1:02.000000','tt0015624',7.9,7930,'en','The Big Parade','The story of an idle rich boy who joins the US Army\'s Rainbow Division and is sent to France to fight in World War I, becomes friends with two working class men, experiences the horrors of trench warfare, and finds love with a French girl.','/8aBXJEkAHcwG2ghNYh6GIFd9ool.jpg','1925-11-05',151,'Released','The epic of the American doughboy!','The Big Parade',3060,2.2127,7.579,'P_-BvxzdOr4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(620,_binary '\0','/v5B596E3IvllVvIJc3EpJJj0VwM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0015634',6.2,1353,'en','Body and Soul','A convict escapes to a Southern town and passes himself off as a reverend, giving him the perfect cover to swindle the townspeople and corrupt an innocent young woman.','/3Xl7ZaNt1ThVCvsXZDW5ISXsP7K.jpg','1925-11-09',94,'Released',NULL,'Body and Soul',86955,1.0526,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(621,_binary '\0','/3RH61Z7BP3f215936PJBEG2qQrT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0015648',7.9,65685,'ru','Броненосец Потёмкин','A dramatized account of a great Russian naval mutiny and a resultant public demonstration, showing support, which brought on a police massacre.','/hZmsRLsCnE9Zshf1YJONUpCOhds.jpg','1925-12-24',75,'Released','Revolution is the only lawful, equal, effectual war. It was in Russia that this war was declared and begun.','Battleship Potemkin',643,6.6971,7.572,'VC66LgoOlCs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(622,_binary '\0','/cscHKe13svp1Txa6ttcj0mDDvCZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0015768',7,2699,'da','Du skal ære din hustru','When a man becomes tyrannical towards his family, the women of the house decide to teach him a lesson in gratitude.','/iRxogRnql0tmHRhuH8XsV1pOSFr.jpg','1925-10-05',107,'Released',NULL,'Master of the House',55589,1.439,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(623,_binary '\0','/rxmIzefXWrEhscIXRNDuMhwFL1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0015772',6.6,2540,'en','The Eagle','Vladimir Dubrouvsky, a lieutenant in the Russian army, catches the eye of Czarina Catherine II. He spurns her advances and flees, and she puts out a warrant for his arrest, dead or alive. Vladimir learns that his father\'s lands have been taken by the evil Kyrilla Troekouroff, and his father dies. He dons a black mask, and becomes the outlaw The Black Eagle. He enters the Troekouroff household disguised as a French instructor for Kyrilla\'s daughter Mascha. He is after vengeance, but instead falls in love with Mascha.','/dwF5S5Vbk2gZC3MPNxn9O5eBJSa.jpg','1925-11-08',73,'Released','There is action without pause - romance that stirs the senses - mystery that baffles - over all a love theme that sweeps the heart','The Eagle',98477,1.4709,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(624,_binary '\0','/kKRDECULj8d81IAshuJ8k04B53Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0015841',7.5,6695,'en','The Freshman','An unathletic college freshman ridiculed by his peers for his mannerisms strives to become popular by making the football team.','/3531lJNSMhrpcNWXrDIYYoYH6Rp.jpg','1925-09-20',77,'Released','Harold kicks the fun winning Goal.','The Freshman',42359,1.5656,6.951,'1ntrhlDr8MU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(625,_binary '\0','/h4lY3dgzmtAZ5dl9mPO81S12S7W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0015842',7,1909,'de','Die freudlose Gasse','In 1921, we follow two women - Marie and Grete - from the same poor Viennese neighborhood, as they try to better the lives of themselves and their families during the period of Austrian postwar hyperinflation.','/qmOQssz4GfbdtOmxwMP0jBj4P4F.jpg','1925-03-01',155,'Released','Open any door in Melchior Alley, and you\'ll come face to face with naked misery.','Joyless Street',8462,1.4856,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(626,_binary '\0','/6cV4KwohyeA7MWy97TsMA3RPaQ7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0015863',7.1,5705,'en','Go West','With little luck at keeping a job in the city a New Yorker tries work in the country and eventually finds his way leading a herd of cattle to the West Coast.','/chZ6GbfTIKgD6nYmUKZScDAnIo8.jpg','1925-11-01',83,'Released','Come with Buster out into the vast open spaces where men are men and cows are their only lady friends','Go West',33015,1.5099,6.914,'1BWMJ06xDN0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(627,_binary '\0','/hZHeDPQGNKN9NN9GuW7qVbM2tDx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0015864',8.1,129182,'en','The Gold Rush','A gold prospector in Alaska struggles to survive the elements and win the heart of a dance hall girl.','/eQRFo1qwRREYwj47Yoe1PisgOle.jpg','1925-07-13',95,'Released','The World\'s Greatest Laughing Picture!','The Gold Rush',962,6.8769,7.961,'DJwOpY84Oq4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(628,_binary '\0','/snAqZwWx9oZc8lcdT48I7dpLf41.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0015873',7.7,1331,'en','Grass: A Nation\'s Battle for Life','A silent documentary which follows a branch of the Bakhtiari tribe of Persia as they and their herds make their epic seasonal journey to better pastures.','/djZ2jwO0C0ZFq0rGSBACMjW3qF.jpg','1925-03-30',71,'Released',NULL,'Grass: A Nation\'s Battle for Life',115132,1.4964,7.7,'9HYOQjYi3m4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(629,_binary '\0','/zc5vjonSbXUUazuQSi0R2bUfWNP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0015881',8,11700,'en','Greed','When housewife Trina wins the lottery, her comfortable life with her dentist husband John slowly deteriorates, in part by her own increasing paranoia and partly by the machinations of villainous acquaintance Marcus.','/eur2vc2BGiOocBuBLVPXySO7lRh.jpg','1924-12-04',140,'Released','The Film of Films','Greed',1405,4.6099,7.3,'MGjSpPgJAoA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(630,_binary '\0','/1aFnd24oLXgut1P8JlPdzzatJeT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0016004',7.2,1586,'en','Lady Windermere\'s Fan','A society woman believes her husband is having an affair, a misconception which may have dire personal consequences for all involved.','/fpDPAhrWuLiF28KMwDhYAj5ofTk.jpg','1925-12-26',89,'Released',NULL,'Lady Windermere\'s Fan',121379,2.3292,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(631,_binary '\0','/kfwYjcbQIzOnBbIVjevFWor15Mk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0016029',7,2104,'en','The Little Colonel','After Southern belle Elizabeth Lloyd runs off to marry Yankee Jack Sherman, her father, a former Confederate colonel during the Civil War, vows to never speak to her again. Several years pass and Elizabeth returns to her home town with her husband and young daughter. The little girl charms her crusty grandfather and tries to patch things up between him and her mother.','/t48Hj1PtU0JhcRbiunJ1BIYxLlA.jpg','1935-02-22',80,'Released','She Has Won An Unconditional Surrender From Every Heart!','The Little Colonel',29879,2.2048,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(632,_binary '\0','/mdNae6nOlJ7iKxFgsWSAgxU9shS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0016039',7,6709,'en','The Lost World','The first film adaptation of Sir Arthur Conan Doyle\'s classic novel about a land where prehistoric creatures still roam.','/411VnWtYJdEFKiaGqJOeTmBv8th.jpg','1925-02-02',104,'Released','Sir Arthur Conan Doyle\'s Stupendous Story','The Lost World',2981,2.416,6.7,'RJL6g91AOs4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(633,_binary '\0','/gITA1IgbVz4qBOWDD54E8rSIK2m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0016104',7.2,2754,'en','The Merry Widow','Prince Danilo falls in love with dancer Sally O\'Hara. However, his uncle, King Nikita I of Monteblanco, forbids the marriage due to her being a commoner. Thinking she\'s been jilted by her prince, Sally marries lecherous old Baron Sadoja, whose wealth has kept the kingdom afloat. When he suddenly dies, Sally must be wooed all over again by Danilo.','/7cicZpacvh3MINqNorntTl8xdOY.jpg','1925-08-27',137,'Released','The gloriously intoxicating love story of the Merry Widow and her Prince Charming, is revealed at last in a picture production which will take your breath away!','The Merry Widow',53230,1.3167,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(634,_binary '\0','/v5fsTmu6FHbbDhZOuCpJl8V0RWd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0016123',6.2,1568,'en','The Monster','A general store clerk and aspiring detective investigates a mysterious disappearance that took place quite close to an empty insane asylum.','/kOyxl0PCoYsZybEZnN32tOR2y0G.jpg','1925-03-16',86,'Released',NULL,'The Monster',27502,1.0639,5.7,'L6a40e-Ya6E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(635,_binary '\0','/6FSs7jMimg1PBYdhZtPNQhtKtEc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0016220',7.5,22492,'en','The Phantom of the Opera','The deformed Phantom who haunts the Paris Opera House causes murder and mayhem in an attempt to make the woman he loves a star.','/mvaYpAYj957C2tlq3vVJPSzGJXK.jpg','1925-06-29',107,'Released','The greatest horror film of modern cinema!','The Phantom of the Opera',964,4.0241,7.1,'HYvbaILyc2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(636,_binary '\0','/m8FIyekwdT4jm9hXppgiYQGpfOE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0016230',5.7,3321,'en','The Pleasure Garden','Two chorus girls at the Pleasure Garden Theatre follow different paths in love and fortune.','/DpCDqbyxBlSChWTCx42n4WA8BX.jpg','1925-11-03',91,'Released',NULL,'The Pleasure Garden',64398,1.329,5.3,'6kSxX3t9lys','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(637,_binary '\0','/jWID4Frsol1gIWK6tB4vrCcBxcd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0016332',7.8,13411,'en','Seven Chances','Struggling stockbroker Jimmie Shannon learns that, if he gets married by 7 p.m. on his 27th birthday -- which is today -- he\'ll inherit $7 million from an eccentric relative.','/fH9woIxzqVtyv6S711vSVlS12eA.jpg','1925-03-15',56,'Released','Seven laughs a minute!','Seven Chances',32600,2.9761,7.506,'4Qlq0y36iQQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(638,_binary '\0','/mqr9jfQ25LsNzBDyDflJKx3pyhe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0016394',6.8,1216,'en','Stage Struck','Daydreaming waitress Jennie Hagen fantasizes about becoming a famous actress, while in reality she and her cook boyfriend, Orme Wilson, hope to one day own their own diner. Although Orme loves Jennie, he also has a weakness for stage stars -- so when a riverboat theatrical crew comes to their town, he is smitten by lead actress Lillian Lyons. Desperate to keep Orme, Jennie insists on going onstage to best Lillian, but is soon out of her depth.','/l711nus4DPVRdk9Hdeph22iHY2K.jpg','1925-11-16',84,'Released',NULL,'Stage Struck',147618,0.8936,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(639,_binary '\0','/lMVQfbKM65JGOx9smdO5Y8doQMR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0016473',7.1,2528,'en','The Unholy Three','Three sideshow performers form a conspiracy known as \'The Unholy Three\' – a ventriloquist, midget, and strongman working together to commit a series of robberies.','/aU3eZJEuzFzngrnTQJrqhTQ8zzO.jpg','1925-07-20',86,'Released','A Mystery Thriller of a Giant, a Ventriloquist and a Dwarf','The Unholy Three',27505,1.7447,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(640,_binary '\0','/qOHv2xgyyJUNiItZgYlWe5BEStM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0016481',7.4,1589,'de','Varieté','Murderer “Boss” Huller—after having spent ten years in prison—breaks his silence to tell the warden his story.','/rcpMbxYrYLngdyQrt1lK4QkpV06.jpg','1925-11-16',104,'Released',NULL,'Variety',94803,1.0959,6.7,'vQ46TEBYFA0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(641,_binary '\0','/wp2akI9bIWA6i9RZ1tnwDT2yBhe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0016544',4.9,1954,'en','The Wizard of Oz','A farm girl learns she is a princess and is swept away by a tornado to the land of Oz.','/l7bVLGopGoTwmuirB0WZdUc47ns.jpg','1925-02-12',81,'Released','The worlds greatest fantastic spectacle.','The Wizard of Oz',47508,2.1444,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(642,_binary '\0','/lXcaTbbsFLOSIp5u1hPT4u2WE8o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0016627',7.1,1401,'en','Bardelys the Magnificent','Rafael Sabatini\'s story of the swashbuckling era and of Bardeleys, the handsome courtier who could win any woman he set his mind to...and was not above boasting about it to all who would listen.','/8Y2xo9pp5NUPxkRziFWVRw88EUv.jpg','1926-09-30',90,'Released','The screen\'s great lover in a dashing role!','Bardelys the Magnificent',128899,1.1989,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(643,_binary '\0','/s4vvrPqqMoltjNHH5mdXPTzQieW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0016630',7,4559,'en','Battling Butler','A meek millionaire masquerades as a boxing star to win a girl\'s heart.','/7MVdo4OyzIcwycN58J9n855ggoS.jpg','1926-08-02',77,'Released','Gloves seemed to hit him from all sides!','Battling Butler',51371,1.845,6.7,'sRhQJxLgifg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(644,_binary '\0','/e7ooaJr9DbLIubHOycjoXG47F2S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0016641',7.8,8459,'en','Ben-Hur: A Tale of the Christ','Erstwhile childhood friends, Judah Ben-Hur and Messala meet again as adults, this time with Roman officer Messala as conqueror and Judah as a wealthy, though conquered, Israelite. A slip of a brick during a Roman parade causes Judah to be sent off as a galley slave, his property confiscated and his mother and sister imprisoned. Years later, as a result of his determination to stay alive and his willingness to aid his Roman master, Judah returns to his homeland an exalted and wealthy Roman athlete. Unable to find his mother and sister, and believing them dead, he can think of nothing else than revenge against Messala.','/aCohFCJNxPner7VzjzyNN7H8BgV.jpg','1925-12-25',143,'Released','Amazing! Thrilling! Colossal! Mighty!','Ben-Hur: A Tale of the Christ',31510,2.994,7.3,'ftxWZZQs-j4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(645,_binary '\0','/ezeFFebkb8MX33IRQ2LYwegLNit.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0016654',7,2425,'en','The Black Pirate','A nobleman vows to avenge the death of his father by the hands of pirates. To this end, he infiltrates the pirate band; Acting in character, he single-handedly captures a merchant vessel, but things are complicated when he finds that there is a beautiful young woman of royal blood aboard.','/841WLSvTRN3TQKxiUjD1TY9dc42.jpg','1926-03-08',94,'Released','The Love Story of a Bold Buccaneer','The Black Pirate',50075,2.1005,6.7,'lehU9FlQmSU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(646,_binary '\0','/l1biocqKm6B2myckxj9wIa0Z3Kd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0016669',7.2,1779,'en','La Bohème','A group of starving artists try to survive in 1830s Paris, including a seamstress and the would-be playwright she loves.','/7fLAxBNFb0CUTe5Nd8qsWeMX2Fr.jpg','1926-03-13',93,'Released',NULL,'La Bohème',110253,1.0104,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(647,_binary '\0','/wsnkhRCiOAEF9xFElkEb7CHPuMh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0016690',6.1,1575,'en','Brown of Harvard','Tom Brown shows up at Harvard, confident and a bit arrogant. He becomes a rival of Bob McAndrew, not only in football and rowing crew, but also for the affections of Mary Abbott, a professor\'s daughter.','/4p55sMwwDD8LBhHilcVqJa05ZrV.jpg','1926-05-02',85,'Released','On the football field, he was a whirlwind- but when Ol\' Dan Cupid tackled him, he went down without a struggle!','Brown of Harvard',117211,0.9095,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(648,_binary '\0','/85VLs4p3PfYN9WmFktBeP85orqr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0016847',8.1,18631,'de','Faust - Eine deutsche Volkssage','God and Satan wager on the soul of a learned and prayerful alchemist as part of their eternal war over Earth.','/rN703hMFxmkZfyEzsXvFtuFhkXE.jpg','1926-10-13',116,'Released','The Voice of the Tempter.','Faust',10728,4.1213,7.9,'Luuw4yTTtRU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(649,_binary '\0','/9TBXfjP7JMAVBVrE8VUq8dbVXAP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0016884',7.6,4979,'en','Flesh and the Devil','When lifelong best friends Leo and Ulrich return home after completing their military training, Leo meets the stunning Felicitas at a railway station and is mesmerized by her beauty. A scandal follows, for which Leo is sent away. Returning home three years later, he discovers that much has changed.','/crbsj3275H5Q0accBiql7GyKTQW.jpg','1926-12-25',112,'Released','Passion ran like wine in their blood!','Flesh and the Devil',38687,2.3524,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(650,_binary '\0','/fEpnNVBEGbMcoOa8nITLNc48mNB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0016895',7.5,2199,'en','For Heaven\'s Sake','An irresponsible young millionaire changes his tune when he falls for the daughter of a downtown minister.','/vIaZ41s0IqU8AlMufJ7fsUKq7Vb.jpg','1926-04-05',58,'Released','Harold Lloyd has punctured the trouble bubble again! For heaven\'s sake, believe us!','For Heaven\'s Sake',42368,1.549,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(651,_binary '\0','/bi2wo3a2ncjbnaGARBCZh3Vfn8v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0017048',7.3,5516,'ja','狂った一頁','A man takes a job at an asylum with hopes of freeing his imprisoned wife.','/4omdvaOfHI438c368MRa2SPObGg.jpg','1926-09-24',71,'Released',NULL,'A Page of Madness',94525,2.214,7.3,'inZy5os7Aq4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(652,_binary '\0','/8svHeSlKssWjscBaa2HnFZR9oo4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0017075',7.3,15301,'en','The Lodger: A Story of the London Fog','London. A mysterious serial killer brutally murders young blond women by stalking them in the night fog. One foggy, sinister night, a young man who claims his name is Jonathan Drew arrives at the guest house run by the Bunting family and rents a room.','/tD84zwFeFRf3zG98x558N3PBMV.jpg','1927-02-14',91,'Released',NULL,'The Lodger: A Story of the London Fog',2760,3.8552,7.2,'BJnoaTzJdLs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(653,_binary '\0','/7m8Bdr7LB3AkGBZtmVg8WXJHQum.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0017128',7.4,3350,'ru','Мать','A Soviet woman is caught between her husband and son, who find themselves on opposing sides of the Russian Revolution.','/u9u71FR74RVndbAbW3rlmts0QyS.jpg','1926-10-11',87,'Released',NULL,'Mother',98914,1.275,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(654,_binary '\0','/eeMoFKxjjiCi6iep2GEZtSAMYIr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0017136',8.2,203092,'de','Metropolis','In a futuristic city sharply divided between the rich and the poor, the son of the city\'s mastermind meets a prophet who predicts the coming of a savior to mediate their differences.','/kr9wXRN23zLuWJIelahas1mtnYj.jpg','1927-01-10',148,'Released','There can be no understanding between the hands and the brain unless the heart acts as mediator.','Metropolis',19,7.941,8.084,'ZAvzaOxDt2c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(655,_binary '\0','/vaBOFhmfsy2tWvNvC5HlQaPOlvL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0017271',7.5,1392,'ru','По закону','After a man kills two members of his Yukon gold prospecting team, the other two surviving members struggle to keep him subdued for the next several months until they can turn him over to the law.','/2LpGKcjV0oHN60Wpi3jWKjqXI1H.jpg','1926-12-03',80,'Released',NULL,'By the Law',126644,1.0696,6.6,'ycElt5k821Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(656,_binary '\0','/pxZOCgdcwNgR5gf1GvKTnYEPvhp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0017350',7.6,2169,'en','The Scarlet Letter','In Puritan Boston, seamstress Hester Prynne and kindly Reverend Arthur Dimmesdale fall in love. After Dimmesdale must go away for a time to England, he returns to discover that Hester has given birth to their child and is the focus of local censure.','/r17PMluxZvEFOHGILuf2iHuyQCt.jpg','1927-01-08',97,'Released',NULL,'The Scarlet Letter',85638,1.0954,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(657,_binary '\0','/4Wgqq9UE5VtW7XHQ3siWtn6NumA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0017416',6.5,2269,'en','The Son of the Sheik','Ahmed, son of Diana and Sheik Ahmed Ben Hassan, falls in love with Yasmin, a dancing girl who fronts her father\'s gang of mountebanks. She and Ahmed meet secretly until one night when her father and the gang capture the son of the sheik, torture him, and hold him for ransom.','/yZib8tHbOHrSTSszif728VwU2L6.jpg','1926-09-05',69,'Released','\"An eye for an eye-a hate for a hate-that my girl, is the law of the tribe.\"','The Son of the Sheik',85689,1.7656,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(658,_binary '\0','/o9GIx92ir5bpTE8Cc3DxICoOBs8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0017423',7.3,1688,'xx','Sparrows','Molly, the eldest child of a group of orphans being used as slaves on a farm hidden deep in a swamp, must rescue the others when their cruel master decides that one of them will be disposed of.','/3ZPfhlwZ9HIYViUCgoZusCszohT.jpg','1926-09-19',94,'Released','Here is life\'s song of love, beating with laughs and sobs, its melody in tune with your own heartstrings.','Sparrows',73575,1.1083,7,'dSi0X28N0mc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(659,_binary '\0','/1vmfytDgYC7YZNK38jT3zbA22Fg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0017448',7.1,2974,'de','Herr Tartüff','A young man shows his millionaire grandfather a film based on Molière\'s play \"Tartuffe\" in order to expose the old man\'s hypocritical governess who covets the young man\'s inheritance.','/xRin1lHzsK8s8EMfT54wgxiD61H.jpg','1926-01-25',70,'Released',NULL,'Tartuffe',55544,1.0418,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(660,_binary '\0','/lp4ORYpcRdB0A6puyLlaE2mtNbH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0017449',6.9,1470,'en','The Temptress','A seductive woman forsakes her husband and lover to pursue a young engineer.','/uGJtzAm4j3BCRU8JRbvtwAn3xIM.jpg','1926-10-03',106,'Released',NULL,'The Temptress',95956,1.1403,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(661,_binary '\0','/kmjkRLZ0buMUFQF9ztxJRylij2F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0017463',7.5,1760,'en','3 Bad Men','Three outlaws come to the aid of a young girl after her father is killed.','/4x1vv1O0QMgE2sSbtSbrV68Zscr.jpg','1926-08-28',92,'Released','The romance of a girl in the land of promise.','3 Bad Men',32716,1.5542,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(662,_binary '\0','/fT6zGEPV6UQ4qyK90JdW6qPstsv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0017534',6.6,2036,'en','West Point','Arrogant and wise-cracking Brice Wayne enrolls at the United States Military Academy at West Point and adjusts to life as a plebe. He tries out for the plebe football team, where he excels and shows up the varsity team. However, his ego is unrivaled, especially in competition with upperclassman Bob Sperry. At the same time, Brice meets a local girl named Betty Channing who cheers for him at football practices.','/5OysLUunonJyDQuW1Aj8X0bB8Si.jpg','1928-01-07',95,'Released','His idea of Field Maneuvers weren\'t military -- he thought they meant a petting party!','West Point',67531,0.8937,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(663,_binary '\0','/lVnUdJ7nqho86UievvSr1LpfU6k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0017668',7.6,5216,'de','Berlin, die Symphonie der Großstadt','A day in the city of Berlin, which experienced an industrial boom in the 1920s, and still provides an insight into the living and working conditions at that time. Germany had just recovered a little from the worst consequences of the First World War, the great economic crisis was still a few years away and Hitler was not yet an issue at the time.','/1APQoI9PKgZtg6PWZjIbr0U7GvZ.jpg','1927-09-23',69,'Released',NULL,'Berlin: Symphony of a Great City',222,1.6633,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(664,_binary '\0','/4u8XR1ULW6c31l7QRgDZOsrUSra.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0017739',7.1,3855,'en','The Cat and the Canary','A group of potential heirs gather in a forbidding old house to learn which of them will inherit a fortune. Later, they learn that a flesh-rending maniac is loose.','/pblghrfHa2XvNE5lDYq2vVMyVoh.jpg','1927-08-20',84,'Released','The mystery thriller of the stage filmed with new effects!','The Cat and the Canary',76804,2.0983,6.9,'tMtD-0NOi2A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(665,_binary '\0','/tg4zelLwIkJByphbVRHyY3iVq7H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0017743',6.7,1273,'en','Chang: A Drama of the Wilderness','Elephants disrupt the lives of a family deep in the jungles of Northern Siam, and an entire village.','/g1y0h1diWpdxxGmMhHB9shqs2bx.jpg','1927-04-29',69,'Released','A MARVEL MOVIE—Nothing Else Describes It!','Chang: A Drama of the Wilderness',44657,1.5777,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(666,_binary '\0','/lmUe7jT0INfybttjprXYt8hsHE3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0017765',6.9,5917,'en','College','A bookish college student dismissive of athletics is compelled to try out sports to win the affection of the girl he loves.','/dUwk8qNkXb243JViqdVqOvUmiMt.jpg','1927-09-10',65,'Released','You\'ll graduate with a perpetual smile!','College',34847,1.655,6.7,'1BWMJ06xDN0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(667,_binary '\0','/1h0VzoJNAwhjjhehLnsgbIcCEFv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0017825',6,3592,'en','Downhill','When school captain Roddy Berwick takes the blame for his friend’s scandal, he is expelled and disowned by his family. Cast out of his privileged world, Roddy drifts through a series of humiliations—from waiter to penniless actor to gigolo—descending ever further into ruin and self-disgust.','/s6AppTbM34sNB9FASwezhIyesn5.jpg','1927-10-24',106,'Released','A College Hero round whom is woven a picture of Love and Treachery.','Downhill',52782,1.4349,5.7,'4TJX1ciN4bs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(668,_binary '\0','/sTgHC0YevZqdDbIALGxd7FAlWQX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0017843',5.4,3394,'en','Easy Virtue','Unjustly accused of adultery in a scandalous divorce, Larita Filton flees to the French Riviera. She soon falls in love with a young Englishman, John Whittaker, and begins anew under an assumed name. But when John brings her home to his disapproving family, Larita’s past begins to resurface.','/2GVP7uJbBigNtlpnN6E6YwS75VB.jpg','1928-04-01',70,'Released','Can she be blamed for a past she didn\'t create?','Easy Virtue',36055,1.365,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(669,_binary '\0','/mzox4HbcV9W42MH2dB1QsdDVGo3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0017925',8.1,106159,'en','The General','During America’s Civil War, Union spies steal engineer Johnny Gray\'s beloved locomotive, \'The General\'—with Johnnie\'s lady love aboard an attached boxcar—and he single-handedly must do all in his power to both get The General back and to rescue Annabelle.','/4NmV1Wei4LxT2lpjViCAScgCZLq.jpg','1926-12-25',79,'Released','Buster drives \"The General\" to trainload of laughter.','The General',961,5.7524,7.914,'eEVWb9NcSuY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(670,_binary '\0','/oFK7PBY9LDHaqWkJHl6HBFRIYfB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0017961',7.3,1293,'ru','Счастье','A hapless loser (with the surname of Loser) undergoes misadventures with avaracious clergy, a tired horse, and a walking granary (among other things) on his road to collectivized happiness.','/nvF0mHfmnSN9lg3yZaMSOd068pE.jpg','1935-03-15',63,'Released',NULL,'Happiness',93743,0.987,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(671,_binary '\0','/ygMZ9DamhPIgQOT5WjacsfvPXIX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0018033',7.2,4034,'en','It','A flapper shopgirl woos her rich boss with animal magnetism -- the captivating personal quality otherwise known as \"it.\"','/nkkhsKik9GILqn3S5BxoZdyml21.jpg','1927-02-05',72,'Released','A salesgirl with plenty of \'it\' pursues a handsome playboy.','It',82283,1.6462,6.9,'XXd7DGz2zHM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(672,_binary '\0','/515FMUnY7irFM0zsMKPvclMUUnJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0018037',6.4,12051,'en','The Jazz Singer','A young Jewish man is torn between tradition and individuality when his old-fashioned family objects to his career as a jazz singer. This is the first full length feature film to use synchronized sound, and is the original film musical.','/wr8Pt1GO87cwB3210TO3JTNDsUc.jpg','1927-10-06',96,'Released','Hear him sing Mammy, Toot Toot Tootsie, My Gal Sal, Mother I Still Have You.','The Jazz Singer',939,2.9632,6.102,'YP00IQ60ZP0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(673,_binary '\0','/kH0q9W1rfj9tce0Y2b2pRz7iEMe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0018051',7.6,5327,'en','The Kid Brother','The timid youngest son of the most important family in town must use his wits to win the respect of his strong father and the love of a beautiful new woman in town.','/wH5VcRHUdR0ZIb938mVEbPzF13c.jpg','1927-01-17',82,'Released','\"The Freshman\" is down on the farm! And there\'s a real plot with bashful love-making and everything!','The Kid Brother',16661,1.6721,6.907,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(674,_binary '\0','/i2ObdxtwzwgbTxa0SIC7vbGtaem.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0018054',7.3,2727,'en','The King of Kings','The King of Kings is the Greatest Story Ever Told as only Cecil B. DeMille could tell it. In 1927, working with one of the biggest budgets in Hollywood history, DeMille spun the life and Passion of Christ into a silent-era blockbuster. Featuring text drawn directly from the Bible, a cast of thousands, and the great showman’s singular cinematic bag of tricks, The King of Kings is at once spectacular and deeply reverent—part Gospel, part Technicolor epic.','/qJThyOfQVeEctEVVtK3LTDVL5S6.jpg','1927-04-19',155,'Released','Supreme in Theme! Gigantic in Execution!','The King of Kings',49633,3.0756,6.4,'pFhcdF_td10','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(675,_binary '\0','/1M70yrB2iYd14FjjNX3fV0gSyBm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0018066',7.3,1999,'ru','Конец Санкт-Петербурга','Shortly before the outbreak of WWI, a peasant from rural Russia arrives in St. Petersburg to find work.','/wKLkiMq76do71f1TcHqXbvkiXOp.jpg','1927-12-13',74,'Released',NULL,'The End of St. Petersburg',106254,1.5594,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(676,_binary '\0','/cbg0MTTF1dU5MrLYGxlxlwIBCJI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0018097',6.7,1590,'en','London After Midnight','The abandoned Balfour House, the owner of which was found dead five years earlier, comes back to life with the arrival of two suspicious sinister-looking tenants.','/mDgG0R5XDai0960ICbk4GOMltlw.jpg','1927-12-03',69,'Released','Lon Chaney in a great Scotland Yard mystery','London After Midnight',64852,1.1948,6.6,'JTuKq6-c5wg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(677,_binary '\0','/jybjek09q5t98IWEN54m3NIdIvC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0018107',6.8,1307,'en','Love','In Imperial Russia, Anna Karenina falls in love with the dashing military officer Count Vronsky and abandons her husband and child to become his mistress.','/6Wdf0zB8DQeuquy5O3ldOK04Mfg.jpg','1927-11-29',81,'Released','The Stars of \"Flesh and the Devil\" — together again!','Love',120831,1.0998,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(678,_binary '\0','/aZ6YMH5OjY1IYSlREtVmmcHqgQf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0018192',8.2,9891,'fr','Napoléon','A biopic of former Emperor of France, Napoleon Bonaparte, tracing the Corsican\'s career from his schooldays (where a snowball fight is staged like a military campaign) to his flight from Corsica, through the French Revolution (where a real storm is intercut with a political storm) and the Terror, culminating in his triumphant 1797 invasion of Italy.','/kwudEzOQcihoNhCYZPhT9XqU4hG.jpg','1927-01-10',425,'Released',NULL,'Napoleon',42536,2.9634,7.856,'6504eRh5h6M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(679,_binary '\0','/lcFVMnRPEVpvRDpXlxGfpuz0ik3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0018217',7.4,9097,'ru','Октябрь','Sergei M. Eisenstein\'s docu-drama about the 1917 October Revolution in Russia. Made ten years after the events and edited in Eisenstein\'s \'Soviet Montage\' style, it re-enacts in celebratory terms several key scenes from the revolution.','/tsfz9Ak1slSnxr6mSmRD3Wj7YZS.jpg','1928-05-11',115,'Released',NULL,'October (Ten Days that Shook the World)',697,1.9694,6.9,'tqwLwEhUtrE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(680,_binary '\0','/9kSgM3tFuFDv7HfUNrehP9V1HHQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0018311',6.8,1579,'en','The Red Mill','A servant girl plays matchmaker for the local burgomaster\'s daughter while setting her own sights on a visiting Irishman.','/5HTn2bwnJzqwjMed599U2ghNnBz.jpg','1927-01-29',74,'Released','You\'ll love Marion Davies as Tina, the little Dutch slavey in this riproarous film romance.','The Red Mill',134475,1.0105,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(681,_binary '\0','/8nCWeu8mgd3Wa0TtkSUIla0x9cF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0018328',6.1,4397,'en','The Ring','Both Jack Sander and Bob Corby are boxers in love with Mabel. Jack and Mabel wed, but their marriage is flat. The young wife looks to Bob for comfort.','/VeNRpyspVlJzkrNAyszdGtmy9e.jpg','1927-09-28',116,'Released','Two boxers compete for the love of a woman.','The Ring',36056,1.548,5.9,'3aTyC8ck348','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(682,_binary '\0','/ebgjvr2dwubTYzOfa419bAzumQ0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0018379',7.5,4757,'en','7th Heaven','In 1910s Paris, a sewer worker disillusioned with Christianity feels his prayers have been answered when he chances upon a street waif and they fall in love.','/3ETXMu5PrcVMRJpfN2Z3MwcfXzy.jpg','1927-09-10',119,'Released',NULL,'7th Heaven',82474,1.5443,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(683,_binary '\0','/xylm6zAC8W64LJ4KS5Gw6WEwcXJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0018451',7.5,1848,'en','The Student Prince in Old Heidelberg','A young prince falls in love with a beautiful barmaid while at university in old Heidelberg.','/3OUjEGUjo9SeO7VwMhukNZofuXF.jpg','1928-01-30',106,'Released','Watch your own first timid flight of young love unfold before your eyes in this sweet-scented romance. Hear the \"Student Prince\" music.','The Student Prince in Old Heidelberg',85876,1.6901,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(684,_binary '\0','/hKrrCigPFmhv1bg5IJl9nzjEaN4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0018455',8.1,57112,'en','Sunrise: A Song of Two Humans','A married farmer falls under the spell of a slatternly woman from the city, who tries to convince him to drown his wife.','/5V9jDm4u2QemGHbqjUyP5HmFmzf.jpg','1927-11-04',94,'Released','\"An artistic masterpiece and also a joy to watch.\"','Sunrise: A Song of Two Humans',631,4.7848,7.8,'PCgbFay53BA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(685,_binary '\0','/5ZNGKiunqaM2jWdC00DTxD6fHqc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0018471',7.1,1714,'en','Tell It to the Marines','U.S. Marine Sergeant O\'Hara has his hands full training raw recruits, one of whom, \'Skeets\' Burns, is a particular thorn in his side. If Burns\'s lackadaisical approach to the military were not bad enough, he also makes advances on nurse Nora Dale, whom Sergeant O\'Hara secretly loves. Nora is oblivious to O\'Hara\'s feelings and is attracted to the handsome \'Skeet.\' But an indiscretion turns her against him, and it takes an expedition to China and a battle with a warlord\'s bandit brigade to sort things out among the nurse and her two Marines.','/wX8Q8otMiIHGRDETwFLMqZaGVCL.jpg','1926-12-23',103,'Released',NULL,'Tell It to the Marines',111305,1.336,6.5,'Em4XvsiwmeU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(686,_binary '\0','/5VL3Rh6jW7lNQH5ZBUqA01XNacy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0018505',7.3,1483,'ru','Третья Мещанская','Life changes for a Moscow couple after they allow an old friend of the husband’s to move in.','/uEYi67LRcdPa94bpbtCm0EqwuIQ.jpg','1927-03-15',87,'Released',NULL,'Bed and Sofa',98200,1.4296,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(687,_binary '\0','/9RSA0tT2B1yx7aS1SQsKdy3GiXe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0018515',6.6,1298,'en','Two Arabian Knights','During World War I, two American soldiers fight to escape the Germans while squabbling over a beautiful harem girl. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with University of Nevada, Las Vegas Foundation in 2016.','/cwura9mNFJ8XRP1KSfXbceh2Ask.jpg','1927-09-23',92,'Released',NULL,'Two Arabian Knights',102384,1.1889,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(688,_binary '\0','/1NYCVTVWmwy0r5KYD1CXk8RcRyj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0018526',7.5,3957,'en','Underworld','Boisterous gangster kingpin Bull Weed rehabilitates his former lawyer from his alcoholic haze, but complications arise when he falls for Weed\'s girlfriend.','/6ZjgbeCwS7sipil1J221lbjaqGG.jpg','1927-08-20',87,'Released','\'Nobody helps me -- I help them!\'','Underworld',42565,1.2255,7.057,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(689,_binary '\0','/5T4hHFzhv5BiwyBjuIoWZM6t20A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0018528',7.7,10413,'en','The Unknown','On the lam, criminal Alonzo hides in the circus as The Armless Wonder—a performer who uses his feet to hurl knives. Alonzo keeps the arms he really has concealed to hide his identity. Meanwhile, ringmaster\'s daughter Nanon has a phobia of being touched by men, but is romantically pursued by not only Alonzo but the strongman Malabar. Alonzo\'s desperation to remain with Nanon will only end in tragedy.','/c9R1wE1vMJWMZNdmqXUV8oTaCPQ.jpg','1927-05-29',68,'Released','Don\'t miss this startling spectacle!','The Unknown',27503,1.9969,7.5,'0ZPxz_gwOvk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(690,_binary '\0','/u90ajspDd9911ISbx74rtofQZfO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0018578',7.5,16549,'en','Wings','Two young men, one rich, one middle class, both in love with the same woman, become US Air Corps fighter pilots and, eventually, heroic flying aces during World War I. Devoted best friends, their mutual love of the girl eventually threatens their bond. Meanwhile, a hometown girl who\'s the lovestruck lifelong next door neighbor of one of them pines away.','/kEl6KCBgdmT1Nex3ka0EIWAOmtm.jpg','1927-08-12',144,'Released','Youth, hitting the clouds! Laughing at danger! Fighting, loving, dodging death! That\'s \"WINGS\"','Wings',28966,3.5701,7.2,'08NbkvJQq-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(691,_binary '\0','/ik1rsFEl0xmcmOcNDmXuZyKuThZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0018618',6.2,1246,'en','Across to Singapore','While Joel and his older ship\'s captain brother Mark are at sea, the latter is abandoned in Singapore by devious ship\'s mate Finch who, upon their return, convinces the townspeople that Joel abandoned his brother. Joel, determined to not only find Mark but to see justice done, returns the ship to Singapore.','/paVqiDnjXYI2QUM2lxbQtLpLf4T.jpg','1928-04-07',85,'Released','A boy and a girl---alone against a ship full of mutineers. High adventure on the high seas, with the great star of romance leading the way.','Across to Singapore',142159,1.2807,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(692,_binary '\0','/x0hH45lrgfaisOpQlJ6LRgch7h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0018684',7.4,1562,'en','Beggars of Life','After killing her treacherous step-father, a girl tries to escape the country with a young vagabond. She dresses as a boy, they hop freight trains, quarrel with a group of hobos, and steal a car in their attempt to escape the police, and reach Canada.','/tUqClcPiLoMDExiC0nnQ6c0Zjku.jpg','1928-09-22',82,'Released','A Glimpse of the Ways of the Wanderer','Beggars of Life',85697,1.2277,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(693,_binary '\0','/y3WwIEEDcbT88MxjCjM8mlBEF04.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0018737',7.7,13066,'de','Die Büchse der Pandora','The rise and inevitable fall of an amoral but naive young woman whose insouciant eroticism inspires lust and violence in those around her.','/3B2A5g8t3HZltKp1fplNn2xW4us.jpg','1929-01-30',141,'Released',NULL,'Pandora\'s Box',905,3.2728,7.438,'A1kZaoHqEuU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(694,_binary '\0','/7Za5Riy12u1CUDXeqMUlDBweYAE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0018742',8,14780,'en','The Cameraman','A photographer takes up newsreel shooting to impress a secretary.','/cLVJMJNW3VavnB1CZqbEC9GwSkR.jpg','1928-09-10',74,'Released','You\'ll laugh yourself completely out of focus!','The Cameraman',31411,3.4317,7.8,'lWQTXkb5VYQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(695,_binary '\0','/f6GI9jxs3Py7AqTARasofNp2RZ5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0018756',5.4,3056,'en','Champagne','A spoiled heiress defies her millionaire father by running off to France to pursue her lover. Things don\'t go entirely as planned.','/9xLjNbCOXuRWs7AkZ7bW4m8I0H4.jpg','1928-08-17',105,'Released','A Picture of the Finest Vintage','Champagne',36054,1.4433,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(696,_binary '\0','/7jnqgnLUgazXvTwpZgnGgYAgEiN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0018770',7.2,5122,'fr','La Chute de la maison Usher','A man travels to the remote and decaying mansion of his old friend Roderick Usher, who lives in isolation with his mysterious and gravely ill wife, Madeleine. As the strange atmosphere surrounding the Usher family grows increasingly unsettling, the visitor finds himself drawn into their world of obsession, illness, and supernatural dread.','/gWpTehQgkkpMfxdCkr5CwU8vONR.jpg','1928-10-04',63,'Released',NULL,'The Fall of the House of Usher',28189,2.1363,7.1,'efvbSCjtACI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(697,_binary '\0','/hVla7xGSvz2z3Q81Nijax3zc5N5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0018773',8.1,38921,'en','The Circus','Charlie, a wandering tramp, becomes a circus handyman - soon the star of the show - and falls in love with the circus owner\'s stepdaughter.','/sihWAgBYa8yZFVAonGFGbLTVUj2.jpg','1928-01-06',72,'Released','The Circus is Here!','The Circus',28978,4.5895,7.9,'FTZfMBREBtc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(698,_binary '\0','/gU6ZJQbMLOKPURvkmh3vNOuW5Ew.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0018806',8,10131,'en','The Crowd','John, an ambitious but undisciplined New York City office worker, meets and marries Mary. They start a family, struggle to cope with marital stress, financial setbacks, and tragedy, all while lost amid the anonymous, pitiless throngs of the big city.','/jftzHLCZLE2DOLQWY0mENOIPjxc.jpg','1928-03-03',98,'Released','A Motion Picture with a stirring message on Marriage! A Powerful Film, full of truths of life and love!','The Crowd',3061,2.128,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(699,_binary '\0','/uLgeOKqBF7PIn9Dz3oa5TSY8k3s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0018839',7.5,5582,'en','The Docks of New York','A blue-collar worker on New York\'s depressed waterfront finds his life changed after he saves a woman attempting suicide.','/rCMZpfPAHeuy02nMCttEX3OJt4B.jpg','1928-09-16',76,'Released',NULL,'The Docks of New York',885,2.2277,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(700,_binary '\0','/t5HZ0PvZbdqI1sZLoVPOAqyWjPQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0018876',5.8,3489,'en','The Farmer\'s Wife','Successful middle-aged farmer Samuel Sweetland becomes widowed, then his daughter marries and leaves home. Deciding he wishes to remarry, Sweetland pursues some local women he considers prospects.','/xgHF8syPdDxr1WSOPpAGWoIAeN9.jpg','1928-02-24',112,'Released',NULL,'The Farmer\'s Wife',35832,2.5426,5.625,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(701,_binary '\0','/n3rEkTewthP1VIhwTCaJXYrEE0n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019071',7.9,5151,'en','The Last Command','A former Imperial Russian general and cousin of the Czar ends up in Hollywood as an extra in a movie directed by a former revolutionary.','/uKb5bFIwEzDtT3km99lqQBGNFCx.jpg','1928-01-21',88,'Released',NULL,'The Last Command',52679,1.4261,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(702,_binary '\0','/zrYWSrdmje2ZGA5Qo4OLdbZqK0F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019074',7.5,2311,'en','Laugh, Clown, Laugh','A despairing clown suffering a broken heart and a self-indulgent count who uncontrollably laughs learn to help each other with their problems, but both fall in love with the same young woman.','/629NipgEKskEHAlrEeESYsI9Uoz.jpg','1928-04-14',74,'Released','What did he hide behind his painted smile?','Laugh, Clown, Laugh',27507,1.7656,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(703,_binary '\0','/h14tydAmBAX9CXJDFPb18wEJGnr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019109',7.7,3013,'en','Lonesome','Two lonely people in the big city meet and enjoy the thrills of an amusement park, only to lose each other in the crowd after spending a great day together. Will they ever see each other again?','/ctxscU1tJ4nFRP4Q6n3Rngp9od1.jpg','1928-06-20',70,'Released','With all the glamor and glitter of Coney Island that millions everywhere are always eager to see','Lonesome',101482,2.2044,7.5,'iuCd76BL2TY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(704,_binary '\0','/sEACcNF5lUEJusfiCa8ExwGrbC5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019130',7.6,9353,'en','The Man Who Laughs','When a proud noble refuses to kiss the hand of the despotic King James in 1690, he is cruelly executed and his son surgically disfigured.','/iQXBMr4NzQst4X0rDU6MII6ZUOM.jpg','1928-11-04',110,'Released','THE BREAKING HEART BEHIND THE LAUGHING FACE.','The Man Who Laughs',27517,2.7006,7.3,'2KhzpkSDwHA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(705,_binary '\0','/c9SuYVmuYVrD6PsgyqwL3nIDhn4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019195',7.2,1550,'en','The Mysterious Lady','A beautiful Russian spy seduces an Austrian military officer in order to obtain secret plans. When she falls in love with him, both are placed in danger.','/iOmtOcwSLNFwV2kqDsfnSpVphSL.jpg','1928-08-04',89,'Released','Their net of intrigue spread through every country','The Mysterious Lady',108923,1.7863,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(706,_binary '\0','/44c3n8032AIXsSNF92ITAlMwFr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019237',6.7,2222,'en','Our Dancing Daughters','A flapper who\'s secretly a good girl and a gold-digging floozy masquerading as an ingénue both vie for the hand of a millionaire.','/ifilTkhpv4G49vZpSyWo0vYuh4z.jpg','1928-09-01',84,'Released','THE JAZZ-MAD GIRL, THE JAZZ-MAD WHIRL: A romance of flaming youth, the children of the rich, and the jazz-mad age.','Our Dancing Daughters',42614,1.0482,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(707,_binary '\0','/5YyWhr5cgVeYYHbsWjyQ0OGKkmu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019254',8.1,69246,'fr','La Passion de Jeanne d\'Arc','A classic of the silent age, this film tells the story of the doomed but ultimately canonized 15th-century teenage warrior. On trial for claiming she\'d spoken to God, Jeanne d\'Arc is subjected to inhumane treatment and scare tactics at the hands of church court officials. Initially bullied into changing her story, Jeanne eventually opts for what she sees as the truth. Her punishment, a famously brutal execution, earns her perpetual martyrdom.','/tAgV9yxY6AC1bsPt3qJJQpD4s8.jpg','1928-04-21',81,'Released','An Immortal Screen Classic that will live Forever!','The Passion of Joan of Arc',780,7.5463,8,'Iz3XmfNzrNs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(708,_binary '\0','/89s41ImajQHVwhnZ0Q0UnNT6cke.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019258',7.4,2921,'en','The Patsy','An awkward teenager hopelessly in love with her older sister\'s boyfriend tries to make him notice her.','/sjlOwMr1IhzZrLocyw3hfwW50G0.jpg','1928-04-22',78,'Released','If you were the little \"Patsy\" of the family, with your good looking sister getting all the breaks, what would you do about it?','The Patsy',53209,1.0239,6.76,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(709,_binary '\0','/lblZfPwOR8kRltqVvELTcVZ8Qwq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019286',6.9,2523,'ru','Потомок Чингисхана','In 1918 a young and simple Mongol herdsman and trapper is cheated out of a valuable fox fur by a European capitalist fur trader. Ostracized from the trading post, he escapes to the hills after brawling with the trader who cheated him. In 1920 he becomes a Soviet partisan, and helps the partisans fight for the Soviets against the occupying British army. However he is captured by the British when they try to requisition cattle from the herdsmen at the same time as the commandant meets with a reincarnated Grand Lama. After the trapper is shot, the army discovers an amulet that suggests he is a direct descendant of Genghis Khan. They find him still alive, so the army restores his health and plans to use him as the head of a puppet regime. The trapper is thus thrust into prominence as he is placed in charge of the puppet government. By the end, however, the \"puppet\" turns against his masters in an outburst of fury.','/myksAJCJsrwAtCs4YMYuNmSaXi7.jpg','1928-11-10',127,'Released','Pudovokin\'s Remarkable Film Of The East In Revolt','Storm Over Asia',84273,0.8129,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(710,_binary '\0','/yCpYVgJH7d49vDc44SKrHLEVhcq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019304',6.5,1918,'en','The Racket','A renegade police captain sets out to catch a sadistic mob boss. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2016.','/wHAJfHslSb6OpNQmj1hu9aE9IQR.jpg','1928-11-01',84,'Released',NULL,'The Racket',27777,0.9528,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(711,_binary '\0','/t3toEFst66ULjuLJdLFSFxCPgxI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019344',7.2,3022,'en','Sadie Thompson','A young, beautiful prostitute named Sadie Thompson arrives on the South Pacific island of Pago Pago looking for honest work and falls for Timothy O\'Hara, an American sailor who is unfazed by her unsavory past. However, Mr. Davidson, a missionary who arrived on the island at the same time, aims to \"save\" Sadie from her sinful life and petitions to have her separated from her beau and deported back to San Francisco.','/7IHxSWO4paEcPiuh515L4fzJDZx.jpg','1928-01-07',97,'Released','Sadie could storm any barrack she attacked! Magnetism had never been heard of until she hit town! What a woman! You\'ll say so, too!','Sadie Thompson',42538,1.3261,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(712,_binary '\0','/lIO8ZVTVRemo4gQMsvMzdNh86Eb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019379',7.6,4282,'en','Show People','Hollywood hopeful Peggy Pepper arrives at a major studio, from Georgia, to become a great dramatic star. Things don\'t go entirely according to plan.','/kMf0YYCNMqUbS9cTJBTCWcvsXEn.jpg','1928-11-20',79,'Released',NULL,'Show People',31404,2.4995,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(713,_binary '\0','/6NfwgI1eKHfprTv1nMqVUVi0Otq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019412',7.6,4866,'en','Speedy','A hapless young man living in New York City rallies to save his girlfriend\'s grandfather\'s horse-drawn trolley, the last in the city, from being put out of business by a railroad company.','/zWhWaWCCIsnQDsFTAe98ap3R5y.jpg','1928-04-07',86,'Released','You\'ve Waited a Year for This But WOW! What a Hit!','Speedy',22595,1.5943,7.3,'a-oh8XH5V48','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(714,_binary '\0','/h749gsHjvzST11avCDHp1fCkyNQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019415',7.5,4389,'de','Spione','The mastermind behind a ubiquitous spy operation learns of a dangerous romance between a Russian lady in his employ and a dashing agent from the government\'s secret service.','/ri1agTtNaG8LemO9wcILukvULiR.jpg','1928-03-22',145,'Released','Fritz Lang’s Espionage Epic!','Spies',78507,1.8995,7.337,'xbIeDOTe7zY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(715,_binary '\0','/kmZjw9hbo8ErovofQvPB21HRyRf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019421',7.8,17771,'en','Steamboat Bill, Jr.','The just-out-of-college, effete son of a no-nonsense steamboat captain comes to visit his father whom he\'s not seen since he was a child.','/zygJMsmXxeyDc1N67OCZc8xtq4I.jpg','1928-05-09',70,'Released','The Laugh Special of the Age. See It.','Steamboat Bill, Jr.',25768,3.1999,7.594,'4a9VXNW0jjE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(716,_binary '\0','/vW6MatSQJ0vi24ZdicPTPjGS4yC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019429',7.2,2832,'en','Street Angel','A spirited young woman finds herself destitute and on the streets before joining a traveling carnival, where she meets a vagabond painter.','/rGDFZRIwZPYocBvspSB7RGQMzXq.jpg','1928-04-09',102,'Released','\"Not just another \"Motion Picture\" — \"Street Angel is the masterpiece of all time\".\"','Street Angel',28391,1.1445,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(717,_binary '\0','/9ser9RnKEFh8XL1Q6S7b2nJH31B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019558',7.3,2055,'en','The Wedding March','Against the backdrop of Vienna\'s hidebound caste system, aristocrat and army officer Nicki is attracted to peasant Mitzi, although he knows it cannot last. Acquiescing to familial pressure, he ultimately gives her up to marry the more socially acceptable – albeit crippled – heiress Cecelia. Mitzi, for her part, is heartbroken and must resign herself to marrying churlish butcher Schani Eberle.','/ej61Px6QKN1lTbkU9b1kqEHnWEW.jpg','1928-10-06',109,'Released','Dashing, Impetuous, Insolent. the playboy of Vienna- handsome, well-born, idol of the ladies- Prince Nicki, portrayed by Erich Von Stroheim. Riotous, color-splashed romance of Vienna.','The Wedding March',42537,1.2856,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(718,_binary '\0','/4nSYIK4v6irS0bSXXL0bZRtkbkd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019563',7.2,2142,'en','West of Zanzibar','A magician seeks vengeance upon the man who paralyzed him and the illegitimate daughter he sired with the magician\'s wife.','/zwnhJhF73rADB9MURcpQ6AeLrPg.jpg','1928-11-24',70,'Released','A story of love and revenge in the African jungles!','West of Zanzibar',27506,1.4991,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(719,_binary '\0','/mieB1ghpEBgTdGiYvewlLPN24jZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019585',8,7891,'en','The Wind','When Letty Mason relocates to West Texas, she finds herself unsettled by the ever-present wind and sand. Arriving at her new home at the ranch of her cousin, Beverly, she receives a surprisingly cold welcome from his wife, Cora. Soon tensions in the family and unwanted attention from a trio of suitors leave Letty increasingly disturbed.','/11ySoycM3ARm66RLiYE9yRcrg5b.jpg','1928-09-15',76,'Released','A tornado of human emotions.','The Wind',31416,1.5874,7.3,'ViZDewxaJ8s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(720,_binary '\0','/sqWMX6aCANfcHHVTcHkHAmFACc2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019591',7.1,1877,'en','A Woman of Affairs','Childhood friends Diana, Neville and David are caught in a love triangle as adults. Diana and Neville have long been smitten with each other, but her father disapproves of the relationship, resulting in her eventual marriage to David. It\'s not long after their wedding, however, that tragedy strikes, sending Diana on a downward spiral. When Neville reappears in her life, will he be able to save her from her own misery?','/4mPXzRGMBKrzN9XBrEgPoxhdbu.jpg','1928-12-15',91,'Released','Wild Desire! Burning Lips! Racing Hearts!','A Woman of Affairs',42615,1.4896,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(721,_binary '\0','/e8H8a7dAsvV1fFzftg6feGue2G8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019611',7,1300,'uk','Звенигора','An old man tells his grandson of a legendary treasure buried beneath the hills of Zvenigora, setting in motion a sweeping cinematic poem that intertwines Ukrainian folklore, history, and revolution.','/iuQBwLMXwxT1N5GmF49anbdGJ0r.jpg','1928-03-07',92,'Released',NULL,'Zvenigora',82088,0.8607,6.3,'9dHNh0hNrxw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(722,_binary '\0','/oUiWdJXwRPuCA2tKQXkKGeZZ3St.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019644',7.1,1655,'en','Applause','This early example of the \"backstage\" musical genre tells the story of Kitty Darling, a fading burlesque star who tries to save her convent-educated daughter April from following in mom\'s footsteps.','/dhcVy77WKN0Mr9kCzRgwbbtkEd3.jpg','1929-10-07',80,'Released','She gave youth and beauty for Applause','Applause',120833,0.9743,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(723,_binary '\0','/tQJ99dVOjAHrXTjFP46Y3GyCAog.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019646',7.4,1255,'fr','L\'Argent','Adapted from the novel L\'Argent by Émile Zola, the film portrays the world of banking and the stock market in Paris in the 1920s.','/pbGXz7Yn4eWV9Edv0gT2OiZuBSB.jpg','1928-12-25',165,'Released',NULL,'L\'Argent',50181,2.2785,7,'Z9kt8NS7s4U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(724,_binary '\0','/qyku09NoSXE3DRUmOCW2UDYI539.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019649',7.1,2541,'ru','Арсенал','A soldier returns to Kyiv after surviving a train crash and encounters clashes between nationalists and collectivists. The story of the suppression of the Bolshevik uprising at the Arsenal factory in Kyiv by the Central Council troops.','/uKFpCZSNwOPyz28uOcAuHisolVA.jpg','1929-02-25',93,'Released',NULL,'Arsenal',85715,1.3346,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(725,_binary '\0','/wJMaLm0XXhB4Pq5ptmSPoSuM6Wr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019655',7.4,1878,'de','Asphalt','Starring Betty Amann in her most famous leading role, Joe May\'s Asphalt is a luxuriously produced German Expressionist classic where tragic liaisons and fatal encounters are shaped alongside the constant roar of Berlin traffic.','/dlAQ3fEkoTOn4WNF9Zh9Rk2bMEN.jpg','1929-03-12',93,'Released',NULL,'Asphalt',55584,1.8969,7.3,'f6k8cq47N08','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(726,_binary '\0','/3fWwpoAVj3mhgQxTnv2O0F1ElAM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019702',6.9,13721,'en','Blackmail','London, 1929. Frank Webber, a very busy Scotland Yard detective, seems to be more interested in his work than in Alice White, his girlfriend. Feeling herself ignored, Alice agrees to go out with an elegant and well-mannered artist who invites her to visit his fancy apartment.','/7ioNEKouUkkWyv5tUDwVUd7BDRR.jpg','1929-07-28',86,'Released','A romance of Scotland Yard','Blackmail',543,3.0514,6.5,'w1kWUWNPJa8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(727,_binary '\0','/tEAEturRMtH4uY3wq2xvlINgiVj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019729',5.5,9210,'en','The Broadway Melody','The vaudeville act of Harriet and Queenie Mahoney comes to Broadway, where their friend Eddie Kerns needs them for his number in one of Francis Zanfield\'s shows. When Eddie meets Queenie, he soon falls in love with her—but she is already being courted by Jock Warriner, a member of New York high society. Queenie eventually recognizes that, to Jock, she is nothing more than a toy, and that Eddie is in love with her.','/giq8GJs8YGMzHxeKxNSuwzAdd1c.jpg','1929-02-08',101,'Released','All talking. All singing. All dancing.','The Broadway Melody',65203,2.8014,5.117,'BuB2HVP-mNU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(728,_binary '\0','/nYvQRR3s5zVwiOmC5KM33L6jSSV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019735',6.3,1530,'en','Bulldog Drummond','Bulldog Drummond is a British WWI veteran who longs for some excitement after he returns to the humdrum existence of civilian life. He gets what he\'s looking for when a girl requests his help in freeing her uncle from a nursing home. She believes the home is just a front and that her uncle is really being held captive while the culprits try to extort his fortune from him.','/7pN3nEDQBfQRjrtgOwJ3WBBm23F.jpg','1929-05-02',90,'Released',NULL,'Bulldog Drummond',81829,1.1101,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(729,_binary '\0','/83nEeCJ0DFWRVpfhnFrm75NohYD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019745',6,1273,'en','The Canary Murder Case','A beautiful showgirl, name \"the Canary\" is a scheming nightclub singer. Blackmailing is her game and with that she ends up dead. But who killed \"the Canary\". All the suspects knew and were used by her and everyone had a motive to see her dead. The only witness to the crime has also been \'rubbed out\'. Only one man, the keen, fascinating, debonair detective Philo Vance, would be able to figure out who is the killer.','/x21cBrK1sM30j0xNlHKPI33toTS.jpg','1929-02-16',82,'Released','Who killed the most beautiful woman on Broadway?','The Canary Murder Case',82105,1.8662,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(730,_binary '\0','/byRNEm1QwfQC1Mn0K4gLM2fIfWO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019760',8.3,30714,'ru','Человек с киноаппаратом','A cameraman wanders around with a camera slung over his shoulder, documenting urban life with dazzling inventiveness.','/vJgAdgJWX54v0oXfIvhwjlZnmgn.jpg','1929-05-12',68,'Released','The Greatest Documentary Ever Made','Man with a Movie Camera',26317,3.2638,7.8,'BtTlgxtoqhg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(731,_binary '\0','/b1Lmbk9rPU9h2SH50ASRkd1P7e5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019777',6.8,8958,'en','The Cocoanuts','During the Florida land boom, the Marx Brothers run a hotel, auction off some land and thwart a jewel robbery.','/xfiyCaWDfftKHzft2MKxAFFwHYL.jpg','1929-05-23',93,'Released','Paramount\'s All Talking Musicomedy Sensation','The Cocoanuts',20625,2.9035,6.481,'VPVNvoJcS8k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(732,_binary '\0','/wRvxb5hOgJdBZevFEn0EZSeJOed.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019788',5.4,2531,'en','Coquette','A Southern belle\'s flirtation with a working man leads to tragedy.','/55WVe0RBtaLADx7VW4dpKPTeYeq.jpg','1929-03-30',76,'Released','100% talking picture','Coquette',85507,1.12,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(733,_binary '\0','/vbisPEmrFqzQYrp3SwNeuQvvOLN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019811',6.7,1304,'en','Desert Nights','Jewel thieves pull a heist on a diamond mining operation in Africa and take the foreman hostage before escaping into the Kalahari Desert, but when they get lost, the foreman must take charge and save them.','/gan6z7cRBD1GmNi6NVBOYyvhXf0.jpg','1929-03-09',62,'Released',NULL,'Desert Nights',119922,0.8832,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(734,_binary '\0','/lAhQmZJkcL3CjIyfzA3cDQeOLo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019823',6,1683,'en','Disraeli','Prime Minister of Great Britain Benjamin Disraeli outwits the subterfuge of the Russians and chicanery at home in order to secure the purchase of the Suez Canal.','/uVTmxQJp0sqBujbieSTrB2ui9al.jpg','1929-11-01',90,'Released','Disraeli – Lover and Leader!','Disraeli',84274,1.3187,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(735,_binary '\0','/cvAOkB5bryGWbxp8SqD1ovEsF4v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019901',7.3,4308,'de','Frau im Mond','A scientist discovers that there\'s gold on the moon. He builds a rocket to fly there, but there\'s too much rivalry among the crew to have a successful expedition.','/7s6zEsOAY3LD5qvzljmKKzjnLiT.jpg','1929-10-15',170,'Released',NULL,'Woman in the Moon',3007,2.2885,7.231,'lDnqSc1T3k0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(736,_binary '\0','/aYm06AmXLNbWMPacucu34e25tpI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019959',6.7,2250,'en','Hallelujah','A black laborer turns preacher after accidentally killing a man.','/eRRhrNMQkYLq90ZvwDqqMMebZWB.jpg','1929-08-20',100,'Released','HEAR AND SEE 100 JUBILEE SINGERS!','Hallelujah',72856,1.7921,6.6,'eayYUrtOB60','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(737,_binary '\0','/vu7gLgWefXGoP2UtAC41FTozSYs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0019993',5.6,2579,'en','The Hollywood Revue of 1929','An all-star revue featuring MGM contract players.','/pe8dZ8LpRnfivsQ7nxLhH5AWxoW.jpg','1929-11-23',118,'Released','25 of the screen\'s greatest stars - chorus of 200 - amazingly revolutionary motion picture!','The Hollywood Revue of 1929',31678,2.4894,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(738,_binary '\0','/VRjzMGnGuAXycd1alavkwgAqQJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0020018',5.5,1552,'en','In Old Arizona','Army Sergeant Mickey Dunn sets out in pursuit of the Cisco Kid, a notorious if kind-hearted and charismatic bandit of the Old West. The Kid spends much of his loot on Tonia, the woman he loves, not realizing that she is being unfaithful to him in his absence. Soon, with her oblivious paramour off plying his trade, Tonia falls in with Dunn, drawn by the allure of a substantial reward for the Kid\'s capture -- dead or alive. Together, they concoct a plan to ambush and do away with the Cisco Kid once and for all.','/x1XSQeLUdoi72P5UOXqAyL46B9a.jpg','1928-12-25',95,'Released','The first all-talking sound-on-film feature.','In Old Arizona',83989,1.2818,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(739,_binary '\0','/l6dxdIQMsqTzKlWBCVk3AdB7Dv5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0020030',7,1582,'en','The Iron Mask','King Louis XIII of France is thrilled to have born to him a son - an heir to the throne. But when the queen delivers a twin, Cardinal Richelieu sees the second son as a potential for revolution, and has him sent off to Spain to be raised in secret to ensure a peaceful future for France. Alas, keeping the secret means sending Constance, lover of D\'Artagnan, off to a convent. D\'Artagnan hears of this and rallies the Musketeers in a bid to rescue her. Unfortunately, Richelieu out-smarts the Musketeers and banishes them forever.','/f9t60V0eJ2pLwCl0YsBnvXQmRNN.jpg','1929-02-21',103,'Released','The Further Adventures of \"The Three Musketeers\"!','The Iron Mask',79761,2.0313,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(740,_binary '\0','/eVWNBhMs3NDWVACJiRlt2oRxPKX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0020062',6.8,1377,'en','The Kiss','An unhappily married woman is caught up in scandal and murder when her affection toward a young man is misinterpreted.','/t82WbEYJwKgnq9yKu9IQRxZk2f9.jpg','1929-11-15',62,'Released','A woman made for love...sacrificed on the altar of a desperate passion...','The Kiss',30631,1.2568,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(741,_binary '\0','/iu55XOBLoKKjFBRFTPTZizKn0jp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0020112',6.9,2968,'en','The Love Parade','The queen of mythical Sylvania marries a courtier, who finds his new life unsatisfying','/pWAoFnPsH4gYiFGqLwzicyMazdh.jpg','1929-11-19',107,'Released','He sang himself into the Queen\'s boudoir! One kiss and the whole kingdom was his!','The Love Parade',51759,1.9029,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(742,_binary '\0','/lWNkrEUaJWVh2LBk1hTggWcJpxN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0020122',7.6,1708,'en','Lucky Star','Mary, a poor farm girl, meets Tim just as word comes that war has been declared. Tim enlists in the army and goes to the battlefields of Europe, where he is wounded and loses the use of his legs. Home again, Tim is visited by Mary, and they are powerfully attracted to each other; but his physical handicap prevents him from declaring his love for her. Deeper complications set in when Martin, Tim\'s former sergeant and a bully, takes a shine to Mary.','/Ae5D9BmePeILMyvMIqFSNdPZr0o.jpg','1929-08-18',99,'Released','THE ONLY PICTURE GREAT ENOUGH TO MAKE YOU FORGET \"STREET ANGEL\"-\"SEVETH HEAVEN\"','Lucky Star',105981,1.3712,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(743,_binary '\0','/7AwNTqMuII17NVImYITXl0XXrx9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0020142',6.2,3699,'en','The Manxman','A fisherman and a rising lawyer who grew up together as brothers fall in love with the same woman.','/1CoJiLwUwKipp7X89M5ZmsI016.jpg','1929-01-18',100,'Released','The screen\'s supreme masterpiece!','The Manxman',20213,1.8465,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(744,_binary '\0','/anbsMyaswmoivxesRGDQGhw3g4k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0020143',6.1,1315,'en','Marianne','At the conclusion of World War I, a French girl is romanced by an American doughboy even though she is promised to a French soldier who was sent to the front.','/1jqPoj9MlsNb2Frzy6G9PWMyWX5.jpg','1929-08-24',111,'Released',NULL,'Marianne',190227,2.1112,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(745,_binary '\0','/9Ldf2rbtTpIvars9mf896XhFMvq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0020163',7.2,4011,'de','Menschen am Sonntag','A semi-documentary experimental 1930 German silent film created by amateurs with a small budget. With authentic scenes of the metropolis city of Berlin, it\'s the first film from the later famous screenwriters/directors Billy Wilder and Fred Zinnemann.','/gWIkCmYaRDlA78WMIfRUlURuLCZ.jpg','1930-02-04',74,'Released',NULL,'People on Sunday',347,2.0446,7.2,'z2O5QiCTreA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(746,_binary '\0','/h7W065cQV1qtIkFIePFasLZSMCA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0020269',7.1,2115,'en','Piccadilly','A young Chinese woman, working in the kitchen at a London dance club, is given the chance to become the club\'s main act.','/biZjt8E9ljayP80tZPXgWKBiiyn.jpg','1929-02-01',109,'Released',NULL,'Piccadilly',51079,1.7632,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(747,_binary '\0','/iS4APOsILdMylXr8UL7V101mHBx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0020298',7.1,3591,'en','Queen Kelly','A convent girl is abducted and seduced by a prince before being sent off to a brothel in East Africa.','/i1BN0KpSACWyDBHULPKUc24oE67.jpg','1929-12-31',101,'Released','The silent film masterpiece that never was... Until now.','Queen Kelly',42638,1.6512,6.5,'lNlS1XFoTkQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(748,_binary '\0','/1072g4Z38jwvQiEff7yJtbTjVtR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0020442',6.9,2851,'en','Spite Marriage','An unimpressive but well-intentioned man is given the chance to marry a popular actress, of whom he has been a hopeless fan. But what he doesn\'t realize is that he is being used to make the actress\' old flame jealous.','/eXt4ilTxsrY5a1Lagp1TE79vIvN.jpg','1929-03-24',76,'Released','The Scream of the Screen-Buster in a Matrimonial Maelstrom – Buster\'s Adventure in Married Bliss.','Spite Marriage',51303,1.6902,6.582,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(749,_binary '\0','/tF2OHtIQkN4Y5D7xuy3S2ZuRM9k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0020451',7.1,1894,'ru','Старое и новое','Also known as The Old and the New, The General Line illustrates Lenin’s stated imperative that the nation move from agrarian to industrial culture in an epic ode to farm-collectivization progress.','/6sSikOdXU9Aiwkwfjrm9iT4fH1N.jpg','1929-09-25',125,'Released',NULL,'The General Line',110741,1.03,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(750,_binary '\0','/vKFN25TQMeH8JdAC4TwTBMO0FNe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0020475',7.8,5253,'de','Tagebuch einer Verlorenen','Thymian Henning, an innocent young girl, is raped by the clerk of her father\'s pharmacy. She becomes pregnant, is rejected by her family, and must fend for herself in a harsh, cruel world.','/uDR1Tt2pFR0M3gUFCJ1w2oiVYlM.jpg','1929-09-27',113,'Released',NULL,'Diary of a Lost Girl',42637,1.7259,7.3,'Y8CVd5pM4AA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(751,_binary '\0','/qoNihbuFTophbYa5NRLwyqs1a1w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0020514',6.4,1531,'en','The Trespasser','A stenographer who works for a lawyer falls in love with and marries a wealthy young man. His family has the marraige annulled, after which she gives birth to a child. Her former boss helps her out to ensure the child\'s welfare, which starts gossip that she is a \"kept woman.\"','/8IIvlovQzJ4BXbdNiAvtXRbu90u.jpg','1929-11-11',90,'Released','Her First ALL TALKING Picture','The Trespasser',53796,1.1933,6.9,'uyfndlsXL2A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(752,_binary '\0','/3MmOT50aI8QVR9s3tS8GrgDPQ04.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0020570',7.3,1243,'de','Die weiße Hölle vom Piz Palü','Dr. Johannes Krafft climbs a 12,000-foot mountain over and over again to search for his wife, who was lost on their honeymoon. Another couple makes the dangerous climb with him.','/wrPcJD1wjEHamKnbccHpURJwjBc.jpg','1929-10-10',150,'Released',NULL,'The White Hell of Pitz Palu',29043,1.9521,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(753,_binary '\0','/uhPHNGd4PHMoXnhda2s0zm2ddDy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0020620',5.7,1907,'en','Abraham Lincoln','An episodic dramatization of the 18th President of the United States\' life, including his early years, affair with Ann Rutledge, courtship of Mary Todd, debates with Stephen A. Douglas, the election of 1860, his presidency during the Civil War, and finally his assassination at Ford\'s Theater in 1865.','/4BOmqevJBC5gBfQNXpa2epf27yO.jpg','1930-11-08',83,'Released','The wonder film of the century, about the most romantic figure who ever lived!','Abraham Lincoln',130816,2.1041,5.5,'11rSeJ19XuI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(754,_binary '\0','/yeQGyB8MjpX8KR7rUrP0E3gaviC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0020629',8.1,72754,'en','All Quiet on the Western Front','When a group of idealistic young men join the German Army during the Great War, they are assigned to the Western Front, where their patriotism is destroyed by the harsh realities of combat.','/1wZUB08igw8iLUgF1r4T6aJD65b.jpg','1930-04-29',133,'Released','They left for war as boys never to return as men.','All Quiet on the Western Front',143,7.3851,7.8,'Qeh3DlBEjAc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(755,_binary '\0','/2gVyboeQAgprrPWed3OraflG6x4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0020640',7.4,16332,'en','Animal Crackers','The well-known explorer and hunter Captain Spaulding has just returned from Africa, and is being welcomed home with a lavish party at the estate of influential society matron Mrs. Rittenhouse when a valuable painting goes missing. The intrepid Captain Spaulding attempts to solve the crime with the help of his silly secretary Horatio Jamison, while sparring with the anarchic Signor Emanuel Ravelli and his nutty sidekick The Professor.','/qj7owFXzCtIbZC51O8NwLe4Kde4.jpg','1930-08-08',98,'Released','The maddest comics of them all!','Animal Crackers',13913,2.465,6.907,'0ykYqkECz9E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(756,_binary '\0','/rBXc4JPCe97mYS5oiCrbbZFQKVY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0020641',6.5,3881,'en','Anna Christie','Old sailor Chris Christofferson eagerly awaits the arrival of his grown daughter Anna, whom he sent at five years old to live with relatives in Minnesota. He has not seen her since, but believes her to be a decent and respectably employed young woman. When Anna arrives, however, it is clear that she has lived a hard life in the dregs of society, and that much of spirit has been extinguished. She falls in love with a young sailor rescued at sea by her father, but dreads to reveal to him the truth of her past. Both father and young man are deluded about her background, yet Anna cannot quite bring herself to allow them to remain deluded.','/zHsjA95g42xeBEPcWdF4s1BA53L.jpg','1930-02-21',89,'Released','Garbo Talks!','Anna Christie',42812,1.4666,6,'46ybS7cebuU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(757,_binary '\0','/2ANy7LVvJwOkTPOHYii0Z0lwTHf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0020668',6.3,1545,'en','The Bat Whispers','Infamous burglar \"The Bat\" commits a daring jewelry theft despite heavy police presence. Soon after, a bank theft occurs, which may be the work of the criminal as well. Meanwhile, Cornelia Van Gorder has various people arrive at her old mansion, including her niece, Dale, a bank employee, and police detective Anderson. When guests start turning up dead, Cornelia begins to suspect that The Bat may be lurking around the estate.','/pkgDRRgLjvMwjJXpnKrBYriSd9X.jpg','1930-11-13',83,'Released','Greatest All Talking Thriller','The Bat Whispers',26162,1.1388,6.6,'JeaNEWKchts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(758,_binary '\0','/4lRe6MUBc6NW3HRxLYjtEnwdju5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0020686',7.1,3065,'en','The Big House','Convicted of manslaughter for a drunken driving accident, Kent Marlowe is sent to prison, where he meets vicious incarcerated figures who are planning an escape from the brutal conditions.','/qVf7Dpgx0sdDkZEn4CwTYethoMp.jpg','1930-06-14',87,'Released','Timely! Tremendous! Thrilling! Drama of Love and a Jail-Break!','The Big House',47250,1.359,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(759,_binary '\0','/ea9rdcxr7NZwI5MVCoF3x3VzWHq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0020691',7.2,5267,'en','The Big Trail','Young scout Breck Coleman leads a wagon train along the dangerous trail to Oregon as he tries to get the affection of the beautiful pioneer Ruth Cameron and plans his revenge on the harsh scoundrels who murdered a friend of his in the past.','/mmKlxMlpvTRwJWs0x2nAhdhWOIv.jpg','1930-11-01',122,'Released','A mighty drama of the early pioneers','The Big Trail',42640,2.8087,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(760,_binary '\0','/jLvlD6ABDESFfYl3F1TqCoiBaig.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0020697',7.6,17829,'de','Der blaue Engel','Prim professor Immanuel Rath finds some of his students ogling racy photos of cabaret performer Lola Lola and visits a local club, The Blue Angel, in an attempt to catch them there. Seeing Lola perform, the teacher is filled with lust, eventually resigning his position at the school to marry the young woman. However, his marriage to a coquette -- whose job is to entice men -- proves to be more difficult than Rath imagined.','/khz2rKLAPDVu9auJt1sR1HO9SCG.jpg','1930-04-01',108,'Released','You Too, Will Be Aroused By Her Intoxicating Beauty! \"This Woman Makes a Man of Dignity a Slave to Love!\"','The Blue Angel',228,3.8844,7.3,'Lw6GJiGNO74','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(761,_binary '\0','/6hOnedl1IdzLc1xMuESG9KUtNMr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0020768',7.7,4119,'en','City Girl','A waitress from Chicago falls in love with a man from rural Minnesota and marries him, with the intent of living a better life - but life on the farm has its own challenges.','/d0ioAdV4cg9euanBb2OdA3zpAsT.jpg','1930-01-12',88,'Released','SEE AND HEAR LIFE IN THE \"RAW\" WITH THE \"CITY GIRL\"','City Girl',34796,2.0927,7.5,'Pop64E6uOD8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(762,_binary '\0','/viBqsZGPEbq8fn3r4Apzy8NABab.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0020793',7.5,1364,'en','A Cottage on Dartmoor','A jealous barber\'s assistant becomes enraged by the attentions the manicurist he\'s obsessed with and a repeat customer pay to one another.','/7pEJGYom5opZCzyoc8JXXDP8Lag.jpg','1929-10-01',88,'Released',NULL,'A Cottage on Dartmoor',94716,1.1515,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(763,_binary '\0','/1n6OeLYXzDZ5TnuyWj9ysatBDyv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0020815',7.1,2342,'en','The Dawn Patrol','World War I ace Dick Courtney derides the leadership of his superior officer, but he soon is promoted to squadron commander and learns harsh lessons about sending subordinates to their deaths.','/rJQIJGOx1EMkPt0vkRGpEUuXvSw.jpg','1930-07-10',108,'Released','GREATEST AIR EPIC EVER!','The Dawn Patrol',81847,1.2434,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(764,_binary '\0','/d56eqsCmBCGQZebPjIeAL9ZHXWu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0020827',6.6,4192,'en','The Divorcee','When a woman discovers that her husband has been unfaithful, she decides to pay him back in kind.','/zzu6IW9ilkUt6L4DL9SoNnwtAfy.jpg','1930-04-19',83,'Released','Her sin was no greater than his… but she was a woman.','The Divorcee',80708,1.3796,6.242,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(765,_binary '\0','/Ac6WZRfp3NnJD0QsqkgfEXDs4qW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0020836',6.5,1627,'en','The Doorway to Hell','A vicious crime lord decides that he has had enough and much to the shock of his colleagues decides to give the business to his second in command and retire to Florida after marrying his moll. Unfortunately, he has no idea that she and the man are lovers.','/jZgIKq8CHrcy17Mdb4VMGMQNV3a.jpg','1930-10-18',78,'Released',NULL,'The Doorway to Hell',26699,1.6367,6.5,'ofEVUDv4eL4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(766,_binary '\0','/t0dKYjfNXrNM9rMI5dousDPDGiE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0020876',6.7,1308,'en','Feet First','An ambitious shoe salesman, Harold, unknowingly meets the boss\' daughter and tells her he is a leather tycoon. The rest of the film he spends hiding his true circumstances, in the store and later on a ship. Trying to deliver a letter, he later finds himself dangling high above the street on a building\'s scaffolding.','/7cD3xWlzcX7WwmQuqZ8Qi7BAz40.jpg','1930-10-30',91,'Released','Every inch -- a thrill!','Feet First',42363,1.1099,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(767,_binary '\0','/ciFb2FQICFlxzzG6oPVDROwjx5n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0020891',6,1455,'en','The Florodora Girl','A chorus girl gets bad advice from her fellow chorines in handling a rich suitor who assumes she is a gold digger.','/ylHVWhDO6Aw00gtpCQGogkn34II.jpg','1930-05-31',79,'Released','A Story of the Gay Nineties','The Florodora Girl',162874,1.412,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(768,_binary '\0','/wZeh4Pa9NXtvgyIngIOIS9j2C3S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0020960',7.2,6866,'en','Hell\'s Angels','As the Great War breaks out in Europe, Oxford brothers Roy and Monte enlist in the RFC to fight for queen and country, while their college friend Karl is drafted in Germany. A love triangle involving Monte, Roy, and Roy\'s girlfriend, Helen, the brothers\' disparate personalities, and Monte\'s cowardice in the face of war soon threaten to compromise a top-secret bombing mission over German territory.','/vt6zF55B9WLzYENs6cuXy8J5o1X.jpg','1930-11-15',131,'Released','Howard Hughes\' Thrilling Multi-Million Dollar Air Spectacle','Hell\'s Angels',22301,3.4632,6.563,'KqD3hN9G2AM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(769,_binary '\0','/ojxIfC8ESL3HnCUPcjvUcVg6wJD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021015',4.6,2873,'en','Juno and the Paycock','In the slums of Dublin during the Irish Civil War, the Boyle family’s fragile stability collapses after news of an unexpected inheritance lures them into a false sense of prosperity. Captain Boyle, a boastful idler, squanders their meager resources, while his wife Juno holds the household together. When the fortune proves illusory, the family faces ruin, betrayal, and tragedy.','/eKAOKqfBacUDNhPwvXFxaP59Kyp.jpg','1930-06-29',94,'Released','The \"Over-The-Hill\" of the Talkies.','Juno and the Paycock',47695,1.9668,4.594,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(770,_binary '\0','/lrjr3n25Hmwy6foSrr1w9nMi3e8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021025',6.7,1965,'en','King of Jazz','A large-scale revue musical built around Paul Whiteman and his orchestra, presenting a series of musical performances, sketches, and staged tableaux in early two-color Technicolor, emblematic of Hollywood’s early sound-era “all-star” musical productions.','/2CXh34kZ4AblbpnVIqmPF1vKwti.jpg','1930-04-20',100,'Released','A NEW ERA in sound and color entertainment!','King of Jazz',108213,1.9642,6.4,'Mp4nfqmhxAg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(771,_binary '\0','/5jUtmqC9KwpEJ8wmNCsGpVozVIh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021040',6.7,2019,'en','Ladies of Leisure','Kay Arnold is a gold digger who wanders from party to party with the intention of catching a rich suitor. Jerry Strong is a young man from a wealthy family who strives to succeed as an artist. What begins as a relationship of mutual convenience soon turns into something else.','/71LYZn15hORP7MKE1jZAEb37ZSo.jpg','1930-04-05',100,'Released','Zippy, daring, peppy, gay!','Ladies of Leisure',122047,1.622,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(772,_binary '\0','/fG5sKoSaTiySmGaqFjNcGXo4Gtt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021079',7.1,16198,'en','Little Caesar','A small-time hood shoots his way to the top, but how long can he stay there?','/1K3Q1tAHHA5Sdtja2pPALBQevA7.jpg','1931-01-25',78,'Released','The Power-Mad Monarch of the Murder Mobs!','Little Caesar',27899,3.3293,6.856,'pAM2UDuQIjw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(773,_binary '\0','/qeMUiDbR2AIX3feRFDdBZesjDM7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021106',6.3,1607,'en','Madam Satan','A socialite masquerades as a notorious femme fatale to win back her straying husband during a costume party aboard a doomed dirigible.','/fMRAu0p3cT1p06TCbPDsjcLgs4O.jpg','1930-09-20',116,'Released',NULL,'Madam Satan',83817,1.9802,5.9,'44kEVSMCzm4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(774,_binary '\0','/tffrbnKlVzcYlXxBNOcf5zWWnZx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021148',6.7,2157,'en','Min and Bill','Min, the owner of a dockside hotel, is forced to make difficult decisions about the future of Nancy, the young woman she took in as an infant.','/9I8cAo1fbEeztrgvbNwk18xqTwz.jpg','1930-11-29',66,'Released','All taking picture','Min and Bill',85505,1.0135,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(775,_binary '\0','/dqrOCjOXZKFsiEIobIOIyRHlWmw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021153',6.6,1695,'en','Monte Carlo','A countess fleeing her husband mistakes a count for her hairdresser at a Monte Carlo casino.','/eKw9l71pSV2lQpUsfK1pV3KJKaX.jpg','1930-08-27',90,'Released','As intimate as a lady\'s boudoir!','Monte Carlo',105067,1.1673,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(776,_binary '\0','/fyIbxqQ75Ma9jXmSr4OxXZ0UkOa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021156',7,8532,'en','Morocco','Mogador, Morocco. Late 1920s. A complex romance develops between a womanizing Legionnaire and a disillusioned Parisian cabaret singer.','/jDqZsxyv35iyJWW0mANk1RhxhJp.jpg','1930-11-14',92,'Released','Who is this woman who scorns a hundred men...to give her love to a Devil-May-Care Soldier?','Morocco',42641,2.7088,6.4,'u80OARwTRBw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(777,_binary '\0','/PYhykxjFQU3TnlvqoqMrsLTJ8U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021165',6.3,7933,'en','Murder!','When actress Diana Baring is found in a daze beside her colleague’s murdered body, all evidence points to her guilt. During the trial, juror Sir John Menier doubts the verdict, but yields to pressure. Haunted by remorse, he launches his own investigation.','/iu8mee9GciHFgfqG5ifdDOTLw4F.jpg','1930-07-31',102,'Released','Who killed Edna Druce?','Murder!',31930,2.478,5.9,'BxMMkvTnW0A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(778,_binary '\0','/wEoiSEhCoI2UZD1QhSKobfsCBDf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021189',5.8,1221,'en','Not So Dumb','Not-so-smart chatterbox Dulcy Parker does and says all the wrong things, but they right themselves to prove she\'s not so dumb after all.','/nQzIXyGp560iqMpb8EmOVJiDl0N.jpg','1930-02-02',76,'Released','A laugh in every line...and a howl in every scene. The Comedy Hit Of The Talking Screen','Not So Dumb',221395,1.1411,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(779,_binary '\0','/gzcfhMFuoryamZ2hOkICFMc6oGk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021281',6.4,1266,'en','Raffles','A distinguished English gentleman has a secret life--he is the notorious jewel thief the press has dubbed \"The Amateur Cracksman\". When he meets a woman and falls in love he decides to \"retire\" from that life, but an old friend comes to him with a predicament that entails him committing one last job.','/mOeP2d3JO1Q8bLgphb9zyEM3spG.jpg','1930-07-11',72,'Released',NULL,'Raffles',104439,0.8831,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(780,_binary '\0','/dxxAdGfbTuQa7feJ8WN0nMouWwQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021309',7.6,1804,'fr','Le Roman de Renard','In the kingdom of animals, Master Fox is used to trick and fool everyone. So the King, the Lion, receives more and more complaints about him. He orders that Master Fox is arrested and brought to him.','/eYt1ddYGIO98MzsprcRjgZuPusW.jpg','1941-04-10',65,'Released',NULL,'The Tale of the Fox',90034,1.5658,7.1,'M6RNyaMAhrs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(781,_binary '\0','/kRQVehqORmZPeK3kt7ktmeKPhqt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021331',7.2,8089,'fr','Le Sang d\'un poète','In a poet’s room, an armless statue abruptly comes to life. It invites the poet to step through a mirror and to discover another world. Strange places and characters present themselves to him. The poet tears himself away from these twisted fascinations and returns, with some difficulty, to his room.','/paHmfMrtQVT2cUTeteni3iDgRym.jpg','1932-01-20',55,'Released',NULL,'The Blood of a Poet',36877,2.3857,7.037,'3scPy9ohKDc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(782,_binary '\0','/ufiS5eOoVdBOzuemG52My8skGO3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021409',7,2723,'fr','Sous les toits de Paris','In the tenement slums of Paris between the world wars, impoverished street singer Albert yearns for beautiful Romanian immigrant Pola. Pola\'s boyfriend, local hoodlum Fred, grows jealous of Albert\'s constant attention to his woman and frames the hapless musician for one of his own petty crimes. But while Albert is in prison for Fred\'s misdeed, Pola ends up falling for Albert\'s faithful best friend, Louis.','/xvpsXolyLwcSIoCMdeWbRZjaBbU.jpg','1930-04-28',92,'Released',NULL,'Under the Roofs of Paris',54419,1.6085,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(783,_binary '\0','/l7MNAXrIiJ2MbQ6MpxVGEMsxJuE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021505',6.7,1579,'en','The Unholy Three','A trio of former sideshow performers double as the \"Unholy Three\" in a scam to nab some shiny rocks.','/4NLoePBFJX8O0yCwBbhrqhHFXFp.jpg','1930-07-12',72,'Released','Lon Chaney talks!','The Unholy Three',27504,1.073,5.913,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(784,_binary '\0','/3Qj51g5mNkzrR0gNIrR16ywWfeZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021508',5.9,1564,'en','Up the River','Daily life at men and women\'s prison units where baseball and the marching band are serious business. Two prisoners escape in order to help paroled Steve from being blackmailed by his girlfriend\'s ex-partner-in-crime.','/pJjvzJiSAh0g0XsQvMbCFakNO0v.jpg','1930-10-10',85,'Released','You bet ~ IT\'S FUNNY a movietone laugh riot.','Up the River',72602,1.2398,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(785,_binary '\0','/sNJSZxMKh2YneVI7XBeeFKbDXKN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021542',7.3,2963,'de','Westfront 1918: Vier von der Infanterie','A group of German infantrymen of the First World War live out their lives in the trenches of France. They find brief entertainment and relief in a village behind the lines, but primarily terror fills their lives as the attacks on and from the French army ebb and flow. One of the men, Karl, goes home on leave only to discover the degradation forced on his family by wartime poverty. He returns to the lines in time to face an enormous attack by French tanks.','/oaMSB0DZY0GK8VdaDuHQLLdtHkg.jpg','1930-05-23',97,'Released',NULL,'Westfront 1918',80705,1.9398,6.6,'0yqQLJCDDT0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(786,_binary '\0','/mZk2fz2Wok6EsESjXbNW8NDXxP0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021549',6.3,1331,'en','Whoopee!','Western sheriff Bob Wells is preparing to marry Sally Morgan; she loves part-Indian Wanenis, whose race is an obstacle. Sally flees the wedding with hypochondriac Henry Williams, who thinks he\'s just giving her a ride; but she left a note saying they\'ve eloped! Chasing them are jilted Bob, Henry\'s nurse Mary (who\'s been trying to seduce him) and others.','/jVggH7wheJahCoQWUzt1CA2KGVN.jpg','1930-09-26',93,'Released','90 Blazing Boistrous minutes of the Funniest Guy that ever made a camera crack wide open with Laughter','Whoopee!',108224,1.0202,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(787,_binary '\0','/5EHNInARZmBhOnwl3kiDfhCYTvC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021571',7.2,7077,'uk','Земля','During the agrarian collectivization process in the Soviet Union, Vasyl, a peasant member of the youth division of the Communist Party, gets a tractor with the help of a local party organization and plows private boundaries on kulak fields. However, this enthusiasm will cost him dearly.','/zXRpYOJFZ8wWzhCYWILSiw1ouOy.jpg','1930-04-08',79,'Released',NULL,'Earth',46594,2.1446,6.7,'8wXzFIDMLT0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(788,_binary '\0','/9sm4hWWjbLVVRhsokPaa1toqHe7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021577',7.1,15843,'fr','L\'Âge d\'or','The film consists of a series of tightly interlinked vignettes, the most sustained of which details the story of a man and a woman who are passionately in love. Their attempts to consummate their passion are constantly thwarted, by their families, by the Church and bourgeois society in general.','/q3OH9Yk3hOE5uYEK55ASjEtsPfE.jpg','1930-11-28',63,'Released','A surrealist masterpiece.','L\'Âge d\'or',5729,3.7553,6.762,'Q14oKtsd-Zw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(789,_binary '\0','/lEbxTnpp7dj8Cwm6YjWR9kNaAoN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021622',6.2,2297,'en','Arrowsmith','A medical researcher is sent to a plague outbreak, where he has to decide priorities for the use of a vaccine.','/urUy4jYuRs53WSmE0t0BivUSQjC.jpg','1931-12-07',108,'Released','HE FOUGHT FOR MAN... and lost a woman!','Arrowsmith',84298,1.5421,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(790,_binary '\0','/r1KRWPYxnfu54yB5EaB7uBtb6JC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021633',6.4,1356,'en','The Bachelor Father','Lonely in his English country estate, Sir Basil decides to gather his grown (albeit illegitimate) children around him in his declining years. He uses a ledger which keeps track of the payments he has been making to ex-lovers to locate 2 of them, and a third is found by a lawyer in New York, her mother was too proud to accept any money. Sir Basil is a curmudgeon, and his three adult children have a hard time with him at first. Toni, the American, is a free spirit who had a budding career in show business. Jeffery is English and a semi-gentleman, and Maria is Italian, with a Latin temperament. They begin to bond, especially Sir Basil and Toni, whose outgoing personality finally wins over the old man. But past lives begin to creep back into the picture and threaten the old man\'s plans for a life filled with his children.','/5B8w50JMSSTOf0fRVSakW8ci77e.jpg','1931-01-10',90,'Released','Her daddy was a bachelor-and she won her way right into his heart.','The Bachelor Father',229005,0.968,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(791,_binary '\0','/a2M2cG9pwZmFkGlyAAseHTGuxWQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021635',6.4,1929,'en','Bad Girl','A man and woman, skeptical about romance, nonetheless fall in love and are wed, but their lack of confidence in the opposite sex haunts their marriage.','/kUwfDGMbTdb3Foc8p0cG7urBQBW.jpg','1931-08-13',90,'Released','VINA DELMAR\'S novel of New York Life','Bad Girl',84299,2.0802,5.976,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(792,_binary '\0','/ziNXkGR4WvF2hWLh5LJjhJ1znr7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021636',6.1,1729,'en','The Bad Sister','Marianne falls in love with con man Valentine who uses their relation to get her father\'s endorsement on a money-raising scheme. He runs off with the money and Marianne, later dumping her. Her sister Laura loves Dr. Lindley although she knows he loves Marianne. Marianne returns and marries a wealthy young man, and Lindley turns his love toward Laura.','/n7jx03EnD2eyob8ld07bOD5XOcl.jpg','1931-03-29',68,'Released','The girl who wanted everything!','The Bad Sister',156322,1.3646,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(793,_binary '\0','/9qX09KMoyYVyQqFqcjrmwllQcPO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021668',6.6,1891,'en','The Black Camel','Movie star Shelah Fane is seeing wealthy Alan Jaynes while filming in Honolulu, Hawaii, but won\'t marry him without consulting famed psychic Tarneverro first. Enter inspector Charlie Chan of the Honolulu Police, investigating the unsolved murder, three years earlier, of a Hollywood actor.','/oq1NH2ZJkkp31zzOqXiCOeGnLqj.jpg','1931-06-21',71,'Released','The unsolved secrets of Hollywood disclosed under the romantic spell of Hawaiian moonlight','The Black Camel',38453,1.3749,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(794,_binary '\0','/rjtNt4qKhzaymup7vwViOYzogH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021673',7.1,2626,'en','Blonde Crazy','The adventures of a cocky con man and his beautiful accomplice.','/dhQSdNMkXEsEXS3TllcdgbhLqMm.jpg','1931-09-16',79,'Released','Jim\'s back!... with a brand new line!','Blonde Crazy',42659,1.3718,7.043,'5cKY_Fw1PhA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(795,_binary '\0','/vT5TmlYo9Y16KGMx86bD3KLMIbL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021730',7.2,4015,'en','The Champ','A broken-down alcoholic prizefighter struggles to keep custody of his adoring son.','/5miye3zystUco0k4WtN5cKoKJB.jpg','1931-11-21',86,'Released','The knockout picture of the year!','The Champ',42816,2.1914,7.1,'soDPKxKMESM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(796,_binary '\0','/hiaZPun8bezhRcY8rFJEtRE8PG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021739',7.5,5412,'fr','La Chienne','Cashier Maurice Legrand is married to the wretched Adele. By chance, he meets Lucienne, \'Lulu\', and makes her his mistress. He thinks he has finally found love, but Lulu is a streetwalker, still in love with her pimp.','/h3b8k9sY4z8mIy0J6zu9O3ZIcLr.jpg','1931-11-01',96,'Released',NULL,'La Chienne',26614,1.7289,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(797,_binary '\0','/mgo2XCKPHzZINzcm0YFjSUGpPIr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021746',5.8,7917,'en','Cimarron','When the government opens up the Oklahoma territory for settlement, restless Yancey Cravat claims a plot of the free land for himself and moves his family there from Wichita. A newspaperman, lawyer, and just about everything else, Cravat soon becomes a leading citizen of the boom town of Osage. Once the town is established, however, he begins to feel confined once again, and heads for the Cherokee Strip, leaving his family behind. During this and other absences, his wife Sabra must learn to take care of herself and soon becomes prominent in her own right.','/cqvfhi9s1VsTgXcV1B7vX0Cb1qA.jpg','1931-01-26',123,'Released','Terrific as all creation!','Cimarron',42861,2.0315,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(798,_binary '\0','/Ma7mQsldFCaQpsZbm8zolgLfmV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021749',8.5,218264,'en','City Lights','A tramp falls in love with a beautiful blind flower girl. His on-and-off friendship with a wealthy man allows him to be the girl\'s benefactor and suitor.','/ugmakEL5y294I5bXgiBqApuZpwc.jpg','1931-02-06',87,'Released','True Blind Love','City Lights',901,6.9626,8.245,'7vl7F8S4cpQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(799,_binary '\0','/eB9u5szYI4XEQdGiqqhtdfvFGpV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021750',7,2121,'en','City Streets','A mobster\'s daughter leads her boyfriend from the circus into bootlegging.','/1P2FKo5AgmdIA7ifosxTo8UosED.jpg','1931-04-18',83,'Released','Love and courage pitted against a ruthless hate!','City Streets',29745,1.3693,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(800,_binary '\0','/4kcUGPbSZZvvTjve3DrJo3erzFT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021770',6.9,1816,'en','The Criminal Code','After young Robert Graham commits a murder while drunk and defending his girlfriend, he is prosecuted by ambitious Mark Brady and sentenced to 10 years. Six years later, Brady becomes the prison warden and offers the beleaguered Robert a job as his chauffeur. Robert cleans up his act, but, on the eve of his pardon, his cellmate drags him back into the world of violence, and he faces a difficult choice that could return him to prison.','/nshRsmnw7wpE2fsRkVrCED7uCcI.jpg','1931-01-03',97,'Released','LOVE saved him from worse than THE CHAIR','The Criminal Code',42815,1.4289,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(801,_binary '\0','/adR7ehgGwnGLNTbqLb28PdgOHAr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021778',6.3,1456,'en','Dance, Fools, Dance','When misfortune hits hard on the Jordan family of Chicago\'s upper class, Bonnie Jordan, a dazzling and witty girl, finds a job as an aspiring reporter; however, her naive younger brother Rodney takes a twisted path and gets involved with the wrong people.','/dwieBi0VsQpGnKLMOomldAWgipR.jpg','1931-02-07',78,'Released','She Dances Her Way from the Gayest Social Whirl to Grimmest Underworld!','Dance, Fools, Dance',154515,1.237,6.435,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(802,_binary '\0','/pzV5QZHhAsG5ODCPmgAezkfUdas.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021800',7.2,3622,'en','Dishonored','The Austrian Secret Service sends its most seductive agent to spy on the Russians.','/g3Q4WgQdJgLdt4EVMqLQqKsDcFv.jpg','1931-04-04',91,'Released','Can a Woman Kill a Man With Whom She Has Known a Night of Love?','Dishonored',73420,2.794,6.952,'0Oeq47VQoQs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(803,_binary '\0','/cemjdP7HrUyJAry85vRT19Hidbi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021814',7.3,65435,'en','Dracula','A British estate agent travels to Transylvania to meet with the mysterious Count Dracula, who is interested in leasing a London castle. After Dracula enslaves and drives the agent to insanity, the pair return to London together, where Dracula, a secret bloodsucker, begins preying on socialites.','/ueVSPt7vAba0XScHWTDWS5tNxYX.jpg','1931-02-12',74,'Released','The story of the strangest passion the world has ever known!','Dracula',138,6.1432,7.2,'M5zL-jCgvUA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(804,_binary '\0','/7z9swUmSsfMjmgSds1TUoELWqHr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021815',7,5677,'es','Drácula','A British estate agent travels to Transylvania to meet the mysterious Count Dracula, who is interested in leasing a London castle. After Dracula enslaves the agent and drives him to insanity, the pair return to London together, where Dracula, a secret bloodsucker, begins preying on socialites.','/vXpPf8MFLqp4f9KdUyjL7tSYDmd.jpg','1931-03-01',104,'Released',NULL,'Drácula',39259,3.1939,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(805,_binary '\0','/tNynKhMCy215pLuDeleRsEy85tr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021818',7.2,2764,'de','Die 3 Groschen-Oper','In London at the turn of the century, underworld kingpin Mack the Knife marries Polly Peachum without the knowledge of her father, the equally enterprising \'king of the beggars\'.','/w39cIJWmtLRxyqAE2KdhSuUa0wC.jpg','1931-02-18',112,'Released','Let the fantasy take you far, far away...','The 3 Penny Opera',42837,1.6986,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(806,_binary '\0','/sy5ABckvrfsMvAd1AGeWMHJH9yj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021873',7.3,2971,'en','Five Star Final','Searching for headlines at any cost, an unscrupulous newspaper owner forces his editor to print a serial based on a past murder, tormenting a woman involved.','/1DZF4buRoDNsnAtkQZd8fIYVCCV.jpg','1931-09-26',89,'Released','A picture as sensational as its subject!','Five Star Final',42669,1.4231,6.6,'GUUoZLA9Iag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(807,_binary '\0','/pZwMcUbmfhmT94szAABnr4n0PEj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021874',6.4,1567,'en','Five and Ten','John owns the largest chain of five and ten cent stores in the country. He moves his family to New York from Kansas City and their life, though grand, is falling apart due to his constant working. Wife and mother Jenny is lonely. Son Avery hates his job. Daughter Jennifer is snubbed by classmate Muriel and her friends. At a charity bazaar, Jennifer meets Berry and sparks are evident. However, he is engaged to Muriel and Muriel will make sure that she, and only she, marries Berry. After the marriage, Berry still thinks of Jennifer as Jennifer thinks of Berry. Avery laments about the state of his family since they were happy in Kansas City.','/uYnB3pqyyffBtuaJbeRfxMMhIJ5.jpg','1931-06-13',89,'Released',NULL,'Five and Ten',53232,1.4389,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(808,_binary '\0','/wFbPbJ9uRDpjY7micBTeolgkOA4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021884',7.7,88693,'en','Frankenstein','Henry Frankenstein pieces together body parts in the hope of bringing a human-like creature to life. The mad scientist’s dreams are shattered by his monstrous creation awakening with rage to a world that hates and fears him.','/mu6wHwH0IwCCaEYtpqujuPJYat1.jpg','1931-11-21',70,'Released','The man who made a monster.','Frankenstein',3035,5.3872,7.5,'EEH5MZCewPQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(809,_binary '\0','/1cnOaObW5D0x1v3zJVzenQy0iYG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021885',6.6,3229,'en','A Free Soul','An alcoholic lawyer who successfully defended a notorious gambler on a murder charge objects when his free-spirited daughter becomes romantically involved with him.','/A1mXqIz27GtoJfLCMQvkf6FBYbu.jpg','1931-06-02',93,'Released','She wasn\'t a divorcee but she believed that strangers could kiss!','A Free Soul',50600,1.4446,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(810,_binary '\0','/oXKzUfG4HPl1e3b87eFWV8Lr07a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021890',6.7,3905,'en','The Front Page','Hildy Johnson is an investigative reporter looking for a bigger paycheck. When an accused murderer escapes from custody, Hildy sees an opportunity for the story of a lifetime. But when he finds the criminal, he learns that the man may not be guilty. With the help of his editor, Hildy attempts to hide the convict, uncover the conspiracy and write the scoop of his career.','/1ZVA6L4a5HKIdvfpNcxDU38BHYd.jpg','1931-04-04',101,'Released','A Picture That Has Cracked This Shock-Proof Town Wide Open!','The Front Page',42814,1.4359,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(811,_binary '\0','/bOQ44VeEO2v4BPExBGYl070zQBO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021985',7.7,1926,'hu','Hyppolit a lakáj','Evergreen comedy about a typical parvenu, an ignorant transportation entrepreneur who has suddenly found himself very rich. Despite their humble origins, his wife strives to live a sophisticated lifestyle. When she engages a butler, Hyppolit, their whole life is turned upside down. It has remained one of the most viewed Hungarian comedies of all time: it is shown regularly and is still extremely popular','/k3u3KwdYsQyZE6EItJZxsgp5zzw.jpg','1931-11-27',72,'Released',NULL,'Hyppolit, the Butler',41062,0.9428,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(812,_binary '\0','/ogNO3Gj0UBWe9lmpO8mqB4qUZvV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0021992',6.1,1301,'en','Illicit','Ann, a young woman with outrageously advanced ideas, has been living in sin with Dick, her lover, because of her conviction that marriage would destroy their love; but social pressure ends up paying off, so Ann and Dick get married.','/eo6YfvqgJICwEURzIvXod9utIzJ.jpg','1931-02-14',77,'Released','Married love or illicit. Which does the modern girl prefer?','Illicit',121020,1.0805,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(813,_binary '\0','/1i90zjs2VIODfwhm6hcpEAv1v7j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022000',6.2,1628,'en','Indiscreet','A young woman jeopardizes the relationship with the man she loves when a no-account from her past shows up.','/nlRlzLXItc270RwJb5h7re0cDvg.jpg','1931-04-25',92,'Released','Through one indiscretion--a woman with a future became a woman with a past','Indiscreet',53797,0.9884,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(814,_binary '\0','/x8Ta8xVfffyyGA9k8sdGf3VCFo2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022017',7.5,2093,'de','Kameradschaft','At a mine on the shared edge of France and Germany, an underground explosion leads to the entrapment of a group of French miners. In an effort to save the trapped Frenchmen, German miners Wittkopp and Kasper take it upon themselves to traverse a crumbling war tunnel leading down into the mines. Yet, though the workers harbor no political biases against one another, their callous, less tolerant bosses hope to halt this cross-cultural rescue mission.','/dSGMzPqWQz2IvjvVx0WDD3z7zBF.jpg','1931-11-17',93,'Released',NULL,'Comradeship',42836,1.3419,7,'0yqQLJCDDT0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(815,_binary '\0','/yFOm7O3decb8kp8hexPQP1fKLNv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022054',6.8,1498,'en','The Last Flight','WWI pilots Cary, Shep, Bill, and Francis, traumatized by the devastation of the war, head to Paris instead of home, where they meet the eccentric and wealthy Nikki, who is drawn to Cary. The five friends, tagged by boorish reporter Frink, drink their way from Paris to Lisbon.','/cUxjKqeZCEBJd0vE3CBf8bXUG15.jpg','1931-08-29',76,'Released','IMPORTANT! \"The Last Flight,\" excepting for the few opening scenes, IS NOT A WAR PICTURE!','The Last Flight',99732,0.9688,6.5,'UNWA_pmEEaU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(816,_binary '\0','/sHlIQYhuqJnAKDv2Ud3t1BQWDKq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022074',7.1,4469,'en','The Smiling Lieutenant','An amorous lieutenant is forced to marry a socially awkward princess, though he tries to keep his violin-playing girlfriend on the side.','/6CiCOw0DYgi2Fjn3Bl8O5AAYH17.jpg','1931-08-01',89,'Released','Maurice Chevalier laughing and loving again in Ernst Lubitsch\'s sparkling cocktail of romantic merriment','The Smiling Lieutenant',31409,1.191,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(817,_binary '\0','/vyJSwV80dzj2WI1i6zZ68MDIo57.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022080',7,3366,'pt','Limite','Adrift in the vast expanse of the ocean, a solitary boat carries three castaways—a man and two women. Stranded and devoid of any glimmer of rescue, they find solace in recounting the tales of their lives to one another. As they delve into their personal narratives, reminiscing about the circumstances that led them to this desolate predicament, they navigate through the depths of three distinct destinies. Bound by the confines of their shared space, every aspect of their existence becomes a boundary, underscoring their plight.','/lRx6OsS1PXKs9k6pfUw4DhGkjNZ.jpg','1931-05-17',120,'Released','The urban entity versus the passion for the land','Limite',8353,1.2543,7.1,'We2Dyk9zmDU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(818,_binary '\0','/5Pk1rGAtyblh9Xaq72T7ARCQSDQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022100',8.3,184395,'de','M - Eine Stadt sucht einen Mörder','In this classic German thriller, Hans Beckert, a serial killer who preys on children, becomes the focus of a massive Berlin police manhunt. Beckert\'s heinous crimes are so repellant and disruptive to city life that he is even targeted by others in the seedy underworld network. With both cops and criminals in pursuit, the murderer soon realizes that people are on his trail, sending him into a tense, panicked attempt to escape justice.','/bTdZk3q2DWpBRnLiaaItKFWOVhI.jpg','1931-05-11',110,'Released','Who is the murderer?','M',832,6.3259,8.1,'nsVproWjN6c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(819,_binary '\0','/xe8eAG6khMJcSFctjkKRBporwSw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022111',6.8,3606,'en','The Maltese Falcon','A lovely dame with dangerous lies employs the services of a private detective, who is quickly caught up in the mystery and intrigue of a statuette known as the Maltese Falcon.','/zpE6gucVjusGXSS4lcSjqIWCeAj.jpg','1931-05-23',80,'Released',NULL,'The Maltese Falcon',28257,1.472,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(820,_binary '\0','/bfEZgxN4Fr6Mjy9dJju0Fp9Qjox.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022125',7.8,2923,'fr','Marius','César runs a bar along Marseilles\' port, assisted by his 23-year-old son, Marius. Friends since childhood, Fanny and Marius love each other, but Marius has a secret wanderlust: every ship\'s whistle stirs a longing for foreign lands. When M. Panisse seeks Fanny\'s hand in marriage and when a departing clipper needs a deckhand, Marius and Fanny must decide who and what they love most. César, with his generous, wise spirit, tries to guide his son.','/1dpo4ZJ4Sdv9XEUKNRGXvO6gp87.jpg','1931-10-09',128,'Released',NULL,'Marius',42818,1.3005,7.414,'VifNG9c7c04','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(821,_binary '\0','/130w48OEfsipXXvBfVo6J8KTcFm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022150',7.3,4116,'fr','Le Million','Debt-ridden painter Michel is overcome with joy at discovering that he has just won 1 million florins in the Dutch lottery, but almost immediately, he discovers that his softhearted girlfriend, Béatrice, has given away his jacket containing the winning ticket to an elderly petty thief. Soon Michel, Beatrice and Michel\'s artistic rival, Prosper, are hurtling through the streets of Paris on the trail of the missing jacket.','/tNxaR9GBrQVBsGVc5CUxXrUWWxd.jpg','1931-02-04',83,'Released','You MUST see it to know how indescribably clever and enormously \"smart\" a movie CAN be!','Le Million',32317,1.4266,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(822,_binary '\0','/cjYyYzKtaSExuSxPLqHko2isXVP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022153',7.2,2779,'en','The Miracle Woman','After an unappreciated minister dies, his daughter loses her faith in God, prompting her to open a phony temple with a con man. Can the love of a blind former aviator restore her faith and happiness?','/vwtCXSnl2RhLu9KFtBSbQpAhoqk.jpg','1931-07-17',90,'Released','Romance of a glorious girl who betrayed her faith-but could not deceive her love!','The Miracle Woman',44463,1.7528,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(823,_binary '\0','/eQnCtWu1zErzfQg6mlfUTJYwIS2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022158',7.4,13850,'en','Monkey Business','Four stowaways get mixed up with gangsters while running riot on an ocean liner.','/ArzqncdHxfoegpoglvlm9lC4czi.jpg','1931-09-19',77,'Released','Laughing days are here again!','Monkey Business',13911,3.2369,6.926,'jh-yzc-k54U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(824,_binary '\0','/hEnyo81ZaxfC46xjOdLI9oF0hgN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022183',7.5,4437,'de','Mädchen in Uniform','A sensitive girl is sent to an all-girls boarding school and develops a romantic attachment to one of her teachers.','/xCyjsv32kZ3F1BgZqJOEIKCDFiv.jpg','1931-11-27',88,'Released','What is its strange appeal? Why does it stir the emotions?','Mädchen in Uniform',9653,2.4172,7.2,'uPC7OBgY09Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(825,_binary '\0','/aYsCNMFtfHx4uHPZUQee88K8bXa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022208',7,5174,'en','Night Nurse','Lora Hart manages to land a job in a hospital as a trainee nurse. Upon completion of her training she goes to work as a night nurse for two small children who seem to be very sick, though something much more sinister is going on.','/hmY6xd0WWKOqad5cMLbzax62wDp.jpg','1931-07-16',72,'Released','Tells the Naked Truth About Happenings in the Dead of Night!','Night Nurse',51394,2.215,6.755,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(826,_binary '\0','/i7p0F5BScNEaZoqsWBjyc6p6u9m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022236',6.4,1577,'en','Other Men\'s Women','The friendship of two working stiff railroad engineers is put to the test when one falls for the other’s wife.','/nViV5hSzDvnGsow8MIpp5J1idjQ.jpg','1931-01-17',70,'Released','A Romance of the Shining Rails','Other Men\'s Women',33001,2.0173,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(827,_binary '\0','/jDBInktFzyTbirZHA7y5bQ7wkU2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022264',6.5,1440,'en','The Phantom of Paris','Chéri-Bibi is a world class escape artist, but he cannot escape the false murder charge that is placed on him.','/mbSSvn5LDaFUHHGlbyLAxVNSwux.jpg','1931-09-12',74,'Released','For money one man would murder, for love another would risk his life.','The Phantom of Paris',95862,1.7027,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(828,_binary '\0','/38i3bqHXzVcp0QURneALNWt4fXa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022268',6.7,4014,'en','Platinum Blonde','Ann Schuyler is an upper-crust socialite who bullies her reporter husband into conforming to her highfalutin ways. The husband chafes at the confinement of high society, though, and yearns for a creative outlet. He decides to write a play and collaborates with a fellow reporter.','/nlVEC1fvzW2bKKt6gXTON7LyNEZ.jpg','1931-10-31',89,'Released','She Was Gorgeous - He Was A Man . . . So, the other girl had to wait !','Platinum Blonde',26884,2.0821,6.647,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(829,_binary '\0','/zInWjix9xjMcFlubwLF8UjnGhGq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022276',6.9,2628,'en','Possessed','Marion is a factory worker who hopes to trade the assembly line for a beautiful penthouse apartment. Mark Whitney, a wealthy and influential lawyer, can make her dreams come true, but, there is only one problem; he will give her everything except a marriage proposal. Will this affair ever lead to marriage?','/qrTMfXVNzC6oSUU46hGDLLA8I3p.jpg','1931-11-21',76,'Released','How long will it last?','Possessed',52239,2.7091,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(830,_binary '\0','/7vF5OQn97hvaPnYPrbSO71wqYUL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022279',6.7,1498,'en','Private Lives','Amanda and Elyot are one another\'s former spouse. Elyot is remarried to Sibyl and Amanda married Victor. Unexpectedly, both honeymooning couples arrive at a hotel on the same day and are put in rooms with adjoining terraces. Things go well until Amanda sees Elyot on the adjacent terrace.','/3A6UrOdi8Xll5Cn0GiWwtgWgFjz.jpg','1931-12-12',84,'Released','They knew what they wanted...only they didn\'t know what to do about it!','Private Lives',99283,1.0617,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(831,_binary '\0','/oXLaGV0VOqQhXdUmQpm6KGsSpu1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022286',7.5,23811,'en','The Public Enemy','Two young Chicago hoodlums, Tom Powers and Matt Doyle, rise up from their poverty-stricken slum life to become petty thieves, bootleggers and cold-blooded killers. But with street notoriety and newfound wealth, the duo feels the heat from the cops and rival gangsters both. Despite his ruthless criminal reputation, Tom tries to remain connected to his family, however, gang warfare and the need for revenge eventually pull him away.','/vVxdaRMprQO2DM4AFyJ6C4qZSFO.jpg','1931-04-23',84,'Released','All his life he took what he wanted...Why not women?','The Public Enemy',17687,2.8191,7.2,'ECEcNXe4x8w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(832,_binary '\0','/dHmXDOXwdxyMQ5eogtdefpu9C2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022335',6.9,2382,'en','Safe in Hell','To avoid the rigors of the law, Gilda flees New Orleans and hides on a Caribbean island where the worst criminals can ask for asylum. Besieged by the scum of the earth, Gilda will soon find out that she has found refuge in hell.','/y2LfGVBCABX4Lx2Ufr39FtfgDfW.jpg','1931-12-12',71,'Released','Love had mocked her...Life had marked her...Too honorless to be loved...But too beautiful to be safe in a land of forgotten men!','Safe in Hell',82397,1.6765,6.7,'SaPKnbXKQTs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(833,_binary '\0','/8nGzaEabv1tHqoT3Z0GIhgLpCi1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022357',6.3,1228,'en','The Secret Six','Bootlegger/cafe owner, Johnny Franks recruits crude working man Scorpio to join his gang, masterminded by crooked criminal defense lawyer Newton. Scorpio eventually takes over Frank\'s operation, beats a rival gang, becomes wealthy, and dominates the city for several years until a secret group of six masked businessmen have him prosecuted and sent to the electric chair.','/67dWQ7G6uER6D5c8TT724FX7SlK.jpg','1931-04-18',83,'Released',NULL,'The Secret Six',28258,1.3834,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(834,_binary '\0','/3LNBgCtT7IZfw9JafARuOETvwzv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022386',6.6,1314,'en','The Sin of Madelon Claudet','Out of jail for a crime she did not commit, Madelon turns to prostitution and thievery to send her illegitimate son to medical school.','/nr3dzgku0NqqwQntJxS5YcyUwVL.jpg','1931-10-23',75,'Released',NULL,'The Sin of Madelon Claudet',85504,1.7263,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(835,_binary '\0','/bpF9ub4qFfm2uq1SWff8FMJTJFo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022395',5.7,4013,'en','The Skin Game','An old traditional family and a modern family battle over land in a small English village.','/toLLyYTaAvQyLIvpAu8UeQ0sqOL.jpg','1931-02-26',82,'Released','Ancestral pride v. Industrial progress.','The Skin Game',52748,1.8242,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(836,_binary '\0','/73b4nTlC7DtqGAAG6W8bk3uNL6J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022403',6.8,2564,'en','Smart Money','Two brothers\' trip to the big city to do a little gambling results in a fateful turn of events.','/2KnQNZSnle6xxAF1K846byLZ63J.jpg','1931-06-11',81,'Released','Just a small-town barber who became a \"big-shot\" gambler-riding high and handsome until he went balmy for a blonde!','Smart Money',17966,1.6623,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(837,_binary '\0','/n2qGV6NbX0GsLKap8Cd9obAFvxh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022436',7.6,2508,'en','Street Scene','The setting is a city block during a sweltering summer, where the residents serve as representatives of the not-very-idealized American melting pot. There is idle chitchat, gossip, jealousy, racism, adultery, and suddenly but not unexpectedly, a murder.','/x80hXmYooG76fm37j0rQkw3q4Ct.jpg','1931-09-05',78,'Released','The simple story of LIFE through the window pane of the house across the street.','Street Scene',109435,1.5094,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(838,_binary '\0','/3QhhS10BuFvTl9oZQzIx9YlKZam.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022453',6.3,1433,'en','Susan Lenox','A young woman runs away from an abusive home and pre-arranged marriage only to be frustrated in her attempts to find happiness with a handsome engineer.','/s8ZUAkn7BslZc4lYbhE2rP820Xn.jpg','1931-10-10',76,'Released','She sought the sweet fruits of living, snatching at each bit of happiness....what if the world did call her bad.','Susan Lenox',151590,3.7166,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(839,_binary '\0','/sSe0mxPhY4zQk7J4hrBTouO2xKh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022454',6.8,2978,'en','Svengali','A music maestro uses hypnotism on a young model he meets in Paris to make her both his muse and wife.','/jLE87vAc9bqytSZAfU76MmnQdMh.jpg','1931-05-20',81,'Released','He hypnotizes! He thrills...! Any woman caught in his spell must obey.','Svengali',45803,1.3645,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(840,_binary '\0','/jLtiBuYhQoqAEACLyyhO3mo4JHx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022458',7.3,6992,'en','Tabu: A Story of the South Seas','On the South Pacific island of Bora Bora, a young couple\'s love is threatened when the tribal chief declares the girl a sacred virgin.','/c4zfawkB8Jsp5lhWl62QCzczR3M.jpg','1931-07-30',86,'Released',NULL,'Tabu: A Story of the South Seas',977,2.9629,7.1,'BmHQjE_YCGw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(841,_binary '\0','/2aik0zg9armFkCrm43ij3D2BB3G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022469',6.5,1231,'en','Ten Cents a Dance','A taxi dancer with a jealous husband finds herself falling for a wealthy client.','/d1oWSFU9YpgLbXU8EjftHoEBQFF.jpg','1931-01-30',77,'Released','SHE WAS A DANCE HALL HOSTESS BUT THE BAND NEVER PLAYED \"HOME SWEET HOME\" FOR HER','Ten Cents a Dance',121018,1.8785,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(842,_binary '\0','/9FugKFP3fEGeESTRUVw7j7XS1nY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022485',7.1,1714,'ja','東京の合唱','During the Depression, a young man struggles to provide for his family after he is sacked for defending an older colleague.','/koagfZhAbaphDG4nkFbzw0Axo0i.jpg','1931-08-15',91,'Released',NULL,'Tokyo Chorus',112882,1.3897,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(843,_binary '\0','/nlAWpjHsHXNophDfZgQrp9yQ1Wr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022489',6.5,1858,'en','Tonight or Never','A young opera singer finds her career stalled because of her cold and passionless performances, until she finds romance with a handsome admirer.','/vOHkTjJWiW0kgSe2PBvvG2raC6D.jpg','1931-01-04',80,'Released','A Woman Who Turned from Ice to Fire!','Tonight or Never',120845,1.567,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(844,_binary '\0','/p92mFg6cQ4p7l6N7C74J5ajlwBN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022495',6.1,1358,'en','Trader Horn','While on safari in an unexplored area of Africa, Trader Horn and Peru find missionary Edith Trent killed by natives. They decide to carry on her quest for her lost daughter Nina. They find her as the queen of a particularly savage tribe, and try to bring her back to civilization.','/rBzzjMMOXUKWglfGsSZDxIbavjk.jpg','1931-02-03',122,'Released','The Miracle of Pictures','Trader Horn',84296,1.4595,5.4,'m6307hyF4NA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(845,_binary '\0','/h6DB3L6zHFfUeX2kX7apGvkCGcs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022550',7.4,3450,'en','Waterloo Bridge','In WWI London, out-of-work American chorus girl Myra makes ends meet by picking up men on Waterloo Bridge. During a Zeppelin air raid, she meets Roy, a naive young Yank who enlisted in the Canadian army. After they fall for each other, Roy tricks Myra into visiting his family, who live in a country estate outside London, his mother having remarried to a retired British Major. Myra is reluctant to continue the relationship with Roy, he not aware of her past.','/pHzA3gHKl63gkwOqghlcZQMwrhL.jpg','1931-09-01',81,'Released',NULL,'Waterloo Bridge',95797,1.7991,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(846,_binary '\0','/naHXHsdkizGec3ndo3kwcwamLos.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022599',7.4,5390,'fr','À nous la liberté','In this classic French satire, Louis, a convict, escapes from prison and takes on legitimate work, making his way up in the business world. Eventually becoming the head of a successful factory, Louis opts to modernize his company with mechanical innovations. But when his friend Émile finally leaves jail years later and reunites with Louis, the past catches up with them. The two, worried about being apprehended by police, long to flee the confines of industry.','/z6XdIxE1CRqSgfOJxX1nGik6CGm.jpg','1931-12-18',95,'Released',NULL,'À Nous la Liberté',31514,2.0854,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(847,_binary '\0','/b6jzjjZHRYfdGNBvBSxcKVexBIN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022626',7.4,2690,'en','American Madness','Socially-conscious banker Thomas Dickson faces a crisis when his protégé is wrongly accused of robbing the bank, gossip of the robbery starts a bank run, and evidence suggests Dickson\'s wife had an affair... all in the same day.','/mKMrLe7SXLjDaFqdAmcuGXM1HHD.jpg','1932-08-15',76,'Released','The Great American Picture of Today!','American Madness',1773,1.9097,6.9,'0_BtIFlTtPA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(848,_binary '\0','/5P1Hx46wvCVx9D9yT8M5rdUIHZB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022628',6.3,1449,'en','The Animal Kingdom','Tom Collier has had a great relationship with Daisy, but when he decides to marry, it is not Daisy whom he asks, it is Cecelia. After the marriage, Tom is bored with the social scene and the obligations of his life. He publishes books that will sell, not books that he wants to write. Even worse, he has his old friend working as a butler and Cecelia wants him fired. When Tom tries to get back together with Daisy to renew the feelings that he once felt, Daisy turns the tables on him and leaves to protect both of them.','/nONPUIWAj2UtuZOmBvPtOEfVozk.jpg','1932-12-28',85,'Released','He scratched her tender skin and found a savage!','The Animal Kingdom',120862,1.7521,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(849,_binary '\0','/7LG9AgO1mkmFoy2LTudSa0jRquH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022639',6.9,1489,'en','Arsène Lupin','A charming and very daring thief known as Arsene Lupin is terrorizing the wealthy of Paris. He even goes so far as to threaten the Mona Lisa. But the police, led by the great Guerchard, think they know Arsene Lupin\'s identity, and they have a secret weapon to catch him.','/zmN5X4wM9DcMoiIMMfDxX8eoqbP.jpg','1932-02-26',84,'Released',NULL,'Arsène Lupin',161297,2.1634,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(850,_binary '\0','/1VOla3pRj8okoylwvTNTlBQWLQe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022651',7.1,1267,'en','Back Street','A woman\'s love for and devotion to a married man results in her being relegated to the \"back streets\" of his life.','/kj74LmtNkIBpoLDHOq5Crmvc2eq.jpg','1932-08-04',93,'Released','A story that will grip you with its powerful emotional appeal written by one of America\'s foremost novelists... A picture with an amazing cast of star players','Back Street',109197,2.0188,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(851,_binary '\0','/idViho2KKhx5SKOwSY2n7EotMIA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022660',6.7,1700,'en','The Beast of the City','Police Chief Jim Fitzpatrick is after gangster Sam Belmonte. He uses his police detective brother Ed to watch over Daisy who is associated with Belmonte but things don\'t go as planned.','/j7yvH2ngnLrM0yjRMJ3Yh8mk8VS.jpg','1932-02-13',86,'Released','Beware the hunters who stalk their prey through city jungles!','The Beast of the City',20675,1.9702,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(852,_binary '\0','/lInOcxdv9R1LfYgZ1entTjWikYZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022685',6.5,2076,'en','A Bill of Divorcement','A World War I veteran returns home after fifteen years in an asylum and finds that everything has changed — his daughter is grown and about to marry.','/fHop0zEy6bdhmar8xckZWxWLXlc.jpg','1932-09-30',70,'Released',NULL,'A Bill of Divorcement',73125,1.6102,6.4,'dUWvmCD7Pso','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(853,_binary '\0','/8DRhpJMBN3eYxyabtYxTGAq809o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022689',6,1819,'en','Bird of Paradise','When a young South Seas sailor falls overboard, the beautiful daughter of a Polynesian king dives in and saves his life. Thus begins the romance of Johnny and Luana. Though Luana is promised to another man, Johnny whisks her away, and for a brief time the lovers live very happily together. But, when a local volcano threatens their lives, Luana knows that she must sacrifice herself to the volcanic gods in order to save her island.','/n2vjVQ1Y3m0LBTm59bYm1NfclqW.jpg','1932-08-12',80,'Released','A drama of forbidden love beyond the pale of white men\'s morals.','Bird of Paradise',92341,1.5692,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(854,_binary '\0','/YgXGhAc8UqNCIu0x8uf6hcGOah.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022694',6.8,1579,'de','Das blaue Licht','Junta is hated by the people in the village where she lives, especially by the women, who suspect her of being a witch. Only she can climb the nearby mountains to a cave high up, whence a mysterious blue light glows when the moon is full. Many young men of the village have died trying to follow her. She is driven out of town, and takes to living in the mountains. Eventually she shares the secret of the blue light with one man, and he betrays it.','/n3rEqnaZxL7gR44g5N9khdcgzCJ.jpg','1932-03-24',83,'Released','A mountain legend from the Dolomites','The Blue Light',72495,1.6326,6.897,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(855,_binary '\0','/hmWBEjJ3MGjwerY7wmzZwyRiFqv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022698',7.1,6408,'en','Blonde Venus','In an effort to be able to afford expensive treatment for her gravely ill American husband, a retired German entertainer returns to the cabaret as Blonde Venus and catches the eye of a wealthy politician.','/fC2KsO3vVCSgBR5f29resfAmgVF.jpg','1932-09-23',93,'Released','What could she do but flee from love? She loved two men at once!','Blonde Venus',34474,2.6558,6.783,'VKas4aaFgJk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(856,_binary '\0','/e5Zd3FWo6xYZBjv9px6B1NumL7T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022700',6.4,1528,'en','Blondie of the Follies','New York City tenement dwelling neighbors Blondie and Lottie are longtime best friends. When Lottie makes the cast of the Follies and moves up in the world, she arranges for Blondie, as well, to join the cast and gain the advantages. But the friendship goes awry when Lottie\'s sweetheart, wealthy Larry Belmont, falls for Blondie and she for him.','/6eT7ELpyc05KJwS3a2kmmTwAlMh.jpg','1932-09-01',91,'Released','You\'ll Laugh! You\'ll Cry! But How You\'ll Enjoy Each Moment of It!','Blondie of the Follies',4111,1.7891,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(857,_binary '\0','/f2xs9gITz87n72jm6b04o6SZPqr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022718',7.2,6709,'fr','Boudu sauvé des eaux','Michel Simon gives one of the most memorable performances in screen history as Boudu, a Parisian tramp who takes a suicidal plunge into the Seine and is rescued by a well-to-do bookseller, Edouard Lestingois. The Lestingois family decides to take in the irrepressible bum, and he shows his gratitude by shaking the household to its foundations. With Boudu Saved from Drowning, legendary director Jean Renoir takes advantage of a host of Parisian locations and the anarchic charms of his lead actor to create an effervescent satire of the bourgeoisie.','/hCRUtli9TCrekxSysHJ15QhMk44.jpg','1932-11-11',84,'Released',NULL,'Boudu Saved from Drowning',48365,1.3955,6.9,'etAwZ9ZILAQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(858,_binary '\0','/qjz4cgmaRzFO5AdcpiaUqklErQ0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022725',7.6,1947,'en','Broken Lullaby','A young French soldier in World War I is overcome with guilt when he kills a German soldier who, like himself, is a musically gifted conscript, each having attended the same musical conservatory in France. The fact that the incident occurred in war does not assuage his guilt. He travels to Germany to meet the man\'s family.','/zYZjUEPC0j96rNfGj0dHajLMw5t.jpg','1932-01-24',76,'Released','Honor Thy Father...And Thy Mother BUT HOW ABOUT OUR ENEMY\'S PARENTS? How About His Sweetheart, the Girl We Love?','Broken Lullaby',58192,1.7939,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(859,_binary '\0','/5cUdlDd7LYeS1aN9a4OIaqQY5Q8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022735',6.6,2009,'en','The Cabin in the Cotton','Sharecropper\'s son Marvin tries to help his community overcome poverty and ignorance.','/hfjPvRk899cGswfTXPpW7dWVolW.jpg','1932-09-26',78,'Released','They said this book was \"throbbing, vital, absorbing.\" (N.Y. American) You\'ll say the same thing about the picture!','The Cabin in the Cotton',43075,1.767,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(860,_binary '\0','/gkmF0kFYUziXwvRIKplELhx8Cyk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022737',7,1329,'en','Call Her Savage','A high-spirited and short-tempered Texan woman storms her way through life until her luck runs out, forcing her to learn the error of her ways.','/817TDYCmdxN0TVuiGoXHiHwnRLr.jpg','1932-11-24',88,'Released','SHE\'S BACK...and greater than ever','Call Her Savage',86457,1.7022,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(861,_binary '\0','/2cyErj8qMUi23NhnlJKSIHGHGcY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022753',6.2,1318,'en','Chandu the Magician','When delusional madman Roxor kidnaps a scientist in hopes of using his death ray to achieve world dominance, he is opposed by Chandu, a powerful hypnotist and yogi.','/3pYOJPXdRLVjEh60OzhuBJqMutb.jpg','1932-08-04',71,'Released','CHANDU.. He Lives on the Screen!','Chandu the Magician',89573,1.2745,6.308,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(862,_binary '\0','/uxiZeTfSwbEh74C8P16Ck5zf2Hr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022775',6.8,1360,'en','Frisco Jenny','Jenny is carrying the child of a young man who dies in the San Francisco earthquake (1906). After giving birth, she decides to place her child in the custody of a wealthy married couple. Years later, thanks to the protection of a corrupt politician, she becomes the main \"madame\" of San Francisco, in addition to participating in various illegal activities.','/akye9O1aMeMlh9DS9c2ZUACPeaW.jpg','1933-01-14',71,'Released','My Record\'s Perfect Now!...Ten Commandments and I\'ve Broken Every One of Them!','Frisco Jenny',72338,1.1682,6.7,'DY2OgiPyt10','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(863,_binary '\0','/l919PDSYhjoROPvBWWQVH6MSD1X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022787',7.7,1990,'fr','Les Croix de bois','The young and patriotic student Demachy joins the French army in 1914 to defend his country. But he and his comrades soon experience the terrifying, endless trench war in Champagne, where more and more wooden crosses have to be erected for this cannon fodder.','/lcIwbiZn57HR9xpQD1U8pUC0PBJ.jpg','1932-03-17',110,'Released',NULL,'Wooden Crosses',32859,1.8278,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(864,_binary '\0','/54C2l69LB15TmiRLdjwaNXIFm6F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022792',6.2,1613,'en','The Crowd Roars','Famous auto racing champion Joe Greer returns to his hometown to compete in a local race, discovering that his younger brother has aspirations to become a racing champion.','/o8uxqjQuAIZ4PbBkdqtEmC7pGBf.jpg','1932-04-16',85,'Released','Ablaze with excitement-heart pounding romance women never forget!','The Crowd Roars',125736,1.2767,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(865,_binary '\0','/s2KiUvWQdpbKKAgtUDuFquuxCPp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022802',6.7,1440,'en','The Dark Horse','The Progressive Party convention is deadlocked for governor, so both sides nominate the dark horse Zachary Hicks. Kay Russell suggests they hire Hal Blake as campaign manager; but first they have to get him out of jail for not paying alimony. Blake organizes the office and coaches Hicks to answer every question by pausing and then saying, \"Well yes, but then again no.\" Blake will sell Hicks as dumb but honest. Russell refuses to marry Blake, while Joe keeps people away from Blake\'s office. Blake teaches Hicks a speech by Lincoln. At the debate when the conservative candidate Underwood recites the same speech, Blake exposes him as a plagiarist. Hicks is presented for photo opportunities and gives his yes-and-no answer to any question, including whether he expects to win.','/k9Kny1v2btbtBj8QAGZHOZC4dy4.jpg','1932-06-16',75,'Released','Hilarity is just around the corner, in this screaming burlesque on the political parade! You\'ll Vote For Every Star!','The Dark Horse',78327,1.2402,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(866,_binary '\0','/qNRBstFGcLro5sdbgdcaTpVoLf7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022827',6.4,4888,'en','Doctor X','A wisecracking New York reporter intrudes on a research scientist\'s quest to unmask The Moon Killer.','/z8hlncTkxO58t5KAvNRTXnm29Ii.jpg','1932-08-03',76,'Released','Out-thrills them all!','Doctor X',3574,2.4237,6.012,'gu2KEKMP58c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(867,_binary '\0','/dgzycvnWeOJJaMMUikE3R1HqVKs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022834',7,1966,'en','Downstairs','In the Austrian manor of Baron and Baroness von Burgen, the relationship between the upstairs aristocracy and the downstairs staff is quite positive. The servants seem to enjoy their time together, and some even fall in love, as head butler Albert and maid Anna have done. But when lecherous new chauffeur Karl Schneider enters the house, affairs and blackmail follow, and the harmony of the home is slowly destroyed.','/1irNBBQiipoMwvDYhj5uhWMQApF.jpg','1932-08-06',77,'Released','HE WAS A BACHELOR ON A PERPETUAL HONEYMOON!','Downstairs',134427,1.2997,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(868,_binary '\0','/zN6pJV518rw1DSFrXSpaelqxHkZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022835',7.6,17957,'en','Dr. Jekyll and Mr. Hyde','Dr. Henry Jekyll believes that there are two distinct sides to men: one that is good and one that is evil. He believes that by separating the two, man can become liberated. He succeeds in his experiments with chemicals to accomplish this and transforms into Hyde to commit horrendous crimes. When he discontinues use of the drug, it is already too late.','/mZtQORzQWkCSqeeHApH6vJDA1D2.jpg','1931-12-24',96,'Released','Put yourself in her place! The dreaded night when her lover became a madman!','Dr. Jekyll and Mr. Hyde',3019,4.0705,7.2,'CReiffsq5Bk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(869,_binary '\0','/sGDYPEgFpUBXtFqpZA4XiNc7J8P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022854',7,1273,'en','Emma','After decades of raising the motherless Smith children, housekeeper Emma Thatcher is faced with resentment when she marries their father.','/kwOOi0dMKsbPqjMwyBoT76FclCi.jpg','1932-01-02',72,'Released','She makes you LAUGH, She makes you CRY, but always makes you HAPPY!','Emma',104221,1.4108,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(870,_binary '\0','/fJlmuteVveQc46ItJKRQKj06FNq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022867',6.6,3176,'cs','Extase','Eva has just gotten married to an older gentleman, but discovers that he is obsessed with order in his life and doesn\'t have much room for passion. She becomes despondent and leaves him, returning to her father\'s house. One day while bathing in the lake, she meets a young man and they fall in love. The husband has become grief stricken at the loss of his young bride, and fate brings him together with the young lover that has taken Eva from him.','/nwCNnXnw0iYsMdWqp4qyGrzHTh0.jpg','1933-01-20',89,'Released',NULL,'Ecstasy',43124,1.9383,6.3,'-0JsWm_AC1E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(871,_binary '\0','/rSslcDAsoBvpxNqDYEb4YcOB4gV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022877',7.7,2176,'fr','Fanny','Soon after Marius\'s departure, Fanny learns that she is pregnant with his child, to the disappointment of her mother and of Marius\'s father, César. To secure a better life for her unborn child, she accepts a marriage proposal from the aging widower Honoré Panisse.','/8hY9A0mWwVXhgdV1S2YKxSp1ruS.jpg','1932-10-27',127,'Released',NULL,'Fanny',43146,1.4752,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(872,_binary '\0','/ek1883HwUWzFliDaE6FAmJ8XoXi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022879',6.4,7709,'en','A Farewell to Arms','A tale of the World War I love affair, begun in Italy, between American ambulance driver Lt. Frederic Henry and British nurse Catherine Barkley. Eventually separated by Frederic\'s transfer, tremendous challenges and difficult decisions face each as the war rages on.','/eNmPByGZJqlp60nCZRhsAlVAb3F.jpg','1932-12-08',89,'Released','Every woman who has loved will understand','A Farewell to Arms',22649,4.4447,6.1,'KT1RIeg5WL0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(873,_binary '\0','/2FR3OfQfAUU2qrSVrxOlLBDyxIN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022905',6.9,2422,'en','Forbidden','On a cruise to Cuba, Lulu Smith falls in love with Bob Grover. Back home, she breaks off the romance when he tells her he is married. Lulu has a baby but doesn\'t tell Bob, who turns out to be a rising politician. She passes herself off as the baby\'s nanny. When Bob learns what is going on, he adopts the little girl, not telling his wife or anyone else where she came from. Lulu gets a job at a newspaper. Things get complicated when the editor gets the dirt on Bob, but also wants to marry Lulu.','/nBUDSm2r6UvFXGjMiGSMnPmTEFw.jpg','1932-01-08',85,'Released','Her Greatest Dramatic Role !','Forbidden',50072,2.8098,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(874,_binary '\0','/r18vpGFsNf6n984x4KdJmAAWKkP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022913',7.8,55355,'en','Freaks','A circus\' beautiful trapeze artist agrees to marry the leader of side-show performers, but his deformed friends discover she is only marrying him for his inheritance.','/fX2Wxd0W9E7eVClUd8kJTfennoV.jpg','1932-01-01',64,'Released','Can a full grown woman truly love a midget?','Freaks',136,5.3494,7.8,'681Ii7g9Ln4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(875,_binary '\0','/mTRmleBtvqlwMCLoRt9iwptDRRC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022958',7.3,22927,'en','Grand Hotel','Guests at a posh Berlin hotel struggle through worry, scandal, and heartache.','/g8xrpXJWzz91R4jL8ybMKMValB2.jpg','1932-09-11',112,'Released','Thank the stars for a great entertainment!','Grand Hotel',33680,3.7714,7,'QFBKK8uaPww','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(876,_binary '\0','/bu4T2lfMZU8EbPPaLdcLAn3jMLp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0022991',5.8,1575,'en','Hell\'s House','A teenager lands in a brutal reform school for refusing to squeal on his bootlegger boss.','/xQLiQVUV4SKmKZHS9C0kXYgJz6J.jpg','1932-01-30',72,'Released','EXPOSED! The Grim Joke of Justice!','Hell\'s House',136116,1.0184,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(877,_binary '\0','/rFzahi1q5ioRVCrwbOyd9A4CG6T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023027',7.5,14286,'en','Horse Feathers','Quincy Adams Wagstaff, the new president of Huxley U, hires bumblers Baravelli and Pinky to help his school win the big football game against rival Darwin U.','/sndzhGYShAcSf3AaYGfiwl4YbgS.jpg','1932-08-19',68,'Released','The Maddest Comics of the Screen!','Horse Feathers',13912,2.2556,6.9,'1RZ6csU7DYY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(878,_binary '\0','/x8dyVX54XM1M9HW4MoBddOIJci9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023028',6.5,1543,'en','Hot Saturday','A pretty but virtuous small-town bank clerk is the victim of a vicious rumor from an unsuccessful suitor that she spent the night with a notorious womanizer.','/ItvxwGzzA3WZgb3MBRzO8zNRRJ.jpg','1932-10-28',73,'Released','They called her \'BAD\' ... and she tried to live up to it!','Hot Saturday',52355,1.3649,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(879,_binary '\0','/nWLMIG4xY4MO2ESGoVfoVemu2a5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023042',8.2,15854,'en','I Am a Fugitive from a Chain Gang','A World War I veteran’s dreams of becoming a master architect evaporate in the cold light of economic realities. Things get even worse when he’s falsely convicted of a crime and sent to work on a chain gang.','/jer6lim61i8V6a5HOZq2i07UQQf.jpg','1932-11-09',92,'Released','Six sticks of dynamite that blasted his way to freedom … and awoke America’s conscience!','I Am a Fugitive from a Chain Gang',29740,4.3474,7.8,'24R9vDcviKQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(880,_binary '\0','/gKgDAN2cmA1KqS0rdeDra7tJnkR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023049',6.9,2587,'en','If I Had a Million','An elderly business tycoon, believed to be dying, decides to give a million dollars each to eight strangers chosen at random from the phone directory.','/qHFusV8b94ayRPrEEfWKuo3jNCE.jpg','1932-11-18',88,'Released','YOU\'VE OFTEN SAID IT! NOW SEE WHAT HAPPENS!','If I Had a Million',121238,2.705,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(881,_binary '\0','/bJl0ElmnX1CaqJQHr9rPEX95m9d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023074',7.2,3052,'en','Jewel Robbery','Baroness Teri von Horhenfels deals with the tedium of her aristocratic Vienna life with a long line of lovers. Her rich husband, Franz, seems oblivious. As she\'s just about to end her latest affair, the baroness gets a much-needed dose of adrenaline when she becomes the target of a charismatic thief. After staging a daring robbery, he makes off with not only the baroness\'s ring but also her heart.','/wVMMFJ6Z2TXmWvQGxjNXRMl3p3H.jpg','1932-07-08',68,'Released','He stole her jewels -- but that wasn\'t all!','Jewel Robbery',50078,1.8036,6.5,'oicmvvec4q8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(882,_binary '\0','/d8D2RV5kB6Cih3Rbp41HOGONH8w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023101',6.5,1296,'en','Kongo','The ruthless Flint, a disabled man, rules an isolated region of Kongo like an omnipotent god, through superstition and sadism, living only for the day when he can get revenge on the man who ruined his life.','/4mDntFmBDmQGLjKW21oIfrxFOst.jpg','1932-10-01',87,'Released','In the heart of the Kongo!','Kongo',84505,1.178,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(883,_binary '\0','/xLNdvByiv6oS6wm5U4WxMGZN7s0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023125',6.5,1356,'en','Lawyer Man','Idealistic attorney Anton Adam makes headlines when he successfully prosecutes prominent New York City political party boss John Gilmurry. Adam\'s sudden renown attracts the attention of high-profile legal eagle Granville Bentley, who asks Adam to become a partner in his firm. But Adam\'s rising career nosedives when he\'s framed by corrupt Dr. Gresham and a sexy actress in a trumped-up breach of promise suit. The only constant in Adam\'s life is the loyalty and unrequited love of his secretary, Olga.','/czEj1dT5yWtlJp09pfbE8RMMmrS.jpg','1932-12-24',68,'Released','His Fame Was Built on Love Letters-Written by Other Men....','Lawyer Man',126922,1.0343,6.1,'hGNL12M04KI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(884,_binary '\0','/tl1m11MJhHfSJHg9m5CCIlJvkNj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023158',7.5,5179,'en','Love Me Tonight','A Parisian tailor goes to a château to collect a bill, only to fall for an aloof young princess living there.','/3wjHj3LmmezUsBHxFL8xpRdMxVX.jpg','1932-08-18',89,'Released','Warm Love! Hilarious fun! Sweet music! Hot lyrics!','Love Me Tonight',31532,2.6013,6.6,'go_hj2t_zAY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(885,_binary '\0','/frWFnUCIzaq4xCHF25DycA1zBOM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023181',6.8,1416,'en','The Man Who Played God','While giving a private performance for a visiting monarch, concert pianist Montgomery Royle is deafened when a bomb is detonated in an attempt to assassinate the foreign ruler. With his career over as a result of his injury, Royle returns to New York City with his sister Florence, close friend Mildred Miller, and considerably younger fiancée Grace Blair. After abandoning thoughts of suicide, Montgomery discovers he can lip read, and he spends his days observing people in Central Park from his apartment window. As he learns of people\'s problems, he tries to help them anonymously and becomes absorbed in his game of \"playing God\".','/wmhTcgjpsRvl5ft4ryMSGuoCHTu.jpg','1932-02-09',80,'Released','\'A Modern Drama From Real Life\'','The Man Who Played God',114302,1.8639,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(886,_binary '\0','/iuFBORoulPz4iMkyOnabiJeA5LC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023194',6.2,4143,'en','The Mask of Fu Manchu','The villainous Dr. Fu Manchu races against a team of Englishmen to find the tomb of Ghengis Khan, because he wants to use the relics to cause an uprising in the East to wipe out the white race.','/4iMjZwxFGxlF0RkfSAzgn6iTUb3.jpg','1932-11-04',68,'Released','The Frankenstein of the Orient!','The Mask of Fu Manchu',3484,3.1085,5.4,'d0ING5qhUnE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(887,_binary '\0','/4mcZo3B8CwMyH8x2W5DpW1oZqqY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023196',6.5,4258,'en','Mata Hari','A semi-fictionalized account of the life of Mata Hari, an exotic dancer who was accused of spying for Germany during World War I.','/3HvUY98WbP1HuIFk8W3f1gDLKZX.jpg','1931-12-26',89,'Released','Men worshipped her like a goddess, only to be betrayed by a kiss!','Mata Hari',35545,3.3563,6.25,'THUQX8QvocQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(888,_binary '\0','/iYROnjvGVliseRF4TKMvkZP2mdL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023202',6.6,1624,'en','Me and My Gal','Jaunty young policeman Danny Dolan falls in love with waterfront cafe waitress Helen Riley.','/pAPxl1vECf3hmyX1W4juWd2Fzil.jpg','1932-12-04',79,'Released',NULL,'Me and My Gal',84337,1.913,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(889,_binary '\0','/3v3Rf3dlrIabDFc5fqBiHjslmwH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023213',6.9,2378,'en','Merrily We Go to Hell','A drunken newspaperman, Jerry Corbett, is rescued from his alcoholic haze by an heiress, Joan Prentice, whose love sobers him up and encourages him to write a play, but he lapses back into dipsomania.','/kSwYDEtFhPXYuyIO3WxpzfusTIA.jpg','1932-06-10',83,'Released','In her innocence she expected days and nights of tender love. What she got was a Bitter Shock!','Merrily We Go to Hell',81107,2.4154,6.4,'ulcSW8VAVPc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(890,_binary '\0','/3lMA0t3SxHSfOdt2nDJq7WXcIUp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023225',6.8,1560,'en','Million Dollar Legs','A small country on the verge of bankruptcy is persuaded to enter the 1932 Los Angeles Olympics as a means of raising money.','/atqRmaEd22UZe78RWh0Sd00XoSX.jpg','1932-07-08',64,'Released','It\'s Insane -- It\'s Joyous','Million Dollar Legs',119564,1.4072,6.8,'7Ni39WXW6uI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(891,_binary '\0','/5XGobuLZa1FjbGHpzz8QTWqSv9z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023236',4.1,1219,'en','The Monster Walks','Ruth Earlton has come home to her ancestral mansion to claim her inheritance. Accompanied by her boyfriend, she discovers that her father died suddenly under suspicious circumstances. Now it\'s her turn, as her deranged and relentless uncle targets her for death with the help of his wife and son, plus a very unhappy ape.','/c2MEDsZHT2zYCTXnYbsL2JyfWKO.jpg','1932-02-07',60,'Released',NULL,'The Monster Walks',95560,0.956,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(892,_binary '\0','/psBFJubFWiAV23dAZ6D0wjQWbhe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023238',7,15696,'en','The Most Dangerous Game','When legendary hunter Bob Rainsford is shipwrecked on the perilous reefs surrounding a mysterious island, he finds himself the guest of the reclusive and eccentric Count Zaroff. While he is very gracious at first, Zaroff eventually forces Rainsford and two other shipwreck survivors, brother and sister Eve and Martin Towbridge, to participate in a sadistic game of cat and mouse in which they are the prey and he is the hunter.','/3aNlOIFlGOnIzxqvAWpgm5Sly1H.jpg','1932-09-16',63,'Released','They saw the heads of hunted men in Zaroff\'s trophy room!','The Most Dangerous Game',1994,3.7397,6.905,'DoHUfQKA_sc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(893,_binary '\0','/tx1aZQDc0IRDKUybXo1cTQUPOll.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023241',7.1,1846,'en','Movie Crazy','After a mix-up with his application photograph, an aspiring actor is invited to a screen test and goes off to Hollywood.','/9iqQodSzndRx2MAnJ3xe6N1fjsh.jpg','1932-09-23',96,'Released','He\'ll make you laugh! He\'ll make you weep - but always makes you happy!','Movie Crazy',53522,1.2013,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(894,_binary '\0','/oorcx2bfW12NUhLklMuf9JtFmPx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023245',6.9,33687,'en','The Mummy','An ancient Egyptian priest named Imhotep is revived when a British archaeological expedition finds his mummy and one of the researchers accidentally reads an ancient life-giving spell. Imhotep escapes from the field site and searches for the reincarnation of the soul of his lover.','/vSKpbZVvzqQcw6htiyEinbCY9vq.jpg','1932-12-22',73,'Released','It comes to life!','The Mummy',15849,6.1326,6.7,'5eLN8ve_Eoc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(895,_binary '\0','/sLdz4K32OUP8cKk5G58e0JLofY9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023249',6.3,6032,'en','Murders in the Rue Morgue','In 19th century Paris, a maniac abducts young women and injects them with ape blood in an attempt to prove ape-human kinship but constantly meets failure as the abducted women die.','/vd7APCDkYTL0ZpNc88XB1uEYCQx.jpg','1932-01-27',61,'Released','The super shocker !','Murders in the Rue Morgue',28435,2.3392,6,'W3ONG8qFw_4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(896,_binary '\0','/zRDD47ue6Q4bTDhwuhos0D0BBFQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023266',6.7,1408,'en','Night After Night','A successful ex-boxer opens a high-class speakeasy in what once was the childhood home of a formerly rich society girl.','/zXp66XqUpqDWBcdBesQ6CVZOpyc.jpg','1932-10-29',73,'Released','Danger Lurks - Romance Flames - Excitement Plays in Joe Anton\'s Place \"Night after Night\"','Night After Night',82169,1.1933,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(897,_binary '\0','/c4NkLlxWE98WiMLkIL5CXLW5bz1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023277',6.6,1838,'en','No Man of Her Own','An on-the-lam New York card shark marries a small-town librarian who thinks he\'s a businessman.','/zLaI6pxeXBQAI2JroGC2faPuD4T.jpg','1932-12-30',85,'Released',NULL,'No Man of Her Own',36513,1.7463,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(898,_binary '\0','/5Tk0g4PiRiSlt8jYcewYUZrbVeI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023285',5.6,6119,'en','Number Seventeen','A gang of jewel thieves hides out in an abandoned London house after a robbery, unaware that a detective is among them in disguise.','/rie7xUzlxMHNDmaQSLatkoZn3jf.jpg','1932-07-18',63,'Released','A great play. A great novel. And a greater film.','Number Seventeen',15007,2.5707,5.5,'_1In3eSTomc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(899,_binary '\0','/Aoknrm6AdGdPdqIIKyXzygvlEzP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023293',7,14947,'en','The Old Dark House','In a remote region of Wales, five travelers beset by a relentless storm find shelter in an old mansion.','/t4058MoAiVg8R1aqHNL3nAP48km.jpg','1932-10-20',70,'Released','Beware the night!','The Old Dark House',31592,3.3405,6.7,'06RuAO980U4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(900,_binary '\0','/f8CAg1WyM3uWUyGhEzrXn3AcGaY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023303',7,3296,'en','One Hour with You','Andre and Colette Bertier are happily married. When Colette introduces her husband to her flirtatious best friend, Mitzi, he does his best to resist her advances. But she is persistent, and very cute, and he succumbs. Mitzi\'s husband wants to divorce her, and has been having her tailed. Andre gets caught, and must confess to his wife. But Colette has had problems resisting the attentions of another man herself, and they forgive each other.','/oVDJZXwHKD0NgHaHZrkHuqHsJyF.jpg','1932-03-23',80,'Released','Chevalier! Captivating all the world with laughter and love!','One Hour with You',43145,2.1375,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(901,_binary '\0','/6W7TwvVZx14XiFq6HbW8OUQLGar.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023305',7.5,5034,'en','One Way Passage','A terminally ill woman and a debonair murderer facing execution meet and fall in love on a trans-Pacific crossing, each without knowing the other\'s secret.','/c3FRmz3VTtvlmmNBJ7l8ILO0zzD.jpg','1932-10-04',68,'Released','Their tickets took them to a heaven of love...but port was the gateway to hell!','One Way Passage',13634,1.849,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(902,_binary '\0','/l1VSgIdqUOvoDZTpCoP71W98azd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023312',7.2,2986,'en','Pack Up Your Troubles','The story begins in 1917 with Stan and Ollie being drafted into the U.S. Army to fight in World War I. While in the Army, the pair befriend a man named Eddie Smith, who is killed by the enemy during a battle. After the war is over, Stan and Ollie venture to New York City, where they begin a quest to reunite Eddie\'s little daughter with her rightful family. The task proves both monumental and problematic as the boys discover just how many people in New York have the last name Smith.','/1nfi4YmKSHn974CDd5VxOtPYOLU.jpg','1932-09-16',68,'Released','From crack-pot civilians to coo-coo privates–they\'ll lead you a chase so crammed with hysterical laughter, you\'ll say it\'s even funnier than their first feature, \"Pardon Us.\"','Pack Up Your Troubles',44775,2.0638,6.796,'_VkXBsYDfFk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(903,_binary '\0','/k5uuPAIRcM6FO7DfIOxQbqSDBET.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023327',6.9,1700,'en','The Penguin Pool Murder','New York schoolmarm Hildegarde Withers assists a detective when a body of unscrupulous stockbroker Gerald Parker suddenly appears in the penguin tank at the aquarium.','/5JsNPCnbNjxYDLh9t1eXgZGnHB4.jpg','1932-12-09',70,'Released',NULL,'The Penguin Pool Murder',84971,1.4188,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(904,_binary '\0','/dwqvK4pqds7qFSnH3R9x30ePcRR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023349',6.1,1286,'en','Polly of the Circus','When Polly Fisher, a circus aerialist, is hurt while performing, she is taken to the house of a nearby minister, John Hartley. As she recuperates, they fall in love with each other and secretly marry. But when the truth leaks out , John\'s congregation rebels at having a circus woman as their minister\'s wife, and he is fired. Polly decides to leave John in hopes of giving back to him the calling that means so much to him. But fate steps in and rearranges all plans.','/uQhm7knOh0XF9IkO95ZGHsE1Ged.jpg','1932-02-27',69,'Released','\"LOVE is no SIN\" -Accused! Denounced! Dismissed! He was guilty of LOVE!','Polly of the Circus',221656,1.5927,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(905,_binary '\0','/ft5zgn9GFf3UBUjsoood3LyX9Ev.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023362',6.4,2168,'en','The Purchase Price','Nightclub singer Joan Gordon runs away from her gangster boyfriend to become a mail-order bride to a struggling North Dakota farmer. Their relationship has a rocky start, but just as Joan realizes she\'s developing feelings for her husband, her old boyfriend arrives to win her back.','/oWQ59z6PoTyzFVX6GfQLvH42Iq.jpg','1932-07-23',68,'Released','She took another woman\'s place on her wedding night!','The Purchase Price',75510,1.5725,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(906,_binary '\0','/xmrI0dTP124l51eR6VT8KCPu1iL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023369',6.9,3553,'en','Rain','Due to a possible cholera epidemic onboard, passengers on a ship are forced to disembark at Pago Pago, a small village on a Pacific island where it incessantly rains. Among the stranded passengers are Sadie Thompson, a prostitute, and Alfred Davidson, a fanatic missionary who will try to redeem her.','/loiZCnkxAiSDyFmCAsUoTm62CAb.jpg','1932-10-12',94,'Released','A woman without shame. A woman without soul.','Rain',61369,1.856,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(907,_binary '\0','/5Ik710g5n9AIe0kVHcaLnBganp3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023374',6.5,1385,'en','Rasputin and the Empress','The story of corrupt, power-hungry, manipulative Grigori Rasputin\'s influence on members of the Russian Imperial family and others, and what resulted.','/txLqNjctfiVbCyxIKa261W5tz70.jpg','1932-12-23',121,'Released','Beautiful girls who came to pray! Caught in the web of debauched Rasputin, whose crafty mind toppled a throne!','Rasputin and the Empress',43132,2.8692,5.5,'8ka57eClzIY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(908,_binary '\0','/bAXToJkAahJfR8isDSL04jfz5sW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023382',7.2,5370,'en','Red Dust','Dennis, owner of a rubber plantation in Cochinchina, is involved with Vantine, who left Saigon to evade the police. When his new surveyor arrives along with his refined wife Dennis is quickly infatuated by her.','/laHlMLtR1SyKoOhWmQG5aLHflJa.jpg','1932-10-22',83,'Released','She fought for her mate with a tigress\' fury…','Red Dust',38077,1.9236,6.904,'gpEj0mOHSLQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(909,_binary '\0','/cBsgEJhxaR1hGOOWR68A6sWXAMs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023385',7,3994,'en','Red-Headed Woman','Lil works for the Legendre Company and causes Bill to divorce Irene and marry her. She has an affair with businessman Gaerste and uses him to force society to pay attention to her.','/3Iv5sY7qWljRFEHQ3qsgRetIboC.jpg','1932-06-25',79,'Released','The Red-Headed Woman\'s Code: Every man... single or married... is fair prey.','Red-Headed Woman',77966,1.5795,6.57,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(910,_binary '\0','/uHTctQl1uxu3zbrEoA7qbp5M3jk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023394',6.2,1317,'en','The Rich Are Always with Us','A wealthy couple\'s marriage is falling apart due to the man\'s infidelity. The wife\'s male friend has long loved her and sees his big opportunity.','/n7Mgtli5R9OQku7NZf1judTmDCE.jpg','1932-05-19',71,'Released','Sumptuous portrayal of sensuous society in the perfumed fragrance of Park Avenue and Paris boudoirs.','The Rich Are Always with Us',122325,1.5498,5.3,'BHxPypMBpy4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(911,_binary '\0','/1sanK5lpAIFyFDFGi4OBz1yyWnJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023395',5.7,5436,'en','Rich and Strange','After receiving an advance inheritance, a bored London couple set off on a world cruise hoping to rejuvenate their marriage and escape their dull routine. But newfound wealth and freedom only expose deeper cracks in their relationship, as each becomes infatuated with someone else. Their journey through exotic ports and mounting disillusionment ultimately brings them face to face with the fragility—and resilience—of love.','/8uELURwfZlQBsy26VUk7ap0v3ZS.jpg','1931-12-10',83,'Released','From Dale Collins’ romantic and exciting novel of the strange and lovely places of the world, unfolded before the wondering eyes of a simple London clerk and his wife — the magic of unexpected wealth.','Rich and Strange',36049,3.0371,5.4,'0SoJL6G8Ai8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(912,_binary '\0','/bIv1kaxb7tsiZYPO27PHfVb5eSF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023427',7.7,33805,'en','Scarface','In 1920s Chicago, Italian immigrant and notorious thug, Antonio \'Tony\' Camonte, aka Scarface, shoots his way to the top of the mobs while trying to protect his sister from the criminal life.','/y4E5oRiHMTFkEB12IIcpbKbKzDW.jpg','1932-04-09',93,'Released','The rise and fall of a power hungry mobster.','Scarface',877,4.8971,7.4,'XRmWftEjit0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(913,_binary '\0','/yGBAQcQVauUGNWGgWHxG4ihNCOp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023458',7.3,11952,'en','Shanghai Express','A beautiful temptress re-kindles an old romance while trying to escape her past during a tension-packed train journey.','/z0ea6xM3HhIZi7zApDVsxewv9R8.jpg','1932-02-12',82,'Released','Many Men Had Loved Her -- but only one had been loved in return!','Shanghai Express',875,3.3383,6.986,'i86Hc6AAVt4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(914,_binary '\0','/mGiibFkLgctSaGnZJUQ1fLW5DDJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023464',6.4,1259,'en','Shopworn','A waitress falls for a wealthy young man but has to fight his mother to find happiness.','/p0dOmUGunUBbOtobAkwHZTNm87J.jpg','1932-03-25',66,'Released','A SUPERB ARTISTE IN HER MOST GLAMOROUS ROLE...Barbara STANWYCK','Shopworn',121013,1.9763,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(915,_binary '\0','/9FntIH0fQjEKm5ZARBjU6a7G2pD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023470',6.8,3112,'en','The Sign of the Cross','A Roman soldier becomes torn between his love for a Christian woman and his loyalty to Emperor Nero.','/qJdANRQy3BkTJGxXXHKMVoUigSD.jpg','1932-12-13',126,'Released','A picture which will proudly lead all the entertainments the world has ever seen','The Sign of the Cross',50070,2.7161,6.445,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(916,_binary '\0','/dUQh4cTI19Lg9Y6p7OeylBLdTMl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023488',6.8,1804,'en','Smilin\' Through','On the day of his wedding, Sir John Carteret\'s fiancée, Moonyeen, is killed by a jealous rival named Jeremy, leaving him emotionally devastated. Carteret spends three decades in seclusion, mostly communing with the spirit of Moonyeen, until he learns that her niece, Kathleen, has become an orphan. He adopts and raises the child as his own but is alarmed when, as a young woman, she falls in love with the son of Moonyeen\'s murderer.','/aq0rbICU0lGFQlCYMLJwV0iolPv.jpg','1932-09-24',98,'Released','Exquisite romance!','Smilin\' Through',84303,1.2931,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(917,_binary '\0','/jge2M6MIBlsRO1TR2gTbmb2hbnF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023491',6.8,1991,'en','So Big!','A farmer\'s widow takes on the land and her late husband\'s tempestuous son.','/41SiOxy1lIRGVOQgL2tzsno0dhA.jpg','1932-04-30',81,'Released','Edna Ferber\'s epic of American Womanhood','So Big!',98536,1.1814,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(918,_binary '\0','/zQpmMt7wdQre1IT5DreQaK9rvDN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023498',5.8,1309,'en','Speak Easily','A professor gets mixed up with chorus girls in a Broadway musical.','/pWVjJr90gKkt50omskSlT3t0Emy.jpg','1932-08-13',81,'Released','See it and laugh to your heart\'s content!','Speak Easily',43131,1.1244,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(919,_binary '\0','/uudJ8er8FaDBNIVRBS2psG6cSsO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023551',6.9,9035,'en','Tarzan the Ape Man','James Parker and Harry Holt are on an expedition in Africa in search of the elephant burial grounds that will provide enough ivory to make them rich. Parker\'s beautiful daughter Jane arrives unexpectedly to join them. Jane is terrified when Tarzan and his ape friends abduct her, but when she returns to her father\'s expedition she has second thoughts about leaving Tarzan.','/4n6VfSDMN9ylv5JNAb19qVGN1Hf.jpg','1932-03-22',100,'Released','Mothered by an ape—he knew only the law of the jungle—to seize what he wanted!','Tarzan the Ape Man',26845,4.8112,6.6,'lIoPPD0NKhA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(920,_binary '\0','/ycCXHjOqS80D8LwG9y0rSokmHNK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023556',6.6,1828,'en','Taxi!','Amidst a backdrop of growing violence and intimidation, independent cab drivers struggling against a consolidated juggernaut rally around hot-tempered Matt Nolan. Nolan is determined to keep competition alive on the streets, even if it means losing the woman he loves.','/4S2teUultfRWlJxpa0fRXsW7mPF.jpg','1932-01-23',69,'Released',NULL,'Taxi!',82260,1.4378,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(921,_binary '\0','/1cqCq9KJUeeygcUpip4qfokmQG2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023563',7.9,14790,'de','Das Testament des Dr. Mabuse','After a detective is assaulted by thugs and placed in an asylum run by Professor Baum, he observes the professor\'s preoccupation with another patient, the criminal genius Dr. Mabuse the hypnotist. When Mabuse\'s notes are found to be connected with a rash of recent crimes, Commissioner Lohmann must determine how Mabuse is communicating with the criminals, despite conflicting reports on the doctor\'s whereabouts, and capture him for good.','/tc2ET7j6X066VCjdHblSwLr8sEz.jpg','1933-04-21',122,'Released','Madman? Monster? Murderer? Scientist?','The Testament of Dr. Mabuse',12206,3.6881,7.6,'IEEjeviFMeY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(922,_binary '\0','/ylH6yTReNk9X16VJ6kjz16ThRnH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023582',6.3,2317,'en','Thirteen Women','Thirteen women who were schoolmates ask a swami to cast their horoscopes. The news they receive is not good for any of them.','/jLNBQpb3X3UtWWr6qw7q3WD4X2d.jpg','1932-09-16',59,'Released','Each one doomed','Thirteen Women',91181,1.4214,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(923,_binary '\0','/gg5NpGAkrg7Mk0cCN4oIGYt9hJl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023590',7.1,5030,'en','Three on a Match','Although Vivian Revere is seemingly the most successful of a trio of reunited schoolmates, she throws it away by descending into a life of debauchery and drugs.','/rgx6zwUzi4jZyXaB0Hg8dKx47Qp.jpg','1932-10-29',63,'Released','Three wise girls who barred no holds and bit in the clinches.','Three on a Match',42914,2.1601,6.3,'yQUvX0FrFhA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(924,_binary '\0','/oGe7xOU0cohvsSYmeDHSvkq9i71.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023594',6.3,1282,'en','Tiger Shark','A Portuguese tuna fisherman catches his bride with his first mate.','/hBnxEG4HCVqtScs6Ew8UrHMMzlj.jpg','1932-09-24',77,'Released','UNFAITHFUL! ...or Was She Too Lovely To Be One Man\'s Woman!','Tiger Shark',109262,1.3425,6.444,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(925,_binary '\0','/8xFIubJoxyidKaGjO1dc0btC9e7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023622',7.9,17715,'en','Trouble in Paradise','Thief Gaston Monescu and pickpocket Lily are partners in crime and love. Working for perfume company executive Mariette Colet, the two crooks decide to combine their criminal talents to rob their employer. Under the alias of Monsieur Laval, Gaston uses his position as Mariette\'s personal secretary to become closer to her. However, he takes things too far when he actually falls in love with Mariette, and has to choose between her and Lily.','/FBxuoLRD3Biyul14unT5m3PYNS.jpg','1932-10-30',83,'Released','HIS PARADISE BECAME A MERRY HELL!','Trouble in Paradise',195,2.5653,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(926,_binary '\0','/p68TvdLOCLXJWTfI9R865Je6mfm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023629',6.9,1497,'en','Two Seconds','A condemned murderer, in the process of being executed, relives the events that led to his being sentenced to die in the electric chair. Told in flashback, we witness a sleazy dancehall girl dupe a high rise riveter into marriage so she can live off of him. But when he loses his job and his marbles, she ends up supporting him with money from her side man--and misses no opportunity to rub it in his face that she\'s now supporting him in his emasculated state. As the animosity grows and things get more and more unbearable, he is eventually driven to desperate measures.','/mSsJxhXgkoqijFV5gRe2BvahJP1.jpg','1932-05-28',67,'Released','HIS LIFE WAS A LIVING HELL until he killed the thing that Crushed him!','Two Seconds',26714,1.4244,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(927,_binary '\0','/2Z20IzIW3Do6HWXbEMuFRkMkWaZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023634',7.8,6841,'ja','大人の見る繪本 生れてはみたけれど','Brothers Keiji and Ryoichi move to a new neighborhood in the Tokyo suburbs after their father, an office clerk, is promoted. The boys join the local gang as lowly new kids and emerge as natural leaders after defeating a bully. While visiting the home of their father\'s boss, the brothers witness the ridicule their father endures to please his superior. Angry and embarrassed, the boys find their naive ideas about power being challenged.','/dD3Do5OQj23RJd4thYyUW2AqsCc.jpg','1932-06-03',91,'Released',NULL,'I Was Born, But...',28268,1.3877,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(928,_binary '\0','/g8QoU2TeM5YxX6oPHB7AySUtdY7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023642',7.1,1297,'en','Union Depot','Among the travelers of varied backgrounds that meet and interact on one night at Union Depot, a metropolitan train station, are Chick and his friend Scrap Iron, both newly released from prison after serving time for vagrancy. Hungry and desperate for a break, Chick fortuitously comes across across a valise abandoned by a drunken traveler. In it he finds a shaving kit and a suit of clothes with a bankroll, which help transform the affable tramp into a dashing gent. After buying himself a meal, Chick seeks some female companionship among the many hustlers who walk the station. He propositions Ruth Collins, a stranded, out-of-work showgirl and takes her to the station\'s hotel.','/r9ujw92xMRPQ7dFH6rzKzbenuhs.jpg','1932-01-14',67,'Released','A Lifetime Crowded Into a Few Mad Hours! A Picture Shockingly Real—Lifting You Out of the Humdrum Routine, Pluning You Wildly Into Life\'s Melodrama!','Union Depot',111307,1.1833,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(929,_binary '\0','/rg3hBiQbDet8uNQkgfbpk7306p8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023649',7.4,23090,'de','Vampyr - Der Traum des Allan Grey','Allan Gray, a young man fascinated by the supernatural, goes to a small village where he feels a sinister force descending upon him. There, Allan meets an old man who asks him to protect his two daughters, for one of them has been bitten by a vampire.','/yt3JS5JSoZseSohYkhs6FLU9B0O.jpg','1932-05-06',74,'Released','The strange adventure of Allan Gray.','Vampyr',779,4.0595,7.3,'acZJwgwmk4w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(930,_binary '\0','/keej6aUV33w1wF6PcIG5y46PnHx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023659',6.9,1222,'en','Virtue','A relationship gradually develops between a savvy New York City street girl and a good-hearted cab driver, but other matters keep getting in their way, including financial problems and a murder.','/mxBzbdpLYQ6XK9AFc5xRIZSgxpn.jpg','1932-10-25',68,'Released','Yesterday a Lady with a Past — Today the Wife of the Man She Loved!','Virtue',79308,1.0243,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(931,_binary '\0','/6U5MXeOktDMmTR2LkaIlHC17HCP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023686',7,2933,'en','What Price Hollywood?','Sassy and ambitious waitress Mary Evans amuses and befriends amiable seldom-sober Hollywood film director Max Carey when he stumbles into her restaurant. Max invites Mary to his film premiere and, after a night of drinking and carousing, Mary is granted a screen test. A studio contract follows. Just as Mary finds her dreams coming true, Carey’s life and career begins its descent.','/1sgN5YoUMKnPQhOzqwXRjC3oCxo.jpg','1932-06-24',88,'Released','First intimate expose of the private life and glamorous loves of a Hollywood star','What Price Hollywood?',56724,1.5017,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(932,_binary '\0','/9tcIzvTfIYkoxjLiTcaXdMwfzT6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023694',6.2,12847,'en','White Zombie','A wealthy landowner living in Haiti convinces a sorcerer to lure the woman he has fallen for away from her fiancé. The madman later betrays their agreement by keeping the woman for himself…as a zombie.','/s5DnfWHGeCExlweIFF4JOHKyx3H.jpg','1932-07-28',67,'Released','Stranger things are happening than you ever dreamed of!','White Zombie',26860,3.111,5.979,'Qzum68zgBl4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(933,_binary '\0','/zAlmrbAOAEUIFJuGRkCbUPXNbiO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023731',6.8,3235,'en','20,000 Years in Sing Sing','Brash hoodlum Tom Connors enters Sing Sing cocksure of himself and disrespectful toward authority, but his tough but compassionate warden changes him.','/pz6IM5TC5uLi3AQeXVMvPSgwngw.jpg','1932-12-24',78,'Released','MEN without WOMEN...MEN without HOPE! smash their lives to pieces against their STEEL CHAINS!','20,000 Years in Sing Sing',42822,2.49,6.4,'x2f9JNfq1V4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(934,_binary '\0','/g1LcYjBXzjqNrGXYTRll1jNRTfb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023753',6.3,3063,'en','Alice in Wonderland','In Victorian England, a bored young girl dreams that she has entered a fantasy world called Wonderland, populated by even more fantastic characters.','/k4hlsqfhEtTrEtiDE647qxTR6PI.jpg','1933-12-18',76,'Released','The Entertainment Miracle of All Times!','Alice in Wonderland',25694,3.0473,6.1,'-iaZZx-ldvU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(935,_binary '\0','/ykA6EZ1sONECr1z7a5j7BEzdwYy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023775',7.5,9364,'en','Baby Face','A young woman uses her body and her sexuality to help her climb the social ladder, but soon begins to wonder if her new status will ever bring her happiness.','/ul4BLZAXepOQRwUtORmvEpZ4KW4.jpg','1933-07-13',76,'Released','She climbed the ladder of success - wrong by wrong!','Baby Face',27449,14.7318,7.242,'8uI4eij-K0Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(936,_binary '\0','/AjXjoawu5zLE9GiRWZ9fd20G9Aa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023814',6.9,4859,'en','The Bitter Tea of General Yen','Shanghai, China, the 1920s. In the midst of a bloody civil war, General Yen, a ruthless warlord, rescues Megan Davis —who was about to marry a missionary— from certain death amid the chaos.','/63lQVmPRDuc4fUDfgbKYnvuSYYr.jpg','1933-01-06',88,'Released','They found a love they dared not touch!','The Bitter Tea of General Yen',34187,2.4673,6.338,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(937,_binary '\0','/6o06tJsEqLziirSSuJt3Vk5y2KZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023825',7,3468,'en','Bombshell','A glamorous film star rebels against the studio, her pushy press agent and a family of hangers-on.','/dFWEo4b1kxu997TFetFDjk1RwJm.jpg','1933-10-13',96,'Released','An explosion of laughter...with beautiful Jean Harlow as the female fire-cracker of filmdom!','Bombshell',43601,1.263,6.491,'8n-WQ6tqH3c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(938,_binary '\0','/bABhkMdOH2TQPQiAvYzxb9rKXoy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023856',6.5,1509,'en','Bureau of Missing Persons','A young woman goes to the police looking for her missing husband. When it turns out her husband is both a murder victim and a bachelor - and that she is the primary suspect - tough cop Butch Saunders comes up with a scheme to crack the case.','/grDoaGUj3Ue9N3NdwHnpHJLfm9K.jpg','1933-09-16',73,'Released','SHAME is responsible for the \"amnesia\" plague which has swept America!','Bureau of Missing Persons',52227,1.7896,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(939,_binary '\0','/q0O8uTVPAYfTt2yu3iqicUJTsTt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023871',7.7,1647,'pt','A Canção de Lisboa','Vasco is a medical student in Lisbon, supported by his rich aunts, whom he had falsely told he had already graduated. In fact, he devotes himself to a bohemian life, preferring the popular fairs and pretty women, especially Alice, a seamstress from the Castelinhos quarter, which rather upsets her ambitious father, tailor Caetano, who is familiar with Vasco\'s debts. After failing yet another final exam, he is surprised by his aunts\' announcement that they will visit him in Lisbon to see his practice.','/t7zpnBcbbbKMWuZwk05r9PNongi.jpg','1933-11-07',85,'Released',NULL,'A Song of Lisbon',49961,2.0275,8.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(940,_binary '\0','/9LQdJ807aXpZtE4JsBF62ZXpL4F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023876',5.7,6772,'en','Cavalcade','A cavalcade of English life from New Year\'s Eve 1899 until 1933 is seen through the eyes of well-to-do Londoners Jane and Robert Marryot. Amongst events touching their family are the Boer War, the death of Queen Victoria, the sinking of the Titanic, and the Great War.','/a6yld4HmB49b9CP9wmv3wcwk65K.jpg','1933-02-08',112,'Released','THE PICTURE OF THE GENERATION!','Cavalcade',56164,2.2114,5.471,'d2sd4bObXD0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(941,_binary '\0','/cXEsVDYz99bUSokeNuoxsyquTOT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023891',6.3,1920,'en','Christopher Strong','A romance develops between a happily married middle-aged British politician and an adventurous young aviatrix.','/jhPBTEHlgw4xONmNxdJzWRuugMm.jpg','1933-03-09',78,'Released','Higher and higher! Faster and faster! She gave herself to the great god Speed, and tried to run away from the fires within her!','Christopher Strong',37581,1.4478,5.9,'OFOs8QWtMDU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(942,_binary '\0','/1UIzcxkGkd2nNjDE5BGTnjumRHH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023911',7.5,1702,'en','Counsellor at Law','A successful lawyer struggles to deal with his wife\'s unfaithfulness and his own hidden past.','/6mQ9jFo5qpNGptSe5AJMYAcrnSs.jpg','1933-12-25',82,'Released','Great is the word for...COUNSELLOR AT LAW!','Counsellor at Law',53792,1.3169,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(943,_binary '\0','/hfdfEX02JiXT1jlkROm31xj1Nif.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023926',6.8,2922,'en','Dancing Lady','Janie lives to dance and will dance anywhere, even stripping in a burlesque house. Tod Newton, the rich playboy, discovers her there and helps her get a job in a real Broadway musical being directed by Patch. Tod thinks he can get what he wants from Janie, Patch thinks Janie is using her charms rather than talent to get to the top, and Janie thinks Patch is the greatest. Steve, the stage manager, has the Three Stooges helping him manage all the show girls. Fred Astaire and Nelson Eddy make appearances as famous Broadway personalities.','/bJc8DTD34kbpccaMDROojHXJ0RS.jpg','1933-11-24',92,'Released','The Scenes Are Enthralling! The Electrical Ballet! Girls in Cellophane! Mirrors of Venus! Merry-Go-Round Girls','Dancing Lady',43600,2.281,6.9,'ehdyRdR8GaM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(944,_binary '\0','/aywosu5Dthu0yUGVod4Hm4d7Gfw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023935',6,1754,'en','The Death Kiss','When a movie actor is shot and killed during production, the true feelings about the actor begin to surface. As the studio heads worry about negative publicity, one of the writers tags along as the killing is investigated and clues begin to surface.','/jr9NNKQqSDGDR1wiinfrUFhHvpG.jpg','1932-12-05',75,'Released','IT\'S FULL OF THRILLS!','The Death Kiss',59158,1.6493,5.203,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(945,_binary '\0','/nbUNRrlJ5e8Jx6gMTiGZ7cJnhRQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023937',7.2,1615,'ja','出来ごころ','In Depression-era Tokyo, a struggling middle-aged single father with a young son comes across a homeless young lady and convinces a bar owner to take her in.','/aoxgzp1QLDHnR2GgXB56F6HkX19.jpg','1933-09-07',101,'Released',NULL,'Passing Fancy',117412,1.2061,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(946,_binary '\0','/cMUjH61we5JUDLmIpLFxlS0tHvB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023940',7.4,8710,'en','Design for Living','Independent Gilda is resigned fo a life of married tedium when Tom and George, having gotten past their jealousy, come to America and whisk Gilda away to live an exciting polyamorous life in Paris.','/h0T4FHsY51IccSGqGfaoYsd7hyx.jpg','1933-12-29',91,'Released','Three hearts that beat as one.','Design for Living',77210,2.1748,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(947,_binary '\0','/1hUBlSUrVx2MuNmqg4SkhlGnOX3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023943',7,2243,'en','The Devil\'s Brother','Two wannabe bandits join the service of a dashing nobleman, who secretly masquerades as Fra Diavolo, a notorious outlaw.','/gblt0cSVu82R921SmgNFX0Nq9bv.jpg','1933-05-05',90,'Released','Great lords lost their gold to him—great ladies their hearts.','The Devil\'s Brother',58012,2.9624,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(948,_binary '\0','/jMoeCypP4Vu12nr1CFdBL5TV1gC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023948',7.5,9817,'en','Dinner at Eight','An ambitious New York socialite plans an extravagant dinner party as her businessman husband, Oliver, contends with financial woes, causing a lot of tension between the couple. Meanwhile, their high-society friends and associates, including the gruff Dan Packard and his sultry spouse, Kitty, contend with their own entanglements, leading to revelations at the much-anticipated dinner.','/p9V2dIMqC1g1S9bDgvxqUOJDfp6.jpg','1933-12-22',111,'Released','HERE IS THE SCREEN\'S CLIMAX OF GLAMOR AND THRILL THAT RAN OVER A YEAR ON BROADWAY! THE STAGE SMASH NOW A SENSATIONAL FILM TRIUMPH!','Dinner at Eight',39130,2.8119,6.772,'vDP8jh1JRhw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(949,_binary '\0','/3TLgNKMGvhXoYWiOfZGyg2RK9ih.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023960',6.8,1428,'en','Double Harness','After tricking him into marriage, a woman tries to win the love of her philandering husband.','/WYjDNBuzzL1B8H0216VGBJ0U9v.jpg','1933-07-21',69,'Released','The story of a temporary marriage','Double Harness',175027,1.642,6.475,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(950,_binary '\0','/nVpp3ZcIFtJJ3fJp65eJczehIN8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023969',7.7,64458,'en','Duck Soup','Rufus T. Firefly is named president/dictator of bankrupt Freedonia and declares war on neighboring Sylvania over the love of wealthy Mrs. Teasdale.','/31t63plEGKHhYuuCpC9bFWO9SBS.jpg','1933-11-12',68,'Released','War is swell...when the Marx Brothers are in it. They\'ll be out of the trenches by Christmas...if the food doesn\'t improve!','Duck Soup',3063,4.0206,7.3,'MSMTkUYyKYU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(951,_binary '\0','/5oV4v3QFhHFFFtyG10IcGb5sAVu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023973',7,1556,'en','The Eagle and the Hawk','The pilots of a Royal Air Force squadron in World War I face not only physical but mental dangers in their struggle to survive while fighting the enemy.','/qkg6lo4OvOTOqCQ2dkMJKuQ93BU.jpg','1933-05-06',73,'Released','One a dauntless flyer, the other a relentless killer!','The Eagle and the Hawk',81110,2.2847,6.621,'8jqgTwtTbJE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(952,_binary '\0','/tj7xXnxWjqlSAPu7aNzo9zHCWyU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023985',6.4,1449,'en','Emperor Jones','Unscrupulously ambitious, Brutus Jones escapes from jail after killing a guard and, through bluff and bravado, finds himself the emperor of a Caribbean island.','/676jzPaamXDHe0pJdiiHkt9ZTFd.jpg','1933-09-29',73,'Released','GIN...GALS...DICE AND MURDER MADE HIM A FUGITIVE IN THE NIGHT! BUT MORNING FOUND HIM A KING!','Emperor Jones',43594,1.1586,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(953,_binary '\0','/y55oP3fny7ixmID40PG6s2xmkpW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023986',7.2,1878,'en','Employees\' Entrance','Kurt Anderson is the tyrannical manager of a New York department store in financial straits. He thinks nothing of firing an employee of more than 20 years or of toying with the affections of every woman he meets. One such victim is Madeline, a beautiful young woman in need of a job. Anderson hires her as a salesgirl, but not before the two spend the night together. Madeline is ashamed, especially after she falls for Martin West, a rising young star at the store. Her biggest fear is that Martin finds out the truth about her \"career move.\"','/oRBztofgI6c4v2ahiMNm0unGzls.jpg','1933-02-11',75,'Released','Working Girls-Here\'s Your Picture About Your Lives—Your Problems!','Employees\' Entrance',43599,1.1008,6.161,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(954,_binary '\0','/DzCeL5vjOmnE5Q8jwFoBBBVVPF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0023993',6.4,1857,'en','Ex-Lady','Although free spirit Helen Bauer does not believe in marriage, she consents to marry Don, but his infidelities cause her to also take on a lover.','/bYKtoVtx0yRHzgaGOhh88Dt9JYc.jpg','1933-05-15',67,'Released','So frank . . so outspoken... so true...','Ex-Lady',52228,1.1011,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(955,_binary '\0','/pFIdP1omUgiCkkRAngjmkQ1CyTE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024008',6.7,2140,'en','Female','Alison Drake, the tough-minded executive of an automobile factory, succeeds in the man\'s world of business until she meets an independent design engineer.','/zHgACPj8LHUai00XjDZYPNQ2xeg.jpg','1933-11-11',60,'Released','she had plenty of trouble finding a man she couldn\'t boss. ...AND PLENTY MORE AFTER SHE FOUND HIM!','Female',83868,1.2707,6.3,'eDfRzke3R9E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(956,_binary '\0','/gb01PQypcQVz7Q15vsZQRqhdSQc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024025',6.6,4382,'en','Flying Down to Rio','An American bandleader woos a Brazilian beauty who is already engaged to his employer. His friends try to help him, while learning the local dance, The Carioca. The first pairing of Fred Astaire & Ginger Rogers, and their only pre-Code film.','/zKBXy84eN6tgwXaYsiFSCgq0GBc.jpg','1933-12-22',89,'Released','Too big for the world... So they staged it in the clouds... Too beautiful for words... So they set it to music!','Flying Down to Rio',28293,4.4159,6.3,'lJI1CRzGTIs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(957,_binary '\0','/a3cPv2bi7UEnK7PGqPIYhigtpm9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024028',7.5,6740,'en','Footlight Parade','A fledgling producer finds himself at odds with his workers, financiers and his greedy ex-wife when he tries to produce live musicals for movie-going audiences.','/3i03jv70icLoxJiwkqcFsLmmmrA.jpg','1933-10-21',104,'Released','Climaxing Warner Bros.\' glittering parade of musicals!','Footlight Parade',28432,3.283,6.843,'EIv4A53jH6s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(958,_binary '\0','/5a5lJCew2hGBcd6abdMkomr9mos.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024034',7.3,14007,'en','42nd Street','Broadway director Julian Marsh needs just one more hit show so he can retire and recover his health. It looks like he just may pull it off until temperamental star Dorthy Brock breaks her ankle on the eve of the show\'s premiere and has to be replaced by her understudy Peggy.','/q4UEd8BL74zVsOOaJkKVMLMmdTg.jpg','1933-03-11',89,'Released','The Greatest Musical Hit the Screen Has Ever Known!','42nd Street',3062,2.9935,6.9,'f2OaJv0NBB8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(959,_binary '\0','/hUv6v2eV1t9WeH9C0T61jRBJB78.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024044',6.4,1647,'en','Gabriel Over the White House','A political hack becomes President during the height of the Depression and undergoes a metamorphosis into an incorruptible statesman after a near-fatal accident.','/fZt8iHZerWqN54JuOWvX7pc8T3G.jpg','1933-03-31',86,'Released','The sensation of a nation!','Gabriel Over the White House',100420,1.7553,6.833,'S6cCsd-OhU4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(960,_binary '\0','/vXovDO9DfrSkpx9mB9NQYvMquhw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024055',5.8,3811,'en','The Ghoul','British Egyptologist Professor Morlant seeks immortality through a jewel buried in the tomb of an Oriental idol. Upon his death, Morlant returns to Earth to seek vengeance upon those who removed the jewel from his grave.','/dmMBlNiGLQJRVNGgy8SRnscidUn.jpg','1933-08-01',77,'Released','From the Depths of the Earth, He Will Rise.','The Ghoul',28046,1.3139,5.6,'_SZtP0V0L2M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(961,_binary '\0','/xxfcDTwQkZxENU4nxpz1QRx3FnX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024067',6.1,2052,'en','Going Hollywood','Sylvia is a French teacher at an all-girls school who wants to find love. When she hears Bill Williams on the radio, she decides to go visit and thank him. However, difficult problems lie ahead when Lili gets in the way.','/uS8537GrF5d53SDTFMMEW2fRhE1.jpg','1933-12-22',78,'Released','SHE FELL IN LOVE WITH HIS VOICE and followed him to Hollywood!','Going Hollywood',33709,1.2995,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(962,_binary '\0','/oK4zUOQdGF0qIa05urUfCGaFzrK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024069',7.7,10172,'en','Gold Diggers of 1933','When all Broadway shows are shut down during the Depression, a trio of desperate showgirls scheme to bilk a repugnant high society man of his money to keep their show going.','/sXsUJsW9fcVT15hfBu9LyU22qmG.jpg','1933-05-27',97,'Released','THE BIGGEST SHOW ON EARTH!','Gold Diggers of 1933',31511,3.8003,7.223,'n7LcBOOqgZo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(963,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024087',5.8,1514,'de','Hans Westmar','Nazi film about the story of a Nazi Storm Trooper named Horst Wessel--here called \"Hans Westmar\"--who took part in street brawls and assassinations in Berlin in the 1920s and 1930s against Communists and other opponents of the Nazis, and was killed by Communists not long before this film came out.','/6P8LclqXP8j482OCJ2PQaiR5jpW.jpg','1933-12-13',95,'Released',NULL,'Hans Westmar',163838,1.5354,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(964,_binary '\0','/3n4WpNvlLnId5VYFTNIT0fVHid3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024115',7.3,2746,'en','Heroes for Sale','World War I veteran Tom Holmes is marked by the unbearable suffering caused by his battle wounds. Over the years, he comes to experience both the pain of misfortune and a love for other human beings.','/36ENJ2HpKkQLRycFwwgHxKQw71T.jpg','1933-06-17',72,'Released','What good are medals on tortured breasts?','Heroes for Sale',66701,2.0668,7.077,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(965,_binary '\0','/i0kjnisPqirgsUa1i8P2EI7MBcs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024120',6.9,1313,'ja','非常線の女','A gangster tries to find redemption with the inadvertent help of an innocent shop girl and his jealous girlfriend will do anything to keep him.','/uHkdSXumZHqUILAy8zsiYLlfGmH.jpg','1933-04-27',100,'Released',NULL,'Dragnet Girl',117472,1.4699,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(966,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024127',5.5,1911,'de','Hitlerjunge Quex','Nazi propaganda film based on the life and death of Hitler Youth Herbert \"Quex\" Norkus – in the film, renamed Heini Völker – who was killed while distributing flyers in a Communist neighborhood.','/ndIG50vNtPYKGimY1hgOBxCjyS0.jpg','1933-09-10',91,'Released','Our flag leads us forward!','Hitler Youth Quex',167235,2.1702,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(967,_binary '\0','/9Y2vVsIjJdckQkh6jWMO90Z1uGF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024130',6.9,2054,'en','Hold Your Man','Ruby falls in love with small-time con man Eddie. During a botched blackmail scheme, Eddie accidentally kills the man they were setting up. Eddie takes off and Ruby is sent to a reformatory for two years.','/xQYkhqL9yQ1aaPp2WXGG7WWRofw.jpg','1933-06-30',87,'Released','THE STARS YOU LOVE TO SEE MAKING LOVE!','Hold Your Man',90957,1.6634,6.348,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(968,_binary '\0','/eDsDz98u2ADBStyNwYS5nXcDpmY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024166',6.9,4386,'en','I\'m No Angel','Bold performer Tira works as dancing beauty and lion tamer at a fair. Out of an urgent financial need, she agrees to a risky new number: she\'ll put her head into the lion\'s mouth! With this attraction, the circus makes it to New York and Tira can pursue her dearest occupation — flirting with rich men and accepting expensive presents.','/ttACv1NRimYH9JiyVwy5Kwq2nL0.jpg','1933-10-06',87,'Released','\"Come up and see me sometime - any time!\"','I\'m No Angel',34456,2.7218,6.3,'WljI-X_Zkf8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(969,_binary '\0','/5SHDt0nkkHOTIWYaW3RDjv06XE8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024183',6.9,1672,'en','International House','Foreign investors converge on a luxury hotel in China to bid on a new kind of radioscope. But, this is a hotel where Burns and Allen are the in-house medical staff, a measles risk sends the whole building into quarantine, and a madcap millionaire crashes dinner in his autogyro. Hotel and radioscope become a stage for an all-star cast of comedians and musicians, from vaudeville to the new generation.','/fCZ2Q7vOoxitgaVv1exWSkHIPmR.jpg','1933-05-27',68,'Released','Grand Hotel of comedy','International House',30230,3.4131,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(970,_binary '\0','/uGXid3UHMzoL2hyNfWSPDWkqbKC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024184',7.6,44668,'en','The Invisible Man','After experimenting on himself and becoming invisible, scientist Jack Griffin, now aggressive due to the drug\'s effects, seeks a way to reverse the experiment at any cost.','/ejoVwGmEbTBrf78tqnTSO5g8iVz.jpg','1933-10-31',71,'Released','H.G. Wells’ fantastic, out-of-this-world show!','The Invisible Man',10787,5.6473,7.5,'C4rEv7ArYwg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(971,_binary '\0','/61IefEsvLfIu60mp1WWu144hoHN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024188',7.3,12409,'en','Island of Lost Souls','An obsessed scientist conducts profane experiments in evolution, eventually establishing himself as the self-styled demigod to a race of mutated, half-human abominations.','/g7K7r1FojQC52YHxfmuXgwYBq5Q.jpg','1932-12-23',71,'Released','TERROR! Stalked the Brush-Choked Island...Where Men Who Were Animals Sought the Girl Who Was All-Human!','Island of Lost Souls',3031,3.4401,6.9,'D6wWPwz4BAM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(972,_binary '\0','/aeks316GfUNJLmljKxD8F9HY5Fu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024210',6.8,4702,'en','The Kennel Murder Case','Philo Vance, accompanied by his prize-losing Scottish terrier, investigates the locked-room murder of a prominent and much-hated collector whose broken Chinese vase provides an important clue.','/sLVl74dMT8JF7HiBqwqqASnEeHx.jpg','1933-10-28',73,'Released','William Powell returns as Philo Vance','The Kennel Murder Case',53873,2.0122,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(973,_binary '\0','/lYfHa1AtkUMtplrKx7SRLHpwonW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024216',7.9,96647,'en','King Kong','Adventurous filmmaker Carl Denham sets out to produce a motion picture unlike anything the world has seen before. Alongside his leading lady Ann Darrow and his first mate Jack Driscoll, they arrive on an island and discover a legendary creature said to be neither beast nor man. Denham captures the monster to be displayed on Broadway as King Kong, the eighth wonder of the world.','/lHlnxKL5GbgRibyRFI7n1Ey850i.jpg','1933-04-07',100,'Released','Beauty conquered the beast!','King Kong',244,7.3501,7.6,'I8P7RzqOU_M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(974,_binary '\0','/wg2tk0YT5L7HvLsQUSptLtHQbBM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024238',6.6,2324,'en','Ladies They Talk About','A moll, imprisoned after participating in a bank robbery, helps with a breakout plot.','/1oEJ9Y2aO9qMvgiYqhmoca5kXys.jpg','1933-02-04',69,'Released','She\'s BRAZEN!','Ladies They Talk About',43598,1.9834,6.167,'4tW4c6H6j1A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(975,_binary '\0','/mqk4GxyxgGWkkm8zyfSQ5yW0OXG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024239',7,2316,'en','Lady Killer','An ex-gang member tries to resist his old cohorts\' criminal influence after he suddenly becomes a Hollywood movie star.','/jDFue65MCa3fnehTVA9KCunQD0M.jpg','1933-12-09',76,'Released','Warner Bros. screen scoop of the year teaming Jimmie again with the girl he slapped all the way from obscurity to fame in \"Public Enemy\"','Lady Killer',43597,1.4223,6.9,'a1wROiL2ZL8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(976,_binary '\0','/fiP5YEGacZNT3GLbFrxbVRBs9Xv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024240',7.4,5291,'en','Lady for a Day','Apple Annie is an aging New York City fruit seller whose daughter Louise has been raised in a Spanish convent since she was an infant. As she grows up, Louise is led to believe that her mother is a society matron called Mrs. E. Worthington Manville. Annie worries that her lie is in danger of being uncovered when she learns that Louise is sailing to New York with her new fiancé and his nobleman father.','/3qOtbnBKhcM66wtYgUViasKdj6s.jpg','1933-09-13',96,'Released','Takes its place among the greatest pictures ever made!','Lady for a Day',43130,2.5609,7.1,'okXAbM8aVfE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(977,_binary '\0','/iKW4lNjtPuZWzLn1Q8VabiIjVkl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024252',7.4,1678,'de','Liebelei','Vienna in the beginning of the twentieth century. Cavalry Lieutenant Fritz Lobheimer is about to end his affair with Baroness Eggerdorff when he meets the young Christine, the daughter of an opera violinist. Baron Eggerdorff however soon hears of his past misfortune...','/yQyvKKKotBSnKk3ZFyhCzDzhnsy.jpg','1933-03-10',88,'Released',NULL,'Liebelei',43596,0.9645,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(978,_binary '\0','/33hTF4n2Y7XeEVXLxhQ3nElwNM1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024262',7,1551,'en','The Little Giant','Prohibition is ending so bootlegger Bugs Ahearn decides to crack California society. He leases a house from down-on-her-luck Ruth and hires her as social secretary. He rescues Polly Cass from a horsefall and goes home to meet her dad who sells him some phony stock certificates. When he learns about this he sends to Chicago for mob help.','/n7YHYu2JO0zBCEsBW8lKRBvpTgr.jpg','1933-05-20',76,'Released','\"Little Caesar\" Swaps Dames for Debs...Beer Trucks for Tea Cups!','The Little Giant',27991,1.5371,6.955,'QcRJ2vZoSD0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(979,_binary '\0','/vDaoVHc9Y2aKnpi5BBkpPGWbWfM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024264',7.1,8613,'en','Little Women','Four sisters come of age in America in the aftermath of the Civil War.','/6jbBsk4uDuSkO2Uxv5YxoPNmVVj.jpg','1933-11-24',115,'Released','Louisa May Alcott’s Immortal Story!','Little Women',39938,3.1128,6.8,'LQLLijJevd8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(980,_binary '\0','/5PazExcpzsdCKfLcul6QPDkokOM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024302',7.1,2189,'en','Man\'s Castle','Bill takes Trina into his depression camp cabin. Later, just as he finds showgirl LaRue who will support him, Trina becomes pregnant.','/v1FnexSyXDvR7V5ugPXGXve7B8c.jpg','1933-11-20',75,'Released','Hers was the beauty of awakening dawn - binding his fickle heart forevermore!','Man\'s Castle',109886,1.3559,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(981,_binary '\0','/AwvC48B7Mh84VHsrH1oAMaSlEgS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024314',6.9,2145,'en','The Mayor of Hell','Members of a teenage gang are sent to the State Reformatory, presided over by the callous Thompson. Soon Patsy Gargan, a former gangster appointed Deputy Commissioner, arrives and takes over the administration to run the place on radical principles. Thompson needs a quick way to discredit him.','/lqYNH0qqCDrWQ19WHmyLP6q2PjA.jpg','1933-06-24',90,'Released','Rips the Lid from an Inferno of Human Passions!','The Mayor of Hell',100894,2.6624,7.074,'ZxFZDz5O68A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(982,_binary '\0','/6pPwKjl3wi56h1jPLKQez8229gX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024334',7,1941,'en','Midnight Mary','While on trial for her life, a young woman recalls her tough upbringing and her involvement with the men who brought her to this current state of affairs.','/gd3TAaPUKfnGEYXveQnmU6rAe8B.jpg','1933-06-30',74,'Released','A woman you will never forget!','Midnight Mary',70738,1.5647,6.778,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(983,_binary '\0','/zDE7JFI0GomnQyz2GecaC8vztYA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024353',6.4,3626,'en','Morning Glory','Wildly optimistic chatterbox Eva Lovelace is a would-be actress trying to crash the New York stage. She attracts the interest of a paternal actor, a philandering producer, and an earnest playwright. Is she destined for stardom, or will she fade like a morning glory after its brief blooming?','/jp92gr0EWgYQxoGcY5GQaV3kmax.jpg','1933-08-18',74,'Released','A drama fired with Hepburn\'s blazing genius!','Morning Glory',31777,1.8283,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(984,_binary '\0','/akb5CDFDtGRBmpl0qNcEKzX9VaS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024360',6.4,2109,'en','Murders in the Zoo','Dr. Gorman is a millionaire adventurer, traveling the world in search of dangerous game. His bored, beautiful, much younger wife entertains herself in the arms of other men. In turn, Gorman uses his animals to kill these men. When a New York City zoo suggests a fundraising gala, Gorman sees a prime opportunity to dispatch the dashing Roger and anyone else who might cross him.','/8GL0POYXHakLfgWSi0iwehLdhcY.jpg','1933-03-31',62,'Released','HE KILLED FOR LOVE...AND LOVED TO KILL!','Murders in the Zoo',39311,2.081,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(985,_binary '\0','/1wINMy8ApHpx9RcF4ClRwzahKKu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024368',6.8,7705,'en','Mystery of the Wax Museum','A wax sculptor opens a new museum years after he is severely injured during a fire that destroyed his original collection. The disappearance of both people and corpses coincides with this grand reopening and leads a reporter to start investigating.','/rs4FJ6F5gY0wDqNGzGqV5OU7VzS.jpg','1933-02-18',78,'Released','The supreme thriller!','Mystery of the Wax Museum',32652,3.389,6.481,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(986,_binary '\0','/3yAckThEiCiMa1E5fVaUgRjpQeX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024402',7.1,1227,'ru','Окраина','In a remote Russian village during World War I, colourful and nuanced characters experience divided loyalties: family loyalty vs. personal desire, nationalism vs. transcendent humanism.','/Aezrd4wZ2LauHhExEwKMTBIy1Fe.jpg','1933-03-25',91,'Released',NULL,'Outskirts',94638,0.9907,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(987,_binary '\0','/ijnSSzDgGjI1qDj3yXRAVok9DvC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024426',6.4,1433,'en','Parachute Jumper','An Air Force washout and his buddy room with a pretty young lady. Desperate for jobs during the Depression, they finally land employment with the mob.','/lH3kQo4Q6O6OoIVVcPkmxgOMkpd.jpg','1933-01-28',72,'Released','Seventy-five Smackers a Jump- and Most of it Goes to Widows!','Parachute Jumper',160466,1.2999,5.955,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(988,_binary '\0','/om1upwfu2twyizfn4CbsrwP6qSi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024433',6.5,1615,'en','Peg o\' My Heart','Peg and her father live a simple life in an Irish fishing village. One day Sir Gerald arrives at the village to tell Pat that Peg is heir to estate of her grandfather, who hated Pat. The upshot of the will is that she must go to England for 3 years to learn to be a lady and that Pat can never see her again.','/alvPkrbQ7LX2jrapEwpY76LTUS6.jpg','1933-05-26',87,'Released','She\'ll go straight to your heart with her laughs, her tears, her songs. Sad moments, glad moments, they\'re all here in the story of the immortal Peg that has won the heart of the world.','Peg o\' My Heart',162862,1.7631,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(989,_binary '\0','/yd20fbSkoddiGSEsfCxonXRnok8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024435',6.8,1503,'en','Penthouse','Gertie Waxted knows how notorious gangster Jim Crelliman runs his rackets, because she\'s long been under the hoodlum\'s thumb. She\'s secretly helping lawyer Jackson Durant in a snoop job aimed at pinning a murder on the thug. Her life will be in peril when that secret gets out.','/mUJCt9wBvsspffPacWFo66F8VoM.jpg','1933-09-08',88,'Released','A strange romance in a penthouse- a sky high love-nest! A girl from nowhere bringing drama that screamed from the headlines!','Penthouse',34977,1.5224,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(990,_binary '\0','/fXXSB942LsmNqqtsx0pEl2lmxfT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024450',7,2067,'en','Picture Snatcher','An ex-con uses his street smarts to become a successful photojournalist.','/2V2AwXXjc44S56dVmN272hgnEkt.jpg','1933-05-06',77,'Released','His camera takes \'em from love nests to Page One before they can bat an eye---or put on a negligee!','Picture Snatcher',49064,2.096,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(991,_binary '\0','/6VJrTfrcFaUvyP4Dw5kKbuh9rKO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024471',6.7,1324,'en','Private Detective 62','A former government agent in France, who has failed at an assignment and been disavowed, is deported back to the USA, where he can only find work at a low-rent detective agency. He soon gets involved with a woman with ties to a crooked gambling club owner, who is a client of his agency.','/7nTQPjyY6xsAQcbsSjS13ncBAmD.jpg','1933-06-10',66,'Released','It\'s a pleasure to have your home wrecked by a man like him.','Private Detective 62',39494,1.2874,6.2,'i4f7G4bx1p4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(992,_binary '\0','/lc7li4hwGpKcQ6bSE64BzCIsuVn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024473',7,5519,'en','The Private Life of Henry VIII','Renowned for his excess, King Henry VIII goes through a series of wives during his rule. With Anne Boleyn, his second betrothed, executed on charges of treason, Henry weds maid Jane Seymour, but that wedded bliss also ends in tragedy. Not one to be single for long, the tyrannical king chooses German-born Anne of Cleves, but their union lasts only months before an annulment is granted, and so Henry\'s reign of spousal terror continues.','/ncQC8U3gGFhCTWlxxn32nkFr2d4.jpg','1933-08-17',97,'Released','HE GAVE HIS WIVES A PAIN IN THE NECK, And did his necking with an axe. Henry, the Eighth Wonder of the World! And this picture...the wonder of all time!','The Private Life of Henry VIII',43122,2.4286,6.424,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(993,_binary '\0','/e6YpCECKNPMBonp425jmHgd6D44.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024481',7.5,9412,'en','Queen Christina','Popular monarch Queen Christina of Sweden must choose between love and loyalty to her nation when she unexpectedly falls for a Spanish envoy.','/lGGYwoBp21CzF7cMzNPcOr6i6iw.jpg','1934-02-09',99,'Released','Triumphant Return To The Screen!','Queen Christina',31526,3.0066,6.912,'icS3e2IFxBk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(994,_binary '\0','/qZoRQ0J083NQSadNNekZb7H1eiy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024500',5.4,1359,'en','Riders of Destiny','James Kincaid controls the local water supply and plans to do away with the other ranchers. Government agent Sandy Saunders arrives undercover to investigate Kincaid\'s land swindle scheme, and win the heart of one of his victims, Fay Denton.','/aZCgQuRhDpWjjJgVYTDxWwcJ08i.jpg','1933-10-10',55,'Released','A Great Western Star in a WHIRLWIND of ACTION!','Riders of Destiny',23391,1.5388,5.3,'_1Hj6p-Dfi8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(995,_binary '\0','/3lSWJv9CW8FWC4XL1LHgdlrcjqM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024516',5.4,1544,'en','Sagebrush Trail','Imprisoned for a murder he did not commit, John Brant escapes and ends up out west where, after giving the local lawmen the slip, he joins up with an outlaw gang. Brant finds out that \'Jones\', one of the outlaws he has become friends with, committed the murder that Brant was sent up for, but has no knowledge that anyone was ever put in jail for his crime. Willing to forgive and forget, Brant doesn\'t realize that \'Jones\' has not only fallen for the same pretty shopgirl Brant has, but begins to suspect that Brant is not truly an outlaw.','/pCJlvS7o6wJ6Xn8qZ5GkVJWpRMc.jpg','1933-12-15',54,'Released','Romance rides in a drama of thundering hoofs and blazing guns!','Sagebrush Trail',23590,2.1682,5.3,'ZzY7Lg3yrJ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(996,_binary '\0','/kNej6oLVz4awvQlGIsww5RmkLDX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024538',6.4,1388,'en','Secret of the Blue Room','According to a legend, the mansion\'s \"blue room\" is cursed -- everyone who has ever spent the night in that room has met with an untimely end. The three suitors of the heroine wager that each can survive a night in the forbidding blue room.','/y2DEVVE9ZHn9kvaWlgngiLx98Wa.jpg','1933-07-20',66,'Released','Shocks! Shivers! Sensation! Surprises! Creeping shadows, clutching hands, a blue death-chamber and a houseful of bewildered men defying the supernatural for the sake of a beautiful girl!...','Secret of the Blue Room',118570,1.8152,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(997,_binary '\0','/mzSpJ0ne8YiGLYd3UIssneTV9mJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024548',6.3,7715,'en','She Done Him Wrong','New York singer and nightclub owner Lady Lou has more male friends than can be imagined. One is a vicious escaped criminal on the way to see \'his\' girl, unaware she hasn\'t exactly been faithful in his absence. Help is at hand in the form of young Captain Cummings, a local temperance league leader.','/kwxAUj8tf9kO2ESAriD8foYN28q.jpg','1933-02-09',65,'Released','Mae West gives a \'Hot Time\' to the nation!','She Done Him Wrong',43595,2.4745,5.866,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(998,_binary '\0','/o11eGDPUdxjJmnCTp6nkJp6k8vA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024554',5.3,1224,'en','A Shriek in the Night','Rival newspaper reporters Pat Morgan and Ted Rand find themselves unraveling the mystery behind the death of a millionaire philanthropist who fell from his penthouse balcony. When it is discovered that the plunge was not an accident, the building\'s residents come under suspicion. Soon, the body count begins to mount as three more murders occur by strangulation.','/mQzNjqtHJHVoG1M9UcINVKenC0Y.jpg','1933-07-22',66,'Released',NULL,'A Shriek in the Night',22689,1.4902,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(999,_binary '\0','/r8Ao60h2qk7R95QoTcV4ClyUfB0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024593',5.6,5865,'en','The Son of Kong','Beleaguered adventurer Carl Denham returns to the island where he found King Kong.','/eJ2Qe3tesoKUtWNJRDpHKz1xCJc.jpg','1933-12-22',70,'Released','SEE! The cannibals! The earthquake! The sea serpent! The fighting monsters of ages past!','The Son of Kong',43149,3.4654,5.4,'ZORAQa93iyQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(1000,_binary '\0','/aX476hnJ3qbDs6nwWgcUeBACGlL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000','tt0024601',7.5,10507,'en','Sons of the Desert','Ollie and Stan deceive their wives into thinking they are taking a medically necessary cruise when they are really going to a lodge convention.','/4ojrxP6qiyDOQ5jHQlh7Yn59wJt.jpg','1933-12-29',65,'Released','THEIR NEW FULL-LENGTH FEATURE PICTURE!','Sons of the Desert',43128,3.0312,7.072,'jXf_GgrLGAM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:02.000000'),(1001,_binary '\0','/ritIv2bm1QUNVhiPWhYga06JFTp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0024610',6.6,1343,'en','State Fair','The children of Iowa farmers find love, with mixed results, at the state fair.','/tx3h4QTmPlrdgvFBBDtKzqm4gif.jpg','1933-02-10',97,'Released','A \"demand\" showing of the unforgettable film that brought Will Rogers his greatest fame!','State Fair',52517,1.2965,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1002,_binary '\0','/5PJElxfrmvpBsrjKlTMrcDuLk9L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0024617',7.1,2269,'en','The Story of Temple Drake','The coquettish granddaughter of a respected small-town judge is stranded at a bootleggers’ hide-out, subjected to an act of nightmarish sexual violence, and plunged into a criminal underworld that threatens to swallow her up completely.','/hOuRZF5KemHS5LPkdGO3HnjsSv1.jpg','1933-05-06',71,'Released','I CAN NEVER FACE THE WORLD AGAIN!','The Story of Temple Drake',27986,2.4026,6.512,'yi-FtTE2Cx0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1003,_binary '\0','/lUYXA4pr3VrOxcfMhrZzhjbYmmA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0024625',5.6,1389,'en','A Study in Scarlet','In London, a secret society led by lawyer Thaddeus Merrydew collects the assets of any of its deceased members and divides them among the remaining members. Society members start dropping like flies. Sherlock Holmes is approached by member James Murphy\'s widow, who is miffed at being left penniless by her husband. When Captain Pyke is shot, Holmes keys in on his mysterious Chinese widow as well as the shady Merrydew. Other members keep dying: Malcom Dearing first, then Mr. Baker. There is also an attempt on the life of young Eileen Forrester, who became a reluctant society member upon the death of her father. Holmes\' uncanny observations and insights are put to the test.','/c0IdtTeMOXVty8Lp7aufagNJD22.jpg','1933-05-14',72,'Released',NULL,'A Study in Scarlet',38585,1.5069,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1004,_binary '\0','/kDnIMnIDXhi1V8JoKHzxkbaR0su.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0024675',5.9,1577,'en','Today We Live','Two lovers are living together and are not married; they had made a promise as children to get married when they grew up, but they \"didn\'t wait.\"','/ecKQuSqPbPiKihaTradMU2SpTzM.jpg','1933-03-03',113,'Released','Without regret or remorse..with pride in the sacrifice of self..she burned up her youth..for them..living dangerously..Regardless of Tomorrow.','Today We Live',103938,1.2119,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1005,_binary '\0','/ddtQrSe4AsMS2wq60ZbWfarmn9K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0024727',5.8,3436,'en','The Vampire Bat','A German village is stricken by a series of murders that appear to be the work of vampires.','/bGN3Ik3CatDC9wvfV55LLBrBGh8.jpg','1933-01-21',64,'Released','These are the TALONS of The Vampire Bat','The Vampire Bat',43148,1.5552,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1006,_binary '\0','/9nB3Z5jq5R11j8MiKFELQAP7qMC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0024747',5.7,1975,'en','Waltzes from Vienna','In Vienna, aspiring composer Johann Strauss Jr. clashes with his domineering father, who wants him to abandon music for a steady job in a bakery. Torn between his love for the baker’s daughter, Resi, and the encouragement of a wealthy countess, Strauss finds inspiration that leads to the creation of \"The Blue Danube.\"','/34AL66MN44fJKiFjaHNPdqftqsY.jpg','1934-03-15',81,'Released',NULL,'Waltzes from Vienna',52907,1.5656,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1007,_binary '\0','/qUkyy4Eprqrohd9Wi4M5OY9S4Jj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0024763',6.8,1324,'en','When Ladies Meet','Mary, a writer working on a novel about a love triangle, is attracted to her publisher. Her suitor Jimmy is determined to break them up; he introduces Mary to the publisher\'s wife without telling Mary who she is.','/6GGK7UGIT1mG8wbGiDouhG9joaO.jpg','1933-06-23',85,'Released','WIFE MEET MISTRESS! and HOW THESE LADIES TALK! A picture for suspicious wives---Misunderstood Husbands and Sweethearts!','When Ladies Meet',175035,1.4577,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1008,_binary '\0','/2QNS5eIO1fVRuiUryHutWu7BEqZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0024772',7.5,2689,'en','Wild Boys of the Road','At the height of the Great Depression, Tommy\'s mother has been out of work for months when Eddie\'s father loses his job. Eager not to burden their parents, the two high school sophomores decide to hop the freight trains and look for work.','/c1nq13h6Q7C90LTnxFIV5XaI7VQ.jpg','1933-10-07',68,'Released','Girls living like boys! Boys living like savages!','Wild Boys of the Road',50073,1.9831,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1009,_binary '\0','/vPb127UmFQkdZQt0HIZbDl1lzHY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0024785',7.2,1470,'en','The Working Man','A successful shoe manufacturer named John Reeves goes on vacation and meets the grown children of his recently deceased and much-respected competitor; they\'re on the verge of losing the family legacy through their careless behavior. Reeves takes it upon himself to save his rival\'s company by teaching the heirs a lesson in business.','/fo5jreTOPlj0KKRG4PEdh7WZqVQ.jpg','1933-04-20',78,'Released',NULL,'The Working Man',95321,1.2134,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1010,_binary '\0','/9pB6CO85B6vwwgZtBKkvyISd3Lq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0024803',7.2,10139,'fr','Zéro de conduite : Jeunes diables au collège','In a repressive boarding school with rigid rules of behavior, four boys decide to rebel against the director on a celebration day.','/oQcGB9BGj9LPTWcEdij47McotKY.jpg','1933-04-07',48,'Released',NULL,'Zero for Conduct',44494,1.9143,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1011,_binary '\0','/kuqLBeJK2zpp9qLcWmR3BTHvziP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0024805',5.1,1276,'en','\'Neath the Arizona Skies','Chris Morrell, the guardian of half-Indian girl Nina, is helping her find her missing white father. so she can cash in on her late mother\'s oil lease. Outlaw Sam Black is after the girl and her father as well. Besides dealing with the Black gang, Morrell has to find another robber, Jim Moore, who switches clothes with him after he finds Chris unconscious from a fight with Sam Black. Along the way, he meets a lady who\'s the sister of Jim Moore, another bad hombre who\'s in cahoots with Jim Moore, and an old friend who takes in Nina and helps Chris locate Nina\'s father and fight off the various desperadoes','/cCVaInxUvRDeCo2u3NCdHtPfvae.jpg','1934-12-05',52,'Released','Hair-trigger Action! Hair-Trigger Action!','\'Neath the Arizona Skies',53830,1.877,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1012,_binary '\0','/eHjuitb1xGKpDiiSHmnrUuUDV1E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0024831',7,1576,'en','Anne of Green Gables','Anne Shirley, an orphan, is fostered by farmer Matthew Cuthbert and his sister Marilla, who were expecting a boy to be sent them to help with their farm work. They accept Anne, who quickly endears herself to them and to the local villagers.','/xkXXyY8rqToMwCkGndUk9I3GAl8.jpg','1934-11-23',78,'Released','A PICTURE MADE FOR THE MILLIONS WHO LOVED \"LITTLE WOMEN\"','Anne of Green Gables',43901,1.8489,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1013,_binary '\0','/dFbCil5MUoRX2s4u2XcK7knJpT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0024844',7.7,18825,'fr','L\'Atalante','Newly married couple Juliette and ship captain Jean struggle through marriage as they travel on the L\'Atalante along with the captain\'s first mate and a cabin boy.','/yDTHSZGk1G33Q3nBNqhnpgmkyk7.jpg','1934-04-24',88,'Released',NULL,'L\'Atalante',43904,2.5443,7.477,'hq024oIC25I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1014,_binary '\0','/ba8MIR0o5xp2Vs442Pq1RLA4AYP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0024852',7.1,8327,'en','Babes in Toyland','Ollie Dee and Stannie Dum try to borrow money from their employer, the toymaker, to pay off the mortgage on Mother Peep\'s shoe and keep it and Little Bo Peep from the clutches of the evil Barnaby. When that fails, they trick Barnaby, enraging him.','/iN8B54ymwiLJmnbz5iluqbsit1e.jpg','1934-12-14',78,'Released','1½ hours of hilarious laughter!','Babes in Toyland',25898,2.9973,6.3,'EklOlx9POlo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1015,_binary '\0','/lLmI59EA1gYKuOLVIHt1n7N0CnN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0024865',6.9,2439,'en','The Barretts of Wimpole Street','Remarkable poet Elizabeth Barrett is slowly recovering from a crippling illness with the help of her siblings, especially her youngest sister, Henrietta, but feels stifled by the domestic tyranny of her wealthy widowed father. When she meets fellow poet Robert Browning in a romantic first encounter, her heart belongs to him. However, her controlling father has no intention of allowing her out of his sight.','/c8BfdxxwmABRATDnMVJNmW2sLhG.jpg','1934-09-21',109,'Released','When poets love, Heaven and Earth fall back to watch!','The Barretts of Wimpole Street',43693,2.037,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1016,_binary '\0','/5cFcktsYXCXg2DTRc3MkCmHD04r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0024890',6.2,1231,'en','The Big Shakedown','Former bootlegger Dutch Barnes pressures neighborhood druggist Jimmy Morrell into making cut-rate knockoff toiletry, cosmetic, and pharmaceutical products.','/wIlHx7FRCpAxwOTI76aPZluMqzx.jpg','1934-01-06',61,'Released','A New Type of Racket Exposed! In This Thrilling Underworld Drama','The Big Shakedown',79052,1.4598,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1017,_binary '\0','/ww1gZ8vVCjmtyO2zkhcsRB7v6Tf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0024894',6.9,14592,'en','The Black Cat','After a road accident in Hungary, the American honeymooners Joan and Peter and the enigmatic Dr. Werdegast find refuge in the house of the famed architect Hjalmar Poelzig, who shares a dark past with the doctor.','/QTH3dkeDGTBRBmsY0A7STpsNN4.jpg','1934-05-07',65,'Released','Things you never said before nor even dreamed of!','The Black Cat',24106,3.0507,6.726,'qpdP7zliaeA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1018,_binary '\0','/czVoG6F48raC12spvSuCn8Qavb3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0024902',5.3,1932,'en','Blue Steel','When Sheriff Jake sees a man at the safe and then finds the payroll gone, he trails him. Just as he is about to arrest him, the man saves his life. Still suspicious, he joins up with the man and later they learn that Melgrove, the towns leading citizen, is trying to take over the area\'s ranches by having his gang stop all incoming supply wagons. With the ranchers about to sell to Melgrove, the two newcomers say they will bring in provisions.','/s5Ar8WGmCQlHbbrzRmUrUCqIWoy.jpg','1934-05-10',54,'Released','He turned man-hunter to run down a gang of thieving scoundrels!','Blue Steel',53828,1.5665,4.8,'3H-gjSkVJ6Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1019,_binary '\0','/jSR7pVfVbEg5n3VqSiddDNgNVEd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0024906',6.1,1375,'en','Born to Be Bad','Letty, a young woman who ended up pregnant, unmarried and on the streets at fifteen is bitter and determined that her child will not grow up to be taken advantage of. Letty teaches her child to lie, steal, cheat and anything else he\'ll need to be street smart.','/WGsz8Zy0GPIUI6yWP7AltPLLZF.jpg','1934-05-18',62,'Released','Rules of the game meant nothing to her...she was \"born to be bad\" ..and she knew it!','Born to Be Bad',81111,1.5877,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1020,_binary '\0','/aYhALsIVWyhO6YBYjazwtubMEiU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0024914',7.2,2752,'en','Bright Eyes','An orphaned girl is taken in by a snobbish family at the insistence of their rich, crotchety uncle, even as her devoted aviator godfather fights for custody.','/jEEtxWvQWB9OXUzocGCLqquZYVs.jpg','1934-12-28',85,'Released','YOU\'VE BEEN WANTING TO SEE HER IN A PICTURE LIKE THIS!','Bright Eyes',29887,2.0504,6.7,'AVm0_6Onf64','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1021,_binary '\0','/nMzwClZuT1cYtppGuwB8XTciNLB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0024916',6.6,1266,'en','Broadway Bill','Tycoon J.L. Higgins controls his whole family, but one of his sons-in-law, Dan Brooks, and his daughter Alice are fed up with that. Brooks quits his job as manager of J.L.\'s paper box factory and devotes his life to his racing horse Broadway Bill, but his bankroll is thin and the luck is against him. He is arrested because of $150 he owes somebody for horse food, but suddenly a planned fraud by somebody else seems to offer him a chance...','/dDWQjYnnxNTsU99mpjr4CRPOry7.jpg','1934-11-30',104,'Released','The Comedy Successor to \'It Happened One Night\'','Broadway Bill',77198,1.7141,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1022,_binary '\0','/qytu013HQUfsDDaOry3e5asBVx7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0024961',6.7,1481,'en','The Cat\'s-Paw','Naive Ezekial Cobb, brought up by his missionary father in China returns to America to seek a wife. Corrupt politicians enlist him to run for mayor as a dummy candidate with no chance of winning. Their plan backfires as he wins and embarks upon a reform crusade.','/qxrR4uZ1JpNQDS0FKYvuueYh3cn.jpg','1934-08-07',102,'Released','Everything new but these [eyeglasses]','The Cat\'s-Paw',41347,1.5824,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1023,_binary '\0','/z8PDdOaREzSDZOomcb2WqA8M7s8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0024963',6.3,1238,'en','Chained','Richard, a millionaire in love with his secretary, Diane, is dispirited when his wife refuses to divorce him. Concerned that Diane will now lose interest, Richard offers her an all-expense-paid cruise to Argentina so that she can think it over. While traveling, however, Diane falls in love with fellow traveler Mike. She resolves to come clean to Richard, but upon return she becomes conflicted when she finds out he was able to get divorced after all.','/lGvFPJGXfvQDLGlrh9lhef8Z2hR.jpg','1934-08-31',76,'Released','When she\'s in his arms, it\'s the grandest thrill the screen can give!','Chained',50079,1.4214,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1024,_binary '\0','/crxDhEA0JueH727df5JR7xOqiaL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0024966',7,1627,'ru','Чапаев','An account of the peasant turned mythical military hero Vasily Chapayev, charting his campaign in the Red Army during the Russian Civil War.','/va7mzdH8qu1qa5KYmWAczrTz5FA.jpg','1934-11-07',93,'Released',NULL,'Chapayev',46774,1.4997,5.944,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1025,_binary '\0','/zOW2QQWmgTQCEzHlDKt13ODpgLP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0024968',6.9,2330,'en','Charlie Chan in London','Charlie Chan is sought out by Pamela Gray, a desperate young socialite whose brother Paul awaits execution for the murder of a weapons inventor. Pamela is convinced of his innocence.','/wfnnyrPbXxm3TQ7Eu3mkONZ18T8.jpg','1934-09-12',79,'Released','When all others failed, they turned to...','Charlie Chan in London',33391,1.8671,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1026,_binary '\0','/koFms0UoEqfXVXqo4BZzyRlWbrg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0024989',6.6,1313,'en','The Clairvoyant','A fake psychic suddenly turns into the real thing when he meets a young beauty. (TCM)','/mUEMk22Bc6ilB8Q93T6Bd6w94pL.jpg','1935-06-07',81,'Released','HEXED BY THE EVIL EYE','The Clairvoyant',43692,1.5381,6,'nhfT4noIhRA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1027,_binary '\0','/slpR2LO5bVf5I2QxtPPlSM8U6RO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0024991',6.8,5232,'en','Cleopatra','The queen of Egypt barges the Nile and flirts with Mark Antony and Julius Caesar.','/2JxuGqS1zLTy0lKUp0twIVPlk4B.jpg','1934-10-05',100,'Released','The love affair that shook the world!','Cleopatra',43902,2.4446,6.108,'Dhz00dsSrMk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1028,_binary '\0','/6nDGPhvBm5SGqotqwueTL2SYSdK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025004',7.3,3887,'en','The Count of Monte Cristo','Young sailor Edmond Dantès is wrongfully imprisoned, escapes, finds treasure, and reinvents himself as the wealthy Count of Monte Cristo to exact revenge on those who betrayed him.','/gpfDds86hBynC48ZJdb6mmijgkk.jpg','1934-09-06',113,'Released','Romance Lives On ... In The Glory Of Dumas\' Immortal Novel !','The Count of Monte Cristo',43691,2.9028,6.766,'xXidVyvWHJ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1029,_binary '\0','/1RrT0DdlsxGcLTWYU9LnRWWxoDi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025028',7,2723,'en','Dames','A reformer\'s daughter wins the lead role in a scandalous Broadway show.','/uBRbAgn9FrC5RY48RiwMTl8QlbD.jpg','1934-09-01',91,'Released','A WORLD\'S FAIR OF BEAUTY, SONG - LAUGHTER!','Dames',43903,1.479,6.455,'vc7csAWH1Ro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1030,_binary '\0','/rXlqB55eKfa59bqkKrydbaTFAIV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025037',6.9,2696,'en','Death Takes a Holiday','After years of questioning why people fear him, Death takes on human form so he can mingle among the mortals and find an answer. However, events soon spiral out of control as he falls in love with the beautiful young Grazia, the only woman not afraid of him. As he falls in love with her, her father sees him for what he is and begs him to return to his duties. Death must decide whether or not to seek his own happiness or sacrifice it so that Grazia may live.','/becYmbZXZalAvxNC4JVpQSjvqtk.jpg','1934-03-30',79,'Released','No one can die – while he makes love!','Death Takes a Holiday',37215,1.9709,6.314,'T86G_Vs9XAA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1031,_binary '\0','/hKiKr4UukT2h9esnl8w1LfDRFGk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025091',6.9,2011,'en','Evelyn Prentice','A criminal lawyer\'s wife is blackmailed when she is falsely accused of infidelity.','/jJHsYlgbyAIUIr9d6qcPYHJAcuw.jpg','1934-11-09',79,'Released','Remember \"The Thin Man\"? Well, here they are together again!','Evelyn Prentice',53864,2.1367,6.5,'zOEVnpjPnLE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1032,_binary '\0','/gMOTx0MEORlkxHvZkpX7cJrNq3a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025101',6.6,2185,'en','Fashions of 1934','When the Manhattan investment firm of Sherwood Nash goes broke, he joins forces with his partner Snap and fashion designer Lynn Mason to provide discount shops with cheap copies of Paris couture dresses.','/izDJEEPZDxhTV5LTyPSotNMyb3X.jpg','1934-02-14',78,'Released','A new style in entertainment! Entirely different...sumptuous...magnificent!','Fashions of 1934',53872,1.6718,6.6,'B3tDv33iQKA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1033,_binary '\0','/uR1HXxTthaQqV8hssV1hkONEGu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025129',6.5,2008,'en','Fog Over Frisco','Valkyr Bradford takes the assistance of a society reporter and a journalist to investigate the disappearance of her half-sister Arlene, a wealthy socialite involved in criminal activities.','/q3MO3qDLIlq4F01Y8p61V0sOywi.jpg','1934-06-02',68,'Released','Secret pages torn from the life story of a lawless girl!','Fog Over Frisco',50675,1.2788,6.4,'Wxvab0WPK1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1034,_binary '\0','/uLVbI1FDyvEG8B6SffrOHtjfT1h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025132',6.4,1740,'en','Forsaking All Others','A socialite only realises that her friend is in love with her when she falls for the wrong man.','/jPt57JYNjSqKHQPMMRtVal8B2AU.jpg','1934-12-23',84,'Released','STAR-STUDDED GLORY! It\'s Gay! It\'s Thrilling!','Forsaking All Others',150249,1.8273,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1035,_binary '\0','/sxhK5soWUxOdi5tn0m4ocqBt8L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025161',6.5,1321,'en','Gambling Lady','A businesslike syndicate runs all the gambling joints in town; least profitable is honest Mike Lee\'s. Under pressure to allow cheating, Mike \"walks out,\" leaving tough-minded daughter Lady Lee to earn a living the only way she knows. She soon becomes a success gambling among the rich, but, falling out with the syndicate, she considers the marriage proposal of blueblood Garry Madison. Can such a match work despite snobbery and old associations?','/hNTfxLvnpLAqfU42GJXXBpCMu1d.jpg','1934-03-08',66,'Released','SHE WAITED FIVE YEARS FOR THIS ROLE!','Gambling Lady',152986,1.5043,6.2,'qihm9z_11n0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1036,_binary '\0','/h5FknBwnx6fRaiCkHv4idjw6stu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025164',7.3,9431,'en','The Gay Divorcee','Seeking a divorce from her absentee husband, Mimi Glossop travels to an English seaside resort. There she falls in love with dancer Guy Holden, whom she later mistakes for the corespondent her lawyer hired.','/xD6oUOAa0Q6PppaOnY6dy6sWPLG.jpg','1934-10-12',105,'Released','The King and Queen of \'Carioca\'','The Gay Divorcee',28288,2.9593,6.9,'g2y-2pjq4Bk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1037,_binary '\0','/6Pstz00pEbHKLsG6huR3uvfaE8l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025173',6.6,1579,'en','The Girl from Missouri','Leaving Missouri to find a wealthy husband in New York City, Eadie Chapman becomes a chorus girl and soon entertains at the lavish home of millionaire Frank Cousins. Cousins proposes to Eadie, only to then commit suicide due to bankruptcy. Fellow millionaire T. R. Paige defends Eadie when the police question her for having Cousins\' jewelry -- but when she becomes enamored with his son, Tom, Paige declares Eadie a gold digger.','/kXYWwXcABj84FGhGp11gST4Pvxi.jpg','1934-08-03',73,'Released','The story of a platinum blonde who wouldn\'t go off the gold standard!','The Girl from Missouri',121003,1.5577,7.438,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1038,_binary '\0','/6QSqbf8pTcHtGTZJy2m1ROTmUoH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025228',7.1,1508,'en','Heat Lightning','Olga runs an isolated gas station and restaurant in the stifling hot American desert with her discontented younger sister Myra. When two escaped criminals stop for a bite to eat, Olga is reminded of the past she left behind.','/x1EKoIv0q9fdVymPW04foZURkUE.jpg','1934-03-01',63,'Released','\"I just killed a rat!\"','Heat Lightning',87123,1.0204,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1039,_binary '\0','/6Ag72HFOs0TusUiPeohCpg4b5JH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025238',6.2,1386,'en','Here Comes the Navy','A cocky guy joins the Navy for the wrong reason but finds romance and twice is cited for heroism.','/q4ZhIQJUGVXcUgnZm06fNswkhC9.jpg','1934-07-21',87,'Released','James CAGNEY - Pat O\'BRIEN And The Whole U. S. FLEET!','Here Comes the Navy',84099,1.6692,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1040,_binary '\0','/uIkXyOqSoIXggEXAgIWESmSZEJ4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025272',6.4,1609,'en','The House of Rothschild','The story of the rise of the Rothschild financial empire founded by Mayer Rothschild and continued by his five sons. From humble beginnings the business grows and helps to finance the war against Napoleon, but it\'s not always easy, especially because of the prejudices against Jews.','/emqmRhpoMpN565Djn4yps3GnZal.jpg','1934-04-07',88,'Released','He Broke the Sword of Napoleon with a Stroke of His Pen','The House of Rothschild',57035,2.2428,6.2,'qbIKFJw1fQQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1041,_binary '\0','/i480RHtAZZiaJdUYxRBHXY5llmi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025273',6.1,1281,'en','Housewife','Nan Reynolds encourages her copywriter husband Bill to open his own advertising agency and helps him land his first client. Bill\'s former girlfriend Patricia Berkeley writes a very successful commercial for the client and heats up their old romance. Wife and girlfriend struggle over Bill.','/6vm8bDG8wr8adyG5V0pWFWm826G.jpg','1934-08-11',69,'Released','THE BATTLE\'S ON! Modern Bachelor Girl Versus Modern Wife!','Housewife',173267,2.0509,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1042,_binary '\0','/stIYs3ak8LCxRCM1IF2DnzEx1ku.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025301',7.5,6262,'en','Imitation of Life','A struggling widow and her daughter take in a black housekeeper and her fair-skinned daughter. The two women start a successful business but face familial, identity, and racial issues along the way.','/nA8pXV1C2WDJrGQWHwqNUW6RG5i.jpg','1934-11-23',111,'Released','THE DARING STORY OF MOTHER LOVE - On the Screen for the First Time!','Imitation of Life',47921,2.3563,7,'GVMFYDBxZr4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1043,_binary '\0','/hmiC0MsI0PDd1TJXC62xyw0tX0s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025316',8.1,120588,'en','It Happened One Night','A runaway heiress makes a deal with the rogue reporter trailing her but the mismatched pair end up stuck with each other when their bus leaves them behind.','/2PNUGWAflH6UUumas0POMmokHlc.jpg','1934-02-22',105,'Released','An unforgettable entertainment...the outstanding performance of two outstanding careers!','It Happened One Night',3078,6.1709,7.8,'FUAxNS_31So','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1044,_binary '\0','/1NIYYTBeSBiZFJXEl7R0dRsJEVD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025318',7,6139,'en','It\'s a Gift','After he inherits some money, Harold Bissonette (\"pronounced bis-on-ay\") decides to give up the grocery business, move to California and run an orange grove. Despite his family\'s objections and the news that the land he bought is worthless, Bissonette packs up and drives out to California with his nagging wife Amelia and children.','/3DlYiSh3S7A9GO15gUu7zg92bD0.jpg','1934-11-30',68,'Released','LOOK THIS GIFT IN THE FACE IF YOU WANT A BIG HORSE-LAUGH','It\'s a Gift',28001,2.0746,6.347,'tlWmHy1knOc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1045,_binary '\0','/u6wtiUvaAHBxr8x7RItprFlN593.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025330',6.6,2243,'en','Jimmy the Gent','An unpolished racketeer, whose racket is finding heirs for unclaimed fortunes, affects ethics and tea-drinking manners to win back the sweetheart who now works for his seemingly upright competitor.','/fZuLSS7X5j5SddIwQzp9cJbpK5Y.jpg','1934-03-09',67,'Released','He\'s the BIGGEST CHISELER since MICHAELANGELO! Ali Baba and the Forty Thieves Were PIKERS compared to this RED-HAIRED SON-OF-A-GUN!','Jimmy the Gent',81396,2.0874,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1046,_binary '\0','/2OhwfIKb0zvt5JGgmc24tATyE2J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025335',6.2,2817,'en','Judge Priest','Judge Priest, a proud Confederate veteran, restores the justice in a small town in the Post-Bellum Kentucky using his common sense and his great sense of humanity.','/vo7jPkmVR4M0rlw4wwM31bUopyK.jpg','1934-09-15',80,'Released','Enough laughs to make your head spin!','Judge Priest',23024,1.5105,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1047,_binary '\0','/af0aNcgwRVsHp3AUTvofr7JMRAq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025373',5.1,1244,'en','The Lawless Frontier','Tobin is after the bandit Zanti who killed his parents. He finds him just as Zanti is about to kill Dusty and kidnap Ruby. Saving the two, he goes after Zanti. He catches him but Zanti escapes the Sheriff\'s handcuff\'s and this time Tobin has to chase him into the desert.','/9Vcv5AXFwUo931w7Ip0H32fIOAo.jpg','1934-11-22',59,'Released','Pounding Hoofs and Blazing Guns!','The Lawless Frontier',49640,1.4035,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1048,_binary '\0','/2DuNtK9MZmUSRasIzTRbj0tUQzp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025397',6.8,1349,'fr','Liliom','Two women love the same man in a world of few prospects. In Budapest, Liliom is a \"public figure,\" a rascal who\'s a carousel barker, loved by the experienced merry-go-round owner and by a young, innocent maid. The maid, Julie, loses her job after going out with Liliom; he\'s fired by his jealous employer for going out with Julie. The two lovers move in with Julie\'s aunt; unemployment emasculates him and a local weasel tempts him with crime. Julie, now wan, is true to Liliom even in his bad temper. Meanwhile, a stolid widower, a carpenter, wants to marry Julie. Is there any future on this earth for Julie and Liliom, whose love is passionate rather than ideal?','/3vobL7LPk198YHXjkBnO6GeM7cj.jpg','1934-05-15',118,'Released',NULL,'Liliom',63702,0.9677,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1049,_binary '\0','/yWLMR2dZMMQLrPgkJaankQZJXNK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025410',6.9,1632,'en','Little Miss Marker','Big Steve Halloway, gambler and proprietor of New York\'s Horseshoe Cabaret, is in desperate need of money. He arranges for his fellow bookies, especially Sorrowful Jones, to each pay him $1,000 for his racehorse, Dream Prince, to lose. With all bets being placed at the window, Sorrowful encounters a gambler, having lost $500, wanting to place his bet but unable to come up with $20. Instead, he places his little girl, Marthy Jane, as security, or in bookie\'s terms a \"marker\". \"Marky\", as she comes to be known, winds up under the care of Sorrowful Jones and his lady friend, singer Bangles Carson.','/eLt4sYP6fJLkac7ETgy9lL5Kl6J.jpg','1934-06-01',79,'Released',NULL,'Little Miss Marker',43150,1.4744,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1050,_binary '\0','/rt4wkaBe0YEvLMBBp7scJMtEoAP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025423',6.8,4025,'en','The Lost Patrol','A World War I British Army patrol is crossing the Mesopotamian desert when their commanding officer, the only one who knows their destination, is killed by the bullet of unseen bandits. The patrol\'s sergeant keeps them heading north on the assumption that they will hit their brigade. They stop for the night at an oasis and awaken the next morning to find their horses stolen, their sentry dead, the oasis surrounded and survival difficult.','/7zwui44GZmgEq1bLZ7uBfjZ5MLX.jpg','1934-02-16',73,'Released','Blistering sun... blazing bullets!','The Lost Patrol',46910,2.9289,6.554,'M3VWneQUD28','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1051,_binary '\0','/mwD9VCOqMkw6zDbfmX3YXZT4Fi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025440',5.6,1548,'en','The Lucky Texan','Jerry Mason, a young Texan, and Jake Benson, an old rancher, become partners and strike it rich with a gold mine. They then find their lives complicated by bad guys and a woman.','/xwf4n8tinAlU07WQd99xdrsbB9f.jpg','1934-01-22',54,'Released','Action all the way, a hundred thrills in a fight for GOLD and a GIRL!','The Lucky Texan',22612,1.382,5,'BnMt4CYiceA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1052,_binary '\0','/o9QuotgupLq34zYyzFrfd4TrimC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025452',6.7,23827,'en','The Man Who Knew Too Much','While vacationing in St. Moritz, a British couple receive a clue to an imminent assassination attempt, only to learn that their daughter has been kidnapped to keep them quiet.','/qghwbSfQblFYRFq675uK5qDGr3w.jpg','1934-12-09',76,'Released','Knowledge can be a deadly thing.','The Man Who Knew Too Much',8208,3.724,6.495,'hxrGvtF-SjE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1053,_binary '\0','/emC6XBaJAD54qnWOxjXXhyKrTPc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025455',5.2,1393,'en','The Man from Utah','The Marshal sends John Weston to a rodeo to see if he can find out who is killing the rodeo riders who are about to win the prize money. Barton has organized the rodeo and plans to leave with all the prize money put up by the townspeople. When it appears that Weston will beat Barton\'s rider, he has his men prepare the same fate for him that befell the other riders.','/7aP8xAUCwVakayNApyXBNZ9dPiv.jpg','1934-05-15',51,'Released','Framed by a gang of murdering thieves!','The Man from Utah',53622,2.0354,4.8,'4Sw6KZVLC7E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1054,_binary '\0','/xcVYow0RZZv4KCHLk32r7vuR5Xm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025456',7.1,2548,'en','Man of Aran','A documentary on the life of the people of the Aran Islands, who were believed to contain the essence of the ancient Irish life, represented by a pure uncorrupted peasant existence centred around the struggle between man and his hostile but magnificent surroundings. A blend of documentary and fictional narrative, the film captures the everyday trials of life on Ireland\'s unforgiving Aran Islands.','/A67tl48MWZM8bxEYxJZhFGGth9A.jpg','1934-05-06',76,'Released',NULL,'Man of Aran',47684,1.295,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1055,_binary '\0','/tnxDZJh6zkfPPKUCrzfSpCDLlEz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025461',6.6,1309,'en','Mandalay','Abandoned by her lover, a woman becomes the main \"hostess\" in a decadent nightclub, but tries to put her past behind her on a steamer to Mandalay.','/bKUlxknCrMUOeRPL1GTvIqeOtjB.jpg','1934-02-10',65,'Released','THE STORY OF A WOMAN WHO SWORE TO LIVE HER FUTURE SO MADLY SHE WOULD FORGET THE MADNESS OF HER PAST!','Mandalay',178341,1.2797,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1056,_binary '\0','/eIMOU6rAceFLx37oeJn3Tqh5R2e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025464',7.1,5374,'en','Manhattan Melodrama','The friendship between two orphans endures even though they grow up on opposite sides of the law and fall in love with the same woman.','/gAuBeXANJ0NhlQY7kmas63dFMz7.jpg','1934-05-04',93,'Released','RECKLESS with WOMEN...He pursued them ...\"petted\" them...promised them nothing and got away with everything!','Manhattan Melodrama',28564,2.2731,7,'sQMu92i81ow','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1057,_binary '\0','/n8v5jpScRqkkmOEA93Y5RVBgwBf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025465',3.7,2911,'en','Maniac','An ex-vaudeville actor is working as the assistant to a doctor who has Frankenstein aspirations. The ex-vaudeville actor kills the doctor and decides to assume the identity of the dead physician.','/akRVscTstKGKk8ebb0UGDdJ6q3z.jpg','1934-09-11',51,'Released','He menaced women with weird desires!','Maniac',23122,1.6492,4,'oWfAZxPySoc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1058,_binary '\0','/is7Xi9rxxJrXdqc3lNElRYvd86j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025480',6.1,1356,'fr','Mauvaise graine','A young man-about-Paris, cut off from his father\'s money, falls in with a picaresque gang of car thieves.','/j769cMamGAADYvOsFAehUK6iN6k.jpg','1934-07-05',77,'Released',NULL,'Bad Seed',82185,2.6097,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1059,_binary '\0','/gbTyjM4dHlvkVtQ0Z1STI5aJKOF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025493',7.1,3608,'en','The Merry Widow','A prince from a small kingdom courts a wealthy widow to keep her money in the country.','/yjrHjvP5PGxGLmba2Gu6SVPh59I.jpg','1934-11-02',99,'Released','Let Joy be Unconfined!','The Merry Widow',43689,2.3407,6.8,'qL8BRH2N0Mc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1060,_binary '\0','/3YMiMEWEDvKjIUN6T6Q4nReHmii.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025499',5.6,1449,'en','Midnight','Jury foreman Edward Weldon\'s questioning leads to the death sentence for Ethel Saxon. His daughter Stella claims to have killed her lover, the gangster Garboni, just as Saxon was to sit in the electric chair.','/8SRQPlAhyepVvf5V1andNVCVJke.jpg','1934-03-07',76,'Released','One woman was to die at midnight!...another woman was to kill at the same hour...why?','Midnight',42752,2.1321,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1061,_binary '\0','/6Ygj94zMarFNFSqfO3w0EjspMA6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025509',8.3,2270,'fr','Les Misérables','In 19th century France, Jean Valjean, a man imprisoned for stealing bread, must flee a relentless policeman named Javert. The pursuit consumes both men\'s lives, and soon Valjean finds himself in the midst of the student revolutions in France.','/d5jyRFTVKHFj2IphY5X9dfAHfWr.jpg','1934-02-09',281,'Released',NULL,'Les Misérables',67532,2.1784,7.882,'C_9W47mitjE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1062,_binary '\0','/5xahhiOHrLsV3s5ZR5XjiZyT03q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025580',6.5,1354,'en','Now and Forever','Freewheeling wanderer Jerry Day and his beautiful wife Toni are at odds over their lifestyle. Jerry can\'t accept responsibility, but Toni yearns for a family and a settled life. Then the Days \'rediscover\' Jerry\'s young daughter Pennie, who has been living with his rich deceased wife\'s family. Pennie appears to be just what Jerry needs to mend his swindling ways and lead a straight life. Then a corruptible influence enters his life.','/kbIsZSPNfXj0ujRQIVuR9ZrT6A1.jpg','1934-08-31',82,'Released',NULL,'Now and Forever',51277,1.0917,6.75,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1063,_binary '\0','/fbc8uZJ6snwCbOSNjbikBajGUx0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025586',7,9299,'en','Of Human Bondage','A young man finds himself attracted to a cold and unfeeling waitress who may ultimately destroy them both.','/cpGAPsHnCpifmLKeiLnwNgT157y.jpg','1934-07-20',83,'Released','The Love That Lifted a Man to Paradise......and Hurled Him Back to Earth Again','Of Human Bondage',43905,2.6561,6.5,'VE3sLaSTR0s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1064,_binary '\0','/5Hs4TexwPAmqvUKqiVCYLazNVCP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025590',7.3,1265,'en','The Old-Fashioned Way','The Great McGonigle and his troupe of third-rate vaudevillians manage to stay one step ahead of the bill collectors and the sheriff.','/9Fv5XXCR8W3JbG5tz4zMDwtYQKE.jpg','1934-07-13',71,'Released',NULL,'The Old-Fashioned Way',43688,1.3154,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1065,_binary '\0','/qIG3nO6RQTDTlKTxDp6FuPIinbB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025607',5.9,1577,'en','Operator 13','American Civil War, 1862. After the disaster of the Second Battle of Bull Run, Major Allen, chief of the Secret Service of the Union, asks actress Gail Loveless to become one of his operators and infiltrate enemy territory.','/n53ekxC0iWdo4Q1aEUXCPlE8b8t.jpg','1934-06-08',82,'Released','A TRICK OF FATE MADE THEM BOTH ENEMY AND LOVER.','Operator 13',111310,1.629,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1066,_binary '\0','/v21vRUTcv0nhbfUdKehTKI3Lspq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025610',7,2392,'en','Our Daily Bread','John and Mary Sims are city-dwellers hit hard by the financial fist of The Depression. Driven by bravery (and sheer desperation) they flee to the country and, with the help of other workers, set up a farming community - a socialist mini-society. The newborn community suffers many hardships - drought, vicious raccoons and the long arm of the law - but ultimately pull together to reach a bread-based Utopia.','/xbJ3osnuxaKckhhG7e6DFUF2I03.jpg','1934-10-02',80,'Released','We live! We love! We fight! We hate! What don\'t we do for - OUR DAILY BREAD','Our Daily Bread',126136,2.0337,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1067,_binary '\0','/a9SxeGdgIRuEgGD6uZqMjX8SE1T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025617',6.5,1888,'en','The Painted Veil','The wife of a doctor in China falls in love with a diplomat.','/tcgfyJFjSp1biQXZcWoGs2okxQz.jpg','1934-11-23',85,'Released','Do not pass love by...It may never come again!','The Painted Veil',82096,1.7794,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1068,_binary '\0','/mux6L0txdy6hSahKPp6UGrVa3In.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025699',5.3,1332,'en','Randy Rides Alone','Bandits lead by Matt the Mute enter a bar and kill multiple people. Randy Bowers comes to town and is framed by Matt the Mute, who is working with the sheriff (who doesn\'t know Matt is really a criminal). Randy escapes with the help of the niece of the dead owner of the bar. Bowers ends up running from the sheriff, and ends up in the cave in which the bandits have their hide-out…','/5zloNmFTlitQoPVgpHnQD4JmOxd.jpg','1934-06-05',53,'Released','Fearless--- He Rode the Danger Trail!','Randy Rides Alone',22602,1.7366,5.1,'JzFSGGEDCts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1069,_binary '\0','/lBBL4z89pTeQA9Vm7W8oKRj9Xtj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025740',6.9,2004,'en','Sadie McKee','A maid has romances with a two-timer, a boozing millionaire and the master of the house.','/sHuWPirdEdaEbIQ7zgFYI64oUbp.jpg','1934-05-09',93,'Released','She rose from calicos to silks, with men as the stepping stones!','Sadie McKee',43696,1.8767,6.96,'FOj3Y9VMqwU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1070,_binary '\0','/v1lSv9nNeuAC1rmc5pEdR8keUOJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025746',7.5,8023,'en','The Scarlet Empress','During the 18th century, German noblewoman Sophia Frederica, who would later become Catherine the Great, travels to Moscow to marry the dimwitted Grand Duke Peter, the heir to the Russian throne. Their arranged marriage proves to be loveless, and Catherine takes many lovers, including the handsome Count Alexei, and bears a son. When the unstable Peter eventually ascends to the throne, Catherine plots to oust him from power.','/lCoyv38br7T4hFPJF0OnfAGuzbp.jpg','1934-05-09',104,'Released','The Reigning Beauty of the Screen!','The Scarlet Empress',31527,2.7285,6.925,'gY9ZYy6PXV4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1071,_binary '\0','/8F4Idt57rHBbyV8UBXNBVA1ZlWh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025748',7.3,5296,'en','The Scarlet Pimpernel','18th century English aristocrat Sir Percy Blakeney leads a double life. He appears to be merely the effete aristocrat, but in reality is part of an underground effort to free French nobles from Robespierre\'s Reign of Terror.','/9sPfawJsdTnlmdNmPHrsOA9bx2I.jpg','1934-12-20',97,'Released','Match courage with courage... meet cunning with cunning!','The Scarlet Pimpernel',22614,2.4697,7,'ZP8qi_RxMRg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1072,_binary '\0','/kzrxckw8bAkmmsi7Bba1YSX8dit.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025830',5.1,1428,'en','The Star Packer','John Travers and Yak, his faithful Indian sidekick, pick up where a murdered sheriff leaves off, and try to nab the mysterious Shadow.','/logz5iQ5GO5NTN4VOLTiF6T2NlZ.jpg','1934-07-30',53,'Released','He fought for justice... and battled for love!','The Star Packer',38107,1.2969,4.5,'nf6UQhKP2K4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1073,_binary '\0','/neVii6I4Yc1d8VmfnCpu9bkc8PM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025862',7.2,6170,'en','Tarzan and His Mate','Harry Holt returns to Africa with his friend Martin Arlington to head up a large ivory expedition.','/cnLZv1qhaJtzqP8q9ofkSnjoAIn.jpg','1934-04-16',104,'Released','She traded civilization for the love of Tarzan... her mate!','Tarzan and His Mate',18994,3.9313,6.6,'DzfmnGMlzFA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1074,_binary '\0','/b1bMEMtuiHBX23tfQU5ybNpakVf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025878',7.9,35604,'en','The Thin Man','Former detective Nick Charles has retired from police work, preferring a life of cocktails, parties, and relaxation with his wealthy wife, Nora. Their holiday is interrupted when the daughter of Nick’s former client asks for help finding her missing father, eccentric inventor Clyde Wynant. When Wynant’s body is discovered, Nick is drawn back into the investigation, with Nora eagerly joining him. As the couple questions Wynant’s family, friends, and business associates, a tangled web of greed, deception, and murder begins to unravel.','/6cL89ok9t8xEKboOjOVga2W66jj.jpg','1934-05-25',91,'Released','A laugh tops every thrilling moment!','The Thin Man',3529,4.1169,7.5,'F2vlPkv0tQU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1075,_binary '\0','/4uGQifGisnosOxekPZWa7VjKB3E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025880',6.7,1364,'en','Thirty Day Princess','A European princess arrives in New York City to secure a much-needed loan for her country. She contracts the mumps, and an actress who looks exactly like her is hired to impersonate her.','/xGEjDGrgVkn5EaNuoiP8cX3rSGs.jpg','1934-05-18',74,'Released','...She had him going and coming...in a double romance!','Thirty Day Princess',81113,1.4277,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1076,_binary '\0','/hKO0l5mSuqgZk0lQxoxvqJEfPMz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025898',7.2,2328,'fr','Toni','In the 1920s, the Provence is a magnet for immigrants seeking work in the quarries or in the agriculture. Many mingle with locals and settle down for good — like Toni, an Italian who has moved in with Marie, a Frenchwoman. Even a well-ordered existence is not immune from boredom, friendship, romance, or enmity, and Toni becomes entangled in a web of increasingly passionate relationships. For there is his best pal Fernand, but also Albert, his overbearing foreman; there is Sebastian, a steady Spanish peasant, but also Gabi, his young rogue relative; there is Marie, but there is also Josefa.','/ubrZ3WugUofh5P1km5m05UtZOwK.jpg','1935-02-22',84,'Released',NULL,'Toni',51949,1.2721,7.1,'sSLSz5ioARk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1077,_binary '\0','/zV7JeAgHut2diYjC6LzB5I8mx50.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025907',7.1,3597,'en','Treasure Island','In this early film adaptation of the classic novel by Robert Louis Stevenson, young Jim Hawkins is caught up with the pirate Long John Silver in search of buccaneer Captain Flint\'s buried treasure.','/gagTpKHWd9DiDtSb6hIFTAuXi0k.jpg','1934-08-17',103,'Released','Sail the high seas of adventure again!','Treasure Island',43605,2.9395,6.568,'yf1imj0jXYs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1078,_binary '\0','/x57PAMkSURMbNZUk25lecXkJEWu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025913',7.1,18630,'de','Triumph des Willens','A showcase of German chancellor and Nazi Party leader Adolf Hitler at the 1934 Nuremberg Rally.','/hyXCugoQzJ85mdrdz4dboqP8FoX.jpg','1935-03-28',114,'Released',NULL,'Triumph of the Will',39266,3.441,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1079,_binary '\0','/qG1Q0BTLtwo1Onbyy5wgUN2i9qo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025919',7.2,7945,'en','Twentieth Century','A temperamental Broadway producer trains an untutored actress, but when she becomes a star, she proves a match for him.','/lHZcuD5pEoyoNHqeTEUEyDEDVKi.jpg','1934-05-11',91,'Released','The Star of Stars in the Hit of Hits!','Twentieth Century',31835,1.7146,6.835,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1080,_binary '\0','/iA8LoWS4Kf7zyAathOCb8Xs3ams.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025929',7.6,3869,'ja','浮草物語','An aging actor returns to a small town with his troupe and reunites with his former lover and illegitimate son, a scenario that enrages his current mistress and results in heartbreak for all.','/eR0KHE3mS2Ti8sOADMp9ZmKJdJG.jpg','1934-11-23',86,'Released',NULL,'A Story of Floating Weeds',44163,1.5982,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1081,_binary '\0','/x47WOx7vRflR8sGiVdIYDWXkY9t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0025948',6.3,1769,'en','Viva Villa!','In this fictionalized biography, young Pancho Villa takes to the hills after killing an overseer in revenge for his father\'s death.','/nUB1fXAGHOZ89DzReXp3QEcz2uo.jpg','1934-04-27',115,'Released','...TOO BIG FOR HOLLYWOOD...it was dramatized in the heart of Mexico, with a cast of thousands!','Viva Villa!',43604,1.3635,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1082,_binary '\0','/hiDsCnpohrmq9jHC36cMc83nWat.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026017',7.4,1310,'en','You\'re Telling Me!','Sam Bisbee is an inventor whose works (e.g., a keyhole finder for drunks) have brought him only poverty. His daughter is in love with the son of the town snob. Events conspire to ruin his bullet-proof tire just as success seems near. Another of his inventions prohibits him from committing suicide, so Sam decides to go on living.','/ZVjzGlQEGcs0YZT6u71jO1d6LZ.jpg','1934-04-06',66,'Released','He\'s pretty cute playing Cupid to young love!','You\'re Telling Me!',131732,1.9312,6.325,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1083,_binary '\0','/zqLR4jm0lPFGnyN55QBSf4pzz5n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026029',7.6,66879,'en','The 39 Steps','Richard Hanney has a rude awakening when a glamorous female spy falls into his bed - with a knife in her back. Having a bit of trouble explaining it all to Scotland Yard, he heads for the hills of Scotland to try to clear his name by locating the spy ring known as The 39 Steps.','/oC81jK6aAug4MA0xzYVngHmjsZS.jpg','1935-06-06',86,'Released','Handcuffed to the girl who double-crossed him','The 39 Steps',260,5.1036,7.3,'EjPwRiJ1Yxw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1084,_binary '\0','/9OGe2fiieciCq3vUqNAF2u5phPQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026056',6.8,4951,'en','Alice Adams','In the lower-middle-class Adams family, father and son are happy to work in a drugstore, but mother and daughter Alice try every possible social-climbing stratagem despite snubs and embarrassment. When Alice finally meets her dream man Arthur, mother nags father into a risky business venture and plans to impress Alice\'s beau with an \"upscale\" family dinner. Will the excruciating results drive Arthur away?','/rjhJDaC7025umyBKvKHyOsocKDp.jpg','1935-08-23',99,'Released','Twenty-two and wonderful ... as Booth Tarkington\'s loveliest heroine!','Alice Adams',43886,1.5406,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1085,_binary '\0','/3T8piadXjpmUf37D3XtjmHzhpGq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026071',7,6276,'en','Anna Karenina','In Imperial Russia, Anna, wife of the officer Karenin, goes to Moscow to visit her brother. On the way, she meets charming cavalry officer Vronsky, to whom she\'s immediately attracted. But in St. Petersburg’s high society, a relationship like this could destroy a woman’s reputation.','/39bSsAvMGOgN8I5lt2rOQgAXsj7.jpg','1935-08-30',95,'Released','THESE TWO LOVED...and the world stood aghast!','Anna Karenina',70881,3.1651,6.6,'KwYS7BYIIag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1086,_binary '\0','/y3n5LS9ghdTkm4a8nrwIE7bJlUd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026073',6.6,2113,'en','Annie Oakley','Awkward Annie loves her sharpshooting rival in Buffalo Bill\'s Wild West Show.','/ktF8RMMBs8zzjTPqn7HpYF6ddAq.jpg','1935-11-15',90,'Released','Meet Col. Cody, Sitting Bull, and all the two-gun heroes of the plains, in the big show that astonished two continents ... a livid background for the flaming love of Annie Oakley!','Annie Oakley',43887,2.4581,6.473,'hcsvRMIpsy8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1087,_binary '\0','/jjE8o214f2Xn6gAGK3YfXH9XKbG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026097',6.7,2443,'en','Barbary Coast','Mary Rutledge arrives from the east, finds her fiancé dead, and goes to work at the roulette wheel of Luis Chamalis\' Bella Donna, a rowdy gambling house in San Francisco in the 1850s. She falls in love with miner Jim Carmichael and takes his gold dust at the wheel. She goes after him, Chamalis goes after her with intent to harm Carmichael.','/hkUzk3WBI11LYgn1qsWGTsFlLOL.jpg','1935-10-13',90,'Released','Love was a gamble she couldn\'t afford to lose.','Barbary Coast',76499,1.8187,6.4,'N-FXv7txbro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1088,_binary '\0','/6kKdExZ7crG1mabqp2gBOsn9GBa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026104',5.8,1503,'en','Becky Sharp','In early 19th century England, ambitious and ruthless orphan Rebecca Sharp advances from the position of governess to the heights of British society. The first feature length film to use three-strip Technicolor.','/bBjky6HkzOWMxnL44wjCMPPAWDk.jpg','1935-06-28',84,'Released','YOU WILL SEE HER TRANSFORMED BY THE WONDEROUS NEW TECHNICOLOR','Becky Sharp',43888,1.8716,5.7,'jOY5OvXjkY0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1089,_binary '\0','/baFZtModbTZUiLJKvo8tVtZUVCx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026121',6.4,1238,'en','Black Fury','A simple Pennsylvania coal miner is drawn into the violent conflict between union workers and management.','/jfgkjAMMJxEHKDKlzeic5PpO9sP.jpg','1935-05-18',94,'Released','The savage of \"Bordertown\" dynamites his way into the heart of humanity!','Black Fury',92667,1.5158,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1090,_binary '\0','/sXik2U1GMHcU9D2L9yZ9ocf3SrT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026123',6.9,2813,'en','The Black Room','In a 16th-century European town, the ruling family has been given a prophecy that, should there ever be twin boys born, the younger will murder the older; so is dismayed when twins are born to the popular baron. The older grows to be a selfish, slovenly man, who inherits the castle at his father\'s death and becomes ruler over the formerly happy villagers. He enjoys his power until he learns his younger brother is returning from abroad and, afraid of the prophecy, he determines to murder his sibling, hide his body in the \"black room\" - an old torture chamber sealed away behind the fireplace - and then impersonate him, right down to his withered arm. In this way he hopes to not only avoid the prophecy, but also escape consequences of his other criminal deeds and obtain marriage to a local girl of the nobility...','/lXjHM4k632aV4F9vd6u5sJkJF6G.jpg','1935-07-15',70,'Released','Dead or Alive... He could kill!','The Black Room',27003,2.08,6.5,'ppSb01QNBRE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1091,_binary '\0','/AvFrkxjm7fu3zayDlLYLD3sSBsF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026126',6.7,2277,'en','Bonnie Scotland','Stan and Ollie stow away to Scotland expecting to inherit the MacLaurel estate. When things don\'t quite turn out that way, they unwittingly enlist in the Scottish army and are posted to India.','/6eUwTJEFA6iciNvV2oJJWFRsKMw.jpg','1935-08-23',80,'Released','60 minutes of fun!','Bonnie Scotland',43889,2.5774,6.6,'Tln055iSuB0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1092,_binary '\0','/ayhDrswuMnmSzYKx9CeWJhdoood.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026129',6.6,2142,'en','Bordertown','An ambitious Mexican-American gets mixed up with the neurotic wife of his casino boss.','/uqQiWQwIdD7JydpNglrBlIO4YAT.jpg','1935-01-23',90,'Released','NOW HE\'S A FUGITIVE FROM A FEMALE SCARFACE','Bordertown',26323,1.4474,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1093,_binary '\0','/hrED8MSOn4xJP9Cpk7WomUcFKGI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026138',7.8,59557,'en','Bride of Frankenstein','Dr. Frankenstein and his monster both turn out to be alive after being attacked by an angry mob. The now-chastened scientist attempts to escape his past, but a former mentor forces him to assist with the creation of a new creature.','/5241zUwe7rC17MNc2QpCBKKdp1N.jpg','1935-04-20',75,'Released','More fearful than the monster himself!','Bride of Frankenstein',229,5.1949,7.5,'gJoE3AIHTjU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1094,_binary '\0','/eNGptmROfwYxukYh8OklqhxrR4j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026144',6.7,2296,'en','Broadway Melody of 1936','Lovely, gifted Irene Foster hopes that her childhood sweetheart-turned Broadway producer Robert Gordon will recognize her--and her talent. Gordon is too busy sparring with a dirt-dishing gossip columnist to notice, but his wisecracking, heart-of-gold secretary certainly does. She and Irene must use their wits to show him what he\'s missing!','/2ARXx0pReQ3AMnYKY4f292D77uB.jpg','1935-09-20',103,'Released','You have waited seven years for this!','Broadway Melody of 1936',43890,1.8465,6.5,'BtOqMfgRrZ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1095,_binary '\0','/A0a0YbEmjRnFHwZuzTISRaEDqjl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026164',6.8,2928,'en','Call of the Wild','Jack Thornton has trouble winning enough at cards for the stake he needs to get to the Alaska gold fields. His luck changes when he pays $250 for Buck, a sled dog that is part wolf to keep him from being shot by an arrogant Englishman also headed for the Yukon. En route to the Yukon with Shorty Houlihan -- who spent time in jail for opening someone else\'s letter with a map of where gold is to be found -- Jack rescues a woman whose husband was the addressee of that letter. Buck helps Jack win a $1,000 bet to get the supplies he needs. And when Jack and Claire Blake pet Buck one night, fingers touch.','/yhlz8WV0BhlgkPVy4AAceFmlpAX.jpg','1935-08-09',91,'Released','An Epic Novel . . . An Epic Picture !','Call of the Wild',119819,2.7734,6.3,'HeZTA4jYjmQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1096,_binary '\0','/gVCUB5cYjZVzNyBS46Q6RXLfmSr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026174',7.7,17638,'en','Captain Blood','Dr. Peter Blood, unjustly convicted of treason and exiled from England, becomes a notorious pirate.','/Ae0ltppMl66pAH1odgDU1C4H1iq.jpg','1935-12-26',119,'Released','A million dollars worth of adventure!','Captain Blood',16905,4.3222,7.2,'4HmoyQcoBd0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1097,_binary '\0','/e2xmGEMX5Fm6T1RfFVK8wBCVrZv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026184',6.6,1357,'en','The Case of the Curious Bride','After giving the District Attorney another stinging defeat, Perry plans to take a vacation in China. That is, he was, until Rhoda, his old flame, meets him at a restaurant. It seems that her husband Moxley, who had been allegedly dead for four years, is alive and demanding money as she has married into wealth. The case escalates when the police find the body of Moxley and charge her with the murder.','/A5ObflTlxn2JthUW3su3YaiGohr.jpg','1935-04-13',80,'Released','Perry Mason returns','The Case of the Curious Bride',75770,1.6786,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1098,_binary '\0','/gcN3mJRajOWCs8DkoxGB6quaR8C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026197',6.6,2304,'en','Charlie Chan in Egypt','While investigating the theft of antiquities from an ancient tomb excavation , Charlie discovers that the body of the expedition\'s leader concealed inside the mummy\'s wrappings.','/1skaeqBp4h3jjXrYV6Qt2759Epb.jpg','1935-06-04',73,'Released','Once--Twice--Thrice THE KILLER STRIKES-Then CHAN Faces his WEIRDEST MYSTERY!','Charlie Chan in Egypt',33390,1.5851,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1099,_binary '\0','/59B5pPGY5DDLvILqTY9sbXb3S6s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026198',7.1,1910,'en','Charlie Chan in Paris','Charlie\'s visit to Paris, ostensibly a vacation, is really a mission to investigate a bond-forgery racket. But his agent, apache dancer Nardi is killed before she can tell him much. The case, complicated by a false murder accusation for banker\'s daughter Yvette, climaxes with a strange journey through the Paris sewers.','/leUDQsYg3X6IbPxCppNJODu1Vf8.jpg','1935-01-21',72,'Released','PARIS...MYSTERY...MURDER! CHAN FINDS THE ANSWER!','Charlie Chan in Paris',33393,2.2758,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1100,_binary '\0','/fY7wfVGzCunfLsr1bad6K7H92Em.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026199',6.9,1750,'en','Charlie Chan in Shanghai','When a prominent official is murdered at a banquet honoring Charle Chan, the detective and son Lee team up to expose an opium-smuggling ring.','/g7Fq1naVCuIPPI75j7SJwEvlwAk.jpg','1935-10-11',71,'Released','AND NOW YOU SEE HIM IN CHINA!','Charlie Chan in Shanghai',33395,1.8652,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1101,_binary '\0','/5Dt59bozPx5H5afRUmkkPiCcdUD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026205',6.9,3312,'en','China Seas','Captain Alan Gaskell sails the perilous waters between Hong Kong and Singapore with a secret cargo: a fortune in British gold. That\'s not the only risky cargo he carries; both his fiery mistress and his refined fiancee are aboard!','/aCYCbwSJHEd6SJpxLJfE8fnY25m.jpg','1935-08-09',87,'Released',NULL,'China Seas',71282,2.1556,6.2,'vCMdNkT5KVM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1102,_binary '\0','/gmvq84Cj6DgrFoYF2DPxWVcWclF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026246',6.9,2512,'en','Crime and Punishment','Former student Raskolnikov is pushed to murder when struggling to pay the rent on his apartment. When the murder is being investigated by the police, Raskolnikov struggles between trying to hide his guilt and the pressure to confess.','/8e5It3XyWUigGNYNoEvgtLdm3P1.jpg','1935-11-22',88,'Released','I am Sonya! You don\'t know who or what I am... the police know! They know I\'m in love with a murderer! But a woman like me might still save a man\'s soul!','Crime and Punishment',43891,1.6071,6.3,'QGckPfnguxU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1103,_binary '\0','/2sSBO8RrSKF59sLhVBV8S3WlX6r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026249',6.5,1458,'en','The Crusades','King Richard the Lionhearted launches a crusade to preserve Christianity in Jerusalem.','/ecuUhbDcNHqGQCvDgUVxULfdwKj.jpg','1935-08-21',125,'Released','The Flaming chapters of one woman\'s love, trapped by two worlds in terrific conflict!','The Crusades',58905,1.6871,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1104,_binary '\0','/kMkMlmTJ9Q7txL4XMCL4cxjnhzN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026252',6.8,2315,'en','Curly Top','Wealthy Edward Morgan becomes charmed with a curly-haired orphan and her pretty older sister Mary and arranges to adopt both under the alias of \"Mr. Jones\". As he spends more time with them, he soon finds himself falling in love with Mary.','/86I2edVODRBQaUw2rZM2M9wvKuU.jpg','1935-07-26',75,'Released',NULL,'Curly Top',29877,1.7533,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1105,_binary '\0','/bHW4i6h1jLUfr8kFSdgagiYKkNi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026261',6.8,4027,'en','Dangerous','Don Bellows finds former stage star Joyce Heath a penniless drunk and takes her to his Connecticut home for rehabilitation. He asks his fiancée Gail to free him and offers to sponsor Joyce in a play.','/2UskcpJ7iOCoXCMTWez7kourZDE.jpg','1935-12-25',79,'Released','An alcoholic actress considered a dangerous jinx is rehabilitated but shows she\'s as dangerous as ever.','Dangerous',52863,1.6938,6.6,'ysOEA-QNlVk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1106,_binary '\0','/dF4bK5tMVo1AeyPBOHGElECFsYu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026266',7.3,5199,'en','The Personal History, Adventures, Experience, & Observation of David Copperfield the Younger','A young man journeys from a difficult childhood to maturity, exploring social injustice, personal development, and the complexities of human relationships.','/4MtgfnOvnUioz04Yp4Km4JGUOCQ.jpg','1935-01-18',130,'Released','1935\'s most beloved motion picture!','David Copperfield',43899,2.6653,6.7,'iE8GRptlSt4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1107,_binary '\0','/h4a0nvul95hxsAGOoWZXYCZREYQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026267',5.1,1456,'en','The Dawn Rider','When John Mason\'s father is killed, John is wounded. Attracted to his nurse Alice, a conflict arises between him and his friend Ben who plans to marry Alice. John later finds the killer of his father but goes to face him not knowing Ben has removed the bullets from his gun.','/jqYi6f2R2STpKNeahhYSc1dGXWT.jpg','1935-06-20',52,'Released','The End Of The Vengeance Trail','The Dawn Rider',53827,1.2688,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1108,_binary '\0','/1nwI1v3cWMpqkzJLCJrdjveyPU2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026276',6.9,4365,'en','The Devil Is a Woman','In the carnival in Spain in the beginning of the Twentieth Century, the exiled republican Antonio Galvan comes from Paris masquerade to enjoy the party and visit his friend Capt. Don Pasqual \'Pasqualito\' Costelar. However, he flirts with the mysterious Concha Perez and they schedule to meet each other later. When Antonio meets Pasqualito, his old friend discloses his frustrated relationship with the promiscuous Concha and her greedy mother and how his life was ruined by his obsession for the beautiful demimondaine. Pasqualito makes Antonio promise that he would not see Concha. However, when Antonio meets Concha, she seduces him and the long friendship between Antonio and Pasqualito is disrupted','/cc5HUdBbnMSST78sfujsOU4T0Vk.jpg','1935-05-03',80,'Released','Kiss me .. and I\'ll break your heart!','The Devil Is a Woman',42943,2.4509,6.331,'FAUdRXn7rGY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1109,_binary '\0','/gdMvSKnBzOtjESSyLiL7tj9C35l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026388',6.5,1882,'en','Front Page Woman','Ace reporter Curt Devlin and fellow reporter Ellen Garfield love one another, but Curt believes women are \"bum newspapermen\". When a murder investigation ensues, the two compete every step of the way, determined to not be scooped by the other.','/g6NTqQQDneq6IUATIooYjcYRoVl.jpg','1935-07-11',82,'Released','A woman reporter tries to prove she\'s just as good as any man, but runs into trouble along the way.','Front Page Woman',162059,1.6491,5.9,'MWsPnDypwR8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1110,_binary '\0','/aDuAML6poOEohOnhL53PZZ1MgJY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026393',7.1,4702,'en','\'G\' Men','James “Brick” Davis, a struggling attorney, owes his education to a mobster, but always has refused to get involved with the underworld. When a friend of his is gunned down by a notorious criminal, Brick decides to abandon the exercise of the law and join the Department of Justice to capture the murderer.','/6jY4xH5SDNrRIxlYoXskXniO2Zl.jpg','1935-05-04',83,'Released','The King of Action joins the crime smashers!','\'G\' Men',26718,2.5434,6.6,'HTriMepUbJ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1111,_binary '\0','/s7DtYI6KPd5s5UDdpTbXcbmDamB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026406',6.7,2385,'en','The Ghost Goes West','Peggy Martin, daughter of a wealthy American businessman, persuades her father to buy a haunted Scottish castle from Donald Glourie. As the castle is dismantled and transported to Florida, its ghost tags along. Donald and Peggy fall in love, but the restless apparition proves to unwelcome, and they must find a way to appease the kilt-wearing spirit.','/k2lpTJIrZNZLlm1gMJhYHEcp1bt.jpg','1935-12-17',95,'Released','The most romantic ghost you\'ve ever seen!','The Ghost Goes West',132263,1.5792,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1112,_binary '\0','/utKttiha5WHHHBx6DAlBuz9F6Pd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026413',6.7,1481,'en','The Girl from 10th Avenue','When his fiancée Valentine dumps him, prominent lawyer Geoffrey Sherwood goes on a bender and winds up married to a stranger, Miriam Brady. They decide to give their marriage a chance. Their landlady, a one-time Floradora girl, offers to help Miriam become refined. Successful again, Geoffrey is approached (\"if only we were free\") by Valentine. Miriam tells Valentine off in no uncertain terms. Geoffrey moves into his club where Valentine\'s husband tells him he is a fool to leave Miriam','/5SK2O5mB9H9lF7sduXhBOcKCG5c.jpg','1935-06-01',69,'Released','A Shop Girl shows a Society Leader what it takes to Hold a Man!','The Girl from 10th Avenue',196693,1.5226,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1113,_binary '\0','/sw8usJoEQevFcF8WLV09zfC82Bp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026421',6.8,3173,'en','Gold Diggers of 1935','Romance strikes when a vacationing millionairess and her daughter and son spend their vacation at a posh New England resort.','/utP30vhi3le9X3STgoUIKaOLIqG.jpg','1935-03-15',95,'Released','AT LAST!..IT\'S HERE! THE SHOW YOU\'VE WAITED TWO YEARS TO SEE!','Gold Diggers of 1935',43892,2.0758,6.5,'1Un7yzDEDk0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1114,_binary '\0','/oUtVWpO99AB62eBfWhU7RuHlamA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026424',7.4,1850,'en','The Good Fairy','In 1930s Budapest, naïve orphan Luisa Ginglebuscher becomes an usherette at the local movie house, determined to succeed in her first job by doing good deeds for others and maintaining her purity. Luisa\'s well-meaning lies get her caught between a lecherous businessman, Konrad, and a decent but confused doctor, Max Sporum. When Luisa convinces Konrad that she\'s married to Max, Konrad tries everything he can to get rid of the baffled doctor.','/mtn7wvW5I2xty7X64m3cwxZAjhA.jpg','1935-02-18',98,'Released',NULL,'The Good Fairy',47758,1.7079,7.1,'34pTHbhGaYc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1115,_binary '\0','/gtLeiXFY1yh2zsn1VoSJMrk1bWA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026452',6.9,2407,'en','Hands Across the Table','A manicurist and an engaged loafer, both planning to marry money, meet and fall in love.','/m78sdT3CI7HUzwb6bcvyaJ8IzZW.jpg','1935-10-18',80,'Released','A Little Fortune Hunter...A Bankrupt Playboy...Both Out to Marry Money..And Laugh at Love!','Hands Across the Table',31988,1.856,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1116,_binary '\0','/negFKatgXDNp9EJmqpDQovztKmV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026519',7,1756,'en','If You Could Only Cook','An auto engineer and a professor\'s daughter pose as married servants in a mobster\'s mansion.','/p4PZyrokxIeONJHQlltNT111nUs.jpg','1935-12-30',72,'Released','SHE GAVE UP HER PARK BENCH FOR HIM! HE GAVE UP MILLIONS FOR HER!','If You Could Only Cook',126083,2.2179,7.4,'JPjHd13dskk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1117,_binary '\0','/a9KoSHzoT8PLWYoFDBgjDdp1Z78.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026529',7.3,7945,'en','The Informer','Gypo Nolan is a former Irish Republican Army man who drowns his sorrows in the bottle. He\'s desperate to escape his bleak Dublin life and start over in America with his girlfriend. So when British authorities advertise a reward for information about his best friend, current IRA member Frankie, Gypo cooperates. Now Gypo can buy two tickets on a boat bound for the States, but can he escape the overwhelming guilt he feels for betraying his buddy?','/gFsyHdVg93uPMZc64kCaCR3Y7Vn.jpg','1935-05-09',91,'Released',NULL,'The Informer',43896,1.9642,6.833,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1118,_binary '\0','/hOwin1ANIgj82lP2dy7dqGRUv1D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026564',7.4,1572,'fr','La Kermesse héroïque','Flanders, Hispanic Monarchy, 1616. The inhabitants of the small town of Boom are busy organizing the annual local festivities when the arrival of the Duke of Olivares, who rules the country on behalf of the King Philip III of Spain, is announced. While the male citizens cowardly surrender to panic like rats on a sinking ship, the brave female citizens, led by the bold wife of the burgomaster, decide to become the best hosts the Spaniards can ever meet.','/5C4owFvEeQ26u79dVUFm3mIHW6M.jpg','1935-12-03',110,'Released','The Spanish soldiers were not as ruthless as they were depicted','Carnival in Flanders',32543,1.3058,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1119,_binary '\0','/uu2RQccwagL3Vw4iwZheCPAcn0E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026605',6.4,1443,'en','The Last Days of Pompeii','In this action-filled spectacle set in ancient Pompeii, a blacksmith becomes a Roman gladiator, though his rise to wealth and power is jeopardized by his son\'s Christianity and the eruption of Vesuvius.','/rwvCu5Bc03BEcEZoWMRhlrI22nI.jpg','1935-10-18',96,'Released','VESUVIUS...COULD NOT DESTROY THIER LOVE..!','The Last Days of Pompeii',170558,2.1529,5.846,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1120,_binary '\0','/5sgZlz9vC5rX9rWgdFIAwPrkiJ9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026641',6.7,1844,'en','The Littlest Rebel','Virgie Cary\'s father, a rebel officer, sneaks back to his rundown plantation to see his dying wife and is arrested. A Yankee officer takes pity and sets up an escape. Everyone is captured and the officers are to be executed. Virgie and Uncle Billy beg President Lincoln to intercede.','/cMaqJwSPCNFXkGuECB3efImC1iE.jpg','1935-12-27',70,'Released','America\'s Little Sweetheart . . . The Dimpled Darling You Love in the Greatest of Civil War Dramas !','The Littlest Rebel',43897,2.1107,6.4,'d6bTwcKImH0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1121,_binary '\0','/w7r1wv8ptSEgHu2IsIjuHcnWcrL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026643',7,3596,'en','The Lives of a Bengal Lancer','In the Northwest Frontier of India, the 41st Bengal Lancers led by the harsh Colonel Tom Stone are having trouble with the rebellious leader Mohammed Khan. Surly McGregor and wry, blue-blooded Forsythe are officers in charge of newcomer Lieutenant Stone, the commanding officer’s inexperienced son. Motivated by a grudge toward his father, Lt. Stone allows himself to be captured by the enemy.','/lcThieJiNXmXk9cjqfIYU4QEkhm.jpg','1935-01-11',109,'Released','Set in the spectacle of mystic India with its glittering mosques, oirental palaces, weird music, bronzed nautch dancers','The Lives of a Bengal Lancer',43898,2.1293,6.6,'9RCnMHeMGjs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1122,_binary '\0','/sBcLY7JPs2PEGhfeiVZaU4HsCYK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026663',7.2,6570,'en','Mad Love','An insane surgeon\'s obsession with an actress leads him to replace her wounded pianist husband\'s hands with those of a knife-throwing murderer.','/lDD8pKd6jSrFLV3RvE0eDGGGxR0.jpg','1935-07-12',68,'Released','A new, a strange, a gifted personality comes to the screen!','Mad Love',28261,2.0351,7,'boJFq-c277M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1123,_binary '\0','/aWG6Cfu2Sl2fBaStUMB0wlg31je.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026667',6.8,1384,'en','Magnificent Obsession','A playboy tries to redeem himself after his careless behavior causes a great man\'s death.','/zcBLLMeKUjW1igNGwQ71njzB0Iz.jpg','1935-12-30',112,'Released','After You See It You\'ll Never Be the Same!','Magnificent Obsession',47920,1.3729,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1124,_binary '\0','/zz3D8teDui0kuaRImX7XynucNmN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026676',7.4,1476,'en','Man on the Flying Trapeze','Hard-working, henpecked Ambrose Ambrose Wolfinger takes off from work to go to a wrestling match with catastrophic consequences.','/aWpVoEuVxW6DvbRW03AAULAvB2e.jpg','1935-08-03',66,'Released','Come to the crowning of America\'s comedy King!','Man on the Flying Trapeze',55773,1.4928,6.278,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1125,_binary '\0','/m6JQYoijoaLnEjdC6LcdQOxnOsg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026685',6.3,6175,'en','Mark of the Vampire','Sir Borotyn, a prominent Prague resident, is discovered murdered in his home, with all indications pointing to a vampiric assault. The victim\'s friend, Baron Otto, and the physician who analyzes the body, are certain that the vampire is either the mysterious Count Mora or his daughter. Receiving little help from the law, occult expert Professor Zelen is sought to assist with their investigation.','/A6JN2kIEYwXEHHmqEa86aMKDJj8.jpg','1935-04-26',60,'Released','Undead…Yet living on the kisses of youth!','Mark of the Vampire',28910,2.9727,6.2,'eyvOdKm0eDo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1126,_binary '\0','/71J6gmlQSA5G6V9LTtkA1D4z4Dr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026714',6.8,4236,'en','A Midsummer Night\'s Dream','Mistaken identity, unrequited love, and the supernatural are combined in Shakespeare\'s classic set in the woods of Greece on a moonlit night.','/jIdjacF7a1KTSWcheNEo6qFEY8K.jpg','1935-10-09',143,'Released','Three Centuries In The Making! An immortal literary classic becomes a triumph of the ages!','A Midsummer Night\'s Dream',19075,2.9358,6.4,'yIiFUMhBMC8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1127,_binary '\0','/l6A4m3IhK8OSScpo441tyn8or8L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026725',7.6,4268,'en','Les Misérables','In 19th century France, Jean Valjean, a man imprisoned for stealing bread, must flee a relentless policeman named Javert. The pursuit consumes both men\'s lives, and soon Valjean finds himself in the midst of the student revolutions in France.','/9hSPMlFppQBCcDDECA0TgTL0F8k.jpg','1935-04-20',108,'Released','The immortal classic that shook a nation… is now a glorious picture !','Les Misérables',43893,2.0114,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1128,_binary '\0','/jZ9KWu4iSMmK7gZMjkteG3pWHMK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026739',6.8,1384,'en','The Murder Man','Steve Grey, reporter for the Daily Star, has a habit of scooping all the other papers in town. When Henry Mander is investigated for the murder of his shady business partner, Grey is one step ahead of the police to the extent that he often dictates his story in advance of its actual occurrence. He leads the police through an \'open and shut\' case resulting in Mander being tried, convicted and sentenced to death. Columnist Mary Shannon is in love with Steve but she sees him struggle greatly with his last story before Mander\'s execution. When she starts typing out the story from his recorded dictation, she realizes why.','/jjoBHLSJsNml7mcl5lGr1CvYFjs.jpg','1935-07-12',69,'Released','He knows the truth BUT HE CAN\'T TALK!','The Murder Man',27998,1.3463,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1129,_binary '\0','/OBvT7h7Vt6qKGXJBNLDFnRhJEW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026752',7.6,26963,'en','Mutiny on the Bounty','Fletcher Christian successfully leads a revolt against the ruthless Captain Bligh on the HMS Bounty. However, Bligh returns one year later, hell bent on revenge.','/GD98ozz6F6tSu8BWGulpseEKhv.jpg','1935-11-22',132,'Released','Clark Gable as the daring mutineer in the screen\'s most exciting adventure story!','Mutiny on the Bounty',12311,4.8329,7.4,'3jXGEc_BuR8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1130,_binary '\0','/hTPstVpZ9LDlFBCrnCJbpy12Fbq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026759',5.4,1292,'en','The Mystery of the Mary Celeste','During a horrific storm at sea, the crew realizes that there is a murderer among them who is killing them off one by one.','/tKRfm0gKco0qbP700NiLipylzQq.jpg','1935-04-27',62,'Released',NULL,'The Mystery of the Mary Celeste',26921,1.4003,5.563,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1131,_binary '\0','/ed0vnOayRbaKDDuiTRmeJGFZfrE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026768',6.5,1713,'en','Naughty Marietta','In order to avoid a prearranged marriage, a rebellious French princess sheds her identity and escapes to colonial New Orleans, where she finds an unlikely true love.','/mTBQjQxJ4U6Y5fo4GqON0qTNt8k.jpg','1935-03-29',103,'Released','Jeanette MacDonald and Nelson Eddy together for the first time!','Naughty Marietta',43894,2.6802,5.5,'baRIinyT7UI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1132,_binary '\0','/d7YwLX0PnX8vsaaQq9bz93jczGw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026778',7.8,36793,'en','A Night at the Opera','The Marx Brothers take on high society and the opera world to bring two lovers together. A sly business manager and two wacky friends of two opera singers help them achieve success while humiliating their stuffy and snobbish enemies.','/A4YDGfJwaG7aMxDVrVJsOHJ7ufK.jpg','1935-11-15',91,'Released','Don\'t miss it! The funniest picture ever made!','A Night at the Opera',37719,3.9357,7.389,'UY9C9MpoIn4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1133,_binary '\0','/uCESLGRyt94vVwLS6u0XPZ1RvED.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026840',6.7,1457,'en','Page Miss Glory','A country girl goes to the city and gets a job in a posh hotel, and winds up becoming an instant celebrity thanks to an ambitious photographer.','/hlb3ttlCiInjH6Pv0HyIM6YIIj8.jpg','1935-09-07',93,'Released','AN ALL-STAR CAST in an ALL-STAR COMEDY RIOT!','Page Miss Glory',188468,1.4396,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1134,_binary '\0','/kDDYzGOtySBrdqbRHS2O7c2EMWx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026866',6.9,2958,'en','Peter Ibbetson','When his mother dies, young Peter Ibbetson leaves Paris and his best friend, Mary, behind to live with a severe uncle in England. Years later, Peter is an architect with little time for women, until he begins a project with the Duke and Duchess of Towers. When Peter and the duchess become great friends, she reveals that she is Mary — but the duke soon suspects his wife of infidelity and challenges Peter to a duel, threatening the pair\'s second chance.','/pQJvgDUJRtsUiv4UzGzBCGel95d.jpg','1935-11-07',88,'Released','Love... born in the simple hearts of children... loving gloriously... triumphant through the years!','Peter Ibbetson',57412,2.4226,7,'u3GFwZPIHMo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1135,_binary '\0','/lEmvsrSbOvmCj0c2iu2XA5p4NPx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026912',6.8,7435,'en','The Raven','A brilliant but deranged neurosurgeon becomes obsessively fixated on a judge\'s daughter. With the help of an escaped criminal whose face he has surgically deformed, the mad man lures her, her father, and her fiancé to his isolated, castle-like home.','/iVMNfBvKe4XXxi4zrMytZ1c6ejO.jpg','1935-07-08',61,'Released','The uncanny master of make-up in a new amazing shocker!','The Raven',17907,2.6434,6.582,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1136,_binary '\0','/fi4FMDL6Tq6J3jxjPN2f6uHsAPQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026914',6.4,1679,'en','Reckless','A theatrical star, born on the wrong side of the tracks, marries a drunken blue-blood millionaire.','/r43PCgtyx9KTrE6FNnhoxl1k1hP.jpg','1935-04-19',97,'Released','METRO-GOLDWYN-MAYER\'S MAMMOTH MUSICAL MELODRAMA','Reckless',50080,1.6936,5.1,'oc1pqvhcaZQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1137,_binary '\0','/lwt9YQaOrCEVX6T7x0Zfe19ZZd3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026922',6.6,1257,'en','Rendezvous','A decoding expert tangles with enemy spies.','/aIuwG1lKbzaRzbLTw8weeppG3uO.jpg','1935-10-25',94,'Released','Bill Solves an Exciting Mystery and Wins a New Sweetheart!','Rendezvous',53860,1.5617,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1138,_binary '\0','/gKmbCY56U82mK1D2qy7dr0pTTRo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026932',6.2,1273,'en','Riffraff','Fisherman Dutch marries cannery worker Hattie. After he is kicked out of his union and fired from his job he leaves Hattie who steals money for him and goes to jail. He gets a new job, foils a plot to dynamite the ship, and promises to wait for Hattie.','/w6yg0o9x4dIXQsptF7ROQlEZeuX.jpg','1936-01-03',94,'Released','When a red-headed woman meets a red-headed man!','Riffraff',121006,1.2304,5.389,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1139,_binary '\0','/j7Gf4gLZaEMXNR4KKmbolZEJ7Xo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026942',7,3999,'en','Roberta','Football player John Kent tags along as Huck Haines and the Wabash Indianians travel to an engagement in Paris, only to lose it immediately. John and company visit his aunt, owner of a posh fashion house run by her assistant, Stephanie. There they meet the singer Scharwenka (alias Huck\'s old friend Lizzie), who gets the band a job. Meanwhile, Madame Roberta passes away and leaves the business to John and he goes into partnership with Stephanie.','/i4apYC87andlqfn5IhbxZN3b8Up.jpg','1935-03-07',106,'Released','Jerome Kern\'s Queen of Musical Romances!','Roberta',31798,1.2895,7.1,'xtiKZDwITuY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1140,_binary '\0','/t7AhTPxploPYAxjFBnEAcJIo1k9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026955',7.5,4928,'en','Ruggles of Red Gap','In this comedy of an Englishman stranded in a sea of barbaric Americans, Marmaduke Ruggles – a gentleman\'s gentleman and butler to an Earl – is lost in a poker game to an uncouth American cattle baron. Ruggles\' life is turned upside down as he\'s taken to the USA, is gradually assimilated into American life, accidentally becomes a local celebrity, and falls in love along the way.','/57KChzqCoDDsNGqJzsv10NzOwod.jpg','1935-03-08',90,'Released','SH-H-H-H! TONIGHT\'S YOUR NIGHT TO HOWL! And howl you will at this funniest of all comedies...','Ruggles of Red Gap',36006,2.9728,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1141,_binary '\0','/sF29zOqXnWUZ0I9mE5CXJpdt8oO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026972',6.4,3037,'en','Scrooge','Ebenezer Scrooge, the ultimate Victorian miser, hasn\'t a good word for Christmas, though his impoverished clerk Cratchit and nephew Fred are full of holiday spirit. In the night, Scrooge is visited by spirits of the past, present, and future.','/vqRuJyux0KEr4vojK9ytXIrEU46.jpg','1935-11-26',78,'Released','What happened when Scrooge saw Marley\'s face on the door knocker...and the clock struck twelve!','Scrooge',41118,1.5122,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1142,_binary '\0','/mnbkL0eRvuA7mnqWXveFx3EV3Tv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0026983',6.4,2244,'en','She','Leo Vincey, told by his dying uncle of a lost land visited 500 years ago by his ancestor, heads out with family friend Horace Holly to try to discover the land and its secret of immortality, said to be contained within a mystic fire. Picking up Tanya, a guide\'s daughter, in the frozen Russian arctic, they stumble upon Kor, revealed to be a hidden civilization ruled over by an immortal queen, called She, who believes Vincey is her long-lost lover John Vincey, Leo\'s ancestor.','/ziqvOkl1pfOxx3SH8EElx9V1lZo.jpg','1935-07-12',101,'Released','From H. Rider Haggard\'s weird, wondrous story of the beautiful woman who bathed in flame and lived 500 years .. at last to find her first love at this very hour!','She',60566,1.456,5.561,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1143,_binary '\0','/b3UImP6uwHjSYCz9jYh9S81lSYc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027029',6.4,1434,'en','Special Agent','A federal tax agent goes undercover as a reporter and, working with a mobster\'s pretty bookkeeper, infiltrates a crime ring to catch the racketeer. When she agrees to testify, an informant exposes them and she\'s kidnapped.','/uD6FlB0M6D8Y6yThbfRtOv2gUv5.jpg','1935-09-14',76,'Released','SEE \"T-MEN\" MOP-UP MONEYED MOBSTERS G-GUNS COULDN\'T GET','Special Agent',52864,1.5411,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1144,_binary '\0','/A6pmnOrCpZ9fNMB3uHScrrolRgz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027040',6.7,1925,'en','Star of Midnight','When a dancer disappears from a theater, Clay Dalzell is asked to investigate, leading him on a trail of murder and deception.','/2COOIXN7GzOaaMf7BS0EZukJGPP.jpg','1935-04-19',90,'Released','The titian-haired star of \"Gay Divorcee\" and \"Roberta\" joins hands with the master of all screen sleuths in a sparkling, mystery drama breathless with thrills...','Star of Midnight',53863,1.3774,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1145,_binary '\0','/mtNznUsEYYQE92b8KBoat1no2P1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027042',6.9,1492,'en','Steamboat Round the Bend','A Louisiana con man enters his steamboat into a winner-take-all race with a rival while trying to find a witness to free his nephew, about to be hanged for murder.','/httH3BiRr7GFpQyCcTaBkgZ3WOF.jpg','1935-09-06',81,'Released',NULL,'Steamboat Round the Bend',72609,1.8344,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1146,_binary '\0','/hyaIizUGbWh096bfxqa6XCwbJz2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027067',6.2,4919,'en','Sylvia Scarlett','When her father decides to flee to England, young Sylvia Scarlett must become Sylvester Scarlett and protect her father every step of the way, with the questionable help of plenty others.','/1hMesbV20CgdzODWgOgL2t1iHdp.jpg','1935-12-25',97,'Released','You will thrill to every unforgettable moment of this different, charming love story of a woman who almost waited too long... before she dared admit that she was a woman!','Sylvia Scarlett',31866,2.0685,6.3,'y8t7a8wwWhM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1147,_binary '\0','/rvUITyIhqSxFDhg3SE5J1yiwgrn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027075',7.8,7004,'en','A Tale of Two Cities','Set against the conditions leading up to the French Revolution and the Reign of Terror, French doctor Alexandre Manette serves an 18-year imprisonment in the Bastille in Paris, followed by his release to live in London with the daughter he has never met.','/mO8ezngn6ZYqpCQuhXUSEtDDwos.jpg','1935-12-25',126,'Released','The Immortal Story of Love and Intrigue During the French Revolution!','A Tale of Two Cities',17831,2.6241,6.862,'gdCZ6FLMYuY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1148,_binary '\0','/7b4WOkkL7p1qKlLyzBIcSuzuSZK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027076',7.7,1371,'ja','丹下左膳餘話 百萬兩の壺','A man gets rid of a cheap pot without knowing it contains a map to a treasure. As word spreads, many join in hunting it.','/lh34UgRQHrVo3g7qzskhqRpr4GB.jpg','1935-06-15',92,'Released',NULL,'Tange Sazen and the Pot Worth a Million Ryo',112501,1.2737,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1149,_binary '\0','/pY688uD1bSQaVthnzqNOsE5HAJH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027118',7.4,1857,'ja','東京の宿','An unemployed Japanese man and his two sons wander the industrial flatlands of Depression-era Tokyo, until he chances upon an old friend and befriends a woman and her daughter, who are in a similar predicament.','/lSYWTdGQy1xbyZihhjeKXvmL0pD.jpg','1935-11-21',80,'Released',NULL,'An Inn in Tokyo',89462,0.9596,7,'NdUc628jcR4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1150,_binary '\0','/9riMLH4EOw6PZzeCDnPlIGSyiEu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027125',7.7,22381,'en','Top Hat','Showman Jerry Travers is working for producer Horace Hardwick in London. Jerry demonstrates his new dance steps late one night in Horace\'s hotel room, much to the annoyance of sleeping Dale Tremont below. She goes upstairs to complain and the two are immediately attracted to each other. Complications arise when Dale mistakes Jerry for Horace.','/qoPBiN6PBs2NsP7BNOJGCnmwruG.jpg','1935-08-29',99,'Released','They\'re Dancing Cheek-To-Cheek Again!','Top Hat',3080,3.8564,7.244,'FZUwE1n5zsE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1151,_binary '\0','/86zlazhCgzRbxKvISmcLnTsVvfb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027189',6.6,1217,'en','The Wedding Night','While working on a novel in his country home in Connecticut, married writer Tony Barrett develops romantic feelings for Manya Novak, the daughter of a neighboring farmer. Manya is unhappily engaged to Frederik Sobieski. After a snowstorm, Tony and Manya get trapped together in his house overnight. The next day, Manya\'s father insists that her wedding to Frederik take place in spite of Manya\'s misgivings. Drunkenness and jealousy result in tragedy at the wedding reception that night.','/1PMkPuifnusyiLLMuXiMUiZb4nF.jpg','1935-03-08',83,'Released','TONIGHT She\'d leave the man she LOVED with all her SOUL...to MARRY the man she despised!','The Wedding Night',32004,1.6546,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1152,_binary '\0','/mE2TnC4VC5Ilv7dHsZkVfGQy9CA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027194',6.3,7456,'en','Werewolf of London','A strange animal attack turns a botanist into a bloodthirsty monster.','/78kD3Fpvgd8qubKMbhS5dKofjR8.jpg','1935-05-13',75,'Released','Beware the Stalking Being - Half-Human - Half-Beast!','Werewolf of London',27970,4.5254,6.1,'swDiECXLX8o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1153,_binary '\0','/vMTGbVTjyCFQtUKGYJvnRnr8uGX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027214',7.3,3959,'en','The Whole Town\'s Talking','Ordinary man-in-the-street Arthur Ferguson Jones leads a very straightforward life. He\'s never late for work and nothing interesting ever happens to him. One day everything changes: he oversleeps and is fired as an example, he\'s then mistaken for evil criminal killer Mannion and is arrested. The resemblance is so striking that the police give him a special pass to avoid a similar mistake. The real Mannion sees the opportunity to steal the pass and move around freely and chaos results.','/7L0o3XXJpq6fg0OalH3CjR7k68S.jpg','1935-02-22',93,'Released','The most exciting picture in a decade..Inspired by the biggest front page sensation in recent years','The Whole Town\'s Talking',52561,2.3259,6.9,'hBo9Wt7DtAw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1154,_binary '\0','/xRyu3WKWBATP8T4afJ5vArNlElB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027260',7.6,13298,'en','After the Thin Man','After returning to San Francisco, Nick and Nora Charles are drawn into the disappearance of Nora’s cousin’s husband. When he is found murdered, suspicion falls on the troubled family, and Nick reluctantly resumes his detective work. With Nora eagerly at his side, the pair follows a trail of jealousy, blackmail, secret relationships, and long-buried family scandals.','/1fkCHOffEkPOY0UwSrvzG6YKDVp.jpg','1936-12-25',112,'Released','Continuing the fun in their NEW hit!','After the Thin Man',14588,4.1773,7.3,'gql78s6drdM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1155,_binary '\0','/5rZzwulB7l7bteJDB0AERRIHeMd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027286',6.3,2405,'en','The Amazing Quest of Ernest Bliss','A bored millionaire wagers his doctor that he can support himself at a working class job for a year without touching his inheritance.','/rR6G2EWvt5ykKzb7mSuc17GnFAk.jpg','1936-07-28',61,'Released','A Story of Rags to Riches... and More Riches','The Amazing Quest of Ernest Bliss',35810,1.4335,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1156,_binary '\0','/dww52MSjI109oUWCoxBjoqg1o38.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027300',6.3,2233,'en','Anthony Adverse','Based on the novel by Hervey Allen, this expansive drama follows the many adventures of the eponymous hero, Anthony Adverse. Abandoned at a convent by his heartless nobleman father, Don Luis, Anthony is later mentored by his kind grandfather, John Bonnyfeather, and falls for the beautiful Angela Giuseppe. When circumstances separate Anthony and Angela and he embarks on a long journey, he must find his way back to her, no matter what the cost.','/9SPjkq5z86t80Q7XBw8AG2si2vQ.jpg','1936-08-26',141,'Released','The thrill of thrills the world could not forget!','Anthony Adverse',37658,2.4061,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1157,_binary '\0','/pGLJqCREnCERxwbqsKv7ZNKIm9E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027307',7.3,1483,'ja','有りがたうさん','In Depression-era Japan, a courteous bus driver carries an eclectic group of passengers from the mountainous Izu to Tokyo.','/8CmwNF3cvqRhaQWfmPUJrhMWDLO.jpg','1936-02-27',76,'Released',NULL,'Mr. Thank You',100033,1.3536,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1158,_binary '\0','/m52b2oxpV1ScHjLEwjsgtnkdhQt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027336',7.5,3978,'fr','Les Bas-fonds','Inhabitants of a flophouse struggle to survive under the harsh treatment imposed by the landlord, Kostyleva. One resident, young thief Wasska Pepel, ends his affair with the landlord\'s wife, Vassilissa, and takes up with her sister, Natacha. Pepel also befriends the baron, a former nobleman fallen on hard times, but Pepel\'s attempts at happiness are complicated when he\'s accused of murder by a spiteful Vassilissa.','/9jKTFaQE4jYeMRqoY1tR1Flp73n.jpg','1936-12-11',92,'Released','From the world-famous play by MAXIM GORKI','The Lower Depths',45802,1.7625,7.199,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1159,_binary '\0','/8SXkLUb0HgRQFDcQO0x09OrVrdy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027342',7.5,1646,'fr','La Belle Équipe','Five unemployed workers win 100,000 Francs in the national lottery. Instead of sharing the money, they buy a ruin and build an open-air cafe. But difficulties come to split their friendly group apart.','/1Lte67fTCBElypPoyPfiA5UxysW.jpg','1936-09-01',101,'Released',NULL,'La Belle Équipe',67443,1.1768,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1160,_binary '\0','/611ovdpk8ca3oVjt7uuC15f7hMw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027357',6.5,1326,'en','Big Brown Eyes','Sassy manicurist Eve Fallon is recruited as an even more brassy reporter and she helps police detective boyfriend Danny Barr break a jewel theft ring and solve the murder of a baby.','/7VuHwXVc6vZziEH8bfYaCI7RsWj.jpg','1936-04-03',77,'Released',NULL,'Big Brown Eyes',81116,1.4359,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1161,_binary '\0','/9XmKgUuytbrBPkiUOrBhCphVvpL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027367',7,4270,'en','Black Legion','When a hard-working machinist loses a promotion to a Polish-born worker, he is seduced into joining the secretive Black Legion, which intimidates foreigners through violence.','/9g8F2u5sn2DvFovY1Dxqyd1Ryvi.jpg','1937-01-30',83,'Released','They Murdered at Midnight!','Black Legion',42683,1.5799,6.6,'mrGhY727KDc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1162,_binary '\0','/iJvMryam7HMfsTH02m9fe6doPN1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027376',6.6,2452,'en','The Bohemian Girl','Stan and Ollie travel with a band of 18th-century Gypsies holding a nobleman\'s daughter.','/32ChJDhgwlETT1od2nr4dKdRT3B.jpg','1936-02-14',71,'Released','90 mad, merry, musical moments','The Bohemian Girl',82036,1.3841,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1163,_binary '\0','/mEltS22GMPthU9MwzAP4HeRzUYg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027387',6.7,2164,'en','Born to Dance','On leave, a sailor falls in love with a young lady aspiring to become a Broadway dancer, but their relationship is jeopardized by an established Broadway star, who is also enamored by him.','/40ANyC8M0OuL7hevKmQFrAAbZaB.jpg','1936-11-27',105,'Released','M*G*M\'s successor to \'THE GREAT ZIEGFELD\'','Born to Dance',43872,1.6248,6.094,'-txGiUtVAjM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1164,_binary '\0','/6Qslg5eD3RnxioHof3g4JAzStOS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027407',7,3798,'en','Bullets or Ballots','After Police Captain Dan McLaren becomes police commissioner, former detective Johnny Blake publicly punches him, convincing rackets boss Al Kruger that Blake is sincere in his effort to join the mob. \"Bugs\" Fenner, meanwhile, is certain that Blake is a police agent.','/qZhmP4AzkHPdfK0E8tpTSdZnGi1.jpg','1936-06-06',82,'Released','WHO Rules The Rackets ? This picture puts the finger on the political higher-ups!','Bullets or Ballots',27974,1.8664,6.6,'u4gqspylHNA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1165,_binary '\0','/h3IGEKNC8Xg836205fQPMnxNdVF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027413',6.3,2204,'en','Cain and Mabel','A chorus girl and a heavyweight boxer are paired romantically as a publicity stunt.','/s09LD5T664zWoo1zJo12Uwp4bm2.jpg','1936-09-26',90,'Released','It\'s the Romantic Battle of the Century with a World championship Cast!','Cain and Mabel',184741,1.2808,6.4,'-13NUyX6KeI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1166,_binary '\0','/xMoh2McVEGxTakQmUpLlfJcrOnI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027421',7,1665,'en','Captain January','A little girl named Star lives with a lighthouse keeper who rescued her when her parents drowned. A truant officer decides she should go to boarding school, but she\'s rescued by relatives.','/7iRxFqWmhCfEa39EElGfw10wKVQ.jpg','1936-04-17',77,'Released','A classic of childish heartache, courage, and laughter!','Captain January',57840,1.6563,6.8,'l7mhrXCXwoc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1167,_binary '\0','/dsrHhe5Ljve2WKwDUHJPIfyG3f1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027438',7,5916,'en','The Charge of the Light Brigade','In 1853, as the British and Russian empires compete to gain and maintain their place in the dreadful Great Game of political intrigues and alliances whose greatest prize is the domination of India and the border territories, Major Geoffrey Vickers must endure several betrayals and misfortunes before he can achieve his revenge at the Balaclava Heights, on October 25, 1854, the most glorious day of the Crimean War.','/v7PFjyhEAWKGQ8g6cTGw4GzYKsa.jpg','1936-10-20',111,'Released','Theirs not to reason why, theirs but to do and die','The Charge of the Light Brigade',43884,2.8364,6.5,'F2sNWQfdfq0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1168,_binary '\0','/eUhvJYxpeC4UuewlKZNlzmptXqb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027439',6.8,1936,'en','Charlie Chan at the Circus','While visiting the circus with his family, Charlie is recruited by the big top\'s co-owner to investigate threatening letters that he\'s received.','/n7CLgnusrof8kIfPmagu0h659vb.jpg','1936-03-27',72,'Released',NULL,'Charlie Chan at the Circus',33386,1.5749,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1169,_binary '\0','/jqdkNqpKT09koZYER6sAw3AMop9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027440',7.1,2486,'en','Charlie Chan at the Opera','A dangerous amnesiac escapes from an asylum, hides in the opera house, and is suspected of getting revenge on those who tried to murder him 13 years ago.','/xM3HEdNLnJofx6rmj5i4Ha5dquP.jpg','1936-12-04',68,'Released','A fiendish killer lurks at the opera! Weird! Thrilling! The Master Minds of Crime Match Wits Against Each Other!','Charlie Chan at the Opera',28044,2.0932,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1170,_binary '\0','/yaNzyH7LFbNoBJlFgixwQRwOtBC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027441',7.1,1749,'en','Charlie Chan at the Race Track','When a friend of Charlie\'s is found kicked to death by his own race horse on board a Honolulu-bound liner, the detective discovers foul play and uncovers an international gambling ring.','/n02zNAllSZq7KpEKTRTUtKV1955.jpg','1936-08-07',70,'Released','THE DEADLY PHANTOM HORSESHOE STRIKES! AN OCEAN LINER BLAZES ...TO COVER CRIME! THE INFRA-RAY HURLS UNSEEN DEATH! THE POISON FOAM BUBBLES VENOMOUSLY!','Charlie Chan at the Race Track',33387,1.9379,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1171,_binary '\0','/oWczoW5kMU5HunlKrb7GxVJeM7w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027442',6.9,1961,'en','Charlie Chan\'s Secret','Allen Colby, heir to a huge fortune, is presumed drowned after an ocean liner sinks off the coast of Honolulu. Mysteriously, Colby reappears at his mansion only to be murdered soon after. When his body is discovered during a seance, everyone in attendance becomes a suspect, and it\'s up to Chan to find the murderer before he or she strikes again.','/ewpElWzisU83EnZe8YGaZYX8xzw.jpg','1936-01-10',72,'Released','San Francisco is the scene of Chan\'s newest and most baffling mystery!','Charlie Chan\'s Secret',33708,1.6176,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1172,_binary '\0','/9aiwz7W64ngTBf7v3pSs6lSEj0I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027459',6.8,2668,'en','Come and Get It','An ambitious lumberjack abandons his saloon girl lover so that he can marry into wealth, but years later becomes infatuated with the woman\'s daughter.','/4w65AMsJ0RZVkxGfxw4DVWWSTyq.jpg','1936-11-06',99,'Released','YOUTH SACRIFICED! ON THE ALTAR OF POWER!','Come and Get It',93313,2.3232,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1173,_binary '\0','/33jVTjHv4MmJtSIRDQljMToYrXU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027474',7.2,1282,'en','Craig\'s Wife','Harriet, Walter Craig\'s wife, is an upper-class woman obsessed with control, material possessions and social status whose behavior makes difficult her relationship with domestic service and family members.','/30vQfNP0O40izigUrPc0WHffyey.jpg','1936-09-25',75,'Released','What was the sin of Craig\'s wife?','Craig\'s Wife',120357,1.2499,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1174,_binary '\0','/k9UBAuSLZq9ACLzGStRYDKDU2uu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027478',7.2,4113,'fr','Le Crime de Monsieur Lange','Mild-mannered novelist of Western fiction, Amédée Lange, and his colleagues take over a publishing house after their exploitative boss disappears, only for the superior to return and try to reclaim the profits from their successful cooperative.','/gCGunDNK9UGecWF5d1vEKkLbVuE.jpg','1936-01-24',80,'Released',NULL,'The Crime of Monsieur Lange',52677,1.7244,7.1,'F7YjUceObN8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1175,_binary '\0','/iu6iPyuByGrri5c3uPsiQt1Bwrm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027489',7.6,1880,'fr','César','Leaping forward twenty years, the trilogy continues with the death of Fanny\'s husband, Panisse, and the discovery of her secret by her son, Césariot. The young man resolves to track down his biological father, Marius, whose life has been fraught with calamity and poverty.','/bD2tr5HY23lWMw5b4LgI6YunCPA.jpg','1936-11-13',141,'Released',NULL,'César',43873,2.2719,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1176,_binary '\0','/oJgkQVUVhJOJXonF0UzafZXQrHs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027515',7.1,3419,'en','Desire','Madeleine steals a string of pearls in Paris and uses American engineer Tom, who is driving on his vacation to Spain, to get the pearls out of France. But getting the pearls back from him proves to be difficult without falling in love.','/eoYV0IyYQmmbYxhZEVUlGIwb6DT.jpg','1936-04-11',95,'Released','Love was her precious loot!','Desire',78998,2.6765,6.964,'0xhw_hctEow','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1177,_binary '\0','/u4HiWmTyxBKA6MIb33MCi02MhMF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027521',7,5545,'en','The Devil-Doll','Respected Parisian banker Paul Lavond is framed for robbery and murder by crooked associates and sent to prison. Years later, he escapes with a friend, a scientist who was working on a method to reduce humans to a height of mere inches (all for the good of humanity, of course). Lavond, however, is consumed with hatred for those who betrayed him, and takes the scientist\'s methods back to Paris to exact painful revenge.','/m5Wyaw9fx53gVUifKdgPiXKfceD.jpg','1936-07-10',78,'Released','Greater Than \"The Unholy Three\"','The Devil-Doll',29320,2.1033,6.8,'sQ-nxhAJir4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1178,_binary '\0','/aE9zfMnG4kGBf4SEyUZ5ehPsb6K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027532',7.7,11239,'en','Dodsworth','A retired auto manufacturer and his wife take a long-planned European vacation only to find that they want very different things from life.','/qpd9P54mLYvzdC6rBz56is8aeDB.jpg','1936-09-23',101,'Released','Here is a picture that was marked for greatness before it was ever screened!','Dodsworth',31507,2.199,7.1,'zrMuDl7vaTI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1179,_binary '\0','/coZolPUocZJG3Qgd1g4cyI2Qm6L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027545',6.3,9269,'en','Dracula\'s Daughter','A countess from Transylvania seeks a psychiatrist’s help to cure her vampiric cravings.','/y7xBkkRLcg1I0fXHO4yYC5SwBCX.jpg','1936-05-11',71,'Released','She gives you that WEIRD FEELING.','Dracula\'s Daughter',22440,2.9838,5.9,'E_2YyzNAT98','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1180,_binary '\0','/1p5slekaP3qzOhOVQ5YhglG0OUo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027552',7.4,2145,'fr','Drôle de drame','A French farce set in Victorian London where a botanist and his wife get into trouble when they pretend to go missing in order to hide from their sanctimonious cousin – an Anglican bishop who is leading a campaign against such writing.','/b5Pe2U3R4AZkoMImTdMk0H581UX.jpg','1937-10-20',95,'Released',NULL,'Bizarre, Bizarre',59950,1.6538,6.951,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1181,_binary '\0','/vGyi1QOTUDQRsYJheDmoU6ACLZG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027593',6.9,2506,'en','The Ex-Mrs. Bradford','A doctor is driven into an investigation of sinister goings-on at a horse race track by his mystery writer ex-wife.','/1cptWzKLijmmFTZ4bh53rIsDOrU.jpg','1936-04-24',82,'Released','The screen\'s number one society sleuth in a crime riddle dark with mystery!','The Ex-Mrs. Bradford',53858,2.0455,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1182,_binary '\0','/eV6Yn7YdFwQ6JT5JfWKv5Kld4kZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027623',6.9,2954,'en','Flash Gordon','Disaster seems imminent when scientists discover that the planet Mongo is about to crash into Earth. Luckily, heroic young Flash Gordon is on hand to lead an investigative mission into outer space and onto the speedily approaching planet. There, he and his best girl, Dale, who is along for the ride, learn that Ming, the devious ruler of Mongo, has purposely put the planet on a collision course with Earth, and only Flash can stop him.','/9MPf3bzsw1EtUjlXUGArFD80Y9q.jpg','1936-04-06',245,'Released','THRILLING STRANGE WORLD ADVENTURES','Flash Gordon',3632,2.2975,6.4,'NbnJB3DHAQ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1183,_binary '\0','/a4uWcOpL9fpdOdCNlod0esC4iY3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027630',7.1,5082,'en','Follow the Fleet','When the US Navy fleet docks at San Francisco, sailor Bake Baker tries to rekindle the flame with his old dancing partner, Sherry Martin, while Bake\'s buddy Bilge Smith romances Sherry\'s sister, Connie. But it\'s not all smooth sailing—Bake has a habit of losing Sherry\'s jobs for her and, despite Connie\'s dreams, Bilge is not ready to settle down.','/8crR3tx6JapNwH4WcrxDkOaDkRE.jpg','1936-02-20',110,'Released','In the Super-Dreadnought of Musical Shows','Follow the Fleet',28292,2.3953,6.9,'VSUlZFXSFAc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1184,_binary '\0','/nRBw8JYA3Li1d40kJN4AFMi5TT3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027652',7.8,14918,'en','Fury','Joe, who owns a gas station along with his brothers and is about to marry Katherine, travels to the small town where she lives to visit her, but is wrongly mistaken for a wanted kidnapper and arrested.','/u1kjLTUqmqjDMlRxcwCqWagjf6r.jpg','1936-06-05',92,'Released','Two lovers… victims of mob violence!','Fury',14615,3.3053,7.5,'79IBgDWagIU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1185,_binary '\0','/upCjSH8r85Zok72mMNU6ZcefniZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027657',5.8,1850,'en','The Garden of Allah','The star-crossed desert romance of a cloistered woman and a renegade monk.','/ilEUSPjSJC50sgsJgQkDesW7iok.jpg','1936-10-14',79,'Released','Two loves in conflict!','The Garden of Allah',151848,1.8978,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1186,_binary '\0','/5VSgKy4sMrdyThobNZVEW2Zp4gt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027664',6.5,1449,'en','The General Died at Dawn','China, 1930s, during the ravaging civil war. General Pen entrusts O\'Hara, an intrepid American adventurer, with the mission of providing a large sum of money to Mr. Wu with the task of buying weapons in Shanghai to help end General Yang\'s tyranny that keeps an entire province under his ruthless iron boot.','/mpt6AyISPBYesV8lFxED7PoHxZD.jpg','1936-11-17',98,'Released',NULL,'The General Died at Dawn',113916,1.7237,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1187,_binary '\0','/eYEeUDJizg4lcihQzLETlMJyUxT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027672',7.4,3307,'ja','祇園の姉妹','A geisha in the Gion district of Kyoto feels obliged to help her lover when he asks to stay with her after going bankrupt and leaving his wife. However, her younger sister opposes this, thinking that they should both find wealthy patrons to support them.','/pPm0GreGDWgCxHEQSJaUlchz2Lo.jpg','1936-10-15',69,'Released',NULL,'Sisters of the Gion',74581,1.8155,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1188,_binary '\0','/8ci8G1jmxuxos2ztUAm3dm617Ey.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027686',6.4,1377,'en','Gold Diggers of 1937','The partners of stage-producer J. J. Hobart gamble away the money for his new show. They enlist a gold-digging chorus girl to help get it back by conning an insurance company. But they don’t count on the persistence of insurance man Rosmer Peck and his secretary Norma Perry.','/5m02wlrOrt61BXskXVeyHFi8pwN.jpg','1936-12-28',101,'Released','COME ON AND CHEER IT\'S A \"GOLD DIGGERS\" YEAR!','Gold Diggers of 1937',57698,1.4825,6.1,'h4lmhamxe2I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1189,_binary '\0','/grhxDwykHzPzlOxE1sxenCliVK0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027687',6.1,1263,'en','The Golden Arrow','A fake heiress marries a common reporter to thwart the advances of gold-digging playboys.','/kLOi2qJxbLKKGPQvDaPoo22t7F7.jpg','1936-05-23',68,'Released','Here She Is! The 1935 Academy Award Winner in her first picture since winning filmdom\'s highest honor','The Golden Arrow',176259,1.2222,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1190,_binary '\0','/g4jdGrWYn0ZwrTs2hcs1MW1yaBm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027690',5.6,1491,'en','The Gorgeous Hussy','It\'s the early nineteenth century Washington. Young adult Margaret O\'Neal, Peggy to most that know her, is the daughter of Major William O\'Neal, who is the innkeeper of the establishment where most out-of-town politicians and military men stay when they\'re in Washington. Peggy is pretty and politically aware. She is courted by several of those politicians and military men who all want to marry her, except for the one with who she is truly in love.','/jvqWDuu9NRjB8MnIMunYH9GchfZ.jpg','1936-08-28',103,'Released','She swayed a nation..ruled the hearts of men...and spent her life trying to win the one she really loved!','The Gorgeous Hussy',112284,1.5402,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1191,_binary '\0','/eejpzqzvGL8jnyqlcZeEXKR5pdt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027697',6.3,1262,'en','Great Guy','A meat inspector sets out to rid his town of payoff deals affecting the quality of meat being sold to the public.','/AcqtAhoYNFR1kjXvuZiT5ZoY76A.jpg','1936-12-01',66,'Released','SINGLE HANDED- HE BATTLED A NEW KIND OF PUBLIC ENEMY!','Great Guy',46351,1.441,6.3,'26wXPERC1wY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1192,_binary '\0','/koCTizOkm1Aia2xwdwHm4nl0L8W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027698',6.6,9906,'en','The Great Ziegfeld','At the 1893 Chicago World\'s Fair, sideshow barker Florenz Ziegfeld turns the tables on his more-successful neighbor Billings, and also steals his girlfriend. This pattern repeats throughout their lives, as Ziegfeld makes and loses many fortunes putting on ever-bigger, more spectacular shows','/rhF6vYFVCaPCs7CgDqg3n4mNod3.jpg','1936-04-08',185,'Released','The Sensation of the Century!','The Great Ziegfeld',43277,3.532,6.3,'h-Rez1xM3yo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1193,_binary '\0','/sWLZoxw5p9ngxu4xNzDncBEsASL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027752',7.7,4650,'ja','一人息子','A rural widow sends her only son to Tokyo to receive a better education. Years later, she visits him and finds he has become a night school teacher struggling to support his wife and son.','/xFSHjmpIAyDkrheszNfSM99H3Bl.jpg','1936-09-15',87,'Released',NULL,'The Only Son',52047,1.4831,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1194,_binary '\0','/bboCUVG0rlYTBFF2mRxcZM4jMJr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027796',6.5,1535,'sv','Intermezzo','An intense love affair develops between a married concert violinist (Gösta Ekman) and his daughter\'s music teacher (Ingrid Bergman).','/xQTjATD3tMvBCCqX9TltI5zy4th.jpg','1936-11-16',93,'Released',NULL,'Intermezzo',125891,1.6072,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1195,_binary '\0','/wQrQMXXnJOq3WlweA3KDjjHuN7r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027800',6.5,3510,'en','The Invisible Ray','Dr. Janos Rukh discovers a certain type of radium that has almost magical healing properties. But the element has a dangerous side, too, and it has already started affecting Rukh. Consumed by paranoia, he begins to suspect that his wife is having an affair. Wild for revenge, Rukh hatches a deadly plot...using his own poisoned body as a weapon to kill.','/fAMfoQQkJrWtusXR0mDcTSAmhcG.jpg','1936-01-20',79,'Released','Delving into new, strange fields of mystery!','The Invisible Ray',27918,1.9315,6.365,'F96KrZysMJI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1196,_binary '\0','/qbRNXVVZdUaIgXK0m4jtlxjJsaw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027869',6.6,1977,'en','The Last of the Mohicans','The story is set in the British province of New York during the French and Indian War, and concerns—in part—a Huron massacre (with passive French acquiescence) of between 500 to 1,500 Anglo-American troops, who had honorably surrendered at Fort William Henry, plus some women and servants; the kidnapping of two sisters, daughters of the British commander; and their rescue by the last Mohicans.','/A6QezyupjtlFdEazInKtujn6eAH.jpg','1936-07-02',91,'Released','James Fenimore Cooper\'s Greatest Tale Of Rousing Adventure!','The Last of the Mohicans',23108,1.9204,6.36,'roVEH5QKEJA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1197,_binary '\0','/yIj4Y2BXbjr8Qem6Ly8QJWt4PgL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027884',7.8,9751,'en','Libeled Lady','When a major newspaper accuses wealthy socialite Connie Allenbury of being a home-wrecker, and she files a multi-million-dollar libel lawsuit, the publication\'s frazzled head editor, Warren Haggerty, must find a way to turn the tables on her. Soon Haggerty\'s harried fiancée, Gladys Benton, and his dashing friend Bill Chandler are in on a scheme that aims to discredit Connie, with amusing and unexpected results.','/mu2zGdHZJ9IASvnQktjGLZ4kU13.jpg','1936-10-09',98,'Released','At the top of their game.','Libeled Lady',31773,2.7767,7.3,'CgAF2tBoAZQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1198,_binary '\0','/pDSSSx5ipRMvFwVfhgGGUTxeOsi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027893',7.3,2874,'en','Little Lord Fauntleroy','An American boy turns out to be the heir of a wealthy British earl. He is sent to live with the irritable and unsentimental aristocrat, his grandfather.','/tH2RxIEugTQ5SwfiOfLhPcnopP8.jpg','1936-03-06',102,'Released','WHETHER YOUR HEART IS YOUNG OR OLD...THIS GREAT PICTURE TELLS A STORY THAT WILL TOUCH YOU DEEPLY!','Little Lord Fauntleroy',23114,1.837,6.8,'OMmxSELuP-8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1199,_binary '\0','/xRD6SIjR2ezwcMKw6J5UX7gef3v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027902',6.9,1309,'en','Lloyd\'s of London','Norfolk, England, 1770. The nephew of an innkeeper and the son of a reverend maintain a very close friendship until, after living a great adventure, they must separate their paths. The former will head his footsteps to London and bound his destiny to Lloyd\'s, a thriving insurance company; the latter will eventually become one of the greatest heroes in the history of the British Empire.','/7Fg6Kcgrbw3Ek6SCK6DYDp4Y0OT.jpg','1936-11-25',113,'Released','THEY LOVE..AS AN EMPIRE ROCKS!','Lloyd\'s of London',81687,2.0801,7.3,'c9ZGGQKSkug','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1200,_binary '\0','/293StC9N7IZh155N1p4IL3bF9hf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027914',6,1467,'en','Love on the Run','A runaway bride and an undercover reporter get caught up in political intrigue as they lead a merry chase across Europe and uncover a spy plot.','/xvWUy94AMSS1QWd1Msu1W4YpHZb.jpg','1936-11-20',80,'Released','Joan Crawford - On the run! Clark Gable - Running after her! Franchot Tone - Running after both of them!','Love on the Run',61541,1.4761,6.5,'sSSeMlI3CnE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1201,_binary '\0','/42CSd2dFMtB1jZQzOB9bLzO7S4y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027938',6.6,1400,'en','The Man Who Changed His Mind','Dr. Laurence, a once-respectable scientist, begins to research the origin of the mind and the soul. The science community rejects him, and he risks losing everything for which he has worked. He begins to use his discoveries to save his research and further his own causes, thereby becoming ... a mad scientist, almost unstoppable.','/dBED6CQG2K81L19occPCO7IEEP7.jpg','1936-09-11',66,'Released',NULL,'The Man Who Changed His Mind',30640,1.7925,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1202,_binary '\0','/d2TRgU9AMB7PHQ36Y2tZo0y9g9k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027948',6.3,3051,'en','Mary of Scotland','The recently widowed Mary Stuart returns to Scotland to reclaim her throne but is opposed by her half-brother and her own Scottish lords.','/AKInVpVxnGQLSrmnOUoqTlCtdm.jpg','1936-07-28',123,'Released','History called her \"The Temptress\"!','Mary of Scotland',43875,2.181,6.2,'_LJZP_4_EN4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1203,_binary '\0','/1PP0udaiEL3GStMe2leqfACzeVT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027969',6.5,1986,'en','The Milky Way','Timid milkman, Burleigh Sullivan, somehow knocks out a boxing champ in a brawl. The fighter\'s manager decides to build up the milkman\'s reputation in a series of fixed fights and then have the champ beat him to regain his title.','/kSbzM4MI4K2h0R3jBu9N73Zhseq.jpg','1936-02-07',89,'Released','A fighting milkman who outfights and outsmarts everyone-including himself!','The Milky Way',41349,1.2652,6.1,'3dyVwv3VHNs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1204,_binary '\0','/kSlO1pHpwQfPQdgVPr7dJiJNtJ8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027977',8.5,287820,'en','Modern Times','A bumbling tramp desires to build a home with a young woman, yet is thwarted time and time again by his lack of experience and habit of being in the wrong place at the wrong time...','/AthaPakkuCLROdKxtRbKWclkDBK.jpg','1936-02-05',87,'Released','He stands alone as the greatest entertainer of modern times! No one on earth can make you laugh as heartily or touch your heart as deeply...the whole world laughs, cries and thrills to his priceless genius!','Modern Times',3082,11.5214,8.281,'NNznUyDmSFc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1205,_binary '\0','/4HndddVOLbvifowXjNpdkkF8Q71.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0027996',7.8,25225,'en','Mr. Deeds Goes to Town','Longfellow Deeds lives in a small town, leading a small town kind of life. When a relative dies and leaves Deeds a fortune, Longfellow moves to the big city where he becomes an instant target for everyone. Deeds outwits them all until Babe Bennett comes along. When small-town boy meets big-city girl anything can, and does, happen.','/20p5Cxib8wX0AyGl5i1uwPm6UwC.jpg','1936-04-09',115,'Released','Rocking America with laughter!','Mr. Deeds Goes to Town',24807,3.8682,7.5,'eOu8pem4Huk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1206,_binary '\0','/96cNUk1Uj8fQcmbOTnpBauUdqzC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028010',7.9,28974,'en','My Man Godfrey','Fifth Avenue socialite Irene Bullock needs a \"forgotten man\" to win a scavenger hunt, and no one is more forgotten than Godfrey Park, who resides in a dump by the East River. Irene hires Godfrey as a servant for her riotously unhinged family, to the chagrin of her spoiled sister, Cornelia, who tries her best to get Godfrey fired. As Irene falls for her new butler, Godfrey turns the tables and teaches the frivolous Bullocks a lesson or two.','/wtfOW7fIxBZWY78rvUoPpWhMSiR.jpg','1936-09-02',95,'Released','Butler! FOR THE COCK-EYEDEST FAMILY in the WHOLE WORLD!...and the butler-blonde battle was on!','My Man Godfrey',13562,3.6167,7.59,'6zkZd9GkxWc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1207,_binary '\0','/nUAuAEaLjkg6iGYC5DaRhSMt9OQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028021',7.2,2834,'ja','浪華悲歌','Ayako becomes the mistress of her boss in order to pay her father\'s debt and prevent him from going to prison for embezzlement.','/qoLPt7rahsTv3mQketPUhD3kRlA.jpg','1936-05-28',71,'Released',NULL,'Osaka Elegy',43877,1.8628,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1208,_binary '\0','/oHWUCElG26fTPVFtsn0iWVbGxDf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028070',7.3,3803,'en','Our Relations','Two sailors get caught in a mountain of mix-ups when they meet their long-lost twins. Laurel and Hardy play themselves and their twins.','/pW7fpVDBWRDVXoFleXMgXb3p5bh.jpg','1936-09-15',73,'Released','Two innocent sailors on a holiday....but they ended up all at sea.....','Our Relations',46026,2.0554,7.048,'Ch3ASkOlxx4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1209,_binary '\0','/g0SCy0sGaJa381iDQRxqonCMTGN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028096',7.5,16065,'en','The Petrified Forest','Gabby, the waitress in an isolated Arizona diner, dreams of a bigger and better life. One day penniless intellectual Alan drifts into the joint and the two strike up a rapport. Soon enough, notorious killer Duke Mantee takes the diner\'s inhabitants hostage. Surrounded by miles of desert, the patrons and staff are forced to sit tight with Mantee and his gang overnight.','/kjE4pw6mqoA1OJHNLq1aol4y4C1.jpg','1936-02-08',82,'Released','AGAIN THEY TRIUMPH!...The stars of \'Human Bondage\' in a picture greater than the play!','The Petrified Forest',17030,2.4419,7.1,'HeOYbFJxZqc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1210,_binary '\0','/f0XZOJYk9sNk22qDbzGfR7Q0wbf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028108',6.8,2746,'en','The Plainsman','Wild Bill Hickok, Calamity Jane, and Buffalo Bill go up against Indians and a gunrunner.','/nItYdO7zIfcxvYkA737LjBJJw3R.jpg','1936-11-16',113,'Released','IT\'S MIGHTY OUTDOOR ADVENTURE!','The Plainsman',43885,2.6751,6.5,'rPFgkV2XAIM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1211,_binary '\0','/wJT7AJHs545rH4rH7K6Xi3A4cBY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028118',7,1733,'en','Poor Little Rich Girl','Cossetted and bored, Barbara Barry is finally sent off to school by her busy if doting widowed soap manufacturer father. When her nurse is injured en route, Barbara finds herself alone in town, ending up as part of radio song-and-dance act Dolan and Dolan sponsored by a rival soap company.','/w1yAlXypI8T7gr4BJloTYoNRalE.jpg','1936-07-18',79,'Released','ARE YOU AN ARMFUL OF HEAVEN ON EARTH? ...YOU ARE---BUT DEFINITELY!','Poor Little Rich Girl',43268,1.7461,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1212,_binary '\0','/arJE3f2QvXZhCHTdOmSnnHBSJzw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028138',6.7,1426,'en','The Princess Comes Across','A Swedish princess boards an ocean liner in Europe en route to an acting career in America and finds herself getting inconveniently attached to a bandleader returning home. To complicate matters, a blackmailer on board apparently knows she is not who she claims to be - and he has his sights set on other passengers with secrets of their own. In the meantime an escaped killer has stowed away under someone else\'s identity, and is killing again to cover his tracks; five international police detectives on board are heading the investigation to find him. When evidence points to the princess and bandleader, they must find the killer themselves - before he finds them.','/cS3hcy32cef12zrgDRdP013j73q.jpg','1936-05-22',76,'Released','Those rollicking STARS of \"HANDS ACROSS THE TABLE\"','The Princess Comes Across',31879,2.0986,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1213,_binary '\0','/sv6KLwDXi7QNSDcdSofc2NF3tk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028141',7.2,2878,'en','The Prisoner of Shark Island','After healing the leg of the murderer John Wilkes Booth — responsible for the assassination of President Abraham Lincoln — Dr. Samuel A. Mudd, considered part of the atrocious conspiracy, is sentenced to life imprisonment and sent to the sinister Shark Island Prison.','/sRwHEfjPmRhK9rbqV3XNThERKCX.jpg','1936-02-28',93,'Released','Based on the life story of Dr. Samuel A. Mudd','The Prisoner of Shark Island',77245,3.3508,6.8,'_rTOpZMm5Rc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1214,_binary '\0','/f87Lsbz3TWb1YaJaYSYU2uUqFHc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028167',7,2247,'en','Rembrandt','A character study depicting the life of Rembrandt Van Rijn at the height of his fame in the mid 1600s. Beginning with the death of his wife, Rembrandt\'s work takes a dark turn, which offends many of his patrons.','/mGoJsDTITN1WBCEUzbSQEEUIGzj.jpg','1936-11-06',85,'Released','He knew all women! Their lives...Loves...Their souls!','Rembrandt',50031,1.2997,6.8,'3jyDh8rk0CI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1215,_binary '\0','/17rR6xaidQVXndd3fablsWo6V3Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028174',3.5,2054,'en','Revolt of the Zombies','The story is set in Cambodia in the years following WWI. An evil count has come into possession of the secret methods by which men can be transformed into walking zombies and uses these unholy powers to create a race of slave laborers. An expedition is sent to the ruins of Angkor Wat, in hopes of ending the count\'s activities once and for all. Unfortunately, one of the members of the expedition has his own agenda.','/37LMhQ3wk95yxhhhMdHGzkT5lHw.jpg','1936-06-04',62,'Released','WEIRDEST LOVE STORY IN 2000 YEARS!','Revolt of the Zombies',23389,1.5932,3.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1216,_binary '\0','/m2FA2TCgTTgrH3tRAtoo3e8Yyq5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028201',7.5,2815,'fr','Le Roman d\'un tricheur','Life story of a charming scoundrel, with little dialogue other than the star/director\'s witty narration. As a boy, only he survives a family tragedy when he\'s deprived of supper (poisonous mushrooms!) for stealing...concluding that dishonesty pays. Through years of dabbling in crime and amusing adventures, two women appear and reappear in his life, a dazzling blonde jewel thief and a stunning brunette gambler. Finally, he meets the mysterious Charbonnier who had saved his life in World War I, leading to the surprising next phase in his career...','/qxoUomd2i4jzLbGKQFPreLucAi5.jpg','1936-10-02',81,'Released',NULL,'The Story of a Cheat',65642,1.3345,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1217,_binary '\0','/kRY4Y3en26BiJCC0GO4YZ4EDyOb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028203',6.4,2456,'en','Romeo and Juliet','Young love is poisoned by a generations long feud between two noble families.','/tGK16kxbsSrNnuRyhw57Yl1H20w.jpg','1936-09-03',125,'Released','The classic love story by William Shakespeare.','Romeo and Juliet',43879,2.2394,6.3,'qC26Q16bNdA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1218,_binary '\0','/kCS199RUNeox68UV7C4NZrx9u4M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028207',6.6,1520,'en','Rose Marie','An incognito opera singer falls for a policeman who has been assigned to track down her fugitive brother.','/ofVqpswFWyN6v7b7sz4P4ljFAMo.jpg','1936-01-31',113,'Released','She scarcely knew his name but his caress spoke the language of love!','Rose Marie',43880,1.7044,6.1,'cBvLS3TxH5Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1219,_binary '\0','/hdl5cBE9zx5vBKuJ3RUQW0o1yEf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028212',7,21008,'en','Sabotage','Karl Anton Verloc and his wife own a small cinema in a quiet London suburb where they live seemingly happily. But Mrs. Verloc does not know that her husband has a secret that will affect their relationship and threaten her teenage brother\'s life.','/A6cyOt9mhmvWA2uHcVsGkcCaHCz.jpg','1936-12-02',77,'Released','A bomb plot... A Killing... Justice.','Sabotage',12684,3.1363,6.698,'178s548EjM4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1220,_binary '\0','/paFUPuG8ImGQwCtR8vgwTW9iZWB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028216',7.1,6705,'en','San Francisco','A beautiful singer and a battling priest try to reform a Barbary Coast saloon owner in the days before the great earthquake and subsequent fires in 1906.','/zQF1UDB0ck4dRfKAn4XixGrCkjx.jpg','1936-06-26',115,'Released','She Fell In Love . . . with the toughest guy on the toughest street in the world!','San Francisco',43881,2.4669,6.6,'Eawnyxm9vWs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1221,_binary '\0','/27mt9c1e4dNshDcR3sVoM7Cz5X8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028219',5.8,2720,'en','Satan Met a Lady','In the second screen version of The Maltese Falcon, a detective is caught between a lying seductress and a lady jewel thief.','/wuwkuzYxdoQqiuwrDfazINCxYHA.jpg','1936-07-22',74,'Released','HE MADE LOVE TO HER TO MAKE HER CONFESS MURDER! Then She Made A Confession That Made Even The Devil\'s Ears Burn!','Satan Met a Lady',28256,2.5959,5.8,'E1wEoM9sl70','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1222,_binary '\0','/nfsTvfanGeIicFPKsYSAO7rpNqV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028231',6.4,9793,'en','Secret Agent','During World War I, a novelist declared dead is recruited by British intelligence and sent to Switzerland under a new identity to assassinate a German spy. Teamed with a fellow agent posing as his wife and an eccentric assassin known as “the General,” the trio close in on their target — until two of them grow ambivalent when their duty to the mission clashes with their consciences.','/vHfEuqttHs2fXLGgkSxC5nh7AHz.jpg','1936-05-11',86,'Released','Dead Women Tell No Tales Was The Motto of This Charming Lady Killer!','Secret Agent',2761,2.6596,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1223,_binary '\0','/lWRtcQRzmqN4Rtl9JoI40ff4cd9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028249',7.4,4117,'en','Show Boat','Sheltered beauty Magnolia Hawkes takes over as the leading lady on a Mississippi riverboat show when mixed-race Julie and her white husband are forced out of town by a prejudiced sheriff. Charismatic opportunist Gaylord Ravenal wins Magnolia\'s heart, but his gambling losses threaten to ruin their chances for a happy marriage.','/vFJ1vdOvOJjKVsoi8x7eZUthAJm.jpg','1936-05-17',113,'Released','HEAR Glorious New Music and Songs by Jerome Kern and Oscar Hammerstein II:','Show Boat',31548,1.5953,6.7,'pVPmbpPwFwY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1224,_binary '\0','/dNrOYlSjx9F6WPrtVaKai6OAa1k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028313',7.2,3596,'en','The Story of Louis Pasteur','A true story about Louis Pasteur, who revolutionized medicine by proving that much disease is caused by microbes, that sanitation is paramount and that at least some diseases can be cured by vaccinations.','/tEYBb5ZKK22TWSwLY1hkFSD2rjG.jpg','1936-02-22',86,'Released','If This Story Didn\'t Have a Happy Ending YOU and YOU and YOU Might Not Be Alive Today to See It...','The Story of Louis Pasteur',74469,2.1637,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1225,_binary '\0','/6GY3CjFqWE8wl6BxrwmHGrvXCm2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028315',7.1,1624,'en','Stowaway','Chin-Ching gets lost in Shanghai and is befriended by American playboy Tommy Randall. She falls asleep in his car which winds up on a ship headed for America. Susan Parker, also on the ship, marries Randall to give Chin-Ching a family.','/cA8G6s7qAK9kI9DKvbvEWmQkbbe.jpg','1936-12-25',87,'Released','She sings and speaks Chinese!','Stowaway',27597,1.4135,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1226,_binary '\0','/9tRdjGy803VMXEuRQyKME0VFPEo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028330',6.4,1835,'en','Suzy','A French air ace discovers that his showgirl wife\'s first husband is still alive.','/r7DOZC5fCuqoPnZNnpRimFFBdea.jpg','1936-07-20',93,'Released','THE TOAST OF GAY PAREE!','Suzy',52358,1.2661,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1227,_binary '\0','/8fByeHpSz4vmX2RAcNYlHMXlpcL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028331',5.8,1759,'en','Sweeney Todd, the Demon Barber of Fleet Street','It is England in the 1830s. London\'s dockside is teeming with ships and sailors who have made their fortune in foreign lands. Sweeney Todd, a Fleet Street barber, awaits the arrival of men whose first port of call is for a good, close shave. For most it will be the last time they are seen alive. Using a specially designed barber\'s chair, Sweeney Todd despatches his victims to the cellar below, where he robs them of their new found fortunes and chops their remains into small pieces. Meanwhile, Mrs Lovett is enjoying a roaring trade for her popular penny meat pies.','/4EmPHyueexsshJC7nFcQgi6nGGq.jpg','1936-03-01',76,'Released','Brownbeards, Blackbeards, Redbeards. He Polished Them All Off!','Sweeney Todd, the Demon Barber of Fleet Street',87911,2.0858,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1228,_binary '\0','/berFcW4jty3bPar7SVPIyIcqru9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028333',7.4,15733,'en','Swing Time','Lucky is tricked into missing his own wedding to Margaret and has to make $25,000 so her father will allow him to marry her. He and business partner Pop go to New York where they run into dancing instructor Penny. She and Lucky form a successful dance partnership, but romance is blighted by his old attachment to Margaret and hers for Ricky.','/3iukS0hzUAmhwHdqWrgQuKwMnJY.jpg','1936-08-28',103,'Released','A glorious songburst of gaiety and laughter!','Swing Time',20325,2.9878,6.8,'TgimMImX-VE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1229,_binary '\0','/c1rJR3hrMbyK3FWJiMSVRFDDrKp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028345',6.5,3860,'en','Tarzan Escapes','White hunter Captain Fry tries to take Tarzan back to civilization, caged for public display. He arrives in the jungle with Jane\'s cousins, Eric and Rita, who want Jane\'s help in claiming a fortune left her.','/rhh3vQt32phMCDgQ3OamIYX2tOK.jpg','1936-11-06',89,'Released','It\'s New! It\'s amazing! 2 years to produce!','Tarzan Escapes',38661,2.877,6.9,'rGxxiv7MCUY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1230,_binary '\0','/deor9xEiYQIjmNfipzBhwQ6yfgh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028346',3.8,9988,'en','Tell Your Children','High-school principal Dr. Alfred Carroll relates to an audience of parents that marijuana can have devastating effects on teens: a drug supplier entices several restless teens, Mary and Jimmy Lane, sister and brother, and Bill, Mary\'s boyfriend, into frequenting a reefer house. Gradually, Bill and Jimmy are drawn into smoking dope, which affects their family lives.','/pLEy5EpJ09ilda44HDxkrGOQsKl.jpg','1938-06-15',66,'Released','Public enemy no. 1. Women cry for it… Men will die for it!','Tell Your Children',37833,1.7549,4.4,'R_vo0UEteKU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1231,_binary '\0','/oBlTxZS8aSLH1i67nczMeSuwg2a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028355',7.1,3294,'en','Theodora Goes Wild','The small-town prudes of Lynnfield are up in arms over \'The Sinner,\' a sexy best-seller. They little suspect that author \'Caroline Adams\' is really Theodora Lynn, scion of the town\'s leading family. Michael Grant, devil-may-care book jacket illustrator, penetrates Theodora\'s incognito and sets out to \'free her\' from Lynnfield against her will. But Michael has a secret too, and gets a taste of his own medicine.','/rCrLr32lMOeqKHrBuxAPYpDEDJX.jpg','1936-11-12',94,'Released','RIOTOUS ROMANTIC COMEDY!','Theodora Goes Wild',52429,1.5949,6.6,'D0bLmd8lYh0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1232,_binary '\0','/5F4vuX92TxKcZH5hdunrgl0mBRi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028356',7.4,3632,'en','These Three','Close friends Martha and Karen build a private boarding school together with the aid of the local doctor Joe. The school takes off and many students enroll, one of whom is a trouble-maker who tells a scandalous lie that threatens to destroy the trio\'s lives.','/2qGq9jTAaf6XtcGBXSf2xUHxzAl.jpg','1936-03-18',93,'Released','Were they the innocent victims of a whispering campaign?','These Three',54569,1.7765,7.1,'Ps8eDcwPN_I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1233,_binary '\0','/wa6uAXC6ei0BwaDiShwLjbMCLfe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028358',6.6,10312,'en','Things to Come','The story of a century: a decades-long second World War leaves plague and anarchy, then a rational state rebuilds civilization and attempts space travel.','/5mjLuKluuMzBiCKTA28Qa8TR1wc.jpg','1936-03-31',100,'Released','The future is here!','Things to Come',3596,2.7613,6.478,'wemRBFFbhKI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1234,_binary '\0','/e3h2salMB01NHCO6tOldoJXLwOE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028367',7.3,1226,'en','Three Godfathers','In a town called New Jerusalem, three bandits hold up a bank. After a gun battle with the townspeople, the three robbers retreat into the scorching Arizona desert. There, they happen upon an ill woman stranded with her child. As the mother dies, she begs the men to take care of her infant. The fugitives want to save the baby -- but to do so, they\'ll have to travel back to New Jerusalem, where they are wanted men. Remade as 3 Godfathers (1949).','/wz1YPPbZVLV1OJJfh5a3oTJtdW.jpg','1936-03-06',81,'Released','On the brink of hell...a baby\'s smile came into the darkened souls of three bad men!','Three Godfathers',149955,1.5398,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1235,_binary '\0','/iuqShSmgUOCM72Mu4u7Btqelflx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028373',6.5,1735,'en','Three Smart Girls','The three Craig sisters – Penny, Kay, and Joan – go to New York to stop their divorced father from marrying gold digger Donna Lyons and reunite him with their mother.','/zae2mPsb621u2U4vLa2KkDGG7el.jpg','1936-12-20',84,'Released','They SAY nothing They HEAR nothing They SEE nothing but KNOW everything!','Three Smart Girls',64142,1.7781,6.5,'_n-U6vAbL0s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1236,_binary '\0','/fUKKCOLwfuEmp9FGkoZeeIhKEAQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028401',6.8,1565,'en','The Trail of the Lonesome Pine','A well-established tale of a long-running feud between two mountain clans.','/6x9MA5AAfGYuRLCDT8d2dogYtC4.jpg','1936-03-13',96,'Released','The Technicolor spectacle that blazes the trail to an all-time high in adventure!','The Trail of the Lonesome Pine',76094,2.0881,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1237,_binary '\0','/aX3GHHv1y1DkwBOzuea7pRCyE49.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028436',6.9,1348,'ru','У самого синего моря','Two men shipwrecked on an island in the Caspian Sea are saved by members of a collective farm, where they work on its fishing boats and woo the young woman leading the fishermen.','/fQDPRwilsf5Ma0OPqOLqXNhSXTD.jpg','1936-04-20',69,'Released',NULL,'By the Bluest of Seas',110733,0.8502,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1238,_binary '\0','/tdId0HvxUViSxwXmmRqV1Pq7W4m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028478',6.6,3704,'en','The Walking Dead','Down-on-his-luck John Ellman is framed for a judge\'s murder. After he\'s convicted and sentenced to death, witnesses come forth and prove his innocence. But it was too late for a stay to be granted and Ellman is executed. A doctor uses an experimental procedure to restore him to life, though the full outcome is other than expected.','/vRZ0NNqaQewNuN6yvw2HXowFCiu.jpg','1936-02-29',66,'Released','HE DIED a man with a hunger to love... and returned a monster with an instinct to kill.','The Walking Dead',27115,2.4409,6.27,'mw6KvFvYp_w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1239,_binary '\0','/x5PiKsCxqweRo3bAoNeWZgCrSlv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028505',7,4385,'en','Wife vs. Secretary','Linda, the wife of a publishing executive, suspects that her husband Van’s relationship with his attractive secretary Whitey is more than professional.','/ufPxYmsDDGNUv2qbAtZhXr5m4rU.jpg','1936-02-28',88,'Released','3 GREAT STARS IN THE PERFECT TRIANGLE!','Wife vs. Secretary',38721,2.0977,6.727,'6QotiVKXfUU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1240,_binary '\0','/aBBPL7f2CqGxO0etZI7NqMNfdzE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028510',6,1306,'en','Winds of the Wasteland','The arrival of the telegraph put Pony Express riders like John Blair and his pal Smoky out of work. A race will decide whether they or stageline owner Drake get the government mail contract.','/sD0v5nxEoiRG3hwyL9OulUjNcBQ.jpg','1936-07-06',54,'Released','A six-shooter writes the law as war flames on the range! Adventure---as bullets blaze the pioneer trail!','Winds of the Wasteland',40743,2.3436,5.2,'yfFFZ3HCI1E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1241,_binary '\0','/qlGQSScyNAZcGYrd2NKJm83BA1f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028575',7.2,3841,'en','Angel','While vacationing without her busy British diplomat husband, a married woman falls for another man.','/5zHcGQOUSAhp9Dqzwxe6vPGPfHo.jpg','1937-10-29',91,'Released','I want love - and I\'m going to get it!','Angel',44208,2.0864,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1242,_binary '\0','/hkYHYp6IrVbDE39ffoGofTIsVj5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028597',7.6,23534,'en','The Awful Truth','Unfounded suspicions lead a married couple to begin divorce proceedings, whereupon they start undermining each other\'s attempts to find new romance.','/2VtsJoxvjpcMpwh0gweS8IMfHxO.jpg','1937-10-21',91,'Released','Danger! Wild woman on the loose!','The Awful Truth',14675,3.5082,7.2,'FeRYj5IeBug','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1243,_binary '\0','/94XikBlAUQOwAqHW5C56akC0TlV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028659',6.4,1318,'en','Breakfast for Two','After a night on the town, Jonathan Blair wakes to find that Texan Valentine Ransome has escorted him home. Valentine is attracted to Jonathan and sets out first to reform him, and his family\'s near-bankrupt shipping company, and then to marry him. In her way is Jonathan\'s fiancée, actress Carol Wallace.','/amtKYOhdWh0jxQtRJdciPZOrwvg.jpg','1937-10-22',67,'Released','SHE GOT HER MAN WITH A SOCK IN THE EYE!','Breakfast for Two',83240,1.0769,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1244,_binary '\0','/3kLPIgDSh9gFA7IpYoRoIbZRDcm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028661',6.3,1396,'en','The Bride Wore Red','A poor singer in a bar masquerades as a rich society woman thanks to a rich benefactor.','/y1a34gBh7JnHWV5yL0baeNvOav4.jpg','1937-10-08',103,'Released','2 weeks to be a lady! 2 weeks to feather her nest! 2 weeks to make one man say \"I do!\"','The Bride Wore Red',112885,1.7462,6.7,'HBMi1LvfgQs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1245,_binary '\0','/vJRSLrUOHPp4fs94XUAFblAOf8D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028665',6.7,1533,'en','Broadway Melody of 1938','Steve Raleight wants to produce a show on Broadway. He finds a backer, Herman Whipple and a leading lady, Sally Lee. But Caroline Whipple forces Steve to use a known star, not a newcomer. Sally purchases a horse, she used to train when her parents had a farm before the depression and with to ex-vaudevillians, Sonny Ledford and Peter Trott she trains it to win a race, providing the money Steve needs for his show.','/45PV63ncLTROIlyDTVFvVaaYPyL.jpg','1937-08-20',110,'Released','So New It\'s A Year Ahead!','Broadway Melody of 1938',43857,2.3258,6.6,'z4GGsEGgSzk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1246,_binary '\0','/ecHSq4vcOcSatl6kBzxpcEpaQQf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028683',7.3,9604,'en','Camille','Life in 1847 Paris is as spirited as champagne and as unforgiving as the gray morning after. In gambling dens and lavish soirees, men of means exert their wills and women turned courtesans exult in pleasure. One such woman is Marguerite Gautier, who begins a sumptuous romance with Armand Duval.','/78p9egiU16QpJNvmSVa4Vnr0JUK.jpg','1936-12-26',109,'Released','You who are so young—where can you have learned all you know about women like me?','Camille',43874,3.1862,7,'wSshWjTKd6Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1247,_binary '\0','/2eKw8s2m2MZv0fLrmavNDZUS4BE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028691',7.9,12102,'en','Captains Courageous','Harvey, the arrogant and spoiled son of an indulgent absentee-father, falls overboard from a transatlantic steamship and is rescued by a fishing vessel on the Grand Banks. Harvey fails to persuade them to take him ashore, nor convince the crew of his wealth. The captain offers him a low-paid job, until they return to port, as part of the crew that turns him into a mature, considerate young man.','/qhJNHLwIcMqDKBwsr9uMDOumO33.jpg','1937-06-25',115,'Released','As great as \"Mutiny on the Bounty\"','Captains Courageous',16515,2.9341,7.4,'fP19-5_EULo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1248,_binary '\0','/xk1LSunFpEOjlJ54kAbBuvpZav5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028707',6.7,1817,'en','Charlie Chan at Monte Carlo','Although Charlie and Lee are in Monaco for an art exhibit, they become caught up in a feud between rival financiers which involves the Chan\'s in a web of blackmail and murder.','/5tFNym9qNzVfUI77t6JdYVgnDdL.jpg','1937-12-17',71,'Released','Triple murder for high stakes! A new high in mystery excitement! And laughs, too!','Charlie Chan at Monte Carlo',38455,1.9136,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1249,_binary '\0','/3Z2BUM3T8Ync78KgoluKbG1qvsW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028708',7,1981,'en','Charlie Chan at the Olympics','Get ready for a Gold Medal murder mystery! This \"tense, thrilling mystery\" (\'California Congress of Parents and Teachers\') pits Charlie Chan against international spies who are using the Berlin Olympic games as the perfect cover...for cold-blooded murder!','/4a0iIxRy17FqwLeFh1bZ78ooy6J.jpg','1937-05-21',71,'Released','Murderous Spies invade Olympic Games!','Charlie Chan at the Olympics',25148,1.8446,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1250,_binary '\0','/s3QbZf5rSUjNT1ehdve7YEljLIz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028709',7.1,1770,'en','Charlie Chan on Broadway','Returning from European exile where she avoided testifying against her criminal associates, a former singer with a tell-all diary is murdered to insure her silence.','/60aIC1jxjsknG4c11lvUxsVzW9b.jpg','1937-09-22',68,'Released',NULL,'Charlie Chan on Broadway',38454,1.7951,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1251,_binary '\0','/qxemi7eEgn5pqov7lsNPZyDwsmA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028737',7.4,1491,'en','Confession','Vera Kowalska is put on trial for murdering concert pianist Michael Michailow. In court it is revealed that some years earlier Michael ruined Vera\'s life.','/tK3HzkEDZAbkc4YaeqKez49NFp4.jpg','1937-08-19',87,'Released','HEARTBREAK written in blood and tears!','Confession',92352,1.4953,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1252,_binary '\0','/fbhH4yT41Q8CNPbj5SUHERZnnus.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028739',6.5,1870,'en','Conquest','A Polish countess is dispatched by her country to become Napoleon Bonaparte\'s mistress at the urging of Polish leaders, who feel she might influence him to support Polish independence.','/wVnEeoRAUw57WHyneZhXCNjv5YD.jpg','1937-10-22',113,'Released','The Love Story of Marie Walewska','Conquest',30630,1.66,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1253,_binary '\0','/ug4E4V0gwC00HEydgF2F3OXEdjF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028757',6.8,2641,'en','A Damsel in Distress','Lady Alyce Marshmorton must marry soon, and the staff of Tottney Castle have laid bets on who she\'ll choose, with young Albert wagering on \'Mr. X\'. After Alyce goes to London to meet a beau she is restricted to the castle to curb her scandalous behavior. Albert then summons Jerry to Alyce\'s aid in order to \'protect his investment\'.','/uqRcVA1JCbpPngcXu68Gzm8qR7I.jpg','1937-11-19',101,'Released','With Sword in Hand He Goes to the Head of the Clash!','A Damsel in Distress',66473,2.2947,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1254,_binary '\0','/r9tXK2BOmdjHcFQ8QatBh0XoGpK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028767',6.2,1644,'en','Dark Journey','British double agent Madeleine Goddard meets and falls in love with German spy Baron Karl Von Marwitz during World War I.','/i1ac0OKN7ApGfN7KX55dtUWGiBL.jpg','1937-07-02',77,'Released','Her lips kissed... but never told!','Dark Journey',90523,1.3951,6.5,'HaOJ0g228RQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1255,_binary '\0','/oZDRp2YU6op4nsixT69fz8MfH1J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028772',7.5,15503,'en','A Day at the Races','Doctor Hugo Hackenbush, Tony, and Stuffy try and save Judy\'s sanitarium by winning a big race with a finicky horse owned by Judy\'s boyfriend Gil. There are a few problems. Hackenbush, who was recently put in charge of the sanitarium, isn\'t really a doctor, he\'s a veterinarian.','/2TYWSyAMbaFN3p3ewwmzweDUSLC.jpg','1937-06-11',109,'Released','Three Great Laff Stars ! . . . more gags and gals . . . more songs and dances !','A Day at the Races',11939,3.6279,7.1,'z29ojMxZp_o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1256,_binary '\0','/4q7kVPAgX8tgRvG99JrWdgo5FLK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028773',7.2,9729,'en','Dead End','The lives of a young man and woman, an infamous gangster and a group of street kids converge one day in a volatile New York City slum.','/5ZYJY5qZOj7dPfjSdnM7gFk2Ch0.jpg','1937-08-27',93,'Released','THE GREATEST GANGSTER THRILLER THAT EVER EXPLODED FROM THE SCREEN!','Dead End',27973,2.5049,7,'_MrEyLB7qQM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1257,_binary '\0','/obwcr31XRSkFtt7a9WcoSFJoHni.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028804',6.9,2886,'en','Double Wedding','A bohemian free spirit helps meek Waldo win back his fiancée and falls in love with her over-controlling sister in the process.','/76A4FIQuX4gbKVUDtVHkKvcTunY.jpg','1937-10-15',87,'Released','A Riot of Laughs!','Double Wedding',20642,1.7695,6.4,'8Prjqi4wOzw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1258,_binary '\0','/nh6IvmqGkQE5Vxz4Sqb2Zbnconl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028816',7.5,4790,'en','Easy Living','J.B. Ball, a rich financier, gets fed up with his free-spending family. He takes his wife\'s just-bought (very expensive) sable coat and throws it out the window, it lands on poor hard-working girl Mary Smith. But it isn\'t so easy to just give away something so valuable, as he soon learns.','/jAiagfGw23B79vmgHmNTKL7K7IT.jpg','1937-07-16',88,'Released','It\'s dizzy - it\'s daffy, It\'s cockeyed - it\'s laughy!','Easy Living',80364,2.1198,7.155,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1259,_binary '\0','/edq2HcBmJKlyUkzCfCrw7Q2LgxJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028818',7.3,2403,'en','The Edge of the World','A way of life is dying on a remote Scottish island, but some of the inhabitants resist evacuating to the mainland.','/nkf7e1CB1Bh9z3V05m1zZ1yC78t.jpg','1937-09-10',75,'Released',NULL,'The Edge of the World',44407,1.4302,7.2,'Pq8saBO-TJY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1260,_binary '\0','/8f3mBhwOE3owquH6DNIfeSORi5N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028842',6.6,1699,'en','Ever Since Eve','Madge Winton, a beautiful secretary, makes herself look homely in order to avoid advances by lecherous bosses. When her new employer, writer Freddy Matthews, accidentally sees her without her disguise, she has to pretend to be her roommate Sadie.','/gmFzLtNC11w1FwfRr7soxz2I4oZ.jpg','1937-07-15',80,'Released','. . . A Gay Romantic Laugh Hit!','Ever Since Eve',31899,1.368,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1261,_binary '\0','/938qhNARjs9a9XEshf1Tb01WY5S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028872',6.4,2168,'en','Fire Over England','In 1588, relations between Spain and England are at the breaking point. With the support of Queen Elizabeth I, British sea raiders such as Sir Francis Drake regularly capture Spanish merchantmen, bringing gold from the New World.','/eTCR8hRJk2AZ5EwPBB2wNaKuNtl.jpg','1937-03-05',92,'Released','A thrilling tale of love and danger— that will live in your memory as long as there is romance in your heart!','Fire Over England',22969,1.8981,6.2,'ZMpQNeJLuUA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1262,_binary '\0','/4WLiHmBzLdERwktixZGzZM3SSmc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028944',7.4,5805,'en','The Good Earth','China, during the rule of the Qing Dynasty. The arranged marriage between Wang Lung, a humble farmer, and O-Lan, a domestic slave, will endure the many hardships of life over the years; but the temptations of a fragile prosperity will endanger their love and the survival of their entire family.','/bPJe6d8etqVPyPYrNtE5rRNts9T.jpg','1937-06-02',139,'Released','China… Land of unrest… Tomorrow they may starve!','The Good Earth',36652,1.9686,6.3,'ikY9aQCAujw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1263,_binary '\0','/9eHg5qX7LkjW2Zrejvap2RmFGlD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028950',8,41392,'fr','La Grande Illusion','A group of French soldiers, including the patrician Captain de Boeldieu and the working-class Lieutenant Maréchal, grapple with their own class differences after being captured and held in a World War I German prison camp. When the men are transferred to a high-security fortress, they must concoct a plan to escape beneath the watchful eye of aristocratic German officer von Rauffenstein, who has formed an unexpected bond with de Boeldieu.','/lWg41zE0FVixkNsFgxnlRyvDYv9.jpg','1937-06-18',114,'Released','A Great Drama of Human Emotions','Grand Illusion',777,3.635,7.9,'vcO8rEjoG0c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1264,_binary '\0','/jbEbL1gl8VQBAX43kcPCMfBZum7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0028988',7.2,5437,'en','Heidi','Heidi is orphaned and her uncaring maternal Aunt Dete takes her to the mountains to live with her reclusive, grumpy paternal grandfather, Adolph Kramer. Heidi brings her grandfather back into mountain society through her sweet ways and sheer love. When Dete later returns and steals Heidi away to become the companion of a rich man\'s wheelchair-bound daughter, the grandfather is heartsick to discover his little girl missing and immediately sets out to get her back.','/rIfA5X4pYJOHyFPZFqWLOu7yfiZ.jpg','1937-10-15',88,'Released','Shirley\'s A Little Swiss Miss In The Loveliest Story of Her Career !','Heidi',28345,2.6439,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1265,_binary '\0','/ez6ej8JnsY4SSIVK0v50CGdSwxE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029002',7.3,2997,'en','History Is Made at Night','An American woman seeking divorce from her wealthy, controlling husband falls for a romantic Parisian who saves her from his entrapment.','/uINTStWWbJGQKQ58EsW1eAcha65.jpg','1937-03-05',97,'Released','A kiss and history is made at night.','History Is Made at Night',31903,3.8201,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1266,_binary '\0','/aTIWSdGogTc8TiiTqMEZKLjBRLl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029030',7.1,3434,'en','The Hurricane','A Polynesian sailor is separated from his wife when he\'s unjustly imprisoned for defending himself against a colonial bully. Members of the community petition the governor for clemency but all pretense of law and order are soon shattered by an incoming tropical storm.','/x0glopWioudJW9kzIxZpSbbQCem.jpg','1937-11-09',104,'Released','South Sea Adventure Calls','The Hurricane',77250,1.9153,6.7,'5nEfH3tJ5a0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1267,_binary '\0','/5BtoHXAKtjDGwAR7l9Ca7hl7Q47.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029047',6.7,2884,'en','In Old Chicago','The O\'Leary brothers -- honest Jack and roguish Dion -- become powerful figures, and eventually rivals, in Chicago on the eve of its Great Fire.','/s3DPtiEGx4thHOGcIjdgBlWp8D0.jpg','1938-04-15',111,'Released','The Great American Motion Picture!','In Old Chicago',78734,2.4558,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1268,_binary '\0','/esDTXyH2fmbpQ9PWHuBMfBNu3cp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029058',7.3,3037,'en','It\'s Love I\'m After','An infatuated debutante renews a Shakespearean actor\'s running feud with his leading lady.','/yfHshvK1oR8GWilH5Q0iB79DRHU.jpg','1937-10-08',90,'Released','The tops in topsy-turvy romance!','It\'s Love I\'m After',106635,2.5119,7.1,'PPraIfrOV6M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1269,_binary '\0','/jBD9VRoJ9COVKr4zVD6cbdcJy9v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029080',7.2,4422,'en','Kid Galahad','Fight promoter Nick Donati grooms a bellhop as a future champ, but has second thoughts when the \'kid\' falls for his sister.','/eAYC15fSuqUNtBXcFKltIUTL8lO.jpg','1937-05-29',102,'Released','EVERY WOMAN MUST MAKE A FOOL OF HERSELF OVER A MAN...ONCE!','Kid Galahad',52229,2.3006,7.1,'OUtkLtQG_Yc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1270,_binary '\0','/xZj34D46XONUS72MhNlTpxle0Nj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029081',6.3,1672,'en','King Solomon\'s Mines','White hunter Allan Quartermain and his enigmatic guide help a young Irish woman locate her missing father in unexplored Darkest Africa.','/lbOgmmA5K32joQvmDpvAs5Dzfqh.jpg','1937-06-17',80,'Released',NULL,'King Solomon\'s Mines',43860,1.9316,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1271,_binary '\0','/mXIh4HjFAKmquaf1U5zcppPsyQa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029087',6.8,1617,'en','Knight Without Armour','In the last days of Czarist Russia, Russian-speaking Briton A.J. Fothergill is enlisted by his government to go undercover as Bolshevik radical Peter Ouranoff in an attempt to gain access to the revolutionaries\' inner circle. Tasked with accompanying lovely aristocrat Alexandra Vladinoff from Moscow to Petrograd to be tried for crimes against the proletariat, Peter attempts to spirit her out of the war-torn country.','/5pd6NFzZqdEHGDEtptHbHrIaNQS.jpg','1937-07-23',100,'Released','The woman of flame -- the man of steel -- together !','Knight Without Armour',87115,1.7936,5.9,'ZzulympyqoA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1272,_binary '\0','/rEBOzGvlofSHA9DX8HzZC89CXYq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029118',6.7,1992,'en','The Last Gangster','A crime boss goes searching for his ex-wife and son after a ten-year prison stint. His old gang has other plans though, and use the child to try and make him disclose the location of the loot he hid before going to the slammer.','/mCNrlUTdwr7cNgy4mFuFF31uDNK.jpg','1937-11-12',81,'Released','The First Gangster and The Last Gangster.','The Last Gangster',28712,1.6827,6.4,'uRIZrVnmZa0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1273,_binary '\0','/Ah89qlFKTy3YJYVtHsx1RO8y8TT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029120',6.4,1851,'en','The Last of Mrs. Cheyney','A chic American jewel thief falls in love with one of her marks, an English lord.','/tFhy8ZyEY0in5QZZtrIh4jvtW1Z.jpg','1937-02-19',98,'Released','The new star-spangled M-G-M sensation!','The Last of Mrs. Cheyney',53857,1.6249,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1274,_binary '\0','/qsqFiqjdscd0j4jjI45CP9GgtfC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029146',7.1,10125,'en','The Life of Emile Zola','A fictionalized account of famous French writer Émile Zola and his involvement in the Dreyfus Affair. After struggling to establish himself, Zola wins success documenting the unsavory side of Paris and settles into a comfortable upper-class life. However, his complacency is shaken when Jewish officer Alfred Dreyfus is imprisoned for espionage. Realizing that Dreyfus is an innocent victim of anti-Semitism, Zola boldly pens an exposé, only to be charged with libel and now he must defend himself in a dramatic courtroom testimony.','/gsEa6ZU1zHhjTYneNNBQApzl8Vu.jpg','1937-09-09',116,'Released','He\'ll hold you in silence as deep as your emotions!','The Life of Emile Zola',43278,2.7022,6.698,'bTStzVavGpo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1275,_binary '\0','/fi7ZCnJ6TeZTFf4NHnz8ns3SW6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029162',7.6,15878,'en','Lost Horizon','British diplomat Robert Conway and a small group of civilians crash-land in the Himalayas, where they are rescued by the inhabitants of the hidden, idyllic valley of Shangri-La. Protected by the mountains from the world outside, where the clouds of World War II are gathering, Shangri-La provides a seductive escape for the world-weary Conway.','/jCY8uJ80xlO2ApfrsB8s2gzyiBX.jpg','1937-03-03',132,'Released','At last! The masterpiece of America\'s foremost film genius blazes to the screen!','Lost Horizon',3598,3.2984,6.9,'BQ7g3HOGENs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1276,_binary '\0','/2TPV4B6gQZ3rOoJh9YlnGmSVAR3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029192',8.1,10778,'en','Make Way for Tomorrow','An elderly couple are forced to separate themselves from each other after their children refuse to take both into one house.','/zPl6TfnIIJzdPXk9g6QPwFwTIt.jpg','1937-05-09',92,'Released','They want to live their own lives... Can you blame them?','Make Way for Tomorrow',41059,2.8504,7.5,'AeKsY3Kg2OU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1277,_binary '\0','/w3dzDgoDvVxWsKfEFMHYqcwdZda.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029201',6.9,1799,'en','The Man Who Could Work Miracles','An ordinary man, while vigorously asserting the impossibility of miracles, suddenly discovers that he can perform them.','/yAfQRixZWBzQhJ7vwgCIyQhxNW9.jpg','1936-07-23',82,'Released','A Modern Aladdin Who Could make Women Do Things!','The Man Who Could Work Miracles',68849,1.877,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1278,_binary '\0','/mBL8qkSJKjAOdm3r14PtVV1Hf5L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029217',7.1,5570,'en','Marked Woman','In the underworld of Manhattan, a woman dares to stand up to one of the city\'s most powerful gangsters.','/rJHNkbEnyjQUl8DXWxk127hNEhD.jpg','1937-04-10',96,'Released','The star teaming you\'ll never forget!','Marked Woman',25563,2.6274,6.6,'P6nv4Qp4Lws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1279,_binary '\0','/xbw5BiudGIvOjbWfKhVhJvPOdVN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029222',7.2,1289,'en','Maytime','An aging former opera singer looks back on long life, specially on her relationships with her vocal teacher and a music student.','/3P3dENCnuxlhyer7k0SzESRVZrW.jpg','1937-03-26',132,'Released','The singing sweethearts thrill again!','Maytime',43862,2.0235,6.8,'1dZFHDd76lg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1280,_binary '\0','/mBFjYXrca48uLg2Y7kamXgjQKQs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029284',7.2,12801,'en','My Favorite Wife','Years after her ship disappeared, a presumably dead woman returns home. To her shock, she finds her husband has remarried.','/zOeDeZnjqYcvRnMBcfb7omgH15v.jpg','1940-05-17',88,'Released','The funniest, fastest honeymoon ever screened!','My Favorite Wife',41463,3.3084,7.008,'hsMArAsctbM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1281,_binary '\0','/8gpv2IrsHSMxuwVKSrRz7Cey8Xv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029309',6.3,1259,'en','Night Key','The inventor of a new top-of-the-line burglar alarm system is kidnapped by a gang in order to get him to help them commit robberies.','/wIi0b9ltscZCgRChoT6Xuw1hiuD.jpg','1937-04-18',68,'Released','HE MADE HIS ENEMIES BEG FOR MERCY!','Night Key',28045,1.292,6.2,'bRj7tkwxGvI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1282,_binary '\0','/nWU19ODwTxrzss0lwxOrkh3JdFJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029310',7.2,3396,'en','Night Must Fall','Wealthy widow Mrs. Bramson notices that her maid is distracted, and when she learns the girl\'s fiancé, Danny, is the reason, she summons him in. Mrs. Bramson\'s niece Olivia takes a liking to Danny, and comes to believe that he may have been involved in the disappearance of a local woman.','/nSZ8v3cISZpCbHLKLwhTJDHJN13.jpg','1937-04-30',116,'Released','Amazing! Different! Unique!','Night Must Fall',91727,1.3896,6.9,'qXoHI1G47gE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1283,_binary '\0','/sp6i5DtPWJKgCW9zzIb0fbgjseC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029314',7.6,2485,'ja','人情紙風船','In a slum in Edo Japan, a ronin hopes that his deceased father\'s former master will hire him while a disgraced hairdresser attempts to regain his pride by kidnapping the daughter of a wealthy pawnbroker, who is set to be married.','/55qYigH3aum9wRZuaGKqMPUFq5F.jpg','1937-08-25',86,'Released',NULL,'Humanity and Paper Balloons',84237,1.4672,7.8,'6hwrQQ1Arsg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1284,_binary '\0','/5PoDnA7RdNxPM0R3uG3toML2QuE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029322',6.8,7866,'en','Nothing Sacred','When a small-town girl is incorrectly diagnosed with a rare, deadly disease, an unknowing newspaper columnist turns her into a national heroine.','/uqu30x75SjsPNyDN0A5VedoEqyg.jpg','1937-11-25',77,'Released','SEE THE BIG FIGHT!','Nothing Sacred',37650,2.1044,6.272,'fl5ZK-UlqxA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1285,_binary '\0','/43KocvnsgjMYPgGEVkYXUa75AkZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029335',7.4,2003,'en','Oh, Mr. Porter!','Comedy in which a bungling railway worker is given the job of stationmaster at a rundown station in rural Ireland, where his sidekicks are a toothless old gaffer and a portly young loudmouth. Hilarious adventures ensue, including a locomotive chase after gunrunners make off with a train.','/d1g55vwgSnq8WjB47bGFdGhrjoH.jpg','1937-10-05',85,'Released',NULL,'Oh, Mr. Porter!',61483,1.446,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1286,_binary '\0','/uJ3GTEVQc8ibvNOeIpPiERZNc9d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029347',6.7,1405,'en','One Hundred Men and a Girl','The daughter of a struggling musician forms a symphony orchestra made up of his unemployed friends and through persistence, charm and a few misunderstandings, is able to get Leopold Stokowski to lead them in a concert that leads to a radio contract.','/bWCDQRYTq4rnD7sVh1p959mEASe.jpg','1937-09-05',84,'Released','She thrills you again!','One Hundred Men and a Girl',61647,2.1943,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1287,_binary '\0','/4H9a2oLOio3SZ0iyZPMEHBBOXn2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029440',7.2,3196,'en','The Prince and the Pauper','Two boys – the prince Edward and the pauper Tom – are born on the same day. Years later, when young teenage Tom sneaks into the palace garden, he meets the prince. They change clothes with one another before the guards discover them and throw out the prince thinking he\'s the urchin. No one believes them when they try to tell the truth about which is which. Soon after, the old king dies and the prince will inherit the throne.','/sCamwylvoQ1gPvQ5xSybo4ymMbV.jpg','1937-04-30',118,'Released','Mark Twain\'s Immortal Classic !','The Prince and the Pauper',37025,2.5071,6.8,'VYSkvRfqyw4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1288,_binary '\0','/v6CJ1JMWGZf4wbCZotjClHl3Bhl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029442',7.6,5524,'en','The Prisoner of Zenda','A kingdom\'s ascending heir, marked for assassination, switches identities with a lookalike, who takes his place at the coronation. When the real king is kidnapped, his followers try to find him, while the stand-in falls in love with the king\'s intended bride, the beautiful Princess Flavia.','/tvMF7iljOgOXLvkVsWGr5GrPE4j.jpg','1937-09-03',101,'Released','The most thrilling swordfight ever filmed...','The Prisoner of Zenda',43867,3.2028,7.5,'211LZm55CLM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1289,_binary '\0','/rk0JRAkxRy0ABBiasvZucLQ0qlB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029453',7.6,8811,'fr','Pépé le Moko','Pépé le Moko, one of France\'s most wanted criminals, hides out in the Casbah section of Algiers. He knows police will be waiting for him if he tries to leave the city. When Pépé meets Gaby, a gorgeous woman from Paris who is lost in the Casbah, he falls for her.','/y6FTSnCSBVJVPa7M1LuVroLN0ag.jpg','1937-01-28',94,'Released','The World\'s New Triumph!','Pépé le Moko',26252,2.4815,7.21,'8Lh-1-G9tzQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1290,_binary '\0','/hiip7l1t2QRAQiUi2d8QLuz6i6H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029454',6.2,1402,'en','Quality Street','In the 1810s, an old maid poses as her own niece in order to teach her onetime beau a lesson.','/jO2qq9jqWmIkpEyHh5PKS3BGaeA.jpg','1937-03-26',83,'Released','SHE MADE HIM PROPOSE!.. and you\'ll die laughing at her methods..in this captivating comedy of romance on the run!','Quality Street',52237,2.2425,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1291,_binary '\0','/cWspYQc6dblxwayInWJIFrvG6NN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029511',6.5,2438,'en','San Quentin','Ex-Army officer Jameson takes a job a prison guard at San Quentin. Joe, the brother of his new girlfriend May, is sentenced to the prison for robbery. When Jameson tries to separate lawbreakers from hardened criminals, badguy Hansen tries to stir up trouble by telling Joe about Jameson\'s interest in his sister.','/vXVOti9ouBpscfSvFEl0cFsXqEy.jpg','1937-05-24',70,'Released','... Amazing Drama of Desperate Men Behind the Walls!','San Quentin',51601,1.5014,6.7,'Bo5JAba5fOI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1292,_binary '\0','/enoNxIC6Q3iXXeky34T0fBWHiNh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029516',6.5,2188,'en','Saratoga','A horse breeder\'s granddaughter falls in love with a scheming bookie in Saratoga Springs, N.Y.','/3HKRBWHuxClJUKHovKSQjUV9ua6.jpg','1937-07-23',92,'Released','A Tribute and a Triumph that the world demanded to see . . . ! !','Saratoga',45800,1.4443,6.5,'2OMc41r4VYo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1293,_binary '\0','/dWnz21HZqTN2evXnKZbuckSIrLk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029539',7,1245,'en','Seventh Heaven','A Parisian sewer worker longs for a rise in status and a beautiful wife. He rescues a girl from the police, lives with her in a barren flat on the seventh floor, and then marches away to war.','/mI0de3DvGSH6yh2W9rzOmHsLhkU.jpg','1937-03-25',102,'Released','Simone Simon James Stewart portraying a love that will live forever','Seventh Heaven',173605,1.6667,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1294,_binary '\0','/k9xilCWUwnBVz6rqmxQ90CDjtI9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029546',7.4,8457,'en','Shall We Dance','Ballet star Petrov arranges to cross the Atlantic aboard the same ship as the dancer and musical star he\'s fallen for but barely knows. By the time the ocean liner reaches New York, a little white lie has churned through the rumour mill and turned into a hot gossip item—that the two celebrities are secretly married.','/6anwn2NxTw7NwVEEU4qhVwN3Exi.jpg','1937-05-07',109,'Released','Foot-free Fred and joyous Ginger...in their gayest, gladdest show!','Shall We Dance',31530,2.1138,7.3,'mWlDVSlv-2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1295,_binary '\0','/tZzJ8J4QMXjlgepG6pvCOZsVI5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029557',7,1539,'ja','淑女は何を忘れたか','A professor, Komiya, and his bossy wife, Tokiko, are to look after Setsuko, their high-spirited niece from Osaka. Despite being a minor, Setsuko is a liberated woman who does whatever she wants, including smoking. She even convinces Koyima to take her to a geisha house. When she gets rather tipsy, the professor calls Okada, one of his students, to take her home. The wife becomes suspicious of Setsuko when she sees Okada bringing her home.','/l9YuhEMPlMaqpIoKnVDckXZRpnw.jpg','1937-03-03',71,'Released',NULL,'What Did the Lady Forget?',98635,1.2648,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1296,_binary '\0','/4yWayBvwl9gHXaWrDrAslxjL7mh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029583',7.6,240388,'en','Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs','A beautiful girl, Snow White, takes refuge in the forest in the house of seven dwarfs to hide from her stepmother, the wicked Queen. The Queen is jealous because she wants to be known as \"the fairest in the land,\" and Snow White\'s beauty surpasses her own.','/3VAHfuNb6Z7UiW12iYKANSPBl8m.jpg','1938-01-22',83,'Released','The Happiest, Dopiest, Grumpiest, Sneeziest movie of the year.','Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs',408,18.2714,7.128,'4h04eMu24eU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1297,_binary '\0','/9a6ClKkbXhGHsg8wlHuBgRNsCW4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029604',7.7,9978,'en','Stage Door','A spirited heiress wishing to break into theatre on her own merit arrives at a boardinghouse where aspiring young actresses and showgirls are brought together through their cynicism and disappointments.','/p4zqAKoJAtmkK71IyeWHc6spEKB.jpg','1937-10-08',92,'Released','Great stars! Great story! Great picture!','Stage Door',43864,3.067,7.153,'flax6E338y4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1298,_binary '\0','/ixtsHIGYWOAUPNrhKcP4TfE21BZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029605',6.7,1507,'en','Stand-In','An east coast efficiency expert, who stakes his reputation on his ability to turn around a financially troubled Hollywood studio, receives some help from a former child star who now works as a stand-in for the studio.','/kElHrXgDNhZ9MSeiJqaeaQ9NZMB.jpg','1937-10-29',91,'Released','Hail! The conquering hero comes!','Stand-In',118936,1.3441,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1299,_binary '\0','/mBgYaGRKpZq4EPLkgq66kKJvp0d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029606',7.3,12030,'en','A Star Is Born','Esther Blodgett is just another starry-eyed farm kid trying to break into the movies. Waitressing at a Hollywood party, she catches the eye of her idol Norman Maine, is sent for a screen test, and before long attains stardom as newly minted Vicki Lester. She and Norman marry, though his career soon dwindles to nothing due to his chronic alcoholism.','/90EfCmXXWOs5dy7rHTNvGT9T8Kz.jpg','1937-04-20',111,'Released','Is the price of stardom a broken heart?','A Star Is Born',22692,3.5939,7.2,'SDsV85-UqO4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1300,_binary '\0','/qh5Yo1GdWp7maimAJwuBwQgf8Sb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029608',7.4,7114,'en','Stella Dallas','A working-class woman is willing to do whatever it takes to give her daughter a socially promising future.','/spcGWnz05deoY7gAl0EvrBelzPa.jpg','1937-08-06',106,'Released','Sure - I like a good time!','Stella Dallas',43865,1.6608,6.8,'xZMf_kDxMKg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1301,_binary '\0','/uHwb3bFqns3McdraajQSm3FqXoh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029611',6.5,1317,'en','Storm in a Teacup','A local politician in Scotland tries to break the reporter who wrote a negative story about him, and who is also in love with his daughter.','/YmBGnY5v6PZYCYjXjvv4qKDQhH.jpg','1937-02-25',87,'Released','\"When you grow up, you will get out— every time, no matter what it costs\"','Storm in a Teacup',57662,1.8271,7.4,'7ta7gXqiM7I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1302,_binary '\0','/95ispvGrh9JTcWw6Ijf809NSv0m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029648',6.9,1232,'en','Thank You, Mr. Moto','Mr. Moto Heads to China on a quest for seven ancient scrolls that reveal the location of Genghis Khan\'s tomb—a crypt filled with fabulous treasure! But Moto isn\'t the only one stalking the scrolls—so is a shadowy band of thieves. But when his ruthless rivals go too far, the mild-mannered detective\'s quest for antiquities becomes a passion for vengeance—because if he can\'t bring these villains to justice... he\'ll bring them to their knees.','/nz2gDyJdkcNPJ37YrnU3LQteZd0.jpg','1937-12-24',67,'Released','INTRIGUE OF THE ORIENT!','Thank You, Mr. Moto',59581,2.0383,6.2,'kw11_pFr7mA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1303,_binary '\0','/sSvtKoV03AR22cOAfCyQgNthSHJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029650',6.4,1872,'en','That Certain Woman','A gangster\'s widow fights for love despite society\'s disapproval.','/xXYhUmpgwqXbmiykybxmJDA9IkJ.jpg','1937-08-30',93,'Released','Love Broke Her Heart !','That Certain Woman',77964,1.1896,5.6,'r799ZzvuIEk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1304,_binary '\0','/flsum9cNybVAn1zURHJLGQjLuXG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029658',7.2,2156,'en','They Won\'t Forget','A southern town is rocked by scandal when teenager Mary Clay is murdered on Confederate Decoration Day. Andrew Griffin, a small-time lawyer with political ambitions, sees the crime as his ticket to the Senate if he can find the right victim to finger for the crime. He sets out to convict Robert Hale, a transplanted northerner who was Mary\'s teacher at the business school where she was killed. Despite the fact that all the evidence against Hale is circumstantial, Griffin works with a ruthless reporter to create a media frenzy of prejudice and hate against the teacher.','/j7IHtsZyrGreRTUyIV6Mi2pKpl7.jpg','1937-07-14',95,'Released','...EXPLOSIVE HATE DRAMA OF THE FURY OF A LYNCH-MAD MOB!! ...A STORY YOU\'LL NEVER FORGET!','They Won\'t Forget',80639,1.8321,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1305,_binary '\0','/mNjx2QxgNCmwqYcrUP80JNUCS3q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029660',6.7,1384,'en','Think Fast, Mr. Moto','When his import/export business infiltrated by international diamond smugglers, Mr. Moto must follow a trail of clues littered with beautiful women, glittering gems and deadly assassins. Making his way from the mysterious streets of San Francisco\'s Chinatown to the dark and dangerous alleys of Shanghai, Mr. Moto will stop at nothing to bring the culprits to justice...even if it means making the ultimate sacrifice!','/kZsuHYgc3U4qpY1rCdEPfbLaQBK.jpg','1937-07-23',67,'Released','Meet.... MR. MOTO the foxiest detective of them all!','Think Fast, Mr. Moto',59566,2.0384,6.2,'1PvC6sD0oT0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1306,_binary '\0','/7PAi0RQTcyULRo5ERa4PUFJyE4U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029675',6.3,1292,'en','The Toast of New York','After the American Civil War, Jim Fisk, a former peddler and cotton smuggler, arrives in New York, along with his partners Nick and Luke, where he struggles to make his way through the treacherous world of Wall Street\'s financial markets.','/kpEdaj5Fd2D4VuFhKW1bMdl7EeM.jpg','1937-07-22',109,'Released','The terror of Wall Street was a chump for this girl!','The Toast of New York',52359,1.945,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1307,_binary '\0','/hFJ1mantYbTWJ3sOZ1nLLC6rNBg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029682',7.2,9204,'en','Topper','Madcap couple George and Marion Kerby are killed in an automobile accident. They return as ghosts to try and liven up the regimented lifestyle of their friend and bank president, Cosmo Topper. When Topper starts to live it up, it strains relations with his stuffy wife.','/4HEIYO1WVb1fYOBaHnfWrSJnPHm.jpg','1937-07-16',97,'Released','90 ROARING MINUTES OF LAUGHS!','Topper',23101,2.9112,6.7,'gXKrM4Xu7Zg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1308,_binary '\0','/uQLZMpvt8AVkVm8HNYtlg6Tiu2G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029695',6.6,1901,'en','True Confession','A writer takes a job as a secretary because her scrupulous husband isn\'t bringing in the dough as an attorney. When her new employer is murdered, she can\'t seem to make up her mind as to whether she \"dunnit\" or not.','/t80JoyYUBJwNJxT3pgGfvTNyOwq.jpg','1937-12-24',85,'Released','THEY\'RE ON ANOTHER BENDER!','True Confession',114638,1.3436,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1309,_binary '\0','/oAool2HnsroNOV0QOnKBGA0icDk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029747',7.6,9653,'en','Way Out West','Stan and Ollie try to deliver the deed to a valuable gold mine to the daughter of a dead prospector. Unfortunately, the daughter\'s evil guardian is determined to have the gold mine for himself and his saloon-singer wife.','/pTYnwvsD4j5chX8MFgiwx9AzSXj.jpg','1937-04-16',64,'Released','They\'re wild west outlaws of trouble and trigger men!','Way Out West',25599,3.3321,7.101,'PqntSLz8PWs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1310,_binary '\0','/AlF360ESV76PLZmBG3PrsTcQ8Tc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029751',6.9,2159,'en','Wee Willie Winkie','In 1897, little Priscilla Williams, along with her widowed mother, goes to live with her army colonel paternal grandfather on the British outpost he commands in northern India.','/zpCZvLxpgJFzuClBdy6NcdsxCZn.jpg','1937-07-30',100,'Released','TEN-SHUN! Shirley is a peacemaker and matchmaker in Rudyard Kipling\'s most famous story','Wee Willie Winkie',43869,2.0631,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1311,_binary '\0','/uVEayQY6rL1EA0vOe5Gc7I39eHJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029808',7.2,8426,'en','You Only Live Once','Based partially on the story of Bonnie and Clyde, Eddie Taylor is an ex-convict who cannot get a break after being released from prison. When he is framed for murder, Taylor is forced to flee with his wife Joan Graham and baby. While escaping prison after being sentenced to death, Taylor becomes a real murderer, condemning himself and Joan to a life of crime and death on the road.','/v8LSkezS7MvSk88SD6JbPO6VobD.jpg','1937-01-23',86,'Released','A terrifying drama of love and murder!','You Only Live Once',52758,3.6033,7.096,'5hqeqRTW9jg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1312,_binary '\0','/mi0PhGBqRnJXuVqoAjFYIN89kWR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029811',6.8,12243,'en','Young and Innocent','When a young writer is falsely accused of murdering a famous actress, he escapes custody and joins forces with the daughter of a police constable to prove his innocence.','/knc0wcxarPM6Qy3uOm1RV38JGzS.jpg','1937-02-17',83,'Released','A romantic murder-mystery drama!','Young and Innocent',2762,2.8343,6.5,'IVUIWENf7tk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1313,_binary '\0','/26OlUKUTR3lKKCFfNF9yyrnRYGL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029842',5.6,1314,'en','The Adventures of Marco Polo','The Venetian traveler Marco Polo meets Kublai Khan and foils a plotter with fireworks in medieval China.','/iXZoxhfhJGByz1zP72PtELPhrLs.jpg','1938-04-07',104,'Released','HE Came, HE Saw, HE Conquered','The Adventures of Marco Polo',119645,2.3609,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1314,_binary '\0','/yjnfM8QmrXQkWl8dUimsDGl73el.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029843',7.9,58193,'en','The Adventures of Robin Hood','Robin Hood fights nobly for justice against the evil Sir Guy of Gisbourne while striving to win the hand of the beautiful Maid Marian.','/c7LX3GMf9uXQTgVm3uxpm7E6Woc.jpg','1938-05-13',102,'Released','Excitement... Danger... Suspense... as this classic adventure story sweeps across the screen!','The Adventures of Robin Hood',10907,6.0721,7.472,'bU6rh7nRDgY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1315,_binary '\0','/bMDTT7pMvmP7m3mbLoWGaJMiUTz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029844',7,2540,'en','The Adventures of Tom Sawyer','Tom Sawyer and his pal Huckleberry Finn have great adventures on the Mississippi River, pretending to be pirates, attending their own funeral and witnessing a murder.','/v91Ft1tHlKHLSfNp4XBL8H6JMOP.jpg','1938-02-11',91,'Released','\"Tom, you might even be President some day . . . if they don\'t hang you first!\"','The Adventures of Tom Sawyer',30977,3.0666,6.564,'gwYxIjnXKFc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1316,_binary '\0','/gciZ1BbYpg7h230eK7Pj1MO14rt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029850',7.4,13318,'ru','Александр Невский','When German knights invade Russia, Prince Alexander Nevsky must rally his people to resist the formidable force. After the Teutonic soldiers take over an eastern Russian city, Alexander stages his stand at Novgorod, where a major battle is fought on the ice of frozen Lake Chudskoe. While Alexander leads his outnumbered troops, two of their number, Vasili and Gavrilo, begin a contest of bravery to win the hand of a local maiden.','/lsTJYStIsnddwioD1L4FEmwj4Cx.jpg','1938-11-24',109,'Released','The mighty epic of 13th Century Russia...of the \"Battle on the Ice\" when the invading German hordes led by the Teutonic Knights were driven from the soil of Russia - forever.','Alexander Nevsky',10235,1.9133,7.1,'2sCdPWsQnYM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1317,_binary '\0','/zEHZBRf97910p4bL8HL398ZUs5p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029852',6.8,2516,'en','Alexander\'s Ragtime Band','Classical violinist Roger Grant disappoints his family and teacher when he organizes a jazz band, but he and the band become successful. Roger falls in love with the band\'s singer, Stella, but his reluctance to lose her leads him to thwart her efforts to become a solo star. When the World War separates them in 1917, Stella marries Roger\'s best friend and, when Roger returns home after the war, an important concert at Carnegie Hall brings the corners of the romantic triangle together.','/tbmvwfs9C1eTIyCcuhdbnFeuQSA.jpg','1938-05-24',106,'Released','An American Cavalcade!','Alexander\'s Ragtime Band',43839,2.2713,6.8,'M48GEyEUanQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1318,_binary '\0','/wmfTTdJCxJfyQYsSn9PiuPhJiCR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029855',6.6,3707,'en','Algiers','Pepe Le Moko is a notorious thief, who escaped from France. Since his escape, Moko has become a resident and leader of the immense Casbah of Algiers. French officials arrive insisting on Pepe\'s capture are met with unfazed local detectives, led by Inspector Slimane, who are biding their time. Meanwhile, Pepe meets the beautiful Gaby, which arouses the jealousy of Ines.','/cvNQjlXJxRQrmB5VCcyssjKIwW8.jpg','1938-01-16',96,'Released','You\'ve Got A Date With Danger, A Rendezvous With Romance In The Glamorous, Mysterious Algiers... Make A Date Now!','Algiers',22657,1.5383,6.4,'vGFFItr9_8I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1319,_binary '\0','/8aPNj1OK7rSY33RZk4T2jBKCw7D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029864',7,3357,'en','The Amazing Dr. Clitterhouse','A wealthy society doctor decides to research the medical aspects of criminal behaviour by becoming one himself. He joins a gang of thieves and proceeds to wrest leadership of the gang away from its extremely resentful leader.','/7fPKRTXMbDMER4UG1FP4mr09Lll.jpg','1938-07-20',87,'Released','... a thunderbolt of thrills and intrigue!','The Amazing Dr. Clitterhouse',17885,2.2458,7,'x7iI5Cxfffg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1320,_binary '\0','/scHIDomz6Irdf4pQt53Q6pqdSk1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029870',7.8,25084,'en','Angels with Dirty Faces','Childhood chums Rocky Sullivan and Jerry Connelly grow up on opposite sides of the fence: Rocky matures into a prominent gangster, while Jerry becomes a priest, tending to the needs of his old tenement neighborhood.','/k23E4UAcow8eczLRmVCMdukL4Mx.jpg','1938-11-26',97,'Released','The saga of America’s dirty faced kids... and the breaks that life won’t give them!','Angels with Dirty Faces',13696,3.8003,7.5,'z5qzZJ7K_B8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1321,_binary '\0','/ooLP48cPeoNhdai9bID2UdI31I7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029923',7.5,5030,'en','Block-Heads','It\'s 1938, but Stan doesn\'t know the war is over; he\'s still patrolling the trenches in France, and shoots down a French aviator. Oliver sees his old chum\'s picture in the paper and goes to visit Stan who has now been returned to the States and invites him back to his home.','/23rkwonNcEqTiXmqsEUPaeT4iII.jpg','1938-08-19',57,'Released','90 Minutes of Happiness and Hi-Jinks','Block-Heads',43841,2.5459,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1322,_binary '\0','/1u7v5mkkRt6WkEqCpKKyxdFZxLX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029929',7.1,5309,'en','Bluebeard\'s 8th Wife','American multi-millionaire Michael Brandon marries his eighth wife, Nicole, the daughter of a broke French Marquis. But she doesn\'t want to be only a number in the line of his ex-wives and undertakes her own strategy to tame him.','/vEhBrK5Lcrjq1BR4FurSQyvsWUX.jpg','1938-03-25',85,'Released','He married in haste and repeated with pleasure!','Bluebeard\'s 8th Wife',31996,3.1368,7.049,'eet5iFOc-hU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1323,_binary '\0','/pvvUqgvDXu8aLd5VqgrfOccnrnP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029942',7.2,6987,'en','Boys Town','Devout but iron-willed Father Flanagan leads a community called Boys Town, a different sort of juvenile detention facility where, instead of being treated as underage criminals, the boys are shepherded into making themselves better people. But hard-nosed petty thief and pool shark Whitey Marsh, the impulsive and violent younger brother of an imprisoned murderer, might be too much for the good father\'s tough-love system.','/jGwKOZvPItNSocHFAg1USbhKR6c.jpg','1938-09-08',96,'Released','\"No boy is bad, if given a chance!\"','Boys Town',42390,2.6357,6.8,'1Am2XJ-DUt4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1324,_binary '\0','/fzJgCQh2NBnUYlms8EGyr4bPNz3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029947',7.8,69840,'en','Bringing Up Baby','David Huxley is waiting to get a bone he needs for his museum collection. Through a series of strange circumstances, he meets Susan Vance, and the duo have a series of misadventures which include a leopard called Baby.','/vTNNOtemaYmtx3k2NpsLMRJKEwZ.jpg','1938-02-18',102,'Released','And so begins the hilarious adventure of Professor David Huxley and Miss Susan Vance, a flutter-brained vixen with love in her heart!','Bringing Up Baby',900,5.176,7.509,'Qlf6gHD-YEM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1325,_binary '\0','/jS9W4jk2vPtq8PIZppYwYAPZpUP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029957',7.5,9121,'fr','La Bête humaine','Returning by train to the French port of Le Havre, Jacques Lantier, a tormented railwayman, meets by chance the impulsive stationmaster Roubard and Séverine, his wife.','/yB8UpOKAz4yorzBqLWXtc6hO3O4.jpg','1938-12-23',98,'Released',NULL,'La Bête Humaine',29415,2.3364,7.055,'HBLe_J0P7vI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1326,_binary '\0','/ovbtkxEC7ihITdlc1y9Ir9aQU4w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029971',6.9,4703,'en','Carefree','Dr. Tony Flagg\'s friend Steven has problems in the relationship with his fiancée Amanda, so he persuades her to visit Tony. After some minor misunderstandings, she falls in love with him. When he tries to use hypnosis to strengthen her feelings for Steven, things get complicated.','/8vFD6edhyBkRLEHGjsX9UVw890w.jpg','1938-09-02',83,'Released','Together again!','Carefree',29872,1.9654,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1327,_binary '\0','/7PFIEdSmyzwMrX2pl1QrdG6Gveb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029984',6.7,1984,'en','Charlie Chan in Honolulu','While Charlie is distracted with the birth of his first grandchild, son Jimmy impersonates his father in order to investigate a murder aboard a freighter in the harbor.','/53VOY3Pm0YEgET5npYUTeHQq74w.jpg','1938-12-30',67,'Released',NULL,'Charlie Chan in Honolulu',33392,1.6392,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1328,_binary '\0','/1e3nb2OYeLIXQ9yYdLb9NZVQmyv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029992',7.5,10043,'en','A Christmas Carol','Miser Ebenezer Scrooge is awakened on Christmas Eve by spirits who reveal to him his own miserable existence, what opportunities he wasted in his youth, his current cruelties, and the dire fate that awaits him if he does not change his ways. Scrooge is faced with his own story of growing bitterness and meanness, and must decide what his own future will hold: death or redemption.','/cvr7x3CjBMsHv2GptR0tcFddMSa.jpg','1938-12-16',69,'Released','Greater than \"David Copperfield\"!','A Christmas Carol',25842,3.7929,7,'iWa9EVeUqhA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1329,_binary '\0','/aYUtvuhnTjxrrARa5UNhn5NvgtY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0029995',7,2661,'en','The Citadel','Young, idealistic, newly qualified Scottish doctor Andrew Manson arrives in Wales and takes his first job in a mining town, and begins to wonder at the persistent cough many of the miners have. When his attempts to prove its cause are thwarted, he moves to London. His new practice does poorly, but when a friend shows him how to make a lucrative practice from rich hypochondriacs, it will take a great shock to show him what the truth of being a doctor really is.','/eyGS36ZBJmp9RY9zFfX1arralxc.jpg','1938-10-29',110,'Released','Secrets of a doctor as told by a doctor!','The Citadel',84090,2.3169,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1330,_binary '\0','/wrutDQvnfJqkPzknRWbPBLq6oDs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030018',6.6,2021,'en','The Cowboy and the Lady','Mary Smith decides after a lifetime of being a shut-in to do something wild while her father is out campaigning for the presidency, so she takes off for the family\'s home in West Palm Beach and inadvertently becomes romantically entangled with earnest cowboy Stretch Willoughby. Neither the dalliance nor the cowboy fit with the upper class image projected by her esteemed father, forcing her to choose.','/7IFK76jpZPHlxRBquQSViQERzP2.jpg','1938-11-17',91,'Released','MERLE ropes Gary! GARY brands Merle!','The Cowboy and the Lady',112674,2.7506,6.3,'4vs27wGWYWQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1331,_binary '\0','/rd2lUDdcDf5Kfsk7XpXsVodmFVE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030026',6.6,1574,'en','Crime School','In the slums, teenager Frankie Warren hangs out with a rowdy gang who one day knock him out in a fight. In court, the boys refuse to reveal who struck the knockout blow, and all are subsequently sentenced to a reformatory, cruelly run by two corrupt guards. New deputy commissioner Mark Braden arrives determined to change things, but despite the help of Frankie\'s sister, Mark\'s reform plans -- and Frankie\'s future -- may be sabotaged from within.','/711a1AAfFQ5IVlCLUQHWCdI68Pd.jpg','1938-05-10',85,'Released','They\'ll steal your heart again as they turn against the system that tries to make them killers!','Crime School',79129,1.4323,6.4,'dhSB0-NG7Zc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1332,_binary '\0','/bbTVFFCIywOuyBWHwDoES2DvgU1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030044',7.5,3712,'en','The Dawn Patrol','In 1915 France, Major Brand commands the 39th Squadron of the Royal Flying Corps. The young airmen go up in bullet-riddled \"crates\" and the casualty rate is appalling, but Brand can\'t make the \"brass hats\" at headquarters see reason. Insubordinate air ace Captain Courtney is another thorn in Brand\'s side...but finds the smile wiped from his face when he rises to command the squadron himself. Everyone keeps a stiff upper lip.','/ncrQ21mjMTznDZDTmAcT3j5berB.jpg','1938-12-24',103,'Released','They roared through the dawn... with death on their wings!','The Dawn Patrol',46688,1.6938,6.8,'RGQYpP60J70','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1333,_binary '\0','/pde8ujq0rA8IuPxyRRE4gTim2VK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030063',6.6,1862,'en','The Divorce of Lady X','A London barrister believes the woman who spent the night in his hotel suite is the erring wife of his newest client.','/hJIu073QhiXdxOYlmA07yNRPFRP.jpg','1938-01-15',92,'Released','HE STOLE HER HEART SO SHE STOLE HIS PAJAMAS!','The Divorce of Lady X',43850,2.3493,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1334,_binary '\0','/kmgdPpZpgCgPY5F2cFf8YrutmeL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030127',7.5,2768,'fr','La Femme du boulanger','In this little Provencal village, a new baker, Aimable, settles down. His wife Aurelie is beautiful and much younger than he. She departs with a shepherd the night after Aimable produces his first breads. Aimable is so afflicted that he can not work anymore. Therefore, the villagers, who initially laughed at his cuckoldry, take the matter very seriously (they want the bread) and organize a plan to find Aurelie and to bring her back to the bakery.','/a1GhF3nkGC3fb6Hnj9l6tyiKkl7.jpg','1938-09-07',133,'Released',NULL,'The Baker\'s Wife',43844,1.9188,7.3,'WsPZwPY-860','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1335,_binary '\0','/pnWD5Sni0B8LI24Pxwt2qEzlQ03.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030149',6.9,2501,'en','Four Daughters','Musician Adam Lemp and his four equally musical daughters, Emma, Ann, Kay, and Thea, live happily together. Each daughter has an upstanding young man for whom she cares. However, the arrival of a cynical, slovenly young composer named Mickey Borden turns the household upside-down, and romantic and tragic complications ensue.','/b537l9ogYQY3y66G4zLXvP970Lj.jpg','1938-08-09',90,'Released',NULL,'Four Daughters',67880,1.2874,6.6,'Bcb4b1832w0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1336,_binary '\0','/dNBhaPgOo6i241T6GK5kp4jl75o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030151',6.3,1435,'en','Four\'s a Crowd','A public relations man falls for his most difficult client\'s granddaughter.','/5MXJZSYv2qowp2YUByNeXXHrHb6.jpg','1938-08-04',93,'Released','Two\'s company, three\'s a triangle but \"Four\'s a Crowd!\"','Four\'s a Crowd',65580,1.9433,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1337,_binary '\0','/2Q7zgPAavMUu2yaG5Z1ydeOMyEc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030202',6.4,1482,'en','The Great Waltz','Composer Johann Strauss risks his marriage over his infatuation with a beautiful singer.','/n1jm062DHhr6JoYLXHSSOaYpqcJ.jpg','1938-11-04',104,'Released','Your beating heart, your pounding pulse will tell you it\'s the most exciting musical love story ever told!','The Great Waltz',62567,1.6399,5.9,'CkvoMajdOtU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1338,_binary '\0','/sG0TscXVp7817uDwdAnorbml2BA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030241',7.7,20379,'en','Holiday','Johnny Case, a freethinking financier, has finally found the girl of his dreams — Julia Seton, the spoiled daughter of a socially prominent millionaire — and she\'s agreed to marry him. But when Johnny plans a holiday for the two to enjoy life while they are still young, his fiancée has other plans & that is for Johnny to work in her father\'s bank!','/vTswoixIge9o84NLlWGaWl5lrHO.jpg','1938-05-26',97,'Released','Every day\'s a holiday... when you\'re in love.','Holiday',16274,3.1151,7.3,'nSyrZ3ma8r8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1339,_binary '\0','/2TRhus467OxkG6NzdoBst9YU5ZA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030252',7.5,3678,'fr','Hôtel du Nord','On the meandering Canal St. Martin, at the Parisian Hôtel du Nord, a nearly fatal gunshot separates a dejected young couple. But, amid a sad but beautiful panorama of lively characters, love has the final say. Can life be a fairy tale?','/9gJXoE2kkyFUflet4VzjQbMMwV8.jpg','1938-12-17',97,'Released',NULL,'Hôtel du Nord',48369,2.4402,7.1,'ONXDdJr2o24','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1340,_binary '\0','/iedio5AiyYPM4AqxoTq2f7QRebd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030287',7.4,16615,'en','Jezebel','In 1850s Louisiana, the willfulness of a tempestuous Southern belle threatens to destroy all who care for her.','/xewvSLrr0Ru6qVMwVqVheFLaGm4.jpg','1938-03-26',103,'Released','Half angel, half siren, all woman.','Jezebel',1976,3.2943,7.002,'SQJJyYGQqek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1341,_binary '\0','/ljZI54Z2P29VrKLnCLBU53G5AFo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030337',7,1311,'sv','En kvinnas ansikte','A cynical woman with a disfigured face—a hardened criminal—gets an opportunity to change her ways when she meets a sympathetic plastic surgeon. She leaves her old life behind, but soon her old friends catch up with her.','/r294LI2tQrYi10ovdBNJ5KPIhge.jpg','1938-10-31',104,'Released',NULL,'A Woman\'s Face',76848,1.3303,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1342,_binary '\0','/15HEZcSKtLcl69avXfmjoIJBuay.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030341',7.7,62027,'en','The Lady Vanishes','On a train headed for England a group of travelers is delayed by an avalanche. Holed up in a hotel in a fictional European country, young Iris befriends elderly Miss Froy. When the train resumes, Iris suffers a bout of unconsciousness and wakes to find the old woman has disappeared. The other passengers ominously deny Miss Froy ever existed, so Iris begins to investigate with another traveler and, as the pair sleuth, romantic sparks fly.','/c1t9LB76LvEARPanfEzXmkm7fwY.jpg','1938-10-07',96,'Released','Comedy! Chills! Chuckles! in a Mystery Express!','The Lady Vanishes',940,4.7491,7.4,'YihbNGUNQmU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1343,_binary '\0','/u83bKahLAsAhYCbcP4C1XzEDt4p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030386',6.7,2256,'en','Love Finds Andy Hardy','Andy Hardy becomes entangled with three different girls all at the same time.','/eemy6iN41zgrKFmPUZo49SaJVbo.jpg','1938-07-22',91,'Released','The new story of Judge Hardy\'s family!','Love Finds Andy Hardy',43846,2.0818,6.2,'DpeSwg6XzZM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1344,_binary '\0','/dwJ09UVx0pM6RvorXajciSzqUck.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030396',6.7,3217,'en','The Mad Miss Manton','When the murdered body discovered by beautiful, vivacious socialite Melsa Manton disappears, police and press label her a prankster until she and her group of friends prove them wrong.','/mqxNe28kUMwgm0wC74zboq9uuXE.jpg','1938-10-21',80,'Released','Out of the social register and into the police blotter!','The Mad Miss Manton',43855,2.6995,6.4,'LGI3Itbb7lk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1345,_binary '\0','/cNWWdsybfMDSeD9sK4IZdXaVjQl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030413',6.6,1619,'en','Mannequin','Jessie, a young working class woman, seeks to improve her life by marrying her boyfriend, only to find out that he is no better than what she left behind.','/6J1aEBA0nsa8lcIFn7KKo2QGuCa.jpg','1938-01-21',95,'Released','The Romance of a Shopgirl\'s Millions','Mannequin',33025,1.2084,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1346,_binary '\0','/u3IsKWC05Cuz8gh4dWR7RGVXxtG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030418',7.3,3627,'en','Marie Antoinette','The young Austrian princess Marie Antoinette is arranged to marry Louis XVI, future king of France, in a politically advantageous marriage for the rival countries. The opulent Marie indulges in various whims and flirtations. When Louis XV passes and Louis XVI ascends the French throne, his queen\'s extravagant lifestyle earns the hatred of the French people, who despise her Austrian heritage.','/nmsqzJUN6B0guVHfXINhofe4Myt.jpg','1938-08-26',149,'Released','A Queen... but, first of all... a woman in love!','Marie Antoinette',43847,3.1096,6.6,'UsQAmrFRXUQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1347,_binary '\0','/6gTpE5OzguQ8A6vnhYS1USTtDkI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030424',7,1549,'fr','La Marseillaise','The early days of the French Revolution, as seen through the eyes of the ordinary citizens in Marseille and the royal court, including King Louis XVI and Marie Antoinette.','/r3O8HLnNFUa2FU7HzSM8oiA2D2c.jpg','1938-02-10',131,'Released',NULL,'La Marseillaise',43845,1.6686,6.837,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1348,_binary '\0','/zk8dHHRlBvN5yxBIP97fcCDP3dM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030442',7.3,2631,'en','Merrily We Live','Society matron Emily Kilbourne has a habit of hiring ex-cons and hobos as servants. Her latest find is a handsome tramp who shows up at her doorstep and ends up in a chauffeur\'s uniform. He also catches the eye of Geraldine.','/k1bav32MQdTG9SjOiOL31MiB55l.jpg','1938-03-04',95,'Released','Come on in...the fun\'s grand...and the romance glorious...when a glamour girl and a \"gentleman tramp\" romp dizzily into love.','Merrily We Live',111315,1.9894,7,'hbbfofrkCv4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1349,_binary '\0','/nK63h20sVrvXM2AWZXDyWXEfCeK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030473',6,1471,'en','Mr. Wong, Detective','A chemical manufacturer is killed just after asking detective James Wong to help him. So detective Wong decides to investigate this as well as two subsequent murders.','/qQ3aGG51cIQJoQJPzmzSZ498qjO.jpg','1938-10-05',70,'Released','Thousands asked to see Collier\'s Magazine famous detective on the screen... here he is!','Mr. Wong, Detective',23255,1.5816,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1350,_binary '\0','/rbpwgnmQjZXqm3c0lNdGjB6Fia.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030491',6.6,1375,'en','Nancy Drew… Detective','After a wealthy dowager who has made a substantial donation to her alma mater suddenly disappears, Nancy Drew sets out to solve the mystery.','/Ptkn6MnB2pyFJpJuHyxSBG3Qlh.jpg','1938-11-19',66,'Released','A real sleuth shows you how it\'s done! Laughs and fun for all!','Nancy Drew… Detective',47883,1.4427,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1351,_binary '\0','/rfmteAhaxOCHFiedOi4c7xiJRfQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030517',6.8,1590,'en','Of Human Hearts','This is a story about family relationships, set in the time before and during the American Civil War. Ethan Wilkins is a poor and honest man who ministers to the human soul, while his son Jason yearns to be a doctor, helping people in the earthly realm. It is a rich story about striving for excellence, the tension of father-son rebellion, and the love of a mother that can never die.','/dJ0qxlwc61cIWKnrBxDI1TUHvE8.jpg','1938-02-11',103,'Released','Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer\'s Great $5,000 Title Contest Picture','Of Human Hearts',122884,2.0896,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1352,_binary '\0','/icZNU2EV4JeCxjOdmlzMZvBV4kh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030522',7.7,5780,'de','Olympia - Fest der Völker','Starting with a long and lyrical overture, evoking the origins of the Olympic Games in ancient Greece, Riefenstahl covers twenty-one athletic events in the first half of this two-part love letter to the human body and spirit, culminating with the marathon, where Jesse Owens became the first track and field athlete to win four gold medals in a single Olympics.','/49KaePhxdoM3TkJHo8zaoCFEJ6X.jpg','1938-04-21',127,'Released',NULL,'Olympia Part One: Festival of the Nations',677,2.2661,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1353,_binary '\0','/hbL5vWtqJrPCrLEcgQLT5lj2a8G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030523',7.6,4750,'de','Olympia - Fest der Schönheit','Part two of Leni Riefenstahl\'s monumental examination of the 1938 Olympic Games, the cameras leave the main stadium and venture into the many halls and fields deployed for such sports as fencing, polo, cycling, and the modern pentathlon, which was won by American Glenn Morris.','/oleIfZJ4NZebY9ETjoaZoTXYDLb.jpg','1938-06-02',104,'Released',NULL,'Olympia Part Two: Festival of Beauty',685,1.8921,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1354,_binary '\0','/9R4Zmk9vDP2Lk0JNOaAw09LG3lU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030637',7.7,10609,'en','Pygmalion','When linguistics professor Henry Higgins boasts that he can pass off Cockney flower girl Eliza Doolittle as a princess with only six months\' training, Colonel George Pickering takes him up on the bet. Eliza moves into Higgins\'s home and begins her rigorous training after the professor comes to a financial agreement with her dustman father, Alfred. But the plucky young woman is not the only one undergoing a transformation.','/dIrQHvgSEAfpaz3fBnrRpvo0e8u.jpg','1938-10-06',96,'Released','He picked up a girl from the gutter - and changed her into a glamorous society butterfly!','Pygmalion',25016,1.498,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1355,_binary '\0','/tdRp4HCCw4YoWtZuqlePNcZ0nCA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030643',7.7,10985,'fr','Le quai des brumes','Down a foggy, desolate road to the port city of Le Havre travels Jean, an army deserter looking for another chance to make good on life. Fate, however, has a different plan for him, as acts of both revenge and kindness render him front-page news.','/2S8O2V50TZlXV8uabOvGUJ1i5CZ.jpg','1938-05-17',93,'Released','Tender... frankly adult. Filled with almost every emotion known to man','Port of Shadows',46326,2.9303,7.4,'KeBE4ASz_I0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1356,_binary '\0','/w9KVplxPrLkXLeG0xAgszDLvWC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030657',7,2167,'en','Rebecca of Sunnybrook Farm','Rebecca\'s Uncle Harry leaves her with Aunt Miranda who forbids her to associate with show people. But neighbor Anthony Kent is a talent scout who secretly set it up for her to broadcast.','/dOhc4f50v5hX2GnYm9NBbAzMzY6.jpg','1938-03-18',80,'Released',NULL,'Rebecca of Sunnybrook Farm',38716,2.5505,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1357,_binary '\0','/42vILElrpYQWm5QVRMmMbD82kxF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030696',6.6,5984,'en','Room Service','Broke Gordon Miller tries to land a backer for his new play while he has to deal with with the hotel manager trying to evict him and his cast.','/yQIpSvrEuZiDNtq2SABny5VCSIr.jpg','1938-09-21',78,'Released','Better . . . Battier . . . Funnier Than Ever !','Room Service',15938,2.2392,6.5,'c0ftoT1xY8s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1358,_binary '\0','/5t0xfA9zxLdzymp342IOPEnDdyZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030743',6.4,1516,'en','The Shining Hour','A nightclub dancer shakes the foundations of a wealthy farming family after she marries into it.','/icPlJYyRg3zhvONL1wwbqbbXXpH.jpg','1938-11-18',76,'Released','NOW Joan\'s a Dancing Bride in a New Heart Drama!','The Shining Hour',111463,1.6667,6.7,'L1aphDek0d4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1359,_binary '\0','/x8yq5KRHvAPDhJUzEnLRbC6yOck.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030744',6.9,1848,'en','The Shopworn Angel','During WWI Bill Pettigrew, a naive young Texan soldier is sent to New York for basic training. He meets worldly wise actress Daisy Heath when her car nearly runs him over.','/3ZBMVD7YXX32ddNjXn13BB3Jiiw.jpg','1938-07-15',85,'Released','SHE GAVE UP LOVE...AND A MILLION...to be a doughboy\'s \"Dream Girl\"!','The Shopworn Angel',99318,1.6691,6.8,'yiSyDQxbtaM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1360,_binary '\0','/5eWhWfZpbMorbAZ7EUOky1yGJ7A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030746',6.9,1698,'en','St. Martin\'s Lane','Pickpocket Libby is protected by aging street performer Charles, who takes her into his troupe. Libby\'s dancing leads her to meet songwriter Harley and launch a stage career, while Charles is seemingly spurned by the waif he has helped.','/4CWF0BxPll1aCpOiWUjkJ4D6jHD.jpg','1938-10-18',85,'Released','A heart-stirring drama of peace-time London!','St. Martin\'s Lane',111642,2.5646,7.4,'Hjvo_rH9iE4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1361,_binary '\0','/4JRGxn1kWG5qtERGdFyPXLQADCX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030755',6.8,2270,'en','The Sisters','Three daughters of a small down pharmacist undergo trials and tribulations in their problematic marriages between 1904 and 1908.','/1AfBGWRxMPKmlQnyVe3v2PW1FAT.jpg','1938-10-14',99,'Released','THREE SISTERS IN SEARCH OF LOVE...A great novel... a greater MOVIE!','The Sisters',140995,1.7821,6.1,'LYOzHd-jawQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1362,_binary '\0','/3fBlfSDQGkP02JZfdwXX0uMOsCb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030764',7,2768,'en','A Slight Case of Murder','Former bootlegger Remy Marco has a slight problem with foreclosing bankers, a prospective son-in-law, and four hard-to-explain corpses.','/3fC4dLkZ8NXw51v84ASCG2OsFpC.jpg','1938-02-26',85,'Released',NULL,'A Slight Case of Murder',34006,2.3928,6.4,'6MqdiRb5u0Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1363,_binary '\0','/TpI5p7gHSO28c8mU2ynoXqEDJK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030824',6.6,2565,'en','Swiss Miss','Stan and Ollie are mousetrap salesmen hoping for better business in Switzerland, with Stan\'s theory that because there is more cheese in Switzerland, there should be more mice.','/pQVANoTbB4Q8UW0Lbv5dgPnKTd1.jpg','1938-05-20',73,'Released','Yelps in the Alps !','Swiss Miss',82394,1.5623,6.3,'_zim2s5b2k4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1364,_binary '\0','/zBpN6SVoLaicRs5zmU11uwXJpOS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030845',4,2059,'en','The Terror of Tiny Town','In a wild west community populated entirely by residents with dwarfism, the Larson and Preston familes have been in a generations-long feud, recently strained by the actions of cattle rustler and overall devious criminal Bat Haines. Buck Larson, the hero of our tale, takes on Haines, and tries to win the heart of Nancy Preston while resolving the tensions between his and her families.','/ajyE9xse0JlQlYraLK9ovCALxCt.jpg','1938-12-01',62,'Released','LIttle guys with big guns!','The Terror of Tiny Town',31772,1.419,3.4,'alj8HqPKCJ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1365,_binary '\0','/kH7H0GLLQDN1qTndYFScfIFtIjQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030848',6.8,2993,'en','Test Pilot','Jim is a test pilot. His wife Ann and best friend Gunner try their best to keep him sober. But the life of a test pilot is anything but safe.','/vdZ5rv7Cg6HTM6UaMvjezKO0juk.jpg','1938-04-16',118,'Released','They\'re yours... in a heart-walloping love story!','Test Pilot',43155,1.7372,6.1,'6iIQ076uiEE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1366,_binary '\0','/4SDCCaaiIZ0zUoKvjWwatjWuBbQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030865',7.1,2366,'en','Three Comrades','A love story centered on the lives of three young German soldiers in the years following World War I. Their close friendship is strengthened by their shared love for the same woman who is dying of tuberculosis.','/dTLmTBNa2UesT8Sa3cYEE6P8qJd.jpg','1938-06-02',98,'Released','.. Torn from a million souls!','Three Comrades',109970,1.5265,7.2,'j-CHzQC-2Vs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1367,_binary '\0','/qMdIbpdTCcNdt2IwXCFRCIlw6CT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030879',6.6,1791,'en','Too Hot to Handle','While in Shanghai reporting on the Sino-Japanese war, Chris Hunter, a shrewd news reporter, meets pilot Alma Harding. She does not trust him, but he manages to hire her as his assistant. During an adventurous expedition through the jungles of South America, her opinion of him begins to change.','/bdfmUhmuWT0QJllnIJcoJ0aCVuB.jpg','1938-09-16',107,'Released','Love in action on land, sea and air!','Too Hot to Handle',33028,2.1093,6.114,'OO64n9YuThU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1368,_binary '\0','/eHklkFcGA3OoUt57OJOxRUMVnqO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030944',7.1,5093,'en','Vivacious Lady','College town life gets turned upside down after a button-down botany professor secretly weds a sizzling night-club singer.','/lhkDEnO3gZLDAdLihgMpcRn38G.jpg','1938-05-13',90,'Released','Ginger goes to college but not the way you think','Vivacious Lady',33630,3.0344,6.993,'bPJKZLySmpQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1369,_binary '\0','/vk4atNTIni6M51bcjYV2MVD6oO4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030989',6.5,1485,'en','A Yank at Oxford','A brash young American aristocrat attending Oxford University gets a chance to prove himself and win the heart of his antagonist\'s sister.','/vcQDz13PAy1w5Q3bJwBy3srZA6O.jpg','1938-02-18',102,'Released','The roving romances of a two-fisted American!','A Yank at Oxford',114079,2.1702,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1370,_binary '\0','/As4GJO5V3SxbSDW8ZEWPnYtSZIg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030993',7.8,30728,'en','You Can\'t Take It with You','Alice, the only relatively normal member of the eccentric Sycamore family, falls in love with Tony Kirby, but his wealthy banker father and snobbish mother strongly disapprove of the match. When the Kirbys are invited to dinner to become better acquainted with their future in-laws, things don\'t turn out the way Alice had hoped.','/9JltqbDyWstYW6gnvqDO6L5bOrx.jpg','1938-09-01',126,'Released','You\'ll love them all for giving you the swellest time you\'ve ever had!','You Can\'t Take It with You',34106,4.764,7.5,'tUJLqOGoAAo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1371,_binary '\0','/ygiicgjAE4EkBUo8BE9EwUGxBdi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0030996',6.8,2178,'en','You and Me','Mr. Morris, the owner of a large metropolitan department store, gives jobs to paroled ex-convicts in an effort to help them reform and go straight. Among his \'employed-prison-graduates\' are Helen Roberts and Joe Dennis, working as sales clerks. Joe is in love with Helen and asks her to marry him, but she is forbidden to marry as she is still on parole, but she says yes and they are married. In spite of their poverty-level life, their marriage is a happy one until Joe discovers she has lied about her past, in order to marry him. Disillusioned, he leaves, goes back to his old gang and plans to rob the department store.','/sqfLuqm98JpIxSUFgRBm4y6uyPc.jpg','1938-06-01',94,'Released','Every time she says \'I Love You\'... she breaks the law!','You and Me',45971,2.2458,6.6,'-EqM9aIrDWk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1372,_binary '\0','/xNUMYhWIhxmbgEFq6bIiVwCiZSC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031002',7.3,1934,'en','The Young in Heart','A family of confidence tricksters sets their sights on a very rich, very lonely old lady named Miss Fortune.','/ecimQFwdSBQTNwdznb1d2EMuYLh.jpg','1938-07-06',90,'Released','Charming to meet, but expensive to know!','The Young in Heart',38023,1.9667,6.742,'XvnUk9UlE7w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1373,_binary '\0','/xoVYkpxUh00NlG63rTqnzoUav2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031020',6.8,1583,'en','The Adventures of Huckleberry Finn','Huckleberry Finn, a rambunctious boy adventurer chafing under the bonds of civilization, escapes his humdrum world and his selfish, plotting father by sailing a raft down the Mississippi River.','/f90tAQ5wWy0oL6FwFYCFCjFCXiE.jpg','1939-02-10',91,'Released','HIS GREATEST TRIUMPH!','The Adventures of Huckleberry Finn',59403,2.4796,6.7,'oVVt9aBNa1U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1374,_binary '\0','/qpNgzjflNBqzp4kc5QtYIBceWoB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031022',7.2,8313,'en','The Adventures of Sherlock Holmes','Having once again avoided criminal conviction, Professor Moriarity develops a murderous plan to “finish off” his last major nemesis, Sherlock Holmes, by making him fail to prevent the perfect crime. Does it involve a family curse, the crown jewels of England, or something else…','/oNE3GyeA9ZUCzI9jYTgNy7vYTfO.jpg','1939-09-01',85,'Released','The struggle of super-minds in the crime of the century!','The Adventures of Sherlock Holmes',17481,2.8964,6.935,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1375,_binary '\0','/py0IjblW7vsBtiCEVniEjDjItMZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031033',6.3,1999,'en','Allegheny Uprising','South western Pennsylvania area of colonial America, 1760s. Colonial distaste and disapproval of the British government is starting to surface. Many local colonists have been killed by American Indians who are armed with rifles supplied by white traders.','/dB1BolZCjLcW9XKkEN4pftpev1K.jpg','1939-11-10',81,'Released','PIONEERS WHO MADE AMERICA GREAT!','Allegheny Uprising',43825,1.932,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1376,_binary '\0','/rg4nR6hRrbxhiHhoivGd8xIgv2a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031047',7.4,8956,'en','Another Thin Man','Nick and Nora Charles are back - and this time, they have a baby, a wealthy new client, and another murder to solve! Retired detective Nick is enjoying family life with Nora and their young son, Nick Jr., when eccentric industrialist Colonel MacFay asks for protection after receiving threatening messages. When MacFay is found dead at his isolated estate, Nick and Nora spring into action, questioning a houseful of suspicious guests and uncovering greed, blackmail, family secrets, and a dangerous inheritance plot. With their trademark wit and sophistication, the glamorous couple balances parenthood, parties, and peril as they race to expose the killer.','/zmOjn9qg9Cun7P9YAKr5ajNZBcK.jpg','1939-11-17',103,'Released','Their Merriest Hit! Mr. and Mrs. Thin Man Have a B-A-B-Y!','Another Thin Man',14589,2.3934,7.1,'UiV6HqEPhQ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1377,_binary '\0','/rpSDfj74SxkFdKP0SUSu3hV7YYs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031060',6.8,6939,'en','At the Circus','Jeff Wilson, the owner of a small circus, owes his partner Carter $10,000. Before Jeff can pay, Carter\'s accomplices steal the money so he can take over the circus. Antonio Pirelli and Punchy, who work at the circus, together with lawyer Loophole try to find the thief and get the money back.','/dJsDjHYfOemGvVtHTdivU0Tl0YK.jpg','1939-10-20',87,'Released','Keep the world laughing!','At the Circus',22553,2.6578,6.386,'B3qDTGOxbEw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1378,_binary '\0','/aBid3Ug0ZHiFwqtVXNKETxviVkd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031066',6.3,3102,'en','Babes in Arms','Mickey Moran, son of two vaudeville veterans, decides to put up his own vaudeville show with his girlfriend Patsy Barton. But child actress Rosalie wants to make a comeback and replace Patsy both professionally and as Mickey\'s girl.','/hCE0OHNjMI2LNpoqJxDX4Otb06X.jpg','1939-10-10',93,'Released','The big musical fun show!','Babes in Arms',32610,1.8379,6.4,'tg5o_rEuVR0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1379,_binary '\0','/ac5M68cyFcRk4GfET5j5aGcZ3Mf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031067',7.5,5279,'en','Bachelor Mother','Polly Parrish, a clerk at Merlin\'s Department Store, is mistakenly presumed to be the mother of a foundling. Outraged at Polly\'s unmotherly conduct, David Merlin becomes determined to keep the single woman and \"her\" baby together.','/asVj2RpNpr9CSDYdYYu5Osg33A.jpg','1939-06-30',82,'Released','\"And a little child shall lead them\"... into the most delightfully surprising complications you\'ve seen on the screen!','Bachelor Mother',36488,1.8174,7.183,'Yfmrf8NcZyU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1380,_binary '\0','/1YsmP89lRD8SIb0WNXyzjFB8jvI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031088',7.5,7152,'en','Beau Geste','Brothers Beau, John and Digby Geste join the Foreign Legion, where they fall under the rule of tyrannical Sergeant Markoff. Beau and John are assigned to Fort Zinderneuf, where Markoff tries to break their spirit, aware of a dark family secret concerning a fabulous jewel one of them carries. As tensions rise, Arabs attack the fort and rivalries must be thrown aside in a desperate battle for life.','/xDRHfwghNNXy4ASdus5GSzyTX6x.jpg','1939-07-24',112,'Released','Thundering drama!','Beau Geste',36851,2.5862,7,'6Tsnrb9mE0k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1381,_binary '\0','/cTe2c4nnbB8AFzDgI7Y5vaWovy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031143',7.1,4272,'en','The Cat and the Canary','A group of potential heirs gather in a forbidding old house to learn which of them will inherit a fortune. Later, they learn that a flesh-rending maniac is loose.','/np28IFNSYQCGkMkab9tLFaGb3K6.jpg','1939-10-27',73,'Released','A CHILL-AND-CHUCKLE CHASE!...A FORTUNE AT STAKE AND A MONSTER AT LARGE!','The Cat and the Canary',18851,2.3865,6.9,'d0Hia-SDEeI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1382,_binary '\0','/9rQAhvogxiXpCtQwHm5WYDG2xnS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031147',7.2,2044,'en','Charlie Chan at Treasure Island','Charlie Chan\'s investigation of a blackmail-induced suicide as a case of murder leads him into a world of magick and mysticism peopled with a stage magician, a phoney spiritualist, and a for-real mind reader.','/zZbHQUsS2WRoYZQMfeXbtr37YM4.jpg','1939-08-31',72,'Released','The strange case of murder by magic!','Charlie Chan at Treasure Island',33388,1.9737,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1383,_binary '\0','/biPRygMgSHlacOCCwfx08msU7wT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031148',6.5,1493,'en','City in Darkness','Chan, in Paris for a reunion with friends from World War I, becomes involved in investigating the murder of a munitions manufacturer who was supplying arms to the enemy, even as the rising clouds of World War II force the city into nightly blackout status..','/rOv6CRm8WcUI7wsvUcfwk01lqWS.jpg','1939-11-15',75,'Released','PARIS! BLACKOUT!...but there\'s no blackout for crime...and the great detective is commandeered!','City in Darkness',33389,1.4783,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1384,_binary '\0','/hiT9seWWb5sKhYWT731dD5UOmrK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031149',7,1674,'en','Charlie Chan in Reno','Mary Whitman has gone to Reno to obtain a divorce. While there she is arrested on suspicion of murdering a fellow guest at her hotel (which specializes in divorcers). There are many others at the hotel who wanted the victim out of the way. Charlie comes from his home in Honolulu to solve the murder.','/pGmwoMtEurXHKNO0cOsfmmwqoth.jpg','1939-06-16',70,'Released','THE CASE OF THE MURDERED DIVORCEE!','Charlie Chan in Reno',33394,1.65,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1385,_binary '\0','/4FGXDyt6p8r7q2AvgW0KhGUQWk2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031173',6.7,2483,'en','Confessions of a Nazi Spy','FBI agent Ed Renard investigates the pre-War espionage activities of the German-American Bund.','/344MutCY2Xd6nxztXa1tkTR9Nml.jpg','1939-05-06',104,'Released','Trapped!','Confessions of a Nazi Spy',99920,2.34,6.1,'y_wn9GLgbWU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1386,_binary '\0','/9l8ZxvNyesvbux26uL3Mn7VN2cP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031208',5.7,1819,'en','The Dark Eyes of London','Insurance agent-physician collects on policies of men murdered by a disfigured resident of the home for the blind where he acts as doctor-on-call.','/bFJ3EYjBx2iq2UIfma6ajLeYyvl.jpg','1939-11-03',76,'Released','Eyes of Doom! Man or Beast!','The Dark Eyes of London',27144,1.7248,5.8,'FuqA-QZHXPM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1387,_binary '\0','/jsIYE5ntyzkJlGKiJcKFGYqH9yN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031210',7.4,13602,'en','Dark Victory','Socialite Judith Traherne lives a lavish but emotionally empty life. Riding horses is one of her few joys, and her stable master is secretly in love with her. Told she has a brain tumor by her doctor, Frederick Steele, Judith becomes distraught. After she decides to have surgery to remove the tumor, Judith realizes she is in love with Dr. Steele, but more troubling medical news may sabotage her new relationship, and her second chance at life.','/fbbzkhKJAxaA6lpHbcJqQIBaI1d.jpg','1939-04-20',104,'Released','I\'ve crammed every minute so full of waste. And now there\'s so little time. I don\'t know what to do. I\'m afraid!','Dark Victory',27972,3.3823,6.9,'Rawg6NoIP7M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1388,_binary '\0','/7Gy9bSYod5QolabzAm4Ol1P6wHZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031225',7.6,13650,'en','Destry Rides Again','Tom Destry, son of a legendary frontier peacekeeper, doesn’t believe in gunplay. Thus he becomes the object of widespread ridicule when he rides into the wide-open town of Bottleneck, the personal fiefdom of the crooked Kent.','/zEycmpHvzi60EJpbZCKbTc32AT7.jpg','1939-11-30',94,'Released','They make the fighting sinful west blaze into action before your eyes!','Destry Rides Again',43828,3.2702,7.2,'0pI-iBxGqTo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1389,_binary '\0','/wYWYya66V84JT8l8jqIuYTF5JZV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031235',7.1,6402,'en','Dodge City','In this epic Western, Wade Hatton, a wagon master turned sheriff, tames a cow town at the end of a railroad line.','/iySSQEAlvr87OYLA5aLzBU8q9lJ.jpg','1939-04-08',104,'Released','West of Chicago there was no law! West of Dodge City there was no God!','Dodge City',17660,3.0858,6.9,'zaGVr4RzOEE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1390,_binary '\0','/7WAIVDbISW49JZapha2Do88v8mr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031252',7,7504,'en','Drums Along the Mohawk','Albany, New York, 1776. After marrying, Gil and Lana travel north to settle on a small farm in the Mohawk River Valley, but soon their growing prosperity and happiness are threatened by the sinister sound of drums that announce dark times of revolution and war.','/xEBKiwxXByk5Co9ZwSwoQVLNT8e.jpg','1939-11-10',100,'Released','Thrilling! Stirring! Spectacular!','Drums Along the Mohawk',73194,3.7205,6.5,'ou6ITVZX9ao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1391,_binary '\0','/tKzlosTjzpCxVaZre1cefz41HRF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031260',7.2,4255,'en','Each Dawn I Die','A corrupt D.A. with governatorial ambitions is annoyed by an investigative reporter\'s criticism of his criminal activities and decides to frame the reporter for manslaughter in order to silence him.','/xA3lvN5YLQ6VHT7OGzMXgcumDQJ.jpg','1939-08-19',92,'Released','Slugging their way to adventure !','Each Dawn I Die',36342,2.6141,6.8,'08AYn00_5xA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1392,_binary '\0','/nYFHIagD5WhlMMexkggU39JOpFh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031302',6.8,2068,'en','Fifth Avenue Girl','A wealthy man hires a poor girl to play his mistress in order to get more attention from his neglectful family.','/A9XTY7hrdVPIMxS45ZXPX6hAO0u.jpg','1939-09-22',83,'Released','From park bench to parkside mansion in a riot of romantic complications and Hi-Hat Hilarity!','Fifth Avenue Girl',45185,1.9015,7,'_mNdvRNNCYc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1393,_binary '\0','/fnkbjJWmkAASsRifRL3NcRVnhCo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031314',7.1,2637,'en','Five Came Back','Twelve people are aboard Coast Airline\'s flagship the Silver Queen enroute to South America when the airplane encounters a storm and is blown off course. Crashing into jungles known to be inhabited by head hunters, pilots Bill and Joe race against time to fix the engines and attempt a take off. The situation brings out the best and worst in the stranded dozen as they create a makeshift runway and prepare to escape before the natives attack. But damage to the plane and low fuel reserves means that only 5 people can be carried to safety.','/lg5ADlTMjSb6y47JowklE4V0QRr.jpg','1939-06-23',75,'Released','Four must die! One must choose!','Five Came Back',65858,1.6224,6.3,'Bn4D5Zi8meY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1394,_binary '\0','/y3FJ80lgiOyD9D1Q141qypVRtxC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031322',6.7,6348,'en','The Flying Deuces','Ollie falls in love with a woman. When he discovers she\'s already married, he unsuccessfully attempts suicide but he and Stan then decide to join the Foreign Legion to get away from their troubles. When they’re arrested for soon trying to desert the Legion—they escape a firing squad by stealing an aircraft.','/wXXA3s9tzRV7tgiFqhm7Nvu9W8B.jpg','1939-11-03',69,'Released','They dish out the dizziest rib-ride of the year!','The Flying Deuces',22999,2.3012,6.365,'cEpuQyaano8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1395,_binary '\0','/3FXfrGh6gPU5gaaiz8h7zu53APE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031334',7.4,7181,'en','The Four Feathers','A disgraced officer risks his life to help his childhood friends in battle.','/3GMbILAAjMdoVCba5fWjhz2ONuf.jpg','1939-04-20',129,'Released','They made him a hero by branding him a coward... the story of a man who conquered fear.','The Four Feathers',10568,2.2162,7.1,'jY7gR0wHpRY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1396,_binary '\0','/6ktv57E6D7pQITEoey6XIJGYszo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031346',6.6,1228,'en','Frontier Marshal','Wyatt Earp agrees to become marshal and establish order in Tombstone in this very romanticized version of the gunfight at the O.K. Corral.','/SxAhP92u6bg0ok6y6OqAQMUADT.jpg','1939-07-28',71,'Released','BIGGER THAN ALL OUTDOORS - Too thrilling for words!','Frontier Marshal',154064,1.9269,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1397,_binary '\0','/1OVJHcUQ4VriCuwDe94vvZ65Taq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031359',7.3,5999,'en','Gaslight','Twenty years removed from Alice Barlow\'s murder by a thief looking for her jewels, newlyweds Paul and Bella Mallen move into the very house where the crime was committed. Retired detective B.G. Rough, who worked on the Barlow case, is still in the area and grows suspicious of Paul, who he feels bears a striking resemblance to one of Barlow\'s relatives. Rough must find the truth before the killer can strike again and reclaim his bounty.','/h3xaVryGKjvXjomHaqmqjjbasUC.jpg','1940-08-31',84,'Released',NULL,'Gaslight',55207,1.6558,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1398,_binary '\0','/vbdguNCtuz4C7np3yC2r7a9eaaB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031377',6.8,2448,'en','Golden Boy','Despite his talent as a musician, a city boy decides to become a boxer. He\'s successful as a fighter — much to the dismay of his father. When gangsters try to buy a piece of him, he begins to have second thoughts.','/tSbDPwCSXpJ6OuUQ2T2vsGzBU2v.jpg','1939-09-05',99,'Released','A Famous Play.....Now A Great Picture!','Golden Boy',43529,1.6547,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1399,_binary '\0','/4FHcxMtVruMr7ltU2cItWssLjTP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031381',8.2,358725,'en','Gone with the Wind','The spoiled daughter of a Georgia plantation owner conducts a tumultuous romance with a cynical profiteer during the American Civil War and Reconstruction Era.','/lNz2Ow0wGCAvzckW7EOjE03KcYv.jpg','1939-12-15',238,'Released','The greatest romance of all time!','Gone with the Wind',770,17.901,7.9,'0dTsfsr6-X8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1400,_binary '\0','/d9ThwpGXncwXLGk3jNOK1Xyrv5M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031385',7.9,12460,'en','Goodbye, Mr. Chips','Throughout the late 19th-century and early 20th-century, Mr Arthur Chipping rises from a shy, nervous teacher to the beloved, revered headmaster of Brookfield School, with his life and career shaped by his love for his wife and his unwavering dedication to his students.','/1M8yXsSglaW3CdUSX7uAxurwLtp.jpg','1939-07-28',114,'Released','At The Top Of The Year\'s \"Ten Best\" - The picture that earns for 1939 a proud place in motion-picture history!','Goodbye, Mr. Chips',42852,2.1473,7.4,'3lk8Th5SAkE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1401,_binary '\0','/jHjM7FNdW9DyWx83Zaal5KClMCq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031387',4.8,1860,'en','The Gorilla','When an escaped circus gorilla appears to have gone on a murderous rampage, a threatened attorney calls on the detective trio of Garrity, Harrigan and Mullivan to act as bodyguards. In short order, we discover that there is more to the attorney than meets the eye, and the ape may be innocent after all. When a pretty young heiress faces peril, it\'s up to our heroic trio to save the day.','/1SoQjbhbjWnqtbXWoZ4ha9qUBLz.jpg','1939-05-26',68,'Released','A Ritz is afraid of nothing ... but ... THIS ... IS ... SOMETHING!','The Gorilla',89723,1.0253,4.8,'FlG-vcH7pZY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1402,_binary '\0','/pwP9RTomD5Ft6fQYLmkUTUlKTgv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031397',6.6,5483,'en','Gulliver\'s Travels','Gulliver washes ashore on Lilliput and attempts to prevent war between that tiny kingdom and its equally-miniscule rival, Blefiscu, as well as smooth the way for the romance between the Princess and Prince of the opposing lands. In this he is alternately aided and hampered by the Lilliputian town crier and general fussbudget, Gabby. A life-threatening situation develops when the bumbling trio of Blefiscu spies, Sneak, Snoop, and Snitch, manage to steal Gulliver\'s pistol.','/fiwAJIAnSqWbU3JphqN8Y80mFM6.jpg','1939-11-10',76,'Released','The Amazing Characters in Jonathan Swift\'s Immortal Fantasy Come To Life !','Gulliver\'s Travels',42518,2.8725,6.2,'tPRV_8u09Cg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1403,_binary '\0','/e2bbVKWvsci9ZvIA773EozFkEHd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031398',7.2,13761,'en','Gunga Din','British army sergeants Ballantine, Cutter and MacChesney serve in India during the 1880s, along with their native water-bearer, Gunga Din. While completing a dangerous telegraph-repair mission, they unearth evidence of the suppressed Thuggee cult. When Gunga Din tells the sergeants about a secret temple made of gold, the fortune-hunting Cutter is captured by the Thuggees, and it\'s up to his friends to rescue him.','/opkVdHbKWJeCXzgFLba2geEIDak.jpg','1939-01-26',117,'Released','Barbaric Splendor - Gasping Magnitude - Adventure !','Gunga Din',24965,2.9329,6.5,'1wIMA9FRFLU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1404,_binary '\0','/rXILUagNP3zoLcY0iGcRk43dMBH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031448',7.4,13141,'en','The Hound of the Baskervilles','When a nobleman is threatened by a family curse on his newly inherited estate, detective Sherlock Holmes is hired to investigate.','/61XD1LxA3kXLRrBXat3jN84MtPR.jpg','1939-03-24',80,'Released',NULL,'The Hound of the Baskervilles',27118,3.4654,7.1,'HwEKKpw5wUk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1405,_binary '\0','/mt1RJGw7LvAoIGflIqYG87u84Xq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031455',7.8,13435,'en','The Hunchback of Notre Dame','Paris, France, 1482. Frollo, Chief Justice of benevolent King Louis XI, gets infatuated by the beauty of Esmeralda, a young Romani girl. The hunchback Quasimodo, Frollo\'s protege and bell-ringer of Notre Dame, lives in peace among the bells in the heights of the immense cathedral until he is involved by the twisted magistrate in his malicious plans to free himself from Esmeralda\'s alleged spell, which he believes to be the devil\'s work.','/m6fsyHeqSQs4tktk9q3awgo7IzF.jpg','1939-08-31',117,'Released','Impact! Power! Fire! Pathos! Drama!','The Hunchback of Notre Dame',31685,5.6134,7.3,'QoHbHMhRXJA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1406,_binary '\0','/5agQvhI7FuAZj3xjYzKGuFP9MRr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031473',6.5,1974,'en','Idiot\'s Delight','A group of disparate travelers are thrown together in a posh Alpine hotel when the borders are closed at the start of WWII.','/fRM3nh7m941IfQXcb2RKc6EyM93.jpg','1939-01-27',107,'Released','The Biggest Thrill They Ever Gave You! Norma and Clark together in the romance of a \"ham\" song-and-dance man and a \"red-headed liar from Omaha.\"','Idiot\'s Delight',61523,2.2099,6.1,'X1Fj0UfJguw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1407,_binary '\0','/5o3xRUGmMqwnl8bn2jnfriGgzvZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031477',7,3966,'en','In Name Only','A wealthy man falls for a widow but is locked into a loveless marriage with a woman who has contrived to convince his parents she is the ideal wife.','/5hFwlor6k3vow7FVVIQ3L6rI0fN.jpg','1939-08-18',94,'Released','A woman trying to live her own life-A man who wouldn\'t let her-A wife living without love, fighting them both with the bitter weapons of a desperate heart!','In Name Only',33030,1.8282,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1408,_binary '\0','/ye9wO7oHbae13trtAEvS32vFOLZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031491',6.6,3177,'en','Intermezzo: A Love Story','A concert violinist becomes charmed with his daughter\'s talented piano teacher. When he invites her to go on tour with him, they make beautiful music away from the concert hall as well. He soon leaves his wife so the two can go off together.','/vcgWi8qF7blt7KYW7jiBgP7fVmM.jpg','1939-10-06',70,'Released',NULL,'Intermezzo: A Love Story',31868,1.9801,6.7,'jvK23z6E7nQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1409,_binary '\0','/bDxJzTQTHFenVXWZMHKaHHkOLWE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031500',6.8,3766,'en','It\'s a Wonderful World','Detective Guy Johnson\'s client, Willie Heywood, is framed for murder. While Guy hides him so he can catch the real killer, both of them are nabbed by the police, tried, convicted and sentenced to jail: Guy for a year with Willie to be executed. On the way to jail, Guy comes across a clue and escapes from the police.','/9hhZwERR4bOzkqK3kJ6UAnJ3fY7.jpg','1939-05-19',86,'Released','THE HAPPENINGS OF ONE WONDERFUL NIGHT!','It\'s a Wonderful World',47156,2.5474,6.52,'iQdYHQZtWY4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1410,_binary '\0','/lhxWysolJLjlW6NoTTfi9erbAK7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031505',6.3,12427,'en','Jamaica Inn','In early 19th-century Cornwall, young Mary Yellan travels to live with her aunt and uncle at the remote Jamaica Inn, where she discovers the inn is a front for a violent gang of wreckers who lure ships to their doom along the coast. As she becomes entangled in their crimes, Mary must fight to survive and uncover the truth behind the terror that haunts the moors.','/qgeBF25h9MYoxJmKvlUj60IGDNz.jpg','1939-05-11',100,'Released','He ruled Jamaica Inn...citadel of sin on the moors, curse-ridden, shunned, reviled. Enough sensations for a dozen pictures. Laughton at his most magnificent.','Jamaica Inn',31995,3.4481,6.139,'cCZ9o9qduV8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1411,_binary '\0','/wvM3T2lzv1QdByTMrizjyECuEBy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031507',7,5574,'en','Jesse James','After railroad agents forcibly evict the James family from their family farm, Jesse and Frank turn to banditry for revenge.','/s85NggId22ntp4pbYwTbtHdalnY.jpg','1939-01-14',106,'Released','Motion Pictures\' Supreme Epic!','Jesse James',43829,3.2879,6.6,'oh5VyrviJQs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1412,_binary '\0','/9gEEeK9hwkxS1fEtYEAohahAWxq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031514',7.6,8959,'fr','Le jour se lève','After committing a murder, a man locks himself in his apartment and recollects the events that led him to the killing.','/cjbHvOHbZ2sMgHJM8P7L1Pt5wAV.jpg','1939-06-09',93,'Released',NULL,'Daybreak',27053,2.4919,7.583,'6W4lacJZ2Z8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1413,_binary '\0','/wIkio1H3an8DidlNmosy1DZaXvN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031516',6.8,2790,'en','Juarez','The newly-named emperor Maximilian and his wife Carlota arrive in Mexico to face popular sentiment favoring Benito Juárez and democracy.','/khymYF2OFEkSukQouLdrjchugph.jpg','1939-06-10',125,'Released','See It Now ! You\'ll Remember It Always !','Juarez',78318,2.2487,6.5,'Jc_dxKE7sng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1414,_binary '\0','/oc6dDot0ueGbDdfXRtuKcPlTHuM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031536',6.4,1806,'en','King of the Underworld','Physician Carole Nelson, suspected of having ties to notorious gangster Joe Gurney, must prove her innocence or the Medical Board will revoke her license. When Gurney seeks her out for treatment after being shot, it could be the break Nelson needs. Now she has a chance to use her medical know-how to outwit Gurney and his goons and reestablish her professional reputation.','/j3UhHLF1qgIWL8GLDJBKiCIkUDi.jpg','1939-01-14',67,'Released','Don\'t kill this killer! Bring him back alive!','King of the Underworld',27966,1.5401,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1415,_binary '\0','/hH4a4d2xzHmEhaWFX9kqTVuAlR7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031580',7.2,7370,'en','The Little Princess','A little girl goes in search of her father who is reported missing by the military during the Second Boer War.','/cnMSURyv7R6gjmUm5SYdTxXLzIO.jpg','1939-03-17',93,'Released','A great classic comes to life in glorious Technicolor!','The Little Princess',26531,2.8138,6.6,'VKR9LFKI0to','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1416,_binary '\0','/sS1W3HmhIfXbMNp6OECMHyNej6K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031593',7.3,7349,'en','Love Affair','A French playboy and an American former nightclub singer fall in love aboard a ship. They arrange to reunite six months later, if neither has changed their mind.','/2bKxlYgwKRQidS8S9DSPjpITPlv.jpg','1939-04-07',88,'Released','They Part as Strangers... to meet again as lovers...! Two people who were true to themselves...and who loved each other...at the expense of those who loved them!','Love Affair',43739,2.2253,7,'dHtQIxdRr5k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1417,_binary '\0','/jg1ITkQ4oBaz6vJGr12pFIJDQWF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031602',6.3,4579,'en','Made for Each Other','A couple struggle to find happiness after a whirlwind courtship.','/74uJvU4zgGrsy9K3QU2W9UFppmE.jpg','1939-02-10',92,'Released','Heartbreak...!','Made for Each Other',18569,2.7504,6.1,'LT5ocMiaqek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1418,_binary '\0','/8BtYzwyr172RjVUKl6waprQ0YDZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031614',6.8,2267,'en','The Man They Could Not Hang','Dr. Henryk Savaard is a scientist working on experiments to restore life to the dead. When he is unjustly hanged for murder, he is brought back to life by his trusted assistant. Re-animated he turns decidedly nasty and sets about murdering the jury that convicted him.','/suq8DvZGg1klbvbr27YCzmhmmVN.jpg','1939-08-17',64,'Released','TRANSFORMED BY THE HANGMAN\'S NOOSE... from a doctor serving humanity, into a demon filled with hate and terrorizing blood-lust!','The Man They Could Not Hang',26925,2.0655,6.6,'ppSb01QNBRE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1419,_binary '\0','/dV6mM6R6zUWqmWe2cJW1FeACUhr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031619',7,2308,'en','The Man in the Iron Mask','Years have passed since the Three Musketeers, Aramis, Athos and Porthos, have fought together with their friend, D\'Artagnan. But with the tyrannical King Louis using his power to wreak havoc in the kingdom while his twin brother, Philippe, remains imprisoned, the Musketeers reunite to abduct Louis and replace him with Philippe.','/wRA8czTcw7x0cVPCGgGYswGCJOd.jpg','1939-07-13',112,'Released','Free Him!','The Man in the Iron Mask',43836,4.1246,7.038,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1420,_binary '\0','/5OWJmE13ykcnT0NBZupfgiXnGur.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031647',7.8,6522,'en','Midnight','An unemployed American showgirl poses as Hungarian royalty to infiltrate Parisian high society.','/tT7nhCDJ3ngJjATlJVehKMijwSG.jpg','1939-03-24',94,'Released','You\'ll have the time of your LIFE at MIDNIGHT!','Midnight',31993,1.9497,7.378,'_KmF0gSiaTA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1421,_binary '\0','/gQWoielS55JE7v527he8QhNcs9s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031678',6.4,1578,'en','Mr. Moto\'s Last Warning','A Japanese man claiming to be Mr. Moto, of the International Police, is abducted and murdered soon after disembarking from a ship at Port Said in Egypt. The real Mr. Moto is already in Port Said, investigating a conspiracy against the British and French governments.','/AboXVQh5iNEbxqbHxtWoAFRrvva.jpg','1939-01-20',71,'Released',NULL,'Mr. Moto\'s Last Warning',18705,1.6685,5.7,'RAlzRbFxHSw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1422,_binary '\0','/4HagjGPF6dMGYlmx7mEfjLV2kQ0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031679',8.1,130479,'en','Mr. Smith Goes to Washington','After the death of a United States Senator, the idealistic Jefferson Smith is appointed as his replacement in Washington. The naive and earnest new senator soon finds himself battling political corruption.','/nDjg1fbNyq15excNDl3acd2IqAk.jpg','1939-10-19',130,'Released','Romance, drama, laughter and heartbreak... created out of the very heart and soil of America!','Mr. Smith Goes to Washington',3083,5.418,7.812,'0bWfK3VTYGY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1423,_binary '\0','/2IW6WgKO0A9rBlhARUUkVMVOq65.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031709',6.5,1677,'en','Nancy Drew... Reporter','While participating in a contest at a local newspaper in which high school students are asked to submit a news story, Nancy Drew intercepts a real story assignment concerning the death of a woman who was poisoned. Nancy doesn\'t think the young woman accused of the crime is guilty and corrals her neighbor Ted into searching for a vital piece of evidence and stumbles onto the identity of the real killer.','/wFlJKXPWf360M9b1088dHtEUutE.jpg','1939-02-18',68,'Released','What chance has a story with this 16-year-old newshawk on its trail?','Nancy Drew... Reporter',23280,1.4445,6,'tkwnlEqk_pg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1424,_binary '\0','/AjYX2r2dn1s31A8fDaPPiYRrZ6L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031725',7.8,25123,'en','Ninotchka','A stern Russian woman sent to Paris on official business finds herself attracted to a man who represents everything she is supposed to detest.','/v4MkgNqZyodYwBDNbZ64MF9tVEL.jpg','1939-11-16',110,'Released','Garbo Laughs!','Ninotchka',1859,3.8963,7.5,'OhCCG5qSC1I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1425,_binary '\0','/oM2pdFnPzNIyvbM4I1MtF3YNmcS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031742',7.8,7640,'en','Of Mice and Men','An intellectually disabled giant and his level headed guardian find work at a sadistic cowboy\'s ranch in depression era America.','/ihgGS9K8pCYdgb9SpanxoKcJ0Al.jpg','1939-12-24',106,'Released','She was made for love... and tragedy.','Of Mice and Men',51802,3.3468,7.3,'t91ecmMnG18','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1426,_binary '\0','/9QMxQYORVAn3xdxlMO9m5bUkaFN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031747',6.4,2897,'en','The Oklahoma Kid','McCord\'s gang robs the stage carrying money to pay Indians for their land, and the notorious outlaw \"The Oklahoma Kid\" Jim Kincaid takes the money from McCord. McCord stakes a \"sooner\" claim on land which is to be used for a new town; in exchange for giving it up, he gets control of gambling and saloons. When Kincaid\'s father runs for mayor, McCord incites a mob to lynch the old man whom McCord has already framed for murder.','/EryVBlv0KH7m2RBzyoxuTrhZUV.jpg','1939-03-11',85,'Released','Greater Than \"Cimarron\" - Packed with Thrills - Loaded with Action . . . As an Exciting page from American history is unfolded upon the screen !','The Oklahoma Kid',39459,2.6012,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1427,_binary '\0','/rHnYpnvR2pFMk2wTVKs3sWU5hLF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031750',7.4,4508,'en','The Old Maid','The lives of two cousins are complicated by the return of an ex-boyfriend and an illegitimate child.','/zhng83EL9rrH8wPXtjAL19pvQHu.jpg','1939-08-16',95,'Released','Vividly, unforgettably, a woman\'s love starved soul is revealed. All those strange secrets she locks in her heart ... moments of rapture and of heartbreak ... longings that no man can fathom. Of these has the year\'s finest picture been woven!','The Old Maid',44919,1.7822,7,'jU4NPRIWZ_0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1428,_binary '\0','/9pFJqVskfOhlZtRVs4THM8HFToR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031754',7.7,2537,'en','On Borrowed Time','Young Pud is orphaned and left in the care of his aged grandparents. The boy and his grandfather are inseparable. Gramps is concerned for Pud\'s future and wary of a scheming relative who seeks custody of the child. One day Mr. Brink, an agent of Death, arrives to take Gramps \"to the land where the woodbine twineth.\" Through a bit of trickery, Gramps confines Mr. Brink, and thus Death, to the branches of a large apple tree, giving Gramps extra time to resolve issues about Pud\'s future.','/oXMezIc8wpnaT8KdPpcx4cv4yfd.jpg','1939-07-07',99,'Released','The Great Broadway Stage Hit Reaches The Screen','On Borrowed Time',40730,3.0024,7.6,'4aBC-TknLhA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1429,_binary '\0','/wq7KVxUAYH06cHuReBcV0Sx2kFv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031762',7.6,17663,'en','Only Angels Have Wings','A traveling performer arrives at a remote South American port town where the head of an air freight service must risk his pilots\' lives to earn a major contract.','/lqcwiWancAkjtAQPHr9V3SfJjBM.jpg','1939-05-15',121,'Released','BIG As The Fog-Shrouded Andes!','Only Angels Have Wings',43832,4.0493,7.296,'Cu-LBgeDJlA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1430,_binary '\0','/gdHnaAWtZOBpxIIKoy9wHKnYd8m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031796',4.7,1220,'en','The Phantom Creeps','A mad scientist attempts to rule the world by creating various elaborate inventions.','/gsjPEN30Z7WJFMQIgAYUzbxCjvx.jpg','1939-01-07',265,'Released',NULL,'The Phantom Creeps',45607,1.7026,4.5,'v14r8R7Tdns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1431,_binary '\0','/cK2zBicZsxa998cd81Qj6sv0WWi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031826',7,6741,'en','The Private Lives of Elizabeth and Essex','This period drama frames the tumultuous affair between Queen Elizabeth I and the man who would be King of England.','/b0rK1LNAmyaEGbdJ8kvGzU3QVe6.jpg','1939-11-11',106,'Released','Elizabeth I\'s love for the Earl of Essex threatens to destroy her kingdom.','The Private Lives of Elizabeth and Essex',16902,2.4798,6.3,'7BMGcrlwwv0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1432,_binary '\0','/wLXWFOYbHtj1TKsKQYynL26hsVm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031831',6.5,1226,'en','Q Planes','In England, an eccentric police inspector, an earnest test pilot and a spunky female reporter team up to solve the mystery of a series of test aircraft which have disappeared without a trace while over the ocean on their maiden flights; unaware, as they are, that a spy ring has been shooting the planes down with a ray machine hidden aboard a salvage vessel which is on hand to haul the downed aircraft aboard, crews and all.','/7fXAi6UTPtcegc7CUojcgUemL3z.jpg','1939-02-21',82,'Released','DRAMA OF THE WAR ON SPIES!','Q Planes',43833,1.5386,6,'K1y2wpSzvL4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1433,_binary '\0','/9RnsbF7POa9Fm5Eb8LPAdnGJQDN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031835',6.9,2524,'en','The Rains Came','Indian aristocrat Rama Safti returns from medical training in the U.S. to give his life to the poor folk of Ranchipur. Lady Edwina and her drunken artist ex-lover Tom Ransome get in the way, but everyone shapes up when faced by earthquake, flooding, and plague.','/9YKebRdIT0chap1rCSXQuExsZqx.jpg','1939-09-15',104,'Released',NULL,'The Rains Came',115109,2.1992,6.1,'DD-jxCyrobk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1434,_binary '\0','/6pv2fkaDLkEhpqSDYy1bJe0MZn7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031842',6.5,1355,'en','The Real Glory','Fort Mysang, southern Philippine Islands, under US rule, 1906. A small group of army officers and native troops resist the fierce and treacherous attacks of the ruthless Alisang and his fanatical followers.','/fWUlNt585JRfFNBFdYGrfBGO7GS.jpg','1939-09-29',97,'Released','Always outnumbered, never outfought','The Real Glory',111750,2.2209,6.3,'AgxO_4DLA4E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1435,_binary '\0','/ad4ZXMeWkL65tGbdAbtilpCzSNa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031851',5.7,2929,'en','The Return of Doctor X','When news reporter Walter Garrett arrives at the hotel room of bombshell actress Angela Merrova to conduct an interview, he finds her dead from multiple stab wounds. He returns with the police to find the hotel empty and the body vanished. Garrett writes about the incident but is fired when Merrova, alive and well, goes to the paper to complain. Now his only chance to get his job back is to find the truth, which involves the grisly scheme of a madman.','/4ZoZ5iyiBx0DDmNs3C7nCvUvbES.jpg','1939-11-23',62,'Released','HE ROSE FROM THE DEAD...TO HAUNT THE LIVING!!!','The Return of Doctor X',3575,2.3884,6,'pB5m5RiVyAs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1436,_binary '\0','/ujZtDH8CSiVETuK9ancFTPAmZr6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031867',7.9,17803,'en','The Roaring Twenties','After World War I, Armistice Lloyd Hart goes back to practice law, former saloon keeper George Hally turns to bootlegging, and out-of-work Eddie Bartlett becomes a cab driver. Eddie builds a fleet of cabs through delivery of bootleg liquor and hires Lloyd as his lawyer. George becomes Eddie\'s partner and the rackets flourish until love and rivalry interfere.','/nkymdElqwJBm2bl3F6hJp4xJggD.jpg','1939-10-28',104,'Released','The land of the free gone wild! The heyday of the hotcha! The shock-crammed days G-men took ten whole years to lick!','The Roaring Twenties',37698,3.1495,7.535,'-zrSKQg1mhU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1437,_binary '\0','/8lRULNwlOIQ5Jg8puE2g7gjk32j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031885',7.9,33670,'fr','La Règle du jeu','The Marquis de la Chesnaye and his wife host a weekend gala where a variety of complicated romantic and social entanglements between guests and servants lead to tragedy, all against the backdrop of a looming war.','/8JOzt7uFZyshcuzCBmYU6CDJL4D.jpg','1939-07-09',110,'Released',NULL,'The Rules of the Game',776,4.3381,7.482,'oRH7oaBQuaY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1438,_binary '\0','/1Ek4nOpkLeBycYUr3SmLsE9Bm1e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031951',7.1,13577,'en','Son of Frankenstein','One of the sons of late Dr. Henry Frankenstein finds his father\'s ghoulish creation in a coma and revives him, only to find out the monster is controlled by Ygor who is bent on revenge.','/oefhX4T3iWo2XFvaOunR7azWAo3.jpg','1939-01-13',99,'Released','The black shadows of the past bred this half-man/half-demon! Creating a new and terrible juggernaut of destruction!','Son of Frankenstein',3077,4.6623,6.729,'iMzbgLftYro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1439,_binary '\0','/2u9BoSFs0gmOPoiQDrRqvOtE3BD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031968',6.9,2938,'en','The Spy in Black','A German submarine is sent to the Orkney Isles in 1917 to sink the British fleet.','/ukPn5dtccNT29wMfwpMdz0P5rY6.jpg','1939-08-03',82,'Released','Today\'s U-boat terror makes this the year\'s timeliest picture!','The Spy in Black',75363,1.7329,6.4,'IFLJRWi1fuk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1440,_binary '\0','/7SYNEG50fKODsTP6h9phYM3BueV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031971',7.8,59695,'en','Stagecoach','A group of people traveling on a stagecoach find their journey complicated by the threat of Geronimo, and learn something about each other in the process.','/zgMnfnwWZ3nkx4t0bUDEKtW24O8.jpg','1939-03-02',96,'Released','A powerful story of nine strange people.','Stagecoach',995,6.2605,7.598,'OE-VWDsdkwM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1441,_binary '\0','/8LerY6up6Q6WDbDvDInxBxr5IWr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031973',7,1675,'en','Stanley and Livingstone','When American newspaperman and adventurer Henry M. Stanley comes back from the western Indian wars, his editor James Gordon Bennett sends him to Africa to find Dr. David Livingstone, the missing Scottish missionary. Stanley finds Livingstone (\"Dr. Livingstone, I presume.\") blissfully doling out medicine and religion to the happy natives. His story is at first disbelieved.','/qzllhCKNOsrFWhULvMpSaE2OaFx.jpg','1939-08-18',101,'Released','He succeeded in the maddest quest in History...because one girl believed in him!','Stanley and Livingstone',89086,1.6356,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1442,_binary '\0','/AkgwfE8aOS3BNpqCD2g9ujmmpmU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031976',7,1335,'en','The Stars Look Down','Davey Fenwick leaves his mining village on a university scholarship intent on returning to better support the miners against the owners. But he falls in love with Jenny who gets him to marry her and return home as local schoolteacher before finishing his degree.','/aUmcGT0ghKBc82fXvJYypkVt2Pg.jpg','1940-01-22',110,'Released','FROM THE PEN OF \"THE CITADEL\'S\" BOLD AUTHOR!','The Stars Look Down',43822,1.6513,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1443,_binary '\0','/oGrBAl69RJ03KKz5brTkUBVG0CL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031981',6.9,1290,'en','The Story of Alexander Graham Bell','Alexander Graham Bell falls in love with deaf girl Mabel Hubbard while teaching the deaf and trying to invent means for telegraphing the human voice. She urges him to put off thoughts of marriage until his experiments are complete. He invents the telephone, marries and becomes rich and famous, though his happiness is threatened when a rival company sets out to ruin him.','/mi1IX2qBgtwiMihaNTGiPC8nG72.jpg','1939-04-04',98,'Released','Darryl F. Zanuck\'s Entertainment gem will take its place in the Hall of Fame !','The Story of Alexander Graham Bell',67375,2.6023,6.3,'NDN5_Dvmgs4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1444,_binary '\0','/jzXgFdjr1hsqd0i0rO8xW6iQcCX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0031983',6.9,2998,'en','The Story of Vernon and Irene Castle','In 1911, minor stage comic, Vernon Castle meets the stage-struck Irene Foote. A few misadventures later, they marry and then abandon comedy to attempt a dancing career together. While they\'re performing in Paris, an agent sees them rehearse and starts them on their brilliant career as the world\'s foremost ballroom dancers. However, at the height of their fame, World War I begins.','/nIGYzyl31VD3doz9CYeh2yKHi0E.jpg','1939-03-29',93,'Released','Dazzling entertainment rainbowed by memory\'s most haunting hit melodies!','The Story of Vernon and Irene Castle',18651,2.4489,7.035,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1445,_binary '\0','/4nGvDqmcNKhJ6NISaZPYKzqavZF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032007',6.5,3860,'en','Tarzan Finds a Son!','A young couple die in a plane crash in the jungle. Their son is found by Tarzan and Jane who name him Boy and raise him as their own. Five years later a search party comes to find the young heir to millions of dollars. Jane agrees, against Tarzan\'s will, to lead them to civilization.','/zOdhpqijqm1BDzTBlVv2kvFzgVm.jpg','1939-06-16',82,'Released','Super Story of a Super Man ! The Titan of all Tarzans . . . Giant of all jungle thrills . . . worth the years it took to make !','Tarzan Finds a Son!',40044,3.1128,6.1,'uoXH_Slg4vI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1446,_binary '\0','/xnGgfaFymvmvqEQ7xSs02jn8IsW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032022',6.8,2867,'en','They Made Me a Criminal','A boxer flees, believing he has committed a murder while he was drunk.','/aNiWJ2C8Amrun55JCvuvGEPIXli.jpg','1939-01-21',92,'Released','I am a fugitive! I am hunted by the mob! I am wanted by the cops! I am forgotten by decent women!','They Made Me a Criminal',26378,2.3375,6.3,'ZN9gszvotks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1447,_binary '\0','/hc0D1vOE2i7oylKcZcwoo6vO6zr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032043',6.4,1712,'en','Topper Takes a Trip','Mrs. Topper\'s friend Mrs. Parkhurst has convinced Mrs Topper to file for a divorce from Cosmo due to the strange circumstances of his trip with ghost Marion Kirby. Marion comes back from heaven\'s door to help Cosmo again, this time only with dog Mr. Atlas. Due to a strange behavior of Cosmo, the judge refuses to divorce them, so Mrs. Parkhurst takes Mrs. Topper on a trip to France where she tries to arrange the final reasons for the divorce. With help of a gold-digging French baron, Marion takes Cosmo to the same hotel to bring them back together and to get her own final ticket to heaven, but the whole thing turns out to be not too easy.','/7eNvEGuEIgnn1dwuVBpoQRYfhxH.jpg','1938-12-29',80,'Released','A merry romance packed with fun!','Topper Takes a Trip',54430,1.654,6.6,'yf4kcHyhdjg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1448,_binary '\0','/ypOhDna6flQwGSO4Fl5uaH8i0Tn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032049',6.6,2546,'en','Tower of London','In the 15th century, Richard, Duke of Gloucester, aided by his club-footed executioner Mord, eliminates those ahead of him in succession to the throne, then occupied by his brother, King Edward IV of England.','/4SdFxnLTppb2iH0cv2hK13ULSgk.jpg','1939-11-17',92,'Released','See: VAST ARMIES CLASH BEFORE YOUR EYES! See: AXE-COLD MASTERS OF TREACHERY! See: DARK SECRETS BEHIND GRIM TOWERS! See: CRUELTY, COLD AS A HEADSMAN\'S AXE! See: BLOOD BOILING, LUSTY EXCITEMENT!','Tower of London',28365,2.0011,6.151,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1449,_binary '\0','/2irUfjyGZibkM2sR2AsBHTtgeuo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032080',7,3944,'en','Union Pacific','One of the last bills signed by President Lincoln authorizes pushing the Union Pacific Railroad across the wilderness to California. But financial opportunist Asa Barrows hopes to profit from obstructing it. Chief troubleshooter Jeff Butler has his hands full fighting Barrows\' agent, gambler Sid Campeau; Campeau\'s partner Dick Allen is Jeff\'s war buddy and rival suitor for engineer\'s daughter Molly Monahan. Who will survive the effort to push the railroad through at any cost?','/lSk1CWl7EaHKBNMPaDWGnhRO598.jpg','1939-05-05',135,'Released','\"Union Pacific\" is coming!','Union Pacific',43837,2.6598,6.7,'CA6wg0XiBJU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1450,_binary '\0','/g1OvTd1eF346vmx8qsJnjaiooZ6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032138',8.1,472657,'en','The Wizard of Oz','Young Dorothy finds herself in a magical world where she makes friends with a lion, a scarecrow and a tin man as they make their way along the yellow brick road to talk with the Wizard and ask for the things they miss most in their lives. The Wicked Witch of the West is the only thing that could stop them.','/uCC3j4pV9eOZwzDUWp2ilbcTf1f.jpg','1939-08-21',102,'Released','We\'re off to see the Wizard, the wonderful Wizard of Oz!','The Wizard of Oz',630,22.3608,7.6,'FfpF8UUVTeM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1451,_binary '\0','/v7d5LDcIhNn9j3wWeSWp1mesgBe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032143',7.7,16284,'en','The Women','A happily married woman lets her catty friends talk her into divorce when her husband strays.','/wMTbDI60uvt7ecLZ301XEE8mAOo.jpg','1939-09-01',133,'Released','It\'s all about men!','The Women',22490,3.2763,7.2,'I8WsqaN4izs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1452,_binary '\0','/z7aF8AG12QpirHEvKffN0R0HL6M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032145',7.5,23040,'en','Wuthering Heights','Young orphan Heathcliff is adopted by the wealthy Earnshaw family and moves into their estate, Wuthering Heights. Soon, the new resident falls for his compassionate foster sister, Cathy. The two share a remarkable bond that seems unbreakable until Cathy, feeling the pressure of social convention, suppresses her feelings and marries Edgar Linton, a man of means who befits her stature. Heathcliff vows to win her back.','/pwHdSzXwlUFAcYGcFutKcPcX2OW.jpg','1939-04-07',104,'Released','I am torn with Desire… tortured by hate!','Wuthering Heights',3084,4.7525,7.2,'XmuMd4FnnYo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1453,_binary '\0','/wSRdkr01H1eUWIIUKZVgkldSXc1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032152',6.9,2024,'en','You Can\'t Cheat an Honest Man','Fields plays \"Larsen E. Whipsnade\", the owner of a shady carnival that is constantly on the run from the law. Whipsnade is struggling to keep a step ahead of foreclosure, and clearly not paying his performers, including Bergen and McCarthy, who try to coax money out of him, or in McCarthy\'s case, steal some outright.','/rY45oLvvzzRNh8cArch9hyb7e5G.jpg','1939-02-17',76,'Released','AT LAST YOU CAN SEE THESE FAMOUS FEUDSTERS CLASH ON THE SCREEN!','You Can\'t Cheat an Honest Man',28753,1.3878,6.955,'9CP0aAx-DmM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1454,_binary '\0','/epseta9NxR0dyBbqTdGgEnW0Rgi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032153',6.4,1562,'en','You Can\'t Get Away with Murder','Johnnie learns crime from petty thug Frank Wilson. When Wilson kills a pawnbroker with a gun stolen from Johnnie\'s sister Madge\'s fiance Fred Burke, Fred goes to Sing Sing\'s death house. Wilson uses all the pressure can to keep Johnnie silent, even after he and Johnnie themselves wind up in the big house.','/9AqCXB4RksSsU0hk8QpGGyW4qe.jpg','1939-03-23',89,'Released','AMERICA\'S TWO-FISTER ANSWER to the Gun-Mad Rats Who Rule the Underworld!','You Can\'t Get Away with Murder',87612,1.8714,5.8,'Hkv2oz7p1dU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1455,_binary '\0','/buGNPL2zNGjPirZTMT3DwwkVdw1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032155',7.5,10038,'en','Young Mr. Lincoln','In this dramatized account of his early law career in Illinois, Abraham Lincoln is born into a modest log cabin, where he is encouraged by his first love, Ann Rutledge, to pursue law. Following her tragic death, Lincoln establishes a law practice in Springfield, where he meets a young Mary Todd. Lincoln\'s law skills are put to the test when he takes on the difficult task of defending two brothers who have been accused of murder.','/gVHbi2AZfWsZB10FJcwaFV59kIo.jpg','1939-06-09',100,'Released','The story of Abraham Lincoln that has NEVER been told!','Young Mr. Lincoln',43838,2.8356,7.2,'jrwr3KQaZfI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1456,_binary '\0','/jl8Te0ZZXxO6iBuQmZgZSZqqCnd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032156',7.7,4956,'ja','残菊物語','In late 19th-century Tokyo, Kikunosuke Onoue, the adopted son of a legendary actor, himself an actor specializing in female roles, discovers that the praise he receives is only due to his status as his father\'s heir. Devastated, he turns to Otoku, a servant of his family, for comfort, and they fall in love. Kikunosuke becomes determined to leave home and develop as an actor on his own merits, and Otoku faithfully joins him.','/m43EBVmYBiNC2RtcMUAag4IWsZS.jpg','1939-10-13',144,'Released',NULL,'The Story of the Last Chrysanthemum',46069,2.0682,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1457,_binary '\0','/gEu38QfPlIFCuUKDPP4c4MKg4vm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032179',6.1,1461,'en','21 Days','After Larry Darrent accidentally kills his lover\'s blackmailing husband, someone else is arrested for the crime. When he is found guilty, Larry and Wanda have just three weeks together before he must give himself up— or let an innocent man go to the gallows.','/oFM4H2S4UqlbWSK0GDd6lWEw1Fa.jpg','1940-01-07',72,'Released','Excitingly together!','21 Days',46832,2.3219,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1458,_binary '\0','/mh1v8vYCo3kkPc2bg8ugdOa3G6E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032181',7.3,2289,'en','Abe Lincoln in Illinois','Abe Lincoln in Illinois is a 1940 biographical film which tells the story of the life of Abraham Lincoln from his departure from Kentucky until his election as President of the United States.','/xKI8TOiOL5Emt2GAOIOckmlisF1.jpg','1940-02-22',110,'Released','Now on the screen!','Abe Lincoln in Illinois',43806,2.9599,6.9,'X7oKms7i040','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1459,_binary '\0','/uO3SbVLMJDltwD7tPFeXUHvzUP5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032186',7.9,1721,'es','Ahí está el detalle','Cantinflas, the boyfriend of the servant of a rich industrial man, gets into the house in order to kill a mad dog. Suddenly this man appears so the servant tells him that Cantinflas is his wife\'s brother (Leonardo), who had been lost for years. The rich man then remembers that his father in law\'s testament could only be paid when all brothers get together, so treats Cantinflas, a real bum, as a king.','/nrjRU634pbgHVsP5xV87PXjoTbX.jpg','1940-09-11',112,'Released',NULL,'You’re Missing the Point',69060,1.8096,8.199,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1460,_binary '\0','/1ANzUVLtf2iAgemBPz61xnA3M1I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032194',7.4,5958,'en','All This, and Heaven Too','When lovely and virtuous governess Henriette Deluzy comes to educate the children of the debonair Duc de Praslin, a royal subject to King Louis-Philippe and the husband of the volatile and obsessive Duchesse de Praslin, she instantly incurs the wrath of her mistress, who is insanely jealous of anyone who comes near her estranged husband. Though she saves the duchess\'s little son from a near-death illness and warms herself to all the children, she is nevertheless dismissed by the vengeful duchess as the attraction between the duke and Henriette continues to grow.','/j4KbLsCLnJVALXuV3djKOI8sUfc.jpg','1940-07-05',141,'Released','The screen has never held greater thrills than these: the deep-stirring romance of two heaven-destined lovers ...the magnificent surge of its history-making story ...and the first, momentous clash of Hollywood\'s most dynamic stars!','All This, and Heaven Too',43807,2.9896,7.194,'8BP3nIRxiCU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1461,_binary '\0','/hpQ7dLKEdIsztIIFUMzrgVZMkls.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032209',6.5,1500,'en','Angels Over Broadway','Small-time businessman Charles Engle is threatened with exposure for embezzling $3,000 for his free-spending wife. Deciding on suicide, he scribbles a note, stuffs it in his pocket and goes for one last night on the town. He is pulled into a poker game by conman Bill O\'Brien and singer Nina Barone, but when they discover the dropped note, they resolve to turn the tables, get Engle his $3,000 and save his life.','/e3wuFDQ9D8Wtz5sLB16qLIPcC89.jpg','1940-10-02',79,'Released','A Romance Born Between Dusk and Dawn','Angels Over Broadway',42756,1.3407,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1462,_binary '\0','/iLhfRsn3u0GWZ1vr8rQOLNeGw3M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032215',4.7,2314,'en','The Ape','Dr. Bernard Adrian is a kindly scientist who seeks to cure a young woman\'s polio. He needs human spinal fluid to complete the formula for his experimental serum. Meanwhile, a vicious circus ape has broken out of its cage, and is terrorizing the townspeople. Can there be a connection?','/kXb0rlowlyXOriVMaEhpqBzmySk.jpg','1940-09-30',62,'Released','Jungle Beast or Man of Science?','The Ape',37426,1.1996,4.8,'HiQJPyv48b4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1463,_binary '\0','/tIOls8W1J9vkYBHn7Brn8UTZe23.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032221',6.8,1805,'en','Arizona','Phoebe Titus is a tough, swaggering pioneer woman, but her ways become decidedly more feminine when she falls for California bound Peter Muncie. But Peter won\'t be distracted from his journey and Phoebe is left alone and plenty busy with villains Jefferson Carteret and Lazarus Ward plotting at every turn to destroy her freighting company. She has not seen the last of Peter, however.','/qDOcNRXtYJzvqAGmkeubVd17xsG.jpg','1940-12-25',125,'Released','Turbulent Adventure in the Great West!','Arizona',35561,2.1125,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1464,_binary '\0','/erqri6EuFfDNZg2kPjk33IPKfGq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032234',7.1,8315,'en','The Bank Dick','Egbert Sousé becomes an unexpected hero when a bank robber falls over a bench he\'s occupying. Now considered brave, Egbert is given a job as a bank guard. Soon, he is approached by charlatan J. Frothingham Waterbury about buying shares in a mining company. Egbert persuades teller Og Oggilby to lend him bank money, to be returned when the scheme pays off. Unfortunately, bank inspector Snoopington then makes a surprise appearance.','/3XrqHTrJpTaUeyqXqb4fVacYWpf.jpg','1940-11-29',72,'Released','Was His Face Red . . . And His Nose, Too ! when the bandits took the money . . . and the SAFE !','The Bank Dick',911,2.4037,6.526,'vpBRMlo9CH0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1465,_binary '\0','/bnr05Ik91AByas7iKcPPKbxvmCR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032245',6.1,1660,'en','Before I Hang','Dr. John Garth conducting an innovative medical experiment aimed at prolonging life and combating aging. The experiment takes an unexpected turn, placing the doctor in a confrontation with the ethics of his work and the consequences of his research.','/geAC0ve6IKQCLXdB0OESKAFaJJi.jpg','1940-09-17',62,'Released','Beware! When Karloff stops the clock, your hour has come!','Before I Hang',26923,1.5987,6.3,'ppSb01QNBRE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1466,_binary '\0','/yfiPoLudPQaVqwPShYMpEqJqopS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032247',6.5,2710,'en','Beyond Tomorrow','The ghosts of three elderly industrialists killed in an airplane crash return to Earth to help reunite a young couple whom they initially brought together.','/fmZV9KDOjfgQuE7Y2XP7yayzzyw.jpg','1940-05-10',84,'Released','Is there a better time to fall in love?','Beyond Tomorrow',31445,1.2499,6.1,'gNT5IPkWfAI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1467,_binary '\0','/uMbzbXR46JB9UoBrcjpDvOeJADF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032258',6.3,3356,'en','Black Friday','University professor George Kingsley is struck by gangsters while crossing the street, leaving him with brain damage and one of the gangsters, Cannon, paralyzed. Kingsley\'s friend Dr. Sovac attends to both men, and when Cannon offers him a reward for aiding his recovery, Kovac transplants part of Cannon\'s brain into the dying Kingsley\'s skull, creating a dual personality.','/268GiPoyYmuNhrez1I7GXypKC6T.jpg','1940-02-29',70,'Released','A Reign Of HORROR... a man-made monster on the loose!','Black Friday',13784,1.5128,6.024,'aUKx1HeTAJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1468,_binary '\0','/4BQpKhhJ8rXpvkfLFCEmhxxMX5b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032264',6.2,2245,'en','The Blue Bird','Peasant children Mytyl and Tyltyl are led on a magical quest for the fabulous Blue Bird of Happiness by the fairy Berylune. On their journey, they\'re accompanied by the anthropomorphized presences of a Dog, a Cat, Light, Fire, and Bread, among other entities.','/4MLru2banKCbCC5iGOmqon3h569.jpg','1940-01-15',88,'Released','1001 Wonders in Technicolor','The Blue Bird',60400,2.0698,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1469,_binary '\0','/bPeWQCyLtAWGyjtJ9mdfPcvhRTe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032273',7,4181,'en','Boom Town','Two buddies who rise from fly-by-night wildcatters to oil tycoons over a twenty year period both love the same woman. McMasters and Sand come to oil towns to get rich. Betsy comes West intending to marry Sand but marries McMasters instead. Getting rich and losing it all teaches McMasters and Sand the value of personal ties.','/upPOcyAhnL0tDPL8MsTRrOJquiJ.jpg','1940-08-30',119,'Released','Where Men Are Rough And Tough . . . And Like Their Women The Same Way !','Boom Town',55604,1.7377,7,'8RcAIk_gi0c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1470,_binary '\0','/wudRKHhBiUyNY56v60lgHSdQscT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032281',6.3,1224,'en','Brigham Young','Based on the story of the famous Mormon leader, it follows Brigham Young and his challenge to transport his people across the Rocky mountains to settle in Salt Lake City. The plot focuses on two fictitious characters, Jonathan Kent and Zina Webb and the hardships they have to face along the way.','/oEw9oe3e0rWcLxc1L0kp56Big8n.jpg','1940-09-27',114,'Released','The Great American Motion Picture !','Brigham Young',56152,2.4326,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1471,_binary '\0','/afezayeK4htWhOqBAj49pCmRGX0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032283',6.1,1464,'en','British Intelligence','During WWI pretty German master spy Helene von Lorbeer is sent undercover to London to live with the family of a high-placed British official where she is to rendezvous with the butler Valdar, also a spy, and help him transmit secret war plans back to Germany.','/bD2ET0q1eVjJnDDLQ3egApB71fL.jpg','1939-11-10',61,'Released','Although the home of cabinet minister Arthur Bennett is a hotbed of spies, moles, and double agents, no one knows the true identity of notorious German spymaster Strendler.','British Intelligence',51787,1.1893,5.8,'fftw-6iMggE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1472,_binary '\0','/3uuriQM1BLoolqUL4GhsMoqCc8q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032284',7.2,3091,'en','Broadway Melody of 1940','Johnny Brett and King Shaw are an unsuccessful dance team in New York. A producer discovers Brett as the new partner for Clare Bennett, but Brett, who thinks he is one of the people they lent money to, gives him the name of his partner.','/3TiHFf4fh8B14G3ZI4lE8wuHvtQ.jpg','1940-02-09',102,'Released','The Finest Broadway Melody Of Them All','Broadway Melody of 1940',43809,2.7032,6.9,'ZNvtyNA5KrU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1473,_binary '\0','/b8XmJxOpihoaJ6eVSg0N2j4nK8j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032285',7,3473,'en','Brother Orchid','When retired racket boss John Sarto tries to reclaim his place and former friends try to kill him, he finds solace in a monastery and reinvents himself as a pious monk.','/qf2Qr4cBrjpu3ZqiKaa3pP6T7Rr.jpg','1940-06-07',88,'Released','We\'d like youse to meet Brother Orchid!','Brother Orchid',26635,1.6113,6.6,'HbrnNLSdGIA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1474,_binary '\0','/h8HAdHM7y5LSLzPxtmrGYmoTzuH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032324',7,1917,'en','Charlie Chan at the Wax Museum','A wax museum run by a demented doctor contains statues of such crime figures as Jack the Ripper and Bluebeard. In addition to making wax statues the doctor performs plastic surgery. It is here that an arch fiend takes refuge.','/1OObtLSkrFgkadhrkqROCjH0o6F.jpg','1940-09-06',63,'Released','FOUR TIMES IN 18 EERIE MINUTES CHARLIE CHAN FACES DEATH! -- Death from a poison dart! -- Death from a streaking bullet! -- Death from a gleaming dagger!','Charlie Chan at the Wax Museum',38457,1.3652,7.7,'SVv_SGFSpaw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1475,_binary '\0','/uo4L3IwyTLh4Ff2aDCNYKoqJHv5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032325',7.1,1675,'en','Charlie Chan in Panama','Charlie impersonates an employee of the U.S. government to foil an espionage plot which would destroy part of the Panama Canal, trapping a Navy fleet on its way to the Pacific after maneuvers in the Atlantic.','/oFmgkqu2eXQPzGdf4gpe5w58jLl.jpg','1940-03-01',66,'Released','One more minute... and the fleet is doomed!','Charlie Chan in Panama',38458,1.6015,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1476,_binary '\0','/syDlDDwjFLHDQaEVE8ShRyiQ8fk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032326',7.1,1643,'en','Charlie Chan\'s Murder Cruise','On a cruise ship from Honolulu to San Francisco, the famous Chinese detective encounters four more murders while trying to figure out the murder of a Scotland Yard friend.','/cmluBTdeZKIf8irEk6PBi5WuEUK.jpg','1940-05-02',77,'Released','DEATH AFLOAT...striking swiftly. suddenly...leaving on each strangled victim a calling card of crimson coin...thirty pieces of silver!','Charlie Chan\'s Murder Cruise',38456,1.8946,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1477,_binary '\0','/wrY1SEmtP5CrpYZzfe4wkEVfhco.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032338',7.3,4797,'en','Christmas in July','An office clerk loves entering contests in the hopes of someday winning a fortune and marrying the girl he loves. His latest attempt is the Maxford House Coffee Slogan Contest. As a joke, some of his co-workers put together a fake telegram which says that he won the $25,000 grand prize.','/sxbBYi198Zgj4cix3VCL4s0wH4X.jpg','1940-10-25',67,'Released','If you can\'t sleep at night, it isn\'t the coffee - it\'s the bunk!','Christmas in July',34778,1.7173,7,'5JwOJab2Q_w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1478,_binary '\0','/dizD1d6Xw4nRdYZXAOq00mIMjgK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032339',7.2,4761,'en','A Chump at Oxford','The boys get jobs as a butler and maid-- Stan in drag-- for a dinner party. When that ends in disaster, they resort to sweeping streets and accidentally capture a bank robber. The grateful bank president sends them to Oxford, at their request, and higher-education hijinks ensue.','/m88sC2iclgDCyJR4EKgoWQ3ujob.jpg','1940-01-25',63,'Released','Figuring out a grand time for you!','A Chump at Oxford',33810,2.1913,6.875,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1479,_binary '\0','/rc1bQzU565L4RD4t6nUZ0IwSXvq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032342',7.2,3015,'en','City for Conquest','The heartbreaking but hopeful tale of Danny Kenny and Peggy Nash, two sweethearts who meet and struggle through their impoverished lives in New York City. When Peggy, hoping for something better in life for both of them, breaks off her engagement to Danny, he sets out to be a championship boxer, while she becomes a dancer paired with a sleazy partner. Will tragedy reunite the former lovers?','/pwWBxZMFfgSEvi82PjR8099lcl9.jpg','1940-09-21',104,'Released','A story with all the fire and fury of its two great stars!','City for Conquest',31148,2.0696,6.9,'BjvISRn7fvg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1480,_binary '\0','/qcDW9sABLy71v1dKaymdybAotLX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032349',6.6,2043,'en','Comrade X','An American reporter smuggling news out of Soviet Moscow is blackmailed into helping a beautiful Communist leave the country.','/j6eJWdHfydZhLM0IyaejwuORR5W.jpg','1940-12-13',90,'Released','This Year\'s Laugh Riot!','Comrade X',32194,1.7527,6.1,'9vvz6QVbWZo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1481,_binary '\0','/12jrfFV54t2JWNE7fuEKmEJVjuJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032356',6.9,1544,'en','Contraband','During early World War II, a Danish sea captain, delayed in a British port, tangles with German spies.','/tQM4SVjH5sHkwSHFnQG34SLwIh5.jpg','1940-05-11',91,'Released','Stop that man and woman! His mission is deadlier than that of the enemy in the sky. Her beauty is a dangerous weapon of war!','Contraband',79684,1.3975,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1482,_binary '\0','/bKWBwEoZfhSqKPpz9NFJGFgyUyI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032376',6.8,3588,'en','Dance, Girl, Dance','Judy O\'Brien is an aspiring ballerina in a dance troupe. Also in the company is Bubbles, a brash mantrap who leaves the struggling troupe for a career in burlesque. When the company disbands, Bubbles gives Judy a thankless job as her stooge. The two eventually clash when both fall for the same man.','/1gJuUG7SeVAbhmO9qXvkEVKY3Pq.jpg','1940-08-30',90,'Released','Heartbreak Behind Gayety of a Girly-Girl Show!','Dance, Girl, Dance',32196,2.2707,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1483,_binary '\0','/ilf5nRx24mAacQYA23g9W6mKJ7s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032383',6.7,3355,'en','Dark Command','When transplanted Texan Bob Seton arrives in Lawrence, Kansas he finds much to like about the place, especially Mary McCloud, daughter of the local banker. Politics is in the air however. It\'s just prior to the civil war and there is already a sharp division in the Territory as to whether it will remain slave-free. When he gets the opportunity to run for marshal, Seton finds himself running against the respected local schoolteacher, William Cantrell. Not is what it seems however. While acting as the upstanding citizen in public, Cantrell is dangerously ambitious and is prepared to do anything to make his mark, and his fortune, on the Territory. When he loses the race for marshal, he forms a group of raiders who run guns into the territory and rob and terrorize settlers throughout the territory. Eventually donning Confederate uniforms, it is left to Seton and the good citizens of Lawrence to face Cantrell and his raiders in one final clash.','/kpnO4PU7Pc9ZUAfs0BM9QizA0bm.jpg','1940-04-15',94,'Released','A drama of undying love.','Dark Command',40639,2.3518,6.4,'1DUtTBNEaAw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1484,_binary '\0','/1GOo1eE5tLwEMqrysAetuISSE0B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032390',5.4,3893,'en','The Devil Bat','Dr. Paul Carruthers is frustrated because he thinks his employers, Mary Heath and Henry Morton, have cheated him out of the company\'s profits. He decides to get revenge by altering bats to grow twice their normal size and training them to attack when they smell a perfume of his own making. He mixes the perfume into a lotion, which he offers as a gift to Mary and Henry. When they turn up dead, a newspaper reporter decides to investigate.','/g1boVvNLVKYbP2H7MoGol9sQAIH.jpg','1940-12-13',68,'Released','He\'s Trained His Brood of Blood-Hungry Bats to Kill on Command!','The Devil Bat',41021,1.8157,5.3,'UXKxhzAGnSE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1485,_binary '\0','/c9k3Am0QhRhTGJQsDVfcbxeF0lJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032404',5.5,1594,'en','Doomed to Die','Shipping magnate Cyrus Wentworth, downcast over a disaster to his ocean liner \'Wentworth Castle\' (carrying, oddly enough, an illicit shipment of Chinese bonds) is shot in his office at the very moment of kicking out his daughter\'s fiance Dick Fleming. Of course, Captain Street arrests Dick, but reporter Bobbie Logan, the attractive thorn in Street\'s side, is so convinced he\'s wrong that she enlists the help of detective James Lee Wong to find the real killer.','/fZM1TXUismtG2D5OouYhncceTYL.jpg','1940-08-12',68,'Released','The master of crime cleans up the dirty game of murder!','Doomed to Die',22965,1.2626,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1486,_binary '\0','/5kyuveLcxz9aS5ufKXWTPeILJ0S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032410',6.4,1519,'en','Down Argentine Way','The story—in which an American heiress on holiday in South America falls in love with an Argentine horse breeder against the wishes of their families—takes a backseat to the spectacular location shooting and parade of extravagant musical numbers, which include the larger-than-life Carmen Miranda singing the hit “South American Way” and a showstopping dance routine by the always amazing Nicholas Brothers.','/gg3DgplgKq8ZBFnMwMfgGuhSZCs.jpg','1940-10-11',89,'Released','GLAMOROUS BUENOS AIRES NIGHT LIFE WITH SOUTH AMERICAN\'S TANTALIZING, TORRID-VOICED CARMEN MIRANDA','Down Argentine Way',43810,1.7094,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1487,_binary '\0','/nHbIdtHO6oENW1FNOJRX11CdIY1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032412',6.4,3420,'en','Dr. Cyclops','Four explorers are summoned to Peru by the brilliant physicist Dr Thorkel. They discover a rich source of radium and a half-mad Thorkel who shrinks them down to one-fifth their normal size when they threaten to stop his unorthodox experimentation.','/qLsEEx1cy2ouISG7982sX4xNltQ.jpg','1940-04-12',63,'Released',NULL,'Dr. Cyclops',3593,1.9642,6.2,'vz2ChHGknUw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1488,_binary '\0','/1KhMREOLVTemliXbhbyR6IPAJwi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032413',7.4,2027,'en','Dr. Ehrlich\'s Magic Bullet','German scientist Paul Ehrlich makes remarkable advancements in the field of medical diagnostics with his research in cellular staining with dyes. His work results in new knowledge about tuberculosis, but also leads to his contraction of the disease. Ehrlich travels to Egypt, where he investigates diphtheria and earns more accolades. Eventually, his research in treating diseases leads to the development of a \'magic bullet\' treatment for syphilis.','/nLQGolem6LY02jmRu9dpkInKrW3.jpg','1940-02-23',103,'Released','NOT A GANGSTER PICTURE BUT ...a war on the deadliest public enemy of all!','Dr. Ehrlich\'s Magic Bullet',88192,2.0078,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1489,_binary '\0','/xHkb33IVsJBlW8bJmHNsMzJKc6g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032432',7,1978,'en','Edison, the Man','In flashback, fifty years after inventing the light bulb, an 82-year-old Edison tells his story starting at age twenty-two with his arrival in New York. He\'s on his way with the invention of an early form of the stock market ticker.','/zSWK3tOYDnCe2YEnQRpcV7R9bTn.jpg','1940-05-10',107,'Released','Spencer Tracy\'s greatest performance!','Edison, the Man',43811,2.5488,6.8,'lvjSwjtHts4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1490,_binary '\0','/oQwRVbeJ6Y6vsb52ON9w8SNUd6h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032447',7,1332,'en','Escape','An American goes to pre-war Germany to find his mother and discovers her in a concentration camp. With the help of an American-born widowed countess he seeks to engineer her escape.','/hQWrCUM3JnTrDT4Iz9l173JjAHh.jpg','1940-11-01',98,'Released','Thrilling Book : Magnificent Picture','Escape',109008,1.4957,7.5,'7FhC1XcFg68','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1491,_binary '\0','/lyzI5uFJC2E7sIYCCdaU0oZkDw2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032455',7.7,112366,'en','Fantasia','Walt Disney\'s timeless masterpiece is an extravaganza of sight and sound! See the music come to life, hear the pictures burst into song and experience the excitement that is Fantasia over and over again.','/5m9njnidjR0syG2gpVPVgcEMB2X.jpg','1940-11-13',124,'Released','The most sensational sound you\'ll ever see!','Fantasia',756,8.4196,7.3,'-s5oWnsjYdA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1492,_binary '\0','/6tNz5rG7Cr5cy0MFsK7aEu9KOnk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032457',5.4,1507,'en','The Fatal Hour','When a police officer is murdered, Captain Street looks to Mr. Wong to catch the killer. Prime Suspect: Frank Belden Jr., whose father is a businessman well known for both his success and dishonesty. Mr. Wong faces increasing danger and is nearly executed himself as the investigation develops in treachery and complexity. As Mr. Wong follows the trail of dead bodies, he uncovers a jewel smuggling ring on the San Francisco waterfront and a case much larger than the death of a police officer.','/usYO02PkjbQi3n4QJcpgvUWy2Zn.jpg','1940-01-15',68,'Released',NULL,'The Fatal Hour',59706,1.2591,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1493,_binary '\0','/7RxMF2Y4nFJlnH5Y41zqx0BUaAR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032467',6.6,2247,'en','The Fighting 69th','Although loudmouthed braggart Jerry Plunkett alienates his comrades and officers, Father Duffy, the regimental chaplain, has faith that he\'ll prove himself in the end.','/9GeoiU8nO01Cgr20Ls8DbJUoWIP.jpg','1940-01-27',90,'Released','Jammed With Action ! . . Loaded With Excitement ! . . . And Every Thrill-Packed Word Is True !','The Fighting 69th',72638,1.6278,5.8,'_6YkaAmoUmw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1494,_binary '\0','/8jhMguVVMHMkv0Q6BLP1N0iu2FW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032475',6.6,1655,'en','Flash Gordon Conquers the Universe','A mysterious plague, the Purple Death, ravages the earth. Dr. Zarkov, investigating in his spaceship, finds a ship from planet Mongo seeding the atmosphere with dust. Sure enough, Ming the Merciless is up to his old tricks. So it\'s back to Mongo for Flash, Dale, and Zarkov.','/5vT3VkTpdLQ2Me1WWbLHA7QCLr4.jpg','1940-03-03',195,'Released','New Thrills...New Marvels, New Wonders New Thrills!...New Marvels, New Wonders','Flash Gordon Conquers the Universe',68064,2.1708,5.8,'AlEWl3igd0c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1495,_binary '\0','/fe1j0IFaAGNyxbsIgEwFlZICKPk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032484',7.4,26422,'en','Foreign Correspondent','American crime reporter John Jones is reassigned to Europe as a foreign correspondent to cover the imminent war. When he walks into the middle of an assassination and stumbles on a spy ring, he seeks help from a beautiful politician’s daughter and an urbane English journalist to uncover the truth.','/n0WX6eIdIliKB66MI2MWZ3wHsoJ.jpg','1940-08-16',120,'Released','The thrill spectacle of the year!','Foreign Correspondent',25670,3.2128,7,'zXbQ7CRaAao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1496,_binary '\0','/xIxEbgF1Ta7xzQPqLpfhKrMuIw1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032520',7,4606,'en','The Ghost Breakers','After intrepid working girl Mary Carter becomes the new owner of a reputedly haunted mansion located off the Cuban coast, a stranger phones warning her to stay away from the castle. Undaunted, Mary sets sail for Cuba with a stowaway in her trunk—wise-cracking Larry Lawrence, a radio announcer who helps Mary get to the bottom of the voodoo magic, zombies and ghosts that supposedly curse the spooky estate.','/zytHhgTgPuHNdKFxeyznHa6BkA.jpg','1940-06-21',85,'Released','When the Ghost WALKS... They RUN!','The Ghost Breakers',14605,2.3761,6.5,'1Td7YVGfXbc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1497,_binary '\0','/n3UWHyZU5g9Rf7DA0m4UUNSAemd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032536',6.8,6185,'en','Go West','A con man heading west to search for gold teams up with a pair of scheming brothers along the way. The trio soon find themselves in the middle of a feud between two rival families and two underhanded land developers.','/di0laTicoduEdp1WS10T8Poss7r.jpg','1940-12-06',80,'Released','JUMP INTO YOUR BOOTS AND SADDLES...IT\'S ROUND-UP TIME IN THE WILD AND WOOLY WEST!','Go West',22575,4.2554,6.6,'wwccQt_4g6k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1498,_binary '\0','/r7AcmVk6kGhdFdesViGaI3dEHWd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032551',8.1,107649,'en','The Grapes of Wrath','Tom Joad returns to his home after a jail sentence to find his family kicked out of their farm due to foreclosure. He catches up with them on his Uncle’s farm, and joins them the next day as they head for California and a new life... Hopefully.','/eUcxMVBIA0Jg8l1RGUqycrc3eIQ.jpg','1940-03-15',129,'Released','The Joads step right out of the pages of the novel that has shocked millions!','The Grapes of Wrath',596,7.0629,7.803,'e8C_eK2ra3s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1499,_binary '\0','/c8Pi8F1FzpNebtgXcSjC9nWCdSW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032553',8.4,260352,'en','The Great Dictator','Dictator Adenoid Hynkel tries to expand his empire while a poor Jewish barber tries to avoid persecution from Hynkel\'s regime.','/nhMXB8GTdswYMCL9nepDZymJCOr.jpg','1940-10-15',125,'Released','Once again - the whole world laughs!','The Great Dictator',914,10.7699,8.3,'i1C6qZVeFtA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1500,_binary '\0','/8lWbcydL0imbHJAO0IcnuXtvOKg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032554',7.2,4958,'en','The Great McGinty','Told in flashback, Depression-era bum Dan McGinty is recruited by the city\'s political machine to help with vote fraud. His great aptitude for this brings rapid promotion from \"the boss,\" who finally decides he\'d be ideal as a new, nominally \"reform\" mayor; but this candidacy requires marriage. His in-name-only marriage to honest Catherine proves the beginning of the end for dishonest Dan...','/2Lrt9YthfN9Iay4QyiLz4pdp2k0.jpg','1940-08-01',82,'Released','It\'s Two-Fisted FUN! A fightin\' fool gives you laughter of a lifetime..!','The Great McGinty',36495,1.7394,6.951,'OpT06whw7nk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1501,_binary '\0','/ihoQaiMFAz4YCTAaSIsQjRknsNH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032599',7.8,68627,'en','His Girl Friday','Walter Burns is an irresistibly conniving newspaper publisher desperate to woo back his paper’s star reporter, who also happens to be his estranged wife. She’s threatening to quit and settle down with a new beau, but, as Walter knows, she has a weakness: she can’t resist a juicy scoop.','/lu86Y9zTPH3neCiUzLzHCEFHf7f.jpg','1940-01-18',92,'Released','They\'re at each other\'s throats when they\'re not in each other\'s arms!','His Girl Friday',3085,5.2961,7.4,'FKghQCbQOwY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1502,_binary '\0','/vw5sTOWEkMfLP7qXX1Tm4VHcdgP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032610',7,1739,'en','The House of the Seven Gables','In 1828, the bankrupt Pyncheon family fight over Seven Gables, the ancestral mansion. To obtain the house, Jaffrey Pyncheon obtains his brother Clifford\'s false conviction for murder. Hepzibah, Clifford\'s sweet fiancée, patiently waits twenty years for his release, whereupon Clifford and his former cellmate, abolitionist Matthew, have a certain scheme in mind.','/tvruNVi91OtVwFyWkWnC7VYhMdg.jpg','1940-04-12',89,'Released','AN ANCIENT HOUSE! A MURDER SECRET! A HIDDEN TREASURE!','The House of the Seven Gables',28373,2.2941,7,'nj9GRoMKmLE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1503,_binary '\0','/bcOZB2QQkJseteknFPOfL09A2To.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032612',6,1439,'en','The Howards of Virginia','Beautiful young Virginian Jane steps down from her proper aristocratic upbringing when she marries down-to-earth surveyor Matt Howard. Matt joins the Colonial forces in their fight for freedom against England. Matt will meet Jane\'s father in the battlefield.','/yngj5fihIRXufFqzH0MVhC1HdPd.jpg','1940-09-19',116,'Released','The Vivid Drama Of A Nation\'s Birth !','The Howards of Virginia',52360,2.332,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1504,_binary '\0','/me5swCVlFefBFX6lkFLj6KaIiDk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032617',7.4,4286,'en','I Love You Again','Boring businessman Larry Wilson recovers from amnesia and discovers he\'s really a con man...and loves his soon-to-be-ex wife.','/vOqMLBf3AcTqjM1PFcYDDAgye23.jpg','1940-08-09',99,'Released','It\'s one, long, loud l-a-u-g-h!','I Love You Again',20643,2.6036,7.2,'KCDM8bXA-rw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1505,_binary '\0','/s9fkuABRgvo4ovWft8O4ywdtlRB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032635',6.4,6185,'en','The Invisible Man Returns','The owner of a coal mining operation, falsely imprisoned for fratricide, takes a drug to make him invisible, despite its side effect: gradual madness.','/hJmmgKnY0NaJKVP7Glb4ciAzXWr.jpg','1940-01-12',81,'Released','They hear him! They feel him! But they can\'t stop him!','The Invisible Man Returns',28421,3.7727,6.305,'HENb4zmuyGw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1506,_binary '\0','/9CsOxigYZWZ9heb3GfCo5kWZxCI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032636',6.7,2263,'en','Invisible Stripes','A gangster is unable to go straight after returning home from prison.','/88U6ZWmIUWnxQvVPQzE3RJ2fOXY.jpg','1939-12-30',81,'Released','Three Men and a Girl... Bound by Invisible Ties - Branded by Invisible Stripes','Invisible Stripes',80196,2.3196,6.2,'NTyS8idXuRk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1507,_binary '\0','/gbxm4XRbDAfeyd2KLxSi7Rmf2q5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032637',5.9,3940,'en','The Invisible Woman','Kitty Carroll, an attractive store model, volunteers to become a test subject for a machine that will make her invisible so that she can use her invisibility to exact revenge on her ex-boss.','/ySUbbnVGTeFxZKdn2Vdf7OXeIc2.jpg','1940-12-27',72,'Released','She Has an Invisible Touch','The Invisible Woman',28423,2.7875,5.731,'25RiU3VxQNw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1508,_binary '\0','/kkfAWhxWHm7P2UMU74Vvi0Im70m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032643',6.6,1738,'en','It All Came True','After crooked nightclub owner murders a police informant, he blackmails his piano player to allow him to stay at his eccentric mother\'s boarding house.','/660MnFKEjuFuAJnL8cwBPbRmtS7.jpg','1940-04-06',97,'Released','Hurry! Here\'s a Hit!','It All Came True',64928,1.5977,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1509,_binary '\0','/yfTXQ7pjQp7o3mYh2EJ5bPJgIT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032651',6.9,1759,'en','Johnny Apollo','Wall Street broker Robert Cain, Sr., is jailed for embezzling. His college graduate son Bob then turns to crime to raise money for his father\'s release. As assistant to mobster Mickey Dwyer, then falls for Dwyer\'s girl Lucky. He winds up in the same prison as his father.','/hYmGde6YNfJAYpG91kJu6dVKjuU.jpg','1940-04-19',94,'Released','Jolting, Dynamic DRAMA!','Johnny Apollo',66707,1.7794,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1510,_binary '\0','/4msV23h4lRFXQoOUUL8Oc0XTcxt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032653',5,3694,'de','Jud Süß','Nazi historical drama about Duke Karl Alexander of Württemberg and his treasurer Süß Oppenheimer.','/3fN1p4OY7Mi0zXQqMJvCdhRwEYs.jpg','1940-09-24',95,'Released',NULL,'Süss, the Jew',8417,1.7316,4.4,'JCQgMvkaa1s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1511,_binary '\0','/qu13TuRt8PUlgXElKTaaVz2V1UO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032671',6.9,4563,'en','Kitty Foyle','A hard-working, white-collar girl falls in love with a young socialite, but meets with his family\'s disapproval.','/3c5yyi6ULsz5V0Ayv0o90BbmgJj.jpg','1940-12-27',108,'Released','The natural history of a woman','Kitty Foyle',77744,2.2927,6.596,'ha3lQeRVwqo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1512,_binary '\0','/nd5WhA0BzylVBbXldnxs0Xx21Vp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032676',6.7,2350,'en','Knute Rockne All American','The story of legendary Notre Dame football player and coach Knute Rockne.','/b4WaxrxDa2AK4ydo7BaHidwHjMq.jpg','1940-10-05',98,'Released',NULL,'Knute Rockne All American',43812,2.544,6.1,'bPNtH7l6MtI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1513,_binary '\0','/o03816KjEc3SzqP93xamC44xrOL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032701',7.5,16065,'en','The Letter','After a woman shoots a man to death, a damning letter she wrote raises suspicions.','/fe43qXp2sRAZbPDKX1puKGEwOon.jpg','1940-11-21',95,'Released','Fascinating, Tantalizing and DANGEROUS!','The Letter',17801,3.0176,7.275,'F-1sgvur72o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1514,_binary '\0','/o2bN1lMPgWnlylcaQHMnit1BxYR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032728',6.9,5603,'en','The Long Voyage Home','The crew of the merchant ship Glencairn hope to survive a transatlantic crossing during World War II. Adapted from four Eugene O\'Neill one-act plays.','/vZifqG5wSSAoCGl7r3ESFW46Opl.jpg','1940-11-16',105,'Released','The Love of Women in Their Eyes... The Salt of the Sea in Their Blood!','The Long Voyage Home',52859,3.0268,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1515,_binary '\0','/fJPLmN13u4IrKxT6xmhaDQ9HKmo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032753',6.5,1340,'en','The Man with Nine Lives','Dr. Leon Kravaal develops a potential cure for cancer, which involves freezing the patient. But an experiment goes awry when authorities believe Kravaal has killed a patient. Kravaal freezes the officials, along with himself. Years later, they are discovered and revived in hopes that Kravaal can indeed complete his cure. But human greed and weakness compound to disrupt the project.','/aRXAx97EKJDfeCSJbyfJY2UtOiK.jpg','1940-04-18',74,'Released','He kills in the name of science...Tombs of ice for the living...Chambers of horror for the dead!','The Man with Nine Lives',26924,1.9335,6.3,'ppSb01QNBRE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1516,_binary '\0','/g5SJh9Bjbf1zdslLn0koHBrq2ZF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032762',7.5,12143,'en','The Mark of Zorro','Returning from Spain, the son of a California nobleman comes home to find his native land under a villainous dictatorship. On one hand, he plays the useless fop, while on the other, he is the masked avenger Zorro.','/bJDonmAPnDV8jDv9jLlsejAdAoL.jpg','1940-11-08',94,'Released','Ride With Zorro. . . The Dashing Don Of California\'s Most Adventurous Era!','The Mark of Zorro',32093,3.5895,7.152,'zijP4G5X4ms','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1517,_binary '\0','/zqgzF9zkDlLqVARJGgoMSugb1at.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032811',7.7,7021,'en','The Mortal Storm','The Roth family leads a quiet life in a small village in the German Alps during the early 1930s. After the Nazis come to power, the family is divided and Martin Breitner, a family friend, is caught up in the turmoil.','/xPvS7UVrJuCyE5NsiDkW39ABLGX.jpg','1940-06-20',100,'Released','The Most Exciting Picture!','The Mortal Storm',989,2.4237,7.3,'ZGU_trhNuOs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1518,_binary '\0','/epPy2TZgvU2LJWnOp45ePsHVM9g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032818',6,5499,'en','The Mummy\'s Hand','A couple of young, out-of-work archaeologists in Egypt discover evidence of the burial place of the ancient Egyptian princess Ananka. After receiving funding from an eccentric magician and his beautiful daughter, they set out into the desert only to be terrorized by a sinister high priest and the living mummy Kharis who are the guardians of Ananka’s tomb.','/jSSdvLkGXy4oICnSo5Cnz12B6Ae.jpg','1940-09-20',67,'Released','The tomb of a thousand terrors!','The Mummy\'s Hand',31498,2.6455,5.7,'blRrTnq6TBg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1519,_binary '\0','/coz6RYno0XGjrLUVbSVcmBvQbQn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032819',6.9,1511,'en','Murder Over New York','When Charlie\'s old friend from Scotland Yard is murdered when they attend a police convention in New York, Chan picks up the case he was working on.','/sKXdCpgk5dxPRrqR61GTMpj9v1Q.jpg','1940-12-13',65,'Released','«Exciting thrilling!»','Murder Over New York',38459,1.8398,6.2,'i1r3cmXIFss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1520,_binary '\0','/iRmTN3GAdMhu2FBse3dlLPfXtIi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032828',6.8,3368,'en','My Little Chickadee','On her way by stagecoach to visit relatives out west, Flower Belle Lee is held up by a masked bandit who also takes the coach\'s shipment of gold. When he abducts Flower Belle and they arrive in town, Flower Belle is suspected of being in collusion with the bandit.','/bB0ewfiQCrtpdRTd5DQs3cLSigg.jpg','1940-02-09',83,'Released','It\'s the lafftime of a lifetime ! . . as \"Wild Bill\" Fields tries to tame the West!','My Little Chickadee',29353,1.6163,6.405,'x_Vp23EpguY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1521,_binary '\0','/nQXlAXXwZVhD4o3FQ94XyOwqX8w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032842',7.2,6346,'en','Night Train to Munich','Czechoslovakia, March 1939, on the eve of World War II. As the German invaders occupy Prague, inventor Axel Bomasch manages to flee and reach England; but those who need to put his knowledge at the service of the Nazi war machine, in order to carry out their evil plans of destruction, will stop at nothing to capture him.','/fi6Vh72FSrps1eqKG0zj5DIv190.jpg','1940-08-31',96,'Released','Laughs! Thrills! Excitement!','Night Train to Munich',41597,2.7174,7.247,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1522,_binary '\0','/1B9lkqsOFgsyr22M8oGGOA0YdNQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032846',6.2,1370,'en','No Time for Comedy','An aspiring playwright finds himself an overnight Broadway success.','/ovaAAdww9ht6DXqXIkQSAv3qDpM.jpg','1940-09-14',98,'Released','A country boy takes over Broadway . . . until he gets into heart-trouble!','No Time for Comedy',132928,1.9475,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1523,_binary '\0','/8kB3hOnvjfK0FS1epGinNUB0DTm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032850',6.3,2018,'en','North West Mounted Police','Texas Ranger Dusty Rivers (\"Isn\'t that a contradiction in terms?\", another character asks him) travels to Canada in the 1880s in search of Jacques Corbeau, who is wanted for murder. He wanders into the midst of the Riel Rebellion, in which Métis (people of French and Native heritage) and Natives want a separate nation. Dusty falls for nurse April Logan, who is also loved by Mountie Jim Brett. April\'s brother is involved with Courbeau\'s daughter Louvette, which leads to trouble during the battles between the rebels and the Mounties. Through it all Dusty is determined to bring Corbeau back to Texas (and April, too, if he can manage it.)','/qM5Ld0eL4sRHEt84nf8VV1QGGth.jpg','1940-10-22',126,'Released','DeMille\'s first film in Technicolor! 10 Great Stars! 2 Glorious Love Stories! 1,000 Unforgettable Thrills!','North West Mounted Police',83360,2.5922,6.394,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1524,_binary '\0','/3X7dEi4izSFpktnjO9GkrUcEVVd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032851',7,4353,'en','Northwest Passage','Based on the Kenneth Roberts novel of the same name, this film tells the story of two friends who join Rogers\' Rangers, as the legendary elite force engages the enemy during the French and Indian War. The film focuses on their famous raid at Fort St. Francis and their marches before and after the battle.','/d1J3K23jhEEt2uezEvYY0YtatWi.jpg','1940-02-23',126,'Released','Half Men—Half Demons … Warriors Such As The World Has Never Known … They Lived With Death and Danger For The Women Who Hungered For Their Love!','Northwest Passage',43805,2.136,6.6,'a1VZWty39-U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1525,_binary '\0','/pd4stdrS56lnHpDYZaPmNXZqudz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032871',5.7,1942,'en','One Million B.C.','One Million B.C. is a 1940 American fantasy film produced by Hal Roach Studios and released by United Artists. It is also known by the titles Cave Man, Man and His Mate, and Tumak. The film stars Victor Mature as protagonist Tumak, a young cave man who strives to unite the uncivilized Rock Tribe and the peaceful Shell Tribe, Carole Landis as Loana, daughter of the Shell Tribe chief and Tumak\'s love interest, and Lon Chaney, Jr. as Tumak\'s stern father and leader of the Rock Tribe.','/quyzMg8yF0zhTW3oLkfY5cV3hPI.jpg','1940-04-05',80,'Released','So amazing you won\'t believe your eyes!','One Million B.C.',3592,2.4578,5.8,'jV-pNl3_5JQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1526,_binary '\0','/7Q56IxEGXVwfxMQiY13qoIuSrcF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032873',6.3,2041,'en','One Night in the Tropics','Jim \"Lucky\" Moore, an insurance salesman, comes up with a novel policy for his friend, Steve: a \'love insurance policy\', that will pay out $1-million if Steve does not marry his fiancée, Cynthia. The upcoming marriage is jeopardized by Steve\'s ex-girlfriend, Mickey, and Cynthia\'s disapproving Aunt Kitty. The policy is underwritten by a nightclub owner, Roscoe, who sends two enforcers - Abbott and Costello - to ensure that the wedding occurs as planned.','/fpyQH6JTH7K9frevWmCPQ7U3U6v.jpg','1940-11-15',82,'Released','Jerome Kern Tops \"Show Boat\" and \"Roberta\"','One Night in the Tropics',29605,1.9347,5.8,'JfUsixJ5qtU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1527,_binary '\0','/p1W6jXASQxaQebUOvmh5ejySFiV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032881',6.5,3375,'en','Our Town','Change comes slowly to a small New Hampshire town in the early 20th century. We see birth, life and death in this small community.','/tXYWSUIUfiG06XzgSSkd4sQFOru.jpg','1940-05-24',90,'Released','Their love affair was the talk of our town!','Our Town',23283,1.5633,5.9,'Rnqch54OlrM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1528,_binary '\0','/xQcZeezcuaQ59yLJn6pBTRhOqFG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032904',7.8,79287,'en','The Philadelphia Story','When a rich woman\'s ex-husband and a tabloid-type reporter turn up just before her planned remarriage, she begins to learn the truth about herself.','/dKUubjvxO78XDts6VP1Ggcp4R9O.jpg','1940-12-05',113,'Released','Broadway\'s howling year-run comedy hit of the snooty society beauty who slipped and fell - IN LOVE!','The Philadelphia Story',981,4.9921,7.5,'4f2jCffBrck','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1529,_binary '\0','/ikpwuaK0yzNhXO24OeB7cKulhZE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032910',7.4,174562,'en','Pinocchio','When the gentle woodcarver Geppetto builds a marionette to be his substitute son, a benevolent fairy brings the toy to life. The puppet, named Pinocchio, is not yet a human boy. He must earn the right to be real by proving that he is brave, truthful, and unselfish.','/bnZJrLRnoQHpzEJdka1KYfsAF3N.jpg','1940-02-23',88,'Released','When you wish upon a star, your dreams come true.','Pinocchio',10895,14.0947,7.117,'GBgyVY_ClzQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1530,_binary '\0','/dLAgQQfiqDxPZZOoHYoA0RHXVNf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032943',7.3,10157,'en','Pride and Prejudice','In early 19th century England, Mr and Mrs Bennet\'s five unmarried daughters vie for the affections of rich and eligible Mr Bingley and his status-conscious friend, Mr Darcy, who have moved into their neighbourhood. While Bingley takes an immediate liking to eldest daughter Jane, Darcy has difficulty adapting to local society and repeatedly clashes with second-eldest Elizabeth.','/yoWwsLkuY5tMxUqkKMOHAJlImTs.jpg','1940-07-26',118,'Released','The Gayest Comedy Hit of the Screen! Five Gorgeous Beauties on a Mad-Cap Manhunt!','Pride and Prejudice',43818,4.0284,6.914,'sk4hAHHB7L8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1531,_binary '\0','/8gsnNAA3ViqtRQrGcfrndcsaVHY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032946',6.8,2061,'en','Primrose Path','Ellie Mae lives on Primrose Hill with her good-hearted and fancy free mother, her drunken father, her younger sister and a mean-spirited grandmother. The Hill is not a good part of town, however. When she meets and falls for a hard-working man, they marry and she hides her past from him. When he discovers the truth it jeopardizes their marriage.','/2yrimUM6qpPlRTByQLB5YQLdSGH.jpg','1940-03-22',93,'Released','The Play That Shocked New York And Rocked Broadway With Laughter!','Primrose Path',80054,1.3786,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1532,_binary '\0','/7ugewDsHrjllBK2dVUk56gHwi4g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032963',6.4,1396,'en','Raffles','Man about town and First Class cricketer A.J. Raffles keeps himself solvent with daring robberies. Meeting Gwen from his schooldays and falling in love all over again, he spends the weekend with her parents, Lord and Lady Melrose. A necklace presents an irresistible temptation, but also in attendance is Scotland Yard\'s finest, finally on the trail.','/suUhtPpuB2DVXuEUVOF9aiLcj5N.jpg','1939-11-11',72,'Released','Meet \'Raffles\'! He\'s a lion with the ladies-and the cops all want him too!','Raffles',200654,1.6966,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1533,_binary '\0','/46p36NyMO6f25YtSqSYiwz4mKbW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032976',8,162204,'en','Rebecca','Story of a young woman who marries a fascinating widower only to find out that she must live in the shadow of his former wife, Rebecca, who died mysteriously several years earlier. The young wife must come to grips with the terrible secret of her handsome, cold husband, Max De Winter. She must also deal with the jealous, obsessed Mrs. Danvers, the housekeeper, who will not accept her as the mistress of the house.','/1qz3qUOHnVy7dL7M7G8jSErxE4b.jpg','1940-03-23',130,'Released','\"Last night I dreamt I went to Manderley again...\"','Rebecca',223,6.0547,7.9,'cJok8CPtHRw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1534,_binary '\0','/myCAFAWAugRGorbrqOIUvUtmZzx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032981',7.5,8413,'en','Remember the Night','Unexpected love blossoms when an assistant district attorney agrees to take a recidivist shoplifter home so she doesn\'t have to spend Christmas alone in jail.','/kPeGe9VApDwwWgUSRiUCch7Huj7.jpg','1940-01-19',94,'Released','Barbara and Fred in 1940\'s first great love affair…!','Remember the Night',29617,2.6156,7.321,'LKcLcT9dOFk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1535,_binary '\0','/v7pv5KuWWgqNCTkjzZmZ7O1KAxk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032983',6.6,4169,'en','The Return of Frank James','Farmer Frank and his ward hunt brother Jesse\'s killers, the back-shooting Fords.','/4e2X31I53QCIIxxLD62pjevLrSI.jpg','1940-08-10',92,'Released','Encore triumph from 20th Century-Fox.','The Return of Frank James',43821,2.6823,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1536,_binary '\0','/1cxZKHxgNUcKmEdR5H5lhHrjIU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0032993',6.6,4307,'en','Road to Singapore','Two playboys try to forget previous romances in Singapore – until they meet a beautiful dancer.','/bBpFZgZI0oi3oMi9UqJAdhCIFlf.jpg','1940-03-22',85,'Released','Ready For Fun . . Fight . . or a South Seas Romance . . . ! They find them all on the . . .','Road to Singapore',13861,2.0354,6.418,'C31scz62yD0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1537,_binary '\0','/ejLNia8P6YrKbIpvEsihs0Ei8wL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033021',6.2,4667,'en','Santa Fe Trail','As a penalty for fighting fellow classmates days before graduating from West Point, J.E.B. Stuart, George Armstrong Custer and four friends are assigned to the 2nd Cavalry, stationed at Fort Leavenworth. While there they aid in the capture and execution of the abolitionist, John Brown following the Battle of Harper\'s Ferry.','/uBtJzonmF9uOFrDXlqQuxTfMwl7.jpg','1940-12-20',110,'Released','Where the railroad and civilization ended, the Sante Fe Trail began!','Santa Fe Trail',1718,3.2249,5.8,'RDfF3xzFGkA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1538,_binary '\0','/ifwyDqgsHNi5MbnBuZKqSVaa0Db.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033022',7.1,3435,'en','Saps at Sea','Stan and Ollie work in a horn factory. Ollie starts having violent fits every time he hears a horn. His doctor prescribes a restful sea voyage. Mayhem ensues.','/6CScczIA4WRnTOxYgMgsdNRvXSL.jpg','1940-04-29',57,'Released','They\'ll Scuttle Your Blues To the Bottom of the Sea!','Saps at Sea',46260,2.5997,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1539,_binary '\0','/ishvkb7T721yRDFEwkP5znQgbT5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033028',7.6,11676,'en','The Sea Hawk','Dashing pirate Geoffrey Thorpe plunders Spanish ships for Queen Elizabeth I and falls in love with Dona Maria, a beautiful Spanish royal he captures.','/mBJhR84lKoScUPSUfC9mO4yEhjf.jpg','1940-08-10',127,'Released','Dashing... romantic... Errol Flynn at his thrilling best!','The Sea Hawk',26201,3.9696,7.168,'2RYcYg9YFqg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1540,_binary '\0','/7e4dyoI6cOqQfXEPIkrXAU8DCsq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033029',5.7,1906,'en','Second Chorus','Danny O\'Neill and Hank Taylor are rival trumpeters with the Perennials, a college band, and both men are still attending college by failing their exams seven years in a row. In the midst of a performance, Danny spies Ellen Miller who ends up being made band manager. Both men compete for her affections while trying to get the other one fired.','/qo20sq732j5dIbgmNYveJITwvna.jpg','1941-01-03',84,'Released','They\'re the tip-tops in toe-taps!','Second Chorus',23627,1.9773,5.817,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1541,_binary '\0','/tooWr0A5aCUFYHRF8iXNMgqDiC2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033038',6.5,2024,'en','Seven Sinners','Banished from various U.S. protectorates in the Pacific, a saloon entertainer uses her femme-fatale charms to woo politicians, navy personnel, gangsters, riff-raff, judges and a ship\'s doctor in order to achieve her aims.','/cCoRN1oSBRZwhNSvZmL5BcVr2HP.jpg','1940-10-25',87,'Released','She\'s Dynamite... Tearing Through A Lawless Pacific Paradise!','Seven Sinners',40979,2.4592,6,'21X1jZ3DU60','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1542,_binary '\0','/wqgZSvgoctaadgwUdPYVsksivxn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033045',8,44724,'en','The Shop Around the Corner','Two employees at a gift shop can barely stand one another, without realising that they are falling in love through the post as each other\'s anonymous pen pal.','/dZ1aEzGYRiqJwPfjS6VL7wUkHmF.jpg','1940-01-12',99,'Released','EVERY GIRL OR FELLOW WHO EVER KEPT A “BLIND DATE”','The Shop Around the Corner',20334,4.5562,8.1,'1pJLZ6mhKp4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1543,_binary '\0','/xdin9zkEh2g73kZIZGjlT6k2HOZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033105',6.9,3341,'en','Strange Cargo','Convicts escaping from Devil\'s Island come under the influence of a strange Christ-like figure.','/gquGUJwVw2emUu8I4RprKcRpWTO.jpg','1940-03-01',113,'Released','M-G-M\'s Mighty Thrill-Romance for 1940 !','Strange Cargo',50271,1.7811,7,'8LKhosy0IKw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1544,_binary '\0','/jw9FNjcoI0SF1HLh7KTAA86oSA8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033107',6.8,5219,'en','Stranger on the Third Floor','Newspaper reporter Michael Ward plunges into a nightmare of guilt, fearing that his \"evidence\" has sentenced the wrong man to death.','/ovJx3qRt83keSwZ8Cax1wyRc3Lb.jpg','1940-08-16',64,'Released',NULL,'Stranger on the Third Floor',29481,2.3836,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1545,_binary '\0','/9cQHyV7c8JzE1pfxpXE6WhSi8Z1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033110',6.8,2154,'en','Strike Up the Band','Jimmy and Mary get a group of kids together to play in a school orchestra. A huge contest between schools is coming up and they have a hard time raising money to go to Chicago for the contest.','/vJM42XqJSj4K53btMXg26vXuSDD.jpg','1940-09-27',120,'Released','The merriest pair on the screen!','Strike Up the Band',43819,2.4485,6.6,'-y7BNr90DE4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1546,_binary '\0','/cTG7EnKvDdmTaZUGEkRvxgdCOXA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033117',5.9,1570,'en','Susan and God','A flighty socialite neglects her family to promote a new religious group.','/8CPkM6xKdEpL2niWIVDny0BSjdX.jpg','1940-06-07',117,'Released','Saint... Or Screwball?','Susan and God',43820,1.4162,6.5,'_li-f85QZrg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1547,_binary '\0','/4rd9SUlamdxZlLkCBl6A1z24L4e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033149',7.2,10163,'en','They Drive by Night','Joe and Paul Fabrini are Wildcat, or independent, truck drivers who have their own small one-truck business. The Fabrini boys constantly battle distributors, rivals and loan collectors, while trying to make a success of their transport company.','/uF0X3IMhPIFgbwzlbayUsj4I6Tc.jpg','1940-07-26',95,'Released','No picture in 1940 will have bigger thrills!','They Drive by Night',16933,3.2431,6.9,'Qqaql-FSvHQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1548,_binary '\0','/oaSBgbi0czdGjtXllTTIMj1H3th.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033152',7.4,16098,'en','The Thief of Bagdad','When Prince Ahmad is blinded and cast out of Bagdad by the nefarious Jaffar, he joins forces with the scrappy thief Abu to win back his royal place, as well as the heart of a beautiful princess.','/8Fs29JYTOkDluTXgbvLRIaps6PO.jpg','1940-02-19',107,'Released','ONE THOUSAND AND ONE SIGHTS FROM THE THOUSAND OF ONE NIGHTS....','The Thief of Bagdad',12232,5.3161,7.1,'7F_FNm5GABw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1549,_binary '\0','/povPlpYKpZRL5CQMp2UsogYoLF3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033153',6.9,1284,'en','Third Finger, Left Hand','Magazine editor Margot Merrick pretends to be married in order to avoid advances from male colleagues. Unfortunately, things don\'t go to plan when Jeff Thompson, a potential suitor, uncovers the deception and decides to show up at Margot\'s family home posing as her husband!','/nj2sNIvSVEKvrcAlA61sYlNPHfe.jpg','1940-10-11',96,'Released','Such Fun! Such Romance! IT\'S WONDERFUL!','Third Finger, Left Hand',67368,1.7567,7,'xKJOCjkhong','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1550,_binary '\0','/uSVq3u8iJlom7PFqQXoXIxN6ykH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033174',6.5,1956,'en','Too Many Husbands','Long-missing Bill Cardew returns to find his wife Vicky remarried...and in no hurry to settle for just one husband.','/Agxl6QenRcPjoIeaiQENcIO3LLl.jpg','1940-04-03',81,'Released','JUST MARRIED.......BUT TO WHOM?','Too Many Husbands',120109,1.6983,6.48,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1551,_binary '\0','/69UiajifP0HWHjWAEGrkv9vNQc6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033175',6.7,1609,'en','Torrid Zone','A Central American plantation manager and his boss battle over a traveling showgirl.','/iaKXN4b4IwggOBtk2Axx4MIy6v8.jpg','1940-05-18',88,'Released','TROPICAL ROMANCE!','Torrid Zone',94182,1.6315,7,'PukLH2kV8Vw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1552,_binary '\0','/q546MECQ0taslhPY8TrakN9rGoB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033226',6.8,3331,'en','Virginia City','Union officer Kerry Bradford escapes from a Confederate prison and races to intercept $5 million in gold destined for Confederate coffers. A Confederate sympathizer and a Mexican bandit, each with their own stake in the loot, stand in his way.','/lruEZr9WmKWk8RSR6EwiLXgDtlt.jpg','1940-03-23',121,'Released','Go West!...to Virginia City...for excitement, for adventure, for primitive romance!!!','Virginia City',17836,1.9344,6.3,'oqWMDmFx4lo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1553,_binary '\0','/neYZdMJ6Od6o4nHNrrwucsiIJ9L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033238',7.7,12018,'en','Waterloo Bridge','On the eve of World War II, a British officer revisits Waterloo Bridge and recalls the young man he was at the beginning of World War I and the young ballerina he met just before he left for the front.','/2XgYKd5tr5b9W5Yfq80yTZqf3hy.jpg','1940-05-17',108,'Released','\"Every parting from you is like a little eternity\"','Waterloo Bridge',43824,4.6104,7.5,'Lsk6mAYVeWc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1554,_binary '\0','/cp1QQPnRsPxzUbdAWURD1U0b0mv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033253',7.2,7659,'en','The Westerner','Drifter Cole Harden is accused of stealing a horse and faces hanging by self-appointed Judge Roy Bean, but Harden manages to talk his way out of it by claiming to be a friend of stage star Lillie Langtry, with whom the judge is obsessed, even though he has never met her. Tensions rise when Harden comes to the defense of a group of struggling homesteaders who Judge Bean is trying to drive away.','/5DpDg1GYiqAKoCozbunCqPYvRPD.jpg','1940-09-18',100,'Released','THE RAW UNTAMED ADVENTUROUS WEST...LIVES AGAIN!','The Westerner',14710,2.6185,7.072,'NISDm92yv3A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1555,_binary '\0','/rb4qc5hxc102bZKR6w0onKlYaqP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033283',6.1,1704,'en','You\'ll Find Out','The manager of Kay Kyser’s band books them for a birthday party bash for an heiress at a spooky mansion, where sinister forces try to kill her.','/mo1iZWEMtGR1iH4Yo6yNOnpM1b7.jpg','1940-11-22',97,'Released','A Cold-Shiver MYSTERY With Hot-Rhythm MUSIC!','You\'ll Find Out',80720,2.0301,5.643,'5GE5Y4misvw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1556,_binary '\0','/mTbdsq8Z2ETmBI9rvskK19gCQpf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033289',6.8,1386,'en','Young Tom Edison','Inventor Thomas Edison\'s boyhood is chronicled and shows him as a lad whose early inventions and scientific experiments usually end up causing disastrous results. As a result, the towns folk all think Tom is crazy, and creating a strained relationship between Tom and his father. Tom\'s only solace is his understanding mother who believes he\'s headed to do great things.','/b5SpgdQkz5QpoiGVUHSc5eoa7hG.jpg','1940-03-15',86,'Released','This is a story of triumph.. the triumph of an American boy, who had courage, imagination and faith.','Young Tom Edison',56154,2.0824,5.9,'1IejbPVPE2Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1557,_binary '\0','/vEHeHYGLwFLnBGNqUW3mP83B5LD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033314',6.7,1601,'en','Adam Had Four Sons','Emilie has been hired to care for the four sons of wealthy Adam Stoddard and his wife, Molly. After Molly dies, Adam and the boys grow to depend on Emilie even more. At the same time, Emilie falls in love with Adam. The boys grow up, but Adam insists that Emilie stay on as part of the family. Her relationships with both the boys and Adam become strained after one son marries a gold-digging viper named Hester. Written by Daniel Bubbeo','/dBKJh9iI5JggO8tUqJ6TV3qcndo.jpg','1941-03-27',81,'Released','It takes all kinds of women to love all kinds of men!','Adam Had Four Sons',106406,2.3663,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1558,_binary '\0','/nLQFKvG22mtcH4xKAtv3kdXVNJX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033317',7.1,1729,'en','Adventures of Captain Marvel','On a scientific expedition to Siam young Billy Batson is given the ability to change himself into the super-powered Captain Marvel by the wizard Shazam, who tells him his powers will last only as long as the Golden Scorpion idol is threatened. Finding the idol, the scientists realize it could be the most powerful weapon in the world and remove the lenses that energize it, distributing them among themselves so that no one would be able to use the idol by himself. Back in the US, Billy Batson, as Captain Marvel, wages a battle against an evil, hooded figure, the Scorpion, who hopes to accumulate all five lenses, thereby gaining control of the super-powerful weapon','/79YcAqIQ3q29s7l1IuWBCyFvQ31.jpg','1941-03-28',216,'Released','THE MOST POWERFUL MAN IN CARTOONLAND BECOMES THE STRONGEST MAN ON THE SCREEN! All others pale in the light of this human fortress who finds no barrier too great in his amazing fight for justice','Adventures of Captain Marvel',61020,2.2735,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1559,_binary '\0','/eVzQFWYICGBql9cfss1WKn0CxZK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033373',7.7,16220,'en','Ball of Fire','A group of academics have spent years shut up in a house working on the definitive encyclopedia. When one of them discovers that his entry on slang is hopelessly outdated, he ventures into the wide world to learn about the evolving language. Here he meets Sugarpuss O’Shea, a nightclub singer, who’s on top of all the slang—and, it just so happens, needs a place to stay.','/t9L16dMTuNq4saLpQswZjkNvaMt.jpg','1941-12-02',111,'Released','“I LOVE HIM because he doesn\'t know how to kiss—THE JERK!”','Ball of Fire',29884,3.2475,7.4,'74cN0TJdjPM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1560,_binary '\0','/fpZfoBpmL6zgGpAu16cGTNQTkuK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033388',6.5,5830,'en','The Big Store','A detective is hired to protect the life of a singer, who has recently inherited a department store, from the store\'s crooked manager.','/7ChMr4aLGShMkuYcEFr7FLzjm5F.jpg','1941-06-20',83,'Released','Gorgeous Girls! Uproarious Fun! The Big Musical Show!','The Big Store',26182,2.883,6.3,'Da2eU7tG2KA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1561,_binary '\0','/uq8qKpSSfrOTCwUwYI7OlV1YwxW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033397',6.1,2446,'en','The Black Cat','Greedy heirs wait in a mansion for a rich cat lover to die, only to learn her cats come first.','/2H7bQl1VS0x9xuwBxIICVy595H.jpg','1941-05-02',70,'Released','Even Ladd is scared!','The Black Cat',29286,1.9909,6.4,'EfnkDAG1GZk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1562,_binary '\0','/h9qgkNFLDeMqXDwDbBkIvaZ76G0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033405',6.7,3473,'en','Blood and Sand','Bullfighter Juan Gallardo falls for socialite Dona Sol, turning from the faithful Carmen who nevertheless stands by her man as he continues to face real danger in the bullring.','/1cp4d9Mwz1IxZWcfKq0D53oVD0x.jpg','1941-05-30',125,'Released','Love flamed in the shadow of death!','Blood and Sand',44399,2.7676,6.5,'XbUV9gp5d2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1563,_binary '\0','/d0jHDB6c2yu2c2yJBJkzkkADoUz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033407',6.9,2548,'en','Blossoms in the Dust','Edna marries Texan Sam Gladney, operator of a wheat mill. They have a son, who is killed when very young. Edna discovers by chance how the law treats children who are without parents and decides to do something about it. She opens a home for foundlings and orphans and begins to place children in good homes, despite the opposition of \"conservative\" citizens, who would condemn illegitimate children for being born out of wedlock. Eventually Edna leads a fight in the Texas legislature to remove the stigma of illegitimacy from birth records in that state, while continuing to be an advocate for homeless children.','/qKfQuCvpHpmyywk0hgqtbHyHfN2.jpg','1941-08-15',99,'Released','The stirring saga of a childless beauty...who was determined to be a mother!','Blossoms in the Dust',84087,2.2479,6.6,'I99Rcidts-w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1564,_binary '\0','/iCi2TuEBAVEVEpsS6KGy4ZNLxuK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033409',6.7,1726,'en','Blues in the Night','A struggling band find themselves attached to a fugitive and drawn into a series of old feuds and love affairs, as they try to stay together and find musical success.','/A6anBd0LJIZ4fnsh70THxUtuCD.jpg','1941-11-15',88,'Released','2 GRAND BANDS! JIMMY LUNCEFORD\'S and WILL OSBORNE\'S! MUSIC GALORE!','Blues in the Night',25862,1.7167,6.2,'IbKOy2hJnZI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1565,_binary '\0','/tS4EOb0bUPSjW8NQc2nKPvEGuuM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033432',6.9,4138,'en','The Bride Came C.O.D.','A financially-strapped charter pilot hires himself to an oil tycoon to kidnap his madcap daughter and prevent her from marrying a vapid band leader.','/leMw2kY4B5YWyB7D38khfn1UpD4.jpg','1941-07-12',92,'Released','She Came Collect and his heart paid the freight . . . in the year\'s romantic explosion !','The Bride Came C.O.D.',29886,2.5524,7,'zvD-WvX3npo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1566,_binary '\0','/uJVryqvFC6pOnw7OLXvdfBAZHQ3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033436',7,5070,'en','Buck Privates','Petty con artists Slicker Smith and Herbie Brown mistakenly join the Army evading the cops. The cop chasing them winds up as their drill instructor. A rich young man and his former working class chauffeur are not only in the same unit, they\'re vying for a pretty girl who seems attracted to both.','/s5LTBVEVGVKEIMg5FKp1im733P5.jpg','1941-01-31',84,'Released','Swing it!','Buck Privates',29601,2.6317,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1567,_binary '\0','/oSp3zguxIhjP2K4652EOMyCR7ig.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033458',6.9,1623,'en','Charlie Chan in Rio','In Rio de Janiero to arrest a nightclub singer on suspicion of a murder in Hawaii, Charlie Chan becomes involved with the Rio police in solving the singer\'s own murder.','/yjgB0pzbh4iW8dFkD8GJRtF2j3L.jpg','1941-09-05',60,'Released','it\'s Chan\'s most Spine-tingling mystery!','Charlie Chan in Rio',38461,1.6562,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1568,_binary '\0','/ruF3Lmd4A8MHbnEBE6lxPMbsHGL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033467',8.2,496707,'en','Citizen Kane','Newspaper magnate Charles Foster Kane is taken from his mother as a boy and made the ward of a rich industrialist. As a result, every well-meaning, tyrannical or self-destructive move he makes for the rest of his life appears in some way to be a reaction to that deeply wounding event.','/sav0jxhqiH0bPr2vZFU0Kjt2nZL.jpg','1941-04-17',119,'Released','Some called him a hero...others called him a heel.','Citizen Kane',15,11.5568,7.967,'2HY35DNYt8g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1569,_binary '\0','/qYO6U5bgcsFlGZUnjvZ7qaXj7UB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033477',7,2919,'en','Come Live with Me','Seeking US citizenship, a Viennese refugee arranges a marriage of convenience with a struggling writer.','/w4vhGnadQnZxqcpgkvhXOJSpsLM.jpg','1941-01-31',86,'Released','How To Woo An Unkissed Bride!','Come Live with Me',33031,2.0192,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1570,_binary '\0','/xNJoQhq2YrLpuCJx5gYcJUbh2X6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033491',6.7,1605,'en','Cottage to Let','Allied spies and Nazi Agents insinuate themselves at a Scottish cottage (converted to a wartime hospital) with interests on an inventor\'s nearly perfected bomb sight.','/1gxa9sxQAoTv5yOoHENZRa3mJpw.jpg','1941-09-06',90,'Released',NULL,'Cottage to Let',71984,1.2887,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1571,_binary '\0','/ghcWFwEDdR4vcJpDGNnu9G5HAIv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033519',6.9,1487,'en','Dead Men Tell','When the elderly woman sponsoring a treasure hunt is murdered on board her docked ship, Charlie Chan must deal with a treasure map in four pieces, the ghost of a hanged pirate, a talking parrot, a recalcitrant sea captain and several suspicious passengers - and a second murder.','/m44nRXkb7bFkGpUF2TbANj5xBsy.jpg','1941-03-28',61,'Released','Aboard a treasure ship Chan battles his most elusive adversary... the ghost of a pirate 100 years dead!','Dead Men Tell',38460,1.3823,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1572,_binary '\0','/h5iG5pXsVJrxGjM7SX2jD6bjshr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033530',6.1,1755,'en','The Devil Commands','A story about a scientist who is obsessed with communicating with the dead.','/utpkg2xmSj0Q9NdKf2NSW96tZDb.jpg','1941-08-15',65,'Released','When the Devil commands Karloff obeys...!','The Devil Commands',30307,1.3487,6.3,'ppSb01QNBRE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1573,_binary '\0','/zydSOaJk2qf9maONGsktK5Pyjw1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033532',7.5,6630,'en','All That Money Can Buy','Farmer Jabez Stone, about to lose his land, agrees to sell his soul to the devil, known as Mr. Scratch, who gives Jabez seven years to enjoy the fruits of his sale before he collects. Over that time, Jabez pays off his debts and helps many neighboring farmers, then becomes an advocate for the upstanding Sen. Daniel Webster. When Jabez\'s contract with Mr. Scratch concludes, he desperately turns to Webster to represent him in a trial for his soul.','/2GUZ0Yg3DKlZpc3HEF5qJz7KqD5.jpg','1941-10-17',107,'Released','A GREAT MOTION PICTURE DARES TO BE DIFFERENT!','All That Money Can Buy',29451,2.5847,7,'G3mGHWa0CVQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1574,_binary '\0','/dOH2qUexfaqtdaIY96mX8PnHvvd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033533',7.6,5369,'en','The Devil and Miss Jones','The wealthiest man in the world, John P. Merrick, is a private person who likes to stay anonymous. One of his many assets is Neeley\'s Department Store. There is labor unrest at the store, and the employees\' anger is directed at him, who they hang in effigy outside the store despite not knowing what he looks like. Merrick, not happy at what he sees going on, decides to mete out the rabble-rousers. So he goes undercover as a sales clerk in the shoe department.','/spGm2v3Jpg5l5xZS9xjKYNrLYF1.jpg','1941-04-11',92,'Released','For folks who haven\'t laughed since 1929!','The Devil and Miss Jones',43801,2.3206,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1575,_binary '\0','/5EjoUHdoePpgZlkXgdsnhBJSP1O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033537',6.5,2256,'en','Dive Bomber','A military surgeon teams with a ranking navy flyer to develop a high-altitude suit which will protect pilots from blacking out when they go into a steep dive.','/2my6RE1UuD7M3I0gwrToUUosyUQ.jpg','1941-08-30',132,'Released','WINGS TO THE WIND...EYES TO THE SKIES!','Dive Bomber',65587,2.0758,6.3,'R0UuzBbXxwM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1576,_binary '\0','/AlYEWpTN09IKc2nxj1eHu4zpfsZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033553',6.8,10888,'en','Dr. Jekyll and Mr. Hyde','Dr. Jekyll believes good and evil exist in everyone and creates a potion that allows his evil side, Mr. Hyde, to come to the fore. He faces horrible consequences when he lets his dark side run amok.','/2GDdW84XSX3BYMJ9tmnFkZOGJyB.jpg','1941-08-12',113,'Released','It CHILLS you! Half-MAN! Half-MONSTER!','Dr. Jekyll and Mr. Hyde',3022,3.5502,6.5,'bjsQOohEJFA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1577,_binary '\0','/sdSTV9DuZc1gTYfrbRKxXIHZ8wd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033558',6.5,1355,'en','Dressed to Kill','A detective\'s wedding is postponed when gunshots are heard nearby.','/hvI632ALoH7ukWLNzy9fEyJAva8.jpg','1941-08-08',74,'Released','A Double Murder for a Wedding Present!','Dressed to Kill',42298,1.3591,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1578,_binary '\0','/eEKpOowAkVAF3sKJKqY2h4h12GV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033563',7.2,151805,'en','Dumbo','Dumbo is a baby elephant born with over-sized ears and a supreme lack of confidence. But thanks to his even more diminutive buddy Timothy the Mouse, the pint-sized pachyderm learns to surmount all obstacles.','/hKDdllslMtsU9JixAv5HR9biXlp.jpg','1941-10-31',64,'Released','The One...The Only...The FABULOUS...','Dumbo',11360,10.876,7,'8QgTNmlBxTE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1579,_binary '\0','/xhpgyQTOzERzI6xZcRMmqFrEqGm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033582',7.1,2456,'en','The Face Behind the Mask','A kindly, enthusiastic, newly-arrived American immigrant from Hungary is forced to turn to a life of crime after his face is badly disfigured in a hotel fire.','/x9r2dwKDYIGiEhN2iUEQ8wDUFx5.jpg','1941-01-16',69,'Released','What fiendish fury turns man into monster?','The Face Behind the Mask',34943,2.4879,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1580,_binary '\0','/mbbStgbnFrVsT2BUSFV9ipPS9i4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033606',6.5,1501,'en','The Flame of New Orleans','In old New Orleans, a beautiful adventuress juggles the attentions of a rich banker and a dashing sea captain.','/rWpX53eaQo1IMj51jZkqu9984wN.jpg','1941-07-07',79,'Released','THE FLAME IN HER EYES scorched a thousand hearts!','The Flame of New Orleans',61109,2.0293,6.596,'Nxu-SGvYR0o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1581,_binary '\0','/mqheJSpmVhzPcmfiBSoGsaE9ky8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033616',6.7,1716,'en','Footsteps in the Dark','A high-society gent has a secret life - he writes murder mysteries and hangs out with the police attempting to solve crimes. This causes him no end of problems when his wife wants to know about his little disappearances and exceptionally late nights out.','/6T0x5ygxrOMmM1Baxqn3RfiG2N5.jpg','1941-03-08',96,'Released',NULL,'Footsteps in the Dark',62507,1.8051,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1582,_binary '\0','/nvuaUT8kDUyjsRUcNemwuJjTVWD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033627',7.3,8611,'en','49th Parallel','In the early days of World War II, a German U-boat is sunk in Canada\'s Hudson Bay. Hoping to evade capture, a small band of German soldiers led by commanding officer Lieutenant Hirth attempts to cross the border into the United States, which has not yet entered the war and is officially neutral. Along the way, the German soldiers encounter brave men such as a French-Canadian fur trapper, Johnnie, a leader of a Hutterite farming community, Peter, an author, Philip and a soldier, Andy Brock.','/m4YTQv9fHYB2nZ7M2Al6wzOmrYe.jpg','1941-11-24',123,'Released','THE MIGHTEST MANHUNT THAT EVER SWEPT THE SCREEN!','49th Parallel',21735,3.515,7,'U-7gczSfDNc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1583,_binary '\0','/qw0nKwLWBRPJWO41hQ0i9zlzHV0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033650',6.5,1445,'en','The Gay Falcon','Having forsaken the detective business for the safer confines of personal insurance, Gay Laurence is compelled to return to his sleuthing ways. Along with sidekick Jonathan \"Goldie\" Locke, he agrees to look into a series of home party robberies that have victimized socialite Maxine Wood. The duo gets more than they bargained for when a murder is committed at Wood\'s home, but Lawrence still finds time to romance the damsel.','/m0jx2OaNHYLxPl25GULpDRDc5Ls.jpg','1941-10-24',67,'Released','CRIMINALS BEWARE! Here comes fiction\'s man of mystery!','The Gay Falcon',44175,1.7419,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1584,_binary '\0','/v3sXtq2P6o086UV1LJ82agPASVa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033654',7.2,2981,'ja','元禄 忠臣蔵','In the early 18th-century, Lord Takumi-no-kami Asano, feuding with Lord Kira, tries to kill his opponent in the corridors of the Shogun\'s palace. The Shogun sentences Asano to seppuku and deprives the palace and lands from his clan, but does not punish Kira. Asano\'s vassals leave the land and his samurais become ronin and want to seek revenge against the Lord\'s dishonour. But their leader Kuranosuke Oishi seeks to restore the Asano clan with his brother Daigaku Asano. One year later, the Shogun refuses, and Oishi and 46 rōnin are out for revenge.','/9xCbHN8pITzOcJewSIPNxvxLT7k.jpg','1941-12-08',223,'Released',NULL,'The 47 Ronin',45978,2.3479,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1585,_binary '\0','/iaK6PUMZWi5Wj3RvfHSTEQXnhes.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033660',6.1,1908,'en','The Ghost Train','Mismatched travellers are stranded overnight at a lonely rural railway station. They soon learn of local superstition about a phantom train which is said to travel these parts at dead of night, carrying ghosts from a long-ago train wreck in the area.','/aHpUL7rUjAGHcKJmzoQcnsphanU.jpg','1941-05-05',85,'Released',NULL,'The Ghost Train',29609,1.4472,6.132,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1586,_binary '\0','/4vzN07ka8GHrNVHBOaN7Xg7rYOD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033676',6.1,1794,'en','Great Guns','Laurel and Hardy join the army. They are hardly soldiers, but they believe their employer, (Dick Nelson) will need them now he\'s drafted.','/uX5EJy0RataAGM33pKxdvxnxfV9.jpg','1941-10-10',74,'Released','THEY\'RE BACK AGAIN...in the most hilarious comedy of their career!','Great Guns',38890,1.4685,6,'_b4oJIOYjS0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1587,_binary '\0','/l8kGXKlUIKJ63XJm4xkn1ABYzW3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033677',7.1,4753,'en','The Great Lie','After a newlywed\'s husband apparently dies in a plane crash, she discovers that her rival for his affections is pregnant with his child.','/sibxFGB8qmriHBi2z38d3qfEsgV.jpg','1941-04-05',108,'Released','Sometimes there\'s a terrible penalty for telling the truth.','The Great Lie',43705,1.9379,6.991,'jdGqtaJz_GI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1588,_binary '\0','/myfBL29ceOsrGHXZVYELgZNOkry.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033686',6.9,1591,'en','H.M. Pulham, Esq.','A middle-aged businessman who has lived a conservative life according to the routine conventions of society, still remembers the beautiful young woman who once brought him out of his shell.','/usj8p3y51ePMcMoHlNkzqe4A9me.jpg','1941-12-04',120,'Released','THERE\'S A GIRL LIKE MARVIN MYLES HIDDEN IN EVERY MAN\'S LIFE','H.M. Pulham, Esq.',96107,1.8822,7.1,'dx_TB3V-xpc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1589,_binary '\0','/jEHDsO0Wo1WThOrYM58kPAopbtM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033704',7.4,3982,'en','Hellzapoppin\'','Olsen and Johnson, a pair of stage comedians, try to turn their play into a movie and bring together a young couple in love, while breaking the fourth wall every step of the way.','/O5Ta3URiRglqt1fPi2APCvnb8x.jpg','1941-12-25',84,'Released','AT LAST IT\'S ON THE SCREEN! Greater than the Stage Show!','Hellzapoppin\'',19136,2.1316,7.248,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1590,_binary '\0','/sl0tLI7ThQI6PEho6nNvO2wBgcn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033712',7.5,8152,'en','Here Comes Mr. Jordan','Boxer Joe Pendleton, flying to his next fight, crashes...because a Heavenly Messenger, new on the job, snatched Joe\'s spirit prematurely from his body. Before the matter can be rectified, Joe\'s body is cremated; so the celestial Mr. Jordan grants him the use of the body of wealthy Bruce Farnsworth, who\'s just been murdered by his wife. Joe tries to remake Farnsworth\'s unworthy life in his own clean-cut image, but then falls in love; and what about that murderous wife?','/k6gmIV3hTSCG2JBh2zPMLogZ5y3.jpg','1941-08-07',94,'Released','A picture different from anything ever screened before!','Here Comes Mr. Jordan',38914,2.7422,7,'Bb5PkS4CULg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1591,_binary '\0','/6AcvQvapwSI0fw2j9fVUxMOkwNB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033717',7.5,21269,'en','High Sierra','Given a pardon from jail, Roy Earle gets back into the swing of things as he robs a swanky resort.','/fkP6yy25Wja6Sn3AIlZ4F1BWsy0.jpg','1941-01-23',100,'Released','HE KILLED... and there on the crest of Sierra\'s highest crag... HE MUST BE KILLED!','High Sierra',27725,3.5833,7.1,'X-oPLZYOCcM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1592,_binary '\0','/uudTreOlFCOefYNGXFlLcaAI3lj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033722',7.3,3173,'en','Hold Back the Dawn','Romanian-French gigolo Georges Iscovescu wishes to enter the USA. Stopped in Mexico by the quota system, he decides to marry an American, then desert her and join his old partner Anita, who\'s done likewise. But after sweeping teacher Emmy Brown off her feet, he finds her so sweet that love and jealousy endanger his plans.','/wYfLVAvGZcikP3KI3gTNsrLX3W2.jpg','1941-09-26',116,'Released','Three great stars in the story of love...coldly conceived from a man\'s need, and a woman\'s desire!','Hold Back the Dawn',51395,2.2121,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1593,_binary '\0','/hDmGQ9IMWcoADeLpr2qzuH2u5BB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033723',7.2,4678,'en','Hold That Ghost','Two bumbling service station attendants are left as the sole beneficiaries in a gangster\'s will. Their trip to claim their fortune is sidetracked when they are stranded in a haunted house along with several other strangers.','/9CPix9FAWSiUHoxcDOa8eWZYqJ8.jpg','1941-08-07',86,'Released','Here\'s That ALL-AMERICAN LAUGH TEAM!','Hold That Ghost',14604,2.329,6.8,'F82xYOsBd6k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1594,_binary '\0','/fLOIGRuN5XDx0ezIt8ppqam99ME.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033726',6.5,1491,'en','Honky Tonk','Fast-talking con-man and grifter Candy Johnson rises to be the corrupt boss of Yellow Creek, but his wife\'s alcoholic father tries to set things right.','/tspJB5bT5pTKfn2HbRHjPxH2A8t.jpg','1941-10-01',105,'Released','Every Kiss a Thrill! Better than \"Boom Town\"!','Honky Tonk',95131,1.9054,6.3,'lVb0Cw2oKCU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1595,_binary '\0','/cy4YesawATDaHrmPq69YBRStIkj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033727',6.9,1606,'en','Mr. Bug Goes to Town','The happy tranquility of Bugville is shattered when the populace learns that a colossal skyscraper is to be built over their tiny town.','/bn31RqXDmU12Gh0EwJrRkgs1GfI.jpg','1941-12-09',78,'Released','Boy, Oh Boy! Here\'s Music, Laughter, Love and Joy!','Mr. Bug Goes to Town',31309,1.9386,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1596,_binary '\0','/ucQESsrG63LsA5HD70aaPxEyORk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033729',7.7,29585,'en','How Green Was My Valley','Huw Morgan, the academically inclined youngest son in a proud family of Welsh coal miners, witnesses the tumultuous events of his young life during a period of rapid social change. At the dawn of the 20th-century, a miners\' strike divides the Morgans: the sons demand improvements, and the father doesn\'t want to rock the boat.','/8N7OmxBqjRVUrqergUduGgr6exy.jpg','1941-10-28',118,'Released','Rich is their humor! Deep are their passions! Reckless are their lives! Mighty is their story!','How Green Was My Valley',43266,4.6639,7.3,'Aq7yCJG7Dew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1597,_binary '\0','/1deQWW54yiPH8isDhiF26fKjnjh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033740',7.2,5948,'en','I Wake Up Screaming','A young promoter is accused of the murder of Vicky Lynn, a young actress he \"discovered\" as a waitress while out with ex-actor Robin Ray and gossip columnist Larry Evans.','/oeGJPrFxppG4LYEGRMBTkAEU2yP.jpg','1941-10-31',82,'Released','Three of the Hottest names in Hollywood... in a picture that makes the screen SIZZLE!','I Wake Up Screaming',21600,2.2436,6.896,'7bJHmw_voJU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1598,_binary '\0','/eoJyPt7me4tpIEu6JQeS240tUPL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033754',6.7,3369,'en','In the Navy','Popular crooner Russ Raymond abandons his career at its peak and joins the Navy using an alias, Tommy Halstead. However, Dorothy Roberts, a reporter, discovers his identity and follows him in the hopes of photographing him and revealing his identity to the world. Aboard the Alabama, Tommy meets up with Smoky and Pomeroy, who help hide him from Dorothy, who hatches numerous schemes in an attempt to photograph Tommy/Russ being a sailor.','/fikalu8UJgLmZgGEc3BaJSYLxQW.jpg','1941-05-30',86,'Released','THE FLEET\'S ALL IN...Since Those Riotous \"Buck Privates\" Abbott and Costello Joined Up!','In the Navy',33523,1.8126,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1599,_binary '\0','/r4zkprGCkP5fKlpUIoffCzgLPaC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033760',5.3,2988,'en','Invisible Ghost','The town\'s leading citizen becomes a homicidal maniac after his wife deserts him.','/fV5XAHUYRlgWqSnfBzV8OCNa3cP.jpg','1941-04-25',64,'Released','Out of the darkness comes the ear-piercing cry of a terrified girl...','Invisible Ghost',23014,1.3305,5.3,'3QDKv7SX7og','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1600,_binary '\0','/oUO62lsKNeujpQYzFiTLi3k3OPW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033766',7.6,2251,'en','It Started with Eve','A young man asks a hat check girl to pose as his fiancée in order to make his dying father\'s last moments happy. However, the old man\'s health takes a turn for the better and now his son doesn\'t know how to break the news that he\'s engaged to someone else, especially since his father is so taken with the impostor.','/5lWnLdq0MRMPH3Rfm0FLQN1ywc8.jpg','1941-09-26',90,'Released','The Most Romantic Riot Since Eve Gave Adam the Applesauce!','It Started with Eve',33112,1.7933,7.242,'zB8p_hCE3L0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1601,_binary '\0','/rnIGrcPFaDZdmqvzMTe6vPlWw3z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033774',7.1,3897,'en','Johnny Eager','A charming racketeer seduces the DA\'s stepdaughter for revenge, then falls in love.','/eT56vNkYEHo1rv4xhtI3aJLKuUp.jpg','1941-12-09',107,'Released','They’re Dynamite','Johnny Eager',41495,2.2462,6.202,'FpDf1x__UdY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1602,_binary '\0','/h7U0PdMQuOkhmsCZ5f7UcNkOcrW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033781',6.5,1906,'en','Keep \'Em Flying','When a barnstorming stunt pilot decides to join the air corps, his two goofball assistants decide to go with him. Since the two are Abbott & Costello, the air corps doesn\'t know what it\'s in for.','/xOPPNuWygmEos57uanj6t7FMimB.jpg','1941-11-27',86,'Released','They\'re Just Air-Plane Nuts!','Keep \'Em Flying',33486,1.812,6.2,'1peQ5iagq7s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1603,_binary '\0','/sxosjARgDyg35u1aCCBK8YKqTgp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033787',5.3,2817,'en','King of the Zombies','During World War II, a small plane somewhere over the Caribbean runs low on fuel and is blown off course by a storm. Guided by a faint radio signal, they crash-land on an island. The passenger, his manservant and the pilot take refuge in a mansion owned by a doctor. The quick-witted yet easily-frightened manservant soon becomes convinced the mansion is haunted by zombies and ghosts.','/8aR8TjqGCHqBWlntgPK2N7nFnNC.jpg','1941-05-14',67,'Released','HUMAN SACRIFICES! SAVAGE TORTURE! VOODOO RITES!','King of the Zombies',23104,2.0556,5.2,'YfaAb_pKw1A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1604,_binary '\0','/eqKPmUhUjvkfBGS3GZf3FHk1BkY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033802',7.1,2218,'en','Ladies in Retirement','Ellen Creed is a housekeeper who looks after Leonora Fiske, a retired actress living in the English countryside. When Ellen\'s eccentric sisters visit their sibling at Leonora\'s home, tensions soon lead to murder.','/5KULYDhSbuvDdYVMT08mouLLm4Q.jpg','1941-09-09',91,'Released','The Great Broadway Melodrama Comes to Flaming Life on the Screen!','Ladies in Retirement',42066,1.3185,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1605,_binary '\0','/gyo5Jf1pXAIyGb6wp5F5Mp1sNJY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033803',6.4,1345,'en','Lady Be Good','Married songwriters almost split up while putting on a big show.','/pSWzGKpEexa1Q6RsRozXfdshHaP.jpg','1941-09-18',112,'Released','THE TAP-HAPPIEST, SWING-SINGIEST, MELODIC MIRACLE SINCE \"ZIEGFELD GIRL\"!','Lady Be Good',43792,1.4329,5.5,'Le85i6KPcpQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1606,_binary '\0','/7nL4SLErtTIU9lO1ZZMNIJYH0XD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033804',7.7,25762,'en','The Lady Eve','It\'s no accident when wealthy Charles falls for Jean. Jean is a con artist with her sights set on Charles\' fortune. Matters complicate when Jean starts falling for her mark. When Charles suspects Jean is a gold digger, he dumps her. Jean, fixated on revenge and still pining for the millionaire, devises a plan to get back in Charles\' life. With love and payback on her mind, she re-introduces herself to Charles, this time as an aristocrat named Lady Eve Sidwich.','/lJYD3CMgKtv12hazSHc7xt3i2uq.jpg','1941-02-25',97,'Released','When you deal a fast shuffle, love is in the cards.','The Lady Eve',3086,3.2995,7.258,'lj9ilqIyCUk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1607,_binary '\0','/zcGLxxXHUtjbkZLIrdQjXSLGQmx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033836',7.9,14345,'en','The Little Foxes','In 1900, a clan attempts to strike a deal with a Chicago industrialist to get him to build cotton mills in their Deep South town.','/ynawR42jT8ueNWO0ZSBoclr4WoC.jpg','1941-08-29',117,'Released','Bette Davis stars in the film version of the stage hit, as the ruthless beauty whose ambition spelt the doom of three men','The Little Foxes',43802,3.708,7.508,'d_Lfa4jyTCI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1608,_binary '\0','/pCdBYuiG6ZVhrBEVVMjjMnrAxkI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033852',7.4,3865,'en','Love Crazy','Circumstance, an old flame and a mother-in-law drive a happily married couple to the verge of divorce and insanity.','/kPsQ0CiQCEl4YItYh6t9ruyP0A6.jpg','1941-05-23',99,'Released','Hearty laughers welcome! Come on over and HOWL!','Love Crazy',20644,2.2803,6.8,'iBhQSv7_pmY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1609,_binary '\0','/vI2MbOOUPY3jTQNkbUbtxQYKuKn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033868',6.8,1690,'en','Major Barbara','Idealistic young Barbara is the daughter of rich weapons manufacturer Andrew Undershaft. She rebels against her estranged father by joining the Salvation Army. Wooed by professor-turned-preacher Adolphus Cusins, Barbara eventually grows disillusioned with her causes and begins to see things from her father\'s perspective.','/pGn2yUY23pDkjw1OcfXfwYvkApA.jpg','1941-05-14',121,'Released',NULL,'Major Barbara',38770,1.1832,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1610,_binary '\0','/5lMm0MmAviP6DF45nxBVOT9LCwK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033870',7.9,175457,'en','The Maltese Falcon','A private detective takes on a case that involves him with three eccentric criminals, a beautiful liar, and their quest for a priceless statuette.','/bf4o6Uzw5wqLjdKwRuiDrN1xyvl.jpg','1941-10-18',100,'Released','He\'s a Killer When He Hates!','The Maltese Falcon',963,7.5592,7.703,'Yv-BPuqhW9U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1611,_binary '\0','/oPhyvR1UJ7qfOp1697HKz9xmtJP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033873',7.1,7254,'en','Man Hunt','Shortly before the start of WW2, renowned British big-game hunter Alan Thorndike, vacationing in Bavaria, has Hitler in his gun sight. He is captured, beaten, left for dead, and escapes back to London where he is hounded by Nazi agents and aided by a young woman.','/5cQ3rmbzMcVeExlAyhgcJXlGgSO.jpg','1941-06-13',105,'Released','One of the Most Gripping Scenes Ever Filmed...as two world-famous hunters stalk each Other!','Man Hunt',22404,2.1881,6.921,'6UuQGZEl5m8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1612,_binary '\0','/hTEyuDgSQPsaAgOVK3CH4nO33bp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033874',7.5,9906,'en','The Man Who Came to Dinner','An acerbic critic wreaks havoc when a hip injury forces him to move in indefinitely with a Midwestern family.','/3k6KVD9RKADkfFzHLE4ho9yWumO.jpg','1941-12-24',112,'Released','NOTHING COULD BE FUNNIER!','The Man Who Came to Dinner',26319,2.2892,7.05,'U8rMpemxZrU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1613,_binary '\0','/91wtfltKEvR855tEM6txPl6cf5b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033879',6.1,2255,'en','Man-Made Monster','Mad scientist turns a man into an electrically-controlled monster to do his bidding.','/t12DDDsHck8dOVQGI1LiMtNQVf7.jpg','1941-03-28',60,'Released','The most amazing monster the world has ever known.','Man-Made Monster',84719,2.179,6.116,'Vo31M0PIoHM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1614,_binary '\0','/fy2hkQgAWj1st3FWBzqc27JlytC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033891',7.6,16573,'en','Meet John Doe','As a parting shot, fired reporter Ann Mitchell prints a fake letter from unemployed \"John Doe,\" who threatens suicide in protest of social ills. The paper is forced to rehire Ann and hires John Willoughby to impersonate \"Doe.\" Ann and her bosses cynically milk the story for all it\'s worth, until the made-up \"John Doe\" philosophy starts a whole political movement.','/dnBZbFE2OGlTGNGBVTn6t83tJtd.jpg','1941-03-14',123,'Released','All America wants to meet the “Mr. Deeds” of 1941!','Meet John Doe',32574,3.3878,7.3,'9j3gdbdnoEk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1615,_binary '\0','/cdFKUIxnLtDaQV850ArvKvDmVlM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033902',6.6,1341,'en','Men of Boys Town','Father Flanagan raises funds, helps a disabled boy, and saves an older boy from reform school.','/nFJEkWQY9D5WBsaA3PfhwOYqwHu.jpg','1941-04-11',106,'Released','M-G-M\'s NEW hit! Mighty sequel to \"Boys Town\"!','Men of Boys Town',105038,2.1589,6.4,'IDUOfjC2IHw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1616,_binary '\0','/4hUJ98NjDwCpH84yJqUeg4hYy5b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033918',6.7,1539,'en','Moon Over Miami','After losing nearly all of an inheritance to taxes, sisters Kay and Barbara Latimer, waitresses at a drive-in restaurant in Texas, scheme to find rich husbands. With the aid of their aunt Susan, the sisters take the last of their money and head to a well-known Miami resort where they soon meet two wealthy young men, Phil and Jeff, who begin a fierce rivalry for Kay, not realizing that Barbara has fallen in love with one of them.','/c3zBaU3wwTJThzT4jK9Ehwp3ik5.jpg','1941-07-04',91,'Released','POOR GIRL\'S PARADISE! Two sisters storm the Miami Millionaire Colony!','Moon Over Miami',43794,1.6932,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1617,_binary '\0','/6xwE9IF4z0GAzAKYafaEyHIL0lJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033922',6.3,12312,'en','Mr. & Mrs. Smith','Happily married for three years, Ann and David Smith live in New York. One morning Ann asks David if he had to do it over again, would he marry her? To her shock, he answers, \"No\". Later that day, they separately discover that, due to a legal complication, they are not legally married.','/lIFBvhh9EbQpwkYa135dQvMHXSj.jpg','1941-01-31',95,'Released','Lombard and Montgomery Get Hitched As They\'re Getting Unhitched !','Mr. & Mrs. Smith',24197,2.6855,5.886,'HGfQ87J6xQk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1618,_binary '\0','/mflUcwbpLQ6IBUj6Ar0Imd4gb3t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033945',7,2877,'en','Never Give a Sucker an Even Break','Never Give a Sucker an Even Break is a 1941 film about a man who wants to sell a film story to Esoteric Studios. On the way he gets insulted by little boys, beaten up for ogling a woman, and abused by a waitress. W. C. Fields\' last starring role in a feature-length film.','/dHCpKHEBfSGygsZ54RnDOh5s8Ky.jpg','1941-10-10',71,'Released','It\'s a Fields-day of fun!','Never Give a Sucker an Even Break',28789,1.6292,6.913,'FXGfhqf2k8k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1619,_binary '\0','/aXCUVOdmysmq6gKgpLQukS2TNHl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033980',6.6,1691,'en','One Foot in Heaven','Episodic look at the life of a minister and his family as they move from one parish to another.','/vsQkW4kgaJME7emvrZfIpCkAT6P.jpg','1941-11-01',108,'Released','Folks, meet a grand FATHER! He\'s the affable, laffable head of the most delightful family that ever stepped out of America\'s screens...into America\'s hearts!','One Foot in Heaven',84086,1.8007,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1620,_binary '\0','/beGltF8i5lMYcT3191STuDqlUAj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0033987',6.7,2813,'en','Out of the Fog','A Brooklyn pier racketeer bullies boat-owners into paying protection money but two fed-up fishermen decide to eliminate the gangster themselves rather than complain to the police.','/udoM74cW1L24YP661M2fLAbnQxv.jpg','1941-06-14',85,'Released','It\'s lightning and thunder! It\'s Lupino and Garfield!','Out of the Fog',26380,2.21,6.359,'fvIuyPwAIdU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1621,_binary '\0','/cfWxR72RiA3cO9qurVaAAuFoNqk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034012',7.1,8987,'en','Penny Serenade','Julie and Roger are a love-struck married couple who desperately want to have a child. Tragedy after tragedy gets in their way, as the two attempt to rise above their troubles and fulfill their dreams of parenthood.','/7MC1fE5FSEIP9xf0N2VD68zRKv2.jpg','1941-04-24',120,'Released','\"Remember the tune they were singing the night we fell in love?...\"','Penny Serenade',43795,2.7295,6.6,'yvrFt_1bR6g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1622,_binary '\0','/b8Cq27Wf2ullc6CMeqocJb2fjh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034027',7.2,2033,'en','\"Pimpernel\" Smith','Eccentric Cambridge archaeologist Horatio Smith takes a group of British and American archaeology students to pre-war Nazi Germany to help in his excavations. His research is supported by the Nazis, since he professes to be looking for evidence of the Aryan origins of German civilisation. However, he has a secret agenda: to free inmates of the concentration camps.','/2MeWLt3pwvb1PMv8IT2HyFkbswI.jpg','1941-07-28',120,'Released','The man the Gestapo hates!','\"Pimpernel\" Smith',43788,1.6843,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1623,_binary '\0','/ukvCYNPbThf0Pz3k0vxuHAYjlt9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034055',6,2306,'en','Pot o\' Gold','Jimmy, the owner of a failed music shop, goes to work with his uncle, the owner of a food factory. Before he gets there, he befriends an Irish family who happens to be his uncle\'s worst enemy because of their love for music and in-house band who constantly practices. Soon, Jimmy finds himself trying to help the band by getting them gigs and trying to reconcile the family with his uncle.','/kjBp97HVXVtMqzOZUIkjT1oZrQz.jpg','1941-04-03',86,'Released','It\'s the prize romantic laugh of the year... more fun than winning the POT O\' GOLD!','Pot o\' Gold',18702,1.6842,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1624,_binary '\0','/lCzKKAJ0AKPUJ3VFfjVZcv8o4L2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034078',6.4,1445,'en','Rage in Heaven','A jealous man frames his wife\'s suspected lover for murder.','/ut0UkLVmEGdqpO1KYKAZhZYz1Rb.jpg','1941-03-07',85,'Released','In this man was hidden the soul of a beast!','Rage in Heaven',31324,1.9284,6.396,'1O0ZXvkQ0Xs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1625,_binary '\0','/i93j8LqXisSyY5NGdA8qAnz6vP9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034091',6.7,4337,'en','The Reluctant Dragon','Humorist Robert Benchley attempts to find Walt Disney to ask him to adapt a short story about a gentle dragon who would rather recite poetry than be ferocious. Along the way, he is given a tour of Walt Disney Studios, and learns about the animation process.','/woyLqPJLeHP7gzF7DOtEapqaJQx.jpg','1941-06-19',74,'Released','The big feature show with a thousand surprises!','The Reluctant Dragon',22752,3.845,6.618,'UEG58HsLmMM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1626,_binary '\0','/pXPjDpdX91rW8eFMqse6WVzEeSE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034093',7.2,1848,'fr','Remorques','A married tugboat captain falls for a woman he rescues from a sinking ship.','/dM9qttcCSS8053iRD8ILd1J5E5F.jpg','1941-11-27',91,'Released','A tempestuous love story in the great French style...!','Stormy Waters',64897,2.3821,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1627,_binary '\0','/v017dtMxjOEoOC4Ruvk2RbriTJ6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034116',6.7,3556,'en','Road to Zanzibar','Stranded in Africa, Chuck and his pal Fearless have comic versions of jungle adventures, featuring two attractive con-women.','/A4jyOSlBmalVm0dm498Af8WBGvO.jpg','1941-04-11',91,'Released','IT\'S THAT GLEESOME THREESOME AGAIN! Giving you your worth in mirth! Toping all the fun in \"Road to Singapore!\"','Road to Zanzibar',31812,1.6007,6.405,'w7e-TTRQHMs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1628,_binary '\0','/dD1zeP5cn46ba06AMxFu8DIboml.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034162',7.5,5147,'en','The Sea Wolf','Shipwrecked fugitives try to escape a brutal sea captain who\'s losing his mind.','/hgpzaiHupKqvozTcXuqF5Ew5QVF.jpg','1941-03-21',100,'Released','Jack London\'s great novel of terror afloat.','The Sea Wolf',33931,3.5076,7.2,'eKw5jqrQlSM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1629,_binary '\0','/i4nVONDi6brdbG8K8J1NmMrD0NJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034167',7.7,20167,'en','Sergeant York','Alvin York a hillbilly sharpshooter transforms himself from ruffian to religious pacifist. He is then called to serve his country and despite deep religious and moral objections to fighting becomes one of the most celebrated American heroes of WWI.','/54LTgyRHSixyeeFhLtCFj0SMAQ3.jpg','1941-09-27',134,'Released','Missiles! Jets! Tanks! ... It\'s still the guy with guts and a gun who wins the war!','Sergeant York',16442,5.2568,7.2,'6xw4I67VP_U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1630,_binary '\0','/gJwBHK01ybZPmYplmJk5qEfh0XM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034172',7.2,7690,'en','Shadow of the Thin Man','While attending a major horse race with their young son, Nick Jr., Nick and Nora Charles witnesse a shocking murder from the crowded grandstand. What first appears to be an isolated killing soon leads to a maze of corruption, blackmail, gambling scandals, and criminal intrigue. As Nick investigates, he encounters suspicious bookmakers, dishonest officials, rival gangsters, and a mysterious killer determined to stay ahead of the law. Nora, as always, is never far from the action, bringing her quick wit and fearless curiosity to the case.','/sYiasULoMJj84A5zheNyChGuhHY.jpg','1941-11-21',97,'Released','FUNNIER THAN EVER in their first new laugh-thriller in 2 years!','Shadow of the Thin Man',14590,3.2338,7,'LgJWmyZdBjo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1631,_binary '\0','/hYYXrII2LJvv40GlhSGVZiqXDjL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034175',6.5,3256,'en','The Shanghai Gesture','A gambling queen uses blackmail to stop a British financier from closing her Chinese clip joint.','/aHDmFi7Q9M6mpMxRm7VpiXwmTYC.jpg','1941-12-25',99,'Released','Mystery-lure of the Far East!','The Shanghai Gesture',42678,1.5529,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1632,_binary '\0','/ndaGCGWYm2i0cqxbf1gs1aW19Dv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034182',6.9,2921,'en','The Shepherd of the Hills','Young Matt Matthews, an Ozark Mountains moonshiner, hates the father he has never seen, who apparently deserted Matt\'s mother and left her to die. His obsession contributes to the hatred rampant in the mountains. However, the arrival of a stranger, Daniel Howitt, begins to positively affect the mountain people, who learn to shed their hatred under his gentle influence.','/jAysYrMhIAADzdeFTlICMTv2LGR.jpg','1941-07-18',98,'Released','He Tamed Their Wild Hearts With His Courage and Won Them With His Love','The Shepherd of the Hills',43308,2.6537,6.6,'707ntlSwcpI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1633,_binary '\0','/67aG8MDHaQYHiWWJ3aq9mjZaiSI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034224',5.3,2032,'en','Spooks Run Wild','A group of delinquents on their way to summer camp get stuck in a haunted house.','/kYBjhhKuAUXJ5WTZE3MVAQrGwjP.jpg','1941-10-24',65,'Released',NULL,'Spooks Run Wild',43796,1.6304,5.1,'tgxUeKZ78NY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1634,_binary '\0','/ayfhbqfbvo3Ojykb0TBRDYtRubh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034236',7.2,4747,'en','The Strawberry Blonde','Biff Grimes is desperately in love with Virginia, but his best friend Hugo marries her and manipulates Biff into becoming involved in his somewhat nefarious businesses. Hugo appears to have stolen Biff\'s dreams, and Biff has to deal with the realisation that having what he wants and wanting what another has can be very different things.','/cjNJlLKUJQGysAiAucKLDOmzujr.jpg','1941-02-21',97,'Released','Times have changed, but Cagney hasn\'t!','The Strawberry Blonde',76465,2.0038,6.9,'ig8DNks-_gM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1635,_binary '\0','/7E4b9mXU9psvGbqCbI0aGEGI1oO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034240',7.9,31193,'en','Sullivan\'s Travels','Successful movie director John L. Sullivan, convinced he won\'t be able to film his ambitious masterpiece until he has suffered, dons a hobo disguise and sets off on a journey, aiming to \"know trouble\" first-hand. When all he finds is a train ride back to Hollywood and a beautiful blonde companion, he redoubles his efforts, managing to land himself in more trouble than he bargained for when he loses his memory and ends up a prisoner on a chain gang.','/z5cqIM0ysVjkCmaDfyTQnlozdIp.jpg','1941-11-30',91,'Released','Veronica Lake’s on the Take','Sullivan\'s Travels',16305,2.9078,7.4,'kIrdtdpPQHY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1636,_binary '\0','/uVvSAIGgYdXpThHGtmDvEGgeFbl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034241',7.1,2212,'en','Sun Valley Serenade','When Phil Corey\'s band arrives at the Idaho ski resort its pianist Ted Scott is smitten with a Norwegian refugee he has sponsored, Karen Benson. When soloist Vivian Dawn quits, Karen stages an ice show as a substitute.','/6N7NMzb1iWEtb5NhLT622EKK5ht.jpg','1941-08-29',86,'Released','SKY HIGH ROMANCE BETWEEN SONJA AND JOHN TO THE IRRESISTIBLE RHYTHMS OF GLENN MILLER and HIS ORCHESTRA!','Sun Valley Serenade',43797,1.4457,7.1,'n1ihBk7l-2c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1637,_binary '\0','/oa6yoeeZtjxdgzAcZtbCSW3GEE9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034248',7.2,45647,'en','Suspicion','A sheltered heiress falls for a charming playboy and elopes with him, but soon discovers his gambling vice and mounting debts. As his lies deepen and those around them meet mysterious ends, she begins to suspect that her husband’s affection may conceal a deadly motive—and that she could be his next victim.','/clWNlzlbyaEoIK63lcFjqBmXoQz.jpg','1941-11-14',99,'Released','In his arms she felt safety...in his absence, haunting dread!','Suspicion',11462,4.2032,7.1,'gHpCbrRcBhk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1638,_binary '\0','/d1X4q0YtUEXRvQqQxAXUNPPdxC2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034251',7,2456,'en','Swamp Water','A hunter happens upon a fugitive and his daughter living in a Georgia swamp. He falls in love with the girl and persuades the fugitive to return to town.','/dq0mA3QabWcxrCbzYmwzWAqRuJf.jpg','1941-11-16',90,'Released','The Swamp! Sinister - mysterious - it shaped the lives and loves and hates of the people who lived around its edges!!','Swamp Water',45215,1.7809,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1639,_binary '\0','/7eOEjONCwAmFm4ILod0b2pVym7z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034266',6.4,3371,'en','Tarzan\'s Secret Treasure','A scientific expedition happens to discover that gold exists on Tarzan\'s escarpment. The villainous Medford and Vandermeer kidnap Jane and Boy to extort from Tarzan the location of the gold.','/vmRXYQUtCkqo6N8mc46WImvQ1Wz.jpg','1941-12-01',81,'Released','The Greatest Tarzan Is Back!','Tarzan\'s Secret Treasure',40214,2.8458,5.9,'8dTu83otbFc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1640,_binary '\0','/nMMOZIC50vGUbdVkjMEvUIv0Ths.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034269',6.7,1612,'en','Texas','Two Virginians are heading for a new life in Texas when they witness a stagecoach being held up. They decide to rob the robbers and make off with the loot. To escape a posse, they split up and don\'t see each other again for a long time. When they do meet up again, they find themselves on different sides of the law. This leads to the increasing estrangement of the two men, who once thought of themselves as brothers.','/9X8XBAswQx1tIsFADtKYsyds6yO.jpg','1941-10-09',93,'Released','All the thrills of the roaring West!','Texas',75315,1.7338,6.7,'ZpD3FDt1ha8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1641,_binary '\0','/61MzmuuyTZ1afikdmT3HgFYTd3z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034272',7.2,5634,'en','That Hamilton Woman','The story of courtesan and dance-hall girl Emma Hamilton, including her relationships with Sir William Hamilton and Admiral Horatio Nelson and her rise and fall, set during the Napoleonic Wars.','/zDXsdF9Eqk9hs9KyxakRYYijKxK.jpg','1941-04-03',125,'Released','The year\'s most exciting team of screen lovers!','That Hamilton Woman',43798,3.6802,7.1,'8Nvk8ULEEro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1642,_binary '\0','/gOlcqmIn7NOKoDC5MMjvWkARmC7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034274',6.6,3367,'en','That Uncertain Feeling','A happily married woman sees a psychoanalyst and develops doubts about her husband.','/gkasJPQy4DtYCtllr68AZjDrJLQ.jpg','1941-04-20',84,'Released','It\'s a serious problem for a lady with the hiccups, and he is it!','That Uncertain Feeling',43799,1.864,6.564,'BBMm2ndeZEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1643,_binary '\0','/p9P4mxmrTTsjyooxkgISVGOjZSw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034277',7.2,7610,'en','They Died with Their Boots On','The story follows General George Armstrong Custer\'s adventures from his West Point days to his death. He defies orders during the Civil War, trains the 7th Cavalry, appeases Chief Crazy Horse and later engages in bloody battle with the Sioux nation.','/gx8jknFwZRuQwTPooe14Dsx5uTO.jpg','1941-11-20',140,'Released','A STORY OF UNDYING FAITH!','They Died with Their Boots On',17382,3.4337,6.7,'o1Wejl7ZCtE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1644,_binary '\0','/ugltCOyR3N9U3DENjEMu56uqDmg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034281',6.6,1550,'en','They Met in Bombay','A jewel thief and a con artist are rivals in the theft of a valuable diamond and gem necklace in Bombay and as the Japanese Army invades China.','/psuwpX5TO7RRoQLGepmLsPDXOjM.jpg','1941-06-27',92,'Released','Stealing jewels for profit . . . and hearts for pleasure!','They Met in Bombay',100068,2.1513,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1645,_binary '\0','/bfN8fraehQ2issUCp1nHs7fxuuC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034297',6.3,2820,'en','Tobacco Road','Shiftless Jeeter Lester and his family of sharecroppers live in rural Georgia where their ancestors were once wealthy planters. Their slapstick existence is threatened by a bank\'s plans to take over the land for more profitable farming.','/7Iw6h2e2nc9hVioq0sLOc6pW4sL.jpg','1941-02-20',84,'Released','ON THE SCREEN AT LAST! The Picture you\'ve waited eight years to see...Picturized by the men who gave you \"GRAPES OF WRATH\"','Tobacco Road',18539,1.9672,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1646,_binary '\0','/fX2NsdnZWKfgiPucBrYLxH5cltE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034298',7.2,1678,'ja','戸田家の兄妹','After the death of her husband, an elderly woman and her youngest, unmarried daughter are forced to sell their house to cover his debts and decide to move in with one of the former\'s children, each of whom is scarcely happy to accommodate.','/h4WR3geAbWo5SWHVL05TaegqBcg.jpg','1941-03-01',105,'Released',NULL,'Brothers and Sisters of the Toda Family',94659,1.2698,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1647,_binary '\0','/6xPGvzPnHSLYvqNOUtvUDd681L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034299',6.3,1336,'en','Tom, Dick and Harry','Janie is a telephone operator who is caught up in the lines of love of three men: car salesman Tom, Chicago millionaire Dick and auto mechanic Harry. But Janie just can\'t seem to make up her mind between them. While fantasizing about her futures with each of the men, Janie spends her time desperately trying to juggle between them until she can make a decision.','/aZnucljYes0E8NkzH3Bg5jWiQg.jpg','1941-06-13',87,'Released','It\'s the story of every girl who ever fell in love . . . More than once !','Tom, Dick and Harry',86604,1.9128,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1648,_binary '\0','/5HaZJ8YcQcqCbhPsTfLT0D75b0e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034303',6.8,3880,'en','Topper Returns','Topper is once again tormented by a fun-loving spirit. This time, it\'s Gail Richards, accidentally murdered while vacationing at the home of her wealthy friend, Ann Carrington, the intended victim. With Topper\'s help, Gail sets out to find her killer with the expected zany results.','/1lmk672uN88lT8W8wCD6xeWiUdX.jpg','1941-03-21',88,'Released','Topper\'s having girl trouble again!','Topper Returns',44875,2.3113,6.5,'0wt-3v31L-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1649,_binary '\0','/aiCyL9QVipFoBCRI0YDtNIFvhq6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034328',6.2,2140,'en','Two-Faced Woman','A woman pretends to be her own twin sister to win back her straying husband.','/ckur8ivaMyvn6VSP5Q5Ru7E9UJG.jpg','1941-12-31',90,'Released','Love-laughs explode all over the place when Garbo plays twin sisters, and Melvyn Douglas loves both of them!','Two-Faced Woman',95874,2.3001,6.4,'1LX8IBCrjSE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1650,_binary '\0','/k5WmmHfjAmVtctHrskp24jcNsF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034370',6.3,1422,'en','The Wagons Roll at Night','An escaped circus lion provides the impetus for the meeting of carnival owner Nick Coster and Matt Varney, a small-town man who suddenly becomes a lion tamer when he manages to subdue the big cat. While acclimating to carnival life, Matt begins a romance with Nick\'s sister, Mary, causing tension between Matt and Nick. The latter must also juggle his stormy relationship with glamorous circus star Flo Lorraine.','/qIbnArx55PvUNz9zu6jYVTf7bpH.jpg','1941-04-25',84,'Released','FOR THE MILLIONS WHO CHEERED \"THEY DRIVE BY NIGHT\"!','The Wagons Roll at Night',94565,1.6869,6.5,'-I1aWa0cJpI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1651,_binary '\0','/tdsXoeFxNXq5lhZfDvATrKDLsr6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034384',6.7,3728,'en','Western Union','When Edward Creighton leads the construction of the Western Union to unite East with West, he hires a Western reformed outlaw and a tenderfoot Eastern surveyor. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with Twentieth Century Fox Film Corporation in 2000.','/wpWsAhUjcOnnkGCcGDDeEWehMw0.jpg','1941-02-21',95,'Released','A 20th Century-Fox Encore Hit !','Western Union',43804,2.5114,6,'-7vYioszCGI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1652,_binary '\0','/hZhWbscVb8X6RD2ur8Ang02AdqY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034386',6.5,1636,'en','When Ladies Meet','Mary, a writer working on a novel about a love triangle, is attracted to her publisher. Her suitor Jimmy is determined to break them up; he introduces Mary to the publisher\'s wife without telling Mary who she is.','/7fsyWyCU7WV0drPA1mK1Lw5NhMz.jpg','1941-08-29',105,'Released','Hollywood Parade Of Stars In Gay Romance','When Ladies Meet',54635,1.7694,6.9,'bJ_HYeKK_Uw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1653,_binary '\0','/tTzCMdfuDCtjKpgFNPo6IuR3p4o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034389',6.7,1226,'en','Whistling in the Dark','Radio crime show host \'The Fox\' along with his fiancée and ex-girlfriend are kidnapped by a larcenous cult who demand that he help them plan a perfect murder.','/lVywWRJzsTsjk9bTvKdYB6zn9bB.jpg','1941-08-08',78,'Released','SURPRISE COMEDY HIT OF THE YEAR ! Don\'t Miss It !','Whistling in the Dark',90460,1.6157,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1654,_binary '\0','/hwMWJ8G5173SGCHzrm0mVjvESaY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034398',7.2,34781,'en','The Wolf Man','After his brother\'s death, Larry Talbot returns home to his father and the family estate. Events soon take a turn for the worse when Larry is bitten by a werewolf.','/vG8fu5syTtQLzK1hQXyi3ugOPNF.jpg','1941-12-09',70,'Released','His hideous howl a dirge of death!','The Wolf Man',13666,4.4179,7,'GeKQL7ddgMo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1655,_binary '\0','/8Gwr3cbt94yrsNM2xOHIZP0Lwn8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034399',7.2,4426,'en','A Woman\'s Face','A female blackmailer with a disfiguring facial scar meets a plastic surgeon who offers her the possibility of looking like a normal woman.','/v5ULQxXBUomMgqwQjNwRHqlxCQ5.jpg','1941-05-09',106,'Released','HOW COULD THIS WOMAN WIN A MAN\'S LOVE...HIS KISSES...HIS EMBRACES...?','A Woman\'s Face',27622,3.2357,6.8,'58z90AcRRAs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1656,_binary '\0','/5doH8NYYtXkbce6s7N6pVlJUTAF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034405',6.3,1701,'en','A Yank in the R.A.F.','An American pilot impulsively joins His Majesty\'s Royal Air Force in Britain in an attempt to impress his ex-girlfriend.','/2rnMINMnWv5iBM6YaqO6tiFaws7.jpg','1941-09-26',98,'Released','ROLLICKING ROMANCE! GLORIOUS ADVENTURE!','A Yank in the R.A.F.',49609,1.9576,5.6,'ZxTYasgU5XM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1657,_binary '\0','/2tKDhaCaMi7ssFgu15p4c0jLZEW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034409',6.7,3325,'en','You\'ll Never Get Rich','A Broadway choreographer gets drafted and coincidentally ends up in the same army base as the boyfriend of his object of affection.','/6sdGOX0R1OVVT93kcZHz8xmOLOg.jpg','1941-09-25',88,'Released','Exciting loveliness and rhythm in a star-spangled army musical!','You\'ll Never Get Rich',28658,2.3647,6.477,'gMif87MKBF4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1658,_binary '\0','/eHv14CWLRavWYNMQjnX6CqF7Rk4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034415',6.7,3810,'en','Ziegfeld Girl','Discovery by Flo Ziegfeld changes a girl\'s life but not necessarily for the better, as three beautiful women find out when they join the spectacle on Broadway: Susan, the singer who must leave behind her ageing vaudevillian father; vulnerable Sheila, the working girl pursued both by a millionaire and by her loyal boyfriend from Flatbush; and the mysterious European beauty Sandra, whose concert violinist husband cannot endure the thought of their escaping from poverty by promenading her glamor in skimpy costumes.','/jzVzrPg5tFR9WbVL04aLWqz3lMv.jpg','1941-04-25',132,'Released','GREATEST MUSICAL EXTRAVAGANZA OF ALL TIME!','Ziegfeld Girl',32619,2.9259,6.625,'DdnuvvGnm0M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1659,_binary '\0','/8aM5PW062sHwYUp4tGCAPWHEYoJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034424',6.2,1565,'en','A-Haunting We Will Go','Stan and Ollie get involved with con men, crooks, a genial magician, and two interchangeable coffins with disastrous but funny results.','/Acygmwu0OjdHURb6rkxUf3oLbiV.jpg','1942-08-07',68,'Released','It baffles the brain! It mystifies the mind! It scintillates the senses! BEFORE YOUR VERY EYES! Gloom turns to gladness when Stan and Ollie get mixed up in murder, mirth...and black magic!','A-Haunting We Will Go',61524,2.5704,6.2,'XyfN4SSxHhQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1660,_binary '\0','/fGVAJR1dbW6RlTVYXdTrGdfwogF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034428',6.8,5880,'en','Across the Pacific','Rick Leland makes no secret of the fact that he has no loyalty to his home country after he is court-martialed out of the army and boards a Japanese ship for the Orient in late 1941. But has Leland really been booted out, or is there some other motive for his getting close to fellow passenger Doctor Lorenz?','/Amfvgyd7BpnRVgpMXBrHGNJWvWR.jpg','1942-09-04',97,'Released','A Warner Bros. Hit !','Across the Pacific',18790,2.3054,6.624,'un5x3soRjjM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1661,_binary '\0','/3ziTCzdnYjssr2SQrjKswu0z1jC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034449',7.1,5589,'en','All Through the Night','Broadway gamblers stumble across a plan by Nazi saboteurs to blow up an American battleship.','/w6m3b68HSL1tmYoDJBcYxA4yoZX.jpg','1942-01-10',107,'Released','Killer Bogart takes the Gestapo for a ride!','All Through the Night',37036,2.9654,6.656,'64kxaXSj2tA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1662,_binary '\0','/vAzsFnjLY0Y4DCnLTuOho6dfJru.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034461',7.6,2126,'pt','Aniki-Bóbó','Two schoolboys, Carlitos and Eduardo, fight for the affection of a girl, Teresinha.','/u3ALny6no1YHFZ7DaKNKEhlpMuJ.jpg','1942-12-18',71,'Released',NULL,'Aniki-Bóbó',81210,1.171,7.6,'BAo7v0z9fTc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1663,_binary '\0','/cNeglgSiXLyGAV7n3WapAxwH2zR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034465',6.1,1860,'en','Arabian Nights','Two half brothers battle each other for the power of the throne and the love of sensual, gorgeous dancing girl Scheherazade.','/w5ZurZi5LEyY9sGsl5iKzaCyEeC.jpg','1942-12-25',86,'Released','Dashing Thieves of Baghdad...riding out of the magic and splendor of Arabian Nights','Arabian Nights',60488,3.1278,6.018,'WjM98p1pQhw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1664,_binary '\0','/oTM7FNL1I7JCJUQfVulaTIl7RXr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034478',7.3,4004,'fr','L\'assassin habite au… 21','Paris, France. Commissaire Wens follows the lead of a ruthless murderer to an unexpected place.','/q4qcDAOTJ0BvFqZevtDCp6xViJj.jpg','1942-08-07',83,'Released',NULL,'The Murderer Lives at Number 21',74402,2.1897,7.24,'_UAj7GM9v-Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1665,_binary '\0','/hxJmyGWdptdL7slyPLykLse2zgz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034485',6.6,1778,'en','Babes on Broadway','Penny Morris and Tommy Williams are both starstruck young teens but nobody seems to give them any chance to perform. Instead, they decide to put up their own show to collect money for a summer camp for the kids.','/vN1D8TJm93jYtYZQp8p6Rd7HpDG.jpg','1941-12-31',118,'Released','The Show That\'s Out Of This World','Babes on Broadway',43790,1.7818,6.6,'73Pr7saW67M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1666,_binary '\0','/rKgqYwlpU32ZO9UTCuXNdhdnU4B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034492',7.3,166988,'en','Bambi','Bambi\'s tale unfolds from season to season as the young prince of the forest learns about life, love, and friends.','/wV9e2y4myJ4KMFsyFfWYcUOawyK.jpg','1942-08-14',70,'Released','Love Comes To The Forest Folk . . . and to you, in one of the world\'s greatest love stories!','Bambi',3170,10.2468,7.015,'-jXX-EYTAis','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1667,_binary '\0','/jlUSRGkcPDNYAhxlezdohFHrDCa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034493',7.6,3406,'it','I bambini ci guardano','In his first collaboration with renowned screenwriter and longtime partner Cesare Zavattini, Vittorio De Sica examines the cataclysmic consequences of adult folly on an innocent child. Heralding the pair’s subsequent work on some of the masterpieces of Italian neorealism, The Children Are Watching Us is a vivid, deeply humane portrait of a family’s disintegration.','/vEkp2FoxUFpCGeioWdUS4wb7ezh.jpg','1943-10-27',84,'Released','A pulsating drama of childhood.','The Children Are Watching Us',61461,2.0472,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1668,_binary '\0','/mkG8dATxSutWQtOmTIPdM0lj8un.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034513',6.7,1586,'en','The Big Shot','Duke Berne, former big shot but now a three-time loser, fears returning to crime because a fourth conviction will mean a life sentence. Finally, haunted by his past and goaded by his cohorts, he joins in planning an armoured car robbery.','/agVWBrIBPpdOQqhnMjfUJ823Y6h.jpg','1942-06-13',82,'Released','HUMPHREY BOGART as the Last of the Racket Barons... the Big Shot of \'em all!','The Big Shot',19388,1.4207,6.2,'ays4pgVr7Go','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1669,_binary '\0','/3PNcTiO3x263kdCCpoxP5CtqqQ5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034514',6.4,2031,'en','The Big Street','Meek busboy Little Pinks is in love with an extremely selfish nightclub singer who despises and uses him.','/vglh0w4w7TMhEmz02s4SflLuwsn.jpg','1942-08-13',88,'Released','Take it from me... A Girl\'s Best Friend is a Dollar!','The Big Street',98262,2.1948,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1670,_binary '\0','/htz973vvBEafhlMzrAbY0f7927p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034521',4.3,1397,'en','Black Dragons','It is prior to the commencement of World War II, and Japan\'s fiendish Black Dragon Society is hatching an evil plot with the Nazis. They instruct a brilliant scientist, Dr. Melcher, to travel to Japan on a secret mission. There he operates on six Japanese conspirators, transforming them to resemble six American leaders. The actual leaders are murdered and replaced with their likeness.','/wyUGxTPkzYmcKJjKPM5aDIKLmC0.jpg','1942-03-06',64,'Released','It\'s the picture that has the whole town shivering!','Black Dragons',22741,1.5769,4.6,'iNMSoSDzKwk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1671,_binary '\0','/lQMx5C7qoboI2mrU2epn6Hf9h3N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034522',6.7,5689,'en','The Black Swan','When notorious pirate Henry Morgan is made governor of Jamaica, he enlists the help of some of his former partners in ridding the Caribbean of buccaneers. When one of them apparently abducts the previous governor\'s pretty daughter and joins up with the rebels, things are set for a fight.','/xGeoslDZmLq0k5bIN71sswdzm7Y.jpg','1942-12-04',87,'Released','Seas ablaze...with black villainy, with fiery romance, with breathless deeds of daring...in the roaring era of love, gold, and adventure!','The Black Swan',29882,4.2927,6.5,'tEfjutlf-So','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1672,_binary '\0','/7rFRkkIaiS9vJXvpHY57jC8P7nI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034540',5.8,1519,'en','The Boogie Man Will Get You','A young divorcee tries to convert a historic house into a hotel despite its oddball inhabitants and dead bodies in the cellar.','/h5RjwOCwTkHVKsZPYUaheSZ8lXC.jpg','1942-10-22',67,'Released','IT\'S A CHILLER-DILLER OF A MAYHEM-AND-MERRIMENT SHOW!','The Boogie Man Will Get You',30342,1.8278,6.2,'ppSb01QNBRE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1673,_binary '\0','/6RrS4meYqj22Dl0HMMYhh3SIY6C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034546',5.3,1451,'en','Bowery at Midnight','A seemingly charitable soup kitchen operator (who moonlights as a criminology professor) uses his Bowery mission as a front for his criminal gang. Police attempt to close in on the gang as they commit a series of robberies, murders and bizarre experiments on corpses.','/lDWHvIotQkogG77wHVuMT8mF8P.jpg','1942-10-30',62,'Released','The monster and the ghoul! One deals in wholesale murder...the other serves as a torture-master of the living dead! See it and shudder!','Bowery at Midnight',38346,1.248,5,'9YCcV4dPq8Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1674,_binary '\0','/x7fyJc3SdN2lCl7jgKnh6Ym9ZLj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034578',6.4,1995,'en','Captains of the Clouds','Inspired by Churchill\'s Dunkirk speech, brash, undisciplined Canadian bush pilot Brian MacLean and three friends enlist in the RCAF.','/cCFsU3PbbQU530aB6SCzi0PDRna.jpg','1942-02-12',114,'Released','So full of spectacle and glory it had to be made in Technicolor!','Captains of the Clouds',32921,1.9392,6.4,'SiNQPQnUIuo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1675,_binary '\0','/87wqeMeUeMRLjsE1IWNKJcPlpuC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034583',8.5,660992,'en','Casablanca','In Casablanca, Morocco in December 1941, a cynical American expatriate meets a former lover, with unforeseen complications.','/lGCEKlJo2CnWydQj7aamY7s1S7Q.jpg','1943-01-15',102,'Released','They had a date with fate in Casablanca!','Casablanca',289,14.2331,8.139,'4rguz_XRi8E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1676,_binary '\0','/hYDvLMhrPkYMZmB3JIdeZswIaUc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034586',7,1594,'en','Castle in the Desert','Charlie Chan, with son Jimmy on a week\'s pass from the Army, takes up a request for help at a castle-home, miles from anywhere in the American desert south-west and inhabited by an eccentric, reclusive historian and his wife, a descendant of Lucrezia Borgia. Once there, he finds the request\'s legitimacy denied by all who are present, but still necessary as one houseguest has already been murdered, the other guests are at each other\'s throat, and the Borgia-related chatelain is suspected...','/h33clwUr32JbPzws6KQAOpCOTqw.jpg','1942-02-02',62,'Released',NULL,'Castle in the Desert',29328,1.4794,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1677,_binary '\0','/dAE4x4BgauvsRkErmLg1L05LNAV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034587',7.2,29011,'en','Cat People','A Serbian émigré in Manhattan believes that, because of an ancient curse, any physical intimacy with the man she loves will turn her into a feline predator.','/xbe5w7MXOdqsu0ZZRiHHAh6oQlc.jpg','1942-12-05',73,'Released','She knew strange, fierce pleasures that no other woman could ever feel!','Cat People',25508,5.2315,6.926,'w-MIQyzBWHs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1678,_binary '\0','/ubi0BuKxVFEHkrTVmAkeTVxXdih.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034591',7.5,3604,'ja','父ありき','Shuhei Horikawa, a poor schoolteacher, struggles to raise his son Ryohei by himself, despite neither money nor prospects.','/oJ2jVlhj60ofzFfXjfLkOD01rxZ.jpg','1942-04-01',93,'Released',NULL,'There Was a Father',27372,1.6643,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1679,_binary '\0','/3Xzvf4YaxdsPcTBBigabgzSEmFo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034613',4.6,3838,'en','The Corpse Vanishes','A scientist keeps his wife young by killing, stealing the bodies of, and taking the gland fluid from virgin brides.','/ur7omgilzhWeHKW9Spd3ueHFbC1.jpg','1942-05-08',63,'Released','Horror to make your hair stand on end!','The Corpse Vanishes',26922,1.3164,4.3,'_LcN27MFrgk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1680,_binary '\0','/h4wbyroUdHlRXXOUtOYcct0NGy6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034622',6.7,2038,'en','Crossroads','A French diplomat who\'s recovered from amnesia is blackmailed over crimes he can\'t remember.','/5JnVb5EzDHI3uhACWpQfO772yO4.jpg','1942-07-23',83,'Released','Where women wait to seal your fate!','Crossroads',42825,1.7859,5.9,'ft_W-Jl7Hzc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1681,_binary '\0','/kkBvCPktjLkS5RxDBIez0bhehxR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034646',6.9,2905,'en','Desperate Journey','A British bomber crew, including Australian and American, is shot down over Germany during a bombing run. The five make their way across a perilous Germany, intent on reaching the UK with the war secrets they have learned, battling Nazis along the way.','/oanNUFLVasmh3MOIoe7Rq1THnOj.jpg','1942-09-26',107,'Released','Man alive, Just picture this excitement!','Desperate Journey',55236,2.4031,6.1,'JttiUOQeIis','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1682,_binary '\0','/1EsRUY5lcFtqp7iZzFXMtCuGhr8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034694',7.2,3493,'en','Edge of Darkness','The film pivots around the local Norwegian doctor and his family. The doctor\'s wife (Ruth Gordon) wants to hold on to the pretence of gracious living and ignore their German occupiers. The doctor, Martin Stensgard (Walter Huston), would also prefer to stay neutral, but is torn. His brother-in-law, the wealthy owner of the local fish cannery, collaborates with the Nazis. The doctor\'s daughter, Karen (Ann Sheridan), is involved with the resistance and with its leader Gunnar Brogge (Errol Flynn). The doctor\'s son has just returned to town, having been sent down from the university, and is soon influenced by his Nazi-sympathizer uncle. Captain Koenig (Helmut Dantine), the young German commandant of the occupying garrison, whose fanatic determination to do everything by the book and spoutings about the invincibility of the Reich hides a growing fear of a local uprising.','/vlZDRNrKljJmmTveUToMrI2zAi6.jpg','1943-04-09',119,'Released','Resistance fighters battle the Nazis in occupied Norway','Edge of Darkness',55238,3.3437,6.3,'e3cNV15WDn8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1683,_binary '\0','/cx4tQkjAGmErD8yTMhlUOueZ6Uc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034711',6.7,2215,'en','Eyes in the Night','Blind detective Duncan Maclain gets mixed up with enemy agents and murder when he tries to help an old friend with a rebellious stepdaughter.','/7ZfZJNPxyKsrCblI7UT0EF1Cdul.jpg','1942-10-16',80,'Released','Startling as a scream!','Eyes in the Night',84506,2.4572,6.1,'JylLN47E3Jw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1684,_binary '\0','/yKmZ6fdvZw3ylP00dJVQ3utQOeH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034716',6.4,1400,'en','The Falcon Takes Over','While an escaped convict, Moose Malloy, goes in search of his ex-girlfriend Velma, police inspector Michael O\'Hara attempts to track him assuming him to be a prime suspect for a number of mishaps.','/y0QJ2GYYQKn6ukbyDiudnj1SSfN.jpg','1942-05-29',65,'Released','MYSTERY that you\'ll laugh at...when -- The Falcon TAKES OVER','The Falcon Takes Over',44173,1.6791,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1685,_binary '\0','/i4xBv3pjFR3IMQ6afFsSXTFScZL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034732',6.3,1338,'en','Fingers at the Window','In Chicago, an unemployed actor aims to solve the mystery concerning a string of ax murders, apparently committed by a lunatic.','/akeWqApHR6Kowi95K4bfhyH8Aat.jpg','1942-04-22',80,'Released','DANGER AT NIGHTFALL!','Fingers at the Window',65210,2.1505,5.7,'IDp5jMs2xtI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1686,_binary '\0','/7wM9k8dwWnHQOjknf0e6nx46Kep.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034734',7,2396,'en','The First of the Few','This 1942 fictionalized biopic chronicles the true story of how two of the most remarkable men in aviation history - visionary Spitfire designer R.J. Mitchell and his test pilot Geoffrey Crisp - designed a streamlined monoplane that led to the development of the Spitfire.','/rp7tjjcANAcUknUDYw1DGu4YyD8.jpg','1942-09-14',118,'Released','The thrilling human story behind the plane that licked the Luftwaffe!','The First of the Few',16444,2.1005,6.7,'i8JwvJG1MM0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1687,_binary '\0','/vKtDoxuJ5A63GOW2QlgT17CdHwG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034742',6.7,4598,'en','Flying Tigers','Jim Gordon commands a unit of the famed Flying Tigers, the American Volunteer Group which fought the Japanese in China before America\'s entry into World War II. Gordon must send his outnumbered band of fighter pilots out against overwhelming odds while juggling the disparate personalities and problems of his fellow flyers.','/1Aee8HBwkq1yjKYMnL9YMPhXJZ.jpg','1942-10-08',102,'Released','Strong BRAVE MEN FLYING IN THE FACE OF DEATH THAT WE MAY Live','Flying Tigers',29372,2.3302,6.258,'H9lPTkWYJ6U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1688,_binary '\0','/qA7WdA6FWOVeS6xSZEcXwsNNyje.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034746',7,4185,'en','For Me and My Gal','Two vaudeville performers fall in love, but find their relationship tested by the arrival of WWI.','/uWCTKiFf2ffrMjieb2wU3RzZ6Wx.jpg','1942-10-21',104,'Released','She\'s a Yankee Doodle Girlie!','For Me and My Gal',27017,1.9474,6.5,'Yx9yhtemC44','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1689,_binary '\0','/1wFSHI7vFBGyNz4SaVlOyzUXZNQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034778',7.5,4603,'en','Gentleman Jim','As bare-knuckled boxing enters the modern era, brash extrovert Jim Corbett uses new rules and dazzlingly innovative footwork to rise to the top of the boxing world.','/9ajoFwfXXV70UidTkc9YorUzOYo.jpg','1942-11-14',104,'Released','The grandest story of the Naughty \"Nineties\" becomes the gayest picture of the Fighting \"Forties!\"','Gentleman Jim',43522,2.4284,7.2,'9WGN58nXHlM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1690,_binary '\0','/7fJDpwbG7SboimFqkkAvRW6ChHs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034780',6.8,2164,'en','George Washington Slept Here','New Yorkers Bill and Connie Fuller have to move from their apartment. Without Bill\'s knowledge, Connie purchases a delapidated old farmhouse in Pennsylvania, where George Washington was supposed to have actually slept during the American Revolution.','/qJGPPLaarCSFziixOUwFB4MZwmG.jpg','1942-10-30',93,'Released','YOU\'LL GET HAPPY HYSTERICS in this history-mocking comedy','George Washington Slept Here',35262,2.2916,6.474,'zWLmsxJ-Fmk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1691,_binary '\0','/xLXaoqEejsyJOvzTf0iTMM23NYF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034786',6.1,8074,'en','The Ghost of Frankenstein','Frankenstein\'s unscrupulous colleague, Dr. Bohmer, plans to transplant Ygor\'s brain so he can rule the world using the monster\'s body, but the plan goes sour when he turns malevolent and goes on a rampage.','/aGKJ2kjNXHCLyWKMx3b8D5kKCag.jpg','1942-03-13',68,'Released','NEW THRILLS as the Monster stalks again!','The Ghost of Frankenstein',3074,2.9878,5.8,'Jxtn5mwnMiM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1692,_binary '\0','/jkGg59usMSBG36TLfA3KaaHAZnP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034798',7,7957,'en','The Glass Key','A crooked politician finds himself being accused of murder by a gangster from whom he refused help during a re-election campaign.','/wMUEEEdqKWIN9BxcSFx3dlFb7i1.jpg','1942-09-08',85,'Released','The Tougher They Are—The Harder They Fall','The Glass Key',17131,2.3036,6.7,'Aywg8MVnc1s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1693,_binary '\0','/6GTzjkJ4M2W7dfjPcfQQqiPAwuv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034808',6.5,1261,'en','Grand Central Murder','Conniving Broadway starlet Mida King has plenty of enemies, so when she\'s found murdered at Grand Central Station, Inspector Gunther calls together a slew of suspects for questioning. Mida\'s shady ex-flame, Turk, seems the most likely culprit, but when smart-mouthed private eye Rocky Custer -- also a suspect himself -- begins to piece together the crime, a few clues that Gunther has overlooked come to light.','/nGQLo19scnQAkb0XAV0aCoGUwuz.jpg','1942-05-01',73,'Released','Screamingly funny! Screamingly thrilling!','Grand Central Murder',65546,1.3421,5.7,'dcUPfvSf1Ww','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1694,_binary '\0','/8nsQHDPX6Q6mobSpG2sXNFoEOSa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034828',7.1,1753,'en','The Hard Way','Helen Chernen pushes her younger sister Katherine into show business in order to escape their small town poverty.','/bWRQ6bCL8glZ8IfSPGDlfNqbO8F.jpg','1943-01-13',109,'Released','You\'d never believe they\'re sisters!','The Hard Way',36612,1.7673,6.5,'icuYlQka2BI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1695,_binary '\0','/4xM4PBZ7hCeMZAQn1pC1Baxmzaq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034862',7.3,19626,'en','Holiday Inn','Lovely Linda Mason has crooner Jim Hardy head over heels, but suave stepper Ted Hanover wants her for his new dance partner after fickle Lila Dixon gives him the brush. Jim\'s supper club, Holiday Inn, is the setting for the chase by Hanover and his manager.','/7eZzwqLM1w1Mljg60rzB1zr27lu.jpg','1942-07-10',101,'Released','WHAT A HOLIDAY!','Holiday Inn',13485,3.2493,7.1,'rjhBYyMfmXY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1696,_binary '\0','/xrb2llOfcqX5dL5JLca4ZiTdwyu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034881',7.1,11015,'en','I Married a Witch','A 17th-century witch returns to wreak havoc in the life of a descendant of the Puritan witch hunter who burned her, but runs afoul of her father when she discovers that her mischief might have found her true love.','/pOtHcQfo0wCesRfeDPacrS2bD3W.jpg','1942-10-30',77,'Released','No man can resist her!','I Married a Witch',25970,3.9554,6.873,'hxWFekcmzmk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1697,_binary '\0','/aNUN8D9Ga6YAPa34kkj8EjbtjrH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034889',6.3,1748,'en','In Old California','Boston pharmacist Tom Craig comes to Sacramento, where he runs afoul of local political boss Britt Dawson, who exacts protection payment from the citizenry. Dawson frames Craig with poisoned medicine, but Craig redeems himself during a Gold Rush epidemic.','/bmnmz6K2ChiZ0fPf02ze0m04rQ8.jpg','1942-05-31',91,'Released','Torn from the pages of America\'s most reckless era-THE UNFORGETTABLE GOLD RUSH DAYS!','In Old California',40685,2.1606,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1698,_binary '\0','/giyRIb02hjIn8KQRHZbHsb67VLH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034890',7.3,5794,'en','In This Our Life','An unhappy, self-centered woman runs off with her sister\'s husband, wreaking havoc and ruining the lives of those around her.','/bnQulLMPOlBfUqAxKPA3FvqxTrD.jpg','1942-05-08',97,'Released','A sensational novel throbs to life! The cast is one of Warner Bros. best - the picture is one of Warner Bros. biggest!','In This Our Life',43525,3.0278,6.9,'D6AvLXTEhUk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1699,_binary '\0','/qndbDtZQ6dMpa1vevnkUskz7TMv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034891',7.2,7189,'en','In Which We Serve','The story of the HMS Torrin, from its construction to its sinking in the Mediterranean during action in World War II. The ship’s first and only commanding officer is Captain E.V. Kinross, who trains his men not only to be loyal to him and the country, but—most importantly—to themselves.','/i4SkM1rzBROLt9d33u0KGr2SVVm.jpg','1942-09-17',115,'Released','You\'ll Never Forget...','In Which We Serve',28093,2.6973,6.722,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1700,_binary '\0','/bQcWWA0kFDjcei4ECXEUwIjNjQK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034902',5.9,3181,'en','Invisible Agent','The Invisible Man\'s grandson uses his secret formula to spy on Nazi Germany.','/2yybvJ8qeTv3efX8LP0q1KGleDJ.jpg','1942-07-31',81,'Released','Today\'s most amazing sensation!','Invisible Agent',28426,2.4674,5.8,'RUEG1ptVL4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1701,_binary '\0','/ewnZC0LxNGSqQMXwXvmSCnw1UlX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034922',6.5,5198,'en','Journey into Fear','An American ballistics expert in Turkey finds himself targeted by Nazi agents. Safe passage home by ship is arranged for him, but he soon discovers that his pursuers are also on board.','/2VVW1rCSHYW5n1IV7dhDoWa4OCT.jpg','1943-01-07',68,'Released','Welles and Del Rio together! as Terror Man vs. Leopard Woman--for possession of a mysterious stranger in the powder-keg Middle East','Journey into Fear',21366,1.7428,6.051,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1702,_binary '\0','/gP2bFlDxNnDECi3MEKI24xxG3Mm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034928',6.7,5129,'en','Jungle Book','Mowgli, lost in the jungle when a toddler, raised by wolves, years later happens upon his human village and reconnects with its inhabitants, including his widowed mother. Continuing to maintain a relationship with the jungle, adventures follow.','/zYkffyYCFO1Li1f20MyaAYUaYC4.jpg','1942-04-03',106,'Released','A jewelled secret city...guarded by the jungle\'s fiercest denizens!','Jungle Book',23033,3.4424,6.4,'NCHwkSewKWE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1703,_binary '\0','/uiUECQOl3qOXXlTo287nEURsmh9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034936',6.7,3866,'en','Keeper of the Flame','Famed reporter Stephen O\'Malley travels to a small town to investigate the death of a national hero.','/cuedz5RXa3VUhgespJAkejmfPtn.jpg','1943-04-01',100,'Released','The screen\'s most exciting lovers in their newest romantic triumph!','Keeper of the Flame',33034,2.8947,6.6,'SFyWEaPUur4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1704,_binary '\0','/4lX5n2Oy0IXDFia0X3g9b1KJvcB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034941',6.8,1292,'en','Kid Glove Killer','Van Heflin stars as the head of a city crime lab who tries to solve the murder of the town mayor by scientifically analyzing evidence.','/6v6aw8NdFAKBw9Z4QWXzLdhzJhi.jpg','1942-04-17',74,'Released','Crime under the microscope. Introducing Police chemist Gordon McKay.','Kid Glove Killer',48987,1.4914,6.4,'YX17VoZ-tc8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1705,_binary '\0','/2l4BX8926AVZBZmogHBM12ZoACl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034946',7.5,5506,'en','Kings Row','Five young adults in a small American town face the revelations of secrets that threaten to ruin their hopes and dreams.','/mjOZms5qzSGibE5b6GVHg2Y5wwR.jpg','1942-02-02',127,'Released','The town they talk of in whispers.','Kings Row',53779,1.6636,7.4,'dXeIr470Y-M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1706,_binary '\0','/nH41bJjCNLNmRJzobN42Hav6T1U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0034965',7.3,3560,'en','Larceny, Inc.','Three ex-cons buy a luggage shop to tunnel into the bank vault next door. But despite all they can do, the shop prospers...','/j2Eb8Y7zv6jcOrLpodmMFrgFxpT.jpg','1942-04-24',96,'Released','Hold onto your hearts girls!!! Here comes the racket king!','Larceny, Inc.',69119,1.5149,7.145,'YtP8JCKdnTQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1707,_binary '\0','/3PqF057dHrqqzcJIBG7z9eFBcaA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035009',3.6,2106,'en','The Mad Monster','A mad scientist changes his simple-minded handyman into a werewolf in order to prove his supposedly crazy scientific theories - and exact revenge.','/2Mhd2VXiTu1jmkmCbw6L96n40Ba.jpg','1942-05-15',77,'Released','The blood of a wolf he placed in the veins of a man... and created a monster such as the world has never known!','The Mad Monster',110980,1.4057,3.4,'Xi8SWRlcmN0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1708,_binary '\0','/pkD7zVlHpBoORTtupteZxiOxaG4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035015',7.6,28990,'en','The Magnificent Ambersons','The spoiled young heir to the decaying Amberson fortune comes between his widowed mother and the man she has always loved.','/g5EosvM0delNPkgBDGYYZvJl46n.jpg','1942-07-10',88,'Released','Real life screened more daringly than it’s ever been before!','The Magnificent Ambersons',965,3.175,7.336,'ylPT4SV8WDE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1709,_binary '\0','/45wnh2KF40buheDAK7kzOMxUsSw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035017',7.3,2096,'fr','La Main du Diable','A struggling artist buys a talisman that gives him love, fame and wealth. The talisman is a severed left hand, and it works perfectly, in fact, magically. But of course there is nothing free in this world, and after one year the devil comes and asks for his due.','/gKWPDQTIADng8vxQgDmKGRFvfu4.jpg','1943-03-21',80,'Released',NULL,'Carnival of Sinners',54288,1.9525,6.701,'BnS2SD9keU8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1710,_binary '\0','/i6c3nEncfkJSXlktytmIEQbGNCI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035019',7.3,8636,'en','The Major and the Minor','Low on funds, working-class girl Susan Applegate disguises herself as a youngster in order to pay half fare home. But little \'Sue Sue\' finds herself in a whole heap of grownup trouble when she hides out in a compartment with handsome Major Philip Kirby.','/e6ZWWdyWkqiMq8g6KmXibtmSiVK.jpg','1942-09-16',100,'Released','Is she a kid - or is she kidding?','The Major and the Minor',39871,2.9992,7.095,'KGN7Vnb7o9A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1711,_binary '\0','/83UCD8tSCKTXR1qVvVGQqgHxNNu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035020',6.6,1583,'en','The Male Animal','The trustees of Midwestern University have forced three teachers out of their jobs for being suspected communists. Trustee Ed Keller has also threatened mild mannered English Professor Tommy Turner, because he plans to read a controversial piece of prose in class. Tommy is upset that his wife Ellen also suggested he not read the passage. Meanwhile, Ellen\'s old boyfriend, the football player Joe Ferguson, comes to visit for the homecoming weekend. He takes Ellen out dancing after the football rally, causing Tommy to worry that he will lose her to Joe.','/jDluLy4Q3FFAogmAzZ6Y3dPJyHh.jpg','1942-03-12',101,'Released','SHE turned a lamb into a lion!','The Male Animal',90978,1.7419,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1712,_binary '\0','/21MT2QRZzNiIuy6rP6tut5iAyKj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035034',6.6,1956,'en','Manpower','Hank McHenry and Johnny Marshall work as power company linesmen. Hank is injured in an accident and subsequently promoted to foreman of the gang. Tensions start to show in the road crew as rivalry between Hank and Johnny increases.','/BgQWakoUD5PyPFArPoGWZkPMto.jpg','1941-08-09',104,'Released','Raft and Robinson are at the brawling point!','Manpower',23098,1.4554,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1713,_binary '\0','/8y2okDXjjRJEiJzZ63tr9Ai3wHo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035082',6.8,2631,'en','Moontide','After a drunken night out, a longshoreman thinks he may have killed a man.','/3T5PPmpHQd39BIsU4s9wTp5vCyC.jpg','1942-05-29',94,'Released','A Great New Star to thrill you! Strange romance to intrigue you!','Moontide',42062,1.8181,6.4,'uMb-Z-wTYQw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1714,_binary '\0','/jqu2wqiFKrmhbF6fLqwi3zRUDz7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035093',7.6,21545,'en','Mrs. Miniver','Middle-class housewife Kay Miniver deals with petty problems. She and her husband Clem watch her Oxford-educated son Vin court Carol Beldon, the charming granddaughter of the local nobility as represented by Lady Beldon. Then the war comes and Vin joins the RAF.','/fjPjx6FTaoTussbqoLj6OYTtUyi.jpg','1942-07-03',134,'Released','\"Mrs. Miniver\" is more than a picture... It\'s dramatic. It\'s tender. It\'s human. It\'s real.','Mrs. Miniver',27367,4.7974,7.1,'QXXHxxSZZ8A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1715,_binary '\0','/vGdrgwFPcdAqLxOPy4NQobQ6EnS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035096',5.5,4448,'en','The Mummy\'s Tomb','A high priest of Karnak travels to America with the living mummy Kharis (Lon Chaney Jr.) to kill all those who had desecrated the tomb of the Egyptian princess Ananka thirty years earlier.','/wuaqpLGb5PHpUGUCmQwyS5EVLdw.jpg','1942-10-23',61,'Released','The FEAR of the Year!','The Mummy\'s Tomb',29239,2.0857,5.5,'b5NRPPDxZA4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1716,_binary '\0','/carKxsgspiOUJqQ8cUvoDWV3MJf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035100',7,1770,'en','My Favorite Blonde','Larry Haines, a mediocre vaudeville entertainer, boards a train for Los Angeles. Aboard, he meets an attractive, blonde British agent carrying a coded message hidden in a brooch—and is being pursued by Nazi agents.','/pnEnkJO2N5nzfD0SxuqhSSRN3u8.jpg','1942-04-02',78,'Released','HELP! SHE\'S AFTER ME! IS THERE A BRUNETTE IN THE HOUSE?','My Favorite Blonde',97648,1.5561,6.457,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1717,_binary '\0','/sWgQW74fS3wAfRLKq2PRvZTQMnN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035105',7,2019,'en','My Sister Eileen','Sisters Ruth and Eileen Sherwood move from Ohio to New York in the hopes of building their careers. Ruth wants to get a job as a writer, while Eileen hopes to succeed on the stage. The two end up living in a dismal basement apartment in Greenwich Village, where a parade of odd characters are constantly breezing in and out. The women also meet up with magazine editor Bob Baker, who takes a personal interest in helping both with their career plans.','/x3e1zXt4hFh4sHqfmiYPIWQAU6D.jpg','1942-09-24',96,'Released','NOW ON THE SCREEN! THE STAGE HIT THAT CONVULSED BROADWAY AND THE NATION !','My Sister Eileen',33052,1.334,6.8,'XjaYW-Gu_t0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1718,_binary '\0','/ehKSwTmCi9HHqNQuomCVwkKRoz2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035124',6.1,2162,'en','Night Monster','Kurt Ingston, a rich recluse, invites the doctors who left him a hopeless cripple to his desolate mansion in the swamps as one by one they meet horrible deaths.','/hH62urxqyXJEMuayZg5ZMyVXYCj.jpg','1942-10-23',72,'Released','What kind of a thing is it?!','Night Monster',99545,1.2861,6.2,'fdgBG_INLSA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1719,_binary '\0','/lAqTraujV7MQUnMZ78XD07Tv5lQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035140',7.8,21060,'en','Now, Voyager','A woman suffers a nervous breakdown and from an oppressive mother before being freed by the love of a man she meets on a cruise.','/kWtJ1C98fQB1fUDSfqb1NGBPPK8.jpg','1942-10-22',117,'Released','It happens in the best of families. But you\'d never think it could happen to her!','Now, Voyager',32847,3.4461,7.4,'0cr2sS2WN7w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1720,_binary '\0','/vMI5sMIMSyfmOv9FD2Hv5JXURqQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035151',6.4,3576,'en','Once Upon a Honeymoon','A radio correspondent tries to rescue a burlesque queen from her marriage to a Nazi official.','/aWy7AROU1gtYUK1oa4u8mr1vWh0.jpg','1942-11-27',115,'Released','Gee it\'s great to be together at last on another fellows honeymoon!','Once Upon a Honeymoon',43779,2.2361,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1721,_binary '\0','/sDwCcdC38mhzl9ryfpvkhroMWjR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035153',7,3047,'en','One of Our Aircraft Is Missing','During a raid on Germany, a British bomber crew is forced to bail out after their plane is damaged. They land in Holland, where they\'re aided by Dutch civilians.','/fDL8iat0Yhii2dKRc4nQEEWVhvQ.jpg','1942-04-24',102,'Released','1942\'s first blast of screen dynamite','One of Our Aircraft Is Missing',43780,2.218,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1722,_binary '\0','/pfG8KFgovnqRnK2n2mhYwKXhGBG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035157',6.8,1229,'en','Orchestra Wives','Connie Ward is in seventh heaven when Gene Morrison\'s band rolls into town. She is swept off her feet by trumpeter Bill Abbot. After marrying him, she joins the band\'s tour and learns about life as an orchestra wife, weathering the catty attacks of the other band wives.','/bpsFY09nAQvyFF1HIOaCkfaNX4r.jpg','1942-09-04',98,'Released','It\'s Hep! It\'s Hot! It\'s Hilarious!','Orchestra Wives',43781,1.4004,6.5,'jHwPPdFmmG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1723,_binary '\0','/6efjJuY8dUUSmMZ3ERS4CNXEp1j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035160',7.5,9135,'it','Ossessione','Gino, a drifter, begins an affair with inn-owner Giovanna as they plan to get rid of her older husband.','/dHB6NdsOxO0dc71ciP2hsv3nTPf.jpg','1943-05-16',140,'Released',NULL,'Obsession',5155,2.3194,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1724,_binary '\0','/2b999zCG0DGjePd9fpA2keMspey.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035169',7.4,13933,'en','The Palm Beach Story','A New York inventor, Tom Jeffers, needs cash to develop his big idea, so his adoring wife, Gerry, decides to raise it by divorcing him and marrying an eccentric Florida millionaire, J. D. Hackensacker III.','/vl3MVnrUsCa0wRsFTVU0ohbtWy6.jpg','1942-08-28',88,'Released','Love is fickle! Love is blind! She runs \'round the country...with him behind!','The Palm Beach Story',32255,3.1895,7,'7p_wafSdMLI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1725,_binary '\0','/1iWabp2ekWwPqTjTrDpkpztdYm5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035173',6.7,2558,'en','Pardon My Sarong','A pair of bus drivers accidentally steal their own bus. With the company issuing a warrant for their arrest, they tag along with a playboy on a boat trip that finds them on a tropical island, where a jewel thief has sinister plans for them.','/5C42mPi2VhjoEv0Tka4qOcr5oc4.jpg','1942-08-07',84,'Released','They\'re jammin\' the jungle with jest and jive!','Pardon My Sarong',31523,1.9726,6.5,'l7xNKUC8dGY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1726,_binary '\0','/cNquzdCPcSOmeMU2pOsji3gjnbD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035195',6.4,1768,'en','Pittsburgh','Charles \'Pittsburgh\' Markham rides roughshod over his friends, his lovers, and his ideals in his trek toward financial success in the Pittsburgh steel industry, only to find himself deserted and lonely at the top. When his crash comes, he finds that fate has dealt him a second chance.','/zrrF51B2j91F1fuvESVsL0efrq0.jpg','1942-12-11',91,'Released','BIG! BRAWNY! BOLD!','Pittsburgh',62186,1.4618,6.4,'1rk1BwKZ8Ug','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1727,_binary '\0','/bipcEMQU2P79CdHr1ZStfWDK8Pt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035209',7,2609,'en','Why We Fight: Prelude to War','Prelude to War was the first film of Frank Capra\'s Why We Fight propaganda film series, commissioned by the Pentagon and George C. Marshall. It was made to convince American troops of the necessity of combating the Axis Powers during World War II. This film examines the differences between democratic and fascist states.','/vpkCDbVQDXth2lK3Zw5FYcxAvX3.jpg','1942-05-27',53,'Released','The US government puts the finger on the United Nations\' enemies','Why We Fight: Prelude to War',23336,2.0206,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1728,_binary '\0','/bd57iZNhXjX4Olm22XqXHondbBL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035211',7.6,13042,'en','The Pride of the Yankees','The story of the life and career of the baseball hall of famer, Lou Gehrig.','/tbSMm0IAa5WgTcyoeUn7AKAViVY.jpg','1942-07-14',128,'Released','Intimate and thrilling drama of a hero of the headlines... the girl who had his love and shared his life, but dared not question his one secret!','The Pride of the Yankees',19140,3.2178,7.3,'oT2Gs2KbI_k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1729,_binary '\0','/nkpwLl7kKSXwoFUh3EZfviP8iVJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035228',7.8,1375,'pt','O Pátio das Cantigas','A portrait of the relations between neighbours in a Lisbon courtyard. A story made of small episodes of humour, friendship, rivalry, love.','/jIkMld5mBx8YFJ3iBdwg0Z9jUg2.jpg','1942-01-23',125,'Released',NULL,'The Courtyard of the Ballads',74717,1.03,8.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1730,_binary '\0','/oQcCWP7VglRaxOm20BPEgHGJNw4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035238',7.9,9453,'en','Random Harvest','Wandered away from his asylum, an amnesiac World War I veteran falls in love with a music hall star but his amnesia makes it difficult to last.','/x5W3FOGmifwK3e8IhLDQYvURIw2.jpg','1942-12-17',125,'Released','He had found love - lost it - and now had found it again!','Random Harvest',22387,2.6515,7.3,'P12UUGhe_mQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1731,_binary '\0','/eCa0lE8q6r9zf18jRkraDdOvWOr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035244',6.6,3878,'en','Reap the Wild Wind','The Florida Keys in 1840, where the implacable hurricanes of the Caribbean scream, where the salvagers of Key West, like the intrepid and beautiful Loxi Claiborne and her crew, reap, aboard frail schooners, the harvest of the wild wind, facing the shark teeth of the reefs to rescue the sailors and the cargo from the shipwrecks caused by the scavengers of the sea.','/coWMXDjxSFBPT3phsTKcKjVQbwq.jpg','1942-03-26',119,'Released','Cecil B. DeMille\'s GREATEST TRIUMPH! OUT-THRILLS ALL OTHER SCREEN SPECTACLES!','Reap the Wild Wind',63617,3.1886,6.4,'cTQ_n8UT8x0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1732,_binary '\0','/4sej1lDqfhaotP85czyn3cL88eQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035250',6.3,2142,'en','Reunion in France','Frenchwoman Michele de la Becque, an opponent of the Nazis in German-occupied Paris, hides a downed American flyer, Pat Talbot, and attempts to get him safely out of the country.','/25ARg4KpTxk0mTQSAx0WWgmEOqS.jpg','1942-12-25',104,'Released','The Picture Of The Hour! France In Open Revolt! Leaping From The Headlines! The Underground Of Paris!','Reunion in France',28286,1.819,6.5,'hNeC9cr2les','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1733,_binary '\0','/69IxaU6cwV3vfm8aNMKt0fzF8Kc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035252',6.5,1881,'en','Ride \'Em Cowboy','Two peanut vendors at a rodeo show get in trouble with their boss and hide out on a railroad train heading west. They get jobs as cowboys on a dude ranch, despite the fact that neither of them knows anything about cowboys, horses, or anything else.','/6S2ijGwVcomOMml4YkHuNDU14WR.jpg','1941-11-17',86,'Released','They\'d make a horse LAUGH!','Ride \'Em Cowboy',33541,2.0847,6,'5YOlbsD4XA8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1734,_binary '\0','/9g2xPr6tzacLo3EpqJxNLS11xta.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035258',6.6,1291,'en','Rings on Her Fingers','Susan Miller works behind the girdle counter in a department store and dreams about the beautiful clothes and glamour she can never hope to have. Enter May Worthington and Warren, a pair of con artists who pose as the mother and uncle of a pretty girl in order to separate millionaires from their money. They convince Susan she has an opportunity to fulfill all her dreams, and the trio heads for Palm Beach. Susan meets John Wheeler who says he is shopping for a sailboat. Believing that he is a millionaire, Warren and May sell him a boat that doesn\'t belong to them, and make off with his $15,000 life savings. Looking for greener pastures, they work themselves into the family of wealthy Tod Fenwick, who falls for Sue, posing as \"Linda Worthington\". But John shows up as a guest of Fenwick and he tells \"Linda\", not knowing she was part of the scam, that he has a detective after the fake captain that sold him the boat...','/edZcMANN5TI77l6d2aGPXVIYnbC.jpg','1942-03-20',86,'Released','she kissed him out of his life\'s savings... but the poor guy loved it','Rings on Her Fingers',79887,2.0658,6.719,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1735,_binary '\0','/nEZyLq7ZVjslenUohZiTbw342AV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035259',6.1,1348,'en','Rio Rita','Doc and Wishey run into some Nazi-agents, who want to smuggle bombs into the USA from a Mexican border hotel.','/lOpfzO7rlF1nH51YZQR3p3F9Trg.jpg','1942-03-11',91,'Released','\"SENORITA...I\'M CRAZY with LOVE FOR YOU\" -- BUD \"HE\'S CRAZY ALRIGHT...BUT I\'m your DAISY\" -- LOU','Rio Rita',52853,2.3926,6,'H1basmq0-XE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1736,_binary '\0','/q3oxb8KBBc3XvIsQjtLwYIGEFmR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035262',7,6298,'en','Road to Morocco','Two carefree castaways on a desert shore find an Arabian Nights city, where they compete for the luscious Princess Shalmar.','/nECM25OC4iJHV1AHPa4CHnzYgyk.jpg','1942-11-10',82,'Released','You\'ll Shriek At These Shieks! . . . trying the double - Oh! on Sheikess Dorothy Lamour!','Road to Morocco',31805,2.3229,6.882,'pV4d0aLVFKc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1737,_binary '\0','/8MzkfEzx4aJC75elYU3dk6jdLr9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035272',6.9,2124,'en','Roxie Hart','A café in Chicago, 1942. On a rainy night, veteran reporter Homer Howard tells an increasing audience the story of Roxie Hart and the crime she was judged for in 1927.','/hBCSkYj3xMsWcbEzG2kD3dhF3sM.jpg','1942-02-20',72,'Released','The gal who became a national pastime!','Roxie Hart',57684,2.2679,7.018,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1738,_binary '\0','/1rSF7UoY6aU8i7yJOLovZv8AYwX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035279',7.1,29951,'en','Saboteur','Aircraft factory worker Barry Kane flees across the United States after he is wrongly accused of starting the fire that killed his best friend.','/iDKOOTymUZg0WAWPcbdP6nPZEFF.jpg','1942-04-22',109,'Released','Unmasking the man behind your back!','Saboteur',31997,4.406,6.9,'K4ELyvwPTTk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1739,_binary '\0','/kx7ItDbrIl8oLdGHLIlQWR6eSZp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035317',6.5,7436,'en','Sherlock Holmes and the Secret Weapon','In the midst of World War II, Sherlock Holmes rescues the Swiss inventor of a new bomb-sight from the Gestapo and brings him to England, where he quickly falls into the clutches of the evil Professor Moriarty.','/50qLIyhdWrDxcZE0bmHhUaxb2FP.jpg','1942-12-25',68,'Released','Suspense! Thrills! Adventure!','Sherlock Holmes and the Secret Weapon',18706,3.169,6.447,'e3ZTQvkyJ4k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1740,_binary '\0','/lUzUljS7SpSpoW0waVuT935CkQc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035318',6.4,5838,'en','Sherlock Holmes and the Voice of Terror','England, at the start of World War Two. Mysterious wireless broadcasts, apparently from Nazi Germany are heard over the BBC. They warn of acts of terror in England, just before they take place. Baffled, the Defense Committee call in Sherlock Holmes.','/4aprukY55rwcLKzdSVpRzQo1Koa.jpg','1942-09-18',65,'Released','THE MASTER MINDS OF MYSTERY!','Sherlock Holmes and the Voice of Terror',27117,2.2236,6.526,'zn6XiAI1iJs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1741,_binary '\0','/lQ54IyzeTMrhm89Dp0tt3DjRG5c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035360',7,2067,'en','Son of Fury: The Story of Benjamin Blake','Sir Arthur Blake has inherited title and lands from his brother. He also has his orphaned nephew Benjamin working for him as a bonded servant. While he believes the lad was born out of wedlock and so cannot claim the inheritance, he is taking no chances. Benjamin eventually rebels against his uncle and sets sail to try and make his fortune. This may enable him to return to prove his claim to being the rightful heir to the estate.','/zCDbfyiuogdG26fy1InpvrKQ5cx.jpg','1942-01-29',98,'Released','Bold Swooping Tremendous Adventure!','Son of Fury: The Story of Benjamin Blake',44530,2.1783,7.2,'fYZh9K_ZTlU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1742,_binary '\0','/y7bNvayEr7cFSCyEwNCeTTIihuB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035369',6.7,3673,'en','The Spoilers','When honest ship captain Roy Glennister gets swindled out of his mine claim, he turns to saloon singer Cherry Malotte for assistance in his battle with no-good town kingpin Alexander McNamara.','/tNrsmTHpjxtnag30UtFCcuvf49S.jpg','1942-06-11',87,'Released','Crashing Fists in the Gold-Crazed Alaska of \'98!','The Spoilers',43785,2.2361,6.196,'BpsB0ZBPcAQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1743,_binary '\0','/xFaA583wc7nkRUtg6kyp9F1dmJH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035415',7.3,2792,'en','Tales of Manhattan','Ten screenwriters collaborated on this series of tales concerning the effect a tailcoat cursed by its tailor has on those who wear it. The video release features a W.C. Fields segment not included in the original theatrical release.','/oKH3Vfx9cPmhD74iAaKLdGdk32w.jpg','1942-08-05',118,'Released','An Experience You\'ll never forget !','Tales of Manhattan',27655,1.9553,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1744,_binary '\0','/imfdOMgteopHr3xslvSMlBPnZ7k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035417',7.5,10133,'en','The Talk of the Town','Hilarity ensues when a falsely accused fugitive from justice hides at the house of his childhood friend, which she has recently rented to a high-principled law teacher.','/naMSxieb5cD1bGCu0rZ7zLJ6mtA.jpg','1942-08-20',118,'Released','Three people who make life more exciting... love more precious... laughter more joyous!','The Talk of the Town',23159,2.8033,7.3,'LBe02Omuyz0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1745,_binary '\0','/c7Pk9Bu8CczcDKokV7vtsCXTNHm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035419',6.5,3881,'en','Tarzan\'s New York Adventure','Circus owner Buck Rand kidnaps Boy to perform in his show. He forces a pilot to fly him, Boy and his animal trainer out of the jungle. Tarzan and Jane follow them to New York.','/tOt0GhI5McWzEe3MhDOLV4SDuY5.jpg','1942-05-01',71,'Released','You never saw anything like it!','Tarzan\'s New York Adventure',40045,2.7315,6.4,'NtAsQNDCiaA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1746,_binary '\0','/2nKFPGQDMMMW13zyLTmO2M7rMI3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035423',6.4,94755,'en','Kate & Leopold','When her scientist ex-boyfriend discovers a portal to travel through time -- and brings back a 19th-century nobleman named Leopold to prove it -- a skeptical Kate reluctantly takes responsibility for showing Leopold the 21st century. The more time Kate spends with Leopold, the harder she falls for him. But if he doesn\'t return to his own time, his absence will forever alter history.','/fbWYmlGvQXmmZEr4bMeJFjWfFXZ.jpg','2001-12-25',118,'Released','If they lived in the same century, they\'d be perfect for each other.','Kate & Leopold',11232,6.4705,6.357,'lFJywpD2PU4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1747,_binary '\0','/HvIzYYidy1aeI1YhwmaFcS8Z2j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035429',7.5,4903,'en','Went the Day Well?','The quiet village of Bramley End is taken over by German troops posing as Royal Engineers. Their task is to disrupt England\'s radar network in preparation for a full scale German invasion. Once the villagers discover the true identity of the troops, they do whatever they can to thwart the Nazis plans.','/6P9SOdqj4fQf3aYatq95f2g3ME6.jpg','1942-12-07',92,'Released','Went the day well? We died and never knew. But, well or ill, freedom we died for you.','Went the Day Well?',23924,3.9137,7.1,'oJ9Xm9st4Sg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1748,_binary '\0','/2iGtBG5UG3FiTVuKxh6Zlx3FyVY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035431',6.6,1575,'en','This Above All','In 1940 England, aristocratic Prudence Cathaway alarms her snobbish parents by joining the WAF service branch. She soon meets and falls in love with the brooding Clive Briggs, despite his prejudice against the upper classes, and agrees to spend a week with him at a Dover hotel. When Clive\'s soldier friend, Monty, arrives to retrieve him, Prudence learns that Clive went AWOL after Dunkirk, and urges him to recall why England must fight the war.','/aNtMvh4DeuszFSQ5An6muJDDuIE.jpg','1942-05-12',110,'Released','He\'s lost his belief in everything but love.','This Above All',110628,1.5169,6.8,'0FhfLRI4mjA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1749,_binary '\0','/oKCBLyK0LkEwQMEAHAxRtEisXnq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035432',7.3,11784,'en','This Gun for Hire','Sadistic killer-for-hire Philip Raven becomes enraged when his latest job is paid off in marked bills. Vowing to track down his double-crossing boss, nightclub executive Gates, Raven sits beside Gates\' lovely new employee, Ellen, on a train out of town. Although Ellen is engaged to marry the police lieutenant who\'s hunting down Raven, she decides to try and set the misguided hit man straight as he hides from the cops and plots his revenge.','/wfbRnfY1PQTRlDxZ0XEAw5zSeKn.jpg','1942-04-24',81,'Released','A Lone Wolf…dynamite with a girl or a gun!','This Gun for Hire',16703,4.0092,6.967,'GSx-CiuC-QA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1750,_binary '\0','/28vvMlh490bxipmhkbYTQissiof.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035446',8.1,50348,'en','To Be or Not to Be','During the Nazi occupation of Poland, an acting troupe becomes embroiled in a Polish soldier\'s efforts to track down a German spy.','/dDQRpEoyjHT4fzw9cNklIvZuXYg.jpg','1942-03-06',99,'Released','The Picture Everyone Wants to See','To Be or Not to Be',198,5.1798,7.818,'DM4PxOf3OxY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1751,_binary '\0','/gr2mOtuGppXV9wwzWe6nwWbd5yY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035460',6.2,2214,'en','Tortilla Flat','Danny, a poor northern Californian Mexican-American, inherits two houses from his grandfather and is quickly taken advantage of by his vagabond friends.','/fZkx79hMCQ3Q4tlXYPWnDZODW8P.jpg','1942-05-21',105,'Released','THEY\'RE STRONG FOR WINE, WOMEN, AND SONG.','Tortilla Flat',79372,1.7196,5.8,'9p7RR6aFPoE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1752,_binary '\0','/noru5obS1WoXVv9yi0ZPWakzuHN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035489',6.1,1819,'en','The Undying Monster','A werewolf prowls around at night but only kills certain members of one family. It seems like just a coincidence, but the investigating Inspector soon finds out that this tradition has gone on for generations and tries to find a link between the werewolf and the family, leading to a frightening conclusion.','/z3nk09Ydtriv0Gc62MkE59pL1AU.jpg','1942-11-27',64,'Released','LUSTS UPON BEAUTY!','The Undying Monster',28558,1.4438,5.7,'Zle7pmZ1M0g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1753,_binary '\0','/Afd77U95A3RSfl2QStDt75wA7Co.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035521',7.2,2679,'fr','Les Visiteurs du soir','At the end of the 15th century, a man and a woman, posing as traveling minstrels, are sent by the Devil to a castle to seduce its inhabitants.','/yYwXkdfruytUgaGXFvDsZylTfbp.jpg','1942-12-05',121,'Released',NULL,'The Devil\'s Envoys',45000,2.5337,6.805,'7yiEavdILsQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1754,_binary '\0','/g9kAFh9Xp05fQsbv12MbeQGBpxS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035530',6.6,2518,'en','Wake Island','In late 1941, with no hope of relief or re-supply, a small band of United States Marines tries to keep the Japanese Navy from capturing their island base.','/8ytAmQG8E03niY1lqSCHd0w1ghI.jpg','1942-08-11',87,'Released','Leathernecks... writing another glorious chapter of purposeful courage in America\'s history!','Wake Island',43786,1.7041,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1755,_binary '\0','/Ah3uycpxKKKCFVMyUAKg8jrNdrP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035555',7.3,2962,'en','Who Done It?','Two dumb soda jerks dream of writing radio mysteries. When they try to pitch an idea at a radio station, they end up in the middle of a real murder when the station owner is killed during a broadcast.','/6frjQZNXvSbx6LKzp1S9L3yM0wG.jpg','1942-10-30',77,'Released','Shudder through your laughter at the gayest, goofiest manhunt since Abbott and Costello convulsed the screen!','Who Done It?',49092,1.6746,7,'_yILcvT6RC4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1756,_binary '\0','/g6fBL5fvgaIVpILBQJCePZOuse6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035567',7.1,12009,'en','Woman of the Year','Rival reporters Sam Craig and Tess Harding fall in love and get married, only to find their relationship strained when Sam comes to resent Tess\' hectic lifestyle.','/A0Cf2GElBW2UfnQAFUqcqGYV7cY.jpg','1942-02-05',114,'Released','The picture of the year!','Woman of the Year',20640,3.8181,7,'PtQq5CVOG2E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1757,_binary '\0','/dskxBjNFZsn6ThCZ7vAqd5UueEl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035575',7.6,18278,'en','Yankee Doodle Dandy','A film of the life of the renowned musical composer, playwright, actor, dancer and singer George M. Cohan.','/cqLLIyJFjLr6jGOxWVEHG11WGzB.jpg','1942-05-29',126,'Released','Get ready to Laugh, to Sing, to Shout! ...For here comes Uncle Sam\'s Star Spangled Yankee Doodle Dandy!','Yankee Doodle Dandy',3087,2.8106,7,'ionMhYBMpek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1758,_binary '\0','/1jP9oFxWS5EHIrhRp1PM1akDrJI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035583',7.2,4572,'en','You Were Never Lovelier','An Argentine heiress thinks a penniless American dancer is her secret admirer.','/e3X8VDHBHByd2JqV9y0zBY4aHb0.jpg','1942-11-19',97,'Released','Hayworth\'s glowing beauty! Astaire\'s glorious rhythm! Kern\'s greatest score since \"Show Boat\"!','You Were Never Lovelier',43787,3.0097,7.082,'PcyqCTCrpgQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1759,_binary '\0','/iNF9JDWe1tVF0YOhzHczMG5TL6I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035605',6.5,2781,'en','Above Suspicion','Two newlyweds spy on the Nazis for the British Secret Service during their honeymoon in Europe.','/okX71WiiR5SHxKcDpIQf8shJ0c8.jpg','1943-05-31',90,'Released','It happened on a honeymoon!','Above Suspicion',25894,1.8444,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1760,_binary '\0','/4DvQVazlPdXnonF33fHUBXMikMK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035608',7,5063,'en','Action in the North Atlantic','Merchant Marine sailors Joe Rossi (Humphrey Bogart) and Steve Jarvis (Raymond Massey) are charged with getting a supply vessel to Russian allies as part of a sea convoy. When the group of ships comes under attack from a German U-boat, Rossi and Jarvis navigate through dangerous waters to evade Nazi naval forces. Though their mission across the Atlantic is extremely treacherous, they are motivated by the opportunity to strike back at the Germans, who sank one of their earlier ships.','/1FBSnJYFf3FWfgMngCVRajKocpW.jpg','1943-06-12',126,'Released','Warner Bros. thunderous story of the men of the merchant marine!','Action in the North Atlantic',23051,2.8611,7.1,'S1xmbnVO6gU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1761,_binary '\0','/uMJ1LspVhsCIjhN1aidTa56m1gT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035612',7,1297,'en','The Adventures of Tartu','British Captain Terence Stevenson accepts an assignment even more dangerous than his everyday job of defusing undetonated bombs. Fluent in Romanian and German and having studied chemical engineering, he\'s parachuted into Romania to assume the identity of Captain Jan Tartu, a member of the fascist Iron Guard. Tartu makes his way to Czechoslovakia to steal the formula of a new Nazi poison gas and sabotage the factory of its manufacturing.','/6PcwkwhGRs1MDN8nuOdQdAX2KsK.jpg','1943-10-01',91,'Released','A Beautiful Girl! A Dangerous Mission!','The Adventures of Tartu',51791,1.502,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1762,_binary '\0','/7L6SrvZgbTdNdj0lUA9L6C1mjuY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035616',7,4211,'en','Air Force','The crew of an Air Force bomber arrives in Pearl Harbor in the aftermath of the Japanese attack and is sent on to Manila to help with the defense of the Philippines.','/mqH4V49GvANYsu1q4SW4CFUTFZe.jpg','1943-03-20',124,'Released','GIANTS OF THE SKY...blazing a trail to victory!','Air Force',15807,2.5277,6.5,'_Xyol4b9Law','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1763,_binary '\0','/rNVOLQ8iYdnCXwDkPnBivcxKfU8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035617',6.1,1304,'en','Air Raid Wardens','Two bumblers, failures as businessmen and air raid wardens, stumble across a nest of Nazi saboteurs bent on blowing up the local magnesium plant.','/mN0SeFgHJaJWJpVTPkUoGhOWt2y.jpg','1943-04-04',67,'Released','70 Minutes Of Happiness and Hi-Jinks!','Air Raid Wardens',61525,1.8054,7.2,'go0RQF0UvQk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1764,_binary '\0','/47qUuiPY9eYnMJ7H8vcWPecOFYl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035636',7.2,1990,'fr','Les Anges du péché','A well-off young woman decides to become a nun, joining a convent that rehabilitates female prisoners. Through their program, she meets a woman named Thérèse who refuses any help because she says she was innocent of the crime she was convicted for. After being released from prison, Thérèse murders the actual perpetrator of the crime and comes to seek sanctuary in the convent.','/dGSzltZQCBuOVVPlPHOUAi6WxNU.jpg','1943-06-23',86,'Released',NULL,'Angels of Sin',55835,2.3603,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1765,_binary '\0','/5IbHbWXrTJBRptCBzE4fNRY7ja6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035640',4.4,1644,'en','The Ape Man','A scientist is turned into an ape man.','/qtUUVdd716mJwo4PG5gkKsiq6nV.jpg','1943-03-05',64,'Released','No one is safe from the cruel desires of this inhuman fiend!','The Ape Man',37441,1.1989,4.4,'9Mi7beg4ey4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1766,_binary '\0','/trYRISn3s615i19r62uI3rQtjh0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035659',6.4,1843,'en','Background to Danger','An American gets caught up in wartime action in Turkey.','/mepMDzGmh0Fmzq0CuWsNXZTBm6m.jpg','1943-07-03',80,'Released','Love in the midst of intrigue!','Background to Danger',34944,1.5889,6.7,'853zN_Ck5XU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1767,_binary '\0','/i4Uhyno5HzkIfoHTN3sMdU6BtNn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035664',7,3012,'en','Bataan','During Japan\'s invasion of the Philippines in 1942, Capt. Henry Lassiter, Sgt. Bill Dane and a diverse group of American soldiers are ordered to destroy and hold a strategic bridge in order to delay the Japanese forces and allow Gen. MacArthur time to secure Bataan. When the Japanese soldiers begin to rebuild the bridge and advance, the group struggles with not only hunger, sickness and gunfire, but also the knowledge that there is likely no relief on the way.','/gDJ6uGQqDkg45QeyGmHRpkZ8HVS.jpg','1943-06-03',114,'Released','THE STORY OF A PATROL OF 13 HEROES','Bataan',43506,1.7387,6.4,'I1r_Q2HAstA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1768,_binary '\0','/bHxJA9rllKF2jhb11ARAwZJYSp6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035665',6,2812,'en','Batman','Japanese master spy Daka operates a covert espionage-sabotage organization located in Gotham City\'s now-deserted Little Tokyo, which turns American scientists into pliable zombies. The great crime-fighters Batman and Robin, with the help of their allies, are in pursuit.','/AvzD3mrtokIzZOiV6zAG7geIo6F.jpg','1943-07-16',260,'Released','A hundred times more thrilling on the screen!','Batman',125249,2.299,6.2,'kzEpyKuIhkQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1769,_binary '\0','/uto1jAibvYI95DNgMVUBQukVBrP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035703',7.1,3890,'en','Cabin in the Sky','When compulsive gambler Little Joe Jackson dies in a drunken fight, he awakens in purgatory, where he learns that he will be sent back to Earth for six months to prove that he deserves to be in heaven. He awakens, remembering nothing and struggles to do right by his devout wife, Petunia, while an angel known as the General and the devil\'s son, Lucifer Jr., fight for his soul.','/6MSTz2fS8P7ufuCXIHBFpjqW9tr.jpg','1943-03-24',98,'Released','At Last on the Screen! The Musical Comedy Sensation!','Cabin in the Sky',59964,2.05,6.5,'0IT4tTcyOaY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1770,_binary '\0','/dzcelIGAt7YdwB306U7b8neYJxD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035706',6.1,1456,'en','Calling Dr. Death','Losing his memories of the last few days, neurologist Dr. Steele is told that his wife has been brutally murdered. Steele, aware of his conniving wife\'s infidelity, believes he may have been the killer and enlists the aid of his pretty nurse Stella to hypnotize him into recovering his lost memories.','/glvmG9QQ6KQAcHIBy7AkTwDRxqf.jpg','1943-12-17',63,'Released','THE SCREEN\'S FIRST INNER SANCTUM MYSTERY!','Calling Dr. Death',38273,1.1694,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1771,_binary '\0','/kG0HG3Pc9MxkWJyCgGvHy94XuL7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035751',6.7,1763,'en','The Constant Nymph','The daughter of a musical mentor adores a promising composer, who is quite fond of the adolescent. When her father dies, an uncle arrives with his own grown daughter, who begins a romance with the composer which culminates in marriage but creates an emotional rivalry that affects the three.','/1GGP7QOVwcAcNtg775FKB4GDRd5.jpg','1943-06-23',112,'Released','He Tried to Divide His Heart and Broke Theirs','The Constant Nymph',85677,1.7374,6.269,'Mp1pfeKei2Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1772,_binary '\0','/sUvL8Qhl349pRBr4WESwN9LkAYw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035753',7.8,12025,'fr','Le Corbeau','Remy Germain is a doctor in a French town who becomes the focus of a vicious smear campaign, as letters accusing him of having an affair and performing unlawful abortions are mailed to village leaders. The mysterious writer, who signs each letter as \"Le Corbeau\" (The Raven) soon targets the whole town, exposing everyone\'s dark secrets.','/6Oh4hCD2nni5JJpGGIhD3CutfNI.jpg','1943-09-28',92,'Released','One of the Most Discussed Films in the History of French Cinema!','Le Corbeau',29084,2.0203,7.547,'-WEapOCjFBI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1773,_binary '\0','/fn32967cJ0hF8SozyBr9uCbGEzo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035763',6.4,1954,'en','Crash Dive','A US Navy submarine, the USS Corsair, is operating in the North Atlantic, hunting German merchant raiders that are preying on Allied shipping. Its new executive officer, Lt. Ward Stewart, has been transferred back into submarines after commanding his own PT boat. At the submarine base in New London, Connecticut, he asks his new captain, Lt. Cmdr. Dewey Connors, for a weekend leave to settle his affairs before taking up his new assignment. On a train bound for Washington D.C., Stewart accidentally encounters New London school teacher Jean Hewlett and her students. Despite her initial resistance to his efforts, he charms her and they fall in love.','/iiHO2RKRQXLT2FJeHwBOGrgoStX.jpg','1943-04-22',106,'Released','Tyrone Power -- Leading a reckless crew on the war\'s most daring mission!','Crash Dive',74012,1.6255,6.4,'SlcbmDhO2Ms','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000');
INSERT INTO `movies` VALUES (1774,_binary '\0','/gLzqThEthDt7Dn7gX1VtGSMlI9V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035770',7,1373,'en','Cry \'Havoc\'','The Army nurses on Bataan need help badly, but when it arrives, it sure isn\'t what they expected. A motley crew, including a Southern belle, a waitress, and a stripper, show up. Many conflicts arise among these women who are thrown together in what is a desperate and ultimately hopeless situation.','/rqcsC9aNTYpSiiv5R53J9LiGjmW.jpg','1943-11-23',97,'Released','Girls Who Live Dangerously!','Cry \'Havoc\'',72103,1.3811,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1775,_binary '\0','/jQIYDINhr2ioHCZHgmkaIbf0Ui6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035777',6.1,1259,'en','The Dancing Masters','The Dancing Masters is a 1943 Laurel and Hardy feature film. The plot involves the team running a ballet school, and getting involved with an inventor. A young Robert Mitchum has an uncredited cameo role as a fraudulent insurance salesman.','/48gPXhikfcCr4FvMP68fWLZ6EAa.jpg','1943-11-19',63,'Released',NULL,'The Dancing Masters',69017,1.6015,6.257,'QRiR73Ly2-0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1776,_binary '\0','/eLD2tP5JMZLdhTY0NSG0X5K86RH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035784',4.8,1850,'en','Dead Men Walk','When a small town doctor buries his twin brother, a practitioner of the black arts, he believes him dead; but subsequent events force him to realize that his brother has, in fact, returned from the dead as a vampire and is seeking revenge on the doctor, who had killed him in self-defense.','/1AqEIyA6BndGYcNkcUJwXxvEFjq.jpg','1943-04-12',64,'Released','Devil\'s sorcery, as a dead man returns for vengeance!','Dead Men Walk',41023,1.3948,4.6,'tUZzpnIGmlU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1777,_binary '\0','/j7CFSpvPEEwnME8B0nyMBPlKtM0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035795',6.1,2423,'en','Tarzan\'s Desert Mystery','A letter from Jane, who is nursing British troops, asks Tarzan\'s help in obtaining a malaria serum extractable from jungle plants. Tarzan and Boy set out across the desert looking for the plants. Along the way they befriend a stranded American lady magician.','/3Za6bAgQCSnFJ1PlYhltkoUnrSd.jpg','1943-12-26',70,'Released','CHEER as Boy and Cheetah outwit Tarzan\'s captors!','Tarzan\'s Desert Mystery',55871,2.5683,6.1,'hfUL-VGGe_w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1778,_binary '\0','/2AMhRX2RZMbB6aZOrdfMLZkfmrD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035798',6.5,1879,'en','The Desperadoes','Popular mailcoach driver Uncle Willie is in fact in league with the town\'s crooked banker. They plan to have the bank robbed after emptying it, and when Willie\'s choice for this doesn\'t show in time, he gets some local boys to do it. When his man does turn up he decides to stick around, as he is pals with the sheriff and also takes a shine to Willie\'s daughter Allison. This gives the bad men several new problems.','/xNC9av3DgKnNm3Ly5P44blqspOg.jpg','1943-05-25',87,'Released','Red-Blooded Action','The Desperadoes',59882,2.2611,5.903,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1779,_binary '\0','/sYFUT5kIPM9IcLEo5QrgM5HW3iz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035799',7.1,6326,'en','Destination Tokyo','During World War II, Captain Cassidy and his crew of submariners are ordered into Tokyo Bay on a secret mission. They are to gather information in advance of the planned bombing of Tokyo. Along the way, the crew learn about each other as they face the enemy and some of them lose their lives.','/irQLva38syoOiAFCJOrFwykq4f4.jpg','1943-12-31',135,'Released','Explosive ! . . . And As Big As The Broad Pacific !','Destination Tokyo',22871,2.6481,6.9,'VLrRpV6yQg4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1780,_binary '\0','/aKO4Z3sQccq2tFij29A9nVEuCVP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035800',6.3,1456,'en','Destroyer','Flagwaving story of a new American destroyer, the JOHN PAUL JONES, from the day her keel is laid, to what was very nearly her last voyage. Among the crew, is Steve Boleslavski, a shipyard welder that helped build her, who reenlists, with his old rank of Chief bosuns mate. After failing her sea trials, she is assigned to the mail run, until caught up in a disparate battle with a Japanese sub. After getting torpedoed, and on the verge of sinking, the Captain, and crew hatch a plan to try and save the ship, and destroy the sub.','/3BCvOnVaI37dk1HcAGqMxfekqJC.jpg','1943-08-19',99,'Released','You\'ll Always Remember . . . And Never Forget . . . Destroyer','Destroyer',98404,1.5843,6.8,'jgTEwt2hCT0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1781,_binary '\0','/8u1AGJevqZdABsX9mSzArTs3RSS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035829',6.1,1906,'en','Du Barry Was a Lady','Hat check man Louis Blore is in love with nightclub star May Daly. May, however, is in love with a poor dancer but wants to marry for money. When Louis wins the Irish Sweepstakes, he asks May to marry him and she accepts even though she doesn\'t love him. Soon after, Louis has an accident and gets knocked on the head, where he dreams that he\'s King Louis XV pursuing the infamous Madame Du Barry.','/hYeTXHxdWw1UzR62zLE9n88N2dZ.jpg','1943-08-13',101,'Released','THE BIG SHOW is BIGGER THAN EVER!','Du Barry Was a Lady',43508,2.6374,6.5,'yhEyoDXcZs8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1782,_binary '\0','/t2PauqiXhhI0H1cdzeC79DQtdfJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035860',6.6,2166,'en','The Fallen Sparrow','Imprisoned during the Spanish Civil War, John \"Kit\" McKittrick is released when a New York City policeman pulls some strings. Upon returning to America, McKittrick hears that a friend has committed suicide, and he begins to smell a rat. During his investigation, McKittrick questions three beautiful women, one of whom has a tie to his refugee past. Pursued by Nazi operatives, McKittrick learns of the death of another friend, and begins to suspect the dark Dr. Skaas.','/5OhbU7Mfr9gsewp1BtW36tWCcj3.jpg','1943-08-19',94,'Released','No woman was going to play him for a sucker!','The Fallen Sparrow',26533,1.8051,6,'TjiopPetVSU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1783,_binary '\0','/fWna0d9qWw0W1zZjnGhjHH5ympY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035881',6.4,1504,'en','Fires Were Started','British film written and directed by Humphrey Jennings, filmed in documentary style showing the lives of firefighters through the Blitz in World War II.','/A5qsYacdvEZhbLfiz4qtdoYeG6V.jpg','1943-04-12',70,'Released',NULL,'Fires Were Started',84656,1.0916,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1784,_binary '\0','/Y1GoXaPO098QNz25Zv9W7Uvi91.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035884',7.3,7726,'en','Five Graves to Cairo','During the 1942 North African campaign, a British straggler passes as a waiter at the hotel commandeered as Erwin Rommel\'s headquarters. He has thoughts of assassinating Rommel but his cover may provide an even better use.','/sZuSO4VcIzsGWuoQoM6oEyfp1HV.jpg','1943-05-26',96,'Released','Did a Woman Start the Rout of Rommel?','Five Graves to Cairo',60216,3.3002,6.965,'K8-1gYu-4dk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1785,_binary '\0','/3Nvqawmm7gTIHKcz4bVfEyA2btJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035885',6.9,1405,'en','Flesh and Fantasy','Anthology film of three tales of the supernatural. The first story is set at the Mardi Gras in New Orleans. The second involves a psychic who predicts murder. The third is about a man who literally meets the girl of his dreams.','/3SX9WUR5QCDOmRsTeIkYWRTXmqk.jpg','1943-10-29',93,'Released','The motion picture above all!','Flesh and Fantasy',116712,1.799,7.1,'5QdToO2qmtw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1786,_binary '\0','/pzLZHOPZPy3aBmakttW5Mo6M76V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035896',6.8,11244,'en','For Whom the Bell Tolls','Spain in the 1930s is the place to be for a man of action like Robert Jordan. There is a civil war going on and Jordan—who has joined up on the side that appeals most to idealists of that era—has been given a high-risk assignment up in the mountains. He awaits the right time to blow up a crucial bridge in order to halt the enemy\'s progress.','/uoNTHrpeOgIuWsC5Eucx5Sp483D.jpg','1943-07-12',170,'Released','Thunderous! Tender! Touching!','For Whom the Bell Tolls',27854,3.6748,6.5,'-B3MQoKQ_vI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1787,_binary '\0','/ykbk7an62qpgHxwEz16XXKNvXRd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035899',6.4,11142,'en','Frankenstein Meets the Wolf Man','After being resurrected by grave robbers, Larry Talbot searches for Dr. Frankenstein in the hopes of being cured of his lycanthropy. The mad scientist may turn out to be dead, but his monster is just waiting to be found…','/eitxewmvmZXY7qoKpiVhdaFmwMz.jpg','1943-03-12',74,'Released','A death fight between two beasts!','Frankenstein Meets the Wolf Man',3076,3.1414,6.2,'_Kaa88LIwJo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1788,_binary '\0','/58omzraCM2cF9w8pRIUW0ClYxRb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035916',6.6,2247,'en','The Gang\'s All Here','A soldier falls for a chorus girl and then experiences trouble when he is posted to the Pacific.','/c8ayiYlqLkGAOYacaxX1hWm9ZX9.jpg','1943-12-24',103,'Released','What a gang of song hits!','The Gang\'s All Here',67967,2.4878,5.872,'mxJJqr9hpMI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1789,_binary '\0','/ehfFDOhTA0KgCVpuvAXgSCgaUhe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035937',6.6,4199,'en','The Ghost Ship','Captain Stone\'s newly recruited officer, Tom Merriam, idolizes his senior who treats him like a friend. But when a couple of his crew members die mysteriously, Tom starts doubting Stone\'s authority.','/ix6GofmJIfZYUk3uw9OK0JrpXeB.jpg','1943-12-16',69,'Released','MYSTERY TERROR!','The Ghost Ship',40765,1.5633,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1790,_binary '\0','/diFpqZLCBH5wsjAi0GXej7EFZu2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035939',5,1748,'en','Ghosts on the Loose','The East Side Kids try to fix up a house for newlyweds, but find the place next door \"haunted\" by mysterious men.','/fOzkfqjMTIrOqfqQUgnMZGz7uKN.jpg','1943-07-30',67,'Released','You\'ll yell with glee when these happy-go-lucky hooligans invade the shivery domain of the Man of a Thousand Horrors! It\'s Chill-arious!','Ghosts on the Loose',90695,1.7419,4.2,'_9Ni7NcPPp4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1791,_binary '\0','/3C7soqWQdNKcQuM26YfpOFc6vTj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035942',6.8,2488,'en','Girl Crazy','Rich kid Danny Churchill has a taste for wine, women and song, but not for higher education. So his father ships him to an all-male college out West where there\'s not supposed to be a female for miles. But before Danny arrives, he spies a pair of legs extending out from under a stalled roadster. They belong to the Dean\'s granddaughter, Ginger Gray, who is more interested in keeping the financially strapped college open than falling for Danny\'s romantic line. At least at first...','/wPPmitiYoZlbqaNYqLZfG8O4Rzc.jpg','1943-11-26',99,'Released','The Big Musical with Broadway Flair and a Western Air!','Girl Crazy',40916,1.5599,5.66,'0ZQ1BliOtns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1792,_binary '\0','/tNR7QDdMoiS9CMGITknnuWvb5Q8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035957',6.6,2452,'en','Guadalcanal Diary','Concentrating on the personal lives of those involved, a war correspondent takes us through the preparations, landing and initial campaign on Guadalcanal during WWII.','/7xe6JK2JyKmByPRsI5PPIv6EuJC.jpg','1943-10-27',93,'Released','The Victory picture of the year !','Guadalcanal Diary',43510,2.9548,5.6,'3IaWMVI0aig','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1793,_binary '\0','/kQMnOcQbVTB4OZa9CHmkmkXIEJ5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035958',6,1820,'en','Gung Ho!','A true-life epic that revolves around an exclusive bataillon of the U.S. Marine Corps during World War II, \"Carlson\'s Raiders,\" whose assignment is to take control of a South Pacific island once possessed by the United States but now under Japanese command.','/juyMhRpiAsYDfOqeFWjA4qd4Ui5.jpg','1943-12-20',88,'Released','U.S. Marine Raiders in Action...Blasting Their Way To Tokyo!','Gung Ho!',18562,1.9867,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1794,_binary '\0','/cez9he2zb0Jv2AdLhdxcpVph5FS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035959',6.9,3301,'en','A Guy Named Joe','A cocky U.S. Army Air Force pilot stationed in England during World War II falls for a daring female flier. After he\'s killed on a mission, he\'s sent back to Earth by a heavenly General with a new assignment.','/rrdaUol9hZEde4HloyVuG860OH7.jpg','1944-02-25',120,'Released','A guy—a gal—a pal—it’s swell!','A Guy Named Joe',43306,2.9311,6.7,'kRKRb7qjCus','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1795,_binary '\0','/vzNbENKGeqgqrhvJRrItBCzby2r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035962',6.6,1509,'en','The Halfway House','A group of travellers, each with a personal problem that they want to hide, arrive at a mysterious Welsh country inn. There is a certain strangeness in the air as they are greeted by the innkeeper and his daughter. Why are all the newspapers a year old? And why doesn\'t Gwyneth seem to cast a shadow?','/83t2y4X8eeUccI6yi66hgYcNBSu.jpg','1944-04-02',95,'Released',NULL,'The Halfway House',103863,1.558,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1796,_binary '\0','/7rL5tbuSmtpKeLAKcBTqQwmXAGj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035966',7.4,7463,'en','Hangmen Also Die!','During the Nazi occupation of Czechoslovakia, surgeon Dr. Franticek Svoboda, a Czech patriot, assassinates the brutal \"Hangman of Europe\", Reichsprotektor Reinhard Heydrich, and is wounded in the process. In his attempt to escape, he is helped by history professor Stephen Novotny and his daughter Mascha.','/d9J86BpP7NLreJJ9VCbr1SDMRii.jpg','1943-04-01',134,'Released','The shot heard \'round the world!','Hangmen Also Die!',22178,2.422,6.9,'1bjwQgSEoyo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1797,_binary '\0','/lbteQYPmjk1FpdHnMb69Gt85aip.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035979',7.3,13590,'en','Heaven Can Wait','Spoiled playboy Henry van Cleve dies and arrives at the entrance to Hell, a final destination he is sure he deserves after living a life of profligacy. The devil, however, isn\'t so sure Henry meets Hell\'s standards. Convinced he is where he belongs, Henry recounts his life\'s deeds, both good and bad, including an act of indiscretion during his 25-year marriage to his wife, Martha, with the hope that \"His Excellency\" will arrive at the proper judgment.','/m4kM8PSYhUbZAsfmFu5WrSgGDUg.jpg','1943-08-05',112,'Released','He believed in Love… Honor… and Obey – That Impulse!','Heaven Can Wait',18727,2.9777,6.9,'MWpndF2aI4g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1798,_binary '\0','/lVkYUyVB3BTOyuC8nHzSMRftKL9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0035980',6.2,1227,'en','The Heavenly Body','The beautiful wife of a tweedy astronomer becomes convinced that her astrologer\'s prediction of a new dream man in her life will come true.','/AnvEFtyMht2TenJR9TF9As6sPPW.jpg','1944-03-23',95,'Released','There\'s something new under the moon!','The Heavenly Body',33049,1.724,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1799,_binary '\0','/l5erPPTVBpRBp2TmdhhSZa8ERFS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036004',6.7,1876,'en','Hit the Ice','After Flash Fulton and Weejie McCoy take pictures of a bank robbery, they\'re lured to the mountain resort hideout of the robbers, where they meet an old friend and his band.','/euD92LQwQet1qZ68Jn5Y6qxHqnz.jpg','1943-06-02',82,'Released','IT\'S THE Daffiest, Happiest SLEIGH RIDE YOU\'VE EVER BEEN TAKEN ON!','Hit the Ice',33484,1.8869,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1800,_binary '\0','/rwloZ4Z2aX7hJiitjkPOgv7xbrb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036022',7,2812,'en','The Human Comedy','Teenager Homer Macauley stays at home in the small town of Ithaca, California to support his family while his older brother Marcus prepares to go to war.','/rHOLe1QIQn7NVdvqvkrC3z88f7R.jpg','1943-03-02',118,'Released','Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer\'s Great Production','The Human Comedy',48993,1.9136,6.2,'36_8a1E3mYs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1801,_binary '\0','/bCyK6eETwA6kzxLxDDuwJ3l7Wdw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036027',7,15660,'en','I Walked with a Zombie','A nurse in the Caribbean turns to voodoo in hopes of curing her patient, a mindless woman whose husband she\'s fallen in love with.','/uoyBR8XNxPQRojujtczfG1qJezY.jpg','1943-04-21',69,'Released','She\'s alive…yet dead! She\'s dead…yet alive!','I Walked with a Zombie',27130,2.9993,6.8,'R0NhhvTNND0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1802,_binary '\0','/jS8ADXQOTmca4jnCh0hPzNj9EBX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036038',6.4,1761,'en','In Old Oklahoma','Cowboy Dan Somers and oilman Jim \"Hunk\" Gardner compete for oil lease rights on Indian land in Oklahoma, as well as for the favors of schoolteacher Cathy Allen.','/eGbzSYoVFEfQBepFnlqmBIFRQsk.jpg','1943-12-06',102,'Released','BATTLE-HEAT! Untamed men clash in a well of violence!','In Old Oklahoma',40719,2.9982,6.234,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1803,_binary '\0','/c8i981BEeADEktP9UMQV49AWHcP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036055',6.2,1560,'en','Jitterbugs','The two-man Laurel and Hardy Zoot Suit Band find themselves fronting a scam for \"gasolene pills\" in wartime oil-short America. They are however soon on the side of the angels helping recover $10,000 for an attractive young lady whose family have themselves been swindled.','/nxODaNXqdDtavloCtPwiotVjok6.jpg','1943-06-05',75,'Released','This is that movie about those people.','Jitterbugs',71098,1.8162,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1804,_binary '\0','/gCIl56BfKLCKaHbBLNLV4AH16af.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036092',6.3,1658,'en','A Lady Takes a Chance','A city girl on a bus tour of the West encounters a handsome rodeo cowboy who helps her forget her city suitors.','/p4O4d4y1LXxN8wb0jcEVj01JPzr.jpg','1943-08-19',86,'Released','IT\'S SCREWY...And So Funny! IT\'S RIOTOUS...And Romantic!','A Lady Takes a Chance',65503,1.8748,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1805,_binary '\0','/4gK5qOPkucuT2qQP4sEu73lJXes.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036094',6.2,3237,'en','Lady of Burlesque','After one member of their group is murdered, the performers at a burlesque house must work together to find out who the killer is before they strike again.','/bng9HQoCP4i62cKHK0E1EoqZu0X.jpg','1943-05-01',91,'Released','Mirth! Murder! Melody! Mystery! and Girls! Girls! Girls!','Lady of Burlesque',50001,1.851,5.4,'IOibSeDyrMo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1806,_binary '\0','/yzf3b8zFC2ol90eGL0VySETR94K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036098',7.1,6505,'en','Lassie Come Home','Hard times come for the Carraclough family and they are forced to sell their dog, Lassie, to the rich Duke of Rudling. Lassie, however, is unwilling to remain apart from young Carraclough son Joe and sets out on a long and dangerous journey to rejoin him.','/boMs7uR8yJEnHKSvzkszS6eenmz.jpg','1943-12-01',88,'Released','A Thrilling Saga Of Courage And Loyalty !','Lassie Come Home',2202,3.4567,6.724,'X2NdRILPXYg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1807,_binary '\0','/vff5LIVaj7D9984GwxAIKNWQN7u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036104',6.7,6597,'en','The Leopard Man','When a leopard escapes during a publicity stunt, it triggers a series of murders.','/aqgX4T8tnOXQjoZcQ1pHR9MnnyL.jpg','1943-05-08',66,'Released','Woman alone the victims of strange, savage killer!','The Leopard Man',28438,2.1362,6.5,'6q4BAKYYGoM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1808,_binary '\0','/ojYxYkbO939H9OSayf5IKvbFA6i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036112',8,18469,'en','The Life and Death of Colonel Blimp','General Candy, who\'s overseeing an English squad in 1943, is a veteran leader who doesn\'t have the respect of the men he\'s training and is considered out-of-touch with what\'s needed to win the war. But it wasn\'t always this way. Flashing back to his early career in the Boer War and World War I, we see a dashing young officer whose life has been shaped by three different women, and by a lasting friendship with a German soldier.','/kgyd5uyndsXiLYKlVgH0sm7Jfkv.jpg','1943-07-26',163,'Released','An unforgettable story of forty gallant years.','The Life and Death of Colonel Blimp',25037,3.8095,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1809,_binary '\0','/fGSYPxh8MG2HQMtUZ2pLimQbXRH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036126',7.2,3664,'en','Madame Curie','Poor physics student Marie is studying at the Sorbonne in 1890s Paris. One of the few women studying in her field, Marie encounters skepticism concerning her abilities, but is eventually offered a research placement in Pierre Curie\'s lab. The scientists soon fall in love and embark on a shared quest to extract, from a particular type of rock, a new chemical element they have named radium. However, their research puts them on the brink of professional failure.','/mUKThJeC2WESwXfKf6tcAZn0B2g.jpg','1943-12-16',124,'Released','MR. and MRS. MINIVER together again','Madame Curie',37631,2.3375,7.2,'Y3vz1k9OCKo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1810,_binary '\0','/mfpEeay0jKf84zgx1wjkLnW9WyD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036135',6.5,1836,'en','The Man in Grey','After marrying a dour and disinterested lord for status, a young woman falls in love with a stage actor while her best friend from boarding school enters an affair with her husband.','/byqKdKW2XgVoQ1nhJYEuzAuyYwV.jpg','1943-08-06',116,'Released','The most daring novel of the century lives on the screen','The Man in Grey',41996,2.26,6.1,'bvDdJI9-7os','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1811,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036152',7.4,2124,'en','The Memphis Belle','This WW2 documentary centers on the crew of the American B-17 Flying Fortress Memphis Belle as it prepares to execute a strategic bombing raid on Nazi submarine pens in Wilhelmshaven, Germany.','/nB3fVpM6JumgiyeuL59Ht1FfzI5.jpg','1944-04-13',45,'Released','Fly and Fight with the Crew on an Actual Bombing Mission Over Germany!','The Memphis Belle',41355,1.1884,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1812,_binary '\0','/sfFGalNqZmPDJ2mci9LqDaAxoe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036160',6.8,1273,'en','Millions Like Us','When Celia Crowson is called up for war service, she hopes for a glamorous job in one of the services, but as a single girl, she is directed into a factory making aircraft parts. Here she meets other girls from all different walks of life and begins a relationship with a young airman.','/NiSpyRbNhG2Vgojqf4PTKZD1en.jpg','1943-06-01',103,'Released',NULL,'Millions Like Us',54391,1.4528,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1813,_binary '\0','/hzrlJClyJLv1RZTRPEP6sFDFB90.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036172',7.6,8444,'en','The More the Merrier','It\'s World War II and there is a severe housing shortage everywhere - especially in Washington, D.C. where Connie Milligan rents an apartment. Believing it to be her patriotic duty, Connie offers to sublet half of her apartment, fully expecting a suitable female tenent. What she gets instead is mischievous, middle-aged Benjamin Dingle. Dingle talks her into subletting to him and then promptly sublets half of his half to young, irreverent Joe Carter - creating a situation tailor-made for comedy and romance.','/hkwpXQh3rNJWooaFXwZ0tVxmqF2.jpg','1943-05-13',104,'Released','The only picture with a DINGLE!','The More the Merrier',80616,3.0615,6.985,'CDGJmpeyOF8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1814,_binary '\0','/rKIaKc1XL0rGhe0zskKLesZxRZO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036174',7.1,3992,'en','Mr. Lucky','A conman poses as a war relief fundraiser, but when he falls for a charity worker, his conscience begins to trouble him.','/bNwlZCUuueYydkgVL5bcfrYKRNl.jpg','1943-07-01',100,'Released','\"You\'re society. I\' m just one of the mob. To you a guy like me is poison!\"','Mr. Lucky',47352,2.8411,7.2,'5Qiiet3stUU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1815,_binary '\0','/gWxdFCQ8ius5aAdfuwEZM0eeRF0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036191',7,2420,'de','Münchhausen','Legendary, immortal nobleman Baron Munchausen regales a lovestruck woman with tales of his amazing adventures.','/74Ua1d5l7X3HdaBPsq1MYjfiMI.jpg','1943-03-05',116,'Released',NULL,'Münchhausen',11627,1.6489,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1816,_binary '\0','/3DZNqqZvQtXxMfXgKDpSAy731RQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036203',6.7,1625,'en','A Night to Remember','A woman rents a gloomy basement apartment in Greenwich Village thinking it will provide the perfect atmosphere for her mystery writer husband to create his next book. They soon find themselves in the middle of a real-life mystery when a corpse turns up in their apartment.','/mVHxgQk13KUMETPLf7GPgG8sObv.jpg','1942-12-10',88,'Released','Startling in Mystery and Laughs!','A Night to Remember',77121,2.1671,6.7,'zxKDF7_NLgo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1817,_binary '\0','/1haQQxFWUYi4dGqJsaGyrjeUuWp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036208',6.7,1249,'en','No Time for Love','An upper-class female reporter is (despite herself) attracted to a hulking laborer digging a tunnel under the Hudson River.','/r90d1LX8yc5E76OfUzaVchUBVTd.jpg','1943-04-09',83,'Released','SHE COULD BE A LOT OF WOMAN IF SHE GOT THE URGE...and she wouldn\'t need much urging!','No Time for Love',32120,2.0124,7,'yUFR2-BQpv0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1818,_binary '\0','/wa4DU11AeIAUCGOuXV9RbpSckIU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036217',5.9,2124,'en','The North Star','A Ukrainian village must suddenly contend with the Nazi invasion of June 1941. Later re-edited and released as \"Armored Attack.\"','/zENGbNnvBLJNOHxRYpQBoSiX3Ku.jpg','1943-11-04',108,'Released','A rolling wall of hell that couldn\'t be stopped... A handful of men who had to stop it!','The North Star',48127,2.0544,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1819,_binary '\0','/wNd9bieBmmdMzCOPnHSjG8LUA23.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036218',6.6,1782,'en','Northern Pursuit','Canadian Mountie Steve Wagner captures a German Luftwaffe officer on a spy mission, who later escapes from the prison camp. To catch the spy ring, the Mounties employ a ruse so that the spies, believing Steve to be sympathetic, enlist him in their plans.','/2tLScsS98Q9rohkX13guzsnTjIB.jpg','1943-11-07',93,'Released','A woman\'s lips set the frozen north aflame.','Northern Pursuit',55239,1.9524,6.173,'HIB5XYtbl-g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1820,_binary '\0','/6uhE8RZeyDYXqnj3GkEhwmn77R4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036230',7.4,4318,'en','Old Acquaintance','Two writers, friends since childhood, fight over their books and lives.','/i6WIEpY81sXFtCQ5lp88i5XlAdn.jpg','1943-11-27',110,'Released','\"I know what every woman expects from love ...AND WHAT SHE ACCEPTS IF SHE IS WISE!\"','Old Acquaintance',55086,1.5589,7.1,'N6GzZZBs9hM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1821,_binary '\0','/fAntrAMgfQTJ1c3mMR0g2eQvAkp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036241',5.4,5446,'en','The Outlaw','Newly appointed sheriff Pat Garrett is pleased when his old friend Doc Holliday arrives in Lincoln, New Mexico on the stage. Doc is trailing his stolen horse, and it is discovered in the possession of Billy the Kid. In a surprising turnaround, Billy and Doc become friends. This causes the friendship between Doc and Pat to cool. The odd relationship between Doc and Billy grows stranger when Doc hides Billy at his girl Rio\'s place after Billy is shot.','/xqnPtCdL0gF5MvexVeVN1aimWg2.jpg','1943-02-05',116,'Released','Tall.... Terrific.... and Trouble!','The Outlaw',22613,3.1685,5.4,'Gnjv3ONSa9o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1822,_binary '\0','/dmmiwTfk4AraKkK8DwmrXYas5rS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036244',8,27555,'en','The Ox-Bow Incident','A posse discovers a trio of men they suspect of murder and cow theft and are split between handing them over to the law or lynching them on the spot.','/1rzmL32QaewQbpO1zbhZKMDn5Gz.jpg','1943-03-11',76,'Released','Lynch law rules the mob!','The Ox-Bow Incident',980,4.4131,7.7,'hKd34tmlqko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1823,_binary '\0','/xDZ0wxgtOcJaba5fxhYptsHZsK4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036260',7.2,6613,'en','Phantom Lady','A devoted secretary embarks on a dangerous mission to try to find the elusive woman who may prove her boss didn\'t murder his wife.','/pSPH9NlSVbXIfBA8DLRRET3YBBc.jpg','1944-01-28',87,'Released','A Night He Couldn\'t Forget With a Woman He Couldn\'t Remember.','Phantom Lady',37992,2.2886,6.96,'zGkmWKefVn8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1824,_binary '\0','/2tEBEAZ8rRQYBQrsLVYPahIBc05.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036261',6.4,9403,'en','Phantom of the Opera','Following a tragic accident that leaves him disfigured, crazed composer Erique Claudin transformed into a masked phantom who schemes to make beautiful young soprano Christine Dubois the star of the opera and wreak revenge on those who stole his music.','/2C8aHB3xnN8LvlsNLHKumBXzgVu.jpg','1943-08-12',89,'Released','The screen\'s classic of terror!','Phantom of the Opera',15855,4.2498,6.2,'TfSj1dd6qmM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1825,_binary '\0','/1nlvONHy9wPAb1X8UYFfZqLQp0t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036275',6.8,1464,'en','Presenting Lily Mars','Starstruck Indiana small-town girl Lily is pestering theatrical producer John Thornway for a role but he is reluctant.','/ppfKrq4YzVS0ePgIWR5xZgWei41.jpg','1943-04-29',104,'Released','Sing out the news! It\'s a honey of a show!','Presenting Lily Mars',43512,1.7962,6.4,'-2gxW7D1bLU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1826,_binary '\0','/4Prl7DDqIiI28rcvbvxypUCuOaF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036277',6.7,1686,'en','Princess O\'Rourke','A down-to-earth pilot charms a European princess on vacation in the United States.','/8ELqUEit0clvoFdEMJjk0N9xRlp.jpg','1943-10-23',94,'Released','She came from a Royal Line but his Line was better!','Princess O\'Rourke',33039,1.455,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1827,_binary '\0','/e3U2mnT9JPyruXEKi78TWmRN0I2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036323',7.5,11180,'en','Sahara','In Libya, an American tank commander, along with a handful of Allied soldiers, tries to defend an isolated well with a limited supply of water from a German Afrika Korps battalion during the Western Desert Campaign of World War II.','/roVIPqVLMdvs7uOcqDuwO891t8s.jpg','1943-09-22',97,'Released','Their dramatic story can now be told!','Sahara',18783,2.8772,7.233,'15PMPdCeT-8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1828,_binary '\0','/jbYovrQd2gHckrBmkyGCkWd6UEa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036341',6.7,9046,'en','The Seventh Victim','After young Mary Gibson discovers that her older sister Jacqueline has disappeared, she leaves her boarding school and heads to New York City to track down her sibling. But Mary gets drawn deeper into the mystery.','/cvck16EWDqWK6x4p78N8KyJyJNJ.jpg','1943-08-21',71,'Released','Weird pagan rites in secret dens of exotic mystery! Beauty enslaved to a creed of Evil! Loveliness at bay behind a mask of Terror... See the strangest thrills on record!','The Seventh Victim',20945,2.3454,6.426,'P9H7rUJi7NQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1829,_binary '\0','/1p78xI6mywlqhb3tfw6oTJt7X3t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036342',7.7,76113,'en','Shadow of a Doubt','In sleepy Santa Rosa, restless young Charlie’s world brightens when her sophisticated Uncle Charlie arrives for a long visit. But as his behavior grows increasingly strange, she begins to suspect that her beloved uncle may be hiding a terrible secret—and that danger has quietly entered her home.','/ptyWagbWE8jSGyV2tGEzAdVbRCj.jpg','1943-01-15',108,'Released','What horror did her secret life hold… that made her dread this man of her dreams?','Shadow of a Doubt',21734,7.1331,7.494,'d9p3xKsckgY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1830,_binary '\0','/kqWgweplPO9t0uNixBSHq63tJD1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036348',6.9,5795,'en','Sherlock Holmes Faces Death','During WWII several murders occur at a convalescent home where Dr. Watson has volunteered his services. He summons Holmes for help and the master detective proceeds to solve the crime from a long list of suspects including the owners of the home, the staff and the patients recovering there.','/paDmNVK9C7SwAWrfiR32Nh3GvjM.jpg','1943-09-17',68,'Released',NULL,'Sherlock Holmes Faces Death',50553,2.8146,6.875,'kXzEP_efCys','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1831,_binary '\0','/muoXo3P15X4iIrP6TzLIK34TY7b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036349',6.6,5338,'en','Sherlock Holmes in Washington','In World War II, a British secret agent carrying a vitally important document is kidnapped en route to Washington. The British government calls on Sherlock Holmes to recover it.','/ni0H8iNOcmW26Y0aNLiA4wyckxX.jpg','1943-03-24',71,'Released','The Mystery Master in America!','Sherlock Holmes in Washington',44383,2.4621,6.764,'1Hxw-OWdoyQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1832,_binary '\0','/wSdYIGrH67alXUp41KenYIS4QR5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036363',6.3,1328,'en','The Sky\'s the Limit','Flying Tiger Fred Atwell sneaks away from his famous squadron\'s personal appearance tour and goes incognito for several days of leave. He quickly falls for photographer Joan Manion, pursuing her in the guise of a carefree drifter.','/3JyoLIc6Okuyl2aZh0EwpmkwW7s.jpg','1943-07-13',89,'Released','Here\'s a thrill, new and gay! It\'s a dance filled holiday!','The Sky\'s the Limit',43515,1.9536,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1833,_binary '\0','/lrMaqHSDAoKh1tAgNTw8sIccxLa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036367',7.4,2302,'en','So Proudly We Hail','During the start of the Pacific campaign in World War II, Lieutenant Janet Davidson is the head of a group of U.S. military nurses who are trapped behind enemy lines in the Philippines. Davidson tries to keep up the spirits of her staff, which includes Lieutenants Joan O\'Doul and Olivia D\'Arcy. They all seek to maintain a sense of normal life, including dating, while under constant danger as they tend to wounded soldiers.','/1HELEee7lRd1ul37F4tQCRbGOiX.jpg','1943-09-09',126,'Released','The First Great Love Story of Our Women at the Fighting Front!','So Proudly We Hail',150778,2.7415,5.9,'WNdTBYzmqxg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1834,_binary '\0','/ak5VIS2bBDaDOglqTz7gWyhTrMn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036376',6,7141,'en','Son of Dracula','Carpathian Count Alucard is invited to the U.S. by a young heiress. Her boyfriend and local officials are suspicious of the newcomer, who is interested in the \"virile\" soil of the new world.','/pQTLdJ46WXPIix05EkcHAMDKUIw.jpg','1943-10-20',80,'Released','BLOOD on his lips...! DOOM in his eyes...! an accursed VAMPIRE!','Son of Dracula',32023,2.6402,5.8,'WwQHsHIM41o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1835,_binary '\0','/5gxdMOVSzWNVNSjDPzQGwP6xAed.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036377',7.6,8525,'en','The Song of Bernadette','In 1858 Lourdes, France, adolescent peasant Bernadette has a vision of \"a beautiful lady\" in the Massabielle grotto - the townspeople assume this lady to be the Virgin Mary. Pompous government officials think the girl is insane, doing their best to suppress her and her followers, while the church wants nothing to do with the matter. But as Bernadette attracts wider and wider attention, the phenomenon overtakes everyone in the town, ultimately transforming their lives.','/kRZItSgFaSDnHePwxX5PfZvu5M8.jpg','1943-12-21',156,'Released','Here is greatness... wonder... and majesty... no human words can describe!','The Song of Bernadette',43516,4.862,7.1,'X9WCV7sCa2k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1836,_binary '\0','/utUHP8oG2HfdKaJpFdFiqsPD2RX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036384',6.3,1943,'en','Stage Door Canteen','A young soldier on a pass in New York City visits the famed Stage Door Canteen, where famous stars of theatre and film appear and host a recreational center for servicemen during the war. The soldier meets a pretty young hostess and they enjoy the many entertainers and a growing romance.','/1pUUs6kVSXz1x06coXhX2qZYjWA.jpg','1943-06-24',132,'Released','YOU\'VE HEARD ABOUT IT! READ ABOUT IT! NOW *SEE* THE WORLD\'S GREATEST ENTERTAINMENT HIT!','Stage Door Canteen',38726,2.2169,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1837,_binary '\0','/g37wmZiu8SChyFxQs1JBUZXgTWr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036391',7.3,3236,'en','Stormy Weather','The relationship between an aspiring dancer and a popular songstress provides a retrospective of the great African-American entertainers of the early 1900s.','/d6XpJ69jXvP5WXzVsKVR4rUJhe1.jpg','1943-07-21',78,'Released','They Set Basin Street to Broadway Ablaze With Sizzling Songs and Hot Rhythm!','Stormy Weather',43513,1.5712,6.8,'HNHp4x2E4b4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1838,_binary '\0','/90drEOLZlOjNKRWwfCikeTduQEh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036395',7.1,1221,'en','A Stranger in Town','In the small town of Crownport local attorney Bill Adams is trying to break up the ring of corrupt town officials by running for mayor. The cards seemed stacked against him when he gets help from a visiting hunter who, unknown to Adams and the rest of the town, is actually vacationing supreme court justice John Josephus Grant.','/avVfGnYdiDjj4nRt1OrHyJY3O4J.jpg','1943-04-01',67,'Released','You\'ll Take Him Into Your Heart!','A Stranger in Town',194516,1.5389,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1839,_binary '\0','/vRhJdWkTuiBgV2FwWKDOaJNK6Nb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036400',6.7,6345,'ja','姿三四郎','A hotheaded youth in 1880s Meiji Japan apprentices to judo master Shōgorō Yano, trading brute jujutsu bravado for discipline and humility. As Sanshirō matures, he proves judo’s spirit against old-guard challengers—including a deadly duel—while falling for his vanquished opponent’s daughter. Based on the novel by Tsuneo Tomita, son of Tomita Tsunejirō, the earliest disciple of judo.','/vmQV7lDO8hCaU6tuKhF3b9gFs4f.jpg','1943-03-25',97,'Released',NULL,'Sanshiro Sugata',35022,2.8192,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1840,_binary '\0','/y5F20uzZKDt5FzQFuGv2fEqVtbS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036414',6.2,2591,'en','Tarzan Triumphs','Zandra, white princess of a lost civilization, comes to Tarzan for help when Nazis invade the jungle with plans to conquer her people and take their wealth. Tarzan, the isolationist, becomes involved after the Nazis shoot at him and capture Boy: \"Now Tarzan make war!\"','/kW131tphE6YLG1uAN3bNm50ka6o.jpg','1943-01-20',76,'Released','A new beautiful beauty arouses Tarzan\'s fighting heart!','Tarzan Triumphs',55860,3.234,6.2,'tWnPpXbgHEk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1841,_binary '\0','/yG91RiprmrXxGYBSKRvc3Iz0DAS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036422',6.7,2339,'en','Thank Your Lucky Stars','An Eddie Cantor look-alike organizes an all-star show to help the war effort.','/rVqCzzIBN38e1r4ZcbNlaziE4Bg.jpg','1943-09-25',127,'Released','A thousand shows in one!','Thank Your Lucky Stars',43514,1.7721,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1842,_binary '\0','/p9vb0XpMVPZEJoJxmoh9G2vi2Ni.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036430',5.8,1491,'en','This Is the Army','In WW I dancer Jerry Jones stages an all-soldier show on Broadway, called Yip Yip Yaphank. Wounded in the War, he becomes a producer. In WW II his son Johnny Jones, who was before his fathers assistant, gets the order to stage a knew all-soldier show, called THIS IS THE ARMY. But in his pesonal life he has problems, because he refuses to marry his fiancée until the war is over.','/2zBY2WMlhQDd1t24RHvEBz055qT.jpg','1943-08-14',121,'Released','It\'s your own army - in the army\'s own show!','This Is the Army',43517,2.5397,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1843,_binary '\0','/sWZfaaUoZ8MvC9egX2uqP9trlwq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036431',7.6,4288,'en','This Land Is Mine','Somewhere in Europe, in a city occupied by the Nazis, a gentle school teacher finds himself torn between collaboration and resistance, cowardice and courage.','/lrzTlL50vFQhq9cvsuZvCYLPOcq.jpg','1943-05-07',103,'Released',NULL,'This Land Is Mine',45220,3.1376,7.1,'og2quk1a3gM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1844,_binary '\0','/69Ha8P7zR7iFbyXhsUoLrrnTaZA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036432',6.2,1287,'en','Thousands Cheer','Acrobat Eddie Marsh is in the army now. His first act is to become friendly with Kathryn Jones, the colonel\'s pretty daughter. Their romance hits a few snags, including disapproval from her father. Eddie\'s also plagued by fear of having an accident during his family\'s trapeze act in the army variety show, which also features a gallery of MGM stars.','/7YFjle5GLmpU7xajOVH25TH8ljU.jpg','1943-09-13',126,'Released','LOVE STORY of an army camp','Thousands Cheer',43518,1.5944,6.4,'Qaceo-J7-M4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1845,_binary '\0','/8FhAKRTrTLsJfXOkWL6odZeb0M1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036443',6.1,2077,'de','Titanic','In 1912, the Titanic embarks on its inevitable collision course with history. In the wake of the over-spending required to build the largest luxury ship in the world, White Star Line executive Sir Bruce Ismay schemes to reverse the direction of his company\'s plummeting stock value. Onboard the Titanic, brave German 1st Officer Petersen struggles to convince his self-important British superiors not to overexert the ship\'s engines.','/Al7oIXQ4dZAofBTZWm6OiXS3MEa.jpg','1943-09-24',88,'Released',NULL,'Titanic',11021,2.1489,6.1,'qX1HVonpEPw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1846,_binary '\0','/e8xNmmkolNOc8FBKWha19Q6eL4u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036497',6.4,1424,'en','Victory Through Air Power','Based on the book by Major Alexander de Seversky\'s about his theories of the practical uses of long range strategic bombing. Using a combination of animation humorously telling about the development of air warfare, the film shows de Seversky illustrating his ideas of how air power could win World War II for the Allies.','/7uHtN8sAlVsSbTZOvhGV8iTEfGk.jpg','1943-07-17',65,'Released','There\'s a Thrill in the Air!','Victory Through Air Power',22779,1.479,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1847,_binary '\0','/8OYSiDLuSiNA8XcCC9F7MZ80lpw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036506',8,12198,'da','Vredens dag','In a Danish village in the early 1600s, a young woman named Anne, whose mother was thought to be a witch, develops sympathy toward an old woman, Marte, who is accused of witchcraft. The intervention of Anne\'s older but kindly husband, Pastor Absalon saved her mother -- but now, urged on by his overbearing mother, he refuses to help Marte. When Absalon\'s son returns home and is attracted to Anne, it\'s a matter of time before her family destiny catches up with her.','/jEOqbGLFo8fxHHgYoZVTMVYMoQG.jpg','1943-11-13',97,'Released','A Drama of Fear and Superstition in the 20th Century.','Day of Wrath',41391,3.141,8,'6_SATxIRMts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1848,_binary '\0','/vR6sKvMlxIGv0f6QcaVgLlGHI98.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036515',7.1,5571,'en','Watch on the Rhine','On the eve of World War II, the German Kurt Müller, his American-born wife Sara, and their three children, having lived in Europe for years, visit Sara\'s wealthy mother near Washington, DC. Kurt secretly works for the anti-Nazi resistance. A visiting Romanian count, becoming aware of this, seeks to blackmail him.','/6ZeyGqZEmK4JUbV0o5nBglEODoC.jpg','1943-08-27',114,'Released','On her lonesome lips a smile.','Watch on the Rhine',68440,2.3695,6.9,'fIaTKBRcxgk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1849,_binary '\0','/wSvnZAdbJ6WCcLH5ohDu2ovh1tN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036516',6.7,1944,'en','We Dive at Dawn','A gripping tale of WWII naval warfare in the Baltics, starring John Mills as Lt. Freddie Taylor, a British submarine Captain. The crew of the Sea Tiger are summoned from leave on shore with their families, and sent on a secret mission to intercept the Nazi battleship Brandenburg. In the ensuing battle the British submarine is damaged by a German destroyer. The submarine is leaking fuel so badly that the crew won\'t be able to make it back to Britain before running out somewhere along the Danish coast. When it seems that their only option may be to blow up the submarine and try to escape to Denmark, seaman James Hobson hatches a plan...','/tz2t5d2auUAqkXnGC0AkYyxUn0A.jpg','1943-04-15',98,'Released','A Tense Drama Of Under-The-Sea Heroism !','We Dive at Dawn',43519,1.37,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1850,_binary '\0','/gpNzDB3S9O5X9ffoRHeHUHG2xs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036581',6.9,1354,'en','Address Unknown','When a German art dealer living in the US returns to his native country he finds himself attracted to Nazi propaganda.','/eitmE8snK3kIHhbeoHqwIPRtVaB.jpg','1944-06-01',72,'Released','It Startled Millions! NOW...It Becomes the Great Screen Drama of Our Time!','Address Unknown',126759,1.4175,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1851,_binary '\0','/hPvsXF9pcK4y1wxYJMIxR8ay8y1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036582',7.1,1464,'en','The Adventures of Mark Twain','A dramatised life of Samuel Langhorn Clemens, or Mark Twain.','/fzYugOo4QJICLuJ2PI1tG3QeDjM.jpg','1944-07-20',130,'Released','The Life Story of the Creator of Tom Sawyer and Huckleberry Finn - His keen pen wove a fabric of wit into the lives of Americans !','The Adventures of Mark Twain',120747,1.5685,7,'P5HPT7ML84s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1852,_binary '\0','/ew8HKvaUWk0l8xLOmvr6o0EvQSg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036591',6.3,1514,'en','Ali Baba and the Forty Thieves','Orphaned as a young child and adopted by a band of notorious thieves, now-grown Ali Baba sets out to avenge his father’s murder, reclaim the royal throne, and rescue his beloved Amara from the iron fist of his treacherous enemy.','/n3bXF6WDy5YiD0TsdzncL2aU293.jpg','1944-01-14',87,'Released','Wild nights of sheer delights! Burning days of bold adventure!','Ali Baba and the Forty Thieves',44475,3.1955,6.154,'f2zBgFPf3gs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1853,_binary '\0','/h0jlcOISKcrVG4IE4p5IyZGrMhn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036613',7.9,78142,'en','Arsenic and Old Lace','Mortimer Brewster, a newspaper drama critic, playwright, and author known for his diatribes against marriage, suddenly falls in love and gets married; but when he makes a quick trip home to tell his two maiden aunts, he finds out his aunts\' hobby - killing lonely old men and burying them in the cellar!','/xG1GEEQGgExKl0WT5sRo1Arst5D.jpg','1944-09-01',118,'Released','She Passed Out On Cary! No Wonder . . . She\'s just discovered his favorite aunts have poisoned their 13th gentleman friend!','Arsenic and Old Lace',212,5.302,7.6,'7TsXVrLV9gg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1854,_binary '\0','/wPDRXiz4dUweMT37amhUbmSoNOf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036628',6.4,2120,'en','Bathing Beauty','After breaking up with her fiancé, a gym teacher returns to work at a women\'s college, but a legal loophole allows him to enroll as one of her students.','/9vqXU1hFpyLkJK4Wvt3bfUVMbqI.jpg','1944-06-27',102,'Released','M-G-M’s Mammoth Technicolor Musical Spectacle!','Bathing Beauty',43546,3.5737,5.9,'zbn5XQpmNgo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1855,_binary '\0','/texw0dgm5uwDwh2O35rGNZas8y5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036629',7.1,1756,'en','Why We Fight: The Battle of Russia','The fifth film of Frank Capra\'s Why We Fight propaganda film series, revealing the nature and process of the fight between the Soviet Union and Germany in the Second World War.','/xgcuUIKFkiVwtUzZy7iE7oeD8ro.jpg','1943-11-13',83,'Released',NULL,'Why We Fight: The Battle of Russia',112912,1.7955,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1856,_binary '\0','/cOnFl1Egh1tPfIAvbkOhOp0gxNE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036641',7.1,2627,'en','Between Two Worlds','Passengers on an ocean liner can\'t recall how they got onboard or where they are going. Soon it becomes apparent that they all have something in common.','/t1NeBrt65qUJCcOBOqf8MlTcnOy.jpg','1944-05-20',112,'Released','They lived in the Shadow of Death!','Between Two Worlds',26600,2.6653,7.2,'LnUIIlY2qpA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1857,_binary '\0','/jSQ0vkASII6dcLOF6ILAJjqFEZC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036644',6.3,1577,'en','The Big Noise','During World War II Stan and Ollie find themselves as improbable bodyguards to an eccentric inventor and his strategically important new bomb.','/7XmHQ5sRF5ilX9IDs5K34wKTijF.jpg','1944-09-22',74,'Released','DANGER! YOU\'LL LAUGH YOURSELF TO DEATH!','The Big Noise',73737,1.3543,6.2,'489_6vIFAt8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1858,_binary '\0','/5orcLA7wa4dVXvVgfYc3QHNB8Xi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036653',5.9,2357,'en','Bluebeard','Young female models are being