ies.','/5R6sxDUvrUbRR6vdt418elh8z9x.jpg','1944-08-17',63,'Released','When the Bells Toll at Midnight...Werewolves Prowl the Earth!','Cry of the Werewolf',35914,1.7434,4.8,'CyfMKsSIaZc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1872,_binary '\0','/1EYMFlz6zYq9etcMV4mIcoN8w3J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036733',6.7,7987,'en','The Curse of the Cat People','Amy, the young, friendless daughter of Oliver and Alice Reed, befriends her father\'s late first wife and an aging, reclusive actress.','/a2KedIReZYiPLjy1Ib89OSYo8Iv.jpg','1944-03-02',70,'Released','A tender tale of terror!','The Curse of the Cat People',28436,2.7708,6.2,'dWvo6inl98E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1873,_binary '\0','/AsiYt7HBBj6n1PyipnKgfkK74uR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036745',6.5,1239,'en','Dark Waters','Leslie Calvin, the sole survivor of a submarine accident, goes to her relatives in order to recover emotionally. Unfortunately, she encounters various scam artists led by Mr. Sydney who intend to kill her and steal the family assets. Dr. George Grover helps Leslie to defeat Sydney.','/xZm932Mo56dT1GLJUWIGptYB700.jpg','1944-11-21',90,'Released','Was love or madness to be her fate?','Dark Waters',36332,1.3472,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1874,_binary '\0','/3Kr3TVGvF4NrC4jYPtns2oYy8L2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036748',6.1,1607,'en','Days of Glory','A heroic guerilla group fights back against impossible odds during the 1941 Nazi invasion of Russia.','/b0iRM1CGk3VerLf1oO9uOn2sea1.jpg','1944-06-16',86,'Released','One Kiss taught her to kill... taught him to love!','Days of Glory',96366,2.2201,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1875,_binary '\0','/byQdu1nzQLI9t1VeoP1xuQfru3L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036775',8.3,183274,'en','Double Indemnity','An insurance representative is seduced by a dissatisfied housewife into a scheme of insurance fraud and murder that arouses the suspicion of his colleague,