.000000','tt0036824',6.4,4273,'en','The Fighting Seabees','Construction workers in World War II in the Pacific are needed to build military sites, but the work is dangerous and they doubt the ability of the Navy to protect them. After a series of attacks by the Japanese, something new is tried, Construction Battalions (CBs=Seabees). The new CBs have to both build and be ready to fight.','/pfqahIjSJ8XkU1Pta2z9M9PuIJY.jpg','1944-01-27',100,'Released','The thrilling story of America\'s supermen!','The Fighting Seabees',22994,2.8143,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1880,_binary '\0','/k8sH3RyFg1G4fHN0k9QNoHk8i4E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036855',7.8,38378,'en','Gaslight','A newlywed fears she\'s going mad when strange things start happening at the family mansion.','/gXKszCl5Q1KrgWRWpPcqn94CP58.jpg','1944-05-04',114,'Released','Strange drama of a captive sweetheart!','Gaslight',13528,5.363,7.508,'pnGdlnH2BDY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1881,_binary '\0','/n0og4mDtl08x9RLTWXt8zUKpqXQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036868',8.1,77153,'en','The Best Years of Our Lives','It\'s the hope that sustains the spirit of every GI: the dream of the day when he will finally return home. For three WWII veterans, the day has arrived. But for each man, the dream is about to become a nightmare.','/gd5EoAU4MM57sW3vlWxJ0NMM8cV.jpg','1946-11-22',171,'Released','Three wonderful loves in the best picture of the year!','The Best Years of Our Lives',887,5.2021,7.7,'X9lufYAOxes','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1882,_binary '\0','/jiGn1FXSQVfN2nhix0tQtmoGWcF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036872',7,14960,'en','Going My Way','Youthful Father Chuck O\'Malley led a colorful life of sports, song, and romance before joining the Roman Catholic clergy. After being appointed to a run-down New York parish, O\'Malley\'s worldly knowledge helps him connect with a gang of boys looking for direction, eventually winning over the aging, conventional Parish priest.','/838yNJnOk6iZj5YK1MoKiN2n1hw.jpg','1944-01-01',126,'Released','When the St. Louis Browns lost Bing, the Cardinal got a good singer!','Going My Way',17661,2.8098,6.7,'0cGqBXb3QVQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1883,_binary '\0','/vfyvDJmvRGMkePPDEg4C0QyymoQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036891',7.6,5603,'en','Hail the Conquering Hero','Having been discharged from the Marines for a hayfever condition before ever seeing action, Woodrow Lafayette Pershing Truesmith delays the return to his hometown, feeling that he is a failure. While in a moment of melancholy, he meets up with a group of Marines who befriend him and encourage him to return home to his mother by fabricating a story that he was wounded in battle with honorable discharge.','/AfuK8Ui0o4Z9ATlUT7nOvYI4P0d.jpg','1944-08-09',101,'Released','MIRACLES DO HAPPEN!','Hail the Conquering Hero',36498,2.2317,7.146,'i3wHtEMmDVA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1884,_binary '\0','/zNca9BKPRMC1WtQYVJ619bqdaOZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036910',7,7769,'en','The Chronicle History of King Henry the Fifth with His Battell Fought at Agincourt in France','In 1415, in the midst of the Hundred Years\' War, the young King Henry V of England embarks on the conquest of France.','/eAisr20DvaKJeHvjDN0oHSx0l7u.jpg','1944-11-24',137,'Released',NULL,'Henry V',22638,3.2707,6.7,'NWzXHWzwHMM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1885,_binary '\0','/uEfzPXa4Uz9Rs6nf2QIeQ6lro1z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036914',7.2,4180,'sv','Hets','Jan-Erik Widgren meets the lonely Bertha Olsson, a woman struggling with alcoholism. Though Bertha is already linked to Caligula, Jan-Erik\'s heartless teacher, she begins a relationship with the boy anyway. When Caligula learns that Jan-Erik is having an affair with Bertha, he begins to torture his student psychologically. He reserves his cruelest behavior for Bertha, however, which results in a tragic turn of events.','/9ZyQouoMZm0M0ERUGBKYZR0M8PN.jpg','1944-10-02',101,'Released',NULL,'Torment',51144,1.4968,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1886,_binary '\0','/rk52jJxMdAnyv2o0OwQ2hZGRTct.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036922',7,2684,'en','Hollywood Canteen','Two soldiers on leave spend three nights at a club offering free of charge food, dancing, and entertainment for servicemen on their way overseas. Club founders Bette Davis and John Garfield give talks on the history of the place.','/4ifU2c7Kbt4sCLbTdLFBqnhPYDp.jpg','1944-12-15',124,'Released','All of Hollywood\'s Heart is in it! Most of Hollywood\'s Stars are in it!','Hollywood Canteen',38697,1.7651,7.3,'GnIJJwCUHNo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1887,_binary '\0','/rlpRSGY5RG8FA7ZH1P2fDF4wRBL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036931',6.2,8765,'en','House of Frankenstein','Deranged scientist, Gustav Niemann, escapes from prison and overtakes the director of a traveling chamber of horrors, soon reviving the infamous Count Dracula, the frozen Frankenstein Monster, and the Wolf Man.','/9HPcPasdgxjlSMlnyzIWrnGodOz.jpg','1944-12-15',71,'Released','All the screen\'s titans of terror - together in the greatest of All SCREEN SENSATIONS!','House of Frankenstein',3103,4.0989,6.1,'I90bPakb1zs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1888,_binary '\0','/pd9yPQlh9OueZEglB5GfCIZZOzD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036940',7.1,2867,'en','I\'ll Be Seeing You','Mary Marshall, serving six years for accidental manslaughter, is given a Christmas furlough to visit her closest relatives, her uncle and his family in a small Midwestern town. On the journey, she meets Zach Morgan, a troubled army sergeant on leave from a military hospital. Although his physical wounds have healed, he suffers from PTSD and is subject to panic attacks. The pair are attracted to one another and, in the warm atmosphere of the Christmas season friendship, blossoms into romance, but Mary is reluctant to tell him of her past and that she must shortly return to serve the remainder of her sentence.','/qIILAaSfWpfXOfOybsVi0ZzeCOJ.jpg','1944-12-24',85,'Released','Both Living a Secret...each afraid to tell!','I\'ll Be Seeing You',30719,2.433,6.942,'BAoSeIJJYQI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1889,_binary '\0','/pvFmXlMDsYoDnFu21hY3tlyW1xv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036947',5.6,2869,'ja','一番美しく','Young women at a precision optics factory in wartime Japan push to exceed production quotas, enduring illness, injury, and personal hardship to “serve the country.” Led by Tsuru Watanabe, they fight fatigue and setbacks to keep their line moving—even when duty collides with grief.','/37EKyIKpmGLEX5Js0cQq9J8DFW3.jpg','1944-04-13',85,'Released',NULL,'The Most Beautiful',17988,1.9707,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1890,_binary '\0','/ov5pHjoWsSYIZk3zDPJNj9JnttA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036953',6.6,2257,'en','In Society','Two bumbling plumbers are hired by a socialite to fix a leak. A case of mistaken identity gets the pair an invitation to a fancy party and an entree into high society. As expected, things don\'t go too smoothly.','/yunh802Qj0BynwVRIPPMO5uNyTV.jpg','1944-08-16',75,'Released','THE COMEDY KINGS are BACK!','In Society',36704,1.7124,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1891,_binary '\0','/5Ayh76arJCy9lebsbF0dtabaMCH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036959',5.7,3204,'en','The Invisible Man\'s Revenge','A fugitive, dangerous madman reaches an English village where he confronts his former partner who left him for dead in the jungle after their discovery of a diamond mine. When the former partner also claims to have since lost the mine and all its wealth, which he took all for himself, and though the partner is still living in a state of luxury , the madman takes up an offer from a crazed scientist to make him invisible, something the scientist has already done with experimental animals, so that he can take revenge.','/vdJBIqTd1DQcSKpxa17xr27IgsL.jpg','1944-06-09',78,'Released','A Trail Of Terror!','The Invisible Man\'s Revenge',28425,2.9252,5.6,'QWOvnNCziz4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1892,_binary '\0','/lQZBj79QytDUuJKKyrlwItQEDpC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036962',7,3440,'en','It Happened Tomorrow','A young turn-of-the-century newspaper man finds he can get hold of the next day\'s paper. This brings more problems than fortune, especially as his new girlfriend is part of a phony clairvoyant act.','/byWjI8SYnATh0OdnaCCKhO9nY0R.jpg','1944-03-31',85,'Released','Funniest thing on the screen today','It Happened Tomorrow',3589,2.3841,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1893,_binary '\0','/sAk9UwRR9eeFkAT2vKK7k6vAOPQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036969',7.4,10434,'en','Jane Eyre','After a bleak childhood, Jane Eyre goes out into the world to become a governess. As she lives happily in her new position at Thornfield Hall, she meets the dark, cold, and abrupt master of the house, Edward Rochester. Jane and her employer grow close in friendship and she soon finds herself falling in love with him. Happiness seems to have found Jane at last, but could Rochester\'s terrible secret be about to destroy it forever?','/stD4BQiN4TLNf6P5ju95AVRPdto.jpg','1943-12-24',97,'Released','A love story every woman would die a thousand deaths to live!','Jane Eyre',22744,3.5605,6.9,'fupUKF9SEy4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1894,_binary '\0','/dOQsrSLRDHjwsBuSVc7skyveJGa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036983',7.2,3497,'en','The Keys of the Kingdom','A young priest, Father Chisholm is sent to China to establish a Catholic parish among the non-Christian Chinese. While his boyhood friend, also a priest, flourishes in his calling as a priest in a more Christian area of the world, Father Chisholm struggles. He encounters hostility, isolation, disease, poverty and a variety of set backs which humble him, but make him more determined than ever to succeed.','/5cjw4opFmuJHHidnxV6TYFCJUza.jpg','1944-12-15',137,'Released','THE PICTURE THAT TOUCHES NEW HEIGHTS OF EMOTION','The Keys of the Kingdom',18050,2.9834,7.1,'RmdXdrhL4UQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1895,_binary '\0','/3WFMlfIWoFFnzMrEkjDYJPfzXQi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0036984',6,1468,'en','Kismet','In ancient Baghdad, penniless beggar Hafiz dotes on his beautiful daughter, Marsinah, at home and adopts the dashing and wealthy persona of the Prince of Hassir on the streets. While wooing the glamorous Lady Jamilla, wife of the Grand Vizier, Hafiz accidentally ignites a battle between the treacherous Vizier and the rakish Caliph for his daughter\'s hand in marriage, in the process exposing each man\'s secrets.','/fuoKJ341mqiRB5hMXEJc49GWpn6.jpg','1944-10-01',103,'Released',NULL,'Kismet',43501,1.5044,5.5,'Lo5natt3ia0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1896,_binary '\0','/d5HjGve67GkNC9lWpzZVKSotLlT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037008',7.9,56702,'en','Laura','A police detective falls in love with the woman whose murder he\'s investigating.','/utpUn9TdBIx6x2QX91YhYzFZxg1.jpg','1944-10-11',88,'Released','The story of a love that became the most fearful thing that ever happened to a woman!','Laura',1939,4.3673,7.631,'KgGtRJY516E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1897,_binary '\0','/X5kdpMCowusOsub7jSHSnALysp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037017',7.6,34148,'en','Lifeboat','During World War II, a small group of survivors is stranded in a lifeboat together after the ship they were traveling on is destroyed by a German U-boat.','/2QXpzBMJJtmH7JvVf0ZzENvgc1o.jpg','1944-01-28',96,'Released','Six men and three women - against the sea, and each other!','Lifeboat',13321,3.2275,7.4,'O_SGsmN96hk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1898,_binary '\0','/tmDRpisxZSocdISKpZ7TXh6xsPz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037024',7,4461,'en','The Lodger','In Victorian era London, the inhabitants of a family home with rented rooms upstairs fear the new lodger is Jack the Ripper.','/qKuVeCVHRN9hfNWEk06JBVKuWww.jpg','1944-01-19',84,'Released','PROBING EYES that marked the woman he loved for death!','The Lodger',29094,1.9624,6.5,'B7C2PSYDVqY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1899,_binary '\0','/edqq95wwPyT9ZNWBRoNGjDUYVeb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037027',6.3,1373,'en','Lost in a Harem','Two bumbling magicians help a Middle Eastern prince regain his rightful throne from his despotic uncle.','/jiynQuvW6Rto120raPSLiOGcOql.jpg','1944-11-08',89,'Released','Were You Ever In a Harem? WOW!','Lost in a Harem',58920,2.2035,5.6,'TX6143SoWX4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1900,_binary '\0','/j8Kyi1hRdWWgeVuorJZhVHIDXmv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037054',7.3,1428,'es','María Candelaria (Xochimilco)','A young journalist asks an old artist about the portrait of a naked Indian woman that he has in his study. The artist tells the story of Maria Candelaria, a young Indian woman who was rejected by her own people for being the daughter of a prostitute. She is protected by a young Indian man, Lorenzo Rafael, who has fallen in love with her.','/whd229FgEBmzxZOGgOWffKOcuRl.jpg','1944-01-20',102,'Released',NULL,'Maria Candelaria',60225,2.0684,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1901,_binary '\0','/tjfLCnhJOpEpgAu4Nf9iGLvtUfy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037055',7.2,4596,'en','The Mask of Dimitrios','A mystery writer is intrigued by the tale of notorious criminal Dimitrios Makropolous, whose dead body was found washed up on the shore in Istanbul. He decides to follow the career of Dimitrios around Europe, in order to learn more about the man. Along the way he is joined by the mysterious Mr. Peters, who has his own motivation.','/wsf399maXMnhOWfQSjOxErURxzN.jpg','1944-06-23',95,'Released','The fabulous tale of a man of mystery!','The Mask of Dimitrios',35006,2.4853,7.1,'4Cihb4yEYlg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1902,_binary '\0','/fQ93o3wVSIe0dXMLTVTBHoqWwew.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037059',7.5,31398,'en','Meet Me in St. Louis','A year in the life of a turn-of-the-century middle class family, leading up to the opening of the 1904 St. Louis World\'s Fair.','/ekVeUvG81pidsv2LMtWf5yYcNbq.jpg','1944-11-28',114,'Released','Glorious love story with music!','Meet Me in St. Louis',909,5.1165,7.013,'dLNa7mp0wWo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1903,_binary '\0','/lmdoys4dvffcnm9P99DXkYcHCh2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037075',7.1,9787,'en','Ministry of Fear','Stephen Neale is released into WWII England after two years in an asylum, but it doesn\'t seem so sane outside either. On his way back to London to rejoin civilization, he stumbles across a murderous spy ring and doesn\'t quite know to whom to turn.','/w4e8jC9nupHedW75m4AvCStPMGz.jpg','1944-05-19',86,'Released','Thrilling drama of the Invisible Network of Terror!','Ministry of Fear',21451,2.1892,6.9,'Ga9QishZc5Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1904,_binary '\0','/vamzfTPDFBdXukywhbcONqvPgGH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037077',7.5,8461,'en','The Miracle of Morgan\'s Creek','A small-town girl with a soft spot for American soldiers wakes up the morning after a wild farewell party for the troops to find that she married someone she can\'t remember.','/rf2OgScEs3zsJL0Gp4ZMsR2ScdN.jpg','1944-09-18',98,'Released','The True Story of TRUDY KOCKENLOCKER, who kissed the Boys Goodbye... REGIMENT BY REGIMENT!','The Miracle of Morgan\'s Creek',42879,2.4023,6.831,'bCu4IH9rkr8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1905,_binary '\0','/AozphW6uU4aOU4tptTrOAfHUBAs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037084',4.8,1402,'en','The Monster Maker','Mad scientist injects his enemies with acromegaly virus, causing them to become hideously deformed.','/8jJPN5D52XZX4JwRILETQ7RejUF.jpg','1944-04-15',62,'Released',NULL,'The Monster Maker',108382,1.1955,5.2,'eed3VuC64aI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1906,_binary '\0','/svHni0vschECxgJwBAWRafdfStP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037094',7.5,7385,'en','Mr. Skeffington','A beautiful but vain woman who rejects the love of her older husband must face the loss of her youth and beauty.','/7qqEkoPqC9ImQzPoVdVhI6NFGti.jpg','1944-05-25',145,'Released','She was lucky that Mr. Skeffington was such a gentleman!','Mr. Skeffington',43307,3.3972,6.8,'em4ouBJ91IU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1907,_binary '\0','/ne1sYWOyAQ8nhdv2SfbjqPbA8R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037096',7,2122,'en','Mrs. Parkington','In this family saga, Mrs. Parkington recounts the story of her life, beginning as a hotel maid in frontier Nevada where she is swept off her feet by mine owner and financier Augustus Parkington. He moves them to New York, tries to remake her into a society woman, and establishes their home among the wealthiest of New York\'s high society. Family and social life is not always peaceful, however, and she guides us, in flashbacks, through the rises and falls of the Parkington family fortunes.','/i5dKc60s9SuxNfJMT2E1b8TvG9T.jpg','1944-10-12',124,'Released','The Great Novel of a Millionaire\'s Romance!','Mrs. Parkington',50066,1.6936,6,'UDNKr831DJY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1908,_binary '\0','/k4SJCY65JzCgenu8gyNMb1NWGCD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037098',5.4,3858,'en','The Mummy\'s Curse','After being buried in quicksand for the past 25 years, Kharis is set free to roam the rural bayous of Louisiana, as is the soul of his beloved Princess Ananka, still housed in the body of Amina Mansouri, who seeks help and protection at a swamp draining project.','/mzdLuaFsZrxJ7KcrExTh7GEOqJt.jpg','1944-12-22',60,'Released','Egypt\'s ancient loves live again in evil!','The Mummy\'s Curse',29242,3.0125,5.5,'WO_5s8qiQRk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1909,_binary '\0','/4I9kfIAHK64pii1T4kBQz3n2ijJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037099',5.5,3952,'en','The Mummy\'s Ghost','An Egyptian high priest travels to America to reclaim the bodies of ancient Egyptian princess Ananka and her living guardian mummy Kharis. Learning that Ananka\'s spirit has been reincarnated into another body, he kidnaps a young woman of Egyptian descent with a mysterious resemblance to the princess. However, the high priest\'s greedy desires cause him to lose control of the mummy...','/eRNWTjYXkUQvqopfgz8DvHolxWA.jpg','1944-06-30',60,'Released','Nameless! Fleshless! Deathless!','The Mummy\'s Ghost',29243,2.1522,5.6,'EpJlqCN7_zY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1910,_binary '\0','/mIcj44rCT7TBWGV7wjMnusBbFte.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037101',7.5,16577,'en','Murder, My Sweet','After being hired to find an ex-con\'s former girlfriend, Philip Marlowe is drawn into a deeply complex web of mystery and deceit.','/tbyzfN1AUKTvzh058L9ZcOpS9Vn.jpg','1944-12-14',95,'Released','Haunted by a lovely face... hunted for another\'s crime!','Murder, My Sweet',1834,4.1788,7.2,'PHRDGxSL2o4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1911,_binary '\0','/xXJ48xbBA2xT8HxNSEz9SpCkSeV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037120',7.3,8970,'en','National Velvet','Mi Taylor is a young wanderer and opportunist who finds himself in the quiet English countryside home of the Brown family. The youngest daughter, Velvet, has a passion for horses and when she wins the spirited steed Pie in a town lottery, Mi is encouraged to train the horse.','/iUQfP3s967V3SIAbyomNT8z8MIf.jpg','1945-01-26',123,'Released','Simple story of a boy... a girl... and a horse! Set to the thunder of the Grand National Steeplechase!','National Velvet',17641,2.7545,7.2,'nPBY9yWqs7I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1912,_binary '\0','/iwSuFnsieEdzAt943GzhmHTU6V3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037135',6.4,3066,'en','None But the Lonely Heart','When an itinerant reluctantly returns home to help his sickly mother run her shop, they\'re both tempted to turn to crime to help make ends meet.','/st37wKa1ZUbVSlKFI1fuUWb0rbi.jpg','1944-10-17',113,'Released','\"Black as the Ace I am!\"','None But the Lonely Heart',52362,1.9612,6.3,'NNHLsNT0ZMg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1913,_binary '\0','/ziQpPpvcYEAFsGuRJvXIY2A2Rme.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037136',7.1,1436,'en','None Shall Escape','Through flashbacks going as far back as the end of WW1, the story of a Nazi war criminal is exposed during his trial.','/vtJdshqBOnasjyBsTDktiI80LWv.jpg','1944-02-03',85,'Released','NAZIS! QUISLINGS! WOMEN KILLERS! FIRST COMPLETE STORY OF THE TRIAL OF THE NAZI WAR CRIMINALS!','None Shall Escape',48989,1.2834,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1914,_binary '\0','/rLgMJ6Y4qMc7CJKsCj0zl4eg6vT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037138',6.3,1409,'en','Nothing But Trouble','Two bumbling servants are hired by a dizzy society matron to cook and serve a meal for visiting royalty.','/b7FDnVIpUs5IUYx1WvaUfK1ohDQ.jpg','1944-12-06',69,'Released','Nothing but fun!','Nothing But Trouble',25600,1.3307,6.4,'pZfFFZ7borA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1915,_binary '\0','/jVwAJX6ABQHprKHWiEFoll9IoE4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037150',6.1,1271,'en','Once Upon a Time','Broadway producer Jerry Flynn is anxious to recapture the magic and reclaim the crowds after a set of costly flops. Outside his theater one night, Flynn meets a young boy who just might save the day. Inside a small box the boy shows Flynn his pride and joy: a caterpillar named Curly that dances to Yes Sir, That\'s My Baby. Word quickly spreads about the amazingly talented hoofer, and the caterpillar becomes a symbol of hope for wartime America. Soon, offers are pouring in to capitalize on this sensational insect.','/vaHApHfVWr1DzkFwRfSg6Ps7AZH.jpg','1944-06-29',89,'Released','it\'s CHUCKLESOME!','Once Upon a Time',67896,2.0641,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1916,_binary '\0','/ymADZIaTwmspYWVaCx6omdYUe2a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037151',5.4,1809,'en','One Body Too Many','An insurance salesman, Albert Tuttle, is hired as a body guard for a millionaire.','/uds2Nw8jwJlARSbgG8xw9I8jboY.jpg','1944-11-24',75,'Released','The Murder Mystery of the Season!','One Body Too Many',23281,1.5777,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1917,_binary '\0','/70wIyJMx9MZE33tzrrkH3NRZkjM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037166',6.8,5750,'en','Passage to Marseille','A freedom-loving French journalist sacrifices his happiness and security to battle Nazi tyranny.','/14s5iMOLt8EboZmnltXjB7g2sap.jpg','1944-02-16',109,'Released','Warner Bros. Triumph','Passage to Marseille',18229,2.8175,6.671,'WhYEFpjAzyA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1918,_binary '\0','/308vtODqXf6ot8Tat8TMIbi0550.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037168',7.1,5495,'en','The Pearl of Death','The famous Borgia Pearl, a valuable gem with a history of bringing murder and misfortune to its owner since the days of the Borgias, is brought to London, thanks in part to Sherlock Holmes. But before long the jewel is stolen, due to an error on Holmes\' part, and shortly thereafter, a series of horrible murders begin, the murderer leaving his victims with their spines snapped and surrounded by a mass of smashed china.','/36crcUCyyKZritifPJNlXMfsp9a.jpg','1944-08-01',69,'Released','The master minds tackle the master crimes!','The Pearl of Death',33421,2.8553,7.1,'kVQLNTQ23YU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1919,_binary '\0','/y8C3mhdLbFemmeVypo7yUhp6PyF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037193',6.8,2671,'en','The Princess and the Pirate','Princess Margaret is travelling incognito to elope with her true love instead of marrying the man her father has betrothed her to. On the high seas, her ship is attacked by pirates who know her identity and plan to kidnap her and hold her for a king\'s ransom.','/foAqdD4Xov5q09rLkj4AzRxs9aQ.jpg','1944-11-17',94,'Released','Yo-Ho HOPE and a Cargo of Laughs!','The Princess and the Pirate',30506,2.6456,6.9,'6_MGMSzEMM4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1920,_binary '\0','/c10mI7HNt3Z6dRI0cMJPcpHOe70.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037219',6.2,3287,'en','The Return of the Vampire','In 1918, an English family is terrorized by a vampire, until they learn how to deal with it. They think their troubles are over, but German bombs in WWII free the monster. He reclaims the soul of his wolfman ex-servant, and assuming the identity of a scientist who has just escaped from a concentration camp, he starts out on a plan to get revenge upon the family.','/qp8aCa4ajBcCozBNDATIWimZiFu.jpg','1943-11-11',69,'Released','The Vampire\'s Prey... a Beautiful Girl! Compelled to follow his commands! The blood of her fiancé on his hands! How can she escape the vampire?','The Return of the Vampire',32858,2.1799,6.139,'Y9M3rjn0qes','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1921,_binary '\0','/hyZCJs9D97GnM7mCWF7CM1LH28T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037248',7.1,6645,'en','The Scarlet Claw','When a woman is found dead with her throat torn out, the local villagers blame a supernatural monster. But Sherlock Holmes, who gets drawn into the case from nearby Quebec, suspects a human murderer.','/1laSfU5KqQjwgxRqyTUuSmTZIZe.jpg','1944-05-18',74,'Released','Holmes vs. Monster!','The Scarlet Claw',33423,2.2599,7,'R4_YNGKt1cg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1922,_binary '\0','/g6iZoAvfvdcr52GGhBOpt4xpM2z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037263',7.4,3383,'en','The Seventh Cross','In Nazi Germany in 1936 seven men escape from a concentration camp. The camp commander puts up seven crosses and, as the Gestapo returns each escapee he is put to death on a cross. The seventh cross is still empty as George Heisler attempts an escape to freedom in Holland.','/sznO6f1h4uG03VDs8OCI1llz9Ur.jpg','1944-07-24',110,'Released','His greatest role!','The Seventh Cross',85574,1.9685,6.8,'_jOC1SUVF7U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1923,_binary '\0','/96ymUd1TTAM2IaJKochuiqFXJGU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037280',7.5,5569,'en','Since You Went Away','In 1943, several people enter, re-enter, and exit the difficult life of a Midwestern family whose patriarch has been called up to war, leaving behind his wife and two teen daughters.','/wSaJNuhDTzkKntI7Pony2DRyDKY.jpg','1944-06-30',177,'Released','A love story of today\'s love and laughter','Since You Went Away',42401,3.1501,6.6,'YwtXPbSE2mc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1924,_binary '\0','/jKAlYhPdKlLADl6zNG6ao0vMCcM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037303',7,5799,'en','The Spider Woman','Sherlock Holmes investigates a series of so-called \"pajama suicides\". He knows the female villain behind them is as cunning as Moriarty and as venomous as a spider.','/yTbwfGfrJ1opMAIrdltCCf3eRo2.jpg','1943-12-10',63,'Released','Grim mystery to hold you breathless!','The Spider Woman',2443,2.2166,7,'6LSHno13Lzs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1925,_binary '\0','/vU7Jdx2v6li9hEwGRUILe4iK2aL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037316',6.6,1235,'en','The Story of Dr. Wassell','As the Japanese sweep through the East Indies during World War II, Dr. Wassell is determined to escape from Java with some crewmen of the cruiser Marblehead. Based on a true story of how Dr. Wassell saved a dozen or so wounded sailors who were left behind when able bodied men were evacuated to Australia.','/yjrMxwMxhsahGbCHLFpDUW5fR1t.jpg','1944-07-04',140,'Released','Flaming Action from the Jungles of Java to China and the Seven Seas!','The Story of Dr. Wassell',92399,2.333,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1926,_binary '\0','/bfzoOngMHwVAQ9zpl9AyZVZO4hS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037323',7.4,2588,'en','The Fighting Sullivans','The lives of a close-knit group of brothers growing up in Iowa during the days of the Great Depression and of World War II and their eventual deaths in action in the Pacific theater are chronicled in this film based on a true story.','/lyYw2dk1dowEc4NlPFFtsDBihTm.jpg','1944-02-03',112,'Released','THEY MET LIFE - AND GLORY - IN ONE BLINDING FLASH!!','The Fighting Sullivans',43504,1.2257,6.3,'7M1goZ_vVsE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1927,_binary '\0','/sP0C08r6oFKVQ8eBTlb9gUyZJJW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037330',7.3,3992,'en','The Suspect','Genial shopkeeper Philip has to endure the constant nagging of a shrewish wife while he secretly yearns for a pretty young stenographer. When the henpecking gets to be too much, Philip murders his wife and manages to make her death look like an accident. A ruthless blackmailer and a low-key detective both discover Philip\'s secret, and he has to decide which of them poses the more dangerous threat.','/kHInEMFDY5PG7tigy872pKzg1bm.jpg','1945-01-26',85,'Released','His Was a Strange Secret, Hers Was a Strange Love','The Suspect',25413,1.5499,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1928,_binary '\0','/lOpLaPKboIE2ZdojoAiJxiyF0Db.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037343',6.9,4089,'en','Tall in the Saddle','When Rocklin arrives in a western town he finds that the rancher who hired him as a foreman has been murdered. He is out to solve the murder and thwart the scheming to take the ranch from its rightful owner.','/1y566vrPxOXrTFJ9USp4aSTJ43S.jpg','1944-09-29',87,'Released','WAYNE PACKS A WALLOP...In Action...In Love!','Tall in the Saddle',15264,3.1652,6.6,'iqsmY9Kjm8Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1929,_binary '\0','/1VXaz7dZ7MUhznNIRYgmZYoFuzX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037365',7.3,7010,'en','The Thin Man Goes Home','Hoping for a peaceful visit with his parents in the small town of Sycamore Springs, Nick Charles and his wife Nora soon find themselves surrounded by old rivalries, family tensions, and a mysterious murder. Nick’s father, a respected retired doctor, would much rather see his son give up detective work, but a suspicious shooting quickly draws Nick back into action. As Nick and Nora investigate, they uncover jealousy, deception, hidden motives, and a dangerous secret involving the town’s prominent citizens.','/xKnTU1LOeRU8AubY2LO5lGRiPpv.jpg','1944-12-24',101,'Released','Together again in M-G-M\'s riotous comedy.','The Thin Man Goes Home',14594,2.4517,7.1,'G-_ZRSRs4ls','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1930,_binary '\0','/xnf9zh6Ptxc7SU5Lt08LIPc68u8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037366',7.2,7207,'en','Thirty Seconds Over Tokyo','In the wake of Pearl Harbor, a young lieutenant leaves his expectant wife to volunteer for a secret bombing mission which will take the war to the Japanese homeland.','/dvvgU0TwstTtZofAzBA5syt5on7.jpg','1944-11-15',138,'Released','Heart-Warming Romance . . . Ripped from the Heart!','Thirty Seconds Over Tokyo',18770,3.1682,6.7,'70o03FbZCsM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1931,_binary '\0','/1xnLgQQPPTyO7MkNwpJfrbyZ8Tf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037367',7.3,4681,'en','This Happy Breed','A chronicle of the lives of the Gibbons family, from shortly after the end of the First World War to the beginning of the Second.','/3E4BiVMUAHJqT0VEZ6LUFD0P9J9.jpg','1944-05-28',111,'Released','A Sweeping Panorama of Living','This Happy Breed',51617,2.6193,7.1,'kItHpwdf8yU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1932,_binary '\0','/uYRnUnBE4kk5ocvyBckRfMAsZpJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037382',7.8,41575,'en','To Have and Have Not','A Martinique charter boat skipper gets mixed up with the underground French resistance operatives during WWII.','/m6EjBAY7gA6tx5RMutXGtZWFzyI.jpg','1945-01-20',100,'Released','TALK ABOUT T.N.T! THIS is IT!','To Have and Have Not',22584,4.2117,7.5,'0UlUzhnehvc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1933,_binary '\0','/khbg0wAflDw9rAFfiww731DBFbM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037414',7.1,1681,'en','Uncertain Glory','In occupied France, a convicted thief and murderer escapes the guillotine when a bombing raid strikes the prison, but is quickly re-captured by the inspector of the Surete responsible for his original arrest. Fearing the guillotine more than his actual death, the convict inveigles the inspector to help him with a plan to rescue 100 Frenchmen taken by the Gestapo following an act of sabotage: he will confess to being the saboteur and allow himself to be executed by firing squad, the Gestapo\'s method of execution, thus freeing the 100 men.','/uCGksCMaDEqacHEnsn2zNvpquQY.jpg','1944-04-07',102,'Released','A French playboy gets serious when his country is threatened during World War II','Uncertain Glory',55240,1.4056,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1934,_binary '\0','/poCmeIQA2xL7GnGq9PMwUcJ4AgI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037415',7.2,13723,'en','The Uninvited','A pair of siblings from London purchase a surprisingly affordable, lonely cliff-top house in Cornwall, only to discover that it actually carries a ghostly price—and soon they’re caught up in a bizarre romantic triangle from beyond the grave.','/uwp5ahLmWliRyX3mPoLHU7BKhf5.jpg','1944-02-24',99,'Released','The Story of a Love That is Out of This World!','The Uninvited',16373,3.0601,6.9,'1dTHjio2kg0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1935,_binary '\0','/2TSEvm2JsXeBXyjaW1awSxrKyzB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037420',6.2,1274,'en','Up in Arms','Hypochondriac Danny Weems gets drafted and accidentally smuggles his girlfriend aboard his Pacific-bound troopship.','/rFgHxjHkuZvQtQ598GvqrWdcHJf.jpg','1944-02-17',105,'Released','SHOW OF SHOWS...AND YOUR ENTERTAINMENT DELIGHT OF ALL TIME!','Up in Arms',113757,1.7648,5.833,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1936,_binary '\0','/h9JTOh3J2srMkoqil5hrcS0Opkj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037441',5.3,1392,'en','Voodoo Man','After several female motorists begin disappearing en route to Twin Falls, a Hollywood screenwriter and the cousin of his bride-to-be discover that they\'ve all been abducted by the mysterious Dr. Marlowe, who is attempting to resurrect his dead wife.','/7RF1T9PwnDeqawATpGt05l3wQCE.jpg','1944-02-21',62,'Released','HIS LUST FOR VOODOOISM SPELLS D-O-O-M!','Voodoo Man',28359,1.3855,5,'NmOG-DRXG7A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1937,_binary '\0','/n6Rrv6codL89wBFw2PxDePv2Wfr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037449',6.9,2537,'en','The Way Ahead','A mismatched collection of conscripted civilians find training tough under Lieutenant Jim Perry and Sergeant Ned Fletcher when they are called up to replace an infantry battalion that had suffered casualties at Dunkirk.','/rJP2JsLnlyv4pkT7crrJYz0V4pE.jpg','1944-06-09',115,'Released','From Workers — To Warriors','The Way Ahead',28916,1.7351,6.5,'6h2jq38M2_s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1938,_binary '\0','/tzUbbZXwLLaY3J0Rqn73WC3IKzB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037453',6.2,1333,'en','Weird Woman','After bringing his beautiful new wife Paula home to America from a remote island on which she was raised, Professor Norman Reed begins to feel the clash between his world of rational science and hers of bizarre dancing and freaky voodoo rituals. Norman\'s stuck-up friends also sense Paula\'s strangeness, and soon their meddling gossip and suspicious scheming push the poor woman to use her magic to defend herself and her husband – and maybe even to kill! Or is it just the power of suggestion...?','/sA2N5mnNYybE85cZvYJTEUx7b6V.jpg','1944-03-01',64,'Released','WEAVING HER WEIRD DEAD SPELL OF VOODOO!','Weird Woman',64076,1.4753,6,'qbWqkGQgCeQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1939,_binary '\0','/3aBQSTy2Y033FMjDMetYXtwB4QY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037458',6.5,1571,'en','When Strangers Marry','A naive small-town girl comes to New York City to meet her husband, and discovers that he may be a murderer.','/cHhmAtkD3R2Z2wJb2rcJumcIy43.jpg','1944-08-21',67,'Released','DYNAMIC!','When Strangers Marry',26169,1.27,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1940,_binary '\0','/fazly5Gm760bGY92vFDXaR59bQ9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037461',6.3,1426,'en','The Whistler','A guilt-ridden man blames himself for his wife\'s death and secretly pays an assassin to kill him. But then he finds out that his wife isn\'t dead at all. And now the assassin is on his trail, with no way to call off the hit.','/zNc6cUawDIaBmg63wbsUcPh67YK.jpg','1944-03-30',60,'Released','Radio\'s Master of Mystery... Now on the Screen!','The Whistler',28668,1.6457,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1941,_binary '\0','/cpC76nY1HDJLz6m60uUY8FFQJFT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037462',7,2027,'en','The White Cliffs of Dover','American Susan travels with her father to England for a vacation. Invited to a society ball, Susan meets Sir John Ashwood and marries him after a whirlwind romance. However, she never quite adjusts to life as a new member of the British gentry. At the outbreak of World War I, John is sent to the trenches and never returns. When her son goes off to fight in World War II, Susan fears the same tragic fate may befall him too.','/l6g71AmExvAIKOZB3vdEBR5WArm.jpg','1944-05-11',126,'Released','The greatest love story of our time!','The White Cliffs of Dover',52440,2.2455,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1942,_binary '\0','/oj9hKlrfZjb43RXdYyhGW1TcC37.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037465',6.3,1875,'en','Wilson','The political career of Woodrow Wilson is chronicled, beginning with his decision to leave his post at Princeton to run for Governor of New Jersey, and his subsequent ascent to the Presidency of the United States. During his terms in office, Wilson must deal with the death of his first wife, the onslaught of German hostilities leading to American involvement in the Great War, and his own country\'s reticence to join the League of Nations. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with Twentieth Century Fox Film Corporation in 2006.','/6nXIUIUwh4GZ8mQvEhgqUuqMann.jpg','1944-08-01',154,'Released','DRAMA AND SPECTACLE UNPARALLELED! ENTERTAINMENT UNDREAMED OF! 12,000 PLAYERS! 200 MIGHTY SCENES! TOLD TO THE TUNE OF 87 BELOVED SONGS!','Wilson',84084,1.4023,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1943,_binary '\0','/27vPuwocCu8uu8Fnvw7fz4lQtMK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037466',6.6,1807,'en','Wing and a Prayer','An aircraft carrier is sent on a decoy mission around the Pacific, with orders to avoid combat, thus lulling Japanese alertness before the battle of Midway.','/cHx4awWZOTyGLD2eWBkDj7yy6Z1.jpg','1944-01-01',97,'Released','THE MOST DANGEROUS MISSION IN THE WAR!','Wing and a Prayer',69847,1.8841,6.7,'MVvOt6L5ZhY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1944,_binary '\0','/6vXnGv5ly9leE6QGBRCzrUuG2tG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037469',7.6,19797,'en','The Woman in the Window','A seductive woman gets an innocent professor mixed up in murder.','/i8jDpAWByVYaQZJXbsg8XqDOF5y.jpg','1944-10-25',99,'Released','It was the look in her eyes that made him think of murder.','The Woman in the Window',17136,4.2563,7.372,'QO_O8v5JEew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1945,_binary '\0','/zz0xYmH3T4dZpFAXOnbywjSxbgq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037492',6.3,2554,'en','Bud Abbott and Lou Costello in Hollywood','When two bumbling barbers act as agents for a talented but unknown singer, they stage a phony murder in order to get him a plum role.','/52U8Lcukrr3iOYZSBdmphvUDrGk.jpg','1945-10-05',83,'Released','A double-barrelled fun birst!','Bud Abbott and Lou Costello in Hollywood',46068,2.0427,5.8,'pXJ84LJfKzc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1946,_binary '\0','/zxH9yWILhL5JUmOFxfnwWMyRLPE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037494',6.2,1393,'en','Adventure','A rough and tumble man of the sea falls for a meek librarian.','/8FinPadaPJ40JDEzfWIi8q4RV3Y.jpg','1945-12-28',135,'Released','GABLE\'S back and GARSON\'S got him!','Adventure',44869,1.8561,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1947,_binary '\0','/i6vKDaFJOut5BbL23B5JLsCKXO4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037508',6.5,2690,'en','Along Came Jones','An easy-going cowboy is mistaken by the townsfolk for a notorious gunman. The cowboy decides it would be best to leave town, until he meets the gunman\'s girlfriend.','/6rVRbRvhHsKRN2FVPj2czV8rs4Q.jpg','1945-07-19',90,'Released','IT\'S THE WEST AT ITS BEST! WITH ROOTIN\'...TOOTIN\'...SHOOTIN\' COOPER!','Along Came Jones',72163,2.3935,5.789,'X1YiEBa3yqE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1948,_binary '\0','/oRw716yj4jgshktF03s2is7HGun.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037514',7,10115,'en','Anchors Aweigh','Two sailors on shore leave head out for four days of partying – only to become involved in the affairs of an aspiring singer and her precocious nephew.','/fPa79qA8qaikB0wiloKnfSm9NiJ.jpg','1945-08-13',143,'Released','ON WAVES OF SONG, LAUGHTER AND ROMANCE ! TWO LOVE-LOST SAILORS ON A FOUR-DAY LEAVE OF FUN AND FRIVOLITY !','Anchors Aweigh',17889,2.6493,6.8,'ulZcqaPVw-w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1949,_binary '\0','/anyaK6Ab3g2FQyXpTI36rAWRQsw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037515',7.3,18828,'en','And Then There Were None','Ten strangers are summoned to a remote island and while they are waiting for the mysterious host to appear, a recording levels serious accusations at each of the guests. Soon they start being murdered, one by one. As the survivors try to keep their wits, they reach a disturbing conclusion: one of them must be the killer.','/maV1jQZ58NZIjwRbdtmRcaW3fZo.jpg','1945-10-31',98,'Released',NULL,'And Then There Were None',4886,4.0789,7.049,'mQ5MDXW7v5w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1950,_binary '\0','/zPhP5xxoOBRoj6czKkof92eYN1i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037522',6.6,4730,'en','Back to Bataan','A U.S. Army colonel leads local fighters in a guerrilla campaign against the Japanese in the Philippines.','/3AQRnZbdjiAvabgrDMc3NfXPQkF.jpg','1945-05-30',95,'Released','SEE! Battle of Bataan! March of Death! Guerilla Raids! Fierce bolo fighters in action!','Back to Bataan',19096,2.8981,6.1,'ky2Gk2EHCko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1951,_binary '\0','/v5UW9OP2vjPJAY5UcHUdI3OgPNg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037536',7.2,10666,'en','The Bells of St. Mary\'s','Father O\'Malley is sent to St. Mary\'s, a run-down parochial school on the verge of condemnation. He and Sister Benedict work together in an attempt to save the school, though their differing methods often lead to good-natured disagreements.','/e2REwGOzsD21acHSRcXcXzkQmUi.jpg','1945-12-27',126,'Released','The Whole World\'s in Tune... with Bing and Bergman together at their most brilliant best!','The Bells of St. Mary\'s',32430,3.9539,6.8,'vwE2HDSRtaA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1952,_binary '\0','/ogG40ZQhBIjTS8TG4PPJSVSTJ7V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037547',6,2533,'en','Blood on the Sun','Nick Condon, an American journalist in 20s Tokyo, publishes the Japanese master plan for world domination. Reaction from the understandably upset Japanese provides the action, but this is overshadowed by the propaganda of the time.','/hZ4IDpM7MBdHRTQL6vYZu9jYBvu.jpg','1945-04-26',94,'Released','Having a wonderful time In Tokyo!','Blood on the Sun',75888,2.4338,5.9,'gCSoCGlRFvs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1953,_binary '\0','/v3sRVoYfBNUAwAXQgEOa5CL3aeI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037549',7.3,11315,'en','The Body Snatcher','Edinburgh, 1831. Among those who undertake the illegal trade of grave robbery is Gray, ostensibly a cab driver. Formerly a medical student convicted of grave robbery, Gray holds a grudge against Dr. MacFarlane who had escaped detection and punishment.','/1dOCP2ahMVlA95SivxhEdVvcXZE.jpg','1945-05-25',78,'Released','GRAVES RAIDED! COFFINS ROBBED! CORPSES CARVED! MIDNIGHT MURDER! BODY BLACKMAIL! STALKING GHOULS! Mad Thrills of Terror And Macabre Mystery... –and don\'t blame us if you stay awake all night!','The Body Snatcher',30346,3.3391,7,'CM2ZwiLzR30','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1954,_binary '\0','/asREEOHNJulwpLzG86PSR3Hsbdi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037557',6.6,1749,'en','Brewster\'s Millions','Monty Brewster is a pennyless, former U.S. Army soldier back from World War II Europe who learns that he has inherited $8 million from a distant relative. But there\'s a catch: he must spend $1 million of that money in less than two months before his 30th birthday in order to inherit the rest.','/kMQHIeoQYH0Bi5YWyhpMS2vTf0i.jpg','1945-04-07',79,'Released','It\'s a HOWLUVA Lot of Fun!','Brewster\'s Millions',43489,1.3707,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1955,_binary '\0','/vKvoOlhhaZCsiGQDvaZQqyGq1oA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037558',8,49239,'en','Brief Encounter','Returning home from a shopping trip to a nearby town, bored suburban housewife Laura Jesson is thrown by happenstance into an acquaintance with virtuous doctor Alec Harvey. Their casual friendship soon develops during their weekly visits into something more emotionally fulfilling than either expected, and they must wrestle with the potential havoc their deepening relationship would have on their lives and the lives of those they love.','/jC9EwLJcGhYMSQAHu2LxkKN5v7O.jpg','1945-11-24',86,'Released','A story of the most precious moments in a woman\'s life!','Brief Encounter',851,7.0665,7.705,'TtIN_HQHBdA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1956,_binary '\0','/gcFxYJ2BKTwlzofoUUHyymr3pHo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037563',6.2,1584,'en','The Bullfighters','Bumbling detective Stan Laurel disguises himself as a famous matador in order to hide from the vengeful Richard K. Muldoon, who spent time in prison on Stan\'s bogus testimony.','/sxXu8LwRR8kNalvHMdK1uB9JFOq.jpg','1945-05-01',61,'Released',NULL,'The Bullfighters',58732,1.3638,5.961,'Vu7FStoxpRo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1957,_binary '\0','/9IiXU6ekQONqqikCtrju1KQzbKE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037576',6.3,2441,'en','Captain Kidd','Cutthroat pirate William Kidd captures Admiral Blayne\'s treasure ship and hides the bounty in a cave. Three years later, Kidd, posing as a respectable merchant captain, offers his services to the King of England. Seeking a social position, Kidd also negotiates for Blayne\'s title and lands, provided he can prove Blayne was associated with piracy. Launched upon his royal mission, Kidd is unaware that Blayne\'s son Adam is among the crew, determined to clear his father\'s name.','/o6Ag6fl5wRX1lwVXq5fP6lHYpsN.jpg','1945-11-22',89,'Released','Swashbuckling Adventure of the PRINCE of PIRATES!','Captain Kidd',15401,2.6204,6.3,'nAZdL0e1bwE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1958,_binary '\0','/2TBfuHBQtPjWf3DxJ4Lj8S6xbDJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037595',7.3,13846,'en','Christmas in Connecticut','While recovering in a hospital, war hero Jefferson Jones grows familiar with the \"Diary of a Housewife\" column written by Elizabeth Lane. Jeff\'s nurse arranges with Elizabeth\'s publisher, Alexander Yardley, for Jeff to spend the holiday at Elizabeth\'s bucolic Connecticut farm with her husband and child. But the column is a sham, so Elizabeth and her editor, Dudley Beecham, in fear of losing their jobs, hasten to set up the single, childless and entirely nondomestic Elizabeth on a country farm.','/oH1hM9wOZZflPZ5smKqWXvLXcyX.jpg','1945-07-27',102,'Released','The romancin\'s rosy and the fun\'s furious and everybody\'s going to be there! You\'re invited!','Christmas in Connecticut',13669,2.4629,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1959,_binary '\0','/kySsSz5ZfDXZjzRetK1Kryv5alF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037604',7.3,4492,'en','The Clock','A G.I. en route to Europe falls in love during a whirlwind two-day leave in New York City.','/wyfIzEASD2M6ECWIunOVsZHjk0s.jpg','1945-05-25',90,'Released','Every second a heart-beat.','The Clock',54028,2.5642,7.1,'-BLgNwANu8A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1960,_binary '\0','/gcGPnm0AVMtd08RrITaY2BjVxeT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037610',6.5,1619,'en','Confidential Agent','During the Spanish Civil War, an agent on a mission to purchase coal meets with murder and counterspies.','/kcswwGt162T9BAXN1uc22xA4AFM.jpg','1945-11-02',118,'Released','You\'ll see the screen cook when \"The Lover\" meets \"The Look\"!!!','Confidential Agent',160660,2.4495,5.5,'8yh77ZURYDo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1961,_binary '\0','/tLUANAgxUMhzlVxOgLKaRK0KCNB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037611',7.2,5490,'en','Conflict','Unhappily married Richard Mason concocts a meticulous scheme to kill his shrewish wife so that he\'ll be free to marry her sister.','/kzVULA1agXKgi5cc2fbyWiDKiuF.jpg','1945-06-15',86,'Released','SUSPENSE...SUSPICION...MAN-WOMAN DESIRES!','Conflict',26654,2.0822,6.7,'P0IcpAJnWqI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1962,_binary '\0','/4EbZ11wd00NmE3Ou4kJdoORIY9j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037614',7.3,3532,'en','The Corn Is Green','When a teacher reads an essay written by Morgan Evans, one of the boys, moved by his rough poetry she decides to hold classes in her house and believes that Morgan is smart enough to attend Oxford.','/OYjEXE6onZT4riWiWHwozMfdeZ.jpg','1945-03-29',115,'Released','In her heart of hearts she knew she\'d never hold him.','The Corn Is Green',43492,2.6864,7.2,'6AbHztmp7DY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1963,_binary '\0','/lF6kUKZ4EAb6mM41uNMNhQbYpxS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037615',6.7,2827,'en','Cornered','A World War II veteran hunts down the Nazi collaborators who killed his wife.','/8Tnliph0BmvpSIkEshWI2Ms6IpB.jpg','1945-11-23',102,'Released',NULL,'Cornered',35954,1.7429,6.2,'3pIhdImiNrE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1964,_binary '\0','/8XqjukK63vhVKWH83vcxsN0bFO3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037627',6,1901,'en','Dakota','In 1871, professional gambler John Devlin elopes with Sandra \"Sandy\" Poli, daughter of Marko Poli, an immigrant who has risen to railroad tycoon. Sandy, knowing that the railroad is to be extended into Dakota, plans to use their $20,000 nest egg to buy land options to sell to the railroad at a profit. On the stage trip to Ft. Abercrombie, their fellow passengers are Jim Bender and Bigtree Collins, who practically own the town of Fargo and Devlin is aware that they are prepared to protect the little empire... trying to drive out the farmers by burning their property, destroying their wheat, and blaming the devastation on the Indians. Continuing their journey north on the river aboard the \"River Bird\', Sandy and John meet Captain Bounce, an irascible old seafarer. Two of Bendender\'s henchmen, Slagin and Carp, board the boat and relieve John of his $20,000 at gunpoint. Captain Bounce, chasing the robber\'s dinghy..','/gqnyYhIgDuJWaaE8gS8AA0MBP1C.jpg','1945-12-15',82,'Released','THE YEAR\'S TOP ACTION ROMANCE!','Dakota',58455,1.5584,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1965,_binary '\0','/oyNMFo2m3HhaKvWKv0m057keDC6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037630',7.1,5238,'fr','Les Dames du bois de Boulogne','A love story that follows the maneuverings of a society lady as she connives to initiate a scandalous affair between her aristocratic ex-lover and a prostitute.','/mLjWbWdzHsfnxrYQX5enDsTpnmw.jpg','1945-09-21',84,'Released',NULL,'Les Dames du bois de Boulogne',49845,2.1464,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1966,_binary '\0','/9usqa6XNwQIduTwWh55F1xx0FLE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037635',7.5,16079,'en','Dead of Night','An architect, visiting an English country house, realizes the other guests are familiar from his recurring nightmare. When they share their tales of the supernatural, he is filled with a growing dread.','/6bpPtLRMbfSkH0k6sLdJRIcEeq3.jpg','1945-09-09',103,'Released','The unexpected, the tragic, the comic, the romantic, the dramatic...','Dead of Night',13581,4.1587,7.2,'8UCJz617E8s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1967,_binary '\0','/uGOKN4VeCsf249zypWfaAzfTxAB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037638',7.3,22473,'en','Detour','The life of Al Roberts, a pianist in a New York nightclub, turns into a nightmare when he decides to hitchhike to Los Angeles to visit his girlfriend.','/gJb9HRAs1V4bA0VKsWpT6mhv2RT.jpg','1945-11-30',68,'Released','He went searching for love… but fate forced a DETOUR to revelry… violence… mystery!','Detour',20367,2.5991,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1968,_binary '\0','/yPLcs4CZcP5tx3mavf02836KDRz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037642',5.9,1852,'en','Dick Tracy','Dick is faced with a series of brutal murders in which the victims, all from different social and economic backgrounds, are viciously slashed to pieces. Suspects abound but Tracy, getting a clue that there will be 15 murders in all, must find the common thread among the victims before more are killed.','/6fpQCSEMxFUNMIYYm2T1JlgwWgj.jpg','1945-12-01',61,'Released','Hero to 30,000,000... Thrilling on the Screen!','Dick Tracy',112842,2.3514,5.2,'cyT_8siZG8A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1969,_binary '\0','/loAiiv4A511550m9cps1ciTGVhI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037644',6.5,2471,'en','Dillinger','The life of American public enemy number one who was shot by the police in 1934.','/52fF9VV0ImOBtTKpAfKVYRVuuRv.jpg','1945-04-25',70,'Released','A Cold Blooded Bandit and a Hot Blooded Blonde ... who stopped at Nothing!','Dillinger',28115,1.5285,5.9,'7df6vmwoz7c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1970,_binary '\0','/oNSeVEaJfvTtO9fwcsQ7hxC15Z4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037671',7.5,3978,'en','The Enchanted Cottage','A homely maid and a scarred ex-GI meet at the cottage where she works and where he was to spend his honeymoon prior to his accident. The two develop a bond and agree to marry, more out of loneliness than love. The romantic spirit of the cottage, however, overtakes them. They soon begin to look beautiful to each other, but no one else.','/tLDER6R4oIbi6WabLSvm1NedArP.jpg','1945-04-28',91,'Released','The whole town WHISPERED about these two!','The Enchanted Cottage',43494,2.0999,7.4,'tSfmY9sn61Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1971,_binary '\0','/ubERa5VEJlBRglxDSBSL0YBG7XB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037674',8.3,22743,'fr','Les Enfants du Paradis','In a chaotic 19th-century Paris teeming with aristocrats, thieves, psychics, and courtesans, theater mime Baptiste is in love with the mysterious actress Garance. But Garance, in turn, is loved by three other men: pretentious actor Frederick, conniving thief Lacenaire, and Count Edouard of Montray.','/yiy9stl1jjVhW44ypkWMFDT8Ix3.jpg','1945-03-15',190,'Released','AT LAST! The Celebrated French Film.','Children of Paradise',2457,4.517,8,'GfqRRYDLKS8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1972,_binary '\0','/xiUeFsVrG8O4oBbd2lMNe66fkD4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037678',5.9,1318,'en','Escape in the Fog','A military nurse recovering from a nervous breakdown at an inn keeps having dreams where she witnesses two men trying to murder a third. When she meets a federal agent, she\'s astounded to discover that he is the victim from her visions.','/81h4vZJNQPhisVOmZ48uA44pIiv.jpg','1945-04-05',63,'Released','Slipping silently out of the fog... came murder!','Escape in the Fog',30102,1.6808,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1973,_binary '\0','/yNqFvR6HH2OxZWwEygbWUXPm8uD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037691',7,7373,'en','Fallen Angel','An unemployed drifter, Eric Stanton wanders into a small California town and begins hanging around the local diner. While Eric falls for the lovely waitress Stella, he also begins romancing a quiet and well-to-do woman named June Mills. Since Stella isn\'t interested in Eric unless he has money, the lovelorn guy comes up with a scheme to win her over, and it involves June. Before long, murder works its way into this passionate love triangle.','/8WLGwhpJWaSu8W8geauaaWpJC8A.jpg','1945-11-15',98,'Released','The creator of \"Laura\" does it again!','Fallen Angel',26243,6.9566,6.6,'-hIA82_TuFo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1974,_binary '\0','/kWEKqm6ZoQBkXNSHSUdF86B1Pyn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037702',6.2,1779,'en','Flame of Barbary Coast','Duke Fergus falls for Ann \'Flaxen\' Tarry in the Barbary Coast in turn-of-the-century San Francisco. He loses money to crooked gambler Boss Tito Morell, goes home, learns to gamble, and returns. After he makes a fortune, he opens his own place with Flaxen as the entertainer; but the 1906 quake destroys his place.','/cuW9HCAXQFkfhJhDutugC3JlOMU.jpg','1945-05-28',91,'Released','The brawling, colorful story of the queen of hearts and the ace of gamblers... with a shock climax such as the screen has never known!','Flame of Barbary Coast',40716,2.513,5.5,'zpbwukjf4Eg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1975,_binary '\0','/ipgLKNmncP4iRC8VixCRX5BMzCy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037722',5.8,1328,'en','The Frozen Ghost','When a man dies of a heart attack, a stage and radio mentalist believes he has willed him to die because he was angry with the man. Riddled with guilt, the mentalist cancels further shows, breaks off his engagement to his female partner, who can read minds while in a hypnotic trance, and takes refuge in the eerie wax-museum-cum-home of another woman friend.','/oA1yY7hW6i259eTXxeFMqmYStHl.jpg','1945-06-01',61,'Released','The screen\'s newest Inner Sanctum Mystery!','The Frozen Ghost',64078,1.4481,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1976,_binary '\0','/xWEV5xrSSSt6DEJTbvo7NjXHdUy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037749',6.5,1638,'en','The Great Flamarion','A beautiful but unscrupulous female performer manipulates all the men in her life in order to achieve her aims.','/u6u1XCswVV3ESYzgX9896y3gMzo.jpg','1945-01-13',78,'Released','Great with a gun!!','The Great Flamarion',35543,1.319,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1977,_binary '\0','/zt9O1O3PXOLrDPF2rOPmAeF68mA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037761',7.3,4619,'en','Hangover Square','When composer George Harvey Bone wakes with no memory of the previous night and a bloody knife in his pocket, he worries that he has committed a crime. On the advice of Dr. Middleton, Bone agrees to relax, going to a music performance by singer Netta Longdon. Riveted by Netta, Bone agrees to write songs for her rather than his own concerto. However, Bone soon grows jealous of Netta and worries about controlling himself during his spells.','/hKkeuelnX0cr5xZHys2wfpAnbm2.jpg','1945-02-07',78,'Released','THE SCREEN\'S MOST Terrifying LOVE STORY! EXCITING MYSTERY AND STRANGE EMOTION!','Hangover Square',35849,1.5983,7.032,'SW-KkfL7Zv4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1978,_binary '\0','/iiWXU5mO1m8mkd54PnD8D3A23GE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037771',6.6,1600,'en','Here Come the Co-Eds','Molly, her brother, Slats, and his pal, Oliver, are taxi dancers at the Miramar Ballroom. As a publicity stunt, Slats plants an article about Molly claiming her ambition is to earn enough money to attend staid, all-girl Bixby College. Bixby\'s progressive dean offers Molly a scholarship. Molly accepts on the condition that Slats and Oliver come along too as campus caretakers. But the pompous Chairman threatens to foreclose on the school\'s mortgage if Molly isn\'t expelled. Together, the trio, with the help of some new friends, concocts a scheme to raise enough money to save the school. The plan involves a bet on the Bixby basketball team, which is playing in a game rated at 20 to 1 by the local bookie. But the bookie has other plans for their dough and hires a group of ringers to step in for the opponents. All is not lost, at least while Oliver has the chance to turn things around for his friends-one way or another.','/6V3Qhpbv8CJZHc2YXf5ATPMaVrY.jpg','1945-02-02',90,'Released','They\'re the Teacher\'s Petters...In a Girl\'s School!','Here Come the Co-Eds',33482,2.0687,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1979,_binary '\0','/i8jRozUUJ1VaMEnJdziaUmCw0OY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037790',6.6,1662,'en','The Horn Blows at Midnight','A trumpet player in a radio orchestra falls asleep during a commercial and dreams he\'s Athanael, an angel deputized to blow the Last Trumpet at exactly midnight on Earth, thus marking the end of the world.','/5fT50i4TAcxgUMHkbdrqzG1GxB1.jpg','1945-04-28',78,'Released','The curfew blows at midnight but the laughs go on forever!!!','The Horn Blows at Midnight',64925,1.7038,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1980,_binary '\0','/2yPeVCim2ugYiYVgSFxZBhDbdpb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037793',5.7,6904,'en','House of Dracula','A scientist working on cures for rare afflictions, such as a bone softening agent made from molds to allow him to correct the spinal deformity of his nurse, finds the physical causes of lycanthropy in wolf-man Larry Talbot and of vampirism in Count Dracula, but himself becomes afflicted with homicidal madness while exchanging blood with Dracula.','/x2HZq0CjGJbU90Q8Bm7jDKBM7ZG.jpg','1945-12-07',64,'Released','HORROR UPON HORROR in the HOUSE OF DRACULA','House of Dracula',30793,2.9866,5.5,'6KLf-PjcxQg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1981,_binary '\0','/s5MiaLHRcrz82MN8z45AmBFhYVE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037794',7.2,6265,'en','The House of Fear','The Good Comrades are a collection of varied gentlemen who crave one thing - solitude. They reside at Drearcliff House, ancestral home of their eldest member. All seems serene and convivial until one by one the members begin to perish in the most grisly of manners. Foul play is suspected by the Good Comrades\' insurance agent, who turns to Sherlock Holmes and Dr. John Watson for guidance.','/3tHTXEnBmnTX4tJUQ5JAIKosp3d.jpg','1945-03-16',69,'Released','HORROR stalking its halls!','The House of Fear',33419,2.2262,6.914,'i2G7J8LC_Ec','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1982,_binary '\0','/2bsB9TcE2g02kMoLltkKxVx1oan.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037795',6.6,3580,'en','The House on 92nd Street','The US Government tries to track down embedded Nazi agents in the States.','/3jhJqRXQHm4l5LQjbiRTltFZZHq.jpg','1945-09-10',88,'Released','The F.B.I.\'s own tense, terrific story behind the protection of the ATOMIC BOMB!','The House on 92nd Street',42295,2.0877,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1983,_binary '\0','/thMFavG6WLWpZucD3DT3npAPuXC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037798',2.6,3105,'en','I Accuse My Parents','Ignored by his alcoholic parents, Jimmy Wilson starts hanging around with some shady characters. After falling in love with a lounge singer, Jimmy tries to impress her by doing jobs for her shady boss. After one of these jobs goes bad, Jimmy ends up on the run. Eventually, he must confront the truth, his past, and his parents. The judge cites parental neglect in the case of a teenager (John Miljan) charged with murder.','/A4IdQ6lI1cPylgwNhMNgTnGZIzN.jpg','1944-10-27',68,'Released',NULL,'I Accuse My Parents',31282,1.8174,2.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1984,_binary '\0','/nDfHT9HvEyRFrjctodwqxZ7Yuem.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037800',7.4,11555,'en','I Know Where I\'m Going!','Plucky Englishwoman Joan Webster travels to the remote islands of the Scottish Hebrides in order to marry a wealthy industrialist. Trapped by inclement weather on the Isle of Mull and unable to continue to her destination, Joan finds herself charmed by the straightforward, no-nonsense islanders around her, and becomes increasingly attracted to naval officer Torquil MacNeil, who holds a secret that may change her life forever.','/woAOLgYVUmLBtWNxTJgAnqGwyuL.jpg','1945-11-16',91,'Released',NULL,'I Know Where I\'m Going!',56137,2.4019,7.085,'EVXs_bUXQ_8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1985,_binary '\0','/9zXy1IaPY2VLtVTKdkn6AaYQmXJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037820',6.4,5825,'en','Isle of the Dead','On a Greek island during the 1912 war, several people are trapped by quarantine for the plague. If that isn\'t enough worry, one of the people—a superstitious old peasant—suspects a young woman of being a vampiric demon.','/eHnxz2K8fuUR5qwmkhdurBpZ5z0.jpg','1945-09-07',72,'Released','A grave\'s dank darkness smothers the screams of a girl still alive!','Isle of the Dead',30348,2.448,6.033,'fI4D8KokkWg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1986,_binary '\0','/ohn9zA2dUbVuo4ajx32Em97qvMr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037824',7.6,11917,'ru','Иван Грозный','Set during the early part of his reign, Ivan faces betrayal from the aristocracy and even his closest friends as he seeks to unite the Russian people. Sergei Eisenstein\'s final film, this is the first part of a three-part biopic of Tsar Ivan IV of Russia, which was never completed due to the producer\'s dissatisfaction with Eisenstein\'s attempts to use forbidden experimental filming techniques and excessive cost overruns. The second part was completed but not released for a decade after Eisenstein\'s death and a change of heart in the USSR government toward his work; the third part was only in its earliest stage of filming when shooting was stopped altogether.','/rzFWfdq6CXLCnlfXTTZs9W9dMR2.jpg','1944-11-11',95,'Released',NULL,'Ivan the Terrible, Part I',9797,2.5454,7.3,'JcJkHCihTmE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1987,_binary '\0','/bXnfCm3qpYJwURwgClgEZwzKBiC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037826',6.2,1460,'en','The Jade Mask','The latest assignment for respected detective Charlie Chan has come directly from the government and involves the disappearance of a scientist named Harper, who was working on an extremely important serum. When the scientist is killed, Chan must sort through all very likely suspects, including the man\'s sister and his butler.','/tjqMZz6YjOyyY83QYXJNDssMClr.jpg','1945-01-26',66,'Released','A MYSTERY MANSION...Where death lurks in every dark corner and a mad genius runs loose!','The Jade Mask',38468,1.0407,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1988,_binary '\0','/aWjOzlTHiQZs45pYkrfxx9bGkht.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037832',6.2,1450,'en','Johnny Angel','George Raft plays a sailor who sets out to solve his father\'s mysterious death.','/asBgX6c8kNas1O0WbfoCRUPc1mp.jpg','1945-10-25',79,'Released','A New Orleans Woman Plots Murder and Mutiny For Love!','Johnny Angel',42191,1.5278,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1989,_binary '\0','/cAkRFw4VEKQrCqK6jA596WRnSXv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037859',6.7,2908,'en','Lady on a Train','While watching from her train window, Nikki Collins witnesses a murder in a nearby building. When she alerts the police, they think she has read one too many mystery novels. She then enlists a popular mystery writer to help her solve the crime on her own, but her sleuthing attracts the attentions of suitors and killers.','/9DylvvWcb52Qjq6lzN4lJxOcYyU.jpg','1945-08-03',94,'Released','Deanna... on a Man (Oh! Man) Hunt!','Lady on a Train',30022,2.3274,6.639,'Pqy0UUqoZT8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1990,_binary '\0','/yctQYbmF9ZyRTqdbvkDoL09H7jX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037865',7.6,17250,'en','Leave Her to Heaven','A socialite marries a prominent novelist, which spurs a violent, obsessive, and dangerous jealousy in her.','/aUzQZt2UlaurZ3wlhzVXQb6PQk8.jpg','1945-12-25',110,'Released','Hers was the deadliest of the seven sins!','Leave Her to Heaven',17645,3.9098,7.4,'vfMZ5HKHN1o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1991,_binary '\0','/vyINER8nv4kAJyCIq2Sr1xjOOjC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037884',7.8,43681,'en','The Lost Weekend','Longtime alcoholic Don Birnam has been sober for ten days and appears to be over the worst... but his craving has just become more insidious. Evading a country weekend planned by his brother and girlfriend, he begins a four-day bender that just might be his last – one way or another.','/yL6EJxPeYIcB9TChm56lHqXKzHC.jpg','1945-11-29',101,'Released','The screen dares to open the strange and savage pages of a shocking bestseller!','The Lost Weekend',28580,4.3999,7.614,'eVb2LVcDfTQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1992,_binary '\0','/iJZwCTx2IXAuF6uEzy7lQJiNpJP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037885',7,2056,'en','Love Letters','Alan Quinton, a soldier stationed in Italy during World War II, writes love letters for his ineloquent friend, Roger, to his romantic interest at home, Victoria. Alan falls for Victoria through their correspondence despite his engagement to another. After being wounded, Alan returns home only to learn that Roger and Victoria have died under strange circumstances. However, an amnesiac named Singleton might hold the key to the mystery of their deaths.','/jr4PYYbjRw16AL6pQEpKoVcTXOv.jpg','1945-10-26',101,'Released',NULL,'Love Letters',109881,1.8677,6.538,'crPMj2LevpE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1993,_binary '\0','/iWAijx2874J0QgNVXwqW24IMRai.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037913',7.9,31789,'en','Mildred Pierce','A hard-working mother inches towards disaster as she divorces her husband and starts a successful restaurant business to support her spoiled daughter.','/3bqF5bJPjeITNeC8ydbUOQZfuqP.jpg','1945-10-20',111,'Released','Please don\'t tell anyone what Mildred Pierce did!','Mildred Pierce',3309,3.8132,7.6,'KoOr_OoHbv4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1994,_binary '\0','/oJRGXKcXnggwbOsP9VKwTjPr55q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037931',6.9,2379,'en','Murder, He Says','Pete Marshall is sent as a replacement to the mountain district town of Plainville when a public opinion surveyor who went there goes missing. Visiting the hillbilly family of Mamie Fleagle, Pete begins to suspect that she and her two sons have murdered the surveyor. Pete also believes that Mamie is slowly poisoning wealthy Grandma Fleagle, who has put a vital clue to her fortune in a nonsensical embroidered sampler.','/zVvZNwBYPwVNv1KQKi34N0re5N0.jpg','1945-06-23',91,'Released',NULL,'Murder, He Says',110790,1.3227,6.8,'qyR2uCwL-HE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1995,_binary '\0','/gFl2UbHNznIxxsp4kkKX7lB8uGX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037932',7,4231,'en','My Name Is Julia Ross','Julia Ross secures employment with a wealthy widow and goes to live at her house. Two days later, she awakens in a different house in different clothes and with a new identity.','/ofUTB5ojMTr6mndUxVQan5p8p2X.jpg','1945-11-08',65,'Released','She went to sleep as a secretary ... and woke up a madman\'s \"bride\"!','My Name Is Julia Ross',42077,2.0617,6.7,'98yTPTmBLac','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1996,_binary '\0','/ggvLjcmZ1tdHs7cJCO5uyxc45td.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037939',7,2339,'en','The Naughty Nineties','In the gay \'90s, cardsharps take over a Mississippi riverboat from a kindly captain. Their first act is to change the showboat into a floating gambling house. A ham actor and his bumbling sidekick try to devise a way to help the captain regain ownership of the vessel.','/ilmFwtwiheeAFkDsdqiyCASVqZZ.jpg','1945-06-20',76,'Released','A Show Boat Load of Laughter!','The Naughty Nineties',33536,2.1539,6.7,'xdNYm0-4ubg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1997,_binary '\0','/xh8ux0O751ciw13dmP5HizeoJmd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037954',7.3,6005,'en','Objective, Burma!','A group of men parachute into Japanese-occupied Burma with a dangerous and important mission: to locate and blow up a radar station. They accomplish this well enough, but when they try to rendezvous at an old air-strip to be taken back to their base, they find Japanese waiting for them, and they must make a long, difficult walk back through enemy-occupied jungle.','/3hq4VhEMseKMZuNUaSExDyqGhja.jpg','1945-02-17',142,'Released','An American platoon parachutes into Burma to take out a strategic Japanese outpost','Objective, Burma!',43490,2.7061,6.9,'-FUoC4Oon8Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1998,_binary '\0','/o7gA6yhnIebxHnj21BhEARufb74.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037963',7.6,2713,'en','Our Vines Have Tender Grapes','Welcome to Fuller Junction, Wisconsin, a friendly small town settled by Norwegian farmers. Here we see the exploits of two young cousins, Selma and Arnold, who learn about their world and experience the ups and downs of life as the season pass.','/pImRa1RwYGtAOk3JxWUG5aOKo08.jpg','1945-09-06',105,'Released','M-G-M\'s true-to-life drama','Our Vines Have Tender Grapes',108843,2.1893,7.1,'snA0dexRgrs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(1999,_binary '\0','/puPgkq1giC3WxzPCkNd71yYdePW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037980',7.1,1829,'en','Perfect Strangers','After World War II service changes them, a married couple dread their postwar reunion.','/sI1jTzZRkGv7HhIrPwPftgruzTc.jpg','1945-10-15',102,'Released','Mr. Chips Is Back In A New Thrilling Romance!','Perfect Strangers',182756,1.7659,6.6,'JXm3AxynMP0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2000,_binary '\0','/kXGTMl6J8URO3ZCg2BtQqHbCBKG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037981',7.4,1258,'es','La perla','Fisherman Quino and his wife Juana are very poor and desperate because the town\'s foreign doctor refuses to treat their son Coyotito, who has been bitten by a scorpion. When Quino unexpectedly finds a magnificent pearl in the sea, Juana senses that the discovery will only bring them misfortune and tries to convince her husband to return it to the sea.','/yWnAJPPrsyxZY7mQY0SVyAb90na.jpg','1947-09-12',86,'Released','Steinbeck\'s most talked-about story!','The Pearl',43459,1.2279,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2001,_binary '\0','/6LF0NpAu1Ea8ZlWTjwm4lWaBsyp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0037988',7.5,16266,'en','The Picture of Dorian Gray','A handsome young man trades his soul so that his portrait ages while he stays eternally young.','/mfvcsmAzdie8YuWI0JpO2u1uzfF.jpg','1945-03-03',111,'Released','Why did women talk about Dorian Gray in whispers?','The Picture of Dorian Gray',16559,4.5581,7.1,'jp7xAM-ZCCg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2002,_binary '\0','/zNcamSDSunP4l55pWijIhCodLI6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038000',7.3,1843,'en','Pride of the Marines','Marine hero Al Schmid is blinded in battle and returns home to be rehabilitated. He readjusts to his civilian life with the help of his soon to be wife.','/jpDRMCsw1TsLVrrZgkecneIbHeD.jpg','1945-08-24',119,'Released','A love story born out of the bedrock of the human spirit','Pride of the Marines',52337,2.3737,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2003,_binary '\0','/85boGrk5fP4mmGiiOEIhaO5xfE3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038008',6.7,4628,'en','Pursuit to Algiers','After the King of Rovenia has been assassinated, Holmes and Watson are engaged to escort his son to Europe via Algiers, aboard a transatlantic ocean liner which also carries a number of suspicious persons, any of whom may be involved in a plot to also assassinate him.','/gkhEUBlbiLULLJxSrbsYZdlwxdZ.jpg','1945-10-26',65,'Released',NULL,'Pursuit to Algiers',50401,1.7031,6.9,'H4ZkOx1zwUU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2004,_binary '\0','/lIri93wvchHFq97Y4lf4hpHVHPA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038026',7.1,1932,'en','Rhapsody in Blue','Fictionalized biography of George Gershwin and his fight to bring serious music to Broadway.','/qTSRbFWtwp5EOryh0tLGrSihEwE.jpg','1945-06-27',161,'Released','The jubilant story of George Gershwin.','Rhapsody in Blue',43491,1.8653,6.6,'1mqqnh2mDP8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2005,_binary '\0','/rpnilQ69Pua9q8gAKKlrgHE5qfx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038032',7.1,3998,'en','Road to Utopia','While on a ship to Skagway, Alaska, Duke and Chester find a map to a secret gold mine, which had been \'stolen\' by thugs. In Alaska to recover her father\'s map, Sal Van Hoyden falls in with Ace Larson, who secretly wants to steal the gold mine for himself. Duke, Chester, the thugs, Ace and his henchman chase each other all over the countryside—for the map.','/3N5YNjkwSJxppBCilUZZjMdCyI5.jpg','1946-02-27',90,'Released','Paramount\'s most riotous \"Road\" show!','Road to Utopia',29021,1.702,6.8,'2wmQqUfgFbQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2006,_binary '\0','/wB4CazN8fb3HnLF3RcbsakDlhuV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038040',6.7,1322,'en','A Royal Scandal','Catherine the Great falls in love with an army officer who is plotting against her.','/cv25KxImscW0OoyO6Qju6DniveP.jpg','1945-03-26',94,'Released','Saucy! Naughty! Delicious!','A Royal Scandal',77123,1.9089,6.9,'mqYkL5i9c7g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2007,_binary '\0','/85qxyZCdAiZgZZI0eLMBXDDgw4m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038048',6.3,2095,'en','San Antonio','Rancher Clay Hardin arrives in San Antonio to search for and capture Roy Stuart, notorious leader of a gang of cattle rustlers. The vicious outlaw is indeed in the Texan town, intent on winning the affections of a beautiful chanteuse named Jeanne Starr. When the lovely lady meets and falls in love with the charismatic Hardin, the stakes for both men become higher.','/vwLq4HsUrjnfaQq1cwYzUCKnZ60.jpg','1945-12-29',109,'Released','Warner\'s Adventure of the Century!','San Antonio',17818,1.8159,6.071,'90VM_OuNoIw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2008,_binary '\0','/xTyjYMJOFcGzv0bWiQJlBaKm9fW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038053',6.3,1760,'en','Saratoga Trunk','An opportunistic Texas gambler and the exiled Creole daughter of an aristocratic family join forces to achieve justice from the society that has ostracized them.','/5FyEqAihmhGBiOWqLOWMvxE0vq2.jpg','1945-11-21',135,'Released','ON THE SCREEN AT LAST! DESTINED FOR GREATNESS!','Saratoga Trunk',46563,1.5819,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2009,_binary '\0','/hoW2FVYeR1DsyGpSFDo4tMl7r7f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038056',6.3,1731,'en','The Scarlet Clue','Chinese sleuth Charlie Chan discovers a scheme for the theft of government radar plans while investigating several murders.','/vsDnujk7PDjccm2oJyDSRLXDlaI.jpg','1945-05-11',65,'Released','CHAN FACES HIS MOST DIABOLIC ENEMY!','The Scarlet Clue',38467,1.1674,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2010,_binary '\0','/g0phljbAcccz7bkSZpFEPVLuIRP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038057',7.7,21657,'en','Scarlet Street','Cashier and part-time starving artist Christopher Cross is absolutely smitten with the beautiful Kitty March. Kitty plays along, but she\'s really only interested in Johnny, a two-bit crook. When Kitty and Johnny find out that art dealers are interested in Chris\'s work, they con him into letting Kitty take credit for the paintings. Cross allows it because he is in love with Kitty, but his love will only let her get away with so much.','/eGEDor1BWSQGaLtOntPHUSqNzRC.jpg','1945-12-25',103,'Released','The things she does to men can end only one way - in murder!','Scarlet Street',17058,4.4347,7.6,'9Z8QoTWAyP4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2011,_binary '\0','/hj7RjkgPrn7H43Qu3hFBGSf6y0o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038080',6.4,1422,'en','The Shanghai Cobra','Someone is attempting to steal radium stored in a bank. Death by cobra venom connects a number of murders. Charlie Chan investigates.','/cCBMMKluSdIzG5pzCjYRRpNU2MD.jpg','1945-09-29',64,'Released','Charlie Chan at his best in his most thrilling adventure!','The Shanghai Cobra',38465,1.1852,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2012,_binary '\0','/xGJFqFeiCthuHOwXw50qmSOha2e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038104',6.6,1770,'en','A Song to Remember','Prof. Joseph Elsner guides his protégé Frydryk Chopin through his formative years to early adulthood in Poland. The professor takes him to Paris, where he eventually comes under the wing and influence of novelist George Sand and rises to prominence in the music world, to the exclusion of his old friends and patriotic feelings towards Poland.','/lyERBKfUZAE1RyXQn6jvE2wQ0s3.jpg','1945-01-19',113,'Released','As long as the world loves a lover…this romance will live!','A Song to Remember',119764,2.5957,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2013,_binary '\0','/qVgP6MDPscPnt9LGQo0OuJctDcA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038107',7.1,4373,'en','The Southerner','Sam Tucker, a cotton picker, in search of a better future for his family, decides to grow his own cotton crop. In the first year, the Tuckers battle disease, a flood, and a jealous neighbor. Can they make it as farmers?','/bCX8D1Zpk1SXCCYLIq5p5o1p5ly.jpg','1945-04-30',92,'Released','The picture that never lets go of your heart!','The Southerner',45219,1.9915,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2014,_binary '\0','/c5yL92LGa4EYX8uhQeMvYyfsZNH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038108',6.3,2121,'en','The Spanish Main','Laurent van Horn is the leader of a band of Dutch refugees on a ship seeking freedom in the Carolinas, when the ship is wrecked on the coast of Cartagene, governed by Don Juan Alvardo, a Spanish ruler. Alvarado has Laurent thrown in prison, but the latter escapes, and five-years later is a pirate leader. He poses as the navigator on a ship in which Contessa Francesca, daughter of a Mexican noble, is traveling on her way to marry Alvarado, whom she has never seen. Laurent\'s pirates capture the ship and Francesca, in order to save another ship, gives her hand-in-marriage to Laurent, who sails her to the pirate hideout. This irks his jealous pirate comrades Anne Bonney and Captain Benjamin Black. They overpower Laurent and send Francesca to Alvarado, and then Mario du Billar, a trusted right-hand man, makes a deal to deliver Laurent to Alvarado.','/9I6sv8uaZQTnSX78Pqpp4bogv4n.jpg','1945-10-01',100,'Released','Loving her . . . taming her . . . called for all his reckless daring!','The Spanish Main',97735,2.0068,6.457,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2015,_binary '\0','/45HFziT30x25QxQdWPkhSIqFbKR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038109',7.5,55867,'en','Spellbound','When Dr. Anthony Edwardes arrives at a Vermont mental hospital to replace the outgoing hospital director, Dr. Constance Peterson, a psychoanalyst, discovers Edwardes is actually an impostor. The man confesses that the real Dr. Edwardes is dead and fears he may have killed him, but cannot recall anything. Dr. Peterson, however is convinced his impostor is innocent of the man\'s murder, and joins him on a quest to unravel his amnesia through psychoanalysis.','/dPAox7jGScLBvxKLeRptJIBF7v.jpg','1945-10-31',111,'Released','This is love! Complete...reckless...violent!','Spellbound',4174,4.4757,7.4,'HIBaGIUbXqI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2016,_binary '\0','/kjsFrj41Egk1kf5Z9lPoTS4GGnL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038116',7,4927,'en','State Fair','During their annual visit to the Iowa State Fair, the Frake family enjoy many adventures. Proud patriarch Abel has high hopes for his champion swine Blueboy; and his wife Melissa enters the mincemeat and pickles contest...with hilarious results.','/cmy55K7Qs1WQeGPksHBphjyjh3b.jpg','1945-08-29',100,'Released','For the young in heart! And romantic oldsters, too!','State Fair',27686,1.63,6.623,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2017,_binary '\0','/oRa4kWyXeJVDbzNSCrrGHLLrFto.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038120',7.1,4397,'en','Story of G.I. Joe','War correspondent Ernie Pyle joins Company C, 18th Infantry as this American army unit fights its way across North Africa in World War II. He comes to know the soldiers and finds much human interest material for his readers back in the States. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with The Film Foundation in 2000.','/oOlCfMtwobk2bNgqpXaaf17OtBo.jpg','1945-07-13',108,'Released','The mightiest action drama ever filmed !','Story of G.I. Joe',46614,2.9533,6.5,'u0XDlHb8w2U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2018,_binary '\0','/tRzW65hRFeMp3sKPTEPG0VAa3Mk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038123',6.8,2254,'en','The Strange Affair of Uncle Harry','George Sanders stars in this engrossing melodrama about a very domineering sister who holds a tight grip on her brother -- especially when he shows signs of falling in love.','/zNEJvMYjz7R1vneA39KGxcOSjtF.jpg','1945-08-17',80,'Released','From the Play that shocked Hollywood!','The Strange Affair of Uncle Harry',43269,2.4117,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2019,_binary '\0','/xLrQnusMvyAWrsyOwQajOlGNeiC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038126',6.2,1371,'en','Strange Illusion','An adolescent believes that his widowed mother\'s suitor may have murdered his father.','/nPzXDkET3vUeX6U5Dc5oivKhZGA.jpg','1945-03-31',87,'Released',NULL,'Strange Illusion',41491,0.9687,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2020,_binary '\0','/h7BSu8EH7fwQ9kWiMEGxYussBs0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038151',6.2,2782,'en','Tarzan and the Amazons','A group of archaeologists asks Tarzan to help them find an ancient city in a hidden valley of women. He refuses, but Boy is tricked into doing the job. The queen of the women asks Tarzan to help them.','/3D9irZok7EQ2pLoJLwbVBdedEpQ.jpg','1945-04-29',76,'Released','Hidden City Of Women . . . Forbidden To Men!','Tarzan and the Amazons',55872,2.7708,6.4,'hXtTf-2ohUk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2021,_binary '\0','/iHDx1MZr0BsbT7rigPccuXxNWTX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038160',7.2,10378,'en','They Were Expendable','After a demonstration of new PT boats, Navy brass are still unconvinced of their viability in combat, leaving Lt. \"Rusty\" Ryan frustrated. After the attack on Pearl Harbor, however, Ryan and his buddy Lt. Brickley are told they can finally take their squadron into battle. The PT boats quickly prove their worth, successfully shooting down Japanese planes, relaying messages between islands, and picking off a multitude of enemy ships.','/ejzJHdvEtUVbiLrDE55DRQskYyf.jpg','1945-12-07',135,'Released','A Tribute to Those Who Did So Much... With So Little!','They Were Expendable',18771,2.9288,6.5,'JJqef8133HQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2022,_binary '\0','/kcWYiBWej3JdYbGEVaKYAQGfqYp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038166',6.2,17417,'en','The Three Caballeros','For Donald\'s birthday he receives a box with three gifts inside. The gifts, a movie projector, a pop-up book, and a pinata, each take Donald on wild adventures through Mexico and South America.','/nMfScRxw9wVLoO7LiEjziFAKLSK.jpg','1944-12-21',71,'Released','A CARTOON FIESTA of FUN and FANTASY!','The Three Caballeros',15947,5.5533,6.3,'fS_Xklf08EY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2023,_binary '\0','/55BI6lux6SrOPvlamniB4geAYRY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038178',6.3,1273,'en','Tonight and Every Night','An American girl falls for an RAF pilot while performing at a British music hall.','/b60KhVds1deRvKjA4PcLYATbuqt.jpg','1945-01-09',92,'Released','The screen\'s first dramatic musical','Tonight and Every Night',43497,1.9992,5.5,'XsChXUDCOm0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2024,_binary '\0','/A10txDd3GMo6GqpzBfB41tEFUQI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038182',6.7,4955,'ja','虎の尾を踏む男達','A fugitive lord and his six retainers disguise themselves as monks to bluff their way through a hostile checkpoint.','/lbspqbHnGrGKQMQ83UvIpC28aJh.jpg','1952-04-24',59,'Released',NULL,'The Men Who Tread on the Tiger\'s Tail',36916,2.1546,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2025,_binary '\0','/yCDSn2dO0YLK2wk0CWFgfvQo1V2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038190',8,9134,'en','A Tree Grows in Brooklyn','In Brooklyn circa 1900, the Nolans manage to enjoy life on pennies despite great poverty and Papa\'s alcoholism. We come to know these people well through big and little troubles: Aunt Sissy\'s scandalous succession of \"husbands\"; the removal of the one tree visible from their tenement; and young Francie\'s desire to transfer to a better school...if irresponsible Papa can get his act together.','/oFmmEyjD3tnA8NbbasfeDFMaAjY.jpg','1945-02-28',128,'Released','Each heart-warming character comes alive on the screen!','A Tree Grows in Brooklyn',30177,3.0634,7.536,'8NEsJ5ScGr4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2026,_binary '\0','/84vD7vl79iVebvLRBvzhUPCjLEQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038199',6.5,1582,'en','Two O\'Clock Courage','A cab driver nearly hits a man with amnesia, then helps him unravel his past, only to discover he\'s a murder suspect as she falls for him.','/l5YoNf3VuSwKgxyyAxwa2wGGo7F.jpg','1945-04-13',68,'Released',NULL,'Two O\'Clock Courage',43533,1.9726,6.3,'VSHYxBQ7cFE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2027,_binary '\0','/yfd5hQMky9HttGy56BV3ZVKiV3D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038213',7.3,2795,'en','The Valley of Decision','Mary Rafferty comes from a poor family of steel mill workers in 19th Century Pittsburgh. Her family objects when she goes to work as a maid for the wealthy Scott family which controls the mill. Mary catches the attention of handsome scion Paul Scott, but their romance is complicated by Paul\'s engagement to someone else and a bitter strike among the mill workers.','/kiHMWi0OWMIovdCnd4AbMEyQh3c.jpg','1945-05-03',119,'Released','The Book That Thrilled Millions!','The Valley of Decision',43610,3.8888,7.2,'m3AOQcX4bX0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2028,_binary '\0','/oqt7YeyBCF1uevRdtKlQCVIY7dE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038235',6.9,4591,'en','A Walk in the Sun','It\'s 1943 and the allied landings in and around the town of Salerno,Italy are underway.A platoon from the U.S 36th Infantry Division is tasked with advancing 6 miles inland to blow a bridge before clearing a nearby farmhouse, with the hope of blocking an expected counter attack on the Division\'s bridgehead.','/uHZX36Ls2rtfMZqX1mmhmbV92R8.jpg','1945-12-25',117,'Released','THEY FOUGHT BEST WHEN IT WAS HOPELESS!','A Walk in the Sun',43488,2.325,5.9,'Iu1kR5RJNIw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2029,_binary '\0','/8lTHsJotBr5uRuQTBJccCM6aq6Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038238',7.3,1832,'en','The Way to the Stars','Life on a British bomber base, and the surrounding towns, from the opening days of the Battle of Britain, to the arrival of the Americans, who join in the bomber offensive. The film centres around Pilot Officer Peter Penrose, fresh out of a training unit, who joins the squadron, and quickly discovers about life during war time. He falls for Iris, a young girl who lives at the local hotel, but he becomes disillusioned about marriage, when the squadron commander dies in a raid, and leaves his wife, the hotel manageress, with a young son to bring up. As the war progresses, Penross comes to terms that he has survived, while others have been killed.','/bBxYrwRZ5YSqQplA2pF80JbyOFC.jpg','1945-06-16',109,'Released','Thrills in the sky ! and romance below ...','The Way to the Stars',44087,1.6128,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2030,_binary '\0','/bRLOLTQYiCPoDtRvr27xl0OJKFr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038239',6.6,1536,'en','Week-End at the Waldorf','Anything can happen during a weekend at New York\'s Waldorf-Astoria: a glamorous movie star meets a world-weary war correspondent and mistakes him for a jewel thief; a soldier learns that without an operation he\'ll die and so looks for one last romance with a beautiful but ambitious stenographer; a cub reporter tries to get the goods on a shady man\'s dealing with a foreign potentate.','/3W4gxPk730tRJxZG0d4sv2eNhdq.jpg','1945-10-04',130,'Released','It\'s always exciting and Romantic!','Week-End at the Waldorf',94881,1.6714,6.5,'U1eVUWUAzrw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2031,_binary '\0','/toUfvGmbpaMe5c9UoICnYWxvZCp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038250',6.8,1989,'en','The Wicked Lady','A married woman finds new thrills as a masked robber on the highways.','/732dptVJodpDo0t6VVzt8QstUVO.jpg','1945-11-15',104,'Released','The most daring pair danger ever designed!','The Wicked Lady',41073,1.7059,6.3,'WttS2rSxBrI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2032,_binary '\0','/pk5VFZpU1rZmrAjWCCnX4kMzl3T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038256',6.6,3073,'en','Without Love','In World War II Washington DC, scientist Pat Jamieson\'s assistant, Jamie Rowan, enters a loveless marriage with him. Struggles bring them closer together.','/54ayABmVMl9YVbURzShhRDLXrNQ.jpg','1945-03-22',111,'Released','She was a bashful bride! He walked in his sleep!','Without Love',31998,1.7003,7,'5klgfhyrg_Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2033,_binary '\0','/200TtHs6FAoWBHnGzTlUlFkRiPf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038259',6.6,7839,'en','The Woman in Green','Sherlock Holmes investigates when young women around London turn up murdered, each with a finger severed. Scotland Yard suspects a madman, but Holmes believes the killings to be part of a diabolical plot.','/rWcMZ8IZWeYZDcW6Acoiz1gG3tn.jpg','1945-06-15',68,'Released','From her LIPS — poison that bred MURDER!','The Woman in Green',34327,3.9132,6.5,'AqGu2wRqyiY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2034,_binary '\0','/8q0LHhG9j3bhbT8kp2bUB4RFQDZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038260',6.8,2769,'en','Wonder Man','Boisterous nightclub entertainer Buzzy Bellew was the witness to a murder committed by gangster Ten Grand Jackson. One night, two of Jackson\'s thugs kill Buzzy and dump his body in the lake at Prospect Park in Brooklyn. Buzzy comes back as a ghost and summons his bookworm twin, Edwin Dingle, to Prospect Park so that he can help the police nail Jackson.','/A9PXUextPtjQD4Z7WBopKJzFVtS.jpg','1945-06-08',98,'Released','It\'s Gala-Gala with Girls, Gaiety and that Goldwyn Glamour!','Wonder Man',34127,1.919,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2035,_binary '\0','/ikgmiZRoW28H39L5YDqGw3rY96o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038262',5.9,1268,'en','Yolanda and the Thief','Johnny Riggs, a con man on the lam, finds himself in a Latin-American country named Patria. There, he overhears a convent-bred rich girl praying to her guardian angel for help in managing her tangled business affairs. Riggs decides to materialize as the girl\'s \"angel\", gains her unquestioning confidence, and helps himself to the deluded girl\'s millions. Just as he and his partner are about to flee Patria with their booty, Riggs realizes he has fallen in love with the girl and returns the money, together with a note that is part confession and part love letter. But the larcenous duo\'s escape from Patria turns out to be more difficult than they could ever have imagined.','/3y2LPO85Dzozhvoti8oa9pxAQP9.jpg','1945-11-22',108,'Released','M-G-M\'s Magic Musical in Technicolor!','Yolanda and the Thief',43498,2.1838,6,'-mjZsO9Kokc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2036,_binary '\0','/h8NCk1Dsc8daZDbKXT5a2sFdIV9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038268',5.9,3171,'ja','續 姿三四郎','A few years after his breakthrough, Sanshiro resumes his path to judo mastery—testing his discipline against an American prizefighter and later facing vengeful karate brothers. As rival schools and public spectacle push him toward violence, he must reconcile strength with restraint and the true spirit of his art.','/9rOoa0NfglJ8nkesLonyeXkQZkO.jpg','1945-05-03',83,'Released',NULL,'Sanshiro Sugata, Part Two',45965,1.9023,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2037,_binary '\0','/k0tPyBn36Ot4syZ68AeioShF4YO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038279',6.9,3334,'en','13 Rue Madeleine','Bob Sharkey, an instructor of would-be spies for the Allied Office of Strategic Services, becomes suspicious of one of the latest batch of students, Bill O\'Connell, who is too good at espionage. His boss, Charles Gibson confirms that O\'Connell is really a top German agent, but tells Sharkey to pass him, as they intend to feed the mole false information about the impending D-Day invasion.','/5LWLFo2F618U6nb35PujPuXdEyi.jpg','1947-01-15',95,'Released','The Most Sinister Address in History!','13 Rue Madeleine',18200,1.5728,6.1,'4s_ZJyOkT0g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2038,_binary '\0','/n4umGbZmQHCb61n3JeisH9C8Obj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038284',6.2,1550,'en','Abilene Town','Marshall Dan Mitchell, who is the law in Abilene, has the job of keeping peace between two groups. For a long time, the town had been divided, with the cattlemen and cowboys having one end of town to themselves, while townspeople occupied the other end. Mitchell liked it this way, it made things easier for him, and kept problems from arising between the two factions. However…','/56wUpULMCeytbqgdNDCRksNjMkz.jpg','1946-01-11',89,'Released','Ablaze with guns and guts and glory!','Abilene Town',22349,1.9125,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2039,_binary '\0','/t3KNHcrd6N2nVkCqJRqkimowom4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038289',6.9,2051,'en','I See a Dark Stranger','Proud Irishwoman Bridie Quilty journeys to Dublin while World War II rages across Europe. During her travels, she encounters J. Miller, who recruits her as a Nazi spy. She acquires the necessary information that leads to the breakout of a German spy who holds key information about the Allies\' newest offensive plans. However, the arrival of British officer David Baynes and his romancing of Bridie lead to unexpected consequences.','/2mgCNAsZyGXZ2CFrCylzfkfU6W4.jpg','1946-07-04',112,'Released','The woman hunt is on... For the girl with the little black book.','I See a Dark Stranger',28006,1.473,6.5,'gcsXB-pKBoY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2040,_binary '\0','/u6yUCjP5s5Vcm98jB5v2PIHsGJB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038300',6.8,3478,'en','Angel on My Shoulder','The Devil arranges for a deceased gangster to return to Earth as a well-respected judge to make up for his previous life.','/6nKIHzDdtsWZ1xJOym0IuMUPMvu.jpg','1946-09-20',100,'Released','With an angel on his shoulder...and the devil in his heart!','Angel on My Shoulder',22688,2.5211,6.5,'dGJA9rMWpos','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2041,_binary '\0','/wcuLN4VaPWb59Q0l9edUjmqQuW4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038303',7,2867,'en','Anna and the King of Siam','In 1862, a young Englishwoman becomes royal tutor in Siam and befriends the King.','/yg4hXEWzWsLI3rgzqrC1KzCYzM1.jpg','1946-08-11',128,'Released',NULL,'Anna and the King of Siam',43471,2.6322,6.2,'ftSktC2M9cg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2042,_binary '\0','/7rGlfKh1ZP87tdRcdtYOOGByXxy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038334',7,1526,'fr','La Bataille du rail','During the Second World War, many French railway workers participated in the resistance. Daily acts of sabotage, spectacular derailments: the railway network took many actions against Nazi occupation. Stationmanager Camargue and his deputy, Athos, risk their lives in managing the network in their sector.','/olRrnwadx2JYgphNdSN6PQlQFvE.jpg','1946-02-27',85,'Released',NULL,'The Battle of the Rails',39142,1.8306,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2043,_binary '\0','/sPBH6bM80wSUsPL3SCO14FXx23U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038338',6.5,3462,'en','The Beast with Five Fingers','Locals in an Italian village believe evil has taken over the estate of a recently deceased pianist where murder has taken place. The alleged killer: the pianist\'s severed hand.','/ji8V2Ul2MS0qV2XEqsGqZjfYiGo.jpg','1947-02-08',88,'Released','Your flesh will creep…at the hand that crawls!','The Beast with Five Fingers',41020,2.3299,6.363,'uGs2snwXVao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2044,_binary '\0','/mOh0p0thBRIDxUxgCRnNbt6FNNf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038343',6.8,4795,'en','Bedlam','London, 1761. St. Mary\'s of Bethlehem, a sinister madhouse, is visited by wealthy people who enjoy watching the patients confined there as if they were caged animals. Nell Bowen, one of the visitors, is horrified by the deplorable living conditions of the unfortunate inhabitants of this godforsaken place, better known as Bedlam.','/rDYbo7kSkVjdKMAdJwN4pOMO6z1.jpg','1946-05-10',76,'Released','Beauty at the mercy of madmen!','Bedlam',24111,3.0541,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2045,_binary '\0','/l7qjp8P97XayZuOEk3BBttiUJ3W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038346',6.4,1272,'en','Behind Green Lights','An unscrupulous private investigator with a penchant for blackmail is found dead in a car and the leading suspect is Janet Bradley, the daughter of a mayoral candidate. With the election just weeks away, shady and ruthless individuals muscle the medical officer into switching the corpse with another body. Lieutenant Sam Carson, one of the few good apples in the bunch must find a way to get to the bottom of it all.','/pshb0QuZ0dflGwHkox4qt9COPYV.jpg','1946-02-15',64,'Released','This private sleuth has two mysteries to solve at once...Twice the thrills and double the excitement!!!','Behind Green Lights',61436,1.2744,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2046,_binary '\0','/2Ae0iV2HR3Raoras8G40MjBtJnn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038348',7.9,30071,'fr','La Belle et la Bête','The story of a gentle-hearted beast in love with a simple and beautiful girl. She is drawn to the repellent but strangely fascinating Beast, who tests her fidelity by giving her a key, telling her that if she doesn\'t return it to him by a specific time, he will die of grief. She is unable to return the key on time, but it is revealed that the Beast is the genuinely handsome one. A simple tale of tragic love that turns into a surreal vision of death, desire, and beauty.','/iYSe3yrkma0e1B0wWPXgr8w5sDN.jpg','1946-10-29',96,'Released','Once upon a time…','Beauty and the Beast',648,4.2733,7.5,'IsXkv1mpRUk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2047,_binary '\0','/yxMgxS0NlmkG5RhatQE8MUjxT2C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038355',7.9,95027,'en','The Big Sleep','Private Investigator Philip Marlowe is hired by wealthy General Sternwood regarding a matter involving his youngest daughter Carmen. Before the complex case is over, Marlowe sees murder, blackmail, deception, and what might be love.','/lraHo9D8c0YWfxsKqT5P5sVqMKN.jpg','1946-08-22',114,'Released','The picture they were born for!','The Big Sleep',910,6.8111,7.6,'n-K49CUaeto','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2048,_binary '\0','/zr6LHA7lDXrNKXNhPQdaBQuUViI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038360',6.9,4536,'en','Black Angel','A falsely convicted man\'s wife, Catherine, and an alcoholic composer and pianist, Martin, team up in an attempt to clear her husband of the murder of a blonde singer, who is Martin\'s wife.','/gSpQ7iTM8P3VIW8vlrvtmYBPjap.jpg','1946-08-02',81,'Released','DURYEA! ...that fascinating tough-guy of \"Scarlet Street\"!','Black Angel',20298,2.0318,6.1,'XZXNrU53Z28','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2049,_binary '\0','/xFqLWRaYqxNC2KfqvUcj5Ln4gmB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038363',7,9451,'en','Blithe Spirit','While holding a séance for skeptical novelist Charles Condomine, self-proclaimed \'spiritualist medium\' Madame Arcati inadvertently summons the spirit of his deceased first wife Elvira, leading to an increasingly complex love triangle with Ruth, his current wife of five years.','/mBKB90yS8Gti4QhcYGuUeJmeOoC.jpg','1945-04-05',96,'Released','Elvira is the kind of gal who can turn an evening into a night you\'ll never forget!','Blithe Spirit',19072,3.2659,6.95,'wu-kkkiDnT0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2050,_binary '\0','/lMpSxEci1FyaMGtBDWtY9Jd2TAp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038369',7.1,10707,'en','The Blue Dahlia','Soon after a veteran returns from war, his cheating wife is found dead. He evades police in an attempt to find the real murderer.','/Aeebl2nZ3FzmEQJMoDkouRmOWrg.jpg','1946-04-16',99,'Released','Double dame trouble! Double-barrelled action!','The Blue Dahlia',16090,2.8395,6.689,'vPx-6PO845I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2051,_binary '\0','/wXlJlcjcuCf3pTJS656qRA0xH3k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038370',6.4,1689,'en','Blue Skies','Jed Potter looks back on a love triangle conducted over the course of years and between musical numbers. Dancer Jed loves showgirl Mary, who loves compulsive nightclub-opener Johnny, who can\'t stay committed to anything in life for very long.','/uPNmCJliNheRdHkemlq82QfqPex.jpg','1946-10-15',104,'Released','It\'s the nearest thing to Heaven!','Blue Skies',53446,2.1033,6.2,'M1yML3KUYdE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2052,_binary '\0','/20vxE6LwAxfS9UiK6Jn68qUiD6H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038387',4.5,1706,'en','The Brute Man','A facially disfigured and mentally unhinged man wreaks his revenge on those he blames for his condition.','/uzRslu8AbdUlxrb7NE56MGhQRw4.jpg','1946-10-01',58,'Released','No woman was safe from his crushing arms...','The Brute Man',84720,1.1511,4.6,'1e9FS_Gy4t8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2053,_binary '\0','/ifbCrCs1GjyOu46CVGVVVlyA8yi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038390',6.2,3509,'en','Caesar and Cleopatra','At the height of the Roman Civil War, an aging Julius Caesar finds himself intrigued by the young Egyptian queen Cleopatra, whom he teaches how to rule Egypt.','/sZHFk8miCUDzSloPn919ODqlWEA.jpg','1945-12-11',138,'Released','The most lavish picture ever on the screen!','Caesar and Cleopatra',31561,3.2125,6.2,'Q1B-0S5L-y4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2054,_binary '\0','/8OqEqKfcr1hjVdjVbxymS5Q1B1S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038392',6.1,1286,'en','California','\"Wicked\" Lily Bishop joins a wagon train to California, led by Michael Fabian and Johnny Trumbo, but news of the Gold Rush scatters the train. When Johnny and Michael finally arrive, Lily is rich from her saloon and storekeeper (former slaver) Pharaoh Coffin is bleeding the miners dry. But worse troubles are ahead: California is inching toward statehood, and certain people want to make it their private empire.','/5uzCAnXTkzw1UTAR3bTXh7Wf831.jpg','1947-02-21',97,'Released','Mighty drama of men who were titans...and a woman who was their match!','California',111459,1.5992,6.8,'6E8eQ8ApppY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2055,_binary '\0','/cTb61xW9LCFDLkc10MifOTkP1Me.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038395',6.9,3079,'en','Canyon Passage','In 1850s Oregon, a businessman is torn between his love of two very different women and his loyalty to a compulsive gambler friend who goes over the line.','/duWXNlo39CSJvvrnkrvFGfupasc.jpg','1946-07-17',92,'Released','Every Exciting Character! Every Dangerous Moment....','Canyon Passage',37309,2.2092,6.754,'FQF8Mci9Eyk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2056,_binary '\0','/1tUsZIldVtVhJNvGNwtdY9vRlRM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038396',7,1307,'en','The Captive Heart','A series of stories about the lives and loves of men in a Prisoner of War camp over five years. The main story is of Hasek (Redgrave) a Czech soldier who needs to keep his identity a secret from the Nazis. To do this, he poses as a dead English Officer and corresponds with the man\'s wife. Other inmates’ stories are also revealed. Location shooting in the British occupied part of Germany adds believability.','/5g9d9RYuTp7TDzsi3AKniQkVngG.jpg','1946-04-29',104,'Released','Would you forge love letters to save your life?','The Captive Heart',82819,1.553,6.4,'RYpPptWS93s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2057,_binary '\0','/qXJ7QTbmzafBdCrlJExYK3mtYDM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038409',6.4,3194,'en','The Chase','Chuck Scott gets a job as chauffeur to tough guy Eddie Roman; but Chuck\'s involvement with Eddie\'s fearful wife becomes a nightmare.','/qTlMQv1xnnuJha3vMa3LPH8QSxZ.jpg','1946-11-16',86,'Released',NULL,'The Chase',29100,1.9747,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2058,_binary '\0','/u11RPFi4hAArznfs86EdN23ZarM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038417',6.6,3995,'en','Cloak and Dagger','Italian partisans help a professor sent by the OSS to find an atomic scientist held by Nazis.','/zC0oUxvPPBhTHBVZcWNPuQZAtl7.jpg','1946-09-28',106,'Released','The moment he fell in love was his moment of greatest danger!','Cloak and Dagger',44043,2.223,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2059,_binary '\0','/ceBxKk9YEFJz5Kv3Ztqwi4qE6cm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038419',7.4,4706,'en','Cluny Brown','Amateur plumber Cluny Brown gets sent off by her uncle to work as a servant at an English country estate.','/AbB09oWSJnh7xyPWyzIooDOaKzw.jpg','1946-06-02',100,'Released','At Last...The Stars You\'ve Wanted - In Each Other\'s Arms!','Cluny Brown',52270,2.1208,7.194,'hLUGbnkPsN4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2060,_binary '\0','/ziGCRjsEbMEpVsVdjdXUIj3ENeD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038427',6.2,1798,'en','Courage of Lassie','Bill\'s separated from his litter, making friends with the wild creatures until he\'s found and adopted by young Kathie. An accident separates him from her, and he\'s drafted into K-9 duty in the trenches until battle fatigue takes its toll and he turns vicious. And even though he finds his way back home, he may be condemned as a killer.','/gRff56Vpe3xw9I94k7gFa2NR68s.jpg','1946-11-08',92,'Released','As Refreshing As A Breath Of Spring !','Courage of Lassie',61856,2.6217,5.9,'o9a9OXWRarU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2061,_binary '\0','/hlcHeAfTVBlMyKyS5QQoh0rK2JV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038429',6.5,2055,'en','Crack-Up','Art curator George Steele experiences a train wreck...which never happened. Is he cracking up, or the victim of a plot?','/fpbvXEMcfJhntg9975F4zbS4RTO.jpg','1946-09-06',96,'Released','Could I KILL ... and not remember?','Crack-Up',26166,1.3247,5.8,'-btN0VAVFlU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2062,_binary '\0','/7pODiwsPHZnTOuvkiUZwGhAXQj6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038449',6.3,1419,'en','Dangerous Money','A treasury agent on the trail of counterfeit money confides to fellow ocean liner passenger, Charlie Chan, that there have been two attempts on his life.','/1huVmRCYBUVXuTitqZ04dfvWPPe.jpg','1946-10-12',66,'Released','One of Chan\'s Most Terrifying Cases!','Dangerous Money',38470,1.211,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2063,_binary '\0','/uNO6hXzuhx1qJrUISfdEVdX5Kgd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038452',6.4,1613,'en','Dark Alibi','After three men are convicted of bank robberies, Charlie becomes suspicious. After some investigation Charlie finds the men are innocent and that the fingerprint evidence used to convict them had been forged. Charlie then proceeds to find the true bank robbers.','/aKojx5sfIFglK3oifUQLkVkoPEI.jpg','1946-05-25',61,'Released','THE MASTER OF MYSTERY EXPOSES A GENIUS OF CRIME!','Dark Alibi',38471,1.2274,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2064,_binary '\0','/2st9cojHMfZH4pVwOaXba86de6L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038453',7.1,5809,'en','The Dark Corner','Ex-con turned private investigator Bradford Galt suspects someone is following him and maybe even trying to kill him. With the assistance of his spunky secretary, Kathleen Stewart, he dives deep into a mystery in search of answers.','/l3DNBjWxeZZAGrv2jCks5PyyZ22.jpg','1946-04-09',99,'Released','Save your lipstick, girls, he plays for keeps.','The Dark Corner',21336,2.5993,6.6,'db5-nMHg39U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2065,_binary '\0','/n6HcY2ZV8WYXGPKOBKE9cwhXhgR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038455',7,6420,'en','The Dark Mirror','A sister and her disturbed twin are implicated in a murder and a police detective must figure out which one\'s the killer.','/iGo43zFcIugVmdQ1L6snrYHU3Dq.jpg','1946-10-17',85,'Released','Twins! One who loves... one who loves to Kill!','The Dark Mirror',44041,1.9406,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2066,_binary '\0','/bxIyjLnBK1NbiBoeUCY0n4MXBd0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038458',6.8,2755,'en','Deadline at Dawn','A young Navy sailor has one night to find out why a woman was killed and he ended up with a bag of money after a drinking blackout.','/hG6b2urZbqkq4tc0p85LAkmHH2Q.jpg','1946-03-18',83,'Released','Fate points the finger of suspicion... and one evening of innocent fun turns into a nightmare of MURDER!','Deadline at Dawn',34650,1.6239,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2067,_binary '\0','/gnYOyE05MZUw7Q64LEh3VcLOdEt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038461',7.1,4661,'en','Deception','After marrying her long lost love, a pianist finds the relationship threatened by a wealthy composer who is besotted with her.','/jLJ837hwFn6x89i3YODO8D5POvP.jpg','1946-10-26',110,'Released','SEE IT NOW! See Her Greatest!','Deception',25502,1.9104,6.7,'pj1oU9dDL04','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2068,_binary '\0','/cYvAoDLpfhq63ntKqqGlhYxjzd5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038462',6.7,2443,'en','Decoy','A fatally shot female gangleader recounts her sordid life of crime to a police officer just before she dies.','/mnuBJ5efPrKqYywLkJmxsFqcH95.jpg','1946-09-14',76,'Released','She Treats Men the Way They\'ve Been Treating Women for Years!','Decoy',20028,1.5996,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2069,_binary '\0','/umBK231yCJd92CfIJk90ohdaLeS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038468',6.6,1896,'sv','Det regnar på vår kärlek','A young couple, penniless, break into a summer cottage; the owner offers to rent to them but he has ulterior motives. By living together, the lovers must face their pasts and contend with the meddling neighbors and authorities.','/mzovDBejDqkuEu158bLwebrPSw5.jpg','1946-11-09',95,'Released',NULL,'It Rains on Our Love',96067,1.5912,6.8,'fHJZaidk2pI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2070,_binary '\0','/uh2A3sW75P2fvXSVlIy2yP6tV5B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038477',6.5,1655,'en','The Diary of a Chambermaid','Celestine, the chamber-maid, has a new job in the country, at the Lanlaires. She has decided to use her beauty to seduce a wealthy man, but Mr. Lanlaire is not a right choice: the house is firmly controlled by Madame Lanlaire, helped by the strange valet Joseph. Then she tries the neighbour, former officer Mauger. This seems to work. But soon the son of the Lanlaires comes back. He is young, attractive and does not share his mother\'s antirepublican opinions. So Celestine\'s beauty attracts Captain Mauger, young Georges Lanlaire, and Joseph. Three men, from three different social classes, with three different conceptions of life. Will Celestine be able to convince Georges of her sincerity?','/j7Dyo9P0goGyW5eYADR16Yrskfx.jpg','1946-02-15',91,'Released',NULL,'The Diary of a Chambermaid',45212,2.5161,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2071,_binary '\0','/v1hEKyIMbVEh1a1Xin7Nf3GyXPj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038478',5.9,1587,'en','Dick Tracy vs. Cueball','A police detective uses his girlfriend to track down a homicidal maniac.','/5czzZWxoKpFdhIHXHTya2gm6w7t.jpg','1946-11-22',62,'Released','HE\'S TERRIFIC! Your Favorite Crime Crusader!','Dick Tracy vs. Cueball',68143,1.8569,5.4,'Ul7A9x1BRHU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2072,_binary '\0','/51xuevXW4ifZw221EMGxwpmdXv2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038492',6.9,6298,'en','Dragonwyck','A simple Connecticut farm girl is recruited by a distant relative, an aristocratic patroon, to be governess to his young daughter in his Hudson Valley mansion.','/guyisLW25bpd7bMGA30OYLbssm6.jpg','1946-04-10',103,'Released','Secret thoughts... That led to secret love... That led to rapture and terror!','Dragonwyck',26286,3.0905,6.625,'NzpW6CsunDo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2073,_binary '\0','/2LWKnEBMLyPUoDnCZPIuye1YYmD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038494',6.8,7760,'en','Dressed to Kill','A convicted thief in Dartmoor prison hides the location of the stolen Bank of England printing plates inside three music boxes. When the innocent purchasers of the boxes start to be murdered, Holmes and Watson investigate.','/oD4z3ON2ciLMv6obEH2K8tGThWG.jpg','1946-05-24',72,'Released','Queen…of a crime cult!','Dressed to Kill',20417,2.6954,6.656,'YcVGBo-sqoQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2074,_binary '\0','/hjrE7mFn4ppTfxZjFsYZQ4oin9h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038499',6.7,10598,'en','Duel in the Sun','Beautiful half-breed Pearl Chavez becomes the ward of her dead father\'s first love and finds herself torn between her sons, one good and the other bad.','/dW479xuDWrcuFuxr7yfoReztlzF.jpg','1946-12-31',144,'Released','Emotions . . . As Violent As The Wind-Swept Prairie !','Duel in the Sun',32275,4.1811,6.4,'OrP_CtoeO9E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2075,_binary '\0','/2oQ9hnAYsoZH61PnjSkuX4Uvd2d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038559',7.6,37809,'en','Gilda','A gambler discovers an old flame while in Argentina, but she\'s married to his new boss.','/46eKPjoWEyNBAQKDoXEcDFBcaUw.jpg','1946-04-25',110,'Released','There NEVER was a woman like Gilda!','Gilda',3767,4.4918,7.5,'9hTdgygrlOg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2076,_binary '\0','/5SdVucbeGF5xAHT496uPRPZVJD6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038574',7.8,28627,'en','Great Expectations','In this Dickens adaptation, orphan Pip discovers through lawyer Mr. Jaggers that a mysterious benefactor wishes to ensure that he becomes a gentleman. Reunited with his childhood patron, Miss Havisham, and his first love, the beautiful but emotionally cold Estella, he discovers that the elderly spinster has gone mad from having been left at the altar as a young woman, and has made her charge into a warped, unfeeling heartbreaker.','/ynaFuVvW2jaG06pMV67dOhzMYfJ.jpg','1946-12-26',118,'Released','From the Vivid Pages of Charles Dickens\' Masterpiece!','Great Expectations',14320,3.8609,7.294,'ueGOsCoG5b8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2077,_binary '\0','/niPETqW4YV7b7TCMzFXZ5ojzdvC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038577',7.3,6399,'en','Green for Danger','In the midst of Nazi air raids, a postman dies on the operating table at a rural hospital. But was the death accidental?','/a4DKicJXJc2IZ5Ze8fU34sZTT4L.jpg','1946-12-07',91,'Released','Murder... weapon or clue?','Green for Danger',29589,2.0059,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2078,_binary '\0','/9OmLo1a5kQ6EfJkAb5Z7Rw3ExjQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038578',7.1,1216,'en','The Green Years','An orphaned young boy is guided by his great-grandfather and strives to go to university to become a doctor. However, the boy\'s harsh grandfather stands in his way.','/sD8tUj5O9zrOHbgovQoKFM9VdRw.jpg','1946-07-04',127,'Released','It\'s the Book with a Heartful of Love that Thrilled Millions!','The Green Years',99351,1.5547,6.4,'GBi_QrOOPKY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2079,_binary '\0','/kC4AOQAvk9g6oybMpniplAiKkbw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038589',7,5480,'en','The Harvey Girls','On a train trip out west to become a mail-order bride, Susan Bradley meets a cheery crew of young women traveling out to open a \"Harvey House\" restaurant at a remote whistle-stop.','/qGta8SzLwRTFsmsWtlS8d7pFKt6.jpg','1946-01-18',104,'Released','It\'s Blazing, Blistering Romance... in the wide open spaces!','The Harvey Girls',28907,2.5138,6.609,'OcH52XSiAsA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2080,_binary '\0','/gSMVDPnOxfcmb8JEWOij3LwuihV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038621',6.1,1534,'en','House of Horrors','An unsuccessful sculptor saves a madman named \"The Creeper\" from drowning. Seeing an opportunity for revenge, he tricks the psycho into murdering his critics.','/TP8SJiSVE3sVkLQvCiAD1GFVvq.jpg','1946-03-29',65,'Released','Meet...The CREEPER!','House of Horrors',84419,1.3836,6.1,'PDdYEFWikuM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2081,_binary '\0','/7QF0dKP4Wa25867qjqmy8HMgAzD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038622',7.3,5492,'en','Humoresque','A classical musician from a working class background is sidetracked by his love for a wealthy, neurotic socialite.','/tJCIfxap0C7maxpjKtzNrj29dHW.jpg','1947-01-25',125,'Released','TWO WHO MET AND KISSED AND NEVER SHOULD HAVE MET AGAIN!','Humoresque',26701,2.0414,7,'DQW2lU_glJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2082,_binary '\0','/3q35nBLCIdEbxYfsr7D5ocYQXKz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038650',8.6,559272,'en','It\'s a Wonderful Life','George Bailey has spent his entire life giving to the people of Bedford Falls. All that prevents rich skinflint Mr. Potter from taking over the entire town is George\'s modest building and loan company. But on Christmas Eve the business\'s $8,000 is lost and George\'s troubles begin.','/bSqt9rhDZx1Q7UZ86dBPKdNomp2.jpg','1946-12-20',131,'Released','It\'s a wonderful laugh! It\'s a wonderful love!','It\'s a Wonderful Life',1585,17.7623,8.278,'6jB4Vsi1UUM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2083,_binary '\0','/cxQ1yRHsxotDjiyk5TB8JgP8YWt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038661',7.2,1977,'en','The Jolson Story','At the turn of the 20th century, young Asa Yoelson decides to go against the wishes of his cantor father and pursue a career in show business. Gradually working his way up through the vaudeville ranks, Asa — now calling himself Al Jolson — joins a blackface minstrel troupe and soon builds a reputation as a consummate performer. But as his career grows in size, so does his ego, resulting in battles in business as well as in his personal life.','/TA8OqACOphikMD16HLeohJqPk.jpg','1946-10-10',128,'Released','The Music... The Magic... The Times... of America\'s Greatest Entertainer.','The Jolson Story',31206,1.4677,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2084,_binary '\0','/sOSS0aSeMDCXCBqEHb4HKLlLMD8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038668',6.5,1421,'en','The Kid from Brooklyn','Shy milkman Burleigh Sullivan accidentally knocks out drunken Speed McFarlane, a champion boxer who was flirting with Burleigh\'s sister. The newspapers get hold of the story and photographers even catch Burleigh knock out Speed again. Speed\'s crooked manager decides to turn Burleigh into a fighter. Burleigh doesn\'t realize that all of his opponents have been asked to take a dive. Thinking he really is a great fighter, Burleigh develops a swelled head which puts a crimp in his relationship with pretty nightclub singer Polly Pringle. He may finally get his comeuppance when he challenges Speed for the title.','/paB1nPmu7Ax1rRugC8IKKA42cFh.jpg','1946-03-21',113,'Released','BEAUTY STACKED! TUNE PACKED!','The Kid from Brooklyn',109235,1.9932,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2085,_binary '\0','/w6XdWl6L2WDHJGw2FKySbi86WDg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038669',7.7,26465,'en','The Killers','Two hit men walk into a diner asking for a man called \"the Swede\". When the killers find the Swede, he\'s expecting them and doesn\'t put up a fight. Since the Swede had a life insurance policy, an investigator, on a hunch, decides to look into the murder. As the Swede\'s past is laid bare, it comes to light that he was in love with a beautiful woman who may have lured him into pulling off a bank robbery overseen by another man.','/uXnuc6pW01s1MDwb6QwBWg2JQeX.jpg','1946-08-30',103,'Released','She\'s a match for any mobster!','The Killers',14638,3.7364,7.4,'Cq_gxqCaFms','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2086,_binary '\0','/t4cfsFn0jX3PLLYQqxlbnZjLBlf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038675',6.4,3977,'sv','Kris','A small-town piano teacher is shocked by the arrival of her foster daughter\'s biological mother, whose young lover soon follows and causes further disruption.','/1G15pUMNnWspV47sbyQgnZfQf3C.jpg','1946-02-25',93,'Released',NULL,'Crisis',30734,1.1785,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2087,_binary '\0','/dJxxKv6eGBNRGVGlMEuO3J8EoNC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038687',7.4,2202,'en','Let There Be Light','The final entry in a trilogy of films produced for the U.S. government by John Huston. Some returning combat veterans suffer scars that are more psychological than physical. This film follows patients and staff during their treatment. It deals with what would now be called PTSD, but at the time was categorised as psychoneurosis or shell-shock. Government officials deemed this 1946 film counterproductive to postwar efforts; it was not shown publicly until 1981.','/wgcAMb5BLKFANzTDfKwnxeH1kYA.jpg','1946-12-16',58,'Released',NULL,'Let There Be Light',86990,1.9486,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2088,_binary '\0','/4FZE1CvhmBvLWMNX5JIP40YtwNg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038694',6.7,1519,'en','Little Giant','Lou Costello plays a country bumpkin vacuum-cleaner salesman, working for the company run by the crooked Bud Abbott. To try to keep him under his thumb, Abbott convinces Costello that he\'s a crackerjack salesman. This comedy is somewhat like \"The Time of Their Lives,\" in that Abbott and Costello don\'t have much screen time together and there are very few vaudeville bits woven into the plot.','/iyVF2tsQQfMji6vbDrwWHA8qHQc.jpg','1946-02-22',90,'Released','They\'re Selling Vacuum Cleaners!','Little Giant',36706,1.509,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2089,_binary '\0','/iy7i3iJYgGOFr9SXPXRBplYcEpK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038700',7.1,3799,'en','The Locket','A dark personal secret drives a young woman to use every man she encounters.','/maLGJ5CDL2vWWqKPsd12bwTxFO8.jpg','1946-12-20',85,'Released',NULL,'The Locket',38042,2.7548,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2090,_binary '\0','/v3a6fM8QpNWZOQFgOYUeHu6RIad.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038718',6.1,5675,'en','Make Mine Music','In the tradition of Fantasia, Make Mine Music is a glorious collection of musically charged animated shorts featuring such fun-filled favorites as \"Peter and the Wolf\", narrated by the beloved voice behind Winnie the Pooh. In addition you\'ll enjoy such classic cartoon hits as \"Casey at the Bat,\" \"The Whale Who Wanted to Sing at the Met\" and \"Johnnie Fedora and Alice Bluebonnet.\"','/1Mu98243emXAKy8iZfymUJDgTpS.jpg','1946-06-30',75,'Released','Happy Comedy Musical','Make Mine Music',20343,3.917,5.849,'1N_3g1xPf7g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2091,_binary '\0','/aayMGUNwFgvQXbalIadcGerklB0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038721',6.7,2034,'en','The Man I Love','Tough torch singer Petey Brown, visiting her family, finds a nest of troubles: her sister, brother, and the neighbor\'s wife are involved in various ways with shady nightclub owner Nicky Toresca. Petey has what it takes to handle Nicky, but then she meets San Thomas, a formerly great jazz pianist now on the skids, and falls hard for him.','/65XBeEUjTLSPR8vnCrvN8XsyqSw.jpg','1946-12-26',96,'Released','There should be a law against knowing the things I found out about men!','The Man I Love',26663,2.1878,6.1,'z43mqng43FA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2092,_binary '\0','/bY7DvsYsAODykqUJfkPZA3BHKOd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038733',8,28279,'en','A Matter of Life and Death','A British wartime aviator who cheats death must argue for his life before a celestial court, hoping to prolong his fledgling romance with an American girl.','/H74LWKnhOeIFSk9gNjBcPjIov3.jpg','1946-12-15',104,'Released','Neither Heaven nor Earth could keep them apart!','A Matter of Life and Death',28162,5.6999,7.7,'S0veuSLLWZ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2093,_binary '\0','/q4OPVRS5a55BOcUtGcQh81Idsgt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038762',7.7,28851,'en','My Darling Clementine','Three brothers stop off for a night in the town of Tombstone. The next morning they find one of their brothers dead and their cattle stolen. They decide to take revenge on the culprits.','/o7G5klSt9i8LQZdUNvrWUJbbxAO.jpg','1946-10-17',97,'Released','She was everything the West was - young, fiery, exciting!','My Darling Clementine',3088,4.464,7.471,'2aF5QQoGgCE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2094,_binary '\0','/du0NkKLV7BqydXPTeGIHFKu7c2n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038765',7,2354,'en','My Reputation','Tongues begin to wag when a lonely widow becomes romantically involved with a military man. Problems arise when the gossip is filtered down to her own children.','/cBAiKCoxiHVm0I9Kqt6z7wcfush.jpg','1946-01-25',94,'Released','Of all the dramatic triumphs from Warners this one is the greatest!','My Reputation',123295,1.7801,7.261,'gn51DxWURGs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2095,_binary '\0','/vgitnrjL4BqXeSUi7yAhILqsDXP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038769',7.4,3217,'de','Die Mörder sind unter uns','After returning from a concentration camp, Susanne finds a traumatized ex-soldier living in her apartment in bombed out Berlin. Together the two try to move past their experiences during WWII.','/7XPV2ynhmW0BmzsyyHZob0qLie6.jpg','1946-10-15',81,'Released',NULL,'The Murderers Are Among Us',932,2.2745,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2096,_binary '\0','/pmGGB2G6gS2oRzKVCgyO66RELG5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038773',6.8,1467,'en','Never Say Goodbye','Phil and Ellen Gayley have been divorced for a year, and their 7-year old daughter, Flip, is very unhappy that her parents are not together. Flip starts a correspondence with a Marine, sending a picture of her beautiful mother as the author of Flip\'s flirtatious letters. When the Marine shows up to meet his pen pal, Ellen takes the opportunity to make her ex-husband jealous.','/x9hnpYMH4do0dRJXPSc20O26qQy.jpg','1946-11-09',97,'Released','Howls by the hundreds...surprises by the score...Errol used to be a superman...but he isn\'t anymore!','Never Say Goodbye',61151,1.6917,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2097,_binary '\0','/6HUYNe8nKkezM5sqWknvgUmlCCX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038774',6.7,1228,'en','Night Editor','A daily news editor recalls a married detective and the deadly woman behind his downfall.','/tCyhHqjXHcvH4knab5Aem6izazi.jpg','1946-03-29',68,'Released','In the middle of a kiss...Murder!','Night Editor',26805,1.3024,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2098,_binary '\0','/35kwCFM9tNu9Y5AlvSDSYGSkXXg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038776',6.1,3541,'en','Night and Day','When his first stage show fails, songwriter Cole Porter goes off to fight in WWI until, injured, he lands in a hospital. He impresses nurse Linda Lee with his creativity, but their budding romance must wait as Cole heads home. Back in New York, he mounts a series of popular shows, and when his work brings him back to Europe, he eventually marries Linda. But success doesn\'t spare him from marital complications or bad news about a beloved relative.','/mrlKsBUxPwxGr8M8xupI96qrA8j.jpg','1946-07-02',128,'Released','The story of Cole Porter with those Cole Porter song sensations !!!','Night and Day',43485,3.0419,6,'lW30DeXxmhI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2099,_binary '\0','/wQ5rFmRnCsdZlc2mDNK4HUW2y3L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038777',6.9,8162,'en','A Night in Casablanca','The Marx Brothers are employed at a hotel in postwar Casablanca, where a ring of Nazis is trying to recover a cache of stolen treasure.','/iltVdhtFkIyHuZDfJi9I1UAHD9D.jpg','1946-05-10',85,'Released','100 Girls! 1,000 Scenes! 10,000 Laffs!','A Night in Casablanca',26940,3.1124,6.8,'7U-1eJejNcY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2100,_binary '\0','/hADrdkGx07F6x3ptGDlWvDXKhQX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038780',7,2312,'en','Nobody Lives Forever','A con artist falls for the rich widow he\'s trying to fleece.','/u9TtI1vL1XutkB0RuL3Fgnl7vST.jpg','1946-11-01',100,'Released','I killed a man for this kiss so you better make it good !','Nobody Lives Forever',26657,1.8922,6.4,'m9NUqCFAojk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2101,_binary '\0','/uBYsY0t8CB82lMSrjF5YUBRUhKa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038782',6.5,2068,'en','Nocturne','In 1940s Los Angeles, when womanizing composer Keith Vincent is found dead, the inquest concludes it was a suicide but police detective Joe Warne isn\'t so sure.','/vfNS6tqT74RdGxB0KtopN0S0Zye.jpg','1946-10-29',87,'Released','HOLLYWOOD GLAMOR MURDER!','Nocturne',38279,1.1875,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2102,_binary '\0','/6jRd6vT3NhwIeyqaiWCYzi64lSP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038787',7.9,113549,'en','Notorious','In order to help bring Nazis to justice, U.S. government agent T.R. Devlin recruits Alicia Huberman, the American daughter of a convicted German war criminal, as a spy. As they begin to fall for one another, Alicia is instructed to win the affections of Alexander Sebastian, a Nazi hiding out in Brazil. When Sebastian becomes serious about his relationship with Alicia, the stakes get higher, and Devlin must watch her slip further undercover.','/e7DHQGgivZyMvM4z7mA7gMNvOHg.jpg','1946-08-21',103,'Released','Deep their love! Great the risk!','Notorious',303,5.4773,7.714,'H8f4UOtLf5Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2103,_binary '\0','/zNjp6eolIcpGx11tDbE5eekeHEG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038823',7.6,10863,'it','Paisà','Six stories unfold in various regions, from Sicily to the northern Po Valley as American military personnel interact with a variety of Italian locals over eighteen months in the push north during the Italian Campaign of WWII as German forces retreat.','/r5IGAFASCXmp8m51vUbER3WwVcB.jpg','1946-12-10',125,'Released','There are always opportunities for redemption.','Paisan',8429,2.0138,7.516,'JM_KpDmdF98','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2104,_binary '\0','/hrDuoZlfsIzxpwC8IAIHEGoRh4g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038824',7.9,2998,'fr','Panique','Proud, eccentric, and antisocial, Monsieur Hire has always kept to himself. But after a woman turns up dead in the Paris suburb where he lives, he feels drawn to a pretty young newcomer to town and discovers that his neighbors are only too ready to suspect the worst of him.','/pN1jUg8RqGXB321v9XDwbmPp5G3.jpg','1947-01-15',99,'Released',NULL,'Panic',43462,1.124,7.367,'nXpddF9qBFA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2105,_binary '\0','/71aPwcRfO1v3jjy7vLm0BUwrNvT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038853',7.1,1446,'fr','Les Portes de la nuit','In post-Liberation Paris, a man reunites with a friend and meets the woman of his dreams, only to discover her brother\'s dark past.','/e8BngTN2DHwSvdcABKPLqiNP1z3.jpg','1946-12-03',107,'Released',NULL,'Gates of the Night',60799,1.7675,7.036,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2106,_binary '\0','/cXkA9CqkZyWufwPE0GSVj1SFwUW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038854',7.4,25165,'en','The Postman Always Rings Twice','A married woman and a drifter fall in love, then plot to murder her husband.','/3qdX948vUXi4q8raUUOHHlbP9q8.jpg','1946-05-02',113,'Released','Their Love was a Flame that Destroyed!','The Postman Always Rings Twice',25736,3.6896,7.1,'n2R4I84QS5M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2107,_binary '\0','/7P319Zq0RwYsAHmSjLndcOSW9kl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038873',7.3,7536,'en','The Razor\'s Edge','An adventurous young man goes off to find himself and loses his socialite fiancée in the process. But when he returns 10 years later, she will stop at nothing to get him back, even though she is already married.','/a6UTn8J0dftf4YBID6qAf1UeZEx.jpg','1946-11-19',145,'Released','Hunger no love... woman... or wealth could satisfy!','The Razor\'s Edge',56135,3.5088,6.875,'dqYPxtmHX74','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2108,_binary '\0','/cztYhbawTjK9m8lFBd97Yl5Zd8r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038890',8,34460,'it','Roma città aperta','During the Nazi occupation of 1944 Rome, Resistance leader Giorgio Manfredi is pursued by the Nazis as he seeks refuge and a means of escape.','/ijGV4v8JxgbNzgEhqKdzHdaZn8a.jpg','1945-10-08',104,'Released','Our battle has barely begun.','Rome, Open City',307,4.2895,8,'5uzXxXnGfVs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2109,_binary '\0','/38rMfVYssufIZyJtoNDtPJQXrw3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038908',6.5,1401,'en','A Scandal in Paris','A smooth-talking French thief wangles his way into an important position as prefect of police.','/kOBl4nTfUtJugCjAmchRofdyEso.jpg','1946-07-19',100,'Released','Every man has his price... and every woman pays it.','A Scandal in Paris',118534,2.3439,6.4,'clp5xDFnEr0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2110,_binary '\0','/nHxDQoD4B8leyb7axSQQrb0CHJr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038913',8,9147,'it','Sciuscià','Two shoeshine boys in postwar Rome, Italy save up to buy a horse, but their involvement as dupes in a burglary lands them in juvenile prison; the experience take a devastating toll on their friendship.','/qhhbo7rzJ1U8y1jW5cpR2j5GhvR.jpg','1946-04-27',91,'Released',NULL,'Shoeshine',43469,2.9018,7.782,'0qcBeWoNh2k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2111,_binary '\0','/6wd5Fql4vy5uyhMYTJXRuypuwXS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038924',6.7,2664,'en','The Seventh Veil','A concert pianist with amnesia fights to regain her memory.','/hk64loLiFPfYKpqvUIiSMmX8iu6.jpg','1945-10-18',94,'Released','It Dares Strip Down a Woman\'s Mind','The Seventh Veil',43495,1.8934,6.587,'uu1PHOZ9LGM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2112,_binary '\0','/s6jtFOPMTDDWltzzVM3Ur03NxR4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038934',5.3,3569,'en','She-Wolf of London','A young heiress finds evidence suggesting that at night she acts under the influence of a family curse and has begun committing ghastly murders in a nearby park.','/3H1JNJS8eIJPd502sPgbEfyhtDG.jpg','1946-05-17',61,'Released','A woman whose hatred knew no bounds!','She-Wolf of London',45322,2.5644,5.6,'fE8aLtopgUc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2113,_binary '\0','/pbUs4pFJJ7lSXPBp99BAIQ1XMzo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038937',6.3,3772,'en','Shock','In this thriller, psychiatrist Dr. Cross kills his wife and expects to get away with murder, until he discovers that the slaying was observed by a next-door neighbor, Janet Stewart. As Janet attempts to convince her husband of the doctor\'s dastardly deed, Cross shows up to advise him that Janet is in dire need of some in-depth counseling.','/egWouljGXXidknA9cplDTApXcAt.jpg','1946-02-01',70,'Released','He never dreamed what it would all lead to...and she didn\'t care !','Shock',29237,1.8307,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2114,_binary '\0','/kve7uPGnLw6yXnfVd4Y6I30m7Zr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038948',7.2,1379,'en','Sister Kenny','An Australian nurse discovers an effective new treatment for infantile paralysis, but experiences great difficulty in convincing doctors of the validity of her claims.','/kmwDdk6EaNmC5rjv40IPAUd3ROm.jpg','1946-10-10',116,'Released','A woman made for love... but whose service to humanity became her destiny!','Sister Kenny',51571,2.0708,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2115,_binary '\0','/p0PUaNCoh3lYXn4DxnbmJT2WQRx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038958',6.3,1584,'en','So Dark the Night','Inspector Cassin, a renowned Paris detective, departs to the country for a much-needed break. There he falls in love with the innkeeper’s daughter, Nanette, who is already betrothed to a local farmer. On the evening of their engagement party, Nanette and the farmer both disappear. Cassin takes up the case immediately to discover what happened to them and who is responsible.','/wqGngbTPCAUyKOZTwseWa61SBVn.jpg','1946-10-10',71,'Released','Most Baffling of Mysteries!','So Dark the Night',40824,1.7285,6.1,'zbJsyrPNr4I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2116,_binary '\0','/k2nDbhwjsZ8cIs7FVswNKzyjKb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038965',7,3995,'en','Somewhere in the Night','George Taylor returns from WWII with amnesia. Back home in Los Angeles, while trying to track down his old identity, he stumbles onto a three year old murder case and a hunt for a missing $2 million.','/ygJHtg34113MJPqYSgeOsoB33iE.jpg','1946-06-12',110,'Released','Somewhere in his mind!','Somewhere in the Night',20000,2.6194,6.7,'QRsnuJdB1j4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2117,_binary '\0','/gfOYEKGz5wHlZTggfHbf5CLJ8zB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038969',6.9,15361,'en','Song of the South','Uncle Remus draws upon his tales of Br\'er Rabbit to help little Johnny deal with his confusion over his parents\' separation as well as his new life on the plantation.','/lFlWpfcw8TCmZ88jw6e943vEbtu.jpg','1946-11-20',94,'Released','Here Comes the Zip-A-Dee-Doo-Dah Show!','Song of the South',13850,4.9092,6.467,'NxwqH47Ne70','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2118,_binary '\0','/tbt3dq9AMrojwq5SGeAcL97buC8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038975',7.3,12697,'en','The Spiral Staircase','On a stormy night, the mute servant to an ailing matriarch is stalked by a serial killer.','/4k0k9f59g901GWzw0gfFT7f5in.jpg','1946-01-26',83,'Released','Conflicts that freeze your emotions! Suspense that takes your breath!','The Spiral Staircase',27452,2.1847,7,'Y-hIiCQT848','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2119,_binary '\0','/fJRSfSobrZL2mVVNhGPgS36IWid.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038984',7.2,4724,'en','A Stolen Life','When a woman’s twin sister is drowned, she assumes her identity in order to be close to the man she feels her sister took from her years before.','/zwa3EVAc4dvq1G3WTAL9FBFGNCD.jpg','1946-05-01',109,'Released','Their faces the same...Their fates so different!','A Stolen Life',43470,1.9733,6.4,'hrLHWk9whe8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2120,_binary '\0','/wyHgr0RZnSPRdcR08cP5nIshLAV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038988',7.4,12538,'en','The Strange Love of Martha Ivers','Three childhood friends, Martha, Walter and Sam, share a terrible secret. Over time, the ambitious Martha and the pusillanimous Walter have married. She is a cold businesswoman; he is the district attorney: a perfect combination to dominate the corrupt city of Iverstown at will. But the unexpected return of Sam, after years of absence, deeply disturbs the life of the odd couple.','/iUAq0UYHglCsnHVbBLcJvZ6KQN9.jpg','1946-08-19',115,'Released','Fate drew them together… and only murder could part them!','The Strange Love of Martha Ivers',27033,3.6939,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2121,_binary '\0','/hf2Je1J37cuKtnv2bO0xvTf4tHU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038990',6.5,2945,'en','The Strange Woman','In early 19th century New England, an unscrupulous woman uses her beauty and wits to seduce, deceive and control the men around her.','/4hlj2BT6b1N2jJnBabJdMHUC4ir.jpg','1946-10-25',100,'Released','The book that was talked of in a Whisper!','The Strange Woman',32945,2.6549,6.2,'4BcuzPayO_k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2122,_binary '\0','/osCupz9uxvUoca6aqSSkns1UnlQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0038991',7.3,31225,'en','The Stranger','An investigator from the War Crimes Commission travels to Connecticut to find an infamous Nazi, who may be hiding out in a small town in the guise of a distinguished professor engaged to the Supreme Court Justice’s daughter.','/bzjoPScBLUWpSu10m3GbSbSwVhS.jpg','1946-06-02',95,'Released','The most deceitful man a woman ever loved!','The Stranger',20246,2.9385,7.2,'ZbiLI6gfAiw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2123,_binary '\0','/r41J4MW5Z2D0624DH2fHLss0kwb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039011',6,2600,'en','Tarzan and the Leopard Woman','A tribe devoted to the leopard cult is dedicated to preventing civilization from moving further into Africa.','/n2AtSeKyuygtbFcKuyurJ6m6tmJ.jpg','1946-02-18',72,'Released','An Exotic Beauty Rules The Jungle !','Tarzan and the Leopard Woman',55873,2.392,5.7,'60Yc2KLx8qE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2124,_binary '\0','/xMm9Bb8EqJuceDYkEWRjJlZElVI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039017',6.7,7814,'en','Terror by Night','Holmes and Watson board a passenger train bound from London to Edinburgh, to guard the Star of Rhodesia, an enormous diamond worth a fortune belonging to an elderly woman of wealth; but within the first hour of the trip, the woman\'s son is murdered and the diamond stolen and any of the passengers in their car could be the killer thief.','/cjGgLJ2GViKy0bla8OfaAhOBAJw.jpg','1946-02-01',60,'Released','One way ticket to DEATH..!','Terror by Night',20408,2.7716,6.6,'n7dlM8nIp0c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2125,_binary '\0','/bFY9vBmSAWn5utDmI7thmg4H1cu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039029',6.9,2964,'en','Three Strangers','On the eve of the Chinese New Year, three strangers, Crystal Shackleford, married to a wealthy philanderer; Jerome Artbutny, an outwardly respectable judge; and Johnny West, a seedy sneak thief, make a pact before a small statue of the Chinese goddess of Destiny. The threesome agree to purchase a sweepstakes ticket and share whatever winnings might accrue.','/aK4CHMMTkwZqrdzbKgZQYmrqfU.jpg','1946-01-23',92,'Released','BREATHTAKING SUSPENSE - THRILLS!','Three Strangers',35077,2.1366,6.4,'3BuqsdPiwmU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2126,_binary '\0','/vDkeIpXVv3rhGL1dewXsB9slNWU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039035',6.4,3045,'en','Till the Clouds Roll By','Light bio-pic of American Broadway pioneer Jerome Kern, featuring renditions of the famous songs from his musical plays by contemporary stage artists, including a condensed production of his most famous: \'Showboat\'.','/bHy3xEV2wmeRQWVE8Ko3HdWxt97.jpg','1946-12-05',136,'Released','The mammoth musical of Jerome Kern\'s dramatic life story','Till the Clouds Roll By',18700,2.9714,5.767,'xmVNCA7jrto','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2127,_binary '\0','/992MD4AdqmewHFGKYVe5DJT91N0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039036',6.7,1822,'en','Till the End of Time','Three former marines have a hard time readjusting to civilian life. Perry can\'t deal with the loss of the use of his legs. William is in trouble with bad debts. And Cliff can\'t decide what he wants to do with his life, although he gets encouragement from war widow Pat Ruscomb.','/ij2xw0b3Gic0eCkLqx4Q7WrJJlv.jpg','1946-07-23',105,'Released','New love in each other\'s heart... till the end of time!','Till the End of Time',101859,2.3265,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2128,_binary '\0','/cWLr9NOni65MM7pfzRih2uRoDdD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039037',7.5,4171,'en','The Time of Their Lives','Two ghosts, who were mistakenly branded as traitors during the Revolutionary War, return to 20th century New England to retrieve a letter from George Washington which would prove their innocence.','/wFO5tIivUKS9PU9feLIm8G1oHaK.jpg','1946-08-13',82,'Released','Lou haunts a house - for free!!','The Time of Their Lives',33546,2.2284,7.2,'i-BjHBlEklg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2129,_binary '\0','/nn9xlJLB1i8m36etR9O7qbfUj3m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039040',7.6,3281,'en','To Each His Own','During World War I, small-town girl Josephine Norris has an illegitimate son by an itinerant pilot. After a scheme to adopt him ends up giving him to another family, she devotes her life to loving him from afar.','/jDk2Y8U2C7KupYv4GKmMfgx0y2s.jpg','1946-03-12',122,'Released','A Great Picture! You\'ll Thrill to Every Moment!','To Each His Own',54568,2.1297,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2130,_binary '\0','/xiZaEKTiWs8R7EVQ54WaTCA4L0v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039041',7.3,3439,'en','Tomorrow Is Forever','In 1918, Elizabeth MacDonald learns that her husband, John Andrew, has been killed in the war. Elizabeth bears John\'s son and eventually marries her kindly boss. Unknown to her, John has survived but is horribly disfigured and remains in Europe. Years later, on the eve of World War II, Elizabeth refuses to agree to her son\'s request to enlist and is stunned when an eerily familiar stranger named Kessler arrives from abroad and becomes involved.','/T8MUS5r5YJqrVIkOYTzgoIqWqf.jpg','1946-02-20',105,'Released','The Vibrant, Pulsing Story of a Woman Escaping Her Past!','Tomorrow Is Forever',44100,2.4305,6.318,'HSOlbxcLvLY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2131,_binary '\0','/xL4GbifwdtiQeXD5Aa6k4J6hjTD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039066',6.5,3936,'en','Undercurrent','After a rapid engagement, a dowdy daughter of a chemist weds an industrialist, knowing little of his family or past. He transforms her into an elegant society wife, but becomes enraged whenever she asks about Michael, his mysterious long-lost brother.','/7IyNoYoHcV5a52FhWj6QPxR8cBV.jpg','1946-11-11',116,'Released','An Irresistible Force That Draws a Man and Woman Together!','Undercurrent',44098,2.4034,5.9,'mACJEHFTVa4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2132,_binary '\0','/zlZVFFZOY453caEZj3F56SqBxVx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039074',7,1562,'ja','歌麿をめぐる五人の女','Utamaro, a great artist, lives to create portraits of beautiful women, and the Tokyo brothels provide his models. A world of passion swirls around him, as the women vie for lovers, and, occasionally, his art gets him into trouble.','/1oRhyRvqNUAezLbxLxC4kNJV3FB.jpg','1946-12-17',94,'Released',NULL,'Utamaro and His Five Women',101382,1.6895,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2133,_binary '\0','/lVs1eNZAasBUdHC9FpRQQFKr5o8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039080',7.2,3405,'en','The Verdict','After an innocent man is executed in a case he was responsible for, a Scotland Yard superintendent finds himself investigating the murder of his key witness.','/mBaLOlfTOd71p9cJnaAMeK5NFcL.jpg','1946-10-24',86,'Released',NULL,'The Verdict',35123,2.0895,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2134,_binary '\0','/dOxtXBFxpEuftXkgPI3GoJZdTlX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039082',6.4,1471,'en','The Virginian','Arriving at Medicine Bow, eastern schoolteacher Molly Woods meets two cowboys, irresponsible Steve and the \"Virginian,\" who gets off on the wrong foot with her. To add to his troubles, the Virginian finds that his old pal Steve is mixed up with black-hatted Trampas and his rustlers...then finds himself at the head of a posse after said rustlers; and Molly hates the violent side of frontier life.','/nF1Oc6V9N4c3Dv0B2oojcFELKiA.jpg','1946-05-05',87,'Released','The All-Time Best-Selling Love Story of the West... Now On the Screen In Spectacular Technicolor!','The Virginian',121230,1.9517,6.2,'yNMkIudKToY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2135,_binary '\0','/2I46DNR7WSZxTj8yFPSA5YC8L5y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039090',7.1,4551,'ja','わが青春に悔なし','After her anti-fascist professor father is dismissed, Yukie navigates love, political repression, and wartime upheaval—ultimately forging her own path in pre- and post-WWII Japan.','/2NEgykELHbMdyDzGSsbUIGZsN9k.jpg','1946-10-29',111,'Released',NULL,'No Regrets for Our Youth',43487,2.4221,6.892,'aiLWuVNrcSU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2136,_binary '\0','/6o60tDWSBXacuG2bmXxdu0oM6bi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039101',5.5,1484,'en','Whistle Stop','When beautiful Mary returns to her \"whistle stop\" hometown, long-standing feelings of animosity between two of her old boyfriends leads to robbery and murder.','/yOhmHkmefSZk3QlyhLn63i7oSii.jpg','1946-01-25',85,'Released','SHE SPELLED TROUBLE FOR EVERY GUY THAT MADE A PLAY FOR HER!','Whistle Stop',55600,2.395,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2137,_binary '\0','/jpROckUTwAFttzc31kVa37AeRGA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039110',6.4,2109,'en','Without Reservations','Kit Madden is traveling to Hollywood, where her best-selling novel is to be filmed. Aboard the train, she encounters Marines Rusty and Dink, who don\'t know she is the author of the famous book, and who don\'t think much of the ideas it proposes. She and Rusty are greatly attracted, but she doesn\'t know how to deal with his disdain for the book\'s author.','/iz8B4R6uaRo4mvaC4qOvx3Wg034.jpg','1946-05-13',107,'Released','Transcontinental Romance - Unlimited!!!','Without Reservations',33077,2.135,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2138,_binary '\0','/2I39r8rD7A8fgSnJkExr09U9DqC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039111',7.1,7124,'en','The Yearling','Jody convinces his parents to allow him to adopt a young deer, but what will happen if the deer misbehaves?','/4N8oYLpY82ev7waXz7zwu7Ph1o1.jpg','1946-12-18',128,'Released','THRILLS! DRAMA! HEART-THROBS!','The Yearling',19049,2.7791,6.7,'_V67fqgvyXQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2139,_binary '\0','/wasyZjFu1VWxRaiyYWfbg69d7lB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039116',6.4,4056,'en','Ziegfeld Follies','The late, great impresario Florenz Ziegfeld looks down from heaven and ordains a new revue in his grand old style.','/f5CPLtMX9vSMoumnZi1s8KbbD6p.jpg','1945-08-26',110,'Released','Greatest Production Since the Birth of Motion Pictures!','Ziegfeld Follies',43176,2.4781,6,'aO_wY10l0Zo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2140,_binary '\0','/z431y0waKviqvo2Je426ci8z3NY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039152',6.8,7514,'en','Angel and the Badman','Notorious shootist and womanizer Quirt Evans\' horse collapses as he passes a Quaker family\'s home. Quirt has been wounded, and the kindly family takes him in to nurse him back to health against the advice of others. The handsome Evans quickly attracts the affections of their beautiful daughter, Penelope. He develops an affection for the family and their faith, but his troubled past follows him.','/tbnte13MT1mke828R0rKmNZ41G6.jpg','1947-02-15',100,'Released','He lived only for revenge...She lived only for his love!','Angel and the Badman',22356,3.3739,6.4,'kw9Hi8le_Cg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2141,_binary '\0','/dV0LX2CiLDem4CZRZFO0N6fxlK7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039155',7.3,1267,'fr','Antoine et Antoinette','1947, in France, Antoine and Antoinette, a young couple living in Paris, lead a monotonous existence: he works in a print shop while she is a shop assistant. But one evening, they regain hope: Antoine finds a winning lottery ticket in his girlfriend\'s handbag. He decides to cash it in, but loses his wallet. What follows is a series of twists and turns that redefine the couple\'s priorities while forcing them to remain optimistic.','/mQrx290OaYTgnuvcFaU0hFHBRlS.jpg','1947-09-27',88,'Released',NULL,'Antoine & Antoinette',44532,1.5161,6.245,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2142,_binary '\0','/bibt7aP2Cf6Mtp43eriWadryE9f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039169',7.2,10424,'en','The Bachelor and the Bobby-Soxer','Teenager Susan Turner, with a severe crush on playboy artist Richard Nugent, sneaks into his apartment to model for him and is found there by her sister Judge Margaret Turner. Threatened with jail, Nugent agrees to date Susan until the crush abates.','/eeBn5yhOBMBq2qQ9x2xQHyP1ZJk.jpg','1947-09-01',95,'Released','Rollicking Romantics!','The Bachelor and the Bobby-Soxer',27437,2.9238,6.9,'suIG0pVI33I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2143,_binary '\0','/fVEynIdJC8gRpslMfGXyZXrz5ar.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039190',7.6,24002,'en','The Bishop\'s Wife','An Episcopal Bishop, Henry Brougham, has been working for months on the plans for an elaborate new cathedral which he hopes will be paid for primarily by a wealthy, stubborn widow. He is losing sight of his family and of why he became a churchman in the first place. Enter Dudley, an angel sent to help him. Dudley does help everyone he meets, but not necessarily in the way they would have preferred. With the exception of Henry, everyone loves him, but Henry begins to believe that Dudley is there to replace him, both at work and in his family\'s affections, as Christmas approaches.','/2sMpffmvoJlW7WBcvyHTPR9DEsj.jpg','1947-12-25',109,'Released','Have you heard about Cary and the bishop\'s wife?','The Bishop\'s Wife',19490,4.6029,7.1,'bgb6ZRNQTv8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2144,_binary '\0','/hAyWibhJjMHyWXrMVX8N2MrEqF8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039192',7.7,31850,'en','Black Narcissus','A group of Anglican nuns, led by Sister Clodagh, are sent to a mountain in the Himalayas. The climate in the region is hostile and the nuns are housed in an odd old palace. They work to establish a school and a hospital, but slowly their focus shifts. Sister Ruth falls for a government worker, Mr. Dean, and begins to question her vow of celibacy. As Sister Ruth obsesses over Mr. Dean, Sister Clodagh becomes immersed in her own memories of love.','/jSbFWWbkUq5N5ikewJHNATcWnxS.jpg','1947-05-26',100,'Released','A story of exquisite yearning in a strange and beautiful land. Towering over the screen ... as the mountains that saw it happen.','Black Narcissus',16391,4.4636,7.5,'o7HQnwnUl1I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2145,_binary '\0','/dWqUklfSKDqMd07HA8eygj1o0ZX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039195',6.7,1342,'en','Blanche Fury','Penniless Blanche Fuller takes a job as a governess at the estate of her rich relations, the Fury family. To better her position in life, Blanche marries her dull cousin, Laurence Fury, who has a daughter she\'s fond of. But Blanche begins a tempestuous romance with steward Philip Thorn. Together, they hatch a murderous plan to gain control of the estate.','/iBvC2WdKSXrPfICPY0hAnV72Kgx.jpg','1948-02-19',90,'Released','Young, lovely, passionately beautiful ... and her love was as wild and tempestuous as her name!','Blanche Fury',129815,1.4716,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2146,_binary '\0','/wbky6s7YnNgUBE9ENAe4pJfFaUr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039204',7.6,5939,'en','Body and Soul','Charley Davis, against the wishes of his mother, becomes a boxer. As he becomes more successful the fighter becomes surrounded by shady characters, including an unethical promoter named Roberts, who tempt the man with a number of vices. Charley finds himself faced with increasingly difficult choices.','/lnKYS1A1k78X5v5IpLA96e6EYoe.jpg','1947-11-11',104,'Released','All for you...','Body and Soul',17487,2.5266,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2147,_binary '\0','/8aanbGZZFefH8HlE0v9PLb3pQ6k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039208',7.2,5512,'en','Boomerang!','When a kindly priest is murdered while waiting at a street corner in a quiet Connecticut town, the citizens are horrified and demand action from the police. All of the witnesses identify John Waldron, a nervous out-of-towner, as the killer. District Attorney Henry Harvey is then put on the case and faces political opposition in his attempt to prove Waldron\'s innocence.','/eN6p5zG2ar7zw5BD6UIGUpkA2FF.jpg','1947-02-28',88,'Released','It comes back at you again and again!','Boomerang!',18926,1.7114,7,'x0a_-1ICDNo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2148,_binary '\0','/xcXUN0iRoZfDyXj29tbRFFPhMf7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039211',7.2,6801,'en','Born to Kill','A calculating divorcée risks her chances at wealth and security with a man she doesn\'t love by getting involved with a hotheaded murderer.','/fFq23ToiVg8sWiMnD4f3Fj37UHD.jpg','1947-04-30',92,'Released','THE COLDEST KILLER A WOMAN EVER LOVED','Born to Kill',33813,1.9989,6.729,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2149,_binary '\0','/lnQ2tA9VInk6g0NyH9ULaQHCdUX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039217',6.5,1634,'en','The Brasher Doubloon','Mrs. Elizabeth Bright Murdock hires Marlowe to find an old rare coin, the Brasher Doubloon, that belonged in her deceased husband\'s collection. Marlowe begins investigating, but quickly finds himself entangled in a series of unexplained murders.','/eneuf3VaJaMaVlZaFpcfV46VNnm.jpg','1947-02-06',72,'Released','Some women can\'t stand cats ... with me it\'s men!','The Brasher Doubloon',1840,1.6572,6,'U_Vq4SxlXtk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2150,_binary '\0','/qXer7MXWDPz5BnmzAgbRWzARz4j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039220',7.2,7716,'en','Brighton Rock','Centring on the activities of a gang of assorted criminals and, in particular, their leader – a vicious young hoodlum known as \"Pinkie\" – the film\'s main thematic concern is the criminal underbelly evident in inter-war Brighton.','/pNzK7KEY30dgI9rfbTvolzNVZie.jpg','1948-01-09',92,'Released','Graham Greene\'s Shocking Thriller of the RAZOR GANGS!','Brighton Rock',13385,2.1152,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2151,_binary '\0','/aJcr2XzbFt2jqKtCnlw9Po1ZA2f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039224',7.5,12880,'en','Brute Force','Timeworn Joe Collins and his fellow inmates live under the heavy thumb of the sadistic, power-tripping guard Captain Munsey. Only Collins\' dreams of escape keep him going, but how can he possibly bust out of Munsey\'s chains?','/xgmmXFbioGOXZTou2FS44yKa54r.jpg','1947-07-16',98,'Released','Power Packed Picture!','Brute Force',28297,3.6955,7.306,'uTn6pHKVpNc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2152,_binary '\0','/rcbvgDkVkNR2WeBhH3o8V7qz6Zx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039226',6.8,2337,'en','Buck Privates Come Home','Two ex-soldiers return from overseas--one of them having smuggled into the country a French orphan girl he has become attached to. They wind up running into their old sergeant--who hates them--and getting involved with a race-car builder who\'s trying to find backers for a new midget racer he\'s building.','/vSp2sMdtEq3bVp2sU5FSOaGZPDG.jpg','1947-04-04',77,'Released','They\'re Out of the Army!','Buck Privates Come Home',33478,2.4086,6.4,'8jAcTJMPcKE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2153,_binary '\0','/96OBCIrpNckv0B2H2Kag1vQk3UT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039243',6.8,2460,'en','Captain from Castile','Spain, 1518: young caballero Pedro De Vargas offends his sadistic neighbor De Silva, who just happens to be an officer of the Inquisition. Forced to flee, Pedro, friend Juan Garcia, and adoring servant girl Catana join Cortez\' first expedition to Mexico. Arriving in the rich new land, Cortez decides to switch from exploration to conquest...with only 500 men. Embroiled in continuous adventures and a romantic interlude, Pedro almost forgets he has a deadly enemy...','/5DojmAjGSnISbZLg7C1Bb6dvXVJ.jpg','1947-12-25',140,'Released','Master of Women\'s Hearts . . . . . . . Conqueror of a New World.','Captain from Castile',44534,2.3777,7.2,'VB62g7-H8Kc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2154,_binary '\0','/5PM0fYL1RTqHtF2dHBNtbJmNUF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039250',6.4,1256,'en','Cass Timberlane','Judge Cass Timberlane marries a girl from the wrong side of the tracks, Virginia Marshland. A baby is stillborn and she turns more and more to attorney friend of of Cass\' Brad Criley. While quarreling the Judge tells Virginia to stay with Brad, but when she becomes sick he brings her home.','/msE1uf76jidFEgKHhANfwR9vlZz.jpg','1947-11-06',119,'Released','\"In Love With Her Was Like Being in an Earthquake!\"','Cass Timberlane',108688,2.7451,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2155,_binary '\0','/oDDa5vMivd1NQYJfpUs6OQzV4IZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039277',6.1,1483,'en','Copacabana','A talent agent sells his girlfriend to a nightclub – as two separate acts. The deception and constant costume changes are too much for his girl, and the men who have fallen for the different performers.','/mZeA7LCVSrvKdgpcP7ylwvlQtFF.jpg','1947-05-30',92,'Released','So LAVISH! So LILTING! So LADEN with LAUGHTER!','Copacabana',46955,2.2963,5.3,'F9nb4iW7lV4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2156,_binary '\0','/9QYqNGVKx0YabMExlwPXyUSuQFl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039286',7.2,11014,'en','Crossfire','A man is murdered, apparently by one of a group of soldiers just out of the army. But which one? And why?','/s3EFBiCsc4Ckc1tntoHAEnhZtSO.jpg','1947-08-15',86,'Released','Hate is like a loaded gun!','Crossfire',28120,3.5616,6.674,'Qf_tJx9SwMk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2157,_binary '\0','/xuqMsPZKKxPVXu3WalymRErCSPh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039288',6.6,2249,'en','Cry Wolf','A woman uncovers deadly secrets when she visits her late husband\'s family.','/ynwtpCC3bTw6crktOSLggWd9eIW.jpg','1947-08-19',83,'Released','The howl in the night is the voice of danger.','Cry Wolf',62720,1.844,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2158,_binary '\0','/icdGAwNnR3BpJQ8M6LEGUL7z7HB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039294',6.8,3388,'en','Daisy Kenyon','Daisy Kenyon is a Manhattan commercial artist having an affair with an arrogant and overbearing but successful lawyer and family man named Dan O\'Mara. Daisy meets a single man, a war veteran named Peter Lapham, and after a brief and hesitant courtship decides to marry him, although she is still in love with Dan.','/A3uIBvjXZVIAsenyJyMvonarqQf.jpg','1947-12-25',99,'Released','These Three Together... IN A LOVE ONLY TWO CAN SHARE!','Daisy Kenyon',20301,2.4367,6.6,'Q3HsRE1H48I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2159,_binary '\0','/nFCXzdeJbJiYZF6rvSQnkkHAL7G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039302',7.5,24366,'en','Dark Passage','A man convicted of murdering his wife escapes from prison and works with a woman to try and prove his innocence.','/dvwmiD6qQ05gojrFQRaFbdhbNDF.jpg','1947-09-05',106,'Released','In danger as violent as their love!!!','Dark Passage',16227,3.6985,7.3,'DaeoGJGTNGg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2160,_binary '\0','/mmhv5VyBsPHBoBBcoHfdAKwPjSv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039305',7,10156,'en','Dead Reckoning','War heroes Rip Murdock and Johnny Drake are sent to Washington, D.C, to receive top honors for their service. Johnny, seemingly terrified by the publicity that awaits him, jumps off the train and later turns up dead. Suspecting foul play, Rip begins digging into his pal\'s past. He encounters cover-ups, threats to his own life and deadly femme fatale Coral Chandler.','/kL1TxvXABa4ibbuctSZsUjDZX74.jpg','1946-12-31',100,'Released','He Doesn\'t Trust Anyone... Especially Women!','Dead Reckoning',20663,2.8467,6.856,'5HiuXaPLUpc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2161,_binary '\0','/yBHeKuom4pFNkvoiqGaQBPUpH3I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039306',6.9,1333,'en','Dear Murderer','When a man discovers his wife is having an affair, he commits the perfect crime.','/nd3KC7M4VZ0OOS8ARr8tndtiatW.jpg','1947-06-23',90,'Released',NULL,'Dear Murderer',36335,1.0187,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2162,_binary '\0','/5xL5EEqY6RGQZKb3eSUU2py8OVH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039308',6.8,1229,'en','Deep Valley','A shy California farm girl falls head-over-heels in love with Barry Burnett, a fugitive from a chain gang building a road through the wilderness.','/kFEPpg7Q69Wtogjlr96Qdw49ay3.jpg','1947-07-30',104,'Released','Mountainous thrills! Wild adventure! ...plunging them ever deeper into desperate danger !','Deep Valley',64319,1.48,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2163,_binary '\0','/cTLbCv6jAAWrGlOjsXTIr9rQXB4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039311',6.5,2540,'en','Desert Fury','The daughter of a Nevada casino owner gets involved with a racketeer, despite everyone\'s efforts to separate them.','/gNZsrXGmhz1KNMxz5I6Tzu2bthc.jpg','1947-08-15',96,'Released','Two men wanted her love ... The third wanted her life !','Desert Fury',27034,2.5786,6,'ViyqI7e2C7E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2164,_binary '\0','/tITgpXEA9XcoIgNKivYAdzXyRq3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039313',6.7,2822,'en','Desperate','An innocent trucker takes it on the lam when he\'s accused of robbery.','/Ac91MANcG3oFkr0u9TgcwD2LJNv.jpg','1947-06-20',73,'Released','MURDER at any moment! SUSPENSE... in every step!!!','Desperate',35955,1.5764,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2165,_binary '\0','/4GeMyaQkmBdYxKihEGVO9EXvaCU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039320',6.1,2097,'en','Dick Tracy Meets Gruesome','A gang of criminals, which includes a piano player and an imposing former convict known as \'Gruesome\', has found out about a scientist\'s secret formula for a gas that temporarily paralyzes anyone who breathes it. When Gruesome accidentally inhales some of the gas and passes out, the police think he is dead and take him to the morgue, where he later revives and escapes. This puzzling incident attracts the interest of Dick Tracy, and when the criminals later use the gas to rob a bank, Tracy realizes that he must devote his entire attention to stopping them.','/sUJNIJqSPIX2hEFu82OjaqZJK1m.jpg','1947-09-26',65,'Released','KARLOFF PETRIFIES THEM!','Dick Tracy Meets Gruesome',70702,2.9124,5.5,'JJTZ4iZIwc4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2166,_binary '\0','/afDfU55Z6RZM0JEea0YUHaq94dm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039321',5.8,1263,'en','Dick Tracy\'s Dilemma','Dick Tracy investigates the theft of a fortune of fur coats, a possible insurance swindle and several murders, all linked to a huge thug who wears a hook in place of his right hand.','/8fuS89ds46W5Nk7ZInoPh8QqWFG.jpg','1947-05-20',60,'Released','DEATH BATTLE... with Hook of Doom!','Dick Tracy\'s Dilemma',117123,2.1715,5.6,'GjphaVC9vDg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2167,_binary '\0','/8z9qUEH89loemVfh9hrRk8eeyjK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039324',6.5,1911,'en','Dishonored Lady','Art editor Madeleine Damian carries on numerous loveless affairs. After a failed relationship with advertiser Felix Courtland, the increasingly depressed Madeleine attempts suicide. When Jack Garet, her secretary and former lover, tries to blackmail her, Madeleine resigns and seeks a reclusive life. Neighbor David Cousins befriends Madeleine, but soon Courtland and Garet discover her whereabouts and disrupt her new life.','/2ROd0CeOM5cQP7rJdY81s0rdP5S.jpg','1947-05-16',85,'Released','Unbridled passion . . . scandal . . . murder!','Dishonored Lady',33079,1.5677,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2168,_binary '\0','/r9xIDDGz1AsKkPWiFGCTmFlVkWN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039335',6.9,4407,'en','A Double Life','A Shakespearian actor starring as Othello opposite his wife finds the character\'s jealous rage taking over his mind off-stage.','/rYa7JZN5PnpxXpR4oXAcefP9YXa.jpg','1947-12-25',104,'Released',NULL,'A Double Life',41206,2.4643,6.3,'zaxtunDdD6g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2169,_binary '\0','/duMqEHSpPOEdH0ddBP2vAP2nPF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039337',6.1,1825,'en','Down to Earth','Upset at a new Broadway musical mocking The Nine Muses, Greek goddess Terpsichore comes down to earth to land a part in the show and change it.','/vVJVe73kGdnD9iexcRR1nHlYcII.jpg','1947-08-21',101,'Released','She Sings And Dances like an Angel!','Down to Earth',67060,2.0449,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2170,_binary '\0','/k9G93xglgvaKSQEzysUcTyDUvjI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039349',6.9,3538,'en','The Egg and I','World War II veteran Bob MacDonald surprises his new wife, Betty, by quitting his city job and moving them to a dilapidated farm in the country. While Betty gamely struggles with managing the crumbling house and holding off nosy neighbors and a recalcitrant pig, Bob makes plans for crops and livestock. The couple\'s bliss is shaken by a visit from a beautiful farm owner, who seems to want more from Bob than just managing her property.','/xBQc0rPnQzbV6XbOlA6v3ETO2lU.jpg','1947-05-01',108,'Released','A best seller becomes a best picture !','The Egg and I',42342,2.499,7.04,'p8z_kOuAG0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2171,_binary '\0','/2n1gPPZ0kANDTU2DcGksTqMYUbm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039370',7.2,3264,'en','The Farmer\'s Daughter','After leaving her family\'s farm to study nursing in the city, a young woman finds herself on an unexpected path towards politics.','/k6RlWveQEKiVY7vFAPCi70Zisv0.jpg','1947-03-26',97,'Released','A Gal with Cultivating Ways!','The Farmer\'s Daughter',43466,2.2695,7.1,'mhta6TYF00E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2172,_binary '\0','/xFHlAqckVDSaeKbleVJl1CewA2L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039372',6.3,2050,'en','Fear in the Night','The dream is unusually vivid: Bank employee Vince Grayson finds himself murdering a man in a sinister octagonal-shaped room lined with mirrors while a mysterious woman breaks into a safe. It is so vivid that Vince suspects it may have really happened. To get the dream off his mind, he goes on a picnic with some relatives. When a thunderstorm forces his party into a nearby mansion, Vince discovers that the bizarre room does exist, and it means nothing but trouble.','/1aNGOSWDnIrQY2aZK1nkD87WiEt.jpg','1947-04-10',72,'Released','Nightmare of Murder...or Dream...or Reality','Fear in the Night',35401,1.6418,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2173,_binary '\0','/cRCZSGlKIVyVjgSXIfQsfCaxzbS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039391',6.5,1971,'en','Forever Amber','Amber St Clair, orphaned during the English Civil War and raised by a family of farmers, aspires to be a lady of high society; when a group of cavaliers ride into town, she sneaks away with them to London to achieve her dreams.','/lbqzwUxawDiKwPbIc46yKpDgL4R.jpg','1947-10-10',138,'Released',NULL,'Forever Amber',104720,2.7628,6.1,'_LUMuguY1Tg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2174,_binary '\0','/uTPWKLIxxafjeQHnfDhjSWFfX0b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039396',6.9,2981,'en','Framed','Truck driver Mike Lambert is a down-and-out mining engineer searching for a job. When his rig breaks down in a small town, he happens upon a venomous seductress. When her boyfriend robs a bank, they intend to frame Lambert.','/gCpZ13hCj4xp9m8FwERFKIzxVii.jpg','1947-05-25',82,'Released','\"I didn\'t ask you to come into my life!\"','Framed',29365,1.6357,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2175,_binary '\0','/uobfnW6lfH6jhBa0WSONyJO2uVo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039402',6.3,2920,'en','The Fugitive','Anti-Catholic and anti-cleric policies in the Mexican state of Tabasco lead the revolutionary government to persecute the state\'s last remaining priest.','/2CHA46FqD5rQAoJZwkjxMb0EOw8.jpg','1947-11-11',100,'Released','Peril-Laden adventure ... of a man\'s desperate plight !','The Fugitive',37368,3.0062,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2176,_binary '\0','/gcLCXH7ZTr3Yk2JG1u7cXb7p1vy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039404',6.3,10738,'en','Fun and Fancy Free','Jiminy Cricket hosts two Disney animated shorts: Bongo about a circus bear escaping to the wild, and Mickey and the Beanstalk, a take on the famous fairy tale.','/zBMBHx7JrHIB6U4wYT3q0yvwQuP.jpg','1947-09-27',73,'Released',NULL,'Fun and Fancy Free',46929,6.3634,6.26,'tzQZT3H6Nzc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2177,_binary '\0','/pgmWZsDuqSRTnC0JXlZCc1iLcQW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039410',6.5,1449,'en','The Gangster','Based on the novel Low Company. One of the most peculiar film noirs of the 1940s stars Barry Sullivan as a small-time hood who suffers a mental breakdown as his big plans begin to crumble. Beautiful Belita is his singer girlfriend who only fuels his paranoia.','/iD780H3mMhXFWkPMhBIgoreyKjf.jpg','1947-11-25',84,'Released','HE\'S GOT THE TOWN BY THE THROAT!','The Gangster',25735,1.5929,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2178,_binary '\0','/4XMEwQVADrym6XWcxudH11caLCA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039416',7.2,19359,'en','Gentleman\'s Agreement','A magazine writer poses as a Jew to expose anti-Semitism.','/aCCRbcmigPk00f34hpJuWZuvABo.jpg','1947-11-11',118,'Released',NULL,'Gentleman\'s Agreement',33667,2.9657,7,'E2eAXa7rNXw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2179,_binary '\0','/vblx2TkQFrBrEORsEssizgEqakT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039417',7.8,15529,'it','Germania anno zero','In the ruins of post-WWII Berlin, a twelve-year-old boy is left to his own devices in order to help provide for his family.','/sdxegsjrrvujXvv2GLPENyDlWDI.jpg','1948-07-11',74,'Released','A soldier can lose everything but his courage.','Germany, Year Zero',8016,3.2427,7.6,'JM_KpDmdF98','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2180,_binary '\0','/m1QTfbKD90j63Gh9bOJt0g67LvA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039420',7.8,21609,'en','The Ghost and Mrs. Muir','In 1900, young widow Lucy Muir learns that her seaside cottage is haunted and forms a unique relationship with the ghost.','/idoD3cwfwj86BPvVoWVgWhnT2xq.jpg','1947-05-25',105,'Released','THE SPIRIT... so willing! THE FLESH... so weak! THE ROMANCE... so wonderful!','The Ghost and Mrs. Muir',22292,3.8534,7.5,'n-X00-BoG9o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2181,_binary '\0','/qT2NFVFUq8rtqadklNODI95wx6Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039428',6.6,1388,'en','Golden Earrings','A British colonel escapes from the Gestapo to the Black Forest and poses as a Gypsy\'s mate.','/3ZMKfwdgqV1AfqmOK5Qykgr96n2.jpg','1947-08-27',95,'Released','Strange . . . Amazing . . . Their Love Story !','Golden Earrings',121357,1.1237,6.2,'GG0a0HI1WZM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2182,_binary '\0','/s518BymtHZvdkPwgOcgbJIxIxF7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039431',6.7,3033,'en','Good News','At fictitious Tait University in the Roaring \'20s, co-ed and school librarian Connie Lane falls for football hero Tommy Marlowe. Unfortunately, he has his eye on gold-digging vamp Pat McClellan. Tommy\'s grades start to slip, which keeps him from playing in the big game. Connie eventually finds out Tommy really loves her and devises a plan to win him back and to get him back on the field.','/m9pwo2RskZkeTk0H0dce253RNpD.jpg','1947-12-04',95,'Released','M-G-M\'s terrific technicolor musical!','Good News',31513,1.3828,6.5,'DJpIhDg0sHo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2183,_binary '\0','/jnrHsz0meZoJwcshhxqoMkXLgQC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039437',6.8,2006,'en','Green Dolphin Street','Sophie loved Edmund, but he left town when her parents forced her to marry wealthy Octavius. Years later, Edmund returns with his son, William. Sophie\'s daughter, Marguerite, and William fall in love. Marguerite\'s sister, Marianne, also loves William. Timothy, a lowly carpenter, secretly loves Marianne. He kills a man in a fight, and Edmund helps him flee to New Zealand. William deserts inadvertently from the navy, and also flees in disgrace to New Zealand, where he and Timothy start a profitable business. One night, drunk, William writes Octavius, demanding his daughter\'s hand; but, being drunk, he asks for the wrong sister.','/otyQj68iZSm3ezzaQJOJa3rfRsW.jpg','1947-01-15',141,'Released','A Fiery Girl Who Dares The Dangers Of The Sea And A Savage Land... Fighting For The Love Of A Bold Adventurer!','Green Dolphin Street',108994,1.7632,6.3,'yfxtWl1dUUo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2184,_binary '\0','/ftjFfSzzbR4H7SWtvvFMk6OCNVh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039464',6.9,2422,'en','High Wall','Steven Kenet, suffering from a recurring brain injury, appears to have strangled his wife. Having confessed, he\'s committed to an understaffed county asylum full of pathetic inmates. There, Dr. Ann Lorrison is initially skeptical about Kenet\'s story and reluctance to undergo treatment. But against her better judgement, she begins to doubt his guilt.','/7tiUGOrjmtS1wqRMCHFiSj8c1zz.jpg','1947-12-17',99,'Released','So tense! So taut! It closes in on you like a high wall!','High Wall',26838,1.4325,6.4,'p3_iMnhEYuI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2185,_binary '\0','/cCCGVjBeZrX9BOwHe49PWAZy9vP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039477',6.7,2155,'en','The Hucksters','A World War II veteran wants to return to advertising on his own terms, but finds it difficult to be successful and maintain his integrity.','/eJJJKpwh0VI3WxBtBWXTHjLr7Ds.jpg','1947-07-17',115,'Released','Gable\'s New Star is Deborah Kerr (rhymes with star)','The Hucksters',88812,2.2343,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2186,_binary '\0','/qOoVCqUqqF2phqPabCX0XNo37Zv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039478',6.7,2054,'en','Hue and Cry','A gang of street boys foil a master crook who sends commands for robberies by cunningly altering a comic strip\'s wording each week, unknown to writer and printer. The first of the Ealing comedies.','/odxsRtigwwQlHcUwn582qdSNdRy.jpg','1947-02-01',82,'Released','The Film that Begs to Differ','Hue and Cry',37193,1.0969,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2187,_binary '\0','/cSbRlgagrLLx5ez82KQn4blLaul.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039482',7,4155,'en','I Walk Alone','Bootleggers on the lam Frankie and Noll split up to evade capture by the police. Frankie is caught and jailed, but Noll manages to escape and open a posh New York City nightclub. 14 years later, Frankie is released from the clink and visits Noll with the intention of collecting his half of the nightclub\'s profits. But Noll, who has no intention of being so equitable, uses his ex-girlfriend Kay to divert Frankie from his intended goal.','/ovAn6MX1Oxs5GUBa3byvKCCYlea.jpg','1947-12-31',97,'Released','Once I trusted a dame... now I Walk Alone','I Walk Alone',27035,2.8852,6.586,'8tJ54Ddp9z8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2188,_binary '\0','/ktNXtYui4TNZRkuDHMIHJOlyTZq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039501',6.5,1248,'en','It Happened in Brooklyn','Danny has been in the army for 4 years, yet all he thinks about is Brooklyn and how great it is. When he returns after the war, he soon finds that Brooklyn is not so nice after all. He is able to share a place with Nick, the janitor of his old High School, and get a job as a singer in a music store. He also meets Leo, a talented pianist and his teacher Anne, whose dream is to singing Opera. When Jamie arrives from England, Danny tries to show him the Brooklyn experience and help him compose modern swing music. Together, these four also try to help Leo get the Brooklyn Music scholarship.','/lXCowhLhwdfFC5F9sVghK2irZTe.jpg','1947-03-13',105,'Released','IT ALL TAKES PLACE IN THAT FASCINATING WONDERLAND OF THE FAR EAST...BROOKLYN!','It Happened in Brooklyn',19525,1.7906,5.929,'4Bqe_W3-Zvc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2189,_binary '\0','/eCyZVhnmfSQjMCk3IhfmxFCY7aU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039502',7.6,7675,'en','It Happened on Fifth Avenue','A New Yorker hobo moves into a mansion and along the way he gathers friends to live in the house with him. Before he knows it, he is living with the actual home owners.','/4iYAKgBIh8fKY7fdzSKee2t2VIa.jpg','1947-04-17',116,'Released','It\'s 1947\'s Richest Comedy!','It Happened on Fifth Avenue',52844,2.5478,7.063,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2190,_binary '\0','/2Eir9DLWT0wiMXflTzb8M4c6Ri8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039504',7,1385,'en','Ivy','When Ivy, an Edwardian belle, begins to like Miles, a wealthy gentleman, she is unsure of what to do with her husband, Jervis, or her lover, Dr. Roger. She then hatches a plan to get rid of them both.','/mmycmi7LKGeJ9dvKtzzUTKqeqRd.jpg','1947-06-26',99,'Released','Pity the men in her life!','Ivy',44542,1.4633,6.6,'wnUkIPSMUHA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2191,_binary '\0','/d8IOOWTdSr6zgpfa6satceEcfTM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039515',6.8,3093,'en','Johnny O\'Clock','When an employee at an illegal gambling den dies suspiciously, her sister, Nancy, looks into the situation and falls for Johnny O\'Clock, a suave partner in the underground casino. Selfish and non-committal by nature, Johnny slowly begins to return Nancy\'s affection and decides to run away with her, but conflict within his business threatens their plans. As Johnny tries to distance himself from the casino, his shady past comes back to haunt him.','/9lT7qfwSKI30rnp108uA75txQUj.jpg','1947-01-07',95,'Released','Johnny Played Rough With Women Who Played Cute!','Johnny O\'Clock',19335,1.7805,6.3,'5Q82iUgMWZo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2192,_binary '\0','/nV8bclTuYEvTKGdZuMWfhjR1vF5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039536',7.4,10707,'en','Kiss of Death','An ex-con trying to go straight must face a crazed criminal out for revenge.','/3xenZzofvq2rLsCp9R7bTzIHj8t.jpg','1947-08-27',99,'Released','From her lips there is no escape!','Kiss of Death',21454,3.3188,7.1,'VDvh338LUFo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2193,_binary '\0','/tm4yDVgjqQxqOugvnGONpmTbWP8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039545',6.5,7180,'en','Lady in the Lake','Private eye Phillip Marlowe wants to get out of the detective racket and into crime writing. But when he\'s called to the office of editor Adrienne Fromsett, it\'s not to talk about his story ideas — she wants him to locate the missing wife of her boss, Mr. Kingsby. The assignment quickly becomes complicated when bodies start turning up.','/fJiooZDnO6x04FkOomLfG5joobZ.jpg','1946-12-19',105,'Released','You and Robert Montgomery Solve a Murder Mystery Together!','Lady in the Lake',1841,3.226,6.1,'lu1yBpO5cwE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2194,_binary '\0','/kaYIYUHAotU9nd3ixlGfBgFVhfR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039563',7.7,1319,'pt','O Leão da Estrela','Anastácio lives in Lisbon and is fanatic for Sporting CP, one of the city\'s football teams. When the team travels to face Porto, he follows it with the family, staying in house of his friend, Mr. Barata, pretending to be rich.','/yZpmSPNV8etwB4yqY7JD0dYziIW.jpg','1947-11-21',121,'Released',NULL,'The Lion from Estrela',79128,1.3388,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2195,_binary '\0','/1dbO38aZrL9HXPqdmjtERjK5NGS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039566',7.1,7151,'en','Life with Father','A straitlaced turn-of-the-century father presides over a family of boys and the mother who really rules the roost.','/6b7xRttshmonGW6xzSCDMrHMTjA.jpg','1947-09-13',118,'Released','Here for all!! All the happiness of the play that ran longer, the laughs that were louder than any known before!','Life with Father',41465,2.394,6.7,'FrbQ0YjSFSI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2196,_binary '\0','/3ir7a5TpNFvDi4ZzG1KWogCBbFA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039581',6.5,2418,'en','The Long Night','City police surround a building, attempting to capture a suspected murderer. The suspect knows there is no escape but refuses to give in.','/oM9ckww6Apnni3YrQl9R4qsXN7q.jpg','1947-05-28',101,'Released','COMING AT YOU ... in a blast of terrific drama!','The Long Night',44626,2.4412,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2197,_binary '\0','/fG8ia0DAyKzQIxZuXEQ4VmlLh9g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039583',6.8,1547,'en','The Lost Moment','In a long flashback, a New York publisher is in Venice pursuing the lost love letters of an early-19th-century poet, Jeffrey Ashton, who disappeared mysteriously. Using a false name, Lewis Venable rents a room from Juliana Bordereau, once Jeffrey Ashton\'s lover, now an aged recluse. Running the household is Juliana\'s severe niece, Tina, who mistrusts Venable from the first moment. He realizes all is not right when late one night he finds Tina, her hair unpinned and wild, at the piano. She calls him Jeffrey and throws herself at him. The family priest warns Venable to tread carefully around her fantasies, but he wants the letters at any cost, even Tina\'s sanity.','/zSUiir5uokSB5xr9LzRhNSsxcrp.jpg','1947-11-21',89,'Released',NULL,'The Lost Moment',72544,2.1155,6.288,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2198,_binary '\0','/1jq49u1SKjoVXvuEuVnnCF8vyeU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039589',7,5888,'en','Lured','Sandra Carpenter is a London-based dancer who is distraught to learn that her friend has disappeared. Soon after the disappearance, she\'s approached by Harley Temple, a police investigator who believes her friend has been murdered by a serial killer who uses personal ads to find his victims. Temple hatches a plan to catch the killer using Sandra as bait, and Sandra agrees to help.','/3nBt4ljVJGSynBEHI9xgD0GS6pe.jpg','1947-08-28',102,'Released','Don\'t answer this ad... Don\'t... don\'t... don\'t...','Lured',30308,2.0922,6.3,'1IlbW2LCue0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2199,_binary '\0','/kZ18VKdD1q1NtikeIdR3Fps4ae2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039595',6.4,1895,'en','Magic Town','Rip Smith\'s opinion-poll business is a failure...until he discovers that the small town of Grandview is statistically identical to the entire country. He and his assistants go there to run polls cheaply and easily, in total secrecy (it would be fatal to let the townsfolk get self-conscious). And of course, civic crusader Mary Peterman must be kept from changing things too much. But romantic involvement with Mary complicates life for Rip; then suddenly everything changes.','/plCn5h9s98MgqEpvqyuw7ZtZ1JX.jpg','1947-10-07',103,'Released','The guy with the dynamite heart meets the girl with the firecracker eyes!','Magic Town',90966,3.1737,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2200,_binary '\0','/x1q88uHMllcOyN6xJGwc1DbySI1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039615',7,1311,'fr','Les Maudits','In April 1945, a group of Nazis and collaborators gather in Oslo to board a submarine headed for South America, aiming to avoid justice. Kidnapped Doctor Guilbert is forced to accompany them.','/uzlRzlHXp4WtlHjkCEu730Xk4P8.jpg','1947-09-19',105,'Released',NULL,'The Damned',87245,1.2386,5.9,'YXOzoT-zsZ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2201,_binary '\0','/rSnMQ82mFlpBLRt2UvohO6sgemd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039628',7.9,60112,'en','Miracle on 34th Street','Kris Kringle, seemingly the embodiment of Santa Claus, is asked to portray the jolly old fellow at Macy\'s following his performance in the Thanksgiving Day parade. His portrayal is so complete that many begin to question if he truly is Santa Claus, while others question his sanity.','/vehuIm3y6BeMI7mYjxzaA1H8M0k.jpg','1947-06-04',96,'Released','Capture the spirit of Christmas with this timeless classic!','Miracle on 34th Street',11881,6.8619,7.4,'kUwyGo6PQzY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2202,_binary '\0','/f5EUue0mNt4gzjsrCP5QZENv3Ub.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039631',7.8,20803,'en','Monsieur Verdoux','The film is about an unemployed banker, Henri Verdoux, and his sociopathic methods of attaining income. While being both loyal and competent in his work, Verdoux has been laid-off. To make money for his wife and child, he marries wealthy widows and then murders them. His crime spree eventually works against him when two particular widows break his normal routine.','/mUPXIinTQsBdLlDaWiSl7GwQXVs.jpg','1947-08-27',124,'Released','Chaplin changes! Can you?','Monsieur Verdoux',30588,4.0238,7.7,'eND72dzh7EU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2203,_binary '\0','/qjsFuAlp0qrlMKITUgRmu6941t1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039632',7,1224,'fr','Monsieur Vincent','The life of Vincent de Paul, the 17th-century author and priest who founded two religious orders.','/6NpfFmqbDT0t6wIsju9X9KOMNW3.jpg','1947-11-05',111,'Released',NULL,'Monsieur Vincent',43460,1.957,6.617,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2204,_binary '\0','/eHuFlx1Tb2tabvZKbkRyNj2mk2H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039636',6.3,1451,'en','Mourning Becomes Electra','Near the end of the Civil War, the proud residents of Mannon Manor await the return of shipping tycoon Ezra Mannon and son Orin. Meanwhile Ezra’s conniving wife Christine and daughter Lavinia vie for the love of a handsome captain with a dark secret while well-meaning neighbor Peter sets his sights on Lavinia.','/xetaaQQDF84PQ7Hs57U31EuMPil.jpg','1947-11-19',173,'Released','...Mother and daughter in love with the same man ... rivals in ruthlessness even to murder!','Mourning Becomes Electra',82101,1.7329,6.25,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2205,_binary '\0','/6Pu1FOyMA3cdGXEjmOrO9J7O4eA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039645',6.7,4238,'en','My Favorite Brunette','Ronnie Jackson is a lowly baby photographer who secretly fantasizes about being a private detective. When a lovely baroness actually mistakes him for one and asks him to help locate her missing husband, Baron Montay, Ronnie finds himself agreeing. Several days later he is on death row whiling away the hours until his execution by recounting to a group of reporters the bizarre tale of how he ended up there.','/tTI4QFLQirmIw6YLR5kRAKyDKvv.jpg','1947-03-19',87,'Released','He\'s a hilarious hawkshaw... with a case on Dottie!','My Favorite Brunette',18649,2.176,6.641,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2206,_binary '\0','/qDg1saad2maGOYXNYWINRB72ibs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039651',7.7,2657,'ja','長屋紳士録','A hard-hearted old woman in a bombed-out Tokyo neighborhood reluctantly takes in an abandoned boy, leading to a heartwarming bond between them.','/fmlYp4hlIu59QCnBZ3A1tQ7UCVD.jpg','1947-05-20',72,'Released',NULL,'Record of a Tenement Gentleman',74126,1.6363,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2207,_binary '\0','/x6z4EGl6KCqAnhFRH1ACRvpXgCM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039661',7.7,14808,'en','Nightmare Alley','A roustabout joins a traveling carny and schemes to figure out the mind-reading act of Mademoiselle Zeena and her alcoholic husband.','/odlV13MZEswVyMBQ4fmmxLRHYT0.jpg','1947-10-09',112,'Released','He was all things to all men… But only one thing to all women!','Nightmare Alley',19169,4.5534,7.204,'4G3SS4LZRoQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2208,_binary '\0','/eu4lnt6IbNUPTEFshuWqf2PUtK0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039666',7.1,2608,'en','Nora Prentiss','Quiet, organised Dr. Talbot meets nightclub singer Nora Prentiss when she is slightly hurt in a street accident. Despite her misgivings, they become heavily involved, and Talbot finds himself faced with the choice of leaving Nora or divorcing his wife. When a patient expires in his office, a third option seems to present itself.','/ivIS8hNCg5B9SNAjHh0CDx7JHUt.jpg','1947-02-22',111,'Released','Would you keep your mouth shut if you were Nora Prentiss?','Nora Prentiss',26592,1.7599,6.3,'ix3ReOZ717A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2209,_binary '\0','/qxncAxaSl8LztlPXUQXxawBgTrh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039668',7.8,1305,'es','Nosotros los pobres','Carpenter Pepe El Toro lives peacefully with his daughter Chachita in an impoverished Mexico City neighborhood. He pursues a romance with the pretty Celia, but tragedy comes knocking on his door when he is falsely accused of having perpetrated a felony.','/ApnG8a3kNHyOUhuUjs2Zt2i24wC.jpg','1948-03-25',128,'Released',NULL,'We the Poor',53510,1.6213,8.171,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2210,_binary '\0','/jNSd62YYdvUMajHYnty1FVL1Bxu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039676',7,1770,'en','The October Man','Jim Ackland, who suffers from a head injury sustained in a bus crash, is the chief suspect in a murder hunt, when a girl that he has just met is found dead on the local common, and he has no alibi for the time she was killed.','/eDkJGh6qlKhV5aMaXcSQWUh3mCj.jpg','1947-08-28',95,'Released','The Great Star of \"Great Expectations\" at His Greatest!','The October Man',65777,1.4725,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2211,_binary '\0','/eb4aHemLxnyjqTqPNAQA0q1oyCw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039677',7.6,13281,'en','Odd Man Out','Belfast police conduct a door-to-door manhunt for an IRA gunman wounded in a daring robbery.','/zfNkremz9WlWK5gIaqqFwElc7rz.jpg','1947-01-30',116,'Released','An adventure in unbearable suspense!','Odd Man Out',43461,3.2678,7.3,'EsLLfuNOvws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2212,_binary '\0','/9qGWOflC5WNhaKk2UPYu55SjjNj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039689',7.9,45202,'en','Out of the Past','The peaceful life of a gas station owner is disrupted when a man from his past arrives in town and forces him to return to the dark world he had tried to escape.','/lnUK6Cg5ARM0qaq0B5SG20VAM0h.jpg','1947-11-25',97,'Released','OUT of the Sun, OUT of the Moonlight, OUT of the Past.','Out of the Past',678,6.5277,7.7,'tLMHIPMQmsM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2213,_binary '\0','/dlzDLqSR9bZZrmmw8CyMuml4VV4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039694',6.5,13617,'en','The Paradine Case','In London, barrister Anthony Keane takes the case of Maddalena Paradine, a beautiful woman accused of poisoning her blind husband. Though happily married, Keane becomes infatuated with his enigmatic client and convinced of her innocence. His obsession clouds his judgment as he builds a defense implicating her servant, André Latour—an act that leads to devastating consequences both in court and at home.','/faUkygLOpVA8roEYNYyQTX3llnJ.jpg','1947-12-29',114,'Released','The dramatic case of a beautiful woman whose trial for murder held the nation spellbound.','The Paradine Case',31667,3.5091,6.2,'HCKqAc1z72w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2214,_binary '\0','/hfEXbZpm90pkqnNITCFXgRKqEip.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039698',6.4,1355,'en','The Perils of Pauline','Funloving Pearl White, working in a garment sweatshop, gets her big chance when she \"opens\" for a delayed Shakespeare play...with a comic vaudeville performance. Her brief stage career leads her into those \"horrible\" moving pictures, where she comes to love the chaotic world of silent movies, becoming queen of the serials. But the consequences of movie stardom may be more than her leading man can take','/sNRA50WgkFnMA7g1M0qjBaPYrT2.jpg','1947-07-04',96,'Released','The Untold Story of the Life and Loves of the First Great Thrill Star of the Screen!','The Perils of Pauline',149687,1.8944,6.7,'8wOt0EREAFk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2215,_binary '\0','/2V7a9HmPyazSZGAFweLcREhzs7M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039725',7.1,6439,'en','Possessed','After being found wandering the streets of Los Angeles, a severely catatonic woman tells a doctor the complex story of how she wound up there.','/RfQXnFgzSpMzqLWYS3HN7qXrYQ.jpg','1947-05-29',108,'Released','You’ll be possessed by the love-madness of \"POSSESSED\"','Possessed',20849,2.0019,6.9,'2XoWYeofNbs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2216,_binary '\0','/m6prBXuahIAarhiEtbq3kNChICe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039737',7.2,4365,'en','Pursued','A boy haunted by nightmares about the night his entire family was murdered is brought up by a neighboring family in the 1880s. He falls for his lovely adoptive sister but his nasty adoptive brother and mysterious uncle want him dead.','/5UjUTgSGytAYsU4WCXmaBXLtlSY.jpg','1947-03-05',101,'Released','Robert Mitchum fights for the love of three people who want to see him dead...his family.','Pursued',26761,1.8001,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2217,_binary '\0','/yBNounwKZfu291XkoRZZeWGwFpx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039739',7.7,6961,'fr','Quai des Orfèvres','Paris, France, December 1946. Jenny Lamour, an ambitious cabaret singer, and Maurice, her extremely jealous pianist husband, become involved in the thorough investigation of the murder of a shady businessman, led by Antoine, a peculiar and methodical police inspector.','/1z7v34MT4pXYwiRGHRovlzuL6xp.jpg','1947-10-04',108,'Released',NULL,'Jenny Lamour',49842,2.0057,7.53,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2218,_binary '\0','/f8NDL0lHcb4QkRHcBirBqlzNFiC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039748',6.6,1966,'en','Railroaded!','A beautician and her crooked boyfriend attempt to rob the bookie operation located in the back room, but when the plan goes wrong, they frame an innocent man.','/A0nTXfbw50iqPcdsSFOJozSFGGC.jpg','1947-09-25',72,'Released','THE FACE OF DANGER was the face of the man she loved!','Railroaded!',43463,1.2357,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2219,_binary '\0','/9mRzGA37bB8KgdEydYbQRBrYxnG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039750',6.6,2096,'en','Ramrod','A cattle-vs.-sheepman feud loses Connie Dickason her fiance, but gains her his ranch, which she determines to run alone in opposition to Frank Ivey, \"boss\" of the valley, whom her father Ben wanted her to marry. She hires recovering alcoholic Dave Nash as foreman and a crew of Ivey\'s enemies. Ivey fights back with violence and destruction, but Dave is determined to counter him legally... a feeling not shared by his associates. Connie\'s boast that, as a woman, she doesn\'t need guns proves justified, but plenty of gunplay results.','/8NWwT1YhZKcSDben3OZiEbAlaRY.jpg','1947-05-02',95,'Released','Men are so Easy!... A Little Lace, a Pair of Lips, a Touch, and they Kill for you!','Ramrod',60541,2.1073,6.5,'BgHNF35fau8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2220,_binary '\0','/wzBmxfGWQH5v6xhI6T8jgkDVGwc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039757',6.7,5715,'en','The Red House','An old man and his sister are concealing a terrible secret from their adopted teen daughter, concerning a hidden abandoned farmhouse, located deep in the woods.','/9BBdps0PfYccltNvVJGq1siip4D.jpg','1947-02-04',100,'Released','OF THIS MAN...AND THE GIRL WHO LIVED IN \"THE RED HOUSE\"...people spoke only in whispers','The Red House',30162,2.1907,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2221,_binary '\0','/xBeRRtiUzNM1RynWw0yjvDYtn3v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039761',6.8,2428,'en','Repeat Performance','On New Year\'s Eve 1946, Sheila Page kills her husband Barney. She wishes that she could relive 1946 and avoid the mistakes that she made throughout the year. Her wish comes true but cheating fate proves more difficult than she anticipated.','/lr337XUyoOfjvExZGiG2Ke0mTmy.jpg','1947-05-22',91,'Released','Time stopped in its tracks... when she pulled the trigger!','Repeat Performance',28914,2.1667,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2222,_binary '\0','/aDLIjWJiXKx7PZ9JR8kuVNvUhyt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039768',7.2,3867,'en','Ride the Pink Horse','A con man tries to blackmail a Mexican gangster.','/6oJWu5XZ5tb7EgJVmTdOlaqcsjf.jpg','1947-10-08',101,'Released','THE EXCITEMENT OF DESPERATE ADVENTURE! THE SUSPENSE OF RELENTLESS MAN-HUNT!','Ride the Pink Horse',18871,2.4126,7.229,'nVcdFIWT6zA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2223,_binary '\0','/jsxs4MfNoOSRkFd4jR0hK6pkWQ6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039776',6.9,3742,'en','Road to Rio','Scat Sweeney and Hot Lips Barton, two out of work musicians, stow away onboard a ship bound for Rio, after accidentally setting fire to the big top of a circus. They then get mixed up with a potential suicide Lucia, who first thanks them, then unexpectedly turns them over to the ship\'s captain. When they find out that she has been hypnotized, to go through a marriage of convenience, when the ship reaches Rio, the boys turn up at the ceremony, in order to stop the wedding, and to help catch the crooks.','/9xUeOjK6sTkhjwv1MuaUE2o2sLt.jpg','1947-12-25',100,'Released','Take a New Year Cruise to Rio with the Screen\'s Top Laughter Trio!','Road to Rio',31980,1.8067,6.793,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2224,_binary '\0','/gfvbV9NQgH4eZ6H0GV7XmbWs3wX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039800',4.1,2057,'en','Scared to Death','A woman is married to the son of a doctor, the proprietor of a private sanatorium, where she is under unwilling treatment. Both the son and the doctor indicate they want the marriage dissolved. Arriving at the scene is a mysterious personage identified as the doctor\'s cousin who formerly was a stage magician in Europe. He is accompanied by a threatening dwarf.','/ymaIo6NbBbQeNgzQBP8zHTn21ph.jpg','1947-02-01',68,'Released','A thrilling mystery of a supernatural killer!','Scared to Death',23622,1.2202,4.3,'2V18q0QuxrY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2225,_binary '\0','/nMbY1iOXk1VPIAjsp6qJqvl45d9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039806',6.3,2737,'en','The Sea of Grass','On America\'s frontier, a St. Louis woman marries a New Mexico cattleman who is seen as a tyrant by the locals.','/uUhSjS8jrkQwI2b6CD7VzzDylGa.jpg','1947-04-25',123,'Released','Big as its stars!','The Sea of Grass',87531,2.9124,6.1,'Snci-9qxtSk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2226,_binary '\0','/hQWVrE9WvxMC44anlmL70Exb9CU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039808',6.9,7620,'en','The Secret Life of Walter Mitty','Walter Mitty, a daydreaming writer with an overprotective mother, likes to imagine that he is a hero who experiences fantastic adventures. His dream becomes reality when he accidentally meets a mysterious woman who hands him a little black book. According to her, it contains the locations of the Dutch crown jewels hidden since World War II. Soon, Mitty finds himself in the middle of a confusing conspiracy, where he has difficulty differentiating between fact and fiction.','/cctKBFz6VoDDW56PbuWiq4F9Nmr.jpg','1947-09-01',110,'Released','A dream world of comedy, color and Goldwyn-Girl loveliness!','The Secret Life of Walter Mitty',40092,3.7441,6.822,'awthjYwVAr4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2227,_binary '\0','/guZVHRB7UK8Cts5XzRyiYgmtx4s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039822',7.6,6284,'fr','Le Silence de la mer','In a small town in WWII France, a German officer is billeted in the house of an elderly man and his niece who resist the occupation by refusing to interact with him, even as he speaks to them candidly about his life and hopes for the future of France and Germany.','/fSXcS9ARNI07I1mR6FcycdLnnJj.jpg','1949-04-22',87,'Released',NULL,'The Silence of the Sea',40650,2.1453,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2228,_binary '\0','/d83LZQIa2MAIGsAgbyaIOZ3f49O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039825',6.3,1872,'en','The Sin of Harold Diddlebock','Twenty-three years after scoring the winning touchdown for his college football team mild-mannered Harold Diddlebock, who has been stuck in a dull, dead-end book-keeping job for years, is let go by his pompous boss, advertising tycoon J.E. Wagglebury, with nothing but a tiny pension. Harold, who never touches the stuff, takes a stiff drink with his new pal... and another, and another. What happened Wednesday?','/gXYOAlBjG2bx65sL1ObWWVRvGnp.jpg','1947-04-04',92,'Released','Yes Sir! Wednesday was WILD! Wednesday was RUGGED!','The Sin of Harold Diddlebock',23001,1.7596,6.4,'-qH-UDsI80Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2229,_binary '\0','/AcrGUn80TyjBonMyjuR6f0NnNqv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039826',6.1,2562,'en','Sinbad the Sailor','Daredevil sailor Sinbad embarks on a voyage across the Seven Seas to find the lost riches of Alexander the Great. His first stop is the port of Basra, where his ship is seized and scheduled for auction. In his attempt to win it back, he befriends beautiful concubine Shireen. But when her master, the nefarious Emir, calls her back to duty, Sinbad must interrupt his adventure to save the \"Jewel of Persia.\"','/vGR0NXdzfUEtokDLvKj7IFn4RFv.jpg','1947-01-13',116,'Released','BRAVE in Adventure! BOLD in Love!','Sinbad the Sailor',43464,2.7476,6,'_szq077PN1U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2230,_binary '\0','/ed2ooAOQCedP49Zo2WlYtfnxTDu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039834',6.4,2579,'sv','Skepp till Indialand','Returning home after seven years at sea, a sailor relives his youth aboard a salvage ship dominated by his abusive father, recalling love, betrayal, and the desire to escape. Told in flashback, the film explores family conflict, longing, and moral reckoning in an early milestone of Ingmar Bergman’s career.','/t3YMYzdL25sdd2G4JIugcfZBeIm.jpg','1947-09-22',96,'Released',NULL,'A Ship to India',106122,1.8827,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2231,_binary '\0','/ivcFLwMa7Ix9XvNo2XXmlqWxadI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039840',6.3,1933,'en','Smash-Up: The Story of a Woman','A nightclub singer uses alcohol in excess to sooth her painful life.','/zNTmxsWoDz6tQwEtTI266FFK5pj.jpg','1947-03-01',103,'Released','Love-Wrecked!','Smash-Up: The Story of a Woman',48994,1.9452,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2232,_binary '\0','/fzjz2CifO8O6Jqq7zkfp4tynyI7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039850',6.7,1255,'en','Song of Love','Composer Robert Schumann struggles to compose his symphonies while his loving wife Clara offers her support. Also helping the Schumanns is their lifelong friend, composer Johannes Brahms.','/3k8UyQfGq8YZ32iuRPWOv6ApCRF.jpg','1947-10-09',115,'Released','A Love Story So Beautiful It Was Set to Music!','Song of Love',130899,1.628,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2233,_binary '\0','/zSkPlXzUp4PvXM5SgJws0WmHMs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039853',6.9,6355,'en','Song of the Thin Man','While attending a glamorous jazz cruise on New York’s East River, Nick and Nora Charles witness the fatal shooting of a wealthy patron. When suspicion falls on a young bandleader and his musicians, the couple steps in to clear their friends and uncover the real killer. Their investigation leads through a lively world of jazz clubs, radio personalities, high society, and backstage rivalries, where almost everyone has a secret and the next clue may be hidden in the music.','/wlj6IQrYRtHAQdIY08gicGOBp49.jpg','1947-08-28',86,'Released',NULL,'Song of the Thin Man',14595,2.3674,6.7,'DCg3DOopWXM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2234,_binary '\0','/9EorJBzsBuEQ2MpEHwnYwFrmpqu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039871',7.2,4228,'ja','素晴らしき日曜日','Two broke sweethearts wander war-scarred Tokyo on a single Sunday, stretching 35 yen as they chase housing, small pleasures, and a little hope.','/2JADvAzmEiLaYqnw8eZVOp88q5j.jpg','1947-07-01',108,'Released',NULL,'One Wonderful Sunday',45967,2.2338,7.189,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2235,_binary '\0','/mAQ0hJfI7Q1UPHhEqIRIAXwSpZM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039881',6.9,4441,'en','T-Men','Two T-men, U.S. Treasury agents, go undercover in Detroit, and then Los Angeles, in an attempt to break a U.S. currency counterfeiting ring.','/gmFklBSJdi38WDjJUq0mXRXe2qt.jpg','1947-12-15',92,'Released','Terrific... and true!','T-Men',26174,2.7691,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2236,_binary '\0','/27gBh0aNRzs9b0loQSMGZAvZbaj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039887',6,2384,'en','Tarzan and the Huntress','A shortage of zoo animals after World War II brings beautiful animal trainer Tanya, her financial backer and her cruel trail boss to the jungle. After negotiating a quota with the native king, they take more animals than allowed. Tarzan intervenes.','/ldOLFlbk6ecRnANiozgh4nX4GrD.jpg','1947-04-05',72,'Released','Adventure Crashes To The Screen . . . Romance, Plus! Action, Plus! . . . Amid the Teeming Jungle!','Tarzan and the Huntress',82053,2.2965,5.7,'KuLbdEj9m6A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2237,_binary '\0','/s4Bcy370GvLHzkwSXZY76arZI97.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039895',7.2,2292,'en','They Made Me a Fugitive','After being framed for a policeman\'s murder, a criminal escapes prison and sets out for revenge.','/dJ8VhdQkFPhmLeBmodgXuzyQ1mC.jpg','1947-06-27',99,'Released','Gangway for Gangland\'s Blazing Guns!','They Made Me a Fugitive',49334,2.2993,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2238,_binary '\0','/4goYJJJUZc7wjJ67Rv8rYOTjI7a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039896',7.2,3635,'en','They Won\'t Believe Me','On trial for murdering his girlfriend, philandering stockbroker Larry Ballentine takes the stand to claim his innocence and describe the actual, but improbable sounding, sequence of events that led to her death.','/aUMZpKU2GRUKjeufdJKfbPhBzva.jpg','1947-07-16',95,'Released','He lived a lie that led him from one disastrous love to another!','They Won\'t Believe Me',27203,2.6054,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2239,_binary '\0','/3a2sPIxltYZn6uEPe0epvkE40Zy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039912',6,1378,'en','The Trap','When a troupe of showgirls with their impresario and press agent vacation at a Malibu Beach resort, two of them are garroted. Charlie takes on the case assisted by Number Two Son Jimmy and faithful chauffeur Birmingham Brown.','/209R5pMdoLpu2P3xqm7sa7JaynA.jpg','1946-11-30',62,'Released','It\'s The HEIGHT of FRIGHT!','The Trap',38472,1.717,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2240,_binary '\0','/mYOXjwKUjTE5YjK8NtW9cUaVlFW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039926',6.8,5571,'en','The Two Mrs. Carrolls','Struggling artist Geoffrey Carroll meets Sally while on holiday in the country. A romance develops, but he doesn\'t tell her he\'s already married. Suffering from mental illness, Geoffrey returns home where he paints an impression of his wife as the angel of death and then promptly poisons her. He marries Sally but after a while he finds a strange urge to paint her as the angel of death too and history seems about to repeat itself.','/r4Xky20Yi1S5tsQD7tqP714XH7T.jpg','1947-03-04',99,'Released','Never try to deceive two women!','The Two Mrs. Carrolls',27448,2.4422,6.4,'ChFysLtfKAc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2241,_binary '\0','/9VCsJiRkhM93fvqe4sN77FOf9Eb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039927',6.1,1840,'en','Tycoon','Engineer Johnny Munroe is enlisted to build a railroad tunnel through a mountain to reach mines. His task is complicated, and his ethics are compromised, when he falls in love with his boss\'s daughter','/kinlg9PjTwa6iCe0EdXDPBqUoRD.jpg','1947-12-27',128,'Released','Breath-taking Adventure !','Tycoon',56930,1.6969,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2242,_binary '\0','/bpJmsiKJQDtJ4GVrvUNvf5dA92E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039931',6.9,3340,'en','Unconquered','England, 1763. After being convicted of a crime, the young and beautiful Abigail Hale agrees, to escape the gallows, to serve fourteen years as a slave in the colony of Virginia, whose inhabitants begin to hear and fear the sinister song of the threatening drums of war that resound in the wild Ohio valley.','/sOsESBjWExyOulekJJMc9o5Q5BX.jpg','1947-10-10',147,'Released','I bought this woman for my own… and I\'ll kill the man who touches her!','Unconquered',72241,11.7835,6.5,'vUgOJUs4lH8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2243,_binary '\0','/kyHzh8wKHP9EDg9wQnrmWaTDFr6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039937',6.8,1836,'en','The Unfaithful','Christine Hunter kills an intruder and tells her husband and lawyer that it was an act of self-defense. It\'s later revealed that he was actually her lover and she had posed for an incriminating statue he created.','/3lU8LmPTqRzm0VbpY21gVUKsYw0.jpg','1947-07-01',109,'Released','It\'s So Easy to Cry \'SHAME\'!','The Unfaithful',72847,1.715,5.9,'HAWwTtNKKn8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2244,_binary '\0','/vpx6zQ1Lz37qqb3TqFaqte08lcj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039941',7.2,4188,'en','The Unsuspected','The secretary of an affably suave radio mystery host mysteriously commits suicide after his wealthy young niece disappears.','/cUhDjZUHtWuB1tAnpHbIXeQMsGb.jpg','1947-10-11',103,'Released','You can\'t foresee it! You can\'t forget it!','The Unsuspected',29117,2.4033,6.7,'yX1mZvd3UB0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2245,_binary '\0','/6jx105RezDHbBH5pdvpBAIkbeLa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039947',6.9,1679,'en','The Upturned Glass','A neurosurgeon relates to his students in medical school a story about an affair he had with a married woman and how after the affair was over, the woman fell out a window and died. The surgeon, suspecting that she was murdered, set out to find her killer -- but, instead of turning the suspect over to the police, he planned to take his own revenge on the murderer.','/kduVBUAcvoOQBbTr0OMOV43c0NV.jpg','1947-06-17',86,'Released','A Powerful NEW Drama of a Mad Love!','The Upturned Glass',77649,1.3033,6.8,'b3z9yxXUxuc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2246,_binary '\0','/oprtsBXkDJULlZGbswnjdA4aS1j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039973',7.1,1795,'en','The Web','A brash young lawyer takes a short-term, high-paying job as bodyguard for a slick business exec being threatened by a former partner, and quickly realizes he may be in over his head.','/lCOfqAKkcwelgFeQ8VWMLf35IJs.jpg','1947-06-04',87,'Released',NULL,'The Web',29113,1.5027,7.1,'qcE8ESlRJDU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2247,_binary '\0','/pIQwX8ZiWEluBKirJqCEryXg42l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0039998',6.7,1362,'en','The Wistful Widow of Wagon Gap','Chester Wooley and Duke Egan are travelling salesmen who make a stopover in Wagon Gap, Montana while enroute to California. During the stopover, a notorious criminal is murdered, and the two are charged with the crime.','/edzrpD23NGCEBaOG1Gjh7xtHej2.jpg','1947-10-08',78,'Released','It\'s \'Ma (EGG AND I) KETTLE\' as the wild and willing widow!','The Wistful Widow of Wagon Gap',33551,1.8778,6.2,'lz8YTX33QFA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2248,_binary '\0','/2sRTQTtY5lSRqG9njDoYTUWPVvv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040000',6.3,2958,'en','The Woman on the Beach','A sailor suffering from post-traumatic stress becomes involved with a beautiful and enigmatic seductress married to a blind painter.','/fz7ASNtc7koTdrx4fuRZbLobgSw.jpg','1947-06-07',71,'Released','Go ahead and say it...I\'m no good!','The Woman on the Beach',37041,2.1877,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2249,_binary '\0','/vkDqTAQdBvtABEA43Kt8hAdD5K3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040064',7,11779,'en','3 Godfathers','Three outlaws on the run discover a dying woman and her baby. They swear to bring the infant to safety across the desert, even at the risk of their own lives.','/dsVrYIpK2Rcgsr5QrfjBQWee5JE.jpg','1948-12-31',102,'Released','John Ford\'s Legend of the Southwest!','3 Godfathers',29244,4.9158,6.77,'QSISyY3oOwE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2250,_binary '\0','/61tnLDN51qnBZnpRJXhiiFahj52.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040068',7.3,20575,'en','Bud Abbott and Lou Costello Meet Frankenstein','The Wolf Man tries to warn a dimwitted porter that Dracula wants his brain for Frankenstein monster\'s body.','/tCMtyjL7aFRalXBDkHKz1bMVRHm.jpg','1948-06-01',83,'Released','JEEPERS! The CREEPERS are after BUD & LOU!!','Bud Abbott and Lou Costello Meet Frankenstein',3073,4.5573,7.099,'3NzfaLvm4Po','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2251,_binary '\0','/o82GZeidFbK5MXafnihhHng7ukJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040071',6.8,1264,'en','The Accused','When college student Bill Perry grows inappropriately fond of psychology professor Wilma Tuttle and tries to rape her, her self-defense inadvertently kills him. Wilma then moves Bill\'s corpse to a nearby beach and makes his death look like the result of a cliff diving accident. But her guilt over the incident builds, and Lt. Ted Dorgan begins to suspect that Wilma knows more than she\'s letting on.','/cazrLbE894pXLIiUxa8snxj2D7Q.jpg','1949-01-12',101,'Released','Everything points to... the Accused!','The Accused',29846,1.9995,6.1,'1VKl5UzO8iQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2252,_binary '\0','/ybJdjtKCbMbl0hjhKONIN43UgAI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040076',7,3867,'en','Adventures of Don Juan','Spanish Lothario Don Juan, the legendary lover and adventurer returns to Spain following a scandal and comes to the aid of his queen, who is under threat from sinister forces.','/5kI8MwkTQWBGsFqwDTVkvMDOHg2.jpg','1948-12-24',106,'Released','History\'s Boldest Lover . . . Most Daring Swordsman ! !','Adventures of Don Juan',34233,3.2429,6.8,'waquWFCKLPg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2253,_binary '\0','/bvDSGW50jvDvbiWhxKMYp0YEHEP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040087',7.3,2725,'en','All My Sons','During WWII, industrialist Joe Keller commits a crime and frames his business partner Herbert Deever. Years later, his sin comes back to haunt him when his son plans to marry Deever\'s daughter.','/zEtpSNIQy2wW8ZDpT4MaF7O18Ha.jpg','1948-05-01',94,'Released',NULL,'All My Sons',45166,2.148,6.5,'3mKWOSfdhy8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2254,_binary '\0','/a3DKApUt7uv7uJhP1Iw3HgZJiBH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040092',6.9,2236,'it','L\'Amore','L\'Amore (\'Love\') is a 1948 Italian drama anthology film that consists of two parts, The Human Voice (Una voce umana), based on Jean Cocteau\'s 1929 play of the same title, and The Miracle (Il miracolo), based on Ramón del Valle-Inclán\'s 1904 novel Flor de santidad.','/yhnoiJDFM39YYEoVqFnWv1x669e.jpg','1948-11-02',80,'Released',NULL,'L\'Amore',43444,1.1159,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2255,_binary '\0','/nLvfDsVENl6TYAcp3I4fWusfF6w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040098',6.6,3197,'en','Anna Karenina','In Imperial Russia, Anna, wife of the officer Karenin, goes to Moscow to visit her brother. On the way, she meets charming cavalry officer Vronsky, to whom she\'s immediately attracted— but in St. Petersburg’s high society, a relationship like this could destroy a woman’s reputation.','/fWIjqoYdNSJFJIQtT9aaeCmjCeP.jpg','1948-01-22',139,'Released','Vivien Leigh— in the most magnificent love story ever written!','Anna Karenina',32066,2.467,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2256,_binary '\0','/m6YvMxFKxiVjm1uH6nGJgm7chx6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040104',7.3,1314,'en','Apartment for Peggy','Professor Henry Barnes decides he\'s lived long enough and contemplates suicide. His attitude is changed by Peggy Taylor, a chipper young mother-to-be who charms him into renting out his attic as an apartment for her and her husband Jason, a former GI struggling to finish college.','/lnjHqtOyYwIcZ9BGGPCKve27fGU.jpg','1948-09-30',96,'Released',NULL,'Apartment for Peggy',218212,1.4879,8.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2257,_binary '\0','/jy3MaXwlMMToHwYRsU2VE9VbkP9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040109',6.3,2177,'en','Arch of Triumph','In the winter of 1938, Paris is crowded with refugees from the Nazis, who live in the black shadows of night, trying to evade deportation. One such is Dr. Ravic, who practices medicine illegally and stalks his old Nazi enemy Haake with murder in mind. One rainy night, Ravic meets Joan Madou, a kept woman cast adrift by her lover\'s sudden death. Against Ravic\'s better judgment, they become involved in a doomed affair.','/aKzNR6ZHexdUgwfaxgkqlYnAwwQ.jpg','1948-02-17',133,'Released','The story of an outcast and a killer!','Arch of Triumph',40985,2.6092,6,'Lftqjui2SxU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2258,_binary '\0','/joQuZ1psLXeeiPQxaREu66msAdW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040142',5.3,1285,'en','The Babe Ruth Story','The baseball player goes from wayward youth to Boston Red Sox pitcher to New York Yankees home-run hero.','/7HYkbTeh0m6e9Q0f7bNtfjFipuk.jpg','1948-09-16',106,'Released','The incredible life... the spectacular thrills... the fabulous times of America\'s best-loved hero.......','The Babe Ruth Story',43452,1.5674,6.1,'2eUZT2_bO8w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2259,_binary '\0','/dbZWe2V6wtdVUn2SHKWmb5AD5oC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040155',6.8,4323,'en','Berlin Express','In post-war Europe, a diverse group of passengers aboard a U.S. Army train to bombed-out Frankfurt becomes involved in a Nazi assassination plot.','/eoJHaq8FLu7vJiJZTEs1OsdAjcy.jpg','1948-05-01',87,'Released','Trapped on a Train of Terror!','Berlin Express',42286,2.09,6.3,'RpD6VBtApD8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2260,_binary '\0','/drtVPcIOUllCL5iVkEpe4XHikIr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040160',7.6,11086,'en','The Big Clock','George Stroud, a crime magazine\'s crusading editor, has to postpone a vacation with his wife - again - when a glamorous blonde is murdered and he is assigned by his publishing boss to find the killer. As the investigation proceeds to its conclusion, Stroud must try to disrupt his ordinarily brilliant investigative team as they increasingly build evidence that he is the killer.','/urnKMXbvNubipGbdqmXpXoNS2OO.jpg','1948-03-18',95,'Released','The Strangest and Most Savage Manhunt in History!','The Big Clock',19974,2.9497,7.266,'ruleU0zIz3g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2261,_binary '\0','/vuXbLyk6ZTuPknqsLzSBcV7ommq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040175',6.9,4042,'en','Blood on the Moon','Down-and-out cowhand Jim Garry is asked by his old friend Tate Riling to help mediate a cattle dispute. When Garry arrives, however, it soon becomes clear that Riling has not been entirely forthright. Garry uncovers Riling\'s plot to dupe local rancher John Lufton out of a fortune. When Lufton\'s firecracker of a daughter, Amy, gets involved, Garry must choose between his old loyalties and what he knows to be right.','/eQk2JSVfC1iskVEUUURs2gi0ANM.jpg','1948-11-11',88,'Released','A woman\'s bullet kills as quick as a man\'s!','Blood on the Moon',29966,3.2473,6.247,'8abz9-GlJuY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2262,_binary '\0','/xzARrhtQBc6cMIoETqAHi2HqaC5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040178',6.5,1376,'en','Bodyguard','A cop on suspension is framed for murder when he noses in on a murder investigation.','/cSmyue0TmvMnfSjCTQ9EIPsuEHf.jpg','1948-09-04',62,'Released','A Real \"Who-done-it\" Thriller','Bodyguard',61579,2.0464,6.094,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2263,_binary '\0','/axLBB4Q6mgCuy1W0cTfkY4IdUSd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040185',6.7,3556,'en','The Boy with Green Hair','Peter, an orphaned boy, is adopted by Gramp Frye after his parents are killed in Europe while doing war relief work. The boy feels safe with his new caretaker, but when he is taunted for being an orphan, he gets demoralized. The next day Peter wakes up with green hair. Embarrassed and further ridiculed, Peter seeks solace in a nearby forest. To his surprise, he finds other orphans in the woods, who encourage him to spread news of the injustices of war.','/a2secYe7o6mDllV6PAgrnaCaCzz.jpg','1948-11-26',82,'Released','Please don\'t tell why his hair turned green!','The Boy with Green Hair',43759,2.5901,6.2,'N683gK0dMsM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2264,_binary '\0','/dnQUmqqcfKGZ8TqhT5SaF35awI1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040202',7.4,11608,'en','Call Northside 777','In 1932, a cop is killed and Frank Wiecek sentenced to life. Eleven years later, a newspaper ad by Frank\'s mother leads Chicago reporter P.J. McNeal to look into the case. For some time, McNeal continues to believe Frank guilty. But when he starts to change his mind, he meets increased resistance from authorities unwilling to be proved wrong.','/ejXHWJRTYfvPFGQnwOZevqoNU6H.jpg','1948-02-13',111,'Released','It couldn\'t happen... but it did!','Call Northside 777',26038,2.4798,6.7,'p8M12Ca2XgM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2265,_binary '\0','/uTSgp6I0f4Byb3wWodxEboWlLBO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040221',7,4825,'en','Caught','Wide-eyed and poor young Leonora weds an obsessive millionaire named Ohlrig, but the marriage is loveless. Even worse, Ohlrig seems to have manic, violent tendencies. Eventually, young Leonora escapes her unhappy life and begins working with New York City doctor Larry Quinada, who she soon falls for. Unfortunately, Ohlrig refuses to grant his wife a divorce, and things get even darker for Leonora when she realizes she\'s pregnant with his child.','/htMtSPue5zDW79iL67quA6dM4Gz.jpg','1949-02-17',88,'Released','THE STORY OF A DESPERATE GIRL!','Caught',43397,2.9316,6.592,'3fEZNn2fdgY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2266,_binary '\0','/451OaBHGmElL7Ew117pXdShqKYC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040242',7.3,2292,'en','Command Decision','High-ranking officers struggle with the decision to prioritize bombing German factories producing new jet fighters over the extremely high casualties the mission will cost.','/moCcbMzkfvxBh7QAl5cyehdmeVC.jpg','1948-12-23',112,'Released','Heroes, cowards, fighters, braggarts, liars... and what goes on in their hearts!','Command Decision',23861,2.06,6.6,'OySTC_4dzmE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2267,_binary '\0','/9hYS11ieIDmq871Z6yVKU1stcf1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040245',6.7,1293,'en','Coroner Creek','A man is bent on taking revenge on those responsible for his fiancée\'s death.','/vNuIDlaJhF6omwLBvOumasRwZp7.jpg','1948-07-01',90,'Released','Brutal! Breathtaking Drama!','Coroner Creek',60565,1.3778,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2268,_binary '\0','/lRBd0Fa0eRtOHZssIuNHehqM3V1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040257',7.2,4449,'en','Cry of the City','Petty crook and cop-killer Martin Rome, in bad shape from wounds in the hospital prison ward, still refuses to help slimy lawyer Niles clear his client by confessing to another crime. Police Lt. Candella must check Niles\' allegation; a friend of the Rome family, he walks a tightrope between sentiment and cynicism. When Martin fears Candella will implicate his girlfriend Teena, he\'ll do anything to protect her. How many others will he drag down to disaster with him?','/33GZQ5NmhygSf0TH0LVIFCNeUka.jpg','1948-09-29',95,'Released','From the heart of its people comes the ... cry of the city.','Cry of the City',20362,3.2436,6.7,'q8YJMqT977k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2269,_binary '\0','/gK25BmhuLlsMJ6Al1NMmCb6tGLD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040270',6.3,2554,'en','The Dark Past','A gang hold a family hostage in their own home. The leader of the escaped cons is bothered by a recurring dream that the doctor of the house may be able to analyze.','/yAwloinfuRVbLsFChZqTt7qJtL5.jpg','1948-12-22',74,'Released','SENSATIONAL SUSPENSE DRAMA!','The Dark Past',43453,2.3386,6,'c0c65fN3nwE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2270,_binary '\0','/7xGE3qlzQWrPwsKFw0u5p5N6G5m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040271',6.5,1617,'en','A Date with Judy','Best friends Judy and Carol compete for the affection of an older man during their high school dance. As Carol tries to rekindle Judy\'s relationship with Carol\'s bumbling brother, Oogie, Judy suspects that her father is having an affair with a beautiful dance instructor. The two girls team up to expose Judy\'s father -- who is only taking innocent dance lessons.','/akvjD6n3AGT4QzMvtaIi7vgHYky.jpg','1948-07-29',113,'Released','The best date you ever had!','A Date with Judy',96252,1.9952,6.1,'yeEVmHuMQos','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2271,_binary '\0','/g2MffH3EQXvjSnFF8ol1VkuAKci.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040308',7.3,12190,'en','Easter Parade','On the day before Easter in 1911, Don Hewes is crushed when his dancing partner (and object of affection) Nadine Hale refuses to start a new contract with him. To prove Nadine\'s not important to him, Don acquires innocent new protege Hannah Brown, vowing to make her a star in time for next year\'s Easter parade.','/aLgvafQvb6D6at4khC0b7kn0h8f.jpg','1948-07-08',103,'Released','The Happiest Musical Ever Made is...','Easter Parade',29380,3.6481,7,'RKt54TFrxMc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2272,_binary '\0','/n5HCbabb6UjFPn0lJ33Z7OWRnME.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040317',6,2127,'en','The Emperor Waltz','A brash American gramophone salesman tries to get Emperor Franz Joseph\'s endorsement in turn-of-the-century Austria.','/duJXRdPna0jWpsdcDOPpPqbTPsa.jpg','1948-07-02',106,'Released','Bing hits the high notes! Joan hits the love notes! You\'ll hit a happy note... in this king-sized muscial wonder!','The Emperor Waltz',38804,1.5954,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2273,_binary '\0','/kGffRgiZlt80CHMhp07V62yNaOm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040321',7.2,1574,'en','Enchantment','Roland Dane finally retires to the house he was brought up in. Lost in thoughts of his lost love Lark, he does not want to be disturbed in his last days. However, the appearance of his niece and her subsequent romance with Lark\'s nephew causes him to reevaluate his life and offer some advice so the young couple doesn\'t make the same mistake he did, all those years ago.','/va1NmbFgojTohqjruhH3Lz0UnVT.jpg','1948-12-25',100,'Released','JUST ABOUT THE MOST WONDERFUL LOVE STORY EVER FILMED!','Enchantment',33111,1.6684,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2274,_binary '\0','/e3jyAHY8AIu9HVhG0C999wbBV4M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040331',6.3,2823,'en','Every Girl Should Be Married','Anabel Sims is determined to find the perfect husband. She thinks she\'s found her man in Madison Brown, a handsome pediatrician. She then prepares an elaborate scheme to trap him into marriage','/npJFF02CDT6yPb0jnVFA78N6XFl.jpg','1948-12-25',85,'Released','He won\'t say \"YES\"! She won\'t take \"NO\"!','Every Girl Should Be Married',43441,2.8944,5.917,'61aYWrJ9zDU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2275,_binary '\0','/tJo3mbPc1iPoyX5wudWEfVv2KMn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040338',7.6,10886,'en','The Fallen Idol','Phillipe, the son of an ambassador in London, hero-worships his father\'s butler Baines. His perception of the man changes when he accidentally discovers the secret that Baines keeps and witnesses the consequences that adults\' lies can cause.','/sCcjmsYVgh0urTbLqQgEeskkmPt.jpg','1948-09-30',96,'Released','The suspense is almost unbearable…','The Fallen Idol',21631,2.531,7.2,'ZU8nIwPEpus','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2276,_binary '\0','/mo0NlwRLaV8DBUi6Tdn0ymIHe7K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040366',7.2,8646,'en','Force of Evil','Lawyer Joe Morse wants to consolidate all the small-time numbers racket operators into one big powerful operation. But his elder brother Leo is one of these small-time operators who wants to stay that way, preferring not to deal with the gangsters who dominate the big-time.','/x33LVKf4yWdjMeczJkzE5sIw4VG.jpg','1950-08-24',79,'Released','Sensational Story Of a Numbers King Whose Number Was Up!','Force of Evil',26744,2.0931,6.6,'mL5HOk2TvPs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2277,_binary '\0','/ua2DkHaB7Jy0m5YfK60jWlIHZ60.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040367',7.3,9601,'en','A Foreign Affair','In occupied Berlin, an army captain is torn between an ex-Nazi café singer and the US congresswoman investigating her.','/3kVxhtmvAIjcqj6LP7pAp5aId97.jpg','1948-08-20',116,'Released','\"A Foreign Affair\" is a funny affair!','A Foreign Affair',61650,2.3668,7.1,'6mT96MCJNn8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2278,_binary '\0','/lJyDK0shCLOVa7OZQrcYkM9MKmq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040369',7.4,21637,'en','Fort Apache','Owen Thursday sees his new posting to the desolate Fort Apache as a chance to claim the military honour which he believes is rightfully his. Arrogant, obsessed with military form and ultimately self-destructive, he attempts to destroy the Apache chief Cochise after luring him across the border from Mexico, against the advice of his subordinates.','/5PqKsWVlyIFuMeV1UkK6Q9Q8y9k.jpg','1948-05-21',128,'Released','John Ford\'s Masterpiece of the Frontier!','Fort Apache',37347,4.5338,7,'887kL8RpP-4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2279,_binary '\0','/yPOD7rXOnSB58Qvl478gX7wqoOp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040370',7,1229,'en','Four Faces West','Cowboy Ross McEwen arrives in town. He asks the banker for a loan of $2000. When the banker asks about securing a loan that large, McEwen shows him his six-gun collateral. The banker hands over the money in exchange for an I.O.U., signed \"Jefferson Davis\". McEwen rides out of town and catches a train, but not before being bitten by a rattler. On the train, a nurse, Miss Hollister, tends to his wound. A posse searches the train, but McEwen manages to escape notice. However a mysterious Mexican has taken note of the cowboy, and that loudmouthed brat is still nosing around. Who will be the first to claim the reward for the robber\'s capture?','/pCVRQPLAQYxnubSsyxIjlm4ldTs.jpg','1948-08-03',89,'Released','The Strangest Desperado the West has Ever Known!','Four Faces West',64139,1.5556,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2280,_binary '\0','/fs3HqCkrJDE8SxGHMkn37hKTJTp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040395',6.3,1222,'en','Good Sam','Sam Clayton has a good heart and likes to help out people in need. In fact, he likes to help them out so much that he often finds himself broke and unable to help his own family buy the things they need--like a house.','/nJFZzEmreM9Z2jmhx4GoUyrGzBH.jpg','1948-09-01',114,'Released','He\'ll take the whole world...and you to his heart!','Good Sam',108256,2.5502,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2281,_binary '\0','/tFfucMJh4Me1JYBIRJcOokWWuLs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040416',7.5,20123,'en','Hamlet','Winner of four Academy Awards, including Best Picture and Best Actor, Sir Laurence Olivier’s Hamlet continues to be the most compelling version of Shakespeare’s beloved tragedy. Olivier is at his most inspired—both as director and as the melancholy Dane himself—as he breathes new life into the words of one of the world’s greatest dramatists.','/woO9SgU2vTRMZeG0YqOLeoIqlzC.jpg','1948-12-10',153,'Released','The motion picture of all time ... for all time!','Hamlet',23383,3.2777,7.4,'9G8LjlR60bw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2282,_binary '\0','/y5FKMFpzGziJMZaSu3VNaOpMdph.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040418',6.6,3169,'sv','Hamnstad','A suicidal factory girl, just out of reformatory school and anxious to escape her overbearing mother, falls in love with a sailor who can\'t forgive her past.','/rTpZ1CijMCN1Z5ecIysNdlnFWhK.jpg','1948-10-11',93,'Released',NULL,'Port of Call',51141,1.3742,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2283,_binary '\0','/gKid6ohUtqZphz07N72VyP45cl8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040427',7,7615,'en','He Walked by Night','Roy Martin aka Roy Morgan is a burglar and former war-time Radio & Electronics Engineer who listens in to radio police calls, allowing him to stay one step ahead of the cops.','/wAhLdEjC9iIvF6Oly42Qs3LXKuL.jpg','1949-02-06',79,'Released','Savage TRUTH! Stronger than Fiction!','He Walked by Night',31556,3.3783,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2284,_binary '\0','/pn2yjwW4PsYqr8X9f1FPxziQ0Xx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040444',6.7,3593,'en','Hollow Triumph','Pursued by the big-time gambler he robbed, John Muller assumes a new identity—with unfortunate results.','/gRbXP8cKiufjKjtZoyxHjOORUMQ.jpg','1948-08-18',83,'Released','Love couldn\'t hide the secret of his past...or shield them for the end of their future!','Hollow Triumph',25672,3.1448,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2285,_binary '\0','/c7FFSwEl9bFzvSnTav3WeSlHKYo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040446',6.9,1267,'en','Homecoming','Self-absorbed Dr. Lee Johnson enlists with the Army medical corps during World War II, more out of a feeling that it\'s \"the thing to do\" rather than deep-seated patriotism. On his first day, he\'s put into place by \'Snapshot\', a sassy and attractive nurse. Their initial antagonism blossoms into romance. Lee then finds himself torn with guilt over being unfaithful to his wife, Penny, who\'s waiting for him back home.','/rkrIGWsQQmHTqoc5zdGrCgI7Xwt.jpg','1948-04-29',113,'Released','The Stirring Story of a Dangerous and Romantic Journey','Homecoming',102026,1.3417,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2286,_binary '\0','/upS3MQvpxd4LRvUGOUjtlivEr1G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040457',6.7,1380,'en','I Love Trouble','A wealthy man hires a private detective to investigate his wife\'s mysterious past.','/cDVCZx45xkd16MaWQIrswwKeJgL.jpg','1948-01-15',93,'Released','Scandalous secrets only murder can silence!','I Love Trouble',37484,1.7151,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2287,_binary '\0','/xclfnIHbG9fGXEgNdK0odwdag3o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040458',7.8,6656,'en','I Remember Mama','Norwegian immigrant Marta Hanson keeps a firm but loving hand on her household of four children, a devoted husband and a highly-educated lodger who reads great literature to the family every evening. Through financial crises, illnesses and the small triumphs of everyday life, Marta maintains her optimism and sense of humor, traits she passes on to her aspiring-author daughter, Katrin.','/oqiq3Zm6NeiVvd08gpUUu3WrihA.jpg','1948-03-09',134,'Released','You\'ll just love...MAMA!','I Remember Mama',43442,2.1856,7.2,'lE-E-KU-S3g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2288,_binary '\0','/2dDFxCjwbCHAz3QoMoHDDfSa9CU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040472',6,1335,'en','Inner Sanctum','A killer hides out in a small-town boarding house.','/iPIOExn7a2YlyLyC1n48gZUs98R.jpg','1948-10-15',62,'Released','Great on the air... Thrilling as a best seller... Now a sensation as a new screen hit!','Inner Sanctum',47922,1.3514,5.05,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2289,_binary '\0','/92qVnRyZSisqnymC7T64T4T6ViH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040478',6.3,1331,'en','The Iron Curtain','The Iron Curtain is based on the actual 1945 case of Soviet cipher clerk Igor Gouzenko, (Dana Andrews), who, after careful training, was assigned to the U.S.S.R. Embassy in Ottawa, Canada in the midst of World War II. Eventually, Gouzenko defected with 109 pages of material implicating several high level Canadian officials, outlined the steps taken to secure information about the the details of the nuclear bomb via numerous sleeper cells established throughout North America. The scandal that resulted when details of this case were publicized by American columnist Drew Pearson in early 1946 involved Canada, Britain and the United States.','/kkdfF5ZrmwdreS2M2A6PK7Tawi1.jpg','1948-06-16',87,'Released','What Was Behind Their Mission... THIS TERROR?','The Iron Curtain',26747,1.2594,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2290,_binary '\0','/l6tRb74xpFFUHGKJ5MSu81aY7vj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040481',7.1,2767,'en','It Always Rains on Sunday','During a rainy Sunday afternoon, an escaped prisoner tries to hide out at the home of his ex-fiance.','/545TEkJNPHEMDFxiIlAsm3oGtK9.jpg','1947-11-28',92,'Released','The secrets of a street you know','It Always Rains on Sunday',35007,2.5326,6.6,'uiHxc_07-Ic','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2291,_binary '\0','/9YLQnn3ChNgzBVoSMcV8oFmW7it.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040491',6.4,4293,'en','Joan of Arc','In the 15th Century, France is a defeated and ruined nation after the One Hundred Years War against England. The fourteen-year-old farm girl Joan of Arc claims to hear voices from Heaven asking her to lead God\'s Army against Orleans and crowning the weak Dauphin Charles VII as King of France. Joan gathers the people with her faith, forms an army, and conquers Orleans.','/ho3rFoxHaQad2tH3FYUSlvnQWUY.jpg','1948-12-22',145,'Released','Greatest of all spectacles!','Joan of Arc',43443,3.2083,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2292,_binary '\0','/u3lmI4KMiU2tV5zWQPm6222kq92.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040495',7.7,5867,'en','Johnny Belinda','A small-town doctor helps a deaf-mute farm girl learn to communicate.','/lIkYFx7ZaU56iG507lgLoSh1GNR.jpg','1948-09-14',102,'Released','There was temptation in her helpless silence...and then torment','Johnny Belinda',62000,2.4712,6.9,'arZQyXMyZ6Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2293,_binary '\0','/qUtJCQgGl02aH5pPbxEU4kMGuZL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040497',7.2,9814,'fr','Jour de fête','Jour de Fête tells the story of an inept and easily-distracted French mailman who frequently interrupts his duties to converse with the local inhabitants, as well as inspect the traveling fair that has come to his small community. Influenced by too much wine and a newsreel account of rapid transportation methods used by the United States postal system, he goes to hilarious lengths to speed the delivery of mail while aboard his bicycle.','/x1wwNdrBywcmZSfIsO8qcaZxYWR.jpg','1949-05-11',86,'Released',NULL,'Jour de Fête',4595,2.1273,7.1,'U3-R6ZzKnoE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2294,_binary '\0','/e3TabVPgGOZhi9a4M80m806ghh5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040498',6.8,1312,'en','Julia Misbehaves','Julia and William were married and soon separated by his snobbish family. They meet again many years later, when their daughter he has raised invites her mother to her wedding, with the disapproval of William\'s mother.','/qX9lZApUTrJvgvzj6mUttkKL4Ze.jpg','1948-08-08',99,'Released','It\'s daring! It\'s delicious! It\'s the gayest comedy-romance of the year!','Julia Misbehaves',69483,1.4308,6.7,'ve77HKoMUYA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2295,_binary '\0','/8ClqFgAkjFCBWdl2B20e5H9AFu4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040499',6.8,2394,'en','June Bride','A magazine\'s staff, including bickering ex-lovers Linda and Carey, cover an Indiana wedding, which goes slightly wrong.','/jAsPwmgj9VtFo5icRXJQ1vyUeN9.jpg','1948-10-29',96,'Released','Warner Bros. new laugh team in the happiest hit of their lives!!!','June Bride',107593,2.8236,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2296,_binary '\0','/pfkMco3YE9557cBaEzoGXRWYwyL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040505',7.4,2276,'ja','風の中の牝鶏','Tokiko patiently awaits her husband\'s return from WWII when her four-year old son falls ill. She takes him to the doctor but has no means of paying, so she resorts to prostitution. A month later, her husband returns to find his desperate wife, who tells him the truth. Together, they must deal with the consequences.','/mvoiw4BjoN0npqXkgJGLZs3k7VM.jpg','1948-09-17',84,'Released',NULL,'A Hen in the Wind',126219,1.6567,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2297,_binary '\0','/m2SXRnAd0d5N6qH2cbgluRgMX4z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040506',7.7,47682,'en','Key Largo','A hurricane swells outside, but it\'s nothing compared to the storm within the hotel at Key Largo. There, sadistic mobster Johnny Rocco holes up - and holds at gunpoint hotel owner James Temple, his widowed daughter-in-law Nora, and ex-GI Frank McCloud.','/rySfmQQZhS7RswOiJcJrww6FcHy.jpg','1948-07-16',100,'Released','A storm of fear and fury in the sizzling Florida Keys!','Key Largo',11016,3.7331,7.468,'oIi_ipWRxXo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2298,_binary '\0','/h4PCFBqstdB7QwRkJBne38rQaXV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040512',6.8,2473,'en','Kiss the Blood Off My Hands','Bill Saunders, a former prisoner of war living in England, whose experiences have left him unstable and violent, gets into a bar fight in which he kills a man and then flees. He hides out with the assistance of a nurse, Jane Wharton, who believes his story that the killing was an accident.','/aOH1t76EnvuVmMigHbVeOVwrYQt.jpg','1948-10-30',79,'Released','Only Her Arms Could Tame the Fury of His Fists!','Kiss the Blood Off My Hands',22925,2.0762,6.7,'IlE0A6PurO0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2299,_binary '\0','/nd6ItWuWGmTKhHXuxVC8kp86CmQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040522',8.2,193295,'it','Ladri di biciclette','Unemployed Antonio is elated when he finally finds work hanging posters around war-torn Rome. However on his first day, his bicycle—essential to his work—gets stolen. His job is doomed unless he can find the thief. With the help of his son, Antonio combs the city, becoming desperate for justice.','/iPdVqIpmR3bRvOQJPrn4pr2KR3q.jpg','1948-07-21',89,'Released','The Prize Picture They Want to Censor!','Bicycle Thieves',5156,7.9557,8.161,'H2P4xo9kmPM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2300,_binary '\0','/ehgX2eTBOgqB1Py3vSTKf3LXbEv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040525',7.5,37039,'en','The Lady from Shanghai','A romantic drifter gets caught between a corrupt tycoon and his voluptuous wife.','/whqdqWavNMSoeXTx1X3DauO1LG6.jpg','1947-12-24',87,'Released','I told you... you know nothing about wickedness','The Lady from Shanghai',3766,4.9397,7.3,'C_FTmZ0Y_hw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2301,_binary '\0','/7amSQSipxgiQnEejWX6iQonFrZI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040536',7.8,15060,'en','Letter from an Unknown Woman','A pianist about to flee from a duel receives a letter from a woman he cannot remember. As she tells the story of her lifelong love for him, he is forced to reinterpret his own past.','/gRGRW7DKyK8qBtKJTWguULMGbHG.jpg','1948-04-28',87,'Released','This is the love every woman lives for…the love every man would die for!','Letter from an Unknown Woman',946,3.5937,7.8,'lOtmlrHJfRU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2302,_binary '\0','/f5z01S7J9st1zUYLSocBUGqYpBK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040550',6.4,2413,'en','Louisiana Story','Cajun boy Alexander Napoleon Ulysses LaTour lives with his family and his beloved pet raccoon in the Louisiana bayou. When his father allows an oil barge to drill on their land, the boy questions the process and its safety.','/kwEbsHAvdY9G2gJKRKYmxJ6IB6L.jpg','1948-09-28',78,'Released',NULL,'Louisiana Story',70447,1.331,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2303,_binary '\0','/hRCyfCtARGdOEe7YWpVOEKcY9vn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040552',6.1,1549,'en','The Loves of Carmen','Gypsy Carmen drives men wild in 1820s Spain, especially the dragoon Don Jose.','/q6zuGR1lyWDRaBGpmKhddm5wgBX.jpg','1948-08-23',99,'Released','A story of beauty and savagery...love and hate...splendor and shame...','The Loves of Carmen',43455,1.9161,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2304,_binary '\0','/qSaJMpZ8jVVBjiKNXgTWvsoPLBv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040553',6.7,1423,'en','The Luck of the Irish','Following American reporter Stephen Fitzgerald from Ireland to New York, a grateful leprechaun acts as the newsman\'s servant and conscience.','/wxgpH4vOC1TvMqInQBWSEwa6uXg.jpg','1948-09-15',99,'Released','Choosing good is the real pot of gold!','The Luck of the Irish',112705,2.1708,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2305,_binary '\0','/jyTQJ1ioXoWs7zBrAJy9w4AHZyZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040558',7.4,8571,'en','Macbeth','Macbeth, the Thane of Glamis, receives a prophecy from a trio of witches that one day he will become King of Scotland. Consumed by ambition and spurred to action by his wife, Macbeth commits a treasonous act and takes the throne for himself.','/4DbzuePqGcUY7olAKzGly7kCEmU.jpg','1948-10-01',107,'Released','Entertainment Greatness … That Only Motion Picture Magic Can Bring!','Macbeth',27883,3.4788,7.3,'lu4xhBotbxo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2306,_binary '\0','/zy7wZp6WEdK4zeVhrw2V5BIbLRy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040580',6.1,7992,'en','Melody Time','In the grand tradition of Disney\'s great musical classics, Melody Time features seven timeless stories, each enhanced with high-spirited music and unforgettable characters. You\'ll be sure to tap your toes and clap your hands in this witty feast for the eyes and ears.','/pKR4iRyDdIX1T13z1Vs5jBERXni.jpg','1948-05-27',75,'Released','For Your All-Time Good Time!','Melody Time',13757,5.2417,6.087,'BjgrjB_8vdg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2307,_binary '\0','/hJgVNWOvX8v9iW6chbQaHSH2AiS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040582',6.2,1415,'en','Mexican Hayride','Two con men selling phony stock flee to Mexico ahead of the law, where they run into a woman friend from their earlier days, who is now a bullfighter.','/ulGgAg9mGms3ECQuxtyL0QHjcDT.jpg','1948-12-27',78,'Released',NULL,'Mexican Hayride',31664,1.5513,6.1,'CFOucUifeWs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2308,_binary '\0','/AoRZYgpwUyNB6wLbPxXyPTjOhZj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040594',6.6,1245,'en','The Miracle of the Bells','The body of a young actress is brought to her home town by the man who loved her. He knows that she wanted all the church bells to ring for three days after she was buried, but is told that this will cost a lot of money. The checks that he writes to the various churches all bounce, but it is the weekend and, in desperation, he prays that a miracle will happen before the banks reopen. It does, but not in the way he hoped.','/1C8wDuJoCZ5BhtAGinhejcyjcge.jpg','1948-03-27',120,'Released',NULL,'The Miracle of the Bells',43456,1.9961,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2309,_binary '\0','/lbT9uEk0bSN3yUrafVXnpuzFCTy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040597',6.8,1319,'en','Miranda','A young married physician discovers a mermaid, and gives into her request to be taken to see London. Comedy and romantic entanglements ensue.','/i5RA9dyTDPaBaPiSnorWfhNoDJ.jpg','1948-04-06',80,'Released','Miranda Has Everything!','Miranda',111960,1.3978,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2310,_binary '\0','/4O2edhgfsspXdyNV0nLQLN5IsU5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040607',7,3480,'en','Moonrise','Stigmatized from infancy by the fate of his criminal father, a man is bruised and bullied until one night, in a fit of rage, he kills his most persistent tormentor. As the police close in around him, he makes a desperate bid for the love of the dead man’s girlfriend, a schoolteacher who sees the wounded soul behind his aggression.','/9U0WHjNGNDipkl11Qlcg4NA9aHz.jpg','1948-10-01',90,'Released','HER ARMS...HER LOVE...HIS ONLY ESCAPE FROM A HERITAGE OF HATE!','Moonrise',28392,1.7963,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2311,_binary '\0','/eXU2ZonDfVZgaQYPFykYPRHf6wW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040613',7.2,13830,'en','Mr. Blandings Builds His Dream House','An advertising executive dreams of getting out of the city and building a perfect home in the country, only to find the transition fraught with problems.','/smKM575W3FLvWHna5YaWWeN5po8.jpg','1948-03-25',94,'Released','Looks like the Blandings will have no heating problem!','Mr. Blandings Builds His Dream House',32294,3.1176,6.952,'oLCjMCH8YTY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2312,_binary '\0','/iHVjZYTsOcM3yCdwHNkLeG5cV0Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040614',6.4,1639,'en','Mr. Peabody and the Mermaid','As told to a psychiatrist: Mr. Peabody, a middle-aged Bostonian on vacation with his wife in the Caribbean, hears mysterious, wordless singing on an uninhabited rock in the bay. Fishing in the vicinity, he catches...a mermaid. He takes her home and, though she has no spoken language, falls in love with her. Of course, his wife won\'t believe that the thing in the bathtub is anything but a large fish.','/zi4MRJrM8oBrPheeRhnxSUEBia8.jpg','1948-08-11',89,'Released','Lucky Mr. Peabody...Everybody thought he was DREAMING!','Mr. Peabody and the Mermaid',53834,1.8855,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2313,_binary '\0','/rctnquyNxfn0MiYrxoCpIGoPw7P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040622',6.4,1736,'sv','Musik i mörker','In postwar Sweden, a gifted young pianist’s life is transformed after a tragic accident leaves him blind. Struggling with bitterness, isolation, and the loss of his former world, he finds unexpected support and companionship from a compassionate young woman who helps him rebuild his sense of purpose. As their relationship deepens over the years, both must confront questions of pride, class, and emotional vulnerability in order to move forward.','/9bNKxmlGVDAQYVxc2Sw0Pcdh0R.jpg','1948-01-17',87,'Released','From the World\'s Master Film Maker Ingmar Bergman a startling journey into the darkness of the human soul!','Music in Darkness',68291,1.5607,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2314,_binary '\0','/7EOKJveqdQ07R3bCNAuTUyPGUOf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040626',5.6,1335,'en','My Dear Secretary','A budding young writer thinks it\'s her lucky day when she is chosen to be the new secretary for Owen Waterbury, famous novelist. She is soon disppointed, however, when he turns out to be an erratic, immature playboy. Opposites attract, of course, but not without sub-plots that touch on competitiveness within marriage and responsibility.','/lfwdZE4JQLgXbNfQmER25RY1Knv.jpg','1948-11-05',94,'Released','He chased her . . . \'til she caught him!','My Dear Secretary',18703,2.4225,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2315,_binary '\0','/yjEoHzWo4O8tTa7lrVNv2okVkLz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040636',7.5,17254,'en','The Naked City','After a former model is drowned in her bathtub, Detective James Halloran and Lieutenant Dan Muldoon attempt to piece together her murder.','/rex4oaiSCD8UQg9204R6hQcFrX9.jpg','1948-03-04',96,'Released','The soul of a city. Her glory stripped! Her passion bared!','The Naked City',20482,3.34,7.2,'TX-Yquq3efk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2316,_binary '\0','/90Ja1K6SFr6AGHjF7ildBl2EtVy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040643',7.1,2317,'en','Night Has a Thousand Eyes','When heiress Jean Courtland attempts suicide, her fiancée Elliott Carson probes her relationship with John Triton. In flashback, we see how stage mentalist Triton starts having terrifying flashes of true precognition. Now years later, he desperately tries to prevent tragedies in the Courtland family.','/jLbSxx090bM5E1d36b8D5ZMRv7a.jpg','1948-08-20',81,'Released','NEVER HAVE THE STARS LOOKED DOWN...ON AN ADVENTURE LIKE THIS !','Night Has a Thousand Eyes',26387,1.895,6.9,'t00GHuu0jHQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2317,_binary '\0','/zrpKl4x8lulnlr2AFVk8WP2PYqj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040652',6.6,1314,'en','The Noose Hangs High','Two window washers are mistaken for crooks by gangsters who are missing money.','/gLleQgRllDlxRlTxLFywvsoOpQU.jpg','1948-04-05',77,'Released','BUD ABBOTT LOU COSTELLO in the CHOKE of the Century!','The Noose Hangs High',33538,2.2945,6.9,'Fnoe1BsihQc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2318,_binary '\0','/cySQNHMxuWvNiIp2hZPjTaJFLwa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040662',7.8,15159,'en','Oliver Twist','When 9-year-old orphan Oliver Twist dares to ask his cruel taskmaster, Mr. Bumble, for a second serving of gruel, he\'s hired out as an apprentice. Escaping that dismal fate, young Oliver falls in with the street urchin known as the Artful Dodger and his criminal mentor, Fagin. When kindly Mr. Brownlow takes Oliver in, Fagin\'s evil henchman Bill Sikes plots to kidnap the boy.','/wkMdDqXI58MuW99wi9kotC8kCVM.jpg','1948-06-28',121,'Released','A Screen Event To Be Remembered For All Time !','Oliver Twist',10949,4.6572,7.6,'Z2Oc0wuRA-I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2319,_binary '\0','/l5tJKBNqd5DTLFjk2puiIv0pMVn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040669',6.6,1935,'en','One Touch of Venus','A window dresser\'s kiss brings a statue of the Roman goddess of love to life.','/3BdWcqPnEVFYm6WZRPYMFRSUcKi.jpg','1948-08-01',82,'Released','The Gal Who Invented Love!','One Touch of Venus',43447,2.3586,6.7,'YO-Q_O2vb14','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2320,_binary '\0','/dm8dfILA11OYR0usqQGJJZQMw93.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040679',6.6,5048,'en','The Paleface','Bob Hope stars in this laugh-packed wild west spoof co-starring Jane Russell as a sexy Calamity Jane, Hope is a meek frontier dentist, \"Painless\" Peter Potter, who finds himself gunslinging alongside the fearless Calamity as she fights off outlaws and Indians.','/a7XFll1vLKd9I91ZT8fsha95hh2.jpg','1948-12-17',91,'Released','Like Merry Xmas and Happy New Year...They belong together!','The Paleface',17804,2.1175,6.098,'MbRVX3LT_g4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2321,_binary '\0','/sqDk8JjOPO4eJSdKqHCBYlQuDsp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040694',6.9,6117,'en','The Pirate','A girl is engaged to the local richman, but meanwhile she has dreams about the legendary pirate Macoco. A traveling singer falls in love with her and to impress her he poses as the pirate.','/ltoy9asHYuLcEq78jjvZPjH6LCG.jpg','1948-06-11',102,'Released','The great MGM musical romance','The Pirate',35032,3.6804,6.5,'_2Un-4TJHlg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2322,_binary '\0','/84HkZ8cK3EB1GNe6zPwnYz40Ql6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040695',7.1,5320,'en','Pitfall','An insurance man wishing for a more exciting life becomes wrapped up in the affairs of an imprisoned embezzler, his model girlfriend, and a violent private investigator.','/3tBedVxTTFfP4IE1JtuANZOvk4G.jpg','1948-08-11',86,'Released','A man can be as strong as steel...but somewhere there\'s a woman who\'ll break him!','Pitfall',25688,1.9882,6.9,'v5IBCzVDgPI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2323,_binary '\0','/reoP1aJZbtxXNpBDwMFESng80lY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040705',7.6,8520,'en','Portrait of Jennie','In Depression-era New York, painter Eben Adams despairs at his lack of success. One cold winter evening in Central Park, he meets enigmatic, old-fashioned Jennie Appleton, who captures his fancy when she asks him to wait for her to grow up. Soon after, Eben sells a sketch of Jennie to kindly art dealer Miss Spinny and, as he meets the oddly mutable Jennie in fleeting moments, begins to realize they share a special destiny.','/AuZVFoCOxKKwC6eKWol4NkAFpWi.jpg','1948-12-25',86,'Released','The screen\'s most romantic team!','Portrait of Jennie',32558,3.0281,7.2,'rKPEHkVjikM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2324,_binary '\0','/g7dB1Z0uJZhXJFFTfOXgyskNhDY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040720',7,3073,'en','Rachel and the Stranger','A widowed farmer takes an indentured servant as his new wife, but the arrival of a passing stranger threatens their burgeoning relationship.','/9q5o7FyuHRbW1fh9YK7ZKLi91be.jpg','1948-09-18',93,'Released','Once was a man, a married man... Who couldn\'t see the danger Until one day, one fateful day... Along came a Tall, Dark Stranger!','Rachel and the Stranger',43448,2.1207,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2325,_binary '\0','/1URCrF9KDmoDNaqhtzbke668SmM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040723',7.2,6378,'en','Raw Deal','Joe Sullivan is itching to get out of prison. He\'s taken the rap for his accomplice Rick, a sadistic mobster who owes him $50,000 from the job they pulled. Rick sets up an escape for Joe, assuming that Joe will be killed while fleeing. But with the help of his love-struck girl Pat and his sympathetic legal caseworker Ann, Joe gets further than Rick intended...','/qLC4VnigxhC4ovSZdH2JUjuXoYY.jpg','1948-05-21',79,'Released','Bullets! Women! -- Can\'t Hold a Man Like That!','Raw Deal',26167,2.0944,6.671,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2326,_binary '\0','/agUD7Wp6LAwpaB3phx6yiRmFoSY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040724',7.7,38423,'en','Red River','Following the Civil War, headstrong rancher Thomas Dunson decides to lead a perilous cattle drive from Texas to Missouri. During the exhausting journey, his persistence becomes tyrannical in the eyes of Matthew Garth, his adopted son and protégé.','/jyNTsAzrIWB441OtvfbgKtx1kFS.jpg','1948-09-17',133,'Released',NULL,'Red River',3089,4.2165,7.3,'ZxVCrIMPQXI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2327,_binary '\0','/Aa1jUhkenqspgGQlqbsXFax6iW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040725',8.1,44241,'en','The Red Shoes','A fledgling ballerina falls in love with a brilliant composer, but the jealous head of the ballet company plots to drive them apart.','/vPvpBWFWDvEXuQBkoYgA6A89GVp.jpg','1948-09-06',133,'Released','Dance she did, and dance she must…Between her two loves!','The Red Shoes',19542,5.1254,8,'_mHgGU4AbOA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2328,_binary '\0','/1xbmwdaPBxXINV2KawDc1oQyJwa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040737',7.6,5714,'it','Riso amaro','Francesca and Walter are two-bit criminals in Northern Italy, and, in an effort to avoid the police, Francesca joins a group of women rice workers. She meets the voluptuous peasant rice worker, Silvana, and the soon-to-be-discharged soldier, Marco. Walter follows her to the rice fields, and the four characters become involved in a complex plot involving robbery, love, and murder.','/9vvbZgbkfE7urqQXRNiONmvYTtF.jpg','1949-09-30',109,'Released','An earthy drama of human passions among women rice workers in the Po Valley.','Bitter Rice',31058,2.6635,7.483,'P1pHqMnpwb4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2329,_binary '\0','/xzcSJx2kTYbW9JZm6zHrha770ta.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040740',7.2,3580,'en','Road House','A night club owner becomes infatuated with a torch singer and frames his best friend/manager for embezzlement when the chanteuse falls in love with him.','/wCH0AtTWpwr4YpIftfl1wVydokZ.jpg','1948-09-22',95,'Released','There\'s nothing like a woman to come between men!','Road House',30624,1.7588,6.723,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2330,_binary '\0','/6xdHzVtFQoyoker40qD4rdlIFtU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040745',7.1,3122,'en','Romance on the High Seas','Georgia Garrett is sent by jealous wife Elvira Kent on an ocean cruise to masquerade as herself while she secretly stays home to catch her husband cheating. Meanwhile equally suspicious husband Michael Kent has sent a private eye on the same cruise to catch his wife cheating. Love and confusion ensues along with plenty of musical numbers.','/8S8f8hyk3GzRBfhPtEeAkxEsVKm.jpg','1948-06-25',99,'Released','Romance and Laughter...under a Rio moon!','Romance on the High Seas',43449,2.8633,6.716,'2SBbDWpUQOc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2331,_binary '\0','/81LX4wktTXWEXjLNlkHTmJm7tRu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040746',7.9,166629,'en','Rope','Two young men attempt to prove they committed the perfect murder by hosting a dinner party for the family of a classmate they just strangled to death.','/9ar6rxLDB8kagAnXZKn6h9smscr.jpg','1948-02-01',81,'Released','It begins with a shriek...it ends with a shot! From beginning to end, nothing ever held you like Alfred Hitchcock\'s ROPE!','Rope',1580,8.6217,7.9,'mTmEraaEY20','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2332,_binary '\0','/wNW781aVk4GDbF2G8dmJrkv3i6Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040751',6.8,1646,'en','Ruthless','Horace Vendig always gets what he wants. Even as a poor youth, he charmed his way into high society by getting the father of his friend, Martha, to foot the bill for his Harvard education. When Vic, another childhood pal, is invited to Horace\'s mansion for a party, he brings along Mallory Flagg, who happens to bear a striking resemblance to Martha. As Vic and Horace reunite, old resentments rise to the surface.','/kuQE1wlkiz2USJO3afafzL9HoLZ.jpg','1948-04-16',104,'Released','He wasn\'t a man; He was a way of life!','Ruthless',37504,1.1941,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2333,_binary '\0','/j1VQtn0PsOTjsNZrFFRrxLjMh12.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040761',7,2837,'en','Scott of the Antarctic','The true story of the British explorer Robert Falcon Scott and his ill-fated expedition to try to be the first man to discover the South Pole - only to find that the murderously cold weather and a rival team of Norwegian explorers conspire against him','/A8544D4JiRjZIhiP3o1t0lyTkl7.jpg','1948-11-29',111,'Released','The noblest adventure man ever dared!','Scott of the Antarctic',43450,5.3343,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2334,_binary '\0','/4wjo1gxtDzavaqEPEK3gT4lmXG2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040765',7.8,5405,'en','The Search','In postwar Germany, a displaced Czech boy, separated from his family during wartime, is befriended by an American GI while the boy\'s mother desperately searches for him.','/jDP8XxQUJTTofJPkhFER3aBYDqR.jpg','1948-03-26',104,'Released','Everybody agrees MGM\'s The Search is a wonderful motion picture!','The Search',41131,2.1785,7.1,'vK5n4D3jc44','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2335,_binary '\0','/xMZJwdGMDEQWKavwMWB4Lpkuixg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040766',6.6,6498,'en','Secret Beyond the Door','After a whirlwind romance in Mexico, a beautiful heiress marries a man she barely knows with hardly a second thought. She finds his New York home full of his strange relations, and macabre rooms that are replicas of famous murder sites. One locked room contains the secret to her husband\'s obsession, and the truth about what happened to his first wife.','/uVBEwjzXweHWjCFjAs7eJzH9in6.jpg','1947-12-24',99,'Released','Some Men Destroy What They Love Most!','Secret Beyond the Door',560,3.4239,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2336,_binary '\0','/zEdxQGQDIQ0Ygs5fCmTz0qw2p4J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040789',6.5,1774,'en','Silver River','Unjustly booted out of the cavalry, Mike McComb strikes out for Nevada, and deciding never to be used again, ruthlessly works his way up to becoming one of the most powerful silver magnates in the west. His empire begins to fall apart as the other mining combines rise against him and his stubbornness loses him the support of his wife and old friends.','/dWjndd9IUwLTA0a26Mps1VRDI9o.jpg','1948-05-20',110,'Released','WHERE MEN OF IRON SHOOT IT OUT FOR A CITY OF SILVER','Silver River',65581,1.7908,6.1,'Jfe4TTE79SM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2337,_binary '\0','/pcwaxZgCzFIRxIPXXTmmPZI5okA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040795',7.4,3084,'en','Sitting Pretty','Tacey and Harry King are a suburban couple with three sons and a serious need of a babysitter. Tacey puts an ad in the paper for a live-in babysitter, and the ad is answered by Lynn Belvedere. But when she arrives, she turns out to be a man. And not just any man, but a most eccentric, outrageously forthright genius with seemingly a million careers and experiences behind him.','/aZYDJs8MUcVtwjtL9YgMa9cZWCM.jpg','1948-03-10',83,'Released','Never was a baby-sitter like this!','Sitting Pretty',76211,1.81,7.1,'2Tz5L_QW0Ro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2338,_binary '\0','/lvDvnjlIo5NdUQvNHPAZfB6JgBj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040798',6.8,2600,'en','Sleep, My Love','A woman wakes up in the middle of the night on board a train, but she can\'t remember how she got there. Danger and suspense ensue.','/9frXdBO5Z8gP0YwNHNt3DhKavBt.jpg','1948-02-18',97,'Released','...the most terrifying words a man ever whispered to a woman!','Sleep, My Love',74525,2.074,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2339,_binary '\0','/xyPp8XpOozFfpZmYSlz0h9SpOpO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040806',7.5,9231,'en','The Snake Pit','Virginia Cunningham is confused upon finding herself in a mental hospital, with no memory of her arrival at the institution. Tormented by delusions and unable to even recognize her husband, Robert, she is treated by Dr. Mark Kik, who is determined to get to the root of her mental illness. As her treatment progresses, flashbacks depict events in Virginia\'s life that may have contributed to her instability.','/wLO2TVjM4UUQUwOq7RqfS8PCdMC.jpg','1948-11-04',108,'Released','Married and in love... with a man she didn\'t know or want!','The Snake Pit',62694,2.4719,7.1,'1CBLJoNETqU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2340,_binary '\0','/mRhWEMnQlxHQbc9J4pnO6x74EJJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040820',6.9,3194,'en','A Song Is Born','The story of seven scholars in search of an expert to teach them about swing music. They seem to have found the perfect candidate in winsome nightclub singer Honey Swanson. But Honey\'s gangster boyfriend doesn\'t want to give her up.','/aSAR6nbRbAWOdcXz51LQsrMsTjS.jpg','1948-10-19',113,'Released','...with the hottest men in music - beating out the rhythm with\'m!','A Song Is Born',17829,2.5479,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2341,_binary '\0','/jKInpViHPPW2MDGhpSUICDx8FYO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040823',7.3,14480,'en','Sorry, Wrong Number','Leona Stevenson is confined to bed and uses her telephone to keep in contact with the outside world. One day she overhears a murder plot on the telephone and is desperate to find out who is the intended victim.','/A39p8fEvucMFQXFmjp5Z8WepdsQ.jpg','1948-09-24',89,'Released','Tangled Wires... Whispering of Murder! Tangled Lives... Fighting to Escape!','Sorry, Wrong Number',21635,3.3118,6.775,'dj3-yqaXY_c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2342,_binary '\0','/A7ZBrQCAIJCskA8oXm7i5jV1Yoj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040829',6.4,2692,'en','The Amazing Mr. X','On the beach one night, Christine Faber, two years a widow, thinks she hears her late husband Paul calling out of the surf...then meets a tall dark man, Alexis, who seems to know all about such things. After more ghostly manifestations, Christine and younger sister Janet become enmeshed in the eerie artifices of Alexis; but he in turn finds himself manipulated into deeper deviltry than he had in mind...','/7CQ5G1Jpmu2ppeHxTx47DpJ5YEw.jpg','1948-07-29',78,'Released','In his eyes, the threat of terror! In his hands, the power to destroy!','The Amazing Mr. X',29998,2.3098,6.2,'kvhn36lrrmM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2343,_binary '\0','/6cGKOTkgrUuF1sHYLXGmILrKLxu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040834',7.2,4689,'en','State of the Union','An industrialist is urged to run for President, but this requires uncomfortable compromises on both political and marital levels.','/s8opauqGVUdGbgdZgLsVyfKXh9O.jpg','1948-04-30',124,'Released','How\'s the State of the Union? It\'s GREAT!','State of the Union',33792,2.7543,6.766,'GoPGvoL8LNU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2344,_binary '\0','/yV5d3eK7OxQHgErHdhaf0cOvLmE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040835',6.6,1667,'en','Station West','When two US cavalrymen transporting a gold shipment get killed, US Army Intelligence investigator John Haven goes undercover to a mining and logging town to find the killers.','/768q6hR1gZIBZnZfNSZs7113ybZ.jpg','1948-09-01',87,'Released','A STRANGER IN TOWN...WHERE STRANGERS WEREN\'T WELCOME!...and he found out a gal double-crossed is Deadly as Poison!','Station West',37294,1.7308,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2345,_binary '\0','/m1my5tTcWBUqLDnWleuFrBB1BaF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040843',7,3665,'en','The Street with No Name','After two gang-related killings in \"Center City,\" a suspect (who was framed) is arrested, released on bail...and murdered. Inspector Briggs of the FBI recruits a young agent, Gene Cordell, to go undercover in the shadowy Skid Row area (alias George Manly) as a potential victim of the same racket. Soon, Gene meets Alec Stiles, neurotic mastermind who\'s \"building an organization along scientific lines.\" Stiles recruits Cordell, whose job becomes a lot more dangerous.','/t2OkuSVnw1KxeSGwhTbTaXiQfxr.jpg','1948-07-14',91,'Released','Counter Attack!','The Street with No Name',36814,2.2632,6.4,'NqhuWJF1WXU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2346,_binary '\0','/sfWWu2Nf6FuGinullL4FD1QldnW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040852',6.7,1422,'en','Superman','Superman comes to Earth as a child and grows up to be his home\'s first superhero with his first major challenge being to oppose The Spider Lady.','/vLvSA6HLaldOBOCeKw8jJejXV8J.jpg','1948-07-15',244,'Released',NULL,'Superman',126712,1.6982,6.2,'YH_5_LFUvNY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2347,_binary '\0','/hQ7xqQpfkBrlJE7E7VLLSJFD7kH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040862',5.5,2355,'en','Tarzan and the Mermaids','A high priest tries to force a young beauty to marry a pearl trader who is masquerading as the god Balu.','/729UP57wf1f9qwYmXsRqSBt0oJC.jpg','1948-05-15',68,'Released','TARZAN DEFIES THE MAN-GOD\'S TERROR - to Save the Queen of Pearl-Divers!','Tarzan and the Mermaids',70136,2.4338,6,'I6hWT275WfU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2348,_binary '\0','/fwtG7TrqR2JLHj3QQEXa4KDPexD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040866',7.8,6309,'it','La terra trema','In rural Sicily, the fishermen live at the mercy of the greedy wholesalers. One family risks everything to buy their own boat and operate independently.','/cVK1GmzkLkVutFT9fFt6V6CripQ.jpg','1949-12-03',160,'Released',NULL,'La Terra Trema',43445,1.8458,7.753,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2349,_binary '\0','/9YuUlWBr9dntfhWAnuHuG8RemWr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040870',6.5,1240,'en','That Wonderful Urge','When an heiress finds out that the friendly young man she\'s met at Sun Valley is really an investigative reporter, she ruins his career by falsely claiming they\'re married.','/n7cK0kMXvCem3kwS9rWGpKIAKlI.jpg','1948-11-20',82,'Released','Obey That Impluse!!!!!','That Wonderful Urge',143170,1.8258,6.643,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2350,_binary '\0','/d98FV28Tt3uuYLaPbGNRlW5Ec60.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040872',7.4,10538,'en','They Live by Night','An escaped convict, injured during a robbery, falls in love with the woman who nurses him back to health, but their relationship seems doomed from the beginning.','/p9ifSgroa8eoh13OLFUAMwiFByV.jpg','1949-11-01',96,'Released','Cops or no cops I\'m going through!','They Live by Night',44190,4.3415,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2351,_binary '\0','/oq5cf8FK7zAUtdcYuNImJfSYBbf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040876',7.1,7784,'en','The Three Musketeers','In 17th century France, young D\'Artagnan wants to join the King\'s Musketeers, but instead befriends three legendary musketeers—Athos, Porthos, and Aramis—and together, they become embroiled in the political intrigue surrounding King Louis XIII and his adversaries, particularly the powerful Cardinal Richelieu.','/jOkXsC1NjkNOxNyooRhTIf1nxsn.jpg','1948-10-20',125,'Released','THE COMPLETE ROMANCE...THE FULL NOVEL!','The Three Musketeers',41609,4.712,6.8,'7GH--R9iwAg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2352,_binary '\0','/4Fa8pLcAkA5smMyreur0qFAvHVM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040884',6.2,1452,'en','The Time of Your Life','Joe spends a lot of his time at Nick\'s Pacific Street Saloon. Tom, who credits Joe with once saving his life, stops by regularly to run errands for Joe. Today, Tom notices a woman named Kitty when she comes into Nick\'s, and he quickly falls in love with her. Meanwhile, a distraught young man repeatedly calls his girlfriend, begging her to marry him. Nick himself muses on all the various persons who come into his bar, some to ask for work and others just to pass the time.','/pIlsRsR2785SKJA2Cuhe4u17Otp.jpg','1948-09-03',109,'Released','FROM THE GREAT STAGE PLAY!','The Time of Your Life',76076,1.624,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2353,_binary '\0','/osytHgkv86CTFKxo46l9P7ACEjm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040897',8.2,142725,'en','The Treasure of the Sierra Madre','Two jobless Americans convince a prospector to travel to the mountains of Mexico with them in search of gold. But the hostile wilderness, local bandits, and greed all get in the way of their journey.','/pWcst7zVbi8Z8W6GFrdNE7HHRxL.jpg','1948-01-15',126,'Released','The nearer they get to their treasure, the farther they get from the law.','The Treasure of the Sierra Madre',3090,7.7246,7.95,'1DwXNmorsa0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2354,_binary '\0','/bGyYxpwjPouydUVwYi4k2tYkjhe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040919',7.4,6344,'en','Unfaithfully Yours','Before he left for a brief European visit, symphony conductor Sir Alfred De Carter casually asked his staid brother-in-law August to look out for his young wife, Daphne, during his absence. August has hired a private detective to keep tabs on her. But when the private eye\'s report suggests Daphne might have been canoodling with his secretary, Sir Alfred begins to imagine how he might take his revenge.','/kJ5lV3SuD1yHgBPOfKQaJcoR09z.jpg','1948-11-05',105,'Released','Will somebody \"get her\" tonite?','Unfaithfully Yours',33115,2.8493,7.212,'x1hWIg93bJw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2355,_binary '\0','/EAsNUAhKmacreQtkjdsFjKTLwS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040934',6.8,1871,'en','The Velvet Touch','Stage actress Valerie Stanton is locked in a bitter feud with her producer and ex Gordon Dunning. When he attempts to blackmail her into remaining under contract with his company, Stanton, in a fit of passion, clubs Dunning with a statuette, killing him. Her gloves have prevented fingerprints but her perfect alibi quickly unravels as Captain Danbury begins investigating.','/pIExpZkAaHnZ4106e8n82sfUKQv.jpg','1948-07-13',100,'Released','Rosalind has her eye on three men... three men have their eye on Rosalind... one of them is up to no good!','The Velvet Touch',29116,2.1392,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2356,_binary '\0','/5NCVJR1pS9DZQvqFTVN2SUK5AHU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040946',6.5,3227,'en','Wake of the Red Witch','Captain Ralls fights Dutch shipping magnate Mayrant Sidneye for the woman he loves, Angelique Desaix, and for a fortune in gold aboard the Red Witch.','/ln7zx4wFEtnA3AhoZRR1Z1tgPxw.jpg','1948-12-30',106,'Released','Romance! Adventure!...as wild as the RAGING SEAS!','Wake of the Red Witch',40718,3.0911,5.877,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2357,_binary '\0','/bojUvjQro3e2NpjSWpad5nTvYeM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040947',6.3,1325,'en','Walk a Crooked Mile','A security leak is found at a Southern California atomic plant. The authorities stand in fear that the information leaked would go to a hostile nation. To investigate the case more efficiently, Dan O\'Hara, an FBI agent, and Philip Grayson, a Scotland Yard sleuth, join forces. Will they manage to stop the spy ring from achieving their aim?','/oZ9DYpscD0bTOo9hm02LrsDcQ7f.jpg','1948-09-02',91,'Released','FBI teams up with Scotland Yard to avenge murder of G-Man!','Walk a Crooked Mile',26385,1.9344,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2358,_binary '\0','/gD9lXej1aqR22pRTbXVypQJfZA4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040965',6.6,1632,'en','Whispering Smith','Smith is an iron-willed railroad detective. When his friend Murray is fired from the railroad and begins helping Rebstock wreck trains, Smith must go after him. He also seems to have an interest in Murray\'s wife (and vice versa).','/p46uII7te9cwU5KSrgfz0s5SEbq.jpg','1948-12-09',89,'Released','A new Ladd thrills the Old West !','Whispering Smith',60545,1.5644,6.7,'B0RNC-NrPhc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2359,_binary '\0','/h3ol0CvbiOHi3ztueYjvORKmpOK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040970',7.6,2117,'en','The Winslow Boy','In pre-WWI England, a youngster is expelled from a naval academy over a petty theft, but his parents raise a political furor by demanding a trial.','/5HjxMMFr6QKB3vaiGQxavcs3qB0.jpg','1948-09-24',117,'Released',NULL,'The Winslow Boy',77822,1.8473,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2360,_binary '\0','/lEd2VenGgo0fI56QSkBbm5ICg56.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040971',6.2,1648,'en','Winter Meeting','A repressed poetess and an embittered war hero help each other cope with their problems.','/1oTZOVu00BgTg9Yf7LFoU1S1eME.jpg','1948-04-07',104,'Released','You\'ve told me your secret, now I\'ll tell you mine.','Winter Meeting',43457,0.9231,6.6,'iv242EpekU0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2361,_binary '\0','/3E8pn71SnhEHHhHWkRky8mS7Pwd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040974',6.6,2115,'en','The Woman in White','A young painter stumbles upon an assortment of odd characters at an English estate where he has been hired to give art lessons to beautiful Laura Fairlie. Among them are Anne Catherick, a strange young woman dressed in white whom he meets in the forest and who bears a striking resemblance to Laura; cunning Count Fosco, who hopes to obtain an inheritance for nobleman Sir Percival Glyde, whom he plans to have Laura marry; Mr. Fairlie, a hypochondriac who can\'t stand to have anyone make the slightest noise; and eccentric Countess Fosco who has her own dark secret. The artist also finds himself drawn to Marion Halcomb, a distant relation to Laura for whom the Count also has plans.','/gT0GIiAOkrjh76TyqvXSeYIYMBQ.jpg','1948-05-07',109,'Released','CAUGHT IN THE BLACK SPELL OF TERROR!','The Woman in White',37300,1.8099,5.7,'l1MdH-QMUaE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2362,_binary '\0','/bO4WFPLwAy0Z6uCHwt2T5yvFM7N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040976',6.4,1697,'en','Words and Music','Encomium to Larry Hart (1895-1943), seen through the fictive eyes of his song-writing partner, Richard Rodgers (1902-1979): from their first meeting, through lean years and their breakthrough, to their successes on Broadway, London, and Hollywood. We see the fruits of Hart and Rodgers\' collaboration - elaborately staged numbers from their plays, characters\' visits to night clubs, and impromptu performances at parties. We also see Larry\'s scattered approach to life, his failed love with Peggy McNeil, his unhappiness, and Richard\'s successful wooing of Dorothy Feiner.','/j2EKiMGFeKk3VVz7lZz0HaXXjH0.jpg','1948-12-31',121,'Released','The BIGGEST musical!','Words and Music',43458,2.1542,5.8,'kYMp7lKihSk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2363,_binary '\0','/hJwZnEQ22fwuQNAW8GGXYIFbFcc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040978',7.4,6619,'en','Yellow Sky','In 1867, a gang robs a bank and flees into the desert. Out of water, the outlaws encounter a ghost town called Yellow Sky and its only residents, a hostile young woman and her grandfather.','/ahS9YKQSkckF5XSWkAJxpwLmuef.jpg','1948-12-24',98,'Released','It was as if the YELLOW SKY had sought them out... where fate had forgotten them and life had left them behind!','Yellow Sky',20638,3.1694,7,'Jnub_flGGcw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2364,_binary '\0','/4Tis1cA6ULVHx2RqZnccroQFBa9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040979',7.6,15020,'ja','醉いどれ天使','In postwar Tokyo, a blunt, alcohol-soaked doctor diagnoses a swaggering young yakuza with tuberculosis, forging an uneasy bond that’s tested when the gangster’s ruthless former boss returns and drags him back toward the swampy underworld he can’t escape.','/AtOmansAPc5mDb8SpcuV0QT9Tdu.jpg','1948-04-27',98,'Released',NULL,'Drunken Angel',25858,4.162,7.6,'gwqzBTTn-Uo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2365,_binary '\0','/oohhWs8CeZhLNO0UVVdTEGfgML2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0040980',7.2,1719,'ja','夜の女たち','In early post-war Osaka, three women—war widow Fusako, her Korean expat sister Natsuko, and Kumiko, Fusako\'s sister-in-law—descend into prostitution, all for their individual reasons.','/yFjyz3hLnC6gkZiRh6RjZpWgVro.jpg','1948-05-26',74,'Released',NULL,'Women of the Night',85844,1.4458,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2366,_binary '\0','/78xZddksrHJ71OmNKxILMXDlkyw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041084',6.7,1289,'en','Abandoned','A Los Angeles newspaperman seeks a woman\'s sister and finds a black-market baby ring.','/nJlvfBywxqwogkKy72yeg5iiKTQ.jpg','1949-10-26',78,'Released','NO NAME FOR HER BABY...only a PRICE!','Abandoned',32849,1.0952,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2367,_binary '\0','/gfaDcnvJ1odvZ1r7IMWgyGUBpyo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041085',6.7,4535,'en','Bud Abbott and Lou Costello Meet the Killer, Boris Karloff','Lost Caverns Resort Hotel bellhop Freddie Phillips gives an empty threat to one attorney Amos Strickland, and is shortly fired. When Freddie visits his guest\'s suite to apologize, he finds Strickland dead of a gunshot wound. As the investigators file in, Freddie becomes the scapegoat of the guests in the hotel, who all had a bone to pick with Strickland. It\'s now up to Freddie and Detective Casey Edwards to find out who the real killer is, all the while avoiding the many vigorous and violent villains staying at the resort.','/qXUudFnk6Dw5hYYFjEhr4p3RYHv.jpg','1949-05-26',84,'Released','MORE GHOULISH GLEE THAN WHEN THEY MET FRANKENSTEIN!','Bud Abbott and Lou Costello Meet the Killer, Boris Karloff',33477,2.1039,6.592,'7dKTwhCBkc0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2368,_binary '\0','/xsshuimhFbd6d7lfwAwu8986S7K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041088',7.5,6866,'en','Act of Violence','A former prisoner of war, Frank Enley is hailed as a hero in his California town. However, Frank has a shameful secret that comes back to haunt him when fellow survivor Joe Parkson emerges, intent on making Frank pay for his past deeds.','/vzJ2CTNDtNfm4sP1JFrcFT7KrmU.jpg','1949-01-22',82,'Released','The manhunt no woman could stop!','Act of Violence',32850,2.2425,6.9,'8vfz7eDNKVg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2369,_binary '\0','/q9bDTKlHh5nURBo4VS0cVa0x4E1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041090',7.4,24681,'en','Adam\'s Rib','A woman\'s attempted murder of her uncaring husband results in everyday quarrels in the lives of Adam and Amanda, a pair of happily married lawyers who end up on opposite sides of the case in court.','/k9gT6d2sDT9Jd4dvzHowTt3l6Zg.jpg','1949-11-17',101,'Released','It\'s The Hilarious Answer To Who Wears The Pants!','Adam\'s Rib',25431,3.9024,7.104,'tQ5NpJ81AY4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2370,_binary '\0','/tKjS4qUrtJw5Hg4kFpZaVEPrQOT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041094',6.8,20501,'en','The Adventures of Ichabod and Mr. Toad','The Wind in the Willows: Concise version of Kenneth Grahame\'s story of the same name. J. Thaddeus Toad, owner of Toad Hall, is prone to fads, such as the newfangled motor car. This desire for the very latest lands him in much trouble with the wrong crowd, and it is up to his friends, Mole, Rat and Badger to save him from himself. - The Legend of Sleepy Hollow: Retelling of Washington Irving\'s story set in a tiny New England town. Ichabod Crane, the new schoolmaster, falls for the town beauty, Katrina Van Tassel, and the town Bully Brom Bones decides that he is a little too successful and needs \"convincing\" that Katrina is not for him.','/o6GfVkgPaaHJnXNywDLpHJII2tW.jpg','1949-10-05',68,'Released','Two Tall Tales by the world\'s top story-tellers in one hilarious All-Cartoon Feature!','The Adventures of Ichabod and Mr. Toad',13465,6.313,6.5,'Gzz2Ly_fPuw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2371,_binary '\0','/m07cPVJ2AtpftYIqXVC1GYW3w6E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041098',6,4343,'en','Africa Screams','When bookseller Buzz cons Diana into thinking that his friend Stanley knows all there is to know about Africa, they are abducted and ordered to lead Diana and her henchmen to an African tribe in search of a fortune in jewels.','/kwG0Zvu99fFerIJv0qnqHXZ5MWt.jpg','1949-05-04',79,'Released','A Zany, Hilarious Romp!','Africa Screams',20278,1.7201,5.7,'USOHyNuOCZ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2372,_binary '\0','/w34GFErW7GoSqfxQ0QMRXXQRlEY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041107',7.1,1813,'en','Alias Nick Beal','After straight-arrow district attorney Joseph Foster says in frustration that he would sell his soul to bring down a local mob boss, a smooth-talking stranger named Nick Beal shows up with enough evidence to seal a conviction. When that success leads Foster to run for governor, Beal\'s unearthly hold on him turns the previously honest man corrupt, much to the displeasure of his wife and his steadfast minister.','/8wy0peTDb2Zrdecely80hOyAPv8.jpg','1949-03-04',93,'Released','No man ever held more terrible power over women than this tall dark handsome stranger from nowhere!','Alias Nick Beal',32887,2.0182,6.814,'MhNMR91vybY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2373,_binary '\0','/bSTvvll9gIOcoavWRIVYL5RoTkn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041113',7.4,18345,'en','All the King\'s Men','A man of humble beginnings and honest intentions rises to power by nefarious means. Along for the wild ride are an earnest reporter, a heretofore classy society girl, and a too-clever-for-her-own-good political flack.','/7o8nnvFnkekDAlIYznNUWzxQFM6.jpg','1949-11-16',109,'Released','He Might Have Been A Pretty Good Guy . . . If Too Much Power . . . And Women . . . Hadn\'t Gone To his Head !','All the King\'s Men',25430,4.7766,7,'DivcuGBAHcI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2374,_binary '\0','/gcWIzfhlnyhRLqDS8OLOKHT5zv3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041127',6.9,1349,'en','Any Number Can Play','When illegal casino owner Charley Kyng develops heart disease, he is advised by a doctor to spend more time with his family. However, he finds it difficult to keep his work separate from his life at home. His son, Paul, feels ashamed of Charley\'s career and gets into a fight at his prom because of it. Meanwhile, Charley\'s brother-in-law, Robbin, who works at the casino, begins fixing games due to his extreme gambling debts.','/wIqcrtNP6wkPO6vQYYRkwasvWNY.jpg','1949-07-15',112,'Released','The most exciting picture in years!','Any Number Can Play',121074,2.1101,6.9,'LFJupAQ8Nn0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2375,_binary '\0','/sKEncrsqPxibvlWbsXYsPhXGBjw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041154',8.2,21965,'ja','晩春','Noriko is perfectly happy living at home with her widowed father, Shukichi, and has no plans to marry -- that is, until her aunt Masa convinces Shukichi that unless he marries off his 27-year-old daughter soon, she will likely remain alone for the rest of her life. When Noriko resists Masa\'s matchmaking, Shukichi is forced to deceive his daughter and sacrifice his own happiness to do what he believes is right.','/iNtRSY2AGjW1VDXDR79bKsNUdus.jpg','1949-09-13',108,'Released',NULL,'Late Spring',20530,4.1267,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2376,_binary '\0','/lraknsIRsxNE38469HayRlmM8Lm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041158',7,3767,'en','The Barkleys of Broadway','Josh and Dinah Barkley are a successful musical-comedy team, known for their stormy but passionate relationship. Dinah feels overshadowed by Josh and limited by the lighthearted musical roles he directs her in. So she decides to stretch her skills by taking a role in a serious drama, directed by another man.','/gSBFe63y0xkeBzhhmD1621FDSSN.jpg','1949-05-04',108,'Released','Joyously together again!','The Barkleys of Broadway',29885,2.6546,6.9,'i6zNNPq6uCc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2377,_binary '\0','/wYGqHWbg4h5Jj8AB7EYy62gcvlE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041162',5.9,2360,'en','Batman and Robin','This 15-chapter serial pits Batman and Robin against The Wizard, who uses a device that allows him to control machinery to hold the city hostage.','/411pEyeqP5rLS6Zc9batSRL0c8G.jpg','1949-05-26',263,'Released','Based on the well-known Batman comic magazine feature appearing in \"Detective Comics\" and \"Batman\" magazines.','Batman and Robin',93560,1.719,5.7,'qMEVLZkVdCM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2378,_binary '\0','/bam6RudCnYDj8YIZt2vi3bUTxSp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041163',7.4,8648,'en','Battleground','Members of the U.S. Army\'s 101st Airborne Division are fighting for their country amidst the rugged terrain of Bastogne, Belgium, in December 1944. Holley and his American compatriots have already seen one of their own, Roderigues, perish under enemy fire. The men try to rebuff another series of Nazi attacks, but what they really need is a change in the weather. Without clear skies, they\'ll never get the air support they need.','/qSrcs7zmF61aRtzmOVPxeBBowap.jpg','1949-11-09',118,'Released','The First Great Picture Of The Second World War!','Battleground',31623,3.2117,6.713,'7fSsf6b9aWU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2379,_binary '\0','/9QA5D4Y4KvNn8hZbBbqoSulOVX8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041172',6.8,2948,'en','Beyond the Forest','Rosa, the self-serving wife of a small-town doctor, gets a better offer when a wealthy big-city man insists she get a divorce and marry him instead. Soon she demonstrates she is capable of rather deplorable acts -- including murder.','/vKVNZQpyGldpYhEudwJmeAWdSW3.jpg','1949-10-21',97,'Released','Nobody\'s as good as Bette when she\'s bad!','Beyond the Forest',35896,1.7595,6.7,'uJoZBiYjJck','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2380,_binary '\0','/rwHk1Zhi2b0eNTcyPgv2AGWJZVA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041178',6.9,5860,'en','The Big Steal','Army Lieutenant Halliday, accused of stealing the Army payroll, pursues the real thief on a frantic chase through Mexico aided by the thief\'s ex-girlfriend and is in turn being chased by his accuser, Capt. Blake.','/a1usoDu6Ae4k3pRfQ1IMzFWR2qy.jpg','1949-07-01',71,'Released','Mitchum is HOT! - HOT...off location in the heart of Mexico...HOT...after a girl with a million-dollar figure!...HOT...at the nation\'s boxoffices...HOT...in his newest picture!','The Big Steal',19998,1.6523,6.6,'ABUptJ9138Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2381,_binary '\0','/3MjtMfTmI8eOBvqXnlAw4Tg1lWO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041182',6.4,1700,'en','Black Magic','A hypnotist uses his powers for revenge against King Louis XV\'s court.','/bsoMpbilQTp2RAVpYNr6XJKMFZc.jpg','1949-08-19',105,'Released','...It Will Hold You in its Spell!','Black Magic',92796,2.7698,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2382,_binary '\0','/2gx877qmwhr6AOrdRm4GkBRE8aj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041187',6,1756,'en','Blonde Ice','A golddigging femme fatale leaves a trail of men behind her, rich and poor, alive and dead.','/lTrelCTjiWPKtqrUaIYsTtYRPv0.jpg','1948-07-24',73,'Released','ICE in her veins... ICICLES on her heart!','Blonde Ice',41487,1.7201,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2383,_binary '\0','/5SQJiWr966EmMupe42qnjL3cvCT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041198',7,3100,'en','Border Incident','The story concerns two agents, one Mexican (PJF) and one American, who are tasked to stop the smuggling of Mexican migrant workers across the border to California. The two agents go undercover, one as a poor migrant.','/FESTAHTpccVj6npkUv6GJ5d1St.jpg','1949-10-28',94,'Released','The Shame of Two Nations!','Border Incident',33811,1.8428,6.9,'9wbzvBSVMPU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2384,_binary '\0','/lNURX5jBR2yomeJZip2GBwmfl9O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041207',6.6,2384,'en','The Bribe','United States Federal agent Rigby travels to the Central American island Carlotta to investigate a stolen aircraft engines smuggling racket.','/lpSkLEOCFbFpmwmTuprWLl5DRRg.jpg','1949-02-03',98,'Released','5 Great Stars in a Daring Drama of Love and Adventure!','The Bribe',25509,1.7796,6.3,'Rgh62TdVhjs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2385,_binary '\0','/5tl6cv6AU44WcvMbzD1x0OGjqu0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041239',7.3,5427,'en','Champion','An unscrupulous boxer fights his way to the top, but eventually alienates all of the people who helped him on the way up.','/luBAS7aD9Iu6RwEumfXbQewjO1g.jpg','1949-04-09',99,'Released','Fighting or loving, he was the... CHAMPION','Champion',25918,2.4378,6.692,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2386,_binary '\0','/geizp94zUS43Q0h7kO0ZlUQI3Mn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041253',7.2,3617,'en','Colorado Territory','After escaping from jail, outlaw Wes McQueen is convinced by his old partner in crime to do one last heist.','/sliBPULxtTEit14lFJYLSeHO679.jpg','1949-06-11',94,'Released','A mighty, memorable new adventure hurtling out of the heroic vastness of Colorado Territory.','Colorado Territory',28484,2.2971,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2387,_binary '\0','/bDYgODkocRo0lVzAEOseBZIfORX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041257',7.1,1828,'en','Come to the Stable','Two nuns arrive unannounced in the small New England town of Bethlehem, where they recruit various townspeople to help them build a children\'s hospital.','/5S8e0COr9OmIeuy9nGL6x0H1oda.jpg','1949-07-27',94,'Released','Laughs To Make Your Heart Ring Out With Joy!','Come to the Stable',120481,2.0475,6.767,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2388,_binary '\0','/rJMfeNRWWCn9NUamHgFVVFIGSsY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041259',6.5,3015,'en','A Connecticut Yankee in King Arthur\'s Court','A bump on the head sends Hank Martin, 1905 auto mechanic, to Arthurian England, 528 A.D., where he is befriended by Sir Sagramore le Desirous and gains power by judicious use of technology. He and Alisande, the King\'s niece, fall in love at first sight, which draws unwelcome attention from her fiancée Sir Lancelot; but worse trouble befalls when Hank meddles in the kingdom\'s politics.','/2LYlMNGXmes2tMlMn6KgSNwUpCo.jpg','1949-04-18',106,'Released','Its laughter will ring through the centuries!','A Connecticut Yankee in King Arthur\'s Court',36848,2.3237,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2389,_binary '\0','/vpOFbe0atVYwaWNp4ehvjrV7e6h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041260',6.1,1219,'en','Conspirator','A newlywed suspects her husband of being a Communist spy.','/uqK0Nxp88M6G2wuQWWTyLejfIHN.jpg','1949-07-28',87,'Released','The Man She Loved Was A Traitor, Sworn To Kill Her!','Conspirator',83932,2.5229,5.8,'kK4NmcwprAM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2390,_binary '\0','/9ubFa6qzOhigJgjTcH3Ynmypl84.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041263',6.6,1899,'en','Cover Up','Insurance investigator Sam Donovan is looking into the apparent suicide of a man in a small Midwestern town. All clues leads him into suspecting murder. Unfortunately, no one wants to assist him with the case, including Sheriff Larry Best.','/8T890IORE2kMxoeV4T7SW2eXtEn.jpg','1949-02-25',82,'Released','It takes more than a kiss to cover up a killing!','Cover Up',37615,2.185,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2391,_binary '\0','/eVzCqwLk806hU6RN8sv9l1ilVL8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041268',7.4,10975,'en','Criss Cross','An armored-car guard must join a robbery after being caught with his ex-wife by her gangster husband.','/AwmyVw6h3nZWvkZUuNpZYDA2Dly.jpg','1949-02-04',88,'Released','When you Double-Cross a Double-Crosser... It\'s a Criss Cross!','Criss Cross',22112,3.0749,7.095,'iGP0fwE0ZFA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2392,_binary '\0','/g6Ruj0yRNhsXOFjg2Slfy6q0WZO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041269',6.6,1805,'en','The Crooked Way','A war veteran suffering from amnesia, returns to Los Angeles from a San Francisco veterans hospital hoping to learn who he is and discovers his criminal past.','/l91wMZ5B4dtodl2EOiLKR0fQ9mg.jpg','1949-04-22',90,'Released','He\'s got a date ...with DEATH!','The Crooked Way',37482,2.0356,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2393,_binary '\0','/q6kUDRJE5EAH6B0WSIOHM34e0kB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041313',7.4,1277,'en','Down to the Sea in Ships','During a whaling expedition in the late 1800\'s, the aging Captain Bering Joy (Lionel Barrymore) and his new first mate, Dan Lunceford (Richard Widmark) engage in a battle of wills concerning the education of the captain\'s struggling grandson.','/uWowLRmayDVqhB10Xgky7imfTiu.jpg','1949-02-15',120,'Released','Thar She Blows!','Down to the Sea in Ships',164073,2.2359,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2394,_binary '\0','/4KHxCEw5Ru8UfZccMQYD7yve0LK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041327',6.9,2883,'en','East Side, West Side','A vain businessman puts strains on his happy marriage to a rich, beautiful socialite by allowing himself to be seduced by a former girlfriend.','/50DthmxOgQlLR48CFLSKeWwcOUR.jpg','1949-12-22',108,'Released','I was married to a man other women pursued!','East Side, West Side',99627,2.7528,7.1,'5AjOiTS2130','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2395,_binary '\0','/8qE5S3Z7QBV3SxNvmnfAHlJvkM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041329',6.5,1621,'en','Edward, My Son','Following the death of his only son, a ruthless businessman reflects on his life, his unhappy marriage and his questionable parenting skills.','/1udAkFcPMFRfxXWrZtQnSrRV2iG.jpg','1949-03-01',112,'Released','Broadway Stage Hit . . . Now on the Screen !','Edward, My Son',94959,1.5565,6.5,'nDbK2O5bhhM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2396,_binary '\0','/6ecqX2rPMWLLs5oZ6OZyji5QG6B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041361',6.4,3936,'en','The Fighting Kentuckian','John Breen (John Wayne), a Kentucky militiaman falls in love with French exile Fleurette De Marchand (Vera Ralston). He discovers a plot to steal the land that Fleurette\'s exiles plan to settle on and aims to foil it.','/pWloasdkbcb2HlbXljmqPMl3ayW.jpg','1949-09-15',100,'Released','ROUGHER, TOUGHER, MORE ROMANTIC THAN EVER!','The Fighting Kentuckian',15266,2.8696,6,'pVh9ZszFU0U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2397,_binary '\0','/rovH7UG8HOytV1lebx8R7DmL2xX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041368',6.9,3607,'en','The File on Thelma Jordon','Cleve Marshall, an assistant district attorney, falls for Thelma Jordon, a mysterious woman with a troubled past. When Thelma becomes a suspect in her aunt\'s murder, Cleve tries to clear her name.','/sPGWc8F0IolxlpfSuOJ8AcvKQLg.jpg','1949-11-04',100,'Released','...SHE\'LL LIE...KILL OR KISS HER WAY OUT OF ANYTHING!','The File on Thelma Jordon',35404,2.7988,6.6,'vrFXARH__0E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2398,_binary '\0','/90RUkFDU9xa5asnlU6FGBVuKGt7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041373',7.1,4170,'en','Flamingo Road','A stranded carnival dancer takes on a corrupt political boss when she marries into small-town society.','/yBISF3qpoDTN82Tz2RbPLNVGda8.jpg','1949-04-30',94,'Released','A wrong girl for the right side of the tracks.','Flamingo Road',27563,1.9855,7,'vTXM5rvC5lM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2399,_binary '\0','/nXZxPRA1LtOFfYFw7HDdvPAQ4Q7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041378',6.5,2242,'en','Follow Me Quietly','When it rains in the city, a serial killer known as \"The Judge\" looks for his next strangling victim. For months, the madman has been stalking at night, leaving behind clues, but police efforts have been fruitless. Constructing a life-size dummy of the murderer, police Lt. Harry Grant is growing obsessed with capturing him, and always following Grant is the relentless reporter Ann Gorman looking to break the story, but the hunt continues.','/undj4wTGliQ909hYypS0LRRGyRA.jpg','1949-07-07',60,'Released','Police baffled by the FACELESS KILLER!','Follow Me Quietly',31167,1.4425,6.2,'Z-9P-s3vGKE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2400,_binary '\0','/7AHYt8RanRRMhLpazdlWXh3ehoY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041386',7,11914,'en','The Fountainhead','An uncompromising, visionary architect struggles to maintain his integrity and individualism despite personal, professional and economic pressures to conform to popular standards.','/2uo8tfSwzrDeRS5YpmLVSXHSjOl.jpg','1949-06-25',112,'Released','No Man Takes What\'s Mine!','The Fountainhead',24650,3.55,6.8,'UlI24CTWxmE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2401,_binary '\0','/aZ8WT3iNZU3bFZruJ1WMiKJ2Ekn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041387',6.5,1706,'en','Francis','During World War II, a junior American Army officer, Lt. Peter Stirling, gets sent to the psychiatric ward whenever he insists that an Army mule named Francis speaks to him.','/bKjJYQzIVrMKjehGq8xKrEWNebq.jpg','1950-02-08',91,'