:03.000000','tt0041452',8.1,19265,'en','The Heiress','In 1840s New York, the uneventful and boring days of the daughter of a wealthy doctor come to an end when she meets a dashing poorer man — who may or may not be after her inheritance.','/1oN0zsjw3iS1HaOLoZbmptzrD1W.jpg','1949-10-06',115,'Released','A truly great motion picture.','The Heiress',28571,3.6731,7.8,'ltjOydHAO0M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2407,_binary '\0','/r6NNj4pBibkn1onHj3mduMCt2vn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041460',7.3,3585,'en','Obsession','A British psychiatrist devises a devilish revenge plot against his wife\'s lover.','/7BlzTHGLBxxCiqY0fTvPqaE2hcX.jpg','1949-08-03',96,'Released','Hidden love! Hidden hate! Hidden fear!','Obsession',35852,2.005,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2408,_binary '\0','/bdoBLsX2PNHDGojEJzRmRZBabpf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041473',7.2,8088,'en','Holiday Affair','Just before Christmas, department store clerk Steve Mason meets big spending customer Connie Ennis, who\'s actually a comparison shopper sent by another store. Steve lets her go, which gets him fired. They spend the afternoon together, which doesn\'t sit well with Connie\'s steady suitor, Carl, when he finds out, but delights her young son Timmy, who quickly takes to Steve.','/aQsQJNiRI8L8pBBrCIGUUXNtv2M.jpg','1949-12-12',87,'Released','It happens in December... but it\'s hotter than July!','Holiday Affair',24863,2.5022,6.868,'rzBQzMV4F6c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2409,_binary '\0','/npDnqGGKvjaLMCYWaZ9AIwjCv87.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041487',7.3,4685,'en','House of Strangers','Ruthless Italian-American banker Gino Monetti is engaged in a number of criminal activities. Three of his four grown sons refuse to help their father stay out of prison after he\'s arrested for his questionable business practices. Three of them take over the business but kick their father out. Max, a lawyer, is the only son that remains loyal.','/BrhMI1iWT4arbn7mcDkHTc0Gy6.jpg','1949-07-01',101,'Released','A powerhouse of emotion.','House of Strangers',20003,2.7684,7,'M7gDQZE_CYQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2410,_binary '\0','/gtrfIUipl5YNtNiwj186wmW7ra6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041495',6.1,1613,'en','The Woman on Pier 13','Communists blackmail a shipping executive into spying for them.','/2C20ARNn99V29hVH2uXEOkRcoRS.jpg','1950-06-15',73,'Released','Her beauty served a mob of terror whose one mission is to destroy!','The Woman on Pier 13',27978,1.8019,5.3,'jCVBt-cDL4I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2411,_binary '\0','/nNsWh6XGHnOWvmOeBjBrMvgebVS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041497',6.8,2742,'en','I Shot Jesse James','Bob Ford murders his best friend Jesse James in order to obtain a pardon that will free him to marry his girlfriend Cynthy. The guilt-stricken Ford soon finds himself greeted with derision and open mockery throughout town. He travels to Colorado to try his hand at prospecting in hopes that marriage with Cynthy is still in the cards.','/8NiIpXBImEW1vacQS4LyinVGqa4.jpg','1949-02-26',81,'Released','THE THRILLING AND COLORFUL LAST DAYS OF AMERICA\'S MOST FABULOUS OUTLAW...POWERFULLY WRITTEN IN GUNSMOKE!','I Shot Jesse James',41058,2.2135,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2412,_binary '\0','/7DAmOH52a1rm4bsdSBV2PJeLDLy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041498',7,9941,'en','I Was a Male War Bride','After marrying an American lieutenant with whom he was assigned to work in post-war Germany, a French captain attempts to find a way to accompany her back to the States under the terms of the War Bride Act.','/gwliIJs9TWlZAcp6k0cx0I81W5e.jpg','1949-08-26',105,'Released','...and this is how SHERIDAN TOOK GRANT!','I Was a Male War Bride',23567,2.3225,6.914,'Z_7L-sWWG1Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2413,_binary '\0','/bMKU5vxYx2nhGW45IXFKfRu0n5Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041503',7,5654,'en','Impact','After surviving a murder attempt, an auto magnate goes into hiding so his wife can pay for the crime.','/tNF03oWEefF5dImf0uOt1QgYdew.jpg','1949-03-20',111,'Released','Wanted By Two Women! One For Love! One For Murder!','Impact',25503,1.7915,6.1,'q4cw25jdsCA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2414,_binary '\0','/arC834SbhtecAw3W4hiz2VKGPmN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041507',7.1,4826,'en','In the Good Old Summertime','Two co-workers in a music shop dislike one another during business hours but unwittingly carry on an anonymous romance through the mail.','/5kPe0U01FrHaS1GsvBe9ZkWdg6d.jpg','1949-07-29',102,'Released','Fall in love.','In the Good Old Summertime',25698,2.9772,6.7,'7lyv0k6hNxY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2415,_binary '\0','/m8hzP0azCnfEjapY9UMfnIWiG7x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041509',6.7,3884,'en','The Inspector General','An illiterate stooge in a traveling medicine show wanders into a strange town and is picked up on a vagrancy charge. The town\'s corrupt officials mistake him for the inspector general whom they think is traveling in disguise. Fearing he will discover they\'ve been pocketing tax money, they make several bungled attempts to kill him.','/pEseNGrq1lSdomjayEflNn0xjaZ.jpg','1949-12-31',101,'Released','The Kaye way to chaos and corruption.','The Inspector General',40206,2.4251,6.627,'t3ehZvLL2UE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2416,_binary '\0','/igWvOpVFD6u4l8agtTYt6x8zFwO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041513',7.6,3483,'en','Intruder in the Dust','Rural Mississippi in the 1940s: Lucas Beauchamp, a local black man with a reputation of not kowtowing to whites, is found standing over the body of a dead white man, holding a pistol that has recently been fired. Quickly arrested for murder and jailed, Beauchamp insists he\'s innocent and asks the town\'s most prominent lawyer, Gavin Stevens, to defend him, but Stevens refuses. When a local boy whom Beauchamp has helped in the past and who believes him to be innocent hears talk of a mob taking Beauchamp out of jail and lynching him, he pleads with Stevens to defend Beauchamp at trial and prove his innocence.','/upQaoMXJhglvPhsYXEDatTLiBXy.jpg','1949-11-22',87,'Released','It\'s Sensational!','Intruder in the Dust',80572,1.8078,7.3,'RVOAKPavYWU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2417,_binary '\0','/nQw6GzHjJCvciLnGozk7BRvPezz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041514',6.8,2084,'en','It Happens Every Spring','A scientist discovers a formula that makes a baseball which is repelled by wood. He promptly sets out to exploit his discovery.','/18mVDAvnpVmKYgsfFe15mALF0iI.jpg','1949-06-10',87,'Released','\"Oh yeah?\" \"Oh yeah!\"','It Happens Every Spring',88288,2.2214,6.6,'E777IQGlqQA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2418,_binary '\0','/1iWhvMWDUfuy7YYTWMqAMNjnRpM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041515',6.4,2195,'en','It\'s a Great Feeling','A waitress at the Warner Brothers commissary is anxious to break into pictures. She thinks her big break may have arrived when actors Jack Carson and Dennis Morgan agree to help her.','/jjZ1dQZ7TX4pU4XGKD3ZQ6ixWSv.jpg','1949-08-20',85,'Released','Guest stars galore!','It\'s a Great Feeling',32552,2.2245,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2419,_binary '\0','/r7jtS16I3vgVvqapgCa7RMkZnvj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041546',8,42504,'en','Kind Hearts and Coronets','When his mother eloped with an Italian opera singer, Louis Mazzini was cut off from her aristocratic family. After the family refuses to let her be buried in the family mausoleum, Louis avenges his mother\'s death by attempting to murder every family member who stands between himself and the family fortune. But when he finds himself torn between his longtime love and the widow of one of his victims, his plans go awry.','/eBvpyRjD3DcCsWgdV6Y9oqPS7dO.jpg','1949-06-23',104,'Released','He chopped down the family tree...','Kind Hearts and Coronets',11898,3.5939,7.6,'fVli0y9bQoA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2420,_binary '\0','/1EvJFAFyMHe5dhDdtTNgyIjutmx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041555',6.6,4992,'en','Knock on Any Door','An attorney defends a hoodlum of murder, using the oppressiveness of the slums to appeal to the court.','/aig0a88U0gHQw1dfnqqbwo5bjZv.jpg','1949-02-22',100,'Released','It will shock you but it will hold you spellbound to the end!','Knock on Any Door',41214,3.5764,6.2,'HBdWzPAJAnM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2421,_binary '\0','/94WgX3skARNW5WIanp1JqK07Er9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041571',6.2,1828,'en','Ladies of the Chorus','Former burlesque star May and her daughter Peggy dance in the chorus. When May has a fight with featured dancer Bubbles, Bubbles leaves the show and Peggy takes her place. When Peggy falls in love with wealthy Randy, May fears class differences may lead to misery.','/j6BT1TpxHPlhZlGn7dC09JnYdsV.jpg','1948-12-30',61,'Released','A Front-Row View Of The Burlesque World!','Ladies of the Chorus',39949,2.2082,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2422,_binary '\0','/cbLA3t5tynW6cTuDhpAv9xXYFaG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041572',6.6,1246,'en','The Lady Gambles','When Joan Boothe accompanies husband-reporter David to Las Vegas, she begins gambling to pass the time while he is doing a story. Encouraged by the casino manager, she gets hooked on gambling, to the point where she \"borrows\" David\'s expense money to pursue her addiction. This finally breaks up their marriage, but David continues trying to help her.','/cFEGxjrXUjGn2spUfwrQ30XWQ0F.jpg','1949-05-20',99,'Released','Once she was someone\'s wife ... now she\'s just someone\'s luck !','The Lady Gambles',36376,2.2409,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2423,_binary '\0','/feSYboaBumxLbMKjfk3ASMcRP36.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041587',7.6,11894,'en','A Letter to Three Wives','A letter is addressed to three wives from their \'best friend\', announcing that she\'s running away with one of their husbands – but she doesn\'t specify which one.','/bSfwTLt2K8IeEeppsiDq7svikbV.jpg','1949-01-20',103,'Released','ALL OF THEM WONDERED WHILE ONE OF THEM WANDERED!','A Letter to Three Wives',45578,3.2817,7.202,'Ufdm0bOCsR0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2424,_binary '\0','/uTPHXSCC7KS1WBSmSSxu3jmypbS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041594',7.2,9035,'en','Little Women','Four sisters come of age in America in the aftermath of the Civil War.','/qrshhX8dywIOljtITGHGNK6TJcB.jpg','1949-03-10',121,'Released','THRILLS OF YOUNG LOVE!','Little Women',43436,5.7166,7.4,'kopTV7sUopo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2425,_binary '\0','/gw05SPvhKfqzLBT7Z2FonOIZmy8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041604',5.8,3371,'en','Love Happy','The Marx Brothers help young Broadway hopefuls when they get mixed up with gangsters due to a tin of sardines containing Romanoff diamonds.','/ha5gq3O5d09OihXO2siVrEWAj37.jpg','1949-10-12',85,'Released','New Musical Girlesque!!!','Love Happy',26814,3.6526,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2426,_binary '\0','/r9zpUOJuYfvZ6Ynbt8dA6dV0pPv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041610',6.8,1913,'en','Lust for Gold','A man determined to track down the fabled Arizona gold mine known as The Lost Dutchman has an affair with a married treasure hunter, whose pursuit of the mine has lead her to double-cross her husband.','/mAcPR8tht7tBTdMvfxjSSGUcK7Y.jpg','1949-06-10',90,'Released','Ruthless Fortune Seekers Who Will Stop at Nothing...','Lust for Gold',94139,2.3507,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2427,_binary '\0','/eyLmT3gApRX7qEepQVApxIJhfzY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041613',6.7,1676,'en','Ma and Pa Kettle','The Kettles and their fifteen children are about to be evicted from their rundown rustic home when Pa wins the grand prize by coming up with a new tobacco slogan. Birdie Hicks is jealous of the family\'s new wealth, which includes a completely automated modern home, and accuses Pa of stealing the slogan. Reporter Kim Parker proves Birdie wrong and marries Tom Kettle.','/fk1nTY7CUT0Q0YLZdHVUdcaiDLN.jpg','1949-04-01',76,'Released','It\'s Loaded . . . with new laffs !!! All Your Favorites fresh from','Ma and Pa Kettle',64620,1.828,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2428,_binary '\0','/ftqzAbXqsHaj3ueKnzd6fYv9ALI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041615',7,3386,'en','Madame Bovary','In 19th-century France, doctor\'s wife Emma Bovary seeks to escape her dull provincial life through various extramarital affairs and extravagant spending, leading to tragic consequences.','/eO9BG1g7dkJSJzVW3OknNrCzpas.jpg','1949-08-25',106,'Released','Whatever it is that French women have ... Madame Bovary had more of it!','Madame Bovary',45184,3.3148,6.8,'OWAvHjmDgEI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2429,_binary '\0','/goUVDQpDFE3oKOLJA6q4q3fDA2i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041622',6.5,1661,'en','Malaya','Soon after the Japanese attack on Pearl Harbor, cynical former newspaper correspondent John Royer devises a scheme with his old editor and government agents to return to the Far East and smuggle out a vast amount of rubber for the war effort. Demanding the freedom and company of his ex-friend, Carnahan, whom he betrayed in an exposé years earlier, Royer sails off into the hands of the Japanese with a motley crew, gold, and the promise of covert government aid.','/ux3vUiB4lXhDhQq5AuPnMyjDkLM.jpg','1949-12-27',98,'Released','When you kiss a girl in Malaya...keep your eyes wide open and a gun in your hand!','Malaya',43962,2.0642,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2430,_binary '\0','/qfIULZ45HvvQ2cc6sYcAweARKQW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041625',6.7,2239,'en','The Man from Colorado','Two friends return home after their discharge from the army after the Civil War. However, one of them has had deep-rooted psychological damage due to his experiences during the war, and as his behavior becomes more erratic--and violent--his friend desperately tries to find a way to help him.','/14x3trG2gMUxIJ3Vca26JfXhwBD.jpg','1948-08-07',100,'Released','COLORADO WASN\'T BIG ENOUGH FOR BOTH...WHEN A WOMAN CAME BETWEEN THEM!','The Man from Colorado',60646,2.2936,6.9,'DMdOaI56faY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2431,_binary '\0','/n94nLT7u9ty05LCp2urULT5uFEZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041634',6.8,1499,'fr','Manon','Port of Marseille, France, recently liberated from the German yoke. Caught as stowaways aboard a ship, Manon, a young woman who was accused of collaborating with the Nazis, and Robert, a freedom fighter who saved her from reprisals, tell the captain about the many challenges they have had to face in order to survive.','/xBnz0NP8mHnIlSLzeT7hOBM7a0Y.jpg','1949-03-09',101,'Released',NULL,'Manon',132332,1.928,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2432,_binary '\0','/a2KwDRJyXFk4fFI9GccAozOEVLx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041650',7,6309,'en','Mighty Joe Young','A young woman, Jill Young, grew up on her father\'s ranch in Africa, raising a large gorilla named Joe from an infant. Years later, she brings him to Hollywood to become a star.','/bCfiB4xlXyAWwgq30QZ44xbe5xm.jpg','1949-07-13',94,'Released','Merian Cooper\'s amazing adventure in the unusual!','Mighty Joe Young',39314,3.8218,6.4,'46AyCmufOs8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2433,_binary '\0','/yxADivhTkV9SuSUNUu25bTGZB2R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041663',6.6,1531,'en','Mr. Soft Touch','When he learns that a gangster has taken over his nightclub and murdered his partner, returning WWII hero Joe Miracle steals the money from the club\'s safe and hides in a settlement home, while the mob is on his tail.','/kuYyDmeXRrw2DaKFewXaBMWCXoW.jpg','1949-07-28',93,'Released','You can\'t keep running forever...because a bullet can travel faster than you can run...','Mr. Soft Touch',50731,1.556,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2434,_binary '\0','/eFcaohWJwTIzbbXCMPAS55Css0y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041671',6.6,1913,'en','My Dream Is Yours','Conceited singer Garry Mitchell refuses to renew his radio contract, so agent Doug Blake decides to find a new personality to replace him. In New York, he finds Martha Gibson, a single mother with a great voice. He arranges for her to move to Hollywood, but then has a problem trying to sell her to the show\'s sponsor. Doug tries every trick he can think of to make Martha a star, and as the two work more closely, he falls in love with her. Complicating matters further, Martha meets and becomes attracted to Garry.','/mj0Fzma5Bfn1XzBaKwPN00ACbXO.jpg','1949-04-15',101,'Released','The All-Time Big-Time Musical!!','My Dream Is Yours',24040,2.129,6.438,'G52zqzOoZvg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2435,_binary '\0','/78M4EsvYLsS0F4DxIowdIdcHXLc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041672',6.8,1531,'en','My Foolish Heart','After a long absence, Mary Jane visits her schoolfriend Eloise, and Eloise\'s daughter Ramona. Eloise drinks too much and is unhappily married to Lew Wengler. Eloise falls asleep and remembers her time with her true love, Walt Dreiser, at the beginning of the Second World War. She recalls the events that lead up to her split with Mary Jane, and how Lew married Eloise rather than Mary Jane.','/g62PfrgWS6otUhW154Qlpg0dqx4.jpg','1950-01-19',98,'Released','Some men can say more with a touch than others with a fierce embrace!','My Foolish Heart',109887,1.6849,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2436,_binary '\0','/3SnfrqhypSXRw15EliwJouPBYfs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041673',6.4,1397,'en','My Friend Irma','Prototype dumb blonde Irma and her slacker, wheeler-dealer boyfriend Al interfere in the love life of Irma\'s level-headed room mate Jane.','/o7mNkoLDstiYPUELgaRD5jXPtmA.jpg','1949-10-14',103,'Released',NULL,'My Friend Irma',96432,1.9737,6.8,'OY0G6U1zoDg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2437,_binary '\0','/woQsr8PpVmkaUFogenmzesq4h5l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041687',6.3,2059,'en','Neptune\'s Daughter','Scatterbrained Betty Barrett mistakes masseur Jack Spratt for Jose O\'Rourke, the captain of the South American polo team. Spratt goes along with the charade, but the situation becomes more complicated when they fall in love. Meanwhile, Betty\'s sensible older sister Eve fears Betty\'s heart will be broken when Jose returns to South America. She arranges to meet with the real O\'Rourke and love soon blossoms between them as well.','/d9O19EfkPl9FCmGh6QfklCDcoIv.jpg','1949-06-10',95,'Released','With a Great Cast of Stars! Bathing Beauties! Songs and Spectacle!','Neptune\'s Daughter',43437,2.6388,6.088,'5XMfLFv6TiU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2438,_binary '\0','/avet9DX7N7m3rN0zp8bIj1tzgK8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041694',7.4,3317,'en','No Man of Her Own','A penniless pregnant woman adopts the identity of a rich woman killed in a train crash.','/pYJukaE6s3AwHXJ1pQl8PEVlozx.jpg','1950-02-21',98,'Released',NULL,'No Man of Her Own',40767,2.7154,6.9,'qehCeqTys5c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2439,_binary '\0','/pKeatSUHRrlcTmkAOQ9tvESbCCe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041699',7.8,21216,'ja','野良犬','A bad day gets worse for young detective Murakami when a pickpocket steals his gun on a hot, crowded bus. Desperate to right the wrong, he goes undercover, scavenging Tokyo’s sweltering streets for the stray dog whose desperation has led him to a life of crime. With each step, cop and criminal’s lives become more intertwined and the investigation becomes an examination of Murakami’s own dark side.','/riBzUgeYawBDi2q9PjARjHrQM7Z.jpg','1949-10-17',122,'Released','The Suspense Filled Story of 7 Bullets!','Stray Dog',30368,3.3525,7.6,'afA0M0rO72I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2440,_binary '\0','/otY1rdFZ9XNsacvZHis9EkaxdnJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041716',7.3,20092,'en','On the Town','Three sailors wreak havoc as they search for love during a whirlwind 24-hour leave in New York City.','/lEU8QQmIayAtPZrCDf2czQgTjQ1.jpg','1949-12-08',98,'Released','They Paint The Town With Joy!','On the Town',31516,3.8145,6.992,'ri4OegFn3Jk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2441,_binary '\0','/zoWSiV6GZ7EJsEOnpyekJE1ceB1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041719',7.8,14720,'fr','Orphée','A famous poet in postwar Paris, scorned by the Left Bank youth, is in love with both his wife Eurydice and a mysterious princess. Seeking inspiration, the poet becomes obsessed and follows the princess from the world of the living to the land of the dead.','/diu88F9PlUsrzHApC7VCV2QkNxR.jpg','1950-09-29',95,'Released',NULL,'Orpheus',4558,4.1123,7.6,'9ciOWebRF3Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2442,_binary '\0','/7ygJjPeWvmRfUUdWUnPRdxGfT1I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041735',7.2,3674,'en','The Passionate Friends','A woman is torn between the love of her life, who\'s married to someone else, and her older husband.','/awmC8rVQR2WcN7kTKP7bXHFInnA.jpg','1949-01-26',91,'Released','Their affair took on a life of its own.','The Passionate Friends',51618,2.2529,6.867,'XGj5ggh47ps','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2443,_binary '\0','/xC6suee08ve5VGuVpKKfeBCweqg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041737',7.1,5971,'en','Passport to Pimlico','When an unexploded WWII bomb is accidentally detonated in Pimlico, it reveals a treasure trove and documents proving that the region is in fact part of Burgundy, France and thus foreign territory. The British government attempts to regain control by setting up border controls and cutting off services to the area.','/tYPQny9ZFJo9ZkObdQkiT9N69lN.jpg','1949-10-26',84,'Released','French Goings-On in the Heart of London.','Passport to Pimlico',30095,2.0916,6.9,'_ZvLqZ4-8-M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2444,_binary '\0','/hh33QdKGio3Vdr4dpvP3M7JDZD9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041746',7.2,3773,'en','Pinky','Pinky, a light skinned black woman, returns to her grandmother\'s house in the South after graduating from a Northern nursing school. Pinky tells her grandmother that she has been \"passing\" for white while at school in the North. In addition, she has fallen in love with a young white doctor, who knows nothing about her black heritage.','/4KF6DKLq5vVVjLriBnCttJGTiHA.jpg','1949-09-28',102,'Released','The poignant story of a girl who fell hopelessly in love!','Pinky',62727,2.3692,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2445,_binary '\0','/sPDnbW9uQYjSN2bgY0JLLlNysvG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041761',6,1237,'en','Port of New York','Two narcotics agents go after a gang of murderous drug dealers who use ships docking at the New York harbor to smuggle in their contraband.','/r2daeeaQdjkRSr2cGyPX8iVIsUl.jpg','1949-11-28',82,'Released','No crime too vicious ... no justice too swift for the Merchants of Death who lurk in its shadows!','Port of New York',23334,1.9425,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2446,_binary '\0','/4a7JFwKeGu0VRWOzOYSLs5ij1Zc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041767',6.9,2199,'en','Prince of Foxes','In 1500, Duke Cesare Borgia hopes to marry his sister to the heir apparent of Ferrara, which impedes his conquest of central Italy. On this delicate mission he sends Andrea Orsini, his sister\'s lover and nearly as unscrupulous as himself. En route, Orsini meets Camilla Verano, wife of the count of Citta\' del Monte, and sentiment threatens to turn him against his deadly master, whom no one betrays twice...','/wW7QnqORPwTUGp62gAxaOequywC.jpg','1949-11-11',107,'Released','King of Romantic Epics!','Prince of Foxes',44533,1.9218,6.3,'mdxf4upvzC4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2447,_binary '\0','/gqcnrni9siRgIGvovvSMW1LhTIR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041776',7.1,2780,'en','The Queen of Spades','A czarist captain stops at nothing to learn the secrets of a countess rumored to have sold her soul to the devil in order to always win at cards.','/Aro69lxeXWZN0mKy5DYtFcfx2cX.jpg','1949-03-16',95,'Released','Passionate... Exciting... Intriguing... He bartered his soul for the SECRET of the cards!','The Queen of Spades',77546,2.6398,6.5,'p-5s8VExmv8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2448,_binary '\0','/c0gCHnvEqurJAbmp4Pk2kuUH2a6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041786',7.1,6619,'en','The Reckless Moment','After discovering the dead body of her teenage daughter\'s lover, a housewife takes desperate measures to protect her family from scandal.','/qvGt1gbQt7g5vUzJrZU2qWQNEqR.jpg','1949-12-09',82,'Released','It could happen to so many married women!','The Reckless Moment',28007,2.5366,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2449,_binary '\0','/nC9RWgMuTCS3uwgk8FpS8R4s8Eq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041790',6.4,1815,'en','Red Light','Nick Cherney, in prison for embezzling from Torno Freight Co., sees a chance to get back at Johnny Torno through his young priest brother Jess. He pays fellow prisoner Rocky, who gets out a week before Nick, to murder Jess... who, dying, tells revenge-minded Johnny that he\'d written a clue \"in the Bible.\" Frustrated, Johnny obsessively searches for the missing Gideon Bible from Jess\'s hotel room.','/5Vs4kB5HD3dIVoPuVNvi9xr9ONI.jpg','1949-09-30',83,'Released','THERE\'S TROUBLE AHEAD!','Red Light',25807,1.3237,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2450,_binary '\0','/nwm9e1oEc4pjLknaX7hNTFvMx8q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041792',6.3,1338,'en','The Red Pony','Peter Miles stars as Tom Tiflin, the little boy at the heart of this John Steinbeck story set in Salinas Valley. With his incompatible parents -- the city-loving Fred and country-happy Alice -- constantly bickering, Tom looks to cowboy Billy Buck for companionship and paternal love.','/mVFxAQEmKqTyY96HNk6xtcgyFCC.jpg','1949-03-08',91,'Released','John Steinbeck\'s great American story !','The Red Pony',23395,1.853,6,'VDlSuP8sK5g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2451,_binary '\0','/qgAp2QLadhpoT6CxeS8PPbqN6bj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041796',6.9,2429,'en','Reign of Terror','The French Revolution, 1794. The Marquis de Lafayette asks Charles D\'Aubigny to infiltrate the Jacobin Party to overthrow Maximilian Robespierre, who, after gaining supreme power and establishing a reign of terror ruled by death, now intends to become the dictator of France.','/vHJaF9RoTT1XU1uUj9c6nLVulQj.jpg','1949-10-15',87,'Released','Open or shut… it can cost your life!','Reign of Terror',27635,1.7868,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2452,_binary '\0','/4LX8TT3lHjH5GBCCytuA2hpSUk4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041822',6.6,2100,'en','Rope of Sand','Two years after trespassing on South African diamond company land, safari guide Mike Davis returns, but, instead of sending his heavy, the manager hires a seductive adventuress to ferret out his secrets, unaware of the extent Davis is willing to go.','/jRhr83DBbOG6kPROTbpbwR4nRy0.jpg','1949-08-03',104,'Released','Savage Greed...Sultry Love...Wild Adventure!','Rope of Sand',15481,2.2084,5.892,'rFvJXB4XcT4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2453,_binary '\0','/2ak3COMEe5g7JN8WvJhpoBxBqcp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041838',6.8,10122,'en','Samson and Delilah','When strongman Samson rejects the love of the beautiful Philistine woman Delilah, she seeks vengeance that brings horrible consequences they both regret.','/d2AHCe6WzvshD7ucKuUWgugExjc.jpg','1949-12-21',134,'Released','HISTORY\'S MOST BEAUTIFUL AND TREACHEROUS WOMAN!','Samson and Delilah',29993,6.6935,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2454,_binary '\0','/ovfJX70VfUTXM2o28lvZQchtynG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041841',7,12529,'en','Sands of Iwo Jima','Haunted by personal demons, Marine Sgt. John Stryker is hated and feared by his men, who see him as a cold-hearted sadist. But when their boots hit the beaches, they begin to understand the reason for Stryker\'s rigid form of discipline.','/utpy9JLuyhsxpw2E3yExw23f3eS.jpg','1950-01-01',100,'Released','A great human story... makes a mighty motion picture!','Sands of Iwo Jima',18712,4.0045,6.4,'Xp5cNZ4JTjQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2455,_binary '\0','/pVrQkuSwxeQtvdtgJlnGPTJjygv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041847',6.6,1771,'en','Scene of the Crime','A cop investigates the shooting of another policeman... that may have been involved in crooked activities.','/dLKT3qon0ZtIlUVt0jmlWPnVnTG.jpg','1949-07-28',94,'Released','Be there when it happens!','Scene of the Crime',38395,2.378,6.1,'Y1oR0gc6Qbk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2456,_binary '\0','/43DOpUZMYaz3tI1Hhe1cigjJK6L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041855',7.5,3624,'en','The Secret Garden','When Cholera takes the parents of Mary Lennox, she is shipped from India to England to live with her Uncle Craven. Mary changes the lives of those she encounters at her Uncle\'s remote estate.','/a28DY7ar8klmQAgDQIlpluzeBgt.jpg','1949-04-30',92,'Released','The Key to the Most Unusual Picture of the Year','The Secret Garden',43439,2.4326,7.1,'_hEEl9unTNE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2457,_binary '\0','/mkI2oI6OdL8asZY3tJhI95UbvBD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041859',7.8,11455,'en','The Set-Up','Expecting the usual loss, a boxing manager takes bribes from a betting gangster without telling his fighter.','/uxE5LZP0RClXKsAqtrHQPiNLHzf.jpg','1949-03-29',73,'Released','I want a man … not a human punching bag!','The Set-Up',17218,2.7765,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2458,_binary '\0','/45tJCXfr3S08qb5fVP86duFUUzx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041866',7.2,21077,'en','She Wore a Yellow Ribbon','On the eve of retirement, Captain Nathan Brittles takes out a last patrol to stop an impending massive Indian attack. Encumbered by women who must be evacuated, Brittles finds his mission imperiled.','/2IXtuwkTVcDsaa09AiQnlkfxe7I.jpg','1949-10-22',104,'Released','John Ford\'s new and finest picture of the fighting cavalry!','She Wore a Yellow Ribbon',13909,4.515,6.9,'JJikQeKBfnQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2459,_binary '\0','/pYW7AaiU0tEpQJbBqDopWSAVHjF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041870',7.3,4454,'ja','静かなる決闘','A young army surgeon, Kyoji Fujisaki, accidentally contracts syphilis during a WWII field operation. Back at his father’s clinic, he treats himself in secret and breaks off his engagement rather than risk his fiancée’s future, even as he confronts the irresponsible patient who infected him—testing his ethics, pride, and capacity for sacrifice.','/19dqy5MgZDiWLaXEmvz6oOd3M1Y.jpg','1949-03-19',95,'Released',NULL,'The Quiet Duel',37513,2.246,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2460,_binary '\0','/cDaU7Mgc36H8qvmnJpfY8BGGmrM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041871',6.5,2906,'en','Shockproof','Jenny Marsh, recently released from prison for killing a man, finds herself under the watchful eye of her parole officer, Griff Marat, who helps her secure a job caring for his ailing mother.','/jxOBL7OKd0jSjgFkAupM0jdHSJh.jpg','1949-01-25',79,'Released','He thought he was shockproof!','Shockproof',25915,1.4665,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2461,_binary '\0','/2OIPXBKopfhFIDVL6koSTYiaFjr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041886',7.1,3776,'en','The Small Back Room','As the Germans drop explosive booby-traps on 1943 Britain, the embittered expert who\'ll have to disarm them fights a private battle with alcohol.','/9f1NRCFv634J0jXsdyEiwKLqgWV.jpg','1949-02-21',107,'Released',NULL,'The Small Back Room',46096,2.7298,6.7,'juJ2qmN-ZjA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2462,_binary '\0','/naRUQ7gNgz0Q9VjBuQGewJlRKmf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041890',6.6,1922,'en','So Dear to My Heart','The tale of Jeremiah Kincaid and his quest to raise his \'champion\' lamb, Danny. Jeremiah\'s dream of showing Danny at the Pike County Fair must overcome the obstinate objections of his loving, yet strict, grandmother Granny. Jeremiah\'s confidant, Uncle Hiram, is the boy\'s steady ally.','/sWoOc4tkxlTf0i8YYia25sPRinY.jpg','1948-11-29',82,'Released','A \"dilly-dilly\" delight!','So Dear to My Heart',29682,3.0681,6.6,'nuxi9TcrePE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2463,_binary '\0','/A9cz3ZrsrFT7NgTZNgYevHIfjwF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041928',7.1,3660,'en','The Stratton Story','Star major league pitcher Monty Stratton loses a leg in a hunting accident, but becomes determined to leave the game on his own terms.','/pp301J6FXlnHAoeY5zExdfui42N.jpg','1949-05-12',106,'Released','James Stewart - June Allyson, In The True Romance of The Year','The Stratton Story',43440,1.5008,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2464,_binary '\0','/58wyozfcoM7mFiA0soOJfHEA27N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041931',7.2,9092,'it','Stromboli (Terra di Dio)','After the end of WWII, a young Lithuanian woman and a young Italian man from Stromboli impulsively marry, but married life on the island is more demanding than she can accept.','/tsyyzGSspKsawHocchfokskwbeM.jpg','1950-02-15',107,'Released','Raging Island... Raging Passions!','Stromboli',4173,2.6134,7.1,'n1cWuVFEtsU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2465,_binary '\0','/1ZWHx8diG4gQQb2Q8AW57opmA0Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041944',6.7,4427,'en','Take Me Out to the Ball Game','The Wolves baseball team gets steamed when they find they\'ve been inherited by one K.C. Higgins, a suspected \"fathead\" who intends to take an active interest in running the team. But K.C. turns outs to be a beautiful woman who really knows her baseball. Second baseman Dennis Ryan promptly falls in love. But his playboy roommate Eddie O\'Brien has his own notions about how to treat the new lady owner and some unsavory gamblers have their own ideas about how to handle Eddie.','/skOi1IHgpkZ6bOxE5yX8fYmUBLT.jpg','1949-03-09',93,'Released','A Homerun Of Laughter, Romance And Fun','Take Me Out to the Ball Game',33738,2.2296,6.7,'QNcFPNhrb2E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2466,_binary '\0','/6hQFcXhD57hzwf6HQY8N6sUZDqj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041948',6.6,1366,'en','Task Force','After learning the finer points of carrier aviation in the 1920s, career officer Jonathan Scott and his pals spend the next two decades promoting the superiority of naval air power. But military and political \"red tape\" continually frustrate their efforts, prompting Scott to even consider leaving the Navy for a more lucrative civilian job. Then the world enters a second World War and Scott finally gets the opportunity to prove to Washington the valuable role aircraft carriers could play in winning the conflict. But what will it cost him and his comrades personally?','/av1YqGB6yXTumCq2K3DpbCkP1C1.jpg','1949-08-30',116,'Released','Nothing ever like it ! Nothing you ever liked more !','Task Force',61262,1.6411,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2467,_binary '\0','/2wl3PXysRe9oFGd0fbFnMbXkHQc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041954',7.3,4075,'en','Tension','Warren Quimby manages a drugstore while trying to keep his volatile wife, Claire, happy. However, when Claire leaves him for a liquor store salesman, Warren can no longer bear it. He decides to assume a new identity in order to murder his wife\'s lover without leaving a trace. Along the way, his plans are complicated by an attractive neighbor, as well as a shocking discovery that opens up a new world of doubts and accusations.','/9xhArxwGLDQyEccn7vmBT5BJc0C.jpg','1949-11-25',95,'Released','In every two-timing kiss you will feel…TENSION!','Tension',25900,1.2636,6.8,'DhjNKXV2RfQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2468,_binary '\0','/1dZVmIMtVQBx2bFKoTPOjgcwRNj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041955',6.7,1615,'en','That Forsyte Woman','Soames and Irene Forsyte have a marriage of convenience. Young Jolyon Forsyte is a black sheep who ran away with the maid after his wife\'s death. Teenager June Forsyte has found love with an artist, Phillip Bosinny. The interactions between the Forsytes and the people and society around them is the truss for this love story set in the rigid and strict times of the Victorian age.','/mxRMcHHS5pYxEHmcDnEZxu9rI2z.jpg','1949-11-03',113,'Released','This is the story of that Forsyte woman and the men who were such fools about her.','That Forsyte Woman',43187,1.7295,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2469,_binary '\0','/rAleakTLVPwVAeDiZXVL1VFBGxO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041958',7.5,7651,'en','Thieves\' Highway','Nick Garcos comes back from his tour of duty in World War II planning to settle down with his girlfriend, Polly Faber. He learns, however, that his father was recently beaten and burglarized by mob-connected trucker Mike Figlia, and Nick resolves to get even. He partners with prostitute Rica, and together they go after Mike, all the while getting pulled further into the local crime underworld.','/ljnFEsYQXeoW03Jagw159xVDP0J.jpg','1949-09-20',94,'Released','You Need a Friend, Strong Man, - And I\'m Friendly!','Thieves\' Highway',20025,2.211,7.3,'QW-mpnQmV8A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2470,_binary '\0','/rLLhOCgAjuvlKmjUqVb7P1UAbUI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041959',8.1,197371,'en','The Third Man','In postwar Vienna, Austria, Holly Martins, a writer of pulp Westerns, arrives penniless as a guest of his childhood chum Harry Lime, only to learn he has died. Martins develops a conspiracy theory after learning of a \"third man\" present at the time of Harry\'s death, running into interference from British officer Major Calloway, and falling head-over-heels for Harry\'s grief-stricken lover, Anna.','/vqnFHTx1phgTAsLfxZoejSbMVHA.jpg','1949-08-31',105,'Released','Hunted by men ... Sought by WOMEN!','The Third Man',1092,9.2266,7.9,'MMxj32oe3s8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2471,_binary '\0','/er5t0aRqvXpFn5BMJ1u1bTh8Hp7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041963',6.7,1280,'en','The Threat','A violent escaped con and his gang kidnap the police detective and DA who put him behind bars.','/ghRKE4tvT57YeEAaz168Sr5tQ3Z.jpg','1949-12-01',66,'Released','KILLER IN JAILBREAK on vengeance trail!','The Threat',73595,1.2413,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2472,_binary '\0','/f8UeXWO8pQCCW1p7udFZvmMthTn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041967',6.3,3202,'en','Tokyo Joe','An American veteran returns to Tokyo to try to pick up the threads of his pre-World War II life there, but finds himself squeezed between criminals and the authorities.','/tXHcILigqhV3y1NxwAyGFcIaGNm.jpg','1949-10-26',88,'Released','Bogart rips the Jap underworld apart over a blonde in a Tokyo hot spot !','Tokyo Joe',70113,1.9501,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2473,_binary '\0','/eACFK15MdkIf63wXSRqGwjXK6gY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041968',7.3,6637,'en','Too Late for Tears','Through a fluke circumstance, a ruthless woman stumbles across a suitcase filled with $60,000, and is determined to hold onto it even if it means murder.','/7lCWILDGzk8EjFILNO9Xy96DsKT.jpg','1949-07-17',99,'Released','She Got What She Wanted... With Lies... With Kisses... With Murder!','Too Late for Tears',27036,3.4746,6.8,'L6OMgsVMeRk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2474,_binary '\0','/3ty1Whni0RiGt4nBnFr3a5A91J0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041983',6.4,2141,'en','Trapped','Secret Service agents make a deal with a counterfeiting inmate to be released on early parole if he will help them recover some bogus moneymaking plates, but he plans to double-cross them.','/9LWy5kjUhBGH1sN4CLQCVq9IjhF.jpg','1949-09-27',78,'Released','When a killer dreams of millions... and a girl to spend them on!','Trapped',29260,1.3781,6,'oen73Ui5SY0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2475,_binary '\0','/oKYwUvy11gDi4eKon8rPFXRs31p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041994',6.2,1552,'en','Tulsa','It\'s Tulsa, Oklahoma at the start of the oil boom and Cherokee Lansing\'s rancher father is killed in a fight with the Tanner Oil Company. Cherokee plans revenge by bringing in her own wells with the help of oil expert Brad Brady and childhood friend Jim Redbird. When the oil and the money start gushing in, both Brad and Jim want to protect the land but Cherokee has different ideas. What started out as revenge for her father\'s death has turned into an obsession for wealth and power.','/mQMWt7KormvYxsbjcHwNpAuNi2p.jpg','1949-04-13',90,'Released','Tempestuous loves! Lusty adventures! Violent hates!','Tulsa',104083,1.663,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2476,_binary '\0','/fVnphXrYJTH8xPKvJCtzSwZycFC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041996',7.7,15856,'en','Twelve O\'Clock High','In the early days of daylight bombing raids over Germany, General Frank Savage must take command of a \'hard luck\' bomber group. Much of the story deals with his struggle to whip his group into a disciplined fighting unit in spite of heavy losses, and withering attacks by German fighters over their targets.','/g9VeQUobhofLwxSIbKM4ia5biAX.jpg','1949-12-21',132,'Released','A story of twelve men as their women never knew them...','Twelve O\'Clock High',15497,3.9401,7.2,'AGEekUoEQUM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2477,_binary '\0','/oRpnMu1AOwZJ93fUTaI24gC4HeT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0041998',6.5,3231,'sv','Törst','A fractured portrait of desire and isolation, following a failing marriage and parallel stories of emotional entrapment as memories surface during a train journey through postwar Europe. Told through flashbacks and multiple narrative threads, the film signals Ingmar Bergman’s emerging mature style.','/NZMjTeIHRimCPr5BQV34iKKWep.jpg','1949-10-17',85,'Released',NULL,'Thirst',51143,1.4988,6.347,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2478,_binary '\0','/rF35vILVjqI2ryfiiKkP8EQNvU8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042004',6.2,9092,'en','Under Capricorn','A British ex-convict in colonial Australia and his fragile wife, haunted by the past crime that binds them, struggle to rebuild their lives when a young newcomer stirs long-buried passions and secrets.','/90wKMRxhGFrWXt4rJvVfqVEjpQ1.jpg','1949-10-08',118,'Released','Mystery, murder and passion from the master of suspense!','Under Capricorn',4175,3.5006,6,'38WMD6EWjEM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2479,_binary '\0','/eGjHUHxGeSkjQpFhfiqWV57kkMR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042006',6.6,1978,'en','The Undercover Man','Frank Warren is a treasury agent assigned to put an end to the activities of a powerful mob crime boss. Frank works undercover, posing as a criminal to seek information, but is frustrated when all he finds are terrified witnesses and corrupt police officers.','/5l3CoMK953DUsvEaKPbHoGhJgXH.jpg','1949-03-21',85,'Released','TOLD WITH THE SNARL OF A MACHINE GUN!','The Undercover Man',23189,2.2244,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2480,_binary '\0','/uNlvJvY5VoiUMNfzg5dZHGKYYhe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042033',6.5,1297,'en','The Walking Hills','A study in greed in which treasure hunters seek a shipment of gold buried in Death Valley.','/yYWOAhLk4TyAyImgXbXQMbkDVaI.jpg','1949-03-05',78,'Released','10 WENT IN...7 CAME OUT...as the Walking Hills guarded their treasure!','The Walking Hills',241754,1.9683,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2481,_binary '\0','/j8UWcwQeLocoUiSYcb8o6Y3icca.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042035',6.6,1583,'en','We Were Strangers','China Valdes joins the Cuban underground after her brother is killed by the chief of the secret police, Ariete. She meets and falls in love with American expatriate Tony Fenner. Tony develops a plan to tunnel under the city\'s cemetery to a plot owned by a high official, assassinate him, and blow up the whole Cuban hierarchy at the ensuing state funeral. Together with a band of dedicated revolutionaries, they begin digging.','/6dyjFLrxNESNqD61Zu3DgBhv6IN.jpg','1949-04-27',106,'Released','An explosive story of violent lives...lived dangerously!','We Were Strangers',50117,2.4009,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2482,_binary '\0','/ucBEXGJDqQAGc8d6hmMsbrJbzlM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042039',6.7,5346,'en','Whirlpool','The wife of a psychoanalyst falls prey to a devious quack hypnotist when he discovers she is an habitual shoplifter. Then one of his previous patients now being treated by the real doctor is found murdered, with her still at the scene, and suspicion points only one way.','/swwFPsZxjYMyQPkcqDrQs6yQ7Aq.jpg','1950-01-13',98,'Released','Tomorrow she will know what she did tonight!!','Whirlpool',29106,2.9269,6.413,'huqyli8aE_g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2483,_binary '\0','/y1siOoSCQ4oLBo05F3STFia7tVb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042040',7.1,7442,'en','Whisky Galore!','Scottish islanders try to plunder 50,000 cases of whisky from a stranded ship.','/4qz5Oc3hgXx4eBx7vkqLfG58J9X.jpg','1949-06-16',82,'Released',NULL,'Whisky Galore!',16665,1.8885,6.8,'THriYNnq7iQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2484,_binary '\0','/cap8458wFeRCJSKxL758dI82TRK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042041',8.1,38982,'en','White Heat','A psychopathic criminal with a mother complex makes a daring break from prison and then leads his old gang in a chemical plant payroll heist. After the heist, events take a crazy turn.','/v7cPOHKKZI9qChi7HDUxNIhEcLR.jpg','1949-09-02',114,'Released','Pick up the pieces folks, Jimmy\'s in action again!','White Heat',15794,3.8281,7.645,'3bMtOABixrQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2485,_binary '\0','/7cVQJWjlyUw7Gl2h2walQGytmXg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042046',7.4,5510,'en','The Window','An imaginative boy who frequently makes things up witnesses a murder, but can\'t get his parents or the police to believe him. The only people taking him seriously are the killers - who live upstairs, know that he saw what they did, and are out to permanently silence him.','/pez60cVCRjy2os36iI4YXYWTrRT.jpg','1949-05-10',73,'Released','Through the Window He Saw it...but no one would believe him...no one except the Killers!','The Window',32684,2.1121,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2486,_binary '\0','/a0d2eJmB5Y6XvJ2SsaISu6yRA8F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042052',6.9,1740,'en','Woman in Hiding','As far as the rest of the world is concerned, mill heiress Deborah Chandler Clark is dead, killed in a freak auto accident. But Deborah is alive, if not too well. Having discovered a horrible truth about her new husband, Deborah is now a “woman in hiding,” living in mortal fear that someday her husband will catch up with her again. When a returning GI recognizes Deborah, however, she must decide whether or not she can trust him.','/5QDEOAZpqVnGZ0kvha3lwIQp4J1.jpg','1950-01-06',92,'Released','Hounded for money ... pursued for love ... hunted by a KILLER.','Woman in Hiding',61149,1.6493,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2487,_binary '\0','/MuQwGvUHoPbdhw6eqPisd11L1A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042053',6,2263,'en','A Woman\'s Secret','A popular singer, Marian Washburn, suddenly and unexplainably loses her voice, causing a shake-up at the club where she works. Her worried but loyal piano player, Luke Jordan, helps to promote a new, younger singer, Susan Caldwell, to temporarily replace Marian. Susan finds some early acclaim but decides to leave the club after a few performances. Soon after Susan quits, she is gunned down, and Marian quickly becomes a suspect.','/1BEccn00r1oExZxyzys7tayWDFN.jpg','1949-01-13',84,'Released','I had to stop her ... at any cost ... that\'s why I pulled the trigger !','A Woman\'s Secret',84364,2.4088,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2488,_binary '\0','/vo811W1vuRP2Qe00Y3MrLxanZ2I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042176',6.8,2642,'en','711 Ocean Drive','A telephone repairman in Los Angeles uses his knowledge of electronics to help a bookie set up a betting operation. After the bookie is murdered, the greedy technician takes over his business. He ruthlessly climbs his way to the top of the local crime syndicate, but then gangsters from a big East Coast mob show up wanting a piece of his action.','/nRTfhyRPFW2f3RPi8PgjQE9t3Pt.jpg','1950-07-01',102,'Released','Expose of the $8,000,000,000 gambling syndicate and its hoodlum empire!','711 Ocean Drive',37087,1.4323,6.4,'aXg71Ggfwuo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2489,_binary '\0','/xqHmaQRcENlXelUax12CdwSlGad.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042179',6.3,3297,'en','Bud Abbott and Lou Costello in the Foreign Legion','Jonesy and Lou are in Algeria looking for a wrestler they are promoting. Sergeant Axmann tricks them into joining the Foreign Legion, after which they discover Axmann\'s collaboration with the nasty Sheik Hamud El Khalid.','/5UiAkJV2YTtPsIs29G0W8MPkXbB.jpg','1950-08-05',80,'Released','Their NEWEST and FUNNIEST by far!','Bud Abbott and Lou Costello in the Foreign Legion',33474,2.1257,6.1,'G440NKfJcVE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2490,_binary '\0','/zAL3LOswagN9onjN8DPcNFTqKuD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042192',8.2,150587,'en','All About Eve','From the moment she glimpses her idol at the stage door, Eve Harrington is determined to take the reins of power away from the great actress Margo Channing. Eve maneuvers her way into Margo\'s Broadway role, becomes a sensation and even causes turmoil in the lives of Margo\'s director boyfriend, her playwright and his wife. Only the cynical drama critic sees through Eve, admiring her audacity and perfect pattern of deceit.','/blBzZaatPWVuWpXEnPscMA4Xp6m.jpg','1950-11-09',139,'Released','It\'s all about women... and their men!','All About Eve',705,7.8082,8.1,'MILphnfj2mo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2491,_binary '\0','/1n5JLtkXaA2gSAgYGwqe52lIECV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042195',6,1485,'en','American Guerrilla in the Philippines','American soldiers stranded in the Philippines after the Japanese invasion form guerrilla bands to fight back. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with Twentieth Century Fox Film Corporation in 2001.','/765vfp2mKDY4ZdU99lapFTnwi5y.jpg','1950-11-08',105,'Released','One of the great adventures to come out of the Pacific!','American Guerrilla in the Philippines',74512,2.223,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2492,_binary '\0','/tih6Bfzh08zaZ8MCZdfv2G2Fm6f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042200',6.8,5777,'en','Annie Get Your Gun','Gunslinger Annie Oakley romances fellow sharpshooter Frank Butler as they travel with Buffalo Bill\'s Wild West Show.','/c2ZLeqZVI2FYctcrFwm5C86zkLH.jpg','1950-05-17',107,'Released','Biggest musical under the sun!','Annie Get Your Gun',25209,2.8784,6.7,'E8RgYpW6eBA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2493,_binary '\0','/ZV98BXRcmNef2ypusfrJi5cm5R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042206',7,3657,'en','Armored Car Robbery','While executing an armored car heist in Los Angeles, icy crook Dave Purvis shoots policeman Lt. Phillips before he and his cronies make off with the loot. Thinking he got away scot-free, Purvis collects his money-crazy mistress, Yvonne, then disposes of his partners and heads out of town. What Purvis doesn\'t know is that Phillips\' partner, tough-as-nails Lt. Cordell, is wise to the criminal\'s plans and is closing in on his prey.','/1cYOPFbHEEXcXq8VYlJI5h2QpIe.jpg','1950-06-08',67,'Released','The stick-up that stunned the nation!','Armored Car Robbery',22924,2.0337,6.541,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2494,_binary '\0','/pDGkMdMHkl1qRAYmQjdLKVx3euQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042208',7.8,33395,'en','The Asphalt Jungle','Recently paroled from prison, legendary burglar \"Doc\" Riedenschneider, with funding from Alonzo Emmerich, a crooked lawyer, gathers a small group of veteran criminals together in the Midwest for a big jewel heist.','/8xsUnT0P2fJWQv9jGDhs3i9Zx2l.jpg','1950-05-12',113,'Released','The City Under the City','The Asphalt Jungle',16958,4.9698,7.502,'tiH8mOrCNSI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2495,_binary '\0','/h5GoZPqorCVBQd2kbkBogQ9CL2l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042209',5.5,2919,'en','At War with the Army','Two former nightclub partners are now enlisted in the Army. Sergeant Puccinelli ranks above his former partner, Private First Class Korwin. Puccinelli is desperately trying to get transferred from his dull job to active duty overseas. Meanwhile, all Korwin wants is a pass to see his wife and new baby.','/viLzurxFrHbosBtTGf0gkPKa9qx.jpg','1950-12-31',93,'Released','America\'s Funniest Guys are G.I.s!','At War with the Army',23325,2.1747,5.3,'yVkqU7qZBmM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2496,_binary '\0','/qaYIuRbwgBDgjgkYN7aTxAefnnU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042210',5.5,2442,'fr','Atoll K','Stan and Ollie are marooned on an island in the south pacific ocean.','/86XVqC144ERq5AVxmSmYhF9bmRw.jpg','1951-10-17',82,'Released','An Island Paradise... Or At Least It Used To Be','Robinson Crusoeland',70106,1.5312,5.6,'tm3MWgmmzHk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2497,_binary '\0','/gZhl46i9BlLg6dQkKLFGCuD573p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042219',6.5,2073,'en','Backfire','When he\'s discharged from a military hospital, ex-GI Bob Corey goes on a search for his army buddy Steve Connolly. A reformed crook, Connolly is on the lam from a trumped-up murder rap, and Corey hopes to clear his pal. Tagging along is Army nurse Julie Benson, who has fallen for Corey.','/2qPDrYCedMnhiuXNedlzAYd2pRK.jpg','1950-01-26',91,'Released','That \"White Heat\" girl turns it on again!..','Backfire',32929,1.9669,5.894,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2498,_binary '\0','/t43qVBaBxlflPU5CrH3T4mABa0j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042229',6.9,2778,'en','The Baron of Arizona','The U.S. government recognizes land grants made when the West was under Spanish rule. This inspires James Reavis to forge a chain of historical evidence that makes a foundling girl the Baroness of Arizona. Reavis marries the girl and presses his claim to the entire Arizona territory.','/gzieDFqLaZ6Xc1UyToJrom0XlTd.jpg','1950-03-04',97,'Released','The lustiest adventure a man ever lived!','The Baron of Arizona',37329,2.0413,6.7,'4JdwXDrpvEU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2499,_binary '\0','/fk3qkMghffpNYfuUKf2Vjk46k2I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042235',7.3,2065,'fr','La Beauté du diable','Henri Faust, retiring after 50 years as a professor in a circa-1700 French university, despairs at the ravages of old age ... whereupon Mephistopheles, agent of Lucifer, appears as a virile, handsome young man and exchanges bodies with him to induce Faust to sign a pact to exchange his soul for renewed youth, riches and power. But though the \"new\" Faust is attracted by the material improvements in his life, he remains wary of signing, while Mephistopheles, now posing as the aged professor whose body he inhabits, must find a way to trick him into signing the pact - and dissuade him from the love of a gypsy girl who prays for his soul - or find himself damned by his own Master...','/amyT9hugNHyGbmFFPUgDWKB3zZe.jpg','1950-03-16',96,'Released','Rene Clair - whose genius has created masterpieces...now brings his magic touch to the screen in a new achievement!','The Beauty of the Devil',58513,1.7976,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2500,_binary '\0','/xvJnfNtfTLksbt7yT8mDbpX2cjz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042242',6.6,1515,'en','Between Midnight and Dawn','Rocky and Dan, war buddies, are prowl car cops on night duty. Dan is a cynic who views all lawbreakers as scum; Rocky feels more lenient. Both are attracted to the radio voice of communicator Kate Mallory; but in person, Kate proves reluctant to get involved with men who just might stop a bullet. By lucky chance, Rocky and Dan cause big trouble for murderous racketeer Ritchie Garris; but when he swears vengeance, Kate\'s fears may prove justified.','/yjFByhrqLY8jGfiVe0pq84ebRnT.jpg','1950-10-01',89,'Released','THE STORY OF PROWL CAR 13...BASED ON THE POLICE FILES OF A GREAT CITY!','Between Midnight and Dawn',61501,2.0974,5.726,'fC9bYz14PeU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2501,_binary '\0','/kllV9RgCPrMhfMnXREZqlhM3Byl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042249',6.4,1960,'en','The Big Lift','The Berlin Air Lift from the point of view of two Air Force NCOs who navigate romance in a bombed out post WW2 Germany.','/uXgOBEOblFofs5cNs6OTw3PunKC.jpg','1950-04-26',120,'Released','From the Ruins came Hope and Despair','The Big Lift',37468,1.7728,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2502,_binary '\0','/wJnoicAYh2ZD4JZWIXvZLB0LKvq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042250',6.8,1345,'en','Highway 301','The \"Tri-State\" gang goes on a successful bank robbing streak causing local authorities to turn up the heat on the daring career criminals.','/qgkhQ2LWEXdPZoiXFUrypkpyooK.jpg','1950-12-01',83,'Released','The whole blazing story of the Tri-State murder mob!','Highway 301',29477,1.631,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2503,_binary '\0','/61guSpi1y7GlN6oQDyfrMjhT6Yy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042256',6.2,2763,'en','The Black Rose','In the 13th century, Walter of Gurnie, a disinherited Saxon youth, is forced to flee England. With his friend, Tristram, he falls in with the army of the fierce but avuncular General Bayan, and journeys all the way to China, where both men become involved in intrigues in the court of Kublai Khan.','/g8038EuXcIIT10TCj6H3iDSf6xJ.jpg','1950-09-01',116,'Released','An adventure that will blaze... A love that will flame... \'till the stars grow cold...','The Black Rose',44398,1.9087,6.5,'4ixpmjtTHfk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2504,_binary '\0','/8w0ChLDvXaGSXr6ujMBoCI8u9d8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042265',6.8,2991,'en','The Blue Lamp','P.C. George Dixon is a long-serving traditional copper who is due to retire shortly. He takes a new recruit under his aegis and introduces him to the easy-going night beat. Dixon is a classic ordinary hero but also anachronistic, unprepared and unable to answer the violence of the 1950s.','/t8ekJGjiFaPNIvANSgN46oVmbmw.jpg','1950-01-19',84,'Released','Sheds just enough light for MURDER','The Blue Lamp',54392,2.1037,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2505,_binary '\0','/6580GWK6mayTelaYrfq5QqUAvSo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042274',6.1,1888,'en','Borderline','The Los Angeles police know that Pete Ritchie has been bringing drugs into the city, but they can\'t pin a single piece of evidence on him. After many botched attempts to get at the crook, they resort to having cop Madeleine go undercover and seduce her way into Ritchie\'s circle. Before she can get anywhere, she\'s abducted by Johnny, a government agent posing as a thug. But Johnny and Madeleine have no idea they\'re on the same side of the law.','/6f7Lgj6qfGEehEWZmb3YXr8rkqi.jpg','1950-03-01',88,'Released','Two Undercover Agents Unwittingly Stalk the Same Target.','Borderline',46531,1.5517,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2506,_binary '\0','/1BhSy8nDRavKGxh4iNgjsDXL58x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042275',6.6,3309,'en','Born to Be Bad','Christabel Caine has the face of angel and the heart of a swamp rat. She\'ll step on anyone to get what she wants, including her own family. A master of manipulation, she covertly breaks off the engagement of her trusting cousin, Donna, to her fabulously wealthy beau, Curtis Carey. Once married to Curtis herself, Christabel continues her affair with novelist Nick Bradley, who knows she\'s evil, but loves her anyway.','/tGpviqO04uPH3WUo1MjbWtOsdaH.jpg','1950-09-21',94,'Released','Women hated her...but men DESIRED her!','Born to Be Bad',43385,2.7775,6,'F95Qtgb-_J8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2507,_binary '\0','/hX8pUUpUes6lwt4yN857eZRfNef.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042276',7.5,13752,'en','Born Yesterday','Uncouth, loud-mouth junkyard tycoon Harry Brock descends upon Washington D.C. to buy himself a congressman or two, bringing with him his mistress, ex-showgirl Billie Dawn.','/hPiQUhnkgp2O9bQz9KhSyOjLvGl.jpg','1950-12-26',103,'Released','It\'s Here AT LAST!','Born Yesterday',24481,2.8393,7.3,'QL3NsTHAQ8s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2508,_binary '\0','/vd80mHDkPvFKEWrQlpAQYpZuqPk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042281',7.5,5327,'en','The Breaking Point','A fisherman with money problems hires out his boat to transport criminals.','/gmScaZfpgF9KkZ7TKFo0Fn4d7Yy.jpg','1950-10-06',97,'Released','A guy who had nothing to sell but guts!','The Breaking Point',37954,2.0671,7.048,'sfSb8z0KyzM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2509,_binary '\0','/o4m8u90LyJrFCC4ZEHQ4zbTVeCD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042285',6.7,1755,'en','Bright Leaf','Two tobacco growers battle for control of the cigarette market.','/3zNlVaHbobs4sfo0xK77R15oJJ.jpg','1950-06-16',110,'Released','He had to fight for everything he owned ... except this woman\'s lips !','Bright Leaf',83116,2.1872,6,'nmpcpp7PM-4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2510,_binary '\0','/yEP3KF4YBOn4CMO5kc5aQWuqLmi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042286',7.1,10929,'en','Broken Arrow','Indian scout Tom Jeffords is sent out to stem the war between the American settlers and Apaches in the late 1870s Arizona. He learns that the Indians kill only to protect themselves, or out of retaliation for white atrocities.','/n061xgOTAvJ2l06latNDF4s13FV.jpg','1950-07-21',93,'Released','The most powerful weapon is courage...','Broken Arrow',37292,7.6251,6.7,'qdYOfdwB_iM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2511,_binary '\0','/oUQm9dtU0vQsOLPbeVBolqGV1ie.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042296',7.6,5697,'en','Caged','A single mistake puts a 19-year old girl behind bars, where she experiences the terrors and torments of women in prison.','/vvGyjfwGOQkB91XbzLJHmItiBIl.jpg','1950-05-19',96,'Released','The Story of a Women\'s Prison today','Caged',29381,2.4051,7.1,'yzJ2S2_S4T0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2512,_binary '\0','/hW4CN7YrJzHagmkSQXTog7vjV5t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042324',6,1792,'en','Chain Lightning','Former World War II flying ace Matt Brennan takes a position as a test pilot for a commercial aircraft corporation and bumps into his old girlfriend, Jo Holloway, who now works as a receptionist for the company.','/cHDc6XE2CZmZ0b1KAP22NPF7Qeh.jpg','1950-02-18',94,'Released','There\'s a new Bogart thrill in the sky!','Chain Lightning',87621,2.8009,6.4,'LORgsjJvTKA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2513,_binary '\0','/1MtJBnEXfBPRjXEku15o0oft8rk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042325',7.3,1467,'en','Champagne for Caesar','When jobless genius Beauregard Bottomley interviews with Burnbridge Waters for a position at Waters\' soap company, the owner rudely turns Bottomley down. As revenge, Bottomley enters a TV quiz show that Waters\' company sponsors, with the goal of winning until he bankrupts the businessman. When Bottomley keeps acing the questions, becoming a media sensation, Waters desperately calls on vixen Flame O\'Neal to uncover Bottomley\'s area of weakness.','/jVigwtKTVb9YnoZ4yi3Je5vx88y.jpg','1950-05-11',99,'Released','...the bubbliest, frothiest, tickliest comedy!','Champagne for Caesar',41084,2.0234,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2514,_binary '\0','/tWr9NT2I76ZtKY804rx7SkDux9R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042327',7,6124,'en','Cheaper by the Dozen','\"Cheaper by the Dozen\", based on the real-life story of the Gilbreth family, follows them from Providence, Rhode Island, to Montclair, New Jersey, and details the amusing anecdotes found in large families.','/sGj9auC0z18y25NObFbvWLt8gtX.jpg','1950-03-31',85,'Released','He\'s the New Father of His Country!','Cheaper by the Dozen',33839,3.59,6.4,'Pyh4UZ0Dw7I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2515,_binary '\0','/puJKgNcWaGgMk5VHanSSomUTpmw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042332',7.3,189411,'en','Cinderella','Cinderella has faith her dreams of a better life will come true. With help from her loyal mice friends and a wave of her Fairy Godmother\'s wand, Cinderella\'s rags are magically turned into a glorious gown and off she goes to the Royal Ball. But when the clock strikes midnight, the spell is broken, leaving a single glass slipper... the only key to the ultimate fairy-tale ending!','/4nssBcQUBadCTBjrAkX46mVEKts.jpg','1950-02-22',74,'Released','The greatest love story ever told.','Cinderella',11224,16.2594,7.053,'0XIKCbF80W4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2516,_binary '\0','/s6SB6DUj975mWyDwj5eN8743OnL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042338',6,1346,'en','Colt .45','Gun salesman Steve Farrell gets two of his new Colt .45 pistols stolen from him by ruthless killer Jason Brett but vows to recover them.','/fOpZdojtGjyz0zbedKKZCb5elHw.jpg','1950-05-27',74,'Released','The gun that became the law of the land !','Colt .45',55472,2.0164,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2517,_binary '\0','/5kwhDhhflE7KqJ3e3p2IncayWnP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042343',6.8,1768,'en','Convicted','A prison warden fights to prove one of his inmates was wrongly convicted.','/lKSB2IJDifvE9AC2OOmxY7gJqWI.jpg','1950-08-01',91,'Released','Academy Winning Star of \"ALL THE KING\'S MEN\"','Convicted',35920,1.5221,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2518,_binary '\0','/61bzxoJvGTgyBUGVAQSGylBEEcv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042352',6.7,2108,'en','Crisis','An American doctor gets caught in the middle of a revolution when he\'s forced to operate on a South American dictator.','/qpP3JwkvaBAJIreGruRx0WaLCFG.jpg','1950-07-07',96,'Released','Carefree Cary Grant on a gay holiday with his lovely bride walks right into DANGER!','Crisis',52364,1.7399,6.6,'3mYeMCcxroM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2519,_binary '\0','/uXrT52LrlpLHrh3Alcy29BqtKRC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042355',7.1,3907,'it','Cronaca di un amore','A wealthy, possessive husband\'s investigation reignites his young wife\'s past love, leading them to plot against him. As obstacles fall away, their passion faces a new test.','/9afrreOCHzCPF0Zft7ptWVbk3xr.jpg','1950-11-03',98,'Released',NULL,'Story of a Love Affair',49781,2.0094,6.7,'R5xWSEX3gno','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2520,_binary '\0','/sI0ISjxKLbRZwaY5mjUI8SdJeME.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042367',7.4,5065,'en','Cyrano de Bergerac','France, 1640. Cyrano, the charismatic swordsman-poet with the absurd nose, hopelessly loves the beauteous Roxane; she, in turn, confesses to Cyrano her love for the handsome but tongue-tied Christian. The chivalrous Cyrano sets up with Christian an innocent deception, with tragic results.','/l4JFOXslwb90opz8xozfIhPke8z.jpg','1950-11-16',113,'Released','The Most Loved of All Love Stories!','Cyrano de Bergerac',43386,2.8088,6.856,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2521,_binary '\0','/rsl2YCe2bSeni2qGdaMoDBS7sLo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042369',7.2,14335,'en','D.O.A.','Frank Bigelow is about to die, and he knows it. The accountant has been poisoned and has only 24 hours before the lethal concoction kills him. Determined to find out who his murderer is, Frank, with the help of his assistant and girlfriend, Paula, begins to trace back over his last steps. As he frantically tries to unravel the mystery behind his own impending demise, his sleuthing leads him to a group of crooked businessmen and another murder.','/m7wZXWOt9XQKJT8r9pbAFo7jB46.jpg','1949-12-23',83,'Released','A Picture As Excitingly Different As Its Title!','D.O.A.',18995,2.8146,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2522,_binary '\0','/8BUghVCt0RrGXofdrikZHuySgXA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042372',6.2,1761,'en','Dallas','After the Civil War, Confederate soldier Blayde Hollister travels to Dallas to avenge the savage murder of his family. Discovering his enemy is now an esteemed citizen, Hollister plots to expose the outlaw and his syndicate.','/szVFvCur0ZMpvu2wSICtZKxHmMq.jpg','1950-12-30',94,'Released','THE FURY OF VIOLENCE AND VENGEANCE ECHOES ACROSS THE TEXAS PLAINS!','Dallas',113921,2.7749,6.4,'FAovEnNIQ_4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2523,_binary '\0','/oMkHp9ExIqtCWEAxWFt543iJs1W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042376',7.1,4341,'en','The Damned Don\'t Cry','Fed up with her small-town marriage, a woman goes after the big time and gets mixed up with the mob.','/7kIZMJuGDEag4QWSlY1v8jQIDdQ.jpg','1950-05-13',103,'Released','Warner Bros.\' Flaming Stars of \'Flamingo Road\' Meet in Scarlet Shadows Again!','The Damned Don\'t Cry',36656,2.3238,7,'m13O9Toi27U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2524,_binary '\0','/zdiuruiGNzPnKfEMpIojbBZxr0E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042379',6.7,3064,'en','Dark City','War hero Danny Haley fleeces out-of-town dupes in a rigged poker game. He and his pals see Arthur Winant as an easy mark, but they\'ve reckoned without Winant\'s homicidal brother, who wants revenge after Arthur commits suicide.','/7mkj8Vv5lpndZnjdHNBdIV4fhoh.jpg','1950-10-17',98,'Released','A tense, tough drama of underworld violence and revenge !','Dark City',36331,2.2979,6.5,'fee_G-Z4duo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2525,_binary '\0','/3RKBbSG68HdAeXmVa3h9G7nBMbh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042393',6.3,5277,'en','Destination Moon','A team composed of an aerospace scientist, an ex-Air Force general, and an industrialist conceives an ambitious plan to land Americans on the moon. From their base in the Mojave Desert, they construct and successfully launch a spacecraft named \"Luna\" that contains a cargo of four astronauts. But a critical miscalculation of needed power to escape the moon\'s gravitational pull may put the astronauts\' lives in danger.','/2dsJUooqTX5BkOmkfnuuFlkmbB6.jpg','1950-06-27',91,'Released','Two years in the making!','Destination Moon',25392,1.6336,5.9,'Fk0vNz_OkaM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2526,_binary '\0','/1f4GWcCsz77aic9n708cN49O5YI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042395',7.2,2304,'en','Devil\'s Doorway','A Native American Civil War hero returns home to fight for his people.','/v10XONu2NJ6MyGMMOJKgp2GJYEd.jpg','1950-08-18',84,'Released','M.G.M. presents a Great Drama of Flaming Frontiers !','Devil\'s Doorway',34651,1.9208,6.9,'MT6EeW-qSHs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2527,_binary '\0','/s6vPi3wQEBfcqoJ5CzFnkTjujUx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042397',6.8,1733,'en','Dial 1119','A deranged killer escapes from a mental institution. Intent on locating the psychiatrist whose testimony sent him to the asylum, he holds the patrons of a bar hostage.','/zKNX4dxps6uXltOcCHKd2KGgQ19.jpg','1950-11-03',75,'Released','When you see this man... Dial 1119!','Dial 1119',35957,1.3718,5.5,'moxfOSSCXm0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2528,_binary '\0','/vBYjLO02lrK6P6ns4lpZJrginET.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042436',6.9,4613,'fr','Les Enfants terribles','Elisabeth and her brother Paul live isolated from much of the world after Paul is injured in a snowball fight. As a coping mechanism, the two conjure up a hermetic dream of their own making. Their relationship, however, isn\'t exactly wholesome. Jealousy and a malevolent undercurrent intrude on their fantasy when Elisabeth invites the strange Agathe to stay with them -- and Paul is immediately attracted to her.','/yxcc8CfOn6M2HSGbjaDkAKb0QNQ.jpg','1950-03-29',107,'Released','A love story by Jean Cocteau','The Strange Ones',15390,1.2817,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2529,_binary '\0','/6287CLSbEORwkZdJ1r4Q6e2EwVU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042447',6.4,1665,'en','Fancy Pants','An American actor, impersonating an English butler, is hired by a rich woman from New Mexico to refine her husband and headstrong daughter. The complications increase when the town believes the actor/butler to be an earl and President Roosevelt decides to pay a visit.','/zGdQJlatFeexcPU82UTSnnq9jns.jpg','1950-07-19',92,'Released','Bob tames that \"Wildcat\" Gal!','Fancy Pants',55441,1.8611,5.8,'L3raoV2QG-Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2530,_binary '\0','/t6cQzpKwJCl3rreU7BPSWFLXjNg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042451',7.1,13692,'en','Father of the Bride','Proud father Stanley Banks remembers the day his daughter, Kay, got married. Starting when she announces her engagement through to the wedding itself, we learn of all the surprises and disasters along the way.','/sygyqqXq41SBZiYjY8nuQRAcuUv.jpg','1950-05-18',92,'Released','You\'re invited... to a hilarious wedding!','Father of the Bride',20758,4.0608,7,'7EMQgVqta_M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2531,_binary '\0','/ad11JK3REitAW2sFAInX6R8zSMw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042464',6.8,4728,'en','The Flame and the Arrow','Dardo, a Robin Hood-like figure, and his loyal followers use a Roman ruin in Medieval Lombardy as their headquarters as they conduct an insurgency against their Hessian conquerors.','/30edZxvbt7W8p8y5OsMX9XSWSwK.jpg','1950-07-07',88,'Released','All the adventure a man can live, he lives.','The Flame and the Arrow',32563,2.7217,6.3,'dTXnQawQzOk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2532,_binary '\0','/4vo4MEYhyFxXL3JsYCxE4V8SQ4c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042466',7.5,1641,'sv','Flicka och Hyacinter','A young woman dies by suicide and leaves all her belongings to her next-door neighbour, who becomes determined to investigate her reasons for taking her life.','/y2Ck0na94toFJPKAMgFfICdTOJ5.jpg','1950-03-06',89,'Released',NULL,'Girl with Hyacinths',81981,1.5861,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2533,_binary '\0','/nkDRQOvrJSkVEo0LSY7RQpCTqSS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042477',7.3,4563,'it','Francesco, giullare di Dio','In a series of simple and joyous vignettes, director Roberto Rossellini and co-writer Federico Fellini lovingly convey the universal teachings of the People’s Saint: humility, compassion, faith, and sacrifice. Gorgeously photographed to evoke the medieval paintings of Saint Francis’s time, and cast with monks from the Nocera Inferiore Monastery, The Flowers of St. Francis is a timeless and moving portrait of the search for spiritual enlightenment.','/4db6zjmJK4D5gEzQ0V5JTkRo0X5.jpg','1950-12-15',87,'Released','A Movie for Today... And All Time','The Flowers of St. Francis',56518,2.1301,7.1,'pzDn8BVUGZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2534,_binary '\0','/zfchTpxqcZdcsxKUPlAdrtQbIGc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042488',6.6,1274,'en','The Fuller Brush Girl','A daffy door-to-door saleswoman blunders into a murder investigation.','/lPPTTcFbjKgXPwos0UmVYruxgUQ.jpg','1950-09-15',85,'Released','A BRAND NEW LINE OF LAFFS!','The Fuller Brush Girl',94831,1.7905,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2535,_binary '\0','/6kuekBQNtmT6tbQXmchsbb6GShd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042490',7.2,4411,'en','The Furies','A New Mexico cattle man and his strong-willed daughter clash over land and love.','/kVlgoW4LWj8Uxr5fXuFi6qhpzP0.jpg','1950-07-22',109,'Released',NULL,'The Furies',28304,2.4567,7.1,'YFOI5m7g5L0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2536,_binary '\0','/yLlxvMhiYLCPzyu28lVce2nDiD3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042509',7,1391,'en','The Glass Menagerie','An aging Southern Belle complicates life for her ambitious son and crippled daughter because of her own warped views of what life should be.','/mBqa5vGXo8ipOfUauJ1Wtx3j7y0.jpg','1950-09-28',107,'Released','Her first Gentleman caller...!','The Glass Menagerie',68443,1.4256,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2537,_binary '\0','/mO5lCwtKbOci6zBFbGkod3CsVAc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042513',6.9,1735,'en','Gone to Earth','Hazel Woods, a beautiful and young Welsh girl, lives a wild, rustic life and loves animals — in particular, her pet fox. She is hotly desired by Jack Reddin, a fox hunting squire who vies for her affection and pursues her, despite the purer amorous intentions of the local pastor.','/xj3rKQuB3cfc4Px1JnHAL9maxno.jpg','1950-11-06',111,'Released','Lost... lost in a love she was helpless to resist!','Gone to Earth',79401,2.2188,6.237,'YXtmLKlcSkE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2538,_binary '\0','/iugTLuTZoKZuD8B1joOpxXegsee.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042524',6.4,1901,'en','The Great Rupert','Shortly before Christmas, a family moves into an apartment where Rupert the squirrel lives in the attic rafters. Just as it seems that the holiday will come and go without so much as a Christmas tree, Rupert acts as the family\'s guardian angel - not only saving Christmas, but changing their lives forever.','/aJGIPdcB8JddD3gpCTEIN9j6K1O.jpg','1950-03-01',88,'Released','Christmas miracles do happen','The Great Rupert',50926,1.7674,5.7,'C0f33Lj1SvY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2539,_binary '\0','/6zkiVqimS2HQY4IYQ5x48LaWNYA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042529',6.2,1421,'en','Guilty Bystander','A drunken ex-cop gets a shot at redemption when his young son is kidnapped after a smuggling deal goes belly up.','/2YKtb9Umc788aLJyfnHgJQ3kOOm.jpg','1950-04-20',91,'Released','How innocent can a bystander be?','Guilty Bystander',37485,1.0354,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2540,_binary '\0','/eR9S6iMbk4ycV7DcqvVxFp8lNFV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042530',7.6,16829,'en','Gun Crazy','Bart Tare, an ex-Army man who has a lifelong fixation with guns, meets a kindred spirit in sharpshooter Annie Starr and goes to work at a carnival alongside her. After upsetting the carnival owner who lusts after Starr, they both get fired. Soon, at Starr\'s behest, the couple embarks on a crime spree for cash.','/kC1IIitCJTZLwZyuQnKw4zaOaXc.jpg','1950-01-20',87,'Released','Thrill Crazy... Kill Crazy... Gun Crazy','Gun Crazy',18671,3.1952,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2541,_binary '\0','/8alkXDam8EUF6gvVyfowvZJ795T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042531',7.7,14593,'en','The Gunfighter','The fastest gun in the West tries to escape his reputation.','/5696EpyH0tB8DtKvwNGABMRWknX.jpg','1950-05-26',85,'Released','His only friend was his gun... His only refuge - a woman\'s heart!','The Gunfighter',17409,3.4086,7.4,'yFqQAK6l6QE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2542,_binary '\0','/3CLfWXxudqvhB2gq4nh8EeAUXwI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042539',6.6,3230,'en','Halls of Montezuma','Richard Widmark leads an all star cast of marine leathernecks including Jack Palance, Robert Wagner, Karl Malden, Richard Boone and Jack Webb into battle on a heavily fortified island. This action-packed story follows the squad as they pick their way through enemy-infested jungles on a time sensitive mission to find the source of the enemy rockets. As the mission progresses, the squad and leader overcome many challenges as they are transformed into an effective and efficient fighting unit.','/nXAolbmS7iYXnyk1mgiqv73gjIw.jpg','1951-01-04',113,'Released','The everlasting story of the everlasting glory of the UNITED STATES MARINES!','Halls of Montezuma',38766,2.3735,5.955,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2543,_binary '\0','/ce6sljM5YvNgNA5cqPSrRAAxDRy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042541',7.2,2144,'en','The Happiest Days of Your Life','Nutbourne College, an old established, all-boys, boarding school is told that another school is to be billeted with due to wartime restrictions. The shock is that it\'s an all-girls school that has been sent. The two head teachers are soon battling for the upper hand with each other and the Ministry. But a crisis (or two) forces them to work together.','/pdFz4p3ShCdWitN9Jv429VqdZVi.jpg','1950-03-08',81,'Released',NULL,'The Happiest Days of Your Life',83015,1.9574,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2544,_binary '\0','/Ae6qKWmBRRSld1LGvH6l7oIIarY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042544',7.3,3040,'en','Harriet Craig','A perfectionist woman\'s devotion to her home drives away friends and family.','/zrwq0en5FxedV2scMS7i9teDKVt.jpg','1950-11-02',90,'Released','What Was Harriet Craig\'s Lie?','Harriet Craig',85293,1.257,7.5,'k48aA8wls38','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2545,_binary '\0','/Ah7uiN6ws2QcBZhLdDfkiSJIX35.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042546',7.9,61382,'en','Harvey','The story of Elwood P. Dowd who makes friends with a spirit taking the form of a human-sized rabbit named Harvey that only he sees (and a few privileged others on occasion also.) After his sister tries to commit him to a mental institution, a comedy of errors ensues. Elwood and Harvey become the catalysts for a family mending its wounds and for romance blossoming in unexpected places.','/dgd82hYmpiXDM1G867HqNaWe8wj.jpg','1950-12-04',104,'Released','The Wonderful Pulitzer Prize Play … becomes one of the Great Motion Pictures of our Time!','Harvey',11787,3.5717,7.7,'0iEwoJj3X58','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2546,_binary '\0','/yQDWlXBCECuRASzegi3LfPx8riX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042579',7,5254,'en','House by the River','Wealthy writer Stephen Byrne tries to seduce the family maid, but when she resists, he kills her. Long jealous of his brother John, Stephen does his best to pin the blame for the murder on his sibling. Also affected by Stephen\'s arrogant dementia is his long-suffering wife Marjorie.','/a3p8tk8rCvMD7Hp2kUXkXrY59vP.jpg','1950-03-23',88,'Released','WOMEN SPOKE OF HER with Scorn...MEN THOUGHT OF HER with Longing!','House by the River',30014,2.5725,6.795,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2547,_binary '\0','/5fuZzGsUZtF9esFFBHPwysB6b6a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042593',7.9,39824,'en','In a Lonely Place','A violent screenwriter and a female neighbor fall in love after she clears him of murder, but she begins to have second thoughts.','/vbdgtwzLOpE6MppZlyYChMagvQq.jpg','1950-05-17',93,'Released','The Bogart suspense picture with the surprise finish!','In a Lonely Place',17057,5.3357,7.6,'68C2IFX60CU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2548,_binary '\0','/lsYyd0hx4DZrHAANKmyH6ZTRK2X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042609',6.4,1610,'en','The Jackie Robinson Story','Biography of Jackie Robinson, the first black major league baseball player in the 20th century. Traces his career in the negro leagues and the major leagues.','/cx13WcbLX3dU7Lo6ZcVwygQpdtO.jpg','1950-05-16',77,'Released','You\'ll HIT With Him! You\'ll RUN With Him! You\'ll SLIDE With Him!','The Jackie Robinson Story',43392,1.8152,6.3,'fDCyjoPq9Cw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2549,_binary '\0','/uMC1ZUAPx2URcirlUyzyirQuBwj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042610',6.6,1516,'en','The Jackpot','Bill Lawrence wins a bevy of prizes from a radio program, but ends up having to sell them in order to pay the taxes incurred.','/4Gsw3T73hYtoduoQEKla8EHKBzE.jpg','1950-11-01',85,'Released','He had a wife, two kids, a home of his own, a job with a future and then POOR JIMMY WON THE $24,000 RADIO JACKPOT!','The Jackpot',111732,1.3892,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2550,_binary '\0','/luytZGyalDVIBy2jDk51EKV45T8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042619',7.7,13820,'fr','Journal d\'un curé de campagne','An inexperienced, sickly priest shows up in the rural French community of Ambricourt, where he joins the community\'s clergy. But the locals don\'t take kindly to the priest, and his ascetic ways and unsociable demeanor make him an outcast. During Bible studies at the nearby girls school, he is continually mocked by his students. Then his attempt to intervene in a family feud backfires into a scandal. His failures, compounded with his declining health, begin to erode his faith.','/mft7ZJqHxUyFaLL3ZYXX1MN2Gro.jpg','1951-02-07',115,'Released','A priest of humble origin, lost in the maze of worldiness','Diary of a Country Priest',43376,2.7696,7.5,'hXLcNxG0OtM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2551,_binary '\0','/4h21Ud5T4IvmZ92L3JYRnlMcomf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042629',6.1,1536,'en','Kansas Raiders','Outraged by Redleg atrocities, the James and Younger Brothers along with Kit Dalton join Quantrill\'s Raiders and find themselves participating in even worse war crimes.','/2Jl1X3GUBgYXHmxBw1ROeDD4a7R.jpg','1950-11-15',80,'Released','THE FURIOUS, FIGHTING STORY OF QUANTRILL\'S GUERILLAS!','Kansas Raiders',97421,1.7584,6,'Yic3V6qz2Xg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2552,_binary '\0','/hPUZpZHOSo0Nn5IVahiAzI81woi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042643',6.4,2209,'en','The Killer That Stalked New York','In New York, Sheila Bennet and her spouse, Matt Krane, are trying to unload a trove of rare jewels they smuggled into America from Cuba, but the police are hot on the couple\'s trail. Meanwhile, government officials begin a desperate search for an unknown individual who is infecting the city with smallpox.','/3JD63sXu6WxWlpDBZRgbQxTGifc.jpg','1950-10-06',79,'Released','One Woman Brings Terror to 8,000,000 People!','The Killer That Stalked New York',32205,1.8481,6.2,'uw6F9O9FGco','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2553,_binary '\0','/ipBWlJhDEROgBYSmdW2IkPj613M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042644',6.5,2398,'en','Kim','During the British Raj, the orphan of a British soldier poses as a Hindu and is torn between his loyalty to a Buddhist mystic and aiding the English secret service.','/naUTqET84gVJcn0e1AnA3eL05t1.jpg','1950-12-07',113,'Released','Famed Spectacular Adventure Story Filmed Against Authentic Backgrounds in Mystic India The Greatest Spy Thriller of Them All!','Kim',110465,1.6801,6.5,'nR5qoOSkfAQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2554,_binary '\0','/mZOrVI6HyFLpVVxAj6brA3LDEw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042646',6.7,7949,'en','King Solomon\'s Mines','Fortune hunter Allan Quatermain teams up with a resourceful woman to help her find her missing husband lost in the wilds of 1900s Africa while being pursued by hostile tribes and a rival German explorer.','/s5T4Da7d3f255YRyaWfhMWfoBKK.jpg','1950-11-09',103,'Released','Lovers trapped in animal stampede!','King Solomon\'s Mines',43388,3.1305,6.5,'tmXgC7k-QB0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2555,_binary '\0','/qSdPDMj7qhxZOhSK4MEki6veQ4s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042648',7.1,2903,'en','Kiss Tomorrow Goodbye','Ralph Cotter, a ruthless criminal, escapes violently from a farm prison. Then, he seduces a dead inmate’s sister, gets back quickly into the crime business, faces corrupt local cops who run the city’s underworld and meets a powerful tycoon’s whimsical daughter.','/g5kLnnT7prY9WNPvedHMuh9QsIt.jpg','1950-08-19',103,'Released','Unarmed… He’s dangerous. Armed… He’s lethal.','Kiss Tomorrow Goodbye',18262,2.2351,6.837,'I1EVMx-p-_g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2556,_binary '\0','/hqHqRxP2fBnIPFK7TfnmjEHyxmZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042650',7.9,3043,'no','Kon-Tiki','\"Kon-Tiki\" was the name of a wooden raft used by six Scandinavian scientists, led by Thor Heyerdahl, to make a 101-day journey from South America to the Polynesian Islands. The purpose of the expedition was to prove Heyerdal\'s theory that the Polynesian Islands were populated from the east- specifically Peru- rather than from the west (Asia) as had been the theory for hundreds of years. Heyerdahl made a study of the winds and tides in the Pacific, and by simulating conditions as closely as possible to those he theorized the Peruvians encountered, set out on the voyage.','/oGdy7EkyQ9LCpuLptEII5kwjB5r.jpg','1950-01-13',58,'Released','The Amazing Adventure Of Six Men On A Raft Across The Pacific! True! Thrilling!','Kon-Tiki',20088,1.2165,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2557,_binary '\0','/6e5FrrOapD9bIT8bLX1OttDtpUs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042664',6.1,1261,'en','A Lady Without Passport','An undercover U.S. Immigration agent falls in love with an immigrant attempting to enter the United States through Havana, Cuba in an illegal smuggling ring.','/wJfzpAglQhQLtUICju4A2cRmK77.jpg','1950-08-03',74,'Released','How long can she remain','A Lady Without Passport',30195,2.0123,5.3,'S9ydcidDTu0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2558,_binary '\0','/sqAcErm6aEYNRRh6zLHsAwwZmEE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042665',7.3,2424,'en','Last Holiday','George Bird is a salesman of agricultural machinery who finds out that he hasn\'t long to live. On his doctor\'s advice, he goes to an exclusive seaside resort to spend his savings on one last holiday.','/2rUFvSmkPvMMIhf02uFOfH1TDDA.jpg','1950-05-15',88,'Released','Guinness...The Great Lover!','Last Holiday',16939,1.8017,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2559,_binary '\0','/e82Q0Iuz3YTv7a7A5eCovdRk6DR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042677',6.3,1567,'en','A Life of Her Own','A young woman from Kansas moves to New York City, becomes highly successful at a prestigious modeling agency, and falls in love with a married man.','/msKQceHxcDhCUT88WHa4ajkd7w4.jpg','1950-09-01',108,'Released','Lana...as Lily James...a girl who knew what she wanted...and almost got it!','A Life of Her Own',176734,2.2932,5.2,'LVSS57Wp3P4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2560,_binary '\0','/k6ksC8bISMCB8dSAc6Pt0g1Cs4u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042692',7.1,4404,'it','Luci del varietà','In Italy, Checco Dal Monte manages a troupe of traveling performers with plenty of heart but minimal talent. At a small town engagement, he encounters the starry-eyed, gorgeous Lily Antonelli, and hires her as a dancer on the show. Vivacious Lily quickly sells out crowds and earns the resentment of Checco\'s mistress, Melina Amour, but the fledgling performer has far bigger ambitions and soon sets her sights on a higher-profile role.','/YIjVHxmNetC15MrRPu97OYdIOW.jpg','1950-12-06',93,'Released',NULL,'Variety Lights',43389,1.9461,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2561,_binary '\0','/vvqprQnRk954ztiidiz3EPBflpu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042700',6.9,2446,'en','Madeleine','Madeleine\'s middle-class family cannot understand why she puts off marrying a respectable young man, as they know nothing about her long-term affair with a Frenchman.','/nQsThlhGuWUn8h3vpdbK3Kr4qGM.jpg','1950-02-16',115,'Released','Here are the virile, violent facts that caused the most famous jury verdict in history...','Madeleine',46995,1.3528,6.8,'vZBYGTT7IKM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2562,_binary '\0','/w0w3wqNo9HqPKtH1OEhHoQt6six.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042707',6.8,3353,'en','The Man Who Cheated Himself','A veteran homicide detective who has witnessed his socialite girlfriend kill her husband sees his inexperienced brother assigned to the case.','/jJKWfhHjDaFGSNvRnXx0Xxehhls.jpg','1950-12-26',81,'Released','...the unpredictable way of a man\'s love for an evil woman!','The Man Who Cheated Himself',38751,2.1217,6.152,'hxcLsOJFjUQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2563,_binary '\0','/e9tL9KczncUBdl4Yd56DnhzJMr7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042727',7.1,5661,'en','The Men','Ken, a WWII GI, returns home after he\'s paralyzed in battle. Residing in the paraplegic ward of a veteran\'s hospital and embittered by his condition, he refuses to see his fiancée and sinks into a solitary world of hatred and hostility. Head physician, Dr. Brock cajoles the withdrawn Ken into the life of the ward, where fellow patients Norm, Leo and Angel begin to pull him out of his spiritual dilemma.','/88hG50Z7EMxKdsKOBc5o2yOpPB5.jpg','1950-08-25',85,'Released','A completely new experience between men and women!','The Men',1882,2.1905,7,'JVA_I-xB4PM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2564,_binary '\0','/drVlJhT4bRFX30Ttm52ONnr4lFL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042742',7,2327,'en','Mister 880','The Skipper is a charming old man loved by all his neighbors. What they don\'t know is that he is also Mr. 880, an amateurish counterfeiter who has amazingly managed to elude the Secret Service for 20 years.','/aEYs8GpSqpssqPWaIS9XXOBeY8o.jpg','1950-09-29',90,'Released','It\'s the picture everybody is cheering !','Mister 880',102144,2.0371,7.2,'3Xk2oPkKuAI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2565,_binary '\0','/3dBvV5rS2ddhl4gLnz015ETtc6N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042744',6.2,1515,'en','Montana','An Australian sheep man comes to Montana looking for grazing space, is opposed by local ranchers and a wealthy cattle-woman.','/pLEql6TNUiKPYtYrOaUqO95M9sP.jpg','1950-01-28',76,'Released','Their bullets riveted a new star to the flag!','Montana',121707,1.9482,5.6,'CAbCaNlWR5c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2566,_binary '\0','/pCPYL0j4lqrmSF8e92n2zlaAyMI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042762',7.4,1509,'ja','宗方姉妹','Setsuko is in an unhappy marriage to Mimura, an unemployed, alcoholic engineer. She had always been in love with Hiroshi but both failed to propose when Hiroshi left for France a few years ago. But now he\'s back and Mariko tries to reunite them, although she too is secretly in love with Hiroshi.','/aIIQYqZDeRhqcTyH2BmcZVP7XBZ.jpg','1950-08-25',112,'Released',NULL,'The Munekata Sisters',55198,1.7548,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2567,_binary '\0','/5CeF4wVNCC9Yn9c5DH0VioYty2R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042771',7.2,4224,'en','Mystery Street','When a young woman\'s skeletal remains turn up on a Massachusetts beach, Barnstable cop Peter Moralas teams with Boston police and uses forensics, with the help of a Harvard professor, to determine the woman\'s identity, how she died, and who killed her.','/dxabjdOtyugFdT4E9s3AI4ISjqf.jpg','1950-06-23',93,'Released','MYSTERY STREET will thrill you!','Mystery Street',19170,2.2941,6.8,'nUTB3-2axL4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2568,_binary '\0','/pxpEuujvHVnhAK16QGai41nEjAx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042782',6.3,1456,'en','The Nevadan','A mysterious stranger crosses paths with an outlaw bank robber and a greedy rancher.','/d7JFVv4bUkLu2vQoLpvh1lU3r6E.jpg','1950-01-11',81,'Released',NULL,'The Nevadan',46367,1.6627,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2569,_binary '\0','/15mrnCjsVRJafPhdsRKvmbhu3S0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042788',7.8,16845,'en','Night and the City','Londoner Harry Fabian is a second-rate con man looking for an angle. After years of putting up with Harry\'s schemes, his girlfriend, Mary, becomes fed up when he taps her for yet another loan.','/2NBmzm8z5fd283eWeECkPrkwta8.jpg','1950-06-15',95,'Released','The inside story of London after dark.','Night and the City',19119,4.5047,7.5,'-y6sueICajY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2570,_binary '\0','/3Tqpr0WaCe5piWxmCqAEGQELI7z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042792',7.4,7049,'en','No Way Out','Two hoodlum brothers are brought into hospital for gunshot wounds, and when one dies, the other accuses their Black doctor of murder.','/plRDHhcTwS6Z7ohWP39zgPRm7oX.jpg','1950-08-16',106,'Released','Is it a question... or an answer?','No Way Out',28433,2.5269,6.941,'IbkGJDZMFFs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2571,_binary '\0','/5jewDz5RxdarX45djYc8kjGa5Ia.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042804',8.2,23946,'es','Los olvidados','A group of juvenile delinquents live a violent life in the infamous slums of Mexico City; among them Pedro, whose morality is gradually corrupted and destroyed by the others.','/cDCvmYoyqFg4CuSMtGMvCpfOIEw.jpg','1950-12-09',82,'Released',NULL,'The Young and the Damned',800,4.3981,8.054,'HBDgOrB76Rk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2572,_binary '\0','/6R4WYIn7SWUnNSmGW9ZFyvfjNhT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042824',6.7,2261,'en','Outrage','A young woman who has just become engaged has her life completely shattered when she is raped while on her way home from work.','/2zGupaPiJBU3iR9WgY1kMpYalY2.jpg','1950-09-27',75,'Released','Is any girl safe?','Outrage',73492,1.6405,6.5,'9uBiCnEhtoA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2573,_binary '\0','/4Od8hhDwKRzMdKcdi1nJz2p7HWw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042832',7.2,9619,'en','Panic in the Streets','A medical examiner discovers that an innocent shooting victim in a robbery died of bubonic plague. With only 48 hours to find the killer, who is now a ticking time bomb threatening the entire city, a grisly manhunt through the seamy underworld of the New Orleans Waterfront is underway.','/79jfETdOonIFL8UEjBxptPS27yo.jpg','1950-07-27',96,'Released','THE SCREEN\'S GREATEST EXCITEMENT OF THE YEAR!','Panic in the Streets',32078,2.8189,6.883,'gk1r0TO-US8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2574,_binary '\0','/w9ali1hQaTpIJyvmzaDsT5njZzp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042851',7.1,1498,'en','Pool of London','Jewel thieves, murder, and a manhunt swirl around a sailor off a cargo ship in post-war London.','/7ayHSHo84IdTeLtCQop6F8yOald.jpg','1951-02-20',85,'Released','A drama of the river underworld','Pool of London',27917,1.4606,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2575,_binary '\0','/k2xBKsOIlqpSvbn5Tc6381v1krq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042869',6.6,3024,'en','Quicksand','Young auto mechanic Dan Brady takes $20 from a cash register at work to go on a date with blonde femme fatale Vera Novak. Brady intends to put the money back before it is missed, but the garage\'s bookkeeper shows up earlier than scheduled. As Brady scrambles to cover evidence of his petty theft, he fast finds himself drawn into an ever worsening \"quicksand\" of crime.','/rTtFvxrHpLECgLE86zStkHYxTyx.jpg','1950-03-24',79,'Released','A guy who yields to temptation just once...... ....and finds it\'s once too often!','Quicksand',23342,1.1899,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2576,_binary '\0','/tDn1dA52bQH9B85vilHeU7C83W1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042876',8.1,198727,'ja','羅生門','Four people recount different versions of the story of a man\'s murder and the rape of his wife.','/ijWibsAU1iBcCD8tuIZfTmDzMVE.jpg','1950-08-26',88,'Released','The husband, the wife… or the bandit?','Rashomon',548,8.7095,8,'L2E_DfExUmU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2577,_binary '\0','/bcZUdS133kwngC8CXJHD6sRAHDt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042895',7,19621,'en','Rio Grande','Lt. Col. Kirby Yorke is posted on the Texas frontier to defend settlers against depredations of marauding Apaches. Col. Yorke is under considerable stress by a serious shortage of troops of his command. Tension is added when Yorke\'s son (whom he hasn\'t seen in fifteen years), Trooper Jeff Yorke, is one of 18 recruits sent to the regiment.','/zYoK2RkBCmyhIV6UUb6EZLqxmZq.jpg','1950-11-15',105,'Released','John Ford\'s Most Powerful Drama. The Breathtaking Saga of the United States Cavalry! The third installment of John Ford\'s trilogy...','Rio Grande',11617,4.1009,6.8,'d8ngyY96grQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2578,_binary '\0','/a2jTsapIuYQ18Kjwp1sxjIpCCZE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042897',4.9,2793,'en','Rocketship X-M','Astronauts blast off to explore the moon on Rocketship X-M or \"Rocketship eXploration Moon\". A spacecraft malfunction and some fuel miscalculations cause them to end up landing on Mars. On Mars, evidence of a once powerful civilization is found. The scientists determine that an atomic war destroyed most of the Martians. Those that survived reverted to a caveman like existence.','/kEODdwwJBEROPYpFUPWHSAm1ZTJ.jpg','1950-06-02',77,'Released','The screen\'s first story of man\'s conquest of space!','Rocketship X-M',37744,2.0283,4.9,'tG9RD1lje_s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2579,_binary '\0','/f2iThMKDrTVh2Rk6zu6pi9tF4pL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042898',7.2,1582,'en','The Rocking Horse Winner','A strange and tragic tale of a young boy who is able to predict race winners at the horse track by riding his own rocking horse to aid his parents out of their endless round of debts.','/orGyd5eUmjGwvjggTgmKK2bi9NR.jpg','1949-11-30',91,'Released','Exciting As Your Wildest Dreams!','The Rocking Horse Winner',43438,1.5893,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2580,_binary '\0','/fekqfvlTqeiPXJwbMoQgbTrjBVC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042899',6.7,1498,'en','Rocky Mountain','A Confederate troop, led by Captain Lafe Barstow, is prowling the far ranges of California and Nevada in a last desperate attempt to build up an army in the West for the faltering Confederacy. Because the patrol saves a stagecoach, with Johanna Carterr as one of the passengers, from an Indian attack, and is marooned on a rocky mountain, it fails in its mission but the honor of the Old South is upheld.','/fxo5QdEFPr6feRs5Pt0EXH5m1qp.jpg','1950-11-11',83,'Released','Gun-violence echoes across the Dangerland of the West!','Rocky Mountain',48897,1.5682,5.8,'BLfZl82Qk9E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2581,_binary '\0','/2zOnLOEn9AsK2bT0pkf1QeJWZon.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042906',7.4,6575,'fr','La Ronde','An all-knowing interlocutor guides us through a series of affairs in Vienna, 1900. A soldier meets an eager young lady of the evening. Later he has an affair with a young lady, who becomes a maid and does similarly with the young man of the house. The young man seduces a married woman. On and on, spinning on the gay carousel of life.','/jMcF0XAD66n1abW1ZZhtrD0AsKN.jpg','1950-09-27',95,'Released',NULL,'La Ronde',50030,1.7374,7.26,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2582,_binary '\0','/h59BJ2rPAqH3vfmdTtdEdMNpX7t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042935',6.6,1439,'en','The Secret Fury','The wedding of Ellen and David is halted by a stranger who insists that the bride is already married to someone else. Though the flabbergasted Ellen denies the charge, the interloper produces enough evidence that his accusation must be investigated. Ellen and David travel to the small coastal town where her first wedding allegedly occurred. There, they meet a number of individuals whose stories make Ellen question her own sanity.','/wS7c3XQEeZdiFAK7ew5XkNdQRP2.jpg','1950-02-21',85,'Released','The Stranger at her wedding was a messenger of Fear and Evil!','The Secret Fury',74437,1.7198,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2583,_binary '\0','/2Y6cQJRD0NuMjfSDFg697KfqtU5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042949',7,2558,'en','Seven Days to Noon','When Professor Willingdon becomes wary of the nuclear weapons he is helping build, he steals a warhead and threatens to detonate it in London in seven days unless the government begins nuclear disarmament. As Willingdon goes into hiding, Detective Folland of Scotland Yard sets out to find him. Willingdon\'s daughter Ann also joins the cause, hoping she can talk sense into her father before he causes a catastrophe.','/aDvEMfWqgCzMMBwKp1J2GashTga.jpg','1950-10-30',94,'Released','A Boulting Bros. Thriller With a Difference!','Seven Days to Noon',46932,2.0187,6.8,'Vp5IhXCPHEw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2584,_binary '\0','/mVDPZymNgFpy2iUV4gV4Lm9o0m5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042952',6.7,1688,'en','Shadow on the Wall','Angered that her sister Celia has stolen her fiance, Dell Faring kills her and allows Celia\'s husband David, knocked out in an argument with Celia, to take the blame and end up on death row. Later Dell, finding out that David\'s young daughter Susan was witness to the crime and is undergoing psychiatric treatment, plans to eliminate her before her memory returns.','/qzySAC336zcypJzWjQ7TWi62Ayr.jpg','1950-05-19',84,'Released','Some women will stop at nothing!','Shadow on the Wall',25548,2.1637,6.7,'KtOq5KNylD8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2585,_binary '\0','/l9gUT9ViOUYeIkZnBRp4Usbo0IZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042958',7.2,5333,'ja','醜聞','A celebrity photograph sparks a court case as a tabloid magazine spins a scandalous yarn over a painter and a famous singer.','/nIpDB30mVA37o7ezno4vaiYpJ88.jpg','1950-04-26',104,'Released',NULL,'Scandal',32690,2.1621,6.874,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2586,_binary '\0','/3w2htkaUjP6snAJOExXK8t6Gnr5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042960',7.1,3916,'en','Side Street','A struggling young father-to-be gives in to temptation and impulsively steals an envelope of money from the office of a corrupt attorney. Instead of a few hundred dollars, it contains $30,000. When he decides to return the money, things go wrong - and that is only the beginning of his troubles.','/yt3VdPaLWhfgwsCMMW4DIVlgzdd.jpg','1950-03-23',83,'Released','Where temptation lurks!','Side Street',18281,1.5637,6.5,'zR7gRki-XKM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2587,_binary '\0','/us42UnfrGxda01azLK5fKqidcKh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042963',6.4,1267,'en','Sierra','Ring Hassard and his father Jeff, wild horse breakers, live in a hidden mountain eyrie as Jeff is wanted for a murder he didn\'t commit. Things change when they take in a lost young lady, Riley Martin, who finds that Ring has \"never seen a woman close up.\" Jeff is injured, Ring runs afoul of horse thieves and the law, and Riley (who is a lawyer) labors to clear the Hassards (who others would prefer dead).','/akxybiTgk4qH5Ccp8l5PxxAQdaq.jpg','1950-05-26',83,'Released','Adventure ... raging to the very peaks of Excitement !','Sierra',126900,1.7944,5.4,'hTnUIGufuX8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2588,_binary '\0','/vA3sViuWspSoON6xh4zEEqiKFzo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042980',7.1,2929,'en','So Long at the Fair','Vicky Barton and her brother Johnny travel from Naples to visit the 1889 Paris Exhibition. They both sleep in seperate rooms in their hotel. When the she gets up in the morning she finds her brother and his room have disappeared and no one will even acknowledge that he was ever there. Now Vicky must find out what exactly happened to her brother.','/z4UYl84foEkIXXdG6v4849XUzO.jpg','1950-05-31',81,'Released','Paris ! ... city of love and intrigue ... scene of the most fascinating mystery ever filmed !','So Long at the Fair',67411,2.5733,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2589,_binary '\0','/sUZfWQ8zlZx0OwOTmorDgttzIia.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042994',7,17934,'en','Stage Fright','A struggling actress tries to help a friend prove his innocence when he\'s accused of murdering the husband of a high-society entertainer.','/l43OTqhib8do1WwXig8JI8Y68Fd.jpg','1950-02-23',110,'Released','Love held its breath as sudden terror held the stage!','Stage Fright',1978,4.8804,6.82,'oRvWOz1-ekY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2590,_binary '\0','/7pfVsefOe8m3VZifxVM58YU5Du5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0042998',7.4,2862,'en','Stars in My Crown','An orphaned man recalls his upbringing with his aunt and her husband, the parson, in a small Western town during the Reconstruction.','/nKE6dBnB5W4AosuCrwILhnSDmUc.jpg','1950-05-11',90,'Released','\"Take Your Choice...Either I Speak...Or My Pistols Do!\"','Stars in My Crown',111390,2.3329,7.069,'L-J8OHUB7dI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2591,_binary '\0','/hgViSp8G2HbMpXJ85XaT6QJHHcD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043012',7.1,5321,'en','Summer Stock','To Jane Falbury\'s New England farm comes a troup of actors to put up a show, invited by Jane\'s sister. At first reluctant she has them do farm chores in exchange for food. Her reluctance becomes attraction when she falls in love with the director, Joe, who happens to be her sister\'s fiance.','/akCdZrlDIoIRXbL8rZOoHFxSkWY.jpg','1950-08-31',108,'Released','MGM brings on the show with music - dancing - Technicolor','Summer Stock',43390,3.0793,6.7,'8r0kUdQrgYs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2592,_binary '\0','/p47ihFj4A7EpBjmPHdTj4ipyq1S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043014',8.4,263797,'en','Sunset Boulevard','A hack screenwriter writes a screenplay for a former silent film star who has faded into Hollywood obscurity.','/zt8aQ6ksqK6p1AopC5zVTDS9pKT.jpg','1950-08-10',110,'Released','A Hollywood Story: Sensational...Daring...Unforgettable...Sunset Blvd','Sunset Boulevard',599,12.4208,8.273,'ZQWqIA1-kvA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2593,_binary '\0','/atNiMTTg211WNG5Jv7S2Fs23j0h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043018',7.2,2497,'es','Susana','The story of a girl of questionable mental stability who escapes from incarceration and ends up at a plantation where she disrupts a working family\'s daily routines and chemistry.','/k5tA8DuisnLPpkDZYUFKecCjlHR.jpg','1951-04-11',86,'Released','The Devil and The Flesh','Susana',44655,2.1709,6.8,'b3aPdGKS8ko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2594,_binary '\0','/mcED725KmwYXNbTlMpMtj5cOdwf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043027',6.1,1347,'en','The Tattooed Stranger','Detectives investigate the Central Park murder of a young woman with a Marine Corps tattoo.','/khkK56q2rTZ5rKEwMD0weO1Y02J.jpg','1950-02-09',64,'Released','TWO MEN LOVED THIS MURDERED WOMEN ...That\'s All The Police Know','The Tattooed Stranger',59165,1.225,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2595,_binary '\0','/xTd8BAI7mefCyzHYQiK1TYEcqqq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043030',6.5,2389,'en','Tea for Two','In this reworking of \"No, No, Nanette,\" wealthy heiress Nanette Carter bets her uncle $25,000 that she can say \"no\" to everything for 48 hours. If she wins, she can invest the money in a Broadway show featuring songs written by her beau, and of course, in which she will star. Trouble is, she doesn\'t realize her uncle\'s been wiped out by the Stock Market crash.','/8qeQo1oSoA2C2uBq1av910MHHjC.jpg','1950-09-01',98,'Released','A story that\'s a joy to be told! They hitch their lovin\' to a song and take everyone along for the ride!','Tea for Two',33117,1.4968,6.1,'iTbkZCWszyU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2596,_binary '\0','/6SJvlYWpfQXmYgH53ifyNOK1Gmt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043041',7.3,2440,'en','Three Came Home','Borneo, 1941, during World War II. When the Japanese occupy the island, American writer Agnes Newton Keith is separated from her husband and imprisoned with her son in a prison camp run by the enigmatic Colonel Suga.','/hZczNjqrzjYiyuzhuKyPEcDwul2.jpg','1950-02-20',106,'Released','The true story of one woman\'s personal experience!','Three Came Home',96255,1.4948,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2597,_binary '\0','/yAB8GQBHhZv8bTTzguqWrNOIog6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043044',6.9,2298,'en','Three Little Words','Song-and-dance man Bert Kalmar can\'t continue his stage career after an injury, so he has to earn his money as a lyricist. By chance, he meets composer Harry Ruby and their first song is a hit. Ruby gets Kalmar to marry his former partner Jessie Brown, and Kalmar and Jessie prevent Ruby from getting married to the wrong girls. But due to the fact that Ruby has caused a backer\'s withdrawal for a Kalmar play, they end their professional relationship.','/7O9keBF6bcKKAAD05LqT382z837.jpg','1950-07-12',102,'Released','A wonderful musical!','Three Little Words',42767,2.0964,6.3,'575QOTbujC0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2598,_binary '\0','/qv0joYzCyVZqo3au61TrWsxdhAf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043048',7.1,3848,'sv','Till glädje','A young orchestra violinist’s fear of mediocrity and drive for artistic success strain his marriage to a fellow musician. Told largely in flashback and shaped by Beethoven’s Ninth Symphony, the film examines ambition, love, and loss in early Ingmar Bergman.','/8xvao8GSizgjaMfGijuaWcgjuAs.jpg','1950-02-20',99,'Released',NULL,'To Joy',39284,1.5002,6.823,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2599,_binary '\0','/niPocyCFhwAvRdpgLuuMF0vVYN0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043052',6.2,1345,'en','To Please a Lady','Mike Brannon is a former war hero turned midget car racer. His ruthless racing tactics have made him successful but the fans consider him a villain and boo him mercilessly. Independent, beautiful reporter Regina Forbes tries to interview him but is put off by his gruff chauvinism, and when Brannon\'s daredevil tactics cause the death of a fellow driver, he finds himself a pariah in the sport thanks to her articles. When she finds him earning money as a barnstorming daredevil driver hoping for a comeback, they begin to become mutually attracted.','/aZ9uaQO3OVcFeLZ9n2pvKPU7MHX.jpg','1950-10-13',91,'Released','CLARK GABLE - BARBARA STANWYCK - HE\'S MISTER SPEED! SHE\'S MISS SPITFIRE!','To Please a Lady',168045,1.7853,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2600,_binary '\0','/uiLhtMHXek72SEfbztG05pTNcc0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043067',6.9,10972,'en','Treasure Island','Enchanted by the idea of locating treasure buried by Captain Flint, Squire Trelawney, Dr. Livesey and Jim Hawkins charter a sailing voyage to a Caribbean island. Unfortunately, a large number of Flint\'s old pirate crew are aboard the ship, including Long John Silver.','/zPzBsQZ2EhSmO9FLvQQtWVkJqRu.jpg','1950-07-19',96,'Released','PIRATE\'S PLUNDER a young cabin boy, a roguish buccaneer... match wits in a swashbuckling adventure!','Treasure Island',6646,4.9884,6.5,'ez7_3UviUMs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2601,_binary '\0','/h7rvGlS6h82SbvJyawofrbFUUv8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043075',7.2,2393,'en','The Sound of Fury','A family man – desperate for a job – latches onto a friend who encourages him into being a criminal.','/wNaVQXctttdfOHPmHIHWzxu80rM.jpg','1950-12-12',85,'Released','A blonde with ice cold nerves and deep warm curves !','The Sound of Fury',27543,1.9793,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2602,_binary '\0','/mqBCk5qzWXAZPIgFulNFqc0xbwn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043079',6.7,1357,'en','Two Flags West','A group of confedarate prisoners is sent to a unionist fort in the west to help the local garrison to fight the indians.','/334zxF6EMlrhqcvWkt9OrNdG8HL.jpg','1950-10-12',92,'Released','UNFURLS THE BANNER TO HIGH ADVENTURE!','Two Flags West',103119,2.234,6.2,'v3bURi2AiL0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2603,_binary '\0','/j2YZtEWjCzzXlxmM3Ku8DUWULlJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043088',6.9,1505,'en','The Underworld Story','A blacklisted reporter brings his shady ways to a small-town newspaper after being fired from a big city daily.','/7ElO0mVXiN2Yqjbid2mzC2IX1Ii.jpg','1950-07-26',91,'Released','Fighting Reporter Exposes Corruption','The Underworld Story',40858,1.3922,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2604,_binary '\0','/zmEkTUjYPkAgRNF0ndbMfGJVZkM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043090',6.8,3121,'en','Union Station','Police catch a break when suspected kidnappers are spotted on a train heading towards Union Station. Police, train station security and a witness try to piece together the crime and get back the blind daughter of a rich business man.','/oF9dN6RO2sgAQj1uANJR8ZOTS4T.jpg','1950-10-04',81,'Released','... where hundreds of thousands of people pass through every day... AND THIS DAY... ONE OF THEM WAS A DANGEROUS KILLER!','Union Station',43396,2.2064,6.5,'ocVvBYGi55o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2605,_binary '\0','/kdYgSgFCGhnW1YYHC9Oqzr9Vnwh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043117',7.1,6322,'en','Wagon Master','Two young horse traders guide a Mormon wagon train to the San Juan Valley and encounter rugged terrain, the cutthroat Clegg gang, hospitable Navajo, and moral challenges on the journey.','/6yVHAtXoSe2FOQP2fePuR6nnFLr.jpg','1950-04-22',86,'Released','John Ford\'s lusty successor to \"Fort Apache\" and \"She Wore a Yellow Ribbon\"','Wagon Master',37327,2.1087,6.676,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2606,_binary '\0','/xdcxPmOj7qQn0dDvYPK8kX9TSg5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043118',6.5,1582,'en','Walk Softly, Stranger','Fugitive Chris Hale starts over in a small Midwestern town in Ohio, where he befriends Elaine Corelli, a kind-hearted heiress left disabled after a skiing accident. As love blossoms, Hale vows to change his ways, but escaping his past may mean one last job.','/iWA8WTamFe1JYvlmIav0TRDI7Sw.jpg','1950-10-14',82,'Released','A strange lie! A strange love!','Walk Softly, Stranger',88075,1.4332,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2607,_binary '\0','/3UGCp2TMhHu3diaLtWuaSrHFSA9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043123',6.2,1641,'en','The West Point Story','A Broadway director helps the West Point cadets put on a show, aided by two lovely ladies and assorted complications.','/4VwiwooiP0EXRnrODZ70aynw6Rd.jpg','1950-11-25',107,'Released','A Song-Spangled Colors-Flying Salute to Uncle Sam\'s own cadets!','The West Point Story',52848,2.0857,5.8,'tg-FCfEFbO4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2608,_binary '\0','/oxTzpF9cfhsyWtLOEXEPHkdQR1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043131',6.7,3838,'en','Where Danger Lives','A young doctor falls in love with a disturbed young woman and apparently becomes involved in the death of her husband. They head for Mexico trying to outrun the law.','/yIWDATzqcIPGsOdKRGlOAbPFq3L.jpg','1950-11-16',82,'Released','Mitchum in Action!','Where Danger Lives',20153,2.0858,6.4,'h8DPzx_KUuU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2609,_binary '\0','/baa8BwCJblUiVRmCEyo6Sw7yyfS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043132',7.5,11279,'en','Where the Sidewalk Ends','A police detective\'s violent nature keeps him from being a good cop.','/27Q0i6ZjmRnjfvegksunixnLxuG.jpg','1950-07-07',95,'Released','Only a woman\'s heart could reach out for such a man!','Where the Sidewalk Ends',17221,3.229,7.19,'KLbFTJsDhkU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2610,_binary '\0','/f9dWvVRwJEcsK7PxCONRAl1DcZe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043137',7.6,23440,'en','Winchester \'73','Lin McAdam rides into town on the trail of Dutch Henry Brown, only to find himself in a shooting competition against him. McAdam wins the prize, a one-in-a-thousand Winchester rifle, but Dutch steals it and leaves town. McAdam follows, intent on settling his old quarrel, while the rifle keeps changing hands and touching a number of lives.','/rqRgjWqSmK9oI6duvigPmn49aVG.jpg','1950-07-06',92,'Released','The Gun That Won The West!','Winchester \'73',14551,3.8339,7.3,'eb7xOnMX1Qw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2611,_binary '\0','/4Ea1otcpxsCWcEGGAQTrWxI2Y1R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043140',6.8,1388,'en','The Woman in Question','Agnes \"Astra\" Huston, a fortune teller at a run-down fair, is found strangled in her bedroom. As the police question five suspects, their interactions with her are shown in flashbacks from their point of view.','/5Z7N3LMvSB4WOX4iFGUoHnN3BOp.jpg','1950-10-03',88,'Released','The suspense-tense surprise of the year!','The Woman in Question',27256,1.8727,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2612,_binary '\0','/4vRFZeIcstzgRKLdhwxpbjD2ZHC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043142',7.2,5776,'en','Woman on the Run','Frank Johnson, a sole witness to a gangland murder, goes into hiding and is trailed by Police Inspector Ferris, on the theory that Frank is trying to escape from possible retaliation. Frank\'s wife, Eleanor, suspects he is actually running away from their unsuccessful marriage. Aided by a newspaperman, Danny Leggett, Eleanor sets out to locate her husband. The killer is also looking for him, and keeps close tabs on Eleanor.','/6wp0FpyQvYVphtUSvANiCarawop.jpg','1950-11-10',77,'Released','As Startling as Your OWN Scream in the Night!','Woman on the Run',28663,2.9959,6.788,'3Uck_n3b7gc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2613,_binary '\0','/rmfUtvNc1CDBINoQC7f5aDl6Gqx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043147',6.9,1786,'en','The Wooden Horse','True story of three British POWs and their attempt to escape from Nazi Germany','/c0o7shDXIMZnB4uEcc2sVlkc6ZZ.jpg','1950-10-16',101,'Released','Charged with high voltage excitement !','The Wooden Horse',68309,1.3076,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2614,_binary '\0','/hRz7P1QUUHiLfckBhnmoejZxn73.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043153',7.2,4308,'en','Young Man with a Horn','Taken in by the musical world as a young orphan, Rick Martin grows up with a desire to play pure jazz instead of the commercial gigs he lands, whilst also coping with the problems caused by his tempestuous marriage to an aloof heiress.','/fCM4Guj2poyGcGC9yYIM8cXaIu6.jpg','1950-03-01',112,'Released','Put down your trumpet, jazzman. I\'m in the mood for love!','Young Man with a Horn',34623,3.0493,6.398,'bTHeo3wHKoY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2615,_binary '\0','/5pXhfTMklUEKVtDt6EIUKcEqtSx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043255',6.6,6781,'en','Bud Abbott and Lou Costello Meet the Invisible Man','As novice detectives, Bud and Lou come face to face with the Invisible Man.','/qNsAGXUy2j3pyCc72YntENPUdef.jpg','1951-03-14',83,'Released','It\'s all NEW and a RIOT too!','Bud Abbott and Lou Costello Meet the Invisible Man',33475,2.8633,6.311,'KSKBXW6vhAY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2616,_binary '\0','/a6jTLoGlmuHmze5ctop97mFiOde.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043262',6.2,2464,'en','Across the Wide Missouri','In the 1830\'s beaver trapper Flint Mitchell and other white men hunt and trap in the then unnamed territories of Montana and Idaho. Flint marries a Blackfoot woman as a way to gain entrance into her people\'s rich lands, but finds she means more to him than a ticket to good beaver habitat.','/5CaJjN9FKSujvnTzbyhDF6ZJVjp.jpg','1951-10-12',78,'Released','The action, the drama, the men, the women... who blasted their heroic way into a new empire!','Across the Wide Missouri',34269,2.4281,6.1,'UxHYq7HBy40','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2617,_binary '\0','/wCJP24CYlsx632qYknoJkMRmvP7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043265',7.7,88161,'en','The African Queen','At the start of the First World War, in the middle of Africa’s nowhere, a gin soaked riverboat captain is persuaded by a strong-willed missionary to go down river and face-off a German warship.','/2Ypg0KhQfFYWILelvHGtSHHR0dk.jpg','1952-01-07',105,'Released','The greatest adventure a man ever lived… with a woman!','The African Queen',488,5.9162,7.335,'HUKpm2bcIz8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2618,_binary '\0','/tyj0QztA0PkYo6XauifWjkx7UVi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043274',7.3,168770,'en','Alice in Wonderland','On a golden afternoon, wildly curious young Alice tumbles into the burrow and enters the merry, madcap world of Wonderland full of whimsical escapades.','/20cvfwfaFqNbe9Fc3VEHJuPRxmn.jpg','1951-08-09',75,'Released','A world of wonders in one great picture!','Alice in Wonderland',12092,16.5624,7.194,'JY2rHymtNvc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2619,_binary '\0','/utO9qIZZghb0NZQWnQoRISro0v3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043276',6.8,2618,'en','Along the Great Divide','US marshal Len Merrick saves Tim Keith from lynching at the hands of the Roden clan, and hopes to get him to Santa Loma for trial. Vindictive Ned Roden, whose son Ed was killed, still wants personal revenge, and Tim would like to escape before Ned catches up with him again. Can the marshal make it across the desert with Tim and his daughter? Even if he makes it, will justice be served?','/kj7QlTu82y8zj9IXBq1c943iAFm.jpg','1951-06-02',88,'Released','AN ADVENTURE THAT AVALANCHES FROM THE BULLET-PROOF ROOF OF THE ROCKIES TO THE FIERY DESERT FLOOR!','Along the Great Divide',43562,2.5603,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2620,_binary '\0','/hVvW015x8cD2X0KthGovw27EpF2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043278',7.1,39785,'en','An American in Paris','Jerry Mulligan is an exuberant American expatriate in Paris trying to make a reputation as a painter. His friend Adam is a struggling concert pianist who\'s a long time associate of a famous French singer, Henri Baurel. A lonely society woman, Milo Roberts, takes Jerry under her wing and supports him, but is interested in more than his art.','/lyDXkvG53ldz6Cf7dbjJl7TaoP5.jpg','1951-09-26',113,'Released','What a joy! It\'s M-G-M\'s Technicolor musical!','An American in Paris',2769,5.6907,6.999,'1XMXAleA1eQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2621,_binary '\0','/gwLukBMtEv2pRxqQcWpkVhWt90j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043286',7.2,3371,'en','Angels in the Outfield','The short-tempered manager of the Pittsburgh Pirates mends his ways in return for a little divine assistance.','/72vL5Z7v0Mq0AfFiU1iL6tMHTID.jpg','1951-10-19',99,'Released','The toughest guy you ever met... until an angel said \"Hello!\"','Angels in the Outfield',45588,3.5164,7,'7oiV5VAJ8VE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2622,_binary '\0','/7NrFWP7kRqTcqh3C90RADbnWCqU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043288',6.6,1712,'en','Anne of the Indies','After buccaneer captain Anne Providence spares Pierre LaRochelle and recruits him into her pirate crew, their growing attraction is tested when Captain Blackbeard reveals LaRochelle\'s true identity as a former French navy officer.','/qqqsaRNgEKfbmyPpCSwIYgcialS.jpg','1951-10-18',81,'Released','The storming, slashing, sweeping saga of history\'s fabulous pirate queen !','Anne of the Indies',69784,2.9939,6.375,'9dtbML25Pv8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2623,_binary '\0','/pV68OaT9SYt0UJpnMTnuSTAkrnu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043292',6.5,1689,'en','Appointment with Danger','Al Goddard, a detective who works for the United States Postal Inspection Service, is assigned to arrest two criminals who\'ve allegedly murdered a U.S. postal detective.','/hZOvwsG2KbwUROmiidyVbijdLJu.jpg','1950-04-07',89,'Released','ALAN LADD as the U.S. Mail\'s ace agent smashes the biggest mail robbery plan in history!','Appointment with Danger',25564,2.0094,5.7,'YaFoSuxLYG0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2624,_binary '\0','/2LTiAS1aSrKaStae98tsQ01eEgY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043299',6.5,1790,'en','As Young as You Feel','A 65-year-old printer hatches an elaborate scheme to avoid forced retirement.','/2XuI2PYIt3bUBVeiSwrGsIOBclU.jpg','1951-06-15',77,'Released','A THOUSAND CHEERS FOR THE NATION\'S HAPPY-AS-A-LARK FAMILY!','As Young as You Feel',45581,2.2201,6.4,'DsQgTOBcWNY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2625,_binary '\0','/4i3EQ7H9JszOWyVJ1MJuuHe4cFQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043303',7.2,1748,'fr','L\'Auberge rouge','A group of travelers, including a monk, stay in a lonely inn in the mountains. The host confesses the monk his habit of serving poisoned soup to the guests, to rob their possessions and to bury them in the backyard.','/sX2M4U549oYBUJTjwPtrlD1FfV0.jpg','1951-10-19',104,'Released',NULL,'The Red Inn',28190,1.8573,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2626,_binary '\0','/2MWe3NWuwF91Aidc5gm5vNKeteS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043306',7.8,4999,'hi','आवारा','A petty thief is put on trial for the attempted murder of a lawyer. Through a series of flashbacks, the intertwining lives of the thief, the lawyer, and the thief\'s defense lawyer are illustrated.','/njaaQO1JZRtypogw5IPLtTlOSLI.jpg','1951-12-14',168,'Released','The Vagabond','Awaara',39039,2.0544,7.162,'3YqLOKB10x8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2627,_binary '\0','/2U4bERBTIEVXLFfEJBV7KxCLNg1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043313',8,10884,'ja','麦秋','In postwar Tokyo, Noriko lives with her extended family. Although she enjoys her career and her social life, her more traditional family worries about her single marital status at the advanced age of 28. 40-year-old business associate Takako proposes, Noriko\'s family press her into accepting, but when her widowed childhood friend Kenkichi returns to the neighborhood, she finds her heart leading in another direction.','/qVJsIMOYT7pNEldMttuATep6mtB.jpg','1951-10-03',125,'Released',NULL,'Early Summer',50247,2.2169,7.849,'SsVEqDRcH2U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2628,_binary '\0','/iMB1LloZTz1pY8IKvSZd6Caeybe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043325',5.5,1224,'en','Bedtime for Bonzo','College prof Peter Boyd tries to salvage his professional and personal reputation by using a lab chimp to prove that environment trumps heredity in behavioral development.','/6fyCX61AY0MsNwMZ0dz5IOquvcK.jpg','1951-04-05',83,'Released','The funniest new idea on film since \"FRANCIS!\"','Bedtime for Bonzo',43371,1.6629,6.2,'is2ITtEGN-E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2629,_binary '\0','/c9WbbEdmIAmq9NYYZG2uoEAH8sH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043332',7.7,6155,'it','Bellissima','Film director Blasetti is looking for a little girl for his new movie. Along with other mothers, Maddelena takes her daughter to Cinecittà, hoping she’ll be selected and become a star. She is ready to sacrifice anything for little Maria.','/Ao5l92i1QPYq3Na98cffLInFsGB.jpg','1952-01-04',115,'Released',NULL,'Bellissima',43372,1.8972,7.8,'HOSDp1BJF8I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2630,_binary '\0','/bG8EGUNGvZ6vNcBKlXa8Xkoe3kS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043338',8,43056,'en','Ace in the Hole','An arrogant reporter exploits a story about a man trapped in a cave to revitalize his career.','/gPVPzHEsJBX02HtBtIQgYnfeqNQ.jpg','1951-06-29',112,'Released','Rough, tough Chuck Tatum, who battered his way to the top... trampling everything in his path - men, women and morals !','Ace in the Hole',25364,5.012,7.851,'AX8GLtyWpOY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2631,_binary '\0','/wvq0jyrg1QB9fWq3158yjoVAYQY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043340',6.3,1330,'en','The Big Night','A young man zigzags through the sordid vortex of downtown Los Angeles while seeking vengeance on the man that beat his father.','/oOn0C6aJdpMUiJTgNmk7s0beH95.jpg','1951-12-07',75,'Released','Love! Hate! Murder!','The Big Night',37084,1.2945,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2632,_binary '\0','/ajIlR0mN5Cd1PVA2g6VEBZdGeqn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043360',4.4,1581,'en','Bride of the Gorilla','The owner of a plantation in the jungle marries a beautiful woman. Shortly afterward, he is plagued by a strange voodoo curse which transforms him into a gorilla. But is his transformation real or is it all in his head?','/5sk3yl6zhpQptkqu0eqiqHSox7L.jpg','1951-10-01',70,'Released','A Blonde Beauty and a Savage Beast... alone in the Jungle!','Bride of the Gorilla',22856,1.7404,4.8,'JbQOkNKxGag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2633,_binary '\0','/7aLyz4RTdQZCxOsnuPk67bXIZIn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043362',8,5936,'en','The Browning Version','Andrew Crocker-Harris has been forced from his position as the classics master at an English public school due to poor health. As he winds up his final term, he discovers not only that his wife, Millie, has been unfaithful to him with one of his fellow schoolmasters, but that the school\'s students and faculty have long disdained him. However, an unexpected act of kindness causes Crocker-Harris to re-evaluate his life\'s work.','/fRlXkYgQc6QfwYMAlv2neKhRswl.jpg','1951-04-06',90,'Released','How could he look on and say nothing ... it was his wife!','The Browning Version',39946,1.7671,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2634,_binary '\0','/vlUrvggcp0QFTGFLN4jAUEQlkku.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043379',7.3,8606,'en','Captain Horatio Hornblower R.N.','Captain Horatio Hornblower leads his ship HMS Lydia on a perilous transatlantic voyage, during which his faithful crew battle both a Spanish warship and a ragged band of Central American rebels.','/oielnqLw4gVpaJDN6QTOapCqRXf.jpg','1951-04-10',117,'Released','The sun never sets on his world of adventure.','Captain Horatio Hornblower R.N.',23928,3.6551,7,'s2l0p-fg4lU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2635,_binary '\0','/kpqwEMYwvD1EeeJz9gkm6QJORfr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043386',7.6,6713,'fr','Casque d\'Or','At the end of the 19th century, during a ball in Joinville, on the outskirts of Paris, Georges, a former delinquent working as a carpenter, meets Marie, a young woman connected to a criminal gang.','/c7VHPq0FxlvDiwMCvb8VOxeg8ub.jpg','1952-03-13',99,'Released',NULL,'Casque d\'Or',68822,2.1919,7.311,'d-f7-nnkQaI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2636,_binary '\0','/kDzbdmi7tEGnCWp4f4V8SRRidoY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043390',6.4,2974,'en','Cause for Alarm!','A bedridden and gravely ill man believes his wife and doctor are conspiring to kill him, and outlines his suspicions in a letter.','/6yCPB2jBvNEhG6qFej8ay3Xn5KU.jpg','1951-03-30',74,'Released','This Girl Is In Danger!','Cause for Alarm!',29835,2.097,5.9,'Crw1vkBpXx4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2637,_binary '\0','/lAdzAmV8NNQfPpdPAlWadeHUfmk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043408',6.3,1337,'en','The Cimarron Kid','After being falsely accused of a payroll heist, The Kid heads for the high country where he joins a gang of outlaws slaughtered during a daylight bank robbery. Hiding out in a local ranch, he falls in love with the rancher\'s daughter, who tries to rehabilitate the cowboy.','/d3D3E0sRkRI7r3OMO77mjIHiacj.jpg','1952-01-13',84,'Released','He led the last great outlaw raids !','The Cimarron Kid',60539,1.9884,6.109,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2638,_binary '\0','/dtQolkfCKP3wZaE7d1GibWFdKtS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043409',6.5,1263,'en','Circle of Danger','An American comes to Britain to investigate the murky circumstances of his brother\'s death that occurred during a WW2 commando raid.','/fwRcaUO6RuyiLge7cLIp1uNXYPN.jpg','1951-04-17',86,'Released','A man on a man hunt!','Circle of Danger',49368,1.4057,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2639,_binary '\0','/eoDbk2Gk7Sb2q7LUlG32NtdMZau.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043411',8,1594,'cs','Císařův pekař – Pekařův císař','The Emperor\'s mismanagement of his country is provoking some in his court to plot to overthrow him. He feels successful, at least, when he discovers the legendary Golem, which he believes can protect him and even cure his imaginary illnesses but, when he disappears while on a bender, his kindly baker, who looks just like him, is mistaken for him, and begins to put things in order. However, the conspirators, not to be outdone, determine to bring the Golem back to life to do their bidding.','/3i6VoJXD5EMmNCN1f7DTvZMzJnJ.jpg','1951-12-28',144,'Released',NULL,'The Emperor and the Golem',36918,1.9359,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2640,_binary '\0','/71obmCD1E30vrZ12QtoRZJH55QZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043425',6.3,1578,'en','Comin\' Round the Mountain','Al Stewart and Wilbert are magicians doing a stage act when they run into Wilbert\'s cousin, Dorothy McCoy. They find out that Wilbert\'s grandfather, Squeeze-box McCoy, had treasure hidden in the hills of Kentucky, which they go to find.','/auyndyN3B5hu1hqyTflvQVfJxaz.jpg','1951-07-26',77,'Released',NULL,'Comin\' Round the Mountain',33479,2.1634,6.1,'zh_X_qwIapI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2641,_binary '\0','/tzWKpxYCe36CRaloHr4I8DGiWmc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043435',7.3,3119,'en','Cry Danger','After serving five years of a life sentence, Rocky Mulloy hopes to clear his friend who\'s still in prison for the same crime.','/dZuzzGR6Ibha4Kgb4U8ExmizoUU.jpg','1951-02-23',79,'Released','Powell\'s on the Prowl!','Cry Danger',25726,1.7273,6.7,'kut03z4ItU8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2642,_binary '\0','/vmvg7xk3q1K4pTLcHKOXqxGSZsz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043455',6.2,2994,'en','David and Bathsheba','King David enters into an adulterous affair with the beautiful Bathsheba, which has tragic consequences for his family and Israel.','/gOYwjVzXami9Nko7pfw7qyt3odu.jpg','1951-08-10',123,'Released','Mighty as Goliath!','David and Bathsheba',42567,2.6871,5.8,'RoUeZwd7a1o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2643,_binary '\0','/qwZRvb0DJ5IwDoRuKDRCBuHWzkw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043456',7.7,89375,'en','The Day the Earth Stood Still','An alien and a robot land on Earth after World War II and tell mankind to be peaceful or face destruction.','/eslDNzf0LF1m9GsgUXlmyfTcC6Y.jpg','1951-09-18',92,'Released','From out of space...A warning and an ultimatum.','The Day the Earth Stood Still',828,5.9145,7.5,'sU_wBld7FPo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2644,_binary '\0','/kgYUW7496ljalfvxeXdb4C6oP8o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043458',7.2,1350,'en','Death of a Salesman','Willy Loman, an aging, failing salesman, struggles to accept reality and his failure to achieve the American Dream.','/xnyRkG1LMQX0NUpROq61GiKW7eJ.jpg','1951-12-20',115,'Released','One mistake... seen by his sons... unleashes... in the overwhelming power... the greatest drama of our day!','Death of a Salesman',104394,2.1934,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2645,_binary '\0','/wih0esrlvzqX5lU8BMvHeJMkhT7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043459',7.2,3367,'en','Decision Before Dawn','WWII is entering its last phase: Germany is in ruins, but does not yield. The US army lacks crucial knowledge about the German units operating on the opposite side of the Rhine, and decides to send two German prisoners to gather information. The scheme is risky: the Gestapo retains a terribly efficient network to identify and capture spies and deserters. Moreover, it is not clear that \"Tiger\", who does not mind any dirty work as long as the price is right, and war-weary \"Happy\", who might be easily betrayed by his feelings, are dependable agents. After Tiger and another American agent are successfully infiltrated, Happy is parachuted in Bavaria. His duty: find out the whereabouts of a powerful German armored unit moving towards the western front.','/wOrzwxmEvPIiD9VDSuN1utgMAxX.jpg','1951-12-21',119,'Released','A woman\'s kiss . . . A lighted cigarette - Each had Its meaning! An exciting and realistic story of war . . . of German Prisoners Sent Back Behind Their Own Lines as Agents of the Allies!','Decision Before Dawn',4461,2.7443,6.8,'80o4lPb4tsA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2646,_binary '\0','/ezfezjXNPKTFMFCpsAyoHQdozjq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043461',6.9,7275,'en','The Desert Fox: The Story of Rommel','The life and career of Erwin Rommel and his involvement in the plot to assassinate Hitler.','/nqid63zCxtVLmferoP2GYGH6jhB.jpg','1951-10-16',88,'Released','At last! The sensational best-seller comes to the screen!','The Desert Fox: The Story of Rommel',26205,3.6292,6.7,'DNky81BF7kI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2647,_binary '\0','/6BXP1XEWP31Tvm8wADiONAUs4uL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043465',7.5,10678,'en','Detective Story','Tells the story of one day in the lives of the various people who populate a police detective squad. An embittered cop, Det. Jim McLeod, leads a precinct of characters in their grim daily battle with the city\'s lowlife. The characters who pass through the precinct over the course of the day include a young petty embezzler, a pair of burglars, and a naive shoplifter.','/3DyED8DAoeBeQKHKQqkPh3loWjf.jpg','1951-10-19',103,'Released','The love story of a man whose wife was more woman than angel!','Detective Story',20853,2.4836,7.035,'mN8cE2TSjEo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2648,_binary '\0','/lyRLWZLvXRrS6CUZ9YPwifuQ0JU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043469',6.3,2651,'en','Distant Drums','After destroying a Seminole fort, American soldiers and their rescued companions must face the dangerous Everglades and hostile Indians in order to reach safety','/i47dolQL1igTPUQ7jvCzyiBENDQ.jpg','1951-12-25',101,'Released','Against unseen jungle terrors and untamed savage tribes ... and pounding war-drums that echoed his challenge!','Distant Drums',61391,3.7627,6.3,'LJWSX9EVc1E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2649,_binary '\0','/6ZlAG5iNeMEgjlhQ9vDDJymMc5F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043476',5.9,1502,'en','Double Dynamite','An innocent bank teller, suspected of embezzlement, is aided by an eccentric, wisecracking waiter.','/eC78JPGLhE64F6q9hG1VR6zbFTa.jpg','1951-12-25',80,'Released','Double Fun! Double Joy! Double Everything!','Double Dynamite',84397,2.4787,6.5,'WV2eLKdorkw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2650,_binary '\0','/34WzsXWrGjVKVD1C9zyB0bs5e6q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043503',7.2,6221,'en','The Enforcer','After years of investigation, Assistant District Attorney Martin Ferguson has managed to build a solid case against an elusive gangster whose top lieutenant is about to testify.','/k7FAq6mmLfsC6htX6f5zKwbw8LF.jpg','1951-02-24',87,'Released','They called him The Enforcer','The Enforcer',26712,2.5414,7.1,'tOpJGv9RLFU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2651,_binary '\0','/yo48a0FPvHwMDLKsnhQAIbkWVpH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043511',7.4,5544,'it','Europa \'51','A wealthy, self-absorbed Rome socialite is racked by guilt over the death of her young son. As a way of dealing with her grief and finding meaning in her life, she decides to devote her time and money to the city’s poor and sick. Her newfound, single-minded activism leads to conflicts with her husband and questions about her sanity.','/hw9MEW5kslyRwpJp8AgpIlBxtmr.jpg','1952-12-04',118,'Released',NULL,'Europa \'51',41464,1.9934,7.3,'kjorQxtgyks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2652,_binary '\0','/hcmiKaAVpLU0HQHGpowTAT6ztk8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043526',6.5,4786,'en','Father\'s Little Dividend','Newly married Kay Dunstan announces that she and her husband are having a baby, leaving her father to come to grips with the fact that he will soon be a granddad.','/nqGO8WJwha5Shc4I640s5xBndOM.jpg','1951-04-05',82,'Released','Funnier than \"Father of the Bride!\"','Father\'s Little Dividend',22968,3.2201,6.5,'9lEYq4gJ4m0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2653,_binary '\0','/5eLRW1lwivUdoflnb3wt0PcqAQc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043539',6.3,1941,'en','Five','The film\'s storyline involves five survivors, one woman and four men, of an atomic bomb disaster. The five come together at a remote, isolated hillside house, where they try to figure out how to survive.','/awMJBJpywUl7u75rLGohrRZ41wl.jpg','1951-04-25',93,'Released','Four men and one woman are the last five people on Earth...This is their story!','Five',48481,1.1297,6.6,'vmJedSwjFuw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2654,_binary '\0','/rbgkAogNVgN2USeox5mJsTBETgK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043540',6.9,2322,'en','Fixed Bayonets!','The story of a platoon during the Korean War. One by one, Corporal Denno\'s superiors are killed until it comes to the point where he must try to take command responsibility.','/hw5blc9tACbkxKGhR20lxULuipV.jpg','1951-11-21',92,'Released','Bayonets All-Steel…Hearts ALL-AMERICAN…Their story ALL GLORY!','Fixed Bayonets!',46875,1.8789,6.5,'k39YfGFa-p8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2655,_binary '\0','/kYXh2uugNXNt7aq4Ug0QXVSS5ZI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043545',5.1,1688,'en','Flight to Mars','Four scientists and a newsman crash land on Mars and meet martians who act friendly.','/frpl5j2OLXoQKGGky5Z8O5H1VqW.jpg','1951-11-11',72,'Released','The Most Fantastic Expedition Ever Conceived by Man!','Flight to Mars',43374,1.6122,5.2,'eqyMum67diI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2656,_binary '\0','/8L58LWsLOMp3xcNRViztOXEMK9r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043547',6.3,6068,'en','Flying Leathernecks','Major Daniel Kirby takes command of a squadron of Marine fliers just before they are about to go into combat. While the men are well meaning, he finds them undisciplined and prone to always finding excuses to do what is easy rather than what is necessary. The root of the problem is the second in command, Capt. Carl \'Griff\' Griffin. Griff is the best flier in the group but Kirby finds him a poor commander who is not prepared to make the difficult decision that all commanders have to make - to put men in harm\'s way knowing that they may be killed.','/xhT8QtoHibGosDVGBrRI9TxmPEe.jpg','1951-08-28',102,'Released','From Guadalcanal to Okinawa...the Marine air-devils blazed a trail of glory...while the women they left behind fought battles of their own!','Flying Leathernecks',47555,2.3494,5.8,'F5IHVn-nd7A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2657,_binary '\0','/lX0PAZCmHk6TrTwf8QaR8y1REIH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043560',7.1,3415,'en','Fourteen Hours','A young man, morally destroyed by his parents not loving him and by the fear of being not capable to make his girlfriend happy, rises on the ledge of a building with the intention of committing suicide. A policeman makes every effort to argue him out of it.','/eoD9MoQjMy6cB68lnRDQnDGjiWB.jpg','1951-04-01',92,'Released','A new element in screen suspense','Fourteen Hours',54139,3.5527,7.3,'_qylEfhyanY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2658,_binary '\0','/ra8SsXTWUfRUVqQoKo7t4pTJT6x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043565',6.5,1753,'en','The Frogmen','The new commander of a Navy Underwater Demolition Team--nicknamed \"Frogmen\"--must earn the respect of the men in his unit, who are still grieving over the death of their former commander and resentful of the new one.','/nFdHsoCgCr1bhDWtRokdkZhp3af.jpg','1951-01-25',96,'Released','UNCLE SAM\'S UNDERWATER COMMANDOS!','The Frogmen',44890,1.922,6.2,'oHQtbJFgWRM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2659,_binary '\0','/5pNUnJ70DRhC3xI5VSaueeFnhUB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043567',7.1,2317,'sv','Fröken Julie','Based on the play by August Strindberg, Miss Julie vividly depicts the battle of the sexes and classes that ensues when Julie, a wealthy businessman\'s daughter, falls for Jean, her father\'s bitter servant.','/t0FCrjopWvU6rm54WpioTLCUVZc.jpg','1951-06-28',90,'Released',NULL,'Miss Julie',18650,1.7078,6.6,'ODYhj-p5mOs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2660,_binary '\0','/z3YncSFgNTUfFm6cDOzHaS6wPMv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043590',6.6,2062,'en','Go for Broke!','A tribute to the U.S. 442nd Regimental Combat Team, formed in 1943 by Presidential permission with Japanese-American volunteers. We follow the training of a platoon under the rueful command of Lt. Mike Grayson who shares common prejudices of the time. The 442nd serve in Italy, then France, distinguishing themselves in skirmishes and battles; gradually and naturally, Grayson\'s prejudices evaporate with dawning realization that his men are better soldiers than he is.','/2XnwfYhgAnZzDPkA7ixdiSai81p.jpg','1951-05-04',92,'Released','The story of Japanese-American soldiers who fought in Europe during World War II','Go for Broke!',37214,1.3469,5.9,'2IKaTRPG4Bk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2661,_binary '\0','/opIsf7BFQNPvMeBBvJQYxjJvI8u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043599',6.5,1712,'en','The Great Caruso','Enrico Caruso\'s only passion is to sing. For that, he leaves his hometown of Naples, Italy, and travels to America to sing for the Metropolitan Opera. At first, his lack of education and poor background make him an outcast in the high-class opera world. Eventually, his voice wins him both fans and the hand of his love, Dorothy. But his nonstop pace and desire to perform at any cost eventually take their toll on the singer\'s health.','/yNPl1UGjzXQCaQqdlB4CblFjsyl.jpg','1951-04-16',109,'Released','The Intimate Story of a Man with a Voice as Great as His Heart!','The Great Caruso',98328,2.2883,5.9,'nwhEc75Ktq0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2662,_binary '\0','/lpdJBN9gLWloFFXE17QcE1kiaSP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043606',7.7,2074,'it','Guardie e ladri','Esposito is a thief who cons tourists in Rome. Officer Bottoni manages to catch him and starts persecuting him. When Esposito manages to flee, Bottoni\'s superiors inform him that he\'ll lose his job if he can\'t catch Esposito.','/udsIKaw4kbLifKwVXuhct9yrh0d.jpg','1951-11-29',105,'Released',NULL,'Cops and Robbers',45099,1.5559,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2663,_binary '\0','/i1I90iYpzA49bZUMV89z22gXu4K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043614',7.1,6319,'ja','白痴','A gentle, war-shattered ex-soldier, Kinji Kameda, arrives in wintry Hokkaidō and is pulled into a volatile tangle of love and pity between the disgraced Taeko Nasu, the proud Ayako, and his possessive friend Akama. Kameda’s saintly compassion exposes everyone’s wounds, steering the quartet toward jealousy, violence, and inexorable tragedy. Adapted from Dostoevsky’s novel.','/4a6zhVb9a9KEnxNevKrJLfuGhm4.jpg','1951-05-23',166,'Released',NULL,'The Idiot',24774,3.6931,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2664,_binary '\0','/8iH8x46OfNmU9043coheJ7wym91.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043625',7,3794,'en','He Ran All the Way','A crook on the run hides out in an innocent girl\'s apartment.','/rjeeFJdqE7JWBXPVXas3dDxrlTf.jpg','1951-06-20',77,'Released','DYNAMITE hits the screen with their kind of love!','He Ran All the Way',25738,2.421,7.2,'Lk3AqnUOCVc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2665,_binary '\0','/1oQavPqCmNKN4LBW5mGh3RYYKId.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043633',6.3,1282,'en','Here Comes the Groom','Foreign correspondent Pete Garvey has 5 days to win back his former fiancée, or he\'ll lose the orphans he adopted.','/eboMQGKcRQJC1ZuYfeCudi0eiwY.jpg','1951-09-20',113,'Released',NULL,'Here Comes the Groom',27629,2.4584,5.4,'kOjccwllpi0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2666,_binary '\0','/pOtCuWEVxWrO7bkZiPvirOv27ZT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043643',7,5707,'en','His Kind of Woman','Career gambler Dan Milner agrees to a $50,000 deal to leave the USA for Mexico, only to find himself entangled with fellow guests at a luxurious resort and suspecting that the man who hired him may be the deported crime boss Nick Ferraro aiming to re-enter to the USA.','/mB5vCfHE7ootyK96F3IVhLSaJzP.jpg','1951-08-15',120,'Released','They were two of a kind! ...and bound to meet, but neither of them knew what such a meeting would mean!','His Kind of Woman',33673,3.431,6.8,'smdt0wGkrfg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2667,_binary '\0','/r5aXNWkohjRfHGtKvBaW6E1VV1j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043646',6.8,1278,'en','Hollywood Story','An independent producer unwisely opens a can of worms after he decides to make a movie about the unsolved murder of a famous silent film director.','/wpV1Cphki6opdO2Frfs19zrl66s.jpg','1951-06-01',76,'Released','We can\'t tell you what this picture is about ... without giving away the secret that rocked the lives of five fabulous people!','Hollywood Story',46196,1.3396,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2668,_binary '\0','/b9YGdNEHSJAxlujAU8wbHy48ty5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043651',4.9,1228,'en','Home Town Story','Blake Washburn blames manufacturer MacFarland for his defeat in the race for re-election to the state legislature. He takes over his uncle\'s newspaper to take on big business as an enemy of the people. Miss Martin works in the \"Herald\" newspaper office. When tragedy strikes, Blake must re-examine his views.','/merGh0FLsk0XruiwFNmZAHVMJ8d.jpg','1951-05-18',61,'Released','It could happen anywhere!','Home Town Story',36501,1.7292,4.9,'OI3vGX7Fv2o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2669,_binary '\0','/jd6DEtIjNhPJQtXjMhEu01hjLlp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043655',6.2,1350,'en','The Hoodlum','Vincent Lubeck is a vicious ex-convict. His criminal activities are despised by his family, but he uses and abuses them in the course of his crimes. Eventually his own brother must stand up to him.','/vz1ey1oY7vYVlHSiY4XOyYGeDG1.jpg','1951-07-05',61,'Released','One way road to the chair for today\'s greatest menace !','The Hoodlum',47256,1.1814,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2670,_binary '\0','/ofGwfK8ZzMeJUzCOk4EbIN44oHP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043660',6.9,4410,'en','The House on Telegraph Hill','Concentration camp survivor Victoria Kowelska finds herself involved in mystery, greed, and murder when she assumes the identity of a dead friend in order to gain passage to America.','/vjKabI7snDt6yym62ARh5MtBbw8.jpg','1951-05-12',93,'Released','Shame is the mistress of this house and betrayal its master!','The House on Telegraph Hill',28434,2.4663,6.4,'mAhaUyaNWeE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2671,_binary '\0','/dLzwQw2MZghH1B1ztx19Op9Z0v4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043669',6.8,1362,'en','I\'ll See You in My Dreams','Songwriter Gus Kahn fights to make his name, then has to fight again to survive the Depression.','/l7qBmXPwXUZRa17RI2M3MLbTnTV.jpg','1951-12-06',110,'Released','The glorious story of Gus Kahn, the songs he wrote into America\'s heart, and the girl who put them into his!!!','I\'ll See You in My Dreams',43375,1.8306,4.9,'H9-blGrPsd4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2672,_binary '\0','/iNkgF4uBzcFTrY3NN6JrlCD5Ho.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043686',8,14340,'fr','Jeux interdits','Orphaned after a Nazi air raid, Paulette, a young Parisian girl, runs into Michel, an older peasant boy, and the two quickly become close. Together, they try to make sense of the chaotic and crumbling world around them, attempting to cope with death as they create a burial ground for Paulette\'s deceased pet dog. Eventually, however, Paulette\'s stay with Michel\'s family is threatened by the harsh realities of wartime.','/nby91GNVXQAv1NmKvqlpEEdhcMQ.jpg','1952-05-09',87,'Released','War ... and how it affects the lives of our children','Forbidden Games',5000,4.1296,7.8,'JUwdB3PS8jg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2673,_binary '\0','/6N61qD16XwP4k3y1dW3DcLH9PSU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043687',6.9,2563,'en','Jim Thorpe – All-American','The triumph and tragedy of Native American Jim Thorpe, who, after winning both the pentathlon and decathlon in the same Olympics, is stripped of his medals on a technicality.','/dFtIs3baceJcAXmcspoGZ0mZ55h.jpg','1951-08-24',107,'Released','He wore America\'s heart over his!','Jim Thorpe – All-American',60853,2.4226,6.5,'hyLFX4S1sYQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2674,_binary '\0','/l9ZP7VBeqIhH4Y9frBEPPoqHDsI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043709',7.1,1346,'en','Kind Lady','Mary Herries has a passion for art and fine furniture. Even though she is getting on in years, she enjoys being around these priceless articles. One day she meets a strange young painter named Elcott, who uses his painting skill to enter into her life. Little does she expect that his only interest in Mary is to covet everything she has.','/oIIMGWSApeKqYhYP2NMghciuAL8.jpg','1951-06-20',78,'Released','Broadway\'s dramatic thunderbolt!','Kind Lady',193547,2.3517,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2675,_binary '\0','/3y9BoKR57e2gKT7mltfOUIWBGaI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043727',7.1,2296,'en','Laughter in Paradise','When an eccentric practical joker dies, he divides his fortune among four heirs. But before they can collect the cash they must each do something which goes completely against their nature. NB: This is the film which introduced Audrey Hepburn.','/9l8NmkbfL0lN0fC6ZqADGxHv1yo.jpg','1951-06-01',97,'Released','He sets the whole world laughing ... there\'s even Laughter in Paradise!','Laughter in Paradise',81724,2.0217,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2676,_binary '\0','/82N94u1rtmBvEUCzFTtwyBIjAIY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043733',7,2534,'en','The Lemon Drop Kid','When the Lemon Drop Kid accidentally cheats gangster Moose Moran out of his track winnings, the Kid promises to repay Moose the money by Christmas. Creating a fake charity for \"Apple Annie\" Nellie Thursday, the Kid tricks his gang into donning Santa suits and \"collecting dough for old dolls\" like Nellie who have nowhere to live.','/uG5m1LHHUWBvhpYvABQloUlPfkW.jpg','1951-04-02',91,'Released','Damon Runyan\'s zaniest Broadway characters come alive with fun...especially the Lemon Drop Kid (Bob, natch!)','The Lemon Drop Kid',24512,2.4387,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2677,_binary '\0','/sOm5wurKI0Et1xtfutYG1266y8g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043736',6.1,1584,'en','Let\'s Make It Legal','A woman divorces her husband of 20 years because he gambles too much.','/z440UCgYVwPv3QyIVp9cH44wpKF.jpg','1951-10-31',77,'Released','Who Cares If It\'s Legal As Long As It\'s Tempting! Virile! Tantalizing! Smooth! Wow!','Let\'s Make It Legal',24002,2.527,5.6,'TSISIDHS554','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2678,_binary '\0','/mqBaA9COjSqRRoKWELPSKtDjX0y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043744',6.5,1716,'en','Lightning Strikes Twice','Sent to a dude ranch in the west to recover her health, a New York actress falls in love with a ranch owner recently acquitted of the murder of his wife.','/cS5T7GRkG2lD2BsImG7SPNNXv8L.jpg','1951-04-12',91,'Released','Would You Have the Nerve to Do What She Did on Her Wedding Day?','Lightning Strikes Twice',72479,1.3878,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2679,_binary '\0','/aKwLvHLj54hyFnXdmKMm5tAyPke.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043751',6.2,1476,'en','Lone Star','Cattle baron Devereaux Burke is enlisted by an aging Andrew Jackson to dissuade Sam Houston from establishing Texas as a republic. Burke must fight state senator Thomas Craden, in the process winning the heart of Craden\'s newspaper-editor girlfriend Martha Ronda.','/4AMTdBJpApUz55HqVbZBS5GNQa6.jpg','1952-10-24',94,'Released','The Battle for Texas and the Battle of the Sexes!','Lone Star',37593,2.7183,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2680,_binary '\0','/iVvzZuBpagsgOGkaVkin9MDtCJU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043757',3.5,1999,'en','Lost Continent','When an experimental atomic rocket crashes somewhere off-radar, its three developing scientists are joined by three Air Force men in tracking it down to a small Pacific island, where it apparently has landed on the plateau of the island\'s steep-walled, taboo mountain.','/sXI8wCc5osqLWtfKsWuqztNPhpL.jpg','1951-08-17',83,'Released','Monsters in a land that time forgot!','Lost Continent',44592,1.5488,3.6,'SoTOAkzQk-4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2681,_binary '\0','/phkR0UAcwWGfm5aGdN4STSmQyOA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043759',6.2,1611,'en','Love Nest','Jim and Connie\'s postwar New York building troubles keep Jim from working on his novel. Ex-WAC from Jim\'s army days Roberta moves in, further upsetting Connie but pleasing Jim\'s friend Ed. Tenant Charley, who marries tenant Eadie, loans money to Jim to help him keep the building, money which this Casanova obtains from rich widows.','/baFv5L12aDMLB5OTmyjDXy34TbM.jpg','1951-10-10',84,'Released',NULL,'Love Nest',16089,1.444,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2682,_binary '\0','/n41y0pUUvK5uynIP8CLOPJx6ija.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043762',6.7,1445,'en','Lullaby of Broadway','Pretty Melinda Howard has been abroad singing with a musical troupe. She decides to return home to surprise her mother whom she thinks is a successful Broadway star with a mansion in Manhattan. She doesn\'t know that her mother is actually a burnt-out cabaret singer with a love for whiskey. When she arrives at the mansion, she is taken in by the two servants who are friends of her mother\'s. The house actually belongs to Adolph Hubbell, a kind-hearted Broadway producer who also gets drawn into the charade. Hubbell takes a shine to Melinda and agrees to star her in his next show. Melinda also finds romance with a handsome hoofer who\'s also in the show. All is going well for Melinda except that she wants to see her mother who keeps putting off their reunion.','/gz4TUoGzjju9iBfd0fN6nB0kyW.jpg','1951-03-26',92,'Released','Big and Gay as the Gay White Way!','Lullaby of Broadway',43377,1.3095,6,'JYQ820CbYV4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2683,_binary '\0','/aFjR7ELSqn50QAqteNehpw5Z6jG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043766',6.8,2659,'en','M','Remake of the 1931 Fritz Lang original. In the city, someone is murdering children. The Police search is so intense, it is disturbing the \'normal\' criminals, and the local hoods decide to help find the murderer as quickly as possible.','/jJWNGF5FxbKyk8EyH4Ad8FA0WK.jpg','1951-03-01',88,'Released','The most gripping motion picture you\'ve ever seen!','M',36373,2.2151,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2684,_binary '\0','/toWlnfb9GIJT2dyACbEn1S9YS5q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043769',7,1587,'en','The Magic Box','Now old, ill, poor, and largely forgotten, William Freise-Greene was once young and handsome William Green. He changed his name to include his first wife\'s for the photographic portrait work he excelled at. But he was also an inventor and his search for a way to project moving pictures became an obsession that ultimately changed the life of all those he loved.','/kRtukdvDz3tkyhSC8GzGOkQhAb0.jpg','1952-01-01',118,'Released','A rich and deeply moving story of a man whose achievement opened up a new world, and of the two women whose love and sacrifices made it possible!','The Magic Box',80596,1.4335,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2685,_binary '\0','/6QlHa9BaC2CTcfzCgqeyGRVwlYr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043778',5.7,3558,'en','The Man from Planet X','While watching for a planet that may collide with earth, scientists stationed in Scotland are approached by a visitor from outer space.','/bA8TbHq96DaWxml0j3OneCBjrJG.jpg','1951-04-27',70,'Released','The WEIRDEST Visitor the Earth has ever seen!','The Man from Planet X',50153,2.202,5.8,'WXE_XUcZWrc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2686,_binary '\0','/pamVDHSiF3lYPjOkLdWpV3ulXRJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043781',6.3,1785,'en','Man in the Saddle','A small rancher is being harassed by his mighty and powerful neighbor. When the neighbor even hires gunmen to intimidate him he has to defend himself and his property by means of violence.','/pSswVK4dONQ9UU01yaw7HiYQUS8.jpg','1951-12-02',87,'Released','SIX-GUN SHOWDOWN IN THE SIERRAS','Man in the Saddle',43378,2.352,6.6,'Po1FVX_qcpY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2687,_binary '\0','/x5EQjx4Md9nes69x8Goh4D3jeAW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043782',6.6,1628,'en','The Man with a Cloak','Set in 19th-century New York, this mystery begins when a Frenchwoman shows up at the home of one of Napoleon\'s former marshals. The alcoholic man is badly crippled and slowly dying, but this doesn\'t stop the forthright lady from pushing him to change his will to include his estranged grandson so that he can help out the struggling French Republic. Unfortunately, the dying man\'s conniving housekeeper and butler, already planning murder to get the money themselves, overhear her and begin plotting her demise.','/xZbpS0m9G2F3DR2y2RGwTgSVNcX.jpg','1951-11-27',84,'Released','What strange hold did this man have over the lives of these two beautiful women ?','The Man with a Cloak',83664,1.9007,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2688,_binary '\0','/lsUznKdNY0HahX6zCJoWnmxhLWc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043792',7.3,2211,'en','The Mating Season','Ellen McNulty leaves her New Jersey hamburger stand and heads west to pay a surprise visit to her son and his new bride. When Ellen arrives, her daughter-in-law mistakes her for the maid she has hired for a big party they are throwing. Rather than cause any embarrassment, Ellen goes along with the charade, which leads to many complications.','/sQ54MP0RvqS9VTY18W2121LrNmu.jpg','1951-01-12',101,'Released','The comedy of the year!!!','The Mating Season',108232,1.4127,6.621,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2689,_binary '\0','/h3Dy80Xh2fKePQ6zauv42ghqupA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043801',7.6,2026,'ja','めし','In post-WWII Osaka, a middle-aged woman is forced to examine her dreary life and marriage when her husband\'s young and flirtatious cousin arrives for a brief stay to escape an arranged marriage.','/cWK2cRiF2vW67XqWnGZ6GD8eTV.jpg','1951-11-23',97,'Released',NULL,'Repast',47184,3.0428,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2690,_binary '\0','/auItHwCI7tvJ8C5f2B0lS5zjDZQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043809',7.6,9527,'it','Miracolo a Milano','Once upon a time a wise and kind old woman discovers a baby in her cabbage patch. She brings up the child and, when she dies, the boy, Totò, enters an orphanage. Totò leaves the orphanage a happy young man, and looks for work in post-war Milan. He ends up with the homeless and organizes them to build a shanty town in a vacant lot. But when greedy developers threaten the community’s land, Totò will need all the help he can get in order to find an impossible way out.','/9l47FSwRvu0IETKjDVpZ2INbqvI.jpg','1951-02-08',97,'Released','An impudent, riotous laugh on the lives and morals of our day!','Miracle in Milan',43379,2.4383,7.266,'la8midGNmV4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2691,_binary '\0','/ydJ8u4dPGAJI8WsoPZuFh8jdgGM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043812',7.1,3078,'en','The Mob','An undercover officer tracks waterfront corruption from California to New Orleans and back.','/vDzTY3WAFXE1Bb94PGERVbT52uq.jpg','1951-09-07',87,'Released','cruel... cunning... cold as ice...','The Mob',25728,2.0802,6.7,'zszubL-89KE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2692,_binary '\0','/oP24Wn0qzSUQwErFBaKwE71g9hB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043827',6.5,1439,'en','My Favorite Spy','A burlesque comic doubles for a spy in Tangier and meets the spy\'s girlfriend, who is also a spy.','/4hG2j4IaAOLdoa0OhPWqPVfjW1x.jpg','1951-12-25',93,'Released','When Bob tangles with Hedy ... there\'s hilarity in Araby ... Moroccan style !','My Favorite Spy',103165,1.6305,6,'pLHiOnhZ1kg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2693,_binary '\0','/pqXeFnhquUHFOROSUwuYOd9hKbx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043828',6.2,1342,'en','My Forbidden Past','An 1890s New Orleans heiress tries to buy a married doctor\'s love with her tainted family fortune.','/jUmuhlOf4KoI87czkVwo0z51vyK.jpg','1951-04-25',70,'Released','SHE\'s the kind of woman that made NEW ORLEANS famous!','My Forbidden Past',106016,1.7253,5.5,'__2kl5yYVvY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2694,_binary '\0','/feS4Clv8q6AtoX76OK20vMAXaag.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043859',7.1,5120,'en','No Highway in the Sky','James Stewart plays aeronautical engineer Theodore Honey, the quintessential absent-minded professor: eccentric, forgetful, but brilliant. His studies show that the aircraft being manufactured by his employer has a subtle but deadly design flaw that manifests itself only after the aircraft has flown a certain number of hours. En route to a crash site to prove his theory, Honey discovers that he is aboard a plane rapidly approaching his predicted deadline.','/9zmMPkuz7cZJkg6zk0hQlsv6Cy0.jpg','1951-06-28',98,'Released','EXCITEMENT and SUSPENSE 18,000 Feet Over the Atlantic!','No Highway in the Sky',43882,2.5354,7,'O11zBpUziDo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2695,_binary '\0','/40XiCfIHubD334gMa75UfpIiYKk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043861',6.7,1253,'en','No Questions Asked','With the help of some seedy gangsters, young attorney Steve Keiver makes some quick cash by bending the law, and in the process, he impresses the mobsters so much that they invite him to work for them on a regular basis. But when Police Inspector Matt Duggan realizes that Steve is working as a middleman for the mob, the young lawyer finds himself in a life-threatening situation. In order to clear his name, he must betray the deadly crooks he\'s been working for.','/hVGkYk7d7mJKFLATjJyJfCnE7jz.jpg','1951-06-15',80,'Released','\"Give her the works til she tells where the jewels are hidden.\"','No Questions Asked',73313,1.5307,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2696,_binary '\0','/7mlqPA7uSIt9svcDLiKyln86LFi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043871',6.8,1251,'en','Odette','The film is based on the true story of Special Operations Executive French-born agent Odette Sansom, who was captured by the Germans in 1943, condemned to death and sent to Ravensbrück concentration camp to be executed. However, against all odds she survived the war and testified against the prison guards at the Hamburg Ravensbrück Trials. She was awarded the George Cross in 1946; the first woman ever to receive the award, and the only woman who has been awarded it while still alive. (From Wikipedia, licensed under CC-BY-SA)','/yrydkCkM5A13H06PrZUSvxjvyfu.jpg','1950-10-02',124,'Released','The Dramatic Story of a Woman\'s Courage!','Odette',80636,1.8978,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2697,_binary '\0','/u60YmRuwJqg8mLCMsdvnM9UPnLw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043873',7.1,2050,'en','Has Anybody Seen My Gal?','When a 1920s millionaire tests the fiber of his Vermont family, a young lady and her boyfriend feel the repercussions.','/zZFk1jwxoZ7e6o5exhFIykDWyF8.jpg','1952-06-25',88,'Released','How you\'ll cheer the hit songs of the roaring twenties!','Has Anybody Seen My Gal?',54670,1.9961,7,'_w3EHp1d0uc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2698,_binary '\0','/euaUD5Cy5DnyEr5uvJHp4WGk0zj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043879',7.2,9338,'en','On Dangerous Ground','A big-city cop is reassigned to the country after his superiors find him too angry to be an effective policeman. While on his temporary assignment he assists in a manhunt of a suspected murderer.','/dJiSzEf5uGV0l9bQbaCyk7ob2YP.jpg','1951-12-13',82,'Released','In One Strange Night she met both LOVE... and MURDER!','On Dangerous Ground',31152,2.5468,6.63,'Ry04YYpQnJQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2699,_binary '\0','/cLLT5vYyCpoV98ZmVa1bqxZe5Ea.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043880',6.9,3408,'en','On Moonlight Bay','The Winfield family moves into a new house in a small town in Indiana. Tomboy Marjorie Winfield begins a romance with William Sherman who lives across the street. Marjorie has to learn how to dance and act like a proper young lady. Unfortunately William Sherman has unconventional ideas for the time. His ideas include not believing in marriage or money, which causes friction with Marjorie\'s father, who is the local bank vice president','/9hARAM4Ze0lsMHpUEjymptvD06k.jpg','1951-07-26',95,'Released','The lovin\'est musical in many a moon!','On Moonlight Bay',41204,1.9402,6.5,'H43OEfL8Rz4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2700,_binary '\0','/c5GAlcfuAGAghO0L1pxuQT94bOW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043882',6.3,1296,'en','On the Riviera','In this fast-paced remake of the Maurice Chevalier vehicle Folies Bergère, talented Danny Kaye plays both a performer and a heroic French military pilot.','/pKOXKfX85YuvsMeYjqDwd2OJvJ4.jpg','1951-04-20',89,'Released',NULL,'On the Riviera',29577,1.5651,6.019,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2701,_binary '\0','/mtbW3Yu3YsqTmilJNF5zbUG1lfU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043885',6.5,2048,'en','Only the Valiant','Only the Valiant, a classic western adventure, based on a novel by Charles Marquis Warren, the film tells the story of a Cavalry officer who volunteers for a suicidal mission to fight the hostile Apaches in an effort to prove his loyalty to his men and the woman he loves.','/7j2DB5PBuyxXMDKM8t5sia87wht.jpg','1951-04-13',105,'Released','GREGORY PECK, AS CAPTAIN LANCE, WHO GAVE FORT INVINCIBLE ITS NAME!','Only the Valiant',56597,2.7467,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2702,_binary '\0','/kbVjnJckue3DpimYnkd6tioKiqg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043887',6.6,4260,'en','Operation Pacific','During WWII, Duke E. Gifford is second in command of the USS Thunderfish, a submarine which is firing off torpedoes that either explode too early or never explode at all. It\'s a dilemma that he\'ll eventually take up personally. Even more personal is his quest to win back his ex-wife, a nurse; but he\'ll have to win her back from a navy flier who also happens to be his commander\'s little brother.','/w76x8HiPPzpnHiaZI7j7rRIk08I.jpg','1951-01-27',111,'Released','He\'s Skipper \"Duke\" Gifford Who Could Put A Torpedo Through A Needle...And Sew Up A Date With A Laugh!','Operation Pacific',40683,3.4665,6.1,'RUPewDdXWP4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2703,_binary '\0','/xhoshY4aaHhh9k71U5nRSwUYlJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043892',7.4,2134,'ja','お遊さま','Shinnosuke is introduced to Shizu as a prospective marriage partner, but he falls in love with her widowed sister Oyu. Convention forbids Oyu to marry because she has to raise her son as the head of her husband\'s family. Oyu convinces Shinnosuke and Shizu to marry so that she can remain close to Shinnosuke.','/5h46GdEaK2IZsYWKiK4N9Oyz4Y0.jpg','1951-06-22',94,'Released',NULL,'Miss Oyu',46043,1.4958,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2704,_binary '\0','/nmg9kG7WeOJEtdcHuenNDW3P2ki.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043895',4.3,1381,'en','The Painted Hills','After years of prospecting, Jonathan finally strikes gold. He returns to town only to discover that his partner has since died and left Tommy fatherless. He decides to leave Shep with Tommy to cheer him up. Meanwhile, Jonathan\'s new partner isn\'t interested in sharing the gold, and lures Jonathan to his death.','/4Xvm83XJiACBeVj3quKLhu1VSIH.jpg','1951-05-04',68,'Released','PACKED WITH THRILLS!','The Painted Hills',61855,1.3518,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2705,_binary '\0','/oWbdLvqzWEMIxmSpHSjcwBlcCrj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043899',6.9,5499,'en','Pandora and the Flying Dutchman','Pandora Reynolds is a woman who has never fallen in love – but one who men kill and die for. When she meets dashing and mysterious ship\'s captain Hendrik van der Zee, he pushes her to commit the ultimate act of love.','/yKjbyfAPFH0fI1W1nOTHyztTqZS.jpg','1951-04-13',124,'Released','The Loves of Pandora in Flaming TECHNICOLOR!','Pandora and the Flying Dutchman',38688,2.8197,6.8,'5HMCBGgweqI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2706,_binary '\0','/rXuWNVbRxadzldZNoYIA0ESlSLG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043910',6.9,2126,'en','Payment on Demand','David gives his wife, Joyce, an unexpected—and unpleasant—surprise when he suddenly demands a divorce. When she then learns that David has taken up with a younger woman, Joyce decides to make the most of this separation by taking a solo trip to the Caribbean. However, just before diving into a vacation fling, she runs into Emily, an old chum whose own divorce has left her embittered. Joyce then debates giving married life one last chance.','/i735e0FTx0nZwrJB8dn0qCwkkUm.jpg','1951-02-03',90,'Released','He Strayed... and He Paid. She saw to that!','Payment on Demand',83667,1.7026,6.2,'jWgYR-3GKSU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2707,_binary '\0','/5TjuibTuQ7T5QbAtsRhyvxhS7id.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043914',6.8,1702,'en','The People Against O\'Hara','A defense attorney jeopardizes his career to save his client.','/ljjHON28dyyV3BTQP7FMdwfumW7.jpg','1951-09-01',102,'Released','O\'HARA MIGHT BEAT MURDER - IF HIS LAWYER CAN BEAT THE BOTTLE!','The People Against O\'Hara',36634,2.525,5.8,'Z82be9pTniY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2708,_binary '\0','/euIGOqxmaKndp4Bd6x1NGyIo0Bs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043915',7.3,7931,'en','People Will Talk','A successful, unorthodox doctor befriends a young woman with suicidal ideations due to her pregnancy by her ex, a military reservist killed in action.','/w7wdYUwie8kBsEojZCF5gbTfVii.jpg','1951-08-29',110,'Released','The picture that takes a new look at life!','People Will Talk',23152,2.0126,7.1,'TvLNaV-ja4E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2709,_binary '\0','/3pmuMl10ZLABOWdZRmGARsfuYLe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043918',7.6,5299,'it','Don Camillo','In a village of the Po valley where the earth is hard and life miserly, the priest and the communist mayor are always fighting to be the head of the community. If in secret, they admired and liked each other, politics still divided them as it is dividing the country. And when the mayor wants his \"People\'s House\"; the priest wants his \"Garden City\" for the poor. Division exist between the richest and the poorest, the pious and the atheists and even between lovers. But if the people are hard as the country, they are good in the bottom of there heart.','/bDbzuBgsgZ5VVljMHNni3gJK9Qx.jpg','1952-03-28',107,'Released',NULL,'The Little World of Don Camillo',11972,2.3302,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2710,_binary '\0','/49LzDsuSefYnEOaNjsoYLMUDn0r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043924',7.7,27280,'en','A Place in the Sun','A young social climber wins the heart of a beautiful heiress but his former girlfriend\'s pregnancy stands in the way of his ambition.','/3tKYbChwIRYCwFrMUDBkbZyDIoN.jpg','1951-06-12',122,'Released','Young people asking so much of life... taking so much of love!','A Place in the Sun',25673,4.3732,7.3,'sk7a9EyMGiY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2711,_binary '\0','/2LfG1zNl4IkaHYPcu4QFv3pZTxV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043927',7.4,1960,'fr','La Poison','Paul Braconnier and his wife Blandine only have one thing in mind: to find a way to kill each other without risk. After listening to a radio show, Paul decides to go to Paris to meet a famous lawyer in the acquittal of the murderers. He tells the lawyer that he killed his wife. The lawyer asks Paul to reconstruct the circumstances of the drama. Without knowing it, he explains, in spite of himself, the way for Paul to murder his wife by putting the odds on his side to avoid death penalty or even be released...','/supFTAz1bryBrTAHw7cOMDbD1TF.jpg','1951-11-30',85,'Released',NULL,'Poison',65534,1.9815,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2712,_binary '\0','/kT9SWKJJkKfYeBOlm3mAqYXtx6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043938',7.1,5487,'en','The Prowler','Los Angeles, California. A cop who, unhappy with his job, blames others for his work problems, is assigned to investigate the case of a prowler who stalks the home of a married woman.','/7i5jflxPAWYRz0cxgmabiCYfXDe.jpg','1951-05-25',93,'Released','Watch out for…','The Prowler',22985,2.07,6.8,'uF14oWy_ujM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2713,_binary '\0','/cEdyAF813pgjsYzGqpDFjJgTzbs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043949',7.1,18708,'en','Quo Vadis','After fierce Roman commander Marcus Vinicius becomes infatuated with beautiful Christian hostage Lygia, he begins to question the tyrannical leadership of the despotic emperor Nero.','/dqF1dattMNiwGjPSphu2VSi558Q.jpg','1951-11-08',174,'Released','THIS IS THE BIG ONE! The splendor and savagery of the world\'s wickedest empire! Three hours of spectacle you\'ll remember for a lifetime!','Quo Vadis',11620,4.9769,7.1,'d89YbVtQFN0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2714,_binary '\0','/eyeERx6Xfh5wr2aoWjylNKrQAOm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043955',6.7,3782,'en','The Racket','The big national crime syndicate has moved into town, partnering up with local crime boss Nick Scanlon. McQuigg, the only honest police captain on the force, and his loyal patrolman, Johnson, take on the violent Nick.','/nZI5BAErP5FU0G72DdZaVam8N8X.jpg','1951-10-25',88,'Released','The Racket boldly begins where the Senate crime committee left off!','The Racket',25876,2.4016,6.3,'m60js8IcXZI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2715,_binary '\0','/iuhR3UXXIj7OqPY7zimAIaiC7sj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043959',7.1,3735,'en','Rawhide','At a desolate relay station in the west, a stagecoach attendant and a stranded woman traveller are held captive by a band of escaped convicts.','/5LoxiswQPlhg5PfAjMSNqn1N0TV.jpg','1951-03-25',89,'Released',NULL,'Rawhide',43380,2.0678,6.7,'4jujbfORn7A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2716,_binary '\0','/cgmuUeuz6hOZvKWzlk4G824QvKL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043961',7.1,5394,'en','The Red Badge of Courage','Henry Fleming is a young Union soldier in the American Civil War. During his unit\'s first engagement, Henry flees the battlefield in fear. When he learns that the Union actually won the battle, shame over his cowardice leads him to lie to his friend Tom and the other soldiers, saying that he had been injured in battle. However, when he learns that his unit will be leading a charge against the enemy, Henry takes the opportunity to face his fears and redeem himself.','/RKomX6ExUYMvlNcv2HjgupVKdS.jpg','1951-09-27',69,'Released','Stephen Crane\'s Great American Story of the Civil War','The Red Badge of Courage',59401,2.8647,6.4,'XLdXhaW8bLs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2717,_binary '\0','/bZXTWrpuMyAwFJ8tp49o5Dr9E9W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043972',7.4,7491,'en','The River','Director Jean Renoir’s entrancing first color feature—shot entirely on location in India—is a visual tour de force. Based on the novel by Rumer Godden, the film eloquently contrasts the growing pains of three young women with the immutability of the Bengal river around which their daily lives unfold. Enriched by Renoir’s subtle understanding and appreciation for India and its people, The River gracefully explores the fragile connections between transitory emotions and everlasting creation.','/rC1k4xkffb5sdQlktiP2TyiBxT2.jpg','1951-09-10',99,'Released','Beauty... Mystery... Delightful Humor...','The River',45218,2.8601,7.215,'4EjxmASL9zc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2718,_binary '\0','/3vt4W5bEZAyj0swIyZJlsUzstCs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043973',6.6,1860,'en','Roadblock','An insurance agent\'s greedy girlfriend with a taste for mink leads him to a life of crime.','/fZ3yfxUEO7zrH0xpWMSOZ70n3yX.jpg','1951-09-17',73,'Released','Hot lead and cold cash outside the law!','Roadblock',28561,1.7767,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2719,_binary '\0','/iBVKjk68mfOZNW0TtymZj00g7Qv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043983',6.7,6745,'en','Royal Wedding','A brother and sister dance act encounter challenges and romance when booked in London during the Royal Wedding.','/5hOyBgsmSApFl10ZfaYxUTQu5Ze.jpg','1951-03-08',93,'Released','A story of a famed singing, dancing, brother and sister team!','Royal Wedding',18646,2.7275,6.4,'vApZ6LWuTc4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2720,_binary '\0','/ywlwmsvVAfyfUHULdLnaSL4RvNn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043989',6.2,1570,'en','Sailor Beware','Meeting in a navy recruiting line, Al Crowthers and Melvin Jones become friends. Al has tried to enlist before, but was always rejected. He keeps trying so that he can impress women. Melvin, is allergic to women\'s cosmetics and his doctor prescribed ocean travel, so he decided to join the navy.','/fksEN0tiQMbWYwh9Z1OH4fL3yHp.jpg','1952-02-08',108,'Released','They go down to the sea in ships… and come up with oceans of LAUGHTER!','Sailor Beware',39015,2.335,6.2,'EELehFoMArc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2721,_binary '\0','/lLYLF28MkKikw0owUdWBUrYiwiu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0043992',6.1,1311,'en','Santa Fe','After their service in the Civil War, four brothers go their separate ways, but later find themselves on opposite sides of a final showdown.','/4sjsuWSM5wcFhEld7svtx3xJoKa.jpg','1951-04-01',88,'Released','BEYOND FORBIDDEN FRONTIERS...Iron men forge a path of steel for \"The Iron Horse!\"','Santa Fe',147903,1.8783,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2722,_binary '\0','/oSU98IDxfeR8q6IimvKaLmkorro.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044000',7.2,7622,'it','Lo sceicco bianco','In Italy, small-town newlyweds Wanda and Ivan Cavalli embark on their honeymoon in the big city of Rome. Ivan dutifully wants to keep appointments with family and church, but Wanda is only interested in meeting her favorite photo-strip star known as \"The White Sheik\". While Wanda impetuously sneaks away to locate the object of her affections, disconsolate Ivan tries his hardest to keep up appearances with the couple\'s relatives.','/kyO9tTwiD4zsQKqMicP2AVxglww.jpg','1952-09-27',83,'Released','A Very Funny Picture by Federico Fellini','The White Sheik',43361,2.3821,7.158,'6dvi0d5mT3U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2723,_binary '\0','/bW9fKeoIbq4bDclZ4h9D5BqSqmX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044008',8.1,29350,'en','Scrooge','Ebenezer Scrooge malcontentedly shuffles through life as a cruel, miserly businessman, until he is visited by three spirits on Christmas Eve who show him how his unhappy childhood and adult behavior has left him a selfish, lonely old man.','/sxLRt2u5xgUgkrIAPyE0KiiSVnX.jpg','1951-11-30',86,'Released','Charles Dickens\' Joyous Holliday Classic!','Scrooge',13188,3.8817,7.4,'9h9HX1T3crc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2724,_binary '\0','/mc00TZnJsQXgcBsRHRauhrWwpBm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044013',6.4,1854,'en','The Second Woman','In flashback from a \'Rebecca\'-style beginning: Ellen Foster, visiting her aunt on the California coast, meets neighbor Jeff Cohalan and his ultramodern clifftop house. Ellen is strongly attracted to Jeff, who\'s being plagued by unexplainable accidents, major and minor. Bad luck, persecution...or paranoia? Warned that Jeff could be dangerous, Ellen fears that he\'s in danger, as the menacing atmosphere darkens.','/c6Bt8EEBcbPwSC642xQzSVSoQSd.jpg','1950-07-07',91,'Released','Not since \'SPELLBOUND\' such a masterpiece of suspense!','The Second Woman',62661,1.4779,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2725,_binary '\0','/8TYDLxvJZHP0Mc4Q1L8QjhtHLrb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044015',6.9,1760,'en','The Secret of Convict Lake','After a group of convicts escapes from prison, they take refuge in the wilderness. While most of the crew are ruthless sociopaths, Jim Canfield is an innocent man who was jailed under false pretenses. When Canfield and his fellow fugitives reach an isolated farming settlement where the men are all away, it creates tension with the local women. Things get direr when rumors of hidden money arise, and Canfield discovers that the man who framed him is part of the community.','/l69zTFXKVkefNiLq5AwUknJ2GMR.jpg','1951-07-29',83,'Released','6 women at the mercy of the west\'s most dangerous outlaws !','The Secret of Convict Lake',40642,2.9564,6.609,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2726,_binary '\0','/ArRVe2TdaSgXaTWM8N6P4lUGDms.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044030',6.8,5781,'en','Show Boat','A dashing Mississippi river gambler wins the affections of the daughter of the owner of the Show Boat.','/sk7s574pI9QAi6uVqbTg0bnLEUC.jpg','1951-07-19',107,'Released','It\'s NEW!','Show Boat',17820,2.8316,6.2,'AcGVUcc3Fn0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2727,_binary '\0','/5S1MHJJL1Z5d7Z3a8JvEeM8gOhK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044040',6.2,3149,'en','Sirocco','A mysterious American gets mixed up with gunrunners in Syria.','/9gsUSoeTlG1GfM7ckAxmHzkgi0n.jpg','1951-06-13',98,'Released','Beyond Casablanca... Fate, in a Low-cut Gown, Lies in Wait for Bogart!','Sirocco',30025,3.0661,6,'o-O3boYe0ek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2728,_binary '\0','/UfbtXEm4FopWpqBZVLOCOMjsnr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044060',7.5,7412,'sv','Sommarlek','During a brief summer vacation, a lonely woman recalls her first love thirteen years earlier.','/3Yl2nPAzBcygds63L6yf4g7I2k8.jpg','1951-10-01',96,'Released','An intimate love story—frank, fresh, and delightful in its telling!','Summer Interlude',47473,1.9568,7.355,'vW-f_la2-GA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2729,_binary '\0','/tt2NNBnxj9DqlT3k7LOvv4QjF6W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044072',7.4,5270,'en','The Steel Helmet','A ragtag group of American stragglers battles against superior Communist troops in an abandoned Buddhist temple during the Korean War.','/vaGLD07umhVJfma1lciYd4uIW4W.jpg','1951-01-24',85,'Released','Action story of our fighting G.I.\'s!','The Steel Helmet',46872,1.9284,6.995,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2730,_binary '\0','/dztPTbLGCg6rQzFJKUDCuff0YLO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044075',7.2,3302,'en','Storm Warning','A fashion model witnesses the brutal assassination of an investigative journalist by the Ku Klux Klan while traveling to a small town to visit her sister.','/rLQFeibR5q1OKaBGdyYaCssJoWh.jpg','1951-02-10',93,'Released','Behind this burning cross... Behind the loopholes in the law... Behind their cowardly hoods... They hide a thousand vicious crimes!','Storm Warning',35009,2.9154,6.604,'OE5Tmpkv-CM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2731,_binary '\0','/wBkjhgbbqwJqj90OSQXkNkN1KmQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044078',6.3,1455,'en','The Strange Door','The wicked Alain plots an elaborate revenge against his younger brother Edmund, leading to a deadly confrontation in his dungeon deathtrap.','/x614dZFKVzuHMwFhUD2WN1vjf4F.jpg','1951-10-31',81,'Released','Robert Louis Stevenson\'s masterpiece of Terror !','The Strange Door',39409,1.9688,6.176,'RJ1aMhY-9z8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2732,_binary '\0','/8Tnn2UOlecCKNLKG8ZK5Mu6bK94.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044079',7.9,149167,'en','Strangers on a Train','A charming psychopath tries to coerce a tennis star into his theory that two strangers can commit the perfect crime by exchanging murders—each killing the other’s most-hated person.','/ihC083U7ef56Ui4x0P0dobojrZ1.jpg','1951-06-27',101,'Released','It starts with a shriek of a train whistle... and ends with shrieking excitement!','Strangers on a Train',845,7.8017,7.7,'PC62NBWBkjM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2733,_binary '\0','/or90vNrOVnYwi07fYYpQ3pbnjxP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044081',7.9,119671,'en','A Streetcar Named Desire','A disturbed, aging Southern belle moves in with her sister for solace — but being face-to-face with her brutish brother-in-law accelerates her downward spiral.','/aicdlO5vt7z2ARm279eGzJeYCLQ.jpg','1951-09-18',122,'Released','...Blanche, who wanted so much to stay a lady...','A Streetcar Named Desire',702,7.7962,7.618,'U3CXLHLFvyM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2734,_binary '\0','/wmKtjGWzgUWUlUgnJ4yfIdUQPjg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044084',6.9,1559,'es','Subida al cielo','Newlywed Oliverio receives disturbing news that his mother is on her deathbed. He travels to a remote part of Mexico to fetch a lawyer who can sort out her will. Leaving his wife behind, he embarks on a bus ride that’s interrupted by an increasingly absurd series of episodes, including an impromptu birthday celebration; a one-legged man writhing in the mud; come-ons from an insatiable small-town belle, Raquel; and Oliverio’s frequent, Freudian nightmares.','/b8LLhwG4PqXFPHhGPOfp2qLXPMP.jpg','1952-06-25',80,'Released',NULL,'Mexican Bus Ride',44804,1.2449,6.605,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2735,_binary '\0','/2IbaHMUwb81cr7PwcvaXl0JtikP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044091',5.5,2830,'en','Superman and the Mole Men','Reporters Clark Kent and Lois Lane arrive in the small town of Silsby to witness the drilling of the world\'s deepest oil well. The drill, however, has penetrated the underground home of a race of small, furry people who then come to the surface at night to look around. The fact that they glow in the dark scares the townfolk, who form a mob, led by the vicious Luke Benson, intent on killing the strange people. Only Superman has a chance to prevent this tragedy.','/2zWramOLbIMfXSvXZJsUNasw27S.jpg','1951-11-23',58,'Released','ON THE SCREEN...America\'s Favorite Hero!','Superman and the Mole Men',41800,2.4153,5.319,'QygK8gYl-2M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2736,_binary '\0','/42ySUQ98lpKKOMmQtfhB5DJU9ow.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044103',7.1,4655,'en','The Tales of Hoffmann','A melancholy poet reflects on three women he loved and lost in the past: a mechanical performing doll, a Venetian courtesan, and the consumptive daughter of a celebrated composer.','/3rqMnYSLjFa9OYwoLhXLVacwhQ7.jpg','1951-04-04',127,'Released','You Will Never See Anything Finer On The Screen!','The Tales of Hoffmann',44334,2.7911,7.1,'HN82DTbamkA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2737,_binary '\0','/lxWgF3FPlcZMimXN0abRbmCZruu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044105',7.2,2800,'en','The Tall Target','A detective tries to prevent the assassination of President-elect Abraham Lincoln during a train ride headed for Washington in 1861.','/lEotfudS3jtF8A6gGV3B4y9kU9l.jpg','1951-08-17',78,'Released','You\'ll never see the target till the very end!','The Tall Target',27263,1.6406,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2738,_binary '\0','/alw8uAIPYoApSvGnjmpTma53yWJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044110',6,1326,'en','Ten Tall Men','Sgt. Mike Kincaid of the French Foreign Legion learns, from a Riff prisoner, that an attack will soon be made by the villainous Hussin on the Legion\'s outpost of Tarfa. Kincaid volunteers to lead nine other Legionnaires on a mission to delay Hussin\'s attack till reinforcements arrive. When he discovers that Hussin plans to marry Mahla, a girl from a rival tribe, in order to build a coalition against the French, Kincaid kidnaps Mahla. Hussin forcefully takes her back, but by now his planned attack on Tarfa is crumbling and Mahla has begun to fall in love with Kincaid.','/f6ZdVuBvdzR9fbK343uwPmocWtq.jpg','1951-10-26',97,'Released','LUSTY! GUSTY! RARING TO GO!','Ten Tall Men',115834,2.0578,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2739,_binary '\0','/6D7ZX0SKyK3wTmLhg9qiGp2id7V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044119',6.1,1275,'en','That\'s My Boy','Jack Jackson, the greatest football player in Ridgefield College history, is disappointed that his only son Junior is an uncoordinated, allergy-ridden bookworm. He uses his athletic reputation and standing as #1 alumni contributor to pressure the coach to take Junior onto the team. In addition, he pays the tuition of Junior\'s financially needy classmate Bill Baker, a potential all-American, with the understanding that he will room with Junior and mentor him athletically and socially. Junior\'s initial efforts as quarterback prove disastrous and further complications arise when the room mates both fall in love with the same co-ed.','/pd0q88EMkUMRYubH9adwyzr3DnY.jpg','1951-05-31',104,'Released','MADCAPS OF THE CAMPUS!','That\'s My Boy',53718,2.1718,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2740,_binary '\0','/30aHDHSHGX4HEeKlrgCwhTU72QP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044121',7,36067,'en','The Thing from Another World','Scientists and US Air Force officials fend off a blood-thirsty alien organism while investigating at a remote arctic outpost.','/rm2w8dEhOGDuckB6i0Spz9lTzpR.jpg','1951-04-05',87,'Released','Natural or Supernatural?','The Thing from Another World',10785,4.6414,6.7,'vs2lXH1aFZ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2741,_binary '\0','/lUt2AzGAvaN95wuQpU1dpiMmvYU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044128',6.8,1610,'en','Thunder on the Hill','Sister Mary presides over a convent where a convicted murderess, who is being escorted to Death Row, is stranded by bad weather. She is slowly becoming convinced that Valerie is innocent so Sister Mary sets about to clear the girl and bring the real killer to justice.','/rfIMctcB4BrkpUQ17ZEhnZSlt1.jpg','1951-10-17',84,'Released','Six desperate people...hiding one guilty secret!','Thunder on the Hill',77066,2.498,6.4,'FA9TRHD3J8k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2742,_binary '\0','/pPonQC0mQAZQ5jzZAcKu0mGdNtH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044135',6.4,1284,'en','Tomahawk','In 1866, a new gold discovery and an inconclusive conference force the U.S. Army to build a road and fort in territory ceded by previous treaty to the Sioux...to the disgust of frontier scout Jim Bridger, whose Cheyenne wife led him to see the conflict from both sides. The powder-keg situation needs only a spark to bring war, and violent bigots like Lieut. Rob Dancy are all too likely to provide this. Meanwhile, Bridger\'s chance of preventing catastrophe is dimmed by equally wrenching personal conflicts. Unusually accurate historically.','/jnGomJATrts0A4TKhBEZqyqlIzR.jpg','1951-02-05',82,'Released','The Glory Story of the Great Sioux Indian Uprising!','Tomahawk',39018,1.832,7,'MdHovhMIwg4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2743,_binary '\0','/A8WJUxlWcdHFCjKVBGPfhJJpNxR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044136',7.1,2015,'en','Tomorrow Is Another Day','A man who spent his formative years in prison for murder is released, and struggles to adjust to the outside world and escape his lurid past. He gets involved with a cheap dancehall girl, and when her protector is accidentally killed, they go on the lam together, getting jobs as farm labourers. But some fellow workers get wise to them.','/qp2w8o7UZCqfE8Aq3CGo7i932km.jpg','1951-08-08',90,'Released','The take their lives in their hands... when they take each other in their arms!','Tomorrow Is Another Day',29467,1.5983,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2744,_binary '\0','/jCVUStB1Pd8mpQkMx3qgaECZQtB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044167',4.2,1636,'en','Unknown World','With the cyclotram, an atomic-powered rock-boring vehicle, Dr. Jerimiah Morley leads an expedition into a subterranean world.','/gjF34MepQwZBGuc3mumLwmjeCo3.jpg','1951-10-26',74,'Released','Drilling into the forbidding depths of the earth!','Unknown World',27185,1.4239,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2745,_binary '\0','/ar0U96O9sZ1VYmhSXzqb3vzlUlQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044186',5.9,2850,'en','Vengeance Valley','A cattle baron takes in an orphaned boy and raises him, causing his own son to resent the boy. As they get older the resentment festers into hatred, and eventually the real son frames his stepbrother for fathering an illegitimate child that is actually his, seeing it as an opportunity to get his half-brother out of the way so he can have his father\'s empire all to himself.','/yIiXDUWV2ka5116V4snpCBRsn0b.jpg','1951-02-14',83,'Released','Burt Lancaster in His BIGGEST Outdoor Adventure Drama!','Vengeance Valley',43384,2.5525,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2746,_binary '\0','/reQH3DULLA9cEJbRwofnsccntA9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044188',7,1325,'de','Der Verlorene','A German scientist murders his fiancée during World War II when he learns that she has been selling the results of his secret research to the enemy.','/rTjLxVby8Y4jvkyEpW6g08iBttC.jpg','1951-09-07',98,'Released',NULL,'The Lost One',88176,1.1122,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2747,_binary '\0','/9zVe7ugr3I7WFSSArV6xsQ42y9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044205',7.6,4487,'en','Westward the Women','There\'s a deficit of good, honest women in the West, and Roy Whitman wants to change that. His solution is to bring a caravan of over 100 mail-order brides from Chicago to California. It will be a long, difficult and dangerous journey for the women. So Whitman hires hardened, cynical Buck Wyatt to be their guide across the inhospitable frontier. But as disaster strikes on the trail, Buck just might discover that these women are stronger than he thinks.','/ys78QNYypeTxhJKQVL78JzO6Faq.jpg','1951-12-16',118,'Released','The BIG MGM Spectacle ! HE LED 200 WOMEN ON AN ADVENTURE THAT MOST MEN FEARED TO FACE!','Westward the Women',101557,2.7714,7.1,'F4uey4-H6wU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2748,_binary '\0','/3yq46OSqqCqh6nP36guN1WAwwVy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044207',6.6,10563,'en','When Worlds Collide','When a group of astronomers calculate a star is on a course to slam into Earth, a few days before, it\'s accompanying planet will first pass close enough to the Earth to cause havoc on land and sea. They set about building a rocket so a few selected individuals can escape to the planet.','/zVBEXGxtnD83t0PfKm9uZbnpDbA.jpg','1951-09-14',83,'Released','Planets destroy earth!','When Worlds Collide',16380,2.6048,6.359,'7jP2l9Ya3RY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2749,_binary '\0','/e0MsKelKuPRh4kSTmmnrsxRk1iT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044314',7.6,6165,'en','5 Fingers','During WWII, the valet to the British Ambassador to Ankara sells British secrets to the Germans while trying to romance a refugee Polish countess.','/bjD5qcUGjQIZUAeyMJBnXDuN6SW.jpg','1952-02-22',108,'Released','The true story of the most fabulous spy of all time!','5 Fingers',59087,2.6473,7.5,'eOXY0n5XdQ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2750,_binary '\0','/6aTGJ1iXwNKwuZz007kAqNDiYM1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044320',5.7,2480,'en','Abbott and Costello Meet Captain Kidd','Two hapless waiters in a tavern on the Spanish Main play cupid between aristocratic Lady Jane and tavern co-worker Bruce Martindale, but the two bumpkins mix-up a love letter with Captain Kidd\'s treasure map of Skull Island, leading to them being kidnapped and taken off to the notorious pirate\'s island.','/7w4jGvuf2l6dGos3J1M3POdyrwa.jpg','1952-12-27',70,'Released','It\'s one big roar, from shore to shore!','Abbott and Costello Meet Captain Kidd',63795,2.5299,6,'njeiByeaLiQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2751,_binary '\0','/jUdRs8ZzNqHoD9hQ15iIujwLCw1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044324',6.9,1521,'en','Above and Beyond','The story of Colonel Paul Tibbets, the pilot that dropped the atomic bomb on Hiroshima. Although unaware of the full potential of this new weapon, he knows that it can do tremendously more damage than any other weapon used before, and that the death toll resulting from it will be huge. He is reluctant to be the person who will end so many lives, but as time goes on, the pressure upon him only increase.','/gCPfp4GCKhQtGwBtTITRIFdJcQr.jpg','1953-01-02',122,'Released','The love story behind the billion dollar secret!','Above and Beyond',80806,1.851,6.2,'w5HYnn83HME','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2752,_binary '\0','/dArOk8vUcyODF57ccD0c8w7n3E5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044331',6.6,3638,'en','Affair in Trinidad','A nightclub singer enlists her brother-in-law to track down her husband\'s killer.','/osRNszY1Adrq28K06mWQID9EnLC.jpg','1952-07-29',98,'Released','\"You weren\'t the first... and you won\'t be the last!\"','Affair in Trinidad',61430,2.5404,6.4,'woqpTCS5VoE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2753,_binary '\0','/ozupKX4X2tbiJhpEEzAsDZc5R6r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044333',6.5,3277,'en','Against All Flags','In the 18th century, the pirates of Madagascar, lords of the Republic of Libertatia and masters of the Indian Ocean, live in an impregnable natural fortress, killing, robbing and plundering with impunity, so the British Navy hatches a daring plan to destroy them.','/oTmHsKdSparDyqu5JMKmLzzS8Ky.jpg','1952-12-24',81,'Released','The greatest sea adventure of the them all!','Against All Flags',44631,2.7942,6,'_Df8i7unFbY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2754,_binary '\0','/4qTuhQTKWzHUx5tw3kE2TxW2cux.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044357',7.2,10280,'en','Angel Face','Ambulance driver Frank Jessup is ensnared in the schemes of the sensuous but dangerous Diane Tremayne.','/c4wrCYEgEtLXxoyEZf4pBl6XD4V.jpg','1953-01-02',91,'Released','She loved one man …enough to KILL to get him!','Angel Face',1938,2.9334,7.079,'da4jHmpKFU0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2755,_binary '\0','/cfYKYL7hx3AvqLRwPjoYgIP7ZDX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044364',6.8,4219,'en','Another Man\'s Poison','Mystery novelist Janet Frobisher, lives in an isolated house, having been separated for years from her criminal husband. She has fallen in love with her secretary\'s fiancé and when her estranged husband unexpectedly returns, Janet poisons him, but just as she\'s about to dispose of the body, one of her husband\'s criminal cohorts also shows up.','/c1l9H43tauTdy4PZaekywdLYY5x.jpg','1951-11-20',90,'Released','She Had Everything You Could Give A Woman To Torment A Man!','Another Man\'s Poison',53714,2.0073,6.8,'nkELrGEz72Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2756,_binary '\0','/pknxDvJgdsDWLAvwxVvKiWRezB9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044370',5.9,1696,'en','April in Paris','A series of misunderstandings leads to a chorus girl traveling to Paris to represent the American theater, where she falls in love with a befuddled bureaucrat.','/4O9FSBPt6BXF75MwBNrpYIaRIiM.jpg','1952-12-24',100,'Released','When they sing... your heart dances! When they dance... your heart sings!','April in Paris',40693,1.7295,4.9,'QghKcPWhmf8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2757,_binary '\0','/1cmKxkRkiGYo0DaPSYZOwYG1Yx2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044386',6.6,5154,'en','Robinson Crusoe','The titular adventurer, after defying his parents to go to sea, survives a shipwreck and becomes a castaway on a deserted island for nearly thirty years, learning to build a new life from scratch, discovering companionship with a native man he names Friday, and eventually returning to civilisation a changed man, finding wealth and new challenges.','/jZU3j6mVlidq5G1Hr6wpfS1Pwlj.jpg','1954-08-05',90,'Released','Every thrill-swept page blazes to life on the screen!','Robinson Crusoe',54979,2.0609,6.324,'f195WWXMt-A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2758,_binary '\0','/jVyVSD0w4Bg3r67geP0LvkizfC5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044391',7.7,18013,'en','The Bad and the Beautiful','Told in flashback form, the film traces the rise and fall of a tough, ambitious Hollywood producer, Jonathan Shields, as seen through the eyes of various acquaintances, including a writer, James Lee Bartlow; a star, Georgia Lorrison; and a director, Fred Amiel. He is a hard-driving, ambitious man who ruthlessly uses everyone on the way to becoming one of Hollywood\'s top movie makers.','/ajAXzTiPkL7JxeCRw5lQBqrKNGx.jpg','1952-12-25',118,'Released','I took you out of the gutter... I can fling you back!','The Bad and the Beautiful',32499,4.321,7.3,'T4mG-4HBn1w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2759,_binary '\0','/g94EddQ2dldPmLQGaLclhKiojbv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044406',3.6,2770,'en','Bela Lugosi Meets a Brooklyn Gorilla','The entertainment duo Mitchell & Petrillo, en route to a USO show for troops in Guam, fall out of their plane and end up on the jungle island of Cola Cola, where the mad scientist Dr. Zabor is conducting evolutionary experiments.','/oW9A5kF7nbqdhGEPIFWAGTSsqVJ.jpg','1952-09-04',74,'Released','A horror film that will stiffen you with laughter!','Bela Lugosi Meets a Brooklyn Gorilla',38404,1.6791,3.5,'OrRtIp3jylk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2760,_binary '\0','/9mdELZDEekUH2R4YD3aVoXaYizQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044408',6.1,1238,'en','The Belle of New York','In squeaky-clean New York at the turn of the century, playboy Charlie Hill falls so much in love that he can walk on air. The object of his affections is beautiful Angela Bonfils, a mission house worker in the Bowery. He promises to reform his dissolute life, even trying to do an honest day\'s work.','/lauMXPbB6ZhT3snMSXdzAF8jOYb.jpg','1952-02-22',82,'Released','M.G.M\'s Gay TECHNICOLOR Musical!','The Belle of New York',43366,1.7862,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2761,_binary '\0','/feVBQEga57PvtT4RerDgEbUcuao.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044410',6.5,1227,'en','Belles on Their Toes','The \"Cheaper by the Dozen\" crew is back, sans Clifton Webb. Lillian is struggling to make ends meet without her husband\'s income, while Anne, Martha, and even Ernestine find romance.','/mQb9vtlMy5qJhaAjktNdok4TYeU.jpg','1952-05-02',89,'Released','The new adventures of the \"Cheaper By the Dozen\" family!','Belles on Their Toes',50549,2.3058,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2762,_binary '\0','/qiL8TkEUcKwZExd9UHO5rp3woYD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044413',7.2,11082,'en','Bend of the River','Two men with questionable pasts, Glyn McLyntock and his friend Cole, lead a wagon-train load of homesteaders from Missouri to the Oregon territory...','/pffOvEVDt6XRWDwBkmQ6zWITakJ.jpg','1952-01-23',91,'Released','The greatness... the glory... the fury... of the Northwest Frontier!','Bend of the River',38732,3.6772,7.1,'cfa6dEYSVrU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2763,_binary '\0','/vMnlabFCmIySst1aTHYo4iUXnVf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044417',6.7,2600,'en','Beware, My Lovely','A psychopath on the run takes a job as a handyman at the house of a lonely widow.','/eAbmuXqrmNxF8OG3yQaiBnt6Y0s.jpg','1952-08-29',77,'Released','Trapped by a man beyond control!','Beware, My Lovely',43191,1.4494,6.1,'Ti_A50yir_4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2764,_binary '\0','/tHhKsrdmOBbQi9XwbYIRcGna8x8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044418',5.2,2491,'en','Big Jim McLain','House Un-American Activities Committee investigators Jim McLain and Mal Baxter come to post war Hawaii to track Communist Party activities even though belonging to the party was legal at the time. They are interested in everything from insurance fraud to the sabotage of a U.S. naval vessel.','/uVt7D7LaFGo2B6hmYGOsJSZ5jz0.jpg','1952-08-30',90,'Released','FILMED in HAWAII and FILLED with EXCITEMENT!','Big Jim McLain',40715,1.9648,5,'A2KxV4X1MF4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2765,_binary '\0','/7mVxlq9ln4USELWdbmulSprVMAa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044419',6.9,5379,'en','The Big Sky','Two tough Kentucky mountaineers join a trading expedition from St. Louis up the Missouri River to trade whisky for furs with the Blackfoot Indians. They soon discover that there is much more than the elements to contend with.','/iAmNnANi9XK9l0AMC7JCuSGBnT4.jpg','1952-08-19',133,'Released','Theirs the great adventure...','The Big Sky',43367,2.2829,6.6,'LepAacvaEO4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2766,_binary '\0','/d6OTMZbbCEwtXVSQDS960pWBUgz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044420',5.7,2065,'en','The Big Trees','In 1900, unscrupulous timber baron Jim Fallon plans to take advantage of a new law and make millions off California redwood. Much of the land he hopes to grab has been homesteaded by a Quaker colony, who try to persuade him to spare the giant sequoias...but these are the very trees he wants most. Expert at manipulating others, Fallon finds that other sharks are at his own heels, and forms an unlikely alliance.','/5BPeNZ1cfFMDVZDl3G63U6WatyC.jpg','1952-02-05',89,'Released','MAMMOTH REDWOOD WILDERNESS -- TREASURE PILED TO THE SKY!','The Big Trees',43368,1.7765,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2767,_binary '\0','/7S1CFRrOUqQJtjS1p8IrZio3UMK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044423',6.3,2017,'en','The Black Castle','Englishman Sir Ronald Burton enters the castle of Austrian nobleman Count von Bruno, complete with torture chamber and moat, while investigating the disappearance of two friends.','/sqZ2fmT8kp2VOMEI8yh3RsAxPqy.jpg','1952-10-31',82,'Released','Terror Stalks Its Turreted Battlements... and Horror Crawls the Catacombs Beneath!','The Black Castle',30345,1.5648,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2768,_binary '\0','/vAIE8dnMt1g3bCgbr4R6qTpjgjO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044426',5.9,1930,'en','Blackbeard, the Pirate','Honest Robert Maynard finds himself serving as ship\'s surgeon under the infamous pirate Blackbeard.','/ocuraoHR7bclHL9SUuV5GNYYBPh.jpg','1952-12-24',99,'Released','The thunder of their plundering shook the earth, the seas, the sky!','Blackbeard, the Pirate',120509,2.0178,5.9,'HIDBE5d0TYY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2769,_binary '\0','/bXGp7yGlHjvqUUaQJo5mtFLc77.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044429',7.2,1842,'ar','صراع في الوادي','A wealthy landlord floods and destroys a village on purpose to prevent the people living there from making a profit off their crops. What he doesn\'t know is that his own daughter, Amal, is in love with Ahmed, a young man from the village.','/x2LEsBwFOajHK80K8gxq9cv9dfH.jpg','1954-03-01',116,'Released','Struggle in the Valley','The Blazing Sun',199456,1.9228,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2770,_binary '\0','/ycw1LTBimIrYIKegutP0SGULZG8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044446',6.7,2701,'en','The Sound Barrier','A young RAF pilot tests his father-in-law’s prototype supersonic aircraft to the limit, at a time of intense development in the field of aviation, just as commercial jet airliners are about to enter service.','/cExgxdISr0gEvVr74mmpEL4yLh4.jpg','1952-07-22',117,'Released',NULL,'The Sound Barrier',51619,1.9769,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2771,_binary '\0','/uTrf7aWMduVdjLsRDi5SUq5B1hA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044453',7.2,2489,'es','El bruto','A tough young man, who helps to kick poor people out of their houses, falls in love with a girl. She lives with her father in the building about to be demolished.','/mLSssRzdL1Ww4mje7sBoirWJTv6.jpg','1953-02-05',81,'Released',NULL,'The Brute',42502,1.8109,6.942,'eaBLUX9lKw4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2772,_binary '\0','/7vE0d4PEtGB030VPMy4BqurJGFl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044476',6.6,1498,'en','The Captive City','A small-town newspaper editor defies threats to expose the mob.','/qL0PE0B6klruRntPfuZmQywCOxL.jpg','1952-03-26',91,'Released','NO PUNCHES PULLED...NO TRUTHS UNTOLD!','The Captive City',62006,1.557,6.1,'qQtrnJeNfP8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2773,_binary '\0','/gJiU2HeLU4ZyeD79Go35xLbLwpF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044480',6.9,2236,'en','Carbine Williams','David Marshall Williams is sent to a prison farm where he works in the tool shop and eventually develops the precursor of the famous M-1 Carbine automatic rifle used in World War II.','/cxD7BIOWcmmxflBiymKimyQBhrC.jpg','1952-05-01',92,'Released','This is my Story','Carbine Williams',43961,1.9052,6.6,'ke_rMbccnmc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2774,_binary '\0','/8A7Xmpsaph7xOlcsqtXs53ieYWM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044486',7.3,3151,'en','Carrie','In the late 1890s, the ambitious, innocent Carrie arrives in Chicago’s South Side and stays with her nagging, dullish married sister. She then runs for help to traveling salesman Charles Drouet. She soon becomes his mistress, but falls in love with married restaurant manager George Hurstwood.','/hif1GraUbvlocgqtrwYMaybsGcJ.jpg','1952-07-17',118,'Released',NULL,'Carrie',43358,2.4552,6.413,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2775,_binary '\0','/sCFbxavogjcE6xTnT71nZxTV5ia.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044487',7,3810,'en','Le Carrosse d\'or','A viceroy, a nobleman and a bullfighter court a comedy-troupe actress in 18th-century Peru.','/6x1JnbgsUarHnLRmqnprhzQwWlR.jpg','1952-12-05',105,'Released',NULL,'The Golden Coach',56167,1.913,7.1,'wn3EfdigfNI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2776,_binary '\0','/un6nn4ZJ6eASeMpcyk4lzNH5DFG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044488',6.4,1411,'en','Carson City','Mine owner William Sharon keeps having his gold shipments held up by a gang of bandits. Sharon hires banker Charles Crocker, who happens to have connections in the Central Pacific Railroad, to build a spur line from Virginia City to Carson City, so that the gold can be shipped by railroad. Silent Jeff Kincaid is the railroad engineer. However there is opposition to the railroad, chiefly from another mine owner, Big Jack Davis.','/dUSZEoRWQV4tIqP4K00S0gN3zii.jpg','1952-06-13',87,'Released','He comes tearing in with a gun and a grin ... to carve a new notch in the Silver Belt of Nevada !','Carson City',72472,2.0707,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2777,_binary '\0','/407aCg7nde0oRPFqpnBIHrlmAAG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044497',7.6,1514,'ja','原爆の子','Shows the devastation caused by the atomic bomb, and by use of a fictional storyline, portrays the struggle of the ordinary Japanese people in dealing with the aftermath.','/od3ZsMNLJvfqqQUCqmbawnmRdno.jpg','1952-08-06',97,'Released',NULL,'Children of Hiroshima',77057,1.6439,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2778,_binary '\0','/obROG3k0E2hIhKzPppvWGzFNUBz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044502',7,8463,'en','Clash by Night','An embittered woman seeks escape in marriage, only to fall for her husband’s best friend.','/zhGWvfuKUSeOZZaHJrIGyluGLZY.jpg','1952-05-30',105,'Released','Livin’ in my house! Lovin’ another man! Is that what you call bein’ honest? That’s just givin’ it a nice name!','Clash by Night',24003,2.6018,6.683,'tTPXgZLsiRE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2779,_binary '\0','/knfUsQTZmCKj8Z1wCmt55YVsi8H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044509',7.5,5921,'en','Come Back, Little Sheba','A mismatched couple\'s marital problems come to the surface when the husband develops an interest in their pretty boarder.','/3hg3c6TVFVGuoqmHi0Yw25qvpRu.jpg','1953-03-06',96,'Released',NULL,'Come Back, Little Sheba',84214,2.5214,7.272,'qT6Yi2DHFII','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2780,_binary '\0','/tqtgrJm6EYKTFozDH8POJqcY3Vj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044517',7.1,7715,'en','The Crimson Pirate','Burt Lancaster plays a pirate with a taste for intrigue and acrobatics who involves himself in the goings on of a revolution in the Caribbean in the late 1700s. A light hearted adventure involving prison breaks, an oddball scientist, sailing ships, naval fights and tons of swordplay.','/lOSqs9ntb2wB7gveCx2l7cqC1nG.jpg','1952-09-27',105,'Released','MAN OF NINE LIVES AND 1000 SURPRISES!','The Crimson Pirate',11570,3.1894,7.009,'Izws4RmQUBo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2781,_binary '\0','/pbBNQ6i0TURuznGSwBphiWWadzi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044533',7.2,4896,'en','Deadline - U.S.A.','New York City newspaper The Day is in trouble. Even though editor Ed Hutcheson has worked hard running the paper, its circulation has been steadily declining. Now the publisher\'s widow wants to sell the paper, which will most likely mean its end. Hutcheson\'s only hope is to finish his exposé on a dangerous gangster before the sale is finalized.','/xioYj4tRukm2BETibaJwXlQar2V.jpg','1952-05-23',87,'Released','20th Century-Fox savagely turns the spotlight of truth on revenge killings that shocked a nation !','Deadline - U.S.A.',36334,3.9655,6.929,'CniKtNOzzuE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2782,_binary '\0','/bH3vJsIAjFAqce45ASdu8zh2co1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044552',6.8,1702,'en','Diplomatic Courier','During the Cold War, diplomatic courier Mike Kells must retrieve a dispatch containing top-secret intelligence. But when he arrives at the meeting point, a train station in Salzburg, his contact turns up dead, and the message is nowhere to be found. With no clear suspect in sight, Kells must sort through his uncertain relationships with two women, while sidestepping the pitfalls of subterfuge, sabotage and spies in his search for the documents.','/fF3q6LXQFfCD09QlJwXog2wQfNd.jpg','1952-06-13',97,'Released','Number 1 target for 1,000 enemy agents... from Paris to Salzburg to Trieste..!','Diplomatic Courier',4462,1.8389,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2783,_binary '\0','/ztYkb29H1vZ0ug7SjlmH3mIu1Np.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044557',6.9,9769,'en','Don\'t Bother to Knock','An airline pilot pursues a live-in babysitter at his hotel and gradually realizes she is not as stable as perhaps she should be.','/btbTidQlmg8brVHC7tN0HnAy8Dm.jpg','1952-07-18',76,'Released','… a wicked sensation as the lonely girl in room 809!','Don\'t Bother to Knock',24005,3.3655,6.6,'7eaFrgobiUM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2784,_binary '\0','/y4ca4INgytr9QMfRqw0i4mHHMlw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044573',6.4,2166,'en','The Duel at Silver Creek','When a gang of ruthless claim jumpers brutally murders his miner father, a gunman known as the Silver Kid joins forces with the local marshal to free the tiny town of Silver City from the clutches of the dastardly villains.','/2Qj29Mz2SehlVJxlmz9yLvktH8i.jpg','1952-09-05',77,'Released','Gun Against Gun For The Rule Of The Town!','The Duel at Silver Creek',60547,2.3475,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2785,_binary '\0','/u2bPVcP0Gku9jGfxUIB0n0ud61Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044602',7.1,3824,'fr','Fanfan la Tulipe','Fanfan is a young handsome peasant. He joins the army to escape marriage because a gypsy girl predicted he will get glory and the king\'s daughter as a wife. But the gypsy girl was in fact Adeline, the daughter of the recruiting officer. Once he has discovered the stratagem, Fanfan refuses to forget this dream and decides to fulfill the destiny of the fake prediction.','/kdhnzJfcwvi0i6a8wqasRN3sq6l.jpg','1952-03-20',102,'Released',NULL,'Fan-Fan the Tulip',62547,2.372,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2786,_binary '\0','/y22C1YyK8YXjU8LHoyA06MclOs6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044672',6.5,17590,'en','The Greatest Show on Earth','To ensure a full profitable season, circus manager Brad Braden engages The Great Sebastian, though this moves his girlfriend Holly from her hard-won center trapeze spot. Holly and Sebastian begin a dangerous one-upmanship duel in the ring, while he pursues her on the ground.','/cKI0yGPRh1IlvRKKJRoMZruior8.jpg','1952-02-16',152,'Released','The Heartbeat Story of Circus People, Filmed with the Cooperation of Ringling Bros. - Barnum and Bailey Circus!','The Greatest Show on Earth',27191,4.5203,6.3,'8GJHCicaOs0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2787,_binary '\0','/iDXynXmwYzlRDmOYJd558ZOXDWV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044683',6.7,2037,'en','Hangman\'s Knot','In 1865, a troop of Confederate soldiers led by Major Matt Stewart attack the wagon of gold escorted by Union cavalry and the soldiers are killed. The only wounded survivor tells that the war ended one month ago, and the group decides to take the gold and meet their liaison that knew that the war ended but did not inform the troop. The harsh Rolph Bainter kills the greedy man and the soldiers flee in his wagon driven by Major Stewart. When they meet a posse chasing them, Stewart gives wrong information to misguide the group; however, they have an accident with the wagon and lose the horses. They decide to stop a stagecoach and force the driver to transport them, but the posse returns and they are trapped in the station with the passenger. They realize that the men are not deputies and have no intention to bring them to justice but take the stolen gold.','/ifpv8Tyxg4h33HrkkeDSpBr37ki.jpg','1952-11-15',81,'Released','It Happened When A Killer With A Rope Ruled Nevada!','Hangman\'s Knot',53651,3.3952,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2788,_binary '\0','/b7JozC8zQE9P5Uj485EuqwhAics.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044685',6.9,4666,'en','Hans Christian Andersen','A small-town shoemaker with a knack for spinning yarns, Hans encounters happiness and heartbreak on his road to becoming a full-fledged writer.','/auHA8xsD452GDCY2KdHGgYPmDPf.jpg','1952-12-19',112,'Released','The glorious story of the greatest storyteller of them all!','Hans Christian Andersen',16618,1.5276,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2789,_binary '\0','/raYHhtIDyh3qDS6WdyRzeqjLyIK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044706',7.9,117374,'en','High Noon','Will Kane, the sheriff of a small town in New Mexico, learns a notorious outlaw he put in jail has been freed, and will be arriving on the noon train. Knowing the outlaw and his gang are coming to kill him, Kane is determined to stand his ground, so he attempts to gather a posse from among the local townspeople.','/qETSMQ4IXBSAS409Z9OL0ppXWTW.jpg','1952-06-09',85,'Released','The story of a man who was too proud to run!','High Noon',288,10.0151,7.7,'BralwMf3Awg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2790,_binary '\0','/uH1Z4v7iXGYcgIZ6vIb7loMNXr6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044716',7.3,2343,'en','The Holly and the Ivy','An English clergyman\'s neglect of his grown children, in his zeal to tend to his parishioners, comes to the surface at a Christmas family gathering.','/ivKbMaB1KLZf4gaogkxRs7EHmMQ.jpg','1952-12-03',83,'Released','A LOVE STORY OF RARE QUALITY flavored with delightful characterizations and priceless humor.','The Holly and the Ivy',79817,1.9871,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2791,_binary '\0','/rJVeWfLC1GyOdotLytdAQhWyUKY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044722',6.4,1382,'en','Horizons West','Following the Civil War, brothers Dan and Neil Hammond return to Texas, where ambitious Dan turns to rustling and then shady land deals to build an empire. Being held for a murder, he\'s rescued from a lynch mob by Neil, now the Marshal, but they have an inevitable falling-out.','/rFV5wxIQTWytlZQksRJMceEhV1L.jpg','1952-10-11',81,'Released','LAWLESS RUTHLESS DEFIANCE!','Horizons West',60535,2.0622,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2792,_binary '\0','/pQ06lTkmJd1mbotdl847HoV2iaA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044741',8.3,103963,'ja','生きる','Kanji Watanabe is a middle-aged man who has worked in the same monotonous bureaucratic position for decades. Learning he has cancer, he starts to look for the meaning of his life.','/dgNTS4EQDDVfkzJI5msKuHu2Ei3.jpg','1952-10-09',143,'Released','A big story of a little man which will grip your soul...','Ikiru',3782,9.3184,8.3,'geKhyNerWM8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2793,_binary '\0','/inQrNyGxELqWxzPuam45WQpfvEy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044744',7.4,6967,'en','The Importance of Being Earnest','Two young gentlemen living in 1890s England use the same pseudonym (\'Ernest\') on the sly, which is fine until they both fall in love with women using that name, which leads to a comedy of mistaken identities.','/ahHp1nOjLTWBdLCofxjLYMVqqgs.jpg','1952-06-02',95,'Released','They don\'t come any wilder than Oscar Wilde\'s classic comedy of manners, morals and morality!','The Importance of Being Earnest',20324,3.3412,7.2,'QNi9o5HUcuU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2794,_binary '\0','/t3MaIRN5YClpymyjFXOy3bbM3tL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044750',3.6,1959,'en','Invasion, U.S.A.','A group of American witness the deadly invasion of the United States by the Soviet Union.','/Y7ovODwkyGH149SXPEpiSY9sQk.jpg','1952-12-10',73,'Released','See New York topple! See San Francisco in flames! See Boulder Dam destroyed!','Invasion, U.S.A.',46145,1.7053,3.4,'cNZaMm5q_BA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2795,_binary '\0','/pKAq05IpPBoO6B6xmhiLoCvPCGD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044760',6.7,11455,'en','Ivanhoe','Sir Walter Scott\'s classic story of the chivalrous Ivanhoe who joins with Robin of Locksley in the fight against Prince John and for the return of King Richard the Lionheart.','/2Se7dafuvchdSr6vdZ5L0DXsYWv.jpg','1952-07-31',106,'Released','At Last on the Screen ! Biggest Spectacle since QUO VADIS!','Ivanhoe',26175,3.175,6.842,'3Ch5eUAhPtE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2796,_binary '\0','/8FviMNXvzW4o17Dx2noM7cXz3XU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044762',5.8,3839,'en','Jack and the Beanstalk','Two down-on-their-luck loafers take a job babysitting, with a bedtime story of the titular tale turning into a wacky Abbott and Costello-faced musical retelling involving stolen cows, terrible giants, and the heroic boy with an opportunistic butcher in a castle above the clouds.','/psogkzcA2yOT0Tz669i0Lm1eZXM.jpg','1952-04-07',78,'Released','Be happy go wacky!','Jack and the Beanstalk',18698,2.2911,5.7,'Xc8ZrxH3yzM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2797,_binary '\0','/iM1rglBh98DcmEkrI169zDXwt0d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044774',6.2,1262,'en','Jumping Jacks','Nightclub entertainer Hap Smith has a new act since his former partner Chick Allen joined the army. With his lovely new female partner, Hap now plays a clownish parody of a soldier. When Chick organises a soldier show at Fort Benning, he realizes he needs his former partner\'s help—so, to get onto the base, Hap impersonates a hapless real soldier, but circumstances force them to prolong the masquerade, creating an increasingly tangled Army-sized SNAFU.','/v2E61e3iyn6fO4V4SiT0hRstpMg.jpg','1952-06-11',96,'Released','IT\'S A RIP-ROARING RIOT! When Dean and Jerry Reach For Their Rip-Cords...','Jumping Jacks',43359,2.0454,6.5,'9g0uLqEYN24','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2798,_binary '\0','/z9Hs1wbcJycRL0y0QOr3CNZw48K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044789',7.3,9291,'en','Kansas City Confidential','An ex-convict sets out to uncover who framed him for an armored car robbery.','/2RcTYPzsR0QfN5d8g3HjIkIqcbg.jpg','1952-11-11',100,'Released','The Crime That Shocked The Nation!','Kansas City Confidential',21296,2.5008,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2799,_binary '\0','/usZCxiu4qqL4H8O8x5Pltrgd0VT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044811',7,3368,'sv','Kvinnors väntan','The four wives of four brothers share stories of their marriages as they wait for their husbands in a small, secluded cottage.','/bUUTuh376ppUQJCzpjz4PSWNohv.jpg','1952-11-03',104,'Released','The love affairs of three women - marital... premarital... and one marvelous surprise!','Waiting Women',69544,2.2542,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2800,_binary '\0','/b0G5lXN6MCIXaqJa2xVMxjeqfGu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044825',6.4,1789,'en','The Las Vegas Story','When newlyweds visit Las Vegas, the wife\'s shady past comes to the surface.','/mjLqvTC16CoWAir5ynyokARszzG.jpg','1952-01-30',88,'Released','Las Vegas... where everybody plays a game! And these two play the oldest game on earth... with a new twist!','The Las Vegas Story',26283,2.1627,6,'Bso54TGLJ28','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2801,_binary '\0','/vPA53RF6clLSWlpoCLgYvmygiOl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044829',7.5,17126,'en','The Lavender Hill Mob','A meek bank clerk who oversees the shipments of bullion joins with an eccentric neighbor to steal gold bars and smuggle them out of the country.','/u4mZyim3CwXHu0zVhXjfK8fqoN7.jpg','1951-06-28',78,'Released','The men who broke the bank and lost the cargo!','The Lavender Hill Mob',32961,3.5684,7.183,'-_wbootYMio','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2802,_binary '\0','/q5vgDhmDS4EoYWrk9f9nqYZGDOw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044837',8,24247,'en','Limelight','A fading music hall comedian tries to help a despondent ballet dancer learn to walk and to again feel confident about life.','/wNWQS4cPTVtyOPzMZ9HSjmOLZ97.jpg','1952-10-16',137,'Released','The masterpiece of laughter and tears from the master of comedy!','Limelight',28971,4.7905,7.892,'dkvb6aGl6nA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2803,_binary '\0','/aWxcAMmMILMlxBNnTORlTILmI5O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044849',7,1516,'en','The Long Memory','An innocent man is released from prison after 12 years and tracks down the witnesses who lied about him in court.','/3uocURWNbUKZyEiF3V4BpIa3JCS.jpg','1953-01-23',96,'Released','To kiss or to kill?','The Long Memory',50208,1.2462,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2804,_binary '\0','/iyl1GIFMsjStbOExeJ5qNFCVEWA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044851',6.2,2272,'en','Lost in Alaska','After two volunteer firemen rescue a gold prospector from suicide, they discover that the police mistakenly want them for murder.','/neKVgXr4qxYOkIZZR5eRviCqxSu.jpg','1952-08-13',76,'Released','It\'s ALL NEW and a RIOT TOO!','Lost in Alaska',33522,1.9427,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2805,_binary '\0','/d0vdyzvSfYq3xatj8KYY3H4ByeR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044860',7.3,4166,'en','The Lusty Men','Retired rodeo champion Jeff McCloud agrees to mentor novice rodeo contestant Wes Merritt against the wishes of Merritt\'s wife who fears the dangers of this rough sport.','/1JBtbRmuf8B73pxYlTdAwr9T9C3.jpg','1952-10-24',113,'Released','A Fast Buck... A Fast Bronc... A Fast Thrill!','The Lusty Men',43370,2.1911,6.7,'FwgUbokUfko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2806,_binary '\0','/yYQFxk9FRfROfTMKmQUyo8Ye8DW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044863',6.6,4273,'en','Macao','Nick Cochran, an American in exile in Macao, has a chance to restore his name by helping capture an international crime lord. Undercover, can he mislead the bad guys and still woo the attractive singer/petty crook, Julie Benson?','/eXoIIwdaaDuCthlTGMimjCjfPRD.jpg','1952-04-11',81,'Released','A sultry chanteuse, a hunk on the lam and a fortune in stolen gems','Macao',26282,2.1615,6.273,'lUsRsDs6NCk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2807,_binary '\0','/eSxcby3f435Dq5yE3kPdLLj0oi7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044876',7.2,11820,'en','The Man in the White Suit','The unassuming, nebbishy inventor Sidney Stratton creates a miraculous fabric that will never be dirty or worn out. Clearly he can make a fortune selling clothes made of the material, but may cause a crisis in the process. After all, once someone buys one of his suits they won\'t ever have to fix them or buy another one, and the clothing industry will collapse overnight. Nevertheless, Sidney is determined to put his invention on the market, forcing the clothing factory bigwigs to resort to more desperate measures...','/laTLoNZB7Ar3ZDoQmspBDVa5mbC.jpg','1951-08-07',85,'Released','Guinness is Back...Working Wonders With Wile, Whimsey and Wit!','The Man in the White Suit',32568,2.7664,6.9,'NZwZ_TPR-20','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2808,_binary '\0','/lGtsQY8f4INRLy9baNKIfkkMAtR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044888',6.9,1809,'en','The Marrying Kind','Florence and Chet Keefer have had a troublesome marriage. Whilst in the middle of a divorce hearing the judge encourages them to remember the good times they have had hoping that the marriage can be saved.','/bf7MKkF2izIZ6B3W3kOUDFq8Kox.jpg','1952-02-01',92,'Released','\"Shaddup!\"','The Marrying Kind',84903,1.2699,6.7,'T5jsS6rslzU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2809,_binary '\0','/i2kunv539oNBMXN5bVCwDBHNwEy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044896',6.7,1709,'en','The Member of the Wedding','Tomboy, Frances \'Frankie\' Addams, dreams of running away with her brother and new fiancée away from the Deep South.','/i1QymzFHXx9ZKbqqNayuzmUHRIo.jpg','1952-12-25',93,'Released','She became a woman in the middle of a kiss!','The Member of the Wedding',93775,1.9175,6.3,'P_7EDWwUXDI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2810,_binary '\0','/TG1LWkwAlJklXt0yYxdUQ2wizF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044903',6.5,1989,'en','Million Dollar Mermaid','After overcoming polio, Annette Kellerman achieves fame and creates a scandal when her one-piece bathing suit is considered indecent.','/waLcgBcXbwKPWqyyIMjgE33BVIR.jpg','1952-12-04',115,'Released','Inspired by the true story of bathing beauties!','Million Dollar Mermaid',43189,2.9402,6.5,'Un0w7WyRgsc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2811,_binary '\0','/2dQPQ6MXsVUkFNR0iVoHEZajBDN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044905',6.8,1617,'en','The Miracle of Our Lady of Fatima','In 1917, three shepherd children living just outside Fatima, Portugal have visions of a lovely lady in a cloud. The anticlerical government wishes to squelch the Church; reports of religious experiences are cause for serious concern. Yet the children stand by their story, and the message of peace and hope the Lady brings. In the last vision, attended by thousands of people, the Lady proves her reality with a spectacular miracle that is seen by everyone present. Based on actual events at Fatima in the summer of 1917.','/sIAnF7FtMpiSZXTZhS9W5e6Zb0t.jpg','1952-08-20',102,'Released','Warner Bros. present the motion picture that reaches deep inside you!','The Miracle of Our Lady of Fatima',49616,2.1037,5.9,'5mJlZzQr298','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2812,_binary '\0','/1sS6ilJQOv6QUbQ6cgZ0E7mh5qB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044916',6.9,16942,'en','Monkey Business','Research chemist Barnaby Fulton works on a fountain of youth pill for a chemical company. One of the labs chimps gets loose in the laboratory and mixes chemicals, but then pours the mix into the water cooler. When trying one of his own samples, washed down with water from the cooler, Fulton begins to act just like a twenty-year-old and believes his potion is working. Soon his wife and boss are also behaving like children.','/cVYh7b1fLy9zzpZLX2aVNF5U12C.jpg','1952-09-03',97,'Released','It\'s some fun!','Monkey Business',24008,4.5694,6.683,'h0u2pOqUXFk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2813,_binary '\0','/dqNVSLoksKIdCHMyrRYmpWyGbtQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044926',7,7415,'en','Moulin Rouge','In 1890 Paris, Moulin Rouge is a nightclub where crippled artist Toulouse-Lautrec feels like he fits in. In the following years, he meets two women who provide an opportunity for him to find true love.','/iTPcjDqJnimppXYwDcLScKCJTnI.jpg','1952-10-24',119,'Released','Wild, wicked, wonderful Paris...all her loves, ladies and lusty legends!','Moulin Rouge',10910,2.6111,6.6,'CKyh4zKkths','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2814,_binary '\0','/tny9NXQGi84BeXuo6Ms1bN9icav.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044937',7.1,3858,'en','My Cousin Rachel','A young man plots revenge against the woman he believes murdered his cousin, but his plans are shaken when he comes face to face with the enigmatic beauty.','/2Ki5RsrRByusjYOBFM6cK6SAo12.jpg','1952-12-25',98,'Released','She makes a secret potion for her lovers to drink!','My Cousin Rachel',94529,2.015,6.7,'8fKjZDgat_0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2815,_binary '\0','/AhBDWDu1NQ1UBqfedUsZvsmeHRA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044953',7.3,14159,'en','The Naked Spur','A bounty hunter trying to bring a murderer to justice is forced to accept the help of two less-than-trustworthy strangers.','/xS5EAgCnFFvHbyRydlqTbDbaXZ6.jpg','1953-01-29',91,'Released','Packed with Technicolor Thrills!','The Naked Spur',20442,3.5178,7,'FtBtW1v6wuw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2816,_binary '\0','/yFUFyxPrlMeo110xX9gzRic3CHC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044954',7.6,10097,'en','The Narrow Margin','A tough cop meets his match when he has to guard a gangster\'s widow on a train journey from Chicago to Los Angeles.','/kdlCfBmTZ7CoJoCvS1b56Xj1qJi.jpg','1952-05-03',71,'Released','A Fortune If They Seal Her Lips!...A Bullet If They Fail!','The Narrow Margin',31713,2.4148,7.3,'OZtFTnm8GnY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2817,_binary '\0','/oMGRbIKScyQkxXa2PcmgRuJUamX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044981',7.2,3459,'en','O. Henry\'s Full House','Five O. Henry stories, each separate. The primary one from the critics\' acclaim was \"The Cop and the Anthem\". Soapy tells fellow bum Horace that he is going to get arrested so he can spend the winter in a nice jail cell. He fails. He can\'t even accost a woman; she turns out to be a streetwalker. The other stories are \"The Clarion Call\", \"The Last Leaf\", \"The Ransom of Red Chief\", and \"The Gift of the Magi\".','/vznk8LPE5nRRbNjeTG20P42yy2l.jpg','1952-09-18',117,'Released','A dozen top stars - five famed directors bring you the best stories of O. Henry!','O. Henry\'s Full House',24006,2.529,6.9,'c7FInmLD_F8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2818,_binary '\0','/p5BLZ8KmcQFOaT51KnmDmRxrpnb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0044982',7.6,4515,'ja','お茶漬けの味','The arranged marriage between a capricious woman from Tokyo high society and a quiet rustic man is tested by a marital crisis.','/mCXg9AfQlcwCR7E7vJCI96n4nLv.jpg','1952-10-01',116,'Released',NULL,'The Flavor of Green Tea Over Rice',55197,2.4797,7.5,'w7rqCC4gJZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2819,_binary '\0','/mTk6HYIKbrikhXJsJme189LcCJq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045002',6.9,1461,'en','Outcast of the Islands','After financial improprieties are discovered at the Eastern trading company where he works, Peter Willems flees the resulting disgrace and criminal charges. He persuades the man who gave him his start in life, the merchant ship captain Lingard, to bring him to a trading post on a remote Indonesian island where he can hide out.','/fiDzvW8g2w3anqhFvl9KwBOgG8T.jpg','1951-11-15',102,'Released','Even Her Love Was Primitive!','Outcast of the Islands',87349,1.9256,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2820,_binary '\0','/dYPs1E7bNFsbBnb085aCXbpjOTv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045009',7.2,2250,'en','Park Row','In 1880s New York City newspaper district, a dedicated journalist manages to set up his own paper. It is an immediate success but attracts increasing opposition from one of the bigger newspapers and it\'s heiress owner.','/qHx9RhWqr7MndUhJqd6Bs4Gs0jp.jpg','1952-09-01',83,'Released','Street of rogues... reporters... and romance!','Park Row',26242,1.1604,6.7,'necFn6lPljc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2821,_binary '\0','/j3zYIDlhqwbHKyanhk4rPENc0Id.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045012',6.9,6607,'en','Pat and Mike','Pat Pemberton is a brilliant athlete, except when her domineering fiancé is around. The ladies golf championship is in her reach until she gets flustered by his presence at the final holes. He wants them to get married and forget the whole thing, but she cannot give up on herself that easily. She enlists the help of Mike Conovan, a slightly shady sports promoter. Together they face mobsters, a jealous boxer, and a growing mutual attraction.','/6hSJWY1ygsOVAtPEz9Nb5q5FeyA.jpg','1952-06-13',95,'Released','Together again - and it\'s no fib, their funniest hit since \"Adam\'s Rib\"','Pat and Mike',33575,2.4447,6.4,'llKImTsSmnY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2822,_binary '\0','/fCd18BqKowyeFMM5Vgw5zIlnogK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045029',6.9,3498,'en','Phone Call from a Stranger','Four strangers board a plane and become fast friends, but a catastrophic crash leaves only one survivor. He then sets off on a journey to discover who these people were, but ultimately discovers the devastating truth about himself.','/sMw7gMaG1wIdAX4BYuUHJ61Ml7w.jpg','1952-02-01',105,'Released','Five great stars in a masterpiece of bold and intimate emotions !','Phone Call from a Stranger',76229,2.7995,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2823,_binary '\0','/ceVcrZeak4gfbtGUnAUpWIzeiFR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045034',7.5,5888,'fr','Le Plaisir','Three stories about pleasure. The first one is about a man hiding his age behind a mask to keep going to balls and fancying women - pleasure and youth. Then comes the long tale of Madame Tellier taking her girls (whores) to the country for attending her niece\'s communion - pleasure and purity. And lastly, Jean the painter falls in love with his model - pleasure and death.','/qxJAam675KDRIrT5KMYMOMVHBqQ.jpg','1952-02-29',97,'Released',NULL,'Le Plaisir',43360,2.704,7.493,'nUAq1tZhG0U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2824,_binary '\0','/9dRmnUEVqzWx1CGXO49Xcif5MJY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045039',6.3,1839,'en','Plymouth Adventure','During the Mayflower pilgrims\' long voyage across the Atlantic Ocean on their way to America, Captain Christopher Jones falls in love with William Bradford\'s wife Dorothy.','/p1bBvxJ4hD8MnLRlpH11wIOYyvA.jpg','1952-11-28',105,'Released','MGM presents the great Technicolor drama of the sea!','Plymouth Adventure',90968,2.1907,5.9,'v7BxsMmYTUg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2825,_binary '\0','/kFaLtcCN7SSirMZBFJEnOnu9Lfr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045053',6.9,4372,'en','The Prisoner of Zenda','A kingdom\'s ascending heir, marked for assassination, switches identities with a lookalike, who takes his place at the coronation. When the real king is kidnapped, his followers try to find him, while the stand-in falls in love with the king\'s intended bride, the beautiful Princess Flavia.','/9F4WrZfZjg6JqRLIBo6koFoDHjq.jpg','1952-11-04',100,'Released','A Swashbuckling Adventure In The Grand Style!','The Prisoner of Zenda',28431,2.5166,6.9,'vPnn4-r16Vk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2826,_binary '\0','/bJ77lq5x7SDzzh4SvA9tiTYZqRH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045056',7.1,2174,'en','The Card','A charming and ambitious young man finds many ways to raise himself through the ranks in business and social standing - some honest, some not quite so. If he can just manage to avoid a certain very predatory woman.','/lFK9EPjJAxSCQcx9jDeF7HplEUx.jpg','1952-02-25',85,'Released','He\'s the cheekiest man in town!','The Card',43369,1.7109,7,'GqXKM_TM1WI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2827,_binary '\0','/x67V2BApRy3XURCh6jccMT2GbIO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045061',7.7,46390,'en','The Quiet Man','An American man returns to the village of his birth in Ireland, where he finds love and conflict.','/u3B1hVKHE56yBRoxF3Nk9uxHdYN.jpg','1952-07-21',129,'Released','Action... Excitement... Romance... Fill the Screen!','The Quiet Man',3109,5.484,7.3,'T-n873zZvMo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2828,_binary '\0','/4fFgjG6wAk3vvxTHijttZ0qVSf0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045064',4.6,1319,'en','Radar Men from the Moon','Commando Cody, \'Sky Marshal of the Universe\', works with American scientists Joan Gilbert and Ted Richards in the development of a flying suit and a rocket to the Moon. When the nation\'s defences are being sabotaged and destroyed, Cody learns that an atomic-gun is being used and that the men on the moon are the culprits.','/7pYrj4h2w5wkgTbbff4KS1MYP60.jpg','1952-01-09',169,'Released',NULL,'Radar Men from the Moon',44608,2.0259,4.6,'Kd3D8d62Cps','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2829,_binary '\0','/8SDMnOJuJHXkbEQuejqMXqyblbE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045070',6.8,6246,'en','Rancho Notorious','A man in search of revenge infiltrates a ranch, hidden in an inhospitable region, where its owner, Altar Keane, gives shelter to outlaws fleeing from the law in exchange for a price.','/nQnO8hMViqSriSGLnYWm14iMykb.jpg','1952-04-10',86,'Released','Where anything goes… for a price!','Rancho Notorious',28894,2.7212,6.5,'xQBC7k7Qs1s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2830,_binary '\0','/5RUgbequZRPTKkuPkLNJ33vpq9x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045073',4.9,1664,'en','Red Planet Mars','Husband-and-wife scientists pick up a pie-in-the-sky TV message supposedly from Mars.','/k8voXCic0uXt9O3CLa1kj03ulDo.jpg','1952-05-15',87,'Released','SEE! The first contact between Earth and Mars!','Red Planet Mars',26241,1.6971,4.9,'GYDS2hMH2Sk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2831,_binary '\0','/xXZsz4eqvH6R2JDVjUhvwKtgZFz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045081',7.2,2921,'fr','Le Retour de Don Camillo','Energetic priest Don Camillo returns to the town of Brescello for more political and personal duels with Communist mayor Peppone.','/DPSCKSwMYsGnu2X4w7iOGI9vHQ.jpg','1953-06-05',115,'Released',NULL,'The Return of Don Camillo',11578,2.3401,7.2,'Kgl0YzRoBfw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2832,_binary '\0','/vagBzhtlUmt6hGnEHU2QxvlKUgA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045094',6.4,5575,'en','Road to Bali','Having to leave Melbourne in a hurry to avoid various marriage proposals, two song-and-dance men sign on for work as divers. This takes them to an idyllic island on the way to Bali where they vie with each other for the favours of Princess Lala. The hazardous dive produces a chest of priceless jewels which arouses the less romantic interest of some shady locals.','/qOaOWAk0vtjr4enTUx04cw0zmlV.jpg','1952-12-05',91,'Released','TOGETHER AGAIN!...in the BEST and FUNNIEST \'Road\' Picture Yet!','Road to Bali',34082,2.3214,6.2,'Au3KizymRu0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2833,_binary '\0','/kW9aJeFTMv5GfQ2SFjnFOelg4j1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045102',7.2,3485,'en','Room for One More','Anne and \"Poppy\" Rose have three quirky kids. Anne has a generous heart and the belief in the innocence of children. To the unhappy surprise of her husband she takes in the orphan Jane, a problem child who already tried to kill herself once.','/2VJg810IoARDJDtZFGePRciXcsV.jpg','1952-01-10',98,'Released','Makes room for your broadest grins and your longest laughs!','Room for One More',48627,2.4415,6.6,'rKls9oE6uEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2834,_binary '\0','/lfKudsl29KWBIbbArj2iAOuIlot.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045109',6.7,1965,'en','Ruby Gentry','A sexy but poor young girl marries a rich man she doesn\'t love, but carries a torch for another man.','/bFFDqnL6mK2epcaFb1BNInKpq8N.jpg','1952-12-25',82,'Released','So dangerous...destructive...deadly to love!','Ruby Gentry',50085,2.2303,6.4,'UROc6tl9KXk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2835,_binary '\0','/2abzWmOGC1KNISvLlLZ6IIp1PoE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045112',8,8508,'ja','西鶴一代女','During the Edo Period, a noblewoman\'s banishment for her love affair with a lowly page signals the beginning of her inexorable fall.','/8sIZjJdLrXPxrSERSLese1gUIwt.jpg','1952-04-17',136,'Released',NULL,'The Life of Oharu',43364,2.6907,7.8,'2Qxy_dUiRpU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2836,_binary '\0','/z7H0MoLe1qmhSVYCGkpaoMGbH8r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045124',7.4,4287,'en','Scandal Sheet','A tabloid editor assigns a young reporter to solve a murder the editor committed himself.','/fvQKSEt3m3kZzvBDDlnQRGY10HE.jpg','1952-01-16',82,'Released','The man from \"The Mob\" is making another killing!','Scandal Sheet',26009,1.7512,7,'z--MgCVDJic','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2837,_binary '\0','/cvvgW32yPZbVSsZmQgVxyULEpHe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045125',7.5,6888,'en','Scaramouche','In 18th-century France, a young man masquerades as an actor to avenge his friend\'s murder.','/yALSC7jqOsmMtfSPp6ThCuNGjiR.jpg','1952-05-08',110,'Released','The Company that made \"Quo Vadis\" brings the world another spectacular romantic triumph!','Scaramouche',33454,4.2608,7,'yzYEYyOsQtA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2838,_binary '\0','/6qOyw4yfzbzTp5YsCX26C28Do0S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045152',8.3,285842,'en','Singin\' in the Rain','In 1927 Hollywood, a silent film star falls for a chorus girl just as he and his paranoid screen partner struggle to make the difficult transition to talking pictures.','/671EPwBsHGHBk0cdOeZqmOK0XB3.jpg','1952-04-10',103,'Released','What a Glorious Feeling!','Singin\' in the Rain',872,13.2086,8.126,'D-NJHUasYVA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2839,_binary '\0','/AvdaSijPWCV0XDikddO1nsPQLeF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045161',7.1,4563,'en','The Sniper','Eddie Miller struggles with his hatred of women, he\'s especially bothered by seeing women with their lovers. He starts a killing spree as a sniper by shooting women from far distances. In an attempt to get caught, he writes an anonymous letter to the police begging them to stop him.','/upYwLa9rKoejM79p9DRXuLjYXN7.jpg','1952-05-09',88,'Released','To the Police--Stop Me--Find Me and Stop Me--I\'m Going to Do it Again','The Sniper',25551,2.625,6.7,'2EsOJBYsCYU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2840,_binary '\0','/zQERahUUbVZTosd41NNUPNHqSKJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045162',6.1,6601,'en','The Snows of Kilimanjaro','Writer Harry Street reflects on his life as he lies dying from an infection while on safari in the shadow of Mount Kilimanjaro.','/xIdEt2rycY6h3QAKGqWrIGqhviD.jpg','1952-09-17',117,'Released','His adventures . . . Like his loves . . . Were great and exciting!','The Snows of Kilimanjaro',4460,3.3007,5.9,'VfB3uvtk2O8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2841,_binary '\0','/3TmRl1fhY3DH0ZN4c4dMrggyKAt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045177',6.8,2709,'en','Son of Paleface','Peter Potter Jr. returns to claim his father\'s gold, which is nowhere to be found.','/caCpFT0SjltDb0uy29LWv2MRvr7.jpg','1952-07-14',95,'Released','Yes, Even More Laughs Than \"The Paleface\"','Son of Paleface',30801,1.9298,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2842,_binary '\0','/3esWzggfxCyQBzlKr7lBsJeSpqF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045184',6.6,2674,'en','Springfield Rifle','Major Lex Kearney, dishonourably discharged from the army for cowardice in battle, volunteers to go undercover to try to prevent raids against shipments of horses desperately needed for the Union war effort. Falling in with the gang of jayhawkers and Confederate soldiers who have been conducting the raids, he gradually gains their trust and is put in a position where he can discover who has been giving them secret information revealing the routes of the horse shipments.','/nmvePM95FtjB8m2tDD8K6mMZXV5.jpg','1952-10-22',93,'Released','The Gun... The Girl... They Made One Man The Equal Of Five!','Springfield Rifle',111043,2.2925,6.358,'8q7GxHjafn0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2843,_binary '\0','/3wTCD9C7TGaMZPDR2KWkI0wiY9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045186',6.9,4649,'en','The Star','Actress Margaret Elliot is well past her prime but refuses to retire from the acting business. Despite entreaties from both her daughter, Gretchen, and one-time professional colleague Jim Johannsen, Margaret remains convinced that she can regain her former glory. As she sets her sights on a coveted Hollywood role, Johannsen tries doggedly to get his unrequited love to see the folly of her ways.','/gvga2csMHbDYjSTIIFS0TArTurp.jpg','1952-12-11',89,'Released','The story of a woman...who thought she was a star so high in the sky no man could touch her!','The Star',85783,1.5036,7.2,'lkSqGm2djHQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2844,_binary '\0','/Ap5rg3aQGrppnETpWPsdgv2RRcm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045190',6.9,1954,'en','The Steel Trap','Joseph Cotten plays an assistant bank manager who steals $1,000,000 from the safe late on a Friday and then plans to flee to Brazil over the weekend.','/b0AifWNRWGkw0gCn30H358PfmdD.jpg','1952-11-12',85,'Released','For the Love of a Woman, He Stole $1,000,000!','The Steel Trap',31559,1.1534,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2845,_binary '\0','/nqjidEk5LGgnjQGo8teXVWJZA6C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045191',6.1,1530,'en','Stolen Face','A plastic surgeon changes the face of a female convict to match that of the beautiful woman who broke his heart and left him. He marries the convict but trouble starts when his true love returns.','/bKZQUswbsLJPD7zfWLBfg6bqSa6.jpg','1952-05-01',72,'Released','Treachery wears a stolen face!','Stolen Face',38964,1.6105,5.8,'Z0rSWhmSuaQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2846,_binary '\0','/j31XQKIjhUR1UzhUDcFJrJHi7Cs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045192',6.7,1804,'en','The Stooge','Bill Miller is an unsuccessful Broadway performer until his handlers convince him to enhance his act with a stooge—Ted Rogers, a guy positioned in the audience to be the butt of Bill\'s jokes. After Ted begins to steal the show, Bill\'s girlfriend and his pals advise him to make Ted an equal partner.','/cskQxPZ9hvOAnfnmhfvMMmplIeI.jpg','1951-11-15',100,'Released','A RIOTOUS MUSICAL RAMPAGE!','The Stooge',58182,2.1565,6.6,'tsMM3n-zVoI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2847,_binary '\0','/hqwO3nlLT0jlgXfQBAvbocwOdHV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045197',6.5,2900,'en','The Story of Robin Hood and His Merrie Men','Young Robin Hood, in love with Maid Marian, enters an archery contest with his father at the King\'s palace. On the way home his father is murdered by henchmen of Prince John. Robin takes up the life of an outlaw, gathering together his band of merry men with him in Sherwood Forest, to avenge his father\'s death and to help the people of the land that Prince John are over taxing.','/qnVw3CwQgHnKiOWKhAv69dsKBfG.jpg','1952-05-26',84,'Released',NULL,'The Story of Robin Hood and His Merrie Men',27884,2.442,6.207,'gM9Ce1qnYfM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2848,_binary '\0','/uZjVYZPofczbx2O98zZEy9G8uqy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045201',7.3,1634,'en','Hunted','An unexpected bond develops between a fugitive killer and a runaway orphan on an odyssey across England.','/vnWkXgsUNo1jnVgTf5Jdo0NnwQU.jpg','1952-03-17',84,'Released','Nowhere dare they show themselves... Nowhere dare they rest...','Hunted',131074,1.2972,6.9,'TozyEzttOJc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2849,_binary '\0','/sdiSlc86WlzhozqkWnQn73Wq5UW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045205',7.5,9013,'en','Sudden Fear','Actor Lester Blaine has all but landed the lead in Myra Hudson\'s new play when Myra vetoes him because, to her, he doesn\'t look like a romantic leading man. On a train from New York to San Francisco, Blaine sets out to prove Myra wrong...by romancing her. Is he sincere, or does he have a dark ulterior motive?','/xDDRhGX99c7smveM3UelCVmi6xi.jpg','1952-08-07',112,'Released','Every Suspenseful Moment... Every Embrace... Every Kiss... A Breathtaking Experience!','Sudden Fear',19171,2.0298,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2850,_binary '\0','/xbOOFeRfhsFwjSpKVQnyxciIuy0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045230',6.7,1592,'en','The Thief','A chance accident causes a nuclear physicist, who\'s selling top secret material to the Russians, to fall under FBI scrutiny and go on the run.','/1jXvDY9pqIQu2Y986PoVFm2sDDj.jpg','1952-10-15',85,'Released','NOT A WORD IS SPOKEN!','The Thief',38417,1.2592,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2851,_binary '\0','/osK1nkMgSyyQlhQFr8XfEBHQK6y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045232',6.1,1366,'en','This Woman Is Dangerous','A crime gang leader is losing her sight, so while her lover goes into hiding, she checks in to the hospital for extensive surgery to recover her eyesight. There she is treated by a handsome young doctor. As expected not only does the doctor successfully open her eyes, he also opens her heart for him.','/6epl5Bq3PcaC0YbJWVMk9JKjuXy.jpg','1952-02-09',100,'Released','Part of her was Ritz - part of her was \"racket\" - all of her was exciting! Beth Austin---stylish dame with a stylish name---who lived by jungle law in a big city and clawed her way to where the money was...!','This Woman Is Dangerous',78265,2.0476,5.9,'kIbCWMuQfUc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2852,_binary '\0','/kHbwWLE4mFVoC4wFCXsZ2HioRuf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045251',7.5,10301,'en','Othello','Manipulated by his jealous ensign Iago, the Moorish general Othello is driven to believe that his new wife Desdemona is unfaithful, setting in motion a chain of deception, jealousy, and violence that leads to tragedy.','/61A7EJqfMsrQO0YWsUWq8gbgbu0.jpg','1951-11-28',93,'Released','Orson Welles\' magnificent screening of Shakespeare\'s immortal tragedy','Othello',47697,2.9864,7.4,'fCZ0obRJa08','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2853,_binary '\0','/3mfPYlfczW1H1zd7fmDcHMeKBdT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045267',6.8,2024,'en','The Turning Point','Special prosecutor John Conroy hopes to combat organized crime and appoints his cop father Matt as chief investigator. John doesn\'t understand Matt\'s reluctance, but cynical reporter Jerry McKibbon thinks he knows: he\'s seen Matt with mob lieutenant Harrigan. Jerry\'s friendship with John is tested by the question of what to do about Matt, and by his attraction to John\'s girl Amanda. Meanwhile, the threatened racketeers adopt increasingly violent means of defense.','/oAQOQEev0CS4HNeKQ8S8FcjtTpK.jpg','1952-07-12',85,'Released','Today\'s most sensational story of racket-busting !','The Turning Point',61095,2.0782,6.3,'8xpl-j2BLpA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2854,_binary '\0','/dop0CEPeeW3BXDUGL1oDt9ywgK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045274',8.1,30981,'it','Umberto D.','When elderly pensioner Umberto Domenico Ferrari returns to his boarding house from a protest calling for a hike in old-age pensions, his landlady demands her 15,000-lire rent by the end of the month or he and his small dog will be turned out onto the street. Unable to get the money in time, Umberto fakes illness to get sent to a hospital, giving his beloved dog to the landlady\'s pregnant and abandoned maid for temporary safekeeping.','/5I7SYsNQmZRZpQ2MAarIQYU9vaX.jpg','1952-01-20',91,'Released',NULL,'Umberto D.',833,2.7843,7.879,'uAgrq1_UOOc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2855,_binary '\0','/ieR8c5Vnu17Avf27HLECqhPBvou.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045283',6.9,3143,'fi','Valkoinen peura','A newly-married woman becomes frustrated as her husband, a reindeer herder for an Arctic village, spends much of his time away. Desperate for affection, she visits a shaman who offers a potion that makes her irresistibly desirable, with unexpected and deadly results.','/ooUIhsDl4fwdaccdbdq7R4bsnxA.jpg','1952-07-18',68,'Released','Finland\'s greatest horror film!','The White Reindeer',84944,2.1055,6.603,'ECyp3fJBI20','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2856,_binary '\0','/1OCxbH2TTzTiar5iMAmOYGwr0kG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045294',6.5,1263,'it','I vinti','Three tales of privileged youth entangled in murder: French students kill for money, an Italian student smuggles cigarettes, and an English poet exploits a grim discovery.','/5A2F4n6foej9fH2dpEtWttrTB8Z.jpg','1953-10-22',113,'Released',NULL,'The Vanquished',90770,1.1428,6.3,'twBnDLAYRBE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2857,_binary '\0','/7aX2mfTcQArKS9PufnngjexnaQY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045296',7.2,13589,'en','Viva Zapata!','The story of Mexican revolutionary Emiliano Zapata, who led a rebellion against the corrupt, oppressive dictatorship of president Porfirio Díaz in the early 20th century.','/vfarxn9ddiaZpRDml8FGhB46Qrc.jpg','1952-02-07',113,'Released','A BANDIT WHO BECAME A LEGEND! Roaring Story of Mexico’s Tiger on a White Horse!','Viva Zapata!',1810,3.4375,6.8,'Ek2K5cLQ8E8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2858,_binary '\0','/2MezSvWFaGQAZiFSYbH0ojXXHQL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045317',6.3,2664,'en','We\'re Not Married!','A Justice of the Peace performed weddings a few days before his license was valid. A few years later five couples learn they have never been legally married.','/sxgqy0ZdpZ1cWjHFIO4DH8TRaLD.jpg','1952-07-11',86,'Released','What Embarrassment When We Discover...\"WE\'RE NOT MARRIED!\"','We\'re Not Married!',24004,2.9914,5.95,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2859,_binary '\0','/lhpRbeyILu7STYwDDPFtvB4a67O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045323',6.1,1550,'en','What Price Glory','Two military men, Captain Flagg and Sergeant Quirt, who are rivals to begin with, grow more at odds with each other when Quirt is made Flagg\'s top sergeant. And when a local beauty comes between them, their rivalry escalates even further. But when they discover that the woman has marriage in mind, they now compete to try to avoid marching down the aisle - that is, until they are called upon to march into battle.','/i2GkobjZ5UFjZVkVtdLWDhq1CvM.jpg','1952-08-22',110,'Released','The New \"What Price Glory\"','What Price Glory',72613,2.5542,5.8,'dYCkK-WSrYc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2860,_binary '\0','/yJK3E7uIBexLvC6yz4E1sUmOMNy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045332',6.5,1222,'en','The Winning Team','Poor health and alcoholism force Grover Cleveland Alexander out of baseball, but through his wife\'s faithful efforts, he gets a chance for a comeback and redemption.','/yx0VRKwrMeL2ZVnChtBou5aGTXZ.jpg','1952-06-20',98,'Released','To every man who plays for the love of the game....To every woman who has ever played the wonderful game of love.....We promise an experience of heart-warming warmth and excitement.','The Winning Team',108844,1.4224,6.1,'hGb9mllc0bo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2861,_binary '\0','/jliwdbenSCvfkAJiXmNGJ25NRpa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045333',6.7,1599,'en','With a Song in My Heart','Jane Froman, an aspiring songstress, lands a job in radio with help from pianist Don Ross, whom she later marries. Jane\'s popularity soars, and she leaves on a European tour... but her plane crashes in Lisbon, and she is partially crippled. Unable to walk without crutches, Jane nevertheless goes on to entertain the Allied troops in World War II.','/KePfsUc63Z9J0xEKxwydlzNOkP.jpg','1952-04-03',117,'Released',NULL,'With a Song in My Heart',65787,1.7207,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2862,_binary '\0','/tQ8jUKO1MRajTXE8Cu6rW5pydeo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045339',6.8,2558,'en','The World in His Arms','A boisterous sea captain in the Pacific Coast, circa 1850, has a plan to buy Alaska from the Russians… if they don’t kill him first.','/dxqGT4lJ3wolbNAASncbtphbL5g.jpg','1952-10-09',104,'Released','A salty sea captain, a beautiful Russian countess, and the love that would span an ocean.','The World in His Arms',74436,2.577,6.582,'CAjwcJGFxsg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2863,_binary '\0','/dDWSK0xdXiOdzKY7ZT0TEoR4isb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045361',7.9,7566,'es','Él','Gloria encounters Francisco, a man whose social veneer betrays a truer self burrowed underneath.','/c5GjKN0aRxfw043NUsyMkqRNJvO.jpg','1953-07-09',92,'Released',NULL,'Él',43344,1.7301,7.7,'1jewKsuMI1w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2864,_binary '\0','/8bIrOuqJeOmrz1bZosYkqMp0itA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045464',6.7,4926,'en','The 5,000 Fingers of Dr. T.','Young Bart Collins lives with his widowed mother Heloise. The major blight on Bart\'s existence is the hated piano lessons he is forced to endure under the tutelage of the autocratic Dr. Terwilliker. Bart feels that his mother has fallen under Terwilliker\'s sinister influence, and gripes to visiting plumber August Zabladowski, without much result. While grimly hammering away at his lessons, Bart dozes off and enters a fantastical musical dream.','/5sAxThhLhsQSf4mjrIGHqfKlaAy.jpg','1953-06-19',89,'Released','The Wonder Musical of the Future!','The 5,000 Fingers of Dr. T.',33743,1.9167,6.2,'dgpfMxYFSmE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2865,_binary '\0','/oKVL30uzSd0IYk5wR3iU2u4gQTk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045465',7.4,4052,'en','99 River Street','A former boxer turned taxi driver earns the scorn of his nagging wife and gets mixed up with jewel thieves.','/sJ4kX89iD0Ne8cdlVAFCsAn0kbe.jpg','1953-08-21',83,'Released','Rips into you like a double-crossing Dame!','99 River Street',36949,2.583,6.801,'FYY48zTTsDk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2866,_binary '\0','/7Ck3Q00b6rsPxntPAnsCmoxjmYH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045468',5.9,3845,'en','Abbott and Costello Go to Mars','Lester and Orville accidentally launch a rocket which is supposed to fly to Mars. Instead it goes to New Orleans for Mardi Gras. They are then forced by bank robber Mugsy and his pal Harry to fly to Venus where they find a civilization made up entirely of women, men having been banished.','/wGnKIzOiymXrPq2GU5htrWVIXZK.jpg','1953-04-06',77,'Released','They\'re too wild for one world!','Abbott and Costello Go to Mars',33472,2.1618,5.466,'TlGQiLQkeDc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2867,_binary '\0','/9uxrsVcRCTuSmQ4CB8XUfE35Co2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045469',6.4,5573,'en','Abbott and Costello Meet Dr. Jekyll and Mr. Hyde','As American policemen in London, Bud and Lou meet up with Dr. Jekyll and Mr. Hyde.','/bRsn8H6X5bxX1YXu9hHIExSSwHa.jpg','1953-08-01',77,'Released','The laughs are twice as MONSTER-OUS as ever before!','Abbott and Costello Meet Dr. Jekyll and Mr. Hyde',3023,1.9786,6.26,'aLepl3_iTyg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2868,_binary '\0','/gKfu0rXXRUmuvBJSoRw0AmA5QIh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045471',6.4,1680,'en','The Actress','The true story of Ruth Gordon\'s early struggles on the road to stage stardom.','/ms7Ni0s6vH9ZCEUyuNIEaQOMxtI.jpg','1953-09-25',90,'Released','There\'s hope and heart-ache in the adventures of a stage-struck daughter!','The Actress',98364,2.5325,6.4,'cNO7zsXZHBg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2869,_binary '\0','/dLakTxmd1Apu0eDLMz2vpmbEKio.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045492',7,2783,'en','All I Desire','In 1910, a stage actress re-visits her husband and children she deserted ten years ago.','/tp1giq4e18XxScMQucHruf8Bv5A.jpg','1953-07-03',80,'Released','Now He Knew Her as Other Men Had!','All I Desire',63858,1.4298,7,'Dsa0IZBHbfc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2870,_binary '\0','/hFkGcMOLa28G87behmw84X69gPF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045494',6.2,1221,'en','All the Brothers Were Valiant','In the South Pacific islands, two brothers, one good and one bad, fight over the same girl and over a bag of pearls.','/wPbkZYWHdCePuP0qdJU9zdzaBpb.jpg','1953-11-13',101,'Released','MGM\'s Great Technicolor Romance!','All the Brothers Were Valiant',91419,2.1725,6.1,'RPhD14GcTRs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2871,_binary '\0','/cLEYNI2wRPnAYV2tKIYCyHzeg23.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045504',6.5,1709,'it','L\'amore in città','Six vignettes explore love and desire in Rome, from prostitution and heartache to unwed motherhood and the male gaze.','/hCCrolo9ovoL56gVm7urL0t1Qbr.jpg','1953-11-27',115,'Released','A daring new film experience... made without fear, without taboos!','Love in the City',31293,1.9285,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2872,_binary '\0','/r634eEDKs9pITWhisuRZP0OKSAQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045518',5.9,1739,'en','Arrowhead','Chief of Scouts Ed Bannon works for the US Army at Fort Clark, Texas and he dreams of aiding in bringing peace to the region, despite opposition from both the Army and the Apaches.','/ydVyCnK6uqRijEkNGHAZR4EvP68.jpg','1953-08-03',105,'Released','Real Heroes of the West!','Arrowhead',61049,1.9106,6.1,'LuJsKxe6o7o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2873,_binary '\0','/bud4H3I6X9b9HIcilAb33k6mNES.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045537',7.4,13738,'en','The Band Wagon','A Broadway artiste turns a faded film star\'s comeback vehicle into an artsy flop.','/5CvUmTWK46rShfgLmw7LuKF2fYL.jpg','1953-08-07',112,'Released','Get Aboard!','The Band Wagon',29376,3.9072,7.2,'rgvJPU8t6kE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2874,_binary '\0','/vpWd0Wv32bJXurN81Rw3HJiska.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045544',6,1863,'en','Battle Circus','A young Army nurse, Lt Ruth McGara, newly assigned to the 8666th MASH during the Korean War, attracts the sexual attention of the unit\'s commander Dr. Jed Webbe. Major Webbe, who has a drinking problem, at first wants a \"no strings\" relationship. McGara is warned by the other nurses of Webbe\'s womanizing ways. Despite these initial handicaps, their love flourishes against a background of war, enemy attacks, death and injury. The relationship deepens and uplifts both characters.','/oSsRPi35KNeIUjMAXNIWDBBg7Uq.jpg','1953-03-06',90,'Released','M-G-M\'s great drama of desire under fire!','Battle Circus',91245,1.532,6,'LUGc568DMFs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2875,_binary '\0','/7WSOCpCWcTJR8sTEYfh02ct7ylB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045546',6.6,9794,'en','The Beast from 20,000 Fathoms','The controlled explosion of an atomic bomb in the Arctic Circle awakens a frozen dinosaur that will wreak havoc in New York City.','/a45mCN6BUPg0JHVnprDOPc2VIST.jpg','1953-06-13',80,'Released','You\'ll see it tear a city apart!','The Beast from 20,000 Fathoms',35073,3.734,6.6,'2UP0-Ne1aTs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2876,_binary '\0','/BYiMTAFfc0PYBM2yfdTIaZV9Fq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045551',5.6,1801,'en','Beneath the 12-Mile Reef','Mike and Tony Petrakis are a Greek father and son team who dive for sponges off the coast of Florida. After they are robbed by crooks, Arnold and the Rhys brothers, Mike decides to take his men to the dangerous 12-mile reef to dive for more sponges. Mike suffers a fatal accident when he falls from the reef leaving Tony to carry on the business. But now he has a companion, Gwyneth Rhys.','/lAeqIi5bxqmQNqSaHqNUZ0oVLo6.jpg','1953-12-02',102,'Released','You see it without special glasses !','Beneath the 12-Mile Reef',22734,2.498,6,'fd61i535SgQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2877,_binary '\0','/ccW55iIsh8gTN8fRkv0rIkuu46B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045554',7.9,5295,'es','¡Bienvenido, Mister Marshall!','A small Spanish town, Villar del Río, is alerted to the upcoming visit of American diplomats and its ruling townsmen begin preparations to impress the American visitors, in the hopes of benefiting under the Marshall Plan. Hoping to demonstrate the side of Spanish culture with which the visiting foreign officials would be more familiarized, the Castilian citizens don unfamiliar Andalusian costumes, hire a renowned flamenco performer, and re-decorate their town in Andalusian style, meantime waiting for their uncertain arrival.','/zj1kQTChTXJwdsyBsl7972MDfWS.jpg','1953-04-04',78,'Released',NULL,'Welcome Mr. Marshall!',31936,1.8484,7.4,'A79ips5IPZc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2878,_binary '\0','/aqZookq6pJmIT9lVIjDsBY2MNpK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045555',7.9,33231,'en','The Big Heat','After the suspicious suicide of a fellow cop, tough homicide detective Dave Bannion takes the law into his own hands when he sets out to smash a vicious crime syndicate.','/ezt6fb4JbghGKmaMzzuMtxpz0Kb.jpg','1953-10-14',89,'Released','A hard cop and a soft dame.','The Big Heat',14580,3.8169,7.7,'ze6S3zZdSlA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2879,_binary '\0','/bn63p4oxeOWSXwtAf1xCPv1ZQIo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045557',6.8,5491,'en','The Bigamist','San Francisco businessman Harry Graham and his wife and business partner, Eve, are in the process of adopting a child. When private investigator Mr. Jordan uncovers the fact that Graham has another wife, Phyllis, and a small child in Los Angeles, he confesses everything.','/iht6xFLrObIoQvvuC3XOmnocc9u.jpg','1953-12-03',80,'Released','Wanted by two women!','The Bigamist',74122,1.9801,6.4,'NF6qA0hGGeA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2880,_binary '\0','/flYVoE26aDW0I2jfOz9PB3uGYD2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045563',6.4,1410,'en','Blowing Wild','Wildcatter Jeff Dawson does his best to bring in a gusher in Mexico despite continual bandit raids. He asks for help from his ex-employer Ward Conway, but Conway, now married to Dawson\'s ex-lover Marina refuses, fearing that his wife will want to renew her romance with the other man.','/qRIRy1yb44RHCZjKL2O1WEPjK46.jpg','1953-10-07',90,'Released','Fighting wild! Loving wild!','Blowing Wild',76140,2.1377,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2881,_binary '\0','/rsvJrcEn0DHKLLb37eKPVF0394Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045564',6.8,7307,'en','The Blue Gardenia','Upon waking up to the news that the man she’d gone on a date with the previous night has been murdered, a young woman with only a faint memory of the night’s events begins to suspect that she murdered him while attempting to resist his advances.','/1RwM1jUx5XV4Q9DxcOVubmk5laH.jpg','1953-03-20',89,'Released','There was nothing lily-white about her -- the clinch-and-kill girl they called: The Blue Gardenia','The Blue Gardenia',21594,2.8232,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2882,_binary '\0','/kNjW7UfqU7EH7QrA2yeAUR2O8tM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045566',6.7,2052,'en','A Blueprint for Murder','Whitney Cameron is in a quandary: he\'s attracted to his beautiful sister-in-law, Lynn, but also harbors serious suspicions about her. Her husband, Cameron\'s brother, died under mysterious circumstances, and now that the death of her stepchild, Polly, has been attributed to poisoning, he suspects that Lynn is after his late brother\'s estate, and killing everyone in her way.','/5YmRhrJoYoDR323X4Racm8s7dnd.jpg','1953-07-24',77,'Released','He kissed her into the most sacred confession a woman can make!','A Blueprint for Murder',31560,1.9066,6.2,'poB_n-Fj2eQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2883,_binary '\0','/ims5XCNbHOGJP4wZzPSanfEewkL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045586',7,2756,'en','By the Light of the Silvery Moon','Marjorie Winfield\'s engagement to Bill Sherman, who has just arrived home from fighting in World War I, serves as the backdrop for the trials and tribulations of her family.','/v11fDnu7Oq8UeVt2xRy4GyPWZlX.jpg','1953-03-26',101,'Released','They\'re Wooin\' and Doin\' The Things Boy and Girls Like To Do...','By the Light of the Silvery Moon',19590,1.6992,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2884,_binary '\0','/gbRBItDONx9WgXbFxzIdCJU3EcM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045589',6.3,2713,'en','The Caddy','Although the son of a skilled golfer and an outstanding player in his own right, Harvey Miller is too nervous to play in front of a gallery, so he acts as coach and caddy for Joe Anthony, his girlfriend\'s brother.','/h1zLzZ8Ko6FdT4ISJOZM6I21l7K.jpg','1953-08-10',95,'Released','It\'s a screamer right down the fairway, FOOOOORE!!!!!!','The Caddy',44747,1.9785,6.3,'eR3K2RyFOyc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2885,_binary '\0','/wW48YBivOLmHLh1wJ9nP9siQetB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045591',7.2,12351,'en','Calamity Jane','Sharpshooter Calamity Jane takes it upon herself to recruit a famous actress and bring her back to the local saloon, but jealousy soon gets in the way.','/bYeTi8t6Gtbck861Pm9XtE3BdpS.jpg','1953-11-04',101,'Released','Warner Bros.\' sky highest, smile widest, wild and woolliest Western of \'em all!','Calamity Jane',14117,3.7601,7,'wKxH7aFoJn4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2886,_binary '\0','/geiE3b1TtaMrB2ZLy8Pc6ELQxRB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045592',6.8,1598,'en','Call Me Madam','Washington hostess Sally Adams becomes a Truman-era US ambassador to a European grand duchy.','/zNemnYu57J8oesfYmjeSD6CVdQQ.jpg','1953-03-25',116,'Released',NULL,'Call Me Madam',46011,1.6387,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2887,_binary '\0','/8R9kzEv9bchLX4vE55NSLmSK5Aj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045607',6.8,1940,'en','The Captain\'s Paradise','Mediterranean ferryboat captain Henry St James has things well organized - a loving and very English wife Maud in Gibraltar, and the loving if rather more hot-blooded Mistress, Nita in Tangiers. A perfect life. As long as neither woman decides to follow him to the other port.','/12J6sfwwrzRAXyJ9L18oBqHCQZM.jpg','1953-06-09',94,'Released','He makes two-timing an art...and gets away with it','The Captain\'s Paradise',43354,1.7224,5.7,'KhD9J0gERdk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2888,_binary '\0','/dgOEH9LyL9Dw0Ama8N7lPvxLvYh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045609',4,2296,'en','Cat-Women of the Moon','Astronauts travel to the moon where they discover it is inhabited by attractive young women in black tights.','/jjN6eqMwirmmWmdgXj6uALFuebm.jpg','1953-09-03',64,'Released','Love-starved moon maidens on the prowl!','Cat-Women of the Moon',43341,1.9406,4.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2889,_binary '\0','/roInrQTgNiGgZ4kLMDTXLfFbAg6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045631',6.7,1841,'en','City That Never Sleeps','Chicago cop Johnny Kelly, dissatisfied with his job and marriage, would like to run away with his stripper girlfriend Angel Face, but keeps getting cold feet. During one crowded night, Angel Face decides she\'s had enough vacillation, and crooked lawyer Biddel has an illegal mission for Johnny that could put him in a financial position to act. But other, conflicting schemes are also in progress...','/abwqfeFGOxPmCGBGKJx2lvhxHzU.jpg','1953-06-12',90,'Released','...from the Honky Tonks to the penthouses...the creeps, the hoods, the killers come out to war with the city!','City That Never Sleeps',33924,1.8907,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2890,_binary '\0','/l8AAefZ2lvAphYXe7HZ9uVxGbgQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045654',7.3,1262,'en','Mandy','London, the early 1950s. Born deaf, Mandy is mute for most of her childhood. As she reaches school age her family itself is in danger of breaking up. Christine, Mandy\'s mother, has heard of a residential school for the oral education of the deaf.','/8bwWXoxCjCUDJN6hKPCtUWUzPux.jpg','1952-07-29',93,'Released','The Greatest Emotional Drama yet brought to the screen...','Mandy',47026,1.6121,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2891,_binary '\0','/kG93zIRD0nnD4MPmNfGRIf8AFxQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045659',7.4,6196,'en','The Cruel Sea','At the start of World War II, Cmdr. Ericson is assigned to convoy escort HMS Compass Rose with inexperienced officers and men just out of training. The winter seas make life miserable enough, but the men must also harden themselves to rescuing survivors of U-Boat attacks, while seldom able to strike back. Traumatic events afloat and ashore create a warm bond between the skipper and his first officer.','/kmMGoeLx7rntdbqKZFp6bmT8ZCW.jpg','1953-02-24',126,'Released',NULL,'The Cruel Sea',16914,2.8216,6.9,'joUDAD3GB3g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2892,_binary '\0','/waU7YjiGsR3ooC3skUf1q7o4Ryj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045669',6.9,3257,'en','Dangerous Crossing','A honeymoon aboard an ocean liner is cut short when the bride finds herself suddenly alone, and unable to convince anyone of her husband’s existence.','/cSqIMcCkK79qPzZHD6jTFotow2G.jpg','1953-07-22',75,'Released',NULL,'Dangerous Crossing',36330,1.8542,6.4,'_yWBycLk2iE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2893,_binary '\0','/ibJ02DUPDBFNiKAbfh0IOIMGL2r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045670',6.3,1307,'en','Dangerous When Wet','The health conscious, dairy-farming Higgins family begin each day with an invigorating swim. One day, traveling health-tonic salesman, Windy Weebe, comes to town and suggests they could swim the English Channel. Sponsored by \"Liquapep\" and coached by Windy, the family arrive in Europe. There it is decided that daughter Katie is the only one strong enough to enter the contest. But while she should be focused on the difficult and risky task ahead, Katie is pursed by dashing Frenchman, André Lanet... This comedic musical is well remembered for the scene when Katie dreams she is swimming with cartoon characters Tom & Jerry!','/kgPlMHis4svsH6jxPbEy08jTPO3.jpg','1953-06-18',95,'Released','MGM\'s splashy Technicolor musical!','Dangerous When Wet',43193,1.7338,6,'XLxJVPkiQ9w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2894,_binary '\0','/7w5mzWhX7paRM3WLYKSUtjwzF0I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045679',6.7,5740,'en','The Desert Rats','In North Africa, German Field Marshal Rommel and his troops have successfully fended off British forces, and now intend to take Tobruk, an important port city. A ramshackle group of Australian reinforcements sent to combat the Germans is put under the command of British Captain MacRoberts. The unruly Aussies immediately clash with MacRoberts, a gruff, strict disciplinarian, however this unorthodox team must band together to protect Tobruk from the German forces.','/upCaOY9mkgF9tJoiPU8LFbLCkK8.jpg','1953-03-26',88,'Released','They crawled their way across the blazing sands of Africa... to turn disaster into victory!','The Desert Rats',36554,2.6765,6.296,'gECHuUalFoA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2895,_binary '\0','/34hZoZuQ8PmE3qng88VySIQrLsw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045682',6.3,1331,'en','Destination Gobi','A group of US Navy weathermen taking measurements in the Gobi desert in World War II are forced to seek the help of Mongol nomads to regain their ship while under attack from the Japanese.','/cTp02LeUbtInHnHrE1FAC3wrpeZ.jpg','1953-03-20',90,'Released','ADVENTURE AS FIERY AND FURIOUS AS THE FLAMING SANDS OF CHINA\'S GOBI DESERT!','Destination Gobi',123868,1.6565,5.9,'5zB67odK8N4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2896,_binary '\0','/hifKfHKoLMKLoBZxILJBbbfMJkm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045693',8.3,2553,'hi','दो बीघा ज़मीन','After falling for a cunning landlord’s scheme, a farmer (Balraj Sahni) and his young son (Ratan Kumar) travel to Calcutta in search of work to save money and reclaim their ancestral land.','/uFCgOvfHfqRd6N4fBXqaSKS9Rlm.jpg','1953-01-02',125,'Released',NULL,'Two Acres of Land',54352,0.8231,7.917,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2897,_binary '\0','/qxY4TP2MDNiDsqIXC8Y98Yvsy4g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045699',5.9,1874,'en','Donovan\'s Brain','A scientist takes the brain of dead man and revives it via electrodes as it lays suspended in a tank of liquid. Soon, the brain grows to possess enormous psychic powers and inflicts its personality upon the doctor who saved it, creating a \"Jekyll and Hyde\" paradigm.','/pUTwbjQkl9Fj0t1u1Kjetdo4QK4.jpg','1953-09-30',83,'Released','A dead man\'s brain in a hidden laboratory told him to KILL... KILL... KILL','Donovan\'s Brain',43342,1.7059,6.2,'-xWMB6l_E0Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2898,_binary '\0','/gIJysgFRli5w3wIY8SDVgteQ2F5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045706',5.9,2349,'en','Dream Wife','Clemson Reade, a business tycoon with marriage on his mind, and Effie, a U.S. diplomat, are a modern couple. Unfortunately there seems to be too much business and not enough pleasure on the part of Effie. When Clemson meets Tarji, a princess trained in all the arts of pleasing men, he decides he wants an old fashioned girl. Princess Tarji\'s father is king of oil-rich Bukistan. Because of the oil situation and to maintain good political relations during the courtship between Clemson & Tarji, the State Department assigns a diplomat to maintain protocol until the wedding - Effie!','/zqKiB8csGBsA3b5dbXlJSNBQYez.jpg','1953-06-19',100,'Released','It\'s a RIOT how Cary carries on!','Dream Wife',52365,1.6788,5.4,'E_MzyXOnGC4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2899,_binary '\0','/m8crLdBzIGGnL6L0aPXj3IV4z5k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045737',6.6,3469,'en','Escape from Fort Bravo','A Southern belle frees a Rebel officer and his men from a Union captain\'s Arizona fort.','/dWOpEeHS7ACISCdKE2k0N12zZyO.jpg','1953-12-04',99,'Released','M-G-M\'s Great Romance Excitingly photographed in Ansco Color','Escape from Fort Bravo',83099,3.2757,6.3,'fM6FYHobcYQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2900,_binary '\0','/kpVJVahswdWXA3GtCl2zniKSFvI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045758',5.3,15657,'en','Fear and Desire','After their airplane crashes behind enemy lines, four soldiers must survive and try to find a way back to their battalion. However, when they come across a local peasant girl the horrors of war quickly become apparent.','/mj7CDh6d5nJDDmEhd0ft6s3L8CM.jpg','1953-03-31',62,'Released','Trapped… 4 desperate men and a strange half-animal girl!','Fear and Desire',10165,2.5189,5.4,'rDy7E6pNBSc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2901,_binary '\0','/kpTTUyVxWMTebmBkaxB2YAX8yyU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045793',7.6,54852,'en','From Here to Eternity','In 1941 Hawaii, a private is cruelly punished for not boxing on his unit\'s team, while his captain\'s wife and second in command are falling in love.','/sP3T6hTkTMCksUXb0wzzOgbXIfk.jpg','1953-08-28',118,'Released','The boldest book of our time… honestly, fearlessly on the screen!','From Here to Eternity',11426,6.5623,7.3,'gFqfmJXrgUc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2902,_binary '\0','/joKE4go2xu9zLnS1KMO9ahu1Ifj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045808',7,3820,'en','Genevieve','Two friends driving in the London to Brighton vintage car rally bet on which of them will be the first to arrive back home.','/fO5PtTc7GGgxDfD6ndM009gGWhE.jpg','1953-05-28',86,'Released',NULL,'Genevieve',43346,1.4109,6.7,'YwRTGiaC8Z0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2903,_binary '\0','/2clBxxclZJ4OK1xzhmCCXHEfy3r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045810',7.1,47065,'en','Gentlemen Prefer Blondes','Lorelei Lee is a beautiful showgirl engaged to be married to the wealthy Gus Esmond, much to the disapproval of Gus\' rich father, Esmond Sr., who thinks that Lorelei is just after his money. When Lorelei goes on a cruise accompanied only by her best friend, Dorothy Shaw, Esmond Sr. hires Ernie Malone, a private detective, to follow her and report any questionable behavior that would disqualify her from the marriage.','/fDozhst5HVJJcd3BM8ZOsKniO7Q.jpg','1953-07-15',91,'Released','The Two M-M-Marvels Of Our Age In The Wonder Musical Of The World!','Gentlemen Prefer Blondes',759,5.3172,7.32,'TOqfJEPB8rI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2904,_binary '\0','/AtSEK9mpWh03THz0X38IUGveRa2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045814',7.6,2685,'ja','祇園囃子','Fleeing a distressing family situation, Eiko, a very young girl, becomes an apprentice to Miyoharu, a veteran geisha. Both, determined to preserve their professional integrity, must face the selfishness and ambition of several petty people.','/fQelo0Z5vhVHATqUmdNrXVoUEcv.jpg','1953-08-12',85,'Released',NULL,'A Geisha',45991,1.7843,7.6,'qYBu2etwwxc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2905,_binary '\0','/9OBrllwK5LXyYXNdfAfU5Zv0Ze0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045824',6.9,1553,'en','The Glass Wall','Peter Kuban, a Hungarian refugee, is about to be deported after jumping ship in New York harbor. He needs to find an ex-G.I. named Tom whom he helped during the war, as Tom can prove Peter\'s right to legal entry into the United States. If he can\'t find Tom within 24 hours and prove his case, he will be branded a fugitive and will be permanently disqualified for U.S. citizenship.','/fg0Y0KlcmG4ALhecZCQ3y1tCzVD.jpg','1953-03-19',82,'Released','THE 10-HOUR MANHUNT...that tore New York apart!','The Glass Wall',34752,1.5755,5.3,'OKcPOqfIM5U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2906,_binary '\0','/i3amNNQD4X0KHG241kuJ3s5wYbG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045826',4.3,9807,'en','Glen or Glenda','Glen doesn\'t dare tell his fiancée Barbara that he is a transvestite known as Glenda; in addition, Alan is undergoing medical treatment to become a woman named Anne; both stories are told by a psychiatrist.','/uZir2hA6VOmVNS6JdKb6RiYghTA.jpg','1953-04-01',71,'Released','I Changed My Sex!','Glen or Glenda',24018,1.7393,4.691,'taoDcurT738','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2907,_binary '\0','/mQRLC2etilSvEfIFAMovzBevIAG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045846',6.1,2042,'en','Gun Fury','After a stagecoach holdup, Frank Slayton\'s notorious gang leave Ben Warren for dead and head off with his fiancée. Warren follows, and although none of the townspeople he comes across are prepared to help, he recruits two others who have sworn revenge on the ruthless Slayton.','/d4xs3z9hQHPj0EImNQkRWfLMOBE.jpg','1953-10-09',83,'Released','A WOMAN WRONGED...A MAN TO AVENGE HER!...and he rode south to do it!','Gun Fury',43348,2.2979,6.1,'mDSKedgf5GA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2908,_binary '\0','/19M4AmGDk8xSY9B7v1WBp8zbHFz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045847',6.6,1529,'en','Gunsmoke','Reb Kittridge is hired by the villans but turns to defend the rancher Saxon after learning the true situation. Kittrige wins Saxon\'s ranch with a cut of the cards but Saxon has other reasons for loosing the gamble. Telford and Lake try everything from bushwacking to wildfire starting to stop the Saxon/Kittridge herd of cattle from reaching the railhead.','/oEI67VJbujFNllaRBiIHFIxzBTK.jpg','1953-05-04',79,'Released','Hired Gunslinger In A Lawless Land!','Gunsmoke',128851,1.4664,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2909,_binary '\0','/fMYjzQAqTlz8kWAcSmjSH9s7QIN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045848',7.4,8159,'sv','Gycklarnas afton','A number of complicated relationships develop between a circus ringmaster, his estranged wife and his lover.','/o1LGjSnibRtFuoBXrttm6pueNiD.jpg','1953-09-14',93,'Released',NULL,'Sawdust and Tinsel',47721,1.4964,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2910,_binary '\0','/lscsVYcLRhzDVqJa4SMa1zT5N2A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045876',6.1,1553,'en','His Majesty O\'Keefe','Men steal for it. Nations go to war for it. The it is oil - and it grows on trees. Coconut oil is the precious lifeblood of 1870s South Seas traders. And lots of real blood will be spilled to get it! Screen royalty Burt Lancaster is His Majesty O\'Keefe in this last of three adventures that (along with The Flame and the Arrow and The Crimson Pirate) blew a revitalizing wind into the sails of the swashbuckler genre. Action, cunning and derring-do are watchwords of the title seafarer as he befriends, defends and ultimately rules the islanders of exotic Yap. Lensed on gorgeus Fiji locations, grandly scored by Robert Farnon and rousingly directed by Byron Haskin, His Majesty O\'Keefe delivers heroics of regal proportions.','/kdHvzBI9lzoUJ0roiDvFALxMegs.jpg','1954-01-16',90,'Released','Adventure Beyond The Fabulous! Two Years In The Making! All Of It Actually Filmed In The Fiji Islands!','His Majesty O\'Keefe',113785,2.3087,6.4,'8LaSLqOW6BM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2911,_binary '\0','/r25MOqbIjOVw2lK7MrZ1dGFNjiy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045877',6.9,12076,'en','The Hitch-Hiker','Roy and Gilbert\'s fishing trip takes a terrifying turn when the hitchhiker they pick up turns out to be a sociopath on the run from the law. He\'s killed before, and he lets the two know that as soon as they\'re no longer useful, he\'ll kill again. The two friends plot an escape, but the hitchhiker\'s peculiar physical affliction, an eye that never closes even when he sleeps, makes it impossible for them to tell when they can make a break for it.','/9ORvQWC2o0FwIEl6zYU1jw9qH0X.jpg','1953-03-30',71,'Released','Who\'ll be his next victim... YOU?','The Hitch-Hiker',41462,2.233,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2912,_binary '\0','/zZWFQH8Sh5g3FsljHEZJVa9Lgwg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045883',7,14200,'en','Hondo','Army despatch rider Hondo Lane discovers a woman and her son living in the midst of warring Apaches, and he becomes their protector.','/ziHGGNGd9SEcrPgd1sdxJ9JPHWO.jpg','1953-11-26',84,'Released','Out of the gun smoke into her heart!','Hondo',6529,4.7979,6.5,'zIlTK68TUOE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2913,_binary '\0','/r88LTOW3Sl8iZPIf8QbVmzoi6hM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045886',6.8,4034,'en','Houdini','By the early 1900s, the extraordinary Houdini earned an international reputation for his theatrical tricks and daring feats of extrication from shackles, ropes, handcuffs and... Scotland Yard\'s jails.','/9Qz3v7IgaGrSmYfMGyPAPbEJvnV.jpg','1953-07-02',106,'Released','His feats of magic were GREAT! The magic of their love was GREATER!','Houdini',43192,2.3773,6.6,'UAvYTGxIpx4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2914,_binary '\0','/dNRjBNbwQAx4v4lgv4GR0PAzqXC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045888',7,22811,'en','House of Wax','A sculptor opens a wax museum to showcase the likenesses of famous historical figures, but quickly runs into trouble when his business partner demands the exhibits become more extreme in order to increase profits.','/5Di30K5NzAtYMjBSAABwgZHV0Ro.jpg','1953-04-16',88,'Released','You\'ve never been scared until you\'ve been scared in 3-D.','House of Wax',18573,4.9526,6.9,'M5RkKx-9tEM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2915,_binary '\0','/pkOgOztKdFadcarmNZwrOcNHrdq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045891',6.8,27144,'en','How to Marry a Millionaire','Three women set out to find eligible millionaires to marry, but find true love in the process.','/dFwefYyEOOZaWVn15xGY6CbYYJ2.jpg','1953-11-10',96,'Released','The Most Glamorous Entertainment Of Your Lifetime in CinemaScope. You See It Without Glasses!','How to Marry a Millionaire',10297,4.1357,6.848,'7Xdy2t0CfXU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2916,_binary '\0','/5DGlfuO31upq3ieF5rHBVALz5kn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045897',7.2,25587,'en','I Confess','When a priest hears a murderer’s confession, he becomes bound by his vow of silence—even as circumstantial evidence turns suspicion toward him. Torn between faith and self-preservation, he faces public scandal and trial for a crime he cannot reveal the truth about.','/5IYyJetEctAypFYIffqx55PXTPT.jpg','1953-02-12',95,'Released','If you knew what he knew what would you do?','I Confess',30159,4.9587,7.1,'VY2sixen4Iw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2917,_binary '\0','/nDWfUcMGtBKxAFtJ6gwnG67FlFy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045899',6.6,1223,'en','I Love Melvin','Melvin Hoover, a budding photographer for Look magazine, accidentally bumps into a young actress named Judy LeRoy in the park. They start to talk, and Melvin soon offers to do a photo spread of her. His boss, however, has no intention of using the photos. Melvin wants to marry Judy, but her father would rather she marry dull and dependable Harry Black. As a last resort, Melvin promises to get Judy\'s photo on the cover of the next issue of Look, a task easier said than done.','/yF7yoYofUExKH8IVt4iHfTuc71O.jpg','1953-03-20',77,'Released','Songs! Dances! Joy! as a boy promises to get his girl\'s picture on a LOOK magazine cover!','I Love Melvin',80032,1.5491,6.2,'DcxFCmoetdo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2918,_binary '\0','/alGeVsCYeCQnQritNjUzq3UgqYh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045907',7,1787,'es','La ilusión viaja en tranvía','Confronted with the unfortunate news that their favorite Streetcar, no. 133, is going to be decommissioned, two Municipal Transit workers get drunk and decide to \"take \'er for one last spin,\" as it were. Unfortunately, the \"one last spin\" ends up being an all-night and all-day scramble to stay out of trouble, as they are confronted with situation after sometimes bizarre situation that prevents them from returning the \"borrowed\" Streetcar!','/2j7qoxCzDzDqMzmNez2VaTGcj51.jpg','1954-03-10',90,'Released',NULL,'Illusion Travels by Streetcar',43338,1.9165,6.531,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2919,_binary '\0','/t49An9icOxWpOFLmpBvfJBhQjb6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045911',7,2068,'en','Inferno','When selfish and arrogant millionaire Donald Carson fractures his leg during a desert vacation, his wife, Geraldine, leaves with their friend Joseph Duncan to supposedly get help. However, the two of them are really lovers who are leaving Carson to die in the heat. Slowly, Carson realizes he is on his own and vows revenge on the traitorous couple. Having had a privileged life, Carson must now use his wits to stay alive.','/2jND5Ez8I1gcWvF0XCWXkcm2SIS.jpg','1953-08-12',83,'Released','The most breath-taking man hunt that ever criss-crossed out of the screen!','Inferno',37198,1.3359,6.1,'fhCxe7sb9tc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2920,_binary '\0','/f26rSgpMWGNOtW4pdIpUDQSnbj3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045917',6.3,10482,'en','Invaders from Mars','A boy tries to stop aliens that have taken over his town and are brainwashing its inhabitants.','/hoHCZJWrHwEXfog7ql0DtGbzmv4.jpg','1953-04-09',78,'Released','NATURAL or SUPERNATURAL?','Invaders from Mars',20424,3.2497,5.9,'t-UznSukKJA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2921,_binary '\0','/tq2vEygYUPHY6U9pw9AtiDH2NLJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045919',6.8,4191,'en','Island in the Sky','A C-47 transport plane, named the Corsair, makes a forced landing in the frozen wastelands of Labrador, and the plane\'s pilot, Captain Dooley, must keep his men alive in deadly conditions while awaiting rescue.','/z4SFfn5f4a2RrXAqVue9P8lTCLi.jpg','1953-09-05',109,'Released','He Fought Every Fury of Man and Mountain To Get Where His Woman Was!','Island in the Sky',40577,2.7015,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2922,_binary '\0','/gViGkoDcSzD068r04Vdo6jF0oGM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045920',6.5,13024,'en','It Came from Outer Space','Author and amateur astronomer John Putnam and schoolteacher Ellen Fields witness an enormous meteorite come down near a small town in Arizona. Putnam becomes a local object of scorn when, after examining the object up close, he announces that it is a spacecraft, and that it is inhabited...','/zPXff8iRma28YQFApfzuWadZXzP.jpg','1953-06-05',80,'Released','Fantastic sights leap out at you!','It Came from Outer Space',19483,2.7073,6.346,'YJY4zGfQ_vo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2923,_binary '\0','/myvNbmklXMyINevJqRBc2i9laeh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045932',6.8,2904,'en','Jeopardy','A woman is kidnapped when she goes to get help for her husband who is trapped on a beach with the tide coming in to surely drown him.','/8eXPMsrLsTK2AcFSwbCoWWIeeRB.jpg','1953-03-30',69,'Released','She did it... because her fear was greater than her shame!','Jeopardy',41611,1.6316,6.7,'jThhYGJqt8w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2924,_binary '\0','/sd6ubptU7n0iWYSn9a0tHl1bVpb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045935',7.1,4896,'ja','地獄門','Japan, 1159. Moritō, a brave samurai, performs a heroic act by rescuing the lovely Kesa during a violent uprising. Moritō falls in love with her, but becomes distraught when he finds out that she is married.','/um7KDGoLgS1aRDZENkxlTSLIQNw.jpg','1953-10-30',86,'Released','The most honored screen import in a decade!','Gate of Hell',43349,1.9432,7.1,'DAwhQRDSzBk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2925,_binary '\0','/8NHcXLY9jLquzYlHhxGlv2BNCkF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045943',7.2,14337,'en','Julius Caesar','The growing ambition of Julius Caesar is a source of major concern to his close friend Brutus. Cassius persuades him to participate in his plot to assassinate Caesar but both have sorely underestimated Mark Antony.','/u0tgcCv1x73fumXaVPEzyvjjs4G.jpg','1953-06-04',121,'Released','MGM\'s acclaimed production of William Shakespeare\'s Julius Caesar.','Julius Caesar',18019,4.0436,7.1,'DcGenSlgwAM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2926,_binary '\0','/4tQZGla6QVCAUMWX8iW3zMoJqwS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045963',7,7362,'en','Kiss Me Kate','A pair of divorced actors are brought together to participate in a musical version of The Taming of the Shrew. Of course, the couple seem to act a great deal like the characters they play, and they must work together when mistaken identities get them mixed up with the mafia.','/phJTfsjxxi0a6ibYQ7SCACoTXDC.jpg','1953-11-26',109,'Released','Famed Stage Hit Now Big Color Musical!','Kiss Me Kate',34857,2.3637,6.549,'ZiTQMypUgs8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2927,_binary '\0','/qzaE9gBDu4DTSrmPfmctMAjbfh1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045966',6.2,4551,'en','Knights of the Round Table','In Camelot, kingdom of Arthur and Merlin, Lancelot is well known for his courage and honor. But one day he must quit Camelot and the Queen Guinevere\'s love, leaving the Round Table without protection.','/bkXgVIpzVtDIbIscq5Z4M6sJ8Ex.jpg','1953-12-22',115,'Released','All the glory and splendor of King Arthur\'s court','Knights of the Round Table',19957,3.258,6,'kya9QyMYbdo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2928,_binary '\0','/drPnhMQbM8P7vptzE9yvxbefaMR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0045992',6.3,1603,'en','The Lawless Breed','After being released from prison, ex-gunfighter John Wesley Hardin hopes to have his autobiography published in order to rehabilitate his tarnished reputation.','/tjjbx5SCnKynd5bsMjX9pBUdyUF.jpg','1952-12-28',83,'Released','He cut a swath of daring across the great southwest!','The Lawless Breed',99224,2.1824,6.729,'VTDFKGFNBjU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2929,_binary '\0','/ybp84IEabQXA0N647JxKIchjVfv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046000',7.2,4487,'en','Lili','Members of a circus troupe \"adopt\" Lili Daurier when she finds herself stranded in a strange town. The magician who first comes to her rescue already has romantic entanglements and thinks of her as a little girl. Who can she turn to but the puppets, singing to them her troubles, forgetting that there are puppeteers? A crowd gathers around Lili as she sings. The circus has a new act. She now has a job. Will she get her heart\'s desire?','/3vcaVT09imU0XlxClUlgMAYMexu.jpg','1953-03-10',81,'Released','You\'ll fall in love with...','Lili',43350,2.5299,6.735,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2930,_binary '\0','/afc1HoNlt8JMr5oydHGW7HZKETh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046004',7.5,3363,'en','Little Fugitive','After a prank makes Joey Norton believe he killed his older brother, he runs away from home and spends the day at Coney Island while his brother tries to find him before their mother gets home.','/bb1zkuqfxGT8xSJu3mVYIT5xO4u.jpg','1953-10-01',80,'Released','Morris Engel\'s All-American Classic','Little Fugitive',52620,1.3562,6.936,'cRgkgXthRk8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2931,_binary '\0','/i6yv70rZxMmRyVYldSEajmSAHbZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046008',7.3,1991,'en','The Living Desert','Although first glance reveals little more than stones and sand, the desert is alive. Witness moving rocks, spitting mud pots, gorgeous flowers and the never-ending battle for survival between desert creatures of every shape, size and description.','/yFMhGIMqXdZZYG9pfnyC26bRD6z.jpg','1953-11-10',69,'Released','Opening a whole new world of entertainment!','The Living Desert',11383,2.2912,7.072,'DwewijOin68','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2932,_binary '\0','/msQMXYEBHQ7zPVu0TPEm7wUSGHQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046022',7.8,12290,'fr','Madame de…','In late 19th century France, the Countess Louise, wife of a wealthy general, sells the earrings her husband gave her on their wedding day to pay off her secret debts, then claims to have lost them. Her husband quickly learns of the deceit, which is the beginning of many tragic misunderstandings, all involving the earrings, the general, the countess, and her new lover, the Italian Baron Donati.','/xAgA99X8BjkCUX91ukgiK10Z6La.jpg','1953-04-16',105,'Released','It was her vanity that destroyed her.','The Earrings of Madame de...',27030,2.3598,7.492,'al18feIPhPI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2933,_binary '\0','/9pPBXYHq0iH6Z71YwQIqV2y9h4x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046026',5.7,2363,'en','The Magnetic Monster','The Office of Scientific Investigations tracks down the source of increased magnetism and radioactivity in Los Angeles, and discovers that a man-made isotope is consuming available energy from nearby mass every few hours, doubling its size in the process. Although microscopic, it will soon become big enough to destroy Earth; and how to stop it is yet to be determined. The film\'s Deltatron special effects footage is taken from the 1934 German sci-fi film GOLD.','/eIV85xjg61orfVQnQykTSNGKTVj.jpg','1953-02-18',76,'Released','Terror swoops through the heart of a city in the dead of night!','The Magnetic Monster',44692,2.3375,5.6,'kxrleyBdW-A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2934,_binary '\0','/i9fd8WG7NOcNNbWAauDxcunB3Mz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046029',6.5,2246,'en','Malta Story','Malta, 1942, during World War II. While the German air force is relentlessly bombing the island, a British pilot falls in love with a young Maltese girl.','/euFcLelmexn1bsgWITBa9oR350d.jpg','1953-06-01',99,'Released',NULL,'Malta Story',65489,1.326,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2935,_binary '\0','/rBOntYgK9u7k51RKvktcWxitnXV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046031',7,2945,'en','The Man Between','A British woman on a visit to post-war Berlin is caught up in an espionage ring smuggling secrets into and out of the Eastern Bloc.','/nXKmv6vF17wntw0s1vHVgm2DQze.jpg','1953-10-19',100,'Released','Terror! Vice! Violence! He stopped at nothing!','The Man Between',3014,2.5342,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2936,_binary '\0','/F4Uy3Z0tJIktuiJL7Rqg124DRv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046035',6.4,2382,'en','The Man from the Alamo','During the war for Texas independence, one man leaves the Alamo before the end (chosen to help others\' families) but is too late to accomplish his mission, and is branded a coward. Unable to expose a gang of turncoats, he infiltrates them instead.','/hfbzo1t4hCbK28aXeeGfGSv5aLB.jpg','1953-08-07',79,'Released','Out Of Texas\' Bravest Hour... Came The Man They Called The Coward','The Man from the Alamo',38808,3.0972,6.602,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2937,_binary '\0','/zSGh6Il6IBtxVUpWGNjNqSsaM57.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046040',7.2,2082,'en','Man on a Tightrope','The owner of an impoverished circus in Communist-ruled Czechoslovokia plots to flee across the border to freedom, taking his entire troupe of performers and wild animals with him.','/alW4hvzjGgdq74ZW4zoQNFA8OEh.jpg','1953-05-21',105,'Released','It\'s true! The stranger-than-fiction story that screams with SUSPENSE!','Man on a Tightrope',99898,2.7467,6.6,'0hJxDEaor2Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2938,_binary '\0','/rpYeuC1MQ4wjoOGLU7vzXqfn4XV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046054',6.4,2000,'en','The Master of Ballantrae','Scottish highlander Jamie Durie falls into a life of piracy after joining the failed rebellion of Bonnie Prince Charlie against the British crown.','/lYoPcDtJEAoyZZ7e0QHCgTPynQi.jpg','1953-08-05',90,'Released','The Thundering Crusaders of the White Cockade!','The Master of Ballantrae',43355,2.52,5.9,'84QbuPhOHbQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2939,_binary '\0','/6vWIjtLcup0czXQX1ISDJ46dRKg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046057',5.8,1531,'en','The Maze','A Scotsman abruptly breaks off his engagement to pretty Kitty and moves to his uncle\'s castle in the Scottish highlands. Kitty and her aunt follow Gerald a few weeks later, and discover he has suddenly aged. Some mysterious things happen in a maze made from the hedges adjoining the castle.','/eZhrTbkWZb45QcBjIlSUNTarydm.jpg','1953-07-02',80,'Released','The Deadliest Trap in the World!','The Maze',85498,1.6296,5.6,'WCi5olsvVwY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2940,_binary '\0','/zQ8wPuH8gBri5HklctmjrfxF5nL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046066',2.7,2099,'en','Mesa of Lost Women','A mad scientist, Dr. Aranya (Jackie Coogan), has created giant spiders in his Mexican lab in Zarpa Mesa to create a race of superwomen by injecting spiders with human pituitary growth hormones. Women develop miraculous regenerative powers, but men mutate into disfigured dwarves. Spiders grow to human size and intelligence.','/gTuJoE9Zt6e4g9rhtrtTvdTOZKZ.jpg','1953-06-17',69,'Released','A race of deadly spider-women luring men to their death!','Mesa of Lost Women',23125,2.0659,2.5,'c6FNTpoyNJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2941,_binary '\0','/jBQSWkYCHN6cI27W90ok63WYjqP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046072',6.8,4780,'en','The Million Pound Note','An impoverished American sailor is fortunate enough to be passing the house of two rich gentlemen who have conceived the crazy idea of distributing a note worth one million pounds. The sailor finds that whenever he tries to use the note to buy something, people treat him like a king and let him have whatever he likes for free. Ultimately, the money proves to be more troublesome than it is worth when it almost costs him his dignity and the woman he loves.','/vB5bI215fOPg3rDkOwP1aS4Z2R.jpg','1954-01-07',90,'Released','Great fun... you can bank on it!','The Million Pound Note',34000,4.3458,7,'-2DQxr47qMc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2942,_binary '\0','/5OMMPh1WG3yUNA6Z4SFhpLfaXQF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046076',5.9,1906,'en','Miss Sadie Thompson','Sadie Thompson winds up stranded on an island and while her boat is being quarantined, she manages to stir up the blood of every marine on the base.','/bivpL0VSVuFTSDT7LAXQJ1xvQVx.jpg','1953-12-23',91,'Released','RITA TURNS ON THE HEAT IN 3D','Miss Sadie Thompson',44140,1.9635,5.387,'diAS8GVoW9U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2943,_binary '\0','/4B5y8UxovpOWwdF9xSXfxljjgxj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046085',6.6,10113,'en','Mogambo','On a Kenyan safari, white hunter Victor Marswell has a love triangle with seductive American socialite Eloise Kelly and anthropologist Donald Nordley\'s cheating wife Linda.','/sKc2pZhmTz3xfItLAci44vCTrYx.jpg','1953-09-23',116,'Released','Flaming love found in the savage heart of the jungle!','Mogambo',25009,2.5206,6.4,'--GdJaV-kIo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2944,_binary '\0','/6o6hr98v8Dv0rWOkGTPX8WgqIKJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046094',6.7,2750,'en','The Moon Is Blue','Two aging playboys are both after the same attractive young woman, but she fends them off by claiming that she plans to remain a virgin until her wedding night. Both men determine to find a way around her objections.','/wKwmMM7gBFloF13EapN6XXpQlFE.jpg','1953-07-08',99,'Released','From the Sensational Stage Hit That Ran 3 years on Broadway!','The Moon Is Blue',71839,2.5955,6.3,'SdCsHItDcWo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2945,_binary '\0','/ctUWlPJ0jLYkwyXjvofdQjtRdgu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046126',7,22804,'en','Niagara','Rose Loomis and her older, gloomier husband, George, are vacationing at a cabin in Niagara Falls. The couple befriend Polly and Ray Cutler, who are honeymooning in the area. Polly begins to suspect that something is amiss between Rose and George, and her suspicions grow when she sees Rose in the arms of another man. While Ray initially thinks Polly is overreacting, things between George and Rose soon take a shockingly dark turn.','/wb9OBAiO3aUpY4UBkE07KscXSkA.jpg','1953-01-29',92,'Released','A raging torrent of emotion that even nature can\'t control!','Niagara',19997,4.0621,6.8,'NHUOyB1TB3c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2946,_binary '\0','/kvL58xz7yjaBuZ75Y4A0dmztoQq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046159',6.9,2588,'it','Pane, amore e fantasia','When a veteran marshal is sent to a small town, he quickly falls for two women: a midwife and an earthy young woman nicknamed \"Frisky\".','/qFZa1OU1Kbp0yDQN9RvU5bmWNAw.jpg','1953-12-22',87,'Released','...the stuff great entertainment is made of!','Bread, Love and Dreams',56402,2.308,7.005,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2947,_binary '\0','/vwcfvPzYO3Gz975yRXp6DYSSbzo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046183',7.2,167697,'en','Peter Pan','Leaving the safety of their nursery behind, Wendy, Michael and John follow Peter Pan to a magical world where childhood lasts forever. But while in Neverland, the kids must face Captain Hook and foil his attempts to get rid of Peter for good.','/fJJOs1iyrhKfZceANxoPxPwNGF1.jpg','1953-02-05',77,'Released','It will live in your heart forever!','Peter Pan',10693,13.1066,7.191,'8TYSIf1Ppcg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2948,_binary '\0','/44JuUrM0J2Yhzf0u6cmkUCCncvy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046186',4.1,1783,'en','Phantom from Space','After a UFO sighting, a mysterious phantom in a bizarre outfit starts attacking people in San Fernando Valley.','/blctsVWNJVlv8Zc4wWcgzlCFc28.jpg','1953-05-15',73,'Released','His secret power menaced the world!','Phantom from Space',23293,1.4923,4.5,'Rhks-1SGKCE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2949,_binary '\0','/wrX24LRWYGZyvPr3W3SSM35QOd7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046187',7.6,18105,'en','Pickup on South Street','In New York City, an insolent pickpocket, Skip McCoy, inadvertently sets off a chain of events when he targets ex-prostitute Candy and steals her wallet. Unaware that she has been making deliveries of highly classified information to the communists, Candy, who has been trailed by FBI agents for months in hopes of nabbing the spy ringleader, is sent by her ex-boyfriend, Joey, to find Skip and retrieve the valuable microfilm he now holds.','/et4fY4BxLyAPwxvUFUbzCUrGsjR.jpg','1953-05-27',80,'Released','How the law took a chance on a B-girl … and won!','Pickup on South Street',25955,3.3841,7.4,'vEAURni5bIE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2950,_binary '\0','/3e29eboA5v6SOcSKPxskPOMl8Td.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046198',5.8,1667,'en','Pony Express','Buffalo Bill and Wild Bill Hickok join forces to establish a mail route that can get mail from St. Joseph, Missouri, to Sacramento, California, in ten days. Along the way they must battle bad weather, hostile Indians and outlaws intent on robbing the mail and shutting down the entire operation.','/azGNafKSZIOm0OTEJKjSApwnSbI.jpg','1953-06-15',101,'Released','GALLOPING THRILLS! A mighty adventure when America\'s destiny rode in the saddle bags of the...PONY EXPRESS','Pony Express',43351,2.8406,5.793,'B5va9JXedVo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2951,_binary '\0','/h5lp0a9ABTLSm96mKokG7VIXznN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046213',3.4,1543,'en','Project Moon Base','In the future (1970) the US sends a mission to the moon to investigate the building of a moon base.','/djG5ljYkjESdyeueMNfdu0VHsL0.jpg','1953-09-04',63,'Released','They found romance 100,000 miles from the earth!','Project Moon Base',26270,1.2734,3.3,'IRYWKD5TwJE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2952,_binary '\0','/9kKyVrQ9QNZpGzzlupJMXSlcBdq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046239',6.1,1265,'en','Ride, Vaquero!','Two Mexican outlaws, Rio and Esqueda, raised as stepbrothers, have a showdown over the issue of whether to evict new settlers from their Texas border territory.','/pA9t01y8BvWMal5MwSIozinASu3.jpg','1953-07-17',90,'Released','The Outlaw And The Beauty!','Ride, Vaquero!',46193,2.0627,6.1,'PE2xyuUfXAw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2953,_binary '\0','/nWCcl7iY718qikjbYfERstvcBrn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046247',6.7,13068,'en','The Robe','Drunk and disillusioned Roman, Marcellus Gallio, wins Jesus\' robe in a dice game after the crucifixion. Marcellus has never been a man of faith like his slave, Demetrius, but when Demetrius escapes with the robe, Marcellus experiences disturbing visions and feels guilty for his actions. Convinced that destroying the robe will cure him, Marcellus sets out to find Demetrius — and discovers his Christian faith along the way.','/qFYZNGzftIM8dqGMJBToGraAFJp.jpg','1953-09-16',135,'Released','The first motion picture in CinemaScope--the modern miracle you see without glasses!','The Robe',29912,4.0045,6.8,'f4TXamLcmZE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2954,_binary '\0','/ytcBjaFsLZ3g8krv6dej87Wemgt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046248',3,5875,'en','Robot Monster','Ro-Man, an alien robot who greatly resembles a gorilla in a diving helmet, is sent to earth to destroy all human life. Ro-Man falls in love with one of the last six remaining humans, and struggles to understand how his programming can instruct him to kill her while his heart demands that he can\'t.','/5b4SKRHdSHCm2SZmrP26lnVC44x.jpg','1953-06-24',66,'Released','Moon monsters launch attack against Earth! How can science meet the menace of astral assassins? New Science Fiction Thrills!','Robot Monster',43353,1.4366,4.5,'NF2YHnr--J4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2955,_binary '\0','/gzRISGjiDMj4xqYE9ES2KNIXxpo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046250',8,158889,'en','Roman Holiday','Overwhelmed by her suffocating schedule, touring European princess Ann takes off for a night while in Rome. When a sedative she took from her doctor kicks in, however, she falls asleep on a park bench and is found by an American reporter, Joe Bradley, who takes her back to his apartment for safety. At work the next morning, Joe finds out Ann\'s regal identity and bets his editor he can get exclusive interview with her, but romance soon gets in the way.','/8lI9dmz1RH20FAqltkGelY1v4BE.jpg','1953-08-26',119,'Released',NULL,'Roman Holiday',804,12.6229,7.9,'2vm2FdHg7Io','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2956,_binary '\0','/xOTXvXuhS5QLzdDPzuTRoUhfQPU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046264',5.3,1390,'ru','Садко','In the old Russian city of Novgorod, the merchants are feasting in a gorgeous palace and Sadko is bragging that he can bring to their land a sweet-voiced bird of happiness. They laugh at him, but he is offered help by the Ocean King\'s daughter, who is mesmerized by Sadko\'s singing and is in love with him. The hero is destined to visit many lands in his search of the bird.','/oJGOe5rTM7Y1Cs27t0exJgCX0vd.jpg','1953-01-05',85,'Released',NULL,'Sadko',46997,2.1612,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2957,_binary '\0','/hTP6H7sNlWXdGxAciXQSjNJ1ob7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046268',8.1,74399,'fr','Le Salaire de la peur','In a run-down South American town, four men are paid to drive trucks loaded with nitroglycerin into the jungle through to the oil field. Friendships are tested and rivalries develop as they embark upon the perilous journey.','/sNOvIp4X0fmCMfgEs2ww5IyMgFm.jpg','1953-04-22',154,'Released','‘Dynamic’ ‘Tremendous’ ‘Shattering’','The Wages of Fear',204,6.1436,8.004,'2_0OrSG5RWA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2958,_binary '\0','/eCimTTSMNIJueBP9NaOZid3NmnK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046269',5.8,2582,'en','Salome','In the reign of emperor Tiberius, Gallilean prophet John the Baptist preaches against King Herod and Queen Herodias. The latter wants John dead, but Herod fears to harm him due to a prophecy. Enter beautiful Princess Salome, Herod\'s long-absent stepdaughter. Herodias sees the king\'s dawning lust for Salome as her means of bending him to her will. But Salome and her lover Claudius are–contrary to Scripture–nearing conversion to the new religion.','/kHZnxZoxYJPXMfkPieR0xNiTJjh.jpg','1953-03-24',103,'Released','The Glory And Excitement Of Rome... In All Its Greatness and Badness!','Salome',40165,2.0903,5.8,'AO7hCTljfIc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2959,_binary '\0','/8oxhZyEKEnuYVjXt5XwyE2unhO1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046280',6.4,2476,'en','Scared Stiff','A nightclub singer and his partner escape mobsters by fleeing to Cuba with a beautiful heiress, who has inherited a haunted castle on an isolated island. The trio hunt for a hidden treasure and encounter a ghost, a zombie, and a mysterious killer...','/cnglxMYB0912uje2gC2VfMZRywo.jpg','1953-04-27',108,'Released','They\'re making a spook-tacle of themselves!','Scared Stiff',33754,2.5122,6.5,'454WwfYuETU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2960,_binary '\0','/96Z4GUIYmgeUpvQ7qng4W491iTU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046288',5.9,1500,'en','Second Chance','A prize-fighting boxer with a lethal right punch falls for a gangster\'s moll on the run in Mexico.','/t3ttg4ak6sZxvbgKcUGfE5NnUBH.jpg','1953-07-18',82,'Released','For the First Time - 3D with Important Stars!','Second Chance',20621,1.6574,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2961,_binary '\0','/dVVHQUdxfvUZSBjsW4E5xfoLWF6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046292',6.5,1778,'it','Il segno di Venere','Agnese has many men who woo her and live with her cousin Cesira, who has the opposite problem with men and wishes she would also have men woo her.','/qR0GFiUNutlGVkBglgWrZvHREWe.jpg','1955-03-12',101,'Released',NULL,'The Sign of Venus',56435,2.1105,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2962,_binary '\0','/d4UtWStJr1z13fBjMlsHHCbHVoJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046294',6.2,1521,'en','Seminole','Lance Caldwell, a cavalry lieutenant, recounts his efforts to make peace with the Seminole Indian tribe, under an evil major.','/dVY3d7uVAMFSrFqlzrEMQlh3FFB.jpg','1953-03-20',87,'Released','Courage...Treachery...and Love --- AND THE GREAT EVERGLADES INDIAN WARS!','Seminole',63861,1.6021,5.6,'1ubawEW7IeM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2963,_binary '\0','/mPzUzA0iK50gBdMuux4Dojb7VQL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046303',7.6,48291,'en','Shane','A weary gunfighter attempts to settle down with a homestead family, but a smouldering settler and rancher conflict forces him to act.','/svr5ADpjXTCOQv8hmuJnB7I14Qv.jpg','1953-04-23',118,'Released','The greatest story of the West ever filmed!','Shane',3110,5.735,7.3,'JMYo9FTcnck','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2964,_binary '\0','/f04ZvLvWxmmWOQO9toPn9Hu5H2y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046313',7.1,2560,'it','La signora senza camelie','A Milanese shop assistant becomes an overnight film sensation when fate lands her the leading role in a prominent producer\'s romantic drama.','/lOBo0a99Y8FHzAZO2feS888or1C.jpg','1953-02-27',97,'Released',NULL,'The Lady Without Camelias',93863,1.6977,6.5,'j2XA4flU8wA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2965,_binary '\0','/kF5UhtIbadVqR0sfhzBBmwq8ToG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046345',7.5,18073,'sv','Sommaren med Monika','One summer day, two teens begin a reckless affair and abandon their families to be with one another.','/82hLsn67V9TjgrLOZCFL7247pJd.jpg','1953-02-09',98,'Released','A Picture for Wide Screens and Broad Minds.','Summer with Monika',47735,2.9078,7.343,'W_yx-_D7b-c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2966,_binary '\0','/4Wh7Fm7BmIFum7yfUdez5OlhcMG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046353',6.8,2316,'en','Split Second','Escaped convicts hold hostages in a ghost town targeted for a nuclear bomb test.','/tLRXYfxtpAbPjURqzJI0YZpmH0i.jpg','1953-05-02',85,'Released','Steel Your Nerves! Here\'s excitement that will smash them!','Split Second',25549,1.2888,6.4,'oyZ00ZfhdbM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2967,_binary '\0','/rM3C9s0b9oiOQDdrfLSOoE0sjWl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046359',7.9,60558,'en','Stalag 17','After two American prisoners are killed by guards in the act of escaping from a German POW camp in World War II, barracks black marketeer J.J. Sefton is suspected of being an informer.','/lfve9FDKjT7JPbWI9NCs5340F79.jpg','1953-05-29',120,'Released','The star-spangled, laugh-loaded salute to our P.W. heroes!','Stalag 17',632,3.2058,7.7,'nPT7bzA5Nis','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2968,_binary '\0','/pFIKYogV7g3kjGGiS8TQRJfwDeM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046366',6.2,3492,'it','Stazione Termini','While on vacation in Rome, married American Mary Forbes becomes entangled in an affair with an Italian man, Giovanni Doria. As she prepares to leave Italy, Giovanni confesses his love for her; he doesn\'t want her to go. Together they wander the railroad station where Mary is to take the train to Paris, then ultimately reunite with her husband and daughter in Philadelphia. Will she throw away her old life for this passionate new romance?','/4yEmRpNVEbdOxWlPDhLE3enYD79.jpg','1953-04-02',64,'Released','This Longing ... This Yearning ... This Wanting ...','Indiscretion of an American Wife',74585,2.2377,5.975,'NXKuMaoWk04','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2969,_binary '\0','/gSSnqdbdoo35862hz4jYGgo2odZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046374',6.7,1628,'en','The Story of Three Loves','Passengers on an ocean liner recall their greatest loves.','/9C90c1iCpL1KX51nm7HFpyjZHGZ.jpg','1953-03-26',122,'Released','Dangerous Love. Jealous Love. Forbidden Love.','The Story of Three Loves',130424,2.9032,6,'C9qLkCdOvWQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2970,_binary '\0','/rdbP2JYQkjhF5kBcXbqoiLoefxz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046375',5.9,1731,'en','The Stranger Wore a Gun','Having been a spy for Quantrill\'s raiders during the Civil War, Jeff Travis thinking himself a wanted man, flees to Prescott Arizona where he runs into Jules Mourret who knows of his past. He takes a job on the stage line that Mourret is trying to steal gold from. When Mourret\'s men kill a friend of his he sets out to get Mourret and his men. When his plan to have another gang get Mourret fails, he has to go after them himself.','/gCB76s6nPPt2vOjE1JZFvzpVLuw.jpg','1953-07-30',82,'Released','THE SCREEN\'S GREATEST OUTDOOR STAR','The Stranger Wore a Gun',43356,2.5025,5.5,'MB_JSmwfiGo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2971,_binary '\0','/zqXzRk8Q656tJqN3Zm80gyagBIe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046384',6.9,2071,'en','The Sun Shines Bright','With the election approaching, a judge in a Southern town at the turn of the 20th century is involved variously in revealing the real identity of a young woman, reliving his Civil War memories, and preventing the lynching of an African youth.','/46aBk8HjLwruaHK9vCzjVhd82VZ.jpg','1953-05-02',102,'Released','JUDGE BILLY PRIEST...the only man who ever called Mallie Crump a Lady','The Sun Shines Bright',109539,2.6249,6.6,'VB36s_1zTJ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2972,_binary '\0','/qU0hzGpBhedZxFhsPMTsymdkK8z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046398',6,1249,'en','Take the High Ground!','Sgt. Thorne Ryan, who once fought bravely in Korea, now serves as a hard-nosed drill instructor to new Army recruits at Fort Bliss, Texas. But is he really the man he is often described as? His fellow instructor, and friend helps him to face the ghosts of his past experiences in Korea. One night in a bar across the border in Juarez, Mexico, Sgt. Ryan meets a lady who begins to turn his life around. Will this be enough to help him deal with the past? Or will he continue to be so hard on his troops?','/71ZNVdhhvJaaxPxwwl4Xs5Ydrw6.jpg','1953-10-30',101,'Released','From its rowdy, ribald horse-play, to its rousing marching song... from its hard-boiled hates and slugging feuds to its tough-but tender love story... this is a drama of our times... exciting, exalting, young, brave and alive!','Take the High Ground!',102091,2.009,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2973,_binary '\0','/mGn28CazoJCNkrxxkCWKXHpmVXM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046414',6.4,11571,'en','Beat the Devil','A group of con artists stake their claim on a bogus uranium mine.','/jztp9bhYDGAMK7WgvLA3mmzLseN.jpg','1953-11-24',95,'Released','They’re Out To Beat the Devil At His Own Game!','Beat the Devil',22733,3.517,6.1,'y6X_KEGaG-A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2974,_binary '\0','/c8gLzGFC22jgx7VPfpolrtDuZsJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046415',7.1,1390,'fr','Le Comte de Monte-Cristo','Young sailor Edmond Dantès is wrongfully imprisoned, escapes, finds treasure, and reinvents himself as the wealthy Count of Monte Cristo to exact revenge on those who betrayed him.','/9h1aCqb0lOtvh8BLDsVUhDu4Fxk.jpg','1954-01-14',183,'Released',NULL,'The Count of Monte Cristo',82046,3.5438,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2975,_binary '\0','/8CjSFT2zQpxsxjqH4Mfe17syFSj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046425',6.5,2346,'en','Thunder Bay','Shrimpers and oilmen clash when an ambitious wildcatter begins constructing an off-shore oilrig.','/jLGtRDeGvojKjUFhsCPX15VbhSv.jpg','1953-05-21',103,'Released','The Brawling, Mauling Story of the Biggest Bonanza of Them All !','Thunder Bay',37380,1.8109,6,'B7uEu01oDKg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2976,_binary '\0','/4VVRAIKLDThpuNKooF1i4kABNKY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046429',7.4,2151,'fr','Thérèse Raquin','Star-crossed lovers Thérèse and Laurent think they\'ve gotten away with murder after Thérèse\'s weakling husband \"falls\" from a speeding train. But when forced to contend with a blackmailer\'s demands and the mute accusations of Thérèse\'s mother-in-law, it\'s only a matter of time before the law, their passion or blind chance trips them up.','/efJr4u8UwDefCqAj4rZrJRyvlIN.jpg','1953-11-06',106,'Released',NULL,'Thérèse Raquin',67736,1.3456,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2977,_binary '\0','/ahbx803wrITvlSjxLyp0Sfkzy3s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046435',7,8290,'en','Titanic','Unhappily married, Julia Sturges decides to go to America with her two children on the Titanic. Her husband, Richard also arranges passage on the luxury liner so as to have custody of their two children. All this fades to insignificance once the ship hits an iceberg.','/rEPzO9I6LCk6Mxg1X4BsBk6oA3V.jpg','1953-04-11',98,'Released','TITANIC in Emotion...in Spectacle...in Climax...in Cast!','Titanic',16535,3.1945,6.6,'r2z4DQcKl2c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2978,_binary '\0','/j9NsPNWYs0yXMxTAl3iWP6TXjo7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046436',7,3728,'en','The Titfield Thunderbolt','When British Railways announce the closure of the Titfield to Mallingford branch line a group of local residents make a bid to run it themselves, backed by a monied member of the community who is attracted by the complete lack of licensing hours on trains. Unfortunately the local bus company starts to use methods that can hardly be seen as fair competition.','/pGIAJXG5l8mrtuljnkufBM0ARaQ.jpg','1953-03-04',84,'Released','The Comedy Hit of the Year!','The Titfield Thunderbolt',24381,1.9988,7,'aYvt8Dqjdvk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2979,_binary '\0','/jLq0ol1f0ZKXni9R9GsPBcyPrNN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046438',8.1,78832,'ja','東京物語','The elderly Shukishi and his wife, Tomi, take the long journey from their small seaside village to visit their adult children in Tokyo. Their elder son, Koichi, a doctor, and their daughter, Shige, a hairdresser, don\'t have much time to spend with their aged parents, and so it falls to Noriko, the widow of their younger son who was killed in the war, to keep her in-laws company.','/g2YbTYKpY7N2yDSk7BfXZ18I5QV.jpg','1953-11-03',137,'Released','As long as life goes on, relationships between parents and children will bring boundless joy and endless grief.','Tokyo Story',18148,6.8892,8.148,'5zEKw4VQIeY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2980,_binary '\0','/lYQQWhWA4pAaQRVgKfOrTtZbzAo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046446',5.6,1697,'en','Torch Song','Jenny Stewart is a tough Broadway musical star who doesn\'t take criticism from anyone. Yet there is one individual, Tye Graham, a blind pianist who may be able to break through her tough exterior.','/m9U6griHNqNi6AhuKwj2E54vfLR.jpg','1953-10-01',90,'Released','Tough Baby - a wonderful love story with the star of \"Sudden Fear\" and for the first time you\'ll see her in Technicolor','Torch Song',133119,1.5778,5.9,'KkUb4k54D_0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2981,_binary '\0','/lz8Tbe00QsXrLJ412zY8gezVclx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046451',7.6,9772,'fr','Touchez pas au grisbi','Gentleman gangster Max and his partner, Riton, pull off their last, most successful heist and find themselves comfortable enough to retire in the style they enjoy. However, Max confides the details of the theft to his younger mistress, Josey -- who has secretly taken up with ambitious young rival gangster Angelo. Angelo then has Riton kidnapped and demands the stash of gold as ransom, which threatens Max\'s dreams of the perfect retirement.','/svG2UuJ3SPrCp8O0RGPaKbECilq.jpg','1954-03-17',95,'Released','It Bristles With Violence!','Touchez Pas au Grisbi',27430,3.8713,7.16,'-TVtSLzG4D8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2982,_binary '\0','/cTUNMuc5oiQHm7UAcTWng4Oi7tY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046463',6.8,2513,'en','Trouble Along the Way','Struggling to retain custody of his daughter following his divorce, football coach Steve Williams finds himself embroiled in a recruiting scandal at the tiny Catholic college he is trying to bring back to football respectability.','/pIIWtP5oAEvVUkB61TooDUgY2mC.jpg','1953-04-04',110,'Released','Wild, Wayne and Wonderful All The Way!','Trouble Along the Way',40686,2.337,6.1,'moExVXryj0A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2983,_binary '\0','/fRCVU8DTsCHm4mxQbzdAvpx1M1q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046464',6.6,1288,'en','Trouble in Store','Norman is working in the stock room of a large London department store, but he has ambition (doesn\'t he always !!), he wants to be a window dresser making up the public displays. Whilst trying to fulfill his ambition, he falls in love (doesn\'t he always !!), with one of the shopgirls. Together they discover a plot to rob the store and, somehow, manage to foil the robbers.','/qlBlowWA83mgVZW95uRkRCTjJ5V.jpg','1953-12-14',85,'Released','I know it\'s true, yes, I\'m a fool','Trouble in Store',38388,1.613,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2984,_binary '\0','/iB1tCWl4MKl6OO1kMBD5LxM5BmJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046478',8.1,28590,'ja','雨月物語','In 16th century Japan, peasants Genjuro and Tobei sell their earthenware pots to a group of soldiers in a nearby village, in defiance of a local sage\'s warning against seeking to profit from warfare. Genjuro\'s pursuit of both riches and the mysterious Lady Wakasa, as well as Tobei\'s desire to become a samurai, run the risk of destroying both themselves and their wives, Miyagi and Ohama.','/r8RiuKTIYIJBjczBVsfeP5C00CJ.jpg','1953-03-26',96,'Released',NULL,'Ugetsu',14696,3.562,8.007,'CLrlhu0XxdY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2985,_binary '\0','/dK6s1EMpMcUwBHpiYVMBiTdgdvy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046487',7.3,22219,'fr','Les vacances de Monsieur Hulot','Monsieur Hulot, Jacques Tati’s endearing clown, takes a holiday at a seaside resort, where his presence provokes one catastrophe after another. Tati’s masterpiece of gentle slapstick is a series of effortlessly well-choreographed sight gags involving dogs, boats, and firecrackers; it was the first entry in the Hulot series and the film that launched its maker to international stardom.','/r4F4tsU0Ajeh9ZYUkWOJSYmioj7.jpg','1953-02-25',87,'Released','It\'s laugh-vacation time!','Monsieur Hulot\'s Holiday',778,4.8198,6.9,'4f2gLy-A0hM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2986,_binary '\0','/5SDqKj8AfUazPqXvOCDL1nmE8Zb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046511',7.2,14077,'it','Viaggio in Italia','Married for eight years with no children, Brits Katherine and Alex Joyce are driving to Italy, their ultimate destination just outside of Naples to sell the villa they have just inherited from his uncle, the villa where they will be staying during their time there. On the drive, they come to the realization that this trip marks the first time that they have truly been alone together, and as such don\'t really know one another in the true sense.','/d470qCzer5cTLRdeN0iTCQCJiOc.jpg','1954-09-08',85,'Released',NULL,'Journey to Italy',2748,3.39,7.2,'XXJM3shx8WU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2987,_binary '\0','/A1CWq1kOmAuLlbEwLSNYjGT3XjG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046514',6.8,1645,'en','Vice Squad','A Los Angeles police captain ties the case of a slain policeman to a bank robbery, all in a day.','/5yPSBlPIJjpUzxQZH5pPUI8dSCm.jpg','1953-07-31',87,'Released','Holds you... like a gold diggin\' woman!','Vice Squad',85367,1.5795,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2988,_binary '\0','/wLHQ13c9pSa1Ds9Oo4uBulVa6E2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046515',6.5,1663,'en','Vicki','A supermodel gets murdered. While investigating the case the story of a waitress turned glamor girl is revealed.','/bwd5pWQhWtqgPkrllE0nsWsFEeG.jpg','1953-10-05',85,'Released','\'She Had Everything a Man Could Ever Want And Lived the Way No Woman Ever Should!\'','Vicki',37408,1.595,5.5,'-f6IuBdLz30','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2989,_binary '\0','/xET9AzXSWFWUFSftW5dtrhDTi4n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046521',7.8,23488,'it','I vitelloni','Five young men dream of success as they drift lazily through life in a small Italian village. Fausto, the group\'s leader, is a womanizer; Riccardo craves fame; Alberto is a hopeless dreamer; Moraldo fantasizes about life in the city; and Leopoldo is an aspiring playwright. As Fausto chases a string of women, to the horror of his pregnant wife, the other four blunder their way from one uneventful experience to the next.','/boqcM6bhQICnNue4pkgmauj9JN3.jpg','1953-09-17',103,'Released','A daring story of uninhibited youth!','I Vitelloni',12548,4.0396,7.651,'ZI40T1YNXXc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2990,_binary '\0','/74Q8M90Tg2TsV3iKjoDpJ77WPMJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046534',7,42237,'en','The War of the Worlds','The residents of a small town are excited when a flaming meteor lands in the hills, until they discover it is the first of many transport devices from Mars bringing an army of invaders invincible to any man-made weapon, even the atomic bomb.','/gzc75Za4ArqfXIIr7STNnIE5rnA.jpg','1953-04-03',85,'Released','Mighty panorama of Earth-shaking fury as an army from Mars invades!','The War of the Worlds',8974,6.6455,6.8,'iISa2VMK7Ts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2991,_binary '\0','/v8KYuQKNMjbtf2CDrTgQqJVvAOn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046564',6.7,2045,'en','Young Bess','The mother died under the executioner\'s axe; the daughter rose to become England\'s greatest monarch -- the brilliant and cunning Queen Elizabeth I. Jean Simmons portrays young Bess in this rich tapestry of a film that traces the tumultuous, danger-fraught years from Elizabeth\'s birth to her unexpected ascension to the throne at a mere 25. Charles Laughton reprises his Academy Award®-winning* role as her formidable father Henry VIII. Deborah Kerr plays her last stepmother (and Henry\'s last of six wives), gentle Catherine Parr. And Simmons\' then real-life husband, Stewart Granger, adds heroics as Lord Admiral Thomas Seymour. In a resplendent world of adventure, romance and court intrigue, Young Bess reigns.','/yI8vCadGjFtMnJdkRWDGnXrB8rv.jpg','1953-05-29',112,'Released','A Great and Spectacular Drama!','Young Bess',44711,2.5147,5.8,'VAJB3wrr2ko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2992,_binary '\0','/6kN5rkADuRtVw7kLD08JyQHZ5OB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046672',7.2,39795,'en','20,000 Leagues Under the Sea','A ship sent to investigate a wave of mysterious sinkings encounters the advanced submarine, the Nautilus, commanded by Captain Nemo.','/heAEH85fdxEgV98LizHbQCL95iZ.jpg','1954-12-23',127,'Released','The mightiest motion picture of them all!','20,000 Leagues Under the Sea',173,7.0977,7.1,'BdHWQOhs1x4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2993,_binary '\0','/r8ordppo5kDyw6kUjYyl40mTSA2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046675',6.7,1555,'es','Abismos de pasión','In 19th-century Mexico, young orphan Alejandro is adopted by the wealthy, landowning Earnshaw family and moves into their estate, Wuthering Heights. Soon, the new resident falls for his compassionate foster sister, Catalina. The two share a remarkable bond that seems unbreakable until Catalina, feeling the pressure of social convention, suppresses her feelings and marries Eduardo, a man of means who befits her stature. Alejandro vows to win her back.','/u1u2bDkzfzRgbwdJ8njHXdCchC3.jpg','1954-06-30',91,'Released','Adaptation of Emily Bronte\'s classic novel.','Wuthering Heights',43328,1.6659,6.2,'wxsp3RsCn9Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2994,_binary '\0','/40CMrFZHnh4BP9obKSq8jQp4sOv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046695',6,1643,'fr','Ali Baba et les Quarante Voleurs','A lord’s servant, Ali Baba, is sent to retrieve a slave for his master, but ends up on an adventure filled with gold, mischief, love, and forty famous thieves instead.','/314RaBN4qVTQcmbu2kfKVLmdPfY.jpg','1954-12-21',92,'Released',NULL,'Ali Baba and the Forty Thieves',66540,2.2924,6.154,'FjV7xCQlJos','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2995,_binary '\0','/kZ7H3eRqscmG0n2rZEoDgFkuquS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046705',6.9,2195,'it','Un americano a Roma','Nando Moriconi is a young Italian living in Rome obsessed with all-things American.','/bFaNi1GmVMdXLFkKhdNKx3gc3kL.jpg','1954-12-10',85,'Released',NULL,'An American in Rome',43294,2.6548,7.111,'n91Bo3JQD8E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2996,_binary '\0','/eKLHQ9YOpeRwBcYXH2GGLOg7AdC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046712',7,1559,'ja','アナタハン','From June 1944, twelve Japanese seamen are stranded for seven years on an abandoned and forgotten island called Anatahan.','/v3Z42fH1vQKg91I9k2tRhgI5dfP.jpg','1953-06-28',91,'Released',NULL,'Anatahan',104776,2.068,6.83,'xzk9N_9rY54','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2997,_binary '\0','/8UjIVt7SBUG4Mz4MH8xErEVYzm8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046714',6.5,1538,'en','Angels One Five','The year is 1940 and Pilot Officer T.B. Baird arrives straight out of flight school to join a front line RAF squadron at the height of the Battle of Britain. After an unfortunate start and a drumming down from his commanding officer, Baird must balance the struggle to impress his Group Captain, regain his pride, fit in with his fellow pilots, and survive one of the most intense air battles in history.','/r1bBcmopZPDieHtBhuQcUkZ0TpJ.jpg','1952-03-19',98,'Released','A Story of Some of \"The Few\"...','Angels One Five',41312,1.6192,6.1,'d674Vrq3tJo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2998,_binary '\0','/u6JfwUGjZsOgK0tqVYKxZLTHstJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046719',6.3,5569,'en','Apache','Following the surrender of Geronimo, Massai, the last Apache warrior is captured and scheduled for transportation to a Florida reservation. On the way he manages to escape and heads for his homeland to win back his girl and settle down to grow crops. His pursuers have other ideas though.','/5Q05vmMNL2syEciyUqOmlEq3JC2.jpg','1954-07-09',87,'Released','Unconquerable!','Apache',43329,2.5069,6.035,'XiXvdGw2MNU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(2999,_binary '\0','/xsl9Gtnyqs2Z19LgyNVBqvInXsO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046750',7.4,1331,'ja','晩菊','What is the life of a Geisha like once her beauty has faded and she has retired? Kin has saved, and become a wealthy money-lender, spending her days coldly collecting debts. Even her best friends, fellow Geisha Tomi, Nobu, and Tamae, are now indebted to her. For all of them, the glamour of their young lives has passed; Tomi and Tamae have disappointing children. Kin has two former lovers who still pursue her; one she wants to see, and the other she doesn\'t. But even the one she remembers fondly, when he shows up, proves less than satisfactory.','/e3cwwGKhwPcmsdLV8Kktu7BCk7v.jpg','1954-06-15',101,'Released',NULL,'Late Chrysanthemums',36871,1.5335,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3000,_binary '\0','/2yK59yDiP4P5hsENbGYSPc3YA5I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046754',6.9,14665,'en','The Barefoot Contessa','A washed-up filmmaker gets a second chance at stardom when he discovers stunning peasant Maria Vargas dancing in a Madrid nightclub. Goaded by his producer, the director convinces Maria to screen test for, and then star in, his next big picture. But as the producer\'s possessive nature and the realities of stardom weigh on Maria, she seeks a genuine lover with whom she can escape.','/dn0zbrO4gW4isuBSpwWUgOBF8cR.jpg','1954-09-29',128,'Released','The world\'s most beautiful animal!','The Barefoot Contessa',34689,3.6558,6.75,'GPqq6UZy4B8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3001,_binary '\0','/hyNOrKiTaRfhLcw6zT0IZhaL7Hf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046757',5.6,1323,'en','Beachhead','On a Japanese-occupied island during World War II, only two soldiers remain alive after a mission attempt goes horribly wrong. Trapped on the island, they must escort a scientist and his daughter to the other side of the island where their ship awaits. They must battle nature, hard terrain, and advancing Japanese troops.','/rG2E8gcWzHCBLNvxdwZXfgLLPT2.jpg','1954-02-05',90,'Released','Is not just a war move.','Beachhead',62753,1.8554,5.8,'cAXyPnk66UU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3002,_binary '\0','/ohoem1Je75AWfBj1wfFLbnoPOKp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046759',6.4,2000,'en','Beau Brummell','Captain George Bryan Brummell is a British soldier who appreciates fine clothing and innovative dress. Although he initially alienates the Prince of Wales with insulting comments about the prince\'s uniform designs, he eventually becomes his close confidant. Brummel also falls in love with the beautiful Lady Patricia Belham. However, his outspoken manner eventually leads to his being exiled to France.','/5fPDFzIiJQ1YKMKcgGA9agUuQ9t.jpg','1954-11-16',113,'Released','Soldier, poet, adventurer, rogue, gambler, lover !','Beau Brummell',43331,2.4339,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3003,_binary '\0','/4AgksenI4v7RMB27HX8PZ9LfZ4c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046766',6.7,3193,'en','The Belles of St Trinian\'s','The unruly schoolgirls of St Trinian\'s are more interested in men and mischief than homework and hockey. But greater trouble than ever beckons when the arrival at the school of Princess Fatima of Makyad coincides with the return of recently expelled Arabella Fritton, who has the kidnap of a prize racehorse on her mind.','/fKqPAMTJA7df8bHiPPbpV7RzEl8.jpg','1954-09-28',91,'Released','Would you send your daughter to St. Trinian\'s?','The Belles of St Trinian\'s',11402,2.5205,6.4,'VKzCKoO-K9I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3004,_binary '\0','/2xOIzSf69RLGgCx0vWvLWKEO6eX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046770',6.1,1535,'en','Betrayed','When the Dutch resistance brings in Carla Van Oven to spy on the Nazis, Col. Pieter Deventer initially suspects she could be a double agent. Van Oven eventually convinces Deventer of her character, and when she is sent into occupied territory, she joins up with a rebel leader known as \"The Scarf\". As the resistance endures severe losses and their missions fail, Deventer starts to wonder whose side Van Oven is fighting on.','/37BAn5IK9SYjVE2S2JABpMXHtTX.jpg','1954-09-07',108,'Released','M-G-M filmed the mystery of the year in Holland!','Betrayed',83665,2.4118,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3005,_binary '\0','/5co9je5tIO6k55ThCTJqn35WDia.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046789',6.4,2298,'en','The Black Shield of Falworth','In the days of King Henry IV, stalwart young Myles and his sister Meg have been raised as peasants, without any knowledge of who their father really was. But one day, they journey to Macworth Castle. There, Myles falls in love with Lady Anne Macworth, makes friends and enemies, and learns to be a knight.','/8gXIl5Ql8VGv5Hmm3LM5y5d1AD0.jpg','1954-09-02',99,'Released','A timeless story of Love, Honor and Glory.','The Black Shield of Falworth',24442,3.0463,6.366,'xOC_aa8f0yo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3006,_binary '\0','/zARyz0HH0KXnptMtK1EcOysdiHX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046790',6.8,1587,'en','Black Tuesday','Vicious gangster Vincent Canelli pulls off a daring prison escape just moments before going to the electric chair, taking with him Peter Manning – a bank robber and cop killer who was to die right after him. Taking several hostages along, they try to get their hands on the loot from Manning’s robbery to finance their escape from the country.','/q1TopGrmEohQZIH1USRkAYKGsK2.jpg','1954-12-31',80,'Released','The most ruthless Robinson of all time!','Black Tuesday',33224,1.5605,6.2,'tCRJ_W56jsI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3007,_binary '\0','/kWg5zRFTXRt531DD8ZlP0gQkI0T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046791',6.7,3824,'en','Black Widow','When a young stage hopeful is found dead, suspicion falls on her mentor, a successful Broadway producer.','/6u1ynJxGhqhKpFMvDmPk1OWQ5FW.jpg','1954-10-28',95,'Released','Someone will kill this girl tonight!','Black Widow',44052,2.4514,6.4,'STaRvoUJnig','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3008,_binary '\0','/b4rDM52ihCFtTrYBOpP0aEEZY3h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046792',6.2,1220,'en','Murder by Proxy','When a beautiful young woman suddenly offers inebriated Casey Morrow a lot of money for a quick and easy job, he doesn\'t ask too many questions. But when the girl\'s father is found murdered the following day and Morrow\'s coat is soaked with blood, he must unravel the mystery to clear his name.','/7nQmi9JbPGrGxuPtcITZGz75z2L.jpg','1954-03-19',87,'Released','EXPLODES...in a sinister network of evil!','Blackout',38962,1.3456,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3009,_binary '\0','/u43Zvz1ICdYfvQDqzzVsFMLLbCz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046801',6.6,1676,'en','The Bounty Hunter','A year after a violent train robbery, the Pinkerton detective agency hires a bounty hunter to find the three remaining killers. He tracks them to Twin Forks but has no clue to their identity. Tensions surface as just his presence in town acts as a catalyst.','/67xGDWNRuzevbmMQP1lFYhnExdK.jpg','1954-09-25',79,'Released','When the law put up the money The Bounty Hunter put on his guns!','The Bounty Hunter',139308,2.4349,6.7,'_baOkgF7tTU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3010,_binary '\0','/ro4tbCyKJtfyWtz3ocPzbNmJCQU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046806',6.7,7052,'en','The Bridges at Toko-Ri','A U.S. Navy pilot and his squad are assigned to bomb a group of heavily defended bridges deep behind enemy lines during the Korean War.','/xAXMYP4SNKoV698ccC77vtJ9kLz.jpg','1954-12-01',102,'Released','Jets Dare Danger Over Korea!','The Bridges at Toko-Ri',35580,3.387,5.973,'uZ1f0OA752w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3011,_binary '\0','/eGzQPFy6VTR3r72mTOIOXoQYuHc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046807',6.8,10164,'en','Brigadoon','Americans Jeff and Tommy, hunting in Scotland, stumble upon a village - Brigadoon. They soon learn that the town appears once every 100 years in order to preserve its peace and special beauty. The citizens go to bed at night and when they wake up, it\'s 100 years later. Tommy falls in love with a beautiful young woman, Fiona, and is torn between staying or going back to his hectic life in New York.','/va3DcpyZDnnWdRB0FTPKzObo3Uz.jpg','1954-09-08',108,'Released','The great Broadway stage musical hit is on the screen!','Brigadoon',18283,2.5786,6.537,'8QMXGQeTiJ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3012,_binary '\0','/nh2NeGSz6u7uXjtoQWl8RCdM4bi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046808',6.9,4841,'en','Broken Lance','Tensions erupt within an Arizona cattle baron\'s household when his three sons vie for control of the ranch.','/qOf7yWjTAhUE72u3PV6ij4Wy9lJ.jpg','1954-09-25',96,'Released','Fury of the West\'s Most Lawless Feud!','Broken Lance',42328,2.8582,6.511,'dN_z0v8Zfmo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3013,_binary '\0','/xSN7sVwIC6ExQZVMIUMjm4Tl2TN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046816',7.6,31338,'en','The Caine Mutiny','When a US Naval captain shows signs of mental instability that jeopardize his ship, the first officer relieves him of command and faces court martial for mutiny.','/vuO4Z3wOWVlhq35MS9asZeT9rVp.jpg','1954-06-24',124,'Released','As big as the ocean!','The Caine Mutiny',10178,4.5394,7.2,'3OcS-Y6gL1I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3014,_binary '\0','/nhbeAwC5NcvPIOVDkamICjdKIFN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046828',6.7,6477,'en','Carmen Jones','In this musical set in an all-Black army camp, civilian parachute maker and \"hot bundle\" Carmen Jones is desired by many of the men. Naturally, she wants Joe, who\'s engaged to sweet Cindy Lou and about to go into pilot training for the Korean War.','/5Vo4NeE7dlXBUaikbGnUOmUNHJ3.jpg','1954-10-28',105,'Released','Something Really New! Something Truly Different!','Carmen Jones',51044,3.2151,6.204,'sohT0HTgP84','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3015,_binary '\0','/bME35dyWq3m7dwFo24dtgftAPjB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046839',5.7,1223,'en','Cattle Queen of Montana','Sierra Nevada Jones must fight a villainous rancher to regain the land that is rightfully hers.','/xErxYP5A1zvJDf3iMwChrRGCV5F.jpg','1954-11-18',88,'Released','She strips off her petticoats . . . and straps on her guns !','Cattle Queen of Montana',121703,2.6732,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3016,_binary '\0','/aiEMx1ND6Gq5uFYWRHektj5CrSs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046851',8,5514,'ja','近松物語','When the wife of a 17th-century Kyoto scrollmaker is falsely accused of having an affair with his best employee, the pair flee the city and find themselves truly falling for one another.','/3FTzr49lQKouUEutQRX5bqMCO4C.jpg','1954-11-23',102,'Released','The tortured heart behind the cultivated image.','Chikamatsu Monogatari',35861,2.2645,7.8,'qomQiXaBtA0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3017,_binary '\0','/ssPh7tZwDtSurPf8rFPINIWkNvd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046874',7.2,7444,'en','The Country Girl','An actor on the skids is given one more chance to regain his stardom, as well as his self-respect, yet his alcoholism may prevent that from happening.','/7LdXybdZcTdZo7lkkrFQKf7byZf.jpg','1954-12-15',104,'Released',NULL,'The Country Girl',2438,2.9575,7.036,'DtwNCEL05C4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3018,_binary '\0','/31P56eY3GQOA0wTwiW0gzkJyhSG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046876',6.9,38865,'en','Creature from the Black Lagoon','When scientists exploring the Amazon River stumble on a “missing link” connecting humans and fish, they plan to capture it for later study. But the Creature has plans of his own, and has set his sights on the lead scientist\'s beautiful fiancée, Kay.','/euCzA2Exc70MpTDCVYih8tdE7z1.jpg','1954-03-05',79,'Released','From the Amazon\'s forbidden depths came the Creature from the Black Lagoon.','Creature from the Black Lagoon',10973,5.4481,6.8,'Jd1QPUL_EWo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3019,_binary '\0','/jdSaSvtX8DBPXG5Z59Wo1tVqVUu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046878',7.3,5457,'en','Crime Wave','Reformed parolee Steve Lacey is caught in the middle when a wounded former cellmate seeks him out for shelter. The other two former cellmates then attempt to force him into doing a bank job.','/6eQiEo6fxb5SdJ3PolsTHv75gL2.jpg','1953-10-22',73,'Released','Before your shocked eyes -- the city blasted SIN-SIDE OUT!','Crime Wave',19618,2.298,7.103,'48113otVhiI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3020,_binary '\0','/rxc8kls2ErqlySL7XjJjhHeMaPt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046889',7.4,12408,'en','The Dam Busters','The story of the conception of a new British weapon for smashing the German dams in the Ruhr industrial complex and the execution of the raid by 617 Squadron \'The Dam Busters\'.','/bZKmBxzy5O5PjguhfMYgSaUxUmi.jpg','1955-05-16',124,'Released',NULL,'The Dam Busters',13210,3.0104,6.9,'xKQHVdgCeXo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3021,_binary '\0','/hwn8LGEDp6yVVDJhLEiz07h4anS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046899',6.6,4667,'en','Demetrius and the Gladiators','The story picks up at the point where \"The Robe\" ends, following the martyrdom of Diana and Marcellus. Christ\'s robe is conveyed to Peter for safe-keeping, but the emperor Caligula wants it back to benefit from its powers. Marcellus\' former slave Demetrius seeks to prevent this, and catches the eye of Messalina, wife to Caligula\'s uncle Claudius. Messalina tempts Demetrius, he winds up fighting in the arena, and wavers in his faith.','/qZHr0738TLaQWC9CXCQGpw85XUR.jpg','1954-06-16',101,'Released','It begins where \"The Robe\" left off!','Demetrius and the Gladiators',43332,3.238,6.568,'DzwJZmd6FpM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3022,_binary '\0','/chQ1wU7ZDHrdtN9vjvrxlUXsDfk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046903',6.3,4025,'en','Désirée','In Marseilles, France in 1794, Desiree Clary, a young millinery clerk, becomes infatuated with Napoleon Bonaparte, but winds up wedding General Jean-Baptiste Berandotte, an aid to Napoleon who later joins the forces that bring about the Emperor\'s downfall. Josephine Beauharnais, a worldly courtesan marries Napoleon and becomes Empress of France, but is then cast aside by her spouse when she proves unable to produce an heir to the throne.','/mvTDhI11hpiWJDRKAheoWtBknTf.jpg','1954-11-16',110,'Released','The life...the women...the conquests of Napoleon!','Désirée',43333,2.7204,6.6,'xS3IZ670r0A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3023,_binary '\0','/1CZ45ULErNaN0JPwdl3xOXCMv0F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046906',6.6,1860,'en','Destry','Western remake of \"Destry Rides Again\", starring Audie Murphy, Mari Blanchard, Thomas Mitchell, Lori Nelson and Lyle Bettger.','/3g7ogx6Uj5gsvhYyFKPXxRSV0Jt.jpg','1954-12-01',95,'Released','From the roaring , raucous, rowdy pages of the best-loved legend of the West!','Destry',94176,2.5197,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3024,_binary '\0','/aNA1B8U4XhBtoLIlW2UcF7hQFC1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046907',5,2644,'en','Devil Girl from Mars','Eight people at a remote Scottish inn find themselves confronted by a woman from Mars, who has landed her flying saucer for repairs but intends to soon conquer the Earth and enslave its men for breeding purposes.','/kgQh1yJdQ3ESgwNzTAVNIw3FzMZ.jpg','1954-05-01',77,'Released','Invasion from Outer Space!...Sights too weird to imagine! Destruction too monstrous to escape!','Devil Girl from Mars',24212,1.815,5.2,'hOBn-g5VTfM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3025,_binary '\0','/rcEUuRtr0dFL078bNeXL8pQqrMK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046911',8.1,73896,'fr','Les Diaboliques','The cruel and abusive headmaster of a boarding school, Michel Delassalle, is murdered by an unlikely duo -- his meek wife and the mistress he brazenly flaunts. The women become increasingly unhinged by a series of odd occurrences after Delassalle\'s corpse mysteriously disappears.','/jE8ygUYBUGyUcM4sR6iinPqYeDK.jpg','1955-01-29',118,'Released','See it, be amazed at it, but...BE QUIET ABOUT IT!','Diabolique',827,5.9119,7.9,'BzbGtjtfZwA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3026,_binary '\0','/mD6EAjfIr7CLdFlCIJjh7CJeWX3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046912',8.1,207055,'en','Dial M for Murder','When her American lover visits London, a wealthy woman’s jealous husband hatches a plan to murder her and inherit her fortune.','/2gDCAgl2iBQNuJuk6p2xtuS1ewg.jpg','1954-05-29',105,'Released','Is this the man she was waiting for... or the man who was waiting for her?','Dial M for Murder',521,9.1739,8,'_rLa7HIkkQc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3027,_binary '\0','/4IbJ4rXoURhMaSh02z9yfg4hJqD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046921',6.5,1805,'en','Doctor in the House','The first of the seven \"Doctor\" films, based on Richard Gordon\'s novels and released between 1954 and 1970. Simon Sparrow is a newly arrived medical student at St Swithin\'s hospital in London. Falling in with three longer-serving hopefuls he is soon immersed in the wooing, imbibing and fast sports-car driving that constitute 1950s medical training. There is, however, always the looming and formidable figure of chief surgeon Sir Lancelot Spratt to remind them of their real purpose.','/iGRDD9B0FgaWLgsjSZIHcA3ZF3N.jpg','1954-03-23',92,'Released','Happy-Go-Laughable Hit!','Doctor in the House',68242,1.8354,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3028,_binary '\0','/6K0U3qcbk2IFYaK6klcAq2G1xO1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046928',6.6,1848,'en','Down Three Dark Streets','An FBI Agent takes on the three unrelated cases of a dead agent to track down his killer.','/x2JMsqltTw25UbEcdFk8QGCYrP6.jpg','1954-09-03',85,'Released','Down This Street Raced Dead-End Violence... Down This One Stretched Excitement Taut As Silk!','Down Three Dark Streets',37413,2.2912,5.8,'yvm3gS9X5vI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3029,_binary '\0','/2btToMyS7GrRfS8nluwo7HFIR8q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046931',6.6,1252,'en','Dragnet','Two homicide detectives try to find just the facts behind a mobster\'s brutal murder.','/nvzFBDVtthFaZVoB23dSgWf3sZN.jpg','1954-09-04',89,'Released','This was the hottest case to hit the department!','Dragnet',43334,1.4232,6.1,'6et9FHzMAr0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3030,_binary '\0','/sLeFt0ndJCPSoq9QsPWvOG3je0z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046935',6.9,2314,'en','Drive a Crooked Road','A mechanic gets caught up with the mob when he falls for a gangster\'s girlfriend.','/pdwuPI6KdFFyy2cl22ESucnRmFq.jpg','1954-03-10',83,'Released','Why would a dame like her go for a guy like me?','Drive a Crooked Road',34652,1.8822,6.2,'DznnODI71jI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3031,_binary '\0','/ceAHaGuLqnaqxdTAekBGSumq2O9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046936',6.3,1303,'en','Drum Beat','President Grant orders Indian fighter MacKay to negotiate with the Modocs of northern California and southern Oregon. On the way he must escort Nancy Meek to the home of her aunt and uncle. After Modoc renegade Captain Jack engages in ambush and other atrocities, MacKay must fight him one-on-one with guns, knives and fists.','/dX1EzLF8eb4kqI1MkcfWOkiE6A4.jpg','1954-11-10',111,'Released','Only the fierce Modocs knew the terrible meaning of each beat of the Drum !','Drum Beat',150875,2.6538,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3032,_binary '\0','/hILOWCPN7I2XeK3FpKCEoF1ukb1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046937',6.2,1268,'en','Drums Across the River','All the gold in a small Colorado town has been panned, save for a bit on land belonging to the Ute. Greedy Frank Walker rounds up the locals and makes plans to raid the territory, but even-tempered settler Sam Brannon tries to dissuade Walker. As the battle nears, Sam\'s conflicted son, Gary, is torn between his belief in his father\'s morality and his hatred of the Utes, who killed his mother.','/eD1VTyENoknVvV02GqFnmfUilGU.jpg','1954-06-01',78,'Released','A wilderness of danger! An empire of savage hate!','Drums Across the River',107427,2.3799,5.75,'ukkz21PzyIA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3033,_binary '\0','/4ifPpmTPKep4Q9CA2uFILpNrynM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046949',6.5,5005,'en','The Egyptian','In eighteenth-dynasty Egypt, Sinuhe, a poor orphan, becomes a brilliant physician and with his friend Horemheb is appointed to the service of the new Pharoah. Sinuhe\'s personal triumphs and tragedies are played against the larger canvas of the turbulent events of the 18th dynasty. As Sinuhe is drawn into court intrigues he learns the answers to the questions he has sought since his birth.','/vYLY2YIGCWINPSzLg6tBiN6ub7X.jpg','1954-08-25',139,'Released','To Nefer, shameless temptress of Babylon, he surrendered his parents\' hope of immortality!','The Egyptian',24973,4.4923,6.487,'iQ05t5ckBVk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3034,_binary '\0','/whWNvbUssPFsVuZzUCsLQf5E6EP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046951',6.3,3098,'en','Elephant Walk','Colonial tea planter John Wiley, visiting England at the end of World War II, weds lovely English rose Ruth and takes her home to Elephant Walk, Ceylon, where the local elephants have a grudge against the plantation. Ruth\'s delight with the tropical wealth and luxury of her new home is tempered by isolation as the only white woman in the district; her husband\'s occasional imperious arrogance; a mutual physical attraction with plantation manager Dick Carver; and the hovering, ominous menace of the hostile elephants.','/82DMbgX6Mo9eT2oGpbZCHC3wDfh.jpg','1954-04-21',103,'Released','One man claimed the land. Two men claimed the woman who lived there.','Elephant Walk',43335,2.5704,5.9,'zUZKii_MM4c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3035,_binary '\0','/uDe7FgcFPhJJFcXUiRfLAGPSKh5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046963',7.4,5320,'en','Executive Suite','When the head of a large manufacturing firm dies suddenly from a stroke, his vice-presidents vie to see who will replace him.','/dQ5LdPOkRwlTTl3ocObuNGKB1of.jpg','1954-04-30',104,'Released','Behind the lighted tower windows the conflict of love and power is reckless and daring!','Executive Suite',43336,2.7656,7.039,'4YlNEDus69U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3036,_binary '\0','/8asUJMTcr1KEfbGtpZhESI0I7X6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046969',5.4,1846,'en','The Fast and the Furious','A framed man escapes prison and takes a wealthy woman\'s Jaguar with her in it. After she tries to escape numerous times, they begin to develop feelings for each other, and enter a road race that ends in Mexico.','/731NMB4a85McIYcftPtbH4D3l5x.jpg','1954-11-01',76,'Released','High speed Excitement...As a Wanted Man...Meets a Wanting Woman','The Fast and the Furious',20174,2.1513,5.3,'t3vEkE_8S3w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3037,_binary '\0','/hiRR61Evb2yMCmaI2XrWBppYVPe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046970',6.7,2053,'en','Father Brown','Works of art are disappearing, stolen by a master thief, a master of disguise. Father Brown has two goals: to catch the thief and to save his soul.','/xDamZSvZMEbVUj1RNdfjRoETBsr.jpg','1954-06-08',91,'Released','An open and shut case of Guinness! Up to his EARS in chaos... Up to his NECK in laughs','Father Brown',89160,1.5115,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3038,_binary '\0','/uQJO0dR7wtls6Og8tNV8uqOyd7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046977',2.6,2213,'en','Fire Maidens of Outer Space','An astronaut and crew land on Jupiter\'s 13th moon and find a monster and women from Atlantis.','/w8Wo5URjEVIzVmXR2qwEWuSkAOl.jpg','1956-07-01',80,'Released','SEE - the CREATURE OF HORROR who RAVISHED A PLANET!','Fire Maidens of Outer Space',31280,1.8589,2.8,'-L90TQwIRS0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3039,_binary '\0','/12I4h4SBMRZUf1IAs3Sj21d2tKN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0046998',7.3,4897,'fr','French Cancan','Nineteenth-century Paris comes vibrantly alive in Jean Renoir’s exhilarating tale of the opening of the world-renowned Moulin Rouge. Jean Gabin plays the wily impresario Danglard, who makes the cancan all the rage while juggling the love of two beautiful women—an Egyptian belly-dancer and a naive working girl turned cancan star.','/slIF5i3Mz03I90sqoxj7Xteutyb.jpg','1955-04-09',102,'Released',NULL,'French Cancan',45213,1.9442,7.185,'qQ3UvYy872g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3040,_binary '\0','/yebl9GiE74zVceoxsaWI10aFYlK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047013',6.6,4425,'en','Garden of Evil','A trio of American adventurers marooned in rural Mexico are recruited by a beautiful woman to rescue her husband from Apaches.','/jJOGIC8vBKIw7jcV060KFUOwgys.jpg','1954-07-09',100,'Released','Takes you beyond the land of the Black Sand!','Garden of Evil',36191,3.167,6.309,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3041,_binary '\0','/weRJkZn65fHWFVhF4BLadU2TXkB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047030',7.3,10648,'en','The Glenn Miller Story','A vibrant tribute to one of America\'s legendary bandleaders, charting Glenn Miller\'s rise from obscurity and poverty to fame and wealth in the early 1940s.','/eEuwIMj7jKYaUt0ZG6aVpYxlkrC.jpg','1954-01-04',116,'Released','Their Love Made Such Wonderful Music!','The Glenn Miller Story',17729,3.5605,7.021,'Tn-WKsv_oDM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3042,_binary '\0','/m5JBb6Hix2BU70JojwCChzfExtV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047033',5.4,1880,'en','Gog','A mechanical brain is programmed to sabotage the government\'s secret lab while working on the first space station.','/9CUqQa7Ho5ZB3kuS490nxFOSjUb.jpg','1954-06-04',85,'Released','... and then, without warning, the machine became a frankenstein of steel!','Gog',63333,1.5867,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3043,_binary '\0','/ub1sIbdSrokPZawY2ljExXZov2j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047034',7.6,46287,'ja','ゴジラ','Japan is thrown into a panic after several ships are sunk near Odo Island. An expedition to the island led by Dr. Kyohei Yamane soon discover something far more devastating than imagined in the form of a 50 meter tall monster whom the natives call Gojira. Now the monster begins a rampage that threatens to destroy not only Japan, but the rest of the world as well.','/2W0Yw0qrgVMgdsSCZRKtfvaAh0i.jpg','1954-11-03',96,'Released','Godzilla, a weapon of science, a great battle of wonder and terror!','Godzilla',1678,5.6942,7.6,'IVONRrcn9TI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3044,_binary '\0','/f90EjvaasXq1fH3UhyKC2AuiIHw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047040',6.7,1836,'en','The Good Die Young','An amoral, psychotic playboy incites three men who are down on their luck to commit a mail van robbery, which goes badly wrong.','/3kR9IJpuIzhyvdHxmHzcdmYeFJQ.jpg','1954-03-02',100,'Released','Two deadly weapons. Burning lips! ... Hot lead! ...','The Good Die Young',47312,1.8754,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3045,_binary '\0','/qoXL7Ww7uUyXFn1NyU9CTTKXaYA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047050',5.9,1734,'en','Green Fire','In Colombia, mining engineer Rian Mitchell discovers Carrero, the lost emerald mine of the Conquistadors, but has to contend with notorious local bandit El Moro\'s gang and with coffee planter Catherine Knowland\'s love.','/cCy1vu48Hf1ICNdNxai2qcHW2fR.jpg','1954-12-29',100,'Released','Lovely GRACE KELLY in a new kind of man-danger!','Green Fire',80241,1.653,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3046,_binary '\0','/rmItKpbB2BkSBA0kWPex7PCUFIy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047073',6.1,2604,'en','Hell and High Water','A privately-financed scientist and his colleagues hire an ex-Navy officer to conduct an Alaskan submarine expedition in order to prevent a Red Chinese anti-American plot that may lead to World War III. Mixes deviously plotted schoolboy fiction with submarine spectacle and cold war heroics.','/umpMY57hbbBxHfg5tjNuZeTCAA2.jpg','1954-02-01',103,'Released','29 men and one woman ... in the captive world of a submarine !','Hell and High Water',23097,3.151,6,'Zfy2Aw70o1A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3047,_binary '\0','/ww7Ttoe3EqWEC6iQ3SrtZnlwPgD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047085',6.9,1656,'en','The \'Maggie\'','The poor, elderly—and the wily, when it comes to parting those who can afford it from their money—Scottish skipper of a broken-down old \'puffer\' boat tricks an American tycoon into paying him to transport his personal cargo. When the tycoon learns of the trick, he attempts to track down the boat and remove his possessions.','/dNOaqMf1k2mvLHvCIpCAi7W78wf.jpg','1954-02-25',92,'Released',NULL,'The \'Maggie\'',48954,1.3778,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3048,_binary '\0','/xgzMiezZQ3NEVXxlb2nlBTPKYg4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047086',6.6,7253,'en','The High and the Mighty','Dan Roman is a veteran pilot haunted by a tragic past. Now relegated to second-in-command cockpit assignments he finds himself on a routine Honolulu-to-San Francisco flight that takes a terrifying turn when disaster strikes high above the Pacific Ocean after the point of no return.','/il7ZUf1ys5ElbafW2VAEnX5NWD7.jpg','1954-07-03',147,'Released','The 2-Year Best-Seller Sensation! The Year\'s Greatest Cast!','The High and the Mighty',17761,3.8024,5.9,'64BarFD6Mso','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3049,_binary '\0','/1GeeKCUu77eBU1ut8hTBQRmb7Iq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047094',7.7,10244,'en','Hobson\'s Choice','A widower refuses to let his three daughters marry in order to avoid paying settlements, so they\'ll just have to outsmart him.','/kbP7EgoiOw2bIypai50JWRsqP7p.jpg','1954-04-19',108,'Released','A Masterpiece of Lusty, Gusty, Rowdy Entertainment','Hobson\'s Choice',16410,2.526,7.372,'urEsrgcHzCQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3050,_binary '\0','/yqfeWVhhqrI8w3wACVGEeudeQv9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047101',7.1,7421,'en','Human Desire','A Korean War vet returns to his job as a railroad engineer and becomes involved in a sordid affair with a co-worker\'s wife following a murder on a train.','/jENxUySE0H3XUUIP1mitESyhjEK.jpg','1954-08-05',91,'Released','A rarity on the screen … a RAW slice of life!','Human Desire',21564,2.1194,6.74,'EUaDKWDTHok','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3051,_binary '\0','/uhcUsxP21KwvT84RyJzynMRWQ6I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047119',7.5,6156,'en','An Inspector Calls','An upper-crust family dinner is interrupted by a police inspector who brings news that a girl known to everyone present has died in suspicious circumstances. It seems that any or all of them could have had a hand in her death. But who is the mysterious Inspector and what can he want of them?','/j637ICfPZPVnhoGPlRw9xVf6IqL.jpg','1954-03-16',80,'Released','Is he real... or the creature of conscience?','An Inspector Calls',18174,1.783,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3052,_binary '\0','/5tEI9qnusNGIrgrxuGtc8fH34hT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047123',7.2,5265,'en','It Should Happen to You','Gladys Glover has just lost her modeling job when she meets filmmaker Pete Sheppard shooting a documentary in Central Park. For Pete it\'s love at first sight, but Gladys has her mind on other things, making a name for herself. Through a fluke of advertising she winds up with her name plastered over 10 billboards throughout city.','/rj4hPdJmoRivGhApCEidPFtxVku.jpg','1954-01-15',86,'Released','That \"Born Yesterday\" Bombshell Explodes Again!','It Should Happen to You',20127,3.0666,7.123,'oCJ0fJX1i8Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3053,_binary '\0','/nYTLewoAsZ2y3BNwwT9lLX8mEJT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047127',3.8,3037,'en','Jail Bait','Don Gregor, the son of famous plastic surgeon Dr. Boris Gregor, begins to hang around with young criminal Vic Brady and carry a gun. The pair attempt an armed holdup, and when things start to go wrong Gregor accidentally kills a night watchman. Fearing that Gregor plans to turn himself in, Brady kills him and blackmails Dr. Gregor into giving him a new face.','/av2ppBDn3Z9BSBByao9WEv8XWXA.jpg','1954-05-12',74,'Released','Danger! These girls are hot!','Jail Bait',23020,1.1179,3.8,'BxNtVrsdIUo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3054,_binary '\0','/yiglnLtYEH6UGY1qFy4zacixCXf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047136',7.6,21839,'en','Johnny Guitar','On the outskirts of town, the hard-nosed Vienna owns a saloon frequented by the undesirables of the region, including Dancin\' Kid and his gang. Another patron of Vienna\'s establishment is Johnny Guitar, a former gunslinger and her lover. When a heist is pulled in town that results in a man\'s death, Emma Small, Vienna\'s rival, rallies the townsfolk to take revenge on Vienna\'s saloon – even without proof of her wrongdoing.','/bap37yOCwcR9x4YDsNUaSo9nIp9.jpg','1954-05-26',110,'Released','Gun-Queen of the Arizona Frontier! And her kind of men!','Johnny Guitar',26596,3.2155,7.4,'ACgSyxdV9vE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3055,_binary '\0','/6vgwY2uMmvgNJiWN20NviRic7Wt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047149',3.6,2851,'en','Killers from Space','Atomic scientist/pilot Doug Martin is missing after his plane crashes on an reconnaissance mission after a nuclear test. Miraculously appearing unhurt at the base later, he is given sodium amethol, but authorities are skeptical of his story that he was captured by aliens determined to conquer the Earth with giant monsters and insects. Martin vows to use existing technology to destroy them.','/ajQgkwtcVvjqBcDq31qwbn8svyT.jpg','1954-01-23',71,'Released','The last word in science-fiction thrills!','Killers from Space',23045,1.412,3.8,'0n3535NXOpQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3056,_binary '\0','/zeIbItfG8cPFNawVc94yETafi9i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047152',6.7,1297,'en','Knock on Wood','Ventriloquist Jerry Morgan has failed with another love affair. The reason: when the relationship reaches the point when it is time to discuss marriage, his two dolls become mean and jealous. Morgan\'s dollmaker Papinek is a member of a spy ring who has stolen the secret plans for the top-secret Lafayette airplane. Since Morgan is leaving for Zurich the same night, he decides to hide the secret plan in the heads of the dolls.','/mSoZzEcqJl0g3kLGPH4rvvHWiaM.jpg','1954-04-06',103,'Released','The No. 1 Song-and-Dance Clown at his best!','Knock on Wood',55859,1.4655,6.7,'r5JeWJP2-dM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3057,_binary '\0','/5f5Qh9tpxIaQK9EkHzZ4oYZmy4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047162',6.1,4855,'en','The Last Time I Saw Paris','Reporter Charles Wills, in Paris to cover the end of World War II, falls for the beautiful Helen Ellswirth following a brief flirtation with her sister, Marion. After he and Helen marry, Charles pursues his novelistic ambition while supporting his new bride with a deadening job at a newspaper wire service. But when an old investment suddenly makes the family wealthy, their marriage begins to unravel — until a sudden tragedy changes everything.','/yARMwDXPi5fjcDkWuBApfXQhb2s.jpg','1954-11-18',116,'Released','The sensational story of youth on a fling','The Last Time I Saw Paris',57575,3.0895,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3058,_binary '\0','/u8C3cbk6UgDNp0sZN4DROp8kQXy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047167',7,4155,'sv','En lektion i kärlek','After fifteen years of marriage and mutual infidelity, a couple on the brink of divorce unexpectedly confront their unresolved love during a journey to Copenhagen. Blending farce with emotional reflection, the film is Ingmar Bergman’s first sustained venture into marital comedy.','/y2033AA89qdxgJMASAfmuZ17GoA.jpg','1954-10-04',97,'Released',NULL,'A Lesson in Love',64782,2.014,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3059,_binary '\0','/29hzPH1QSlRz3IFc9FOmQAypeqd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047178',5.8,1236,'en','A Life at Stake','An out-of-work architect meets a married woman who has a business proposition for him. The architect begins to suspect the woman\'s interest in him is not just financial and may actually be deadly.','/jSL2BOdH3u4NrGJXTfzZBG8qvfI.jpg','1955-03-01',78,'Released','A Cheat At Heart From Her Painted Toes To Her Plunging Neckline!','A Life at Stake',72242,1.9432,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3060,_binary '\0','/1A7xSWUoB0jSv7tzRmM86C3qjzT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047184',6.5,1906,'en','Living It Up','Homer Flagg is a railroad worker in the small New Mexico town of Desert Hole. One day, he finds an abandoned automobile at an old atomic proving ground. His doctor and best friend, Steve Harris, diagnoses him with radiation poisoning and gives Homer three weeks to live. A big city reporter hears of Homer\'s plight and convinces her editor to provide an all-expenses paid trip to New York.','/y4rc8vwJs0DHbhw9oN4coaHKTzx.jpg','1954-08-04',94,'Released','THEY\'RE LAFFIN\' IT UP!','Living It Up',39016,2.6243,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3061,_binary '\0','/w2TpqOKQrqqfBvjXBld4SAJdyHY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047191',7,6267,'en','The Long, Long Trailer','A newly wed couple, Tacy and Nicky, travel in a trailer for their honeymoon. The journey is a humorous one that could end up destroying their marriage.','/aOFWMCpKqRYMqG8ROtk09SzkmV6.jpg','1954-02-19',96,'Released','America\'s No. 1 Favorites—Funnier than Ever on the Screen!','The Long, Long Trailer',24518,2.8097,7,'-Qbm-T_OSa4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3062,_binary '\0','/y7DdDGrCZ0fxFgwlc1Er7DcDj5c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047200',6.5,2717,'en','The Mad Magician','Don Gallico is an inventor of stage magic effects who aspires to become a star in his own right. Just before his first performance his act is shut down by capricious manager Ross Ormond who wants Gallico\'s brilliant buzz saw effect for the act of The Great Rinaldi, an established star. With this defeat, and the humiliation of having already lost his wife Claire to Ormond, Gallico decides it is time to take matters into his own hands.','/ctYNCvKiMN3yRHAXe6q2l6anMRk.jpg','1954-05-19',72,'Released','3D THRILL! Fuel for the human bonfire!','The Mad Magician',28363,2.3735,6.922,'l3FuAYHhb1E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3063,_binary '\0','/rQk2Mn6g9CDZPk8OkJr8QY3Ye9n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047203',7,8766,'en','Magnificent Obsession','Reckless playboy Bob Merrick crashes his speedboat, requiring emergency attention from the town’s only resuscitator while a local hero, Dr. Phillips, dies waiting for the life-saving device. Merrick then tries to right his wrongs with the doctor’s widow, Helen, falling in love with her in the process.','/511Z4X0NdOfbjgycDHuedsm8zfc.jpg','1954-08-07',108,'Released','This was the moment unashamed... when this man and this woman felt the first ecstasy of their Magnificent Obsession','Magnificent Obsession',13457,2.4837,6.851,'mk10gqsonlg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3064,_binary '\0','/cOscm0VamygZi4OmlOMS0MSQGyR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047209',6.2,2333,'en','Man in the Attic','London, 1888: on the night of the third Jack the Ripper killing, soft-spoken Mr. Slade, a research pathologist, takes lodgings with the Harleys, including a gloomy attic room for \"experiments.\" Mrs. Harley finds Slade odd and increasingly suspects the worst; her niece Lily (star of a decidedly Parisian stage revue) finds him interesting and increasingly attractive. Is Lily in danger, or are her mother\'s suspicions merely a red herring?','/bTNobpUvLfY8beiYxqyLbxeljNj.jpg','1953-12-31',82,'Released','The Life...The Loves...The Crimes of Jack the Ripper!','Man in the Attic',41018,2.1935,5.4,'mNot7jS83FQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3065,_binary '\0','/1EoZR0hGuuFIGlxcwChgS3qcCY6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047216',7.2,3248,'es','Marcelino pan y vino','Left on the doorstep of a monastery as an infant, Marcelino was raised by the monks. He was well-cared for but lonely and missed having a mother. One day he found a special friend in the forbidden attic, hanging on a cross. A friend that would repay Marcelino\'s kindness by granting him one heart-felt wish.','/w4uW544NZnP9gAtYigkJCewDmi1.jpg','1955-02-24',91,'Released',NULL,'The Miracle of Marcelino',62395,3.3411,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3066,_binary '\0','/idseJDUwZyCDuXttkRL0LrhjyKV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047238',7.6,2319,'it','Miseria e nobiltà','Eugene, a young nobleman, asks two penniless idlers to impersonate his noble relatives to help him marry Gemma, the daughter of an enriched cook.','/yOwn3agwatgzHtEGJ8Dda9hANGj.jpg','1954-04-17',90,'Released',NULL,'Poverty and Nobility',58007,1.5643,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3067,_binary '\0','/sKrmkqlbKbYhGDlrxL6P9Vw3Ner.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047244',3.8,1277,'en','Monster from the Ocean Floor','Julie, an American on vacation in Mexico, spots a giant, one-eyed amoeba rising from the ocean, but when she tries to tell the authorities, no one believes her. She finally teams up with a marine biologist in an attempt to destroy it.','/aoVlZnCxzVaXcW8UBtaoQM6ETNn.jpg','1954-05-21',64,'Released','Terror Strikes!...From Beneath the Sea','Monster from the Ocean Floor',29057,1.272,3.8,'EVvFN2qmVbg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3068,_binary '\0','/raQoXdtpQAPJl0MjYGDKCgrOKpx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047259',6.5,1313,'de','Mädchenjahre einer Königin','Vickie, short for Victoria, is crowned Queen of England and as such needs to learn the responsibilities of her new post.','/f3JfFL9ilDHe4pMeM7RTBbUN6A3.jpg','1954-12-15',103,'Released',NULL,'The Story of Vickie',46363,1.8267,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3069,_binary '\0','/eCPYu4iTE5jhoSfbQCgvWQSBgZw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047263',6.6,2044,'en','Naked Alibi','Questioned as a murder suspect, solid (but drunk) citizen Al Willis attacks his police questioners, is beaten, and swears vengeance against them. Next night, Lieut. Parks is murdered; Willis is the only suspect in the eyes of tough Chief Conroy, who pursues him doggedly despite lack of evidence. The obsessed Conroy is dismissed from the force, but continues to harass Willis, who flees to a sleazy town on the Mexican border. Of course, Conroy follows. But which is crazy, Conroy or Willis?','/it52yQxPw2n5LawHjPjonsSZNsY.jpg','1954-10-01',86,'Released','The story of a love with the law at its heels!','Naked Alibi',28560,2.5632,6.1,'dVEZgkQAmQw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3070,_binary '\0','/7Zh6m94Vy7gSOHl2IABcj3JiyHO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047264',6.7,4912,'en','The Naked Jungle','The Leiningen South American cocoa plantation is threatened by a 2-mile-wide, 20-mile-long column of army ants.','/gZyPloNh7m2uaaJa1TvKHhlAFFR.jpg','1954-03-03',95,'Released','The picture about the Marabunta!','The Naked Jungle',61988,3.4986,6.61,'rEN0EscKTmQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3071,_binary '\0','/rKUGfI0ShAw9anuaf1cQUpfMqnF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047278',7,1849,'en','The Night My Number Came Up','British Air Marshal Hardie is attending a party in Hong Kong when he hears of a dream, told by a pilot, in which Hardie\'s flight to Tokyo on a small Dakota propeller plane crashes on a Japanese beach. Hardie dismisses the dream as pure fantasy, but while he is flying to Tokyo the next day, circumstances start changing to align with the pilot\'s vivid vision, and it looks like the dream disaster may become a reality.','/xrIpXLmAHULKFSV3NB4SiNQ6DAW.jpg','1955-03-22',94,'Released','12 Men and a Girl Re-Living a Dream That Fortold Disaster','The Night My Number Came Up',55380,1.7851,6.9,'k90Z9wenGvc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3072,_binary '\0','/vsC3bSPQh6BhVV25QCF3ClShHMu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047279',6.5,1843,'en','Night People','A US intelligence officer, stationed in Germany, is caught in a political dilemma when the Russians kidnap a young Army private, the son of prominent American businessman. In exchange for the soldier\'s return, the Russians attempt to barter a trade for an elderly German couple who they want for treason.','/oAQhxAKMCwPHsDtYxQSVyZH6y7m.jpg','1954-03-11',93,'Released','The story of a counter-spy!','Night People',76372,3.2139,6.1,'rwbCsFEMXzY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3073,_binary '\0','/or5iuVbEWQqTUP4OyO18ztbP1IW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047281',7.9,3250,'ja','二十四の瞳','From 1928 to 1946, the lives of 12 young people and their school teacher in a poor Japanese village are profoundly affected by historical events and personal circumstances.','/lHV1b64e42LCYMGUwxSZWPPcuEE.jpg','1954-09-15',156,'Released',NULL,'Twenty-Four Eyes',43339,3.9434,7.7,'TWNl2IbVJMs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3074,_binary '\0','/j0qTehcyVVV1VEzrJ7YYtoFmWNw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047296',8.1,181054,'en','On the Waterfront','A prizefighter-turned-longshoreman with a conscience goes up against labor leaders to expose corruption, extortion, and murder among the union ranks.','/d4S8LpbCyFJsh1tGgwGQSJdGzKm.jpg','1954-06-22',108,'Released','The man lived by the jungle law of the docks!','On the Waterfront',654,7.4903,7.849,'boekTHsOIY8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3075,_binary '\0','/fhVSxAgbqsfr6rgRXRD30DfT1cF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047313',7.3,2384,'it','L\'oro di Napoli','A tribute to Naples, this film presents six episodes: a clown exploited by a gangster, a pizza seller losing her husband’s ring, a child\'s funeral, a gambler beaten by a kid, a prostitute\'s unusual wedding, and a \"wisdom seller\" offering advice.','/jQcXnwwc05ovRurcA9TlVQIwwjf.jpg','1954-12-03',131,'Released','A sextet of Neapolitan tales - six captivating stories - wry, delightful and dramatic with that special humor and temperament and that enduring zest for life that characterizes these volatile people...','The Gold of Naples',56122,3.0574,7.333,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3076,_binary '\0','/tCtkNkp9VwKb5EBQYczmo1uYLVE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047336',6.7,2256,'it','La Paura','Irene Wagner, the wife of the prominent German scientist Professor Albert Wagner, had been having an affair with Erich Baumann. She does not disclose this to her husband, hoping to preserve his innocence and their \"perfect marriage\". This fills her with anxiety and guilt. However, Johanna Schultze, Erich\'s jealous ex-girlfriend, learns about the affair and begins to blackmail Irene, turning Irene\'s psychological torture into a harsh reality.','/srnmuA2cg9ZAUNjnHQp1g1fbrmp.jpg','1954-11-05',83,'Released',NULL,'Fear',96546,2.9055,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3077,_binary '\0','/gT7kNp48vNUHNu6gaqXt6XbzhHR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047348',5.9,1300,'en','Phantom of the Rue Morgue','When several women are found mutilated and murdered, the Paris police are baffled as to who the killer may be. All evidence points to Dupin, but soon it becomes apparent that it is someone (or something) stronger and deadlier than a human.','/8nKlCGTNQFODw9dS7MaljAyIqsg.jpg','1954-03-27',83,'Released','Mad passions, madder deeds in the Edgar Allan Poe chiller!','Phantom of the Rue Morgue',37463,2.3331,6.2,'s1EI1MjO0M0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3078,_binary '\0','/gtgbFA2V1CIjIAux6G35KxA7z00.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047349',6.6,2355,'en','Phffft','Robert and Nina Tracey resolve to 