 He has became a reckless warrior, and is feared by his comrades, who consider him a madman. Dr. Harris, the squadron physician, is determined to help him heal his tormented soul.','/n9ewv2km0KQfAWPWO3UnJoC2J4B.jpg','1954-09-14',98,'Released','His peak of adventure!','The Purple Plain',73907,2.3547,6.458,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3082,_binary '\0','/gSnttdqZNHuMbc73uQdTAhxjMjX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047377',7.1,4875,'en','Pushover','A police detective falls for the bank robber\'s girlfriend he is supposed to be tailing.','/fABS18Pm2jui9EyRQSHUONU9VmP.jpg','1954-07-14',88,'Released','This year the great suspense drama is PUSHOVER, the story of temptation.','Pushover',31555,2.6454,6.6,'mYUO8T8oQrs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3083,_binary '\0','/zGs5tZOlvc9cprdcU6kDOVNpujf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047396',8.4,574032,'en','Rear Window','A wheelchair-bound photographer spies on his neighbors from his apartment window and becomes convinced one of them has committed murder.','/ILVF0eJxHMddjxeQhswFtpMtqx.jpg','1954-08-01',113,'Released','It only takes one witness to spoil the perfect crime.','Rear Window',567,19.9815,8.335,'HejJ-yLmf3Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3084,_binary '\0','/w3bvizHEYDVaDkT9LmFtpNPMPjc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047408',6.2,1327,'en','Rhapsody','A rich, young beauty, Louise Durant, follows the man she loves and hopes to marry to Zurich where he studies violin at the conservatory. A piano student at the conservatory falls madly in love with Louise. The violinist loves his music first and Louise second. The pianist loves Louise first and his music second. Louise must ultimately choose which man she wants.','/hlCoTzHXiv9zPjux1z6DvLe6ZgH.jpg','1954-04-16',115,'Released','M-G-M\'s Magnificent Drama of Music and Romance','Rhapsody',109898,1.6073,6.6,'1WTuqb-m_Y0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3085,_binary '\0','/sfcsU5Ltvws3leY3UdSf6Xns5mF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047411',6.8,1675,'en','Ride Clear of Diablo','A young railroad surveyor returns to his hometown to find the man who murdered his father and brother.','/7mwxmt4Fn1Nw2teLLjhJd4bcZQV.jpg','1954-02-10',80,'Released','No one with a badge ever rides back from Diablo!','Ride Clear of Diablo',138086,2.836,6.1,'AZWwU2Vbp5k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3086,_binary '\0','/qXlfqpiVN8FRH9CSApdsaZQdRGA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047413',6.4,1655,'en','Riding Shotgun','When a stagecoach guard tries to warn a town of an imminent raid by a band of outlaws, the people mistake him for one of the gang.','/2xX8Rk8gRe4GqxMwSd2xKRlPx0u.jpg','1954-04-01',73,'Released','He held a town at bay... to save it!','Riding Shotgun',154093,1.8485,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3087,_binary '\0','/kZHzQIz6qoStgXtxjo5lMhrkDla.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047417',7,2760,'en','Riot in Cell Block 11','A prisoner leads his counterparts in a protest for better living conditions which turns violent and ugly.','/7Odm3v1TZuH2JogmJhvQYvCD2Gl.jpg','1954-02-18',80,'Released','FILMED ON THE SPOT BEHIND PRISON WALLS!','Riot in Cell Block 11',28023,2.4881,7.1,'PMw9NfSLnk8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3088,_binary '\0','/mhvGp9LGViHQviOu86HW0Boo0kI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047422',6.6,14410,'en','River of No Return','An itinerant farmer and his young son help a heart-of-gold saloon singer search for her estranged husband.','/jXYjgPad6IIfZfCtzLuWTnJdijo.jpg','1954-04-30',91,'Released','Reckless, Roaring, Adventure of the Great Northwest Gold Rush Days!','River of No Return',1936,5.3799,6.7,'RSaI1CJPwEY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3089,_binary '\0','/3y8NgBIey8sivJAHaeIiyOnkDOz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047437',7.6,76710,'en','Sabrina','After two years in Paris, chauffeur\'s daughter Sabrina returns home elegantly transformed and immediately catches the attention of David, the playboy son of her father\'s rich employers. David woos and wins Sabrina, who has always been in love with him, however their romance is threatened by David\'s serious older brother Linus, who runs the family business and is relying on David to marry an heiress in order for a crucial merger to take place.','/e1Po9NDrH7IJZhv89467gJH5FS0.jpg','1954-09-01',114,'Released','...the chauffeur\'s daughter who learned her stuff in Paris.','Sabrina',6620,5.8993,7.5,'AOZuxReeNTk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3090,_binary '\0','/uqh2tPWQzY2Bzi8Xg6keXv7XMTo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047443',7.3,4617,'en','Salt of the Earth','At New Mexico\'s Empire Zinc mine, Mexican-American workers protest the unsafe work conditions and unequal wages compared to their Anglo counterparts. Ramon Quintero helps organize the strike, but he is shown to be a hypocrite by treating his pregnant wife, Esperanza, with a similar unfairness. When an injunction stops the men from protesting, however, the gender roles are reversed, and women find themselves on the picket lines while the men stay at home.','/vYOH8TLzXq15alUDM5DDZXMb1LN.jpg','1954-03-14',94,'Released','At last, an honest movie about American working people','Salt of the Earth',23620,2.2065,7,'NB3FGeUMoYk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3091,_binary '\0','/wnxHiql4TYk1yoEPCcoX4m6IuyQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047444',7.4,10476,'ja','宮本武蔵','Struggling to elevate himself from his low caste in 17th century Japan, Miyamoto trains to become a mighty samurai warrior.','/2nCSzKqOslKrsvUHb2T1jsuh2eQ.jpg','1954-09-25',94,'Released',NULL,'Samurai I: Musashi Miyamoto',31372,2.2285,7.168,'D-VOW7E6JPE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3092,_binary '\0','/7m8b1YwEeK8NeMkiSbPY8CMJx6a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047445',8.3,20153,'ja','山椒大夫','In 11th-century feudal Japan, following the exile of an idealistic governor, his wife and children are separated by slave traders; the children, Zushio and Anju, are sold into brutal servitude under the cruel bailiff Sansho.','/cOBsWxFtEoqXIPx4JZP5E7g1WEo.jpg','1954-03-31',124,'Released','Without mercy, man is like a beast.','Sansho the Bailiff',20532,3.7793,8.1,'1TSo4GBi1xI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3093,_binary '\0','/tk0uCdSUD2ZarXt4N86j3J08WVZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047449',6.4,1349,'en','Saskatchewan','Story of blood brothers whose bonds are tested when marauding Sioux Indians cross the border to enlist the peaceful Cree in a battle against the Great White Father.','/nvGkHcdEGB40Pmtqx1sLtxU0mt2.jpg','1954-03-30',87,'Released','...where the Royal Northwest Mounted Police stood alone against the fury of the Custer-massacring Sioux and the savage Cree Nation!','Saskatchewan',147905,2.1285,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3094,_binary '\0','/oXrCYrSk6KmJRVjkjXnaYpBqcuf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047464',6,2612,'en','Secret of the Incas','Harry Steele (Charlton Heston) is a tourist guide determined to make his fortune by finding the Sunburst, an Inca treasure.','/f09jwcHubGvpEN5Lnt7tl1FKgye.jpg','1954-06-06',100,'Released','Marrying Doc is my one chance ... Don\'t kiss it away for me, Harry ... please ... please ... please ...','Secret of the Incas',40790,3.364,5.871,'quLIf57fFis','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3095,_binary '\0','/q2ve97XH53hEUaWEUhD9AQcnn1A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047469',7.4,10168,'it','Senso','A troubled and neurotic Italian Countess betrays her entire country for a self-destructive love affair with an Austrian Lieutenant.','/iyWApADv4UD9KtVQvJ1mkKn9WXV.jpg','1954-03-25',123,'Released','A passionate doomed love affair among the corrupt aristocracy','Senso',43195,2.4066,7.2,'6vJ3DEujOpI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3096,_binary '\0','/5i2rmZ2Vwuzq6CPOaTLW0jjhJmB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047472',7