in is rising like the swollen rivers...','The Silver Chalice',65212,2.1271,4.4,'tkueAHXEQtw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3100,_binary '\0','/rWx3NHwnPRMH2w3TwRmZZip6SNp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047495',6.8,2682,'en','Silver Lode','Dan Ballard, a respected citizen in the western town of Silver Lode, has his wedding interrupted by four men led by Ned McCarty, an old acquaintance who, as a US Marshal, arrests Ballard for the murder of his brother and the theft of $20,000. Ballard seeks to stall McCarty while tracking down evidence that will prove his innocence.','/cVIDVhgbtQ6mAsihqzD8opW9uga.jpg','1954-06-24',81,'Released','While the mob waits they match bullet for bullet… life for life!','Silver Lode',27443,1.9174,6.2,'Ypuc3z7NJ1A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3101,_binary '\0','/xH2pECTsyhNRgtKX0UUefOAmU6j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047505',6.5,1535,'en','The Sleeping Tiger','A petty thief breaks into the home of a psychiatrist and gets caught in a web of a doctor who wishes to experiment on him and a doctor\'s wife who wishes to seduce him.','/6NXrKPB7iP4Fa3nZwhbj8U9hWga.jpg','1954-06-21',89,'Released','A saint turned sinner!','The Sleeping Tiger',74753,1.5202,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3102,_binary '\0','/AhfzktPgKD9kwvkWLvHfCtnylS6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047507',3.3,1401,'en','The Snow Creature','A botanical expedition to the Himalayas captures a Yeti and brings it back alive to Los Angeles, where it escapes and runs amok, seeking food.','/bJQZlaxR3Ak5xqnB8NTGeAGncVE.jpg','1954-11-01',71,'Released','Half man! Half monster! Terrorizes city, abducts women, annihilates men!','The Snow Creature',41030,1.5376,3,'6KBcbTPtinc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3103,_binary '\0','/AlvKqnxlkWWYE6ngRLOWfYY3QuI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047522',7.5,21217,'en','A Star Is Born','A movie star helps a young singer-actress find fame, even as age and alcoholism send his own career into a downward spiral.','/zpg2SzpYhZk1D1seDfIIlwaqAxT.jpg','1954-10-01',176,'Released','The applause of the world... and then this!','A Star Is Born',3111,5.1226,7.128,'K48JkClgYIs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3104,_binary '\0','/p6qM3hlviWYIgpPq4zNwrttn6Io.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047528',8,70485,'it','La strada','When Gelsomina, a naïve young woman, is purchased from her impoverished mother by brutish circus strongman Zampanò to be his wife and partner, she loyally endures her husband\'s coldness and abuse as they travel the Italian countryside performing together. Soon Zampanò must deal with his jealousy and conflicted feelings about Gelsomina when she finds a kindred spirit in Il Matto, the carefree circus fool, and contemplates leaving Zampanò.','/rwjbT0zlsUDMztaCcWjlWuxaEL1.jpg','1954-09-23',115,'Released','Filmed in Italy - where it happened!','La Strada',405,3.1225,7.9,'GrE7syApSkA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3105,_binary '\0','/mxW3h5E71IOnctX65wRWBTqwm5i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047542',6.8,8288,'en','Suddenly','The tranquility of a small town is marred only by sheriff Tod Shaw\'s unsuccessful courtship of widow Ellen Benson, a pacifist who can\'t abide guns and those who use them. But violence descends on Ellen\'s household willy-nilly when the U.S. President passes through town... and slightly psycho hired assassin John Baron finds the Benson home ideal for an ambush.','/v0eQfRMVJtvEkaJjBsSrd6ri1UI.jpg','1954-09-17',77,'Released','A cold-blooded thriller!','Suddenly',18398,2.3982,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3106,_binary '\0','/wzXGuw434Ab0PiCmM2y4v0OrBvc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047550',6.4,2410,'en','Susan Slept Here','On Christmas Eve, suffering from a case of writer\'s block, screenwriter Mark Christopher and his gofer Virgil get an unexpected visit from Sergeant Maizel. Knowing Christopher is working on a juvenile delinquent script, the sergeant brings by delinquent Susan thinking she will inspire Christopher while providing a place for her to spend the holidays outside of juvenile hall.','/gdS7eU6DPxeWwdcW1B5R1o7mtX0.jpg','1954-07-28',98,'Released','She slept in his bed...wore his pajamas - THEN SHE REALLY TOOK OVER!','Susan Slept Here',50356,2.1164,6.109,'vHRpKHEVD4g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3107,_binary '\0','/9yAJFojU7pSRcEkGmGvjtGJCkVJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047559',5.5,1819,'en','Target Earth','Giant robots from Venus invade Chicago. Stranded in the deserted city are Frank and Nora (who has recently attempted suicide). They meet a celebrating couple at a café, Vicki Harris and Jim Wilson. The quartet escape the robot patrol and take refuge in a large hotel. There, they encounter a new danger in Davis, a psychopathic killer.','/stBO3utMARye8eIxWSdei4d0b4W.jpg','1954-11-07',75,'Released','Raw Panic The Screen Never Dared Reveal!','Target Earth',31042,1.3677,6,'NQzgGtoxRTk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3108,_binary '\0','/pBGyZKdtjaDMi6mVogt9wCNAkng.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047572',7.2,1458,'de','Des Teufels General','The adaptation of the eponymous play by Carl Zuckmayer tells the story of renegade general Harras of the German Luftwaffe, who during WWII openly criticizes the Nazi regime. As a consequence, he is put under surveillance, and even imprisoned for a brief period of time. Still remaining outspoken, Harras realizes the horrific dimensions of this hopeless and injust war waged by Germany.','/fOUYefiSxExCzKVrpcXwIROeS9Y.jpg','1955-02-23',117,'Released','They bought his soul and put him in command of Hell!','The Devil\'s General',11295,1.4612,6.867,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3109,_binary '\0','/bW83NQMHtgFIkDSoZBer4eEnc9V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047573',7.2,27198,'en','Them!','As a result of nuclear testing, gigantic, ferocious mutant ants appear in the American desert southwest, and a father-daughter team of entomologists join forces with the state police officer who first discovers their existence, an FBI agent and, eventually, the US Army to eradicate the menace, before it spreads across the continent — and the world.','/tP352STF6BvSROi8K3CMM799TVo.jpg','1954-06-16',94,'Released','A horror horde of crawl-and-crush giants clawing out of the earth from mile-deep catacombs!','Them!',11071,4.5813,6.828,'CugQcmapiwc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3110,_binary '\0','/aI1ah2uVBkAQyoF9CXlojHnBeG9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047574',6.4,7451,'en','There\'s No Business Like Show Business','Molly and Terry Donahue, plus their three children, are The Five Donahues. Youngest son Tim meets hat-check girl Vicky and the family act begins to fall apart.','/3zkiJMfkmhVXC439Z43ZScqUYQP.jpg','1954-12-16',118,'Released','With Love and Kisses from 20th Century-Fox...Straight from the Shoulder, Right from the Heart Comes...The Musicavalcade and the Personal Story of the Greatest Business on Earth!','There\'s No Business Like Show Business',21468,3.3711,6.1,'d1KQAHPsAdY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3111,_binary '\0','/inQQLXDOkb3jwDqNqHF8Lnel6yU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047577',5.9,11557,'en','This Island Earth','Aliens have landed and are hiding on Earth, but need Earth’s scientists to help them fight an inter-planetary war.','/2viRDpHmhzQoreZok2auLjkVbSE.jpg','1955-06-10',85,'Released','2½ Years in the Making!','This Island Earth',831,2.862,6,'eZz2AeXca40','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3112,_binary '\0','/ldHPKWUa5PkzAXnDRRT8Zq6kNfr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047579',6.5,1312,'en','Three Cases of Murder','An atmospheric British omnibus film presenting three tales of murder and the supernatural. In “In the Picture,” a museum attendant is drawn into the eerie world within a painting. In “You Killed Elizabeth,” two lifelong friends become suspects when the woman they both love is murdered. In “Lord Mountdrago,” a disgraced politician seeks revenge on a powerful statesman by exploiting his dreams. Linked by a recurring figure, the film blends psychological horror, mystery, and fantasy across its three interconnected stories.','/y4XHdfPCG21hpRohwdh6vhjr7iM.jpg','1955-03-15',99,'Released',NULL,'Three Cases of Murder',45577,1.7295,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3113,_binary '\0','/91jVA9ITFrX0Mr6xHhvI1EAz9gC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047580',6.3,4154,'en','Three Coins in the Fountain','Three American roommates working in Italy wish for the man of their dreams after throwing coins into Rome\'s magnificent Trevi Fountain. Frances, a secretary at a government agency, sets out to win the heart of her smooth-talking novelist employer; Anita, her coworker, defies office regulations by romancing an Italian who works at the agency; and office newcomer Maria meets a real Italian Prince Charming and falls madly in love. The only thing the three hopeful ladies need to do is seal their fate.','/3y6aNrQd8K2bQjI2gRpmmDJGr99.jpg','1954-05-01',102,'Released','You\'ve Never Lived Until You\'ve Loved in Rome!','Three Coins in the Fountain',41503,3.6572,5.9,'bienKPcoZgU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3114,_binary '\0','/dHaWMT2PpvRmDi5jHHXLAd0VhTR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047603',6.4,2769,'en','Track of the Cat','A family saga: In a stunning mountain valley ranch setting near Aspen, complex and dangerous family dynamics play out against the backdrop of the first big snowstorm of winter and an enormous panther with seemingly mythical qualities which is killing cattle.','/rRIbBdsERc0yGvHWc5aM81Eyn6O.jpg','1954-11-19',102,'Released','A love story of real, raw, runaway emotions!','Track of the Cat',86608,2.4068,5.9,'-yxsmYZGYGc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3115,_binary '\0','/oHnoObrxhfHnHgYzQIyIhpJhI47.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047630',6.6,6798,'it','Ulisse','A retelling of Homer\'s The Odyssey, focusing on Ulysses\'s ten-year journey home to Ithaca following the Trojan War, where he faces various mythical challenges while his wife Penelope fends off suitors.','/1HwrZ6SVRcUiPWSx3ecc7DFqey0.jpg','1954-10-06',100,'Released','History\'s Greatest Epic...On the Screen at Last!','Ulysses',43194,5.0869,6.577,'2Wg3V4qLTRc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3116,_binary '\0','/jNlW8KlzBnZGtdrdRaGQhViD2Sw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047638',7.4,1581,'ja','噂の女','After living a traumatic experience in Tokyo, Yukiko returns to Kyoto, where Hatsuko, her mother, runs a brothel, which upsets Yukiko very much.','/t3vr6WiTJCM9dArfKpwTTJ8lTm1.jpg','1954-06-20',84,'Released',NULL,'The Woman in the Rumor',45993,1.2283,7.3,'-cdd-kmb2qs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3117,_binary '\0','/nUMtpn3Fx94FPl5Fxqsqi3MTGXG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047641',6,1801,'en','Valley of the Kings','Hard-boiled archeologist Mark Brandon is searching for ancient tombs in Egypt when he is approached by beautiful Ann Mercedes, who convinces him to help her fulfill her deceased father\'s life\'s ambition - to provide solid proof of the biblical Joseph\'s travels in ancient Egypt. As an ex-pupil of Ann\'s father, Mark accepts and the two embark on a search for the tomb of the Pharoah Ra Hotep, said to have had some connection with Joseph. The trail to the tomb is fraught with intrigue, betrayal, murder, and the possibility that the tomb itself has been emptied of all its artifacts by ancient looters.','/hkSmyynUZ95g1ZVTESlHCBugWMT.jpg','1954-07-21',86,'Released','AMAZING! TIMELY! THRILLING!','Valley of the Kings',118517,2.3399,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3118,_binary '\0','/oftyzHLMpnpOHe5gV5Vvf0tu7o6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047647',7,13168,'en','Vera Cruz','After the American Civil War, mercenaries travel to Mexico to fight in their revolution for money. The former soldier and gentleman Benjamin Trane meets the gunman and killer Joe Erin and his men, and together they are hired by the Emperor Maximillian and the Marquis Henri de Labordere to escort the Countess Marie Duvarre to the harbor of Vera Cruz.','/7sDTIHW0nG8CqzskwBJtmUnBwcK.jpg','1954-12-25',94,'Released','The Giants Battle In The Biggest Spectacle Of Them All!','Vera Cruz',12766,3.119,6.669,'rUIVb32Qf9M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3119,_binary '\0','/uChOlEWqFwxwJ3eZP9eQj2yqczd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047673',7.6,57267,'en','White Christmas','Two talented song-and-dance men team up after the war to become one of the hottest acts in show business. In time they befriend and become romantically involved with the beautiful Haynes sisters who comprise a sister act.','/A5kBQsHKbIptxJyELEpHQJROCRj.jpg','1954-10-14',120,'Released','THE MOST FABULOUS MUSIC-AND-MIRTH SHOW IN MOTION PICTURE HISTORY!','White Christmas',13368,4.0072,7.183,'3n3-UtakD3I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3120,_binary '\0','/atbJUEuf6Y8vcduHLfvaJqPyF6d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047677',6.7,19357,'en','The Wild One','The Black Rebels Motorcycle Club ride into the small California town of Wrightsville, eager to raise hell. Brooding gang leader Johnny Strabler takes a liking to Kathie, the daughter of the local lawman, as another club rolls into town.','/yVbBTzr6hkTZBNCr01RKXcTyfGu.jpg','1953-12-30',79,'Released','Hot feelings hit terrifying heights in a story that really boils over!','The Wild One',28696,4.5345,6.539,'Ht1_4Z_9h0M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3121,_binary '\0','/ecpBYripcEjmHG8f0mTZJkmzkAi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047679',6.6,4021,'en','Witness to Murder','A woman fights to convince the police that she witnessed a murder while looking out her bedroom window.','/3aPVHx9eiQFcj3qNW1fvy4CuwRh.jpg','1954-04-15',83,'Released','THE SUSPENSE SHOCK OF THE YEAR!','Witness to Murder',37635,1.8372,6.3,'vKf_2rHg8Mw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3122,_binary '\0','/9UDHgEN16ySO73voijsVoPoqcZi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047680',6.9,1640,'en','Woman\'s World','Needing to fill the position of general manager of his company, and believing that an executive\'s wife is crucial to her husband\'s success, auto industry mogul Gifford brings three couples to New York to size up: Jerry and Carol: he hard-driven and self-reliant, she willing to use her beauty to further her husband\'s career; Sid and Elizabeth, he ulcer-ridden and torn between achieving success and restoring their troubled marriage, she positive that his job will kill him, but gamely agreeing to play the good wife for the duration; and down-to-earth Bill, whose good-natured Katie fears that his promotion would spell the end of their idyllic familiy existence.','/n6NBpVPI0qiyzpynRLpnE2Y9w1x.jpg','1954-09-30',94,'Released','The Worldy Story of Three Deadly Females and the Men in Their Lives!','Woman\'s World',113843,1.9409,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3123,_binary '\0','/uxjflMr0CCwmtwxvPRfwgObIYoR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047682',7.7,2383,'ja','山の音','An ingratiating bride develops warm ties to her father-in-law while her cold husband blithely slights her for another woman.','/mzdKn2Eo5rZCV3fzBjVdxAI0KM8.jpg','1954-01-15',96,'Released',NULL,'Sound of the Mountain',46492,1.3861,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3124,_binary '\0','/mNW9aLlqI9WvJMrvCbaNdpgxdkV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047688',6.7,3093,'en','Young at Heart','The lives and romances of three sisters in a musical family; the youngest daughter\'s life is complicated by the subsequent arrival of a charming composer and a cynical music arranger.','/t4n74mKJAfx1ln1CTGSa9vxS1z6.jpg','1954-12-01',117,'Released',NULL,'Young at Heart',43340,1.7064,6,'V9Pg13ZxnqY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3125,_binary '\0','/nLdVBJh1tKgDnUSaHqvCWy4DWKM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047794',6.3,2540,'en','Abbott and Costello Meet the Keystone Kops','Harry and Willie are scammed into buying the Thomas Edison studio lot by a man named Gorman. They decide to follow Gorman\'s trail to Hollywood where, unbeknownst to them, he has taken the identity of a foreign film director. The lads wind up as stunt doubles in film the which Gorman is now shooting, while the conman tries to have the bungling pair done away with before they realize who he really is.','/vOROGs11VzPpHH62633fhYTMtTz.jpg','1955-02-02',80,'Released','Slapstick chases!... Pies in faces!... Shapely beauts in bathing suits!','Abbott and Costello Meet the Keystone Kops',33476,1.9755,6.2,'xF7Rz_ajwhU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3126,_binary '\0','/8rOpJuby0HBjaphddR8CAF3i35.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047795',6.2,6987,'en','Abbott and Costello Meet the Mummy','Bud and Lou, two stranded American archaeologists, run afoul of an Egyptian cult with big plans to resurrect the mummified corpse of Klaris, guardian of his Princess Ara\'s treasure-filled tomb. When Lou accidentally eats the cursed medallion needed to find the ancient treasure, the two become targets of the cult\'s leader, his goons, a mysterious femme fatale, and the mummy of Klaris himself!','/sMW2cKK4RBMgN9xDHY4utzOYWxn.jpg','1955-04-16',79,'Released','They\'re back -- in their mummy\'s arms!','Abbott and Costello Meet the Mummy',26661,3.109,5.945,'EPmeEMWPMvI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3127,_binary '\0','/3fZi5vsXis8FsaDI07NK9DkmfOp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047797',6.6,1850,'en','Above Us the Waves','In World War II, the greatest threat to the British navy is the German battleship Tirpitz. While anchored in a Norwegian fjord, it is impossible to attack by conventional means, so a plan is hatched for a special commando unit to attack it, using midget submarines to plant underwater explosives.','/tAcfM7fh48TLdX9tNHSheiqEbUb.jpg','1955-03-29',99,'Released','Their Orders...Sink the Tirpitz!','Above Us the Waves',28909,2.8408,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3128,_binary '\0','/iQQ4jjYV8fgdEHDgkgSrc4mWgUx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047811',7.6,18820,'en','All That Heaven Allows','Two different social classes collide when Cary Scott, a wealthy upper-class widow, falls in love with her much younger and down-to-earth gardener, prompting disapproval and criticism from her children and country club friends.','/wlSmIk6iQ8yQhBG795UOOBUs4gF.jpg','1955-08-25',89,'Released','How much does Heaven Allow a Woman in Love?','All That Heaven Allows',43316,4.7321,7.343,'3H8yXanHW1I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3129,_binary '\0','/lczZgNXUqSm9SxPLgDAt6SSnSHn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047821',7.1,3806,'it','Le amiche','Clelia, a self-made woman coming from humble means, travels back to Turin, her hometown, to scout locations for the successful Roman atelier she works for. At the hotel, she encounters some upper middle-class women and she finds herself drawn into their friendships.','/ksEwRHvYqOyV7JokAhfgtUUTxsA.jpg','1955-11-18',104,'Released',NULL,'Le Amiche',46979,1.3144,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3130,_binary '\0','/5MYD8Z76Bcbz55HzUTP4U6dH51V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047834',7.2,22160,'en','Animal Farm','Animals on a farm lead a revolution against the farmers to put their destiny in their own hands. However this revolution eats their own children and they cannot avoid corruption.','/lhLp9a0jBIPLMAdUFNlYjCuS72Q.jpg','1954-12-28',73,'Released','He\'s got the world in an UPROAR!','Animal Farm',11848,5.2674,7.1,'YGCo5Tva39s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3131,_binary '\0','/aOv5il3ZjsuC8hYiojsmtAH0txD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047840',6.4,4997,'en','Artists and Models','A struggling painter begins taking inspiration from the dreams of his friend and roommate, a comic book fan who narrates an adventure story while he sleeps, but unbeknownst to the latter, the artist of his favorite comic book lives in the same building as they do with the model for her drawings.','/hKP3lBDj320ruxQ9JepgyEglNad.jpg','1955-11-07',110,'Released','Martin and Lewis run amok with spies, models and Shirley MacLaine!','Artists and Models',43317,2.8698,6.638,'p941L6cp1mw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3132,_binary '\0','/tQv32m6pufbJT2rKuKDzt0kVynQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047849',7.6,27105,'en','Bad Day at Black Rock','One-armed war veteran John J. Macreedy steps off a train at the sleepy little town of Black Rock. Once there, he begins to unravel a web of lies, secrecy, and murder.','/8EnhHjU0DyCckmZRtn46s3WXeEf.jpg','1955-01-13',81,'Released','Just the way it happened!','Bad Day at Black Rock',14554,4.2372,7.3,'17nCYAayWMQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3133,_binary '\0','/r0QqmAFLC1uMYQyTv2zTr64LqeU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047860',6.4,2859,'en','Battle Cry','The dramatic story of US Marines in training, in combat, and in love, during World War II. The story centers on a major who guides the raw recruits from their training to combat.','/ae9Wrw5vQ4WM2NqxNPlYRbfV2n.jpg','1955-02-02',149,'Released','The men who fought. The women who waited. And the stolen moments they shared.','Battle Cry',51426,2.342,5.8,'4rG2vpd4GNE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3134,_binary '\0','/9eIcseuhwNfzevwee0Yn1JrtjHn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047873',6.8,1507,'en','The Benny Goodman Story','Young Benny Goodman is taught clarinet by a music professor. He is advised to play whichever kind of music he likes best, but to make a living, Benny begins by joining the Ben Pollack traveling band.','/pbxZjnYn2hcwHb4Vr20wu0k2HYa.jpg','1956-02-02',116,'Released',NULL,'The Benny Goodman Story',43261,2.3911,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3135,_binary '\0','/tzb3epsqaSJMiBwKtK4GtW25ryq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047876',7.5,7866,'it','Il bidone','Aging small-time conman Augusto works with two younger men: Roberto, who desires to become the Italian Johnny Ray, and Carlo, nicknamed Picasso. Through a series of mishaps and personal entanglements, things go badly for Augusto.','/kpo4sZyeOX3dIY0l8uZ2f214mK8.jpg','1955-10-07',113,'Released','SOME PEOPLE DON’T GIVE A DAMN ABOUT YOUR DAUGHTERS\' WELFARE!','The Swindle',36102,2.0186,7.3,'ctmQQQhg1VQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3136,_binary '\0','/b2X4TG3e3QC4vzNfR25I58h5fdY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047878',7.3,10149,'en','The Big Combo','Police Lt. Leonard Diamond vies to bring a clever, well connected, and sadistic gangster to justice all the while obsessing over the gangster\'s girlfriend.','/fltH7VmdZQeCRMwionxfYKOZoPg.jpg','1955-02-13',88,'Released','The Most Startling Story The Screen Has Ever Dared Reveal!','The Big Combo',22342,2.4175,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3137,_binary '\0','/6ap5La7gtoYOybA4UbIQXk05PeO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047879',6.6,1383,'en','Big House, U.S.A','A tough and realistic crime drama unfolds as merciless kidnapper Jerry Barker (Ralph Meeker) demands ransom paid against a young runaway whose fate lands Barker in Casabel Island Prison.','/54dhnmEOZPPgdRmIQnVLStGiKEt.jpg','1955-03-03',83,'Released','5 KILLER CONVICTS BREAK OUT!','Big House, U.S.A',38059,1.8497,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3138,_binary '\0','/qDZrpmU8ow8Q8LEBFYvACxsLYgp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047880',6.7,4858,'en','The Big Knife','Movie star Charlie Castle draws the ire of Hollywood producer Stanley Hoff when he refuses to sign a new seven-year contract. Castle is sick of the low quality of the studio\'s films and wants to start a new life. While his estranged wife supports him in the decision, Castle\'s talent agent urges him to reconsider. When Castle continues to be uncooperative, Hoff resorts to blackmail in order to get his way.','/1cnE5SXHNSKUwjSBPXR6Uf7pzCV.jpg','1955-10-25',111,'Released','A Journey to the Dark Heart of Hollywood','The Big Knife',48155,2.0298,6,'pXFx-MMwIvs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3139,_binary '\0','/75QBPYzOgSZWiYXRWoshRuO201z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047885',7.4,10704,'en','Blackboard Jungle','Richard Dadier is a teacher at North Manual High School, an inner-city school where many of the pupils frequently engage in anti-social behavior. Dadier makes various attempts to engage the students\' interest in education, challenging both the school staff and the pupils. He is subjected to violence as well as duplicitous schemes.','/vPGvWlsMg4niyuGCSzvAiyjYNWC.jpg','1955-03-25',101,'Released','They turned a school into a jungle!','Blackboard Jungle',26516,3.127,6.9,'Amyo9HNLSgI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3140,_binary '\0','/gRnYl1CfdQereEqR3R26WOukEnH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047889',6.2,3928,'en','Blood Alley','An American Merchant Marine captain, rescued from a Chinese Communist jail by local villagers, is \"shanghaied\" into transporting the entire village to Hong Kong on an ancient paddle steamer.','/e2A6wHN7zamWWVW1TuauxXfAV5a.jpg','1955-10-01',110,'Released','Adventure on the dangerous waters of the Orient!','Blood Alley',29377,3.5685,5.959,'T8Qwb1PkWfc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3141,_binary '\0','/sD3fYFWaoLzMPFDcKrGFPrXFJG3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047892',7.5,14392,'fr','Bob le flambeur','In Paris, Bob Montagne is practically synonymous with gambling -- and winning. He is kind, classy and well-liked by virtually everyone in town, including police inspector Ledru. However, when Bob\'s luck turns sour, he begins to lose friends and makes the most desperate gamble of his life: to rob the Deauville casino during Grand Prix weekend, when the vaults are full. Unfortunately, Bob soon learns that the game is rigged and the cops are on to him.','/3CIfIDtD1I1rYY3ooaya8iZHlD8.jpg','1956-08-24',103,'Released',NULL,'Bob le Flambeur',26030,2.6347,7.3,'1NJBRyUDeA4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3142,_binary '\0','/3mSfCfcntX5cYTrqeSCYxSzrEPR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047898',4.2,8206,'en','Bride of the Monster','Dr. Eric Vornoff, with the help of his mute assistant Lobo, captures twelve men for a grisly experiment; His goal to turn them into supermen using atomic energy. Reporter Janet Lawton, fiancée of the local lieutenant, vows to investigate Vornoff\'s supposedly haunted house.','/mk9uXv3MGHu2FGRAlqatMtGlk0z.jpg','1955-05-11',70,'Released','More horrifying than \"DRACULA\"...\"FRANKENSTEIN\"','Bride of the Monster',36489,2.0582,4.4,'B_ABk1pUXPY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3143,_binary '\0','/5VxEKbjTpi84j92Qc04utSr8ebx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047904',6,1500,'en','A Bullet for Joey','Raoul Leduc is a police inspector trailing a spy who plots to kidnap an important American atomic scientist. Joe Victor a gangster who is hired to carry out the abduction, balks when he learns what is at stake and helps Leduc out instead.','/jiZ1sTbtNlTMv0q7gaxDfSGqCep.jpg','1955-04-15',85,'Released','THE SCREEN\'S TOP \"TOUGH GUYS\" MEET FACE TO FACE!','A Bullet for Joey',27212,2.3068,5.8,'_EhOIlPJ4xY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3144,_binary '\0','/eO3CchK1dKfuzSrYAnV5xsV6754.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047930',7.1,3078,'cs','Cesta do pravěku','Four schoolboys go on an awe-inspiring expedition back through time, where they behold landscapes and creatures that have long since vanished from the earth.','/5WxNZY5D6IhZLACAZm7xUJFXDJU.jpg','1955-08-05',85,'Released','Four boys living the excitement every boy dreams about!','Journey to the Beginning of Time',8779,3.1219,7.2,'iUobdR5-3YQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3145,_binary '\0','/7Hs97t19LUSjgA8n5k2sdby0Lj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047944',6.3,2388,'en','The Cobweb','Patients and staff at a posh psychiatric clinic clash over who chooses the clinic’s new drapes – but drapes are the least of their problems.','/duT2743CkNIKvrwch5CqmB7Xmta.jpg','1955-06-07',124,'Released','The Story of the Strange Mansion on the Hill!','The Cobweb',94123,2.2981,5.7,'UNLogTnvCMA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3146,_binary '\0','/cxuBWkPCnMPbx6Ja37cxz9s0Azw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047945',6.9,3505,'en','The Colditz Story','The Germans believed that no man could escape from Colditz Castle, set as it was in the heart of the Reich, 400 miles from any neutral frontier. This film, based on Pat Reid\'s epic novel, tells the story of how the British, French, Dutch and Polish prisoners of war who were incarcerated in Colditz set out to prove their captors wrong.','/yLeEVpgapcRBzUdeZdSWAe3fYLg.jpg','1955-01-25',94,'Released',NULL,'The Colditz Story',16912,2.6822,6.81,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3147,_binary '\0','/KfKZH5ZVDToddhtS0KXjQv1GDB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047947',5.6,2011,'en','Conquest of Space','A team of American astronauts leave their space station on the first mission to Mars, but the captain\'s religious beliefs may get in the way.','/9RxLfVIJ3nCZQZUMgbF7ThGlrFi.jpg','1955-04-20',81,'Released','See how it will happen - in your lifetime!','Conquest of Space',25952,2.0591,5.6,'qlyHw3mNfmA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3148,_binary '\0','/4pF0O7M99X5bCdz7CdbsKPd2p9o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047956',6.8,2588,'en','The Court-Martial of Billy Mitchell','A dramatization of the American general and his court martial for publically complaining about High Command\'s dismissal and neglect of the aerial fighting forces.','/hdaOpCeRev0lsFybiOSjbaIbehm.jpg','1955-12-31',100,'Released','He defied the army and navy . . . and they gave him a Court Martial!','The Court-Martial of Billy Mitchell',118910,2.9085,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3149,_binary '\0','/uiaKnc4IgbOtxLNC8OTQqIt4nMs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047960',5.5,2069,'en','Creature with the Atom Brain','Murders, with victims dying from spines broken by brute strength, erupt in the city and the killers, when encountered, walk away unharmed by police bullets which strike them. A police doctor\'s investigation of the deaths leads to the discovery of an army of dead criminal musclemen restored to life, remotely controlled by a vengeful former crime boss and a former Nazi scientist, from the latter\'s laboratory hidden in the suburbs.','/71ZgmkyVQpaOK9TSCzR8qmhZAto.jpg','1955-07-01',69,'Released','Here is horror that can happen NOW... TO YOU!','Creature with the Atom Brain',35919,1.8545,5.1,'wvY30GZfPjI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3150,_binary '\0','/sMtdzIMbDCO9vSvlXyIqwDQRqBB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047966',5.8,1784,'en','Cult of the Cobra','While stationed in Asia, six American G.I.\'s witness the secret ritual of Lamians (worshipers of women who can change into serpents). When discovered by the cult, the High Lamian Priest vows that \"the Cobra Goddess will avenge herself\". Once back in the United States, a mysterious woman enters into their lives and accidents begin to happen. The shadow of a cobra is seen just before each death.','/ypQ7rC8lUgt9g7yAMmmfq5vx0Fo.jpg','1955-03-30',82,'Released','Can a woman\'s beauty be changed to a thing of terror?','Cult of the Cobra',35911,2.3977,6,'nfZyon_K4dg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3151,_binary '\0','/bM1LjObzhzqSnt1BR3ev7WO7kpz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047969',6.7,4629,'en','Daddy Long Legs','Wealthy American, Jervis Pendleton has a chance encounter at a French orphanage with a cheerful 18-year-old resident, and anonymously pays for her education at a New England college. She writes letters to her mysterious benefactor regularly, but he never writes back. Several years later, he visits her at school, while still concealing his identity, and—despite their large age difference—they soon fall in love.','/2Tt12RPDJP4KnepYsJ4hrEQS7El.jpg','1955-05-05',126,'Released',NULL,'Daddy Long Legs',33218,3.1338,6.4,'8iDw33RuRiw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3152,_binary '\0','/vnqZ4MsJxaot0lMQ4cXopiFf8de.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047976',6.7,3019,'en','Dementia','In a shadowy world stitched from nightmares, a young woman\'s harrowing journey in a seedy hotel unveils her traumatic past. Haunted by violence and stalked through desolate streets, her psyche unravels as she confronts an abusive husband and unsettling memories.','/u0dai8tk4urRAox8rZTEXixURUw.jpg','1955-12-22',58,'Released','Not ONE WORD is spoken on the screen!','Dementia',79363,1.3541,6.8,'ff8w5U-zueo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3153,_binary '\0','/wVB7ONGfJNDPFitfRcTyMQMpzBc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047977',6.8,5664,'en','Davy Crockett, King of the Wild Frontier','Legends (and myths) from the life of famed American frontiersman Davy Crockett are depicted in this feature film edited from television episodes. Crockett and his friend George Russel fight in the Creek Indian War. Then Crockett is elected to Congress and brings his rough-hewn ways to the House of Representatives. Finally, Crockett and Russell journey to Texas and the last stand at the Alamo.','/7IFRrsQdaaUJaemg2z35fshzswd.jpg','1955-05-25',93,'Released','NOW...on the MOTION PICTURE SCREEN!','Davy Crockett, King of the Wild Frontier',35115,2.9775,6.411,'AFN_1Ju7Hak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3154,_binary '\0','/591TjhWgnTjR3iXLkT4GPaept2O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047985',7.5,11909,'en','The Desperate Hours','Escaped convicts terrorize a suburban family they\'re holding hostage.','/yW9S2jc4elEeNfzwXhm5sF9GTCV.jpg','1955-10-05',112,'Released','A reign of violence sweeps the screen.','The Desperate Hours',18612,3.676,7.039,'naFLiszrF-4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3155,_binary '\0','/jqauGL8DmNzi0VDEHeqagxmBxAV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0047990',7.7,2161,'hi','देवदास','Childhood sweethearts grow up in a small village with a love-hate relationship which changes to love when they mature.','/2C3C3FLfkeCjK0zy7orIBsMKcbW.jpg','1955-12-30',159,'Released',NULL,'Devdas',136627,1.1885,6.054,'WLWhnaubB2Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3156,_binary '\0','/u3SZwkiXXse7DVCKDC1kuP91caA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048001',5.8,1229,'en','Doctor at Sea','A youthful doctor tires of general practice and signs up to be a ship\'s doctor in an effort to bring some excitement into his life. Unfortunately, the cargo boat he joins is skippered by a formidable martinet captain and, worse still, there are only two women on board. Luckily for the fun-loving medic, one of them, a beautiful French girl, is more than impressed with his bedside manner.','/pa9gmzyt6d0k0Y1PwMnhSBfTlFD.jpg','1955-07-12',93,'Released','That Doctor is Back ...and She-Sick!','Doctor at Sea',68339,1.6831,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3157,_binary '\0','/iPXVSai8wqHVHJ5yRlzGtewVfRS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048002',7.1,2463,'it','Don Camillo e l\'onorevole Peppone','Bewildered, Don Camillo learns that Peppone intends to stand for parliament. Determined to thwart his ambitions, the good priest, ignoring the recommendations of the Lord, decides to campaign against him.','/tt2nV4pzFzFqBBGBpmfQIbdna4j.jpg','1955-09-29',97,'Released',NULL,'Don Camillo\'s Last Round',11579,1.9568,7.3,'xjAoU_dVExU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3158,_binary '\0','/cVPBT3FqKG3BPXlH4Hg54KHxnqQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048021',8.1,39715,'fr','Du rififi chez les hommes','Out of prison after a five-year stretch, jewel thief Tony turns down a quick job his friend Jo offers him, until he discovers that his old girlfriend Mado has become the lover of local gangster Pierre Grutter during Tony\'s absence. Expanding a minor smash-and-grab into a full-scale jewel heist, Tony and his crew appear to get away clean, but their actions after the job is completed threaten the lives of everyone involved.','/heVdAFNZUxXVmO6jiJcEHCvI5lK.jpg','1955-04-13',118,'Released','...Means Trouble!','Rififi',934,4.4729,7.8,'PVRiC5ysSLk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3159,_binary '\0','/u7i1XtbOubq0xwRy2Zbgmox6g9W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048028',7.8,51166,'en','East of Eden','In the Salinas Valley in and around World War I, Cal Trask feels he must compete against overwhelming odds with his brother for the love of their father. Cal is frustrated at every turn, from his reaction to the war, how to get ahead in business and in life, and how to relate to his estranged mother.','/xv1MZVIop0SQqwLUymgE5eb2LFl.jpg','1955-04-10',115,'Released','Sometimes you can\'t tell who\'s good and who\'s bad! ...','East of Eden',220,9.4359,7.5,'Yi_wwgJOEwk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3160,_binary '\0','/yoVcU6xy5AzffGC7B4Pz6xZ3R1e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048034',6.5,1686,'en','The End of the Affair','During the 1940s, Maurice Bendrix, a writer recently discharged from the armed service, falls in love with Sarah Miles, whom he interviews for a book. Sarah is married, but she and Maurice eventually give in to their mutual attraction, leading to an affair that lasts several months. Maurice\'s jealousy, along with the bombing of London by the Germans, seemingly leads to the end of their relationship. However, the reasons are later revealed to be more complex.','/mDCUvA3xMcLbPP4iJvTTLjAl6Uz.jpg','1955-02-24',105,'Released','–or just the beginning?','The End of the Affair',78256,2.019,5.8,'Q4ygqw_6GRw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3161,_binary '\0','/lgNnEQCRGVibL8NYW5pKZFwdQLI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048037',7.6,6564,'es','Ensayo de un crimen','A bizarre black comedy about a man whose overwhelming ambition in life is to be a renowned serial killer of women, and will stop at nothing to achieve it - but not everything goes according to plan...','/mqXjXse7cFbQyyA4dGinvZ3krjk.jpg','1955-05-19',89,'Released',NULL,'The Criminal Life of Archibaldo de la Cruz',37628,2.7727,7.314,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3162,_binary '\0','/h3DSOIqy1g5FTQ5InD7W2Y5fvBB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048055',7.1,9661,'en','The Far Country','During the Klondike Gold Rush, a misanthropic cattle driver and his talkative elderly partner run afoul of the law in Alaska and are forced to work for a saloon owner to take her supplies into a newly booming but lawless Canadian town.','/9PzQpapK1VgueIKWfecEFUqVvOy.jpg','1954-02-12',97,'Released','RENEE...the innocent...and the untamed...BEN...the gambler...and the loser...GANNON...the law...and the noose...RUBE...the friendless...and the afraid.','The Far Country',18721,3.675,6.9,'gHNo7dRDomw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3163,_binary '\0','/kfl58HvTr5poVFAYoMxfE8il0kr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048056',6.1,1523,'en','The Far Horizons','Virginia, 1803. After the United States of America acquires the inmense Louisiana territory from France, a great expedition, led by William Lewis and Meriwether Clark, is sent to survey the new lands and go where no white man has gone before.','/iK2oj0p0CFFV4rvozXZlLaAy5sP.jpg','1955-07-04',108,'Released',NULL,'The Far Horizons',94405,2.5722,6.3,'LvKaUwSXMKg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3164,_binary '\0','/8ELE1ArSmnW2ch2np0rPSdXJVmk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048064',6.4,1711,'en','Female on the Beach','Lynn Markham moves into her late husband\'s beach house the morning after former tenant Eloise Crandall fell from the cliff. To her annoyance, Lynn finds both her real estate agent and Drummond Hall, her beachcomber neighbor, making themselves quite at home. Lynn soon has no doubts of what her scheming neighbors are up to, but she finds Drummond\'s physical charms hard to resist. And she still doesn\'t know what really happened to Eloise.','/e3GXlX7ECWHFqiBQI5n3UUEc8Hl.jpg','1955-08-19',97,'Released','She was TOO HUNGRY FOR LOVE... to care where she found it!','Female on the Beach',65014,2.4181,5.7,'DzYjryvcujA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3165,_binary '\0','/aZY2lxtSzAb4Hr5QajjGTOZus17.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048077',5.9,2329,'en','5 Against the House','Former war-time Army buddies now students in college decide to rip off a Reno casino.','/8klUn5eJqWl2cm2gKYnrRpJtpRJ.jpg','1955-06-10',84,'Released','Sizzling!','5 Against the House',37911,2.389,5.9,'SI2wv99lYhg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3166,_binary '\0','/in7cgT30mjG10Fnt18QleQhMZtW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048087',7,2497,'en','Footsteps in the Fog','A Victorian-era murder mystery about a parlour maid who discovers that her employer may have killed his first wife.','/m8Uu7rjm7fdUh0AUzLFTyZcyLpH.jpg','1955-09-14',90,'Released','CLOSE ENOUGH TO KISS...OR KILL!','Footsteps in the Fog',44902,2.6,7,'kceqv4Yu1sU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3167,_binary '\0','/DoSgcJiIn936eYmhubc4lYWjX8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048119',6.4,1323,'en','The Girl in the Red Velvet Swing','Broadway showgirl Evelyn Nesbit is the object of affection of two men: playboy architect Stanford White and the wealthy but unstable Harry Thaw. Nesbit marries Thaw, but White’s continued pursuit puts him in the path of Thaw’s volatile temper. A fictionalized account of true events that occurred at the turn of the 20th century.','/mv1ia76cFLSNI7Ma9QZpnRrW3RE.jpg','1955-10-01',109,'Released','THE RISE - THE FALL of the most beautiful Floradora chorine from penniless model to mistress of $40,000,000','The Girl in the Red Velvet Swing',82203,2.1384,6.1,'ARhXJas59YQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3168,_binary '\0','/7ZG60Jom2wOPGJCw6pIgNeeHNfq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048124',6.4,1779,'en','The Glass Slipper','In a musical retelling of the Cinderella tale, a mistreated scullery maid escapes the oppression of her stepfamily to finding love with a prince.','/fEDHZKUKB5m28tDYKJ8V83F3QDr.jpg','1955-03-24',93,'Released','A screenful of romance, music, spectacular in radiant COLOR','The Glass Slipper',139799,1.8413,6.2,'jCS_lJt7VUw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3169,_binary '\0','/xJgVSEl4HnRl4UscJRQn9Rfubet.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048127',5.7,10026,'ja','ゴジラの逆襲','Two fishing scout pilots make a horrifying discovery when they encounter a second Godzilla alongside a new monster named Anguirus. Without the weapon that killed the original, authorities attempt to lure Godzilla away from the mainland. But Anguirus soon arrives and the two monsters make their way towards Osaka as Japan braces for tragedy.','/bBYdh9tDCyLaArBOzE38QCA7C3y.jpg','1955-04-24',82,'Released','A tremendous, astonishing story that rages across the nation of Japan!','Godzilla Raids Again',1679,3.5422,6,'afODInhsCOQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3170,_binary '\0','/oYorUXxwMTC7VSP0V9b2XvPrwyu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048130',7,1543,'en','Good Morning, Miss Dove','Miss Dove is a prim New England school teacher who is treasured by her students in the small town of Liberty Hill. When she falls ill, a kindly doctor, who is a former student of Miss Dove\'s, comes to her aid. As many of her pupils, present and past, come to see her in the hospital, they reveal how Miss Dove has greatly impacted their lives over the years. These visitors include a police officer, a playwright, a banker, a convict, and an unmarried mother.','/kd4pzpDplw41t92n56rh9blR78b.jpg','1955-11-23',107,'Released','A picture of Everybody for Everybody!','Good Morning, Miss Dove',4809,2.5824,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3171,_binary '\0','/ysJtOM5EmjaCaU0o2ksUrzYYNYY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048133',6.7,1259,'fr','Les Grandes Manœuvres','Armand, a boastful womaniser, makes a bet that he can seduce any girl he wants. He soon crosses paths with a beautiful Parisian divorcee, who is nothing like anyone he has ever met before.','/bNJ3417OQ0Mt8rQ00Hd0BdsMrhk.jpg','1955-10-26',106,'Released',NULL,'The Grand Manoeuvre',66436,1.9213,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3172,_binary '\0','/wKCVht8Vivzub6i6blSK8SIuBvL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048140',7.1,21094,'en','Guys and Dolls','In New York, a gambler is challenged to take a Salvation Army missionary to Havana, and unexpectedly they fall for each other. And the bet has a hidden motive ... classic song and dance ensues!','/mrSM6laJJLBVdMdWfeNRa1innnk.jpg','1955-12-23',149,'Released','It\'s a living breathing doll of a musical!','Guys and Dolls',4825,4.2726,6.568,'ykzP_64l-xk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3173,_binary '\0','/tkhPGA4KTy5njQwglP6t7ytp00p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048182',6.8,4525,'en','House of Bamboo','Eddie Kenner is given a special assignment by the Army to get the inside story on Sandy Dawson, a former GI who has formed a gang of fellow servicemen and Japanese locals.','/7LxWQZA0PCSJ0jGcZ7KYq1uFupL.jpg','1955-07-01',102,'Released','Tokyo Post-War Underworld!','House of Bamboo',20942,2.7529,6.2,'YjJdpTASyQk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3174,_binary '\0','/7wWWHHpzW0nzBfiibXsFuIBej8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048190',6.4,1867,'en','I Died a Thousand Times','After aging criminal Roy Earle is released from prison he decides to pull one last heist before retiring — by robbing a resort hotel.','/5xaY8vWsRyDE38wY7u85Z0Ntby3.jpg','1955-11-09',109,'Released','The Story Behind The Terrifying 60-Day Hunt For Desperado \'Mad-Dog\' Earle!','I Died a Thousand Times',28490,2.4355,6.2,'dZiT7cqZ384','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3175,_binary '\0','/jsoJNVwZ9tXxEdtGoJstzJAJ4xH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048191',7.2,2797,'en','I\'ll Cry Tomorrow','Deprived of a normal childhood by her ambitious mother, Lillian Roth becomes a star of Broadway and Hollywood before she is twenty. Shortly before her marriage to her childhood sweetheart, David Tredman, he dies and Lillian takes her first drink of many down the road of becoming an alcoholic.','/8UfnjpxvNa5nbckfE9EWdc38VRg.jpg','1955-12-25',117,'Released','The frank, revealing story of Lillian Roth\'s life! Best-seller now a film sensation.','I\'ll Cry Tomorrow',28575,2.1901,6.2,'deWVCVIjrTw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3176,_binary '\0','/js2aIEKvejynLyrZQKvZyTo88SS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048198',7.3,6244,'ja','生きものの記録','An aging foundry patriarch, gripped by terror of nuclear annihilation, tries to uproot his family to Brazil. When they petition to have him declared incompetent, a family-court counselor witnesses his obsession slide into ruin—and asks whether ignoring the atomic threat is any saner.','/lStaAPLPkPc5NkeHzZoi191efOy.jpg','1955-11-22',103,'Released',NULL,'I Live in Fear',21490,2.5703,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3177,_binary '\0','/xl7alqShJuYsIpDz8JYLuvcR2FZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048199',7,2810,'en','Illegal','A hugely successful DA goes into private practice after sending a man to the chair -- only to find out later he was innocent. Now the drunken attorney only seems to represent criminals and low lifes.','/z79LbDYC0JOufqtAueieYKAAw39.jpg','1955-10-09',88,'Released','He was a guy who marked 100 men for death - until a blonde called \'Angel\' O\'Hara marked him for life!','Illegal',47739,1.4472,6.5,'7i3wjONCRGI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3178,_binary '\0','/id4E1PUkyVOzyo8YdLoDjmsVEnJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048204',6.3,3206,'en','The Indian Fighter','A scout leading a wagon train through hostile Indian country gets involved with a Sioux chief\'s daughter.','/reWmkD0D2QGYivWZ5Lv9pVC75CS.jpg','1955-12-21',88,'Released','Only one man has the power to stop a war.','The Indian Fighter',57258,2.9724,6.3,'3qHE1_W8qKE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3179,_binary '\0','/xuSKrBLrgGxRBfyhj4u0mptnnNe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048210',6.7,1381,'en','Interrupted Melody','Interrupted Melody is the inspirational filmed biography of world-renowned Australian soprano Marjorie Lawrence. She’s a foremost Wagnerian, equal to the vocal and physical demands of the composer’s oeuvre. And she’s a beacon of triumph to anyone who fights back when personal tragedy strikes.','/fD8XlQnGGmtbIVr5mWDkVokKNAF.jpg','1955-05-05',106,'Released','The greatest musical drama since \"The Great Caruso.\"','Interrupted Melody',43318,1.5089,5.8,'Wuz2zFKZ6TI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3180,_binary '\0','/shmjuV9A0tQL9wIHCYGS9drpPaj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048215',5.9,7271,'en','It Came from Beneath the Sea','A giant octopus, whose feeding habits have been affected by radiation from H-Bomb tests, rises from the Mindanao Deep to terrorize the California Coast.','/5Uhq7FinrZIpvoz8OUUL6yziHtO.jpg','1955-05-02',79,'Released','IT CRUSHES! KILLS! DESTROYS!','It Came from Beneath the Sea',29959,2.8527,5.661,'MXAR5qSDgtE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3181,_binary '\0','/q7ejr4FvNXHPW5z0hGeguyJwmMF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048216',7,4406,'en','It\'s Always Fair Weather','Three World War II buddies promise to meet at a specified place and time 10 years after the war. They keep their word only to discover how far apart they\'ve grown. But the reunion sparks memories of youthful dreams that haven\'t been fulfilled -- and slowly, the three men reevaluate their lives and try to find a way to renew their friendship.','/blcNXbPENULD0JdUcRtOdALFIHi.jpg','1955-08-30',102,'Released','MGM\'s Gigantic and Joyous Musical','It\'s Always Fair Weather',17640,2.7151,7,'g97uFgJHaiY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3182,_binary '\0','/jdG9B3f1pBfGfjEHyMUJ48dAHvU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048233',7.1,5037,'en','Jubal','Jubal Troop is a cowboy who is found in a weakened condition, without a horse. He is given shelter at Shep Horgan\'s large ranch, where he quickly makes an enemy in foreman Pinky, a cattleman who accuses Jubal of carrying the smell of sheep.','/kmxuxREFLJfmeJhv9CnoOZpKS7D.jpg','1956-02-25',100,'Released','THE SOMETIMES VIOLENT STORY OF A DRIFTIN\' COWHAND!','Jubal',43260,2.7333,6.9,'a3cQ38DsxS4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3183,_binary '\0','/zZlm2z1UAefEqlcGMv1UsVPS6SQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048248',6.2,3495,'en','The Kentuckian','A frontiersman and his son fight to build a new home in Texas.','/oTGOSHS02FzrncZYP8NBWbUIKAU.jpg','1955-07-22',104,'Released','Hunter...Frontiersman...Adventurer!','The Kentuckian',66035,2.3418,5.8,'r3imvkv58Eo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3184,_binary '\0','/AlS4tXsiLzQVWCzxcyrTwoykVOe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048250',6.4,1322,'en','A Kid for Two Farthings','Joe is a young boy who lives with his mother, Joanna, in working-class London. The two reside above the tailor shop of Mr. Kandinsky, who likes to tell Joe stories. When Kandinsky informs Joe that a unicorn can grant wishes, the hopeful lad ends up buying a baby goat with one tiny horn, believing it to be a real unicorn. Undaunted by his rough surroundings, Joe sets about to prove that wishes can come true.','/hXwPTwhwkRtqQQbjIcqo7BvGDto.jpg','1955-08-15',96,'Released',NULL,'A Kid for Two Farthings',151431,1.9838,6.629,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3185,_binary '\0','/7ZbNuSp186oxSjdtz5npRLLjVSb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048254',6.5,28621,'en','Killer\'s Kiss','Davey Gordon, a New York City boxer at the end of his career, falls for dancer Gloria Price. However, their budding relationship is interrupted by Gloria\'s violent boss, Vincent Rapallo, who has eyes for Gloria. The two decide to skip town, but before they can, Vincent and his thugs abduct Gloria, and Davey is forced to search for her among the most squalid corners of the city, with his enemy hiding in the shadows.','/rLbad0lscycS4R3qTSrKguZ0Zz5.jpg','1955-10-01',68,'Released','Her Soft Mouth Was The Road To Sin-Smeared Violence!','Killer\'s Kiss',10056,4.0443,6.3,'KP-OWTiGTn4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3186,_binary '\0','/zVjECOijR9dnP14EnspPATacRGZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048256',2.3,1839,'en','King Dinosaur','In 1960, four American scientists travel to a planet that has just entered Earth\'s solar system to see if it\'s able to support an Earth colony. They find an oxygen atmosphere, a lush earth-like forest, and earth-like animals living around a potable fresh-water lake.','/pMNXiEj9pfzlgwsMLxHByfvsvzJ.jpg','1955-07-17',63,'Released','SEE...A prehistoric world of fantastic adventure come to life!','King Dinosaur',28590,1.0062,2.2,'FQBjnBUIYC0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3187,_binary '\0','/UkiaWUABkxr51jUpp35MvLb8v4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048260',6.3,1858,'en','Kismet','A silver-tongued poet and self-proclaimed \"King of the Beggars\" searches old Baghdad for a rich bachelor to marry his dreamy daughter, Marsinah. Along the way, he poses as the renowned sorcerer Hajj and gets in and out of scrapes with an elderly thief, a dim-witted wazir, and his wife. Meanwhile, his daughter develops feelings for a handsome caliph.','/pqFy36jp7aDXA6EIzGpz61r7tDL.jpg','1955-10-08',113,'Released','ECSTACY of Song Spectacle and Love!','Kismet',4822,1.8279,5.605,'Lo5natt3ia0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3188,_binary '\0','/znL0K0hPJndT7IAddNWBfAEYSRC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048261',7.5,23965,'en','Kiss Me Deadly','One evening, Hammer gives a ride to Christina, an attractive hitchhiker on a lonely country road, who has escaped from the nearby lunatic asylum. Thugs waylay them and force his car to crash. When Hammer returns to semi-consciousness, he hears Christina being tortured until she dies. Hammer, both for vengeance and in hopes that \"something big\" is behind it all, decides to pursue the case.','/z7me91nrpWLHY1mZOB2v20cK0zY.jpg','1955-04-28',106,'Released','Blood red kisses! White hot thrills! Mickey Spillane’s latest H-bomb!','Kiss Me Deadly',18030,4.2874,7.221,'ss4AF91KOFw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3189,_binary '\0','/rtlzBfvNiae9YODdXHAbJpZQE1C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048272',7,3868,'sv','Kvinnodröm','Two women—a fashion executive and her young model—experience parallel romantic disappointments during a trip to Gothenburg, exposing generational differences in desire, illusion, and emotional endurance. A transitional work in Ingmar Bergman’s mid-1950s cinema.','/whdg2Oxdp8mJdiO7sIUQtwtMlnV.jpg','1955-08-22',88,'Released',NULL,'Dreams',97211,1.695,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3190,_binary '\0','/tm2ZIN0hG6mw5TnTN49a50X3n4u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048275',7.7,1959,'hu','Körhinta','In a rural scenery in the throes of difficult changes lives humble but promising young farmer girl Mari Pataki. Her father forbids her from seeing the man she loves. The father, above all preoccupied by work on the fields and prospective wealth, decides to give his daughter in marriage to his older business partner. \'Land marries land\', he says, a phrase which seems to be the unyielding rule of the Hungarian peasantry. But the younger lover is ready to confront any challenge to keep Mari\'s love.','/1bFnodDPLQvrfIdyjXAFkAaPvuQ.jpg','1956-02-02',92,'Released',NULL,'Merry-Go-Round',131586,1.6937,7.5,'UaqvRvm6F90','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3191,_binary '\0','/yGgEg4yimYQJLZrZg3Qhogp2raQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048280',7.3,163940,'en','Lady and the Tramp','Lady, a golden cocker spaniel, meets up with a mongrel dog who calls himself the Tramp. He is obviously from the wrong side of town, but happenings at Lady\'s home make her decide to travel with him for a while.','/340NcWz9SQXWQyf4oicMxjbrLOb.jpg','1955-06-22',76,'Released','She\'s from the leash and license set... he\'s footloose and collar free!','Lady and the Tramp',10340,19.1737,7.1,'SAoLpLXvGN0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3192,_binary '\0','/bAnSOcJgNmV9aaJmFkTmkngCF3J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048281',7.6,34515,'en','The Ladykillers','Five oddball criminals planning a bank robbery rent rooms on a cul-de-sac from an octogenarian widow under the pretext that they are classical musicians.','/9LJ6ZV59Q92LAJAbmb7xm9dUBGU.jpg','1955-12-08',91,'Released',NULL,'The Ladykillers',5506,3.8052,7.3,'TdJGho9p-wA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3193,_binary '\0','/ciQYkgKcsU3rqUL17Evid8ppN6q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048283',6.6,5426,'en','Land of the Pharaohs','A captured architect designs an ingenious plan to ensure the impregnability of the tomb of a self-absorbed Pharaoh, obsessed with the security of his next life.','/bpSzz9kkxb95vMgJiGyWe3nV99I.jpg','1955-07-24',105,'Released','HER BLOOD STAINED EVERY STONE OF THE PYRAMID','Land of the Pharaohs',42564,3.5592,6.5,'7Vjv69Qac2w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3194,_binary '\0','/56ct1H6rxQrohJ0Ouz3Orrt8wrM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048289',6.4,1749,'en','A Lawless Street','A Marshal must face unpleasant facts about his past when he attempts to run a criminal gang out of town.','/1fatP9UP4MqTjOh0TXrrUJ58zg3.jpg','1955-11-15',78,'Released','They were all running out at the same time ... his luck ... his bullets ... his woman !','A Lawless Street',43314,2.4928,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3195,_binary '\0','/8Hdh4bzcQv3ujRfTvLiWrthStYY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048291',6.4,3131,'en','The Left Hand of God','A man in priestly robes, seemingly the long-awaited Father O\'Shea, arrives at a little-frequented Catholic mission in 1947 China. Though the man seems curiously uncomfortable with his priestly duties, his tough tactics prove very successful in the Seven Villages, as around them China disintegrates in civil war and revolution. But he has a secret, and his friendship with mission nurse Anne (an attractive war widow) seems to be taking on an unpriestly tone.','/cyWW2SCaCvBJfSW7gPvhy4fVtDV.jpg','1955-09-02',87,'Released','THE STRANGEST COVENANT BETWEEN GOD AND MAN EVER MADE!','The Left Hand of God',63618,2.5651,6.333,'Egq_2pLweec','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3196,_binary '\0','/d0v44yJkq95FZZFCVlzaHKwcZvU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048308',7.2,6737,'fr','Lola Montès','Lola Montes, previously a great adventuress, is reduced to being the attraction of a circus after having been the lover of various important men.','/ycePcddfSvqaalyPxMvFYT5D8wV.jpg','1955-12-23',116,'Released','She lived too intensely and far too well!','Lola Montès',35987,3.8783,6.901,'KuLb53N-XCY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3197,_binary '\0','/hmgNEzFP5qtC9rdVvCIYzaYpanS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048310',6.5,1323,'en','The Lone Ranger','The territorial governor asks the Lone Ranger to investigate mysterious raids on settlers by Indians who ride with saddles. Wealthy rancher Reese Kilgore wants to mine silver on Spirit Mountain which is sacred to the Indians.','/7oRRRoCMDRQ3d23eAzEOcme58iZ.jpg','1956-02-25',86,'Released','The Lone Ranger thunders to the motion picture screen!','The Lone Ranger',108266,3.4748,6.2,'mjQPxtMv3vY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3198,_binary '\0','/y4gPPvaUGvLigYgFrjpU36OL5Nb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048312',7.2,3744,'en','The Long Gray Line','The life story of a salt-of-the-earth Irish immigrant, who becomes an Army Noncommissioned Officer and spends his 50 year career at the United States Military Academy at West Point. This includes his job-related experiences as well as his family life and the relationships he develops with young cadets with whom he befriends. Based on the life of a real person.','/mgkcu0pM9GsH0wdAxil2YV8eYif.jpg','1955-01-04',138,'Released','Warms Your Heart! STIRS YOUR BLOOD! and fires your imagination!','The Long Gray Line',61934,2.7536,7,'UJ04UMWvwpA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3199,_binary '\0','/nOMWT3wKcaVD6aB6Hxn1RveIVln.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048316',6.4,5934,'en','Love Is a Many-Splendored Thing','A widowed doctor of both Chinese and European descent falls in love with a married American correspondent in Hong Kong during China\'s Communist revolution.','/a9aqlitzVeo5fq6UX5Ekl5kopco.jpg','1955-08-18',102,'Released','The price they pay when they come out of their secret garden and face the world in modern-day Hong Kong - makes this one of the screen\'s unforgettable experiences!','Love Is a Many-Splendored Thing',53879,3.0356,6.1,'6ADVQo9Q020','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3200,_binary '\0','/l4hnzWUc7Xmx4H9A4cYrBaoUcN1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048317',7.1,5313,'en','Love Me or Leave Me','A fictionalized account of the career of jazz singer Ruth Etting and her tempestuous marriage to gangster Marty Snyder, who helped propel her to stardom.','/rIT21pBwDQxrKyhmUiwoZCs1IFS.jpg','1955-05-26',122,'Released','You\'ll Love it!...The Big Lavish Musical of the Roaring Twenties!','Love Me or Leave Me',40633,2.9174,6.9,'sqZelp1SDsA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3201,_binary '\0','/6FxarjMQyJfx6I0NmpqbWtfCuRf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048336',6.5,1504,'en','A Man Alone','A gunfighter, stranded in the desert, comes across the aftermath of a stage robbery, in which all the passengers were killed. He takes one of the horses to ride to town to report the massacre, but finds himself accused of it. He also finds himself accused of the murder of the local banker, and winds up hiding in the basement of a house where the local sheriff, who is very sick, lives with his daughter.','/mbTxHtL23Bf6yKx8VOWiFUS0MJp.jpg','1955-10-17',96,'Released','Somewhere in the DARK a Bullet Drilled Home !','A Man Alone',43315,2.2622,5.8,'SR0KEMD-6G0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3202,_binary '\0','/gdGdezaQHNkk8p10dPkMauIznbJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048337',7.2,1234,'en','A Man Called Peter','Based on the true story of a young Scottish lad, Peter Marshall, who dreams of only going to sea but finds out there is a different future for him when he receives a \"calling\" from God to be a minister. He leaves Scotland and goes to America where after a few small congregations he lands the position of pastor of the Church of the Presidents in Washington, D.C. and eventually he becomes Chaplain of the U.S. Senate.','/xYVloXNC5oSatw7qfrdDy5NgRe.jpg','1955-03-31',119,'Released','The True Story of How One Man\'s Faith Uplifted a Nation','A Man Called Peter',45136,1.7544,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3203,_binary '\0','/l0uMmHU7LNHLbXneUwLjD8GgHFS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048339',6.7,2678,'en','Man with the Gun','A stranger comes to town looking for his estranged wife. He finds her running the local girls. He also finds a town and sheriff afraid of their own shadow, scared of a landowner they never see who rules through his rowdy sidekicks. The stranger is a town tamer by trade, and he accepts a $500 commission to sort things out.','/4QTV9kkliG5wrsHj0x6fNYsaQ34.jpg','1955-10-06',83,'Released','A man who lived and breathed violence!','Man with the Gun',26758,2.7174,6.1,'vbpmmjjfd8E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3204,_binary '\0','/12HCtbXXrt2vXBof3zpvIGOM8Og.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048340',6.8,4434,'en','Man Without a Star','A wandering cowboy gets caught up in a range war.','/oiLRunFsrftkOoy7hhAZM727gIv.jpg','1955-03-24',89,'Released','A love-bargain is like barbed-wire...fight it and you\'ll get hurt!','Man Without a Star',43319,3.4618,6.448,'eosDtr0iLA0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3205,_binary '\0','/f2AknGbvyhFdeZUDcbq3ZqguQZT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048342',7.3,13361,'en','The Man from Laramie','Will Lockhart arrives in Coronado, an isolated town in New Mexico, in search of someone who sells rifles to the Apache tribe, finding himself unwillingly drawn into the convoluted life of a local ranching family whose members seem to have a lot to hide.','/aKMZoZpN0FobSIDAlj5Ixv0kDeT.jpg','1955-08-19',103,'Released','The man you\'ll never forget!','The Man from Laramie',18264,4.3745,7.149,'aQXZ8LYrmT4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3206,_binary '\0','/3biBcohe172vLq243lFKreiEOwA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048347',7.3,13562,'en','The Man with the Golden Arm','When illegal card dealer and recovering heroin addict Frankie Machine gets out of prison, he decides to straighten up. Armed with nothing but an old drum set, Frankie tries to get honest work as a drummer. But when his former employer and his old drug dealer re-enter his life, Frankie finds it hard to stay clean and eventually finds himself succumbing to his old habits.','/3TUOhZhM5GCYIbxwFO3chpZ0DHx.jpg','1955-12-26',119,'Released','An \'untouchable\' theme… an unusual motion picture!','The Man with the Golden Arm',541,4.9424,7.125,'vUUbNdnwgaE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3207,_binary '\0','/jdwo6FBKaFgiYaCfeNPPcgEJK5y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048350',6.2,1517,'en','Many Rivers to Cross','Robert Taylor and Eleanor Parker star as a Kentucky backwoodsman and the woman who will NOT let anything interfere with her plans to marry him in this humorous romantic adventure through the American Frontier of 1798.','/a8jO7mPTai88iAOdAQNG1r6Ekq4.jpg','1955-02-04',95,'Released','KENTUCKY ADVENTURE in CINEMASCOPE','Many Rivers to Cross',81512,2.6775,6.5,'FJczYVKCNtE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3208,_binary '\0','/zhZtaNcjtc6VgV8SC4VlokiaeNt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048356',7.6,31023,'en','Marty','Marty, a butcher who lives in the Bronx with his mother, is unmarried at 34. Good-natured but socially awkward, he faces constant badgering from family and friends to get married but has reluctantly resigned himself to bachelorhood. He then meets Clara, an unattractive school teacher. Realising their emotional connection, Marty promises to call, but family and friends try to convince him not to.','/8tnGO5VoAQII4DbE3hozWKhV4BY.jpg','1955-04-11',90,'Released','It\'s the love story of an unsung hero!','Marty',15919,3.7021,7.5,'nchN0nEsXnA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3209,_binary '\0','/tebNVfijCX5Wtr185aF219DHAyq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048362',7.6,1260,'ru','Максим Перепелица','Maksim Perepelitsa is a cheerful, mischievous and resourceful young man from a Ukrainian village. He loves to make up stories and invent practical jokes. When he is drafted into the Russian Army, he doesn\'t stop his antics.','/9KWF3RSZZzWHVmygXTKLZcuoRf1.jpg','1955-12-12',94,'Released',NULL,'Maksim Perepelitsa',174720,1.0268,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3210,_binary '\0','/tWzWYnlvrUFwcEeRNKbsXPpjiRS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048380',7.6,19842,'en','Mister Roberts','Mr. Roberts is a Navy officer who\'s yearning for battle but is stuck in the backwaters of World War II on a non-commissioned ship run by the bullying Captain Morton.','/5B8Gc1N2S3CDWHBzm0VxaMPTyzJ.jpg','1955-07-10',123,'Released','All The Uproarious Fun Of the Smash Broadway Play!','Mister Roberts',37853,3.8331,7,'xGEGZjkC-ZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3211,_binary '\0','/yrvTunVj8GUrdYSDSQasAWr7qLM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048387',6.6,4397,'en','Moonfleet','Set in the eighteenth century, Moonfleet is about John Mohune, a young orphan who is sent to the Dorset village of Moonfleet to stay with an old friend of his mother\'s, Jeremy Fox. Fox is a morally ambiguous character, an elegant gentleman involved with smugglers and pirates.','/dkbpCz2IqeQDg4eomCkezCH99Ff.jpg','1955-06-24',87,'Released','Wild and wonderful as the thrill-packed novel that inspired it !','Moonfleet',29967,2.1376,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3212,_binary '\0','/dSBvYxsJnfIVqpkVu1xDSVSsMvv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048393',7.1,10212,'en','Mr. Arkadin','Claiming that he doesn\'t know his own past, a rich man enlists an ex-con with an odd bit of detective work. Gregory Arkadin says he can\'t remember anything before the late 1920s, and convict Guy Van Stratten is happy to take the job of exploring his new acquaintance\'s life story. Guy\'s research turns up stunning details about his employer\'s past, and as his work seems linked to untimely deaths, the mystery surrounding Mr. Arkadin deepens.','/hoBfh3jmA3XDDx9tGgMwdGd37GE.jpg','1955-08-09',107,'Released','Discovering the past can be murder...','Mr. Arkadin',44026,3.0462,6.8,'qhlOflIHWHU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3213,_binary '\0','/5uWYbklhgBtr9P90IvhY8g4BgR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048394',7.7,4957,'es','Muerte de un ciclista','A couple having an affair strike a bicyclist with their car and do not offer aid out of fear of their relationship being exposed.','/trjTovQqGyImjieaQPBEtf5jHLF.jpg','1955-09-07',88,'Released','Death on the road.','Death of a Cyclist',72083,1.8357,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3214,_binary '\0','/k24GvBqWsJmz1JXE8OmJM9LrBGp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048401',6.8,2394,'en','My Sister Eileen','Ruth and her beautiful sister Eileen come to New York\'s Greenwich Village looking for \"fame, fortune and a \'For Rent\' sign on Barrow Street\". They find an apartment, but fame and fortune are a lot more elusive. Ruth gets the attention of playboy publisher Bob Baker when she submits a story about Eileen. She tries to keep his attention by convincing him that she and the gorgeous, man-getting Eileen are one and the same person.','/ihJqUHuY9ypnWjXfzrPEAIYvK0T.jpg','1955-09-22',108,'Released','That Joyous New Musical !','My Sister Eileen',60966,2.6963,6.6,'bRdKeTeCJcs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3215,_binary '\0','/ckBq7AwE9krBrI5LrZpEsLiRTXM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048412',6.5,1590,'en','The Naked Street','To make an honest woman of his pregnant sister, Rosalie, callous New York mobster Phil Regal intimidates witnesses and bribes a store clerk to get Rosalie’s condemned boyfriend, Nicky Bradna, out of prison. But Regal’s meddling deeds soon backfire.','/bL0AZU3NmxPN8XYjH95CD4ywnXN.jpg','1955-08-01',84,'Released','They live on the main drag of Brooklyn\'s jungle !','The Naked Street',122252,2.2734,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3216,_binary '\0','/oGQrHznIFLXDVCnUSrIaccXqAV2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048421',7.1,1728,'en','New York Confidential','Story follows the rise and subsequent fall of the notorious head of a New York crime family, who decides to testify against his pals in order to avoid being killed by his fellow cohorts.','/a8Rs5DVWsX37I1wbg8ZrsmeikCs.jpg','1955-02-15',87,'Released','When these guns go off they set off the biggest screen explosion about the violence-and-vice merchants ever made public!','New York Confidential',35958,1.6448,6,'NDa9olEqA5E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3217,_binary '\0','/vZZmtfDI7W6ct11ZPZtZaZ5GtA8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048423',6.3,1242,'en','The Night Holds Terror','A group of escaped convicts holds a household prisoner as the police close in.','/6sIK8wFzkFyrQWOYJMY1LikTr84.jpg','1955-07-13',86,'Released','Three young, empty-eyed killers, without mercy or morals, turn a private home into a house of horror!','The Night Holds Terror',43608,1.7466,5.5,'SEGuppXJviI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3218,_binary '\0','/7cVEnb4Pth3STa7YfVOk9RtzDLB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048424',7.9,109490,'en','The Night of the Hunter','In Depression-era West Virginia, a serial-killing preacher hunts two young children who know the whereabouts of a stash of money.','/rBka0nFWiHxabHRLr0KfIA8Yiaq.jpg','1955-07-26',93,'Released','It’s a hard world for little things.','The Night of the Hunter',3112,8.4928,7.9,'GAxs6tChiKo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3219,_binary '\0','/evcbPrWyOL740rq05vQLvjZUbhR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048432',6.7,3122,'en','Not as a Stranger','Lucas Marsh, an intern bent upon becoming a first-class doctor, not merely a successful one. He courts and marries the warm-hearted Kristina, not out of love but because she is highly knowledgeable in the skills of the operating room and because she has frugally put aside her savings through the years. She will be, as he shrewdly knows, a supportive wife in every way. She helps make him the success he wants to be and cheerfully moves with him to the small town in which he starts his practice. But as much as he tries to be a good husband to the undemanding Kristina, Marsh easily falls into the arms of a local siren and the patience of the long-sorrowing Kristina wears thin.','/gN054EboHPbRIjVDXUrbcaQDleU.jpg','1955-07-01',135,'Released','Stands alone! First as a book... Now as a motion picture!','Not as a Stranger',76117,2.5306,6.2,'-jGI2Vh9odM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3220,_binary '\0','/scjRKib0bVVQEZv1lCutko4tlY4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048445',7,15966,'en','Oklahoma!','There\'s a box social coming up, and Curly asks Laurey if she\'ll be his date. Trouble is, Laurey thinks he\'s waited too long, and in a fit of pique accepts an offer from the boorish ranch hand Jud instead. Meanwhile, Laurey\'s friend Ado Annie is also torn between two men: cowboy Will and foreign peddler Ali Hakim. Both women struggle to know their own hearts before it\'s too late.','/ztqT5GmJVI2o8vShGWRVVqykQqA.jpg','1955-10-10',148,'Released','It\'s Here!','Oklahoma!',13936,3.938,6.6,'w-vFeZBWiDE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3221,_binary '\0','/62pTb3zkfE2860lIqQFlxQ5tUEL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048452',8.2,19170,'da','Ordet','The three sons of devout Danish farmer Morten have widely disparate religious beliefs. Youngest son Anders shares his father\'s religion, but eldest son Mikkel has lost his faith, while middle child Johannes has become delusional and proclaims that he is Jesus Christ himself. When Mikkel\'s wife, Inger goes into a difficult childbirth, everyone\'s beliefs are put to the test.','/c9Oef9uQEuadZlnvv8hphRmTIgx.jpg','1955-01-09',125,'Released','A Legend for Today','Ordet',48035,3.9027,7.9,'-uQEPjRog84','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3222,_binary '\0','/wadoNHCMPElgYuOqLxqDQqXpTMx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048473',8.2,42286,'bn','পথের পাঁচালী','Impoverished priest Harihar Ray, dreaming of a better life for himself and his family, leaves his rural Bengal village in search of work. Alone, his wife, Sarbojaya, looks after her rebellious daughter, Durga, and her young son, Apu, as well as Harihar\'s elderly aunt Indir. The children enjoy the small pleasures of their difficult life, while their parents suffer the daily indignities heaped upon them.','/frZj5djlU9hFEjMcL21RJZVuG5O.jpg','1955-08-26',125,'Released',NULL,'Pather Panchali',5801,3.6441,7.802,'mgv68E_o6VM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3223,_binary '\0','/fEmkEFL8X8vn5F2jP56OyOpJ158.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048475',6.8,1382,'it','Peccato che sia una canaglia','When young and attractive Lina Stroppiani, a thief like the rest of her family, tries to steal the taxi of Paolo, together with two accomplices, she can\'t possibly know that this will have far reaching consequences.','/4uIkVdz0i9SJUfa58LCLJEc783l.jpg','1954-12-28',91,'Released',NULL,'Too Bad She\'s Bad',63857,2.5788,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3224,_binary '\0','/d2DYeaGvum9WsCN15itf84zndig.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048484',6.3,1685,'en','Pete Kelly\'s Blues','In 1927, a Kansas City, Missouri cornet player and his band perform nightly at a seedy speakeasy until a racketeer tries to extort them in exchange for protection.','/sGlHz9Isou2Y4scIPvt3MWnEzcs.jpg','1955-07-31',95,'Released','A jazz-man of the wide-open \'20s - caught in the crossfire of its blazing .38s!','Pete Kelly\'s Blues',43321,2.0343,6.29,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3225,_binary '\0','/AgpNe0X1qluiYKC4t6IYlAsAdGZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048488',7.2,3706,'en','The Phenix City Story','A crime-busting lawyer and his initially reluctant attorney father take on the forces that run gambling and prostitution in their small Southern town.','/9VB4tGVtym2qXodfxQsCAJBKkSO.jpg','1955-07-19',100,'Released','ALABAMA\'S CITY OF SIN AND SHAME!','The Phenix City Story',35956,2.4541,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3226,_binary '\0','/pI4l6pRclnUWUSE1YGbLghvymCc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048491',7,10795,'en','Picnic','Labor Day in a small Kansas farm town. Hal, a burly and resolute drifter, jumps off a dusty freight train car with the purpose of visiting Alan, a former college classmate and son of the richest man in town.','/5IMiu8jFEkQ7xzoiXIyeatGz65o.jpg','1955-11-18',114,'Released','Unsurpassed! Unforgettable!','Picnic',39940,3.2415,6.4,'bhBzakdSfeU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3227,_binary '\0','/qCm7JsnryHF0SCXTIvBB7k7oh5m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048499',7,4986,'fr','La Pointe courte','A penetrating study of a marriage on the rocks, set against the backdrop of a small Mediterranean fishing village. Both a stylized depiction of the complicated relationship between a married couple and a documentary-like look at the daily struggles of the inhabitants of Sète in the South of France.','/jPT3tkTu9U7oXkLTSpkPBAr5dwO.jpg','1956-01-04',80,'Released',NULL,'La Pointe Courte',54436,2.1463,6.9,'1yI6eE1kHT8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3228,_binary '\0','/mVQthfjH5QrkDyiY6RxAgl60LqG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048500',7.1,3339,'pl','Pokolenie','Stach is a wayward teen living in squalor on the outskirts of Nazi-occupied Warsaw. Guided by an avuncular Communist organizer, he is introduced to the underground resistance—and to the beautiful Dorota. Soon he is engaged in dangerous efforts to fight oppression and indignity, maturing as he assumes responsibility for others’ lives.','/zUQKN61bjCxSgubchybgzExMCNR.jpg','1955-01-26',87,'Released',NULL,'A Generation',43322,2.1207,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3229,_binary '\0','/o0FBpWBi3QLEobqHECSICbn6wqG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048512',6.8,1273,'en','The Prisoner','A cardinal is arrested for treason against the state. He is a popular hero of his people, for his resistance against the Nazis during the war and his resistance when his country again fell to a totalitarian conqueror. In prison, his interrogator is determined to extract a confession of guilt, and thus destroy his power over his people.','/gPlWKXHnBI6egwiISo3KqOUzIEP.jpg','1955-04-19',95,'Released',NULL,'The Prisoner',52857,1.5386,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3230,_binary '\0','/x7ZaqemK7b8BcH2SldsbAiqKIkN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048527',6.7,3197,'en','Queen Bee','A wicked Southern woman ruthlessly manipulates her family.','/nQpJkS9RRqy3GdGScf7u2N4IUt1.jpg','1955-11-07',95,'Released','She\'s so excitingly good . . . when she\'s so wonderfully bad!','Queen Bee',28296,2.3872,6.3,'hUWLd79aATU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3231,_binary '\0','/3WRHB7Hte5TPSvG0cVbEAeJwmqq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048528',6.3,1262,'en','Quentin Durward','During the 15th century reign of France\'s King Louis XI, a young Scottish man is sent by his English Lord to woo a French lady on his behalf. The plan goes awry when the young man falls in love with her. Based on the classic novel by Sir Walter Scott.','/j3r7MM1pYTLT2fpxMVvIASRNfPP.jpg','1955-09-09',103,'Released','MGM presents in CINEMASCOPE and COLOR...Sir Walter Scott\'s The Adventures of Quentin Durward','Quentin Durward',76231,1.6565,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3232,_binary '\0','/gCBiGB16GoBFIwL2CFFsOcLhPOF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048535',6,1645,'en','Rage at Dawn','In this film\'s version of the story, four of the Reno Brothers are corrupt robbers and killers while a fifth, Clint is a respected Indiana farmer. A sister, Laura, who has inherited the family home, serves the outlaw brothers as a housekeeper and cook. One brother is killed when they go after a bank, the men of the town appear to have been waiting for them…','/oL49nHaB2SnhCDUHLcqqSBzcoXi.jpg','1955-03-26',87,'Released','SHOWDOWN AT SUNUP!','Rage at Dawn',22408,1.7405,6.2,'9qHa0V7Shuk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3233,_binary '\0','/2ieTJ0OfUKnuHlaaMMuEWh8PsfD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048538',5.8,1246,'en','The Rains of Ranchipur','India. The spoilt and stubborn Edwina Esketh, comes to a small town with her husband. She falls in love with an indian doctor, Dr. Safti. She also meets an old friend of hers, the alcoholic Tom Ransome. An awful earthquake is followed by days of rain.','/v1HiHDeE40NXIZ2YCXLQYPdp9WC.jpg','1955-12-14',104,'Released','Theirs was the great sin that even the great rains could not wash away!','The Rains of Ranchipur',39695,1.9574,5.4,'HYAWL9lMfhE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3234,_binary '\0','/mCOQkQAvxBBCgTiktIimkcpYmiV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048543',6.9,1745,'fr','Razzia sur la Chnouf','Henri, the Man from Nantes, comes back to his country after a successful stay in the United States, where he was working for Liski, the drug dealer. With the fame of being a tough guy preceding him, he sets himself to the task of knowing why the French operations were not so profitable - and soon he is master of all links of the organization. He can now get it honed to perfection - or destroy it. Only... the Police are following his every step.','/5MLzcPe7MJj6wWIsgUazTCMK4hd.jpg','1955-04-07',101,'Released',NULL,'Razzia',44256,2.4064,6.703,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3235,_binary '\0','/iRUBsjkPeK21nlHqH4szJCz2Ma1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048545',7.6,104247,'en','Rebel Without a Cause','After moving to a new town, troublemaking teen Jim Stark is supposed to have a clean slate, although being the new kid in town brings its own problems. While searching for some stability, Stark forms a bond with a disturbed classmate, Plato, and falls for local girl Judy. However, Judy is the girlfriend of neighborhood tough, Buzz. When Buzz violently confronts Jim and challenges him to a drag race, the new kid\'s real troubles begin.','/yHStsC8rRRfIjqRN38BQsLh6S7k.jpg','1955-10-27',111,'Released','The bad boy from a good family.','Rebel Without a Cause',221,7.6071,7.485,'HWHH5TwEwtI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3236,_binary '\0','/50IG2hfHcPeAJBZxgRr8op4lLhq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048554',5.6,7827,'en','Revenge of the Creature','In a tributary of the Amazon, a monster – half-man, half-fish – is captured and placed in a reservoir in a Florida national park to be observed by scientists.','/z5Jhrhs9Uu3HBA7nA4V9sb432S6.jpg','1955-01-17',82,'Released','All New Thrills! Shocks! Suspense!','Revenge of the Creature',40761,3.1446,5.6,'FX2FP3LHD9Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3237,_binary '\0','/zIlbxtVlyz223BiOQZ6sWhJTLoU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048563',6.9,5108,'en','The Rose Tattoo','A grieving widow embarks on a new romance when she discovers her late husband had been cheating on her.','/3W3dgP2l24JJWq6sVEl6TddLwbe.jpg','1955-12-12',117,'Released','The boldest story of love you have ever been permitted to see! Seething with realism and frankness!','The Rose Tattoo',65550,2.5776,6.9,'DWbGNWii4i8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3238,_binary '\0','/qRsLJQfBZ42JGMwuLGewtM47fWY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048570',6.7,2074,'en','Run for Cover','An ex-convict drifter and his flawed young partner are made sheriff and deputy of a Western town.','/2OGJ9T9ySAJXsu9LLY5WD4OEtbG.jpg','1955-04-29',93,'Released','The story of a man apart... who brought faith to a youth, love to a woman, justice to a land!','Run for Cover',85639,3.5416,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3239,_binary '\0','/chzvzxHOFhs0tBkbDfoE6exchBP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048572',7.5,1220,'pt','Rio, 40 Graus','On a scorching summer day in Rio de Janeiro, five impoverished black boys venture out of their favela to peddle peanuts throughout the bustling city. As they navigate the various districts of Rio, they bear witness to a series of unfortunate events and encounters, unfolding a vivid tapestry of urban life in Rio de Janeiro during that period. These true misadventures shed light on the gritty reality of the city, unveiling its vibrant urban tapestry.','/bgNYhX1hFFhp4IMjcVlIWomtipl.jpg','1955-08-24',91,'Released',NULL,'Rio, 100 Degrees F°',146075,0.9977,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3240,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048574',7.8,2110,'bn','সবার উপরে','Shankar was a young lawyer in pursuit of making it big in the professional world. However, his world is turned upside down when he comes to know that his father, who he knew went missing, was in real life spending his lifetime in jail as he was incorrectly accused of murdering a lady named Hemangini. His mother urges him to reinvestigate the case and save his father. He goes to Krishnanagar in search of the people and the pieces of evidence that would help him to prove his father’s innocence. He meets Rita, a young and charming lady who assists him. They fall in love. Shankar faces a lot of roadblocks while trying to collect clues, most of them which were imposed by the actual murderer. However, he solves the mystery in the end and his father is thus released from prison.','/fcrmxL9TgPPaS97TuB2hHU4xOMO.jpg','1955-12-01',150,'Released',NULL,'Sabar Uparey',688123,0.8264,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3241,_binary '\0','/gp5MCnItJgQ5qzSs5W3bJMDXbVM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048579',7.3,7624,'ja','続宮本武蔵 一乗寺の決闘','After years on the road establishing his reputation as Japan\'s greatest fencer, Takezo returns to Kyoto. Otsu waits for him, yet he has come not for her but to challenge the leader of the region\'s finest school of fencing. To prove his valor and skill, he walks deliberately into ambushes set up by the school\'s followers.','/nybLbDfegJOUMzsdrWWvLTD4kY0.jpg','1955-07-12',103,'Released',NULL,'Samurai II: Duel at Ichijoji Temple',31374,2.2602,7.168,'UDbkQPIqYS0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3242,_binary '\0','/mIs8rSSOtQ7v2Pm7yUBLsmONZM0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048593',6.4,3877,'en','The Sea Chase','As the Second World War breaks out, German freighter captain Karl Ehrlich is about to leave Sydney, Australia with his vessel, the Ergenstrasse. Ehrlich, an anti-Nazi but proud German, hopes to outrun or out-maneuver the British warship pursuing him. Aboard his vessel is Elsa Keller, a woman Ehrlich has been ordered to return to Germany safely along with whatever secrets she carries. When Ehrlich\'s fiercely Nazi chief officer Kirchner commits an atrocity, the British pursuit becomes deadly.','/vFzBvq70zOqCb25pJL7pjGBrVAN.jpg','1955-06-04',117,'Released','JOHN WAYNE - a skipper sworn never to be taken! LANA TURNER - the fuse of his floating time-bomb!','The Sea Chase',40578,3.1168,6.336,'Y1OA10AHQ_w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3243,_binary '\0','/As0dCIenteCo7gHoDhBvjCv8WI8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048604',6.7,1737,'en','The Seven Little Foys','Vaudeville entertainer Eddie Foy, who has vowed to forever keep his act a solo, falls in love with and marries Italian ballerina Madeleine. While they continue to tour the circuit, they begin a family and before long have seven little Foys to clutter the wings. After tragedy threatens to stall Eddie\'s career, he comes to realize that his little terrors are worth their weight in gold. - Chris Stone','/tFsRUT27D1Jxi58QCU8D743R71q.jpg','1955-09-30',93,'Released','The story of a husband who didn\'t have time to come home! Daddy couldn\'t get home, so the kids all trouped down to Broadway and got into the act. The incredible, incomparable story of America\'s most fabulous family!','The Seven Little Foys',25893,2.8371,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3244,_binary '\0','/o1rW0pM3nxyY6YKl0bQVXbEqKHt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048605',7,46070,'en','The Seven Year Itch','When his family goes away for summer vacation, a hitherto faithful publishing executive with an overactive imagination is tempted by an attractive new neighbor.','/4oLqx0QbjWFzWtkxRmDLGH47CUJ.jpg','1955-06-03',105,'Released','It TICKLES and TANTALIZES! - The funniest comedy since laughter began!','The Seven Year Itch',10653,6.2543,7,'UObTt29qDlo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3245,_binary '\0','/totcmnBIkwJHqutFu26N8JO5jDU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048613',7.9,3345,'hi','श्री ४२०','The story of a small-town man who comes to make it big in the city, where he is almost instantly relieved of all his possessions. Homeless and penniless, he is taken in by a woman who looks after him.','/nKqpOzyDhZvpGUDkUK8aY4treLg.jpg','1955-09-06',168,'Released',NULL,'Shree 420',48929,1.8207,7.524,'yMLbcA9lNQ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3246,_binary '\0','/rKs8y5WlXcYX5GCbDkXcXybGteZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048624',7,11268,'de','Sissi','The young Bavarian princess Elisabeth, who all call Sissi, goes with her mother and older sister Néné to Austria where Néné will be wed to an emperor named Franz Joseph, Yet unexpectedly Franz runs into Sissi while out fishing and they fall in love.','/iGy9j4AdhkiOYRYeTSpq7g3zayL.jpg','1955-12-22',102,'Released','The magical love story of the young Empress Elisabeth!','Sissi',457,3.9901,7.27,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3247,_binary '\0','/9FvGx8T8cOCdNGbJIQ89q8sCwc2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048640',6.2,1997,'en','Soldier of Fortune','An American woman arrives in Hong Kong to unravel the mystery of her missing photographer husband. After getting nowhere with the authorities, she is led by some underground characters to an American soldier of fortune working in the area against the Communists. He promises to help find her husband.','/hai46s11pk90zGE22ifFJefRb0S.jpg','1955-05-24',96,'Released','Tale of Today\'s Orient.','Soldier of Fortune',44888,2.2022,6,'W_T9uPzrZkE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3248,_binary '\0','/mPpEL0P0JSw8AdjB2fx4NzIUIFZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048641',7.7,15873,'sv','Sommarnattens leende','Early in the 20th century, middle-aged lawyer Fredrik Egerman and his young wife, Anne, have still not consummated their marriage, while Fredrik\'s son finds himself increasingly attracted to his new stepmother. To make matters worse, Fredrik\'s old flame Desiree makes a public bet that she can seduce him at a romantic weekend retreat where four couples convene, swapping partners and pairing off in unexpected ways.','/wKeV8lKz8k9DDBCw6MJ9MkhvhqF.jpg','1955-12-26',109,'Released','A sexy frolic about the sport of love','Smiles of a Summer Night',11700,3.4304,7.4,'kacMgRPyNrs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3249,_binary '\0','/gON9zCwWFPARcyn4xaXjtW70Yp9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048657',7.9,3222,'el','Στέλλα','The story of a young, wild woman who doesn\'t want to compromise and settle down. Stella is a restless, rebellious Greek woman who plays with men and enjoys her life as much as she can. But when she meets a young footballer, things get mixed up. She loves him but she loves her freedom too. So it\'s about time she made an important choice.','/ySZt7tyFAkdHlCZTTBc2XKWABJq.jpg','1955-04-04',100,'Released',NULL,'Stella',47778,1.1907,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3250,_binary '\0','/dX15cKUt4grZIj8SG2qDRUsqfc3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048666',6.6,1239,'en','Stranger on Horseback','A circuit judge in the old west attempts to bring a suspected killer to justice. The judge runs afoul of the killer\'s rich cattle baron father in the process.','/c3mtLA2jQIYCdxRxOC6KB9v5O2p.jpg','1955-03-22',66,'Released','A Killer\'s Paradise ... then one day a stranger rode in with a challenge ... a stranger the West would never forget !','Stranger on Horseback',109376,2.116,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3251,_binary '\0','/rrgv4V4UD5vd9C8sxG0cAYjCE4z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048667',6.3,4511,'en','Strategic Air Command','Air Force reservist Lt. Col. Robert \"Dutch\" Holland is recalled into active duty at the peak of his professional baseball career.','/7PE3DAgKp9LyUn4XSyPMI3pqOYt.jpg','1955-03-25',112,'Released','Soar to New Heights of Adventure!','Strategic Air Command',61880,2.0309,6.1,'WkQr2T83UJc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3252,_binary '\0','/irw2E81Cbv2OFR4LNbmUMdLd3Ko.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048673',7.1,11587,'en','Summertime','Middle-aged Ohio secretary Jane Hudson has never found love and has nearly resigned herself to spending the rest of her life alone. But before she does, she uses her savings to finance a summer in romantic Venice, where she finally meets the man of her dreams, the elegant Renato Di Rossi.','/3mlLfrbP9oYkSXvUPJhk24VdYM8.jpg','1955-06-21',100,'Released','All the pent-up yearning of her life was finally fulfilled ... amid the splendor of the world\'s most fabulous city!','Summertime',50363,2.7096,6.734,'_TRHz0UGfTg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3253,_binary '\0','/qCGttaliZIInqQaAYZEvm7ZcmOS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048682',3.4,2150,'en','Swamp Women','An undercover policewoman helps three female convicts escape from prison so that they can lead her to a stash of stolen diamonds hidden in a swamp.','/4Rr4hDuXr8gJnH48d7UcySpEnfC.jpg','1956-04-01',67,'Released','Flaming passions against a background of weird adventure!','Swamp Women',27344,1.1848,3.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3254,_binary '\0','/fsAdd5jZ9anIY1WKboJimvXsLmN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048691',6.7,3656,'en','The Tall Men','Two brothers discharged from the Confederate Army join a businessman for a cattle drive from Texas to Montana where they run into raiding Jayhawkers, angry Sioux, rough terrain and bad weather.','/tvMX9de89OXkbn0aLOd1DjIU5fA.jpg','1955-09-22',122,'Released','As Big and Spectacular and Exciting As The Mighty West Itself!','The Tall Men',37317,3.8624,6.5,'q5UIxHu7CFc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3255,_binary '\0','/mJhEzR254JifF0wjKj48hcqabus.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048696',6.4,12089,'en','Tarantula','A rogue scientist near a small desert town arouses the suspicion of the town\'s doctor when his lab assistant is found dead from a case of acromegaly, which took only four days to develop. As the doctor investigates, aided by the scientist\'s new female assistant, they discover that something is devouring local cattle and humans in increasingly large quantities.','/4mFsbUObsmbTe0rZCXBFPLfDbRt.jpg','1955-10-29',80,'Released','More terrifying than any horror known to man comes a creeping crawling monster whose towering fury no one can escape!','Tarantula',9077,2.5028,6.5,'NU5Ohipxhak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3256,_binary '\0','/2ftX7tESu9cO8ek0pcBGsZrBczs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048703',6,1643,'en','Ten Wanted Men','When his ward seeks protection with rival cattleman John Stewart, embittered, jealous rancher Wick Campbell hires ten outlaws to help him seize power in the territory.','/wgWmvpH0z8ceqhsSyz8NhKfb1Sg.jpg','1955-02-01',80,'Released','The life and death of a reign of terror!','Ten Wanted Men',64368,2.8398,5.9,'STKfgOFN6N0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3257,_binary '\0','/1sgAxMqWE65Wiu9CqmWHVormawT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048705',6.3,3137,'en','The Tender Trap','A young actress flirts demurely with a swinging Manhattan bachelor who thinks he has it made.','/o4uIEZfI0gHfTMOc2nQLPBpGDqf.jpg','1955-11-04',111,'Released','What every girl sets for every man','The Tender Trap',43326,1.7799,6.2,'ESTMst3lTqI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3258,_binary '\0','/6uRr4uhJ45FCAP51oeNDoixnqvs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048724',6.6,2891,'en','Tight Spot','A former model, serving time in prison, becomes a key witness in a trial against a notorious gangster. She is put under protective watch by the District Attorney in a posh hotel, but the crime kingpin makes attempts to get to her.','/gz0x6YH3WJdw71E9oyb3mKTNiXn.jpg','1955-03-19',97,'Released','SHE: \"Is that blood?\" HE: \"I took two bullets through the chest, ma\'am. Just routine.\"','Tight Spot',76121,1.7379,6.542,'LxaGCs7bDv0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3259,_binary '\0','/jGyDvz8WjVZzHX573WDs8BTIUU9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048728',7.4,87677,'en','To Catch a Thief','When a string of jewel robberies hits the French Riviera, suspicion falls on retired thief John “The Cat” Robie. To clear his name, he sets out to trap the copycat himself—entangling a wealthy widow and her beguiling daughter in a seductive game of pursuit, deception, and desire.','/cPy05z52PbFsAvfO5zbp0ebGhIj.jpg','1955-08-03',106,'Released','WANTED by the police in all the luxury-spots of Europe!... A catch for any woman!','To Catch a Thief',381,8.9581,7.26,'YIc5SDKEC6g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3260,_binary '\0','/vJSSWXiKjLMJtYQ8X0vQdDRHZVN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048729',7.1,6587,'en','To Hell and Back','The true WWII story of Audie Murphy, the most decorated soldier in U.S. history. Based on the autobiography of Audie Murphy who stars as himself in the film.','/uzeK4UwVVzzg5zUmYlfXdGXDOG5.jpg','1955-09-22',106,'Released','Rejected by the Marines, the Navy, and the Army paratroopers due to his small size and youthful appearance, when he was finally accepted by the army Murphy became the most decorated soldier in U.S. history!!!','To Hell and Back',16514,2.8703,6.607,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3261,_binary '\0','/pfQZAKF2g5TncTa56vXbhY1grVj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048748',6.9,1438,'en','Trial','A Mexican boy accused of rape and murder becomes a pawn for Communists and red-baiters. A courtroom drama set in 1947 and underlying post-WW2 acute problems facing the USA such as stormy race relations and the growing threat of local communism.','/jJho2pES5IxgYh9PMLLglpql4rb.jpg','1955-10-07',105,'Released','Tense! Timely! Thrilling!','Trial',114083,1.9151,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3262,_binary '\0','/i5MaRm0FsJIpXVLAvrMsMt5YQ5p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048750',7,43406,'en','The Trouble with Harry','In a quiet Vermont village, a corpse creates unexpected chaos as several townspeople each believe they may be to blame.','/uUXLq7fEG3hI46ZFMZzgHj11S6S.jpg','1955-10-03',99,'Released','A different kind of kick-the-bucket comedy!','The Trouble with Harry',11219,4.833,6.976,'171-YyvtCIM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3263,_binary '\0','/25hJTjExgVWI4DbybpAms4X3tQa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048752',8,8196,'fi','Tuntematon sotilas','It is the summer of 1941. An eastern-Finnish machine gun company receives an order to turn in their surplus equipment. The company is transferred to the front lines. The next morning the soldiers wake to the sound of guns – the war has begun.','/3vXBRAd4tydmLsIvQGiVzwS6QOQ.jpg','1955-12-23',181,'Released',NULL,'The Unknown Soldier',36439,1.344,7.2,'rggKrGbjmgs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3264,_binary '\0','/mP1nyyj9TJWPuu8gdWWwGjnDfgC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048757',7.6,3709,'ja','浮雲','A married Japanese forester during WWII is sent to Indochina to manage forests. He meets a young Japanese typist and promises to leave his wife. He doesn\'t and after the war, she turns up and the affair resumes.','/6nMSSTPvNG9vfyHqIXafWg6RHgU.jpg','1955-01-15',123,'Released','So short is the life of a flower, yet so much hardships it suffered.','Floating Clouds',77285,2.0629,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3265,_binary '\0','/dE5UNv0YYBnvOAUYpVS3km7A6Yk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048764',5.3,1283,'en','Underwater!','Two scuba divers find a shipwreck which may contain undiscovered treasure, however, their attempt to salvage it is threatened by scavengers.','/3DZtI8eUVJkODVS3VXgu4ewYFMO.jpg','1955-02-09',99,'Released','UNDERWATER Fury! UNDERWATER Paradise!','Underwater!',102295,1.8982,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3266,_binary '\0','/tENEaWhdCM9Vw5FZILt7pD3LshU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048789',6.9,3814,'en','The Violent Men','A former Union Army officer plans to sell out to Anchor Ranch and move east with his fiancée, but the low price offered by Anchor\'s crippled owner and the outfit\'s bullying tactics make him reconsider. When one of his hands is murdered he decides to stay and fight, utilizing his war experience. Not all is well at Anchor with the owner\'s wife carrying on with his brother who also has a Mexican woman in town.','/v56QMbVu29FCPffQGkkw31Gxuzj.jpg','1955-01-26',96,'Released','VOLCANIC! VALIANT! VICIOUS! Violence and Passion the Screen Has Seldom Seen!','The Violent Men',60643,2.0895,6.5,'i76CyKNdfU8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3267,_binary '\0','/tYt6qg8fShgf8Pa2f1ac8wfuypF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048790',6.9,3472,'en','Violent Saturday','Three men case a small town very carefully, with plans to rob the bank on the upcoming Saturday, which turns violent and deadly.','/2ypnc0Rh5MThlKPpynqu8Arp81p.jpg','1955-04-01',90,'Released','The day all Hell broke loose !','Violent Saturday',39834,3.0484,6.738,'4kwgN7IaSZg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3268,_binary '\0','/nkORbWj7y8aj5Bryi6MvKhVZLCs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048791',6.6,3237,'en','The Virgin Queen','Sir Walter Raleigh overcomes court intrigue to win favor with the Queen in order to get financing for a proposed voyage to the New World.','/1UbeN94QSvD9iv46ddHB3S5fucP.jpg','1955-07-22',92,'Released','CinemaScope spectacularly spreads before you the velvet cape and violent age of Sir Walter Raleigh and The Virgin Queen.','The Virgin Queen',43327,3.0214,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3269,_binary '\0','/jAvAhgVnCo45vc6IQPsp803Oaks.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048801',7.3,12306,'en','We\'re No Angels','Three convicts escape from prison on Devil\'s Island just before Christmas and arrive at a nearby French colonial town. They go to the store of the Ducotels, the only store that gives supplies on credit. They initially intend to take advantage of them but have a change of heart after they find the family is in financial troubles.','/UsrZkcoj95K8ZVf7FMnTiZ5P4C.jpg','1955-07-07',106,'Released','A strangler... A swindler... A safecracker... Yet you\'ll love them!','We\'re No Angels',5996,3.7985,7.178,'COGLBSB7Fwg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3270,_binary '\0','/ihgYojNRfHnM3SCOAyDv8lAgNGy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048805',6.4,1325,'en','White Feather','The story of the peace mission from the US cavalry to the Cheyenne Indians in Wyoming during the 1870s. The mission is threatened when a civilian surveyor befriends the chief\'s son and falls for the chief\'s daughter.','/lFJZpnqAOrvVxbivn5IHkXUtDdG.jpg','1955-02-16',102,'Released','Beyond Any Indian Adventure Ever Filmed!','White Feather',127064,3.5032,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3271,_binary '\0','/twWnHrSfjG2FEu7H7oI8LDmUNaP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048806',6.9,2847,'en','Wichita','Former buffalo hunter and entrepreneur Wyatt Earp arrives in the lawless cattle town of Wichita Kansas. His skill as a gun-fighter makes him a perfect candidate for Marshal, but he refuses the job until he feels morally obligated to bring law and order to this wild town.','/ne83mYnmEBLhXnU8qawebKTA1nv.jpg','1955-07-03',81,'Released','THE TRUE SAVAGE STORY OF WYATT EARP!','Wichita',114975,1.8067,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3272,_binary '\0','/xqxqExaVlDV7J9jiXYOZnD7WqoO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048811',6.5,1355,'en','Women\'s Prison','A crusading psychiatrist battles a sadistic female warden to improve conditions at a women\'s prison.','/79dZhoqHrqWRiq2eQAQQ5vrpZcZ.jpg','1955-02-01',79,'Released','Sensational Scandal Rocks Women\'s Prison!','Women\'s Prison',25788,1.5716,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3273,_binary '\0','/xMDPQrm2IFUzUKq5ONJFCAhsYRY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048820',7.1,2260,'ja','楊貴妃','In 8th-century China, the Emperor grieves the death of his wife. The Yang family wants to provide the Emperor with a consort so that they may consolidate their court influence. General An Lushan finds a distant relative working in their kitchen, whom they groom to present to the Emperor. The Emperor falls in love and she becomes the Princess Yang Kwei-fei. The Yangs are then appointed important ministers, though An Lushan is not given the court position he covets.','/4QiJiqVmeJ3ExzhBUpof5oCrt1m.jpg','1955-05-03',92,'Released',NULL,'Princess Yang Kwei-fei',91426,1.9162,6.7,'8bCuZWQu1FQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3274,_binary '\0','/tZfbeivQv6QVhhGJqETn9AHXMIh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048822',6.5,1908,'en','You\'re Never Too Young','When an aspiring barber becomes inadvertently involved in the theft of a valuable diamond, necessity forces him to masquerade as a 12 year-old child - with humorous consequences.','/mIy3vSiPmDvoH6EGtr86aS28zjM.jpg','1955-08-25',102,'Released','Dino\'s the singing dean of a girl\'s school, Jerry - a wolf in kid\'s clothing - in a class by himself with 503 coeds.','You\'re Never Too Young',53441,3.0432,6.645,'P_nDaO-R9h8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3275,_binary '\0','/eLo6eRTHAbaC21qRuxzyCmUaaT0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048918',6.9,4964,'en','1984','In a totalitarian future society, a man whose daily work is rewriting history tries to rebel by falling in love.','/2EOfGaRluwJe6OlR21JtbLhWDvt.jpg','1956-03-06',90,'Released','Will ecstasy be a crime... in the terrifying world of the future? Amazing wonders of tomorrow! Nothing like it ever filmed! From the startling George Orwell novel!','1984',1984,2.6753,6.5,'tep0DfmsEcE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3276,_binary '\0','/rcLFlORcleyfgbVshzQl4MmfQ4J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048919',6.9,3140,'en','23 Paces to Baker Street','Philip Hannon, a blind playwright living in London, overhears part of a conversation , that leads him into a desperate race, to find a kidnapped child. When he gets no help from the police, he along with his butler, and his ex fiancée, attempt to track down the crooks.','/kh0l1cHt1aZKKsdLsQ3BnMte5VZ.jpg','1956-05-18',103,'Released','STEP-BY-STEP...','23 Paces to Baker Street',71171,2.5233,6.7,'rWarBgLFo2M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3277,_binary '\0','/9mXiLykC4hOO646xpoWUF9uQqBG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048933',7.8,5459,'ja','赤線地帯','Follows five sex workers employed at a Japanese brothel while the nation debates the passage of an anti-prostitution law.','/eVKXkGG9xQiVj9kTt9PbdxJJoKS.jpg','1956-03-18',87,'Released','Men were their prey! Beauty was their lure!','Street of Shame',43255,2.766,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3278,_binary '\0','/yk1ovkzAXZZY02jtzjaazi3FjaU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048937',5.8,4718,'en','Alexander the Great','An engrossing spectacle set in the 4th-century BC, in which Alexander of Greece leads his troops forth, conquering all of the known world, in the belief that the Greek way of thinking will bring enlightenment to people. The son of the barbaric and ruthless King Philip of Macedonia, Alexander achieved glory in his short but remarkable life.','/e3P3GiCKaEmLxzibDMzALmPbEHL.jpg','1956-03-28',136,'Released','The colossus who conquered the world!','Alexander the Great',42668,4.7875,6.1,'sSXAUtbsZmA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3279,_binary '\0','/z29SCOPlLUX8NkmofgFnuTH9OyK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048947',7,10391,'en','Anastasia','Russian exiles in Paris plot to collect ten million pounds from the Bank of England by grooming a destitute, suicidal girl to pose as heir to the Russian throne. While Bounin is coaching her, he comes to believe that she is really Anastasia. In the end, the Empress must decide her claim.','/26wHOXNt4XNn2lYT8i8pWx1JOP0.jpg','1956-12-13',105,'Released','The most amazing conspiracy the world has ever known... and love as it never happened to a man and woman before!','Anastasia',38171,2.469,6.8,'U-Jgt1WNxu4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3280,_binary '\0','/qDEZmaaAGhEso6kvB5kk1CROPwG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048956',8.2,20306,'bn','অপরাজিত','Apu and his family have moved away from the country to live in the bustling holy city of Benares. As he progresses from wide-eyed child to intellectually curious teenager, eventually studying in Kolkata, we witness his academic and moral education, as well as the growing complexity of his relationship with his mother.','/qvR2Qs42WHwCEcuwhQnterU3gVY.jpg','1956-10-11',110,'Released',NULL,'Aparajito',897,2.5542,7.834,'mgv68E_o6VM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3281,_binary '\0','/AiSfsXyFdze5UhlSC3YVqIdG8vS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048960',6.7,32362,'en','Around the World in 80 Days','Based on the famous book by Jules Verne the movie follows Phileas Fogg on his journey around the world. Which has to be completed within 80 days, a very short period for those days.','/kk6Rrwh0toMz9tjuUHdS4O3v2Rk.jpg','1956-10-17',182,'Released','It\'s a wonderful world, if you\'ll only take the time to go around it!','Around the World in 80 Days',2897,7.7551,6.7,'vjiCO8k6Jhg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3282,_binary '\0','/amqGNYHSol9uRvocCLtIkUHftuz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048966',7.4,6601,'en','Attack','Battle of the Bulge, World War II, 1944. Lieutenant Costa, an infantry company officer who must establish artillery observation posts in a strategic area, has serious doubts about Captain Cooney\'s leadership ability.','/7r2MrvqqpvUfaIjxlQx0wx5o3Qe.jpg','1956-09-19',107,'Released','It rips open the hot Hell behind the glory!','Attack',32087,2.13,6.821,'_QG3kq0sRqE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3283,_binary '\0','/i1oaV32Jsbm984IdIVVzFkZ2Drs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048967',6.9,3742,'en','Autumn Leaves','A woman falls for a younger man with severe mental problems.','/9WdCLe9vMgWic184e19JOFXm4Od.jpg','1956-08-01',107,'Released','In the dark, when I feel his heart pounding against mine - is it love? or frenzy? or terror?','Autumn Leaves',43256,2.1011,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3284,_binary '\0','/rNDc15zRhM241DIjNk6jBaezhnM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048971',6.3,1850,'en','Away All Boats','The story of USS \'Belinda\', a U.S. naval ship, and its crew during the battle of the Pacific 1943-1945, as it prepares for action and landing troops on enemy beachheads.','/dyyRfeB45ZUx9JhFKL0L9FS9wOU.jpg','1956-08-16',114,'Released','The battle cry of the South Pacific','Away All Boats',80775,2.3671,5.3,'-JJDIDfh7uQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3285,_binary '\0','/iF7wxLmiudwxrPoFF0f4QZVuoeT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048973',7.2,9097,'en','Baby Doll','Archie Lee Meighan is a failing cotton gin owner who is married to Baby Doll, a 19-year old childlike beauty whose father arranged the marriage for financial reasons. As Archie awaits the arrival of Baby Doll\'s 20th birthday, the day that they are supposed to consummate their marriage, he faces interference from business rival Silva Vacarro, who plots to seduce Baby Doll away from Meighan.','/tatY3XuhxIHIUbuDSJ31NKJkN3N.jpg','1956-12-29',114,'Released','She\'s nineteen. She makes her husband keep away -- she won\'t let the stranger go.','Baby Doll',40478,3.0502,7.034,'KiU9EuGSjgY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3286,_binary '\0','/jPqjjOsmmTwoa13ng3jBtxOXfmW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048975',6.6,1767,'en','Back from Eternity','A South American plane loaded with an assortment of characters crash lands in a remote jungle area in the middle of a storm. The passengers then discover they are in an area inhabited by vicious cannibals and must escape before they are found. A remake of Five Came Back (1939).','/uh1OztOgr6ICHH2vNzb2g5tJ2WF.jpg','1956-09-07',100,'Released','Ooh that Ekberg!','Back from Eternity',46525,2.0204,6.7,'t1QKUtXe3G8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3287,_binary '\0','/fDSQz4yTlV8hfjRrMgzdY55DVjk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048976',6.6,2180,'en','Backlash','Jim Slater\'s father (whom he never knew) died in the Apache ambush at Gila Valley, and Jim is searching for the one survivor, who supposedly went for help but disappeared with a lot of gold. In the process, he gets several people gunning for him, and he keeps meeting liberated woman Karyl Orton, who may be on a similar mission. Renewed Apache hostilities and an impending range war provide complications.','/ny5zwvwmToqeHrLSlJMGk4wXtGZ.jpg','1956-03-14',84,'Released','Was The SIXTH MAN The Secret To The Five Empty Graves?...the Answer waited in a woman\'s lips and watched from the shadows of a frightened town!','Backlash',62648,2.0207,6.5,'nHnTBTNtU4Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3288,_binary '\0','/tqiAcUqaXPyL2oo18CIPWUGxkJk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048977',7.4,17965,'en','The Bad Seed','Air Force Colonel Kenneth Penmark and his wife, Christine, adore their daughter Rhoda, despite her secret tendency for selfishness. Christine keeps her knowledge of her daughter\'s darker side to herself, but when a schoolmate of Rhoda\'s dies mysteriously, her self-deception unravels.','/iAgSkpZslQ2s3onL9TaHbyWygtC.jpg','1956-09-12',129,'Released','Talk all you want about the man and the woman -- but please don\'t tell about the girl!','The Bad Seed',42196,4.6489,7.1,'fZt7gtFiVJk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3289,_binary '\0','/yxP7WzDU2sKwW9jx3FUofvH8N0X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048981',7.5,1805,'it','La banda degli onesti','Italy, mid \'60s. Three guys from a poor neighbourhood try to get rich by printing fake money using the fact that one of them works as a typographer. The story unravels around their embarrassed efforts to spend the money, their little family issues and ends with a surprise.','/eIxcQHq9WDWmcDoJ1qVxhQWlstX.jpg','1956-04-12',101,'Released',NULL,'The Band of Honest Men',56068,1.6393,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3290,_binary '\0','/f2k2PdqXS8YlD9ZRTFIyeP2RtIy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048983',6,1266,'en','Bandido!','American arms dealer Kennedy hopes to make a killing by selling to the \"regulares\" in the 1916 Mexican revolution. American mercenary Wilson favors the rebel faction headed by Escobar, and they plot to hijack Kennedy\'s arms; but Wilson also has his eye on Kennedy\'s wife. Raids, counter-raids, and escapes follow in a veritable hail of bullets.','/rHwBVEK7HxurPkBuVJaeAE5ixqO.jpg','1956-09-01',92,'Released','THE CRY THAT ROCKED THE WORLD\'S HOTTEST STRIP OF HELL!','Bandido!',44022,1.6609,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3291,_binary '\0','/d1juLtJbpbRgMeSpWYJ0d6q7OSg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048990',6.6,5542,'en','The Battle of the River Plate','In the early years of the World War II, the Royal Navy is fighting a desperate battle to keep the Atlantic convoy routes open to supply the British Isles, facing the great danger posed by the many German warships, such as the Admiral Graf Spee, which are scouring the ocean for cargo ships to sink.','/xeI1M8GR467AigykGxhPFf16xzS.jpg','1956-10-30',119,'Released','Pursuit of the Graf Spee','The Battle of the River Plate',17591,3.4598,6.413,'Tgsd9VQZaj0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3292,_binary '\0','/zavNGZK2p9H7N9CdnHg0flV1maZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048991',3.8,2066,'en','The Beast with a Million Eyes','At a decrepit farm outside a remote American desert community, something takes over the minds of some of the local humans and animals and is able to see through their eyes and control their actions.','/nOtqEDKPBdGysXfJl4xfqghgS3Z.jpg','1955-06-15',78,'Released','An unspeakable horror... Destroying... Terrifying!','The Beast with a Million Eyes',29058,2.3476,3.8,'1Qa5kBjmxh4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3293,_binary '\0','/pk2iagBsU2dTZ8sLiwieZtANcXk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0048992',4.1,2141,'en','The Beast of Hollow Mountain','An American cowboy living in Mexico discovers his cattle is being eaten by a giant prehistoric dinosaur.','/xN8Dv4DXCoJjupn12QjAgYCYfgi.jpg','1956-08-01',81,'Released','One Day After A Million Years It Came Out Of Hiding To... Kill! Kill! Kill!','The Beast of Hollow Mountain',108181,1.6373,4.2,'Ar2HCSAPsiU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3294,_binary '\0','/4zaG55iTxwYGFfZcUD4YIR7EQf5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049004',6.6,1810,'en','Between Heaven and Hell','Sam Gifford remembers : In prewar years he was an arrogant southern cotton plantation owner, married to the daughter of a colonel. At the beginning of the war he was mobilized with his National Guard unit as a sergeant. Came the day when, revolted by the cowardice of his lieutenant, who had fired at his own men, he hit him. Downgraded, he was sent to a disciplinary battalion. Sam now discovers his new detachment, his new commanding officer, just another cowardly brute, Captain Waco Grimes. While in combat, Sam will gradually become closer to the privates, working-class people he used to despise. He will become another man, a better man.','/dhZTV445nLKouWZZaTM9RsyPzsh.jpg','1956-10-11',94,'Released','From the best-selling novel of young love in war!','Between Heaven and Hell',84567,2.3568,6.2,'9WI_xjDWFgA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3295,_binary '\0','/hBxdPi4cedZNCVtiu7ajaR3JY6h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049006',6.9,6651,'en','Beyond a Reasonable Doubt','A newspaper publisher, wanting to prove a point about the insufficiency of circumstantial evidence, talks his possible son-in-law Tom into a hoax in an attempt to expose ineptitude of the city\'s hard-line district attorney. The plan is to have Tom plant clues leading to his arrest for killing a female nightclub dancer. Once Tom is found guilty, he is to reveal the setup and humiliate the DA.','/en5rlVq8w4JSrxXForJhMP2S0xY.jpg','1956-09-13',80,'Released','Put them all together they spell M-U-R-D-E-R!','Beyond a Reasonable Doubt',20330,2.9589,6.846,'-6cb4sB2Nk4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3296,_binary '\0','/iwkfRfYO3VwDpYK5FyZTRLh7nXF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049007',6.4,2282,'en','Bhowani Junction','Anglo-Indian Victoria Jones seeks her true identity amid the chaos of the British withdrawal from India.','/fuHxWvbkGqnRvKXDpdAJ9Mchzhp.jpg','1956-05-01',110,'Released','M-G-M\'s Drama Aflame With Love And Revolt!','Bhowani Junction',81699,2.191,6.075,'crzeoOd0MpU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3297,_binary '\0','/gZmP6u7Gy4EUrDBIgpyOOwcq7Wj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049010',7.4,9069,'en','Bigger Than Life','A friendly, successful suburban teacher and father grows dangerously addicted to cortisone, resulting in his transformation into a household despot.','/nC3J5B2lkWDLm7Q7C26AVFzqJLV.jpg','1956-11-20',95,'Released','The story of the handful of hope that became a fistful of hell!','Bigger Than Life',26036,2.3321,7.2,'5NvuvQ6pQIQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3298,_binary '\0','/oUX2SiqoXorKUjd82Ax7mMjKI2R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049012',8,7324,'ja','ビルマの竪琴','In Burma during the closing days of WWII, a Japanese soldier separated from his unit disguises himself as a Buddhist monk to escape imprisonment as a POW.','/aQbrTw1srrfDbte9ZduzF2bTKDI.jpg','1956-01-21',117,'Released',NULL,'The Burmese Harp',33319,2.301,7.8,'LA6xYjEw5Uk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3299,_binary '\0','/eMzMe1HOmUgNLUNgInxAMZao1Qb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049013',6,2400,'en','The Black Sleep','In 19th century England, a noted brain surgeon rescues a former student from being hanged on a false conviction for murder, and spirits him away to an ancient, repurposed abbey far in the countryside. There, he connives his pupil into assisting him in mapping the functions of the various parts of the human brain, using living subjects who are under a terrible animation-suspending drug called \"black sleep\". Subsequently, the student, along with the daughter of one of the subjects, discover that most of these subjects have survived but are being kept in a dungeon-like cellar, in various stages of physical and mental derangement...','/aIGG1C5t8qS4S0wfaVOdZRzYGwY.jpg','1956-06-15',82,'Released','The Terror Drug That Wakes the Dead!','The Black Sleep',28437,1.5996,6.2,'8Ya7Au-MpqI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3300,_binary '\0','/qyKaoaP81JyhCitdCfVrNRx9TGk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049019',7.1,1832,'en','Yield to the Night','Locked in her cell, a murderer reflects on the events that have led her to death row.','/2M9Ivv0PklA0LpUTKxrWCPqW6Iv.jpg','1956-06-19',99,'Released','The Man-By-Man Story of a Lost Soul!','Yield to the Night',20806,1.7911,6.94,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3301,_binary '\0','/1ZRixRPdkVN8vdXkLKHZVpTQhdo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049030',6.6,1294,'en','The Brave One','A young Mexican boy tirelessly tries to save his pet bull from death at the hands of a celebrated matador.','/zDoRHflS5fzFYJWmdtmUnA8iQrf.jpg','1956-10-26',100,'Released','The Touch of Greatness','The Brave One',107443,1.7072,5.9,'-iVk3eD3OnU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3302,_binary '\0','/aLCOATWYP9ibRIFiuLDbxJZ3Rbp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049034',6,1582,'en','Bundle of Joy','Kitschy musical remake of \"Bachelor Mother\". Debbie Reynolds plays an over-eager clerk in a large department store and Eddie Fisher plays the boss\' son. After getting fired from her job, she finds an adorable baby on the steps of the foundling home and the folks inside mistake her for the mother. Fisher, well-meaning, but obtuse, tries to help her out with the baby, and the buds of romance begin to appear. Meanwhile old Merlin, the owner of the store, thinks he just might be a grandfather...','/985HGOBUWNPwKmSGxHgFNTrySQ1.jpg','1956-12-12',98,'Released','Full of love, songs, laughs and surprises!','Bundle of Joy',43257,1.8851,6.4,'q5ktPWnEOk8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3303,_binary '\0','/dJFuCtcO5Q3JyZaFTZYLb3xC8Bp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049035',6.5,2304,'en','The Burglar','Burglar Nat Harbin and his two associates set their sights on wealthy spiritualist Sister Sarah, who has inherited a fortune -- including a renowned emerald necklace -- from a Philadelphia financier. Using Nat\'s female ward, Gladden, to pose as an admirer and case the mansion where the woman lives, they set up a perfect break-in. Things get complicated afterwards.','/19eVor0aJVzLJMUVa1wYlDBsHQO.jpg','1957-06-01',90,'Released','A trail of perfume... and violence!','The Burglar',33843,1.4819,5.7,'cVtB9BxEZ7I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3304,_binary '\0','/5Le00JbfjDA3Gc5wJDKunmZLJZq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049038',6.3,13847,'en','Bus Stop','Cowboys Beauregard Decker and Virgil Blessing attend a rodeo in Phoenix, where Decker falls in love with beautiful cafe singer Cherie. He wants to take Cherie back to his native Montana and marry her, but she dreams of traveling to Hollywood and becoming famous. When she resists his advances, Decker forces Cherie onto the bus back to Montana with him, but, when the bus makes an unscheduled stop due to bad weather, the tables are turned.','/oXZiz5zIyynjQMJMBbXijS4434z.jpg','1956-08-31',95,'Released','Give this boy enough rope and he\'ll land Marilyn Monroe!','Bus Stop',24010,4.0343,6.1,'4Qi9C7w7LuM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3305,_binary '\0','/sCzmxYHsxCIKgwQA1WTeERDQ5qK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049042',7.3,1476,'es','Calabuch','Professor Hamilton, a naive Nuclear scientist who once thought bombs were good for humanity, realizes his mistake and runs away from his inventions. He hides in Calabuch, a beautiful seaside town where people still believe in humor and friendship.','/ejmJiM64jy6bRnyBLSJnETvPtCv.jpg','1956-09-28',102,'Released',NULL,'The Rocket from Calabuch',107612,1.7868,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3306,_binary '\0','/9VmjgkbgSe7oLLR8rrHAGPvJBZX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049043',7.7,1833,'es','Calle Mayor','A small town in Spain, October 1955. Isabel, a 35-year-old dreamer who feels like a failure because she is not married yet, becomes the new target of a group of soulless pranksters.','/ngp7v632ATVqJGmnN3xttfAO2n8.jpg','1956-10-26',98,'Released',NULL,'Main Street',104607,1.102,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3307,_binary '\0','/s4wIZuM5NV0GRJONVPyXarcjWp1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049055',6.5,7350,'en','Carousel','Billy Bigelow has been dead for 15 years. Now outside the pearly gates, he long ago waived his right to go back to Earth for a day. He has heard that there is a problem with his family: namely with his wife Julie Bigelow, née Jordan, and his child he hasn\'t met. He would now like to head back to Earth to assist in rectifying the problem; but before he may go, he has to get permission from the gatekeeper by telling him his story. Adapted from the Rodgers and Hammerstein hit Broadway musical.','/1W7X2rHPTqzfYG5dZbvWcR5MzUs.jpg','1956-02-16',128,'Released','More than your eyes have ever seen!','Carousel',28100,3.114,5.3,'4cBlmIo4Gmc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3308,_binary '\0','/7vYspHEBmcRDwPtoYlmi9c3GZRW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049061',7.4,4217,'en','The Catered Affair','An Irish cabby in the Bronx watches his wife go overboard planning their daughter\'s wedding.','/hfRcP2beAtOSHUNnB9vCbezZFHJ.jpg','1956-06-14',94,'Released','When you\'re in love, nothing else matters','The Catered Affair',107592,2.1055,7.2,'8NvhtKJbAFA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3309,_binary '\0','/4xwqGt65hdwTIGAyNmCGrQQs7SI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049083',6.5,2361,'en','The Cockleshell Heroes','During WW2, German ships are \"safely\" docked upriver at Bordeaux, but the British send a team of kayakers to attack them.','/hD1p8FAcs7zx4C81crvpSTvefMO.jpg','1955-11-16',97,'Released','They Called Them \"Canoe Commandos\"','The Cockleshell Heroes',65114,2.239,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3310,_binary '\0','/uHdsYv222s8Wz9Ogtxqjq4Y5Wor.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049092',3.8,4279,'en','The Conqueror','Mongol chief Temujin battles against Tartar armies and for the love of the Tartar princess Bortai. Temujin becomes the emperor Genghis Khan.','/6gGtujS4opJIUbAgS9j3g4EtiVo.jpg','1956-02-02',111,'Released','GENGHIS KHAN! The world trembled at his name!','The Conqueror',24751,2.2819,3.6,'bll_j0S0TBo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3311,_binary '\0','/dxtPARExUBZniJ5bBVoejPIdoeh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049096',7.8,15253,'en','The Court Jester','A hapless carnival performer masquerades as the court jester as part of a plot against a usurper who has overthrown the rightful king of England.','/pPCOAipDP0sm8SLChpTMBPdCiqB.jpg','1955-12-24',101,'Released','We asked Shakespeare and Francis Bacon would they declare which one wrote this and they both said, “Get outta here!”','The Court Jester',11839,3.4982,7.3,'8mu_aHBFuVY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3312,_binary '\0','/6RLoNK2XEAZfOpWjPMI7sEpw0kL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049103',5.6,4815,'en','The Creature Walks Among Us','Scientists surgically transform the Creature into an air-breather, but being able to live on land is not enough to make him comfortable with humans. Enraged, he turns his wrath on anyone who comes near as he desperately tries to return to the deep-water world where he truly belongs.','/lygDmTXJgynNuHkXH0PjJidXQ0F.jpg','1956-03-01',79,'Released','A city screams in terror!','The Creature Walks Among Us',39408,2.2764,5.4,'VDiWXQc9SC8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3313,_binary '\0','/nlQ847wGkqkBScA8rq2EX6w9CsW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049107',6.6,1570,'en','Crime in the Streets','A social worker tries to end juvenile crime by getting involved with a street gang.','/gxSJPpedReAAUrny8CEqjTbfyFv.jpg','1956-06-10',91,'Released','How can you tell them to be good when their girl friends like them better when they\'re bad!...','Crime in the Streets',35917,1.9236,6.2,'lENNs3BP1cA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3314,_binary '\0','/EBi9prC8HSKeKGyrS9p90YfMSQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049117',5.9,1913,'en','D-Day the Sixth of June','En route to Normandy, an American and a British officer reminisce in flashback about their romances with the same woman.','/ghPpTqMNDYxexeuxPlc10aWIvot.jpg','1956-05-29',106,'Released','The Great Love Story of the Great War','D-Day the Sixth of June',64129,2.6117,5.3,'e5IryhTd1e4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3315,_binary '\0','/sTPXyadD38ri1rG4c1r4lewtKFp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049125',6.6,2787,'en','Davy Crockett and the River Pirates','Davy Crockett and his sidekick Georgie compete against boastful Mike Fink (\"King of the River\") in a boat race to New Orleans. Later, Davy and Georgie, allied with Fink, battle a group of river pirates trying to pass themselves off as Native Americans.','/nK43dRSgNYglR37KbcCjsimj5PE.jpg','1956-07-18',81,'Released','THRILLING ADVENTURES...frontier giants join forces to challenge the might of the River Raiders.','Davy Crockett and the River Pirates',50717,2.8783,6.345,'84PHg3q4Xyk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3316,_binary '\0','/yhSSPNQm9ngaousW5xY8zYK3VkE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049128',5.4,3049,'en','Day the World Ended','After a nuclear attack, an unlikely group of survivors, including a geologist, a crook and his moll, and a prospector, find temporary shelter in the remote-valley home of a survivalist and his beautiful daughter, but soon have to deal with the spread of radioactivity - and its effects on animal life, including humans.','/whivmoD8QfIfJnO87l2juWY8uoW.jpg','1955-12-01',79,'Released','ATTACKED... by a creature from hell!','Day the World Ended',29062,2.2652,5,'CR3VIe4lDgU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3317,_binary '\0','/uxFeKa8A7mSwbTVy0c6jbhkVEVn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049130',6.9,1414,'en','Death of a Scoundrel','A Czech refugee uses women to advance his business interest.','/qbEHXmu4ZCXtBr4GCMyYUE1ktCv.jpg','1956-10-31',119,'Released','Men, Women... he used them, ruined them on his fantastic march to self-destruction','Death of a Scoundrel',62804,2.579,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3318,_binary '\0','/jQH5gsn4ElMKVhaDyilfI4QtV4P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049147',7.4,1658,'cs','Dobrý voják Švejk','Good-natured and garrulous, Schweik becomes the Austrian army\'s most loyal Czech soldier when he is called up on the outbreak of World War I -- although his bumbling attempts to get to the front serve only to prevent him from reaching it. Playing cards and getting drunk, he uses all his cunning and genial subterfuge to deal with the police, clergy, and officers who chivy him toward battle.','/rK3R4cFvcyXZT0XTZ6UJZXJi3G.jpg','1957-08-23',108,'Released',NULL,'The Good Soldier Švejk',123513,1.657,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3319,_binary '\0','/rpazkJ87yIAcKbQ4IFbZ8y2uJIN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049169',6.3,10353,'en','Earth vs. the Flying Saucers','Test space rockets exploding at liftoff and increased reporting of UFO sightings culminate in a direct attempt by alien survivors of a dead, extra-galactic civilization to invade Earth from impervious flying saucers, using ray-weapons of mass destruction.','/qCOLglZvQgQAyWMCZodBo3wmgqp.jpg','1956-06-13',83,'Released','The terrifying truth about flying saucers!','Earth vs. the Flying Saucers',18158,3.3906,6.1,'VbhgzKwQVqc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3320,_binary '\0','/k7RvJXoJxGKhSrxFzzi7mPAQMk6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049170',6.8,2328,'en','The Eddy Duchin Story','The life story of the famous pianist and band-leader of the 1930s and 1940s.','/mFl6TEzFtOzbXM5qLbdAUUxSWI7.jpg','1956-05-02',123,'Released','There Never Was a Guy Like Eddy!','The Eddy Duchin Story',43199,3.0064,6.3,'08aa_dpc5RY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3321,_binary '\0','/lvBODRelT2vMjP0ScliejK0z9PZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049177',6.1,2337,'fr','Elena et les hommes','Set amid the military maneuvers and Quatorze Juillet carnivals of turn-of-the-century France, Jean Renoir’s delirious romantic comedy Elena and her Men stars a radiant Ingrid Bergman as a beautiful, but impoverished, Polish princess who drives men of all stations to fits of desperate love. When Elena elicits the fascination of a famous general, she finds herself at the center of romantic machinations and political scheming, with the hearts of several men—as well as the future of France—in her hands.','/9AcorR9braNGWHwXyYa4hI7ufVy.jpg','1956-09-12',95,'Released','The Only Thing Gayer Than April in Paris is Bergman in Paris!','Elena and Her Men',53156,2.3793,5.95,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3322,_binary '\0','/syEVJo8vgokY3wXWVZrkMWIOjIT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049189',6.3,10857,'fr','Et Dieu… créa la femme','18-year-old orphan Juliette\'s unbridled appetite for pleasure shakes up all of St Tropez; her sweet but naïve husband Michel endures beatings, insults, and mambo in his futile attempts to tame her wild ways.','/viZwV6ji5txsyrDode5fK0EgsYo.jpg','1956-11-28',92,'Released','...but the devil invented Brigitte Bardot!','...And God Created Woman',8420,4.4873,6.1,'PXnZxA3Zgu0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3323,_binary '\0','/aRKTfQkMVBkE45D2ko0z5D7u7Na.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049201',7.1,4194,'en','The Fastest Gun Alive','Whenever it becomes known how good he is with guns, ex-gunman George and his wife Dora have to flee the town, in fear of all the gunmen who might want to challenge him. Unfortunately he again spills his secret when he\'s drunk. All citizens swear to keep his secret and support him to give up his guns forever -- but a boy tells the story to a gang of wanted criminals. Their leader threatens to burn down the whole town, if he doesn\'t duel him.','/7T24qSRCov5cTIJtIDdxpg61fda.jpg','1956-07-12',89,'Released','WHAT HAPPENS in the next few minutes makes one of the most dramatic climaxes of any story you\'ve ever seen!','The Fastest Gun Alive',25914,3.3002,6.918,'XZowj5-IYxI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3324,_binary '\0','/rse0INAZWKg3vp08h2qEf610cqi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049207',7.7,1685,'it','Il ferroviere','Train operator Andrea Marcocci has to witness the suicide of a desperate man who jumps in front of his train. Under the influence of this shock he starts making mistakes. A check up by a doctor reveals that he\'s at the brink of becoming an alcoholic. Due to this evaluation he is degraded and must accept a salary cut.','/3i8AlnmKymmeOLhysuiNFGhlFjn.jpg','1956-11-21',115,'Released',NULL,'The Railroad Man',57969,1.3021,7.8,'0zG5maPCJrg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3325,_binary '\0','/o2Vx6xE0IHizkYMFqXau2YKLfQp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049223',7.5,57818,'en','Forbidden Planet','Starship C57D travels to planet Altair 4 in search of the crew of spaceship \"Bellerophon,\" a scientific expedition that has been missing for twenty years. They find themselves unwelcome by the expedition\'s lone survivor and warned of destruction by an invisible force if they don\'t turn back immediately.','/aq0OQfRS7hDDI8vyD0ICbH9eguC.jpg','1956-03-23',98,'Released','Earthmen on a fabulous, peril-journey into outer space!','Forbidden Planet',830,7.6394,7.3,'IK5ogIE32vA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3326,_binary '\0','/gftEEZC5F76XBUBB8uOxqZJn14K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049224',6,1702,'en','Foreign Intrigue','When a reclusive, enigmatic millionaire dies suddenly on the Riviera, his press agent begins to investigate his employer\'s shady past.','/cfRRV0paefuhmwiaBjnYpFStyYw.jpg','1956-06-28',95,'Released','Robert Mitchum is the hunted... Europe is the hunting ground!','Foreign Intrigue',50177,1.9493,5.8,'VgOJoEmu9To','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3327,_binary '\0','/fvFiuUUia8A6GBb1eA6MrIzXv06.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049225',6,1388,'en','Forever, Darling','Susan and Lorenzo have been married for over five years and they are starting to drift apart. So into her life comes an angel, which only Susan can see, to tell her that there will be trouble ahead if they do not work out their problems. Lorenzo is developing insecticide #383 at Finlay Vega Chemical Co. and plans to test it on a camping trip that he takes with Susan, but the trip becomes an obstacle course for him.','/vTwVt7OFxA3t7i2qXn7eH7n8aNG.jpg','1956-02-09',91,'Released','M-G-M Presents Their Riotous New Comedy In Color','Forever, Darling',28299,1.4195,6.9,'8C1eAT1WRWs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3328,_binary '\0','/vRkB3lYI26YjXvMEc8IvxM45h8X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049233',7.3,8543,'en','Friendly Persuasion','The story of a family of Quakers in Indiana in 1862. Their religious sect is strongly opposed to violence and war. It\'s not easy for them to meet the rules of their religion in everyday life but when Southern troops pass the area they are in real trouble. Should they fight, despite their peaceful attitude?','/mhsdObvFHoOfgaKAVJUOeK3LiOP.jpg','1956-10-30',137,'Released','Here\'s A Superb Motion Picture Full Of Fun... Laughter and Happiness.','Friendly Persuasion',43258,4.3659,6.639,'gZvExs15jMM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3329,_binary '\0','/8KN3dO60kxzcLHEbAUghlKZKF2k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049259',7.3,1845,'fr','Gervaise','Gervaise Macquart is a beautiful Parisian laundress and mother whose lover, Lantier, walks out on her. She eventually marries Henri Coupeau, a roofer who has an unfortunate accident. As her now crippled husband descends into alcoholism, Gervaise tries to make ends meet on her own. Life becomes even more complicated when Lantier returns and befriends Henri. Meanwhile, the man she really loves is sent to prison.','/njux1vvBuiwR4UJ6FCpYoar9buO.jpg','1956-09-05',112,'Released',NULL,'Gervaise',52726,2.2101,6.725,'eB_dT1d2nt8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3330,_binary '\0','/sm3ErHMXQLaNdo74vbIa1JRXIXS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049261',7.6,44428,'en','Giant','Wealthy rancher Bick Benedict and dirt-poor cowboy Jett Rink both woo Leslie Lynnton, a beautiful young woman from Maryland who is new to Texas. She marries Benedict, but she is shocked by the racial bigotry of the White Texans against the local people of Mexican descent. Rink discovers oil on a small plot of land, and while he uses his vast, new wealth to buy all the land surrounding the Benedict ranch, the Benedict\'s disagreement over prejudice fuels conflict that runs across generations.','/h5RRYPVVuHzd7QOJyP5Dsi8J9XZ.jpg','1956-11-08',201,'Released','Sometimes any man can be a giant . . .','Giant',1712,7.4716,7.6,'SZZTWO4_wto','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3331,_binary '\0','/jLPaevNm9otrwdEM9BNAdPjFlG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049263',6.8,4437,'en','The Girl Can\'t Help It','A down-and-out gangster hires a down-on-his-luck agent to make his girlfriend a recording star within six weeks.','/eN8PI9qc0dkZ19qiv2cTm6hygMx.jpg','1956-12-22',98,'Released','BABY, IT\'S THE GREATEST!','The Girl Can\'t Help It',42839,3.2588,6.292,'W4XVKl4j1VA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3332,_binary '\0','/f6qIMkV8gy5vEBy3RyIOH3vjGeO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049278',6.4,1244,'en','Great Day in the Morning','After a card game, Southerner Owen Pentecost finds himself the owner of a Denver hotel. Involved with two women, he then has to make even more fundamental choices when, with the start of the Civil War, he becomes one of a Confederate minority in a strongly Unionist town.','/ghQY8BJfQKHMk6OQV79gW7X1k1D.jpg','1956-05-16',92,'Released','THE BUGLE BLAST that echoed thru history!','Great Day in the Morning',94192,2.4615,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3333,_binary '\0','/vNAvBHJCwp8KmXVYQ7zBQsDEksL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049279',6.8,1621,'en','The Great Locomotive Chase','During the Civil War, a Union spy, Andrews, is asked to lead a band of Union soldiers into the South so that they could destroy the railway system. However, things don\'t go as planned when the conductor of the train that they stole is on to them and is doing everything he can to stop them. Based on a true story.','/tbU8ECQEhWhMx3rEVaBulmId4s0.jpg','1956-06-08',85,'Released','A true-life spy story of ultimate suspense. High speed and inconceivable bravery!','The Great Locomotive Chase',37112,2.2282,6.4,'ue9-eZf7rZA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3334,_binary '\0','/vq1UFAS62mqJ3ExqyaQwUSTaOJ6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049287',3.9,1941,'en','Gunslinger','After her husband is gunned down, Rose Hood takes his place as sheriff of a small Western town.','/p9aBgbq3104nEBJIRmPF1TpLn8H.jpg','1956-06-01',71,'Released','Hired to kill the woman he loved!','Gunslinger',187790,1.6915,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3335,_binary '\0','/wLx7DUmPu2S6jPlhyfdnEWYLlb5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049291',7.5,10494,'en','The Harder They Fall','Jobless sportswriter Eddie Willis is hired by corrupt fight promoter Nick Benko to promote his current protégé, an unknown Argentinian boxer named Toro Moreno. Although Moreno is a hulking giant, his chances for success are hampered by a powder-puff punch and a glass jaw. Exploiting Willis\' reputation for integrity and standing in the boxing community, Benko arranges a series of fixed fights that propel the unsophisticated Moreno to #1 contender for the championship. The reigning champ, the sadistic Buddy Brannen, harbors resentment at the publicity Toro has been receiving and vows to viciously punish him in the ring. Eddie must now decide whether or not to tell the naive Toro the truth.','/93pUA2kAOeVlyvO1EeW8YmYIapt.jpg','1956-05-08',109,'Released','No Punches Pulled! If you thought \"On The Waterfront\" hit hard... wait till you see this one!','The Harder They Fall',28528,10.1574,7.158,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3336,_binary '\0','/whptTxhPlniSpQBzxmNpQL5F0Hq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049293',7.1,2266,'de','Der Hauptmann von Köpenick','A young shoemaker is arrested for stealing a small amount of money, and is jailed for fifteen years. Upon his release, he wants to get a permit to get a job and start anew, but finds that without a job he can\'t get a permit, and without a permit he can\'t get a job. Ensnared in the absurd net of Prussian bureaucracy, he can\'t see any way out. That is, until he enters a thrift shop and spots a Prussian officer\'s uniform that fits him like a second skin...','/volBGUE8Ch7Xq22VvzYWuYA4ZJB.jpg','1956-08-15',93,'Released',NULL,'The Captain from Kopenick',10626,1.7735,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3337,_binary '\0','/btmQVS7TGeXDOFPfh8Adv46oYX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049301',6.1,3064,'en','Helen of Troy','Prince Paris of Troy, shipwrecked on a mission to the king of Sparta, meets and falls for Queen Helen before he knows who she is. Rudely received by the royal Greeks, he must flee...but fate and their mutual passions lead him to take Helen along. This gives the Greeks just the excuse they need for much-desired war.','/u0JgGavnWfisAkFEhGfu9xbzceS.jpg','1956-01-26',121,'Released','Its towering wonders span the age of titans! Its tumultuous story has lived for thirty centuries!','Helen of Troy',42658,4.6329,6.3,'D2ueECHkpwY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3338,_binary '\0','/oV3FcC9A8gQCphOt40IcCwujNx0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049314',6.9,19390,'en','High Society','With socialite Tracy Lord about to remarry, her ex-husband - with the help of a sympathetic reporter - has 48 hours to convince her that she really still loves him.','/eOKLignOrNN7pgTQbwCzW6WPwbD.jpg','1956-07-17',112,'Released','They\'re all together for the first time!','High Society',11424,6.5613,6.834,'bYIFS2jxwbk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3339,_binary '\0','/dv97f0wt4s69u9kB2ZexunxSSqo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049322',6.4,2577,'en','Hollywood or Bust','The last movie with Jerry Lewis and Dean Martin together, is a satire of the life in Hollywood. Steve Wiley is a deceiver who cheats Malcolm Smith when he wins a car, claiming that he won it too. Trying to steal the car, Steve tells Malcolm that he lives in Hollywood, next to Anita Ekberg\'s. When Malcom hears that, they both set out for Hollywood and the adventure begins...','/mm6VZSq6251wy3ynqNDHW7aoWfx.jpg','1956-12-06',95,'Released','A COAST TO COAST FUN TOOT!','Hollywood or Bust',43259,2.6246,6.2,'bBUl4eJ7bJk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3340,_binary '\0','/acVsRJUJIRrBlFarElklGYb5tvt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049357',6.5,2242,'en','Ill Met by Moonlight','Led by British officers, partisans on Crete plan to kidnap the island\'s German commander and smuggle him to Cairo to embarrass the occupiers.','/xJVmq3Jxytt3o4vXP46Xj5M9ZLP.jpg','1957-01-31',104,'Released','They stole a General under the noses of his 20,000 crack paratroops.','Ill Met by Moonlight',54797,2.3623,6.2,'oavjpreBteU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3341,_binary '\0','/dOqFKzcTRPOuAjBpNevHLODP5Zj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049358',5.8,1666,'ru','Илья Муромец','Paralyzed since birth, Ilya can only watch helplessly as his village is plundered by barbarians. But when a mysterious traveler arrives with a magic elixir that restores him to full health, Ilya begins an adventure to protect the village and the royal family from harm.','/o56Hm5uR7FkYY4JJz2X8pfXStrm.jpg','1956-09-09',91,'Released','Eye-Filling Spectacle! Man Against Monsters! The Largest Cast Ever Used in a Motion Picture! A cast of 106,000! 11,000 horses!','Ilya Muromets',118153,1.7526,5.2,'d1A8FbJWlQ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3342,_binary '\0','/3bAoBfuCIVbIRLOBL8Nqerdycuz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049363',4.5,3443,'en','Indestructible Man','A scientific experiment involving subjecting a corpse to an extreme charge of electricity accidentally revives an executed criminal and makes him impervious to harm, allowing him to seek revenge on his former partners, and deal similarly with anyone else who gets in his way.','/kcD0kG86GK2mUHjNf6QoDfwtnxd.jpg','1956-03-24',72,'Released','The Screen\'s 300,000 Volt SHOCKER!','Indestructible Man',48385,1.6076,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3343,_binary '\0','/qcLHMO01oECjbL8MUPRXsLOMFhx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049366',7.7,60531,'en','Invasion of the Body Snatchers','A small-town doctor learns that the population of his community is being replaced by emotionless alien duplicates.','/8BrMQmgwGzIHSyBjCDOLOdi79fJ.jpg','1956-02-05',80,'Released','There was nothing to hold onto - except each other.','Invasion of the Body Snatchers',11549,5.6337,7.455,'9SqN8wHry2M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3344,_binary '\0','/rXAvTVNeGuJKb2BjjwNhyeqGYgu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049369',5.1,1371,'en','The Iron Petticoat','Captain Vinka Kovalenko defects from Russia, but not for political reasons. She defects because she feels discriminated against as a woman. Captain Chuck Lockwood gets the order to show her the bright side of capitalism, while she tries to convince him of the superiority of communism. Naturally, they fall in love, but there\'s still the KGB, which doesn\'t like the idea of having a defected Russian officer running around in London.','/hL66vNYhj5rY0Y7dA25oVmaspRP.jpg','1956-09-01',87,'Released','Bob and Kate...Simply Great','The Iron Petticoat',40953,2.2021,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3345,_binary '\0','/hVvio72dIEXRyNEjfb9wnDGYMfU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049370',5,3012,'en','It Conquered the World','An alien from Venus tries to take over the world with the help of a disillusioned human scientist, as his wife, his best friend and the friend\'s wife try to intervene.','/ed5aKwjf0xJ0yoX2faFUULVLqJJ.jpg','1956-07-14',71,'Released','Every man its prisoner... every woman its slave!','It Conquered the World',27625,2.0742,4.839,'5vD-Z56Px_k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3346,_binary '\0','/olZbFWC4tt702yyiBUwCgn0fYBE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049388',6.2,2474,'en','Julie','A terrified stewardess is stalked by her psychotic estranged husband.','/l7hT7H5k9Ccibphx8oyQFHDBv3N.jpg','1956-10-17',99,'Released','Run JULIE Run, Run For Your Life!','Julie',45726,1.4181,5.8,'1JChCrHa6Bg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3347,_binary '\0','/tbt8vxgw6Zkrzc1YvCKw4Rul8ef.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049397',7.4,3602,'ru','Карнавальная ночь','It is the New Year\'s Eve and the employees of an Economics Institute are ready with their annual New Year\'s entertainment program. It includes a lot of dancing and singing, jazz band performance and even magic tricks. Suddenly, an announcement is made that a new director has been elected and that he is arriving shortly. Comrade Ogurtsov arrives in time to review and disapprove of the scheduled entertainment. To him, holiday fun has a different meaning. He imagines speakers reading annual reports to show the Institute\'s progress over the year, and, perhaps, a bit of serious music, something from the Classics, played by the Veterans\' Orchestra. Obviously, no one wants to change the program a few hours before the show, much less to replace it with something so boring! Now everyone has to team up in order to prevent Ogurtsov from getting to the stage. As some of them trap Ogurtsov one way or another, others perform their scheduled pieces and celebrate New Year\'s Eve.','/yQ0Vk0FifhPr21K7oGqBSSkiXF9.jpg','1956-12-29',78,'Released',NULL,'Carnival Night',63258,1.541,7.018,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3348,_binary '\0','/1SAnrRCXlstd2sUbptyvUakCwnS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049405',6.6,2843,'en','The Killer Is Loose','A savings-and-loan bank is robbed; later, a police wiretap identifies meek bank teller Leon Poole as the inside man. In capturing him, detective Sam Wagner accidentally kills Poole\'s young wife, and at his trial Poole swears vengeance against Wagner. Poole begins his plans to get revenge when he escapes his captors.','/wpBlgwCmotclMPMqYlCJJ15l9lj.jpg','1956-02-03',73,'Released','He was no ordinary killer... She was no ordinary victim... This is no ordinary motion picture!','The Killer Is Loose',27999,2.4563,6.7,'UgMaFfPRTTA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3349,_binary '\0','/2EltoldCMsYmP2BXJVGiuNalEWv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049406',7.9,107251,'en','The Killing','Career criminal Johnny Clay recruits a sharpshooter, a crooked police officer, a bartender and a betting teller named George, among others, for one last job before he goes straight and gets married. But when George tells his restless wife about the scheme to steal millions from the racetrack where he works, she hatches a plot of her own.','/A6VzUPcADZGYdGHlVdWvpMNDF5d.jpg','1956-06-06',85,'Released','In all its fury and violence...','The Killing',247,6.5728,7.643,'c0Odg-GY40w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3350,_binary '\0','/cKDHwk5HfE6OiNWBuc301w98srZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049407',6.1,2257,'en','The King and Four Queens','Opportunistic con man Dan Kehoe ingratiates himself with the cantankerous mother of four outlaws and their beautiful widows in order to find their hidden gold.','/w6lTWootXbnAH0HwPcEkShId9jH.jpg','1956-12-21',86,'Released','The King plays the hottest game in the West . . . with four Queens!','The King and Four Queens',43310,3.001,5.6,'Dxt4Vk8mMpY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3351,_binary '\0','/gjFI54BO9f6eZ2iQyNDhgVVnUCJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049408',7.4,29825,'en','The King and I','Widowed Welsh mother Anna Leonowens becomes a governess and English tutor to the wives and many children of the stubborn King Mongkut of Siam. Anna and the King have a clash of personalities as she works to teach the royal family about the English language, customs and etiquette, and rushes to prepare a party for a group of European diplomats who must change their opinions about the King.','/wUfaP0lLaMpZzp5CrHyII5Vd7cp.jpg','1956-06-29',133,'Released','More than your eyes have ever seen… More than your heart has ever known!','The King and I',16520,5.2669,7.1,'YZ80o1SY71o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3352,_binary '\0','/eOnvnsTi7twr8yBEC2iHiAcXyv5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049414',6.7,5073,'en','A Kiss Before Dying','A college student tries to get rich quick by wooing two wealthy sisters.','/uaTmtWGxiPStGEcMG5qn5eGBYh.jpg','1956-04-20',94,'Released','He had looks, charm ... and killer instincts.','A Kiss Before Dying',53712,3.8612,6.3,'95IWP5U_cmw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3353,_binary '\0','/9aaJz2gKQInDkvydxz0qULE0XBE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049419',7.7,1244,'el','Το κορίτσι με τα μαύρα','Against the backdrop of a cloudless summer, love\'s unforeseen complications will entwine an Athenian writer, a morosely beautiful daughter, and a scorned local suitor. And then, calamity strikes. Can love redeem the sad girl in black?','/eAmHzdte0jYvHWgeid1d0zlftG6.jpg','1956-06-08',100,'Released',NULL,'A Girl in Black',98184,1.0878,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3354,_binary '\0','/mQHNNSDMIYiM4PRQTLwsMnfohR7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049429',6.5,2355,'it','I vampiri','A mad scientist captures young women and drains their blood, in order to keep alive an ancient, evil duchess.','/1erlBZP5BKOvZJQ7yv0eDpKrY47.jpg','1957-04-05',78,'Released','The mad scientist who killed for fun! Beautiful girls were victims of his evil mind!','Lust of the Vampire',28061,1.9251,6.3,'Sh1JvowDpqY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3355,_binary '\0','/3LVTHUel2ZROYmIlUFUFtKRdphU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049431',6.4,1970,'en','The Last Frontier','Three trappers become scouts for a cavalry captain who loses his fort to a hated colonel.','/fKGgDmIh5BHPMKGK8dmsbJXBckI.jpg','1955-12-07',98,'Released','CinemaScope brings you all its continent-sweeping power!','The Last Frontier',4938,2.9088,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3356,_binary '\0','/lMHIWIo6c3U71phAfg5JLvyjVY2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049432',6.8,2071,'en','The Last Hunt','A buffalo hunter has a falling-out with his partner, who kills for fun.','/mw6WJu91gK2QYwOlU3wIx7xZSUi.jpg','1956-04-19',108,'Released','M-G-M presents the GREAT STORY in CINEMASCOPE and COLOR','The Last Hunt',127564,1.7784,6.9,'gMPqSUaItHg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3357,_binary '\0','/4kNd1bI8pWDDThZi53DdlRKIsAQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049434',7,4240,'en','The Last Wagon','When a handful of settlers survive an Apache attack on their wagon train they must put their lives into the hands of Comanche Todd, a white man who has lived with the Comanches most of his life and is wanted for the murder of three men.','/2FHbwL1RZCeAsBRSBVuxYRj9Mhl.jpg','1956-09-21',99,'Released','Nothing Could Stop the Last Wagon From Coming Through!','The Last Wagon',44921,2.6751,6.456,'Lba7Kmt7qXo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3358,_binary '\0','/48oxvgG5yrMPA2f9cPEhi9mHOV4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049452',6.2,5224,'en','Love Me Tender','After the Civil War, Confederate soldiers Clint and Vance Reno steal a Union payroll, leading to conflict when the younger marries the woman his older brother loves.','/4PdRIIrBN4q8H7f8yGbd0ScpTjh.jpg','1956-11-15',89,'Released','Love him strong... Love him sweet... Love him tender!','Love Me Tender',39833,2.8648,6.242,'2miAukzxHNI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3359,_binary '\0','/94Svsxxbww7xR7LrfDIjlQpJUeY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049456',7.3,13255,'en','Lust for Life','An intense and imaginative artist, revered Dutch painter Vincent van Gogh possesses undeniable talent, but he is plagued by mental problems and frustrations with failure. Supported by his brother, Theo, the tormented Van Gogh eventually leaves Holland for France, where he meets volatile fellow painter Paul Gauguin and struggles to find greater inspiration.','/rlK3LG3W41eF3N1tk0SEM7Dln2x.jpg','1956-09-15',122,'Released','He had a lust for life. Sometimes he was brutal, sometimes delicate – always he lived with insatiable passion!','Lust for Life',29592,3.3357,7.2,'2Z3xHMNHQUs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3360,_binary '\0','/bXPKTWAuRO8Mu5rLCORFagX0YZ1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049470',7.4,76981,'en','The Man Who Knew Too Much','An American doctor and his wife, a former singing star, witness a murder while vacationing in Morocco, and are drawn into a twisting plot of international intrigue when their young son is kidnapped.','/gy8YBRjCQRIT9x9G9F5fpnFD4xw.jpg','1956-05-16',121,'Released','A little knowledge can be a deadly thing!','The Man Who Knew Too Much',574,8.1726,7.431,'YP8brOVQnKA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3361,_binary '\0','/ybrl3pEoMwJ9YVZnTdS2Tmyhvvu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049471',7.4,6431,'en','The Man Who Never Was','The true story of a British effort to trick the Germans into weakening Sicily\'s defenses before the 1943 attack. A dead soldier is dressed as a British officer and outfitted with faked papers showing that the Allies were intending to invade occupied Greece. His body is put into the sea where it will ultimately drift ashore and the papers be passed along to German Intelligence.','/ajb6naQi07fPhyJQ9DxkrGNU4Sw.jpg','1956-04-03',103,'Released','The most fiendish plot ever conceived! The most amazing \"human being\" ever created! The most diabolical phantom--','The Man Who Never Was',43791,3.2498,7,'CXyFkINMcI8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3362,_binary '\0','/oaGEEOWIcWqbPrYIsbHyxuPijJF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049474',7.1,4569,'en','The Man in the Gray Flannel Suit','Tom Rath is a suburban father and husband haunted by his memories of World War II, including a wartime romance with Italian village girl Maria, which resulted in an illegitimate son he\'s never seen. Pressed by his unhappy wife to get a higher-paying job, Rath goes to work as a public relations man for television network president Ralph Hopkins. Drawn into poisonous office politics, Tom finds he must choose his career or his family.','/zSsJcyfufRUx7eJ74NiW4Wiochc.jpg','1956-04-12',153,'Released','His loves...his world---both past and present---and the crisis they caused!','The Man in the Gray Flannel Suit',28290,2.9864,6.7,'BfrqYr58st0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3363,_binary '\0','/rGnZ7z5OinGJvfPomgOdBV03RW0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049509',7.1,1581,'en','Miracle in the Rain','Wartime romance about a lonely man and woman who meet one rainy afternoon in New York.','/nDcOSQFFMo6qwr9fvOhQWefnxTX.jpg','1956-03-31',108,'Released','You will see a picture of very, very special greatness.','Miracle in the Rain',79521,2.0753,6.9,'6icklLTHXqM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3364,_binary '\0','/lbuYAwwTuqiWgpzlxMMPrYkUop4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049513',7.3,23364,'en','Moby Dick','In 1841, young Ishmael signs up for service aboard the Pequod, a whaler sailing out of New Bedford. The ship is under the command of Captain Ahab, a strict disciplinarian who exhorts his men to find Moby Dick, the great white whale. Ahab lost his leg to that creature and is desperate for revenge. As the crew soon learns, he will stop at nothing to gain satisfaction.','/7JXcm3RyWlGsRCZ0YlOliWr6TNv.jpg','1956-06-27',115,'Released','The man – The whale – The vengeance – The mightiest adventure ever seen!','Moby Dick',10339,5.2621,7.054,'8HXVJA2XqPo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3365,_binary '\0','/buU4bsenncCbSMkTfdk3Jg5pxTb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049516',5.1,4329,'en','The Mole People','A party of archaeologists discovers the remnants of a five millennia-old mutant Sumerian civilization living beneath a glacier atop a mountain in Mesopatamia.','/utOyyOn1KQ47ONwtAlC8M9i7zmW.jpg','1956-12-01',77,'Released','...a savage civilization a million years old, raging with blood-lusting fury!','The Mole People',41516,2.1267,5.2,'4gbcUCC7vxQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3366,_binary '\0','/7CZRjhX7LIqljczO2GiX1R5a39m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049518',6.9,2047,'fr','Le Monde du silence','Join renowned explorer Jacques-Yves Cousteau as he investigates aquatic habitats worldwide, showcasing whales, sharks, and diverse marine life. The film highlights the brutal realities of nature while capturing the wonder of underwater exploration, as the team ventures into previously unseen ocean depths.','/ys1AiQJbQPNimud1kZQ91FgOJLR.jpg','1956-02-15',86,'Released','Out of an uncharted universe comes an experience of unearthly beauty','The Silent World',60234,1.5456,6.5,'JWtWG0JyCXI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3367,_binary '\0','/26YhgzoUHKGPyuCDa7rKneDhxNp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049521',6.7,2879,'fr','La Mort en ce jardin','In a remote Amazon jungle village, a group of angry diamond prospectors revolt when the local government undertakes a violent crackdown.','/3HSPxDE0rvvvklNxYqba8glk3S5.jpg','1956-09-21',105,'Released','Torrid!… Tantalizing!… Tempestuous!…','Death in the Garden',35206,2.1356,6.366,'1HkkMSTEKms','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3368,_binary '\0','/ifAayB4LKgnSMRrGuBnb6OkjMDW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049523',6.8,2508,'en','The Mountain','Selfish Chris Teller pressures his older brother, a retired climber, to accompany him on a treacherous Alpine climb to loot the bodies of plane crash victims.','/Zj2jJ2Oel89W9O7i787bkwxvS1.jpg','1956-05-31',105,'Released','IT FILLS THE SCREEN with Excitement and Suspense!','The Mountain',57993,2.3926,6.942,'JhUx66guX7I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3369,_binary '\0','/l9X5sv1UpSn9MtTWgC2a5r6k8L7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049531',7.5,2959,'fr','Le Mystère Picasso','Using a specially designed transparent \'canvas\' to provide an unobstructed view, Picasso creates as the camera rolls. He begins with simple works that take shape after only a single brush stroke. He then progresses to more complex paintings, in which he repeatedly adds and removes elements, transforming the entire scene at will, until at last the work is complete.','/kY1Qo3rtkTiElT4iQMiHL9oEDNG.jpg','1956-05-18',78,'Released',NULL,'The Mystery of Picasso',71822,1.2769,7.4,'gHlTvE-AI3Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3370,_binary '\0','/eBvR7VdA23wgDSFQZFLdrkksPS7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049537',7.5,1326,'ja','流れる','Otsuta is running the geisha house Tsuta in Tokyo. Her business is heavily in debt. Her daughter Katsuyo doesn\'t see any future in her mother\'s trade in the late days of geisha. But Otsuta will not give up. This film portrays the day time life of geisha when not entertaining customers.','/cgf4Jmc8IqJydUO3p6IaDr7WYPQ.jpg','1956-11-20',117,'Released',NULL,'Flowing',46493,1.531,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3371,_binary '\0','/byldnuAlhqMvij4cVG5d72wuDFZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049552',7.1,5806,'en','Nightfall','An innocent man turns fugitive as he reconstructs events that implicate him for a murder and robbery he did not commit.','/nFAXOu7vz23YAmcCaH7YI2F7a2V.jpg','1956-11-09',79,'Released','THE BLACK BAG... with $350,000 in loot! THE BLACK DRESS... with a beautiful pick-up girl inside! THE BLACK NIGHT... made for lovers... and killers!','Nightfall',34667,2.1927,6.875,'mhMJG7qmJkE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3372,_binary '\0','/uIIqfuckKarV3rdcfuo6tIG0IVT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049553',6.4,1549,'en','Nightmare','Clarinetist Stan has a nightmare about killing a man in a mirrored room. But when he wakes up and finds blood marks on himself and a key from the dream, he suspects that it may have truly happened.','/oOfLa5l3unWLdyGC7Ky00rKvA4i.jpg','1956-08-20',89,'Released','Beware! These are the eyes of a hypnotist!','Nightmare',35418,1.4914,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3373,_binary '\0','/8K1yOP2ZCsf5RFi2Eqz1nYS8ZHd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049578',6.1,2231,'en','The Opposite Sex','Former radio singer Kay learns from her gossipy friends that her husband, Steve, has had an affair with chorus girl Crystal. Devastated, Kay tries to ignore the information, but when Crystal performs one of her musical numbers at a charity benefit, she breaks down and goes to Reno to file for divorce. However, when she hears that gold-digging Crystal is making Steve unhappy, Kay resolves to get her husband back. The Opposite Sex is a remake of the 1939 comedy The Women.','/piXpVWU67Y9XXJKSHAlP95vd3EG.jpg','1956-11-15',116,'Released','There\'s one thing on their minds- MEN!','The Opposite Sex',43311,1.8588,5.4,'zz1mn8S-Vyk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3374,_binary '\0','/3FTIFfsr01Kwfe2yqEC3BDAKkwz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049593',6.2,1936,'en','Pardners','Rich momma\'s boy Wade Kingsley Jr. an Eastern dude, tries to follow in his murdered father\'s footsteps by returning to the West to partner up with Slim Moseley Jr.,the son of his father\'s former partner. Wade overcomes Slim\'s initial reluctance to accept him by using his fortune to buy a prize cow and new car to help Slim in his job as foreman on the Kingsley family ranch, currently under siege by a gang of outlaws called \"masked raiders.\" Wade generously tries to pay off the ranch\'s mortgage with $15,000 of his own money, but unfortunately neither \"pardner\" realizes that respected banker Dan Hollis, the son of their fathers\' murderer, is the leader of the gang.','/hOwKUmyVhmvPdOudF9S3vde0Ky6.jpg','1956-08-01',88,'Released','You\'ll Ride With \'Em! Shoot With \'Em! Laugh With \'Em! In The Biggest Bestest Funniest Most Musical Western Yet!','Pardners',22390,2.1561,6.7,'zyFeHr8Vaxo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3375,_binary '\0','/mAIotGHIXdPc5AXctoMlFRQYv2C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049601',7.7,4288,'en','Patterns','To eliminate internal opposition, a cruel CEO sabotages and humiliates a good-natured executive in an effort to force his resignation — and make the reticent new hire his new yes man.','/yFaLK81bTKW1SZMSgK9efvsvFdN.jpg','1956-03-27',83,'Released','Ruthless Men And Ambitious Women... Clawing For Control Of A Billion Dollar Empire!!!','Patterns',86782,1.5962,7.2,'B7oWRDpst6g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3376,_binary '\0','/uqmWjWwsBjgm2uGQQjufni7s9VO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049615',3.7,2322,'en','The Phantom from 10,000 Leagues','A marine biologist and a government agent investigate mysterious deaths and rumors of a sea monster in a secluded ocean cove, and find themselves involved with a marine biology professor conducting secretive experiments, international spies trying to steal his secrets, a radioactive light on the sea bottom, and the malevolent thing which guards it.','/eADSHxjhYZ0Pynj2NKHNKwASS8d.jpg','1955-12-01',80,'Released','Terror is about to surface!','The Phantom from 10,000 Leagues',29412,1.537,4.2,'IJXYRC8-WUI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3377,_binary '\0','/oGU2KQa0e6m4qnMzqhUi4hWAjg1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049621',6.5,1965,'en','Please Murder Me','A lawyer tries to exact justice on a woman he defended in court -- a woman whom he found out was guilty after getting her off.','/tELEXOSV6eqI7275sNFcnFF5QVy.jpg','1956-03-01',78,'Released','You are going to commit another murder...','Please Murder Me',46421,2.0269,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3378,_binary '\0','/2QSoRg11bRENT19SIcpISJaIWrd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049639',6.9,1889,'en','The Proud Ones','Robert Ryan plays an aging sheriff responsible for law and order in a frontier cattle town. Virginia Mayo plays his fiancee. As if handling wild cattle drovers isn\'t enough, a crooked casino operator from Ryan\'s past comes to town. An early scuffle in the casino leaves Ryan with vision problems that interfere with his duties. Jeffrey Hunter who came to town with a cattle drive encounters Ryan, who killed Hunter\'s father when Hunter was young. Feelings of animosity soon change as Hunter begins to sense Ryan is telling the truth about his father. What follows is a plot that continues to thicken to the inevitable showdown.','/zLmmAfWiCf4XSov9YYtzEsuh95W.jpg','1956-05-15',94,'Released','A MAN OF FIERCE PRIDE...and six-guns to match!','The Proud Ones',107625,2.1508,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3379,_binary '\0','/hEK998lceNeL6kSkQzHfmuH1Ld.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049646',6.6,8749,'en','The Quatermass Xperiment','The first manned spacecraft, fired from an English launchpad, is lost from radar before roaring back to Earth and crashing in a farmer\'s field. The rocket is found to contain only one of the three men who took off in it; and he is unable to talk but appears to be undergoing a torturous physical and mental metamorphosis.','/lm6cQiUjJ0AUUqESI9WWM7veIbp.jpg','1955-09-26',82,'Released','You Can\'t Escape It!','The Quatermass Xperiment',24580,2.985,6.5,'6Scm9my7Vaw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3380,_binary '\0','/8IG1yDCyYNLKtWBNxdYCA8LLmmn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049652',6.8,1829,'en','The Rack','Army Captain Edward Hall returns to the U.S. after two years in a prison camp in the Korean War. In the camp, he was brainwashed and helped the Chinese convince the other prisoners that they were fighting an unjust war. When he comes back he is charged for collaboration with the enemy. Where does loyalty end in a prison camp, when the camp is a living hell?','/rX5LTigzW7MOuTZeMBNwdQfC6RV.jpg','1956-11-02',100,'Released','Paul Newman, a wonderful new star!','The Rack',82838,2.0643,6.6,'KkRqmu0uhdw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3381,_binary '\0','/djgaAIIFsAO18QQs1ofQ5fkH8OR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049653',6.9,4708,'en','The Rainmaker','Lizzie Curry is on the verge of becoming a hopeless old maid. Her wit and intelligence and skills as a homemaker can\'t make up for the fact that she\'s just plain plain! Even the town sheriff, File, for whom she harbors a secrect yen, won\'t take a chance --- until the town suffers a drought and into the lives of Lizzie and her brothers and father comes one Bill Starbuck ... profession: Rainmaker!','/3E2dmfh3e2LOKq0psiNXAGwtZGl.jpg','1956-12-13',121,'Released','It\'s about the magic that makes a woman beautiful when she\'s wanted by a man!','The Rainmaker',43542,2.603,6.856,'Tf4HDY4XiW4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3382,_binary '\0','/iD5WzA6cJso1IGtqkigjHfPJrRd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049656',7,2712,'en','Ransom!','A wealthy business man stuns his wife and town with a televised response to his son\'s kidnappers.','/5uWehbIMf2aQSW6r6ENad23dhHS.jpg','1956-01-24',109,'Released','When that phone rings --','Ransom!',110754,1.913,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3383,_binary '\0','/pujpNHRw5wFJNmRy8upv75WWywn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049665',7.2,3279,'en','Reach for the Sky','The true story of airman Douglas Bader who overcame the loss of both legs in a 1931 flying accident to become a successful fighter pilot and wing leader during World War II.','/2OKZUqjoIC71vkJ8SUR7DzvXAvw.jpg','1956-07-05',135,'Released',NULL,'Reach for the Sky',22350,2.4499,6.9,'bzWUt2xrFBo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3384,_binary '\0','/yVPt70dRNKG5ki3WCDuinK7sjRF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049674',7.3,5952,'en','Richard III','Having helped his brother King Edward IV take the throne of England, the jealous hunchback Richard, Duke of Gloucester, plots to seize power for himself. Masterfully deceiving and plotting against nearly everyone in the royal court, including his eventual wife, Lady Anne, and his brother George, Duke of Clarence, Richard orchestrates a bloody rise to power before finding all his gains jeopardized by those he betrayed.','/3zp2Kg5bvlFkKmWiQLmuWQAIEgG.jpg','1955-12-13',155,'Released','Conscience is a word that cowards use.','Richard III',43323,3.1467,7.2,'p2dfLcOfZog','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3385,_binary '\0','/nB9lo9DbROGQQd8dcQ5UnI2ouQm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049682',6.2,1433,'en','Rock Around the Clock','A frustrated big-band promoter runs in to rock-and-rollers Bill Haley and the Comets at a small-town dance. He quickly becomes their manager and, with the help of Alan Freed, hopes to bring the new sound to the entire country. But will a conniving booking agent, with a personal ax to grind with the manager, conspire to keep the band from making the big time?','/9ARK9a3zovLoNsJIc3T1JCEo8AF.jpg','1956-03-21',77,'Released','The screen\'s first great rock \'n\' roll feature!','Rock Around the Clock',93061,1.5915,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3386,_binary '\0','/cq8COVinj9TwnuIR6LMMHTjVcqn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049696',6.4,1707,'en','Run for the Sun','Mike, a Hemingway-esque adventure novelist, is spending his days in a self-imposed exile somewhere in Central America. A reporter for Sight Magazine, Katie, has tracked him down in the hope of getting the biggest scoop of her career. Mike falls for Katie. On a flight to Mexico City, their plane crashes near a remote hideaway of Nazi war criminals in hiding. The Nazis want to stay hidden and plan to dispose of their new guests','/4QcUVK1mPGPzKYiykMP9rfldQCY.jpg','1956-07-30',99,'Released','Clawing...Killing...Hacking his way across a thousand miles of steaming jungle!','Run for the Sun',65402,2.476,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3387,_binary '\0','/sL1Jv69vMefWm0BeowsETS07ALm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049710',7.5,7325,'ja','宮本武蔵完結編 決闘巌流島','A humble and simple Takezo abandons his life as a knight errant. He\'s sought as a teacher and vassal by Shogun, Japan\'s most powerful clan leader. He\'s also challenged to fight by the supremely confident and skillful Sasaki Kojiro. Takezo agrees to fight Kojiro in a year\'s time but rejects Shogun\'s patronage, choosing instead to live on the edge of a village, raising vegetables. He\'s followed there by Otsu and later by Akemi, both in love with him. The year ends as Takezo assists the villagers against a band of brigands. He seeks Otsu\'s forgiveness and accepts her love, then sets off across the water to Ganryu Island for his final contest.','/oVGMAef2EGjeXc4rJTTqTJq1ib4.jpg','1956-01-03',105,'Released',NULL,'Samurai III: Duel at Ganryu Island',31378,2.6936,7.2,'7Y9tdDAcHzY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3388,_binary '\0','/fik1HN9kxpD4CtEOXA4WUruwsg1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049730',7.8,103865,'en','The Searchers','As a Civil War veteran spends years searching for a young niece captured by Indians, his motivation becomes increasingly questionable.','/jLBmgW0epNzJ1N9uzaVCjbyT94v.jpg','1956-05-16',119,'Released','He had to find her... he had to find her...','The Searchers',3114,8.7955,7.7,'pJXgjw_5erE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3389,_binary '\0','/srKjwlWBDJs4gb06SSHmS85apYz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049743',7.4,6770,'en','7 Men from Now','Former sheriff Ben Stride, haunted by the loss of his wife in a Wells Fargo robbery, hunts for the seven men responsible for her death – along the way, encountering a couple heading west for California, and an outlaw he once arrested.','/1RMUXKkFimEWfGSenop5Gd7Buo4.jpg','1956-07-24',78,'Released',NULL,'7 Men from Now',26502,3.4159,6.8,'hB-IdQfiS9o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3390,_binary '\0','/C6GzvNmk1Fz75KeLyucJxsXtUA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049745',5.8,1588,'en','7th Cavalry','An officer accused of cowardice volunteers to bring back General Custers\'s body after Little Big Horn.','/cTyK2zcjXUKJeRCUDCKdqHvozbG.jpg','1956-12-01',75,'Released','CHARGING THE BATTLE LINES OF THE SIOUX AND THE CHEYENNES!','7th Cavalry',43254,2.1067,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3391,_binary '\0','/xvcqme7lPw7nXNIQU71z11bbWRd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049762',6.7,8144,'de','Sissi - Die junge Kaiserin','Sissi is now the empress of Austria and attempts to learn etiquette. While she is busy being empress she also has to deal with her difficult new mother-in-law, while the arch-duchess Sophie is trying to tell the emperor how to rule and also Sissi how to be a mother.','/eGBCl0qGEwNbNu0nc5KOWYdBce4.jpg','1956-12-01',107,'Released',NULL,'Sissi: The Young Empress',458,3.339,7.045,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3392,_binary '\0','/7vxJh0wbeLimDKaVG53BYfrsJil.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049769',6.5,1476,'en','Slightly Scarlet','Kleptomaniac Dorothy Lyons is paroled from prison into the custody of her sister June, secretary to \"reform\" politician Frank Jansen. Ben Grace, associate of crime boss Sol \"Solly\" Caspar, sees this as a way to smear Jansen\'s campaign. Seductive Dorothy will do anything to get what she wants, which includes having a good time with Ben-- whom June is now in love with.','/zYULWjzDauzpHUSHeX3Hxb8sU85.jpg','1956-02-29',99,'Released','Out of the shadows of a vice-ridden city comes James M. Cain\'s most explosive drama!','Slightly Scarlet',25506,3.2757,6.2,'5eZMkeblXEs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3393,_binary '\0','/myTbCq45n29mJQMcSefcfwgXYAl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049777',7.4,2782,'en','The Solid Gold Cadillac','Laura Partridge is a very enthusiastic small stockholder of 10 shares in International Projects, a large corporation based in New York. She attends her first stockholder meeting ready to question the board of directors from their salaries to their operations.','/ennpt6fPoCQSzULMr6oK1CXtIx2.jpg','1956-08-22',99,'Released','Anything can happen to the girl in...','The Solid Gold Cadillac',78331,3.0166,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3394,_binary '\0','/pIMNDAeuhcKj78aGEUn0Vu7jtDZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049778',7.5,9788,'en','Somebody Up There Likes Me','The story of boxer Rocky Graziano\'s rise from juvenile delinquent to world champ.','/pyuqFqGJZuhFDAWCSCmRTdyJVQ9.jpg','1956-07-04',113,'Released','A Girl Can Lift A Fellow To The Skies!','Somebody Up There Likes Me',28000,3.6436,7.2,'uSKPN3Upt64','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3395,_binary '\0','/f6p9g80p9IEYiA5l9lvtdmkENDv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049782',6.2,6827,'ja','空の大怪獸 ラドン','Mining engineer Shigeru investigates the disappearance and death of his fellow coworkers when prehistoric nymphs are discovered emerging from the mines. After an attack on the local village, Shigeru heads deeper into the mines only to make a more horrifying discovery in the form a prehistoric flying creature. Soon a second monster appears as the two converge in Fukuoka.','/mSrpaNrAIH2u0tiYvjca8yakj28.jpg','1956-12-26',72,'Released','Born from a volcanic crater, the crimson monster bird Rodan tramples the Earth','Rodan',19742,2.9942,6.5,'i5jfCb6-2RA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3396,_binary '\0','/5If6RAu3bukc476IoqiowLUKlGh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049783',7.4,1901,'ru','Сорок первый','An unexpected romance occurs for a female Red Army sniper and a White Army officer.','/xckVzPkiC09803rRrQD9mA63Hfx.jpg','1956-10-15',88,'Released',NULL,'The Forty-First',46741,1.2894,6.906,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3397,_binary '\0','/l0WJpDWrRGqZabwVlNEl42VKMVz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049784',7.7,4360,'ja','早春','A young salaryman and his wife struggle within the confines of their passionless relationship while he embarks on an extramarital affair.','/aEZuNAL70fVDiAoSG2sAEVHa3xO.jpg','1956-01-29',145,'Released',NULL,'Early Spring',20531,2.1266,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3398,_binary '\0','/vygBtBlFcnNWjgAIjYAXwcxOBbf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049794',7.1,1668,'ru','Старик Хоттабыч','A boy named Volka discovers an ancient vessel on the bottom of a river. When he opens it, a genie emerges from there. He calls himself Hassan Abdurrahman ibn Khottab, or in Russian style Khottabych. Grateful Khottabych is ready to fulfill any of Volka\'s wishes. But it appears that Volka should use the powers of the genie carefully, for they can have undesirable results.','/7YzxhZDa7zzuGiBPcFzgUPVRLTQ.jpg','1957-07-12',86,'Released',NULL,'Old Man Khottabych',71103,1.371,7.025,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3399,_binary '\0','/cgwXYh8WNIv1FEJ98yYaRfRaTVh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049800',6.6,1918,'en','Storm Center','Politicians go after a small-town librarian when she refuses to ban a book. She\'s quickly labeled a Communist.','/1roPYFlTDXucRbzwfJ7q7HsWHHf.jpg','1956-07-31',85,'Released','Who really set the town aflame?...','Storm Center',45239,1.6722,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3400,_binary '\0','/al45i3WpP2pmLEytvO70G3Js7Lk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049801',6.4,1406,'en','Storm Fear','A wounded bank robber takes over his brother\'s home.','/NyojUKHvOqkmpSjWJOQyWRdOc3.jpg','1955-12-16',88,'Released','... tonight her terror would begin!','Storm Fear',75637,1.4455,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3401,_binary '\0','/9GdITJmnjBNdzFA0hRRIgTAaIm1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049815',6.4,3170,'en','The Swan','Princess Beatrice\'s days of enjoying the regal life are numbered unless her only daughter, Princess Alexandra, makes a good impression on a distant cousin when he pays a surprise visit to their palace. Prince Albert has searched all over Europe for a bride and he\'s bored by the whole courtship routine. He is more interested in the estate\'s dairy than Alexandra\'s rose garden. And then he starts playing football with the tutor and Alexandra\'s brothers. Invite the tutor to the ball that night and watch how gracefully Alexandra dances with him.','/cCk7UhSLafu1hdBVMPy7nzHSSH2.jpg','1956-04-26',112,'Released',NULL,'The Swan',61048,2.1068,6.9,'d-0Aljoi6VI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3402,_binary '\0','/rb5KzWNAlNX33SegKPMxQ4MbqxA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049829',7.3,3819,'en','Tea and Sympathy','A sensitive young man recalls his time in boarding school when the only person who seemed compassionate towards him was his housemaster\'s wife.','/vkaMwVQKStFH5a311wCRF3io67B.jpg','1956-09-27',122,'Released','Where does a woman\'s sympathy leave off -- and her indiscretion begin?','Tea and Sympathy',63096,2.4911,7,'3nPIvXomwq4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3403,_binary '\0','/lJb0nZ8NbAu2cjrZmTkGobPSsm4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049830',6.6,4060,'en','The Teahouse of the August Moon','In post-WWII Japan, an American captain is brought in to help build a school, but the locals want a teahouse instead.','/v2G1Vh14X9NslrHR9zGlGoV1i4M.jpg','1957-01-14',123,'Released','All The Riotous Fun Of The Prize-Winning Stage Comedy!','The Teahouse of the August Moon',43313,2.7804,6.2,'uNQo_PQh1W4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3404,_binary '\0','/3e3dVaVrla2GH6CWKbNRjTvk3s8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049833',7.9,85667,'en','The Ten Commandments','Escaping death, a Hebrew infant is raised in a royal household to become a prince. Upon discovery of his true heritage, Moses embarks on a personal quest to reclaim his destiny as the leader and liberator of the Hebrew people.','/3Ei59AR64x6dMZfWobPCkZjbqTL.jpg','1956-10-05',220,'Released','The greatest event in motion picture history!','The Ten Commandments',6844,14.8573,7.796,'KBzbyIPWVT4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3405,_binary '\0','/5s2RuqziI83D9Eko9QQlda60vI5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049839',7.4,1604,'it','Il tetto','Under provincial Italian law at the time, once a roof is erected, the occupants cannot be evicted from a building. This film follows the efforts of a family to erect the roof on a house overnight so that a newlywed couple can have their own home.','/xiBsp3DTOSJLoLuUPBmfw5iHiXW.jpg','1956-09-29',97,'Released',NULL,'The Roof',113936,2.6426,7.308,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3406,_binary '\0','/xGpGWJuLFLlXyDQZOkDV1WKTzuq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049843',7.4,4180,'en','There\'s Always Tomorrow','When a toy manufacturer feels ignored and unappreciated by his wife and children, he begins to rekindle a past love when a former employee comes back into his life.','/hWvyuCWFZSAIrDdqDOaT0m4J0Ue.jpg','1956-01-08',84,'Released','Once upon a time, in sunny California …','There\'s Always Tomorrow',37637,2.633,7.2,'i9Xk-OkUgZE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3407,_binary '\0','/nOzswLUTx41clK2l9ikT3COjksm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049844',6.9,1354,'en','These Wilder Years','A man tries to find a son he gave up for adoption years ago.','/5s6N2U0itOZwpvWpztjQkWdzyIp.jpg','1956-08-17',91,'Released','TOGETHER and TERRIFIC! ...in a story of unforgettable warmth and impact!','These Wilder Years',46190,1.5016,6.5,'MvSCbZWRaGo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3408,_binary '\0','/5dDaku6eNkgPaOk7yqPHaBEvBQF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049845',7,1688,'en','The Long Arm','Scotland Yard detectives attempt to solve a spate of safe robberies across England beginning with clues found at the latest burglary in London. The film is notable for using a police procedural style made popular by Ealing in their 1950 film The Blue Lamp. It is known in the US as The Third Key.','/wMWQCfhYNucYrF8JlTYvzXq6L3w.jpg','1956-06-01',96,'Released','The True Inside Story of Scotland Yard\'s Crime Busters!','The Long Arm',50799,2.0696,6.94,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3409,_binary '\0','/pZXA9KrSzLkvKt1RCVBebkpcz0l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049849',6.3,1797,'en','Three Violent People','A rancher, his shady bride and his one-armed brother fight amid carpetbaggers in Texas.','/osjexM9Yol8UwdTr5fce5zJkyvy.jpg','1956-12-01',100,'Released','Violent love ... violent hate ... violent conflicts.','Three Violent People',75012,2.5442,6,'010zwiMBfhw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3410,_binary '\0','/iehqbR9AjhDMp4iGK6xDVk8emm7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049856',6.8,2443,'en','Time Without Pity','Alec Graham is sentenced to death for the murder of his girlfriend Jennie, with whom he spent a weekend at the English country home of the parents of his friend Brian Stanford. Alec’s father, David Graham, a not-so-successful writer and alcoholic who has neglected his son in the past, flies in from Canada to visit his son on death row. David then goes on a quest to try and clear his son’s name while battling “the bottle.”','/3P6XLCD3tGtWTtktfdlGL3fnJ4t.jpg','1957-03-21',88,'Released','It all started with a young girl’s scream …','Time Without Pity',60938,1.969,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3411,_binary '\0','/oBBtZHbtLt8wOHemA9Qv8hzcqng.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049866',7.7,2341,'it','Totò, Peppino e la... malafemmina','Antonio, Peppino and Lucia are three brothers who live in the country near Naples. Lucia\'s son, Gianni, goes to Naples to study medicine, but there he knows a ballet dancer. They fall in love and, when she goes to Milan, Gianni follows her. Informed of this and afraid that their nephew will stop studying, the three Caponi brothers leave for Milan to persuade Gianni to come back and continue studying and abandon the \"Malafemmina\" (bad girl).','/jHe65nUmr2DBuzEAAkuiFbUssYT.jpg','1956-08-23',101,'Released',NULL,'Toto, Peppino, and the Hussy',55960,1.9398,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3412,_binary '\0','/hbYoayaqNv3KOEZIP14QVxnj83o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049871',7.2,2188,'en','A Town Like Alice','In 1941 Malaysia, the advancing Japanese army captures a lot of British territory very quickly. The men are sent off to labor camps, but they have no plan on what to do with the women and children of the British.','/aTBNZnQVSn26DuQHdRUTW8a6Aux.jpg','1956-03-01',117,'Released','A tale of survival.','A Town Like Alice',88558,2.3378,6.4,'_-zt00X4ChU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3413,_binary '\0','/lSFjxHcbFnZb9gh6VJvsZ9t4d70.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049875',6.8,5872,'en','Trapeze','A pair of men try to perform the dangerous \"triple\" in their trapeze act. Problems arise when the duo is made into a trio following the addition of a sexy female performer.','/3EZKz21OMvvyYg3UqZ3BBzHjWiq.jpg','1956-05-30',105,'Released','High...High...High...Above Them All! - in excitement! - in spectacle! - in fire, flesh and fury!','Trapeze',40494,2.1092,6.3,'03v7dPOfslQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3414,_binary '\0','/fDJ8J4fM5tMdXxljCHfHTlK5Bzl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049877',7.3,4775,'fr','La Traversée de Paris','Two unlikely companions must smuggle four suitcases filled with contraband pork across Nazi-occupied Paris.','/euq3YhkXJgsDlUxid5cTInsxnqh.jpg','1956-10-26',80,'Released','JEAN GABIN and BOURVIL in a REMARKABLE FRENCH FILM with suspense predominating of course - but also much more than just a soupcon of laughter!','La Traversée de Paris',19178,3.3287,7.272,'rTBUyR0RAHA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3415,_binary '\0','/8Rz4GLWVqfmxjDDG89j4xmj2FBA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049881',6.7,1986,'en','Tribute to a Bad Man','Jeremy Rodock is a tough horse rancher who strings up rustlers as soon as looks at them. Fresh out of Pennsylvania, Steve Miller finds it hard to get used to Rodock’s ways, although he takes an immediate shine to his Greek girl Jocasta.','/1va1nQyFyjke1XkvvS7TC0aunse.jpg','1956-03-30',95,'Released','TOUGH AS A DESERT CACTUS!','Tribute to a Bad Man',90406,2.4443,7,'1BUJTvJrAII','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3416,_binary '\0','/7MWT2RzRUIKpQARHjC3AdNGs9O1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049900',4.8,1475,'ja','宇宙人東京に現わる','Large star-shaped aliens travel to earth in hopes of warning them about an oncoming catastrophe. To prevent panic about their appearance, one alien takes the form of a popular singer.','/fxK1qXaZS7S4JtMgrKWha80UuT9.jpg','1956-01-29',87,'Released','Soon, the Earth will explode! A terror which will annihilate all of humanity!','Warning from Space',70872,1.3043,5.3,'vgjfAiF0wu8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3417,_binary '\0','/lNe2z2qQf0G5gzM51ZyJD0zCDVk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049902',8.1,31136,'fr','Un condamné à mort s\'est échappé','A captured French Resistance fighter during World War II engineers a daunting escape from prison.','/gkoZ8fFib24zhB2DKpjQ09SK9FU.jpg','1956-11-11',101,'Released','Robert Bresson\'s Prize Winning Film','A Man Escaped',15244,4.5783,8,'o6nHFpKK6Lc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3418,_binary '\0','/tNyrLXR4JDi0shwlnNTmSJo2qIs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049917',7.4,2028,'ru','Весна на Заречной улице','The story unfolds in an industrial town where a young and charming literature teacher arrives, assigned to teach at an evening school. One of the boys from the metallurgical plant falls in love with the educated girl, but communication between the two young people turns out to be quite challenging.','/lljSerWjgp5f7WL37B72Jtl8T39.jpg','1956-11-26',96,'Released',NULL,'Spring on Zarechnaya Street',54970,1.3227,7.053,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3419,_binary '\0','/5lq4ZpMikWKwLdeylN20oRJb8ni.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049922',3.6,2006,'en','The Violent Years','A newspaper publisher\'s daughter suffers from neglect by her parents. She and her friends turn to crime by dressing up like men, holding up gas stations, raping young men at gunpoint, and having makeout parties when her parents are away. Their \"fence\" gets them to trash the school on request of sinister un-American clients, and they run afoul of the law, apple pie, and God himself.','/yz0Ezoq5XomtJAn8CeucniqZHQJ.jpg','1956-01-01',57,'Released','Teenage Killers Taking Their Thrills Unashamed!','The Violent Years',56157,1.0022,4.4,'oV9lyER4itk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3420,_binary '\0','/h9vizQZtWJXPqWS8CUoSAcLvjQf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049933',6.6,1363,'en','Walk the Proud Land','Indian Agent sent to try new approach to peace with Apache based on respect for autonomy rather than submission to Army. Wins over reservation chiefs and the Indian widow given to him as housekeeper. Through use of diplomacy and demonstrations of faith in Apache leaders, reservation is put on the road to autonomy. Conflicts arise between Apache widow and Eastern wife but latter has a lot to learn.','/z7JtlEV1AywMXA3iqPH9kuOUiJL.jpg','1956-09-01',88,'Released','HE TAMED APACHE WAR-LUST WITH THE POWER OF HIS FAITH...and conquered a savage warrior in a showdown of raw courage!','Walk the Proud Land',225958,2.3263,5.9,'OHJyTHZNcOw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3421,_binary '\0','/wVNkaSBX3gHk1zGZ3XaI0ycoJvY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049934',6.7,11895,'en','War and Peace','The love story of young Countess Natasha Rostova and Count Pierre Bezukhov is interwoven with the Great Patriotic War of 1812 against Napoleon\'s invading army.','/f3a1MyH12PSl3LFDahnooGy6mv8.jpg','1956-08-21',208,'Released','The greatest novel ever written ... Now magnificently alive on the screen!','War and Peace',11706,6.2125,6.6,'k5oUyH7NmKg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3422,_binary '\0','/pAgvge6guyQMmk5Ko0cG3wMlfr6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049944',5.8,2151,'en','The Werewolf','The arrival in a small mountain town of a dissheveled stranger launches a series of murders committed by some sort of animal. As the town doctor and his daughter attempt to help the stranger, the sheriff investigates the murders; and they uncover a sinister experiment involving two rogue scientists, a car accident victim, his wife and children, and a serum that causes a man to turn into a ravaging werewolf.','/yWWzmxfK0dKjTpEbPWZXlPRhGPS.jpg','1956-07-01',79,'Released','You see it happen!','The Werewolf',44545,1.5039,5.6,'VgdKzyQYcNU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3423,_binary '\0','/k8QiPEaVlxMptKg1mR8IpRo9c1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049949',6.9,7947,'en','While the City Sleeps','Newspaper men compete against each other to find a serial killer dubbed \"The Lipstick Killer\".','/yxcHaWVdHXf6FbI0TYa43nnQeVo.jpg','1956-04-19',100,'Released','Suspense as startling as a strangled scream!','While the City Sleeps',36786,3.2655,6.876,'HexzEg3cxJY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3424,_binary '\0','/fJevLurT8xaEpVtDjzD1Uyk8sdW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049964',5.8,3006,'en','World Without End','Four astronauts returning from man\'s first mission to Mars enter a time warp and crash on a 26th-century Earth devastated by atomic war. At first unaware where they are, but finding the atmosphere safe to breathe, they start exploring and find themselves in a divided future where disfigured mutants living like cavemen inhabit the surface, while the normals live comfortably below the surface but are dying as a race from lack of natural water, air and sunlight.','/flvqHHFMBCks5Mlb4HWydUZcwbV.jpg','1956-03-25',80,'Released','Thru the Time Barrier, 552 years Ahead... Roaring To the Far Reaches of Titanic Terror, Crash-Landing Into the Nightmare Future!','World Without End',75506,2.3168,5.7,'VJDz1Ht1R0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3425,_binary '\0','/gb7CnfONI8mWuUsxuqkafWEO71N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049966',7.3,15317,'en','Written on the Wind','Mitch Wayne is a geologist working for the Hadleys, an oil-rich Texas family. While the patriarch, Jasper, works hard to establish the family business, his irresponsible son, Kyle, is an alcoholic playboy, and his daughter, Marylee, is the town tramp. Mitch harbors a secret love for Kyle\'s unsatisfied wife, Lucy -- a fact that leaves him exposed when the jealous Marylee accuses him of murder.','/paeBU70fHsFAOooWM5V35q562f2.jpg','1956-10-04',99,'Released','This woman in his arms was now the wife of the man he called his best friend!','Written on the Wind',69605,5.3987,7,'WHdworuKmwQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3426,_binary '\0','/kHTlqGVoGwaEcGc1LjkJKbC0v4Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0049967',6.1,3778,'en','X: The Unknown','Army radiation experiments awaken a subterranean monster from a fissure that feeds on energy and proceeds to terrorise a remote Scottish village. An American research scientist at a nearby nuclear plant joins with a British investigator to discover why the victims were radioactively burned and why, shortly thereafter, a series of radiation-related incidents are occurring in an ever-growing straight line away from the fissure.','/bS1PSy0lDfP2EEDprGEMOJGbKOG.jpg','1956-09-21',81,'Released','It rises from 2000 miles below the earth to melt everything in its path!','X: The Unknown',26865,1.8688,6.1,'HacfNmy4B2Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3427,_binary '\0','/qqHQsStV6exghCM7zbObuYBiYxw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050083',9,1002645,'en','12 Angry Men','The defense and the prosecution have rested and the jury is filing into the jury room to decide if a young Spanish-American is guilty or innocent of murdering his father. What begins as an open and shut case soon becomes a mini-drama of each of the jurors\' prejudices and preconceptions about the trial, the accused, and each other.','/zhG3vKWyDRaZYoaww1UVAi29T9h.jpg','1957-04-10',97,'Released','It explodes like 12 sticks of dynamite!','12 Angry Men',389,35.295,8.572,'TEN-2uTi2c0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3428,_binary '\0','/pvNE91iHqQlowSOwKHXgWV0gCaM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050084',6.3,9014,'en','20 Million Miles to Earth','When the first manned flight to Venus returns to Earth, the rocket crash-lands in the Mediterranean near a small Italian fishing village. The locals manage to save Colonel Robert Calder, the mission commander. A young boy also recovers what turns out to be a specimen of an alien creature. Growing at a fantastic rate, it manages to escape and eventually threatens the city of Rome.','/wozerDO9kpVBN63sq3wiM5zYmSo.jpg','1957-06-01',82,'Released','Space nightmares!','20 Million Miles to Earth',15096,3.4826,6.3,'vg0huIZxYso','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3429,_binary '\0','/pq1y71lqFoxDJ5VAwU236ltSpqY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050085',6.2,2145,'en','The 27th Day','Five individuals from five nations, including the USA, USSR, and China, suddenly find themselves on an alien saucer, where an alien gives each a container holding three capsules. The alien explains that no power on earth can open a given container except a mental command from the person to whom it is given, then anyone may take a capsule and, by speaking a latitude and longitude at it, cause instant death to all within a given radius: thus each of the five has been provided with the power of life and death. Then, they are given 27 days to decide whether to use the capsules, and returned to the places from which each one came...','/4wFZ74dV3xRu7qG48FLbHENz2pa.jpg','1957-01-07',75,'Released','Terror from Outer Space!','The 27th Day',30299,6.2132,6.3,'OnWD0eTbeeY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3430,_binary '\0','/7B26BW9ec2atiGwCkJJZ5POR4wC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050086',7.6,24127,'en','3:10 to Yuma','Dan Evans, a small time farmer, is hired to escort Ben Wade, a dangerous outlaw, to Yuma. As Evans and Wade wait for the 3:10 train to Yuma, Wade\'s gang is racing to free him.','/emYeJVZrpl2WfndJlhbls1e7lzQ.jpg','1957-08-07',92,'Released','The lonesome whistle of a train... bringing the gallows closer to a desperado... the showdown nearer to his captor!','3:10 to Yuma',14168,6.123,7.3,'G1St5Q6G2qM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3431,_binary '\0','/4OkIGVH6ik9gk5Rjl9c66hzP1HC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050087',6.3,1471,'en','5 Steps to Danger','Can a couple keep important secrets from Communist spies?','/9ugLTCEThvf1Zd7rYJK3zdkC5nq.jpg','1956-11-05',81,'Released','LASHED TOGETHER BY THE SAME SIN AND THE SAME SECRET!','5 Steps to Danger',86768,2.2733,6.6,'tnGP6PJHLsU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3432,_binary '\0','/cLKcXeHJjitzKi2twm8OFLomI8K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050091',7.5,2192,'en','Seven Waves Away','After a massive luxury liner sinks into the ocean, the ship\'s officer must command a rickety lifeboat, built for only nine, that is stuffed with over twenty desperate and injured passengers. As a hurricane approaches and the many wounded passengers struggle for life, difficult decisions must be made about who will remain on the boat and who must be cast to the sea in order to give others the chance to survive.','/4q6g7tQw8U3HRfj9i2W9FeKlwNG.jpg','1957-03-12',100,'Released','14 of these survivors must be cast adrift! Which will the Captain choose?','Seven Waves Away',98289,2.7109,7.5,'inb5GRFoTck','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3433,_binary '\0','/pETrI33C25cdF0cIEcAXFYEbh2u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050095',6.4,5816,'en','The Abominable Snowman','A kindly English botanist and a gruff American promoter lead an expedition to the Himalayas in search of the legendary Yeti.','/j0mz19eFHrloyAbLmxXEYqfJ2k.jpg','1957-08-26',85,'Released','See It With Someone Brave! A Timeless Terror to Freeze You to Your Seats!','The Abominable Snowman',38006,2.742,6.2,'-iNDjbxcxQA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3434,_binary '\0','/gskuuN4WHiRDb7ObPwKRcwcmbZX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050097',7.2,1299,'en','Across the Bridge','In Mexico, a financier on the run poses as a man he just murdered, only to find out that the man was also a murderer.','/n9W3QNZb5Ia3a4LoMUMKfQzUluG.jpg','1957-08-20',103,'Released','In the Tradition of the Finest British Chiller Thrillers','Across the Bridge',73027,1.2508,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3435,_binary '\0','/ghnp0qemiIZQH2fJIx3g4o0KqkI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050100',7.1,2344,'en','The Admirable Crichton','Lord Loam has modern ideas about his household, he believes in treating his servants as his equals - at least sometimes. His butler, Crichton, still believes that members of the serving class should know their place and be happy there. But when the Loam family are shipwrecked on a desert island with the self-reliant Crichton and lady\'s maid Tweeny, the class system is put to the test.','/ux4nDT0IjJRhlj5Bw9XEirC2bZc.jpg','1957-06-11',94,'Released','The Hilarious Story of What the Girls Saw in the Butler...','The Admirable Crichton',64984,2.4166,6.8,'IsBnDLe8dxg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3436,_binary '\0','/coEqWrercSh1vwbuLGgxHD0kgWo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050105',7.4,36044,'en','An Affair to Remember','A couple falls in love and agrees to meet in six months at the Empire State Building - but will it happen?','/jwbWglYHbjqUu8M9DjTYzTOFklt.jpg','1957-07-11',111,'Released','In Italy... on the Mediterranean... across an ocean... and all over New York!','An Affair to Remember',8356,5.1714,7.4,'1qFSl4DiKXA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3437,_binary '\0','/qGL0bYRZZDsYrT5jgo40mQRwZ9l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050112',7.2,1765,'en','All Mine to Give','This is a story based on fact that follows a husband and wife who emigrate from Scotland to Wisconsin in the 1850s. They work very hard and become welcome citizens of their new town, Eureka. They have six children. They prosper in the husband\'s boat-building business. But when their eldest is 12, tragedy strikes the family, and the 12-year-old is burdened with a terrible task which he handles as well as any adult could.','/3Cd1bpE34FWGRZ41vzwXuNjDzsB.jpg','1957-11-13',103,'Released','SIX KIDS ON A TRUE AND WONDERFUL ADVENTURE!','All Mine to Give',80521,2.6206,6.3,'Xr7QKZtWgMI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3438,_binary '\0','/jd2DQ3yxk0yf1gsKVY5noTuJ1nt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050118',4.7,3084,'en','The Amazing Colossal Man','Lt. Col. Glenn Manning is inadvertently exposed to a plutonium bomb blast and although he sustains burns over 90% of his body, he survives. Then he begins to grow, but as he grows he starts losing his mind. By the time he stops he is 50 ft tall, insane and is on the rampage.','/nq0DFAzu4qTcmNk8jwkvXmO9SQ3.jpg','1957-10-25',80,'Released','Growing...! Growing...! Growing...! To a Giant! to a Monster! When will it stop?','The Amazing Colossal Man',43241,2.0604,4.683,'zgpv7_4uonQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3439,_binary '\0','/eWjNy2XHIPGcaKmAsjiCt2zSbWD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050123',7.3,1897,'fr','Les Amants de Montparnasse','Biographic film chronicling the last year of the life of the Italian painter Amedeo Modigliani, 1919, who falls in love with a girl from a wealthy family. Her parents are against this relationship and stop financial help. Modigliani worked and died in abject poverty in the Montparnasse Quarter of Paris, France.','/wnWoxhVhPLKsahprzfbBRGxJNsr.jpg','1958-04-04',108,'Released',NULL,'The Lovers of Montparnasse',80470,3.5248,6.889,'xf5nKwdq3pg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3440,_binary '\0','/3smDggwcZGQlAH1TDTQCpvs9Zkp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050126',6.7,2504,'en','Bitter Victory','During the second world war, two British officers, Brand and Leith, who have never seen combat, are assigned a vital mission. Their relationship and the operation are complicated by the arrival of Brand\'s wife, who had a tryst with Leith years earlier.','/8i6gzqhFqeDyddzv68P0ZzB9Jx8.jpg','1957-08-28',102,'Released','THE DESERT COMMANDO RAID THEY WIPED OFF THE RECORD BOOKS!','Bitter Victory',68850,1.7436,6.4,'4nCI1o5cYm8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3441,_binary '\0','/kaL7mvE62MT2xYCuuWRUFKIsNcE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050143',3.7,1241,'en','The Astounding She-Monster','A scientist and a gang that has kidnapped a rich heiress come up against a beautiful but lethal alien who has crash-landed her spaceship on Earth.','/xiaYRfkR7ybxmmjAoE2N629iyoR.jpg','1957-04-10',62,'Released','A creature from beyond the stars. EVIL... BEAUTIFUL... DEADLY...!','The Astounding She-Monster',44693,1.6715,4,'MdyBTc9Qb9Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3442,_binary '\0','/8eIjBetuGK2F1wwFUJ0JyPbAxMb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050147',4.9,4512,'en','Attack of the Crab Monsters','A group of scientists travel to a remote island to study the effects of nuclear weapons tests, only to get stranded when their airplane mysteriously explodes. The team soon discovers that the tests have given rise to crabs mutated into intelligent, impervious, telepathic giants intent on increasing their numbers by breeding, then travelling to populated areas to feed, and which do not intend to be stopped by their discoverers.','/pDaJt3Jv41mOvND7HaDnmiGsD5V.jpg','1957-02-10',63,'Released','From the depths of the sea... A TIDAL WAVE OF TERROR!','Attack of the Crab Monsters',26946,2.4768,5.2,'YlB5mj-3XdU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3443,_binary '\0','/rxJlbbkf4Er4LmKALYB9nloTnfU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050162',7.2,1449,'ja','幕末太陽傳','Saheji, a man-about-town, gets stuck at a high-class brothel when he can’t pay the bill. He makes the best of his situation by performing various tasks amidst the tumult of the end of the shogunate—but always by making sure to get a “commission” for his troubles.','/kBRGMzF2lro0Aj5S1BIugJIm2NP.jpg','1957-07-14',110,'Released',NULL,'A Sun-Tribe Myth from the Bakumatsu Era',125217,1.8353,7,'JRFZasSrnFQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3444,_binary '\0','/evIHoAb6Y1qEfEStkCw1KGqI7VT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050166',6.5,2833,'en','Band of Angels','Living in Kentucky prior to the Civil War, Amantha Starr is a privileged young woman. Her widowed father, a wealthy plantation owner, dotes on her and sends her to the best schools. When he dies suddenly Amantha\'s world is turned upside down. She learns that her father had been living on borrowed money and that her mother was actually a slave and her father\'s mistress.','/6GfZUN17gZpcTFjAQlmQnuXDHGc.jpg','1957-08-03',125,'Released','You\'re no blue blood any more, honey. The master bought you...and now he\'s waitin\'!','Band of Angels',37311,3.3715,6.3,'SiwLDrgVFeE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3445,_binary '\0','/kIqv5VAgPIJFffSSxLdsVyHRYlG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050168',6.8,1379,'en','Barnacle Bill','A seasick sea captain commands an amusement pier despite local opposition. Released in the U.S. as \'All at Sea\'','/pvtr61ZLnXBgsQBE3NDEXvKvSNC.jpg','1957-12-17',87,'Released',NULL,'Barnacle Bill',44134,1.7351,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3446,_binary '\0','/zRQkNILW50GAid3RKRklJOvTZGO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050171',6.3,1496,'en','Battle Hymn','Dean Hess, who entered the ministry to atone for bombing a German orphanage, decides he’s a failure at preaching. Rejoined to train pilots early in the Korean War, he finds Korean orphans raiding the airbase garbage. With a pretty Korean teacher, he sets up an orphanage for them and others.','/4wvma37xBJJvoxnCiXNBM0ryRDm.jpg','1957-02-14',109,'Released','The true story of Col. Dean Hess, clergyman turned fighter pilot!','Battle Hymn',75046,2.0664,6.7,'tl1mqUg1pnQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3447,_binary '\0','/z45ScPeQe9tZOPtQirvO23o2lbL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050177',4.2,3170,'en','Beginning of the End','An attractive reporter investigating the mysterious destruction of an Illinois town stumbles upon a secret government laboratory conducting radiation experiments on vegetables. The lead scientist is eager to help find out what happened. Together they discover that giant grasshoppers are behind the devastation. Worse yet, thousands of them are headed toward Chicago! Can they be stopped... or is this the BEGINNING OF THE END?','/oYwpYmUWUsbQq13lwoU6rUeNraC.jpg','1957-06-28',73,'Released','New thrills! New shocks! New terror!','Beginning of the End',66918,2.0752,4,'uqVL8blr-rw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3448,_binary '\0','/bkzPygcInZMOKpnNhSHlbqVNinJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050188',7.8,10494,'hi','मदर इण्डिया','A poverty-stricken woman raises her sons through many trials and tribulations. But no matter the struggles, always sticks to her own moral code.','/AlfM9yLcK1rhv73iNbDiOU9vnnu.jpg','1957-02-13',175,'Released','Showing the path is easy, but walking it is hard.','Mother India',917,2.1364,7.009,'OFWHKtISBrY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3449,_binary '\0','/2yNSr4yuAagKwX7q7gq4TxPZHV4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050197',5.5,4019,'en','The Black Scorpion','Volcanic activity frees giant scorpions from the earth who wreak havoc in the rural countryside and eventually threaten Mexico City.','/z6gEzeLl3NWuESexRiUpk4rtLPH.jpg','1957-10-11',88,'Released','Every horror you\'ve seen on the screen grows pale beside the horror of...','The Black Scorpion',44591,2.0028,5.2,'pJMarxVlWLk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3450,_binary '\0','/sl8QLyy0J02TxmmJlDXL5oqUvyc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050201',4.6,1731,'en','Blood of Dracula','A crazed teacher at a respectable girls\' school draws power from a medallion she has obtained from the Carpathian Mountains, and uses it to experiment telepathically on the school\'s newest young pupil.','/b6prd65o6ZNbnyJFiKONVAv373l.jpg','1957-11-01',69,'Released','She Will GIVE YOU Nightmares...FOR EVER!','Blood of Dracula',110336,1.5707,4.9,'sGzVR8rVL3o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3451,_binary '\0','/ttgTEMEyW9X37GaXpvEJVlh5nJj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050208',6.2,2193,'en','Boy on a Dolphin','Phaedra is a poor sponge diver on the lovely Greek isle of Hydra. While diving, she discovers an ancient brass and gold statue of a boy riding a dolphin, which is said to have the magical power to grant wishes. Her shiftless boyfriend wants to sell it to an unscrupulous art collector, but Phaedra wants to give it to anthropologist Jim Calder, who would return it to the Greek government.','/ufLLWel63yrovBmM2boGkw096w2.jpg','1957-04-19',111,'Released','An adventurous love story that will live \'til the seas run dry!','Boy on a Dolphin',37596,3.1439,5.793,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3452,_binary '\0','/gBRBDlLWrw2DE7R2Ws0jONlqHyd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050210',5.2,2224,'en','The Brain from Planet Arous','A malevolent alien brain, bent on world domination, takes over the body of an atomic scientist, while a \'good\' alien brain inhabits the body of the scientist\'s dog and waits for an opportunity to defeat the evil brain.','/vpxIaxnnld60lEI5Ix8gQVsNDtg.jpg','1957-12-26',71,'Released','Science-Fiction\'s most astounding story!','The Brain from Planet Arous',43248,1.9331,5.1,'Z2Ml7XzYZCg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3453,_binary '\0','/cGi9obHiooPoNR4JX72L9RooeOY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050212',8.1,251064,'en','The Bridge on the River Kwai','The classic story of English POWs in Burma forced to build a bridge to aid the war effort of their Japanese captors. British and American intelligence officers conspire to blow up the structure, but Col. Nicholson, the commander who supervised the bridge\'s construction, has acquired a sense of pride in his creation and tries to foil their plans.','/7paXMt2e3Tr5dLmEZOGgFEn2Vo7.jpg','1957-10-11',162,'Released','It spans a whole new world of entertainment!','The Bridge on the River Kwai',826,9.0414,7.8,'RlC7XBayj0s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3454,_binary '\0','/h8iRHvx1gp4TFRpGFyXvOhB6hTk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050213',6.8,1813,'en','The Brothers Rico','Eddie Rico, the erstwhile bookkeeper for a big Mafia boss, is now making a living as an honest merchant in Florida with his family. Things go sour when the police start a search for his syndicate-linked brothers who are on the lam after a big hit, forcing Eddie to get involved with the Mafia again.','/hRGxLEbMmaywycJwO8PZxOs9qy.jpg','1957-08-23',92,'Released','Three hunted men and their desperate women...','The Brothers Rico',35017,1.6188,6.2,'vHlIwlrVq7A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3455,_binary '\0','/gF5ycf6uLF1CW49u5n1rn2UnrNh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050233',7,3879,'en','Cast a Dark Shadow','Edward \"Teddy\" Bare is a ruthless schemer who thinks he\'s hit the big time when he kills his older wife, believing he will inherit a fortune. When things don\'t go according to plan, Teddy sets his sights on a new victim: wealthy widow Freda Jeffries. Unfortunately for the unscrupulous criminal, Freda is much more guarded and sassy than his last wife, making separating her from her money considerably more challenging.','/tpkYTyGa9WyG9l9f2W8JSDdT1Xl.jpg','1955-09-20',83,'Released','No woman could resist his sinister charm!','Cast a Dark Shadow',33814,1.7653,6.5,'Htc2eD296BY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3456,_binary '\0','/kpd4Ceom39YA5Gl54ySUMTdn90p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050243',7.7,1767,'en','The Chaplin Revue','Three Chaplin silent comedies \"A Dog\'s Life\", \"Shoulder Arms\", and \"The Pilgrim\" are strung together to form a single feature length film. Chaplin provides new music, narration, and a small amount of new connecting material. \"Shoulder Arms\" is now described as taking place in a time before \"the atom bomb\".','/Z3SUitp5xVz8hiIgqz5yjDUIgx.jpg','1959-09-01',119,'Released',NULL,'The Chaplin Revue',554678,1.9215,7.378,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3457,_binary '\0','/bUib6ZZgQqzv8V2nJ6QzEgX8fGZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050246',7,1808,'en','Chase a Crooked Shadow','A woman who lives in Spain has trouble convincing anybody that a complete stranger has taken her dead brother\'s identity.','/vt7jAN6EFX92PQNzEjGzKYUlOUr.jpg','1958-01-16',87,'Released','The Man Hunts the Girl... The Girl Hunts the Man...','Chase a Crooked Shadow',22334,2.0556,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3458,_binary '\0','/bS8cS0JcxIe2kV126GINgeOxlVS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050251',6.1,2173,'ja','地球防衛軍','In Japan, scientifically advanced invaders from the war-destroyed planet Mysteroid cause an entire village to vanish, then send a giant robot out to storm the city by night, after which they request a small patch of land on Earth and the right to marry earthling women, claiming to be pacifists. Mankind must decide whether to capitulate or to resist.','/eILFc9gTP1Yxj9oI4hXEBRGnt1w.jpg','1957-12-28',89,'Released','Space weapons mobilize! A great battle between Earth forces and the gruesome mystery planet people, the Mysterians!','The Mysterians',43226,2.7553,6.3,'QqX502-jk4o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3459,_binary '\0','/r3Ddxw4v780GzOZdjAT2CMgo0Gn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050271',6.4,3712,'en','Crime of Passion','Kathy leaves the newspaper business to marry homicide detective Bill, but is frustrated by his lack of ambition and the banality of life in the suburbs. Her drive to advance Bill\'s career soon takes her down a dangerous path.','/dDpstkYlTAE8n9jqcTYt3jJVNXm.jpg','1956-12-28',86,'Released','Her husband was lying so close... the gun was even closer... now she was only one sin away from the Crime of Passion.','Crime of Passion',1920,2.7526,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3460,_binary '\0','/5Hw9NUjWoEo9vJus3ECiwRWl8HH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050280',7,15100,'en','The Curse of Frankenstein','Baron Victor Frankenstein has discovered life\'s secret and unleashed a blood-curdling chain of events resulting from his creation: a cursed creature with a horrid face — and a tendency to kill.','/r9PDkqKhzdo54aqnOL88wUJY49B.jpg','1957-05-20',83,'Released','The creature created by man and forgotten by nature!','The Curse of Frankenstein',3079,4.1491,6.8,'3dShEw3PAuQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3461,_binary '\0','/xKeLNKSQ2p6GGtmbezF5AjA3YqQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050281',4.5,1536,'en','The Cyclops','A test pilot is missing and a search party is sent out in the jungles of Mexico; however, while searching they uncover a monster in the jungle who became this way due to a dose of radioactivity.','/d7D3PRSvAJ9ml1Li2dL4bkIR5Wy.jpg','1957-07-28',66,'Released','50 FT. HIGH MAN-THING in a land of NATURE GONE MAD!','The Cyclops',43249,1.3621,4.5,'2iiYH7NmTdQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3462,_binary '\0','/iZUDrHT7Dj5JjU5F31QUpBQS47Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050294',5.2,4576,'en','The Deadly Mantis','When a melting iceberg releases a prehistoric giant praying mantis, a palaeontologist works alongside the military to kill it after it attacks scientific outposts on its way to Washington and New York.','/6uMoRTAfHbPVaYl59xKbInSVD3g.jpg','1957-05-01',79,'Released','This Was the Day That Engulfed the World in Terror!','The Deadly Mantis',43715,2.5089,5,'3FJ_DCkDGUM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3463,_binary '\0','/2LYrEd13m5dGGmONbefiI2sjN5X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050296',6.8,3982,'en','Decision at Sundown','A man and his partner arrive at a small Western town to kill its most powerful man because the former blames him for his wife\'s death.','/oR7L1RIgN8zHE83E4Z2MU6jYF8r.jpg','1957-11-10',78,'Released','At last the search was over...','Decision at Sundown',39557,3.2789,6.347,'8R4uarQbH_k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3464,_binary '\0','/hLJsVEhgWDXNcSwKKJP0u7yQ12k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050301',6.3,1696,'en','The Delicate Delinquent','Sidney Pythias is a bumbling janitor picked up by cop Mike Damon as a teenage gang member worth saving from delinquency. With Damon\'s help, Sidney works his way through the Police Academy to become a cop too.','/pDmoKAzRPH6wVE9ovZUmgd7w3I9.jpg','1957-06-06',101,'Released','JERRY LEWIS makes that blackboard jungle jump for joy. He\'s funnier than ever...','The Delicate Delinquent',15787,2.5566,6.4,'ZcA-W7cobxY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3465,_binary '\0','/cHQZurCTQd9YPlKewTL73t4EP4K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050306',6.7,6144,'en','Designing Woman','A sportswriter who marries a fashion designer discovers that their mutual interests are few, although each has an intriguing past which makes the other jealous.','/5iKj0fkip6j67iwejogjTGmkLZd.jpg','1957-05-16',118,'Released','His world is guys and dolls! Her world is gowns and glamor!','Designing Woman',33668,2.4729,6.649,'xs3V6kqaNHo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3466,_binary '\0','/yjMq644i4zTEchKsnQbD6lDV2dy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050307',7.2,10551,'en','Desk Set','A computer expert tries to prove his electronic brain can replace a television network\'s research staff.','/9gFerTRUGkIFn41mb3B1wb8ohtj.jpg','1957-08-02',103,'Released','The girls and guys who make the office such a wonderful place to love in!','Desk Set',24203,2.5983,7,'jYWSfztLkCw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3467,_binary '\0','/3TjcYnhzxSkL8qWo1taVAxtKppB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050322',8.4,1988,'hi','Do Ankhen Barah Haath','Progressive, reform-minded young warden gets permission to take six surly murderers from prison to dilapidated country farm, to rehabilitate it and themselves through hard work and kindly guidance.','/nxkY67FZbcLIyxWvss3IsL67eis.jpg','1960-05-20',143,'Released',NULL,'Do Ankhen Barah Haath',72576,1.1388,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3468,_binary '\0','/8hScuQB4qZuvjKtiNACtkqPOPk5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050330',7.2,6509,'ja','どん底','Residents of a rundown boardinghouse in 19th-century Japan, including a mysterious old man and an aging actor, get drawn into a love triangle that turns violent. When amoral thief Sutekichi breaks off his affair with landlady Osugi to romance her younger sister, Okayo, Osugi extracts her revenge by revealing her infidelity to her jealous husband.','/cRPiamuUuipjMDGlVAOTSbEepwC.jpg','1957-10-01',125,'Released',NULL,'The Lower Depths',26893,2.2379,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3469,_binary '\0','/dEcjlPSiyNYVBMW43jcUhrvLDVY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050347',7.2,3962,'en','Edge of the City','A male army deserter and a black male dock worker join forces against a corrupt manager, in a corrupt environment, and as their connection blossoms they must face the oppressive and morally decaying city they live in.','/eixbelLNo7TJJf7jMgCKZB22bxq.jpg','1957-01-04',85,'Released','Tense drama of frightened men!','Edge of the City',35129,3.013,7.1,'gC3_S_4ql5c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3470,_binary '\0','/npUnoVQU6TqXhIZt5JmrpLvoR2i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050356',7.4,13562,'en','The Enemy Below','The crew of the American destroyer escort, the USS Haynes, detects a German U-Boat—resulting in a prolonged, deadly battle of wits.','/9IUUCfrEEkq92sCLznzSAjDPusk.jpg','1957-12-25',97,'Released','The most amazing saga in the fighting annals of the US Navy!','The Enemy Below',15876,4.481,7.167,'oRXXjWZoVK0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3471,_binary '\0','/pkSTm0EmVHNwSmzP8JodHCRE7AM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050359',7.3,1436,'pl','Eroica: Symfonia bohaterska w dwóch częściach','Tells two tales set during WWII: A seemingly feckless and selfish man finally takes up arms in the national struggle against the Nazis. Set in a POW camp, Polish inmates cling to their hopes for an eventual escape, encouraged by the legendary escape of one of their own.','/uWiEsDfapHS1F3gLh6VUUywo0q.jpg','1958-01-04',80,'Released',NULL,'Eroica',117767,1.2306,6.917,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3472,_binary '\0','/kTFXaktj0cRqshYzWvlhCQ1yAGy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050371',8.1,19545,'en','A Face in the Crowd','The rise of a raucous hayseed named Lonesome Rhodes from itinerant Ozark guitar picker to local media rabble-rouser to TV superstar and political king-maker. Marcia Jeffries is the innocent Sarah Lawrence girl who discovers the great man in a back-country jail and is the first to fall under his spell.','/bjPvs6MY6Rv0DIiJ9rgx2TMEkAk.jpg','1957-05-29',125,'Released','POWER! He loved it! He took it raw in big gulpfuls … he liked the taste, the way it mixed with the bourbon and the sin in his blood!','A Face in the Crowd',21849,3.6904,7.6,'wKqOfUt_bKs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3473,_binary '\0','/1ygkMVHFVImBNZoaUHbiyVJ8qt1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050379',5.8,3233,'en','A Farewell to Arms','An English nurse and an American soldier on the Italian front during World War I fall in love, but the horrors surrounding them test their romance to the limit.','/3GQahUGOXXr7LEZJUOcVmTv16UO.jpg','1957-12-14',152,'Released','One of the great love stories of all time!','A Farewell to Arms',80255,4.752,5.975,'uTHmZVbqrdI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3474,_binary '\0','/sV7CgzZi4b4s60ogb6ez0RXiSG9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050381',5.4,2755,'it','Le fatiche di Ercole','In this melange of characters and events from separate mythological stories, Hercules, demigod and superman, arrives in the ancient Greek kingdom of Iolcus to tutor Iphitus, son of king Pelias; immediately on arrival, he falls in love with the king\'s delectable, briefly clad daughter Iole. Before he can win her, he must succeed in a series of quests, in the course of which he teams up with Jason, true heir of Iolcus, whom he accompanies on the famous voyage of the Argonauts.','/t2HYYuN2PmQtpdO44trWg4ain4d.jpg','1958-02-20',99,'Released',NULL,'Hercules',39400,3.0371,5.12,'nisz2sMQ6d8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3475,_binary '\0','/pqJ1JPm547dguNTJYM5ap8f9aS7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050383',6.9,2316,'en','Fear Strikes Out','True story of the life of Jimmy Piersall, who battled mental illness to achieve stardom in major league baseball.','/f4RPc5nOxMaAlTlzsc5YdcPB09s.jpg','1957-03-28',100,'Released','This is Jimmy, balanced on the ragged edge of violence, twisted and trapped by a world he never made…','Fear Strikes Out',125413,1.9573,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3476,_binary '\0','/3PedPRnQUuB4XCaVmCWv2nHrmBA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050393',6.1,5422,'en','Fiend Without a Face','An American airbase in Canada provokes resentment from the nearby residents after fallout from nuclear experiments at the base are blamed for a recent spate of disappearances. A captain from the airbase is assigned to investigate, and begins to suspect that an elderly British scientist who lives near the base and conducts research in the field of mind over matter knows more than he is letting on..','/mvy9fNmdFIMlStKVFWUvMP8JpNX.jpg','1958-07-03',74,'Released','New Horrors! Mad Science Spawns Evil Fiends! ... Taking form before your horrified eyes!','Fiend Without a Face',29347,2.4414,6.1,'rTLRyLnqCH4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3477,_binary '\0','/rIjUszkgqBdzKIxP20d18nqhNaX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050397',6,2226,'en','Fire Down Below','Tony and Felix own a tramp boat, and sail around the Caribbean doing odd jobs and drinking a lot. They agree to ferry the beautiful but passportless Irena to another island. They both fall for her, leading to betrayal and a break-up of their partnership. Tony takes a job on a cargo ship. After a collision he finds himself trapped below deck with time running out (the ship is aflame), and only Felix, whom he hates and has sworn to kill, left to save him.','/i9wNTkhAmDfWfEJ6fmpm5VgI6WW.jpg','1957-05-30',116,'Released','THREE OF THE BIGGEST IN ONE OF THE BEST!','Fire Down Below',56188,2.1313,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3478,_binary '\0','/hMF77Ykwacmk1dRsSnMJ40QPyLZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050398',7.3,1571,'no','Fjols til fjells','At a high mountain hotel in Norway, porter Poppe tries to do the best he can for the guests with an often unhelpful piccolo Rudolf. This, however, leads to a lot of problems, and Poppe thinks some of the guests behave inappropriate.','/4rvAOLB3uG8cAMGXPj2K8jq8AtT.jpg','1957-08-19',101,'Released',NULL,'Fools in the Mountains',56697,1.335,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3479,_binary '\0','/rs1vM1CzVfSkrBZhM6Cfw6oVcVt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050407',6.9,7244,'en','Forty Guns','An authoritarian rancher rules an Arizona county with her private posse of hired guns. When a new Marshal arrives to set things straight, the cattle queen finds herself falling for the avowedly non-violent lawman. Both have itchy-fingered brothers, a female gunman enters the picture, and things go desperately wrong.','/7tJ83se0djTzIQ4pSs1LuebtPV.jpg','1957-09-10',80,'Released','The Taming of the Arizona Territory!','Forty Guns',14837,2.0733,6.6,'OoIOITmuTdg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3480,_binary '\0','/y9C7ZL0gSCV3x71zfwgo1J4BOru.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050414',3.8,2219,'en','From Hell It Came','A wrongfully accused South Seas prince is executed and returns as a walking tree stump.','/isyq2W5onzIUmeGuC5tjVVeArcB.jpg','1957-08-25',73,'Released','Beast-Thing from the Flames of Hades!','From Hell It Came',84058,1.6405,3.9,'Qv4jcKJROFA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3481,_binary '\0','/9VJh0YPms8QM8GYDvt5wtmRsCU5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050419',7,35963,'en','Funny Face','A shy Greenwich Village book clerk is discovered by a fashion photographer and whisked off to Paris where she becomes a reluctant model.','/tzTjalpIz6NyFrWPPlOBFoBjb7z.jpg','1957-02-13',103,'Released','S\'Wonderful! S\'Marvelous! ...She\'s The Fairest Lady of All!','Funny Face',13320,5.4755,7,'X6VLdVrVQGQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3482,_binary '\0','/5rJF6ASGaambfTonEdhbo0HoRu3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050424',6.6,1422,'en','The Garment Jungle','Alan Mitchell returns to New York to work for his father Walter, the owner of a fashion house that designs and manufactures dresses. To stay non-union, Walter has hired Artie Ravidge, a hood who uses strong-arm tactics to keep the employees in line.','/72i06nLvrRlgTURjdO0juiobQdI.jpg','1957-05-01',88,'Released','The Whole Naked Truth','The Garment Jungle',24468,1.8923,6.5,'RcM95uxwTks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3483,_binary '\0','/ebiZGwgT0CotlOmJ87vxjquRhQf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050432',4.6,5044,'en','The Giant Claw','Global panic ensues when it is revealed that a mysterious UFO is actually a giant turkey-like bird that flies at supersonic speed and has no regard for life or architecture.','/hkFSOt7JRUatFRMB6CkfUtMOOKb.jpg','1957-06-01',74,'Released','Flying beast out of prehistoric skies!','The Giant Claw',36089,2.0252,4.8,'zoxPoQKQae0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3484,_binary '\0','/lUoeLsRabarFFpWRSuupenL6LIO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050439',5.6,1376,'en','The Girl in Black Stockings','Residents at a posh Utah hotel become suspects when a girl is found murdered during a pool party. Local sheriff Jess Holmes takes charge of the investigation and must discover who among the terrified guests and staff -- including bodacious vixen Harriet Ames, the hotel\'s bitter, crippled proprietor, visiting lawyer David Hewson and his secretary, Beth -- is the culprit, even as murders continue to take place.','/k0d9ZLInWvzoczOc3Flg7GL5zPe.jpg','1957-09-24',75,'Released','She\'s every inch a teasing, taunting \"Come-on\" Blonde.','The Girl in Black Stockings',62033,1.9703,6.1,'3fbYxld1RXU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3485,_binary '\0','/8yWa53v6CcpkHSgM6nhsi5jRIxb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050456',7.1,2720,'en','The Green Man','Unknown to everyone but his shady Middle Eastern bosses, watchmaker Hawkins is actually a professional hired assassin with a predilection for killing his targets with bombs. After disposing of a dictator and millionaire, Hawkins is assigned to kill a politician who is heading to a remote hotel, The Green Man, for a secret tryst with his secretary. There, however, Hawkins\' plot is discovered by vacuum salesman William Blake, who determines to stop him.','/5UQISYyjXtqjkKzaDp3c84Whk1w.jpg','1956-12-21',80,'Released','The Kind of Picture the British Have a Way With...Things Like Very Merry Murders...Very Unusual Characters...Very Sly Sex...And All Combined in an Uproar of Laughs and Suspense','The Green Man',58470,1.6165,7,'bbV8Lh8UDEY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3486,_binary '\0','/9o4dGUgFpI1aYKzkYLkQk8BfxQM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050458',7.6,6023,'it','Il Grido','A sugar-refinery worker flees his Northern Italy town after a woman refuses his marriage proposal.','/s1o3I46VJP5mkqrBeRJnwdekcRa.jpg','1957-09-26',115,'Released',NULL,'Il Grido',41054,1.6392,7.5,'5WX7Cwvh410','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3487,_binary '\0','/n4Ec7koHqqFKz0fC7vIitNxxqwi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050468',7.1,19114,'en','Gunfight at the O.K. Corral','Lawman Wyatt Earp and outlaw Doc Holliday form an unlikely alliance which culminates in their participation in the legendary Gunfight at the O.K. Corral.','/71AQUFbw49ALCNtKZ69flFmbRhF.jpg','1957-05-30',123,'Released','The Wildest Gunfight in the History of the West!','Gunfight at the O.K. Corral',22201,6.2565,7.005,'xhvD9zcPXU4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3488,_binary '\0','/o43syNek37CQzBOnEtYYV7zcaY6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050470',6.3,1855,'en','The Guns of Fort Petticoat','Opposing his commanding officer\'s decision to attack a group of innocent Indians and wipe them out, Lt. Frank Hewitt leaves his post and heads home to Texas. He knows that the attack will send all of the tribes on the warpath and he wants to forewarn everyone. He gets a chilly reception back home however. With most of the men away having enlisted in the Confederate army Frank, a Union officer, is seen by the local women as a traitor. He convinces them of the danger that lies ahead and trains them to repel the attack that will eventually come.','/AqPmINIfSS2s0NNh8XpmoDcphs1.jpg','1957-04-01',82,'Released','GOOD WOMEN...BAD WOMEN...BRAWLING WOMEN...BRAVE WOMEN! They were all soldiers in skirts!','The Guns of Fort Petticoat',71768,2.3677,6.306,'Bd3UsPcXYNs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3489,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050484',8.1,3472,'bn','হারানো সুর','An amnesiac man escapes the hospital he has been admitted to and is aided by doctor Roma Banerjee, who takes him to her father\'s country house. While treating him she falls for him and he for her. They marry, but an accident makes him remember his life as a rich man in Calcutta and completely forget the time spent with Roma. Roma follows him to Calcutta.','/7xjCDqUet8KIfnsytOZre9aqz69.jpg','1957-09-06',162,'Released',NULL,'Harano Sur',284041,0.7071,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3490,_binary '\0','/gSoBiSXCmDQ3cuh8SBohkHiJrg4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050487',7.1,1788,'en','A Hatful of Rain','A Korean War veteran\'s morphine addiction wreaks havoc upon his family.','/hUhu2qTgvtz1uloooua4KQv1Fip.jpg','1957-07-17',109,'Released','The tender love story of Johnny Pope, husband, brother, father-to-be!','A Hatful of Rain',37086,2.4342,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3491,_binary '\0','/k7gQYCxAV3EyJqryBcw7sotdigp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050490',7.3,10586,'en','Heaven Knows, Mr. Allison','A Roman Catholic nun and a hard-bitten US Marine are stranded together on a Japanese-occupied island in the South Pacific during World War II. Under constant threat of discovery by a ruthless enemy, they hide in a cave and forage for food together. Their forced companionship and the struggle for survival forge a powerful emotional bond between them.','/lsJgNnroZuANP7q8jZpB32m5A7w.jpg','1957-03-13',108,'Released','They were alone on this Pacific Island... trapped behind enemy lines... the marine who had been thru Hell and Sister Angela with her supreme faith in God.','Heaven Knows, Mr. Allison',37103,3.014,7,'GVsxx2TlKrc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3492,_binary '\0','/wrF33Z9YkRfrU5yQ4cMu2NxcqDP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050500',5.6,1257,'en','Hellcats of the Navy','Captain Casey Abbott commands an American submarine in the Pacific during World War II. When a perilous mission to retrieve a new Japanese mine for study goes awry, he\'s forced to abandon a likable combat diver. Abbott\'s orders to leave a man behind appear to be justified, but his second-in-command believes he had ulterior motives:','/sdt2fdPjhX2NhfpZtRtRPDX65J6.jpg','1957-05-01',82,'Released','Down . . . Down . . . Down . . . into enemy waters with the fightin\' hellcats of the U.S. sub pack !','Hellcats of the Navy',82181,2.268,4.8,'FkWXjCnASCk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3493,_binary '\0','/czpVPjEs0z5l3TqXAuJQ86ViKmr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050530',5.2,3184,'en','I Was a Teenage Werewolf','A hypnotherapist uses a temperamental teenager as a guinea pig for a serum which transforms him into a vicious werewolf.','/hUfeXNAyY9r9Yi8LWRGiBmwJwGU.jpg','1957-06-19',76,'Released','Explosive! Amazing! Terrifying! You won\'t believe your eyes!','I Was a Teenage Werewolf',43228,2.4677,4.8,'PCEM0zBMuUQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3494,_binary '\0','/bd9lxQ4SgnNb6NPIph4pz5HGLpY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050539',7.6,22359,'en','The Incredible Shrinking Man','A dangerous combination of radiation and insecticide causes the unfortunate Scott Carey to shrink, slowly but surely, until he is only a few inches tall. His home becomes a wilderness where he must survive everything from spiders living in the cellar to his beloved cat.','/vI7IdqfvsyoQAjAzRWS2fYvUoOu.jpg','1957-02-22',81,'Released','A fascinating adventure into the unknown!','The Incredible Shrinking Man',31682,4.1756,7.5,'JCFrSKmoAfU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3495,_binary '\0','/hINi3qQuRvvyHmT5oMsJVXKsnWF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050545',5.3,2435,'en','Invasion of the Saucer Men','Aliens equipped with venomous claws invade a small town, but the town\'s teenage population is mobilized to fight the menace.','/8gEO48Pzl0IOzuW9gwbAYQGEmW.jpg','1957-06-19',69,'Released','They Threatened The World Until Some Hep Youngsters Took Over!','Invasion of the Saucer Men',52199,2.0804,4.9,'la9VXiM8GJU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3496,_binary '\0','/nbPpPyrMwJLd07nfLtPTp7CKPpS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050546',5.3,1820,'en','The Invisible Boy','A supercomputer plans world domination with the help of Robby the Robot and a 10 year old boy, who is the son of the computer\'s inventor.','/ppZdGVHD6HpV6v8M0Ar5YQoydy3.jpg','1957-10-01',90,'Released','See Timmie and his friend Robby the Robot combat the Super Computer.','The Invisible Boy',26155,1.8509,5.2,'FMP4iZm2qr0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3497,_binary '\0','/cXbIIEFcXvBPWPTDJE3hMH89EV8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050549',6.1,1602,'en','Island in the Sun','A scandalous tale of politics, social inequality, interracial romance, and murder set on a fictitious British-owned Caribbean island.','/edwem9j28FpivnydLlDCchc5WCy.jpg','1957-06-12',119,'Released',NULL,'Island in the Sun',37373,2.5902,6.5,'eh2CZUH1FUs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3498,_binary '\0','/5k7TRCxU84BiOpibPAJByoG3cbe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050556',6.5,10893,'en','Jailhouse Rock','Young convict Vince Everett, serving time for manslaughter, discovers his musical talent in prison and becomes a rock and roll star after his release, navigating fame and relationships.','/iSlddodPAnPuRPr7Cc8AYvaNHSR.jpg','1957-01-17',96,'Released','Elvis in Action as Never Before!','Jailhouse Rock',15697,4.415,6.3,'CW8hct6GpOQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3499,_binary '\0','/8RBGVSwMp3XCrqtqwAjMZgtxL41.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050562',5.6,3081,'en','Jet Pilot','U.S. Air Force aviator Jim Shannon is tasked with escorting a Soviet pilot claiming -- at the height of the Cold War -- that she wants to defect. After falling in love with and marrying her, Shannon learns from his superiors that she\'s a spy on a mission to extract military secrets. To save his new wife from prison and deportation, Shannon devises a risky plan.','/8SdqMiUiTIZa1GzGxil43aQwWey.jpg','1957-10-11',112,'Released','Exploding with all the power of the jet age... with all the passion of a daring love story!','Jet Pilot',53906,2.556,5.5,'Oet7RoEpqzQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3500,_binary '\0','/uskl5KETb1YOXiw49XqIeV7KEvR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050567',6.5,2163,'en','Johnny Tremain','When an injury bars him from pursuing his trade, Revolutionary War-era silversmith\'s apprentice Johnny Tremain finds a new life in the ranks of the Sons of Liberty army, taking part in the Boston Tea Party and Paul Revere\'s legendary ride.','/cQKl3B4lfqKB9hoO8EGYRQiWZfm.jpg','1957-06-19',80,'Released','Hungry for Adventure...Burning to Fight!','Johnny Tremain',43229,1.4575,6.1,'I1fsL7IoscI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3501,_binary '\0','/cjT9FDShbq7BssVs1KpcF0Z77kQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050569',7,1609,'en','The Joker is Wild','A Prohibition-era nightclub crooner has his career is cut short when his throat is slashed by a mob boss.','/4AqFWME7ycwPKVLKChrZqHgzV33.jpg','1957-09-26',126,'Released','The Most Electric Performance That Ever Shocked and Fascinated an Audience!','The Joker is Wild',133792,2.5742,8.1,'Qo7wf86KyhM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3502,_binary '\0','/kfuJtNiY3aevZHzSMA007pbVWqH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050585',7.9,8989,'pl','Kanał','In the last few days of the Warsaw Uprising during World War II, a modest group of Resistance members remains. The band must take refuge in the sewers under the orders of leader Zadra, but it\'s only a matter of time before they will have to emerge. However, when they try, they are met only with intense hostility from the Nazis. Despite their attempts stay resolute through immense mental strain, it becomes increasingly apparent that they may be doomed.','/mUxZNNmvX3MwIJ9LTcuw76ZdtN6.jpg','1957-04-20',96,'Released','The Claustrophobic Nightmare of War','Kanal',29933,2.5019,7.645,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3503,_binary '\0','/wO62WckgbBMpu3efEIY9oQsSLb0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050598',7,9960,'en','A King in New York','A recently-deposed \"Estrovian\" monarch seeks shelter in New York City, where he becomes an accidental television celebrity. Later, he\'s wrongly accused of being a Communist and gets caught up in subsequent HUAC hearings.','/e6KtBoiXa5D3LLZtiMCkiqIDnZv.jpg','1957-09-12',104,'Released','The King of Comedians!','A King in New York',28973,4.0487,6.7,'uF4jTT1t2hU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3504,_binary '\0','/1D6xVjFx3WdEzb0Yu3RprmHZ2Jy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050599',5.6,2316,'en','Kiss Them for Me','Three navy war heroes are booked on a morale-building \"vacation\" in San Francisco. Once they manage to elude their ulcerated public relations officer, the trio throw a wild party with plenty of pretty girls.','/zUNJp1m5lIS5jy2pIuQEIBB3Udi.jpg','1957-12-10',105,'Released','They tried so hard ... so very hard ... not to fall in love !','Kiss Them for Me',52367,2.8754,5.7,'g9oKZY8Ev6U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3505,_binary '\0','/pE4L6xQIpYYgEVVHDbgZKf1263k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050604',7.3,1303,'ru','Конек-Горбунок','Adventures of Ivan the Fool and humpbacked horse in the world of kind magical creatures and cruel people.','/np2JxCCeu0Dq3R2i8mTODMfJjnb.jpg','1947-01-10',57,'Released',NULL,'The Hunchedback Horse',116733,1.7681,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3506,_binary '\0','/1FuGLdgG76Cpa5di16LnoPgPBwU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050610',5.7,2457,'en','Kronos','Scientists investigate a huge meteor that crashes into the ocean off Mexico, and encounter a skyscraper-tall, mobile machine which is designed to syphon energy from earth, including any energy directed at it in an effort to destroy it.','/cq21or9DDlObTSo4AfiXl4u9vnC.jpg','1957-03-31',78,'Released','World-Destroying Monster!','Kronos',43230,1.4675,5.7,'7ErOqYD-i3Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3507,_binary '\0','/rohRr9XqTRF8YwLMGAnTprg3GnL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050613',8,60974,'ja','蜘蛛巣城','Returning to their lord\'s castle, samurai warriors Washizu and Miki are waylaid by a spirit who predicts their futures. When the first part of the spirit\'s prophecy comes true, Washizu\'s scheming wife, Asaji, presses him to speed up the rest of the spirit\'s prophecy by murdering his lord and usurping his place. Director Akira Kurosawa\'s resetting of William Shakespeare\'s \"Macbeth\" in feudal Japan is one of his most acclaimed films.','/zaZFMNxJST0TtPd68yF7fNt1he8.jpg','1957-01-15',108,'Released',NULL,'Throne of Blood',3777,5.7715,7.9,'oa0CcrHB4rc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3508,_binary '\0','/ckoND08stPEqhmY6qC4cqbc7zYA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050622',5.7,2363,'en','The Land Unknown','Navy Commander Alan Roberts is assigned to lead an expedition to Little America in Antarctica to investigate reports of a mysterious warm water inland lake discovered a decade earlier. His helicopter and its small party, including reporter Maggie Hathaway, is forced down into a volcanic crater by a fierce storm. They find themselves trapped in a lush tropical environment that has survived from prehistoric times.','/1kJNx5GJTnp2rLZV8I3Aq4rVL4W.jpg','1957-10-15',78,'Released','BEHIND A BARRIER OF ANTARCTIC ICE... A PARADISE OF HIDDEN TERRORS!','The Land Unknown',43716,1.6956,5.6,'AB59N2iZJt8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3509,_binary '\0','/iQg21T1wlsYAuzhdsg5cKsjmNgy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050629',6.1,4620,'en','Legend of the Lost','American ne\'er-do-well Joe January is hired to take Paul Bonnard on an expedition into the desert in search of treasure.','/3SIcFeARS3BgyOkGRJarKuVtjP0.jpg','1957-12-17',109,'Released','Wayne Tangles with Loren...In the Adventure that\'s Hotter than 1000 Suns!','Legend of the Lost',25848,2.8279,6.191,'Zq2Mn-C0U30','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3510,_binary '\0','/tFT34AaH8NPJsAGVVICf0J2ezm8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050631',6.6,3354,'en','Les Girls','After writing a tell-all book about her days in the dance troupe \"Barry Nichols and Les Girls\", Sybil Wren is sued for libeling her fellow dancer Angele. A Rashômon style narrative presents the story from three points of view where Sybil accuses Angele of having an affair with Barry, while Angele insists that it was actually Sybil who was having the affair. Finally, Barry gives his side of the story.','/78ot7b75r5yWKt0rW9XjXqH7GY1.jpg','1957-10-03',114,'Released','Join \"Les Girls\" And See A World Of Entertainment !','Les Girls',43232,2.0844,6.431,'wLxvAp1X_7Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3511,_binary '\0','/r6bIGLFJ2ml9L970RNpuwDyb4Af.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050634',8.3,23061,'ru','Летят журавли','Veronika and Boris come together in Moscow shortly before World War II. Walking along the river, they watch cranes fly overhead, and promise to rendezvous before Boris leaves to fight. Boris misses the meeting and is off to the front lines, while Veronika waits patiently, sending letters faithfully. After her house is bombed, Veronika moves in with Boris\' family, into the company of a cousin with his own intentions.','/foXYOdXEJ0rvtTDo4LLnsUnvPLB.jpg','1957-10-12',97,'Released','The compelling story of a girl\'s impassioned search for happiness.','The Cranes Are Flying',38360,3.615,7.917,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3512,_binary '\0','/am8LgNooMcWDPf1vRJM5RtLbb5X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050653',6.7,1252,'en','The Long Haul','An American ex-GI takes a job as a truck driver to support his British war bride Connie. It isn\'t long, however, before Harry is blackmailed into joining a smuggling operation run by a conniving criminal.','/aaDEWK1yZEzaLItbSwil2rlm9Rn.jpg','1957-08-27',88,'Released','SILK, FLESH AND DYNAMITE!','The Long Haul',44938,1.8738,5.8,'p_O6aFawNE4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3513,_binary '\0','/zqAg8ZvRAUdGzQqY5NZ10jcwBgm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050658',7.1,18566,'en','Love in the Afternoon','A middle-aged playboy becomes fascinated by the daughter of a private detective who has been hired to entrap him with a client\'s wife.','/jCHVviBhRQ7OkJFQfziO2N2ZJmh.jpg','1957-05-29',130,'Released','Love is a game any number can play... especially in the afternoon...','Love in the Afternoon',18299,3.9188,7.017,'LY7cdC6INIg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3514,_binary '\0','/r0ZGrX630STCIQNRqbXAQXdFIeP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050659',6.5,2792,'en','Loving You','Deliveryman Deke Rivers is discovered by publicist Glenda Markle and country-western musician Tex Warner who want to promote him to fame and fortune, giving him every break he deserves. Romantic complications arise as Susan, another singer in the group, offers him devoted admiration as Glenda leads him on with promises of a golden future.','/o4gUNoyTy3uh2qaHMK0InqvuF8o.jpg','1957-07-09',101,'Released','You\'ll Love Loving You','Loving You',18535,2.4055,6.2,'1p3IK0J9wRw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3515,_binary '\0','/6YKiSNSxatKGm1f4PhlimDOqKz1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050665',7.7,1759,'hi','मधुमती','Two men take shelter in a derelict mansion situated in the countryside during a storm. One of the men suddenly becomes aware that he once visited this mansion in a past life; he recounts a story about when he was Anand, a painter, who fell in love with a tribal girl named Madhumati.','/vrrQ69whukrcuuFi7Oo7PjBaJ2K.jpg','1958-09-12',171,'Released',NULL,'Madhumati',168069,0.7626,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3516,_binary '\0','/A4iFiO82WQPnVHIhX8LpaDb4Row.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050669',7.2,2551,'fr','Maigret tend un piège','Four women are murdered, each knifed and, despite torn garments, remain virtuous. As famed police inspector Jules Maigret pieces the clues together, he comes to realise that for the elusive man that he suspects to be unmasked, he has to set a trap.','/71pYPAf00xoaQ5cmH7lSbWbSOwl.jpg','1958-01-29',119,'Released',NULL,'Maigret Sets a Trap',37454,2.3978,7.032,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3517,_binary '\0','/7YJ9tUShJTW15xohOarp4gDJiH2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050680',6.8,1401,'en','Man in the Shadow','In a modern cow town, the powerful ranch owner’s henchmen kill a ranch hand, prompting the sheriff to investigate despite facing strong opposition. He finds an unlikely ally in the rancher\'s overprotected daughter, but their quest for justice puts them both in danger.','/mBd0BYXAUdEwoXWuFZ4ovzcVqAc.jpg','1957-12-12',80,'Released','THIS WAS THE NIGHT WHEN THE LAW TURNED LAWLESS...to win back the justice a town had betrayed!','Man in the Shadow',36459,2.6853,6.694,'EMIDUpSFCso','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3518,_binary '\0','/fWUdv19MHFPQUmHS8o9CX6cLTNz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050681',7.1,3265,'en','Man of a Thousand Faces','The turbulent life and professional career of vaudeville actor and silent screen horror star Lon Chaney (1883-1930), the man of a thousand faces; bearer of many personal misfortunes that even his great success could not mitigate.','/wNqfvDSeyVV5SHzYcthrCAO6I81.jpg','1957-08-15',122,'Released','The true story of the life and loves of Lon Chaney!','Man of a Thousand Faces',43234,3.0343,6.8,'jWI3eRf_tZg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3519,_binary '\0','/3hEwqtqiXRkJnmHYIFEkADOM2b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050699',7.1,3517,'en','Men in War','In Korea, on 6 September 1950, Lieutenant Benson\'s platoon finds itself isolated in enemy-held territory after a retreat. Soon they are joined by Sergeant Montana, whose overriding concern is caring for his catatonic colonel. Benson and Montana can\'t stand each other, but together they must get the survivors to Hill 465, where they hope the division is waiting. It\'s a long, harrowing march, fraught with all the dangers the elusive enemy can summon.','/jfhF7arZn3VAJhrbjpDLLI9MDOC.jpg','1957-05-03',102,'Released','\"One more step and I\'ll fill your guts with lead!\"','Men in War',61370,2.3695,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3520,_binary '\0','/3yYNJeR6JynSE3Y1AfVIJQ6g3UX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050706',7.6,25148,'fr','Mon oncle','Genial, bumbling Monsieur Hulot loves his top-floor apartment in a grimy corner of the city, and cannot fathom why his sister\'s family has moved to the suburbs. Their house is an ultra-modern nightmare, which Hulot only visits for the sake of stealing away his rambunctious young nephew. Hulot\'s sister, however, wants to win him over to her new way of life, and conspires to set him up with a wife and job.','/wH6RyPiXFy8INLbViVkchLVOmBc.jpg','1958-05-10',118,'Released','Mr Hulot takes a precious, playful and purely premeditated look at modern times...','Mon Oncle',427,3.239,7.428,'vqVpQ6S0BDA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3521,_binary '\0','/ia2IS4eW1334gxiojbxZnuC7CyP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050709',7.4,2159,'fr','Les Misérables','In 19th century France, Jean Valjean, a man imprisoned for stealing bread, must flee a relentless policeman named Javert. The pursuit consumes both men\'s lives, and soon Valjean finds himself in the midst of the student revolutions in France.','/AtjUXhvf3Dla4fuhZc60XHMk322.jpg','1958-03-12',210,'Released',NULL,'Les Misérables',4412,3.284,7.164,'MuMyT4TkbLs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3522,_binary '\0','/fNeaL33dEMm9f2p3I7ClwBDKZjK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050717',2.5,2988,'es','La momia azteca contra el robot humano','A mad doctor builds a robot in order to steal a valuable Aztec treasure from a tomb guarded by a centuries old living mummy.','/z5NR8SLZQ9bcSXig9z72YLAqtzt.jpg','1958-07-17',65,'Released','See the relentless machine battle the gruesome corpse','The Robot vs. The Aztec Mummy',31243,1.6893,3,'ZhsFAt9ju2o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3523,_binary '\0','/owXdDW8G3myf1D34zGHohtH3gty.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050720',6.4,4666,'en','The Monolith Monsters','Rocks from a meteor which grow when in contact with water threaten a sleepy Southwestern desert community.','/xIStqMPFzdvOs4Lm0kRwEMGNNm6.jpg','1957-12-06',77,'Released','Mammoth skyscrapers of stone thundering across the earth!','The Monolith Monsters',52196,1.7747,6.5,'Vo31M0PIoHM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3524,_binary '\0','/8lBKaBFTXpEAshuba3Eh7Qn8Ds1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050722',5.7,3700,'en','The Monster That Challenged the World','Giants Mollusks are released from the earth by an earthquake and start killing people.','/rnXcmKzNatbvuXj20xTXQt7Ne9i.jpg','1957-06-14',84,'Released','A new kind of terror to numb the nerves!','The Monster That Challenged the World',53949,2.6946,5.6,'50NZq9DNVa0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3525,_binary '\0','/78JqWR8c4AVz6I5inSfJNjc6RfM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050723',3.7,1595,'en','Monster from Green Hell','A test rocket carrying wasps to outer space, to study the effects on them of weightlessness and radiations, crashes out of control back to Earth, into the jungles of Africa. The two astrobiologists in charge of the test mount an expedition to the Darkest Continent to retrieve their experiment, only to find the wasps have grown to giant size which are panicking all forms of life as they quest for food.','/yWWqlLzfOBYtfW2iHVHZTn1uhUV.jpg','1957-05-17',71,'Released','The mammoth monster that terrified the Earth! Too awesome to describe! Too terrifying to escape! Too powerful to stop!','Monster from Green Hell',52455,1.8823,3.9,'A4lJdarKpgU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3526,_binary '\0','/lTQjtOreIxbImcsZSCqmkBG6Smw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050738',6.3,1305,'en','My Man Godfrey','The eccentric Bullock household again need a new butler. Daughter Irene encounters bedraggled Godfrey Godfrey at the docks and, fancying him and noticing his obviously good manners, gets him the job. He proves a great success, but keeps his past to himself. When an old flame turns up Irene\'s sister Cordelia starts making waves.','/9qXWyhDDoQH2WEc3KecjRmu6QC.jpg','1957-10-11',92,'Released','She wanted her breakfast in bed - but not alone.','My Man Godfrey',52470,1.9182,6.5,'uGdElifXAsY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000');
INSERT INTO `movies` VALUES (3527,_binary '\0','/khSFRENi0FDKkyGemL7CcjjluKz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050746',7.2,1766,'de','Nachts, wenn der Teufel kam','Hamburg, Germany, 1944, during World War II. A serial killer terrorizes the city. When it seems clear that the local police are unable to catch him, forces as dark and terrible as the criminal himself become involved in the case.','/4sZjljOR09AQ9oSBhDDkMeWtpVy.jpg','1957-09-19',100,'Released',NULL,'The Devil Strikes at Night',103396,2.1692,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3528,_binary '\0','/nFBXCsLY8KssG2nAOFe4NLxAFLu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050749',6.8,2301,'en','The Naked Truth','Nigel Dennis publishes a scandal magazine. But for each story he writes, he first approaches the person whose scandalous behavior is described (or rather implied, to avoid any libel suit) and says he will suppress the story in return for money. Several of his victims first decide individually to kill him instead of paying, but fail in amusing ways. Then they find that to protect their various secrets they must now join forces for a rather different purpose...','/nJNYi89vWdkpdRNalo4qxDijBnK.jpg','1957-12-03',91,'Released','Terrific... Shocking... Scandalous...','The Naked Truth',49843,1.5931,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3529,_binary '\0','/tOagzRL6JkbU0sJIPosQHEaNFg9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050758',7.9,1414,'hi','नया दौर','Shankar lives in a remote village in rural India with his mother and sister, Manju, and drives a horse-carriage for a living. The main employer in the region is a kind-hearted businessman Maganlal. When Maganlal announces that he would like to undertake a religious pilgrimage, his son, Kundan, takes over and wants to cut back on labor and mechanize the business - thus leading to loss in jobs','/rurk32iOjcexNzUtHzOuSQoQYYd.jpg','1957-02-22',173,'Released',NULL,'Naya Daur',48925,0.9443,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3530,_binary '\0','/4Ta5j0ii9mOkhR4fLQky0JurRG9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050762',7.2,2024,'no','Ni liv','The movie takes place during World War II and depicts the true story of Jan Baalsruds amazing escape from the German army from the coast of Northern Norway and across the border to the neutral country Sweden.','/vzM9JWevYCMfFiibaO8z3riTyTK.jpg','1957-10-03',96,'Released',NULL,'Nine Lives',20372,1.4265,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3531,_binary '\0','/wGEmQE6ajaKPh6HiX4waNzzuYSq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050763',6.6,4954,'en','Night Passage','Grant MacLaine, a former railroad troubleshooter, lost his job after letting his outlaw, the Utica Kid, escape. After spending five years wandering the west and earning his living playing the accordion, he is given a second chance by his former boss.','/jb9YcoP4c4kM2n1w37JyYELms2o.jpg','1957-07-24',90,'Released','This was the night when the naked fury of the McLaines flamed out with consuming vengeance across a terrorized land!','Night Passage',25381,2.4908,6.5,'s4gCFpP2aWQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3532,_binary '\0','/bUFWLSQsSYdyy4eohp4iBBnOV1s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050766',7.4,17656,'en','Night of the Demon','American professor John Holden arrives in London for a conference on parapsychology only to discover that the colleague he was supposed to meet was killed in a freak accident the day before. It turns out that the deceased had been investigating a cult lead by Dr. Julian Karswell. Though a skeptic, Holden is suspicious of the devil-worshiping Karswell. Following a trail of mysterious manuscripts, Holden enters a world that makes him question his faith in science.','/ePAjGAhynpwEI5HbpIrB28ML6lg.jpg','1957-11-09',96,'Released','Who will be the next in line to defy the curse?','Night of the Demon',25103,4.1576,7.046,'-rwfiJpyFrI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3533,_binary '\0','/2xegakHz8mB4oVaXSFSSd1nnPT1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050771',7.1,1563,'en','No Down Payment','The marital difficulties of four couples living in a southern California housing development become intertwined. Among the unhappy couples are ne\'er-do-well Jerry Flagg and his long-suffering wife Isabelle, flirtatious Leola Boone and her sadistic husband Troy, hard-working Herman Kreitzer and his understanding wife Betty, and newlyweds Jean and David Martin.','/gjjDmdrkYgZNgNn00QEJE0s5n5i.jpg','1957-10-30',105,'Released','Do You Really Know Your Neighbors?','No Down Payment',110671,2.8021,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3534,_binary '\0','/eKb5U1lUeXY5wXRTaByjgYehps5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050778',6.1,2733,'en','Not of This Earth','An alien from planet Davanna, whose population has developed a terminal blood disease caused by nuclear radiation, is sent to Earth to acquire fresh human blood for his people.','/tgjdzyriupfXJStZVEUouVhU2k9.jpg','1957-02-10',67,'Released','Somewhere in this world stalks a thing that is...','Not of This Earth',27623,2.29,5.705,'kLwLMtS9cJI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3535,_binary '\0','/uvlBN9lUSlqYoBOnqqfZhs3Vs2I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050781',6.6,3492,'fr','Notre-Dame de Paris','In 1482 Paris, Frollo, Chief Justice of benevolent King Louis XI, becomes infatuated by the beauty of Esmeralda, a young Romani girl. The hunchback Quasimodo, Frollo\'s protégé and bell-ringer of Notre Dame, lives in peace among the bells in the heights of the immense cathedral until he\'s involved by the twisted magistrate in his malicious plans to free himself from Esmeralda\'s alleged spell, which he believes to be the Devil\'s work.','/ds4pCq0GOEarBHI35bYSN2PC0KQ.jpg','1956-12-19',115,'Released','The timeless tale of the seductive gypsy Esmeralda and the tortured hunchback Quasimodo.','The Hunchback of Notre Dame',11594,4.2032,6.704,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3536,_binary '\0','/fWkNhudvl6dtEHWSdQD6nl92GnD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050782',7.7,10506,'it','Le notti bianche','A middle-aged man meets a young woman who is waiting on a canal bridge for her lover\'s return.','/sAFR7LbXnPSjZGpG1ihSAN7vrfR.jpg','1957-11-14',101,'Released',NULL,'White Nights',43231,3.1913,7.446,'2UOGA9gTgZY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3537,_binary '\0','/9yepEBnQNcKzWWyHdUiX8Mnqc6U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050783',8.1,57648,'it','Le notti di Cabiria','Rome, 1957. A woman, Cabiria, is robbed and left to drown by her boyfriend, Giorgio. Rescued, she resumes her life and tries her best to find happiness in a cynical world. Even when she thinks her struggles are over and she has found happiness and contentment, things may not be what they seem.','/xF4oCG3PLNbcrtPZbqB3BtkIbKg.jpg','1957-10-03',110,'Released','The story of a betrayed but unquenchable little Roman street-walker.','Nights of Cabiria',19426,5.3904,8,'OO6EmDhi2X0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3538,_binary '\0','/bFj82z1rOIEmsin3jbdGzkeBDpv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050798',7.2,16904,'en','Old Yeller','Young Travis Coates is left to take care of the family ranch with his mother and younger brother while his father goes off on a cattle drive in the 1860s. When a yellow mongrel comes for an uninvited stay with the family, Travis reluctantly adopts the dog.','/Xe7AB0ffhGPSdBZ4qJ9AKJfllL.jpg','1957-12-25',84,'Released','All the heart, all the excitement of a great frontier adventure!','Old Yeller',22660,4.5191,6.9,'ctter6jvD4Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3539,_binary '\0','/gDE1ARqdCh4GdQvNpQhEKgCXZz5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050800',7.3,1342,'en','On the Bowery','A mix of documentary and scripted footage on the Bowery, New York City\'s skid row. Against a backdrop of men (and a few women) drinking in bars, talking and arguing, and sleeping on sidewalks, we have the story of Ray.','/3ue0wCB0gOyY3c8Tj1idjg2XBQ3.jpg','1957-03-18',65,'Released',NULL,'On the Bowery',88051,1.0606,6.7,'CHuYXEwCk_U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3540,_binary '\0','/2YBUwWtLtAfFggIyAFBsMkN9YDx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050803',7.1,2797,'en','The One That Got Away','Based on the true story of Oberleutnant Franz von Werra, the only German prisoner of war captured in Britain to escape back to Germany during the Second World War.','/kbBjNhQJCDDWaH0MYXFfN1pU9zy.jpg','1957-11-22',111,'Released',NULL,'The One That Got Away',64735,2.5548,6.8,'PqgyBGVIck8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3541,_binary '\0','/hcnfZWVCiURtdRZTsb54aGH70jW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050805',6.5,1469,'en','Operation Mad Ball','In this wacky military spoof, Lemmon plays a terminally bored Army private waging a war of wits as he tries to throw a party under the nose of his obnoxious commanding officer.','/dZKL7oB3NVY94YWN9F3gk55VIH7.jpg','1957-08-17',105,'Released','It\'s Operation Laughter For You! and anything goes!','Operation Mad Ball',60387,1.9012,6.7,'ENyNAHd8woQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3542,_binary '\0','/ckJPiOT2EMsUOHb0pMdpGmeTtqU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050814',6.6,4576,'en','The Pajama Game','An Iowa pajama factory worker falls in love with an affable superintendent who had been hired by the factory\'s boss to help oppose the workers\' demand for a pay raise.','/71Q9f7byPqH8trF4BvZOlXnhO2D.jpg','1957-08-29',103,'Released','Based on the hit Broadway musical, featuring the choreography of Bob Fosse.','The Pajama Game',40867,1.7921,6.2,'u3p1L1LG4Kw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3543,_binary '\0','/aDFQRANjuP90srmxLfxVntEAi83.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050815',6.6,6407,'en','Pal Joey','An opportunistic singer woos a wealthy widow to boost his career.','/5vWaDXDBxEv9ahwF8aSigbC0ADy.jpg','1957-10-25',111,'Released','From Your Pal, Columbia!','Pal Joey',33734,2.256,6.3,'renmTEWSrHQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3544,_binary '\0','/j59qny9pcp3RCzT7HdTQm2auTSk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050817',6.5,2772,'it','Pane, amore e...','Back to his hometown, a former marshal finds his house occupied by a young woman working as a fishwife.','/sfxyltBi5FNoN38KLo491QzdiBB.jpg','1955-12-22',106,'Released','Never have the beauties of Italy been so magnificently revealed!','Scandal in Sorrento',56287,1.8178,6.829,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3545,_binary '\0','/nbMY2UcNnaAr3jrrowzN0NaxQyr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050825',8.4,242672,'en','Paths of Glory','A commanding officer defends three scapegoats on trial for a failed offensive that occurred within the French Army in 1916.','/hGg1UCQSHlXfv2HI9bDHT2OQBam.jpg','1957-10-25',88,'Released','It explodes in the no-man\'s land no picture ever dared cross before!','Paths of Glory',975,8.9202,8.3,'FESvZ0HG2p4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3546,_binary '\0','/rjji4uYr1Uu6VAsZasIrRVQqzUC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050839',7.2,7319,'en','Peyton Place','In the outwardly respectable New England community of Peyton Place, shopkeeper Constance McKenzie tries to make up for a past indiscretion -- which resulted in her illegitimate daughter Allison -- by adopting a chaste, prudish attitude towards all things sexual. In spite of herself, Constance can\'t help but be attracted to handsome new teacher Michael Rossi. Meanwhile, the restless Allison, who\'d like to be as footloose and fancy-free as the town\'s \"fast girl\" Betty Anderson, falls sincerely in love with mixed-up mama\'s boy Norman Page.','/pSANpoBLMbejWTtiKz630eSaDpi.jpg','1957-12-13',157,'Released','Small town America will never be the same again.','Peyton Place',43236,3.0289,6.726,'6mE98wOuyO0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3547,_binary '\0','/r1k9pK3POw3Z0djmOw1hqd8PyOU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050847',6.9,1574,'en','Plunder Road','A spectacular heist starts to unravel as the crooks take it on the lam.','/zm4RBWwImlnUctZmwDKjPHDnz14.jpg','1957-12-05',72,'Released','Crime of the century!','Plunder Road',36521,2.6014,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3548,_binary '\0','/avig8B7cHhtVIDjQDRyslAAE7nx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050858',5.7,3637,'en','The Pride and the Passion','During the Napoleonic Wars, when the French have occupied Spain, some Spanish guerrilla soldiers are going to move a big cannon across Spain in order to help the British defeat the French. A British officer is there to accompany the Spanish and along the way, he falls in love with the leader\'s girl.','/y2VMSaMcwKMdIsy2vdB2FsXmfyD.jpg','1957-07-10',132,'Released','You have never seen its like -- and may never see its equal!','The Pride and the Passion',23102,2.9646,6.019,'9eS7-12Lxjw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3549,_binary '\0','/gZjG63B9YIYxmycvnPnqJyToVC3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050861',6.4,9958,'en','The Prince and the Showgirl','An American showgirl becomes entangled in political intrigue when the Prince Regent of a foreign country attempts to seduce her.','/eNnzkk6OPRnx2jApJ4MnbvJFEvm.jpg','1957-06-13',115,'Released','SOME COUNTRIES HAVE A MEDAL FOR EVERYTHING','The Prince and the Showgirl',24012,2.9995,6.4,'JgHEeTUio7Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3550,_binary '\0','/hvtRa9AZ2mKnR32fRow356vsdSf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050870',8.3,8430,'hi','प्यासा','Vijay, a destitute poet, searches for true love while attempting to get his work published. With the assistance of two women in his life, his dream comes true - but at a cost that causes Vijay to rethink his worldview.','/lQu1gBTKIF4BGC0f3GZPEbQYzWq.jpg','1957-02-19',146,'Released',NULL,'Pyaasa',41053,2.0554,7.292,'IjlQJjmTIcM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3551,_binary '\0','/cEcpxL3BgEs8xBT43ancwLVdNfQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050873',6.7,5570,'en','Quatermass 2','In England, a group of space scientists led by Bernard Quatermass, who have developed plans for the first Moon colony, learn that a secret, ostensibly government-run, complex of identical design has been built in a remote part of England and is the focus of periodic falls of small, hollow \"meteorites\" originating in outer space. Quatermass determines to investigate and uncovers a terrifying extraterrestrial life form which has already begun action to take over the Earth.','/hJJtV5puzYAODgck0JTWVX8zjKu.jpg','1957-06-17',85,'Released','A horrible enemy from the unknown strikes terror across the earth!','Quatermass 2',26278,3.3702,6.4,'gVNFjT2MMvw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3552,_binary '\0','/fN01xZGFvxdEMuCVLJXicmcdfA3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050882',6.3,4856,'en','Raintree County','In 1859, idealist John Wickliff Shawnessey, a resident of Raintree County, Indiana, is distracted from his high school sweetheart Nell Gaither by Susanna Drake, a rich New Orleans girl. This love triangle is further complicated by the American Civil War, and dark family history.','/23JBLEhaOi1ltOTzFOR5r60bVn9.jpg','1957-12-20',188,'Released','In The Great Tradition Of Civil War Romance','Raintree County',65488,2.5955,6.4,'3JzWQCUbYrU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3553,_binary '\0','/mnHVOgE2JbAyLYtMJ8z064KiE9P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050894',6.7,7151,'en','The Revenge of Frankenstein','Rescued from the guillotine by his devoted dwarf Fritz, the Baron relocates to Carlsbruck, where he continues his gruesome experiments.','/3SKLAELeQFislTtdXF9r1aVp4a7.jpg','1958-06-01',90,'Released','The Terror Rises Again.','The Revenge of Frankenstein',3127,2.6765,6.6,'_nkd3AlNug8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3554,_binary '\0','/zSzU6R2xkU6asCuKiaFaKgtEesT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050902',6.7,1270,'en','The Rising of the Moon','Three vignettes of old Irish country life, based on a series of short stories. In \"The Majesty of the Law,\" a police officer must arrest an old-fashioned, traditional fellow for assault. The man\'s principles have the policeman and the whole village, including the man he slugged, sympathizing with him. \"One Minute\'s Wait\" is about a little train station and glimpses into the lives of the passengers, with a series of comic setups. The third piece, \"1921,\" is about a condemned Irish nationalist and his daring escape.','/xUBhv0tHDYgYQmvjSSdEUPwXADv.jpg','1957-05-17',81,'Released','Actually filmed in the Emerald Isle!','The Rising of the Moon',178103,1.934,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3555,_binary '\0','/mepqfHSCOY0f5BK020RpbOKZyDs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050903',6.4,1465,'en','The River\'s Edge','A murderous thief on the run with stolen loot forces a poor rancher to guide him across the desert into Mexico. Accompanying them is the rancher\'s wife, who happens to be the killer\'s former girlfriend.','/5nRwD4kaAVy531CAdQqXZJb1m8G.jpg','1957-04-11',87,'Released','It was kill ... or be killed ... all the way down to The River\'s Edge.','The River\'s Edge',71144,2.5225,6.1,'G4pB7PpXWmc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3556,_binary '\0','/x4vClD6R3lzOmpG0n3kOVHmHfJ4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050915',6.6,2739,'en','Run of the Arrow','When the South loses the war, Confederate veteran O\'Meara goes West, joins the Sioux, takes a wife and refuses to be an American but he must choose a side when the Sioux go to war against the U.S. Army.','/r1nonOkyMMmmtVGvk5JSuY3KpPH.jpg','1957-09-05',86,'Released','The strange saga of the Johnny Reb who turned Sioux to wage a one-man war against the Yankees !','Run of the Arrow',35001,3.0048,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3557,_binary '\0','/wOIktycEFcxHg62T45cSTYYcrWL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050923',6.6,1910,'en','Saddle the Wind','Steve Sinclair is a world-weary former gunslinger, now living as a peaceful farmer. Things go wrong when his wild younger brother Tony arrives on the scene with his new bride Joan Blake.','/bn4b43hKF5z5jVSidGEma1yaWD5.jpg','1958-03-20',84,'Released','Brothers with guns who... Saddle the Wind','Saddle the Wind',77814,2.9592,6.686,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3558,_binary '\0','/4gpoD4zijMBBdaAPYL5syQS3Ocr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050928',6.4,1437,'en','Saint Joan','In 1456, French King Charles VII recalls the story of how he met the 17-year-old peasant girl Joan of Arc, entrusted her with the command of the French Army, and ultimately burned her at the stake as a heretic.','/6dWYLyrxx6BzkMe8XLAdC5Xqy4j.jpg','1957-05-08',110,'Released','A Brilliant Triumph!','Saint Joan',108564,1.8496,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3559,_binary '\0','/eYHkb8xNizPXXGXAFfg4Gvm974b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050933',7,9014,'en','Sayonara','Air Force Major Lloyd Gruver is reassigned to a Japanese air base and is confronted with US racial prejudice against the Japanese people. The issue is compounded because a number of the soldiers become romantically involved with Japanese women, in defiance of US military policy. Ordinarily, a by-the-book officer, Gruver must take a position when a buddy of his, an enlisted man, Joe Kelly, falls in love with a Japanese woman, Katsumi, and marries her. Gruver risks his position by serving as best man at the wedding ceremony.','/xSXJDamf9vSb1qOiBhOMjB2soDE.jpg','1957-12-25',147,'Released','\"I am not allowed to love. But I will love you if that is your desire...\"','Sayonara',40885,2.568,6.7,'koIRJwmbtyE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3560,_binary '\0','/36RTWgKjnw9xiw6Ba9yMhWjKF4b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050957',3.9,2149,'en','The She-Creature','A mysterious hypnotist reverts his beautiful assistant back into the form of a prehistoric sea monster that she was in a past life.','/mRCwf8x6JDQrFaU7eVI9lL0Utbl.jpg','1956-08-01',77,'Released','Hypnotized! Reincarnated as a monster from hell!','The She-Creature',43312,1.8389,4.1,'ALdUtMUWqxw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3561,_binary '\0','/52K332gz99X34od5PQ2mJUnAANP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050972',6.8,4675,'en','Silk Stockings','After three bumbling Soviet agents fail in their mission to retrieve a straying Soviet composer from Paris, the beautiful, ultra-serious Ninotchka is sent to complete their mission and to retrieve them. She starts out condemning the decadent West, but gradually falls under its spell—with the help of an American movie producer. A remake of Ninotchka (1939).','/kuV34rCOrcDt6Ii3149AlJs9bpM.jpg','1957-07-18',117,'Released','Sheer delight!','Silk Stockings',43239,2.684,6.9,'8HXqYbFrR9w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3562,_binary '\0','/5WuvIg4f2AdFPLUADFjxexVAb2H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050974',6.6,6682,'de','Sissi - Schicksalsjahre einer Kaiserin','After a wonderful time in Hungary Sissi falls extremely ill and must retreat to a Mediterranean climate to rest. The young empress’ mother takes her from Austria to recover in Madeira.','/o6B5zxNzWR6hvT77IbjjUXdCtEu.jpg','1957-12-18',109,'Released',NULL,'Sissi: The Fateful Years of an Empress',459,3.1957,7.116,'q4zV81VvWRI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3563,_binary '\0','/6s2BqtDvp1BMiP70zCDU5OW6hMy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050976',8.1,217718,'sv','Det sjunde inseglet','When disillusioned Swedish knight Antonius Block returns home from the Crusades to find his country in the grips of the Black Death, he challenges Death to a chess match for his life. Tormented by the belief that God does not exist, Block sets off on a journey, meeting up with traveling players Jof and his wife, Mia, and becoming determined to evade Death long enough to commit one redemptive act while he still lives.','/wcZ21zrOsy0b52AfAF50XpTiv75.jpg','1957-02-16',96,'Released','The story of a challenge to death.','The Seventh Seal',490,10.9701,8.1,'vZucwtdSvJ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3564,_binary '\0','/ldAxBJpnIBBRQX8HXTvAusxNi2P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050985',6.9,2586,'en','The Smallest Show on Earth','Jean and Bill are a married couple trying to scrape a living. Out of the blue they receive a telegram informing them Bill\'s long-lost uncle has died and left them his business—a cinema in the town of Sloughborough. Unfortunately they can\'t sell it for the fortune they hoped as they discover it is falling down and almost worthless.','/epQZGlatIZvtJPAsfLJ8jOxFBNg.jpg','1957-04-09',83,'Released','The Funniest Show on Earth!','The Smallest Show on Earth',35185,1.7328,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3565,_binary '\0','/BBVAUchYvkmPThVIqipgAfabfl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050986',8.1,125780,'sv','Smultronstället','Crotchety retired doctor Isak Borg travels from Stockholm to Lund, Sweden, with his pregnant and unhappy daughter-in-law, Marianne, in order to receive an honorary degree from his alma mater. Along the way, they encounter a series of hitchhikers, each of whom causes the elderly doctor to muse upon the pleasures and failures of his own life. These include the vivacious young Sara, a dead ringer for the doctor\'s own first love.','/iyTD2QnySNMPUPE3IedZQipSWfz.jpg','1957-08-28',91,'Released',NULL,'Wild Strawberries',614,6.8346,8.07,'EwMgTyVbCS0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3566,_binary '\0','/b7g3wiSml2NoyGhfTf66Rvv1Dlh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050987',7.5,3650,'ru','Снежная королева','When the Snow Queen, a lonely and powerful fairy, kidnaps the human boy Kai, his best friend Gerda must overcome many obstacles on her journey to rescue him.','/ptCK2qAyGEmQBys3cImY6o6qAyp.jpg','1957-10-22',61,'Released','Miracle, magical, musical entertainment for all ages of the heart!!!','The Snow Queen',72214,3.011,6.774,'brehkGE_jzE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3567,_binary '\0','/9lXi3BIGfLr3gE09LbWv1NwQnvR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0050993',6.5,1441,'en','Something of Value','As Kenya\'s Mau Mau uprising tears the country apart, former childhood friends Kimani (Sidney Poitier), a native, and Peter (Rock Hudson), a British colonist, find themselves on opposite sides of the struggle in this provocative drama. Though each is devoted to his cause, both wish for a more moderate path -- but their hopes for a peaceful resolution are thwarted by rage, colonial arrogance and escalating violence on both sides.','/jKkIiaaXosYTPtRPa9FaBYCqkd7.jpg','1957-05-08',113,'Released','Love in an Inferno','Something of Value',67521,1.9534,5.5,'lKf6QosIU10','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3568,_binary '\0','/1uCD2mE2XzPjVayFDK3RwB6LGac.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051003',7.1,9417,'en','The Spirit of St. Louis','In 1927, Charles Lindbergh struggles to finance and design an airplane that will make his New York to Paris flight the first solo transatlantic crossing.','/9mLHzgDph5eYYlvliiIA9nouOka.jpg','1957-04-01',135,'Released','One of the Great Adventures of Our Time!','The Spirit of St. Louis',18776,4.4578,6.678,'pADw8x4zjsk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3569,_binary '\0','/wTMZwa8yxVMoK3zSypT8t3ExdcV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051016',4.8,1706,'en','The Story of Mankind','The devil and the spirit of mankind argue as to whether or not humanity is ultimately good or evil.','/lkjbuh3YRgA191YFvlwKPe7qb9U.jpg','1957-11-08',100,'Released','The whole story of men and their women from Creation to now!','The Story of Mankind',43252,2.1728,4.4,'FVvqhxUIDg4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3570,_binary '\0','/leHTLI1aItR0UsrWllUMr4f8PZq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051019',6.9,1492,'en','The Strange One','A military school student develops a destructive power over his fellow cadets.','/b0SrpyJp7R2UG8cLFEo5qsZ1QHx.jpg','1957-04-12',100,'Released','\"THE STRANGE ONE\" IS A STRANGE ONE!','The Strange One',80264,1.3935,6.5,'bLVfGjqVQ94','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3571,_binary '\0','/6Tf64sfno5XMgzKDgTJEn192Hvp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051020',4.8,1545,'en','The Strange World of Planet X','Near a small English village, a scientific team is conducting experiments with magnetic fields, the results of which may have military applications but the intensification of which seem to be connected to UFO reports, a series of murders, an enormous insect egg, and a strange visitor with exceptional scientific knowledge.','/e1XJeRBmbIgnHU6YseqMLNLREhw.jpg','1958-03-04',75,'Released','Man and alien unite to combat the most insidious peril the universe has ever known!','The Strange World of Planet X',71990,1.8093,4.8,'Mg5eTLxhTBA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3572,_binary '\0','/a9R2ZfRtGzE1pNEoxZcN7kRdRwu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051028',6.2,2895,'en','The Sun Also Rises','A group of disillusioned American expatriate writers live a dissolute, hedonistic lifestyle in 1920\'s France and Spain.','/aUmBezgVtjtYTzw9k2tNbHEfCWI.jpg','1957-08-23',130,'Released','No one dared to film it until now!','The Sun Also Rises',25190,3.5781,5.8,'xplPS8AUMT0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3573,_binary '\0','/6L1Co3uRWuoaqDxpWvGDvgXms7T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051036',8,40649,'en','Sweet Smell of Success','New York City newspaper writer J.J. Hunsecker holds considerable sway over public opinion with his Broadway column, but one thing that he can\'t control is his younger sister, Susan, who is in a relationship with aspiring jazz guitarist Steve Dallas. Hunsecker strongly disapproves of the romance and recruits publicist Sidney Falco to find a way to split the couple, no matter how ruthless the method.','/akzvV8JasNrgEl5iAP9K6zPHGJe.jpg','1957-07-04',97,'Released','Beware these “Gentlemen” of the press!','Sweet Smell of Success',976,4.8868,7.6,'gBbPlyHxj8c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3574,_binary '\0','/eAOKBpJgVI2siHiMdAaTF9hERti.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051047',7.3,7140,'en','The Tall T','Pat Brennan\'s luck is about to go from bad to worse; after gambling his horse away, he gets a ride from Willard and Doretta Mims. However, their stagecoach is hijacked by a trio of merciless bandits, led by ruthless Frank Usher. As Usher holds the passengers hostage, Brennan falls in love with Doretta and develops a risky plan to free himself and the Mimses, leading to a bloody final standoff.','/nTVZAsEOkibDyuNlyuExKpwOdfH.jpg','1957-04-02',78,'Released','Taut! Torrid! Tremendous! T Is for Terror!','The Tall T',43253,3.0744,6.99,'V_nJEMSKXjM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3575,_binary '\0','/s17Yula5CGzVj0ggEchpAIQYWET.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051051',6.9,2984,'en','Tammy and the Bachelor','An unsophisticated young woman from the Mississippi swamps falls in love with an unconventional southern gentleman.','/qUrFoPIN52Ck8Yv326rNraqNw3o.jpg','1957-06-14',89,'Released','All about a little Mississippi riverboat gal who taught a sophisticated bachelor about love!','Tammy and the Bachelor',43240,2.8293,7,'G8tT7VwRAqA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3576,_binary '\0','/bcIZAbwH4iPEeJ1hYcGyU4Fsv69.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051055',7.1,4546,'en','The Tarnished Angels','In the 1930s, once-great World War I pilot Roger Shumann performs as a daredevil barnstorming pilot at aerial stunt shows while his wife, LaVerne, works as a parachutist. When newspaper reporter Burke Devlin arrives to do a story on the Shumanns’ act, he quickly falls in love with the beautiful--and neglected--LaVerne.','/8F7OgLRmJrj8OR1vf0Rk3DVYAaN.jpg','1957-11-21',91,'Released','The Book They Said Could Never Be Filmed!','The Tarnished Angels',38432,2.5303,6.8,'iHGww9jPdLg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3577,_binary '\0','/4jB16WjDVx2CCJywQAs3HpbOiUS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051064',3,1398,'en','Teenage Zombies','A boating trip to an uncharted island becomes a fight for survival when two men happen upon a mad scientist, her brainwashed minions and a murderous gorilla.','/2f1Tsewydiffvz5FNnhTTgYMdZg.jpg','1959-11-12',73,'Released','A fiendish experiment performed with sadistic horror!','Teenage Zombies',35662,0.8737,3.6,'9xH_Zf1usWQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3578,_binary '\0','/8mOm5xjEJpQPYu3dMg3UuSETQpJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051077',7.2,9731,'en','The Three Faces of Eve','A doctor treats a woman suffering from multiple personality disorder.','/jqfTPqaGYlz1ZR7YHjz5RTgPa8U.jpg','1957-12-19',91,'Released','The strangest true experience a young girl ever had.','The Three Faces of Eve',28285,2.798,7.2,'hTfmyD4NsEk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3579,_binary '\0','/5pdvV9yDXTFBVhwN1nzzkTh4acB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051082',7.7,1491,'ru','Тихий Дон','Based on the novel of the same name by Mikhail Sholokhov, about the fate of people broken by the First World War, the October Revolution of 1917 and the Civil War in Russia (1917-1922), about the collapse of the foundations and ideals of the Don Cossacks of Russia at the beginning of the XX century, about the personal tragedy of the protagonist — Grigoriy Melekhov.','/28eNhy2J9VHNiBBNTZDcEKPmkka.jpg','1957-10-26',340,'Released','The epic film based on Mikhail Sholokhov\'s classic novel in COLOR','Quiet Flows the Don',109991,2.0338,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3580,_binary '\0','/Acjh3WddvFEDi81LgbLoHW8Q5uj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051083',7.3,1625,'en','Time Limit','Military investigator Colonel Edwards is assigned a case involving Major Cargill, a Korean War POW who is accused of treason. Although Cargill admits his guilt and Edwards\' superiors are impatiently pushing Edwards to move the case to court martial, Edwards becomes 