d with revenge on her mind.','/y661j8lD78zuV2sDGF5uc6nU7KF.jpg','1958-05-18',66,'Released','A titanic beauty spreads a macabre wave of horror! A terrifying masterpiece of shock and chills!','Attack of the 50 Foot Woman',18724,2.9987,4.794,'RYRWvMaFJjE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3603,_binary '\0','/tTqPtvTvZMqemXibLK3NiKv2gaG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051381',5.2,3142,'en','Attack of the Puppet People','A deranged scientist creates a ray that can shrink people down to doll size.','/tN8lARzROe06PIOFhEyB6nyT1D3.jpg','1958-04-01',79,'Released','Terror Comes In Small Packages!','Attack of the Puppet People',44585,1.9725,5.1,'zderyk3azuY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3604,_binary '\0','/kCFkOwAQFMZ7YhldEpvNZzWLCCv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051383',7.9,14041,'en','Auntie Mame','Mame Dennis, a progressive and independent woman of the 1920s, is left to care for her nephew Patrick after his wealthy father dies. Conflict ensues when the executor of the father\'s estate objects to the aunt\'s lifestyle and tries to force her to send Patrick to prep school.','/uH810rwkYEbUaV6IlwTaAExbXUm.jpg','1958-12-04',143,'Released','Tops the Best-Seller! Tops the Play! The One and Only!','Auntie Mame',16347,2.9139,7,'1MOyMORDN9E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3605,_binary '\0','/bYyHPVFXNFAApU6erUCVwARH7rA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051390',7.5,6353,'ar','باب الحديد','Qinawi, a physically challenged peddler who makes his living selling newspapers in the central Cairo train station, is obsessed with Hanuma, an attractive young woman who sells drinks. While she jokes with him about a possible relationship, she is actually in love with Abu Siri, a strong and respected porter at the station who is struggling to unionize his fellow workers to combat their boss\' exploitative and abusive treatment.','/zm8ET6PSfPT6pozgvjR7htaZFjy.jpg','1958-07-31',77,'Released',NULL,'Cairo Station',47324,2.1433,7.369,'bOJpiUZphTE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3606,_binary '\0','/iXjZI9lxVwZ3D0Wpi49WniyI9GC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051393',6.4,1854,'en','The Badlanders','Two men are released from the Arizona Territorial Prison at Yuma in 1898. One, The Dutchman, is out to get both gold and revenge from certain people in a small mining town who had him imprisoned unjustly. The other, McBain, is just trying to go straight, but that is easier said than done once The Dutchman involves him in his gold theft scheme. Based on the 1949 novel The Asphalt Jungle by W. R. Burnett, the story is given an 1898 setting. It is the second film adaptation of the novel following 1950\'s noir classic The Asphalt Jungle.','/tHn8MOXIPq0WzI1zURb8nOQiGUA.jpg','1958-09-03',85,'Released','A treasure to steal...a woman to win...a past to forget...','The Badlanders',94533,2.3378,6.2,'yULWLiFnBzU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3607,_binary '\0','/yJRArzxnqxx0AOlpXVGXvAvJjo8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051398',5.8,2439,'en','The Barbarian and the Geisha','Townsend Harris is sent by President Pierce to Japan to serve as the first U.S. Consul-General to that country. Harris discovers enormous hostility to foreigners, as well as the love of a young geisha.','/reavQ6J7uZNaj4e6bgCIVvv3yBV.jpg','1958-09-30',105,'Released','The geisha girl they sent to love and to destroy the barbarian from the west!','The Barbarian and the Geisha',65590,2.3349,6.1,'u2nh4NoV7o8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3608,_binary '\0','/xxVO3rDZQAQOS2O26eh3unf0vH7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051404',7.1,4198,'fr','Le Beau Serge','After long absence, a man returns to his hometown only to find his best friend has become an alcoholic.','/dSpzj1q7AIl7SN7Ikd3oHfeD986.jpg','1959-01-10',98,'Released',NULL,'Le Beau Serge',5562,1.6289,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3609,_binary '\0','/y5e5MTZtbMesmJ7EYgBdlceMcWq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051406',6.8,15004,'en','Bell, Book and Candle','Gillian Holroyd, a modern-day witch, becomes smitten with her handsome upstairs neighbor, Shep Henderson. Using her magical powers, she casts a love spell on him, only to face unexpected complications when genuine feelings emerge, threatening her supernatural abilities.','/z3MLtVFPT2wIkKCBSE2yBgDmeXI.jpg','1958-12-25',106,'Released','Getting here is half the fun...','Bell, Book and Candle',2006,4.2705,6.6,'VqtxPF9CVe8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3610,_binary '\0','/mqMCvFJ3fRc7RXa0w6A0VRZ1b7F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051411',7.9,24754,'en','The Big Country','Retired wealthy sea captain Jim McKay arrives in the Old West, where he becomes embroiled in a feud between his future father-in-law, Major Terrill, and the rough and lawless Hannasseys over a valuable patch of land.','/aTjIUBmo7qbiu5FuvSoBA0UONWk.jpg','1958-08-13',167,'Released','Big they fought! Big they loved! Big their story!','The Big Country',12501,5.9922,7.583,'17zDhnPwVik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3611,_binary '\0','/v0GoLfsXXi5MRn4PzGdCSfQlCMx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051413',6,1927,'ja','美女と液体人間','When a narcotics deal goes sour and a suspect disappears, leaving only his clothes, Tokyo police question his wife and stake out the nightclub where she works.','/q0TBsVeBcXI1GrW0zfD2wCN5Zum.jpg','1958-06-24',87,'Released','People are dissolving! The horror of a flowing radioactive liquid!','The H-Man',43113,2.2594,5.8,'0w3IYoCDUGs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3612,_binary '\0','/32l2szM3oY7kdI3TMBral5dsc2E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051418',6.3,32765,'en','The Blob','A drive-in favorite, this sci-fi classic follows teenagers Steve and his best girl, Jane, as they try to protect their hometown from a gelatinous alien life form that engulfs everything it touches. The first to discover the substance and live to tell about it, Steve and Jane witness the blob destroying an elderly man, then it growing to a terrifying size. But no one else has seen the goo, and policeman Dave refuses to believe the kids without proof.','/ctOwn1Ibg3SjDG4WulvFvSH0PRT.jpg','1958-09-10',82,'Released','It crawls. It creeps. It eats you alive!','The Blob',8851,4.1769,6.2,'1dBGk6xFBT8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3613,_binary '\0','/rSOtnBvJovKGNpIvvZKa9cqpCuj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051422',5.5,1752,'en','Blood of the Vampire','A man and wife are terrorized by Mad Scientist Dr. Callistratus who was executed but has returned to life with a heart transplant. Along with his crippled assistant Carl, the \'anemic\' Mad Scientist, believed to be a vampire, conducts blood deficiency research on the inmates of a prison hospital for the criminally insane to sustain his return to life.','/ndLN20yprorlAyT6tLSOWXpEdlK.jpg','1958-08-25',87,'Released','Nothing Like It This Side of Hell!','Blood of the Vampire',52639,2.3915,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3614,_binary '\0','/aE0Q5rp2AlpPcEdEfdjNsjJbY4v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051423',6.3,1584,'en','Blue Murder at St. Trinian\'s','With their headmistress under lock and key in her majesty\'s prison, the St Trinian\'s girls find themselves under the protection of the army. However, when the sixth form take a fancy to winning a trip to Italy through means fair or foul, the army discover this is one battle they can\'t win. Let loose in Europe, it is not long before St Trinian\'s have succeeded in endangering European relations.','/eeINGxCFRck14wYmYLFF4pc6vsB.jpg','1957-12-10',86,'Released','They\'re back... and up to no good!!!','Blue Murder at St. Trinian\'s',16904,1.6189,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3615,_binary '\0','/ks9uOTNHUy9Kw51ucWulsvqEef5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051429',6.8,6478,'en','Bonjour Tristesse','A spoiled teenager spends the summer at the French Riviera with her rich, widower, playboy father, but when his old flame resurfaces, she resolves to keep her frivolous lifestyle at all costs.','/Pm9H9Rzubd9doNTsVMOfv588n1.jpg','1958-01-15',94,'Released',NULL,'Bonjour Tristesse',1937,2.522,6.72,'ipz6kpEMYeE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3616,_binary '\0','/8c1HBuEqbfOoBmnejt2rCINAQwz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051432',4.4,2040,'en','The Brain Eaters','A huge, alien structure resembling an inverted cone, appears in the woods outside a small rural town. Sent from Washington to investigate the origin of the mysterious object, a team of investigators discovers that intelligent parasites from inside the \"cone\" can attach themselves to humans\' nervous systems and control their minds, taking control of the authorities and workers, making communication with the outside world impossible, and leaving the responsibility of stopping the invasion up to seven people who have thus far been able to avoid possession by these creatures from parts unknown.','/24Av3I9WEn8EHMDffgyXStVmGzS.jpg','1958-09-01',61,'Released','Crawling, Slimy Things, Terror-Bent on Destroying the World!','The Brain Eaters',52204,1.6812,4.9,'pfb7cSMWKR4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3617,_binary '\0','/z0koPX2luaQgvB8X2p7cYPPzn3x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051433',7,7264,'en','The Bravados','Jim Douglass arrives in the small town of Rio Arriba in order to witness the hanging of the four men he believes murdered his wife. When the convicts escape, Jim tracks them into Mexico, determined to see that justice is done. But the farther Jim goes in his quest for vengeance, the more merciless he becomes, losing himself in an unrelenting spiral of hatred and violence.','/qKWu7yUqG4QAY9FuIiBDLGjQWRm.jpg','1958-06-25',98,'Released','A Powerful Western Tale of Revenge and Redemption','The Bravados',61564,5.019,6.631,'1DCczNjXSkQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3618,_binary '\0','/8wvwfM2Ig5cH8gYZlfMgMULwShR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051435',6.7,3360,'en','The Brothers Karamazov','Ryevsk, Russia, 1870. Tensions abound in the Karamazov family. Fyodor is a wealthy libertine who holds his purse strings tightly. His four grown sons include Dmitri, the eldest, an elegant officer, always broke and at odds with his father, betrothed to Katya, herself lovely and rich. The other brothers include a sterile aesthete, a factotum who is a bastard, and a monk. Family tensions erupt when Dmitri falls in love with one of his father\'s mistresses, the coquette Grushenka. Two brothers see Dmitri\'s jealousy of their father as an opportunity to inherit sooner. Acts of violence lead to the story\'s conclusion: trials of honor, conscience, forgiveness, and redemption.','/ebehR57SnzCmA9ce8hZXVQgl0lU.jpg','1958-02-20',145,'Released','The greatness and glory, the loves and sins of the famed novel.','The Brothers Karamazov',43138,3.1394,6.5,'-cv983slQig','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3619,_binary '\0','/u7W5LzVcko3C65aJIvN1pMqhofm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051436',6.4,3056,'en','The Buccaneer','During the War of 1812 against Britain: General Andrew Jackson has only 1,200 men left to defend New Orleans when he learns that a British fleet will arrive with 60 ships and 16,000 men to take the city. In this situation an island near the city becomes strategically important to both parties, but it\'s inhabited by the last big buccaneer: Jean Lafitte. Although Lafitte never attacks American ships, the governor hates him for selling merchandise without taxes - and is loved by the citizens for the same reason. When the big fight gets nearer, Lafitte is drawn between the fronts. His heart belongs to America, but his people urge him to join the party that\'s more likely to win.','/hUUg1IuxuKl54eyQfyu5tCZhI1g.jpg','1958-12-11',119,'Released','Piercing Drama of La Fitte - Man or Devil ?','The Buccaneer',4933,3.1667,6.5,'UICEeSlm2is','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3620,_binary '\0','/yqPmW9v8BQAz6w5xMEtWBnGmQb2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051437',6.8,3718,'en','Buchanan Rides Alone','Passing through a border town, a man is caught up in a Mexican\'s murder of a member of the town\'s most powerful family.','/nj11O1s6e6X2I9iCxwgDSPHO303.jpg','1958-08-01',80,'Released','DOUBLE HANGING -- DOUBLE THRILLS!','Buchanan Rides Alone',43114,2.4212,6.6,'rHFFO3qe4Ic','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3621,_binary '\0','/7I8OIi1AnUQ9HRCfR1jS3VRF6SX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051452',6.2,3615,'en','Carry On Nurse','In Haven Hospital, a certain men\'s ward is causing more havoc than the whole hospital altogether. The formidable Matron\'s debut gives everyone a chill every time she walks past, with only Reckitt standing up to her. There\'s a colonel who\'s a constant nuisance, a bumbling nurse, a romance between Ted York and Nurse Denton, and Bell wants his bunion removed straight away, so after a couple of pints, the men decide to remove the bunion themselves!','/5Na65YOj6s9HQM7e1YOhz0Upl13.jpg','1959-01-30',86,'Released','It\'ll fracture your funnybone !','Carry On Nurse',32107,3.3734,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3622,_binary '\0','/jnIBbQimxl0hRnEtxhHXnITROZh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051453',6.3,3368,'en','Carry On Sergeant','Sergeant Grimshawe wants to retire in the flush of success by winning the Star Squad prize with his very last platoon of newly called-up National Servicemen. But a motley bunch they turn out to be, and it\'s up to Grimshawe to put the no-hopers through their paces.','/5nb596JUBIugTkBFugD9Ek6TKJl.jpg','1958-08-31',84,'Released','It’s all about a Dad . . . a Draftee . . . and a Detonation heard round the camp!','Carry On Sergeant',32110,2.0439,6.4,'SASgU5Crdmk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3623,_binary '\0','/6C8JT07pChGqHnwDDKN2LUvHkgV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051454',7.2,2105,'en','Carve Her Name with Pride','London, England, during World War II. After living a tragic life experience, young Violette Szabo joins the Special Operations Executive and crosses the German enemy lines as a secret agent to aid a French Resistance group.','/geQFs3H8Gw1TjCPqfhTNB3SyrSs.jpg','1958-02-18',119,'Released',NULL,'Carve Her Name with Pride',44559,2.1182,6,'FfsFzf_gMss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3624,_binary '\0','/nXAP7rUMno8DjBFqkM5IZlnpybm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051459',7.9,57576,'en','Cat on a Hot Tin Roof','An alcoholic ex-football player drinks his days away, having failed to come to terms with his sexuality and his real feelings for his football buddy who died after an ambiguous accident. His wife is crucified by her desperation to make him desire her: but he resists the affections of his wife. His reunion with his father—who is dying of cancer—jogs a host of memories and revelations for both father and son.','/5djZZECgqDGuSI1INmrdAcGRBb0.jpg','1958-08-29',108,'Released','Just one pillow on her bed... and just one desire in her heart.','Cat on a Hot Tin Roof',261,4.8998,7.6,'SGvJZLJi9sU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3625,_binary '\0','/5mFXaQUsTdvPIJiHglFriHDQ9Dt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051477',6.3,1456,'fr','Christine','Vienna, 1906. A passionate love story develops between Franz Lobheiner and the young Christine. Lobheiner is, however, currently seeing the married Baroness von Eggersdorf. Upon learning of his wife\'s infidelity, the Baron von Eggersdorf provokes a duel with Lobheiner. But the former is no longer a real threat to the Baron. Lobheiner is now passionately in love with Christine. How will this love quartet end?','/mGCJpRSp3XKKZqqsm8TXCNjZfDX.jpg','1958-12-19',100,'Released',NULL,'Christine',4956,2.7687,6.3,'UHgPki9Ejxk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3626,_binary '\0','/ogK780gR7Jaqipyyo2MzdatMgtK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051484',5.9,1453,'en','The Colossus of New York','A brilliant surgeon encases his dead son\'s brain in a large robot body, with unintended results...','/9kSws2eCyBOFgu0JCYZpmFEgZ9u.jpg','1958-06-18',70,'Released','Towering above the skyline ~ an indestructible creature whose eyes rain death and destruction!','The Colossus of New York',56767,2.3949,5.6,'gTY2ArgHcg4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3627,_binary '\0','/5zqCfQQVb6fdlCHZ4oIu8JFF5bR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051496',6.7,3918,'en','Cowboy','Chicago hotel clerk Frank Harris dreams of life as a cowboy, and he gets his chance when, jilted by the father of the woman he loves, he joins Tom Reece and his cattle-driving outfit. Soon, though, the tenderfoot finds out life on the range is neither what he expected nor what he\'s been looking for...','/ArI7lT0mo7EJ4FGjAs2zQScRKqb.jpg','1958-01-23',92,'Released','THE REAL, TRUE STORY OF THE WEST!','Cowboy',39435,2.7994,6.5,'NnC2T31f_Mk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3628,_binary '\0','/p7jCkkBppRTHClNrvNcVVqBDYFG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051501',6.7,1885,'en','Cry Terror!','A mad bomber holds an innocent family hostage.','/mYyMJaaNF35DIlt86aJc2kYqq16.jpg','1958-05-02',96,'Released','An experience in suspense!','Cry Terror!',4926,1.508,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3629,_binary '\0','/jfGgCSFMUlf8DklzUkpz1GfieHA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051516',7,3873,'en','Damn Yankees','Film adaptation of the George Abbott Broadway musical about a Washington Senators fan who makes a pact with the Devil to help his baseball team win the league pennant.','/iSw0Fb4pdXDqm9Bl8iqsSwfn5u7.jpg','1958-09-26',111,'Released','It\'s a picture in a million! Starring that girl in a million, the red-headed darling of the Broadway show, Gwen Verdon!','Damn Yankees',41253,1.9116,6.477,'eQVoU9lPjoU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3630,_binary '\0','/8xXzROwyXY5wqekf9YLrMbM8PuZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051519',6.3,1827,'en','Darby\'s Rangers','Stationed in Scotland, Maj. William Darby and the men under his command are trained by British commandos, becoming the U.S. Army\'s 1st Ranger Battalion. Their drilling period is rigorous, but the men find time to romance local women before being deployed to fight the Nazis. U.S. forces battle from French North Africa to Italy, but when a surprise attack decimates the 1st and 3rd Battalions at the Battle of Cisterna, Darby and the 4th Battalion must come to their aid.','/eUTRFjBP6BbQlya3FBTHRdnkSQ2.jpg','1958-02-12',121,'Released','The Picture That Gets Closer To A Fighting Man Than Any Picture Before!','Darby\'s Rangers',46615,1.6029,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3631,_binary '\0','/jhIdEe9oCZjxLt2Cq1KR8IbnJvj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051525',7.5,20384,'en','The Defiant Ones','Two convicts—one white, one black—escape while chained to each other.','/tGGNyImEXgedDjrCORbC9cTJp0X.jpg','1958-08-14',96,'Released','One of the great ones!','The Defiant Ones',11414,4.2561,7.1,'wRWvcpX4xag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3632,_binary '\0','/72hg3ZUvpI36sckQlvmzCQwf1wa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051532',6.7,1411,'en','Sea of Sand','A small British army team is sent deep behind enemy lines to destroy a German petrol dump as part of the preparation for a major attack in the North African campaign. Sea of Sand was distributed in the US in a shortened version, Desert Patrol.','/hfj1n36louQxSAN1ICsKlEzL2fv.jpg','1958-11-04',97,'Released',NULL,'Sea of Sand',30104,1.8813,6.536,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3633,_binary '\0','/7Q2xeIZ2sr6h6K69ntsYW8UMyvn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051534',6.5,1588,'en','Desire Under the Elms','Ephraim Cabot is an old man of amazing vitality who loves his New England farm with a greedy passion. Hating him, and sharing his greed, are the sons of two wives Cabot has overworked into early graves. Most bitter is Eben, whose mother had owned most of the farm, and who feels who should be sole heir. When the old man brings home a new wife, Anna, she becomes a fierce contender to inherit the farm. Two of the sons leave when Eben gives them the fare in return for their shares of the farm. Meanwhile, Anna tries to cause some sparks by rubbing up against Eben.','/lvRCRiVQtDv5OtlnhB1L8sw08jj.jpg','1958-03-12',111,'Released',NULL,'Desire Under the Elms',77960,2.5075,6.8,'KG1T26Ifxzg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3634,_binary '\0','/3R7ergXDZ80TmiNaWJBaNxnHhB9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051542',6.4,2573,'en','Corridors of Blood','In 1840s London, Dr. Thomas Bolton [Boris Karloff] dares to dream the unthinkable: experimenting with anesthesia gases to make surgery pain-free. While doing so, his demonstration before a panel of his peers ends in a horrific mishap with his patient awakening under the knife; he is forced to leave his position in disgrace. To complicate matters, he becomes addicted to his own chemical experiments and gets involved with a criminal gang led by Black Ben [Francis de Wolff], and a ruthless killer Resurrection Joe [Christopher Lee]. Unfortunately, this shady partnership leads Dr. Bolton to further ruin, culminating in his unwitting participation in murder — for which he becomes the first victim of a blackmail scheme.','/kB6oIgGZOKblxwRS7105xdqvVtE.jpg','1958-12-01',86,'Released','Tops in Terror!','Corridors of Blood',30637,1.8064,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3635,_binary '\0','/ijbBzlKSKwWNRpebLUGfmXhBrvg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051554',7.2,30252,'en','Dracula','After Jonathan Harker attacks Dracula at his castle, the vampire travels to a nearby city, where he preys on the family of Harker\'s fiancée. The only one who may be able to protect them is Dr. van Helsing, Harker\'s friend and fellow-student of vampires, who is determined to destroy Dracula, whatever the cost.','/9UHOATvzXQWbElSGygOY1ar3vpp.jpg','1958-04-21',82,'Released','Who will his bride be tonight?','Dracula',11868,4.7303,7.3,'1TaWGqgxmSU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3636,_binary '\0','/28h4irC8CPqnS7oKQ18RHDgCuPI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051565',7.1,3984,'en','Dunkirk','A British Corporal in France finds himself responsible for the lives of his men when their officer is killed. He has to get them back to Britain somehow. Meanwhile, British civilians are being dragged into the war with Operation Dynamo, the scheme to get the French and British forces back from the Dunkirk beaches. Some come forward to help, others were less willing.','/357BscJA1gDEOzRuTeHnHmVBi7u.jpg','1958-03-20',134,'Released',NULL,'Dunkirk',17720,2.4508,6.9,'ug_wi4ppnnc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3637,_binary '\0','/sZ0scra2AzmZQ0984tUjU95Aqly.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051569',6.8,2980,'no','De dødes tjern','A group of friends travel to a cabin in the Norwegian forest. It\'s a rumour that at night a crazy man can be heard screaming at a lake nearby the cabin.','/79ot6SgnQA3NxDthxsV7qUaLDSP.jpg','1958-12-17',77,'Released',NULL,'Lake of the Dead',36792,1.018,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3638,_binary '\0','/4ZEW1hpw4EIJymClhtZO3ToMj4I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051570',4.7,4122,'en','Earth vs. the Spider','Teenagers from a small town and their high school science teacher join forces to battle a giant mutant spider, living in a cave nearby and getting hungry.','/4uns8WSxu9LSFv0FkJP8uv6Q5kQ.jpg','1958-09-01',73,'Released','The Spider will eat you alive!','Earth vs. the Spider',43115,2.3005,4.792,'TjAUl02dhhE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3639,_binary '\0','/nebwmOifFLuYsSCPpz0KQ1b8yk9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051579',6.6,1903,'fr','En cas de malheur','Leading lawyer Andre Gobillot takes the case of Yvette, a young criminal. As he works on her defence, an unexpected romance blooms between them, only to be cut short by a tragedy.','/7msRp4CTwzWUhSpt0Gd5StFokMQ.jpg','1958-09-17',105,'Released',NULL,'Love Is My Profession',66966,2.4686,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3640,_binary '\0','/yKdCE2hHeMXQFlXJguYkzTPsP1Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051588',7.7,6263,'de','Es geschah am hellichten Tag','The search for a child murderer drags a once-respected detective into an all-consuming obsession.','/8M3CPJvCe96WnIqKT8HHrSLprgT.jpg','1958-06-09',100,'Released',NULL,'It Happened in Broad Daylight',852,2.2057,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3641,_binary '\0','/wpz62HFxCGaMX6jImELAspwqjT1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051622',7.1,28294,'en','The Fly','Industrialist François Delambre is called late at night by his sister-in-law, Helene, who tells him that she has just killed her husband. Reluctant at first, she eventually explains to the police that he invented a matter transportation apparatus and, while experimenting on himself, a fly entered the chamber.','/kXdBcDh2EbgSIf4Oo1dxKapZM2f.jpg','1958-07-16',94,'Released','If she looked upon the horror her husband had become...She would scream for the rest of her life!','The Fly',11815,5.1126,7,'Uj7f75PGx7c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3642,_binary '\0','/cHAvg25pJzFnrbDojUucRM2i8P2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051629',6.2,1227,'en','Fort Massacre','New Mexico Territory, August 1879. The few surviving members of a cavalry column, which has been relentlessly decimated by the Apaches, attempt to reach Fort Crain. On their way through a hostile land, the obsessive and ruthless Sergeant Vinson takes to the limit the battered will of the troopers under his command.','/1VIwLf3yuOqfBo648L2k336AVgO.jpg','1958-05-14',80,'Released','The West has never known a “Hero” like the Killer who commanded','Fort Massacre',95060,1.7314,6.2,'6KN33Tp2zgc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3643,_binary '\0','/4mfRUXiurkEzVSVxjYhpgA5Wg7J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051630',4.9,1802,'en','Frankenstein 1970','The baron\'s grandson rents the family castle to a TV crew to fund his atomic revival of the family monster.','/pblxHVBjN7JJ5lz3Rdl3cjCvChp.jpg','1958-07-20',83,'Released','The One...The Only KING OF MONSTERS!','Frankenstein 1970',3164,1.821,5.4,'wQfLei8RliE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3644,_binary '\0','/oqQ8LeUEjkvBTctRI6TZSjgUqTT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051631',4.3,1480,'en','Frankenstein\'s Daughter','Dr. Frankenstein\'s insane grandson attempts to create horrible monsters in modern day L.A.','/n8n3VS6qiLbiQvh435wceDB53NJ.jpg','1958-12-15',85,'Released','It reaches from the grave to re-live the horror, the terror! More destructive! More terrifying!','Frankenstein\'s Daughter',45674,1.4093,4.6,'E9tRKC9_I5s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3645,_binary '\0','/5DyKnEPWm6giyKcETEdh8ufl5YS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051636',6.9,1328,'en','From Hell to Texas','The naive cowboy Tod Lohman accidentally kills the son of the powerful land baron Hunter Boyd. Tod runs for his life, pursued by the dead man\'s vengeful brothers. Tod shelters on the ranch of Amos Bradley and he falls in love with his daughter Juanita. However, Tod is concerned that he\'ll eventually have to leave when his pursuers catch up with him.','/a45c3PNBguRqtU8PMXoqfZrx5ED.jpg','1958-04-29',100,'Released','in the tradition of \"StageCoach\" \"High Noon\" and \"Shane\"','From Hell to Texas',57664,2.0957,6,'jMC3gaMYBsE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3646,_binary '\0','/rjP34LwvLToxRykRG5WFRCRmSsV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051638',5.1,2017,'en','From the Earth to the Moon','Set just after the American civil war, businessman and inventor Victor Barbicane invents a new source of power called Power X. He plans to use it to power rockets, and to show its potential he plans to send a projectile to the moon. Joining him for the trip are his assistant Ben Sharpe, Barbicane\'s arch-rival Stuyvesant Nicholl, and Nicholl\'s daughter Virginia. Nicholl believes that Power X goes against the will of God and sabotages the projectile so that they cannot return to earth, setting up a suspenseful finale as they battle to repair the projectile.','/cALvMcrweHHswVNfSr1KkQdF2eC.jpg','1958-11-26',101,'Released','The Amazing Story of the Boldest Adventure Dared by Man!','From the Earth to the Moon',44969,2.0163,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3647,_binary '\0','/7NocFglkshS33aagP5NBfkM56BI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051649',6.4,2348,'en','The Geisha Boy','Gilbert Wooley is a second-rate magician who is sent to entertain the troops in the pacific. During his time in Japan he becomes attached to a little orphan boy.','/tDosiUr0iacsqLNnhWtQdU5a5ad.jpg','1958-11-02',98,'Released','MORE THAN GREAT COMEDY HERE\'S GREAT ENTERTAINMENT','The Geisha Boy',37610,2.4759,6.4,'a_JwoY4yfR4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3648,_binary '\0','/7IiUXE7F8tUxz7ZxJRbJe1mY9C0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051654',4.5,1283,'en','Giant from the Unknown','A series of grisly murders plague a small mountain community and the sheriff suspects a local scientist whom he dislikes. Together with a former professor and the professor\'s pretty daughter, the scientist sets about solving the crimes and discovers the killer is an oversized 16th century conquistador, resurrected by a lightning bolt from his mountain grave.','/5Er7lEm2ukXBnkT7dq6hVP8fMJy.jpg','1958-01-03',78,'Released','A Hideous Monster from Beyond the Grave!','Giant from the Unknown',52202,1.5769,4.4,'I7O8gcoWVSM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3649,_binary '\0','/tOjH9b9SpG7dzpOo4n1YAGtHhem.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051655',6.6,1917,'en','Gideon\'s Day','Scotland Yard Inspector George Gideon starts his day off on the wrong foot when he gets a traffic-violation ticket from a young police officer. From there, his \'typical day\" consists in learning that one of his most-trusted detectives has accepted bribes; hunts an escaped maniac who has murdered a girl; tracks a young girl suspected of involvement in a payroll robbery and then helps break up a bank robbery.','/yaDNqztIrTbeIDDkD1DvPqbq4M5.jpg','1958-03-25',91,'Released','24 Tension-Taut Hours in the Life of a Top Crime Fighter!','Gideon\'s Day',44071,2.2172,6.4,'lv1i69cB1NI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3650,_binary '\0','/6aIpiwQB2qvVHSlhsXYZD3lmmSV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051658',6.6,25161,'en','Gigi','A home, a motorcar, servants, the latest fashions: the most eligible and most finicky bachelor in Paris offers them all to Gigi. But she, who\'s gone from girlish gawkishness to cultured glamour before our eyes, yearns for that wonderful something money can\'t buy.','/3GSuecnDr4N5ZaqTrwElSzt6eC2.jpg','1958-05-15',115,'Released','Thank heaven for Gigi','Gigi',17281,3.8385,6.2,'9UV5PzHMOtE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3651,_binary '\0','/h2SAaPqCf8hL9qhee1O9Y8dVBCR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051666',6.5,2337,'en','God\'s Little Acre','In the 1950s, a poor Georgia cotton farmer and his sons search for the gold presumably buried on the farm by their grandfather but problems related to poverty, marital infidelity, unemployment and booze threaten to destroy their family.','/3X0IKivOxtWFfwFKmp3SS5MAVzo.jpg','1958-09-23',118,'Released','Love! Hate! Pride! Passion! Rampant, Riotous In the Heat of a Southern Sun!','God\'s Little Acre',37079,2.156,6.2,'xDUPNTbQweA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3652,_binary '\0','/rInhFfxBbNRWR6DhL8Na7Fjx0st.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051667',6.5,1362,'en','The Goddess','A woman adored by the people around her ultimately struggles to be happy with herself.','/p1kzzWhYGBUgjiY18NxSaGsSxRw.jpg','1958-06-24',104,'Released','Profound and astounding','The Goddess',3081,1.6274,6,'iKl8ZwjF_b8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3653,_binary '\0','/7gZXOEAmqYmjwW8jf0rcJsDkyc0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051688',6.2,1265,'en','The Gunfight at Dodge City','Fleeing to Dodge City after killing a man in self defence Masterson finds his brother Ed (Harry Lauter) running for sheriff of the town. When Ed is killed by hired guns of the corrupt incumbent Bat is determined to settle the score with violence but he is convinced by the townspeople that the best way to avenge his brother\'s death is by taking Ed\'s place on the ballot. Bat agrees and wins the election but his new role on the right side of the law will lead him to unexpected confrontations as he finds himself torn between his loyalties to his friends and his duties as sheriff.','/iFSnCctWdxHdS6jMjm4Snnzo1nx.jpg','1959-05-01',81,'Released','The whole wild west watched.. And held its breath.','The Gunfight at Dodge City',79331,2.3013,5.7,'DSfxSHI5KYA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3654,_binary '\0','/dySl6NrUu5A84YQ1xLWddowudE8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051690',7.1,2431,'en','Gunman\'s Walk','A powerful rancher always protects his wild adult son by paying for damages and bribing witnesses, until his crimes become too serious to rectify.','/mUGEWgmAeup5lh2tJ2f55nUYVSh.jpg','1958-07-15',95,'Released','BLISTERING RAW DRAMA!','Gunman\'s Walk',42871,3.3196,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3655,_binary '\0','/3LAxBL5g2An5W33eyqaRPN6OxJH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051693',8.3,1892,'hr','H-8...','A bus traveling from Belgrade to Zagreb is involved in a tragic accident when a reckless driver causes a catastrophic collision on a rainy night, leading to the tragic deaths of several passengers.','/vaEtJrXSQnRxML3GybVjEzwJ9P9.jpg','1958-07-15',105,'Released',NULL,'H-8...',163774,0.8546,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3656,_binary '\0','/lMCifuTi0mWFHfyUoJSeQ5R3JjX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051706',6.2,2435,'en','Grip of the Strangler','A researcher investigating a notorious serial killer who was hanged 20 years earlier seemingly becomes possessed by the long dead strangler.','/5RdrW6vghcqyyEQ8pqeAHSxfy2k.jpg','1958-05-11',78,'Released','KING OF THE MONSTERS! KARLOFF IN HIS NEW HORROR HIT!','Grip of the Strangler',86667,1.5324,6,'z_KOVRUVnQM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3657,_binary '\0','/8A29SLeO5Ch8R08mJzg9lOsEQcg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051713',7.2,4722,'en','Hell Drivers','An ex-con trying to go clean ends up working for a crooked trucking company owner who encourages competion amongst his drivers.','/5zsGqmJVY0b4Ycdxz753zalUd5M.jpg','1957-07-23',108,'Released','Roaring Down the World\'s Deadliest Roads!','Hell Drivers',44940,3.5521,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3658,_binary '\0','/8BWB0XMdNxryybRdAmNXYG0jLR8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051720',7.8,5504,'ja','彼岸花','Wataru\'s outwardly liberal views on marriage are severely tested when his daughter declares her love for a coworker and is adamant to live her own way, instead of agreeing to an arranged marriage. Outwitted by his female relatives, Hirayama stubbornly refuses to admit defeat.','/osh4NByiG8wOAiQT2qiPGnNWQE1.jpg','1958-09-07',118,'Released',NULL,'Equinox Flower',28272,2.4184,7.426,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3659,_binary '\0','/aGYiuTcaG73iJBX31ihEWJLCNok.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051724',6.1,1270,'en','High School Confidential!','A tough kid comes to a new high school and begins muscling his way into the drug scene. This is a typical morality play of the era, filled with a naive view of drugs, nihilistic beat poetry, and some incredible \'50s slang.','/ihyyUeCVCKc9CRjvQ2WAhC7v5Eu.jpg','1958-05-30',85,'Released','Behind these \"nice\" school walls... A TEACHERS\' NIGHTMARE!...A TEEN-AGE JUNGLE!','High School Confidential!',43116,1.4211,5.6,'O06ezgHflCA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3660,_binary '\0','/168RqBMFfAAY1QS3Smn4ovQ4uE9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051732',7.1,1368,'en','Home Before Dark','A young woman returns home after being institutionalized in a mental hospital.','/ArL6JE6E2YltKRWKmBpuqb6Rt3b.jpg','1958-11-16',136,'Released','A pretty girl and the stunning shock that marriage brings her!','Home Before Dark',121250,1.7075,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3661,_binary '\0','/mzMVXXaxQ7BC7Mc5MdQMrX9T8GA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051739',6.9,4191,'en','The Horse\'s Mouth','Gulley Jimson is a boorish aging artist recently released from prison. A swindler in search of his next art project, he hunkers down in the penthouse of would-be patrons the Beeders while they go on an extended vacation; he paints a mural on their wall, pawns their valuables and, along with the sculptor Abel, inadvertently smashes a large hole in their floor. Jimson\'s next project is an even larger wall in an abandoned church.','/d51I6HuDzwEk5CWZE4E4Uegz3WF.jpg','1958-11-11',95,'Released','Smart Alec ... Sheer madness and all Guinness! The man\'s a genius ...','The Horse\'s Mouth',43139,2.1773,6.7,'Dzt5dMoS5dA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3662,_binary '\0','/nW2fT78cnIuc9cCUtlwGgCpcjCy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051744',6.7,35224,'en','House on Haunted Hill','Frederick Loren invites five strangers to the party of a lifetime and offers each of them $10,000 if they can stay the night in the reportedly haunted house. Armed with a gun for protection, each guest arrives in a hearse and will either leave in it much richer…Or dead.','/g5kdFt3piV3w1pG65W9sSToJ7HB.jpg','1959-01-01',75,'Released','Consult your doctor! Bring your seatbelt!','House on Haunted Hill',15856,5.2464,6.7,'kasKSGAIqw0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3663,_binary '\0','/gm6olhE6677l4ZfuhV9I1ntvkng.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051745',6.6,10584,'en','Houseboat','An Italian socialite on the run signs on as housekeeper for a widower with three children.','/nfaOBiZktPHOV0f3DTqTftgTo3B.jpg','1958-11-19',110,'Released','It All Happens Happily on a Heaven of a Houseboat!','Houseboat',1377,3.2196,6.4,'BEIXXWxiexM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3664,_binary '\0','/6mlslpNNe2xgKNTaTFcI5ucBQ38.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051746',5.6,1789,'en','How to Make a Monster','When master monster make-up man Pete Dumond is fired by the new bosses of American International studios, he uses his creations to exact revenge.','/pE77WtghHXdDbLb0gCj8e28Fuxo.jpg','1958-07-01',73,'Released','See the Ghastly Ghouls in Flaming Color!','How to Make a Monster',116327,1.9489,5.7,'kAaUcwDfqAY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3665,_binary '\0','/6SVKzfocGbrCq3BRrF3kULMoKsX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051750',6.4,1892,'en','The Hunters','With its electrifying flight sequences and high-powered cast, The Hunters is a mesmerizing film based on the best-selling novel by veteran fighter pilot James Salter. Set during the height of the Korean War, the story centers on Major Cleve Saville (Robert Mitchum), a master of the newly operational F-86 Sabre fighter jets. But adept as he is at flying, Saville¹s personal life takes a nosedive when he falls in love with his wingman¹s (Lee Philips) beautiful wife (May Britt). To make matters worse, Saville must cope with a loud-mouthed rookie (Robert Wagner) in a daring rescue mission that threatens all their lives in this well-crafted war drama.','/rKywOWIo1GVj7XjoxFWegiOkoXq.jpg','1958-09-01',108,'Released','Mightiest thrill-shocked adventure spectacle of the super-sonic age !','The Hunters',45520,2.0325,5.8,'cC-PE08OV3g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3666,_binary '\0','/mAl6JWFxTX8NQ7gXAUF8HKZP9JD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051755',6.3,3529,'en','I Bury the Living','The new manager of a small-town cemetery becomes convinced that he triggered the untimely deaths of several plot owners by tampering with a certain map. When nobody believes him, he risks his sanity to play God once again and prove his point.','/z5K0Kj85Tv81j7yuYreSVDNgBMJ.jpg','1958-07-01',77,'Released','Out of a Time-Rotted Tomb Crawls an Unspeakable Horror!','I Bury the Living',34084,2.2263,6.2,'tAM7PHnP7Yw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3667,_binary '\0','/lyMHBfrO2PtVZcWDcsGCgebuFLU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051756',6.4,3569,'en','I Married a Monster from Outer Space','Aliens from Outer Space are slowly switching places with real humans -- one of the first being a young man about to get married. Slowly, his new wife realizes something is wrong, and her suspicions are confirmed when her husband\'s odd behaviour begins to show up in other townspeople.','/a38yzngqdcauRc0p9WEeZgvT2xU.jpg','1958-10-01',78,'Released','Shuddery things from beyond the stars, here to breed with human women!','I Married a Monster from Outer Space',43117,2.745,6,'kTZR5Ut9NpA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3668,_binary '\0','/bRk1G4RJ7OqAahpozmx9LnGWOl9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051758',7.5,8426,'en','I Want to Live!','Brazen perpetual offender Barbara Graham tries to go straight but she finds herself implicated in a murder and sent to death row.','/hufXkmILGy34VXEdQC69etY8Rt4.jpg','1958-11-18',120,'Released','The murder trial that shook the world!','I Want to Live!',28577,3.6789,7,'TbM8CZeAR_s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3669,_binary '\0','/teM3t0vTVXeqy1YiwH2OrHopSGc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051759',6.9,1926,'en','I Was Monty\'s Double','The incredible but true story of how an impersonator was recruited to impersonate General Montgomery to mislead the Germans about his intentions before the North Africa campaign.','/kPA3Eb05PLkMqVk95CN8gaZU2oH.jpg','1958-10-21',101,'Released','The Gigantic Hoax of World War II','I Was Monty\'s Double',77794,2.2103,6.9,'xSBETDJj5gE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3670,_binary '\0','/pNqropWft9qTTF0BM9edTO52mmH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051773',6.8,11368,'en','Indiscreet','Anna Kalman is an accomplished actress who has given up hope of finding the man of her dreams. While talking about this subject with her sister, in walks Philip Adams and she realizes that this is the charming, smart, and handsome man she has been waiting for.','/sv4ao2ceHx2Ii1I2SsAmCqr7k6K.jpg','1958-07-16',100,'Released','How dare he make love to me - And not be a married man!','Indiscreet',22874,2.2828,6.6,'USltTQ_WHRY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3671,_binary '\0','/3R8lX1mqTeBFLlFSyfnxRSYiEgk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051776',7.2,5872,'en','The Inn of the Sixth Happiness','All her life, Englishwoman Gladys Aylward knew that China was where she belonged. Unqualified to be sent as a missionary, Gladys works as a domestic to earn to send herself to a poor, remote village. There, she eventually lives a full and happy life: running the inn, acting as \'foot inspector\', advising the local Mandarin, and even winning the heart of mixed-race Captain Lin Nan. Gladys discovers her real destiny when the country is invaded by Japan and the Chinese children need her to save their lives.','/qSkuoH1e3pUO2sbwESHqq2CNPel.jpg','1958-11-23',154,'Released','BACK AGAIN - INGRID BERGMAN in her greatest role','The Inn of the Sixth Happiness',37451,2.6871,6.8,'wHUSIJx3630','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3672,_binary '\0','/f2CGKEEkQ7q9j5bZ1545VTxRaOK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051786',6,6727,'en','It! The Terror from Beyond Space','The first manned expedition to Mars is invaded by an unknown life form, which stows away on the rescue ship.','/scPw7bBH3PDAHHT48W0fevQeMO8.jpg','1958-07-31',69,'Released','The revelation shocker of things to come!','It! The Terror from Beyond Space',27179,2.6534,5.8,'vKE0BoFwR1k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3673,_binary '\0','/w634xBnBcTrtBGFB9AZtTE34q4O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051790',7.7,8874,'ru','Иван Грозный. Сказ второй: Боярский заговор','This is the second part of a projected three-part epic biopic of Russian Czar Ivan Grozny, undertaken by Soviet film-maker Sergei Eisenstein at the behest of Josef Stalin. Production of the epic was stopped before the third part could be filmed, due to producer dissatisfaction with Eisenstein\'s introducing forbidden experimental filming techniques into the material, more evident in this part than the first part. As it was, this second part was banned from showings until after the deaths of both Eisenstein and Stalin, and a change of attitude by the subsequent heads of the Soviet government. In this part, as Ivan the Terrible attempts to consolidate his power by establishing a personal army, his political rivals, the Russian boyars, plot to assassinate him.','/9VufNqHN0EIkZAsJIv5vDYIitPo.jpg','1958-10-10',82,'Released',NULL,'Ivan the Terrible, Part II: The Boyars\' Plot',43118,2.0257,7.4,'5tcPBx3O_H4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3674,_binary '\0','/mh4WEd1A3iYtu6uPgsiGboCkRFb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051792',7.8,7456,'bn','জলসাঘর','An aging, decadent landlord’s passion for music becomes the undoing of his legacy as he sacrifices his wealth in order to compete with the opulent music room of his younger, richer neighbour.','/1coINFn9GDeFr09QtkzjgTUbev5.jpg','1958-10-10',100,'Released',NULL,'The Music Room',822,2.6824,7.5,'woMURYCtTtQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3675,_binary '\0','/aYD6bR1xs9OAK3lA5WHbvIX2gMN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051808',8,46420,'ja','隠し砦の三悪人','In feudal Japan, during a bloody war between clans, two cowardly and greedy peasants, soldiers of a defeated army, stumble upon a mysterious man who guides them to a fortress hidden in the mountains.','/uQHej0cFJHwSuaENizIZpYtsuNa.jpg','1958-12-28',139,'Released','What you make of another\'s kindness is up to you.','The Hidden Fortress',1059,4.6044,7.985,'63c8g9j1uKs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3676,_binary '\0','/q87fkPucgvWSv7D5nQUa0JXCMqd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051816',6.7,1984,'en','The Key','In wartime England, circa 1941, poorly-armed tugs are sent into \"U-Boat Alley\" to rescue damaged Allied ships. An American named David Ross arrives to captain one of these tugs. He\'s given a key by a fellow tugboat-man -- a key to an apartment and its pretty female resident. Should something happen to the friend, Ross can use the key.','/30lPhoDVPyZNQ3cjjTlsYuO4x0Z.jpg','1958-05-28',134,'Released','He had the life expectancy of a match.','The Key',102081,2.226,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3677,_binary '\0','/d76fxEGPeBZN4CsjJkfeDnfJUu7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051818',7,7202,'en','King Creole','Delinquent Danny Fisher flunks out of high school, quits his job as a nightclub busboy, and one night gets the chance to perform. Success is imminent and local crime boss Maxie Fields wants to hire him to perform at The Blue Shade. Danny declines, but Fields won\'t take no for an answer.','/k5WBAgKrI8OytCSxMd4oau5KXzn.jpg','1958-07-02',116,'Released','A STORY PULSING WITH THE HEARTBEAT OF TODAY\'S YOUTH!','King Creole',18644,3.9206,6.4,'zS6wBU4cOgE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3678,_binary '\0','/A14W3654pck8GyWGew7F4CAkxQ8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051819',6.5,2073,'en','Kings Go Forth','When Harris applies for the position of a radioman in Loggins\' army unit, he is hired immediately. While on a mission together in France, they both fall in love with Monique.','/cSMo17VnTpCNBPpgaXNbZRLtIE1.jpg','1958-06-28',109,'Released','As big and brave and bold a love story as has ever been exploded on the screen!','Kings Go Forth',78229,1.9029,6.1,'vhM-ebsTmcU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3679,_binary '\0','/7Hc2v8edQcCQyxWJhdQTd9mBzxO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051834',7.2,1432,'ja','巨人と玩具','Nishi is an advertising executive for a caramel company that is planning to launch a new product, in fierce competition with two other companies.','/s0ienkeWVgV7QROZny9fRF4qFPR.jpg','1958-06-22',95,'Released',NULL,'Giants and Toys',76754,1.663,7.1,'IpBNmo6Rhp4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3680,_binary '\0','/fdEDV6cT9SbhDmJHcypOsxnO8Cu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051845',7.3,4615,'en','The Last Hurrah','In a changing world where television has become the main source of information, Adam Caulfield, a young sports journalist, witnesses how his uncle, Frank Skeffington, a veteran and honest politician, mayor of a New England town, tries to be reelected while bankers and captains of industry conspire in the shadows to place a weak and manageable candidate in the city hall.','/yM0BC9XLB67494CNcKQVB43lBuG.jpg','1958-12-31',117,'Released','… something to shout about!','The Last Hurrah',56156,2.061,7.2,'u-iEl1EzU88','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3681,_binary '\0','/4hX5UoeX7ggzLegRh5oU1gqOa4B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051848',6.8,3205,'en','The Law and Jake Wade','Jake Wade breaks Clint Hollister out of jail to pay off an old debt, though it\'s clear there is some pretty deep hostility between them. They part, and Jake returns to his small-town marshal\'s job and his fiancée only to find he has been tracked there by Hollister. It seems they were once in a gang together and Jake knows where the proceeds of a bank hold-up are hidden. Hollister and his sidekicks make off into the hills, taking along the trussed-up marshal and his kidnapped bride-to-be to force the lawman to show them where the loot is.','/pbQLht5Wu6gOeJPd04yaG9HEmT8.jpg','1958-06-06',86,'Released','The girl is a captive hostage at the mercy of the West\'s most notorious bandit-killer.','The Law and Jake Wade',44766,2.7884,6.6,'J60XM8Wxy6o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3682,_binary '\0','/9KYGiA1dBYTqtVFwt59P3WEoqZi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051849',6.4,5177,'en','The Left Handed Gun','When a crooked sheriff murders his employer, William \"Billy the Kid\" Bonney decides to avenge the death by killing the man responsible, throwing the lives of everyone around him into turmoil, and endangering the General Amnesty set up by Governor Wallace to bring peace to the New Mexico Territory.','/7VyMilfEFlOtm7RSZDjR1hM5TDm.jpg','1958-04-30',102,'Released','I don\'t run. I don\'t hide. I go where I want. I do what I want.','The Left Handed Gun',42402,3.3095,6,'ozJoQzW44Sk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3683,_binary '\0','/6EYLlBkrr97BjxQxSOTvK3CUEId.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051851',7.3,1224,'fr','La loi c\'est la loi','Assola is an imaginary village on the border between Italy and France and the borderline crosses the village itself. The French customs agent Ferdinand is always trying to catch the Italian smuggler Giuseppe. Giuseppe discovers that Ferdinand was actually born in Italy and therefore he can\'t be a French customs agent.','/iGDcPVt5TeCP5U8jrLFKuQNy2Ba.jpg','1958-09-17',86,'Released',NULL,'The Law Is the Law',56544,1.6183,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3684,_binary '\0','/nUVs60eIFezgmRjEYRAONPAsLCy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051866',7.3,5338,'en','The Lineup','In San Francisco, a psychopathic gangster and his mentor retrieve heroin packages carried by unsuspecting travelers.','/7SyTNyeZpJ4lXoPBV7p8h5ek0Uy.jpg','1958-06-11',87,'Released','The Manhunt They Had to Put On the Giant-Sized Movie Theater Screen!','The Lineup',24508,1.8912,7.1,'Mx7GApmhu8Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3685,_binary '\0','/lnXz5krhKNLFSQcKqjYv3V4tn6i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051878',7.3,13784,'en','The Long, Hot Summer','Accused barn burner and conman Ben Quick arrives in a small Mississippi town and quickly ingratiates himself with its richest family, the Varners.','/nWQddN7kfkVqSimb4SQc35gNUnP.jpg','1958-05-17',115,'Released','The people of Faulkner...the language of Faulkner...the world of Faulkner!','The Long, Hot Summer',40085,5.3093,7,'isihtYXfMTI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3686,_binary '\0','/T06LyzdvILFUrge07eVn6FB9qh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051879',7,4829,'en','Look Back in Anger','A disillusioned, angry university graduate comes to terms with his grudge against middle-class life and values.','/TCukFyvrXbIVp9KSt5Yr2HFy77.jpg','1959-09-15',98,'Released','The story that peels bare the raging emotions of today\'s angry young generation!','Look Back in Anger',50011,2.936,6.681,'WqUpftCklb0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3687,_binary '\0','/vkos6AyXzuLzQAbeRcwl7uxNE7H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051885',5.6,1743,'en','Macabre','After his wife and her blind sister have died under his care, a doctor\'s young daughter is kidnapped and reported as buried alive, leaving him with mere hours to find and rescue her.','/9APm7cJaJaaFXNNuUKSNjLaIQcr.jpg','1958-10-01',72,'Released','As Blood-Chilling As Being Buried Alive!','Macabre',29393,1.4651,6,'Bj5w-UYxMuU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3688,_binary '\0','/pOHocII4Q04XTYHAzXrD6khimg7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051887',6.1,2335,'en','Machine-Gun Kelly','George Kelly is angry at the world and scared to death of dying. A career bank robber, Kelly gets his confidence from his Thompson SMG and his girl Flo. After a botched robbery, Flo, Kelly and his gang try their hand at a more lucrative job: kidnapping.','/s1jB8vxLGiJJjgGhbrqUuIgXTGr.jpg','1958-05-01',83,'Released','Without His Gun He Was Naked Yellow!','Machine-Gun Kelly',43119,2.3279,6,'udUdivSJm98','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3689,_binary '\0','/wfw5JGKAHxU1Aoc05wg1CPtpvM1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051899',7,10952,'en','Man of the West','Heading east to Fort Worth to hire a schoolteacher for his frontier town home, Link Jones is stranded with singer Billie Ellis and gambler Sam Beasley when their train is held up. For shelter, Jones leads them to his nearby former home, where he was brought up an outlaw. Finding the gang still living in the shack, Jones pretends to be ready to return to a life crime.','/fh9vTJ5mOkKK5nZ1LRhfvP5JrD7.jpg','1958-10-01',100,'Released','IN THE ROLE THAT FITS HIM LIKE A GUN FITS A HOLSTER! GARY COOPER as the MAN OF THE WEST','Man of the West',14674,3.4685,6.581,'7b1QuCRs7PQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3690,_binary '\0','/6xRGdXixc84pcJDkNWkXOoTo0AU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051911',6.2,1404,'en','Marjorie Morningstar','While working as a counselor at a summer camp, college-student Marjorie Morgenstern falls for 32-year-old Noel Airman, a would-be dramatist working at a nearby summer theater. Like Marjorie, he is an upper-middle-class New York Jew, but has fallen away from his roots, and Marjorie\'s parents object among other things to his lack of a suitable profession. Noel himself warns Marjorie repeatedly that she\'s much too naive and conventional for him, but they nonetheless fall in love.','/GcFa930a5FJRxLs1bTGAscMxdM.jpg','1958-04-24',123,'Released','Would this glamorous girl choose love...or a star-spangled Career?','Marjorie Morningstar',33731,2.0067,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3691,_binary '\0','/l6TDqqdZjaJ8LTxyWTE5Iby5EFc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051913',6.8,1307,'en','The Matchmaker','Thornton Wilder\'s tale of a matchmaker who desires the man she\'s supposed to be pairing with another woman.','/pbAkfbKsV25hwIjxgdfDnhDNNCh.jpg','1958-07-23',101,'Released','You\'ll Laugh...You\'ll Love...','The Matchmaker',43141,2.3409,7,'SvRFkNhtDVI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3692,_binary '\0','/d7vkLjSLpe6kTJ5aOrMIfh9I6FL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051927',8.3,1936,'el','Μια Ζωή την Έχουμε!','A bank teller discovers an accounting error, becomes rich and lives his life like he\'s never lived it.','/r8Ps8x6soCS3aX3zwTzjB1r4hHO.jpg','1958-05-08',111,'Released',NULL,'We Have Only One Life',24258,0.9476,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3693,_binary '\0','/892QHrkOrg3mGJT3YtPwJ2xA11L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051942',7.3,1216,'fr','Moi, un noir','Winner of the prestigious Prix Louis Delluc in 1958, \"Moi, un noir\" marked Jean Rouch\'s break with traditional ethnography, and his embrace of the collaborative and improvisatory strategies he called \"shared ethnography\" and \"ethnofiction\". The film depicts an ordinary week in the lives of men and women from Niger who have migrated to Abidjan, Côte d\'Ivoire for work.','/6Zz3rVvm8vjXMy9UWkbPGN3cL9v.jpg','1959-03-12',70,'Released',NULL,'I, a Negro',64299,1.1972,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3694,_binary '\0','/yeB2iHmQuScrijgYCy9ggzcpOlE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051947',5.3,1338,'en','The Monster of Piedras Blancas','An old lighthouse keeper who lives with his daughter secretly keeps a prehistoric fish-man by feeding it scraps and fish. One day he misses the feeding and all hell breaks loose.','/3hfimtEN7ddXwF9k6jZ22x5CZoj.jpg','1959-04-22',71,'Released','HE PREYS ON HUMAN FLESH!','The Monster of Piedras Blancas',90030,1.6208,5.6,'EKctdTu5LFs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3695,_binary '\0','/ePaocQD9w1O3WzF7YVYYfcKRBmn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051948',5.8,2412,'en','Monster on the Campus','A college paleontology professor acquires a newly discovered specimen of a coelacanth, but while examining it, he is accidentally exposed to its blood, and finds himself periodically turning into a murderous Neanderthal man.','/oHpJmCYZq5qnDP1MSeUAEBE44gU.jpg','1958-10-15',77,'Released','Co-ed beauty captive of man-monster! Campus terror! Students victims of terror-beast!','Monster on the Campus',34593,1.8434,6.1,'Vo31M0PIoHM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3696,_binary '\0','/cBVOPLJDqnfNnk9yyM6RmLWSJPA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051955',7.5,1394,'ja','無法松の一生','A poor rickshaw driver finds himself helping a young woman and her son after the woman\'s husband dies suddenly.','/8TGbTPMq2Dao441QUQ55lKESpZM.jpg','1958-04-21',103,'Released',NULL,'The Rickshaw Man',43121,1.8178,7.2,'tAd6-pDjn6Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3697,_binary '\0','/A4WPLal7kiWJAiloV7gH8PGhGWR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051959',7.2,5277,'en','Murder by Contract','Claude is a ruthless and efficient contract killer. His next target, a woman, is the most difficult.','/rY0liv7kkpJ4kc7ItSSDngZLVcp.jpg','1958-12-18',81,'Released','Double rates for women... because a woman is always double-trouble!','Murder by Contract',18930,1.9965,6.8,'XH7t-h8rb2c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3698,_binary '\0','/pq7vwYmOibt9XUsF4rhxHaHyjSq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051964',7,1996,'de','Mädchen in Uniform','A new student, Manuela, enters a strict girls\' boarding school after her mother’s death, where she finds comfort in a kind teacher, stirring complex emotions within her.','/snsC0lkDugHhhcP64Iyu0x47hBn.jpg','1958-07-07',95,'Released','This Startling Motion Picture Will Be the Yardstick By Which People Will Measure Each Other\'s Sophistication...','Girls in Uniform',4955,2.6625,6.156,'m7_pbo3NQco','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3699,_binary '\0','/70c8lo8L44w7SMfBQuptozKdtEM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051978',6.4,2057,'en','The Naked and the Dead','Fighting men in World War II learn the value of courage and quickness at the risk of losing their lives.','/yNU7VpfVJJprMsUFfdvbqHK08AC.jpg','1958-08-06',131,'Released','Youth and love and wartime-- the best-seller that electrified seven million readers!','The Naked and the Dead',43142,2.7907,5.7,'z2J8xuQpvQs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3700,_binary '\0','/d81tSjYWT0ITcqL5ecTkUcGwVig.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051980',7.8,4192,'ja','楢山節考','In a remote village where food is scarce, elders who reach the age of 70 are carried by their children to the top of a nearby mountain to die in solitude. Orin, a vibrant 69-year-old grandmother, has accepted her fate — but struggles to prepare the rest of her family for the ritual.','/kwvNyyXFsVAPg9PYQsogcXj99lV.jpg','1958-06-01',98,'Released','With my mother on my back, now is the time to say goodbye to this world.','The Ballad of Narayama',116690,3.7978,7.58,'PCSpol_TJ7k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3701,_binary '\0','/eunBY4OdJseL3LvMeng5zUbxDAG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051983',7.7,7063,'es','Nazarín','A Catholic priest in a poor community lives a charitable life in accordance with his religious principles, but others do not return the favor.','/7W2hnPt4glMnaxJU33wAjKyf7lc.jpg','1959-06-04',95,'Released','A Motion Picture For Ever…','Nazarín',35124,2.0223,7.622,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3702,_binary '\0','/kCdhAnRN5dkkIeHqWFgoTUx5pSk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051989',7.1,2337,'fr','Ni vu… Ni connu…','In a small French village, everything would be quiet if the local wildlife cop was not being ridiculed by a smart poacher.','/j5cIpS6rlLNnwmWwCt3jOLSuJ61.jpg','1958-04-23',95,'Released',NULL,'Neither Seen Nor Recognized',44521,2.9456,6.784,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3703,_binary '\0','/11MQfePzM4i4hFYIiIRJVBtsM5D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051993',3.6,2724,'en','Night of the Blood Beast','An astronaut returns to Earth as the no-pulse host of an alien monster\'s embryos; he is discovered by a loony farmer who find ways to feed his new critter.','/sgA7DNvk3WuLsicTikuC8v87JTo.jpg','1958-08-01',62,'Released','No girl was safe as long as this head-hunting thing roamed the land!','Night of the Blood Beast',109122,1.8061,3.842,'EKq0qcAJVr8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3704,_binary '\0','/gHWnnV2n9eS1aQKRmg6JSpj6bsC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0051994',7.9,19638,'en','A Night to Remember','The sinking of the Titanic is presented in a highly realistic fashion in this tense British drama. The disaster is portrayed largely from the perspective of the ocean liner\'s second officer, Charles Lightoller. Despite numerous warnings about ice, the ship sails on, with Capt. Edward John Smith keeping it going at a steady clip. When the doomed vessel finally hits an iceberg, the crew and passengers discover that they lack enough lifeboats, and tragedy follows.','/6fDhJAz6AuYWj3hAnvUL42Xlxfj.jpg','1958-07-03',123,'Released','Titanic... the greatest sea drama in living memory.','A Night to Remember',10971,5.6806,7.7,'dPAqttGXFaU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3705,_binary '\0','/7le6rsPOLfuXcTh1XeSqKCe0SOe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052002',7.2,3682,'en','No Name on the Bullet','When hired killer John Gant rides into Lordsburg, the town\'s folk become paranoid as each leading citizen has enemies capable of using the services of a professional killer for personal revenge.','/lqajhCQhtyzDfj7vKAfpVVw68B8.jpg','1959-02-01',77,'Released','Twenty-four \"victims\" had died before his lightning draw...until he came to the quiet town that had marked him for death!','No Name on the Bullet',51997,2.9032,6.6,'MwW2r1NCLQA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3706,_binary '\0','/4fobpKsoeNrJ8BtbYiHP4AdSVjU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052005',7.5,4968,'en','No Time for Sergeants','Georgia farm boy Will Stockdale is about to bust with pride. He’s been drafted. Will’s ready. But is Uncle Sam ready for Will?','/yCoIRzy6C5TCXN0ibD2IqEqqOgl.jpg','1958-07-05',119,'Released',NULL,'No Time for Sergeants',19968,1.9809,7.3,'K_u_PUExXb8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3707,_binary '\0','/qKBOeRDdM6yPDOiChV2dsfSJhkg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052013',6.8,1288,'en','Nowhere to Go','A professional thief is sprung from prison with the assistance of a new partner who wants to know where he\'s hid his loot.','/vvTAVmQfn68aPrzG4QJg9u1ZT2a.jpg','1958-12-02',99,'Released','...except into a woman\'s arms!','Nowhere to Go',50697,1.7318,6.6,'Gbl8wJ6JCf0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3708,_binary '\0','/l810ZtbnQzqivGJRqNjs007LbC0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052017',7.3,3831,'sv','Nära livet','This intimate chamber drama, set in a maternity ward, follows the emotional crises of three women as they grapple with motherhood.','/zEXjLCknAuml2e1aw2Gxh2eLxdV.jpg','1958-03-31',85,'Released',NULL,'Brink of Life',60899,1.5565,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3709,_binary '\0','/5S916KQ6Wmn0pDFoeknIvpMgL9v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052027',6.9,9410,'en','The Old Man and the Sea','Santiago is an aging, down-on-his-luck, Cuban fisherman who, after catching nothing for nearly 3 months, hooks a huge Marlin and struggles to land it far out in the Gulf Stream.','/6Q34dJL6m1vdzAr0jDDKDmNL52e.jpg','1958-10-07',86,'Released','SPENCER TRACY in his most suspenseful role...ERNEST HEMINGWAY\'S story of Heroism...Defeat...Victory!','The Old Man and the Sea',11331,3.3132,6.5,'06eBO2RCS1I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3710,_binary '\0','/9RkVdpzg5ltvkRWvUBFBkwbgWop.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052046',7.6,1422,'bn','পরশ পাথর','A middle-aged bank clerk happens on a stone with alchemical properties, allowing him to turn steel into gold.','/nWWQiaXmlIAzKj21bBNSLqMRPk6.jpg','1958-01-17',111,'Released','The Philosopher\'s Stone.','The Philosopher\'s Stone',169781,1.1555,6.808,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3711,_binary '\0','/gFDiIk5JSQq4N46bYduZSEmgCbs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052050',7,4155,'en','Party Girl','Slick lawyer Thomas Farrell has made a career of defending mobsters in trials. It\'s not until he meets a lovely showgirl at a mob party that he realizes that there\'s more to life than winning trials. Farrell tries to quit the racket, but mob boss Rico Angelo threatens to hurt the showgirl if Farrell leaves him.','/AqCFJKx2C6pqdDQOP2d7aXvN7OO.jpg','1958-10-28',99,'Released','You\'ll meet her at the roughest parties ...with the toughest guys in town!','Party Girl',25633,3.384,6.8,'u6pR6HXLhyE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3712,_binary '\0','/cjZGSHreZ1Vllt0uRbGt4IKkFgh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052059',6.3,1347,'en','The Perfect Furlough','A love-starved soldier stationed at an Arctic base wins a furlough in Paris, but a pretty, no-nonsense military psychologist is ordered to accompany him as chaperone to keep him out of trouble.','/yrbtmgxifaVcM8C63UhaiubpzJ6.jpg','1958-11-30',93,'Released','104 POLAR-TRAPPED G.I.s picked the army\'s champ woman-chaser to take their furlough by proxy!','The Perfect Furlough',225943,2.6894,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3713,_binary '\0','/AfZA0tDL6sfkGHNLo9CDKV2gTjO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052063',7.6,1507,'pl','Pętla','A day in the life of an alcoholic. With the help of his girlfriend Krysia, Kuba attempts to regain control of his life.','/6tdvonttQ62k0I0dqI4CGvKnHjb.jpg','1958-01-20',96,'Released',NULL,'The Noose',132141,1.41,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3714,_binary '\0','/9pHCAT1ScILdkhY8ErfOma8W4kB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052077',3.9,42715,'en','Plan 9 from Outer Space','In California, an old man grieves the loss of his wife, and dies the day after she is buried. However, the space soldier Eros and his mate Tanna use an electric device to resurrect them both, alongside the strong Inspector Clay, who was murdered by the alien-controlled dead couple. When the populations of Hollywood and Washington D.C. see flying saucers on the sky, a colonel, a police lieutenant, a commercial pilot, his wife, and a policeman try to stop the aliens.','/bmicZi7PvlnZ9rZqp6QXN2Db0pT.jpg','1957-03-15',78,'Released','Unspeakable horrors from outer space paralyze the living and resurrect the dead!','Plan 9 from Outer Space',10513,3.2166,4.2,'aiZp2sXkVUg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3715,_binary '\0','/1QlZ3Kge4bCH01V3VibxckeVIiu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052080',7.7,15218,'pl','Popiół i diament','A young academy soldier, Maciek Chelmicki, is ordered to shoot the secretary of the KW PPR. A coincidence causes him to kill someone else. Meeting face to face with his victim, he gets a shock. He faces the necessity of repeating the assassination. He meets Krystyna, a girl working as a barmaid in the restaurant of the \"Monopol\" hotel. His affection for her makes him even more aware of the senselessness of killing at the end of the war. Loyalty to the oath he took, and thus the obligation to obey the order, tips the scales.','/nE8aqRvVnRQEqskiarnFhdJdk8g.jpg','1958-10-03',103,'Released','Touched with the fire and rebellion of a new generation of Polish film makers','Ashes and Diamonds',5055,4.6112,7.4,'O6kcDS5QM6I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3716,_binary '\0','/5UpuptCgmqBfhjil0BukK0iLMXX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052097',6.9,2737,'en','The Proud Rebel','Searching for a doctor who can help him get his son to speak again--the boy hadn\'t uttered a word since he saw his mother die in the fire that burned down the family home--a Confederate veteran finds himself facing a 30-day jail sentence when he\'s unfairly accused of starting a brawl in a small town. A local woman pays his fine, providing that he works it off on her ranch. He soon finds himself involved in the woman\'s struggle to keep her ranch from a local landowner who wants it--and whose sons were responsible for the man being framed for the fight.','/Q94ZpugICOlgqLLR0TmoH05uuI.jpg','1958-07-01',103,'Released','A story that reaches far and wide as the human heart!','The Proud Rebel',88431,2.3046,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3717,_binary '\0','/2vsD3cxQdJi9sKUAKCXGV6oWDcQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052104',4.7,2931,'en','Queen of Outer Space','An aborted mission strands a crew on Venus where they find the planet inhabited only by women led by their evil Queen Yllana. Yllana had all the men of Venus killed, now that\'s she met Earth men, she wants them dead, too.','/g1hyY6uh7feVNpGjRv78Bx1ksZR.jpg','1958-09-07',80,'Released','Mankind\'s first fantastic flight to Venus - the female planet!','Queen of Outer Space',43135,2.5367,4.9,'ANeEiPRx-Jw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3718,_binary '\0','/pO7uSiOOAlXCL4zTyfDtdcayHbO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052106',6.7,2373,'en','The Quiet American','Cynical British journalist Fowler falls in love with a young Vietnamese woman but is dismayed when a naïve U.S. official also begins vying for her attention. In retaliation, Fowler informs the communists that the American is selling arms to their enemy.','/67Ks7m063DsocmWmo2DyTSuFXZr.jpg','1958-02-08',120,'Released','Violence boiled in the wake of the quiet American!','The Quiet American',85514,1.8237,5.8,'3pTqEe76uvA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3719,_binary '\0','/zLsgIO2QmWhTgFGOURZBFkL17Vz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052117',5.9,1487,'en','Rally \'Round the Flag, Boys!','Harry Bannerman, a Connecticut suburbanite, becomes involved in various shenanigans when his wife Grace leads a protest movement against a secret army plan to set up a missile base in their community.','/hQk7gAMaM0lFd6kDm43WFnA7AhY.jpg','1958-12-23',106,'Released','20th Century-Fox hilariously declares a national laugh holiday, as the cast of the year brings the #1 fun best-seller howlingly alive!','Rally \'Round the Flag, Boys!',111678,2.1802,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3720,_binary '\0','/rYYYZdTUoiddvw3uTlniXIZ1txx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052126',6.7,2200,'en','The Reluctant Debutante','While visiting her father, an American teenage girl is thrown into London society during its final \"Debutante Season.\"','/prqscm98H6Ybt5AD8JvIhOgqXFO.jpg','1958-08-14',94,'Released','MGM presents the Comedy-Romance in luscious COLOR!','The Reluctant Debutante',64382,1.4757,6.7,'7h9s49Lv-wQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3721,_binary '\0','/5Wzjg6KkDiQAydGEjHYnXYR8gbC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052131',5.7,1780,'en','The Return of Dracula','After a vampire leaves his native Balkans, he murders a Czech artist, assumes his identity, and moves in with the dead man\'s American cousins.','/zRL3lGJ1WoWXbsqcClBw7KrrsJw.jpg','1958-05-21',77,'Released','The most terrifying name in the history of the world now gives you the most horrifying thrill in the history of motion pictures!','The Return of Dracula',53187,2.0404,5.6,'PMgVAUqpPf8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3722,_binary '\0','/9b7GIRyRRXYcmEfAN13Or9IyZRi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052135',6.6,1498,'en','Ride a Crooked Trail','After robbing a bank Murphy assumes the identity of his pursuer, a famous US Marshal, when he stumbles into a town and is confronted by the local judge, Matthau. Murphy is forced to remain as the new Marshal; an old flame, Scala, nearly unmasks him by accident, only to be forced to assume the ruse of being Murphy\'s wife. The \"couple\" given a house and respectability, which neither has had before. They maintain the charade to avoid hurting a young orphan boy, Matthau\'s ward. Scala is torn by her loyalty to boyfriend planning to rob the bank and growing feelings for Murphy','/gVAAvYIneqRgybXHEFyl4iHUONb.jpg','1958-11-23',88,'Released','Alone . . . he faced the deadly crossfire of a killer mob . . . and a fear-crazed town!','Ride a Crooked Trail',38659,2.3149,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3723,_binary '\0','/9iRCGAdBOzGcQt0AXtKmUewzjyW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052141',6.6,2565,'en','Rock-a-Bye Baby','An average television repairman must care for the newborn triplets of his former hometown sweetheart—now a famous movie star—so her career will not suffer.','/T1TsGHK6JIWvCZm8HL3TiYxSxw.jpg','1958-07-23',103,'Released','He\'s The \"Mother\" of The Year!','Rock-a-Bye Baby',42581,2.8107,6.9,'P0tusgCSGPA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3724,_binary '\0','/m3odlVzSQllLAdhOMdoLcggR5Qh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052148',6.2,1244,'en','The Roots of Heaven','In French Equatorial Africa, an idealist campaigns to save the African elephant, gaining support from a nightclub hostess and an ex-soldier. His cause attracts a mix of characters, including a U.S. commentator, a government aide opposed to him, and an ivory hunter with conflicting interests.','/o61Y2bK2Oqnc48C6rUM7hecpUBs.jpg','1958-10-15',121,'Released','Of human laughter, wonder and tenderness !','The Roots of Heaven',75799,2.8872,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3725,_binary '\0','/5yQa1XNCOZiRBuIwLBPoyLzujaY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052151',7.3,14971,'en','Run Silent, Run Deep','The captain of a submarine sunk by the Japanese during WWII is finally given a chance to skipper another sub after a year of working a desk job. His singleminded determination for revenge against the destroyer that sunk his previous vessel puts his new crew in unneccessary danger.','/gIoao6u9DiTSyXWk4PFD0MX6PXx.jpg','1958-03-27',93,'Released','Gable and Lancaster make the seas boil in the battle adventure that hits like a torpedo!','Run Silent, Run Deep',18784,4.3181,7,'-0ybOUrFqrc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3726,_binary '\0','/kymxh9tqeReK0DqKsmXpU2ZjvYJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052156',3.4,1794,'en','The Saga of the Viking Women and Their Voyage to the Waters of the Great Sea Serpent','A group of Viking women build a ship and set off across the sea to locate their missing menfolk, only to fall into the clutches of the barbarian Grimolts who hold their men captive and worship the sea serpent which overturned their ship.','/mQ2BZf0K7jJOvBZqgVE0m7rFmnQ.jpg','1957-12-01',66,'Released','Fabulous! Spectacular! Terrifying! The raw courage of women without men lost in a fantastic Hell-on-Earth!','The Saga of the Viking Women and Their Voyage to the Waters of the Great Sea Serpent',85854,1.6807,3.4,'QXJ08m6u6ks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3727,_binary '\0','/eo5PeRTaCRQq2K52sT72obtqBiD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052169',4,4350,'en','The Screaming Skull','Newlyweds Eric and Jenni Whitlock retire to his desolate mansion, where Eric\'s first wife Marianne died from a mysterious freak accident. Jenni, who has a history of mental illness, begins to see strange things including a mysterious skull, which may or may not be a product of her imagination.','/dvobVaHdaPn0y7KNZT6Nfmgohr0.jpg','1958-08-25',68,'Released','The tortured ghost who claims vengeance in the bride\'s bedroom!','The Screaming Skull',34078,1.313,4.269,'QqOpUyCQmZE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3728,_binary '\0','/6jjv2DMqejxhp08mAJ0lrOWauz2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052182',7.3,10000,'en','Separate Tables','The lives of a disparate group of unfulfilled people converge at a small, seaside English hotel.','/y8exawP0Je3MXVIS3olpJ2fu07.jpg','1958-12-18',98,'Released','The international stage success seen by more than 42 million people in 145 cities all over the world!','Separate Tables',43136,2.8035,7.058,'Aigy1ggMUxE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3729,_binary '\0','/jgqZNN8JZB39XMdmAUfMlLnj0cT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052188',2.9,1231,'en','She Gods of Shark Reef','Two brothers, one wanted for murder, are shipwrecked on an island inhabited by nubile young women who have amassed a valuable cache of pearls.','/1N1Xxc7KXRaw6Iqshr30rIAlD6Q.jpg','1958-08-01',63,'Released','Beautiful maidens in a Lush Tropical Paradise ruled by a Hideous Stone God!','She Gods of Shark Reef',76399,1.605,3.2,'LSIOo1SIwPI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3730,_binary '\0','/tlybOEsUzPgcGT6Fs4rvaYyKNNF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052190',6.8,3478,'en','The Sheepman','A stranger in a Western cattle-town behaves with remarkable self-assurance, establishing himself as a man to be reckoned with. The reason appears with his stock: a herd of sheep, which he intends to graze on the range. The horrified inhabitants decide to run him out at all costs.','/n4TtmJvXPPOSDJmQmqZMjj9F8i2.jpg','1958-05-01',85,'Released','They called him the STRANGER WITH A GUN...','The Sheepman',76568,2.5497,6.894,'OH4VwXgwXj0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3731,_binary '\0','/ogrk4me5XKkpDFQwS1Ji1EWgXlX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052191',6.1,1593,'en','The Sheriff of Fractured Jaw','English gunsmith Jonathon Tibbs travels to the American West in the 1880s to sell firearms to the locals. He inadvertently acquires a reputation of quickness on the draw due to his wrist mounted Derringer style weapon. Soon gaining the post of sheriff, he endeavours to clean up the town using what skills he has—and by multilateral diplomacy.','/v4isUD1Yjs4DbBacdVMyvFWn9e6.jpg','1958-10-28',103,'Released','A gunsmith, a gal, and a whole lot of trouble.','The Sheriff of Fractured Jaw',37123,2.4882,6.556,'VyhXwEn9EQs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3732,_binary '\0','/xngwiDxhOnmHF6RJWDPIiTvBP4R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052207',6.8,2146,'en','The Snorkel','On the Italian coast, writer Paul Decker has grown unhappy in his marriage and executes what appears to be a perfect murder of his wife. While Paul is believed to be writing a book in France, his stepdaughter, Candy, suspects him of murdering her mother, as well as her father years before. With the police unwilling to investigate any further, Candy sets out to confirm her suspicions and take Paul down herself.','/cimYDFGjTTfPUNaJT1S0VUnL3Ao.jpg','1958-07-07',90,'Released','Teenage Girl Vs. ... Killer-With-A-Gimmick!','The Snorkel',36754,1.9189,7.1,'zPBMKjj2nI4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3733,_binary '\0','/ryoWP1kvNcwPif6uNbuZwQfrJPy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052216',7.9,13046,'it','I soliti ignoti','Best friends Peppe and Mario are thieves, but they\'re not very good at it. Still, Peppe thinks that he\'s finally devised a master heist that will make them rich. With the help of some fellow criminals, he plans to dig a tunnel from a rented apartment to the pawnshop next door, where they can rob the safe. But his plan is far from foolproof, and the fact that no one in the group has any experience digging tunnels proves to be the least of their problems.','/f5OxD8Nl0pR3DcYHtYhHRfpsmjl.jpg','1958-07-26',106,'Released','The Story of a Perfect Crime ... Perfectly Hilarious!','Big Deal on Madonna Street',24382,3.3617,8.088,'hP8HX5bnQyo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3734,_binary '\0','/nC57cswfpk1a3sXQjwp5dwxinMl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052218',7.2,8378,'en','Some Came Running','A former novelist returns to his small Midwest town after serving in the Army during WWII, to the chagrin of his social-climbing brother, and becomes close with an easy-going professional gambler and torn between two very different women.','/oFivW0sMerjzWmC6GI8axAfc5xy.jpg','1958-12-25',137,'Released','Everyone knew Dave was back in town... and woman-trouble must be close behind!','Some Came Running',38724,3.61,6.96,'4uw4mFBQTaA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3735,_binary '\0','/1l0rx8cwekCKlGPO9iWFtHvQ7nL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052225',6.8,11162,'en','South Pacific','Can a girl from Little Rock find happiness with a mature French planter she got to know one enchanted evening away from the military hospital where she is a nurse? Or should she just wash that man out of her hair? Bloody Mary is the philosopher of the island and it\'s hard to believe she could be the mother of Liat who has captured the heart of Lt. Joseph Cable USMC. While waiting for action in the war in the South Pacific, sailors and nurses put on a musical comedy show. The war gets closer and the saga of Nellie Forbush and Emile de Becque becomes serious drama.','/nYNltu2clFoRQGBz9BtZUTcCbUm.jpg','1958-03-19',157,'Released','There is nothing you can name that is anything like...','South Pacific',17352,3.0795,6.1,'LSuPYEdeLPI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3736,_binary '\0','/2BpTiJEHPkEHDkuAlz0zVV1o1Cx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052227',4.4,1567,'en','The Space Children','A glowing brain-like creature arrives on a beach near a rocket test site via a teleportation beam. The alien communicates telepathically with the children of scientists. The kids start doing the alien\'s bidding as the adults try to find out what\'s happening to their unruly offspring.','/7TXlrL4dygamb70MXhddYeFRXgV.jpg','1958-06-01',69,'Released',NULL,'The Space Children',115054,1.8052,4.2,'Oo9N5lhcfpM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3737,_binary '\0','/tWkhRX6JiTnbOX12F7lGV2Sc4me.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052233',6.8,1708,'en','The Square Peg','Norman Pitkin and Mr Grimsdale are council workmen mending the road outside an Army base when they come into conflict with the military. Shortly afterwards, they get drafted and fall into the clutches of the Sergeant they have just bested. They are sent to France to repair roads in front of the Allied advance but get captured. Pitkin takes advantage of a useful similarity to impersonate General Schreiber and manages to return a hero','/8wOTPzXNo9uSZ7VPyot2U7GUhCv.jpg','1958-12-04',89,'Released',NULL,'The Square Peg',38364,1.6898,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3738,_binary '\0','/qLvUgjbOp3AaLvDqT95ocLdfuQE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052270',7.1,1805,'en','A Tale of Two Cities','Set against the conditions leading up to the French Revolution and the Reign of Terror, French doctor Alexandre Manette serves an 18-year imprisonment in the Bastille in Paris, followed by his release to live in London with the daughter he has never met.','/t4Ni1CxJhREfhAbsZVYRnE2mvnR.jpg','1958-02-07',115,'Released',NULL,'A Tale of Two Cities',4701,2.5228,6.8,'9GCZS7gi7UU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3739,_binary '\0','/yu8B4OYoVwDMYi7ozuke8FGrKvq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052278',7.1,5596,'en','Teacher\'s Pet','The rugged editor of a city newspaper poses as a journalism student and flirts with the professor.','/nScpsAfMBj0ehlisTOuwivnulH5.jpg','1958-04-01',120,'Released','A tantalizing, titillating tale of a love triangle that leads to tangled trouble. An airy, very amusing romantic comedy.','Teacher\'s Pet',43137,2.3317,6.8,'-4MTo-i1jug','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3740,_binary '\0','/pMqlfO51TfV8HEEYCGU6JmqUZUP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052279',3.6,1891,'en','Teenage Cave Man','Roger Corman\'s post-holocaust quickie about an adolescent tribesman who dares to explore the feared \"forbidden zone.\"','/38kDZhW3885yZBDZjiwMBY1KeBM.jpg','1958-07-01',65,'Released','Prehistoric Lovers Against Primitive Beasts!','Teenage Cave Man',97784,1.5871,4,'CqLEucQzW48','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3741,_binary '\0','/uiibrQESdQd9S9SOT5p8P4RVEVC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052286',3,1648,'en','Terror from the Year 5000','Prof. Erling and his financial backer Victor build a prototype time machine to snatch objects from the past. Latest find, a statuette, radiometrically dates to 5200 AD! When this draws colleague Richard Hedges to the island lab, Erling reveals that 20th-century objects put in the machine seem to be \"traded\" for analogous future objects by intelligent life. And on the sly, Victor\'s been trying to get a living visitor. Does the future need help, or is the present in danger?','/rSWMAF7Sf2yda53AyuRbXSvPIIt.jpg','1958-10-30',70,'Released','From Time Unborn… A Hideous She-Thing!','Terror from the Year 5000',49379,1.2294,3.8,'xFiOsaC8N0Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3742,_binary '\0','/t6bvieSEPNpkr01MkAn8xv1dwP2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052287',6.8,2699,'en','Terror in a Texas Town','Armed with a harpoon, a Swedish whaler is out for revenge after the death of his father. A greedy oil man trying to buy up the Swede\'s land might be the guilty party.','/jO4GTyhIfKlDUKXTxgYJPnfpNjE.jpg','1958-09-01',81,'Released','When the Texas Plains Ran With Blood and Black Gold!','Terror in a Texas Town',46681,1.861,6.7,'05kifZuqvZs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3743,_binary '\0','/vLQSqiONTy8NxtGyMtvEMF3mB9t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052289',4.4,2204,'en','The Thing That Couldn\'t Die','A 400 year old disembodied head hypnotizes a female psychic, who recovered it using a dowsing rod, to search for the rest of its body.','/tBCBlmOAZnu6D4UEXxUhWTT6LOn.jpg','1958-06-27',69,'Released','The grave can\'t hold it ...nothing human can stop it!','The Thing That Couldn\'t Die',47001,1.7374,5.189,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3744,_binary '\0','/duWl0uqNW3WVG1QyyiPZXjB7FpQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052293',6.5,5236,'en','Thunder Road','Unrepentant Tennessee moonshine runner Luke Doolin makes dangerous high-speed deliveries for his liquor-producing father, Vernon, but won\'t let his younger brother Robin join the family business. Under pressure from both out-of-town gangster Kogan, who wants a piece of the local action, and Treasury agent Barrett, who wants to destroy the moonshine business, Luke fights for his fast-fading way of life.','/zLvETidTYiTWR6XtWE4A6myQ3lD.jpg','1958-05-10',92,'Released','More Savage Than The Tommy-Gun Massacre of the Roaring Twenties...TODAY\'S BILLION-DOLLAR WHISKEY WAR!','Thunder Road',19368,3.5374,6.056,'yH0lARODjnE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3745,_binary '\0','/mirBMR2y7tzcORkNo0IltcmDzsA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052295',6.6,3564,'de','Der Tiger von Eschnapur','In Eschnapur, a German architect saves the life of the Maharajah\'s favorite temple dancer and becomes Maharajah\'s friend but their friendship is tested when the architect and the dancer fall in-love, triggering the Maharajah\'s vengeful ire.','/eOQud8hEPgBJ82AmJ2HPjZLmpnz.jpg','1959-01-21',101,'Released',NULL,'The Tiger of Eschnapur',71041,2.0613,6.3,'nQga8ejG99I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3746,_binary '\0','/4mcrE2W30EyhUIY5fqejZDMi54y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052296',7.6,4113,'en','A Time to Love and a Time to Die','A German soldier home on leave falls in love with a girl, then returns to World War II.','/nTN6eW0iYtLW2PEDveaHSAOq92X.jpg','1958-07-09',132,'Released','Born out of the blazing passions of war!','A Time to Love and a Time to Die',84079,3.1784,7.2,'wWALRQcCsv4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3747,_binary '\0','/wmYRQ2jWSihHwuMtez0lU7jkiG4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052301',6.9,1402,'en','Too Many Crooks','Accident-prone Fingers runs a pretty unsuccessful gang. They try and rob wealthy but tricky Billy Gordon - who distrusts banks and fears the Inland Revenue - but he sees Fingers and the boys off. So they decide to kidnap his daughter, only to end up with his wife Lucy. Gordon makes out he couldn\'t be more pleased, spuring Lucy to take charge of the hopeless bunch of villains.','/huy3JJ8b70T7VfFmJU5bZp2w3db.jpg','1959-03-08',87,'Released','Robbery With Laughter! Crime Was Simple To Them - They Were All Simple Minded!','Too Many Crooks',61643,1.3565,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3748,_binary '\0','/nhlLsxdVOk44Mpz2K585nid0qyq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052303',6.4,2729,'en','Torpedo Run','A submarine commander is on a relentless pursuit of a Japanese aircraft carrier in the South Seas during World War II.','/261OLcRuuBzhAeFPmziJ3a9x5cG.jpg','1958-10-24',98,'Released','The greatest submarine picture of them all!','Torpedo Run',69977,1.9682,6.133,'6ruGV8Zjn7g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3749,_binary '\0','/4VoHeMD5EugrxmEfeUgxXpXyzuR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052311',7.9,115643,'en','Touch of Evil','A border-town bombing draws Mexican investigator Miguel Vargas into a corruption-ridden police investigation led by crooked captain Hank Quinlan, setting off a deadly struggle over power, justice, and truth.','/1pvRgmfBaoMczIJBOi9gCOZ4FMC.jpg','1958-03-30',111,'Released','The strangest vengeance ever planned!','Touch of Evil',1480,13.8306,7.742,'gFCaDFAKNlk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3750,_binary '\0','/zOk75ZjFvjKZ7xCIVPIrdRfvXgR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052320',5.3,5631,'en','The Trollenberg Terror','A United Nations investigator crosses paths with a pair of psychic sisters on his way to Trollenberg observatory in the Swiss Alps, which has been plagued by a series of mountaineer disappearances that may be related to a radioactive cloud at the mountain\'s south face.','/jGsu39wlddcl7JxvOVqhBQ1TTEp.jpg','1958-07-07',84,'Released','The nightmare terror of the slithering eye that unleashed agonizing horror on a screaming world!','The Crawling Eye',43143,2.5218,4.789,'sUFSZSD8B1k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3751,_binary '\0','/6H1DE4p2DDEwvLurSiIh5PhmeaA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052325',5.8,1622,'en','The Tunnel of Love','A series of misunderstandings leaves a married man believing he has impregnated the owner of an adoption agency, and that she will be his and his wife\'s surrogate.','/1Ka6ev90Lo8CAPPXM1Q3Snxf9ad.jpg','1958-11-21',98,'Released','From the Bold Blushing Stage Hit of Sex in the Suburbs!','The Tunnel of Love',45599,1.9672,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3752,_binary '\0','/rtVwkTqllcmyY4TVOycgVBHppWf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052357',8.2,462866,'en','Vertigo','A retired San Francisco detective suffering from acrophobia investigates the strange activities of an old friend\'s wife, all the while becoming dangerously obsessed with her.','/15uOEfqBNTVtDUT7hGBVCka0rZz.jpg','1958-05-28',128,'Released','Alfred Hitchcock engulfs you in a whirlpool of terror and tension!','Vertigo',426,13.3593,8.13,'UHhsEYDg8GI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3753,_binary '\0','/uRi6TrBzjXG3IsPqnUP8cz61NRD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052365',7,17621,'en','The Vikings','Einar, brutal son of the viking Ragnar and future heir to his throne, tangles with clever slave Eric, for the hand of a beautiful English maiden.','/fagWQmo7VZkjtMchqCu9jR7d6fK.jpg','1958-06-11',115,'Released','Mightiest Of Men... Mightiest Of Spectacles... Mightiest Of Motion Pictures!','The Vikings',42661,5.278,7,'ERIs9RZmlJU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3754,_binary '\0','/5fecahtvSbL4ZCMytkas7styNWb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052374',7.5,3210,'cs','Vynález zkázy','As the world progresses into the industrial age, a professor studying the \"nature of pure matter\" is spirited away by a would-be dictator and connived into building a super-bomb, as a young reporter and a girl rescued from the sea attempt to warn him of their mutual kidnapper\'s intentions to dominate the world with a new and more-deadly-yet weapon.','/aJ9GqbghpkPJ4siOycoCXEdVC1u.jpg','1958-08-22',83,'Released','Fantastic Pedal Blimps Fly The Skies! - Four-Footed Machines In Incredible Sea Battle!','The Fabulous World of Jules Verne',19759,3.266,7.2,'ggn0nvKCd2w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3755,_binary '\0','/zu4ol66vtGH5JXa2WdYV2yAJ05w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052378',4,2929,'en','War of the Colossal Beast','Glenn Manning, \"The Amazing Colossal Man,\" believed dead after falling from the Hoover Dam, reemerges in rural Mexico, brain damaged, disfigured, and very angry.','/xIQI3aN8zHZAmrCCm74EgwLcuVt.jpg','1958-06-04',69,'Released','The towering terror from hell!','War of the Colossal Beast',38269,1.9234,4.1,'zmOBFvdiiEs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3756,_binary '\0','/xn34kB6xSwAd8AlHLc6gZ2EmNfC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052379',5.1,1489,'en','War of the Satellites','An \"unknown force\" declares war against planet Earth when the United Nations disobeys warnings to cease and desist in its attempts at assembling the first satellite in the atmosphere.','/sMVAUWyl3JDtzYmwmlTPOOiJa2g.jpg','1958-05-18',66,'Released','Life magazine says - \"The ultimate in scientific monsters\"','War of the Satellites',29065,2.157,5.2,'FwNPLjxneuw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3757,_binary '\0','/8HbEF1CLKX8rGoOfcRUgWqf9xMD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052394',2.4,1489,'en','The Wild Women of Wongo','On the tropical island of Wongo, a tribe of beautiful women discover that the other side of the island is inhabited by a tribe of handsome men. They also discover that a tribe of evil ape men live on the island, too, and the ape men are planning a raid on the tribe in order to capture mates.','/izmk8lUpNvDpjqe01pc0ObZXIq9.jpg','1959-03-01',72,'Released','Even the birds and bees are confused..','The Wild Women of Wongo',43144,1.2788,2.6,'iHbUytuR2ww','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3758,_binary '\0','/lmWzwa6QUxbkvDon7VYzRlTveym.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052395',6.5,1439,'en','Wind Across the Everglades','Set in the early 20th century, the film follows a game warden who arrives in Florida to enforce conservation laws. He soon finds himself pitted against Cottonmouth, the leader of a fierce group of bird poachers.','/yuRd5ZzKERVlm9M2aiVxhng4tmz.jpg','1958-09-11',94,'Released','STORMING THE HEIGHTS OF MOTION PICTURE GREATNESS!','Wind Across the Everglades',80555,1.9711,6.2,'5BAJSdI5CKw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3759,_binary '\0','/5E4359lwKUHAi48eybPrFZtW28T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052415',7.1,9703,'en','The Young Lions','The lives of three young men, a German and two Americans, during WWII.','/7o0UhkzH01DhAP3JsMLoNPQnoqc.jpg','1958-04-02',167,'Released','Irwin Shaw\'s monumental best-seller','The Young Lions',40739,5.1425,6.748,'5I8Gg4B1fXc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3760,_binary '\0','/w2FMqCR8eo1NWYIiLzKdzbfeBSX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052427',6.5,3152,'en','Tom Thumb','A boy, no bigger than a thumb, manages to outwit two thieves determined to make a fortune from him.','/oUQYLx8tD3DFKMXW1wrlvHavO4L.jpg','1958-12-04',98,'Released','He\'s only 5 1/2 inches high, but he\'s terrific!','Tom Thumb',56931,2.3273,6.4,'nVCShAidvvk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3761,_binary '\0','/1B5C0rHsyPtQzWsnl1QU5ilZBJq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052530',5.8,2461,'en','4D Man','Two brothers, scientists Scott and Tony Nelson, develop an amplifier which enables a person to enter a 4th dimensional state, allowing him to pass through any object. Scott experiments on himself and discovers that each time he passes through something he ages rapidly. He begins killing people, sucking out their life energies and regaining his youth as a result.','/2i5VFcrWVDVD7dgzou2YS9Fchk7.jpg','1959-10-07',85,'Released','He Walks Through Walls Of Solid Steel And Stone... Into The 4th Dimension!','4D Man',26854,1.6291,5.8,'K4IBMTy8WEk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3762,_binary '\0','/uC98ShtK0uFJcbd4BgZhwfZoNBK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052543',6.7,2177,'en','Al Capone','In this unusually accurate biography, small-time hood Al Capone comes to Chicago at the dawn of Prohibition to be the bodyguard of racketeer Johnny Torrio. Capone\'s rise in Chicago gangdom is followed through murder, extortion, and political fraud. He becomes head of Chicago\'s biggest \"business,\" but moves inexorably toward his downfall and ignominious end.','/xmtLUojTRYTswWEx7U9lWjZeZtx.jpg','1959-03-25',104,'Released','His True Shocking Story...Filmed with Bullet Force!','Al Capone',43051,2.9884,6.6,'UKpK-olcdNY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3763,_binary '\0','/kRcij92FGzFoo8Tlw5KipQkbEkm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052545',6.4,1831,'en','Alias Jesse James','Insurance salesman Milford Farnsworth sells a man a life policy only to discover that the man in question is the outlaw Jesse James. Milford is sent to buy back the policy, but is robbed by Jesse. And when Jesse learns that Milford\'s boss is on the way out with more cash, he plans to rob him too and have Milford get killed in the robbery while dressed as Jesse, and collect on the policy.','/9401kHeTLSsAMmwcrph7VkJP35x.jpg','1959-03-20',92,'Released','Look who they gave a gun!','Alias Jesse James',39318,3.6633,6.1,'KmZ1AuTqAVo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3764,_binary '\0','/4ZtUpel6ETB9GBl6m0JXZDzz3Qo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052549',5.6,2906,'en','The Alligator People','Under therapeutic hypnosis, a seemingly well-adjusted young woman tells a fantastic story, verified by lie detector, of her forgotten marriage to a man who disappeared on the day of their honeymoon, and of her search for him which takes her to a lonely mansion in a remote section of swampland tenanted by snakes, alligators, a drunken one-armed lout, a mysterious doctor, and a cold-hearted elderly woman who lives alone in a brooding manse.','/7YsmJfZvQQG0V640rLlFPpxReWB.jpg','1959-07-16',74,'Released','Nerve-shattering terror!','The Alligator People',43105,2.3461,5.6,'NxRAlmJYUNo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3765,_binary '\0','/70O27hFWjJMVIuaWtE2XOoqiC1R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052556',7.1,6471,'fr','Les Amants','A shallow, provincial wife finds her relationship with her preoccupied husband strained by romantic notions, leading her further towards Paris and the country wilderness.','/5WxZp3XpCnK1EQ6D8XASbpCkrzO.jpg','1958-11-05',91,'Released','THIS WAS HER MOMENT! ...and nothing else mattered!','The Lovers',2574,1.8376,6.61,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3766,_binary '\0','/xfEU7DOlQPwz8Y0TBhKmpETuNIc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052561',8,78762,'en','Anatomy of a Murder','Semi-retired Michigan lawyer Paul Biegler takes the case of Army Lt. Manion, who murdered a local innkeeper after his wife claimed that he raped her. Over the course of an extensive trial, Biegler parries with District Attorney Lodwick and out-of-town prosecutor Claude Dancer to set his client free, but his case rests on the victim\'s mysterious business partner, who\'s hiding a dark secret.','/b2G1QSAwtBv9luhEwErIgSRaU92.jpg','1959-07-01',161,'Released','Last year\'s No. 1 best-seller...This year\'s No. 1 motion picture.','Anatomy of a Murder',93,6.8813,7.8,'LwX8NiXv9Hw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3767,_binary '\0','/gLI6SGBvejSObKEWTkTmG6NMbKf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052563',5.7,1250,'en','The Angry Hills','In 1941 Greece, on the eve of German occupation, cynical American foreign correspondent Michael Morrison arrives in Athens, intending to depart for London the following day. While there he is tricked into smuggling a list of resistance leaders out of the country and is pursued by the Germans.','/iueNm6V3CyUZOuAg4TufyxZKLmL.jpg','1959-07-29',105,'Released','The amazing adventures of a lone American in a land of violence!','The Angry Hills',106017,1.5167,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3768,_binary '\0','/tL96NSWrcmkcBEH7JVt7x5Jhnwh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052564',5.3,4394,'en','The Angry Red Planet','The first manned flight to Mars returns after having been out of communications since it had arrived on Mars. What would it reveal?','/jtY9aJjUdbw6CaQ3rHQW6WJKB6g.jpg','1959-11-23',83,'Released','Spectacular Adventure Beyond Time and Space','The Angry Red Planet',6974,2.3133,5.5,'g4KueAXMQIk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3769,_binary '\0','/d3RW7jRsBCHfC9QZaUF9FpzJrh8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052572',8.4,20699,'bn','অপুর সংসার','Apu, now a jobless ex-student dreaming vaguely of a future as a writer, is invited to join an old college friend on a trip up-country to a village wedding.','/6Tz1Q69o2n3Zwb0ZffzPL0nFt2T.jpg','1959-05-01',105,'Released',NULL,'The World of Apu',896,2.3509,8.1,'mgv68E_o6VM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3770,_binary '\0','/rp418uZLHxZDibzTCndXRqXyJmR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052587',5.1,2244,'en','The Atomic Submarine','Ships disappear on route across the Arctic Sea, and a special submarine is sent to investigate.','/vnofOvxhhG7gwAgSR0XJ9Y6JSMp.jpg','1959-11-29',72,'Released','The Screen\'s Spectacular Inferno of the Battle for Civilization!','The Atomic Submarine',37467,1.7783,5.3,'0eXZvsSzITA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3771,_binary '\0','/dOmtirnpTigG2afZ3WOY7VKToQ0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052589',6.9,1363,'it','Audace colpo dei soliti ignoti','The usual gang of robbers are hired by a thief from Milan to steal a suitcase full of money, but troubles will hinder the success of the operation.','/gV2LHaPsO2CySurC7vmLyBRjbcP.jpg','1959-12-19',105,'Released',NULL,'Fiasco in Milan',62036,1.8717,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3772,_binary '\0','/dt580H0MCP5Epuc0sI9TxmtjqnU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052600',8.2,12452,'ru','Баллада о солдате','During World War II, earnest young Russian soldier Alyosha Skvortsov is rewarded with a short leave of absence for performing a heroic deed on the battlefield. Feeling homesick, he decides to visit his mother. Due to his kindhearted nature, however, Alyosha is repeatedly sidetracked by his efforts to help those he encounters, including a lovely girl named Shura. In his tour of a country devastated by war, he struggles to keep hope alive.','/9teeqzdIgPkWsykRapYkqhdefmm.jpg','1959-12-01',89,'Released','From the very pages of life itself!','Ballad of a Soldier',46592,3.9038,7.969,'SAIxQipQQlc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3773,_binary '\0','/8ydivJF1pFmfHRzrvq1DU1esGpx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052602',6.1,7193,'en','The Bat','Mystery writer Cornelia Van Gorder has rented a country house called \"The Oaks\", which not long ago was the scene of some murders committed by a strange and violent criminal known as \"The Bat\". Meanwhile, the house\'s owner, bank president John Fleming, has recently embezzled one million dollars in securities and has hidden the proceeds in the house, but is killed before he can retrieve it.','/78PVHYnadZ0e2BkBBSNonMZvViB.jpg','1959-08-09',80,'Released','When it flies... someone dies!','The Bat',35813,2.1994,5.922,'Gt5jnKTDMNg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3774,_binary '\0','/3Jds2c7OWSYVLVyOWhEy095KrYD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052604',5.1,1235,'it','La battaglia di Maratona','A Greek soldier leads the fight against an invading Persian army.','/flVLrGEAgM6J00ZqjGqS1veb20A.jpg','1959-12-03',90,'Released',NULL,'The Giant of Marathon',18696,2.0707,5.2,'B23l9PT5m9U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3775,_binary '\0','/mIEXtwqb81eF9LwpLBlcMh0ultC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052607',6.6,2007,'en','The Battle of the Sexes','Angela Barrows is a man-eating business woman sent by her American employer to investigate their export opportunities in Edinburgh. En route she meets Robert MacPherson, a businessman who asks for her help to bring his company into the 20th Century. The staff, led by Mr Martin, has other ideas—and a battle between the old and new business methods soon breaks out.','/xFoxIZp9suLSH8acN2oAj0ov8hC.jpg','1960-02-25',84,'Released','James Thurber\'s Delightful Sex-War Satire.','The Battle of the Sexes',43106,2.0892,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3776,_binary '\0','/fQsQePxngtJKWdfnf6D54HKHWkz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052609',4.4,2538,'en','Beast from Haunted Cave','A gold thief and his gang use a skier\'s lodge and meet a monster covered with cobwebs.','/yTS0VnwfbHJxnTM1kbPdj5YMshk.jpg','1959-07-05',66,'Released','Screaming young girls sucked into a labyrinth of horror by a blood-starved ghoul from Hell.','Beast from Haunted Cave',40954,1.7929,4.5,'h1REG9Hy5CM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3777,_binary '\0','/ja5OvMagMNAqdHmTDCm5opaZJM6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052611',5.7,3376,'en','Behemoth, the Sea Monster','Marine atomic tests cause changes in the ocean\'s ecosystem resulting in dangerous blobs of radiation and the resurrection of a dormant dinosaur which threatens London.','/bOt8hqIipLjyiqjb4y4gklEwz5T.jpg','1959-03-03',80,'Released','The biggest thing since creation!','The Giant Behemoth',43093,2.6797,5.8,'6paRvLAl0pY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3778,_binary '\0','/vNY25kB1At5vU6RRYAKkaLCYzDG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052617',6.1,1339,'en','Beloved Infidel','In the late 1930s, Sheilah Graham’s Hollywood column quickly becomes popular for its biting tone. At a party, she meets author F. Scott Fitzgerald, and the two begin a torrid affair. Scott laments that his writing has fallen out of fashion, and when he is fired from his screenwriting position, he begins drinking heavily. Soon his intrusive, volatile behavior threatens their relationship and Sheilah\'s career.','/6ABKWW1tklOiP3oWaF2GVBcczgz.jpg','1959-11-17',123,'Released','The bitter-sweet love affair of the East End orphan girl who became the friend of the famous.','Beloved Infidel',109949,2.2663,6,'KluwGtK6e-8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3779,_binary '\0','/nk5gq5rNLBJiHvNGMRT6I9VRQX7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052618',8.1,273549,'en','Ben-Hur','In ancient Judea, a Jewish aristocrat opposing Roman occupation of his homeland reunites with his childhood friend, now a Roman commander — setting in motion a saga of betrayal, adventure, tragedy, revenge, and faith.','/m4WQ1dBIrEIHZNCoAjdpxwSKWyH.jpg','1959-11-18',212,'Released','The entertainment experience of a lifetime!','Ben-Hur',665,11.4889,7.893,'f2y1gDeZ230','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3780,_binary '\0','/gf9Xjf4GDn94wado6rtzsXSaU1b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052619',6.6,2662,'en','The Best of Everything','An exposé of the lives and loves of Madison Avenue working girls and their higher-ups.','/hrBGdCREbrjxx4ZbBPsohcFZLks.jpg','1959-10-09',121,'Released','The Female Jungle EXPOSED!','The Best of Everything',57103,2.3145,6.344,'_FkV3XGbog0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3781,_binary '\0','/lAv3lNRmmg0nMawfAQ6PbRljAxc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052631',6.4,1339,'en','The Black Orchid','An aging widower fights family disapproval when he falls in love with a gangster\'s widow.','/328zzE3UFXE08u8BzxPMvCr173t.jpg','1959-02-12',94,'Released','More than a story of love... a story of life!','The Black Orchid',84655,2.384,6.3,'QyX1wxQ4_LA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3782,_binary '\0','/8OheIpBs8mcSpaEaKrpm73Pj1Xk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052644',6.9,1789,'fr','Le Bossu','Duke Philippe de Nevers is an influential and popular man who is married to a beautiful wife called Aurore. His rival Philippe de Gonzague hates him enough to organise an attempt on him. The Duke is accompagnied by Henri de Lagardère when de Gonzague\'s henchmen altogether attack him. Lagardère cannot save his friend because the both of them are hopelessly outnumbered. He has to escape in order to save the Duke\'s daughter and swears revenge. Together with his old buddy Passepoil he raises the little girl in Spain. At the same time he returns frequently to France where he detects confronts his friend\'s murderers and puts them to the sword one by one until only their former leader is left. Finally he discovers that Philippe de Gonzague is the man for whom he is looking.','/yWdifU3NZ0FCU5Cb36hhefyX04R.jpg','1959-11-26',105,'Released',NULL,'The Hunchback of Paris',54880,1.5949,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3783,_binary '\0','/rlGq9CU2O5ii0nxWJUi6fMVZlhQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052646',4.6,8191,'en','The Brain That Wouldn\'t Die','Dr. Bill Cortner and his fiancée, Jan Compton, are driving to his lab when they get into a horrible car accident. Compton is decapitated. But Cortner is not fazed by this seemingly insurmountable hurdle. His expertise is in transplants, and he is excited to perform the first head transplant. Keeping Compton\'s head alive in his lab, Cortner plans the groundbreaking yet unorthodox surgery. First, however, he needs a body.','/npg6NH4maZ4NTTWzA71KNCTvQNG.jpg','1962-02-25',82,'Released','Alive... without a body... fed by an unspeakable horror from hell!','The Brain That Wouldn\'t Die',33468,2.5135,4.674,'BqKv_kLZZGQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3784,_binary '\0','/lcWezs3dPkI35SzhVM6KgNRpCXV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052654',7.9,9462,'de','Die Brücke','A group of German boys are ordered to protect a small bridge in their home village during the waning months of the second world war. Truckloads of defeated, cynical Wehrmacht soldiers flee the approaching American troops, but the boys, full of enthusiasm for the \"blood and honor\" Nazi ideology, stay to defend the useless bridge. The film is based on a West German anti-war novel of the same name, written by Gregor Dorfmeister.','/jCg5NqSdUFB1S6iJu3jyXwHOE8d.jpg','1959-10-21',103,'Released','Boys and Girls Dream of love,Manhood and Womanhood to DIscover a World of Violence !','The Bridge',1566,2.9403,7.6,'AqAQsYmu_1Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3785,_binary '\0','/oOUJjdZio15xFkpWui2hwQJr2Nb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052655',6.7,9061,'en','A Bucket of Blood','Nerdy Walter Paisley, a maladroit busboy at a beatnik café who doesn\'t fit in with the cool scene around him, attempts to woo his beautiful co-worker, Carla, by making a bust of her. When his klutziness results in the death of his landlady\'s cat, he panics and hides its body under a layer of plaster. But when Carla and her friends enthuse over the resulting artwork, Walter decides to create some bigger and more elaborate pieces using the same artistic process.','/fUZqTNinLruI6ZE7GQprY8t0Uwg.jpg','1959-10-21',66,'Released','You\'ll be sick, sick, sick — from LAUGHING!','A Bucket of Blood',22642,3.6925,6.6,'hEfzyjJe0iY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3786,_binary '\0','/8VWhM8zR1Dy38kVrGduqr5I4fcM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052667',5.9,1904,'it','Caltiki il mostro immortale','Academic researchers are chased by a nuclear-hot specimen of ancient Mayan blob.','/jS8eyq1MfK84GrkM708UkBE29hm.jpg','1959-08-07',76,'Released','Slimy Glob of Doom Engulfs The World!','Caltiki, the Immortal Monster',28063,1.7816,5.8,'44brFG1GSeA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3787,_binary '\0','/1ry3BRxGxHd8j5gM62RYcFLWAMM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052676',6.2,3027,'en','Carry On Teacher','When a well-loved headmaster decides to retire, his scheming pupils have other ideas. The cunning boys unleash a campaign of practical jokes, armed with gin, itching power, and bombs!','/lzbezW3U4PzopuEGSGVjHfiPdpJ.jpg','1959-08-20',86,'Released','That laugh-crazy \"Carry On\" shower at their hilarious best!','Carry On Teacher',32113,1.9123,6.4,'qnOoK54ZfxA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3788,_binary '\0','/mLmD1H0CfFiVOoO3tATjMsH3b5R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052680',6.3,1810,'en','Cash McCall','Wealthy hotshot Cash McCall makes his money by purchasing unsuccessful businesses, whipping them into shape and then selling them for a huge profit. When Cash comes across Austen Plastics, a small manufacturing corporation on its last legs, he realizes it might be a gamble to buy the company. But when Cash finds out that the company\'s owner is the father of his old flame, Lory, he buys the business just to get a second chance at romance.','/quzE14JpJ4hNMjgbM2mJBK0QO9O.jpg','1960-01-20',102,'Released','High finance and high romance are about to merge.','Cash McCall',43030,1.8092,6.3,'HEXzIpO-LI8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3789,_binary '\0','/zOu6FD0qdQf6t51iqakNLtJBFhp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052696',6.4,1892,'en','City of Fear','An escaped convict gets a hold of some radioactive material after his escape. Authorities desperately try to find the man that unknowingly is threating the lives of everyone in the city.','/dDULZxXTs2g8iix5GF1OVmQUe8u.jpg','1959-02-01',81,'Released','A million eyes wide and wild with terror!','City of Fear',37942,1.2412,6.3,'MCcZsMKxOkg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3790,_binary '\0','/vXDt8FuT1ENqhhYepCaKhQL3tBV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052698',7.4,5178,'fr','Classe tous risques','Two men pull off a daring daylight payroll heist in Milan, making a fast getaway. One is returning to France after years in hiding, needing money to start fresh with his family.','/uMiuUAlPwiWDKSgu4SoShpzvMR.jpg','1960-03-23',110,'Released','The BIG Crime! The BIG Chase!','The Big Risk',34145,2.2904,7.026,'6vzYX9zj2CQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3791,_binary '\0','/3RoZyKnW4jzMChlYs4yJ38oo5gG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052700',7.4,8709,'en','Compulsion','Two close friends\' plan to execute a flawless crime is crushed when one of them inadvertently leaves his glasses at the crime scene.','/h7NzzMi3pQMFps78K8z0EaV9elg.jpg','1959-04-01',103,'Released','THEIRS WAS THE PERFECT CRIME they thought! They were too sure...too smart...too careful to leave a clue -- but they did! and it exploded -- The shocking story of two teenagers out for kicks...looking for thrills...and finding them!','Compulsion',35921,2.3653,7.074,'f2EtqWDnVSQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3792,_binary '\0','/uQp5i70JdxTAovyg8CWyLcB2ZeN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052708',7.2,3632,'fr','Les Cousins','Young provincial Charles arrives in Paris to stay with his cousin Paul while studying law. Paul is a decadent, bohemian pleasure-seeker who shows the meek, diligent Charles the thrills of city life. When Charles falls for Florence, one of Paul\'s acquaintances, relationships begin to shift.','/c0p1ps8j2l8pVRw3GModHPdCIBV.jpg','1959-03-11',112,'Released',NULL,'The Cousins',2363,1.8422,6.8,'R83zINc4LQk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3793,_binary '\0','/2ywAjiDhGKupFbUewJhmvAlWwa1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052713',6.8,3671,'en','The Crimson Kimono','Two detectives clash over the hunt for a burlesque dancer’s killer in Los Angeles’ Japanese district.','/rRliO7Rg1C2zSXtWOhMWOAzuzFS.jpg','1959-10-21',82,'Released','YES, this is a beautiful American girl in the arms of a Japanese boy!','The Crimson Kimono',27045,1.5847,6.637,'M3aZXe0-44w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3794,_binary '\0','/vNr5oRrDRY7tIefSJiDaLaU2WIs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052718',6,1835,'en','Curse of the Undead','A mysterious epidemic has struck an Old West frontier town and young girls are falling deathly ill. Doc Carter, his lovely daughter Dolores, and preacher Dan Young have their hands full caring for the infirm. When one of the patients dies unexpectedly, Dan notices two puncture wounds on her neck. His investigation leads him to the strange gunslinger Drake Robey, who always seems to be slower on the draw than his opponents, but who—despite being outdrawn, and even shot—always manages to survive these deadly encounters. Dan soon discovers that Drake also has an aversion to crucifixes, sleeps in coffins, and cannot tolerate sunlight...','/jlWWAtiO1GBzcgWxPET6Evyc1hC.jpg','1959-12-01',79,'Released','His body is an empty shell that hides a lustful fiend!','Curse of the Undead',147941,1.7996,5.5,'X7TggpxeGVs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3795,_binary '\0','/8SLK1d5oUGzA1Lz7fFHOIXYJgc3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052722',7.1,10320,'en','Darby O\'Gill and the Little People','A wily old codger matches wits with the King of the Leprechauns and helps play matchmaker for his daughter and the strapping lad who has replaced him as caretaker.','/fvdCK9sIgbKHQJjpjhtF9Ev8ysj.jpg','1959-06-24',91,'Released','A touch O\'Blarney... a heap O\'Magic and A LOAD O\'LAUGHTER!','Darby O\'Gill and the Little People',18887,4.4291,6.672,'0LOpdPUM6Ec','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3796,_binary '\0','/rgL7KXlvA3ACS1wHWjXUU4qSPO3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052724',7.3,5082,'en','Day of the Outlaw','Blaise Starrett is a rancher at odds with homesteaders when outlaws hold up the small town. The outlaws are held in check only by their notorious leader, but he is diagnosed with a fatal wound and the town is a powder keg waiting to blow.','/js4P9y1gyU9bqrzE8s49gSNljQX.jpg','1959-05-14',92,'Released','Watch what happens to the women... watch the west explode!','Day of the Outlaw',37481,3.6163,6.797,'6UIzEwJ8Gzk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3797,_binary '\0','/6tzyYR5a88KhHqebXKs0GRyXdwG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052733',6.6,2492,'fr','Deux hommes dans Manhattan','Two French journalists become embroiled in a criminal plot in New York City involving a disappeared United Nations diplomat.','/oiLXcwYmKIMDBtDw3vNRK1LzDy6.jpg','1959-10-16',84,'Released',NULL,'Two Men in Manhattan',27061,1.5518,6.365,'7Vo-67zxTx8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3798,_binary '\0','/9Nb1hr3bYRDPfDIkOJkak4vgPA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052735',6.9,3334,'en','The Devil\'s Disciple','In a small New England town during the American War of Independence, Dick Dudgeon, a revolutionary American Puritan, is mistaken for local minister Rev. Anthony Anderson and arrested by the British. Dick discovers himself incapable of accusing another human to suffer and continues to masquerade as the reverend.','/axagX83w2B8nhap1IC19Ih1AvmN.jpg','1959-08-20',82,'Released','One Devil of a Motion Picture!','The Devil\'s Disciple',78078,3.8686,6.6,'MQC34HPyccw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3799,_binary '\0','/t5rUpe1MwGP0JwMLbfaMJvAfUsG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052738',7.4,14701,'en','The Diary of Anne Frank','The true, harrowing story of a young Jewish girl who, with her family and their friends, is forced into hiding in an attic in Nazi-occupied Amsterdam.','/i7kUdUAF9eTxQG7GdR6lKUK96En.jpg','1959-03-18',179,'Released','Hollywood has never made a greater suspense story... a more tender love story... or a finer human drama!','The Diary of Anne Frank',2576,4.0601,7.2,'nLCooqzoFtA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3800,_binary '\0','/wgo4NDOiZkkcbKx5Z38lvAJX50n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052765',6.5,1596,'fr','Le Déjeuner sur l\'herbe','New Europe presidential candidate Etienne Alexis is a scientist promoting artificial insemination for social betterment and therapy to eliminate passion. To celebrate his engagement to a cousin, he hosts an aseptic picnic, where Mother Nature asserts herself. A shepherd\'s flute conjures a windstorm throwing Alexis together with the luscious Nénette, a farm lass who, although unimpressed with men, wants to have a baby.','/lBeayRLDWw8l3eDkaqlqWlYsgXv.jpg','1959-11-11',91,'Released',NULL,'Picnic on the Grass',43101,2.2871,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3801,_binary '\0','/nbkUyqcHvUoC7Fv8ew1B4dGBZIf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052771',6.5,1450,'en','Edge of Eternity','Helped by socialite Janice Kendon and barkeeper Scott O\'Brien, Arizona deputy sheriff Les Martin works to solve three brutal murders in and around the Grand Canyon. His efforts leads to the killer fleeing with Janice as a hostage and a chase by car and helicopter lead to a climax on a miner\'s bucket on cables a mile above the canyon floor.','/jth7Eai9E4kO7IS32TpIiS5Poak.jpg','1959-11-02',80,'Released','Mile-High Suspense In The Grand Canyon!','Edge of Eternity',59870,2.0837,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3802,_binary '\0','/2mHanIxLVLoNwWTQG4rVPRVnBX8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052782',4.6,2588,'it','Ercole e la regina di Lidia','En route to Thebes for an important diplomatic mission, Hercules drinks from a magic spring and loses his memory. He spends most of the movie in the pleasure gardens of Queen Omphale of Lydia. While young Ulysses tries to help him regain his memory, political tensions escalate in Thebes, and Hercules\' new wife Iole finds herself in mortal danger.','/4lzZhokSXwb93GlrREMuRLw0SLL.jpg','1959-02-14',98,'Released',NULL,'Hercules Unchained',39402,2.5707,5.1,'n8KoXbIDqvo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3803,_binary '\0','/yNhbxY6IM3ewszPFZjAdoOH7BUt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052784',7.7,2676,'es','El esqueleto de la señora Morales','A taxidermist decides to murder his wife after having to put up with her after twenty years of hellish marriage.','/bWC7hLO1EOHYeK6zNiLT7jonVg4.jpg','1960-05-26',84,'Released',NULL,'The Skeleton of Mrs. Morales',118007,1.5721,7.956,'OmcxItt_6X0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3804,_binary '\0','/4IKzuEBM9Pi8QvisMFYOIRgnzF5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052786',7.3,2218,'it','Estate violenta','Summer, 1943: wealthy youth in the Riccione district of Rimini play while the war gets closer. Carlo Caremoli, a young man who follows the crowd, has found ways to avoid military service. Then, on the beach, he meets Roberta, a war widow with a child. Roberta\'s mother warns Roberta to avoid Carlo, but to her, he seems attentive and to her daughter he is kind. Romance develops. Within a few weeks, Roberta is risking everything. Can there be a resolution between passion, on the one hand, and war, duty, and social expectation on the other?','/7rq5h5rYtYVYmfg5725BRDaqIFe.jpg','1959-11-13',96,'Released',NULL,'Violent Summer',88395,1.5285,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3805,_binary '\0','/aTe5YuzzZ0GnrMN3mwT6RUzdF5j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052792',6.5,4273,'en','The FBI Story','A dedicated FBI agent recalls the agency\'s battles against the Klan, organized crime and Communist spies.','/sRilzVuu6HuPhi5TFjqGoZfU9lH.jpg','1959-10-01',149,'Released','You are crouched in a basement stairway opposite a theatre in Chicago. Keep your eyes on that FBI man across the street. He has set the trap for deadly public enemy, John Dillinger...','The FBI Story',50231,2.4714,6.2,'Jb81VfF-rp0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3806,_binary '\0','/mUMttVYif1VVyeYhigkBHLb8K2b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052805',5.4,2048,'en','First Man into Space','The first pilot to leave Earth\'s atmosphere lands, then vanishes; but something with a craving for blood prowls the countryside...','/lKBIGRetSbZ6cBRWqaNzwHvkgy9.jpg','1959-02-01',77,'Released','The picture that leaps ahead of the headlines!','First Man into Space',28955,1.6047,5.1,'94TEO7MKHJw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3807,_binary '\0','/qmTfpZ0PsUkLqUI3uNe3Z8cQhRa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052809',7.1,2363,'en','The Five Pennies','Dixieland cornetist Red Nichols runs into opposition to his sound, but breaks through to success. He marries a warm, patient woman and even finds time to raise a family. Then tragedy strikes when their daughter contracts polio.','/vECa5z1DgEQ2Tn5OGRa8YTPOTcM.jpg','1959-06-18',117,'Released',NULL,'The Five Pennies',17677,1.8611,6.8,'JimhENx3Zfo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3808,_binary '\0','/dBlWShywAgnUILzEzJjnrP2rb5j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052810',6.8,1490,'fr','La fièvre monte à El Pao','After Caribbean despot Mariano Vargas is murdered at the hands of his enraged populace, his secretary Ramón Vázquez takes not just control but also Vargas\' widow Inés, with whom he\'s been having an affair. Special military unit leader Alejandro Gual arrives to overthrow Vázquez by turning the people and Inés against him.','/mrlQzUGzi1FfMB6sh0p0H1ZYgsx.jpg','1959-12-05',97,'Released',NULL,'Fever Mounts at El Pao',48863,2.1458,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3809,_binary '\0','/lmC20MRqpS9BBFYkFm1J1adcCiY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052811',6.9,2788,'en','The Flesh and the Fiends','Edinburgh surgeon Dr. Robert Knox requires cadavers for his research into the functioning of the human body; local ne\'er-do-wells Burke and Hare find ways to provide him with fresh specimens...','/8fCGyjHUtf7gqZToP9kYM7AFcOg.jpg','1960-02-02',94,'Released','Coffins Looted! Cadavers Dissected!','The Flesh and the Fiends',52203,2.3846,6.658,'eKzUDTtnotQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3810,_binary '\0','/px1puGrSDtP3BuKu2XbdNehjLJp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052820',5.7,1468,'en','The Four Skulls of Jonathan Drake','Jonathan Drake, while attending his brother\'s funeral, is shocked to find the head of the deceased is missing. When his brother\'s skull shows up later in a locked cabinet, Drake realizes an ancient curse placed upon his grandfather by a tribe of South American Jivaro Indians is still in effect and that he himself is the probable next victim.','/wkFhFmuH7BnZBDMNUncOiwmbmoH.jpg','1959-11-13',70,'Released','Written, Produced, And Directed To Scare The Daylights Out Of You!','The Four Skulls of Jonathan Drake',86191,1.864,6,'rgaOmCUwvgU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3811,_binary '\0','/5aEcxujeMLtNZ4Pbth0GzlA8xfv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052829',6.3,1560,'de','Der Frosch mit der Maske','Both Scotland Yard and an amateur American sleuth are tracking a master criminal known as The Frog. This moniker refers to the bulging-eyed mask worn by the evildoer, and is reflected by the frog icons painfully tatooed onto the forearms of his henchmen. The trail leads to the country manor of an enigmatic, steely-eyed nabob, whose repressed son has eyes for the artistes at the Lolita cabaret, and whose lovely daughter captures the fancy of both the American playboy and the villain himself. Murder, kidnapping and seduction ensue.','/vrf942VxNkcJPZoXWfH474IKELE.jpg','1959-09-04',89,'Released',NULL,'Fellowship of the Frog',6699,1.503,6.6,'7hWEgqsUwo4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3812,_binary '\0','/yciP2XXtEmhEDeAEfBmlLDso1GM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052832',7,8410,'en','The Fugitive Kind','Val Xavier, a drifter of obscure origins, arrives at a small town and gets a job in a store run by Lady Torrence. Her husband, Jabe M. Torrance, is dying of cancer. Val is pursued by Carol Cutere, the enigmatic local tramp-of-good-family.','/ta2ircBtQs8EZXe6QznCI5J6N3i.jpg','1960-04-14',121,'Released','With a guitar and a snake skin jacket he drifted out of the rain...and into the lives of these two women...','The Fugitive Kind',47837,2.8324,6.9,'Wr_kd-ivZ9c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3813,_binary '\0','/3VOpsw5H89H5fojmR9cr3znKgHV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052837',6.8,2445,'en','The Gazebo','TV writer Elliott Nash buries a blackmailer under the new gazebo in his suburban backyard. But the nervous man can\'t let the body rest there.','/shQcJ6OuxmmbG5s4AntXmTbIlCy.jpg','1959-12-18',100,'Released','All the love, laughs and murderous fun of the Broadway smash hit!','The Gazebo',1789,1.9924,6.9,'bcoc4nASW8w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3814,_binary '\0','/sbtAGCz7GIVgHHbAT9AO28QOCVM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052846',3.8,4766,'en','The Giant Gila Monster','A small town in Texas finds itself under attack from a hungry, fifty-foot-long gila monster. No longer content to forage in the desert, the giant lizard begins chomping on motorists and train passengers before descending upon the town itself. Only Chase Winstead, a quick-thinking mechanic, can save the town from being wiped out.','/o7LI2NQ0KtDaVaIYYhZ9PHFDV37.jpg','1959-06-25',74,'Released','Only Hell could breed such an enormous beast... Only God could destroy it!','The Giant Gila Monster',34077,1.7483,4.2,'JJgcIwfyToY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3815,_binary '\0','/l1iQ1hkFYzKT2GyBIldCuJutYyM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052847',6.6,4357,'en','Gidget','Due to an accident while swimming in the sea, Francis meets the surfer Moondoggie. She\'s fascinated with his sport and starts to hang out with his clique. Although they make fun of her at first, they teach her to surf and soon she\'s accepted and given the nickname \"Gidget\". But it\'s hard work to become more than a friend to Moondoggie.','/i4aRCd5sRzYLb3TLm8iiUN0iJTr.jpg','1959-04-09',95,'Released','Watch out Brigitte...here comes Gidget!','Gidget',43096,2.804,6,'Y5suc-Yexpw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3816,_binary '\0','/fcH7FM74GoHgOUnKjpGAoKOxWvY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052861',8.1,5123,'it','La grande guerra','Italy, 1916. Oreste Jacovacci and Giovanni Busacca are called, as all the Italian youths, to serve the army in the WWI. They both try in every way to avoid serving the army.','/aDvKsUb5y7GMNMz2HHNtuGww5t8.jpg','1959-10-28',137,'Released','The great battle spectacle of our time!','The Great War',55823,2.702,8.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3817,_binary '\0','/lgfP5iJ3VGrOL1G2YCDwAQUAJn8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052862',5.8,1928,'en','The Great St. Louis Bank Robbery','Career criminals and a local youth carefully plan and rehearse the robbery of a Missouri bank.','/zodT2zxrTpCTWZp1jrz2xNZhSq7.jpg','1959-09-10',85,'Released','Never before in Police annals! Never before in film history!','The Great St. Louis Bank Robbery',5926,1.6967,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3818,_binary '\0','/aWIPVKcXHkRIrQWEdGAIgBT342E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052864',5.3,2851,'en','Green Mansions','A young Venezuelan idealist flees his native land to escape a revolution. Hoping to find peace, he goes to the mountains and the forests of the Amazon. There he encounters Rima, the Bird Girl, an orphan living a life of nature, who is feared by a local jungle tribe.','/jYkH53CRC6cuQfgeixhswc6geyI.jpg','1959-03-19',104,'Released','W. H. Hudson\'s unforgettable story of love and adventure in the South American jungles!','Green Mansions',66869,3.1101,5.7,'rLnwlvW0DRs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3819,_binary '\0','/glLU8JK1hDiicAJ9WbUMLkYeLI5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052876',7.1,5629,'en','The Hanging Tree','Joseph \"Doc\" Frail is a doctor with a past he\'s trying to outrun. While in Montana, he comes across a mining camp with a hanging tree and rescues a man named Rune from the noose. With Rune as his servant, Frail decides to settle down, and he takes over as town doctor. He meets Elizabeth, who is suffering from shock, and the two soon fall in love. But when Elizabeth is attacked, Frail\'s attempt to help her lands them both in trouble.','/lhewmwPYrtbq6YWCFuuAkg8oxaU.jpg','1959-02-19',107,'Released','From The Prize Novel -- A Picture Of Thundering Power!','The Hanging Tree',43008,2.8504,6.721,'FYzK8DWFxN8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3820,_binary '\0','/osa3Lvhl0RMpSeVVWj785VKw7g6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052877',6.6,1374,'en','The Hangman','A marshal nicknamed \"The Hangman\" because of his track record in hunting down and capturing wanted criminals traces a robbery suspect to a small town. However, the man is known and liked in the town, and the citizens band together to try to help him avoid capture.','/76nIzgoW0xJVaXIrTr948XYdO2o.jpg','1959-06-17',87,'Released','He was a U.S. Marshal but the name they called him was ... The Hangman.','The Hangman',48409,2.0049,6.5,'74dKafo2VxY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3821,_binary '\0','/pIK0D0CwwjnILsEXaILYETEOibH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052888',4.4,1765,'en','The Hideous Sun Demon','After exposure to radiation, an atomic research scientist finds himself changing into a murderous, lizard-like creature every time he is exposed to sunlight.','/maXa8CxQnMFn2RZC8hBOeexrrYt.jpg','1958-08-28',74,'Released','The Blaze Of The Sun Made Him A Monster!','The Hideous Sun Demon',41038,1.8917,4.4,'4AZQksTf41I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3822,_binary '\0','/4fynFAYPPYCkyIdt0bsCwWn3Hxv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052893',7.8,39858,'fr','Hiroshima mon amour','The deep conversation between a Japanese architect and a French actress forms the basis of this celebrated French film, considered one of the vanguard productions of the French New Wave. Set in Hiroshima after the end of World War II, the couple -- lovers turned friends -- recount, over many hours, previous romances and life experiences. The two intertwine their stories about the past with pondering the devastation wrought by the atomic bomb dropped on the city.','/zieczjWnvalaxwX5EQASEx0on5f.jpg','1959-06-10',92,'Released','From the measureless depths of a woman\'s emotions...','Hiroshima Mon Amour',5544,7.6921,7.67,'CLts830aLlw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3823,_binary '\0','/37XokaTf9o6nazmKPlDP3LKTYQ6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052896',6.2,3342,'en','A Hole in the Head','An impractical widower tries to hang onto his Miami hotel and his 12-year-old son.','/BOgeA821uM0G2nrKj8rFSPYyGO.jpg','1959-09-15',120,'Released','The most wonderful entertainment in the whole wide wonderful world!','A Hole in the Head',33725,2.3556,6.2,'0634FHGtLz8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3824,_binary '\0','/hu0I2a1JeRjylBDQ5Ialv9m4wh1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052901',5.9,2063,'en','Horrors of the Black Museum','A writer of murder mysteries finds himself caught up in a string of murders in London.','/uSCR1iZDIfTF6dbLzQe5IStRuA9.jpg','1959-04-29',81,'Released','It Actually Puts YOU In The Picture - Can You Stand It?','Horrors of the Black Museum',38823,1.8594,5.9,'GmrpNI5pJzU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3825,_binary '\0','/9ny2f4aVGSvuV3yUKlFAQ26677Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052902',7.1,13262,'en','The Horse Soldiers','A Union Cavalry outfit is sent behind confederate lines in strength to destroy a rail supply center. Along with them is sent a doctor who causes instant antipathy between him and the commander. The secret plan for the mission is overheard by a southern belle who must be taken along to assure her silence.','/kLBwk5ppNsA0DizEocXClTi1Lmx.jpg','1959-06-11',115,'Released','...rides where only the great ones do!','The Horse Soldiers',17664,3.3915,6.9,'h6YCA-9F9ew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3826,_binary '\0','/k735AJpiP0H690rCGCWDVDytN9z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052905',6.9,14423,'en','The Hound of the Baskervilles','When a nobleman is threatened by a family curse on his newly inherited estate, detective Sherlock Holmes is hired to investigate.','/gJNscfPsBnQRdIjjdrTIHVCRwvY.jpg','1959-05-04',87,'Released','The Most Horror-Dripping TALE EVER WRITTEN!','The Hound of the Baskervilles',11791,4.1129,6.8,'DbPU75gfJTI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3827,_binary '\0','/6PuJWzen6CfDE51TjLzIqMuu5Xy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052911',7.1,4924,'en','I\'m All Right Jack','Naive Stanley Windrush looks for a career in a family business. Much to his dismay, he finds work at a munitions factory where he has to start from the bottom, while both the management and the labor union use him as a tool in their fight for power.','/4HD25hdMIcFAd0MbGCFM8t7G0sO.jpg','1959-08-18',105,'Released','Three of England\'s Top Comedians...One Big Laugh Riot!','I\'m All Right Jack',34783,2.0315,6.6,'hJ-O8fG2xfI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3828,_binary '\0','/v6saYVrDHHs5ansCFz5lIyFUV5X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052918',7.8,20093,'en','Imitation of Life','In 1940s New York, a white widow who dreams of being on Broadway has a chance encounter with a black single mother, who becomes her maid.','/xt3cUn7lsjpaGuB279A4v8zAYRn.jpg','1959-04-09',125,'Released','Fannie Hurst\'s best selling novel of today\'s tormented generation!','Imitation of Life',34148,3.7121,7.4,'HaanE7v6uJI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3829,_binary '\0','/iSYyMGqGazsrdZorFuNHmbgDDgs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052924',6.6,3285,'de','Das indische Grabmal','Seetha and Harold Berger are rescued from the desert by a caravan and brought to a small village. However, the greedy owner of the house where they are lodged betrays the law of hospitality and reveals their location to Prince Ramigani. The couple tries to escape but is hunted and captured by Ramigani and his men. Meanwhile Irene Rhode and her husband Walter Rhode suspect that Maharaja Chandra is not telling the truth about Harold\'s destiny. The conspirator Ramigani forces Seetha to accept to get married with Chandra to provoke the wrath of the priests and get the alliance of Prince Padhu and his army. In the meantime, Harold succeeds in escaping from the dungeon and seeks out Seetha to save her.','/4N9uLLo7L2xE0uW9cN2FEJluZzt.jpg','1959-03-05',97,'Released',NULL,'The Indian Tomb',70555,1.8264,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3830,_binary '\0','/3dcotvZbMlhPM5eIVn8IgaSIjK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052929',5,2184,'en','Invisible Invaders','Aliens, contacting scientist Adam Penner, inform him that they have been on the moon for twenty thousand years, undetected due to their invisibility, and have now decided to annihilate humanity unless all the nations of earth surrender immediately. Sequestered in an impregnable laboratory trying to find the aliens\' weakness, Penner, his daughter, a no-nonsense army major and a squeamish scientist are attacked from outside by the aliens, who have occupied the bodies of the recently deceased.','/fBNA9Pvwou79VZlOti8XKgOQvGW.jpg','1959-05-15',67,'Released','A sci-fi shocker that\'ll keep you awake at night!','Invisible Invaders',58997,1.1747,5,'_c5x_KRq9fc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3831,_binary '\0','/iZqj2xWqWWevR973djgzBxIxtQy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052933',6.6,3442,'en','It Happened to Jane','Jane Osgood runs a lobster business, which supports her two young children. Railroad staff inattention ruins her shipment, so with her lawyer George, Jane sues Harry Foster Malone, director of the line and the \"meanest man in the world\".','/iyMFwzRZnS0qewOEhtvwNS9RZPM.jpg','1959-05-24',97,'Released','It\'s bigger than all of us!','It Happened to Jane',40957,2.9225,6.16,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3832,_binary '\0','/2Dlt1zNYvvAgZqI28kbLFctMFKr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052942',7.9,2206,'en','Jazz on a Summer\'s Day','Set at the 1958 Newport Jazz Festival, this documentary mixes images of water and the town with performers and audience. The film progresses from day to night and from improvisational music to Gospel. It\'s a concert film that suggests peace and leisure, jazz at a particular time and place.','/ltdAJF4sVIRAOJmHIUzfLylrVRr.jpg','1960-03-28',82,'Released','...love on a summer\'s night!','Jazz on a Summer\'s Day',53434,1.5226,7.3,'lPhF-_xcvpo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3833,_binary '\0','/qHBnElKuWkHzzk0pwERcJZWOb0V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052946',6.3,1540,'en','John Paul Jones','The career of Revolutionary War naval hero John Paul Jones, from his youth in Scotland through his service to Catherine the Great of Russia.','/3TrDpr3i0DrixtC862izdZV3hA9.jpg','1959-06-16',126,'Released','The adventures that will live forever in America\'s naval history!','John Paul Jones',72904,2.3912,6,'quLZjl8GTXQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3834,_binary '\0','/74aJhP8R5WzmFOEJzR9eUMDiiSH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052948',7,21586,'en','Journey to the Center of the Earth','An Edinburgh professor and assorted colleagues follow an explorer\'s trail down an extinct Icelandic volcano to the earth\'s center.','/nWn9MRFkC1M13hVf17mT0BfYKbg.jpg','1959-12-15',132,'Released','A fabulous world below the world','Journey to the Center of the Earth',11571,6.1582,6.9,'Mytf_8pr4Aw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3835,_binary '\0','/9YkboCn0ejNBAwXjsCGkSGWy0L5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052950',6.8,2020,'en','The Journey','A Communist officer falls hard for a married woman trying to escape from Hungary.','/9HXN8SKOYnasVRPY1JUYiWzMFia.jpg','1959-02-11',126,'Released','The Major was used to having his way - and he meant to take this lovely iceberg - by force if necessary','The Journey',76714,2.3623,6.3,'sAl96emhirY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3836,_binary '\0','/jKmX5N1jr36MCYbW9XOi93xymGM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052954',7.8,3195,'hi','कागज़ के फूल','The film tells, in flashback, the story of Suresh Sinha, a famous film director and his relationship with an aspiring actress.','/aBdEEAKEuzcvk8IKsHfbz3KSitZ.jpg','1959-02-01',142,'Released',NULL,'Kaagaz Ke Phool',53767,1.0553,6.817,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3837,_binary '\0','/b0JdDWFV5q797ptrZpVscKN46Ub.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052961',7.6,2972,'it','Kapò','Determined to survive at any price, Edith, a young Jewish woman deported to an extermination camp, manages to survive by accepting the role of kapo, a privileged prisoner whose mission is to ruthlessly guard other prisoners.','/lAd0NUnvTFkgcwbJmbx0sffn7Bk.jpg','1960-09-27',117,'Released',NULL,'Kapo',45884,1.9172,6.9,'sOPQx3NmApw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3838,_binary '\0','/4kUnuf67zJlqOB6CaryXwsqDhgv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052969',4.2,6181,'en','The Killer Shrews','Trapped on a remote island by a hurricane, a group discover a doctor has been experimenting on creating half sized humans. Unfortunately, his experiments have also created giant shrews, who when they have run out of small animals to eat, turn on the humans.','/2agTmqPg2we1gd4Fr1p2UNAMORI.jpg','1959-06-25',69,'Released','All that was left after...','The Killer Shrews',43109,1.4562,4.5,'CBd5MUQjX30','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3839,_binary '\0','/yoG5OAFINVrwmqVNRxcgNI4zRyu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052993',7.3,9941,'en','Last Train from Gun Hill','A marshal tries to bring the son of an old friend, an autocratic cattle baron, to justice for the rape and murder of his wife.','/hXbBkFAcJZBHH629Kj4Ujrq1r2l.jpg','1959-07-29',98,'Released','Now...from the star, the director and the producer of \'Gunfight at the O.K. Corral\'','Last Train from Gun Hill',14677,4.2045,7.1,'tZd7jJoL_k0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3840,_binary '\0','/wRNLvGcqzne6wZ5YiEFOo9dckPi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0052997',7.2,5970,'en','The League of Gentlemen','Involuntarily-retired Colonel Hyde recruits seven other dissatisfied ex-servicemen for a special project. Each of the men has a skeleton in the cupboard, is short of money, and is a service-trained expert in his field. The job is a bank robbery, and military discipline and planning are imposed by Hyde and second-in-command Race on the team, although civilian irritations do start getting in the way.','/6lJvpL5Z3qZxegmJHUpjGsWROtW.jpg','1960-04-15',116,'Released','What is the league ... Who are the gentlemen ?','The League of Gentlemen',46724,2.8926,7.064,'7uvHIlQ_XCg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3841,_binary '\0','/seC15PgENTKwXEnBmwd6hvEZ55c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053001',6.8,1634,'en','Li\'l Abner','A comedy musical based on the comic strip charcters created by Al Capp. When residents of Dogpatch, USA are notified by the government that they must evacuate because of atomic bomb testing, they try to persuade the government that their town is worth saving. Meanwhile, Earthquake McGoon wants to marry Daisy Mae; Daisy Mae wants to marry Li\'l Abner, and Li\'l Abner just wants to go fishing.','/t8c1Mn9KmPgY71f6ak45hZYjg2c.jpg','1959-12-11',113,'Released',NULL,'Li\'l Abner',34662,1.3457,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3842,_binary '\0','/5a4AZELK2YRv6fw9XgXtIY0lPTb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053002',6.8,1679,'fr','Les Liaisons dangereuses','Juliette de Merteuil and Vicomte de Valmont are a sophisticated couple, always looking for fun and excitement. Both have sexual affairs with others and share their experiences with one another. But when Valmont meets the beautiful young Marianne at a ski resort, he breaks the one rule of his unconventional marriage: never fall in love.','/pKBOwpqkfeUeTEPcAoYEdEEcFQc.jpg','1959-09-09',106,'Released',NULL,'Dangerous Love Affairs',43102,1.7965,6.51,'_nVOBE-DOcM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3843,_binary '\0','/jumCAwyW9tx0ij0zboFkw5P4NbL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053003',7.1,1824,'en','Libel','A California commercial pilot sees a telecast in London of an interview with Sir Mark Lodden at his home. The Canadian is convinced that the baronet is a fraud, and he is actually a look-alike actor named Frank Welney.','/5CfI3m9rdHXLDXYCIaPKlKtDyuS.jpg','1959-10-23',100,'Released','The surprise witness ! The searching question ! The perjured testimony ! The accusing finger ! The shattering truth !','Libel',79180,1.3635,6.8,'2s01W3HH2Tk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3844,_binary '\0','/s9LSf0J6FY2vgyKe9x7BWnfG5Xr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053017',6.6,1708,'en','Lonelyhearts','Burdened by a family secret, Adam White lands a job as a newspaper advice columnist. Little does he realize that it\'s all part of a nasty desire by cynical editor William Shrike to crush the souls of his underlings. Adam feels his readers\' pain, and eventually, he takes an assignment to meet with Faye Doyle, who is exasperated by her crippled husband. When Faye tries to seduce Adam, he must choose between his job and his girl.','/5q8FZ3uNTgcJdPWz0EP4MWYy1Gq.jpg','1959-03-04',100,'Released','SOME WIVES CHEAT BECAUSE THEIR HUSBANDS DO... AND SOME BECAUSE THEY\'RE JUST NO GOOD!','Lonelyhearts',95402,1.3966,6.3,'pvDK5aKB0x8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3845,_binary '\0','/r6xnOE1swzbqFsKUTa2kSNC969a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053033',7,1861,'fr','Maigret et l\'Affaire Saint-Fiacre','Police Commissioner Jules Maigret returns to the small village where he spent his childhood at the request of the Countess of Saint-Fiacre, who has received a disturbing anonymous letter.','/sUj0bDjdYUzRXntxN27g4tMs0Mc.jpg','1959-09-02',98,'Released',NULL,'Maigret and the St. Fiacre Case',434966,2.4121,6.932,'5G7Iwc6aIQo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3846,_binary '\0','/pVhuqgxoz02RmDUuMb1cEez0z8S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053039',7.4,1914,'it','Un maledetto imbroglio','A police inspector comes into contact with people of all types and dispositions during a grueling murder investigation.','/qeCHJySFz0btMH3swU4h4mhf1gi.jpg','1959-10-24',115,'Released',NULL,'The Facts of Murder',26296,1.5528,7.2,'nsy1KL8dq2M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3847,_binary '\0','/sTWRSQbyprCfMw31Lgp3jZrdc6u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053041',6.3,2965,'en','The Man Who Could Cheat Death','Dr. Bonner plans to live forever through periodic gland transplants from younger, healthier human victims. Bonner looks about 40; he\'s really 104 years old. But people are starting to get suspicious, and he may not make 200.','/xL8b3Q88zCzW8JFr2NK8cqqR1kL.jpg','1959-06-15',83,'Released','HIS HIDEOUS OBSESSION LED HIM TO COMMIT GHASTLY CRIMES OF PASSION AND VIOLENCE.','The Man Who Could Cheat Death',28770,2.4719,5.8,'75ZmQoK3Hks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3848,_binary '\0','/i3NqRCA6aClzT3hy0A4nQ3iecSv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053050',7.5,1623,'fr','Marie-Octobre','A group of ex-resistance fighters are brought together by Marie-Octobre, the code name of Marie-Helene Dumoulin. The former members of the network have carried on with their lives after the war, but this evening they are going to have to live again a fateful night – the night their leader was killed. He had been betrayed, his name given to the Germans. The search for the traitor puts each personality in the spotlight – and also that of the killed leader, Castille.','/jU1FRo2rmGAEkhb8A2EB6UpTW0D.jpg','1959-04-24',95,'Released',NULL,'Marie-Octobre',76777,2.0825,7.293,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3849,_binary '\0','/4SievXaB6WqBkE1VFXpP6TQTG9n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053054',6.9,2001,'en','The Mating Game','Tax collector Lorenzo Charlton comes to the Larkins\' farm to ask why Pop Larkins has never filed an income tax return. Charlton has to stay for a day to try to estimate the income from the farm, but it isn\'t easy to calculate when the farmer has such a lovely daughter.','/e87jyPk8Hx4LIdyTdP3IHdc3RH9.jpg','1959-04-29',96,'Released','Filmed on location in the haystack!','The Mating Game',43110,2.1688,6.4,'FTE7YA_1-Iw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3850,_binary '\0','/xnC63rrhWbhy8zYcmmjtHnAhKq7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053065',7.2,2011,'en','Middle of the Night','Jerry Kingsley is a wealthy garment manufacturer left lonely in his 50s when his wife dies. Despite the difference in their ages, he strikes up a romance with divorced 24-year-old receptionist Betty. The relationship is dismissed by his daughter, Lillian, discouraged by his sister, Evelyn, and denounced by Betty\'s mother. But when Jerry begins to mention marriage, even Betty is forced to confront her ambivalence.','/jSlwgfum8DFIbayHKRMq0CH6TzS.jpg','1959-05-20',118,'Released','For every girl who was ever involved with an older man!','Middle of the Night',120522,2.6965,7,'UHl5gVoHWcY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3851,_binary '\0','/gNSpI8hjWJauau4OieeWCN4u8a3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053072',4.1,1725,'en','Missile to the Moon','Two escaped convicts are found hiding in a rocketship built by a renegade inventor, who forces them to become the crew for a trip to the Moon. Also on board, as inadvertent stowaways, are his assistant and his secretary; and none of them are aware that the inventor is actually a Lunarian explorer sent to Earth by the dying Lunar civilization and the only remaining male member of that civilization.','/voOLnn1a1XFyfAAiOwbyuW0Ac8C.jpg','1958-11-15',78,'Released','Lunar She-Devils Lure Earthmen Into Their Lair of Doom!','Missile to the Moon',43120,2.0941,3.7,'EHh3gq-MJyo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3852,_binary '\0','/l6EvqBOrU2fitXyodw4mINFWQSg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053084',6.9,10289,'en','The Mouse That Roared','The Duchy of Grand Fenwick decides that the only way to get out of their economic woes is to declare war on the United States, lose and accept foreign aid. They send an invasion force (in chain mail, armed with bows and arrows) to New York and they arrive during a nuclear drill that has cleared the streets.','/dHSIXGVmLHsPeWdfyVe8J1eZCFS.jpg','1959-07-17',83,'Released','They\'re taking over the country in an invasion of laughs!','The Mouse That Roared',12649,3.8001,6.4,'p7L7WLFBYR4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3853,_binary '\0','/vnRmAak09fX10KGG82blVhBZDHl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053085',6.6,12974,'en','The Mummy','One by one the archaeologists who discover the 4,000-year-old tomb of Princess Ananka are brutally murdered. Kharis, high priest in Egypt 40 centuries ago, has been brought to life by the power of the ancient gods and his sole purpose is to destroy those responsible for the desecration of the sacred tomb. But Isobel, wife of one of the explorers, resembles the beautiful princess, forcing the speechless and tormented monster to defy commands and abduct Isobel to an unknown fate.','/w3XEtgi8W9tuPQnLVFCPVxtweyC.jpg','1959-08-01',88,'Released','Torn from the tomb to terrify the world!','The Mummy',18990,2.7594,6.7,'nTnkLTRR6v8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3854,_binary '\0','/e7F80oQLrFS7kkSXad4eyMIleqw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053103',4.3,1368,'en','Battle Beyond the Sun','English-dubbed and re-edited version of the 1959 Soviet film Nebo Zovyot. Acquired by Roger Corman and reworked by a young Francis Ford Coppola, the film relocates its Cold War “space race” to a fictional future where rival nations—North Hemis and South Hemis—compete to reach Mars first. When one crew’s mission goes awry, their rivals risk their own flight to attempt a daring rescue nearthe Martian moons, where strange cosmic dangers await.','/uJUnkGIH74faI0hiq6D05lKkw53.jpg','1959-09-12',69,'Released','The GIGANTIC battle! Which race will win...and rule the universe?','Battle Beyond the Sun',72838,2.3549,4.4,'LkMVt1JL450','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3855,_binary '\0','/w5v52YJtol2h0KXCZzSt6Y18loA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053106',7.8,4960,'ru','Неотправленное письмо','Four geologists are searching for diamonds in the wilderness of Siberia. After a long and tiresome journey they manage to find their luck and put the diamond mine on the map. The map must be delivered back to Moscow. But on the day of their departure a terrible forest fire wreaks havoc, and the geologists get trapped in the woods.','/eBIEgVI4uMzJGvEtwS31YtgEqTP.jpg','1960-06-27',97,'Released',NULL,'Letter Never Sent',83539,2.2022,7.2,'Pks6wk-e_CY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3856,_binary '\0','/lmlfBM23b1zgLmSJTswRGZwm1km.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053108',5.8,3761,'en','Never So Few','A U.S. military troop takes command of a band of Burmese guerillas during World War II.','/5TzI4sDBPscxeq2SNcM8GZEL0Mh.jpg','1959-12-07',125,'Released','Kiss by kiss the time ran out and never so few were the moments left for love!','Never So Few',4820,3.7824,5.5,'3eNLWO6LFKc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3857,_binary '\0','/d9IXxTrra12erdjVXoWUhuTVzTH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053114',8.5,11705,'ja','人間の條件 第１部純愛篇／第２部激怒篇','After handing in a report on the treatment of Chinese colonial labor, Kaji is offered the post of labour chief at a large mining operation in Manchuria, which also grants him exemption from military service. He accepts and moves with his newlywed wife Michiko, but when he tries to put his ideas of more humane treatment into practice, he finds himself at odds with scheming officials, cruel foremen, and the military police.','/q7godavx5XEbeVxEeqi4pmiOKdI.jpg','1959-01-15',204,'Released','The Immortal Story.','The Human Condition I: No Greater Love',31217,5.8559,8.136,'p4qufXQSfzY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3858,_binary '\0','/4zNC1BtW9uyOKCjbtMZmtu5oGrt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053115',8.5,9353,'ja','人間の條件 第３部望郷篇／第４部戦雲篇','Kaji, sent to the Japanese army labeled Red, witnesses cruelties in the army and revolts against the abusive treatment against a fellow recruit. He also sees his friend Shinjô defecting to the Russian border, and he ends in the front to fight a lost battle against the Russian tanks division.','/7jfv1C4t06VGenQxf3HbmLVmUHZ.jpg','1959-11-20',178,'Released','The second one','The Human Condition II: Road to Eternity',34528,5.3084,8.204,'VXyGpgNkBG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3859,_binary '\0','/6iAYMEk83D4XCFZ7ZF9NtCY7kDa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053121',7.9,5972,'ja','野火','In the closing days of WWII, a Japanese soldier afflicted with tuberculosis is abandoned by his company and left to wander the Philippine island of Leyte.','/zSCyy8GcJ1UCNGA8G5osYbZB7OD.jpg','1959-11-03',105,'Released',NULL,'Fires on the Plain',31427,1.9065,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3860,_binary '\0','/OR8oloCZ3klJtB7Y0i8pSqWw5a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053125',8.2,371673,'en','North by Northwest','Advertising man Roger Thornhill is mistaken for a spy, triggering a deadly cross-country chase.','/kNOFPQrel9YFCVzI0DF8FnCEpCw.jpg','1959-08-06',137,'Released','It\'s a deadly game of \"tag\" and Cary Grant is \"it\"!','North by Northwest',213,12.2274,7.961,'P6ftFG7xC4M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3861,_binary '\0','/eQFss51YLL1uUBHESjjidGU74A2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053126',7.1,3495,'en','North West Frontier','In the rebellious northern frontier province of colonial India, British Army Captain Scott, a young prince and the boy\'s governess escape by an obsolete train as they are relentlessly pursued by Muslim rebels intent on assassinating the prince.','/jjjmsCtXVz2vI03se29DPNjf6ZP.jpg','1959-10-13',129,'Released','Two people trapped by fate. In a country with no destiny.','North West Frontier',58902,2.5533,6.836,'hqUOId1Yeeo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3862,_binary '\0','/nHcXQKWnnk7VEAg9WbGjL3OpZXG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053131',7.5,12854,'en','The Nun\'s Story','After leaving a wealthy Belgian family to become a nun, Sister Luke struggles with her devotion to her vows during crisis, disappointment, and World War II.','/4vNWFhPyjTehPpZsvTnTywwXSiF.jpg','1959-06-18',151,'Released','From the very beginning, she was not like the others...','The Nun\'s Story',27029,5.2601,7.2,'k94PTF2VMj0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3863,_binary '\0','/qv3mfd6j92uDQC6Ss9dROczM45E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053133',7.4,6466,'en','Odds Against Tomorrow','An old-time crook plans a heist. When one of his two partners is found out to be a black man tensions flare.','/z5941aC7ttyY2gUfyKZfXVq11Sg.jpg','1959-10-15',96,'Released','He knew where $50,000 lay begging to be STOLEN!','Odds Against Tomorrow',26983,2.5599,6.9,'eYkvH-UWQec','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3864,_binary '\0','/qH9wiXnx9mU9kNGCH1exaey9CqU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053134',7.8,12690,'ja','お早よう','Two boys beg their parents for a television set, nagging them until all patience is lost. The parents order the boys to be quiet and the boys do exactly that--refusing to utter a word. The boys\' silence ultimately puts the whole neighborhood into turmoil.','/dXy2LFsE0VlHlHJU3SLBdJgrzEq.jpg','1959-05-12',94,'Released','Important things are hard to say.','Good Morning',28276,3.2721,7.7,'G1As9j2Lmig','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3865,_binary '\0','/kiRjFt3UYI8j75h7JVlvz0jM1NM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053137',7.1,16381,'en','On the Beach','In 1964, atomic war wipes out humanity in the northern hemisphere; one American submarine finds temporary safe haven in Australia, where life-as-usual covers growing despair. In denial about the loss of his wife and children in the holocaust, American Captain Towers meets careworn but gorgeous Moira Davidson, who begins to fall for him. The sub returns after reconnaissance a month (or less) before the end; will Towers and Moira find comfort with each other?','/lTDuj5zalrI0fpQel7UfPHTexTK.jpg','1959-12-17',134,'Released','The Biggest Story of Our Time!','On the Beach',35412,4.6075,6.7,'8gITuHT2B28','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3866,_binary '\0','/omMa8BHw4S5da4D69GjvVZ9oObG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053143',7.2,17847,'en','Operation Petticoat','A World War II submarine commander finds himself stuck with a damaged sub, a con-man executive officer, and a group of army nurses.','/pIsm8JvpFZidVxKexv5UgoCjwpZ.jpg','1959-12-05',124,'Released','20,000 laughs under the sea!','Operation Petticoat',9660,4.4299,7.2,'XyTWmH27oAs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3867,_binary '\0','/mXHZJu6wmmNIhbidSMp24PQ3WNw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053146',7.4,13636,'pt','Orfeu Negro','Young lovers Orfeu and Eurydice run through the favelas of Rio during Carnaval, on the lam from a hitman dressed like Death and Orfeu\'s vengeful fiancée Mira and passing between moments of fantasy and stark reality. This impressionistic retelling of the Greek legend of Orpheus and Eurydice introduced bossa nova to the world with its soundtrack by young Brazilian composers Luiz Bonfá and Antonio Carlos Jobim.','/fJWzdNRnfjcJuaZiKqaSURFV6Lg.jpg','1959-06-12',100,'Released','The film that introduced Bossa Nova to the world...','Black Orpheus',40423,3.4178,7,'kKtUEpopu6A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3868,_binary '\0','/5ApVROxPul7vu9NiB2DJWqlA3kE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053168',7.5,27836,'fr','Pickpocket','Michel takes up pickpocketing on a lark and is arrested soon after. His mother dies shortly after his release, and despite the objections of his only friend, Jacques, and his mother\'s neighbor Jeanne, Michel teams up with a couple of petty thieves in order to improve his craft. With a police inspector keeping an eye on him, Michel also tries to get a straight job, but the temptation to steal is hard to resist.','/szulf6uQyZp0QPVOvzavETdVYXI.jpg','1959-12-16',75,'Released','To reach you at last, what a strange path I had to take.','Pickpocket',690,5.8716,7.272,'TyCTOHA4ejA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3869,_binary '\0','/cPDMOeafVmyguVlwE4ls6HER021.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053172',7.4,21238,'en','Pillow Talk','Playboy songwriter Brad Allen\'s succession of romances annoys his neighbor, interior designer Jan Morrow, who shares a telephone party line with him and hears all his breezy routines. After Jan unsuccessfully lodges a complaint against him, Brad sets about to seduce her in the guise of a sincere and upstanding Texas rancher. When mutual friend Jonathan discovers that his best friend is moving in on the girl he desires, however, sparks fly.','/ugvyj5nl9QmTYuaGUTefVYBDePE.jpg','1959-10-07',102,'Released','...It\'s What Goes On When The Lights Go Off!','Pillow Talk',4952,4.5708,7.1,'aXakDxLdN2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3870,_binary '\0','/czSP7QBKITtqndHM1IbMa0X74WM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053176',7.7,4109,'pl','Pociąg','Two strangers, Jerzy and Marta, accidentally end up holding tickets for the same sleeping chamber on an overnight train to the Baltic Sea coast. Also on board is Marta\'s spurned lover, who will not leave her alone. When the police enter the train in search of a murderer on the lam, rumors fly and everything seems to point toward one of the main characters as the culprit.','/vbHhJBNp80uZSUOqJMtGgewzPVt.jpg','1959-09-06',97,'Released',NULL,'Night Train',38898,2.1451,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3871,_binary '\0','/hFaFE7EpKTnjG3LDhoV40gd9vsU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053182',6.9,2130,'en','Porgy and Bess','In the early 1900s, the fictional Catfish Row section of Charleston, South Carolina serves as home to a black fishing community. Crippled beggar Porgy, who travels about in a goat-drawn cart, loves the drug-addicted Bess, who lives with stevedore Crown, the local bully.','/g4zwlj8bgRYsUoF0VEwPEgldCvn.jpg','1959-06-24',138,'Released','The Goldwyn Touch!...more dramatic than ever before!','Porgy and Bess',1940,1.9125,6.3,'Fk5D9C92zOw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3872,_binary '\0','/ceB7vL3GOtB3rfA88OhQiCbtABf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053183',7,5906,'en','Pork Chop Hill','Korean War, April 1953. Lieutenant Clemons, leader of the King company of the United States Infantry, is ordered to recapture Pork Chop Hill, occupied by a powerful Chinese Army force, while, just seventy miles away, at nearby the village of Panmunjom, a tense cease-fire conference is celebrated.','/88LF3thfIx1BDqa5aErseoFXz58.jpg','1959-05-29',98,'Released','Bold! Blunt! Blistering! The battle picture without equal!','Pork Chop Hill',37305,3.1154,6.7,'XPaEECzwUxI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3873,_binary '\0','/cy7ymUaMEWRoig7LWXpfzaaw2vv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053198',8,135538,'fr','Les Quatre Cents Coups','For young Parisian boy Antoine Doinel, life is one difficult situation after another. Surrounded by inconsiderate adults, including his neglectful parents, Antoine spends his days with his best friend, Rene, trying to plan for a better life. When one of their schemes goes awry, Antoine ends up in trouble with the law, leading to even more conflicts with unsympathetic authority figures.','/12PuU23kkDLvTd0nb8hMlE3oShB.jpg','1959-06-03',99,'Released','Angel faces hell-bent for violence.','The 400 Blows',147,11.7418,8,'ICGZfU-9Yl0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3874,_binary '\0','/50SrfUT73FZNO81pESkLexx8E8W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053219',5.7,5756,'en','Return of the Fly','Fifteen years after his father\'s experiments with matter transmission fail, Philippe Delambre and his uncle François attempt to create a matter transmission device on their own. However, their experiments have disastrous results, turning Philippe into a horrible half-man, half-fly creature.','/a6w010kxAZfr0wsW7OiZgvkMwtN.jpg','1959-07-22',80,'Released','Out of the World of Atomic Mutation It Rises - With the Dread Curse of the Father Upon It!','Return of the Fly',38126,2.5431,6.088,'R9v_5IEHPVY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3875,_binary '\0','/5UiC1NvHMH4YVCc88hSwrfZRSSl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053220',7.1,7707,'en','Ride Lonesome','On the way to pick up the bounty on a wanted murderer, a bounty hunter stops at a staging post where he is forced to continue his journey with two outlaws who want the murderer for their own reasons and a recently-widowed woman, with the murderer\'s brother and his men in hot pursuit.','/4fQW6hAFW0YrQXrDUaMweNI1SgQ.jpg','1959-02-01',73,'Released','Scorching lead-hot action all the way!','Ride Lonesome',27644,3.7694,6.7,'BsIaOss2olo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3876,_binary '\0','/38uM6QuI06znUCELfOSiVQy05CX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053221',7.9,74441,'en','Rio Bravo','A small-town sheriff in the American West enlists the help of a disabled man, a drunk, and a young gunfighter in his efforts to hold in jail the brother of the local bad guy.','/4gI4KKmoi0d3yfsF71YU3S0I5t8.jpg','1959-03-08',141,'Released','They fought back to back... No quarter given... No quarter asked... No way in... No way out... of Rio Bravo!','Rio Bravo',301,8.7852,7.8,'VD55fwjvJlw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3877,_binary '\0','/3U5CUwhmJuPzWxlOfiIoJqy6dgi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053226',7.5,8348,'en','Room at the Top','An ambitious young accountant schemes to wed a wealthy factory owner\'s daughter, despite falling in love with a married older woman.','/uuyruoqh7oBtjwN1mJyOF04CPjO.jpg','1958-12-29',115,'Released','A savage story of lust and ambition','Room at the Top',43103,3.0635,6.9,'JPFod38mlNc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3878,_binary '\0','/c3knJX6oIeO1tn1xlBt3IEQQj80.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053232',3.8,1440,'en','Rymdinvasion i Lappland','After a herd of reindeer are mysteriously found dead following a meteor crash in a remote part of Lapland in northern Sweden, soldiers and a geologist are called out to investigate.','/hGeJgZbPa50BG1lBExpTuS0M1C5.jpg','1959-08-19',73,'Released','Monsters Walk the Earth in Ravishing Rampage of Clawing Fury! Could It Happen? See and Decide for Yourself!','Terror in the Midnight Sun',38946,1.6996,4,'UZ-9hyOkbaI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3879,_binary '\0','/txk2P5mAstpPgZaRUI0WzIQiUVo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053240',4.5,1713,'ru','Сампо','Based on Finnish mythology; Lemminkäinen woos the fair Annikki and battles the evil witch Louhi. Louhi kidnaps Annikki to compel her brother to build for her a Sampo, a magical device that creates salt, grain, and gold. When Lemminkäinen fails to recover the Sampo, Louhi steals the sun, plunging the world into frozen darkness.','/w8rSQPlqNv8W5TzvdEgfQJW15Xz.jpg','1959-08-24',90,'Released',NULL,'Sampo',155399,2.321,4.6,'dQIIto2Q1ng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3880,_binary '\0','/eQQ0JokxpSbEN0QDeeishIYYM5k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053241',2.8,5403,'es','Santa Claus','Pitch, the mean-spirited devil, is trying to ruin Christmas. Santa Claus teams up with Merlin the Magician and the children of the world in order to save the day!','/4wI91ojyHnUaNJzYlaFRuhqkRCh.jpg','1959-11-26',94,'Released','Better Than a Visit from Saint Nick Himself!','Santa Claus',13383,2.5367,6.8,'_OYs4meJULM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3881,_binary '\0','/91RLpimgi5P2LOTKO787BkQ9tHJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053242',7.2,3051,'en','Sapphire','Two Scotland Yard detectives investigate the murder of a young woman of mixed race who had been passing for white. As they interview a spate of suspects -- including the girl\'s white boyfriend and his disapproving parents -- the detectives wade through a stubbornly entrenched sludge of racism and bigotry.','/TFilAv8be5yzA39kRANTsIsbmb.jpg','1959-11-02',92,'Released','The sensational story of a girl who didn\'t belong.','Sapphire',64291,3.3138,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3882,_binary '\0','/ufRrfxkwMy52dK2eo5X3hmyzBZK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053244',6.8,2140,'en','The Savage Innocents','An Eskimo who has had little contact with white men goes to a trading post where he accidentally kills a missionary and finds himself being pursued by the police.','/9zWw2SCxCygE9tGs8wMuwb9Fws.jpg','1960-03-20',110,'Released','Savage, sensational drama in this fantastic adventure!','The Savage Innocents',94393,2.3667,6.9,'_sOy7CMR88A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3883,_binary '\0','/6Ar0M4EqFT4ay4TJF4a9yWG9kKy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053247',6.8,2807,'en','The Scapegoat','An Englishman in France unwittingly is placed into the identity, and steps into the vacated life, of a look-alike French nobleman.','/cWtYyQ9U0k5aDwaQKAxrLHoIXWX.jpg','1959-08-06',92,'Released','He took another man\'s name... lived another man\'s life... loved another man\'s woman!','The Scapegoat',126919,2.2318,6.8,'9g0rFRLv_IQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3884,_binary '\0','/A1S23XMWNbDw8gjtGSPkipDjYml.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053250',4.7,3692,'de','Der schweigende Stern','A mysterious magnetic spool found during a construction project is discovered to have originated from Venus. A rocket expedition to Venus is launched to discover the origin of the spool and the race that created it.','/AtlXBkaPMTSvAt406qafZUqw43f.jpg','1960-02-26',93,'Released','You are there … on man’s most incredible journey!','The Silent Star',17938,1.6898,4.9,'5sFZo-Pc52I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3885,_binary '\0','/hSrs1DQNhASDDksXeL8QrD4QgYk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053258',6.4,1960,'ru','Сегодня увольнения не будет...','Soldiers undertake the perilous task of removing a stockpile of World War II bombshells discovered during roadworks under the ground of a small village.','/ojihzqLoTVjzUWHwYu1PkETP6Hs.jpg','1959-05-09',46,'Released',NULL,'There Will Be No Leave Today',45590,0.7735,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3886,_binary '\0','/vBywNMAiQTNn3PxlOWslgYcwcpN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053270',7.2,13717,'en','Shadows','The relationship between Lelia, a light-skinned black woman, and Tony, a white man is put in jeopardy when Tony meets Lelia’s darker-skinned jazz singer brother, Hugh, and discovers that her racial heritage is not what he thought it was.','/zR1gHOGVruoROCdHS7Tc5TSZqED.jpg','1960-10-14',87,'Released','A film not to be missed.','Shadows',15484,2.5159,6.9,'_4Fjpx5kxzs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3887,_binary '\0','/zophxMqVXw2yiuJJyjC4RHn1bnw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053271',6.4,6155,'en','The Shaggy Dog','Through an ancient spell, a boy changes into a sheepdog and back again. It seems to happen at inopportune times and the spell can only be broken by an act of bravery....','/x0fTvnnRIZNyTne2BrcS8I5X20e.jpg','1959-03-19',104,'Released','\"I was a Teen-age boy!\"','The Shaggy Dog',15944,2.2343,6.2,'TiJOBf9WKBA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3888,_binary '\0','/yfyU7F2RDKxWOIACnGKmF32rALG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053272',7,1820,'en','Shake Hands with the Devil','In 1921 Dublin, the IRA battles the \"Black & Tans,\" special British forces given to harsh measures. Irish-American medical student Kerry O\'Shea hopes to stay aloof, but saving a wounded friend gets him outlawed, and inexorably drawn into the rebel organization by his former professor Sean Lenihan, who has \"shaken hands with the devil\" and begun to think of fighting as an end in itself. Complications arise when Kerry falls for a beautiful English hostage, and the British offer a peace treaty that is not enough to satisfy Lenihan.','/2jN4KfZK0XX8q58PeRp4XQP4Cv4.jpg','1959-06-24',111,'Released','A story of love and hate...and the sudden sound of guns!','Shake Hands with the Devil',51947,2.1992,6.5,'a-ayA5BDA6g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3889,_binary '\0','/fNJrIhjpfi8qbePVEcsjMtzvXFz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053279',7.2,2599,'fr','Le Signe du Lion','An American in Paris lives by sponging off his working friends, and throws a party using borrowed money when his rich American aunt dies, believing firmly in his horoscope.','/b5jY3jyISYMY0ReGjqtbgaPq7dr.jpg','1962-05-03',103,'Released',NULL,'Sign of the Lion',64414,2.1552,7,'LTxNai5hxzY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3890,_binary '\0','/me67dwJnUBt3O9NqZaBdEQ6i4vM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053285',7.2,172801,'en','Sleeping Beauty','Cursed to die by the evil fairy Maleficent when she was a baby, Princess Aurora is sent into hiding under protection from three good fairies. As she grows up far away, Maleficent becomes increasingly determined to seal the princess\'s fate.','/pO9YMLSmj3essVSWSGygjGxX6Kw.jpg','1959-02-17',75,'Released','Awaken to a World of Wonders!','Sleeping Beauty',10882,21.7244,6.9,'CfsyUyi_FJM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3891,_binary '\0','/mB0p1RSFkF1Cr6iIRo5PwhYsoQZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053290',6.2,4500,'en','Solomon and Sheba','Near death, King David has a vision that his poet son, Solomon, should succeed him, rather than hot-headed Adonijah. Furious, Adonijah departs the court, swearing he will become king. Other rulers are concerned that Solomon\'s benevolent rule and interest in monotheism will threaten their tyrannical, polytheistic kingdoms. The Queen of Sheba makes an agreement with the Egyptian pharaoh to corrupt Solomon for their mutual benefit.','/sQPLRT014vOADFyvh54TpXFyBPZ.jpg','1959-10-27',139,'Released','Only once in 3000 years... anything like...','Solomon and Sheba',29996,4.0846,6.463,'5aUfjOGvsLU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3892,_binary '\0','/sv2VnbZmgy2rkrtkA2nz7rzH0VK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053291',8.2,307402,'en','Some Like It Hot','In Prohibition-era Chicago, musicians Joe and Jerry witness a mob hit, and flee the state in an all-female band disguised as Josephine and Daphne, but further complications set in.','/hVIKyTK13AvOGv7ICmJjK44DTzp.jpg','1959-03-19',123,'Released','The movie too HOT for words!','Some Like It Hot',239,15.7564,8.078,'97TYs2YXbJw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3893,_binary '\0','/6mhdyuGaSaqUpmg2Wv48ZpKlT6A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053317',7.9,4301,'ru','Судьба человека','The story of a man whose life was ruthlessly crippled by World War II. His wife and daughters were killed during the bombing of his village, he spent some time as a prisoner, and his only son was killed in action only a few days before the victory...','/10WCdk4KSQcQmG4iW87NOor9jvD.jpg','1959-04-12',103,'Released',NULL,'Fate of a Man',88564,1.9203,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3894,_binary '\0','/pMIIOovLyyCr8W5JFOqsSO8gK1r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053318',7.4,19344,'en','Suddenly, Last Summer','The only son of wealthy widow Violet Venable dies while on vacation with his cousin Catherine. What the girl saw was so horrible that she went insane; now Mrs. Venable wants Catherine lobotomized to cover up the truth.','/igma0zn9J5srRvOMDRnxyUDQXJL.jpg','1959-12-22',114,'Released','Suddenly, last summer, Cathy knew she was being used for something evil!','Suddenly, Last Summer',14698,3.9018,7.3,'sHAkalCkrLM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3895,_binary '\0','/5fAsggYDgaBFxZ5YoJaWIK65LGH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053320',6.9,4346,'en','A Summer Place','A self-made businessman rekindles a romance with a former flame while their two teenage children begin a romance of their own with drastic consequences for both couples.','/escHRIldvNphvBnxMcn6ybaJId0.jpg','1959-11-18',130,'Released','The Inn... The Guests... The Sensations...','A Summer Place',18904,2.6548,6.6,'xJD1NUEPQis','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3896,_binary '\0','/h13LF4nikFyrVQ7x8WGZe1ZTt01.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053334',6.4,1643,'en','Tarzan\'s Greatest Adventure','The greatest adventure of jungle king Tarzan. Four British villains raid a settlement to obtain explosives for use in a diamond mine. In doing so they nearly destroy the settlement, so Tarzan pursues them to their mine.','/5wD8bHOKqBRoK7Mgj8aIA4NzENa.jpg','1959-06-17',88,'Released','Adventure\'s Mightiest Hero Lives His Mightiest Adventure!','Tarzan\'s Greatest Adventure',43205,2.3919,5.4,'e7abPMBc7Is','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3897,_binary '\0','/kkOZz1mNVvZSrRzc02gaE2lPxX7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053337',3.9,4218,'en','Teenagers from Outer Space','A young alien falls for a pretty teenage Earth girl and they team up to try to stop the plans of his invading cohorts, who intend to use Earth as a food-breeding ground for giant lobsters from their planet.','/i3T50v0ZNJFyVOpRdEhc41fFV6f.jpg','1959-06-01',86,'Released','Thrill-crazed space kids blasting the flesh off humans!','Teenagers from Outer Space',35139,1.4396,4.1,'dQYlvwp6Ip0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3898,_binary '\0','/s7bwHnUuc2ThRCSIebDR3rZgYgO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053341',6.5,1442,'en','Ten Seconds to Hell','Two rivals from a German bomb squad are left to deactivate duds in postwar Berlin.','/q46iDVM4WZl4ZLGEf7tSjLHiUL9.jpg','1959-04-23',93,'Released','BLOCKBUSTER ABOUT TO EXPLODE!','Ten Seconds to Hell',32070,2.6576,6.2,'5ws7kzft5mU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3899,_binary '\0','/6hObqW3SO5vzPVRsPwrx3hYZljc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053348',6.5,1440,'fr','Le Testament du docteur Cordelier','Dr. Cordelier, living in a suburb of Paris, withdraws from society to pursue research into the functioning of the human brain. His lifelong friend, Maître Joly, becomes concerned when Cordelier draws up a will that bequeaths his entire estate to a stranger, Monsieur Opale; he cannot understand why Cordelier defends him, considering Opale attacks women and children. After a colleague is killed, Joly confronts Cordelier and discovers the truth behind his friend\'s behavior.','/9Rlm1ynzU39TGKHdjvGziLVBSWg.jpg','1960-07-04',95,'Released',NULL,'Experiment in Evil',3026,2.3154,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3900,_binary '\0','/zCCvB5RWCteDCwCoSCjVV4QOLas.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053351',6.4,2710,'en','They Came to Cordura','An army major, himself guilty of cowardice, is asked to recommended soldiers for the Congressional Medal of Honor during the Mexican Border Incursion of 1916.','/bSlfgWxfQzc49yl76UJPBySZVeF.jpg','1959-06-01',123,'Released','Slashing story of a desert warrior who fought his way from HELL to GLORY!','They Came to Cordura',46884,2.4669,6.6,'rGskUITA15o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3901,_binary '\0','/qgBYGZXxiEdGeSrMbTmoeKPr1hG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053352',7,1455,'en','Third Man on the Mountain','Famous British mountaineer Winter wants to climb a difficult summit, the Citadel. He goes to a small village but no guide wants to accompany him. A young man from the village, Rudi Matt, whose father died fifteen years earlier during an attempt to climb the Citadel, is determined to accompany him, with the help of his uncle. Winter also manages to hire a guide from a neighboring village and competitor, Emil Saxo. The roped party of four men then begins the ascent of the still untouched summit.','/rktn8yDe4yqTUiVObuePK89epmI.jpg','1959-11-10',105,'Released','Conquering the past would be the climb of his life','Third Man on the Mountain',64867,2.738,6.8,'dRac_oINFeg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3902,_binary '\0','/b0ZWbpNCgVopS59K9PLarxgCWOh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053354',6.6,2734,'en','The 39 Steps','In London, a diplomat accidentally becomes involved in the death of a British agent who\'s after a spy ring that covets British military secrets.','/4W6uCqZK8X2JSmq3iD5sboJO8XP.jpg','1959-03-13',93,'Released','The Most Suspenseful Manhunt in History!','The 39 Steps',25386,1.9868,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3903,_binary '\0','/sWihYx3jorE6q0v81gccVFt6PDO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053361',7.4,3682,'en','Tiger Bay','In Tiger Bay, the docklands of Cardiff, street urchin Gillie witnesses the brutal murder of a young woman. Instead of reporting the crime, she merely pockets a prize for herself — the perpetrator\'s shiny black revolver — and flees. When Detective Graham discovers that Gillie has the murder weapon, the fiery young girl weaves a web of lies to throw him off course.','/e0YIUi2UsXT0Q9MvDT5EWfVK3aq.jpg','1959-03-01',105,'Released','MURDER...enacted before the eyes of a little girl. She alone has the proof the police are searching for.','Tiger Bay',43112,1.669,7.2,'dsrBfES_LBo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3904,_binary '\0','/1IdrA9gdSkiLo5NJgA5RKK4vXF8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053363',6.6,10720,'en','The Tingler','A pathologist experiments with a deaf-mute woman who is unable to scream to prove that humans die of fright due to an organism he names The Tingler that lives within each person on the spinal cord and is suppressed only when people scream when scared.','/jDuKIccxR0lsdWlYuWiu03hkwnN.jpg','1959-07-29',82,'Released','Ghastly Beyond Belief!','The Tingler',26857,2.7401,6.358,'5NvfUFHJk_M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3905,_binary '\0','/aPuWkZFQEZKLxFvhrTRGNwfFuE0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053388',5.6,1873,'ja','宇宙大戦争','In 1965, the space station JSS-3 is destroyed by a fleet of UFOs, which then begin a global siege on Earth, using rays to manipulate gravity and control the minds of men. In response, a global council meeting is held to determine the source of the attacks and prepare a rocket ship armada for a counter-attack, a true battle in outer space. . . The film is a sequel of sorts to Toho\'s THE MYSTERIANS in the reprise of the Etsuko Shiraishi character of that film as its heroine. It was edited to 74 minutes for its American release.','/dKAqyu8aiYlnmAHzOzJt69B6m20.jpg','1959-12-26',90,'Released','Will the Earth be reduced to space dust? A giant battle unfolds on the other side of the moon!','Battle in Outer Space',62472,2.0783,5.9,'0w3IYoCDUGs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3906,_binary '\0','/o7l1P351p4gh9dTlcQy1xB8NL8H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053390',7.9,9890,'ja','浮草','A theater troupe master\'s visit with his old flame unintentionally sets off a chain of unexpected events with devastating consequences.','/nLepKtb48XSnPQNsuS4svbtNBY7.jpg','1959-11-17',115,'Released',NULL,'Floating Weeds',46918,2.3852,7.5,'bHpVeD9kJEI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3907,_binary '\0','/z2FgyLq9sL3K6xBSEnwKZRM7ANE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053399',6.4,2427,'en','Up Periscope','Lieutenant Braden discovers that Sally, the woman he\'s been falling in love with, has actually been checking out his qualifications to be a U.S. Navy frogman. He must put his personal life behind him after being assigned to be smuggled into a Japanese-held island via submarine to photograph radio codes.','/1t0Zo7y4L7PSJV1T5K5JM8HFQqw.jpg','1959-03-04',112,'Released','The man they called the \'human torpedo\' - the secret underwater marauder who hit like no man hit before!','Up Periscope',18146,2.3872,6.2,'vWF4ZTBZHoA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3908,_binary '\0','/x0C7IMKq7CfD2juh5kUYaYzEiD6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053403',7.1,1916,'fr','La Vache et le Prisonnier','In 1942, a French prisonner of war in Germany decide to escape to France using a cow hold by a lunge as a decoy. He cross all Germany in this way.','/sCEi2m7WHREw2UTXOq8e211BYC5.jpg','1959-12-16',118,'Released',NULL,'The Cow and I',58736,2.6034,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3909,_binary '\0','/zE70BNCMSfjZ7hUsZaEHxj8PPPO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053434',7.1,7838,'en','Warlock','A band of murderous cowboys has imposed a reign of terror on the town of Warlock. With the sheriff humiliatingly run out of town, the residents hire the services of Clay Blaisedell as de facto town marshal. He arrives along with his friend, Tom Morgan, and sets about restoring law and order on his own terms whilst also overseeing the establishment of a gambling house and saloon.','/7jaa3s42MJ1s37c4Fl6cnOqCbpL.jpg','1959-05-15',122,'Released','Wherever you\'ve been ... Whatever you\'ve seen ... You\'ve never run into anything like Warlock.','Warlock',37412,4.2239,6.764,'qgLUMPjuHy4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3910,_binary '\0','/lkGhuh95uQdZsOq93ICGp5Vqedj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053441',6.5,1754,'en','Westbound','As the Civil War spills our nation’s blood, Capt. John Hayes fights on a vital but little-known battlefront. He aims to ship gold to Union banks through a small Colorado town, defying Southern sympathizers who aim to stop him at any cost.','/ik2DvCkFwyRX3iIeYcuCuNpNAiy.jpg','1959-04-25',69,'Released','Hellbound for Vengeance for the Flaming Redhead Who Betrayed Him!','Westbound',110139,1.7868,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3911,_binary '\0','/92eThgy2ppUPdqzOiRADCyyw9os.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053453',6.1,2608,'en','The Wonderful Country','Having fled to Mexico from the U.S. many years ago for killing his father\'s murderer, Martin Brady travels to Texas to broker an arms deal for his Mexican boss, strongman Governor Cipriano Castro. Brady breaks a leg and while recuperating in Texas the gun shipment is stolen. Complicating matters further the wife of local army major Colton has designs on him, and the local Texas Ranger captain makes him a generous offer to come back to the states and join his outfit. After killing a man in self-defense, Brady slips back over the border and confronts Castro who is not only unhappy that Brady has lost his gun shipment but is about to join forces with Colton to battle the local raiding Apache Indians.','/nS12kvSCEEp6SCi3TU6Hk5bRjo2.jpg','1959-10-21',98,'Released','A Face...A Man...A Motion Picture as Proud and Violent as Tom Lea\'s Bold and Powerful Novel!','The Wonderful Country',6610,2.6065,6.1,'wp8jeH_Du-A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3912,_binary '\0','/7l9Qn4nm8WFObVwBCyhfbwc2H59.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053454',6.8,4046,'en','The World, the Flesh and the Devil','Ralph Burton is a miner who is trapped for several days as a result of a cave-in. When he finally manages to dig himself out, he realizes that all of mankind seems to have been destroyed in a nuclear holocaust. He travels to New York City only to find it deserted. Making a life for himself there, he is flabbergasted to eventually find Sarah Crandall, who also managed to survive. Together, they form a close friendship until the arrival of Benson Thacker who has managed to pilot his small boat into the city\'s harbor. At this point, tensions rise between the three, particularly between Thacker, who is white, and Burton, who is black.','/uMB51OAkdrAx7r1dztvLub6RyPJ.jpg','1959-05-01',95,'Released','The Most Unusual Story Ever Told!','The World, the Flesh and the Devil',4928,1.8761,6.4,'bOUBLJaVKNI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3913,_binary '\0','/uubaasvjOEhOrhvOoKN25CwPxMK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053455',6.7,3225,'en','The Wreck of the Mary Deare','A disgraced merchant marine officer elects to stay aboard his sinking cargo ship in order to prove the vessel was deliberately scuttled and, as a result, vindicate his good name.','/bRTOtFiKT9Uxxlf0cxKgyG1PD2v.jpg','1959-11-17',105,'Released','The Saga of the Derelict, Mary Deare... the strange secret she carried... the desperate voyage and plot to sink her!','The Wreck of the Mary Deare',114618,2.6749,6.3,'o4G2sTvByKE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3914,_binary '\0','/ikWhvI1IPbLTjKToJixMHMyHMSl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053457',6.6,1497,'en','Yellowstone Kelly','A fur-trapper named Kelly, who once saved the life of a Sioux chief, is allowed to set his traps in Sioux territory during the late 1870s. Reluctantly he takes on a tenderfoot assistant named Anse and together they give shelter to a runaway Arapaho woman. Tensions develop when Anse falls in love with this woman and when the Sioux chief arrives with his warriors to re-claim her.','/hrjzLXi1VpwUx3kvJ0sgQzlYUxE.jpg','1959-11-11',91,'Released','Clint\'s back!...and \'Kookie\' is with him!','Yellowstone Kelly',72160,2.1341,6.167,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3915,_binary '\0','/zD9u2lmJTp918Y3jpVWyAHRn4OK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053458',7.1,1537,'en','Yesterday\'s Enemy','Set during the Burma Campaign of World War 2, this is the story of courage and endurance of the soldiers struggling at close quarters against the enemy. The film examines the moral dilemmas ordinary men face during war, when the definitions of acceptable military action and insupportable brutality become blurred and distorted.','/piYJtlIlOFyDjui7j6NAuywNGbe.jpg','1959-09-10',95,'Released','War Is Hell!','Yesterday\'s Enemy',94135,1.8212,7.2,'mX0SN2Ozyzs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3916,_binary '\0','/wlqwUNYHMuswEdGo3nSZ9i0LIlc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053459',7.6,39702,'fr','Les Yeux sans visage','Dr. Génessier is riddled with guilt after an accident that he caused disfigures the face of his daughter, the once beautiful Christiane, who outsiders believe is dead. Dr. Génessier, along with accomplice and laboratory assistant Louise, kidnaps young women and brings them to the Génessier mansion. After rendering his victims unconscious, Dr. Génessier removes their faces and attempts to graft them on to Christiane\'s.','/8y7Z9Gvcq52uOlJlUWyn2epGGRd.jpg','1960-01-11',84,'Released','The horror film with a heart of mystery.','Eyes Without a Face',31417,4.3058,7.6,'CEjrg-L8lvs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3917,_binary '\0','/jxBhTw0cSYl3dzrq9hCnxCUakx8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053462',7.4,4679,'en','The Young Philadelphians','Up and coming young lawyer Anthony Lawrence faces several ethical and emotional dilemmas as he climbs the Philadelphia social ladder. His personal and professional skills are tested as he tries to balance the needs of his fiance Joan, the expectations of his colleagues and his own obligation to defend his friend Chester on a murder count.','/5OHKvcn4OukLHp8yC7E15mwGjIA.jpg','1959-05-21',136,'Released','Guilty secrets. Shocking scandals. All in a day\'s work for one Philadelphian lawyer.','The Young Philadelphians',43111,2.222,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3918,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053464',2.4,3209,'ja','遊星王子','Attracted by the report of the development of a new type of rocket fuel, the vicious dictator of Krangkor, the dark planet, descends on Earth to steal the formula from its creator, the benevolent Dr. Makin.','/3rBZdyPkaeReQ0vlwC02X6sPDiE.jpg','1959-05-19',85,'Released',NULL,'Prince of Space',62855,1.097,2.6,'SuvVjHbubOI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3919,_binary '\0','/4WGuyWf1f94CsEeVIIqDKGw5rmO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053472',7.6,96519,'fr','À bout de souffle','A small-time thief steals a car and impulsively murders a motorcycle policeman. Wanted by the authorities, he attempts to persuade a girl to run away to Italy with him.','/9Wx0Wdn2EOqeCZU4SP6tlS3LOml.jpg','1960-03-16',90,'Released','Wild! Violent! Outspoken and Honest!','Breathless',269,8.0733,7.481,'UoICuMPOWrk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3920,_binary '\0','/jrTSlvfg95kYZiQndKIFS4amCLo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053473',6.6,1569,'fr','À double tour','The mistress of the wealthy Henri Marcoux is murdered and the family accuses the milkman of committing the crime. But Marcoux\'s daughter\'s fiancé suspects that she may have been murdered by someone else.','/87jBHEVRI0GyYvD5avFpWPPKTtR.jpg','1959-12-04',110,'Released','An intruder in the life of a family...was she really guileless?','À double tour',45348,1.9375,5.8,'jVi2IffU5j8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3921,_binary '\0','/6AttKqN5x2aSUEAh39h8MojcTBe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053559',6.1,8406,'en','13 Ghosts','The reclusive Dr. Zorba has died and left his sprawling mansion to his nephew Cyrus and his family. They will need to search the house to find the doctor\'s fortune, but along with the property itself, they have also inherited the occultist\'s collection of thirteen ghosts.','/8CyQj2VIfmGzjvdoLwYLyT8h4YS.jpg','1960-05-16',85,'Released','IT\'S FUN TO BE SCARED BY 13 GHOSTS!','13 Ghosts',29756,2.6449,5.8,'XokuP7uN4kU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3922,_binary '\0','/uf43x1arSrcWiE7JtehOeFDSkJd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053570',7.6,1580,'it','Adua e le compagne','When a brothel closes because of new laws, four of the prostitutes decide to go into business running a restaurant. They discover they cannot escape their past.','/etamASh59bdUy6wyUGLxC03U28n.jpg','1960-09-16',125,'Released',NULL,'Adua and Her Friends',63070,2.4816,7.208,'96zLXzsNq74','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3923,_binary '\0','/giNH1VpVMhScuGgcsKnijUuHTjM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053571',6.2,1725,'en','The Adventures of Huckleberry Finn','From chicken thief to cabin boy, riverboat pilot to circus performer, Huck Finn outsmarts everyone on his way down the muddy Mississippi.','/l2bmntngk2bQyrWT7Z9CxMNE8fO.jpg','1960-07-21',107,'Released','The most exciting adventures a boy ever had! Hilarious escapades, hair-raising adventures on the fabulous Mississippi!','The Adventures of Huckleberry Finn',43041,2.2981,5.9,'a4UJ-K_ax9I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3924,_binary '\0','/5YLdFrhWMcGUsvH511tuRNW8KVb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053579',7.9,6811,'ja','秋日和','A woman and her daughter are each forced to contend with an increasing pressure to marry, particularly from three men who knew her late husband.','/3f2dNFbDBjrGBo2iCW57TO4XeyR.jpg','1960-11-13',128,'Released',NULL,'Late Autumn',21967,2.4077,7.714,'DXJr9ndHmXI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3925,_binary '\0','/leDO2O7HywKWZhk15feAQ3Gc37p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053580',6.8,19863,'en','The Alamo','The legendary true story of a small band of soldiers who sacrificed their lives in hopeless combat against a massive army in order to prevent a tyrant from smashing the new Republic of Texas.','/54KNQfJnYZwhI3sPYyjXtptWGfg.jpg','1960-10-23',202,'Released','The Mission That Became a Fortress! The Fortress That Became a Shrine!','The Alamo',11209,5.3239,7.076,'_y36swJUDD4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3926,_binary '\0','/4gpT7MxxzgglHHQCVhckHLgEJr3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053593',4.2,3019,'en','The Amazing Transparent Man','An ex-major forces a scientist to develop a invisibility formula, with which he plans to create an invisible army and sell it to the highest bidder. However there are side effects to the formula.','/aOME46GMTef0rkseEi4phAo4gRf.jpg','1960-02-01',57,'Released','Invisible and Deadly!','The Amazing Transparent Man',31634,1.8405,4,'9MBYh7gt_1g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3927,_binary '\0','/8REOD9flDR7KGNY3kFxqjSAhR9r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053598',3.3,1386,'it','Gli amori di Ercole','Hercules decides to avenge the death of his wife, murdered at the hands of Éurito, king of Ecalia, but everything is a plot of an ambitious courtier. Hercules ends up falling in love with Deyanira, who is now a good queen.','/4J1DNqn1wB8zxTuSnIRFRghIvKr.jpg','1960-08-19',98,'Released',NULL,'The Loves of Hercules',56147,1.9154,3.5,'VoG7b156ZJ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3928,_binary '\0','/cV6SGz5tS8JclRuANlUDmBd5GyA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053602',7.2,1745,'en','The Angry Silence','When the union in his factory walks out on strike, a family man refuses to participate, risking the wrath — and retaliation — of his fellow workers.','/hXQtp9KOgqisXO73WkjiRJnh9mE.jpg','1960-03-10',95,'Released','Rough, Tough, Deeply Moving','The Angry Silence',83995,1.5847,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3929,_binary '\0','/2L8U8rUyWeFTb6n1egTNeJsEsvj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053604',8.3,223084,'en','The Apartment','Bud Baxter is a minor clerk in a huge New York insurance company, until he discovers a quick way to climb the corporate ladder. He lends out his apartment to the executives as a place to take their mistresses. Although he often has to deal with the aftermath of their visits, one night he\'s left with a major problem to solve.','/hhSRt1KKfRT0yEhEtRW3qp31JFU.jpg','1960-06-21',126,'Released','Movie-wise, there has never been anything like it - laugh-wise, love-wise, or otherwise-wise!','The Apartment',284,10.2294,8.184,'OcslkrBMLGc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3930,_binary '\0','/z9yXcMBSq2UUBgM8h1V92sD7NZN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053611',3.8,5338,'en','Attack of the Giant Leeches','A backwoods game warden and a local doctor discover that giant leeches are responsible for disappearances and deaths in a local swamp, but the local police don\'t believe them.','/n3dAhWfWxsNQJ5ZUcn8Q3mW8EIP.jpg','1959-07-15',62,'Released','Massive Blood Sucking Monsters!','Attack of the Giant Leeches',22718,2.5047,4,'2uuO0m8ZHdg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3931,_binary '\0','/kF5AeKG5XIZkAXY0kRgm57qEbJI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053619',7.7,37441,'it','L\'avventura','Claudia and Anna join Anna\'s lover, Sandro, on a boat trip to a remote volcanic island. When Anna goes missing, a search is launched. In the meantime, Sandro and Claudia become involved in a romance despite Anna\'s disappearance, though the relationship suffers from guilt and tension.','/7kUXAS8K7Ihw1T1mhARjnLuMVk3.jpg','1960-09-14',144,'Released','A new adventure in filmmaking...','L\'Avventura',5165,4.0406,7.5,'N6ShLDfjnzw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3932,_binary '\0','/AoQqDYm9Nli8idc1JBEDnuO07oH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053622',6.3,8071,'en','BUtterfield 8','Gloria Wandrous, a promiscuous fashion model, falls in love with Weston Liggett, the hard drinking son of a working class family who has married into money.','/zwMaEBrNWFv9I9NiJVNTQ8znAM4.jpg','1960-11-04',109,'Released','She must hold many men in her arms to find the one man she could love!','BUtterfield 8',23724,2.9089,6.277,'FH0xqOJyycI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3933,_binary '\0','/w0VnIhvzHUUmoHozaO7qVK4YOyf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053636',7.1,1370,'da','Baronessen fra benzintanken','The film begins with Baron von Rosensteen\'s funeral. As Rosensteen has no heirs, the old Rosensteen Castle is to be inherited by the Rabenfeldt family. Supreme Court Attorney Berg visits the widow baroness about a document found among the papers of her son, the deceased baron. It turns out that the baron had a child out of wedlock with a non-noble woman. The widow baroness and the Supreme Court attorney decide to find the child, as this would mean that an heir to the castle had been found. The child turns out to be a girl named Anne Tofte, who works at a gas station with her uncle Lars Tofte and his colleague Hans Høy. They persuade Anne to live with the baroness for a while, which she is not very keen on. The widow tries to teach Anne to be a fine lady, rather than the tomboyish workshop mechanic her uncle had raised her to be.','/u643Zj2FxVD6LjiUC7lsUplocIo.jpg','1960-09-04',122,'Released',NULL,'Baronessen fra benzintanken',46255,1.1474,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3934,_binary '\0','/ycY9c5DZgiM4ZK0eb8fR4YSj3w2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053640',2.6,1248,'en','The Beatniks','A young singer\'s chance at fame is threatened by his hoodlum pals.','/5ghqUJ9lh0wxoNxo69tIgR6hO6j.jpg','1959-06-05',78,'Released','The wild, weird world of the Beatniks!...Sullen rebels, defiant chicks...searching for a life of their own! The pads...the jazz...the dives...those frantic \"way-out\" parties...beyond belief!','The Beatniks',89751,1.0258,2.8,'SxAcboDjZfE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3935,_binary '\0','/203bXvNwwDajPvYEk9bax80o5RO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053643',7.3,2237,'it','Il bell\'Antonio','Problems arise for Antonio Magnano when he is unable to consummate his marriage to the beautiful Barbara Puglisi and his virility is called into question. Despite the fact that he loves his beautiful wife and they have otherwise been happily married for a year, his problem becomes a source of contention for all concerned.','/j3inmLWDgtFqXSG8sdAZ75dzpZj.jpg','1960-03-04',99,'Released','...the frank story of a marital challenge','Il bell\'Antonio',76157,2.308,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3936,_binary '\0','/gyLAJ2vVJdjL0VLTBojUmovhP76.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053644',6.5,5400,'en','The Bellboy','Stanley is a bellboy at the Fountainbleau Hotel in Miami Beach, where he performs his duties quietly and without a word to anyone. All he displays are facial expressions and a comedic slapstick style. And anything that can go wrong, does go wrong when Stanley is involved. One day, Jerry Lewis arrives at the hotel and some of the staff notice the striking resemblance.','/xmdlbkVeUn97buYm4ZZ8quY0EVZ.jpg','1960-07-20',72,'Released','It\'s a Series of Silly Sequences and One of Jerry\'s All-Time Great Comedy Performances!','The Bellboy',15788,2.2652,6.2,'NwZYkWFCa6I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3937,_binary '\0','/lfFhAZmlrkzmcd6usFUuNzk53se.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053645',6.9,4190,'en','Bells Are Ringing','Ella Peterson works in the basement office of Susanswerphone, a telephone answering service. She listens in on others\' lives and adds some interest to her own humdrum existence by adopting different identities for her clients. They include an out-of-work Method actor, a dentist with musical yearnings, and in particular playwright Jeffrey Moss, who is suffering from writer\'s block and desperately needs a muse.','/1XigaSX2wbUYWttuZjHiFD8sSpU.jpg','1960-06-23',126,'Released','The screen is singing M.G.M. is bringing Broadway\'s Bell-Ringer of a Musical to the World!','Bells Are Ringing',43029,2.9946,6.543,'zEzXQ3AEHqc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3938,_binary '\0','/nR54TVnCgwovu3eEqOzXSVFD4L3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053651',5.3,2536,'en','Beyond the Time Barrier','In 1960, a pilot testing an experimental rocket powered aircraft accidentally flies into the future and finds himself in a sealed city whose people suspect he is a spy from outside their walls, but who want to keep him to procreate with the ruler\'s daughter because the majority of the inhabitants are sterile.','/3yrnrp5UZ0uEOjnUvtnnQYZUf8z.jpg','1960-09-08',75,'Released','Adam and Eve of the year 2024! Only they could repopulate the world!','Beyond the Time Barrier',61194,2.4128,6,'jSzrB_tHQOY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3939,_binary '\0','/7Wht4ckYWNyT0qDzjcE9Wm22y4v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053666',7.2,3503,'fr','Les Bonnes Femmes','Four Parisian women navigate the world of romance and daily life looking to fulfill their dreams.','/9KV6RqMfnHmyrqK7phsH6lEQa52.jpg','1960-04-22',100,'Released',NULL,'Les Bonnes Femmes',27419,1.6176,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3940,_binary '\0','/9hdHLj5aJ0kQpPnCC2lFHsu9K7K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053677',6.6,10219,'en','The Brides of Dracula','A young teacher on her way to a position in Transylvania helps a young man escape the shackles his mother has put on him. In so doing she innocently unleashes the horrors of the undead once again on the populace, including those at her school for ladies. Luckily for some, Dr. Van Helsing is already on his way.','/yJYJmxZZIAkrn0BaMcYnvEB8wVk.jpg','1960-06-15',82,'Released','He Turned Innocent Beauty Into Unspeakable Horror.','The Brides of Dracula',23220,5.9082,6.7,'5cHQMEnveP4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3941,_binary '\0','/bVOLBskh7ru5r7s18ZT4cDXswGY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053690',6.3,2763,'en','Can-Can','A Parisian nightclub owner known for her performances of the can-can attracts the ire of a self-righteous judge. He hatches a plot to photograph her in the act but ends up falling for her — much to the chagrin of her lawyer boyfriend.','/hlYe13PUACR5QEvCwnHxnjiV78F.jpg','1960-03-09',142,'Released','The Entertainment Event of the Year!','Can-Can',33726,2.0295,6.676,'sv5TmHUzt_w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3942,_binary '\0','/v78UnhjTGwyKOS4PTJ5XOc3EU04.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053699',6.2,3188,'en','Carry On Constable','With a flu epidemic running rife, three new bumbling recruits are assigned to Inspector Mills police station. With help from Special Constable Gorse, they manage to totally wreck operations of the police force and let plenty of criminals get away, even before they arrive at the station. They all have to prove themselves or else they\'ll be out of a job and Sgt. Wilkins will be transferred.','/pXdjlhYe3bjKLDebwib5SPkxEea.jpg','1960-02-22',86,'Released','Oh! What a Carry On When that Crazy Bunch Join the Police Force','Carry On Constable',21240,1.7859,6.3,'fObtlR82jUs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3943,_binary '\0','/lepTHhiKVcnwLOLJ1NGTl143jz2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053715',6.4,3909,'en','Cimarron','The epic story of a family involved in the Oklahoma Land Rush of April 22, 1889.','/9xPw8iIAWymvNBG0D7kSt45M9c2.jpg','1960-12-01',147,'Released','The story of a man, a land and a love!','Cimarron',46623,2.8556,6.2,'ytDIPs1ksVI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3944,_binary '\0','/xMslkgyKZcyTUHMQ6pbzjPNGq3O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053716',5.9,4108,'en','Cinderfella','When his father dies, poor Fella is left at the mercy of his snobbish stepmother and her two no-good sons Maximilian and Rupert. As he slaves away for his nasty step-family, Maximilian and Rupert attempt to find a treasure Fella\'s father has supposedly hidden on the estate. Hoping to restore her dwindling fortunes, the stepmother plans a fancy ball in honor of the visiting Princess Charmein whom she hopes will marry Rupert. Eventually, Fella\'s Fairy Godfather shows up to convince him that he has a shot at winning the Princess himself.','/5vjqG69ktqkWjmrzdUKuRDDcJF4.jpg','1960-12-18',88,'Released','Jerry Lewis is fabulous fun as...','Cinderfella',18973,2.1371,6.152,'PZ7dynhrz9g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3945,_binary '\0','/wDF6gMT9uO5k9gkv4ETPBnVaetA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053717',6,2881,'en','Circus of Horrors','A plastic surgeon and his nurse join a bizarre circus to escape from the police. Here he befriends deformed women and transforms them for his \"Temple of Beauty\". However, when they threaten to leave, they meet with mysterious accidents.','/9sfshfTBXOFOAutfceewC6Rvgxq.jpg','1960-04-01',88,'Released','Spectacular Towering Terror! One man\'s lust...made men into beasts, stripped women of their souls!','Circus of Horrors',27405,2.3357,5.8,'fwnb0m0MUhs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3946,_binary '\0','/bL5RTR6JXRc2tEjbTsUbGxem8gU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053719',6.7,9866,'en','The City of the Dead','In Whitewood, Massachusetts, a presumed witch places a curse on the town before she is burned at the stake. 300 years later, a college student arrives and checks into the mysterious Raven\'s Inn to research the town\'s history with witchcraft.','/xdM3QYjzzjuMy0cqlDNfet1BQhL.jpg','1960-09-09',78,'Released','300 years old! Human blood keeps them alive forever!','The City of the Dead',39890,3.1112,6.5,'uVsx56Rvv44','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3947,_binary '\0','/mJ6SbrfWwviKF1NGp2z89Px7Zij.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053724',7.3,1867,'es','El cochecito','Don Anselmo, a retired old man, decides to buy a motorized disabled stroller since all his pensioner friends own one. His family strongly refuses him to purchase the vehicle, so don Anselmo decides to take extreme measures to achieve his goal…','/jDh5pJ4EnIEwR9JS7DU0Mt47p6P.jpg','1960-11-03',86,'Released',NULL,'The Wheelchair',99883,1.5151,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3948,_binary '\0','/cxsxTW93MYtGPCQ0mXILkLYgNyK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053729',7,5077,'en','Comanche Station','A white man trades with the Comanche for the release of a female stranger and the pair cross paths with three outlaws who have their eyes on the handsome reward for bringing her home and Comanche on the warpath.','/1PHMKqoyZ4JS1iXBDSgKrbirox.jpg','1960-01-31',74,'Released','The One-Man War Against The Comancheros!','Comanche Station',1673,2.8897,6.675,'AbfeshoB9mw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3949,_binary '\0','/fQV5X2erl9afGJakDz2WHA2spvq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053740',6.8,1983,'en','The Criminal','When a robbery at a racetrack goes wrong ex-con Johnny Bannion is caught and sent back to prison. He won\'t tell the rest of the gang where he has stashed the loot leading to violent consequences.','/hbBJuVwx47pFifrdBnmHWxlCSf4.jpg','1960-09-13',97,'Released','The toughest picture ever made in Britain!','The Criminal',30784,2.31,6.464,'dggj09TY_pY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3950,_binary '\0','/pO8QmLpBJnSg6j9Fuh42G5Ujvox.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053746',7.3,1224,'ru','Дама с собачкой','On holiday in Yalta, Muscovite banker Dimitri Gurov contrives to meet a young woman who walks her dog. She’s Anna Sergeyevna, trapped in a loveless marriage to a lackey. He’s unhappy in an arranged marriage. With neither spouse at hand, Dimitri and Anna begin an affair.','/A1B3lRTxrbMOD9lCx3Xf2CLQxzl.jpg','1960-01-28',83,'Released',NULL,'Lady with the Dog',38831,1.9882,5.828,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3951,_binary '\0','/1bOTY8SZwO9MYBy6swM8Fq84npx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053765',7.8,3520,'bn','দেবী','A devout upper-class Hindu has a vision in a dream that his daughter-in-law is the human incarnation of the Goddess Kali and begins worshipping her.','/Uf7HhrqrGVFmI3Ec5w9skBDIqC.jpg','1960-02-19',99,'Released',NULL,'Devi',43031,1.8543,7.522,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3952,_binary '\0','/dfpzK6bobAQZWD2bJOJ07cBp6hc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053768',4.9,2026,'en','Dinosaurus!','After undersea explosions near a Caribbean island, prehistoric creatures are unleashed on the unsuspecting population.','/s70D6TKjyB2KkJw1HJXAebD1kSi.jpg','1960-07-20',85,'Released','Alive with thrills that started a million years ago!','Dinosaurus!',55663,1.3367,5.8,'9BRheDpYSfA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3953,_binary '\0','/qmxkOVsMiSubQ152TFIElQa6Vca.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053772',7.1,5156,'sv','Djävulens öga','Don Juan is sent from Hell to Earth with a mission: to seduce a virgin in order to spoil her pure wedding. The mission becomes frantic when Don Juan falls in love for the first time in centuries.','/njgS53DDdtsj5DXaGcEwglwq8z3.jpg','1960-10-17',88,'Released','He Came... He Saw... She Conquered!','The Devil\'s Eye',48145,2.8005,7.152,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3954,_binary '\0','/eN2NdMeJLNzLYzWIEEoaGzZAsiD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053779',8,86608,'it','La dolce vita','Episodic journey of journalist Marcello who struggles to find his place in the world, torn between the allure of Rome\'s elite social scene and the stifling domesticity offered by his girlfriend, all the while searching for a way to become a serious writer.','/dZ2v0DAX4aCZartCzZdg4ZinSW2.jpg','1960-02-05',174,'Released','The world’s most talked about movie today!','La Dolce Vita',439,7.8022,8.023,'yg3--NK-Xzo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3955,_binary '\0','/tPMHXHKGl9bFCcByKO6M5mClKnE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053793',7.7,14676,'en','Elmer Gantry','A charismatic charlatan begins a business — and eventually romantic — relationship with a roadside evangelist to sell religion to 1920s America. Based on Sinclair Lewis\' novel of the same name.','/5vd031r08rrfSMqtB9UarwqCUOz.jpg','1960-07-07',146,'Released','If there was a dollar to be made—Gantry would make it … If there was a soul to be saved—Gantry would save it …','Elmer Gantry',22013,3.38,7.3,'z73HAUbQNp4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3956,_binary '\0','/seQEaWg0xDiNFMiTLnrTfVywVC6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053796',7.1,4202,'en','The Entertainer','Archie Rice, an old-time British vaudeville performer sinking into final defeat, schemes to stay in show business.','/s549IYn0XDUlFHJpOLIrWE1uYXv.jpg','1960-07-25',104,'Released','As the applause grew fainter … As the spotlight grew dimmer … His women were younger!','The Entertainer',18929,1.5504,6.2,'IrP-5BvYM68','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3957,_binary '\0','/ahro031cfCSCcOT6YBFxFLL34sS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053802',6.4,1682,'fr','Et mourir de plaisir','The spirit of a vengeful female vampire is released from her grave and possesses a wealthy young woman of nobility, who preys on other women in her village.','/8jI376p60HvCxVlf14hVHxNuvZQ.jpg','1960-09-14',79,'Released','Ghoul or Girl?','Blood and Roses',85620,1.6514,5.9,'McAfJuFSwLg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3958,_binary '\0','/9Knw79HXoPpHIqa9TscDlwbuRJV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053804',6.7,13062,'en','Exodus','Ari Ben Canaan, a passionate member of the Jewish paramilitary group Haganah, attempts to transport 600 Jewish refugees on a dangerous voyage from Cyprus to Palestine on a ship named the Exodus. He faces obstruction from British forces, who will not grant the ship passage to its destination.','/1JXFJRztd43gCf4TAodNUwkfZoi.jpg','1960-12-15',208,'Released','The drama and the passion of one of the epic events of the twentieth century!','Exodus',1941,3.8462,6.7,'JMZ9bjInqwI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3959,_binary '\0','/dMgs7I1TlmOLWhlK9IVtsVhzWP1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053810',6.3,1984,'en','The Facts of Life','Middle-class suburbanites Larry and Kitty grow bored with their lives and respective marriages. Although each always found the other\'s manner grating, they fall in love when thrown together--without their spouses--on vacation. On returning home they try to break things off, only to grow closer. A holiday together will finally settle whether they should end their marriages.','/jgduHeBEmpCdzHKo9wteKj8WO8l.jpg','1960-11-14',103,'Released','EXPOSED!','The Facts of Life',39219,2.1904,5.3,'CJkR8Nqz40E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3960,_binary '\0','/92Y6t9Pv5fi9YpCd1TwtX9i4onN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053825',6.5,4536,'en','Flaming Star','Pacer Burton, a young man of mixed Kiowa and white heritage, is caught between two worlds as conflict erupts between Native Americans and white settlers in Texas.','/5OoB7NErxql4RfEimGIcSHCE3Ve.jpg','1960-12-20',92,'Released','CHOOSE!... Between your white father and your Kiowa mother !','Flaming Star',18639,2.8021,6.534,'r9sLhGOKhWY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3961,_binary '\0','/5Mj7KHV2w9sp7LK8W5FPLeT9DQE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053841',6.7,3494,'en','From the Terrace','Alfred Eaton, an ambitious young executive, climbs to the top of New York\'s financial world as his marriage crumbles. At the brink of attaining his career goals, he is forced to choose between business success, married to the beautiful, but unfaithful Mary and starting over with his true love, the much younger Natalie.','/nG0CavLX9OXhtUVX0a3Nj9pLsA6.jpg','1960-07-15',149,'Released','You can\'t buy respectability by putting a wedding ring on it!','From the Terrace',42541,2.2938,6.612,'jGZABwmXCHk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3962,_binary '\0','/T8CnFIktl0CZ8X0RODnfofJuNN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053848',6.2,4899,'en','G.I. Blues','Stationed in West Germany, soldier Tulsa McLean hopes to open a nightclub once he\'s discharged. Although he may lack the capital for such a venture, a chance to raise the cash comes his way through a friendly wager. Local dancer Lili is a notorious ice queen, and Tulsa bets everything he has that a friend of his can earn her affections. But when the friend is dispatched to Alaska, it\'s up to Tulsa to melt Lili\'s heart.','/8vsi3ezokYXLxccEWJ2sbXj80sF.jpg','1960-11-23',104,'Released','Elvis scores... a singing triumph... and a romantic hit!','G.I. Blues',18642,2.6214,6.487,'fUGcSyMlB3U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3963,_binary '\0','/iceLLX7erAn12ZT9ZVLuN8vxFht.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053849',7.1,2314,'en','The Gallant Hours','A semi-documentary dramatization of five weeks in the life of Vice Admiral William F. \"Bull\" Halsey, Jr., from his assignment to command the U.S. naval operations in the South Pacific to the Allied victory at Guadalcanal.','/7YKWqCWnSfE3fJB2lLUAiQOu0ol.jpg','1960-06-13',115,'Released','They Called Him the Bull of the Pacific...His Name Was Halsey..But the Enemy Spelled it Hell!','The Gallant Hours',99345,2.2433,6.7,'SqDKZzMtNNU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3964,_binary '\0','/uRMjUzSuVfbzuZkenEV9DkHxOR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053856',7.7,4233,'it','Il generale Della Rovere','In WWII-Italy, the Gestapo blackmails a con man to impersonate a dead partisan commander in order to extract information from his fellow inmates.','/dTynqWaUm92ecwxCuMkTdHCoOfx.jpg','1959-10-07',132,'Released',NULL,'General Della Rovere',43100,2.7037,7.481,'E6yrmhGGL5Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3965,_binary '\0','/gTjkmraoxRI2vKOzB14kLTPmmDA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053877',6.4,6496,'en','The Grass Is Greener','Victor and Hillary are down on their luck to the point that they allow tourists to take guided tours of their castle. But Charles Delacro, a millionaire oil tycoon, visits, and takes a liking to more than the house. Soon, Hattie Durant gets involved and they have a good old fashioned love triangle.','/3peOV81MRImLDX8bnGUHOJSB0lN.jpg','1960-12-23',104,'Released','Ever See a Four-Sided Triangle?','The Grass Is Greener',25767,3.0902,6.401,'KIRHjiBCut4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3966,_binary '\0','/vMcjWMPfqApH2kK3jKcnZsD07za.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053879',6.9,1871,'en','The Great Impostor','Fictionalized account of Ferdinand Waldo Demara Jr., who stole or created fictional identities and worked in a variety of occupations, most quite successfully.','/geTOtU4S4nM5By8aA49nLpppwya.jpg','1960-12-23',112,'Released','Will the Real Fred Demara Please Stand Up??','The Great Impostor',63887,2.4117,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3967,_binary '\0','/zRKr3JVlzA0MH4NicexFZm6aIX9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053882',6.4,3411,'en','The 3 Worlds of Gulliver','Doctor Gulliver is poor, so nothing - not even his charming fiancée Elisabeth - keeps him in the town he lives. He signs on to a ship to India, but in a storm he\'s washed off the ship and ends up on an island, which is inhibitated by very tiny people. After he managed to convince them he\'s harmless and is accepted as one of their citizens, their king wants to use him in war against a people of giants. Compared to them, even Gulliver is a gnome.','/1Zdbxszx6CL1SyZJwlScPMQbEMm.jpg','1960-11-30',100,'Released','In a World as different as Night and Day !','The 3 Worlds of Gulliver',18974,2.8429,6.613,'bxi6yZoyVk0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3968,_binary '\0','/3tflKEn1s1g5npkRZjRsnwdqhBQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053891',5.2,1318,'it','Annibale','A Carthaginian general attempts to cross the Alps with an army of elephants in order to conquer Rome.','/3KGA7vHcdcNiEQG4WADCUcYuhAr.jpg','1959-12-21',90,'Released','Hannibal and His Fantastic Elephant Army That Clobbered Half the World!','Hannibal',169818,2.0892,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3969,_binary '\0','/1rnV9msncYM0Aln4ZEONRPwV7Da.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053899',6.6,1455,'en','Hell Bent for Leather','When Clay Santell stops in the town of Sutterville after having his horse stolen, he is mistaken by townspeople for a murderer named Travers. The townspeople capture Santell, and turn him over to lawman Harry Deckett. Deckett, who is tired of chasing the real Travers, decides to kill Santell and pass him off as Travers. Santell escapes from Deckett, taking lovely Janet Gifford hostage in the process. Janet comes to believe Santell\'s story, and helps him in his struggle to prove his real identity.','/rMBhOicw9PxTN1MMvpohBdAYlNB.jpg','1960-02-01',82,'Released','Target For Terror!','Hell Bent for Leather',118653,2.5961,6.3,'ErA1ckjO_Bc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3970,_binary '\0','/iODifHiFqwy5MffquR08TCrXwuV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053900',7,1784,'en','Hell Is a City','Set in Manchester, heartland of England\'s industrial north, Don Starling escapes from jail becoming England\'s most wanted man. Ruthless villain Starling together with his cronies engineered a robbery that resulted in the violent death of a young girl. Detective Inspector Martineau has been assigned to hunt him down and bring him in. From seedy barrooms, through gambling dens the trail leads to an explosive climax high on the rooftops of the city.','/iG0rItDagvFyU3bVyaAwiXOTk2x.jpg','1960-04-10',98,'Released','Murder money stained his hands....','Hell Is a City',28784,1.7802,6.6,'z20Kdo8af7M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3971,_binary '\0','/vJ86uR9NmrueBdGgnUbkzxpdlYb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053901',6.9,1741,'en','Hell to Eternity','Based on the story about Guy Gabaldon, a Los Angeles Hispanic boy raised in the 1930s by a Japanese-American foster family. After Pearl Harbor, his foster family is interned at the Manzanar camp for Japanese Americans, while he enlists in the Marines, where his ability to speak Japanese becomes a vital asset. During the Battle of Saipan, he convinces 800 Japanese to surrender after their general commits suicide.','/iBZ4etannpLgRK9MhAqHyt5CZMW.jpg','1960-08-01',131,'Released','The Marines\' Battle Cry of the South Pacific!','Hell to Eternity',43034,1.7817,6.3,'mEuPUUB5Vek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3972,_binary '\0','/iTfRnvq5ONRfvFk7MVa4vGjtZL6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053902',5.9,1595,'en','Heller in Pink Tights','Nineteenth century Wyoming: the wild West. Mild-mannered Tom Healy has a two-wagon theater troupe hounded by creditors because Angela, his leading lady and the object of his affection, constantly buys clothes. In Cheyenne, they meet with applause, so they hope to stay awhile: the theater owner likes Angela, and she keeps him on a string. She\'s also the object of the attentions of Mabry, a gunslinger who\'s owed money by the richest man in Bonanza.','/o9PfnbAxKyMZef0Z5N1l5zJVSfw.jpg','1960-03-01',100,'Released','Story of theatrical troupe that travels through the Old West.','Heller in Pink Tights',43035,2.3258,5.8,'AMCjKk4V1Go','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3973,_binary '\0','/aMnmFAzwM9OD1f2PevCfn9Ht3wn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053917',7.4,4403,'en','Home from the Hill','The wealthiest man in a Texas town decides to teach his teenage son how to hunt to make a man out of him.','/cE52KPgeJqDyaVu29OFGKqSDyET.jpg','1960-03-03',150,'Released','When you talk about great motion pictures you will talk about this one!','Home from the Hill',89484,2.9334,6.9,'w-_qqEbgBfk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3974,_binary '\0','/bNFtjsp9v95DL9iL20Gue4gMddZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053925',6.9,17633,'en','House of Usher','Convinced that his family is tainted by generations of evil, Roderick Usher is hellbent on stopping his sister Madeline’s wedding to prevent the cursed Usher bloodline from expanding. When her fiancé Philip Winthrop arrives at the crumbling estate to claim his bride, Roderick goes to ruthless—even deadly—lengths to keep them apart.','/jEzZOrGSWpl0jKOIXoY3OnEabLQ.jpg','1960-07-20',79,'Released','Edgar Allan Poe\'s demonic tale of The Ungodly... The Evil House of Usher','House of Usher',23439,2.2011,6.7,'f0JK8RYmWt8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3975,_binary '\0','/1fvSrGEt1UsxENnZ3wHYKuFT87n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053935',7.7,7557,'en','Ice Cold in Alex','A group of army personnel and nurses attempt a dangerous and arduous trek across the deserts of North Africa during the second world war. The leader of the team dreams of his ice cold beer when he reaches Alexandria.','/lkqTxSL9JwyyXDu5yeOoj5mzsVc.jpg','1958-06-24',125,'Released','3 guys...and a couple of gals...and the mission that led them through 600 miles of burning hell!','Ice Cold in Alex',16284,3.4358,7.335,'qaJ5UBi4z2c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3976,_binary '\0','/khgQ9OGIbpFdJQkRBsdTUXPPxq3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053944',3.1,1509,'en','The Incredible Petrified World','Four adventurers descend to the bottom of the sea. When their surface tether snaps, they find themselves marooned in a network of underwater caverns.','/qns5oUzhUTGcPyeNyaM3DwBrwdC.jpg','1959-11-18',70,'Released','See women trapped in fantastic caverns at the center of Earth!','The Incredible Petrified World',35663,1.5882,3.5,'y61dmneMXFw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3977,_binary '\0','/es4sV6krplqscHmhn9TFSqkl8ee.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053946',8.1,35929,'en','Inherit the Wind','Schoolteacher Bertram Cates is arrested for teaching his students Darwin\'s theory of evolution. The case receives national attention and one of the newspaper reporters, E.K. Hornbeck, arranges to bring in renowned defense attorney and atheist Henry Drummond to defend Cates. The prosecutor, Matthew Brady is a former presidential candidate, famous evangelist, and old adversary of Drummond.','/7oaHcF0gCOt2lKaT2zajhajP0Zo.jpg','1960-07-07',128,'Released','It’s all about the fabulous “Monkey Trial” that rocked America!','Inherit the Wind',1908,3.9395,7.7,'1PKkLSCuiEE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3978,_binary '\0','/nAPVApcdTLCSl9gsesvveLG00GZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053957',6.3,3716,'en','It Started in Naples','Mike Hamilton, a Philadelphia lawyer, comes to Naples to settle the estate of his long estranged \"black sheep\" brother. Once there, he discovers that the deceased has left an 8 year old boy who is being raised by Michael\'s sister-in-law Lucia Curcio. To complicate matters, Lucia happens to be a sexy nightclub performer.','/cqgViygbWqqGJs1AOPKRcKEj4rg.jpg','1960-08-06',100,'Released','You\'ll want to be there when the fun starts!','It Started in Naples',38151,3.0214,6.4,'r61X1CmU524','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3979,_binary '\0','/bBK5j3FUk2qy5KtHXMJDLdKH7Ba.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053967',7.4,3350,'en','La joven','A jazz musician seeks refuge from a lynch mob on a remote island, where he meets a hostile game warden and the young object of his attentions.','/vgqmNCe9PKibdGpdWuhA6Ozuso.jpg','1960-09-05',95,'Released',NULL,'The Young One',35030,4.5726,7.016,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3980,_binary '\0','/pcBIabUibUmpOBggWckkjohXtiP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053976',8,34148,'sv','Jungfrukällan','Devout Christians Töre and Märeta send their only daughter, the virginal Karin, and their foster daughter, the unrepentant Ingeri, to deliver candles to a distant church. On their way through the woods, the girls encounter a group of savage goat herders who brutally rape and murder Karin as Ingeri remains hidden. When the killers unwittingly seek refuge in the farmhouse of Töre and Märeta, Töre plots a fitting revenge.','/z70YM3Y4pNYZATMhFMKonngaeMC.jpg','1960-02-08',90,'Released','Ravished innocence... brings terrible revenge!','The Virgin Spring',11656,3.9901,7.8,'IBf4PnJGkZk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3981,_binary '\0','/wVGDzQBuSMKdzX7BVffnA49izHg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053987',7.4,7980,'ru','Каток и скрипка','Seven year old Sasha practices violin every day to satisfy the ambition of his parents. Already withdrawn as a result of his routines, Sasha quickly regains confidence when he accidentally meets and befriends worker Sergei, who works on a steamroller in their upscale Moscow neighborhood.','/rQILTYttUhFTy715d41SG50Xpfi.jpg','1961-12-30',46,'Released',NULL,'The Steamroller and the Violin',38311,1.1932,7.068,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3982,_binary '\0','/lpNuYbQ7QoTE0VZdscYp428Xj16.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0053994',6.5,1772,'en','Kidnapped','Kidnapped and cheated out of his inheritance, young David Balfour falls in with a Jacobite adventurer, Alan Breck Stewart. Falsely accused of murder, they must flee across the Highlands, evading the redcoats.','/5aMT9Mkkqx1q9JhDmAX5ydcSTrK.jpg','1960-02-24',97,'Released',NULL,'Kidnapped',43037,1.889,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3983,_binary '\0','/uBA8YIm1rxMrBm0GQGQh0m9Pgtt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054001',7.7,2330,'fi','Komisario Palmun erehdys','A closed room mystery begins when an infamous tycoon is found dead in his bath tub. The famous police lieutenant Palmu is summoned to investigate.','/ae22krh0RuhMDTsvOwwdS7YpxDX.jpg','1960-09-09',109,'Released',NULL,'Inspector Palmu\'s Error',55398,0.9056,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3984,_binary '\0','/qsrNq2A7I2nmSi82Dl4jwAoas7J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054004',6.9,2459,'pl','Krzyżacy','A tale of a young impoverished nobleman, who with his uncle returns from a war against the order of the Teutonic Knights in Lithuania. He falls in love with a beautiful woman and pledges an oath to bring her \"three trophies\" from the Teutonic Knights.','/v65DS9A4rfWbkLAPopUzGe0fDz8.jpg','1960-09-02',166,'Released',NULL,'Knights of the Teutonic Order',66030,1.6846,7.1,'VC72ymf2Q48','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3985,_binary '\0','/bzCzoPZFt1HGhPOccYko9VdGL0T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054016',6.7,2811,'en','The Last Voyage','The S. S. Claridon is scheduled for her five last voyages after thirty-eight years of service. After an explosion in the boiler room, Captain Robert Adams is reluctant to evacuate the steamship. While the crew fights to hold a bulkhead between the flooded boiler room and the engine room and avoid the sinking of the vessel, the passenger Cliff Henderson struggles against time trying to save his beloved wife Laurie Henderson, who is trapped under a steel beam in her cabin, with the support of the crew member Hank Lawson.','/a4hwHvo4KdaQK4fRjvFH5hkTXMn.jpg','1960-02-19',91,'Released','FIND YOUR S.Q.! What is your Suspense Quotient? How Much Suspense Can You Take?','The Last Voyage',37605,2.2929,6.2,'VcBrBYS6OL8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3986,_binary '\0','/dNkHpAbaWkqDCC6wsgw7N2tBA3K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054017',4.7,2413,'en','Last Woman on Earth','Harold Gern, a shady businessman from New York, is spending a holiday in Puerto Rico with his attractive wife Evelyn. They are joined by Martin Joyce, Harold\'s lawyer, who has come to discuss the latest indictment. Harold invites him along on a boat trip during which all three try out some newly bought scuba diving equipment. When they resurface, they find out that the world has changed forever.','/tgnBd04WHJvysZxf5MYmNTXitVL.jpg','1960-08-05',71,'Released','They fought for the Ultimate Prize!','Last Woman on Earth',71520,1.6775,4.5,'wEAQV1zVDak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3987,_binary '\0','/kA7A2IgtTPjCyrlYun04i20bZa3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054020',4.8,2494,'en','The Leech Woman','An endocrinologist in a dysfunctional marriage with an aging, alcoholic wife journeys to Africa seeking a drug that will restore youth.','/6xMaV4WLDdFQtc3VZiNfy9ViE0A.jpg','1960-05-01',77,'Released','She drained men of their loves and lives!','The Leech Woman',52745,1.4894,4.81,'Y-DNugPr60s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3988,_binary '\0','/gDVa3JFURhhcnic6fIhk3EPmbd0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054022',6.4,8794,'en','Let\'s Make Love','When billionaire Jean-Marc Clement learns that he is to be satirized in an off-Broadway revue, he passes himself off as an actor playing him in order to get closer to the beautiful star of the show, Amanda Dell.','/yzBniSVhbXrGTRmyAH0k276NFzJ.jpg','1960-09-08',119,'Released','MARILYN MONROE and YVES MONTAND the French entertainment sensation! Doing what they do best in LET\'S MAKE LOVE!','Let\'s Make Love',24014,5.0753,6.4,'vTNOL0AQues','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3989,_binary '\0','/sGz7JApiDtClRFxffIw3WgRK8y2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054033',6.2,21502,'en','The Little Shop of Horrors','Seymour works in a skid row florist shop and is in love with his beautiful co-worker, Audrey. He creates a new plant that not only talks but cannot survive without human flesh and blood.','/s9MrumN9oCfv1rFoEvMLwucWD7V.jpg','1960-05-04',73,'Released','The funniest picture this year!','The Little Shop of Horrors',24452,4.2241,6.271,'amlXKaqk2jg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3990,_binary '\0','/z5Dttswiv2w78RNclaB9CGclpWo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054038',5.5,5154,'en','The Lost World','Professor Challenger leads an expedition of scientists and adventurers to a remote plateau deep in the Amazonian jungle to verify his claim that dinosaurs still live there.','/tiBTklBzxgdmcNPTIAtQtL7MkH.jpg','1960-07-13',97,'Released','In the middle of the twentieth century, you fall off the brink of time!','The Lost World',2982,2.7902,5.8,'LL1X5CdDWQg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3991,_binary '\0','/6SKhqqAPrJyPz9Cx1N1jaOBqV0a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054042',8.3,5371,'es','Macario','Poor, hungry peasant Macario longs for just one good meal on the Day of the Dead. After his wife cooks a turkey for him, he meets three apparitions, the Devil, God, and Death. Each asks him to share his turkey, but he refuses all except Death. In return, Death gives him a bottle of water which will heal any illness. Soon, Macario is more wealthy than the village doctor, which draws the attention of the feared Inquisition.','/fKRzGm3BiuOv3MuolazFOEgB8EX.jpg','1960-06-09',91,'Released','Macabre, haunting and wonderful','Macario',122019,2.5951,8.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3992,_binary '\0','/x0JQBBfK68gHm8rmyKk60bnnyw9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054047',7.7,111861,'en','The Magnificent Seven','An oppressed Mexican peasant village hires seven gunfighters to help defend their homes.','/e5ToxOyJwuZD4VOfI0qEn5uIjeJ.jpg','1960-10-12',128,'Released','They were seven…and they fought like seven hundred!','The Magnificent Seven',966,14.3484,7.498,'F11chOCFTi8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3993,_binary '\0','/ghtleNa8N2xxSYYIs10tJCQnCN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054049',7,1247,'en','Make Mine Mink','In a mansion block in Knightsbridge, a gang of middle-aged biddies decide to brighten up \"the dullness of the tea time of life\" by staging a series of robberies on furriers, then donating the proceeds to charitable concerns. Terry Thomas as a retired army officer leads the gang, which includes Athene Seyler and Hattie Jacques, on a series of capers that nearly go awry when their maid, Billie Whitelaw, an ex-con and also a resident of the block, falls for a police officer.','/eLClqmwoW0XCP3hHcpVy8bFIDS6.jpg','1960-08-09',101,'Released','A jolly good show indeed.','Make Mine Mink',44023,1.3943,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3994,_binary '\0','/wKzY5EGRweXc91eBs1jk9ZSXcp0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054067',7.1,20359,'it','La maschera del demonio','A vengeful witch, Asa Vajda, and her fiendish servant, Igor Jauvitch, return from the grave and begin a bloody campaign to possess the body of the witch\'s beautiful look-alike descendant: Katia. Only a handsome doctor with the help of family members stand in her way.','/x41Zx8GeZhducquhOq9nE7z1GBG.jpg','1960-08-11',86,'Released','STARE INTO THESE EYES...Discover deep within them the unspeakable, terrifying secret of BLACK SUNDAY...It will paralyze you with fright!','Black Sunday',27632,4.01,7.383,'N05Bm7kOZgg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3995,_binary '\0','/oAox7z3d94YqwRHTrQOyEZooK94.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054073',7.8,3745,'bn','মেঘে ঢাকা তারা','A selfless young woman, the daughter of a middle-class refugee family from East Pakistan, sacrifices her own happiness for her unappreciative family.','/uIlt1x2eBMzuQHwyU54CNPTSK6A.jpg','1960-04-13',127,'Released',NULL,'The Cloud-Capped Star',59239,0.9693,7.212,'ZAAv6fBh8q8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3996,_binary '\0','/cSPEJCJ2OwSXGp9GfLvl9rK31U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054084',6.8,6711,'en','Midnight Lace','Kit Preston begins to unravel when she receives threatening telephone calls informing her she\'s soon to be murdered.','/o96pMV03LtzLb03Wh3xXMdS1194.jpg','1960-10-13',108,'Released','Even with the arms of her love around her...she still felt the menace of that voice in the night!','Midnight Lace',12617,2.3986,6.6,'PU6JK0r_OUk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3997,_binary '\0','/8NiLVGzYHhKRhtcGXIKvVQu3Me2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054086',5.4,2251,'en','The Millionairess','When her father dies, Epifania Parerga, an Italian in London, becomes the world\'s richest woman. She feels incomplete without a husband and falls in love with a humble, Indian physician, Ahmed el Kabir, much loved by his indigent English patients.','/byMubSKFewDCU2dxyPFbINBDnV.jpg','1960-10-18',89,'Released',NULL,'The Millionairess',3582,2.0016,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3998,_binary '\0','/7mzqRltG7gWEtAX4CM6lfcelS4L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054091',6.8,1488,'fr','Moderato cantabile','Anne Desbarèdes is a young woman who is married to a wealthy businessman and lives a monotonous existence in the small commune town of Blaye. After indirectly witnessing a murder in a café, she returns to the scene of the crime the next day and meets Chauvin, who informs her in more detail about the events that took place. Mentally unbalanced, Anne begins to believe that Chauvin intends to kill her.','/Gti1xNWrLOOefC1bmcK9ku0HqE.jpg','1960-05-25',91,'Released',NULL,'Seven Days… Seven Nights',83662,1.3392,6.239,'1i7Zbbp1Xu0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(3999,_binary '\0','/qEx0Ua1bZe5AHvGmHYOTZk2EyB9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054095',6.2,1271,'en','The Mountain Road','In 1944, in eastern part of China, U.S.Army Major Baldwin and his volunteer team of demolition engineers are left behind the retreating Chinese forces. Their task is to slow down the Japanese advance into eastern China by blowing up bridges, roads, airfields and munitions dumps. They start by blowing up an American airfield and ammo dump. They receive the order to destroy a vital bridge over a mountain pass.The team uses a few army trucks to move around. At the bridge, they encounter a Nationalist Chinese Army unit in charge of guarding the bridge. Thanks to an American soldier who speaks some Chinese, Major Baldwin requests the permission, from the Chinese commander, to blow up the bridge.The Chinese colonel agrees but asks the American Major to do him a favor by also destroying a munitions dump located at some distance away.He also requests that Madame Sue-Mei Hung, the widow of a Chinese colonel, be transported by the American demolition team to the nearest major town.','/fZ9MUjmH2FfD0Gm9UhMvyXFlJ7G.jpg','1960-06-15',102,'Released','Flaming skies... blasted earth... the touch of love!','The Mountain Road',102165,1.4688,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4000,_binary '\0','/1U4V92gwVDnVjWJn6eMciOffClN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054098',8.1,9756,'hi','मुगल-ए-आज़म','In the 16th century, when Prince Salim falls in love with a beautiful courtesan named Anarkali, Emperor Akbar\'s disapproval leads to a battle between father and son.','/lKfNZUh9CRp1EHjxgNGtrbvm55.jpg','1960-08-05',197,'Released',NULL,'Mughal-e-Azam',44519,1.3662,7.008,'6PjoLgcrmcQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4001,_binary '\0','/seXnWUtyLa4fIceoeiUFLAPJ0B0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054099',6.5,2497,'it','Il mulino delle donne di pietra','Hans von Arnam travels to a Flemish village to study a strange carousel located in an old windmill that displays famous murderesses and other notorious women from history. Professor Gregorius Wahl, owner of the windmill, warns Hans to stay away from his mysterious daughter Elfi, in order to keep Hans from discovering the horrible secret shared by the Professor and Elfi\'s Doctor.','/xBGQWpYwxPpIs6LnZYphDXxvc4r.jpg','1960-08-30',95,'Released','Why do warm-blooded beauties suddenly turn to stone?!','Mill of the Stone Women',43036,2.3505,6.1,'-Qr4Fn2ARLo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4002,_binary '\0','/7EIKcWtSZC0yODktjpT1Ecya3xM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054102',6.6,1895,'en','Murder, Inc.','Chronicles the rise and fall of the organised crime syndicate known as Murder, Incorporated, focusing on powerful boss Lepke and violent hit man Reles.','/hXfClepcsBNNbiBvZ5IDt329Pbq.jpg','1960-06-28',103,'Released','The Super-Corporation of Crime!','Murder, Inc.',15375,2.0111,6.5,'ydwARWNMuVI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4003,_binary '\0','/2ur9ZsXcGXKZarnKud7wv9ApwXS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054115',7.1,1874,'en','Never Let Go','John Cummings, an unsuccessful London cosmetics salesman, has his unpaid-for car stolen by a hood in the employ of Lionel Meadows, sadistic organiser of a car conversion racket. As the vehicle is uninsured, and since the police seem indifferent, Cummings decides to find it himself — and gets himself involved in an underworld battle.','/7F3QYIboc5JFy58wMXxJwCypQIs.jpg','1960-06-02',90,'Released','Peter Sellers in a new and exciting role!','Never Let Go',36631,1.8039,6.5,'xoh1LsbaBf8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4004,_binary '\0','/lYwoGA9sZPIw55MrfB5yoRmjvgP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054116',7.4,2408,'en','Never Take Sweets from a Stranger','Peter Carter, his wife Sally and their young daughter Jean move to a sleepy Canadian village, where Peter has been hired as a school principal. Their idyll is shattered when Jean becomes the victim of an elderly, and extremely powerful, paedophile. The film was neither a box office nor a critical success, it garnered criticism for breaking a significant public taboo.','/5TC93BMF6XwDqSfzbSiGibYcWl2.jpg','1960-03-04',81,'Released','...and then he made us play that silly game...','Never Take Sweets from a Stranger',80151,2.0344,7.3,'cITchZCLJFM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4005,_binary '\0','/yVywZerF7Blnq4lZcGTl9OtRvEr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054119',7.3,1900,'pl','Niewinni czarodzieje','A young doctor is tired of being sought by women. One night he meets a young girl who all but forces herself into his room where they talk of morals and love.','/t8fadEnUuIczqDZVcWaVQECUVRh.jpg','1960-12-17',83,'Released',NULL,'Innocent Sorcerers',80324,1.9842,7,'F96plT_pbRg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4006,_binary '\0','/o7DdGVf6pM3LUSO0st9p1eUTgax.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054127',6.9,9318,'en','North to Alaska','After striking gold in Alaska, the romantic George sends his womanizing partner Sam to bring his fiancée up from Seattle. When Sam finds that she has already married, he returns instead with Angel, a dancer originally from France.','/1HSf0NsKtEy2w5qIJqpP5BppZkL.jpg','1960-11-07',122,'Released','These were the adventures . . . fighting, laughing and brawling their way from Seattle to Nome!','North to Alaska',6523,3.4936,6.5,'UhZeTaaus2Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4007,_binary '\0','/5wATYRIHIBhE9kelbGxYm0i7cNs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054130',7.9,26949,'it','La notte','A day in the life of an unfaithful married couple and their steadily deteriorating relationship in Milan.','/xkd7wPJSIC76scBRHCFZ85uOH5d.jpg','1961-01-24',122,'Released','A new genre of motion picture... to make you think and feel.','La Notte',41050,3.4063,7.921,'75SO1lc_TZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4008,_binary '\0','/vJLSt7NvYP85nR4XJ8CxnMadf6G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054135',6.5,26397,'en','Ocean\'s Eleven','Danny Ocean and his gang attempt to rob the five biggest casinos in Las Vegas in one night.','/A4R6u7SidBPVXMVzGSysCiRGTRz.jpg','1960-08-10',127,'Released','Just Danny Ocean and his 11 pals.','Ocean\'s Eleven',299,5.7822,6.4,'ppVby97BNiw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4009,_binary '\0','/uSyVJvqo7EwFguVukPIPa00dLAk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054144',8,5443,'ja','女が階段を上る時','Keiko, whom everyone calls Mama, narrates her story: she\'s a hostess on the Ginza, 30, a widow. She describes life\'s vicious cycle: acting cheerful around drunks, dressing and living well to convey confidence, needing money for these expenses and for her demanding mother and brother, and knowing she\'s growing older.','/miGb5TwM8SIK5URe0mPMOYZqr3g.jpg','1960-01-15',111,'Released','The tree sprouts no matter how strong the wind blows.','When a Woman Ascends the Stairs',36872,2.3353,8,'ooW3aSKfsVA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4010,_binary '\0','/qEmvcfHY8Sq9L2xaVpBOcTgH2NB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054152',7.1,6915,'en','Our Man in Havana','Jim Wormold is an expatriate Englishman living in pre-revolutionary Havana with his teenage daughter Milly. He owns a vacuum cleaner shop but isn’t very successful so he accepts an offer from Hawthorne of the British Secret Service to recruit a network of agents in Cuba.','/6R6zIKywC8rNo6fT1YBDeEAUmEb.jpg','1960-01-27',111,'Released','A murderously funny story, magnificently cast... marvelously made !','Our Man in Havana',25495,3.1091,6.7,'6k28aq528FQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4011,_binary '\0','/biJMHfwb1yaH2W9OwIt3n6RtVbS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054156',6.7,3034,'fr','Paris nous appartient','A young woman joins a theatrical troupe where she slowly believes that the director is involved with a secret group and that he is in grave danger.','/6d5k00vjGDjDn3g7znRoJYCALen.jpg','1961-12-13',141,'Released',NULL,'Paris Belongs to Us',43026,1.6227,6.6,'sYWv5tneX6I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4012,_binary '\0','/bRIbTIJHwyqQg1ijGU3qbl7YLMC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054159',7.4,2501,'pl','Pasażerka','A German woman on a ship returning to Europe notices a face of another woman which brings recollections from the past. She tells her husband that she had been an overseer in Auschwitz during the war, but she has actually saved a woman\'s life.','/ux3lFO5AcyoFiO3hLXVNo133fDW.jpg','1963-09-20',62,'Released','Jailer and prisoner… both haunted by the Holocaust.','Passenger',25939,1.9925,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4013,_binary '\0','/rLm66DbLwxHeRB34oJ1mhsu0urc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054167',7.6,44347,'en','Peeping Tom','Loner Mark Lewis works at a film studio during the day and, at night, takes racy photographs of women. Also he\'s making a documentary on fear, which involves recording the reactions of victims as he murders them. He befriends Helen, the daughter of the family living in the apartment below his, and he tells her vaguely about the movie he is making.','/u36rFrXW7XethWpiEWbRjzfgOc.jpg','1960-04-07',101,'Released','What made this the most diabolical murder weapon ever used?','Peeping Tom',11167,5.2264,7.4,'0pOdgj4zKKA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4014,_binary '\0','/kBDQja5cwHYVba8MfJOAtdwNo7e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054172',5.5,1264,'en','Pepe','Mario \"Cantinflas\" Moreno is a hired hand, Pepe, employed on a ranch. A boozing Hollywood director buys a white stallion that belongs to Pepe\'s boss. Pepe, determined to get the horse back (as he considers it his family), decides to take off to Hollywood. There he meets film stars including Jimmy Durante, Frank Sinatra, Zsa Zsa Gabór, Bing Crosby, Maurice Chevalier and Jack Lemmon in drag as Daphne from Some Like It Hot. He is also surprised by things that were new in America at the time, such as automatic swinging doors. When he finally reaches the man who bought the horse, he is led to believe there is no hope of getting it back. However, the last scene shows both him and the stallion back at the ranch with several foals.','/th8c4sGS5ZAOW7zhyGWyhykuL0M.jpg','1960-12-21',180,'Released','A New Excitement in Screen Entertainment!','Pepe',82792,1.8242,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4015,_binary '\0','/wxABOG4X5wvdt0fYggKE3gGWfGh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054176',7.4,2601,'en','Peter Pan','In this magical tale about the boy who refuses to grow up, Peter Pan and his mischievous fairy sidekick Tinkerbell visit the nursery of Wendy, Michael and John Darling. With a sprinkling of pixie dust, Peter and his new friends fly out the nursery window and over London to Never-Never Land. The children experience many wonderful and exciting adventures with the Lost Boys, Tiger Lily\'s Indian tribe, and Peter\'s arch enemy the dastardly pirate Captain Hook.','/qCQ42aTmU4cuHwzfu8rCvYQuCyx.jpg','1960-12-08',101,'Released',NULL,'Peter Pan',51120,1.4554,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4016,_binary '\0','/q53o3eyUorC2WTbdepCiuc2XSix.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054177',7.1,8870,'fr','Le Petit Soldat','Despite his lack of political convictions, photojournalist Bruno Forestier is roped into a paramilitary group waging a shadow war in Geneva against the Algerian independence movement.','/pzKFKVZHeGhJQYWZN6qO3GXUApU.jpg','1963-01-25',87,'Released',NULL,'Le Petit Soldat',50785,1.9877,6.918,'q4b7jODWiq8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4017,_binary '\0','/hq1jfoAONPe4USBFEjFWXgquJSy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054188',6.4,5451,'en','Please Don\'t Eat the Daisies','Drama critic Larry Mackay, his wife Kate and their four sons move from their crowded Manhattan apartment to an old house in the country. While housewife Kate settles into suburban life, Larry continues to enjoy the theater and party scene of New York.','/neSCV9m8R1ykTqicd53fdwQgQnJ.jpg','1960-03-31',112,'Released','The Uproarious Movie From The Big Best-Seller!','Please Don\'t Eat the Daisies',19414,2.7003,6.2,'knOY2dCfNI4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4018,_binary '\0','/d34za8faZk2zeSnrXEthF0h7a8r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054189',7.7,24499,'fr','Plein soleil','Tom Ripley is a talented mimic, moocher, forger and all-around criminal improviser; but there\'s more to Tom Ripley than even he can guess.','/xGVRU34izQwG8YQNfVOSfKPhD3S.jpg','1960-03-10',118,'Released','Passion at ten. Envy at eleven. Murder at noon.','Purple Noon',10363,5.57,7.6,'tWnvLNTzt-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4019,_binary '\0','/daAGNEXy8VC0VXWG1QZCrZhUqKJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054195',7.4,12715,'en','Pollyanna','A young girl comes to an embittered town and confronts its attitude with her determination to see the best in life.','/9lWkRXg35SjUZXLr10ez8DERvRv.jpg','1960-05-19',134,'Released',NULL,'Pollyanna',31102,2.8784,6.961,'XVtLP5tfpCA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4020,_binary '\0','/k5IM83Gb053ODBSccVFl1oZGrJ9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054197',6.3,2121,'en','Portrait in Black','A pair of lovers plot to kill the woman\'s rich husband.','/Aev5PXbTpOlNrat44ljgibZH8br.jpg','1960-07-27',112,'Released','They touched...and an evil spark was struck!','Portrait in Black',39779,2.5116,5.7,'QVUlJakFeBU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4021,_binary '\0','/6YgRhojLENb3y3ufWqC6SUH1IBE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054198',7.3,6678,'el','Ποτέ την Κυριακή','An American scholar in Greece sets about improving the local prostitute with whom he is infatuated.','/t9zLlS5O5GB57BKjJCtzB21VKZB.jpg','1960-05-24',91,'Released','The Happy Street-Walker of Piraeus...','Never on Sunday',43039,1.9649,6.8,'wQht_oEDKTc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4022,_binary '\0','/e6IPjjDzZDkgdkvxQtCjaVCMYJF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054205',7.1,1688,'en','Primary','Primary is a documentary film about the primary elections between John F. Kennedy and Hubert Humphrey in 1960. Primary is the first documentary to use light equipment in order to follow their subjects in a more intimate filmmaking style. This unconventional way of filming created a new look for documentary films where the camera’s lens was right in the middle of what ever drama was occurring. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with The Film Foundation in 1998.','/gVloWsthHRlw719vzRWRpBqDM20.jpg','1960-11-08',53,'Released',NULL,'Primary',133,1.2084,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4023,_binary '\0','/kLaqdTs9j7ZZ0Xh0eqYaZSMZPhG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054209',6.7,1528,'en','Private Property','A hoodlum plots to seduce a lonely housewife and turn her over to his virginal friend.','/vfi9i5PTztkOgDgOcoSDI0jzDeh.jpg','1960-01-20',79,'Released','The boldest story of a planned seduction ever to scald the screen!','Private Property',251421,1.2119,6.3,'zx5mxptcvlo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4024,_binary '\0','/mufF1aYvwdpKerhq5R1YrVcbJLY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054215',8.5,794143,'en','Psycho','When larcenous real estate clerk Marion Crane goes on the lam with a wad of cash and hopes of starting a new life, she ends up at the notorious Bates Motel, where manager Norman Bates cares for his housebound mother.','/yz4QVqPx3h1hD1DfqqQkCq3rmxW.jpg','1960-06-22',109,'Released','A new and altogether different screen excitement!','Psycho',539,21.3327,8.407,'AJdPFYENJBo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4025,_binary '\0','/jbAGj9IaX1UI6Iqsdk63T8p9sui.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054225',7.4,3007,'it','La ragazza con la valigia','Lorenzo, who\'s 16 and born to a wealthy family in Parma, tries to make things right toward a showgirl, Aida, whom his older brother has mistreated. In extending kindness and standing up for her, he comes of age. But, is there anything he can do that will alter Aida\'s situation or her prospects?','/vC6ysIyFTg7yp483x27uEVsbPGW.jpg','1961-02-09',121,'Released',NULL,'Girl with a Suitcase',49697,2.6675,7.1,'JXdM-18fuuw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4026,_binary '\0','/gqPmVGWCk45IgpDRH6G5UYvhjlN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054230',6.6,1730,'en','The Rat Race','An aspiring musician arrives in New York in search of fame and fortune. He soon meets a taxi dancer, moves in with her, and before too long a romance develops.','/acVCpz5YNwhRGb0j5G1jPy9HTm0.jpg','1960-07-10',105,'Released','CAUGHT...in the wild, frantic, furious...rat race!','The Rat Race',121636,1.8747,6.7,'4dUN4-qZYMU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4027,_binary '\0','/sq6QeVbA8NoaFIBsJAyOLuBUJqD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054240',3,3669,'en','Orgy of the Dead','Horror novelist John and his girlfriend Shirley are taking a night drive, in search of an eerie graveyard that will hopefully inspire John to come up with his next story, but instead stumble into the wild rituals conducted by The Dark Master and his faithful servants.','/4HRzwoEVcDAaqk7qcXIJXD58WIn.jpg','1965-06-01',90,'Released','A Masterpiece of Erotic Horror!','Orgy of the Dead',47615,3.031,2.973,'SeFsnAio6oU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4028,_binary '\0','/pWz0OqS55BmYzAYxQAY8QvMVKAI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054243',6.7,1596,'en','The Rise and Fall of Legs Diamond','Jack Diamond and his sickly brother arrive in prohibition New York as jewelry thieves. After a spell in jail, the coldly ambitious Diamond hits on the idea of stealing from thieves himself and sets about getting close to gangster boss Arnold Rothstein to move in on his booze, girls, gambling, and drugs operations.','/rtKdsKykX4Oz5o3nbtyAtWthkKB.jpg','1960-02-03',101,'Released','The Wildest Mobster of the Roaring Twenties!','The Rise and Fall of Legs Diamond',43046,2.1687,6.1,'2T8LLJD42Mc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4029,_binary '\0','/26LKQHOk5v7XjUFxm4Pv05nYgln.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054248',8.2,26125,'it','Rocco e i suoi fratelli','When a impoverished widow’s family moves to the big city, two of her five sons become romantic rivals with deadly results.','/pngL8AraChIDOiWnKF2o3S9kJzJ.jpg','1960-10-07',178,'Released','DARING in its realism. STUNNING in its impact. BREATHTAKING in its scope.','Rocco and His Brothers',8422,4.9133,8,'54IuJ8ivZl0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4030,_binary '\0','/3FCisYSoJXlW2UdJwJq2tEtUP5Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054269',7.5,10138,'en','Saturday Night and Sunday Morning','A 22-year-old factory worker lets loose on the weekends: drinking, brawling, and dating two women, one of whom is older and married.','/ifhjfo8lZoJ9dvDQiWcnc3GeFK4.jpg','1960-10-27',90,'Released','Saturday night you have your fling at life...and Sunday morning you face up to it!','Saturday Night and Sunday Morning',37230,2.3465,7,'P9Ms04cAkws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4031,_binary '\0','/pL9D6yX1XQXY33HOOKOVhAQ4d3O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054279',7.3,4358,'en','School for Scoundrels','Hapless Henry Palfrey is patronised by his self-important chief clerk at work, ignored by restaurant waiters, conned by shady second-hand car salesmen, and, worst of all, endlessly wrong-footed by unspeakably rotten cad Raymond Delauney who has set his cap at April, new love of Palfrey\'s life. In desperation Henry enrolls at the College of Lifemanship to learn how to best such bounders and win the girl.','/1nmlCWFYx9wObdG11NtuUFemVpo.jpg','1960-03-24',94,'Released','Learn to gain weight by LOSING scruples!','School for Scoundrels',36741,1.449,6.9,'tnJMoNWK28M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4032,_binary '\0','/8wo5dN0nadfZDfGgqSw6PKwtD24.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054285',3.9,1872,'it','Seddok, l\'erede di Satana','When a singer is horribly disfigured in a car accident, a scientist develops a treatment which can restore her beauty by injecting her with a special serum. While performing the procedure, however, he falls in love with her. As the treatment begins to fail, he determines to save her appearance, regardless of how many women he must kill for her sake.','/nMwOVezYX24qmNs5HLyxEhDRoO6.jpg','1960-08-16',107,'Released','You\'ll gasp with Horror...','Atom Age Vampire',22699,1.6241,4.4,'NwnWMdbKo0g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4033,_binary '\0','/vSvKrxEaVnz95ZPBBQYpq35tFsI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054286',6.9,2921,'ja','青春残酷物語','A harsh young man seduces a freeloading young woman and eventually takes advantage of her knack for hitchhiking to rob middle-class men.','/pCoqS3MFmynMc3nKtqdlp99H165.jpg','1960-06-03',97,'Released',NULL,'Cruel Story of Youth',88527,2.4762,6.6,'hLQPVziBq6Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4034,_binary '\0','/jHuEVaTKVJPQtMeSt4uzVFbTsH3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054292',7.4,6227,'en','Sergeant Rutledge','Respected black cavalry Sergeant Brax Rutledge stands court-martial for raping and killing a white woman and murdering her father, his superior officer.','/jpi9dXkF4ZHUVxRDHjh6jJlrdun.jpg','1960-05-18',111,'Released','Forget all the suspense you have ever seen! Forget all the excitement you have ever known!','Sergeant Rutledge',43040,2.5111,7,'E9l3FmOngxQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4035,_binary '\0','/oQl4cEQWa6NoT5Qux1FfTXdTJKS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054295',6.5,2017,'en','Seven Thieves','A discredited professor and a sophisticated thief decide to join together and pick a team to pull off one last job--the casino vault in Monte Carlo.','/6yWo5PtqR2KhhZxp08lCRqGUKyY.jpg','1960-03-11',102,'Released','The robbery that rocked Monte Carlo!','Seven Thieves',64605,1.8196,6.59,'9NRHGCta_BY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4036,_binary '\0','/zEkAnvH9pfC47tKlk5Y6XhDXIGc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054296',6.8,1492,'en','Seven Ways from Sundown','A Texas Ranger must capture an outlaw and take him-in, while tangling with savage Apaches and greedy bounty-hunters on the way back to jail.','/vPKTDltWmjWgKRLRVw8eV7Ntn0T.jpg','1960-09-25',87,'Released','He stalked him... fought him... befriended him... but in the end he knew he\'d have to kill him !','Seven Ways from Sundown',78550,2.557,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4037,_binary '\0','/52wJzEuxLiZkxIm3PgQk0nToroF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054307',6.9,1508,'en','The Sign of Zorro','In this film, edited from eight episodes of Disney\'s hit TV series, Don Diego returns home to find his town under the heel of a cruel dictator, Capitan Monastario. Diego dons the mask of Zorro to fight the evil commandant\'s tyranny, and, with the help of his mute servant Bernardo, free the pueblo from his oppression.','/qyVR7SFGXpBjJ5RoxllrKca4OQ9.jpg','1958-11-18',91,'Released','MASKED RIDER LEAVES DREADED \'Z\'','The Sign of Zorro',462357,2.0752,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4038,_binary '\0','/6mZubQXGNnmZdSAHKNqw3JrDSgS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054310',7.2,9304,'en','Sink the Bismarck!','The story of the breakout of the German battleship Bismarck—accompanied by the heavy cruiser Prinz Eugen—during the early days of World War II. The Bismarck and her sister ship, Tirpitz, were the most powerful battleships in the European theater of World War II. The British Navy must find and destroy Bismarck before it can escape into the convoy lanes to inflict severe damage on the cargo shipping which was the lifeblood of the British Isles. With eight 15 inch guns, it was capable of destroying every ship in a convoy while remaining beyond the range of all Royal Navy warships.','/j6yfHLPpxidw2y4cVSA9odveGuW.jpg','1960-02-11',97,'Released','Personal! Powerful! Human! Heroic!','Sink the Bismarck!',18780,3.4771,6.853,'zmfxl2oQGqI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4039,_binary '\0','/toBNRGMjBPtGWMHUsuMKX9m4415.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054325',6.6,1491,'ja','１３号待避線より その護送車を狙え','A sniper kills two prisoners in a police van, and the driver sets out to find the killer.','/9lkQJVzUh0FWiOnoQWGhJ39vHCO.jpg','1960-01-27',79,'Released',NULL,'Take Aim at the Police Van',71723,1.2105,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4040,_binary '\0','/tF3P0scrDeYV8wC8Vs1ZBPQuiEJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054326',7.1,2015,'en','Sons and Lovers','The son of a working-class British mining family has dreams of pursuing an art career, but when he strikes up an affair with an older, married woman from the town it enrages his kind but possessive mother.','/7BDlr8XivWmNcDsb5ygnhs8CWiR.jpg','1960-06-23',103,'Released','You\'ll never forget the young lovers in...','Sons and Lovers',53939,1.6473,6.5,'9WaL4BJI45k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4041,_binary '\0','/9caD0fGCrp96JTFFeGyI0CGNj7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054331',7.9,152386,'en','Spartacus','The rebellious Thracian Spartacus, born and raised a slave, is sold to Gladiator trainer Batiatus. After weeks of being trained to kill for the arena, Spartacus turns on his owners and leads the other slaves in rebellion. As the rebels move from town to town, their numbers swell as escaped slaves join their ranks. Under the leadership of Spartacus, they make their way to southern Italy, where they will cross the sea and return to their homes.','/nqU4xAn3ygWA4fvXSBufRwdGhpr.jpg','1960-10-13',197,'Released','They trained him to kill for their pleasure ... but they trained him a little too well','Spartacus',967,11.3909,7.5,'R8aWcZa18pc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4042,_binary '\0','/uMThhmhAldIVGaJiFjVDNhrsIYI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054333',2.7,4417,'de','Ein Toter hing im Netz','A bite from a giant spider turns a man into a creature that terrorizes a group of women who survived a plane crash.','/zeT4ZDY2TpUKY0rYijfzQh8HTUv.jpg','1960-04-15',89,'Released',NULL,'Horrors of Spider Island',31392,1.9025,3.4,'BxuLzKH2ZFk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4043,_binary '\0','/1vVobMxGMR3lPvYvxyuWmKltSvf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054343',6.7,1706,'en','The Story of Ruth','Ruth is one of two Moabite women who marry the sons of Elimelech and Naomi. When Elimelech and sons Mahlon and Chillion die, leaving Naomi a widow with two widowed daughters-in-law, Naomi decides to return to Israel. One daughter-in-law, Orpah, bids her goodbye. Daughter-in-law Ruth however says she will not desert her.','/4MPqitAdH1WC52AOMZStTc6bRMX.jpg','1960-06-17',132,'Released','All The Spectacle Of Heathen Idolatry, Human Sacrifice, Pagan Revels - All The Beauty Of One Of The Bible\'s Timeless Love Stories!','The Story of Ruth',43042,2.9244,7.5,'2aIYtAxLi78','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4044,_binary '\0','/w0NQ4rA4MXh1SL9zEghKST8aO5D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054345',7.1,2959,'en','Strangers When We Meet','A suburban architect loves his wife but is bored with his marriage and with his work, so he takes up with the neglected, married beauty who lives down the street.','/3fGmqmBjkvnwCE188L8IdYztKnK.jpg','1960-06-29',117,'Released','\"I LOVE YOU BABY, BUT MY WIFE JUST REFUSES TO UNDERSTAND!\"','Strangers When We Meet',85926,2.3918,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4045,_binary '\0','/anqbIztffBf51E4NzkrI37uNS4d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054346',6.2,1534,'en','The Stranglers of Bombay','In 1826 British-ruled India, the secret Cult of Thugee demonstrates their worship of their goddess, Kali, by the mutilation and mass murder of thousands of Indians while pirating the shipments of the British East-Indian Tea Company. As the British military leaders play down the implications of the piracy and disappearances, a lone captain realizes that they are not just coincidence and sets out to uncover the source of the deviltry, at the risk of his career. Based on history.','/pQPz9R7Fr5FwEqe4FU4WrE2G3ba.jpg','1959-12-04',80,'Released','This is true! This is real! This actually happened!','The Stranglers of Bombay',85611,2.2984,6.5,'USVul-lOREM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4046,_binary '\0','/oQyQ0U7ykHh9dzV8vccdS7y7xYe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054353',7.1,5351,'en','The Sundowners','In the Australian Outback, the Carmody family--Paddy, Ida, and their teenage son Sean--are sheep drovers, always on the move. Ida and Sean want to settle down and buy a farm. Paddy wants to keep moving. A sheep-shearing contest, the birth of a child, drinking, gambling, and a racehorse will all have a part in the final decision.','/4WxvOiZ9M2Ftc9MV8uW4vvKiQgx.jpg','1960-12-08',133,'Released','Across Six Thousand Miles of Excitement...Across a Whole World of Adventure Comes the Rousing, Story of Real People Called \"The Sundowners\"!','The Sundowners',43047,1.9595,6.7,'ZD5N4oWbQM4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4047,_binary '\0','/pAXWetIy7heZdp1hSpQRAwnaxYb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054354',6.8,1644,'en','Sunrise at Campobello','The story of Franklin Roosevelt\'s bout with polio at age 40 in 1921 and how his family (and especially his wife Eleanor) cope with his illness. From being stricken while vacationing at Campobello to his triumphant nominating speech for Al Smith\'s presidency in 1924, the story follows the various influences on his life and his determination to recover.','/y9cJA6rz0cEcPmehvc1Rr1GvvCO.jpg','1960-09-28',144,'Released','The sun came up twice that day. Once in the heavens for all the world to see... once in the darkness for a man, his wife, and their children alone to share...','Sunrise at Campobello',72354,1.5763,6,'zSXGXwy1yDU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4048,_binary '\0','/vNijAksUUekLP0sMuuGctkSFK2L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054357',7.1,20234,'en','Swiss Family Robinson','After being shipwrecked, the Robinson family is marooned on an island inhabited only by an impressive array of wildlife. In true pioneer spirit, they quickly make themselves at home but soon face a danger even greater than nature: dastardly pirates.','/3ZItm1RcdwNuPnCaaqEFGrbVlcO.jpg','1960-12-21',126,'Released','THE ADVENTURE OF ADVENTURES!','Swiss Family Robinson',18444,4.5473,6.8,'O3qehNT3KjY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4049,_binary '\0','/qvx6YRZ4FKWmGpDzQhzRNNwlJUb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054358',5.8,1605,'en','Sword of Sherwood Forest','Robin of Loxley and his men stumble on a plot to overthrow Hubert Walter, King\'s Chancellor and Archbishop of Canterbury. The plotters, the Sheriff of Nottingham and the Earl of Newark, have set an ambush for Walter and Lady Marian Fitzwater. Will Robin get to them before it is too late?','/kvpCGViDZkHTF0EoeFdL7Jwa8CK.jpg','1960-12-26',80,'Released','All-New Adventures of Robin Hood! The world\'s most fearless fighter faces his greatest challenge!','Sword of Sherwood Forest',115972,2.1533,6.1,'GguPcDGiB5M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4050,_binary '\0','/lQ316raNbA3KC19g4dIg73gHyWm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054367',5.9,1425,'en','Tall Story','A young insecure college sportsman is in trouble. He wants to marry his very straightforward girlfriend, but has no money. When he is offered a bribe to fix a game, he is torn even more about the matter.','/7j5iMq8SQO2EwFdcUBf67zix4PK.jpg','1960-04-06',89,'Released','SUCH FUN! That college girl who can\'t help lovin\' tall boys!...','Tall Story',86297,2.6923,5.7,'s8gLnnyL7bw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4051,_binary '\0','/z69TdXY8Lnm3KE3XUjGXLBEyjjl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054371',6.9,4349,'de','Die 1000 Augen des Dr. Mabuse','A reporter is murdered while driving to his job. The Police are contacted by a clairvoyant who saw the death in a vision, but some dark force is preventing him from seeing the man behind the crime...','/fcHPdXIyfMiy5k1YUJxxrFKttUu.jpg','1960-09-14',99,'Released','Dr. Mabuse is on the loose!','The Thousand Eyes of Dr. Mabuse',19128,2.2035,6.8,'KozsS5c_yJQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4052,_binary '\0','/cEe3uMAKOejVHa8WlYWCjZPCg7M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054377',7.1,4184,'fr','Le Testament d\'Orphée','An 18th century poet travels through time in search of divine wisdom. In a mysterious wasteland, he has a series of enigmatic encounters with symbolic phantoms with whom he muses about the nature of art and his own career. Ultimately, the poet strives to achieve his rebirth as a celestial being.','/21ccswsdwgoLVUDsaxp0bVUsE1l.jpg','1960-02-18',80,'Released',NULL,'Testament of Orpheus',36878,2.8823,7.629,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4053,_binary '\0','/yTqF4FX15GKkxbH0XZCvZIEA1fK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054387',7.5,47791,'en','The Time Machine','A Victorian Englishman travels to the far future and finds that humanity has divided into two hostile species.','/sotBnRlFJ67cPisjAUXzbPxi9kC.jpg','1960-05-25',103,'Released','You Will Orbit into the Fantastic Future!','The Time Machine',2134,7.2279,7.4,'2GZnAbgGFxg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4054,_binary '\0','/kgAZX0WXLuK6YYQ6lKN2UdF1Tho.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054389',7.4,22054,'fr','Tirez sur le pianiste','Charlie is a former classical pianist who has changed his name and now plays jazz in a grimy Paris bar. When Charlie\'s brothers, Richard and Chico, surface and ask for Charlie\'s help while on the run from gangsters they have scammed, he aids their escape. Soon Charlie and Lena, a waitress at the same bar, face trouble when the gangsters arrive, looking for his brothers.','/6UhMIZaaoe2HUU7sEIwYpuYgugh.jpg','1960-11-25',85,'Released','François Truffaut, Brilliant Director Who Gave You the Award Winning \"The 400 Blows\", Now Brings to the Screen a Fascinating New Work That Plays in Many Keys...All of Them Delightful!','Shoot the Piano Player',1818,4.0176,7.185,'2u-6Q2L247c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4055,_binary '\0','/rJq9d4A3XjaReMHuLSt4p99Agpk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054393',4.9,3311,'en','Tormented','A jazz pianist is haunted by his dead ex-lover\'s crawling hand and floating head.','/8sGHAZVgizrAO2ixNliGVLDgZwg.jpg','1960-09-22',75,'Released','A ghost-woman owned him body and soul!','Tormented',28586,2.4856,5.1,'vVQ9qawk7I8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4056,_binary '\0','/2pbOZMwv3eFWohxXqjp2IF98nBL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054395',6.3,1581,'de','Die toten Augen von London','A disfigured killer with glazed-over white eyes is doing the dirty work so that an insurance agent-doctor can get the victims\' insurance money.','/9N43T336y2veGXJ6Qrsb2lmplF.jpg','1961-03-28',98,'Released','A city of fear becomes a city of death!','Dead Eyes of London',9633,1.9012,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4057,_binary '\0','/4o2FLyyEl5TlLjPJnHJjw3hYFZM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054403',7.1,1281,'en','The Trials of Oscar Wilde','England, 1890s. The brutal and embittered Marquis of Queensberry, who believes that his youngest son, Bosie, has an inappropriate relationship with the famous Irish writer Oscar Wilde, maintains an ongoing feud with the latter in order to ruin his reputation and cause his fall from grace.','/v5Kr4MvmqbBwS7a1CXFAsISmQCr.jpg','1960-05-28',125,'Released','This man… This Oscar Wilde!','The Trials of Oscar Wilde',172535,2.3557,6.4,'dvlsD_gaOrk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4058,_binary '\0','/f72GEQF2lKsdmEULSI9bWCbQylH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054407',8.5,24210,'fr','Le Trou','Four prison inmates have been hatching a plan to literally dig out of jail when another prisoner, Claude Gaspard, is moved into their cell. They take a risk and share their plan with the newcomer. Over the course of three days, the prisoners and friends break through the concrete floor using a bed post and begin to make their way through the sewer system – yet their escape is anything but assured.','/xyZhiOz5NHVBUKlpioxjwajy7pm.jpg','1960-03-18',132,'Released','Poor Gaspard...','Le Trou',29259,4.8108,8.2,'g2Sbo6JpDsY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4059,_binary '\0','/2ubyBykjjlNiJ9Dk7WUkUJ8Ndkv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054412',7.5,5213,'en','Tunes of Glory','Following World War II in peacetime Scotland, brigade headquarters replaces commanding officer Major Jock Sinclair, a boisterous battalion leader, with the strict, temperamental Lieutenant Colonel Basil Barrow. Resentful toward his replacement, Sinclair undermines Barrow\'s authority and damages his successor\'s reputation among the soldiers. Barrow faces an uphill battle in regaining the discipline and respect of his battalion.','/1Yf5ZggEMxybXGBRVdqzdHLpZ9h.jpg','1960-09-17',106,'Released','Colonel Jock Sinclair drank with his men... and sang and danced with them... until that day, when a shot rang out... and he stood alone!','Tunes of Glory',43048,1.9386,7,'GKfGi90T2Oc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4060,_binary '\0','/t2diJVmDo7ZQgIxuVDaOaa2FIe7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054413',7.7,1711,'it','Tutti a casa','When Italy surrenders to the Allies, part of the Italian army is dispersed and soldiers begin to return to their homes.','/xD9VusieQYGabQgMtKn06ZKZSvn.jpg','1960-10-27',117,'Released',NULL,'Everybody Go Home!',48955,2.0462,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4061,_binary '\0','/kpq9wHx1QaTrEGEn3rCd0nPdZjK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054415',3.4,1560,'en','12 to the Moon','Landed on the moon, Capt. John Anderson and his fellow astronauts quickly find their mission threatened – first by the disappearance of two team members, then by a troubling interaction with aliens who appear to be living within the moon itself. The aliens have weapons that could plunge parts of Earth into another ice age, and they\'re aiming for the United States.','/xZPAi8RWHdQ8ctKDE2RkxHsvFis.jpg','1960-02-03',75,'Released','Ride the Excitement Orbit to the Moon with the First Space Explorers!','12 to the Moon',61702,1.5117,2.8,'9Ud_SBew3e0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4062,_binary '\0','/6trIEq8wjlfDBUkJmpTzt8f2yB1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054416',6.3,3847,'en','The Two Faces of Dr. Jekyll','After a series of scientific experiments directed towards freeing the inner man and controlling human personalities, the kindly, generous Dr Henry Jekyll succeeds in freeing his own alter ego, Edward Hyde, a sadistic, evil creature whose pleasure is murder.','/sPhV0P8L1stGYLWtnQOAYYv031q.jpg','1960-10-24',88,'Released','LIKE NOTHING YOU HAVE EVER SEEN!','The Two Faces of Dr. Jekyll',3025,2.4392,6.1,'HM8FwYrbzZg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4063,_binary '\0','/uhvu9D1OdZGzSRJ56pIB2uTZ86i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054417',6.8,3101,'en','Two-Way Stretch','Three criminals plan to break out of prison the day before their release in order to carry out a daring jewel robbery, intending to establish the perfect alibi by returning to jail afterwards. First however they must get out, a task made more difficult by a new, stricter prison officer.','/n2SYAdyVl4ztoacZS10qH9LralF.jpg','1960-12-20',84,'Released',NULL,'Two-Way Stretch',39948,1.7954,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4064,_binary '\0','/pDN5EfHYT2ayy18dtyhxkEnMPie.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054422',5.6,1453,'it','Gli ultimi giorni di Pompei','Glaucus, a demobilized centurion returns home to Pompeii to find his father murdered by a gang of black-hooded Christian robbers that terrorizes the city and he decides to investigate the matter while the nearby volcano threatens to erupt.','/hcukiLNn4B8GLEhnj4CKUWsW4lD.jpg','1959-11-12',103,'Released','The Fiery Summit of Spectacle!','The Last Days of Pompeii',43098,2.483,6.2,'pDjnV6MvRGA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4065,_binary '\0','/cTuUFQSvFanffKPJfHaeYtxnSJb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054425',7.2,2323,'fr','Un taxi pour Tobrouk','During World War II, French Commandos join forces with a German officer in order to survive the African desert.','/2J7eq4oqKt9YrSTQW2SJXkeHcAm.jpg','1961-05-09',95,'Released','The most exciting, explosive journey the screen has ever taken through a minefield of human emotions.','Taxi for Tobruk',33336,2.3584,7.109,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4066,_binary '\0','/4RjyPqzXvfmH6fnVQ44Zr2IBQlY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054426',7,1293,'fr','Une aussi longue absence','Therese, a café owner, mourns the mysterious disappearance of her husband sixteen years earlier. A tramp arrives in the town and she believes him to be her husband. But he is suffering from amnesia and she tries to bring back his memory of earlier times.','/tPs6Lnp0vfiQDzZELxd4uI09AYa.jpg','1961-05-17',98,'Released',NULL,'The Long Absence',131836,1.931,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4067,_binary '\0','/vFno98QhEkyFcpdVI74kAdSa0ja.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054428',6.5,11124,'en','The Unforgiven','The neighbors of a frontier family turn on them when it is suspected that their beloved adopted daughter was stolen from the Kiowa tribe.','/9085eJIHF1LqoKgGWK74Z3dxXpo.jpg','1960-04-06',125,'Released','A new triumph from Academy Award winner John Huston','The Unforgiven',6643,4.3991,6.174,'UKpApK0gVDY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4068,_binary '\0','/lk5imhmwyMbjl7QsSO5Wrb2C0hv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054442',7.2,1740,'it','Il vigile','An unemployed man gets a job as traffic policeman but the traffic in the big city creates innumerous problems for the poor guy.','/wGj1SrP46McKydvcWQZv9kIGaAQ.jpg','1960-11-16',104,'Released',NULL,'The Traffic Policeman',60046,1.3803,7.345,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4069,_binary '\0','/tlQ2OBQAC7woOTZgk1vE9U69vQT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054443',7.3,21587,'en','Village of the Damned','In a small English village everyone suddenly falls unconscious. When they awake every woman of child bearing age is pregnant. The resulting children have the same strange blond hair, eyes and a strong connection to each other.','/qcpXud1UjQzlSe9A062w8Wqgira.jpg','1960-06-16',77,'Released','What Demonic Force Lurks Behind Those Eyes?','Village of the Damned',11773,4.2864,7.2,'pIeajPZim3s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4070,_binary '\0','/cxCKgeIeDk3gmtdZvHaVAm6t0td.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054446',5.9,1613,'en','Visit to a Small Planet','The weirdest alien of the galaxy pays a visit to Earth... Jerry Lewis is Kreton, a childish alien who, against his teacher\'s will leaves his planet to visit the Earth, and lands in the backyard of a famous television journalist who doesn\'t believe in UFOs and aliens. Wanting to study humans but not able to fully understand them, Kreton makes a mess out of it, generating a lot of comic situations.','/9Lp3ER3czBJH4RvXNEsY0cPVnbe.jpg','1960-02-04',85,'Released','The space race is on and Jerry\'s leading it... In reverse!','Visit to a Small Planet',88376,2.2066,5.3,'fzq15tpPl5k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4071,_binary '\0','/we3XcGn0jgj1tKrsjYCd7P3KLii.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054452',7.6,5610,'fr','La Vérité','As Dominique Marceau is being tried for the murder of Gilbert Tellier, accounts by different witnesses paint a picture of the kind of relationship the two used to share.','/ye15DMXYYZaN1b2R5S07m0NyDT7.jpg','1960-11-02',127,'Released','Truth is many things — so was the woman on trial for her life!','The Truth',61711,2.6408,7.583,'7SQc4dTGIOQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4072,_binary '\0','/bWNzZ2RNOXZWSLmRi2AozDutCZz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054453',6.3,2886,'en','The Wackiest Ship in the Army','Lieutenant Rip Crandall is hoodwinked into taking command of the \"Wackiest Ship in the Navy\" – a real garbage scow with a crew of misfits who don\'t know a jib from a jigger. What none of them knows, including Crandall, is that this ship has a very important top-secret mission to complete in waters patrolled by the Japanese fleet. Their mission will save hundreds of allied lives – if only they can get there in one piece.','/m20XB2JRygYywjwdGAoi5OFjtX9.jpg','1960-12-29',99,'Released','You\'ll crack your timbers when you see how the Navy sticks the Army sad sacks with the crumbiest ship afloat!','The Wackiest Ship in the Army',43752,2.2324,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4073,_binary '\0','/m9NzvzYugcjkkZ5A3WdQhI3Mbe7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054460',7.9,15742,'ja','悪い奴ほどよく眠る','In this loose adaptation of \"Hamlet,\" illegitimate son Kôichi Nishi climbs to a high position within a Japanese corporation and marries the crippled daughter of company vice president Iwabuchi. At the reception, the wedding cake is a replica of their corporate headquarters, but an aspect of the design reminds the party of the hushed-up death of Nishi\'s father. It is then that Nishi unleashes his plan to avenge his father\'s death.','/z0LhZ121uaqa31RUeu1mOnaFb5w.jpg','1960-09-19',150,'Released',NULL,'The Bad Sleep Well',31589,3.5948,7.7,'-_DPoSV-nxM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4074,_binary '\0','/t7tqV852hw3Kvp5TXyGokWTdlGK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054462',4.8,6197,'en','The Wasp Woman','The head of a major cosmetics company experiments on herself with a youth formula made from royal jelly extracted from wasps, but the formula\'s side effects have deadly consequences.','/6yU5PuyeXX7EHG5d1AdWMforNfn.jpg','1959-10-30',61,'Released','Horror Of The Winged Menace!','The Wasp Woman',27545,2.4519,4.5,'yQyhpo8_oys','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4075,_binary '\0','/oYmQAaH4NM6xuAH3jMEE2t5gmWR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054469',6.7,3491,'en','Where the Boys Are','Good girls Merritt, Melanie, Tuggle and Angie - all students at mid-western Penmore University - are planning on going to Fort Lauderdale, Florida for spring break to get away from the mid-western snow despite not having much money to spend once there. On the drive down, they admit their real purpose is to go where the boys are.','/if6vjNZZX2JEclfd4rcus9kOHwT.jpg','1960-12-28',99,'Released','The hilarious inside story of those rip-roaring spring vacations!','Where the Boys Are',43049,2.9702,6.1,'tKyZKNNWngo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4076,_binary '\0','/s6xVF31iDSRYCumfyrbUVXmTZsp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054473',6.5,2001,'en','Who Was That Lady?','In order to get back into the good graces with his wife with whom he has had a misunderstanding, a young chemistry professor concocts a wild story that he is an undercover FBI agent. To help him with his story he enlists the aid of a friend who is a TV writer. The wife swallows the story and the film\'s climax takes place in the sub-basements of the Empire State Building. The professor and his friend, believing themselves prisoners on an enemy submarine, patriotically try to scuttle the vessel and succeed only in rocking the building.','/aRf7LnZD6zOTHbM4gpVXDmWibpU.jpg','1960-04-08',115,'Released','A light-hearted leer at love among the adults!','Who Was That Lady?',105406,2.5775,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4077,_binary '\0','/o6nNP4IPopW7xxJloR6MJJRVBYS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054476',7.5,6725,'en','Wild River','A young bureaucrat for the Tennessee Valley Authority goes to rural Tennessee to oversee the building of a dam. He encounters opposition from the local people, in particular a farmer who objects to his employment (with pay) of local black laborers. Much of the plot revolves around the eviction of a stubborn octogenarian from her home on an island in the river, and the young man\'s love affair with that woman\'s widowed granddaughter. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with The Film Foundation.','/u5zzhqAkxMPy6kqXL0Pk54Cl2fr.jpg','1960-05-26',110,'Released','The Wild Language... The Wild Hungers... The Wild Furies!','Wild River',82311,2.4571,7.236,'mZm_Tfk-yD4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4078,_binary '\0','/8H4aMPXzGEGdtErrHqGoeohIU0D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054483',6.9,3098,'en','The World of Suzie Wong','A Hong Kong prostitute tries modeling and falls for the artist who\'s painting her.','/5EzuPR3FEBKp2ytdFVJfvOLmFrs.jpg','1960-11-10',126,'Released','You are the first man I ever loved... and the world has only just begun...','The World of Suzie Wong',45608,2.3589,6.6,'jnepiAcqb_g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4079,_binary '\0','/dxjjKUulnhB6sLND0WuYJtURUxE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054494',6.9,7342,'fr','Zazie dans le métro','A brash and precocious ten-year-old comes to Paris for a whirlwind weekend with her rakish uncle.','/hl0loQ9fci2PMdRFuZIYoHTP8x8.jpg','1960-10-28',93,'Released','Liberté... Insanité... Hilarité!','Zazie dans le Métro',2546,2.8195,6.562,'5bZ5MoRKYTg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4080,_binary '\0','/9ICHY1WBXwZ2qdQF3L9EN4MHPQa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054495',7.4,1490,'pl','Zezowate szczęście','To convince the prison warden against releasing him, a middle-aged Polish man recounts his life, one he considers to have been characterized by exceptionally bad luck.','/u0EH5axFCg5Vi46ZsUqQObYkw6U.jpg','1960-04-04',108,'Released',NULL,'Bad Luck',121455,0.9968,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4081,_binary '\0','/lVceRZ2dc1XJQQBfLuwzhUWPhz1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054594',6.7,10208,'en','The Absent-Minded Professor','Bumbling professor Ned Brainard accidentally invents flying rubber, or \"Flubber\", an incredible material that gains energy every time it strikes a hard surface. It allows for the invention of shoes that can allow jumps of amazing heights and enables a modified Model-T to fly. Unfortunately, no one is interested in the material except for Alonzo Hawk, a corrupt businessman who wants to steal the material for himself.','/gCnuDDqoyaBdeeItQ4BjKtYpzF6.jpg','1961-01-20',96,'Released','The most amazing discovery since laughter!','The Absent-Minded Professor',17984,3.5416,6.5,'QrwqIEIQuoY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4082,_binary '\0','/rJSCS5EP9JGjNECa5hEB9Bsibjf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054599',7.6,11372,'it','Accattone','A pimp with no other means to provide for himself finds his life spiralling out of control when his prostitute is sent to prison.','/113ts2Bmm5CZ3YJMwfCU9XGFCAf.jpg','1961-09-25',117,'Released',NULL,'Accattone',12491,2.0428,7.716,'M9fv1En4LUQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4083,_binary '\0','/davOfwYOgOTLsJLSasJQ6tOAzgh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054614',7.1,1937,'en','All Night Long','Over the course of one eventful evening, the anniversary celebration of the musical and romantic partners Aurelius Rex and Delia Lane, a jealous, ambitious drummer, Johnny Cousin, attempts to tear the interracial couple apart.','/kL0JqtS5LSvDNDvebw5J0IaBVgS.jpg','1962-02-06',91,'Released',NULL,'All Night Long',37038,1.4006,6.8,'T9BOe-af7y4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4084,_binary '\0','/h1ov8VcVCiZsnWRu4EjZ74R33GP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054632',7.6,27315,'fr','L\'Année dernière à Marienbad','At a weekend gathering, a man tells a woman that they had spent time there together a year prior. But, the woman has no recollection whatsoever and is convinced that he is simply fabricating the encounter. The more he speaks about their activities the previous year however, the more compelling he becomes. The question remains however – did they meet previously or not?','/syIJCqiSkGRJTlyaBtyI5jqPtE7.jpg','1961-09-29',95,'Released','Extraordinary! Hypnotic! Beautiful! Masterful!','Last Year at Marienbad',4024,4.4631,7.436,'p3Tvl1Fuxt8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4085,_binary '\0','/iILH38d6svBaalO4o3IWQATDWDF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054640',7,1798,'it','L\'assassino','Suave antiques dealer Alfredo Martelli is picked up by the police with no justification. At the precinct, Martelli realizes what the investigation is all about-- that he is the main suspect in the killing of his wealthy ex-lover. Is he guilty, or is he just a sleaze?','/kFxmjIcfsxDeiuna9SzPPtzwlZ4.jpg','1961-04-01',97,'Released',NULL,'The Assassin',47240,1.6899,6.9,'oDK7EsYjHAY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4086,_binary '\0','/2D9KjNLPs7LbngAieI1s7Xd82rk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054642',5.5,2364,'en','Atlantis: The Lost Continent','A Greek Fisherman brings an Atlantean Princess back to her homeland which is the mythical city of Atlantis. He is enslaved for his trouble. The King is being manipulated by an evil sorcerer who is bent on using a natural resource of Atlantis to take over the world. The Atlanteans, or rather the slaves of Atlantis, are forced to mine a crystalline material which absorbs the suns rays. These crystals can then be used for warmth. The misuse of science has created weapons out of the crystals that can fire a heat ray to destroy whatever it touches.','/ygC5yVRyrXqwMSmcpvf2khjThAR.jpg','1961-05-03',90,'Released','SIGHTS NEVER BEFORE SEEN - Adventure never before experienced!','Atlantis: The Lost Continent',28758,2.8262,5.144,'zDCWnvBk-DI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4087,_binary '\0','/by47BadpbtQYdPyOLmvbnoSxmYR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054649',6.1,5257,'en','Babes in Toyland','All roads lead to magical, merry Toyland as Mary Contrary and Tom Piper prepare for their wedding! But villainous Barnaby wants Mary for himself, so he kidnaps Tom, setting off a series of comic chases, searches, and double-crosses! The \"March Of The Wooden Soldiers\" helps put Barnaby in his place, and ensures a \"happily ever after\" for Tom and Mary!','/pPNVXVQTCgdUiIiyxxYlTTqkgiZ.jpg','1961-12-14',106,'Released','The happiest, most delightful musical comedy of your lifetime!','Babes in Toyland',32611,2.5376,5.9,'SQf0Ne3UvPE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4088,_binary '\0','/hyy0mqJtpj1Z9AQ39k1avhNlCam.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054652',6.3,2095,'en','Bachelor in Paradise','A bachelor author of sleazy books moves to a family-oriented subdivision where he becomes an unofficial relationship advisor to unhappy local housewives, to the dismay of their respective husbands who suspect him of sexual misconduct.','/b5KDQqX4wIbT9G2Er8juwnd3E8c.jpg','1961-11-01',109,'Released','THE TRUE CONFESSIONS and INTIMATE SECRETS of the world\'s greatest authority on LOVE','Bachelor in Paradise',52841,2.6467,6.3,'bDctz-G3rJ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4089,_binary '\0','/4vRCp0dS5q4fHit9ju05VyZvst8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054653',6.6,1509,'en','Back Street','Ambitious but thwarted, Rae Smith meets handsome U.S. Marine Paul Saxon, of the Saxon department store chain, as he passes through Lincoln, Nebraska, on his way home from World War II. There\'s a definite spark between them but circumstances intervene and he leaves town without her. Later she learns he\'s married. Determined to make it as a fashion designer, Rae moves to New York City and becomes a great success. One day she happens to meet Paul again and again there\'s that spark but he\'s still married so, as a form of escape, Rae moves to Rome to set up shop. Once again she meets Paul and finally they begin an actual affair since Paul\'s shrewish, drunken wife, Liz, won\'t give him a divorce. Time passes, the affair continues whenever time and place permit, but then, Paul\'s young son finds out about Rae and Rae\'s back-street world begins to crumble.','/xTxEV8GW0ucigMVzps6tGUwBWDB.jpg','1961-10-11',107,'Released',NULL,'Back Street',43017,2.0061,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4090,_binary '\0','/elfVwrfn5goenMteFuYboz5q2BN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054665',7.7,3681,'cs','Baron Prášil','A 20th century man lands on the Moon and discovers that Baron Munchausen has beaten him to it, accompanied by Cyrano de Bergerac and the characters from Jules Verne\'s novels about the conquest of the satellite.','/azAhyBd8netxD18VdYo7C4oUvbR.jpg','1962-07-01',85,'Released',NULL,'The Fabulous Baron Munchausen',41213,2.1167,7.4,'Na1h7ozW9VQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4091,_binary '\0','/oYj4xLndnUjuZsW982Ke82k64NE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054668',5.1,1521,'es','El barón del terror','In 1661 Mexico, Baron Vitelius is executed for witchcraft. 300 years later, during a comet\'s return, he resurfaces as a brain-eating monster seeking revenge on the Inquisitors\' descendants.','/yCtRflp5RrPnxfOyLZCq09DVn1r.jpg','1962-11-09',77,'Released','The most bizarre horror movie. Ever.','The Brainiac',42992,1.6463,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4092,_binary '\0','/f1z9wc6ag3f3TK9v75esKuRI5sV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054673',2,10311,'en','The Beast of Yucca Flats','A refugee Soviet scientist arrives at a desert airport carrying secret documents, but is attacked by a pair of KGB assassins and escapes into the desert, where he comes in range of an American nuclear test and is transformed into a mindless killing beast.','/EK8aMR79yM1JnaXbbwKSIeACV9.jpg','1961-06-02',54,'Released','Commies made him an atomic mutant!','The Beast of Yucca Flats',22727,1.3499,2.3,'BsdB9K9k22c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4093,_binary '\0','/pIoGup7Z6U5MlUbDA4eeLiqzgX8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054687',7.4,6493,'en','Blast of Silence','A hired killer from Cleveland has a job to do on a second-string mob boss in New York. But a special girl from his past and a fat gun dealer with pet rats get in his way.','/53vcxT6Ptz5uR9T64IwIudZqcuK.jpg','1961-03-20',77,'Released','An unforgettable experience in suspense! ... as seconds tick off a timetable ... for murder!','Blast of Silence',32008,1.8451,6.934,'mZAdWwDd9BY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4094,_binary '\0','/qBPuSZdmEhZTsBj2YrYGmvgPbCV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054691',3.7,2700,'en','Bloodlust!','Two couples are on a boating trip when they come across an uncharted island. The four investigate and find themselves in the clutches of Dr. Albert Balleau, whose hobby is hunting both animals and humans… The group tries to escape only to be thwarted by Dr. Balleau and his henchmen.','/yWqwoB0ILwhTwyPGPZQ9FZJhjMx.jpg','1961-09-13',68,'Released','Maniac Hunts Humans In A Jungle Hell!','Bloodlust!',22749,1.2159,4.4,'tKaIfpn9-AE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4095,_binary '\0','/xjenQamrkIiKWlfBviOnL5j7E34.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054692',6.1,8545,'en','Blue Hawaii','Just discharged GI Chad Gates returns to Hawaii, where he becomes a tour guide, defying his mother\'s wishes for him to join the family business.','/kujIwcrOsgcyRLbs5xfwU1ADwHk.jpg','1961-11-22',102,'Released','Ecstatic romance... Exotic dances... Exciting music IN THE WORLD\'S LUSHEST PARADISE OF SONG!','Blue Hawaii',18228,3.3969,6.041,'tlGa7L_fqy0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4096,_binary '\0','/jXZ2tyJl44yKvh22I6ooQwU5rFM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054698',7.5,206374,'en','Breakfast at Tiffany\'s','Holly Golightly is an eccentric New York City playgirl determined to marry a Brazilian millionaire. But when young writer Paul Varjak moves into her apartment building, her past threatens to get in their way.','/79xm4gXw4l7A5D0XukUOJRocFYQ.jpg','1961-10-06',115,'Released','Audrey Hepburn plays that daring, darling Holly Golightly to a new high in entertainment delight!','Breakfast at Tiffany\'s',164,10.1083,7.613,'Gb9VgXnRY0s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4097,_binary '\0','/lyig5sHaoCGQOllOMub4vT6sqqO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054709',7.4,2933,'ja','豚と軍艦','In the city of Yokosuka, Kinta and his lover Haruko, both involved with yakuza, brave the post-occupation period with a goal to be together.','/u7fbMQSE5OMKYKOXbSAp5WOJRBj.jpg','1961-01-21',108,'Released',NULL,'Pigs and Battleships',31104,2.2093,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4098,_binary '\0','/3DYbK601E6I0zQ80etRLMcime4A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054724',3.6,1859,'en','I Eat Your Skin','A playboy adventure novelist joins his publisher on an expedition to Voodoo Island in the Caribbean, where a cancer researcher is being forced to turn the tribes-people into zombies.','/mbBgHCs9gR6ba3oQ24FH0TZ2vbl.jpg','1971-05-05',84,'Released','A Carribean zombie nightmare','I Eat Your Skin',93890,1.5427,3.32,'zNejoosw3Vk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4099,_binary '\0','/yZPsZdFXarKVHuTUlLTBZMpl97H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054727',6,2838,'en','Carry On Regardless','After a bunch of no-hopers approaches an employment agency, the anarchy mounts as they do a series of odd jobs, including a chimp\'s tea party, trying to stay sober at a wine tasting… and demolishing a house.','/axFLimJw7un1RKFcPjGeoonmU0b.jpg','1961-04-04',87,'Released','Can you stand the laughs? Do you cry real tears at comedy? Do your sides ache when you laugh too hard?','Carry On Regardless',32115,1.9664,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4100,_binary '\0','/miAp3r4Awr1SBloFTzv2sACfID9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054731',7.5,3927,'en','Cash on Demand','A charming but ruthless criminal holds the family of a bank manager hostage as part of a cold-blooded plan to steal £90,000.','/7LmxstUXIjILQjuWKhC3SSzp9Ni.jpg','1961-12-20',80,'Released','How to rob a bank... and get away with it?','Cash on Demand',37343,1.942,7.566,'jGJpQdMWndM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4101,_binary '\0','/vQaRdr6wwYmGZSGk9UfROh0eMaK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054734',7,1606,'fr','Le cave se rebiffe','\"Le Dabe\" retired many years ago and now he lives in the Tropics where he owns stables and horses. He is a very rich man. He was the king of all money counterfeiters. He is contacted from Paris to organize a new job. He says no. But when he finds out the the currency that should be counterfeited is the Dutch florin, he accepts immediately. He retired after having counterfeited 100 florin notes just before the Queen Wilhelmina retired them from circulation. He flies to Paris. But the gang is not to be trusted, at least not all of them.','/h8yMOVojgPug4zYQZqHedZKGN6C.jpg','1961-09-27',98,'Released',NULL,'The Counterfeiters of Paris',59434,3.4184,7.013,'dATLg75mpTg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4102,_binary '\0','/RkMXpjQD9ww1b5hUAkzlCaVGUd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054743',7.8,21330,'en','The Children\'s Hour','An unruly student at a private all-girls boarding school scandalously accuses the two women who run it of having a romantic relationship.','/goyEWixvULM2IRN4KsKibyrJE4J.jpg','1961-12-19',108,'Released','Can an ugly rumor destroy what\'s beautiful?','The Children\'s Hour',20139,4.8622,7.7,'rft9MMcq708','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4103,_binary '\0','/bolMHmAoPcY9CQ9IMpJPLSr4azQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054745',7.4,4082,'fr','Chronique d\'un été (Paris 1960)','Paris, summer 1960. Anthropologist and filmmaker Jean Rouch and sociologist and film critic Edgar Morin wander through the crowded streets asking passersby how they cope with life\'s misfortunes.','/cKsFs0FUJBy4b8ihPpaeyRl2SJs.jpg','1961-10-20',91,'Released','The first film of cinéma vérité','Chronicle of a Summer',84972,1.8901,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4104,_binary '\0','/3TcUsPiVU0fSLX0Mk7lc3DDuzkY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054749',7.7,13956,'it','La ciociara','A young widow flees from Rome during WWII and takes her lonely twelve-year-old-daughter to her rural hometown but the horrors of war soon catch up with them.','/biWDAUQD58enMEcyO2BqIVSycF4.jpg','1960-12-22',100,'Released','Suddenly, Love Becomes Lust… Innocence becomes shame… As two women are trapped by violent passion and unforgettable terror!','Two Women',24167,5.1337,7.8,'IRZN_u994r4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4105,_binary '\0','/606bzfxrapnnIJA8P354u8tzqF3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054756',5.8,4991,'it','Il colosso di Rodi','While on holiday in Rhodes, Athenian war hero Darios becomes involved in two different plots to overthrow the tyrannical king, one from Rhodian patriots and the other from sinister Phoenician agents.','/xb5PBtqe5rHJkuXwwJGxXwjUcZA.jpg','1961-06-15',127,'Released','A monster statue of bronze and stone...A fabulous fortress 20 stories tall!','The Colossus of Rhodes',43020,3.852,5.934,'jh1hmDr11SY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4106,_binary '\0','/b0J2Gx90w8EulIDLzhvgchVG7gF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054757',6.8,11018,'en','The Comancheros','Texas Ranger Jake Cutter arrests gambler Paul Regret, but soon finds himself teamed with his prisoner in an undercover effort to defeat a band of renegade arms merchants and thieves known as Comancheros.','/awFLQbAuddc9atznFrdFZTeuhRA.jpg','1961-12-16',105,'Released','Big Jake the Adventurer... Paul Regret the Gambler... Pilar the Gypsy beauty... Three With a Past... Destined to Cross and Clash... In a Kingdom of Killers!','The Comancheros',30462,3.9313,6.639,'nWfBenEh28Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4107,_binary '\0','/9IIoVqEM1xLvNnKmKxRdI2VTGSg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054759',6.9,4579,'en','Come September','Robert Talbot, an American millionaire, arrives early for his annual vacation at his luxurious Italian villa. His long-time girlfriend Lisa has given up waiting for him and has decided to marry another man. Meanwhile, his sneaky business associate Maurice secretly misappropriates the villa as a hotel while Talbot is away. The current guests of the \"hotel\" are a group of young American girls.','/zCG13x6TxmsXJCsW0BAhBOTxxOI.jpg','1961-08-09',112,'Released','A Quiet hideaway... A Secret rendezvous... then the teen-agers barged in!','Come September',22386,3.0974,6.8,'9j3vxhzM8MY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4108,_binary '\0','/isdAapzFRHWww5tr8MRF1qyjxT2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054763',7,1219,'en','The Connection','Eight drug addicts are waiting for their connection in a New York apartment while a two-man documentary team films the proceedings. Things go out of control as the men grow increasingly nervous and the cameraman keeps recording.','/6WXMlf7ky3zbyfHTfTEmrmj1TVc.jpg','1962-02-15',103,'Released','Men Held Captive By the Power Of Drugs','The Connection',58227,1.6549,6.5,'frOgv6UNGiA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4109,_binary '\0','/kX7mCfaungQ8VvceZw0lMUPHfJB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054768',3.5,3614,'en','Creature from the Haunted Sea','A crook decides to bump off members of his inept crew and blame their deaths on a legendary sea creature. What he doesn\'t know is that the creature is real.','/9fZwh9aYHPw5pOT199R3yprJBgb.jpg','1961-06-01',75,'Released','What was the unspeakable secret of the SEA OF LOST SHIPS?','Creature from the Haunted Sea',48202,2.0248,3.7,'MbQxUybXel4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4110,_binary '\0','/kHmAXmPOzFOct3TqZUZZBUBYfjI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054777',6.5,7915,'en','The Curse of the Werewolf','A child conceived by a mute servant girl transforms from an innocent youth to a killer beast at night with uncontrollable urges.','/eKQ6kovQVp2I7g1hJegOo8vRBhu.jpg','1961-05-01',93,'Released','HALF-MAN...HALF-WOLF...COMPELLED BY THE HIDEOUS CURSE OF HIS EVIL BIRTH TO DESTROY EVEN THOSE WHO LOVED HIM!','The Curse of the Werewolf',28752,3.1169,6.5,'VpDSqf8y5Ys','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4111,_binary '\0','/nsu5cnimX7r5gSKQV1qFfRp66aj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054790',7.2,7108,'en','The Day the Earth Caught Fire','British reporters suspect an international cover-up of a global disaster in progress... and they\'re right. Hysterical panic has engulfed the world after the United States and the Soviet Union simultaneously detonate nuclear devices and have caused the orbit of the Earth to alter, sending it hurtling towards the sun.','/m0G0b528YVdrayoqmuuwKxRMXdS.jpg','1961-11-01',98,'Released','The INCREDIBLE becomes Real! The IMPOSSIBLE becomes Fact! The UNBELIEVABLE becomes True!','The Day the Earth Caught Fire',28430,2.9946,6.81,'IUFtgep9sj4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4112,_binary '\0','/rboKR7SxAqJIAba0a05xzypQ5Nh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054795',6,3247,'en','The Deadly Companions','An ex-army officer accidentally kills a woman\'s son and tries to make up for it by escorting the funeral procession through dangerous Indian territory.','/jKViOlqMMdL7H51UgLuNyIMCtKh.jpg','1961-06-06',93,'Released','ALONE... IN AN UNTAMED LAND -- WITH THREE MEN WHO FORCED THEIR WAY INTO HER LIFE!','The Deadly Companions',18449,2.7024,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4113,_binary '\0','/yZjUERxuw11QiL3UGZVrpaZIu3q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054803',7.5,1452,'ru','Девять дней одного года','Set in the Soviet scientific community, the story follows two dedicated physicists whose close friendship unfolds amid dangerous nuclear research, shaped by their shared affection for a strong-willed woman. Radiation exposure, scientific ambition, and romantic rivalries intersect as the characters confront the physical risks of their work and the personal consequences of their choices.','/in63ERZ0MZ090DDxV1scjfnpMQT.jpg','1962-03-05',109,'Released',NULL,'Nine Days of One Year',131045,1.3217,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4114,_binary '\0','/fUhx4x5QZwNVdvpdbPNEdMF1oY0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054805',6.4,2776,'en','The Devil at 4 O\'Clock','A crusty, eccentric priest recruits three reluctant convicts to help him rescue a children\'s leper colony from a Pacific island menaced by a smoldering volcano.','/k3HVHD54IZNoujxUzIwYx51ARNw.jpg','1961-10-18',126,'Released','They jumped into hell to save part of heaven.','The Devil at 4 O\'Clock',31916,3.2314,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4115,_binary '\0','/rnJXhvqQ6QQCUOoruegLdOtbxS5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054814',6.9,2119,'it','Don Camillo monsignore... ma non troppo','Don Camillo (now bishop) and Peppone (now senator) return to the town of Brescello and rekindle their friendly rivalry.','/2218LuH9Rt3bOCCurlzWGlVnHvR.jpg','1961-10-07',109,'Released',NULL,'Don Camillo: Monsignor',11580,1.9934,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4116,_binary '\0','/oxTiXHJ821lONbtwy38APR7PhjW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054817',5.5,1257,'en','Five Minutes to Live','A guitar playing killer terrorizes a housewife while his partner robs the bank where her husband works.','/aIduD55OQKSwC3XU34PF3ClwIW7.jpg','1961-12-07',73,'Released','How could she extend the moments he had given her?','Five Minutes to Live',37560,1.9014,5.5,'ztqyuLUM75Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4117,_binary '\0','/6fX4DqAGPBVDcN0IhETXwfGDy9N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054821',7.7,13315,'fr','Le Doulos','Enigmatic gangster Silien may or may not be responsible for informing on Faugel, who was just released from prison and is already involved in what should be a simple heist. By the end of this brutal, twisting, and multilayered policier, who will be left to trust?','/f8Su2mIJ5PyL2NkkrYnswX5IydV.jpg','1962-12-13',108,'Released','Raw! Shocking! Savage!','Le Doulos',20778,3.3106,7.4,'5-NbnHocnFk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4118,_binary '\0','/dWgBxm52s06axo1M7dNrBC02t2n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054823',5,1277,'en','Doctor Blood\'s Coffin','After being thrown out of medical school for ethical violations, Dr. Peter Blood returns home to a small Cornish village, where he sets up a research laboratory in a secluded cave. There, he attempts to revive the dead, using kidnapped humans -- who he views as unworthy of life -- for their body parts, specifically, their hearts.','/jdTpS8mChlGE6o68DcSaxH4oCtO.jpg','1961-02-20',92,'Released','We dare you to look into Doctor Blood\'s Coffin.','Doctor Blood\'s Coffin',50567,1.6195,5.3,'CFiQpWU-vys','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4119,_binary '\0','/7V3Ips6p93w7JhpAIm0p9PLCTLZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054847',7.2,17451,'en','El Cid','Epic film of the legendary Spanish hero, Rodrigo Diaz (\"El Cid\" to his followers), who, without compromising his strict sense of honour, still succeeds in taking the initiative and driving the Moors from Spain.','/a6DY3LDlXFUDuXm47zXTOfiisxP.jpg','1961-10-24',187,'Released','The GREATEST ROMANCE and ADVENTURE in a THOUSAND YEARS!','El Cid',16638,4.142,6.8,'1ZzCrkIf5Sc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4120,_binary '\0','/6erRewcxzNQBQstkD0s8DjCS4my.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054850',6.1,2864,'it','Ercole al centro della terra','Upon his return from battle in the previous film, the great warrior Hercules learns that his lover, Daianara, has lost her senses. According to the oracle Medea, Dianara\'s only hope is the Stone of Forgetfulness which lies deep in the realm of Hades. Hercules, with two companions, Theseus and Telemachus, embarks on a dangerous quest for the stone, while he is unaware that Dianara\'s guardian, King Lico, is the one responsible for her condition and plots to have the girl for himself as his bride upon her revival.','/tGmVETh3SLQpYXoEEQ9QVC803NE.jpg','1961-11-16',86,'Released','An All New Height in Fright and Might!','Hercules in the Haunted World',28058,2.5186,6.6,'fK0N1ixxPgo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4121,_binary '\0','/3EFgn1MZ1GOZBTExHlWiXVx4sy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054851',4.4,1841,'it','Ercole alla conquista di Atlantide','King Androcles of Thebes commands a ship in search of a threat to Greece, predicted by an atmospheric oracle. Hercules is part of the crew, but the strongman falls overboard in a thick fog. Washed ashore, he saves a young Ismene from Proteus, an evil, shape-shifting creature. Ismene takes Hercules to Atlantis, where he discovers that her mother, Queen Antinea, has captured Androcles. Hercules schemes to rescue him and thwart Antinea\'s dream of world conquest.','/w7AmUyC8irs9ho31dC4SEl2mLRb.jpg','1961-08-19',101,'Released','THE WEIRDEST! THE WILDEST! Half Woman! Half Stone!','Hercules and the Captive Women',42576,2.6005,4.3,'04X5SanhcmA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4122,_binary '\0','/awSueB6D7HcBR9rm7DWpyPxXNfY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054853',6.4,2384,'en','The Errand Boy','Paramutual Pictures wants to know where all the money is going so they hire Morty to be their spy. Morty works for Mr. Sneak and gets a job in the mail room so that he can have access to the lot. But all that Morty ever finds is that he can cause havoc no matter what he does.','/htJbw1ztW0m7bdJytMMOXWhgHgq.jpg','1961-11-28',92,'Released','Fractures Hollywood with a Million Howls!','The Errand Boy',35189,2.7186,6.2,'L4Gg0bob2sM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4123,_binary '\0','/xTREOdhJu1Ia8S95hyK9n8cUDLX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054861',6.6,1605,'en','The Exiles','The story of one night in the lives of a group of young Native American men and women who have left their reservations and are now living in the Bunker Hill district of Los Angeles.','/t0ryDIbU9uh0WNg9QZFVr3xfFRS.jpg','1961-07-13',72,'Released',NULL,'The Exiles',84249,0.775,6.2,'GLlsAme5fIQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4124,_binary '\0','/lR6w55w1XYU9udAPWmCv6EA9Nib.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054866',6.8,2997,'en','Fanny','Almost 19-year-old Marius feels himself in a rut in Marseille, his life planned for him by his cafe\'-owning father, and he longs for the sea. The night before he is to leave on a 5-year voyage, Fanny, a girl he grew up with, reveals that she is in love with him, and he discovers that he is in love with her. He must choose between an exciting life at sea, and a boring life with the woman he loves. And Fanny must choose between keeping the man she loves, and letting him live the life he seems to want.','/8hEQpSE3D9rsMw37N30T9EZwLoa.jpg','1961-06-28',133,'Released','FANNY IS ALL THE LOVE STORIES OF THE WORLD ROLLED INTO ONE.','Fanny',84050,1.5441,6.7,'Y2fwv7aX_t4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4125,_binary '\0','/bscqiQRZJqRpnX5aD79H0MNLro6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054880',4.5,1842,'en','Flaming Creatures','Filmmaker and artist Jack Smith described his own film as a “comedy set in a haunted movie studio.” Flaming Creatures begins humorously enough with several men and women, mostly of indeterminate gender, vamping it up in front of the camera and participating in a mock advertisement for an indelible, heart-shaped brand of lipstick. However, things take a dark, nightmarish turn when a transvestite chases, catches and begins molesting a woman. Soon, all of the titular “creatures” participate in a (mostly clothed) orgy that causes a massive earthquake. After the creatures are killed in the resulting chaos, a vampire dressed like an old Hollywood starlet rises from her coffin to resurrect the dead. All ends happily enough when the now undead creatures dance with each other, even though another orgy and earthquake loom over the end title card.','/6WGiHbL7BGoieVwBzcn8ivaxOFM.jpg','1963-04-29',42,'Released',NULL,'Flaming Creatures',47122,0.9547,4.8,'1i3IJmZEKlQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4126,_binary '\0','/3x8JFMv2SNgnlFKs9HalQOoEaDn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054885',6.9,4124,'en','Flower Drum Song','A young woman arrives in San Francisco\'s Chinatown, from Hong Kong, with the intention of marrying a rakish nightclub owner, unaware he is involved with one of his singers.','/d87EHTG1F1uNOWzu8i0yYssWRX5.jpg','1961-11-09',133,'Released','Most joyous hit lights up the screen!','Flower Drum Song',25105,1.6925,6.3,'7bLabYjfW9g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4127,_binary '\0','/47vaUixME69vAungk1fuAE9Y83A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054890',6.5,2682,'en','The Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse','In Argentina, one daughter of patriarch Madariaga is married to a Frenchman while the other is married to a German thus leading to a crisis when Nazi Germany occupies France and some Madariaga family members fight on opposite sides.','/sHVVqS0tpm6JI4sWr94u5vzZOvO.jpg','1962-02-07',153,'Released','Paris, city of lovers... the day the clocks stopped turning and the world stood still...','The Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse',50474,2.741,6,'hiSpSjYO-XU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4128,_binary '\0','/t3D4fBDYxtV32P6VqQMbzJB0pD4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054892',6.3,1262,'en','Francis of Assisi','In 13th century Italy, Francis Bernardone, the son of an Assisi merchant, renounces a promising army career in favor of a monastic life and starts his own religious order, sanctioned by the Pope.','/iWDOc8syamjyC8WDVq0KWzBgcNw.jpg','1961-07-12',105,'Released','The story of a lusty, fighting young adventurer who exchanged his sword for a cross','Francis of Assisi',98010,2.1012,7.7,'RpgfrWi7O0g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4129,_binary '\0','/ehh5Woia5UWGXVhRkWVs0xTVGy0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054898',6.2,1370,'en','The Frightened City','A small time thief is recruited by a mobster to help with the racketeering. He doesn\'t like the job, but with the mob on his back, a femme fatale in his bed and a sick friend to care for, he will have to keep all his wits about him.','/8jzHx0uir2ev5kskSCSXvWMsVaz.jpg','1961-09-01',97,'Released','A city terrorised by its own evil!','The Frightened City',80595,1.817,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4130,_binary '\0','/pbUyFmuw6sqZAQek5tJee3pMHUM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054923',5.7,1383,'en','Gidget Goes Hawaiian','Francis is desperate: her parents want to force her to come with them on vacation to Hawaii - just during the two weeks when her beloved \"Moondoggy\" is home from College. When he suggests her to go for it, she\'s even more in panic - doesn\'t he care to be with her? So she sets out for Hawaii in the worst mood. On the plane she meets the sociable Abby, who gives her the advice to forget about Jeff - and regrets it shortly after, when Francis follows the advice and steals her boyfriend Eddie, a famous dancer. But then Jeff discovers he\'s missing Francis...','/9iVh5W5TU9VN5Ky6mUuXtIaSVzt.jpg','1961-06-02',101,'Released','Get Happy! Get with it! Beach-Parties! Luau-Feasts! Surf-Boarding! Hula-Dancing! Have yourself a Hawaiian holiday when...\"Gidget Goes Hawaiian\"','Gidget Goes Hawaiian',43018,1.5833,5,'fBNwLZQso-c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4131,_binary '\0','/jUosuXvdN1zdtqWb3NdGHRSffxb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054936',7,3496,'en','Goodbye Again','Middle-aged businesswoman Paula Tessier rejects the advances of her client\'s amusing 25-year-old son, Philip Van der Besh, but reconsiders when her longtime philandering partner begins yet another casual affair with a younger woman. She soon learns that May-December romances with older women are frowned upon in society.','/9IIXewZrepuL67mY83RE2dxPcKo.jpg','1961-05-23',115,'Released','This is how love is...and always will be...','Goodbye Again',84119,2.7673,7.1,'pRIYpLDjcjg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4132,_binary '\0','/fCrjcOmQ7PqFmR1HDUQWdwZh34c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054938',5.6,4980,'en','Gorgo','When an underwater volcanic eruption tears up the sea bed off the coast of Ireland, two treasure hunters make the discovery of a lifetime when they encounter a gigantic prehistoric monster that’s been unleashed from the earth’s crust. After capturing the beast, the pair transport the creature down to London where it’s given the name of “Gorgo” and put on display to an avid public. Little do they realize that Gorgo is just an infant, and that his exponentially larger mother is about to emerge from the depths to avenge the capture of her offspring.','/fC27POiM5HB08oDxVedPNkGAKUj.jpg','1961-02-02',78,'Released','Like nothing you\'ve ever seen before!','Gorgo',40804,2.2648,5.3,'B4kgZFjeSdA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4133,_binary '\0','/nW3X1V8oGJcLrDWMIWUP27i00FB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054944',7.2,2120,'en','Greyfriars Bobby','In Scotland 1865, An old shepherd and his little Skye terrier go to Edinburgh. But when the shepherd dies of pneumonia, the dog remains faithful to his master, refuses to be adopted by anyone, and takes to sleeping on his master\'s grave in the Greyfriars kirkyard, despite a caretaker with a \"no dogs\" rule. And when Bobby is taken up for being unlicensed, it\'s up to the children of Edinburgh and the Lord Provost to decide what\'s to be done.','/e2gBOHVK8OIiv7ZVchaZVR92kxu.jpg','1961-07-17',87,'Released','The True Story of a Dog','Greyfriars Bobby',64868,2.0531,6.928,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4134,_binary '\0','/o0vdiPmh1oEpyZ1hSSPnb6tKPRd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054949',7.4,3092,'fr','La Guerre des boutons','For generations, two rival French villages, Longueverne and Velrans, have been at war. But this is no ordinary conflict, for the on-going hostilities are between two armies of young schoolboys. When he is beaten by his father for having lost his buttons, the leader of the Longueverne army, Lebrac, has an idea which will give his side the advantage: next time, he and his brave soldiers will go in battle without their clothes...','/zD6RMT8WdJvjXYtk0BkRmPEkzoT.jpg','1962-04-18',90,'Released',NULL,'War of the Buttons',10421,2.4379,7.245,'KmsHWA7TZO0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4135,_binary '\0','/hgFyxEtHCMDJQc2TdXSl3FGIs2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054953',7.5,60954,'en','The Guns of Navarone','A team of allied saboteurs are assigned an impossible mission: infiltrate an impregnable Nazi-held island and destroy the two enormous long-range field guns that prevent the rescue of 2,000 trapped British soldiers.','/j6VSFnm20GlkUi8yb7hM5Qfc1fA.jpg','1961-04-27',160,'Released','The greatest high adventure ever filmed!','The Guns of Navarone',10911,7.2331,7.3,'0ORnL9WmOEo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4136,_binary '\0','/jPQHiLRWj8nry3cvTaN4iDI8HnQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054988',6.8,4366,'en','Homicidal','A woman named Emily checks into a hotel and offers the bellboy $2000 to temporarily marry her. We soon find out Emily is the caretaker of a wheelchair-bound mute named Helga, who was the childhood guardian of a pair of siblings: Miriam Webster and her half-brother, Warren, who is about to inherit the estate of their late father. Who is the mysterious Emily and what are her intentions?','/vlZQlwdGJSRopkokReMPpqUNBjj.jpg','1961-07-26',87,'Released','A WORD OF WARNING! Please don\'t reveal the ending of this picture or your friends will kill you - IF THEY DON\'T, I WILL!','Homicidal',29394,2.6775,6.4,'i6L-olF6VV8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4137,_binary '\0','/4qKWg1gIDnJQyi2lWvzOpdDTqSs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054989',6.1,1610,'en','The Honeymoon Machine','Lt. Fergie Howard teams up with Lt. Beau Gilliam and Navy scientist Jason Eldridge to turn a supercomputer with missile-tracking capabilities into a tool to predict where a roulette ball will land. They dock in Venice, Italy, and begin making a killing at the casino, but their shore-to-ship signals get misinterpreted as signs of attack by Adm. Fitch, putting a serious crimp in the officers\' get-rich-quick scheme.','/dCUjitGzhcFsNwtAkIDl0e92Kbs.jpg','1961-08-16',87,'Released','Fits either sex... and makes nothing but laughter!','The Honeymoon Machine',34768,1.8997,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4138,_binary '\0','/1aspiiXDHVizaCYTNaWwRQSmXCh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0054997',7.9,90529,'en','The Hustler','Fast Eddie Felson is a small-time pool hustler with a lot of talent but a self-destructive attitude. His bravado causes him to challenge the legendary Minnesota Fats to a high-stakes match.','/snItsSViawjaadW9mlWUmGwR41R.jpg','1961-09-25',134,'Released','They called him Fast Eddie. He was a winner. He was a loser. He was a hustler.','The Hustler',990,5.296,7.7,'n7aFFqz2bXU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4139,_binary '\0','/oog0DJtSuPnWoSTYM7cKmAFbeuU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055018',7.7,36589,'en','The Innocents','In a mid-19th century Essex country house, a young governess for two children becomes convinced that the house and grounds are haunted by ghosts and that the children are being possessed.','/idqvLBmlEHUITMnQ0EJ6Yb5TpVw.jpg','1961-11-24',100,'Released','Apparitions? Evils? Corruptions?','The Innocents',16372,4.2302,7.5,'aOsF0S65RR0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4140,_binary '\0','/oOCBt3EtP3tOQ7WNoAzNQucLKsN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055019',7.5,4704,'en','The Intruder','A man in a gleaming white suit comes to a small Southern town on the eve of integration. He calls himself a social reformer. But what he does is stir up trouble--trouble he soon finds he can\'t control.','/ikbXTVJcAwxVA68kVLEios2Np5J.jpg','1962-05-14',84,'Released','He Fed Their Fears And Turned Neighbor Against Neighbor!','The Intruder',79827,2.2628,7.2,'VB5fiu5oaJk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4141,_binary '\0','/nIwmBQji0Kdza4H6mrNkdcFfc1w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055024',6.7,1348,'en','It Happened Here','World War II, 1940. When the Nazi hordes invade and occupy Great Britain, the English citizens are soon divided between those who choose to submissively collaborate and those who are willing to fight.','/oSbcDgGofczdeQw43uWMpm4Izy4.jpg','1966-05-12',101,'Released','The German occupation of England','It Happened Here',54195,2.0868,6.842,'XxeTSFSWMLY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4142,_binary '\0','/aSlDcWtKNfRkW0SbsnEjnGBs9jV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055031',8.3,98559,'en','Judgment at Nuremberg','In 1947, four German judges who served on the bench during the Nazi regime face a military tribunal to answer charges of crimes against humanity. Chief Justice Haywood hears evidence and testimony not only from lead defendant Ernst Janning and his defense attorney Hans Rolfe, but also from the widow of a Nazi general, an idealistic U.S. Army captain and reluctant witness Irene Wallner.','/b6vYatvui1EXeFYfpDX4rcbueuP.jpg','1961-12-18',191,'Released','The event the world will never forget.','Judgment at Nuremberg',821,6.7883,8,'T3taV43-lGc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4143,_binary '\0','/o3GSSYr7AzrdcukNpQrqFEJNOjk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055032',7.6,47273,'fr','Jules et Jim','In the carefree days before World War I, introverted Austrian author Jules strikes up a friendship with the exuberant Frenchman Jim and both men fall for the impulsive and beautiful Catherine.','/kuFjZlcZhQFDtIjuI3GQJjsQG03.jpg','1962-01-23',106,'Released','A Hymn to Life and Love','Jules and Jim',1628,3.7639,7.5,'X9OzdWczCfQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4144,_binary '\0','/9qVIwrSKdq4Z74pMonmRWt9dnWt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055038',7.7,1828,'fi','Kaasua, komisario Palmu!','A rich widow is found dead in her apartment in Helsinki due to gas poisoning. The incident is initially thought to be an accident, but inspector Palmu notices that the murderer made a mistake, and so Palmu, Kokki and Virta begin the investigation: who had come to the apartment through the balcony door and opened the gas tap while Mrs. Skrof was asleep?','/823WXJeRqAVCj89mKnhKz8vgDDd.jpg','1961-09-15',99,'Released',NULL,'Gas, Inspector Palmu!',145899,0.7578,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4145,_binary '\0','/b9QEPn1UfZ7fzCzoQlROL9zPoVJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055047',7,10141,'en','King of Kings','Who is Jesus, and why does he impact all he meets? He is respected and reviled, emulated and accused, beloved, betrayed, and finally crucified. Yet that terrible fate would not be the end of the story.','/fp1Nx4FASTGldFuQyGXN0HF6Jgk.jpg','1961-10-11',171,'Released','Of good and evil, of love and hate, of peace and war.','King of Kings',36362,4.5106,7.1,'iHEPRuWNF1A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4146,_binary '\0','/53uPO1yAWyQpevkmpfw8AqpjWXx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055052',7.7,5001,'ja','小早川家の秋','The family of an older man who runs a small sake brewery become concerned with his finances and his health after they discover him visiting an old mistress from his youth.','/iM9tdNrjcci5hk5TW59LLIDTl7T.jpg','1961-10-29',103,'Released',NULL,'The End of Summer',28273,4.8262,7.522,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4147,_binary '\0','/tdcgfMk7nt42b1m2UBrZUAh0nBl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055058',4.5,2386,'en','Konga','Dr. Decker returns from Africa after a year, presumed dead. In that year, he discovered a way of growing plants and animals to an enormous size. He brings back a baby chimpanzee to test out his theory. As he has many enemies at home, he decides to use his chimp, \'Konga\', to \'get rid of them\'. Then Konga grows to gigantic proportions and wreaks havoc all over London!','/d4LfBOfM02F8v5AL6Ff4INJ1miW.jpg','1961-03-26',90,'Released','Not since \"King Kong\"...has the screen exploded with such mighty fury and spectacle!','Konga',43023,1.5322,4.4,'OKTF2ejvPH4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4148,_binary '\0','/vH5yM2yod8DZqCk713zyWQWcKjc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055069',6.3,5155,'en','The Ladies Man','After his girl leaves him for someone else, Herbert gets really depressed and starts searching for a job. He finally finds one in a big house which is inhabited by many, many women. Can he live in the same home with all these females?','/c15TotHYrXPZSzjZCBfbup3fz4V.jpg','1961-06-21',95,'Released','It\'s His Biggest, Broadest, Funniest Production Yet!','The Ladies Man',28333,2.9721,6.3,'rjVuoaHbfzQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4149,_binary '\0','/akRrqnWtdcUTotBalfmpUoTktwm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055073',6.7,4195,'en','The Last Sunset','At a Mexican ranch, fugitive O\'Malley and pursuing Sheriff Stribling agree to help rancher Breckenridge drive his herd into Texas where Stribling could legally arrest O\'Malley, but Breckenridge\'s wife complicates things.','/ixhQwzGbyG7AYAHgvnwzAIxwMnH.jpg','1961-06-08',112,'Released','When giants clash, a woman trembles!','The Last Sunset',46757,3.1861,6.785,'wizhpkyepa8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4150,_binary '\0','/joQL41XWmYj5egSVRkVDVbxYtFf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055082',7.5,6345,'fr','Léon Morin, prêtre','Barny, although a Marxist, is intrigued by the mysteries of religion. In confession, she teases a priest, Léon Morin, but he is a young and intelligent man and ready to discuss anything.','/i89R891gei0UVS8xY6ymOUPExtW.jpg','1961-09-22',118,'Released',NULL,'Léon Morin, Priest',63892,2.1796,7.1,'B7FveGpDq8s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4151,_binary '\0','/bX9WDVEdNftHE0BO3jsufoj7jKr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055093',7.4,8608,'fr','Lola','A bored young man meets with his former girlfriend, now a cabaret dancer and single mother, and soon finds himself falling back in love with her.','/uVLkdkTVV10fLrTPyOCBE6alwLD.jpg','1961-03-03',89,'Released',NULL,'Lola',40641,3.5491,7.06,'d4oUnqkJipI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4152,_binary '\0','/fqcf7OgkgnYu71ZegbsE3bjKkyI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055100',7.1,9823,'en','Lover Come Back','Jerry Webster and Carol Templeton are rival Madison Avenue advertising executives who each dislike each other’s methods. After he steals a client out from under her cute little nose, revenge prompts her to infiltrate his secret \"VIP\" campaign in order to persuade the mystery product’s scientist to switch to her firm.','/uY5MvhzoH25LMTgEjRR2XtGLdMi.jpg','1961-12-20',107,'Released','A riotous new twist in the art of gentle persuasion!','Lover Come Back',40894,3.0116,7,'aMeBdaICj1I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4153,_binary '\0','/n9Pl2VNrHsXMkQ9EYaZNNqBjRwz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055106',4.8,1528,'it','Lycanthropus','The new science teacher Dr. Julian Olcott with a mysterious past arrives in an institutional boarding school for troublemaker girls. Along the night, the intern Mary Smith, who is blackmailing another teacher - Sir Alfred Whiteman - with some love letters, is slaughtered by a werewolf. The detective in charge of the investigation attributes the crime to a wolf, while her mate Priscilla believes she was killed by Sir Alfred. On the next days, other deaths happen in the school, reducing the list of suspects.','/tmwehN09D2RUTEvxQuveRaeH0gN.jpg','1961-11-09',84,'Released','A new high in horror!','Werewolf in a Girls\' Dormitory',44444,1.2017,5,'Z1rdt8UJLCc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4154,_binary '\0','/wOHHCkpXXZ24mjUV4SLmAZRgepO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055119',6.6,1308,'el','Μανταλένα','Madalena is a tough seventeen-year-old who is forced to take on her father\'s ferry business after he dies. She has her many brothers and sisters to support, and there is no one else to do the job. So she rallies her defenses and sets out to give her rival in the ferry business a run for his money. But at the same time, the rival\'s handsome son is starting to look better and better. Madalena refuses to acknowledge her feelings for him -- though how long she can sustain that denial is the question.','/cByEaFxf0Pr8j4BXIY47Zs4epMG.jpg','1960-10-24',91,'Released',NULL,'Madalena',198890,1.1684,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4155,_binary '\0','/xwB52YABnnk5LRrU7esnwoG5qpg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055124',6.8,1412,'en','A Majority of One','A gentle love story about a Japanese businessman and widower, and a Brooklyn widow. But before a happy ending can ensue, they must learn again the lessons of tolerance, kindness and forgiveness.','/xHrC85LCp80Bug08VqSjwUC5jLB.jpg','1961-12-27',156,'Released','That joyful hit of the stage is the big, bright delight of the screen !','A Majority of One',158800,1.6844,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4156,_binary '\0','/rGmMQxGBTc8XVgAfmdciUdgDSo5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055139',5.3,1964,'en','The Manster','An American journalist stationed in Japan is given a mysterious injection by a mad scientist, turning him into a murderous, two-headed monster.','/5wsGBmJg7Z2agUwQkADE1RD0oq.jpg','1959-07-01',73,'Released','Half-Man, Half-Monster!','The Manster',38750,1.2064,4.7,'Ev_DeeuQbuo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4157,_binary '\0','/6FZ73ls6gepjbJZsMSCh2wOPqrh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055151',5.8,1275,'en','The Mask','A young archaeologist believes he is cursed by a mask that causes him to have weird nightmares and possibly to murder. Before committing suicide, he mails the mask to his psychiatrist, Dr. Barnes, who is soon plunged into the nightmare world of the mask.','/i0TzUtwGt1oz4nmraLwIwaJ64FO.jpg','1961-10-27',83,'Released','Look through the mask...if you can\'t take it...take it off!','The Mask',57665,1.3165,6.3,'oJigBoo4DxY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4158,_binary '\0','/hqvFwOX7pvB1INYNr0rE90GE5Ju.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055152',5.9,4062,'en','Master of the World','A mad genius tries to bomb the world into peace.','/nNBXfjC4vj27MYQIlmmqjhqtcll.jpg','1961-05-01',102,'Released','The fabulous adventures of the man who conquered the earth to save it!','Master of the World',72693,2.7853,6,'AsJruGxyHBE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4159,_binary '\0','/ZOzAhvwmumXKEkQ7Ufaf6UgSF0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055153',7.5,4917,'pl','Matka Joanna od Aniołów','A Polish priest arrives at a convent hoping to save the Mother Superior who is supposedly possessed by eight demons.','/9THCQEF2r35Ejc7OHcglB6m45N7.jpg','1961-02-09',106,'Released','Maybe the trouble is not demons, but the absence of angels.','Mother Joan of the Angels',113458,2.3818,7.5,'AlbFnsc1GpA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4160,_binary '\0','/uCH6NY9qstOLbBTGv0rWxB1oJJH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055184',7.2,24881,'en','The Misfits','While filing for a divorce, beautiful ex-stripper Roslyn Taber ends up meeting aging cowboy-turned-gambler Gay Langland and former World War II aviator Guido Racanelli. The two men instantly become infatuated with Roslyn and, on a whim, the three decide to move into Guido\'s half-finished desert home together. When grizzled ex-rodeo rider Perce Howland arrives, the unlikely foursome strike up a business capturing wild horses.','/rkIkyPhT5oetT463HxpdIuct30l.jpg','1961-02-01',124,'Released','It shouts and sings with life ... explodes with love!','The Misfits',11536,4.7908,7,'m_nT4r4-vkQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4161,_binary '\0','/fyYBmshYHUwjdVG7CaKCSMDOa7s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055198',6.5,6332,'ja','モスラ','Shipwreck survivors found on the presumably uninhabited Infant Island leads to a scientific expedition that discovers a surviving native population along with the Shobijin, tiny twin fairy priestesses of the island\'s mythical deity called Mothra. After the fairies are kidnapped by an exploitative businessman named Clark Nelson, Mothra sets out to rescue them.','/87hiAyyGFHPuuJ3iXHK8xZSMcRP.jpg','1961-07-30',101,'Released','Mightiest monster in all creation! Ravaging a universe for love!','Mothra',39410,2.951,7.185,'83j8YlkU7J8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4162,_binary '\0','/wlftCPuL5GZh0LeNWCVxK8aWROg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055200',6.6,4134,'en','Mr. Sardonicus','In 1880, Sir Robert Cargrave, a London physician known for his experimental work in paralysis treatment, is summoned to Gorslava by the mysterious Baron Sardonicus—who is now married to Cargrave\'s former wife, Maude—to treat his disfigurement. When Cargrave arrives, he finds the masked baron is a cruel sadist who has threatened to harm Maude if he is not successfully cured.','/ez4rSZu4WemlZVtm8Ss09U2Udoo.jpg','1961-10-08',90,'Released','During the running of the film,the \"Punishment Poll\" lets YOU decide the fate of Mr. Sardonicus!','Mr. Sardonicus',29402,1.5759,6.3,'m6PrUfeWCMo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4163,_binary '\0','/7LAV57poNxNHfDoMq3WslheohbX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055205',7.3,9728,'en','Murder She Said','Miss Marple believes she\'s seen a murder in a passing-by train, yet when the police find no evidence she decides to investigate it on her own.','/tqnUJyeirufO0q29PoSPaCpB27E.jpg','1961-09-26',87,'Released','See the strange case of the strangler-killer on the night express!','Murder She Said',750,2.8234,7.3,'Uv34UJPcJoo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4164,_binary '\0','/iPcAAV7D49lTqm9mLA7w6Ysz5mh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055207',6.7,9878,'en','Mysterious Island','During the US Civil War, Union POWs escape in a balloon and end up stranded on a South Pacific island, inhabited by giant plants and animals. They must use their ingenuity to survive the dangers, and to devise a way to return home. Sequel to \'20,000 Leagues Under the Sea\' .','/lqLIpwISJEvERlS5fSWe8xbQDFf.jpg','1961-12-19',101,'Released','A world beyond imagination! Adventure beyond belief!','Mysterious Island',18993,4.1873,6.592,'DWQMY2zYApg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4165,_binary '\0','/pqTXsJUZqdssbueaSvRax4RLkkT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055214',6.6,1796,'en','The Naked Edge','Five years after George Radcliffe was the chief witness in a high profile murder case, his wife receives a blackmailing letter accusing him of the crime.','/ozBONjGpoFOkyLSk9LHUy2x7zhu.jpg','1961-06-28',100,'Released','ONLY THE MAN WHO WROTE PSYCHO COULD JOLT YOU LIKE THIS!','The Naked Edge',99372,1.7973,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4166,_binary '\0','/uAW0YfIBSm6TTwyE2hTKsqRVhga.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055230',6.4,4787,'en','Night Tide','A young sailor is enamored with a mysterious woman performing as a mermaid on the local pier. As their existences become entwined, he comes to suspect the woman might be a real mermaid who lures men to a watery death during the full moon.','/bd8pTcZQNRBFrShJoCQUWnJxmZJ.jpg','1961-07-01',84,'Released','Temptress from the sea… loving… killing!','Night Tide',38775,2.7179,6.4,'GN9lfkU-I2U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4167,_binary '\0','/h9jZQJ97PM9bumabvl81N6jJvvz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055233',8.8,9115,'ja','人間の條件 完結篇','After the Japanese defeat to the Russians, Kaji leads the last remaining men through Manchuria. Intent on returning to his old life, he faces great odds in a variety of different harrowing circumstances as he and his men sneak behind enemy lines.','/pag7gyxSFe7vTl6riHfZ5Xci6q7.jpg','1961-01-28',190,'Released','Love is the Condition for Being Human.','The Human Condition III: A Soldier\'s Prayer',34530,4.9599,8.4,'RGqmXwbmU4Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4168,_binary '\0','/cZgUATpU4NDlsfGj7sRriKJEiLB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055254',7.3,198871,'en','One Hundred and One Dalmatians','When a litter of dalmatian puppies are abducted by the minions of Cruella De Vil, the parents must find them before she uses them for a diabolical fashion statement.','/kSlYq6FrBUviGSEh8v4L9nrSnBT.jpg','1961-01-25',79,'Released','The Canine Caper of the Century','One Hundred and One Dalmatians',12230,13.9256,7.177,'7B12fxm6fmQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4169,_binary '\0','/4safDVSZx7a4I1TQoSyz6E1agzM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055256',7.8,25009,'en','One, Two, Three','In Cold War-era West Berlin, American Coca-Cola executive C.R. \'Mac\' MacNamara is tasked with playing babysitter to his boss\' spoiled 17-year-old daughter Scarlett, who proves more difficult than anticipated when she reveals that she is pregnant by a Communist.','/yWQE227ub1frfnjP5HZy0wLF0wu.jpg','1961-12-15',109,'Released','Billy Wilder\'s Explosive New Comedy','One, Two, Three',430,4.0446,7.5,'mqT_kN2t76U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4170,_binary '\0','/c34lzH24bX4SJJIZCRbIbYShM1K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055257',7.1,15386,'en','One-Eyed Jacks','Running from the law after a bank robbery in Mexico, Dad Longworth finds an opportunity to take the stolen gold and leave his partner Rio to be captured. Years later, Rio escapes from the prison where he has been since, and hunts down Dad for revenge. Dad is now a respectable sheriff in California, and has been living in fear of Rio\'s return.','/xal47bRKVIxErB7h2CScY3GBnoT.jpg','1961-03-30',141,'Released','The motion picture that starts its own tradition of greatness.','One-Eyed Jacks',18647,4.8798,6.8,'R41AHe59UiU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4171,_binary '\0','/wl7imDwEkYt1HnlsdEcUDXuxnRw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055277',7.2,26683,'en','The Parent Trap','Two identical twin sisters, separated at birth by their parents\' divorce, are reunited years later at a summer camp, where they scheme to bring their parents back together. The girls, one of whom has been living with their mother and the other with their father, switch places after camp and go to work on their plan, the first objective being to scare off a gold-digger pursuing their father.','/jaZFWy6ZAvQoMW2mo9xP5gx4URo.jpg','1961-05-13',129,'Released','Caught in a merry marital mix-up!','The Parent Trap',19186,6.8419,7,'E0HVZHMGXsM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4172,_binary '\0','/p5opuGbfMQFhYjEtWP80CZzG1QE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055278',6.7,4646,'en','Paris Blues','During the 1960s, two American jazz musicians living in Paris meet and fall in love with two American tourist girls and must decide between music and love.','/3yvlRKuzIkymNapRJxMQbJJkrhw.jpg','1961-09-27',98,'Released','A love-spectacular so personally exciting, you feel it\'s happening to you!','Paris Blues',33710,3.9126,6.5,'59LQvDqS1to','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4173,_binary '\0','/rDTpZ2vd6XVq6Ty3Sn7IVZfkM4k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055279',6.5,1349,'en','Parrish','Parrish McLean lives with his mother Ellen on Sala Post\'s tobacco plantation in the Connecticut River Valley. His mother winds up marrying Sala\'s rival Judd Raike, ruthless planter who wants to drive Sala out of business. Judd insists that Parrish learn the business from the ground up.','/Ap2J9y6tdgU0ErqH8ncbVQ2vj0P.jpg','1961-05-04',138,'Released','Looking for something. Wanting everything. Troy Donahue brings new passion to the screen as Parrish.','Parrish',28284,1.6503,5,'jY9QrHjii6E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4174,_binary '\0','/rgDMsPdrhRVzTCBkL5la1f5GGF6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055294',3.9,3682,'en','The Phantom Planet','After an asteroid draws an astronaut and his ship to its surface, he is miniaturized by the phantom planet\'s exotic atmosphere.','/tqXs9OlNv09D3AIkl14Rlw9pTJT.jpg','1961-12-13',82,'Released','It Begins Where Others End! On the Moon!','The Phantom Planet',27717,1.9759,4,'9VG7Elw9TDA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4175,_binary '\0','/lmGgzIXXWcGgHF4SpwDyfg7ql5T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055304',7,18896,'en','The Pit and the Pendulum','In the sixteenth century, Francis Barnard travels to Spain to clarify the strange circumstances of his sister\'s death after she had married the son of a cruel Spanish Inquisitor.','/6hOTmFaePluI5eicY4XTv6hg0T0.jpg','1961-08-12',80,'Released','Betrayal cuts both ways!','The Pit and the Pendulum',28501,4.0019,6.9,'QChBy15UiTs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4176,_binary '\0','/txL0KJhlfEd9n43yOxCFG0uxfxT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055310',7.8,4254,'es','Plácido','In a small Spanish town, during the Christmas holidays, a group of rich old ladies organize a peculiar event that consists of inviting a homeless person to sit down to dinner at their wealthy table. Plácido, a humble worker, is hired by the organizers to participate in a parade with his three-wheeled vehicle, a seemingly simple mission that will not be easy for him to accomplish.','/9xzbq4B8z9i53KGvIhBIKSDyoCa.jpg','1962-06-27',84,'Released',NULL,'Placido',51317,1.4346,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4177,_binary '\0','/kYaqmkeCSqNSat8nKgdLSz0A20l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055312',7.1,8908,'en','Pocketful of Miracles','A New York gangster and his girlfriend attempt to turn street beggar Apple Annie into a society lady when the peddler learns her daughter is marrying royalty.','/xjXwcGJjT5tE22wazQUYH32HwU8.jpg','1961-12-18',136,'Released','You have to see it to belove it!','Pocketful of Miracles',248,3.1011,7.3,'TL9cIQhEJqU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4178,_binary '\0','/i2wfrVqTPcosi2rZCCSD8tuGfnA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055318',6.6,1515,'en','Posse from Hell','Banner Cole is a tough sheriff\'s deputy who forms a small posse to go after 4 death cell escapees who killed the sheriff , along with 3 other men, and kidnapped a woman with rape in mind.','/mciMxUxCUlCEAvKDRoVG8FrU9FS.jpg','1961-03-01',89,'Released','Together They Team Up As An Avenging Posse From Hell!','Posse from Hell',76868,2.2656,6.2,'JqhGUwgZ0vQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4179,_binary '\0','/suP5OvMzfzEt0MHD61T1x2rk6xf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055320',7.9,7868,'it','Il posto','With his family mired in financial troubles, Domenico moves to Milan, Italy, from his small town to get a job in lieu of furthering his education. A lack of options forces him to take a position as a messenger at a big company, where he hopes to receive a promotion soon. There, Domenico meets Antonietta, a young woman in a similar situation as himself. The two form a tentative relationship, but the soulless nature of their jobs threatens to keep them apart.','/wyUxfQCtcPxRzwJtFy0emtfkux8.jpg','1961-09-21',98,'Released',NULL,'Il Posto',31742,1.9048,7.705,'iYJwm4DlKU0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4180,_binary '\0','/ljFZlaGaB9fixUXhJYzIBPRrUTH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055353',8,10662,'en','A Raisin in the Sun','Walter Lee Younger is a young man struggling with his station in life. Sharing a tiny apartment with his wife, son, sister and mother, he seems like an imprisoned man. Until, that is, the family gets an unexpected financial windfall.','/fxGAJFfryAgdi4ONkVyrBWKDBbI.jpg','1961-05-28',128,'Released','The prize-winning drama that warms the screen with its people and its passions...','A Raisin in the Sun',29478,2.9252,7.709,'e_NvQSLv7rI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4181,_binary '\0','/o5KEcyMGAA2pV9kjmcK1N01iyQ7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055380',1.8,1234,'en','Rocket Attack U.S.A.','It\'s the height of the Cold War between the United States and the Soviet Union with the Communists launching a spy satellite that has the Free World leaders in a panic. Fears about the nature of the satellite force the United States to send an agent undercover behind the Iron Curtain to discover what the Soviets have learned. What he finds is the Communists have used the information acquired from their spy satellite to help them perfect a new and even more deadly nuclear weapon.','/uwiX7puxDD89fytQg4jZdpnlEoj.jpg','1960-03-24',64,'Released','From Another Continent ... Destruction!!! Panic!! ... before the Rocket Strikes!','Rocket Attack U.S.A.',113158,1.1962,2.2,'A-274z1jNUQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4182,_binary '\0','/cXG0NDgxwSbxDB90MU4rObAMOdV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055382',6.4,3303,'en','The Roman Spring of Mrs. Stone','An aging actress travels to Rome with her husband; after he suddenly dies during the flight, she begins a passionate affair with a young gigolo.','/frw7Z2CMR8S0VaciAo335YKNtUA.jpg','1961-12-28',103,'Released','In the daring production of Tennessee Williams\' only novel...','The Roman Spring of Mrs. Stone',36731,2.4176,6.9,'b4aNvdjFmMg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4183,_binary '\0','/d3pyIqXlKSJy8LfJ983PUhrYbC2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055399',7.3,6027,'it','Salvatore Giuliano','Sicilian bandit Salvatore Giuliano\'s bullet-riddled corpse is found facedown in a courtyard in Castelvetrano, a handgun and rifle by his side. Local and international press descend upon the scene, hoping to crack open the true story behind the death of this young man, who, at the age of twenty-seven, had already become Italy’s most wanted criminal and celebrated hero.','/uaFTCD0y2MEccTFyHOHj6IrwyZ.jpg','1962-03-01',119,'Released',NULL,'Salvatore Giuliano',27523,1.8363,7.5,'nVZbipz5zLo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4184,_binary '\0','/b48bXS0PElJOYiNE5yZuULY6wkc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055408',3.9,1657,'es','Santo vs. las mujeres vampiro','A professor recruits a professional wrestler to protect his daughter from vampires intent on kidnapping her and marrying her to the devil.','/oPD8OgrIix57GY7xrOfH4XqxMXy.jpg','1962-10-11',89,'Released','The strength of El Santo and his pantherlike agility versus the diabolical power of the vampire women!','Santo vs. the Vampire Women',29871,1.6308,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4185,_binary '\0','/mGltZBHM7oUlwXTCIMFdaqo8RaZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055438',6.3,1883,'en','The Shadow of the Cat','Tabitha, once the placid, gentle and devoted pet, adopts all the characteristics of a ferocious, wild animal following the murder of her mistress. The three guilty people are all trapped by the cat\'s power and each will come to untimely deaths of horrific proportions without anyone being able to solve the mystery that surrounds their brutal death.','/94KSOe2KWLvMSXyB4vOvNc29mSy.jpg','1961-05-01',79,'Released','Was it supernatural force or psychotic compulsion . . . that drove five maddened murderers to destroy themselves ?','The Shadow of the Cat',28720,1.98,6.705,'EtXdg3d8j6M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4186,_binary '\0','/rWjBcvvF3eoLVw9llwOKFwQIvEo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055452',2.7,1813,'en','The Sinister Urge','A flunky for a porno movie ring starts murdering the smut films\' lead actresses.','/jU4StVrRWM0JwE6xGk98qMJ5IUr.jpg','1960-12-08',71,'Released','Pornography Headlines Come to Life!','The Sinister Urge',31286,0.7989,3,'nkp5l5-VtFo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4187,_binary '\0','/4vY6sQ6fgl6qnD6SHM3LWtrMp89.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055458',5.3,1308,'en','Snow White and the Three Stooges','Once upon a time, in the kingdom of Fortunia, a noble king and his lovely young queen lack but one blessing to make their joy complete. The queen gives birth to a daughter named Snow White, but dies soon after. The king mourns her, but in time, he remarries because of the pleading of his people. His new queen is a beautiful, but evil woman who soon becomes jealous of Snow White\'s beauty.','/kL6N5WKOTWKPbyPzwrDnt30b9lM.jpg','1961-12-22',107,'Released',NULL,'Snow White and the Three Stooges',30126,3.814,5.7,'jbF2ykhgxw8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4188,_binary '\0','/fEae3VSLRDQB8kpVoPZVHyfpYwo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055464',6.7,1989,'en','Something Wild','A young rape victim tries desperately to pick up the pieces of her life, only to find herself at the mercy of a would-be rescuer.','/j6j4LQKevC8YPBowUxrPbMAGJIg.jpg','1961-12-23',112,'Released','On the cinema horizon...something new...something unusual...something wild!','Something Wild',82944,1.9009,6.2,'h9N4Z9Escxk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4189,_binary '\0','/3I5Dsam910xWbTEk69o04i8lVkC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055471',7.7,23148,'en','Splendor in the Grass','A fragile Kansas girl\'s unrequited and forbidden love for a handsome young man from the town\'s most powerful family drives her to heartbreak and madness.','/n6Kw8Ui93SMhrk1MupCFwUg04vq.jpg','1961-10-10',124,'Released','There is a miracle in being young... and a fear.','Splendor in the Grass',28569,4.7476,7.5,'dWDkdsZQq_c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4190,_binary '\0','/yjkxPcfjw1YUt1SHrizfxLTqibE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055489',6.8,2272,'en','Summer and Smoke','In a small Mississippi town in 1916, an eccentric spinster battles her romantic yearnings for the randy boy next door.','/eFpVZFokirARldwjvvoEwGQhUXW.jpg','1961-11-16',118,'Released','In the heat of summer... the smoke of desire...','Summer and Smoke',94917,1.771,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4191,_binary '\0','/xUvE2qim7mBzdUomoYDP9YC8gsZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055499',7.9,29734,'sv','Såsom i en spegel','Karin hopes to recover from her recent stay at a mental hospital by spending the summer at her family\'s cottage on a tiny island. Her husband, Martin, cares for her but is frustrated by her physical withdrawal. Her younger brother, Minus, is confused by Karin\'s vulnerability and his own budding sexuality. Their father, David, cannot overcome his haughty remoteness. Beset by visions, Karin descends further into madness.','/rYD30Fm4vAcBqk1kTsxHw1s8P29.jpg','1961-10-16',91,'Released',NULL,'Through a Glass Darkly',11602,3.8134,7.781,'6AmG2Dq5OGM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4192,_binary '\0','/jI2r5DoPdZHlRdIdYC8SbDh73At.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055505',7.4,6691,'en','Taste of Fear','A wheelchair-bound young girl returns to her father\'s estate after ten years, and although she\'s told he\'s away, she keeps seeing his dead body on the estate.','/k1Eq0XpDAsCkoGUGv5rV8c4uQUs.jpg','1961-04-19',82,'Released','For maximum thrill…We earnestly urge you to see this motion picture from the start!','Taste of Fear',64568,2.8032,7.105,'P_JifnqNXzY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4193,_binary '\0','/zalZRF7sCtghHFg4xCBJfOqj0h5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055506',7.4,7054,'en','A Taste of Honey','While out to avoid spending time with her narcissistic and promiscuous mother, sixteen-year-old Jo has a brief affair that leaves her pregnant and abandoned. When her mother remarries, Jo\'s only support becomes her friend Geoffrey, a homosexual.','/5psrZNVZ9E6Eck7OtpO47A8zTbQ.jpg','1961-10-01',100,'Released','We don’t ask for life. We have it thrust upon us.','A Taste of Honey',25062,2.6807,7.1,'y7LK_-rUfdU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4194,_binary '\0','/l8yamy1OU7xRGqmuMxaXYPeeI5d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055508',7.9,1855,'bn','তিন কন্যা','Three stories with three central female characters linking the stories together. The first one concerns an orphan girl who grows attached to the postmaster she is caring for after he teaches her to read and write. The second one is a supernatural tale about a woman obsessed with the jewels her husband buys for her. The final one follows a young man who falls for an unconventional girl from his new village instead of his arranged bride, the daughter of a respectable family.','/oLGz80EeHTI5WC0lq9wfYT2FfgU.jpg','1961-05-05',173,'Released',NULL,'Three Daughters',43027,1.3766,7.636,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4195,_binary '\0','/gojKvpe9nVeleawb7dtL9wi1sgv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055516',5.7,1363,'en','The Terror of the Tongs','In 1910, Hong Kong, under the rule of the British Empire, is a prosperous and bustling city, but, hidden in the shadows of its many narrow streets, the hideous members of the Red Dragon gang, a branch of the evil Chinese secret society of the Tongs, lurk and murder those who oppose to their tyranny, which thrives on vice, crime and the fear of the weakest.','/2KdowgrSZCaUjkxVcUw3CPRg4rI.jpg','1961-03-15',76,'Released','Terror stalks the street of opium dreams!','The Terror of the Tongs',28750,1.9037,5.7,'VTyyWa7oJgE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4196,_binary '\0','/k6ez8uo3JHHqw9HqN3qCADuukSR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055526',6.1,1804,'fr','Tintin et le Mystère de la Toison d\'or','After the death of Captain Thémistocle Paparanic, Captain Haddock\'s old friend, he inherits a ship called the Golden Fleece. Once Tintin and the captain arrive in Istanbul, where the ship is anchored, they meet Mr. Karabine, a businessman who stubbornly insists on buying it even though it is in a dilapidated state.','/8TIlqyGZ7PFo9FnkvnKZxInJggQ.jpg','1961-12-06',98,'Released',NULL,'Tintin and the Mystery of the Golden Fleece',46521,2.2556,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4197,_binary '\0','/84dT6opIgfTWRUtdG7VHtIOhv7t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055534',6.8,1747,'en','Too Late Blues','Ghost is an ideological musician and leader of a jazz band who would rather play his blues in the park to the birds than compromise himself. His peripatetic performances lead him to cross paths with a singer, while his masculinity is thrown into question following a violent brawl.','/zklWXL0nlmJRyG9TGaCxr7f5IKN.jpg','1961-11-01',103,'Released','The Bold Story Of A Man Caught Between Two Strange Loves!','Too Late Blues',75752,2.5428,6.4,'jQ6KhpVkXDc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4198,_binary '\0','/1sucQpbuLAwJDe5DzRxhKSSRKXc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055539',7.2,2157,'en','Town Without Pity','Four American soldiers stationed near a German village face death in the rape of a local girl and are defended by outside counsel Major Steve Grant.','/sLLWUfWccuULmvuLdE5JNm1EAh7.jpg','1961-10-10',105,'Released','The Story of What Four Men Did To a Girl... And What the Town Did To Them!','Town Without Pity',93427,1.7637,6.9,'Tos3dCc1J94','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4199,_binary '\0','/rfxj5qsqSnbpF8SK8Gnis8Ejz4e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055558',6.7,7792,'en','Two Rode Together','Two tough westerners bring home a group of settlers who have spent years as Comanche hostages.','/gAFUWIeHyaY357N36XLphDfh38u.jpg','1961-05-24',109,'Released','TOGETHER...THEY RODE INTO A THOUSAND DANGERS!','Two Rode Together',32634,2.6451,6.4,'axQDbzux0hs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4200,_binary '\0','/7DG1tjim8dXBzm3z3tXpBwKJTkY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055562',2.3,2931,'ja','宇宙快速船','Astronomer Shinichi Tachibana has a secret identity as the superhero \"Iron Sharp\" and is well beloved by children. When they are attacked by a group of metallic aliens, Iron Sharp drives the aliens away. The resourceful Tachibana helps develop an electric barrier to block the aliens from coming to the Earth. After several losses by the aliens, they announce that they will invade the Earth, throwing the world into a state of panic.','/qXFiYA9cDwCeMzEKrc0QOr6zLaB.jpg','1961-07-19',74,'Released',NULL,'Invasion of the Neptune Men',31254,1.1318,3.1,'ouHf7kAgkMk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4201,_binary '\0','/jN3dzT70hC1OeexxW5vhYzWdndB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055571',7.3,4421,'en','Underworld U.S.A.','A bitter young man sets out to get back at the gangsters who murdered his father.','/xPlQikmoHV1Rt1n0lwVYXkbWR0I.jpg','1961-02-22',99,'Released','A Sensational Film That Puts the Finger On Today\'s Biggest Business... Crime!','Underworld U.S.A.',28699,3.4852,7.1,'l5GYs8dmDXM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4202,_binary '\0','/oseBXGQMYWTWzAVHJaUEwGgrjGA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055572',7.3,20653,'fr','Une femme est une femme','Longing for a baby, a stripper pursues another man in order to make her boyfriend jealous.','/xrZu21hriGJQY3qY8nifh2smVHu.jpg','1961-09-06',83,'Released','Is this a tragedy or a comedy? Either way, it\'s a masterpiece.','A Woman Is a Woman',31522,4.5745,7.3,'vmxc2B2o08Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4203,_binary '\0','/lFTIB7obHpTYTMOruePsxigthQN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055597',7.7,8253,'en','Victim','A web of blackmail and murder attracts the attention of a barrister with a seemingly idyllic life, threatening to derail his career on the path of success.','/6N1V0qW86D5jxcPyLlIJpjgNX6p.jpg','1961-08-01',101,'Released','A Scorching Drama of the Most Un-talked About Subject Of Our Time!','Victim',43028,1.9235,7.5,'yU50Gvk_7y4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4204,_binary '\0','/oEpaiiEK1D6a2peB6kbzFulXaOM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055599',5.6,1467,'fr','Vie privée','After achieving fame as a movie star, a woman finds her private life invaded by relentless fans, leading her mother’s ex-lover to intervene and offer protection.','/nLiqpUkxnuo20WVJhvCHCQIkCkU.jpg','1962-01-31',103,'Released','A Story of the Heartbreaks...Behind the Big Breaks!','A Very Private Affair',48196,2.8394,5.2,'j-8Sk7-HrVc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4205,_binary '\0','/2QGuTuyxwCCER9iwSeONW8BAxce.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055601',8,28561,'es','Viridiana','Viridiana is preparing to start her life as a nun when she is sent, somewhat unwillingly, to visit her aging uncle, Don Jaime. He supports her; but the two have met only once. Jaime thinks Viridiana resembles his dead wife. Viridiana has secretly despised this man all her life and finds her worst fears proven when Jaime grows determined to seduce his pure niece. Viridiana becomes undone as her uncle upends the plans she had made to join the convent.','/mYPuSx5JwL8AdTwS1iQW4Un1cYP.jpg','1962-04-01',90,'Released','We\'ve got nothing to hide...','Viridiana',4497,3.144,7.659,'XlQ3E6wFlzY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4206,_binary '\0','/mxroilIGGybhO0J144ikw0qdGzW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055602',8,2591,'it','Una vita difficile','Silvio refuses to fight for the fascists and joins the resistance with Elena. After the war, his vitriolic newspaper articles cause him to be sentenced to imprisonment.','/uZSG01kHYoCj2EF19KjvKktDmO8.jpg','1961-12-19',118,'Released',NULL,'A Difficult Life',56343,1.5855,8.007,'2OjiB9pl-GI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4207,_binary '\0','/wrafPAcHnOyWeJLf43yuaFp28Dw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055608',6,7245,'en','Voyage to the Bottom of the Sea','The crew of an atomic submarine battle to save the world from global destruction.','/eBm2BUvRwGwxr3hfAaOJ8kVuuhw.jpg','1961-07-12',105,'Released','From Hundred of Miles In Outer Space to Seven Miles Beneath the Sea!','Voyage to the Bottom of the Sea',2160,3.2993,5.673,'h4fOHsL9d2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4208,_binary '\0','/swYJtp5GISfsCMZ46y2WNBBwJsq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055614',7.6,128755,'en','West Side Story','In Manhattan’s Upper West Side, rival gangs of Polish-Americans and newly arrived Puerto Ricans clash for control of the neighborhood, even as two young members from opposite sides fall dangerously in love.','/nzCMu6D5q60i2bVrIQ0DxlRSgCZ.jpg','1961-12-13',153,'Released','The screen achieves one of the great entertainments in the history of motion pictures.','West Side Story',1725,6.8947,7.2,'7CfPT9N9ZM0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4209,_binary '\0','/e9CCHkt0Kz8YJrHf3JU3PHaq67P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055618',7.6,4191,'en','Whistle Down the Wind','When an injured wife-murderer takes refuge on a remote Lancashire farm, the farmer’s three children mistakenly believe him to be the Second Coming of Christ.','/2Q8wpOJCmhE9B03HoifIcvrPzXz.jpg','1961-07-25',99,'Released','Today\'s hottest young star in her newest... and by far her greatest.','Whistle Down the Wind',34282,2.1379,7.2,'fPnxRB2Yj7g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4210,_binary '\0','/gagUSAQmTYUs1owPRtrnUGlvWN0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055623',6.3,2354,'en','Wild in the Country','A troubled young man discovers that he has a knack for writing when a counselor encourages him to pursue a literary career.','/zZTKTY0lWrm07kdxPE6RjpG4EBp.jpg','1961-06-15',114,'Released','It\'s all about young people and their growing pains!','Wild in the Country',32825,2.7998,6.3,'D56UIxIxlSE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4211,_binary '\0','/5BBwSVytssbFuSPZE4DtJVhROjN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055630',8.2,144708,'ja','用心棒','A nameless ronin, or samurai with no master, enters a small village in feudal Japan where two rival businessmen are struggling for control of the local gambling trade. Taking the name Sanjuro Kuwabatake, the ronin convinces both silk merchant Tazaemon and sake merchant Tokuemon to hire him as a personal bodyguard, then artfully sets in motion a full-scale gang war between the two ambitious and unscrupulous men.','/tN7kYPjRhDolpui9sc9Eq9n5b2O.jpg','1961-04-25',110,'Released','Kill one or a hundred... you only hang once','Yojimbo',11878,6.1626,8.1,'nazk6Zpm_Ks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4212,_binary '\0','/bm1KQsK3Ofu9ibTP87g4EaKj8zq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055633',6.9,3347,'en','The Young Savages','A district attorney investigates the racially charged case of three teenagers accused of the murder of a blind Puerto Rican boy.','/wwuzTM314iVSqodZxBtYHvUFeBM.jpg','1961-05-24',103,'Released','Here is Raw Truth… Nailed to the Screen!','The Young Savages',86616,1.9749,6.5,'2x8q0EHcSW4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4213,_binary '\0','/4NTw6SrRYNtfxrgNkpj5yDBvVWa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055635',8,1571,'uk','За двома зайцями','Svyryd Petrovych Holokhvosty has his own barbershop in town and a reputation of a dandy. Once, after losing everything he had at cards, he decides to remedy his financial situation by a profitable marriage. A rich but ugly girl named Pronia Sirko falls for the illustrious suitor’s courtship.','/9M5yTqfjMw3YWkkY7cyVwi8lxHd.jpg','1961-12-21',77,'Released',NULL,'Chasing Two Hares',85901,1.6663,7.686,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4214,_binary '\0','/i5hSiMd2RKbOZ6mvP2zlGxbn08Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055719',6.5,8335,'en','The 300 Spartans','The 300 Spartans is an account of the 480 B.C. Battle of Thermopylae, in which the Greek Spartan King Leonidas, played by Richard Egan, led a remarkably small number of Greek Sparta to victory over an invading Persian army led by evil King Xerxes that was thought to number over 25,000. This spectacular conflict gave the Grecians enough time to organize a force to ultimately repel the Persians, and thus change the course of Western civilization.','/zHiZrkCBEQwMOKdUqU9tZV45hhM.jpg','1962-08-01',114,'Released',NULL,'The 300 Spartans',19972,3.7278,6.5,'ncviqBoQCMg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4215,_binary '\0','/k7RUSthjmUv6Q4v1NtWfUKfpyF5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055724',7.9,1463,'bn','অভিযান','Narsingh, a North Indian taxi driver, attempts to reinvent his life by visiting his native place, but instead gets embroiled in a local Marwari businessman\'s smuggling and human trafficking business.','/dqsx54wzgjzWPzh4kRxUMzSj0fV.jpg','1962-09-27',146,'Released',NULL,'The Expedition',94798,1.3323,7.526,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4216,_binary '\0','/8PrzDfd0i34h9bLYFm9ts9zEgzJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055728',7.7,8166,'en','Advise & Consent','Proposed by the President of the United States to fill the post of Secretary of State, Robert Leffingwell appears before a Senate committee, chaired by the idealistic Senator Brig Anderson, which must decide whether he is the right person for the job.','/hdLQlarvUmZVtrbME6y4t6Km9ZC.jpg','1962-06-06',139,'Released','Are the men and women of Washington really like this?','Advise & Consent',17185,2.9584,7.217,'eVmIJvNSQdg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4217,_binary '\0','/nYo5UtbRRjePL2s9kIMkFVL5IpR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055732',7.2,1257,'ja','秋津温泉','Just after WW2, a romance between an innkeeper and a man with tuberculosis unravels near a thermal spring.','/h1ArecIy9TpzLvBQ9DWfxRby3ug.jpg','1962-06-15',113,'Released',NULL,'Akitsu Hot Springs',33342,1.3954,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4218,_binary '\0','/2EWvpA1oRe5mPbs3seCrkPhs6Fr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055738',6.8,2552,'en','All Fall Down','Ralph and Annabell Willart are a feuding couple who are constantly bickering over their worthless, good-for-nothing son Berry-Berry. When Berry-Berry begins yet another meaningless love affair, this time with an older woman named Echo O’Brien, he really gets his parents at each others’ throats.','/wWtPUOEnYHEId0eWmF4Dp7JiOjR.jpg','1962-04-06',110,'Released','Male enough to attract a dozen women... not man enough to be faithful to one!','All Fall Down',86240,1.518,6,'4CwpUNhc320','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4219,_binary '\0','/uJlc4aNPF3Y8yAqahJTKBwgwPVW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055747',7.1,2590,'fr','L\'Amour à vingt ans','Love at Twenty unites five directors from five different countries to present their different perspectives on what love really is at the age of 20. The episodes are united with the score of Georges Delerue and still photos of Henri Cartier-Bresson.','/aup2QCYCsyEeQfpboXy0f4uj8aE.jpg','1962-06-22',120,'Released','The Intimate Secrets of Young Lovers','Love at Twenty',8773,2.2312,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4220,_binary '\0','/9sbOeoZOw5nbV4HU2Dq9dKTchwY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055763',7.4,1538,'es','Atraco a las tres','When their beloved boss is ousted for a tyrannical one, a group of bank employees plot to rob the bank themselves.','/yGKTy8zwl9ixwTuONzR28MyD1AM.jpg','1962-12-10',92,'Released',NULL,'Robbery at 3 O\'clock',71767,1.5205,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4221,_binary '\0','/4tVL360DCWMcCmBnw12AFbB5cNQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055774',6.9,7845,'en','Barabbas','Epic account of the thief Barabbas, who was pardoned for his crimes and spared crucifixion when Pilate offered the Israelites a choice to pardon Barabbas or Jesus. Struggling with his spirituality, Barabbas goes through many ordeals leading him to the gladiatorial arena, where he tries to win his freedom and confront his inner demons, ultimately becoming a follower of the man who was crucified in his place.','/8qTylsK58cNc9hP7cQksi65j8JW.jpg','1961-12-23',137,'Released','The man of violence in whose place Christ died','Barabbas',24248,3.9933,6.899,'l5rwYyLSXaA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4222,_binary '\0','/dzXBTFvrRj0paVRjWGVlwVCzry1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055779',5.9,1353,'en','Beat Girl','When her architect father brings home a much younger new wife, rebellious and resentful teen Jenny goes to extreme lengths to sabotage their relationship.','/hCA0ecn9LjRWbXXu1E1jUIUi0JV.jpg','1960-08-21',88,'Released','\"My mother was a stripper... I want to be a stripper too!\"','Beat Girl',43092,1.5747,5.9,'kcSCvGGktqA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4223,_binary '\0','/28tiYUtQ2nbBhzbrFjMSZbFmPxT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055796',7.8,5572,'en','Billy Budd','Billy is an innocent, naive seaman in the British Navy in 1797. When the ship\'s sadistic master-at-arms is murdered, Billy is accused and tried.','/mdhGhduqT85qIbSgxD9VP6JvJlH.jpg','1962-11-12',119,'Released','The men! The mutiny! The might of the greatest adventure classic of the high seas!','Billy Budd',5334,2.5862,7.3,'ceAr8fyOvGg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4224,_binary '\0','/g7g3oK3E7sDt1OZCOraOJXOsEgl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055797',6.1,1878,'en','Billy Rose\'s Jumbo','The daughter of a circus owner fights to save her father from a takeover spearheaded by the man she loves.','/kmvuW4U5zjawlCNDqbJW5fMSOtl.jpg','1962-12-06',125,'Released','Jump for joy it\'s Jumbo!','Billy Rose\'s Jumbo',42991,2.3972,6,'mvbqyzbtwAQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4225,_binary '\0','/1J6QXImtqIQxiOdVTonLV5IbRwA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055798',7.8,21506,'en','Birdman of Alcatraz','After killing a prison guard, convict Robert Stroud faces life imprisonment in solitary confinement. Driven nearly mad by loneliness and despair, Stroud\'s life gains new meaning when he happens upon a helpless baby sparrow in the exercise yard and nurses it back to health. Despite having only a third grade education, Stroud goes on to become a renowned ornithologist and achieves a greater sense of freedom and purpose behind bars than most people find in the outside world.','/6EODLN11HTX4l2cmakAhWIoJLF.jpg','1962-07-04',147,'Released','Inside the rock called Alcatraz they tried to chain a volcano they called \'The Bird Man\'!','Birdman of Alcatraz',898,5.4661,7.5,'8j-U4REl0yE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4226,_binary '\0','/6XLeYldW5jxX6zIOPxXy8Xz1Cum.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055805',7,5712,'it','Boccaccio \'70','An anthology of four comic moral tales about the hypocrisies surrounding sex in 1960s Italy: frothy young love and office politics in the big city; milk advertisements that begin to haunt an aging prude; a trophy wife enduring her husband\'s very public affairs; a lucky ticket-holder at a small town fair.','/7ZkRvQr0HspqEDBDVBHs16noFxd.jpg','1962-02-23',204,'Released','The first 4-act motion picture ever presented!','Boccaccio \'70',45267,3.6858,6.9,'oW1kJAIklRY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4227,_binary '\0','/4HfyCj3YSv0Wkst1CfUlKnGbfHB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055809',6.5,2662,'en','Boys\' Night Out','Fred, George, Doug and Howie are quickly reaching middle-age. Three of them are married, only Fred is still a bachelor. They want something different than their ordinary marriages, children and TV-dinners. In secret, they get themselves an apartment with a beautiful young woman, Kathy, for romantic rendezvous. But Kathy does not tell them that she is a sociology student researching the sexual life of the white middle-class male.','/4mcM4SB7OtGeGAXNAMEhNFve2pG.jpg','1962-06-21',115,'Released','If you believe in sex and fun... by all means join us!','Boys\' Night Out',35057,2.9474,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4228,_binary '\0','/v4rCibmdklWP92CZg4DLJggFfYH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055824',7.7,36096,'en','Cape Fear','Sam Bowden witnesses a rape committed by Max Cady and testifies against him. When released after 8 years in prison, Cady begins stalking Bowden and his family but is always clever enough not to violate the law.','/xDqaHjMbnebtB05QWgAR8wW86sb.jpg','1962-04-12',106,'Released','Now he had only one weapon left—murder!','Cape Fear',11349,6.6643,7.4,'lej6ZDMieD4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4229,_binary '\0','/esIoQw7VaykfHsw6fx2VltZ1R7U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055830',7,31628,'en','Carnival of Souls','Mary Henry ends up the sole survivor of a fatal car accident through mysterious circumstances. Trying to put the incident behind her, she moves to Utah and takes a job as a church organist. But her fresh start is interrupted by visions of a fiendish man. As the visions begin to occur more frequently, Mary finds herself drawn to the deserted carnival on the outskirts of town. The strangely alluring carnival may hold the secret to her tragic past.','/AdbQsFB8pS090l0NO3uBtLZy2zw.jpg','1962-11-02',78,'Released','She Escaped Death. Now It Wants Her Back!','Carnival of Souls',16093,3.8539,6.952,'dkTz0EvfEiY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4230,_binary '\0','/oh1uiGaYv1ljk1XRUjLmLxbKDIm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055831',6.1,3602,'en','Carry On Cruising','Captain Crowther\'s lot is not a happy one! Five of his crew have to be replaced and at such short notice before the voyage begins there isn\'t much to choose from. Not only does he get the five most incompetent shipmates ever to sail the seven seas, but the passengers turn out to be a rather strange bunch too. The SS Happy Wanderer will never be the same.','/uGdrTIuUQK5NkEwVjts1BLn9w9X.jpg','1962-03-12',89,'Released',NULL,'Carry On Cruising',26190,2.2826,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4231,_binary '\0','/aeNAF2tnhgjEyaFVjLxthCYvUn5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055832',6.5,3386,'fr','Cartouche','In the 18th century, Louis de Bourguignon is working with the Malichot\'s gang, but their ways are too \'unethical\' for him. He creates his own band, acting under the name of Cartouche, making audacious robberies of the rich people, and even distributing the takings with the poor. Thus, cartouche attracts the people\'s sympathies, Venus\'s love, and hate from the Police and Malichot... Cartouche can escape all the traps they set at him - except the entrapments of love. Eventually, he will be saved by a woman, at her own cost.','/5j6hcUIXzG8ltLk2yQeFdhJx6jA.jpg','1962-03-07',114,'Released',NULL,'Cartouche',26866,1.694,6.34,'pEQDc6T-sak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4232,_binary '\0','/gEt1TN9SOaTlMqg1g81f0jmEbuu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055844',6.9,3192,'ru','Человек-амфибия','People living at a seashore town are frightened by reports of an unknown creature called \"the sea devil\". Nobody knows what it is, but it\'s really the son of doctor Salvator. The doctor performed surgery on his son and now young Ichtiander can live under water. This gives him certain advantages, but also creates a lot of problems.','/nICdk7XHOzX2KuiDH8NpadqUzh1.jpg','1962-01-03',96,'Released',NULL,'Amphibian Man',43685,2.0611,6.8,'_xWk7CwuwPI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4233,_binary '\0','/b6DX1q8RC3DV1Polft7krLWsbgS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055850',7.5,2410,'ja','忠臣蔵 花の巻・雪の巻','After their lord is tricked into committing ritual suicide, forty-seven samurai warriors await the chance to avenge their master and reclaim their honor.','/Ac9n6tJOhfLz9SYaoMKkMJaoLQd.jpg','1962-11-03',207,'Released','Japan\'s Supreme Screen Classic','Chûshingura',44662,2.886,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4234,_binary '\0','/oyatchDPpS4I9jpIIezFJGrmXcR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055852',7.8,32276,'fr','Cléo de 5 à 7','Agnès Varda eloquently captures Paris in the sixties with this real-time portrait of a singer set adrift in the city as she awaits test results of a biopsy. A chronicle of the minutes of one woman’s life, Cléo from 5 to 7 is a spirited mix of vivid vérité and melodrama, featuring a score by Michel Legrand and cameos by Jean-Luc Godard and Anna Karina.','/oelBStY4xpguaplRv15P3Za7Xsr.jpg','1962-04-11',90,'Released','The whole world... has made an appointment with...','Cléo from 5 to 7',499,7.2287,7.7,'sRR0_VJFqwg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4235,_binary '\0','/68uiiAFDZDmJabbIrCWdT7GvBMq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055858',6.8,2867,'it','La commare secca','Roman police detectives interrogate a series of potential perpetrators in their struggle to determine whom to arrest for the brutal murder of a beautiful prostitute whose body is discovered in a park on the day of a torrential rainstorm. One by one, the prime suspects -- girl-crazy teenager Nino, pickpocket Canticchia, a soldier on leave, a tourist and a pimp -- recount the events of the day to the police, each insisting he is innocent.','/mRlO7kBLNxG4nUwkzaL5eDT8fK9.jpg','1962-08-27',91,'Released',NULL,'La Commare Secca',42999,1.5538,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4236,_binary '\0','/uFeS0iA9IdaReCtLQR21vvwAG4T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055871',7.4,3516,'en','The Counterfeit Traitor','Blacklisted in modern day WW2, a Swedish oil trader opts to assist British Allies, by means of infiltrating and surveying Nazi Germany.','/eKppEJWQZpf6VY9hqYYqsR5IEaq.jpg','1962-04-13',140,'Released','The Most Suspenseful Adventure Ever Lived!','The Counterfeit Traitor',43013,2.1014,6.456,'wRMp7z6pigI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4237,_binary '\0','/amgZTJ8WYw5DuUieyYjYH3UwbpC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055872',5.7,1938,'en','The Creation of the Humanoids','Many years after a nuclear war, the human survivors have created a new society where much of the work is done by androids, referred to derisively by humans as \"clickers\". A police official who is concerned that his sister has become involved with an android is sent to investigate a larger rumor that the androids are developing reason and emotion.','/b6le9I3KKS3XxAwHMZ06ZrTFla5.jpg','1962-07-03',75,'Released','Man\'s Own Creation! Can He Control Machines That Produce People?','The Creation of the Humanoids',69292,1.3855,6.5,'aCD4aOgHH04','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4238,_binary '\0','/n4j994w22L2V1YVEzTRsfPjldmp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055884',7.1,3485,'en','H.M.S. Defiant','Defiant\'s crew is part of a fleet-wide movement to present a petition of grievances to the Admiralty. Violence must be no part of it. The continual sadism of Defiant\'s first officer makes this difficult, and when the captain is disabled, the chance for violence increases.','/xN8zeOsIqsyZGsEHDX403pMkf0G.jpg','1962-04-15',101,'Released','The cry was MUTINY... and the decks ran red!...','H.M.S. Defiant',42997,3.0983,6.556,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4239,_binary '\0','/v0kWieDdaMpThbcLr3lsjvCBj4I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055892',7.2,3687,'en','David and Lisa','Teenager David Clemens develops a hysterical fear that he will die if he comes into physical contact with another person. Perturbed, David\'s overbearing mother places him in a home for mentally disturbed young people, but David remains withdrawn from the other patients and his psychiatrist. Over time, however, David grows interested in 15-year-old Lisa, who suffers from multiple personalities – one who can only speak in rhyme, and the other, a mute.','/jujTT52xmggRVwdWvSD2DPqUI1O.jpg','1962-12-26',95,'Released','An unusual love story!','David and Lisa',109667,3.6521,7.2,'UiKlI9KbQnc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4240,_binary '\0','/9QAq05yiisQKhsE20khLJYIUGf2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055893',4.9,1333,'en','The Day Mars Invaded Earth','Martians replace scientist &amp; his family to pave way for invasion.','/tW3bGGYma4LesdXTj6aNBpxtOM1.jpg','1963-02-14',70,'Released','Strange Invisible Astro-Energy Unleashed Leaves Mankind A Human Shell As It Destroys His Body And Brain!','The Day Mars Invaded Earth',118716,1.8413,4.3,'mHcd-Ei9S5A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4241,_binary '\0','/dEwdT5ZULYHOYVlc7aSRhAazAeO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055894',6.1,9858,'en','The Day of the Triffids','After an unusual meteor shower leaves most of the human population blind, a merchant navy officer must find a way to conquer tall, aggressive plants which are feeding on people and animals.','/x6LYwbOzBl606vMXZtd6apxhcaY.jpg','1963-04-24',93,'Released','From the nightmare novel that made the world shudder!','The Day of the Triffids',21143,3.2262,6.101,'FqrLqg3w6AU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4242,_binary '\0','/1L6or9sR7oW4BkYx18NZOwapLkD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055895',7.8,15246,'en','Days of Wine and Roses','An alcoholic falls in love with and gets married to a young woman, whom he systematically addicts to booze so they can share his \"passion\" together.','/cRVl1BR3x3P2NqUv61eveJNJ0ip.jpg','1963-02-04',117,'Released','From the days of wine and roses, finally comes a night like this.','Days of Wine and Roses',32488,3.5701,7.5,'ga2BIz0YugA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4243,_binary '\0','/g9ypRImifSFWGM3VZWPYvQAfXFV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055902',4.7,1624,'en','The Devil\'s Hand','A man is haunted by visions of a beautiful woman. When he finally meets her, he winds up involved in a satanic cult.','/nLQawCmsE2rKKkvAav6u7FLl2jx.jpg','1961-09-13',71,'Released','The men she loved lived to love no others!','The Devil\'s Hand',48421,1.5499,4.6,'PeFSQgBFOaA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4244,_binary '\0','/dMQcHcEMDLuCjtrIY1nfuktoLW8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055910',7.7,5149,'fr','Cybèle ou les dimanches de ville d\'Avray','The tragic story of a young orphan girl who is befriended by an innocent but emotionally disabled veteran of the French Indochina War.','/9L5DtYYlO3yrg2qtTCxROLnLl2V.jpg','1962-11-12',110,'Released',NULL,'Sundays and Cybele',43001,2.1533,7.2,'h92ihcGOW-g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4245,_binary '\0','/u2nPH7STKcz8ddpvxo8Ler1SvPc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055913',7.9,15935,'it','Divorzio all\'italiana','Ferdinando Cefalù is desperate to marry his cousin, Angela, but he is married to Rosalia and divorce is illegal in Italy. To get around the law, he tries to trick his wife into having an affair so he can catch her and murder her, as he knows he would be given a light sentence for killing an adulterous woman. He persuades a painter to lure his wife into an affair, but Rosalia proves to be more faithful than he expected.','/vZbdSpUFyFiDBBTY0AiSrN9f303.jpg','1961-12-20',104,'Released','He ordered marriage on the rocks with a twist... Italian Style!','Divorce Italian Style',20271,3.2251,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4246,_binary '\0','/srgq7bzZsuDw7NoGXdazRXp7Hl6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055928',7.2,197882,'en','Dr. No','Agent 007 battles mysterious Dr. No, a scientific genius bent on destroying the U.S. space program. As the countdown to disaster begins, Bond must go to Jamaica, where he encounters beautiful Honey Ryder, to confront a megalomaniacal villain in his massive island headquarters.','/9zCOLJmLNst0sCPZlkW1IRoH65E.jpg','1962-10-07',110,'Released','Now meet the most extraordinary gentleman spy in all fiction!','Dr. No',646,12.1509,7,'6TQWsRWXvUM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4247,_binary '\0','/pm7SvDzGFqmWNJ3cBNB51jSNSrC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055946',2.3,6299,'en','Eegah','Teenagers stumble across a prehistoric caveman, who goes on a rampage.','/mvLmdKwnzVjPNdRs5FYBgL3xQWB.jpg','1962-04-17',92,'Released','The Crazed Love Of A Prehistoric Giant For A Ravishing Teen-Age Girl!','Eegah',31287,2.283,2.8,'vc2By03wD9g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4248,_binary '\0','/sh8D9InLWD79DhuExnIOE3Vcbhv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055950',7.5,2216,'el','Ηλέκτρα','Living in exile after the death of their father, the grown children of a murdered and usurped king converge to exact eye-for-an-eye revenge.','/k9wrO7tJqr04YVbXuVeyclf38i9.jpg','1962-05-25',110,'Released',NULL,'Electra',47447,1.3988,7,'jk9-2kuPbaI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4249,_binary '\0','/hAryw4rYslyZARW8KKunpzaZXQ4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055966',6.5,1284,'es','El espejo de la bruja','A husband murders his wife, and years later her ghost emerges from a witch\'s mirror to take her revenge.','/xZNG0AWKcShU3JIaZUSJBelahUj.jpg','1962-07-12',75,'Released',NULL,'The Witch\'s Mirror',42993,1.1867,6.9,'JLjPuPaUwaA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4250,_binary '\0','/mz2nMk0iA7CwHZwtbWdcV8oePg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055972',7.3,7622,'en','Experiment in Terror','A man with an asthmatic voice telephones and assaults clerk Kelly Sherwood at home and coerces her into helping him steal a large sum from her bank.','/knD04Xa9nYoGYQARpN2fXHf2JAg.jpg','1962-04-12',123,'Released','Terror... Tension... Almost More Than The Heart Can Bear','Experiment in Terror',42995,2.3186,7.1,'wP818MvKBEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4251,_binary '\0','/fm7MbxpTXeOhuyzxvX8kpmBJZXI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055981',7.5,2660,'it','I fidanzati','A young man has a renewed interest in his girlfriend when he takes a job that separates the two.','/hK3nOU0MZhnzj8DoNvIUfbLqMDs.jpg','1963-05-16',84,'Released',NULL,'The Fiancés',66180,1.4157,7.653,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4252,_binary '\0','/8TXAoYmiSSlC6PNZVScuqhyEprz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055988',5.7,1521,'en','Five Weeks in a Balloon','Professor Fergusson plans to make aviation history by making his way across Africa by balloon. He plans to claim uncharted territories in West Africa as proof of his inventions worth.','/uX6rzy5SwjMFO9TgHXNBp8nSfpS.jpg','1962-08-22',101,'Released','DISCOVER...! The slave market of Zanzibar! The forbidden city of Timbuktu! The treacherous Simoon of the Sahara!','Five Weeks in a Balloon',42996,2.2933,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4253,_binary '\0','/c8XDDDiJ9pkbxCoIUEB6jIs3ArG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055992',6.6,3307,'en','Follow That Dream','When the Kwimper family car runs out of fuel on a new Florida highway and an officious state supervisor tries to run them off, Pop digs in his heels and decides to do a little homesteading. He, his son Toby and their \'adopted\' children—Holly, Ariadne, and the twins—start their own little community along a strip of the roadside.','/fpTkjmDyjN8rsWwmoZsba8xZzMl.jpg','1962-04-11',109,'Released','GO! GO! GO! It\'s Free-Wheeling Fun!','Follow That Dream',18643,2.5024,6.1,'P7fzyA0Sd5Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4254,_binary '\0','/9OAFaisshciBLDVQpIJkNAlHfCf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0055998',7.1,3769,'en','Freud: The Secret Passion','An examination of Austrian psychologist Sigmund Freud\'s career when he began to treat patients diagnosed with hysteria, using the radical technique of hypnosis.','/pApfDPqjVcBEcz2MHzklRVxKt74.jpg','1962-12-12',140,'Released','Alone he fought against his own dark passions...','Freud: The Secret Passion',35806,2.4755,6.5,'cP2lnhl4xQc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4255,_binary '\0','/aVWtleBwULL24bR2ehbwfdANZYR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056016',5.8,1502,'en','Geronimo','In 1883, the Apache Indians lead by Geronimo reluctantly surrender to the attacks of American and Mexican troops, in exchange for a territory and food for their warriors. Soon though, Geronimo escapes the camps and declares war against the Americans.','/mO8jTUR212MuRs2aMajCe95gZ3W.jpg','1962-04-27',101,'Released','No bullet could kill him. No army could capture him.','Geronimo',37238,2.4436,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4256,_binary '\0','/xO298AhLjxTiJZSdpus5jszuyOy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056017',7.1,1479,'en','Gigot','A poignant comedy about a mute who befriends Nicole, the little daughter of a prostitute. Gleason shows his considerable talents as an actor without uttering a sound as he plays the bumbling, kind-hearted janitor, Gigot. Gleason wrote the original story and music for this film.','/yICUAhX7RNGgSkZXDHMGq7qNYci.jpg','1962-11-01',104,'Released','A new joy has come to the screen... and the world is a happier place to live in!','Gigot',48003,1.827,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4257,_binary '\0','/tFE3gE1EsfTLgaknzKXXLGIYHTx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056023',5.6,3987,'en','Girls! Girls! Girls!','When he learns that his boss is retiring to Arizona, sailor Ross Carpenter has to find a way to buy the Westwind, a boat that he and his father built. Meanwhile, he\'s also caught between two women: insensitive club singer Robin and sweet Laurel.','/41NoayYsUD4LPv586apJxl0iNzf.jpg','1962-11-21',99,'Released','The Swingin\'-est Elvis! + Girls (Girls, Girls) + Songs (lots of them). Who could ask for anything more?','Girls! Girls! Girls!',15734,2.5532,5.4,'e75ncIrK4BA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4258,_binary '\0','/u8AWqW7ierKmRNR9YGLoLTa9prW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056040',6.1,1991,'es','Gritos en la noche','Dr. Orlof, a former prison doctor, abducts beautiful women from nightclubs to use their skin to repair his daughter\'s fire-scarred face. He is assisted by Morpho, a deformed monstrosity who delights in biting his victims. Orlof had better hurry, though -- a young police inspector and his ballerina girlfriend are onto his sadistic practices.','/rBMXFntgf2CqfysOqG1eiitRmX.jpg','1962-05-14',90,'Released','You\'ll get an insight into the face of terror!','The Awful Dr. Orlof',27699,1.67,5.9,'u6ytGe1Iesw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4259,_binary '\0','/1eA14ee9HceViYc2vHe5e7T8HAK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056045',7.4,1939,'ru','Гусарская баллада','A young girl decides to join a Hussar squadron and fight against Napoleon. Dressed as a man, she proves herself an excellent, even heroic soldier, but complications ensue when her real identity is revealed.','/4Bzy43hgPcFKF4OYH5ih3Jrzadn.jpg','1963-01-19',96,'Released',NULL,'Ballad of a Hussar',63304,1.2443,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4260,_binary '\0','/frVo9Q4TCYrH2Hm79SHa27SNYao.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056048',7.1,7626,'en','Gypsy','Gypsy\'s mother Rose dreams of a life in show business for her daughters, but Louise becomes a huge burlesque star. Stage musical loosely based on the memoirs of Gypsy Rose Lee.','/qmeyhwe7pHJ30n6uLq8swyW1Juz.jpg','1962-11-01',143,'Released','All The Heart and Happiness of The Broadway Play','Gypsy',39391,3.0753,6.354,'chNGGFtAZf8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4261,_binary '\0','/rBsAgCTXB6LtjTdtXG7mnSRwcse.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056049',8,6889,'ja','裸の島','A family of four are the sole inhabitants of a small island, where they struggle each day to irrigate their crops.','/rHpQyPBuFyofx5D5UC95ec2sFgV.jpg','1960-11-23',97,'Released',NULL,'The Naked Island',3764,2.4688,8,'3GrLWObrHkA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4262,_binary '\0','/nC3IjYhUgZWgfKfFX0ygMigFwgc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056058',8.6,94089,'ja','切腹','Down-on-his-luck veteran Tsugumo Hanshirō enters the courtyard of the prosperous House of Iyi. Unemployed, and with no family, he hopes to find a place to commit seppuku—and a worthy second to deliver the coup de grâce in his suicide ritual. The senior counselor for the Iyi clan questions the ronin’s resolve and integrity, suspecting Hanshirō of seeking charity rather than an honorable end. What follows is a pair of interlocking stories which lay bare the difference between honor and respect, and promises to examine the legendary foundations of the Samurai code.','/5konZnIbcAxZjP616Cz5o9bKEfW.jpg','1962-09-15',135,'Released','What befalls others today, may be your own fate tomorrow.','Harakiri',14537,10.69,8.5,'gfABwM-Ppng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4263,_binary '\0','/1YZS8WA84TwLFrcnj3LHE2nznN1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056059',7.1,15957,'en','Hatari!','A female wildlife photographer arrives on an East African reservation where a group of men trap wild animals for zoos and circuses.','/fT1Ht8PSM5cFKmejrnufWvpXAPk.jpg','1962-06-19',157,'Released','Hatari means Fun! Hatari means Adventure! Hatari means Thrills!','Hatari!',11385,4.0346,6.8,'twlWGH9jmjc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4264,_binary '\0','/m1NdU25axOn22J42c9SDt3VNDhf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056062',6.9,8191,'en','Hell Is for Heroes','World War II drama where the action centers around a single maneuver by a squad of GIs in retaliation against the force of the German Siegfried line. Reese joins a group of weary GIs unexpectedly ordered back into the line when on their way to a rest area. While most of the men withdraw from their positions facing a German pillbox at the far side of a mine-field, half a dozen men are left to protect a wide front. By various ruses, they manage to convince the Germans that a large force is still holding the position. Then Reese leads two of the men in an unauthorized and unsuccessful attack on the pillbox, in which the other two are killed; and when the main platoon returns, he is threatened with court-martial. Rather that face the disgrace, and in an attempt to show he was right, he makes a one-man attack on the pillbox.','/nZ0h8V0jsS5NLKdUZIZ2I2xMWtR.jpg','1962-06-26',90,'Released','This is the living hell for heroes','Hell Is for Heroes',32041,3.6968,6.5,'lD_R_s_dZ1o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4265,_binary '\0','/4hK1fDFO2u4MmvMK2isOAzyweTL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056085',7.1,25857,'en','How the West Was Won','The epic tale of the development of the American West from the 1830s through the Civil War to the end of the century, as seen through the eyes of one pioneer family.','/rmwc89VMQR4rUSDfakd0Z6GyF6q.jpg','1962-11-02',164,'Released','It\'s here! The mightiest adventure ever filmed!','How the West Was Won',11897,6.0728,7,'updl0L4Tayc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4266,_binary '\0','/9uYktPaKu6hRPGfgd7OAHpgGeBs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056093',6.8,1371,'en','If a Man Answers','Rich socialite Chantal marries photographer Eugene and everything seems blissful until her envious friend attempts to break them up. In desperation, she turns to her mother, but the advice she receives may do more harm than good.','/7wupF3mY2RWFHGO0zT0ctCFo2GL.jpg','1962-10-10',102,'Released','...Don\'t Hang Up! Hang Around for the Fun!','If a Man Answers',46081,2.2454,6.1,'JiJgM_gO5SA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4267,_binary '\0','/4TqqMASEdL3E23Onc4742IQ1D8i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056095',6.6,3790,'en','In Search of the Castaways','Two teenagers, Mary (Hayley Mills) and Robert (Keith Hamshere) are lead by Professor Paganel (Maurice Chevalier) on a search expedition for the children\'s shipwrecked sea captain father. This Disney film was based upon Jules Verne\'s 1868 adventure novel Captain Grant\'s Children.','/27hbGwIAmvcB9X9FdXSwvU05frt.jpg','1962-12-01',98,'Released','A Thousand Thrills, And Hayley Mills!','In Search of the Castaways',34774,1.6585,6.5,'sBVu7oLdd1I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4268,_binary '\0','/jOulpNwtoJP5fF1LJX1ojw6BxBq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056111',8,44077,'ru','Иваново детство','In WW2, twelve year old Soviet orphan Ivan Bondarev works for the Soviet army as a scout behind the German lines and strikes a friendship with three sympathetic Soviet officers.','/trY9ADhXgSExH3DLlFhV5C8aDtw.jpg','1962-05-09',95,'Released',NULL,'Ivan\'s Childhood',31442,3.8965,7.825,'00BWObZx5FI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4269,_binary '\0','/12jlQhQmix9lErdB1wTrJsnmfZS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056112',6.3,3593,'en','Jack the Giant Killer','Desiring control of the kingdom, evil wizard Pendragon devises a cunning machination to usurp the throne. By abducting and forcing Princess Elaine to marry him, Pendragon will coerce the king into abdicating his power. When Pendragon sends a giant to kidnap Elaine, a simple farmer named Jack witnesses the abduction, and bravely slays the beast. Undeterred, Pendragon has more power and creatures at his disposal.','/nQYitRN2Wyy2sf8VQ6AvWBaVB2z.jpg','1962-05-18',94,'Released','A pretty princess. An evil sorcerer. A hero for the ages.','Jack the Giant Killer',25360,3.937,6.561,'E5LncguSkS8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4270,_binary '\0','/oKNaUIsvIREuaw5RrwNsVgmb8O1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056121',7.2,2112,'en','Jigsaw','A woman is found murdered in a seaside house along the coast from Brighton in the county of East Sussex, England. Local D.I. Fred Fellows and D.S. Jim Wilks lead an investigation methodically following up leads and clues mostly in Brighton and Hove but also further afield. _-= Based on the novel \"Sleep Long My Love\" by Hillary Waugh and Inspired by the Brighton Trunk Murders of the late 1930\'s =-_','/aQfhEyE2BBjsr4LzAoQu1x9cZSn.jpg','1962-08-21',107,'Released',NULL,'Jigsaw',93193,1.3587,7.2,'7dlBXG0V1ao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4271,_binary '\0','/AsAgNQ4O72I9G2wctMYKiKlXIwt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056127',4.7,2187,'en','Journey to the Seventh Planet','A space expedition to Uranus is menaced by a giant brain that can make illusions come true.','/f80iztZfwhYVd0jBOGCKwj47ChY.jpg','1962-03-10',77,'Released','What is this monstrous THING? With the power of mind over matter?... There beyond the stars your unspeakable fears...deepest desires...come alive...and you are trapped in a spectacle of terror- your secret fears pitted against you!','Journey to the Seventh Planet',29570,1.9424,4.9,'AvM5lek4zLw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4272,_binary '\0','/lIwLd1VnEFHjvV2bxg3oSqqIENt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056134',7.8,1293,'bn','কাঞ্চনজঙ্ঘা','Played out in real time, several complex family dramas intersect in the landscape of the Himalayan foothills, allowing the Bengali auteur to examine the class and generational differences of postcolonial India while celebrating the hopes of a society in transition.','/dci2Nw6Ywb8BEwUi2FsmCwCY058.jpg','1962-05-11',102,'Released',NULL,'Kanchenjungha',166204,1.254,7.588,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4273,_binary '\0','/ml1b7hJ3Kr3wu3s3bC2NIxdAPNd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056135',7.4,1329,'ja','からみ合い','A dying businessman intends to will ¥200 million to his three illegitimate children, but his associates scheme to take advantage of the situation.','/u8WTsuLlx5sytaFX3CjDxgBezUe.jpg','1962-02-16',108,'Released',NULL,'The Inheritance',159414,1.7119,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4274,_binary '\0','/mwuLeBWUuM6UrhQ6hRjiUxule22.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056138',6.1,3442,'en','Kid Galahad','After completing military service, Walter Gulick takes a job as a sparring partner at a gym, the owner of which sees potential in Walter as a professional fighter—and takes him under his wing.','/9iyvjDZgbbMTgoAbsVk7B4GvTjR.jpg','1962-11-29',96,'Released','Presley packs the the screen\'s biggest wallop...with the gals...with the gloves...with the guitar!','Kid Galahad',18684,3.0005,6.213,'zh-74tEWM_U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4275,_binary '\0','/fqRjyw9MceJrTj9Z3ppEWPeYq09.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056141',7.3,2977,'en','A Kind of Loving','As Vic Brown vacillates between infatuation and disinterest for his co-worker Ingrid Rothwell, she finds out that she is pregnant and Vic has to reconcile how he thought his life would go with what life actually has in store for him.','/zOmiMh7lkHbzWHwazcHFGYVnVHY.jpg','1962-04-12',112,'Released','A kind of loving that knew no wrong until it was too late!','A Kind of Loving',33765,2.2755,7.1,'n5lOTh309ZY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4276,_binary '\0','/nmdsYZvgqxwLkcgWCYCXQEcDxW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056160',7.9,1634,'hu','Két félidő a pokolban','To celebrate Hitler\'s birthday, a soccer match is organised between the Germans and a group of Hungarian political prisoners, one of whom is a famous pre-war football star.','/2fKH3uZP3jbbIcohRWQX0R9nGQo.jpg','1961-11-02',120,'Released',NULL,'Two Half-Times in Hell',163363,1.4704,7.731,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4277,_binary '\0','/5AgxkrTcjgUlz9WUWGsWWyK2swY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056165',6.4,1395,'fr','Landru','Paris, France, during the First World War. While thousands of soldiers die every day on the battlefields, Henri Landru, a seemingly respectable furniture dealer, married and father of four children, relentlessly feeds his own sinister factory of death.','/dnBReq5q1KlsEMqZEHn2NRs1dtl.jpg','1963-01-25',112,'Released','The most shocking scandal Paris ever saw!','Bluebeard',4195,2.931,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4278,_binary '\0','/olvFHqjMCCUVJ6NxxDxNJKPSl21.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056171',6.8,2493,'it','Ro.Go.Pa.G.','Four short films by four different directors dealing with the principles of modern life. \"Illibatezza\" (Rossellini): The hostess Anna Maria, to dissuade an aggressive suitor who prefers maternal tendencies, assumes an unscrupulous attitude, obeying the suggestions of her distant boyfriend. \"The New World\" (Godard): The deflagration of an atomic bomb causes strange effects on the inhabitants of a city. \"La ricotta\" (Pasolini): During the filming of a film about a religious subject, the extra Stracci dies hanging on the cross due to an indigestion of ricotta. \"Il pollo spante\" (Gregoretti): While an expert illustrates to a board of merchants the most modern techniques to increase sales through the discovery of the secret self of the average consumer, the human story of a bourgeois who, following these suggestions, focuses on the purchase of a plot of land in the countryside.','/AjZgOidGeYN6ZGDHlwx1RZ9UFXV.jpg','1963-02-19',122,'Released','Gay Beginnings of the End of the World.','Ro.Go.Pa.G.',59045,2.4214,7.2,'51uh1PT6I58','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4279,_binary '\0','/eULrEMwgXnWmzdowUfegaw2YYgD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056172',8.3,346171,'en','Lawrence of Arabia','During World War I, English officer Thomas Edward \'T.E.\' Lawrence sets out to unite and lead the diverse, often warring, Arab tribes to fight the Turks.','/AiAm0EtDvyGqNpVoieRw4u65vD1.jpg','1962-12-11',228,'Released','Nothing is written.','Lawrence of Arabia',947,15.7467,7.999,'KR1yTI8zFJk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4280,_binary '\0','/akKHrV0yKvVMQz5FicKfkwLe2An.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056183',6.9,2114,'en','Light in the Piazza','A young American woman traveling in Italy with her mother is slender, blonde, beautiful and there is something charmingly naive about her. Fabrizio Naccarelli seems to always know where the mother and daughter will sightsee next. Signor Naccarelli is just as concerned about where this will lead as Mrs. Johnson is. Then she starts thinking that perhaps her daughter can be a wife of a wealthy young man in a society where all she has to do is look beautiful. What happens if Signor Naccarelli finds out who his prospective daughter-in-law really is?','/vNlaQd8MJRqIhk8a93PHJW619Db.jpg','1962-02-07',102,'Released','Were they too young for the love they dared?','Light in the Piazza',45247,2.386,6.4,'V66EQzFA-Hs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4281,_binary '\0','/40JNQ4FOekM1LDgUC5mDcM8bZyl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056193',7.5,117182,'en','Lolita','Humbert Humbert is a middle-aged British novelist who is both appalled by and attracted to the vulgarity of American culture. When he comes to stay at the boarding house run by Charlotte Haze, he soon becomes obsessed with Lolita, the woman\'s teenaged daughter.','/8Puqbeh0D95DpXFWep1rmH78btu.jpg','1962-06-13',154,'Released','How did they ever make a movie of Lolita?','Lolita',802,7.6519,7.3,'KOgioT6OTGc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4282,_binary '\0','/8DH2ri8SEH2hYnWL28A1712c7F0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056194',7.5,10105,'en','The Loneliness of the Long Distance Runner','A rebellious youth, sentenced to a boy’s reformatory for robbing a bakery, rises through the ranks of the institution by impressing its Governor through his prowess as a long distance runner. He is encouraged to compete in an upcoming race, but faces ridicule from his peers.','/ePhZKUNyFGc8lzx0E0LiCcKs4y4.jpg','1962-09-20',104,'Released',NULL,'The Loneliness of the Long Distance Runner',16103,2.2936,7.2,'r6LOFFJt94Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4283,_binary '\0','/7hbpOpGDOYZ4G8ddLuzNmzxZP6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056195',7.5,11135,'en','Lonely are the Brave','A fiercely independent cowboy arranges to have himself locked up in jail in order to then escape with an old friend who has been sentenced to the penitentiary.','/g6wKfhwGPsKgPI77ZiLhL6argMQ.jpg','1962-04-26',107,'Released','Life can never cage a man like this!','Lonely are the Brave',43002,3.9435,7.366,'RDKGx3lOXkQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4284,_binary '\0','/k6E1lQBDb29OD5c9XlyyVpR4P8E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056196',7.5,6564,'en','Long Day\'s Journey Into Night','An Irish miser, his morphine addicted wife, their debauched older son, and a gravely ill younger son. A quiet Connecticut vacation home on one foggy day in August 1912 becomes the backdrop for domestic decline.','/b7cu92b2sAJix1WFiLZiHSkZY1r.jpg','1962-10-09',170,'Released',NULL,'Long Day\'s Journey Into Night',43004,2.2583,6.9,'oMqvzhFXXyg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4285,_binary '\0','/yt9FIS2Osm97M7w4dLFkBu7YxW8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056197',7.7,63638,'en','The Longest Day','The retelling of June 6, 1944, from the perspectives of the Germans, US, British, Canadians, and the Free French. Marshall Erwin Rommel, touring the defenses being established as part of the Reich\'s Atlantic Wall, notes to his officers that when the Allied invasion comes they must be stopped on the beach. \"For the Allies as well as the Germans, it will be the longest day\"','/5zmvEofdIlgXrQl9A7e5IOzlnFU.jpg','1962-09-25',178,'Released','THE INTERNATIONAL ACCLAIMED HIT JUST AS IT WAS SHOWN IN THE MAJOR CAPITALS OF THE WORLD!','The Longest Day',9289,8.8967,7.6,'nqFn_pM5QxU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4286,_binary '\0','/z5Q09PMkEsh6K6PLKcxNbgh9hmN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056210',7.6,3385,'it','Mafioso','When a good-natured factory supervisor living in Milan with his Northern wife returns to his native Sicily, a decades\' old oath forces him to fulfill a nightmarish obligation.','/36abgVBo67TI2rPEIWqMRh3oQ1Z.jpg','1962-10-24',105,'Released','This is the face of a MAFIOSO...sometimes smiling, sometimes savage. Here is the story of a man who returns to his native Sicily for a holiday and finds himself again bound to the silent laws of \"The Honored Society.\"','Mafioso',34866,1.6614,7.574,'9SK_CyQazRk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4287,_binary '\0','/kQt1Rg9v6AYyGROMeuTR9m8E7BW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056211',4.8,2966,'en','The Magic Sword','The son of a sorceress, armed with weapons, armour and six magically summoned knights, goes on a quest to save a princess from a vengeful wizard.','/mVivlmUdyUwqSBnQkSzX3TLduky.jpg','1962-04-01',80,'Released','The Most Incredible Weapon Ever Wielded!','The Magic Sword',26643,2.5445,4.3,'16oWjDLJqEg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4288,_binary '\0','/4OqoSolfhNesDAfv2zluIDVXiPR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056215',7.7,11560,'it','Mamma Roma','After years spent working as a prostitute in her Italian village, middle-aged Mamma Roma has saved enough money to buy herself a fruit stand so that she can have a respectable middle-class life and reestablish contact with the 16-year-old son she abandoned when he was an infant. But her former pimp threatens to expose her sordid past, and her troubled son seems destined to fall into a life of crime and violence.','/kQtO9rzEhcezWl0nQlIxV2FZftt.jpg','1962-09-22',110,'Released',NULL,'Mamma Roma',47796,2.5295,7.881,'dMNlwanLUZ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4289,_binary '\0','/f6gTJLQ950dPHfFRnxQdaA6OlXJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056217',8.1,89789,'en','The Man Who Shot Liberty Valance','Questions arise when Senator Stoddard attends the funeral of a local man named Tom Doniphon in a small Western town. Flashing back, we learn Doniphon saved Stoddard, then a lawyer, when he was roughed up by a crew of outlaws terrorizing the town, led by Liberty Valance. As the territory\'s safety hung in the balance, Doniphon and Stoddard, two of the only people standing up to him, proved to be very important, but different, foes to Valance.','/4C1R0LEivLjbv3swAzJfzh0tzXl.jpg','1962-04-13',123,'Released','Together for the first time','The Man Who Shot Liberty Valance',11697,8.085,7.8,'EVXuo2WiU_I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4290,_binary '\0','/bbec0wDUaV8nQnQHC6Fb0fSYwNM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056218',7.9,85271,'en','The Manchurian Candidate','Near the end of the Korean War, a platoon of U.S. soldiers is captured by communists and brainwashed. Following the war, the platoon is returned home, and Sergeant Raymond Shaw is lauded as a hero by the rest of his platoon. However, the platoon commander, Captain Bennett Marco, finds himself plagued by strange nightmares and soon races to uncover a terrible plot.','/fE0Yjnxnv9JPs11elXha4BEwKTR.jpg','1962-10-24',126,'Released','When you\'ve seen it all, you\'ll swear there\'s never been anything like it!','The Manchurian Candidate',982,5.5966,7.5,'tgCyowLRfvA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4291,_binary '\0','/egPyHQTaEDn65JurwvNSmwAeqqd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056219',5.9,1808,'en','Maniac','When a stranger enters a quiet, country town and is seduced by a sensuous married woman he unwittingly finds himself at the centre of a storm of sexual guilt and murder.','/ttiI7okdfXITHGLS2E9aijKGhOy.jpg','1963-05-20',86,'Released','Stalks his wife... his daughter... their lover!','Maniac',37342,2.408,6.2,'lpD4DqAeEHw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4292,_binary '\0','/dwEl5fjIUdqJViFcszRUYKi8mCo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056234',6.6,3183,'en','Merrill\'s Marauders','Brigadier General Frank D. Merrill leads the 3,000 American volunteers of his 5307th Composite Unit (Provisional), aka \"Merrill\'s Marauders\", behind Japanese lines across Burma to Myitkyina, pushing beyond their limits and fighting pitched battles at every strong-point.','/gj3SuPPTGcz4XnHL6jHr3G8K1h9.jpg','1962-03-16',98,'Released','How they fought those last 500 miles will remain forever in your memory!','Merrill\'s Marauders',35392,2.3352,6.243,'ehV6phpy-N8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4293,_binary '\0','/5bvQEihHBKJ0Rs1J46HcG0wASDr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056241',8.1,21346,'en','The Miracle Worker','The true story of the frightening, lonely world of silence and darkness of 7-year-old Helen Keller who, since infancy, has never seen the sky, heard her mother\'s voice or expressed her innermost feelings. Then Annie Sullivan, a 20-year-old teacher from Boston, arrives. Having just recently regained her own sight, the no-nonsense Annie reaches out to Helen through the power of touch, the only tool they have in common, and leads her bold pupil on a miraculous journey from fear and isolation to happiness and light.','/3dI6UVM5W1sz3MU9gNK5nVDcAyQ.jpg','1962-05-23',106,'Released','An emotional earthquake!','The Miracle Worker',1162,4.7321,7.9,'OffvfxvcSFc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4294,_binary '\0','/hTYfahH0QbWUVmul3l9rVhuayjE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056255',6.8,6454,'en','Mr. Hobbs Takes a Vacation','Banker Roger Hobbs wants to spend his vacation alone with his wife, Peggy, but she insists on a family vacation at a California beach house that turns out to be ugly and broken down. Daughter Katey, embarrassed by her braces, refuses to go to the beach, as does TV-addicted son Danny. When the family is joined by Hobbs\' two unhappily married daughters and their husbands, he must help everyone with their problems to get some peace.','/82JEB6tYkXwB1LshoT2mho9QH2p.jpg','1962-06-15',116,'Released','Jimmy Takes A Vacation... You Have All The Fun!','Mr. Hobbs Takes a Vacation',41521,2.9248,6.5,'DNH9l90Yw0c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4295,_binary '\0','/urXv48loBPvUDf8CF1YtYjmRECW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056262',7.7,21035,'en','The Music Man','Traveling con artist Harold Hill targets the naïve residents of a small town in 1910s Iowa by posing as a boys\' bandleader to raise money before he can skip town.','/4yo6qaqVF1IThXMapo4yW9BRWjV.jpg','1962-06-19',151,'Released','The story of that man and his 76 trombones, and the wonderful, wonderful tune he played on every heart in town!','The Music Man',13671,3.4985,7.1,'cbiBx5T2uX0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4296,_binary '\0','/dZJpcnokyQ86wrUNooiRJGmDMHT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056264',7.2,19699,'en','Mutiny on the Bounty','The Bounty leaves Portsmouth in 1787. Its destination: to sail to Tahiti and load bread-fruit. Captain Bligh will do anything to get there as fast as possible, using any means to keep up a strict discipline. When they arrive at Tahiti, it is like a paradise for the crew, something completely different than the living hell aboard the ship. On the way back to England, officer Fletcher Christian becomes the leader of a mutiny.','/caxk06SANEacvycZFiApv1LA6Kl.jpg','1962-11-08',185,'Released','The mightiest excitement that ever swept across the sea or the screen!','Mutiny on the Bounty',11085,4.9377,7.06,'Ur25pXcI52o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4297,_binary '\0','/gluooDaZ9PYOq4pUlKDCagRoBcp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056267',6.5,1746,'en','My Geisha','Famed movie director Paul Robaix breaks with tradition by not casting his actress-comedienne wife, Lucy Dell, in his latest film production, a version of Madame Butterfly. Undaunted, the resourceful Lucy wings her way to Tokyo and, masquerading as a Japanese geisha, lands the coveted role from her unsuspecting husband! But in front of the cameras (and behind the pancake makeup), Lucy faces greater challenges: her lecherous leading man - and a husband who is beginning to realize that his talented new \"discovery\" seems vaguely familiar...','/xIFrL4TKONYvfnZApzAxveysNTg.jpg','1962-03-09',120,'Released','It\'s the WACKIEST HOAX That Ever Turned the Screen Hilarious!','My Geisha',43006,2.7604,6.5,'zv0Ts3VFZmU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4298,_binary '\0','/rJTL5zeWPmBvoxcKbIcHOsd359U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056277',6.6,4130,'en','Captain Clegg','A captain and his sailors investigate the rampaging \"Marsh Phantoms\" terrorizing a coastal town, but their search is hindered by a local reverend and a horrifying curse.','/5wQbnaBidXchb2WSSCdEFgX0ZyT.jpg','1962-06-13',83,'Released','Who knows the truth about the curse of Captain Clegg?','Captain Clegg',19201,2.0312,6.3,'U8Qm47Mhmew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4299,_binary '\0','/qKI987IS7BgJg5gnoI8guzpUX1e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056279',6.9,4998,'en','Night of the Eagle','A college professor who discovers that his wife has been practicing black magic for years forces her to stop but soon learns the true power of the occult.','/zhsE6gYKJjgRCaV7MF0fCsErHzm.jpg','1962-04-25',90,'Released','Do The Undead Demons Of Hell Still Arise To Terrorise The World?','Night of the Eagle',45714,2.4968,6.7,'ihw5zZqjryw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4300,_binary '\0','/e0yaTDxhKYOzM0ktqFSCoO7DO1r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056289',6.7,3372,'en','The Notorious Landlady','An American junior diplomat in London rents a house from, and falls in love with, a woman suspected of murder.','/rFzKbGPrTwbFSq6gd9qviLCnxdo.jpg','1962-04-13',123,'Released','Did she...or did she?','The Notorious Landlady',49844,1.8441,6.8,'k_cqtI__Q1M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4301,_binary '\0','/hlS23ABq7d8BwAeB9LKfZ2Xum8L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056291',7.4,25402,'pl','Nóż w wodzie','On their way to an afternoon on the lake, husband and wife Andrzej and Krystyna nearly run over a young hitchhiker. Inviting the young man onto the boat with them, Andrzej begins to subtly torment him; the hitchhiker responds by making overtures toward Krystyna. When the hitchhiker is accidentally knocked overboard, the husband\'s panic results in unexpected consequences.','/tkdeCwZhy9hzzVjZFjw0RPGWUIg.jpg','1962-03-09',94,'Released','Acclaimed by all! Roman Polanski\'s tense, ironic Drama!','Knife in the Water',11502,2.9212,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4302,_binary '\0','/tfU2yq4rUkpElRMRfCWg7r288nA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056293',3.8,1554,'en','Nude on the Moon','Through an unexpected inheritance, a couple of male scientists travel to the moon via a rocket of their own design. There, they find a lush garden paradise rather than a barren wasteland. They\'re captured by (semi-nude) telepathic humanoids and taken before the Great Council, where the Moon Goddess decides they should be allowed to continue their experiments. One falls in love, the other seeks to return home.','/wBTbmSSRCh6qxpNesRYximBS4gz.jpg','1961-01-01',70,'Released','A truly different adventure!','Nude on the Moon',50977,1.3938,4.2,'zZywl8PXXu4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4303,_binary '\0','/qKHUXZjvNFz0QOR8Q6PffzgC9le.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056302',7,1313,'fr','L\'Œil du Malin','On a work assignment in Germany, failed journalist Albin crosses paths with Andreas, a successful writer, and his wife Hélène, who quickly becomes the apple of Albin’s eye. While Andreas is off on a business trip, Albin tries to seduce Hélèn and, eventually, take over Andreas’ life.','/6bVUMaY3BaXQQ8FxtA0KApYEqFz.jpg','1962-05-02',80,'Released','Three\'s a crowd...until she whispered...\"three\'s allowed.\"','The Third Lover',101183,2.1985,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4304,_binary '\0','/Aj2OTdXudqbXPNTAtFwkA76tZxw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056308',6.5,1577,'en','Only Two Can Play','John Lewis is bored of his job and his wife. Then Liz, wife of a local councillor, sets her sights on him. But this is risky stuff in a Welsh valleys town - if he and Liz ever manage to consummate their affair, that is.','/pBt7wzFB7f5Yt5uR420aJNmOdkS.jpg','1962-01-19',106,'Released',NULL,'Only Two Can Play',54723,1.8743,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4305,_binary '\0','/AtUh4L4EP4bhqZghND0tIISeua7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056315',6.3,2364,'it','L\'orribile segreto del Dr. Hichcock','In late 19th century London, a woman weds a necrophiliac doctor whose first wife died under mysterious circumstances - and who might be returning from the grave to torment her successor.','/47Ej4hEQN21PPUrV1qdf7Xzjky6.jpg','1962-08-01',88,'Released','The candle of his lust burnt brightest in the shadow of the grave!','The Horrible Dr. Hichcock',42998,2.024,5.932,'loS3wZ3nXck','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4306,_binary '\0','/k13mFZr51lcOxvLrHHCk9Llevcf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056322',8.3,4752,'pt','O Pagador de Promessas','Zé is a very poor man whose most prized possession is his donkey. When his donkey falls terminally ill, Zé makes a promise to Saint Bárbara: If his donkey recovers, he will carry a cross - like Jesus - all the way from his city to Saint Bárbara\'s church, in the state capital. Upon the recovery of his donkey, Zé leaves on his journey. He makes it to the church, but the priest refuses to accept the cross once he discovers the context of Zé\'s promise.','/wjNydK6CnoJFEp69OzAcSsAaIME.jpg','1962-04-17',98,'Released',NULL,'The Given Word',59990,2.1081,8.1,'VO1F_WDMNCo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4307,_binary '\0','/zchaaZhN2wcIB6O6YLDBehRRBJK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056327',7.7,5336,'ja','乾いた花','A recently released gangster has to cope with the recent shifts of power between gangs, while taking care of a thrill-seeking young woman, who got in bad company while gambling.','/xEB48waFBIx4WEySuOpk1vOFZ6E.jpg','1964-03-01',96,'Released',NULL,'Pale Flower',61475,2.1486,7.4,'oOOr4nuWFqU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4308,_binary '\0','/juC8DqI4IlZFU1Q1FkMy9vrxdLF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056331',6.6,5746,'en','Panic in Year Zero!','While on a fishing trip, Harry Baldwin and his family hear an explosion and realize that Los Angeles has been leveled by a nuclear attack. Looters and killers are everywhere. Escaping to the hills with his family, he sets about the business of surviving in a world where, he knows, the old ideals of humanity will be the first casualties.','/tqeVkPaRwn0Rt5MF0VvGsBsMJtF.jpg','1962-07-05',93,'Released','An orgy of looting and lust!','Panic in Year Zero!',27568,2.585,6.3,'OpriTp9BkiY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4309,_binary '\0','/eUuI7MyC49QH562zkEWUmX69KLc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056335',6.8,1778,'en','The Password Is Courage','Sergeant-Major Charles Coward, a brave British soldier is captured by German forces during World War II. When he\'s thrown into a prisoner of war camp, he immediately plans his escape. Masquerading as a wounded German soldier, he makes it as far as the medical tent, where the deceived enemy forces award him the Iron Cross. Though he is ultimately discovered, he goes on to courageously pursue his freedom with a whimsical and undying audacity.','/qfkfrw3Wej1ZVRJPN37kkpV6OKQ.jpg','1962-06-01',116,'Released','The only man ever awarded the Iron Cross by the enemy!!!','The Password Is Courage',67749,1.7709,6.5,'jM4HkxAOwxs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4310,_binary '\0','/p55n7xZJnDUoJwopNpYsmJ09s5D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056341',6.2,1869,'en','Period of Adjustment','A newlywed couple on their honeymoon visit friends who are having marital problems of their own.','/8HyzrfJbVyt0SXlbXR4FM4kN72C.jpg','1962-10-31',112,'Released','The agonizing pause between the honeymoon and the marriage!','Period of Adjustment',43007,1.6109,6,'BJ-B7o74ZTk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4311,_binary '\0','/66L1r722YjycVD2Lmhbz4ejWUTb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056346',6.8,2178,'en','Phaedra','A modern retelling of the Greek myth of Phaedra. The young and fiery second wife of an extremely wealthy shipping magnate meets her estranged stepson Alexis and sparks immediately fly. Their love seems doomed from the beginning when she convinces him to come to Paris to meet his father.','/xHlKqqqrHbkdZ0iaRCbDVbcehLH.jpg','1962-05-25',116,'Released','A violent drama of profane love','Phaedra',48110,1.5467,5.7,'vB4kmEZaOQ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4312,_binary '\0','/uCgTZa2MPWCnTNP97NmoXDhevGm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056347',6.4,4227,'en','The Phantom of the Opera','A London opera house is haunted by tragic events on its opening night, but when its star is kidnapped, a producer tracks down the Phantom who is intent on seeking his revenge.','/sLNKIDXC9dFt9EnjNFxYMctZH1z.jpg','1962-06-25',84,'Released','BENEATH HIS MASK...The Grotesque Face of Horror Unimaginable! INSIDE HIS HEART...The Desperate Desire for Beauty and Love!','The Phantom of the Opera',46330,2.6665,6.4,'RQ3wfKvBuns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4313,_binary '\0','/5eWpI6zbH04Bq1kQzUSupw4aRQw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056350',5.9,1319,'en','The Pirates of Blood River','A group of ruthless pirates attack a 17th Century Huguenot settlement on the Isle of Devon in search of treasure and will stop at nothing to obtain it.','/ye0ioSmMo2zvDVpwnlm6rzkcKiV.jpg','1962-05-09',87,'Released','Ransacking a lost tropic island... for a fabulous idol of gold!','The Pirates of Blood River',58733,2.2624,6.2,'bo3uCLRrSH4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4314,_binary '\0','/4ZmW76nrYZ0e9VF1tnMVroWFSuf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056352',6.3,1674,'ru','Планета бурь','Soviet cosmonauts land on the planet Venus and find it teeming with life, some of it dangerous.','/5GjUVE9cx4sMWhue4LQXuWwAghf.jpg','1962-04-13',82,'Released',NULL,'Planet of Storms',49164,1.4366,5.5,'kw5uAxb_xsw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4315,_binary '\0','/mmlE3YStQ7dvAGnEEYI6TDFsfJQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056357',7.3,3037,'ru','Полосатый рейс','A Soviet cruise ship \"Evgeni Onegin\" is carrying cages with tigers and lions for a Soviet Circus. One loose monkey unlocks all cages, letting the tigers and lions out. Poor passengers and crew have no place to run. The captain abandons his post out of fear, and the monkey takes over the captain\'s post. The ship gets under total control by the tigers and lions. Only one lady is standing up to the challenge. Her name is Marianna, she loves animals, and she takes the situation under control.','/rlCyS3UPjTMBiYjGJsQWoZFmpvL.jpg','1961-06-27',84,'Released',NULL,'Striped Trip',45210,1.8918,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4316,_binary '\0','/4wlsQhrSPKI1ogfcPZJ5EZXtqEI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056368',6.5,5539,'en','The Premature Burial','An artist grows distant from his new wife as an irrational fear of premature burial consumes him.','/lHy5kqRrLPKnO61HG2xehGW9oLX.jpg','1962-03-07',81,'Released','Within the Coffin I Lie...ALIVE!','The Premature Burial',29235,2.5311,6.29,'l-88CQaoajU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4317,_binary '\0','/5nZmxvTsQV3sZnai0ocN10PKHAT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056370',7.1,2422,'en','Pressure Point','An African-American prison psychiatrist finds the boundaries of his professionalism sorely tested when he must counsel a disturbed inmate with bigoted Nazi tendencies.','/lSLMHSgvRK8ZOpD7anpOGRDSeJl.jpg','1962-10-10',89,'Released','The boiling point of two men who mutinied against the world and each other!','Pressure Point',33735,1.8863,6.6,'E0p5VfSL-jc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4318,_binary '\0','/br2P3BpVJHbtGWRiWiaPNSbTjlB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056371',6.8,3467,'it','Prima della rivoluzione','As Fabrizio contemplates joining the Communist Party, he breaks off his planned marriage to a bourgeois woman and becomes incestuously involved with his alluring aunt.','/eonuTTUGbxVurkBgC1KLJ00QIvR.jpg','1964-05-13',111,'Released','Italy is the place where they\'ve made an art of everything - especially love!','Before the Revolution',42788,1.2386,7.045,'Zh2KM4Y4bA8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4319,_binary '\0','/lugVUlwpvVP7wnuvZCMoZBgUW2i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056389',7.6,1245,'it','Le quattro giornate di Napoli','September 1943. After Italy surrenders to the Allies, people in Naples believe the war is finally over, but soon they realize Germans are still in control — and as ruthless as ever. Armed with makeshift weapons, civilians rise up en masse against the invaders — and overwhelming odds.','/kTaSb8eTHl0rIHuLrH6G45DGPXL.jpg','1962-11-16',120,'Released','Stunning! Brilliant! Stirring! Scorching! Epic!','The Four Days of Naples',65048,1.9801,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4320,_binary '\0','/a5h1Q4u2CKIVXWdUFsMQrfbN0f1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056405',3.7,4845,'da','Reptilicus','A portion of the tail of a prehistoric reptile is discovered in Denmark. It regenerates into the entire reptile, which proceeds to destroy buildings and property and generally make a nuisance of itself. It can fly, swim, and walk, and has impenetrable scales, which makes it difficult to kill.','/aROeaJgaEoq72gksPLqpQqbKZ2F.jpg','1961-02-20',81,'Released','Invincible...Indestructible! What was this awesome BEAST born 50 million years out of time?','Reptilicus',21266,1.6814,3.6,'dUJW7BubKL4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4321,_binary '\0','/oSg662qyuvqjgNASD1jLRrcI8Ao.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056406',7.8,5319,'en','Requiem for a Heavyweight','After suffering a brutal defeat and being told he can no longer fight, 37-year-old, scar-ridden prizefighter Louis \'Mountain\' Rivera struggles to find a new direction in life.','/qUKTcUhIeFZO0ZGvjja5bx1rsMu.jpg','1962-10-16',95,'Released','The world of Mountain Riviera... the fast buck... the angry men... the lonely woman!','Requiem for a Heavyweight',53229,2.8505,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4322,_binary '\0','/sZU9mr6J1CUIU505LThSKNy21og.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056412',7.4,16496,'en','Ride the High Country','An ex-lawman is hired to transport gold from a mining community through dangerous territory. But what he doesn\'t realize is that his partner and old friend is plotting to double-cross him.','/oBdJliz2o88ZLPulL5KLdbRsQuf.jpg','1962-05-09',94,'Released','Showdown in the High Sierra!','Ride the High Country',36206,4.3779,7.1,'O8a70CB8mzU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4323,_binary '\0','/sCoKZZmtRSCzlcKXFhpQAO4WHE0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056415',1.9,1517,'en','Ring of Terror','A group of medical students undertake some silly and frightening endeavors in order to pledge a fraternity.','/hVuVppiIntAR5Sf01nWCBinnWHL.jpg','1961-06-11',71,'Released',NULL,'Ring of Terror',113739,1.1402,1.9,'l67VJX412xg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4324,_binary '\0','/vqzwKmCmPnKU0kFJpxrOpvTx1Bg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056417',6.1,2958,'en','The Road to Hong Kong','When Chester accidentally memorises and destroys the only copy of a secret Russian formula for a new and improved rocket fuel, he and Harry are thrust into international intrigue, trying to stay alive while keeping the formula out of enemy hands.','/6HWu1UwUbXls12RgyLh4EvrHT6u.jpg','1962-03-29',91,'Released','The last of the red hot Lamas!','The Road to Hong Kong',31804,2.538,5.824,'foL8WflpTCw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4325,_binary '\0','/qUkhyZb1Sr4R3pz72fEXyRx1JBy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056424',6.4,1665,'en','Rome Adventure','Prudence resigns from her teaching position after being criticized for giving a student her copy of a romance novel. She sails for Italy, takes a job at a small bookstore in Rome, and meets Don, who has just broken up with his girlfriend. Prudence and Don tour Italy together, and romance naturally follows.','/7HUzY2mVusFWOmSm8ZKb93BHVtT.jpg','1962-04-21',119,'Released','THIS was her European plan for learning about love...','Rome Adventure',94915,2.1087,5.8,'yAJQJhgD0xo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4326,_binary '\0','/jPYrzVKqiIfMhwhDPUBXH5TDHvf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056436',8.1,2039,'hi','साहिब बीबी और ग़ुलाम','A debauchee Zamindar greatly neglects his wife. The decadence of the Bengali Zamindar milieu in the late 19th century, seen through the eyes of a young upward mobile rustic seeking fortune in Calcutta, fascinated by the lonely lady of the house.','/tUVjkGSe7ZRhFoWirqZOh00kNlz.jpg','1962-07-29',152,'Released',NULL,'Sahib Bibi Aur Ghulam',70366,0.8744,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4327,_binary '\0','/7g5v2zXedkwiFqDlWqcoRUUQYD6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056443',8,43781,'ja','椿三十郎','In this companion piece and sequel to \"Yojimbo,\" jaded samurai Sanjuro helps an idealistic group of young warriors weed out their clan\'s evil influences, and in the process turns their image of a proper samurai on its ear.','/zW47oIH3bc3ggmmmzTvKqM4Fqjk.jpg','1962-01-01',96,'Released','You cut well, but the best sword stays in its sheath!','Sanjuro',11712,4.2404,7.9,'Nkrc_FLZWEs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4328,_binary '\0','/hl3ZJljnYIfjhDRgahVXsUKyVnH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056444',8,12217,'ja','秋刀魚の味','Widower Shuhei Hirayama\'s caretaker is his 24-year-old daughter, Michiko. Gradually, he comes to realize that Michiko should not be obliged to look after him for the rest of his life, so he arranges a marriage for her.','/4RtWkqywkzxonlnGBwv4RpSw4Rb.jpg','1962-11-18',113,'Released',NULL,'An Autumn Afternoon',50759,3.0809,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4329,_binary '\0','/rNqagxqo0c4FF4no7mlArTKlf24.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056452',6.8,4096,'de','Der Schatz im Silbersee','Fred Engel\'s father is murdered by Colonel Brinkley in order to acquire a treasure map, however the Colonel only acquires half of it, the other half as held by Mrs. Butler. Discovering the scene of the crime, Old Shatterhand and Winnetou help Fred bring his father\'s murderer to justice and locate the treasure of Silver Lake.','/2cVvcf9l2k4wOU7D8w6ouQlTaAe.jpg','1962-12-12',111,'Released',NULL,'Treasure of Silver Lake',5636,4.1351,7.1,'2ABAq6xugQs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4330,_binary '\0','/xIL91bRr6cvg6Y9W9vIhBzNNHXQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056470',5.9,1462,'en','Sergeants 3','Mike, Chip, and Larry are three lusty, brawling U. S. Cavalry sergeants stationed in Indian Territory in 1870.','/nA0AdRXFIwXp6vopoqqncdErext.jpg','1962-02-10',112,'Released','They\'re the Wildest Characters in All the West!','Sergeants 3',18512,1.8007,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4331,_binary '\0','/AgiNLhBJxqCOvu9f5Nt7OnlPQ35.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056480',5.4,1566,'de','Sherlock Holmes und das Halsband des Todes','Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson embark on a search for Cleopatra\'s ancient necklace, which has been stolen.','/k3wlok2LnWaDAImfJmRja9sGysE.jpg','1962-11-30',83,'Released',NULL,'Sherlock Holmes and the Deadly Necklace',43010,2.3725,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4332,_binary '\0','/3KEEO1DkKi0aMW6wjAaey216Gjp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056499',3,1888,'en','The Slime People','After Los Angeles is invaded by an army of subterranean monsters, a small group of people must fight for survival in the deserted metropolis.','/dQxxekz2IygIn9x7ODxdc9DiZ20.jpg','1963-03-29',76,'Released','Up from the bowels of the earth come...','The Slime People',63087,1.3029,3.5,'ad8ajnQDbVw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4333,_binary '\0','/80y9prUznPxijs5bb7h39DbHWRc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056504',5.7,2491,'en','Sodom and Gomorrah','Lot leads his people to a fertile valley adjacent to the cities of Sodom and Gomorrah, hotbeds of vice and corruption ruled by the merciless Queen Bera. When Lot orders a dam to be busted in order to prevent the destruction of the cities by the attacking Helamites, the queen, in gratitude, allows Lot\'s people to settle in Sodom. Soon, however, the veneer of civilization begins crumbling as Lot and the Hebrews become corrupted by the Sodomites.','/hbb0WRKvLA7SCrUxG4ZS0PQA27S.jpg','1962-10-04',148,'Released','The cities that mocked the very name of God... The vengeance that tore the Earth asunder!','Sodom and Gomorrah',43011,3.4677,5.3,'_dgOSmlHqAA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4334,_binary '\0','/uUrV5KSjnZx47Dq7e6STr73iN4N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056512',8.2,14766,'it','Il sorpasso','Roberto, a shy law student in Rome, meets Bruno, a forty-year-old exuberant, capricious man, who takes him for a drive through the Roman and Tuscany countries in the summer. When their journey starts to blend into their daily lives though, the pair’s newfound friendship is tested.','/4h1ckrJQVcQYjeOkqS8i9BqZ9MI.jpg','1962-12-05',105,'Released',NULL,'Il Sorpasso',24188,3.1803,8.2,'bFf2VID8-qg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4335,_binary '\0','/sI9m1OevDTh3PJr7666Ty2GTVnG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056514',7.2,1274,'fr','Le soupirant','Absent-minded yet cultured, Pierre answers his parents demands to wed by ignoring both astronomy and the housemaid, instead falling head-over-heels for rich damsels.','/ld8Ig3n6CR5hH8g62nQuWl8E68w.jpg','1962-11-12',84,'Released',NULL,'The Suitor',67556,2.2281,6.518,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4336,_binary '\0','/8mZ4LJ3VyLTav0Pe2Zo8EcmGYhj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056526',5.9,1491,'en','State Fair','Texan farmers the Frake family head for the Texas State Fair in Dallas. The parents are focused on winning the competitions for livestock and cooking. However, their restless daughter Margy and her brother Wayne meet attractive new love interests.','/zGx9PpbzRa4J4TlJOiV38mJXl1T.jpg','1962-03-09',120,'Released',NULL,'State Fair',28187,1.895,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4337,_binary '\0','/2ZWfSMeOxDQGji53pTOukgqmf2S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056537',7.4,1488,'bn','সুবর্ণরেখা','After an old college friend offers him a job at an iron foundry, the upright and honest Ishwar leaves a shanty town on the outskirts of Calcutta where he lives with a group of refugees from East Bengal. With plans to forge a solid living for himself, sister Sita and Abhiram, an orphaned boy he offers a home to, Ishwar is accused of selling out and deserting his people.','/3le6UjPH0E8ZNgdBwPysDSag5jE.jpg','1965-10-01',123,'Released',NULL,'The Golden Thread',86303,1.2911,6.488,'tYRX96yT7ig','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4338,_binary '\0','/i5fqy8pN3Z1jF0rpsJGfPVARcnJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056541',7.1,9383,'en','Sweet Bird of Youth','Gigolo and drifter Chance Wayne returns to his hometown as the companion of a faded movie star, Alexandra Del Lago, whom he hopes to use to help him break into the movies. Chance runs into trouble when he finds his ex-girlfriend, the daughter of the local politician Tom \"Boss\" Finley, who more or less forced him to leave his daughter and the town many years ago.','/uA9tl4o8P1hNB3lDBhHKHcNGdtr.jpg','1962-03-21',120,'Released','He used love like most men use money.','Sweet Bird of Youth',33632,3.1319,6.727,'nybbP_21wes','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4339,_binary '\0','/lcnDx86U3Slwzo5gEYuskIIvwsF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056552',6.8,9522,'en','Tales of Terror','Three stories adapted from the work of Edgar Allen Poe: 1) A man and his daughter are reunited, but the blame for the death of his wife hangs over them, unresolved. 2) A derelict challenges the local wine-tasting champion to a competition, but finds the man\'s attention to his wife worthy of more dramatic action. 3) A man dying and in great pain agrees to be hypnotized at the moment of death, with unexpected consequences.','/itHjXJLzxeUsPsruQV3r79egxaO.jpg','1962-07-04',89,'Released','A Trilogy of Shock and Horror!','Tales of Terror',29074,2.629,6.7,'Y58nHVXTO1c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4340,_binary '\0','/uRnYzCJELrXfuSggDKYWDho3gOc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056556',6.3,5060,'en','Taras Bulba','Ukraine, 16th century. While the Poles dominate the Cossack steppes, Andrei, son of Taras Bulba, a Cossack leader, must choose between his love for his family and his folk and his passion for a Polish woman.','/8bnn12yMugSBIKlrhSuCOVJKrgH.jpg','1962-11-21',119,'Released','A love story of flesh and fire!','Taras Bulba',43012,2.9252,6.3,'CGIJM4aO0hw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4341,_binary '\0','/aJaWmyx0sIfVLaLneDdCWqwUiFU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056575',6.6,11843,'en','That Touch of Mink','Cathy Timberlake is en route to a job interview when a car transporting businessman Philip Shayne covers her in mud. He sends his assistant, Roger, to apologize, but upon meeting Cathy, Roger knows that she would be a suitable match for his boss. Despite their mutual attraction, Cathy and Philip want different things. Philip wants a fling, while Cathy wants a marriage. As they travel to exotic locales, their differing motivations are put to the test.','/eEG29x9cljGKL2GPmRK9IByyL9e.jpg','1962-06-14',99,'Released','Insistence! Resistance! Persistence! Co-Existence! It\'s the year\'s most uproarious, romantic free-for-all...!','That Touch of Mink',12708,3.7947,6.5,'SNxeoMGISGY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4342,_binary '\0','/ptpNVQkxSB28iOvIvQuCBYLSs8q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056576',6.6,4632,'en','The Damned','An American tourist and a troubled young woman are chased by her gang leader brother to a top secret British government facility that conducts experiments on children.','/ngQlrgkqQe67nL6GvvsjY0kdG4O.jpg','1962-11-16',96,'Released','Children of Ice And Darkness! They Are the Lurking Unseen Evil You Dare Not Face Alone!','The Damned',71701,2.0653,6.292,'u9zyO2B0K9I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4343,_binary '\0','/61OfCC6yzkApBVqsnl44OthbkAQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056579',6.1,1316,'en','The Three Stooges Meet Hercules','The Three Stooges manage to crash through the time barrier with their slap-happy antics in this classic feature-length comedy. Larry, Moe, and Curly-Joe are friends of a young scientist, Schuyler Davis, who has created a time machine. Together with Schuyler\'s girlfriend, Diane, they are all transported back to ancient Ithaca which is ruled by the tyrannical King Odius. The lecherous king promptly takes a liking to Diane and banishes Schuyler and The Stooges to the galleys. When they manage to escape, they begin promoting Schuyler as \"Hercules\" at local gladiatorial combats - until the real Hercules shows up. But, with their unique \"charm,\" The Stooges convince Hercules to help them rescue Diane. Written by Robert Lynch','/p1Jc9rO4kUhKiICSgIQRstdLiZC.jpg','1962-02-15',89,'Released','See Hercules - Man of Steel meet the maniacs of mayhem!','The Three Stooges Meet Hercules',41279,1.7153,6.5,'Spk24OhxG3g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4344,_binary '\0','/bs6EteeAqmEEwh1WIyRaovoPfaP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056585',5.8,2315,'en','Tickle Me','A singing rodeo rider takes a job at an all-female dude ranch, where he gets involved with a physical trainer and a treasure hunt for gold in a ghost town, leading to a showdown with kidnappers.','/zj4wfziY4bUjGNvu8s08juSXtmD.jpg','1965-06-30',90,'Released','Elvis as singing, swinging wrangler on a Dude Ranch... for Girls!','Tickle Me',18645,2.7777,5.957,'Yqvz0tvh5aI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4345,_binary '\0','/wYRpVySPCC7wA28p54yAaoMT478.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056592',8.2,353289,'en','To Kill a Mockingbird','Scout Finch, 6, and her older brother Jem live in sleepy Maycomb, Alabama, spending much of their time with their friend Dill and spying on their reclusive and mysterious neighbor, Boo Radley. When Atticus, their widowed father and a respected lawyer, defends a black man named Tom Robinson against fabricated rape charges, the trial and tangent events expose the children to evils of racism and stereotyping.','/pKUaZNOb2FDdzSz7kWyAuBMhA8I.jpg','1962-12-20',129,'Released','A father must expose his children to a small town\'s outraged passions… and can only protect them with his love.','To Kill a Mockingbird',595,11.7016,7.979,'4-CrrtYjrbM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4346,_binary '\0','/9f7UO3XXO5mXZbTGkOSRTUnVy5p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056606',6.3,3152,'en','Tower of London','The twisted Richard III is haunted by the ghosts of those he has murdered in his attempt to become the King of England.','/pcEHgUyuMe20JlyoYM7eNHWcwIu.jpg','1962-10-24',80,'Released','Do you have the courage to spend 83 minutes in the Tower of London?','Tower of London',43014,1.946,5.941,'n7HWvtOeW-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4347,_binary '\0','/36MqTrqojeNhKPDiyYP2Lvpfhwn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056625',6.4,3334,'en','Two Weeks in Another Town','After spending three years in an asylum, a washed-up actor views a minor assignment from his old director in Rome as a chance for personal and professional redemption.','/vjVuuUXNrGgekTmW5ZqL1ujG7b4.jpg','1962-08-17',107,'Released','...only in Rome could this story happen...','Two Weeks in Another Town',62655,2.375,5.9,'nkDNPYxMDCI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4348,_binary '\0','/mwGU1Efc8lz28UCzDlpUEREOIMh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056626',6.6,2449,'en','Two for the Seesaw','After leaving his wife, lawyer Jerry Ryan moves from Omaha, Nebraska to New York City to start a new life. While studying for the New York Bar Examination and working to finalize his divorce, Ryan meets dancer Gittel Mosca, and the two begin a cautious courtship. However, Ryan feels that he must come to terms with his failed marriage and overcome his lingering attachment to his ex-wife before he can redefine himself and embrace his budding romance.','/j1idt5I3aarVVO2zb5SdwJtg2h.jpg','1962-11-21',119,'Released','A square from Nebraska? An off-beatnik from Greenwich Village? It just didn\'t figure ... that they would ... that they could ... that they did!','Two for the Seesaw',76344,2.4824,6.51,'V-goswTzeck','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4349,_binary '\0','/rqF2lDTbCYyvjoHk1evAxEQkFbB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056628',7.2,1418,'fi','Tähdet kertovat, komisario Palmu','A man\'s body is found on Tähtitorninmäki in Helsinki. Palmu starts to investigate the case, but the scandalous newspaper story causes problems for the police.','/adMU4TzWWBlElOSwsBTPUlWUtC7.jpg','1962-09-07',100,'Released',NULL,'Tähdet kertovat, komisario Palmu',144728,1.0149,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4350,_binary '\0','/lWkd9Nqz9zxMaJXSiY9E2veHmYk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056632',6.6,2778,'en','The Ugly American','An intelligent, articulate scholar, Harrison MacWhite, survives a hostile Senate confirmation hearing at the hands of conservatives to become ambassador to Sarkan, a southeast Asian country where civil war threatens a tense peace. Despite his knowledge, once he\'s there, MacWhite sees only a dichotomy between the U.S. and Communism. He can\'t accept that anti-American sentiment might be a longing for self-determination and nationalism. So, he breaks from his friend Deong, a local opposition leader, ignores a foreman\'s advice about slowing the building of a road, and tries to muscle ahead. What price must the country and his friends pay for him to get some sense?','/o8IjdO8uwi0b4e1uVryZd6a8m6P.jpg','1963-04-02',115,'Released','The most explosive adventure of our time!','The Ugly American',53650,2.378,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4351,_binary '\0','/4KnKQPGJ95Ti2pEJbkVLXPtooOm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056636',7.4,3864,'fr','Un singe en hiver','During World War II, an innkeeper vows to abstain from alcohol for the sake of his family. Years later, as they thrive in Normandy, his resolve is tested by a charming advertising professional who loves to drink.','/mxp6FnCsblmjAkSrjWg4ATx72cC.jpg','1962-07-29',105,'Released','The Story of Two Very Uncommon Men...With One Purpose in Common!','A Monkey in Winter',33998,3.0377,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4352,_binary '\0','/68NGFE8zD2gaQVH6MqJeKzojFJM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056663',7.8,38038,'fr','Vivre sa vie: film en douze tableaux','Twelve episodic tales in the life of a Parisian woman and her slow descent into prostitution.','/A0BjScjASfMFgyGI5sU0CwfKh3l.jpg','1962-09-20',84,'Released','The many faces of a woman trying to find herself.','Vivre Sa Vie',1626,4.7284,7.697,'ZAZGR5O33jw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4353,_binary '\0','/rcpuzkriHOFjay7ZWYtltmpHwHd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056671',6.7,3471,'en','Walk on the Wild Side','At a 1930s New Orleans bordello, Hallie is the main attraction for both clients and the shrewd madam. The arrival of Dove Linkhorn, her lovesick sweetheart from three years ago, disrupts the normal and triggers a chain of events involving a number of people, including the young woman he travelled with, who is now the Doll House\'s newest employee.','/t1fPzQlKpk06an9Akme1LJX2MjU.jpg','1962-02-21',114,'Released','A side of life you never expected to see on the screen!','Walk on the Wild Side',60792,2.7772,6.6,'mF0uQc6IRic','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4354,_binary '\0','/oDkBxSBH3zPvcVjkFb1Nn3Xx3EL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056675',6.3,1428,'en','War Hunt','Dispatched to the front lines during the Korean War, an idealistic American soldier discovers the horrors of combat and comes at odds with a psychopathic member of his platoon.','/31b3W1v8MOeOpYuk3dBSXFNpiHG.jpg','1962-05-01',83,'Released','It happened on a raging battlefield, but he could have been a murderer stalking a city\'s streets!','War Hunt',32071,1.8994,6.4,'62T_CWQp-qY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4355,_binary '\0','/u1XOyGjEnLSFmRDR35LXs2Fkpqn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056676',6.6,2539,'en','The War Lover','Buzz Rickson is a dare-devil World War II bomber pilot with a death wish. Failing at everything not involving flying, Rickson lives for the most dangerous missions. His crew lives with this aspect of his personality only because they know he always brings them back alive.','/4YHNVfhiUuZ3bJ5J0OsOM60ppzB.jpg','1962-10-25',105,'Released','The men of the flying forts whose bravery became a legend','The War Lover',55305,2.2929,6,'srBUAam4tl0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4356,_binary '\0','/gkXL5ka6ciU4A4KYSvLIAXtvh7k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056687',8,68376,'en','What Ever Happened to Baby Jane?','A former vaudeville child star viciously torments her paraplegic sister in their decaying Hollywood mansion.','/msGYzyWwtjAaA3DScdgmvJ5MReG.jpg','1962-10-31',135,'Released','Sister, sister, oh so fair, why is there blood all over your hair?','What Ever Happened to Baby Jane?',10242,6.0323,7.9,'3qFYjkFCxiE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4357,_binary '\0','/gUmxshmfbFC7zFBt9kwdkSdQCNy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056700',6.4,2495,'en','The Wonderful World of the Brothers Grimm','The Grimm brothers Wilhelm and Jacob, known for their literary works in the nineteenth century, have their lives dramatized. Wilhelm fights to write something entertaining amongst the sea of dry, non-fiction books they write and he sets about collecting oral-tradition fairy tales to put into print. Their life story is countered with reenactments of three of their stories including \"The Dancing Princess,\" \"The Cobbler and the Elves\" and \"The Singing Bone.\"','/zElwCWdMG7A6xThgesRxNrgD2MP.jpg','1962-08-07',140,'Released','WONDERFUL THRILLS! ADVENTURE! ROMANCE!','The Wonderful World of the Brothers Grimm',28367,4.0501,5.9,'hiASEIz3qrg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4358,_binary '\0','/eYd5tvjdivkHnAldxDLSoENhqWM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056704',6.7,2706,'en','The Wrong Arm of the Law','The crooks in London know how it works. No one carries guns and no one resists the police. Then a new gang appears that go one better. They dress as police and steal from the crooks. This upsets the natural order of the police/criminal relationship and the police and the crooks join forces to catch the IPOs (Impersonating Police Officers), including an armoured car robbery in which the police must help the gangs to set a trap.','/8OjnowuacvM0n7sItBw3xNflPfS.jpg','1963-03-17',94,'Released','Meet the Mastermind Who Pulls the Strings in the Underworld...and all his mobs and dolls...filling the London fog with laughter and lunacy!!!','The Wrong Arm of the Law',42989,2.3731,6.7,'KGR8qmV8FcQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4359,_binary '\0','/xT4EOR9S06sqomLfcAEIW93hMdc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056714',7.6,6571,'ja','座頭市物語','The adventures of a blind, gambling masseur and master swordsman. Zatoichi targets a yakuza-controlled village, because war with a neighbouring town\'s smaller gang is brewing.','/ohFJMGouR4rwH32QOM9zk4TC000.jpg','1962-04-18',96,'Released',NULL,'The Tale of Zatoichi',16692,2.4225,7.3,'-sXA1ZnmIoU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4360,_binary '\0','/wJ4HyVZsbZRWH7BS3bLZsvO31rZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056732',7.9,38550,'es','El ángel exterminador','After a lavish dinner party, the guests find themselves unable to depart... and, over the next few days, all of their elaborate societal pretenses and façades deteriorate as they are reduced to living like animals.','/qqZXHvBFxUpo8Pfbyvgh4SYMiWm.jpg','1962-05-16',93,'Released','The degeneration of high society!','The Exterminating Angel',29264,4.5315,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4361,_binary '\0','/n6hmnEqU9W4jcVxCU00S4XJ5ecw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056736',7.6,24786,'it','L\'eclisse','Vittoria is a beautiful literary translator living in Rome. After splitting from her writer boyfriend, Riccardo, Vittoria meets Piero, a lively stockbroker, on the hectic floor of the Roman stock exchange. Though Vittoria and Piero begin a relationship, it is not one without difficulties, and their commitment to one another is tested during an eclipse.','/oXoe0Fp92Yw3mMJ9Vq0hPlaMELg.jpg','1962-04-13',126,'Released','The ache and ecstasy of love…','L\'Eclisse',21135,4.9933,7.6,'SHUapLYEi4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4362,_binary '\0','/vqO2z6pr7R6dIsGbqmtTvaSi4qS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056800',6.7,8324,'en','55 Days at Peking','Diplomats, soldiers and other representatives of a dozen nations fend off the siege of the International Compound in Peking during the 1900 Boxer Rebellion. The disparate interests unite for survival despite competing factions, overwhelming odds, delayed relief and tacit support of the Boxers by the Empress of China and her generals.','/uR0xaqmqlbhatf9014mHuwV1Uly.jpg','1963-05-06',154,'Released','A handful of men and women held out against the frenzied hordes of bloodthirsty fanatics!','55 Days at Peking',27759,4.7801,6.886,'oNGXU1uXDw0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4363,_binary '\0','/y2FNZLHynsevBnVTocGW6c3pQpr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056801',8,133784,'it','8½','Guido Anselmi, a film director, finds himself creatively barren at the peak of his career. Urged by his doctors to rest, Anselmi heads for a luxurious resort, but a sorry group gathers—his producer, staff, actors, wife, mistress, and relatives—each one begging him to get on with the show. In retreat from their dependency, he fantasizes about past women and dreams of his childhood.','/23VIf7zNxAgaXwIlvzd3IvOd9sY.jpg','1963-02-14',139,'Released','A picture that goes beyond what men think about - because no man ever thought about it in quite this way!','8½',422,7.0142,8.1,'4CjMvGBY_lI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4364,_binary '\0','/uJRAP6T9EoGMeFSDFfj9T7hLiPo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056825',7.7,6492,'en','America America','A young Anatolian Greek, entrusted with his family\'s fortune, loses it en route to Istanbul and dreams of going to America.','/76RffKrNPrfA4TWYkx5wIIOzOlV.jpg','1963-12-15',174,'Released','One man\'s struggle to the golden shore','America America',47249,2.1771,7,'84SUVEOAyeg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4365,_binary '\0','/bFFw0zYBNA7HmMTVZUNEcjyF668.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056844',7.2,2459,'cs','Až přijde kocour','While old Oliva tells a group of children about his life as a sailor and how he met Diana and her cat with sunglasses, a strange circus arrives in town.','/o7i3VkgltQYKY63j822W7L2Bryk.jpg','1963-09-20',104,'Released',NULL,'When the Cat Comes',47852,1.7867,6.987,'6NSoSFWf_U4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4366,_binary '\0','/kjkYG0UUM6XwBsA987sOtuoZqp7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056845',6.5,2026,'fr','L\'Aîné des Ferchaux','Young boxer Michel Maudet is sacked by his manager after a series of match defeats and is forced to look for a new job. He is engaged as secretary to a millionaire named Ferchaux who is in a hurry to flee the country when he discovers he has been implicated in a high-profile fraud.','/1wjAEZWBcdjrwePqJ34RLPpAq8.jpg','1963-09-25',102,'Released',NULL,'Magnet of Doom',69729,1.6442,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4367,_binary '\0','/ye2znT1pX45ECnSIj5lrVkM8Z1j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056846',7.2,4978,'fr','La Baie des Anges','A bank clerk is drawn into the risky world of a gorgeous gambling addict.','/7gMfVJur6DgujNyt1297GIGYMwJ.jpg','1963-03-01',84,'Released','Love is just a game of chance','Bay of Angels',60773,3.2362,6.678,'qZJp381jgLs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4368,_binary '\0','/6cry2pSWo4dpT5JKgje2HBU4vFw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056860',5.8,2619,'en','Beach Party','Anthropology Professor Robert Orwell Sutwell and his secretary Marianne are studying the sex habits of teenagers. The surfing teens led by Frankie and Dee Dee don\'t have much sex but they sing, battle the motorcycle rats and mice led by Eric Von Zipper and dance to Dick Dale and the Del Tones.','/3Wmf7VKBIlwUSpakKDMi9LIGnP.jpg','1963-08-07',101,'Released','Surfs up and the Beach is really swinging!','Beach Party',26484,2.1023,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4369,_binary '\0','/7GnuKyGYNgIxTd9jC5SZZFSIbSP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056868',7.2,7778,'en','Billy Liar','A young Englishman dreams of escaping from his working class family and dead-end job as an undertaker\'s assistant. A number of indiscretions cause him to lie in order to avoid the penalties. His life turns into a mess and he has an opportunity to run away and leave it all behind.','/gphAIMqyO6Jqg8m7aINCguHVwmq.jpg','1963-08-15',98,'Released','one guy ... three girls ... one ring!','Billy Liar',26535,2.1042,6.844,'5cg2yvjneLw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4370,_binary '\0','/98qofsLB8HwPsmlq0HczQTt8BcS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056869',7.6,222184,'en','The Birds','Thousands of birds flock into a seaside town and terrorize the residents in a series of deadly attacks.','/eClg8QPg8mwB6INIC4pyR5pAbDr.jpg','1963-03-28',119,'Released','...and remember, the next scream you hear may be your own!','The Birds',571,8.6002,7.51,'lCxR7dlavwg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4371,_binary '\0','/c4Yi0IUIG3sd2gef8HHUzjddWGQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056875',5,7996,'en','Blood Feast','In the sleepy suburbs of Miami, seemingly normal Egyptian immigrant Fuad Ramses runs a successful catering business. He also murders young women and plans to use their body parts to revive the goddess Ishtar. The insane Ramses hypnotizes a socialite in order to land a job catering a party for her debutante daughter, Suzette Fremont, and turns the event into an evening of gruesome deaths, bloody dismemberment and ritual sacrifice.','/u6mWxgOrNAF3AaevaGEE4NqCwcQ.jpg','1963-07-06',67,'Released','You\'ll Recoil and Shudder as You Witness the Slaughter and Mutilation of Nubile Young Girls - in a Weird and Horrendous Ancient Rite!','Blood Feast',28172,1.6061,4.8,'-4Inzx9WPSc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4372,_binary '\0','/jhMk9aLhN0wLLFuzc5MfKxwzBP6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056883',7.1,1563,'it','Il boom','Sweet-sour comedy on Italy\'s 1950s rage to get rich as fast as possible! The businessman wants to satisfy his wife\'s craving for luxury and a \"respectable life\" so he becomes heavily indebted. In desperation he agrees to sell a precious part of his body for a large sum of money. But just before the crucial operation he panics...','/osvbQlIPhIEAVT7kHy1govIZEH3.jpg','1963-09-24',89,'Released',NULL,'The Boom',81831,1.9253,6.873,'PIyT-w7d7Ik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4373,_binary '\0','/8Tt1KVGDMc7l6CgWSENruPdt6Pl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056891',6.6,10583,'en','Bye Bye Birdie','A singer goes to a small town for a performance before he is drafted.','/u3m2kU5aFj6V6cNYOd9a22Iia7O.jpg','1963-04-04',112,'Released','The Most WONDERFUL Entertainment EVER! EVER!','Bye Bye Birdie',25167,3.7427,5.9,'Z8S00U2-L74','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4374,_binary '\0','/n5S88bLnmMdcqHFH8Da7fzxgm7r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056903',6.9,3325,'en','Captain Newman, M.D.','In 1944, Capt. Josiah J. Newman is the doctor in charge of Ward 7, the neuropsychiatric ward, at an Army Air Corps hospital in Arizona. The hospital is under-resourced and Newman scrounges what he needs with the help of his inventive staff, especially Cpl. Jake Leibowitz. The military in general is only just coming to accept psychiatric disorders as legitimate and Newman generally has 6 weeks to cure them or send them on to another facility. There are many patients in the ward and his latest include Colonel Norville Bliss who has dissociated from his past; Capt. Paul Winston who is nearly catatonic after spending 13 months hiding in a cellar behind enemy lines; and 20 year-old Cpl. Jim Tompkins who is severely traumatized after his aircraft was shot down. Others come and go, including Italian prisoners of war, but Newman and team all realize that their success means the men will return to their units.','/ovXBWbk3YjOZB5cmiTvdNaDYGKu.jpg','1963-12-25',126,'Released','It speaks to you in the language of love, laughter and tears!...','Captain Newman, M.D.',33728,3.2026,6.7,'-KnXdeKyzIE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4375,_binary '\0','/aIOSM79COU9YAEs0Yqsudvx5X3V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056905',6.7,3990,'fr','Les Carabiniers','During a war in an imaginary country, unscrupulous soldiers recruit poor farmers with promises of an easy and happy life. Two of these farmers write to their wives of their exploits.','/oBL7ragSWtX8rHswM25BkdzQzWZ.jpg','1963-05-31',80,'Released',NULL,'The Carabineers',52705,1.8074,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4376,_binary '\0','/pQ2I2MxlZYc43jAVsEVWMhg7FTd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056907',6.8,3305,'en','The Cardinal','A young Catholic priest from Boston confronts bigotry, Nazism, and his own personal conflicts as he rises to the office of cardinal.','/y23FoRE97IH9bHFo2OBP5IkKnLq.jpg','1963-12-12',185,'Released','A motion picture that spans two decades of conflict and drama as it tells the story of a young American and his rise to prince of the church.','The Cardinal',3010,3.124,6.491,'Bz7CLziCEUk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4377,_binary '\0','/1AUOomyYHEaMrXZvSlaVNZhFw8a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056910',6.8,4668,'fr','La Carrière de Suzanne','Timid pharmacy student Bertrand has mixed feelings about his womanising friend Guillaume\'s new girlfriend, Suzanne, who financially supports her duplicitous lover.','/5XNoOO5gmtSzFzPvPjy4OTY8sfe.jpg','1963-02-27',54,'Released',NULL,'Suzanne\'s Career',86764,1.7481,6.469,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4378,_binary '\0','/pgRJRsz3NjBAcnlMZbyYkUP3s7R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056912',6.4,3407,'en','Carry On Cabby','Speedee Taxis is a great success, which means its workaholic owner Charlie starts neglecting Peggy, his wife. Suddenly a fleet of rival taxis appears from nowhere and start pinching all the fares. The rivals are Glamcabs, and they have a secret weapon. All their drivers are very attractive women! Who\'s behind Glamcabs? It\'s open warfare and only one fleet can survive!','/3S9fkzkl3kqgnlZUvBF1SqYKVm0.jpg','1963-06-01',91,'Released','They\'re here again in Carry on Taxi','Carry On Cabby',19254,1.5675,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4379,_binary '\0','/8PwJrI7a67QqWQYZ11oDc6Nqqtb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056917',7,3136,'fr','Cent Mille Dollars au soleil','A truck driver ventures into the Moroccan desert to retrieve a stolen truck, facing danger, bad luck, and uneasy alliances. Chaos builds to a climactic showdown.','/s3C7Xm9RCW5grV5zJNSEtAky0Ar.jpg','1964-04-17',122,'Released',NULL,'Greed in the Sun',34059,2.1321,7.114,'prWOvLDLb2E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4380,_binary '\0','/jWUjXdQF7b3L6kRGfoCZLjSBbDg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056919',7,3420,'cs','Černý Petr','A few days in the life of a Czechoslovak teenager when he starts work.','/103gre18aXhXeh0121STX05adkJ.jpg','1964-04-17',89,'Released',NULL,'Black Peter',46982,1.7501,6.618,'e8Vz_VDUm9A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4381,_binary '\0','/gj2TBYmOIy4E2GjMIpnbAEZNCQx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056923',7.8,94738,'en','Charade','After Regina Lampert falls for the dashing Peter Joshua on a skiing holiday in the French Alps, she discovers upon her return to Paris that her husband has been murdered. Soon, she and Peter are giving chase to three of her late husband\'s World War II cronies, Tex, Scobie and Gideon, who are after a quarter of a million dollars the quartet stole while behind enemy lines.','/qqaPjC5FQidtKY65jbAKZPiOTaS.jpg','1963-12-01',113,'Released','Is anyone really who they seem to be?','Charade',4808,7.5732,7.7,'OpuGXAlvDZs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4382,_binary '\0','/uw4Lb9F5OaMqzuiHGhhy6PA53r4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056930',7.2,3966,'en','A Child Is Waiting','Dr. Matthew Clark is the head of a state institution for intellectually disabled children. Jean Hansen, a former music teacher anxious to give her life some meaning, joins the staff of the hospital. Jean, who tries to shelter the children with her love, suspiciously regards Dr. Clark\'s stern training methods. She becomes emotionally involved with 12-year-old Reuben Widdicombe, who has been abandoned by his divorced parents.','/A4T7rPZRgvE96ZT9qJuyNnGm0No.jpg','1963-02-13',102,'Released','Burt Lancaster & Judy Garland take an untouched theme - and make it touching and unforgettable!','A Child Is Waiting',88912,3.2962,6.841,'NwBPOiA7X84','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4383,_binary '\0','/qMPqHKxcZriTiLzt7OlEQYq7o0c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056931',6.2,5563,'en','Children of the Damned','Six children are found spread through out the world that not only have enormous intelligence, but identical intelligence and have a strange bond to each other.','/l8zpr1tq03YPqdOz6aAmnSpD7o6.jpg','1964-01-10',90,'Released','Beware the eyes that paralyze!!!','Children of the Damned',30202,2.6895,6.1,'9ZYGfxa5IW4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4384,_binary '\0','/q7fBDmVcU0MWkc8sWt9IKj6YbVd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056937',7,41807,'en','Cleopatra','Determined to hold on to the throne, Cleopatra seduces the Roman emperor Julius Caesar. When Caesar is murdered, she redirects her attentions to his general, Marc Antony, who vows to take power—but Caesar’s successor has other plans.','/bj7rUGUewofA9cpHt1h36gvDFfy.jpg','1963-06-12',251,'Released','The motion picture the world has been waiting for!','Cleopatra',8095,9.5226,7.061,'NGDyZHlHklo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4385,_binary '\0','/4h91n6QBOAuTxFzUmOCtfsUARpz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056940',6,1312,'en','Come Blow Your Horn','The story of a young man\'s decision to leave the home of his parents for the bachelor pad of his older brother who leads a swinging \'60s lifestyle.','/b5YVP5Kncb6colRZoMwe5EtnT2t.jpg','1963-06-05',112,'Released','I tell ya, chum...laughs it is!','Come Blow Your Horn',33729,1.9878,5.1,'Qo7wf86KyhM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4386,_binary '\0','/prvlizZrLurkh6vVaEN5JThgtK7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056943',6.5,7985,'en','The Comedy of Terrors','An undertaker who hasn\'t had any \'customers\' in a long time is forced to pay one year\'s back-rent. To get money he starts to kill people, which brings absurd results.','/r33eBrYYJphzny0jPJ9sRFYoxev.jpg','1964-01-22',84,'Released',NULL,'The Comedy of Terrors',29486,2.4433,6.5,'8ARUKfGB6wc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4387,_binary '\0','/jAikERBYAHiTzxemFESSa0tXgL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056945',8,3841,'it','I compagni','In the late 19th century, a former high school teacher turned unionist tries to organize workers laboring with inhuman conditions at a textile factory in Turin, Italy.','/oT0bkjJEyeKIHh33MPMxVgySOGt.jpg','1963-10-25',130,'Released','A RARE MOTION PICTURE... BRILLIANT PERFORMANCE!','The Organizer',51092,1.9696,7.5,'e-PZ6w_2wp0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4388,_binary '\0','/gfqYo084VTNSeplCQSOTsA85fqo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056956',6.8,3830,'en','The Courtship of Eddie\'s Father','Although he\'s only seven, Eddie\'s got it all figured out. He wants his father, a widower, to get remarried — to the girl next door. Unfortunately, she\'s not one of the women that his dad\'s been dating.','/g1xNTfyQefR2HBmtAseFd6h1ev5.jpg','1963-03-27',120,'Released','Every boy needs a mother... even if Dad has to marry her!','The Courtship of Eddie\'s Father',42986,2.3316,5.9,'9o47cmaXqyk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4389,_binary '\0','/iNGDaZ30ol2qnJGVJLNp0KSZ1Ev.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056957',6.2,1413,'en','Le Couteau dans la plaie','American ex-Air Force man and current businessman Bob Macklin is married to the impoverished Italian-born Lisa. Bob’s jealousy and immaturity irks Lisa, who tells him she’s planning to file for a divorce before his plane departs on a business trip for Casablanca.','/4pZA2D3EGZrLBh3LWFDiurSjsYE.jpg','1962-12-12',108,'Released','The Suspense Begins...From the Very First Second!','Five Miles to Midnight',15469,2.4466,5.9,'m9eoUr1ofS8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4390,_binary '\0','/tg2Vttp0DEeOfe5YimL9TBpuNIy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056961',3.3,2166,'en','The Crawling Hand','After an astronaut space capsule is detonated in orbit, with the astronaut begging to be killed, a teenager couple finds a severed arm on a remote beach. The boy takes the arm home, where it becomes animate and the alien force which animates it soon possesses his mind as well.','/dc6HgjkuQ7kgAw0GRBuMXTxnIFi.jpg','1963-09-04',89,'Released','Astronaut Ordered Blown Up!!!','The Crawling Hand',51260,1.1618,3.2,'4vTRh9xoCaM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4391,_binary '\0','/c4zQcKLp7KtIMVno0xJZFjNTeEq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056964',5.7,1271,'en','Critic\'s Choice','Parker Ballantine is a New York theater critic and his wife writes a play that may or may not be very good. Now Parker must either get out of reviewing the play or cause the breakup of his marriage.','/wYqHxE7yzL82wtx9qEr2B4wYigp.jpg','1963-02-24',100,'Released','Everybody\'s \'choice\' for a great big wonderful time!','Critic\'s Choice',59838,1.7618,5.6,'zR4-LWmuUiE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4392,_binary '\0','/oSDAyY7RBaf6iRVt2X6tThP3uHB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056966',7.2,1349,'it','Cronaca familiare','Enrico is a struggling journalist in the Rome of 1945. He receives a phone call informing him that his younger brother Lorenzo has died. Enrico recalls their long and difficult relationship; he was brought up by their poor but warm-hearted grandmother, Lorenzo was raised as a gentleman by a wealthy local aristocrat. Reunited in the Florence of the 1930s, Enrico becomes his spoilt brother\'s keeper, forever haunted by a sense of guilty responsibility towards a man he both hates and loves.','/hXSBKcxowauPtMlpvjqNM15NbCt.jpg','1962-09-28',108,'Released',NULL,'Family Diary',80557,1.4302,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4393,_binary '\0','/vRUW69sWDQtf7vaVrSsgK9gy0is.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056982',7.5,1479,'ru','Деловые люди','Three stories based on O. Henry novels. (1) Bob Tidball recovers $30,000 in pristine credit cards from a bandit’s sack and races across the plains until his horse breaks its leg. Forced to mount Dodson’s stallion, he’s ambushed and killed by “Shark” Dodson, who seizes the entire loot. (2) A thief slips through a third-floor window to steal a stack of bills from a sleeping gentleman’s dressing table. When the homeowner awakens and raises only one hand against the revolver—his other immobilized by a sudden rheumatic attack—the would-be robber reconsiders his plan. (3) Sam and Bill, two small-time grifters short $2,000 for their swindle, decide to kidnap Ebeneger Dorset’s young son. They demand exactly that sum as ransom, setting in motion a desperate bargain.','/pJWXUFMcL21m7QgUBqQqcvTokPf.jpg','1963-05-27',84,'Released',NULL,'Strictly Business',92983,1.1891,7.29,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4394,_binary '\0','/z2ZiFPibdguCYJBN9rZeHCMHxcO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056983',5.7,10324,'en','Dementia 13','A scheming widow hatches a bold plan to acquire her late husband\'s inheritance, unaware that she is being targeted by an ax murderer who lurks in the family\'s estate.','/aLv5491Q11zhIZbpqz7rnRZkSLZ.jpg','1963-09-25',75,'Released','Are you afraid of death by drowning? Have you ever attempted suicide? Have you ever thought of committing murder?','Dementia 13',28503,2.2975,5.5,'T5Lu2G0O3TA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4395,_binary '\0','/swWKnAUfjnYDthXDPCbnGk2nKt3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0056993',6.3,3506,'en','Diary of a Madman','Simon Cordier, a French magistrate and amateur sculptor comes into contact with a malevolent entity. The invisible - yet corporeal - being, called a \"horla\" is capable of limited psychokinesis and complete mind control.','/mvsJcPEghB6YhG06FMYjtkoMCfr.jpg','1963-03-06',96,'Released','The most terrifying motion picture ever!','Diary of a Madman',29060,2.244,6.099,'OksWHWBBgnQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4396,_binary '\0','/fDdMm5ZW45GzOZM1DuA7fPa1ANF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057007',6.7,10888,'en','Donovan\'s Reef','After her great aunt\'s death, a high-society woman arrives on a Hawaiian island in search of the heir - the father she has never met.','/xxZ6VUmnsxNiMa812IP3ohUf3BS.jpg','1963-06-12',109,'Released','Gangway...For This Year\'s BIG Adventure!','Donovan\'s Reef',15875,2.7435,6.2,'fxCDQVh89bE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4397,_binary '\0','/7i0L2ee4Iy0aXV6vR5u1ZmblOrx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057012',8.3,554528,'en','Dr. Strangelove or: How I Learned to Stop Worrying and Love the Bomb','After the insane General Jack D. Ripper initiates a nuclear strike on the Soviet Union, a war room full of politicians, generals and a Russian diplomat all frantically try to stop it.','/gHm96BRW4GoI339rF1vYoYTB6Qe.jpg','1964-01-29',95,'Released','The hot-line suspense comedy.','Dr. Strangelove or: How I Learned to Stop Worrying and Love the Bomb',935,12.8072,8.121,'0rF5XftjRGM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4398,_binary '\0','/2pGyqnuNkZLRg2BbZheTsr3Sl4X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057051',6.7,2976,'fr','Faites sauter la banque !','Shopkeeper Victor Garnier has naively invested his family\'s life savings in an African mine, on his banker\'s recommendation. When the mine is nationalized, rendering the stock worthless, he considers himself shamelessly robbed by the bank; it seems only fair to him to return the \'favor\' and rob the bank, teaming up with the whole family as they were all duped. Even for professionals such an enterprise -he decides to dig a tunnel- is quite demanding, but for simple commoners it\'s daunting, as they also have their personal downsides; thus Victor\'s wife has a most unwelcome tendency to blurt out the truth, even to the grumpy local copper: a crazy risk when you need to keep a criminal plan secret.','/cz7LwYjJCwjkPNC1Eid3hRK1dwE.jpg','1964-02-25',88,'Released',NULL,'Let\'s Rob the Bank',57144,2.102,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4399,_binary '\0','/aHMsHOCPSVD4Mv5rLf5k4JetPAv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057058',7.8,11793,'fr','Le Feu follet','Depressed Alain Leroy leaves the clinic where he was detoxified. He meets friends, acquaintances and women, trying to find a reason to continue living.','/9iHsReoh2VuHihDmNXgLXCi18rR.jpg','1963-10-15',108,'Released',NULL,'The Fire Within',2593,3.1457,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4400,_binary '\0','/mwPMzbwuwqXKb9Lfp7oQMZyoVFz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057063',6.1,2209,'en','Flipper','Sandy is distraught when, having saved Flipper by pulling out a spear, his father insists the dolphin be released. A grateful Flipper, however, returns the favor when Sandy is threatened by sharks.','/x8tmePZ3082Na0QTqOgB5zZVb2S.jpg','1963-08-14',90,'Released','The wonderful story of a boy and his amazing underwater friend!','Flipper',19893,2.8796,5.844,'G4LXJLNh7FU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4401,_binary '\0','/gFgovhVqLEhqYbElntoo017VcSw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057069',6.3,1289,'en','40 Pounds of Trouble','Hilarity ensues when a casino manager spends a day at Disneyland with a cute but troublesome little girl.','/3wnQF0Xb7lLKiXJlNSuQvzmCGcU.jpg','1962-12-31',106,'Released','Tony\'s got women trouble!','40 Pounds of Trouble',42990,2.4015,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4402,_binary '\0','/jLRx4JPuzCIelygVrR9PYY7Wsno.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057071',5.5,3943,'en','4 for Texas','In the 1870s, two rival businessmen, Zack Thomas and Joe Jarrett, on a stagecoach heading to Galveston, Texas, must pull together to protect $100,000 from an outlaw named Matson. Once in Galveston, however, their rivalry continues, as Thomas joins up with Elya Carlson and Jarret with Maxine Richter. But Matson is still on the loose, and a scheming banker threatens both Thomas and Jarrett.','/kElgIdPt8cCjrbR6qOSjgJ4LE8Q.jpg','1963-12-21',124,'Released','The far out story of the far west','4 for Texas',17691,3.0307,5.175,'EMbP1jrGCQA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4403,_binary '\0','/8JMiQa0OqsCYvbNUrQIrMzwV7g2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057076',7.3,160719,'en','From Russia with Love','Agent 007 is back in the second installment of the James Bond series, this time battling a secret crime organization known as SPECTRE. Russians Rosa Klebb and Kronsteen are out to snatch a decoding device known as the Lektor, using the ravishing Tatiana to lure Bond into helping them. Bond willingly travels to meet Tatiana in Istanbul, where he must rely on his wits to escape with his life in a series of deadly encounters with the enemy.','/zx4V17FP8oclNvOpTgs2iCCtiYk.jpg','1963-10-10',115,'Released','The world\'s masters of murder pull out all the stops to destroy Agent 007!','From Russia with Love',657,15.3733,7.1,'sqebrE47m9c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4404,_binary '\0','/EGIbG1zVCdlQnyDFkSwScyMzUo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057078',6.6,5386,'it','La frusta e il corpo','Disowned in the past by his father, Kurt Menliff, a cruel and sadistic nobleman, returns to the family castle to reclaim his inheritance.','/lydaya4kSCMpev4UwrqrM05fa9k.jpg','1963-08-29',87,'Released','Evil horror!!!','The Whip and the Body',27636,2.915,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4405,_binary '\0','/xHycZ3fivt48RKtk5kbcHb1S9tb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057083',5.9,4154,'en','Fun in Acapulco','Mike Windgren works on a boat in Acapulco, but when the bratty daughter of its owner gets him fired, Mike finds new work as a lifeguard and singer at a local hotel. Tensions increase when Mike runs afoul of the rival lifeguard—also the champion diver of Mexico.','/fCHQQ6EmhQshb80VPKzmOzLHke3.jpg','1963-11-27',97,'Released','Come With Elvis to Fabulous Acapulco!','Fun in Acapulco',18692,2.8519,5.938,'t-fPl3ws1ok','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4406,_binary '\0','/x2b3zkbxAKNWROsyMarlU8Z2QnC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057090',6.1,1272,'en','A Gathering of Eagles','A B-52 commander must prepare his men to pass a grueling inspection.','/aMhdBWKwRKdfrx5OJ0mXIc5mwHW.jpg','1963-06-21',115,'Released','The Red Phone... His Mistress... Her Rival... Hurling Him to the Edge of Space... Freezing Her Love on the Edge of Time!','A Gathering of Eagles',124058,2.6186,5.8,'-EuPtB5t5Ts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4407,_binary '\0','/myikoqu8Z2gtE7TaBgk9r6fB9MF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057091',7.9,35043,'it','Il gattopardo','As Garibaldi\'s troops begin the unification of Italy in the 1860s, an aristocratic Sicilian family grudgingly adapts to the sweeping social changes undermining their way of life.','/riSUxwoK3xjkOgy6YJSvPhi7cO6.jpg','1963-03-27',186,'Released','Luchino Visconti\'s enduring romantic adventure','The Leopard',1040,7.6175,7.7,'06f7f24lpUI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4408,_binary '\0','/rD8xddvtLR7yumzdXfPrPbMLt67.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057093',6.7,2439,'en','Gay Purr-ee','Mewsette is a starry-eyed cat who grows weary of life on a French farm and heads for the excitement of 1890s Paris. Her tomcat suitor, Jaune-Tom, and his furry cohort, Robespierre, chase after Mewsette, but she\'s already fallen under the spell of a feline modeling-school racket run by Madame Rubens-Chatte and her slimy assistant, Meowrice.','/kSu1iF8idPcPobLFX7q7sFgZWUB.jpg','1962-10-24',85,'Released','Vive La Coolest Cat Who Ever Captured The Happy Heart Of Paris!','Gay Purr-ee',32328,2.2231,6.6,'iyjAMt0qXfE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4409,_binary '\0','/lb87H6BFXXKMJlUnDHvPOMGfh8z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057115',8.2,280070,'en','The Great Escape','The Nazis, exasperated at the number of escapes from their prison camps by a relatively small number of Allied prisoners, relocate them to a high-security \'escape-proof\' camp to sit out the remainder of the war. Undaunted, the prisoners plan one of the most ambitious escape attempts of World War II. Based on a true story.','/gBH4H8UMFxl139HaLz6lRuvsel8.jpg','1963-07-03',173,'Released','Put a fence in front of these men... and they\'ll climb it!','The Great Escape',5925,14.4527,7.925,'8No6XGbvr0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4410,_binary '\0','/i7Id8WE9183hVK5WL6eFle7Kfdi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057128',6.7,9954,'en','The Haunted Palace','A man and his wife claim the mansion of his warlock ancestor burned alive in 1765.','/l1rXixv1R5ApEdgb5B3j6q6WtvM.jpg','1963-09-11',87,'Released','A warlock\'s home is his castle...forever!','The Haunted Palace',30137,3.6661,6.727,'CIxey5Y0inY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4411,_binary '\0','/9CVUzIPyBMnHsDDighQNgkDYsP9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057129',7.4,44959,'en','The Haunting','Dr. John Markway recruits three strangers for a sleep-disorder study at the eerie and isolated Hill House. It soon becomes clear his real interest lies in the mansion itself and its sinister history, as they are forced to confront the nature of its horror…','/fmpTnUKTcrpuxLSY23gQMUf9qu7.jpg','1963-03-28',112,'Released','You may not believe in ghosts but you cannot deny terror.','The Haunting',11772,4.8098,7.1,'noW6c70Yrbs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4412,_binary '\0','/zjrYvAAb5P3ML415Y8a2PwESD6k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057134',6.7,1987,'en','Heavens Above!','A clerical error leads to the appointment of a left-leaning small-town priest to a rich village, where he immediately horrifies his snobby parishioners by appointing a dustman and a black man as vicar\'s wardens and throwing open the vicarage to the sprawling, disreputable Smith family, who have just been evicted from their caravan site. He converts the dowager aristocrat to works of absurd charity but he soon has the town and much of the country in uproar.','/wNM2se70dpwcOVLHWHrIBRXOehj.jpg','1963-05-20',118,'Released','Where \"I\'m All Right Jack\" left off…this takes off!','Heavens Above!',42800,1.4483,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4413,_binary '\0','/dlmROevxOVYtZXRUzt6DGJzl9BL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057163',7.8,26371,'en','Hud','Hud Bannon is a ruthless young man who tarnishes everything and everyone he touches. Hud represents the perfect embodiment of alienated youth, out for kicks with no regard for the consequences. There is bitter conflict between the callous Hud and his stern and highly principled father, Homer. Hud\'s nephew Lon admires Hud\'s cheating ways, though he soon becomes too aware of Hud\'s reckless amorality to bear him anymore. In the world of the takers and the taken, Hud is a winner. He\'s a cheat, but, he explains, \"I always say the law was meant to be interpreted in a lenient manner.\"','/A168bF52vmAIGkC2Qafj7M2EmaE.jpg','1963-05-24',112,'Released','The man with the barbed-wire soul.','Hud',24748,3.6883,7.2,'9uSurLxEiRc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4414,_binary '\0','/lN6wkxwHX4rtKcPESIZOT3cnQi9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057168',6.9,1858,'en','I Could Go on Singing','Jenny Bowman is a successful singer who, while on an engagement at the London Palladium, visits David Donne to see her son Matt again, spending a few glorious days with him while his father is away in Rome in an attempt to attain the family that she never had. When David returns, Matt is torn between his loyalty to his father and his affection for Jenny.','/4MbUdjRiMiQqICONsVZ1w5Nryys.jpg','1963-03-07',99,'Released','It\'s Judy! Lighting up the lonely stage!','I Could Go on Singing',86168,2.1957,6.1,'3fcc6FrOUBY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4415,_binary '\0','/i7awVEzUulqDX35EDKtXijRCpzM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057171',7.2,11614,'it','Ieri, oggi, domani','Three tales of very different women using their sexuality as a means to getting what they want.','/uRJuHGtdNES7OgCoBpTXkOTO9IL.jpg','1963-12-21',119,'Released','They\'re in Love Three Times and Three Ways...In One Movie!','Yesterday, Today and Tomorrow',42801,3.1945,7.424,'A6Rrj3LgAPs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4416,_binary '\0','/dn3bDESwzrNIQz3mQUhLNj1k2lI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057176',7.2,1645,'fr','L\'Immortelle','A melancholy man meets a stunning, mysterious woman while he is traveling, and discovers she may or may not be involved in a prostitution ring. She disappears after their relationship lasts a few days, and though he searches for her, those around him pretend not to know who he is speaking of.','/f85l2aDUdmr9GHuEuNXO23ppJBQ.jpg','1963-03-27',102,'Released',NULL,'The Immortal One',121737,1.3282,6.875,'Ua-zYCL93zU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4417,_binary '\0','/ql4XLTUhEMCB46upRMlWPHzc3aq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057180',7,5780,'en','The Incredible Journey','The story of three pets, a cat and two dogs, who lose their owners when they are all on vacation. Can they find their way home?','/vOnusK40twHThlxz6sGXVyakATx.jpg','1963-11-20',80,'Released','Three against the wilderness... nothing could stop them - only instinct to guide them across 200 perilous miles of Canadian wilderness!','The Incredible Journey',37969,2.5877,6.659,'1kHyY7LZlFU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4418,_binary '\0','/btViQKBLqjBQ7exByvmQXHJGnMS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057181',2.4,5511,'en','The Incredibly Strange Creatures Who Stopped Living and Became Mixed-Up Zombies!!?','Jerry, his girlfriend Angela, and their friend Harold take a trip to a local seaside carnival, but when the carnival\'s fortune teller, Madame Estrella, predicts death for someone close to Angela, strange things begin to happen.','/vfXLgQk5s1bzQfWV1LnS8Ch1Sbi.jpg','1964-02-10',82,'Released','She keeps monsters in cages for pets! He preys on wild go-go girls!','The Incredibly Strange Creatures Who Stopped Living and Became Mixed-Up Zombies!!?',31383,1.6552,2.7,'gMMkrdy1_0I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4419,_binary '\0','/baSfWto9f4Js2h0VY8JwXf9tnQP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057183',6.6,1285,'de','Das indische Tuch','When a wealthy man dies, his avaricious relatives look forward to inheriting all his money. However, he leaves a provision in his will that they all must spend a week together in his castle before they will be able to inherit anything. At the castle (which is cut off from the outside world), the relatives soon begin to be killed off one by one, each strangled with an Indian scarf.','/rFOjlEGk5pfc1ZQQPs5xHBOejle.jpg','1963-09-13',86,'Released',NULL,'The Indian Scarf',9634,1.6831,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4420,_binary '\0','/6j1yeUhtFUVACFjLJXCFLswlcFE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057187',7.3,24524,'en','Irma la Douce','When a recently fired policeman falls in love with a French prostitute, he doesn\'t want her to be with other men, so he creates an alter-ego in order to become her only customer.','/5TgL8ql6WwXWmX4EvBL4geJ7gx5.jpg','1963-01-30',147,'Released','A story of passion, bloodshed, desire and death... everything, in fact, that makes life worth living.','Irma la Douce',2690,4.6056,7.384,'-e2GpdeN5M4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4421,_binary '\0','/n6OG7rBZZoTGl7otm8TbeWKzva6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057191',6.1,3481,'en','It Happened at the World\'s Fair','Mike Edwards and Danny Burke fly a cropduster, but due to Danny\'s gambling debts, a local sheriff takes custody of it. Trying to earn money, they hitchhike to the World\'s Fair in Seattle and, while Danny tries to earn money playing poker, Mike cares for a small girl whose father has disappeared.','/2ZyMccwiHjf79pmd1Tw65XTyGVL.jpg','1963-04-03',105,'Released','Swinging higher than the space needle with the gals and the songs at the famous Worlds Fair!','It Happened at the World\'s Fair',8745,2.9044,5.8,'LAUno33GQvQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4422,_binary '\0','/wSiBXaJ2PtlxUGH2waIxQZjFPhg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057193',7.4,51684,'en','It\'s a Mad, Mad, Mad, Mad World','A group of strangers come across a man dying after a car crash who proceeds to tell them about the $350,000 he buried in California. What follows is the madcap adventures of those strangers as each attempts to claim the prize for himself.','/j4mWzOisSHFkaqIkq34l2mm8a5K.jpg','1963-11-07',192,'Released','The biggest entertainment ever to rock the screen with laughter!','It\'s a Mad, Mad, Mad, Mad World',11576,8.206,6.974,'Oly0EY47Ht4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4423,_binary '\0','/xdefSJpYARFdW4jPhPsuvUlmt2M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057197',7.3,35700,'en','Jason and the Argonauts','Jason, a fearless sailor and explorer, returns to his home land of Thessaly after a long voyage to claim his rightful throne. He learns, however, that he must first find the magical Golden Fleece. To do so, he must embark on an epic quest fraught with fantastic monsters and terrible perils.','/xHVxIgqD5CxlOI5GHxvVSt5Zh5Y.jpg','1963-06-13',104,'Released','The epic story that was destined to stand as a colossus of adventure!','Jason and the Argonauts',11533,6.0395,7.2,'WbWmMsyqf6k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4424,_binary '\0','/hx5ecIP6mlnv9TLyU4R16xHh56H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057200',6.4,1293,'en','Johnny Cool','A deported gangster trains an Italian convict to take over his operations in the U.S.','/q9xo7i31O5KbUUPBR96YPj1u9WO.jpg','1963-10-02',103,'Released','Don\'t let his looks fool you. He\'s the coldest killer of killers who ever lived!','Johnny Cool',72901,3.1691,5.396,'UfsrZ6OTcDY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4425,_binary '\0','/eNQxoousltKctmhf0LesrobK87l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057207',7,3215,'fr','Judex','Georges Franju\'s Judex is an arch, playful tribute to the serials of the influential silent filmmaker Louis Feuillade. Franju shuffles through the plot of Feuillade\'s lengthy serial of the same name, about an adventurer named Judex whose revenge against the corrupt banker Favraux unleashes a complicated series of schemes.','/v9QWXz5F11R0yZpCcxIH1W50BHP.jpg','1963-12-04',104,'Released',NULL,'Judex',56800,2.4845,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4426,_binary '\0','/xMgNdmRaHbs23tW6jfxgO33T4wP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057212',7.4,1317,'ja','十三人の刺客','A sadistic Daimyo (feudal lord) rapes a woman and murders both her and her husband, but even when one of his own vassals commits suicide to bring attention to the crime, the matter is quickly hushed up. Not only will there be no punishment, but because the Daimyo is the Shogun\'s younger brother, he will soon be appointed to a high political position from which he could wreak even more havoc. Convinced that the fate of the Shogunate hangs in the balance, a plot is hatched to assassinate the Daimyo. The two most brilliant strategic minds of their generation find themselves pitted against each other; one is tasked to defend a man he despises, and has a small army at his disposal. The other is given a suicide mission, and has 12 brave men. They are the 13 Assassins.','/9WhtxGDgRZylO01m94TJDjcajtS.jpg','1963-12-07',125,'Released','A group of assassins come together for a suicide mission to kill an evil lord.','13 Assassins',52011,1.8266,7.5,'JTeZjMSolLk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4427,_binary '\0','/2bXp4GTcvU1mCQbq9lXRUiDdTcZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057215',5.8,1854,'ja','海底軍艦','The legendary empire of the lost continent of Mu reappears to threaten the world with domination. While countries unite to resist, an isolated World War II Captain has created the greatest warship ever seen, and possibly the surface world\'s only defense.','/u5fD2mfsovtW1Pn2Umtl2G3280w.jpg','1963-12-22',96,'Released','The dreaded undersea kingdom challenges the surface! The emergency dispatch of the all-purpose atomic battleship!','Atragon',35072,2.5349,6.6,'-1aS06Cg5SU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4428,_binary '\0','/juKXmgj55x5zoFJte1i3xLOwgD8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057225',6.1,2506,'en','Kings of the Sun','In order to flee from powerful enemies, young Mayan king Balam leads his people north across the Gulf of Mexico to the coast of what will become the United States. They build a home in the new land but come into conflict with a tribe of Native Americans led by their chief, Black Eagle, while both Balam and Black Eagle fall in love the beautiful Mayan princess Ixchel.','/luWboioLUipYdlcfolprXoMi2Fm.jpg','1963-12-18',108,'Released','Now a lost world becomes a new world of adventure!','Kings of the Sun',80027,3.1745,6,'bXdDLh831ss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4429,_binary '\0','/6nvf7s9KmZ52eJXwHBdDldExfdV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057226',6.2,4583,'en','The Kiss of the Vampire','Honeymooning in Bavaria, a young couple becomes stranded and is forced to stay the night in the area. Doctor Ravna, owner of the impressive chateau that sits imposingly above the village, invites them to dinner that evening. Their association with Ravna and his charming, beautiful family is to prove disastrous.','/4RHWz6frLuTxuRW3Kh0YosOhdir.jpg','1963-09-11',89,'Released','Shocking! - Horrifying! - Macabre!','The Kiss of the Vampire',39222,2.6413,6.1,'WZl_ACWvDLM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4430,_binary '\0','/uPdlCuIW9g0axLgthR56yz2LtAe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057227',5.3,2722,'en','Kissin\' Cousins','Army officer Josh Morgan returns to the Smoky Mountains and tries to convince his kinfolk to allow a missile site to be built on their land. Once he arrives, he discovers he has a lookalike cousin.','/lRn1a2J5FH7O3H5cycXWF7V5L53.jpg','1964-03-06',96,'Released','ELViS feudin\' ELViS lovin\' ELViS swingin\'....as he joins his mountain kinfolk for a hey, hey, hayride to good ol\' mountain music!','Kissin\' Cousins',42783,2.4828,4.7,'0snhCIAedY0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4431,_binary '\0','/xrA1eAAVcXLo8mAhHOkiRiZJz3f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057229',8.1,2267,'el','Τα Κόκκινα Φανάρια','The inextricably intertwined stories of five sex workers who live in a brothel at Pireas harbor.','/v1nYMzMEpTtyzUo1ghG5GlIflxa.jpg','1963-02-12',132,'Released','Daring! Realistic! Overwhelming!','The Red Lanterns',47790,1.4513,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4432,_binary '\0','/xOptPF75fZ6q3TWdQRvlJyt7ukS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057232',7.2,2023,'ru','Королева бензоколонки','Lyudmila doesn\'t have any luck in finding the perfect job. She tried to be an air hostess, newscaster, model, ice skater, but fate had something else in store for her - a petrol station, where her incredible positivity and fiery personality charm everyone around her.','/3TldhPiQlRJCrofs4SzXMa611V9.jpg','1963-02-18',78,'Released',NULL,'Gas Station Queen',20977,1.3025,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4433,_binary '\0','/wo91tuso6gBXwwKiiiNkLZZM7Q3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057237',7.3,2028,'sv','Kvarteret Korpen','In 1936, aspiring writer Anders, along with his friend Sixten, is desperate to escape his working-class upbringing. Anders\' father is an unemployed alcoholic and his mother slaves away at a laundry to support the family. A ray of hope comes Anders\' way when he finishes his first novel and submits it to a publisher. But after his girlfriend gets pregnant, his future dims before his eyes once more.','/mOct6yh6AFO4DyPiklDq0TYS02L.jpg','1963-12-25',97,'Released',NULL,'Raven\'s End',47206,1.9617,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4434,_binary '\0','/sJi1q3wyQXPubDM5gv8hVAYPVYM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057239',7.3,2556,'en','The L-Shaped Room','Jane is young, French, pregnant and unmarried. Bucking convention, she is uninterested in settling with her baby\'s father or getting an abortion. After renting a room in a dingy London boarding house, Jane befriends the odd group of inhabitants and starts an affair with one boarder, Toby. As Jane\'s pregnancy threatens her new relationship, and the reality of single motherhood approaches, she is forced to decide what to do about both her baby and her budding romance.','/ie8EArW3CjO2gLMYtJEMLU4CAQN.jpg','1962-11-20',126,'Released','Sex is not a forbidden word','The L-Shaped Room',76000,2.6754,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4435,_binary '\0','/2IKCG6YmQCptKZclDGE9X2ZzmB0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057244',7.1,1302,'en','The Leather Boys','Reggie and Dot are a young South London couple who get married before they really get to know each other. After the marriage, they quickly begin to drift apart. Dot seems content to pursue her own interests, until Reggie meets Pete, a fellow cyclist, and begins to explore his own identity.','/l9oYKhfxQYLu3Itkm4d4eeYBhaP.jpg','1964-03-08',108,'Released','The frustrations of sexual conflict.','The Leather Boys',140008,1.4064,6.6,'n4tWA-S-PHA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4436,_binary '\0','/yyoZuEAMcT7QhpChN4s1JyUorcT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057251',7.5,15601,'en','Lilies of the Field','An unemployed construction worker heading out west stops at a remote farm in the desert to get water when his car overheats. The farm is being worked by a group of East European Catholic nuns, headed by the strict mother superior, who believes the man has been sent by God to build a much needed church in the desert.','/gYoVx2m8NP2hTWnEpwNeROIWrQ4.jpg','1963-06-04',94,'Released','Sidney Poitier as the life-loving ex-GI who one day encounters five nuns escaped from beyond the Berlin Wall...','Lilies of the Field',38805,3.5356,7.2,'l5G_dQZE01o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4437,_binary '\0','/oo4BWafFHgnFIY7Ymbs8TaTHw3k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057254',6.8,6187,'en','The List of Adrian Messenger','Adrian Messenger, a famous writer, asks his friend Anthony Gethryn, a former British agent, to help him investigate the whereabouts of the people who appear on a list, without asking him the reason why he should do so.','/kegT7mgLFZc69exeq4sE3qxIHew.jpg','1963-05-23',99,'Released','The most bizarre murder mystery ever conceived!','The List of Adrian Messenger',11605,2.7292,6.672,'yc63KNjNHYA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4438,_binary '\0','/xfM0AXT5WUK2HLZFKs759fi6F6F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057259',6,3484,'en','The Long Ships','Moorish ruler El Mansuh is determined to locate a massive bell made of gold known as the \"Mother of Voices.\" Viking explorer Rolfe also becomes intent on finding the mythical treasure, and sails with his crew from Scandinavia to Africa to track it down. Reluctantly working together, El Mansuh and Rolfe, along with their men, embark on a quest for the prized object, but only one leader will be able to claim the bell as his own — if it even exists at all.','/vgZOBBGsZGKhK7ajbmAe2egcqbc.jpg','1964-03-25',126,'Released','The Viking adventurers who challenged the seas... and conquered the world!','The Long Ships',44736,2.6237,6.1,'AkhZJFn0gXw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4439,_binary '\0','/gLRsYQTWShZrCOASZDswahfGcQF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057261',6.8,22276,'en','Lord of the Flies','Following a plane crash a group of schoolboys find themselves on a deserted island. They appoint a leader and attempt to create an organized society for the sake of their survival. Democracy and order soon begin to crumble when a breakaway faction regresses to savagery with horrifying consequences.','/3jhp9oxZpwcWCZ1vfn3PyMWovzq.jpg','1963-08-13',92,'Released','Evil is inherent in the human mind, whatever innocence may cloak it...','Lord of the Flies',9960,4.6613,6.7,'GPxguAyViJk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4440,_binary '\0','/xWetk35w1SIAp02HlJulXRzHVz2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057263',7.2,6207,'en','Love with the Proper Stranger','Angie Rossini, an innocent New York City sales clerk from a repressive Italian-American family, engages in a short-lived affair with a handsome jazz musician named Rocky Papasano. When Angie becomes pregnant, she tracks down Rocky hoping he\'ll pay for her abortion.','/1Dzre2aAiLZhAW03FlJ1n6YwQSN.jpg','1963-12-25',102,'Released','There is a moment - a long moment - when everything is risked with the proper stranger','Love with the Proper Stranger',39495,3.0989,6.8,'Eh-p2kJsiNc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4441,_binary '\0','/cDxkqKumuTe9q5MoC98tRXGW50o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057277',8.3,5734,'bn','মহানগর','Arati takes a job as a door-to-door saleswoman in Calcutta\'s wealthy neighbourhoods, in defiance of her traditionally-minded husband, Subrata, and his live-in parents. Emulating her Anglo-Indian friend Edith, who speaks equal to the men she encounters on the job, Arati quickly becomes her firm\'s top salesperson. When Subrata loses his job, the power dynamic begins to shift.','/hPDMRWqb5WzXKa4qJCgcnvxAkO6.jpg','1963-09-27',136,'Released',NULL,'The Big City',60567,1.8145,7.795,'HGA8WBTvQco','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4442,_binary '\0','/38nZjWRW5wfxeaochjTeIjQ0PZW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057280',5.8,1545,'it','La cripta e l\'incubo','Count Karnstein sends for a doctor to help his sick daughter Laura. Her nurse believes she is possessed by the spirit of a dead ancestor, Carmilla. A young woman becomes intrigued by the mysterious deaths surrounding Laura after a carriage accident outside the castle forces her to stay. They become close friends until Laura becomes convinced the spirit of Carmilla is forcing her to kill.','/wf5yZPhdl0PWU4184Ba1MWODncx.jpg','1964-05-27',82,'Released','How much shock can the human brain endure before it cracks?','Crypt of the Vampire',221767,2.1481,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4443,_binary '\0','/7mcCpszj9Xqt04uZz8dk2vEvDaE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057286',7.6,3731,'it','Le mani sulla città','Prior to a city council election, the collapse of a building leaves a land developer and his political backers defending themselves against a scandal.','/zR9uj0dtm5osrrpM7zwO5ndAtbh.jpg','1963-10-11',101,'Released',NULL,'Hands Over the City',58383,2.2214,7.387,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4444,_binary '\0','/7Mmp2I9AMmOkOCSoC8jb3w81YjC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057295',6.4,4018,'ja','マタンゴ','Five vacationers and two crewmen become stranded on a tropical island near the equator. The island has little edible food for them to use as they try to live in a fungus covered hulk while repairing Kessei\'s yacht. Eventually they struggle over the food rations which were left behind by the former crew. Soon they discover something unfriendly there...','/kfUJ1XO15yWz6U2N7vmubJS9aX8.jpg','1963-08-11',89,'Released','Can you survive the madness and terror of Matango?','Matango',52302,2.2858,6.7,'uWNAX2DlmTI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4445,_binary '\0','/cPAabDXqphKbEa8uCNb4uqATGwP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057298',7.1,18559,'en','McLintock!','Aging rancher and self-made man, George Washington McLintock is forced to deal with numerous personal and professional problems. Seemingly everyone wants a piece of his enormous farmstead, including high-ranking government men and nearby Native Americans. As McLintock tries to juggle his various adversaries, his wife—who left him two years previously—suddenly returns. But she isn\'t interested in George; she wants custody of their daughter.','/gjaAtWJqGomsE5qNQStHcHhSzES.jpg','1963-11-12',127,'Released','Never such a tender love story! Never such a savage showdown! Never such restless natives!','McLintock!',15263,5.1321,6.6,'8Cbh2UqXk-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4446,_binary '\0','/mSnbknxnpgnWu50yspMdVc23xLM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057318',6.2,5020,'it','Mondo Cane','A documentary consisting of a series of travelogue vignettes providing glimpses into cultural practices throughout the world intended to shock or surprise, including an insect banquet and a memorable look at a practicing South Pacific cargo cult.','/kw8MBBknqE0GO7JuP7F3QDIHLt9.jpg','1962-03-30',105,'Released','It enters a hundred incredible worlds where the camera has never gone before!','Mondo Cane',32688,2.9689,6.2,'3XBg6BgOSgs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4447,_binary '\0','/ic3hMvpouz2sIDrrlEnMYSZ8Sl9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057323',7.4,3085,'it','I mostri','The myths of the sixties are satirized in 20 episodes.','/6ojy9P8zp1Fz8byLqACux5H2cVP.jpg','1963-10-30',123,'Released','14 Happenings! Wild! Weird! Wonderful!','The Monsters',45005,2.9887,7.37,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4448,_binary '\0','/aZm8O7mNw8sOpzOnJY9SkRC0KJo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057328',6.3,2173,'en','The Mouse on the Moon','Sequel to The Mouse that Roared; The Tiny Country of Grand Fenwick has a hot water problem in the castle. To get the money necessary to put in a new set of plumbing, they request foreign aid from the U.S. for Space Research. The Russians then send aid as well to show that they too are for the internationalization of space. While the grand Duke is dreaming of hot baths, their one scientist is slapping together a rocket. The U.S. and Soviets get wind of the impending launch and try and beat them to the moon.','/vqkfzHxFJBmh6zFNSyNKvTpZJXb.jpg','1963-05-07',85,'Released','Stop shooting at our moon!','The Mouse on the Moon',49876,2.4467,6.3,'Zlllwrw5d6Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4449,_binary '\0','/xuegsCmBsTD5NQBSK3T0SoUNpUw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057329',6.9,7104,'en','Move Over, Darling','Three years into their loving marriage, with two infant daughters at home in Los Angeles, Nicholas Arden and Ellen Wagstaff Arden are on a plane that goes down in the South Pacific. Although most passengers manage to survive the incident, Ellen presumably perishes when swept off her lifeboat, her body never recovered. Fast forward five years. Nicholas, wanting to move on with his life, has Ellen declared legally dead. Part of that moving on includes getting remarried, this time to a young woman named Bianca Steele, who, for their honeymoon, he plans to take to the same Monterrey resort where he and Ellen spent their honeymoon. On that very same day, Ellen is dropped off in Los Angeles by the Navy, who rescued her from the South Pacific island where she was stranded for the past five years. She asks the Navy not to publicize her rescue nor notify Nicholas as she wants to do so herself.','/4KrfjjGpOAXiMZyHlbSyklPa1eA.jpg','1963-12-19',103,'Released','She\'s Married to Him... He\'s Married to Her... and It\'s Sheer Bedlam from Morning \'till Night!','Move Over, Darling',30204,3.0643,6.7,'ObuP1JRc-mA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4450,_binary '\0','/qUInTApfYSwiDYGY89lWqgWc0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057334',7.2,7650,'en','Murder at the Gallop','Miss Marple and Mr. Stringer are witnesses to the death by heart attack of elderly, rich Mr. Enderby. Yet they have their doubts about what happened. The police don\'t believe them, thus leading Miss Marple to yet again investigate by herself.','/lCLJ6yutSJc8PkiazcEh8dB6Juh.jpg','1963-05-09',81,'Released','It\'s a Penny to a Pony... Murder Will Out!','Murder at the Gallop',751,2.6502,7.1,'i2_jW8q0pTU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4451,_binary '\0','/jAjwOxqKrhZKLEEI0gokJZVF3hn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057336',7,4236,'fr','Muriel, ou le Temps d\'un retour','In the seacoast town of Boulogne, antique furniture saleswoman Hélène lives with her stepson, Bernard, who\'s back from military duty in Algiers. An old lover of Hélène\'s comes to visit, Alphonse, with his niece Françoise; he too is back from Algiers, where he ran a café. Bernard speaks of his fiancée, Muriel, whom Hélène has not met. The past is obscured by guilt, misperceptions, and missed possibilities. Appearances deceive, things change. As Hélène and Alphonse try to sort out a renewal, everyone seems off-kilter just enough to hint that all cannot end well.','/pAltAnAC26V1WrYYGNGqvpcsNN7.jpg','1963-10-01',117,'Released',NULL,'Muriel, or the Time of Return',54563,2.3382,6.9,'Mps49Z9hap8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4452,_binary '\0','/sPn3xLcCZCHkwql6ubC4fy3HJEJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057344',7.3,5308,'fr','Mélodie en sous-sol','Charles, fresh out of jail, rejects his wife\'s plan for a quiet life of bourgeois respectability. He enlists a former cell mate, Francis, to assist him in pulling off one final score, a carefully planned assault on the vault of a Cannes casino.','/pjA8gAy6oqLZHXXdCKygqZA6cf6.jpg','1963-03-19',122,'Released','Don\'t tell the ending...nobody\'ll ever believe you!','Any Number Can Win',22650,3.1897,7.246,'EezMqnbKZkA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4453,_binary '\0','/afxEiYxANGG88xXVYpNtAHFzTIV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057345',7.4,39733,'fr','Le Mépris','Art film producer Jeremy Prokosch, unhappy with the work of his director, hires Fritz Lang (as himself) to direct an adaptation of The Odyssey, but when it seems that the legendary filmmaker is making a picture destined to bomb, he brings in a screenwriter to energise the script. The professional intersects with the personal when a rift develops between the writer and his wife.','/kNElbRcp4Qz6wmJ9kH5vdY004Hq.jpg','1963-10-29',103,'Released','More bold! More brazen! And much, much more Bardot!','Contempt',266,5.8088,7.029,'do7ULPlH0jM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4454,_binary '\0','/2nXZ9S7tYHQAv2nXtNjcITYokjy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057357',7.5,3107,'ar','الناصر صلاح الدين','The first Sultan of Egypt and Syria leads the Muslim military campaign against the invading Christians from Europe during the Third Crusade.','/9LQkB7xuIMzAuKwsuUVkpNt2hTu.jpg','1963-02-25',180,'Released',NULL,'Saladin',46800,2.3099,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4455,_binary '\0','/tis6nrWakUsuG6Jwdm4yESfTU0o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057358',8,29915,'sv','Nattvardsgästerna','A Swedish pastor fails a loving woman, a suicidal fisherman and God.','/wDxrEssdjFWYwIZLbr06RQNcg1q.jpg','1963-02-11',80,'Released',NULL,'Winter Light',29455,2.872,7.9,'S_ihGR6Wung','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4456,_binary '\0','/vHOmZXyPhUacV5BsxxmD4BmV8E4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057360',5.7,1938,'en','A New Kind of Love','A down-and-out reporter and a fashion designer fall in love in Paris.','/9VsPciuwXuK0EpQAiOffEummYlq.jpg','1963-10-10',110,'Released','It\'s time for a change, it\'s time for a new attitude on a new kind of love!','A New Kind of Love',42798,2.2099,6.2,'7ZZsnBmY1UQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4457,_binary '\0','/4UnSMjU6OtcRxc8tniVV9oklC2N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057363',7.3,2747,'ja','にっぽん昆虫記','A woman, Tome, is born to a lower class family in Japan in 1918. The title refers to an insect, repeating its mistakes, as in an infinite circle. Imamura, with this metaphor, introduces the life of Tome, who keeps trying to change her poor life.','/tIY9Phiuk1rQOSpXLe4d4j0Msd0.jpg','1963-11-16',123,'Released','She lives by instinct with no sense of right or wrong.','The Insect Woman',42984,2.0445,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4458,_binary '\0','/rrl4ocI776vN5SmncsUXQ51lQYR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057372',6.6,19611,'en','The Nutty Professor','A timid, nearsighted chemistry teacher discovers a magical potion that can transform him into a suave and handsome Romeo. The Jekyll and Hyde game works well enough until the concoction starts to wear off at the most embarrassing times.','/a3lzU19j7WGfyXVDfPMdh8DAkru.jpg','1963-06-04',107,'Released','What does he become? What kind of monster?','The Nutty Professor',18331,4.8445,6.5,'1DUkGjWVOlc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4459,_binary '\0','/x9TJjcqBemsedoNregXr7ZkizdB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057379',5.5,2963,'en','The Old Dark House','An American car salesman in London becomes mixed up in a series of fatal occurrences at a secluded mansion.','/nJqVMBtYONl312UuZwORuK0PfR5.jpg','1963-10-30',86,'Released','READY! SET! LAUGH! Join the fun in a nut-house of terror!','The Old Dark House',29400,2.4512,5.9,'NBalKqUzHZ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4460,_binary '\0','/mmWrKwZ8bxX0cLGzshcNNFEkEAN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057380',6.1,2143,'de','Old Shatterhand','Renegades trying to get the army to abandon their fort get the Indians addicted to whiskey, then convince them to attack and drive out the soldiers.','/4SsCDjWXbCtlJynQ1XhoV1QxoNN.jpg','1964-04-30',122,'Released',NULL,'Old Shatterhand',9547,4.6294,6.2,'SC-juGxdrKQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4461,_binary '\0','/coGjjM9d7azWwIFGVJRpKIqDIr7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057393',6.7,3306,'en','PT 109','Dramatization of President John F. Kennedy\'s war time experiences during which he captained a PT boat, took it to battle and had it sunk by a Japanese destroyer. He and the survivors had to make their way to an island, find food and shelter and signal the Navy for rescue.','/61n1RcpXZbtYXWUxCjqutSFVEDX.jpg','1963-06-26',140,'Released','Most men would have given up...But not the crew of PT 109','PT 109',27858,1.7859,6.1,'keZM2Y_-VZs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4462,_binary '\0','/keL0VyHtFmEBXSqQm7BASm62kez.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057396',5.9,1383,'en','Palm Springs Weekend','Set in Palm Springs during a long, fun-filled weekend where several Los Angeles college students flock to spring break, centering on Jim who finds romance with Bunny, the daughter of Palm Springs harred, stressful police chief. Jim\'s bumbling roommate, Biff, tries to get Amanda, a tomboyish girl\'s attention with a so-called love gadget. Meanwhile, Gayle Lewis is a high school senior posing as a wealthy college girl who is pursued by Eric Dean, a wealthy and spoiled college prepie, while Gayle has eyes for a cowboy from Texas, named Stretch. Also Jim and Biff\'s basketball coach, Campbell, tries to romance Naomi, the owner of the motel where all of the gang is staying at, which is interfered by Naomi\'s young, trouble-making, brat son who\'s dubbed, Boom-Boom.','/v5lt8axlnmTD5lWdE2pGmbaRjD9.jpg','1963-11-05',100,'Released','IT\'S WHERE THE BOYS ARE AND THE GIRLS ARE...that swingin\' vacation weekend when American youth descends on America\'s swankiest playground!','Palm Springs Weekend',42985,1.6711,5,'tWB_tDhLLwU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4463,_binary '\0','/ytxlMOBQEn6eAqdFd4XyMbs8dQH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057401',6.7,3708,'en','Paranoiac','Eleven years ago, the wealthy Ashby family was shattered when Mr and Mrs Ashby died in an airplane crash and their grieving son Tony committed suicide. All who remains is cruel Simon, an alcoholic in desperate need of funds; his mentally fragile sister Eleanor; and his protective aunt Harriet. Simon is just weeks away from receiving his inheritance, but there\'s a hitch in his plans when the long-believed dead Tony suddenly arrives.','/gXD4mLMXR2nibJkELmB5afAI3vj.jpg','1963-01-07',80,'Released','Shocking! Horrifying! Macabre!','Paranoiac',42344,2.143,6.6,'8sGpT1t3cXo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4464,_binary '\0','/eVHH8peqVMN9VcEZvn9yTG6SDed.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057413',7,62406,'en','The Pink Panther','The trademark of The Phantom, a renowned jewel thief, is a glove left at the scene of the crime. Inspector Clouseau, an expert on The Phantom\'s exploits, feels sure that he knows where The Phantom will strike next and leaves Paris for the Tyrolean Alps, where the famous Lugashi jewel \'The Pink Panther\' is going to be. However, he does not know who The Phantom really is, or for that matter who anyone else really is...','/aCjJ0sKayks2uL7MJBzdp2i67NI.jpg','1963-12-18',115,'Released','You only live once… so see the Pink Panther twice!!!','The Pink Panther',936,9.8612,6.8,'-Dy-Gb3LaFE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4465,_binary '\0','/iy0eUwBRk1I7EUD1N9yjMryfr8G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057422',6.5,2379,'fr','Pouic-Pouic','Léonard Monestier owns a large fortune, alas his wife Cynthia made a bad investment in a worthless oil concession. Far from letting this get him down, Léonard decides to find a sucker to buy this concession from him. Right on cue appears Antoine Brévin, a befuddled billionaire who is very interested in Léonard\'s beautiful daughter Patricia and would do anything to win her hand...','/7715vX6RRrR6ArYFAYMYrkmAeY5.jpg','1963-11-20',86,'Released',NULL,'Squeak-squeak',36324,2.0831,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4466,_binary '\0','/81WwJb8meAD6Wu98uIrSjIyZxYc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057426',6.8,5926,'en','The Prize','A group of Nobel laureates descends on Stockholm to accept their awards. Among them is American novelist Andrew Craig, a former literary luminary now writing pulp detective stories to earn a living. Craig, who is infamous for his drinking and womanizing, formulates a wild theory that physics prize winner Dr. Max Stratman has been replaced by an impostor, embroiling Craig and his chaperone in a Cold War kidnapping plot.','/k5A9KlSQaCg5epjrMH5RFyYQoTs.jpg','1963-12-25',134,'Released','He ordered a martini... kissed a girl... and was plunged into a nightmare of danger!','The Prize',4025,2.7066,6.683,'ZhcKEekDUp8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4467,_binary '\0','/yhfHeIsR5Ki02b5SqBuLqAsLDCk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057427',7.6,27267,'en','Le Procès','Arrested for an unnamed crime, Josef K. is trapped in a surreal bureaucratic maze where justice is unknowable and guilt is assumed.','/4qDUe5HqB8pXNplSBlsoyVjNP3r.jpg','1962-08-25',119,'Released','The Most Remarkable Motion Picture Ever Made!','The Trial',3009,3.7767,7.392,'ae3-01zSQOs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4468,_binary '\0','/d7T4H4j68JOQEChO3CA9o2IeF38.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057443',6.9,6458,'it','La ragazza che sapeva troppo','A tourist witnesses a murder and finds herself caught up in a series of bloody killings.','/9vYcrXLAnD04FE3E4tGn8eDJeHG.jpg','1963-02-10',86,'Released','LOOK... and you cannot look away for everywhere you turn it\'s there... watching... waiting to strike!','The Girl Who Knew Too Much',28041,2.581,6.912,'YdD1JreD4H8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4469,_binary '\0','/y4DdIOaqH2PD9zpvx2IqzSvGiBw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057449',6.5,15400,'en','The Raven','A magician who has been turned into a raven turns to a former sorcerer for help.','/tt7m22ki1raa0NrvesawJgsQ4Jn.jpg','1963-01-25',86,'Released','The Macabre Masterpiece of Terror!','The Raven',29056,4.2418,6.3,'Evw20AXS3kg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4470,_binary '\0','/pRvZdvB0G4PwqQbdmBmDuX4bHIf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057463',6.5,2270,'en','The Running Man','An Englishman with a grudge against an insurance company for a disallowed claim fakes his own death and escapes to Spain, but is soon pursued by an insurance investigator.','/4tKUyNMhnhWeezI0AwLWc6tWyZG.jpg','1963-10-01',103,'Released','Time is Running Out for the Running Man...And His Woman!','The Running Man',144299,2.8144,6.673,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4471,_binary '\0','/2nqiZdWmVZ7jnDBtICF78mjMMJJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057465',6.6,3396,'en','The Sadist','Three people driving into Los Angeles for a Dodgers game have car trouble and pull off into an old wrecking yard where they are held at bay by a bloodthirsty psycho and his crazy girlfriend.','/3m1pUOGi568pXGNO3pQYi9ko8JR.jpg','1963-04-01',92,'Released','A human volcano of unpredictable terror!','The Sadist',29103,1.3244,6.4,'BMHeORo3mLw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4472,_binary '\0','/qKittEkEI5E7oxZW84DmU2piExN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057473',6,1285,'en','Savage Sam','Travis, Arliss, and Lisbeth are captured by Apaches while Old Yeller\'s son, Sam, tracks their trail.','/lWHdfGKfVzn7dBxKgvXHljxNKUw.jpg','1963-06-01',103,'Released','Two tough Texans take on the whole Apache nation!','Savage Sam',50033,2.4178,5.2,'vNqTfXeHsYY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4473,_binary '\0','/a5NNxs0HA6CEEtCNCUDvOZiQqIK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057490',7.7,16097,'en','The Servant','An indolent aristocrat gets more than he bargained for when he hires a competent but silently devious manservant.','/pRa4og93BeOoMCt6oWuPCwu5Coo.jpg','1963-11-14',116,'Released','A Terrifyingly Beautiful Motion Picture!','The Servant',42987,5.1703,7.6,'naaFmYU2_I8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4474,_binary '\0','/5JfXNdjitnpFoWxfARzD9IDYnyA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057495',7.3,14163,'en','Shock Corridor','With the help of his girlfriend Cathy and Dr. Fong, a psychiatrist, ambitious journalist Johnny Barrett poses as a madman in order to be admitted to a mental institution where a bloody murder has been committed.','/7jFI7GdduTss2SdgApcsiWtU5gA.jpg','1963-09-25',102,'Released','… opens the door to sights you\'ve never seen before!','Shock Corridor',25504,2.5275,6.9,'5vn4WcUkHoA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4475,_binary '\0','/kspNDhfl9GzoAAEzSXYb1SbYWXN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057503',7.3,2647,'ja','新・座頭市物語','Wishing to find peace, Zatoichi travels to his old village but only finds trouble when he ends up in a love triangle and finds old scores have followed him home.','/tP8r41Raxj0JjaUGMJ6P09DNWSH.jpg','1963-03-15',91,'Released',NULL,'New Tale of Zatoichi',18510,1.8071,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4476,_binary '\0','/74BtgomBYNgHpUjATYNPe4QNa50.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057507',1.9,5001,'en','The Skydivers','A woman seeks revenge on her former lover, who owns a skydiving business.','/5uSZyEQeCMGO8GKfYlLtqsx2Rq1.jpg','1963-11-13',73,'Released','Thrill jumping guys... Thrill seeking girls... Daring death with every leap!','The Skydivers',31118,0.8755,2.6,'EONKpfxmKUM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4477,_binary '\0','/rWq2eQUnFAKPQyIZSQrpQUnyPN9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057517',6.7,2203,'en','Soldier in the Rain','Maxwell Slaughter is a kind, heavyset guy who has reached the rank of master sergeant in the army. Admired by handsome young Sgt. Eustis Clay, Slaughter forms a close bond with his peer. Clay hopes to convince Slaughter to join him in a business venture outside of the service, but, in the meantime, he introduces the older officer to the beautiful young Bobby Jo Pepperdine, inadvertently creating trouble for both men.','/vmJhxt93SGZrrLiaXU9C8Jtsubf.jpg','1963-11-27',88,'Released','Two highly irregulars, in the very regular army! And this is the story of the million-dollar schemes they dared, the fabulous dolls and dates, they shared.','Soldier in the Rain',53336,2.3753,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4478,_binary '\0','/bNtkulVOqiyaUGLGbgZU0rb1QoA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057518',6.1,3431,'en','Son of Flubber','Beleaguered professor Ned Brainard has already run into a pile of misfortunes with his discovery of the super-elastic substance \"Flubber.\" Now he hopes to have better luck with a gravity-busting derivative he\'s dubbed \"Flubbergas.\" Ned\'s experiments, constantly hampered by government obstruction, earn the consternation of his wife, Betsy. But a game-winning modification to a football uniform may help Ned make the case for his fantastic new invention.','/nP2V3il0SCAwu12SypdcTQggUBA.jpg','1963-01-16',100,'Released','The Professor\'s \"Off\" and Flying... and FUN SCORES A NEW HIGH!','Son of Flubber',19762,2.8329,6.083,'BJNDjrX0GoQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4479,_binary '\0','/AhPzIOJpvsaPuYsWXSPFLYGnHmZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057522',6.2,1788,'it','Lo spettro','A woman and her lover murder her husband, a doctor. Soon, however, strange things start happening, and they wonder if they really killed him, or if he is coming back from the dead to haunt them.','/cJUiTm53JRXZsmDqtcQDPYMnkxk.jpg','1963-03-30',97,'Released','Horror... sharp as a razor\'s edge!','The Ghost',28533,1.2733,6.3,'I6DTS07tgQ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4480,_binary '\0','/b5ZXa8WrSwAfZFeLGg5s6neu5jF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057523',7,3586,'en','Spencer\'s Mountain','Clay Spencer and his wife, Olivia, live in a small town deep in the mountains. When Clay isn\'t busy drinking with his buddies or railing against the town minister, he\'s building the house he\'s always promised Olivia. He is overjoyed when he learns his eldest son will be the first Spencer to attend college, if he can resist the charms of a pretty local girl and rustle up the money for tuition.','/g7vN9ZduHCI5mmFs3jfI0vJxxm3.jpg','1963-05-16',118,'Released','Clayboy\'s schoolteacher impresses upon Clayboy the following phrase, \"The world steps aside to let a man pass, if he knows where he is going\"','Spencer\'s Mountain',44916,2.4871,6.8,'SQNm90_QAaQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4481,_binary '\0','/3tmi1xq0lX4yie148eHeUIr9IaF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057530',6.9,1428,'en','A Stitch in Time','An accident in the butchers shop leads Norman Pitkin and Mr Grimsdale to the hospital where, after causing the normal amount of chaos, Pitkin finds Lindy, a little girl who hasn\'t spoken or smiled since her parents were killed in an aeroplane accident. Pitkin decides to help.','/gaXRPV7jpsvBvVe2wD0y2ngG3Dg.jpg','1963-12-01',89,'Released',NULL,'A Stitch in Time',38377,1.8998,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4482,_binary '\0','/yD1631ZvQI5D8DlXDM9Cf0uVRhJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057541',6.1,2112,'en','Summer Holiday','1960s musical showcasing Cliff Richard. Four bus mechanics working for London Transport strike up a deal with the company: they do up a one of the company\'s legendary red double decker buses and take it to southern Europe as a mobile hotel. If it succeeds, they will be put in charge of a whole fleet. While on the road in France they pick up three young British ladies whose car breaks down and offer to take them to their next singing job in Athens. They also pick up a stowaway, who hides the fact that she\'s a famous American pop star on the run, chased by the media and her parents.','/b4UwmZrb1ReyTXoAFRXhdgv05Hd.jpg','1963-02-18',108,'Released','From the First Kiss to the Last Blush It\'s the Craziest Riot On Wheels!','Summer Holiday',43532,1.5031,5.9,'BcGoU9K9caE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4483,_binary '\0','/zxKYuwNdh7Xcr4w7tbjWAcGuOYc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057542',6.9,3016,'en','Summer Magic','Mother Carey, a Bostonian widow, and her three children move to Maine. Postmaster Osh Popham helps them move into a run-down old house and fixes it up for them. It\'s not entirely uninhabited, though; the owner, Mr. Hamilton, is a mysterious character away in Europe, but Osh assures them he won\'t mind their living there, since he won\'t be coming home for a long time yet. The children and a cousin who comes to live with them have various adventures before an unexpected visitor shows up','/12GBF0hH9DWSaTBPZpCCKq4DiA6.jpg','1963-07-07',110,'Released','THAT WONDERFUL HAYLEY! a-flitterin\' in a romantic whirl of her own!','Summer Magic',37204,2.1315,6.6,'yr80_uYFhDQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4484,_binary '\0','/aWG0sQnVVKFsdvmtBozHyyW6HTB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057543',6.7,3757,'en','Sunday in New York','An innocent upstarter visits her airline pilot brother and meets a stranger she tries to seduce.','/ybvLO9e7JMrdnZ8XOwZnRrs92I8.jpg','1963-11-13',105,'Released','Dedicated to the proposition that every pretty girl receives sooner or later!','Sunday in New York',61892,2.7227,6.776,'tjxBqKEZWlo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4485,_binary '\0','/uMe6McFXAPEhkasGVlaLTOuhfnl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057546',7.1,115754,'en','The Sword in the Stone','Wart is a young boy who aspires to be a knight\'s squire. On a hunting trip he falls in on Merlin, a powerful but amnesiac wizard who has plans for him beyond mere squiredom. He starts by trying to give him an education, believing that once one has an education, one can go anywhere. Needless to say, it doesn\'t quite work out that way.','/7lyeeuhGAJSNXYEW34S8mJ1bwI8.jpg','1963-12-25',79,'Released','Tired of living in a Medieval mess... Merlin uses all his magic powers to change a scrawny little boy into a legendary hero!','The Sword in the Stone',9078,10.3264,7.227,'ThOtoGV6ylU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4486,_binary '\0','/wTr8jNxwvjjjQS5DVwmcRZKQgEU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057556',6.2,1638,'en','Take Her, She\'s Mine','After reluctantly packing up his daughter, Mollie, and sending her away to study art at a Paris college, Frank Michaelson gives new meaning to the term \"concerned parent.\" Reading Mollie\'s letters describing her counter-culture experiences and beatnik friends, Frank eventually grows so paranoid that he boards a plane to Paris to see firsthand the kind of lessons his daughter is learning with her new artist amour.','/dwa3iEhAUM7dSmljfAukPDjxpXn.jpg','1963-11-13',98,'Released','There comes a time in every father\'s life when his baby becomes a \'babe\'... THAT\'S WHEN THE FUN BEGINS!','Take Her, She\'s Mine',45241,3.0532,5.5,'9_ygxR8SIxE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4487,_binary '\0','/i1NjlccZcuqbgDCS92RHdhEnx59.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057565',8.4,73556,'ja','天国と地獄','A Yokohama shoe executive faces a wrenching choice when kidnappers mistakenly seize his chauffeur’s son but demand the ransom anyway.','/tgNjemQPG96uIezpiUiXFcer5ga.jpg','1963-03-01',142,'Released','Stark, intense drama almost beyond belief!','High and Low',12493,11.2196,8.4,'ELsgPvgDBoY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4488,_binary '\0','/yZ0dExpNW44xrpOG6qHwLV8pq3P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057569',5.1,9535,'en','The Terror','Lt. Andre Duvalier awakens on a beach to the sight of a strange woman who leads him to the gothic, towering castle that serves as home to an eerie baron.','/7ls64LquXB0nc5MkJFWyWaXlBLj.jpg','1963-06-17',79,'Released','A new classic of horror comes to the screen!','The Terror',31655,3.3463,5.1,'N2YRo6dskac','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4489,_binary '\0','/fuVL383GZ1uA8Jltt5ckMHbZU9q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057578',7.5,7738,'en','This Sporting Life','In early 1960s Northern England, Frank Machin is mean, tough and ambitious enough to become an immediate star in the rugby league team run by local employer Weaver.','/lOxaN1ziYdOJgAQouWO1pGEBU7H.jpg','1963-02-07',134,'Released','He only believed in strength - love was a word he hadn\'t the power to say.','This Sporting Life',18774,2.6389,7,'9RNWy5VpL8Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4490,_binary '\0','/yGeqzvGFKuV5FncnY3e86FTfrRh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057579',7.2,2900,'en','The Three Lives of Thomasina','Thomasina the cat brings a family together through her mysterious death and reappearance.','/7yptSpeO8RYS8vHP2k5zttJxQpV.jpg','1963-12-11',97,'Released','Three Human Lives Wonderfully Bewitched by a Enchanted Cat!','The Three Lives of Thomasina',15081,2.3814,6.8,'Kw6PzsOlfFo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4491,_binary '\0','/Aaj718ddBiRCvA0biKrBG0YOLTf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057581',6.9,6483,'en','The Thrill of It All','A housewife\'s sudden rise to fame as a soap spokesperson leads to chaos in her home life.','/eza4PZbDuLcQHEefdN9lQ4vzLw5.jpg','1963-07-17',108,'Released','She\'s hoping he\'s ready. He\'s wishing she\'s willing.','The Thrill of It All',22233,3.5168,7.1,'ykOT2O5IcQE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4492,_binary '\0','/cbHhPCdSdoMpjaLazz7gDS2WYpz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057590',6.3,15516,'en','Tom Jones','Tom loves Sophie and Sophie loves Tom. But Tom and Sophie are of differering classes. Can they find a way through the mayhem to be true to love?','/yKuZKLMhe74PJzaxYLh2s8h4P2P.jpg','1963-08-24',128,'Released','Tom Jones!... loves and loves and loves and loves...','Tom Jones',5769,3.508,5.9,'C0DDuzX2bjM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4493,_binary '\0','/2pnfUSFqUPn9F4mzl1MLKrlnNbU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057591',7.7,7244,'fr','Les Tontons flingueurs','An aging gangster, Fernand Naudin is hoping for a quiet retirement when he suddenly inherits a fortune from an old friend, a former gangster supremo known as the Mexican. If he is ambivalent about his new found wealth, Fernand is positively nonplussed to discover that he has also inherited his benefactor’s daughter, Patricia. Unfortunately, not only does Fernand have to put up with the thoroughly modern Patricia and her nauseating boyfriend, but he also had to contend with the Mexican’s trigger-happy former employees, who are determined to make a claim.','/1uYCIsMpX7FtWu2xO1YMIAQYvLR.jpg','1963-11-27',111,'Released',NULL,'Crooks in Clover',25253,2.3248,7.724,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4494,_binary '\0','/u0WvmWYfNiFePdsYWyUVuWEod4I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057598',6.7,1738,'en','Toys in the Attic','Julian Berniers returns from Illinois with his young bride Lily Prine to the family in New Orleans. His spinster sisters Carrie and Anna welcome the couple, who arrive with expensive gifts. The sisters hope Julian will help with their expenses, and he tells them that while his profitable factory went out of business, he did manage to save money. It turns out that Julian pulled off a real estate scam and took off with the money. Carrie is obsessed with her brother. Her jealousy of Lily pushes her to discover the shady land deal for herself and she does everything she can to wreck their marriage.','/aOHcs1gn6DBoz2QIEb1uVBFEMdS.jpg','1963-07-31',90,'Released','Toys in the Attic Plays With Fire!','Toys in the Attic',108869,2.3965,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4495,_binary '\0','/vELycsAjczFbhneSJG1V6gvTz0D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057603',7,16218,'it','I tre volti della paura','Three tales of supernatural horror include a woman plagued by threatening phone calls, a family targeted by vampiric monsters, and a deceased medium who wreaks havoc upon the living.','/vrMcn6CKrLjWAtHHMFL7cj8A5au.jpg','1963-08-17',95,'Released','A story that goes beyond the boundaries of the Supernatural to the half-world of the living dead...Where a woman\'s soul inhabits a fly\'s body...Where vampires suck only the blood of those they love dearest.','Black Sabbath',28043,4.0706,7.2,'t7MyJMlOpdE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4496,_binary '\0','/ub8LX2xAHmL7EQu7i03sHkaHIZo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057608',6.6,4052,'en','Twice-Told Tales','3 horror stories based on the writings of Nathaniel Hawthorne. In the 1st story titled \"Dr. Heidegger\'s Experiment\", Heidegger attempts to restore the youth of three elderly friends. In \"Rappaccini\'s Daughter\", a demented father is inoculating his daughter with poison so she may never leave her garden of poisonous plants. In the final story \"The House of the Seven Gables\", The Pyncheon family suffers from a hundred year old curse and while in the midst of arguing over inheritance, a stranger arrives.','/aLhx6RsJOYocRR6kJE1094utwWS.jpg','1963-09-01',120,'Released','A trio of terror!','Twice-Told Tales',47553,2.3869,6.236,'Fh3hsm0un_E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4497,_binary '\0','/mNpd8763X64KKGXnrdnBHdON9np.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057611',7.7,22888,'sv','Tystnaden','Traveling through an unnamed European country on the brink of war, sickly, intellectual Ester, her sister Anna and Anna\'s young son, Johan, check into a near-empty hotel. A basic inability to communicate among the three seems only to worsen during their stay. Anna provokes her sister by enjoying a dalliance with a local man, while the boy, left to himself, has a series of enigmatic encounters that heighten the growing air of isolation.','/2KkHAsBVZVoMO1Zauvm5rFSxp09.jpg','1963-09-23',95,'Released','BERGMAN at his most POWERFUL! SHOCKING! BOLD!','The Silence',11506,2.659,7.5,'xddkAomes8k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4498,_binary '\0','/bYnT1yAIDHI385aTilKuFED6455.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057622',6,2280,'en','Under the Yum Yum Tree','A love-struck landlord tries to convince a pretty tenant to dump her fiancé and give him a chance.','/20oQRYfHaSfGGCOKBEh1M1CpgCc.jpg','1963-10-23',110,'Released','Yum\'s the word... Welcome to the Sin-Bin!','Under the Yum Yum Tree',43750,2.2931,6.1,'IXJrtNUgNkA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4499,_binary '\0','/f2iEf5G2CGVQ8Qg6gfZlRz85080.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057623',6.4,1216,'en','Unearthly Stranger','A series of scientists working on a new techology to facilitate man\'s conquest of space are killed in mysterious circumstances. Suspicion falls on the wife of another scientist on the project, who may not be what she seems.','/AnhW4rBAvPnEb4CDaWOf5zzmVeK.jpg','1963-09-12',78,'Released','Terrifying - Weird… Macabre! Unseen things out of Time and Space!','Unearthly Stranger',136467,1.0089,6,'CRTWxzknAIs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4500,_binary '\0','/cNeL0Jk2HamULkwVhlsHkV5xFOB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057634',6.3,4641,'en','The V.I.P.s','Wealthy passengers fogged in at London\'s Heathrow Airport fight to survive a variety of personal trials.','/rlDromcNudpKl69gzqnBNotu9lo.jpg','1963-09-01',119,'Released','THIS IS THE STORY OF ONE DRAMATIC, DEVASTATING NIGHT ...in the glamorous private world of the very rich, the very famous, the very beautiful, the very powerful ...the \"Very Important Persons\"!','The V.I.P.s',37222,2.775,6.174,'dC3JZoYhGmA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4501,_binary '\0','/w6uWNB1xOGSzULlGKemnFOKJcpu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057637',7.4,2521,'ru','Вечера на хуторе близ Диканьки','The story that happened on the farm near Dikanka on the night before Christmas, when the village blacksmith Vakula, having saddled the Devil, brought to his beloved Oksana, the daughter of a rich Cossack Chub, queen\'s \"сherevichki\"(the little women shoes) from the capital — St. Petersburg.','/yBzyHEDJyA0BwTUd2kSo8TnNLIt.jpg','1961-12-15',66,'Released',NULL,'Evenings on a Farm near Dikanka',83429,1.7735,7.193,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4502,_binary '\0','/2Pr7CpHan1PUvXafEjczAimZqP2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057643',7.9,8303,'es','El verdugo','An undertaker gets married to an old executioner\'s daughter and, although he doesn\'t like it, must continue the profession of his father-in-law after his retirement.','/z7U7XZWeRmsxqMtVahHHYQYIxlY.jpg','1963-08-31',91,'Released','An original and brilliant movie','The Executioner',4498,2.2448,7.6,'lUwO3YDulg0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4503,_binary '\0','/ipU5cAhw4NAOmxvG7dfS4m0Spba.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057646',5.8,1451,'it','La vergine di Norimberga','Women are being tortured to death with various devices in the dungeon of an old castle by a mysterious, hooded figure who may be a notorious executioner from medieval times.','/53mIigTNgfEsVbVirNjarRUyMmL.jpg','1963-08-15',85,'Released','Women\'s virtues made him a killer!','Horror Castle',74215,1.9206,5.7,'S93wv8Wyzmo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4504,_binary '\0','/dYCmzdD0INOsNRoJOjqCLsirl4M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057652',6.9,1990,'en','The Victors','Intercutting dramatic vignettes with newsreel footage, the story follows the characters from an infantry squad as they make their way from Sicily to Germany during the end of World War II.','/bVzJNdrhSjEzeyLle0rbJaH7Xon.jpg','1963-11-22',175,'Released','A Shattering Entertainment Experience!','The Victors',3012,1.695,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4505,_binary '\0','/3KBuZG9keFgKAbIRnMMn4MoOzo7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057654',7.5,3465,'pt','Vidas Secas','A destitute family tries to escape the drought in the backlands of northeastern Brazil. Fabiano (Átila Iório), Sinhá Vitória (Maria Ribeiro), their two children and their dog Baleia wander aimlessly and almost hopelessly through the remote interior, surviving the forces of nature and the cruelty of men. An adaptation of the work by Graciliano Ramos.','/bBb4GiCZul2W6hhV8sbbnBnlhuE.jpg','1963-08-22',100,'Released',NULL,'Barren Lives',836,1.3328,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4506,_binary '\0','/nx6Rgq8BQrrBEw8ElVQnHqpiyq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057681',6.5,1711,'en','The Wheeler Dealers','Henry J. Tyroon leaves Texas, where his oil wells are drying up, and arrives in New York with a lot of oil money to play with in the stock market. He meets stock analyst Molly Thatcher, who tries to ignore the lavish attention he spends on her but, in the end, she falls for his charm.','/mKQVrAV2hbdhcJUTq4nyFfIXxJO.jpg','1963-11-14',107,'Released','He really wasn\'t out to make $1,000,000. He already had that!','The Wheeler Dealers',42988,2.2069,6.3,'cfcQ_s2rCeQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4507,_binary '\0','/a0JEoxbjkHev5QgdqcmEfIwu68x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057683',6.7,3046,'en','Who\'s Minding the Store?','Norman Phiffer, a proud man in a humble life, doesn\'t know that his girlfriend, Barbara, is heir to the Tuttle Department Store dynasty. Mrs. Tuttle, Barbara\'s mother, is determined to split the two lovers, and hires Norman in an attempt to humiliate him enough that Barbara leaves him. Will she ruin their love, or will he ruin her store?','/9YAdqb4ZJEdmNRFOMV2Gt50DDkn.jpg','1963-11-28',90,'Released','Look who\'s minding the store!','Who\'s Minding the Store?',42305,2.733,6.8,'L_UNP138sl4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4508,_binary '\0','/1f9kaPcMAHGZmy3F81Z0d041UXX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057687',6.8,5215,'de','Winnetou 1. Teil','The construction of the Great Western Railroad creates heavy conflict between the railway company and neighboring Indian tribes. Worse, criminal gang leader Santer sets his eyes on a gold mine located on holy Indian land and influences the construction supervisor to re-rout the planned railroad straight through Apache land. Old Shatterhand, who works as a measurement technician, discovers the evil plan and searches contact with the Apaches in an effort to avert war.','/hHS5Bf4zliMzYj9WqTdr1exZHUS.jpg','1963-12-11',101,'Released','An Adventure as Vast as the Wild Land That Spawned It!','Apache Gold',3685,6.7673,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4509,_binary '\0','/34Z8NJEG8KtRiGu8PG7I9Plza2S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057693',6.6,9277,'en','X: The Man with the X-Ray Eyes','A doctor uses special eye drops to give himself x-ray vision, but the new power has disastrous consequences.','/7YMk1mtTsGYPBC8zj2Kd3K6h3g3.jpg','1963-07-13',79,'Released','Suddenly he could see through clothes, flesh… and walls!','X: The Man with the X-Ray Eyes',32569,3.7415,6.6,'MJfFh1mOyUI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4510,_binary '\0','/eVQ3nRByV4YIg9jUGEqZrCDm8wN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057694',7.7,3839,'ru','Я шагаю по Москве','On a stopover in Moscow, a young writer Volodya makes friends with Kolya, who is returning home from a hard night shift. Just as Kolya is about to take a rest, he is met by his old friend Sasha, who wants help getting a deferral from military service so that he can get married.','/pOEPnNDgxLAsA64iKSuEhQVt5aC.jpg','1964-04-11',78,'Released',NULL,'Walking the Streets of Moscow',27862,1.9724,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4511,_binary '\0','/dh6bH6aEs0v1XyTRjPtGc5wtO4P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057695',8.4,1269,'ka','მე, ბებია, ილიკო და ილარიონი','The residents of a Georgian village bungle their way through war, peace, life and death.','/gSOcksuHjddOOj7taME2YpwxGWv.jpg','1962-12-01',90,'Released',NULL,'Me, Grandma, Iliko and Ilarion',87248,1.0662,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4512,_binary '\0','/9BeluCE1MXfGlo8D4PKSv9fp4RV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057697',7.3,4305,'ja','野獣の青春','When a mysterious stranger muscles into two rival yakuza gangs, Tokyo\'s underworld explodes with violence.','/dWHa0JT3Syj6WbiwpXBbZMHoKEv.jpg','1963-04-21',92,'Released',NULL,'Youth of the Beast',37939,1.7677,6.943,'RY-cennt8CQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4513,_binary '\0','/sd7UGHu2DasJz1mKVI0YTpQK1qo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057710',7.3,3216,'ja','雪之丞変化','In Edo Japan, a kabuki actor seeks revenge against the three men who drove his parents to their deaths years ago.','/cNjcjBVbXoUQGsJqCkOJvog88kD.jpg','1963-01-13',114,'Released',NULL,'An Actor\'s Revenge',27197,1.994,6.6,'ZpWmkGdfgWA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4514,_binary '\0','/yiftev5lvurePC2YDJe10qQWtBj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057714',7.2,2182,'ja','座頭市喧嘩旅','Zatoichi is sworn to protect the life of a young girl and without any real allies finds himself in the middle of a bloody turf war.','/NYY2Udt5eZtvy4glkSQPOypTcT.jpg','1963-11-30',87,'Released',NULL,'Zatoichi on the Road',18624,1.6504,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4515,_binary '\0','/m0kQob7HPO1R1xveWLCwPlDK3vo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057715',7.2,2251,'ja','座頭市兇状旅','After arriving in the town of Shimonita, Ichi finds that a price has been put on his head by a local yakuza boss. He\'s drawn into a trap, but after hearing of the slaying of a former love, Ichi furiously fights his way through the entire clan to face the killer, a hired ronin.','/giR1dC7hRfpps1M2TSGs1eR1F1Z.jpg','1963-08-09',86,'Released',NULL,'Zatoichi the Fugitive',18511,1.5564,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4516,_binary '\0','/r6zRj0RdVhgtNWpbm0T5cfcN3xA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057809',7.4,5446,'en','36 Hours','Germans kidnap an American major and try to convince him that World War II is over, so that they can get details about the Allied invasion of Europe out of him.','/JrkndJe6vmkrMorF7l3TjuTvB9.jpg','1964-11-26',115,'Released','\"Give Me Any American for 36 Hours And I\'ll Give You Back a Traitor\"','36 Hours',37684,2.19,7.1,'dGXXSkMCp0k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4517,_binary '\0','/4FQlTt2IbgbZQ6F8SNXS43qD2QC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057811',6.4,5140,'en','633 Squadron','When Norwegian resistance leader Lieutenant Erik Bergman reports the location of a German V-2 rocket fuel plant, the Royal Air Force\'s 633 Squadron is assigned the mission to destroy it. The plant is in a seemingly-impregnable location beneath an overhanging cliff at the end of a long, narrow fjord lined with anti-aircraft guns. The only way to destroy the plant is by collapsing the cliff on top of it.','/aqeM21nsUw2zRzEQJXY1xSh5jYR.jpg','1964-04-06',102,'Released','The greatest adventure since men fought on earth - or flew over it!','633 Squadron',15925,2.8153,6.2,'I6_u9kVjUNQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4518,_binary '\0','/1CYIvjmkhVYJblOYPucgfF9EXQQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057812',7.1,6001,'en','7 Faces of Dr. Lao','An old Chinese man rides into the town of Abalone, Arizona and changes it forever, as the citizens see themselves reflected in the mirror of Lao\'s mysterious circus of mythical beasts.','/dwUTdtGUDmCb3Tiz6iTzBuONGTQ.jpg','1964-03-18',100,'Released','Bolt the doors! Lock the windows! Dr. Lao\'s coming to town!','7 Faces of Dr. Lao',14241,2.8118,6.921,'XUej2Wcqn4o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4519,_binary '\0','/5EPdCbeAk5L4CJ5TzAZYdo0lR6O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057813',6.4,1341,'en','The 7th Dawn','Political and personal intrigues surround a group of characters in Malaya, after the close of the Second World War.','/djRhlLuZ4greH1wkrgttGiUQiyv.jpg','1964-09-02',123,'Released','A STRANGE LAND SLEEPS LIKE A BEAUTIFUL WOMAN - SO STILL...SO MYSTERIOUS...SO UNTOUCHED- UNTIL THE FIRST LIGHT OF DAWN AWAKENS THE PASSIONS OF MEN AND THE FURIES OF WAR!','The 7th Dawn',85763,2.1867,6.5,'1S-neev6SsI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4520,_binary '\0','/ygpyhavKrCoCSvvXPVWm9cP8wI9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057829',7.6,2023,'ja','赤い殺意','The neglected common-law wife of a Japanese librarian is repeatedly harassed by a young man with a heart condition who seduces her with the prospect of a better life.','/2IKiXnPnOXUmYOsuhArqldszYA.jpg','1964-06-28',150,'Released',NULL,'Intentions of Murder',49571,1.5539,7,'AZxMBt5r7tY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4521,_binary '\0','/fdKE05kO9lch613DR2rfIqbv7dN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057831',7.6,25883,'el','Αλέξης Ζορμπάς','An uptight English writer traveling to Crete on a matter of business finds his life changed forever when he meets the gregarious Alexis Zorba.','/jAYOY38TRDprIgu7vgES0FFJJSl.jpg','1964-12-14',142,'Released','Life. Lust. Love. Zorba.','Zorba the Greek',10604,4.0242,7.5,'8nwCqdA5HdI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4522,_binary '\0','/fO3x6euB6hWmGTYfxkqbnD7s7Sw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057840',7.3,6306,'en','The Americanization of Emily','American sailor Charlie Madison falls for a pretty Englishwoman while trying to avoid a senseless and dangerous D-Day mission concocted by a deranged admiral.','/zA9254usF2X0m0P5CeEXft7uzSe.jpg','1964-10-27',115,'Released','Why did Emily call Charlie the most immoral man she\'d ever met?','The Americanization of Emily',42791,2.7449,6.7,'c9IYZx3GjBU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4523,_binary '\0','/wLDtXgRy0e9oU000YnjgG1V8jHj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057842',7.6,3416,'fr','Les Amitiés particulières','A tale of the tender relationship between a twelve-year-old boy and the fourteen-year-old upperclassman who is the object of his desire, all set within the rigid atmosphere of a Jesuit-run school.','/c46p1ZHudea0jJ0Fl1BlsUKbME4.jpg','1964-09-04',96,'Released','What Was Their Guilt?','This Special Friendship',66956,2.6414,7.802,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4524,_binary '\0','/vp4vAcBbIg9ftcz52mWMGWnFSMY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057846',6.7,3323,'fr','Angélique, marquise des anges','In 17th-century France, beautiful country maiden Angélique marries wealthy neighbor Jeoffray de Peyrac out of convenience, but eventually, she falls in love with him. So when Jeoffray is arrested and then vanishes, she bravely sets out to find him. This is the first of many dramas based on Anne and Serge Golon\'s novels about strong-willed Angélique and her adventures during the reign of Louis XIV, the Sun King.','/lBPpq9f5FNa1fgbcguVh9cOzfg0.jpg','1964-12-08',117,'Released','Fiction\'s most tantalizing heroine... half-angel, half-devil, wholly woman!','Angelique',44450,4.264,6.675,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4525,_binary '\0','/lxnG4nMhVbZnQ4utkjuUsARPUlq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057851',6.4,3619,'en','Apache Rifles','A young cavalry officer is assigned the job of bringing in a band of Apaches who have been terrorizing the countryside.','/3rm0KEElXEWxFZpsyjgzTTaLEag.jpg','1964-11-26',92,'Released','The Cry Was Revenge - And One Man Vowed to Stop the Bloodshed of Two Warring Nations!','Apache Rifles',155685,2.0853,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4526,_binary '\0','/gIB9dwcZsTgU741vfzhpvZm4wkQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057859',3.1,3128,'en','Monstrosity','A rich but unscrupulous old woman plots with a scientist to have her brain implanted in the skull of a sexy young woman.','/fXRtuZOLvOSgtO7qMEEC8xluavm.jpg','1963-09-01',65,'Released','WANTED: Youth and Beauty. Will Pay Millions. Only Beautiful and Shapely Girls Need Apply. No References Required. Appointments After Dark Only.','Monstrosity',37464,0.9267,3.5,'A2GeonvTlK8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4527,_binary '\0','/kKsy8sCjfOtfHPBT2i8z13bIRij.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057869',7.6,29251,'fr','Bande à part','Cinephile slackers Franz and Arthur spend their days mimicking the antiheroes of Hollywood noirs and Westerns while pursuing the lovely Odile. The misfit trio upends convention at every turn, be it through choreographed dances in cafés or frolicsome romps through the Louvre. Eventually, their romantic view of outlaws pushes them to plan their own heist, but their inexperience may send them out in a blaze of glory -- which could be just what they want.','/9oqyj79xmcypxLajJdefOtrYx64.jpg','1964-08-05',97,'Released','A Who-Dunit, Who\'s Got-It, Where-Is-It-Now Wild One From That \"Breathless\" director Jean-Luc Godard!','Band of Outsiders',8073,3.7298,7.5,'TM0lC2QCiSU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4528,_binary '\0','/k31CzSjvmWXz6QDYhSK3KRmMy1s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057870',6.8,2174,'fr','Les Barbouzes','A cold-war spy parody. After the death of an armaments manufacturer, an international group of spies is drawn into a high-stakes battle of wits to obtain the valuable military patents which have been inherited by the lovely widow.','/mwePSc9Yjbg6tJPjspt99hHoMGf.jpg','1964-12-10',108,'Released','RUN...love takes you where the spies are...PURSUE...women who are curved like weapons...Hide...with the one you seek...and the sparks fly upward...','The Great Spy Chase',31270,3.4279,6.9,'sZeCb0EOebg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4529,_binary '\0','/bYwrsPgIloJsqD6nWfLycAp7tn6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057877',7.7,17250,'en','Becket','Thomas Becket, Henry II\'s longtime advisor, finds his friendship with the debauched king corroding when he is unwillingly appointed as Archbishop of Canterbury in an attempt to gain absolute loyalty from the Church.','/swWmxVbq0pXv4wwsc2O803PiXR7.jpg','1964-03-11',148,'Released','An age of rampant lusts, abandon, runaway passions. An age brought bristling to life by two of the most exciting stars of our time!','Becket',15421,3.7603,7.2,'YGN42AaT3MA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4530,_binary '\0','/AnyLcUKmEQX1qJpPKuTvzVoKv4c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057878',6.7,2724,'en','Bedtime Story','Benson is a Casanova who tricks women into having sex with him before leaving them. He is content with this game until he meets Jamison, a real operator who poses as an exiled prince and not only gets women to share his bed but also to give him money to help him fund his supposed counter-revolution.','/4oN375vg2eJSHZzf9kztiwnu3jP.jpg','1964-06-10',99,'Released','The Sin-tillating Capers of Two Cunning Con Men who Fleeced the Sexiest Chicks on the Riviera...until each decided to become king of the mountain !','Bedtime Story',40618,2.4334,6.3,'Vczsn3JYPlU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4531,_binary '\0','/A6U1uZAObADjvezj92dk23z9FQj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057879',6.7,2492,'en','Behold a Pale Horse','Manuel Artiguez, a famous bandit during the Spanish civil war, has lived in French exile for 20 years. When his mother is dying he considers visiting her secretly in his Spanish home town. But his biggest enemy, the Spanish police officer Vinolas, prepared a trap at the hospital as a chance to finally catch Artiguez.','/uMbvDdf3iiGhoWT9TNF53sMwjve.jpg','1964-08-14',118,'Released','Of suspense, pursuit and courage...','Behold a Pale Horse',166607,2.686,6,'7I-kUhoGdUE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4532,_binary '\0','/17lIF5K26H1IzfgJxFY3dImtfTd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057883',7.6,4318,'en','The Best Man','The other party is in disarray. Five men vie for the party nomination for president. No one has a majority as the first ballot closes and the front-runners begin to decide how badly they want the job.','/k0P6pKJLUbdG4og9Kk3JNWeTtE1.jpg','1964-04-05',102,'Released','Does The Best Man Always Get To The White House?','The Best Man',37315,2.4264,7.3,'MjUbfK1jvTY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4533,_binary '\0','/a2TWtQ95MmgPUruFkY0xpb7bHfc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057887',5.5,1971,'en','Bikini Beach','A millionaire sets out to prove his theory that his pet chimpanzee is as intelligent as the teenagers who hang out on the local beach, where he is intending to build a retirement home.','/oGlBaAR2FZbmOaAuZ7cznVkKDGh.jpg','1964-07-22',99,'Released','It\'s where every torso is more so, and bare-as-you-dare is the rule!','Bikini Beach',39113,1.8848,5.6,'Ezlp6c6LDJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4534,_binary '\0','/1F53Pu8pVBHjBrcosYjF7G5RmEY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057905',6.4,1250,'en','Bullet for a Badman','Former Texas Rangers Sam Ward and Logan Keliher become enemies when Sam turns bank robber and Logan marries Sam\'s ex-wife.','/8awyIvj4U8Vw29uubOrwKZwLsWN.jpg','1964-09-01',80,'Released',NULL,'Bullet for a Badman',128437,2.5288,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4535,_binary '\0','/4KLUteNCiJR3Yq3uh4Ej7DGTLWP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057916',6.6,1897,'en','Carol for Another Christmas','Wealthy industrialist and fierce isolationist Daniel Grudge, long embittered by the loss of his son in World War II, is visited by three ghosts on Christmas Eve who lead him to reconsider his attitude toward his fellow man.','/v8WK3fmkDDZf5lNLe9ulXfih3v1.jpg','1964-12-28',84,'Released','Where the future meets the past... and our world collides.','Carol for Another Christmas',86778,1.9224,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4536,_binary '\0','/7nXqmjreUX9gO2P7OFBLfjf2pw2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057917',6.5,2747,'en','The Carpetbaggers','Jonas Cord is a disagreeable young tycoon who\'s building planes, directing films, and catting around on the corporate make in 1930s Hollywood.','/rjDleWaF5dUMV2FiBlMnH5QvXjq.jpg','1964-04-08',150,'Released','It is unlikely that you will experience in a lifetime all that you will see in... THE CARPETBAGGERS.','The Carpetbaggers',42792,2.0833,5.964,'wZQYht6ND5w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4537,_binary '\0','/r6IaAOvRPXZi5CUddbD8MHiXgOx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057918',6.7,5613,'en','Carry On Cleo','Two Britons—inventor Hengist Pod, and Horse, a brave and cunning fighter—are captured and enslaved by invading Romans and taken to Rome. One of their first encounters in Rome leaves Hengist being mistaken for a fighter, and gets drafted into the Royal Guard to protect Julius Caesar.','/7Qsuxb8TkKKJDIWqMdRsKTML9IL.jpg','1964-11-08',94,'Released','The Funniest Film Since 54 B.C.','Carry On Cleo',5066,2.3231,6.7,'4mlU6bxcx5s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4538,_binary '\0','/nPdrpkYwHOEuWuptJqPsSy9AnDL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057919',5.9,2886,'en','Carry On Jack','Able seaman Poop-Decker signs up for adventure on the high seas with the wicked Captain Fearless. Those swabbing the decks include Juliet Mills, Charles Hawtrey and Donald Houston. The film was originally to be titled Up the Armada, but the British Board of Film Censors objected to such a rude title.','/bbX36nhu01POs4ZQjJVXrNP53CP.jpg','1964-02-23',87,'Released','That crazy \'Carry On\' team . . . on a tidal wave of hilarity !','Carry On Jack',32105,1.607,5.9,'cTBw24U-Mfg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4539,_binary '\0','/zwvRPsyISel4ME3DYIDBzJFHgen.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057920',6.2,3486,'en','Carry On Spying','Carry On favourite Barbara Windsor makes her debut in this outrageous send-up of the James Bond movies. Fearless agent Desmond Simpkins and Charlie Bind, aided and abetted by the comely Agent Honeybutt and Agent Crump, battle against the evil powers of international bad guys STENCH and their three cronies.','/tjzKu4m1XEGi2rmzzP3LOrHyChu.jpg','1964-06-01',87,'Released','Cloak And Dagger Operations Exposed. Secret Agent Charlie Bind O.O.O.H! Takes The Lid Off The Funniest Spy Story Of The Year!','Carry On Spying',32109,2.0422,6.355,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4540,_binary '\0','/fc2b3l8q7OS5VWf4uWjEr3Mposv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057924',5.7,1521,'it','Il castello dei morti vivi','Count Drago invites over entertainers to his castle, but what the people don\'t know is that Drago mummifies animals and humans!','/vZsgsxRgdlpeGCNOwSmpSVE4bdI.jpg','1964-08-05',90,'Released','How much shock can the human brain endure before it cracks?','The Castle of the Living Dead',28592,1.6588,6.1,'CoOqNxPAu0k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4541,_binary '\0','/hhJwKAopKgZjW0bciNyKnpurRG8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057933',7.2,2926,'en','The Chalk Garden','The peculiar antics of Laurel, an emotionally troubled young girl, are the focus of The Chalk Garden – a stately household drama set on the cliffs of the English south coast. Edith Evans plays a matriarchal grandmother who, in raising her granddaughter, has neglected her other love – a barren chalk garden. Mayhem ensues as Laurel\'s behavior frightens away a succession of governesses until an enigmatic one is hired in spite of her mysterious references. She skillfully sets about tending to the girl\'s reckless emotions and the pitifully failed garden.','/IXGqj9MoPFbaoBcUkUZf97XHlx.jpg','1964-04-02',105,'Released','A girl on the verge of womanhood... a woman on the edge of loneliness... both suspicious of affection, yet starved for love.','The Chalk Garden',66022,1.9596,7.176,'Nk8Neu_5Sik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4542,_binary '\0','/hXYf2k0igWcfReM98949EVTfSgP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057935',8.1,8108,'bn','চারুলতা','In 1870s India, Charulata is an isolated, artistically inclined woman who sees little of her busy journalist husband, Bhupati. Realizing that his wife is alienated and unhappy, he convinces his cousin, Amal, to spend time with Charulata and nourish her creative impulses. Amal is a fledgling poet himself, and he and Charulata bond over their shared love of art.','/ei2YaCcnUBudyc6BQSc6mpCSJTx.jpg','1964-04-17',117,'Released',NULL,'Charulata',35790,4.0317,7.487,'gFCuy_FUsdo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4543,_binary '\0','/iNAOupG7L1Z9zeDQh8aBBlfQacN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057940',6.7,7080,'en','Cheyenne Autumn','A reluctant cavalry Captain must track a defiant tribe of migrating Cheyenne.','/kYc1NuT9Cvm6GHAdf5nlEXb3evl.jpg','1964-10-15',157,'Released','1,500 miles of heroism and incredible adventure!','Cheyenne Autumn',40630,3.3601,6.7,'kQ9E0J6YzHg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4544,_binary '\0','/1fvoMvKbk4L0vzdXyTwOGxXxrl3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057950',7.6,3796,'en','Cinderella','After the success of the live 1957 Cinderella on CBS (with Julie Andrews), the network decided to produce another television version. The new script hewed closer to the traditional tale, although nearly all of the original songs were retained and performed in their original settings. Added to the Rodgers and Hammerstein score was \"Loneliness of Evening\", which had been composed for South Pacific but not used.','/60gQBt16TakffKrR2sizX7SWJ1M.jpg','1965-02-22',78,'Released',NULL,'Cinderella',25892,2.3882,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4545,_binary '\0','/cguzwAWMrT9yhSvilgaZxNhipdo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057952',6.1,3377,'en','Circus World','Circus owner Matt Masters is beset by disasters as he attempts a European tour of his circus. At the same time, he is caught in an emotional bind between his adopted daughter and her mother.','/vwioP29cTAsQP1dUrVa1yvLVNmz.jpg','1964-06-25',143,'Released','John Wayne Wild Across the World!','Circus World',42782,2.2956,6.2,'bJHUHa_AUbo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4546,_binary '\0','/sn5dvn1g977bejLHGyMUlXeEXn7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057960',7.5,3055,'it','Comizi d\'amore','Pier Paolo Pasolini sets out to interview Italians about sex, apparently their least favorite thing to talk about in public: he asks children if they know where babies come from; asks old and young women if they support gender equality; asks both sexes if a woman\'s virginity still matters, what do they think of homosexuality, if divorce should be legal, or if they support the recent abolition of brothels. He interviews blue-collar workers, intellectuals, college students, rural farmers, the bourgeoisie, and every other kind of people, painting a vivid portrait of a rapidly-industrializing Italy, hanging between modernity and tradition — toward both of which Pasolini shows equal distrust.','/olOuK4gkrYzgo7xJWR1EugZ2vdS.jpg','1965-07-05',88,'Released',NULL,'Love Meetings',42733,2.0743,8.2,'eirKFZBkUA0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4547,_binary '\0','/aDi4GqSYi4pcTvS7A9AuXLuhUVQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057967',7.3,9115,'fr','Le Corniaud','In this Franco-Italian gangster parody, a shopkeeper on his way to an Italian holiday suffers a crash that totals his car. The culprit can only compensate his ruined trip by driving an American friend\'s car from Naples to Bordeaux, but as it happens to be filled with such contraband as stolen money, jewelry and drugs, the involuntary and unwitting companions in crime soon attract all but recreational attention from the \"milieu\".','/kGFE3U01sMApp5Q7h0akEvdTwPK.jpg','1965-03-24',111,'Released','The funniest fraud a fall-guy ever fell for!','The Sucker',25866,3.7908,7.365,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4548,_binary '\0','/sKhEX64vcWVqgwlRSaWxCgEwjn3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057970',2,4936,'en','The Creeping Terror','A newlywed sheriff tries to stop a shambling monster that has emerged from a spaceship to eat people.','/ap6DIQHtS0JjgfbdVnbcoVdSZEd.jpg','1964-11-20',77,'Released','EEK!!! Lock the doors! Bolt the windows! It\'s...','The Creeping Terror',31275,1.2047,3,'SAJLcqWv87Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4549,_binary '\0','/4RZijMThT2PwZogE4pN4Lj96fDX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057982',7.7,2001,'en','Culloden','Culloden, Scottish Highlands, April 16th, 1746. It was one of the most mishandled and brutal battles ever fought in Great Britain. Its aftermath was tragic. The men responsible for such a disaster must be exposed. The men, women and children who suffered because of it must be remembered.','/hptZ0wiHRbQqODlfrOcnWAQpA6v.jpg','1964-12-15',69,'Released',NULL,'Culloden',61302,1.02,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4550,_binary '\0','/3GzQ4maZwSR6hF3ASJQj13Gv3Dp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057986',5.6,4193,'en','The Curse of the Mummy\'s Tomb','Those who have interfered with the Tomb of Ra-Antef are in terrible danger. Against expert advice, American showman and financial backer of the expedition, Alexander King, plans a world tour exhibiting this magnificent discovery from the ancient world but on the opening night the sarcophagus is void of its contents. The mummy has escaped to fulfill the dreadful prophesy and exact a violent and bloody revenge on all those who defiled his final resting place.','/1DdEHgHmitZN2dfXoqE4IUgnQx2.jpg','1964-10-18',80,'Released','It Lives Again To Kill Again!','The Curse of the Mummy\'s Tomb',39044,2.3922,5.5,'pm9zg24DkZM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4551,_binary '\0','/s2MNZ9fEroQrKMagzBl5gO43VlD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057993',6.8,3536,'it','Danza macabra','When a cynical journalist accepts a wager that he won\'t survive the night in a haunted castle, it unlocks an odyssey of sexual torment, undead vengeance, and a dark seductress who surrenders the gravest of pleasures.','/A17gEQk617FsLhtPyalRN885KM3.jpg','1964-02-27',91,'Released','The living and the dead change places in an orgy of terror!','Castle of Blood',28532,1.5103,7.085,'KOz0VMelwyc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4552,_binary '\0','/dHt3xZrV3o5FgvFoGZ8g7dIObIR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057997',7.3,7464,'en','Dead Ringer','The working class twin sister of a callous wealthy woman impulsively murders her out of revenge and assumes the identity of the dead woman. But impersonating her dead twin is more complicated and risky than she anticipated.','/3gFIovyx38syFIY6kAl1FcwhWMd.jpg','1964-01-29',116,'Released','What Bette Davis does to Bette Davis and to Karl Malden and Peter Lawford in DEAD RINGER is just what \"Baby Jane\" people will adore!','Dead Ringer',22543,2.8175,6.9,'J0FxZmdoh_4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4553,_binary '\0','/nu644MCQoQJVWYE28bjrdRNznI9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0057999',7.2,2142,'en','Dear Heart','A lonely Ohio spinster hopes to find romance when she travels to New York City for a postmasters\' convention.','/8rRzxfPsztNhgac81KJk3tphCME.jpg','1965-03-07',114,'Released','Two hours from now, two total strangers will meet at a hotel convention in the most unconventional love affair in years!','Dear Heart',101226,1.4579,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4554,_binary '\0','/6NQaH8YAM9365WlC2EO3Ib7QbT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058001',7.3,3251,'cs','Démanty noci','Two Jewish boys escape from a train transporting them from one concentration camp to another. Beyond themes of war and anti-Nazism, the film concerns itself with man\'s struggle to preserve human dignity.','/djBsRTj1BlXCHDAQRAa2lkvxTMY.jpg','1964-09-25',67,'Released',NULL,'Diamonds of the Night',100589,1.2134,7,'6c7bOSyEup4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4555,_binary '\0','/xe43LKesFXjQgP4W1s2juf7Tb4t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058003',7.4,19527,'it','Il deserto rosso','In an industrializing Italian town, a married woman, rendered mentally unstable after a traffic accident, drifts into an affair with a friend of her husband.','/rGcTVdyhaGzMxPPRVApXre6F7SD.jpg','1964-09-04',117,'Released','This is the story of a woman… Her hidden thirsts and hungers…','Red Desert',26638,3.819,7.319,'SY_MEkvIRuo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4556,_binary '\0','/sDKHdt84JGzfxAJp2vqLdVzPj0Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058006',7.1,6440,'pt','Deus e o Diabo na Terra do Sol','Wanted for killing his boss, Manuel flees with his wife Rosa to the sertão, the barren landscape of Northern Brazil. Thrust into a primordial violent region, Manuel and Rosa come under the influence and control of a series of frightening figures.','/keNDV8nbgVLiCUyzObisEDxdAI4.jpg','1964-03-13',120,'Released','Here’s my gun to stop the poor from starving','Black God, White Devil',67612,2.9272,7.1,'06lr4b9vA60','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4557,_binary '\0','/ladTLUrMEfoCAP3fcCt8hO5RKjF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058007',4.9,2934,'en','Devil Doll','An evil hyponotist/ventriloquist plots to gain an heiress\' millions.','/uma37slg8b3J3zEHZxXsZHUoHZ.jpg','1964-09-01',81,'Released','Is it flesh or wood? Man or monster? Alive or dead?','Devil Doll',29318,1.4025,4.741,'6_u-D3fj0Ok','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4558,_binary '\0','/bd7O36rI3UTGy195a9R2y8jLxUL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058018',6.4,3653,'en','The Disorderly Orderly','Poor Jerome Littlefield. He wants to be a doctor – but that\'s not exactly the perfect career choice when you\'re hopelessly squeamish. So he settles for the job of orderly at the Whitestone Sanitarium, a career move that\'s guaranteed to keep the patients – and viewers – in stitches!','/nL0phS4VMSCL2fMsDrzkCYkZFvg.jpg','1964-12-16',89,'Released','NOTE: This picture was made entirely without the co-operation of any medical association!','The Disorderly Orderly',35188,2.5278,6.3,'bzgCB_mcmyQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4559,_binary '\0','/ajJzGsXgfwfOmE4SFt2KEDNVd44.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058019',6.3,1290,'en','A Distant Trumpet','In 1883, US Cavalry lieutenant Matthew Hazard, newly graduated from West Point, is assigned to isolated Fort Delivery on the Mexican border of Arizona, where he meets commanding officer Teddy Mainwarring\'s wife Kitty, whom he later rescues from an Indian attack.','/u97EKR3ZQgXcKgzTIMzdbqNJDFM.jpg','1964-05-20',117,'Released','From Pulitzer Prize winner Paul Horgan\'s epic novel of Indians and Indian-fighters','A Distant Trumpet',69472,2.4502,5.547,'31JS_MQDKM4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4560,_binary '\0','/avCDRUMLMwoh4ATAgrWCAYdz0Nv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058022',7.8,4062,'ru','Добро пожаловать, или Посторонним вход воспрещен','Children rebel against the strict rules and regulations they face during their time in a Communist Young Pioneer camp.','/9QijJUlaeuNpuePp8nkQt24sGSb.jpg','1964-10-09',73,'Released',NULL,'Welcome, or No Trespassing',20886,1.8293,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4561,_binary '\0','/jRVfXosVCkBsgvzqvJ4gletc9iS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058050',5.9,2911,'en','The Earth Dies Screaming','A crack test pilot lands to find the planet has been devastated by unknown forces. There are a few survivors, so he organizes them in a plan to ward off control by a group of killer robots.','/ny4srEaGOmWZCL9jTkD2fPKRDwg.jpg','1964-10-04',62,'Released','They came from the heavens... and sent the world into hell!','The Earth Dies Screaming',77669,2.0049,6.3,'Eg8c96bKQ5s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4562,_binary '\0','/fR6CIp6IsfefvejkRGN43McTZDe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058060',5.9,1945,'en','Ensign Pulver','1945, on an old cargo ship somewhere deep in the Pacific ocean: Captain Morton strives to become commander, so he demands the maximum quality of work from his crew, without granting them any freedom or favors - ignoring that they\'re thousand of miles away from the front. In one word: he drives his crew crazy. They are near mutiny, but no-one dares to do the first step. Until Ensign Pulver plays a prank on the captain that triggers fatal consequences...','/sbhbIPJMQ1zTXky1gY62BSbx2YJ.jpg','1964-07-31',104,'Released','Following in the hilarious fun-steps of \"Mister Roberts\"','Ensign Pulver',42785,1.9615,6.5,'EkHaUTGLmFs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4563,_binary '\0','/bmZNXRwM7P0YSkSJIkLDd7nb309.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058073',6,5295,'en','The Evil of Frankenstein','Once hounded from his castle by outraged villagers for creating a monstrous living being, Baron Frankenstein returns to Karlstaad. High in the mountains they stumble on the body of the creature, perfectly preserved in the ice. He is brought back to life with the help of the hypnotist Zoltan who now controls the creature. Can Frankenstein break Zoltan\'s hypnotic spell that incites the monster to commit these horrific murders or will Zoltan induce the creature to destroy its creator?','/yJBzyHZ6m9fOisiAtrtUjNidZ1k.jpg','1964-05-08',87,'Released','He\'s never been more shocking! shocking! shocking!','The Evil of Frankenstein',3124,2.3719,6.2,'NLPsFMW84eE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4564,_binary '\0','/zBbiWRmuulFQU12ApzzSe038fYa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058083',8,28383,'en','Fail Safe','Because of a technical defect an American bomber team mistakenly orders the destruction of Moscow. The President of the United States has but little time to prevent an atomic catastrophe from occurring.','/qrsj5hort5xkLOKw9NyraGMnlVP.jpg','1964-10-07',112,'Released','It will have you sitting on the brink of eternity!','Fail Safe',502,3.5914,7.8,'filmUN4W59I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4565,_binary '\0','/wpTgHZCCfM3SffZvq6tCFdkkMz0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058085',6.7,11468,'en','The Fall of the Roman Empire','In the year 180 A.D. Germanic tribes are about to invade the Roman empire from the north. In the midst of this crisis ailing emperor Marcus Aurelius has to make a decision about his successor between his son Commodus, who is obsessed by power, and the loyal general Gaius Livius.','/ggrPUKNYFZ6ogs896ZiT0lQG9Tr.jpg','1964-03-24',188,'Released','Never before a spectacle like the fall of the Roman empire','The Fall of the Roman Empire',17277,5.0872,6.5,'sQ-sPXgSWCs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4566,_binary '\0','/pXYTP26ED7gAyyQ5QNrsGeieYbY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058089',6.9,13872,'fr','Fantômas','Fantômas is a man of many disguises. He uses maquillage as a weapon. He can impersonate anyone using an array of masks and can create endless confusion by constantly changing his appearance.','/eBg2ka0vAHZEwIWAaIYcDVp0wPx.jpg','1964-11-04',104,'Released',NULL,'Fantomas',1871,4.2911,6.8,'2kegOG4e_GM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4567,_binary '\0','/ngVXUpFEIhJYQwN5fpdNpXJ2du.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058091',6.8,2142,'en','Fate Is the Hunter','An airline executive refuses to believe that pilot error, by his friend, caused a fatal crash and persists in looking for another reason.','/faDAYcBU0dboJ8QpYSSSCtKUwud.jpg','1964-10-16',106,'Released','He played with death to prove a theory','Fate Is the Hunter',102286,2.5995,6.5,'FCD5CxXAum4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4568,_binary '\0','/qxfuWn03LIk8FFT85gIoFQmPB3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058092',7.3,13738,'en','Father Goose','During World War II, South Sea beachcomber Walter Eckland is persuaded to spy on planes passing over his island. He gets more than he bargained for as schoolteacher Catherine Frenau arrives on the run from the Japanese with her pupils in tow!','/Tp4vSQef0qsI78M90SsZZLJzPE.jpg','1964-12-10',118,'Released','They\'re sharing a South Sea island with 7 little chaperones...and the Pacific as their battleground!','Father Goose',30295,3.5744,7.049,'4OGjiL7dDio','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4569,_binary '\0','/ispyRJVbcB3c9y6AhuZdbgMuzi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058100',6.5,7410,'en','First Men in the Moon','The world is delighted when a spacecraft containing a crew comprised of the world\'s astronauts lands on the moon, but are shocked when the astronauts discover an old British flag and a document declaring that the moon is taken for Queen Victoria, proving that the astronauts were not the first men on the moon.','/q2Ee1fUretsxTvNrobQzeVYbq22.jpg','1964-08-06',103,'Released','H.G. Wells\' Astounding Adventure in Dynamation!','First Men in the Moon',34276,3.2871,6.3,'0zxAiUQu0v8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4570,_binary '\0','/jVIrKJoVaeYxlIAnvWTnkWKyzrd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058101',5.8,1624,'en','The Flesh Eaters','An alcoholic actress, her personal assistant, and their pilot are downed on a secluded isle by bad weather, where a renegade Nazi scientist is using ocean life to develop a solvent for human flesh. The tiny flesh-eating sea critters that result certainly give our heroes a run for their money - and lives.','/hpN9HG19LFOJDH0Agdfl95v7Sth.jpg','1964-03-18',87,'Released','The only people who will not be STERILIZED with FEAR are those among you who are already DEAD!','The Flesh Eaters',42793,1.1328,5.6,'ec9Js0iL9VI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4571,_binary '\0','/iT4HQTcuIkkgLyVPx2TItH9E6xM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058123',7,3639,'fr','Les Félins','A small-time con man on the run from his girlfriend\'s gangster husband hides out in a strange, brooding mansion run by two mysterious women, where he finds himself trapped in deception between the two.','/ejmE0meo3edkUEyOIzNaa3273dy.jpg','1964-06-12',97,'Released','The Women of the \"Joy House\" Allowed Him Every Freedom...Except the Freedom to Leave!','Joy House',38421,2.5485,6.4,'uXf34IKYS5w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4572,_binary '\0','/lcjcbS0Am4SaBGli3JnxlOM66z0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058124',5.4,2897,'sv','För att inte tala om alla dessa kvinnor','Pretentious critic Cornelius is writing a biography on a famous cellist and to do some research he stays in the cellist\'s house for a few days. He doesn\'t manage to get an interview with the man, but by talking to all the women who live with him, he comes to learn a lot about the musician\'s private life none the less. Cornelius then decides to use this information to blackmail the cellist into performing a composition that he, Cornelius, has written.','/jOOLYdOUbXL5ufuxP6Xr8llajKr.jpg','1964-06-15',77,'Released',NULL,'All These Women',96118,1.8288,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4573,_binary '\0','/rr8f8StqCT0taRsv94h3Zlq8QKo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058126',8.2,3268,'ru','Гамлет','Shakespeare\'s 17th century masterpiece about the \"Melancholy Dane\" was given one of its best screen treatments by Soviet director Grigori Kozintsev. Kozintsev\'s Elsinore was a real castle in Estonia, utilized metaphorically as the \"stone prison\" of the mind wherein Hamlet must confine himself in order to avenge his father\'s death. Hamlet himself is portrayed (by Innokenti Smoktunovsky) as the sole sensitive intellectual in a world made up of debauchers and revellers. Several of Kozintsev directorial choices seem deliberately calculated to inflame the purists: Hamlet\'s delivers his \"To be or not to be\" soliloquy with his back to the camera, allowing the audience to fill in its own interpretations.','/bM7VeWSydVMysUBA77rkNdQ3Icg.jpg','1964-06-24',140,'Released',NULL,'Hamlet',71317,1.3871,7.2,'OvssXTX2tuw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4574,_binary '\0','/mSwyH7ix20lqdKmPx7682gALwGu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058135',7.1,15535,'fr','Le Gendarme de Saint-Tropez','The ambitious police officer Cruchot is transferred to St. Tropez. He\'s struggling with crimes such as persistent nude swimming, but even more with his teenage daughter, who\'s trying to impress her rich friends by telling them her father was a millionaire and owned a yacht in the harbor.','/6510K6Y8eYLf9FJ7O4xaOnwhn2u.jpg','1964-09-08',89,'Released','Beguiling BATHING BEAUTIES will give you a load of laughs!','Le Gendarme de Saint-Tropez',4727,4.598,7.046,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4575,_binary '\0','/9g3D4uqDYeukbSGckW8khR4G93C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058138',7.3,7431,'da','Gertrud','Hopeless romantic Gertrud inhabits a turn-of-the-century milieu of artists and musicians, where she pursues an idealized notion of love that will always elude her. She abandons her distinguished husband and embraces an affair with a young concert pianist, who falls short of her desire for lasting affection. When an old lover returns to her life, fresh disappointments follow, and Gertrud must try to come to terms with reality.','/kHjqxHcJlwd5fL8G6pDuLfOCaPW.jpg','1964-12-19',119,'Released','AMOR OMNIA, Love is Everything.','Gertrud',34181,2.4146,7.3,'ofoj3YEER0A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4576,_binary '\0','/2vmBcDzk6Al6TjtiZQFBRjZhk1m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058142',6.9,1664,'en','Girl with Green Eyes','A naive young country girl moves to Dublin and finds herself drawn to a sophisticated author twice her age.','/ntuLUDK48OQMQgBpakOfQtpM70e.jpg','1964-05-14',91,'Released',NULL,'Girl with Green Eyes',64811,1.9894,6.7,'9KYFna8cwsM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4577,_binary '\0','/mM4WeXqJd2tu1gCF5GYyAZf2Npl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058150',7.7,219862,'en','Goldfinger','Special agent 007 comes face to face with one of the most notorious villains of all time, and now he must outwit and outgun the powerful tycoon to prevent him from cashing in on a devious scheme to raid Fort Knox -- and obliterate the world\'s economy.','/aKNFzaqQgPzsGXnsMc4kJH5hFIV.jpg','1964-09-20',110,'Released','Everything he touches turns into excitement!','Goldfinger',658,12.1125,7.359,'MA65V-oLKa8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4578,_binary '\0','/AjAh4kC9EPmbM4EuyQpM0TCGkIR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058153',6.7,3603,'en','Good Neighbor Sam','To help his divorced neighbor claim a substantial inheritance, a family man poses as her husband. The ruse spills over into his career in advertising, and his recent promotion relies on his wholesome and moral appearance.','/dLyFlaMOZ998xitLiOEMur2FyrD.jpg','1964-07-22',130,'Released','Slam! Bam! Here comes Sam!...Caught in the Middle of a Two-Woman Jam!','Good Neighbor Sam',3011,2.934,6.6,'FqqSckA3SjI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4579,_binary '\0','/eHhDsK5GZ4fcpjib5GnFNbffCqD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058154',6.2,2323,'en','Goodbye Charlie','When a cavorting Hollywood writer is killed by the angry husband of a woman he was having an affair with, he comes back as a spirit in the form of a beautiful woman and moves in with his/her best friend as a base operation for enacting sweet revenge.','/tA7MNMfk1BQdEMM8aJhQSLP4fA5.jpg','1964-11-18',116,'Released','They don\'t make girls like \"Charlie\" anymore -- they never did!','Goodbye Charlie',52906,1.881,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4580,_binary '\0','/yngAajGDpARUqVuimkJgBzVQjgY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058155',6.4,8148,'en','The Gorgon','In the early 20th century a village experienced a series of inexplicable murders. All the victims were young men who had been turned to stone. The perpetrator of these deaths was a being so repulsive that she transformed the onlooker using the power of her deadly stare. Much of the time the creature took the form of a beautiful and seductive woman, but during periods of the full moon she becomes a living horror, vicious and deadly. A professor has come to investigate the deaths, bringing with him his beautiful assistant whose knowledge of the Gorgon is more intimate than anyone would ever realise.','/yk0hJB3hy3o6cAzv5tjcPoKQd9p.jpg','1964-10-18',83,'Released','A venture into the deepest, starkest realms of the supernatural...','The Gorgon',28667,2.2363,6.37,'KFTE5vXi2yQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4581,_binary '\0','/pztVgUebg3Gn51voumoC3zS94Bq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058166',7.1,2139,'en','Guns at Batasi','An anachronistic martinet RSM on a remote Colonial African army caught in a local coup d\'etat must use his experience to defend those in his care.','/cUZvtHoqIteUAEeBrNfiR56Tw5O.jpg','1964-10-30',103,'Released','Outnumbered A Hundred to One - Yet Fighting Like a Thousand Heroes in a Hell Spot Called Batasi!','Guns at Batasi',64158,1.8541,7,'gYew4znBe-c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4582,_binary '\0','/9hWiNbvLR3nPDanTdEWOc4EeBGp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058182',7.5,50370,'en','A Hard Day\'s Night','Capturing John Lennon, Paul McCartney, George Harrison and Ringo Starr in their electrifying element, \'A Hard Day\'s Night\' is a wildly irreverent journey through this pastiche of a day in the life of The Beatles during 1964. The band have to use all their guile and wit to avoid the pursuing fans and press to reach their scheduled television performance, in spite of Paul\'s troublemaking grandfather and Ringo\'s arrest.','/6Ulsccp2VkaVU5qbya3bxm9JG4x.jpg','1964-07-07',88,'Released','The Beatles, starring in their first full-length, hilarious, action-packed film!','A Hard Day\'s Night',704,6.1612,7.302,'TWbiVqlSMgc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4583,_binary '\0','/AhsYBiX63CkMNK9MGT12TztRXZr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058191',6.6,1828,'de','Der Hexer','The sister of a famous, but as yet uncaught, criminal named \"The Hexer\" is murdered. Inspector Higgins of Scotland Yard believes that \"The Hexer\" will surface to take his revenge on his sister\'s killers, and plans to set a trap to finally capture him. However, soon bodies start piling up, and it looks as if \"The Hexer\" may get away yet again.','/mkrGRYJgifUSzP0WlDUBH9AiZGO.jpg','1964-08-21',85,'Released',NULL,'The Mysterious Magician',9630,1.784,6.7,'QgUGq_9JkpM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4584,_binary '\0','/1oziVuVtJc7BgHRCVLhVJ53u9u3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058203',7,7157,'fr','L\'Homme de Rio','French military man Adrien Dufourquet gets an eight-day furlough to visit his fiancée, Agnès. But when he arrives in Paris, he learns that her late father\'s partner, museum curator Professor Catalan, has just been kidnapped by a group of Amazon tribesmen who have also stolen a priceless statue from the museum. Adrien and Agnès pursue the kidnappers to Brazil, where they learn that the statue is the key to a hidden Amazon treasure.','/AhaUqqHTIMSXG6WOMRCreitQ1ZX.jpg','1964-02-05',117,'Released','Look what they call a quiet week in Rio!','That Man from Rio',4034,4.1324,7.3,'ceB4bqJVEYg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4585,_binary '\0','/bQXgxCNZ6zdTiuytQa70nNoNJ0V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058208',3.4,3454,'en','The Horror of Party Beach','Radioactive waste dumped off the coastline creates mutant monsters. The beasts attack slumber parties, beaches, tourists, and terrorize a waterfront community as a scientist, his daughter, her boyfriend and the local police try to find a way to stop them.','/q7ro6YyinHyhMIEROwqS0Br98mz.jpg','1964-06-01',78,'Released','WEIRD! Ghoulish atomic beasts who live off human blood!','The Horror of Party Beach',42794,1.122,4.4,'PyUp4vLUUO8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4586,_binary '\0','/3BlLlwc1dLWLpgFQG9l5Fzzl5Xg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058212',6.4,8208,'en','How to Murder Your Wife','Stanley Ford is a successful cartoonist and happily single. That is, until he gets drunk at a friend\'s bachelor party and impulsively proposes to the beautiful woman who pops out of the cake. Once sober, he regrets the decision, but she won\'t agree to a divorce. Stanley jokingly vents his frustrations in his comic strip by having the main character kill his wife. But when his actual wife goes missing and Stanley is arrested for her murder, he has a change of heart.','/1lwxAeN3OGXkoPH9DzZrRtA7XK0.jpg','1965-01-26',118,'Released','Bring The Little Woman...Maybe She\'ll Die Laughing!','How to Murder Your Wife',26685,3.7456,6.353,'OSy-P6f7VHw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4587,_binary '\0','/oe9YRZv9FTtOJ9IKbJxyh23MYO1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058213',7.5,17661,'en','Hush... Hush, Sweet Charlotte','An aging, reclusive Southern belle plagued by a horrifying family secret descends into madness after the arrival of a lost relative.','/hwVGNaVXFblluLwUjGcJ7RgW1rV.jpg','1964-12-16',133,'Released','The years will soon erase a lover\'s lies...the blood on his face!','Hush... Hush, Sweet Charlotte',10299,4.0964,7.3,'-NHC-Re-kfo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4588,_binary '\0','/9Nl6rdopLxaYlSfn2B19oz1tXLx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058230',6.5,6622,'en','The Incredible Mr. Limpet','Milquetoast Henry Limpet experiences his fondest wish and is transformed into a fish. As a talking fish he assists the US Navy in hunting German submarines during World War II.','/j2xkRT5peEPQRocgtoUEpUtoin2.jpg','1964-03-28',99,'Released','GLUB! The face that launched a thousand torpedoes!','The Incredible Mr. Limpet',19953,2.5309,6.2,'xDkt79gV6xQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4589,_binary '\0','/7aKxzaKPOJg0cYsCabcLSGr3TYM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058232',7,1261,'fr','L\'Insoumis','In this drama that alludes to the Algerian War with France of the 1960s, Thomas is a deserter from the French Foreign Legion who is on the run from authorities. He helps damsel in distress Dominique, who has been taken hostage by a group of terrorists. Thomas is wounded but manages to escape after killing the guard who inflicted the injury. Dominique gives Thomas money to escape to France after he secures her freedom, but he is caught between the Foreign Legion and the terrorists seeking revenge.','/ozkODwxrNcsVS1yC1HDIX0hyrGm.jpg','1964-09-25',115,'Released','Have I The Right to Kill?','The Unvanquished',137859,1.3699,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4590,_binary '\0','/gsscmNRUF8AfxNOZWZQ7a8GR0uG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058238',6.3,2656,'en','Invitation to a Gunfighter','In New Mexico, a Confederate veteran returns home to find his fiancée married to a Union soldier, his Yankee neighbors rallied against him and his property sold by the local banker who then hires a gunman to kill him.','/1ei32SG6KVAnALnCxJvMq0LSnKM.jpg','1964-10-14',92,'Released','He Kills By Invitation','Invitation to a Gunfighter',55150,2.5307,5.9,'IjfJSG5lifA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4591,_binary '\0','/vpPdmaGYQUiM9Rb2znWpNyzE3Km.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058249',7.3,10651,'fr','Le Journal d\'une femme de chambre','Celestine has a new job as a chambermaid for the quirky M. Monteil, his wife and her father. When the father dies, Celestine decides to quit her job and leave, but when a young girl is raped and murdered, Celestine believes that the Monteils\' groundskeeper, Joseph, is guilty, and stays on in order to prove it. She uses her sexuality and the promise of marriage to get Joseph to confess -- but things do not go as planned.','/epCJe5dzAn21mQ9L1fQ2FjIF13T.jpg','1964-03-04',97,'Released',NULL,'Diary of a Chambermaid',36245,3.2254,7.079,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4592,_binary '\0','/ijVTqtGWNnhl4LQ3CtViFtQUaF0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058262',7,10623,'en','The Killers','A hit man and his partner try to find out why their latest victim, a former race-car driver, did not try to get away.','/7IeXjRmUZ2pnSFMRh0ZXpu3Nkmn.jpg','1964-07-07',93,'Released','There\'s more than one way to kill a man!','The Killers',24229,3.1984,6.9,'BBi5Hmd-gTE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4593,_binary '\0','/wd7Hsv0jKGN8pmiM3WZ5SkB2nTu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058263',7.5,3061,'en','King and Country','During World War I, Army Private Arthur James Hamp is accused of desertion during battle. The officer assigned to defend him at his court-martial, Captain Hargreaves, finds out there is more to the case than meets the eye.','/pNThxWhNcvdH6CatXTfdipYHlNb.jpg','1964-12-03',85,'Released','Go ahead... kill him - you\'re the only friend he has!','King and Country',96394,1.8198,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4594,_binary '\0','/nu7UcOrHkshgQOPOYbuxANW9FM8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058265',6.9,9547,'en','Kiss Me, Stupid','While traveling home from Vegas, an amorous lounge singer named Dino gets conned by a local mechanic/songwriter into staying in town for the night. The mechanic\'s songwriting partner, Orville, offers Dino his home for overnight lodging and enlists a local waitress/call girl to pose as his wife in order to placate Dino\'s urges.','/sbMILWDfzwQI8ZBIn42zGNU4xqg.jpg','1964-12-22',125,'Released','It happened in Climax, Nevada','Kiss Me, Stupid',53021,2.7662,7,'vwcINbTX01c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4595,_binary '\0','/63ryQqprKrVMvazWaPCOdgMz6xI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058267',5.3,1666,'en','Kitten with a Whip','Straitlaced senatorial hopeful David Stratton has no idea what he\'s in for when he arrives home from a trip to find sexy teen Jody curled up asleep in his daughter\'s bed. Soon, delinquent Jody is holding David -- and his plush suburban home -- hostage while she hides out from the cops and throws a wild party with her beatnik pals. David, terrified of scandal, agrees to drive Jody and her friends to Mexico, a decision he regrets when the ride gets out of control.','/rGNvcHMsjsETfmP7KYbJfgrX2xb.jpg','1964-11-04',82,'Released','Every man who sees her digs her... but she digs kicks of a very special kind!','Kitten with a Whip',42786,2.2519,5.3,'0h3r3_nFGmA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4596,_binary '\0','/qJDyJI9CxkTrHqvfxyxTlHl6sNJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058275',7.4,3360,'cs','Limonádový Joe aneb Koňská opera','A satire of the Great American Way, with Lemonade Joe a \"clean living\" gunfighter who drinks only Kola-Loca Lemonade and convinces everyone else in town (with his gun skills) that all \"real men\" drink ONLY lemonade!','/gQM8tVWVRoYbyDe0qWyu5luixjf.jpg','1964-10-16',99,'Released',NULL,'Lemonade Joe',20629,2.0572,7.138,'Zm_BreW18hw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4597,_binary '\0','/9GAU0z2wVA8M2D2w36CaloWYYgv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058279',7.9,23306,'ja','怪談','Taking its title from an archaic Japanese word meaning \"ghost story,\" this anthology adapts four folk tales. A penniless samurai marries for money with tragic results. A man stranded in a blizzard is saved by Yuki the Snow Maiden, but his rescue comes at a cost. Blind musician Hoichi is forced to perform for an audience of ghosts. An author relates the story of a samurai who sees another warrior\'s reflection in his teacup.','/t9UMfViYl47SdZZatKQ1JKjjCgs.jpg','1965-01-06',183,'Released','In the tradition of \"RASHOMON\" and \"GATE OF HELL.\"','Kwaidan',30959,4.2956,7.7,'CWcyccePme4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4598,_binary '\0','/4R0X5dzkkTzoeCqHEWOlEoruBDp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058283',6.7,4153,'en','Lady in a Cage','A woman trapped in a home elevator is terrorized by a group of vicious hoodlums.','/f0eafb0uhYhBTvA2MRB1vN0yJL7.jpg','1964-06-10',94,'Released','What happens in this elevator is not for the weak - it is, perhaps, not even for the strong!','Lady in a Cage',42787,2.5616,6.181,'7Mok24oro4A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4599,_binary '\0','/lCYHPp0jDN87AG4Gy4ZXHxfmf2G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058294',6.8,3616,'en','Lilith','Vincent Bruce, a war veteran, begins working as an occupational therapist at Poplar Lodge, a private psychiatric facility for wealthy people where he meets Lilith Arthur, a charming young woman suffering from schizophrenia, whose fragile beauty captivates all who meet her.','/zBTRVBpWZkkXkhfqqFTh59i4XjU.jpg','1964-10-01',114,'Released','Before Eve there was Evil… and her name was Lilith!','Lilith',60437,2.5071,6.4,'53lYIQkJ-rk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4600,_binary '\0','/hIv6OyyUTWmAwrEYiGdipVz8Qjf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058301',5.7,1329,'en','Lorna','Lorna and Jim have been married for a year but Lorna remains sexually unsatisfied. While he\'s at work, she is raped by an escaped convict, then becomes lustfully involved with him.','/8GoCGn7Rc9OhNmeb8KWPpXSjfBL.jpg','1964-09-11',78,'Released','Longing...Love...Lust...Life, Lorna . . . the embodiment of fulfillment and desire.','Lorna',5741,1.5439,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4601,_binary '\0','/gN0rYDD89hbRoIZApHa2bIPZBk2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058307',6.2,2236,'it','I lunghi capelli della morte','In a 15th century village, a woman is accused of witchcraft and put to death. Her beautiful older daughter knows the real reason for the execution lies in the lord\'s sexual desire for her mother.','/xJ5XE14dYPcGA0ychIjbnvlnK0d.jpg','1964-12-30',96,'Released','Terrifying! Witches unleash horrific vengeance!','The Long Hair of Death',83121,2.01,6.3,'L3HkESAaMDE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4602,_binary '\0','/9qwC63drOWfYz8SEcc2ic1HnmOO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058311',3,2100,'it','Maciste e la regina di Samar','Hercules is summoned to oppose the evil Queen Samara, who has allied herself with aliens and is sacrificing her own people in a bid to awaken a moon goddess.','/lQSDjwoJUr7uxmHYcrUHxVA2Roq.jpg','1964-06-27',90,'Released','Earth\'s mightiest man battles moon monsters!','Hercules Against the Moon Men',31396,1.7805,3.2,'6dRByEh6qlo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4603,_binary '\0','/lhsP86Dup2Y7sjbmSdJi6gEksjv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058324',7,6950,'en','Man\'s Favorite Sport?','Roger Willoughby is a renowned fishing expert, who, unbeknownst to his friends, co-workers, or boss, has never cast a line in his life. One day, he crosses paths with Abigail Paige, a sweetly annoying girl who has just badgered his boss into signing Roger up for an annual fishing tournament.','/ku6w1vtaKM0lIR9jz1MupKmzqZR.jpg','1964-01-31',120,'Released','It takes a girl to supply the answer!','Man\'s Favorite Sport?',39231,3.1934,7,'EvehgKWOjaI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4604,_binary '\0','/pBrT3lnqfKuvgUeCK50XZvUJZgO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058326',6.8,1319,'ja','卍(まんじ)','The four principals in a love affair collide when jealousy, blackmail and suicide enter the picture.','/iEb5MQBPLMZkxOrtXfsfEpb9ps6.jpg','1964-07-25',91,'Released',NULL,'Manji',80642,1.824,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4605,_binary '\0','/dmznYjPfNpNMJZtmnlgSutIDot2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058329',7.1,58112,'en','Marnie','Marnie is a beautiful but emotionally withdrawn thief, stealing from employers before disappearing under new identities. When her new boss, Mark Rutland, discovers her secret, his fascination turns to obsession, and he blackmails her into marriage, convinced he can cure her. But as he probes deeper into Marnie’s fractured mind, long-buried fears and compulsions begin to surface.','/nRRy4VO2A3Py7wiZBPz11PAlogp.jpg','1964-07-17',130,'Released','The more he loved her . . . The more she hated him . . . For trying to unravel her secret!','Marnie',506,4.5943,7.101,'QV_2-v_dsAU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4606,_binary '\0','/nMXLizoHhVTeh3GjFyUOfNx3b7i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058331',7.8,200436,'en','Mary Poppins','In turn of the century London, a magical nanny employs music and adventure to help two neglected children become closer to their father.','/o4Wsby4ydIXhWmtmfvb451D5Np1.jpg','1964-12-17',139,'Released','The fairest of them all...the funniest of them all!','Mary Poppins',433,11.5287,7.55,'6TLIi28kNYg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4607,_binary '\0','/oHVfPPSlii66NTQpOrRurivfrDW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058333',6.9,18616,'en','The Masque of the Red Death','A European prince terrorizes the local peasantry while using his castle as a refuge against the \"Red Death\" plague that stalks the land.','/sSYceyGZrWskWDsn3MHtipJ1wFM.jpg','1964-09-16',90,'Released','Horror has a face.','The Masque of the Red Death',25319,3.6696,6.6,'clT8P-v9uso','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4608,_binary '\0','/eOJb6uspOUEbs4wdMTAfuoOyTg2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058335',7.4,12822,'it','Matrimonio all\'italiana','During the bombing of Naples in World War II, a cynical businessman helps a naive prostitute, who spends the next two decades desperate to have him reciprocate her feelings.','/1VVQFXwr4i6QSAoPnCs9UmGTUVw.jpg','1964-12-18',102,'Released','You have never seen it before! A New torrent of emotions! A New Triumph of Film-Making from Embassy Pictures who brought you \"Divorce Italian Style\" and \"Yesterday, Today and Tomorrow\" now brings you...','Marriage Italian Style',49687,2.8132,7.7,'TgFec85heuU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4609,_binary '\0','/ikvHjj0HKkAEnV7VLN5k23P6oxQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058336',6.4,1301,'en','McHale\'s Navy','The crew of PT-73 get into trouble when they back the wrong horse in a race. Now they have to come up with a way to raise the money to pay off the winners.','/ho517k1uK7zGgrtM9vGonIl7iXy.jpg','1964-06-25',89,'Released','Their first full-length motion picture in color !','McHale\'s Navy',54295,1.6211,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4610,_binary '\0','/owqEXmHaAlgs8EidRv6llLAItY0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058343',6.5,1995,'fr','Merveilleuse Angélique','Angelique is saved by the king of the cutthroats when she is endangered in the streets of Paris. After her hero is killed, she has many amorous affairs and becomes a successful businesswoman.','/46sNgfbm3MXCYlIpCOvOMJIrEWN.jpg','1965-07-07',105,'Released',NULL,'Angelique: The Road to Versailles',44453,3.3746,6.644,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4611,_binary '\0','/qziYY4vp9L32nW4XPd4qM30ChlL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058349',8,2492,'ja','乱れる','War widow Reiko rebuilds and runs the grocery shop in the house of her husband\'s family. Many years later, their business is threatened by a newly built supermarket and Reiko\'s in-laws plan to convert their small shop into a supermarket, to her detriment.','/eiyrGxTMVqRrk6axCvVUMYFmqyK.jpg','1964-01-15',98,'Released',NULL,'Yearning',111398,2.4163,8.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4612,_binary '\0','/5oMDcgFJW75JU4aI4caZbViPjbm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058361',7.7,1813,'ru','Мне двадцать лет','Having returned from the army, 20-year-old Sergei settles down at the thermal power station and merges into ordinary life. Every day he meets and spends time with childhood friends — the young family man Slava and the merry fellow Nikolai, and once at first sight he falls in love with a stranger on the bus. A lyrical story about a generation of young people entering adulthood, a reappraisal of values, life principles, traditions in culture and art.','/mvGm5MyJeKe8DPks3rOLsNFuwmD.jpg','1965-01-18',165,'Released',NULL,'I Am Twenty',148782,1.1729,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4613,_binary '\0','/7rLjtBCMdcUkkA7azkefzJZxOj3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058371',6.5,3403,'en','The Moon-Spinners','Young English girl Nikky and her aunt arrive at the Moon-Spinners, a hotel on Crete, to a less than enthusiastic welcome. The coolness of the owner is only out-done by the surliness of her brother Stratos, recently back from London. But then there is nice English lad Mark to make friends with, at least until Stratos and his pal take a shot at him one night. When Nikky helps him hide she finds the Greeks are after her too.','/iRsJ7CbJG4GibduaQKJ69qJPddf.jpg','1964-07-08',118,'Released','Hayley\'s romantic, carefree holiday suddenly becomes an electrifying surprise in suspense!','The Moon-Spinners',42795,2.748,5.861,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4614,_binary '\0','/11G5rV9vCWTRykd4CG9SvOKUn4I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058374',6.4,6138,'ru','Морозко','A fairy tale about a conceited young man and a young woman with a tyrannical step-mother, who must overcome magical trials in order to be together.','/l2rtXml5YXsIkNtEmEFtFciB7Sr.jpg','1965-03-24',79,'Released',NULL,'Father Frost',20932,2.2794,6.235,'vQnU5nSReNA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4615,_binary '\0','/dKMpMwJB9Aq1fflGAcVfagfG0R5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058379',6.5,12091,'ja','モスラ対ゴジラ','Journalists Ichiro Sakai and Junko cover the wreckage of a typhoon when an enormous egg is found and claimed by greedy entrepreneurs. Mothra\'s fairies arrive and are aided by the journalists in a plea for its return. As their requests are denied, Godzilla arises near Nagoya and the people of Infant Island must decide if they are willing to answer Japan\'s own pleas for help.','/y49vvM03gpuyhpyMc1f55VrNkP3.jpg','1964-04-29',89,'Released','A massive Mach 3 moth! The heavy missile tank Godzilla! The sky, sea, and land quake in the fierce battle of the century!','Mothra vs. Godzilla',1682,3.3303,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4616,_binary '\0','/ahwvpGrljmcmBTlGH9AogOCs7eW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058382',7,6556,'en','Murder Ahoy','During an annual board of trustees meeting, one of the trustees dies. Miss Marple thinks he’s been poisoned after finding a chemical on him. She sets off to investigate at the ship where he had just come from. The fourth and final film from the Miss Marple series starring Margaret Rutherford as the quirky amateur detective.','/rfWqXgr0yVz8Ml4JdUEBOmN6KrW.jpg','1964-09-22',93,'Released','New mischief amidst the mizzen-masts!','Murder Ahoy',758,2.2809,7.1,'j7eluzozN1M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4617,_binary '\0','/pTntob09b9616xtluRPO5Wl8Y3B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058383',7.1,7074,'en','Murder Most Foul','A murderer is brought to court and only Miss Marple is unconvinced of his guilt. Once again she begins her own investigation.','/qTCKB5rxYzgdWUUH4UMgpRVH3GJ.jpg','1964-03-01',90,'Released','New misdeeds are afoot afoot the footlights!','Murder Most Foul',757,2.651,7.1,'1qEcXbo5cfs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4618,_binary '\0','/kOo3IpFmK5pVZFzwnphkDPKo9Z6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058384',5.2,1973,'en','Muscle Beach Party','Local beach-goers find that their beach has been taken over by a businessman training a stable of body builders.','/loKZcf1zVMNQYvziaKBZFvTSueE.jpg','1964-03-25',94,'Released','When 10,000 Biceps go around 5,000 Bikinis... you KNOW what\'s gonna happen!','Muscle Beach Party',27376,1.8504,5.7,'HxB3nKUod2I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4619,_binary '\0','/xMoQjqa3JUc2unO4nF9PmM1JTQu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058385',7.7,108634,'en','My Fair Lady','A snobbish phonetics professor agrees to a wager that he can take a flower girl and make her presentable in high society.','/bTXVc29lGSNclf94VIZ49W4gGKl.jpg','1964-12-01',173,'Released','The loverliest motion picture of them all!','My Fair Lady',11113,8.2805,7.481,'86JALxpEFEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4620,_binary '\0','/oRNdJ70UnEwzn5sJ6MR6hh1AayB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058390',7.2,9785,'en','The Naked Kiss','A former prostitute works to create a new life for herself in a small town, but a shocking discovery could threaten everything.','/fOChacazF29zAhs2hDxyJ05XUaY.jpg','1964-10-29',93,'Released','Shock and Shame Story of a Night Girl!','The Naked Kiss',26031,2.7611,6.998,'kFvdT67lalE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4621,_binary '\0','/1bKfhtqVy48rmDl3t6yxLZNvB0B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058403',6.3,2962,'en','The Night Walker','A woman is haunted by recurring nightmares, which seem to be instigated by her late husband who supposedly was killed in a fire.','/yWIO2LYQvluWSIWNYqEGmqcmynf.jpg','1964-12-30',86,'Released','Will It Dare You To Dream of Things You\'re Ashamed to Admit!','The Night Walker',29403,1.7369,6.4,'qEbbQ1llA8c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4622,_binary '\0','/4v27m8CCm7t8P8E5KLfvXtSBYmK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058404',7.5,14234,'en','The Night of the Iguana','A defrocked Episcopal clergyman leads a bus-load of middle-aged Baptist women on a tour of the Mexican coast and comes to terms with the failure haunting his life.','/3HY8MSeoj4s0uSWGW135Jlh7eSI.jpg','1964-08-06',118,'Released','One man... three women... one night','The Night of the Iguana',14703,3.6446,7.155,'MLC3h4KZ5SU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4623,_binary '\0','/5SYq2XTZn1cYycVsO8skMbVaSPa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058405',6.7,3088,'en','Nightmare','A young woman is plagued by nightmares of her asylum-patient mother. Upon returning to her family home, the nightmares become real when she sees a strange woman pacing the halls.','/iyrWn77rfUBd05HkYRozwJtM4RC.jpg','1964-02-28',83,'Released','THREE SHOCKING MURDERS...did she DREAM them? ...or DO them?','Nightmare',64524,2.0977,6.8,'_YZ5H1ijssY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4624,_binary '\0','/lpY4RTJpuKboamSwE1IYK36RB7A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058409',7.2,3749,'ja','肉体の門','In the shady black markets and bombed-out hovels of post–World War II Tokyo, a tough band of prostitutes eke out a dog-eat-dog existence, maintaining tenuous friendships and a semblance of order in a world of chaos. But when a renegade ex-soldier stumbles into their midst, lusts and loyalties clash, with tragic results. With Gate of Flesh, visionary director Seijun Suzuki delivers a whirlwind of social critique and pulp drama, shot through with brilliant colors and raw emotions.','/yRi34m5PlktF5NdgHEKOzyOkHGo.jpg','1964-05-31',90,'Released',NULL,'Gate of Flesh',86666,2.3899,6.6,'h2pezDnZK0M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4625,_binary '\0','/ukHo2IXsFalApyBgMQOUJGfwtgL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058414',7.9,2522,'en','Nothing But a Man','Railroad laborer Duff Anderson struggles to maintain his dignity and marriage to a preacher\'s daughter in the racially segregated South.','/6vWkmRHsX1yIUJSimDKEJLU4UkD.jpg','1964-12-27',95,'Released','Nothing But a Man has the violence, passion, tenderness of a Negro man and a girl in a smoldering southern town!','Nothing But a Man',91721,2.3395,7.4,'bSjgshFzHJE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4626,_binary '\0','/nbuOVqpn121kZqMrQFT0SdrstRw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058425',6.5,1220,'en','Of Human Bondage','Medical student Philip Carey becomes involved with flirtatious waitress Mildred Rogers. Their love affair is interrupted when Philip is made aware of her constant infidelity. As Mildred quits her job and becomes a prostitute, Philip is still in love with her.','/cCJvEJms76nz1rHex3stQrkQRoE.jpg','1964-09-23',100,'Released','SOME WOMEN CAN\'T HELP BEING WHAT THEY ARE!','Of Human Bondage',120526,2.1542,6.1,'phgOdeijwUQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4627,_binary '\0','/AcAMkNfQ21cL7EJzs5eVx24k3H4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058430',7.8,26181,'ja','鬼婆','While her son, Kichi, is away at war, a woman and her daughter-in-law survive by killing samurai who stray into their swamp, then selling whatever valuables they find. Both are devastated when they learn that Kichi has died, but his wife soon begins an affair with a neighbor who survived the war, Hachi. The mother disapproves and, when she can\'t steal Hachi for herself, tries to scare her daughter-in-law with a mysterious mask from a dead samurai.','/xyPLG53OodhJtvfQEfcmC43l16O.jpg','1964-11-21',105,'Released','The most daring film import ever...From Japan!','Onibaba',3763,3.5275,7.7,'s2SkmwgU8qs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4628,_binary '\0','/1vQrpkfCTuGniO0g71TShNIvMwe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058437',6.2,2748,'en','The Outrage','At a disused railway station, three men -- a con artist, a preacher, and a prospector -- discuss the recent trial and sentencing of the outlaw Juan Carrasco for the murder of a man and the rape of his wife. In their recounting, the three explore the conflicting testimonies of the parties involved in the crimes. Disconcerting new questions arise with each different version of the event.','/9dhtCGXMu0oCLf9Hysrth4cqgKc.jpg','1964-10-07',96,'Released','Was It an Act of Violence or an Act of Love?','The Outrage',85609,2.1533,5.8,'zt9xrEjQZPg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4629,_binary '\0','/e9OTOWpj5d8S2x2yTJqrsE1YIxF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058439',8,1414,'ro','Pădurea spânzuraţilor','In 1916 as an officer in the Habsburg Army ethnic Romanian Apostol Bologa is torn between remaining loyal to the Habsburgs or deserting to the Romanian Army across enemy lines.','/pRFflpigFD9vSoPCcESjwGg4cjz.jpg','1965-03-16',165,'Released',NULL,'Forest of the Hanged',118487,1.3716,6.6,'7aWbJ-H5e8o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4630,_binary '\0','/rxexN7OHk41cNxfmtf9HrXhbTD2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058440',5,1466,'en','Pajama Party','A Martian teenager sent to prepare for an invasion falls in love with an Earth girl.','/uzk45q0phMDlKwgcv5ePmME7yq3.jpg','1964-11-11',87,'Released','The Party Picture That Takes Off Where The Others Pooped Out!','Pajama Party',53617,2.0675,4.8,'NyKXQsXY6HA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4631,_binary '\0','/m1Gei9O5GfLoJHQjBaxWBSkXX2y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058450',7.8,35675,'fr','Les Parapluies de Cherbourg','This simple romantic tragedy begins in 1957. Guy Foucher, a 20-year-old French auto mechanic, has fallen in love with 17-year-old Geneviève Emery, an employee in her widowed mother\'s chic but financially embattled umbrella shop. On the evening before Guy is to leave for a two-year tour of combat in Algeria, he and Geneviève make love. She becomes pregnant and must choose between waiting for Guy\'s return or accepting an offer of marriage from a wealthy diamond merchant.','/tAgTf64XKK5ir7w5C7dnB53jWWG.jpg','1964-02-19',93,'Released','A film for all the young lovers of the world.','The Umbrellas of Cherbourg',5967,6.4725,7.4,'7H-fl3njp5s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4632,_binary '\0','/nhsjEEct8f4GDDSAvkpEJJWfuf2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058453',6.2,10277,'en','Paris When It Sizzles','Hollywood producer Alexander Meyerheimer has hired drunken writer Richard Benson to write his latest movie. Benson has been in Paris supposedly working on the script for months, but instead has spent the time living it up. Benson now has just two days to the deadline and thus hires a temporary secretary, Gabrielle Simpson, to help him finish on time.','/aojHngnnK0kTYjvCwtlfAj8xf4B.jpg','1964-03-01',110,'Released','Go absolutely Ape in...','Paris When It Sizzles',22829,4.2895,6.3,'arz6IfPTGsM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4633,_binary '\0','/map1zRO69SjeUqO8Unbrz7Wzr0y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058456',6.2,2813,'en','The Patsy','Eccentric bellhop Stanley Belt is recruited unexpectedly by the comedy team of a recently deceased entertainer. Stanley struggles to become a song-and-dance man as the team grooms him to become a star. But as the date of a high-stakes appearance on the Ed Sullivan Show grows near, they begin to fear that the only astonishing thing about Stanley is his utter lack of talent.','/3ZzZNKCIBrIHWdChzA55DwXLDoa.jpg','1964-06-24',101,'Released','Jerry\'s a dumb-like-a-fox bellhop that some smart alecs manipulate into stardom...','The Patsy',24062,2.7609,6.2,'8uQDU364YGk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4634,_binary '\0','/9yPgh3v4itb0ah4XWgGM4BdAtNa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058458',7.5,9222,'fr','La Peau douce','Pierre Lachenay is a well-known publisher and lecturer, married to Franca and father of Sabine. He starts a love affair with air hostess Nicole, which Pierre is hiding, but he cannot stay away from her.','/nYo083NgJCAQQByHzYrayxQ5xBV.jpg','1964-04-20',119,'Released','The Eternal Triangle At Its Most Eternal.','The Soft Skin',1719,2.8521,7.155,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4635,_binary '\0','/9gMkOYzk7P9QXwndhLRAC8cMZcJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058461',7.9,256828,'it','Per un pugno di dollari','The Man With No Name enters the Mexican village of San Miguel in the midst of a power struggle among the three Rojo brothers and sheriff John Baxter. When a regiment of Mexican soldiers bearing gold intended to pay for new weapons is waylaid by the Rojo brothers, the stranger inserts himself into the middle of the long-simmering battle, selling false information to both sides for his own benefit.','/lBwOEpwVeUAmrmglcstnaGcJq3Y.jpg','1964-09-12',99,'Released','In his own way he is, perhaps, the most dangerous man who ever lived!','A Fistful of Dollars',391,13.3275,7.8,'RFWYI5buWlY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4636,_binary '\0','/jxyLXwFaccE8XzhF62HauyXJi14.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058500',7.1,3328,'en','The Pumpkin Eater','Jo, the mother of seven children, divorces her second husband in order to marry Jake, a successful but promiscuous screenwriter. Though they are physically and emotionally compatible, they are slowly torn apart.','/5llEDfwte6SnAd2grP065N95yeo.jpg','1964-07-16',110,'Released','A Much Married Woman Who Drifts From Husband to Husband!','The Pumpkin Eater',69557,3.2155,6.648,'8atlrU6F0-g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4637,_binary '\0','/3zBl0FII2tYyAcPnla3CMZjQIaf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058525',6.5,2688,'en','Rio Conchos','Two Army officers, an alcoholic ex-Confederate soldier and a womanizing Mexican travel to Mexico on a secret mission to prevent a megalomaniacal ex-Confederate colonel from selling a cache of stolen rifles to a band of murderous Apaches.','/becKk2SAvZMEz7IAaxy0hCVIhfO.jpg','1964-10-28',107,'Released','Four men stalking the Apache nation...on a mission that could drench the whole Southwest in blood and flames!','Rio Conchos',32560,2.0744,6.3,'fX83XRFS7ZI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4638,_binary '\0','/m26S4JAfI5AhBBDiiYYA1jUcslX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058529',6.4,6173,'en','Robin and the 7 Hoods','Set in Prohibition era Chicago, bootlegger Robbo and his cronies refuse to pay the greedy Guy Gisborne a cut of their profits after Guy shoots mob boss Big Jim and takes over. When Big Jim\'s daughter, Marian, gives Robbo a large sum, believing he has avenged her father\'s death, the gangster donates to an orphanage, cementing his reputation as a softhearted hood.','/1jqQdHnuIDaHB3owOb3BcD5xZgX.jpg','1964-06-24',123,'Released','Like we\'ve taken the Robin Hood legend and changed the bows and arrows to machine guns...! Like with songs yet!.. Like WILD!','Robin and the 7 Hoods',17696,2.9791,6.188,'19GsHdus_Vs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4639,_binary '\0','/ay8Sl3esPX1MyuBOLjl0xI2TiXX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058530',6.4,7714,'en','Robinson Crusoe on Mars','Stranded on Mars with only a monkey as a companion, an astronaut must figure out how to find oxygen, water, and food and companionship on the lifeless planet.','/a3MBNEoquGKZT5UYbq9o509dzTV.jpg','1964-06-01',110,'Released','One U.S. astronaut pitted against all the odds beyond this earth!','Robinson Crusoe on Mars',7348,3.1555,6.281,'Twa8jKrIWE0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4640,_binary '\0','/47ZHqfSt7PtmAJ3DJBR4QGo8aLc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058534',6,3677,'en','Roustabout','After losing his job at a coffee shop, Charlie Rogers finds employment at a struggling carnival, but his attempted romance with a teenager leads to friction with her father.','/nzB1aQauY8GTu1SCQV3EcGOqjXF.jpg','1964-11-11',101,'Released','Elvis Presley as a Roving, Restless, Reckless, ROUSTABOUT','Roustabout',2094,2.5811,6,'aMl-rjMGUWY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4641,_binary '\0','/zd3p7GKopxH4rIjGoDQ1ugalUtx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058536',8,42663,'en','Rudolph the Red-Nosed Reindeer','Sam the snowman tells us the story of a young red-nosed reindeer who, after being ousted from the reindeer games because of his glowing nose, teams up with Hermey, an elf who wants to be a dentist, and Yukon Cornelius, the prospector. They run into the Abominable Snowman and find a whole island of misfit toys. Rudolph vows to see if he can get Santa to help the toys, and he goes back to the North Pole on Christmas Eve. But Santa\'s sleigh is fogged in. But when Santa looks over Rudolph, he gets a very bright idea...','/xjAElUhXuc7zFJPj3qUHjcySNsE.jpg','1964-12-06',52,'Released','You might even say it glows!','Rudolph the Red-Nosed Reindeer',13382,4.6327,7.4,'W6IAY9bSP7s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4642,_binary '\0','/2iGt5GvgmYtxoSCINZxZrNEIcUR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058541',7.2,1276,'he','סאלח שבתי','Sallah Shabati, the patriarch of a big family recently arrived to Israel from Yemen, tries to make money and get better housing, in a country that can barely provide for its own and is in the midst of absorbing hundreds of thousands of Jewish refugees from Arab countries.','/lLLcR8vsbT5EwGfzEoLtuQkp25p.jpg','1964-06-02',110,'Released',NULL,'Sallah',116762,1.2502,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4643,_binary '\0','/aQHjAx6PisDlolT4bM4bHqLP1uJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058544',6.5,9301,'ja','三大怪獣 地球最大の決戦','After a meteorite unleashes a three-headed beast upon Tokyo, Mothra tries to unite with Godzilla and Rodan to battle the extraterrestrial threat.','/qkI5nhvxx3233gQmoQvv0W3MB7A.jpg','1964-12-20',92,'Released','Space Super Monster King Ghidorah attacks the Earth!','Ghidorah, the Three-Headed Monster',15766,3.6622,6.988,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4644,_binary '\0','/bOwjgqQYgh8tkWanOecPIiE79Ks.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058547',7.3,2142,'hi','संगम','An air force pilot, upon returning home from war after being assumed dead, weds the woman he had long loved, unaware that she had been planning to marry his best friend.','/njI2kk6DE6oovfpapO1VEE76Ijl.jpg','1964-06-18',238,'Released',NULL,'Sangam',48926,1.4047,7.4,'Po9HbSpZBC4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4645,_binary '\0','/5f1Li4gdAa16VEwTePZIQ29kPrg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058548',2.8,13340,'en','Santa Claus Conquers the Martians','Martians fear their children have become lazy and joyless due to their newfound obsession with Earth TV shows. After ancient Martian leader Chochem suggests that the children of Mars need more fun—including their own Santa Claus—supreme leader Lord Kimar assembles an expedition to Earth. Once there, they kidnap two children who lead them to the North Pole, then capture the real Santa Claus, taking all three back to Mars in an attempt to bring the Martian children happiness.','/f8lxrcMx98AuvlLSb2hPkz0CuH0.jpg','1964-11-14',81,'Released','Santa brings Christmas fun to Mars!','Santa Claus Conquers the Martians',32307,2.2813,3.18,'X06DV3Hx_Q4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4646,_binary '\0','/bGXaffbdbYqwV4mkVUA4y6F6qdf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058557',7.5,8332,'en','Seance on a Wet Afternoon','Working-class British housewife Myra Savage reinvents herself as a medium, holding seances in the sitting room of her home with the hidden assistance of her under-employed, asthmatic husband, Billy. In an attempt to enhance her credibility as a psychic, Myra hatches an elaborate, ill-conceived plot to kidnap a wealthy couple\'s young daughter so that she can then help the police \"find\" the missing girl.','/dHu7nuNwXTXoPdpNOEPKhHfCBk5.jpg','1964-06-19',116,'Released','Was it magic... Or murder they planned?','Seance on a Wet Afternoon',3092,2.421,7.223,'oLrtv6YfyVE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4647,_binary '\0','/3fQ46Yw7KIxpfHI3wHmVI51q5PP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058561',5.8,1503,'en','The Secret Invasion','During World War II, convicts are recruited by the Allies for an extremely hazardous mission.','/3AhywIKyyom2ec8RgDxy2wTEGyg.jpg','1964-09-16',97,'Released','The Daring Plan; The Staggering Odds!','The Secret Invasion',29032,2.3538,5.8,'nSBecnclJFI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4648,_binary '\0','/f9VuFOKfb7xLR1e4Tex9vRqY8wf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058564',7.9,4395,'it','Sedotta e abbandonata','The film presents the tale of Agnese Ascalone, daughter of prominent miner Vincenzo Ascalone, and takes place in a small town in Sicily. Agnese is seduced by her sister Matilde\'s fiancé, and has a tryst with him for which she confesses and tries to repent, only to be discovered by her mother and father.','/5kmSfkHFaP4kQcoRnSHuxHmvfxg.jpg','1964-01-30',118,'Released',NULL,'Seduced and Abandoned',42790,2.2172,7.657,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4649,_binary '\0','/6eW84lUWSJ09OuWTCNOmTY1i2Cm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058567',7.1,15499,'it','Sei donne per l\'assassino','Isabella, a young model, is murdered by a mysterious masked figure at a fashion house in Rome. When her diary, which details the house employees\' many vices, disappears, the masked killer begins killing off all the models in and around the house to find it.','/zYCQjsdktEvlWTRap836iI5paEL.jpg','1964-03-14',88,'Released','A Fashion House of Models… Becomes a Terror House of Blood!','Blood and Black Lace',28055,4.3908,7.3,'AkIyAvQ83f8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4650,_binary '\0','/odEAcgmBfhgIgRteuq9RQTnNuEd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058571',7,8224,'en','Send Me No Flowers','When a hypochondriac assumes that he is dying, he makes an elaborate plan to ensure his wife\'s happiness. However, trouble ensues when she misunderstands his intentions.','/hBnLdDRU4pDaY6WtmDJGNlY5yzj.jpg','1964-10-14',100,'Released','Rock is ready to make love yesterday, tomorrow, and especially to Day (Doris that is!)','Send Me No Flowers',4939,3.2936,6.782,'wJuDJNhSMGs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4651,_binary '\0','/4IUgVFJzBOwQz2S8CCqBARhN1Hr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058576',7.8,17905,'en','Seven Days in May','A U.S. Marine Corps colonel alerts the president of a planned military coup against him.','/fgMwyNl7uZeUrnIAqlX7htSQ2O2.jpg','1964-02-01',118,'Released','The astounding story of an astounding military plot to take over the United States! The time is 1970 or 1980 or, possibly, tomorrow!','Seven Days in May',23518,4.5511,7.4,'EsMuK_Sos58','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4652,_binary '\0','/rPHvIqO4KuVPxlfwbsnROFbCzQB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058580',6.4,5229,'en','Sex and the Single Girl','A womanizing reporter for a sleazy tabloid magazine impersonates his hen-pecked neighbor in order to get an expose on renowned psychologist Helen Gurley Brown.','/eGGj9foBY4jonHskGq7ysgf2ESR.jpg','1964-12-25',110,'Released','She wrote the book on love!','Sex and the Single Girl',26817,17.2253,6.5,'nemmlHn1QaM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4653,_binary '\0','/26O2JCu4cyR7U3ga1GT7BhTj888.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058586',7.3,34395,'en','A Shot in the Dark','Inspector Jacques Clouseau, smitten with the accused maid Maria Gambrelli, unwittingly turns a straightforward murder investigation into a comedic series of mishaps, testing the patience of his irritable boss Charles Dreyfus as casualties mount.','/pR6tNqNLYIbRRYC5TFKWVWaVvvK.jpg','1964-06-23',102,'Released','…the picture that gets away with murder!','A Shot in the Dark',1594,7.0818,7.188,'y6elEZvYS7w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4654,_binary '\0','/cLKNGx0bFpbtsVOXeaXJw3dNcKQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058604',8.2,12727,'es','Soy Cuba','A study in contrasts set in and around Havana that explores Cuba\'s 1959 revolution: a young woman\'s fascination with the excess of an American-owned casino leads to her downfall in the eyes of her street vendor boyfriend; a tenant farmer revolts the only way he knows how, attacking the land he works; university students gain first-hand knowledge of political upheaval; and, in the hills outside the city, the members of a poor peasant family are patriotically swept up into the burgeoning revolt.','/qQxv27Lae6Uph7iOEzyZ5BOZxJh.jpg','1964-10-26',141,'Released',NULL,'I Am Cuba',32015,3.2682,7.9,'5RtATwDFvak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4655,_binary '\0','/icDYw7BphDSj4OUQH9meWvadphg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058606',6.7,8997,'en','Spider Baby','In a dilapidated rural mansion, the last generation of the degenerate, inbred Merrye family lives with the inherited curse of a disease that causes them to mentally regress from the age of 10 or so on as they physically develop. The family chauffeur looks out for them and covers up their indiscretions. Trouble comes when greedy distant relatives and their lawyer arrive to dispossess the family of its home.','/pKKJsmTGt5MndLT8gBfl1pMp4fU.jpg','1967-12-24',84,'Released','Come into my parlor, said the spider to the...','Spider Baby',28504,2.1883,6.8,'_wSGLxo2OCY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4656,_binary '\0','/gIyO8Z39TLML2RBynKuEely4ky5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058615',1.6,3585,'en','The Starfighters','A young Air Force lieutenant falls in love with fighter planes while his father, a Congressman and war hero, yearns for him to fly heavy bombers.','/oL9iO695oX3sK6B3nsZ6A3xg3bt.jpg','1964-03-25',78,'Released','The blazing adventure of the men and planes who rocket to the very edge of outer space!','The Starfighters',31122,1.1351,1.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4657,_binary '\0','/vFKEzYVfZZ5smPhTjYVB96X6Y06.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058620',6.8,7898,'en','Strait-Jacket','After a twenty-year stay at an asylum for a double murder, a mother returns to her estranged daughter where suspicions arise about her behavior.','/eNL4ydW0KVhennniy3QSYYv18Hp.jpg','1964-01-19',93,'Released','WARNING! \'Strait-Jacket\' vividly depicts ax murders!','Strait-Jacket',29396,2.282,6.6,'DyHcPCUhQSc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4658,_binary '\0','/o4tz9tEYQ5zfbp0771htpxX0NlH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058621',6.2,1354,'en','Strange Bedfellows','After a hasty wedding, Carter and Toni find that they disagree on everything. They separate and seven years later, on the eve before their divorce, meet again and spend the night together. Reality sets in when morning comes and they begin arguing again. Once again, divorce proceedings are on — until Carter finds out that an important promotion hinges on whether he\'s married.','/l2oxd8nGZ7k0pihcNmNxAQ0BC1C.jpg','1965-02-09',98,'Released','They love to fight... but not at night!','Strange Bedfellows',48451,1.8682,6,'fXN2tePlhRY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4659,_binary '\0','/lMEhH0YrC4QqZ58TVfoRcgLT7P5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058622',6.6,1476,'en','The Strangler','An overweight lab technician with low self esteem, brought on by his dominant mother, becomes a serial killer of female nurses.','/dnttPCxSz367Ue2htpedKXSnAWx.jpg','1964-04-01',89,'Released','Based on the terror that has shocked the nation!','The Strangler',42796,1.352,6.4,'xLm2HhhnlA0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4660,_binary '\0','/dxfFh9pTKDaYH2B6PwcR6ohCM1L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058625',8.4,26461,'ja','砂の女','A vacationing entomologist suffers extreme physical and psychological trauma after being taken captive by the residents of a poor seaside village and made to live with a woman whose life task is shoveling sand for them.','/xiBr3bIT2xpbuIKo5bLK7ebP4O1.jpg','1964-02-15',147,'Released','Haunting. Erotic. Unforgettable.','Woman in the Dunes',16672,6.2037,8.2,'7kX4h_sEBiI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4661,_binary '\0','/9UQoFWYiNU1NIz7pQlg5Wnub9In.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058642',7.8,9799,'uk','Тіні забутих предків','In the Carpathian Mountains of 19th-century Ukraine, love, hate, life and death among the Hutsul people are as they’ve been since time began. Ivan is drawn to Marichka, the beautiful young daughter of the man who killed his father. But fate tragically decrees that the two lovers will remain apart.','/9oSZTeejmx80tIBVSqYzJpFhjkI.jpg','1965-10-18',96,'Released',NULL,'Shadows of Forgotten Ancestors',26782,2.5874,7.5,'OeIzpWNG23Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4662,_binary '\0','/1JSIzFQw2gv0f3O1VclHfvGviEB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058649',6.5,1629,'en','The Third Secret','A prominent London psychologist seems to have taken his own life, causing stunned disbelief amongst his colleagues and patients. His teenage daughter refuses to believe it was suicide as this would go against all of the principles her father stood for, therefore she is convinced it was murder. She enlists the help of a former patient to try to get to the truth. However, the truth turns out to be both surprising and disturbing.','/aXaTNMIoAWDyJGNVbf4IeOQnj1I.jpg','1964-02-02',103,'Released','The Story of a Man Searching for a Killer Who Might Be Himself!','The Third Secret',101651,1.8094,6.2,'m-cop9ZChbE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4663,_binary '\0','/acw4C12npNOkbaelv64X01nHEmc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058652',7.6,4508,'ja','三匹の侍','Shiba, a wandering ronin, encounters a band of peasants who have kidnapped the daughter of their dictatorial magistrate, in hopes of coercing from him a reduction in taxes. Shiba takes up their fight, joined by two renegades from the magistrate\'s guard, Sakura and Kikyo. The three outlaws find themselves in a battle to the death.','/5gHucIqPYxKzOhQxyEshbDtuU4m.jpg','1964-05-13',93,'Released','One...two...three Samurai filling the giant screen with flashing swordplay','Three Outlaw Samurai',58878,2.0764,7.5,'i-yHW3drgs4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4664,_binary '\0','/qpGMck9EPT1nzDNWPAwpCKJQiqq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058659',5.3,3677,'en','The Time Travelers','Research scientists experimenting with time warps are accidentally propelled forward into an unbearable future.','/cc3deOS6bejonPRPLsbZBg1LlPN.jpg','1964-10-29',82,'Released','Step Through','The Time Travelers',49160,1.9412,5.1,'856Q5e5lML0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4665,_binary '\0','/k041k12Ap9QYllUOVYvh1N96olT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058663',4.8,1317,'fr','Tintin et les oranges bleues','Professor Calculus\'s friend develops a blue-skinned orange that can grow on any kind of land and survive harsh weather (in the manner of Lue Gim Gong) and therefore solve world hunger. The Professor and his friends, however, run afoul of gangsters who also covet the fruit. The adventure takes them from their home in Marlinspike Hall (Moulinsart), a fictional mansion that is presumably in Belgium, to Spain, where Calculus and another scientist are kidnapped.','/xlYgA1tFhIre1Ou4apLyvXWZDNF.jpg','1964-12-18',105,'Released',NULL,'Tintin and the Blue Oranges',46690,2.2299,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4666,_binary '\0','/jZQwv8GZXsCTXMiMhPylQ8kk7M7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058672',6.9,11735,'en','Topkapi','Arthur Simon Simpson is a small-time crook biding his time in Greece. One of his potential victims turns out to be a gentleman thief planning to steal the emerald-encrusted dagger of the Mehmed II from Istanbul\'s Topkapi Museum.','/pPlJbEkiDjt8opos6Qg0GWLiuSS.jpg','1964-09-02',119,'Released','Join us - we\'ll cut you in on the theft of the century!','Topkapi',5052,1.9125,6.5,'WFiAWWwh168','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4667,_binary '\0','/7DU7mGPrryJMJz63cmdxUZhCwq8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058692',6.6,3332,'fr','La Tulipe noire','Aristocrat Guillaume de Saint Preux leads a double life as a masked bandit known as the Black Tulip. The Black Tulip only robs rich aristocrats, so the local peasants regard him as a hero. Baron La Mouche is convinced Guillaume is the Tulip. During a robbery, he scars the Tulip\'s face, and hopes to use this to expose Guillaume, but Guillaume is one step ahead.','/fYaIoQrEEz2fnJcY3KAzBsPwvF4.jpg','1964-02-28',115,'Released',NULL,'The Black Tulip',12539,3.883,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4668,_binary '\0','/jGQbthB6VN6KJVYTMBzwU3KcwJN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058694',5.7,5671,'en','Two Thousand Maniacs!','Six people are lured into a small Deep South town for a Centennial celebration where the residents kill them one by one as revenge for the town\'s destruction during the Civil War.','/soUfoBbqwhlCshuDz2gS27heOOv.jpg','1964-03-20',87,'Released','An entire town bathed in pulsing human blood! Madmen crazed for carnage!','Two Thousand Maniacs!',28177,1.558,5.532,'2lC5tN8Ou7s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4669,_binary '\0','/9IApWHVAtkXuVdSOnvji3n5zLcq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058700',6.7,24115,'en','The Last Man on Earth','When a disease turns all of humanity into the living dead, the last man on earth becomes a reluctant vampire hunter.','/tTnwBklPiWp5roxtHUO2yHXr9Fw.jpg','1964-05-06',87,'Released','Do you dare imagine what it would be like to be...The last man on earth...Or the last woman.','The Last Man on Earth',21159,3.7707,6.588,'4i7mcozmMZ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4670,_binary '\0','/sghiIicSkXstVJwzXhaFi2G0A9O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058701',7.1,4815,'fr','Une femme mariée: Suite de fragments d\'un film tourné en 1964','A superficial woman finds conflict choosing between her abusive husband and her vain lover.','/3NUhCU2LsffAZNe2Ej0ZjKIpRsi.jpg','1964-12-04',95,'Released','She Loves Two Men... She is Married to One!','The Married Woman',40652,2.644,6.884,'B8xtvvpBahg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4671,_binary '\0','/jqV50ENB0UUnKdbMlQduCv7Dg40.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058708',6.6,4695,'en','The Unsinkable Molly Brown','The buoyant Molly Brown has survived the first crisis of her life—a flood. Sixteen years later she sets out to make her way in the world. She assures the Leadville saloon keeper that she can sing and play the piano, and learns quickly. Soon she marries Johnny Brown, who in a few years will be able to replace the original cigar wrapper wedding ring with a replica in gold and gemstones. The Browns head for Europe and bring a few crowned heads back to Denver for a party that turns into a ballroom brawl. Molly goes to Europe alone, returning on the Titanic. She didn\'t survive a flood as a baby for the story to end here.','/gMFUWB1BHqLtiB2t1pstE6FpT7F.jpg','1964-06-11',128,'Released','Get out of the way... or get hit in the heart!','The Unsinkable Molly Brown',42797,2.7069,5.7,'oqe9jCZ-7mw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4672,_binary '\0','/a7JCZH7g6378BG32OH8UbOAJb8z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058709',5.9,2099,'de','Unter Geiern','Outlaws disguised as Indians commit crimes against settlers but Winnetou and Old Surehand are determined to unmask the bandits and keep the peace. Alternate English Title: Amongst Vultures.','/xVA3LE121ZvwoLdHSxXLyYHfDEn.jpg','1964-12-08',98,'Released','The Indian... The Hunter... and The Girl!','Frontier Hellcat',9347,2.3869,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4673,_binary '\0','/iz7xP1INmMTAfRKaToWVmXrrE1P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058715',7.6,15333,'it','Il vangelo secondo Matteo','Along a rocky, barren coastline, Jesus begins teaching, primarily using parables. He attracts disciples; he\'s stern, brusque, and demanding. His parables often take on the powers that be, so he and his teachings come to the attention of the Pharisees, the chief priests, and elders. They conspire to have him arrested, beaten, tried, and crucified, just as he prophesied to his followers.','/oifi2CQkKbb6Y2x6J5K6CjaKab9.jpg','1965-03-03',137,'Released','A Motion Picture which will be seen by the entire world - up to the end of the world!','The Gospel According to St. Matthew',24192,4.4216,7.4,'xEs4g9A9HGc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4674,_binary '\0','/uxMRuoay5PYW8tsJp2igzFW2qHx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058724',7.4,2186,'en','The Visit','Carla Zachanassian had a child by Serge Miller as a teenager. When Serge refused to marry her, she was driven out of town. By her own wit and cunning, she has returned as a multi-millionaire for a visit. The town lays out the red carpet expecting big things from Carla, only to learn that her sole purpose is to see Serge Miller killed...','/t3BdC8nEa8TlSg1EqXflhon1BHB.jpg','1964-05-06',100,'Released',NULL,'The Visit',151138,2.3512,7.2,'0Y681DYBXec','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4675,_binary '\0','/7AP3RLWMnnJDy1fspP3jK7f89RL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058725',6.4,10222,'en','Viva Las Vegas','Lucky Jackson arrives in Las Vegas with his car literally in tow ready for the first Grand Prix — once he has the money for an engine. He gets the cash easily enough but mislays it when the pretty pool manageress takes his mind off things. It seems he\'ll lose both race and girl, problems complicated by rivalry from womanizing fellow racer Elmo Mancini.','/7YEjLotGpVYVcGGKpqfHX8aDfNJ.jpg','1964-02-08',85,'Released','Elvis is at the wheel but Ann-Margret drives him wild!','Viva Las Vegas',2098,3.1938,6.119,'4CUpdmvx9Ok','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4676,_binary '\0','/daFNDMrofQJJDTT522XxQdDYOcG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058740',6.9,2329,'fr','Week-end à Zuydcoote','In June 1940, during the Dunkirk evacuation of Allied troops to England, French sergeant Julien Maillat and his men debate whether to evacuate to Britain or stay and fight the German troops that are closing-in from all directions.','/xAccmjsaK4bCtA7lBDYTK2p1GuI.jpg','1964-12-18',119,'Released','Only once before, in The Longest Day, has a motion picture achieved such greatness !','Weekend at Dunkirk',75525,2.1461,6.9,'7PPw7S4IuIg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4677,_binary '\0','/ai8RYlN6Mq03yWAcqMQQMl1wKzs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058743',6.9,6937,'en','What a Way to Go!','A four-time widow discusses her four marriages, in which all of her husbands became incredibly rich and died prematurely because of their drive to be rich.','/6fuRkL3OhoeubEOULCMVJsUTaAU.jpg','1964-07-02',111,'Released','What A Cast!... What A Past!... What A Show!...','What a Way to Go!',23574,4.3306,7.1,'kh2MVtfeljQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4678,_binary '\0','/jQIpYLNbQFB6gZGPAuTQlLlPrlD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058745',6.1,1872,'en','Where Love Has Gone','A divorced couple\'s teen-age daughter stands trial for stabbing her mother\'s latest lover.','/bCwFYHfXvgoL8NBELmNEISO2Vaz.jpg','1964-11-02',111,'Released','It\'s Gone Wrong! It\'s Gone Wild!','Where Love Has Gone',73348,2.3816,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4679,_binary '\0','/8B6WE1x650vi2hgc9IKPZKnuXmW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058751',6.5,4027,'de','Winnetou 2. Teil','Forester, a ruthless oil baron, wants to create a war between the native American tribes and the white men. Old Shatterhand, Winnetou and their sidekick Castlepool try to prevent this.','/3UXTBXX4XsM5HqhDW2vxZtcs0fk.jpg','1964-09-17',94,'Released',NULL,'Last of the Renegades',3686,3.8704,6.7,'YkYElPPzRp4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4680,_binary '\0','/qGOLhOyNirLgATt9j26mgidAdQ1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058753',6.1,1902,'en','Witchcraft','When her grave is disturbed by modern-day land developers, a 300-year-old witch is accidentally resurrected and terrorizes an English village.','/nXxxW0Gl66xqwJE9fpTLN0bPqBh.jpg','1964-03-01',79,'Released','Hex Marks the Spot!','Witchcraft',83519,1.3577,6.6,'99rgiZhQElY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4681,_binary '\0','/9JNbwhAWNjE0WPtcgMmKgJSbdjM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058754',6.8,3662,'en','Woman of Straw','Anthony Richmond schemes to get the fortune of his tyrannical, wheelchair-using tycoon uncle Charles Richmond by persuading Maria, a nurse he employs, to marry him.','/tzBJBCwqXKNuIzDUuP03kA0an26.jpg','1964-04-28',122,'Released','It\'s so easy to set fire to a...','Woman of Straw',4999,2.2948,6.2,'lMSmuDFGJfU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4682,_binary '\0','/jgfhWP1i70niAT3J4JtVpNJRZVm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058756',6.6,4292,'en','The World of Henry Orient','A mischievous, adventuresome fourteen-year-old girl and her best friend begin following an eccentric concert pianist around New York City after she develops a crush on him.','/9FWPyQuLy1wsQfDwudM2tHamzBg.jpg','1964-03-19',106,'Released','Step into the world of Henry Orient...and meet two junior-size misses and one king-size nut!','The World of Henry Orient',19662,2.263,5.9,'V_FxV38CsEM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4683,_binary '\0','/41ZWAGMttCr74dq7sAeh44QSJTQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058777',7.7,46819,'en','Zulu','In 1879, during the Anglo-Zulu War, man-of-the-people Lt. Chard and snooty Lt. Bromhead are in charge of defending the isolated and vastly outnumbered Natal outpost of Rorke\'s Drift from tribal hordes.','/9V7tl1kIb67ZPRRNlUdy3JvqEiA.jpg','1964-01-22',138,'Released','Dwarfing the mightiest! Towering over the greatest!','Zulu',14433,4.0968,7.4,'6WuoiR0I8Es','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4684,_binary '\0','/q1Jn9CG3ePA4Ulk558ijlP75Y7z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058863',7.3,1902,'fr','La 317ème Section','In Laos, 1954, eight days before the french defeat in the Indochina war, the 317th platoon – four french soldiers and 41 laotian combatants – has been ordered to leave its outpost and to retreat for the plains of Diên Biên Phu, where the french army is getting stucked. Led by the inexperienced and idealistic sous-lieutenant Torrens, fresh out of the military academy, and by adjutant Willsdorf, a WWII veteran of the Werhmacht, the group must cross 150 kilometers of jungle. But dripping rainwater, hostile nature, and the Viêt-minh ambushes expose them to constant danger.','/h4IzUHwC9IqfO6TNwHkwtDVcAke.jpg','1965-03-31',100,'Released',NULL,'The 317th Platoon',31344,1.3172,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4685,_binary '\0','/33Aeb2U7cFBcD2OS1WFv46heJG0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058886',7.2,8915,'en','The Agony and the Ecstasy','During the Italian Renaissance, Pope Julius II contracts the influential artist Michelangelo to sculpt 40 statues for his tomb. When the pope changes his mind and asks the sculptor to paint a mural in the Sistine Chapel, Michelangelo doubts his painting skills and abandons the project. Divine inspiration returns Michelangelo to the mural, but his artistic vision clashes with the pope\'s demanding personality and threatens the success of the historic painting.','/4ZiwyXtyxYDmMnNiVemCPgxY8X6.jpg','1965-09-16',138,'Released','From the age of magnificence comes a new magnificence in motion pictures.','The Agony and the Ecstasy',36815,3.4,7.044,'aZHbjT-pZ_I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4686,_binary '\0','/jJK3skg06c2iUXgpJg9DTxQhRb4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058888',8.3,23782,'ja','赤ひげ','Aspiring to an easy job as personal physician to a wealthy family, Noboru Yasumoto is disappointed when his first post after medical school takes him to a small country clinic under the gruff doctor Red Beard. Yasumoto rebels in numerous ways, but Red Beard proves a wise and patient teacher. He gradually introduces his student to the unglamorous side of the profession, ultimately assigning him to care for a prostitute rescued from a local brothel.','/iYNH3Re0JSypoYaWvZtERUnNaJL.jpg','1965-03-04',185,'Released','What is the key to life - power, prestige or peace?','Red Beard',3780,6.2019,8.2,'DM-0fWdlx1o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4687,_binary '\0','/iOUhnp01rP9Xr5QG66LMAKSDkYv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058898',6.9,30396,'fr','Alphaville, une étrange aventure de Lemmy Caution','Lemmy Caution is on a mission to eliminate Professor Von Braun, the creator of a malevolent computer that rules the city of Alphaville. Befriended by the scientist’s daughter Natasha, Lemmy must unravel the mysteries of the strictly logical Alpha 60 and teach Natasha the meaning of the word “love.”','/fFJP3D5fJDFxN7ChqSye1DZ0fTL.jpg','1965-05-05',99,'Released','Suddenly the word is Alphaville... and a secret agent is in a breathless race against the Masters of the Future.','Alphaville',8072,4.8985,6.9,'CzaATgGHmy0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4688,_binary '\0','/zN1ICWg3iMimwWJm8g05qcgolcL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058909',6.6,2015,'fr','Angélique et le Roy','Soon after her latest husband death, the King himself (Louis XIV) meets with our heroine and begs her to help convince the Persian Ambassador to agree to a treaty. However, what they didn\'t realize was that the handsome Persian was in fact a sexual sadist. So, it is up to the King\'s half- brother, some Hungarian prince, to save Angélique from the evil troll\'s clutches.','/AtrK32Qdu7oaPqBiN7tGo1BhkJL.jpg','1966-01-31',100,'Released','The dazzling mistress of rogues and royalty gambles her beauty for the favor of the most elegant Libertine in all of France - Louis XIV himself.','Angelique and the King',22183,3.8387,6.514,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4689,_binary '\0','/fooM828h3e59rEd0bOGISLpnsVK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058917',5.9,1405,'en','Arizona Raiders','Murphy plays an ex-Quantrill\'s Raider who\'s released from jail with buddy Cooper to be deputized as Arizona Rangers in order to hunt down the remnant of the gang, rumored to he hiding out in a town \"neer dee border\" in the words of the loose-lipped saloon dancer. The goons are found hiding in an Indian mission. Murphy and Cooper pretend to want to rejoin the gang, but the bad guys catch on and brutally beat Cooper, who protects Murphy\'s true sentiments to the death.','/s2UxpL2AB8xDOhPvy82XV8NHwe2.jpg','1965-08-01',97,'Released','Audie Murphy as a new kind of action-man... Raider-turned-Ranger!','Arizona Raiders',132939,2.0496,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4690,_binary '\0','/4YM42L4T4FdYcWWnbJMVcaa81R8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058926',6.7,3005,'sv','Att angöra en brygga','A group of party goers have trouble getting their boat ashore on a small island. The inhabitants of the island try to help, often with the help of an old sailor, and the results are absurd and hilarious.','/9EqFzloPhNhn2hfRzBMNAWB9XNJ.jpg','1965-12-26',101,'Released',NULL,'Docking the Boat',17091,1.2345,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4691,_binary '\0','/xjQLbQPAt6plkDa8dBpzUoV1ybo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058930',6.3,2291,'en','Baby the Rain Must Fall','Henry Thomas tries to overcome the horrors of his childhood and start a new life with his wife and kid. However, his abusive step-mother and his dependence on alcohol threaten to ruin his future.','/AhUaRlyV0WdbNZADY9ITZzhijh6.jpg','1965-01-12',100,'Released','The more he gets into trouble, the more he gets under her skin!','Baby the Rain Must Fall',95548,2.1267,6.1,'zKiK1VQXLPI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4692,_binary '\0','/60kXjgoXqlKNhtX3TaJZaQDkDYo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058933',4.8,1308,'en','Bad Girls Go to Hell','On the run after dispatching her rapist, homemaker Ellen flees to the Big City, where further misfortunes befall her. When she finally finds stability, she discovers that her landlady\'s son is a detective, threatening her newfound identity and peace of mind.','/vfFT9V2EPHFCgvT6kpBP7MixNAe.jpg','1965-12-24',65,'Released','Possessed with sex, they know no shame!','Bad Girls Go to Hell',42732,1.2843,4.719,'BcJxxaPvkFs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4693,_binary '\0','/ze7GsNSv418o7pzqc9fb00LWWDk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058946',8.1,76981,'it','La battaglia di Algeri','Paratrooper commander Colonel Mathieu, a former French Resistance fighter during World War II, is sent to Algeria to reinforce efforts to squelch the uprisings of the Algerian War. There he faces Ali la Pointe, a former petty criminal who, as the leader of the Algerian Front de Liberation Nationale, directs terror strategies against the colonial French government occupation. As each side resorts to ever-increasing brutality, no violent act is too unthinkable.','/2p3AFtOHFvP6OeVMqlnL1zLKOqL.jpg','1966-09-08',122,'Released','The Revolt that Stirred the World!','The Battle of Algiers',17295,7.2793,7.905,'vhhoS3zOskE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4694,_binary '\0','/oy6iVutVLwR4nj4iykeie0vsbXe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058947',6.8,19307,'en','Battle of the Bulge','In the winter of 1944, the Allied Armies stand ready to invade Germany at the coming of a New Year. To prevent it, Hitler orders an all-out offensive to re-take French territory and capture the major port city of Antwerp.','/vNEw6H6St25991C0a8r6AQKTdqi.jpg','1965-12-16',169,'Released','Warner Bros.\' super action show of shows!','Battle of the Bulge',13524,5.5746,6.9,'mdjau_yi5AY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4695,_binary '\0','/n60K0femXYcGuOc3rKFklNjxJlt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058953',5.7,3429,'en','Beach Blanket Bingo','In the fourth of the highly successful Frankie and Annette beach party movies, a motorcycle gang led by Eric Von Zipper kidnaps singing star Sugar Kane managed by Bullets, who hires sky-diving surfers Steve and Bonnie from Big Drop for a publicity stunt. With the usual gang of kids and a mermaid named Lorelei.','/96PQsb6z1hGtck5ZM5B5CsXm7fw.jpg','1965-04-14',98,'Released','It\'s the game that separates the girls and the boys...into groups of two!','Beach Blanket Bingo',26483,2.0586,6,'C2SBi5BUeXo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4696,_binary '\0','/ldb1wAUNQrsedDMSc5xRIGZymMf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058954',3.4,1240,'en','The Beach Girls and the Monster','A young girl is killed at the beach in Malibu. Professor Otto Lindsay suspects that it is some form of mutated fish. However, his son Richard, who was a good friend of the girl, thinks that it is a madman who has a grudge against Richard and his friends. Soon the list of victims grows.','/tITqhiIr5VhjoaTqtHDxG2TUBEd.jpg','1965-09-01',70,'Released','Go! Go! Go! The Coolest Monster Shindig of Chicks and Chills!','The Beach Girls and the Monster',69780,1.0778,3.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4697,_binary '\0','/yHMyKcZqebSmohORSrJCpUjpnYd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058962',7.3,6761,'en','The Bedford Incident','During a routine patrol, a reporter is given permission to interview a hardened cold-war warrior and captain of the American destroyer USS Bedford. The reporter gets more than he bargained for when the Bedford discovers a Soviet sub and the captain begins a relentless pursuit, pushing his crew to breaking point.','/rRs46zijLxcXQ3MXu1UwU3dz8GU.jpg','1965-10-11',102,'Released','“Hunt her down … until she comes up!”','The Bedford Incident',17744,2.7543,7,'uA-rgKBq7Ss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4698,_binary '\0','/jYDCZaZ0Gduf7m6iMW3KdEevgDo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058977',6.2,1225,'en','Blindfold','A patient being psychoanalyzed by Dr. Snow is a government scientist. General Pratt hides him in a secret place known as \"Base X,\" forcing Dr. Snow to wear a blindfold whenever he is taken there ...','/fzJ5UXjrahKtzwVL407miJX01tH.jpg','1966-05-23',102,'Released','Behind the Blindfold is the Greatest Security Trap Ever Devised!','Blindfold',169066,1.7433,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4699,_binary '\0','/gBzgNPx6hZ4bSCHWJ1VfSni7CFn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058981',6.4,3891,'en','Boeing, Boeing','Living in Paris, journalist Bernard has devised a scheme to keep three fiancées: Lufthansa, Air France and British United. Everything works fine as long as they only come home every third day. But when there\'s a change in their working schedule, they will be able to be home every second day instead. Bernard\'s carefully structured life is breaking apart','/o2eazNQoh4WF7ZcKByhfKSMGc7q.jpg','1965-12-22',102,'Released','The Big Comedy of Nineteen-Sexty-Sex!','Boeing, Boeing',38655,2.2428,6.4,'Ozgd_B0uivI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4700,_binary '\0','/vUAnVogNDQWhwg9YOhacgede1P4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058983',4.5,2670,'it','Il boia scarlatto','A photographer and his models go to an old, abandoned castle for a photo shoot. Unbeknownst to them, the castle is inhabited by a lunatic who believes himself to be the reincarnated spirit of a 17th-century executioner whose job it is to protect the castle against intruders.','/xCBV9KEvgGx5CseJAaPt0r7zX9c.jpg','1965-11-28',87,'Released','He was a homicidal maniac who LIVED TO KILL!','Bloody Pit of Horror',22758,1.8973,4.6,'gJwl4prnVA8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4701,_binary '\0','/wPliKFiYaUEYCWWIIFW9mxjiz0G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058985',7.6,12147,'fr','Le Bonheur','Though married to the good-natured, beautiful Thérèse, young husband and father François finds himself falling unquestioningly into an affair with an attractive postal worker. One of Agnès Varda\'s most provocative films, \'Le bonheur\' examines, with a deceptively cheery palette and the spirited strains of Mozart, the ideas of fidelity and happiness in a modern, self-centered world.','/nNW4ewpsqxEQQoHXv4PAUsFuDmd.jpg','1965-02-10',80,'Released','Only a woman could dare to make this film.','Happiness',53023,6.219,7.445,'H_apt9n4y88','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4702,_binary '\0','/u6cyzNiF95GaZFRmNYRDQJoU0Av.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0058997',7.3,11394,'en','Bunny Lake Is Missing','A woman reports that her young daughter is missing, but there seems to be no evidence that she ever existed.','/zsZ2PAMMyBhkn5OSC8Qnror2KCA.jpg','1965-10-03',107,'Released','No one admitted while the clock is ticking!','Bunny Lake Is Missing',1942,3.5262,7.244,'Nmy8NFY_19k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4703,_binary '\0','/83aNchGigrkj6uDiknje6OwY6sl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059012',7.6,11326,'en','Campanadas a medianoche','Henry IV usurps the English throne, sets in motion the factious War of the Roses and now faces a rebellion led by Northumberland scion Hotspur. Henry\'s heir, Prince Hal, is a ne\'er-do-well carouser who drinks and causes mischief with his low-class friends, especially his rotund father figure, John Falstaff. To redeem his title, Hal may have to choose between allegiance to his real father and loyalty to his friend.','/5Fjxyz3u2Zdco4WeuC3wQ6O5tYQ.jpg','1965-12-22',115,'Released','A Distinguished Company Breathes Life Into Shakespeare’s Lusty Age of FALSTAFF','Chimes at Midnight',986,2.8358,7.2,'bxdJTgBHqUQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4704,_binary '\0','/rWFIvCYYlaHfA42DWzKRO5WjAVT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059014',6.2,3758,'en','Carry On Cowboy','Stodge City is in the grip of the Rumpo Kid and his gang. Mistaken identity again takes a hand as a \'sanitary engineer\' named Marshal P. Knutt is mistaken for a law marshal. Being the conscientious sort, Marshal tries to help the town get rid of Rumpo, and a showdown is inevitable. Marshal has two aids—revenge-seeking Annie Oakley and his sanitary expertise.','/22EXyio02raVcI6dt6X69NoxBSy.jpg','1965-11-26',93,'Released','How the west was lost!','Carry On Cowboy',5065,2.0403,6.3,'zZOZwyqOxEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4705,_binary '\0','/bB8OQAE9KumhiaQfdUYsq8otHdN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059015',6.4,1528,'it','Casanova \'70','The amorous adventures of Andrea Rossi-Colombotti, an army officer who finds pleasure with beautiful women in life-threatening situations.','/x93gr9oIiAviLCOCIcr7eKLDF6T.jpg','1965-06-15',110,'Released','Made in all the loveliest places...Burma, Switzerland, Germany, France, Italy','Casanova \'70',3520,2.1773,6.367,'jb27-zuDfWg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4706,_binary '\0','/vITHhBDV2t4QIT9UBcLl4zEa7Zy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059017',6.7,17638,'en','Cat Ballou','A woman seeking revenge for her murdered father hires a famous gunman, but he\'s very different from what she expects.','/3WJmB1F5z4mLwt84i1FuIrSYEe.jpg','1965-06-24',97,'Released','It\'s That Way-Out Whopper Of A Funny Western...A She-Bang To End All She-Bangs!','Cat Ballou',11694,4.7598,6.4,'2wlGJ_j0viE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4707,_binary '\0','/ucWnzjWWWd6CmRal8J3tWz6m1A7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059026',8.3,50979,'en','A Charlie Brown Christmas','When Charlie Brown complains about the overwhelming materialism that he sees amongst everyone during the Christmas season, Lucy suggests that he become director of the school Christmas pageant. Charlie Brown accepts, but it is a frustrating struggle. When an attempt to restore the proper spirit with a forlorn little fir Christmas tree fails, he needs Linus\' help to learn the meaning of Christmas.','/vtaufTzJBMJAeziQA1eP4BLU24C.jpg','1965-12-09',25,'Released','That\'s what Christmas is all about, Charlie Brown!','A Charlie Brown Christmas',13187,5.7808,7.7,'dV9sgMB-BKE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4708,_binary '\0','/3IlZ4fSnthp0h1gPES3Ar03tqSy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059037',7.2,19936,'en','The Cincinnati Kid','An up-and-coming poker player tries to prove himself in a high-stakes match against a long-time master of the game.','/s4Apy8FcF6a0lR1Qay1atpfwAv9.jpg','1965-10-15',102,'Released','He\'d take on anyone, at anything, anytime.','The Cincinnati Kid',886,3.8404,7,'sWBWeVVaIPk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4709,_binary '\0','/rqpa2fAAHvH3ej9e2LWrpn0N8xl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059043',7.5,13369,'en','The Collector','A man kidnaps a woman and holds her hostage just for the pleasure of having her there.','/iMiih5FGHwpUCAaJAIkYKl5Hffi.jpg','1965-06-17',119,'Released','Almost a love story.','The Collector',42740,3.9687,7.351,'5CuxkTnu-CA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4710,_binary '\0','/9Yjb2T5qIJjsouQ22chA7JqD7XZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059044',5.1,2190,'en','Color Me Blood Red','A crackpot painter kills people to use their blood as his new crimson red color for his art.','/wQR9ZhhZ7LZwZVnm0dcTs8LdG20.jpg','1965-10-13',79,'Released','Fiendish is the word for it!','Color Me Blood Red',28180,1.5057,4.7,'543BJ4K1lcc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4711,_binary '\0','/rYFZ2NChSQrjSqa9EkqWboOmrtJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059049',6.9,2195,'it','Il compagno Don Camillo','Priest Don Camillo blackmails his friendly rival Peppone into letting him join a Communist delegation visiting the Soviet Union.','/rBNEwPdjy8Ph8MDdYvaxlT1mlIN.jpg','1965-09-18',109,'Released',NULL,'Don Camillo in Moscow',37991,1.9448,7.1,'9IqjCh8-DPY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4712,_binary '\0','/o