ied to transport himself along with a tiny housefly, continues to pursue his father\'s experiment, while his own two sons attempt to extricate him, themselves and the family name from further disaster and scandal.','/vxHiDzbLPkYzYv9muxXrjZSf6SX.jpg','1965-05-01',86,'Released','Piece by Piece...Atom by Atom...Humans Invisibly Teleported Through Time and Space!!!','Curse of the Fly',38125,2.2695,5.4,'iRCFaXOqcpQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4716,_binary '\0','/kV73hJI6YUidib2OFKPUaKKwt4m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059079',6.9,5732,'zh','大醉俠','Golden Sparrow is a fighter-for-hire who has been contracted by the local government to retrieve the governor\'s kidnapped son. Holding him is a group of rebels who are demanding that their leader be released from prison in return for the captured son. After a brief encounter with the gang at a local restaurant, Golden Sparrow is joined by an inebriated wanderer Drunken Cat who aids her in her mission.','/bVQhrpCfMZy8YoiAmbze1qWIoho.jpg','1966-04-07',91,'Released',NULL,'Come Drink with Me',26259,3.0178,6.7,'01Xl296CxQE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4717,_binary '\0','/eSUVRiUdaJMTeCMgAXxR3zTjLdq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059080',5.3,4335,'ja','大怪獣ガメラ','A nuclear explosion in the far north unleashes Gamera, the legendary flying turtle, from his sleep under the ice. In his search for energy, Gamera wreaks havoc over the entire world, and it\'s up to the scientists, assisted by a young boy with a strange sympathic link to the monster, to put a stop to Gamera\'s rampage.','/iwjp6qJaWNGOLDU9zzar0SMcPjl.jpg','1965-11-27',79,'Released','Striking down jets, grabbing hold of the Tokyo Tower, flying through the air breathing fire, the giant monster of the century!','Gamera, the Giant Monster',21930,1.6599,5.9,'2PCM3EVD6lo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4718,_binary '\0','/8b6j2HY159XwnLn6Qh9HxrtYeR0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059084',7,8890,'en','Darling','Diana, a beautiful but shallow and easily distracted model and failed actress, toys with the affections of several men while attempting to gain fame and fortune in Swinging London.','/cBd5YO9xG7VmRuC8Q27uR3PV9mn.jpg','1965-08-03',128,'Released','When she was good she was very, very good… and when she was bad she was DARLING!','Darling',24134,3.5254,6.742,'1IbxDEjGJc0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4719,_binary '\0','/cE1DdUr5VSJtdNZNI9wlWBE5nwh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059094',6.3,2073,'en','Dear Brigitte','Professor Leaf, an absent-minded poet with a prejudice against the sciences, is forced to face the fact that his son is a math prodigy with little artistic talent of his own.','/j6e1w0bmoaQpu74QLuYWdsne9dl.jpg','1965-01-08',100,'Released','What\'s All the Noise About??? It\'s Laughter...About the Funniest Picture of the Year!','Dear Brigitte',42734,1.538,6.4,'n5yrk_rW7-w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4720,_binary '\0','/dCfusmm2ZeT2jnCd0biDAzIpSHx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059095',6.6,5835,'it','La decima vittima','In the near future, big wars are avoided by giving individuals with violent tendencies a chance to kill in the Big Hunt. The Hunt is the most popular form of entertainment in the world and also attracts participants who are looking for fame and fortune. It includes ten rounds for each competitor, five as the hunter and five as the victim.','/qwXXxwnN1yj5XiZBUrdazBRMqw1.jpg','1965-12-02',92,'Released','It\'s the 21st century and they have a licence to kill.','The 10th Victim',65632,3.7289,6.666,'tp8wRHNmniQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4721,_binary '\0','/k2Q0ma55NK8nshooakwnIHZFSPn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059106',6.3,3656,'en','Fanatic','A young woman is terrorized by her former fiance\'s demented mother who blames her for her son\'s death. Also known as Die! Die! My Darling!','/p0FiaEEMw0WPGSh7MslmPgs9DFq.jpg','1965-03-21',97,'Released','She\'s One Mean Mother-in-Law!','Fanatic',42735,2.431,6.6,'SIbPwO6h9Xs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4722,_binary '\0','/8PEBA5K96VtyNE6oE9PbsHFN3lQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059112',5.9,2038,'en','Do Not Disturb','When American couple Janet and Mike move to England for his business, she soon fears he\'s having an affair with his attractive secretary and decides to get back at him by pretending she has been unfaithful.','/tWsXxglsq4zSH50RKgfPGCFm5hT.jpg','1965-12-22',103,'Released','What Should a Girl Do When Opportunity Knocks...Twice?','Do Not Disturb',45256,1.9367,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4723,_binary '\0','/wUaDgHfW7fViru7IubWa6Nronq9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059113',7.9,88041,'en','Doctor Zhivago','The life of a Russian physician and poet who, although married to another, falls in love with a political activist\'s wife and experiences hardship during World War I and then the October Revolution.','/r0Iv2BiCFYDnzc6uU1q3AJ56igT.jpg','1965-12-22',200,'Released','A Love Caught in the Fire of Revolution','Doctor Zhivago',907,7.6248,7.55,'6GkLjncctic','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4724,_binary '\0','/r3WMDOfXdlpO4USrBV4oeYzdznR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059114',6.4,1401,'it','Un dollaro bucato','Two brothers part company only to be reunited when one is hired to stop a thief who turns out to be his sibling.','/qYPqaacXnlHJkTV4T8UkPxWqIGa.jpg','1965-08-08',99,'Released','Death for a silver dollar!','Blood for a Silver Dollar',95838,2.168,6.714,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4725,_binary '\0','/mzNAJqEjFevV3qr746yEwljT2Sy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059116',7,1875,'it','La donna del lago','While visiting his favorite resort village during winter, a writer investigates the apparent suicide of a woman he was infatuated with.','/cwa9oWlNqUNrDCuwir3y84iKK8P.jpg','1965-07-24',85,'Released',NULL,'The Possessed',104244,1.6453,6.8,'wKWZ8T70Y7E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4726,_binary '\0','/8P4YHsHMimLyDEK5EhOPGfjmRwD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059124',5.1,2900,'en','Dr. Goldfoot and the Bikini Machine','Mad scientist Dr. Goldfoot has invented an army of bikini-clad robots programmed to seek out wealthy men and charm them into signing over their assets. Secret agent Craig Gamble and millionaire Todd Armstrong set out to foil his fiendish plot.','/v1NPmkAgQ85fTJAD7cmZ2EcFCvh.jpg','1965-11-06',88,'Released','Super sexbots... built to kill!','Dr. Goldfoot and the Bikini Machine',26573,2.8395,5.2,'e6kC3nNR4Zg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4727,_binary '\0','/lX9j2uDbhJONuhQqUFjcRPQB6Ja.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059125',6.6,8785,'en','Dr. Terror\'s House of Horrors','Five train passengers are joined by a mysterious fortuneteller who offers to read Tarot. A quintet of stories unfold: an architect returns to his ancestral home to find a vengeful werewolf; a doctor suspects his new wife is a vampire; an intelligent vine takes over a house; a jazz musician plagiarises music from a voodoo ceremony; and a pompous art critic is pursued by a disembodied hand.','/ccQtFSAGievlTYpuS88PCTHzLu7.jpg','1965-02-23',98,'Released','Acclaimed as \"THE FEAR OF THE YEAR.\"','Dr. Terror\'s House of Horrors',26811,3.3659,6.5,'-FFeBEPMCJA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4728,_binary '\0','/z2m3gXtNOzwkVlh0dEOcQIZj1QD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059126',5.6,5924,'en','Dr. Who and the Daleks','Scientist Doctor Who accidentally activates his new invention, the Tardis, a time machine disguised as a police telephone box. Who, his two granddaughters Barbara and Susan, and Barbara\'s boyfriend Ian are transported through time and space to the planet Skaro, where a peaceful race of Thals are under threat of nuclear attack from the planet\'s other inhabitants: the robotic mutant Daleks.','/qhCHlQFb3DoI0JcofRdN8F1PBSh.jpg','1965-08-23',82,'Released','Now on the Big Screen in COLOUR!','Dr. Who and the Daleks',26581,2.7111,5.7,'lFM2xAkD1y8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4729,_binary '\0','/1BaTdEzBaZDW8z1wk1twkXMpwsd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059127',6.6,12088,'en','Dracula: Prince of Darkness','Whilst vacationing in the Carpathian Mountain, two couples stumble across the remains of Count Dracula\'s castle. The Count\'s trusted servant kills one of the men, suspending the body over the Count\'s ashes so that the blood drips from the corpse and saturates the blackened remains. The ritual is completed, the Count revived and his attentions focus on the dead man\'s wife who is to become his partner; devoted to an existence of depravity and evil.','/9uSP0h1jYZSLd3fZw1b4H1w3cPo.jpg','1966-01-09',90,'Released','DEAD for Ten Years DRACULA, Prince of Darkness, LIVES AGAIN!','Dracula: Prince of Darkness',17102,3.3517,6.7,'zg9w_5hdL3g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4730,_binary '\0','/kbHbhSANzJBMfM8aqW8hnII29e3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059143',6.6,1455,'en','The Early Bird','Norman Pitkin is the assistant helping to run a small, old fashioned dairy which is threatened by a larger, modern organisation. Pitkin does his best to save the dairy (and his horse) and the usual chaos ensues','/3pad4nciJUrKUMNOGa5lLiClYjw.jpg','1965-11-30',98,'Released','His Latest and Funniest and First Time in Colour','The Early Bird',38387,1.4321,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4731,_binary '\0','/amhZdJUOM9CbYUlIWPujdf9yfU6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059159',6.9,1847,'ja','悦楽','After committing murder, businessman Atsushi is blackmailed into keeping a suitcase of embezzled money. What follows is a descent into lustful, reckless actions and regret.','/59AjVcpVAEb0k4VcGgbgNgICEon.jpg','1965-08-29',91,'Released',NULL,'Pleasures of the Flesh',72026,1.564,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4732,_binary '\0','/qYMN0gn97qRqB8AwZb4F2hUnoY9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059160',6.4,2279,'en','Eva','Best-selling author Tyvian Jones has a life of leisure in Venice, Italy, until he has a chance encounter with sultry Frenchwoman Eva Olivier. He falls for her instantly, despite already having wedding plans with Francesca Ferrara. Winning Eva\'s affection proves elusive; she\'s more interested in money than in love. But Tyvian remain steadfast in his obsession, going after Eva with a fervor that threatens to destroy his life.','/cEBNSaPwlp7s8oQoopovMFVKreA.jpg','1962-10-03',100,'Released','They called her the 8th deadly sin!','Eva',94655,1.6564,5.961,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4733,_binary '\0','/86TP3RmtWQc9QPPLh2pXpEVrmc9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059161',2.4,1626,'en','The Eye Creatures','A teenager and his girlfriend must save the world from \"eye\" aliens after their attempts to convince authorities of an invasion fall on deaf ears.','/7vqyB8KcgafSzJXzi7fKDTKOHs0.jpg','1967-10-20',80,'Released','World Panic as UFOs Approach Earth...','The Eye Creatures',63088,1.2207,3.1,'aHYcEWmLRso','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4734,_binary '\0','/nZT9v48vZrIMvKdaDThMW0QbpAq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059162',5.8,2229,'en','The Face of Fu Manchu','Grisly strangulations in London alert Nayland Smith of Scotland Yard to the possibility that fiendish Fu Manchu may not after all be dead, even though Smith witnessed his execution. A killer spray made from Tibetan berries seems to be involved and clues keep leading back to the Thames.','/sOsKQovokQUKW4fqGdbxBmpvxak.jpg','1965-08-06',96,'Released','Obey Fu Manchu Or Every Living Thing Will Die!','The Face of Fu Manchu',3481,2.4135,6.2,'PuJRxviIAbA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4735,_binary '\0','/pWw8wrDKUJRszAHKJqJ9Fn0oFWl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059166',6.2,2724,'en','The Family Jewels','A young heiress must choose between six uncles, one of which is up to no good and out to harm the girl\'s beloved bodyguard who practically raised her.','/1Ar6Aq75Ro35XTqjDr3KgJFRobP.jpg','1965-07-01',99,'Released','Jerry is seven times nuttier in seven gems of character portrayal!','The Family Jewels',52122,2.6001,6.5,'Pj9N_x2ypUc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4736,_binary '\0','/ofQyDtvprS9qtXtXhBQQoZIkiv0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059168',6.8,9407,'fr','Fantômas se déchaîne','In the second episode of the trilogy Fantômas kidnaps distinguished scientist professor Marchand with the aim to develop a super weapon that will enable him to menace the world. Fantômas is also planning to abduct a second scientist, professor Lefebvre.','/m5fyoLC3CAZbeo1lJnGtbLsC949.jpg','1965-12-08',105,'Released',NULL,'Fantomas Unleashed',1870,3.4995,6.735,'Lus57L9i6yg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4737,_binary '\0','/j7UOjPzoYRDQlayNLswiNRzmtK9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059170',6.6,17564,'en','Faster, Pussycat! Kill! Kill!','A trio of thrill-seeking go-go dancers kidnap a young girl and attempt to seduce an old rancher and his two sons out of their small fortune, but their scheme doesn\'t play out as intended.','/2hIHFk52SZ9XsZB4U85RUq36BT4.jpg','1965-08-06',83,'Released','SUPERWOMEN! BELTED, BUCKLED and BOOTED!','Faster, Pussycat! Kill! Kill!',315,3.883,6.4,'gLTnzo-nd8Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4738,_binary '\0','/kQVe1fh6H3q5bCMM5nXt1tKS0hv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059183',7.5,24445,'en','The Flight of the Phoenix','A cargo aircraft crashes in a sandstorm in the Sahara with less than a dozen men on board. One of the passengers is an airplane designer who comes up with the idea of ripping off the undamaged wing and using it as the basis for a replacement aircraft they need to build before their food and water run out.','/zrzLl7NWdjwGhVE7bqpOAxMVtF.jpg','1965-12-15',142,'Released','Theirs was the triumph - yours, the excitement!','The Flight of the Phoenix',10243,5.924,7.2,'OUyP-qIdzJk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4739,_binary '\0','/fCvMaGxddK4y1vvYSdYn74uZ0oZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059199',3.8,2267,'en','Frankenstein Meets the Space Monster','When an atomic war on Mars destroys the planet\'s women, it\'s up to Martian Princess Marcuzan and her right-hand man Dr. Nadir to travel to earth and kidnap women for new breeding stock. Landing in Puerto Rico, they shoot down a NASA space capsule manned by an android. With his electronic brain damaged, the android terrorizes the island while the Martians raid beaches and pool parties','/aJO5PMnntvWKUazEf3gF9ObFxXZ.jpg','1965-09-22',79,'Released',NULL,'Frankenstein Meets the Space Monster',3166,1.6711,4.7,'O9It2mr5hP8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4740,_binary '\0','/pGDGr33gZvozMMV0fO2krFCcy1w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059205',5.5,2716,'ja','フランケンシュタイン対地底怪獣','During WWII, Germans obtain the immortal heart of Frankenstein\'s monster and transport it to Japan to prevent it being seized by the Allies. Kept in a Hiroshima laboratory, it is seeming lost when the United States destroys the city with the atomic bomb. Years later a wild boy is discovered wandering the streets of the city alone, born of the immortal heart.','/wXzG32nsY6i8mMslXGrsHMOZla9.jpg','1965-08-08',90,'Released','A fearsome kaijin? A mad new antagonistic kaiju? A golden entertainment epic of Japan-U.S. collaboration!','Frankenstein Conquers the World',3160,5.4686,6.7,'Q3cej8jiLk8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4741,_binary '\0','/nnfVMtkUcIqQBVodjLJzWRqRhLF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059219',5.8,2698,'en','Genghis Khan','This is the story of the shy Mongol boy Temujin who,during the 13th century, becomes the fearless Mongol leader Genghis Khan that unites all Mongol tribes and conquers India,China,Persia,Korea and parts of Rusia,Europe and Middle-East.','/xDbKUiPsEYGppuTOzGQoBU3UBMv.jpg','1965-04-15',127,'Released','Only once in the furied history of adventure and conquest...did one man rule so vast an empire!','Genghis Khan',4868,2.5852,5.7,'CEobBH9X8d4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4742,_binary '\0','/phhe9poa5jq95FJCAMXD7BdNQ6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059221',7.3,8514,'en','The Ghost and Mr. Chicken','Luther Heggs, a typesetter for the town newspaper, pitches an idea for a story about a local haunted house where a famous murder/suicide occurred 20 years earlier. After the editor assigns Luther to spend one night alone in the mansion, Heggs has a number of supernatural encounters and writes a front page story that makes him a hometown hero...until the nephew of the deceased sues him for libel.','/AomOgoN5kmVtMWWMKVeTPT8nVOE.jpg','1966-01-20',90,'Released','G-G-GUARANTEED! YOU\'LL BE SCARED UNTIL YOU LAUGH YOURSELF SILLY!','The Ghost and Mr. Chicken',13343,3.7118,6.731,'LzZ0XO4ly1g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4743,_binary '\0','/7IVPxy9v0exnYRgoWNI2EiHGyXz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059224',6.4,3295,'en','Girl Happy','Chicago mobster Big Frank hires rock & roll singer Rusty Wells and his band to keep an eye on his daughter during Spring Break in Fort Lauderdale.','/J8QebKJaB52o34sTXEfZ0bVYev.jpg','1965-04-01',96,'Released','Elvis jumps with the campus crowd to make the beach \'ball\' bounce!!!','Girl Happy',18682,3.1577,6.4,'efJPNRm8Gcg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4744,_binary '\0','/9VeXz4mj4QaOfTNSLy0owJHkWEo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059229',7.4,15885,'it','Giulietta degli spiriti','Middle-aged Giulietta grows suspicious of her husband, Giorgio, when his behavior grows increasingly questionable. One night when Giorgio initiates a seance amongst his friends, Giulietta gets in touch with spirits and learns more about herself and her painful past. Slightly skeptical, but intrigued, she visits a mystic who gives her more information -- and nudges her toward the realization that her husband is indeed a philanderer.','/NbN10moPWQiiIKDJsC7A3j4Mcy.jpg','1965-10-22',148,'Released','The inhibitions... the desires... the obsessions... of a jealous woman held prisoner by her own dreams','Juliet of the Spirits',19120,3.1494,7.2,'RcPiyeQRVy0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4745,_binary '\0','/bONqGKL72vZup5huGNaGGxrdOpw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059241',6.9,1232,'fr','Les Grandes Gueules','Hector Valentin returns to France from Canada when he inherits a small sawmill. He has difficulties restarting the run-down operation which has inefficient workers and is hampered by the dirty tactics of its bigger...','/y1OV7AbXCPPacXpASpL6X7csU7B.jpg','1965-10-22',128,'Released',NULL,'The Wise Guys',74767,1.8437,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4746,_binary '\0','/vga7453tBLXDqxeTV2IGUpVgIgk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059243',7.2,21804,'en','The Great Race','Professional daredevil and white-suited hero, The Great Leslie, convinces turn-of-the-century auto makers that a race from New York to Paris (westward across America, the Bering Straight and Russia) will help to promote automobile sales. Leslie\'s arch-rival, the mustached and black-attired Professor Fate vows to beat Leslie to the finish line in a car of Fate\'s own invention.','/9rL8GWuFdO3fLXcNV9rZRHskoOn.jpg','1965-07-01',160,'Released','The movie with 20,000-miles or one-million-laughs guarantee!','The Great Race',11575,5.5663,7.1,'9biklE2wA6M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4747,_binary '\0','/f6JjKDXn66XgNnYjBcKiwO4h3A7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059245',6.6,13599,'en','The Greatest Story Ever Told','From his birth in Bethlehem to his death and eventual resurrection, the life of Jesus Christ is given the all-star treatment in this epic retelling. Major aspects of Christ\'s life are touched upon, including the execution of all the newborn males in Egypt by King Herod; Christ\'s baptism by John the Baptist; and the betrayal by Judas after the Last Supper that eventually leads to Christ\'s crucifixion and miraculous return.','/c21ON7BZn0jwdNl6ibZ1vhXJmpy.jpg','1965-04-09',199,'Released','Only once in a lifetime... an entertainment so rich... an experience so rewarding...','The Greatest Story Ever Told',2428,5.6467,6.4,'z0XO3ojIGHI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4748,_binary '\0','/9hXAAN4xUdXlr0gPwAtKztnEUDt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059246',8.4,13075,'hi','Guide','A tourist guide meets an unhappy married woman who wants to take up dancing. With his motivation, she becomes a successful dancer but success corrupts the man\'s mind.','/a31qY8UA4hsJdwFrollZ1iRzukC.jpg','1965-02-06',183,'Released','A classic Indian drama of love, sacrifice, downfall and redemption.','Guide',80484,1.2781,6.744,'JEUt35teTw8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4749,_binary '\0','/vtSWA6SKzJRiht7FBNXebinsNtE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059250',6.4,5012,'en','The Hallelujah Trail','A wagon train heads for Denver with a cargo of whisky for the miners. Chaos ensues as the Temperance League, the US cavalry, the miners and the local Indians all try to take control of the valuable cargo.','/umgRSG9XnV3tIitq37gdTR4gxnT.jpg','1965-06-23',165,'Released','Cinerama sends you roaring with laughter and adventure down that wide and wonderful fun-trail!','The Hallelujah Trail',23194,3.0655,6.1,'XqL8TlCON_U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4750,_binary '\0','/amxpyBU4rY74lQ3xe7xv2mco9jU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059252',5.5,1280,'en','Harlow','Jean Harlow arrives in Los Angeles as a teenager, pushed into showbiz by her mother and stepfather. Kindhearted agent Arthur Landau becomes Jean\'s mentor, while a devious Howard Hughes-like mogul grows infatuated with the beautiful young actress. Harlow herself falls for producer Paul Bern before tragedy strikes.','/q2sPkI179LpW5l4UMyAJfAtpMUF.jpg','1965-06-23',125,'Released','Harlow stood for only one thing - as no woman ever has - before or since!','Harlow',6971,1.6838,5.6,'dJRQ87N3n0s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4751,_binary '\0','/3S7ACYS4Z0HzT7rHNfb4qwMtJT8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059255',4.6,2172,'en','Harum Scarum','Johnny Tyronne, action movie star and ladies\' man, is traveling through the Middle East on a goodwill tour to promote his latest film. Upon arrival, however, he\'s kidnapped by a gang of assassins so impressed with his cinematic adventures that they want him to carry out an assassination for them.','/kjBn7Ujj2ywCif5pdI3YwvEbvpT.jpg','1965-12-15',85,'Released','1001 Swingin\' nights as ELVIS brings the Big Beat to Bagdad in a riotous, rockin\' rollin\' adventure spoof!!!','Harum Scarum',7506,2.05,4.8,'liTPKgSj4jQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4752,_binary '\0','/qhpib62efVnZon7yiYaV1hEb2kF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059260',7.1,21428,'en','Help!','An obscure Eastern cult that practices human sacrifice pursues Ringo after he unknowingly puts on a ceremonial ring (that, of course, won\'t come off). On top of that, a pair of mad scientists, members of Scotland Yard, and a beautiful but dead-eyed assassin all have their own plans for the Fab Four.','/nLvgIB3bVb8jyhls5W6B74Xt4Ei.jpg','1965-07-29',92,'Released','Stop worrying! HELP! is on the way!','Help!',14831,3.2522,6.9,'Zn99sY-PdtU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4753,_binary '\0','/pdUjaz2BGxt2z2p9mVHcf9D2yxH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059263',6.5,9215,'en','The Heroes of Telemark','Set in German-occupied Norway, resistance fighter Knut Straud enlists the reluctant physicist Rolf Pedersen in an effort to destroy the German heavy water production plant in rural Telemark.','/rKGD7tR8mj02IyQbacmBxE5RIae.jpg','1965-11-12',131,'Released','Unarmed and outnumbered, they stunned the world with their incredible victory.','The Heroes of Telemark',16850,4.3292,6.9,'RYezsD46FMU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4754,_binary '\0','/te2inmHAbGbK9wVnW37lmqcBTCx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059269',6.5,2484,'en','A High Wind in Jamaica','In 1870, a Jamaican colonial family sends its children to Britain for proper schooling, but their ship is taken over by pirates, who become fond of the kids.','/HJbD89cwclhExqQDvRKXVDSLNL.jpg','1965-05-01',103,'Released','Piracy and High Adventure on the High Seas!','A High Wind in Jamaica',38340,2.5628,6.3,'w8QKNw2xRe0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4755,_binary '\0','/mOi2oONVYBPNa7Y55PGrqbaKczp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059274',7.8,16653,'en','The Hill','North Africa, World War II. British soldiers on the brink of collapse push beyond endurance to struggle up a brutal incline. It\'s not a military objective. It\'s The Hill, a manmade instrument of torture, a tower of sand seared by a white-hot sun. And the troops\' tormentors are not the enemy, but their own comrades-at-arms.','/cmBpImAjHJnuHXMVByzqnxtDcae.jpg','1965-06-11',123,'Released','They went up like men! They came down like animals!','The Hill',24395,4.5505,7.5,'ww4_ZbsDK1M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4756,_binary '\0','/o8RWNYzLwKM36HcabBN37MAaWEK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059287',4.8,1804,'en','How to Stuff a Wild Bikini','When he\'s stationed in Tahiti, a sailor hires a witch doctor to keep an eye on his girlfriend.','/285efVjhE5xMnKWVJDRieEcBqQd.jpg','1965-07-14',93,'Released','It\'s a Beginner\'s Course in \'Boy-Girlsmanship\'','How to Stuff a Wild Bikini',26879,1.7678,5.3,'vseYA1O4zMI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4757,_binary '\0','/6sH1zc18D67CKE7Lyux2kyww0SC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059297',6.2,3802,'en','I Saw What You Did','Teenage friends Kit and Libby make prank phone calls for fun but then find themselves involved in a brutal double murder committed by one of their targets.','/mliHs2Ii393vF0A3i73F6jAysdh.jpg','1965-07-21',82,'Released','Don\'t laugh little girl, better run for your life. The man you were talking to, has just murdered his wife!','I Saw What You Did',28295,2.2888,6.2,'6fJgN686Znw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4758,_binary '\0','/cluK5pUbcnKQt3iN17A42MEgAuy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059303',7,2038,'ja','異聞猿飛佐助','Years of warfare end in a Japan unified under the Tokugawa shogunate, and samurai spy Sasuke Sarutobi, tired of conflict, longs for peace. When a high-ranking spy named Tatewaki Koriyama defects from the shogun to a rival clan, however, the world of swordsmen is thrown into turmoil. After Sasuke is unwittingly drawn into the conflict, he tracks Tatewaki, while a mysterious, white-hooded figure seems to hunt them both. By tale’s end, no one is who they seemed to be, and the truth is far more personal than anyone suspected. Director Masahiro Shinoda’s Samurai Spy, filled with clan intrigue, ninja spies, and multiple double crosses, marks a bold stylistic departure from swordplay film convention.','/uLD26c8LgyKYJVcHPNtuE0ekOln.jpg','1965-07-10',100,'Released',NULL,'Samurai Spy',46916,1.6105,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4759,_binary '\0','/rVL6ZMDOOajNxElpRw4qF40jvUq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059309',7.3,11600,'en','In Harm\'s Way','A Naval officer, reprimanded after Pearl Harbor, is later promoted to Rear Admiral and gets a second chance to prove himself against the Japanese.','/4NrxQVGjIfGdPJdG4RJggAgs4vW.jpg','1965-04-06',165,'Released','Stripped of everything - they lived and loved and fought as if there were no tomorrow...','In Harm\'s Way',37921,4.3451,6.562,'jiA6YA1rYog','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4760,_binary '\0','/AcnwPajP9XFVNqhtsycqY65YyVu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059311',6.1,2485,'eo','Incubus','On a strange island inhabited by demons and spirits, a man battles the forces of evil.','/xek3INIVvqlWXGeYl1vZxN2pMIk.jpg','1966-10-26',74,'Released','Evil has never been so seductive.','Incubus',59802,2.2464,5.786,'VZBvqfHN1Vk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4761,_binary '\0','/4wXArxer1R0gKbDw9Uly7HeK4hX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059314',6.2,4730,'en','Inside Daisy Clover','A girl on the road to stardom fights the dehumanizing effects of Hollywood life.','/2U2k08HLUmSano95U2UfJIH5w6m.jpg','1966-02-10',128,'Released','The story of what they did to a kid...','Inside Daisy Clover',49683,3.0038,5.6,'1pZcDfn_Hlc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4762,_binary '\0','/y7qyru5dzEGk6QUO8ZobgfVbF2b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059319',7.1,19822,'en','The Ipcress File','Sly and dry intelligence agent Harry Palmer is tasked with investigating British Intelligence security, and is soon enmeshed in a world of double-dealing, kidnap and murder when he finds a traitor operating at the heart of the secret service.','/iCNRK7NVhBvNpiyMRmCpTBFNoLO.jpg','1965-03-18',109,'Released','The spy story of the century.','The Ipcress File',15247,3.876,6.8,'EHbvZ1FBqjI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4763,_binary '\0','/6XzyOYXu5flHzOgCBHcfPY2DLEG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059320',7,1284,'ja','刺青一代','After his own gang sets him up to kill a rival mobster, a hit man is forced to flee with his younger brother.','/yhJ6fISn8H7NVxEBANb8RKdWhd2.jpg','1965-11-13',87,'Released',NULL,'Tattooed Life',88435,1.3143,7.25,'EYV06jT4QiM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4764,_binary '\0','/kpt7UTujy2hU4dfpAVJEaDWB4Uh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059346',6.2,8764,'ja','怪獣大戦争','Astronauts Glenn and Fuji investigate Planet X and encounter mysterious aliens known as the Xiliens, who ask Earth\'s people to help save their world from \"Monster Zero\". In exchange for borrowing Godzilla and Rodan, the Xiliens offer a cure for cancer. As Glenn investigates, he develops a romance with Miss Namikawa and uncovers the Xilien\'s true intentions.','/70gwaushxXcpGRvadHtLD0YLHC1.jpg','1965-12-19',96,'Released','The great fierce battle between Godzilla, Rodan, and King Ghidorah that will sway the ruler of the Universe, Planet X!','Invasion of Astro-Monster',19545,7.2343,6.8,'XPD9pKEKAD8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4765,_binary '\0','/fmvlV6uJpKKpPVLZ76Et8GYtoGR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059348',7.6,2758,'bn','কাপুরুষ','Amitabha Roy is a Calcutta-based scriptwriter, driving around in the country to collect material for a film. His vehicle breaks down in a small town. A tea planter, Bimal Gupta, offers hospitality for the night. Amitabha is forced to accept the offer as he has no alternative.','/nJFvRbIQ4xx5AQGvsJBnimNtf6G.jpg','1965-05-07',70,'Released',NULL,'The Coward',138030,1.4911,7.211,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4766,_binary '\0','/d7yXQaZzKUEV49cCJ7yllYslkpF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059358',7.5,5611,'en','King Rat','When Singapore surrendered to the Japanese in 1942, the Allied POWs, mostly British but including a few Americans, were incarcerated in Changi prison. Among the American prisoners is Cpl. King, a wheeler-dealer who has managed to establish a pretty good life for himself in the camp. King soon forms a friendship with an upper-class British officer who is fascinated with King\'s enthusiastic approach to life.','/tofzWLQxmM6ISFsOY1YFKJBiUhJ.jpg','1965-10-27',134,'Released','They Made the Toughest Among Them... King!','King Rat',29586,1.9661,7.2,'XhB552sXQGw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4767,_binary '\0','/8Rf6qaHRZkq0tN5wd4xh8ezSJa8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059362',6.2,4127,'en','The Knack... and How to Get It','A nebbish schoolteacher begs his smooth (and misogynistic) pal to teach him \'the knack\' – how to score with women. Serendipitously, the men meet up with a new girl in town, as well as a friendly lunatic who can’t help but paint things white.','/xO2dJcCISY6lujaU4Qew3RzSErJ.jpg','1965-06-03',85,'Released','Some have it, some don\'t.','The Knack... and How to Get It',42744,3.0347,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4768,_binary '\0','/be6rFWh61jtfpr56r3TpNWJ5WpA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059377',5.5,1474,'en','Lady L','Lady L is an elegant 80-year-old woman who recalls her amorous life story, including past loves and lusty, scandalous adventures she has lived through.','/dyH9h8H897au6Rf7PTipN4MrZEo.jpg','1965-12-17',117,'Released','She\'s the only lady who ever got a boyfriend for a wedding present!','Lady L',71006,1.7278,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4769,_binary '\0','/1wVN3eAPEYmTyRUHL4QmEwWKoK3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059390',5.9,1447,'en','The Liquidator','Lighthearted spy drama about Boysie Oakes, who takes a nice job with the British Secret Service, enjoys all the perks, and signs all the forms before learning that his job depends on murdering people, and not romancing all the beautiful civilian staff in Whitehall.','/imi3N0uyOsfRLmLMTgIidh9rHJO.jpg','1965-11-01',105,'Released','Right between the eyes is where it hits you . . . Boysie Oakes is DEADLIER than the most dangerous spy !','The Liquidator',26199,1.6549,6.3,'C0aAOEv0BGU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4770,_binary '\0','/ePEMEklx5d5ItZ1Cp5CDqJiP3Ms.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059399',6.7,4608,'en','Lord Jim','After being discredited as a coward, a 19th century seaman lives for only one purpose: to redeem himself. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with Sony Pictures Entertainment in 2000.','/hgoxcPLJYYqDIlFDl7pnndcm9MT.jpg','1965-02-15',154,'Released','Lord Jim blasts the screen with breathless adventure!','Lord Jim',11387,3.2855,6.8,'UyaorFJUqIY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4771,_binary '\0','/AjylZxTsFiE7QoCUD01LHtoNxhj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059410',6.9,4315,'en','The Loved One','The suicide of his expatriate uncle draws Englishman and poet Dennis Barlow into California\'s booming funeral industry.','/behcjnBwmJoceReiGzDppnagT38.jpg','1965-10-11',122,'Released','The motion picture with something to offend everyone!','The Loved One',16303,3.0037,6.2,'cO85GsQBoh8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4772,_binary '\0','/jGwZRoK9wRJyufcx9qIQnsTxoyu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059415',7.4,10356,'cs','Lásky jedné plavovlásky','Andula, an innocent Czech girl from a factory town, is desperately in search of love. She believes she\'s found it when she beds Milda, a charming young musician visiting from Prague. Milda, however, is only looking for a casual encounter, and leaves town assuming he\'ll never see Andula again. But when Andula doesn\'t hear from him, she packs up and heads to Prague, to the surprise of Milda and his parents.','/fyRg6Qh4oN1KRfkx8Q3DFzA642P.jpg','1965-11-12',81,'Released',NULL,'Loves of a Blonde',39387,2.3634,6.998,'2wN7COyj0k4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4773,_binary '\0','/u0iak3jqnc4gzExomWnpRSz74Us.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059417',7,1922,'bn','মহাপুরুষ','A wandering baba initiates a widower layer and his youngest daughter, irritating her boyfriend Satya and the ever-skeptical Nibaran.','/oE1iq1xSzWoFpKw1863l9mxLZ5a.jpg','1965-05-06',65,'Released',NULL,'The Holy Man',198567,0.8737,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4774,_binary '\0','/mNeBPfgPguvooS46noMeOrB1q4z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059418',6.7,9715,'en','Major Dundee','During the last winter of the Civil War, cavalry officer Amos Dundee leads a contentious troop of Army regulars, Confederate prisoners and scouts on an expedition into Mexico to destroy a band of Apaches who have been raiding U.S. bases in Texas.','/afdhdupMyfn3tDoL3XosgQF82gX.jpg','1965-03-15',125,'Released',NULL,'Major Dundee',29715,4.1423,6.656,'MbGSavGVqWQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4775,_binary '\0','/tDvuOjnFsFWXBra7aQOt8xFuN9p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059431',5.7,1478,'en','Marriage on the Rocks','Ad-agency president Dan Edwards goes to Mexico to celebrate his nineteenth wedding anniversary and winds up getting divorced by mistake, whereupon his wife Valerie marries his best friend Ernie Brewer by mistake.','/iNMyMrCkUw62yBG1pyQFPg0Rxnx.jpg','1965-09-24',109,'Released','Any Number Can Play!','Marriage on the Rocks',98648,2.3208,5.8,'mDFUDb2Aeno','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4776,_binary '\0','/5sDY536S3MlezYXNGjQTSYxVdJ3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059440',6.9,4566,'pt','À Meia Noite Levarei Sua Alma','Zé do Caixão is an undertaker in a small Brazilian town, searching for the perfect woman to bear him a superior child. Unable to conceive with his wife, he kills her and sets out to find someone else.','/tzPyUpVEObyLov2VC0aFu5H07ww.jpg','1964-11-09',83,'Released',NULL,'At Midnight I\'ll Take Your Soul',30913,1.6146,6.8,'A78PxCLzv1g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4777,_binary '\0','/px4P6oFIOClx7zp93JB965GqGTw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059447',6.3,2136,'en','Mickey One','A former comic is on the run from the mob.','/zVEMfHv05WcBmDISv5Pp9TeWylh.jpg','1965-09-27',93,'Released','...and the name of the game is Mickey!','Mickey One',32609,1.2022,5.8,'t1iXptTXjbk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4778,_binary '\0','/8SI5CN6dhCgaxSGnrqZuJFCnWVA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059448',7.2,6806,'en','Mirage','After a blackout in his office building, accountant David Stillwell emerges outside to find out a man he did not know either jumped or was pushed out a window to his death — and that he can\'t remember the past two years of his life. Enlisting the help of a rookie private eye and a reluctant old flame, Stillwell uncovers the mystery detail by unexpected detail.','/dMDgPPaBvyed07YZOV98ge2igLL.jpg','1965-10-29',109,'Released','RUN... Right Into Her Arms... Perhaps She\'ll Lead You to Your Lost Secret... Or Into the Arms of Peril!','Mirage',19661,2.2774,7.1,'881yq-nuRxc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4779,_binary '\0','/ig8wIHSYutNNuAkw1JzhLQdyAAv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059453',6,1607,'en','Mister Buddwing','An amnesiac wanders the streets of Manhattan, trying to solve the mystery of who he is.','/dyG1ldxgM6AaQFcPFKTjIS8cRfi.jpg','1966-07-15',100,'Released','The Story of a Man Who Had to Live Twelve Years in One Day with Four Women!','Mister Buddwing',207681,1.4712,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4780,_binary '\0','/a21fC2MBassba5GwzaJ1Tpdapon.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059464',1.8,9818,'en','Monster a Go-Go!','A space capsule crash-lands on Earth, and the astronaut aboard disappears. Is there a connection between the missing man and the monster roaming the area?','/qo7KOaQjodrJ2KfHjQaUwi6MTKw.jpg','1965-07-01',69,'Released','An astronaut went up- a \"guess-what\" came down!','Monster a Go-Go!',31119,1.509,2.3,'nhj1ZbDn9QE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4781,_binary '\0','/v9NUZI0ODIBIT4P2FQxqjvEEoJH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059465',5.6,4184,'en','Die, Monster, Die!','A young man visits his fiancé\'s estate to discover that her wheelchair-bound scientist father has discovered a meteorite that emits mutating radiation rays that have turned the plants in his greenhouse to giants. When his own wife falls victim to this mysterious power, the old man takes it upon himself to destroy the glowing object with disastrous results.','/sDMSPdAEJbw55CG5V1sVZqrTjkx.jpg','1965-10-26',80,'Released','No one can stop this killing machine....It\'s Already Dead!!!','Die, Monster, Die!',29067,1.9302,5.7,'RbWbc73-R8c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4782,_binary '\0','/Ahqwt4xvQIkaYGEvqM65k5ptkp2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059470',7,4973,'en','Morituri','A German living in India during World War II is blackmailed by the English to impersonate an SS officer on board a cargo ship leaving Japan for Germany carrying a large supply of rubber for tyres. His mission is to disable the scuttling charges so the captain cannot sink the ship if they are stopped by English warships.','/tXhWg0m92zVGaei06FYw5lQFAoQ.jpg','1965-08-24',123,'Released','Must mean something unusual','Morituri',42737,2.5253,6.726,'YwcHzp3B6is','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4783,_binary '\0','/soS9qQtL79YmRRJAg0NvgesPaGF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059474',5.9,1882,'en','Motorpsycho!','A vengeful veterinarian and a grieving widow join forces to track down violent bikers after they commit heinous acts against their loved ones.','/tSCSSnEjLJltHTcqMUNJINd9S06.jpg','1965-08-01',75,'Released','Bike riding HOODLUMS FLAT-OUT on their MURDER cycles...','Motorpsycho!',5720,1.5858,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4784,_binary '\0','/7HAxaIgeDHr2dGNmYiPwNJwM4BV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059477',6.2,1609,'en','Mudhoney!','In this Depression-era tale, Calef McKinney, traveling from Michigan to California, stops in Spooner, Missouri, where Lute hires him for odd jobs. Calef gets involved with Lute\'s niece, Hannah. But she\'s married to Sidney, a wife-beating drunk who hopes to inherit his uncle-in-law\'s money. Sidney and an eccentric preacher plot against Calef, who finds it difficult to conceal his mysterious past and his growing affection for Sidney\'s wife.','/8iHie5qpBGrYpoC8ypN2m4PkPDe.jpg','1965-05-25',93,'Released','...leaves a taste of evil!','Mudhoney!',5719,1.0128,6.2,'raoRkndsExY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4785,_binary '\0','/xdWUOLCvNr1nmHUVZlFGRzvPadp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059496',7.1,7475,'en','The Nanny','Nanny, a London family\'s live-in maid, brings morbid 10-year-old Joey back from the psychiatric ward he\'s been in for two years, since the death of his younger sister. Joey refuses to eat any food Nanny\'s prepared or take a bath with her in the room. He also demands to sleep in a room with a lock. Joey\'s parents -- workaholic Bill and neurotic Virgie -- are sure Joey is disturbed, but he may have good reason to be terrified of Nanny.','/2MjaiPWaZVLWnJi8FxiIaXcjvB5.jpg','1965-10-07',91,'Released','Nanny wasn\'t responsible . . . WAS SHE?','The Nanny',39893,2.2128,7,'dLAMjk6jPys','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4786,_binary '\0','/hgnHHTaCOvuU6PGVROcweweYZVd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059499',6.6,1585,'fr','Ne nous fâchons pas','One-time gangster Antoine is enjoying retirement on the coast, now managing a boating club. He receives a visit from a former accomplice who asks for a loan. The money will be repaid by a crook who is now in hiding; Antoine intends to recover his money.','/2gsHUKobJzRQWOo1NOrHY7M2Rae.jpg','1966-04-20',100,'Released',NULL,'Let\'s Not Get Angry',33360,1.9703,7.503,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4787,_binary '\0','/4B7KVzu1z53tKMQ6B0iyIFhyC24.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059518',6.4,2347,'en','None But the Brave','American and Japanese soldiers, stranded on a tiny Pacific island during World War II, must make a temporary truce and cooperate to survive various tribulations. Told through the eyes of the American and Japanese unit commanders, who must deal with an atmosphere of growing distrust and tension between their men.','/rIiPD7Xt196jpf2W8zFHgTg29Oi.jpg','1965-02-24',106,'Released','The brave are never different - only different looking!','None But the Brave',43407,2.4557,6.4,'q8p3aiKlAss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4788,_binary '\0','/dpa5PiYGIvkjeMTcBG9VD4bQOjg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059527',8.2,10579,'sk','Obchod na korze','In a small town in Nazi-occupied Slovakia during World War II, decent but timid carpenter Tono is named \"Aryan comptroller\" of a button store owned by an old Jewish widow, Rozalie. Since the post comes with a salary and standing in the town\'s corrupt hierarchy, Tono wrestles with greed and guilt as he and Rozalie gradually befriend each other. When the authorities order all Jews in town to be rounded up, Tono faces a moral dilemma unlike any he\'s known before.','/pOjsOzPzYrCFsMsatKxAwYzIeCg.jpg','1965-06-24',128,'Released',NULL,'The Shop on Main Street',25905,2.7379,7.1,'gvZE9Yuxkyg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4789,_binary '\0','/8om2YlmUXDPwbyw2p7lU11CRN38.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059529',8.1,2379,'ru','Обыкновенный фашизм','Romm pulls out all the stops in its selection of documentary material to draw the viewer not only into absolute horror about fascism and nazism in the 1920s–1940s Europe, but also to a firm conviction that nothing of the sort should be allowed to happen again anywhere in the world.','/lbgMTTwF7gefKNEFMTkOQHR57KQ.jpg','1965-12-31',138,'Released',NULL,'Triumph Over Violence',53194,1.6957,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4790,_binary '\0','/fy47O3cSNXjvXTN3JQ2mwkZf3xx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059538',5.8,1949,'de','Old Surehand','Old Surehand and his faithful old friend Old Wabble are on the trail of a cold-blooded killer with the nickname \'The General\'. The brother of Old Surehand was murdered by him. On the way Old Surehand and Old Wabble are involved in the running conflict between settlers and Comanches who are likely to go on the war path. Old Surehand can count on the support of his friend and blood brother Winnetou, the amiable chief of the Apaches. Written by Robert','/1Y32jmHx7Wm6u0DcTXHaKvLPUcr.jpg','1965-12-14',90,'Released','They turned the frontier into a river of blood overflowing with the West\'s most dangerous passions.','Flaming Frontier',9627,2.6635,6.2,'GWh-HXqHXiw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4791,_binary '\0','/4RQFnUg52MTU38CMjSSM4SXlQGM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059540',6.5,2442,'en','Once a Thief','Ex-convict Eddie and his wife, Kristine, attempt to build a new life for themselves and their daughter Kathy in San Francisco, but police officer Mike Vido is determined to send Eddie back to prison.','/gQfNFsYfE5a7kB0jiQE4uhnhNYk.jpg','1965-04-24',107,'Released','always a target, for either side of the law!','Once a Thief',36514,2.285,6.5,'1HgxLVgZjL8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4792,_binary '\0','/ygPdCGaQEpnzfXfQkNaYrKVxXIP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059549',6.6,6310,'en','Operation Crossbow','Allied agents infiltrate the Nazi rocket complex at Peenemunde in order to obtain their secrets and sabotage the plant. The film alternates between German developments of the V-1 missile and V-2 rocket (with a German cast speaking their own language) and discovery by British Intelligence of the weapon.','/Zxj0YdYf7t7gC63JBDencVKIoQ.jpg','1965-04-01',115,'Released','Sabotage of Hitler\'s ingenious weapons of mass destruction...the V1 and V2 rockets!','Operation Crossbow',36583,3.4102,6.746,'9v8bGRiRUmU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4793,_binary '\0','/k9r86oHFo06ZC21zw2FkRD9wcJX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059550',8.4,16799,'ru','Операция «Ы» и другие приключения Шурика','The film consists of three independent parts: \"Workmate\", \"Déjà vu\" and \"Operation Y\". The plot follows the adventures of Shurik, the naive and nerdy Soviet student who often gets into ludicrous situations but always finds a way out very neatly.','/di0OpDXkIj53Fv2wy6f5As8AbNA.jpg','1965-08-16',95,'Released',NULL,'Operation Y and Other Shurik\'s Adventures',20875,2.9697,7.5,'hrvzSFKqifk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4794,_binary '\0','/bp7G5Y6cDYL5sOpJkpq7EoNdzZa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059555',7,1807,'en','Othello','General Othello\'s marriage is destroyed when vengeful Ensign Iago convinces him that his new wife has been unfaithful.','/Vqp61OKFKlu3FdXmGLAC83Gs2m.jpg','1965-12-15',165,'Released','The greatest Othello ever by the greatest actor of our time','Othello',44006,1.624,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4795,_binary '\0','/dQbZRSQLmWlaU3TNVmBj72M1TBg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059557',6.4,7711,'en','Our Man Flint','When scientists use eco-terrorism to impose their will on the world by affecting extremes in the weather, Intelligence Chief Cramden calls in top agent Derek Flint.','/rd2jKIqFfJ8LgZEaBpAvLL44G10.jpg','1966-01-16',108,'Released','The ORIGINAL man of mystery!','Our Man Flint',23728,2.908,6.5,'Auhb6JS6wxs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4796,_binary '\0','/qJNy6kADD4fMRgurRtpI0cWxGrc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059563',5.5,2718,'en','Paradise, Hawaiian Style','Blacklisted by the major airlines for endlessly chasing female staff, pilot Rick Richards returns to Hawaii to set up a helicopter charter company with his friend Danny. Having a girl on every island is a good way to get business but it becomes clear that romance and flying don\'t always mix.','/6PLfdCgjqD3Gm9UeeaF3e8iTo3M.jpg','1966-04-23',91,'Released','His newest! His Biggest!','Paradise, Hawaiian Style',18894,2.1435,5.1,'fBxydJKnUSg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4797,_binary '\0','/wVo50l8ezpANMvsYaR8nn9v860t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059565',6.7,1598,'fr','Paris vu par…','Six vignettes set in different sections of Paris, by six directors. St. Germain des Pres (Douchet), Gare du Nord (Rouch), Rue St. Denis (Pollet), and Montparnasse et Levallois (Godard) are stories of love, flirtation and prostitution; Place d\'Etoile (Rohmer) concerns a haberdasher and his umbrella; and La Muette (Chabrol), a bourgeois family and earplugs.','/2wgiXwjpoKEQUszDBqv8BQn4MA.jpg','1965-05-19',95,'Released',NULL,'Six in Paris',51808,1.333,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4798,_binary '\0','/3RrBUEWUELfW1o1zv0ddXNZOq0F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059573',8,10385,'en','A Patch of Blue','A blind, uneducated white girl is befriended by a black man, who becomes determined to help her escape her impoverished and abusive home life.','/9eFULnzgoLpO7lvg6FMutGRuNFg.jpg','1965-12-10',105,'Released','Love is color blind.','A Patch of Blue',33364,3.2257,7.563,'2f64hh6k8jc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4799,_binary '\0','/nr1ACkxYiZwssHUM8E5fz7AWSc9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059575',7.6,11818,'en','The Pawnbroker','A Jewish pawnbroker, a victim of Nazi persecution, loses all faith in his fellow man until he realizes too late the tragedy of his actions.','/6z9PSwCZEGyG9VpN733PLyZ34Gm.jpg','1965-04-20',116,'Released','The Most Talked About Picture!','The Pawnbroker',20540,2.9907,7.1,'XKvzeCwMCgc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4800,_binary '\0','/hs6OPto38fF589ScpGhl7uSU4MI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059578',8.2,304049,'it','Per qualche dollaro in più','Two bounty hunters both pursue the brutal and sadistic bandit, El Indio, who has a large bounty on his head.','/ooqASvA7qxlTVKL3KwOzBwy57Dh.jpg','1965-12-18',132,'Released','The man with no name is back... the man in black is waiting... a walking arsenal - he uncoils, strikes and kills!','For a Few Dollars More',938,11.8261,8.028,'bNt9NcLteoU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4801,_binary '\0','/4zJ9w3lZcZI3mBXcNiq6s8bqpDO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059592',7.4,40578,'fr','Pierrot le fou','Pierrot escapes his boring society and travels from Paris to the Mediterranean Sea with Marianne, a girl chased by hit-men from Algeria. They lead an unorthodox life, always on the run.','/i124H6iQB4CawrgFW9aZaZs7OBO.jpg','1965-11-05',110,'Released','You\'ve met the tame Godard, the love Godard, the think Godard, ...now meet the wild Godard!','Pierrot le Fou',2786,5.0769,7.3,'TVvhJrrgfs0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4802,_binary '\0','/tre05lohn53MOkhkcXlQJd2laV6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059601',6.5,2644,'it','Una pistola per Ringo','Giuliano Gemma stars as a cool, cocky mercenary enlisted by a sheriff to infiltrate a ruthless gang of outlaws. Ennio Morricone provided the score to this early spaghetti western hit.','/tpA8zRTg3V6IXzzv7vgabJoQk6H.jpg','1965-05-12',98,'Released','Quick- Treacherous- And Deadly To Anyone Who Tried To Cross Them!','A Pistol for Ringo',56431,2.6598,6.3,'wWMwkHlYsO0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4803,_binary '\0','/kpjWEZvoMhiinhDArNJ31VXvgh5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059616',7.4,6617,'fr','Procès de Jeanne d\'Arc','Rouen, Normandy, 1431, during the Hundred Years\' War. After being captured by French soldiers from an opposing faction, Joan of Arc, the Maid of Orléans, is unjustly tried by an ecclesiastical court overseen by her English enemies.','/gHb9UUow3j25sMCb3wDIZatfIg1.jpg','1963-02-13',62,'Released',NULL,'The Trial of Joan of Arc',48764,2.4765,7.2,'ao5DJLd-3IA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4804,_binary '\0','/l6lpFI2qimWC0ra2s3WBQm9Zylx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059619',7.5,5784,'it','I pugni in tasca','A deeply disturbed and epileptic young man benignly decides to murder other members of his dysfunctional family for altruistic reasons.','/xEMvB9iuUD8Ol4MeUZxVpoRHopl.jpg','1965-10-26',110,'Released',NULL,'Fists in the Pocket',46591,2.235,7.777,'XW1DYKaH_sg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4805,_binary '\0','/bBnQhsxFp2T9o2Sj9RU6HbbH2rG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059633',7.2,1408,'en','Rapture','Agnes, a lonely teenage girl, and her father befriend an escaped convict, named Joseph, who arrives at their farm in Brittany, France. When Joseph develops an attraction to Agnes, her father threatens to break up the union.','/3W1cDAKWIYs45Rt0j5EJCjZt8Ev.jpg','1965-08-23',105,'Released','Curiosity. Infatuation. Awakening. Love. These are but the stepping stones to rapture.','Rapture',83957,1.26,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4806,_binary '\0','/3sfgDIiZnHSB3kGrLz9U2L1MKqm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059635',6.2,3852,'en','Rasputin: The Mad Monk','Rasputin, a crazed and debauched monk wreaks havoc at the local inn one night, chopping off the hand of one of the drinkers. As the bitter locals plan their revenge, the evil Rasputin works his power over the beautiful women who serve at the Tsar\'s palace. Even the Tsarina herself is seduced by his evil ways and, as his influence begins to dominate government policy, there is only one course of action left... to destroy him before he destroys them all.','/kACUmeHoIUPWiavUyKE1Tzkzldk.jpg','1966-03-06',91,'Released','Ladies\' Man - And Lady Killer!','Rasputin: The Mad Monk',28669,2.3519,5.9,'ERbbv-04hss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4807,_binary '\0','/jkL0mvTshktR6xyOk0DGNjnB4Sr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059641',5.6,1305,'en','Red Line 7000','The lives and passions of a stock car team are revealed against the turbulent backdrop of the professional racing world.','/lw3nxKQsRfPUMd6rE6Ch4h51e0D.jpg','1965-11-09',110,'Released','Here Comes the Speed Breed!','Red Line 7000',80046,1.9404,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4808,_binary '\0','/rtWQw7yZEbFZrjfuHdUGZ6f7KkP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059643',7.7,6607,'pl','Rękopis znaleziony w Saragossie','During the Napoleonic wars, a Spanish officer and an opposing officer find a book written by the former\'s grandfather.','/3P8g5U4gbifjM2lnqSpZogh7FrD.jpg','1966-02-27',183,'Released',NULL,'The Saragossa Manuscript',8785,2.6065,7.749,'knA_-a-bhKg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4809,_binary '\0','/5rbPwIdEZTyLTkpAgvGdacgCr7T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059646',7.5,61821,'en','Repulsion','Beautiful young manicurist Carole suffers from androphobia (the pathological fear of interaction with men). When her sister and roommate, Helen, leaves their London flat to go on an Italian holiday with her married boyfriend, Carole withdraws into her apartment. She begins to experience frightful hallucinations, her fear gradually mutating into madness.','/dtyCKEPLqv9wxyVazL4b843vtUb.jpg','1965-06-01',105,'Released','The nightmare world of a virgin\'s dreams becomes the screen\'s shocking reality!','Repulsion',11481,5.3344,7.367,'BYZzJC_DqBI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4810,_binary '\0','/gmojPc9jHKXkxPo6ImXkX0a2PHx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059649',7,1487,'en','Return from the Ashes','A Jewish woman, Dr. Michele Wolf, interred in a Nazi concentration camp during WWII returns to her Paris home after the war\'s end. She\'s unaware that her husband, the handsome gigolo and chess master Stanislaw Pilgrin, has been having an affair with her stepdaughter Fabi in her absence.','/El4j2xBo33LCGMdaEkrJ3LFCy4.jpg','1965-11-16',105,'Released','The water warm... the champagne chilled... the music soft... then the daydream ends... and the nightmare begins!','Return from the Ashes',91796,1.8288,6.2,'sZjhEC6wWCA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4811,_binary '\0','/903undxixp8AM9C6OLuuFPIGWkP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059653',6.4,5138,'en','Ride in the Whirlwind','Three cowboys, mistaken for members of an outlaw gang, are relentlessly pursued by a posse.','/Afx1Wigd0sr9nM1Unq2MkVd2RT1.jpg','1966-10-23',82,'Released','Ride with the Easy Rider into an action whirlwind.','Ride in the Whirlwind',60555,2.6829,6.241,'WxEGkbnl4MQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4812,_binary '\0','/aBCyN3hZfEsilQovumRHqx0Do5C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059661',6.1,2141,'en','The Rounders','Ben (Glenn Ford) and Marion (Henry Fonda) are two cowboys who make a meager living breaking wild horses. Their frequent employer Jim (Chill Wills), who always gets the better of them, talks them into taking a nondescript horse in lieu of some of their wages. Ben finds that the horse is un-rideable, he comes up with the idea of taking it to a rodeo and betting other cowhands they cannot ride it.','/rqJbj4khnRnUVHaB8HD83VROdYS.jpg','1965-01-08',85,'Released','The wild west\'s biggest fall guys go head over heels... for a mean-eyed bronc... and some bear-backed fillies','The Rounders',24790,2.7936,5.5,'EAzn7AUrSdI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4813,_binary '\0','/mmDuls9sAId9SfWQ65INDaCSpZE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059673',7.4,2761,'ja','侍','Japan, 1860. The men of the Mito clan, victims of the Ansei purge, anxiously prowl around the Sakurada Gate of Edo Castle with the intention of assassinating Naosuke Ii of Hikone, tairō of the Tokugawa shogunate and responsible for their misfortune.','/p4Z3hIghFiJZdr9fIVMzRn8Rxgu.jpg','1965-01-03',122,'Released','Here, at the Gates of Sakurada, the Shogunate will fall.','Samurai Assassin',79406,2.2336,7.3,'ELkh7tj2blo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4814,_binary '\0','/x2dgbGQr4MAt6ljJHIsW0ObqwWD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059674',6.3,4266,'en','The Sandpiper','A free-spirited single mother forms a connection with the wedded headmaster of an Episcopalian boarding school in Monterey, California.','/cOEIl9QjFe6Pt5W7hbkt2Hy7EfX.jpg','1965-06-23',117,'Released','From the beginning, they knew it was wrong....but nothing could keep them apart!','The Sandpiper',77915,3.1182,6.4,'Y9wVMzOviCU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4815,_binary '\0','/14e4wyD0dqVPnYonsAlbqMvyHqS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059675',6.7,1770,'en','Sands of the Kalahari','A diverse group of individuals struggle to survive in the Kalahari desert after their passenger plane crashes.','/gJxYBWxU3ac2yMBnqSrQMslCEQL.jpg','1965-11-24',119,'Released','The strangest adventure the eyes of man have ever seen!','Sands of the Kalahari',70950,2.1391,6.303,'bAuJB5AkP7s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4816,_binary '\0','/bYyfLgEeLpFlioUH9k7WTUB3OW0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059678',6.1,3610,'en','The Satan Bug','A US government germ warfare lab has had an accident. The first theory is that one of the germs has been released and killed several scientists. The big fear is that a more virulent strain, named The Satan Bug because all life can be killed off by it should it escape, may have been stolen.','/jMqA1ooDaqQqaifI5hnU7tw9hf2.jpg','1965-03-26',114,'Released','The price for uncovering the secret of the satan bug comes high - YOUR LIFE!','The Satan Bug',27709,3.5701,6.1,'BsbV_8Renm8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4817,_binary '\0','/2hFHSUwlN1iUkSYstrUyOVDZu0C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059710',5.8,4064,'en','She','The lost city of Kuma is ruled by the cruel, arrogant, beautiful queen, Ayesha, gifted with eternal life. She lures Leo Vincey into her world, seeing in him the reincarnation of the lover she long ago murdered in a fit of violent jealousy. Against all advice Leo is determined to stay and Ayesha persuades him to bathe in the flame of eternal youth... with disastrous consequences.','/foCvE8j9WeEYBR7SiHqkjHX68Kn.jpg','1965-06-09',106,'Released','SHE who must be obeyed! ...SHE who must be loved! ...SHE who must be possessed!','She',17604,2.1557,5.6,'jDLRcKYppPI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4818,_binary '\0','/e6615TUkrhQvOyCYM60SQLPTVAL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059711',7.3,10633,'en','Shenandoah','Charlie Anderson, a farmer in Shenandoah, Virginia, finds himself and his family in the middle of the Civil War he wants nothing to do with. When his youngest boy is taken prisoner by the North, the Civil War is forced upon him.','/jAB8UFwpoKPdgJlCuYZiF1hyn9E.jpg','1965-06-03',105,'Released','Two mighty armies trampled its valley... A fighting family challenged them both!','Shenandoah',21027,2.6024,6.9,'gFB8JtN1nzc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4819,_binary '\0','/zCHwjbNdCE4kMcvXRHuWz3kqPhv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059712',7,7828,'en','Ship of Fools','A varied group of passengers boarding a ship bound for pre-WWII Germany represents a microcosm of early-1930s society.','/2LOe4Hu6Gxw6k76hLWhS8JVVILa.jpg','1965-07-29',149,'Released','EXPLORER, MISTRESS, VAGRANT, LOAFER, ARTIST, TRAMP– THEY\'RE ALL AT THE CAPTAIN\'S TABLE!','Ship of Fools',30080,3.6102,6.649,'mUFQYnMCwaQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4820,_binary '\0','/v8VwNljgCjvcOsGk9WnL1AvnIDG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059715',7.3,1803,'ja','春婦伝','Volunteering as a \"comfort woman\" on the Manchurian front, where she is expected to service hundreds of soldiers, Harumi is commandeered by the brutal Lieutenant Narita but falls for the sensitive Mikami, Narita\'s direct subordinate. Seijun Suzuki\'s Story of a Prostitute is a tragic love story as well as a rule-bending take on a popular Taijiro Tamura novel, challenging military and fraternal codes of honor, as seen through Harumi\'s eyes.','/mJQUZF2Gu1w1aYu9PGFpk8XsRjn.jpg','1965-02-27',96,'Released',NULL,'Story of a Prostitute',39506,2.5614,6.6,'ehfqm4xuVjU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4821,_binary '\0','/sm7NapjwKYhIH2GzFEgJkiw9hF1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059719',7.8,11985,'es','Simón del desierto','Simon, a deeply religious man living in the 4th century, wants to be nearer to God so he climbs a column. The Devil wants him come down to Earth and is trying to seduce him.','/gU9sYpMvA8FM55p9sBM5cF1hYmd.jpg','1965-08-27',45,'Released','Sacrifice and Temptation','Simon of the Desert',36265,2.1005,7.7,'iNrIUANm50s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4822,_binary '\0','/l0ftiZeis1c0b2802XVKGUmMV4Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059727',6.2,4300,'en','The Skull','Esoterica collector Dr Maitland buys an unusual skull from his ordinary source; the artifact is what remains of the Marquis De Sade. Much too soon, Maitland discovers that the skull is turning him into a frenzied killer.','/zBMT4WHMk4xdYv3puiHTa663Kd5.jpg','1965-08-25',83,'Released','When the Skull strikes you\'ll scream!','The Skull',42745,2.1113,6,'8EokkZkaaQA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4823,_binary '\0','/uFtP4UK0e7kNmm7x1V39SLrpay1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059729',7,2723,'en','The Slender Thread','Alan is a Seattle college student volunteering at a crisis center. During a lonely night shift, a woman calls up and tells Alan that she needs to talk to someone. She informs him she\'s taken an overdose of pills; he tries desperately to get help to her, while keeping her on the line. As crucial minutes tick by, Alan learns more about the woman, her family life, and why she wants to die.','/dlKnUW3G6ghd5IyQpIfgYfU1Gsi.jpg','1965-12-15',98,'Released','When a woman\'s emotions sway on a slender thread, expect anything…','The Slender Thread',51054,2.2349,7.1,'6CCxVqolLW4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4824,_binary '\0','/u9Yrx1ZYMSvtujeCRlLbNON8hR2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059740',7.1,19856,'en','The Sons of Katie Elder','The four sons of Katie Elder reunite in their hometown of Clearwater, Texas for her funeral and discover that the family ranch is now in the hands of Morgan Hastings, a corrupt businessman who wants to exploit the area around the town.','/n6ox5IniBxxx6ISTol5pm36WoFr.jpg','1965-06-24',122,'Released','From the four winds they came, the four brothers, their eyes smoking and their fingers itching...','The Sons of Katie Elder',16211,5.3472,7.03,'fmwix09CP6U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4825,_binary '\0','/ioQYjcRnU54ir5ltgyS7k53zw5x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059742',8.1,295209,'en','The Sound of Music','In the years before World War II, a tomboyish postulant at an Austrian abbey is hired as a governess in the home of a widowed naval captain with seven children and brings a new love of life and music into the home.','/c6CrUZypAsBCaRWX0M3RVRDbhNS.jpg','1965-03-29',174,'Released','The happiest sound in all the world!','The Sound of Music',15121,18.3025,7.728,'Q7wZClqWm_o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4826,_binary '\0','/llwusQFdHmHCWS7jySP2r6bbAIm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059749',7.5,20976,'en','The Spy Who Came In from the Cold','British agent Alec Leamas refuses to come in from the Cold War during the 1960s, choosing to face another mission, which may prove to be his final one.','/lN3PWv6cW22mqXDcgGZgK1Aa2gh.jpg','1965-12-16',112,'Released','Brace yourself for greatness.','The Spy Who Came In from the Cold',13580,4.5159,7.1,'vlYK9AoQlOc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4827,_binary '\0','/5853Wc0cmPu3WBHY5XHZcy6fyha.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059764',6.5,2893,'en','A Study in Terror','When Watson reads from the newspaper there have been two similar murders near Whitechapel in a few days, Sherlock Holmes\' sharp deductive is immediately stimulated to start its merciless method of elimination after observation of every apparently meaningless detail. He guesses right the victims must be street whores, and doesn\'t need long to work his way trough a pawn shop, an aristocratic family\'s stately home, a hospital and of course the potential suspects and (even unknowing) witnesses who are the cast of the gradually unraveled story of the murderer and his motive.','/gWKXoUpzB28R5qHhQAoC6kOJaQ1.jpg','1965-10-01',95,'Released','Sherlock Holmes meets Jack the Ripper! Here comes the original caped crusader!','A Study in Terror',42729,2.7674,6.2,'1w8iVriqo8s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4828,_binary '\0','/nzKVpW9wYxdsQZroLaOBxuQ9GoU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059776',7.5,3781,'hu','Szegénylegények','After the failure of the Kossuth\'s revolution of 1848, people suspected of supporting the revolution are sent to prison camps. Years later, partisans led by outlaw Sándor Rózsa still run rampant. Although the authorities do not know the identities of the partisans, they round up suspects and try to root them out by any means necessary.','/7dCBle7ZTLXxvXLhVP96fmyE3wA.jpg','1966-01-06',91,'Released',NULL,'The Round-Up',94663,1.2314,7.2,'9Edloa6Ds84','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4829,_binary '\0','/zDSOkE121D7Ig08cKZH6fojCw3S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059792',6.2,8347,'it','Terrore nello spazio','After landing on a mysterious planet, a team of astronauts begin to turn on each other, swayed by the uncertain influence of the planet and its strange inhabitants.','/bPpfT4r9HtHcri0eIknqpewoewM.jpg','1965-09-15',88,'Released','This was the day the universe trembled before the demon forces of the killer planet!','Planet of the Vampires',17921,2.4834,6.443,'GdbZY4ZPOCU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4830,_binary '\0','/kINVRRAAWa1p1sHkme5GK7ZKNMx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059793',6.8,8899,'en','That Darn Cat!','A young woman suspects foul play when her cat comes home wearing a wristwatch. Convincing the FBI, though, and catching the bad guys is tougher than she imagined.','/by92HEWg2d4WrkgbUIPEA0ufsHI.jpg','1965-12-02',116,'Released','It takes a Siamese secret agent to unravel the PURR-fect crime!','That Darn Cat!',20723,3.4473,6.595,'QfqVYCRdtdc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4831,_binary '\0','/ilxJjPUHcHAkHbQExzEQyPnPE61.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059797',7,9990,'en','Those Magnificent Men in Their Flying Machines or How I Flew from London to Paris in 25 Hours 11 Minutes','In order to boost circulation of his newspaper, Lord Rawnsley announces an air race and offers £10,000 to the first person who can fly across the English Channel. But one of the participants, Percy, plots to sabotage his competitor\'s planes. Will Percy triumph?','/wcGELNaQ8TbiMUpAnkKLl5g09OO.jpg','1965-06-16',138,'Released','20th Century-Fox Presents The Motion Picture That Sets Comedy Ahead 100 Years!','Those Magnificent Men in Their Flying Machines or How I Flew from London to Paris in 25 Hours 11 Minutes',10338,3.1241,6.782,'0X73Oble8j0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4832,_binary '\0','/brYujqSBuefAyHBL42nyM0GJtFw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059798',7.3,3993,'en','A Thousand Clowns','Twelve-year-old Nick lives with his Uncle Murray, a Mr.Micawber-like Dickensian character who keeps hoping something won\'t turn up. What turns up is a social worker, who falls in love with Murray and a bit in love with Nick. As the child welfare people try to force Murray to become a conventional man (as the price they demand for allowing him to keep Nick), the nephew, who until now has gloried in his Uncle\'s iconoclastic approach to life, tries to play mediator. But when he succeeds, he is alarmed by the uncle\'s willingness to cave in to society in order to save the relationship.','/tXPsmtVy3T5Whz20LwiscprCdCT.jpg','1965-12-13',118,'Released','... IT\'S A LIFT FOR THE SPIRITS','A Thousand Clowns',42731,1.9571,6.9,'IKEXGNByRQY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4833,_binary '\0','/7DLCXCQx52YLle1qTokrjROTwVV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059800',6.9,139282,'en','Thunderball','A criminal organization has obtained two nuclear bombs and are asking for a 100 million pound ransom in the form of diamonds in seven days or they will use the weapons. The secret service sends James Bond to the Bahamas to once again save the world.','/wCc4qllaTDsQN8zgGkAgQrKO6N9.jpg','1965-12-11',130,'Released','Look up! Look down! Look out! Here comes the biggest Bond of all!','Thunderball',660,11.6571,6.67,'7JowkFmI1Fo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4834,_binary '\0','/3vjLwvGF0Mp8GkqFdQOZJBpHMmE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059812',8.3,3038,'hu','A tizedes meg a többiek','PFC Molnár decides his WWII services are over, and with serious money hidden in his hand grenades, he heads to an abandoned mansion where he encounters not only the sour butler but a bunch of others who also try to wimp out of their duties.','/m0C3mo00vaFvbumWB40xFTyu9dS.jpg','1965-09-03',111,'Released',NULL,'The Corporal and the Others',158713,1.394,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4835,_binary '\0','/xi7frd8JRME37yCsSEf6orYiQ0K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059817',7.8,2487,'ja','東京オリンピック','This impressionistic portrait of the 1964 Tokyo Summer Olympics pays as much attention to the crowds and workers as it does to the actual competitive events. Highlights include an epic pole-vaulting match between West Germany and America, and the final marathon race through Tokyo\'s streets. Two athletes are highlighted: Ethiopian marathon runner Abebe Bikila, who receives his second gold medal, and runner Ahamed Isa from Chad, representing a country younger than he is.','/bjN7zlN5vq6bgvetojjM82qWwLE.jpg','1965-03-20',170,'Released','The Man’s Picture… Every Woman Will Love!','Tokyo Olympiad',43618,1.8325,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4836,_binary '\0','/tK41nyg0bbAf9GEWfdMODXKo98l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059821',6.4,7766,'en','The Tomb of Ligeia','Verden Fell is shattered after the death of his lovely wife. But, after an unexpected encounter with Lady Rowena Trevanion, Fell soon finds himself married again. Nevertheless, his late wife\'s spirit seems to hang over the dilapidated abbey that Fell shares with his new bride. Lady Rowena senses that something is amiss and, when she investigates, makes a horrifying discovery -- learning that Fell\'s dead wife is closer than she ever imagined possible.','/j8gc33Q97xorBvnMUQLXs9Yla0H.jpg','1964-11-01',81,'Released','Even on her wedding night she must share the man she loved with the \"female thing\" that lived in the Tomb of the Cat!','The Tomb of Ligeia',29030,3.0295,6.4,'ImbdfE4bxnE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4837,_binary '\0','/tL5uUcgmpcCZOnrnjPcNwz1LGqY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059825',7.8,22235,'en','The Train','As the Allied forces approach Paris in August 1944, German Colonel Von Waldheim is desperate to take all of France\'s greatest paintings to Germany. He manages to secure a train to transport the valuable art works even as the chaos of retreat descends upon them. The French resistance however wants to stop them from stealing their national treasures but have received orders from London that they are not to be destroyed. The station master, Labiche, is tasked with scheduling the train and making it all happen smoothly but he is also part of a dwindling group of resistance fighters tasked with preventing the theft. He and others stage an elaborate ruse to keep the train from ever leaving French territory.','/bzgPLB7efMohled42PIn6CcOTnO.jpg','1964-09-24',133,'Released','It carried their hopes, their nation\'s honour!','The Train',3482,3.5319,7.6,'KDpjtVI1z9g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4838,_binary '\0','/wjqAPaNbsxkZHWZlZTxdZbcNeAi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059831',6.2,2750,'fr','Les Tribulations d\'un Chinois en Chine','A millionaire realizes he really wants to live after he has hired an assassin to kill him.','/2h1adpIPl82aygyO3BPDyALAEey.jpg','1965-12-04',104,'Released','That Man from Rio is UP the Himalayas... UP the Yang-tze... UP in a balloon... UP-stage with a stripper... UP-town in Hong Kong... You can\'t keep a great adventurer DOWN','Up to His Ears',61765,2.8538,7,'XSdLD1Oj1Ao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4839,_binary '\0','/onXQ0CGsRFuZ97l21Aej40oA7Au.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059837',6.1,1682,'en','Two on a Guillotine','The daughter of a dead magician who accidentally killed his wife, her mother, while performing a guillotine trick must spend the night in his house in order to collect her inheritance. Is the house haunted or is it all magic?','/hcZP5MdRHt4SzNqOfNCwJ7V3rVQ.jpg','1965-01-13',107,'Released','Wouldn\'t you like to learn how to flip your lid? If you\'re chopping for entertainment, here\'s the super shocker of them all.','Two on a Guillotine',48136,2.2245,6.1,'HgcP84ic3Us','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4840,_binary '\0','/50r2hZEculAYYmLk8mTSmCRKlr9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059855',8.1,2795,'zh','大闹天宫','Sun Wukong, the King of the Monkeys, sets off on his first adventure to gain a worthy weapon. This earns the attention of the Jade Emperor of Heaven.','/vBHI9QjQyCyJP7EtqoGweahTU8S.jpg','1961-07-25',114,'Released','You tell your Jade Emperor, accept my title or I\'ll ruin his Palace!','The Monkey King: Uproar in Heaven',47759,3.1917,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4841,_binary '\0','/ntHhAhIDkrELc9i6koBnmsvVF4E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059856',7.1,2600,'it','Vaghe stelle dell\'Orsa...','Sandra returns to her hometown to take care of family business, but childhood memories and secrets soon overcome her.','/4ni3YypuKYh3nS2yftX40JUYGQf.jpg','1965-09-16',100,'Released','Sandra is excitement! What Sandra does... is astonishing!','Sandra',92432,2.7268,7.006,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4842,_binary '\0','/o4J01PEdAnv3B01LZGZLw19gEHy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059872',6.8,1260,'fr','La Vie de château','In the countryside near Normandy\'s beaches lives Marie, unhappy. It\'s 1945, she\'s married to Jérôme, a somewhat fussy milquetoast, diffident to the war around him and unwilling to move his wife to Paris, where she longs to live, shop, and party. A German outfit is bivouacked at Jérôme and Marie\'s crumbling château because its commanding officer is pursuing Marie. She\'s also eyed by a French spy working with the Allies as they plan D-Day. He woos her (posing to the Germans as her brother) and, in his passion, forgets his mission. Heroics come from an unexpected direction, and Marie makes her choice.','/hPfS3Emw7P3QzxjJ9vQisoneW2Q.jpg','1966-01-25',93,'Released',NULL,'A Matter of Resistance',4194,2.0314,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4843,_binary '\0','/5R2GlmTGIyodpgdUb13y1YAPXcl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059878',3.8,3087,'en','Village of the Giants','\"Genius\" accidentally invents \"goo\" which causes living things to rapidly grow to an enormous size. Seeing an opportunity to get rich, some delinquent teenagers steal the \"goo\" and, as a result of a sophomoric dare, consume it themselves and become thirty feet tall. They then take over control of the town by kidnapping the sheriff\'s daughter and dancing suggestively.','/dMFo3dd4jYGoCQ10Er7zOR2VYxE.jpg','1965-10-20',81,'Released','All the kids grow 10 feet tall... and TAKE OVER!','Village of the Giants',42780,2.0378,3.7,'-PIQhKa1FTI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4844,_binary '\0','/y9htC5WfjvH4ByG1GPOsv07rypD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059880',4.1,1301,'en','Vinyl','Andy Warhol’s screen adaptation of Burgess\'s \"A Clockwork Orange”.','/eb2OD1I6u6AaMx8ze5qSKhuLpkz.jpg','1965-06-04',70,'Released',NULL,'Vinyl',85871,0.984,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4845,_binary '\0','/xPW7hyo8L42cXuooxoyhEbvjW1U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059884',8.1,2655,'ru','Война и Мир 1: Андрей Болконский','In 1805 St. Petersburg, Pierre Bezukhov, illegitimate son of a rich nobleman, is introduced to high society. His friend, Prince Andrei Bolkonsky, joins the Imperial Russian Army as aide-de-camp of General Mikhail Kutuzov in the War of the Third Coalition against General Napoleon Bonaparte. Part one of the four-part adaptation of Leo Tolstoy\'s 1869 novel.','/ykqdYsRl6AU54R4tNQ3cERwsP00.jpg','1966-03-14',147,'Released',NULL,'War and Peace, Part I: Andrei Bolkonsky',147371,2.1405,7.6,'3DqanxfecIA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4846,_binary '\0','/4nIEoIesbcW85iwgneg92a9xU2P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059885',7.1,16366,'en','Von Ryan\'s Express','Von Ryan\'s Express stars Frank Sinatra as a POW colonel who leads a daring escape from WWII Italy by taking over a freight train, but he has to win over the British soldiers he finds himself commanding.','/kNIpEa4fe0RvgTqjkRrHFuSW8lz.jpg','1965-06-23',117,'Released',NULL,'Von Ryan\'s Express',21876,5.0745,7.1,'k-umWzR3Z3M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4847,_binary '\0','/prioHI5Z8BtN41QqZFd7frCp4Dp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059887',3.8,2063,'en','Voyage to the Prehistoric Planet','In 2020, following the colonization of the moon, the spaceships Vega, Sirius and Capella are launched from Lunar Station 7. They\'re to explore Venus under the command of Professor Hartman, but an asteroid collides and explodes Capella. Vega stays orbiting and sends the astronauts Kern and Sherman with the robot John to the surface of Venus, but they have problems with communication with Dr. Marsha Evans in Vega. The Sirius lands in Venus and Commander Brendan Lockhart, Andre Ferneau and Hans Walter are attacked by prehistoric animals. They use a vehicle to seek Kern and Sherman while collecting samples from the planet. Meanwhile, John helps the two cosmonauts to survive. (Re-edited version of Pavel Klushantsev\'s 1962 Soviet sci-fi Planet of Storms, dubbed into English with additional scenes.)','/3Zpax52NVEyf8nIcKlaWgGa6kb8.jpg','1965-08-01',78,'Released',NULL,'Voyage to the Prehistoric Planet',72091,1.8901,4.1,'xGYbwnTlmrs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4848,_binary '\0','/6KZoaJuDorWcpRcLpRow97gcgGB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059893',7.6,1719,'hi','वक़्त','A businessman\'s family is torn apart by an earthquake and reunited years later in a courtroom where father and sons stand opposed in the roles of accused, lawyer, and witness.','/bOvDhkmqvbWWfxE82fAvU4wZVXO.jpg','1965-07-28',178,'Released','The Moving Finger writes; and, having writ, moves on.','Waqt',71299,1.1566,6.7,'G2cduBMs48o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4849,_binary '\0','/soIpQdRz2HzTyRl8zZemGgeaH8h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059894',7.9,8272,'en','The War Game','A hypothetical Chinese invasion of South Vietnam triggers a new world war between East and West. In Rochester, Kent, the anticipation of a nuclear attack leads to mass evacuations. When a stray missile explodes, the ensuing firestorm blinds all those who see it. It\'s not long before the fabric of society is ripped apart from radiation poisoning, a lack of infrastructure and rioting for food and other necessities.','/puJGNnrAPOv3BUMI9mKlCJp3UrQ.jpg','1966-04-13',48,'Released','BBC TV\'s film about a nuclear attack on Britain','The War Game',26508,1.7896,7.7,'vR3ySErpgBQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4850,_binary '\0','/9d1zhCO3d3lu7LPDFqeg9gPE1uX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059895',5.3,2970,'en','City Under the Sea','A chance discovery leads American mining engineer Ben Harris and acquaintance Harold to discover a lost city under the sea while searching for their kidnapped friend Jill. Held captive in the underwater city by the tyrannical Captain (Vincent Price), and his crew of former smugglers, the three plot to escape...','/u8zFBSOpblP7XoTfRkftqhYyAFp.jpg','1965-05-26',84,'Released','They dared the most fantastic journey that has ever challenged imagination!','War-Gods of the Deep',38267,2.9622,5.006,'Fo8SrycaTFE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4851,_binary '\0','/A02jv1zko5VM8lUCEF4gdFOyDqH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059896',6.6,4072,'en','The War Lord','A knight in the service of a duke goes to a coastal village where an earlier attempt to build a defensive castle has failed. He begins to rebuild the duke\'s authority in the face of the barbarians at the border and is making progress until he falls in love with one of the local women.','/7fMXFuKQ6ww0fwq854kjWDtsQJ0.jpg','1965-11-17',123,'Released','He Battled Two Empires For The Love Of One Woman.','The War Lord',42664,3.2543,6.247,'K9jGTDFAneQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4852,_binary '\0','/rq8908sDqtyEGiRagGtPYuWSwFb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059903',6,12115,'en','What\'s New Pussycat?','A playboy who refuses to give up his hedonistic lifestyle to settle down and marry his true love seeks help from a demented psychoanalyst who is having romantic problems of his own.','/seKbiGx8mjF04Bx4LVBQk741Eqv.jpg','1965-06-22',108,'Released','How you cats will laugh ... when you see the answer to the comedy question of the year!!!','What\'s New Pussycat?',3681,3.4408,5.945,'_QdV4w7Rljo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4853,_binary '\0','/eYOil3TxFHKpvFRmj4ArUHgZMGq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059909',6.6,1850,'en','Who Killed Teddy Bear?','A grim police detective embarks on a one-man crusade to track down a depraved sex maniac when a nightclub deejay receives a disturbing series of obscene phone calls. Finding himself getting far too close to the victim for comfort, the hard-boiled cop must track down the unbalanced pervert before he can carry out his sick threats.','/dQrzV5QaqI5pERSSmSqUympcAk9.jpg','1965-09-01',94,'Released','Why with everybody else - why with every slob ... and not with me?','Who Killed Teddy Bear?',85246,2.0163,6.4,'BG7v766AO78','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4854,_binary '\0','/aJkWnVcyLjnHLTYi5Zx2w8EXqwc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059914',4.6,1240,'it','I criminali della galassia','A rogue cop must stop a scientist from taking over the world with his deadly female robots, who are shrinking the world leaders.','/eV5aRcljsF6Tmnz6UgmY7zrnxuK.jpg','1966-07-15',93,'Released','WILD is the Word For This World!','The Wild, Wild Planet',28912,2.1796,4.5,'viPFbQYEMWY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4855,_binary '\0','/8viekHLJISuhitoskhrENyNhUKZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059915',6.6,3280,'de','Winnetou 3. Teil','Rollins\' gang wants to grab land by inciting the settlers in a war against the Indians but Winnetou and Old Shatterhand try to keep the peace, until Rollins frames Winnetou up for the murder of Jicarilla Chief\'s son.','/2pGKMW4QpvljuS2AiEcxyP9RwCk.jpg','1965-10-14',93,'Released','«Blazing a trail of violence across the Apache range!»','The Desperado Trail',7085,3.7874,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4856,_binary '\0','/kKfmcvVPQ7Qu5FNzjMqe8L45WbR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059927',6.4,4416,'en','The Yellow Rolls-Royce','One Rolls-Royce belongs to three vastly different owners, starting with Lord Charles, who buys the car for his wife as an anniversary present. The next owner is Paolo Maltese, a mafioso who purchases the car during a trip to Italy and leaves it with his girlfriend while he returns to Chicago. Finally, the car is owned by American widow Gerda, who joins the Yugoslavian resistance against the invading Nazis.','/2LgXARrIIafiBk0sImU83NUo4Sr.jpg','1964-12-31',122,'Released','The screen\'s most exciting cast...in the year\'s most magnificent movie.','The Yellow Rolls-Royce',47616,3.0386,6.1,'dyiwV519aYE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4857,_binary '\0','/c8dGHq1uzmXKQf3WcLlc9enlSCI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059930',6.5,1475,'en','Young Cassidy','In Dublin circa 1911, John Cassidy (Rod Taylor), an impoverished idealist, whose ambitions are restricted by the demands of looking after his family, journeys through the social injustices of Dublin life, involving himself with the rowdy tramway-men strike, dawdling with prostitute Daisy Battles (Julie Christie), and seeking a better life. He falls in love with bookshop assistant Nora (Dame Maggie Smith) who encourages him toward a life of writing. Finding success at the Abbey Theatre, his unorthodox views estrange him from family, friends, and his own past.','/tHEiiXdVeZbks3AIFHXKvbT86Yy.jpg','1965-02-25',110,'Released','He\'s a brawling, sprawling giant - on the make for fame and fortune and then some!','Young Cassidy',130474,1.8129,6.4,'jjNUV0Y6Dxg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4858,_binary '\0','/g85eAKkBGTuymtSaG8t1BwxwD1L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059934',7.5,1952,'fr','Yoyo','The story follows the son of a millionaire from the 1920s to the 1960s. After losing his fortune in the stock-exchange crash, he teams up with an equestrienne and becomes a circus clown.','/yjgxj4hkZk87hNXd39GpUPC6STp.jpg','1965-02-19',92,'Released',NULL,'Yoyo',90228,2.1589,7,'6dBKC0eDpBg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4859,_binary '\0','/lUFbxqNdvAg5dCyF0QiPebfQ3yp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059942',7.3,1765,'ja','座頭市地獄旅','Zatoichi makes friends with a dangerous chess player, while fending off angry yakuza and bloodthirsty relatives out for revenge, and trying to save a sick child. Meanwhile, his luck with dice is turning.','/uCjTYCDTjpFl6CNKhRMO824d4Vk.jpg','1965-12-24',87,'Released',NULL,'Zatoichi and the Chess Expert',54275,1.5782,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4860,_binary '\0','/om47GMuXbkAtlBgBcOnklWAXg6H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059956',6.3,4462,'fr','Viva Maria!','1907 Central America: Maria II is the daughter of an Irish terrorist. After her father\'s death, she meets Maria I, a performer, and decides to stay with the circus, and on her debut as a singer, unintentionally invents the striptease and makes the circus famous. Their inadvertent encounter with a socialist revolutionary lands them leading a revolution against the dictator, the capitalists, and the Church.','/hAArxvmVALRNf7fmWdzT7dVFz8k.jpg','1965-11-22',120,'Released','The world will never forget the two heroines who charged into battle undaunted, unafraid, and… undressed!','Viva Maria!',11799,3.7707,6.1,'r6-nQ14u-Po','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4861,_binary '\0','/3pDUmvySpZ9NcDGsNfZdaLYjabi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0059958',5.8,1883,'de','Der Ölprinz','\'The Oilprince\' is an unscrupulous businessman. He looks forward to a lucrative deal with the \"Western Arizona Bank\'. He sells the bank oil wells at Shelly Lake that do actually not exist. The Oilprince learns that the colonists would like to settle at Shelly Lake. So The Oilprince exchanges the scout of the settlers by one of his minions to give them another route. But soon The Oilprince has to recognize that he has not counted on Winnetou, the righteous leader of the Apaches, and his blood brother Old Surehand.','/nfqEVP55iiL8aqeNjWc1ci1c9nA.jpg','1965-08-25',89,'Released','Flaming arrows blaze a trail of violence!','Rampage at Apache Wells',19199,2.6382,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4862,_binary '\0','/6Nz73hPTfFuBUXaINATITdtO86D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060048',5.8,1343,'en','40 Guns to Apache Pass','The Apaches are on the warpath and the Army must defend them. Murphy\'s mission is to get a shipment of rifles, but it\'s stolen by greedy white traders with the help of mutinous soldiers','/jyIw7iw40epEMCOilkdrAH5trks.jpg','1967-05-01',95,'Released','He had to get the guns through the whole Apache nation !','40 Guns to Apache Pass',38680,2.1418,5.283,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4863,_binary '\0','/7GAhBBYzEoFbOFhUEppjtaVPWiS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060049',5.5,1456,'it','5 tombe per un medium','An attorney arrives at a castle to settle the estate of its recently deceased owner. The owner\'s wife and daughter reveal that he was someone who was able to summon the souls of ancient plague victims and, in fact, his spirit was roaming the castle at that very moment. Soon occupants of the castle begin to die off in gruesome, violent ways.','/oDPvbzIURDmkCE4b2NXrJDk4C9x.jpg','1965-06-23',85,'Released','They rise from dank coffins in the dead of night, murdering their victims in an orgy of slaughter!','Terror-Creatures from the Grave',63507,1.721,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4864,_binary '\0','/wXZ1B8eCiEWeQ8nlGnKgc2NwvrW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060050',6.8,3103,'en','7 Women','In a mission in China in 1935, a group of women are preyed on by Mongolian bandits, led by Warlord chief Tunga Khan.','/cD4SUHUBDpJgFc63UjANsy1cPhl.jpg','1965-12-11',87,'Released','Love-Lust, Courage and Cowardice, Faith-Fury and Sacrifice!','7 Women',68692,2.6724,6.5,'oY-Jbqv0J28','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4865,_binary '\0','/gKNYytFLuh1uiLFxguojAfPoPgf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060063',6.9,1218,'de','Abschied von gestern','A young German woman searches for happiness, liberation, and independence in the illusive wake of a transformative national recovery.','/jNZE31JyFxGWbjgQ3ThAsFtGgfW.jpg','1967-09-21',88,'Released',NULL,'Yesterday Girl',89785,1.1791,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4866,_binary '\0','/g961TJZSGL8RzWGwpFK3Us77SfM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060073',7,2273,'it','Africa Addio','A chronicle of the violence that occurred in much of the African continent throughout the 1960s. As many African countries were transitioning from colonial rule to other forms of government, violent political upheavals were frequent. Revolutions in Zanzibar and Kenya in which thousands were killed are shown, the violence not only political; there is also extensive footage of hunters and poachers slaughtering different types of wild animals.','/fPLzCid2gk7eOCrYlXIBU24bTpO.jpg','1966-02-11',138,'Released','Every Scene Looks You Straight in the Eye... and Spits!','Africa Blood and Guts',41264,3.0399,6.2,'R2owwGvTsUw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4867,_binary '\0','/dFijYQ5amAjLepT6ctbcQ9z3DJz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060074',2.4,1579,'en','Agent for H.A.R.M.','The head of the Human Aetiological Relations Machine pits an agent against a flesh-to-fungus spore gun.','/2j79blKjbZLhhI6ObVw69pX7gjB.jpg','1966-01-05',84,'Released','They used the world\'s deadliest weapons against this super-secret agent!','Agent for H.A.R.M.',31240,1.6591,2.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4868,_binary '\0','/ksSpcJxiYaqDlgAgEFtbGieXQMM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060086',7,16999,'en','Alfie','A young man leads a promiscuous lifestyle until several life reversals make him rethink his purposes and goals in life.','/tPUqgfGMkZazRZ1UO41j2Fiib5C.jpg','1966-03-29',114,'Released','Is any man an Alfie? Ask any girl!','Alfie',15598,2.7981,6.5,'4i49XISKA48','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4869,_binary '\0','/zCHWazmCt8ljDXGD0ikeCddZ5dE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060094',5.2,2161,'en','The Alphabet Murders','The Belgian detective Hercule Poirot investigates a series of murders in London in which the victims are killed according to their initials.','/AiBmQsxpMage7Vbs7NgUZT4EkhY.jpg','1965-12-26',90,'Released','It\'s really no mystery why this girl is MURDER... it\'s as simple as ABC if you look hard enough!','The Alphabet Murders',6026,2.2191,5.7,'CjCHKFj2GhY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4870,_binary '\0','/eqHr8VVCIPTg6SJspjkqkRC5FrX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060095',6.3,3020,'en','Alvarez Kelly','In 1864, during the American Civil War, Mexican cattleman Alvarez Kelly supplies the Union with cattle until unexpected circumstances force him to change his customers.','/6kIcuVMyJJKmxy7bFbI9q1DWByR.jpg','1966-10-06',106,'Released','A herd of cattle against a herd of cannon!','Alvarez Kelly',60285,3.0445,6.175,'Lf1b4c8hh-E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4871,_binary '\0','/l6aGueqXfrXfiatoriaWIYjhuey.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060097',5.7,3057,'it','Amanti d\'oltretomba','A sadistic count tortures and murders his unfaithful wife and her lover, then removes their hearts from their bodies. Years later, the count remarries and the new wife experiences nightmares and hauntings.','/rP53nQzUYJ04ur6Mb7XSaahW1vN.jpg','1965-08-20',105,'Released','WARNING! See it with someone who\'s shockproof!','Nightmare Castle',28673,2.2978,5.3,'vMeq47AnwSo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4872,_binary '\0','/jqha8JCXm0aJ5SJ03Jd0JmGgWRs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060107',8,61208,'ru','Андрей Рублёв','An expansive Russian drama, this film focuses on the life of revered religious icon painter Andrei Rublev. Drifting from place to place in a tumultuous era, the peace-seeking monk eventually gains a reputation for his art. But after Rublev witnesses a brutal battle and unintentionally becomes involved, he takes a vow of silence and spends time away from his work. As he begins to ease his troubled soul, he takes steps towards becoming a painter once again.','/jUihkn16SwPPIjuOyo6orHWUep6.jpg','1966-12-16',183,'Released','In much wisdom there is much grief.','Andrei Rublev',895,4.4423,7.9,'t1d5FSyMEd8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4873,_binary '\0','/l5M7tsmEqA02z4Ftdv9C5VHp4ue.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060109',6.4,1454,'it','Un angelo per Satana','At the end of the 19th century, in a little Italian village by a lake an old statue is recovered. Soon a series of crimes start and the superstitious people of the village believe that the statue carries an ancient malediction.','/hL4mqhDMmRKbbC98xwAPhlhyG4I.jpg','1966-05-04',90,'Released',NULL,'An Angel for Satan',69777,1.6015,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4874,_binary '\0','/uKvJAa9orzv4uRjlUbcTZrOU8vn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060112',6,1265,'en','Any Wednesday','Ellen Gordon, a New York executive\'s mistress falls for the executive\'s young business associate when the young man is accidentally sent to use the apartment where the executive and his mistress get together every Wednesday. More complications arise when the executive\'s wife shows up with plans to redecorate the apartment.','/hhnpJY9ldontHXHbxBAiRJw0eIw.jpg','1966-10-13',109,'Released','It\'s got some new ideas about multiple dwelling!','Any Wednesday',42714,1.4055,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4875,_binary '\0','/40iHvDkT3YfnIGSIHQhw0HxOFtJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060116',7.5,1227,'hu','Apa','When young Tako\'s father dies in Hungary in 1945, Tako is left with scant memories of him. Nurtured by his mother, the boy fantasizes about the man his father was, imagining him a hero. Grown into a man himself, Tako falls for a Jewish refugee, Anni. Burdened by her own heritage as a Jew, Anni sparks in Tako a desire to find out what his father was really like, and he delves into the role his father played in World War II.','/8FyQmF3aAtgEDrhBN6g2HixfpaR.jpg','1966-12-08',88,'Released','Diary of One Week','Father',42715,0.9168,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4876,_binary '\0','/3p3yFs26AVDE8RP6ANT0NOETrlx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060120',6.3,3904,'en','The Appaloosa','A man tries to recover a horse stolen from him by a Mexican bandit.','/uCxvQAKOltwQ7vPIocW6CVe2cxO.jpg','1966-09-15',99,'Released','Southwest to Sonora rode the lustful, the lawless... to live on the edge of violence!','The Appaloosa',34012,2.6327,6.4,'1Oglpgqb52Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4877,_binary '\0','/tCfdA5LRFiKIiz6Og6I3DvEFJla.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060121',6.4,9153,'en','Arabesque','When a plot against a prominent Middle Eastern politician is uncovered, David Pollock, a professor of ancient hieroglyphics at Oxford University, is recruited to help expose the scheme. Pollock must find information believed to be in hieroglyphic code and must also contend with a mysterious man called Beshraavi. Meanwhile, Beshraavi\'s lover, Yasmin Azir, seems willing to aid Pollock -- but is she really on his side?','/ufQBXrETmVizoVaoYKAmjArRTyr.jpg','1966-05-04',105,'Released','Ultra Mod. Ultra Mad. Ultra Mystery.','Arabesque',23030,2.6158,6.3,'1aMKGOO7PXM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4878,_binary '\0','/dELiIRHrpNpncIApojSW67kPNdQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060125',7.7,5936,'it','L\'armata Brancaleone','A group of rogues steal a scroll granting its bearer the property of the land of Aurocastro in Apulia, a province in the south of Italy. They elect a shaggy knight, Brancaleone from Norcia, as their leader, and decide to get possession of this supposedly wealthy land. Many adventures will occurr during the journey.','/zRdd1qYJpxKKy57ufAK4E7gi13W.jpg','1966-04-07',120,'Released',NULL,'For Love and Gold',23832,3.0198,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4879,_binary '\0','/fnWKgGGImCrcxQny9bFif0IikpL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060135',5.6,1361,'en','Assault on a Queen','A group of adventurers refloat a WWII German submarine and prepare to use it to pull a very large heist; The Queen Mary which they plan to rob on the high seas.','/njPVhwl192zIJOpy5agbzY7XCEj.jpg','1966-06-15',106,'Released','They Stick Up The Queen Mary In Mid Atlantic','Assault on a Queen',42716,2.3517,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4880,_binary '\0','/7LPz7NEYtLXcV44j0kRLLkZ54yH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060138',7.7,25177,'fr','Au hasard Balthazar','The story of a donkey Balthazar as he is passed from owner to owner, some kind and some cruel but all with motivations beyond his understanding. Balthazar, whose life parallels that of his first keeper, Marie, is truly a beast of burden, suffering the sins of humankind. But despite his powerlessness, he accepts his fate nobly.','/lkLO1HDzzaXpTXtAgnGpVqIQkvF.jpg','1966-05-25',96,'Released',NULL,'Au Hasard Balthazar',20108,3.6047,7.543,'RN9H8ze3hXI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4881,_binary '\0','/eDEvBbgV1gJBRrysqXNp0B176V7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060143',6.1,2102,'it','Texas, Addio','A Texan sheriff and his younger brother travel across the border into Mexico to confront the man who killed their father.','/v7LfMBSjReDfsgskvzwCn1AobHw.jpg','1966-08-28',93,'Released',NULL,'Texas, Adios',23076,1.9807,6,'L5MpadGcWG0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4882,_binary '\0','/nOWOU0bdX76iF9XA1YPlInLbI4Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060153',6.5,38492,'en','Batman','The Dynamic Duo faces four super-villains who plan to hold the world for ransom with the help of a secret invention that instantly dehydrates people.','/iBaHizz1sfMs4N03aHsGe7I2G6S.jpg','1966-07-30',105,'Released','He\'s here big as life in a real Bat-Epic.','Batman',2661,5.7546,6.373,'TdG2V4vhPjg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4883,_binary '\0','/8KvYrF6oax8ZUIzi0z3mQmVPQUW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060161',8,6857,'ru','Берегись автомобиля','An insurance agent who moonlights as a car thief steals cars various crooks and never from the common people. He sells the stolen cars and gives the money to charity. His best friend, a cop, is assigned to bring in this modern Robin Hood.','/pxf7dGhwpwxe8b1itqxkkjFQac8.jpg','1966-05-22',94,'Released',NULL,'Beware of the Car!',39768,2.197,7.514,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4884,_binary '\0','/6xBqZoj40gIAyLSuemwI38c6OID.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060164',6.2,7018,'en','The Bible: In the Beginning...','Covering only the first 22 chapters of the Book of Genesis, vignettes include: Adam and Eve frolicking in the Garden of Eden until their indulgence in the forbidden fruit sees them driven out; Cain murdering his brother Abel; Noah building an ark to preserve the animals of the world from the coming flood; and Abraham making a covenant with God.','/2BtesvzFQJYFS2sPVVbUdet0TTC.jpg','1966-09-28',175,'Released','The unforgettable adventure of man from the creation!','The Bible: In the Beginning...',2525,6.3653,7.3,'uDrSn0wrJTU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4885,_binary '\0','/5D0UTw3y5KCsLxfP18zeiqjwGBz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060165',7.3,5356,'en','A Big Hand for the Little Lady','A naive traveler in Laredo gets involved in a poker game between the richest men in the area, jeopardizing all the money he has saved for the purpose of settling with his wife and child in San Antonio.','/cfLpJPfcg1XQtfymoiM2me4PScm.jpg','1966-06-08',95,'Released','All the action you can take...all the adventure you can wish for!','A Big Hand for the Little Lady',37301,3.9125,7.1,'qKmCIj3qtCM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4886,_binary '\0','/t04FA7toFWM2lO4g4tGOwwlbKMm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060168',3.9,2481,'en','Billy the Kid Versus Dracula','Dracula travels to the American West, intent on making a beautiful ranch owner his next victim. Her fiance, outlaw Billy the Kid, finds out about it and rushes to save her.','/A822lbDC7VkH6ZBR5wbVYl8C6K1.jpg','1966-04-10',74,'Released','The West\'s deadliest gun-fighter! The world\'s most diabolical killer!','Billy the Kid Versus Dracula',56165,1.6998,4.1,'rE-chhwi0bw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4887,_binary '\0','/zLdbdmBWCXkLPXozRPzmJOmpxco.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060174',5.1,1314,'en','Blood Bath','A painter of morbid art, who becomes a murderous vampire by night and kills young women, attempts a daytime relationship with a woman who resembles a former love and is also the sister of one of his victims.','/cTDOq2bYILUE2nxhKdvnxINpZ7Q.jpg','1966-03-02',62,'Released','The shrieking of mutilated victims caged in a black pit of horror!','Blood Bath',29070,1.6884,5.5,'BUNuXfuTQ_0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4888,_binary '\0','/rWtRkNGkg05rET8taCA96c7heLb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060176',7.4,73403,'en','Blow-Up','A successful mod photographer in London whose world is bounded by fashion, pop music, marijuana, and easy sex, feels his life is boring and despairing. But in the course of a single day he unknowingly captures a death on film.','/jVDVpydUw8Z50naUDAG4NbRCrSa.jpg','1966-12-18',111,'Released','Sometimes, reality is the strangest fantasy of all.','Blow-Up',1052,5.726,7.3,'PRENEOHlcbw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4889,_binary '\0','/g6fzxtuMPPx8KtQ2I6O6F2SPyfB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060177',7.1,8300,'en','The Blue Max','A young pilot in the German air force of 1918, disliked as lower-class and unchivalrous, tries ambitiously to earn the medal offered for 20 kills.','/p9FVlRLaB9uoZm6UoFe7Z4p84b4.jpg','1966-06-21',156,'Released','There was no quiet on the Western Front!','The Blue Max',19728,3.1445,6.833,'Efc6Y6LCuuc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4890,_binary '\0','/33kRnZfiYd6WPKpMge5OQhzxYGN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060182',7.2,7640,'en','Born Free','At a national park in Kenya, English game warden George Adamson and his wife, Joy, care for three orphaned lion cubs. After the two larger lions are shipped off to a zoo in the Netherlands, the smallest of the three, Elsa, stays with the couple. When Elsa is blamed for causing an elephant stampede in the nearby village, head warden John Kendall demands the young lion either be trained to survive in the wilds of the Serengeti or be sent to a zoo.','/xI5BkObQm7UtYEFTw7ZmiDGF7gT.jpg','1966-03-14',95,'Released','From The Pages Of The Beloved Best Seller... A Motion Picture To Delight All The World!','Born Free',15347,2.5857,6.761,'77C6wRRfzgA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4891,_binary '\0','/rysGHe65LF3cdmeibH2kCkozjaR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060186',5.5,1435,'en','Boy, Did I Get a Wrong Number!','Tom Meade mistakenly dials the gorgeous European film star Didi at her Oregon hotel. Didi, who has escaped Hollywood to avoid being typecast as a bombshell, takes up Meade\'s offer to hide away at his backwoods cabin. Meade, with the help of his housekeeper, goes to absurd lengths to help the actress evade discovery by both the public and his suspicious wife.','/o6sITOCTE4OfjtQDp3ct85UYOn9.jpg','1966-06-08',99,'Released','38-22-36 Boy - she has some area code!','Boy, Did I Get a Wrong Number!',39214,2.1476,5.3,'-ggK-bqmrF4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4892,_binary '\0','/mbFvUfsKqeuinP4gGygn5LeR5pu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060188',5.5,1542,'en','The Brides of Fu Manchu','This time Fu Manchu and his army of henchmen are kidnaping the daughters of prominent scientists and taking them to his remote island headquarters. Instead of asking for ransom, Fu demands that the fathers help him to build a death ray, which he intends to use to take over the world. But Fu\'s archenemy, Nayland Smith of Scotland Yard, is determined not to let that happen.','/yoz8Enrv2gRdEfcozkpMh9Nr8JA.jpg','1966-12-16',94,'Released',NULL,'The Brides of Fu Manchu',30972,2.2583,5.9,'29qsLeh4CKQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4893,_binary '\0','/x4biAVdPVCghBlsVIzB6NmbghIz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060196',8.8,900938,'it','Il buono, il brutto, il cattivo','While the Civil War rages on between the Union and the Confederacy, three men – a quiet loner, a ruthless hitman, and a Mexican bandit – comb the American Southwest in search of a strongbox containing $200,000 in stolen gold.','/bX2xnavhMYjWDoZp1VM6VnU1xwe.jpg','1966-12-23',161,'Released','For three men the Civil War wasn\'t hell. It was practice.','The Good, the Bad and the Ugly',429,28.455,8.468,'3VQjSSB78es','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4894,_binary '\0','/sQRqZ4s7KHl2uHg5dm2CGm0BZgI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060200',6.4,5331,'en','After the Fox','A criminal mastermind sets up a phony film production as part of a plan to smuggle stolen gold.','/aw4jMLBfDU9NfFxb4GvbHrupQoS.jpg','1966-09-08',108,'Released','Watch your girl, guard your gold, hold your jewels ...the fox is loose!','After the Fox',19137,2.2611,6.1,'MrQl0VsQYtw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4895,_binary '\0','/rAnmyPxyEFSeBCV8WqxAaFQ70F1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060214',6.7,6679,'en','Carry On Screaming!','The sinister Dr. Watt has an evil scheme going—he\'s kidnapping beautiful young women and turning them into mannequins to sell to local stores. Fortunately for him, Detective Sergeant Bung is on the case, and he doesn\'t have a clue!','/wdx7B9BjOBSmMJYYdmdbY55JquJ.jpg','1966-05-20',97,'Released','Carry On Screaming with the Hilarious CARRY ON Gang!!','Carry On Screaming!',5060,2.1068,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4896,_binary '\0','/pBnwwNZ5W44ruMjoPz5ZRvKxnL7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060218',6.3,4481,'en','Cast a Giant Shadow','An American Army officer is recruited by the yet to exist Israel to help them form an army. He is disturbed by this sudden appeal to his Jewish heritage. Each of Israel\'s Arab neighbors has vowed to invade the poorly prepared country as soon as partition is granted. He is made commander of the Israeli forces just before the war begins.','/s3IhCoMfbQSMuUCJvpKWKFuOMwY.jpg','1966-03-30',146,'Released','Outnumbered - unarmed - unprepared - they stunned the world with their incredible victory!','Cast a Giant Shadow',8737,3.8602,6.3,'5AhsTY5_1hE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4897,_binary '\0','/wRrJUyd8v8sozRdPw2xDRsLkHFo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060223',7.5,2729,'es','La caza','Three veterans of the Spanish Civil War go rabbit hunting. While doing so, old wounds open up.','/2lODWq6rLdcb8hLuQpt9qHSAatW.jpg','1966-11-07',87,'Released',NULL,'The Hunt',114333,1.1472,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4898,_binary '\0','/ikdiyynH0DWG3edRffdN9p3BJvE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060228',6,1657,'en','Chamber of Horrors','A one-handed madman (he lost the hand while escaping a hanging) uses various detachable devices as murder weapons to gain revenge on those he believes have wronged him.','/20ZSQmTNtddC4AXUojj4ASYx7kx.jpg','1966-10-19',99,'Released','The unspeakable vengeance of the crazed Baltimore strangler!','Chamber of Horrors',52840,2.2302,5.6,'CZuKyuOJ-zk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4899,_binary '\0','/v1qEgoa9gqdomROteK8ceelJueJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060232',7.1,15474,'en','The Chase','The escape of Bubber Reeves from prison affects the inhabitants of a small Southern town.','/lpX8szjdzaXqxKBiV8xfRVNzSiu.jpg','1966-02-18',135,'Released','A breathless explosive story of today!','The Chase',31602,4.7769,7.1,'plmBOSpRGiw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4900,_binary '\0','/xoKUNLfbxA40bAQO55eKodHTrCf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060261',6.7,2630,'it','I crudeli','A Southern Colonel, his three sons, and a card shark embark on an odyssey through the Southwest carrying a coffin full of stolen money with which the Colonel plans to revive the Confederacy.','/bdoM24jbpxMvpiS2OCjCNkJP0H8.jpg','1967-02-02',90,'Released','A coffin without a corpse... crammed with millions in cash!','The Hellbenders',90720,2.2236,6.5,'49YthFy2Bzk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4901,_binary '\0','/7IQSByEDlsHqwRJZcQUPoiBlwAe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060263',6.4,1576,'fr','Les Créatures','A writer decides to use the strange inhabitants of a small island as a basis for characters in his new book.','/Au7UmEA1gnUPIljLFPwb180WOkh.jpg','1966-09-03',94,'Released',NULL,'The Creatures',53026,1.8757,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4902,_binary '\0','/9MA9H3opBwq9cP4taf3S5ZWI2Fz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060268',7,15108,'en','Cul-de-sac','On the run and in search of help, two wounded gangsters find refuge in the secluded castle of a feeble man and his wife; however, under the point of a gun, nothing is what it seems.','/5YmxgiY8Pi9D1kawwzQUE7nCQQM.jpg','1966-06-17',112,'Released','Sometimes there’s nothing left to do but laugh!','Cul-de-sac',4772,2.9013,6.7,'3YEAeELtSYQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4903,_binary '\0','/4qEw9OXqagoJDW0vpzLL5Fe1Mt0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060277',7.9,13415,'ja','大菩薩峠','Ryunosuke, a gifted swordsman plying his trade during the turbulent final days of Shogunate rule, has no moral code and kills without remorse. It’s a way of life that leads to madness.','/yjHbIihqpuAXlZVoPbWdqaukllB.jpg','1966-02-25',122,'Released','The sword is the soul. Study the soul to know the sword. Evil mind, evil sword.','The Sword 