ERN LIFE','2 or 3 Things I Know About Her',8074,3.3441,6.249,'yST1KXpBamI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4908,_binary '\0','/1qKTp9G1hrCxindF0xpsZGKbSsL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060305',7.9,7537,'fr','Le Deuxième Souffle','A gangster escapes jail and quickly makes plans to continue his criminal ways elsewhere, but a determined inspector is closing in.','/yuTl6T6BnRdCqyGMJvSmLkAgSaS.jpg','1966-11-01',144,'Released',NULL,'Le Deuxième Souffle',25047,2.0744,7.673,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4909,_binary '\0','/h0ScFzvKcd5pa3At8zVM54pS0uv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060307',5.8,3667,'en','The Witches','Following a nervous breakdown, Gwen takes up the job of head teacher in the small village of Haddaby. There she can benefit from the tranquillity and peace, enabling her to recover fully. But under the facade of idyllic country life she slowly unearths the frightening reality of village life in which the inhabitants are followers of a menacing satanic cult with the power to inflict indiscriminate evil and death if crossed.','/jPfBd6Af21hVtSSFPrbfV4nWKCz.jpg','1966-11-21',89,'Released','A STRANGER IN A TOWN THAT HAS LOST ITS MIND... IF SHE\'S NOT CAREFUL, SHE MAY LOSE HERS TOO!','The Witches',40244,1.7445,6,'v-FUFzbkhLg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4910,_binary '\0','/2tFsObjPy5Q0Ea4pb0ICPqVI2ht.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060315',7.2,34603,'it','Django','A coffin-dragging gunslinger and a prostitute become embroiled in a bitter feud between a Klan of Southern racists and a band of Mexican Revolutionaries.','/XO7MrV0nsDlBWLjfM5ekiGgjyt.jpg','1966-04-06',92,'Released','The movie that spawned a genre.','Django',10772,4.5029,7.2,'jLPFh4ObsJU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4911,_binary '\0','/ppjf2RDN3vz0LV75OKsLw9gBeIP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060330',6.5,3494,'en','Don\'t Lose Your Head','Amidst the French revolution, Citizen Robespierre is beheading the aristocracy! When word gets to England, noblemen Sir Rodney Ffing and Lord Darcy Pue take it upon themselves to aid their French counterparts. Sir Rodney is a master of disguise, and becomes \'The Black Fingernail\' scourge of Camembert and Bidet, leaders of the French secret police.','/tZE4PPIX1qhUZjyajzDLwsEZtVT.jpg','1967-03-02',97,'Released','Carry On laughing until you have hysterics, but... Don\'t Lose Your Head!','Don\'t Lose Your Head',5061,2.2653,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4912,_binary '\0','/1Q5b34cge5nClCpamxf3HkU18W1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060345',8.3,66630,'en','How the Grinch Stole Christmas!','Bitter and hateful, the Grinch is irritated at the thought of a nearby village having a happy time celebrating Christmas. Disguised as Santa Claus, with his dog made to look like a reindeer, he decides to raid the village to steal all the Christmas things.','/7ir0iRuPK9OEuH569cp0nF5CJce.jpg','1966-12-18',25,'Released','You\'re a mean one, Mr. Grinch.','How the Grinch Stole Christmas!',13377,5.5515,7.521,'8J1AXS8C20M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4913,_binary '\0','/1ULaC1QZjZxoGHpdYzoSvxNzo5g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060355',6.5,4963,'en','Duel at Diablo','In Apache territory, a supply Army column heads for the next fort, an ex-scout searches for the killer of his Native wife, and a housewife abandons her husband to rejoin her Apache lover\'s tribe.','/bKtx5Nu0LzjNDvCHthTQ3KAY95f.jpg','1966-06-15',105,'Released','Yesterday they fought each other – today they fight together in a dead end canyon called Diablo!','Duel at Diablo',1403,3.3405,6.4,'-KKf9cm-7rs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4914,_binary '\0','/uNRfK14Ga8Hwfqt07vo8nvWQN1i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060371',7.6,7009,'en','The Endless Summer','Bruce Brown\'s The Endless Summer is one of the first and most influential surf movies of all time. The film documents American surfers Mike Hynson and Robert August as they travel the world during California’s winter (which, back in 1965 was off-season for surfing) in search of the perfect wave and ultimately, an endless summer.','/jDdntrv2j64KB0Zpr63cko4Mebt.jpg','1966-06-15',91,'Released','The Search for the Perfect Wave!','The Endless Summer',21,1.9665,7.157,'yZsuQXKkPdw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4915,_binary '\0','/wXVLnXy1g2kV7EyB3LCbn5LfJaO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060380',6.9,2660,'pt','Esta Noite Encarnarei no Teu Cadáver','Coffin Joe, the unholy undertaker, is back in town to continue his quest for the perfect woman, embarking on an even more brutal campaign of terror, aided and abetted by his hunchbacked assistant.','/gLqPb9nRw1mAoXfA4RvrnR0vf9j.jpg','1967-03-13',108,'Released','Hell in Eastmancolor','This Night I\'ll Possess Your Corpse',30914,1.2289,6.9,'PE3UUxSmpB0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4916,_binary '\0','/gyC9u8GOeNwyKzvXHAOhTsfps5u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060390',7.2,47866,'en','Fahrenheit 451','In the future, the government maintains control of public opinion by outlawing literature and maintaining a group of enforcers, known as “firemen,” to perform the necessary book burnings. Fireman Montag begins to question the morality of his vocation…','/k2CTpexoS9MO9lKVFfnzwVdJuM.jpg','1966-09-07',113,'Released','What if you had no right to read?','Fahrenheit 451',1714,4.208,7.113,'7cQ-yGCyjyM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4917,_binary '\0','/u4jVMdkgfNhom6AARDkGox0003l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060395',7.3,2193,'en','The Family Way','Young newlyweds Arthur and Jenny Fitton want nothing more than to get their marriage started on the right foot. But before they can depart for their honeymoon in Spain, they have to spend their first night together at the home of Arthur\'s parents. The couple are prevented from having any intimacy, but it only gets worse. They find out that their trip to Spain is canceled, which sets the tone for a rocky few weeks.','/1uUCHj2gmaRcbfIqvmJkvdemggd.jpg','1966-12-18',115,'Released','A girl, a boy, a tender, funny, terrible wedding night.','The Family Way',18373,1.8677,6.7,'p2azcOdkRbU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4918,_binary '\0','/mXMoQjJjoAhLl51uVDZlSGMPb9S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060397',6.8,22732,'en','Fantastic Voyage','In order to save an assassinated scientist, a submarine and its crew are shrunk to microscopic size and injected into his bloodstream.','/hEWWLe1Lrk58gle3IKCnjBScfzO.jpg','1966-08-24',101,'Released','A Fantastic and Spectacular Voyage... Through the Human Body... Into the Brain.','Fantastic Voyage',2161,4.7843,6.668,'dO5E4wkg0hA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4919,_binary '\0','/6BMk2AnieC5sDkhcBiNjWWoxvHe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060400',6.7,8955,'fr','Fantômas contre Scotland Yard','In the third and final episode of the trilogy, Fantômas imposes a head tax on the rich, threatening to kill those who do not comply.','/wrs0leNyQwVbUOoXCnfMf3Bix4V.jpg','1967-03-16',104,'Released',NULL,'Fantomas vs. Scotland Yard',1875,3.8203,6.7,'bWWy5OahGV0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4920,_binary '\0','/oHxgUzwwLv0a9EQfsmnUxaoFVSC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060401',7.3,2752,'pl','Faraon','Young Pharaoh Ramses XIII clashes with Egypt\'s clergy over influence on the affairs of the state and its coffers. inexperienced, but quite ambitious pharaoh is putting up a fight against a powerful clan of priests usurping rule over the country.','/8ipkoxt3yvYeLuHfxPhaRaQCgwX.jpg','1966-03-11',151,'Released','Out of Ancient Egypt - The Real... Dramatic Struggle of Love And Power - 5000 Years B.C','Pharaoh',5040,1.6328,6.773,'qYg2QDNDKXU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4921,_binary '\0','/lDPx7Byf5Zwtxa9Kva6J0uD97V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060414',5.5,1705,'en','A Fine Madness','A womanizing poet falls into the hands of a psychiatrist with a straying wife.','/rBLOhciaodPoG4yOulsaCjlWbWM.jpg','1966-06-29',107,'Released','We should all be so crazy.','A Fine Madness',70498,2.0274,5,'REhThF0RxhM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4922,_binary '\0','/xf5vP9v5DeJkiidaWfk4TbHdJtD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060420',7.1,2820,'en','Follow Me, Boys!','Lem Siddons is part of a traveling band who has a dream of becoming a lawyer. Deciding to settle down, he finds a job as a stockboy in the general store of a small town. Trying to fit in, he volunteers to become scoutmaster of the newly formed Troop 1. Becoming more and more involved with the scout troop, he finds his plans to become a lawyer being put on the back burner, until he realizes that his life has been fulfilled helping the youth of the small town.','/f9K6Opys2zr5B64EbfsnuxPmbRh.jpg','1966-12-01',131,'Released','IT CAPTURES ALL...all the happiness and heartbreak of being America\'s #1 hometown hero.','Follow Me, Boys!',40454,2.2579,6.7,'o4dHmLu07HY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4923,_binary '\0','/x9krjfbtFfv1ouL8A59324M7O0e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060424',7.2,17486,'en','The Fortune Cookie','TV cameraman Harry Hinkle is injured while filming a football game. Seeing big dollar signs, his unscrupulous ambulance-chasing lawyer brother-in-law Willie Gingrich enters the picture, and convinces Harry to overstate his injuries and claim $1 million in pain and suffering. Harry\'s similarly-minded ex-wife suddenly reappears in an attempt to rekindle their relationship.','/tGZc0sRoXgGzRDhHaCRmqxNSKVZ.jpg','1966-10-19',125,'Released','Is he a spy? A security risk? Is he unfaithful? Or is he a nice, normal shnook - out to make a million bucks by sheer accident!','The Fortune Cookie',1888,3.8683,7.2,'3PTtQLQgaO0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4924,_binary '\0','/apiaZnjqu6G5xPBbsyr3M5nqgZs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060429',5.6,2740,'en','Frankie and Johnny','Johnny is a riverboat entertainer with a big gambling problem. After a psychic tells Johnny how he can change his luck, the appearance of a new \'lady luck\' soon causes a catfight with Johnny\'s girlfriend, Frankie.','/p0FXqTJ8fNASnJRxW8PYE5lfM6L.jpg','1966-03-31',87,'Released','ELVIS Turns The Land Of The Blues Red Hot With 11 Great Songs!','Frankie and Johnny',18691,3.3286,5.6,'uU7vS3XbpVU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4925,_binary '\0','/gmeKG3MPsuk1Bo1rheXlE8qEDFY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060437',6.8,8823,'en','Funeral in Berlin','Colonel Stok, a Soviet intelligence officer responsible for security at the Berlin Wall, appears to want to defect but the evidence is contradictory. Stok wants the British to handle his defection and asks for one of their agents, Harry Palmer, to smuggle him out of East Germany.','/xT15D124pyoq3HWDpuhoJTqLfFM.jpg','1966-12-22',102,'Released','It was going to be a lovely funeral. Harry ‘Ipcress File’ Palmer just hoped it wouldn’t be his …','Funeral in Berlin',34388,3.5527,6.395,'1AHOUwBdsKs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4926,_binary '\0','/hzamEWW4VPo5RMCxKWGAwZDr1tE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060438',6.8,10804,'en','A Funny Thing Happened on the Way to the Forum','A wily slave must unite a virgin courtesan and his young smitten master to earn his freedom.','/h3S9DZMUZNsAqd8ZNBed7ttPWXk.jpg','1966-10-16',97,'Released','Something for Everyone!','A Funny Thing Happened on the Way to the Forum',17768,3.0047,6.1,'Dl-bZH7EDic','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4927,_binary '\0','/nqcbVtaD5eYctQnYJyCiY9jp50t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060440',6.1,4145,'ja','フランケンシュタインの怪獣 サンダ対ガイラ','Gaira, a humanoid sea beast spawned from the discarded cells of Frankenstein\'s monster, attacks the shores of Tokyo. While the Japanese military prepares to take action, Gaira\'s Gargantua brother, Sanda, descends from the mountains to defend his kin. A battle between good and evil ensues, leaving brothers divided and a city in ruins.','/q8EH0y601mhYJmchoTRoo92Q0FS.jpg','1966-07-31',88,'Released','A crisis, striking from the mountains and the sea! Greater Tokyo is the battlefield of death!','The War of the Gargantuas',3146,2.5866,6.3,'7JBWFSkwNuo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4928,_binary '\0','/dnWUAYVMpsqZnvIthuYMhvRH5cQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060445',7.1,7560,'en','Gambit','Harry Dean is a career burglar set on stealing a piece of priceless art from the world\'s wealthiest man, Mr. Shahbandar. With the help of exotic showgirl Nicole Chang, he concocts the perfect scheme for how the robbery should go and lays it out point by point. However, when the team tries to execute the plan, perfection and reality don\'t quite match up, and Harry\'s vision begins to unravel in this twisty tale of a heist gone wrong.','/1MchaxoMtROoioSAwjLd5FEp6D.jpg','1966-12-16',109,'Released','Go Ahead: Tell the End (It\'s Too Hilarious to Keep Secret) But Please Don\'t Tell the Beginning!','Gambit',28270,2.9196,6.972,'bcDgAeUDUrM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4929,_binary '\0','/4r82M3QqtWfHKKDXwx2Rdo1ooMy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060446',5.2,3213,'ja','大怪獣決闘 ガメラ対バルゴン','Gamera escapes from his rocket enclosure and makes his way back to Earth as a giant opal from New Guinea is brought back to Japan. The opal is discovered to have been an egg that births a new monster called Barugon. The creature attacks the city of Osaka by emitting a destructive rainbow ray from his back, along with a freezing spray capable of incapacitating Gamera.','/tXHVZDyeZPMtd3ggxZEpjmDIdWg.jpg','1966-04-17',106,'Released','Gamera burns the streets of Osaka in an instant! Barugon freezes Osaka Castle with a single gust! An underwater clash at Lake Biwa!','Gamera vs. Barugon',22899,2.0587,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4930,_binary '\0','/e8PgiV1JE6fNSWPhSOvSqbeqUzU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060450',6.4,9377,'fr','Le Gendarme à New-York','Sergeant Cruchot and his faithful comrades have been sent to the International Congress of Gendarmerie in N.Y.','/rFXr6bjK1RfIU5IHz8SVyuiHdqc.jpg','1965-10-28',95,'Released',NULL,'The Gendarme in New York',4728,3.9539,6.316,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4931,_binary '\0','/Aitc3j9jzoRN0b2H0yqaSPVwb5n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060453',6.9,4644,'en','Georgy Girl','A homely but vivacious young woman dodges the amorous attentions of her father\'s middle-aged employer while attempting to please her glamorously stuck-up roommate Meredith.','/2v6ezHOqJM2HpSHiGWqLj0Mqs78.jpg','1966-08-04',99,'Released','Georgy Girl is BIG!','Georgy Girl',42719,2.2422,6.2,'PYoPDSuXkvA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4932,_binary '\0','/uWzysCpp7no96yXeYxzQTG2waUo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060457',4.6,1509,'en','The Ghost in the Invisible Bikini','A corpse has 24 hours to mastermind a good deed without leaving his crypt, to go \"up there\" and have his youth restored.','/oQi7TMOoFHF0J3DIojK9FKX2pQT.jpg','1966-04-06',82,'Released','There\'s Something BLOOD CURDLING for Everyone! ...when a pretty GHOUL trades in her bed sheet for a BIKINI!','The Ghost in the Invisible Bikini',86343,1.8469,5.1,'0xX834pEGp4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4933,_binary '\0','/cQ9sbPLBox8z2LIYsExHnsvgrzZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060463',6.5,5750,'en','The Glass Bottom Boat','Bruce, the owner of an aerospace company, is infatuated with Jennifer and hires her to be his biographer so that he can be near her and win her affections. Is she actually a Russian spy trying to obtain aerospace secrets?','/jlj5rCl7jfW7QskJ1vucd7j5n5M.jpg','1966-06-09',110,'Released','Is this the girl next door?','The Glass Bottom Boat',33666,3.2564,6.3,'GYUuHLCCgYs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4934,_binary '\0','/xQzDpV5edHLmCM3n15pcatHynOd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060464',5.6,7495,'ja','ゴジラ・エビラ・モスラ 南海の大決闘','Searching for his brother, Ryota stows away on a boat belonging to a criminal alongside two other teenagers. The group shipwrecks on Letchi island and discover the Infant Island natives have been enslaved by a terrorist organization controlling a crustacean monster. Finding a sleeping Godzilla, they decide to awaken him to defeat the terrorists and liberate the natives.','/rYGsvMKjIBU5CAQrfHOv9xIfYhn.jpg','1966-12-17',87,'Released','The atrocious new monster Ebirah! Three giant monsters of the land, sea, and sky take part in the confrontation of the century!','Ebirah, Horror of the Deep',3115,2.9114,6.3,'DLZmhf49-hA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4935,_binary '\0','/96etD6qTLBfoGYZsLb9AAcSETjE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060472',7.2,12269,'en','Grand Prix','The most daring drivers in the world have gathered to compete for the 1966 Formula One championship. After a spectacular wreck in the first of a series of races, American wheelman Pete Aron is dropped by his sponsor. Refusing to quit, he joins a Japanese racing team. While juggling his career with a torrid love affair involving an ex-teammate\'s wife, Pete must also contend with Jean-Pierre Sarti, a French contestant who has previously won two world titles.','/yEXrf09o8wVRFSptYFr6VcqLjPr.jpg','1966-12-21',176,'Released','All the glamour and greatness of the world\'s most exciting drama of speed and spectacle!','Grand Prix',20379,4.5491,7.321,'UHkdux17PBs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4936,_binary '\0','/bodTQ7K68AopK2uQumsrSVT9g4A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060474',7.9,22714,'fr','La Grande Vadrouille','During World War II, two French civilians and a downed British Bomber Crew set out from Paris to cross the demarcation line between Nazi-occupied Northern France and the South. From there they will be able to escape to England. First, they must avoid German troops – and the consequences of their own blunders.','/91l4Sf3WJwrb0tSVPsOqnBXG8E6.jpg','1966-12-08',132,'Released',NULL,'Don\'t Look Now... We\'re Being Shot At!',8290,6.958,7.9,'ZmWcxvB1j_E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4937,_binary '\0','/5508isiWLDMbFerBqjUN0dAoBrT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060475',6.5,4159,'fr','Les Grandes Vacances','Monsieur Bosquier, the owner of a private school, is far from pleased when his eldest son, Philippe, fails his end of year exams. He decides to send his wayward offspring to England to improve his English. In exchange, Philippe’s host, a wealthy whisky distiller, Mac Farrel, will send his daughter, Shirley, to live with the Bosquiers in France. However, Philippe has already decided to spend the summer holidays on a yacht with his friends, so he sends a fellow student, Michonnet, to England in his place. The deception is soon discovered but things go from bad to worse when Philippe and Shirley fall in love and fly to Scotland to get married...','/73lKodrSbIqVfoeApFgLUf2SeWR.jpg','1967-12-01',85,'Released',NULL,'The Exchange Student',11696,2.8214,6.842,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4938,_binary '\0','/cwZ54HFhjqMB6Rw3QCUpRi0snYW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060476',5.8,1272,'en','The Great St Trinian\'s Train Robbery','The all-girl school foil an attempt by train robbers to recover £2.5 million hidden in their school.','/gtqktwlZVseDW3XkuGQEYGSKTcj.jpg','1966-03-11',93,'Released',NULL,'The Great St Trinian\'s Train Robbery',14387,1.5663,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4939,_binary '\0','/ucSm33teUWa7Xm09qy6oygojnwu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060479',6.6,2359,'en','The Group','It\'s 1933, and eight young women are friends and members of the upper-class group at a private girl\'s school, about to graduate and start their own lives. The film documents the years between their graduation and the beginning of the World War in Europe, and shows, in a serialized style, their romances and marriages, their searches for careers or meaning in their lives, their highs and their lows.','/sdi14MruD5SJEAxmJisPwE3ZJNI.jpg','1966-03-04',152,'Released',NULL,'The Group',84278,2.1005,5.7,'u6LQYmp0wpw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4940,_binary '\0','/G0tvrklupK9ZupJkofdylDMzuM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060481',7.2,2759,'fr','La guerre est finie','On his way from Madrid to Paris, Diego, a chief of the Spanish Communist Party, is arrested at the border for an ID check but manages to flee. When he arrives in Paris, he searches for one of his comrades to prevent him from going to Madrid where he could be arrested.','/2tyYpZOk1qI7h98usC9cslgf1QA.jpg','1966-05-11',121,'Released',NULL,'The War Is Over',4781,2.6143,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4941,_binary '\0','/ocVv7ivaYXl2TFrQbk25mnzhhsm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060482',7.6,2196,'ro','Dacii','The great King of Dacia, Decebal (Decebalus), is disposed to make the ultimate sacrifice in order to keep the integrity of his people. His own son, Cotyso, is given to the god Zamolxis to the dismay of the King and his daughter Meda. Septimius Severus, a young Roman devoted to his adopted country, must make the choice between his blood origins and the culture he was introduced to.','/tEZGwJImVKOe8JExbjBNLgSaUVe.jpg','1967-05-31',110,'Released',NULL,'The Dacians',36662,2.2002,7.1,'gbSV7-YZOGU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4942,_binary '\0','/tVLqORYuiFdYqMQblBRdUf5mhQR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060486',7.1,1336,'ja','白昼の通り魔','Two young women must come to terms with the fact that a man they\'re deeply linked to is a murdering rapist.','/4c2JVOW4rsumhXhRS8CIbSzAU1M.jpg','1966-07-15',99,'Released',NULL,'Violence at Noon',42720,1.6804,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4943,_binary '\0','/lSjWDLe8KwU731Bhs1TAwA7agGH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060490',6.8,12396,'en','Harper','Harper is a cynical private eye in the best tradition of Bogart. He even has Bogie\'s Baby hiring him to find her missing husband, getting involved along the way with an assortment of unsavory characters and an illegal-alien smuggling ring.','/zy56CkGHBA9WubuJ7fjntTZCvRi.jpg','1966-02-22',121,'Released','Harper takes a case - and the payoff is murder.','Harper',26268,4.3431,6.665,'QMwhtA7fjGA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4944,_binary '\0','/1wf2appoWwC9CQS0cDnMoHbWiDB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060491',6.5,4248,'en','Hawaii','Abner Hale, a rigid and humorless New England missionary, marries the beautiful Jerusha Bromley and takes her to the exotic island kingdom of Hawaii, intent on converting the natives. But the clash between the two cultures is too great and instead of understanding there comes tragedy.','/cRqw7ajYhz7Kn4p0y559K6jR9Zi.jpg','1966-10-10',189,'Released','James Michener\'s novel reaches the screen.','Hawaii',14689,2.3463,6.3,'Vbvh3RsOkRc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4945,_binary '\0','/lX5nHKBnF35dzTzYNavCBrZ6twU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060522',7.5,32627,'en','How to Steal a Million','A woman must steal a statue from a Paris museum to help conceal her father\'s art forgeries.','/xaf3pwmITJvfz9Ab8DiGM8OOtBC.jpg','1966-07-13',123,'Released','A movie about those who appreciate the finest things in life... for free!','How to Steal a Million',3001,5.4567,7.5,'UPStHOzjQWU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4946,_binary '\0','/xrJgyLmQqOcwI1pdRI0U5K8Ypq0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060529',7.3,1463,'sv','Här har du ditt liv','A working class teenager comes of age in 1910s rural Sweden, moving through a series of jobs and romances that gradually shape his future.','/laIqb67aApgE78cPzFQrUSmJI4F.jpg','1966-12-26',169,'Released',NULL,'Here Is Your Life',9646,2.4154,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4947,_binary '\0','/3vbTzfQfv2JcIsfW16THfD4ZevR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060536',2.9,1310,'en','In the Year 2889','The last seven survivors of a nuclear war barricade themselves against the outside world. Beyond a dense mist, other survivors, radiated and mutant, grow hungry.','/ghnf1UyBRCiLCeZRSQhSDqHpKMo.jpg','1969-01-19',80,'Released','Mutant Cannibals on the Loose!','In the Year 2889',74837,1.2744,3.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4948,_binary '\0','/1miU2XTKzZSbd18qOnCSKXH3CJD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060538',7.6,1621,'it','Incompreso (Vita col figlio)','The story of a widower and his two sons, focusing on their complex and sometimes difficult relationships.','/6z6jD1BLxRJe3pQRwC6ezYF1ft4.jpg','1967-01-21',105,'Released',NULL,'Misunderstood',56978,2.2416,7.5,'IW4zWoSkOPE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4949,_binary '\0','/jBKfEPieb9w9xm5HeZn95MHyD3a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060543',7.1,1850,'cs','Intimní osvětlení','Two classically trained musicians and childhood friends - one a successful cellist in Prague, the other a violinist who makes his money playing provincial funerals - reconvene on the eve of a small-town symphony concert.','/a4VpypMjarRltCu7TIN8KGq1qpU.jpg','1965-04-08',73,'Released',NULL,'Intimate Lighting',77381,2.0206,6.659,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4950,_binary '\0','/33PsUvkpQsH93JrkSHzk86luU9z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060545',7.6,3878,'it','Io la conoscevo bene','A young woman from the Italian countryside experiences the dark side of the business after she moves to Rome to become a star.','/eyQibuSHTg2lwSeWj3VRF4EJKoN.jpg','1965-12-01',115,'Released',NULL,'I Knew Her Well',59336,2.9639,7.479,'_xt2jIx5IEM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4951,_binary '\0','/6zHwjdSm0duhVzbYH9sODUQOv7t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060548',6.1,4971,'en','Island of Terror','When a small island community becomes overrun with creeping, blobbish, tentacled monsters that liquefy and digest the bones from living creatures, the community struggles to fight back.','/xbKgZjvMw5FiSfsmPYephSNChST.jpg','1966-06-20',89,'Released','How could they stop the devouring death...that lived by sucking on living human bones!','Island of Terror',28763,1.871,5.9,'XMPLzowjKQc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4952,_binary '\0','/k7F9aj6Vmz8rJ9lcm2mIgUiWDWV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060550',8.1,24635,'en','It\'s the Great Pumpkin, Charlie Brown','Join the Peanuts gang for a timeless adventure as Charlie Brown preps for a party, Snoopy sets his sights on the Red Baron, and Linus patiently awaits a pumpkin patch miracle.','/59wp9OWexYsxlSPHYmVLsl5xlFt.jpg','1966-10-27',25,'Released','Every year he rises from the pumpkin patch...','It\'s the Great Pumpkin, Charlie Brown',13353,6.8463,7.5,'MLhMSdtQPoc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4953,_binary '\0','/macLGPewy8OarjOYPjPOXa34uu5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060558',3.5,2205,'en','Jesse James Meets Frankenstein\'s Daughter','Dr. Frankenstein\'s Granddaughter Maria, and her brother assistant Rudolph, moved to the old west because the lightning storms there are more frequent and intense, which allows them to work on the experiments of their grandfather. But the experiments are failing and Rudolph\'s been secretly killing the corpses afterwards. Meanwhile, the Lopez family leaves the town because of the evil going on there','/v4CQ0oP2ISRReZABJNcVWrvetCY.jpg','1966-04-09',83,'Released','ROARING GUNS against RAGING MONSTER!','Jesse James Meets Frankenstein\'s Daughter',3149,1.781,4.3,'UbjzpAW5rdo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4954,_binary '\0','/crorv6BTbcYBForF1uXkVeHVBUO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060560',7.2,2792,'ja','「エロ事師たち」より 人類学入門','A former Buddhist monk turned erotic filmmaker, Subuyan lives with hairdresser Haru and her two teenage children. Shooting two skin flicks per day, he somehow manages to stay out of the clutches of the yakuza, but real trouble starts when Haru discovers him lusting after her daughter.','/seIiQOJDUmOUQ6bx2AanzuHXncH.jpg','1966-03-12',128,'Released',NULL,'The Pornographers',42718,1.7282,7.3,'fsncHdY0s4k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4955,_binary '\0','/nVaaYlGszQafKEkhzY1UvhPKCdL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060574',7.2,2966,'de','Der junge Törless','At an Austrian boys\' boarding school in the early 1900s, shy, intelligent Törless observes the sadistic behavior of his fellow students, doing nothing to help a victimized classmate—until the torture goes too far. Adapted from Robert Musil\'s acclaimed novel, Young Törless launched the New German Cinema movement and garnered the 1966 Cannes Film Festival International Critics\' Prize for first-time director Volker Schlöndorff.','/rJWcKXABcww5u2kgPEQTYQ85G7d.jpg','1966-05-20',87,'Released',NULL,'Young Törless',45694,2.1397,6.6,'Oz_RsCiz6Ns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4956,_binary '\0','/lYg9Iqn4U1WFaDUUdaN2NH8OqrK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060584',8.2,15332,'ru','Кавказская пленница, или Новые приключения Шурика','Shurik, a kind but naïve ethnography student, falls in love with the intelligent, athletic and beautiful All-Union Leninist Young Communist League member Nina. He has a rival in the wealthy comrade Saakhov, who concocts a kidnapping scheme to force Nina to marry him.','/orp7Ec8fDDHXFYnAjOPWsuF0Dhe.jpg','1967-04-03',82,'Released',NULL,'Kidnapping, Caucasian Style',20878,3.2964,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4957,_binary '\0','/s409AF9n552PrzVW8qoqKWUwQ8c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060586',6.9,1723,'ja','けんかえれじい','Kiroku boards with a Roman Catholic family and falls for the daughter Michiko. He ignores his feelings, joins a gang, gets in fights and, eventually, becomes involved with the radical Kita Ikki group.','/q6EZUUvfdKWlvfqDXrGCS2Rmb1a.jpg','1966-11-09',86,'Released',NULL,'Fighting Elegy',42721,1.6201,7,'BW_YIUOCM3c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4958,_binary '\0','/fb9k7H14y7htb4VBYiaAlko689M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060588',6.8,9327,'en','Khartoum','English General Charles George Gordon is appointed military governor of Anglo-Egyptian Sudan by the Prime Minister. Ordered to evacuate Egyptians from the Sudan, Gordon stays on to protect the people of Khartoum, who are under threat of being conquered by a Muslim army.','/lcqulOKVAPkyEbvvYtPYgVQazWD.jpg','1966-06-09',134,'Released','Where the Nile divides, the great Cinerama adventure begins!','Khartoum',29710,3.7178,6.348,'M6-fSbcFGcs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4959,_binary '\0','/9lphTa0vpeYtByQxyLvQFO7B07N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060597',7.7,1329,'cs','Kočár do Vídně','A WW2 story of a young Austrian soldier running from the Russian army and a woman whom he forces to come along in order to save his wounded mate.','/tkosU5OUEs5RJSmahYnnxj2xTg4.jpg','1966-11-11',76,'Released',NULL,'Carriage to Vienna',118497,1.4652,7.269,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4960,_binary '\0','/crnXlbyWywNnLLZXJ7vRjyTHspl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060635',7.4,4284,'zh','龍門客棧','China, year 1457. The Minister of Defense is executed, and his children are sentenced to exile by order of the tyrannical Tsao. Fearful of future revenge from the young people, Tsao sends cruel soldiers to murder them, but a brave group of swordsmen can change the course of the battle at the Dragon Inn.','/x1EVgOjZ4gfnRTFSZIsr1UoAx0W.jpg','1967-11-23',111,'Released',NULL,'Dragon Inn',104237,2.9885,7.367,'GAq31U-fOS0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4961,_binary '\0','/cXLofh6LTLMUtoOaJadPBQT97Vp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060636',6.2,1981,'en','Lord Love a Duck','From his prison cell, young Alan Musgrave relates his experiences of the previous year dedicated to fulfilling every whim of beautiful and self-absorbed high school senior Barbara Ann Greene.','/srjQmFy1Hi5iNga7uKTjnubYUpr.jpg','1966-02-21',105,'Released','This motion picture is an act of pure aggression','Lord Love a Duck',52867,2.1333,5.7,'nMx2d25qbPg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4962,_binary '\0','/l3KkceuLYYckSl6HiYIWbgZRWcM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060637',6.3,2647,'en','Lost Command','After being freed from a Vietnamese war prison, French Lt. Col. Pierre Raspeguy is sent to help quell resistance forces in Algeria. With the help of the Capt. Esclavier, who has grown weary of war, and Capt. Boisfeuras, who lives for it, Raspeguy attempts to convert a rugged band of soldiers into a formidable fighting unit, with the promise of marrying a beautiful countess if he\'s made a general.','/fDC55I2v1WbtK3V0E7sTW1Hn0a9.jpg','1966-05-01',129,'Released','They lived and loved and fought across three continents !','Lost Command',41057,2.6666,6.2,'uoFoyHHpw_c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4963,_binary '\0','/xBqRl2R0pFvEnLNuEm2r78RM80n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060640',5.9,1714,'en','Lt. Robin Crusoe U.S.N.','Lt. Robin Crusoe is a navy pilot who bails out of his plane after engine trouble. He reaches a deserted island paradise where he builds a house and begins to adjust to life. He is in for trouble however when a local girl is banished to the island by her father, who then comes after Crusoe.','/yXxf8Is4LG48e2SOloFq7U43SbK.jpg','1966-07-01',113,'Released','It\'s Shape Up or Ship Out for \"Admiral Honey\'s\" all girl navy!','Lt. Robin Crusoe U.S.N.',54227,2.4735,5.7,'R_Q1YqbT4jc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4964,_binary '\0','/k8bHVfEm7AFBGCZqOaNlZ8f7RFI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060645',6.9,2822,'en','Madame X','Holly Parker, the wife of a wealthy diplomat, is compromised by the accidental death of a man who has been romantically pursuing her. She is forced by her mother-in-law to assume a new identity in order to save the reputation of her husband and infant son. She wanders the world, trying to forget her heartbreak with the aid of alcohol and unsavory men. Eventually returning to the city of her downfall, she murders a blackmailer who threatens to expose her past. Amazingly, Holly is represented at her murder trial by her now adult son, who has become a public defender. In the hope of protecting her family, she refuses to reveal her real name and is known to the court as \"Madame X\".','/pF9m0GruyTuC4H4cBROEzEaf42C.jpg','1966-02-25',100,'Released','There was always a man... never a name!','Madame X',42723,2.3738,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4965,_binary '\0','/7Mg5eGXNXiPUy9cmfi6ebr2Ulgn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060647',6.2,4952,'fr','Made in U.S.A','Paula Nelson goes to Atlantic City to meet her lover, Richard Politzer, but finds him dead and decides to investigate his death. In her hotel room, she meets Typhus, whom she ends up knocking out. His corpse is later found in the apartment of David Goodis, a writer. Paula is arrested and interrogated. From then on, she encounters many gangsters.','/c4SDhdZlKA03flhd4ssO3Opm8Xa.jpg','1967-01-27',85,'Released',NULL,'Made in U.S.A',29369,1.9644,6.1,'VnisklaDaaU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4966,_binary '\0','/aVcdD7OJ9wmC9H6AMwuwwjFBImi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060648',7.1,1948,'fr','Mademoiselle','A sexually repressed school teacher releases her pent up passions in a series of shocking crimes.','/nfTFh0ltQK7lkIpYXZmcjBUrDia.jpg','1966-06-01',105,'Released','This One is Truly Different!','Mademoiselle',36457,1.6394,7,'3iflLaiE9qI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4967,_binary '\0','/ush4pQYfRV545s2WWzD24GqggGj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060661',6.5,2147,'en','The Man Called Flintstone','In this feature-length film based on the \"Flintstones\" TV show, secret agent Rock Slag is injured during a chase in Bedrock. Slag\'s chief decides to replace the injured Slag with Fred Flintstone, who just happens to look like him. The trip takes Fred to Paris and Rome, which is good for Wilma, Barney, and Betty, but can Fred foil the mysterious Green Goose\'s evil plan for a destructive missile without letting his wife and friends in on his secret?','/3nnVtJjLQmRcHhJNeyP5UYnkfE9.jpg','1966-08-03',89,'Released','Their first full-length tune-full adventure!','The Man Called Flintstone',42515,2.701,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4968,_binary '\0','/o8Pc05f7zwgZCLrcfqszHWEQF0w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060665',7.7,40789,'en','A Man for All Seasons','A depiction of the conflict between King Henry VIII of England and his Lord Chancellor, Sir Thomas More, who refuses to swear the Oath of Supremacy declaring Henry Supreme Head of the Church in England.','/kcwcqMitcnRO1SySlX1HKVn7yUV.jpg','1966-12-13',120,'Released','...a motion picture for all times!','A Man for All Seasons',874,7.4314,7.3,'HM7jj9t2CQ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4969,_binary '\0','/cjbIk6T7NqhX6myBGyQXU3j9ngk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060666',1.7,38587,'en','\"MANOS\" The Hands of Fate','A family gets lost on the road and stumbles upon a hidden, underground, devil-worshiping cult led by the fearsome Master and his servant Torgo.','/aJZsXdJWgtVCSE3SOcOkMPNpbkV.jpg','1966-11-15',74,'Released','It\'s Shocking! It\'s Beyond Your Imagination!','\"MANOS\" The Hands of Fate',22293,2.2282,2.19,'sF03ZFt8t8w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4970,_binary '\0','/z3AhiyRVEAi8sqZHo6Y9jtgRzqP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060668',7.5,2882,'en','The Persecution and Assassination of Jean-Paul Marat as Performed by the Inmates of the Asylum of Charenton Under the Direction of the Marquis de Sade','In Charenton Asylum, the Marquis de Sade directs a play about Jean Paul Marat\'s death, using the patients as actors. Based on \'The Persecution and Assassination of Jean-Paul Marat as Performed by the Inmates of the Asylum of Charenton Under the Direction of the Marquis de Sade\', a 1963 play by Peter Weiss.','/7aucmdXXvqB4uW63K6t7P9sTc1f.jpg','1967-02-22',116,'Released','By Peter Weiss','The Persecution and Assassination of Jean-Paul Marat as Performed by the Inmates of the Asylum of Charenton Under the Direction of the Marquis de Sade',44258,2.6034,6.2,'Sdeg5j8UMxA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4971,_binary '\0','/q1umoxNOnFdW0m3WWWCb9fwwFfH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060672',3.2,1258,'en','Mars Needs Women','Tommy Kirk leads his fellow Martians to Earth on an interplanetary quest for females. Kirk proves that Martians have impeccable taste when one of his first conquests turns out to be sexy scientist Yvonne Craig.','/dnTHZUgEJZiFtHZGUXBiRCWze6d.jpg','1968-08-24',83,'Released','They Were Looking For Chicks... To Go All The Way!','Mars Needs Women',24563,1.5454,3.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4972,_binary '\0','/83AMHdZU71x7U4aZ7QFGBRtdyxo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060675',7.3,19271,'fr','Masculin féminin','Paul, a young idealist trying to figure out what he wants to do with his life, takes a job interviewing people for a marketing research firm. He moves in with aspiring pop singer Madeleine. Paul, however, is disillusioned by the growing commercialism in society, while Madeleine just wants to be successful. The story is told in a series of 15 unrelated vignettes.','/AroNQnZiqjJOWf32lLNZUzWlGvd.jpg','1966-03-22',105,'Released','Jean-Luc Godard\'s Swinging Look at Youth and Love in Paris Today!','Masculin Féminin',4710,5.5323,7.2,'53KROTcwf-Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4973,_binary '\0','/m93TIzEvAEhjByYUM0DvS468Qyy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060701',6.6,1413,'es','Miss Muerte','A woman seeks to avenge her father\'s death using a local dancer, with long poisonous fingernails, to do her bidding.','/t20mOwAfmuxpfMpWGMPCxxLQrph.jpg','1966-08-01',86,'Released','Nothing ever stripped your nerves screamingly raw like the diabolical Dr. Z','The Diabolical Dr. Z',27697,1.236,5.8,'NY6z3v5PRn0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4974,_binary '\0','/oZANPqYAF1R5fbJcDWlAyDYywpN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060708',5,3535,'en','Modesty Blaise','Modesty Blaise, a secret agent whose hair color, hair style, and mod clothing change at a snap of her fingers is being used by the British government as a decoy in an effort to thwart a diamond heist. She is being set up by the feds but is wise to the plot and calls in sidekick Willie Garvin and a few other friends to outsmart them. Meanwhile, at his island hideaway, Gabriel, the diamond thief has his own plans for Blaise and Garvin.','/rpQRLEcQeWe2T8TbSJ0zJ0Avqij.jpg','1966-05-01',120,'Released','Nothing can faze Modesty Blaise, the world\'s deadliest and most dazzlingly female agent!','Modesty Blaise',36645,2.3941,5.3,'z7WcmAaSAX4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4975,_binary '\0','/6sswkS3SQCgavptmAxSpNET87JV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060712',4.8,1432,'en','Mondo Topless','Completely topless. Completely uninhibited. The craze that began in San Francisco is now exploding across the USA and Europe.','/vpudwaFJJA9nE6p80ZQLE3qKHpc.jpg','1966-11-17',60,'Released',NULL,'Mondo Topless',5726,1.5461,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4976,_binary '\0','/1d6wE08ywDeUTqlPRbLjSYRcmEe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060714',6.5,2253,'en','Morgan: A Suitable Case for Treatment','Morgan, an aggressive and self-admitted dreamer, a fantasist who uses his flights of fancy as refuge from external reality, where his unconventional behavior lands him in a divorce from his wife, Leonie, trouble with the police and, ultimately, incarceration in a lunatic asylum.','/xu4awPUFmrFUaX2qk12Lv4QhJSF.jpg','1966-04-03',97,'Released','Can one charming madman save the only thing in the real world that\'s lived up to his best fantasies?','Morgan: A Suitable Case for Treatment',42724,1.9694,6.3,'iyuHkMweWO4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4977,_binary '\0','/a8kLcUyRNWllXyyazDe2slmLV2B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060722',7.6,1682,'es','La muerte de un burócrata','A model Cuban revolutionary tragically dies at work and, as a badge of honor, is buried with his labor card in his suit pocket. When his widow attempts to apply for his pension, the pension office demands the original labor card. Desperate, his nephew embarks on an increasingly chaotic and surreal quest through the Cuban bureaucratic system to secure permission to exhume the body, only to be met with endless forms, contradictory regulations, and apathetic officials.','/89PQSEQOt1yKp0A6b89p50tX5iR.jpg','1966-07-24',84,'Released','It is easier to kill a bureaucrat than to kill bureaucracy.','Death of a Bureaucrat',43778,1.3371,7.4,'IVflVrAOYKM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4978,_binary '\0','/4FAuWlMCtSawaoJCoRku7M4r7Cy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060726',6.4,3397,'en','Munster, Go Home!','Herman discovers he\'s the new lord of Munster Hall in England. The family sails to Britain, where they receive a tepid welcome from Lady Effigy and Freddie Munster, who throws tantrums because he wasn\'t named Lord Munster. An on-board romance had blossomed between Marilyn and Roger, but on land Marilyn discovers Roger\'s family holds a longstanding grudge against the Munsters.','/22Yn9deUj4S0Lyykv214JYdp9YH.jpg','1966-06-15',96,'Released','America\'s Funniest Family in their First Full-Length Feature','Munster, Go Home!',35992,2.1335,6.4,'CWeXPz1Ilkc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4979,_binary '\0','/e9g1AXxE3cWFI5VuOmbbfZNwOe3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060728',5.8,2771,'en','Murderers\' Row','The handsome top agent Matt dies a tragic death in his bath tub - the women mourn about the loss. However it\'s just faked for his latest top-secret mission: He shall find Dr. Solaris, inventor of the Helium laser beam, powerful enough to destroy a whole continent. It seems Dr. Solaris has been kidnapped by a criminal organization. The trace leads to the Cote D\'Azur.','/hzCbOzehs5B2hZ2bcb7YxCusEcM.jpg','1966-12-20',105,'Released','Matt Helm outdoes Matt Helm in his new all-out adventure!','Murderers\' Row',36642,2.5889,5.7,'QQnQ8xX3-k8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4980,_binary '\0','/m1p2f1QoD79N2YNFXDtVMQtExVG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060736',7.3,6384,'en','The Naked Prey','A group of men are on safari. One of the party refuses to give a gift to a tribe they encounter. The tribe is offended, seizes the party, and one-by-one, kills all but one of the safari members in various creative and horrifying ways. The last surviving member is given \"The Lion\'s Chance\" by the tribal leader to be hunted down by a party of tribal warriors.','/lBm8f2eVBKUKVqrdyJTNwdfAUqi.jpg','1965-06-01',96,'Released','Stripped, weaponless, alone and only ten desperate seconds ahead of the killers!','The Naked Prey',18513,3.4502,6.654,'cVZHRkHHSXU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4981,_binary '\0','/55hrsQbqKh6yYTKthEQRBSBbW15.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060742',8.3,6272,'bn','নায়ক','Arindam, a matinee idol, is going by train to collect an acting award. On the train, he is confronted by Aditi, a journalist who somewhat unwillingly starts to take his interview. Arindam, won over by Aditi\'s naivete, starts to disclose his past, his fears and his secrets.','/fXWxCRJwmw3NQYRpQHvwsrzaqfU.jpg','1966-05-06',118,'Released',NULL,'The Hero',112999,2.06,8.05,'NYYS0DhbR_o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4982,_binary '\0','/9L6qaoN8MJXi3ER0WliKLhdXluH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060747',7.3,2228,'ru','Неуловимые мстители','Danka\'s and Ksanka\'s childhood in the village brutally ends when their father is killed by a White Guard officer in front of their eyes. Seeking revenge, they join forces with Valerka, an intellectual from big city, and the gipsy Yashka, but before they can get close to their enemy they have to help their village and the advancing Red Army.','/94rCowBW6NyvyWg3gI3S1nbZq1q.jpg','1967-04-29',78,'Released',NULL,'The Elusive Revengers',41979,1.7147,6.854,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4983,_binary '\0','/cCTvYljawuuO0CdOaVvEgJ41sRK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060748',6.9,10007,'en','Nevada Smith','Nevada Smith is the alias of Max Sand, the son of an Indian mother and American father. When they are killed by three men over gold, Nevada sets out to avenge them. The young man is taken in by a gun merchant who shows him how to shoot, on time and correctly.','/4QJLqSZRnhAb9pezEEIxidVINes.jpg','1966-06-10',128,'Released','Some called him savage- and some called him saint... some felt his hate- and one found his love... and three had to die...','Nevada Smith',5921,3.0536,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4984,_binary '\0','/naBftqr9LOZDZe2WZruohmMCM2g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060753',1.6,6552,'en','Red Zone Cuba','Griffin escapes from jail and teams up with two local thugs to invade Cuba. However, they\'re soon captured by a Castro look-alike and receive sub-human treatment. But Griffin hatches a plan- will it be enough to bring peace to Cuba?','/oqh6rEJbUZOiSd9h1SfKe1Oh6fZ.jpg','1966-11-01',89,'Released','Make the Mistake!','Red Zone Cuba',31123,1.4502,2.7,'aJvrpa2F2Sg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4985,_binary '\0','/8GCJyIRihJR55PdZy0uQTZ94f3M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060754',6.5,1761,'en','The Night of the Grizzly','Marshall \"Big Jim\" Cole turns in his badge and heads to Wyoming with his family in order to settle on some land left him by a relative. He faces opposition both from a neighbor who wants that land for his own sons, and from a grizzly bear nicknamed \"Satan\" who keeps killing Cole\'s livestock.','/kt23CmHdXll4T4lvjPLltmbzwKc.jpg','1966-04-20',108,'Released',NULL,'The Night of the Grizzly',4940,2.3101,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4986,_binary '\0','/3NcTGBFQnGpUUvfloymFiTaejZA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060758',7.4,7629,'fr','La Noire de...','Eager to find a better life abroad, a Senegalese woman becomes a mere governess to a family in southern France, suffering from discrimination and marginalization.','/hYYAk9I9KkscSr8DC30KyDjzsVu.jpg','1966-03-17',65,'Released',NULL,'Black Girl',95597,1.7663,7.3,'tcBzo0YWWjs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4987,_binary '\0','/9rR2D1RyBd2Gq1qWhMNen7UHskR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060782',5.7,10647,'en','One Million Years B.C.','As the Earth wrestles with its agonizing birth, the peoples of this barren and desolate world struggle to survive. Driven by animal instinct they compete against the harsh conditions, their giant predators, and warring tribes. When two people from opposing clans fall in love, existing conventions are shattered forever as each tribe struggles for supremacy and Man embarks on his tortuous voyage of civilization.','/qVcQpoOqGrgNEdahRRzxEZkEouG.jpg','1966-11-24',100,'Released','Travel back through time and space to the edge of man\'s beginnings... discover a savage world whose only law was lust!','One Million Years B.C.',3591,4.8789,6.196,'gSYmJur0Npw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4988,_binary '\0','/dfPMlFEOSG6URAJrKyTF8Zkicgj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060794',6.8,8758,'it','Operazione paura','A 20th century European village is haunted by the ghost of a murderous little girl.','/fyGzcMVf8iospgEtBoZkvO9j9Vr.jpg','1966-07-08',83,'Released','Makes you shiver & shake!','Kill, Baby... Kill!',28049,2.0248,6.9,'a1RULhoVSMc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4989,_binary '\0','/3mMw1M8DIdJNirXv4P1RnuXw3a1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060801',5.3,1621,'en','The Oscar','An amoral lowlife accidentally stumbles into an acting career that sets him on a trajectory to Hollywood stardom. But everyone on whom he steps on the way to the top remembers when he is nominated for an Oscar and he runs a dirty campaign in an attempt to win.','/rPdhkMFPJwj3hOmeNBDTEq277io.jpg','1966-03-04',119,'Released','The breath-taking race for Hollywood\'s highest award!','The Oscar',56168,2.4725,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4990,_binary '\0','/pe2APM7NsJXfNRfq2cUWdc0dRbQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060802',7.6,15202,'cs','Ostře sledované vlaky','At a village railway station in occupied Czechoslovakia, a bumbling dispatcher’s apprentice longs to liberate himself from his virginity. Oblivious to the war and the resistance that surrounds him, this young man embarks on a journey of sexual awakening and self-discovery, encountering a universe of frustration, eroticism, and adventure within his sleepy backwater depot.','/oKiOhsSRWO6fRqxtvda8WuCiXBm.jpg','1966-11-18',93,'Released','All it takes to make a man of a boy is a woman.','Closely Watched Trains',789,2.5872,7.2,'Igc0Jp62kEg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4991,_binary '\0','/y8b8mobmUMem8woXGuQQT9uGFxn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060814',6.8,5601,'fr','Paris brûle-t-il?','Near the end of World War II, General Dietrich von Choltitz receives orders to burn down Paris if it becomes clear the Allies are going to invade, or if he\'s unable to maintain control of the city. After much contemplation, Choltitz ignores orders, enraging the Germans and giving hope to various resistance factions that the city will be liberated. Choltitz, alongside Swedish diplomat Raoul Nordling, helps a leader organise his forces.','/hdlXGmBbfZuF46yVbsZnT2TRAnn.jpg','1966-10-26',173,'Released','\"Burn Paris!\" was the order that had come shrieking over the phone.','Is Paris Burning?',4708,5.0719,7.177,'VMxeKRT0-zU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4992,_binary '\0','/cN6iR0hNUmyMoTkY8Ihg40hYe1F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060818',6.2,2529,'en','Penelope','When Penelope gets married to banker James Elcott, she finds him too preoccupied with work to pay much attention to her, so she robs his bank in disguise. After she confesses to her psychiatrist, Greg Mannix, he offers to return the money for her, as he is secretly in love with her. However, he abandons the money when the police approach. Penelope becomes determined to admit to the crime, but neither James nor the police believe her story.','/k95uACMjBx3iPANxfBi4pF0PhOs.jpg','1966-11-10',98,'Released','The world’s most beautiful bank-robber','Penelope',174865,2.2259,5.5,'xx5OMBDIsMw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4993,_binary '\0','/amr72SENYz7AM4Hq5WBXxFBJEY6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060827',8,142170,'sv','Persona','A young nurse, Alma, is put in charge of Elisabeth Vogler: an actress who is seemingly healthy in all respects, but will not talk. As they spend time together, Alma speaks to Elisabeth constantly, never receiving any answer.','/cl0HEZT8UfzLqaMrYTvGNHOfPYj.jpg','1966-10-18',85,'Released','Ingmar Bergman\'s most personal and original film.','Persona',797,7.5268,8.1,'8ZO01M8k1mg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4994,_binary '\0','/nSQrwzDH3FX0nbpFSaphjKx3ipL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060841',6.6,6331,'en','The Plague of the Zombies','Sir James Forbes arrives in a remote Cornish village to identify a mysterious plague afflicting the population. He discovers that one of the squires is a disciple of Haitian witchcraft and using dark magic to resurrect the dead. As the plan to create undead servants unravels, the squire unleashes his zombie army on the unsuspecting village.','/yFme66bZIpOzBlTNZvCxlQzuML.jpg','1966-01-02',91,'Released','Only The Lord Of The Dead Could Unleash Them!','The Plague of the Zombies',29049,2.4734,6.4,'KwVqUyLWvEw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4995,_binary '\0','/z7Wq5zsMLZGZ90QIy2yTbmouOSi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060860',7.1,1879,'fr','La Prise de pouvoir par Louis XIV','Cardinal Mazarin dies, leaving a power vacuum in which the young Louis asserts his intention to govern as well as rule. Mazarin\'s fiscal advisor, Colbert, warns against Fouquet, the Superintendant who has been systematically looting the treasury and wants to be prime minister. Fouquet believes Louis will soon tire of exercizing power and overplays his hand by offering a bribe to Louis\' mistress to be his ally. She reports this to the king who arrests Fouquet. Louis and Colbert design a brilliant strategy to keep merchants making money, nobles in debt, the urban poor working and fed, and peasants untaxed.','/1cwIWZFiJc10CSb8aElC9FtpTx7.jpg','1966-10-08',95,'Released',NULL,'The Taking of Power by Louis XIV',69912,1.7251,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4996,_binary '\0','/jJKjniDrS1FaWiSgOBxjjTe6ME.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060862',7.3,21193,'en','The Professionals','An arrogant Texas millionaire hires four adventurers to rescue his kidnapped wife from a notorious Mexican bandit.','/sH4Clw7QrtH23xl9o4sOpHNkRIz.jpg','1966-11-01',117,'Released','Rough, tough and ready.','The Professionals',22383,7.0022,7.1,'JzuQhlRL5s4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4997,_binary '\0','/vWTY5bQqd018A26BnVBPuoWQIB7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060865',5.5,1693,'en','Circus of Fear','A circus becomes the location for stolen loot and murder.','/is2RTtVLOOY9TNaq16ljS8QUarV.jpg','1966-04-29',91,'Released','The most horrifying syndicate of evil in history!','Circus of Fear',42717,1.8084,5.5,'iKCwOeYRu5g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4998,_binary '\0','/2hNh7GJ5rzkl5eEmbBFneqrWQ0L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060866',6,1389,'en','The Psychopath','Four men involved in the investigation of a German millionaire at the end of World War II are found murdered with tiny dolls beside their corpses.','/yJlmSYc7iycyQBHQpyoNsRTo9B0.jpg','1966-02-04',83,'Released','Mother, may I go out to kill?','The Psychopath',74397,1.1112,6.4,'W0Q_RZvIBCI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(4999,_binary '\0','/hjKXHB5bF6uR0ME0GShBtrjj7Mn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060877',5.3,2780,'en','Queen of Blood','A spaceship is sent to Mars after an alien distress signal is picked up. They find one survivor, but when a crew member is found drained of blood it\'s evident they have rescued a bloodsucking monster. (Uses footage from Encounter in Space (1963).)','/4DxssFMAshoIm39NWXeImdwrowP.jpg','1966-03-01',81,'Released','NEW HIGHS IN BLOOD CHILLING HORROR!','Queen of Blood',27642,2.0936,5.3,'EGkLMDaEnNk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(5000,_binary '\0','/g84SQaNwn4aD6jAIe0knlmTfnJD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000','tt0060879',6.8,1387,'fr','Qui êtes-vous, Polly Maggoo ?','A model tells a television crew about her dreams of a life with prince charming all while fending off the lecherous advances of a horde of men.','/3974gYgxfnWhVqoCmVx1TpQ1cze.jpg','1966-10-21',103,'Released','She’s a total star!','Who Are You, Polly Maggoo?',66953,1.9756,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:03.000000'),(5001,_binary '\0','/vF1ykw0QKK9X9o7Ki199GJGwlcR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0060880',6.3,4828,'en','The Quiller Memorandum','After two British Secret Intelligence Service agents are murdered at the hands of a cryptic neo-Nazi group known as Phoenix, the suave agent Quiller is sent to Berlin to investigate.','/hWC6UXgbQZ7HNWbsD95F8gIoll5.jpg','1966-11-10',104,'Released','He played the most dangerous game in Europe, and he played it alone.','The Quiller Memorandum',46041,2.455,5.906,'yakSWyVSNUs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5002,_binary '\0','/zI4cYYemGhEsVGYjPCjzp4ApIKF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0060884',6.4,4434,'en','The Rare Breed','When her husband dies en route to America, Martha Price and her daughter Hilary are left to carry out his dream: the introduction of Hereford cattle into the American West. They enlist Sam \"Bulldog\" Burnett in their efforts to transport their lone bull, a Hereford named Vindicator, to a breeder in Texas, but the trail is fraught with danger and even Burnett doubts the survival potential of this \"rare breed\" of cattle.','/9LJ3iQgvfScjM0PMk3fnpCl6HRi.jpg','1966-02-02',97,'Released','Young lovers ... restless, bold, ready to meet the brawling dangers of the raw West ... Head On !','The Rare Breed',38800,3.04,6.2,'FFYjxsl7HRM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5003,_binary '\0','/auWpC62GLdB5je6TOOw1a4jGm2F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0060891',7.5,3597,'fr','La Religieuse','In eighteenth-century France, a girl is forced against her will to take vows as a nun. Three mothers superior treat her in radically different ways, ranging from maternal concern, to sadistic persecution, to lesbian desire.','/75EehgZs63K70RODuFLXXgopPl.jpg','1967-07-26',140,'Released','The banned film by Jacques Rivette','The Nun',42722,1.897,7.1,'kD5Au1sJmjc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5004,_binary '\0','/4Ah1aUVniy6fw3s3z4ijmHnhrKn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0060893',6.1,4479,'en','The Reptile','Harry and Valerie Spalding arrive in the remote Cornish village to an unwelcoming and suspicious population. Harry\'s brother dies suddenly, bitten by a lethal reptilian bite. They befriend a young woman Anna whose tyrannical father controls her life and, as they discover that others in the village have suffered a similar fate, their investigations lead to Anna. What they uncover is a victim of the most terrifying legacy... a destiny of mutilation and murder.','/pyDCGewLquVYjXSL0SifoCtlyeZ.jpg','1966-03-06',90,'Released','Half woman - half snake!','The Reptile',29052,1.6993,6.1,'Pqyfhd7s7jQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5005,_binary '\0','/64ABp1dJnwqZJl9DIEMe6UObhOu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0060897',5.5,5618,'en','Return of the Seven','Chico, one of the remaining members of The Magnificent Seven, now lives in the town that they (The Seven) helped. One day someone comes and takes most of the men prisoner. His wife seeks out Chris, the leader of The Seven for help. Chris also meets Vin another member of The Seven. They find four other men and they go to help Chico.','/xO3cPFFzXa7zZ704dOwgws5duFK.jpg','1966-10-19',95,'Released','Between the law and the lawless - SEVEN again... MAGNIFICENT again!','Return of the Seven',12639,4.3624,6.115,'pCz94aD2JfI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5006,_binary '\0','/1tCIvxxHBkYOLFRlZDKrM5TLVpB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0060903',6.7,2349,'it','Il ritorno di Ringo','Once again billed as Montgomery Wood, Giuliano Gemma plays a civil war soldier who returns to his family land to find his family decimated, his property taken over by a family of Mexican bandits and his fiancee about to marry the Mexican gangster behind all this. Bent on revenge, he goes undercover disguised as a Mexican and discovers he has a daughter!','/9jsEyb8KTNRfUq35TrTIzmdbnfH.jpg','1965-12-08',95,'Released',NULL,'The Return of Ringo',63260,2.5349,6.3,'YHpLzMGolt4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5007,_binary '\0','/wjocv4un0nuaDhwfQg0OCDtwWK1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0060908',7.3,4710,'fr','Le Roi de cœur','An ornithologist mistaken for an explosives expert is sent alone into a small French town during WWI to investigate a garbled report from the resistance about a bomb which the departing Germans have set to blow up a weapons cache.','/7RekNiu247cWDPfSqMyX77Yoez4.jpg','1966-12-21',102,'Released','De Broca\'s Crowning Touch!','King of Hearts',17685,2.309,7,'FsOInjrRcOo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5008,_binary '\0','/5If0AOiaB68crKlnd6XfUMAuYzM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0060921',7,11348,'en','The Russians Are Coming! The Russians Are Coming!','When a Soviet submarine gets stuck on a sandbar off the coast of a New England island, its commander orders his second-in-command, Lieutenant Rozanov, to get them moving again before there is an international incident. Rozanov seeks assistance from the island locals, including the police chief and a vacationing television writer, while trying to allay their fears of a Communist invasion by claiming he and his crew are Norwegian sailors.','/rRGeIp9MOAfFHH3Exr5Ago7hEuq.jpg','1966-05-25',126,'Released','IT\'S A PLOT! ...to make the world die laughing!!','The Russians Are Coming! The Russians Are Coming!',31918,3.4749,6.454,'0ACDoxjj9WQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5009,_binary '\0','/9r9AaYJrV2oIhwPKRUsZdF10Bwy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0060934',7.5,18014,'en','The Sand Pebbles','Engineer Jake Holman arrives aboard the gunboat USS San Pablo, assigned to patrol a tributary of the Yangtze in the middle of exploited and revolution-torn 1926 China. His iconoclasm and cynical nature soon clash with the \'rice-bowl\' system which runs the ship and the uneasy symbiosis between Chinese and foreigner on the river. Hostility towards the gunboat\'s presence reaches a climax when the boat must crash through a river-boom and rescue missionaries upriver at China Light Mission.','/muZyCXWoayEtwVkxc0ql48X1h6L.jpg','1966-12-20',196,'Released','This is the heroic story of the men on the U.S.S. San Pablo who disturbed the sleeping dragon of savage China as the threatened world watched in breathless terror.','The Sand Pebbles',5923,4.0245,7.2,'fg_HzXTD0uM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5010,_binary '\0','/xqifM3qMTLZ91knsftAYxq55xwc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0060955',7.6,24079,'en','Seconds','An unhappy middle-aged banker agrees to a procedure that will fake his death and give him a completely new look and identity; one that comes with its own price.','/5G3q3OvulFTnFdiouaZdD8wjtIc.jpg','1966-10-05',107,'Released','Who are SECONDS? The answer is almost too terrifying for words!','Seconds',20620,4.2822,7.4,'65OnfXgxvXU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5011,_binary '\0','/5ZRqeB9uurxQswNQXf2ZkDmyEUH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0060956',2.7,1223,'it','New York chiama Superdrago','A series of murders in Michigan lead an American secret agent to Amsterdam, where he uncovers a plot to imperil the world with a potent new drug.','/a9hyX0Pj7ZOGrXEf1Epnp0KWk5M.jpg','1966-02-17',100,'Released','Beautiful Women! Silver-Masked Men! Deadly Windmills! Karate Killings! Lethal Oriental Vases!','Secret Agent Super Dragon',3692,1.8193,3.6,'AA40Syu-Mx4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5012,_binary '\0','/A1Ajyl9qdUvK94ABteqEelk6M1Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0060959',7.2,18002,'cs','Sedmikrásky','Two teenage girls embark on a series of destructive pranks in which they consume and destroy the world around them.','/8sxMhdn3i1Pn8OlGCBBjr9rjP1y.jpg','1966-12-30',76,'Released','Ups-a daisy… downs-a-daisy… turned-ons-a-daisy.','Daisies',46919,5.1785,7.3,'5F46fcTm5n4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5013,_binary '\0','/j3c6qh98WZ2bQ9tibE573ifeB6u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0060980',5.9,4210,'en','The Silencers','Matt Helm is called out of retirement to stop the evil Big O organization who plan to explode an atomic bomb over Alamagordo, NM, and start WW III.','/eLxVPMCV3IWiOKwxRKoSZqpT8lY.jpg','1966-02-18',102,'Released','The Best Spy Thriller of Nineteen Sexty-Sex!','The Silencers',21779,3.4474,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5014,_binary '\0','/qLsoHP5ri2xnOxZMp8PBf82rgkY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0060983',6.1,1722,'en','The Singing Nun','Belgian nun Sister Ann is sent to another order where she\'s at first committed to helping troubled souls, like Nichole and little Dominic. When Father Clementi hears Sister Ann\'s uplifting singing style, he takes her to a talent contest. Sister Ann is signed to a record deal and everyone is listening to her lighthearted songs. She is unprepared for her newfound fame (like appearing on The Ed Sullivan Show) and unwanted side effects, including a wrongful attraction to an old friend.','/vITreT3v0ofJXchbvtlwB6AjR1Z.jpg','1966-03-17',97,'Released','GOT A HEART? Here\'s the picture for it!','The Singing Nun',49863,1.885,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5015,_binary '\0','/fNhZjgajXrvJQKA94QEMYii6nQJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061005',4.7,1752,'en','The She Beast','A young woman is driving alongside a lake. She has an accident and the car plunges into the water. Her body is then possessed by the spirit of an 18th-century witch who was killed by local villagers, and is bent on avenging herself on them.','/qSPryYmCWvVxaiMt6FioVAHdyGS.jpg','1966-06-01',79,'Released','Deadlier than Dracula! Wilder than the Werewolf! More frightening than Frankenstein!','The She Beast',101898,1.7431,5,'PLOowaHzGWw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5016,_binary '\0','/2Xlo1H0UEHZqiJfZKBvdyGzUcpq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061014',4.1,1694,'it','Le spie vengono dal semifreddo','Mad scientist Dr. Goldfoot plots another twisted scheme to take over the world by killing off the major military leaders of every country; to that end, he creates in his secret lab a bevy of bodacious girl bombs; full-length, life-size robots that explode when embraced.','/cXmuzUai3wOiRK9asq6Tl96RJZZ.jpg','1966-07-29',83,'Released','MEET THE MOST TITILATING TIME BOMBS EVER!','Dr. Goldfoot and the Girl Bombs',77076,2.9135,5,'1rFZXsVo7tQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5017,_binary '\0','/eSI34pJt44UmfMjk79NxARh0q9W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061015',5.8,2597,'en','Spinout','Band singer/race driver Mike McCoy must choose between marrying a beautiful girl and driving her father\'s car in a prestigious race.','/pgqKE56C74L0RdKcb0aq3EEGkpw.jpg','1966-10-06',93,'Released','It\'s ELVIS with his foot on the gas and no brakes on the fun!!!','Spinout',18690,1.7913,5.6,'5A5dAco5sEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5018,_binary '\0','/f8H7cPsumy03oDaztaClookBf0z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061024',6.1,2575,'en','Stagecoach','A group of unlikely travelling companions find themselves on the same stagecoach to Cheyenne. They include a drunken doctor, a bar girl who\'s been thrown out of town, a professional gambler, a travelling liquor salesman, a banker who has decided to embezzle money, a gun-slinger out for revenge and a young woman going to join her army captain husband. All have secrets but when they are set upon by an Indian war party and then a family of outlaws, they find they must all work together if they are to stay alive.','/wsifrzutFIzt51FLVDbWW5AOTUG.jpg','1966-04-21',115,'Released','These Were The Ten Who Fought Indians, Outlaws And Each Other As They Rode To Greatness On The Stagecoach To Cheyenne!','Stagecoach',39287,3.3613,6.108,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5019,_binary '\0','/mp9mPkuVZL382O8Xq9Bu295QSgW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061029',7.8,1651,'cs','Happy End','A dark comedy about a murder and its consequences presented in a backwards manner, where death is actually a rebirth. The film starts with an \"execution\" of the main protagonist and goes back to explore his previous actions and motivations.','/ikM5PK5fahvlAfZhQdUINqBqboJ.jpg','1967-09-01',71,'Released',NULL,'Happy End',51578,1.2907,7.509,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5020,_binary '\0','/6C3A8UH5oEoqFDq8L3qKv332t2n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061037',5.9,2319,'it','Le streghe','Five short stories loosely dealing with the roles of women in society. A superstar actress travels to a mountain resort, only to evoke jealousy from women and lust from men. A woman offers to take an injured man to the hospital. A widowed father and his son seek for a new wife/mother. A man seeks revenge for a woman\'s honor. A bored housewife tries to explain to her husband that he\'s not as romantic as he used to be.','/7ptxCzOW7aqvXKTWV0fxwnZMH8M.jpg','1967-02-22',111,'Released','Woman as she is...all things to men!','The Witches',36236,2.607,6,'s3qO2-oxYG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5021,_binary '\0','/xayaa3lWZBP57Yowtas9yfMHh0Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061042',7.7,3612,'da','Sult','In 1890, Pontus, the starving writer, wanders the streets of Christiania, in search of love and a chance to get his work published. All he meets is defeat and suffering while his sense of reality is withering. One moment he is delighted and the next he curses everybody. All the time he manages to maintain human dignity and pride.','/yyMiQ6YoxvySq3bjZLh0TaNd5C1.jpg','1966-08-19',112,'Released',NULL,'Hunger',76235,1.7224,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5022,_binary '\0','/g1C4dj1tTqtwKPjSBfWr01v9e7N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061065',7.8,12331,'ja','他人の顔','A businessman with a disfigured face obtains a lifelike mask from his new doctor, but the mask starts altering his personality and causing him to question his identity.','/eUnFdf1Mf1b8AD3ChMPOCUfTBDQ.jpg','1966-07-15',122,'Released','It’s always lonely being free.','The Face of Another',29452,3.3278,7.8,'HiS4sOMiRh0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5023,_binary '\0','/xT58IXwDTRVbrSgfmUmQ8MClR9Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061073',7.6,1413,'hi','तीसरी मंज़िल','Blaming him for the suspicious death of her sister, a young woman sets out to exact revenge on a nightclub drummer. She becomes romantically involved with a charismatic young man she meets on the way, unaware that he is the suspect.','/nibr8V7SWtBUJASFlRJmCE6BbLY.jpg','1966-10-21',175,'Released',NULL,'Teesri Manzil',108286,1.0758,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5024,_binary '\0','/uy16uXBFHJnpjcaBOuf9qCRPvG1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061074',6.5,2768,'it','Le colt cantarono la morte e fu... tempo di massacro','In 1866, prospector Tom Corbett returns to his hometown of Laramie, Texas, now under the brutal control of gangster Jason Scott and his violent son, Junior. With his brother Jeff, a struggling drunk cared for by their maid Mercedes, Tom seeks to overthrow the Scotts\' tyrannical rule and restore peace to the town.','/vR071DK3PNAkApOTkPW4PPGBdCQ.jpg','1966-08-10',92,'Released','THE MASSACRE MEN - They carry their hate in their holsters and a name on every bullet in their belts...','Massacre Time',40141,2.2046,6.39,'ZX0IQUlFYiI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5025,_binary '\0','/zW3V0HiwV25mf9rI9AtzIuFP7LI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061075',6.6,6075,'en','Ten Little Indians','Ten strangers are invited as weekend guests to a remote mountain mansion. When the host doesn\'t show up, the guests start dying, one by one.','/iFBY02sqbyNHEtfRpHAKi5m9KDZ.jpg','1965-07-31',92,'Released','Ten people trapped in a house of death... And the murderer determined to kill them all— One By One By One!','Ten Little Indians',4879,2.5092,6.3,'KobbZ8VDI00','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5026,_binary '\0','/lorcfPSg33hX5D6ZOYQej50l7kv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061080',6.2,2169,'en','Texas Across the River','The Louisiana wedding of debutante Phoebe Ann Naylor to Don Andrea de Baldasar, El Duce de la Casala is stopped by the Cavalry over a matter of honor. Don Andrea flees across the river to Texas, where he meets up with Sam Hollis and his Indian sidekick, Kronk, who are carrying rifles to the town of Moccasin Flats. Don Andrea rescues an Indian maiden, Lonetta, tames some longhorns, competes with Sam for Phoebe\'s affections, eludes a Comanche war party and the cavalry and ultimately saves the town and gets his girl.','/bpZMy0X9b9Kpm9sH32PXuUXiC0k.jpg','1966-10-26',101,'Released','A Swinging Fun-Romp that Fractures the Frontier!','Texas Across the River',52480,3.2745,5.6,'aR05p_vo0aI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5027,_binary '\0','/yCAsjEQ8y12x761yx6RQqrvXt1K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061087',6.4,1294,'en','They\'re a Weird Mob','An Italian sports journalist arrives in Australia but finds no work. The only employment he can find is as a builder\'s labourer. At first, he cannot comprehend the culture, but eventually he finds mateship and romance.','/DkpOKOHc4gSA1wjS7NDfKZW8TU.jpg','1966-08-18',108,'Released',NULL,'They\'re a Weird Mob',31486,1.4007,6,'f53pKI-V-fI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5028,_binary '\0','/rBskSmRJXQ13YbIk1XVwsKv5p72.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061089',7,7244,'en','This Property Is Condemned','Owen Legate, a railroad official, comes to Dodson, Mississippi to shut down the local railway - the town\'s main income. But Owen unexpectedly finds love with Dodson\'s flirt and main attraction, Alva Starr.','/lLiyBhKER2N1vi3xedBwf2YvwAY.jpg','1966-08-03',110,'Released','Call her what you want. Do with her what you will. But remember...','This Property Is Condemned',65012,3.2698,6.4,'kyGmrAlDpxE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5029,_binary '\0','/m7toV0xzR4MvgVYZ88InTf5clN8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061093',5.8,1327,'en','Three on a Couch','An artist has an opportunity to go to Paris and wants to bring his fiancee along. However, she\'s a psychiatrist who currently has three female patients who don\'t like men. So, he guises himself as three different men to gauge their trust and hopefully cure them so that his fiancee can go with him.','/ccmeNZoCVtaI45ztDeGYsvbioWh.jpg','1966-03-01',109,'Released','When Jerry takes over as \'The King\' of the great lovers — Pandemonium reigns!','Three on a Couch',38773,2.2868,5.4,'hZ-TFnwxAOM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5030,_binary '\0','/2ULcmRBUxzunUlQ1gFDrjnoCEPy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061094',6.4,2858,'en','Thunderbirds Are GO','When the launch of a mission to Mars goes awry due to sabotage, International Rescue is requested to assist in the mission\'s second attempt.','/rYzxKzIX2gznr3E20w5HgkJBr6n.jpg','1966-12-15',93,'Released','Excitement is GO! Adventure is GO! Danger is GO!','Thunderbirds Are GO',35780,2.0546,6.4,'CIrVGFTX-6E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5031,_binary '\0','/bhAuNmyb3noOMeQ9kCy6X6HnMgZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061101',7.1,10710,'ja','東京流れ者','After yakuza boss Kurata dissolves his own criminal empire, a rival kingpin offers a position to Kurata\'s top operative, Tetsuya \"Phoenix Tetsu\" Hondo. When the fiercely loyal Tetsu declines, Otsuka taps unstoppable Tatsuzo the \"Viper\", a ruthless gun-for-hire, to assassinate him. As the Viper trails his target through the countryside, the agile Phoenix Tetsu grows concerned that one of his former associates has betrayed him.','/dkscSldTB6FGUMMLnInUfKYLfPR.jpg','1966-04-10',83,'Released',NULL,'Tokyo Drifter',45706,2.1103,7.1,'LgXmTOC8Gow','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5032,_binary '\0','/84jdp4kDVL9jm5VmWyELd7K13jw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061107',6.6,31961,'en','Torn Curtain','During the Cold War, an American scientist appears to defect to East Germany as part of a cloak and dagger mission to find the formula for a resin solution—but the plan goes awry when his fiancee, unaware of his motivation, follows him across the border.','/7XC1l9eP2TBYMEdA4KRUqKAFmbm.jpg','1966-07-14',127,'Released','It tears you apart with suspense!','Torn Curtain',5780,5.2064,6.6,'KY0onrdb4ZE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5033,_binary '\0','/2UpJOEIxD5qNrplEjNMpiLbdHNB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061113',7,2362,'fr','Trans-Europ-Express','A movie producer, director and assistant take the Trans-Europ-Express from Paris to Antwerp. They get the idea for a movie about a drug smuggler on their train and visualize it while taping the script.','/1obuqweg5lipvB3GiS7FV15ciTZ.jpg','1966-12-31',95,'Released','Erotic? Serious? Funny? Tragic? A Mystery? A Game? A Paradox? Neo-Sadism? A Detective Story?','Trans-Europ-Express',90908,1.8103,6.611,'BHR3zpTbkZA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5034,_binary '\0','/ish5utoJCe3JWKsKMCIyj6dEQ3n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061115',7.1,2448,'en','The Trap','A French-Canadian fur trapper takes a mute girl as his unwilling wife to live with him in his remote cabin in the woods.','/qdiAXBVYvSqmN0KEFVvSqzo46nE.jpg','1966-04-07',106,'Released',NULL,'The Trap',51445,2.4612,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5035,_binary '\0','/sClW2k65ENUYOhoO2JsFRPj90Qw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061122',7.3,6538,'en','The Trouble with Angels','Mary and her friend, Rachel, are new students at St. Francis Academy, a boarding school run by the iron fist of Mother Superior. The immature teens grow bored and begin playing pranks on both the unsuspecting nuns and their unpleasant classmates, becoming a constant thorn in Mother Superior\'s side. However, as the years pass, Mary and Rachel slowly mature and begin to see the nuns in a different light.','/bv0yTpB2so7mtjG7VIbZyfuJaO1.jpg','1966-03-29',112,'Released','It\'s heaven in Earthly entertainment!','The Trouble with Angels',38606,2.8473,6.7,'vPs5TtdNZro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5036,_binary '\0','/sS0P6Kzfb95vopsqXdlNUgvkZQV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061132',7.2,6390,'it','Uccellacci e uccellini','A man and his son take an allegorical stroll through life with a talking bird that spouts social and political philosophy.','/4IUw0b8k6vHpuCaAqOSELJwaB7p.jpg','1966-05-04',90,'Released','An off-beat comedy about serious matters by PIER PAOLO PASOLINI.','The Hawks and the Sparrows',33954,1.7442,7.2,'_fNLxbmnfKM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5037,_binary '\0','/mxUBaup8dAcgqGtfKFa7VkBccAX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061135',6.5,5127,'en','The Ugly Dachshund','The Garrisons are the \"proud parents\" of three adorable dachshund pups - and one overgrown Great Dane named Brutus, who nevertheless thinks of himself as a dainty dachsie. His identity crisis results in an uproarious series of household crises that reduce the Garrisons\' house to shambles - and viewers to howls of laughter!','/wetpLqvY2iZcYcBm2A8q4eQuotD.jpg','1966-02-16',93,'Released','A HAPPY HONEYMOON GOES TO THE DOGS!...When a Great Dane disguised as a Dachsie crashes the party!','The Ugly Dachshund',20277,2.6564,6.717,'FLQMQYx4y4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5038,_binary '\0','/chVgCErGuL1oUNFg6Gs7iQZGGZF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061138',7.5,13864,'fr','Un homme et une femme','A man and a woman meet by accident on a Sunday evening at their childrens\' boarding school. Slowly, they reveal themselves to each other, finding that they have something deeply in common.','/boDZQiubhyhksN8fcgM4sXZ2btW.jpg','1966-05-27',102,'Released','See it with someone you love!','A Man and a Woman',42726,4.1885,7.349,'_F7guhRPmOQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5039,_binary '\0','/zUYzUl4Gnro8R05iWIbQmrpXOPZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061140',4.5,1381,'en','The Undertaker and His Pals','An undertaker befriends a pair of motorcycle-riding, knife-wielding, psycho restaurant owners who kill people for body parts to use in their blue-plate daily specials.','/1jTMa1COl2XcSzTGPZvMYIvl0T4.jpg','1966-07-01',63,'Released','A macabre story of two motorcycle-riding, knife-wielding, shiv-shaving, eye-gouging, arm-twisting, chain-lashing, scalpel-flashing, acid-throwing, gun-shooting, bone-breaking, pathological nuts and their pal the UNDERTAKER...','The Undertaker and His Pals',56702,1.0452,4.7,'VpbhhH_5eK0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5040,_binary '\0','/7mZiY9HtlpJLJJVbczRJyQSmhQm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061162',7.9,2258,'ru','Война и Мир 2: Наташа Ростова','As 1809 nears its end, Natasha attends her first ball, where Andrei falls in love with her with the intent of marriage. However, as her father demands they wait, the prince travels abroad, leaving Natasha in desperate longing. But she meets Anatol Kuragin and forgets Andrei. Part two of the four-part adaptation of Leo Tolstoy\'s 1869 novel.','/5YM92mP27fIyIG4KlngEvZRZPXk.jpg','1966-07-20',98,'Released',NULL,'War and Peace, Part II: Natasha Rostova',149465,2.1423,7.2,'3DqanxfecIA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5041,_binary '\0','/6N4WjErrVGBfynV3kbeMlabdRHv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061170',6.6,5172,'en','Walk Don\'t Run','During the housing shortage of the 1964 Summer Olympic Games, two men and a woman share a small apartment in Tokyo, and the older man soon starts playing Cupid to the younger pair.','/cdgTjp6blLr4AR48a6fT2q3dN2e.jpg','1966-06-29',114,'Released','Run, don\'t walk to see Walk, Don\'t Run.','Walk Don\'t Run',38720,2.7201,6.5,'0hkIWY0DobM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5042,_binary '\0','/knxP8YgSTZQaftWPyB1FMti5sFf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061173',5.3,1233,'en','Way... Way Out','A platonically wed American couple run a lunar weather station near an unwed Soviet couple.','/wcFXDl8AZ6q3Ctf5YalYQko517J.jpg','1966-10-26',101,'Released','By Gemini, here\'s the wildest crew on Earth, Saturn, Mars, Moon etc.','Way... Way Out',102195,1.84,5.9,'lC9M-os5rTI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5043,_binary '\0','/c68Nl00QKNFyAoVX0VgGToGXhDX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061176',6.6,2507,'en','What Did You Do in the War, Daddy?','A by-the-book Captain is ordered to capture a strategic village in Italy. The Italian soldiers are willing to surrender, if they can have a festival first. The lieutenant convinces the Captain this is the only way. Because of aerial reconnaissance, they must look like they are fighting. To sort this out an intelligence officer is sent in. Meanwhile the festival gets complicated with the Mayors daughter.','/2bRQyZgdC7RFVKUeHsjtmQc7o2.jpg','1966-08-31',116,'Released','The screen dares reveal the best kept secrets of World War II!','What Did You Do in the War, Daddy?',36283,3.0943,5.9,'2CUauhocf7k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5044,_binary '\0','/tKZMG0k7lr9UUCLbI5EEnzMf8Dy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061177',5.8,10384,'en','What\'s Up, Tiger Lily?','In comic Woody Allen\'s film debut, he took the Japanese action film \"International Secret Police: Key of Keys\" and re-dubbed it, changing the plot to make it revolve around a secret egg salad recipe.','/XOoAcDUMeuPz2sOMsrAXcc8848.jpg','1966-11-02',80,'Released','He\'s not the world\'s greatest lover... but 8th place is not bad!','What\'s Up, Tiger Lily?',21449,2.5537,5.4,'LAcB1G439Mk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5045,_binary '\0','/sACetLDUubCpWo7xlAFT0Zi4N0x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061180',7.1,1779,'en','The Whisperers','Margaret Ross is an impoverished old woman who lives alone in a seedy apartment and enjoys a rich fantasy life as an heiress. One day she discovers stolen money hidden by her son and believes her fantasy has come true.','/8T9P7cm3F9stR2J3OtrkK4LNq0e.jpg','1967-07-18',105,'Released',NULL,'The Whisperers',70635,1.0634,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5046,_binary '\0','/sZxPKiNCK8piKBtXAbm3Ucj6RQk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061184',8,83764,'en','Who\'s Afraid of Virginia Woolf?','A history professor and his wife entertain a young couple who are new to the university\'s faculty. As the drinks flow, secrets come to light, and the middle-aged couple unload onto their guests the full force of the bitterness, dysfunction, and animosity that defines their marriage.','/wF7ihB5V5gSm6zxjv3ZhHOpgREI.jpg','1966-06-22',131,'Released','You are cordially invited to George and Martha\'s for an evening of fun and games','Who\'s Afraid of Virginia Woolf?',396,6.6272,7.7,'ppeMfoKdbAY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5047,_binary '\0','/kQ2WvmTk2fpEMJHkjjGaF6Z81ST.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061189',5.6,3905,'en','The Wild Angels','A motorcycle gang arrives in a small town in search of a motorcycle that has been stolen by a rival gang; but, pursued by the police, one of its members is injured, an event that will cause an orgy of violence and destruction.','/whWwL2xLQ1RZOSz2pEAwGEGjK3Q.jpg','1966-07-20',87,'Released','The most terrifying film of your time!','The Wild Angels',42725,2.7145,5.5,'ndP8T_8h3Vs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5048,_binary '\0','/bK30scD8ODBRIWFi19ct5eCdlc5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061191',1.8,4870,'en','The Wild World of Batwoman','A busty Batwoman enlists her beauteous bevy of Batgirls to help her regain a mad scientist\'s invention–an atom bomb made from a hearing aid–before costumed ne\'er-do-well Rat Fink can glom onto it for his own purposes.','/oPhwk02vibVJt6vVQxM40TENvlF.jpg','1966-01-01',70,'Released','Beyond Wildest Dreams!','The Wild World of Batwoman',31258,1.4142,2.5,'PAjNAkcs1ek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5049,_binary '\0','/ub2oe0ndOVkaPCQdfCu3kc6LjV9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061196',7.5,2643,'ru','Крылья','Former fighter pilot turned provincial schoolmistress Nadezhda Petrovna struggles to adapt to peacetime, having internalised military ideals of service and obedience.','/sGWFjV5e86OJWxs8QYbwo9MHtyL.jpg','1966-11-10',85,'Released',NULL,'Wings',50013,1.1067,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5050,_binary '\0','/qXLHevogZOTjDI8YhNNYkJbgZWA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061197',5.7,1986,'de','Winnetou und das Halbblut Apanatschi','On her b-day, settler\'s daughter Apanatschi receives her father\'s secret gold mine but greedy neighboring prospectors resort to murder and kidnapping in order to get the gold, forcing the girl and her brother to seek Winnetou\'s protection.','/xO4PpdZPWUYdR6Mwei2YMR9Ydtw.jpg','1966-08-17',90,'Released','The new great adventure from the Wild West with Winnetou and Old Shatterhand.','Winnetou and the Crossbreed',9628,3.7803,6.2,'mCzmve4jrW4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5051,_binary '\0','/pYr86DMbhcQuekNI5SUVmkZMc0Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061198',5.2,1636,'de','Winnetou und sein Freund Old Firehand','Firehand and his Apache friend Winnetou are determined to get justice for the murder of four young braves. They set off to track down the gang responsible for the horrendous act.','/3sitZXB3DjPSpkJwu7DrUlqcTvm.jpg','1966-12-13',98,'Released','A Thunder-Clap of Screen Excitement!','Thunder at the Border',9629,2.7184,5.8,'YKkoANdD9aQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5052,_binary '\0','/hpb4ztqfttz7sGRyfsR5z5X2xWo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061203',2.6,1390,'en','Women of the Prehistoric Planet','A space ship crash lands on the third planet of a distant solar system, killing all hands except for a young boy named Tang. The rescue ship arrives some 20 years later. One of the crew, a girl named Linda meets Tang and falls in love with him. They are attacked by the native humanoids of the planet and many of them are killed off. Also, the crew encounters many strange beasts on this strange, but somewhat familiar world.','/teURW8JLrjCFFcBCzIr9IviFL2O.jpg','1966-04-14',90,'Released','It\'s the battle of the sexes as savage planet women attack female space invaders!','Women of the Prehistoric Planet',42727,1.5876,3.857,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5053,_binary '\0','/shkgaVKFJtnu0ghZuqvqf5e1sWN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061204',6.7,4432,'en','The Wrong Box','In Victorian England, a fortune now depends on which of two brothers outlives the other—or can be made to have seemed to do so.','/nflbFmWXFCs8X2rGstQwetEW70m.jpg','1966-06-19',105,'Released',NULL,'The Wrong Box',62143,2.4556,6.4,'GR-5ZzB7yAQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5054,_binary '\0','/a85JFAjE4w9p4ZGHLJLCNDYXCvB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061209',6,2440,'en','You\'re a Big Boy Now','Naive library clerk Bernard Chanticleer moves out of his parents’ home and into a chaotic city full of eccentric landlords, meddling parents, and romantic missteps. Infatuated with a glamorous but manipulative go-go dancer, he learns through heartbreak—and the kindness of a steadfast admirer—what growing up really means.','/4kjCCRZeZW7YiFZ6YPcI46tPTc0.jpg','1966-12-09',97,'Released','The odyssey of a young youth who wants no part of sex...he wants it all!','You\'re a Big Boy Now',42728,2.0814,6.1,'PlC04ulnMcw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5055,_binary '\0','/9OOFIRotd2s7L7hUhOI1q2gTlu3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061217',3.2,1250,'en','Zontar: The Thing from Venus','A misguided scientist enables an alien from Venus named Zontar to come to earth in order to \"help solve man\'s problems\". However, as soon as Zontar arrives on Earth, it quickly becomes obvious that the three-eyed, bat-winged, skeletal black creature has a hidden agenda.','/2YY7c3dws5XU7FX4G41kcnJRlaQ.jpg','1967-12-01',80,'Released','It\'s Coming for YOU from Space to wipe all living things from the face of the Earth! CAN IT BE STOPPED?','Zontar: The Thing from Venus',41302,1.5876,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5056,_binary '\0','/8skpuiVnIZNpXkHyjoCUUaYkxjL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061320',7,2249,'it','A ciascuno il suo','A leftist professor wants the truth about two men killed during a hunting party; but the mafia, the Church and corrupt politicians don\'t want him to learn it.','/tBRjeDnVLWIrtMmNq25hKBzGEQ4.jpg','1967-02-24',99,'Released','Sicily is a small island. Some people live there. Some people love there. Some people die there.','We Still Kill the Old Way',80441,2.2038,6.743,'OGjDw-dFpeI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5057,_binary '\0','/xjgFYs2FrQEf0f7WfVoVC2MUBRh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061328',6.8,5484,'en','Accident','Stephen is a professor at Oxford University who is caught in a rut and feels trapped by his life in both academia and marriage. One of his students, William, is engaged to the beautiful Anna, and Stephen becomes enamored of the younger woman. These three people become linked together by a horrible car crash, with flashbacks providing details into the lives of each person and their connection to the others in this brooding English drama.','/gttNRLWBDJXwOdoNCKQFgxSGUh8.jpg','1967-02-09',105,'Released','The story of a love triangle... and the four people trapped in it!','Accident',74544,2.2064,6.4,'6Efu7RpZUdg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5058,_binary '\0','/39QeBKuwhWRRcZMVYDezDmiZCLu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061333',6.4,1527,'en','The Adventures of Bullwhip Griffin','To restore his family\'s lost wealth, a young Boston lad stows away on a ship bound for the California Gold Rush. When their very proper butler gives chase, all roads lead to nonstop adventure, wild and woolly characters, and a lucky punch that leads to a bonanza of belly laughs!','/khvURUTM5YMHOjlplljYeCq7MYD.jpg','1967-03-08',108,'Released','When the family fortune runs out, the laughs rush in.','The Adventures of Bullwhip Griffin',20237,3.2466,6.625,'RgqhGUnayAs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5059,_binary '\0','/8p0chBOMP5E10XF2zz7pwX93Iov.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061343',7.3,2518,'fr','Alexandre le bienheureux','Alexandre, a young and honest farmer, is oppressed by an authoritarian wife, who makes him work like a dog. When she dies in a car crash, he decides to stay in bed, absolutely free and inactive. Just a dog is occupied to carry food and newspapers to him.','/rQkeFyDIm9f8Oj6MsmlIxShOfu2.jpg','1968-02-09',100,'Released',NULL,'Very Happy Alexander',18628,1.9624,6.879,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5060,_binary '\0','/wthhvdweznzC1hKWaQtxlTfgJOv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061357',6.3,1804,'fr','Angélique et le Sultan','Angélique is in a North African Muslim kingdom where she is now part of the Sultan\'s harem. She refuses to be bedded as her captors try to beat sense into her. She finally decides to escape with the help of two Christian prisoners.','/mqENboMTcwRg09lm6wO1eyPaWgJ.jpg','1968-03-13',105,'Released','Not even the heat of the sultan\'s harem can melt the bonds of true love','Angelique and the Sultan',44446,3.5319,6.388,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5061,_binary '\0','/bAoPOb3GWnzycolOMYk9E2jkapz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061369',6.6,13306,'fr','Astérix le Gaulois','In the year 50 BC, Gaul is occupied by the Romans - nearly. But the small village of Asterix and his friends still resists the Roman legions with the aid of their druid\'s magic potion, which gives superhuman strength. Learning of this potion, a Roman centurion kidnaps the druid to get the secret formula out of him.','/A2dlVs5WRmAwIPVS5vODhAOkNy7.jpg','1967-12-20',68,'Released',NULL,'Asterix the Gaul',11047,4.9997,6.5,'C5Ig-sa3XAw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5062,_binary '\0','/vfxRVP9AP8fcYfmf2KV1si3Wol.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061376',7,4515,'fr','Les Aventuriers','Two adventurers and best friends, Roland and Manu, are the victims of a practical joke that costs Manu his pilot\'s license. With seeming contrition, the jokesters tell Roland and Manu about a crashed plane lying on the ocean floor off the coast of Congo stuffed with riches. The adventurers set off to find the loot.','/rsl3EbF6gwKEihyffIXXcVlvOx9.jpg','1967-04-12',112,'Released',NULL,'The Last Adventure',11396,2.0405,6.89,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5063,_binary '\0','/grmcOEixdC646XC90Lgj09SKMqR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061380',5.7,1289,'en','The Ballad of Josie','A frontier widow aims to raise sheep despite a cattle rancher in old Wyoming.','/jlthYoRvDYx5TpW1j5vWpXOpCmV.jpg','1967-12-22',102,'Released','IT\'S QUICK-DRAW DORIS!','The Ballad of Josie',81046,2.6134,6,'OWYZJW7fgy8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5064,_binary '\0','/1hNQtElM8RfieC2xJHvsoUylMZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061385',7,23104,'en','Barefoot in the Park','In this film based on a Neil Simon play, newlyweds Corie, a free spirit, and Paul Bratter, an uptight lawyer, share a sixth-floor apartment in Greenwich Village. Soon after their marriage, Corie tries to find a companion for mother, Ethel, who is now alone, and sets up Ethel with neighbor Victor. Inappropriate behavior on a double date causes conflict, and the young couple considers divorce.','/qh64tAOmbQNoYMLTETkhmBQgSbu.jpg','1967-05-25',106,'Released','Broadway\'s barest, rarest, unsquarest love play.','Barefoot in the Park',17887,3.6762,7.1,'McZTziIw_Ys','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5065,_binary '\0','/c7lKsVMeFrbo5RRE0nWNQagCLw3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061389',6.1,2006,'en','Beach Red','American troops storm ashore on a Japanese-held island and push inland while their enemies plan a counterattack in this look at warfare. Soldiers on both sides are haunted by memories of home and the horrifying, sickening images they find in combat.','/6hAOU5jcsgRTq0CR6eHUsi76tzR.jpg','1967-08-03',103,'Released','IT\'S HIM OR YOU BABY!','Beach Red',39519,1.9967,6.5,'SXIei1za_Og','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5066,_binary '\0','/i3fkCA1syexLsxINZJad5ERteT5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061391',6.7,10496,'en','Bedazzled','A hapless loser sells his soul to the Devil in exchange for seven wishes, but has trouble winning over the girl of his dreams.','/4POWJtOXt19PWfO18rHpw5GIQc6.jpg','1967-10-30',103,'Released','An irreverent romp that raises hell','Bedazzled',18209,2.7726,6.205,'FsyqpUP1knQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5067,_binary '\0','/9fJPLvrUV32MzpfDwXk7cOnj8hM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061395',7.6,53994,'fr','Belle de jour','Beautiful young housewife Séverine Serizy cannot reconcile her masochistic fantasies with her everyday life alongside dutiful husband Pierre. When her lovestruck friend Henri mentions a secretive high-class brothel run by Madame Anais, Séverine begins to work there during the day under the name Belle de Jour. But when one of her clients grows possessive, she must try to go back to her normal life.','/iUAFECovwPA0cVV9bo4uNGLJSGL.jpg','1967-05-24',101,'Released','Luis Bunuel\'s Masterpiece of Erotica!','Belle de Jour',649,7.1794,7.3,'gC1lO7lqMuw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5068,_binary '\0','/cMpnczREJPgDAE8HDvnfLqtBre5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061398',5.4,3024,'en','Berserk!','A lady ringmaster milks the publicity from a string of murders.','/gGWC7AncEsAxNv01yXY2xlr8gZz.jpg','1967-11-01',96,'Released','The Screen Screams out at a Hundred Horrors!','Berserk!',42689,2.062,5.681,'3Retaev15Xs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5069,_binary '\0','/qsqD0aAB50OymFqCUAQN8XAXUOs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061401',5.5,1484,'en','The Big Mouth','A fisherman crosses paths with a diamond-smuggling gangster–who is his doppelgänger—and inadvertently takes his place at a resort hotel where he meets a special girl.','/2q6TKlvsngxJfraxJ4qprC0sOd3.jpg','1967-07-12',107,'Released','The Big Mob vs. The Big Mouth...','The Big Mouth',99377,2.6677,5.3,'_Xxoh70YFZg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5070,_binary '\0','/1LsJxgTU0XGXfiVBE6Cl2k8TQH2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061405',5.9,6761,'en','Billion Dollar Brain','A former British spy stumbles into in a plot to overthrow Communism with the help of a supercomputer. But who is working for whom?','/igCZbIKbYJijEhMVYwUD9MooApa.jpg','1967-11-16',111,'Released','Pow… Power… Brainpower','Billion Dollar Brain',4889,3.2447,5.6,'DQ8dBx-ywlI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5071,_binary '\0','/irejIt5Uu0xbUYQ6XAGamEjpRoX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061407',7,9645,'en','The Taming of the Shrew','Italy, 16th century. Petruchio, a choleric, lying and poor rural landowner from Verona, arrives in Padua in search of fortune and a wife, while Baptista, a wealthy merchant, announces that he will not allow Bianca, his youngest daughter, to marry until the temperamental and unruly Katherina, his eldest daughter, does.','/2LpU3kyg1PowiQoEHf7oUXOUmVa.jpg','1967-03-08',117,'Released','The motion picture they were made for!','The Taming of the Shrew',25560,4.5719,6.931,'_a3KJ9OGQDE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5072,_binary '\0','/ZfxFFBMTaQjSQXtWhWaS3uCQbn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061411',5.2,2382,'en','The Blood Beast Terror','A scientist working with genetics creates a horrifying flying creature that feeds on human blood. Following a gruesome trail of dead bodies, Scotland Yard investigators must scramble to halt its ravenous rampage.','/oPf7ZhBthvAa0kBzVgNqKx0mLRo.jpg','1968-02-01',88,'Released','A ravishing PSYCHO-FIEND feasts on the BLOOD of her Lovers','The Blood Beast Terror',77173,2.2873,5.5,'h5imt9zz0d4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5073,_binary '\0','/t3h2iCZnWKCn7jASVrhDV2wlDth.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061412',3.6,1434,'en','Blood of Dracula\'s Castle','Count Dracula and his wife capture beautiful young women and chain them in their dungeon, to be used when they need to satisfy their thirst for blood.','/mRmmdKl4IfweC4cS2ti9Taim1We.jpg','1969-10-05',84,'Released','Once The Gate Closes You\'ll Never Get Out!','Blood of Dracula\'s Castle',29121,2.0477,4.3,'86e9F5_fgWI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5074,_binary '\0','/vmMC9rC2Z3iptDj2K5AiK0wlVAF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061418',7.7,127773,'en','Bonnie and Clyde','In the 1930s, bored waitress Bonnie Parker falls in love with an ex-con named Clyde Barrow, and together they start a violent crime spree throughout the country, stealing cars and robbing banks.','/sCSQFK9kMsprT4jgWqgw82dT6WI.jpg','1967-08-13',111,'Released','They’re young… they’re in love… and they kill people.','Bonnie and Clyde',475,9.548,7.5,'hZpm1zj9510','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5075,_binary '\0','/eeYYvPFVhupP2L2BcMoMsSIle3g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061420',5.9,3318,'en','The Born Losers','A biker gang incites a reign of terror in a California coastal town that culminates in four teenage girls being raped. Vietnam veteran Billy Jack has had enough, however, and takes on the depraved bikers single-handedly. He rescues young Vicky Barrington from their clutches, but then has to contend with not only the thugs, but also the ineffectual and racist local lawmen, who have it out for the half-Native American Billy.','/mQ3IsmgXIsV8mitbatCG6N2IrRE.jpg','1967-07-12',114,'Released','An innocent girl is first prize in the dirtiest game ever played!','The Born Losers',44695,2.0898,6.4,'4mlSyNZrmFY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5076,_binary '\0','/lbgRSXK74GxA4ahyzXaMrNcD9et.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061429',7,5738,'it','Quién sabe?','El Chuncho\'s bandits rob arms from a train, intending to sell the weapons to Elias\' revolutionaries. They are helped by one of the passengers, Bill Tate, and allow him to join them, unware of his true intentions.','/mKJtHftfsLwz8y8XMb8gPdxoBKJ.jpg','1967-01-13',118,'Released','Like the Bandit... Like the Gringo... A bullet doesn\'t care who it kills!','A Bullet for the General',37316,2.6455,6.644,'cKZAQzwNmU0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5077,_binary '\0','/yN7kiVhfZx9j05xXeqFs9KnbneL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061433',6,1619,'it','C\'era una volta','A fairy tale of the misadventures of a beautiful but temperamental Neapolitan peasant, Isabella, when she meets the ill- tempered Spanish Prince Rodrigo Ferrante y Davalos. The King of Spain has ordered Rodrigo to choose a wife among seven Italian Princesses, but he is smitten by the lowly peasant.','/g2PVZfQUIhmZSPTHulb0vO2Hefg.jpg','1967-10-19',104,'Released','Who ever thought that making love could be such a glamorous, romantic, spectacular adventure?','More Than a Miracle',60543,2.4975,5.9,'HJXp9oZ5zK0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5078,_binary '\0','/s1kHDtPr5pn11OqwTlTREAelSRl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061439',6.6,8239,'en','Camelot','The plot of his illegitimate son Mordred to gain the throne, and Guinevere\'s growing attachment to Sir Lancelot, threatens to topple King Arthur and destroy his \"round table\" of knights.','/1ohPMbfmQVg0Zzy9wkySm1w8Kr7.jpg','1967-10-25',180,'Released','Relive the songs. Relive the romance. Relive the music. Relive the drama. Relive the magic.','Camelot',18978,3.0568,6.2,'hzaeisqxtvQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5079,_binary '\0','/1ma3COc6cjgKIpbOk3D2pvhxVyI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061447',5.5,1973,'en','Caprice','Patricia Foster, an industrial designer, causes chaos when she sells a secret cosmetics formula to a rival company.','/zn6mHBrlOh5oqrm8EX3DMdYF88A.jpg','1967-04-18',92,'Released','Caprice is a zig zag pattern of suspense and excitement that leaves all other thrillers behind... far behind!','Caprice',44769,1.712,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5080,_binary '\0','/mWtOA7c8MMJD2hIJxiJKO1fe1Ra.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061450',6.5,4615,'en','Carry On Doctor','Francis Bigger, a notorious charlatan who tours the country lecturing on the subject of mind over matter, slips off the platform in the middle of his performance and ends up in hospital under the care of Dr Tinkle. The hospital is about to enter a period of total chaos.','/gJU1zThyVI8wd3QUPWLjjf4Lsgw.jpg','1967-12-02',94,'Released','That \'Carry On\' Gang is playing Doctor with the Sexiest Nurses in town!','Carry On Doctor',5064,2.0413,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5081,_binary '\0','/bzd7Uph8qfAB3fi488rIE3x2pWg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061452',5,35270,'en','Casino Royale','Sir James Bond is called back out of retirement to stop SMERSH. In order to trick SMERSH, James thinks up the ultimate plan - that every agent will be named \'James Bond\'. One of the Bonds, whose real name is Evelyn Tremble is sent to take on Le Chiffre in a game of baccarat, but all the Bonds get more than they can handle.','/9wdw5H018bgIM8bK2HuDvh8BwOh.jpg','1967-04-18',131,'Released','Casino Royale is too much for one James Bond!','Casino Royale',12208,8.7547,5.2,'e_YndB3k170','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5082,_binary '\0','/eWiUHC8DH4Uvly3tfCd1K66vevl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061456',2.3,2392,'en','Catalina Caper','A group of swingin\' teens take time out from having fun in the sun to try to foil a group of crooks searching for a stolen scroll.','/6efmkosmHrbwDqkkq23R5JV0rPt.jpg','1967-12-01',84,'Released','Wild adventure... international intrigue!','Catalina Caper',31265,1.2176,2.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5083,_binary '\0','/abwlBbryDrwbhzD0i4YlgkIVLHc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061465',5.6,1836,'en','Chelsea Girls','Follows various residents of the Chelsea Hotel in 1966 New York City.','/c1oA8F4IfZrZw10LuvJGSzqmSxx.jpg','1966-09-15',210,'Released',NULL,'Chelsea Girls',1686,1.279,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5084,_binary '\0','/5xKuOSej5ZmcDzrXIg6gqHask3o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061473',6.9,9139,'fr','La Chinoise','A small group of French students are studying Mao, trying to find out their position in the world and how to change the world to a Maoistic community using terrorism.','/hfGzYErvwi8hB38kCsSNy6OjdPv.jpg','1967-08-30',96,'Released','A movie in the making.','La Chinoise',1629,2.6046,7,'vQcB95HJ8kg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5085,_binary '\0','/hR4HrX9sHTBkcdbaL9e9urXc1XY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061474',7.2,1257,'bn','চিড়িয়াখানা','When Byomkesh Bakshi\'s new client, Dr. Nishanath Sen, is murdered at Golap Colony, he decides to probe into the case with the help of his close aide, Ajit.','/aLOt5gVf74VK4qTKu5HWd1fnbgR.jpg','1967-11-18',125,'Released',NULL,'The Zoo',238159,1.0081,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5086,_binary '\0','/1lbOd6KB0qSFfJvtW17TX3HSusY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061477',6.3,1244,'en','Chuka','A group under siege at an Army fort grapple with painful memories.','/fVmHQoFkGLlFS1odAGyB4ect8PH.jpg','1967-06-11',105,'Released','He\'s a man called Chuka and you don\'t forget it!','Chuka',39110,2.639,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5087,_binary '\0','/d3Hzfh0hkrjAlHzJimKQngOF6F2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061489',5.7,3666,'en','Clambake','The heir to an oil fortune trades places with a water-ski instructor at a Florida hotel to see if girls will like him for himself, rather than his father\'s money.','/2d7E9eattf7dkFR16OVJmHBmBsr.jpg','1967-12-04',99,'Released','It\'s ELVIS barreling... biking... bikini-ing and belting out that W I L D Presley beat','Clambake',26299,2.3907,5.8,'-kohyyGyDrQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5088,_binary '\0','/lEamKAOMyENqc97bEuwLFMvie8x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061495',7.3,11043,'fr','La Collectionneuse','Bombastic, womanising art dealer Adrien and his painter friend Daniel go on holiday at a 17th-century villa on the Riviera. But their idyll is disturbed by the presence of the bohemian Haydée, accused of being a \'collector\' of men.','/rMVluFrpfeCtcCUtDkjklbBirry.jpg','1967-03-02',86,'Released',NULL,'La Collectionneuse',4837,2.4969,6.9,'dBK-cedrRt8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5089,_binary '\0','/7oyZyweMSLg84YTUFbURIsIBoZg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061502',6.3,2506,'en','The Comedians','American and British tourists get caught up in political unrest in Haiti.','/xlFWqgh0Uyyn21kIaDlRgJk0YYA.jpg','1967-10-31',152,'Released','They lie, they cheat, they destroy… they even try to love','The Comedians',86059,1.6996,6.1,'sxQXtKktsAM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5090,_binary '\0','/9TDi0FPOSAePfVLZXAUgFZhiMLf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061512',8,197341,'en','Cool Hand Luke','When petty criminal Luke Jackson is sentenced to two years in a Florida prison farm, he doesn\'t play by the rules of either the sadistic warden or the yard\'s resident heavy, Dragline, who ends up admiring the new guy\'s unbreakable will. Luke\'s bravado, even in the face of repeated stints in the prison\'s dreaded solitary confinement cell, \"the box,\" make him a rebel hero to his fellow convicts and a thorn in the side of the prison officers.','/4ykzTiHKLamh3eZJ8orVICtU2Jp.jpg','1967-11-01',127,'Released','The man... and the motion picture that simply do not conform.','Cool Hand Luke',903,8.8597,7.7,'EdMpFEl7DhY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5091,_binary '\0','/7CETzDYJ7JUPRIGQ2nmyw37VPKz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061520',5.8,2098,'en','Corruption','A surgeon discovers that he can restore the beauty to his girlfriend\'s scarred face by murdering other women and extracting fluids from their pituitary gland. However, the effects only last for a short time, so he has to kill more and more women. It is ultimately a killing spree which ends with considerable death and disaster.','/tPDKxaK0GEj62RdY4ONCXVjcezV.jpg','1968-07-19',91,'Released','where will the bodies turn up next? ...under a car seat? ...in a valise? ...or in a deep-freeze?','Corruption',39861,1.5637,5.8,'SLJGYZSKgI4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5092,_binary '\0','/xGaloya0EgeP0BGbxm2lTEX82Zo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061523',6,7884,'en','A Countess from Hong Kong','A Russian countess stows away in the stateroom of a married U.S. diplomat bound for New York.','/dquOunnHxQXBVOOiqkdtGWIK1lP.jpg','1967-01-05',107,'Released','Fun at Sea! His Cabin, His PJs, Her Move!','A Countess from Hong Kong',2984,3.1227,6,'pHW3fqwqGtY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5093,_binary '\0','/tX46PTo0xv4XlxtUpMTujcUPOg4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061537',7.5,4380,'hu','Csillagosok, Katonák','In 1919, Hungarian Communists aid the Bolsheviks\' defeat of Czarists, the Whites. Near the Volga, a monastery and a field hospital are held by one side and then the other.','/ksoCAQDpcQl4gmkL9IGdtFCQGnv.jpg','1967-11-03',90,'Released',NULL,'The Red and the White',52885,1.6244,7,'2DzCL4kKb0Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5094,_binary '\0','/5cn7Nc7GA4zuFhfBMiwvzdeOw1y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061549',3.9,1958,'ko','대괴수 용가리','Earthquakes in central Korea turn out to be the work of Yongary, a prehistoric gasoline-eating reptile that soon goes on a rampage through Seoul.','/8o0ZwBHqueNvlynd2VX4xySRrFM.jpg','1967-08-13',79,'Released','A Monster from another age ... with terrifying destructive powers ...','Yongary, Monster from the Deep',42699,1.5307,4.8,'CWLX-tegi18','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5095,_binary '\0','/ugVdGHicz21A3JjSctP1SlpF3e4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061550',4.4,1919,'ja','大巨獣ガッパ','An expedition in the South Pacific lands on a tropical island where the natives worship the mysterious deity Gappa. An earthquake opens up an underground cavern and a baby reptile is discovered inside. The natives warn the foreigners to leave the hatching alone, but they don\'t listen and take it back to a zoo in Japan. Soon after, moma and papa Gappa start smashing Tokyo looking for their kidnapped child.','/pS2NY8VZlkKGyCE5hwZpTbu8exu.jpg','1967-04-22',84,'Released','Vast! Hideous! Invincible!','Gappa, the Triphibian Monster',2097,1.9227,5.6,'ISZ4tMKU4PY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5096,_binary '\0','/y7FMwxLAouENpX05f2YSgZozrlR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061556',6.7,4795,'en','The Deadly Affair','Charles Dobbs is a British secret agent investigating the apparent suicide of Foreign Office official Samuel Fennan. Dobbs suspects that Fennan\'s wife, Elsa, a survivor of a Nazi Germany extermination camp, might have some clues, but other officials want Dobbs to drop the case. So Dobbs hires a retiring inspector, Mendel, to quietly make inquiries. Dobbs isn\'t at all sure as there are a number of anomalies that simply can\'t be explained away. Dobbs is also having trouble at home with his errant wife, whom he very much loves, having frequent affairs. He\'s also pleased to see an old friend, Dieter Frey, who he recruited after the war. With the assistance of a colleague and a retired policeman, Dobbs tries to piece together just who is the spy and who in fact assassinated Fennan.','/Av6mrgiizvdSC1Tl9cEvazjS9S.jpg','1967-01-26',115,'Released','From the author of \"The Spy Who Came in from the Cold\"','The Deadly Affair',14755,2.7855,6.304,'4eCUkup14NM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5097,_binary '\0','/lCE88IkoxaQ1vFehBAUHidYPquw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061557',4.3,2431,'en','The Deadly Bees','Pop singer Vicki Robbins collapses from exhaustion while shooting ta music video; her physician prescribes a respite on Seagull Island with beekeeper Ralph Hargrove. Initially finding the Hargroves\' bitter marital strife oddly relaxing, the arrival of specially-bred attack bees pushes Vicki to her survival instinct.','/ePWorn3mWFdZNSlQbjBbymrAzFC.jpg','1966-12-23',83,'Released','Hives of horror!','The Deadly Bees',47003,1.7924,4.512,'BV9cEHiIH5g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5098,_binary '\0','/sZxFoGDNhSGILUPtZuP2R4sJbaW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061568',6,2317,'fr','Diaboliquement vôtre','A wealthy amnesiac begins to suspect that his devoted wife is not really his wife and that he is not the man people keep telling him he is.','/k9PsKtjPll2IynyfmZGtH1MiIFt.jpg','1967-12-22',93,'Released','I\'m yours to have and to hold till DEATH do us part.','Diabolically Yours',42690,3.0723,5.942,'nSbahEXuVcs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5099,_binary '\0','/bGjSG8LTmliQkGAWGedMpaBO9eW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061576',6.2,6450,'it','Dio perdona... Io no!','In this violent spaghetti western a murderous robber hijacks a payroll train, murders everyone aboard and then stashes his loot. A gunslinger learns about it and decides he wants the money for himself and so hatches an elaborate plot to get at it. He lures the crook into a rigged poker game, and afterward a gunfight ensues. The quick-drawing gunman makes short work of the robber, then teams up with an insurance agent to look for the hidden fortune. Unbeknownst to them, the robber had an ace up his sleeve...','/mEhoHmnwxpGeLdSOfqJHFGmcWqv.jpg','1967-10-31',113,'Released','They call him PRETTY FACE! ...and his credo is simple and short and sweet!','God Forgives... I Don\'t!',41608,4.6525,6.6,'kFCa8nIJVaU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5100,_binary '\0','/2hABgVIhalvUB30Z2kIPVv8YX9n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061578',7.7,84825,'en','The Dirty Dozen','12 American military prisoners in World War II are ordered to infiltrate a well-guarded enemy château and kill the Nazi officers vacationing there. The soldiers, most of whom are facing death sentences for a variety of violent crimes, agree to the mission and the possible commuting of their sentences.','/tFWWsuhp22zJ6OG6QepJIiPUfeF.jpg','1967-06-15',149,'Released','Train them! Excite them! Arm them!...Then turn them loose on the Nazis!','The Dirty Dozen',1654,8.2514,7.6,'cWi6vekSZgA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5101,_binary '\0','/92d8MYd6wfAw4RZ3htZJVNjH91G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061581',6.3,2128,'en','Divorce American Style','After 17 years of marriage in American suburbia, Richard and Barbara Harmon step into the new world of divorce.','/5QLwwLUDkuBCYYGaLZZipalRW95.jpg','1967-06-21',109,'Released','If you thought divorce was ugly, try marriage!','Divorce American Style',102057,1.9638,5.9,'HRgwwrxjx