ler','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5106,_binary '\0','/m3EKZKunYksXMNU11lxd8dYxcmy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061592',2.6,1592,'en','Doomsday Machine','Following the discovery of a doomsday machine capable of destroying Earth, the launch of a US space mission to Venus is taken over by the military.','/8K2Xho8yK3bFGTCuZcc5Qo420dp.jpg','1972-01-01',83,'Released','See! The Earth Destroyed In A Nuclear Holocaust!','Doomsday Machine',113523,1.7966,3.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5107,_binary '\0','/q5f41y43TXJJ8rvHo9sVO5BO4Jb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061594',5.9,1390,'en','The Double Man','In a complex piece of espionage the Russian secret service attempts to kidnap a high ranking officer in the CIA and replace him with a one of its own.','/2S35Net0RCwMKxwKeu3UQZ3yeHj.jpg','1967-04-25',105,'Released','The key man to the most daring plot ever concocted by the secret agents of two worlds!','The Double Man',105056,1.9452,6.3,'P1nJuF7Ty98','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5108,_binary '\0','/zRBR3l4cRoMLbquWVlLkR0r2LtV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061595',5.1,2057,'en','Double Trouble','When singer Guy Lambert goes on tour in Europe, he is pursued by two beautiful women, bumbling jewel thieves, and a mysterious killer.','/16arir1nxX0CgoS9KpNwNGob4Y6.jpg','1967-04-05',91,'Released','ELVIS takes mad mod Europe by song as he swings into a brand new adventure filled with dames, diamonds, discotheques, and danger!!','Double Trouble',45335,2.6744,5,'ZnoNpEJXJeA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5109,_binary '\0','/jZlUG3Vs6HAVPr7JedmfoMIxeZW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061597',7.2,4173,'zh','獨臂刀','A noble swordsman, whose arm had been chopped off, returns to his former teacher to defend him from a villainous gang of rival swordsmen.','/5uUwl2cB4O7NmDFsKCmZkYTtVGO.jpg','1967-07-26',111,'Released',NULL,'The One-Armed Swordsman',54178,2.784,6.876,'jd8GXguZJfQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-1