ther with a fighter and a gambler, they help a rancher and his family fight a rival rancher that is trying to steal their water.','/poJxkMtTA3E95lJ6RnBgNxF0Vmx.jpg','1966-12-17',126,'Released','It\'s the big one with the big two!','El Dorado',6644,4.8295,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5114,_binary '\0','/npDDNi2b7XBvaFL2Noh2MbS2EWd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061620',7,3687,'sv','Elvira Madigan','Famous acrobat Elvira Madigan meets Sixten Sparre, a married Swedish officer with two children. They decide to elope, but since Sparre deserted the army, he\'s unemployable and the couple encounter various hardships.','/odjkOW8BYVTj1q73Ad5KIHFfAge.jpg','1967-04-24',91,'Released',NULL,'Elvira Madigan',42692,2.2099,7,'oPFxTQZQTmk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5115,_binary '\0','/v9tnOguGFRmLFIjnFLuOq3EPTZj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061633',7.6,1870,'es','El extraño viaje','In a small town near Madrid, Paquita and her brother Venancio, both single and with a childish personality, live under the shadow of their bossy older sister, Ignacia, a grumpy old maid.','/qR34wM5e8tDuE1u5o1G8alP5AKo.jpg','1964-08-09',89,'Released',NULL,'Strange Voyage',162510,1.5406,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5116,_binary '\0','/bXrx6qd0djjDDhoXyH5EvQDLLJS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061634',6.1,3803,'en','Eye of the Devil','A French nobleman deserts his wife because of an ancient family secret.','/14gehKJzoyoFWMqzCKDt5mHQXZs.jpg','1966-11-18',96,'Released','This is the climax in mind-chilling terror!','Eye of the Devil',3051,2.6076,6.1,'RSTx19mcy2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5117,_binary '\0','/aur68UIJEbXdQfW5nIqIzCIjhMS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061636',7.1,3693,'it','Faccia a faccia','History Professor Brad Fletcher heads west for his health, but falls in with Solomon Bennett\'s outlaw gang. Fascinated by their way of life, Fletcher finally takes over the gang, leading with a new \'efficient\' ruthlessness.','/tvvCChgjwqyzwcrHtqG1hMNlfv2.jpg','1967-11-24',112,'Released','Facing death... a vigilante against an avenger.','Face to Face',45211,2.3994,7,'b6Nyq8UnKUg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5118,_binary '\0','/qoEwJ3Z9okEclRrC7Sim4dVAeDy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061643',6.7,6686,'es','Fando y Lis','Fando and his partially paralysed lover Lis search for the mythical city of Tar.','/3GBjyujvyLEOtKL5WIm4UN9WHh5.jpg','1972-06-08',97,'Released',NULL,'Fando and Lis',33257,1.9305,6.8,'a8j8mDbroLc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5119,_binary '\0','/dM6OzbDhcBspYCVF6do11h0uC1R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061647',6.3,3760,'en','Triple Cross','Safecracker Eddie Chapman is languishing in prison on the island of Jersey when the Nazis arrive. An adept manipulator of situations, Chapman convinces the Germans to use him to spy on the British. And when the would-be traitor arrives home, he convinces the English to use him as a double agent -- in exchange for a full pardon.','/AoGvqzc66h533Ncxjx3pSjy7Xmf.jpg','1966-12-09',140,'Released','MASTER-CRIMINAL! SUPER-SPY! AND ALL TRUE!','Triple Cross',4375,3.1531,6.1,'9wbMBEDVUsI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5120,_binary '\0','/fDeklBmKoeTUslH9uYtZRzWnXHs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061648',7.2,6875,'en','Far from the Madding Crowd','Bathsheba Everdine, a willful, flirtatious, young woman, unexpectedly inherits a large farm and becomes romantically involved with three widely divergent men.','/2cCHnpaf5JTRlgO07uulEdUpFkb.jpg','1967-06-18',166,'Released','Her romance with three men becomes a bold adventure','Far from the Madding Crowd',3469,3.01,6.917,'OyOmpEiqDYI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5121,_binary '\0','/bnnZQkX1KLM20dF4WO7XOJ54HHw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061653',5.7,2009,'en','Fathom','While touring abroad in Europe, beautiful American skydiver Fathom Harvill gets wrapped up in international intrigue when Scottish spy Douglas Campbell recruits her to help him on a secret mission. Before long, Fathom realizes that no one around her, including the mysterious Peter Merriweather, can easily be trusted, leading to various adventures that involve bull fighting, beaches and, of course, romance.','/w8ere2qGBpoJ92lL6fsJ3hrYT6z.jpg','1967-08-25',99,'Released','The world\'s most uncovered undercover agent!','Fathom',43915,1.9105,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5122,_binary '\0','/pmO4NERkXjJiCfpEuLT1raZS5fA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061655',7,36281,'en','The Fearless Vampire Killers','A noted professor and his dim-witted apprentice fall prey to their inquiring vampires, while on the trail of the ominous damsel in distress.','/nqk9oTXRaukSyhFAwBGGgEnLl43.jpg','1967-11-13',108,'Released','Who says Vampires are no laughing matter?','The Fearless Vampire Killers',3053,5.9138,6.9,'LK46jK_6YsI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5123,_binary '\0','/1vJ2sHEIMKtEzvSft8hJwLjTu5s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061669',6.7,2419,'en','Fitzwilly','When Miss Vicki\'s father dies, she becomes the world\'s greatest philanthropist. Unfortunately, she is flat broke! Her loyal butler, Claude Fitzwilliam, leads the household staff to rob from various businesses by charging goods to various wealthy people and misdirecting the shipments, all to keep Miss Vicki\'s standard of living.','/749GJU7RGeEJijDcUQJh1mFio4m.jpg','1967-12-20',102,'Released','Fitzwilly strikes again!','Fitzwilly',33730,2.3714,6.2,'l2PaGofePPg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5124,_binary '\0','/5Lye8jj5tga0LewL0DhaJTc7WHJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061671',1.8,2112,'en','Five the Hard Way','A racer in the motorcycle sport called \'sidehacking\' goes on a rampage of vengeance when his fiancée is raped and murdered.','/vWZlZKSrgLoUxBg2BhtVbi0cXpt.jpg','1969-05-01',89,'Released','HARD RIDERS! Mounted on Burning Steel! ... with only their leathers between THEM and HELL!','The Sidehackers',31124,1.8738,1.8,'xSBwUsLqUEU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5125,_binary '\0','/gXQWAtmBpvHs87uZx4VOQgiOVVX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061678',6.8,2762,'en','The Flim-Flam Man','Mordecai Jones, a silver-tongued swindler and self-proclaimed “M.B.S., C.S., D.D.—Master of Back-Stabbing, Cork-Screwing and Double-Dealing,” has made a career out of charming and cheating his way through life. Played with devilish charm by George C. Scott, Jones takes on a new protégé in Curley, a wide-eyed Army deserter eager for direction. Together, they crisscross the backroads of the rural South, pulling off a string of homespun cons while staying one step ahead of a relentless local sheriff. Along the way, Curley falls for Bonnie Lee Packard, a rebellious heiress who joins their misadventures. But as the scams grow riskier, Curley begins to wonder whether a life of flimflam is worth the price. With its colorful characters, offbeat humor, and standout performance by Scott, The Flim-Flam Man is a rollicking Southern caper about cons, conscience, and unlikely camaraderie.','/zNKLe9v0ioYM6foZ3hGFaPTcQYo.jpg','1967-08-22',104,'Released','Meet Mordecai Jones; Master of Back-Stabbing, Cork-Screwing and Double-Dealing!','The Flim-Flam Man',42407,2.4106,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5126,_binary '\0','/qC8avfLKvG9rpnQTn3zDT45FSvf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061680',6,3020,'en','Follow That Camel','Bertram Oliphant \'Bo\' West wants to clear his unjustly smeared reputation, so he joins the Foreign Legion—with Simpson his manservant in tow. But the fort they get posted to is full of eccentric legionnaires, and there\'s trouble brewing with the locals too. Unbeknown to Bo, his lady love has followed him in disguise.','/v6JcQoUgI33c3qKfYw8SMWA7qag.jpg','1967-08-10',95,'Released',NULL,'Follow That Camel',24568,2.4228,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'