,'YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5130,_binary '\0','/h0Uww4IJKw6x4LvhMtdwirPtR1u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061709',7,6578,'it','I giorni dell\'ira','A scruffy garbage boy becomes the pupil of famed gunfighter Talby, and the stage for confrontation is set when the gunman overruns the boy\'s town through violence and corruption.','/2TYZtE3BXP1LvktbkMb45mbd42G.jpg','1967-12-19',113,'Released','Lee Van Cleef has been dirty, \"ugly\" and downright mean... now watch him get violent.','Day of Anger',56373,3.1721,7.1,'P0TGLbFUib4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5131,_binary '\0','/sf3xfJppftP4VF0Ta2sqlT8oe2x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061715',6.5,2693,'en','The Gnome-Mobile','An eccentric millionaire and his grandchildren are embroiled in the plights of some forest gnomes who are searching for the rest of their tribe. While helping them, the millionaire is suspected of being crazy because he\'s seeing gnomes! He\'s committed, and the niece and nephew and the gnomes have to find him and free him.','/oeugD3jvHaNCaSc6r3NK1EcYvty.jpg','1967-07-19',85,'Released','A Tall Tale About Little People!','The Gnome-Mobile',24816,2.5165,6.3,'PwUQuZAGyd8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5132,_binary '\0','/lIY8ZTp6OJTAMfiorDGsPsJ5LT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061722',8,304127,'en','The Graduate','A disillusioned college graduate finds himself torn between his older lover and her daughter.','/8XaDpF0COV1MLsDirJMnxmYc1Wp.jpg','1967-12-21',107,'Released','This is Benjamin. He’s a little worried about his future.','The Graduate',37247,14.0839,7.631,'6cKafIqhEvk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5133,_binary '\0','/qMS3UI6FTvATktHR8Htnf1VioN0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061728',6.7,7549,'fr','Le Grand Restaurant','A great French restaurant\'s owner, Monsieur Septime, is thrust into intrigue and crime, when one of his famous guests disappears.','/gTr2HfSlRpKf4KtJYyIQwNLADGm.jpg','1966-09-09',82,'Released',NULL,'The Restaurant',19548,2.7605,6.765,'n2AyN8o41uw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5134,_binary '\0','/oQuKvlANoSH2BEwFQrQJ0PhSsPd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061733',4.8,1326,'en','The Gruesome Twosome','A demented elderly woman has her mentally incompetent son kill and scalp various young women to use their hair for her wig shop while a persistent co-ed tries to link various killings on a local Florida college campus to them.','/akgVApkJXIF5LUXusj2VsoHuB3x.jpg','1967-08-28',72,'Released','Oh Yes... Our Wigs Are Made From Genuine Human Hair, And How!','The Gruesome Twosome',48885,0.8995,4.8,'YoE4fr9Ah0o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5135,_binary '\0','/yTKXKR9quKkH8N8szLjWLJ6TLBy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061735',7.8,53254,'en','Guess Who\'s Coming to Dinner','A couple\'s attitudes are challenged when their daughter brings home a fiancé who is black.','/fkHeYWahNbhxhuLefaAg553lYo5.jpg','1967-12-11',108,'Released','A love story of today.','Guess Who\'s Coming to Dinner',1879,5.408,7.6,'Rg1pnX3nYc8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5136,_binary '\0','/bFQGD6kDtfq3qDZCSbtInwZOovA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061736',6.6,3245,'en','A Guide for the Married Man','A man gives his friend a series of lessons on how to cheat on one\'s wife without being caught.','/gAuFxWQwD74Z2huac9fkE3lCvhu.jpg','1967-05-25',89,'Released','Fourteen Famous Swingers give you the do\'s and don\'t\'s for the man with the roving eye and the urge to stray!','A Guide for the Married Man',4932,2.7616,6,'DqZvHBRDM0g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5137,_binary '\0','/z1mGshfVVUNyjeLaqSzO56ROGk6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061747',7,48976,'en','Hang \'em High','Marshall Jed Cooper survives a hanging, vowing revenge on the lynch mob that left him dangling. To carry out his oath for vengeance, he returns to his former job as a lawman. Before long, he\'s caught up with the nine men on his hit list and starts dispensing his own brand of Wild West justice.','/gFvRKgCAa1MKlcAKZfoDNdR2dgy.jpg','1968-04-12',115,'Released','The hanging was the best show in town. But they made two mistakes. They hung the wrong man and they didn\'t finish the job!','Hang \'em High',4929,7.5449,6.865,'FtxTu-NTebg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5138,_binary '\0','/fbijheDiKwi9miQVMQSkPlkJMrA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061749',6.5,2712,'en','The Happiest Millionaire','A happy and unbelievably lucky young Irish immigrant, John Lawless, lands a job as the butler of an unconventional millionaire, Biddle. His daughter, Cordelia Drexel Biddle, tires of the unusual antics of her father--especially since the nice young men around town all fear him. Wouldn\'t you fear a father-in-law that keeps alligators for pets and teaches boxing at his daily Bible classes?','/xPePeB56IdkQOwMz8niiFhePOsq.jpg','1967-11-30',169,'Released','It\'s the happiest musical of the year!','The Happiest Millionaire',25445,2.8134,6.9,'KhxZC_o5QKo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5139,_binary '\0','/xC8gdQutqAOmIp048c5reM986jB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061752',7.2,2487,'es','Hasta el viento tiene miedo','A group of college students, led by Claudia, decide to investigate a local tower that has figured prominently in disturbing reoccurring dreams Claudia has been having. They are suspended from school for their antics, but Claudia learns from one of the female staff members that the person in the dream is a student who killed herself years before and that the headmistress has seen her ghost.','/je6rko1r6YG7Bi3VKe8Wq7B3mjN.jpg','1968-05-30',88,'Released',NULL,'Even the Wind Is Afraid',68627,2.7074,7.9,'t7lR3C97sC0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5140,_binary '\0','/xDxPHGqcfI3iCJ9zDW1wsI67D6I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061758',5.2,3009,'en','Hells Angels on Wheels','At first gas station attendant Poet is happy when the rockers gang “Hell’s Angels” finally accepts him. But he’s shocked when he learns how brutal they are – not even murder is a taboo to them. He gets himself in trouble when the leader’s girlfriend falls in love with him – and he welcomes her approaches.','/8fj3UEgROOWRyyJEnCdo8nUsyFV.jpg','1967-06-01',95,'Released','The shattering true story of the Hell\'s Angels of Northern California! The violence...The hate...The way-out parties...Exactly as it happens!','Hells Angels on Wheels',33642,2.3233,5.3,'kVjBdwF6A_s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5141,_binary '\0','/77wDcjzDlKD2jBv6pkJg5s1O7LV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061759',2,1918,'en','The Hellcats','The brother and fiancee of a dead policeman infiltrate a female-led biker gang to uncover his murderer.','/xKavmw50IwxQIlEUKMcQRY3BhNC.jpg','1968-05-08',90,'Released','The cycle-gang gals... scratching... clawing any guy who gets in their way!','The Hellcats',31125,1.568,2.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5142,_binary '\0','/mDcYkutcGMlyfLlDhOIFpSWZeqk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061765',2.8,1687,'en','Hillbillys in a Haunted House','Country singers on their way to Nashville have car trouble, forcing them to stop at an old haunted mansion. Soon they realize that the house is not only haunted, but is also the headquarters of a ring of international spies after a top secret formula for rocket fuel.','/i2QSsv1DobFwD7V9pwvSzpvHPhd.jpg','1967-05-01',86,'Released','They\'ll scare your pants off!','Hillbillys in a Haunted House',99008,1.6477,2.8,'-p45zBlnQrA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5143,_binary '\0','/wNwE1HpHSTNZE4uIzOZ2AmYkOB1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061770',7.4,16038,'en','Hombre','John Russell, disdained by his \"respectable\" fellow stagecoach passengers because he was raised by Indians, becomes their only hope for survival when they are set upon by outlaws.','/puqgDLxdIZSnodDJ6Q0KxofOebo.jpg','1967-03-21',111,'Released','Hombre means man... Paul Newman is Hombre!','Hombre',27945,4.2189,7.1,'24ZKMRSutuM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5144,_binary '\0','/mRCh7Pq1i0jLuS54ojD0HZEc2wU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061780',6.7,3353,'en','The Honey Pot','In Venice, a millionaire hires an actor to help him prank three greedy exes into thinking he\'s dying and leaving his fortune to one of them.','/wMuxOddbhc9tESDKdQtrkzAMPQ6.jpg','1967-05-21',125,'Released','You are cordially invited to enjoy a perfectly elegant case of murder!','The Honey Pot',61105,2.3411,6.472,'2fFAv4oQ5V0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5145,_binary '\0','/7ncgCjyUgL9EsRfbHVjl25jDHQa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061781',7.3,13487,'cs','Hoří, má panenko','The firemen of a provincial Czechoslovakian town throw a ball in honor of the old chief\'s retirement. There will be music and dancing, a beauty pageant and a raffle. The whole town will be in attendance. However, the proceedings are dogged by difficulty at every step. Workplace injuries, stolen prizes, a shortage of pretty girls... and fire.','/yylEjPttmTDar0o92StlrO5ghmw.jpg','1967-12-15',73,'Released','A colorful comedy, in which people dance, steal and extinguish the fire.','The Firemen\'s Ball',38442,4.3107,7.1,'GfJI4LzLBUw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5146,_binary '\0','/5vpZlB1J2JoIJDYXQ59yNX1bdwQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061786',6.6,1892,'en','Hotel','This is the story of the clocklike movements of a giant, big city New Orleans hotel. The ambitious yet loyal manager wrestles with the round-the-clock drama of its guests. A brazen sneak thief, who nightly relieves the guests of their property, is chased through the underground passages of the hotel. The big business power play for control of the hotel and the VIP diplomat guest with a secret add to the excitement.','/fq83GS78zcvuQQ7KXsiPYFUKrDZ.jpg','1967-01-19',124,'Released','Warner Bros. unlocks all the doors of the sensation-filled best-seller!','Hotel',77553,2.0152,6.12,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5147,_binary '\0','/fS8FSSdv0MIwhVi5Haw9qT3FkFI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061787',6.6,5415,'en','Hour of the Gun','Marshal Wyatt Earp kills a couple of men of the Clanton-gang in a fight. In revenge Clanton\'s thugs kill the marshal\'s brother. Thus, Wyatt Earp starts to chase the killers together with his friend Doc Holliday.','/4sFnOXm9wvJIfWzfwIvTN1dZ8KE.jpg','1967-11-01',100,'Released','Wyatt Earp - hero with a badge or cold-blooded killer?','Hour of the Gun',31658,3.5525,6.5,'II7nX2zJ21c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5148,_binary '\0','/kWI4YmipuIfVhjt3Pe9I9xaqoXx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061789',5.5,2694,'en','How I Won the War','An inept British WWII commander leads his troops to a series of misadventures in North Africa and Europe.','/m3m6WC9JEKpCNht26OcFEDVU3V1.jpg','1967-10-18',109,'Released','\"There\'s been some marvelous advances in surgery, thanks to war!\"','How I Won the War',29048,2.266,5.6,'d8cK7Z78o8k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5149,_binary '\0','/zq1lFZLyhv9S8ugUImIQWoOaZMU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061791',7.2,5725,'en','How to Succeed in Business Without Really Trying','A young but bright former window cleaner rises to the top of his company by following the advice of a book about ruthless advancement in business.','/nxjgAm7fDMqUjbEbMKNYasEgAjB.jpg','1967-03-09',121,'Released','Nothing Succeeds Like \"Succeed\" ! !','How to Succeed in Business Without Really Trying',22682,2.5948,6.7,'NftdqRWxuh8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5150,_binary '\0','/6mdGxp4IQsggl8E0goF2NXQPubR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061796',5.9,1551,'en','Hurry Sundown','A ruthless Southern opportunist tries to buy his cousin\'s land, and when thwarted, brings several tragedies to the lives of his loved ones.','/lpZNG4WmNnKe451GR0wl8nRDqfn.jpg','1967-02-09',146,'Released','They are dynamite in love and in anger!','Hurry Sundown',118911,2.6406,6.4,'dKUOudmL-Is','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5151,_binary '\0','/3ZDKxS9OcaRhl48V1jj8BdOe1Kx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061802',7.5,1217,'de','Ich war neunzehn','A young soldier enters Germany with Soviet troops at the end of WWII, feeling like a stranger in his homeland. As he meets Germans, he grapples with his ambivalence, realizing he is both a victor and one of the vanquished. His inquisitive nature leads him to confront the atrocities and lies he encounters along the way.','/a7b6FBTiV11KZNq3tkBTZCbmJU1.jpg','1968-02-01',115,'Released',NULL,'I Was Nineteen',38768,1.8366,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5152,_binary '\0','/gQYsE1Zu89fbi3yUL4bubxoRjbh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061809',7.9,32094,'en','In Cold Blood','After a botched robbery results in the brutal murder of a rural family, two drifters elude police, in the end coming to terms with their own mortality and the repercussions of their vile atrocity.','/sPEvsif5Y70mfVvtU39iOyrVJdF.jpg','1967-12-15',134,'Released','The crime that shocked a nation.','In Cold Blood',18900,4.293,7.5,'vU_TY9ZQ48A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5153,_binary '\0','/3Nr0wKsuYKRyyI9Z3Po7GW4RD1g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061810',6.1,6559,'en','In Like Flint','Flint is again called out of retirement when his old boss finds that he seems to have missed 3 Minutes while golfing with the President. Flint finds that the President has been replaced by an actor (Flint\'s line [with a wistful look] is \"An Actor as President?\") Flint finds that a group of women have banded together to take over the world through subliminal brainwashing in beauty salons they own.','/fnZyHB7SdfZSlQJmw6PVhzsebIr.jpg','1967-03-15',114,'Released','FLINT\'S BACK In Action... In Danger... In the Virgin Islands... Where the Bad Guys... Are Girls!','In Like Flint',24130,2.7842,6.2,'y1Bxoar17FY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5154,_binary '\0','/xY5sgU09cOsvEAgJZaYo2aOZEFi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061811',7.9,92450,'en','In the Heat of the Night','African-American Philadelphia police detective Virgil Tibbs is arrested on suspicion of murder by Bill Gillespie, the racist police chief of tiny Sparta, Mississippi. After Tibbs proves not only his own innocence but that of another man, he joins forces with Gillespie to track down the real killer. Their investigation takes them through every social level of the town, with Tibbs making enemies as well as unlikely friends as he hunts for the truth.','/qFpfALhprXmOAbA5upTNupZw8rq.jpg','1967-08-02',109,'Released','They got a murder on their hands. They don’t know what to do with it.','In the Heat of the Night',10633,6.9511,7.7,'d15DhX_ltls','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5155,_binary '\0','/t78HhX62iZKSOXaTgXrAsiIwQf5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061814',7.6,5681,'en','The Incident','Two hoodlums terrorize the passengers of a late-night New York City subway train.','/ghXkcvpKPwOaViJ1V9SK8UyZ27g.jpg','1967-11-05',99,'Released','A Bold, Gritty, Terrifying Story Of Inner-City Terror','The Incident',66043,2.5523,7.409,'9pk8Fdvxrew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5156,_binary '\0','/biJ3xEAZSOuAlqiBu2rEDTgOJpd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061819',6.5,1752,'fr','Indomptable Angélique','Angelique goes in search of her husband Joffrey de Peyrac who did not die on the stake.','/eRoY4KaLZ5woEzmsdE1hKSfMMye.jpg','1967-10-21',95,'Released',NULL,'Untamable Angelique',44448,2.147,6.547,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5157,_binary '\0','/2iMhmLm8P9hBjUjpfxaqLM4ete4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061826',5.6,1748,'en','It!','After a warehouse fire, museum director Grove and assistant Pimm find everything destroyed, only one statue withstood the fire mysteriously undamaged. Suddenly Grove is lying dead on the ground, killed by the statue? Pimm finds out that the cursed statue has been created by Rabbi Loew in 16th century and will withstand every human attempt to destroy it. Pimm decides to use it to his own advantage.','/sBMFTviUDt6bm8LROkAWAvw1Ts5.jpg','1967-07-01',96,'Released','Bullets can\'t kill it! Fire can\'t burn it! Water can\'t drown it! How can we destroy IT before IT destroys us?','It!',31232,2.1545,6.2,'DA_kyTKud8k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5158,_binary '\0','/5Ao5rqanTKzjwZD145OHi1SKCoO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061834',6,4564,'sv','Jag är nyfiken - en film i gult','Lena, aged twenty, wants to know all she can about life and reality. She collects information on everyone and everything, storing her findings in an enormous archive. She experiments with relationships, political activism, and meditation. Meanwhile, the actors, director and crew are shown in a humorous parallel plot about the making of the film and their reactions to the story and each other. Nudity, explicit sex, and controversial politics kept this film from being shown in the US while its seizure by Customs was appealed.','/oE6AI3yXNLjpt8OqmnWZNQhmoqA.jpg','1967-03-10',122,'Released',NULL,'I Am Curious (Yellow)',42695,2.1966,5.7,'e83L05ptpAE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5159,_binary '\0','/yGv5u1PGozHmebSTQUsVKHatUbY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061842',7.9,2286,'hi','Jewel Thief','Vinay finds himself constantly mistaken for a look-alike jewel thief. To clear his name, he joins hands with the police to impersonate the thief and catch the real culprit. When the thief decides to counter by posing as Vinay, their true identities become thoroughly muddled.','/bDgXjS4bXj2RDj3KpIb023d7AAT.jpg','1967-10-27',186,'Released',NULL,'Jewel Thief',48922,1.047,6.7,'oOPNmD7TSTs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5160,_binary '\0','/eE6ysigsKowJfJHgoaSR4GOYJw6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061847',8.3,15862,'ja','上意討ち 拝領妻始末','The mother of a feudal lord\'s only heir is kidnapped by the lord. Her husband and his samurai father must decide whether to accept the unjust decision, or risk death to rescue her.','/bKySGFUTgsZyn5i7s5htMVy4Xd2.jpg','1967-05-27',121,'Released','In the end, we had no choice but to have it this way. We just took a roundabout path.','Samurai Rebellion',27031,3.1772,8.258,'GTkERWlcJB0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5161,_binary '\0','/3sbmRuIpYEH5dMvec4z4JxKQHoj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061852',7.6,215627,'en','The Jungle Book','The boy Mowgli makes his way to the man-village with Bagheera, the wise panther. Along the way he meets jazzy King Louie, the hypnotic snake Kaa and the lovable, happy-go-lucky bear Baloo, who teaches Mowgli \"The Bare Necessities\" of life and the true meaning of friendship.','/yN1kuupnPTLUprgfvC5WapgrxG4.jpg','1967-10-18',78,'Released','The Jungle is JUMPIN\'!','The Jungle Book',9325,15.3483,7.3,'JFsGn_JwzCc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5162,_binary '\0','/s2XTnH8zys9GLXWWvkCecPLuhu6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061855',7.9,1660,'sh','Кад будем мртав и бео','The story about Jimmy Barka, a young vagabond who works as a seasonal worker. Having been sacked from the job, his dreams are to become a singer. As most of the things in the Balkans happen, he is destined to failure.','/aKTsQd4wAEGnAvCdpQpBgKQLuXC.jpg','1967-12-27',79,'Released',NULL,'When I Am Dead and White',155992,0.9219,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5163,_binary '\0','/pk6jpt8SJi0eTeWfDHgVYgXoRLr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061856',5.2,6992,'ja','怪獣島の決戦 ゴジラの息子','Reporter Goro Maki stumbles upon scientists conducting weather experiments on Sollgel Island in the South Seas. He discovers the island is inhabited by giant mantis and a woman named Saeko who\'s been cast away since the death of her father. The pair soon find a helpless infant monster that Godzilla must adopt and learn to raise as one of his own.','/ueVb71Om2KaDcbeSLA8IHQtJ7oJ.jpg','1967-12-16',86,'Released','A great duel against a new monster by a parent-child combination!','Son of Godzilla',18627,3.262,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5164,_binary '\0','/aiGJ8b58euKRXaA9rjiS7V4SgLR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061868',5.5,3637,'ja','キングコングの逆襲','An adaptation of the Rankin/Bass cartoon, \"The King Kong Show\". King Kong is brought in by the evil Dr. Who to dig for Element X in a mine when the robot Mechani-Kong is unable to do the task. This leads to the machine and the real Kong engaging in a tremendous battle atop Tokyo Tower.','/1Z2fL5ycdVGs83i4iPdliDZVeVM.jpg','1967-07-22',104,'Released','The electronic monster Mechani-Kong boldly challenges the ruler of the South Seas, King Kong!!','King Kong Escapes',39276,3.2938,6.1,'vSks5ahjNj0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5165,_binary '\0','/ncNNm6gbs833dnlU8nY1AZY1rhu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061876',7.5,1849,'ru','Комиссар','Klavdia Vavilova, a Red Army cavalry commissar, is waylaid by an unexpected pregnancy. She stays with a Jewish family to give birth and is softened somewhat by the experience of family life.','/dpCKri2vdKDLkGEFLTOZNrD4bwv.jpg','1967-06-06',110,'Released',NULL,'The Commissar',71336,1.6255,6.488,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5166,_binary '\0','/eBX1etPQLrvOeJb9YQodwQzVKUf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061882',7.2,11277,'ja','殺しの烙印','After botching his latest assignment, a third-ranked Japanese hit man becomes the target of another assassin.','/asiSCq1SFrCV4gy7PJzw8c3m0yL.jpg','1967-06-15',91,'Released',NULL,'Branded to Kill',17905,2.6927,7.2,'n_-Onsz_YQE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5167,_binary '\0','/e9MlueNC7UM8pkxHDs1IKaoLZtn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061883',7.1,1416,'ru','Короткие встречи','Country girl Nadia moves to the city and becomes a maid in Valya\'s apartment. Valya, who is a member of the local District Committee, does not know that Nadia fell in love with her currently absent husband, a geologist named Maksim, when he had visited Nadia\'s village during a recent expedition.','/cwzvlpICOAq7xrJQvNMDLyplSag.jpg','1967-12-13',96,'Released',NULL,'Brief Encounters',83440,1.367,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5168,_binary '\0','/AiS4U9z62d4awuoJLXqP5xMDT0b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061893',6.1,1441,'en','The Last Challenge','An upstart outlaw baits a legendary gunslinger, now a marshal in love with a saloon keeper.','/DUeh0W111OtnOD83916AsdkAH1.jpg','1967-06-25',105,'Released','Killer VS Killer','The Last Challenge',105059,3.0041,6.3,'m3XQ3a5hXLU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5169,_binary '\0','/wL8kf5WXBeNWcacQfQpoHLA05SI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061912',7.3,2176,'sh','Ljubavni slucaj ili tragedija sluzbenice P.T.T.','After many adventures, a young female switchboard operator starts a love relationship with a serious young man. But while he\'s away on business, she gets lonely and succumbs to her colleague\'s passes.','/yMt9UFVIiTfX5PIZNHzA5uE1uKw.jpg','1967-09-22',69,'Released',NULL,'Love Affair, or the Case of the Missing Switchboard Operator',42696,1.6135,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5170,_binary '\0','/h1bSMU4fLgLvgMKV19xmealLdx2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061931',6.6,4027,'en','Mad Monster Party?','When Dr Frankenstein decides to retire from the monster-making business, he calls an international roster of monsters to a creepy convention to elect his successor. Everyone is there including Dracula, The Werewolf, The Creature, Dr Jekyll & Mr Hyde and many more. But Frankenstein\'s title is not all that is at stake. The famous doctor has also discovered the secret of total destruction that must not fall into the wrong hands!','/6DsTP8PSrOPxlO1926sFZF6VPd0.jpg','1967-03-08',95,'Released','It\'s the silliest party of the year...and you\'re all invited!','Mad Monster Party?',17278,2.7727,6.5,'-5fe7D14Jp8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5171,_binary '\0','/NHuM9aazjbtewxp7K8n89qrSzm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061937',6.1,8561,'en','Magical Mystery Tour','While on a coach tour, The Beatles and a few dozen friends experience strange happenings caused by magicians.','/uJSqSXCeK407l7t4zTXaYSJH0gL.jpg','1967-12-25',52,'Released','Let yourself go - The Beatles will come and take you away in Magical Mystery Tour.','Magical Mystery Tour',34038,2.1312,6.6,'jIDEZ_frJBs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5172,_binary '\0','/zVkewY6kYYiNB6gG5aMyJjoF6yJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061955',7.2,11705,'fr','La mariée était en noir','Julie Kohler is prevented from suicide by her mother. She leaves home with the intent to track down, charm and kill five men who do not know her. What is her goal? What is her purpose?','/iP7kuo3tMyR2hJfqBsssiPnEoik.jpg','1968-03-22',107,'Released','She was a bride when the violence happened... now she\'s a widow and it\'s going to happen again.','The Bride Wore Black',4191,3.8031,7.1,'9elbbTIYeJE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5173,_binary '\0','/cfkSg7Nun81mTpgyqOARg1oNz2f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061957',7.1,1230,'da','Martha','The oldest ship in the fleet, Martha, and her jolly crew, must race Harald and win, or it\'s the scrappers next.','/3VsgYv8ilUiiWHkhGWDIthY0ikk.jpg','1967-10-10',93,'Released','An old tub with a crew unlike any other','Martha',31704,1.4644,6.9,'mWvWTtzn6ks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5174,_binary '\0','/ukCJoQNk4U50YsdDlorGkwH8jdy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061971',7.8,1571,'ja','乱れ雲','A man is involved in a fatal car accident, and though he is blameless, his company transfers him to a remote branch in a small town. Before he leaves, he gives the man\'s widow a large sum of money that she uses to move back to her hometown.','/g2vXkiwEgkL3HkDyohqx8K8PFhZ.jpg','1967-11-18',108,'Released',NULL,'Two in the Shadow',126432,1.5994,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5175,_binary '\0','/97A6igREbbSY7LZtleu1J5Ys7Hl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061976',3.7,1541,'en','The Million Eyes of Sumuru','Sumuru is a beautiful but evil woman who plans world domination by having her sexy all-female army eliminate male leaders and replace them with her female agents.','/q4MBJan6wojQJTjO7FQYoTdH4j3.jpg','1967-05-05',80,'Released','She rules a palace of pleasure','The Million Eyes of Sumuru',37960,2.8047,4.3,'IYiPjzI0My4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5176,_binary '\0','/AbhiNyd1f3k2gXhPSMZ0ikThKit.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061994',5.8,2064,'it','La morte ha fatto l\'uovo','A love triangle develops between three people who run a high tech chicken farm. It involves Anna (who owns the farm), her husband Marco (who kills prostitutes in his spare time) and Gabriella (the very beautiful secretary). Marco continues to kill as jealousy becomes more prevalent on the farm.','/mTNQrflCUiyQSCFQegeVGeRPVi2.jpg','1968-01-09',89,'Released','See them tear each other apart. Then see what they do with the pieces.','Death Laid an Egg',126243,2.7424,5.7,'sKygzdMisaA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5177,_binary '\0','/uwF6l5rNtxwkgA2TuXoSJXJrchD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0061996',7.6,14294,'fr','Mouchette','A young girl living in the French countryside suffers constant indignities at the hand of alcoholism and her fellow man.','/cITZsSQ7VG122xQ0xAN3NHZF0OH.jpg','1967-03-28',81,'Released',NULL,'Mouchette',1561,3.4547,7.4,'j9HXcsE0gI8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5178,_binary '\0','/xUBfm1vfD7jboORRg71Vk98y1a5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062006',5.5,2688,'en','The Mummy\'s Shroud','Archaeologists discover the final resting place of a boy king, removing the remains to be exhibited in a museum. By disturbing the sarcophagus they unleash the forces of darkness. The Mummy has returned to discharge a violent retribution on the defilers as the curse that surrounds the tomb begins to come true. One by one the explorers are murdered until one of them discovers the ancient words that have the power to reduce the brutal killer to particles of dust.','/bHWIncz6asTzkBeQYO1KmxztS9v.jpg','1967-03-15',90,'Released','Beware the beat of the cloth-wrapped feet!','The Mummy\'s Shroud',39262,2.0489,5.4,'2TlObO0HIDI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5179,_binary '\0','/lMAwpUmNRpbkWv8Ibpie3ZOm938.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062022',6.1,1270,'de','Der Mönch mit der Peitsche','Police try to track down a hooded serial killer who murders his victims with a combination of acid and poison gas.','/rV5PWXg6nh6ZABJkeJnr4GxBAlY.jpg','1967-08-11',88,'Released',NULL,'The College Girl Murders',9632,2.0662,6.8,'xQkZdrlhnHI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5180,_binary '\0','/pdKQ87Zvacb3SqOkUTBa7oHHsb3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062032',5.2,1449,'de','Necronomicon - Geträumte Sünden','Lorna Green is a performer at a Lisbon nightclub who performs fictionalized acts that involve erotically charged sadomasochistic murders. As she begins to suffer violent, surreal nightmares, she starts to believe that she may be under mind control by a man who may be Satan incarnate.','/i4CtRLNX29DWgUGk9pjqUnQbjok.jpg','1968-04-19',84,'Released','Demon...or Woman? Meet Lorna... who turns men\'s wildest dreams into nightmares!','Succubus',28279,1.6852,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5181,_binary '\0','/1a78ZKkuPs4i8LQMb3yw7cfwZtd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062037',5.6,2876,'en','Night of the Big Heat','While mainland Britain shivers in deepest winter, the northern island of Fara bakes in the nineties, and the boys at the Met station have no more idea what is going on than the regulars at the Swan. Only a stand-offish visting scientist realizes space aliens are to blame.','/kqiFahl2iPSuTCW7DCfwKBzKG3f.jpg','1967-05-01',94,'Released','Searing Terror! Burning In Its Intensity!','Night of the Big Heat',54801,2.5424,5.333,'1OWsgPoyu0A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5182,_binary '\0','/vIeWi9GWFoaMj4WvdWSdraOzJwU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062038',7.2,9646,'en','The Night of the Generals','A German intelligence officer investigates a prostitute\'s killing in Warsaw during World War II. He lands on three major Nazi generals as suspects, two of whom are also involved in a plot to kill Adolf Hitler.','/qcr0rCbqij3dSDpBsAUTItEBMaC.jpg','1967-01-29',148,'Released','Patriotism has been known to have its vicious side.','The Night of the Generals',42700,4.0763,6.798,'U1AQshNJK5k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5183,_binary '\0','/fcwsUTdFFDOMtede2O7L4qRs21U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062041',7.7,1221,'ja','日本のいちばん長い日','Following the detonation of the atomic bombs on Hiroshima and Nagasaki, the Japanese military and the government clash over the demand from the Allies for unconditional surrender. Minister of the Army Anami leads the military officers who propose to fight on, even to the death of every Japanese citizen. Emperor Hirohito, however, joins with his ministers in asking the unthinkable, the peaceful surrender of Japan. When the military plots a coup to overthrow the Emperor\'s civilian government, Anami must face the choice between his desires and loyalty to his Emperor.','/1IfCvCMoE14B2DbLtcWz4bgkl7P.jpg','1967-08-03',157,'Released','The dramatic true story of the end of WWII.','Japan\'s Longest Day',47370,2.0401,7.3,'lSPbSWtHY0k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5184,_binary '\0','/8iljX8A83MxAycUaAjkRp6PxH2z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062060',7.9,2753,'tr','Ah Güzel İstanbul','The lovely Ayşe moves from her country village to Istanbul in the hope of becoming an actress. One day she meets Haşmet, a grumpy, world-weary street photographer. He takes it upon himself to cure Ayşe of what he sees as her blind optimism, but some of it begins to rub off on the old cynic.','/p6WZvO6YLt88rgPNvxU4vTeWzmX.jpg','1966-07-01',98,'Released',NULL,'Oh, Beautiful Istanbul',143729,1.2193,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5185,_binary '\0','/4mcCJeKbodLEwGd6LG2YxbbeYye.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062069',6.7,1785,'ja','犯された白衣',NULL,'/y2hxur2iF01DtYlKSV1v4fGFzrF.jpg','1967-03-01',56,'Released',NULL,'Violated Angels',55711,1.4042,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5186,_binary '\0','/4xPXmSUhMhDJxwjH6vob3vv6xUZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062078',3.7,1753,'it','O.K. Connery','The evil crime syndicate Thanatos is bent on taking over the world, using a magnetic wave generator that will cause all metal-based machinery to grind to a halt. However, the well-known British secret agent normally assigned to such tasks isn\'t available, so they engage his civilian brother, Neil, to help. Neil, played by Neil Connery, is a world-class plastic surgeon, hypnotist, and lip-reader, which turn out to be precisely the skills required for thwarting Thanatos.','/rcLDzxLlhSEl3a7F11Wdnm0GlMA.jpg','1967-04-20',104,'Released','Such close friends... such beautiful enemies...','Operation Kid Brother',98085,1.4328,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5187,_binary '\0','/lLE7SfvQx36daeAddes09WJrwNr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062080',6.9,2090,'it','Operazione San Gennaro','A pair of Americans want to perform the greatest robbery: the treasure of San Gennaro, in Napoli.','/wAj2GiU25Xh8zgkEG7VC5zMj6cq.jpg','1966-11-25',104,'Released','They planned a crime so perfect that only a miracle could stop it. And did.','The Treasure of San Gennaro',58404,1.6857,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5188,_binary '\0','/3i1N1ZVbbuPHtSCcXs4bRBFxxqv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062082',6.3,3291,'it','Se sei vivo spara','A Mexican outlaw known as \"The Stranger\" is part of a band of thieves that steal a cargo of gold from a stagecoach. However, the Americans in the band betray him, and shoot all the Mexicans. The Stranger is not completely dead though, and crawls his way out of his shallow grave, continuing his pursuit of the gold, and exacting a bloody vengeance.','/6aFamqGpI5T7sl9pVKBf7pipeV.jpg','1967-05-03',117,'Released','Terror from the depths of hell!','Django Kill... If You Live, Shoot!',61943,2.3668,5.9,'DauHqe4qNGk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5189,_binary '\0','/k0hmRQYWTxc3TvQ7QuvYt2wXZvA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062083',7.5,8590,'fr','Oscar','This film originated as a play in Paris. The story focuses on the one-day adventures of Bertrand Barnier played with a genius of French cinema, Louis de Funes. In the same morning he learns that his daughter is pregnant, an employee stole a large amount of money from his company, his maid is about to resign in order to marry a wealthy neighbor and his body builder is interested in marrying his daughter. The seemingly complicated story-line is full of comedy or errors and some of the most hilarious mime scenes of the French cinema.','/imsP4Vl1UpsLf27DPxX1atIubBB.jpg','1967-10-11',85,'Released',NULL,'Oscar',2798,1.9629,7.317,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5190,_binary '\0','/5NSTd8UFpLK57h8Ji5oYdgklKsg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062089',7.2,2556,'en','Our Mother\'s House','Seven children bury their mother and hide her death - until their long-lost father returns.','/yI1Aoy79FyWdqwekiV765lNjYh6.jpg','1967-09-14',105,'Released','The children\'s story that is not for children...','Our Mother\'s House',2516,3.0613,7.2,'Dp1MJ-VBSoo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5191,_binary '\0','/tLcKOR2HLrRzr6GFp7i78F12AQI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062092',6.7,1701,'fr','Le pacha','Six months before his retirement from the criminal police, inspector Joss finds his colleague Gouvion dead, in a poorly faked suicide attempt. Joss loses his temper, and investigates on his own, which leads him through the bas-fond of Paris...','/fDGHxgQ8nd9BwEa1Pzqk3VbEdzg.jpg','1968-03-14',90,'Released',NULL,'Pasha',55316,2.3797,6.748,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5192,_binary '\0','/nwi6iGfa8Tmn6r6OH27vu7YmpSe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062113',7.1,2234,'es','Peppermint frappé','Julián, a middle-aged single doctor, is reunited with Pablo, a childhood friend who has just married Elena, a beautiful young woman.','/vBoDIvqSU88rWLcpzNmnstc8FBV.jpg','1967-10-09',90,'Released',NULL,'Peppermint Frappé',105584,2.1279,6.598,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5193,_binary '\0','/fkIymGaZbJTuqTP9cPpRL3ZH7jj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062120',6.6,5098,'fr','Le Petit Baigneur','Louis-Philippe Fourchaume, another typical lead-role for French comedy superstar Louis de Funès, is the dictatorial CEO of a French company which designs and produces sail yachts, and fires in yet another tantrum his designer André Castagnier, not realizing that man is his only chance to land a vital contract with the Italian magnate Marcello Cacciaperotti. So he has to find him at his extremely rural birthplace in \'la France profonde\', which proves a torturous odyssey for the spoiled rich man; when he does get there his torment is far from over: the country bumpkin refuses to resume his slavish position now the shoe is on the other foot, so Fourchaume is dragged along in the boorish family life, and at times unable to control his temper, which may cost him more credit then he painstakingly builds up...','/scxiE4uHetFNXLsdSycWG7Elb2Y.jpg','1968-03-22',96,'Released',NULL,'The Little Bather',46655,2.766,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5194,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062133',6.7,1802,'en','The Plank','A slapstick comedy about two workmen delivering planks to a building site. This is done with music and a sort of \"wordless dialogue\" which consists of a few mumbled sounds to convey the appropriate emotion.','/2DKCXgNTp0rpglPxisa3Elcfqcs.jpg','1967-05-18',55,'Released','You\'ll splinter your sides laughing at this classic of all comedies','The Plank',18879,1.3205,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5195,_binary '\0','/pKX8G6IN8ZCRvKeHh6ctqoHZl0K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062136',7.8,30168,'fr','PlayTime','Clumsy Monsieur Hulot finds himself perplexed by the intimidating complexity of a gadget-filled Paris. He attempts to meet with a business contact but soon becomes lost. His roundabout journey parallels that of an American tourist, and as they weave through the inventive urban environment, they intermittently meet, developing an interest in one another. They eventually get together at a chaotic restaurant, along with several other quirky characters.','/kQOrS0DLUXYsqPMedM2G6NJcJBq.jpg','1967-12-13',115,'Released','An incomparable spectacle.','PlayTime',10227,5.3975,7.7,'zrYB8hgyq4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5196,_binary '\0','/sousyLLi3l14qho6gATKYX7pEyR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062138',7.2,27035,'en','Point Blank','After being double-crossed and left for dead, a mysterious man named Walker single-mindedly tries to retrieve the rather inconsequential sum of money that was stolen from him.','/xvZc8EvB7tNPHM9VdmNA19EiwqU.jpg','1967-08-30',92,'Released','There are two kinds of people in his up-tight world: his victims and his women. And sometimes you can\'t tell them apart.','Point Blank',26039,5.0891,7.1,'Z3CCNj_zMco','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5197,_binary '\0','/fnYbEpiAPDgW0up43ZMwMAdM0rO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062141',6.8,2315,'en','Poor Cow','Joy lives a life filled with bad choices. At a young age, she marries and has a child–with an abusive thief who quickly ends up incarcerated. Left alone, she takes up with the guy\'s mate, another thief, who seems to give her some happiness but who also ends up locked up. She then takes up with a series of seedy types who offer nothing but momentary pleasure–if that.','/w7ANsKsrbphsx21hGVRGZl1tydj.jpg','1967-12-05',101,'Released','When two arms close around her...She knows she\'s home. Two arms will do. Any two arms will do.','Poor Cow',76072,2.8978,6.382,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5198,_binary '\0','/zfP4WCWXtepBQjj5wvcfZAdp19X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062144',7,1668,'en','Portrait of Jason','Interview with Jason Holliday aka Aaron Payne. House-boy, would-be cabaret performer, and self-proclaimed hustler giving one man\'s gin-soaked, pill-popped view of what it was like to be black and gay in 1960s United States.','/w8Zu23Lc2OW4Z0ljMVCYppsCJMp.jpg','1967-09-29',108,'Released',NULL,'Portrait of Jason',83232,1.0041,6.6,'t-ehssx01b0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5199,_binary '\0','/eAjZlkh3yB0WlAY9A4SrIvucafr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062150',4.5,1494,'en','Slave Girls','Leader of a tribe of amazon women, Queen Kari, has vanquished a rival tribe and rules them with savage ruthlessness and cruel arrogance. A hunter stumbles onto the enclave and falls for one of the slaves, so unleashing the anger and envy of the possessive, sadistic Queen.','/i6onVgaC7pehJpAVGj0U5u6EbjC.jpg','1967-01-25',90,'Released','Beaten into submission… turned into slaves… man at the mercy of a Kingdom of Prehistoric Women!','Slave Girls',39308,2.4829,5,'DJLaNgRghHQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5200,_binary '\0','/r4nlR8H7SAfYiLDNug1M8ILzL1n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062151',6.3,3593,'it','Preparati la bara!','A mysterious gunfighter named Django is employed by a local crooked political boss as a hangman to execute innocent locals framed by the boss, who wants their land. What the boss doesn\'t know is that Django isn\'t hanging the men at all, just making it look like he is, and using the men he saves from the gallows to build up his own \"gang\" in order to take revenge on the boss, who, with Django\'s former best friend, caused the death of his wife years before.','/cJxVk479TiLTBvLXhMWWPcaNkRa.jpg','1968-01-27',92,'Released','Wanderer. Gunslinger. Executioner.','Django, Prepare a Coffin',46443,2.9899,6.309,'k--epuTbdcc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5201,_binary '\0','/5p4vOrzmAUoIXHjHojetud5tpWz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062153',6.8,3771,'en','The President\'s Analyst','At first, Dr. Sidney Schaefer feels honored and thrilled to be offered the job of the President\'s Analyst. But then the stress of the job and the paranoid spies that come with a sensitive government position get to him, and he runs away. Now spies from all over the world are after him, either to get him for their own side or to kill him and prevent someone else from getting him.','/q0bU82JwVZUFYnK7YvAKRTvQybV.jpg','1967-12-21',103,'Released','Only two people on earth want Sidney Schaefer alive. Sidney Schaefer. And the President of the United States.','The President\'s Analyst',24214,2.4043,5.9,'5XvaDL-laNA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5202,_binary '\0','/5SrmdQGA0CyrG80g9QSJlaA6KPw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062155',6.8,1479,'en','Privilege','Britain\'s biggest pop singer, Steven Shorter, receives unwavering adulation and possesses total control over his rabid fans, which includes nearly the entire population. Yet Shorter is not an autonomous performer -- he is little more than a puppet for the government, promoting whatever agenda they see fit. When a beautiful artist, Vanessa Ritchie, is commissioned to paint his portrait, she pushes Shorter to question his obedience to his manipulative handlers.','/oX3lnV77rYHibP9UEdrZzq3TJfW.jpg','1967-02-28',103,'Released','The Raw, Shocking Movie Of A Pop Singer Who Makes It Big!','Privilege',51856,1.3134,6.7,'v_dZEky0KAw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5203,_binary '\0','/3lBAZqT1GDqWUW7yxhiCPPCqKAn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062164',7.8,3707,'hu','A Pál utcai fiúk','In turn-of-the-century Budapest, teenage gangs the Paul Street Boys and the Red Shirts have been skirmishing over a vacant lot. When the Red Shirts decide to drive the Paul Street Boys out, they appoint small, sickly Nemescek to spy on their opponents.','/cg1ii1WpO8K6KWpGrhy2DKN7NBM.jpg','1969-04-03',110,'Released','The most extraordinary battle ever fought by the bravest army that ever had to be home for dinner.','The Boys of Paul Street',41064,2.0148,7.7,'TnyOLhsNcTE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5204,_binary '\0','/zqnDSm1Bjcqm69DiVo0sRKWCNCg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062168',7,12754,'en','Quatermass and the Pit','A mysterious artifact unearthed below a London Underground station proves to have powerful psychic effects on the people around.','/AvruSt4xRIbXO8gVxPzHupbf5A2.jpg','1967-11-09',97,'Released','World in panic! Cities in flames!','Quatermass and the Pit',26912,3.1549,6.671,'0Zoz9MN0-Y4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5205,_binary '\0','/dV4lDjkZ11OFlqIh1bLBE4o5ErP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062185',6.7,8905,'en','Reflections in a Golden Eye','Bizarre tale of sex, betrayal, and perversion at a military post.','/aB2q0EqCedMUlGdsulIqE1REf4a.jpg','1967-10-13',108,'Released','In the loosest sense he is her husband. . .and in the loosest way she is his wife!','Reflections in a Golden Eye',3547,2.8337,6.472,'aEYZs6Wz9uI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5206,_binary '\0','/zAasrPpmVnA6CVO0nCfuemAZdYj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062190',6.3,2981,'en','The Reluctant Astronaut','Roy Fleming is a small-town kiddie-ride operator who is deathly afraid of heights. After learning that his father has signed him up for the space program, Roy reluctantly heads for Houston, only to find out upon arriving that his job is as a janitor, not an astronaut. Anxious to live up to the expectations of his domineering father, Roy manages to keep up a facade of being an astronaut to his family and friends. When NASA decides to launch a layperson into space to prove the worthiness of a new automated spacecraft, Roy gets the chance to confront his fears.','/kSX2LJeoCUGObWmKnxMjmTVfTI2.jpg','1967-09-05',101,'Released','He\'s an Astro-Knott Turned Astronaut in the Maddest Mix Up in Space History!!','The Reluctant Astronaut',36855,1.4278,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5207,_binary '\0','/d9GaMfxDQ3FoZGoUPF2n87mpQOW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062207',6.9,2439,'en','Robbery','In this fictionalised account of the Great Train Robbery, career criminal Paul Clifton plans an audacious crime: the robbery of a mail train carrying millions in cash.','/jgxfBWr94Ykw8KM3Fg7EInr813U.jpg','1967-08-01',110,'Released','Who says crime doesn\'t pay? 3 Million pounds says it does!','Robbery',73208,2.244,6.6,'3c1eeA0qquc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5208,_binary '\0','/dXwq3b6Ps9mQzHnOKkct21EPv9P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062218',6.4,1796,'en','Rough Night in Jericho','The only business in the Wild West town of Jericho that corrupt sheriff Alex Flood doesn\'t control behind the scenes is the stagecoach owned by tough-willed widow Molly Lang and her right-hand man, Hickman. Former marshal Dolan, recently hired by Lang and Hickman as a driver, wants to stay out of the mess, but when he sees Flood\'s henchman Yarbrough assault Lang, he steps up to fight the corruption.','/2gmK6yhpwiestvvblxufMXqDsMa.jpg','1967-08-01',104,'Released','Who says they don\'t make westerns like they used to?','Rough Night in Jericho',64963,2.7325,6.695,'bQtUV5gKHQU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5209,_binary '\0','/z9Qw2zjI6GWqzYctpt2FwQblHFz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062228',7.9,4375,'pl','Sami swoi','Two quarreling peasant families, who were forced to leave their lands after the war, are settled by accident on two neighboring farms.','/vcjxn35i1H88ZyhwwUePiz4o4US.jpg','1967-09-15',81,'Released',NULL,'Our Folks',8211,0.8022,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5210,_binary '\0','/znLq5iyuMVvHwDdgZf6HyVUNjWB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062229',8,67239,'fr','Le Samouraï','After carrying out a flawlessly planned hit, Jef Costello, a contract killer with samurai instincts, finds himself caught between a persistent police investigator and a ruthless employer, and not even his armor of fedora and trench coat can protect him.','/5Fa6o5nfUPEatQ9b3OwEvdEdR7T.jpg','1967-10-25',105,'Released','His only friend was his gun!','Le Samouraï',5511,7.1703,7.8,'PTFV07ah4fY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5211,_binary '\0','/7EzSQdUEvPOZxBLvywlPuvoGC2P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062235',5.8,3219,'de','Die Schlangengrube und das Pendel','In the Olden Tymes, Count Regula is drawn and quartered for killing twelve virgins in his dungeon torture chamber. Thirty-five years later, he comes back to seek revenge on the daughter of his intended thirteenth victim and the son of his prosecutor in order to attain immortal life.','/aao5hdQbzy5RxdewrdSW3SFSHZG.jpg','1967-10-05',85,'Released','UNBELIEVABLE! Until You See It With Your Own Eyes!','The Torture Chamber of Dr. Sadism',12602,2.7565,6.4,'2F2StH8zmqk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5212,_binary '\0','/ubLIbSmnTu6UQgwvCU4WaKP7AqK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062259',3.7,1422,'en','She Freak','Jade is a waitress who leaves the greasy-diner business for the excitement of the carnival. She quickly discovers that she despises freaks and human oddities.','/7pb3Oe22CHcvoZwGaCq1ouQRobX.jpg','1967-05-03',83,'Released','In the Corridors of Every Woman\'s Soul There Lurks a...','She Freak',30935,1.111,3.6,'rKBP_li0UMU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5213,_binary '\0','/bmzxl2sL2TARJCeFagnXDsUFEpc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062262',6.4,7553,'en','The Shooting','Two miners agree to guide a mysterious woman, who has appeared in their camp from nowhere, to a nearby town; but soon, because of her erratic behavior, they begin to suspect that her true purpose is quite different.','/oaySRq49jlCtoYjhoR7IhSga6Vm.jpg','1966-06-02',82,'Released','Suspenseful desert pursuit in the “High Noon” tradition','The Shooting',42701,2.5238,6.243,'5updNaVyvBU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5214,_binary '\0','/xpSWNsdbf1tMs0Mly8CnSD8mTgh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062266',5.8,1971,'en','The Shuttered Room','In a small island off the American coast, the Whateleys live in an old mill where a mysterious bloody being creates an atmosphere of horror. After her parents get killed by lightning, young Susannah is sent to New York by her aunt Agatha, who wants her to avoid the family curse. Years later Susannah, now married, persuades her husband to spend a holiday in the abandoned mill. Once on the island, Susannah and Mike soon find themselves exposed to the hostility of a gang of thugs led by Ethan, Susannah\'s brutal cousin.','/fyRqdjKyBzv23A5AclQFSe71leC.jpg','1967-06-27',99,'Released','There are some doors that should never be opened...','The Shuttered Room',93939,2.0891,6.1,'x_Zo0lcByNg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5215,_binary '\0','/cIBAsszLhD1tvE6GQ6FYLAPOS1s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062271',7.5,2002,'it','Signore e signori','An anthology presents three storylines, all set in the Italian town of Treviso: A husband pretends to be impotent as a cover for having an affair; a bank clerk abandons his wife for his mistress, but the rest of the town\'s husbands become jealous and unite to conspire against them; and local men all seduce a promiscuous young woman, but when her father eventually reveals that she is underage, they all face prosecution for statutory rape.','/9q3b1tVa4LO2Xx3JUcjThdV3b12.jpg','1966-02-10',115,'Released',NULL,'The Birds, the Bees and the Italians',17974,1.5007,7.165,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5216,_binary '\0','/kSi5EnOCpbtevtPxwv8I9jP3hWD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062277',7.6,2926,'sr','Skupljaci perja','The protagonist, Bora, is a charming but mean-spirited gypsy, while his older wife, Lence, is submissive. Bora is in love with the younger Tisa, who is being offered in marriage by her father. The two get themselves in trouble and eventually have to flee. Tisa rejects her husband and she and Bora get married in the church, and their adventures continue.','/zSegXDenrymOkEnCn5kb40HMtnH.jpg','1967-03-27',94,'Released',NULL,'I Even Met Happy Gypsies',59088,2.2877,7.077,'u3MH8hAs_Dg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5217,_binary '\0','/A2xkHB7W61FspEybTneoPjwAjI5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062292',6.2,2749,'en','The Sorcerers','An aging hypnotist creates a device that allows the user to control the mind of another person, but his wife abuses its power by manipulating a younger man to commit evil acts.','/nDzpHpsnbJbyj7jMlxH5m7TUokT.jpg','1967-06-25',86,'Released','Boris Karloff He Turns Them On…He Turns Them Off…to live…love…die or KILL!','The Sorcerers',73203,1.4072,6.2,'sUsxDjjKocg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5218,_binary '\0','/4N1ppAie727z3w3Vr8R3YKVtx1g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062301',6.6,5285,'en','The St. Valentine\'s Day Massacre','Chicago February 14th 1929. Al Capone finally establishes himself as the city\'s boss of organised crime. In a north-side garage his hoods, dressed as policemen, surprise and mow down with machine-guns the key members of Bugs Moran\'s rival gang. The film traces the history of the incident, and the lives affected and in some cases ended by it.','/jNESk6Y5ViKmbOHPocKkatGbNb5.jpg','1967-06-30',100,'Released','The shocking truth about events leading up to one of the most violent days in American history!','The St. Valentine\'s Day Massacre',42702,3.5355,6.3,'RvR9H4Ymeyo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5219,_binary '\0','/5ekGWawVJRnVzVsOqQMF9UpkZGP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062310',7.1,3775,'it','Lo straniero','Meursault is a man who feels utterly isolated from everyone and everything around him. This alienation results in sudden, inexplicable bursts of violence, culminating in murder.','/q4SP2AyOyMAdWZhgWvDLZ9MY680.jpg','1967-10-14',104,'Released',NULL,'The Stranger',31332,2.013,6.8,'T5qeaxu4n3A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5220,_binary '\0','/nnNXFn3Beqw4HzKSCrbmIGKaT2s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062322',7.8,6831,'tr','Susuz Yaz','A scheming tobacco farmer sets out to ruin his competition by diverting the local water to his own property.','/uUuxr9C5TAQTfladuNR6F6soACf.jpg','1963-12-16',90,'Released',NULL,'Dry Summer',58897,2.2288,7.505,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5221,_binary '\0','/npq3QptZ6zf0zJZ4prfh6ZGE5y1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062323',7.3,1798,'ru','Свадьба в Малиновке','The movie takes place during Russia\'s civil war between the Reds (Bolsheviks) and the Whites (Mensheviks). Andrejka and Yarinka are a young betrothed couple in the village of Malinovka, caught between the battle lines. Gritsian is the leader of a Menshevik band who are planning to attack the village. Yarinka appeals to the local Bolshevik commander for his faction\'s help. The Bolsheviks quickly come up with a plan to save the village... but the plan requires Yarinka to enter into a pretend marriage with Gritsian.','/oxVGHc6slieNkMmXaShGk7LcJrw.jpg','1967-09-25',95,'Released',NULL,'Wedding in Malinovka',20879,1.4939,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5222,_binary '\0','/xCSzJsUmgd61nXjxoslbWOgOlbY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062352',7.3,4057,'pt','Terra em Transe','Eldorado, a fictitious country in America, is sparkling with the internal struggle for political power. In the eye of this social convulsion, the jaded journalist Paulo Martins opposes two equally corrupt political candidates: a pseudopopulist and a conservative. In this context, Paulo is torn between the madness of the elite and the blind submission of the masses. But, in this complex tropical reality, nothing really is what it seems to be.','/kuBU2eGzZyCBYxChYBUGbyTQ052.jpg','1967-05-02',108,'Released','The political game without marked cards','Entranced Earth',67062,1.8741,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5223,_binary '\0','/t8yqhwUuoM7e4plO0ZUtLsEtTky.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062360',4.6,2540,'en','They Came from Beyond Space','When meteors in a curious V-formation crash on a Cornwall field, an alien force possesses several scientists and infects bystanders with a deadly disease. Shielded from the meteor\'s influence by a metal plate in his head, Dr Curtis Temple discovers that an alien race on the moon seeks to use the manipulated geniuses for seemingly nefarious purposes. But, as he learns more about the invaders, they may not be as evil as initially thought.','/dJURpYgHWtsxNpIUOi9syHSoEgF.jpg','1967-05-01',85,'Released','Conquerors from a Dying World Invade Earth!','They Came from Beyond Space',35668,1.9373,5.2,'FwPLMNDVe4M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5224,_binary '\0','/ufekY2p0zR41eAeKDrqpmylDa6K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062362',6.9,7740,'en','Thoroughly Modern Millie','Millie Dillmount, a fearless young lady fresh from Salina, Kansas, determined to experience Life, sets out to see the world in the rip-roaring Twenties. With high spirits and wearing one of those new high hemlines, she arrives in New York to test the \"modern\" ideas she had been reading about back in Kansas: \"I\'ve taken the girl out of Kansas. Now I have to take Kansas out of the girl!\"','/ce8rBGFR0naGsp6mKy9CNKn9iSa.jpg','1967-03-22',152,'Released','Julie as you love her... in the happiest motion picture hit of the year!','Thoroughly Modern Millie',32489,2.964,6.8,'jdtjq7fzlU8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5225,_binary '\0','/gtfIjT2D6f3WYQqyUZcZ0xHDTyF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062373',5.4,1267,'en','A Time for Killing','During the Civil War, Confederate soldiers escape from a Union prison and head for the Mexican border. Along the way, they kill a Union courier bearing the news that the war is over. Keeping the message a secret, the captain has his men go on and they soon find themselves in a battle with the Union search party who also is unaware of the war\'s end.','/7xIfi6De5aavf1nuHEbcKZ61jkV.jpg','1967-08-01',88,'Released','Two violent men... and a violated woman!','A Time for Killing',4949,3.6355,4.8,'K5cjHRZhT5o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5226,_binary '\0','/9Y5hD8cPFBHRvFbvRFYFXQKUn4X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062374',7.7,5854,'en','Titicut Follies','Employing methods of direct cinema–observation, limited stylization, and non-intervention–this stark look into the State Prison for the Criminally Insane in Bridgewater, Massachusetts shows its denizens, who were often kept in barren cells and infrequently bathed, forced to strip naked publicly, force feeding, and the indifference and bullying by many of the hospital\'s staff.','/hAJOSqWB4FeVV7yi0fRSYFoCwvM.jpg','1967-10-03',84,'Released','Don\'t turn your back on this film... if you value your mind or your life.','Titicut Follies',41212,2.0749,7.3,'FlKUYY9MYQM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5227,_binary '\0','/vUZbARc0xY3MjwZnZtybpqbAoK9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062376',7.6,22230,'en','To Sir, with Love','A British Guianese engineer starts a job as a high school teacher in London’s East End, where his uninterested and delinquent pupils are in desperate need of attention and care.','/xMaVwTfgETmPs5yp3lNK5SeWCtB.jpg','1967-06-14',105,'Released','Turned-on teens... and the teacher who had to tame them!','To Sir, with Love',25934,6.1337,7.4,'oMAjca-pgr4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5228,_binary '\0','/llFa51lyn3muKVe4ek7d0vJkr9z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062377',6.4,4034,'en','Tobruk','In September 1942, the German Afrika Korps under Rommel have successfully pushed the Allies back into Egypt. A counter-attack is planned, for which the fuel dumps at Tobruk are a critical impediment. In order to aid the attack, a group of British commandos and German Jews make their way undercover through 800 miles of desert, to destroy the fuel dumps starving the Germans of fuel.','/5QJNlZGLktDHFqrCtE8cBO6VnmE.jpg','1967-02-07',107,'Released',NULL,'Tobruk',25385,2.4173,6.419,'h3hcxQjfJJc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5229,_binary '\0','/hT5Zkm1s8E6duzUKdIZQ025Y071.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062380',6.5,3682,'en','Tony Rome','Tony Rome, a tough Miami PI living on a houseboat, is hired by a local millionaire to find jewelry stolen from his daughter, and in the process has several encounters with local hoods as well as the Miami Beach PD.','/5QQjTAxHBAY8RiHdeZcVZ3T0tVk.jpg','1967-11-10',110,'Released','The action is so fast... it\'s a wonder Tony Rome stays alive... and single!','Tony Rome',26204,1.8527,6.4,'d17ak2hF9ko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5230,_binary '\0','/4kBmeJFCqzCmvJ5aGFevc8ncIO7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062384',6.2,3972,'en','Torture Garden','A special sideshow torture exhibit has the power, according to showman Dr Diabolo, to warn people of foreseeable evil. One by one, skeptics stand before the Fate Atropos to preview the greed and violence hiding behind their respectable façades.','/9DkIKppS5D7s2dgCegKl4ApAuxa.jpg','1967-11-01',100,'Released','Do You Dare See What Dr. Diabolo Sees?','Torture Garden',41035,2.3184,6.2,'TCKdbfa6HOg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5231,_binary '\0','/tJ13ODQW6N8Bae4s4xYkjfP2uGB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062393',7.8,1408,'ru','Три тополя на Плющихе','A married woman fresh from the countryside meets a charming cab driver on her first day in Moscow. They spend the day together and their fondness for each other grows...','/pKgMohiu6dVujLwGg2GSjnW7HcH.jpg','1968-04-29',79,'Released',NULL,'Three Poplars on Plyuschikha Street',63293,1.3875,7.19,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5232,_binary '\0','/n59XVeuh9G8VHk0HhPg0eiQr3k8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062395',6.1,6020,'en','The Trip','After his wife leaves him, a disillusioned director dives into the drug scene, trying anything his friend suggests.','/tRX6gEJ4G1oFBDxEGdIhfogdjCN.jpg','1967-08-23',85,'Released','A Lovely Sort of Death','The Trip',22694,2.744,5.767,'HNsEYrhy5dE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5233,_binary '\0','/mAZqXy8Ssigm1owFtwC70nT2RcB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062407',7.3,15848,'en','Two for the Road','Architect Mark Wallace and his wife, Joanna, travel to France to meet with an affluent client. While there, they reflect on their first decade of marriage -- memories of when they first met, of courtship, and of road trips through the French countryside. As flirtation and playful quarreling turn to boredom with the banality of married life, the Wallaces struggle to rekindle their passion, while mutual infidelity threatens to tear them apart.','/f9GAaL5gXzSP8LhXJcAx8Remfy3.jpg','1967-04-27',112,'Released','They make something wonderful out of being alive!','Two for the Road',5767,5.6147,7.026,'7RWoUPQ218U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5234,_binary '\0','/m9PIU3qMtaAyUx1Hl7264OEWfsJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062411',4.8,1738,'ja','宇宙大怪獣ギララ','The spaceship AAB-Gamma is dispatched from FAFC headquarters in Japan to make a landing on the planet Mars and investigate reports of UFOs in the area. As they near the red planet, they encounter a mysterious UFO that coats the ship\'s hull with unusual spores. Taking one of the specimens back to earth, it soon develops and grows into a giant chicken-lizard-alien monster that tramples Japan.','/fY4LR4Q04BjPbaZ79XTpSB9NnOv.jpg','1967-03-25',89,'Released','Mankind threatened by a deadly nucleus from the vast void of space','The X from Outer Space',42712,1.5538,5.2,'Kxz85hXZEnk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5235,_binary '\0','/akccsezgPeKN2o12TMrBctgzBGM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062425',7.3,2786,'en','Up the Down Staircase','Sylvia, a novice schoolteacher, is hired to teach English in a high school, but she’s met with an apathetic faculty, a delinquent student body and an administration that drowns its staff in paperwork. The following days go from bad to worse as Sylvia struggles to reach her most troubled students.','/mF2JrUUsdzu6Fxchu7CnVv3morL.jpg','1967-06-28',124,'Released','Simple words that start a war: \"Good morning. My name is Miss Barrett. I am your Home Room teacher...\"','Up the Down Staircase',42713,2.7071,7.1,'ySSIPnY48Ac','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000');
INSERT INTO `movies` VALUES (5236,_binary '\0','/43kxj1gcewWJNlzqGmPkZXE3fek.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062430',6.1,11009,'en','Valley of the Dolls','Lured by their dreams of fame and fortune, three ambitious young women enter the world of show business and discover how easy it is to sink into a celebrity nightmare of ego, alcohol and pills — the beloved \"dolls.\"','/hQgsWkNTL8GJloJRzqonImIaIJb.jpg','1967-12-27',123,'Released','In the Valley of the Dolls, it\'s instant turn-on… dolls to put you to sleep at night, kick you awake in the morning, make life seem great – instant love, instant excitement, ultimate hell!','Valley of the Dolls',3055,4.4737,6,'EibsiYuaynw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5237,_binary '\0','/kNHhWlyS5ydDK2iYqNIHkqRkPuN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062445',7.4,2503,'fr','La Vingt-cinquième Heure','A Romanian peasant fights to get back to his family after he\'s imprisoned by the Nazis.The picture is based on real events. It includes Hungary\'s government in collaboration with the Nazis, the encroachment of Romania by Stalin\'s troopers, and other happenings.','/6dn74C4XXSU4bAigMdUEDjjM57T.jpg','1967-04-26',121,'Released','A Love Story That Rises Above the Tides of Battle!','The 25th Hour',66568,2.5499,7.6,'cARO3NQGjdE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5238,_binary '\0','/dNghsRsAvZa8R6fWsUd3TYRCZ77.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062446',5.2,1571,'fr','Le Viol du vampire','After a psychoanalyst unsuccessfully tries to convince four sisters that they are not 200 year old vampires, the Queen of the Vampires promulgates the cause of the Undead.','/aUVP3VSbAkbCFXihkQFj6PCBVWJ.jpg','1968-05-27',95,'Released',NULL,'The Rape of the Vampire',29790,1.8768,5.3,'oLTkv3zb8R0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5239,_binary '\0','/sNjRnpuMVSmavDnyWUiuTn6cY7T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062453',7.1,12083,'ru','Вий','A seminary student on monastery holiday kills an old witch in a remote village. The hag then transforms into a beautiful young woman whose dying wish is for him to watch over her wake for three nights. With terrors occurring and his faith waning, he reads prayers on the overnight watch and tries to survive the supernatural encounters.','/rgkp4X9C1NNobH8bq55zcMTQFCl.jpg','1967-11-27',76,'Released','The Soviet Union’s first horror film!','Viy',57230,3.733,6.9,'keuYSRXwcVg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5240,_binary '\0','/xYlmeKp0fIt45LvSp0tNQIhCeNI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062455',8.3,2234,'ru','Война и Мир 3: 1812 год','In 1812, as Napoleon\'s army invades Russia, Kutuzov asks Bolkonsky to join him as a staff officer, yet the prince requests a command in the field. Pierre sets out to watch the armies\' impending confrontation. As the Battle of Borodino rages, he volunteers to assist in an artillery battery. Part three of the four-part adaptation of Leo Tolstoy\'s 1869 novel.','/IoHDaPpoa344ggOqYJ1UI7sWhZ.jpg','1967-07-21',81,'Released',NULL,'War and Peace, Part III: The Year 1812',149467,2.1436,7.6,'3DqanxfecIA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5241,_binary '\0','/2KBrQ0DcbFkw9tPsQeX2MVXfyqU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062456',8.1,2091,'ru','Война и Мир 4: Пьер Безухов','As Moscow is set ablaze by the retreating Russians, the Rostovs flee their estate, taking wounded soldiers with them, and unbeknownst to them, also Andrei. Pierre, dressed as a peasant, tries to assassinate Napoleon but is taken prisoner. As the French are forced to retreat, he\'s marched for months with the Grande Armée, until being freed by a raiding party. Part four of the four-part adaptation of Leo Tolstoy\'s 1869 novel.','/cZsw2D6OMuoXjpPCae5wZ3Bv3YS.jpg','1967-11-04',96,'Released',NULL,'War and Peace, Part IV: Pierre Bezukhov',149468,1.834,7.5,'3DqanxfecIA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5242,_binary '\0','/jkOxEQ4iwjuuAoqUZ4F6uyyZuuE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062457',6.8,2606,'fr','Le Voleur','In turn-of-the-century Paris, Georges Randal is brought up by his wealthy uncle, who steals his inheritance. Georges hopes to marry his cousin Charlotte, but his uncle arranges for her to marry a rich neighbour. In retaliation, Georges steals the fiancé\'s family jewels, and enjoys the experience so much that he embarks upon a lifetime of burglary.','/tPEDn3u2q8q82kREjiGKmfA7rPm.jpg','1967-02-22',120,'Released','The light touch of the masters! Malle makes… Belmondo takes.','The Thief of Paris',55370,1.7557,6.733,'6KBztmDgSAk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5243,_binary '\0','/3PYjmY1OiOq2LQ8ZvvLxzwbqIq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062467',7.7,36902,'en','Wait Until Dark','After a flight back home, Sam Hendrix returns with a doll he innocently acquired along the way. As it turns out, the doll is actually stuffed with heroin, and a group of criminals led by the ruthless Roat has followed Hendrix back to his place to retrieve it. When Hendrix leaves for business, the crooks make their move -- and find his blind wife, Susy, alone in the apartment. Soon, a life-threatening game begins between Susy and the thugs.','/cNW3ewCB52KkxzSE47PcE5Bqvmr.jpg','1967-10-26',108,'Released','A blind woman plays a deadly game of survival.','Wait Until Dark',11206,4.7696,7.3,'WnDJ7tywTVI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5244,_binary '\0','/doc1yGmr2QvFFLniF6KpHNwhsKr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062472',6.8,12216,'en','The War Wagon','An ex-con seeks revenge on the man who put him in prison by planning a robbery of the latter\'s stagecoach, which is transporting gold. He enlists the help of a partner, who could be working for his nemesis.','/wGSv9mfHocleVwH4Q8d38SkwQP.jpg','1967-05-26',101,'Released','The War Wagon Rolls And The Screen Explodes!','The War Wagon',27277,4.5106,6.8,'RXYMUD8oUaY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5245,_binary '\0','/msgNsC9z7vtoCMuF7VDAi9BNjzq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062477',6.1,1847,'en','Waterhole #3','After a professional gambler kills a Confederate soldier, he finds a map pinpointing the location in the desert where stolen army gold bullion is buried. He plans to retrieve it, but others are searching for it too.','/avVCDiBjLrggNEkqEFZkOWAbz2L.jpg','1967-10-10',95,'Released','This is the West as it really was. ABSOLUTELY RIDICULOUS!','Waterhole #3',54011,2.1929,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5246,_binary '\0','/aNDgfwBrTGJuso6Yzvos51mzZBX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062479',6.2,4371,'en','The Way West','In the mid-19th century, Senator William J. Tadlock leads a group of settlers overland in a quest to start a new settlement in the Western US. Tadlock is a highly principled and demanding taskmaster who is as hard on himself as he is on those who have joined his wagon train. He clashes with one of the new settlers, Lije Evans, who doesn\'t quite appreciate Tadlock\'s ways. Along the way, the families must face death and heartbreak and a sampling of frontier justice when one of them accidentally kills a young Indian boy.','/cexs9SGcB9JGfBBO1mKeFS1dzc8.jpg','1967-05-24',122,'Released','Cracking Like a Whip From Here to Excitement!','The Way West',42703,3.1463,6.1,'3vlKvqRINMc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5247,_binary '\0','/beRcdPSD4cYcmMilMpsdrChpNGt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062480',6.9,16837,'fr','Week End','A supposedly idyllic weekend trip to the countryside turns into a never-ending nightmare of traffic jams, revolution, cannibalism and murder as French bourgeois society starts to collapse under the weight of its own consumer preoccupations.','/e9p8VdsAKXz1GoVXD36Lg5e3YKo.jpg','1967-12-29',104,'Released',NULL,'Weekend',8075,3.028,6.896,'dFJLuhVvBPM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5248,_binary '\0','/rKxxcGs85dk1RiH9xGeRh6XXisj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062482',5.8,1849,'it','Welcome to Hard Times','A sociopathic stranger all but destroys a small hardscrabble town but the \'mayor\' convinces its survivors to stay and rebuild.','/1Y59enKhkNUJ9P1IxaMcxbuq99q.jpg','1967-04-30',103,'Released','A town can be killed by a bullet...just like a man!','Welcome to Hard Times',118017,2.8314,5.3,'7KaRhEnle-I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5249,_binary '\0','/8RzpR3dx57RNW97RO2jzgEkLeB4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062490',7,1503,'en','Who\'s Minding the Mint?','A bumbling government employee accidentally destroys a small fortune and decides to break into the US Mint to replace it, but before long everyone wants a slice of the action - and the money.','/wg3BPrfZ5Kf4S08KkCi8IPhS03u.jpg','1967-09-26',97,'Released','With a cast of thousands - in hundreds, tens and singles!','Who\'s Minding the Mint?',43710,1.9246,7.1,'y2-D7-MOweY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5250,_binary '\0','/zREgb9rKU3wMNdczblQwl8cZ8vj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062502',5.8,2243,'en','Woman Times Seven','Seven mini-stories of adultery: a widow misbehaves at her husband\'s funeral, a wife turns to streetwalking for revenge, a prudish girl surprises, a neglected wife vies for her husband\'s attention, a fight over a dress, a death pact, and a detective revealed as a jealous husband\'s spy.','/eQMMWWZ86T9N7T2LBGRHain3jHq.jpg','1967-09-29',100,'Released','As Naughty As A Black Lace Nightgown!','Woman Times Seven',61041,2.9749,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5251,_binary '\0','/cpZAXIYA0lkZMpAt7d1MmH8ojNV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062512',6.8,128785,'en','You Only Live Twice','A mysterious spacecraft captures Russian and American space capsules and brings the two superpowers to the brink of war. James Bond investigates the case in Japan and comes face to face with his archenemy Blofeld.','/gIhS0VC7YzI8pj6zfS3KxsxV0dS.jpg','1967-06-13',117,'Released','...and \"twice\" is the only way to live!','You Only Live Twice',667,12.5827,6.59,'gMXuLObYidM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5252,_binary '\0','/zd7dvgFbbH52W5D6VasXZcp1dY5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062518',7,1531,'ja','座頭市牢破り','When a local gambling house kidnaps some peasants because they failed to pay their debts, a rival gambling house pays their debts and sets them free.','/ujszCOunFyY9OjYDRB5SaI2ZQyF.jpg','1967-08-12',96,'Released',NULL,'Zatoichi the Outlaw',54278,1.3675,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5253,_binary '\0','/w5IDXtifKntw0ajv2co7jFlTQDM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062622',8.3,792758,'en','2001: A Space Odyssey','Humanity finds a mysterious object buried beneath the lunar surface and sets off to find its origins with the help of HAL 9000, the world\'s most advanced super computer.','/ve72VxNqjGM69Uky4WTo2bK6rfq.jpg','1968-04-02',149,'Released','An epic drama of adventure and exploration.','2001: A Space Odyssey',62,26.7299,8.043,'F-CmZP-imSI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5254,_binary '\0','/f29Qla45bcVqH2CvPgMmL1NOhhG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062626',6.5,5083,'en','5 Card Stud','After a card shark is caught cheating, he is taken out and lynched by the drunkards he was playing against. Soon afterwards, the men who were in the lynch mob start being murdered, one after another; all by hanging.','/wCsPsveFq4IQTL3IGGJYu7NkmAd.jpg','1968-07-28',103,'Released','A card cheat was hung... then all hell broke loose!','5 Card Stud',4993,3.4342,6.276,'V5t3ZDWkmq4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5255,_binary '\0','/xGzFpi5odisamdjAD6R0xQVJ3sZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062636',6.8,1606,'en','Ad ogni costo','Professor James Anders is a seemingly mild-mannered teacher, an American working in Rio De Janeiro. Anders, bored with years of teaching, decides to put together a team to pull off a diamond heist during the Rio Carnival. Four international experts are brought together to carry out the robbery: a safe cracking expert, a master thief, a mechanical genius, and a playboy.','/o99F6fqGihBrfPS9CW6xDas34vI.jpg','1967-09-28',121,'Released','These men are in... for the crime of their lives.','Grand Slam',76851,1.4002,7.1,'Eb6hw30LDS8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5256,_binary '\0','/2ECyXUVZarITeOyY7NUeYQVftzT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062639',6.6,4965,'fr','Adieu l\'ami','After serving together in the French Foreign Legion, a mercenary and a doctor leave the service and go their separate ways. Later, they are reunited and become involved with a caper involving millions in a high-security safe. The two men become locked in during a holiday weekend as they attempt to crack the safe\'s combination.','/trAfixmmqlFEr4w2WvBNDVPgu5P.jpg','1968-08-14',115,'Released','The only one to help him is his enemy.','Farewell, Friend',4857,2.1807,6.343,'V29nw1vg2EI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5257,_binary '\0','/t5530JQQZZ5qqEKsKIukpdTr9ac.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062645',6,1732,'it','Al di là della legge','A thief takes the job as a town sheriff in order to rob a silver shipment before his ex-partner can grab it.','/pC1R4yNV37dju6cJmyVivroNJnk.jpg','1968-04-10',109,'Released',NULL,'Beyond the Law',12758,2.427,5.8,'zBxMQMvZUcQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5258,_binary '\0','/sajSC8wGGNecmmSSfTPoKlGosSq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062657',5.3,2616,'en','The Ambushers','When an experimental flying saucer crashes, secret agent Matt Helm has to bring back the secret weapons hidden on board.','/wplPG11BF4rxHamotqDeG4uIxaO.jpg','1967-12-22',102,'Released','Matt Helm rides again! ... with the Ambushers on his back, and some fun on the side!','The Ambushers',36775,2.7577,5.1,'dhfslHHicQM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5259,_binary '\0','/6R1gEWCgkQKtsxajg7Eaae56jap.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062659',6.2,1260,'it','Ammazzali tutti e torna solo','During the American Civil War, a Confederate prisoner, Clyde McKay, attempts to steal a box of gold from a Union prison camp. He is aided by a group of prisoners and a prison guard but he is double-crossed along the way.','/kQzzmAyWanSdsErGMYjxa3IwA8z.jpg','1968-12-31',100,'Released',NULL,'Kill Them All and Come Back Alone',130322,2.1402,6.2,'4eg-ux8-2vk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5260,_binary '\0','/sq7Q3jKNo2Z8byxWNOmK4k2OTvt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062671',6.9,3053,'en','The Anniversary','Mrs Taggart always celebrates her anniversary with her grown sons. It’s a tradition practised since the death of her husband and she is determined for it to continue. None of her three sons have dared to cross their ruthless domineering mother but this anniversary they intend to try. With cruel and brutal twists, the family get-together becomes a social nightmare beyond endurance.','/g5VFZLUhhqkJa5Qo0Wh3pxN7qkR.jpg','1968-02-07',95,'Released','The legendary actress as the most merciless mother of them all','The Anniversary',58293,1.7471,6.6,'HYT8GiD1sa4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5261,_binary '\0','/hLLxcj9zBqitqus2r8W7w7Lb7VK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062673',6,4332,'it','Lo sbarco di Anzio','American troops land unopposed on Italian beaches during World War II, but instead of pushing on to Rome, they dig in and the Germans fight back ferociously.','/yBRiZCpjqpLZhApdcmm6LEJlCUn.jpg','1968-07-24',117,'Released','...where all roads lead to Rome!','Anzio',35284,3.369,5.678,'pOcMOmEW6-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5262,_binary '\0','/ort14Ott2BvpfmTuhsMUVnSEsWd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062687',7.2,16166,'fr','Astérix et Cléopâtre','Popular animated hero Asterix and his faithful sidekick Obelix travel to ancient Egypt to help Cleopatra build a new summer home. Cleopatra and Julius Caesar have made a bet, with Caesar wagering the project cannot be completed in a few weeks time. With the help of a magic potion, Asterix comes to the rescue of the Queen of the Nile as Caesar and an angry architect plot against them.','/gNpKAmWFsCiWKKx39Ap8pF7EWQg.jpg','1968-12-19',72,'Released',NULL,'Asterix and Cleopatra',9929,6.4626,6.9,'KtlKwSJIRA4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5263,_binary '\0','/8DE0qc6ydiBsq4YTJXKd9T6uFUl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062690',6,1449,'pt','O Despertar da Besta','A psychiatrist experiments on four volunteers with LSD to examine \'60s drug culture, soon unleashing an expert in depravity.','/7ZckEOCKv8OPtphaSgCx8157R6B.jpg','1970-10-01',93,'Released','Coffin Joe\'s return in...','The Awakening of the Beast',91378,1.9132,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5264,_binary '\0','/fPFuTcXcxYR6odkHA7PW786ZWjV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062695',7.5,16747,'fr','Baisers volés','The third in a series of films featuring François Truffaut\'s alter-ego, Antoine Doinel, the story resumes with Antoine being discharged from military service. His sweetheart Christine\'s father lands Antoine a job as a security guard, which he promptly loses. Stumbling into a position assisting a private detective, Antoine falls for his employers\' seductive wife, Fabienne, and finds that he must choose between the older woman and Christine.','/5qHh1Vp2TOOX5IaTVt4wyT8OTnR.jpg','1968-09-04',90,'Released','Antoine knows what he wants to do ... his problem is doing it.','Stolen Kisses',255,6.3198,7.3,'nB3UyhrfyDU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5265,_binary '\0','/A3VVZs1aTuQkm8xrHlE8lGHwrjn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062706',6.6,1249,'it','Bandidos','Renowned gunman Richard Martin is traveling on a train, held up by Billy Kane, a former student of Martin\'s. Kane spares Martin, but only after shooting his hands. Years later, Martin meets an escaped convict, wrongly convicted for the train robbery. Martin trains his new student and both men seek out Billy Kane.','/lL6y17DDsiO0NCcfFhUqApY9Bb5.jpg','1967-10-15',94,'Released',NULL,'Bandidos',90015,1.6059,6.8,'ItRJNXrfoUU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5266,_binary '\0','/bMb7zmPQjhw6y5znIhowYH7vsiJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062708',6.5,6436,'en','Bandolero!','Posing as a hangman, Mace Bishop arrives in town with the intention of freeing a gang of outlaws, including his brother, from the gallows. Mace urges his younger brother to give up crime. The sheriff chases the brothers to Mexico. They join forces, however, against a group of Mexican bandits.','/vzBzyeE4XXOsWokyX8EWqcNCNbG.jpg','1968-06-01',106,'Released','There are \"Westerns\" and \"Westerns\". Every now and then comes a NEW kind of Western. This is \"BANDOLERO!\".','Bandolero!',41857,3.6061,6.6,'3XwfwGp1kZk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5267,_binary '\0','/gY8essk1UcNZMK3VRkPpdaUQLDQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062711',5.9,41266,'en','Barbarella','In the far future, a highly sexual woman is tasked with finding and stopping the evil Durand-Durand. Along the way she encounters various unusual people.','/facTz5BZz4AkJal1FWgjYciekih.jpg','1968-10-10',98,'Released','See Barbarella do her thing!','Barbarella',8069,7.169,6,'ZKakq5NgoxA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5268,_binary '\0','/v2NFZfpBLiOqfPFpZ0YGS6qiJp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062713',6.6,2759,'en','La Bataille de San Sebastian','Leon Alastray is an outlaw who has been given sanctuary by Father John, whom he then escorts to the village of San Sebastian. The village is deserted, with its cowardly residents hiding in the hills from Indians, who regularly attack the village and steal all their supplies. When Father John is murdered, the villagers mistakenly think the outlaw is the priest. Alastray at first tells them he is not a priest, but they don\'t believe it, and an apparent miracle seems to prove they are correct. Eventually, he assists them in regaining their confidence and defending themselves.','/2vxVQVdYD25o7oAdp7HQBDZ5Y6K.jpg','1967-04-26',111,'Released','The epic of a town that became an army','Guns for San Sebastian',67659,3.1657,7.032,'RVI2uzs3lJU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5269,_binary '\0','/ylOk9eD57uChXuaXzCrsZtYvyCz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062728',6.8,4269,'fr','Les Biches','A bored bisexual millionaire picks up a young destitute street artist and whisks her away to her villa in Saint Tropez. They meet a dashing local architect and both fall for him, setting in motion a ménage à trois of deception and betrayal.','/aso44GAzBFgw7q4FtbHVHbvJxos.jpg','1968-03-22',95,'Released','A sensual triangle!','Les Biches',1787,1.6912,6.056,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5270,_binary '\0','/9u70x2AswYyAZ9JVh5eyvLePXhY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062732',6.4,1391,'en','The Birthday Party','Based on Harold Pinter\'s enigmatic play about a boarder in a British seaside dwelling who is visited by two strangers. They torment him verbally, ask him idiotic unanswerable questions, force him to sit down and stand up, and give him a \"party\". Then, eventually, they take him away, a tongue-tied idiot. The trivial becomes the terrible, and with it a certain wonder, a certain pity.','/qgPV2nIX4i7pmoUF3ds6PBjBrhB.jpg','1968-12-09',123,'Released',NULL,'The Birthday Party',121052,2.0161,6.523,'4evKVvaE4N0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5271,_binary '\0','/4bAsuQeYcLbUOzxXe407yEJQoF7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062737',6.8,7553,'en','Blackbeard\'s Ghost','The eponymous wraith returns to Earth to aid his descendant, elderly Emily Stowecroft. The villains want to kick Emily and her friends out of their group home so that they can build a crooked casino. Good guy Steve Walker gets caught in the middle of the squabble after evoking Blackbeard\'s ghost.','/bEMEjagTsdkUi7Jzxe0lQsquD7J.jpg','1968-02-08',106,'Released','He\'s out\'a sight...literally!','Blackbeard\'s Ghost',16249,3.8508,6.727,'0pgOSllKF_0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5272,_binary '\0','/996nP2LR4FV8yxwTAZedfXwBZqB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062741',4.3,1715,'en','The Blood of Fu Manchu','In his remote jungle hideout, the evil Fu Manchu and his sadistic daughter Lin Tang have discovered a deadly venom that affects only men. Using mind control Fu Manchu recruits six women to become carriers of the \'kiss of death\' targeting key people of political influence. This will prevent them from interfering with his own ambition to spread his venomous death around the World\'s major cities in a plan to gain World domination.','/4nCcZ1MkF9EsNs5tQ74msUNXVul.jpg','1968-08-23',92,'Released',NULL,'The Blood of Fu Manchu',3483,2.4173,4.4,'JuRs9dO7Uh8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5273,_binary '\0','/elW1M4UjyEr6IqvXwPhpjOlHgHI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062751',5.5,1992,'en','Boom!','Secluding herself in an island mansion in the Mediterranean with her servants and nurses, the wealthy Flora \"Sissy\" Goforth prepares for her impending death -- and she isn\'t the only one who\'s waiting. Known for his attraction to the dying rich, poet Chris Flanders ingratiates himself with the wilting Sissy. Although her friend explains Flanders\' \"Angel of Death\" nature to her, Sissy embraces the vulture-like Flanders.','/fnZXyiICb8mJzXNMnnJnq6nQwEr.jpg','1968-05-26',113,'Released','Together they devour life','Boom!',85765,2.0679,5.9,'AlSPZZMQ-v4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5274,_binary '\0','/eOezHJhtwK0sFaOKmTI2IvC8cNn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062755',7,12138,'en','The Boston Strangler','Boston is being terrorized by a series of seemingly random murders of women. Based on the true story, the film follows the investigators path through several leads before introducing the Strangler as a character. It is seen almost exclusively from the point of view of the investigators who have very few clues to build a case upon.','/hIVMUQf80zT4PyTMmXA1LXUzmBF.jpg','1968-10-08',116,'Released','Why did 13 women willingly open their doors to the Boston Strangler?','The Boston Strangler',26690,3.5746,6.6,'wIx0Xv5BPok','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5275,_binary '\0','/azc8hiaT0sNAxNP1MSC591Oxod1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062759',8.2,18258,'ru','Бриллиантовая рука','A diamond smuggling operation goes wrong when an ordinary Soviet citizen becomes unwittingly involved, and the criminals are forced to court him to retrieve their diamonds.','/iwVRDsZAuJmulnPKeYxhezzpr9A.jpg','1969-04-28',94,'Released','A cinematographic novel in two parts from the life of smugglers','The Diamond Arm',20873,2.9404,7.733,'W6D-r1CU-VM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5276,_binary '\0','/nFQGvUVt6lLzlmjtQUvWIxN8CqS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062760',6,1364,'en','The Brotherhood','The son of a powerful Mafia don comes home from his army service in Vietnam and wants to lead his own life, but family tradition, intrigues and powerplays involving his older brother dictate otherwise, and he finds himself being slowly drawn back into that world.','/34m31EnWUL4AxP3M3VA24bJx6uu.jpg','1968-12-01',96,'Released','Honor. Loyalty. Betrayal.','The Brotherhood',53654,2.0336,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5277,_binary '\0','/glvwKs7zwGh6G3hoCYJexwEfPfT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062765',7.4,81867,'en','Bullitt','Senator Walter Chalmers is aiming to take down mob boss Pete Ross with the help of testimony from the criminal\'s hothead brother Johnny, who is in protective custody in San Francisco under the watch of police lieutenant Frank Bullitt. When a pair of mob hitmen enter the scene, Bullitt follows their trail through a maze of complications and double-crosses. This thriller includes one of the most famous car chases ever filmed.','/2ffzF1WmeXtH420fSUoCrecFvDA.jpg','1968-10-17',113,'Released','The word \'cop\' isn\'t written all over him—something more puzzling is.','Bullitt',916,8.6744,7.155,'2TKo_HOfKMI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5278,_binary '\0','/gUeKgchT04anxU73vE6hTLQF0gk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062767',6.8,2202,'en','Buona Sera, Mrs. Campbell','After the end of WWII, an Italian woman receives child support payments from three former US soldiers who all believe themselves to be the father of her daughter, Gia.','/wccUNceVo65LmtDaIXqXhKNghM.jpg','1968-10-23',108,'Released','Take someone you love to a nice, warm, funny picture about a nice, warm, unwed mother.','Buona Sera, Mrs. Campbell',32831,2.2613,6,'QqOOFiz7HVM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5279,_binary '\0','/5dwIarA5pfH8T38w0mSiaGDVPEs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062776',5.1,4201,'en','Candy','A high school girl encounters a variety of kookie characters and humorous sexual situations while searching for the meaning of life.','/ym2TGzBpEh8I5EzP6ur9DIRuegG.jpg','1968-12-17',124,'Released','She\'s only faithful to the book.','Candy',46498,6.8191,5.1,'k9tF0nNQg50','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5280,_binary '\0','/5BrsFB9dURqZ1Ihuz6g6fAOAiEe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062782',6.8,6067,'en','Carry On Up the Khyber','Sir Sidney Ruff-Diamond looks after the British outpost near the Khybar pass. Protected by the kilted Third Foot and Mouth regiment, you would think they were safe, but the Khazi of Kalabar has other ideas—he wants all the British dead. But his troops fear the \'skirted-devils, who are rumoured not to wear any underwear.','/onwpgb0KjgmKbclw3XUE2XgkZfM.jpg','1968-02-12',88,'Released','YOU\'RE DRAFTED . . . to enjoy the laughs in the Latest and Funniest','Carry On Up the Khyber',22937,2.1681,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5281,_binary '\0','/mzCLXcA61mbmlKx6gBNeeOidLnn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062790',6.6,4406,'en','The Charge of the Light Brigade','During the Crimean War between Britain and Russia in the 1850s, a British cavalry division, led by the overbearing Lord Cardigan, engages in an infamously reckless strategic debacle against a Russian artillery battery.','/ptEaZjVn6ilw4kYDrZz1gBaNhJL.jpg','1968-04-10',139,'Released','Theirs is not to reason why...','The Charge of the Light Brigade',42193,4.1423,6.206,'ZFIkxAQCIM0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5282,_binary '\0','/sURKVV4auOpRWaS6lRIdcTPtlee.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062794',6.9,7851,'en','Charly','An experiment on a simpleton turns him into a genius. When he discovers what has been done to him he struggles with whether or not what was done to him was right.','/uxGt80D4hxEEwGwdOJ5tdVvjXEC.jpg','1968-09-23',103,'Released','A love story that begins with an incredible experiment!','Charly',29146,1.8397,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5283,_binary '\0','/vOl8p3u3MKjACtpTn6CV3BB7HY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062803',7,55600,'en','Chitty Chitty Bang Bang','A hapless inventor finally finds success with a flying car, which a dictator from a foreign government sets out to take for himself.','/wJ62FzGeCAs6PjCIK1as6xzdIY5.jpg','1968-12-17',144,'Released','The most fantasmagorical musical entertainment in the history of everything!','Chitty Chitty Bang Bang',11708,5.9032,6.8,'CV75eP3_WF4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5284,_binary '\0','/n09tR1wlRbJ8Bh6Eqz77rI5PegO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062804',6.8,1750,'de','Chronik der Anna Magdalena Bach','The life and music of Johann Sebastian Bach as presented by his wife, Anna.','/bABKBHPge6UHlRbTkN1hgEiuOG5.jpg','1968-02-03',94,'Released',NULL,'Chronicle of Anna Magdalena Bach',95600,2.063,6.3,'gjD5815D7vg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5285,_binary '\0','/89TA0vmaupuM3denF9QDbeyGEPS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062808',4.2,1459,'en','Die sieben Männer der Sumuru','Sumuru, the beautiful leader of the all-female kingdom of Femina, plans to use her women to take over the world.','/2UoEJSCzNOzFbSAABlJgP1UG75W.jpg','1969-03-14',94,'Released','An action film of the extra class!','The Girl from Rio',42620,4.0218,4.8,'zPXjzZqTy4I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5286,_binary '\0','/xm2VoHMglT9ioEkVkJH3wRQwPjt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062819',5.4,1224,'it','Commandos','Sgt. Sullivan puts together a group of Italian-Americans into disguise as Italian soldiers in order to infiltrate a North African camp held by the Italians. After the soldiers have knifed the Italians in their beds, they find a hooker living at the camp. Sullivan\'s commandos are to hold this camp and its weaponry until an American battalion arrives, all the while these Italian-Americans pretend to be Italian soldiers, often hosting the enemy. Lt. Valli is a young, \"green,\" by-the-book officer who constantly argues with Sgt. Sullivan, who tells his superior that he has no idea what he is doing. One man on the base, probably a touch from Argento, is an entomologist who is needlessly killed. Things go terribly wrong after that.','/7Clnm9KtNWAQhj4QF6pX3a6Ddf0.jpg','1968-11-19',118,'Released','Seven men who stood between Rommel\'s Afrika Korps and ultimate victory','Commandos',89653,1.9442,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5287,_binary '\0','/hMw0qFWdHEFMU4YY0OoLvF4gRVJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062824',6.4,21154,'en','Coogan\'s Bluff','Coogan, an Arizona deputy sheriff goes to New York to pick up a prisoner. While escorting the prisoner to the airport, he escapes and Coogan heads into the city to recapture him.','/A0dObkaXai6q46sIMSRI1MCcN7E.jpg','1968-10-02',94,'Released','The man with no fear... takes on a killer with no pity... in a city with no heart.','Coogan\'s Bluff',26170,4.7568,6.3,'Ems0vabZwGo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5288,_binary '\0','/8AQkjqNtnYYZKa1ByCEA4sA2Y8G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062825',6.8,2281,'it','Corri uomo corri','The legendary Tomas Milian stars as Cuchillo, a knife-throwing thief on the run from murderous bandits, sadistic American agents, his hot-blooded fiancée and a sheriff turned bounty hunter, all of whom are gunning for a hidden fortune in gold that could finance the Mexican Revolution.','/5j8FLFM3n6SVSQvqPoEmZcyk2l2.jpg','1968-08-29',120,'Released',NULL,'Run, Man, Run',18928,2.1103,6.509,'3oI8DpGHewM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5289,_binary '\0','/5HvP81VzAVksY4hSNT2bKTukPnA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062827',5.9,3002,'en','Countdown','Desperate to land a man on the moon before Russia does, NASA hastily preps a would-be spaceman for a mission that would leave him alone in a lunar shelter for a year.','/dsGu8yNR6xyn1lTaiB6bBgqKVCQ.jpg','1967-08-20',101,'Released','The motion picture that puts a man on the moon and you follow him every terrifying second of the way.','Countdown',27441,1.6783,5.8,'duc9W9Bsffo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5290,_binary '\0','/6qf5CRCO8Nt13P5YY4HE8Fbvauk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062833',5.5,3668,'en','Curse of the Crimson Altar','When his brother disappears, a man visits the remote country house where he was last seen. While the host seems outwardly friendly and his niece more demonstrably so, there\'s a feeling of menace in the air with the overhanging legend of Lavinia Morley, the Black Witch of Greymarsh.','/y45LdkyTdZvihACTjNNeUZZbbHD.jpg','1968-12-01',87,'Released','Come face to face with naked fear on the altar of evil!','Curse of the Crimson Altar',28073,2.5439,5.2,'LOSZOVbnwRA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5291,_binary '\0','/ozW6egWkcplKWi00ghgKFrKjHE5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062844',5.8,1813,'en','Custer of the West','The story of U.S. Army commander George Armstrong Custer, a flamboyant hero of the Civil War who later fought and was exterminated with his entire command by warring Sioux and Cheyenne tribes at the battle of Little Big Horn in 1876.','/ha6x7zXvJrgHiaXu5bQBcDaS7QS.jpg','1967-11-09',143,'Released','From the fury and chaos of the Civil War to the glory days of the 7th Cavalry ...to the final earth-shaking charge at Little Big Horn!','Custer of the West',82379,3.0693,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5292,_binary '\0','/6Ed8jhhzHEuJGEG9vuKwR2ycgfJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062851',6.7,2156,'ja','大魔神','A giant stone statue comes to life to protect the residents of a small town against the depradations of an evil warlord.','/1SFtiK4m6qkLaVKbAHX5QuDDbkn.jpg','1966-04-17',84,'Released',NULL,'Daimajin',28719,1.6944,6.5,'HGxjbQUe9Dw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5293,_binary '\0','/5LHztkMJcNj9uBWKSziOV03RYEm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062859',6.2,1638,'en','A Dandy in Aspic','Double-agent Alexander Eberlin is assigned by the British to hunt out a Russian spy, known to them as Krasnevin. Only Eberlin knows that Krasnevin is none other than himself! Accompanying him on his mission is a ruthless partner, who gradually discovers his secret as Eberlin tries to maneuver himself out of a desperate situation.','/5MxaHR8EOtftUbhm1wqqdJIiUNS.jpg','1968-04-02',107,'Released','A Double Agent in Double Danger!','A Dandy in Aspic',84844,2.5102,6.9,'XAYuZ-F-GhI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5294,_binary '\0','/mi3MUh5iI7Ul55wuAP7aQZKA3ii.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062861',6.5,8186,'it','Diabolik','International man of mystery Diabolik and his sensuous lover Eva Kant pull off heist after heist, all while European cops led by Inspector Ginko and envious mobsters led by Ralph Valmont are closing in on them.','/ozU1Qgu3CqWg2MWz8God3P6PoF3.jpg','1968-01-24',104,'Released','Out for all he can take, seduce, or get away with...','Danger: Diabolik',2994,2.9464,6.337,'C0a6gxrN194','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5295,_binary '\0','/gHMzchjtEjfaVmVkUQem4gXZJM9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062863',6.8,4002,'en','Dark of the Sun','A band of mercenaries led by Captain Curry travel through war-torn Congo across deadly terrain, battling rival armies, to steal $50 million in uncut diamonds. But infighting, sadistic rebels and a time lock jeopardize everything.','/kywLiY28MJulKRXOuePV8IELpT0.jpg','1968-02-08',101,'Released','Brutes! Savages! Heroes! They\'re Mercenaries... They\'re Paid to do a Job!','Dark of the Sun',25553,2.8145,6.6,'Rj2CuIKPR5U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5296,_binary '\0','/a3UT5vKGoCmOTukXXK4ImolOr5K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062864',6.5,2036,'en','David Holzman\'s Diary','A young filmmaker decides to make a movie about his day-to-day activities in an attempt to understand himself and get his life back in order. A precursor to reality television and vlogs.','/6CeyRNT2jkVlpzTtQ4SJEicjobL.jpg','1967-10-09',74,'Released',NULL,'David Holzman\'s Diary',85535,1.4979,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5297,_binary '\0','/tw9QwVzIT5lNo1db96oIe5Lxqqy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062865',6.4,1785,'en','Day of the Evil Gun','Returning home after disappearing three years ago, former gunslinger Lorn Warfield finds that an Apache raiding party has kidnapped his wife and children. Though he has renounced violence, he now takes up his gun and joins forces with his neighbor, Owen Forbes. Complicating matters, Forbes is engaged to Warfield\'s wife, who believed her husband was dead. As they pursue the Apaches, the two men are joined by an Indian trader, Jimmy Noble.','/9SVu8XFPFQHEvuhSrAzf96gCVzo.jpg','1968-03-01',95,'Released','They had one enemy even more deadly than the Apaches... each other!','Day of the Evil Gun',27105,3.3248,6.207,'bDur30BJJKU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5298,_binary '\0','/4FOIEXuPFYgvJmFzwjjw8poilwF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062868',5.7,1441,'en','Deadfall','Cat burglar Henry Clarke and his accomplices the Moreaus attempt to steal diamonds from the chateau of millionaire Salinas.','/774TAysDKtW09jNAQwW3Smbdi6d.jpg','1968-09-11',120,'Released','Michael Caine plunges into the world of the adulterous... the treacherous... and the perverse!','Deadfall',69065,2.1069,5.4,'Li-Bqru76Wk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5299,_binary '\0','/nCJGyJ4VGsg6vZTBxTJCI9sgppO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062870',5.1,2360,'it','Marquis de Sade: Justine','Without a family, penniless and separated from her sister, a beautiful chaste woman will have to cope with an endless parade of villains, perverts and degenerates who will claim not only her treasured virtue but also her life.','/j6oZpGbGuEp7wAPXkwLu0AiD8ML.jpg','1969-04-03',124,'Released','An erotic fantasy horror from the tortured pen of The Marquis de Sade.','Marquis de Sade: Justine',72309,4.6783,5,'HD3JrJBi0xU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5300,_binary '\0','/8m7qOKlsdnxt4335vpFzpffuIVu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062873',7.7,14042,'fr','Les Demoiselles de Rochefort','In the seaside town of Rochefort, twin sisters Delphine and Solange dream of love and artistic fulfillment beyond their quiet lives. As sailors, artists, musicians, and chance visitors pass through town during a weekend fair, a web of near-misses and romantic longing brings ideal partners tantalizingly close—without their realizing it.','/jtxhyGaYhurH6KsjvP1jV3dDypz.jpg','1967-03-08',126,'Released','…They\'re singing and dancing in the streets.','The Young Girls of Rochefort',2433,5.5147,7.664,'vZFK8svwtxA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5301,_binary '\0','/lzQc6msV2agvM88Czv9dWHZwUvY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062883',6.5,4604,'en','The Detective','New York City Police detective Joe Leland investigates the grisly murder of Teddy Leikman, the gay son of a politically influential department store owner. While investigating, he discovers links to official corruption in NYC in this drama that delves into a world of sex and drugs, homophobia, homosexuality and bisexuality.','/sMUJzLhzFotnJdi7WA9fE9xv5Te.jpg','1968-05-28',114,'Released','An adult look at a police detective.','The Detective',42636,3.2662,5.9,'9odRuy4D-VA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5302,_binary '\0','/kb4pMEB8b54tXSnROhNrMFf63c5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062885',6.8,11761,'en','The Devil Rides Out','The powers of good are pitted against the forces of evil as the Duc de Richelieu wrestles with the charming but deadly Satanist, Mocata, for the soul of his friend. Mocata has the knowledge and the power to summon the forces of darkness and, as the Duc de Richelieu and his friends remain within the protected pentacle, they are subjected to ever-increasing horror until thundering hooves herald the arrival of the Angel of Death.','/p1AWO8PIMfT6XGHV8uaa8erencj.jpg','1968-07-20',96,'Released','The beauty of woman...The demon of darkness...The unholy of union.','The Devil Rides Out',39891,3.6185,6.6,'LCZnuo1vuWU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5303,_binary '\0','/wjZUj0TBqQVpAKRf3zu5pMGtsBt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062886',6.7,7057,'en','The Devil\'s Brigade','At the onset of World War II, American Lt. Col. Robert Frederick is put in charge of a unit called the 1st Special Service Force, composed of elite Canadian commandos and undisciplined American soldiers. With Maj. Alan Crown leading the Canadians and Maj. Cliff Bricker the acting head of the American contingent, there is initial tension -- but the team comes together when given a daunting mission that few would dare to attempt.','/kbcyQHD93FcPxUvKQai5oJ9tUtE.jpg','1968-05-15',130,'Released','What they did to each other was nothing compared to what they did to the enemy!','The Devil\'s Brigade',31938,3.5581,6.3,'xMee254zEFg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5304,_binary '\0','/5f2NnHhhvQgE6mHwNCPnoVQwiVv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062893',6.9,3135,'it','Dillinger è morto','A man decides to cook for himself and finds a revolver (which may have belonged to John Dillinger) hidden in his kitchen.','/4JykpUFcI2j0Vo2UCYazUmIN1Rh.jpg','1969-01-24',95,'Released',NULL,'Dillinger Is Dead',56693,2.0378,7.1,'0UQeDWwzDFE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5305,_binary '\0','/kxU3gDDG3lsxbZvaoibthOEVgeF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062898',5.4,1518,'en','Doctor Faustus','Faustus is a scholar at the University of Wittenberg when he earns his doctorate degree. His insatiable appetite for knowledge and power leads him to employ necromancy to conjure Mephistopheles out of hell. He bargains away his soul to Lucifer in exchange for living 24 years during which Mephistopheles will be his slave. Faustus signs the pact in his own blood and Mephistopheles reveals the works of the devil to Faustus.','/5jF0JpqgrnGBhrIe0tns1ZljChg.jpg','1967-10-10',93,'Released','The story of a scientist who sells his soul to the devil','Doctor Faustus',95404,1.319,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5306,_binary '\0','/nFRqKtNhPNsiqgL11sFZDeOsXUX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062900',7.3,1761,'sv','Dom kallar oss mods','A documentary film depicting a group of young boys from Stockholm which live on the outskirts of society. The film is the first part of a trilogy.','/430znVHk45xX5ze9w6FEPfhw01a.jpg','1968-03-25',100,'Released',NULL,'They Call Us Misfits',56500,0.8124,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5307,_binary '\0','/tRqbUkRSDpb7oKj1MWpWSQqzkSF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062907',7.8,1905,'ru','Доживем до понедельника','A respected history teacher, Ilya Semenovich Melnikov, decides to quit his job due to distressing rumors about a colleague who is in love with him. His final week is disrupted when a student\'s controversial essay on happiness sparks a classroom conflict. Melnikov\'s intervention in the situation ultimately causes him to reconsider his decision to resign.','/v8KACDBvRh7RnAxYc95w2aMT6nH.jpg','1968-07-02',106,'Released',NULL,'We\'ll Live Till Monday',109774,1.0629,7.524,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5308,_binary '\0','/3qouPzs9cD5VqYp3rH9B9Owdpdc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062909',6.5,9270,'en','Dracula Has Risen from the Grave','In the shadow of Castle Dracula, the Prince of Darkness is revived by blood trickling from the head-wound of an unconscious priest attempting exorcism. And once more fear and terror strikes Transylvania as the undead Prince of Darkness stalks the village of Keineneburg to ensnare victims and satisfy his evil thirst.','/yo7FPlWRAevH0Pz60MHwGodg1NG.jpg','1968-11-07',92,'Released','He lives! They die! Christopher Lee as the fanged undead.','Dracula Has Risen from the Grave',29778,3.5565,6.7,'9k7sl9ni-Lk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5309,_binary '\0','/rDEW58OCgER88Ijk7J23wlMRVcb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062925',7.3,2921,'hu','Egri csillagok','This romantic and grandiose historical film depicts the era of the constant incursions and heroic battles fought by the defenders of the castle of Eger, led by captain István Dobó, against the heavy odds of superior numbers through the lives and love of Bornemissza Gergely and Cecey Éva. Gergely is inaugurated as a fighter already at the age of 7, when he escapes the captivity of the half-eyed Turk, Jumurdzsak, with Vica and the war-booty. In thirty years\' time he becomes the first assistant of captain Dobó and the brain of the castle in the defence of Eger.','/sENhscK5vMkrsWvTUYkNECF8dse.jpg','1968-08-12',145,'Released',NULL,'Stars of Eger',41861,1.9238,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5310,_binary '\0','/wVpZAFqzcXKlHw3Dx85EpnG9vvW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062952',7.4,12920,'en','Faces','Middle-aged suburban husband Richard abruptly tells his wife, Maria, that he wants a divorce. As Richard takes up with a younger woman, Maria enjoys a night on the town with her friends and meets a younger man. As the couple and those around them confront a seemingly futile search for what they\'ve lost -- love, excitement, passion -- this classic American independent film explores themes of aging and alienation.','/qTkhxFQ0o6DEtTtPXkv4IA5M90J.jpg','1968-11-24',130,'Released','The acclaimed motion picture','Faces',753,2.7839,7.1,'l_53iJ6JF68','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5311,_binary '\0','/fv3Blpc6N7rdG1RP00Fsen31Y8d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062957',4.5,1425,'es','Malenka','A beautiful virgin inherits a castle, but when she arrives at it, she finds that the inhabitants include a strange nobleman and a bevy of beautiful women she suspects may be vampires.','/cLG4t7sQY16t4LBZb9hzuSYFxMO.jpg','1969-07-08',94,'Released',NULL,'Fangs of the Living Dead',28690,1.1772,4.4,'UPZOwWXzGNY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5312,_binary '\0','/tRyPuhThCFVWaE4JkPOBdFl5a5s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062974',6.1,4635,'en','Finian\'s Rainbow','An Irishman and his daughter arrive in the American South with a stolen pot of gold, hoping to make their fortune. Pursued by a leprechaun desperate to recover his treasure, they become entangled in a battle over land, love, and prejudice in Rainbow Valley—where the gold’s magic turns wishes, and lives, upside down.','/7vPJBLw9GL0FlJXXTgZqWnwMzK9.jpg','1968-10-09',145,'Released','Let yourself glow.','Finian\'s Rainbow',42622,2.5273,5.9,'9o9fbSl5F0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5313,_binary '\0','/1OGpHtpa58vmIOUyHVQJOSKjkJQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062975',6.8,4479,'en','Firecreek','A peace-loving, part-time sheriff in the small town of Firecreek must take a stand when a gang of vicious outlaws takes over his town.','/rqLtRLPsxHVahQkWGyFEK5aghYr.jpg','1968-01-24',104,'Released','JAMES STEWART -- HENRY FONDA MEET IN THE HEAT OF FIRECREEK','Firecreek',4934,2.4655,6.2,'CiAg-P62ptk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5314,_binary '\0','/9tg0OSfvyU4sZ0QXc8w0pk0ONpI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062977',6.7,1588,'en','The Fixer','Set in tsarist Russia around the turn of the century and based on a true story of a Russian Jewish peasant Yakov Bog who was wrongly imprisoned for a most unlikely crime - the “ritual murder” of a Gentile child in Kyiv. We witness the unrelenting detail of the peasant handyman\'s life in prison and see him gain in dignity as the efforts to humiliate him and make him confess fail.','/zJS5I0akpAaAuynNhyuMiLERKY2.jpg','1968-12-08',132,'Released','They accused him… They beat him… They condemned him… and after all that, they were more afraid of him than ever.','The Fixer',87267,1.6697,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5315,_binary '\0','/mwKPNi1YjShDcXegWIh9EPLkY9e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062979',5.6,2788,'en','Flesh','A heroin junkie works as a prostitute to support his habit and fund an abortion needed by the girlfriend of his lesbian wife. His seedy encounters with delusional and damaged clients, and dates with drag queens and hustlers are heavy on sex, drugs and decadence.','/o5XHzPi91uJbHeOpXqYumULcdwz.jpg','1968-12-16',89,'Released','Just an ordinary day in the life of a male hustler.','Flesh',4578,2.0523,5.6,'RLrHdYrQ_Kc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5316,_binary '\0','/rPsktMO9tDFWvEAKMQSj1K4Vbwh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062981',6.7,1240,'sv','Flickorna','As they tour Sweden in a theatrical production of \"Lysistrata\", performing to often uncomprehending audiences, three women find their own lives and marriages mirrored in Aristophanes’s play. Soon, onstage drama, offstage reality, and surrealist fantasies begin to collide.','/myTh2XqjesnL5Alt0st5lCUQeEy.jpg','1968-09-16',100,'Released',NULL,'The Girls',135337,1.3446,6,'vYjhQ37ffV4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5317,_binary '\0','/bmlr5Rj1ZHkezjm6f06vUXGTRI1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062990',6.5,1463,'en','The Fox','Jill Banford and Ellen March have built a good life together on a hardscrabble Canadian farm. Then handsome Paul Grenfell enters their isolated world, and sets friend against friend. But is Paul the real trouble between Jill and Ellen? Or has his presence merely awakened the unspoken, unexplored sexual tension that always existed between the women?','/jzme3QqBk2gbVBOwpffupF3y4Ip.jpg','1967-12-13',110,'Released','The Fox ... symbol of the male.','The Fox',74896,1.3669,6.2,'DYiU7hceyqw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5318,_binary '\0','/6VuGhV3iv3CHF2mTRDMa6fTu4Vn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062994',7.4,27715,'en','Funny Girl','The life of famed 1930s comedienne Fanny Brice, from her early days in the Jewish slums of New York, to the height of her career with the Ziegfeld Follies, as well as her marriage to the rakish gambler Nick Arnstein.','/ywjXHWUK0niM26UKy7DTCErWTFz.jpg','1968-09-19',155,'Released','People who see FUNNY GIRL are the luckiest people in the world!','Funny Girl',16085,4.7305,7.144,'qzOFC4XiqL0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5319,_binary '\0','/81CGkcAatbPGBrO3s3L3WlQy9WI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0062997',6,1289,'fr','Le Gai Savoir','While alone in an abandoned television studio, two militants, Emile Rousseau and Patricia Lumumba, have a discourse on language. Referring to spoken word as \"the enemy\"--the weapon used by the establishment to confuse liberation movements--the two deconstruct the meanings of sounds and images in an attempt to \"return to zero\" and truly experience the joy of learning.','/tEDA0zdeZQzyYO5mnlDElDWlOLO.jpg','1969-07-12',95,'Released',NULL,'Joy of Learning',51205,1.2943,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5320,_binary '\0','/vHa2SVUJVY7TSwTj84msHkdA3KG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063000',4.6,2169,'ja','ガメラ対宇宙怪獣バイラス','As alien invaders plot to conquer the Earth, two Boy Scouts steal a mini-submarine and discover Gamera in their midst. Transported to the alien\'s spaceship, the Scouts are menaced by the evil inhabitants, including Viras, a squid-like monster that grows to colossal size to battle Gamera.','/cVrmsX0O071tWBUQBtjSnIBFYk4.jpg','1968-03-20',81,'Released','Civilization is in chaos...','Gamera vs. Viras',34131,1.82,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5321,_binary '\0','/lVkPc19q3iymP98NKeeoAMFXry2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063005',6.8,9570,'fr','Le Gendarme se marie','The Saint-Tropez police launch a major offensive against dangerous drivers. Marechal Cruchot (Louis de Funès) relishes the assignment, which he pursues with a manic zeal. Cruchot is after an offending driver, who turns out to be Josépha (Claude Gensac), the widow of a highly regarded police colonel. When they meet, Cruchot falls instantly in love....','/hDQp4lp2wiUgUdPryIqUXUuvJbr.jpg','1968-10-30',90,'Released',NULL,'The Gendarme Gets Married',4729,4.7033,6.518,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5322,_binary '\0','/s20As5RvqGtTHXt4PgqUjoCxXr8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063010',7,2456,'it','Il giorno della civetta','Set in Sicily, this violent crime drama tells the tale of an Italian cop who heads to a small island town to look into the death of a construction supplier. Once there he is shocked by the influence the Mafia has over the people and even himself.','/4QnOjIUR58Yficc6fuJtrJFPKOJ.jpg','1968-02-17',108,'Released','What are \'friends\' for...? Why, for murder, terror, extortion, violence and other profitable enterprises!','The Day of the Owl',58658,2.7074,7.1,'xev8x9mu6Ho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5323,_binary '\0','/uhxg6es3h5R5kjaRSukjnhq7nSS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063013',5.3,3086,'en','The Girl on a Motorcycle','Newly-married Rebecca leaves her husband\'s Alsatian bed on her prized motorbike - symbol of freedom and escape - to visit her lover in Heidelberg. En route she indulges in psychedelic reveries as she relives her changing relationship with the two men.','/9h6X4oJaEqJsRMVcr03fHiTMdVY.jpg','1968-06-21',91,'Released','She\'s always naked under leather','The Girl on a Motorcycle',29722,2.3264,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5324,_binary '\0','/6HLHtth6BBD2PLtITHoHhCHWGQS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063023',8.6,6067,'bn','গুপী গাইন বাঘা বাইন','Goopy Gyne and Bagha Byne are banished from their respective villages for being bad musicians. However, with their skills, they succeed in pleasing the king of ghosts who grants them three boons. How will they succeed in preventing the war between Halla and Shundi which is looming large?','/7CtaNb9v7UAkx8eZ1tC1ODKbVse.jpg','1969-05-08',129,'Released',NULL,'Goopy Gyne Bagha Byne',135092,1.2051,7.556,'xVgXiC2hOkg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5325,_binary '\0','/ksGuopH0XgXLNHJMvoqZMl3lHTT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063032',7.7,20850,'it','Il grande silenzio','A mute gunslinger fights in the defense of a group of outlaws and a vengeful young widow, against a group of ruthless bounty hunters.','/3kpxS7SZMyYSXvhDnmxQXOOxiTM.jpg','1968-11-22',107,'Released','His voice was the silence of death!','The Great Silence',9028,4.3589,7.5,'nMrhQp35uUo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5326,_binary '\0','/iRvk7UzJyd6C6cQiaJymC35LGO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063035',5.6,14903,'en','The Green Berets','Col. Mike Kirby picks two teams of crack Green Berets for two missions in South Vietnam. The first is to strengthen a camp that is trying to be taken by the enemy. The second is to kidnap a North Vietnamese General.','/c5WG23iqf3RakGOTjZnBATbYM1f.jpg','1968-07-04',142,'Released','A special force in a special kind of hell!','The Green Berets',22377,4.5539,5.7,'zZOPXB-o4h4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5327,_binary '\0','/3vWJjyNagny3lkdht29H0XQ508H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063036',5.6,4647,'en','Greetings','Three friends in New York City discuss how to dodge the draft and Vietnam, JFK\'s assassination, voyeurism, computer dating, and everything else.','/saqtwYWMbIAOzWp4Nm8oGEzDUqU.jpg','1968-12-15',87,'Released','An Overground Protest Film!','Greetings',73604,2.042,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5328,_binary '\0','/3sj37BVB8BQ1vAmD24LY4aJnPuL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063049',6.4,7458,'en','Head','In this surrealistic and free-form follow-up to the Monkees\' television show, the band frolic their way through a series of musical set pieces and vignettes containing humor and anti-establishment social commentary.','/pvMy7sTqOEr7faJzDE5UD0zUiHA.jpg','1968-11-06',86,'Released','What is HEAD all about? Only John Brockman\'s shrink knows for sure!','Head',18193,2.5486,6.2,'a-5sKqR2zrg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5329,_binary '\0','/mDJd6YJJHKrSPB90bT70B4c9QQE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063050',7.6,5126,'en','The Heart Is a Lonely Hunter','Singer is a deaf-mute whose small world brings him in contact with a young girl, Mick, who cherishes a seemingly hopeless dream of becoming a concert pianist. At first hostile, Mick soon becomes friends with Singer, hoping to enlarge his small world. Three other central characters come to Singer for help also, each of them seeing in him a powerful force.','/vOznrQ5x8IAnsY0P3T7Jz9EEGP7.jpg','1968-07-31',123,'Released','... and from this man who could not speak or hear, the girl heard many things.','The Heart Is a Lonely Hunter',22176,2.7008,7.5,'hm-q_w0bYLc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5330,_binary '\0','/eACKasKgXboV8JTX3MwCXoTRdup.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063056',7.2,9987,'en','Hell in the Pacific','During World War II, a shot-down American pilot and a marooned Japanese navy captain find themselves stranded on the same small uninhabited island in the Pacific Ocean.','/kEiJRrDP6m0o96v7n2UMtad4sAF.jpg','1968-12-19',103,'Released','Out of violence, compassion. Out of suspicion, trust. Out of hell, hope.','Hell in the Pacific',31681,3.096,7,'pIFMT-ponTw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5331,_binary '\0','/orINCrlVi9W9Hdd4sbMV94clCFq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063060',6.5,7356,'en','Hellfighters','The adventures of oil well fire specialist Chance Buckman (based on real-life Red Adair), who extinguishes massive fires in oil fields around the world.','/qTGlUtaxYgfVJGTA04gEov2EJwd.jpg','1968-11-27',121,'Released','The Toughest Hellfighter Of All!','Hellfighters',32726,2.9614,6.33,'737h6nSnGqg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5332,_binary '\0','/dsfRpw40D5XBDaVEZlojGkxyd6S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063084',7.6,1336,'es','La hora de los hornos','An impassioned three-part documentary of the liberation struggle waged throughout Latin America, using Argentina as a historical example of the imperialist exploitation of the continent. Part I: Neo-Colonialism and Violence is a historical, geographic, and economic analysis of Argentina. Part II: An Act For Liberation examines the ten-year reign of Juan Perón (1945-55) and the activities of the Peronist movement after his fall from power. Part III: Violence and Liberation studies the role of violence in the national liberation process and constitutes a call for action.','/750AVmOtNEXAaOzW9ArwbP8IrRv.jpg','1968-09-30',260,'Released',NULL,'The Hour of the Furnaces',89681,1.9059,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5333,_binary '\0','/4lsUlVwNECaFA9n89L9Ft8x32y6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063090',4.8,1415,'es','La horripilante bestia humana','A surgeon transplants the heart of an ape into his ailing son with horrific results.','/ssE6dACUHnCDGDjATXWX8eiQNLO.jpg','1969-02-05',81,'Released','Half man, half beast, all horror','Night of the Bloody Apes',42610,1.9434,5.5,'1PY6Sv8Rafs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5334,_binary '\0','/AshTOWFlTjBoBk6Op9RzZ1rLSgO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063091',6.3,1244,'en','The Horse in the Gray Flannel Suit','Frederick Bolton has to solve two problems. First, his boss has instructed him to come up with a reasonable campaign to promote a new product, a stomach pill named \"Aspercel\" - by tomorrow. The second problem is Fred\'s daugther, Helen. She is absolutely fond of horses, takes riding classes and has already had decent success in some competitions. Her biggest wish is to own a horse herself, a dream her father cannot afford at all. Now Fred tries to solve both problems at once by simply combining them: A horse named \"Aspercel\", ridden by his daugther should bring the name of the pill into the papers and make Helen happy, too. But there\'s still one more obstacle: Helen and Aspercel of course have to win a few prices to make this idea work...','/chOwOYnJ3ct76mqP5SK1TS4au7r.jpg','1968-12-16',113,'Released',NULL,'The Horse in the Gray Flannel Suit',42645,1.5712,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5335,_binary '\0','/sxLrQ1Hyu1S2eqb68ULiUO48bOP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063094',6.8,2609,'en','Hot Millions','A con artist gains employment at an insurance company in order to embezzle money by re-programming their \"new\" wonder computer.','/tP8QEV55HvxXaNI2rHdIllBzg3s.jpg','1968-09-19',106,'Released',NULL,'Hot Millions',26186,2.1793,6.613,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5336,_binary '\0','/kgeRY8HY9ovmOdcNLBs3pEbU3AT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063115',6.2,3688,'en','I Love You, Alice B. Toklas!','Harold Fine is a self-described square - a 35-year-old Los Angeles lawyer who\'s not looking forward to middle age nor his upcoming wedding. His life changes when he falls in love with Nancy, a free-spirited, innocent, and beautiful young hippie. After Harold and his family enjoy some of her \"groovy\" brownies, he decides to \"drop out\" with her and become a hippie too. But can he return to his old life when he discovers that the hippie lifestyle is just a little too independent and irresponsible for his tastes?','/zhlJINj5sVFUnghjbxfJJvWjA2W.jpg','1968-10-18',92,'Released','The saga of Harold...from dedicated lawyer to dedicated dropout.','I Love You, Alice B. Toklas!',42623,2.3851,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5337,_binary '\0','/soKjkMeyySehYjaXuhkteiskSYE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063121',6.6,13123,'en','Ice Station Zebra','A top-secret Soviet spy satellite -- using stolen Western technology -- malfunctions and then goes into a descent that lands it near an isolated Arctic research encampment called Ice Station Zebra, belonging to the British, which starts sending out distress signals before falling silent. The atomic submarine Tigerfish, commanded by Cmdr. James Ferraday, is dispatched to save them.','/euPqp2J79zAomdgCcdpCmqjRHMy.jpg','1968-04-04',149,'Released','An American nuclear sub... A sky full of Russian paratroopers... A race for the secret of Ice Station Zebra!','Ice Station Zebra',17657,4.0112,6.384,'du502oLN-Ow','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5338,_binary '\0','/ujgCXF6k7rHhuoIz00oePW0Vely.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063127',6.9,3945,'en','The Immortal Story','An aged, wealthy trader plots with his servant to recreate a maritime tall tale, using a local woman and an unknown sailor as actors.','/cI0IdXJWemWTyombF1n1FwK6KYT.jpg','1968-09-18',58,'Released',NULL,'The Immortal Story',84636,1.7695,7.1,'nmgwqfzG3qk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5339,_binary '\0','/855wSmSvZw5Ma0kIPMw3aj046KO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063135',4.7,3701,'en','Inspector Clouseau','Detective Inspector Jacques Clouseau is borrowed from the Surete on special assignment for Scotland Yard in hopes that a fresh outlook will help the government recover the loot from the Great Train Robbery, which is being used to underwrite a new crime wave. What they don\'t count on, however, is having more than one Clouseau on the job.','/gpL8PDb0dzXkqZaevYvO1hAidS8.jpg','1968-07-19',96,'Released','Put Clouseau on another case? They wouldn\'t dare!','Inspector Clouseau',11573,4.2224,5.014,'mvOgu5W5RYU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5340,_binary '\0','/f2lktfjHGCKphm12KQ79iHQRIii.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063141',6.8,2885,'en','Isadora','A biography of the dancer Isadora Duncan, the 1920s dancer who forever changed people\'s ideas of ballet. Her nude, semi-nude, and pro-Soviet dance projects as well as her attitudes on free love, debt, dress, and lifestyle shocked the public of her time.','/5NAjQxJgf4BJWz8m2Qj0fryG3bV.jpg','1968-09-14',131,'Released','The Life and Many Loves of the Most Exciting Woman of Our Time','Isadora',42626,1.803,6.2,'pbXHUB5r2rY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5341,_binary '\0','/2YvF8jBP1l0QtLgol3JAtgPL5Vb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063149',6,1793,'sv','Jag är nyfiken - en film i blått','The same movie with the same characters, cast and crew as I am Curious (Yellow), but with some different scenes and a different political slant. The political focus in Blue is personal relationships, religion, prisons and sex. Blue omits much of the class consciousness and non-violence interviews of the first version. Yellow and Blue are the colors of the Swedish flag.','/tUXUQEbxf7MVZR9MnvQ63dnTE4h.jpg','1968-03-11',107,'Released','Look who\'s flying into the blue!','I Am Curious (Blue)',45690,1.6423,5.5,'FiNsPT7hlEg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5342,_binary '\0','/knn3SEUUakHOoU0a4dDwL1Yi6JF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063152',7.1,3821,'fr','Je t\'aime, je t\'aime','Recovering from an attempted suicide, a man is selected to participate in a time travel experiment that has only been tested on mice. A malfunction causes the man to experience moments from his past in a random order.','/lCRSBE0SzRaoOcaJMYGpxDaue9i.jpg','1968-04-24',94,'Released','The past is the present and future in Alain Resnais\' new time machine.','Je T\'Aime, Je T\'Aime',4798,2.3991,6.6,'HElwY3rt8t0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5343,_binary '\0','/59ePiJjyo7mW4VXBeAbZPM2aE1d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063161',5.6,1220,'en','Journey to Shiloh','At the beginning of the Civil War, seven friends embark on a cross-country journey in order to join the Confederate army.','/eiBcYW3ZcwbOSJk3FD2wMC6OQqJ.jpg','1968-05-10',101,'Released','The Unstoppable Seven! They came to fight in tattered buckskins... and left in blazing glory!','Journey to Shiloh',79863,1.9364,5.4,'3TDsCi4sfwg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5344,_binary '\0','/wDVTcI3vrcSwA5RiLsOnPzfoSGy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063171',7.3,1486,'ja','怪談雪女郎','Two sculptors spend the night in a mountain lodge after being caught in a snowstorm. A female spirit appears and takes the life of one of the men. She spares the other man\'s life on the condition that he never tell anyone what happened that night.','/4vFYCaNLBvHiZ210HuP4spnWWeB.jpg','1968-04-20',79,'Released','The tale of Yuki-onna.','The Snow Woman',57875,1.9198,7,'aVJ6jvEmh4E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5345,_binary '\0','/l4gfTsSZkVofKxzcqMCTBUkeHw8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063172',6.4,9014,'ja','怪獣総進撃','At the turn of the century, all of the Earth\'s monsters have been rounded up and kept safely on Monsterland. Chaos erupts when a race of she-aliens known as the Kilaaks unleash the monsters across the world.','/24r1hsRisfUidwLF67J0iMuWh7p.jpg','1968-08-01',89,'Released','The mysterious Kilaaks appear! Shaking the universe, the great battle of 11 monsters!','Destroy All Monsters',3107,3.5353,6.9,'mBdamsfrkKQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5346,_binary '\0','/k5xRpN0Cgrq2UnWTD3aW2JbzaZP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063173',7.5,2206,'ja','神々の深き欲望','Tokyo engineer Kariya arrives on a primitive tropical island, where he interacts with the Futori clan, to drill a well to power a sugar mill.','/n5GTZHtCV0ThjUmDDItz30uVz9c.jpg','1968-11-22',173,'Released',NULL,'Profound Desires of the Gods',50696,2.0065,7.4,'Zu0DZztRuKM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5347,_binary '\0','/wHatuSY3bQb7ixDhYOt1iAQ0hfj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063185',7,2799,'en','The Killing of Sister George','The life of a soap opera actress begins to unravel as she fears her character will be written out of the series.','/u9Cyc6mde7pthv7M2xvk3wmfAHP.jpg','1968-09-01',138,'Released','The story of three consenting adults in the privacy of their own home.','The Killing of Sister George',54575,2.2816,6.3,'P0Nze1n0IQQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5348,_binary '\0','/eIefrW5jXfG9YjTzCgmtw37X4hD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063186',7.4,3479,'ja','斬る','A pair of down-on-their-luck swordsmen arrive in a dusty, windblown town, where they become involved in a local clan dispute. One, previously a farmer, longs to become a noble samurai. The other, a former samurai haunted by his past, prefers living anonymously with gangsters. But when both men discover the wrongdoings of the nefarious clan leader, they side with a band of rebels who are under siege at a remote mountain cabin.','/wAmeXWsKTZrb1mQpEBvGfBpNM43.jpg','1968-06-22',114,'Released','Behold the best of Seven Samurai, Yojimbo, and Sanjuro all in one film.','Kill!',39029,1.7791,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5349,_binary '\0','/2lqj0xTaA4XKPxgFX18jER3bgUy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063198',7.5,3951,'ja','絞死刑','A Korean man is sentenced to death in Japan but somehow survives his execution, sending the authorities into a panic about what to do next.','/tszrnBe8XACsDxLJjt1rKfFHfHi.jpg','1968-02-02',118,'Released',NULL,'Death by Hanging',98193,2.8164,7.496,'Pl0i8lMIRqM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5350,_binary '\0','/n1fqV4yOavgpIkGd8Dl2XeuhCCI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063206',6.1,2233,'ja','吸血鬼ゴケミドロ','The survivors of a plane crash in a remote area are attacked by blob-like alien creatures that turn their victims into blood-thirsty vampires.','/tjBZ1HdYBskrsRMacQHmmv9uQ2A.jpg','1968-08-14',84,'Released','A fiendish vampire from a strange world in outer space drains his victims\' blood and turns them into weird corpses!','Goké, Body Snatcher from Hell',42628,1.3991,5.842,'GT8ge_M2qsU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5351,_binary '\0','/kpR4LdXWsn24YTnOLkMzdljtXFf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063210',5.8,3160,'en','Lady in Cement','While diving for sunken treasure, street-smart gumshoe Tony Rome finds the body of a gorgeous blonde, her feet stuck in a block of cement. Soon after, tough guy Waldo Gronski hires him to find a missing woman named Sandra Lomax, and Rome wonders if there\'s a connection. He sets about trying to locate the woman, and in no time finds himself mixed up with a beautiful party girl and a slippery racketeer.','/r70X120GasMpDDsInD6Y1vE7Y5N.jpg','1968-11-19',93,'Released','A beautiful body under water. A private eye in over his head.','Lady in Cement',42630,2.1802,6.134,'OZZSfGdXIf8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5352,_binary '\0','/1WTvUnZ2j1GTRvWeziBHbeLKzbr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063218',7,2844,'de','Lebenszeichen','During World War II, three German soldiers are withdrawn from combat when one of them, Stroszek, is wounded. They are assigned to a small coastal community on the Greek island of Kos while Stroszek recuperates. The men become increasingly stir crazy in their uneventful new assignment. Stroszek eventually goes mad.','/kPxzosD2y4duUZMwtPOkJuYYdB6.jpg','1968-07-05',91,'Released',NULL,'Signs of Life',67217,1.9536,6.623,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5353,_binary '\0','/9jlQsnNJAYs9nQyIduqRd2rUb9D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063219',5.7,1683,'en','The Legend of Lylah Clare','A dictatorial film director hires an unknown actress to play the lead role in a planned movie biography of a late, great Hollywood star.','/nX0pmvrcPFFIkNtp36MYlo4bhM9.jpg','1968-08-21',130,'Released','Overnight, she became a star...Over many nights, she became a legend.','The Legend of Lylah Clare',86816,2.7303,6,'2n-CaBQP1u4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5354,_binary '\0','/u8EQqjCeaYDkgACV4mMfkPHLqpP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063227',7.8,37215,'en','The Lion in Winter','Christmas 1183, Angevin Empire: King Henry II plans to announce his successor to the throne. Jockeying for the crown, though, is complex. Henry has three sons and wants his boy Prince John to take over. Henry\'s wife, Queen Eleanor, believes their son Prince Richard should be king. As family and various schemers gather for the holiday, each tries to make the indecisive king choose their option.','/yMgJnZADJObzfjA70ygXJkjnrFX.jpg','1968-08-20',134,'Released','What family doesn\'t have its ups and downs?','The Lion in Winter',18988,5.6879,7.4,'Pqz3gkrmBbo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5355,_binary '\0','/i2NMcNeFNEbAeozopC6jigBG6Aq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063230',6.9,7357,'en','The Little Drummer Boy','After being kidnapped and escaping, young drummer boy Aaron searches for his camel and finds him in the Nativity of the Baby Jesus. Aaron gives Baby Jesus the only gift he has, a song on his drum.','/oqnVoHW2aCOIFVHUCSxcm1XWeh9.jpg','1968-12-19',25,'Released','His gift was his song.','The Little Drummer Boy',18846,2.4162,6.57,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5356,_binary '\0','/fhFB8q6SQXmWnXAfmEBOso14XEo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063231',5.7,2305,'en','Live a Little, Love a Little','Photographer Greg Nolan moonlights in two full-time jobs to pay the rent, but has trouble finding time to do them both without his bosses finding out.','/2qiDzE7RcfNFBUHZKM5lV3cusfH.jpg','1968-10-23',89,'Released','Watch Elvis click with all these chicks!','Live a Little, Love a Little',18686,2.697,5.5,'oKWvX2qVMs8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5357,_binary '\0','/zK03Kjo6ltX3D8PWbtfTusk0nDX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063240',5.5,2537,'en','The Lost Continent','An eclectic group of characters set sail on Captain Lansen’s leaky cargo ship in an attempt to escape their various troubles. When a violent storm strikes, the ship is swept into the Sargasso Sea and the passengers find themselves trapped on an island populated by man-eating seaweed, giant crabs and Spanish conquistadors who believe it’s still the 16th century.','/tlEUe4DyZ21j4pApjF6nT8EYZAj.jpg','1968-06-19',89,'Released','A living hell that time forgot!','The Lost Continent',5147,2.1279,5.6,'AVw5fJsnj7c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5358,_binary '\0','/gC8QwpOivBvwmZ5fFdKKQkjo80k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063242',3.9,1377,'en','Love Camp 7','Two female Army agents go undercover at a Nazi prison camp to get information from a scientist being held there.','/sjeHWyTAAWXkpBJvb91FlZs99xq.jpg','1969-10-04',96,'Released','A Place of Total Despair. All the youthful beauty of Europe enslaved for the pleasure of the 3rd Reich.','Love Camp 7',28652,1.8968,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5359,_binary '\0','/cxjlVtThxrNn9Z5JDG9SUCMsbu7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063256',6.5,4489,'en','Madigan','NYPD detectives Bonaro and Madigan lose their guns to fugitive Barney Benesch. As compensation, they are given a weekend to bring Benesch to justice. While they follow various leads, Police Commissioner Russell goes about his duties, including attending functions, meeting with aggrieved relatives, and counseling the spouses of fallen officers.','/hj4AgOat5aQUVQfKOi2KNdmnCNc.jpg','1968-03-29',101,'Released','\"If Detective Madigan kept his eyes on the killer instead of the broad...\"','Madigan',4931,3.4925,6.2,'5rInXuAdWLM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5360,_binary '\0','/wQsqrPdEnfVIo8lkX1d2psROxlW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063260',5.6,1994,'en','The Magus','A teacher on a Greek island becomes involved in bizarre mind-games with the island\'s magus (magician) and a beautiful young woman.','/sMfTUp1Ic53zKZwtskLt9XLeUCU.jpg','1968-10-05',117,'Released','Between mystery and manipulation, where reality slips away and illusions dominate.','The Magus',33228,2.049,5.697,'iFjaPCP2t0M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5361,_binary '\0','/z5ZyAtLhK5eistltd8ibpBp4qSz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063268',7.3,1822,'wo','Mandabi','A money order from a relative in Paris throws the life of a Senegalese family man out of order. He deals with corruption, greed, problematic family members, the locals and the changing from his traditional way of living to a more modern one.','/8L5GJMgWUfyuIwtKSvoa7Ovejk3.jpg','1968-11-27',92,'Released',NULL,'Mandabi',99329,2.5748,7.1,'L3LJ5RJ8wOg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5362,_binary '\0','/1Vbd0TVNZXlzTlyLkYnOMzpq1eH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063278',7.8,6787,'cs','Marketa Lazarová','Mikolás and his brother Adam end up with a young German hostage of noble blood during a robbery. While their clan prepares for the wrath of the German king, Mikolás is sent to pressure his neighbor Lazar into a defense pact. Persuasion fails and he abducts Lazar\'s daughter Marketa on the eve of her initiation as a nun in an act of vengeance.','/bBf0N1kNQGr6btlO9F66VAV1moz.jpg','1967-11-24',166,'Released','Putting the ‘dark’ back in the Dark Ages.','Marketa Lazarová',25904,2.8489,7.76,'GR7YXgF3pPY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5363,_binary '\0','/kuAcehliObELss7aKKKHyHOpUDH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063285',6.7,14038,'en','Witchfinder General','England, 1645. The cruel civil war between Royalists and Parliamentarians that is ravaging the country causes an era of chaos and legal arbitrariness that allows unscrupulous men to profit by exploiting the absurd superstitions of the peasants; like Matthew Hopkins, a monster disguised as a man who wanders from town to town offering his services as a witch hunter.','/5QuF8YbNtOpLbcTlEFSAokUv5sp.jpg','1968-05-17',87,'Released','He\'ll hang, burn, and mutilate you. He\'s the… Witchfinder General','Witchfinder General',31965,2.9105,6.502,'98gzk6VSzfU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5364,_binary '\0','/1BnnGrmwMVrHt8GPnIIKn1qgmk3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063288',7.1,1998,'it','Il medico della mutua','Comedy about the flawed Italian healthcare system of the time and a doctor\'s expeirence with it.','/ilPCRdZSsHeBisrSgkDE2ejUB2r.jpg','1968-10-24',94,'Released',NULL,'Be Sick… It\'s Free',58188,2.0886,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5365,_binary '\0','/mE58wQKaXb09zjrGrCVjWrkp7Xn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063291',7.6,5468,'es','Memorias del subdesarrollo','In the aftermath of the Bay of Pigs incident, Sergio chooses to stay behind in Cuba while his wife and family escape to neighboring Miami. Alone in a brave new world, Sergio observes the constant threat of foreign invasion while chasing young women all over Havana. He finally meets Elena, a young girl he seeks to mould into the image of his ex-wife, but at what cost to himself?','/av7zEHpOyzmm86VPRa68zOLaBqf.jpg','1968-08-19',99,'Released',NULL,'Memories of Underdevelopment',47576,1.0987,7.2,'FGcBNmiCdxw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5366,_binary '\0','/d9UmrrINacgZtMRQBazAxN6eX4h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063293',7.1,7030,'it','Il mercenario','While a Mexican revolutionary lies low as a U.S. rodeo clown, the cynical Polish mercenary who tutored the idealistic peasant tells how he and a dedicated female radical fought for the soul of the guerrilla general Paco, as Mexicans threw off repressive government and all-powerful landowners in the 1910s. Tracked by the vengeful Curly, Paco liberates villages, but is tempted by social banditry\'s treasures, which Kowalski revels in.','/gIRRNEpkZg41syNBw0phpQfXa3C.jpg','1968-12-20',101,'Released','He sells death to the highest bidder! Buy or die!','The Mercenary',48169,3.7407,6.854,'bbvUrq72T74','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5367,_binary '\0','/34N7lToXdNMfvLHNMKRKebqj9I6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063348',6.1,2044,'en','The Night They Raided Minsky\'s','Rachel arrives in New York from her Amish community intent on becoming a dancer. Unfortunately Billy Minsky\'s Burlesque is hardly the place for her Dances From The Bible. But the show\'s comedian Raymond sees a way of wrong-footing the local do-gooders by announcing the new Paris sensation \"Mme Fifi\" and putting on Rachel\'s performance as the place is raided. All too complicated, the more so since her father is scouring the town for her and both Raymond and his straight-man Chick are falling for Rachel.','/cVZ0zyozUWm4YRWOqF1uYFHO8Bx.jpg','1968-12-21',99,'Released','Sometimes being a nice girl is too much to bare','The Night They Raided Minsky\'s',42648,2.0644,5.518,'LKYR5bpRd5k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5368,_binary '\0','/5KtmBSqFtHY3I9t8lgH27Mc0bqY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063350',7.8,152474,'en','Night of the Living Dead','A ragtag group barricade themselves in an old Pennsylvania farmhouse to remain safe from a horde of flesh-eating ghouls ravaging the Northeast.','/rb2NWyb008u1EcKCOyXs2Nmj0ra.jpg','1968-10-04',96,'Released','If it doesn\'t scare you, you\'re already dead!','Night of the Living Dead',10331,27.0827,7.604,'V5XwrRFP7Zw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5369,_binary '\0','/jFGtFqO4eFDmKkVRbu5c6390h9G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063356',7,2870,'en','No Way to Treat a Lady','Christopher Gill is a psychotic killer who uses various disguises to trick and strangle his victims. Moe Brummel is a single and harassed New York City police detective who starts to get phone calls from the strangler and builds a strange alliance as a result. Kate Palmer is a swinging, hip tour guide who witnesses the strangler leaving her dead neighbor\'s apartment and sets her sights on the detective. Moe\'s live-in mother wishes her son would be a successful Jewish doctor like his big brother.','/ArbuDeAQ7BiJjVLS9JP6FYPsQUu.jpg','1968-03-20',108,'Released','...or is it?','No Way to Treat a Lady',42633,2.2879,6.6,'5CeOILTXiCM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5370,_binary '\0','/5hn1Wq2Ctex5Xxi0xpzdcMYgHhX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063369',7.1,1341,'ru','Новые приключения неуловимых','The action takes place in 1920 during the Civil War. Crimea on the eve of complete liberation from the White Guards. Returning from patrol, the four brave “elusive” knocked down an airplane. In the field bag of the captured pilot, they find a secret report, which speaks of the existence of defensive fortifications around the coastal city, which the Reds have yet to take. Young heroes get the task to get a map of fortifications and go to the city...','/hy7RVuhoUR53txkGRUeVCQfTNM2.jpg','1968-11-04',82,'Released',NULL,'The New Adventures of the Elusive Avengers',65591,1.0727,7.138,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5371,_binary '\0','/mqJKvdiMW8t50WOl9NUiTwC3Df7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063371',7,2017,'cs','O slavnosti a hostech','A group of the bourgeois head for a prominent figure\'s birthday party. As they venture through the woods and have a picnic, they\'re suddenly surrounded by some suspicious strangers.','/3Nl4QFdesxZcgPBs0qLn4koE2Ee.jpg','1966-12-30',70,'Released','Maybe one day the Czechs will see this picture again.','The Party and the Guests',105348,1.6642,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5372,_binary '\0','/h63N8AZ0kzC1qTqo2bXI33lXkJe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063374',7.6,40375,'en','The Odd Couple','In New York, Felix, a neurotic news writer who just broke up with his wife, is urged by his chaotic friend Oscar, a sports journalist, to move in with him, but their lifestyles are as different as night and day are, so Felix\'s ideas about housekeeping soon begin to irritate Oscar.','/d3dKPpzEi7WfgmoMnMwWyQnd2ja.jpg','1968-05-16',106,'Released','...say no more.','The Odd Couple',11356,4.9169,7.408,'A58OtN9h918','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5373,_binary '\0','/rB5tQiiLzWKYukr3Q8leEL0owLz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063379',6,1988,'it','Oggi a me... domani a te!','A man, released after a jail term for a crime he did not commit, raises a gang to go after the man who framed him.','/vvhnbqZmnu3D2LGxSj2bIUZKW3k.jpg','1968-03-28',95,'Released','Brutal! Violent! Savage!','Today We Kill, Tomorrow We Die!',46570,3.6079,6.1,'Y4DvaSN6Yys','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5374,_binary '\0','/kd2zTW96fK5qNuZcwVUFeMIYxBa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063385',7.4,44843,'en','Oliver!','Musical adaptation of Charles Dickens\' Oliver Twist, a classic tale of an orphan who runs away from the workhouse and joins up with a group of boys headed by the Artful Dodger and trained to be pickpockets by master thief Fagin.','/1XJgoaOWKrqxkKeBKWLKSigqG8c.jpg','1968-09-26',153,'Released','Much much more than a musical!','Oliver!',17917,4.3192,7,'PKKLLm715iw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5375,_binary '\0','/zJkIRlBTWKg43KZh54JUQkza71l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063386',6.6,2869,'da','Olsen-banden','The first of 14 Olsen Gang films presents us with Egon Olsen, head of the gang, and his friends Benny and Kjeld, who want to become the best known gang in Denmark and eventually Europe by stealing a famous Bavarian work of art currently displayed in a Copenhagen museum. Although Egon\'s plan works out fine, there is only trouble ahead for the little gang.','/AacndEk3B1wBVhhu9jJD8aEohZ5.jpg','1968-10-11',80,'Released',NULL,'The Olsen Gang',11389,1.4315,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5376,_binary '\0','/aLVztOwxn8kmNfek3tWTbc2H7Ws.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063404',8.1,10371,'hi','Padosan','A simple man from a village falls in love with his new neighbor. He enlists the help of his musical-theater friends to woo the lovely girl-next-door away from her music teacher.','/b3saYvaYdzuXCEfIfNJiKaO58qO.jpg','1968-11-29',157,'Released',NULL,'Padosan',20622,1.0272,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5377,_binary '\0','/nFTPwJAjWOCOHs0QOKBRXaZurlT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063410',6.2,1322,'en','Paper Lion','Sportswriter George Plimpton poses as a rookie quarterback for the Detroit Lions for a \"Sports Illustrated\" article.','/kECYAW0dhyDq0m3ldVBvSbVg4ow.jpg','1968-10-14',107,'Released','The Paper Lion is about to get creamed!','Paper Lion',86284,1.6286,6.8,'FNE7uDzFVUo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5378,_binary '\0','/dKesVvpPWcw75HeGuN5jg2ge0BD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063413',6,2136,'it','Orgasmo','Following the death of her wealthy husband, American widow Kathryn West migrates to Italy and takes up a reclusive existence in a luxurious villa. After quickly succumbing to the charms of a local man, she lets him move into the villa and the two are later joined by his sister, which soon leads to complications.','/lu5t1Ckw2NVK8N5wbQSNBLYbsRk.jpg','1969-02-07',91,'Released','Orgasmo sucks you into a whirlpool of erotic love!','Paranoia',64525,2.2048,5.9,'Ceh_kZDiATM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5379,_binary '\0','/jqw9t9nshz9mV79C66PV2giHVw6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063415',7.4,47513,'en','The Party','Hrundi V. Bakshi, an accident-prone actor from India, is accidentally put on the guest list for an upcoming party at the home of a Hollywood film producer. Unfortunately, from the moment he arrives, one thing after another goes wrong with compounding effect.','/nWZ9rrbMoHHgsvYNdng2EhbjeLf.jpg','1968-04-04',99,'Released','If you\'ve ever been to a wilder party... you\'re under arrest!','The Party',10794,4.0829,7.3,'VvgkolEbjeI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5380,_binary '\0','/i86KGfhcshYh44WU6C4eHVpkXme.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063426',6.8,3759,'en','Petulia','Dr. Archie Bollen is having a midlife crisis. He\'s just divorced his wife and is establishing a new life for himself. One night, he catches the eye of Petulia Danner, a charming, free-spirited young woman. Petulia\'s vibrant personality hides her fear of her abusive husband, David, whose father is a powerful society figure. As Petulia and Archie\'s feelings for each other grow, they must decide what it is they truly want.','/i0r0HPm4PEPNZL93lwE1fCGvL0b.jpg','1968-06-10',105,'Released','People bugged by people will do extraordinary things.','Petulia',42634,3.1606,6,'9CSLkdNjwE0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5381,_binary '\0','/gmJOXle5QeOOVFEYOVBOkmIJUWV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063442',8,211254,'en','Planet of the Apes','Astronaut Taylor crash lands on a distant planet ruled by apes who use a primitive race of humans for experimentation and sport. Soon Taylor finds himself among the hunted, his life in the hands of a benevolent chimpanzee scientist.','/2r9iKnlSYEk4daQadsXfcjHfIjQ.jpg','1968-02-07',112,'Released','Somewhere in the Universe, there must be something better than man!','Planet of the Apes',871,14.3968,7.657,'k0-dUM_A-Cg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5382,_binary '\0','/bh5nH5yCbnX81fwIfhvxRoPWcDb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063443',6.8,4258,'en','Play Dirty','During World War II in North Africa, a group of British commandos disguised as Italian soldiers must travel behind enemy lines and destroy a vital Nazi oil depot.','/8BkQ3aRlYQMqCLO943c0u1njscG.jpg','1969-01-02',118,'Released','Forget the medals, throw away the rule book, if you want to survive… Play Dirty','Play Dirty',26652,3.5318,6.3,'SiStS0_3wc8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5383,_binary '\0','/ceXjo7qNeLDPbTTsYc3TDgSp6UP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063452',5.9,2079,'en','The Power','One by one members of a special project team are being killed by telekinesis - the ability to move things with the power of the mind alone. The race is on to determine which of the remaining team members is the murderer and to stop them.','/dDo4S3LryO89an2Uq0xvgZUMZN3.jpg','1968-02-21',108,'Released','YOU feel it until you can\'t feel anything at all!','The Power',46015,3.2854,6.3,'1GMd4DxkvTQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5384,_binary '\0','/2DkUiZlSBa4RDiVpRXniN446yEn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063456',7,4695,'en','Pretty Poison','A troubled arsonist spins a tale of espionage to a captivating girl, who becomes enthralled and entangled in his dangerous fantasies, leading to unexpected murder and chaos that change their lives forever.','/bUwIOxAfHWr7TdzXGYfVOPNQWGa.jpg','1968-07-18',89,'Released','What Brought A Nice Kid Like Sue Ann To A Shocking Moment Like This?','Pretty Poison',32969,3.6475,6.753,'DKcW3ryuO0k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5385,_binary '\0','/o14HQApursZ48yyrNVoHDHAcDCD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063458',7.1,2171,'fr','La Prisonnière','Gallery director Stanislas bolsters the development of modern art with his collection of surprising works. His newest acquisition is a sculpture by Gilbert, whose wife Josée is captivated by Stanislas. But unbeknownst to her, Stanislas is amassing photographs of a very perverse, disturbed nature.','/z6hcz5KxtupHBO4lIEpu9oQxHpL.jpg','1968-11-20',106,'Released',NULL,'Woman in Chains',70496,1.9343,6.981,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5386,_binary '\0','/hQPDNRs6Zvt1pwss7DSu5Cihtim.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063462',7.5,64527,'en','The Producers','A conniving Broadway producer and his meek accountant plan to profit from charming wealthy old biddies to invest in an overbudget production, and then put on a sure-fire disaster, so nobody will ask for their money back — and what\'s more disastrous than a tasteless musical celebrating Adolf Hitler.','/9qCIkNWGuRj5lMyeOXwJs8z9nRz.jpg','1968-03-18',89,'Released','Hollywood Never Faced a Zanier Zero Hour!','The Producers',30197,5.2876,7.058,'Lt19Wna_sG4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5387,_binary '\0','/o3ujllK4ulmxYlStRzgdFvTr5Sb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063469',5.9,3190,'en','Psych-Out','Jenny, a deaf runaway who has just arrived in San Francisco\'s Haight-Ashbury district to find her long-lost brother, a mysterious bearded sculptor known around town as The Seeker. She falls in with a psychedelic band, Mumblin\' Jim, whose members include Stoney, Ben, and Elwood. They hide her from the fuzz in their crash pad, a Victorian house crowded with love beads and necking couples. Mumblin\' Jim\'s truth-seeking friend Dave considers the band\'s pursuit of success \"playing games,\" but he agrees to help Jennie anyway.','/gl0waHdQJkcP7TxjPl4V8jeduI4.jpg','1968-03-06',101,'Released','The Ultimate Head Trip','Psych-Out',63100,1.9221,4.9,'NMtEdSelV4c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5388,_binary '\0','/A846ZQ402NGN31dZ2rFANJla75D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063477',7.2,1583,'en','The Queen','In 1967, New York City is host to the Miss All-American Camp Beauty Pageant. This documentary takes a look behind the scenes, transporting the viewer into rehearsals and dressing rooms as the drag queen subculture prepares for this big national beauty contest. Jack/Sabrina is the mistress of ceremonies, and their protégé, Miss Harlow, is in the competition. But, as the pageant approaches, the glamorous contestants veer from camaraderie to tension.','/enAf3MycnyeWFhgz8TOos9NvH4s.jpg','1968-06-17',68,'Released','A vibrant piece of queer history.','The Queen',42649,1.4139,6.4,'SeXrIZqMAfY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5389,_binary '\0','/agPJ2Snxm9PWEyR2uabc0ncN8T3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063483',7.1,4525,'en','Rachel, Rachel','Rachel is a 35-year-old school teacher who has no man in her life and lives with her mother. When a man from the big city returns and asks her out, she begins to have to make decisions about her life and where she wants it to go.','/67flKS1FKxIiYUjXPqRc39hb9LX.jpg','1968-08-26',101,'Released','Who cares about a 35 year old virgin?','Rachel, Rachel',42635,1.9145,6.6,'D_j6FYGb0_w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5390,_binary '\0','/skBQzXIk6AUYCLPEKvI31u5rohY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063485',6.7,1986,'it','La ragazza con la pistola','A Sicilian woman is dishonored by her lover, then goes to London with a pistol intending to murder him.','/pbHIDYHPRIVaDSwVT3A6ck2gr8d.jpg','1968-09-20',102,'Released',NULL,'The Girl with a Pistol',56233,2.5103,6.9,'2YVQzFyWN5A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5391,_binary '\0','/q7wHeDM7qKG1NKo2yOJQjx3hF6L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063493',7.8,1860,'ro','Reconstituirea','A prosecutor, policemen and teacher take the students Vuica and Nicu to a restaurant to re-enact their drunken brawl there, and have it filmed to show the effects of alcoholism.','/1Yfea4XRSQA8gMxkjdexThqo86o.jpg','1968-01-01',100,'Released',NULL,'Reconstruction',35166,1.8621,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5392,_binary '\0','/l0DezTvg6cDZhuxJH44e64oSw8v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063500',6.5,1285,'it','Requiescant','A Mexican community is slaughtered by Confederate troops; the lone survivor, a boy, is taken in by a preacher. Years later, the boy is now a soft-spoken, devout young man with perfect shooting skills (despite being a pacifist). On his journey to help his half-sister out of a complicated situation, he crosses paths with the men who killed his family, unbeknownst to him.','/e3rDgShdLUHs3d3Tf55OTcplDYQ.jpg','1967-03-10',107,'Released',NULL,'Kill and Pray',122787,1.3632,6.4,'aaHm_Ea3VSQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5393,_binary '\0','/6htGplcbeXm7cfMV4NozTKhW425.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063501',7.4,8066,'it','La resa dei conti','Unofficial lawman John Corbett hunts down Cuchillo Sanchez, a Mexican peasant accused of raping and killing a 12-year-old girl.','/a03mr7GwtyTz8EvmZYcugOBH7hN.jpg','1967-03-03',111,'Released','Mr. Ugly comes to town!','The Big Gundown',16662,2.7566,7.3,'gp4LGLIComk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5394,_binary '\0','/zf8DvfTPHUWhJSb24937ZJKW5pH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063518',7.6,37798,'en','Romeo and Juliet','Romeo Montague and Juliet Capulet fall in love against the wishes of their feuding families. Driven by their passion, the young lovers defy their destiny and elope, only to suffer the ultimate tragedy.','/vaBQKLbSWkXGTOlsz9ARdJP4lvg.jpg','1968-04-02',138,'Released','No ordinary love story...','Romeo and Juliet',6003,7.3184,7.385,'4FHpmn-KYec','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5395,_binary '\0','/qszuXKhzYR24oRpsmh7eZaPbvL8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063522',8,260999,'en','Rosemary\'s Baby','A young couple, Rosemary and Guy, moves into an infamous New York apartment building, known by frightening legends and mysterious events, with the purpose of starting a family.','/uYgvlHceRFjAFbsNeMInYcLZLUb.jpg','1968-06-12',138,'Released','Pray for Rosemary\'s Baby.','Rosemary\'s Baby',805,13.1539,7.8,'pwLKIcB0zDw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5396,_binary '\0','/rlByxvwSGXXzAibt978pZLKYRdw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063527',6.9,1779,'cs','Rozmarné léto','Middle-aged Antonin and his friends, the major, now retired, and the canon, are in the river, swimming and philosophizing. Then it starts to rain. It just seems to be that sort of summer. Antonin runs the swimming bath with his portly wife Katherine... A man appears with his horse-drawn caravan. He lays a striped pole across the river and walks over. With a handstand and a magic trick, Ernie the Conjuror invites everyone to that evening\'s performance... Ernie is a tightrope walker of only modest skill, but with a slim and beautiful assistant, Anna. Antonin speaks to her. The two spend the night in the change room by the river, Antonin massaging her feet all night long. Katherine decides to move into the caravan with Ernie. But now the major and even the canon sense Anna\'s attractiveness...','/kQvgIj2P8LyjqIjUotlO2XehfWq.jpg','1968-05-24',74,'Released',NULL,'Capricious Summer',47189,2.1709,6.457,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5397,_binary '\0','/7ryDL1g6FNHMFdXmmmFGZZpEh0a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063555',7.5,17128,'hy','Նռան գույնը','The life of the revered 18th-century Armenian poet and musician Sayat-Nova. Portraying events in the life of the artist from childhood up to his death, the movie addresses in particular his relationships with women, including his muse. The production tells Sayat-Nova\'s dramatic story by using both his poems and largely still camerawork, creating a work hailed as revolutionary by Mikhail Vartanov.','/rMUbQf7RgsYgQ47AFf1wpoSt4dX.jpg','1969-10-01',80,'Released','A poetic evocation of the life of Armenian poet Sayat Nova.','The Color of Pomegranates',26302,7.5939,7.359,'RsrUqqnPA3Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5398,_binary '\0','/5F4UVIChHtekl5i8nUXrI0hCxd9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063557',6.7,5184,'en','The Scalphunters','Forced to trade his valuable furs for a well-educated escaped slave, a rugged trapper vows to recover the pelts from the Indians and later the renegades that killed them.','/m82aMr1Pcqt5t0cpSCwq5REdajY.jpg','1968-02-29',102,'Released','\"I\'M JOE BASS and I say that scalphunters are the most ornery, girl-grabbing, back-stubbers on earth. I HUNT SCALPHUNTERS!\"','The Scalphunters',32068,3.0849,6.4,'P8u7zNIsNWo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5399,_binary '\0','/79XxWOXg7JTCTjQbPjgfksQbIM4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063568',6.3,2203,'it','Se incontri Sartana prega per la tua morte','After a stagecoach is robbed and the passengers murdered, a long and tangled series of surprise attacks and murderous double-crosses, leaves the coach\'s strongbox in the hands of the killer Lasky. It is up to the legendary hero Sartana to track down the missing money and determine just who is ultimately behind the grisly robberies and killings.','/bCNoJDWXZP2WzX7WJYo8CTXXkoM.jpg','1968-08-14',95,'Released','The gunman with the deadliest arsenal in the West','If You Meet Sartana Pray for Your Death',83122,2.2082,5.948,'QW_yfDbdmgM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5400,_binary '\0','/tNA5rUyiCiYPA0P6u7zxlHJXX2g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063571',6.3,2976,'en','Secret Ceremony','A penniless woman meets a strange girl who insists she is her long-lost mother and becomes enmeshed in a web of deception, and perhaps madness.','/ezkV9lbSwbA76qomzhBNpGEHrkI.jpg','1968-10-23',109,'Released','It\'s time to speak of unspoken things...','Secret Ceremony',71395,2.2065,6.1,'TzBWo6LKNe0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5401,_binary '\0','/kmSSmHFjoIqQYbzFjZD2llUy0fq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063573',6.3,1979,'en','The Secret War of Harry Frigg','When 5 allied generals are captured in Italy in WWII, it is a propaganda nightmare for the allies. The generals are all 1 star and refuse to take orders from each other in order to plan an escape. Harry Frigg is a private who has escaped from the guard house dozens of times. He is promoted to Major General and ordered to get the generals out once he is captured. Harry is willing to escape, but then he meets the countess...','/i88HNR7t90iqWIL4zGRpTEvlyuX.jpg','1968-02-29',110,'Released','It\'s not who you con. It\'s how you do it.','The Secret War of Harry Frigg',32073,2.6512,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5402,_binary '\0','/aAnVxSOZd09BJm9tOl5HeEoY0bh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063591',6.4,3364,'en','The Shakiest Gun in the West','Jesse W. Haywood (Don Knotts) graduates from dental school in Philadelphia in 1870 and goes west to become a frontier dentist. Penelope \"Bad Penny\" Cushing (Barbara Rhoades) is offered a pardon if she will track down a ring of gun smugglers. She tricks Haywood into a sham marriage as a disguise. Haywood inadvertently becomes the legendary \"Doc the Haywood\" after he guns down \"Arnold the Kid\".','/mWOyypjHxqpRXj50zcbbxCGeavg.jpg','1968-07-10',101,'Released','He\'s so bad he was scalped by a cigar store Indian!!','The Shakiest Gun in the West',20238,2.1223,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5403,_binary '\0','/4005Fur9C9mvAsfbigo92B369a4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063592',5.6,3926,'en','Shalako','While guiding a hunting party of clueless European aristocrats, cowboy Bosky Fulton leads them into hostile Apache territory. Becoming separated from the group, Countess Irina Lazaar experiences the first run-in with an Apache, which results in the tracker Shalako coming to her rescue. Despite Shalako\'s warning to leave the area immediately, the pampered foreigners fail to take him seriously, leaving them in grave danger.','/ywxINymAsSGAJmPvDqMkdFY3PNH.jpg','1968-09-26',113,'Released','Sean Connery is Shalako! Shalako means action! Action means Bardot!','Shalako',39209,3.8167,5.615,'xt0TV494OzA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5404,_binary '\0','/3IxF5ea5Zj4e6AvS8ibIwX243iH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063599',7,4705,'en','The Shoes of the Fisherman','Ukrainian bishop Kiril Lakota, a political prisoner in a Soviet gulag for twenty years, is unexpectedly released and sent to the Vatican, where, upon the sudden death of the Pope, leader of the Catholic Church, he must face a challenging destiny that will put the future of the entire world in his hands.','/m9HqMSaDz7Peo0ufCaBUP8gG5gf.jpg','1968-11-14',162,'Released','From political prisoner to Pope.','The Shoes of the Fisherman',17665,3.415,6.8,'x7JByO8Wtws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5405,_binary '\0','/mq8Vguqv4GjHfpSVIWFkIsOS6YK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063611',8,16691,'sv','Skammen','In the midst of a civil war, a pair of former violinists in a tempestuous marriage oversee a farm on a rural island. In spite of their best efforts to escape their homeland, the war impinges on every aspect of their lives.','/cRJFOadujA7COrBV4HqB6bWcpLs.jpg','1968-09-29',104,'Released',NULL,'Shame',26372,3.4305,7.5,'aTUIajGQLD8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5406,_binary '\0','/wts6E7Ygv6xCQq0uMMLRX4YCrgq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063612',4.7,2075,'en','Skidoo','Ex-gangster Tony Banks is called out of retirement by mob kingpin God to carry out a hit on fellow mobster \"Blue Chips\" Packard. When Banks demurs, God kidnaps his daughter Darlene on his luxury yacht.','/9gLzrTg7Kmw7yH7YsUWdT61hAMW.jpg','1968-12-19',98,'Released','It takes two to skidoo.','Skidoo',27470,1.7102,4.7,'sd6OxYZigFU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5407,_binary '\0','/3n3hBvNJgj5agNxYpbkdb4mToGc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063615',7.8,1331,'ru','Служили два товарища','Set during the last days of the civil war that followed the Russian Revolution. The Crimea Peninsula is the last stronghold of the White Guard, and the Red Army is planning the final assault. The first story line of the movie follows two Red Army soldiers: unlikely friends Nekrasov and Karyakin. The second story line is about a White Guard officer Brusentsov who is devoted to Russia and his cause but sees it being destroyed day by day.','/cmLEVBzEcRxxxAaboSa2x985MEF.jpg','1968-10-21',99,'Released',NULL,'Two Comrades Were Serving',49580,0.7625,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5408,_binary '\0','/fMjdPM3pdc7T0NVoVqXtXEuJvG2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063633',8,13211,'cs','Spalovač mrtvol','In 1930s Prague, a Czech cremator who firmly believes cremation relieves one from earthly suffering is drawn inexorably to Nazism.','/9or2Jzw9HOE4gp9niwXBkZdpTVx.jpg','1969-03-14',101,'Released','NO ONE WILL SUFFER.','The Cremator',18352,2.8935,7.8,'yMOT553AyAE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5409,_binary '\0','/cHWOVST8W41t382W8JrXBca78kZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063634',5.6,3017,'en','Speedway','A race car driver tries to outrun the beautiful tax auditor out to settle his account.','/eWjGauqY2NIdZOCi7KW9ZNpHBxV.jpg','1968-06-07',94,'Released','Smooth, fast and in high gear!','Speedway',18693,1.7182,5.9,'GkEbKeQcyA4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5410,_binary '\0','/1W0cTVhORgSzdeENamJkdbkdpIE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063636',6,1797,'en','The Split','A group of thieves attempt a daring robbery of a football stadium.','/djvKlaid635GhsedLRE3QUxV6sB.jpg','1968-11-04',91,'Released','No wonder they\'re happy. They just stole a half-million dollars in front of a hundred-thousand witnesses... But watch what happens when it\'s time for The Split!','The Split',31937,2.0323,6.7,'LVrO8JbUN8c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5411,_binary '\0','/l1wcKPBvB4FKXpvG6rD8FbpjvPT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063642',6.4,2403,'en','Star!','Gertrude Lawrence rises to stage stardom at the cost of happiness.','/xMyOm5hLWeuoWBea1DJrcJy8bU6.jpg','1968-07-18',176,'Released','Happiness is a girl called Julie!','Star!',52959,2.0329,6.9,'YqalEWhEITw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5412,_binary '\0','/je33xfkVVdAGS0G7D8pDXxobPod.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063643',4.5,1650,'en','Stay Away, Joe','Joe Lightcloud persuades his Congressman to give him 20 heifers and a prize bull so he and his father, Charlie, can prove that the Navajos can successfully raise cattle on the reservation. If their experiment is successful, then the government will help all the Navajo people. But Joe\'s friend, Bronc Hoverty, accidentally barbecues the prize bull, while Joe sells the heifers to buy plumbing and other home improvements for his stepmother.','/zslRaj04IkzfrtPomJURHuClOqL.jpg','1968-03-08',102,'Released','Elvis is kissin\' cousins again- and also friends, friends of friends, and even some perfect strangers!','Stay Away, Joe',49776,1.9443,5.5,'YmC9q_tH33E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5413,_binary '\0','/jRaXao0GH1KNTFW3DUeyqFVD4Hl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063654',7,2046,'en','The Subject Was Roses','Timmy Cleary returns to his Bronx home at the end of World War II and is soon disillusioned to find his parents\' marriage filled with discord, quarreling, and recriminations.','/2mjvVqEXb5Ii64NQWgjsgKDeFlU.jpg','1968-10-13',107,'Released','The Story of Three Strangers...A Mother...A Father...And a Son.','The Subject Was Roses',118872,2.0615,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5414,_binary '\0','/lILtfUlBP0J34dv18GFH9bJrJj5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063661',6.8,1440,'en','Sweet November','A woman refuses to let her romances last longer than one month.','/oov1xqtInL7stQywMDDmxqXAO1D.jpg','1968-02-08',114,'Released','Sara... She had to be remembered by every man she met. So she divided the calendar into twelve men and gave each a month and a key to her apartment. Charlie\'s month was November because he belonged to Sara as no one ever would again.','Sweet November',97936,1.8604,7,'-ugIxMgNnRg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5415,_binary '\0','/i38PPPpZUhknR7buscEBvfLRIBW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063663',7.6,16680,'en','The Swimmer','A man spends a summer day swimming home via all the pools in his quiet suburban neighborhood.','/urzLPHVno21hv2Ti7CwQuoQAUAI.jpg','1968-08-09',95,'Released','When you talk about \"The Swimmer\" will you talk about yourself?','The Swimmer',33564,3.62,7.3,'zY0tmQCa_Os','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5416,_binary '\0','/eNKqAIKKyCT2RNeoGEYflUb7p9w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063665',6.2,3548,'en','Sympathy for the Devil','While The Rolling Stones rehearse \"Sympathy for the Devil\" in the studio, an alternating narrative reflects on 1968 society, politics and culture through five different vignettes.','/wxfNcj87BORjRYYKhY1jGMnVPLo.jpg','1968-12-01',115,'Released','Jean-Luc Godard on Black Power, Rape, Murder, Fascism, Acid, Pornography, Sex, Revolution, Brutality and all the other things that make life worth living.','Sympathy for the Devil',50789,2.2178,6.3,'juChsS5KvhQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5417,_binary '\0','/9yDEQpI0wMjVZwnFeOFRQD03RmF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063668',6.6,2776,'ja','太陽の王子ホルスの大冒険','Young Horus lives in a mythical Scandinavia of the Iron Age. Recovering the stolen Sword of the Sun from a rock giant, he learns he must travel to the lands of his ancestors, encountering the beautiful but enigmatic Hilda as his journey leads to a series of adventures.','/zFwoHHJgfJaNqao3L96vktnG7OJ.jpg','1968-07-24',82,'Released',NULL,'Horus: Prince of the Sun',52686,2.4962,6.4,'MPp1hjKoeDU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5418,_binary '\0','/4BWKgipcFzDOZQPDZtmKGZVhEoU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063671',7.3,13958,'en','Targets','An aging horror-movie icon\'s fate intersects with that of a seemingly ordinary young man on a psychotic shooting spree around Los Angeles.','/n0xQThLhrymktXzQbD0KwwUMXSB.jpg','1968-08-13',90,'Released','TARGETS are people...and you could be one of them!','Targets',19383,3.1667,7.1,'2ZY0ZC9d6Tc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5419,_binary '\0','/2RpV669hhl189lxYDvtFoSx6Mub.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063674',6.5,3999,'fr','Le Tatoué','An art dealer wants to buy a Modigliani, which is tattooed on the back of an old soldier.','/AvxINMO5KmpUNBZw3DpYE9CpFnA.jpg','1968-08-17',90,'Released',NULL,'The Tattoo',11912,3.1846,6.4,'EqaRQo02FYg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5420,_binary '\0','/7o5uc27hJD4L95ZnJO9CR5iHdfQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063678',7,17186,'it','Teorema','A wealthy Italian household is turned upside down when a handsome stranger arrives, seduces every family member and then disappears. Each has an epiphany of sorts, but none can figure out who the seductive visitor was or why he came.','/wftXxZPCduFbv9TsVRZfCy2qDsn.jpg','1968-09-07',95,'Released','There are only 923 words spoken in \"Teorema\" – but it says everything!','Theorem',5335,3.116,7,'oCGVIg1ksYU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5421,_binary '\0','/3DLAG7EzNWbQfFhgB3MzleZ8WW4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063679',6.6,1466,'it','Tepepa','The Mexican guerilla leader Tepepa and his gang fight against the chief of police, Cascorro.','/uGhH5hd0wqfWLw1P5Xr7ozKoZZ9.jpg','1969-01-31',136,'Released','Jails can\'t hold him! Armies can\'t stop him! Women can\'t get enough of him!','Tepepa',81270,2.769,6.5,'YEjm2pgYY0M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5422,_binary '\0','/gjyXDI7pHbT4hip8j79l5ob2TzG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063688',6.9,32632,'en','The Thomas Crown Affair','A debonair, adventuresome bank executive believes that he has pulled off the perfect multi-million dollar heist--until he must match wits with an insurance investigator who will do anything to get her man.','/oODAwa2AK3fXvK93GCbq7dFLZPi.jpg','1968-06-26',102,'Released','McQueen and Dunaway... partners in crime.','The Thomas Crown Affair',912,5.462,6.8,'qWq177unTh4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5423,_binary '\0','/zuIqNx6rq9mJyMUnNgkO9ygXtW3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063694',6.3,1750,'en','Thunderbird 6','The International Rescue team is faced with one of its toughest challenges yet, as the revolutionary lighter-than-air craft Skyship One is hijacked while on her maiden voyage around the world. Against backdrops including the Statue of Liberty and the Sphinx, Lady Penelope, Parker, Alan and Tin-Tin fight the hijackers from on-board, while the rest of the team tries to stop the airship crashing.','/1zxO00ycylxZ8lFET5uXNOtBCcE.jpg','1968-08-03',89,'Released','THUNDERING INTO YOUR SIGHTS, STAGGERING THE IMAGINATION, \'BRAINS\' GREATEST INSPIRATION','Thunderbird 6',25361,1.4716,5.9,'85RtcTzX18Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5424,_binary '\0','/s8h41U0rqM0PP6qCas8qzBtxeen.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063715',6.4,7868,'fr','Histoires extraordinaires','Anthology film from three European directors based on stories by Edgar Allan Poe: a cruel countess haunted by a ghostly horse, a sadistic young man haunted by his double, and an alcoholic actor haunted by the Devil.','/9HmCwfPG7URPSXSrmEAFN65VoWE.jpg','1968-05-16',122,'Released','The ultimate orgy of evil.','Spirits of the Dead',41225,3.303,6.228,'7FJuSlLlmSk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5425,_binary '\0','/hldJ2bunIoFqMakWUGiOKrGUbuf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063729',7,2865,'en','Twisted Nerve','Martin Durnley is a young man with an infantilizing mother, resentful stepfather and an institutionalized brother with Down\'s syndrome. To cope, he retreats into an alternate child personality he calls Georgie. After being caught during a theft attempt at a department store, he befriends a female customer who is sympathetic to him, but his friendship soon turns into obsession.','/7U2pwwzvCb0XPIjDcM5Gn9dfrCu.jpg','1968-12-20',112,'Released','Cleaver. Cleaver. Chop. Chop. First the mom and then the pop. Then we\'ll get the pretty girl. We\'ll get her right between the curl.','Twisted Nerve',56092,2.4908,6.8,'KmqGOXMUmjY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5426,_binary '\0','/j8Hw8Jni7qQkEMyVhPY2mBQi3oN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063740',6.6,2788,'it','Une corde, un Colt...','A melancholic gunfighter is drawn into a vengeful and tragic kidnapping plot by his widowed ex-lover.','/gUJnuwDAAMLudOlVpYsjlNNQz6O.jpg','1969-01-25',91,'Released','Her thirst for revenge made his guns shoot to kill','Cemetery without Crosses',20361,2.7615,6.3,'D-NDp1w2084','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5427,_binary '\0','/3u8f16v26jKjpOHhIBN6BHUC7x0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063748',7.3,1327,'en','Uptight','Set against the backdrop of a community mourning the recent MLK assassination, Black militants building up an arsenal of weapons in preparation for a race war are betrayed by one of their own.','/7YUaUs2SVIDvIulLzsrfpTq6kw1.jpg','1968-12-28',104,'Released','A man on the run. A life at stake. A people about to explode.','Uptight',121971,2.0678,6.8,'kjnEVs79sUU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5428,_binary '\0','/pEHxojfy6EGOZ3e7TU9lREpWvNN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063759',7.5,25410,'sv','Vargtimmen','While vacationing on a remote German island with his younger pregnant wife, an artist has an emotional breakdown while confronting his repressed desires.','/jSqTnEP1x1OcOglqrInYvGSF1tL.jpg','1968-02-19',88,'Released','The hour of the wolf is the hour between night and dawn. It is the hour when most people die, when sleep is the deepest, when nightmares feel most real.','Hour of the Wolf',18333,3.8464,7.4,'DXk6VXs6jh4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5429,_binary '\0','/shehqzdgLKS22kSGJQNReoYLiEr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063765',4.6,1218,'en','The Vengeance of She','Beautiful young European girl, Carol, is possessed by the spirit of Ayesha – “She Who Must be Obeyed” – and led to the lost city of Kuma, where she is destined to become queen.','/9Uw5sJcj1gjC6mXEynf9GQcqd7L.jpg','1968-04-14',97,'Released','The ultimate female who used her beauty and her body to bring kingdoms to their downfall and men to their knees!','The Vengeance of She',64428,2.3333,5.3,'08xZObip_a4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5430,_binary '\0','/ul3EMzo5LbMANuooOvRGvjmhUZc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063771',7.6,2729,'fr','Le Vieil Homme et l\'Enfant','A story of the caring friendship formed between a crusty, old anti-Semite and an eight-year-old Jewish boy who goes to live with him during World War II.','/3OEIEFEkhC2CqFKhrBQNep49ism.jpg','1967-03-08',90,'Released',NULL,'The Two of Us',62570,1.745,7.581,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5431,_binary '\0','/fUsE95pA6ErFo4k23RjO2yVhQxw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063775',6.3,2578,'en','Villa Rides','Pulled into the Mexican Revolution by his own greed, Texas gunrunner and pilot Lee Arnold joins bandit-turned-patriot Pancho Villa and his band of dedicated men in a march across Mexico battling the Colorados and stealing women\'s hearts as they go. But each has a nemesis among his friends: Arnold is tormented by Fierro, Villa\'s right-hand-man; and Villa must face possible betrayal by his own president\'s naiveté','/z8I8sOWEC2I1l3rdOQGvAHvPc6O.jpg','1968-05-29',121,'Released','Villa rages! Villa lusts! Villa kills! VILLA RIDES!','Villa Rides',48564,3.0969,6.2,'VL65g9g5iac','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5432,_binary '\0','/uLu8zcwmR7qjkkF3zkScm6Sjh2v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063787',5.6,3844,'en','Vixen!','In a Canadian mountain resort, Vixen Palmer resides with her naive pilot husband Tom. While he\'s away flying in tourists, she sleeps with practically everybody including a husband and his wife, and even her biker brother. However, the only one she won\'t bed is her brother\'s friend... who is Black.','/9KMZWDA3xTrlgrScqdMisINQmsh.jpg','1968-10-15',72,'Released','Is she woman... or animal?','Vixen!',5721,7.2494,5.5,'FuMIkgbiyGI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5433,_binary '\0','/jdVe3NHBNRVGSBgum3k2ShsQz1C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063790',2.9,2356,'en','Voyage to the Planet of Prehistoric Women','Astronauts crash-land on Venus and find themselves in trouble when they kill a monster that is worshipped by a group of Venusian women. Re-edited version of Soviet sci-fi Planet of Storms (1962) by Pavel Klushantsev, dubbed into English with additional scenes.','/aTZHuHghiEpB3WYM93V1FtYyJ4B.jpg','1968-10-01',80,'Released',NULL,'Voyage to the Planet of Prehistoric Women',36530,1.9242,3.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5434,_binary '\0','/eF0UYfLOrirT8TLpIMfkuvw4x4I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063791',7.5,1231,'cs','Všichni dobří rodáci','The lives of 7 friends in a small Czech town from 1945 to some time after 1958.','/hn0F5V3ZIjYbi7xTAkdGfRug6l6.jpg','1969-07-04',121,'Released',NULL,'All My Good Countrymen',46659,1.3255,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5435,_binary '\0','/1MfNkV5WISM3jFbJlMgpGxpj4M0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063794',8.3,9875,'ru','Война и мир','The love story of young Countess Natasha Rostova and Count Pierre Bezukhov is interwoven with the Great Patriotic War of 1812 against Napoleon\'s invading army.','/tvMJ84g2lx2XusA29wvOeaanwWZ.jpg','1968-04-28',422,'Released','Greatest motion picture ever made! Romance ever lived! Adventure story written!','War and Peace',29266,3.2801,7.6,'3DqanxfecIA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5436,_binary '\0','/lvE2u593oO86ImyoU4RuMqju6lU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063800',6.4,2047,'en','Where Angels Go, Trouble Follows','Mother Superior of St. Francis Academy is challenged by a modern young nun when they take the girls on a bus trip across the country.','/wnDSUbsbaV2umOX39E2b93yhu30.jpg','1968-04-10',93,'Released','...and so do the boys!','Where Angels Go, Trouble Follows',71189,2.1157,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5437,_binary '\0','/cZJ8ovVlHqPI3QILx6Q5STLkW7I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063803',6.5,11164,'en','Who\'s That Knocking at My Door','A Catholic New Yorker falls in love with a girl and wants to marry her, but he struggles to accept her past and what it means for their future.','/zcH6pKZKeImwcBtIH7fSdUyoQ2e.jpg','1968-09-08',90,'Released','Mean Streets was just around the corner.','Who\'s That Knocking at My Door',42694,2.3813,6,'wh1yj9lMtVQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5438,_binary '\0','/vCOD2t2r8e5e9nCEXrwAqh4wSkt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063808',5.9,2438,'en','Wild in the Streets','Musician Max Frost lends his backing to a Senate candidate who wants to give 18-year-olds the right to vote, but he takes things a step further than expected. Inspired by their hero\'s words, Max\'s fans pressure their leaders into extending the vote to citizens as young as 15. Max and his followers capitalize on their might by bringing new issues to the fore, but, drunk on power, they soon take generational warfare to terrible extremes.','/fJHCvd5wQszKZdVZ43U5Wu0k03Z.jpg','1968-05-29',94,'Released','If you\'re thirty, you\'re through!','Wild in the Streets',42688,2.0031,5.7,'45pwZ7-rSoc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5439,_binary '\0','/u6QeHLm3NNAYwVzFnIiHtjqXowQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063811',7,5870,'en','Will Penny','Will Penny, an aging cowpoke, takes a job on a ranch which requires him to ride the line of the property looking for trespassers or, worse, squatters. He finds that his cabin in the high mountains has been appropriated by a woman whose guide to Oregon has deserted her and her son. Too ashamed to kick mother and child out just as the bitter winter of the mountains sets in, he agrees to share the cabin until the spring thaw. But it isn\'t just the snow that slowly thaws; the lonely man and woman soon forget their mutual hostility and start developing a deep love for one another.','/v3RcNrqutEPGsiTLd31J3U735kB.jpg','1967-12-19',110,'Released','He was a peaceful man. But he could kill! He was a hard man. But he could smile! He was a shy and lonely man. But he could love!','Will Penny',1676,3.2634,6.659,'XA1CdNzjMM0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5440,_binary '\0','/ufy2hQNhsL0ZPg875tbiXIOmWWw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063818',6.1,1883,'de','Winnetou und Shatterhand im Tal der Toten','An army gold shipment and its escort vanish in the Ozarks, prompting accusations of theft and desertion but frontiersman Old Shatterhand and Apache chief Winnetou help solve the mystery of the missing army gold.','/sB8Eboh8CuFNIAetA93PyFANgIh.jpg','1968-12-12',89,'Released','The inseparable blood brothers in a new, captivating adventure !','The Valley of Death',10638,2.8495,6.5,'5vrNOdUjGdg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5441,_binary '\0','/hg3Hdv3Oda4DLgQb73wn358T73n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063821',6.4,3319,'en','With Six You Get Eggroll','Abby McClure, a widow with three sons, and Jake Iverson, a widower with a teenage daughter, begin dating and eventually decide to get married. But they\'re not prepared for the hostile reactions from their children, who are not very excited about the new union between the two families.','/lftVCP4BmMvikPBJ40391htsyUS.jpg','1968-08-07',95,'Released','The return of the happy ending.','With Six You Get Eggroll',39225,2.4579,6.4,'5sIpOXJ_XFk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5442,_binary '\0','/1J2Aox2FsctJjvxp6kBsXmMM1xU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063823',7.4,30150,'en','Yellow Submarine','The wicked Blue Meanies take over Pepperland, eliminating all color and music. As the only survivor, the Lord Admiral escapes in the yellow submarine and journeys to Liverpool to enlist the help of the Beatles.','/1pmeLKaLFNggcsAk5FiouIvo3ST.jpg','1968-07-17',90,'Released','It\'s all in the mind y\'know!','Yellow Submarine',12105,4.864,7.2,'uOlwwoZLoKE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5443,_binary '\0','/6EEbNkExTwbYnxVw1xY3ammTGxm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063829',7.1,11195,'en','Yours, Mine and Ours','When a widower with ten children marries a widow with eight, can the twenty of them ever come together as one big happy family?','/ejbrAFkAHP5W5mzI8wA0zUTcDdg.jpg','1968-04-24',111,'Released','The Bride had 8 Boys and Girls. The Groom had 10 Boys and Girls. Their wedding night set new attendance records.','Yours, Mine and Ours',27983,4.8206,6.86,'7Lo85c89z14','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5444,_binary '\0','/u4ST4q3vapjjNUeECNshg5H4vx3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063834',7.4,1696,'ja','座頭市血煙り街道','Ichi is staying at an inn when a woman dies. Her dying wish is that Ichi take her son to his father, an artist living in a nearby town. After arriving in the town, Ichi finds out that the father has been forced by a local boss to create illegal pornography to pay off his gambling debts. Ichi makes it his mission to save the man and reunite the family, even though it brings him into conflict with a samurai he sort of befriended on his way to the town.','/b2XFVEQDXVzO1lUOfBPQot5XIck.jpg','1967-12-30',87,'Released',NULL,'Zatoichi Challenged',54279,1.5271,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5445,_binary '\0','/6mCdwgMs7MWAVzwojv2QF17OhyJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063835',7.3,1460,'ja','座頭市果し状','Zatoichi runs afoul of some evil fugitives, working for a corrupt law official.','/m299HKMbzNPWt26Lud8S84sXs6c.jpg','1968-08-10',82,'Released',NULL,'Zatoichi and the Fugitives',54280,1.6856,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5446,_binary '\0','/o4FosiyTwRkIAipGpNebLsJm7AI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063840',7.2,1261,'ru','Зигзаг удачи','Photo studio \"Contemporary\" in a provincial town lives with its everyday problems. The director is concerned over the failure to fulfill the planned targets, receptionist Alevtina wants to get married, and photographer Vladimir Oreshnikov dreams of becoming a professional photographer. But suddenly luck smiles on Oreshnikov. He takes 20 rubles form the worker\'s mutual aid fund, buys a government lottery bond and wins 10,000 rubles. Oreshnikov wants to receive the win himself, but his colleagues object to him, because the money that he spent on the bond were public, hence the win should be divided equally among all workers. It creates a controversial situation, which is successfully resolved on the very eve of the New Year, under the chiming clock...','/1QD12JLugolx9YLi7IFkxgL2Qd.jpg','1968-12-30',88,'Released',NULL,'Zigzag of Success',46588,1.038,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5447,_binary '\0','/4TQD2LboA5WpqIVKzwh6XCcwH7O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063845',8.2,3537,'ru','Золотой теленок','A crook named Ostap Bender, who survived a murder attempt by Kisa Vorobyaninov in \"12 Chairs,\" now schemes to extort 1 million from an underground millionaire.','/yqVRV5uRMxMLeDw8HEKO7am6O18.jpg','1968-07-08',174,'Released',NULL,'The Golden Calf',64714,1.1056,7.979,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5448,_binary '\0','/b5OqjAne0vAV08V43QvXpmlfvSg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063850',7.4,26632,'en','if....','In an English boys\' boarding school, social hierarchy reigns supreme and power remains in the hands of distanced and ineffectual teachers and callously vicious prefects in the Upper Sixth. Three Lower Sixth students, Wallace, Johnny and leader Mick Travis decide on a shocking course of action to redress the balance of privilege once and for all.','/oqlpAGq4aXhc6ODtxBcGM1SEoIp.jpg','1968-12-19',112,'Released','Which side will you be on?','if....',14794,2.7413,7,'2FahMGaCoow','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5449,_binary '\0','/z0E3Mvwf1AKQ2TZ4mshfXF5Jj0Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063876',7.4,2207,'ja','少年','A family of four lives off of scams in which they pretend to be injured by automobiles.','/tY2yQaF9MrsICq5EwmfGaaYKOos.jpg','1969-07-26',98,'Released',NULL,'Boy',104193,1.5318,7.2,'zRlLN_Apq10','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5450,_binary '\0','/oiF2hQNDCLUEXLBguBWbvZs0X4M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063970',6,4362,'en','100 Rifles','When half-breed Indian Yaqui Joe robs an Arizona bank, he is pursued by dogged lawman Lyedecker. Fleeing to Mexico, Joe is imprisoned by General Verdugo, who is waging a war against the Yaqui Indians. When Lyedecker attempts to intervene, he is thrown into prison as well. Working together, the two escape and take refuge in the hills, where Lyedecker meets beautiful Yaqui freedom fighter Sarita and begins to question his allegiances.','/slmaFStLZ0RMaWopC1xMT125cXy.jpg','1969-03-26',110,'Released','All they need is… 100 RIFLES','100 Rifles',37308,4.6693,5.9,'CJReENn1fuY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5451,_binary '\0','/yg3Xn8n7NbCnL2OLYMYgRV1inCl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063977',4.6,1843,'en','Der heiße Tod','Female prisoners endure the horrors of drug abuse, prostitution and rampant sadism at an island prison. When an escape attempt goes awry, the fugitives discover that escaping can be as dangerous as remaining in the prison.','/ly5TqICjfQxjEQJGmNBoZKlBhRY.jpg','1969-03-05',99,'Released','99 WOMEN... behind bars -- without men!','99 Women',28277,2.595,5.4,'NtF4XmSWtEI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5452,_binary '\0','/n1s3vhFSxpMYrBCjSNyr4izBxKu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063979',5.8,1244,'it','A doppia faccia','After a businessman\'s unfaithful wife is seemingly killed in a car accident, he is led by several unscrupulous characters to believe that she is actually alive.','/5F6lgRBQTvqDZWuJHd52NTNXYE2.jpg','1969-07-04',88,'Released','Lies. Betrayal. Murder. That’s Marriage!','Double Face',133941,2.4485,5.8,'qZH_frbjIsY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5453,_binary '\0','/e9VGO5hPvLQltVnibjbQ2LS0fpQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0063991',6.3,4231,'en','Age of Consent','An elderly artist thinks he has become too stale and is past his prime. His friend (and agent) persuades him to go to an offshore island to try once more. On the island he re-discovers his muse in the form of a young girl.','/rgNg90MAqNsmdwkNAKzB3iMzPyW.jpg','1969-05-13',108,'Released','Let yourself go... they do!','Age of Consent',49225,3.0096,5.966,'RGZSby00WXs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5454,_binary '\0','/pndZd2kOaIGus7uB6BjfnssXqmX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064000',6.2,1298,'en','Alfred the Great','While Old England is being ransacked by roving Danes in the 9th century, Alfred is planning to join the priesthood. But observing the rape of his land, he puts away his religious vows to take up arms against the invaders, leading the English Christians to fight for their country. Alfred soundly defeats the Danes and becomes a hero. But now, although Alfred still longs for the priesthood, he is torn between his passion for God and his lust for blood.','/qYQBfJ0igsaecCRjnxp8BYjuyIK.jpg','1969-10-08',122,'Released',NULL,'Alfred the Great',73672,1.9752,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5455,_binary '\0','/gSxBpt9YVANM9NdLoVeAfZCIot6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064002',6.3,4987,'en','Alice\'s Restaurant','After getting kicked out of college, Arlo decides to visit his friend Alice for Thanksgiving dinner. After dinner is over, Arlo volunteers to take the trash to the dump but finds it closed for the holiday, so he dumps the trash in the bottom of a ravine. This act of littering gets him arrested and sends him on a bizarre journey.','/m3xifcmDpyuYfrm1tHuACBaLjlZ.jpg','1969-08-20',111,'Released','Every Generation Has A Story To Tell.','Alice\'s Restaurant',5638,2.1354,6.227,'jNBurHDrZwM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5456,_binary '\0','/zyLU9jHFS2IInPagitMfasDwss.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064030',7.4,8929,'en','Anne of the Thousand Days','Henry VIII of England discards his wife, Katharine of Aragon, who has failed to produce a male heir, in favor of the young and beautiful Anne Boleyn.','/u2p5SspAs1GqeuHXNXywryU3k37.jpg','1969-12-18',145,'Released','He was King. She was barely 18. And in their thousand days they played out the most passionate and shocking love story in history!','Anne of the Thousand Days',22522,3.8721,7.2,'c0pA8QMEEww','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5457,_binary '\0','/64hlgKVES4nDZlGQ1u7EjBBQlAW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064036',6.1,1832,'en','The April Fools','Newly-promoted if none too happily married Howard Brubaker leaves a rowdy company party early with the stunning Catherine, whom it turns out is herself unhappily married — to the boss. They spend an innocent night in New York becoming more and more attracted to each other, so that when Catherine announces she intends to leave her husband and return to Paris, Howard asks to go along too.','/99MXK0a8wyrK3qd695DcgLhdqhr.jpg','1969-05-28',95,'Released','He has a wife. She has a husband. With so much in common they just have to fall in love.','The April Fools',90563,2.4338,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5458,_binary '\0','/6UZfWXVY3c9p0JVsW6AH85gch55.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064038',8,2893,'ar','الأرض','Set in 1933, the mayor informs the peasants that the share of irrigation of their land will be split equally between them and feudal lord Mahmoud Bey. The peasants send Mohamed Effendi to submit a petition to the government. Mahmoud Bey then proposes a project that would require taking part of the peasants\' lands.','/serzJZX1jK5i8lYHEUcWxHJPknC.jpg','1970-01-26',135,'Released',NULL,'The Land',123648,1.2236,8.3,'MZnPrfYeeow','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5459,_binary '\0','/8tuIe9tMGsD47cgWdjux4aqdAaq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064040',8.1,29697,'fr','L\'Armée des ombres','Betrayed by an informant, Philippe Gerbier finds himself trapped in a torturous Nazi prison camp. Though Gerbier escapes to rejoin the Resistance in occupied Marseilles, France, and exacts his revenge on the informant, he must continue a quiet, seemingly endless battle against the Nazis in an atmosphere of tension, paranoia and distrust.','/aqNZWM9bspt8zaDvVRIRiWxRVJ7.jpg','1969-09-10',145,'Released','Betrayal. Loyalty. Collaboration. Resistance.','Army of Shadows',15383,5.8645,7.9,'GYl2I0vVok4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5460,_binary '\0','/1rXjkXSlZLwJVFGmOVS3EdtrcQR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064041',6.3,3612,'en','The Arrangement','An adman attempts to rebuild his shattered life after suffering a nervous breakdown.','/zBghjtl7pEF1D9LVIR2TN48yPP4.jpg','1969-11-18',125,'Released','If your wife insists you see it together, be careful.','The Arrangement',48612,3.2249,6.536,'ZSj7sYOUKUY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5461,_binary '\0','/uxYCY2cOUZXpcIztNkqIcmWVjc4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064045',6.4,4061,'en','The Assassination Bureau','In 1908 London, a women\'s rights campaigner discovers the Assassination Bureau Limited, an organization that kills for justice. When its motives are called into question, she commissions the assassination of its chairman. Knowing that his colleagues have recently become more motivated by greed than morality, he turns the situation into a challenge for his board members: kill him or be killed.','/mAQ8z14i2UyAd3NrMFxbeGz6Kpj.jpg','1969-03-09',112,'Released','Zeppelins. Bombs. Bordellos. Burials. You name It. We have It.','The Assassination Bureau',69526,2.2275,6.7,'9K3HfF9vUlQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5462,_binary '\0','/4i3ARgC2rak2NJJQB0kRmTCQl2I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064048',3.2,3017,'en','The Astro-Zombies','For devilishly mad \'astro-scientist\' Dr. DeMarco, a typical day involves run-ins with reanimated corpses, bloodthirsty solar-powered killer robot zombies, Chinese communist spies, and vicious Mexican secret agents. But when a bloody trail of young female murder victims leads an intrepid CIA agent to his door, things get really interesting.','/l6qLDiE98SAwAlpMwpTzX4tpH0N.jpg','1968-05-19',91,'Released','Dismembered Bodies, Transplanted Organs, Are Used To Create The...','The Astro-Zombies',27831,1.5037,3.6,'pnqpqntUt_Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5463,_binary '\0','/wRBjG7wFxb4ewOWKWAarfbKARtK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064068',7.7,8590,'ja','薔薇の葬列','In 1960s Tokyo, Gonda owns a bar in which the gay, cross-dresser, and trans scenes meet. Gonda is in a relationship with the madam of the bar, Leda. As the younger Eddie starts a passionate affair with Gonda, she ignites the jealousy of Leda, unaware of another kind of history between them.','/7cRQ6rSGajW2soWDr3voEN2rgYO.jpg','1969-09-13',105,'Released','Who\'s the fairest of them all?','Funeral Parade of Roses',1556,3.288,7.5,'EteaHqdX6hU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5464,_binary '\0','/6Ht821fxEaQ5f4MufKjY5Ks97Qk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064072',7,27166,'en','Battle of Britain','In 1940, the Royal Air Force fights a desperate battle against the might of the Luftwaffe for control of the skies over Britain, thus preventing an attempted Nazi invasion.','/98kyEWxcqqNrsaprUtPaQ4adsNG.jpg','1969-09-15',132,'Released','Never was so much owed by so many to so few.','Battle of Britain',11463,4.7971,6.8,'4d86cHhp65Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5465,_binary '\0','/5RgkfFx8jxprhbxJ8xob5tHE8FP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064073',6.5,1294,'it','Beatrice Cenci','In 1599 Italy, Beatrice Cenci is the teenage daughter of the crazed landowner and nobleman Francesco Cenci who keeps her locked up in the dungeon of his castle where he sexually abuses her. Beatrice plots with her stepmother, her besotted servant Olimpio, as well as a local bandit, named Catalano to plan Francesco’s murder.','/qarGydiRQfj6UwayEybuBJwOr7F.jpg','1969-11-14',99,'Released',NULL,'The Conspiracy of Torture',46768,1.811,6.4,'TdQU2awlCR0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5466,_binary '\0','/jNH0zURxnlmYbqnDGbNI3DicOxt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064074',6,2908,'en','The Bed Sitting Room','In the hazy aftermath of World War III, the fallout from a \'nuclear misunderstanding\' is producing strange mutations amongst the survivors, and the noble Lord Fortnum finds himself transforming into a bed sitting room.','/q2hbnDZI0R8myBsW0MLuA5et0px.jpg','1969-06-01',91,'Released','The great nuclear misunderstanding lasted 2 minutes and 28 seconds (including the peace treaty)','The Bed Sitting Room',26509,2.4076,5.9,'eABgavnUf9w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5467,_binary '\0','/3tFBMBgzMXQDBrxnhfK6UBLMZNq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064091',7,4498,'sh','Bitka na Neretvi','In January 1943 the German army, afraid of an Allied invasion of the Balkans, launched a great offensive against Yugoslav Partisans in Western Bosnia. The only way out for Partisan forces and thousands of refugees was the bridge on the river Neretva.','/wNgBGWnlfkXHAH06dcTCW5QVxm6.jpg','1969-10-07',175,'Released',NULL,'The Battle of Neretva',34449,2.9264,6.7,'cLJeOgkSQ7c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5468,_binary '\0','/abWke008aC7M7nAUrij9JTWPEXk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064100',6.8,8339,'en','Bob & Carol & Ted & Alice','After returning to Los Angeles from a group therapy session, documentary filmmaker Bob Sanders and his wife, Carol, find themselves becoming vigilante couples counselors, offering unsolicited advice to their best friends, Ted and Alice Henderson. Not wanting to be rude, the Hendersons play along, but some latent sexual tension among the four soon comes bubbling to the surface, and long-buried desires don\'t stay buried for long.','/8fDLuB1q3JycYJPK0F65OYO3lAX.jpg','1969-09-17',105,'Released','Consider the Possibilities','Bob & Carol & Ted & Alice',26520,4.719,6.3,'4LfRyUPgp-c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5469,_binary '\0','/8cyxP51631Pfi2yMfYafkcg7y7u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064106',7.3,10553,'fr','Le Boucher','An unlikely friendship between a dour, working class butcher and a repressed schoolteacher coincides with a grisly series of Ripper-type murders in a provincial French town.','/An2gkXn5TATag9Adul2Zbq5Ndrv.jpg','1970-02-27',93,'Released','An outstanding new film by one of France\'s leading directors.','The Butcher',2912,3.6333,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5470,_binary '\0','/zV6S39vCyV7VuUaRWC3dsDQT9An.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064107',7.3,6254,'en','A Boy Named Charlie Brown','Poor Charlie Brown. He can\'t fly a kite, and he always loses in baseball. Having his faults projected onto a screen by Lucy doesn\'t help him much either. Against the sage advice and taunting of the girls in his class, he volunteers for the class spelling bee.','/whBPKLOJnFhuPxxLKmGstqxY3fP.jpg','1969-12-04',86,'Released','Charlie Brown and the Peanuts Gang in their First Movie!','A Boy Named Charlie Brown',15374,2.9576,6.962,'SjIEWmqD3xc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5471,_binary '\0','/3ar6tWdgjxViSdpyc6pHMKFP93O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064110',6.7,11928,'en','The Bridge at Remagen','In March of 1945, as the War in Europe is coming to a close, fighting erupts between German and American troops at the last remaining bridgehead across the Rhine.','/ez04diSu5hw9jl74fYaY0C2SBK4.jpg','1969-06-25',117,'Released','Thus ended the last great German stand in the West.','The Bridge at Remagen',15873,4.134,6.733,'qb-dUGyv4W0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5472,_binary '\0','/C6jcUqld8M6hZQmzBxgwHuQ4qT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064115',8,239757,'en','Butch Cassidy and the Sundance Kid','As the west rapidly becomes civilized, a pair of outlaws in 1890s Wyoming find themselves pursued by a posse and decide to flee to South America in hopes of evading the law.','/gFmmykF1Ym3OGzENo50nZQaD1dx.jpg','1969-09-23',111,'Released','Not that it matters, but most of it is true.','Butch Cassidy and the Sundance Kid',642,12.8058,7.6,'YdJW2UxvSFQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5473,_binary '\0','/u5IhDThM1SClL4pkCUp8hOmsDQJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064116',8.5,387745,'it','C\'era una volta il West','As the railroad builders advance unstoppably through the Arizona desert on their way to the sea, Jill arrives in the small town of Flagstone with the intention of starting a new life.','/qbYgqOczabWNn2XKwgMtVrntD6P.jpg','1968-12-21',166,'Released','There were three men in her life. One to take her… one to love her —and one to kill her.','Once Upon a Time in the West',335,18.9607,8.263,'Yw-Av9BpC-w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5474,_binary '\0','/53E3lEu32AULE4elVrfAQ8lcLkS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064117',7.2,13546,'en','Cactus Flower','A dentist pretends to be married to avoid commitment, but when he falls for his girlfriend and proposes, he must recruit his lovelorn nurse to pose as his wife.','/oabi6jdkxP3KHMNywKn6nQeDzQZ.jpg','1969-12-16',103,'Released','The prickly stage success that convulsed audiences around the world... with all its barbed wit and the sharpest comedy cast of the year!','Cactus Flower',28289,4.3121,7.2,'gA_rg02cCFU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5475,_binary '\0','/2pEegRXaVCdRYFp0b2CucFhILDn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064118',7.4,11101,'it','La caduta degli dei','In the early days of Nazi Germany, a powerful noble family must adjust to life under the new dictatorship regime.','/ncrB07xLfGzbw10JE1vjQ7gQIT8.jpg','1969-10-30',158,'Released','He was soon to become the second most powerful man in Nazi Germany.','The Damned',41876,4.9247,7.3,'MFRZZ2k2iGk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5476,_binary '\0','/tp4e21dbGJlRAQ6gmjjYZLCVdAm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064132',6.2,3360,'en','Carry On Again Doctor','Dr. Nookey is disgraced and sent to a remote island hospital. He is given a secret slimming potion by a member of staff, Gladstone Screwer, and he flies back to England to fame and fortune. But others want to cash in on his good fortunes, and some just want him brought down a peg or two.','/qOmUS5fdhjT8nnQI1WiMOyGDm9J.jpg','1969-12-05',85,'Released','Their latest laughter operation!','Carry On Again Doctor',19293,1.9822,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5477,_binary '\0','/13O70o7hy1JvqhYmltIxxzP6iI7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064133',6.6,6594,'en','Carry On Camping','Sid and Bernie keep having their amorous intentions snubbed by their girlfriends Joan and Anthea, so when they decide to take them on a holiday to Paradise Camp, they think they\'re off to a nudist colony—but they couldn\'t be more wrong, and meet up with the weirdest bunch of campers you can imagine.','/t1lFHqOXCJW5yo6MK5d7EdnnJsL.jpg','1969-05-29',88,'Released','Fun and games in the great outdoors!','Carry On Camping',19307,2.3245,6.586,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5478,_binary '\0','/dBuOwc53TIVNGHnR6KEPs9YYnKE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064137',6.1,3798,'en','Castle Keep','During the Battle of the Bulge, an anachronistic count shelters a ragtag squad of Americans in his isolated castle hoping they will defend it against the advancing Germans.','/sPoTOlu4OkLtszFAftmcSgbO3SX.jpg','1969-07-23',105,'Released','A one-eyed major and his oddball heroes fight a twentieth-century war in a tenth-century castle!','Castle Keep',45522,2.556,5.741,'6GSaesy7ZIA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5479,_binary '\0','/prLH9OrtVjTBUM5vGT0rcrtXFOj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064146',6.8,4803,'fr','Le Cerveau','Arthur and Anatole are two little robbers. They want to rob money, money that will travel in a special train from Paris to Bruxelles. They don\'t know that other people have planned to do the same thing.','/wCtaWDaOiGPVEoo7tiPBSH7sQx9.jpg','1969-03-07',115,'Released','The Brain has rocked the world with laughter!','The Brain',33436,2.8801,7.3,'D4dZ0dG1a_g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5480,_binary '\0','/9R0u13JM7MZ4p6QF6NTQiX1v1xq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064147',7.6,1305,'es','El Chacal de Nahueltoro','Based on an actual murder case that ignited a furious debate over the death penalty in Chile in 1960, this experimental social drama portrays the life and death of an illiterate peasant who, while drunk, murdered the woman with whom he had a relationship and her five children.','/tjcWfo5AJgU7TIyG5TFTpVhgS0t.jpg','1970-05-04',95,'Released',NULL,'Jackal of Nahueltoro',72855,1.1437,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5481,_binary '\0','/gyxFK1IW5WexDR520OMaxiuRcsz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064148',5.6,1590,'en','The Chairman','An American scientist is sent to Red China to steal the formula for a newly developed agricultural enzyme. What he is not told by his bosses is that a micro-sized bomb has been planted in his brain so that should the mission ever look likely to fail, he can be eliminated at the push of a button!','/xBEt1EGaR0wUI1VW1dWrgrRRZ0V.jpg','1969-06-25',93,'Released','If the Red Chinese don\'t kill him... a computer in London will!','The Chairman',107353,2.196,5.5,'yC-G7oDLLa8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5482,_binary '\0','/zORmU0HMcXIpuHLKDV2tmN1eQf1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064155',5.7,2753,'en','Charro!','Vince Hackett\'s gang steals a prized victory canon from Mexico and blames the deed on ex-member Jess Wade, who wants to go straight.','/xNokTbYDZf1FslFqFmPUjjytTjR.jpg','1969-03-13',98,'Released','On his neck he wore the brand of a killer. On his hip he wore vengeance.','Charro!',18688,2.4062,5.4,'QrPw9SVNYWw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5483,_binary '\0','/2OdvdoXyaLktZejlvcZZtvDtf7b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064160',5.3,1403,'en','Cherry, Harry & Raquel!','In a small border town, a sheriff and his \'associate\', involved in an operation in which they divert marijuana through the border, must kill another smuggler who has gone into business for himself.','/gzPVbOSvGuS0KWBA8wf4omeFF4i.jpg','1969-11-26',72,'Released',NULL,'Cherry, Harry & Raquel!',5742,1.2966,5.4,'ifs6fNhPRVI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5484,_binary '\0','/tlrIYO67FDjnHEJNXpmhVVJGO45.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064165',7.4,6419,'fr','Les Choses de la vie','The mind of Pierre Bérard, a successful middle-aged architect, is torn between his unstable present with Hélène, his younger lover, and his happy memories of the past with Catherine, his ex-wife; but his true destiny awaits him at a crossroads on his way to Rennes…','/nC3b7VV5YcSkAF6WteQL8EF4lme.jpg','1970-03-13',89,'Released',NULL,'The Things of Life',3423,4.907,7.074,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5485,_binary '\0','/1gNfZauhTpNWRmwtKlJZBqT34fd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064169',7.4,10653,'fr','Le Clan des Siciliens','An ambitious mobster plans an elaborate diamond heist while seducing the daughter-in-law of a ruthless mob patriarch as a determined police commissioner closes in on all of them.','/uVBbDPbm1H4Z9M7uZ976KFaAjDR.jpg','1969-12-05',121,'Released','Behind every gun is \"The Sicilian Clan!\"','The Sicilian Clan',4235,4.2979,7.6,'Vtx6Y1L1hO8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5486,_binary '\0','/grBJX0e4bczD1uHjPOIwiP9j9IN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064175',5.5,4185,'it','La collina degli stivali','Victims of oppressive town boss Honey are offered help by an unusual alliance of gunmen and circus performers','/9gnmBJi9ioGo1WeQP6Hii02u9Aq.jpg','1969-12-20',86,'Released','Where Nobody Died of Natural Causes!','Boot Hill',12529,3.5597,5.901,'MzXmNuyHWlo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5487,_binary '\0','/3eV9l3HhOGOytCilHJOACDL9DIT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064177',7.1,11873,'en','Colossus: The Forbin Project','The U.S. has handed over control of its nuclear defense system to the Colossus supercomputer designed by scientist Dr. Charles Forbin. It soon becomes clear, that the now-sentient Colossus is far more intelligent than its creator realized—with the fate of the world hanging in the balance.','/kmVDlTzERxSvBrqtQurjKf1zEy1.jpg','1970-04-08',100,'Released','This is the dawning of the Age of Colossus (where peace is compulsory... freedom is forbidden... and Man\'s greatest invention could be Man\'s greatest mistake).','Colossus: The Forbin Project',14801,4.4328,6.945,'kyOEwiQhzMI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5488,_binary '\0','/44NMw8AjDERQbL7R2dSbqJdOopK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064186',6,1558,'it','Così dolce... così perversa','An industrialist\'s affair with a troubled woman entangles him in a dangerous situation with her abusive boyfriend. His glamorous life spirals into unexpected peril.','/eE6iMygmNuMCyGZXbtvZLanN2PS.jpg','1969-10-31',89,'Released',NULL,'So Sweet... So Perverse',75958,2.3211,5.6,'EdIrSmV7YWQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5489,_binary '\0','/9FbiHF7JcBNxeNrOgHa1kRlioZU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064208',7,11069,'it','Da uomo a uomo','Bill Meceita, a boy whose family was murdered in front of him by a gang, sets out 15 years later to exact revenge. On his journey, he finds himself continually sparring and occasionally cooperating with Ryan, a gunfighter on his own quest for vengeance, who knows more than he says about Bill\'s tragedy.','/qjvb8IYBaqizU1GG1qmGtMJpkBK.jpg','1967-08-31',115,'Released','This is revenge... and there\'s nothing sweet about it!','Death Rides a Horse',49397,3.837,6.975,'KibMV5nhfaM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5490,_binary '\0','/vN26L95ODtdtRJnmBahAluF24iu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064217',6.3,1915,'en','Death of a Gunfighter','In the turn-of-the century Texas town of Cottonwood Springs, marshal Frank Patch is an old-style lawman in a town determined to become modern. When he kills drunken Luke Mills in self-defense, the town leaders decide it\'s time for a change. That ask for Patch\'s resignation, but he refuses on the basis that the town, on hiring him, had promised him the job for as long as he wanted it. Afraid for the town\'s future and even more afraid of the fact that Marshal Patch knows all the town\'s dark secrets, the city fathers decide that old-style violence is the only way to rid themselves of the unwanted lawman.','/jwJLZQXMkemwKMr5lu8rhZM8HrJ.jpg','1969-04-25',94,'Released','Marshall Patch... he lived by the law of the gun...','Death of a Gunfighter',74333,2.852,6.3,'NtqZ2KO48AY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5491,_binary '\0','/7Wqx3w9sdhUNBOucQK6HRbxsoI1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064225',6.9,2220,'fr','Dernier domicile connu','Marceau Léonetti, a competent and energetic officer stops by chance the son of an influential lawyer driving under the influence of alcohol. A few months later, the lawyer falsely accuses Léonetti as being violent and incompetent. As a result Marceau is transferred to a small police station, where he meets young and beautiful Jeanne. Soon they are faced with a tough investigation.','/aTKwyIFMxwCcsWoeuUxIZqWcedU.jpg','1970-02-25',102,'Released',NULL,'Last Known Address',70967,1.9825,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5492,_binary '\0','/eUtvsWC2Vj7hFvnvkxdavTdTzjM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064240',6,1432,'it','Django il bastardo','A Confederate soldier returns from the dead to take revenge on three officers who betrayed his unit in battle.','/gtzylsOLaSkMGZDBiFb5PGbrT9A.jpg','1969-11-08',99,'Released','From Hell... the Stranger Comes Back!','Django the Bastard',92312,1.6014,5.9,'qGyy4wFzXaY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5493,_binary '\0','/5oRRWumsuTrvMlBc6Mx9fChx3t2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064253',6.3,6621,'en','Downhill Racer','An ambitious young skier, determined to break all existing records, is contemptuous of the teamwork advocated by the US coach when they go to Europe for the Olympics.','/cIHcteKsKc05fYYdXRctnpN9aT5.jpg','1969-11-06',101,'Released','How fast must a man go to get from where he\'s at?','Downhill Racer',33166,2.8815,6,'ZXFKRZQAW10','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5494,_binary '\0','/kb3wnJV4MARi7XivGaD0EShqHHQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064256',7,2653,'pt','O Dragão da Maldade contra o Santo Guerreiro','A new incarnation of Cangaceiro bandits, led by Coirana, has risen in the badlands. A blind landowner hires Antônio to wipe out his old nemesis. Yet after besting Coirana and accompanying the dying man to his mountain hideout, Antônio is moved by the plight of the Cangaceiro’s followers. The troubled hitman turns revolutionary, his gun and machete aimed towards his former masters.','/fOoqqn5A2XoPLblvAPpujRonzZm.jpg','1969-06-14',100,'Released','God created the land, Satan built the fences','Antonio das Mortes',74349,2.149,6.753,'ZM4XOWnpsDw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5495,_binary '\0','/id6fZ93uPO3QnySFXOxQXNSyjJL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064265',7.1,1673,'zh','獨臂刀王','After the events of The One-Armed Swordsman (1967), a retired Fang Gang is drawn back into the jianghu to protect various young apprentices whose swordsmanship schools have been terrorized by 8 evil swordsmen seeking to rule the jianghu.','/qupi6LGWSMSTaZHWPYUyAyVplLx.jpg','1969-02-28',106,'Released',NULL,'Return of the One-Armed Swordsman',48300,2.609,6.6,'MGYtWsud5AQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5496,_binary '\0','/hQ54aaK3sNQczZv36EXkqGZFnO1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064273',6.7,2087,'it','E Dio disse a Caino…','An innocent man sentenced to ten years in prison for a crime he did not commit, is released from jail, promising to seek revenge on the guilty.','/zUChj5zgTRmbkWwskTtHznN2gUg.jpg','1970-02-05',101,'Released','The darkest western ever made','And God Said to Cain',77165,2.824,6.654,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5497,_binary '\0','/qvTmYyYsv71qTq5syAq24k1kGk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064276',7.2,123589,'en','Easy Rider','Wyatt and Billy, two Harley-riding hippies, complete a drug deal in Southern California and decide to travel cross-country in search of spiritual truth.','/3H3vwPGX6EbBRffIVHp3eHHcjka.jpg','1969-06-26',96,'Released','A man went looking for America and couldn’t find it anywhere...','Easy Rider',624,8.0658,7,'IlfpTppsR0U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5498,_binary '\0','/siuwx1J6sQ1Hqe3KHQ270CaHGky.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064285',7.4,9632,'fr','L\'Enfant sauvage','The true story of Victor of Aveyron. In a French forest circa 1798, an abandoned child — feral, filthy and mentally impaired — is found. Dr Jean Marc Gaspard Itard becomes interested in the case and patiently attempts to civilise the boy.','/ivIyyc2VgefJK9LdAogl1BEgmeH.jpg','1970-02-26',83,'Released','At last an adult film to which you can take your children.','The Wild Child',1627,2.6436,7.1,'yddJBd6D2lo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5499,_binary '\0','/zEPVHPVN72OMOAbngjDjkkPKQdJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064296',7.4,2479,'ja','エロス＋虐殺','Two interwoven stories. The first is a biography of anarchist Sakae Osugi which follows his relationship with three women in the 1920s. The second centers around two 1960s students researching Osugi\'s theories.','/v8n58R9xGy6LXEV9LGuiRpTBe97.jpg','1969-03-13',216,'Released',NULL,'Eros + Massacre',78117,1.8948,7.3,'NWVrSxivE1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5500,_binary '\0','/r7NK5DmF7SwDG9sZpc98LaPGogw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064300',6.5,2130,'it','Un esercito di cinque uomini','At the behest of local revolutionaries, a mercenary enlists four specialists in various combat styles to help him rob a Mexican Army train carrying $500,000 in gold.','/5NSCCCQn06UfkKap9rIXL5g7GPG.jpg','1969-10-16',105,'Released','They\'re riding to a trainload of Mexican gold... and they don\'t care how many killings it takes to get there!','The 5-Man Army',38670,2.5552,6.6,'Ed764yEk9Co','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5501,_binary '\0','/AhtLLGynwv2JXcOV2V8jzMYAPRk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064310',6.1,1552,'en','Eye of the Cat','A man and his girlfriend plan to rob the mansion of the man\'s eccentric but wealthy aunt. However, the aunt keeps dozens of cats in her home, and the man is deathly afraid of cats.','/zoHaQFwqdZj5iusFoCE4w06D7MI.jpg','1969-06-18',102,'Released','Terror that tears the screams right out of your throat!','Eye of the Cat',121401,2.6384,5.5,'ixQPkzbt-NM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5502,_binary '\0','/1Q8AKdjbaHQUU8xk7CpXFSOXFn3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064323',7.3,5318,'fr','La Femme infidèle','A man begins to believe his wife is cheating on him.','/eHNBnXqj5g03l1Hi7U1MVCdTvFb.jpg','1969-01-22',94,'Released','A psycho-sexual study in murder!','The Unfaithful Wife',8286,4.6673,6.899,'zFrbk4dsRDY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5503,_binary '\0','/ab68Ss1zgyfTqLpG0alV1GUulIm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064338',3,2538,'en','The Castle of Fu Manchu','The evil mastermind Fu Manchu plots his latest scheme to basically freeze over the Earth\'s oceans with his diabolical new device. Opposing him is his arch-nemesis, Interpol\'s very British Nayland Smith.','/cRRVPZ5TyBa5T9pZrepNthAumet.jpg','1969-05-29',92,'Released',NULL,'The Castle of Fu Manchu',3485,1.8744,3.6,'7AeCSkcfiwI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5504,_binary '\0','/732Q6M5iyCljGQjymNmGLkPXA3d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064356',7.8,8859,'fa','گاو','An old villager deeply in love with his cow goes to the capital for a while. While he\'s there, the cow dies and now the villagers are afraid of his possible reaction to it when he returns.','/9MVUDF3o1ihrWSgGSvkF7IPesF9.jpg','1969-01-21',105,'Released',NULL,'The Cow',43984,1.7887,7.674,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5505,_binary '\0','/yFC72NT2tNv6AUonYj1IpYHflMl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064360',4.4,3404,'ja','ガメラ対大悪獣ギロン','Two young boys sneak aboard a spaceship and find themselves whisked away to the mysterious planet Terra. There, they encounter Gamera\'s old foe Gyaos and two female aliens with a taste for human brains. Gamera must save the children and battle the new monster Guiron, whose entire body is a deadly living weapon.','/13Hn8vS45Ua0ex5dpVED5eQlqZi.jpg','1969-03-21',82,'Released','Controlled from the mysterious tenth planet, the immensely powerful Giant Demon Beast! The Earth is in danger! Launch the counter strategy, Gamera, you can do it!','Gamera vs. Guiron',26947,1.3975,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5506,_binary '\0','/kqMwIWVrWBqcN8XVIvtTVv6Rgeo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064366',5.8,1402,'en','Genesis II','A scientist who has been preserved in suspended animation wakes up to find himself in a primitive society in the future.','/lUuTI79hfzxdgywmP3O2wxOKTOm.jpg','1973-03-23',74,'Released',NULL,'Genesis II',56769,2.0602,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5507,_binary '\0','/xqdpC8d3VriU1o1WiItv1FJh1op.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064368',7.5,4156,'fa','قیصر','A young man\'s drive to avenge for his sister and brother.','/ibV6C3Jplus4VSvZROllO0sGOXk.jpg','1969-12-31',100,'Released',NULL,'Qeysar',256786,0.8055,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5508,_binary '\0','/t1h3SW4PP2l3AofpX367MAeIt7v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064373',3.9,6464,'ja','ゴジラ・ミニラ・ガバラ オール怪獣大進撃','Ichiro Miki is a child living in the industrial district of Kawasaki, where his parents\' constant struggle to make ends meet often leaves the schoolboy alone. Constantly teased by a bully nicknamed Gabara, his only friends are toy consultant Shinpei and fellow classmate Sachiko. Ichiro turns to escapist dreams of Monster Island where he befriends the equally bullied Minilla.','/f0LQ38Z1eAM0Hz8EbfyTF0oZZYF.jpg','1969-12-20',70,'Released','A Godzilla father-son crisis: the furious new monster Gabara appears, taking aim at the throne of Monster Island!','All Monsters Attack',39462,3.3038,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5509,_binary '\0','/tow4QVLS4qmC2GtNp7R1YwJgu6s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064379',6.1,1775,'en','The Good Guys and the Bad Guys','An aging lawman and an aging outlaw join forces when their respective positions in society are usurped by a younger, but incompetent Marshal, and a younger, but vicious gang leader.','/yqdCWEVwGHGFwAb0NqAH5WLPcEx.jpg','1969-10-10',91,'Released','The last of The Wildest Bunch shoots it out with a new breed of gunslinging glory-seekers.','The Good Guys and the Bad Guys',70191,3.5249,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5510,_binary '\0','/aiiWgt80uOVvW72eXOYAurZ79RR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064381',6.4,2595,'en','Goodbye, Columbus','A Jewish man and a Jewish woman meet, and while attracted to each other, find that their worlds are very different. She is the archetypal Jewish American Princess — very emotionally involved with her parents\' world and the world they have created for her, while he is much less dependent on his family. They begin an affair which brings more differences to the surface.','/yEfA6HiXipVZdHvxiagV6MxuDNS.jpg','1969-05-21',102,'Released','Every father\'s daughter is a virgin.','Goodbye, Columbus',42604,2.1831,5.4,'CEyNGiy94rY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5511,_binary '\0','/xOUAsYByQImHAjs9QXyoE4xhfvV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064382',6.8,4338,'en','Goodbye, Mr. Chips','Academy Award-honoree Peter O\'Toole stars in this musical classic about a prim English schoolmaster who learns to show his compassion through the help of an outgoing showgirl. O\'Toole, who received his fourth Oscar-nomination for this performance, is joined by \'60s pop star Petula Clark and fellow Oscar-nominee Michael Redgrave.','/2dDSbfOXvsuZyi5KSUbS3kKVmPU.jpg','1969-11-05',155,'Released','He is a shy schoolmaster. She is a music hall star. They marry and immediately have 283 children...all boys!','Goodbye, Mr. Chips',42607,2.8181,6.8,'52t3sIdNTWk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5512,_binary '\0','/wRjADWjD5mE0N6KFOkfDnkslDDB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064387',7.6,2931,'ja','御用金','A guilt-haunted samurai warrior attempts to stop a massacre taking place.','/5X0oO5Lg5OmYRd2zsGfxTaSFXEp.jpg','1969-05-01',124,'Released',NULL,'Goyokin',49355,2.3463,7.486,'gNmryODkwsc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5513,_binary '\0','/nOVqSy3uyY9IhzqXN6DO1Ufl5BU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064390',7.5,1585,'fr','Le Grand Amour','Pierre married Florence, the only daughter of a small industrialist. 15 years later, he is the boss, but his middle-class life worries him a lot. When a new young and lovely secretary comes, he starts dreaming.','/aLKBgO0HXkY4cYX4XE35oemETwR.jpg','1969-03-21',87,'Released',NULL,'Le Grand Amour',138906,1.7005,6.55,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5514,_binary '\0','/fLrntTx2ta90QhnMZpMnuhKxdTM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064393',4.9,4344,'en','The Green Slime','A giant asteroid is heading toward Earth so some astronauts disembark from a nearby space station to blow it up. The mission is successful, and they return to the station unknowingly bringing back a gooey green substance that mutates into one-eyed tentacled monsters that feed off electricity. Soon the station is crawling with them, and people are being zapped left and right!','/3MWnOwcLeySNqPtHpxqr7bJTZE5.jpg','1968-12-19',90,'Released','The Green Slime are coming!','The Green Slime',29290,2.3002,5.3,'Kvybkv4ccs0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5515,_binary '\0','/fhdgjlWESBa9B4G3PDhrXSJo1gK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064395',5.8,3810,'en','Guns of the Magnificent Seven','When Mexican revolutionary leader Quintero is left to rot in jail by the forces of President Diaz, it\'s up to his subordinate, Max, to bust him out. With $600 in hand, he crosses the border into America and hires Chris Adams, a mercenary of considerable skill, who uses the rest of the cash on more hired guns. After the team is rounded out by experts on close-combat fighting, explosives, and knife-throwing, they set off to free Quintero.','/moFQCPRHvMGfvoFbF5lqEQw9ETX.jpg','1969-07-14',105,'Released','The Magnificent Seven are back ...and they don\'t aim to please.','Guns of the Magnificent Seven',12625,4.0742,5.405,'-M34TbyG8Pc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5516,_binary '\0','/mFF0OIM0FTlT58teE2bUX7IoTBx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064397',6.3,2797,'en','The Gypsy Moths','Three skydivers and their travelling thrill show barnstorm through a small midwestern town one Fourth of July weekend.','/ojSarHMxAFII9qAEC4tnN7PfLNT.jpg','1969-08-29',107,'Released','The Gypsy Moths fall fast. They can\'t stop risking their lives - not even for their down-to-earth women.','The Gypsy Moths',64079,2.6562,6,'Dg_eYSQlM28','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5517,_binary '\0','/twXk9QlXitnYNvlIU0ClaigO9eu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064403',6.6,1877,'en','Hannibal Brooks','A POW in World War II is put to work in a Munich zoo, looking after an Asian elephant. The zoo is bombed by the Americans and the director of the zoo decides it is not safe for his Asian elephant Lucy to remain there. So he sends Brooks to safety with Lucy. They escape and go on the run in order to get to Switzerland.','/y4wG7BG6anYd4XTyKZ75N6ZEJt3.jpg','1969-01-18',102,'Released','If Hannibal Did It...So Could Brooks!','Hannibal Brooks',26972,1.7944,6.4,'I51Jy0dhlNQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5518,_binary '\0','/vXC52hXEcQYp0fyrZLzk9YYt6H8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064405',6.3,1492,'en','The Happy Ending','When Fred asked for Mary\'s hand in marriage, she thought she had the happy ending she only read about in fairy tales. Now it\'s 16 years later; Fred has had an affair, and Mary drowns her sorrows in pills and booze, a dangerous combination that nearly resulted in her death the year before. As Mary rushes off to the Bahamas for a relaxing escape from her crumbling marriage, she reflects on the past and wonders just where it all went wrong.','/2xFRXsgk7o0LD6X3LxmTQPBQJ0F.jpg','1969-12-21',112,'Released','Marriage is a 30 billion dollar business! And that\'s just to get married.','The Happy Ending',94608,1.6622,6.1,'leKfStS5pE8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5519,_binary '\0','/ocesZs2joS6MqTXRWmRGqNIF56p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064409',6.3,1264,'en','Heaven with a Gun','Jim Killian arrives in a small Arizona town hoping to establish a peaceful life as the local preacher, but he soon finds himself in the middle of a feud between sheep ranchers and cattlemen. Leloopa, a young Native American woman, pleads for Killian\'s help after her shepherd father is hung by Coke Beck, the vicious son of the head cattle rancher. Killian must weigh his actions carefully lest he perpetuate the cycle of retribution and revenge.','/bwqCdQmOrQuVOuhKaYELqONlwlX.jpg','1969-05-20',98,'Released','Jim Killian killed like an artist. This is the story of his masterpiece.','Heaven with a Gun',1790,2.6919,5.481,'NIvnH2xrGkk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5520,_binary '\0','/ybi3LVVyXVRQUDz9xos2YM24Gnj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064418',7.1,18783,'en','Hello, Dolly!','Dolly Levi is a strong-willed matchmaker who travels to Yonkers, New York in order to see the miserly \"well-known unmarried half-a-millionaire\" Horace Vandergelder. In doing so, she convinces his niece, his niece\'s intended, and Horace\'s two clerks to travel to New York City.','/aPZOt9BR3gnk1RyX924ySq81S4P.jpg','1969-12-12',148,'Released','Come anytime for the time of your life!','Hello, Dolly!',14030,7.0237,6.983,'OYxJKrl3uHQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5521,_binary '\0','/yoIwxm5PlsHfK6DfqdRdZN7A6t9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064425',6.6,7475,'fr','Hibernatus','Hubert de Tartas\' life becomes a complete muddle when his wife\'s grandfather is unearthed after having spent 65 years in frozen hibernation in the polar circle. After being de-frosted, the Hibernating Man believes it is still the beginning of the century. Nothing is spared to keep that illusion alive. At the end of his rope, Hubert blurts out the truth and takes the man from Edwardian times on a crazy spree through an ultramodern Twentieth Century.','/dQTG9gwSgaGD9T8vukNFPMOcBh0.jpg','1969-09-10',82,'Released',NULL,'Hibernatus',2462,3.8265,6.7,'NmcJAbceXWw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5522,_binary '\0','/kqApyWGEEbO45HbOBMQN5T4K5aa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064429',7.5,2784,'en','High School','What really happens inside the walls of an American high school? Famed documentarian Frederick Wiseman answers that question in this peek inside Philadelphia\'s Northeast High School, where students constantly clash with teachers, and teachers wage their own battle against the administration. Delving into the everyday struggle teachers face to discipline their unruly charges, the audience is offered a glimpse into the highs and lows at an urban public school.','/d3R2ELJJJtsdC722O63BVLmcxSe.jpg','1969-05-14',75,'Released',NULL,'High School',60315,1.1349,7.2,'H7CjJuEBats','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5523,_binary '\0','/egrxDU6GM8Dv5u5e8Nm2Wlq7k2E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064437',6.9,6516,'en','The Honeymoon Killers','Martha Beck, an obese nurse who is desperately lonely, joins a \"correspondence club\" and finds a romantic pen pal in Ray Fernandez. Martha falls hard for Ray, and is intent on sticking with him even when she discovers he\'s a con man who seduces lonely single women, kills them and then takes their money. She poses as Ray\'s sister and joins Ray on a wild killing spree, fueled by her lingering concern that Ray will leave her for one of his marks.','/3n69M2qBFMWEYAOOQdvxYAaaDLM.jpg','1970-02-04',108,'Released','Love is a bitch...Called Martha.','The Honeymoon Killers',10237,1.6116,6.5,'rjPrNZxXUw0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5524,_binary '\0','/psJvUxK2WIiUpRIqnW6tsDS7wZc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064443',4.8,1476,'en','The Haunted House of Horror','Teenagers in an old mansion are being murdered one by one. The survivors must discover who among them is the killer before they\'re all finished off.','/xkebRdCNbogBYhdA3jhaF4qp7T.jpg','1969-07-15',91,'Released','Behind it\'s forbidden doors an evil secret hides!','The Haunted House of Horror',93929,1.578,4.9,'YwO45xwrFRI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5525,_binary '\0','/8Owq1pLkjT7YiKahStSh8VIKU6C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064451',7.5,8376,'zh','俠女','Yang Hui-zhen, a mysterious princess on the run from corrupt government officials, is joined in her endeavors by skilled Buddhist monks and an unambitious painter named Gu Sheng-zhai.','/pgveqayMFUIZbFqN87ghiKmmxt3.jpg','1970-07-10',180,'Released',NULL,'A Touch of Zen',44154,3.4339,7.608,'ccYoSiMHYUM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5526,_binary '\0','/osYndg7SOfCyYPpJnozAMlKDdzC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064462',6.9,1473,'en','I Start Counting','An English schoolgirl suspects the foster brother she worships is a serial killer.','/aMlhnvMc3wua4eZlAYjkP6TRFfm.jpg','1970-10-27',105,'Released','In the world of the nightmare, a little blood adds colour!','I Start Counting',96243,0.9998,6.5,'a9cTwHvEFm4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5527,_binary '\0','/gDs34xSi2zm1zb9dxRnVUw6NGOe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064471',6.3,2785,'en','If It\'s Tuesday, This Must Be Belgium','A group of travelers from the United States race through seven European countries in 18 days.','/ekeVazUMtejiDhuBiykEgbXUBsd.jpg','1969-04-24',105,'Released',NULL,'If It\'s Tuesday, This Must Be Belgium',11643,2.8304,5.9,'i9pvQyJshjs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5528,_binary '\0','/mZHo1jC2plAN6nuc1cdkt01yveQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064473',5.8,3769,'en','The Illustrated Man','A man who has a body almost completely covered in tattoos is searching for the woman who cursed him with the \"skin illustrations\". Each tattoo reveals a bizarre story, which is experienced by staring at the scene depicted. When the illustrated man meets a fellow tramp on the road a strange voyage begins.','/hxTncIosSPstrHNE9ynivvXfjI3.jpg','1969-03-26',103,'Released','Don\'t dare stare at the illustrated man.','The Illustrated Man',25874,1.7136,5.6,'fXhnKTgzCrs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5529,_binary '\0','/xERm1ZTUJPzd07D01nh4UQciWaf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064482',7.4,2111,'en','In the Year of the Pig','Both sober and sobering, producer-director Emile de Antonio’s In the Year of the Pig is a powerful and, no doubt for many, controversial documentary about the Vietnam War.','/iXAeDRmDguZAl2QxaHv1YQ7G1u6.jpg','1969-02-26',101,'Released','WE ARE ALL \"A BLOODY GOOD BUNCH OF KILLERS\" ...','In the Year of the Pig',63951,1.1957,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5530,_binary '\0','/wUsHR0SuimjijNgfgitaKUlADaU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064494',5.2,2395,'es','De Sade 70','A young woman is lured to an island paradise, where she is drawn into a dark world of pleasure, pain, and murder under the control of a sinister figure.','/lKvSKZfYlWcFKvF5xC9mvrzYyQ4.jpg','1970-02-20',87,'Released','...the story of her journey into perversion','Eugenie',87503,3.4098,4.9,'Hg_tUY2mNEY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5531,_binary '\0','/wUeNS3fsxtDzGnCJizGnd4vu1lV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064498',8,2691,'hu','Isten hozta, őrnagy úr!','The Tóth family resides in Northern Hungary. The couple has a daughter and a son, the latter a member of the armed forces. When his weary major is ordered to take a vacation, the son talks him into a visit to his family home. Hilarity ensues when the Tóths go overboard trying to make things pleasant for the visiting major in hopes of an easier life for their son, the soldier.','/oSjxEkgwITSdpi7lIIIpxZ546g9.jpg','1969-11-29',95,'Released',NULL,'The Tóth Family',8776,1.4607,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5532,_binary '\0','/jkYdRAhshaRwiRAB4KdDz1Ocj4e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064505',7.2,54949,'en','The Italian Job','Charlie\'s got a \'job\' to do. Having just left prison he finds one of his friends has attempted a high-risk job in Torino, Italy, right under the nose of the mafia. Charlie\'s friend doesn\'t get very far, so Charlie takes over the \'job\'. Using three Mini Coopers, a couple of Jaguars, and a bus, he hopes to bring Torino to a standstill, steal a fortune in gold and escape in the chaos.','/8NOw3HPHkcBndJW2K6ofbcSb7WD.jpg','1969-06-02',100,'Released','Introducing the plans for a new business venture: \"The Italian Job.\"','The Italian Job',10536,7.4771,6.933,'Z0uN32GV1_c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5533,_binary '\0','/tzKi9KTO721pjXyAPbnioKJPuZL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064506',7.4,1348,'hi','Ittefaq','Taking place almost entirely over the course of one stormy night, a woman is terrified when an accused murderer escapes from a mental hospital and seeks refuge in her home.','/oBDwBk0Hxp3LXvLLTPRfp2mtXkH.jpg','1969-10-10',104,'Released',NULL,'Ittefaq',166874,1.0218,5.2,'MvL4S76iszI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5534,_binary '\0','/7dcsqrWaX0UwkdHB6kKeEIOh9IK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064513',6.6,2680,'en','John and Mary','John and Mary meet in a singles bar, sleep together, and spend the next day getting to know each other.','/1Uw1LUoDDhBpv9orJOEj1xQytRF.jpg','1969-12-14',92,'Released',NULL,'John and Mary',61742,2.6181,5.89,'am6r-xbqoxc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5535,_binary '\0','/yyAwhv0FU6BnMFwu0rKCJM1tVsX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064519',6.3,4433,'en','Doppelgänger','A planet is discovered in the same orbit as Earth\'s but is located on the exact opposite side of the sun, making it not visible from Earth. The European Space Exploration Council decide to send American astronaut Glenn Ross and British scientist John Kane via spaceship to explore the other planet.','/tW7Dr74ovic9wTAqoeRZy2SQ96L.jpg','1969-08-27',101,'Released','You will meet yourself face-to-face when Earth meets its duplicate in outer space!','Doppelgänger',40430,1.6712,6.2,'Zyv6n2TLWco','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5536,_binary '\0','/10fwnbvtPHEslBnsiXMISDkdPFF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064536',6.8,3341,'de','Katzelmacher','A group of young slackers spend most of their time hanging out in front of a Munich apartment building. When a Greek immigrant named Jorgos moves in, however, their aimless lives are shaken up. Soon, new tensions arise both within the group and with Jorgos.','/r3DoaIqMng1rhjen5gN3iiHB2fA.jpg','1969-11-22',90,'Released',NULL,'Katzelmacher',7736,2.1281,6.381,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5537,_binary '\0','/eWvxOS5g67B1b46Cff9TlYuJleY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064541',7.9,26583,'en','Kes','Bullied at school and ignored and abused at home by his indifferent mother and older brother, Billy Casper, a 15-year-old working-class Yorkshire boy, tames and trains his pet kestrel falcon whom he names Kes. Helped and encouraged by his English teacher and his fellow students, Billy finally finds a positive purpose to his unhappy existence.','/r1FMq75irhsQBVGjXhPU4xA9SDo.jpg','1970-04-03',111,'Released','They beat him. They deprived him. They ridiculed him. They broke his heart. But they couldn’t break his spirit.','Kes',13384,3.0778,7.4,'JTZwKbJgoDk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5538,_binary '\0','/8N1Idlj9tnnKRnTZsL3g36ew9gJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064542',8,1687,'et','Kevade','Paunvere parish school students Arno and Teele, Toots and Kiir, Tõnisson and Imelik experience feelings during one school winter, the traces of which they carry throughout their future lives - from true friendship and first love to self-discovery and clarifying life goals.','/miB1rYhgp7FUalSLeRAWyMYeNvc.jpg','1970-01-05',84,'Released',NULL,'Spring',46809,1.3003,6.6,'r9jUP_mGMuU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5539,_binary '\0','/t37NBV44eyILIqbgmI3umhPY0rV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064546',7.7,3444,'cs','Kladivo na čarodějnice','In the 1600s, an overzealous clergy hauls innocent women in front of tribunals, forces them to confess to imaginary witchery, and engages in brutal torture and persecution of their subjects.','/o7RsXmfWXWLQ5vZww2OsKg9rIQE.jpg','1970-01-23',107,'Released','Anyone who stands up for heretics is considered a heretic himself!','Witchhammer',62843,3.2998,7.6,'ZO8MBD6ctv4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5540,_binary '\0','/wAZX1Su9KBQK9jTDLn2jbGeEoHW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064553',8,1837,'ru','Король Лир','King Lear, old and tired, divides his kingdom among his daughters, giving great importance to their protestations of love for him. When Cordelia, youngest and most honest, refuses to idly flatter the old man in return for favor, he banishes her and turns for support to his remaining daughters. But Goneril and Regan have no love for him and instead plot to take all his power from him. In a parallel, Lear\'s loyal courtier Gloucester favors his illegitimate son Edmund after being told lies about his faithful son Edgar. Madness and tragedy befall both ill-starred fathers.','/iP4J0hWdkpK7PB18bQ1JU1LQzZm.jpg','1970-12-15',132,'Released',NULL,'King Lear',9554,1.3106,6.778,'r_ladIeqk5I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5541,_binary '\0','/vgnhNeV2gf9FZnvOiW9VRYHQ3NX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064555',5.5,2179,'en','Krakatoa, East of Java','A team of maritime salvage workers are about to embark on a recovery dive. However the 1883 Krakatoa Volcano eruption provides more pressing problems.','/4c5Z9DkivG1JrpWuO3y4ILloG2U.jpg','1969-03-17',131,'Released',NULL,'Krakatoa, East of Java',51104,2.6528,5.8,'FAh8QSGNmEY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5542,_binary '\0','/rJft7iU2WfNYJL4CxeRUxYPtp9b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064573',6.9,2593,'en','Last Summer','During summer vacation on Fire Island, three young people become very close. When an uncool girl tries to infiltrate the trio\'s newly found relationship, they construct an elaborate plot that has violent results.','/ajbvQYVVnYHixttt1Qgw0dd2mGA.jpg','1969-06-19',95,'Released','Last summer was too beautiful to forget... and too painful to remember.','Last Summer',38096,2.3359,6.2,'MWNPL090ERA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5543,_binary '\0','/she3ghUOGCIOiG00TN5cg5fkV8w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064579',7.2,1930,'en','The Learning Tree','The story, set in Kansas during the 1920\'s, covers less than a year in the life of a black teenager, and documents the veritable deluge of events which force him into sudden manhood. The family relationships and enmities, the fears, frustrations and ambitions of the black teenager in small-town America are explored with a strong statement about human values.','/kxA20n5Oiy4Xx9nAqeXAMJ00S2K.jpg','1969-08-06',107,'Released',NULL,'The Learning Tree',91737,1.5357,6.8,'hnnv5BsNxTM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5544,_binary '\0','/99z6hvmCj8vaKPhT2OXwkEV3N3u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064588',6.4,3846,'de','Liebe ist kälter als der Tod','Small-time pimp Franz is torn between his mistress and Bruno, the gangster sent after him by a shady crime syndicate he has refused to join.','/2X2id722AEOsf9xcZNgQnj8A3Cm.jpg','1970-01-16',88,'Released',NULL,'Love Is Colder Than Death',12482,2.1047,6.238,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5545,_binary '\0','/eilLY4PuoyEwFiKhKx79pVlFwTy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064591',5.8,1625,'en','Lions Love','Three actors in Hollywood live and love together. A director comes from New York to make a movie about actors and Hollywood.','/ahLU10GZeVLFg1KoC6wblOk8ZlW.jpg','1969-10-12',110,'Released','The Creators of \"Hair\" and \"Viva\" in a Film by Agnes Varda.','Lions Love',63320,2.1087,5.9,'9ve_oRoS8kY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5546,_binary '\0','/z8mx3V1anRp1Z0lNYQK8jsFV0ga.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064598',5.2,1238,'en','Twinky','A middle aged writer of pornographic novels meets and falls in love with a sixteen year old school girl. This alone is cause for concern but when the couple get married and move to America, the trouble (and fun) really begins.','/oT0Oujt6SZUv7WeOHUQir3LHq8C.jpg','1970-01-06',98,'Released','It may be love... but it\'s definitely exhausting!','Twinky',77925,1.5164,4.6,'IpRwolowGVE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5547,_binary '\0','/w6PpUETms1qZc4WJUqR7PuHpbTT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064603',6.5,19297,'en','The Love Bug','Down-on-his-luck race car driver Jim Douglas teams up with a little VW Bug that has a mind of its own, not realizing Herbie\'s worth until a sneaky rival plots to steal him.','/9Lc1efdYZUZia2zsRWcUkiD1KdN.jpg','1968-12-23',108,'Released','Herbie will honk his way into your heart.','The Love Bug',14136,6.8192,6.6,'gn3gK27HIsw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5548,_binary '\0','/7oVufFS6hDRfq5dh25zz0oVvf9u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064606',6.4,1218,'en','The Love God?','Ornithologist Abner Peacock sells off his modest-selling birdwatching periodical to a charlatan who turns it into a girlie mag, making it a massive financial success. After Peacock and the magazine are taken to court on obscenity charges, he unwillingly becomes a reluctant hero and ends up a swinging libertine.','/o7W7amRSCelwAvpxh7XJj75FO6.jpg','1969-08-01',101,'Released','So many women... Not enough man.','The Love God?',40721,1.847,6,'2sMNR1Uw0a8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5549,_binary '\0','/bLgWv6cux1SUYB0HO676buFqRbE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064609',7.1,1372,'es','Lucía','Traces episodes in the lives of three Cuban women, each named Lucía, from three different historical periods: the 1890s, the 1930s, and the 1960s.','/528i3iwgTxmR7HyGunUvgQKkM2Z.jpg','1968-10-01',161,'Released',NULL,'Lucía',88591,1.9794,6.4,'SZhsPBV2A1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5550,_binary '\0','/zNMMKmyZ2W5viK2iqbsRfaQIa2u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064612',7.8,16290,'fr','Ma nuit chez Maud','The Catholic Jean-Louis runs into an old friend, the Marxist Vidal, in Clermont-Ferrand around Christmas. Vidal introduces Jean-Louis to the modestly libertine, recently divorced Maud and the three engage in conversation on religion, atheism, love, morality and Blaise Pascal\'s life and writings on philosophy, faith and mathematics. Jean-Louis ends up spending a night at Maud\'s. Jean-Louis\' Catholic views on marriage, fidelity and obligation make his situation a dilemma, as he has already, at the very beginning of the film, proclaimed his love for a young woman whom, however, he has never yet spoken to.','/9usKgth3ROn4LwPQ7tTvxKnpBGL.jpg','1969-06-04',110,'Released',NULL,'My Night at Maud\'s',48831,3.5703,7.6,'AKzDv3UAGI8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5551,_binary '\0','/osqSUfyy3P2PwIRpi0C8XNFADfz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064615',6.7,10872,'en','Mackenna\'s Gold','A bandit kidnaps a Marshal who has seen a map showing a gold vein on Indian lands, but other groups are looking for it too, while the Apache try to keep the secret location undisturbed.','/uChjCbOKpoREb3yZrG1p8L3GyC7.jpg','1969-03-18',128,'Released','A Giant of a movie','Mackenna\'s Gold',18118,6.1086,6.6,'Q3XVYjhKU-U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5552,_binary '\0','/jF48zUgbw98Q5wSDyQFZ31ymwAf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064616',6.8,2409,'pt','Macunaíma','Born a fully grown black man in a village in the Brazilian jungle, Macunaíma later magically transforms into a white man before making an adventure-filled trip to the city of São Paulo. Once there, he becomes something of a dandy, falling in love with Ci, a revolutionary who dies in an accidental bombing. After robbing a ruthless industrialist, Macunaima returns to his village where he finds his newly acquired knowledge and possessions of little use.','/x04KJLU1alGon5xELPE5UpkwABz.jpg','1969-09-03',110,'Released','My! Such laziness!','Macunaima',68173,2.4644,6.925,'t0XqoeIOeVs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5553,_binary '\0','/dmtkVTXachXbaeYdJXqtK9lZv5M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064621',5.9,1297,'en','The Madwoman of Chaillot','An eccentric Parisian woman\'s optimistic perception of life begins to sound more rational than the traditional beliefs of others. The story is set in a 20th-century society endangered by power and greed and imagines the rebellion of the \"little people\" against corrupt and soulless authority.','/nWyMz5SThqKOeMBhc8xwOM5yNaj.jpg','1969-10-12',132,'Released','With the world getting ready to blow itself up, look who\'s minding the store.','The Madwoman of Chaillot',148662,2.0674,7.3,'tac737y2Wi4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5554,_binary '\0','/cC00hiG1zPdzm3eXVYnqaaGIl0z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064622',5.8,4233,'en','The Magic Christian','Sir Guy Grand, the richest man in the world, adopts a homeless man, Youngman. Together, they set out to prove that anyone--and anything--can be bought.','/92OHvXPieitIzkmPWbycCvclQ5E.jpg','1969-12-12',92,'Released','The Magic Christian is: antiestablishmentarian, antibellum, antitrust, antiseptic, antibiotic, antisocial & antipasto.','The Magic Christian',24152,2.5145,5.755,'WaLMsZU6NaY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5555,_binary '\0','/r90ndUtMyfmH8EtAj8vmhDPfhsg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064624',4.3,1720,'en','Maid in Sweden','Schoolgirl Inga goes to visit her sister in Stockholm and is shocked to find her living with her boyfriend, Casten.','/mI9hLOxGfx5bPgygQrdMMDR6NLu.jpg','1971-11-03',80,'Released','Inga at sixteen. Her coming of age.','Maid in Sweden',47570,3.4451,4.8,'32EWogEpmwQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5556,_binary '\0','/vcHuYZzFq4o9ctymFpq92Up6LHR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064638',6.4,4655,'en','Marlowe','Mysterious Orfamay Quest hires Los Angeles private investigator Philip Marlowe to find her missing brother. Though the job seems simple enough, it leads Marlowe into the underbelly of the city, turning up leads who are murdered with ice picks, exotic dancers, blackmailed television stars, and self-preserving gangsters. Soon, Marlowe\'s life is on the line right along with his case.','/CI9vFcMRcZNX9IJsUHmFOIV8jr.jpg','1969-09-19',96,'Released','Marlowe is the best private eye in the business. Just ask the people he does business with.','Marlowe',1846,2.5772,6.141,'GVPcxL8t8QM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5557,_binary '\0','/d5agxNrduE1LdnXmgN8QNRiSlL9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064639',5.9,6596,'en','Marooned','After spending several months in an orbiting lab, three astronauts prepare to return to Earth only to find their de-orbit thrusters won\'t activate. After initially thinking they might have to abandon them in orbit, NASA decides to launch a daring rescue. Their plans are complicated by a hurricane headed towards the launch site—and a shrinking air supply in the astronauts\' capsule.','/lFnHHKGzTXg4TND5YiS2KYs8AMJ.jpg','1969-12-11',134,'Released','Three marooned astronauts. Only 55 minutes left to rescue them. While the whole world watches and waits...','Marooned',40140,2.4064,6,'yjFg7fgjhNc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5558,_binary '\0','/pDEBGS3LiLrN3WqfCIlaIF702ob.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064645',6.2,1996,'en','Mayerling','Crown Prince Rudolf of Austria clashes with his father, Emperor Franz Joseph I of Austria, over implementing progressive policies for their country. Rudolf soon feels he is a man born at the wrong time in a country that doesn\'t realize the need for social reform. The Prince of Wales, later to become Britain\'s King Edward VII, provides comic relief. Rudolf finds refuge from a loveless marriage with Princess Stéphanie by taking a mistress, Baroness Maria Vetsera. Their untimely demise at Mayerling, the imperial family\'s hunting lodge, is cloaked in mystery.','/7yV66NIGGJO3Th7KCn8I21Atwtf.jpg','1968-10-31',140,'Released','No one woman could satisfy him...until he fell in love.','Mayerling',63888,3.0313,6.17,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5559,_binary '\0','/mUKnaWnd3pndy7PBtKu8aniGF6q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064651',6.5,1374,'en','Me, Natalie','Since she was a child, Natalie Miller has always thought she was an ugly ducking. Despite her mother\'s encouragement that she will grow up to be pretty, Natalie has never believed it will happen. She runs away to Greenwich Village to find herself and discovers a vibrant bohemian counterculture.','/6KAYtHlO618SmRqw10Q9QZSD8uf.jpg','1969-07-13',111,'Released','I guess I really didn\'t need help finding a husband... what I needed was help finding myself.','Me, Natalie',181553,2.7719,5.6,'EgILAXHoC-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5560,_binary '\0','/plMHzh9Mas5cfZZkmHGPQEaoN1I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064652',7.2,5253,'en','Medium Cool','John Cassellis is the toughest TV news reporter around. After extensively reporting about violence and racial tensions in poor communities, he discovers that his network is helping the FBI by granting them access to his footage to find suspects.','/uiRU2wJQh5x7q0HU3oBN0VbRMnt.jpg','1969-08-27',111,'Released','Beyond the age of innocence...into the age of awareness.','Medium Cool',42612,2.7702,6.6,'A4xCcPHPjps','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5561,_binary '\0','/wY04PHkTBqdlaEbsDj6cchfRL98.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064665',7.8,132813,'en','Midnight Cowboy','Joe Buck is a wide-eyed hustler from Texas hoping to score big with wealthy New York City women; he finds a companion in Enrico \"Ratso\" Rizzo, an ailing swindler with a bum leg and a quixotic fantasy of escaping to Florida.','/ckklq45UxUkwgHve9xItXqXr06r.jpg','1969-05-25',113,'Released','For those who have never seen it and those who have never forgotten it.','Midnight Cowboy',3116,7.3993,7.5,'o29GST0Lj28','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5562,_binary '\0','/kdVWfx8kv7m7CwJfSOfbP0Da3Fl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064674',6.4,1372,'fr','Mr. Freedom','Mr. Freedom, a bellowing good-ol\'-boy superhero decked out in copious football padding, jets to France to cut off a Commie invasion from Switzerland. A destructive, arrogant patriot in tight pants, Freedom joins forces with Marie Madeleine to combat lefty freethinkers, as well as the insidious evildoers Moujik Man and inflatable Red China Man, culminating in a star-spangled showdown.','/ae543dtPTLDBgDbNsVPkd0SDsOh.jpg','1969-01-08',92,'Released','Kill for love! Kill for freedom!','Mr. Freedom',27146,1.455,5.2,'R614shARgd8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5563,_binary '\0','/rjD9PqjeTxf3Q7U7dKYkKPHRDCV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064679',6.7,2451,'en','Model Shop','While trying to raise money to prevent his car from being repossessed, George is attracted to Lola, a Frenchwoman who works in a \"model shop\", an establishment that rents out beautiful pin-up models to photographers. George spends his last twelve dollars to photograph Lola, and discovers that she is as unhappy as he.','/yzwcXSS9vdmEiEr4vMsoc66PBzR.jpg','1969-02-11',95,'Released','Maybe Tomorrow. Maybe Never. Maybe.','Model Shop',85942,1.967,6.5,'5mEpkrmoWhQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5564,_binary '\0','/pZ00Rcw888SFzpjlAErm8uQWUuW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064683',5.8,1681,'en','Mondo Trasho','A day in the lives of a hit-and-run driver and her victim, and the bizarre things that happen to them before and after they collide (sexual assault by a crazed foot-fetishist, visions of the Virgin Mary, strange chicken-foot grafting operations).','/xnvM8CcJeICfCGGaipGqOpkJeFD.jpg','1969-03-14',95,'Released','At Last... A \"Gutter Film\"','Mondo Trasho',30645,1.1189,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5565,_binary '\0','/82TiaGlRjRAtWGpwVdMQmJek4tO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064687',4.2,1286,'es','Los monstruos del terror','Aliens from a dying world plot to conquer earth by preying on man\'s superstitions. Bringing two dead scientists back to life, they use their knowledge to re-animate various earth monsters, including the werewolf, Frankenstein\'s monster, the mummy Tao-Tet, and the vampire Count de Meirhoff.','/pN38R3xfr5J5Cqn66NA257BPocc.jpg','1970-02-24',87,'Released',NULL,'Assignment Terror',3216,1.7966,5.2,'dt1i9GXaIWw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5566,_binary '\0','/r7CCDKvb58DxC57v4XUZPe4k1TN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064688',6.1,2804,'en','Monte Carlo or Bust!','Sequel to \"Those Magnificent Men In Their Flying Machines\". This time an international car rally from England to Monte Carlo provides the comedic farce.','/10RJ70j2aZG4iboDoN6sbTTkI7v.jpg','1969-04-28',122,'Released',NULL,'Monte Carlo or Bust!',38792,2.7598,5.891,'FOgJOHX95L4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5567,_binary '\0','/qSiVTAtDU0kJd8KjHHpMfGusIMt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064689',7.9,5530,'en','Monterey Pop','Featuring performances by popular artists of the 1960s, this concert film highlights the music of the 1967 California festival. Although not all musicians who performed at the Monterey Pop Festival are on film, some of the notable acts include the Mamas and the Papas, Simon & Garfunkel, Jefferson Airplane, the Who, Otis Redding, and the Jimi Hendrix Experience. Hendrix\'s post-performance antics -- lighting a guitar on fire, breaking it and tossing a part into the audience -- are captured.','/wEB3c5Y5spAHOQaFWcsfFky3SWb.jpg','1968-12-26',80,'Released','Do you know where your kids are hanging out tonight?','Monterey Pop',42632,1.6499,7.4,'5uk0PbILVa0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5568,_binary '\0','/gBcz5u6LxdBtGoG55RHmmzBLRRc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064691',4.6,2199,'en','Moon Zero Two','On the Moon in the year 2021, a former-astronaut-turned-salvager helps a millionaire space industrialist capture a 6000-ton sapphire asteroid, while also assisting a woman in finding her missing miner/prospector brother','/1IIIKlNZXj9vVBrQXZeWttzFoNm.jpg','1969-10-26',101,'Released','The first moon \"western\"...','Moon Zero Two',26121,2.0056,4.9,'FFqhcpINLdE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5569,_binary '\0','/eaIxmSxWE00HkLbQgf0sqWMbLeS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064694',6.4,3498,'en','More','A German student, Stefan, now finished with his studies, hitchhikes to Paris. There he meets a free-spirited American girl, Estelle, who he follows to Ibiza. The two begin a sad and dark path into heroin addiction.','/kUwWvHuqJFWfYAREKQ52KNbHOxV.jpg','1969-08-04',117,'Released',NULL,'More',21323,2.0113,6.3,'RV-M-ryiDJw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5570,_binary '\0','/7MNRjrPnjCzcdksEI7yO3Ev2Jwh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064695',6.1,1316,'en','More Dead than Alive','When the multiple murderer Cain is released from prison after 18 years, he wants to settle down as a rancher and never touch a gun again. But his former life haunts him; not only that nobody wants to give him a job, some villains also want to pay him back. So he has to accept the offer of showman Ruffalo to perform as \"Killer Cain\" in his traveling shooting show. However after 18 years without practice even Ruffalo\'s young assistant Billy shoots better than Cain.','/uOBbYYb9gJYD0rrYZen2f8Ayxza.jpg','1969-01-15',101,'Released','Killers in pairs... death by the dozen... They left the west... More Dead than Alive.','More Dead than Alive',122160,2.0938,6,'BRyrnC-RC4w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5571,_binary '\0','/cioTeyYblLhnZY9l438ap8uNmH1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064699',5.7,2124,'en','Mosquito Squadron','England, World War II. Quint Munroe, RAF officer and new leader of a Mosquito squadron, is tasked with destroying a secret Nazi base in France while trying to overcome the disappearance of a brother-in-arms.','/4yWIuaT6PvKAyI6WVsUrgqUYm84.jpg','1969-08-22',91,'Released','Bomb it, but don\'t blow it!','Mosquito Squadron',26316,3.236,5.574,'ukodcpf3F5A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5572,_binary '\0','/q65a1LQKidDB8fQEAiaFZrpn6W1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064703',7.7,2223,'ar','المومياء','Set in 1881, a year before the start of British colonial rule, it is based on the true story of the Abd el-Rasuls, an Upper-Egyptian clan that had been robbing a cache of mummies they have discovered at tomb DB320 near the village of Kurna, and selling the artifacts on the black market. After a conflict within the clan, one of its members made a crucial decision when the Antiquities Service arrived.','/vyhW3umTG8qNrK4XjlXVtvpQ79F.jpg','1969-01-27',102,'Released','The day when the years are counted','The Night of Counting the Years',46707,1.2037,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5573,_binary '\0','/r0IHHwtbog17wBi1cnqmLUVzR0m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064704',6.4,1877,'en','Mumsy, Nanny, Sonny & Girly','A wealthy, fatherless British clan kidnap bums and hippies, forcing them to participate in an elaborate role-playing game in which they are the perfect family; those who refuse or attempt escape endure ritualistic murder.','/A45LM2gVGv1pbh5BRrfSS2ccTKa.jpg','1970-02-12',102,'Released','Everyone is dying to meet Girly','Mumsy, Nanny, Sonny & Girly',62108,2.0335,6,'CWyDlFpo-SU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5574,_binary '\0','/20l04YUnLuEdvbvNsFvDCzedNb7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064708',6.6,1278,'en','My Side of the Mountain','Thirteen-year-old Sam Gribley, a devotee of Thoreau, decides to leave the city to spend a sabbatical in the Canadian woods and see if he can make it as a self-sufficient spirit after his parents promise a summer trip that doesn\'t pan out.','/ne8InrFiWu6lbP4CgTuEX6u2sUc.jpg','1969-06-25',100,'Released','A boy who dreams of leaving civilization.','My Side of the Mountain',37437,2.098,6.8,'AZaXjkgYUEE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5575,_binary '\0','/j6Fwf8dNCmOyTAibitkgB8YWvsa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064727',5.2,1827,'it','Il trono di fuoco','In 1685 England, an overzealous Lord Chancellor condemns various rebels and \"witches\" to satisfy his political whims, ignorant of the true consequences of his actions.','/fIeZzM9b5tNklBpWCpMArAOgetI.jpg','1970-02-05',102,'Released','Horror will hold you helpless!','The Bloody Judge',42591,2.5633,5,'IKdFMl_lhIU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5576,_binary '\0','/xMs0p04vRzeECvhXtX5niuuwytN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064728',6,2747,'en','The Night of the Following Day','A gang of four professional criminals kidnaps a wealthy teenage girl from an airport in Paris in a meticulous plan to extort money from the girl\'s wealthy father. Holding her prisoner in an isolated beach house, the gang\'s scheme runs perfectly until their personal demons surface and lead to a series of betrayals.','/zDnXl0mME67bjhPVdLx1G9crd1g.jpg','1969-01-10',93,'Released','The Higher the Stakes, The Greater the Terror.','The Night of the Following Day',46495,1.9244,6,'wE38qDiz5Z0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5577,_binary '\0','/evbbd21rZZh0cZbrclA6SDC1EBn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064747',6,4549,'en','The Oblong Box','Evil lurks in the gloomy house at Markham Manor where a deranged Sir Edward is the chained prisoner of his brother Julian. When Sir Edward escapes, he embarks on a monstrous killing spree, determined to seek revenge on all those whom he feels have double-crossed him.','/6MHJRsWmY7rl3ub2ucoZcpGd7hF.jpg','1969-06-11',96,'Released','Some things are better left buried.','The Oblong Box',55152,2.9963,5.8,'AW2cvxbb4hA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5578,_binary '\0','/89CYP8nIIk9v9UAPFYgef8KXDOw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064754',7,3581,'en','Oh! What a Lovely War','The working-class Smiths change their initially sunny views on World War I after the five boys of the family witness the harsh reality of trench warfare.','/zLAYzMNOos506tcKYXxIDvupY5S.jpg','1969-03-10',144,'Released','The ever popular war games. With songs, battles & a few jokes.','Oh! What a Lovely War',21335,2.634,6.6,'h1n6nDqh774','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5579,_binary '\0','/jP7bzBpeyOOYSa20BDI6KGi90QD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064755',6.4,2221,'da','Olsen-banden på spanden','A good looking female social welfare worker makes Egon Olsen forget about crimes for some time, but when an American gangster breaks into a local bank and the police think its Egon\'s work, he has to get back to work to prove he\'s innocent.','/hnCzNCKjE2h4esd9UDoQWnY0MNR.jpg','1969-10-03',111,'Released',NULL,'The Olsen Gang in a Fix',12231,1.5679,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5580,_binary '\0','/1kdyLiE2Mqt7cxnivdPX3qckvfW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064757',6.7,110020,'en','On Her Majesty\'s Secret Service','With the help of Marc-Ange Draco, head of the Unione Corse crime syndicate, and Draco\'s troubled daughter Tracy, James Bond tracks his archnemesis, Ernst Stravro Blofeld, to a mountaintop retreat in the Swiss Alps, where he is training an army of beautiful, lethal women.','/m3KfbxvqaiAvRJ6MpguA3GuLdDQ.jpg','1969-12-18',142,'Released','Far up! Far out! Far more! James Bond 007 is back!','On Her Majesty\'s Secret Service',668,11.078,6.561,'U_-nD5r8dc0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5581,_binary '\0','/dZpyZxO0y9UwuiAXssGK0nUwGX3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064781',6.7,1435,'cs','Ovoce stromů rajských jíme','An experimental retelling of the story of Adam and Eve which then progresses into an allegorical depiction of the loss of innocence.','/m0S3Jek3a9l4LvtKkSzvZy96jbD.jpg','1970-07-31',99,'Released',NULL,'Fruit of Paradise',80080,1.7228,6.2,'czBMc4Gd6d4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5582,_binary '\0','/fhRurTei4K2T6dNeK3YxbGHuqmc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064782',6.6,16364,'en','Paint Your Wagon','A Michigan farmer and a prospector form a partnership in the California gold country. Their adventures include buying and sharing a wife, hijacking a stage, kidnapping six prostitutes, and turning their mining camp into a boom town. Along the way there is plenty of drinking, gambling, and singing. They even find time to do some creative gold mining.','/fwnYGuba3ZSM2bXwBZZs4DqqKTl.jpg','1969-10-15',164,'Released','Stake Your Claim To The Musical Goldmine of \'69!','Paint Your Wagon',20391,3.8666,6.3,'B0idoJnBAvk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5583,_binary '\0','/arvKnOUz6EvB5Do8EMD9MuwZYXp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064785',7.2,1977,'pl','Pan Wołodyjowski','In 1668 Polish colonel Michał Wołodyjowski, who recently retired to a monastery, is recalled to active duty and takes charge of Poland\'s eastern frontier defenses against invading Tatar hordes and Ottoman armies.','/bVkP1UzNLU0Xyoql0ssfwnFINBh.jpg','1969-03-28',148,'Released',NULL,'Colonel Wolodyjowski',126434,2.7689,7,'Qp_if0bauZ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5584,_binary '\0','/486bnOayPZKIGwXdMfdEosDxtrk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064787',6.3,1715,'it','Paranoia','A race-car driver who\'s down on her luck is invited by her ex-husband\'s wife to stay at their plush villa. The two women form a bond, and it\'s not long before their mutual dislike for the husband culminates into a plan to kill him. As it turns out, though, they\'re not alone in plotting murder.','/9WHSqOPwbhnLT2bE1cX9yYKBATI.jpg','1970-02-20',94,'Released',NULL,'A Quiet Place to Kill',105079,2.2139,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5585,_binary '\0','/b1HalxWanOZpc0r8ltrqFUWbx02.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064789',5.6,2494,'en','Paroxismus','After a jazz musician finds a woman\'s corpse washed up on the beach and remembers that he witnessed her murder at a party the previous night, a woman who bears a strong resemblance to her begins to exact revenge on the murderers.','/i6HBrexlMGUAIryakcTwqNB4TTU.jpg','1969-08-19',86,'Released','Venus in Furs will be smiling.','Venus in Furs',28287,1.3816,5.4,'M9leGU7oSFM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5586,_binary '\0','/5Sd6N00XTU26nUKQ2SWFFWjea9i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064791',6.6,4487,'fr','Le Passager de la pluie','Melancolie Mau is a lonely woman on the French seaside who falls victim to a horrific rape, but she manages to turn the tables and kill her attacker. She chooses not to tell anyone and dumps the body, but it comes back to haunt her when a U.S. colonel arrives, mysteriously armed with full knowledge about her ordeal. However, he seems to have his own agenda, and it may concern Melancolie\'s absent husband.','/1JwjP8BgNwXai42nt3x8UAlhPBw.jpg','1970-01-21',120,'Released','Who will he terrorise... Who will he attack... Who will be his next victim ?','Rider on the Rain',27889,3.0781,6.376,'vdIBeOovRSA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5587,_binary '\0','/gmbk9C6ge97Wx48lLnGq6TciaJF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064793',7.6,11432,'sv','En passion','A recently divorced man and an emotionally devastated widow begin a love affair.','/cr01316AyxUZyZrdLwzz3AXrgJc.jpg','1969-11-10',101,'Released','Man is the king of beasts...','The Passion of Anna',42602,2.5383,7.4,'v0nL84KIv90','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5588,_binary '\0','/9S49TBx6VhoLcBkjWDEBWjqYGK6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064806',6.8,3901,'en','The Phantom Tollbooth','A young boy named Milo unexpectedly receives a magic tollbooth and, out of boredom, drives through it and enters a fantastical, animated kingdom in turmoil following the loss of its princesses, Rhyme and Reason.','/totkDxL4QApB4xFr7gc1EdGkz7J.jpg','1970-11-07',89,'Released','It\'s an Alphabeautiful Mathemagical New Musical Movie!','The Phantom Tollbooth',28476,1.521,6.9,'pZ1ldmMzmvk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5589,_binary '\0','/2K7fr05VMRM20o6HsjxmUFZDcL3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064815',7.7,1568,'ka','ფიროსმანი','A biography of the Georgian primitive artist Nikoloz Pirosmanishvili (1862–1918), better known as Pirosmani, who died of starvation and sold his paintings to bars and restaurants for food and drink. The film experiments with color control techniques based on the painter’s style.','/xXCfzNcX0NcOgYeaB9hIXqDc0rB.jpg','1969-12-28',85,'Released',NULL,'Pirosmani',88302,1.0902,7.1,'j19L9QdVdZw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5590,_binary '\0','/pQpGA6XsWlmlAyicVIxVXHIW02P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064816',7.1,17442,'fr','La Piscine','Set in a magnificent villa near a sun-drenched St. Tropez, lovers Jean-Paul and Marianne are spending a happy, lazy summer holiday. Their only concern is to gratify their mutual passion - until the day when Marianne invites her former lover and his beautiful teenage daughter to spend a few days with them. From the first moment, a certain uneasiness and tension begin to develop between the four, which soon escalates in a dangerous love-game.','/pIR9bZM0bN1TwM1tppP7wZ2eJrL.jpg','1969-01-31',123,'Released','The most dangerous love-game ever played','The Swimming Pool',4946,6.3899,7,'Y0H1TAbHykE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5591,_binary '\0','/u2vv5T4lLtmu6xDHTEhssU2bjc7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064819',6.7,1281,'en','Pit Stop','Rick Bowman, a drag racing street punk, comes to the attention of crafty businessman Grant Willard. Willard bails him out of jail and offers him sponsorship as a stock car driver. Bowman accepts and enters the demolition derby-adjacent world of \"figure eight\" racing. As Bowman moves up in the ranks, his regard for his friends slips-- giving way to outright obsession with becoming the best.','/7IX7KbthFQ9CX9bdOyhinI9ygue.jpg','1969-05-14',91,'Released','Raw guts for glory! Flesh against steel!','Pit Stop',92378,1.277,6.9,'SkjIamryzCQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5592,_binary '\0','/e1o66REVW5T3JY0N7mHAaoFr7D5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064828',6.6,4396,'it','Porcile','Two dramatic stories. In an undetermined past, a young cannibal (who killed his own father) is condemned to be torn to pieces by some wild beasts. In the second story, Julian, the young son of a post-war German industrialist, is on the way to lie down with his farm\'s pigs, because he doesn\'t like human relationships.','/pWnvIB0yQPCd6R07TUeVvTyVu6X.jpg','1969-09-02',99,'Released','I killed my father, I ate human flesh, and I quiver with joy.','Pigsty',48688,2.0676,7,'c22GE3ldZ3o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5593,_binary '\0','/bOSnj6nVi8E1629IUEoC6sJbCQK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064839',7.7,1663,'ru','Преступление и наказание','Former student Raskolnikov is pushed to murder when struggling to pay the rent on his apartment. When the murder is being investigated by the police, Raskolnikov struggles between trying to hide his guilt and the pressure to confess.','/v4JMrsUr1bk9wci5DKdOQa3Pa24.jpg','1970-09-28',221,'Released',NULL,'Crime and Punishment',69631,1.3265,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5594,_binary '\0','/hBSQbL2VZV8BmH8wbzbFn3x8PFg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064840',7.6,11332,'en','The Prime of Miss Jean Brodie','A headstrong young teacher in a private school in 1930s Edinburgh ignores the curriculum and influences her impressionable 12-year-old charges with her over-romanticized worldview.','/lEZdKL17yneFK4dbbWPKcbkRbqM.jpg','1969-02-24',116,'Released','In the surprising world of Jean Brodie, there were two men and four girls.','The Prime of Miss Jean Brodie',5179,2.7089,7,'CXA0N55c3iw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5595,_binary '\0','/6B5RPhDV3NXgOKV7XZlHBYznz6q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064855',6.7,4827,'en','Putney Swope','Swope—the only black man on the executive board of an advertising firm—is accidentally put in charge after the death of the chairman.','/77hzrjyRGCuytrz6xYc8Cv2JPDy.jpg','1969-07-10',85,'Released','Up Madison Ave.','Putney Swope',32575,1.9055,6.3,'vO5aZjfOIPs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5596,_binary '\0','/myO1oP0NIGTBpSQuTb0uj5ROZwQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064860',6.5,5384,'it','I quattro dell\'Ave Maria','After Cacopoulos manages to save himself from being hung on a false charge, he robs Cat Stevens and Hutch Bessy of a lot of money and steals their horses. This results in a merry chase and Stevens and Bessy become unwilling allies in Cacopoulus\' revenge against the people who deserted him and framed him to get their money back.','/99t363dwsbQ6PXiz5lhGaKmzFCy.jpg','1968-10-02',132,'Released','Nobody beats Caco at his own game, because even if you win...you lose!','Ace High',11874,4.3728,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5597,_binary '\0','/p5iunm7nC06KjmGdnRxadCIhjzi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064861',7.6,5716,'fr','Que la bête meure','When his young son is killed in a hit and run accident, Charles Thenier resolves to hunt down and murder the killer. By chance, Thenier makes the acquaintance of an actress, Helène Lanson, who was in the car at the time of the accident. He then meets Helène’s brother-in-law, Paul Decourt, a truly horrible individual.','/4QEL8tsDBZkBq54AzpTyFE4yY50.jpg','1969-09-04',113,'Released','The House of Hatred and Revenge','This Man Must Die',2527,2.4846,7.337,'ImsAaCwoG0g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5598,_binary '\0','/zm5UNWMCJGGLEZzuGVoLDdM8Q1b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064866',7.1,6517,'it','Queimada','The professional mercenary Sir William Walker instigates a slave revolt on the Caribbean island of Queimada in order to help improve the British sugar trade. Years later he is sent again to deal with the same rebels that he built up because they have seized too much power that now threatens British sugar interests.','/4acIkXLazbf8LzduL9kj5f7q65q.jpg','1969-12-21',129,'Released','The man who sells war.','Burn!',42617,2.2379,6.79,'nd_WPdc2Mgg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5599,_binary '\0','/k5VMD0fpCB8CunTjzpHdjOp6Lqv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064873',6.8,4835,'en','The Rain People','When a housewife finds out she is pregnant, she runs out of town looking for freedom to reevaluate her life decisions.','/dDg4I79yb2VNdM3Vkh9oDOUROTc.jpg','1969-08-27',101,'Released','Rain people are very fragile…one mistake in love and they dissolve.','The Rain People',59231,2.5443,6.6,'o9XgOpsmLU8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5600,_binary '\0','/kmgjlZbGeiRzb5kW60yFBFCjp6E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064886',6.6,3595,'en','The Reivers','In turn-of-the-century Mississippi, an 11-year-old boy comes of age as two mischievous adult friends talk him into sneaking the family car out for a trip to Memphis and a series of adventures.','/s0XZmvjbS4meN86Jf1Retbo7GlB.jpg','1969-12-20',106,'Released','Boon is a reiver (that\'s a cheat, a liar, a brawler and womaniser) and he had just four days to teach young Lucius the facts of life (like cheating, lying, brawling and womanizing).','The Reivers',5928,2.5663,6.4,'b54hl_1msMY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5601,_binary '\0','/i3fdtDIpJ9uDsZcZHWoyWADb9DA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064888',6.8,5045,'es','La residencia','Southern France, 19th century. Teresa, a young girl, arrives at an isolated female boarding school that is tyrannically mastered by Mrs. Fourneau, the strict headmistress, whose protective shadow haunts Luis, her weak son.','/a6rUOhmr14mXx7pDRJskFv2GpH2.jpg','1969-12-01',100,'Released','One by one they will die!','The House That Screamed',64624,1.9761,6.5,'4WEbBmrhQGA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5602,_binary '\0','/9kCxNyZhmhCSzU7UM6RyhoWVgJu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064893',7.1,1806,'en','Ring of Bright Water','Stuck in a dead-end job, Graham Merrill adopts an otter, Mij, as a pet and then moves to an isolated village in western Scotland. Together they set out to explore the curious and magnificent natural wonders that surround their seaside home. Soon, Graham finds himself falling in love with the beautiful town doctor, Mary. Before long, the three become inseparable friends.','/sUI7ZkpgjzB8wTFP6ezn3u8FWjV.jpg','1969-06-18',107,'Released','The stars, the warmth, the pleasure of Born Free.','Ring of Bright Water',59427,1.8762,5.8,'Cvop3ayFwBA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5603,_binary '\0','/uUMv6QcTHz60WSKlLgy7NZZVDIe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064897',7,3754,'sv','Riten','Called to court on obscenity charges, a theatre troupe are forced to expose their neuroses and inner psychological torments.','/6rlNfkvnDbxtoDpKGxFmbJgWpfE.jpg','1969-03-25',72,'Released',NULL,'The Rite',65092,1.9315,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5604,_binary '\0','/saUc6DREYFuUDU0L2lUhcRKdIGC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064904',6.3,4952,'it','Il rosso segno della follia','A madman haunted by the ghost of his ex-wife carves a corpse-laden trail.','/6uzxm3EjilcpjVSVKb1DFdmSWjR.jpg','1970-06-02',83,'Released','When you chop - Aim well! Don\'t slip! And just make sure - She doesn\'t drip!','Hatchet for the Honeymoon',28050,2.1711,6.4,'PPIaXJiYLp0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5605,_binary '\0','/iNRwFcUFxzRXsy4jYm1JxLI9vps.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064916',6.7,6514,'it','Ehi amico... c\'è Sabata. Hai chiuso!','Several pillars of society have robbed an Army safe containing $100,000 so they can buy the land upon which the coming railroad will be built. But they haven\'t reckoned on the presence of the master gunslinger, Sabata.','/pbM3vxFTYIpz6BZg4OP5S9f5mKo.jpg','1969-09-16',106,'Released','The man with gunsight eyes comes to kill!','Sabata',52916,3.246,6.3,'AP4N3rnEnLc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5606,_binary '\0','/y9I304YATiOlL0EFCfTZ0b592kE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064921',7.6,6256,'en','Salesman','This documentary from Albert and David Maysles follows the bitter rivalry of four door-to-door salesmen working for the Mid-American Bible Company: Paul \"The Badger\" Brennan, Charles \"The Gipper\" McDevitt, James \"The Rabbit\" Baker and Raymond \"The Bull\" Martos. Times are tough for this hard-living quartet, who spend their days traveling through small-town America, trying their best to peddle gold-leaf Bibles to an apathetic crowd of lower-middle-class housewives and elderly couples.','/gQhe7uWygmAiQ6HNA7Jeys4wdbk.jpg','1969-04-17',90,'Released','The best seller and the world.','Salesman',27375,1.7232,7.2,'GMcrdhBJkvA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5607,_binary '\0','/jAQnzbR1c78VfGefpGGjK46iJLY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064923',5.9,2063,'en','Sam Whiskey','A widow hires an ex-gambler to retrieve gold bars from a sunken river boat in Colorado and discreetly return them to the Federal Mint, from where they had been stolen by her dead husband.','/ho9de3wKBBHUo5iCRlY8NJ8PrEy.jpg','1969-04-01',96,'Released','Don\'t mix with \"Sam Whiskey\" - It\'s risky!','Sam Whiskey',8693,2.1798,5.7,'CK-CIAbPVFg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5608,_binary '\0','/sxPoJwHBxyKz4briSY2Lbst5aJ9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064939',4.8,1268,'en','Satan\'s Sadists','The Satans, a sadistic biker gang led by Anchor, go to a diner in the middle of the California desert where they terrorize owner Lew, waitress Tracy, and the patrons. One patron manages to escape, and must reach a town before the Satans catch up to and kill them.','/3926XccZ9uUC54UrpD7jVQEzj9C.jpg','1969-06-01',86,'Released','Motorcycle maniacs on wheels','Satan\'s Sadists',37042,1.4726,4.8,'1R8rIF6iPK8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5609,_binary '\0','/kPdvXDdXIbuKKAt9gEy13FNYgbm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064940',6.8,18336,'it','Fellini – satyricon','After his young lover, Gitone, leaves him for another man, Encolpio decides to kill himself, but a sudden earthquake destroys his home before he has a chance to do so. Now wandering around Rome in the time of Nero, Encolpio encounters one bizarre and surreal scene after another.','/83urUMl04GtwuuGIFpezqzi7n6m.jpg','1969-09-18',129,'Released','Rome. Before Christ. After Fellini.','Satyricon',11163,3.3263,6.7,'8i9Z7r8dAFo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5610,_binary '\0','/endnZGuhTL42LVF9YnJvHMbz38Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064949',5.5,5103,'en','Scream and Scream Again','A serial killer who drains his victims of blood is on the loose and London police follow him to a house owned by an eccentric scientist.','/49m9QJ2ubKuVtdDj9B7XqgCyriv.jpg','1970-02-02',95,'Released','TRIPLE DISTILLED HORROR... as powerful as a vat of boiling ACID!','Scream and Scream Again',42594,2.2889,5.3,'BsRfJuGM518','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5611,_binary '\0','/eGUdHfchC6lS28OxECnNl1IHLUd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064952',7.2,4575,'en','The Secret of Santa Vittoria','During World War II, Italian villagers hide their wine from the German army.','/uX4xHo8GptvEbkch6i7OpWiM1L0.jpg','1970-01-02',139,'Released','In the beginning there was Bombolini the fool, Bombolini the drunk, Bombolini the joke. In the end there was Bombolini the mayor, Bombolini the hero, Bombolini the beautiful. In between is the secret of Santa Vittoria.','The Secret of Santa Vittoria',30298,3.0494,6.877,'8Afu1kOaHz0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5612,_binary '\0','/yJ4NVBNJCvyvYwgp1mIe4HfDKt1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064975',7.6,2883,'ja','心中天網島','Successful and married with children, paper-mill owner Jihei knows better than to contradict the strict social and moral codes of 18th-century Japan. But when he meets the lovely courtesan Koharu, he becomes a man obsessed. Koharu returns his love, even foregoing other customers while Jihei schemes to somehow buy her freedom. His efforts yield ruinous consequences for his business and his family life, and Koharu is meanwhile purchased by another client.','/xACR5JGGZsWCnP3j3CUOFhFpUoU.jpg','1969-05-24',105,'Released',NULL,'Double Suicide',45713,2.5471,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5613,_binary '\0','/bEe4xvjFr9kObNeBCw8kce3o047.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064990',6.9,8170,'fr','La Sirène du Mississipi','A tobacco planter on Réunion island in the Indian Ocean becomes engaged through correspondence to a French woman he does not know. The woman that arrives does not look like the picture he received, but he marries her anyway.','/l2jsT4bWzGZry34x4k5eNiSquhv.jpg','1969-06-18',123,'Released','The bride came as advertised... with an unadvertised special.','Mississippi Mermaid',1651,2.8906,6.631,'FsfrXLG_O_c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5614,_binary '\0','/fgXKispeCxrX38bQhK6XXJSXAe6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0064994',7.3,2429,'cs','Skřivánci na niti','In post-WWII Communist Czechoslovakia, several characters considered bourgeois are sentenced to work in a junkyard for rehabilitation. Among them is a young man who pines for a female convict.','/iyM7dduKJFIH8Ybydp7HYCbd5lI.jpg','1990-02-01',94,'Released',NULL,'Larks on a String',12078,1.3789,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5615,_binary '\0','/yPFPOAVqSwliShY6bzCxMoOpkxW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065019',6.4,1345,'it','Sono Sartana, il vostro becchino','Sartana is falsely accused of robbing a bank, and must find the real robbers and clear his name.','/aYBBwWdGATZ5xb4GppCiPvuP8YV.jpg','1969-11-20',102,'Released','Shoot quickly and live even faster!','I Am Sartana Your Angel of Death',64650,2.0775,6.368,'UPXKbxCXj8U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5616,_binary '\0','/hKdf1IDH9cKupBrCTN6E0k9lOxg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065026',6.3,1762,'it','Gli specialisti','Hud Dixon returns to his hometown when his brother is killed by a lynch mob.','/6vfaorXGPVHRFp025Ow2GZOEC5b.jpg','1969-11-25',104,'Released',NULL,'The Specialists',7507,3.0105,5.7,'PxvJJ3btrGw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5617,_binary '\0','/xZO1T2UC6Kad3d6DHgsf1WJUn7f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065032',6.6,3713,'en','The Stalking Moon','While moving a group of Apaches to a Native American reservation in Arizona, an American scout named Sam Varner is surprised to find a white woman, Sarah Carver, living with the tribe. When Sam learns that she was taken captive by an Indian named Salvaje ten years ago, he attempts to escort Sarah and her half-Native American son to his home in New Mexico. However, it soon becomes clear that Salvaje is hot on their trail.','/mKgo8n39VQh9JDqjKDJxBHteQUE.jpg','1968-12-25',109,'Released','He comes with the stalking moon. Silently. Relentlessly. And when he comes there is no place to hide.','The Stalking Moon',42685,3.1983,5.9,'syjx0qYNpNc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5618,_binary '\0','/7pTuDsXVjbYjo4oAS2Q76agg6Mo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065036',5,2916,'en','Stereo (Tile 3B of a CAEE Educational Mosaic)','A group of Canadian university students agree to partake in a grisly psychological experiment, which renders them incapable of speech but able to communicate telepathically.','/b0iWpWPBqZLHNCfhSEjvJH6UT3h.jpg','1969-06-23',65,'Released',NULL,'Stereo (Tile 3B of a CAEE Educational Mosaic)',33691,1.1724,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5619,_binary '\0','/oG8BHJO9JoKCyRfUSY0Y8XjcxLi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065037',6.7,2619,'en','The Sterile Cuckoo','Uptight college freshman Jerry Payne finds a carefree friend in zany Pookie. After an awkward meeting on the bus, Pookie quickly works her way into Jerry\'s life. She makes an unannounced visit to Jerry\'s campus, and before long annoyance turns to affection, and friendship turns to romance. But with Pookie\'s increasingly neurotic behavior, how long can this love affair last?','/8IP6hkHhmyVvgKPL8V37yjDMiAp.jpg','1969-10-22',107,'Released','First love... if it happens to you once, you\'re lucky','The Sterile Cuckoo',54494,1.5568,5.6,'cofPOcFtc6Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5620,_binary '\0','/pxTe8a3FapSaaAgo29iPMfnhkjp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065043',7.2,1951,'pl','Struktura kryształu','Two friends who used to study physics together are forced to make tough decisions as their lives take different paths.','/3YHF0GPd6VBUCgOg2Vvi4jkOMpK.jpg','1969-10-14',74,'Released',NULL,'The Structure of Crystal',167267,1.3451,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5621,_binary '\0','/nWe91B0iGdOc12cGB7Pks4HiKId.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065051',7.4,14841,'en','Support Your Local Sheriff!','In the old west, a man becomes a Sheriff just for the pay, figuring he can decamp if things get tough.','/7s8uz1dGA8JtPRSDg04zSYMUbnn.jpg','1969-03-26',92,'Released','Bad men... Bad ladies... Bad horses...','Support Your Local Sheriff!',11574,4.4943,6.9,'Icxh5FMcQRE',