 revenge, the count makes sure that the gentlemen are killed one by one by their own sons.','/hhK8KDZgtuvMYhC55keOrEsTwt1.jpg','1970-05-07',95,'Released','DRINK A PINT OF BLOOD A DAY','Taste the Blood of Dracula',29748,3.7773,6.1,'3AklIkFbn-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5626,_binary '\0','/zxSiL18jSx3Ef0gSE8o5Mq5SYKj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065079',6.3,3758,'en','Tell Them Willie Boy Is Here','While confronting the disapproving father of his girlfriend Lola, Native American man Willie Boy kills the man in self-defense, triggering a massive manhunt, led by Deputy Sheriff Christopher Cooper.','/jHgVrkklycUdjKtzGiKgGzwCEnl.jpg','1969-10-31',98,'Released','Tell them that old Indian fighter got his. Tell them I\'ll kill if I have to. Tell them they\'ll never take me alive.','Tell Them Willie Boy Is Here',42619,3.0549,5.8,'4Z2J5Rr1EVw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5627,_binary '\0','/6OrHLKigU5clo7Hir9RVPINN3vx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065086',7,2848,'en','That Cold Day in the Park','Frances Austen, a young, wealthy spinster, invites a mute teenager into her apartment after finding him freezing in the park next to where she lives. Despite her best efforts, their lack of communication only increases her sense of loneliness, as her possessiveness spirals into frightening new realms.','/tUcTRSXeU6mzlPqQ6i8vfWY3MhP.jpg','1969-06-08',107,'Released','How far will a woman go? How far will a 32 year-old spinster go to possess a strange, 19 year-old boy?','That Cold Day in the Park',66488,2.5775,6.613,'ESO3Ej4LQ3w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5628,_binary '\0','/aNGoAAVZWxyOLcGRBJb46nXDdDt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065088',7.8,22022,'en','They Shoot Horses, Don\'t They?','In the midst of the Great Depression, manipulative emcee Rocky enlists contestants for a dance marathon offering a $1,500 cash prize. Among them are a failed actress, a middle-aged sailor, a delusional blonde and a pregnant girl.','/7wVLBgriOQpT5RrufAFCdCSUp7M.jpg','1969-12-10',120,'Released','People are the ultimate spectacle.','They Shoot Horses, Don\'t They?',28145,5.0121,7.6,'ke-sWMXspNA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5629,_binary '\0','/tJyGzgJOSZx7PivGvPMDyU5Xng2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065106',6.6,2462,'fr','Tintin et le Temple du Soleil','When seven archaeologists find an ancient Inca temple, they become victims of an ancient curse. Back in Europe, one by one they fall into a deep sleep and only once a day, all at the same time, they wake up for a few minutes and experience hallucinations where the sinister living mummy of Rascar Capac appears.','/bSiuapguCBSjjF5Cqezj123F2J6.jpg','1969-12-13',78,'Released',NULL,'Tintin and the Temple of the Sun',241001,2.6315,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5630,_binary '\0','/3NSwwxsu8YXIqnGOrfREEsXWkT7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065112',6.2,21209,'en','Topaz','Copenhagen, Denmark, 1962. When a high-ranking Soviet official decides to change sides, a French intelligence agent is caught up in a cold, silent and bloody spy war in which his own family will play a decisive role.','/8u7vxykCVZoaxNocLbpstv3IFNK.jpg','1969-12-17',127,'Released','Hitchcock takes you behind the actual headlines to expose the most explosive spy scandal of this century!','Topaz',2370,4.3226,6,'mocX-_VeqRc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5631,_binary '\0','/84cJGth1MDICnDfDka2zMD89ZDX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065119',6.4,2520,'it','Un tranquillo posto di campagna','A painter facing a creative block arranges to spend the weekend in the country at his mistress\'s villa. While staying there, his sanity begins to disintegrate.','/jJWsQYRv3BDnAedG1viWdzlLJPK.jpg','1968-11-14',106,'Released','In a quiet place she strips away the structure of his mind and body... piece by piece.','A Quiet Place in the Country',92927,2.2451,6.3,'QJDZOc2Yvjc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5632,_binary '\0','/fVA7U7B6G17nDeJKFzR5CcJnF6c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065125',5.2,2020,'en','The Trouble with Girls','Chautauqua manager Walter Hale and his loyal business manager struggle to keep their traveling troupe together in small town America.','/hMGjplBCvmnpFTielOBvbNx82ym.jpg','1969-06-24',97,'Released','Elvis crosses the country...into trouble! trouble! trouble!','The Trouble with Girls',45598,2.7106,4.9,'OjKKvgckZa0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5633,_binary '\0','/i7n9u1SppzXcSO2EVgwEehzABzm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065126',7.4,54563,'en','True Grit','The murder of her father sends a teenage tomboy on a mission of \'justice\', which involves avenging her father\'s death. She recruits a tough old marshal, \'Rooster\' Cogburn because he has \'true grit\', and a reputation of getting the job done.','/lmexRC57l39elaIcnxhaHpcaIW2.jpg','1969-06-11',128,'Released','The strangest trio ever to track a killer.','True Grit',17529,7.8354,7.3,'ruTdCaAWTNA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5634,_binary '\0','/A3FXi0fWl2q0LIK4RVSE3aH8Y09.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065134',7,33320,'en','Two Mules for Sister Sara','When a wandering mercenary named Hogan rescues a nun called Sister Sara from the unwanted attentions of a band of rogues on the Mexican plains, he has no idea what he has let himself in for. Their chance encounter results in the blowing up of a train and a French garrison, as well as igniting a spark between them that survives a shocking discovery.','/2G9eM8UAM57TanLBhuPmz3jaNZG.jpg','1970-03-02',114,'Released','CLINT EASTWOOD...the deadliest man alive...takes on a whole army with two guns and a fistful of dynamite!','Two Mules for Sister Sara',11916,6.8722,7,'OiAYi9x7DmQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5635,_binary '\0','/uj4vPPQBsD4HXoltTgPysfhm4Qn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065143',7.1,27484,'it','L\'uccello dalle piume di cristallo','An American writer living in Rome witnesses an attempted murder that is connected to an ongoing killing spree in the city and conducts his own investigation, despite him and his girlfriend being targeted by the killer.','/dpALRkwodEIT7TGX9SqTgwVNn0i.jpg','1970-02-27',96,'Released','All the screaming in the world won\'t help!','The Bird with the Crystal Plumage',20345,4.1451,7.139,'8rWtIA-ogaI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5636,_binary '\0','/640XC826YZjf2NrqRjD1Kz9LnX6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065148',6.6,3174,'it','Una sull\'altra','A San Francisco doctor encounters a prostitute who bears a striking resemblance to his late wife.','/jHq7UY8edzYHoVjkhJVXln8sWYX.jpg','1969-08-15',108,'Released','What Is The Most Incredible Thing A Woman Ever Did For $1,000,000?','One on Top of the Other',2993,2.0571,6.438,'gvXUCXJConc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5637,_binary '\0','/e8Gg3x7XIUZ4kAyKCWawgrmYJBZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065150',6.6,8427,'en','The Undefeated','After the Civil War, ex-Union Colonel John Henry Thomas and ex-Confederate Colonel James Langdon are leading two disparate groups of people through strife-torn Mexico. John Henry and company are bringing horses to the unpopular Mexican government for $35 a head while Langdon is leading a contingent of displaced southerners, who are looking for a new life in Mexico after losing their property to carpetbaggers. The two men are eventually forced to mend their differences in order to fight off both bandits and revolutionaries, as they try to lead their friends and kin to safety.','/vWoGmFL5LvnF5rDgizfvPWyecmk.jpg','1969-10-04',119,'Released','Across 2000 Miles Of Savage Wasteland... They Lived A Thundering Adventure That Rocked Two Nations!','The Undefeated',18972,3.8562,6.3,'ROoapOp54xo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5638,_binary '\0','/bmkamz54GT5jqI6koWwybFzpdOh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065152',7.3,3472,'fr','Une femme douce','When his young wife commits suicide with no explanation, an introspective pawnbroker looks back on their life together.','/4YWHhIEQwqOaXuZ8IFe9NaZwrEt.jpg','1969-08-27',85,'Released',NULL,'A Gentle Woman',55836,1.8493,6.8,'5DizkYh_XtM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5639,_binary '\0','/jOQBhXQ9M9ZHDgZsE8xA1WhZKyl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065163',6.2,5753,'en','The Valley of Gwangi','A turn of the century wild west show struggling to make a living in Mexico comes into the possession of a tiny prehistoric horse. This leads to an expedition to the Forbidden Valley where they discover living dinosaurs. They capture one and take it back to be put on display, leading to inevitable mayhem.','/5RP7yHpTHsLlQEP8V3gji743Sbh.jpg','1969-07-19',96,'Released','Cowboys Battle Monsters in the Lost World of Forbidden Valley.','The Valley of Gwangi',42329,4.2183,7.1,'mJN5pDacIEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5640,_binary '\0','/ugcUpVTNiboHlAU06T8CA4AY5Wq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065168',5.4,2190,'en','La Vampire Nue','A young man falls in love with a beautiful woman being chased by sinister masked figures at night. He tries to track her down, and learns she\'s being held captive by his father and colleagues who believe she\'s a vampire.','/7CBqJsnDU31S8f04TwexzU7sRCR.jpg','1970-05-01',85,'Released',NULL,'The Nude Vampire',22480,1.9471,4.9,'0pyXAogB54U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5641,_binary '\0','/7ORlIcSqTrVFPTmOliBIU6K63nC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065180',7.7,1754,'et','Viimne reliikvia','A medieval love story with lots of adventures. The times are troubled - there\'s a revolt of peasants going on. To secure its safety a monastery chases for a relics of a holy Brigitte. A nobleman promises to get it if he gets beautiful Agnes as a reward. But she fells in love with a handsome adventurer. The monastery has to act shrewd now and play double game.','/d6qNZJg3Sv7cfzR2GGL9vQUxQrZ.jpg','1970-03-23',86,'Released',NULL,'The Last Relic',47150,1.9289,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5642,_binary '\0','/gV8L15s7RELeeBBUXglK8ysYJhH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065198',4.6,1865,'en','The Wedding Party','Young Charlie begins to develop cold feet as his wedding looms nearer. Desperate to throw the plans off-track, he tries a variety of tactics, including attempting to rekindle the relationship between his fiancée, Josephine, and her former boyfriend.','/vfEkKOCeFmfWwkuaO4wTvtM7E3.jpg','1969-04-09',92,'Released','You are cordially invited to join the confusion at...','The Wedding Party',74137,1.9232,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5643,_binary '\0','/kC5fbip6RL8uj8zwnMlg0OmloPE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065206',6.8,3200,'en','What Ever Happened to Aunt Alice?','An aging widow hides a deadly secret which she will do anything to keep buried.','/myKAhtxPkf8xyRBcBZOazR3dENW.jpg','1969-08-20',101,'Released','A horrific tale...with grave consequences!','What Ever Happened to Aunt Alice?',77571,2.1938,6.2,'D1-CAFAlNUI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5644,_binary '\0','/vzavBt9c6v4zBaGiwQDO21aNQG9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065207',7.6,67332,'en','Where Eagles Dare','World War II is raging, and an American general has been captured and is being held hostage in the Schloss Adler, a Bavarian castle that\'s nearly impossible to breach. It\'s up to a group of skilled Allied soldiers to liberate the general before it\'s too late.','/dnyiVS4Ad4w4rfS4Bm1YalEdonx.jpg','1968-12-04',155,'Released','One weekend Major Smith, Lieutenant Schaffer, and a beautiful blonde named Mary decided to win World War II.','Where Eagles Dare',11046,8.3249,7.524,'J80nOz7wFqY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5645,_binary '\0','/nkgWcfOeQnVnxak5xCKvkRDLt5H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065214',7.9,94770,'en','The Wild Bunch','An aging group of outlaws look for one last big score as the \"traditional\" American West is disappearing around them.','/8j9yEC3xjy1PJDSizIbaxcHaSph.jpg','1969-06-19',145,'Released','Unchanged men in a changing land','The Wild Bunch',576,6.766,7.59,'kdy0t_8mQBw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5646,_binary '\0','/wuZAk5sawu4sod4u2kf7f1fTLju.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065215',6.1,2412,'en','Winning','Frank Capua is a rising star on the race circuit who dreams of winning the big one - the Indianapolis 500. But to get there he runs the risk of losing his wife Elora to his rival, Luther Erding, and strains the relationship with his stepson.','/ynLLloFYEMjhxxpuGZTujYJg7yi.jpg','1969-05-22',123,'Released','Winning is... everything.','Winning',42621,2.0143,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5647,_binary '\0','/zL3WDqWMaIq7w5QZGsG5a04Gyio.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065225',5.5,4265,'en','The Wrecking Crew','When Count Contini attempts to destroy the world\'s economy by masterminding the theft of $1 billion in U.S. gold, ICE chief MacDonald summons secret agent Matt Helm to stop him.','/rvuQCsZBaZ1k254gubEojOz9zss.jpg','1968-12-30',105,'Released','Matt Helm Is Alive And Well And Swinging In Copenhagen--So Far!','The Wrecking Crew',3054,3.1302,5.7,'josGhZCiy1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5648,_binary '\0','/7dXhrAXJjpHoh66mymg6Po3gU6l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065230',5.7,1774,'en','Young Billy Young','A peace-loving man named Ben Kane takes a job as deputy marshal of Lords, in the old West. Kane is no lawman, but he accepts the badge because he has an old score to settle with the town\'s chief trouble-maker. Once on the job, Kane must also deal with a young sharpshooter named Billy Young and a sharp and sassy saloon dancer, Lily.','/rOCkCr7GbdaWaL1gf1pNJ3HPdsY.jpg','1969-10-15',89,'Released','Billy better learn fast... or die young!','Young Billy Young',39295,2.9835,5.9,'0BNQwlObe0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5649,_binary '\0','/omKgqKsmfcHihKshQAocj8Dzi6i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065233',7.1,2891,'ja','ゆけゆけ二度目の処女','Go, Go, Second Time Virgin is the story of two damned and abused teenagers who meet and fall in mutant love on a Tokyo rooftop. Their only hope is to cement their love with an escape into oblivion.','/b1vuQMFttcNxbBRP2FBsSy9H5PW.jpg','1969-01-01',66,'Released',NULL,'Go, Go Second Time Virgin',68429,1.6041,6.7,'9PocodGpmlo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5650,_binary '\0','/ofSyquvDw78bpOmDAwisAfQoBYQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065234',8.1,34427,'fr','Z','A prominent politician is murdered during a demonstration. The government and army are trying to suppress the truth, but a tenacious magistrate is determined not to let them get away with it.','/dFAJyFNgvOv24f2RQyI9KDxjGr3.jpg','1969-02-26',122,'Released','He is alive!','Z',2721,3.8214,7.8,'7E3QUHUMe5I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5651,_binary '\0','/f1VSYIc7svIliTfVtd8MJqqvhtT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065241',7.1,1915,'cs','Žert','In the 1950s, Ludvik Jahn was expelled from the Communist Party and the University by his fellow students, because of a politically incorrect note he sent to his girlfriend. Fifteen years later, he tries to get his revenge by seducing Helena, the wife of one of his accusers.','/koQFbDEnbq1JPZO4KrlQhdHjTSQ.jpg','1969-02-28',77,'Released',NULL,'The Joke',105627,1.0899,6.5,'xxbYHvPBuHE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5652,_binary '\0','/u0RDI1DwWsDq883peRTRAU3iVZ8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065261',7,2065,'sv','Ådalen 31','A film about the 1931 Ådalen shootings, in which Swedish military forces opened fire against labour demonstrators in the Swedish sawmill district of Ådalen.','/36nb5JRvhdaEcpE71LKexPtYIa1.jpg','1969-05-01',114,'Released',NULL,'Adalen 31',87208,1.1981,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5653,_binary '\0','/s1rdRZL08qdIO8ZMC1FHyoTrocM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065360',6.7,1527,'en','… tick… tick… tick…','Racial tensions threaten to explode when a black man is elected sheriff of a small, racially divided town in the Deep South.','/1zIfIunFL4TfsInTupiZ1TKUtwr.jpg','1970-01-09',100,'Released','Two men with nothing in common but the hate that surrounds them.','… tick… tick… tick…',85255,1.4238,6.7,'GwArCCZZq8I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5654,_binary '\0','/4h4UaUk0ENBR9mdttafE1q4fkeI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065377',6.6,25145,'en','Airport','An airport manager tries to keep his terminals open during a snowstorm, while a suicide bomber plots to blow up a Boeing 707 airliner in flight.','/6iOKluJfyiU1SLZbGYrY7Z0i6k0.jpg','1970-03-25',137,'Released','The #1 novel of the year - now a motion picture!','Airport',10671,4.4275,6.468,'PACKbKt8MOw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5655,_binary '\0','/dodmOh7FB8YPDOnmqBoP8TT43Wi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065391',6.5,2084,'de','Der amerikanische Soldat','Ricky returns to Munich from Vietnam and is promptly hired as a contract killer.','/9KPu8tFNptILYYfwTaWJ7ViabJE.jpg','1976-10-14',80,'Released','Trained to be the best','The American Soldier',48267,1.1105,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5656,_binary '\0','/dNODFGhiUphEPvhlyBzJHTbm4ze.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065396',7.3,1726,'el','Αναπαράσταση','An immigrant returns to his village after many years, only to find that no one is waiting for him. When his wife and her lover murder him, an investigator attempts to reconstruct the crime, while a film crew documents the event.','/jM3Gnf75zTrZGA9aIGoKWxdEmEi.jpg','1970-09-24',100,'Released',NULL,'Reconstruction',85769,1.1915,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5657,_binary '\0','/o2veMC5GcFcJwpM7hXIvYDmizo2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065398',6.6,4982,'en','And Soon the Darkness','Two young English women go on a cycling tour of the French countryside. When one of them goes missing, the other begins to search for her. But who can she trust?','/n6p6JmnIACFI5FVy9jUNmEe5dOE.jpg','1970-09-10',99,'Released','Remember the way Hitchcock kept you on the edge of your seat...?','And Soon the Darkness',51992,3.3869,6.5,'DmEOl29iy8c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5658,_binary '\0','/7CTx02MMqqcOBFsSCWM3HSbI20X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065416',7.6,2267,'hi','आराधना','Vandana\'s husband, Arun, gets killed in an air crash after they secretly get married but no one accepts their marriage. Thereafter, she is forced to put her child up for adoption and later work as his nanny to stay by his side.','/wpAYC3kWt9VpDDY2a3jWt4sF3wc.jpg','1969-11-07',169,'Released',NULL,'Aradhana',96732,1.1971,7.2,'-Q8mrKJ1Jps','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5659,_binary '\0','/pDmZPPCFvQOWXfxocGIStNY4vze.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065417',8,3504,'bn','অরণ্যের দিনরাত্রি','Four friends from Calcutta who have very different personalities make a holiday excursion into the country, to a tiny village in the state of Bihar where they set themselves up in a bungalow. A series of minor events, all connected to their respective reactions to their new environment, reveals their characters more deeply.','/lkaPfN95q8aaO8c0jUR6ytUhcwd.jpg','1970-01-16',117,'Released',NULL,'Days and Nights in the Forest',35867,2.0334,7.075,'r9Uf_t9FwV0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5660,_binary '\0','/rnMwOM8gMqo6Gf6XXMpaJEayUwk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065421',7.1,126869,'en','The Aristocats','When Madame Adelaide Bonfamille leaves her fortune to Duchess and her children—Bonfamille’s beloved family of cats—the butler plots to steal the money and kidnaps the legatees, leaving them out on a country road. All seems lost until the wily Thomas O’Malley Cat and his jazz-playing alley cats come to the aristocats’ rescue.','/aOWs5XMJEABN6SKCTJBCoeD1kCA.jpg','1970-12-24',78,'Released','Meet the cats who know where it\'s at... for fun, music and adventure!','The Aristocats',10112,12.7137,7.302,'-Rr9Ge2OUes','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5661,_binary '\0','/sZRR4sTJrXszqW6gGqg846FzuP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065436',6.7,6822,'de','Auch Zwerge haben klein angefangen','A group of tormented patients stage a coup at an oppressive, dismal asylum after they\'re not allowed out on an excursion.','/b0jmVC1a4LghH9BtzTPn1DELvBP.jpg','1971-02-02',96,'Released',NULL,'Even Dwarfs Started Small',11900,2.5273,6.4,'6RA3JrqEPRI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5662,_binary '\0','/cA8YAm0UHpKuWEO2UzlguG2WHSz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065439',7.8,5432,'fr','L\'Aveu','In 1950s communist Czechoslovakia, a government minister, a war veteran long a loyal party man, leads a relatively comfortable life with his wife. However, he soon finds himself under surveillance, then under arrest. Unclear what his offense is, agents for the totalitarian regime interrogate and torture him, aiming to use their unending power to gain a false confession for these supposed crimes against the state.','/m44QZwZKLq8HqAxhb6VibYj32bC.jpg','1970-04-29',139,'Released',NULL,'The Confession',60859,2.1845,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5663,_binary '\0','/4WfwZ5QLbyQccaaTDsJLs1Mt3By.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065446',7.2,11483,'en','The Ballad of Cable Hogue','Double-crossed and left without water in the desert, Cable Hogue is saved when he finds a spring. It is in just the right spot for a much needed rest stop on the local stagecoach line, and Hogue uses this to his advantage. He builds a house and makes money off the stagecoach passengers. Hildy, a prostitute from the nearest town, moves in with him. Hogue has everything going his way until the advent of the automobile ends the era of the stagecoach.','/bEth8XAYaytjzxnHkLkj4nZx2XD.jpg','1970-03-18',121,'Released','Cable Hogue says … “Do unto others … as you would have others do unto you.”','The Ballad of Cable Hogue',23330,4.1251,6.961,'z3WGlF07bAo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5664,_binary '\0','/7cWsn2jDe6nChJcMuGTkHjkZ7os.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065451',6.3,2375,'en','Barquero','Jake Remy leads a gang of outlaw cutthroats making their escape toward Mexico from a successful robbery. Barring their way is a river--crossable only by means of a ferry barge. The barge operator, Travis, refuses to be bullied into providing transport for the gang and escapes across river with most of the local populace--leaving Remy and his gang behind, desperately seeking a way across. A river-wide stand-off begins between the gang and the townspeople, both groups of which have left people on the wrong side of the river.','/qq9fkHnSbzzEVWOcnflwzcKpTRF.jpg','1970-07-29',110,'Released','How much is enough, Barquero?','Barquero',32142,2.3673,6.2,'cdmfT5Yo8Lc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5665,_binary '\0','/6xjIxq8nwdiRDKcBQZiumZXNmPX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065457',7.7,1429,'ru','Бег','The film is about a group of people who in other times wouldn\'t have anything in common, some of them innocent bystanders, some moral criminals. But nothing is straightforward and simple. From Russia \"the flight\" continues to Constantinople, to Paris, back to Russia. Some of them have understood that they can\'t live outside Russia and go back maybe to be happy, maybe not, some go back to face sure death for their crimes, some don\'t go back and know that are going to miss homeland forever, some are comfortably well off (are they?) in exile.','/j09rl0CS6cZSAOvEBVovK14g93W.jpg','1971-01-14',196,'Released',NULL,'The Flight',95431,1.6456,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5666,_binary '\0','/gxz2lWaekGbVu8ODCi2qeZyBX1g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065462',6,57029,'en','Beneath the Planet of the Apes','The sole survivor of an interplanetary rescue mission lands on the planet of the apes, and uncovers a horrible secret beneath the surface.','/szHCeYwi4ubewuYnlnz0YGqWnQC.jpg','1970-04-23',95,'Released','The bizarre world of \"Planet of the Apes\" was only the beginning...','Beneath the Planet of the Apes',1685,8.5588,6.15,'qOSEpi8K-XM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5667,_binary '\0','/4ms1JNHHpW4rwEXnjyhLN7IP0PZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065466',6.1,13134,'en','Beyond the Valley of the Dolls','An all-girl rock band moves to Hollywood in the hope of achieving success, only to fall into a whirlpool of wickedness and decadence.','/eslylQSssnNIV4f06fHtfxPTH3I.jpg','1970-06-17',109,'Released','This Is Not A Sequel. There Has Never Been Anything Like It!','Beyond the Valley of the Dolls',5722,5.6569,6.1,'xGy05ClqiL8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5668,_binary '\0','/oteKii22BdK9Q7zrTKLFBsnmVvB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065481',5.7,4320,'en','Bloody Mama','Sexually abused as a young girl, Kate \"Ma\" Barker grows into a violent and powerful woman by the 1930s. She lovingly dominates her grown sons and grooms them into a pack of tough crooks. The boys include the cruel Herman, who still shares a bed with Ma; Fred, an ex-con who fell in love with a fellow prisoner; and Lloyd, who gets high on whatever\'s handy. Together they form a deadly, bizarre family of Depression-era bandits.','/nC3hrqu28L6eEC88MIN4hccARod.jpg','1970-03-24',90,'Released','You gotta\' believe... You gotta\' have faith... But first, you gotta\' get rid of the witnesses!','Bloody Mama',31581,2.5671,5.6,'GJ5bTSq2ufQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5669,_binary '\0','/gygNkDF0mTdVaaRO8nTeXvJwjFA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065486',6.8,5759,'fr','Borsalino','In 1930s Marseilles two small-time crooks decide to join forces when they meet while brawling over a woman. Starting with fixed horse races and boxing matches, they soon find themselves doing jobs for the local gangster bosses. When they decide to go into the business for themselves, their easy-going approach to crime starts to change.','/yYmYPRswLysH9D1Qvy7diumFXG2.jpg','1970-05-19',125,'Released','They\'re going after what they want. And what they want is everything.','Borsalino',25251,2.8888,6.861,'_e7GoMZZBz4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5670,_binary '\0','/lpVmsGEWVAvQdzZObTxdidMX8le.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065488',7.6,6581,'en','The Boys in the Band','Harold is celebrating a birthday, and his friend Michael has drafted some other friends to help commemorate the event. As the evening progresses, an unexpected guest shows up, the alcohol flows, the knives come out, and dormant and unspoken emotions are unleashed.','/zgPdZZkM2EVOFlw3e7qEmZv6Po8.jpg','1970-03-16',120,'Released','... is not a musical.','The Boys in the Band',34377,2.4978,7,'WIeQwDRHrKc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5671,_binary '\0','/s3CRGd17e5bIoVLxMCttdcBylBc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065489',7.2,2167,'it','Brancaleone alle crociate','After saving an infant of royal blood, knight Brancaleone forms a new army and sets out to return the baby to his father: a prince fighting in the Crusades.','/4rEwjGJJfKiyykcNAYV2lUZqrnZ.jpg','1970-12-24',120,'Released',NULL,'Brancaleone at the Crusades',49321,1.939,7.226,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5672,_binary '\0','/qO7WHzj41jMuaZIu3zEXZnwndn1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065491',6.1,4573,'de','Hexen bis aufs Blut gequält','In 1700s Austria, a witch-hunter\'s apprentice has doubts about the righteousness of witch-hunting when he witnesses the brutality, the injustice, the falsehood, the torture and the arbitrary killing that go with the job.','/pbSXuasXM9wLL8xSq280TkGqmf8.jpg','1970-02-19',96,'Released','Positively the most horrifying film ever made','Mark of the Devil',39931,2.7814,6.1,'J6R3RQWpuow','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5673,_binary '\0','/5QRIsSdNkqKorBTyAeg6y9BTSgx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065492',6.8,6615,'en','Brewster McCloud','Brewster is an owlish, intellectual boy who lives in a fallout shelter of the Houston Astrodome. He has a dream: to take flight within the confines of the stadium. Brewster tells those he trusts of his dream, but displays a unique way of treating others who do not fit within his plans.','/3ASd8z3yn7jMAJS38VcAmIRzKQA.jpg','1971-08-18',105,'Released','\"Something else\" from the director of M*A*S*H','Brewster McCloud',26525,2.2064,6.3,'Y0kp4QfNlF8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5674,_binary '\0','/jzez1Ch2BnocjMwIHWy3H23xsu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065509',6.2,1224,'it','C\'è Sartana... vendi la pistola e comprati la bara','Sartana, bounty hunter and gunfighter, witnesses the robbery of a shipment of gold. He finds his way into town where he meets with a lot of suspicious stares from the locals. He also meets with Samuel Spencer, who seems to own the company in this company town. The gold shipments are being stolen, so Spencer agrees to hire Sartana to protect the next gold shipment. Numerous dull-witted villains make attempts on Sartana\'s life, but he survives. Eventually, Sartana\'s nemesis Sabbath (he of the white coat and parasol) rides into town. With a showdown inevitable, Sartana and Sabbath square off to settle the score.','/dQCWCJlAkCaKCZLKqCHmbN56gPc.jpg','1970-08-07',93,'Released','Fistful of Lead','Sartana\'s Here... Trade Your Pistol for a Coffin',83140,2.3793,6.4,'XNArIgrUkTQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5675,_binary '\0','/p0FYXIKgJ7t46dCVUpKKSxMQ9X3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065522',5.7,2090,'en','Captain Nemo and the Underwater City','Survivors of a sinking ship are rescued by Captain Nemo and his submarine crew. They are taken to an underwater city where they may spend the rest of their lives.','/whvYatDbIFsPGSt2Pv9Rrk0q7zT.jpg','1969-12-01',105,'Released','They tried to leave the golden city with the most valuable prize of all - their lives!','Captain Nemo and the Underwater City',56354,2.3641,5.6,'6_eHLnKnEAA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5676,_binary '\0','/4FW0msh4S1Lyvb7pgcrMBbYwKBR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065524',5.9,2969,'en','Carry On Loving','The Wedded Bliss computer dating agency aims to bring together the lonely hearts of Much-Snoggin-in-the-Green. Its owner, Sidney Bliss, has enough complications in his own love life, but still produces a pamphlet called \'The Wit to Woo\'. The strange collection of hopefuls lead to some outlandish matches—and jealousies are bound to lead to trouble.','/adUhM6u0drfMqEMBsc8ybXMICgO.jpg','1970-09-20',88,'Released','Their Mating Game is a Riot!','Carry On Loving',24570,1.8635,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5677,_binary '\0','/z6dWuM72WkPsJVE475XhtYSE26q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065525',6,3491,'en','Carry On Up the Jungle','The Carry On team send up the Tarzan tradition in great style. Lady Evelyn Bagley mounts an expedition to find her long-lost baby. Bill Boosey is the fearless hunter and guide. Prof. Tinkle is searching for the rare Oozalum bird. Everything is going swimmingly until a gorilla enters the camp, and then the party is captured by an all female tribe from Aphrodisia...','/r8zrAhPIwY6oh7IN4TZkNfFVPla.jpg','1970-03-20',89,'Released','A safari of laughs with the Carry On Gang!','Carry On Up the Jungle',17276,1.7625,5.9,'CrV_SJxIP70','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5678,_binary '\0','/7Oju2DdZTL7RUnoKctRvH4u1n8N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065528',7.1,27324,'en','Catch-22','A WWII military pilot makes a valiant effort to be certified insane in order to be excused from flying missions. But there\'s a catch.','/eSB3i3vvFiRTszmZVawWqROzM6p.jpg','1970-06-24',121,'Released','The nice thing about war is that the person who kills you really has nothing against you. Personally.','Catch-22',10364,6.1829,6.673,'Unn8fgs8fao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5679,_binary '\0','/93iDrZmjDF01Tn3PxOYL8Zz9hBM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065531',7.9,32215,'fr','Le Cercle rouge','When French criminal Corey gets released from prison, he resolves to never return. He is quickly pulled back into the underworld, however, after a chance encounter with escaped murderer Vogel. Along with former policeman and current alcoholic Jansen, they plot an intricate jewel heist. All the while, quirky Police Commissioner Mattei, who was the one to lose custody of Vogel, is determined to find him.','/w56La43IJnGpLepgqfGCAZsbQPp.jpg','1970-10-19',140,'Released','No place to hide . . . nowhere to run . . .','Le Cercle Rouge',11657,5.3403,7.6,'taSkmZUa4dY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5680,_binary '\0','/u9YiShfJX9XklhoY1LBDwmDqpN6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065537',6,2981,'en','Change of Habit','Dr. John Carpenter takes the job of running a health center in a low-income district. He enlists three women to help out who — unbeknownst to him — are actually nuns in street clothes. The church wants to improve the neighborhood but fears that nuns in full habit would be poorly received. Unaware of her unavailability, John falls for Sister Michelle, serenading her with his guitar — which, luckily for him, effectively wears away at her religious resolve.','/bZx6oDV3LnhaDImYJj2tkgEtqI0.jpg','1969-11-10',93,'Released','Could he change her life, could she forget her vows and follow her heart...','Change of Habit',18694,2.2322,5.4,'Famlevc4VFQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5681,_binary '\0','/n4LBFHRV6okolylCIJjvmzfL8AD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065542',6.8,5595,'en','The Cheyenne Social Club','Cowboy John O\'Hanlan is surprised to learn that someone\'s left him a business in Cheyenne, Wyoming. He sets out to claim it, only to discover it\'s a brothel.','/5bRm0ALG9yPO53Y2kKuPPV3irdF.jpg','1970-06-12',103,'Released','Imagine these two cowboys inheriting the one place in the west everyone wants to get their hands on .... \"The Cheyenne Social Club.\"','The Cheyenne Social Club',28303,3.3347,6.3,'jhV81_Ez_H8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5682,_binary '\0','/wMMUUFuCIUbqrrPRkrhLk9EC8h6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065547',6.9,12118,'en','Chisum','Cattle baron John Chisum joins forces with Billy the Kid and Pat Garrett to fight the Lincoln County Land War in the New Mexico Territory of 1878.','/t7GnHtvMslkBQFA8rgotzpGfm0A.jpg','1970-07-23',111,'Released','THE LEGEND - John Wayne is \'Chisum\'','Chisum',38765,7.8313,6.6,'_V291WgiyRU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5683,_binary '\0','/32oNbiNUxJANQAHJNQPWqcJa5Xl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065553',5.7,3980,'it','5 bambole per la luna d\'agosto','A wealthy playboy gathers a group of bourgeois friends at his isolated beach house for a weekend of relaxation. When bodies start pilling up, they realize they’re trapped with a killer in their midst, sending them in a frenzy to figure out who amongst them is killing the others before they are killed next.','/AvWAWkRUhxPlDT7XgZOAXsdyUPO.jpg','1970-02-14',82,'Released','The Island of Terror!','Five Dolls for an August Moon',28051,3.502,5.736,'ZN9-c5QazD8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5684,_binary '\0','/y4BWsaJ5IcvL9a3WUNuooe0OCPO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065555',6.2,4290,'it','Città violenta','A hitman is double-crossed by his girlfriend and barely escapes a murder attempt. He then sets out to take his revenge on the woman and the gang boss who put her up to it.','/xzDXeaIUP8uEddDJXprUUpWojkL.jpg','1970-09-17',103,'Released','In a city set to explode, one man has just lit the fuse','Violent City',31672,2.5684,5.964,'KuK9RRnRgJY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5685,_binary '\0','/ulSMjQWtePjr0fvGw1l0lZDMo9R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065566',6,6535,'en','The Computer Wore Tennis Shoes','Some college students manage to persuade the town\'s big businessman, A. J. Arno, to donate a computer to their college. When the problem- student, Dexter Riley, tries to fix the computer, he gets an electric shock and his brain turns to a computer; now he remembers everything he reads. Unfortunately, he also remembers information which was in the computer\'s memory, like Arno\'s illegal businesses..','/vXfUKvAHTIifAU7IP17kl1ZBGh6.jpg','1969-12-29',91,'Released','Programmed for laughs!','The Computer Wore Tennis Shoes',29228,3.4461,6.024,'32g-9Jbwlc4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5686,_binary '\0','/lKYBCsT3rEqXiQMhnqoAUxSW9Qn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065569',5.6,4689,'de','Nachts, wenn Dracula erwacht','A faithful adaptation of the classic tale portrays Dracula as an old man who grows younger whenever he dines on the blood of young maidens.','/hilXfuoYRwDfpzzh8xWZPtXnNbj.jpg','1970-04-03',98,'Released','Finally! The original version!','Count Dracula',5620,3.0531,5.9,'A4ncEQE4yFI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5687,_binary '\0','/rrMRjuD4kipkmgN9RrsYKFchXHj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065570',6,1582,'en','El Condor','Luke, an escaped convict, and Jaroo, a loner gold prospector, team up with a band of Apache Indians in 19th century Mexico to capture a large, heavily armed fortress for the millions -- or billions -- of dollars in gold that are rumored to be stored within. Written by Brian C. Madsen','/fsX96nme7dqG2bGFZlb46Oddfvd.jpg','1970-06-19',102,'Released','You can get killed trying to break through the walls of El Condor...but it\'s one helluva way to die!','El Condor',94201,1.9467,5.4,'e9kbYCP3V3o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5688,_binary '\0','/xKhnjQA5wrAUaopEKegdKD3Yi26.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065571',7.9,39724,'it','Il conformista','A weak-willed Italian man becomes a fascist flunky who goes abroad to arrange the assassination of his old teacher, now a political dissident.','/nLJjFRqIJAK8qz0OKYnpKCblZNK.jpg','1971-01-29',108,'Released','A dazzling movie.','The Conformist',8416,5.7141,7.6,'04kMeEjVGIk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5689,_binary '\0','/4GQZWqYLnh7PVrnz0jiVdtczIlQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065579',6.5,3273,'en','Cotton Comes to Harlem','Harlem\'s African-American population is being ripped off by the Rev. Deke O\'Malley, who dishonestly claims that small donations will secure parcels of land in Africa. When New York City police officers Gravedigger Jones and Coffin Ed Johnson look into O\'Malley\'s scam, they learn that the cash is being smuggled inside a bale of cotton. However, the police, O\'Malley, and lots of others find themselves scrambling when the money goes missing.','/tW30OfbGhe2uFBw4cr6tKsZwCcl.jpg','1970-05-27',97,'Released','Introducing COFFIN ED and GRAVEDIGGER. Two detectives only a mother could love.','Cotton Comes to Harlem',59917,3.3346,6.231,'V7xDwO44syQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5690,_binary '\0','/8J5I8riV0eh7eDRRR7vyB66Tjrt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065580',5.9,5593,'en','Countess Dracula','Hungary, XVII century. After being widowed, the old countess Elizabeth Nádasdy, of the Báthory lineage, fortunately discovers a way to become young again; but the price to be paid by those around her will be high and bloody.','/ybYHPH9SywTbFaggQJDhju9KV2M.jpg','1971-01-30',93,'Released','Here lies the body of…','Countess Dracula',39043,3.2106,5.7,'e_WQ6vDLYKQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5691,_binary '\0','/BqKararfhJ7FLqF6AStOe7Qbwd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065591',4.7,3608,'en','Crimes of the Future','In a dystopic world where a plague is killing off pubescent human females, an esoteric researcher seeks his missing mentor while trying to retain morality in the sex-obsessed society he lives in.','/w28rLVOO5hrmA7fe4cbZgS2993Y.jpg','1970-06-01',63,'Released',NULL,'Crimes of the Future',27371,1.7261,4.8,'3ZSrZ5Il7ho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5692,_binary '\0','/q6jV4IwZ1eVulRJDyilnDICz5yk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065593',7,8184,'en','Cromwell','Disgusted with the policies of King Charles I, Oliver Cromwell plans to take his family to the New World. But on the eve of their departure, Cromwell is drawn into the tangled web of religion and politics that will result in the English Civil War.','/1qlnKlQGEdRl70KDpAv03F8uGzI.jpg','1970-07-16',140,'Released',NULL,'Cromwell',31675,2.6752,6.6,'M7QHFm2AeMo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5693,_binary '\0','/4epcwHvZw10Q9zskYfznfDlje4u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065594',6.3,1251,'en','Crowhaven Farm','A couple, Maggie and Ben Porter, inherit an old farmhouse and move in, hoping to reinvigorate their marriage. When they learn the home was occupied long ago by a woman who was executed for practicing witchcraft, Maggie begins to have nightmares about her.','/h3JF9ntnWhpqba1caOLNEh6bEri.jpg','1970-11-24',74,'Released',NULL,'Crowhaven Farm',28760,1.3498,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5694,_binary '\0','/inOCZ0FDJiPAyXhgh6VhMv07e3D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065595',5.2,1312,'en','Crucible of Horror','A mother and daughter hatch a scheme to murder their family\'s domineering and sadistic patriarch.','/vYs1se2bMYZecw3sSZZbDaXsztp.jpg','1971-11-10',91,'Released','TERROR ends with MURDER! ...but NIGHTMARES begin with... THE CORPSE.','Crucible of Horror',30792,1.3393,5.4,'CaR3MlEDizU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5695,_binary '\0','/bzXqKeKQUpFQkqyuxNseaNVTPkk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065597',5.5,3457,'en','Cry of the Banshee','In seventeenth century England Lord Whitman wages unending war on what he sees as the ever-present scourge of witchcraft, and many local villagers have suffered at his hands. But one victim uses her occult powers to curse his family, enlisting unknowing help from one of the household.','/urub0N7F8mZDEsMwORiN2T2vTXq.jpg','1970-07-22',91,'Released','Hell hath no fury like a sorceress scorned!','Cry of the Banshee',22033,2.4615,5.361,'fO3R6WPegcs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5696,_binary '\0','/5hCGMVTgs24FSsiLjZqGXoQ352j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065611',6.1,2663,'en','Darling Lili','World War I. Lili Smith is a beloved British music hall singer, often providing inspiration for the British and French troops and general populace singing rallying patriotic songs. She is also half German and is an undercover German spy, using her feminine wiles to gather information from the high ranking and generally older military officers and diplomats she seduces.','/ugypriAtGu3LdUrp5bLkeIcg5Jf.jpg','1970-06-18',143,'Released','She gave away secrets to one side and her heart to the other.','Darling Lili',42586,1.8986,5.6,'28WmoT1lHaU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5697,_binary '\0','/ksK1EkInuAkliMEQF9RZKZglaMY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065620',6.4,1691,'de','Deadlock','After pulling off a bank robbery two bandits meet in a deserted mining town to divide their loot but an old miner tries to steal it from them.','/zf84Uh1bYMxH7E2mkgMReDS0YXm.jpg','1970-10-15',93,'Released',NULL,'Deadlock',79830,2.4503,6.264,'YB4g03Z_WvI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5698,_binary '\0','/9CbH2EktREWAur7XLBeFNFNr5BQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065622',7,13896,'it','Il Decameron','A young Sicilian is swindled twice, but ends up rich; a man poses as a deaf-mute in a convent of curious nuns; a woman must hide her lover when her husband comes home early; a scoundrel fools a priest on his deathbed; three brothers take revenge on their sister\'s lover; a young girl sleeps on the roof to meet her boyfriend at night; a group of painters wait for inspiration; a crafty priest attempts to seduce his friend\'s wife; and two friends make a pact to find out what happens after death.','/iL5mmuIL6fqFSWJeHE417WWrocz.jpg','1971-08-25',111,'Released','Ribaldry! Rakes and libertines. Raised skirts and lowered lashes. A blush on every cheek. Pasolini. Filming The Decameron. Bringing life to art...and art to life.','The Decameron',33583,3.7379,6.9,'FA3R7ocHWpk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5699,_binary '\0','/3q14UHjWRR78AqxuDXWRASbqQd2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065636',7,2649,'en','Diary of a Mad Housewife','Tina Balser is a bored New York housewife-mother married to Jonathan, a pompous, social-climbing lawyer who ridicules her in front of their children, criticizing everything she does or wears. She begins an affair with George Prager, a dashing, successful, and blatantly sadistic writer.','/loZFqYvqqzAhehLcbZq6djNo0JA.jpg','1970-08-10',95,'Released','It can happen to any married woman anywhere, anytime...it happened to Tina.','Diary of a Mad Housewife',31677,2.4675,6.2,'L4kOSCEZgu4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5700,_binary '\0','/6CsuEnJUbrHb2xVLgkB4zxb1Kta.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065649',7.3,8465,'ja','どですかでん','On a Tokyo dump’s shantytown edge, interwoven vignettes follow residents scraping by: a boy who “drives” an imaginary trolley, a homeless father and son designing a dream house, a young woman brutalized at home, drunks, schemers, and saints of small kindnesses. Kurosawa crafts a ragged mosaic of hardship, fantasy, and flickers of grace that keep people moving forward.','/gP9pM94ATcZGfKQ3faKy0a3dVIi.jpg','1970-10-31',140,'Released',NULL,'Dodes\'ka-den',33205,3.8659,7.1,'uUgAMxdGGOM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5701,_binary '\0','/9JJqO2yNfoE4uAbu5FDhIhwbqpq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065651',7.4,11724,'fr','Domicile conjugal','Parisian everyman Antoine Doinel has married his sweetheart Christine Darbon, and the newlyweds have set up a cozy domestic life of selling flowers and giving violin lessons while Antoine fitfully works on his long-gestating novel. As Christine becomes pregnant with the couple\'s first child, Antoine finds himself enraptured with a young Japanese beauty. The complications change the course of their relationship forever.','/s9R5wKbrB9SfOG1FzbICbOsssX8.jpg','1970-09-09',97,'Released','First Truffaut gave us The 400 Blows. Then Stolen Kisses... and now Bed and Board.','Bed and Board',258,4.2806,7.102,'h8MDEMfhi3E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5702,_binary '\0','/bPCOv9VkD3J8sB6XrBcbAeVLqgl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065656',5.8,1494,'de','Das Bildnis des Dorian Gray','London, England. Dorian Gray is a young man who somehow keeps his beauty eternally, while a mysterious portrait of himself gradually reveals his moral decay.','/bh4CFuIT9UbFLxggnCnZPMLEqAB.jpg','1970-04-24',97,'Released','He is twenty-one. He has been twenty-one for almost half a century','Dorian Gray',47459,3.486,5.1,'u7a8exTFmWo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5703,_binary '\0','/sbJZTwa4VcJ6OH3QBWJLpqFZFxv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065662',7.1,2886,'it','Dramma della gelosia (tutti i particolari in cronaca)','Construction worker Oreste and young fiancee Adelaide meet Nello, a cook in a pizzeria. This love triangle often goes to communist rallies, and enjoys the filthy beaches of Ostia. Will the hostile environment pave a way to jealousy?','/gFVREOJXd010ngszEkA7smK778n.jpg','1970-01-18',105,'Released','The story of a woman who was completely faithful... to two men','A Drama of Jealousy (and other things)',56366,2.2315,7.197,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5704,_binary '\0','/drYtJvtJXtdJtX0QCoOleG4Kine.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065669',5.4,6112,'en','The Dunwich Horror','Dr. Henry Armitage, an expert in the occult, goes to the old Whateley manor in Dunwich looking for Nancy Wagner, a student who went missing the previous night. He is turned away by Wilbur, the family\'s insidious heir, who has plans for the young girl. But Armitage won\'t be deterred. Through conversations with the locals, he soon unearths the Whateleys\' darkest secret — as well as a great evil.','/veoJRMZSk9RwTnDJmhhNj6WpJWx.jpg','1970-01-14',88,'Released','A few years ago in Dunwich a half-witted girl bore illegitimate twins. One of them was almost human!','The Dunwich Horror',65891,2.7506,5.3,'8_KL3-k3SUE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5705,_binary '\0','/tuoytAAyfcfvyuShMPEFkpqhR2O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065670',8.1,8156,'ru','12 стульев','A former aristocrat Ippolit Vorobyaninov leads a miserable life in Soviet Russia. His mother-in-law reveals a secret to him - she hid family diamonds in one of the twelve chairs they once had. Vorobyaninov in cooperation with a young con artist Ostap Bender start a long search for the diamonds.','/fVzfgLPgrEOti2svUqwyLCtIeML.jpg','1971-06-21',161,'Released',NULL,'12 Chairs',31648,1.4185,7.648,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5706,_binary '\0','/eEwONClRpFwDeb2QH0wZEQy1Kb9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065677',6.2,2479,'it','Le foto proibite di una signora per bene','The wife of a financially struggling businessman is blackmailed by a mysterious man into having a sadistic relationship with him, or he will release damning evidence that suggests that her husband is a murderer.','/7bhC6HDdUeQmknrONYAM8jB8ZTZ.jpg','1970-11-27',93,'Released','A triangle of friendship, love, sex, and, perhaps, murder.','The Forbidden Photos of a Lady Above Suspicion',92233,1.8073,6.5,'34dcrG1Q9j4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5707,_binary '\0','/tXwXxjxuTZFy6PJqhSzwOI1Grzd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065687',8,3523,'en','Elvis: That\'s the Way It Is','On July 31, 1970, in Las Vegas, Nevada, Elvis Presley staged a triumphant return to the concert stage from which he had been absent for almost a decade. His series of concerts broke all box office records and completely reenergized the career of the King of Rock ‘n’ Roll.','/snU2ElTb6OEQO6vrMx7KnhjTkAG.jpg','1970-11-11',95,'Released','A film about him','Elvis: That\'s the Way It Is',31151,2.465,8.115,'1O7cStOGZXI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5708,_binary '\0','/kfcUXzhIwEbNVVYikQWZXc1FRW1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065695',7.4,2959,'fr','L\'Enfance nue','Handed over to foster care by his mother—who\'s unwilling to give up permanent custody—the now-adolescent François understands that nothing in life is permanent, and his increasingly erratic actions reflect this knowledge.','/2cD6WpamMeCdMoinljqnj5c6YrF.jpg','1969-01-22',83,'Released',NULL,'Naked Childhood',31345,1.6886,7.33,'dnmVzPcOzFM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5709,_binary '\0','/5j623W879am0R9xHVHqf9ZEYvXa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065702',6.2,1907,'de','Erinnerungen an die Zukunft','Documentary based on the book by Erich von Däniken concerning the ancient mysteries of the world, such as the pyramids of Egypt and Mexico, ancient cave drawings, the monuments of Easter Island, etc., and the fact that these things and modern civilisation could have been influenced by extraterrestrial visitations hundreds (or perhaps thousands) of years ago.','/gBkZEvKLizGwuddvoQe99PdRrN5.jpg','1970-04-26',92,'Released',NULL,'Chariots of the Gods',42587,1.873,6.3,'K_17SUfxI5A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5710,_binary '\0','/w6NWeorsVfsvh789hBgA3mb8b9w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065720',6.5,1942,'en','Figures in a Landscape','Two escaped convicts are on the run in an unnamed Latin American country. But everywhere they go, they are followed and hounded by a menacing black helicopter.','/bOzYMaBRe2OeLQHMnjKUlDVQAaE.jpg','1970-11-12',110,'Released','The Bird Has Come For Its Prey.','Figures in a Landscape',107327,2.1196,6,'4UcaYsQ37Qo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5711,_binary '\0','/y7pnEmBotaowRY0o8V33r4JuRNS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065724',7.3,45095,'en','Five Easy Pieces','Robert Dupea spends his days doing various odd jobs, drinking and womanizing until an encounter with his sister makes him revisit his past.','/sUEzamvvoTIhPIVhfZw3pUEo6bY.jpg','1970-09-12',98,'Released','He rode the fast lane on the road to nowhere.','Five Easy Pieces',26617,4.2026,7.1,'VkcXtLz-BaM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5712,_binary '\0','/msn7JgJQYw4Vrz5uLpJYpxP8k0v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065737',6.1,1295,'en','Fragment of Fear','Reformed drug addict Tim Brett (David Hemmings) is vacationing in Italy with his aunt. When she is murdered, he tries to investigate. Soon his whole life spins out of control.','/g0FVuvvekTgfJzgVEoObJ6v2Kdj.jpg','1970-09-03',94,'Released','Murder in Pompeii. Voices in the night. Despair in the gutter. A phantasmagoria of fright!','Fragment of Fear',75905,1.8157,5.9,'qYsxBj-Y9GM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5713,_binary '\0','/euwX44vNkXGBobigO9rJ1iRDqCO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065738',6.7,6035,'en','Frankenstein Must Be Destroyed','Blackmailing a young couple to assist with his horrific experiments the Baron, desperate for vital medical data, abducts a man from an insane asylum. On route the abductee dies and the Baron and his assistant transplant his brain into a corpse. The creature is tormented by a trapped soul in an alien shell and, after a visit to his wife who violently rejects his monstrous form, the creature wreaks his revenge on the perpetrator of his misery: Baron Frankenstein.','/rLCCdYBhCm4ATkupOTf4yRbFgm6.jpg','1969-05-22',101,'Released','The Most Frightening Frankenstein Movie Ever!','Frankenstein Must Be Destroyed',3075,2.754,6.315,'1ylPaweSVfw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5714,_binary '\0','/dXME4QHw2MXlAV1EyGRb87SxhyL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065744',5.6,2735,'fr','Le Frisson des vampires','A newlywed couple travels to a small town to visit the bride\'s cousins—her last two surviving relatives—at the castle where they live, only to discover that the cousins have just died and the castle is now inhabited by vampires.','/wAkhx6MFJBS8W2VxRwWhkqXOmf7.jpg','1971-04-21',95,'Released','We were surprised to hear of your deaths. Your reappearance is even more surprising.','The Shiver of the Vampires',29129,1.9812,5.1,'5wxwrMG3cmo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5715,_binary '\0','/l6kCYH7DbjNKf5zPAbSQmwleMdE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065755',5.2,1844,'ja','ガメラ対大魔獣ジャイガー','When a giant stone statue on Wester Island is disturbed, the legendary monster Jiger appears and heads for Japan. Gamera tries to stop this new rival, only to be injured when Jiger lays eggs inside of him. As two boys in a submarine go on a dangerous quest inside of Gamera\'s body to save him, Jiger threatens the Expo \'70 world\'s fair in Osaka.','/4nIUsyeNTJXpsTi4Hc6Fkwr6y3l.jpg','1970-03-21',83,'Released','Watch out for extreme ultrasound!','Gamera vs. Jiger',70327,1.4694,5.7,'j-3ZOGamw-I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5716,_binary '\0','/nfP8AtgA6JqNPzUHoZtZnRfkeYI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065760',4.2,1908,'en','Gas! -Or- It Became Necessary to Destroy the World in Order to Save It.','A gas is let loose upon the world that kills anyone over 25 years old.','/bR6U9tVmCpZ68XrmvsNgxSzZYtY.jpg','1970-09-04',79,'Released','Invite a few friends over to watch the end of the world!','Gas! -Or- It Became Necessary to Destroy the World in Order to Save It.',85224,1.7453,4.3,'MX7Mi6OxvuY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5717,_binary '\0','/5yunPf3vpOMYon7HBJtrwZNs1YG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065761',6.6,14512,'it','Il gatto a nove code','A newsman works with a blind puzzle-solver to uncover a deadly conspiracy linked to a genetic research facility.','/vVfylUKX9Lz3Idpu0J3ds7vGXoF.jpg','1971-02-12',112,'Released','Caught between the truth and a murderer\'s hand!','The Cat o\' Nine Tails',27431,4.1129,6.683,'0-DW3saLTSI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5718,_binary '\0','/rZoLlRrD0QE3wYJGPjkv6IMrGjB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065769',6.5,8307,'fr','Le Gendarme en balade','The whole clique of Cruchot\'s police station is retired. Now he lives with his rich wife in her castle - and is bored almost to death. He fights with the butler, because he isn\'t even allowed to do the simple works. But when one of the clique suffers from amnesia after an accident, all of the others reunite and kidnap him, to take him on a tour to their old working places and through their memories. In their old uniforms they turn St. Tropez upside down.','/o7TYeAazHF6Du1Qt8RuEaZ07xN3.jpg','1970-10-28',90,'Released',NULL,'The Gendarme Takes Off',11913,3.522,6.349,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5719,_binary '\0','/eirSTJkaGgEB8mpunntNrXI1nNH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065772',7.4,13765,'fr','Le Genou de Claire','On the eve of his wedding, on holiday on the Lake Annecy shore, a career diplomat visits an old acquaintance, perhaps a former girlfriend. Through her he meets an intense teenager, Laura, and then lusts after her sister, Claire. Whilst Laura attempts to flirt with him, his fantasy becomes focused on wanting to caress Claire\'s knee.','/wekWNf0Nj6fkfR6pOjPojMAqz69.jpg','1970-12-11',105,'Released',NULL,'Claire\'s Knee',2860,3.0872,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5720,_binary '\0','/hvoAaSlYJepuRnzSkC6qiWtssiS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065775',6.3,1800,'en','Getting Straight','Graduate student Harry Bailey was once one of the most visible undergraduate activists on campus, but now that he\'s back studying for his master\'s, he\'s trying to fly right. Trouble is, the campus is exploding with various student movements, and Harry\'s girlfriend, Jan, is caught up in most of them. As Harry gets closer to finishing his degree, he finds his iconoclastic attitude increasingly aligned with the students rather than the faculty.','/qwyyq5lMFWTO1xS2qWI48Be5tdU.jpg','1970-05-13',124,'Released','America\'s children lay it on the line.','Getting Straight',42588,1.7212,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5721,_binary '\0','/a7skXABKA7u5gyu2cfeG0zI9EtN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065776',5.4,1692,'ja','ゲゾラ・ガニメ・カメーバ 決戦!南海の大怪獣','When a space probe crash-lands on a far-flung Pacific atoll, the craft\'s alien stowaways decide to take over their new world one creature at a time. Soon, the parasitic life forms latch onto three indigenous critters -- a squid, a crab and a snapping turtle -- and transform them into colossal mutant monsters.','/xEnROAQX4Pm03Zmi6P2fnuA79ZM.jpg','1970-08-01',84,'Released','An alien aiming for the Earth transforms monsters to attack!','Space Amoeba',38221,2.3587,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5722,_binary '\0','/bMTBDpipkszdWcY9U9lRTVy4zh9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065777',7.2,8507,'it','Il giardino dei Finzi Contini','In 1930s Italy, a wealthy Jewish family tries to maintain their privileged lifestyle, hosting friends for tennis and parties at their villa. As anti-Semitism intensifies under Fascism, they must ultimately face the horrors of the Holocaust.','/qHDATOZMoiJjfy2bb1xEFFPzkuG.jpg','1970-12-04',95,'Released','A world where love was forgotten... a garden where love grew','The Garden of the Finzi-Continis',4789,2.4977,6.964,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5723,_binary '\0','/c4Chm8w7AsekIkPb6KSxUxCzXq2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065780',7.8,13908,'en','Gimme Shelter','A detailed chronicle of the famous 1969 tour of the United States by the British rock band The Rolling Stones, which culminated with the disastrous and tragic concert held on December 6 at the Altamont Speedway Free Festival, an event of historical significance, as it marked the end of an era: the generation of peace and love suddenly became the generation of disillusionment.','/7lWFVDYyeft9WbglHGEBUl9OLFu.jpg','1970-12-13',92,'Released','The music that thrilled the world… and the killing that stunned it!','Gimme Shelter',132,3.1414,7.353,'x7UsBmavjsE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5724,_binary '\0','/qdsZrnGu2YQSIJIaCHt88ASMHVh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065782',7.3,5162,'it','I girasoli','After World War II, a woman refuses to believe her husband, missing on the Russian front, is dead. Flashbacks reveal their brief courtship and marriage. Years later, she travels to Russia with his photo, determined to find him. What will she discover?','/eVxcQRc3xfA2IOOzXHT0ML1CjzS.jpg','1970-03-14',109,'Released','A woman born for love. A man born to love her. A timeless moment in a world gone mad.','Sunflower',1863,4.0193,7.522,'y3TW9Nj-mJ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5725,_binary '\0','/q3i2mS7t9saNIlwiz5KTszBV8hI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065797',6.9,3095,'en','The Great White Hope','A black champion boxer and his white female companion struggle to survive while the white boxing establishment looks for ways to knock him down.','/guVIeqNrjeAszhIDe68TDnlY6ik.jpg','1970-10-11',103,'Released','He could beat any white man in the world. He just couldn\'t beat all of them.','The Great White Hope',17978,2.1469,6.3,'PjFVa3hPxC4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5726,_binary '\0','/cnSTQxH0wdGbAVdJiiQTivwRkRr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065808',6.4,1670,'de','Götter der Pest','After his release from prison, ex-convict Franz Walsch finds his way back into the Munich criminal underworld. His attentions focus upon two women, Joanna and Margarethe, as well as upon Günther, his friend who earlier shot his brother.','/rNdUc21wxttgRQsuGMtgH3NnxSB.jpg','1970-07-24',91,'Released',NULL,'Gods of the Plague',10244,1.7727,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5727,_binary '\0','/mYnOKbSjjCXWVY1ktKgGe0wxLux.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065820',6.2,1657,'en','The Hawaiians','A wanderer returns home only to find political turmoil, disease and romantic difficulties.','/bf0Np3insLJiYkY6e6ZCQeytPZy.jpg','1970-06-17',134,'Released','The continuation of James A. Michener\'s epic novel, Hawaii!','The Hawaiians',85290,2.5374,5.5,'uIQMY6TPlag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5728,_binary '\0','/byEn9PSz6KHrOx6rIjur10GXiCT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065832',3.4,20792,'en','Hercules in New York','Hercules is sent from Mount Olympus to modern-day Manhattan, where he takes up professional wrestling before getting mixed up with a gang of mobsters.','/2Rad0CXcWSyjp6vidmz08QriYNZ.jpg','1970-02-23',92,'Released','See Him Topple Two Ton Newspaper Rolls! See Him Toss Tough Men Like Toothpicks!','Hercules in New York',5227,4.4158,4.1,'pvWySqI9uN4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5729,_binary '\0','/vl8dVttuNMYmsT97pKGeGRGNTZb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065836',6.1,7141,'en','Hi, Mom!','Vietnam vet Jon Rubin returns to New York and rents a rundown flat in Greenwich Village. It is in this flat that he begins to film, \'Peeping Tom\' style, the people in the apartment across the street. His obsession with making films leads him to fall in with a radical \'Black Power\' group, which in turn leads him to carry out a bizarre act of urban terrorism.','/l4rge37nxK6nQFQVJxgdRaBG1xS.jpg','1970-04-27',87,'Released','God bless our humble upper-middle-class high-rise co-op and keep it free from smut peddlers, militants, urban guerrillas and Greenwich Village liberals.','Hi, Mom!',42589,2.7724,6.2,'2ns4yRTpquU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5730,_binary '\0','/sXQlRXf5mVsiEqw3Fvyi1iRNkAe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065839',6.8,1945,'en','Hoffman','A businessman blackmails his young secretary into spending a weekend with him.','/yT8nDK3lQzI0s9qgA8iXi2nb2mC.jpg','1970-07-16',113,'Released','A sly tale of blackmail about a beauty and her boss','Hoffman',26427,1.3996,7,'nLXktgCNDbs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5731,_binary '\0','/yBneyOvSQQSZI9psn6SWVARIpBH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065848',6.2,3973,'fr','L\'Homme orchestre','Evan Evans, the director of a ballet troupe, is rehearsing his next show in Monaco, in preparation for a worldwide tour. When one member of his troupe leaves to get married, Evans imposes a regime of strict discipline on his remaining dancers. The latter get their revenge by presenting Evans’ nephew Philippe, the only male member of the group, with a baby and a note claiming he is the father…','/b6IYXmSNkWPSrDG8wyUisEP0c8n.jpg','1970-09-18',85,'Released',NULL,'The One Man Band',36179,2.3028,6,'jyWDzWrtWVY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5732,_binary '\0','/z2ybQoOXAOoDC5JVPSRNlfI4Qtg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065850',5.8,1283,'en','Hornets\' Nest','An American commando who\'s the sole survivor of a parachute jump into WWII-era Italy leads a group of children in a campaign of sabotage against the Nazis.','/yoqJVM7AT8Ku9E5hokTiqOfODVw.jpg','1970-09-08',110,'Released',NULL,'Hornets\' Nest',87358,2.7681,5.7,'ckGZ10S2whM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5733,_binary '\0','/hYvfaCccyazxhcBwEpPmQoDAEL0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065851',5.8,3425,'en','The Horror of Frankenstein','Brilliant but arrogant scientist Victor Frankenstein builds a man from spare body parts, only for the monster to come alive and wreak havoc.','/8lFv0ABZqINbHijXjCc41AmrRlm.jpg','1970-11-08',95,'Released','The dead shall rise again!','The Horror of Frankenstein',3145,2.7824,5.9,'nMCg0was6mY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5734,_binary '\0','/4tHdqUlbfmNAmOqIlnDzcBxeU7R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065854',6.5,8943,'en','The House That Dripped Blood','A Scotland Yard investigator looks into four mysterious cases involving an unoccupied house.','/jP0G5M0MNEPKkcnjaMerO6AxelQ.jpg','1971-02-22',102,'Released','Vampires! Voodoo! Vixens! Victims!','The House That Dripped Blood',39261,3.3789,6.4,'nNO3yw0Cg5I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5735,_binary '\0','/oTxwLPF4SJwUL4SYBK8fvY9RsFX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065855',5.5,1323,'en','The House That Would Not Die','A tale of witchcraft, black magic and a haunted house in the Amish country.','/auK8SR6NTr7S7LTXqoQlb025wFR.jpg','1970-10-27',74,'Released','What terrible secrets are locked in the walls of the old Campbell house? What accounts for the sounds of a violent struggle and a woman\'s scream?','The House That Would Not Die',101060,2.0154,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5736,_binary '\0','/vehhfFGWUsthy2frL0AJxmJzEyy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065856',6.3,3835,'en','House of Dark Shadows','Barnabas Collins searches for a cure for vampirism in order to marry a woman resembling his long-lost fiancée Josette.','/uI2bfcqbuF4gowoqYx9422PzoS4.jpg','1970-09-09',97,'Released','Come see how the vampires do it','House of Dark Shadows',71943,2.3187,6.601,'WvED00MDYqQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5737,_binary '\0','/gxYnKLgPev1iz2PmqVDVpFrziEH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065867',7,8265,'en','Husbands','A common friend\'s sudden death brings three men, married with children, to reconsider their lives and ultimately leave the country together. But mindless enthusiasm for regained freedom will be short-lived.','/482OpzSoSeAVx7KDJlWupLNIf0r.jpg','1970-12-08',131,'Released','A comedy about life, death and freedom.','Husbands',52105,2.049,6.728,'Eu9pnWGT_Vw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5738,_binary '\0','/cRqXfDNRMjLL8X18eL2quXTqU3n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065872',7.4,3540,'en','I Never Sang for My Father','A man living in the towering shadow of his aging father finds it difficult to start a new chapter in his life by marrying his girlfriend and moving to California.','/o494qtKJgd5IU21sMjdc5tTd7fQ.jpg','1970-10-18',92,'Released','A motion picture the whole world has taken to its heart.','I Never Sang for My Father',92283,2.3592,6.7,'X4HiQu9mYdA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5739,_binary '\0','/1egcm5poKE8ucuo1uetX07FaAtr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065874',6.5,2675,'en','I Walk the Line','Henry Tawes, a middle-aged sheriff in a rural Tennessee town, is usually the first man to criticize others for their bad behavior. Miserable in his marriage, Henry falls in love with teenage seductress Alma, who is the daughter of local criminal and moonshiner Carl McCain. Henry\'s moral character comes further into question when he is tempted to conceal Carl\'s crimes in order to prolong his relationship with Alma.','/slwnnOlNcCpgUEQHZXx6FYDYkRJ.jpg','1970-11-18',97,'Released','Sheriff Tawes walks the line between duty and desire, between law and violence, between honor and shame','I Walk the Line',72881,3.1336,5.9,'4uhv3uR6ZYc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5740,_binary '\0','/7SUT9mYb7SD88Gz7rFeLbjC2YeG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065889',8,15758,'it','Indagine su un cittadino al di sopra di ogni sospetto','Rome, Italy. After committing a heinous crime, a senior police officer exposes evidence incriminating him because his moral commitment prevents him from circumventing the law and the social order it protects.','/vPTZwlq1IC4o1DCsEZEl2uGljzm.jpg','1970-10-16',111,'Released',NULL,'Investigation of a Citizen Above Suspicion',26451,4.3793,8.196,'PfXZVqdLKcE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5741,_binary '\0','/iNAMRPUEEsNIAiZL0RmVmIGjiv1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065895',6.1,1805,'it','Gli intoccabili','After serving 12 years behind bars for armed robbery, tough guy Hank McCain finds himself the pawn of a ruthless mob runt\'s rebellion against a high level don. When McCain discovers that he\'s been betrayed and abandoned by his new employer, he retaliates with a high stakes Las Vegas casino heist that erupts into all-out war on the streets of Los Angeles, San Francisco and New York. Neither blood, nor lust, nor wedding vows can come between McCain and his money... or his machine gun.','/nlCoQTTfVVuzpEbNe2H0ovjnsA.jpg','1969-04-01',96,'Released','Even the Mafia Calls Him Mister!','Machine Gun McCain',45138,2.5326,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5742,_binary '\0','/6j1WNnGbzpL2Lfer6pKHpvhIRME.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065904',2.4,2681,'en','The Party at Kitty and Stud\'s','Stud\'s world revolves entirely around sex, sex, and more sex — an interest he shares with his way-out friends and his girl Kitty, who likes her men mean and muscular!','/5F7I0QewdxrE6632PybXMChbPcz.jpg','1970-02-10',67,'Released',NULL,'The Party at Kitty and Stud\'s',4255,8.9046,3.8,'qFYUTMQUD7U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5743,_binary '\0','/wNG4fRsgDa66gLUruWx6Ed26QBB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065911',6.4,1352,'en','Jane Eyre','After a bleak childhood, Jane Eyre goes out into the world to become a governess. As she lives happily in her new position at Thornfield Hall, she meet the dark, cold, and abrupt master of the house, Mr. Rochester. Jane and her employer grow close in friendship and she soon finds herself falling in love with him. Happiness seems to have found Jane at last, but could Mr. Rochester\'s terrible secret be about to destroy it forever?','/weaCySikR0ZMnZnSdQaZhAmNudK.jpg','1970-12-01',110,'Released',NULL,'Jane Eyre',131313,2.5086,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5744,_binary '\0','/wJzz1upLQBbDGCh5oTcgHUmaZYB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065916',6.8,5239,'en','Joe','After murdering his daughter\'s drug-dealing boyfriend, a wealthy ad executive stumbles into a bar and strikes up an uneasy alliance with Joe Curran, a drunken bigot with a bloodlust who works at a local factory.','/2x4YCP8uV4cKOS5ZEKt1Cc1h4eF.jpg','1970-07-15',107,'Released','Keep America beautiful.','Joe',46691,1.9905,6.5,'OLcMHH405Ig','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5745,_binary '\0','/wIX0Ys9EGUkGzJBl044IfBMlUal.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065922',6.1,2368,'en','Julius Caesar','All-star cast glamorizes this lavish 1970 remake of the classic William Shakespeare play, which portrays the assassination of Julius Caesar on the Ides of March, and the resulting war between the faction led by the assassins and the faction led by Mark Anthony.','/rGSB4RHTHRg1UwqGLMWfkmUJKmx.jpg','1970-06-04',117,'Released','No grander Caesar... No greater cast!','Julius Caesar',42592,1.8863,5.9,'szCavHK_7Hc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5746,_binary '\0','/uGd1aBoxdAbFNPx6ahi3xBbePRL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065932',6.5,1831,'ja','怪談昇り竜','Akemi is a dragon tattooed leader of the Tachibana Yakuza clan. In a duel with a rival gang Akemi slashes the eyes of an opponent and a black cat appears, to lap the blood from the gushing wound. The cat along with the eye-victim go on to pursue Akemi’s gang in revenge, leaving a trail of dead Yakuza girls, their dragon tattoos skinned from their bodies.','/j4dNhtbGpFfu9bOxYKG7YaWn4eA.jpg','1970-06-20',85,'Released',NULL,'Blind Woman\'s Curse',70412,1.5496,6.265,'N-NjiTJ30G8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5747,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065936',7.2,1323,'hi','कटी पतंग','A runaway bride promises her dying widowed friend that she will assume her identity and look after her infant child.','/sTLOmWeGw8xQh08zF7E5OAA76t1.jpg','1971-01-29',160,'Released',NULL,'Kati Patang',317371,1.1007,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5748,_binary '\0','/eSEhPsuIiKEGdZRrBsAJbEH6AGk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065938',7.6,59216,'en','Kelly\'s Heroes','A misfit group of World War II American soldiers goes AWOL to rob a bank behind German lines.','/hleMxFKSC42yT0TClS4G29HV11n.jpg','1970-06-22',144,'Released','They set out to rob a bank... and damn near won a war instead!','Kelly\'s Heroes',11589,7.5578,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5749,_binary '\0','/rlnmgMp5tE8Roqb96bRV6rdfYte.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065950',6.2,2580,'en','The Kremlin Letter','After an unauthorized letter suggesting U.S. support for a Russian attack on China is sent to Moscow, a former naval officer and his team go undercover to retrieve it. Their plans are disrupted when a cunning politician raids their hideout.','/wSxhK4AJTupQIiODuhfxR2YqUE.jpg','1970-02-01',120,'Released','World War III... in an envelope!','The Kremlin Letter',45817,1.9756,5.94,'YGcgfHMbWu4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5750,_binary '\0','/hdX3esdD6u0gUdU1oSAaNMFlFQk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065955',7.2,8303,'sv','En kärlekshistoria','The puppy love of two teenagers is set against a backdrop of adults struggling with their own lives. As a couple in love, they don\'t care about anything but themselves and seem totally unaware about everything that surrounds them.','/bSIkQ7Yu8LEcZ8g85GkzSpHJRZ.jpg','1970-04-24',119,'Released',NULL,'A Swedish Love Story',31304,2.054,7.037,'wvrp7zaZq0o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5751,_binary '\0','/aY3LIWmAe1SW6OTPBOj4o9IPUMi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065963',6.9,3501,'en','The Landlord','At the age of twenty-nine, Elgar Enders \"runs away\" from home. This running away consists of buying a building in a black ghetto in the Park Slope section of Brooklyn. Initially, his intention is to evict the black tenants and convert the building into a posh flat. But Elgar is not one to be bound by yesterday\'s urges, and soon he has other thoughts on his mind.','/DoDKRMIRki2ft2D9bZGa1zzgVx.jpg','1970-05-20',112,'Released','Watch the landlord get his.','The Landlord',64828,1.8503,6,'VnpQu7D3jTU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5752,_binary '\0','/kOtcXYpuPl5nyPBUe6y5NL2oF5J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065969',7,3979,'en','The Last Valley','People in a small German village in the last valley to remain untouched by the devastating Thirty Years\' War try to exist in peace with a group of soldiers occupying the valley.','/sCUBbKRjpFbw8eiCL44EXrv4Ya4.jpg','1971-01-28',128,'Released','From An Age of Conflict...A Film For The Ages!','The Last Valley',42525,2.5413,6.5,'jePTp8ckzFo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5753,_binary '\0','/bo551V4mYJM4cg1md1jdNkylcEP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065976',7.6,8824,'en','Let It Be','A documentary chronicling the Beatles\' rehearsal sessions in January 1969 for their proposed \"back to basics\" album, \"Get Back,\" later re-envisioned and released as \"Let It Be.\"','/rYvoOo6h48xhDGIIaiP8XyEeVVQ.jpg','1970-02-13',81,'Released','An intimate bioscopic experience with The Beatles.','Let It Be',20556,2.2714,7.661,'sHxl6eDYLUs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5754,_binary '\0','/eA7oF1ZxSnhTye0PpFiBtaYvMna.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065979',6.8,1435,'en','The Liberation of L.B. Jones','A successful African American businessman has a quarrel with a white policeman, suspecting that he is having an affair with his wife. The policeman\'s colleagues are seeking to avoid publicity.','/nX4cm1sPtXMNC0LdofKADvCYwax.jpg','1970-03-18',102,'Released','Some of his best friends were black... some of her best friends were white.','The Liberation of L.B. Jones',95556,2.2671,6.1,'Q9dtVlPZlGM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5755,_binary '\0','/eeQlrIK92z91XYhdaMkIXZRhS5W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065981',5.8,1461,'en','The Lickerish Quartet','A wealthy couple and their adult son invite a motorcycle stuntwoman from a local circus back to their castle, thinking she is an actress from a pornographic film they\'ve just watched.','/y9twmhhDl9X4QHBJl3x5C3FzaSv.jpg','1970-10-13',88,'Released','Body to body is the name of the game','The Lickerish Quartet',70422,1.3797,5.371,'d4p71oE136Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5756,_binary '\0','/7l4Z3umguBXqBeleGNhFJwCF2b4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065988',7.5,40766,'en','Little Big Man','Jack Crabb, looking back from extreme old age, tells of his life being raised by Indians and fighting with General Custer.','/boGU9wr66y20Lr6z8vQDmaozqgU.jpg','1970-12-23',139,'Released','Either the most neglected hero in history or a liar of insane proportion!','Little Big Man',11040,4.2682,7.4,'-2DWY63CVlk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5757,_binary '\0','/u6KYeH9FwZSWDrqu5X1ZO3jzVU7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0065989',5.9,1692,'en','Little Fauss and Big Halsy','The friendship between two Arizona dirt bike racers is tested when they both lust for an attractive runaway young woman who joins them on the racing circuit.','/qHj9GJwIzpIIWGK4CJKUFackRNB.jpg','1970-10-21',99,'Released','Little Fauss and Big Halsy are not your father\'s heroes.','Little Fauss and Big Halsy',44721,2.2559,6,'-5VhoX0p2S8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5758,_binary '\0','/jrcSnUsgeKJIEiOoEdQmtxFuQWD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066001',5.8,1620,'en','The Looking Glass War','When a Polish sailor jumps ship in Britain, a couple of local intelligence operatives keep him under surveillance. Soon, he’s recruited to infiltrate a missile installation outside of East Berlin and bring back photos of the new rockets.','/5uEeOzMH9xSD5rbcVhYBQK5Prig.jpg','1970-01-02',108,'Released','\"Why do we listen to them? Why do we fight their wars for them?\"','The Looking Glass War',46358,2.5085,5.682,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5759,_binary '\0','/jZC1xS5DVTe4T5azqJ4NB2QBpgt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066011',6.9,40704,'en','Love Story','Harvard Law student Oliver Barrett IV and music student Jennifer Cavilleri share a chemistry they cannot deny - and a love they cannot ignore. Despite their opposite backgrounds, the young couple put their hearts on the line for each other. When they marry, Oliver\'s wealthy father threatens to disown him. Jenny tries to reconcile the Barrett men, but to no avail.','/yCjADq9fwbdPnxMo0DKNeRGZ4YC.jpg','1970-12-16',100,'Released','Love means never having to say you’re sorry.','Love Story',9062,4.4731,6.8,'fgfy2guZu58','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5760,_binary '\0','/nywUPHC1gX0NNJlUoVHFMygKxJH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066016',6.6,1566,'en','Lovers and Other Strangers','Mike Vecchio and Susan Henderson are preparing for their upcoming wedding. However, they seem to be the only two people at the wedding that are happy. Mike\'s brother Richie and his wife Joan are going through a divorce, which is upsetting his overly devout Catholic mother Beatrice. Also, Susan\'s father is carrying on an affair and her sex starved older sister Wilma is going through her troubles with her husband Johnny. All this is going on while Mike\'s best friend Jerry is trying to bed the maid of honor, Susan\'s cousin Brenda.','/uIcFAUNHg9aGvT4kznkYd0bGAd4.jpg','1970-08-12',104,'Released',NULL,'Lovers and Other Strangers',42593,2.2838,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5761,_binary '\0','/3YWL6rZmvZxCQw2qEwxPGrqhYku.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066026',7.3,83684,'en','M*A*S*H','One of the world\'s most acclaimed comedies, M*A*S*H focuses on three Korean War Army surgeons brilliantly brought to life by Donald Sutherland, Tom Skerritt and Elliott Gould. Though highly skilled and deeply dedicated, they adopt a hilarious, lunatic lifestyle as an antidote to the tragedies of their Mobile Army Surgical Hospital, and in the process infuriate Army bureaucrats. Robert Duvall, Gary Burghoff and Sally Kellerman co-star as a sanctimonious Major, an other-worldly Corporal, and a self-righteous yet lusty nurse.','/on8Q9LhtHYNhmITjUMpgOUkIG8o.jpg','1970-02-18',116,'Released','M*A*S*H gives a D*A*M*N.','M*A*S*H',651,7.9542,6.9,'NJ6quIFtbXs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5762,_binary '\0','/umkXwhFMB6CliyJFh9LbC2Le0po.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066040',6.6,3228,'fr','Mais ne nous delivrez pas du mal','Anne and Lore, neighbors and best friends, barely into their teens, board at a convent school where they have taken a vow to sin and to serve Satan. Anne keeps a secret diary, they read a salacious novel, they get a classmate in trouble, they spy on the nuns, they set aside their communion wafers; they make a pact of devotion.','/gPm3D4yYqPHkVTezY7BdQN7Cu5K.jpg','1971-10-13',102,'Released','A film that goes where no other has dared.','Don\'t Deliver Us from Evil',61683,2.9479,6.547,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5763,_binary '\0','/nea3UGrcrMZ6t7jrynpbDkWdIC1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066049',6.8,10321,'en','A Man Called Horse','In 1825, English peer Lord John Morgan is cast adrift in the American West. Captured by Sioux Indians, Morgan is at first targeted for quick extinction, but the tribesmen sense that he is worthy of survival. He eventually passes the many necessary tests that will permit him to become a member of the tribe.','/gvo0LMk5EWwsypsXl2i25D83ztm.jpg','1970-05-01',114,'Released','A man called \"Horse\" becomes an Indian warrior in the most electrifying ritual ever seen!','A Man Called Horse',14676,3.654,6.455,'5H0dKc9QG9E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5764,_binary '\0','/bIRag83wqDmLGjPNJvKrXMGU0K6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066050',5.9,1750,'en','A Man Called Sledge','James Garner is Luther Sledge, the leader of a pack of rebels who are planning to steal a stash of gold. But after the thieves actually manage to get away with the bounty, they soon discover that the enemy lies within their midst. As they begin to bicker over who should get the biggest cut, the stage is set for a deadly showdown. Claude Akins and John Marley co-star in this Italian Western directed by Vic Morrow.','/2RqnEBkdOjSF1E8NsQQmtQATXgW.jpg','1970-11-14',93,'Released','When SLEDGE hits town it stays hit!','A Man Called Sledge',70387,3.6675,6.1,'Uv430fWuTjU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5765,_binary '\0','/qH0jCsPLT0O5aJdfAMHEWqwl92X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066053',6.4,3390,'en','The Man Who Haunted Himself','Executive Harold Pelham suffers a serious accident after which he faces the shadow of death. When, against all odds, he miraculously recovers, he discovers that his life does not belong to him anymore.','/gItc85LIfLxRWo9foVTPwIgAB2S.jpg','1970-09-17',88,'Released','Stalked by fear and terror… night and day!','The Man Who Haunted Himself',4910,2.4529,6.1,'1rCgP8hPXZI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5766,_binary '\0','/oA1ZRMcs5muKXVStdeB29tOfT4V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066064',6.5,2009,'en','The McKenzie Break','A German U-Boat commander plans a daring escape from a PoW camp in Scotland.','/nLNDK7bOoYP4wInxxbtfrbhbWfV.jpg','1970-10-28',108,'Released','P.O.W. ... S.O.B ...','The McKenzie Break',45398,1.688,5.9,'zgWFr9wv1oo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5767,_binary '\0','/ib13RxoXJ28IjcI3xKplNEkxTdq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066065',6.9,6253,'it','Medea','Based on the plot of Euripides\' Medea. Medea centers on the barbarian protagonist as she finds her position in the Greek world threatened, and the revenge she takes against her husband Jason who has betrayed her for another woman.','/wkSDxihi8njeITBNWQJYfrNU7eA.jpg','1969-12-28',118,'Released','It\'s a movie about a woman who beheads her brother, stabs her children, and sends her lover\'s wife up in flames. For Maria Callas, it\'s a natural.','Medea',26356,2.4751,6.6,'HN-KHdL1Hs0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5768,_binary '\0','/tiWwyqMEGxW3fO8LvrLqk3iBZy0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066070',7.9,5969,'hi','मेरा नाम जोकर','Raju faces many hurdles and disappointments in matters of the heart throughout his life. But as a clown in a circus, he tries to make his audience laugh at the cost of his own sorrows. Along the way, Raju loves and loses, but must always keep a smile on his face because, in the words of his circus manager, \"The show must go on.\"','/pGBSS3jPxWc7bkIGvqHCelAB5KR.jpg','1970-12-18',248,'Released','The Show Must Go On...','Mera Naam Joker',21466,1.7067,7.343,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5769,_binary '\0','/jC6ZjZSbvwCzxDwlfD28eo5luSL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066078',8.4,6779,'ro','Mihai Viteazul','An epic fresco depicting the reign (1593-1601) of Mihai Pătrașcu (better known as \"Mihai Viteazul\" / \"Michael the Brave\"), the famous prince who united the three provinces: Transalpine Vallachia, Transylvania and Moldavia, into the country of Romania, at the end of the 16th century (1599-1601) against the opposition of the Ottoman and Austrian Empires, this movie features large scale battle scenes mixed with political intrigues, murderous treachery, and family drama.','/9xbZPbDT09JKBBNqZAkRSn5aQ5G.jpg','1971-02-13',203,'Released',NULL,'Michael the Brave',31398,1.0967,7.2,'ZM_FS_-C--8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5770,_binary '\0','/fPy8zbYcqcKupx2ziixSuH4NKAu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066079',7.5,1534,'de','Das Millionenspiel','A candidate in a game show is hunted by three men. He will get a Million DMark, if he survives for a week; the hunters will get the money, if they can kill the candidate. The audience of the show is watching the transmissions of twenty camera teams filming the hunt. The showmaster appeals to the TV-viewers to help either the candidate or the hunters, whomever they want.','/1RUB5goPRL6TvS59oy5P4qsQ5BO.jpg','1970-10-18',96,'Released',NULL,'The Million Game',5465,1.2223,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5771,_binary '\0','/hRVF7brFtRqpcjqqRSa6yXl4rqm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066090',6.8,4886,'en','The Molly Maguires','Schuylkill County, Pennsylvania, 1876. A secret society of Irish coal miners, bond by a sacred oath, put pressure on the greedy and ruthless company they work for by sabotaging mining facilities in the hope of improving their working conditions and the lives of their families.','/3ywN7tPWiOkbalS2gAEPzNk4Nq9.jpg','1970-02-08',120,'Released','They were called the Molly\'s.','The Molly Maguires',42345,3.2872,6.4,'wJvmsE-yEyI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5772,_binary '\0','/cTG7NNt6ynOyR3r6pJVjgiAi462.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066093',7,3386,'en','Monte Walsh','Monte Walsh is an aging cowboy facing the ending days of the Wild West era. As barbed wire and railways steadily eliminate the need for the cowboy, Monte and his friends are left with fewer and fewer options. New work opportunities are available to them, but the freedom of the open prarie is what they long for. Eventually, they all must say goodbye to the lives they knew, and try to make a new start.','/oASAa5HE0J4lqfIsaSegzglU9ij.jpg','1970-09-26',99,'Released','Monte Walsh is what the West was all about.','Monte Walsh',71244,2.3176,6.343,'AKE3-qguqRo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5773,_binary '\0','/mvkHV2E53coW71UDIqbjG1npDhe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066104',5.6,2405,'de','Sie tötete in Ekstase','A vengeful widow seduces and murders the men and women responsible for her husband’s suicide.','/6aqolUAcTzv6BKxoZM1LaIIfxO8.jpg','1971-12-10',81,'Released','Her revenge was blood and death','She Killed in Ecstasy',28294,1.8685,5.1,'RzqCBJMomTw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5774,_binary '\0','/39iwtYN6hB2vDV6K1lHJJiurosn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066109',7.2,3557,'en','The Music Lovers','Composer, conductor and teacher Peter Ilych Tchaikovsky struggles against his homosexual tendencies by marrying, but unfortunately, he chooses wacky nymphomaniac Nina, whom he is unable to satisfy.','/hxqRVEGh86ZZnnzCIlQkuzdcLtM.jpg','1971-02-12',123,'Released','The music lover. He had a love of life. But was torn by it. He reached out for the sensual. And was burned by it. His genius demanded a price. And he paid it.','The Music Lovers',72899,2.499,6.5,'ubvb4Oxy418','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5775,_binary '\0','/kme5jFECpbf3NBwvdB8dyHBNw89.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066115',4.5,3744,'en','Myra Breckinridge','Myron Breckinridge flies to Europe to get a sex-change operation and is transformed into the beautiful Myra. She travels to Hollywood, meets up with her rich Uncle Buck and, claiming to be Myron\'s widow, demands money. Instead, Buck gives Myra a job in his acting school. There, Myra meets aspiring actor Rusty and his girlfriend, Mary Ann. With Myra as catalyst, the trio begin to outrageously expand their sexual horizons.','/hOGo2iLGuR1bkEsZamj4HSMbjC.jpg','1970-06-24',94,'Released','Everything you heard about Myra Breckinridge is true.','Myra Breckinridge',40973,2.6588,4.5,'ywcr3lYuVo0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5776,_binary '\0','/zZ0bs8rPbd0FppyJq5ukaATh745.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066122',7.1,8858,'en','Deep End','London, England. Mike, a fifteen-year-old boy, gets a job in a bathhouse, where he meets Susan, an attractive young woman who works there as an attendant.','/8pZxUJTgjerjxuifSU13B8pXAJB.jpg','1971-03-25',92,'Released','If you can\'t have the real thing— you do all kinds of unreal things.','Deep End',59408,2.8167,7.012,'I3qpEzHmZAA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5777,_binary '\0','/6umXaC6mx34HDkKkZAd50dD8rgp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066130',5.1,1586,'en','Ned Kelly','Unable to support his family in the Australian outback, a man turns to stealing horses in order to make money. He gets more deeply drawn into the outlaw life, and eventually becomes involved in murders. Based on the life of famed 19th-century Australian outlaw Ned Kelly.','/wW9T3zMbE24SbrEv2JEBEoxEtk.jpg','1970-06-10',106,'Released','The true story of Australia\'s most legendary outlaw.','Ned Kelly',38978,1.4884,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5778,_binary '\0','/Afk7j9MnIRPzNhIY2hM3y8E9TLn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066141',6.7,2356,'en','The Night Visitor','An insane Swedish farmer escapes from an asylum to get revenge on his sister, her husband and others.','/bOKz7uhdjuLC9MNNY2874T5h6pX.jpg','1971-02-10',106,'Released','Locked in the cold asylum of his mind – a sane man stalks his prey...','The Night Visitor',72086,1.7886,6.5,'uqq1NF_e430','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5779,_binary '\0','/5swiqOZKdJzJyOykcGYqx3nkE6I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066154',5.8,2244,'en','No Blade of Grass','A strange new virus has appeared, which only attacks strains of grasses such as wheat and rice, and the world is descending into famine and chaos. Architect John, along with his family and friends, is making his way from London to his brother\'s farm in northern England where there will hopefully be food and safety for all of them.','/vHwFAbUNRVz77LnPEXI7VknB916.jpg','1970-06-20',96,'Released','The creeping terror drifted towards them stamping out all civilization in its eerie path!','No Blade of Grass',21886,2.7824,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5780,_binary '\0','/oZgELWwJS8U7QBzdnC08oBYREev.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066160',5.3,2434,'es','La noche de Walpurgis','Elvira is travelling through the French countryside with her friend Genevieve, searching for the lost tomb of a medieval murderess and possible vampire, Countess Wandessa. They find a likely site in the castle of Waldemar Daninsky, who invites the women to stay as long as they like. As Waldemar shows Elvira the tomb that supposedly houses the countess, she accidentally causes the vampire to come back to life, hungrier than ever. Daninsky has a hidden secret of his own, but will it be enough to save the two girls from becoming Wandessa\'s next victims?','/t7dammDmgyynv3luBlr3mQaxQUe.jpg','1971-05-17',95,'Released','Things happen that have never been seen by human beings. The blood flows like vintage wine. See it with someone you hate.','The Werewolf Versus the Vampire Woman',28403,2.4081,5.4,'NqBFofslr_U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5781,_binary '\0','/fVWsmlME9SLzsRK28mFjT0xLJIY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066167',6.4,1442,'it','Una nuvola di polvere… un grido di morte… arriva Sartana','Wily roving gunslinger Sartana arrives in a small town and tries to find a hidden fortune of half a million dollars in gold and two million dollars in counterfeit money. Naturally, a bunch of other treacherous folks who include conniving widow Senora Manassas, shrewd fellow gunslinger Grand Full, and the vicious and unhinged General Monk are also looking to get their greedy hands on said fortune.','/9USuV1t7fouQ8ObLXJ86OnsbIGt.jpg','1970-12-24',96,'Released','Cloud of dust… Cry of death… Sartana is coming','Light the Fuse… Sartana Is Coming',83124,2.2926,6.314,'vmICAPnl9F4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5782,_binary '\0','/3XKMnHWide4UiYg91P5dV073IVS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066181',6.4,4707,'en','On a Clear Day You Can See Forever','Daisy Gamble, an unusual woman who hears phones before they ring, and does wonders with her flowers, wants to quit smoking to please her fiancé, Warren. She goes to a doctor of hypnosis to do it. But once she\'s under, her doctor finds out that she can regress into past lives and different personalities, and he finds himself falling in love with one of them.','/maUgkAqcTTBpMbZoxUmuxtb9mzk.jpg','1970-06-17',129,'Released','Look into my eyes.','On a Clear Day You Can See Forever',38222,2.9536,6.66,'wb0KLj9rnww','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5783,_binary '\0','/jWBecw9360enEW276BJHvCzMPqi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066193',7.1,10193,'en','The Out-of-Towners','A trip to New York for a job interview turns into a trip to hell for a small town couple.','/1yun6b1oVbHvyfnkhs5Ib7uQjSL.jpg','1970-05-28',98,'Released','When they take you for an out-of-towner, they really take you.','The Out-of-Towners',20444,3.8163,6.794,'xgXtfWx5cfg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5784,_binary '\0','/g1s0fNx41SdJ8xRNCV9nmLucxVf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066195',6.4,4782,'en','The Owl and the Pussycat','Meek, owlish Felix and strident, catty Doris live in the same apartment building. His incessant typing bothers her; her gentlemen callers bother him. Felix informs the landlord of her activities, so Doris moves in on Felix. When they both get thrown out, they move in with Barney... until they drive him out! That\'s when Felix and Doris finally decide to put theory into practice. But do opposites attract?','/yGzDvJ99qHM1rpQef8wlm2Cxchl.jpg','1970-11-03',95,'Released','It\'s no longer a story for children.','The Owl and the Pussycat',42597,3.1273,6.2,'uD4UT26qnpk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5785,_binary '\0','/txXPooNu7fr4YhLwx7AlXkU0PnN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066206',7.9,114211,'en','Patton','\"Patton\" tells the tale of General George S. Patton, famous tank commander of World War II. The film begins with Patton\'s career in North Africa and progresses through the invasion of Germany and the fall of the Third Reich. Side plots also speak of Patton\'s numerous faults such his temper and habit towards insubordination.','/rLM7jIEPTjj4CF7F1IrzzNjLUCu.jpg','1970-01-25',172,'Released','The Rebel Warrior','Patton',11202,6.9595,7.447,'bLXzqSmxGaM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5786,_binary '\0','/3yZva3ONs7C1kKJ6IVvrZQJCUIj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066207',7,8054,'fr','Peau d\'âne','A fairy godmother helps a princess disguise herself so she won\'t have to marry her father.','/kSODEFNpTBCOJNHhsbwrwvH0Uvd.jpg','1970-12-16',90,'Released','The skin of an animal hid her captivating beauty that only a prince could discover!','Donkey Skin',5590,5.4188,7.2,'2jTtSppDlNA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5787,_binary '\0','/1CNov0ElVrYUzTLJUReangjzJw3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066212',6.4,1351,'en','Perfect Friday','The deputy manager of a London bank has worked out a way to rob the branch of £200,000. When he becomes involved with the attractive Lady Dorset he decides to go ahead with his plan. He needs her help and that of her philandering spendthrift husband. It all comes down to a matter of trust.','/nnlGtQgg6yYnnq9PAo5BJmo1TA2.jpg','1970-11-10',94,'Released','The perfect BAIT. The perfect CRIME. The perfect TRIPLE CROSS. It All Happens on Perfect Friday.','Perfect Friday',91583,1.6736,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5788,_binary '\0','/u6twkjIhNbNynmWWHrCZ5BZpfNI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066214',6.7,12352,'en','Performance.','In underworld terms, Chas Devlin is a \'performer,\' a gangster with a talent for violence and intimidation. Turner is a reclusive rock superstar. When Chas and Turner meet, their worlds collide—and the impact is both exotic and explosive.','/yKuqk84TtTpj0nYZS5m680JmprG.jpg','1970-08-03',106,'Released','See them all in a film about fantasy. And reality. Vice. And versa.','Performance.',26606,2.0985,6.76,'JyamwoLSqTI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5789,_binary '\0','/79IDgRdjQ2KenGlOmIwZYuwJAR5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066227',6.9,6113,'sv','Pippi Långstrump på de sju haven','Pippi Longstocking, accompanied by friends Tommy and Annika, adventures on the South Seas to search for her father, who has been kidnapped by pirates.','/oyi9bkhQ5q4FwL6f3mdNcgJAyyN.jpg','1970-01-24',95,'Released',NULL,'Pippi in the South Seas',12127,3.2235,6.92,'feBcyA4Ru2Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5790,_binary '\0','/rVgW81YtIyMZFoRBwv4vOxaOMnA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066237',8.1,2135,'bn','প্রতি দ্বন্দ্বী','Siddhartho Chowdhury, a brilliant young medical student, is forced to leave his studies after his father\'s sudden demise. He is forced to navigate the high unemployment rate and the communist socio-political climate of 1960s Calcutta in search of a job.','/oUGlRTP0DaidYWoE8IfoN9WO1eH.jpg','1970-10-27',110,'Released','Man vs. Metropolis','The Adversary',42498,1.588,7.25,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5791,_binary '\0','/9FxGJdhpvDjb0qvhEjNFT3a1r4L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066249',7,15055,'en','The Private Life of Sherlock Holmes','When a bored Sherlock eagerly takes the case of Gabrielle Valladon following an attempt on her life, the search for her missing husband leads to Loch Ness and the legendary monster.','/vQSYu0DXkqTOEfWF21AzaqXxYCZ.jpg','1970-10-29',125,'Released','Anything But Elementary.','The Private Life of Sherlock Holmes',5185,4.5632,6.8,'sFvUB6cn_IA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5792,_binary '\0','/ncrzqLQXEFZDBkrBzbYoxjDLyGi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066256',6.5,1345,'en','Pufnstuf','Jimmy (Jack Wild) ventures to Living Island with his magical, talking flute, Freddy. Once there, he befriends many of the island\'s inhabitants, but the evil Witchiepoo (Billie Hayes) is determined to steal Freddy the flute away from the boy to impress the visiting Witches\' Council and win the Witch of the Year Award.','/qhr2xcHmE87IYQv1ohRTxdhszXg.jpg','1970-05-13',94,'Released','A musical adventure of Double-Stuffed proportions!','Pufnstuf',63859,1.4777,6.2,'qKbyYvFyRfk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5793,_binary '\0','/7vtdOiO1lz6RPH44sUiKKiShp3s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066258',6,1512,'en','Puppet on a Chain','Following a triple professional hit a U.S. agent, Paul Sherman, arrives in Amsterdam to investigate a heroin smuggling ring. He finds a city rife with drugs and a police force unable or unwilling to do much about it. With his incognito female fellow agent, Maggie, the American is soon stirring things up.','/xNM1z4fWyP9SnX4QokFmYfZb839.jpg','1970-08-02',98,'Released','It will keep you hanging on the edge of your seat....','Puppet on a Chain',32034,2.928,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5794,_binary '\0','/oFMyC3ZE6hIrZFnl0zoEoOKMl2p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066265',6.8,4416,'sv','På rymmen med Pippi Långstrump','Fed up with their strict parents, Tommy and Annika run away from home, with their friend Pippi Longstocking to look after them in their long trek.','/2iUh3aslpUL2ek7SDp78axm3w3Z.jpg','1970-11-14',94,'Released','Pippi Longstocking\'s Newest, Most Hilarious Adventure!','Pippi on the Run',11626,2.9985,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5795,_binary '\0','/3AADhdnGMABTMOOEb1as4Lt9Zfj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066279',7.3,6406,'en','The Railway Children','At the dawn of the 20th century, following their father\'s arrest on suspicion of betraying state secrets, the three Waterbury children—Bobbie, Phyllis and Peter—move with their mother to Yorkshire, where they find themselves involved in unexpected dramas along the railway by their new home.','/kusEIHfdngzcypY36yjWJVWMShj.jpg','1970-12-21',109,'Released','The railway, the children... and the wonderful secret they\'ll share with you!','The Railway Children',37662,1.8653,6.75,'NvG0V-M_8wU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5796,_binary '\0','/8P9voQG9lDpuKyuZgnypByfzzlk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066289',7.5,4001,'pl','Rejs','A stowaway sneaks aboard a ship departing on a cruise down the Vistula River. The captain takes him for a Communist Party cultural coordinator and the intruder gladly adapts to his new role, immediately setting to work at manipulating the passengers and crew into silly and vaguely humiliating games. Before long, Tym has got everyone under his thumb and created his own comedic dictatorship.','/rUNhVVY3WkPQpKRfdW8c3qrfgbh.jpg','1970-10-19',65,'Released',NULL,'The Cruise',36404,0.9228,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5797,_binary '\0','/yxAw8UE3MiYbc6yCN3XhVXdG9yx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066301',6.7,15435,'en','Rio Lobo','After the Civil War, a former Union colonel searches for the two traitors whose perfidy led to the loss of a close friend.','/2vlpjEE5GxJr7CiURQ4e2DWybkw.jpg','1970-04-01',116,'Released','Give \'Em Hell, John.','Rio Lobo',26593,4.8103,6.468,'nFteTTDde0c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5798,_binary '\0','/70bYQWBw1rFwrNsg4GTPQoL0naI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066318',7.1,2308,'fr','La Rupture','An innocent woman falls prey to her abusive husband, his wealthy father and a shady family friend.','/jiX8v5NPmnxQvIPxb6aZp76UYeJ.jpg','1970-08-26',124,'Released',NULL,'The Breach',4266,2.0237,6.2,'tF96zYv9z6k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5799,_binary '\0','/3247bXj6vbjPpMCMleiNUgoG89q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066319',7.4,11781,'en','Ryan\'s Daughter','In the wake of the 1916 Easter Rising, a married schoolteacher in a small Irish village has an affair with a troubled British officer.','/g5NAbtEK5bEAkBdXq6YM7a7tkZO.jpg','1970-11-09',206,'Released','A story of love...set against the violence of rebellion','Ryan\'s Daughter',38953,2.8293,7.1,'T0qXgUvQo2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5800,_binary '\0','/4byysN0CjC1vabe8bSGzPZWGU8Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066327',7.7,20282,'en','Santa Claus Is Comin\' to Town','A postman, S.D. Kluger, decides to answer some of the most common questions about Santa Claus, and tells us about a baby named Kris who is raised by a family of elf toymakers named Kringle. When Kris grows up, he wants to deliver toys to the children of Sombertown. But its Mayor is too mean to let that happen. And to make things worse, the Winter Warlock lives between the Kringles and Sombertown.','/8BYZEKB0BQkbniS1WRzPaU38cmp.jpg','1970-12-13',51,'Released','You better watch out!','Santa Claus Is Comin\' to Town',13400,3.7921,7.154,'c2qkv_RB9-o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5801,_binary '\0','/bHHyjodPqQVlNiRR9g6L5ar5JOy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066344',7.5,14058,'en','Scrooge','A musical adaptation of Charles Dickens\' classic ghost tale starring Albert Finney.','/eadjJGFdbZdhXSjtokmay7NjVHi.jpg','1970-11-05',114,'Released','What the Dickens have they done to Scrooge?','Scrooge',13765,3.0646,6.8,'EDWxqmEBG_s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5802,_binary '\0','/5FZ41qoEA69xr5ow6VAVlrIU2eh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066356',7.9,3458,'en','7 Plus Seven','After a 7 year wait, director Michael Apted revisits the same group of British-born children from Seven Up! The subjects are interviewed as to the changes that have occurred in their lives during the last seven years.','/v4Dzob8aIKMdbJoLQ363lA6NS1r.jpg','1970-12-15',52,'Released',NULL,'7 Plus Seven',50754,1.2034,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5803,_binary '\0','/ivCjtu14DXhEVrzGkqXHob44Cu5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066365',4.6,1405,'en','Shark','A gunrunner loses his cargo near a small coastal Sudanese town so he\'s stuck there. When a woman hires him to raid a sunken ship in the shark-infested waters, he sees a chance to compensate for his losses. He\'s not the only one.','/yUTzpRHEWHSZerpKcozoA9NlvQR.jpg','1969-10-08',92,'Released','A realistic film became too real! Shark will rip you apart!','Shark',4992,1.5916,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5804,_binary '\0','/mQvyxrbSIadB30lHGVjOGrxBJq7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066380',5.4,6073,'es','Vampyros Lesbos','An erotic horror tale about a vixen vampiress seducing and killing women to appease her insatiable thirst for female blood.','/qaZc7veACx1vmq6tZtnIT6vLmxM.jpg','1971-07-15',90,'Released','A Psycho-Sexadelic Horror Freakout!','Vampyros Lesbos',17343,2.665,5.7,'iZnDPGaaXMA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5805,_binary '\0','/ff2zbJ1PljlCWY5npok4TctInsW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066390',6.9,7403,'en','Soldier Blue','After a cavalry group is massacred by the Cheyenne, only two survivors remain: Honus, a naive private devoted to his duty, and Cresta, a young woman who had lived with the Cheyenne two years and whose sympathies lie more with them than with the US government. Together, they must try to reach the cavalry\'s main base camp. As they travel onward, Honus is torn between his growing affection for Cresta.','/2fRfVQpdrjAhvxwytG0scOqdQOJ.jpg','1970-08-12',115,'Released','The most savage film in history!','Soldier Blue',14384,5.41,6.755,'wkEs3dkqJHw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5806,_binary '\0','/pAsnL96oWdBDIYAoXPiLley0kCf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066392',7,1267,'en','Something for Everyone','In post-war Austria, an opportunistic young man begins working as a footman to a widowed countess and uses his sexual talents to better his station in life.','/qJwBSnDLtcIETEAwx1rrop3SIm1.jpg','1970-07-22',112,'Released','Compared to them, the MacBeths were just plain folks and the Borgias were a nice Italian family.','Something for Everyone',150043,1.3358,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5807,_binary '\0','/ljG6LY7bT6qlV560dIsuE0Y3iZl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066402',6.4,3486,'en','Start the Revolution Without Me','Two sets of identical twins are accidentally switched at birth. One pair, Phillipe and Pierre DeSisi, are aristocratic and haughty, while the other, Charles and Claude Coupé, are poor and dim-witted. On the eve of the French Revolution, both sets find themselves entangled in palace intrigue.','/z4gspFa639yUWLSyefP5yCxKgRi.jpg','1970-02-04',90,'Released','Gene Wilder... wilder than ever!','Start the Revolution Without Me',19753,3.0025,6,'weuuQ9pMHwU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5808,_binary '\0','/fEy6l6Fni0mYq0IWLc5yVCAVXOP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066407',5.1,1321,'da','Stille dage i Clichy','Joey is a struggling writer with no money. His roommate Carl is a charming stud with a taste for young girls. Together, these two insatiable dreamers will laugh, love and screw their way through a decadent Paris paved with wanton women, wild orgies and outrageous erotic adventures.','/liVNctVdb6j6xdY6MwxcIvnxQGk.jpg','1970-06-01',80,'Released',NULL,'Quiet Days in Clichy',62759,1.6343,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5809,_binary '\0','/ovjuyiShsoriFOMJeDlUmZdGQVB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066412',6.9,6409,'it','Lo strano vizio della Signora Wardh','When socialite and heiress Julie Wardh begins receiving blackmail letters attributed to a mysterious serial killer, she suspects her cruel and sadistic former lover Jean is behind them. With her husband Neil frequently out of town, she falls into the arms of her friend\'s cousin George, and as the unknown assassin begins to make his move, she fears that one of the three men in her life may be the killer.','/6UvVeGdC1DFc97e8U2Jis121bjq.jpg','1971-01-15',96,'Released','Always unheard… unseen… until he reached out to touch and caress!','The Strange Vice of Mrs Wardh',30903,2.8935,6.8,'mqeTmeU1azw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5810,_binary '\0','/teD2odnlfZUyAoSgxtzkZrR4UXG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066413',6.8,3481,'it','Strategia del ragno','A young man returns to his countryside hometown to investigate the unclear circumstances behind the death of his father, ostensibly killed by Fascists in 1936, before his birth. As he unravels a web of lies that seems to encompass the whole town, he finds himself entangled in the same web.','/z8IK3qwu3pscCFsIK6Wkbn4boq3.jpg','1970-09-17',100,'Released',NULL,'The Spider\'s Stratagem',42595,1.8329,7.051,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5811,_binary '\0','/l81DeDoiLHJJnudqGcGLZUo9EZH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066415',6.6,1962,'en','The Strawberry Statement','A college student joins a group of revolutionaries to meet girls but ends up committed to their goals.','/kKhzIkHWrg51jkTRxq6eAhBSIIl.jpg','1970-08-28',109,'Released','They\'re young and feel everything more deeply... and there\'s so much to feel deeply about.','The Strawberry Statement',51956,2.1931,5.9,'UIgaarWfhsI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5812,_binary '\0','/2Id4DNJRw5pnCfjltNvMdpZnuhk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066423',6.2,3895,'fr','Sur un arbre perché','Henry Roubier, a French promoter, and Enrico Mazzini, an Italian, have signed an agreement guaranteeing them a stranglehold on European highways. While driving on the roads of the south, Roubier takes two young hitchhikers, but an unfortunate swerve the car rushes by Henri and its occupants on the top of a pine tree onto the side of a cliff.','/91SYK4YPHZYwyM8Zp049xQDMrOL.jpg','1971-04-12',90,'Released',NULL,'Perched on a Tree',11914,2.9072,5.329,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5813,_binary '\0','/fM9ODwfR7m8fI2g99M9WyhvqXtI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066434',6.6,58007,'en','THX 1138','People in the future live in a totalitarian society. A technician named THX 1138 lives a mundane life between work and taking a controlled consumption of drugs that the government uses to make puppets out of people. As THX is without drugs for the first time he has feelings for a woman and they start a secret relationship.','/pPyEXW7h2SJRjTsHZqrIlXxOgW9.jpg','1971-03-11',86,'Released','The Future is here.','THX 1138',636,3.5431,6.438,'a64IVhSsjdQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5814,_binary '\0','/aJd3j8MOg7EfhIAl3WeWiDS9xjd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066448',6.8,5765,'en','There Was a Crooked Man...','A charming but ruthless criminal is sent to a remote Arizona prison, where he enlists the help of his cellmates in an escape attempt with the promise of sharing his hidden loot.','/qHGNCWJiOOnmbF8tfVXdkFmQZWD.jpg','1970-09-18',123,'Released','Of All the Crooked Men in All the Crooked West One of Them Was the Best!','There Was a Crooked Man...',27172,3.3389,6.819,'HpNHkVRyPW8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5815,_binary '\0','/r4YQPFetu003ITMirFj7u9HX3aM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066449',5.7,3067,'en','There\'s a Girl in My Soup','TV personality Robert Danvers, an exceedingly vain rotter, seduces young women daily, never staying long with one. He meets his match in Marion, an American, 19, who\'s available but refuses any romantic illusions.','/195ursANUsXrV5voVTkPGDtpueE.jpg','1970-12-15',95,'Released','Soup\'s on!','There\'s a Girl in My Soup',42599,2.7205,5.5,'4TACE9lBDUY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5816,_binary '\0','/jmQb9ajubJ6hqSS5aa9RiYdszsA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066450',6,5014,'en','They Call Me Mister Tibbs!','A police detective\'s investigation of a prostitute\'s murder points to his best friend.','/7UMb7hDPMlJPOvRgkclclnbtjRq.jpg','1970-07-10',108,'Released','The last time Virgil Tibbs had a day like this was \"In the Heat of the Night\"','They Call Me Mister Tibbs!',34732,3.8621,5.9,'0XOBh6tSVEE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5817,_binary '\0','/upopjN9c58ZHd6FYXUwcoKldnyf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066461',8.5,2863,'hr','Tko pjeva zlo ne misli','Set in pre-World War II Zagreb, the story is seen through the eyes of 6-year-old Perica Šafranek (played by Tomislav Žganec). A dandy from Zagreb, Mr Fulir (played by Relja Bašić), starts flirting with Perica\'s mother during a family picnic. At first, Perica\'s father doesn\'t notice anything, but wants to marry off Perica\'s aunt, so he invites the man to their residence. After multiple rendezvous, Perica\'s father becomes aware of Fulir\'s attempts to seduce his wife.','/t0IB5koLpfUFt24mL3CX89eJD3J.jpg','1970-10-19',95,'Released',NULL,'One Song a Day Takes Mischief Away',221244,0.9803,6.717,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5818,_binary '\0','/bqKPCNHjmkFn8vLLA5LjwJCPbki.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066471',6.6,4363,'en','Too Late the Hero','A WWII film set on a Pacific island. Japanese and allied forces occupy different parts of the island. When a group of British soldiers are sent on a mission behind enemy lines, things don\'t go exactly to plan. This film differs in that some of the \'heroes\' are very reluctant, but they come good when they are pursued by the Japanese who are determined to prevent them returning to base.','/sPSwjNA1OVkotd10pH8G9xNCFTN.jpg','1970-05-20',145,'Released','War. It\'s a dying business.','Too Late the Hero',31935,3.3052,6.439,'tl6LHhzmlHA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5819,_binary '\0','/z2mntgw06VvPybd1YlNBi5prg7N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066473',7.5,40208,'en','Tora! Tora! Tora!','In the summer of 1941, the United States and Japan seem on the brink of war after constant embargos and failed diplomacy come to no end. \"Tora! Tora! Tora!\", named after the code words used by the lead Japanese pilot to indicate they had surprised the Americans, covers the days leading up to the attack on Pearl Harbor, which plunged America into the Second World War.','/c311sN931DixuZRer0JGYCwpx9N.jpg','1970-01-26',144,'Released','The incredible attack on Pearl Harbor.','Tora! Tora! Tora!',11165,8.7462,7.2,'-n1pKsGqrqQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5820,_binary '\0','/vJuSO97qlgvtruzUOrnTdvVORbH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066476',2.4,3256,'en','The Touch of Satan','A murderous and decrepit old woman resides on a California walnut farm with her family. On a whim, a traveler named Jodie makes a brief side trip to the farm, where he meets and falls in love with Melissa, the proverbial farmer\'s daughter. Jodie and Melissa grow closer as Melissa begins to reveal the strange, dark history of her family.','/hYuIjm96PQnzZzkvNm35BhX8kHl.jpg','1971-08-23',90,'Released','To Love Her Is To Be Cursed!','The Touch of Satan',31382,1.4693,3,'tRBPUhOF-bk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5821,_binary '\0','/cu7d0RKDbIU2J4yXlG3a7lDQK37.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066482',6.1,3041,'en','Trash','The movie follows Joe, a heroin addict, throughout his quest to score more drugs. The episodic plot occurs over a single day and centers on Joe\'s problematic relationship with his on-off, sexually frustrated girlfriend. During the course of the day, Joe overdoses in front of an upper-class couple, attempts to fool Welfare into approving his methadone treatment by having Holly fake a pregnancy, and frustrates the women in his life with his drug-induced impotence.','/bQAICaVkVQoeCAQLNbrVng6WVt0.jpg','1970-10-05',110,'Released',NULL,'Trash',89199,1.7832,5.7,'1youklSzX90','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5822,_binary '\0','/rAJEXUzsWRuM5zcmiWs2b10AZTC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066491',7.4,13978,'es','Tristana','As a young woman, Tristana is orphaned and taken under the guardianship of Don Lope, a respected member of the community, who takes advantage of his innocent charge. When Tristana falls in love with artist Horacio, she must learn to be more assertive in order to achieve independence from her nefarious guardian, or her blossoming relationship with Horacio is doomed.','/zs695dsih9HRlj0YF4rujHTRya5.jpg','1970-03-29',98,'Released','Somewhere between the innocent girl and the not so innocent mistress is the bizarre, sensuous story of Tristana','Tristana',35838,3.8568,7.2,'HJSRcBb8gb4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5823,_binary '\0','/x68NlwH8LstpVfcBKnFQ9bsNB1A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066492',4,3480,'en','Trog','Anthropologist Dr Brockton unearths a primitive troglodyte — an Ice Age \'missing link\': half-caveman, half-ape — in a local cave. Through experimentation, she manages to communicate with and domesticate him before he\'s released by an irate land developer and goes on a rampage, terrorising the local citizenry.','/tGSYOU7ozwVTjutl9T8SshPTzPd.jpg','1970-10-24',91,'Released','From a million years back...Horror explodes into today!','Trog',44000,1.5322,4.6,'68JrnoSzgVo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5824,_binary '\0','/mSvu3wHtw6XB6EPe8AVErITAamr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066495',6.4,7940,'en','The Twelve Chairs','In 1920s Soviet Russia, a fallen aristocrat, a priest and a con artist search for a treasure of jewels hidden inside one of twelve dining chairs, lost during the revolution.','/qw0yZKqdWyakNRasQ3NvEiRyZpN.jpg','1970-10-28',94,'Released','A wild and hilarious chase for a fortune in jewels.','The Twelve Chairs',24918,3.2478,6.2,'Wt1lHyuTDWE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5825,_binary '\0','/bjuttI5ewihYXhODlYXv82iKU1A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066498',7.6,3798,'cs','Ucho','Government bureaucrat Ludvik becomes suspicious after several colleagues disappear and he overhears something strange at a cocktail party. Returning home with his wife, Anna, he finds their house under surveillance and spends a fraught night worrying about his possible arrest in the morning. Marital difficulties come to light as Ludvik and his wife attempt to act normal in front of the cameras while dredging up their problems out of sight.','/tvLMBdTZPxMvWoBis5Sel05lDB6.jpg','1990-01-01',95,'Released',NULL,'The Ear',88953,1.4454,7.253,'wVuMrrMiFbM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5826,_binary '\0','/mdPQzNJx8fgES4kq3NUXMVksv8o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066500',7.9,4703,'tr','Umut','After losing one of his horses in an accident, an illiterate horse cab driver sets out into the desert in a quest for a mythical lost treasure.','/zh0aj9PwrZ0gqdflp88RLw8VKKh.jpg','1970-05-25',100,'Released',NULL,'Hope',52104,2.0569,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5827,_binary '\0','/eTEDrFvAMt18BtUMqWyhn0z751A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066511',7.6,2237,'it','Uomini contro','Time after time, soldiers of the Italian Army are forced to leave their mountain trenches in attempts to storm an enemy fortress, always with the same disastrous results. As casualties mount, indignation spreads among the rank and file. Disturbed by his superiors\' decisions, Lieutenant Sassu is led to question the purpose of war and reconsider where his real duties lie.','/nCqNhRFXmqBMZePXauTLBC5RyfQ.jpg','1970-09-17',101,'Released','They fought by the rule book... and died by the thousands!','Many Wars Ago',78101,1.6491,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5828,_binary '\0','/cygF3MFce4MDpvyqDQXNvZiytc4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066516',7,13814,'cs','Valerie a týden divů','Valerie, a Czechoslovakian teenager living with her grandmother, is blossoming into womanhood, but that transformation proves secondary to the effects she experiences when she puts on a pair of magic earrings. Now seeing the world around her in a different light, Valerie must endure her sexual awakening while attempting to discern reality from fantasy as she encounters lecherous priest Gracian, a vampire-like stranger and otherworldly carnival folk.','/lY0IkdouazLBpPYot8dsPAsJqHK.jpg','1970-10-16',73,'Released','A journey into womanhood...','Valerie and Her Week of Wonders',46315,3.9373,6.995,'NPLSMpngACo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5829,_binary '\0','/wbherYlV9zGsivnNxzpldjkYkuC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066518',6.4,9347,'en','The Vampire Lovers','In the heart of Styria the Karnstein Family, even after their mortal deaths, rise from their tombs spreading evil in the countryside in their lust for fresh blood. Baron Hartog whose family are all victims of Karnstein vampirism, opens their graves and drives a stake through their diabolical hearts. One grave he cannot locate is that of the legendary beautiful Mircalla Karnstein. Years of peace follow that grisly night until Mircalla reappears to avenge her family\'s decimation and satisfy her desire for blood.','/6MTiYnp62i2kdweHjhchwJscQrj.jpg','1970-10-04',91,'Released','An erotic nightmare of tormented lusts that throb in headless, undead bodies!','The Vampire Lovers',31952,4.1358,6.4,'XYGk0G9IWfE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5830,_binary '\0','/qxXVjxZnWdw6oeMeQXhYDHrqaeM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066530',6.6,1731,'fr','Viva la muerte','At the end of the Spanish civil war, Fando, a boy of about ten, tries to make sense of war and his father\'s arrest. His mother is religious, sympathetic to the Fascists; his father is accused of being a Red. Fando discovers that his mother may have aided in his father\'s arrest. Sometimes we witness Fando imagining explanations for what\'s going on; sometimes we see him at play, alone or with his friend Thérèse. Oedipal fantasies and a lad\'s natural curiosity about sex and death mix with his search for his mother\'s nature and his father\'s fate. Will Fando survive the search?','/G6pItVZarazu876GpMPu7EnCon.jpg','1971-05-12',90,'Released',NULL,'Long Live Death',42528,1.3465,5.9,'yiRPfZaF1vQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5831,_binary '\0','/dlH6bkq4SJwwlLpr7jAWeG2UATx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066534',7.3,8638,'fr','La Voie lactée','Two men, part tramp, part pilgrim, are on their way from France to Santiago de Compostela in Spain. On their way, they meet a vast assortment of characters—some truculent, some violent, and some bizarre; they experience many adventures—some mysterious, some erotic, some even supernatural.','/5lV9Ogp4F8MIB5slKQGrfU9JuEq.jpg','1969-02-28',102,'Released',NULL,'The Milky Way',35031,2.2937,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5832,_binary '\0','/6GmIURwmFGnozNAUWJvApBonMxc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066540',5.5,1574,'en','WUSA','Rheinhardt, a cynical drifter, gets a job as an announcer for right-wing radio station WUSA in New Orleans. Rheinhardt is content to parrot WUSA\'s reactionary editorial stance on the air, even if he doesn\'t agree with it. Rheinhardt finds his cynical detachment challenged by a lady friend, Geraldine, and by Rainey, a neighbour and troubled idealist who becomes aware of WUSA\'s sinister, hidden purpose. And when events start spinning out of control, even Rheinhardt finds he must take a stand.','/3qR3xr9SqlJnSMUy1SjMFWGWzKj.jpg','1970-08-19',115,'Released','Love it or leave it.','WUSA',49411,1.838,5.3,'sh3lwAiQ4Wo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5833,_binary '\0','/5Rw42QGYwcfCxAlHBLXCasUdRJt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066546',7.2,3055,'de','Warum läuft Herr R. Amok?','Technical draftsman Herr R. is a dependable guy. He gets along with his colleagues although his boss wants him to go beyond technical cleanliness to problem solving. He\'s a dutiful husband; his wife\'s a social climber and pressures him to seek a promotion, but they also share sweet moments. He\'s a caring father, helping his son with homework. His parents visit; his mother criticizes his wife. Old schoolmates drop by, as do neighbours. Some comment on his wife\'s expensive tastes. His promotion may be a long shot, especially after he gives a dull and tipsy toast at an office dinner. But why would Herr R. run amok?','/wnHawdMrCGmeeCb2SyYKuc1CvWT.jpg','1970-06-28',84,'Released',NULL,'Why Does Herr R. Run Amok?',10308,1.8836,7.36,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5834,_binary '\0','/yvUkDp3uWj8SpeHQVpmLpnMW3Vc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066549',7.3,14882,'en','Waterloo','After defeating France and imprisoning Napoleon on Elba, ending two decades of war, Europe is shocked to find Napoleon has escaped and has caused the French Army to defect from the King back to him. The best of the British generals, the Duke of Wellington, beat Napolean\'s best generals in Spain and Portugal, but now must beat Napoleon himself with an Anglo Allied army.','/zd4SV3qs5Xg7Yl8kqshU2fxTT0D.jpg','1970-10-26',134,'Released','One incredible afternoon Napoleon met Wellington . . . at Waterloo.','Waterloo',33157,3.846,7.1,'JmRDwWiz6kw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5835,_binary '\0','/pbpd9rg7suUml8GXvQmzkaYwZBi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066550',6.7,3324,'en','Watermelon Man','A racist insurance agent lives in a typical suburban neighborhood, but his bigoted world of taunting and harassing black people on and off the job is turned upside down when his skin inexplicably turns dark overnight.','/7jKQ7goaKwlpDz40ZrgoXWHg26n.jpg','1970-05-27',100,'Released','His white bread world just turned upside brown!','Watermelon Man',42600,1.5841,6.3,'cC_rYYnD05s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5836,_binary '\0','/cLJMQ0igyeZlGJBhitaFSlpMyqq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066561',5.2,3235,'en','When Dinosaurs Ruled the Earth','An ancient tribe attempts to sacrifice Sanna as an offering to the Sun god to save their tribe from dinosaurs. Tara, a young man from another tribe, saves Sanna and takes her along with him.','/jrqwwOfeGQSlRIOvn2zOE9oYHyh.jpg','1970-10-25',100,'Released','Enter an age of unknown terrors, pagan worship and virgin sacrifice...','When Dinosaurs Ruled the Earth',35002,3.2492,6.1,'lHaClZaXoJk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5837,_binary '\0','/dCiMfg9Io0TRftq14JM1SCSin7U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066563',6.4,2627,'en','Where’s Poppa?','When New York attorney Gordon Hocheiser meets Louise Callan, the girl of his dreams, he schemes to eliminate his aging, senile mother, even though he promised his late father that he\'d always take care of her. He fears that his batty mom\'s eccentricities will shortly lead to Louise\'s departure.','/eXRK08Ml1WcBOVcaPHZu1Kqxdp2.jpg','1970-11-10',82,'Released','The tush scene alone is worth the price of admission.','Where’s Poppa?',42569,2.4791,6,'McVuDLbpfbA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5838,_binary '\0','/8UtMQhSorcv6nIcsNzgAKJfLmqS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066564',4.6,1539,'en','Which Way to the Front?','Brendan Byers III, one of the richest men in America, has been pronounced 4-F and can\'t serve his country in its war against Hitler. Byers does not take \"No\" for an answer and recruits other 4-F\'s to fight against Hitler.','/2Bar3vLPSVSCeXF9qeNZSG6I7jj.jpg','1970-09-03',96,'Released','You vill see... and you vill laugh.','Which Way to the Front?',123961,1.9876,4.8,'bdrpvoL9NHs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5839,_binary '\0','/wsl9ig1xEGX7q7SidK3gaOMmqY9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066565',7.6,8838,'ru','Белое солнце пустыни','The setting is the east shore of the Caspian Sea (today\'s Turkmenistan) where the Red Army soldier Fyodor Sukhov has been fighting the Civil War in Russian Asia for a number of years. After being hospitalised and then demobbed, he sets off home to join his wife, only to be caught up in a desert fight between a Red Army cavalry unit and Basmachi guerrillas. The cavalry unit commander, Rahimov, \"convinces\" Sukhov to help, temporarily, with the protection of abandoned women of the Basmachi guerrilla leader Abdullah\'s harem. Leaving a young Red Army soldier, Petrukha, to assist Sukhov with the task, Rahimov and his cavalry unit set out to pursue fleeing Abdullah.Sukhov and women from Abdullah\'s harem return to a nearby shore town. Soon, looking for a seaway across the border, Abdullah and his gang come to the same town...','/m0dWCKMtZAlPERK7Wsq7DH2BS4M.jpg','1969-12-14',83,'Released',NULL,'The White Sun of the Desert',20848,2.2919,7.257,'QU24JzKG8WQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5840,_binary '\0','/mwmWIZeLNREOiW5fcvfWWRUevFv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066578',5.2,4345,'en','The Wizard of Gore','A talk show hostess and her boyfriend investigate a shady magician who has the ability to hypnotize and control people\'s thoughts in order to stage gory onstage illusions using his powers of mindbending.','/z8zaRJb0e19jrniGoZoWzwCWTQk.jpg','1970-10-23',95,'Released','Is It Magic? Or Wholesale Slaughter?','The Wizard of Gore',23506,1.3594,5.4,'F-5Xus_DwSU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5841,_binary '\0','/v8THzvdUncS8sO7rP3eVrVfwkGi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066579',7.1,9847,'en','Women in Love','Growing up in the sheltered confines of a 1920s English coal-mining community, free-spirited sisters Gudrun and Ursula explore erotic love with a wealthy playboy and a philosophical educator, with cataclysmic results for all four.','/uHfThxdQC99LLoe2jKZ1u3vIge2.jpg','1969-09-13',131,'Released','The relationship between four sensual people is limited: They must find a new way.','Women in Love',66027,3.5581,6.6,'Rn8EPZtnsrE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5842,_binary '\0','/50tOx2lJXuszVjwCjNYHEXnPMWx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066580',8.1,19633,'en','Woodstock','An intimate look at the Woodstock Music & Art Festival held in Bethel, NY in 1969, from preparation through cleanup, with historic access to insiders, blistering concert footage, and portraits of the concertgoers; negative and positive aspects are shown, from drug use by performers to naked fans sliding in the mud, from the collapse of the fences by the unexpected hordes to the surreal arrival of National Guard helicopters with food and medical assistance for the impromptu city of 500,000.','/AapH8Qx4kUZoO7F4aK5cUnHjtdg.jpg','1970-03-26',224,'Released','3 days of peace, music...and love.','Woodstock',9459,3.217,7.6,'IrfrRqOSZVI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5843,_binary '\0','/8kcFXRFMuSAiqTpOshNbpUL8Fh0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066585',6.3,2656,'en','Wuthering Heights','Young orphan Heathcliff is adopted by the wealthy Earnshaw family and moves into their estate, Wuthering Heights. Soon, the new resident falls for his compassionate foster sister, Cathy. The two share a remarkable bond that seems unbreakable until Cathy, feeling the pressure of social convention, suppresses her feelings and marries Edgar Linton, a man of means who befits her stature. Heathcliff vows to win her back.','/gOK1fb5nvk6IXTRmOr1pPsNr8Zu.jpg','1970-06-09',104,'Released','The power, the passion, the terror of Emily Bronte\'s immortal story of young love.','Wuthering Heights',98491,3.2581,6.4,'Jl-PjHZ6ITY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5844,_binary '\0','/9FJv6PD41Mfsu50AA6lto8aCYyE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066593',5.7,2004,'en','You Can\'t Win \'Em All','During the 1922 Turkish Civil War, two Americans and a group of foreign mercenaries offer their services to a local Turkish governor who hires them as guards for a secret transport.','/pf1eaEAZaTFwMpcJngq4UE3EOvL.jpg','1970-07-23',97,'Released','Two soldiers of fortune matching wits and guns against the armies of two nations!','You Can\'t Win \'Em All',161460,3.5098,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5845,_binary '\0','/5MVdjenheGI20somGcX3yC3A19T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066600',6.6,1588,'ja','幽霊屋敷の恐怖 血を吸う人形','A young man goes missing after visiting his girlfriend\'s isolated country home. His sister and her boyfriend trace him to the creepy mansion, but their search becomes perilous when they uncover a gruesome family history.','/4U5kCOqxDUaY8XxKsOewSSgVq2h.jpg','1970-07-04',71,'Released','The curse of an undead beauty who has risen, weeping in her search for fresh blood...','The Vampire Doll',115018,1.5352,6.921,'9MnCFRms0K0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5846,_binary '\0','/nLb3TOTjgvvjmHnUmlkg4Rwq9jG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066601',6.9,18581,'en','Zabriskie Point','Anthropology student Daria, who\'s helping a property developer build a village in the Los Angeles desert, and dropout Mark, who\'s wanted by the authorities for allegedly killing a policeman during a student riot, accidentally encounter each other in Death Valley and soon begin an unrestrained romance.','/uelo2oMg4fM51LAm4eEArEwOHXZ.jpg','1970-03-26',113,'Released','How you get there depends on where you\'re at.','Zabriskie Point',2998,3.4924,7,'iBaMHIBySpk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5847,_binary '\0','/8Qkx4cKWbGR10pyFmObVSbKEAXW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066602',7.1,1930,'ja','新座頭市 破れ！唐人剣','Zatoichi is a blind massage therapist and swordsman who finds out that something troubling is taking place on the outskirts of town. After discovering who the guilty parties are -- an accomplished Chinese martial artist named Wang Kang and his youthful attendant -- Zatoichi finds them and discovers that the pair\'s mixed up with a dangerous bunch of terrorist samurai who murdered the boy\'s parents. Now, Zatoichi must step in to save the day.','/Aki4LCd3nLmqgfXJp70GK60fiId.jpg','1971-01-13',94,'Released',NULL,'Zatoichi Meets the One-Armed Swordsman',24444,1.9994,6.8,'ni18UzsE578','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5848,_binary '\0','/y0W77MnV5tPPqsNiHQ7AsD5QWXm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066603',7,3159,'ja','座頭市と用心棒','Zatoichi treks to a village that has always been a favorite spot of his, only to discover that it’s become a living hell, plagued by feuding father and son yakuza as well as the younger crime boss’s bodyguard, scruffy, smart-mouthed, cash-hungry Yojimbo of legend.','/faY48OfU3M32JXWUNz8doaG3Cd4.jpg','1970-01-15',115,'Released',NULL,'Zatoichi Meets Yojimbo',42601,2.2579,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5849,_binary '\0','/f1IVvhl1eRGVkRdSMv31dNyBBMk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066612',7.2,5551,'it','Vamos a matar, compañeros','Arms dealer Yolaf Peterson aims to make a sale to guerilla Mongo, but the money is locked in a bank safe, the combination known only to Professor Xantos, a prisoner of the Americans. Yolaf agrees to free Xantos, accompanied by reluctant guerilla Basco, but a former business partner of Yolaf\'s- John \'The Wooden Hand\', has other ideas.','/i5pRcXrVo3zcoTCV9iMIf5qgrrk.jpg','1970-12-18',120,'Released','Fate brought them together, greed made them inseparable, and violence made them Compañeros!','Compañeros',61044,2.962,6.5,'vLAfW9P2Mtk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5850,_binary '\0','/1M3bYS0HmY2sbILlrXKKKvXHLgq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066639',7.2,1483,'ja','儀式','Oshima’s magisterial epic, centering on the ambivalent surviving heir of the Sakurada clan, uses ritual and the microcosm of the traditional family to trace the rise and fall of militaristic Japan across several decades.','/zcF7oQAmnSpYZQSWXsJdI6WuWyT.jpg','1971-05-18',123,'Released',NULL,'The Ceremony',94466,1.9573,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5851,_binary '\0','/utbO9R3vPqIPEmRiQLnJt0HBgpw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066728',5.8,2965,'en','The Million Dollar Duck','Professor Dooley takes home a duck from his research laboratory as a toy for his son, but soon finds out that it lays golden eggs.','/7fC6VILpXvnyn6w5o0zjM0TTtBk.jpg','1971-06-30',92,'Released','What an EGGstravaganza!','The Million Dollar Duck',22777,3.2789,5.847,'2PXvPVScbsU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5852,_binary '\0','/kSAbF6RWUDl1eAlsPuMlppSC35q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066730',7.5,11060,'en','10 Rillington Place','The story of British serial killer John Christie, who committed most or all of his crimes in the titular terraced house, and the miscarriage of justice involving Timothy Evans.','/aQP2rSIciaeb2FGPeOQIWsCysts.jpg','1971-02-10',111,'Released','What happened to the women at 10 Rillington Place?','10 Rillington Place',26234,3.0412,7.266,'oWzfIU7V1cg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5853,_binary '\0','/3oP45gGDbm4zy1MS8idVb23xHqZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066732',5.6,2574,'en','200 Motels','\"Touring makes you crazy,\" Frank Zappa says, explaining that the idea for this film came to him while the Mothers of Invention were touring. The story, interspersed with performances by the Mothers and the Royal Symphony Orchestra, is a tale of life on the road. The band members\' main concerns are the search for groupies and the desire to get paid.','/bLwx4NoyPPiOtKjKT2OsFkxFgnm.jpg','1971-11-10',98,'Released',NULL,'200 Motels',27645,1.3426,5.1,'YHxWXeK4KJA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5854,_binary '\0','/oAcOzQxU3jOXSKfuGFfMeO0IjmN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066735',6.5,11298,'it','4 mosche di velluto grigio','Roberto, a drummer in a rock band, keeps receiving weird phone calls and being followed by a mysterious man. One night he manages to catch up with his persecutor and tries to get him to talk but in the ensuing struggle he accidentally stabs him. He runs away, but he understands his troubles have just begun when the following day he receives an envelope with photos of him killing the man. Someone is killing all his friends and trying to frame him for the murders.','/dLwvOsuZ2pklMZQOGMWe6O2i7Gw.jpg','1971-12-17',104,'Released','When the flies start to crawl, so will your flesh...','Four Flies on Grey Velvet',30689,3.0591,6.5,'BeEZW2opNkI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5855,_binary '\0','/sVCJjlVfoslaUQ19aU4XMgB2yVB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066740',7,18262,'en','The Abominable Dr. Phibes','After a team of surgeons botches his beloved wife\'s operation, the distraught Dr. Phibes unleashes a score of Old-Testament atrocities on his enemies.','/4853HMKlJl1RozE6OyHBKQemCE0.jpg','1971-04-01',95,'Released','Love means never having to say you\'re ugly.','The Abominable Dr. Phibes',17965,3.9472,6.965,'0sBKGlY_uS8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5856,_binary '\0','/dsiuTOlnSPM0WK6RD7jENzZAET6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066745',5.9,2623,'it','Indio Black, sai che ti dico: Sei un gran figlio di…','Under the brutal rule of local garrison leader Colonel Skimmel and European tyranny, a group of Mexican revolutionaries hires gunslinger Sabata to rob a transport of Austrian gold to buy weapons. But Colonel Skimmel has other plans, taking the gold for himself and blaming the revolutionaries. But no scheming colonel is going to keep Sabata from earning his pay.','/npA2XK7Gad36fUjPgQbhDB6zxgq.jpg','1970-09-30',105,'Released','Sabata Aims to Kill ...and his gun does the rest!','Adiós, Sabata',71206,2.3708,6.3,'AP4N3rnEnLc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5857,_binary '\0','/ixgWGsfdBXN2Uv2rSgZSc5aZ5tT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066758',8.1,2221,'hi','अमर प्रेम','A village woman abandoned by her husband is forced into prostitution in Kolkata and forms nameless yet strong relations with a wealthy patron as well as an abused boy in the neighbourhood.','/dv6yRlG7a64jWsaBf4xDXTChMQx.jpg','1972-01-28',143,'Released',NULL,'Amar Prem',29534,1.094,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5858,_binary '\0','/uZEN5R7s3IvZlt29uTEhpnOAyZd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066763',8.1,37922,'hi','आनन्द','Dr. Bhaskar Bannerjee struggles with his patients\' suffering and the darkness and poverty he confronts daily. He treats cancer patient Anand who upon learning of his impending death determines to use the time he has left to the absolute fullest.','/vgrege8e0yk3SSdHzHfMTvk2ffc.jpg','1971-03-12',122,'Released',NULL,'Anand',26237,1.4698,7,'4zu4blN745A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5859,_binary '\0','/aDFKsJW39VxoFcs9oTcMPpMiSZQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066765',7.5,32901,'en','And Now for Something Completely Different','A collection of Monty Python\'s Flying Circus skits from the first two seasons of their British TV series.','/ajbdFQLvJTlNu4LnVWGnNMb4mZ8.jpg','1971-09-28',88,'Released','If the Motion Picture Industry dies… Monty Python killed it!','And Now for Something Completely Different',9267,4.4237,7.2,'4fBd87L7a7s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5860,_binary '\0','/9mM8uRktDd5WH2sSMVOLBfK0EUL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066767',6.4,10193,'en','The Anderson Tapes','Thief Duke Anderson—just released from ten years in jail—takes up with his old girlfriend in her posh apartment block, and makes plans to rob the entire building. What he doesn\'t know is that his every move is being recorded on audio and video, although he is not the subject of any surveillance.','/6pjMMwqnL4qkl5pFnlfAqp0cNn9.jpg','1971-06-17',99,'Released','The Crime of the Century!','The Anderson Tapes',30941,3.3814,6.142,'olpkoInL9CI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5861,_binary '\0','/9PPx5qspyRA0LBTBHo0BX57Vzow.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066769',7.2,44759,'en','The Andromeda Strain','When virtually all of the residents of Piedmont, New Mexico are found dead after the return to Earth of a space satellite, the head of the US Air Force\'s Project Scoop declares an emergency. A group of eminent scientists led by Dr. Jeremy Stone scrambles to a secure laboratory and tries first to isolate the life form while determining why two people from Piedmont - an old alcoholic and a six-month-old baby - survived. The scientists methodically study the alien life form, unaware that it has already mutated and presents a far greater danger in the lab, which is equipped with a nuclear self-destruct device designed to prevent the escape of dangerous biological agents.','/4FBSFz8wLpxd4o6hnvKOJJ8WSIz.jpg','1971-03-12',131,'Released','The picture runs 130 minutes... The story covers 96 of the most critical hours in man\'s history... The suspense will last through your lifetime!','The Andromeda Strain',10514,5.0522,7.053,'YMbSpnlOOtE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5862,_binary '\0','/jkPUM7bwuexyZK7JSY6S9wSqSsN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066773',6.5,2690,'de','Die Angst des Tormanns beim Elfmeter','Goalkeeper Josef Bloch is sent off after committing a foul during an away game. This causes him to lose his bearings, and he wanders aimlessly through the city streets and spends the night with the box-office attendant of a movie theatre.','/havaGXwHhznTiW53yqHgcyulSGD.jpg','1975-11-05',101,'Released',NULL,'The Goalie\'s Anxiety at the Penalty Kick',42481,2.0632,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5863,_binary '\0','/s9CZfxkXBwm8TlMX1MPkSmOxhp5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066798',6.9,2876,'fr','L\'Aventure c\'est l\'aventure','When they realize the times are changing, five crooks decide to switch from bank robberies to personality abductions.','/w4UYJt7etFBmWBR5UhNcG6ttHZw.jpg','1972-05-04',120,'Released',NULL,'Money Money Money',34280,2.0715,6.654,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5864,_binary '\0','/heV7cEEZLD0FzPp3WRj1fth7Cn8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066806',7.3,1413,'ja','博徒外人部隊','A yakuza gang gets driven out of Yokohama by a big gang from Tokyo. They relocate to Okinawa to violently start over.','/anVq54Gx3dyM46Vt4DORKCp7sHw.jpg','1971-01-12',93,'Released',NULL,'Sympathy for the Underdog',90351,1.6618,7.1,'4d_8RqKVtkY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5865,_binary '\0','/bnJrWEST2YVuWfZiYP4owjXpjwq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066808',6.9,40281,'en','Bananas','When a bumbling New Yorker is dumped by his activist girlfriend, he travels to a tiny Latin American nation and becomes involved in its latest rebellion.','/gK11RUXspxqty0Wq6KoV8J0crKO.jpg','1971-04-28',82,'Released','The Revolutionist That Shook the World With LAUGHTER!','Bananas',11302,3.5194,6.7,'8tO1xhgYvUM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5866,_binary '\0','/9V6a5txVOLcpN6IIGRdp8fL91Fw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066811',5.9,2221,'en','The Barefoot Executive','In the great Disney tradition of wild family fun, a young Kurt Russell stars as Steven Post - an ambitious mailroom clerk at a second-rate TV network. With his eye on the boardroom, and getting nowhere with the studio\'s top dog, he makes a career-changing discovery. His girlfriend\'s lovable pet chimp can pick a hit show every time! His secret for success turns into a madcap monkey business when he makes vice president and jealous rivals want in on the act. Ride along with narrow escapes and a classic cast featuring Joe Flynn and Harry Morgan in a comedic climb up the corporate ladder that will leave you howling for more!','/l80GlJCOFM6rE2uwiW0EMD6jAPd.jpg','1971-03-17',96,'Released','The Secret To Success Is Pure Monkey Business','The Barefoot Executive',20173,2.2942,5.6,'OIyiOtRfkzE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5867,_binary '\0','/t7aE9LZ1FcobRrLrzLHVTGnvENw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066815',4.9,1328,'en','The Beast in the Cellar','Soldiers in a rural English town are being brutally murdered by an unknown creature. Two nearby sisters realise they might understand what\'s happening.','/lXWJc1ccNiZPbv0XSHAJCxgBrNa.jpg','1971-04-14',89,'Released','A chill-filled festival of horror!','The Beast in the Cellar',49800,1.7761,4.8,'SU75X4I_wEE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5868,_binary '\0','/zylJOaiIp0M4xeE6ox3giDjBTFx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066817',7.1,43798,'en','Bedknobs and Broomsticks','Three children evacuated from London during World War II are forced to stay with an eccentric spinster. The children\'s initial fears disappear when they find out she is in fact a trainee witch.','/1BBzsThIZ06UmjZ3rChYGZhJtFQ.jpg','1971-10-07',117,'Released','You\'ll beWITCHED! You\'ll beDAZZLED! You\'ll be swept into a world of enchantment BEYOND ANYTHING BEFORE!','Bedknobs and Broomsticks',12335,4.8825,7.047,'8Qp_yoPMX18','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5869,_binary '\0','/1jCmmjnldEjpeVvciSVNbX421qm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066819',7.1,21365,'en','The Beguiled','Offbeat Civil War drama in which a wounded Yankee soldier, after finding refuge in an isolated girls\' school in the South towards the end of the war, becomes the object of the young women\'s sexual fantasies. The soldier manipulates the situation for his own gratification, but when he refuses to completely comply with the girls\' wishes, they make it very difficult for him to leave.','/zfYYQxt0rjrgEVTbpBQ2oVWlVfV.jpg','1971-01-23',105,'Released','his love...or his life...','The Beguiled',31906,3.7665,7.042,'s_NSUbIJP1E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5870,_binary '\0','/jYeV0cKJg1jSoKjEOUCM7a6kum8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066824',6.9,1379,'it','Bello, onesto, emigrato Australia sposerebbe compaesana illibata','The film is about an old fashioned Italian with moral values of the 1930/40\'s , who has to find a wife in the modern, woman\'s liberated society of Australia of the 1960/70\'s.','/jCofiNBGNtJLgHDe9ig7e3abgwK.jpg','1971-12-22',107,'Released',NULL,'A Girl in Australia',61799,1.7945,6.7,'wo_MnBBW8ho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5871,_binary '\0','/q94dUDBVP3RqLyAS0DkADJXmB4H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066826',6.3,2580,'sv','Beröringen','A Swedish housewife begins an adulterous affair with an American archaeologist, unaware of his emotional scars as a Holocaust survivor; consequently, their relationship will be painfully difficult.','/4bz8hRBj8jsLFBa5nKP28MQufEd.jpg','1971-07-14',115,'Released',NULL,'The Touch',105254,1.8324,5.9,'wMrJ7tpSKak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5872,_binary '\0','/jBwq9uIOSncXGfRxAq63tuDnfBv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066827',5.1,2103,'it','La bestia uccide a sangue freddo','A masked killer stalks an institution for mentally disturbed rich women.','/lgl10TDsWLY0rEDVTSHxWus2I35.jpg','1971-08-02',97,'Released','A Place Where Nothing Is Forbidden!','Slaughter Hotel',27439,2.6592,4.8,'efpfrf_5J-Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5873,_binary '\0','/1jsImJLr3jzbkOZpHMCtdRmv1bM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066830',5.8,3552,'en','The Big Doll House','Female prisoners in a Philippine jail are being subjected to sadistic torture. Five of the women, along with the help of two men, plot an escape.','/yVze9LOqMkCg0RfYmFJwk5MgLm2.jpg','1971-04-30',95,'Released','Their bodies were caged, but not their desires. They would do anything for a man - or to him.','The Big Doll House',42517,3.6589,5.6,'vFlEUyZh0d4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5874,_binary '\0','/n5ajL8GUn8QHLWiOmVU0LwMfYDI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066831',7.1,16128,'en','Big Jake','An aging Texas cattle man who has outlived his time swings into action when outlaws kidnap his grandson.','/wcmxYNuM9akm0Qjs86quqMAUX6C.jpg','1971-05-26',110,'Released','They wanted gold. They gave them lead instead!','Big Jake',21717,4.0225,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5875,_binary '\0','/68XwXH3TG1kMIMYVTOACiLAE3l1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066832',6.2,7155,'en','Billy Jack','A Euro-Indigenous American Ex-Green Beret hapkido expert saves wild horses from being slaughtered for dog food and helps protect a desert \"freedom school\" for runaways.','/rVE2YKxiHMHTxA5yPZPzsChc37H.jpg','1971-05-01',114,'Released','When you need him, he\'s always there!','Billy Jack',21142,1.9909,6,'Ymc8SUsOkFc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5876,_binary '\0','/lWgZOtEHjnD3RMtK6w9p39grgUu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066834',5.4,1270,'en','Black Beauty','Told from the POV of Black Beauty himself, his birth and perception of humans are explored, but his first owner, a boy named Joe, is his most memorable.','/hsUDY8L6eCakWdWUttdMdGKiOaQ.jpg','1971-04-01',106,'Released','The all-new motion picture about the most beloved story of our time!','Black Beauty',28356,1.3707,6,'6JHEjwSI7RY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5877,_binary '\0','/5OktQG2bx3l4vlVcGj6Z571cvdR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066842',6.9,1993,'en','Bleak Moments','Moments from the uncompromisingly bleak existence of a secretary, her intellectually disabled sister, aloof and uneasy teacher boyfriend, bizarre neighbor and irritating workmate.','/j6UZkLlGXxMpB4CsrZ4pyLEU5iZ.jpg','1972-05-25',111,'Released',NULL,'Bleak Moments',122271,1.6616,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5878,_binary '\0','/aw3rsa3dNMWSg5fviwMFgA4Uhdf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066844',6.2,1484,'it','Blindman','A blind, but deadly, gunman, is hired to escort fifty mail order brides to their miner husbands. His business partners double cross him, selling the women to bandit Domingo. Blindman heads into Mexico in pursuit.','/aPulAJ81joUMYlC6epEmgNcOGRF.jpg','1971-11-15',105,'Released','Blindman, Blindman, what did he do? Stole 50 women that belong to you.','Blindman',30648,1.6917,5.7,'mYXaPyiud7g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5879,_binary '\0','/wFPkxvfPWE9GWJBtNgtBDbo6T3j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066848',5.4,1428,'en','Blood and Lace','After her prostitute mother and her john are beaten to death while they are asleep in bed, teen-aged Ellie Masters is sent to an isolated orphanage run by a mysterious woman and her handyman, both whom she comes to suspect are hiding dark secrets.','/fwOJb1LgNUyeJIBb1MvD3PzHreN.jpg','1971-03-17',87,'Released','SHOCK after SHOCK after SHOCK as DESIRE drives a bargain with MURDER!','Blood and Lace',85496,1.3582,5.7,'5--XXKMieg0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5880,_binary '\0','/lVgJzjtd97Aznpbp4KkSM0Oxj7J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066849',6.4,9385,'en','Blood on Satan\'s Claw','After a landsman in 18th century England discovers a corpse covered in fur buried in a field, the town becomes infected by \"the devil\'s skin,\" leading the local children to engage in demonic rituals and criminal behavior.','/hp3xBv3sXmswAubsouWJ1V9Dfpi.jpg','1971-01-28',96,'Released','A chill-filled festival of horror!','Blood on Satan\'s Claw',26774,8.1126,6.227,'dIFHqlU58T8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5881,_binary '\0','/n1HP3A7MAXZ2ZU7gOkxyIERPMKD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066856',5.8,2537,'en','Born to Win','A smart-mouthed junkie and a former hairdresser spends his days looking for just \"one more fix\".','/y43Zv5TMVNxO7UBjjTgYcXXQlWn.jpg','1971-12-01',88,'Released','Their story is written on his arm. If they can get a grip on each other, maybe they can turn their lives around.','Born to Win',21256,2.0349,5.4,'ZonPaKxavr8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5882,_binary '\0','/uv7TlTv7IXv8AEOiK2XgFBigYnS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066858',6.8,3918,'en','The Boy Friend','When the leading lady of a low-budget musical revue sprains her ankle, the assistant stage manager is forced to understudy and perform in her place.','/4vhT6YOJ99YeFygYfx8WyzyVJxA.jpg','1971-12-16',138,'Released','A glittering super colossal heart warming toe-tapping continuously delightful musical extravaganza!','The Boy Friend',31515,2.322,6.43,'NQiR3l3lqJc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5883,_binary '\0','/oo5xhT4ke4VkCRcKDXt20gJ1p3z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066863',5.5,2179,'en','The Brotherhood of Satan','A family is trapped in a desert town by a cult of senior-citizens who recruit the town\'s children to worship Satan.','/btJm6MrEX7bXZ3VxuZai1d7sAac.jpg','1971-08-06',92,'Released','A demon-spirit of madness and murder holds a California town in the grip of terror.','The Brotherhood of Satan',42519,2.1727,5.8,'54wgYNvV1Vw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5884,_binary '\0','/tPPSEHMyFazlAmWi1eNccP48MZx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066870',5.6,1221,'en','Bunny O\'Hare','Bette Davis handles the title role in this highly offbeat crime comedy about two aging hippies who elect to rob a bank to restore Bunny O\'Hare\'s financial affairs after she\'s been unjustly evicted and rendered homeless. When that heist ends up paying off, rather than take off for the border, Bunny opts for a life of crime with her new partner, Bill Green, played by fellow Oscar-winner Ernest Borgnine.','/kdkA2FDB7j5lZ3Dpk5aOshTmZqG.jpg','1971-10-18',88,'Released','Enjoy those GOLDEN YEARS with a holiday filled with fun and profit!','Bunny O\'Hare',88179,1.2738,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5885,_binary '\0','/1R01PmMyUeCl59tmYkL6F7uBMSa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066886',4.7,1224,'en','Captain Apache','The title character is a US army Captain of Native American descent who is asked to investigate the murder of an Indian agent. His only clue is \"April morning\", the last words spoken by the victim. Can he unravel the mystery before the clock runs out?','/hIjIPEb06ZivzJYwImj0CJ5QARx.jpg','1971-10-27',94,'Released','They Trailed Him...Tailed Him...Tried to Nail Him...NO WAY!!!','Captain Apache',104974,1.9488,4.7,'5b2iOTWQ2t8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5886,_binary '\0','/jbDu1quaSjr8NAx105UED2QPQxP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066892',6.9,17275,'en','Carnal Knowledge','Two lifelong friends navigate complex sexual encounters and emotional entanglements, wrestling with societal norms and personal desires.','/l7e1qP8Mq97W1Wg14FNnbz1OxmG.jpg','1971-06-30',98,'Released','Its time has come.','Carnal Knowledge',36492,5.283,6.6,'pOPYMnrn17o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5887,_binary '\0','/916VyZ1V6eahJSGkdzkAu3l1sAz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066894',6.2,3406,'en','Carry On Henry','Henry VIII has just married Marie of Normandy, and is eager to consummate their marriage. Unfortunately for Henry, she is always eating garlic, and refuses to stop. Deciding to get rid of her in his usual manner, Henry has to find some way of doing it without provoking war with Marie\'s cousin, the King of France. Perhaps if she had an affair...','/sU2OyxyGsZm2c9h3MkxQO2wg33h.jpg','1971-06-03',89,'Released','A great guy with his \'chopper\'!','Carry On Henry',24569,1.8894,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5888,_binary '\0','/6PRvD29WgZgEm40nBCpfX9XU9Ft.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066895',6.2,3946,'en','Carry On at Your Convenience','At WC Boggs\' Lavatory factory, Vic Spanner is the union representative who calls a strike at the drop of a hat. However, eventually everyone gets fed up with him.','/8BRVvZOWEO86tsey3KsGNucpmgH.jpg','1971-12-10',90,'Released',NULL,'Carry On at Your Convenience',19297,2.2259,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5889,_binary '\0','/sCmrA0DyRNEql1bwH8IWrtyH2Pk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066900',5.6,1592,'en','Catlow','An outlaw tries to avoid interference as he journeys to Mexico to pull off a $2,000,000 gold robbery.','/pIBCD4pEgO9lcXmGHSqTwKlV7ZY.jpg','1971-10-01',101,'Released','The Mexican cavalry wanted him murdered. The Apache nation wanted him massacred. Texas ranchers wanted him mangled and his only hope was a Marshal, who wanted him hanged.','Catlow',75130,1.9547,5.1,'33_Djc1bj7o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5890,_binary '\0','/3NSEiF2pQ49b3GAeTngPrrXoRA3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066906',7.5,2719,'fr','Le Chat','Julien Bouin, a former typographist, and his wife Clemence, who used to perform in a circus, hardly talk to each other in their small house, soon to be demolished. His cat Greffier being the only one he still gives affection to, he becomes the object of Clemence\'s anger.','/6MQUQL4y4o5c5ED52ehcSPafyAn.jpg','1971-04-24',87,'Released','A love/hate so devastating it destroys everything...the marriage, the wife, the husband, the house...even the cat','The Cat',24984,2.5216,7.426,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5891,_binary '\0','/xKbC1dQkBA8omEumGm8wqqDzMuf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066907',6.6,7466,'en','Chato\'s Land','In 1870s New Mexico, a half-breed kills a bigoted sheriff in self-defense but the posse that eventually hunts him finds itself in dangerous territory.','/hkPgmx39U5rWjyFMcYa3btZnh76.jpg','1972-05-25',100,'Released','What Chato\'s land doesn\'t kill, Chato will.','Chato\'s Land',26119,3.5527,6.552,'kG-iqEn8q44','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5892,_binary '\0','/whw3d4loX1b80U5XjKmJZyHbf8H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066914',4.9,3045,'fr','Une vierge chez les morts-vivants','A girl arrives from London to visit her estranged relatives in a remote castle for the reading of her father\'s will. After a while she discovers that they are all in fact dead and her decision to live with them turns into a nightmare. Unable to leave she\'s drawn into a macabre underworld through visions of nude satanic rituals and her own impending sacrifice.','/vP6ZC7L8CLawIiTx19tXfIuaIuF.jpg','1973-11-15',79,'Released','She\'s going down.','A Virgin Among the Living Dead',19095,2.3999,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5893,_binary '\0','/nZRxN3c9Hywlu5jh6mqLArIwShF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066919',7.6,4901,'it','La classe operaia va in paradiso','After losing a finger in a work accident, an Italian worker becomes increasingly involved in political and revolutionary groups.','/2RMjWY4CknXmLRI5qJpsTA6sKy3.jpg','1971-09-17',113,'Released',NULL,'The Working Class Goes to Heaven',56231,2.3334,7.8,'RRUz45GVOAM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5894,_binary '\0','/nLFxvLokHe3bQmrmAfljIfax2jQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066921',8.2,944775,'en','A Clockwork Orange','In a near-future Britain, young Alexander DeLarge and his pals get their kicks beating and raping anyone they please. When not destroying the lives of others, Alex swoons to the music of Beethoven. The state, eager to crack down on juvenile crime, gives an incarcerated Alex the option to undergo an invasive procedure that\'ll rob him of all personal agency. In a time when conscience is a commodity, can Alex change his tune?','/4sHeTAp65WrSSuc05nRBKddhBxO.jpg','1971-10-28',137,'Released','Being the adventures of a young man whose principal interests are rape, ultra-violence and Beethoven.','A Clockwork Orange',185,20.6394,8.169,'2meAsIclTzQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5895,_binary '\0','/lEvdinLO1qmc6dAHsRArExHtjYw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066922',7,3328,'it','I Clowns','Fellini exposes his great attraction for the clowns and the world of the circus first recalling a childhood experience when the circus arrives nearby his home. Then he joins his crew and travel from Italy to Paris chasing the last greatest European clowns still live in these countries. He also meets Anita Ekberg trying to buy a panther in a circus.','/uS7GdwTpn5c1bcRkjL5bbE4m8Fl.jpg','1970-12-27',93,'Released',NULL,'The Clowns',42590,2.1138,6.8,'RnelLLS5Jl0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5896,_binary '\0','/3K0YzKakbUtETzPY1Z15u9A8lZr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066924',6.7,3991,'it','La coda dello scorpione','After her husband dies in a freak plane accident, a woman leaves London for Athens to collect his generous life insurance policy. She soon discovers that others besides herself are keen to get their hands on the money - and are willing to kill for it. Meanwhile, a private investigator arrives to investigate irregularities in the claim, teaming up with a beautiful reporter.','/n4UM3TqaWjyi3JVNHKOnx5pPRUj.jpg','1971-08-16',96,'Released',NULL,'The Case of the Scorpion\'s Tail',16825,2.1062,6.3,'HCzVcU_nSV8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5897,_binary '\0','/wQY5DL8whJMWShvuC7GVFGlxPGk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066927',6.6,2853,'en','Cold Turkey','Reverend Brooks leads his small Iowa town in a contest to stop smoking for a month. But some tobacco executives don\'t want them to win, and try everything they can to make them smoke. If townspeople don\'t go nuts from wanting a cigarette, or kill each other from irritation and frustration, they will win a huge prize.','/k1NBOkxBS3v6y7bdNAS2KcymPpl.jpg','1971-02-19',99,'Released','See the hilarious BATTLE OF THE BUTT!','Cold Turkey',42493,2.4721,6.266,'oMEMp6I4lSQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5898,_binary '\0','/gaso2bnobV6E5oZup9Ec3xpY5IT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066933',7.6,4598,'en','Ransom for a Dead Man','A brilliant attorney gets rid of her boring husband by faking his kidnapping and keeping the ransom. The FBI may be fooled, but not Columbo.','/wxiOUKGqkfH9CsTOU2FfEa1qSkQ.jpg','1972-10-09',95,'Released',NULL,'Ransom for a Dead Man',360627,2.2477,7.333,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5899,_binary '\0','/iUJAST64A5eiD3nTSY2dhKTIXQD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066936',6.7,1312,'pt','Como Era Gostoso o Meu Francês','In 1594 Brazil, a frenchman becomes a prisoner of the Tupinambás. While waiting to be executed, the foreigner learns the habits of the indigenous people and joins a woman who tries to help him escape.','/yls9gNguacmJa0UWnBD59u8pC4E.jpg','1971-06-01',84,'Released','A film for every palate.','How Tasty Was My Little Frenchman',105347,1.5414,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5900,_binary '\0','/eIH1NgJx5btpvcamE5IFumZTGZM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066939',6.7,1719,'es','Condenados a vivir','A group of ruthless convicts is led to prison through an inhospitable mountain range by a small cavalry detachment commanded by Sergeant Brown, who is accompanied by his young and beautiful daughter.','/o2YJpPfcmliO36dtjsBOroN9tgs.jpg','1971-10-23',92,'Released','Violence is their way of life','Cut-Throats Nine',29496,1.6852,6.5,'VvYkPpwuIN0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5901,_binary '\0','/vooHR1pNkQE3EiKHft0yRAwuRsI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066940',7.2,2068,'it','Confessione di un commissario di polizia al procuratore della Repubblica','A police captain arranges the release of a criminally insane prisoner, who soon winds up dead. When the District Attorney takes on the case, he uncovers corruption in the department and vows to take down the man who\'s responsible.','/s7761FscQjnbEQTWYzvficLGunD.jpg','1971-03-26',101,'Released','He cut the red tape and left it full of bullet holes!','Confessions of a Police Captain',117890,1.9466,6.8,'G_hhMrXtj8I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5902,_binary '\0','/iF9kW0tUapcz9yshJpkODpNZmxt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066950',5.2,2534,'it','Il corsaro nero','Rivaling Pirates and Spanish gold are the ingredients for this story. Blackie the pirate is the one who first hears from this shipment of gold when he encounters \"Don\" Pedro. He thinks of a plan to find this ship and its gold. His counter player is the vice roy of the Spanish kolony. When they visit one of the pirate settlements, they find three other pirate captains over there. One of them sells goods and prisoners from his latest capture. Don Pedro recognizes the wife of the vice roy, and Blackie buys her. However, one of the pirate captains, Skull, knows also who she is, and tries to make a deal. Blackie refuses, and Skull makes a deal with the other two pirate captains to plot against Blackie.','/dMUbLBHbEmc2eDGLgTkbGNUUKiN.jpg','1971-03-12',99,'Released',NULL,'Blackie the Pirate',52721,2.8024,5.8,'6yb9SfKGA38','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5903,_binary '\0','/ijiCejJZJlMmRx1HboBeTgRU4Fj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066952',5.7,3434,'en','Count Yorga, Vampire','Posing as a hip medium, a bloodthirsty old-world undead gent attracts young lovelies to his mansion by holding séances in modern-day Los Angeles.','/zRAemNKmsErSDUWxBuSm8URDxQM.jpg','1970-06-12',93,'Released','Dashing, Dark and Deadly.','Count Yorga, Vampire',28733,1.9064,5.563,'G-z-ZfxSCHI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5904,_binary '\0','/gUUDJWuFfuMK26sK7OIJ0GjWfdb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066955',4.5,1246,'en','Creatures the World Forgot','As the first nomadic tribes wander across the vast wilderness of the infant planet they confront hostilities created by the harsh environment and each other. After a massive volcanic eruption a tribal chief is killed and his two sons fight for supremacy, not only for the leadership of the tribe but also for the love of a beautiful young woman. The age-old battlegrounds of rivalry, envy and passion are explored in this tale of prehistoric adventure.','/5hW4PTOcbqbeLKcVlFqfMxX6jz7.jpg','1971-09-01',92,'Released','They don\'t make them like this anymore... not in a million years!','Creatures the World Forgot',102443,1.8089,4.9,'eU8NY2njxXM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5905,_binary '\0','/p0xrc888nqw8xX9b5egxaoBZJki.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066963',6.9,3976,'en','Dad\'s Army','Dad\'s Army was a 1971 feature film based on the BBC television sitcom Dad\'s Army. Directed by Norman Cohen, it was filmed between series three and four and was based upon material from the early episodes of the television series. The film told the story of the Home Guard platoon\'s formation and their subsequent endeavours at a training exercise.','/3vc6GWhFciyrL7JyAULko1nUdSu.jpg','1971-03-12',95,'Released','At last! Their epic story invades the Big Screen!','Dad\'s Army',20051,1.5563,5,'I773m9D4wgo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5906,_binary '\0','/xz2AVQ4oJS6mhzFnq9q548Ozsiz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066968',7.1,1511,'fa','داش‌آکل','Dash Akol is greatly respected in Shiraz as an honorable man who has lost his family\'s money through helping his friends. He has an enemy, however, named Kaka Rostam, a mean and spiteful person. Dash Akol, who is in his forties, falls in love with Marjan, daughter of the late Haji Samad, for whose estate he is the executor. But he keeps his love secret. One day a suitor asks for Marjan\'s hand, and Dash Akol considers it against his code of honor to refuse. On the night of the wedding, Dash Akol hands over responsibility for the family to the bridegroom. As he is leaving the house, however, Kaka Rostam is waiting for him and a fight ensues. Kaka Rostam stabs him in the back, but Dash Akol succeeds in killing him. On his deathbed, Dash Akol sends his parrot to Marjan with the confession of love he has taught it.','/jgTaQhZDoPbNWFI5QYP9x5Guebj.jpg','1971-08-25',95,'Released',NULL,'Dash Akol',267953,0.8064,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5907,_binary '\0','/rJ6iF4n0w5HOY7PSbCu9cuKNEhL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066970',5.7,3624,'en','Cold Sweat','During the Korean War, Joe Moran, is convicted for striking a colonel. Imprisoned in Germany he encounters his former company commander Captain Ross, jailed for black marketeering. Together with Ross\' cohorts Joe agrees to escape with them, but things go wrong and a policeman is killed. An appalled Joe escapes by himself, abandoning the others, who are recaptured. Years later Joe has a boat rental business where he is found by Ross. Now a wanted drug smuggler he wants the use of Joe\'s boats and to ensure his cooperation, they kidnap his wife and daughter.','/9rbTkc6FWhJS0IrNRPQ2Fcn1x6v.jpg','1970-12-18',94,'Released','Bronson and Mason play a high stakes game of cat and mouse . . . and only one man can walk away the winner','Cold Sweat',42358,3.7779,5.705,'GPSCQduUj-0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5908,_binary '\0','/iQVXY1ugHmCRGWcSSnLWLs45mPe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066982',5.3,2332,'en','Demons of the Mind','A physician discovers that two children are being kept virtually imprisoned in their house by their father. He investigates, and discovers a web of sex, incest and satanic possession.','/ve0midvftE2RkBbLqaFomqqRzXm.jpg','1972-11-05',89,'Released','They came to torture an agonised mind.','Demons of the Mind',46359,2.0349,5.3,'neaA0yGcdIc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5909,_binary '\0','/tXoYHLjqZYNIWeLc6g8QCaMNsG8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066989',7.2,6450,'fr','Les Deux Anglaises et le Continent','In the early 20th-century, Frenchman Claude meets Englishwoman Ann in Paris. Ann invites him to her family home, intending him for her sister Muriel. Claude falls for Muriel, but families demand year-long separation before approving marriage.','/2fc5hjuzJbkVKXLy0SoAr2Hbdy2.jpg','1971-11-18',130,'Released',NULL,'Two English Girls',42513,2.5407,6.939,'RS-FIx-dZE0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5910,_binary '\0','/8ApwSMdd9QehKjvW3fOmKVrnZXv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066993',7.7,21857,'en','The Devils','In 1634 France, charismatic Father Urbain Grandier becomes the target of a sexually obsessed nun’s witchcraft accusations, which corrupt church and state officials are all too happy to exploit.​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​','/y1k7eiOFc6fzm8XeTa1kNGx6JIs.jpg','1971-07-16',112,'Released','Hell will hold no surprises for them...','The Devils',31767,6.899,7.5,'ImeXlanF3iY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5911,_binary '\0','/pyTDtQCn5sG8gi2zkM5ZylSNmtJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066995',6.5,124570,'en','Diamonds Are Forever','Diamonds are stolen only to be sold again in the international market. James Bond infiltrates a smuggling mission to find out who\'s guilty. The mission takes him to Las Vegas where Bond meets his archenemy Blofeld.','/ooDT0eKrWCxJCsn9JehPkD0QYNj.jpg','1971-12-14',120,'Released','The man who made 007 a household number.','Diamonds Are Forever',681,12.1907,6.398,'eblH_hfmOS4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5912,_binary '\0','/fMyttWsQXJCG3V9oUOFebYZ0HJT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066997',7.7,1417,'en','Directed by John Ford','A documentary about the life and films of director John Ford.','/kv3tPDvWyGTQ2Nb66LTXwK18iXR.jpg','1971-09-06',110,'Released',NULL,'Directed by John Ford',94623,2.5151,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5913,_binary '\0','/mJjOZSaTTqG3an5MkkOX3x18lYX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0066999',7.7,182769,'en','Dirty Harry','When a madman dubbed \'Scorpio\' terrorizes San Francisco, hard-nosed cop, Harry Callahan – famous for his take-no-prisoners approach to law enforcement – is tasked with hunting down the psychopath.','/scl2JDHzYoIEs5xyYy5ITCfyY0G.jpg','1971-12-23',102,'Released','Detective Harry Callahan. He doesn\'t break murder cases. He smashes them.','Dirty Harry',984,9.7992,7.5,'K6Vi1VurN9s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5914,_binary '\0','/rUpPLkny7wYyirLufHyP83EaZWa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067003',6.2,2417,'en','Doc','Doc Holliday travels to Tombstone, Ariz., with prostitute Katie Elder. Although the trip is difficult because Doc is ill with tuberculosis, they eventually reach their destination, where Holliday is reunited with his old friend Marshal Wyatt Earp, who has been clashing with the Clanton gang. Tensions between Earp and the Clantons rise until their infamous final showdown brings it to a head.','/dqTktrvM9bdmCqOevMqSy8sR2DH.jpg','1971-08-01',96,'Released','For the past 90 years these three people have been heroes. Until now!','Doc',83147,2.104,6.15,'YauapthsuL8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5915,_binary '\0','/A41PQ4HYilckr5iI0M0rpK945LU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067009',6.8,1695,'zh','獨臂拳王','A martial-arts student learns the iron fist and death grip techniques to avenge his teacher\'s death.','/jmUlzkwzWZPiGlh4yRmN2wwRCBk.jpg','1972-08-02',93,'Released','Make Way For the Chinese Professionals! The Kung Fu Beast! The Invincible The Karate Beast! The Siamese Devils! The Tibetan Tiger Men! The Bloody Kwon-Do Master! The Judo King! The Invincible Yuga Kahn! The Fantastic One-Armed Boxer!','One-Armed Boxer',49967,2.2111,7,'Sc2sV2p625A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5916,_binary '\0','/kSb86UTBR8YbIJno2gIRkOB2PWx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067017',3.5,2414,'en','Dracula vs. Frankenstein','Judith Fontaine is looking for her sister Joanie, who has disappeared into the hippie community of Venice, California. It turns out that Joanie has become fallen victim to Groton, an axe-wielding homicidal maniac under the employ of Dr. Durea, the last living descendant of the Frankenstein family and is now both running a house of horrors on the beach\'s boardwalk and performing experiments on Groton\'s victims in his basement laboratory.','/okBup7vZhKPat0mO6SQ1HdLP0YZ.jpg','1971-12-01',91,'Released',NULL,'Dracula vs. Frankenstein',3125,2.0378,4.5,'VEwI1xGJvoo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5917,_binary '\0','/AoGLKkPvBcZP27jwSA85fY8emvJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067023',7.6,86942,'en','Duel','Traveling businessman David Mann angers the driver of a rusty tanker while crossing the California desert. A simple trip turns deadly, as Mann struggles to stay on the road while the tanker plays cat and mouse with his life.','/w9Vk1Txx14vWvACELFYFlixrsfr.jpg','1971-12-25',74,'Released','The most bizarre murder weapon ever used!','Duel',839,7.8867,7.419,'Gdk1Igqu05Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5918,_binary '\0','/3oRxnZkNI4EG4v2pXYD6qXjpZhe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067040',6.3,1575,'fr','L\'Éden et après','A group of French students are drawn into the psychological and sexual games of a mysterious man called Duchemin. Once they sample his \"fear powder\" the students experience a series of hallucinations.','/AmJXMwr7xOgAmt6HlGLRRFUIBMr.jpg','1970-04-20',93,'Released',NULL,'Eden and After',104239,1.5449,6.2,'n2w0njfHjq8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5919,_binary '\0','/u6iErpd26Vmq0u4VOYh6bp78vpb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067047',7.3,4837,'sv','Emil i Lönneberga','Emil Svensson lives with his mother and father, little sister Ida, farmhand Alfred, and maid Lina on a picturesque farm in Småland. He is an unusually lively little boy, who just can\'t resist trying out every whim that enters into his white-haired head. Always with the best intentions in mind, because he is a good-hearted child, but often with catastrophic results, especially for his short-tempered father. As a result, Emil spends a lot of quality time in the wood shed carving wood figurines and waiting for Anton\'s temper to cool down. And the father\'s patience is certainly tried, as Emil gets his head stuck in the family\'s only soup bowl, hoists little Ida up the flag pole, and arranges a lavish Christmas party for the poor.','/8rhTvhB0oiUUrpL0J6hO3OVcjwM.jpg','1971-12-04',98,'Released',NULL,'Emil of Lonneberga',11945,2.5977,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5920,_binary '\0','/vbHBEDfTIlOvbmcf4CoreYKtI07.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067052',6,3055,'en','Endless Night','Shiftless dreamer Michael Rogers fantasizes about a lifestyle above his means and marries a wealthy, young girl who just came of age. They hire a famous architect to build their dream home amidst a series of suspicious incidents. The spouse has dark intentions toward his naive, inexperienced bride. Secrets from his past and sinister ties to their house guest Greta lead to a terrible turn of unexpected events.','/i90GwuPa58Ndz8CE71sZF6D2jQX.jpg','1972-10-05',99,'Released','Victim... or killer?','Endless Night',40821,2.6881,6.1,'xVoEEIUf7mo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5921,_binary '\0','/U6RQN0c78oveHFnnDW2CIFsWEf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067055',5.2,3962,'en','Equinox','Due to their possession of an ancient mystic book, four friends are attacked by a demon while on a picnic and find themselves pitched into a world of evil that overlaps their own. The film was originally made in 1967 by Dennis Muren as The Equinox: Journey into the Supernatural. Jack Woods was hired to shoot additional footage and expand on Muren\'s work.','/4TbevVaTQ8Vyyez8eEXnoEyDvvq.jpg','1970-10-01',82,'Released','Occult Barrier Between Good and Evil','Equinox',28681,1.3742,5.1,'s2ofWZtcww0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5922,_binary '\0','/7GVWNxz7fN0yK61NGSPjBWZPt1J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067065',6.3,45176,'en','Escape from the Planet of the Apes','The world is shocked by the appearance of three talking chimpanzees, who arrived mysteriously in a spacecraft. Intrigued by their intelligence, humans use them for research - until the apes attempt to escape.','/vqD7qjBRizY7sPVIHbFRUZwgEXL.jpg','1971-05-20',98,'Released','Meet baby Milo who has Washington terrified.','Escape from the Planet of the Apes',1687,7.8655,6.399,'2e1acuBXj4g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5923,_binary '\0','/kfKKcSjBMrlRv1MhobuuWsddFy9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067072',7.1,2030,'en','Evil Roy Slade','Orphaned and left in the desert as an infant, Evil Roy Slade grew up alone—save for his teddy bear—and mean. As an adult, he is notorious for being the \"meanest villain in the West\"—so he\'s thrown for quite a loop when he falls for sweet schoolteacher Betsy Potter. There\'s also Nelson L. Stool, a railroad tycoon, who, along with his dimwitted nephew Clifford (Henry Gibson), is trying to get revenge on Evil Roy Slade for robbing him.','/tkxLMe6jXhuyzQnNfCi4jGcvQ0z.jpg','1972-02-18',97,'Released',NULL,'Evil Roy Slade',25109,1.5888,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5924,_binary '\0','/AueBESo0PibkfK0P2hIyaBWCWDz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067084',6.3,2315,'it','Una farfalla con le ali insanguinate','When a young female student is savagely killed in a park during a thunderstorm, the culprit seems obvious: TV sports personality Alessandro Marchi, seen fleeing the scene of the crime by numerous eyewitnesses. The evidence against him is damning... but is it all too convenient? And when the killer strikes again while Marchi is in custody, it quickly becomes apparent that there\'s more to the case than meets the eye...','/oaZ0rYLbTfBVW7ESgdufbb5cmlZ.jpg','1971-09-10',99,'Released','A brutal murder cannot be solved. But the murderer has been recognized by someone...','The Bloodstained Butterfly',29482,2.1079,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5925,_binary '\0','/fO489b4PPR5Ndm3xJZ1AboCoSb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067085',6.6,4494,'de','Fata Morgana','Shot under extreme conditions and inspired by Mayan creation theory, the film contemplates the illusion of reality and the possibility of capturing for the camera something which is not there. It is about the mirages of nature—and the nature of mirage.','/peGA1QPb0I255XtvoOcz5WG1jfy.jpg','1972-02-01',76,'Released',NULL,'Fata Morgana',55624,2.4296,6.5,'ckNMT0gQMdc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5926,_binary '\0','/n1pItGYLcgAh7c0ewjWeXKTjXFT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067093',8,52815,'en','Fiddler on the Roof','In a pre-revolutionary Russia, a poor Jewish milkman struggles with the challenges of a changing world as his daughters fall in love and antisemitism grows.','/v65PHx7Q6Jx0anyNeUOX07SJic9.jpg','1971-11-03',181,'Released','To Life!','Fiddler on the Roof',14811,6.1471,7.7,'1Aq5H3PX9xM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5927,_binary '\0','/sv8nSUSXb7ldLOg4dm6KDIDdSEU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067108',7.2,8977,'fr','La Folie des grandeurs','Don Sallust is the minister of the King of Spain. Being disingenuous, hypocritical, greedy and collecting the taxes for himself, he is hated by the people he oppresses. Accused by The Queen, a beautiful princess Bavarian, of having an illegitimate child to one of her maids of honor, he was stripped of his duties and ordered to retire to a monastery.','/uJtEs9WRqyEREvdkS470n593z03.jpg','1971-12-08',108,'Released',NULL,'Delusions of Grandeur',14257,3.6727,7.4,'Dorv9VMPIuQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5928,_binary '\0','/xGmFeO5RX5i21d17fezzcLnki2y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067109',6.4,1914,'en','Fools\' Parade','When a trio of ex-convicts led by Mattie Appleyard is released from prison, they hope to open a general store using money Mattie has saved during his 40-year sentence. This attempt is met with great resistance from a corrupt prison official and the banker who issued Mattie the check.','/gffMBBnlXu3tPSzxevaPadlusiv.jpg','1971-08-18',98,'Released','Glory, W.Va., 1935. It wasn\'t exactly a parade. It wasn\'t a time for celebration. It was a time to run for your life.','Fools\' Parade',65502,2.9764,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5929,_binary '\0','/AsaW2VwcArvQmYjf2wsDjqWEn6f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067116',7.6,152458,'en','The French Connection','Tough narcotics detective \'Popeye\' Doyle is in hot pursuit of a suave French drug dealer who may be the key to a huge heroin-smuggling operation.','/pH4saPwMjhnVGwmSH6RkMaHrt3s.jpg','1971-10-09',104,'Released','Doyle is bad news—but a good cop.','The French Connection',1051,8.4984,7.5,'T76K3RxJY0A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5930,_binary '\0','/8kYHyiA4aMq7ow5wFoXeh1xg8Gj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067118',6.5,1260,'en','Friends','Paul, a rich English boy, and Michelle, an orphaned French girl, run away from home to a remote beach. Living on their own, their friendship grows into love.','/oaNJNddADomFR97gr3SsY6xVUuU.jpg','1971-03-24',101,'Released','Who needs the world when you own the moon and stars.','Friends',4156,1.7849,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5931,_binary '\0','/9dPrFtN7sDUEWOXCTT4rItKOzcR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067119',5.8,2679,'en','Fright','Young babysitter Amanda arrives at the Lloyd residence to spend the evening looking after their young son. Soon after the Lloyds leave, a series of frightening occurrences in the gloomy old house have Amanda\'s nerves on edge. The real terror begins, however, when the child\'s biological father appears after recently escaping from a nearby mental institution.','/3HpslY91rWbmbBRPZS0It1uWarD.jpg','1971-09-18',87,'Released','The scream you can hear is your own','Fright',40350,2.7983,6,'dd-PNrcmyxU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5932,_binary '\0','/4hcLBDLok8LJvJ0rqelLYhFNFSt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067123',3.7,2161,'ja','ガメラ対深海怪獣ジグラ','A moon base is destroyed by a spaceship from Zigra which is looking to take over the planet earth to use its oceans for its ocean-dwelling denizens. Gamera must once again come to the aid of the human race while all of Japan roots him on.','/nL7CjKEQlsegz9FstfkzI05eGXt.jpg','1971-07-17',87,'Released','Deep-Sea Monster Zigra!','Gamera vs. Zigra',70322,1.3151,4.7,'wvnHy1AXeRg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5933,_binary '\0','/7dPdrt7Rgh10ppP6LE8j2wdVTeZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067124',4.8,1736,'en','The Gang That Couldn\'t Shoot Straight','A Brooklyn mobster and his gang try to rub out their rivals.','/AmecTGLXTRXDfFUFqlTuXn6p7GO.jpg','1971-12-22',96,'Released','The hilarious comedy about dis-Organized Crime.','The Gang That Couldn\'t Shoot Straight',59226,2.2816,5.2,'jH-oh7sLsEQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5934,_binary '\0','/q7WBYbZ1DiirFGx1Ex11N7jKMyT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067128',7.3,39151,'en','Get Carter','Jack Carter is a small-time hood working in London. When word reaches him of his brother\'s death, he travels to Newcastle to attend the funeral. Refusing to accept the police report of suicide, Carter seeks out his brother’s friends and acquaintances to learn who murdered his sibling and why.','/3AytAYzJuPmS4Wo8X3jcsaN4oM3.jpg','1971-02-03',112,'Released','What happens when a professional killer violates the code? Get Carter!','Get Carter',1485,3.3538,7,'0NtstlDW0Zo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5935,_binary '\0','/4IS01Tag6iDtOqKlOUKCgCaEEuo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067134',6.6,3108,'it','Giornata nera per l\'ariete','A journalist finds himself on the trail of a murderer who\'s been targeting people around him, while the police are considering him a suspect in their investigation.','/rUFHw7bz0uoSR7zCku7yiHOAfDA.jpg','1971-08-17',93,'Released',NULL,'The Fifth Cord',42676,2.2921,6.597,'OJyI13w73Kk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5936,_binary '\0','/2ZbYjD4j3RzUZ7PvPb8toKQeF4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067140',7.5,40759,'it','Giù la testa','At the beginning of the 1913 Mexican Revolution, greedy bandit Juan Miranda and idealist John H. Mallory, an Irish Republican Army explosives expert on the lam from the British, fall in with a band of revolutionaries plotting to strike a national bank. When it turns out that the government has been using the bank as a hiding place for illegally detained political prisoners -- who are freed by the blast -- Miranda becomes a revolutionary hero against his will.','/nWmAtZf83qpOai0fzehf7Hn1S3R.jpg','1971-10-29',157,'Released','Two daredevils battle for a fortune in gold, and it will take an army to stop them!','Duck, You Sucker',336,6.6856,7.7,'EccOlGxfwJI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5937,_binary '\0','/7jsa6wxOTjJ7jD757it4W3V3u7h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067144',7.1,7230,'en','The Go-Between','British teenager Leo Colston spends a summer in the countryside, where he develops a crush on the beautiful young aristocrat Marian. Eager to impress her, Leo becomes the \"go-between\" for Marian, delivering secret romantic letters to Ted Burgess, a handsome neighboring farmer.','/61dXOIpDaiWCp7aIjBYkd6ujdXZ.jpg','1971-06-16',116,'Released','In those days, you fell in love with your own class. Or found a Go-Between.','The Go-Between',36194,2.7392,6.8,'5_SIV8Bm9q8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5938,_binary '\0','/xuVoIUhiV41rnUG8I9obCAW8iJi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067148',6.1,7858,'ja','ゴジラ対ヘドラ','An ever evolving alien life-form arrives on a comet from the Dark Gaseous Nebula and proceeds to consume pollution. Spewing mists of sulfuric acid and corrosive sludge, neither humanity nor Godzilla may be able to defeat this toxic menace.','/mWVRlVwWK3sUCGd9lzMMWUa7CBu.jpg','1971-07-24',85,'Released','The Smog Monster Hedorah arrives in a shooting star!','Godzilla vs. Hedorah',39464,3.8496,6.8,'f2o_Tibx47w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5939,_binary '\0','/u1klcjM5DYyckx2UQT5ZUCT1qOd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067162',6.7,1638,'en','The Grissom Gang','Violent crime caper set in 1930s Kansas in which a gang kidnap an heiress and attempt to recover a ransom. However, the scheme is jeopardised when the leader falls in love with their beautiful captive.','/4gZQqXBEbrUhzNoPP8cUqysdn9c.jpg','1971-05-28',128,'Released','The psychotic killer, the young heiress...the kidnapping that becomes a love story.','The Grissom Gang',79645,2.6892,6.7,'hIep9Ut3BYM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5940,_binary '\0','/gSvFmuWP6Durg7svkv5h8oKC5R8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067164',7.2,1250,'hi','Guddi','A teenage girl will not accept her family\'s attempt to arrange a marriage for her, as her heart is currently too full of love for the movies and heartthrob actor \"Dharmendra.\"','/iidwFEgZ0yroFQJSOSXggGpSqpe.jpg','1971-09-24',121,'Released',NULL,'Guddi',231449,0.8956,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5941,_binary '\0','/22QAVvImke8EQjPskkRlrFtrvuh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067168',6.3,1592,'en','A Gunfight','Will Tenneray and Abe Cross are two aging, famous gunfighters, both in need of money. Tenneray comes up with the idea to stage a duel to the death in a bullfight arena, with the ticket proceeds going to the winner.','/rJBZPEGHKqHfpNoDlCImHDasNN7.jpg','1971-08-25',89,'Released','In Bajo Rio, they pay to see a man kill a bull. Today, they\'ll pay to see a man kill another man.','A Gunfight',71654,2.79,5.8,'CxuhR8iQpWs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5942,_binary '\0','/oBZyBTAmgBedWywhvHrwDtD3wlO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067176',6.2,3430,'en','Hands of the Ripper','A series of murders occur that mirror those committed by the Whitechapel Ripper. Through his experiments with psychoanalysis Dr Pritchard discovers a deadly violence in one of his young female patients. As he delves into the recesses of her mind he uncovers that Anna is possessed by her dead father\'s spirit, willing her to commit acts of gruesome savagery over which she has no control. But the most chilling revelation of all is the identity of her father: Jack the Ripper himself.','/b9S0II7UwL6F7IzZl7Ea7WP710k.jpg','1971-10-17',85,'Released','The hands of Jack the Ripper live again...','Hands of the Ripper',53045,2.0746,6.2,'OOOJuXkfjkQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5943,_binary '\0','/jKgfnnCATAg4fxMfS0LZThmqOZB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067185',7.8,85663,'en','Harold and Maude','A deadpan young man obsessed with death meets an eccentric septuagenarian who teaches him to live life to the fullest.','/t7qEuGwDjcYu8ajaKZ68DeDnOxw.jpg','1971-12-20',92,'Released','They were meant to be. But exactly what they were meant to be is not quite clear.','Harold and Maude',343,5.508,7.583,'u-cOukYeGVM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5944,_binary '\0','/wBdcrn5iBVpvZdpzkTfOBBbbuJc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067204',6.9,4164,'en','The Hired Hand','Harry Collings returns home to his farm after drifting with his friend, Arch. His wife, who had given up on him, reluctantly allows him to stay, and soon believes that all will be well again. But then Harry has to make a difficult decision regarding his loyalties and priorities.','/qE1fgjbtQinQXvSA2ADnOj5SRdl.jpg','1971-08-11',91,'Released','Peter Fonda is riding again... To the woman he lost... for the revenge he craves!','The Hired Hand',42522,1.7193,6.165,'Xut32fFI1uM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5945,_binary '\0','/5je5kclZdLOWwBXnvemAewIZxl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067209',8.2,2398,'en','The Homecoming: A Christmas Story','It\'s Christmas Eve, early 1930s on Walton\'s Mountain. As the family prepares for the holiday, they anxiously await Pa\'s return home from his job in the city some 50 miles away. He is late, and Ma and the grandparents hear on the radio a report of a bus accident that worries them. Oldest son John-Boy must step up to help grandfather cut down a Christmas tree, and upon learning the concern about Daddy sets out to find him.','/wcXI79DjFThXsy4YcJaTl6PVWFu.jpg','1971-12-19',99,'Released',NULL,'The Homecoming: A Christmas Story',56308,2.5467,7.3,'oojeQoVedB8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5946,_binary '\0','/v2W7TOojN25SJjfrdbskfqJI23D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067216',6.2,1382,'en','The Horsemen','In Afghanistan, the ruthless sport of buzkashi is a game of great pride. When Uraz breaks his leg and loses a spirited match, he brings shame to his village, especially his father. After losing his leg below the knee, Uraz, to regain his honor, must learn to ride again and win with a special, one-of-a-kind horse.','/c0lXvdfCXMs4agg8kvv9UMK2VDm.jpg','1971-08-16',110,'Released','A Horse Worth Killing For. A Dream Worth Dying For.','The Horsemen',68659,2.2909,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5947,_binary '\0','/aOQ6ZdPng9NPu3qf0CLeAFK0mfo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067217',7.1,8375,'en','The Hospital','Dr. Bock, the chief of medicine at a Manhattan hospital, is suicidal after the collapse of his personal life. When an intern is found dead in a hospital bed, it appears to Bock to be a case of unforgivable malpractice. Hours later, another doctor, who happens to be responsible for another case of malpractice, is found dead. Despondent, Bock finds himself drawn to Barbara, the daughter of a comatose missionary.','/mOxi0lUCv8F9HqS8u0cEIthwhc7.jpg','1971-12-14',103,'Released','Madness, Murder and Malpractice.','The Hospital',32082,2.7494,6.647,'HftRP0NAJYg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5948,_binary '\0','/qjM7ROfFV3oBpnKseSm5AQHq6VP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067224',6.2,3970,'en','The Hunting Party','A ruthless rancher, and his gang, use extremely long range rifles to kill the men who kidnapped his wife.','/wJOgMQk15rGmhfB3LOg3DJ1DSgj.jpg','1971-07-16',111,'Released','You\'re Invited to a Party... We\'ll Play the Deadliest Game of All... Hunting 26 Men and 1 Woman!','The Hunting Party',45007,3.0483,6.1,'zsOLFC6evNE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5949,_binary '\0','/s1i2PXNoxhQw06iL1upC2UG8gwe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067227',7.3,5779,'de','Händler der vier Jahreszeiten','Hans is a street fruit peddler and born loser. His choice of career upsets his bourgeois family, causing him to turn to drinking and violence. After recovering from a debilitating heart attack, his business finally begins to take off. However, the more he becomes a credit to his family, the more depressed he becomes.','/6SoPBvDdx3WoG1t86XHWyfV6JQm.jpg','1972-03-10',88,'Released',NULL,'The Merchant of Four Seasons',10309,2.1319,6.753,'TpCh-JSYMc8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5950,_binary '\0','/7zS6mp8SwwWYahFftNWDdqzI2kW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067229',5.9,4651,'en','I Drink Your Blood','A group of Satanic hippies wreak havoc on a small town where a young boy, whose sister and grandfather were victimized by them, tries to get even - with deadly results.','/vmqUMajGp8WTMvUexATvfabY7xx.jpg','1971-05-07',83,'Released','Great Blood-Horror to Rip Out Your Guts!','I Drink Your Blood',27313,2.3703,5.9,'9GbgG8xevGs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5951,_binary '\0','/alrN6vXAYF8jpufHnfUzUXdIHiQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067236',5.5,1220,'it','L\'iguana dalla lingua di fuoco','In Dublin, the acid-scarred, razor-slashed corpse of a young woman is discovered in the boot of the Swiss Ambassador\'s limousine. The Ambassador, his family and employees all become immediate suspects. Faced with the problem of diplomatic immunity, the police officer in charge of the case brings in John Norton, an ex-Inspector known for his brutal methods, to carry out an \"unoffical\" investigation. While Norton develops a relationship with the Ambassdor\'s attractive daughter, several more gruesome murders occur...','/dA8NnCvQ2yfAyBXp8eqASlGDcGL.jpg','1971-08-24',92,'Released',NULL,'The Iguana with the Tongue of Fire',99449,1.9097,5.286,'M25Dd1U0ccI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5952,_binary '\0','/rePwHcfSRaq2tZzrn4haWcPsYm6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067242',7.5,2023,'it','In nome del popolo italiano','An obscure Italian magistrate suspects that a well-known industrialist commited murder, and decides to investigate him, and bring him to court, whatever it takes. But - will the magistrate have it in him to go against impossible odds, in the name of the Italian people he represents?','/e5reonxsH0Dxti5TZ1qi7qGt11G.jpg','1971-12-18',99,'Released',NULL,'In the Name of the Italian People',65573,2.2069,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5953,_binary '\0','/zJ24uGwADdIVxs2ZmxC2iFj9IYc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067245',3.6,1958,'en','The Incredible 2-Headed Transplant','Dr. Roger Girard is a rich scientist conducting experiments on head transplantation. His caretaker has a son, Danny, who, although fully grown, has the mind of child. One day an escaped psycho-killer invades Girard\'s home, killing Danny\'s father before being gunned down himself. With the maniac dying and Danny deeply unsettled by his father\'s death, Dr. Girard decides to take the final step and transplant the killer\'s head onto Danny\'s body.','/sDVMIXoZM9d8Uf5s2EwJDP3HGOg.jpg','1971-04-28',87,'Released','Two heads crafted on the body of a giant... The most fearsome living force ever created by man.','The Incredible 2-Headed Transplant',86193,1.8494,3.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5954,_binary '\0','/rhA03KqeCgPsJig55Tb8n4XH9bp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067249',7.2,2165,'ja','いのちぼうにふろう','In feudal Japan, when any commerce with the rest of the world is strictly prohibited, an idealist appears at an isolated inn, headquarters of smugglers with stolen money intended to ransom his loved one forced to work in a brothel.','/wakCL3sni86vr1juHURcEYjwgE0.jpg','1971-09-11',121,'Released',NULL,'Inn of Evil',101740,1.6634,6.3,'8dFieGDUQac','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5955,_binary '\0','/2y6qnUaICupt4epIdanjgsEzhv9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067274',7.1,4260,'fr','Jo','A writer accidentally shoots his blackmailer and tries to hide the body.','/oO916dKqqKIWcQjUnbWjEcLF47Y.jpg','1971-08-31',85,'Released','Committing a crime is easy. Hiding a body is murder.','Jo',12598,3.2456,7.232,'F-s7S1JkEJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5956,_binary '\0','/cnf41Zu7ue1VgYdJEIYRC9w5yhS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067277',7.8,20086,'en','Johnny Got His Gun','A young American soldier, rendered in pseudocoma from an artillery shell from WWI, recalls his life leading up to that point.','/ryIY3FPmTtXu9g6W4I69qCdkxKj.jpg','1971-08-04',112,'Released','The most shattering experience you\'ll ever live.','Johnny Got His Gun',16328,4.0572,7.495,'K7AFmXc0wK0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5957,_binary '\0','/6vMxC2eq4jVljvLYguNcd8ndzdr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067302',6.2,1768,'en','Kidnapped','Scottish orphan David Balfour is betrayed by his wicked uncle Ebeneezer, who arranges for David to be kidnapped and sold into slavery so that he cannot claim his inheritance. The boy is rescued and befriended by Alan Breck, a Scottish rebel fighting on behalf of his country\'s independence from the British.','/snvNu7aXBIFSnYncIMc5DYlIUNU.jpg','1971-12-22',100,'Released','Robert Louis Stevenson\'s Great Adventure Story...Now a Monumental Motion Picture!','Kidnapped',32032,2.0053,6.221,'K__MLrseIMM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5958,_binary '\0','/bxh7ybql4p24u9WsX1GI9v9PDLg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067309',7.1,34364,'en','Klute','A high-priced call girl is forced to depend on a reluctant private eye when she is stalked by a psychopath.','/tVyINAsNGSgD1OIstqwCcs7wyGH.jpg','1971-06-23',114,'Released','You\'d never take her for a call girl. You\'d never take him for a cop.','Klute',466,4.358,6.8,'3S4rxnjwFDg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5959,_binary '\0','/ocITefWXer6L2QyOZRSsWEAXvpD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067314',6.6,1773,'en','Kotch','When retired salesman Joseph Kotcher begins to feel pressure to move out of the house he shares with the family of his son, he opts to embark on a road trip instead of settling in a retirement home. Befriending Erica, a young pregnant woman and his grandson\'s former nanny, Kotch begins to finds new meaning in life as he helps her prepare to welcome her baby into the world.','/yPyMVlAD8F159i9uIyPgxwnmmLm.jpg','1971-09-17',113,'Released','Walter Matthau in the role only he could make so excitingly different...','Kotch',76002,1.5107,6.6,'p-EJbyHAxsw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5960,_binary '\0','/wIJ2XeUIm9UPAAD0Qcw34XshbIa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067315',6.8,2699,'ru','Красная палатка','Torn by personal guilt, Italian General Umberto Nobile reminisces about his 1928 failed Arctic expedition aboard the airship Italia.','/ywTSr9hrYs72ZjIqZ9b805DNJfC.jpg','1969-12-23',158,'Released','Forget everything you\'ve ever heard about heroes. Now there is \"The Red Tent.\"','The Red Tent',8063,2.4289,6.063,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5961,_binary '\0','/BptAeUVnlWgWqxLygABTNL5SBU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067321',5.2,2928,'it','La figlia di Frankenstein','When Dr. Frankenstein is killed by a monster he created, his daughter and his lab assistant continue his experiments.','/vMZgGVXHzL6Ixy2zy8ac81TQMzt.jpg','1971-10-22',99,'Released','A Mad Surgeon\'s Mind in a Woman\'s Body','Lady Frankenstein',3122,2.3752,5.6,'qoMJfEKRJJQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5962,_binary '\0','/wlANdDl0ukKYiM474Y9k1k6xCJf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067324',7.9,3629,'de','Land des Schweigens und der Dunkelheit','Through examining Fini Straubinger, an old woman who has been deaf and blind since her teens, and her work on behalf of other deaf-blind people, this film shows how the deaf-blind struggle to understand and accept a world from which they are almost wholly isolated.','/wzruxvZEYZzaFOuL1Ufwe5PYG0t.jpg','1971-10-08',85,'Released',NULL,'Land of Silence and Darkness',62437,1.8357,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5963,_binary '\0','/eRlLmoE0SepKmWf3Y7Iqxy1ggUh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067327',6.1,3050,'en','The Last Movie','After a film production wraps in Peru, an American wrangler decides to stay behind, witnessing how filmmaking affects the locals.','/c0OkAQkZZPQ65jXF8SiLbWWLpVO.jpg','1971-09-29',108,'Released','There is a time to die and a time not to','The Last Movie',49600,1.807,5.7,'E7038IZw_MQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5964,_binary '\0','/fhzwleXGmiqBuQdWxmEwpkydhm4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067328',8,57620,'en','The Last Picture Show','High school seniors and best friends, Sonny and Duane, live in a dying Texas town. The handsome Duane is dating a local beauty, while Sonny is having an affair with the coach\'s wife. As graduation nears and both boys contemplate their futures, Duane eyes the army and Sonny takes over a local business. Each struggles to figure out if he can escape this dead-end town and build a better life somewhere else.','/7NYePZc0lZrRomtmQsjOJMePTEb.jpg','1971-10-03',119,'Released','Anarene, Texas, 1951. Nothing much has changed…','The Last Picture Show',25188,7.2561,7.613,'NufO2KXHbKQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5965,_binary '\0','/sYxcSFV3bOGU7t0mj8y5U3TmVHZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067329',6.6,3060,'en','The Last Run','A former mob getaway driver from Chicago has retired to a peaceful life in a Portuguese fishing village. He is asked to pull off one last job - to drive a dangerous crook and his girlfriend to France.','/dhZ9a6fwQQTvQXBV2ab3peJ2KxP.jpg','1971-07-07',95,'Released','In the tradition of Hemingway and Bogart.','The Last Run',72447,1.7392,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5966,_binary '\0','/xbzrxVwGamKC5Ui57JHVZQLHpQg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067333',7,7219,'en','Lawman','While passing through the town of Bannock, a bunch of drunken cattlemen go overboard with their celebrating and accidentally kill an old man with a stray shot. They return home to Sabbath unaware of his death. Bannock lawman Jered Maddox later arrives there to arrest everyone involved on a charge of murder. Sabbath is run by land baron Vince Bronson, a benevolent despot, who, upon hearing of the death, offers restitution for the incident.','/88DTPi738IZD4epYGj58yCm3WTz.jpg','1971-03-11',99,'Released','He gave the West justice right up to its neck... then rammed more down its throat.','Lawman',42500,3.036,6.535,'H2WKu3cw8JM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5967,_binary '\0','/ruIjq7TYVsy83Wo9Arb7rWjR1EU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067334',6.7,13482,'en','Le Mans','Filmed during the annual 24-hour endurance race at Le Mans, Michael Delaney is a Porsche driver haunted by the memory of an accident at the previous year\'s race in which a competing driver was killed. Delaney also finds himself increasingly infatuated with the man\'s widow.','/45lMKp75PCDuTS4Or8B48FehY1z.jpg','1971-06-23',104,'Released','Steve McQueen takes you for a drive in the country. The country is France. The drive is at 200 MPH!','Le Mans',5920,3.4596,6.8,'228f-dPxI3Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5968,_binary '\0','/9yNeSl7d3MPxn7fBUVxMQvasaej.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067341',6.4,10573,'en','Let\'s Scare Jessica to Death','Newly released from a mental ward, Jessica hopes to return to life the way it was before her nervous breakdown. But when Jessica moves to a country house with her husband and a close friend, she finds a mysterious girl living in there. Jessica\'s terror and paranoia resurface as evil forces surround her.','/vR8H0KSUYptRjheMjysyidpbPSP.jpg','1971-08-27',89,'Released','Something is after Jessica. Something very cold, very wet...and very dead.','Let\'s Scare Jessica to Death',16154,2.566,6.242,'4V3fKVHAZaA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5969,_binary '\0','/9JNJVFClLBNSAgnuzDIAJVtWOBx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067345',6,2163,'en','The Light at the Edge of the World','Pirates take over a lighthouse on a rocky island. They then execute a devious plan to cause ships to run aground, pillaging their wrecks. A lone member of the lighthouse crew survives, and he deperately fights their plot. A shipwrecked maiden that avoids the pirates slaughter soon complicates the situation.','/hA7KfC9fzc43R5Yt4gLhELtp1tA.jpg','1971-07-16',128,'Released','Jules Verne Takes You Over the Edge of the World!','The Light at the Edge of the World',90974,2.6705,6.017,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5970,_binary '\0','/bfJOITZlFbxwHtgZPHa6x8z4Q4y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067350',6.8,4193,'en','Little Murders','A young nihilistic New Yorker copes with pervasive urban violence, obscene phone calls, rusty water pipes, electrical blackouts, paranoia, and ethnic-racial conflict during a typical summer of the 1970s.','/i2QOxh6pwgy1MUF4bBYDVdPwbWa.jpg','1971-02-09',108,'Released','Funny in a new and frightening way!','Little Murders',27459,2.0069,6.7,'-LsH8Z9lZh0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5971,_binary '\0','/z2EYbXNON8bQDgE0YY1SdRe5C4j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067355',7.4,28846,'it','Lo chiamavano Trinità...','The simple story has the pair coming to the rescue of peace-loving Mormons when land-hungry Major Harriman sends his bullies to harass them into giving up their fertile valley. Trinity and Bambino manage to save the Mormons and send the bad guys packing with slapstick humor instead of excessive violence, saving the day.','/9wpvCdjqqz3VxYkMn5QwDUXhQW6.jpg','1970-12-22',115,'Released','Look out! Here comes Trinity...','They Call Me Trinity',9394,8.722,7.5,'PbBQ1mPCG7Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5972,_binary '\0','/FoxWPSJjxlUyylZgN35qkWvpTz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067361',6.8,6700,'it','Una lucertola con la pelle di donna','Carol Hammond, daughter of a politician, has vivid nightmares involving sex orgies and LSD. In a dream, she murders a neighbor she envies and wakes up to a real investigation into her neighbor\'s murder.','/nS0M12LDDnYJAzJMmI4ULSJlsvw.jpg','1971-02-18',104,'Released','Biting, Gnawing Terror Claws at Your Brain!','A Lizard in a Woman\'s Skin',63025,2.6074,6.5,'4PT0UqpxwWc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5973,_binary '\0','/eC0G0B1BJQQG6CJ0wuoT6KcrPwa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067367',5.7,4339,'en','Lust for a Vampire','In 1830, the Karnstein heirs use the blood of an innocent to bring forth the evil that is the beautiful Mircalla - or as she was in 1710, Carmilla. The nearby Finishing School offers rich pickings not only in in the blood of nubile young ladies but also with the headmaster who is desperate to become Mircalla\'s disciple, and the equally besotted and even more foolish author Richard Lestrange.','/ovaDuEswr439cxPeUaOF3TcsSNC.jpg','1971-01-17',91,'Released','A vampire\'s lust knows no boundaries...','Lust for a Vampire',31472,3.1441,5.901,'VI48szQIB3g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5974,_binary '\0','/isyOwiSRyLRFXdsMn0UiA7mQbXV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067372',7.4,16209,'en','Macbeth','Scotland, 11th century. Driven by the twisted prophecy of three witches and the ruthless ambition of his wife, warlord Macbeth, bold and brave, but also weak and hesitant, betrays his good king and his brothers in arms and sinks into the bloody mud of a path with no return, sown with crime and suspicion.','/35wNrDYuZjVCLurOmTZ5j490iuR.jpg','1971-12-20',141,'Released',NULL,'Macbeth',11316,3.7084,7.082,'Zp70jXJFX9M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5975,_binary '\0','/60hvlGqR2OCKVIPLF7oLBNW4TSv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067375',5.7,1287,'en','Madame Sin','A CIA agent is used as a pawn in an insane woman\'s plan to steal a Polaris submarine.','/jLybVAVkKebh8u7vvASyKNoWgHj.jpg','1972-01-15',90,'Released',NULL,'Madame Sin',55032,1.5476,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5976,_binary '\0','/bnYKsKWWvpIaErI1TiSrb2f44Ja.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067384',6.6,4407,'it','La corta notte delle bambole di vetro','An American journalist in Prague searches for his girlfriend who has suddenly disappeared.','/i9NVwOKd0qxq2IH5tWXo81bSth2.jpg','1971-10-28',97,'Released','When things are not what they seem...','Short Night of Glass Dolls',39993,2.3908,6.7,'tnqiCNY8Q6k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5977,_binary '\0','/84fLFwU3Jfn0KBrtUCETb5xCHCn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067385',6.2,1232,'fr','Les Malheurs d\'Alfred','Unlucky in love, Alfred tries to commit suicide, only to be thwarted by police efforts to prevent a simultaneous attempt by a nearby young woman. Recovering, the young lady puts him up at her house, as he has run out of places to live. He joins a Parisian sporting team and seems to have transferred his bad luck to a corrupt television boss who is attempting to manipulate the game so that Alfred\'s Paris team loses.','/b1upysXG6WkdH9b6EzGPJWq9b6S.jpg','1972-03-08',98,'Released',NULL,'The Troubles of Alfred',67420,2.0043,5.94,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5978,_binary '\0','/4UQIqXbjUg0lbxfTuieYhxdFkQc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067386',6.6,2006,'nl','Malpertuis','A young sailor finds himself trapped in the labyrinthine mansion of his occultist uncle, along with a number of eccentric and mysterious relatives who all seem to be harboring a dark secret.','/iDb2K01wbVSJZAf03VMVRcyRaYI.jpg','1972-06-02',125,'Released','If you expect to get out alive... you must be dreaming.','Malpertuis',46362,1.8545,6.5,'g0YJlW_idWQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5979,_binary '\0','/7AwsicUVwmol6VjhxVwdnAMrLw1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067388',6.8,3968,'en','Man in the Wilderness','In the early 1800s, a group of fur trappers and Indian traders are returning with their goods to civilization and are making a desperate attempt to beat the oncoming winter. When guide Zachary Bass is injured in a bear attack, they decide he\'s a goner and leave him behind to die. When he recovers instead, he swears revenge on them and tracks them and their paranoiac expedition leader down.','/2thgsNTcJ9sz6viuUe6kcRFBlIG.jpg','1971-11-24',104,'Released','He was left for dead. He would not forget.','Man in the Wilderness',46845,2.8972,6.3,'ltyvk_TX_D4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5980,_binary '\0','/zHPD6iHVwYfi495iTvkZwkRqwmI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067396',5.2,1835,'es','La mansión de la niebla','A group of travelers, stranded at an isolated, fog-bound mansion, are beset upon by the living dead from the adjoining cemetery.','/mrfPkCFMc5QFkvQYEDjMfTuAw84.jpg','1972-08-05',83,'Released','Welcome to Home Bloody Home','Murder Mansion',105110,1.7206,5.7,'EdlQdXBYcOA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5981,_binary '\0','/c3yRhy3AYr7PUAV8WsJv7E7Ll3D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067397',6.5,1911,'fr','Les Mariés de l\'an deux','Nicolas Philibert goes to America after killing a French aristocrat. On his return he tries to divorce his wife, Charlotte, but when he sees others trying to woo her his own interest is rekindled.','/sVKoO20twVTFZO8ivf1gSCD3tdF.jpg','1971-04-07',98,'Released',NULL,'The Married Couple of the Year Two',4279,3.0088,6.515,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5982,_binary '\0','/64TQeLz7f5N0F7NQEzEFTAtuHvK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067402',7.1,5321,'en','Mary, Queen of Scots','Mary Stuart, who was named Queen of Scotland when she was only six days old, is the last Roman Catholic ruler of Scotland. She is imprisoned at the age of 23 by her cousin Elizabeth Tudor, the English Queen and her arch adversary. Nineteen years later the life of Mary is to be ended on the scaffold and with her execution the last threat to Elizabeth\'s throne has been removed. The two Queens with their contrasting personalities make a dramatic counterpoint to history.','/7YJtMIkpxK83qVOT8nasQIZ1LTZ.jpg','1971-12-22',128,'Released','MARY, QUEEN OF SCOTS, who ruled with the heart of a woman.','Mary, Queen of Scots',46067,3.008,6.7,'qlc4Ng5Koz0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5983,_binary '\0','/24p72GoNxdTscZhDBGjpsBHakNZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067409',7.3,3532,'fr','Max et les ferrailleurs','A detective decides to go undercover and set up a group of robbers, but he may be getting too caught up in the task at hand.','/vtFINNmvCqR5av2y5aDPS5SlhfV.jpg','1971-02-17',112,'Released',NULL,'Max and the Junkmen',3427,3.1332,7.106,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5984,_binary '\0','/zaZVjkAwPsaBTsoyJMPWqnsPOM5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067411',7.6,30772,'en','McCabe & Mrs. Miller','A gambler and a prostitute become thriving business partners in a remote Old West mining town until a large corporation arrives on the scene.','/oR839yRsFAiQHwJ78hdKZYjEBg8.jpg','1971-07-08',120,'Released','The story of a gambling man and a hustling lady and the empire they fashioned from the wilderness.','McCabe & Mrs. Miller',29005,4.4411,7.1,'Xkr5p0XCaUQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5985,_binary '\0','/hYdUqZsGe2K8eTjgU6WZEeMyczi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067418',7.5,3554,'en','Melody','Two youngsters declare to their parents that they want to get married. Not sometime in the future but as soon as possible.','/AmLfhgwwFmEZzTUBN0S4JM3YlVw.jpg','1971-03-28',103,'Released','A tender love story for everyone who was ever ten years old.','Melody',48207,2.8038,7,'918-ZXTDzgo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5986,_binary '\0','/6Lqg3mq2qSdAS806LryixLjnz8A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067419',6.1,3635,'en','The Mephisto Waltz','A frustrated pianist himself, music journalist Myles Clarkson is thrilled to interview virtuoso Duncan Ely. Duncan, however, is terminally ill and not much interested in Myles until noticing that Myles\' hands are ideally suited for piano. Suddenly, he can\'t get enough of his new friend, and Myles\' wife, Paula, becomes suspicious of Duncan\'s intentions. Her suspicions grow when Duncan dies and Myles mysteriously becomes a virtuoso overnight.','/h2zyPibxcUtvcL9Fxxsh1RRkW49.jpg','1971-04-09',115,'Released','...The Sound of Terror','The Mephisto Waltz',40158,1.9955,6,'EIJFfSBGyOs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5987,_binary '\0','/thNaDbW6Nt6c9kSiXzj9qezwlyv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067429',7.4,5572,'it','Milano Calibro 9','Just out of prison, ex-con Ugo Piazza meets his former employer, a psychopathic gangster Rocco who enjoys sick violence and torture. Both the gangsters and the police believe Ugo has hidden $300,000 that should have gone to an American drug syndicate boss.','/tV5xhT0luyD1Xiebx4HXbv3sV0q.jpg','1972-02-15',102,'Released',NULL,'Caliber 9',40022,2.0164,7.468,'9Nw_eRFafqs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5988,_binary '\0','/fnHcASfxa8afgkwpnzYBVkjPNDg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067433',7.2,5895,'en','Minnie and Moskowitz','Depressed and jaded after being dumped by her married boyfriend, aging beauty Minnie Moore wonders if she\'ll ever find love. After shaggy-haired parking lot attendant Seymour Moskowitz comes to her defense from an angry and rebuffed blind date, he falls hopelessly in love with her despite their myriad differences. Minnie reluctantly agrees to a date with Moskowitz, and, slowly but surely, an unlikely romance blossoms between the two.','/pufOqUEeEzbUma3WfnLS0AHiMl5.jpg','1971-12-22',115,'Released','John Cassavetes, who gave you \'husbands\', \'faces\', \'shadows\', now adds to his list of intriguing characters...','Minnie and Moskowitz',24349,2.2624,6.653,'hIPoCwux0kI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5989,_binary '\0','/djEwMhVtcRALmCJF8VzHGuQ2Vph.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067434',6.4,2058,'it','Mio caro assassino','Following the mysterious decapitation of an insurance investigator, Police Inspector Peretti is put onto the case, but all the clues lead to an unsolved case of kidnapping and murder.','/rV4Wh0CAe226fAwXMRLbzZY7Upe.jpg','1972-02-03',96,'Released',NULL,'My Dear Killer',69579,1.8892,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5990,_binary '\0','/2pX2geI8oItHs5IfsUPwJwcmuXV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067439',7.4,3454,'fr','Mon oncle Antoine','Set in cold rural Quebec at Christmas time, we follow the coming of age of a young boy and the life of his family which owns the town\'s general store and undertaking business.','/9gcADZrXrRoCO3U02e1temvQu7Z.jpg','1971-11-12',105,'Released',NULL,'Mon oncle Antoine',74689,1.1117,6.9,'t1Yi6tHMvPc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5991,_binary '\0','/tyWnJeMatQGLsiLfLsxBV0pp9nk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067445',7.3,25233,'it','Morte a Venezia','Composer Gustav von Aschenbach travels to Venice for health reasons. There, he becomes obsessed with the stunning beauty of an adolescent Polish boy named Tadzio who is staying with his family at the same Grand Hôtel des Bains on the Lido as Aschenbach.','/s81SuFBSqY8T5Lrn5R8ucX8LKxi.jpg','1971-03-05',131,'Released','The celebrated story of a man obsessed with ideal beauty.','Death in Venice',6619,3.9737,7.2,'GPkmRY3pDAE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5992,_binary '\0','/6XC5tyirzQpUUzICB58RV0iX9Fy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067446',6.5,2686,'it','La morte cammina con i tacchi alti','Exotic dancer Nicole finds herself terrorized by a black-clad assailant determined on procuring her murdered father\'s stolen gems. Fleeing Paris in hopes of evading her knife-wielding pursuer, Nicole arrives in England only to discover that death stalks her at every corner.','/OgnXQqhORlSIXGHfM3TpgDph4w.jpg','1971-11-30',108,'Released',NULL,'Death Walks on High Heels',77029,1.9804,6.5,'TByuLlIj9wc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5993,_binary '\0','/jQXqGFnNntcqOAvarkIyxGcqZUN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067454',6.5,5323,'en','Multiple Maniacs','The Cavalcade of Perversion, a traveling freak show, acts as a front for Divine, who is out for blood after discovering her lover\'s affair.','/pro4OiTibouFxb6O5GhddSUImI7.jpg','1970-04-10',97,'Released','A celluloid atrocity!','Multiple Maniacs',25625,3.3324,6.275,'vLLXRN9XqF8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5994,_binary '\0','/z4qfxUTMVnnyqsLWIEWrMHnfeGz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067457',5.2,1809,'en','Murders in the Rue Morgue','In Paris, in the beginning of the Twentieth Century, Cesar Charron owns a theater at the Rue Morgue where he performs the play \"Murders in the Rue Morgue\" with his wife Madeleine Charron, who has dreadful nightmares. When there are several murders by acid of people connected to Cesar, the prime suspect of Inspector Vidocq would be Cesar\'s former partner Rene Marot. But Marot murdered Madeleine\'s mother many years ago and committed suicide immediately after.','/hCMJqvDiB2PBIqpj9mOF4kP0SLg.jpg','1971-07-21',87,'Released','LOVE and MURDER are the two consuming passions of the Rue Morgue!','Murders in the Rue Morgue',63512,2.2428,5.2,'jd0jHewFTho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5995,_binary '\0','/pstKL6eLcraGnR91CYlxaLfkuxW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067458',6.7,4459,'en','Murphy\'s War','Murphy is the sole survivor of his crew, that has been massacred by a German U-Boat in the closing days of World War II. He is rescued, and ends up at a forgotten mission station near the mouth of the Orinoco, and begins to plot his vengeance. He wishes to sink the U-Boat by means of any method imaginable to him, and sets about to make the courageous attempt, assisted by Louis, the administrator of the local oil company.','/dXTJJj5C7usHjI9gOEvzA2Jzlmq.jpg','1971-01-13',107,'Released','World War Two was just ending. World War Murphy is about to begin.','Murphy\'s War',35068,2.7634,6.1,'lWdp7KWZnCY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5996,_binary '\0','/6InmEjIm7inXQj7bg0zMZHRajOI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067464',7.3,1806,'cs','Dívka na koštěti','A teenage witch, frozen in time as a punishment for 300 years, finds herself in a modern world.','/8QkQA89AAmVIOjQ5YhWq1onEUSu.jpg','1972-09-08',76,'Released',NULL,'The Girl on the Broomstick',47712,1.7297,6.991,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5997,_binary '\0','/5f3YTZZSuIzrLja2rw2xB1pzZxM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067467',6.7,2221,'hu','Még kér a nép','Set in the 1890s on the Hungarian plains, a group of farm workers go on strike in which they face harsh reprisals and the reality of revolt, oppression, morality and violence.','/eapZ1WPlH9iHodlUEJe7DE5nJzZ.jpg','1972-03-09',86,'Released',NULL,'Red Psalm',86732,1.7765,6.3,'g6SysGRC7L4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5998,_binary '\0','/5AfPKd4i7IrPCRRyMU4H0CCfUUJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067482',7.3,9066,'en','A New Leaf','After running out of funds, Henry Graham, a carefree playboy, plots to marry and murder wealthy botanist Henrietta Lowell.','/2yKcVFrizqpBBzZBEBvvBR3JKJF.jpg','1971-03-11',102,'Released','Henry & Henrietta… the love couple of the seventies... and the laugh riot of the year.','A New Leaf',36850,2.9788,7.257,'_kpOUqih-iA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(5999,_binary '\0','/1WU0h2ivjKXOlRke4DtGGn0CBKA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067483',7.2,6321,'en','Nicholas and Alexandra','Tsar Nicholas II, the inept last monarch of Russia, insensitive to the needs of his people, is overthrown and exiled to Siberia with his family.','/66JQ2dtAQNjyVIppBqBDk7MAGKv.jpg','1971-11-29',189,'Released','The Last Dance of the Romanovs.','Nicholas and Alexandra',38646,3.2599,7,'Lbwqgfnh2-Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6000,_binary '\0','/mM44QD0H7SYilFixKvfu5S5fQ1Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067484',7.5,2549,'pl','Nie lubię poniedziałku','An acute case of Mondayitis in Warsaw. Interwoven stories of a few inhabitants of Warsaw, including one very unlucky Italian on a governmental mission and a charitable Polish American.','/bmZPLqHjZGHGMvfc8WoDFxG27D5.jpg','1971-08-27',98,'Released',NULL,'I Hate Mondays',64115,1.6852,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6001,_binary '\0','/ypfO7sWia7zb3pvooeP9hOb5PZx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067486',6.3,1546,'en','The Road Builder','The dreary existence of middle-aged spinster Maura Prince takes an unexpected turn with the arrival of young handyman Billy Jarvis, but there may be more to him than meets the eye.','/aiZQhG7yaxGGTNKAQZxmvQZMc3o.jpg','1971-02-25',98,'Released','A lonely woman in a decaying mansion... A young stranger on a big, black bike.','The Road Builder',86979,1.3917,6.3,'H3Lnq2xSofA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6002,_binary '\0','/i8wETDmJT29mPJQTceDHcYDl5lb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067487',5.8,3325,'it','La notte che Evelyn uscì dalla tomba','A rich, mentally-unstable man with a penchant for playing deadly S&M games with women who resemble his dead wife, sparks off a chain of bizarre events after getting remarried.','/sUMDXrKxPRZeNQgKDG5bl3FQ2Zd.jpg','1971-08-18',102,'Released','The Worms are Waiting!','The Night Evelyn Came Out of the Grave',42499,1.9238,6,'5-heCUH3rEs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6003,_binary '\0','/eKYX2Mz8XYzdwAKSEaIH22RO6nt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067489',5.7,2188,'it','La tua presenza nuda!','A wealthy author\'s second wife begins to suspect that her 12-year old stepson may have murdered his mother, who mysteriously died in a bathtub accident.','/AcKzXVEhxsp1L7XWZ45z9zfraT8.jpg','1972-10-14',89,'Released','What he saw is what he did.','What the Peeper Saw',112355,5.0988,5.9,'7325YdxJhzU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6004,_binary '\0','/3Bj0asM1kSAXB0aj8dyIgioxW3d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067490',7.4,8677,'en','The Night Stalker','Wisecracking reporter Carl Kolchak investigates a string of murders in Las Vegas and suspects the culprit is a vampire. His editor thinks he\'s crazy and the police think he\'s a nuisance, so Kolchak takes matters into his own hands.','/dij60cVBL39B5t1SdGQr33APksC.jpg','1972-01-11',74,'Released','A real horror story…','The Night Stalker',15360,4.092,6.9,'L05_RaNGDxk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6005,_binary '\0','/5IQviPdztniz3mo6LdinkFU8ia8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067491',5.4,2032,'en','Night of Dark Shadows','Recently married, Quentin and Tracy Collins have just moved into Collinwood, a New England estate that has long been in the Collins family and which Quentin has just inherited. They soon find themselves plagued by spirits of past residents.','/5Xu5emaAXByZd7s2EVwzCvXAuf7.jpg','1971-08-04',95,'Released','Just another night of... Terror.','Night of Dark Shadows',71945,2.5772,6.6,'YoG23udt0r8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6006,_binary '\0','/aXPKz2DEY6uDhRhwVVqF5t91qpc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067500',6.1,7133,'es','La noche del terror ciego','In 13th century Berzano, a legion of knights known as the Templar were executed for conducting black magic rituals and committing human sacrifices in a quest for eternal life. 700 years later, they rise from the dead and attack a group of vacationing college students who visit the remains of their abandoned monastery.','/8JGJojd01EHKuKvYsgZ1aPCrZfS.jpg','1972-04-10',101,'Released','Makes \"Night of the Living Dead\" Look Like a Kids\' Pajama Party!','Tombs of the Blind Dead',37601,2.4632,6.2,'_K4w5NPRtZw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6007,_binary '\0','/liQ843fUSzgzVTnXhW8Tnv0uAKo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067503',6.2,1269,'ja','呪いの館 血を吸う眼','A young girl suffers a terrifying nightmare of a vampire with blazing golden eyes. Eighteen years later, it is revealed to be a hellish prophecy when a strange package containing an empty coffin mysteriously turns up at a nearby lake.','/dFJ6jAfO7j9mc6CzDt8HOOjRZYc.jpg','1971-06-16',82,'Released','A white mist flows through the woods at night.','Lake of Dracula',108737,1.387,6.8,'t_wAthHLfEs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6008,_binary '\0','/mEbi8mxaNvtqsXZvDhjYFoCNkjh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067513',5.9,1287,'it','L\'occhio nel labirinto','Julie is disturbed by the disappearance of her psychiatrist boyfriend Luca following a bizarre dream where she witnessed him murdered. She travels to a seaside village where he might be and encounters Frank, who tells her Luca has indeed been there. Julie\'s investigation leads her to the house of Gerta, where the mystery deepens among the odd characters residing at this artists enclave.','/tdqYovoweaumkdXtFSThiaIjcqb.jpg','1972-03-24',93,'Released','Chilling horror!','Eye in the Labyrinth',74325,1.8862,5.729,'x18vdpy_MPY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6009,_binary '\0','/rLF7gYMI1OkrZHuetMoiXACFXrM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067515',3.3,1574,'en','Octaman','A scientific team in Mexico discover a pool of unusual baby \"octopus-like\" specimens. Gathering a few for analysis back at the lab, it is soon discovered that the critters belong to a gangly six-foot half man/half octopus-like creature, that\'s pretty angry and wants her \'babies\' returned…','/nzMm4o7mWA247zPmLAi4bnturbj.jpg','1971-11-03',76,'Released','Horror heap from the nuclear trash!','Octaman',91736,1.1449,3.7,'jBzqaN4nvXg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6010,_binary '\0','/4aFaG4VbWOHOCoOvZs3I5VjRpYE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067517',7.5,2389,'ru','Офицеры','Two friends are army officers, and the turbulent times throw them from the Civil War in the early 20s to the Soviet conflict in Finland, from China to the Urals.','/ig4COIGS7WE3AR2YoJyRso6NYt8.jpg','1971-07-26',96,'Released','There is such a profession - to defend their homeland','Officers',65386,0.9095,6.963,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6011,_binary '\0','/jKekVhTqPBs4wCPy5TxeXgRb4Hc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067524',7.2,2808,'da','Olsen-banden i Jylland','The Olsen gang in Jutland. Ones again Egon Olsen has a plan when he gets out of Vridslose State Prison. He has found out that the Germans left a large sum of money (in American dollars and gold bars) in one of their commando bunkers, when they were defeated in 1945; the only problem it\'s in Jutland. Egon, Benny and Kjeld \"appropriate\" a car and drives to Jutland along with Kjelds wife and child Yvonne and Borge. They look forward to fooling the the people in Jutland, but of course, things don\'t go quite as planed. It ends with Benny, Kjeld, Borge and Yvonne sitting in the train back to Copenhagen, were they are overtaken by Egon in his car on the road next to the track. This is the last time the Olsen gang goes to Jutland.','/lpQNR02pqXynd8fXh0v3mCYIcMV.jpg','1971-10-08',96,'Released',NULL,'The Olsen Gang in Jutland',11390,1.5485,7,'LzQyiafHoZ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6012,_binary '\0','/zE7DPxbY0u6vRLftpoYAG4QYXzY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067525',6.4,36487,'en','The Omega Man','Due to an experimental vaccine, Dr. Robert Neville is the only human survivor of an apocalyptic war waged with biological weapons. Besides him, only a few hundred deformed, nocturnal people remain; sensitive to light, and homicidally psychotic.','/qlt65C43HeoDm5K5gYBtT20OeA1.jpg','1971-08-01',98,'Released','The last man alive...is not alone!','The Omega Man',11234,4.4515,6.2,'KfxxSeURcKI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6013,_binary '\0','/5tOMD50gvzerK4et7OhuSi7u8ae.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067527',7.7,1743,'en','On Any Sunday','Documentary on motorcycle racing featuring stars of the sport, including film star Steve McQueen, a racer in his own right.','/pIzXpUuVRXxW2KdczbI6C5vZFeq.jpg','1971-07-28',96,'Released','Take a trip at 265 mph','On Any Sunday',29251,0.9027,6.9,'xSLRlPiiiQE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6014,_binary '\0','/7Lm2F1oxm8Eu6Y0efSYE12hotIK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067528',6,2425,'en','On the Buses','Stan gets a little annoyed when his Mum and Sister keep buying expensive items on hire purchase, but the money he earns for overtime working as a bus driver means that he can afford it... just! His job is secure, as bus drivers are hard to come by, and his overtime prospects are good, until the bus company decide to revoke a long standing rule and employ women bus drivers. Aghast at the thought of','/fKIcELUNmiSlktMelhsslPZkxnH.jpg','1971-07-09',88,'Released','From Telly Laughs To Belly Laughs!','On the Buses',19243,1.7842,6.25,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6015,_binary '\0','/kTq3MJJMcZFUxHUtRpH6alVixHJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067535',6,2532,'en','The Organization','After a group of young revolutionaries break into a company\'s corporate headquarters and steal $5,000,000 worth of heroin to keep it off the street, they call on San Francisco Police Lieutenant Virgil Tibbs for assistance.','/2FKlfGq6cxScLrcFUIWGAavFdxA.jpg','1971-10-20',108,'Released','One honest cop has the guts to take on \"The Organization.\"','The Organization',92272,2.73,6.262,'3-DfrENJWEQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6016,_binary '\0','/6EHp4gjYmXaevHMnlYnH1abTEdt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067541',7.5,16748,'en','Wake in Fright','A young schoolteacher descends into personal moral degradation after finding himself stranded in a brutal, menacing town in outback Australia.','/5XwMDn2acQZ3CHuJ3EDXLg348G3.jpg','1971-07-21',109,'Released','Have a drink, mate? Have a fight, mate? Have some dust and sweat, mate? There\'s nothing else out here.','Wake in Fright',26405,3.6066,7.2,'0mh7qZq0f_w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6017,_binary '\0','/saEcTHiuQgQefEMKZpWUHTH53ik.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067546',7.2,2039,'hi','पाक़ीज़ा','A beautiful courtesan is unable to break away from the cycle of prostitution until a forest ranger falls in love with her. Unfortunately, his wealthy parents oppose the union.','/dVm7WcvVfeQzi8M7NZXcdtbF6jz.jpg','1972-02-04',153,'Released',NULL,'Pakeezah',54966,1.2264,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6018,_binary '\0','/rHhNgpxeuIglRO7Fskmk7Ru6Nke.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067549',7.1,22780,'en','The Panic in Needle Park','A stark portrayal of life among a group of heroin addicts who hang out in Needle Park in New York City. Played against this setting is a low-key love story between Bobby, a young addict and small-time hustler, and Helen, a homeless girl who finds in her relationship with Bobby the stability she craves.','/rhJ8Dnl6Z9KR9R2zskBKIfrFeFs.jpg','1971-06-01',110,'Released','God help Bobby and Helen, they\'re in love in Needle Park','The Panic in Needle Park',27554,4.7834,6.8,'eNeN9ZU2CSM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6019,_binary '\0','/jDgaKZG5KfEMKYmxt6G3mpKBfo6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067580',6.6,2029,'en','Pink Narcissus','An outrageous erotic poem focusing on the daydreams of a beautiful boy prostitute who, from the seclusion of his ultra-kitsch apartment, conceives a series of interlinked narcissistic fantasies populated by matadors, dancing boys, slaves, and leather-clad bikers.','/kaZiiGE6820KyFF9XkzPB9Rx9qn.jpg','1971-05-24',65,'Released','A unique experience in visual fantasy!','Pink Narcissus',42497,2.6118,6.3,'jf2bymItPmo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6020,_binary '\0','/1hVYX8rmxkMpifYsTERkUyrz3ay.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067588',6.9,35638,'en','Play Misty for Me','A brief fling between a late-night radio disc jockey and an obsessed female fan takes a frightening turn when another woman enters the picture.','/m1rdcRWJ9QAgS5lFkrZN9B6kaKf.jpg','1971-10-01',102,'Released','The scream you hear may be your own!','Play Misty for Me',15393,5.4825,6.6,'6Y9J7QjN1gg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6021,_binary '\0','/x2dtw01nx8U6kJsX2530WiolpFl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067589',6.5,3130,'en','Plaza Suite','Film version of the Neil Simon play has three separate acts set in the same hotel suite in New York\'s Plaza Hotel with Walter Matthau in a triple role. In the first, Karen Nash tries to get her inattentive husband Sam\'s attention and help save their failing marriage. In the second, brash film producer Jesse Kiplinger tries to seduce his former one-time flame Muriel. In the third, Roy Hubley and his wife Norma try and persuade their daughter, a bride to-be with cold feet, out of the bathroom before her approaching wedding ceremony.','/yZ5eDobhO60wK4snbX6vtlz0Agh.jpg','1971-05-12',114,'Released','Plaza Suite. Through its portals pass the world\'s most mixed-up mortals.','Plaza Suite',42514,1.8605,6.2,'IB61gxV8HCI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6022,_binary '\0','/jopwusM9WeXiNyW1lTQncX2p4WE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067592',6,2605,'fr','La Plus Longue Nuit du Diable','Seven tourists sent by Satan to a castle are caught by a ghastly woman as they commit deadly sins.','/tRvh4IpxWvRg2AKuTOIpVNXbX7d.jpg','1971-11-14',95,'Released','EXORCISM! The one last hope for the possessed … But this time the devil wins!','The Devil\'s Nightmare',58218,1.66,6.2,'i3Ngri33WHM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6023,_binary '\0','/m8RL50mhMJv2aXAQYIS3K4T490K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067595',7.5,3387,'en','The Point','A father reads his son a bedtime story about young Oblio, who is banished from the fantastical kingdom of pointed heads and things for having no point.','/7S5BY8G6WFWJWtbO7RCNsRJjmbl.jpg','1971-02-02',74,'Released',NULL,'The Point',23544,1.4207,6.8,'6d2P-IUviEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6024,_binary '\0','/20zn6dsKw5mp0fmEsUBXiREQrQo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067601',5.8,1554,'en','The Possession of Joel Delaney','An upper-class Manhattan divorcee comes to believe that her brother is possessed by the spirit of a serial killer who beheaded young women in Spanish Harlem.','/dLZtcVpnHfeTAeirievzvFm6fI8.jpg','1972-05-24',105,'Released','If you believe, no explanation is necessary. If you don\'t believe, no explanation is possible.','The Possession of Joel Delaney',29491,2.3072,5.6,'f64u38Vm7Sc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6025,_binary '\0','/hKK7M0cC6OxklmVImwBgDqj2Bcf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067602',6.1,1303,'it','Un posto ideale per uccidere','Two young sexually free hippies, Dick and Ingrid, finance their travels by selling naked snaps of Ingrid until their plan is brought to an abrupt end by the Police. Forced on the run the two seek refuge at a seemingly empty isolated large villa. As it turns out the house is inhabited by the middle-aged Barbara who invites them in for some potential three-way hanky-panky that soon locks them into something far more twisted and chilling!','/eHpcAw4XOb1NDpseRBM7UxYT6mO.jpg','1971-08-18',90,'Released','Young, free \'n\' kinky... but for how long?','Oasis of Fear',64630,1.6291,5.6,'mD7DPop2VVc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6026,_binary '\0','/rYdQaA3uq1GOSlQnKNqgR60Ed0W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067610',6.1,3201,'en','Pretty Maids All in a Row','At Oceanfront High School, female students are being targeted by an unknown serial killer. Meanwhile, a married teacher hides his flings with nubile students, and an awkward male is frustrated by the plethora of uninhibited freewheeling young girls.','/v9fOCFolNCB5RQ4grachHoYK7cb.jpg','1971-04-28',91,'Released','A good football coach, can get away with murder','Pretty Maids All in a Row',69321,2.8925,5.9,'VQyknwTFypU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6027,_binary '\0','/vtt6JlYWZam5O3qPQX9hBTI0xHq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067625',7.8,2910,'ru','Проверка на дорогах','Shot in 1971 but banned until 1986, this distinctly Russian war story takes place in 1942 behind enemy lines. A regiment of partisans captures former Red Army lieutenant Lazarev who is dressed in a German uniform. He’s a Nazi defector and collaborator but now desires to switch back and fight with Russian partisans.','/5UMvXCAUjvRFxEfx5xtDayd0Clq.jpg','1986-04-01',96,'Released',NULL,'Trial on the Road',71762,1.1563,7.063,'bAy1iN7okPQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6028,_binary '\0','/aVMo2axHMp1Nl07C9RKGTXqYVv9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067630',5.8,3645,'en','Psychomania','A gang of young people call themselves the Living Dead. They terrorize the population from their small town. After an agreement with the devil, if they kill themselves firmly believing in it, they will survive and gain eternal life. Following their leader, they commit suicide one after the other, but things don\'t necessarily turn out as expected...','/698hIkRSMmZzY2trCADbgzvpVXx.jpg','1973-03-01',90,'Released','The Dead Still Ride... the Living Howl in Terror!','Psychomania',48350,1.2013,5.5,'Qa8zcFMRwxo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6029,_binary '\0','/oqKfIArX3RcHdHot8tDE0NHFxH5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067633',7.7,8654,'en','Punishment Park','In this fictional documentary, U.S. prisons are at capacity, and President Nixon declares a state of emergency. All new prisoners, most of whom are connected to the antiwar movement, are now given the choice of jail time or spending three days in Punishment Park, where they will be hunted for sport by federal authorities. The prisoners invariably choose the latter option, but learn that, between the desert heat and the brutal police officers, their chances of survival are slim.','/fPGnMnp80ycqUHdgP1T3nzCyYKe.jpg','1971-10-01',88,'Released','One of the most controversial films ever made.','Punishment Park',26513,3.7651,7.3,'suh2r2ojP3I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6030,_binary '\0','/7Z3Lzevwua5KFDkqi07ITIdvIs3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067637',5.3,1597,'fr','Les Pétroleuses','Outlaw sisters in the old West inherit a ranch and try to settle down and develop relationships with neighboring family of lots of brothers.','/pQgcpLTie0dGCZibymDcTD7nncG.jpg','1971-12-16',94,'Released','A Bawdy, Brawling, Bouncing Western Comedy!','The Legend of Frenchie King',64345,3.0708,5.6,'GyoPXHEhfF0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6031,_binary '\0','/5kh4VMRflkmlOcvnB0WW2LgbZg9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067641',7.2,4432,'fr','Quatre nuits d\'un rêveur','Jacques, a young man with artistic aspirations, spends four nights wandering Paris with a young woman, whom he rescued from suicide.','/cVzvJsn2TUEXxRszs2IVFF36hSA.jpg','1972-02-02',82,'Released',NULL,'Four Nights of a Dreamer',55847,2.1392,7.1,'dBQTyOzJmzE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6032,_binary '\0','/zOnb0WKYSrXI1GiIkHdC8qt4PT9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067647',6.3,9211,'it','I racconti di Canterbury','Glimpses of Chaucer penning his famous work are sprinkled through this re-enactment of several of his stories.','/6mAUGtIc0PjvL1EhDwX6WMkUQpp.jpg','1972-09-02',111,'Released','From the team that gave you \"Decameron\", Geoffrey Chaucer\'s Lustiest Tales of Merrie Olde England!','The Canterbury Tales',5691,4.9719,6.1,'7dH-0wqXHD4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6033,_binary '\0','/bI4MWCHHW0ai0SlOkGk7wOSfxj0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067649',7.2,1267,'fa','رگبار','Well-educated and humble teacher Mr Hekmati arrives in a new city and at a new job in the pre-revolutionary Iran. He falls in love with a hardworking underprivileged young woman who nurses her elderly mother and raises her young brother.','/rntcTRuOINGczdClitm8f8U3EkI.jpg','1972-05-17',130,'Released',NULL,'Downpour',134346,0.8005,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6034,_binary '\0','/aCpJrGjmG6Qp7oyrrrnJn7ka4e1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067650',5.5,2623,'en','Raid on Rommel','Captain Foster plans on raiding German-occupied Tobruk with hand- picked commandos, but a mixup leaves him with a medical unit led by a Quaker conscientious objector.','/eXsYwl8p4MWPC0lvZRItgHlR7vq.jpg','1971-02-12',99,'Released','He took o Rommel...the Sahara...and a unit of untrained me to blow the Desert Fox to Hell.','Raid on Rommel',53657,2.6324,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6035,_binary '\0','/2E2tfSguMHWrzbc29j1yKWifKDv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067656',6.4,14911,'it','Ecologia del delitto','An elderly heiress is killed by her husband who wants control of her fortunes. What ensues is an all-out murder spree as relatives and friends attempt to reduce the inheritance playing field, complicated by some teenagers who decide to camp out in a dilapidated building on the estate.','/cTqmAcZwaEY609QDCLpgBlwijn9.jpg','1971-09-08',85,'Released','They came to play, they stayed to die.','A Bay of Blood',5486,4.1694,6.6,'T-jUOqnUAm8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6036,_binary '\0','/zUmb5ThHDYUQ0c5f4ATzTqDQG1X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067658',6,1591,'en','Von Richthofen and Brown','Spend time on both sides of World War I, partly with German flying ace Baron Manfred Von Richthofen (John Phillip Law), aka \"The Red Baron,\" and his colorful \"flying circus\" of Fokker fighter planes, during the time from his arrival at the war front to his death in combat. On the other side is Roy Brown of the Royal Air Force, sometimes credited with shooting Richthofen down.','/slorcURQhOTyMFQAtav5XZAKnlk.jpg','1971-06-30',97,'Released','On April 21, 1918, the Red Baron of Germany and the Black Sheep of the R.A.F. met in the skies of France for the last time!','Von Richthofen and Brown',84285,2.3143,6.2,'nOjsE4M2d1I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6037,_binary '\0','/xomlSuimOwQccK2l38rRCCONn2L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067671',5.6,1728,'en','The Return of Count Yorga','Count Yorga continues to prey on the local community while living by a nearby orphanage. He also intends to take a new wife, while feeding his bevy of female vampires.','/6GFQ3MbdJlIRxlmjAeqhUsrOTtv.jpg','1971-08-20',97,'Released','The DEATHMASTER is Back from Beyond the Grave!','The Return of Count Yorga',28855,2.0038,5.3,'YSSqQPoksus','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6038,_binary '\0','/v4fn0Bho1aMNLCNfaGuqXrXCZwq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067672',5.6,2533,'it','È tornato Sabata... hai chiuso un\'altra volta!','A quick draw, master gunslinger traveling with a circus rides into a small town and helps the citizens free themselves from a crooked politician.','/dI2IU9a69lk7DwJ2aAsbDoNOfuX.jpg','1971-09-03',105,'Released','The man with gunsight eyes is back!','Return of Sabata',72032,2.7376,5.9,'rkxj6iCvaF0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6039,_binary '\0','/6AyblcyTInbyjhM6cB0oEpcFD74.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067681',6.7,1222,'fr','La Route de Salina','Jonas, a young drifter, is wandering in a deserted area on the road to Salina, Mexico. He stops at a desolate roadside service station when Mara, the owner, identifies him as her son Rocky, who disappeared four years ago. Feeling sorry for Mara, he decides to stay on and meets Mara\'s friend Warren and Rocky\'s sister Billie, but dark facts are to be revealed about the disappearance of Rocky.','/32955FEmC7LZNBrmjCaQjDMEauw.jpg','1970-11-09',96,'Released','Her mind was the most erotic and dangerous part of her body.','The Road to Salina',79717,2.3941,6.3,'L0Gd3UbFOKg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6040,_binary '\0','/unIuV3x6bbaR9ur6EidZXjj6lTb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067690',6.5,8352,'en','Les Lèvres rouges','Ostend, Belgium. In a decadent seaside hotel, Stefan and Valerie, a newlywed couple, meet the mysterious Countess Báthory and Ilona, her secretary.','/w6669wTC2x3WtBveKEBv04y70fh.jpg','1971-05-28',100,'Released','These are the Daughters of Darkness… They are waiting for you – They thrive on blood!','Daughters of Darkness',46175,2.608,6.179,'nlWScevOsVo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6041,_binary '\0','/hafH6RcBq67to3O6L7z132yVKlf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067696',6.3,3230,'it','Sette orchidee macchiate di rosso','A maniac on the loose is committing savage acts of slaughter, and one survivor may be the only key to unmasking the serial slayer known as the Half-Moon Killer. The mysterious half-moon lockets he leaves with his victims could be the only key to unraveling his sinister motives, but will that be enough before he completes his ice-cold plot to claim his intended seven victims?','/8AB1EeJWra8kiTsjSTHkuDDzCzw.jpg','1972-02-24',92,'Released',NULL,'Seven Blood-Stained Orchids',3699,2.3485,6.2,'GrYtRlRpVl4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6042,_binary '\0','/pJlI4IrHTOWvph6pxUe6dZAqhAz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067698',7.7,4247,'it','Sacco e Vanzetti','Boston, 1920. Italian immigrants Nicola Sacco and Bartolomeo Vanzetti are charged and unfairly tried for murder on the basis of their anarchist political beliefs.','/pgAoI8h6lKLKenW8aKmdNd7AFwJ.jpg','1971-03-16',125,'Released','The Murders that shocked the Nation. The Trial that still shakes the World.','Sacco & Vanzetti',48211,2.4257,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6043,_binary '\0','/l6erZFDSdZXOIt8xbvOGX6XA5iU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067699',4.9,1492,'en','A Safe Place','Noah, a young woman who lives alone in New York, is dating two very different men, Fred and Mitch, at the same time. However, she realises that neither man can totally fulfil her needs.','/xRIdcMxfPgSKqUN4SVmFN4E2iyZ.jpg','1971-10-01',94,'Released',NULL,'A Safe Place',53898,1.4497,5.2,'_u5UTFF_alA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6044,_binary '\0','/df3uxnz6QXQokqx60UXrjFFduaR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067713',6.1,7406,'en','Scars of Dracula','The Prince of Darkness casts his undead shadow once more over the cursed village of Kleinenberg when his ashes are splashed with bat\'s blood and Dracula is resurrected. And two innocent victims search for a missing loved one... loved to death by Dracula\'s mistress. But after they discover his blood-drained corpse in Dracula\'s castle necropolis, the Vampire Lord\'s lustful vengeance begins.','/yS06u6RqaY3saimoVr6ZVZP9K7s.jpg','1970-11-08',96,'Released','The mark of death remains forever!','Scars of Dracula',34479,3.2684,5.9,'Zw1HJEQjz60','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6045,_binary '\0','/hPZnGavHDVNerv512cjIQGnIZey.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067716',5.5,2249,'en','Schlock','A quiet suburb in Southern California is terrorized by a mysterious murderous monster living in a cave. As the bodies pile up -- with incriminating banana peels always near by the crime scene -- a group of teens stumble on the guilty party: a 20-million-year-old Schlockthropus, an ape-like creature with a sense of the absurd.','/pr9DXClc5hHJDUZ7iCmMbmqHXur.jpg','1973-03-01',80,'Released','The first musical monster movie in years.','Schlock',54123,1.5059,5.6,'eoBvNZyMS0c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6046,_binary '\0','/6e42tDk7WOboTPwtvANmb46qWuy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067727',6.6,4926,'en','See No Evil','In the English countryside, Sarah Rexton, recently blinded in a horse riding accident, moves in with her uncle\'s family and gallantly adjusts to her new condition, unaware that a killer stalks them.','/gR2xs6S9F2zjPrmzWsgMXSdVX2C.jpg','1971-09-02',89,'Released','Keep your eyes on what she can not see.','See No Evil',39859,2.6517,6.5,'U7R-nZiuLA4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6047,_binary '\0','/5MHks7Xz5Wo4oVNdULy1Mx79AyU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067729',7.8,1540,'bn','সীমাবদ্ধ','Ambitious businessman Shyamalendu enjoys showing his visiting sister-in-law, Tutul, the extravagant life he leads with his wife. But Tutul is less than impressed with the trappings of wealth.','/yNqM9ullGvDACmGdaRs5tfd4fgJ.jpg','1971-09-24',110,'Released',NULL,'Company Limited',45940,1.0793,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6048,_binary '\0','/1YAWNhFiqENsahLefpIZNvX0YQ5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067732',6.3,2154,'es','La semana del asesino','A young man, Marco, working as a butcher, accidentally kills a taxi driver. His girlfriend Paula wants to go to the police so he has to kill her too. He then has to kill his brother, his brother’s fiancée and his father, who have become suspicious. He gets rid of the bodies by taking them to a slaughter house.','/A2srdcBbijsL8wzfy9HM87NaVji.jpg','1972-04-13',98,'Released','When the butcher goes berserk....','The Cannibal Man',29336,2.0976,6.1,'P5cLcUcx4E0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6049,_binary '\0','/c8dlIxgLwoR7DAJGrIPTrh7vNdt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067741',6.6,23317,'en','Shaft','Cool Black private eye John Shaft is hired by a crime lord to find and retrieve his kidnapped daughter.','/7PSuOC3HI6Alf9NIlXppaxyfqqB.jpg','1971-06-25',100,'Released','The mob wanted Harlem back. They got Shaft...up to here.','Shaft',482,3.6685,6.4,'hwrLNTN7-Fs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6050,_binary '\0','/qzJstBZJW2mHvOpcuSiPjKLR6bp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067750',6.2,2755,'en','Shoot Out','Clay Lomax, a bank robber, gets out of jail after an 7 year sentence. He is looking after Sam Foley, the man who betrayed him. Knowing that, Foley hires three men to pay attention of Clay\'s steps. The things get complicated when Lomax, waiting to receive some money from his ex-lover, gets only the notice of her death and an 7 year old girl, sometimes very annoying, presumed to be his daughter.','/kyuq9116gONmk6zMhP1Qn4VsXBm.jpg','1971-07-02',94,'Released','Three fast guns against one determined man!','Shoot Out',79735,2.6727,6.3,'lEoH28uxPRk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6051,_binary '\0','/uyS2Jtc8UnLrNfQN5f3GW7t0vQq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067755',7.1,1317,'ja','沈黙 SILENCE','In 17th-century Japan, two Portuguese Jesuit priests seek their mentor, who is rumoured to have committed apostasy, and to propagate Catholicism.','/8C08Kex73PXwiOPygyC0RScOYFU.jpg','1971-11-13',130,'Released',NULL,'Silence',92670,1.8764,7.2,'WbCzPdp81fY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6052,_binary '\0','/5QTwfS9vcr22Nl7PCcUro7dEMFq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067756',6.6,34014,'en','Silent Running','After the entire flora goes extinct, ecologist Lowell maintains a greenhouse aboard a space station for the future with his android companions. However, he rebels after being ordered to destroy the greenhouse in favor of carrying cargo, a decision that puts him at odds with everyone but his mechanical companions.','/ahasZ5HILZHtlrl6cbXgpfk0y8H.jpg','1972-03-09',89,'Released','Amazing companions on an incredible adventure... that journeys beyond imagination!','Silent Running',811,4.7472,6.4,'p69lEMn0I8k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6053,_binary '\0','/ruQqa2J96o8VfyXhdVanwzND81T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067763',7,2244,'en','Skin Game','Quincy Drew and Jason O’Rourke, a pair of friends and con men—the former white, the latter a Northern-born free Black man— travel from town to town in the pre–Civil War American West. In their scam, Quincy sells Jason into slavery, frees him, and the two move on to the next town of suckers . . . until a con gone wrong leads Jason into real danger.','/revU4hZ3OSnMv2rVNXGm5ek0qGX.jpg','1971-09-30',102,'Released','To market, to market, to sell your best friend, then split up the money and do it again.','Skin Game',20628,2.1689,6.6,'OKvAze3Sosc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6054,_binary '\0','/zKeTLUB5obmb0DPqqqtm3k0Mfbm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067770',6.8,12952,'fr','Soleil Rouge','In 1870, Japanese ambassador Sakaguchi and his entourage travel by train to Washington to deliver a valuable sword to the President of the United States, a gift from the Emperor of Japan. On board the same train are two robbers, Link and Gauche, ready to make their move…','/hDQyx0N8J5OJMJYpJLIX0SkKwT4.jpg','1971-09-15',114,'Released','The greatest fighting machine the West has ever known.','Red Sun',11842,4.9804,6.8,'Y1seoPdjpUg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6055,_binary '\0','/cjFCt5SdTgGLzMfIIeEYUG5MdaS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067773',5.8,2001,'en','Quelqu\'un derrière la porte','A neurosurgeon with a cheating wife takes an amnesiac into his home and conditions him to believe that the cheating wife is his own and to take the \"appropriate\" action.','/f061UCG07ns15qrmoG7hBKd8gKC.jpg','1971-07-28',93,'Released','No memory, no name, no mind: This man will act out someone else\'s insanity and revenge.','Someone Behind the Door',4679,2.3546,5.415,'6oDtdNEDucI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6056,_binary '\0','/o2e4wpi2HvofShB54wVLF8EuKDW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067774',6.9,5074,'en','Sometimes a Great Notion','Hank Stamper and his father, Henry, own and operate the family business by cutting and shipping logs in Oregon. The town is furious when they continue working despite the town going broke and the other loggers go on strike ordering the Stampers to stop, however Hank continues to push his family on cutting more trees. Hank\'s wife wishes he would stop and hopes that they can spend more time together. When Hank\'s half brother Leland comes to work for them, more trouble starts.','/8ZSweQLYQR1J7oS3IRPk2XE5hRc.jpg','1971-12-17',114,'Released','\"Never give a inch\" was the motto of the Stampers of Oregon. And live it they did!','Sometimes a Great Notion',40083,2.8946,6.9,'kJz8JEEjGrI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6057,_binary '\0','/d3u97tjDhvPJjeyYMTIEfodtk9j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067778',7.5,11770,'fr','Le Souffle au cœur','This loosely plotted coming-of-age tale follows the life of 15-year-old Laurent Chevalier as he stumbles his way over the burgeoning swell of adolescence in 1950s France. After having his first sexual experience with a prostitute and dodging the lips of a priest, Chevalier contracts a case of scarlet fever. When the fever leaves him with a heart murmur, Chevalier is placed in a sanatorium, along with his over-attentive and adulterous mother.','/gJt4ojBYsaUDGnKqnIqGvQOLpjh.jpg','1971-04-27',118,'Released','A souffle of a movie!','Murmur of the Heart',42501,4.9813,7.02,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6058,_binary '\0','/maS3NZWIBczt6idc4e19gNiRoY1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067789',7.3,2429,'ru','Старики-разбойники','An old detective does not want to retire. The only way out is to prove to his boss that he still can catch criminals. The problem is that there were no crimes recently to work on. Together with his retired friend he decides to commit a perfect crime himself and then quickly solve it. Real problems start when a real criminal steals money he has stolen.','/hCoon0OCV0eT3MKRrnEOkU4j0JH.jpg','1972-08-07',92,'Released',NULL,'Old Men: Robbers',46010,1.4057,7.212,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6059,_binary '\0','/uTTySGAQ092zr5TP7PqDnHuWR1W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067800',7.4,68823,'en','Straw Dogs','David Sumner, a mild-mannered academic from the United States, marries Amy, an Englishwoman. In order to escape a hectic stateside lifestyle, David and his wife relocate to the small town in rural Cornwall where Amy was raised. There, David is ostracized by the brutish men of the village, including Amy\'s old flame, Charlie. Eventually the taunts escalate.','/yigkfHE1OhkxPPrjrV78Y9ibGEk.jpg','1971-11-25',116,'Released','In the Face of Every Coward Burns a Straw Dog.','Straw Dogs',994,5.0531,7.2,'_SPJza7ZUjo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6060,_binary '\0','/t0IIuPfAGPnmTgtahEW1KdKNVWK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067803',7.2,10194,'en','Summer of \'42','Over the summer of 1942 on Nantucket Island, three friends -- Hermie, Oscy and Benjie -- are more concerned with getting laid than anything else. Hermie falls in love with the married Dorothy, whose husband is an army pilot recently sent to the battlefront of World War II.','/4n7m05C2ee3UM5Co2k2BOWqH5o2.jpg','1971-04-19',103,'Released','In everyone\'s life there\'s a \"Summer of \'42\"','Summer of \'42',41357,3.1037,6.727,'5c119LHL-pY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6061,_binary '\0','/xkIaVZo98JFCteffdXRgZfcW5A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067805',6.9,7977,'en','Sunday Bloody Sunday','Recently divorced career woman Alex Greville begins a romantic relationship with glamorous mod artist Bob Elkin, fully aware that he\'s also intimately involved with middle-aged doctor Daniel Hirsh. For both Alex and Daniel, the younger man represents a break with their repressive pasts, and though both know that Bob is seeing both of them, neither is willing to let go of the youth and vitality he brings to their otherwise stable lives.','/7q1h3M1vDlsHDKRhoPOzKjmFCVq.jpg','1971-09-21',110,'Released','It\'s about three decent people. They will break your heart.','Sunday Bloody Sunday',45938,2.5971,6.563,'YLYLasLqII4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6062,_binary '\0','/jX6U13wBH9W2A8FVhzHWz0FUQLr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067809',6.8,7425,'en','Support Your Local Gunfighter','A con artist arrives in a mining town controlled by two competing companies. Both companies think he\'s a famous gunfighter and try to hire him to drive the other out of town.','/kDxgzFwLrLubxcKorV7BSQxG3NP.jpg','1971-05-26',91,'Released','The story of a man who took the law into his own finger!','Support Your Local Gunfighter',18287,3.4232,6.6,'viQuUmXzjGs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6063,_binary '\0','/w3HmBVzzawXuLmZzbs2jEh5TdVE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067810',5.5,6516,'en','Sweet Sweetback\'s Baadasssss Song','After saving a Black Panther from some racist cops, a black male prostitute goes on the run from \"the man\" with the help of the ghetto community and some disillusioned Hells Angels.','/ykGkbDp1QxQTM3UUrUvowtXLI0i.jpg','1971-03-31',98,'Released','YOU BLED MY MOMMA. YOU BLED MY POPPA. BUT YOU WONT BLEED ME.','Sweet Sweetback\'s Baadasssss Song',5822,2.2812,5.1,'aen5aQ7w4PE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6064,_binary '\0','/biyESqYfSpmoRP7XzUY4KfMyYzC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067814',7.8,2440,'hu','Szerelem','Luca, who regularly visits her bedridden mother-in-law, hides from her the fact that János, his son, has been arrested on a trumped up political charge.','/qjTpEIC3BBrE61hNFluExkjH7Nf.jpg','1971-01-21',88,'Released',NULL,'Love',42516,0.9445,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6065,_binary '\0','/c9yVY3YK2fsBTwH00EGNFjhApJs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067815',7.4,1938,'hu','Szindbád','Based on the stories of Hungarian writer Gyula Krúdy, this film is a lush and sensuous depiction of the life, loves and memories of serial seducer Szindbád. As the protagonist looks back on his life, past and present, imagination and reality flow inseparably into one another.','/yEFh4TGVnJEAyBexEMGTdioKSyb.jpg','1971-11-25',91,'Released',NULL,'Sinbad',86431,1.8516,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6066,_binary '\0','/5sOxgIflTDccpPwfn5tGfmaRTNL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067820',7.3,5340,'en','Taking Off','Unable to deal with her parents, Jeannie Tyne runs away from home. Larry and Lynn Tyne search for her, and in the process meet other people whose children ran away. With their children gone, the parents are now free to rediscover/enjoy life.','/2UXNQy39AqER8Y5LjuZcA1pliwq.jpg','1971-03-28',93,'Released','\"Taking Off\" is about people. People like your neighbor. People like the family down the street. People like yourself.','Taking Off',59881,2.1047,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6067,_binary '\0','/993ZXFkyHGltND6AvlrVlVsveyM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067824',6.9,32049,'zh','唐山大兄','Cheng is a young Chinese mainlander who moves in with his expatriate cousins to work at an ice factory in Thailand. He does this with a family promise never to get involved in any fights. However, when members of his family begin disappearing after meeting the management of the factory, the resulting mystery and pressures force him to break that vow and take on the villainy of the Big Boss.','/9VFYDWYnAhXAgyqgs94lwNmMBbk.jpg','1971-10-23',99,'Released','Every limb of his body is a lethal weapon!!!','The Big Boss',12481,6.2264,7.1,'eFJmVD0qHHg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6068,_binary '\0','/yAi5VrtGhsyvqFWYEz9PqnH2f8j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067848',6.7,3644,'en','They Might Be Giants','After the death of his wife, retired judge Justin Playfair creates a fantasy world for himself in which he is the legendary detective Sherlock Holmes, even dressing like the character. Out of concern for Justin\'s money more than his health, his brother Blevins puts him under the care of psychiatrist Dr. Mildred Watson. As Dr. Watson grows fond of Justin, she begins to play along with his theories, eventually becoming an assistant in his investigations.','/yzv8J2Vu63AQyEw5D9ckyBgn9Fo.jpg','1971-06-09',98,'Released','When they reach out for each other... they touch every heart... with warmth, charm and laughter!','They Might Be Giants',27841,3.0564,6.9,'rSD5yKu27es','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6069,_binary '\0','/xkfXO0Zswvvlbs0FlxH3TA4qji3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067866',7.2,33614,'es','El Topo','El Topo decides to confront warrior Masters on a trans-formative desert journey he begins with his 6 year old son, who must bury his childhood totems to become a man.','/fKoNBTATc94rUYLq8VyypS24LUw.jpg','1970-12-18',125,'Released','The definitive cult spaghetti western','El Topo',13041,4.3214,7,'xjTlNTbv-xs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6070,_binary '\0','/8Vu4WHGzxJpB3Usee8aXljC1OYr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067881',6.9,1918,'en','The Trojan Women','In the aftermath of the Trojan Wars, Queen Hecuba takes stock of the defeated kingdom. Her son has been killed, and his widow, Andromache, is left to raise their son, Astyanax, alone. Hecuba\'s daughter, Cassandra, fears being enslaved by her Greek masters, while Helen of Troy risks being executed. Astyanax also becomes the focus of the Greeks\' attention as the last male heir of the Trojan royal family.','/o6EjYCJXNc9VpeJOyJ1UsRP1hYV.jpg','1971-05-01',105,'Released','The strength of mankind has always been its women.','The Trojan Women',47446,5.0943,6.2,'h98-rkXblFM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6071,_binary '\0','/y9NXfEz8p1IiR8Ug4vpa3MiI8lJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067885',7.3,3320,'pl','Trzecia część nocy','Set during the Nazi occupation of Poland, the story follows Michał, who witnesses the murder of his mother, wife and child and then is hurled into a life that literally is not his own; a surreal world littered with trapdoors, doppelgängers and wormholes.','/cGHrnnAYyYUFhLM6d90PyimMbDE.jpg','1972-01-04',107,'Released',NULL,'The Third Part of the Night',46799,1.8253,7.005,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6072,_binary '\0','/tdNMIUmeCSJcLN672JNIxNFp1Zi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067893',7.2,14593,'en','Two-Lane Blacktop','A driver and mechanic drag racing for money cross paths with a female hitchhiker and a drifter who challenges them to a cross-country race.','/8GSjw941Maq4oDvbYqbyc6UM8WH.jpg','1971-07-07',102,'Released','no beginning... no end... no speed limit...','Two-Lane Blacktop',27236,3.5911,6.9,'J5sxfIBCTY0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6073,_binary '\0','/pVhFrfHcbQ7aUjdffRC9FPuF4S0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067900',7,12442,'fr','Un flic','A Parisian police chief has an affair, but unbeknownst to him, the boyfriend of the woman he’s having an affair with is a bank robber planning a heist.','/gICgcF0VuxW13XeHeeUEKlAkyOE.jpg','1972-10-01',100,'Released',NULL,'Un Flic',42741,2.8456,6.609,'8yhUY7-VLJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6074,_binary '\0','/ftU0EgDdpQTEts7qxlwOBNSW9Ke.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067916',6,1402,'en','Up Pompeii','A funny thing happens to Lurcio on the way to the rent-a-vestal-virgin market stall. A mysterious scroll falls into his hands, listing the names of all the conspirators plotting to murder Emperor Nero. And when the upstart slave is elected to infiltrate the ringleader\'s den, the comical ups-and-downs lead to total uproar.','/bF0tIIRMhul0oYEb1Av4nusAc3L.jpg','1971-03-11',90,'Released','Join us for an ORGY of LAUGHS!','Up Pompeii',32116,1.2679,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6075,_binary '\0','/1DtGBns1occ4yaUmPwyTqiMdRmr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067919',8,8408,'sv','Utvandrarna','Karl and Kristina Nilsson work on a farm in a cold and desolate area of 19th century rural Sweden. Growing privations, combined with increasing social and religious persecution, motivate the Nilssons and many of their neighbors to strike out for the United States. Following a treacherous ocean crossing and an equally grueling land passage, the emigrants find themselves in seemingly idyllic Minnesota.','/7k8FjLqqfZIgsVzo8jT8v58mbma.jpg','1971-03-08',191,'Released','a new land... a new hope... a new dream','The Emigrants',40732,1.621,7.4,'AgfJTnh1vc0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6076,_binary '\0','/1ElnSpktceRXLe5kr8D4mL57gX4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067921',6.7,5261,'en','Valdez Is Coming','Old Mexican-American sheriff Bob Valdez has always been a haven of sanity in a land of madmen when it came to defending law and order. But the weapon smuggler Frank Tanner is greedy and impulsive. When Tanner provokes a shooting that causes the death of an innocent man and Valdez asks him to financially compensate the widow, Tanner refuses to do so and severely humiliates Valdez, who will do justice and avenge his honor, no matter what it takes.','/3OdjC3Q98UFDBrvlaUiqmu7vsoK.jpg','1971-04-09',91,'Released','Honor is always worth fighting for','Valdez Is Coming',21242,2.9277,6.3,'lvSNaFiwnjI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6077,_binary '\0','/cMghYBBCHoESAWjPH53QMCodXIQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067924',6.3,5656,'en','Vampire Circus','After a spate of murders, the villagers of Schtettel kill the depraved perpetrator, Count Mitterhouse. Fifteen years later the Circus of Nights appeared in the plague-ridden village and its performers include Mitterhouse\'s mistress, children and cousins. They have come to Schtettel to fulfil the Count\'s last words, an evil, vicious curse of death and destruction on those who participated in his impaling. The children of Schtettel become the targets for a brutal and devastating revenge as the Vampire Circus rehearses for its most deadly performance.','/sbYsGpPy1JgHjlOb1Onc9xwqr8u.jpg','1972-04-30',87,'Released','Human fangs ripping throats - no sawdust can soak up the torrent of blood!','Vampire Circus',29960,1.7779,5.9,'wBzAT6HZBuI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6078,_binary '\0','/sYn05iS9AxV9rsjqBSHrI4azji1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067927',7.2,32527,'en','Vanishing Point','Kowalski works for a car delivery service, and takes delivery of a 1970 Dodge Challenger to drive from Colorado to San Francisco. Shortly after pickup, he takes a bet to get the car there in less than 15 hours.','/1ThnpFx2G2HPhecvODGFEQxfOpO.jpg','1971-01-15',105,'Released','It\'s the maximum trip... at maximum speed.','Vanishing Point',11951,5.6723,7.088,'0P2VCMT8vAw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6079,_binary '\0','/dpWZxkPozRADR62L7j0hg3LEjbB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067929',5.3,2216,'en','The Velvet Vampire','A married couple accept the invitation of mysterious vixen Diane LeFanu to visit her in her secluded desert estate. Tensions arise when the couple, unaware at first that Diane is a centuries-old vampire, realize that they are both objects of the pale temptress\' seductions.','/ezoPhwnnb25QWETr7EpOph7gumz.jpg','1971-10-13',80,'Released','She\'s waiting to love you... to death!','The Velvet Vampire',29069,1.5092,4.6,'n14rbnUtE94','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6080,_binary '\0','/ay3HAK3IbyuW7fMPz5UFSPvIBrE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067943',6.9,2519,'fr','La Veuve Couderc','The relationship between a middle-aged French widow and a young drifter takes a turn when her young niece pays a visit.','/gsQbfn2E250eaBki0vSkg5NTf7e.jpg','1971-09-15',92,'Released','Their interests were worlds apart but strange events brought them close together','The Widow Couderc',76871,2.1065,6.8,'eS8M83sU74E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6081,_binary '\0','/slFo0cA5cngqWDuRW3KzxJBi3Tn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067950',5.3,2699,'fr','Requiem pour un vampire','Two girls on the run get lost in the French countryside, and wind up in a haunted chateau occupied by an ailing vampire and his servants.','/zzVCXhUDqWld6LxkRwzdWaBX9Hv.jpg','1972-04-05',87,'Released','Two young girls... trapped... with no escape! Forced to submit to the Horrors of the Pit!','Requiem for a Vampire',29111,1.6775,5.2,'3Cq5eBDk0B4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6082,_binary '\0','/rPEKFkSwxHPQq1oxTPSCJryB1sK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067952',6.5,2449,'en','Villain','In 1970s London, Scotland Yard orchestrates the downfall of mob boss Vic Dakin after he crosses the line by blackmailing Members of Parliament.','/45iFu2qhIDrRHfwEPRUsZUaqJlz.jpg','1971-05-26',98,'Released','By the time he\'s ready to kill you, its an act of mercy.','Villain',30341,2.0084,6.143,'gKlz5jM2zw4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6083,_binary '\0','/r2Xx2cCOjB2aRnyQCfYKgWuJ8pl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067958',6.6,5854,'sh','W.R. - Misterije organizma','What does the energy harnessed through orgasm have to do with the state of communist Yugoslavia circa 1971? Only counterculture filmmaker extraordinaire Dušan Makavejev has the answers (or the questions). His surreal documentary-fiction collision begins as an investigation into the life and work of controversial psychologist and philosopher Wilhelm Reich and then explodes into a free-form narrative of a beautiful young Slavic girl’s sexual liberation.','/k0TNEVnIUgMIQrkcBasprdZh5Bz.jpg','1971-05-10',85,'Released','The film they said we would never see...','WR: Mysteries of the Organism',42529,2.1667,6.2,'ZpFR2uYeMDA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6084,_binary '\0','/uA5GfPzRU1vRVY7pDfqXQmjRTPI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067959',7.6,30118,'en','Walkabout','Under the pretense of having a picnic, a geologist takes his teenage daughter and 6-year-old son into the Australian outback and attempts to shoot them. When he fails, he turns the gun on himself, and the two city-bred children must contend with harsh wilderness alone. They are saved by a chance encounter with an Aboriginal boy who shows them how to survive, and in the process underscores the disharmony between nature and modern life.','/24vooYt5StgtgcQObVr1GHuM5gy.jpg','1971-07-01',95,'Released','A boy and girl face the challenge of the world\'s last frontier.','Walkabout',36040,4.0861,7.3,'Fdqwbs8uKwQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6085,_binary '\0','/bL1etbhvRGhHhpjbwzHZbXNwM5R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067961',7.1,7138,'en','Wanda','After a string of abusive relationships, Wanda abandons her family and seeks solace in the company of a petty criminal.','/izuJ7cUhcihFnTpfsdSnkMCHsRQ.jpg','1970-09-01',103,'Released',NULL,'Wanda',80560,2.1522,6.8,'KF32MBvdy70','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6086,_binary '\0','/8gsDl83oTZ4cDAwA3xOmZ3Toukd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067962',6.6,2820,'de','Warnung vor einer heiligen Nutte','Film director Jeff and his lead actor are taking their time getting to set. In their absence, the crew lack a purposeful way to spend their time waiting, so they drink heavily. However, as booze is downed and frustration sets in, morale hits rock bottom.','/bwJXQMurcvmS81dqqXVIxb8gJNY.jpg','1971-09-01',103,'Released',NULL,'Beware of a Holy Whore',32319,1.8874,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6087,_binary '\0','/kxFOEavIUCezztjUSgnlrww21wA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067963',5.8,1441,'nl','Wat zien ik','Dutch prostitutes Greta and Nel cruise the Amsterdam red light district, seeking clients to involve in their elaborately staged fetish fantasies, be it disciplinarian headmistresses, surgeons cutting open a willing patient, or even dressing up as chickens, the duo show their expertise in role-playing again and again and again. In reality, Nel is trapped in an abusive marriage and Greta is forever in the middle of their confrontations but her life takes a positive upturn when she becomes involved with a client.','/8qDnAYnKg0nRRtOAIDrsMQXkeFs.jpg','1971-09-10',90,'Released',NULL,'Business Is Business',98050,1.437,5.75,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6088,_binary '\0','/qATv0LLA9Vef007IbKmtr9p99kU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067972',4.3,1781,'en','Werewolves on Wheels','A biker gang visits a monastery where they encounter black-robed monks engaged in worshipping Satan. When the monks try to persuade one of the female bikers, Helen, to become a satanic sacrifice the bikers smash up the monastery and leave. The monks have the last laugh, though, as Helen, as a result of the satanic rituals, is now possessed and at night changes into a werewolf, with dire results for the biker gang.','/ykkxRp24xBQFKpu3N80V0nsSXr1.jpg','1971-08-11',85,'Released','If you\'re hairy, you belong on a motorbike!','Werewolves on Wheels',56259,0.9088,4.6,'6nQDGTli3uc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6089,_binary '\0','/bRkGKMazA0hWBOsBehkmHyaFONn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067975',6.3,2497,'en','What\'s the Matter with Helen?','Two middle-aged women move to Hollywood after their sons are convicted of a notorious murder and open a dance school for children eager to tap their way to stardom.','/9u8Jn04HR4n2u6IQB9otYoYKAxY.jpg','1971-06-30',101,'Released','So you met someone and now you know how it feels. Goody, Goody.','What\'s the Matter with Helen?',42530,1.7268,5.9,'tbND374QLyA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6090,_binary '\0','/k13ItlCIfpRAuNTNmRk9ArXLc1v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067976',6,3261,'en','When Eight Bells Toll','Phillip Calvert is a British Treasury secret service agent assigned to stop the ruthless pirating of millions in gold bullion off the western coast of the Scottish highlands. His search takes him to the small port town of Torbay on the Isle of Torbay where numerous fishing boats, yachts and people have been mysteriously disappearing. A trail of deceit and subterfuge leads him to Cypriot tycoon and shipping magnate Sir Anthony Skouras and his beautiful wife, Charlotte aboard their luxury yacht anchored off the coast, who may hold the answers to the truth.','/nwDYGaJx2o6mABNElpe6o9ZL7TP.jpg','1971-04-30',94,'Released','Danger runs deeper than the sea bed!','When Eight Bells Toll',38654,2.3143,5.7,'OrarUjKC6FY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6091,_binary '\0','/ijM80VjODKjXJP4Kb6wCQqKc0aV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067977',5.9,1271,'en','When Michael Calls','A woman begins to receive ominous phone calls from her nephew, who died 15 years earlier. With each phone call, a family member dies. Will she be the next in line?','/iKXACAQt1JUae4aQBrP7tkPZWtz.jpg','1972-02-05',73,'Released','In \"When Michael Calls,\" Elizabeth Ashley receives mysterious phone calls. Who\'s keeping her on the hook?','When Michael Calls',90391,1.7802,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6092,_binary '\0','/pzhQVEp3ImqYvHYbGWj8sJdTjSU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067979',6.4,1275,'de','Whity','\"Whity\" is the mulatto butler of the dysfunctional Nicholson family in the American Southwest in 1878. The father, Ben Nicholson, has an attractive young wife, Katherine, and two sons by a previous marriage: the homosexual Frank and the feeble-minded Davy. Whity tries to carry out all their orders, however demeaning, until various family members ask him to kill some of the others.','/4tNrHnRgIezx88vU01bA9iKDUVv.jpg','1971-06-02',95,'Released',NULL,'Whity',105757,1.1379,5.4,'Ni1bwcRNndY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6093,_binary '\0','/wRSYoaiUfb3qiLm7PRCLIJ7aduj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067983',6.1,2965,'en','Whoever Slew Auntie Roo?','Mrs Rosie Forrest, aka \'Auntie Roo\', has a holiday tradition of inviting orphans to her mansion for a party. But Roo isn\'t completely sane; she lost her husband and is obsessed with her deceased daughter, whose corpse she still keeps in the house. When Katy Coombs sneaks into the party with her brother, Christopher, the deranged biddy abducts the young girl with the hopes of replacing her daughter.','/mvjAXWzNX8Eurt3z5w6p4E5fSzK.jpg','1972-02-11',91,'Released','She\'s Taking a STAB at Motherhood!','Whoever Slew Auntie Roo?',6976,2.7893,6.2,'j1AEGHyD7rg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6094,_binary '\0','/85u80PRhSBg67iNKjM0Ggqm0CTA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067989',6.5,2380,'en','Wild Rovers','Ross Bodine and Frank Post are cowhands on Walt Buckman\'s R-Bar-R ranch. Bodine is older and broods a bit about how he will get along when he\'s too old to cowboy. Post is young and rambunctious and ambitious for a better life than wrangling cows. When one of their fellow cowboys is killed in a corral accident, Post suggests a way into a better life for himself and his friend: robbing a bank. Bodine reluctantly joins in the plan and the two contrive to rob the local bank. They make good their escape initially, but Walt Buckman and his two sons, John and Paul, are incensed at this betrayal by their own trusted employees. John and Paul set out to bring Bodine and Post to justice.','/xi86WQgEfPEADexlsyCxyEhyonC.jpg','1971-06-23',136,'Released','They were damned good cowboys, until they robbed a bank.','Wild Rovers',42531,1.9319,6.1,'7rDHeSXZD4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6095,_binary '\0','/goim0tvdXQBnCRv6unuGc0v0Xvh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067991',6.2,6590,'en','Willard','A social misfit, Willard is made fun of by his co-workers, and squeezed out of the company started by his deceased father by his boss. His only friends are a couple of rats he raised at home, Ben and Socrates. However, when one of them is killed at work, he goes on a rampage using his rats to attack those who have been tormenting him.','/uhDAH8JRO9R1ROjSH24GoJPaJBJ.jpg','1971-07-30',95,'Released','This is Willard and his friend Ben. Ben will do anything for Willard.','Willard',42532,2.6669,6.1,'b8Gn98fbeMs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6096,_binary '\0','/ko7hMSCtXoJFfpYAIbrowwgH0eq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067992',7.8,246940,'en','Willy Wonka & the Chocolate Factory','When eccentric candy man Willy Wonka promises a lifetime supply of sweets and a tour of his chocolate factory to five lucky kids, penniless Charlie Bucket seeks the golden ticket that will make him a winner.','/vmpsZkrs4Uvkp9r1atL8B3frA63.jpg','1971-06-29',100,'Released','It\'s scrumdidilyumptious!','Willy Wonka & the Chocolate Factory',252,14.6954,7.483,'2WKPKnggJqk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6097,_binary '\0','/4UFBqsDFgpxwBaK8m159bWPBBiM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0067995',5,2223,'en','Women in Cages','Carol Jeffries is a naive American woman staying in the Philippines. She is given ten years in prison after being set up by her drug-dealer boyfriend, Rudy. She endures the harsh conditions, sadistic head matron and attempts on her life, then convinces her cell-mates to try to escape with her through the jungle, in spite of the knowledge that ruthless trackers will be sent out after them.','/zaXqLsz2u6D2Plr3xyw6LEOqJJR.jpg','1971-10-19',81,'Released','The dirty dolls of devil\'s island. You can meet them for a price!','Women in Cages',34462,2.2799,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6098,_binary '\0','/azYTNtGDWS67se4RLra9jVLo9Oe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068000',5.1,2416,'cn','刁手怪招','Hsiao Hu has been secretly training in martial arts, as his father (Tien Feng) has forbidden him. Later, some local store owners ask Ah to help protect them from a greedy Chinese extortion ring. Ah discovers that the crime lord behind the extortion had killed his father years before and is determined for revenge.','/3Qf9OEhcYM3zW5e9ZGtJ6IQ53sY.jpg','1973-03-31',80,'Released','As a boy he was taught the secrets of Kung Fu, now he will use them to avenge his father\'s death.','The Cub Tiger from Kwang Tung',34800,2.9639,5.228,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6099,_binary '\0','/47HzvpIU8EghRs4z2sLNAJGxK17.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068014',6.1,1764,'en','Zeppelin','The outbreak of World War I places Scots officer Geoffrey Richter-Douglas in an uncomfortable position. Although his allegiance is to Britain, his mother was from an aristocratic Bavarian family, and he spent his summers in Germany as a child. When Geoffrey is approached by a German spy who offers him a chance to defect, he reports the incident to his superiors, but instead of arresting the spy they suggest that he accept her offer--and become an Allied agent. In Germany, among old friends, Geoffrey discovers that loyalty is more complicated than he expected, especially when he finds himself aboard the maiden voyage of a powerful new prototype Zeppelin, headed for Scotland on a secret mission that could decide the outcome of the war.','/441jRGFCrRyTzAuojMVXndCj8mM.jpg','1971-04-08',101,'Released','The Great War\'s most explosive moment!','Zeppelin',49719,1.5963,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6100,_binary '\0','/f1KVZhP46zwwcL6JpjIzp3NDoN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068022',5.8,1272,'en','Something Big','Joe Baker has a dream. He wants to do \'something big.\' When he needs a Gatling gun to accomplish this, he seeks out a black marketeer. The price he wants for the gun? A woman! So Baker kidnaps a woman off of the stagecoach, only to find that she is the wife of the commandant of the local Cavalry detachment. Things get further complicated when a girl named Dover McBride shows up. She has come to force Baker to marry her and return east, as he promised to do four years earlier','/rsKawnj4soIbfogebmip8hp5C8y.jpg','1971-11-19',108,'Released','Sooner or later, Baker will find the right girl. And when he does, he\'ll swap her for a machine gun. And do something big.','Something Big',196784,2.4187,5.4,'qNjd5ZbXuhM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6101,_binary '\0','/2Jad8hn3sUQRXx0cr4CAlOXbmOZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068025',6.6,2353,'sv','Äppelkriget','A German businessman wants to buy land in southern Sweden for a gigantic amusement park, his new project called \"Deutschneyland\" (a wordplay of Deutschland and Disneyland). Some of the locals dislike the idea, including the magically talented Lindberg family, and work to frustrate the development plans.','/fpAxwj6OANg46MgmgmBeJgZoagi.jpg','1971-12-18',103,'Released',NULL,'The Apple War',45983,1.5481,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6102,_binary '\0','/sPFpJ9vpVdFGSnINvvUFsNpjxQL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068152',6.3,3123,'en','$','A bank security expert plots with a call girl to rob the safety deposit boxes of three very different criminals from a high-tech bank in Hamburg.','/bQ4f5lmo8m0tfkQqqXbAUfFeHIJ.jpg','1971-12-15',121,'Released','The BIG bank-heist is on!','$',31644,1.7261,6.2,'0mcX0ABQ2uk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6103,_binary '\0','/t9PbbwHpArtyVHcdFitvjNahOIx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068154',7.2,19576,'it','...continuavano a chiamarlo Trinità','The two brothers Trinity and Bambino are exchanged by two federal agents and take advantage of the situation to steal a huge booty hidden in a monastery by a gang of outlaws.','/oRd5Zb2MJEvBBxvyh3gVe6d4cAl.jpg','1971-10-21',118,'Released','Trinity\'s back in the saddle again and still horsing around','Trinity Is Still My Name',11829,8.0302,7.4,'fTAxSGO8F90','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6104,_binary '\0','/vNR2HcqGrIK1BX570en1SpzOYF7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068156',7.6,10350,'en','1776','Colonial representatives gather in Philadelphia with the aim of establishing a set of governmental rules for the burgeoning United States. Benjamin Franklin and John Adams charge Thomas Jefferson with the task of writing a statement announcing the new country\'s emancipation from British rule.','/o50REDExdajGxTWczsmC3qcawGr.jpg','1972-11-09',141,'Released','The award winning musical comes to the screen!','1776',14902,4.2072,6.9,'7-u8v8nxeOI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6105,_binary '\0','/jMhH9stEPx3RbPXwUQOmGBODGDl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068161',8,5391,'ru','...А зори здесь тихие','In a remote village in Karelia, Sergeant Vaskov commands an anti-aircraft unit that protects a rail depot. While his men are transferred to the front line, he is reprimanded for their unruly behavior. He retorts that he wants replacements that aren\'t drunks or womanizers. In response, he is assigned a unit made up entirely of young women, fresh from training.','/pPmVxCf6LR50s2mSyh7jLhEKiZh.jpg','1972-11-04',188,'Released',NULL,'The Dawns Here Are Quiet',49106,1.8346,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6106,_binary '\0','/4H7QiNpacRNuSBYXR5yvGne5fEx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068168',7,8536,'en','Across 110th Street','In a daring robbery, some $300,000 is taken from the Italian mob. Several mafiosi are killed, as are two policemen. Lt. Pope and Capt. Mattelli are two New York City cops trying to break the case. Three small-time criminals are on the run with the money. Will the mafia catch them first, or will the police?','/ooxttcglcMbcCX58jzXibGEybKB.jpg','1972-12-19',102,'Released','If you steal $300,000 from the mob, It\'s not robbery. It\'s suicide.','Across 110th Street',23847,2.9153,6.671,'iOZ3MqdHzzQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6107,_binary '\0','/kfSZaOr9ApNR52gWKlpXHD0id0W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068182',7.8,69038,'de','Aguirre, der Zorn Gottes','A few decades after the destruction of the Inca Empire, a Spanish expedition led by the infamous Aguirre leaves the mountains of Peru and goes down the Amazon River in search of the lost city of El Dorado. When great difficulties arise, Aguirre’s men start to wonder whether their quest will lead them to prosperity or certain death.','/zU1FLiGJw3m3iFrakwA0SzFvIPV.jpg','1972-12-29',95,'Released','A breathtaking journey into the heart of darkness.','Aguirre, the Wrath of God',2000,5.387,7.445,'eJDuicFyJPg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6108,_binary '\0','/rqgvGaaLjl9UpDsmEVd9v0NKZAS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068189',6.5,1279,'it','Alfredo, Alfredo','Alfredo, a timid young Italian, lusts after and woos the beautiful Maria Rosa. But when he manages to marry her, he discovers life is not nearly so blissful as he expected.','/mfIKrvKxswDpfpLlJZ6D5Q7Ymbg.jpg','1972-09-22',110,'Released','Do you, Alfredo, take this woman to be your awful wedded wife?','Alfredo, Alfredo',59855,1.7289,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6109,_binary '\0','/uZfrViY3ag9Qz2dhtyoGWnIWoYd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068190',5.7,2054,'en','Alice\'s Adventures in Wonderland','An all-star cast highlights this vibrant musical adaptation of Lewis Carroll\'s immortal tale. One day, plucky young Alice follows a white rabbit down a hole and discovers a world of bizarre characters.','/GaiN6EjIlY6wiPynV5XAG1mCrX.jpg','1972-11-20',101,'Released','Made in Wonderland, the most magical musical of all!','Alice\'s Adventures in Wonderland',34461,2.6279,6.3,'bv40oNFHamE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6110,_binary '\0','/rfaffjv5oyDX08GdkkPeFKlFi2S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068200',6.8,1964,'en','The Amazing Mr. Blunden','Mysterious old solicitor Mr. Blunden visits Mrs. Allen and her young children in their squalid, tiny Camden Town flat and makes her an offer she cannot refuse. The family become the housekeepers to a derelict country mansion in the charge of the solicitors. One day the children meet the spirits of two other children who died in the mansion nearly a hundred years prior. The children prepare a magic potion that allows them to travel backwards in time to the era of the ghost children. Will the children be able to help their new friends and what will happen to them if they do?','/7ZnQAGqE26ys2QFk4SgZJ7FtuU9.jpg','1972-12-07',95,'Released','Follow him into fun, fantasy & fright -- he\'s a time-traveling ghost who\'s often out of sight.','The Amazing Mr. Blunden',53780,1.8577,6.6,'rCBsyQ62td4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6111,_binary '\0','/AiidLUGpb8lVvH3s4olLjAuwcCz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068205',7.6,10575,'fr','L\'Amour l\'après-midi','Successful Parisian lawyer Frédéric is happily married to schoolteacher Hélène. Though he daydreams of affairs with other women, he doesn\'t come close to acting on such thoughts until he runs into Chloé, a beautiful old acquaintance. Tempted by the vibrant Chloé, Frédéric is torn between impulsive lust and his love for Hélène.','/5fItTSqhGG2T9WkUNu2nSruSKsP.jpg','1972-09-01',97,'Released',NULL,'Love in the Afternoon',12116,2.8478,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6112,_binary '\0','/3wmq54GdhgimOl2GMxwo5P6RcOe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068206',6.2,1855,'it','Alla ricerca del piacere','A beautiful American woman infiltrates the home of a novelist and his wife so she can investigate the disappearance of her lover — who was her employers’ previous secretary — and soon finds herself the target of the couple\'s erotic desires and a murder plot.','/4RHmaVuiePevU1RD1mjZ5AstadD.jpg','1972-03-21',98,'Released','An explosion of sexual frenzy!','Amuck!',64528,2.3653,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6113,_binary '\0','/eBvxAUWjl7vbuQMUDflNLhMiM2G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068207',7.2,2229,'es','Ana y los lobos','The young but traveled Ana arrives in a manor in the countryside of Spain to work as nanny of three girls and finds a dysfunctional family.','/faQe1QMwhCDws4OtTEWIjGroSSL.jpg','1973-06-04',102,'Released',NULL,'Anna and the Wolves',107287,2.6333,6.803,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6114,_binary '\0','/mDqnRc7YGvureHZMnJZI3n4FK4D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068226',5.7,2150,'fr','L\'Assassinat de Trotsky','A Stalinist assassin tracks exiled revolutionary Leon Trotsky to Mexico in 1940.','/fBYtcu7BVZAVa8LtvXIUmYO6tuS.jpg','1972-03-30',103,'Released','For one moment, they hold history in their hands. With one terrible blow, they make it.','The Assassination of Trotsky',4702,2.5019,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6115,_binary '\0','/dbjBWMSMPn9u6dWobxlcf0wHUBJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068230',6.5,9369,'en','Asylum','A young psychiatrist applies for a job at a mental asylum and must pass a test by interviewing four patients. He must figure out which of the patients, is in fact, the doctor that he would be replacing if hired.','/vETvqWG44fgj4XLAU135Z2rncwT.jpg','1972-11-17',88,'Released','You have nothing to lose but your mind.','Asylum',25993,2.0729,6,'9yig3s-S-iY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6116,_binary '\0','/fdaLUHfzpsJmIsJmgnO6Qe3LVll.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068232',5.8,3263,'es','El ataque de los muertos sin ojos','Nearly a half-millenium after they were blinded and executed for committing human sacrifices, a band of Templar knights returns from the grave to terrorize a rural Portuguese village during its centennial celebration. A small group of people take refuge in a deserted cathedral and must find a way to escape from the creatures.','/ro2APVpXpSm1U6mKJ063tmbGPG1.jpg','1973-05-17',91,'Released','Scream...So They Can Find You!','Attack of the Blind Dead',12550,1.9901,5.787,'im_Aq5RMMSM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6117,_binary '\0','/61jP8dg2Ui0GFjJm3HqayUmjQUt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068240',7.1,13369,'en','Avanti!','A successful businessman travels to Italy to arrange for the return of his tycoon father\'s body, only to learn that dear old dad died with his longtime mistress.','/dxhQzsBIjWMRu7rqprX4I2WzyEo.jpg','1972-12-17',138,'Released','When someone knocks on your door and says permesso?... be careful before you say Avanti!','Avanti!',12530,4.2058,6.9,'9VlK0mLDCF4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6118,_binary '\0','/pbr9NcP5HWyEZbp67qObIEyNVQ7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068245',6.9,5219,'en','Bad Company','After Drew Dixon, an upright young man, is sent west by his religious family to avoid being drafted into the Civil War, he drifts across the land with a loose confederation of young vagrants.','/8UpEdkJmdjwQb6OJJyPRSMf80v6.jpg','1972-10-08',93,'Released','They\'re young, desperate, dangerous—a long way from home, but a short way from Hell.','Bad Company',31591,2.8561,6.4,'B6Q-MmsvVJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6119,_binary '\0','/a9slbsF2MWGGjlN04cCbGSZO0jX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068246',4.6,1218,'en','Bad Man\'s River','Robber Roy King loses his wife, Alicia, to revolutionary Montero. Despite their rivalry they collaborate in an attempt to rob the Mexican government of one million dollars.','/usfHTrvVFLzhHWsvheG6CJVhgs4.jpg','1971-10-14',92,'Released','The gang, the rebels, the army. She sold them all down','Bad Man\'s River',79683,2.7564,4.847,'OsjTssIHTN8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6120,_binary '\0','/gMin6gU1hyAgqV6J1Q86cJdmUer.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068257',8.1,4874,'hi','बावर्ची','Desperate for a cook, the disgruntled Sharmas are relieved when a multi-talented man, Raghu, takes up the job. However, when all seems well, the family jewels disappear and so does Raghu.','/34zBSGpu8MnUlIF74PcWfrZZAG1.jpg','1972-04-07',130,'Released',NULL,'Bawarchi',60389,1.4829,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6121,_binary '','/6lnvoh1CKQwO3gnZ5AXvKYuizwp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068260',5.8,2498,'en','Behind the Green Door','Gloria is kidnapped and taken to a theater where she is told that she will have \"the most exquisite moment of her life.\" She shares many sexual and intimate experiences on a stage in front of a small masked audience that grows increasingly aroused as the performance progresses.','/dmulHU3k6hIGF0CkmntpJ8LJRyB.jpg','1972-12-17',72,'Released','The Mitchell Brothers Present the all American Girl','Behind the Green Door',24992,0,6,'Nu_I8ynukwg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6122,_binary '\0','/d1tL5FbQq7QfEaIYS2NqGa9Dsnx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068264',5.3,3997,'en','Ben','A lonely boy becomes good friends with Ben, a rat. This rat is also the leader of a pack of vicious killer rats, killing lots of people.','/LvTapjbjdg9bGzt79hZAp2idcn.jpg','1972-06-23',94,'Released','Where \'WILLARD\' ended... Ben begins. And this time, he\'s not alone!','Ben',42476,2.3854,6.1,'uxv0ZNXvmqk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6123,_binary '\0','/a6bimMtvcFqsOzgELjbgiywrmNx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068271',4.1,2888,'en','Beware! The Blob','A technician brings a frozen specimen of the original Blob back from the North Pole. When his wife accidentally defrosts the it, it terrorizes the populace-- the local hippies, cops, drunks and bowlers must all face the Blob!','/sqFXrV2zFiIedby3wWz1F7I0WFT.jpg','1972-06-21',87,'Released','It\'s loose again eating everyone!','Beware! The Blob',40983,1.9463,4.6,'W6TdzeCerL4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6124,_binary '\0','/xxYEkwlzzwZq6jvjAPfliS7AdIo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068273',5.8,3457,'en','The Big Bird Cage','Women rebel against slave labor in a filthy jungle prison where they feed sugar cane to a mechanical maw.','/1lO5o4si8JPPFi7XAGlFH5az4Yp.jpg','1972-07-01',96,'Released','Women so hot with desire they melt the chains that enslave them!','The Big Bird Cage',22910,3.0775,5.6,'F10ZbOa-B0k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6125,_binary '\0','/kyVtVCs493JAL3lxfSC8UrGbrwS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068278',7.5,12606,'de','Die bitteren Tränen der Petra von Kant','Petra von Kant is a successful fashion designer -- arrogant, caustic, and self-satisfied. She mistreats Marlene (her secretary, maid, and co-designer). Enter Karin, a 23-year-old beauty who wants to be a model. Petra falls in love with Karin and invites her to move in.','/bkxrRfXaoTvZObG1Gd91x2mnmFX.jpg','1972-10-05',124,'Released','Sex is the ultimate weapon.','The Bitter Tears of Petra von Kant',10310,2.9157,7.4,'eq0w_XsEAAU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6126,_binary '\0','/fJHlbR9UwhgURxs80zqFRnuXsgH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068282',5.6,4237,'en','Black Mama, White Mama','When two troublemaking female prisoners (one a revolutionary, the other a former harem-girl) can\'t seem to get along, they are chained together and extradited for safekeeping. The women, still chained together, stumble, stab, and cat-fight their way across the wilderness, igniting a bloody shootout between gangsters and a group of revolutionaries.','/pwTnHe9WBBWvaivTNeuuy1tUzLh.jpg','1973-01-19',87,'Released','Chicks in Chains - where they come from this is... Fun!','Black Mama, White Mama',28797,2.6384,5.4,'4RdpzwacITk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6127,_binary '\0','/yd2v918VZTg0sDmONrIGb3yQtwG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068284',5.8,8940,'en','Blacula','An 18th century African prince is turned into a vampire while visiting Transylvania. Two centuries later, he rises from his coffin attacking various residents of Los Angeles and meets Tina, a woman who he believes is the reincarnation of his deceased wife.','/yLqtFeZfRPoUUzzro3ogCdobB6q.jpg','1972-08-25',93,'Released','BLOODSUCKER! Deadlier than Dracula!','Blacula',30566,2.4739,5.5,'V8Sfrhj5IP4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6128,_binary '\0','/ssc7avppPJuW8zMUJI06fkCH2YH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068285',6.2,1380,'en','Bless This House','The legendary Sid James stars as the head of a chaotic household in this movie spin-off from the hit ITV sitcom. Sid Abbott and his best mate Trevor (Peter Butterworth) enjoy home-brewing. Plans to turn their hobby into a profitable, if illicit, sideline come unstuck when a Customs and Excise officer (Terry Scott) moves in next door! What’s more, Sid’s outspoken and madcap family hinder neighbourly relations even further.','/3WN3FVaoqAREZm6FbUMMttI8BA.jpg','1972-09-08',87,'Released',NULL,'Bless This House',17120,1.5101,6.4,'5O2HwlgscU0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6129,_binary '\0','/jrHEAGrVdBucR76OUoTZlg3orGb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068286',6.7,1722,'en','Bless the Beasts & Children','A group of social misfits at a summer camp for boys run away to save penned-in buffaloes from a rifle club\'s slaughter.','/g8e7NgKkaidTbeLsJcpOFzL0X7p.jpg','1971-07-30',102,'Released','Only one animal kills just for the sport of it... Guess which...','Bless the Beasts & Children',94225,2.3273,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6130,_binary '\0','/700jlsV99duRRKqHyVxu7aNcq46.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068290',5.6,4656,'en','Blood from the Mummy\'s Tomb','Two Egyptologists, Professor Fuchs and Corbeck, are instrumental in unleashing unmitigated horror by bringing back to England the mummified body of Tara, the Egyptian Queen of Darkness. Fuchs’s daughter becomes involved in a series of macabre and terrifying incidents, powerless against the forces of darkness, directed by Corbeck, that are taking possession of her body and soul to fulfill the ancient prophesy that Queen Tara will be resurrected to continue her reign of unspeakable evil.','/x2CfNW6RMpUcNMWBMhiZyVE9KLw.jpg','1971-10-14',94,'Released','A severed hand beckons from an open grave!','Blood from the Mummy\'s Tomb',39263,4.1938,5.55,'2qxAGO-LzV0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6131,_binary '\0','/HiidlKN4AOLnQBJK3TLjASr6Uv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068294',5.6,1886,'en','Bluebeard','Baron von Sepper is an Austrian aristocrat noted for his blue-toned beard, and his appetite for beautiful wives. His latest spouse, an American beauty named Anne, discovers a vault in his castle that\'s filled with the frozen bodies of several beautiful women.','/fuVlMgyg4YnQQCxQ3OFJikvlXmX.jpg','1972-09-01',125,'Released','He had a WAY with the world\'s most beautiful, most seductive, most glamorous women ...he did AWAY with them.','Bluebeard',27116,2.5349,5.4,'-CuEAp1VHSY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6132,_binary '\0','/ovsvEYCIH4HUnSdLCKbfw00VUFh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068305',6.7,1388,'hi','बॉम्बे टू गोआ','Mala, an aspiring Bollywood actress, witnesses a murder and boards a Goa-bound bus to escape the killer. On the journey, she meets exciting people from different cultures and a young man who will not leave her side.','/vbwZBOBVYrnIlTZgmNmYSCrIR2c.jpg','1972-03-03',137,'Released',NULL,'Bombay to Goa',64864,1.0355,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6133,_binary '\0','/uo9MRGzpqV4mqOTTalcLoOSet4m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068306',6.7,1629,'en','Bone','When a criminal breaks into the Beverly Hills home of a wealthy couple experiencing marital problems, he unwillingly provides the spouses with an unlikely resolution to their conflicts as well as a solution to his own secret.','/ik2QO1CLffGOO8khqTfbHMKlTIa.jpg','1972-07-01',95,'Released','Love Bone Before He Loves You.','Bone',27012,1.1824,6.2,'1dQpplqKY9A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6134,_binary '\0','/qqzuj6uWDNCtuRZSeNLji9LqQwZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068309',6,12806,'en','Boxcar Bertha','\"Boxcar\" Bertha Thompson, a transient woman in Arkansas during the violence-filled Depression of the early \'30s, meets up with rabble-rousing union man \"Big\" Bill Shelly and the two team up to fight the corrupt railroad establishment.','/gF5VslUB2xpWbboc735VVnO7DXh.jpg','1972-06-14',89,'Released','Life made her an outcast. Love made her an outlaw.','Boxcar Bertha',22784,3.0759,5.762,'ZZl1WHkVlec','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6135,_binary '\0','/zDn3cbldAhAldpPSkJkUwR9sHBq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068310',7,1798,'zh','馬永貞','Leaving the poverty of his life in Shantung to seek fortune in Shanghai, The Boxer is instead drawn into a world of corruption, gang warfare and evil... Where his only protection is his famed fighting technique.','/2gXphwegja8ccflsDaFqcf6g587.jpg','1972-02-11',134,'Released',NULL,'The Boxer from Shantung',50569,2.4522,6.926,'xEuBplr6JIA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6136,_binary '\0','/nj6IiU6FRr0emfosYDP8ohVMCcL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068315',7.5,9674,'en','Brian\'s Song','Based on the real-life relationship between teammates Brian Piccolo and Gale Sayers and the bond established when Piccolo discovers that he is dying.','/yjmT2unPtvahuuqowdg9YNQnok5.jpg','1971-11-30',73,'Released',NULL,'Brian\'s Song',18047,2.3644,7.3,'rkSGeDlzYVU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6137,_binary '\0','/4gzZmRCppUx0aXXqwfUztKukSzS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068323',6.6,3195,'en','Buck and the Preacher','A wagon master and a con-man preacher help freed slaves dogged by cheap-labor agents out West.','/wOC45WEW18IjdXGYohqTlEP2U1j.jpg','1972-03-17',102,'Released','The fight was against the raiders... but the feud was between themselves!','Buck and the Preacher',26928,3.1042,6.3,'E4eMJoYA1oA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6138,_binary '\0','/g8ILtBUKi9BphXGnVRsUtviAaAp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068326',7.2,6538,'en','Butterflies Are Free','Striving to be independent, the blind but determined Don Baker moves away from his overprotective mother. After settling into his new San Francisco digs, Don meets kooky neighbor Jill Tanner. Don\'s quick wit and good looks disarm the free-spirited Jill, and before long they\'re more than just friends. Will Mrs. Baker\'s incessant meddling destroy Don and Jill\'s budding relationship?','/qCBy94qp7D6tGspX3M0ZbkGPQ1g.jpg','1972-07-06',109,'Released','I Could Love You If You\'d Let Me','Butterflies Are Free',55106,2.1195,6.8,'w_Kfq1tlRE8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6139,_binary '\0','/yInvVRrCmEypIt5hm0WvXkjxsQX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068327',7.8,64375,'en','Cabaret','Inside the Kit Kat Club of 1931 Berlin, starry-eyed singer Sally Bowles and an impish emcee sound the clarion call to decadent fun, while outside a certain political party grows into a brutal force.','/fMhOeJ2TvuY46iYGmsowhgRXfnr.jpg','1972-02-13',124,'Released','Life is a Cabaret.','Cabaret',10784,4.7333,7.4,'6DZ2wtichOM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6140,_binary '\0','/rd6IEzxIx3I066DeXPg4K861f4D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068334',7,13651,'en','The Candidate','Bill McKay is a candidate for the U.S. Senate from California. He has no hope of winning, so he is willing to tweak the establishment.','/6zcDSOe1akUXsc2Q1APfchKcVaI.jpg','1972-06-29',110,'Released','Bill McKay has a lot going for him...but nothing compared to what\'s coming.','The Candidate',21711,3.0296,6.52,'9RTIQWXzexU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6141,_binary '\0','/y3V9gVSGnrl3M0fAwJsJKbO6knA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068337',6.2,1953,'en','The Carey Treatment','A doctor uncovers a hotbed of corruption when he tries to clear a colleague of a murder charge.','/4SWxSm9jW14J4GMdOOsuEj617P.jpg','1972-03-29',101,'Released','You\'ve never seen a doctor like Dr. Carey. He has a unique way of operating. It\'s called... The Carey Treatment.','The Carey Treatment',72449,1.6251,6,'3SO2SRPvxtk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6142,_binary '\0','/cCjhGxjdaMW0XdIUXumyHkL7i4L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068339',6.2,3682,'en','Carry On Matron','A gang of thieves plan to make their fortune by stealing a shipment of contraceptive pills from Finisham maternity hospital. They assume disguises and infiltrate the hospital, but everything doesn\'t go according to plan. The hypochondriac consultant Sir Bernard Cutting, Matron and the doctors and nurses at Finisham have a habit of getting in the way.','/6Nuin5NRIPYgnJkfd23XGZmraGj.jpg','1972-05-05',87,'Released','The Carry On team serve up another \'prescription\' of hilarious comedy!!!','Carry On Matron',24571,2.1216,6.1,'vynub4ktptA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6143,_binary '\0','/bdevgK9EAitedDkROxhREXbuW4y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068341',6.4,5149,'en','The Valachi Papers','When Joe Valachi has a price put on his head by Don Vito Genovese, he must take desperate steps to protect himself while in prison. An unsuccessful attempt to slit his throat puts him over the edge to break the sacred code of silence.','/6c5Nz4FX2VNdiDsj8iip0aNGW6I.jpg','1972-01-06',125,'Released','The Valachi Papers. Fact not Fiction.','The Valachi Papers',33357,3.1989,6.496,'6fSMaU24zto','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6144,_binary '\0','/wl6kXCMdmFIHYyzTgAoB8LsaduB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068346',7.6,2913,'it','Il caso Mattei','Enrico Mattei helped change Italy’s future, first as freedom-fighter against the Nazis, then as an investor in methane gas through a public company, A.G.I.P., and ultimately as the head of ENI, a state body formed for the development of oil resources. On October 27, 1962, he died when his private airplane crashed during a flight to Milan. Officially, it is declared an accident, but many journalists explore other plausible reasons for Mattei\'s untimely death.','/p4EHDfdbgjNXmQb7WB9fYmom0s1.jpg','1972-01-26',116,'Released','On October 27, 1962, a plane crashed in Bascape, Italy, sparking an international intrigue...sabotage...disappearances and murders! These events are all the more bizarre because they are TRUE. The central figure was Enrico Mattei.','The Mattei Affair',62382,2.22,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6145,_binary '\0','/azrtZLeZCVmG0NPESATV7YOvGCF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068347',6.6,3442,'fr','Le Casse','In Athens a collection of emeralds is successfully stolen by a team of robbers, led by safe-cracker Azad. Things go smoothly until they miss the ship by which they planned their escape; a police chief pursues Azad while he waits for the next ship to set off.','/qt3JVm7hhwESFFxuO5BlN3A6TfI.jpg','1971-10-27',120,'Released','Catch the burglars!','The Burglars',34184,3.2028,6.905,'4xebrhLaH7k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6146,_binary '\0','/8Klg7fisTMkgYT2QJE9abFLgD3P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068348',7.5,2869,'es','El castillo de la pureza','A disciplined and sexually driven man forces his family to stay isolated in their home in order to protect them from the “evil nature” of human beings.','/lkJX8gEpbME4a5iDUlr8xYNqLVu.jpg','1973-05-10',110,'Released',NULL,'Castle of Purity',47582,1.9593,7.368,'rCmkUk_MQYc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6147,_binary '\0','/z6NI6n5MvQZMZJbXKLiyFl1yDeA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068361',7.7,50977,'fr','Le Charme discret de la bourgeoisie','In Luis Buñuel’s deliciously satiric masterpiece, an upper-class sextet sits down to dinner but never eats, their attempts continually thwarted by a vaudevillian mixture of events both actual and imagined.','/zN4ILX2x64PvT2jIOAHXxCOi5WA.jpg','1972-09-15',101,'Released',NULL,'The Discreet Charm of the Bourgeoisie',4593,5.4191,7.5,'OloPNPpealQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6148,_binary '\0','/kzt70vMxF4i4vQaxNUHqb8AOzRL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068364',5.3,1853,'en','The Cheerleaders','A group of cheerleaders from the local high school decide to show their school spirit for their football team by sleeping with the opponents the night before the game so that they can be so worn out the opposition won\'t be able to play.','/xPF1il9rtvfRc39lmc5H8D62XcL.jpg','1973-03-01',83,'Released','Come and huddle with the cheerleaders.','The Cheerleaders',54396,2.9824,6,'MD2doJqYJlI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6149,_binary '\0','/irzd4KOTuraPWJl1bldCFJpJFYX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068367',6.4,3436,'it','Chi l\'ha vista morire?','Between a four-year gap in the murder of a young girl, the daughter of a well-known sculptor is discovered dead, and her parents conduct an investigation, only to discover they are in over their heads as the body-count keeps rising.','/5AxV8OE0aa8LE0if2pCoMLJ9RCU.jpg','1972-05-12',94,'Released','And who will survive to tell the tale?','Who Saw Her Die?',69576,2.3864,6.3,'nJQy2G3M9MU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6150,_binary '\0','/nELEBktXi7wpAi1dS2P2kXFHDtq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068369',6.2,1958,'en','Child\'s Play','At an exclusive boys\' school, a new gym teacher is drawn into a feud between two older instructors, and he discovers that everything at the school is not quite as staid, tranquil and harmless as it seems.','/sOfwI5dzqTwFWQh40C86fjQz07M.jpg','1972-12-12',100,'Released','You only lose once.','Child\'s Play',82465,1.5624,6.1,'e9gMzjZVrWc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6151,_binary '\0','/A3ZszCrmyJraa6h4HCgMSzg3nK8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068370',5.2,5537,'en','Children Shouldn\'t Play with Dead Things','Six actors go to a graveyard on a remote island to act out a necromantic ritual. The ceremony works, and soon the dead are walking about and chowing down on human flesh.','/bLWtAzj3zlqVBjv07v9KcGOLpiv.jpg','1972-06-09',86,'Released','You’re invited to Orville’s coming out party! It’ll be a scream…Yours!','Children Shouldn\'t Play with Dead Things',20842,1.7901,5.336,'AKI7Uzj4FD0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6152,_binary '\0','/i7Vp666mpD6xEbLxeT45eCr1ad3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068371',5.6,6729,'ja','地球攻撃命令 ゴジラ対ガイガン','Manga artist Gengo Odaka lands a job with the World Children\'s Land amusement park only to become suspicious of the organization when a garbled message is discovered on tapes. As Gengo and his team investigate, Godzilla and Anguirus quickly decipher the message and begin their own plan of action.','/pNQro37cFrg4Lfz5DUbRFZlMG3y.jpg','1972-03-12',89,'Released','Defeat the evil space monsters! You can protect the Earth, Godzilla!','Godzilla vs. Gigan',19336,2.897,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6153,_binary '\0','/hb9vtVVs4X8vlvEfkIG2utiOKC0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068379',5.6,1283,'en','Ciao! Manhattan','Fiction and documentary mingle in a freewheeling portrait of Susan Superstar, a New York celebrity on a drug-fueled downward slide that mirrors Edie Sedgwick’s own self-destructive spiral.','/vwqnH6omAWc7EVBSGSikrCddEzM.jpg','1973-04-19',84,'Released','Speed. Madness. Flying Saucers.','Ciao! Manhattan',42479,1.019,5.5,'Lo5gIExSnos','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6154,_binary '\0','/X6N9ZxQOxkmhyaFPnT1R1XTwxi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068384',6.5,2548,'en','Cisco Pike','A down on his luck former drug dealer is forced by a corrupt LAPD policeman to sell 100 kilos of confiscated marijuana in one weekend.','/qaNHDgvSSAlkhpZOX3mHX5LD8Db.jpg','1972-01-14',95,'Released','CISCO PIKE is a man of the West... West L.A.!','Cisco Pike',55044,1.8934,5.6,'Lnjcv6JbOlg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6155,_binary '\0','/wwsn6KT2GAYEr9pbxxJtQ3CcdLQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068390',6.6,1264,'en','A Cold Night\'s Death','Two scientists suspect that there is someone other than their research primates inhabiting their polar station.','/7akJh2BAAdInXc4tGjZO8CXw5t1.jpg','1973-01-30',74,'Released','A chilling picture. An icy climax.','A Cold Night\'s Death',100788,1.9166,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6156,_binary '\0','/ra7aOJIX06Ap6cs05RcpzjjKNMk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068394',6,1717,'it','Il coltello di ghiaccio','A mute woman, traumatized by her parents\' death, faces new horrors when her cousin is murdered by a suspected killer. As danger looms, the truth proves far more complex.','/unDLopcnKJmCC3bzemgrAelGaIF.jpg','1972-08-24',91,'Released',NULL,'Knife of Ice',28488,1.8515,6.1,'b1wr297ppbY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6157,_binary '\0','/3yazPBvuE1u07ljHFTPRaK2AHOt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068408',6.1,40929,'en','Conquest of the Planet of the Apes','In a futuristic world that has embraced ape slavery, a chimpanzee named Caesar resurfaces after almost twenty years of hiding from the authorities, and prepares for a revolt against humanity.','/tzKZRY2opw5MruSkevffgT5ocun.jpg','1972-06-29',88,'Released','All new! The revolt of the apes. The most awesome spectacle in the annals of science fiction!','Conquest of the Planet of the Apes',1688,7.8785,6.2,'CWIbQqbivVc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6158,_binary '\0','/o21NPXJBZr47k2QxLuXfIIJAJhu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068414',4,1787,'en','The Corpse Grinders','When the Lotus Cat Food Company finds itself in financial trouble, the owners decide to find a new, cheap source of meat – the local graveyard. However, soon cats develop a taste for human flesh, and tabbies are tearing out throats all over town.','/fwfTBden2KGCPeHH9V2FcVldHAV.jpg','1971-05-19',72,'Released','They Went in People and Came Out Hamburger!','The Corpse Grinders',27832,1.1528,4.1,'K3_9kJcundg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6159,_binary '\0','/3C4lMFB1yLCAZwGYo83jwfn8l80.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068415',5.7,1889,'it','La morte negli occhi del gatto','In a small Scottish village, horribly murdered bodies keep turning up. Suspicion falls upon the residents of a nearby castle that is haunted by a curse involving a killer cat.','/v6y5ajDJlZj41DcEpMZmjuMZSUG.jpg','1973-04-12',95,'Released','Death means NOTHING to a beast with nine lives!','Seven Deaths in the Cat\'s Eye',98027,2.1334,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6160,_binary '\0','/5J2ijG7v68e1BfoXG5JOQ9dQPgi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068416',6.9,6619,'it','Cosa avete fatto a Solange?','After several Catholic school pupils are murdered, a teacher who is having an affair with one of his students becomes a suspect. When other gruesome murders start occurring shortly thereafter, the teacher suspects that he may be the cause of them.','/eMwcPwaqPckzR0c312v0eCyfQ5U.jpg','1972-03-23',107,'Released',NULL,'What Have You Done to Solange?',6591,2.4894,6.656,'-b2t_HjmQeo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6161,_binary '\0','/pzWkw7Acgn7OyAwMHTlrB6PGnNa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068421',7.4,17639,'en','The Cowboys','When his cattlemen abandon him for the gold fields, rancher Wil Andersen is forced to take on a collection of young boys as his cowboys in order to get his herd to market in time to avoid financial disaster. The boys learn to do a man\'s job under Andersen\'s tutelage, however, neither he nor the boys know that a gang of cattle thieves is stalking them.','/srdRiGV9tYFzWd2C4IjPJNtLrmr.jpg','1972-01-13',134,'Released','All they wanted was their chance to be men... and he gave it to them.','The Cowboys',15573,4.2548,7.1,'emjnjPfmoPI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6162,_binary '\0','/fWsYSt83EK8YB3o1OSBS9t8A6tF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068424',6.1,5055,'en','The Creeping Flesh','A Victorian scientist returns to London with his paleontological bag-of-bones discovery from Papua New Guinea. Unfortunately, when exposed to water, flesh returns to the bones, unleashing a malevolent entity on the scientist\'s family and friends.','/tC6nxcNqXOcp10JbFI2cGZkXhjL.jpg','1973-02-12',92,'Released','A terrifying journey through the nightmare worlds of evil, insanity, and terrible revenge.','The Creeping Flesh',42469,2.3621,5.872,'TZPuNi9dISQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6163,_binary '\0','/dUltfurPdy7BMmPTxq2E9Bt2MDE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068428',6,1346,'en','The Cross and the Switchblade','David Wilkerson\'s first five years in New York City, where he ministered to