 says claims seven lives every hundred years. When a mysterious woman in a red cloak starts targeting their circle of friends, the sisters begin to suspect there might be some truth to the legend.','/78LsL4kCR08PzBxRTJzFlKw4M31.jpg','1972-08-18',100,'Released','The Corpse That Didn\'t Want to Die!','The Red Queen Kills Seven Times',40130,2.3454,6.8,'zzKLLpbQ6NM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6168,_binary '\0','/tyKCGp87NYJPTTcbrjsJvffxt47.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068448',4.5,1449,'en','Daughters of Satan','A man buys a painting depicting witches being burned at the stake, one of whom bears an uncanny resemblance to his wife.','/d8u8NfIRnVR2PvLSC3wIaUk3FlV.jpg','1972-11-17',90,'Released','A secret cult of lust-craved witches torturing with fire and desire!','Daughters of Satan',46439,1.8268,4.4,'41AhFutYYQQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6169,_binary '\0','/qYJsEtC5WD7fcGiutXMwBjhwnpf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068457',6.6,6980,'en','Dead of Night','A young soldier who was thought to be killed in Vietnam returns home and exhibits disturbing behavior, much to the confusion of his family.','/zunyiTXzsDI4K2SUbjQ0b6UAEsE.jpg','1974-08-29',88,'Released','The dead of night changed the lives of many... and ended the lives of some.','Dead of Night',38996,2.0451,6.3,'ylfLQym9bEs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6170,_binary '\0','/crJ4ErlVMj3qRKU0vhTlc8UZZOD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068458',5.9,6072,'en','Death Line','When a government official disappears in the London tunnels, after several reports of missing people in the same location, Scotland Yard start to take the matter seriously, along with a couple who stumble into a victim by accident.','/kXrFXtJRQ2qR6Z45fozdj8tKeTu.jpg','1972-10-13',87,'Released','A new line in terror.','Death Line',3581,3.2827,5.8,'0CqHWHkRvI0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6171,_binary '','/oQBblybDSy3wAnTPmmaj2HK9R7H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068468',5,7330,'en','Deep Throat','Linda\'s frustration with her inability to achieve orgasm causes a friend to recommend that she see a sex therapist about her problem. During the exam the therapist discovers that Linda\'s clitoris is located in her throat and recommends deep throating as a treatment to her ailment. Linda then goes on to experiment with this new technique as she searches for a husband.','/udJPmmOP7rbS69MIDlkR5LPVrVa.jpg','1972-06-12',61,'Released','How far does a girl have to go to untangle her tingle?','Deep Throat',5853,0,5.4,'Pjk0jWuzI2E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6172,_binary '\0','/rL7Zqmnu42uEdm1hg1JKPTJ2dxG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068471',5.4,1449,'it','Delirio caldo','A respected doctor becomes the prime suspect in a series of gruesome murders.','/js0GYkyqR0RyIbqMMeAZmUtBiWS.jpg','1972-07-05',102,'Released','More perverted than FRENZY... Bloodier than PSYCHO... More sadistic than BLUEBEARD!','Delirium',40345,1.5377,4.8,'4zzrsjcfdlk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6173,_binary '\0','/aaqbyTRo1bZB34ZdjeWyqnL0qz0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068473',7.6,130159,'en','Deliverance','Intent on seeing the Cahulawassee River before it\'s turned into one huge lake, outdoor fanatic Lewis Medlock takes his friends on a river-rafting trip they\'ll never forget into the dangerous American back-country.','/2TrAzNJlHyNYYSkQf6asg3rs2Xr.jpg','1972-08-18',109,'Released','What did happen on the Cahulawassee River?','Deliverance',10669,6.5562,7.317,'iuOUF1-4P3c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6174,_binary '\0','/jpAhwtSLEWvLLoe5wnmNjEe0OAc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068491',5.9,1379,'en','The Doberman Gang','After a failed bank robbery, an ex-con, an ex-waitress and a few of their friends train a pack of doberman dogs to rob a bank for them.','/CFUqGWdZIjqSMHpLf0QLUvS3bv.jpg','1972-05-26',87,'Released','Trained to commit the most incredible caper ever conceived.','The Doberman Gang',32061,1.552,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6175,_binary '\0','/1Dluy0JvMPAwoKO07luhFlZM2gJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068498',5.5,1424,'en','Doomwatch','The waters surrounding an island become contaminated by chemical dumping, and people who eat fish caught in those waters become deformed and violent.','/vS8PuC2gkmDGAjsTHOOy2xQYdJY.jpg','1972-03-01',92,'Released','An ecological nightmare gone berserk!','Doomwatch',112687,1.377,6.1,'5DdR--F21Vk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6176,_binary '\0','/bz8ZdPk44rbOzke6YZ0iRvTk6Lr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068502',6.6,4630,'en','Dr. Jekyll & Sister Hyde','In foggy London Dr Jekyll experiments on newly deceased women determined to discover an elixir for immortal life. Success enables his spectacular transformation into the beautiful but psychotic Sister Hyde who stalks the dark alleys of Whitechapel for young, innocent, female victims, ensuring continuation of the bloodstained research. With each transformation Sister Hyde becomes the more dominant personality, determined to eventually suppress the frail, ineffectual Dr Jekyll forever.','/mm3cm6hLHYwuB5bRim1PIM6guvN.jpg','1971-11-07',97,'Released','PARENTS: Be sure your children are sufficiently mature to witness the intimate details of this frank and revealing film.','Dr. Jekyll & Sister Hyde',30855,2.1951,6.2,'ylWRtdfcMLk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6177,_binary '\0','/qQcYMvEv2AqR1olC5ULUnv3onqA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068503',6.3,7987,'en','Dr. Phibes Rises Again','The eminent Dr. Phibes awakens from a decade of suspended animation and heads to Egypt with the corpse of his dead wife, which he intends to resurrect by murdering people in strange and heinous ways.','/g0YtuuuMpBHN11qDhQvQnmVGESy.jpg','1972-07-01',89,'Released','Flesh crawls! Blood curdles! Phibes lives!','Dr. Phibes Rises Again',18250,2.5714,6.3,'GagBlvJNSQo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6178,_binary '\0','/4KfWH20SsOa0jkCYRzrQWdZoTtf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068504',5.1,1559,'es','La mansión de la locura','The inmates of an insane asylum take over the institution, imprison the doctors and staff, and then put into play their own ideas of how the place should be run.','/35k5WIt4VemnQISnxOhsGfZ6DO7.jpg','1973-08-10',99,'Released','The Newest Edgar Allan Poe Horror Thriller!','The Mansion of Madness',95551,1.7887,4.833,'TbNrjg6MFGE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6179,_binary '\0','/cQwKvNR71oMk11ri17CYNXxpfGc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068505',5.9,8478,'en','Dracula A.D. 1972','Set in London in the early 1970\'s, supposedly for teen thrills, Johnny organises a black magic ceremony in a desolate churchyard. The culmination of the ritual, however, is the rejuvenation of Dracula from shrivelled remains. Johnny, Dracula\' s disciple, lures victims to the deserted graveyard for his master\'s pleasure and one of the victims delivered is Jessica Van Helsing. Descended from the Van Helsing line of vampire hunters her grandfather, equipped with all the devices to snare and destroy the Count, confronts his arch enemy in the age-old battle between good and evil.','/rUgVTCBLnXngVlpOaVWZupxwmHZ.jpg','1972-06-26',96,'Released','The Count is back, with an eye for London\'s hotpants . . . and a taste for everything','Dracula A.D. 1972',33020,4.3803,6,'KhBfI8_xPAk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6180,_binary '\0','/dlj1G2dkDX4v8Du3iXxHgQMw8fi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068509',5.6,1941,'en','Drive, He Said','Hector is a star basketball player for the College basketball team he plays for, the Leopards. His girlfriend, Olive, doesn\'t know whether to stay with him or leave him. And his friend, Gabriel, who may have dropped out from school and become a protestor, wants desperately not to get drafted for Vietnam.','/eltTSrLJEWGDSHHzCzYQ0wiWZ7D.jpg','1971-06-13',95,'Released','Don\'t Lie, Don\'t Cheat, And Don\'t Be Afraid!','Drive, He Said',57215,1.4205,5.6,'jAnVRhS0gWs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6181,_binary '\0','/ky6bvpEtk1cpmIDiV2hXsCXwiNs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068519',8.3,14500,'ru','Джентльмены удачи','Kindergarten teacher Evgeniy Ivanovich Troshkin is reluctantly sent undercover to take the place of an imprisoned thief who stole Alexander the Great\'s helmet. Evgeniy uses his striking resemblance to the thief to infiltrate his gang and learn the location of the stolen artifact. He finds the gangsters are unexpectedly similar to his students- they also need love and care.','/owZ2KQ2x99XqMprSvFNeTdmCBk8.jpg','1971-12-13',88,'Released','An Inharmonious Comedy','Gentlemen of Fortune',20871,2.456,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6182,_binary '\0','/bOLpu8UkH17QQGShjziWYKmOUxv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068524',6.5,3661,'it','E poi lo chiamarono il magnifico','By his dying father\'s last wish Joe is sent to the Wild West to become a real guy. The dreamy young man despises guns and fights likes poems and prefers bicycles to horses. Now his three teachers footpads all of them shall teach him otherwise. This doesn\'t work until Joe has to defend himself against gunman Morton who\'s jealous of Joe\'s love to rancher Ohlsen\'s beautiful daughter.','/rFwKo4O14PydJjyUYbR9Y7c7R1O.jpg','1972-09-28',115,'Released',NULL,'Man of the East',54164,2.5837,6.6,'T5IyJTGyBjk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6183,_binary '\0','/oKBF72vHcsKDqGuC8rNyv5EVdCE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068528',7.4,2949,'en','The Effect of Gamma Rays on Man-in-the-Moon Marigolds','Middle-aged widow Beatrice Hunsdorfer and her daughters Ruth and Matilda are struggling to survive in a society they barely understand. Beatrice dreams of opening an elegant tea room but does not have the wherewithal to achieve her lofty goal. Epileptic Ruth is a rebellious adolescent, while shy but highly intelligent and idealistic Matilda seeks solace in her pets and school projects, including one designed to show how small amounts of radium affect marigolds.','/hFGpoV5hDewXyBvjd44ajO58Sxw.jpg','1972-12-20',100,'Released','Life\'s been a real bitch to Beatrice Hunsdorfer. And vice versa.','The Effect of Gamma Rays on Man-in-the-Moon Marigolds',88875,2.9714,7.3,'9U7z35zbxPk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6184,_binary '\0','/nGayQ5MnzzkftZhCmB0hoIDzebs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068537',7.5,2043,'en','Elvis on Tour','This documentary captures Elvis Presley on his 1972 American tour and includes rehearsals, interviews, archival television appearances and backstage moments. With Elvis at his most flamboyant, the film features well-known hits and cover songs showcasing his country, gospel and rhythm-and-blues influences.','/hXxKJuQnkwFtWvOX161ppbaiaC2.jpg','1972-11-01',93,'Released','MGM presents a very different motion picture that captures all the excitement of ELVIS LIVE!','Elvis on Tour',42482,1.4146,7.443,'558MrchF838','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6185,_binary '\0','/fxzTrO9Eq6uUvltMvNIHCd5kutK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068539',5.7,2005,'it','Si può fare… amigo','An outspoken boy and a gunfighter-pimp save a drifter\'s life from hanging. The boy\'s uncle dies, leaving a house and some dry, useless land to the boy. The dying uncle has obtained the drifter\'s promise to help the boy get what is his. Meanwhile the gunfighter has decided that the drifter should marry his daughter after being with her previously. The two get into a series of brawls and shoot-outs until they arrive in the town and find the boy\'s inheritance -which turns out not to be as useless as it first appears.','/h28MHKOKoxbJRcZM5bLlwuIqQo5.jpg','1972-03-31',109,'Released','Trinity\'s pal is back ... slam bang action !','It Can Be Done Amigo',46567,3.3668,5.8,'849CleMghS0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6186,_binary '\0','/yJsgsM2f6HmfR9I1vTpqjmgD836.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068555',6.7,44249,'en','Everything You Always Wanted to Know About Sex *But Were Afraid to Ask','A collection of seven vignettes, which each address a question concerning human sexuality. From aphrodisiacs to sexual perversion to the mystery of the male orgasm, characters like a court jester, a doctor, a queen and a journalist adventure through lab experiments and game shows, all seeking answers to common questions that many would never ask.','/A1ZNhNd8FV8kCW39OeDelokT0tv.jpg','1972-08-06',88,'Released','You haven\'t seen anything until you\'ve seen everything*','Everything You Always Wanted to Know About Sex *But Were Afraid to Ask',11624,6.0769,6.517,'uinn26P2c6M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6187,_binary '\0','/lmsUnrLdFqCWs3flUEQl73UWSev.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068569',7.5,2393,'en','Family Life','A young woman, Janice, is living with her restrictive and conservative parents, who lead a dull working-class life and consider their daughter to be “misbehaving” whenever she’s trying to find her own way in life.','/v98xRe6kJu6NEHwktzTZIqDZe8t.jpg','1971-11-17',108,'Released','Nothing like it ever, ever before!','Family Life',56942,1.4577,7.235,'h_FEjE5ec1E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6188,_binary '\0','/fHKyWtxGIDQ21JcL7Le6rmX36Q1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068575',7.2,11908,'en','Fat City','The story of two men, a veteran boxer who is down and out, and a young man who is just starting his life and boxing career. Their fighting careers cross paths as their lives and fortunes head in opposite directions.','/7ag7BOMnAuDKwNyI0wc8jTeimRb.jpg','1972-07-26',97,'Released','Life is what happens in between rounds.','Fat City',16993,2.935,7.064,'sVXhoiS0BPA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6189,_binary '\0','/vPaUA0y6wOBLc1v3aYF3Zemvran.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068576',6.3,2652,'en','Fear Is the Key','A deep-sea salvage expert enacts an elaborate plan to infiltrate and take revenge on a criminal organization that dealt him a foul misdeed.','/exEVWVE4WP6WktGGJFq2waVoKip.jpg','1972-12-26',103,'Released','In the right hands, fear is the deadliest weapon of all.','Fear Is the Key',25266,2.6677,5.9,'A8ZAEbEFM6E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6190,_binary '\0','/hHqm23xmXrGK2aMJiJGc80OlRNl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068577',5.9,2996,'en','Fear in the Night','It took Peggy Heller a long time to recover from the trauma of a brutal physical assault, suffered in her youth. When she married Robert, he provided her with the love and reassurance she craved for and the two settled down in a pretty house in the grounds of the public school where Robert was a master. But the headmaster of the school is not what he seems and Peggy is convinced he means to harm her - is her fear a figment of her tortured imagination or are there forces at work that intend to manipulate her anxieties with fatal consequences?','/tT2gf4OJCgQMEQ2F0dCqmoqQg2i.jpg','1972-07-09',94,'Released',NULL,'Fear in the Night',39925,2.9061,5.8,'OyBTJDriHfs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6191,_binary '\0','/7HFzjXuLLiTBd5efivbcCYRqDn1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068595',4.8,5157,'en','Flesh Gordon','Emperor Wang (the Perverted) is leader of the planet Porno and sends his mighty \"Sex Ray\" towards Earth, turning everyone into sex-mad fiends. Only one man can save the Earth, football player Flesh Gordon. Along with his girlfriend Dale Ardor and Professor Flexi-Jerkoff, they set off towards the source of the Sex Ray, unaware of the perils that face them!','/qnPEdOzLW9Z7ZYGIZQUJx00ww6S.jpg','1974-07-30',90,'Released','The Space Age Sex Spoof that is out of this World!','Flesh Gordon',3687,3.3512,4.8,'9Qkz__vxYKA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6192,_binary '\0','/e9n0sDkXTPz8CLXBEK1uo6janh3.jpg','2026-10-06 1