his family to his island estate for his birthday celebration. Pickett Smith is a free-lance photographer who is doing a pollution layout for an ecology magazine. Jason Crockett hates nature, poisoning anything that crawls on his property. On the night of his birthday the frogs and other members of nature begin to pay Crockett back.','/dF2OlQBMJiggzkjhfaNfx7HzBOU.jpg','1972-03-10',90,'Released','TODAY - THE POND... TOMORROW - THE WORLD!','Frogs',18274,2.5421,4.789,'36aMO5gfsMs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6196,_binary '\0','/A641FkJBGLdNJBi6nly48DHoZEf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068617',5.5,2598,'en','Fuzz','Police in Boston search for a mad bomber trying to extort money from the city.','/fnN2i4VYgihnbKuFjS3bCmWQHJT.jpg','1972-07-14',93,'Released','Here comes the fuzz','Fuzz',4986,2.0287,5.5,'AvS5457kDYI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6197,_binary '\0','/2BiBj49zY1mwj9rOMLkDMyPYpLs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068619',6.2,3203,'en','Ganja & Hess','After being stabbed with an ancient, germ-infested knife, a doctor finds himself with an insatiable desire for blood.','/gXH43R5Avru4YPUF7WoQLrxPUP2.jpg','1973-04-20',113,'Released','Some marriages are made in Heaven. Others are made in Hell.','Ganja & Hess',83096,1.2433,5.7,'xVmZ_BrAe9Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6198,_binary '\0','/xJeQY8MFLPMjtMcCxQKL2jC7Sfw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068622',5.9,4452,'en','Gargoyles','After receiving word about a mysterious carcass/skeleton unearthed in the Arizona desert, a father and his daughter decide to remove it from the burial grounds for further study. Once they do so, they, as well as the town, are besieged by a colony of gargoyles living in some nearby caverns.','/74x0yhrNGUsAvggdE8beIEOnQrJ.jpg','1972-11-21',74,'Released','Watch Out! The Gargoyles Are Here','Gargoyles',41025,2.3404,5.9,'HiQR5K3cpng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6199,_binary '\0','/o071bFLF