anized crime family patriarch, Vito Corleone barely survives an attempt on his life, his youngest son, Michael steps in to take care of the would-be killers, launching a campaign of bloody revenge.','/3bhkrj58Vtu7enYsRolD1fZdja1.jpg','1972-03-14',175,'Released','An offer you can\'t refuse.','The Godfather',238,63.3707,8.688,'8V2k2YQEQJ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6204,_binary '\0','/vMFJvI72ezgqvMy06l8p8bDh7gW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068649',5.2,3050,'en','The Gore Gore Girls','A young reporter enlists a top notch private eye to solve the murder of a female stripper at a Chicago nightclub.','/bvpLcoETKKVb6iFyl5r47pQKKsh.jpg','1972-12-15',84,'Released','In screaming color','The Gore Gore Girls',28170,1.4372,5.4,'SusBBdSWSkM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6205,_binary '\0','/3PmuXXXDbQTTUfjVuWOinTKBKtR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068650',6.5,2138,'ja','御用牙','Fearless Edo-period police inspector Hanzo Itami, nicknamed The Razor, has developed his own unique way of extracting information for his inquiries. His first adventure sees him investigating his superior officer\'s mistress, whom he suspects of having ties with a reputed criminal on the loose.','/5D8HTMkSJE3ul87D6pAeyXPqqxA.jpg','1972-12-30',94,'Released',NULL,'Hanzo the Razor: Sword of Justice',17099,2.025,6.2,'Ztgs2XK2I7Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6206,_binary '\0','/8vWezom2WvhZ4k9vob1sbUsya28.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068654',5.2,1414,'es','El gran amor del conde Drácula','Four women spending the night in a deserted sanitarium on a mountain fall into the hands of an evil doctor with a terrible secret.','/2RS1moMU7VsPFPgTkzEJTMIr9DZ.jpg','1973-05-12',85,'Released','Sharing his hunger for female flesh was his thirst for human blood...','Count Dracula\'s Great Love',27395,2.0205,4.8,'G94qswoaJXo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6207,_binary '\0','/juoFbQYBmWEX2h4VEcwcCO67sfk.jpg','2026-1