nd his pals plan to steal a huge diamond from a museum. But this turns out to be only the first time they have to steal it...','/vzfGNqmANfRbavk5XdQTsfnjmeH.jpg','1972-01-26',101,'Released','How many times does it take to steal the same diamond?','The Hot Rock',46059,4.1687,6.5,'48APEydOt64','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6226,_binary '\0','/w1yGT8wtALEZZ2UG9Cit8yYUV3u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068724',6.3,1612,'fr','L\'Héritier','After his father is killed in a plane crash, Bart Cordell returns back home to France to claim his inheritance: to lead the industrial empire his father built. But when a prostitute tries to set him up for a drug smuggling charge, he is forced to accept that his father may have been assassinated and that the killers are out to get him as well...','/h2t1mD2WoOHcT9lqkzmRZ3zwiSA.jpg','1973-03-22',112,'Released',NULL,'The Inheritor',57194,1.6231,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6227,_binary '\0','/a8X2CsKyiZabDbmcEtrQn5x9Av6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068727',5.7,2312,'en','I, Monster','Christopher Lee stars in this Amicus production of “Dr. Jekyll & Mr. Hyde” where the names have been changed to Dr. Marlowe and Mr. Blake. Lee as Dr. Marlowe experiments with intravenous drugs that are suppose to release inner inhibitions. So comes forth Mr. Blake (also Lee) who gets more monstrous with each transformation. Peter Cushing plays his friend and colleague, Dr. Utterson.','/7MMjLTD68UiRbSM9bVy8HhYY3uB.jpg','1971-11-01',70,'Released',NULL,'I, Monster',52941,2.6894,5.518,'BVn_Y2nUgmQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6228,_binary '\0','/yL4nA0MtGqWQdqkquhEdQ3O0tBN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068732',7,8823,'en','Images','While holidaying in Ireland, a pregnant children\'s author finds her mental state becoming increasingly unstable, resulting in paranoia, hallucinations, and visions of a doppelgänger.','/d9EobHDOwYc1c59vgzEgtTDS1lM.jpg','1972-12-18',101,'Released','A motion picture of the extra senses.','Images',29449,2.6918,6.8,'BCEdP2ObHGA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6229,_binary '\0','/3y2BtcjEm4yhMystxeOh46u35dH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068744',7.1,1477,'zh','愛奴','18-year-old Ainu is kidnapped and sold to a brothel. Her good looks and wild personality make her very popular with the lustful clients, but also draw the lesbian attentions of brothel madam Chun Yi. Chun Yi teaches Ainu the ways of lust and the ways of kung fu, and Ainu becomes more and more similar to her captor. But rage at her treatment is still burning inside her.','/gsRygZCTyQYXJ7TclTiafnCm6jV.jpg','1972-09-07',87,'Released','The first Chinese sex film!','Intimate Confessions of a Chinese Courtesan',46957,2.461,6.2,'8Slp6jdu2DA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6230,_binary '\0','/fKagUK3RNwp2jH6kXbICuAbEosI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068746',3.7,1256,'en','Invasion of the Blood Farmers','Somewhere in upstate New York, a young woman is terrorized by a group of rural farmers primarily interested in a harvest of blood.','/aq4DjUqumZ9CnCllQzzK33WgcB9.jpg','1972-08-23',78,'Released','They planted the LIVING and harvested the DEAD!','Invasion of the Blood Farmers',91066,1.4392,3.4,'SI1D4_HcKCs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6231,_binary '\0','/gSFkUGrgCSDDQpsQ6HbrEQ41tMl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068762',7.6,40191,'en','Jeremiah Johnson','While slowly adapting to the grueling life of a mountain man in the Rocky Mountains, Jeremiah Johnson encounters the Crow and Flathead tribes as well as hunters, trappers and settlers, all of whom call these mountains home.','/fANj1S3UmBB51wnKxYRKtw8LMBn.jpg','1972-09-10',108,'Released','Some say he\'s dead...some say he never will be.','Jeremiah Johnson',11943,5.9775,7.313,'QFLwH-ZZ1MY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6232,_binary '\0','/lgk1ptAoo8L5sMtVSadkBcnEUqs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068767',7.2,37733,'zh','精武門','During the Japanese occupation of Shanghai, Chen Zhen, the star pupil of a recently-deceased martial arts teacher battles a Japanese dojo which seeks the demise of his fighting school.','/dlcipCOa9hlfBBz7kCAyjsf3q0E.jpg','1972-03-22',108,'Released','Bruce Lee has done the impossible... ...HE\'S SURPASSED HIMSELF!!!','Fist of Fury',11713,8.4714,7.2,'oO9PVJdgu4M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6233,_binary '\0','/xo8Mj2DI9hSivlX4DSNpNubP1Bt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068768',6.4,23125,'en','Joe Kidd','A band of Mexicans find their U. S. land claims denied and all the records destroyed in a courthouse fire. Their leader, Louis Chama, encourages them to use force to regain their land. A wealthy landowner wanting the same decides to hire a gang of killers with Joe Kidd to track Chama.','/gwVL6a6ZPijqM5hB4n2Ztg1akWY.jpg','1972-07-19',88,'Released','If you\'re looking for trouble...he\'s Joe Kidd.','Joe Kidd',14881,4.0751,6.4,'GYSXhkquDYE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6234,_binary '\0','/32srArTWOkrRIAwEXm3vlVRK46G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068786',6.7,7531,'en','Junior Bonner','With his bronco-busting career on its last legs, Junior Bonner heads to his hometown to try his luck in the annual rodeo. But his fond childhood memories are shattered when he finds his family torn apart by his greedy brother and hard-drinking father.','/qA85YYjQob3gPAFiafuIXFhSZSG.jpg','1972-07-21',100,'Released','Steve McQueen going down his own road, tougher than ever, as \"Junior Bonner\"','Junior Bonner',5927,2.5781,6.1,'ls049puMNv8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6235,_binary '\0','/mEqPo10i18oMpq8WWnnDHar0pSu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068795',5.5,1751,'en','Kansas City Bomber','Roller-derby skater K.C. Carr tries to balance her desire for a happy personal life and her dreams of stardom.','/eDkgOnadNwaMjHj0fEh6Gcttmyg.jpg','1972-08-02',99,'Released','The Hottest Thing On Wheels','Kansas City Bomber',28020,1.8869,5.842,'7pZllmzYZRg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6236,_binary '\0','/1HidRheu20rWTqWcPXkW5atpq8w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068805',6.4,6558,'en','The King of Marvin Gardens','Jason Staebler lives on the Boardwalk and fronts for the local mob in Atlantic City. He is a dreamer who asks his brother David, a radio personality from Philadelphia, to help him build a paradise on a Pacific Island, which might be just another of his pie-in-the-sky schemes. Inevitably, complications begin to pile up.','/5JpKFEp9niY90Qgz7xhcIGAOifK.jpg','1972-10-13',103,'Released',NULL,'The King of Marvin Gardens',50627,2.624,5.9,'irEM1lOBXHs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6237,_binary '\0','/riJwCLs7uydVZUL1sSaEjMtvmvI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068814',8.2,3083,'bg','Козият рог','XVII century, Bulgaria is under Ottoman rule. Four men break into the house of the shepherd Karaivan, raping and killing his wife in full view of their child, Maria. To protect his daughter and to enact revenge, he raises Maria as a son, teaching her to fight and kill. But as Maria grows up, she longs for a different life.','/9gY3UruoZWEX1s6cip6sfjZtjAn.jpg','1972-10-04',100,'Released',NULL,'The Goat Horn',66565,1.3925,6.5,'1VL8hv1guxg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6238,_binary '\0','/r6kZzTqPxaiqpLTJdDJzgItz5bf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068815',7.6,9950,'ja','子連れ狼 子を貸し腕貸しつかまつる','Official Shogunate executioner Ogami Itto has been framed for disloyalty to the Shogunate by the Yagyu clan, against whom he now is waging a one-man war, along with his infant son, Daigoro.','/uxJJIzw3lDM0RbFQMQsTTRyFO2D.jpg','1972-01-15',84,'Released',NULL,'Lone Wolf and Cub: Sword of Vengeance',41471,2.1951,7.4,'uwofy9p6Iwk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6239,_binary '\0','/kD5nxaumfXlciZOaOEYjLu7QGrW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068816',7.9,7586,'ja','子連れ狼 三途の川の乳母車','Ogami Itto battles a group of female ninja in the employ of the Yagyu clan and must eliminate a traitor who plans to sell his clan\'s secrets to the Shogunate.','/47PwbebnjjTcGM4CzwJfhZXK6bB.jpg','1972-04-22',81,'Released',NULL,'Lone Wolf and Cub: Baby Cart at the River Styx',17810,2.3539,7.4,'OfDN_LPcLUg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6240,_binary '\0','/eEPl3K9et6UtHIZeRCUqPOPJoIa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068817',7.5,6249,'ja','子連れ狼 死に風に向う乳母車','Ogami Itto volunteers to be tortured by Yakuza in order to save a prostitute and is hired by their leader to kill an evil chamberlain.','/a33RihlBiOhNi4YffwofJxVqIzn.jpg','1972-09-02',89,'Released',NULL,'Lone Wolf and Cub: Baby Cart to Hades',41474,1.9339,7.1,'ajHiSb9FnL4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6241,_binary '\0','/pr0ZrGrYSGUOny744a8zWFAYvm5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068828',7,5277,'fr','Lady Sings the Blues','Chronicles the rise and fall of legendary blues singer Billie Holiday, beginning with her traumatic youth. The story depicts her early attempts at a singing career and her eventual rise to stardom, as well as her difficult relationship with Louis McKay, her boyfriend and manager. Casting a shadow over even Holiday\'s brightest moments is the vocalist\'s severe drug addiction, which threatens to end both her career and her life.','/jr528gGK1RrOW6YAZHUj5lF9RrO.jpg','1972-10-12',144,'Released','Diana Ross is Billie Holiday. Diana Ross sings Billie Holiday. And a superstar is born.','Lady Sings the Blues',23148,2.2903,6.9,'LLMlK7-_wjA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6242,_binary '\0','/mjxuTe76rA1C9btJtTwb8RVbeng.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068833',5.8,42870,'en','The Last House on the Left','On the eve of her 17th birthday, Mari and friend Phyllis set off from her family home to attend a rock concert in the city. Attempting to score some drugs on the way, the pair run afoul of a group of vicious crooks, headed up by the sadistic Krug.','/qyTqXz1C7kPgWmxcD5otQ7xlrJP.jpg','1972-08-30',84,'Released','To avoid fainting keep repeating, it\'s only a movie... Only a movie... Only a movie...','The Last House on the Left',15516,4.8757,6,'nIJwP5DsUsA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6243,_binary '\0','/uTgXhEsfdxNMYTVDnmMzwZQsuWt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068837',5.3,4033,'en','The Legend of Boggy Creek','A documentary-style drama based on true accounts of the Fouke Monster in Arkansas.','/ewSgkgvwNboYlSZq3iHC1YkbCK1.jpg','1972-08-01',87,'Released','A True Story.','The Legend of Boggy Creek',1842,1.7447,5,'PoL7HsEmzS4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6244,_binary '\0','/yAGHYGkFzSE6nfLcgBIpiyG9gfr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068853',6.8,10361,'en','The Life and Times of Judge Roy Bean','Outlaw and self-appointed lawmaker Judge Roy Bean rules over an empty stretch of the West that gradually grows, under his iron fist, into a thriving town, while dispensing his his own quirky brand of frontier justice upon strangers passing by.','/7iqGYu7bpnRMTJmyomQkl9VTDwP.jpg','1972-12-01',120,'Released','If this story ain\'t true... it shoulda been!','The Life and Times of Judge Roy Bean',33638,4.1747,6.5,'IvkDKj1rHBA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6245,_binary '\0','/uOLTu64odYcNvS8ouwuzV9bsJnE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068863',6.2,6130,'it','Lisa e il diavolo','Lisa is a tourist in an ancient city. When she gets lost, she finds an old mansion in which to shelter. Soon she is sucked into a vortex of deception, debauchery and evil presided over by housekeeper Leandre.','/kc1bN9JhSqbezrGcMt8lAvpmXnX.jpg','1974-11-25',95,'Released','Every corner of the soul is lost to the icy clutch of the supernatural!','Lisa and the Devil',5483,3.3333,6.14,'ZwKtmssl2uk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6246,_binary '\0','/wkBvfmvGiGGqgn1FTIOhJ9Mdpmb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068883',7.5,6685,'en','Ludwig','Historical evocation of Ludwig, king of Bavaria, from his crowning in 1864 until his death in 1886, as a romantic hero. Fan of Richard Wagner, betrayed by him, in love with his cousin Elisabeth of Austria, abandoned by her, tormented by his homosexuality, he will little by little slip towards madness.','/9ruh503sW0dkIcWdTKkvY01B8rc.jpg','1973-03-07',239,'Released','Ludwig. He loved women. He loved men. He lived as controversially as he ruled. But he did not care what the world thought. He was the world.','Ludwig',3478,3.5213,7.462,'jRMDfKJeu_A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6247,_binary '\0','/sJrNrubOGMKhcwglYxwUw9R8VGq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068897',5.6,4046,'en','The Magnificent Seven Ride!','Marshal Chris Adams turns down a friend\'s request to help stop the depredations of a gang of Mexican bandits. When his wife is killed by bank robbers and his friend is killed capturing the last thief, Chris feels obligated to take up his friend\'s cause and recruits a writer and five prisoners to destroy the desperadoes.','/g9wUJuEBpAFS6fjXguyWqudZWhZ.jpg','1972-08-01',100,'Released','A Brand New Seven -- Doing Their Number! They put their lives on the line and let it ride!','The Magnificent Seven Ride!',43417,3.9432,5.7,'36qIFflqQ1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6248,_binary '\0','/fHnHgSjYoAKplv5c2YT5cIOUi4n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068902',7.1,3360,'it','La mala ordina','When a shipment of heroin disappears between Italy and New York, a small-time pimp in Milan is framed for the theft. Two professional hitmen are dispatched from New York to find him, but the real thieves want to get rid of him before the New York killers get to him to eliminate any chance of them finding out he\'s the wrong man.','/vheVwwD7ua4PtV41Sei3UUix7Pv.jpg','1972-09-02',96,'Released','When the Godfather signs your contract... there\'s no place in the world you can hide!','The Italian Connection',61462,1.9518,7.1,'dYx9wupw6OA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6249,_binary '\0','/2lF8Beifs7kkSgIZzKGmsOQMhpv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068909',6.6,5295,'en','Man of La Mancha','In the 16th century, poet, playwright and part-time actor Miguel de Cervantes has been arrested, together with his manservant, by the Spanish Inquisition. They\'re accused of presenting an entertainment offensive to the Inquisition. Inside the huge dungeon into which they have been cast, the other inmates gang up on Cervantes and his manservant, staging a mock trial, with the intention of stealing or burning his possessions. Cervantes wishes to desperately save a manuscript he carries with him and stages, with costumes, makeup, and the participation of the other prisoners, an unusual defense—the story of Don Quixote.','/kKpSHHH6cj8YtciW1SHBGJ6pAOO.jpg','1972-12-12',132,'Released','Peter O\'Toole, Sophia Loren and James Coco dream \'The Impossible Dream\' in...','Man of La Mancha',45793,2.7431,6.627,'nZ-_P3j_vdw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6250,_binary '\0','/ypYmZ7zhV2384JObjoXjlwG0ASr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068916',6.4,1721,'sv','Mannen som slutade röka','The Plot focuses on Dante Alighieri, a young man who loves smoking. When his father dies Dante inherits $17 million on one special condition: He must give up smoking in 14 days and then stay smoke-free for an entire year. If he fails, his uncle inherits the $17 million instead. Dante has a living hell while trying to quit, and hires a private detective agency called Little Secret Service who he gives free hands to stop him from smoking, While his uncle, who has taken up smoking himself, also does everything he can to make Dante smoke again.','/laatM94ERVlk2bWnRxlGy5j4YoB.jpg','1972-12-16',104,'Released',NULL,'The Man Who Quit Smoking',44618,1.7918,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6251,_binary '\0','/45Eu4VS1RqQWBL4y7tZACw4RuZy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068918',7.2,1235,'en','Manson','Prosecuting attorney Vincent Bugliosi and Manson \"family\" members Lynette Fromme, Mary Brunner and Sandra Good discuss the Tate-LaBianca murders.','/8hhqxukBGEB0wY4xbjcvR82MMB3.jpg','1973-01-01',83,'Released','See and hear the actual family.','Manson',54505,1.8512,6.8,'GXQoSG3IQ2g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6252,_binary '\0','/mFhE21AsMJoLuuQWUkc6B4fhMrT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068920',5.8,1454,'en','Antony and Cleopatra','Adaptation of Shakespeare\'s Antony and Cleopatra, a historical drama that attempts to bring an epic visual style to the Bard\'s original stage play. The story concerns Marc Antony\'s attempts to rule Rome while maintaining a relationship with the queen of Egypt (Hildegarde Neil), which began while Antony was still married. Now he is being forced to marry the sister of his Roman co-leader, and soon the conflict leads to war.','/bglNdy9hLIsrUvZlPxq6x1ltHAJ.jpg','1972-03-18',138,'Released','Eternity Was in Our Lips and Eyes.','Antony and Cleopatra',98632,2.4084,5.7,'qSXiQ16BOTQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6253,_binary '\0','/pkqLvkkRJOPVE1hadZJOvBFtweC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068924',7.4,1949,'en','Marjoe','Part documentary, part expose, this film follows one-time child evangelist Marjoe Gortner on the \"church tent\" Revivalist circuit, commenting on the showmanship of Evangelism and \"the religion business\", prior to the start of \"televangelism\". Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2005.','/fVSNmaflCEso1i9JAlJmQdJvUnf.jpg','1972-07-24',88,'Released','You Keep the Faith...Marjoe Keeps the Money','Marjoe',38616,1.9787,7.6,'Ui7Pz4blum0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6254,_binary '\0','/thMdGESFFPyMTt14AACD0qk9v0m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068931',6.8,18424,'en','The Mechanic','Arthur Bishop is a veteran hit man who, owing to his penchant for making his targets\' deaths seem like accidents, thinks himself an artist. It\'s made him very rich, but as he hits middle age, he\'s so depressed and lonely that he takes on one of his victim\'s sons, Steve McKenna, as his apprentice. Arthur puts him through a rigorous training period and brings him on several hits. As Steven improves, Arthur worries that he\'ll discover who killed his father.','/hizE0MwFJOBlfLSFqFNKv7cSxkT.jpg','1972-10-06',99,'Released','He has 100 ways to kill... and they all work!','The Mechanic',19403,5.0385,6.7,'Nj1rONaGLgY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6255,_binary '\0','/nqcpVS8tL4GrM6NAoIrPepnF1Mp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068935',7.1,44500,'cn','猛龍過江','After a Chinese restaurant in Rome is threatened by the mafia, who will stop at nothing to acquire the property, the owner recruits a family friend in Hong Kong, kung fu expert Tang Lung, to help them defend their business.','/m7AIITQ624sfldI4SsX4htXPH1f.jpg','1972-12-30',100,'Released','The Colosseum . . the battleground of Bruce Lee and Chuck Norris.','The Way of the Dragon',9462,8.1964,7.4,'72giNDkKhSE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6256,_binary '\0','/S6tDWWyRhVZ7JEAomc8WTvFf5L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068939',6.8,1367,'el','Μέρες του \'36','The assassin of a prominent trade unionist takes a conservative MP hostage, throwing the government into a state of disarray.','/lgFrK9Q0Gz3Q7vnBg79AY1ILYJz.jpg','1972-09-30',105,'Released',NULL,'Days of \'36',114645,0.8294,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6257,_binary '\0','/l8icGxEiOm6xiBRLrlIHPqVi25a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068950',7.3,4684,'it','Mimì metallurgico ferito nell\'onore','Sicilian dockworker Mimi inadvertently becomes embroiled in an increasingly complicated array of personal conflicts. When he loses his job after voting against a Mafia kingpin in an allegedly secret election, Mimi leaves his wife to find new employment. He moves to Turin, where he engages in an affair with a Communist organiser. Soon, Mimi finds himself juggling two demanding relationships while plotting revenge against the corrupt forces that ruined his life.','/cmWOm384ObHI8ZuV0OR92GLVDj.jpg','1972-02-19',113,'Released','He\'s been a husband, a lover, a cuckold and a Communist. Now he just wants to be free.','The Seduction of Mimi',56153,2.3289,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6258,_binary '\0','/i2GKtdvA9HaO6P4CA5UMiAZp4m9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068954',5.7,1279,'it','Il mio nome è Shanghai Joe','A Chinese immigrant, recently arrived in America, fights to free Mexican slaves from their cruel master.','/9eFdlwLdnKZXUSzuhG3fNYYXtH1.jpg','1973-12-28',92,'Released','One Man Stands Alone In His Fight For Justice','The Fighting Fist of Shanghai Joe',30489,1.9635,5.1,'G36Fool412I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6259,_binary '\0','/ttbQQTCrVhjThmhE3QrJ8kFZjto.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068967',5.1,2402,'en','Moon of the Wolf','After several locals are viciously murdered, a Louisiana sheriff starts to suspect he may be dealing with a werewolf.','/lI5iLUP4L2ZCKH4QjVIf0zzR07U.jpg','1972-09-26',75,'Released','Deadly secrets emerge from the shadows when the full moon rises!','Moon of the Wolf',49354,2.5719,4.7,'28fborK_lg0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6260,_binary '\0','/a6ApNaEOl6ZwDGyd22pvoRKLt3T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068971',6.3,2469,'it','La morte accarezza a mezzanotte','Valentina, a beautiful fashion model, takes an experimental drug as part of a scientific experiment. While influenced by the drug, Valentina has a vision of a young woman being brutally murdered with a viciously spiked glove. It turns out that a woman was killed in exactly the same way not long ago and soon Valentina finds herself stalked by the same killer.','/nTOW46oizijZCY6EpS2JQuo5hlL.jpg','1972-11-17',102,'Released','The Steel Claw of Death...','Death Walks at Midnight',91255,1.8551,6.293,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6261,_binary '\0','/hbgB9OgNGlPhBrrNqmL0mkAGXjg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068972',5.7,1907,'it','La morte ha sorriso all\'assassino','Greta is a beautiful young woman abused by her brother Franz and left to die in childbirth by her illicit lover, the aristocrat Dr. von Ravensbrück. Bereft with grief, Franz reanimates his dead sister using a formula engraved on an ancient Incan medallion. Greta then returns as an undead avenging angel, reaping revenge on the Ravensbrück family and her manically possessive brother.','/jMXaIDsW89wvDDswdZNqOvEQxHw.jpg','1973-07-11',88,'Released',NULL,'Death Smiles on a Murderer',5434,2.4464,5.9,'lKM-1H2x_08','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6262,_binary '\0','/bOxG9sJ8g9BjX5OVOV9kCR0FDXP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068981',5.8,1711,'en','Mutiny on the Buses','Bus driver Stan Butler agrees to marry Suzy, much to the anguish of Mum, her son-in-law, Arthur, and daughter Olive. How, they wonder, will they ever manage without Stan\'s money coming in? Then Arthur is sacked, and Stan agrees to delay the wedding. Meanwhile, he hits on an idea: Arthur should learn to drive a bus. Somehow he does just that, and even gets a job. Stan then blackmails the Depot Manager into giving him the job of driver on the new money-making Special Tours Bus. A great idea ...if only the inspector hadn\'t taken Stan on his trial run to the Windsor Safari Park','/4XK9oMfe4Ae53JtXGH45d4c26dG.jpg','1972-06-02',89,'Released','Your Favourite BUSES Fun Gang... Back Again in Their SECOND Big Screen Comedy!','Mutiny on the Buses',40570,1.7162,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6263,_binary '\0','/2ltSI9WrUQEnS7JRBYduVDSj18d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068983',7.3,1565,'en','My Childhood','The first part of Bill Douglas\' influential trilogy harks back to his impoverished upbringing in early-\'40s Scotland. Cinema was his only escape - he paid for it with the money he made from returning empty jam jars - and this escape is reflected most closely at this time of his life as an eight-year-old living on the breadline with his half-brother and sick grandmother in a poor mining village.','/nQ57rkuYVkQ31aDpmjVTw7erh6w.jpg','1972-06-05',47,'Released',NULL,'My Childhood',114444,0.9371,7.134,'BJfccn8Bo04','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6264,_binary '\0','/4Oz425U1FbZ6rDHC3ouKEeTeYqV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0068997',7,3876,'en','The New Centurions','An idealistic rookie cop joins the LAPD to make ends meet while finishing law school, and is indoctrinated by a seasoned veteran. As time goes on, he loses his ambitions and family as police work becomes his entire life.','/f0ve9VvbFKo2LA0HhVbLE9vazCm.jpg','1972-08-03',103,'Released','The nationwide bestseller about cops - by a cop!','The New Centurions',37608,2.3806,6.6,'y9xfbPIktUI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6265,_binary '\0','/4Pq4HbWGxHj0KGpzuYsQOYZyZ6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069002',7.3,4911,'en','The Night Strangler','After being run out of Las Vegas, reporter Carl Kolchak heads for Seattle and another reporting job with the local paper. It\'s not long before he’s on the trail of another string of bizarre murders. It seems that every 21 years, for the past century, a killer murders a certain number of people, drains them of their blood, and then disappears into the night. Kolchak is on his trail, but can he stop him?','/xp3rvEEb9PsCBYeF6swCE7aIlMN.jpg','1973-01-16',90,'Released','The horror continues…','The Night Strangler',32021,1.9624,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6266,_binary '\0','/kw56BJUXYTtGH3UFq4Fb1BkPHj0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069005',4.2,5934,'en','Night of the Lepus','Rancher Cole Hillman is fed up of rabbits plaguing his fields. Zoologist Roy Bennett conducts an experiment to curb their population, but it gives rise to giant rabbits that terrorise the town.','/wF8paiOb7E1JWb6mvec0TCTNq5W.jpg','1972-10-04',88,'Released','How many eyes does horror have?','Night of the Lepus',38761,3.5846,4.429,'AA910vCNRe4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6267,_binary '\0','/wHLGJVlTInWPdPGKVomj3y7nssR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069007',5.8,3294,'en','The Nightcomers','Prequel to the Henry James classic \"Turn of the Screw\" about the events leading up to the deaths of Peter Quint and Ms. Jessel, and the slow corruption of the children in their care.','/nKNPk3CqmEpuOLylXAU7ksG7YkW.jpg','1972-02-15',96,'Released','Two Children. Two Adults. One Unspeakable Crime.','The Nightcomers',42526,2.2927,5.714,'GKS4Zn8BWgU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6268,_binary '\0','/mSBdSd2vRGLdNMmUewsY1kqEkPi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069013',6.7,3056,'it','Tony Arzenta','A mob hitman wants to retire, but his bosses don\'t think that\'s a good idea. Complications - and many bloody shootouts - ensue.','/p0IIvxBNY5N3CUEVooSTvjeUcUb.jpg','1973-08-23',113,'Released','By mistake they killed his wife and child - THAT was a hell of a mistake!','Tony Arzenta',85365,2.5633,6.132,'DcYfPpdY6G4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6269,_binary '\0','/cx7Jfj9DRl03DyaiVtZmF0G2atJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069017',6.5,1899,'it','La notte dei diavoli','In this adaptation of Tolstoy\'s story the Wurdulak, a mentally ill patient known as Nicola flashes back to horrifying experiences that he encountered while driving through the country. Upon damaging his car, Nicola sets out for help, only to meet a mysterious family that lives in total fear of someone or something. This evil force slowly penetrates the household and thrusts each of its members into a frenzy of absolute terror.','/huYSfQPfHQoTSSco1YeS1YqqTK.jpg','1972-04-29',89,'Released','Creatures of the Living Dead!','The Night of the Devils',27409,2.381,6.297,'rsaL_IJE3yU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6270,_binary '\0','/93Q0oOm0j3WHbEAB6S6JBjtVScj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069019',7,12912,'it','Non si sevizia un paperino','A reporter and a promiscuous young woman try to solve a series of child killings in a remote southern Italian town rife with superstition and a distrust of outsiders.','/ehH1xFUdcLyEeJMBfW5FVeT0Flf.jpg','1972-09-29',105,'Released','A classic tale of the perverse from director Lucio Fulci.','Don\'t Torture a Duckling',49361,3.297,7.321,'UQqu4MlEfMo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6271,_binary '\0','/eC6F655nzHDFQl2N098AXHI9ZwA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069024',5.5,2372,'en','Nothing But the Night','When various trustees of the Van Traylen Orphanage begin dying in close order, it\'s at first written off as a coincidence. But, when a school bus accident very nearly takes out three more of them along with a group of orphans, Col. Bingham and his pathologist friend, Mark, begin looking into the deaths. They come to think the answer lies with one of the girls on the bus, who has vivid memories of things she could not possibly have seen.','/ul8TfnX9iyOjbdT5DXzkg1VNWHW.jpg','1973-02-16',90,'Released','This nightmare has already killed five people - now it\'s yours to live!','Nothing But the Night',29596,2.145,6.2,'tIA7X5TwNzQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6272,_binary '\0','/fYj8Mh93SWdcpC96n1VNiOHrcZe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069027',7.2,2505,'fr','Nous ne vieillirons pas ensemble','Jean, a married 40-year-old filmmaker, and his young working class lover, Catherine, engage in a circular series of spectacular blow-ups and tentative reunions, their mutual desire a fire that burns them again and again.','/bwGa43RE2AaBMpoU2Jdlj08rK7.jpg','1972-05-03',110,'Released',NULL,'We Won\'t Grow Old Together',63230,2.0283,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6273,_binary '\0','/1fgIoLGDHxr09fDR54DlCTwfgFm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069029',6.2,2812,'es','La novia ensangrentada','A young newlywed woman begins to have disturbing nightmares just after settling into the old mansion that has belonged to her husband\'s family for centuries. When her sinister dreams come true, the innocent bride is caught in a maddening maze of unspeakable horrors.','/8cdm9lZgePnKb0LUC4t7su1z8S5.jpg','1972-09-30',96,'Released','Till death do us part!','The Blood Spattered Bride',40365,1.6494,5.8,'6UAhF2WzrDI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6274,_binary '\0','/lTwzN6lTIrZZ5zel0gcdG2qrwDe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069031',6.2,2538,'en','Now You See Him, Now You Don\'t','Dexter Riley is a science student at Medfield College who inadvertently invents a liquid capable of rendering objects and people invisible. Before Dexter and his friends, Debbie and Richard Schuyler, can even enjoy their spectacular discovery, corrupt businessman A.J. Arno plots to get his greedy hands on it. Slapstick hijinks ensue as Dexter and his pals try to thwart the evil Arno before he can use the invisibility spray to rob a bank.','/80q0lUxs7lsSTTAbt7wPCVWzJLx.jpg','1972-07-12',88,'Released','He\'s going... going... gone!','Now You See Him, Now You Don\'t',24236,3.5281,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6275,_binary '\0','/4CEtNdl70l4v0AcICcNyU6McvjQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069035',8,5954,'sv','Nybyggarna','A Swedish immigrant family struggles to adapt to their new life on the American frontier during the second half of the 19th century amidst civil war, native uprising and the lure of gold in California.','/eC9SDdBwCa0FGckc76q1MBxlks9.jpg','1972-02-26',202,'Released','From \"The Emigrants\" dream, come the settlers struggle to survive...','The New Land',42488,1.8904,7.5,'U-5dFB_niDY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6276,_binary '\0','/93e9Vmbh3nHItYrLAe1y6oLsVfo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069041',6,1426,'es','Los ojos azules de la muñeca rota','An ex-convict, troubled by dreams that he strangles women, is hired as the caretaker on an estate owned by three very strange sisters. Soon after his arrival, a serial killer begins slaughtering blonde, blue-eyed women - and leaving their eyeballs in a bowl of water.','/2swm3lUYDubyFAfEcYXTBir1IYz.jpg','1974-08-05',89,'Released','They\'re HELL-ON-EARTH with LOVE-LUSTS and BLOOD-LUSTS that will SHOCK YOU OUT OF YOUR SEAT and mind!','Blue Eyes of the Broken Doll',27392,1.7281,5.8,'MBfxoDjfrt0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6277,_binary '\0','/kfx3wytz63Va8JR71j4c61O7jPj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069042',6.7,2102,'da','Olsen-bandens store kup','After his usual stay behind bars, Egon has another cunning plan involving millions. They rob over 4 million from a money transport. The gang keeps a low profile and hide the money. But it\'s stolen by \"Kongen\" and \"Knægten\", who immediately start living it up - in the penthouse suite at the Sheraton. The suitcase with the money changes hands several times, before Kongen\'s daughter takes of with all the money.','/9SX3CFLzNAQ09y9TcJ7tNgMf7W0.jpg','1972-10-06',99,'Released',NULL,'The Olsen Gang\'s Big Score',15498,1.6945,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6278,_binary '\0','/wjcQC9M2NY107an0yGb6mSZ5Z7E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069048',5.9,4813,'it','Gli orrori del castello di Norimberga','A young man, Peter, returns to Austria in search of his heritage. There he visits the castle of an ancestor, a sadistic Baron who was cursed to a violent death by a witch whom the Baron had burned at the stake. Peter reads aloud the incantation that causes Baron Blood to return and continue his murderous tortures.','/62uQ7UABPvTbPnSBwz3tOgCHdNm.jpg','1972-02-25',98,'Released','He sought the ultimate in HUMAN AGONY... with instruments of TORTURE ghastly beyond belief!','Baron Blood',5485,2.1554,6.1,'AK3zWj68spM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6279,_binary '\0','/urIWkloEYK1AGdfui3eHdUGmCzq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069049',6.6,8625,'en','The Other Side of the Wind','At a media-swamped party to celebrate his seventieth birthday and screen his avant-garde film-in-progress, a legendary but jaded Hollywood director is faced both with voracious fans and unsettling questions about what became of his lead actor.','/pFeWBVcCehkdr1BvXaVrepGUJQK.jpg','2018-11-02',122,'Released','40 years in the making.','The Other Side of the Wind',299782,3.2244,6.7,'nMWHBUTHmf0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6280,_binary '\0','/veDQ2dMbldgWBPVx8UkXeAPy9Rf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069050',6.8,7902,'en','The Other','A series of gruesome accidents plague a small American farming community in the summer of 1935, encircling two identical twin brothers and their family.','/m695QOMWVSE9k5CI2ksu0gIn6nh.jpg','1972-05-24',108,'Released','Niles and Holland are as close as twin brothers can be. Appearances can be deceiving... and deadly.','The Other',35280,2.3605,6.5,'6idjzfD7QC8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6281,_binary '\0','/pChnfJNVzkedhvpCqlLjgG2soib.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069073',6.4,3944,'it','Perché quelle strane gocce di sangue sul corpo di Jennifer?','A high-rise apartment populated by models, nightclub dancers and call girls becomes the focus of a mysterious serial killer. When a young model named Jennifer and her friend Marilyn move into one of the victims\' former apartments, Jennifer becomes the next target and the pair try to identify the killer.','/afpZ3Eckzo0NyU2SyKbIouoQ3jm.jpg','1972-08-04',94,'Released','The killer slices without mercy!','The Case of the Bloody Iris',29167,2.0298,6.348,'77NtfI04BQ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6282,_binary '\0','/2dJyusaMWzFoEodHgGThQpypoxp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069080',6.3,1338,'en','Pete \'n\' Tillie','A fun-loving bachelor woos and weds a secretary, but the bonds of this marriage aren\'t strong enough to stop his philandering from continuing.','/itWUkwLlltZZdrmzSqBhPYdGdD9.jpg','1972-12-17',100,'Released','\"Honeymoon\'s over... it\'s time to get married.\"','Pete \'n\' Tillie',107774,1.7295,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6283,_binary '\0','/uh1zf6Q0UcHaqWQXZXu1qOOSCRg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069089',6,31476,'en','Pink Flamingos','Notorious Baltimore criminal and underground figure Divine goes up against Connie & Raymond Marble, a sleazy married couple who make a passionate attempt to humiliate her and seize her tabloid-given title as \"The Filthiest Person Alive\".','/10N8SvTQwUqyWgocPam1P18Jgr.jpg','1972-03-17',93,'Released','An exercise in poor taste.','Pink Flamingos',692,7.633,6.1,'vUd_6FF4AtM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6284,_binary '\0','/jqcKHIV4sCzvCffzQmuOJfG4jiQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069090',8.6,11680,'en','Pink Floyd: Live at Pompeii','British progressive rock band Pink Floyd perform at the ancient Roman Amphitheatre in the ruins of Pompeii, Italy in 1971. Although the band perform a typical live set from the era, there is no audience beyond the basic film crew.','/bxjgbHH14nEMx3YtFDLJ04omQhH.jpg','1972-10-25',84,'Released','And no one sings me lullabies. And no one makes me close my eyes.','Pink Floyd: Live at Pompeii',25771,2.8047,8.069,'ol7e6YuAGDY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6285,_binary '\0','/iHJTF9WcXUfp8iy7EHPxMQ3XQyK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069095',6.6,8366,'it','...più forte ragazzi!','The \"Trinity\" crew makes another modern era film. Plata and Salud are pilots ditching aircraft for insurance money. They wind up crashing for real in the jungles of South America. The plot involves \"Mr. Big\", who is buying the diamonds from the miners for much too little, and has thugs who keep the price down. Of course, Plata and Salud side with the miners','/cWhBysh8ejHqKBcv5cGaA5FCCcq.jpg','1972-12-22',120,'Released','Those \"TRINITY BOYS\" take to the air and still fly off the handle!','All the Way Boys',1721,3.7282,6.818,'RB7Xt6jjy8s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6286,_binary '\0','/6YaphqLSVChdWgF7csZVjM0b08Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069097',7.6,29854,'en','Play It Again, Sam','A neurotic film critic obsessed with the movie Casablanca attempts to get over his wife leaving him by dating again with the help of a married couple and his illusory idol, Humphrey Bogart.','/yZFz5rwrdVmEoHVkVU7EkZedDfz.jpg','1972-05-04',85,'Released','By day he is Woody Allen. But when night falls and the moon rises, Humphrey Bogart strikes again.','Play It Again, Sam',11610,4.5097,7.445,'r4v0lxcCIdc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6287,_binary '\0','/faaeaySmKVNSxpIYeT0RrY1L9Yq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069103',5.4,2207,'en','Pocket Money','Broke and in debt, an otherwise honest cowboy and his buddy get mixed up in some shady dealings with a crooked cattle dealer.','/sfSFXd5vrJ1Zo29Vz6G3t3iK1Yv.jpg','1972-02-01',102,'Released','The two most memorable characters the West can never forget!','Pocket Money',45512,2.8239,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6288,_binary '\0','/ejLsnT6KmMpvtoPHMp40m54hRDd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069113',7.1,54686,'en','The Poseidon Adventure','When their ocean liner capsizes, a group of passengers struggle to survive and escape.','/rKLuf43xJyLZ0eg57yKKXomMEr1.jpg','1972-12-01',117,'Released','Hell, upside down.','The Poseidon Adventure',551,7.2723,7.2,'H_5w-WmSdz0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6289,_binary '\0','/96LPWcgCS8BmqpLqlRTCBgGW7PI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069120',7.1,3669,'it','La prima notte di quiete','In Italy, the gambler and professor of poetry Daniele Dominici arrives in the seaside town of Rimini and is hired to teach for four months in the local high school replacing another teacher. His relationship with his partner Monica is in crisis and he spends most of the time with his new acquaintances and gamblers Giorgio, Marcello and Gerardo. In classroom, he meets the gorgeous nineteen years old student Vanina Abati, who is Gerardo\'s girlfriend.','/3TsBrOGlDLd7S1hq348fOLJ4RNP.jpg','1972-10-18',132,'Released',NULL,'Indian Summer',47251,3.8681,7.561,'VDmLw1Dkzb4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6290,_binary '\0','/yga1jrQiONyMSbfSq0aSWe0NpVC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069121',6.7,6967,'en','Prime Cut','A group of ruthless Chicago mob enforcers are sent to Kansas City to settle things with the owner of a slaughterhouse who has taken money that is not his to keep.','/rAesYoQKGIPBJoT7jmaKAUGD9Y8.jpg','1972-06-01',88,'Released','Any way they slice it, it’s going to be murder','Prime Cut',27292,2.4346,6.504,'EBW3Rlw4mlw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6291,_binary '\0','/ueQikBdMOupJvaZ0LZHT9wiYIy3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069124',6.4,2101,'en','Private Parts','In the sleaziest corner of Los Angeles, the King Edward Hotel has a new arrival in the form of Cheryl, a runaway teen. She\'s hoping to put her life back together but somewhere in the musty halls of the King Edward lurks another guest — who just loves to chop people apart!','/r0qOXei4K7SrMhcCxiEzp7GVCtr.jpg','1972-09-01',87,'Released','Cheryl is a lovely girl... but to George, she\'s a living doll.','Private Parts',24777,2.4278,5.6,'biwvIpEVRYA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6292,_binary '\0','/7vg0qVxbk5gyXZNcQxbReddRsd2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069134',5.9,3178,'en','Pulp','A seedy writer of sleazy pulp novels is recruited by a quirky, reclusive ex-actor to help him write his biography at his house in Malta.','/uNy4WK1pJFmOU1McKzNihyvuAWL.jpg','1972-11-01',95,'Released','Write it. Live it. But try not to be it.','Pulp',28131,2.4117,5.8,'ma56N-BbVI0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6293,_binary '\0','/4Qs1h136ANnnWppodR38B0p5hT4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069158',6.3,1547,'en','Rage','An accidental nerve gas leak by the military kills not only a rancher\'s livestock, but also his son. When he tries to hold the military accountable for their actions, he runs up against a wall of silence.','/jpw9TSzdsBBU6DGSh4sy5RtXEn.jpg','1972-11-22',100,'Released','They called it an accident. He called it murder. It was their conspiracy. It was his son.','Rage',101307,1.6065,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6294,_binary '\0','/iZlI9cEo0DxMwe3ybgi2bgh8R0m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069159',6.1,2629,'it','Una ragione per vivere e una per morire','A dishonored Union Army officer leads a group of convicts to retake Fort Holman from the Confederate Army.','/bqUc5pQD2pxtHAbQwsICwrlstDQ.jpg','1972-12-27',92,'Released','A handful of condemned men on an impossible mission, against hopeless odds...','A Reason to Live, a Reason to Die',61237,2.8824,6.3,'dzGYS8L_DLI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6295,_binary '\0','/2vclk5TTxXQk0hz3cY3Llbe10AU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069172',7.6,1403,'en','Reminiscences of a Journey to Lithuania','Jonas Mekas weaves an elegiac diary film from his 1971–72 return to Lithuania, chronicling a visit to his birthplace of Semeniškiai after decades in exile. Blending personal memory with documentary observation, the film becomes both a portrait of homecoming and a meditation on displacement, family, and the passage of time.','/vnnVqci7fGZFDXBLnxP9nHUCI2m.jpg','1972-08-02',81,'Released',NULL,'Reminiscences of a Journey to Lithuania',148811,1.2166,6.9,'5V5PVxCscL8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6296,_binary '\0','/y1y19cvjp8cqnASszAGwRMImiZF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069179',6.1,1689,'en','The Revengers','The life of peaceful rancher John Benedict is torn apart when his family is massacred by a gang of marauding outlaws and his farm is destroyed. He assembles a team of mean, lawless convicts to act as his posse as he pursues the gang responsible for the deaths of his loved ones.','/pkTz0NgUxn4bbNLBXPpjHlVbCgP.jpg','1972-06-21',106,'Released','He bought six men out of hell and they brought it with them.','The Revengers',127475,2.1137,5.8,'A1l--F7NjC0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6297,_binary '\0','/8d9HhK7i7nfDUq3kp9QfGHZ8fjk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069186',5.9,1436,'it','Rivelazioni di un maniaco sessuale al capo della squadra mobile','A serial killer is on the loose. His victims are unfaithful wives and he always leaves compromising photographs at the crime scene.','/od9gwogLBdCF1lPInjn034Gmj9h.jpg','1972-07-18',100,'Released','One day you\'ll get closer to the violence of death... but THIS IS AS FAR AS WE DARE TAKE YOU... with any hope of bringing you back!','So Sweet, So Dead',105114,2.0669,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6298,_binary '\0','/577MexfjVxgTakrbugG8QbfimUn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069191',7.3,15021,'it','Roma','A virtually plotless, gaudy, impressionistic portrait of Rome through the eyes of one of its most famous citizens.','/rqK75R3tTz2iWU0AQ6tLz3KMOU1.jpg','1972-03-16',120,'Released','The fall of the Roman Empire 1931-1972.','Roma',11035,3.6968,7.3,'O_NAlPgwiSg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6299,_binary '\0','/aOBrmh5djvovWUu2et7B9RCJlC6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069197',5.9,2206,'en','The Call of the Wild','John Thornton, is a fearless man who\'s after more than gold; he wants to do what\'s right. Thornton works for the U.S. mail and is the only person daring and smart enough to figure out how to travel the deadly 600 miles from Skagway to Dawson, Alaska in the icy winter. His incredibly dog Buck is by his side and part of how he survives.','/bK6Vr1zce4HK3WvdAAQVSBL3dU2.jpg','1972-11-30',100,'Released','Sweeping action-adventure.. against the perils of the frozen north!','The Call of the Wild',42759,3.3673,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6300,_binary '\0','/aorPWXGPhteM64CwNoDAM1NYVaJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069198',7.2,7378,'en','The Ruling Class','When the Earl of Gurney dies in a cross-dressing accident, his schizophrenic son, Jack, inherits the Gurney estate. Jack is not the average nobleman; he sings and dances across the estate and thinks he is Jesus reincarnated. Believing that Jack is mentally unfit to own the estate, the Gurney family plots to steal Jack\'s inheritance. As their outrageous schemes fail, the family strives to cure Jack of his bizarre behavior, with disastrous results.','/7BxYz9eS31gMRSx1iZF48s9Wsqt.jpg','1972-05-24',154,'Released',NULL,'The Ruling Class',30892,2.464,6.4,'hvBsk_jJ7j0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6301,_binary '\0','/5N9TVGAk8VNJ0yM7UIuQjSbRZhF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069219',6.3,1221,'fr','Sans mobile apparent','A series of murders is committed in Nice on the French riviera. The commissaire Carella is in charge and tries to find a missing link between all these murders.','/aWYgYyux5pisHML36KW5D1ARQZo.jpg','1971-09-15',100,'Released','One of them is the next victim. One is the killer. We challenge you to guess who.','Without Apparent Motive',150587,2.5092,5.889,'mOmIsIcbgXw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6302,_binary '\0','/73dXzlkftJnfOsOdMQl0XfT0gSx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069225',6.9,1964,'en','Savage Messiah','In the Paris of the 1910s, brash young sculptor Henri Gaudier begins a creative partnership with an older writer, Sophie Brzeska. Though the couple is 20 years apart in age, Gaudier finds that his untamed work is complemented by the older woman\'s cultural refinement. He then moves to London with Brzeska, where he falls in with a group of avant-garde artists. There, Gaudier encounters yet another artistic muse in passionate suffragette Gosh Boyle.','/8SvzigYJY7iy4DGlrnOHfU2FZkY.jpg','1972-06-27',103,'Released','Every man has a dream that must be realised... a love that must come true... a life that must not stop.','Savage Messiah',58257,1.595,6.4,'42Til_Q4yiM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6303,_binary '\0','/9H2DT6zp6StWXrUxiGyYZkK2pEN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069229',5.8,1738,'en','Treasure Island','Young Jim Hawkins finds himself serving with pirate captain Long John Silver in search of a buccaneer\'s treasure, in this short adaptation of Robert Louis Stevenson\'s classic tale.','/37sldJSCJGJeDKo5i5C99JWD0vR.jpg','1972-10-01',94,'Released',NULL,'Treasure Island',22376,3.9327,5.9,'l2rgekf8VOU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6304,_binary '\0','/hMuHGY2Z0UqXgu4MwfJdiuIlScK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069235',7.5,2895,'it','Lo scopone scientifico','An aging American millionairess journeys to Rome each year with her chauffeur George to play the card game scopone with destitute Peppino and his wife Antonia.','/6nOaPSZ9zQCFlwUUclJRBi4OR78.jpg','1972-08-28',113,'Released',NULL,'The Scopone Game',56341,1.8808,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6305,_binary '','/mpcFHHbocf66CodOmdHP3XhACnA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069236',5.8,1507,'en','Score','In the mythical European city of Leisure, married couple Jack and Elvira have an ongoing bet regarding who can seduce whom. This comes up in the wake of a swinging night with a couple of tourists picked up via a newspaper ad. Elvira, a self-professed \"sexual snob\" has bet she can seduce newlywed Betsy, married to handsome marine biologist Eddie. If she fails by midnight, then Jack gets to seduce Eddie.','/haioe1MPBPTp052csfC8amT3xZS.jpg','1973-11-05',90,'Released','MIXED DOUBLES WAS NEVER THIS MUCH FUN!','Score',53897,0,6,'iyFEsJ3QfTw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6306,_binary '\0','/jllzejX8VvHCLsrZLWN9G26PRQV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069237',6.1,1580,'fr','La Scoumoune','For more than 15 years, two Marseille friends and criminals battle the law, rival gangs, prison authorities and even mined beaches in order to survive.','/zMIUKemGgDOVyXKfOTbWDvAICJd.jpg','1972-12-12',102,'Released',NULL,'The Pariah',57539,1.9499,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6307,_binary '\0','/qUYWRV6yH3q9ZzwPbBcXXBcywWf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069239',5.6,4481,'en','Hungry Wives','An unhappy suburban housewife gets mixed up in witchcraft with unexpected consequences.','/hhBfST0YjRpTrLbB6XH0HXoXmkA.jpg','1972-12-27',89,'Released','Every Night is Halloween.','Hungry Wives',29424,2.1597,5.3,'n5l3tfxT_GA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6308,_binary '\0','/pGMzo03sCKwc7Jg5WyvP3E2jjxs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069243',5.8,1253,'fr','Les seins de glace','On a beach in Nice, François meets the mysterious Peggy and falls in love with her. Following her to a villa, he meets Marc, a lawyer who has a strange relationship with the girl.','/xTlxThZV1IkpUM4k2PcXtGJeFtn.jpg','1974-08-28',102,'Released','Be well, be warned, beware of icy breasts','Icy Breasts',79393,2.8255,5.809,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6309,_binary '\0','/jFhT7ZXtEFyTPBRJ9Ftx32AQ9Eu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069251',6.2,1384,'fr','Le Serpent','Vlassov is a Soviet spy who defects in France. He is whisked to the U.S, where Allan Davies takes over the case. After polygraph tests and cross-examinations, Vlassov names several Western European agents who are also spying for the Soviets. Davies wants to take the listed agents into custody; meanwhile, those on the list start dying under mysterious circumstances.','/smqx8XlZSJzezGEfcI9ySIetzpS.jpg','1973-04-07',113,'Released','One of these men is working for the C.I.A.','The Serpent',44607,1.9864,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6310,_binary '\0','/k7fZ3nOlMtiCmTmFOZytbZvOukL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069253',6.1,1224,'it','Sette scialli di seta gialla','In Copenhagen, a blind pianist hunts the culprit in string of murders, each linked by the presence of a yellow shawl and a black cat.','/r2RBt72s9iJxLf0S44PSBkzGNYS.jpg','1972-08-12',98,'Released',NULL,'The Crimes of the Black Cat',29165,1.8812,5.5,'cL91Yk1LuTo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6311,_binary '\0','/9CYpVizrVbQ9fQPFxFYSwhSB6Bt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069257',6.1,3898,'en','Shaft\'s Big Score!','John Shaft is back as the lady-loved black detective cop on the search for the murderer of a client.','/9iNj96mEU66sRi1aCRDzglDUaGn.jpg','1972-06-21',105,'Released','Last time he was nice. This time he\'s ice!','Shaft\'s Big Score!',493,2.9195,6.1,'9int7tF5mcM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6312,_binary '\0','/lG76sb69OfUaEHsrmCluGIJfAwR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069273',6.6,1614,'en','Sitting Target','Imprisoned Harry Lomart is a vicious, brute of a man and yet he is prepared to do his long jail term as he is confident that on his release his beautiful wife Pat will be waiting for him, but a visit from Pat brings him his worst nightmare.','/yTpVk4x8GdVEpJ877DUs8SuZg1A.jpg','1972-05-01',93,'Released','The Hit Man never stops till he scores.','Sitting Target',71910,2.0073,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6313,_binary '\0','/pkSrvE6unmDRWuelTqFEfpwjNB0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069278',5.7,2690,'en','Skyjacked','A crazed Vietnam vet bomber hijacks a Boeing 707 and demands to be taken to Russia.','/bn27c1ztrQEG0k5G4CPfRRhk8Sk.jpg','1972-05-24',101,'Released','On Board Flight 502 Is A Bomb. It Could Be Anywhere. And A Skyjacker. It Could Be Anyone.','Skyjacked',87514,2.0089,6.2,'G5sKGiaI18g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6314,_binary '\0','/z8HBS853iRUYjK9p3plmmayiCtE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069279',5.9,1598,'en','Slaughter','Slaughter, a former Green Beret, avenges the killing of loved ones by the Mob, and after being blackmailed by the feds, is forced to head to South America to finish the mobsters off.','/vVwOhNDw0GLvxXTgOVzrUBD49Mx.jpg','1972-08-16',91,'Released','It\'s not only his name, it\'s his business and sometimes--his pleasure!','Slaughter',56535,1.5424,5.6,'BtbQu_eXTQE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6315,_binary '\0','/tIlhG6ZmJFF1NKEA3aMWJhXhW78.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069280',6.8,15020,'en','Slaughterhouse-Five','Billy Pilgrim, a veteran of the Second World War, finds himself mysteriously detached from time, so that he is able to travel, without being able to help it, from the days of his childhood to those of his peculiar life on a distant planet called Tralfamadore, passing through his bitter experience as a prisoner of war in the German city of Dresden, over which looms the inevitable shadow of an unspeakable tragedy.','/gM2q9pGW9x2zdEMPRsXLBgTDDFH.jpg','1972-03-15',100,'Released','Billy Pilgrim lives —from time to time to time…','Slaughterhouse-Five',24559,3.8591,6.5,'yXsiwjK_cfQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6316,_binary '\0','/rVdKBzVyHTG1gv8bAAJnr5Eu6gl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069281',7.9,53310,'en','Sleuth','A man who loves games and theatre invites his wife\'s lover to meet, setting up a battle of wits with potentially deadly results.','/jAREYLUnYGwPjbQr0vs1s38QLkH.jpg','1972-12-10',138,'Released','Think of the perfect crime... Then go one step further.','Sleuth',993,3.6126,7.7,'XBRMaieaLdU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6317,_binary '\0','/m661bj9ynfVMvlC40go4LCfaQKh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069282',6.2,1839,'en','Slither','While searching for a small fortune of embezzled money, an ex-con, a small-time bandleader, his doting wife and a kooky drifter find themselves being followed. Their chase takes them to trailer camps, bingo halls, laundromats and ultimately, a showdown with a group of unconventional bad guys.','/zBQkChjEWiMna5Qsay7EDDdfUL.jpg','1973-03-07',97,'Released','Kopetzky & Kanipsia together at last.','Slither',87417,1.6913,5.8,'9WGaqqtYDmg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6318,_binary '\0','/mSGie9GCD6nRv8Wmc8LT7maNVCh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069289',7.3,5701,'en','Snoopy, Come Home','When Snoopy receives a letter from his original owner Lila, he goes to visit her in the hospital while Charlie Brown and the gang are on the lookout for him. Suddenly, Snoopy feels that he must go live with Lila, but must say goodbye to all his friends. In his adventure to the hospital, he encounters numerous \"No Dogs Allowed\" signs, an annoying little girl who desires to keep him, and more!','/vGYhYtoXkpjXTZ7KLQMJehwfLG0.jpg','1972-08-09',80,'Released','Where\'s Snoopy?','Snoopy, Come Home',15242,2.1394,7.1,'DsQaAYb6_wQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6319,_binary '\0','/t76lcBoe3oIgYBJHBImkgqw012U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069291',6.3,2312,'en','Snowball Express','When John Baxter inherits a ski resort in the Rocky Mountains, he quits his job in New York and moves the family west to run it. Only to find that the place is a wreck. But together they decide to try to fix it up and run it. But Martin Ridgeway, who wants the property, does everything he can to ensure it will fail.','/aApbK10fRmHWCEJtnMFfIeTAayl.jpg','1972-12-22',93,'Released',NULL,'Snowball Express',32140,2.7792,6.7,'j-oHPN9gTJQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6320,_binary '\0','/jZv1u7uzpOE5JOc2MmrvPUZWoyb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069293',7.9,105224,'ru','Солярис','A psychologist is sent to a space station orbiting a planet called Solaris to investigate the death of a doctor and the mental problems of cosmonauts on the station. He soon discovers that the water on the planet is a type of brain which brings out repressed memories and obsessions.','/pgqj7QoBPWFLLKtLEpPmFYFRMgB.jpg','1972-03-20',167,'Released','The planet where nightmares come true…','Solaris',593,6.6221,7.757,'BBYJH6UAAfw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6321,_binary '\0','/2og6dqoazyVl30uofnQ62yTiJvj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069298',5.2,2578,'en','Something Evil','A young couple moves into a farmhouse in rural Pennsylvania. What they don\'t know is that there is an unseen presence in the house, and that it wants to take possession of the wife.','/uh3PNv7qCVEnvIeDzMMDu6SJSw4.jpg','1972-01-21',73,'Released','It was a happy home... Until the devil had his way.','Something Evil',85483,2.4081,5.4,'mc3xO4JFl20','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6322,_binary '\0','/xWcLHR41XZ6IYINVWqJWtQUjsRl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069303',7.5,5391,'en','Sounder','The oldest son of a loving and strong family of black sharecroppers comes of age in the Depression-era South after his father is imprisoned for stealing food.','/cWFcxsy4tbf0ZXYs9s7IUE0irzh.jpg','1972-09-24',105,'Released',NULL,'Sounder',42489,2.2215,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6323,_binary '\0','/sZ25qWRmw74F8MZPkSCTeZDiUH5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069311',6.5,1977,'en','Steptoe & Son','Albert Steptoe and his son Harold are rag-and-bone men, complete with horse and cart to tour the neighbourhood. They also live together at the junk yard. Harold, who likes the bright lights in the West End of London, meets a stripper, marries her and takes her home. Albert is furious and tries every trick he knows to drive the new bride from his household.','/ihP86Oyt5qDNssKjtaeVrNXFhKr.jpg','1972-03-01',98,'Released','\"You\'d think if the Berk\'s going to get tied up with a stripper, he\'d do it on the telly - not on the big screen where everyone can see it - Dirty little devil.\"','Steptoe & Son',31787,1.1778,6.3,'qnwnPj9S4SY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6324,_binary '\0','/2b7lkEJ38ZHzYUaF6RIvN4L76XT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069316',6.3,2507,'en','The Stone Tape','A research team from an electronics company move into an old Victorian house to start work on finding a new recording medium. When team member Jill Greeley witnesses a ghost, team director Peter Brock decides not only to analyse the apparition, which he believes is a psychic impression trapped in a stone wall (dubbed a \"stone tape\"), but to exorcise it too - with terrifying results...','/oNa0LrdaOCZUFmSJZviBHBoXepZ.jpg','1972-12-25',90,'Released',NULL,'The Stone Tape',41032,1.2321,6.1,'0vIfl6CgZHc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6325,_binary '\0','/men5JQjope8q8mCwqwQwvmEm2zD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069318',5.7,1752,'en','Straight On Till Morning','Brenda, a timid, withdrawn woman, meets Peter, a man she believes is finally the love of her life. However, little does Brenda know that Peter is a vicious serial killer.','/2NqyQVPVnEqGWdfdNpK66XGkqBK.jpg','1972-07-09',96,'Released','She wished the night would never end... How could she know the morning would never come?','Straight On Till Morning',40210,2.1201,5.6,'NxBr_OjIK9s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6326,_binary '\0','/8GcT0zAVVlZj5nd85HSV6LqmAmP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069332',6.4,9434,'en','Super Fly','Priest, a New York City drug kingpin, devises a scheme to get out of the business and retire with a big payday, but his plans are complicated when a street dealer rats him out to the police.','/lCj4IZ9l8NfOEiM4zHq3BRF2LzX.jpg','1972-08-04',91,'Released','Never a dude like this one! He\'s got a plan to stick it to The Man!','Super Fly',21968,1.7341,6.314,'4SqdLsCsjYw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6327,_binary '\0','/QE9ILRngt3v67xkvNUPbjADPe2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069341',6.8,14833,'en','Tales from the Crypt','When a tourist group become lost within ancient catacombs, they meet the sinister Crypt Keeper, who tells them each their fate. The enigmatic figure\'s macabre stories involve a wife dabbling in murder, a retired sanitation worker targeted by his suspicious neighbors, and an adulterer who may face a fitting demise if the yarns come true.','/vA3wsl2lfurU6UFVs0Hg0cZJDah.jpg','1972-03-09',93,'Released','DEATH LIVES in the Vault of Horror!','Tales from the Crypt',38939,4.5212,6.8,'2_liPRYd2wA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6328,_binary '\0','/tfIDnwv6ibrKIQuKrXqbwGMfjPF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069343',6.3,4084,'it','La tarantola dal ventre nero','Inspector Tellini investigates serial crimes where victims are paralyzed while having their bellies ripped open with a sharp knife.','/m3ycrZfaDeTt3ITh9MOmV6fGp7R.jpg','1971-08-12',98,'Released','With needles dipped in deadly venom the victims are paralyzed - so they must lie awake and watch themselves die!','The Black Belly of the Tarantula',26504,2.8945,6.153,'7yqqElLu76c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6329,_binary '\0','/pVtO5k1wKqxmwQkk7o0EHq8Pk1a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069369',6.9,1875,'fr','Themroc','Themroc, a bachelor house painter living at home with his mother, leads a sad and colorless life. One day, after a run-in with his boss, he rebels. He wrecks his apartment, rejects every facet of bourgeois life, and begins acting like an urban, modern-day Neanderthal.','/sIac8tyFkFejfAoqjPK8MjvWRLt.jpg','1973-03-01',104,'Released',NULL,'Themroc',7014,2.1935,6.4,'ORfhpfZqz90','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6330,_binary '\0','/jDOsC7b5RVyrdYNrDZtuSjfflUQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069371',6.2,1446,'en','They Only Kill Their Masters','An enigmatic young woman has been murdered in a small California coast town. The investigation by the local sheriff uncovers a complex web of relationships centering on the victim; the scattered trail of evidence ranges from a mysterious photograph to the victim\'s own dog. During the investigation, the sheriff meets and becomes romantically involved with a woman whose connection to the murder is ambiguous.','/gRv91nooES0CwfQbamGl45Nv0rW.jpg','1972-11-22',97,'Released','Was the murderer a man... or man\'s best friend?','They Only Kill Their Masters',62996,1.9979,5.1,'HYDCcGppX78','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6331,_binary '\0','/oCyMlE4YFjHZDCer5D7H4hGf62C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069372',4.6,3123,'en','The Thing with Two Heads','A rich but racist man is dying and hatches an elaborate scheme for transplanting his head onto another man\'s body. His health deteriorates rapidly, and doctors are forced to transplant his head onto the only available candidate: a black man from death row.','/xYj9DpCeqM6bbvMvxlGqujU9boQ.jpg','1972-07-19',91,'Released','The doctor blew it--the most fantastic medical experiment of the age.','The Thing with Two Heads',28650,2.0907,5,'gWHNA_j7h5A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6332,_binary '\0','/bfWnD3ybA9vRbSHrJmhzbx9pakj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069383',6.2,3384,'fr','Tintin et le lac aux requins','Tintin and Captain Haddock are sent to guard Professor Calculus, who has invented a machine that can duplicate anything, and is staying in a village near the border of Syldavia and Borduria. However, an infamous and ruthless international criminal tries to lure Calculus and Tintin away by kidnapping two children, who live nearby, in order to get his clutches on the machine.','/8oV32sipspRjgTvSwfmdn24dNzr.jpg','1972-12-13',81,'Released',NULL,'Tintin and the Lake of Sharks',241004,2.4603,6.24,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6333,_binary '\0','/r1cA2duQeinxzEdRqlwjLArIb1W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069390',6.6,5473,'it','Tutti i colori del buio','After a car accident that caused the loss of her baby, Jane experiences an increasing amount of nightmares that shake her to her core. After seeking professional help, her haunting visions turn into an even more frightening reality, one full of black magic, blood orgies, and murder.','/bCZcyrLwZ2X1bSsRmfHQap4i9WS.jpg','1972-02-28',94,'Released','Enter a kaleidoscope of psychedelic horror!','All the Colours of the Dark',30901,2.688,6.636,'O--gF8nVkik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6334,_binary '\0','/viUQ2WRHqxYYnHhSHF5sUanfSMl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069393',7.4,1866,'en','Tomorrow','A lonely farmer takes in a pregnant woman and looks after her. After she gives birth, tragedy strikes.','/sq43h42ZATUMaJzRiLYZQMYnfVQ.jpg','1972-04-09',103,'Released',NULL,'Tomorrow',83135,1.2179,6.7,'vtXqM5hWkwA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6335,_binary '\0','/uRElXqD7Dv4KypsnS1OReQS7iFO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069398',6.5,4205,'fr','Tout va bien','A strike at a French sausage factory contributes to the estrangement of a married filmmaker and his reporter wife.','/6mJssZAMmziBP6tIe4vGTdNjeIA.jpg','1972-04-28',95,'Released',NULL,'Tout Va Bien',8071,1.874,6.6,'Ajmh_msQ8c0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6336,_binary '\0','/bRb9uhqaXm82Ioi6WUGLABikUCw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069400',7,8492,'fr','Trafic','Mr. Hulot is the head designer of the Altra Automotive Co. His latest invention is a newfangled camper car loaded with outrageous extra features. Along with the company\'s manager and publicity model, Hulot sets out from Paris with the intention of debuting the car at the annual auto show in Amsterdam. The going isn\'t easy, however, and the group encounters an increasingly bizarre series of hurdles and setbacks en route.','/7BaARzxivOQ5172ao39qoofEmVm.jpg','1971-04-16',96,'Released','The laughs are bumper to bumper!','Trafic',11378,3.1416,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6337,_binary '\0','/oQXWdCiHsnzBSuyK5HnGbuZ7YAM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069404',6.3,2965,'en','Travels with My Aunt','At his mother\'s funeral, stuffy bank clerk Henry Pulling meets his Aunt Augusta, an elderly eccentric with more-than-shady dealings who pulls him along on a whirlwind adventure as she attempts to rescue an old lover.','/2bycdsCdZ7oqZsLbViWRp2fnHEg.jpg','1972-12-17',109,'Released','The story of a Fabulous Dame who brought Style, Class, Grace and Beauty to Smuggling, Hustling, Gambling and Swindling.','Travels with My Aunt',5183,2.1728,6,'oCeiRB-dz4g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6338,_binary '\0','/6ZLsNzP4ActLYt8TV9g2u5ZnNtj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069414',6.7,1825,'en','Trouble Man','It seems that masked men are knocking over the floating crap games of Chalky and Pete. Chalky and Pete hire the cool, loose, elegant Mr. T to fix things. Then, the masked manipulators set up the death of a collector for a rival gang lord. It looks like it\'s up to T to hold a gang war from breaking out, keep the police off his back, and earn his fee from Chalky and Pete.','/dJPPdWX6ghQVaYDnVE7txw1Zb4i.jpg','1972-11-01',99,'Released','His friends call him Mr. T. His enemies call for mercy!','Trouble Man',21949,1.874,6.31,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6339,_binary '\0','/qxBgqQpfkcusqEBeaITpQQO3vJs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069421',6.6,5444,'it','Il tuo vizio è una stanza chiusa e solo io ne ho la chiave','Oliviero is a drunk, burned-out writer who amuses himself by hosting orgies at his grand country manor and humiliating his wife Irina. When a number of women are murdered in grisly fashion, Oliviero becomes a prime suspect.','/tSpHChci1vxD7WwRkbqcDXgyRpj.jpg','1972-08-04',97,'Released','Unlock the Secrets of Your Darkest Desires!','Your Vice Is a Locked Room and Only I Have the Key',69872,2.4987,6.5,'CYs8Tcz9HW8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6340,_binary '\0','/rYzNJv3Ee2kM0HUCdEvgdADdDy5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069427',6.6,7671,'en','Twins of Evil','While dabbling in Satanism, Count Karstein resurrects Mircalla Karnstein who initiates him into vampirism. As a rash of deaths afflicts the village, Gustav the head of Puritan group leads his men to seek out and destroy the pestilence. One of his twin nieces has become inflicted with the witchcraft but Gustav\'s zeal and venom has trapped the innocent Maria, threatening her with a tortuous execution, whilst Frieda remains free to continue her orgy of evil.','/muBFwxCOV3duOMAMIYREOgsyABq.jpg','1971-10-17',87,'Released','Which is the Virgin? Which is the Vampire?','Twins of Evil',28801,2.8065,6.7,'3_Ri5W6GmHU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6341,_binary '\0','/j2NA18Cy6AKwSWEwXJaAaqZ2H0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069436',7,7302,'en','Ulzana\'s Raid','After fierce war chief Ulzana and a small war party jump the reservation bent on murder and terror, an inexperienced young lieutenant is assigned to track him down.','/mftnQcqDDFEIOLc8M4rA626MaEC.jpg','1972-10-27',103,'Released','One man alone understood the savagery of the early American west from both sides.','Ulzana\'s Raid',42491,4.5648,6.89,'UTeVqaFpcE4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6342,_binary '\0','/8Smr9xgJjULayKV9V04mJkz9OEE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069442',6.5,3002,'fr','Une belle fille comme moi','Young sociologist Stanislas Previne is writing a thesis on criminal women, so he visits Camille Bliss in prison for an interview. Accused of murdering her husband and her lover, Camille recounts her life and love affairs.','/b2WwhSb7Ia53Q1n4GehBIyPewAK.jpg','1972-09-13',98,'Released',NULL,'A Gorgeous Kid Like Me',4683,2.3488,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6343,_binary '\0','/rUxKWTnVDK8ru7UK7Q2vHRRWeob.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069449',5.8,1853,'en','Up the Sandbox','Bored with day-to-day life in New York City and neglected by her husband, a young wife and mother slips into increasingly outrageous fantasies: her mother breaking into the apartment, an explorer\'s demonstration of tribal fertility music at a party causing strange transformations, and joining terrorists to plant explosives in the Statue of Liberty.','/8Fdb2ewRZoAVb57KifXgyUZDlnE.jpg','1972-12-21',97,'Released','What\'s Barbra up to? Up the marriage trap. Up the revolution. Up the Zambesi River. And up to something surprisingly wonderful.','Up the Sandbox',42492,2.1577,5.9,'2aiOBIYSb9k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6344,_binary '\0','/4N4iOm0ZFYatx0K1GJ1URGVd8nY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069451',6.3,1583,'fr','La Vallée','Viviane, a French Consul\'s wife, is in New Guinea to find exotic feathers for export to Paris. She encounters four European travelers who are en route to \"La Vallée\": The Valley, high in the Guinean mountains, is shown on maps as \'obscured by clouds\' and is beyond their previous experiences. Viviane joins their trek to find rare feathers and soon becomes entwined in their journey. Their extended stay with the Mapuga tribe brings a denouement between western and indigenous values before their final quest toward the \'Valley of the Gods\'.','/5aeeuieLTqJQuJMtwnS3yedd2Cx.jpg','1972-07-11',105,'Released','Obscured by clouds','The Valley',63327,3.319,5.808,'3N_Lyad5IdM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6345,_binary '\0','/mfHTKqt4yF6JFhV4vrfrm3RTOaI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069452',8.1,3307,'sh','Valter brani Sarajevo','Sarajevo 1944. The German armies desperately need fuel in the retreat. Walter, the enigmatic and charismatic leader of the resistance movement, can endanger their supplies. The Germans are taking a cunning plan to remove that obstacle.','/e7Ce3RDTXlXsSom14vRykQRqEbS.jpg','1972-04-12',133,'Released',NULL,'Walter Defends Sarajevo',90617,2.5191,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6346,_binary '\0','/vD2tsvQyKZC2LhdmrOsFS9vGpOP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069460',6.8,1433,'fr','Le Viager','In 1930, Louis Martinet, a peaceful sexagenarian, no longer has a long life to live according to the words of his doctor, Leon Galipeau, who sees to take advantage of the very interesting situation of the \"future deceased\". This one indeed has a small house in Saint-Tropez. Galipeau sniffs the windfall. Following his advice, Martinet agrees to give it in life to the brother of the doctor, Emile, and then rushes back to a health of iron. Worse, he even survives the war. Galipeau, exhausted, decide to use the great means to get rid of the importunce who persists in thwarting their project ...','/axblx8rNjqvNXH3rolqKkWWUAeq.jpg','1972-01-19',100,'Released',NULL,'The Annuity',62363,2.4741,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6347,_binary '\0','/4ZKHFZjp6epxFkKDUYION6WSFUw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069464',4.8,1867,'en','Virgin Witch','A pair of mini-skirted birds travel to a remote castle in order to land a contract in the modelling agency of the mysterious lesbian Sybil Waite.','/bCObu32TPQxUDOgeCOMMRjOjb6h.jpg','1972-04-01',89,'Released','Every man was hers to command','Virgin Witch',72153,2.0709,4.5,'RyixXFzmJv8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6348,_binary '\0','/5FavuUTRtloz41DYWqN4CWOHwdZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069466',6.3,1782,'en','The Visitors','Bill, Martha and their little child Hal are spending a quiet winter Sunday in their cosy house when they get an unexpected visit from Mike Nickerson and Tony Rodriguez. Mike and Tony are old acquaintances of Bill; a few years back, in Vietnam, they were in the same platoon. They also became opposed parties in a court martial - for a reason that Bill never explained to Martha. What happened in Vietnam, and what is the reason for the presence of Mike and Tony ?','/rlnSJXYfCzbmBN2utn7BRZX5Lak.jpg','1972-02-02',88,'Released','Every one wants to turn his back on violence until it knocks at his front door.','The Visitors',102699,1.4559,6,'cxXpm7tMVgk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6349,_binary '\0','/xmLgdb0yDBXa7Dlo3aCzjhjCkuE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069467',7.9,40262,'sv','Viskningar och rop','As Agnes slowly dies of cancer, her sisters are so immersed in their own psychic pains that they are unable to offer her the support she needs.','/a1bMgB09YDvvRN9SitCclUYragr.jpg','1972-12-21',95,'Released','Four women dressed in white in a mansion painted red... haunted by whispers and cries.','Cries and Whispers',10238,3.6314,7.9,'zc8f9ZlMnTU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6350,_binary '\0','/3uT2LA3EkfgzErJlRo335ZJ5ue3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069492',6.9,1540,'pl','Wesele','Set at the turn of the century, the story concerns a Polish poet living in Cracow who has decided to marry a peasant girl. The wedding is attended by a heterogenous group of people from all strata of Polish society, who dance, get drunk and lament Poland\'s 100-year-long division under Russia, Prussia, and Austria. The bridegroom, a painter friend, and a journalist each in turn is confronted with spectres of Polish past.','/dadMgycHQG31ulWw5OG32pdTPa7.jpg','1973-01-09',102,'Released',NULL,'The Wedding',153917,1.1169,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6351,_binary '\0','/lDeH6UkNGX2UcaOKTJ5SHtmNwbD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069495',7.6,29648,'en','What\'s Up, Doc?','The accidental mix-up of four identical plaid overnight bags leads to a series of increasingly wild and wacky situations.','/d5WwZxneeAH2Kj2SeDV6oUY2oW0.jpg','1972-03-09',94,'Released','A screwball comedy. Remember them?','What\'s Up, Doc?',6949,5.1137,7.4,'xpThOyG1EVI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6352,_binary '\0','/YIKqNExn1AK8qFK9xX3RpDJWxl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069515',6,1402,'en','The Wrath of God','Set in the 1920s, several foreigners held by a South American military group are offered possible freedom if they accept to topple a local crazed military leader.','/7v59ag4DhRzPL9jyVZI2RiHJPPc.jpg','1972-07-14',111,'Released','They offered them a choice—THE FIRING SQUAD . . . or The Wrath of God','The Wrath of God',68247,1.9803,5.5,'oFukI5fSl3g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6353,_binary '\0','/gi9Ca5ij1Gq8Jp6wneztdmX7Ysq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069516',5.8,1632,'en','Zee and Co.','The venomous and amoral wife of a wealthy architect tries, any way she can, to break up the blossoming romance between her husband and his new mistress; a good-natured young widow who holds a dark past.','/9jh2dEmg5n9xOKDRjaeq3pvhxJU.jpg','1972-01-21',110,'Released','An Absolute Ball','Zee and Co.',120653,1.7726,5.7,'bKwx1yVZHqY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6354,_binary '\0','/clO5OH1RK9gyFasMTqkVN1RRLA9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069518',7.1,1957,'zh','新獨臂刀','Lei Li lost his right-arm in a sword duel with the master of a martial arts school, long ago. Now, he is able to defend himself well with just his left arm, and kung fu techniques. That he proves with just the help of his friend Chung-Chieng, when he crosses his path with a beautiful girl in need, Pao Chiao. Even against impossible odds, he will prove a great warrior.','/80wyNgKIPJCMTb8lzaG9rbezV10.jpg','1971-02-07',102,'Released','It slashes! It smashes! It rips you apart! It\'s the bloodiest weapon of the martial arts! Watch it outdo Kung-Fu!','The New One-Armed Swordsman',28039,2.8421,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6355,_binary '\0','/iKTeIaZgH8MVkDap5nCQrdfbzW0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069528',6.7,3359,'en','Young Winston','This historical drama is an account of the early life of British politician Winston Churchill, including his childhood years, his time as a war correspondent in Africa, and culminating with his first election to Parliament.','/lBrw76I5NSsHwS8IcPPCe49JjqC.jpg','1972-07-20',149,'Released','Rebel Soldier Hustler Prisoner Fugitive Firebrand','Young Winston',66775,2.4088,6.2,'2J2r4xp2bFU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6356,_binary '\0','/pwkDMraeADUZ7xfHsxwUAKSOjhu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069530',5.6,1617,'en','Z.P.G.','In the not too distant future, an overpopulated Earth government makes it illegal to have children for a generation. One couple, unsatisfied with their substitute robot baby, breaks the rules.','/rAV2ZiU3mAe0fyqGhHp3N8e5XoF.jpg','1972-05-25',97,'Released','Smog covers the earth. The oxygen is depleted. Love is encouraged. But the penalty for birth is death. The time Is tomorrow and there\'s no time left.','Z.P.G.',52608,1.6335,6.1,'RLVrtfQ6Udk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6357,_binary '\0','/h23aOGIcQJZvomRpC5GI3UmCMtW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069671',7.8,3304,'hi','Abhimaan','A popular singer encourages his wife to sing, but tensions mount between the pair when his career begins to falter and her own musical career and popularity surpasses his own.','/w0PDRsh1f9G6NVvoixzYNmTnpvv.jpg','1973-07-27',122,'Released',NULL,'Abhimaan',75352,1.011,7.4,'le4DkcF_OPg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6358,_binary '\0','/gDibTI8sDBhFnczL3VqHhlnfq78.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069687',7.8,15372,'de','Alice in den Städten','German journalist Philip Winter has a case of writer’s block when trying to write an article about the United States. He decides to return to Germany, and while trying to book a flight, encounters a German woman and her nine year old daughter Alice doing the same. The three become friends (almost out of necessity) and while the mother asks Winter to mind Alice temporarily, it quickly becomes apparent that Alice will be his responsibility for longer than he expected.','/lw22wORmENkTZHGXI6bKmAIHxjO.jpg','1974-05-17',110,'Released',NULL,'Alice in the Cities',2204,5.0114,7.7,'s6KYAJZeuEA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6359,_binary '\0','/fF7higUaFGlfesmrFxRcyKQkt9l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069690',7,1490,'it','Allonsanfàn','After the 1815 Restoration, an aging revolutionary finds himself reluctantly involved in an attempted insurrection in Southern Italy while growing increasingly disillusioned with his cause.','/3tJu2LKI81r7aZRVQ1B3s3qLgds.jpg','1974-09-06',111,'Released',NULL,'Allonsanfan',49125,1.4252,6.9,'qOAbB0KeaJo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6360,_binary '\0','/f7RD6xGAWnFxHYz88HQLEqtlDJ3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069697',7.3,15768,'it','...altrimenti ci arrabbiamo!','After a tied 1st place in a local stunt race, two drivers start a contest to decide who of them will own the prize, a dune buggy. But when a mobster destroys the car, they are determined to get it back.','/oERikPHC3cr9UDCale6YrQxkyNW.jpg','1974-03-29',102,'Released','When the bad guys get mad, the good guys get mad and everything gets madder & madder & madder','Watch Out, We\'re Mad',6916,4.4255,7.459,'HBp-GAbDTYY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6361,_binary '\0','/xdofxnT2FADbSFOJflOTLnCoZe9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069704',7.4,106697,'en','American Graffiti','A couple of high school graduates spend one final night cruising the strip with their buddies before they go off to college.','/1tjLivPad2PX8FAzWko7FPIb8d2.jpg','1973-08-11',112,'Released','Where were you in \'62?','American Graffiti',838,7.1643,7.1,'HBI0p5OGlDw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6362,_binary '\0','/xEKT9VsLArVohWIrYNxANmS7V2D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069713',6.2,3733,'it','Anche gli angeli mangiano fagioli','Two mismatched buddies are mistaken for mob enforcers in Depression-era America.','/hEeC0pFHZ4gK13czO0BJHwDpdzI.jpg','1973-03-22',118,'Released','Al Capone... Get lost! Dillinger... Phooey on you! Here come the funniest crooks since crime began!','Even Angels Eat Beans',11612,3.426,6.413,'zplU8ZVBZWg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6363,_binary '\0','/c0zsDJV9Xhb4rhzWWzgFEh1S3mO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069715',5.9,3677,'en','And Now the Screaming Starts!','In the late 18th century, two newlyweds move into the stately mansion of the Fengriffen family. The young bride is victim of terrifying visions and apparitions, threatening her very sanity. A London psychiatrist comes to her help and uncovers the terrible secret that haunts the estate.','/t7qtRYAL9K1g0FAv3QHEvZ12ork.jpg','1973-04-27',91,'Released','The hand that crawls, kills, and lives!','And Now the Screaming Starts!',42455,3.3445,5.938,'5v2Gi865mwI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6364,_binary '\0','/7odef8E6b8D2jbiPpZF7LbUpz0G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069718',5.1,2112,'sv','Anita','Anita, a young woman with a troubled childhood and a hunger for love, finds a soul mate in Erik, a kindly college student.','/8V62sQJzSL37tCyTko4rmtqMiN1.jpg','1973-12-25',95,'Released','Too soon, too often','Anita, Swedish Nymphet',47397,4.0279,5.1,'hNPcCOUpD7g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6365,_binary '\0','/jTbbgsAt0Vr8HHOQ2uE7VhFyBpZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069729',5.2,2609,'en','The Arena','Female gladiators fight to the death. Inspired by the story of Spartacus, follow the adventures of a bevy of slave girls who, upon finding themselves thrust into the gladiator ring, mount a vicious rebellion to fight their way to freedom.','/rqQlMxVJWPwYM74IhEqDane2FSX.jpg','1974-03-13',81,'Released','See wild women fight to the death!','The Arena',29039,4.6547,5.308,'9rUEaCfSHLg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6366,_binary '\0','/gMnWYxjHHj8g7sD2YugHE9rpoyD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069737',7.9,1905,'bn','অশনি সংকেত','Gangacharan is the new Brahmin of a village, where he assumes various duties: teaching, organizing religious events, and trying to prevent epidemics. But in that year 1943, war is raging (as reminded by the planes occasionally heard flying over the countryside), and a major famine is under way. As food shortages reach catastrophic proportions, Gangacharan attempts to preserve his privileged situation, while his generous wife, Ananga, conversely tries to help and support the community.','/7AT7RPArBH6k5Ac01VSk2uWQkZW.jpg','1973-08-16',101,'Released',NULL,'Distant Thunder',113012,1.0214,6.784,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6367,_binary '\0','/b3PWUGgCUkNXtQajcg6zxfFqqUp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069738',6.2,3617,'en','The Asphyx','Hugo is a brilliant turn-of-the-century scientist, loved and respected by his family and friends, admired by his colleagues. But he is a man quickly becoming obsessed with a curious and frightening question...What is the mysterious apparition found in the photographs of his dying subjects?','/grAI6PofWfdW41bNUY5uKRiLn4z.jpg','1972-12-05',99,'Released','If It Were In Your Power…Would You Sacrifice Your Wife…Your Children For Immortality? This Is The Story Of A Man Who Did!','The Asphyx',37618,2.0185,6,'qXahqEvXOs0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6368,_binary '\0','/ggVZ6xsu5o1SR5PtVifz1ak1xUk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069745',4.7,2380,'fr','La Comtesse noire','A mute noblewoman\'s vampiric heritage compels her to drain the life force from all of her lovers.','/q1wjoDIkpZdF7RlpEhZOIdkNODH.jpg','1975-01-24',105,'Released','World famous shock!','Female Vampire',28802,4.3277,4.5,'srE9j5axIX4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6369,_binary '\0','/4VgyburZo88ocO1aSRFm0i5H5VX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069747',7.4,16531,'fr','Les Aventures de Rabbi Jacob','In this riot of frantic disguises and mistaken identities, Victor Pivert, a blustering, bigoted French factory owner, finds himself taken hostage by Slimane, an Arab rebel leader. The two dress up as rabbis as they try to elude not only assasins from Slimane\'s country, but also the police, who think Pivert is a murderer. Pivert ends up posing as Rabbi Jacob, a beloved figure who\'s returned to France for his first visit after 30 years in the United States. Adding to the confusion are Pivert\'s dentist-wife, who thinks her husband is leaving her for another woman, their daughter, who\'s about to get married, and a Parisian neighborhood filled with people eager to celebrate the return of Rabbi Jacob.','/oYuCFxS2BGCHNGuv9No0GoP2DZf.jpg','1973-10-17',100,'Released','THE WILD... THE HILARIOUS... THE SCREWBALL... THE RIOTOUS','The Mad Adventures of Rabbi Jacob',760,4.7525,7.368,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6370,_binary '\0','/zXWeiuM3Gk5aMlAaXiGaICvSBf4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069753',5.7,2788,'it','Baba Yaga','A mysterious witch casts a spell on an attractive young fashion photographer, who is then thrust into a world of sadism.','/9jXaty7Z7WpZBFFb1zB5ztI7IN9.jpg','1973-09-20',89,'Released','Is it real or is it a dream.','Baba Yaga',55689,1.6987,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6371,_binary '\0','/f2iMBg9Z1LGxuzzVvBhgdUU0ECR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069754',6.1,5232,'en','The Baby','A social worker who recently lost her husband investigates the strange Wadsworth family. The Wadsworths might not seem too unusual to hear about them at first - consisting of the mother, two grown daughters and the diaper-clad, bottle-sucking baby. The problem is, the baby is twenty-one years old.','/ovk7WxoO5Bu970qGCQuF6DgrwZw.jpg','1973-03-01',84,'Released','What goes on in this nursery isn\'t for kids!','The Baby',28156,1.9492,5.921,'vITUjvwnavc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6372,_binary '\0','/5rp9Jydh9RxrvVBW2lr27B8NYiT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069762',7.7,85496,'en','Badlands','An impressionable teenage girl from a dead-end town and her older greaser boyfriend embark on a killing spree in the South Dakota badlands.','/z81rBzHNgiNLean2JTGHgxjJ8nq.jpg','1973-10-13',94,'Released','In 1959 a lot of people were killing time. Kit and Holly were killing people.','Badlands',3133,4.7426,7.5,'qKykxE7CBbc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6373,_binary '\0','/4lFsPbhYcez7EvKCpNyVl9IacsD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069765',6.7,6877,'en','Bang the Drum Slowly','The story of a New York pro baseball team and two of its players. Henry Wiggen is the star pitcher and Bruce Pearson is the normal, everyday catcher who is far from the star player on the team and friend to all of his teammates. During the off-season, Bruce learns that he is terminally ill, and Henry, his only true friend, is determined to be the one person there for him during his last season with the club. Throughout the course of the season, Henry and his teammates attempt to deal with Bruce\'s impending illness, all the while attempting to make his last year a memorable one.','/2MojRzTHI2UMmhEANYZZCsMPHr.jpg','1973-08-26',96,'Released','Nothing is more important than friendship. Not fame, not money, not death.','Bang the Drum Slowly',42459,2.6588,6.1,'28fwlUT3R_Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6374,_binary '\0','/3ap6vhJN7q87mziDP6EltPGQ0hW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069768',5.4,38241,'en','Battle for the Planet of the Apes','The fifth and final episode in the Planet of the Apes series. After the collapse of human civilization, a community of intelligent apes led by Caesar lives in harmony with a group of humans. Gorilla General Aldo tries to cause an ape civil war and a community of human mutants who live beneath a destroyed city try to conquer those whom they perceive as enemies. All leading to the finale.','/dP5dYjLp5p2CG103cJMio4Nj29d.jpg','1973-06-15',93,'Released','The final chapter in the incredible Apes saga. The most suspenseful showdown ever filmed as two civilizations battle for the right to inherit what\'s left of the earth!','Battle for the Planet of the Apes',1705,7.8451,5.7,'yg_cSD2VnE8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6375,_binary '\0','/plNeBZJYJPQPvwo5ne619JMPlPr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069786',6.3,2180,'en','Billy Two Hats','After a bank robbery, runaway Scottish outlaw Arch Deans and his young half-breed Kiowa partner Billy Two Hats develop a father-son relationship, but Sheriff Henry Gifford is determined to capture or kill them.','/nDgbZ1JYQxrqNmv3HNLULDBysKL.jpg','1974-03-07',99,'Released','Against the Law...Against the Odds...Against the Land Itself','Billy Two Hats',32143,2.4379,5.8,'z_RKoDpMMNc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6376,_binary '\0','/mkXgr4XmqA1ZvgKJmpS619jbrzO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069792',6.4,4558,'en','Black Caesar','Raised in Harlem, Tommy Gibbs becomes a successful mob boss but he clashes with the rival Mafia and his old enemy, dirty cop McKinney.','/yq07GtsZiN1Ot2QkTWsKQypq65m.jpg','1973-02-07',95,'Released','Hail Caesar Godfather of Harlem!','Black Caesar',22029,2.4124,5.9,'d-Pnkr_dZOk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6377,_binary '\0','/ld4CD24YlmhRkHLK9FAwMdkhrU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069795',3.5,1658,'en','Blackenstein','Eddie is a Vietnam veteran who loses his arms and legs when he steps on a land mine, but a brilliant surgeon is able to attach new limbs. Unfortunately, an insanely jealous assistant (who has fallen in love with Eddie\'s fiancée) switches Eddie\'s DNA injections, transforming him into a gigantic killer.','/qUDG9xyeogKzGa2QZu8zRNtu6sH.jpg','1973-08-03',87,'Released','To Stop This Mutha Takes One Bad Brutha','Blackenstein',3162,1.1239,3.2,'L0Fxt4LVUQg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6378,_binary '\0','/vDxDTqm9SEgBESJ5kSrbuz7tHVi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069808',6.2,1407,'en','Blume in Love','Lawyer Stephen Blume, who specializes in divorces, lives a paradoxical situation when, having his own marriage break up, is still in love with his ex-wife.','/4Jw2nycNuJmUyTHhVtLwX64IBv6.jpg','1973-06-17',115,'Released','A love story for guys who cheat on their wives.','Blume in Love',109259,1.5861,5.917,'XFB2kgulgOU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6379,_binary '\0','/42f79S8A8pbmIpmpeLOaHRdROCH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069810',6.9,2204,'hi','Bobby','Raja is the 18-year-old son of a wealthy Bombay businessman who suffers from his parents coldness and neglect. Shortly after finishing school he meets Bobby, the 16-year-old daughter of a poor Christian fisherman. They fall head over heels for each other, but they\'ll need everything they have to defend their love as their families won\'t accept them marrying each other...','/mdQvasLl8UnMlamFCXpm2PsAg2T.jpg','1973-09-28',169,'Released',NULL,'Bobby',21496,1.5298,6.1,'DXvv6xokD6U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6380,_binary '\0','/mC1QbEH8SLqMrDCvPxELjizHS8O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069815',7.3,2243,'fr','La Bonne Année','Released from prison under a New Year amnesty, a criminal tries to pick up the threads of a life changed not only by his daring plan to rob a jewelry store in out-of-season Cannes, but also by a very special someone he met there.','/3JdSrp8qV1LhYIXKONT5iP4i4LV.jpg','1973-04-13',115,'Released',NULL,'Happy New Year',76329,1.5511,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6381,_binary '\0','/hImS5c3fhNvCF49ZUoLvVeuh4ip.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069818',6.9,2682,'it','Il boss','A hitman finds himself embroiled in the middle of a Mafia war between the Sicilians and the Calabrians.','/30xGVTvuyqvsahIWt2nkKWD4o6C.jpg','1973-02-01',109,'Released',NULL,'The Boss',58402,1.6792,6.8,'4Ka0kivkyxY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6382,_binary '\0','/xgsM30RQYtrdCJZ9XtFaLOpqTuG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069822',7,6588,'en','Breezy','A free-spirited young woman, Breezy, hitches a ride with an aging real estate salesman, Frank. Sensing that she just wants to use him he tries to have nothing to do with her. She\'s not that easy to shake, however, and over time a bond forms between them.','/5wZT5l2Ys4pAzxkZg6f8lMHREJK.jpg','1973-11-18',108,'Released','Her name is Breezy...and love was all they had in common.','Breezy',40374,3.2308,6.8,'4qrRMblJmLU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6383,_binary '\0','/s3h57HUNewjGiX2kCXaTzg5DAXr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069824',7.2,5389,'it','Fratello sole, sorella luna','In his delirium from his return from war, Francesco Bernardone goes back in his memories to the days when he lived for parties and carnal pleasures. He slowly recovers, but after the illness he is no longer the Francesco that everybody knew. Instead of spending hours in taverns, he meditates on the beauty of God\'s creatures, soon renouncing his riches and his family with plans to rebuild an abandoned church and his life.','/hbe9jnRQKyxtLr2krJR6RBRwzae.jpg','1972-03-03',121,'Released','A Motion Picture That Celebrates The Timeless Joy of Original Innocence','Brother Sun, Sister Moon',2587,2.5497,7.062,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6384,_binary '\0','/8O3lOzIh5VathDwLl56t8xjhVhh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069833',6,3205,'it','Valdez, il mezzosangue','Chino Valdez is a loner horse breeder living in the old west. Partly a loner by choice, and partly because, being a \'half-breed\', he finds himself unwelcome almost everywhere he goes. One day, a young runaway named Jimmy shows up at his door looking for work and a roof over his head. Reluctantly, Chino agrees to take him in and teach him the art of raising, breaking and breeding horses, until the pair finally begin to accept each other.','/sFbU6gkpG8XNoTMxAKkZLzFUJMx.jpg','1973-09-14',98,'Released','They took his land... his horses... his woman... but... they couldn\'t take Chino!','The Valdez Horses',73984,2.3001,5.6,'etb_lWyUhHI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6385,_binary '\0','/An7FB0dUXNiN5qUCZzIYmZbaT32.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069834',6.5,7924,'en','Cahill: United States Marshal','J.D. Cahill is the toughest U.S. Marshal they\'ve got, just the sound of his name makes bad guys stop in their tracks, so when his two young boy\'s want to get his attention they decide to rob a bank. They end up getting more than they bargained for.','/oR3yIiQNL4EdYZJHNE8spFpV21b.jpg','1973-07-11',103,'Released','A lawman and his sons face the ultimate test of courage.','Cahill: United States Marshal',30708,3.3457,6.1,'E-WqI5Xj0ig','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6386,_binary '\0','/rjC4zVbYXik0nhqylTUi8L3KOEN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069838',5.7,1809,'es','La campana del infierno','When John is released from a psychiatric center where he has been hospitalized for a long time, he decides to move into the house of his dead mother, whose inheritance is in dispute.','/nrUFmBvg41uGKwOFZHHk5hlMMe6.jpg','1974-07-19',94,'Released','Who will escape the terror?','Bell from Hell',52849,1.6914,5.6,'zrjDbZN4-5w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6387,_binary '\0','/wscBs1ytePjFSRsmULo2F7FkgFa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069840',6.4,2001,'en','The Candy Snatchers','A nonverbal autistic boy stumbles upon a teenage heiress who has been kidnapped by a trio of young psychopaths, who are intent on extorting diamonds from her stepfather.','/jGTe3W3kPoVMv1Sf5Kt9zX0h4EQ.jpg','1973-06-01',95,'Released','It started as such a simple crime. For 16 year old Candy, dying would have been easier! Was a piece of Candy worth a fortune in diamonds?','The Candy Snatchers',39889,1.778,6.4,'ca1dCdbntZc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6388,_binary '\0','/4X2ZRyDRdnI8i7ACmBehJYmuL41.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069841',4.6,1704,'en','Cannibal Girls','A young couple spend the night in a restaurant, only to find out that it is haunted by three dead women who hunger for human flesh.','/rsKWMYCgrhUcL8xKKkatHl7Ep19.jpg','1973-04-01',84,'Released','These girls do exactly what you think they do!','Cannibal Girls',58411,5.5187,4.6,'J6_BfJuPwvA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6389,_binary '\0','/etDqWEYNL9Xd6dQDRu6RVWcpPmX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069847',6.5,4779,'en','Carry On Abroad','A group of holidaymakers head for the Spanish resort of Elsbels for a 4-day visit. When they get there, they find the Hotel still hasn\'t been finished being built, and the weather is awful. And there is something strange about the staff—they all look very similar. To top it all off, the weather seems to be having an adverse affect on the Hotel\'s foundations.','/2x2D6yhDJHz5hKM9tWHjP6IIFdU.jpg','1972-12-01',88,'Released','The holiday of a laughtime!','Carry On Abroad',19252,2.1848,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6390,_binary '\0','/7UPSzrQ3nxdMqOToe9R7tiq8r7c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069848',5.8,3540,'en','Carry On Girls','Local councillor Sidney Fiddler persuades the Mayor to help improve the image of their rundown seaside town by holding a beauty contest. But formidable Councillor Prodworthy, head of the local women\'s liberation movement, has other ideas. It\'s open warfare as the women\'s lib attempt to sabotage the contest.','/lSRcLXg4pz5yg7KQ3fhrRxSXgT3.jpg','1973-11-09',88,'Released','When it comes to Beauty Queens - It\'s \'Carry On\' and Bust!','Carry On Girls',26329,2.0938,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6391,_binary '\0','/qkA5MrTzb2C7eVMA8PT2uc8LKI1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069850',5.2,1371,'it','Casa d\'appuntamento','After a French prostitute is found dead, one of her regular clients is tried and convicted for her murder. He is eventually sentenced to death but dies in a high speed pursuit after attempting to escape custody. Soon, the witnesses that testified against him end up being systematically murdered by a mysterious killer wearing black gloves.','/4O6XZdBXm6DwJzH3eh3A7LHE3Tx.jpg','1972-06-15',91,'Released',NULL,'The French Sex Murders',39910,1.759,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6392,_binary '\0','/qoTRtiXznXlvWlgZz6rDMdB0hse.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069851',3.9,1404,'it','Terror! Il castello delle donne maledette','Mad Dr Frankenstein recruits an evil dwarf, a Neanderthal man, and others to help him put a brain in the body of a brute.','/r0CX7tL90LNjSG6ewsoQgaf9XMW.jpg','1974-02-19',90,'Released','Terror stalks the castle when the secret of life falls into the wrong hands.','Frankenstein\'s Castle of Freaks',3159,2.0659,4.3,'shh3KUTqYOg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6393,_binary '\0','/3fQ3C4SetoVxSsODFPqJqmIOhJQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069865',7.5,16117,'en','Charley Varrick','Charley Varrick robs a bank in a small town with his friends, but instead of obtaining a small amount of money, they discover they stole a very large amount of money belonging to the mob. Charley must now come up with a plan to not only evade the police but the mob as well.','/qPG2VPNA72he1Kczm2yFmslPNZN.jpg','1973-09-19',111,'Released','When he runs out of dumb luck, he always has genius to fall back on!','Charley Varrick',27331,3.7999,7.4,'TxaqjQWQVAk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6394,_binary '\0','/5CmrF7EqhYINcKh5uoS66GVOQyw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069883',6.7,2682,'en','Cinderella Liberty','A lonely Navy sailor falls in love with a Seattle hooker and becomes a surrogate father figure for her son during an extended liberty due to his service records being lost.','/eySmZJyPAJ4nQDvrpU59NSCbZHI.jpg','1973-12-18',117,'Released','She\'s 32. She drinks too much. She hustles pool. She\'s got a 10-year old mulatto son. She\'s got a different boyfriend every night. She\'s in trouble. And he\'s in love.','Cinderella Liberty',84847,1.8982,6.7,'YAvQmjpSHS8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6395,_binary '\0','/mCtJjF5L5NuK3bY1uzA5tY6xpAz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069890',5.9,3804,'en','Cleopatra Jones','After federal agent Cleopatra Jones orders the burning of a Turkish poppy field, the notorious drug lord Mommy vows to destroy her.','/j13LI9r1Jim2XPvmJUvwGFtD0ag.jpg','1973-07-13',89,'Released','6 feet 2\" and all of it Dynamite!','Cleopatra Jones',26196,1.9505,5.7,'7J5IRiBmt-o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6396,_binary '\0','/iCdtK81PavU2Tcm5nuuPipG0gHt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069895',6.1,16421,'en','The Crazies','The military attempts to contain a manmade virus causing death and permanent insanity in those infected, as it overtakes a small Pennsylvania town.','/xSNgBJL9WKMHwl42gZXeRsQXFa1.jpg','1973-03-16',103,'Released','Why are the good people dying?','The Crazies',29425,4.019,6.1,'HJZGab6J1bk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6397,_binary '\0','/jztSvvmOUEP8V85xadxMRoE5e2O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069897',6.8,15178,'en','Coffy','After her younger sister gets involved in drugs and is severely injured by contaminated heroin, a nurse sets out on a mission of vengeance and vigilante justice, killing drug dealers, pimps, and mobsters who cross her path.','/sN00Cvlahl6JLC2TAUBL0jZOqD3.jpg','1973-06-13',90,'Released','The Baddest One-Chick Hit-Squad that ever hit town!','Coffy',22021,3.8148,6.6,'dyz9XeQwggQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6398,_binary '\0','/9wAvwP9EiPSEfqLLt5fILVnbEDh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069920',6.5,9312,'it','I corpi presentano tracce di violenza carnale','A masked serial killer with psychosexual issues strangles female coeds with scarves before dismembering them. When a wealthy student identifies one of the scarves and thinks she has a lead on a suspect, she becomes the killer\'s next target, retreating to her family\'s remote cliffside villa with three of her girlfriends.','/tWwaVVGHkl9FTVRApyAQdBa2ayU.jpg','1973-01-04',93,'Released','Enter... if you dare the bizarre world of the psychosexual mind.','Torso',31624,2.8881,6.602,'6H3C15_NY7c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6399,_binary '\0','/npWa7mElae0zx9tI0AiJGkmmf5j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069933',4.7,1218,'es','La tumba de la isla maldita','Two archaeologists on a scientific dig come across a vampire burial ground and discover that the creatures are about to awaken and attack a nearby village.','/w76lLGLlFpthlTgXOVulzvk2xRY.jpg','1973-03-01',85,'Released','THE UNDEAD DIES...AGAIN, AGAIN AND AGAIN!','Hannah, Queen of the Vampires',86748,1.8615,4.9,'YS6o6T6Op1w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6400,_binary '\0','/5I6yjyIKzAeQd5C1ynJnfWCK22u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069945',6.1,30740,'en','Dark Star','A group of scientists are sent on a mission to destroy unstable planets. Twenty years into their mission, they have to battle their alien mascot as well as a \"sensitive\" and intelligent bombing device that starts to question the meaning of its existence.','/aiqLBiH0IWrog2Q78dZTT8Ad9Sp.jpg','1974-03-30',83,'Released','The spaced out odyssey.','Dark Star',1410,3.9288,6,'lwISbJfRNz0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6401,_binary '\0','/xdxOzGudrhLKCMN0IEZQN12g8ky.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069946',6,3933,'en','The Day of the Dolphin','A marine biologist teaches his dolphins to communicate in English but shady characters plan to kidnap the trained mammals for a more sinister purpose.','/pDdXaXkJpKe9gH7GOeZrPnG2Iy.jpg','1973-12-19',105,'Released','Unwittingly, he trained a dolphin to kill the president of the United States.','The Day of the Dolphin',42470,2.9137,5.8,'HtV0maR1wac','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6402,_binary '\0','/kB9Y59YDMOFdm5LgSyTVj4b6hh6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069947',7.8,53671,'en','The Day of the Jackal','An international assassin known as ‘The Jackal’ is employed by disgruntled French generals to kill President Charles de Gaulle, with a dedicated gendarme on the assassin’s trail.','/vThgcb3JOj99yETg8WChuci4LV2.jpg','1973-05-16',143,'Released','Nameless, faceless... relentlessly moving towards the date with death that would rock the world.','The Day of the Jackal',4909,7.4753,7.5,'2rY6hFgC0XI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6403,_binary '\0','/8jNhjmpOIT0d0rB3edNWPPNWQr1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069952',3.9,1579,'en','Deadly Weapons','After the mob hits a guy with a list, one of the hoods keeps the list to blackmail its inhabitants. When he’s found out to be a double-crosser, they off him, angering his busty girlfriend. She goes after them using the only two weapons she has.','/gHTzS5brN1sqcHWeFW5unYIS6jk.jpg','1974-04-05',75,'Released','See the mob get busted when Chesty takes her revenge.','Deadly Weapons',50958,1.4483,3.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6404,_binary '\0','/blMW489NEaFqN1sklI55YMrqKTl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069956',5.3,2835,'it','Il paese del sesso selvaggio','A photographer in the rain forest is captured by wild natives, and after months of living with them, he marries the chief\'s daughter and helps protect the village from a vicious cannibal tribe.','/eVvbuiSKAcaLb09Jvf4i77LrZDG.jpg','1972-08-08',93,'Released','WHERE ADVENTURE ENDS... AND HELL BEGINS!','Man from Deep River',68146,2.0153,5.6,'5Y9IUXaPwoA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6405,_binary '\0','/7AXTnSV0ykHFNQuz1MP1KyBrlov.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069966',6.3,1282,'en','Detroit 9000','After a fundraiser for a Black politician is robbed, Detroit police put two detectives, one white and one Black, on the case, who try to work together under boiling political pressure.','/7eKuM4C7A8IX1bCiRMBI43HBgMs.jpg','1973-08-01',106,'Released','It\'s the murder capital of the world. And the biggest Black rip-off of the decade.','Detroit 9000',85837,1.6369,5.5,'drWnXchUaYo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6406,_binary '\0','/p2kEtaDoKo3i3o0U1Nx3Xr8S3lZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069967',7.3,6096,'fr','Deux Hommes dans la ville','A former bank robber is released after 10 years in prison. He gets help from a social-worker, but gets harassed by an old cop from his past.','/tG1hvv3MCeabwubKMzyHRYAfrs8.jpg','1973-10-24',99,'Released',NULL,'Two Men in Town',4680,2.9466,7.094,'xkM0wxcxCMY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6407,_binary '','/gKjHOR7ya6M6Yme0zdKsOvP8OjJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069969',6.1,1794,'en','The Devil in Miss Jones','Following her suicide, middle-aged Justine finds herself at the threshold to hell. In order to fully earn her forthcoming destiny, she pleads with guardian Abaca to grant her a reprieve. He agrees and sends Justine on her journey through a missed lifetime of sensual pleasures.','/wqTH7nr0d38g4raX7CXMzkOeY02.jpg','1973-03-27',64,'Released','If you have to go to Hell... go for a reason.','The Devil in Miss Jones',284109,0,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6408,_binary '\0','/bcoGYfydURioZifRIONTaOBQNVc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069976',6.9,6603,'en','Dillinger','After a shoot-out kills five FBI agents in Kansas City the Bureau target John Dillinger as one of the men to hunt down. Waiting for him to break Federal law they sort out several other mobsters, while Dillinger\'s bank robbing exploits make him something of a folk hero. Escaping from jail he finds Pretty Boy Floyd and Baby Face Nelson have joined the gang and pretty soon he is Public Enemy Number One. Now the G-men really are after him.','/62nI7ftMyd5q9LhHPE0yltPcQKT.jpg','1973-07-20',107,'Released','The Best Damn Bank Robber in the World!','Dillinger',28110,2.6102,6.6,'_SXg43m8bTI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6409,_binary '\0','/7J7jHTMRn8pjSbXS5NaLmat8AjY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069986',4.4,1254,'en','The Doll Squad','After a terrorist plot to sabotage a Cape Canaveral space mission is discovered, a squad of very attractive and very lethal spies have to locate the culprits.','/3NFwk6pa0vi20g4eMHcJHJLwcQV.jpg','1973-09-19',101,'Released','An elite army of female assassins...in a race against time and death to save the world from a hideously diabolical mass destruction at the hands of a madman no one had ever seen!','The Doll Squad',94752,1.2733,4.6,'B12PjijfA2c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6410,_binary '\0','/ef72KPPTnoHCD1TV3TWHHjoyGgt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069987',6.4,1504,'en','A Doll\'s House','Nora Helmer has years earlier committed a forgery in order to save the life of her authoritarian husband Torvald. Now she is being blackmailed, and lives in fear of her husband finding out, and of the shame such a revelation would bring to his career. But, when the truth comes out, Nora is shocked to learn where she really stands in her husband\'s esteem.','/p8Ecypo4yVm6KD9y2qgvHxqDVeu.jpg','1973-04-10',105,'Released','He is the master. He\'s called a husband. She is the play thing. She\'s called a wife.','A Doll\'s House',42457,1.7218,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6411,_binary '\0','/azNqerKX3fEAu5gaDZ1Egk4pzbP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069989',6.2,1654,'en','The Don Is Dead','After his mistress is murdered, a Mafia leader goes after the killer with a bloody vengeance. Soon after the hunt begins, a gang war ensues.','/xXTi6BeRJr6B0t0VbeNipwEADK0.jpg','1973-11-14',106,'Released','Power built an empire. Passion destroyed it.','The Don Is Dead',94741,2.2296,5.9,'lQeMoMFU3Kg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6412,_binary '\0','/A0fXZcyMFBCgx82iKWNRPdVxEs9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069990',5,1384,'fr','Don Juan ou si Don Juan était une femme...','Modern-day Don Juan-styled Jeanne prides herself in the destruction of men who have fallen for her charms, and reveals to a priest the murder she has committed and honestly details her past sexual encounters.','/p7O8oQQBxUAkKUZvs6fVslQ8QQF.jpg','1973-02-22',95,'Released',NULL,'Don Juan or If Don Juan Were a Woman',82969,2.4177,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6413,_binary '\0','/1Emw2d9C0fj4O6dmi3hABIhiaf4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069992',6.5,4636,'en','Don\'t Be Afraid of the Dark','A young couple inherits an old mansion inhabited by small demon-like creatures who are determined to make the wife one of their own.','/dCTGOKxmRxFZ8Su2Vh6iNJvI4gD.jpg','1973-10-10',74,'Released','Now you see them, now you don\'t...now you die.','Don\'t Be Afraid of the Dark',26015,3.0167,6.1,'77CrF_S5ayY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6414,_binary '\0','/5hG0ZG1viPnSW5EdZDoHlPqOYIc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069994',4.9,3817,'en','Don\'t Look in the Basement','A young psychiatric nurse goes to work at a lonesome asylum following a murder. There, she experiences varying degrees of torment from the patients.','/kzrhFnC9LjeOJbFbREZR7dS00hW.jpg','1973-09-01',89,'Released','Hell... has found a new home!','Don\'t Look in the Basement',24097,1.4428,4.9,'ys27ZxU3M3g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6415,_binary '\0','/8qi3gplNf48uLZnne09iiL4OvFG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0069995',7.1,69320,'en','Don\'t Look Now','While grieving a terrible loss, a married couple meet two mysterious sisters, one of whom gives them a message sent from the afterlife.','/ivWsU3QtcstImCTOjItsH0SAbNn.jpg','1973-10-11',110,'Released','Pass the warning.','Don\'t Look Now',931,8.4111,6.922,'xXP8OaJGxrM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6416,_binary '\0','/2eY6ms0qrfJMa6AQZizvwwHXrVV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070003',6.2,3395,'en','Dracula','Dracula is searching for a woman who looks like his long dead wife.','/yxbbIWVwRBfXHoXhB4uidnkaSBi.jpg','1974-06-13',98,'Released',NULL,'Dracula',86889,2.3054,6.3,'tvQzTbYEB8Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6417,_binary '\0','/9gH2SoZCI6uKs0GY15L3bmu9s9w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070013',5,1859,'fr','Les Démoniaques','A gang of pirates rape the two sole survivors of a ship wreck. The violated girls are rescued by the strange inhabitants of a supposedly haunted island, where they are granted supernatural powers to strike revenge against the pirates.','/bGyBRAxXeWmNMnPGmzA12SJhS9w.jpg','1974-12-05',100,'Released',NULL,'The Demoniacs',29130,2.8169,5.786,'5zKY2dFYZrU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6418,_binary '\0','/jyO7LscqXmxOjQpkYYBRImwD300.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070016',6.9,23083,'en','Charlotte\'s Web','Wilbur the pig is scared of the end of the season, because he knows that come that time, he will end up on the dinner table. He hatches a plan with Charlotte, a spider that lives in his pen, to ensure that this will never happen.','/eLq5bed09bkNVjUfknlbSil2cfR.jpg','1973-03-01',94,'Released','That humble radiant terrific book is now a humble radiant terrific movie.','Charlotte\'s Web',15171,3.3645,6.9,'QH2vwaiEHRY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6419,_binary '\0','/ut8MSzeM5KgmecoKF643h5PqPSP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070022',7,7241,'en','Electra Glide in Blue','A short Arizona motorcycle cop gets his wish and is promoted to Homicide following the mysterious murder of a hermit. He is forced to confront his illusions about himself and those around him in order to solve the case, eventually returning to solitude in the desert.','/6813vVr0az8JHSebRULwg3ttX9F.jpg','1973-05-17',114,'Released','He\'s A Good Cop..... On A Big Bike..... On A Bad Road.','Electra Glide in Blue',26332,3.3577,6.9,'_Zf7hAqlzns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6420,_binary '\0','/9bBXwRX4nm6xwyiQX0Y2x01is6R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070030',7.2,7845,'en','Emperor of the North','Hobos encounter a sadistic railway conductor that will not let anyone \"ride the rails\" for free.','/r4i03RQmF50o6T4tP5mhWgPZAGg.jpg','1973-05-23',118,'Released','If you can ride Shack\'s Train and Live - You\'ll be...','Emperor of the North',31943,3.9748,6.858,'3SBVpNAwmoY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6421,_binary '\0','/ugfBioco0L7qNvwq0d0Pl0AL8SL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070034',7.6,121513,'en','Enter the Dragon','A martial artist agrees to spy on a reclusive crime lord using his invitation to a tournament there as cover.','/fyrh2ULEcmLpGTVLPQqFW45hqr5.jpg','1973-08-17',102,'Released','Their deadly mission: to crack the forbidden island of Han!','Enter the Dragon',9461,13.4231,7.414,'5RGju9NuoOU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6422,_binary '\0','/8QZYTagMEBy0B6pbqBtfmw2Mpp6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070039',5.6,1782,'es','El espanto surge de la tumba','In Medieval France a warlock is beheaded and his wife is tortured and executed. Hundreds of years later, an isolated group of people discover his head buried on their property. Soon it comes back to life, possessing people and using them to commit sacrifices and to search for the rest of his body.','/2mLk66YKH8AeR5adeTRNbjiQnUe.jpg','1973-04-27',88,'Released','Lust has never been this terrifying!','Horror Rises from the Tomb',27401,1.8227,5.7,'CRFQfnnJRHw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6423,_binary '\0','/4vbL72K9uVaMLhnvmdg1So7kqex.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070040',7.7,23002,'es','El espíritu de la colmena','In 1940, in the immediate aftermath of the Spanish Civil War, a young girl living on the Castilian plain is haunted after attending a screening of James Whale\'s 1931 film Frankenstein and hearing from her sister that the monster is not dead, instead existing as a spirit inhabiting a nearby barn.','/o6pUTkoCh4r6EA2dHNFKA40OmH2.jpg','1973-10-08',98,'Released',NULL,'The Spirit of the Beehive',4495,4.694,7.64,'aqvpMJNlqxE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6424,_binary '\0','/ymLLxJEm3HSM63A8lZ3oZAxiHR1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070046',6.7,3828,'en','Executive Action','Rogue intelligence agents, right-wing politicians, greedy capitalists, and free-lance assassins plot and carry out the JFK assassination in this speculative agitprop.','/mdULVfaVkGVJZ0XRjqgqtoPVWgW.jpg','1973-11-07',91,'Released','Assassination conspiracy? The possibility is frightening.','Executive Action',29142,3.0628,6.5,'lWoqCVY9x0Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6425,_binary '\0','/xcjJ5khg2yzOa282mza39Lbrm7j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070047',8.1,504763,'en','The Exorcist','When a mysterious entity possesses a young girl, her mother seeks the help of two Catholic priests to save her life.','/5x0CeVHJI8tcDx8tUUwYHQSNILq.jpg','1973-12-26',122,'Released','Something almost beyond comprehension is happening to a girl on this street, in this house…And a man has been sent for as a last resort. This man is The Exorcist.','The Exorcist',9552,21.7088,7.748,'BU2eYAO31Cc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6426,_binary '\0','/6uqdKiGOyFQUVMFaOK6E5gOGCMI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070061',7.7,3954,'it','Film d\'amore e d\'anarchia, ovvero: Stamattina alle 10, in via dei Fiori, nella nota casa di tolleranza','When his anarchist friend is killed trying to assassinate Mussolini, Tunin decides it\'s up to him to finish the job. While visiting a brothel, he meets a prostitute named Salome, who agrees to help, as her former boyfriend was also killed by Mussolini. They enlist the aid of another prostitute and hatch an elaborate plan, but as the fateful day quickly approaches, the women have second thoughts.','/rrFC5wFdYfpp2UwxIx3UAiaMRjB.jpg','1973-02-23',126,'Released',NULL,'Love and Anarchy',65332,2.7663,7.656,'eTTzt_n24Vs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6427,_binary '\0','/onHYSk6SCuQBpEcH3q58zT4Ppxz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070074',7.1,2448,'en','Frankenstein: The True Story','Victor Frankenstein witnesses his creation turn uncontrollable after he\'s duped by his associate, Dr. Polidori.','/d9ZrCrFiIcZzc2AtLItAhWFsFnY.jpg','1974-09-19',186,'Released','He created the perfect man—then something went wrong.','Frankenstein: The True Story',3105,2.444,7.5,'3wmM6J8dJDA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6428,_binary '\0','/mRRFX4LHJTEEnIfYI7dMCRvAdD3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070077',7.4,13956,'en','The Friends of Eddie Coyle','An aging hood is about to go back to prison. Hoping to escape his fate, he supplies information on stolen guns to the feds, while simultaneously supplying arms to his bank robbing chums.','/tyV8Bgf2huCIbGUxTdGgnzdIRKZ.jpg','1973-06-26',102,'Released','It’s a grubby, violent, dangerous world. But it’s the only world they know. And they’re the only friends Eddie has.','The Friends of Eddie Coyle',25680,4.0039,7.2,'vWdqoPHW-F8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6429,_binary '\0','/8PhkvKTyp9V46Ufje63iXU3ayId.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070078',6.6,6136,'en','From Beyond the Grave','Four customers purchase, or take, items from Temptations Limited, an antiques shop whose motto is “Offers You Cannot Resist.” A nasty fate awaits all of them; particularly those who cheat the shop\'s Proprietor.','/8oePNgUwrVGXwykTGxC9vk7dvPX.jpg','1974-02-21',97,'Released','Terror to delight worshippers of the Macabre.','From Beyond the Grave',48014,2.8792,6.5,'f-_QHgLo-0Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6430,_binary '\0','/jb6nAPBw8igUBbvvOGGwrgyNdqT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070083',6.5,1675,'fr','Un homme est mort','A French hit man is hired by a crime family to end the life of a rival mobster, but things fall apart when the boss who hired him is killed.','/1JImEXD7hfdet96BGrgPNcR3O6T.jpg','1972-12-21',111,'Released','If you kill the most powerful man in organized crime, they\'ve got the rest of your life to get you.','The Outside Man',48153,2.6107,6.148,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6431,_binary '\0','/zOIEOx4QP972GPi04vzFgQrI5ee.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070085',6.6,3920,'ja','不良姐御伝 猪の鹿お蝶','Sex & Fury chronicles Ocho\'s exploits as she searches for her father\'s killers, each identified by unique tattoos on their backs (a deer, a boar, and a butterfly). Along the way, she also crosses paths with Shunosuke, a radical set on murdering prominent politician Kurokawa, and Christina, an American spy posing as a gambler.','/z590QOUU30WuZpTaSPoA5z9k83Q.jpg','1973-02-17',88,'Released','The Biography of the Woman Boss of Bad Girls...','Sex and Fury',20567,9.5936,6.2,'YyLZF1t8M5s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6432,_binary '\0','/5hB32XvCEKVxxUExSolJjBb60wr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070099',7.7,1945,'tr','Gelin','The struggles of a migrant Anatolian family to adapt to and survive in the very different conditions of urban Istanbul. A young woman moves with her husband and small child to her husband\'s family in Istanbul. Her son becomes ill and the doctor tells her that he will soon die if he doesn\'t get an operation. The family refuses to help her because they can\'t see anything wrong with the boy. What happens on a Eid morning becomes a breaking point for the family.','/3KBrtuQqjtKjFHyTQPy6bkYpKI8.jpg','1973-04-01',88,'Released',NULL,'The Bride',96049,1.2789,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6433,_binary '\0','/dcJPuhq3J2EKG5vcM1MMhYP0HIN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070112',7.2,1804,'en','The Girl Most Likely To...','An ugly girl undergoes plastic surgery and becomes beautiful. She then takes revenge on all the people who mistreated her when she was ugly.','/1cgCUrEvonEhVenrSdj9laOa5zU.jpg','1973-11-06',74,'Released','They treated her like a dog. Now, she\'s a fox. And she\'s going to make them pay.','The Girl Most Likely To...',57873,2.2369,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6434,_binary '\0','/l8WDEFWtZhRlwVJL7LjAYgzDd6e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070115',7.3,1324,'en','The Glass Menagerie','An aging Southern Belle complicates life for her ambitious son and crippled daughter because of her own warped views of what life should be.','/9GbdnZdjjQwEeHpn2xstOWDYIXz.jpg','1973-12-16',100,'Released',NULL,'The Glass Menagerie',56764,1.4701,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6435,_binary '\0','/jOxFbSLYSftcm2T3xyVF9pyKeue.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070116',6.1,1610,'fr','Glissements progressifs du plaisir','A young woman is questioned by the police and the judges, suspected of being a modern witch. The girl who shared her apartment has been found dead, and a pair of scissors impaled through her heart, as she lay attached to the bedposts. Apparently, the girl does have powers, to make all people around her fall prey to her spell, glissing progressively into desire, lust, and the unknown.','/yBJoqPs9FL7HvlI1qOLLp9IiC6l.jpg','1974-03-07',102,'Released',NULL,'Successive Slidings of Pleasure',78071,2.134,6.1,'P1RH3nwPhWo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6436,_binary '\0','/aCkZhP45uUKSBgbBmWqqczzdkbo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070121',6.6,4123,'en','Godspell','In modern-day New York City, John the Baptist calls out to a group of young men and women to learn from the teachings of Jesus. Through song and dance, they relive Christ\'s crucifixion.','/qhjcjiLcPhB0kniRlQfIoGiILbn.jpg','1973-03-21',102,'Released','A Musical Based on the Gospel According to St. Matthew','Godspell',43158,3.2983,6.6,'b4xLOrpNbHM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6437,_binary '\0','/5KPRH4vvVVsAC5y0d0g5qNw6AT3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070122',4.9,7996,'ja','ゴジラ対メガロ','Inventor Goro Ibuki creates a humanoid robot named Jet Jaguar. It is soon seized by an undersea race of people called the Seatopians. Using Jet Jaguar as a guide, the Seatopians send Megalon as vengeance for the nuclear tests that have devastated their society.','/au8CGZeCjgoxHe33gZWO0DDvndL.jpg','1973-03-17',78,'Released','Dreaded Megalon from the undersea kingdom! A miraculous deathblow from the wound-ridden Godzilla!','Godzilla vs. Megalon',39264,6.0037,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6438,_binary '\0','/7P01mkgduUa5ls4tNeaDCCowbAz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070130',7,16225,'fr','La Grande Bouffe','Four friends gather at a villa with the intention of eating themselves to death.','/g4wOgslrQKprlQl927h0lQQ3P99.jpg','1973-05-16',130,'Released','An experience that hammers your sensibilities.','La Grande Bouffe',10102,6.4854,7,'usASQnTtaWA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6439,_binary '\0','/vW2g9ZZJPGOKR1ZWXLZ3ANywKUg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070133',6.6,1554,'fr','Les Granges brûlées','The body of a young woman is discovered near a farm. The judge, Larcher is in charge and thinks that the farmers have something to do with the murder.','/dnRqLluRvLI2QAXb0XW0IMASfpw.jpg','1973-05-30',95,'Released',NULL,'The Burned Barns',6160,2.0331,6.551,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6440,_binary '\0','/8zK62AqZABy7eQfhf4nH2d2hUph.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070136',7.5,3365,'de','Die große Ekstase des Bildschnitzers Steiner','A study of the psychology of a champion ski-flyer, whose full-time occupation is carpentry.','/adKS727o4EkX0pxdfNo3B3bDdah.jpg','1974-01-01',45,'Released',NULL,'The Great Ecstasy of Woodcarver Steiner',46595,1.5029,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6441,_binary '\0','/4VMuH97CPGqsVBtuGWltp5BeyNj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070155',6.9,7723,'en','The Harder They Come','Ivanhoe Martin arrives in Kingston, Jamaica, looking for work and, after some initial struggles, lands a recording contract as a reggae singer. He records his first song, \"The Harder They Come,\" but after a bitter dispute with a manipulative producer named Hilton, soon finds himself resorting to petty crime in order to pay the bills. He deals marijuana, kills some abusive cops and earns local folk hero status. Meanwhile, his record is topping the charts.','/nXcWgfds0E8T2pQLvgWLCiUmlV6.jpg','1972-08-01',103,'Released','With a Piece in His Hand He Takes on the Man!','The Harder They Come',7514,2.8902,6.592,'imGkQdE7N2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6442,_binary '\0','/ydXKdDmuCCgyaIQlp5NjvvwMyww.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070158',6.3,1713,'en','Harry in Your Pocket','A master thief and his drug-addicted partner teach two aspiring crooks how to steal wallets.','/xvElfDmIxXvjjgnhUW7582w7m0e.jpg','1973-09-23',103,'Released','If you only have eyes for her... If you just bumped into a stranger... If suddenly you develop sex appeal... You\'ve got... \"Harry In Your Pocket!\"','Harry in Your Pocket',72460,2.1353,5.6,'fRJ3yjT8rIo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6443,_binary '\0','/ryJkiGj5M9R6401MvqfFjFUEC90.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070165',6.5,4247,'en','Heavy Traffic','A white dropout struggles to become a cartoonist and filmmaker, drawing inspiration from the harsh, gritty world around him. Still sharing his rundown apartment with his middle-aged parents, an oafish slob of an Italian father and a ditzy nutcase of a Jewish mother, he\'s ridiculed and looked down upon by his friends, hypocrites who run with violent gangs and the Italian Mafia, and a shallow Black girl who makes her living downtown with the pimps and pushers. The cartoonist gets a chance to pitch a film idea to a movie mogul, but the story proves too outrageous: a far-future Earth, depleted by war and pollution, where a mutant antihero challenges and kills God.','/76z4KHEicnCILz5rePLyZmvcXV4.jpg','1973-08-08',77,'Released','More Spice from the makers of Fritz the Cat!','Heavy Traffic',30593,2.6494,6.5,'vraUu632PIY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6444,_binary '\0','/syj0bAmGtXR5PJhbRjxsnq64FzU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070169',5.9,2105,'en','Hell Up In Harlem','A Harlem gangster must rescue his ex-wife, who\'s been kidnapped by the Mafia.','/ae2g3POHhgE2oZF8GcboIawkmRe.jpg','1973-12-01',95,'Released','Black Godfather is back... and there\'s gonna be hell up in Harlem!','Hell Up In Harlem',78076,2.3832,5.539,'FSaTuWUwW3I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6445,_binary '\0','/gCZndZuX1m5UDoWi7uxlU8UsOnW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070184',6.5,2143,'en','Hitler: The Last Ten Days','Hitler: The Last Ten Days takes us into the depths of der Furher’s Berlin bunker during his final days. Based on the book by Gerhard Boldt, it provides a bleak look at the goings-on within, and without.','/tllM8kqfmk4IIlEEBmedoVRsJJG.jpg','1973-04-19',106,'Released',NULL,'Hitler: The Last Ten Days',47536,2.6985,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6446,_binary '\0','/zdjlWGdV5F3IVbyxGYRrJ8fNptm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070190',5.3,2092,'en','Horror Hospital','Following his forced retirement from an appalling rock band, Jason decides to vacation at Brittlehouse Manor, a health farm run by the leather-gloved, ex-Nazi scientist Dr. Storm. Along the way, Jason meets Judy, also on her way to Brittlehouse Manor to visit her aunt, who married Dr. Storm some years ago. Once they arrive, the pair realise rather quickly that something is wrong, probably because the other guests have had their brains surgically removed, or all the blood pouring from the sink, or possibly just because the creepy midget keeps telling them to brush their teeth.','/7hPgo0TZ7X4q1OvEZpHOjdCVMxZ.jpg','1973-05-11',90,'Released','The Operation is a Success ... When the Patient Dies','Horror Hospital',30787,1.1336,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6447,_binary '\0','/qqwg4IKEaCjTGP8IL8xYt37fy9U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070212',7.2,2122,'en','The Iceman Cometh','Set in 1912, inside a dive bar named The Last Chance Saloon, its destitute patrons eagerly await the arrival of Hickey, who arrives annually and props everyone up with free drinks and spirited stories of his travels. However, when Hickey does show up this year, it is with a message of temperance and an exhortation to give up hopeless dreams and face reality.','/3y1QLbrKT7LnoOJ9MIyogVr3PVl.jpg','1973-11-10',239,'Released','They drank and they dreamed...tomorrow they would conquer the world...then along came Hickey.','The Iceman Cometh',41461,2.2572,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6448,_binary '\0','/4II0fdNtTMR0elrMgQSn9wfYuuk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070215',7.3,31289,'it','Il mio nome è Nessuno','Jack Beauregard, an aging gunman of the Old West, only wants to retire in peace and move to Europe, but a young gunfighter known as \"Nobody\" who idolizes Beauregard wants him to go out in a blaze of glory. So, he arranges for Jack to face the 150-man gang known as The Wild Bunch and earn his place in history.','/tJQEVI1p00Jh9TUgNEI623iu7ST.jpg','1973-12-13',117,'Released','Nobody, but \"Nobody,\" knows the trouble he\'s in!','My Name Is Nobody',9474,6.3622,7.273,'TMUX8y8bXWE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6449,_binary '\0','/46SDQjPr2aQXuf5EPSjjLH7TVkK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070217',7.1,2167,'pl','Iluminacja','Film chronicles a decade in the life of a young physics student whose absolute faith in the primacy of rationality and science is shaken by tragedy and affairs of the heart.','/nj8Uhu9bhVQaIn3XlbxTTjvkuRz.jpg','1973-09-29',87,'Released',NULL,'Illumination',154575,1.314,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6450,_binary '\0','/8A0spwCdHvII4EYAryvIiT9nBxV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070222',4.9,3735,'en','Invasion of the Bee Girls','A powerful cosmic force is turning Earth women into queen bees who kill men by wearing them out sexually.','/wIE6Fsq9KHTwBUOWwy1q9HwOXz3.jpg','1973-06-01',86,'Released','They\'ll Love The Very Life Out Of Your Body!','Invasion of the Bee Girls',27084,2.499,4.7,'4ItIpMZ-bZY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6451,_binary '\0','/z8125Gm4hadwQZOcFiZ7uor77E4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070233',8.2,20725,'ru','Иван Васильевич меняет профессию','A scientist builds a time machine and accidentally sends his apartment complex manager and a petty burglar to 16th century Moscow, while Tsar Ivan the Terrible travels to 1973.','/nTAP9fZT2fpl0YLZwMYaiWfV4Zg.jpg','1973-09-17',88,'Released',NULL,'Ivan Vasilyevich Changes His Profession',20803,3.418,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6452,_binary '\0','/meKPxxRvJuIVRcc7r0QgasAM80W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070238',6.9,1238,'en','Jeremy','Jeremy is learning cello at an arts school in New York. At school he spots Susan, who practices for a ballet audition, and he falls in love.','/13GCcDh0Dxm3rXW8ho0zXX2mmke.jpg','1973-08-01',90,'Released','It\'s about the first time you fall in love.','Jeremy',61574,1.3292,6.857,'2K-Bt4XDxGI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6453,_binary '\0','/xQRh7hSPdtEE0aUmuY8EdifrXPK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070239',7.4,33016,'en','Jesus Christ Superstar','As played out by a theatre troupe, the last days of Jesus Christ are depicted from the perspective of Judas Iscariot, his betrayer. As Jesus\' following increases, Judas begins to worry that Jesus is falling for his own hype, forgetting the principles of his teachings and growing too close to the prostitute Mary Magdalene.','/2NQgIjHxYyMJZWeUFH5cuKhN4nh.jpg','1973-08-15',108,'Released','And now the film…','Jesus Christ Superstar',12545,5.0258,7.1,'CEUDcqYGK74','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6454,_binary '\0','/iEube85zdrjVQvYTGoHhCEkSvVp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070244',7.3,1806,'ja','仁義なき戦い 代理戦争','Shozo Hirono has managed to separate from the Yamamori family and create his own small family, and extend his circle of acquaintances. These new friendships include a powerful underboss of the Muraoka family, Noboru Uchimoto.','/9Ucid2Y7CHfZpS3z15SAOdx5eI7.jpg','1973-09-25',102,'Released',NULL,'Battles Without Honor and Humanity: Proxy War',52874,1.7021,7,'rm8DfkpG8sQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6455,_binary '\0','/7JZKIg7wx9fnnIdiKlDveD0Od35.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070245',7.4,2236,'ja','仁義なき戦い 広島死闘篇','Repeatedly beat to a pulp by gamblers, cops, and gangsters, lone wolf Shoji Yamanaka finally finds a home as a Muraoka family hitman and falls in love with boss Muraoka\'s niece. Meanwhile, the ambitions of mad dog Katsutoshi Otomo draws our series\' hero, Shozo Hirono, and the other yakuza into a new round of bloodshed.','/5rhcljWjsUg6O2LtiN1HiB5HBv8.jpg','1973-04-28',99,'Released',NULL,'Battles Without Honor and Humanity: Deadly Fight in Hiroshima',52980,2.4747,7.3,'dQvpguLsLcM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6456,_binary '\0','/iknYlYAoihpMnGcOjDhisNvMVz3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070246',7.4,4875,'ja','仁義なき戦い','In the teeming black markets of postwar Japan, Shozo Hirono and his buddies find themselves in a new war between factious and ambitious yakuza.','/qQmEEj5B3bTQI8Dq8u4zq80Z7JL.jpg','1973-01-13',99,'Released',NULL,'Battles Without Honor and Humanity',34326,2.7626,7.3,'EXNaUDTLUak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6457,_binary '\0','/mOY6Y54NlPnFvTHjRwWTOq40dZu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070248',5.7,2536,'en','Jonathan Livingston Seagull','Jonathan is sick and tired of the boring life in his seagull clan. He rather experiments with new, always more daring flying techniques. Since he doesn\'t fit in, the elders expel him from the clan. So he sets out to discover the world beyond the horizon in a quest for wisdom.','/jP4Cw7YBVvuZ0Yl4s7mKIKNInyF.jpg','1973-10-23',99,'Released','Everyone\'s Book Is Now Everyone\'s Motion Picture','Jonathan Livingston Seagull',56150,2.2161,6.1,'n8A1Wac7tKc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6458,_binary '\0','/4ZnRDSj0K6nz9G34zkaywbgo3WU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070262',7.5,2331,'ru','Калина красная','A thief named Egor, having served a term in prison, goes to the country to meet his pen-friend Lyuba, a kind genial village woman. Egor comes to love Lyuba sincerely. Now he has friends, work and a beloved woman, he decides to break with his criminal past and start a new life. However, his former criminal associates interfere brutally.','/AcqQlRYPiGCVPALF4V3xa1OhAa0.jpg','1974-03-25',110,'Released',NULL,'The Red Snowball Tree',38359,1.4205,7.152,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6459,_binary '\0','/cVJI64gUMeh5aXzV0djCUgbmGVK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070270',6.1,1513,'en','The Killing Kind','A young man returns home to his mother\'s boardinghouse after serving a prison sentence for a gang rape he was forced to participate in. He seeks revenge on his lawyer and the girl who framed him.','/ignhpS8k64YJEOMbOJOGFAkSOrn.jpg','1974-03-20',95,'Released','Terry loved soft, furry, little animals. He loved his mother. He loved pretty girls...ALL DEAD!','The Killing Kind',47678,1.3284,6,'9I4bO-jIwqk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6460,_binary '\0','/e8BESINFPHODsKEfGuaESBqs104.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070287',6.4,2566,'en','The Last American Hero','A young hell raiser quits his moonshine business and tries to become the best NASCAR racer the south has ever seen. Loosely based on the true story of NASCAR driver Junior Johnson.','/1PEOlAC6KDaj0WxWPw87kan3Kmp.jpg','1973-07-27',95,'Released','Instead of a white stallion, he rode a full race, powder blue stocker.','The Last American Hero',31605,2.3102,5.7,'N-e_liywuIQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6461,_binary '\0','/v9pqOa2gxwBPGnyun6DHp2rbsAo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070289',5.4,1304,'en','The Final Programme','Returning from Lapland, where he buried his father, a renowned scientist, Jerry Cornelius, comes back to London with the firm intention of taking revenge on his brother Frank and snatching his beloved sister Catherine from his clutches. Since the recent gigantic global conflagration, things have changed considerably. If he wanted to, Jerry could easily get hold of napalm to blow up Frank\'s hideout. But he prefers to join forces with the disturbing Mrs Brunner, who, with the help of three scientists – Smiles, Lucas and Powys – is trying to recover a mysterious microfilm left to Frank by his father...','/vxznSp0sBbGIzuvcf09pqDtpdst.jpg','1973-10-04',89,'Released','The future is cancelled!','The Final Programme',42471,1.7018,5.391,'Uemp_RDmgi0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6462,_binary '\0','/kyDesXA3VEx74ua1ZGAoYmzvjCc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070290',7.5,31475,'en','The Last Detail','Two Navy men are ordered to bring a young offender to prison, but decide to show him one last good time along the way.','/zQoNkO99qfaBjh5aoA0pKau1prp.jpg','1973-12-11',104,'Released','No *#@!!* Navy’s going to give some poor **!!@* kid eight years in the #@!* brig without me taking him out for the time of his *#@!!* life.','The Last Detail',14886,4.1103,7,'3y_I3gWGtyk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6463,_binary '\0','/tWK8wSl0jdrEMMEMPYS30LndAX0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070291',7.2,10382,'en','The Last of Sheila','A year after Sheila is killed in a hit-and-run, her multimillionaire husband invites a group of friends to spend a week on his yacht playing a scavenger hunt-style mystery game—but the game turns out to be all too real and all too deadly.','/bDPoCBb4mBudYSC4201aHrBZsSg.jpg','1973-06-14',120,'Released','Any number can play. Any number can die.','The Last of Sheila',26331,3.58,6.966,'NPHMoDpCHU8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6464,_binary '\0','/AWWrY0NFIYRFfWzAJqv4KSSML.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070292',6.4,3818,'en','The Laughing Policeman','When a gunman opens fire on a crowded city bus in San Francisco, Detective Dave Evans is killed, along with the man he\'d been following in relation to a murder. Evans\' partner, Sgt. Jake Martin, becomes obsessed with solving the case.','/nwA2I2WZOHLNq4gwfPQ5rgxV8uS.jpg','1973-12-20',112,'Released','This movie is so real it makes every other movie in this town look like a movie.','The Laughing Policeman',29735,2.4011,6.2,'4YTlRpqh1TE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6465,_binary '\0','/nuDpIsAWww6MhBLE0LKlbeyb5J9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070294',6.6,15377,'en','The Legend of Hell House','A team consisting of a physicist, his wife, a young female psychic, and the only survivor of the previous visit are sent to the notorious Hell House to prove or disprove survival after death. Previous visitors have either been killed or gone mad, and it is up to the team to survive a full week in isolation, and solve the mystery of the Hell House.','/zfTWQD3UWJNlv44VLljjLcU3hWA.jpg','1973-06-15',95,'Released','For the sake of your sanity, pray it isn\'t true!','The Legend of Hell House',16180,3.794,6.7,'ySuvaB3h2G4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6466,_binary '\0','/oeEXhhQPyHxFmgEBGL20YAo2EM0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070297',5.8,5648,'en','The Legend of the 7 Golden Vampires','Professor Van Helsing had been asked to help against the tyranny of skeletal creatures that are responsible for terror and death amongst the peasants in rural China. He is the only person qualified to deal with the cause of these phenomena, for the undead are controlled by the most diabolical force of all.... Count Dracula. But he is not alone- to aid him comes a mystical brotherhood of seven martial arts warriors.','/xPhesvQhGKxTsiLsdZFvKabVzlp.jpg','1974-07-11',89,'Released','Hammer Horror! Dragon Thrills! The First Kung Fu Horror Spectacular!','The Legend of the 7 Golden Vampires',26480,4.1192,5.8,'BYRE_cqeEuM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6467,_binary '\0','/kDBlIgliapy7RbEvtY4Vb9PTGAD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070299',6.8,1393,'de','Die Legende von Paul und Paula','Paul and Paula have had bad experiences with love: Paul is financially well off but has lost all affection for his wife, and Paula leads a troublesome life raising two children on her own. They meet and discover a strong passion for each other. Life seems like a dream when they\'re together - but their short flights from the burdens of reality are once and again interrupted by Paul\'s ties to family and career.','/7bhyvM6dnKsLZwbfpI4pK78IXJ.jpg','1973-03-14',105,'Released','The controversial comedy from behind the iron curtain.','The Legend of Paul and Paula',2232,2.0486,5.879,'nOcwWP8mW5o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6468,_binary '\0','/9uP1cCj5qOEiMlLwRfaLKNM0TKb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070300',6.1,2851,'en','Lemora: A Child\'s Tale of the Supernatural','A notorious bank robber kills his wife and flees the police, only to be captured by a mysterious group of figures in an abandoned town. His beautiful daughter, Lila Lee, receives a letter stating that her father is near death and that he needs to see her. Sneaking away at night from her minister guardian, Lila embarks on a terrifying journey...','/cdV3CGZ88oglZWRdCRYoNY69izZ.jpg','1974-12-18',85,'Released','Run, little girl! Innocence is in peril tonight!','Lemora: A Child\'s Tale of the Supernatural',31596,1.8488,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6469,_binary '\0','/kHU2AEVFfCPYB97PVP2pKhYeRTy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070326',7.2,1328,'ja','アンデルセン童話 にんぎょ姫','The story of a beautiful mermaid who gave up a kingdom for her beloved prince.','/hPuRx5wxlWixvAxy55EhDbmJGTs.jpg','1975-03-21',68,'Released',NULL,'Hans Christian Andersen\'s The Little Mermaid',59593,2.6537,6.6,'oqotv59-GqU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6470,_binary '\0','/hzmmXx6UeYQeylioNbliFKjSbV7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070328',6.7,125997,'en','Live and Let Die','James Bond must investigate a mysterious murder case of a British agent in New Orleans. Soon he finds himself up against a gangster boss named Mr. Big.','/39qkrjqMZs6utwNmihVImC3ghas.jpg','1973-06-27',121,'Released','Bond is back. Back in action. Back with excitement.','Live and Let Die',253,11.4371,6.504,'6SQVTSFyf_A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6471,_binary '\0','/eXCKkX8LVo1vRK4GhVoo0bA8jHM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070334',7.5,44997,'en','The Long Goodbye','In 1970s Hollywood, Detective Philip Marlowe tries to help a friend who is accused of murdering his wife.','/16Gu0Vg7tBdoRxg1NJDwlTKx1hG.jpg','1973-03-08',112,'Released','Nothing says goodbye like a bullet…','The Long Goodbye',1847,5.8199,7.413,'XqLUx8RF0EQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6472,_binary '\0','/fPgJeGSvKmrBSuFyGZMC9NHpGom.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070337',5.3,3140,'en','Lost Horizon','While escaping war-torn China, a group of Europeans crash in the Himalayas, where they are rescued and taken to the mysterious Valley of the Blue Moon, Shangri-La.','/gK7dswB1Epf4hg0UCepZRZGL6Ms.jpg','1973-03-14',147,'Released','Come to Shangri-La! Come to a new world of music, a new world of adventure, and a new world of love!','Lost Horizon',97519,2.4614,5.4,'w5Xz2zLUoEM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6473,_binary '\0','/yZJqFoVb687DCgkFXvG04Y2Myw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070350',6.6,3631,'en','The Mack','A recently-released convict becomes the most powerful pimp in Oakland, but tragedy ensues when his activities draw the ire of two corrupt cops and the crime lord he once worked for.','/xcS9bxWGFzC3cA7qAOjcIjKajSf.jpg','1973-04-04',110,'Released','Now that you\'ve seen all the rest... make way for \"The Mack\"','The Mack',29515,1.9197,6.4,'Z1rmTT-4vzs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6474,_binary '\0','/iiJ6iUwfTlto1ywliP7JSguuT7W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070351',6.3,5830,'en','The MacKintosh Man','A member of British Intelligence assumes a fictitious criminal identity and allows himself to be caught, imprisoned, and freed in order to infiltrate a spy organization and expose a traitor; only, someone finds him out and exposes him to the gang...','/qrdrQkgQoPYhE22ntyY8P3gzwLv.jpg','1973-08-01',99,'Released','Only MacKintosh can save them now - and MacKintosh is dead!','The MacKintosh Man',32627,2.6754,6.1,'WfcAF_JRsxM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6475,_binary '\0','/9VIir77wPGtyVvB4Oq5t7md9DpX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070354',7.1,7187,'fr','Le Magnifique','A writer of pulpy book series in which he\'s the hero and his beautiful English roommate is the love interest attempts to finish his new book in time at the publisher\'s demand.','/uIGYrhZY3DOXNJAoWQHSiqs9W7S.jpg','1973-11-23',95,'Released','THE WRITER\'S DREAM, HIS REALITY, AND THE TYPEWRITER IN-BETWEEN','The Magnificent One',19562,2.6928,6.986,'cly4X01y3Yk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6476,_binary '\0','/7QPcmXePg5U4hmUzugFPX44ntxK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070355',7.2,72435,'en','Magnum Force','\"Dirty\" Harry Callahan is a San Francisco Police Inspector on the trail of a group of rogue cops who have taken justice into their own hands. When shady characters are murdered one after another in grisly fashion, only Dirty Harry can stop them.','/1uX1uzn09seCftG3rTGLPyFXxV6.jpg','1973-12-13',124,'Released','This time the bullets are hitting pretty close to home.','Magnum Force',10648,7.3314,7.125,'83iV6rVG-qw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6477,_binary '\0','/sf3LLFDjkZIABUnHi2tIY02az5r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070356',6.9,2925,'fr','Mais où est donc passée la 7ème compagnie ?','1940: During the chaotic running fights of the French army the 7th company disappears - nobody knows they\'ve been taken captive. Only their scouting patrol, three witty but lazy guys, can escape and now wanders around behind the German lines. They\'d like to just stay out the fights, but a Lieutenant urges them to use a captured truck to break through to their troops.','/clSsWDMsUJ49ptNkhJ0yLWyPXlU.jpg','1973-05-24',95,'Released',NULL,'Now Where Did the Seventh Company Get to?',93289,3.0127,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6478,_binary '\0','/eGqZyH83bQ1x5MKD5SggEfarPa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070358',6.3,4121,'it','Malizia','A widower and two of his sons become infatuated by their beautiful housekeeper, and all three set out to seduce her using their own unique methods.','/s1ioOR6IZ6pRN59wEIYCPcY6vW8.jpg','1973-03-29',93,'Released','Wasn\'t that thoughtful of mother — to hire a maid like Angela, and then die.','Malicious',44741,7.5361,7.317,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6479,_binary '\0','/d7f7Dq0I5SuevNHVqLwInQq3EBr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070359',7.7,7829,'fr','La Maman et la Putain','Aimless young Alexandre juggles his relationships with his girlfriend, Marie, and a casual lover named Veronika. Marie becomes increasingly jealous of Alexandre\'s fling with Veronika and as the trio continues their unsustainable affair, the emotional stakes get higher, leading to conflict and unhappiness.','/qUBmGLgADWnWd7SCCl3KR7EggKj.jpg','1973-05-17',219,'Released',NULL,'The Mother and the Whore',48693,3.7434,7.3,'4taaEWrw-IY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6480,_binary '\0','/tpA27pcQvSHO4yjDSWXcZtu8LHg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070363',6.2,1869,'en','The Man Who Loved Cat Dancing','On the run from her violent husband, a woman witnesses a train robbery and is taken prisoner by a frontier outlaw gang, led by a bandit who’s hiding a secret of his own.','/128Di2hUSU9o5pbA5Yzu8Qc5jks.jpg','1973-06-28',123,'Released','Two women loved him. One died for him. One killed for him.','The Man Who Loved Cat Dancing',42472,2.3573,5.969,'NFOb7yndkNo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6481,_binary '\0','/cjpzOffgj2aOYbjgoMFn7PmJ600.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070374',7.5,3304,'de','Martha','After the death of her abusive father, lonely librarian Martha finds herself caught up in a strange, sadomasochistic relationship with a monstrous husband whom she begins to suspect may be trying to murder her.','/2wmPwtE2ZBW1FWs7C8ftM0Fa2Kt.jpg','1974-05-28',116,'Released','A bond marked by fear!','Martha',10311,1.3619,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6482,_binary '\0','/qdecDSIVoqctIoYoOhLH3TgSYLD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070379',7.1,129756,'en','Mean Streets','A small-time hood must choose from among love, friendship and the chance to rise within the mob.','/9msfwOeGc9uL1iRRTBdEf15XonC.jpg','1973-10-14',112,'Released','Go to church on Sunday. Go to Hell on Monday.','Mean Streets',203,7.1454,7.044,'g9xHpS10CZ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6483,_binary '\0','/qJE7bD23dgFLops7nJGxzfMbpqz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070423',5.3,2387,'en','The Mutations','A mad scientist crosses plants with people, and the results wind up in a sideshow.','/mku11cRXXJB3rzid7yS42y35oyK.jpg','1974-05-22',92,'Released','It\'s not nice to fool with Mother Nature... it can be HORRIFYING!','The Mutations',30929,1.7345,4.9,'PXHv42APRc8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6484,_binary '\0','/dZip5p8b7w2nQ0Z7CYfSs3R1DHt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070434',7.2,1968,'hi','Namak Haraam','Somu and Vicky decide to exact revenge on the union leader, Bipinlal Pandey. However, when Somu understands the plight of the workers, it creates a rift between the two friends.','/bxWROB2onweG7ykCccyVVIf4OGp.jpg','1973-11-19',146,'Released',NULL,'Namak Haraam',160148,1.1922,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6485,_binary '\0','/hHe6oQAV3SzYySv5Jg8GqG27bAD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070438',4.4,1574,'en','The Neptune Factor','When an underwater ocean lab is lost in a earthquake, an advanced submarine is sent down to find it and encounters terrible danger.','/t4wrizSnKxCgiJTrB7CGnM2eME4.jpg','1973-06-26',98,'Released','The most fantastic undersea odyssey ever filmed.','The Neptune Factor',62754,2.0549,5.1,'nh09YXxJJNg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6486,_binary '\0','/ksf9cbKl4anahWrqb6fo96iRnLB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070439',7.5,7034,'ru','Невероятные приключения итальянцев в России','In Italy, a dying woman tells her granddaughter that she hid her treasure many years ago in Russia, in the city of Leningrad. As more people learn about it, they head to Leningrad to find the lion where it is rumoured to be buried.','/51iIpaPeoVj8yCo92GpWzUnPIiM.jpg','1974-01-31',102,'Released',NULL,'Unbelievable Adventures of Italians in Russia',57778,1.7091,7.247,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6487,_binary '\0','/vCfb8gjTgcl9oGXQYsK4Danrl3q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070444',6.3,2746,'en','Night Watch','A woman recovering from a nervous breakdown tries to convince her husband and and the local London police that she has witnessed a murder in the abandoned house next door.','/uuWf1nMHYkKegwJB0iOzbPuiKkO.jpg','1973-11-08',99,'Released','Once her nightmare begins...the terror never ends!','Night Watch',40387,2.5582,6.3,'JiAyVBbj7O0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6488,_binary '\0','/c8qiudxElpF56rugomKapXhwclW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070453',6.9,2512,'fr','Les Noces rouges','In a small French town, the mayor discovers his wife is cheating on him, a betrayal that eventually leads to murder.','/1BAC8HGlfSfZobuN3WGzjaieZDt.jpg','1973-04-12',95,'Released','A matter of lust and death.','Wedding in Blood',42463,1.7329,6.358,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6489,_binary '\0','/402xdr6WjnIK3xKbv45BaPXFmvc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070458',6.2,1844,'en','The Norliss Tapes','A newspaper publisher listens to the personal tapes of investigative reporter David Norliss, who has disappeared during an investigation. The tapes tell the story of that investigation, involving a recent widow whose late husband has been seen working in his private studio. As Norliss and the widow investigate, they unravel a plot involving Voodoo and the walking dead.','/p0rLRwVnes02AgeEv3VIT7g6Hyj.jpg','1973-02-21',72,'Released',NULL,'The Norliss Tapes',68133,1.8256,6.2,'jjc9piV0sTc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6490,_binary '\0','/6MbFN88F27WvGC9WhAXq5KUIgTj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070460',8,26680,'fr','La Nuit américaine','A committed filmmaker struggles to complete his latest project while coping with a myriad of crises, personal and professional, among the cast and crew.','/e5xDrSx6zDEUlMe2dWKGhv88PDZ.jpg','1973-05-24',116,'Released','A movie for people who love movies.','Day for Night',1675,3.5465,7.78,'GmSpeM5Hj2A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6491,_binary '\0','/85G8sdp0XiRReaNEWR6hubG6BBR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070463',7.3,2952,'sv','Nya hyss av Emil i Lönneberga','Emil\'s reputation for being a troublemaker makes the Svensson family\'s neighbours take up a collection for sending the boy off to America. But even if he among other unfortunate mishaps causes his father to get stuck in the outhouse window and get bitten by crawfish, all is forgotten when he skillfully wins the family a free horse. And when Alfred the farmhand gets seriously ill, Emil puts his own life on the line, venturing into a snow storm to get his best friend to a doctor before it is too late.','/2QRvDHBNHQ1yR4D7gkFhrzCTAHm.jpg','1972-10-21',91,'Released',NULL,'New Mischief by Emil',11946,2.3287,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6492,_binary '\0','/snJstZtk9PDd0qoCiQQEpAtqjdS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070464',7.6,9353,'en','O Lucky Man!','An ambitious coffee salesman has a series of improbable and ironic adventures seemingly designed to challenge his naive idealism.','/2xlzrpQF76OCgcKpQZvP6WtlpJy.jpg','1973-03-25',184,'Released','Smile while you’re makin’ it. Laugh while you’re takin’ it. Even though you’re fakin’ it. Nobody’s gonna know …','O Lucky Man!',42464,2.9222,6.754,'N_Ze68pE6rs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6493,_binary '\0','/iAjKtR4ezWbRzMje9XiSvcoFqjB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070468',6.8,9218,'en','The Offence','A burned-out British police detective finally snaps while interrogating a suspected child molester.','/yAd3QxpZNO8eU40a4i3FbHxXOe.jpg','1973-01-11',113,'Released','After 20 years, what detective-sergeant Johnson has seen and done is destroying him.','The Offence',32615,2.7512,6.764,'1NpPiMfB9WY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6494,_binary '\0','/cZiWk1u5HMygeNzeNRe5oVx7zPl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070472',6.3,1745,'en','Oklahoma Crude','In 1913, in Oklahoma, oil derrick owner Lena Doyle, aided by her father and a hobo, is stubbornly drilling for oil despite the pressure from major oil companies to sell her land.','/8yCermso0k5dGHsUDYG8sxGnc8H.jpg','1973-07-03',108,'Released','An epic story of wooden derricks, iron men...and a defiant woman.','Oklahoma Crude',147106,2.0693,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6495,_binary '\0','/hDMVgJkXypokiMvaI3rsHrhYU54.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070474',7,2396,'da','Olsen-banden går amok','When Egon Olsen gets out of Vridlose State Prision once again, his friends Benny and Kjeld do not want to know about his new ingenious plan: they are actually WORKING in a shop! Thus, he has to think of something else to get his hands on the money of some international gangster.','/yUSa33TJXIYA8rlLBsxl5flTRsZ.jpg','1973-10-05',100,'Released',NULL,'The Olsen Gang Runs Amok',15499,1.5722,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6496,_binary '\0','/92xv8veoWBp1QjAY31E9Z7ImFEo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070506',7.4,2193,'it','Pane e cioccolata','An Italian immigrant tries to make a new life in Switzerland, taking on a series of increasingly menial jobs in order to do it. He attempts to fit into his new home and society but fails at every turn. Unable to go home again, will his tenacity and optimism be enough to live on?','/24D3e6xBPEvqlFoq4tSMVqVQ3TO.jpg','1974-05-05',115,'Released','You\'ll Laugh Till Your Heart Breaks','Bread and Chocolate',51242,1.6964,7.206,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6497,_binary '\0','/w8oJsFYxbOKa3IhBLfC9UdFTWbX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070509',7.2,9434,'en','The Paper Chase','A first-year law student struggles with balancing his coursework and his relationship with the daughter of a stern professor.','/9LU6tK5S9RIZq8mN7xXZY7HtGAK.jpg','1973-10-16',113,'Released','You may be looking at a future President, Supreme Court Justice, Secretary of State or a dropout.','The Paper Chase',14328,2.5656,6.817,'wGUfvZU4wiE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6498,_binary '\0','/2Cf8V0iQx0c52IxeLdxOvjI2bBf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070510',8.1,58299,'en','Paper Moon','During the Great Depression, a con man finds himself saddled with a young girl who may or may not be his daughter, and the two forge an unlikely partnership.','/3GHG0kTcBWHKdXjj3RdK8GjBCd6.jpg','1973-05-09',102,'Released','As P.T. Barnum put it, \"There\'s a sucker born every minute.\"','Paper Moon',11293,5.2859,7.9,'QDVQOaphlHU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6499,_binary '\0','/fmd17jnQxHanXC6wqqXRLocm60O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070511',8,146990,'en','Papillon','A man befriends a fellow criminal as the two of them begin serving their sentence on a dreadful prison island, which inspires the man to plot his escape.','/356oqQpug682OERsWV0bGZ0YxwQ.jpg','1973-12-16',151,'Released','The greatest adventure of escape!','Papillon',5924,7.3701,7.827,'FJSVcgJqHys','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6500,_binary '\0','/mEEJC1tHmxJZ49L0Gc7jsFlvQXJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070518',7.2,23489,'en','Pat Garrett & Billy the Kid','Pat Garrett is hired as a lawman on behalf of a group of wealthy New Mexico cattle barons to bring down his old friend Billy the Kid.','/vRDvPypWsjGs7spo7G5bz1cSacC.jpg','1973-05-23',106,'Released','Best of enemies. Deadliest of friends.','Pat Garrett & Billy the Kid',11577,5.3767,7.2,'SVDryeFDRPs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6501,_binary '\0','/qMxhl5NeeXj4Rs0stsGgC7GsB9C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070531',6.4,11047,'en','Phase IV','Arizona ants mock the food chain on their way to a desert lab to get two scientists and a woman.','/x6fQtAmCD4JlAcUnTfYoinPp1zz.jpg','1974-09-13',86,'Released','The day the Earth was turned into a cemetery!','Phase IV',59189,2.6839,6.3,'IT__jmBwG_k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6502,_binary '\0','/tpAkAsKJfL7olmdIlBxiLIvOsPy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070534',6.7,4685,'it','Piedone lo sbirro','Inspector “Flatfoot” Rizzo investigates crime and corruption in Naples.','/sLL24J9UmCygAXJrW9Y8qBtdfnj.jpg','1973-10-25',110,'Released','A one man demolition squad!','The Knock Out Cop',11048,2.9,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6503,_binary '\0','/lr3ZpdYKqhYc6YpagmANJQKXbNO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070537',4.8,1731,'en','Daddy\'s Deadly Darling','The owner of a roadside diner and his new helper kill people and feed them to pigs.','/yiFsjysFYrOV5Sndu08UXgunrEn.jpg','1973-05-25',80,'Released','A mad man... A psycho killer... And mean cannibal pigs... All together in the scariest film you\'ll ever see!!!','Daddy\'s Deadly Darling',89351,1.5882,5.2,'YaVa4AB3MX0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6504,_binary '\0','/AwrqoanoZVYoc0MRyE0RiHEKm71.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070544',7.6,43384,'fr','La Planète sauvage','On the planet Ygam, the Draags, extremely technologically and spiritually advanced blue humanoids, consider the tiny Oms, human beings descendants of Terra\'s inhabitants, as ignorant animals. Those who live in slavery are treated as simple pets and used to entertain Draag children; those who live hidden in the hostile wilderness of the planet are periodically hunted and ruthlessly slaughtered as if they were vermin.','/prq0j1S0K07UjwLZLF6oMGflRUI.jpg','1973-12-01',72,'Released','A sublime trip to a fine new world!','Fantastic Planet',16306,3.347,7.634,'LE3AaxGKaEg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6505,_binary '\0','/hDNwmi99YyGupHaXsgenIuKwQU5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070547',5.3,1284,'it','Il plenilunio delle vergini','The 1800s: scholarly Karl Schiller believes he\'s found the ring of the Nibelungen, which holds great power. It\'s at Castle Dracula. His twin, Franz, a gambler, asks if vampires frighten Karl; Karl shows him an Egyptian amulet, which may protect him. Franz takes the amulet and sets out ahead of his brother, arriving at the castle first. There he finds a countess who invites him to dine. Later that night, Karl arrives. Coincidently, it\'s the Night of the Virgin Moon, a night that falls every fifty years and draws five virgins from the surrounding village to the castle not be heard from again. Can Karl protect his brother, find the ring, and rescue any of the women?','/7dXtC1zkssrvQSo25u9muvoGrns.jpg','1973-03-14',83,'Released','Dark desires unleash the legions of lucifer!','The Devil\'s Wedding Night',74831,1.6366,5.3,'RtvAA1M59xQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6506,_binary '\0','/8WlnmVR6StK94HkPjb5s8QmcN0i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070552',6.8,1419,'it','La polizia incrimina la legge assolve','An Italian police inspector matches wits with a powerful European drug ring. As he comes closer to the top of the underworld organization, his odds of survival decrease.','/sCdlstfvym9IPe3fqJVUv4ejmnZ.jpg','1973-08-12',103,'Released','High Action. High Thrills.','High Crime',87362,2.305,6.4,'TQV046CuPVE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6507,_binary '\0','/vDDfSs2Ewg1lt1lKgA1K1YBCwoO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070557',7.5,2847,'pl','Poszukiwany, poszukiwana','Stanisław Maria Rochowicz, a bumbling art historian, is falsely accused of stealing a painting. The alleged thief faces five years in prison. Desperate, he decides to hide in disguise as a woman until he can paint a copy of the stolen canvas. Lacking means to live, he takes jobs as a maid for a variety of colorful characters.','/75W55GxVdEoGXKK7n9l63WUttE5.jpg','1973-04-22',83,'Released',NULL,'Man - Woman Wanted',81309,0.8731,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6508,_binary '\0','/8lKck9fJuREAGT0zUIdUwagIM59.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070565',6.5,3593,'it','Il profumo della signora in nero','Sylvia, an industrial scientist, is troubled by strange hallucinations related to the tragic suicide of her mother.','/obkFF8JiCyuBCXFHWFNRLo1Gl5R.jpg','1974-03-29',103,'Released',NULL,'The Perfume of the Lady in Black',65317,1.9236,6.353,'ebUXpRkFkhc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6509,_binary '\0','/q0tNmJxAqf46VswkJw2XQW91OkT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070568',7.1,1539,'it','La proprietà non è più un furto','A young bank teller, literally allergic to paper money, becomes the worst nightmare of his best customer, a wealthy butcher who manages his business unscrupulously.','/wf8G6AT2nV87sozQ5aE5NmfxCfH.jpg','1973-10-03',121,'Released',NULL,'Property Is No Longer a Theft',129564,1.6685,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6510,_binary '\0','/bpJXFjhMjOJQ6SY2g035ff2crRD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070592',6.5,1730,'it','Rappresaglia','In the Nazi occupied city of Rome, an assault on an SS brigade draws retaliation from the military governship. \"Massacre in Rome\" is the true story of how this partisan attack led to the mass execution of Italian nationals under the orders of SS-Lieutenant Colonel Kappler.','/A7mz1jkufrnEZVBE8GblgYz8W0p.jpg','1973-10-04',99,'Released',NULL,'Massacre in Rome',61278,2.0153,6.3,'MZ3-6YJua-o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6511,_binary '\0','/vj1a8kDXavC5ZvUyFdjS6lzkmZA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070605',5.7,1447,'en','Rhinoceros','A boozing young man in love with his co-worker finds that everyone around him, even his pompous and condescending best friend, is changing into a rhinoceros.','/snbaUumISQKX1uMrEziKXqOjxMF.jpg','1974-01-21',104,'Released','The comedy that proves people are still the funniest animals.','Rhinoceros',39194,1.2639,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6512,_binary '\0','/3WeFPoPVIGgMumjgLn0EPIfq53A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070608',7.5,151948,'en','Robin Hood','With King Richard off to the Crusades, Prince John and his slithering minion, Sir Hiss, set about taxing Nottingham\'s citizens with support from the corrupt sheriff - and staunch opposition by the wily Robin Hood and his band of merry men.','/x9AvkYek0bGdxQSZ8W3lAjGrREm.jpg','1973-11-08',83,'Released','Meet Robin Hood and his MERRY MENagerie!','Robin Hood',11886,10.1252,7.31,'c5Qph47c2uE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6513,_binary '\0','/2D9eBSe9e8p3mBRytxihWlo2Z54.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070622',5.4,4623,'en','Sssssss','David, a college student, is looking for a job. He is hired by Dr. Stoner as a lab assistant for his research and experiments on snakes. David also begins to fall for Stoner\'s young daughter, Kristina. However, the good doctor has secretly brewed up a serum that can transform any man into a King Cobra snake-and he plans to use it on David.','/fIKiHta0LrDpb2f80u7ybPFesoy.jpg','1973-07-06',99,'Released','Terror is ready to strike!','Sssssss',70345,4.6982,5.2,'uOkQ_-XtwlA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6514,_binary '\0','/ljvMYpPSsW51rRABYkyNLnDvfvb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070628',7.4,6345,'pl','Sanatorium pod Klepsydrą','Jozef visits a dilapidated Sanatorium to see his father. Jozef undertakes a strange journey through the many rooms of the sanatorium, each which conjures worlds composed of his memories, dreams and nightmares.','/wV6LsDuRHPGbQqRsaAAu3xHgflW.jpg','1973-12-11',124,'Released',NULL,'The Hourglass Sanatorium',45698,2.4483,7.51,'GaR5LcUi30Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6515,_binary '\0','/edeThmJTJ1DXIH8x6r3ufk8eIMk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070633',5.2,1933,'en','Satan\'s School for Girls','Within the grim walls of Fallbridge College for Girls is Elizabeth Sayers, a new student who, under an assumed name, hopes to learn the truth behind her younger sister\'s apparent suicide. Our heroine soon learns that the school is in the clutches of a coven of witches called \'The Five\' — and that she herself has the right satanic qualities to enable The Five to take over the world!','/vSaIh8f9smY33viUG1WtDpJM4Dh.jpg','1973-09-19',78,'Released',NULL,'Satan\'s School for Girls',33543,2.5783,5.5,'dqaVhKPHZdw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6516,_binary '\0','/7iHNbmOpNuRN8SFITE7nKlk00qY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070634',5.5,7999,'en','The Satanic Rites of Dracula','The police and British security forces call in Professor Van Helsing to help them investigate Satanic ritual which has been occurring in a large country house, and which has been attended by a government minister, an eminent scientist and secret service chief. The owner of the house is a mysterious property tycoon who is found to be behind a sinister plot involving a deadly plague. It is in fact Dracula who, sick of his interminable existence, has decided that he must end it all in the only possible way- by destroying every last potential victim.','/ixkF1HcgQ8wlafCok5hHzi3iYI0.jpg','1973-04-17',88,'Released','Evil begets evil on the sabbath of the undead!','The Satanic Rites of Dracula',35669,4.7148,5.6,'eMAgmFScQvU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6517,_binary '\0','/fQ9CL9i2dHYG5poGHv1WEubo9XL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070636',6,1842,'es','Satánico pandemonium: la sexorcista','Sister Maria is known in the convent for her good works and charity, but, in the secret depths of her sexual fantasies, she is tormented by visions of another world - a world where her forbidden passions are allowed to run free. In this world Satan is her master. As her acts of violence and blasphemy mount, Maria realizes that she has been chosen by the Devil to destroy the convent and lead her sister nuns into hell!','/k6LZn3greNmaYhySVnwUkkDmlpo.jpg','1975-06-26',89,'Released','From bride of Christ to slave of Satan!','Satanic Pandemonium',57084,3.5009,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6518,_binary '\0','/iKRUOex2tI0fZ1kDUdOE3K0ej22.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070640',6.9,6194,'en','Save the Tiger','A businessman\'s professional struggles begin to conflict with his personal life over the course of two days.','/htLwmbIc8L2ufP5g4Wv5OWCOYMl.jpg','1973-02-14',100,'Released','Juggle the books. Set fire to the factory. Supply women for the clients. Harry Stoner will do anything to get one more season.','Save the Tiger',38714,2.3499,6.6,'J-n5Wq7y0G4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6519,_binary '\0','/3OsXhM3WJJKTk77a2RttvP042jp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070641',7.4,2092,'it','Sbatti il mostro in prima pagina','Days before the general election, after a girl from a rich family is murdered in an attempted rape, the editor-in-chief of a conservative tabloid tries to derail the police investigation in order to help the right-wing candidates supported by his bosses.','/lpbmcbPcL7Bj8VTimnSt5uuG6C3.jpg','1972-10-19',87,'Released',NULL,'Slap the Monster on Page One',68053,2.0749,7.661,'ft7uqagVauk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6520,_binary '\0','/jFUhMdZuEISfCGCm9lrI441Cw5j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070643',7.2,22312,'en','Scarecrow','Two drifters bum around, visit earthy women and discuss opening a car wash in Pittsburgh.','/jK0e8jLl0pp59yX6AYMyyJPnMVJ.jpg','1973-04-11',112,'Released','The road leads itself to somewhere.','Scarecrow',31587,3.5167,7,'qWwZbb-tl_4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6521,_binary '\0','/xxIudQBXqXXy5dcs4A9H9NR16JU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070653',6.4,6241,'en','Scorpio','Cross is an old hand at the CIA who often teams up with Frenchman Jean “Scorpio” Laurier, a gifted freelance operative. After their last mission together, the CIA orders Scorpio to eliminate Cross, leaving him no choice but to obey.','/zqz1tkIEXP0gfm1ePRUDtVi6bu2.jpg','1973-04-11',114,'Released',NULL,'Scorpio',42738,2.8026,6.2,'59aPiY2buLI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6522,_binary '\0','/4EmnrktGyndp6CphxHYzekScj8o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070654',4.7,1367,'en','Scream Bloody Murder','A disturbed young boy who kills his father with a tractor is institutionalized. Years later, when he\'s finally released, he goes on a murderous rampage after he finds out that his mother has remarried.','/dvfidlG1ylyicr56Dp6YYtYDu3C.jpg','1973-02-20',90,'Released','Who Will Survive the Psychosexual Claw?','Scream Bloody Murder',79181,1.2158,4.6,'nZYjHmwYViw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6523,_binary '\0','/1Y0aFQ24W3BEWnKO9lqGDIRMO08.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070656',5.7,3654,'en','Scream Blacula Scream','After an aging voodoo priestess dies, her arrogant son Willis Daniel\'s believes he is next in line to lead. He is outraged when Lisa, his mother\'s adopted apprentice is chosen as the leader. Willis seeks revenge by reviving the African prince Blacula — but soon finds that he cannot control him.','/lxzscvc7rBkvahgCCa4mxFeZZ8v.jpg','1973-06-27',96,'Released','The black prince of shadows stalks the earth again!','Scream Blacula Scream',42466,1.8491,5.9,'WL9t6SUx1bU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6524,_binary '\0','/5Ht8hLWADSQFPLh1Q1oLijQpe8G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070657',6.1,1347,'en','Scream, Pretty Peggy','A sculptor hires young college girls to take care of his elderly mother and his supposedly insane sister, both of whom live in the old family mansion with him.','/cEJiTS1jbPMe683u9ggCnDpTrsu.jpg','1973-11-24',74,'Released',NULL,'Scream, Pretty Peggy',206630,1.2139,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6525,_binary '\0','/dXlO2Ri2RvVYWRtBsr6GsIVkleX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070666',7.7,147504,'en','Serpico','New York cop Frank Serpico blows the whistle on the rampant corruption in the force only to have his comrades turn against him.','/pRagfd10PPWryFRSzLPIivfAXHJ.jpg','1973-12-18',129,'Released','Many of his fellow officers considered him the most dangerous man alive - an honest cop.','Serpico',9040,6.8123,7.5,'eoP6bH2ymFo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6526,_binary '\0','/Am1TyZKV2ayIwGM76rB5CAw36Gj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070672',6.8,7754,'en','The Seven-Ups','A tough detective who is part of an elite New York City unit is trying to find out who killed his partner, but uncovers a plot to kidnap mobsters for money.','/xmpzuTWUEiVPsRz7kKXijNISUNq.jpg','1973-12-14',103,'Released','Mess with the Seven-Ups, and they WILL mess you worse.','The Seven-Ups',32080,3.4619,6.356,'JVmcBXVy8Og','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6527,_binary '\0','/lcrEqjQlBoPba6QfOsBrGfcKh2D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070673',4.9,1292,'en','The Severed Arm','Trapped in a cave, five men cut the arm off of another companion in order to ward off starvation. After they are saved, their victim seeks revenge on them one by one.','/7Bp6f2wWQH8gjCSvMhsP4ydrKvD.jpg','1973-11-02',91,'Released','THERE\'S A PSYCHO LOOSE WITH AN AXE!','The Severed Arm',106402,1.5319,4.9,'gGwyxwU1E6U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6528,_binary '\0','/oJQm8RP0DzytLes698kp1sLle78.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070679',5.9,3485,'en','Shaft in Africa','Detective John Shaft travels incognito to Ethiopia, then France, to bust a human trafficking ring.','/z6yYpJBuRd1j5kldYd9vjbv9xfq.jpg','1973-06-20',112,'Released','Shaft is stickin\' it...all the way.','Shaft in Africa',494,2.9676,6.109,'1jENT0CebBw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6529,_binary '\0','/yEkMwEPuuXJ1fknz9OwU6DFOzp0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070680',6,1871,'en','Shamus','Millions in diamonds are stolen from a New York City safe, and later the burglar is killed. Shamus is paid $10,000 by the owner to find the diamonds or the killer.','/xT2oVBP3FBz0bOiPDn3Gc6pk0Z2.jpg','1973-01-31',106,'Released','SHAMUS a pool-shooting, card-playing, broad-chasing, private eye...cross him, and he\'ll blow your head off!','Shamus',4989,2.2302,6.1,'gnxpGcdcERE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6530,_binary '\0','/5cggH2kIZQGP2DkG8j7M3wSxY0Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070687',5.9,1398,'en','Showdown','Two men who have been friends since childhood find themselves on opposite ends of the law.','/dKnHRPL3NLAZujk6238yUgNsjtP.jpg','1973-06-20',98,'Released','...when the running stops and the bullets begin','Showdown',85648,2.117,6.1,'6W_jTRSe-Nw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6531,_binary '\0','/l2hcT7S6TT7PZQOgA7EZOF7qPHz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070689',6.6,1380,'en','Siddhartha','Siddhartha is the story of a young Brahmin and his search for a meaningful way of life. His journey takes him through periods of harsh asceticism, sensual pleasures, material wealth, self-revulsion and eventually to the oneness and harmony that he had been seeking. The story is based on the best-selling novel by German Nobel Prize winner Hermann Hesse.','/wXyfCpesJh0ihDZOKkooSAaEAOc.jpg','1972-08-01',83,'Released',NULL,'Siddhartha',60595,1.1415,6,'OyFg291i8Ak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6532,_binary '\0','/201QQCqdrYh2fuPYWRAxB3hSBw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070694',5.2,5611,'en','Night of the Dark Full Moon','A man investigates the grisly crimes that occurred in a former insane asylum, unsettling the locals who all seem to have something to hide.','/1jGsxEB4fMYS8gOTswxdq9SMfn1.jpg','1972-11-01',85,'Released','The mansion… the madness… the maniac… no escape.','Night of the Dark Full Moon',29852,2.1515,5.1,'r1R0rpnbmxU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6533,_binary '','/xTeuN1lj3qc7SWkvGhusBRqFgtJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070696',4.9,1771,'da','Dværgen','Olaf and his mother run a boarding house and a white slavery ring. They smuggle heroin to keep the addicted girls happy so they do not try and escape. A young couple move into the house and the evil landlords take a liking to the female.','/grflhEbbu9taGu5pFGGF2mIe5WK.jpg','1973-12-20',95,'Released','A young bride... left alone to the lewd passions of an evil dwarf!','The Sinful Dwarf',39922,0,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6534,_binary '\0','/V4iqE9Ptgx7FJ8pLK0IWI9Zg46.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070698',6.8,23857,'en','Sisters','Inquisitive journalist Grace Collier is horrified when she witnesses her neighbor, fashion model Danielle Breton, violently murder a man. Panicking, she calls the police. But when the detective arrives at the scene and finds nothing amiss, Grace is forced to take matters into her own hands. Her first move is to recruit private investigator Joseph Larch, who helps her to uncover a secret about Danielle\'s past that has them both seeing double.','/hqxzpgJse54AcX1Mt1c6raXS290.jpg','1973-03-26',93,'Released','They were joined at birth by the devil and the evil never left them!','Sisters',22307,2.951,6.7,'5PpajTTNk5A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6535,_binary '\0','/8jWWH5b0t1iD6VxzlScBWClVsrd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070700',6.9,5664,'en','The Six Million Dollar Man','Colonel Steve Austin, astronaut and test pilot, is badly injured when he crashes while testing an experimental aircraft. A covert government agency (OSI) is willing to pay for special prosthetics to replace the eye, arm and both legs he lost in the crash. Highly advanced technology (bionics) built into them will make him faster, stronger and more resilient than normal. In return they want him to become a covert agent for the OSI. It will cost $6,000,000 to rebuild Steve Austin.','/cf7JBTR0yrHKkmMJ1EGElZWcwpz.jpg','1973-03-07',74,'Released',NULL,'The Six Million Dollar Man',39829,2.715,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6536,_binary '\0','/uVTEJPLof6fizkWvmhxEprut9oQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070707',7.1,45693,'en','Sleeper','Miles Monroe, a clarinet-playing health food store proprietor, is revived out of cryostasis 200 years into a future world in order to help rebels fight an oppressive government regime.','/YTYSziZZP5aXt5CDvdEMwKDzme.jpg','1973-12-17',87,'Released','Woody Allen takes a nostalgic look at the future.','Sleeper',11561,3.7935,6.8,'PcaXIWYDo-4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6537,_binary '\0','/m8NHyJklrrg4DxvgSQRLdZQQZNZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070723',7,74963,'en','Soylent Green','In the year 2022, overcrowding, pollution, and resource depletion have reduced society’s leaders to finding food for the teeming masses. The answer is Soylent Green.','/5nbkShkOEXUoKVhaX0XG41wyBkq.jpg','1973-04-18',97,'Released','It\'s the year 2022. People are still the same. They\'ll do anything to get what they need. And they need Soylent Green.','Soylent Green',12101,7.8841,6.92,'PPIOp31up_U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6538,_binary '\0','/7dgMnjdRsxvzoZYejz9WiDsSJYs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070726',7.2,1958,'en','The Spook Who Sat by the Door','A black man plays Uncle Tom in order to gain access to CIA training, then uses that knowledge to plot a new American Revolution.','/r0E4QfwxjuOvmpGlNuHgpNf9bSa.jpg','1973-09-21',102,'Released','Their first mistake was letting him in. Their biggest mistake was letting him out!','The Spook Who Sat by the Door',62330,1.9296,6.4,'tj9obZA7yrs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6539,_binary '\0','/4EHIdv3gRaTTXN8lMfGijCXi1rG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070734',6.7,1540,'en','Steptoe & Son Ride Again','Albert Steptoe and his son Harold are rag-and-bone men, complete with horse and cart to tour the neighbourhood. They also live amicably together at the junk yard. Always on the lookout for ways to improve his lot, Harold invests his father\'s life savings in a greyhound who is almost blind and can\'t see the hare. When the dog loses a race and Harold has to pay off the debt, he comes up with another bright idea. Collect his father\'s life insurance. To do this his father must pretend to be dead.','/uWOESkScPGK5W31E5N5dLBi6jOv.jpg','1973-05-01',99,'Released','The old man didn\'t die laughing, but you will.','Steptoe & Son Ride Again',52797,1.8426,6.7,'WFZ_sVb8LTY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6540,_binary '\0','/1r9lH3DaSWKGyvZaoo6BF5STOk5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070735',8.2,305813,'en','The Sting','A novice con man teams up with an acknowledged master to avenge the murder of a mutual friend by pulling off the ultimate big con and swindling a fortune from a big-time mobster.','/ckmYng37zey8INYf6d10cVgIG93.jpg','1973-12-25',129,'Released','...all it takes is a little confidence.','The Sting',9277,11.312,8.015,'_nAIb_J9T5M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6541,_binary '\0','/jbIOhXFfLtIiZtlTCd1rExeWgIS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070736',6.1,4356,'en','The Stone Killer','A Los Angeles detective is sent to New York where he must solve a case involving an old Sicilian Mafia family feud.','/4q5gLjMEfV0JV10KK59Lfp2kuX.jpg','1973-08-08',95,'Released','This Cop Plays Dirty!','The Stone Killer',26202,2.8398,6.338,'MP89Ib5woMg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6542,_binary '\0','/cyzXhJe9Z5VTVET6VmkUddJcQwG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070755',6.8,1221,'de','Supermarkt','A drifting teen slips from petty crime into exploitation on the streets of Hamburg, courted by a self-serving journalist and a predatory pimp, before a doomed romance pushes him toward a desperate armed-robbery scheme he can’t outrun.','/sjFTXy73MK1NYMQCvmTwZKJsQ4M.jpg','1974-01-30',84,'Released',NULL,'Supermarket',218257,0.925,6.54,'6svpPfRabKM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6543,_binary '\0','/n3Mq41drxxzfNZ4O8kFtIzCAaMo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070758',6.8,2029,'sh','Sutjeska','The headquarters of the Marshal Tito\'s Liberation Army are surrounded by Axis forces. The Partisans have no choice but to fight their way out of the encirclement and face the enemy on the plains of Sutjeska.','/s9zYSjL4qir0cYjYWmyxAdFLJzR.jpg','1973-07-03',117,'Released','The Time: May, 1943. The Place: Yugoslavia. The Mission: Capture Tito dead or alive and destroy the Partisan Nation!','The Battle of Sutjeska',143355,1.758,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6544,_binary '\0','/kG0WaeE1BFoRF6NR9SkWiB9oGWH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070770',5.6,2468,'en','Tales That Witness Madness','Enigmatic asylum owner Dr Tremayne houses four very special cases. Visited by his colleague Nicholas, Tremayne explains his amazing and controversial theories as to why each patient went mad, be they a ritualistic \'luau\', a time-travelling bicycle, a toy tiger, and a tree stump.','/zeTgxwQokdojbrqmq78GhxaHQxI.jpg','1973-10-31',90,'Released','An Orgy of the Damned! It happens beyond madness - where your mind won\'t believe what your eyes see.','Tales That Witness Madness',42468,2.1849,5.5,'eZg0uUJGm50','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6545,_binary '\0','/2qo02SgiHlSyJ4aZX04UOUBFWql.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070782',5.3,1961,'en','Terminal Island','After the U.S. Supreme Court banishes the death penalty, California decides to exile all convicted murderers to the remote island of San Bruno, overseen by a tyrannical camp leader who forces all female inmates into sex slavery.','/kOn8fA4w2K6MKkRD4fZ6sJOQGJQ.jpg','1973-06-22',88,'Released','Men and Women... Black and White. Taken From Death Row - Condemned to Devil\'s Island, U.S.A., Where Living is Worse Than Dying!','Terminal Island',91618,2.244,5.3,'f78XcIxAzfU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6546,_binary '\0','/akEH5O3kRIDpDRV2O8DQbean0my.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070788',6.6,1542,'en','That\'ll Be The Day','Britain, 1958. Restless at school and bored with his life, Jim leaves home to take a series of low-level jobs at a seaside amusement park, where he discovers a world of cheap sex and petty crime. But when that world comes to a shockingly brutal end, Jim returns home. As the local music scene explodes, Jim must decide between a life of adult responsibility or a new phenomenon called rock & roll.','/oyaHClO0Wt016hWF9I7O6Eui0Lc.jpg','1973-05-13',87,'Released',NULL,'That\'ll Be The Day',26831,1.9838,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6547,_binary '\0','/3usrJIle0Mso1wI5VQCHrr8XlOT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070791',7.1,13885,'en','Theatre of Blood','A Shakespearean actor takes poetic revenge on the critics who denied him recognition.','/jOmoAXkSL1NDBmR0GfyL3UJlOYn.jpg','1973-03-16',104,'Released','It\'s curtains for his critics!','Theatre of Blood',28498,3.0313,6.7,'qaqv1JFqvps','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6548,_binary '\0','/qfvCotaLIdme6DBWAhDSAnupFz8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070794',6.1,1448,'en','The Thief Who Came to Dinner','A computer programmer decides to become a thief. And when he starts making waves, an insurance investigator hounds him. He also meets a woman who becomes his accomplice.','/2sopwAOdBOzrQ5kcBdZrC1Y9FnS.jpg','1973-03-01',104,'Released','Webster and Laura took everything they wanted ... each other ... and a diamond worth $6.000.000.','The Thief Who Came to Dinner',92299,2.182,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6549,_binary '\0','/37NOpfixwDvVJ9gTxKnNbwXE9sh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070800',7.1,4772,'zh','天下第一拳','A young boxer joins a martial arts school to increase his skill so he can enter a martial arts competition. He leaves the school when he hears that a local gangster is terrorizing the town. He comes to the aid of a young singer and brings on the wrath of the local gang. He eventually enters the martial arts competition after learning iron palm technique and takes out all competition.','/iAEd4aorPPLwbMNTYsQXLelHclo.jpg','1972-04-28',106,'Released','Come prepared for the thrill of a lifetime!','Five Fingers of Death',21964,2.9373,6.7,'weCsyTCx0ow','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6550,_binary '\0','/sjWYru0fUk2YjRU1N3hcev2gdY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070809',7.2,1605,'bn','তিতাস একটি নদীর নাম','An in-depth look at the lives and struggles of a fishing community living by the River Titas in Bangladesh after the Partition of India in 1947.','/l9IO1a8dfVHRgMwBKXU4RNRtQBr.jpg','1973-07-27',159,'Released',NULL,'A River Called Titas',93164,1.5744,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6551,_binary '\0','/nvrnKTnMchR2aBDfygWhbMgMXSO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070814',6.4,2963,'en','Tom Sawyer','Tom Sawyer and his pal Huckleberry Finn have great adventures on the Mississippi River, pretending to be pirates, attending their own funeral, and witnessing a murder.','/In4e2cLbkemK8t2bBfisgT0iqU.jpg','1973-03-15',103,'Released','A Musical Adaptation of Mark Twain\'s Tom Sawyer','Tom Sawyer',42473,3.139,6.5,'4yqzIPjRv2k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6552,_binary '\0','/5RRoVs6zFYD7i1ikn3JyemLWL8v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070819',6.5,3900,'en','A Touch of Class','Steve, a happily married American man living in London meets Vicki, an English divorcée and run off to Marbella for a rollicking week of sex. They then return to London to set up a cozy menage, despite the fact that he loves his wife and children, and now realize that he and Vicki have also fallen in love.','/iEjIwaaXlg8fK7uyNdQU2ityj8v.jpg','1973-05-25',106,'Released','They had the perfect love affair. Until they fell in love.','A Touch of Class',42458,1.9996,6.1,'RdCP7RHeYKI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6553,_binary '\0','/7DlEixaKiNJyK0tHri0AEUAQrk8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070820',6.9,5131,'wo','Touki-Bouki','Mory, a cowherd, and Anta, a university student, try to make money in order to go to Paris and leave their boring past behind.','/kcBYKHyg9GcQqa6DWq0AuQDhtPI.jpg','1973-05-10',91,'Released','The Journey of the Hyena.','Touki Bouki',77771,2.1492,6.6,'KuPxols8FwU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6554,_binary '\0','/tg8vdaC4SO4GNTHYweTVmWXSehV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070825',6.4,7573,'en','The Train Robbers','A gunhand named Lane is hired by a widow, Mrs. Lowe, to find gold stolen by her deceased husband so that she may return it and clear the family name.','/fCbsYSeTvwG9EjPHFck95ODVvRy.jpg','1973-02-01',92,'Released','The gold or the grave. The young widow could lead them to either.','The Train Robbers',40682,3.0413,6.3,'P0rK5Q-TX-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6555,_binary '\0','/4Hf1rFXDyk1ggqPUsuwnQEoxw7f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070826',6.9,2010,'fr','Le Train','Two people, a Frenchman and a Jewish German woman, meet on a train while escaping the German army entering France.','/o55Dv4Fs3oqfXgjPPU81m6TAVko.jpg','1973-10-31',95,'Released',NULL,'The Last Train',3475,2.0138,6.641,'aPLgjf1kfHM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6556,_binary '\0','/hC4tZhIunr9TUMYoz6wVBp7HN8p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070827',6.1,2169,'fr','Traitement de choc','Hélène Masson visits her friend Gérôme Savignat in the isolated rejuvenation clinic owned by Dr. Devilers and his partner Dr. Berbard. But after a series of tragic events, Hélène goes further in her investigation of the clinic.','/t4k78EcpmexEKAeSHxIT84bN5iI.jpg','1973-01-18',91,'Released',NULL,'Shock Treatment',5601,1.7031,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6557,_binary '\0','/r3tn3xGjHdLnjSdQOC3WEkTloPC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070832',7.6,13765,'cs','Tři oříšky pro Popelku','Popelka, a resourceful and independent young girl, is a servant in her stepmother\'s house and confides in her closest friend the owl. When she comes across three magical acorns, she\'s granted a single wish for each one of them.','/g38es1ofNJdgyTdfoEK4IQ8y0Z7.jpg','1973-11-16',82,'Released',NULL,'Three Wishes for Cinderella',8703,4.8792,7.5,'BBT5GAHPAbg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6558,_binary '\0','/6ctU1oGfrkOJlfRgcBcbm2QEeGx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070834',4.6,1773,'en','Trip with the Teacher','A high-school field trip takes a nightmarish turn when the students\' bus breaks down and thugs come to their aid.','/aKFvVM0Fj0iGnI8Dp72M7Y18475.jpg','1975-03-03',91,'Released','How far should a teacher go to protect her students?','Trip with the Teacher',40065,1.756,4.3,'DAcvu8GUbok','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6559,_binary '\0','/2YtfWnpSGfy1vIskzpl24ZOzIBS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070842',7.1,12886,'nl','Turks Fruit','Gifted but hot-headed sculptor Eric has a stormy, erotic, and star-crossed romance with a beautiful young woman named Olga.','/eqnlXShKgQbF3prxU6XYrC53z6F.jpg','1973-02-22',108,'Released','A real love story.','Turkish Delight',21035,4.1816,6.845,'D6of8iM3bw4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6560,_binary '\0','/hExTiLbfB93HwEwkeQxb3q4nHtQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070849',6.8,63231,'it','Ultimo tango a Parigi','A recently widowed American begins an anonymous sexual relationship with a young Parisian woman.','/dNgdUdNOWfHsZI3lDu6Epig7H2P.jpg','1972-12-15',129,'Released','When you see a love story, it\'s only a movie. When you feel it with every nerve in your body, it\'s a masterpiece.','Last Tango in Paris',1643,7.9017,6.9,'_0Vj-B6JVmQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6561,_binary '\0','/pjeXeCnxv2R1JQUN40kHqrdC5BE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070860',5.9,1231,'fi','Uuno Turhapuro','Uuno Turhapuro is a lazy man who abhors manual labor, but has the ability to talk himself out of any sticky situation, usually with his long-suffering wife. In this, his first feature film appearance, Uuno embarrasses his wife in public, tricks his best friend, accidentally goes on a diet, and becomes a famous violinist.','/uIz5rvmckDNDB1YqkU53HD8ehjh.jpg','1973-08-24',88,'Released',NULL,'Uuno Turhapuro',36764,1.7035,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6562,_binary '\0','/c0kQSGXwehhITupNfj2fnIJ9LeS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070861',8.2,6545,'ru','В бой идут одни старики','Alexey Titarenko is very talented pilot and brave leader of \"Singing group\". He also must look after some new cadets and fight together with them against German Luftwaffe planes. Close to Alexey always are his friends, they are all from different parts of the country, but they all became real brothers.','/4TE8gM826e1OU62AErJ5LS4F1os.jpg','1974-08-12',92,'Released',NULL,'Only Old Men Are Going to Battle',37129,1.6103,7.864,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6563,_binary '\0','/sBTRmTsNQvPxzdssFo4zHEBCSIm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070868',6.6,7147,'en','The Vault of Horror','The sequel to Tales from the Crypt. Five strangers trapped in a basement vault converse about their recurring nightmares. Their stories include vampires, bodily dismemberment, east Indian mysticism, an insurance scam, and an artist who kills by painting his victims\' deaths.','/10H05rKoxX2hggBeEMwpm9il2GL.jpg','1973-03-16',87,'Released','Everything that makes life worth leaving!','The Vault of Horror',53868,2.9063,6.39,'4JBe47b_7DY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6564,_binary '\0','/dUiXFnC4GKbki5DSntEmRFUrKWX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070869',5.8,1432,'es','Una vela para el diablo','Two sisters running a small hotel in Spain kill female tourists whose morals do not meet their strict religious standards.','/sqaw7yZXGRimiJExPqhFB1LzqCo.jpg','1973-02-01',87,'Released','Spine-chilling suspense!','A Candle for the Devil',87495,1.8406,5.7,'hAgkHNKSE7Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6565,_binary '\0','/vcuT4cRrr1e7Pzy0U4qlHiEcYrq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070895',6.9,7675,'en','Walking Tall','Ex-wrestler and Tennessee Sheriff Buford Pusser walks tall and carries a big stick as he tussles with county-wide corruption and moonshining thugs.','/dG5lP5vbbRnnrzhk9Za7pT1cwzu.jpg','1973-02-22',125,'Released','The measure of a man is how tall he walks.','Walking Tall',25473,4.0658,6.566,'oejUHM2jngw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6566,_binary '\0','/7mRpaVetpIde0f3Ebk2ipCAqDls.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070903',7,31220,'en','The Way We Were','Opposites attract when, during their college days, Katie Morosky, a politically active Jew, meets Hubbell Gardiner, a feckless WASP. Years later, in the wake of World War II, they meet once again and, despite their obvious differences, attempt to make their love for each other work.','/o5x563ze56iI4iNsCBxTnDkt28i.jpg','1973-10-17',118,'Released','Everything seemed so important then... even love!','The Way We Were',10236,6.5827,7,'YFc1oZv4vL4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6567,_binary '\0','/v8rs04JnVg7Jkppj2N9s2awet8j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070908',4.1,1410,'en','The Werewolf of Washington','After being unknowingly inflicted with the bite of a werewolf while on a visit to Europe, White House press secretary Jack Whittier begins to turn into a deadly beast by night, terrorizing Washington D.C. and presenting a very deadly threat to the President.','/kTvVXSymO5nAd1cR3Gm1OIncUXM.jpg','1973-10-01',90,'Released','Makes It Perfectly Clear.','The Werewolf of Washington',88065,1.7158,3.9,'4rvuGn_2630','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6568,_binary '\0','/m9K8LWrIuujCvYW9c7SgIOSOOj1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070909',6.9,68167,'en','Westworld','Delos is a futuristic amusement park that features themed worlds populated by human-like androids. After two patrons have a run-in with a menacing gunslinger in West World, the androids at Delos all begin to malfunction, causing havoc throughout the park.','/qNt29HzxwZ4jGTgSRxdA34ino9Q.jpg','1973-08-15',89,'Released','Boy, have we got a vacation for you...','Westworld',2362,6.0657,6.775,'_vezkZIMm74','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6569,_binary '\0','/uAJle0hIsEM7cUKOmjM2Nw1CGZT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070913',5.4,5161,'it','Che?','A young American woman traveling through Italy finds herself in a strange Mediterranean villa where nothing seems quite right.','/g1UH2zyO2WLMltt3MsS06YW482X.jpg','1972-12-07',114,'Released','The kinkiest caper of the year!','What?',81522,2.738,5.351,'BKUy7THNoa4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6570,_binary '\0','/bPjUpaZihb5dR8Py2JCMZCiODUY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070915',6.4,6932,'en','White Lightning','An ex-con teams up with federal agents to help them with breaking up a moonshine ring.','/z8eAIC67eaM2h1dFZvnifq7P8ln.jpg','1973-08-06',101,'Released','Meet the Bayou\'s baddest good ol\' boy.','White Lightning',4984,3.9091,6.157,'X6W6_LYgK90','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6571,_binary '\0','/qhPuXbHCIbE94doMxYsY2W3wMry.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070917',7.5,106672,'en','The Wicker Man','Police sergeant Neil Howie is called to an island village in search of a missing girl whom the locals claim never existed. The investigation is further complicated as Howie’s religious views clash with those of the island’s residents.','/wwtrXRL8SiOWxhwLEvw7iBgYh0g.jpg','1973-12-06',93,'Released','Flesh to touch...Flesh to burn! Don\'t keep the Wicker Man waiting!','The Wicker Man',16307,11.7145,7.3,'MXq-NuS24fg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6572,_binary '\0','/q3lR5yQHHsA35GbopK2a3Rlgsnv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070926',4.5,1238,'en','Wonder Women','Dr. Tsu is a brilliant surgeon with her own exotic island off the coast of Manila. Using her sexy, all-girl army of martial-arts experts, Tsu kidnaps some of the world\'s greatest athletes. She is able to transplant any body part, so she uses the athletes for spare parts to sell to the world\'s richest men. Mike Harber is a womanizing, wise-cracking insurance investigator for Lloyd\'s of London sent to Manila to investigate the disappearance of a jai-alai player, and becomes involved with Dr. Tsu\'s mad mission.','/fxTFSLmbqRa8p8RiXNTEdZFh7QK.jpg','1973-04-25',82,'Released','The Most DEADLY WOMEN who ever stalked The EARTH.','Wonder Women',116445,2.2898,4.6,'EeSNGwq16Yg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6573,_binary '\0','/kzr4JDoVsYFjEjsLFhi3MzZYYD2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070928',5.7,1853,'en','The World\'s Greatest Athlete','Stuck with a feeble sports department, college coach Sam Archer (John Amos) faces the ax unless he can reverse the school\'s athletic fortunes. An African vacation with his assistant (Tim Conway) answers Archer\'s prayers when he spots the athletically gifted Nanu (Jan-Michael Vincent). Sam counts on Nanu\'s remarkable abilities to put the team back on the winning track. This upbeat farce boasts an impressive cast of comedians.','/gDgfRDuhT6KXtBwq0Z1G2uqY1eQ.jpg','1973-02-14',106,'Released','From the JUNGLE to the GYM...He\'s the Greatest!','The World\'s Greatest Athlete',33331,2.0917,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6574,_binary '\0','/xYkvGyXA3lAHu19ZBNF9CE0fBsJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070935',7.3,2332,'hi','यादों की बारात','Three brothers are separated after their parents are murdered by a gangster. Years later, they find their paths intertwined around a family song.','/zcR2CY07gUYvpuK3wkBqBbmF1LS.jpg','1973-02-18',164,'Released',NULL,'Yaadon Ki Baaraat',46619,1.407,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6575,_binary '\0','/ml7DVvcqByPTLZew8pQZ556Epzm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070947',7.5,4564,'hi','ज़ंजीर','A tough and honest police officer clashes with a crime boss who, unbeknownst to him, happens to be his parents\' murderer.','/durMAVvVETtevu1EDv3VIcNs7gO.jpg','1973-05-11',146,'Released','The origin of the angry young man.','Zanjeer',103236,1.1122,6.9,'lfvbZsPsBZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6576,_binary '\0','/tFvyHuyeYWsUUcSA8kfg4aQYxX9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070948',5.8,26073,'en','Zardoz','In the far future, a savage trained only to kill finds a way into the community of bored immortals that alone preserves humanity\'s achievements.','/6qvQhJhvM7wWPB2LjVpivSNraIv.jpg','1974-02-06',106,'Released','Beyond 1984, Beyond 2001, Beyond Love, Beyond Death.','Zardoz',4923,3.8294,5.9,'FSjCkISrJfQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6577,_binary '\0','/wd3MNn0tkExUKCzbfkkEJ8ZFshP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070957',6.3,1798,'de','Die Zärtlichkeit der Wölfe','A German serial killer preys on boys and young men during the so-called years of crisis between the wars. Based on the true story of Fritz Haarmann, aka the Butcher of Hanover and the Vampire of Hanover.','/hArRqqGnyoHERNzKnbrOJGLKoKq.jpg','1973-07-12',82,'Released',NULL,'Tenderness of the Wolves',127946,1.728,5.7,'Z_gT12gA7Wo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6578,_binary '\0','/2UoQWAxqhrP1iKhoWU4TzGO3FlT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0070959',7.7,6823,'fr','État de siège','Assigned to South America, US official Philip Michael Santore is employed by a counterinsurgency agency. His position makes him a target for a local band of guerrillas, and, before long, Santore is kidnapped. As a prisoner, he undergoes interrogation, shedding light on the violent situation in the country. Once the insurgents are done with their questioning, they must decide whether Santore lives or dies.','/yEH5yjGFgcEmS36XhFzIblQF0fJ.jpg','1972-12-30',122,'Released','Any resemblance to actual events or to anyone living or dead is not accidental.','State of Siege',91487,2.4446,7.2,'rjv36b99JXk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6579,_binary '\0','/c1dLkRyXC0ayT2Q6zIXsyE3G4c9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071080',6.2,1474,'en','11 Harrowhouse','A small time diamond merchant jumps at the chance to supervise the purchase and cutting of a large first class diamond. But when the diamond is stolen from him, he is blackmailed into pulling off a major heist at the Diamond Exchange, located at 11 Harrowhouse.','/o47sg7uqKpxeVppCDjKZhvJfwiK.jpg','1974-09-26',94,'Released','This is like no robbery you\'ve ever imagined.','11 Harrowhouse',42268,1.6327,5.8,'1wTxk6KLrDs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6580,_binary '\0','/8CyIuR0gohdDr3gZCFHA7FDCWDp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071095',5.5,1262,'en','Abby','When a minister\'s wife becomes possessed by Eshu, the Nigerian god of sexuality, an exorcist is called in to drive the evil spirit away.','/4NupCQHckfbOrXFRxCIs9OwNqG8.jpg','1974-12-25',89,'Released','Abby doesn\'t need a man anymore... the Devil is her lover now!','Abby',78075,1.1782,5.482,'-QUEeQFaclw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6581,_binary '\0','/83YI8dTK3t02c0kyY3SLWu1mSpx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071110',5.8,13702,'en','Airport 1975','When an in-flight collision incapacitates the pilots of an airplane bound for Los Angeles, stewardess Nancy Pryor is forced to take over the controls. From the ground, her boyfriend Alan Murdock, a retired test pilot, tries to talk her through piloting and landing the 747 aircraft. Worse yet, the anxious passengers — among which are a noisy nun and a cranky man — are aggravating the already tense atmosphere.','/etfUuwVCvywq8mGspT94CBeLpSz.jpg','1974-10-18',107,'Released','Something hit us... The crew is dead... Help us, please, please help us!','Airport 1975',27932,5.3989,5.784,'h-l3wzkCwiU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6582,_binary '\0','/5AibuYyzAlJesXvZVjW4vFeqKpj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071115',7.3,30655,'en','Alice Doesn\'t Live Here Anymore','After her husband dies, Alice and her son, Tommy, leave their small New Mexico town for California, where Alice hopes to make a new life for herself as a singer. Money problems force them to settle in Arizona instead, where Alice takes a job as waitress in a small diner.','/A99yzz1W3NCG6zR2HXSwn2kWlse.jpg','1974-12-09',112,'Released','A movie for everyone who has ever dreamed of a second chance.','Alice Doesn\'t Live Here Anymore',16153,5.9201,6.96,'H8jV98slav8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6583,_binary '\0','/iFQzlUmO5QmMPcSHHDdfd522x33.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071129',7.8,51903,'it','Amarcord','In an Italian seaside town, young Titta gets into trouble with his friends and watches various local eccentrics as they engage in often absurd behavior. Frequently clashing with his stern father and defended by his doting mother, Titta witnesses the actions of a wide range of characters, from his extended family to Fascist loyalists to sensual women, with certain moments shifting into fantastical scenarios.','/kS7i093sQpkLTawUEdgf4HVOHSc.jpg','1973-12-18',123,'Released','The Fantastic World of Fellini!','Amarcord',7857,4.8417,7.874,'BtG9ZM-ZHnY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6584,_binary '\0','/ih2q5hoclUTICLxMzV31vxgpCzR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071141',8,26311,'de','Angst essen Seele auf','Emmi Kurowski, a cleaning lady, is lonely in her old age. Her husband died years ago, and her grown children offer little companionship. One night she goes to a bar frequented by Arab immigrants and strikes up a friendship with middle-aged mechanic Ali. Their relationship soon develops into something more, and Emmi\'s family and neighbors criticize their spontaneous marriage. Soon Emmi and Ali are forced to confront their own insecurities about their future.','/cRL8j5RhL4YUviwcfTiCVHfrBFM.jpg','1974-03-05',93,'Released',NULL,'Ali: Fear Eats the Soul',216,3.4384,7.7,'KG12cB5xGCo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6585,_binary '\0','/hKlX0gBFHRO0S86m6PqGXFxaRAZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071143',8.2,4453,'en','Animals Are Beautiful People','Animals Are Beautiful People (also called Beautiful People) is a 1974 South African nature documentary written, produced, directed, filmed and edited by Jamie Uys, about the wildlife in Southern Africa, presented with comedic elements. It was filmed in the Namib Desert, the Kalahari Desert and at the Okavango River and Okavango Delta. It was the recipient of the 1974 Golden Globe Award for Best Documentary Film. The film, a critical and commercial success, was independently made by Uys, also known for his later African comedy The Gods Must Be Crazy (1980).','/bhEihEf39CRycWUK6l49hhRO35Y.jpg','1974-01-31',92,'Released',NULL,'Animals Are Beautiful People',147729,1.5237,7.4,'v1fqy3eY5q8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6586,_binary '\0','/mcNZDTwWdvT60NmFAH4BJ9QL1fA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071145',7.8,1867,'hi','अंकुर','In a small Indian village, a destitute woman\'s barren, alcoholic husband absconds after stealing toddy. Alone to fend for herself, she ends up relying on the affections of her landlord\'s to-be-married son who recently returned to look after the estate.','/jrchYJ6zRkUZoWbhV4XQrnzLzXA.jpg','1974-07-20',122,'Released',NULL,'Ankur',171492,1.2469,6.224,'kPlMe4LCAIU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6587,_binary '\0','/w1L8FTAxPfVVRW9s5IRMTPMAnWR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071150',5.8,2268,'it','L\'anticristo','An Italian nobleman seeks help after his paralyzed daughter becomes possessed by the spirit of a malevolent ancestress.','/wsl0CCmhs1DNkqG9v45V2qqCv2N.jpg','1974-11-22',112,'Released','Deliver her from evil.','The Antichrist',78546,2.5451,6.1,'YeYr6YuqvDY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6588,_binary '\0','/1g3iKmcloaiHCuyOPKY85FUqCi1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071155',6.7,2965,'en','The Apprenticeship of Duddy Kravitz','The younger son of a working-class Jewish family in Montreal, Duddy Kravitz yearns to make a name for himself in society. This film chronicles his short and dubious rise to power, as well as his changing relationships with family and friends. Along the way the film explores the themes of anti-semitism and the responsibilities which come with adulthood.','/wizmy0hFKs7lsn2ljHMctj86KEN.jpg','1974-04-11',120,'Released','There\'s a little bit of Duddy Kravitz in everyone.','The Apprenticeship of Duddy Kravitz',42451,2.0596,6.1,'1ADWjL42OGc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6589,_binary '\0','/5X8wk7vqUNqpVIKPZTdjcfs5MQO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071159',7,1742,'tr','Arkadaş','After betraying his social class, denying his peasant roots and fleeing his native village, Ahmed has become a successful businessman and has found a place in the sun among the bourgeoisie. Azem, his childhood friend, has followed a quite different way. refusing the rat race, he has remained close to people of humble origin. Politically committed, he aspires to be useful to his country and more particularly to the forsaken rural world. The two former friends meet again. Due to the influence of Azem, Ahmed gradually becomes aware that his life is a failure.','/6WxSatDacXgOWsVtkYCc8y4fVB9.jpg','1974-10-01',99,'Released',NULL,'Friend',163857,1.8775,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6590,_binary '\0','/n51s0GvEtUUPLLMn3LpOl4iSlHz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071167',5.7,1295,'it','L\'assassino ha riservato nove poltrone','A rich man gathers together friends and relatives at the abandoned theatre he owns, but the party isn\'t fun for long since apparently one of them is a murderer.','/8HOnC0eePbpjLPqhh7LJyD2yaxU.jpg','1974-05-21',99,'Released',NULL,'The Killer Reserved Nine Seats',99438,1.7771,5.5,'e97ojx9Yjk4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6591,_binary '\0','/zWTAHIHYXByzw3lThuXzuXMRVor.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071175',7.8,2814,'en','The Autobiography of Miss Jane Pittman','In February, 1962, as the civil rights movement reaches Bayonne, Louisiana, a New York journalist arrives to interview Jane Pittman, who has just turned 110. She tells him her story dating back to her earliest memories before slavery ended. In between the chapters of her life, the present-day struggles of Blacks in Bayonne, urged on by Jimmy, are dramatized.','/x0Zg9uJGA2CgYGReA4fE1NU6Inj.jpg','1974-10-17',112,'Released',NULL,'The Autobiography of Miss Jane Pittman',57868,2.3354,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6592,_binary '\0','/ruKHKfaeiHnutsmecTH4irsZ30v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071186',6.5,2795,'en','Bad Ronald','When awkward teen Ronald Wilby accidentally kills a young girl whose sister rejected his affections, his overbearing mother decides to hide him from the law by creating a concealed room in their home for him to live.','/oe2GpLL3twEG6TVuO7bDHiI1n1C.jpg','1974-10-23',74,'Released','The Wood family doesn\'t know it. But the old house they\'ve just bought is already occupied... by a psychopathic killer.','Bad Ronald',56787,1.7061,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6593,_binary '\0','/4Ce7oUjqfLS8JC0kc63lRD6Zb9p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071194',5.4,1344,'en','Bank Shot','A bank temporarily housed in a mobile home while a new building is built, looks like an easy target to break into. On the other hand, why not steal the whole bank, and rob it in a safer location.','/jfWlczsaz3a9oYJa8rXwxwmECVd.jpg','1974-07-31',83,'Released','Criminal Masterminds? Don\'t Bank On It.','The Bank Shot',97313,2.0058,5.4,'NAvBJVdGb_Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6594,_binary '\0','/2ljcEOiJnV7Eu2u7aw0niXWepkE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071198',2.9,2791,'en','The Bat People','Dr. John Beck, recently married, decides to take his wife, Cathy, spelunking in Carlsbad Cavern. While there, Dr. Beck, who specializes in bats, is bitten by a fruit bat. He is then, inexplicably, transformed into a vampire bat. While he escapes and seeks help from another doctor, it is clear the treatments are not working. In fact, they are aggravating his condition. Dr. Beck unwittingly goes on a killing spree, catching the attention of Sergeant Ward.','/37D2iBv7ihU4RsQcXo4uGFYGOaS.jpg','1974-01-15',95,'Released','After the sun has set and the night wind has died comes the hour of the bat people!','The Bat People',28159,1.1978,3.6,'V_ubBTpSln4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6595,_binary '\0','/qnqw68n19xwY51S746DBXcaBQyE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071200',5.6,4753,'en','The Beast Must Die','Wealthy big game hunter Tom Newcliffe has tracked and killed practically every type of animal in the world. But one creature still evades him, the biggest game of all - a werewolf.','/fNJLiSDHjQdoZzB1EfjSORZE1ra.jpg','1974-04-01',93,'Released','One of these eight people will turn into a werewolf. Can you guess who it is when we stop the film for the WEREWOLF BREAK? See it ... solve it ... but don\'t tell!','The Beast Must Die',40218,2.6699,5.5,'klfE_nescX0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6596,_binary '\0','/gpCfsRtAiOTG1H4sTVQpl6edZQV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071203',7.3,9684,'ja','哀しみのベラドンナ','An evil feudal lord rapes a village girl on her wedding night and proceeds to ruin her and her husband\'s lives. After she\'s eventually banished from her village, the girl makes a pact with the devil to gain magical ability and take revenge.','/2okYZVVw7RdMwlOKcAJsQ7Nsrpr.jpg','1973-06-30',87,'Released','A soul wandering in love… Belladonna, a flower that blooms with the sap of tears…','Belladonna of Sadness',64847,3.9911,7.4,'9BmAHCNxUto','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6597,_binary '\0','/pJK178eWhEanZ6nrxdlNZmoktbK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071206',6.1,5579,'en','Benji','Benji is a stray who has nonetheless worked his way into the hearts of a number of the townspeople, who give him food and attention whenever he stops by. His particular favorites are a pair of children who feed and play with him against the wishes of their parents. When the children are kidnapped, however, the parents and the police are at a loss to find them. Only Benji can track them down, but will he be in time? If he can save the day, he may just find the permanent home he\'s been longing for.','/aSowNmq4bZrmfazhQBePyNF8A2E.jpg','1974-10-17',86,'Released',NULL,'Benji',23069,2.7947,6.4,'_zF-iiyxQZc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6598,_binary '\0','/mLrR5QzA1eH4kBsxkngaq9KYRzP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071212',4.8,3078,'it','Chi sei?','Jessica Barrett, wife and mother of two young children, begins to show signs of demonic possession while pregnant with her third child. As she seeks help from her husband and doctor, a mysterious man approaches her and seems to have some answers.','/rm4SyIBQA67mw6DiBampwv6PsU1.jpg','1974-11-21',109,'Released','Evil grows beyond the door!','Beyond the Door',33801,2.3082,5.2,'945V0wVaX7g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6599,_binary '\0','/mBzaMOJABdBkMCbPHv9PkVPL4St.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071216',5.7,3513,'en','Big Bad Mama','Circumstances force a mother and her two daughters to get into bootlegging and bank robbing, and travel across the country pursued by the law.','/dZ6TOtV6WdWHphZfJldvsCdjmb1.jpg','1974-09-19',84,'Released','Hot Lead - Hot Cars - Hot Damn!','Big Bad Mama',45186,4.5705,5.682,'AhtEZe1R8_4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6600,_binary '\0','/6eMtiAmWIGGFCEoRyJWLUcojPfU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071221',6.2,2990,'en','Black Belt Jones','Jones is a secret agent who has gone into semi-retirement, concentrating instead on teaching the martial arts to inner city youths. The karate school is run by a kindly old coot named Pops. His gambling debts, however, bring the local thug, Pinky, down on him. To make matters worse, Pinky is then hired by some white thugs who want to get a hold of the property Pops\' school occupies so they can build a shopping mall. When things get heavy, Black Belt Jones leaps into action. Only he\'s not alone. Pops\' daughter, Sidney, shows up to lend a hand, proving herself every bit as agile and powerful a martial artist as Jones.','/tnzPJzKr2IVPGqkkE6aCGNePDq0.jpg','1974-01-28',87,'Released','He clobbers the mob','Black Belt Jones',18257,1.9654,6,'njrEbNZcydM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6601,_binary '\0','/7nxNnR9yftqVUoFvBdfr2akgu2A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071222',7.1,56858,'en','Black Christmas','As the residents of the Pi Kappa Sigma sorority house prepare for the festive season, a stranger begins to harass them with a series of obscene phone calls.','/ym0QcbrKNujzDyAU1IHGYUdRWub.jpg','1974-10-11',98,'Released','If this picture doesn\'t make your skin crawl... it\'s on TOO TIGHT.','Black Christmas',16938,6.0465,6.951,'k6JuJHmVsh4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6602,_binary '\0','/xwgKINVRSUtpgiYeYPMivDdxJY8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071229',6.3,3738,'en','The Black Windmill','A British agent\'s son is kidnapped and held for a ransom of diamonds. The agent finds out that he can\'t even count on the people he thought were on his side to help him, so he decides to track down the kidnappers himself.','/92lbZJZreeGYFdmjEuXuoQCbhL3.jpg','1974-05-17',106,'Released','The ultimate exercise in controlled terror.','The Black Windmill',32050,1.9865,6.3,'_f4eJSrwKvw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6603,_binary '\0','/syUzOlwPqM8pGRhUxPOnmrcGcHb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071230',7.7,166651,'en','Blazing Saddles','Crafty railroad worker Bart becomes the first Black sheriff of Rock Ridge, a frontier town about to be destroyed in order to make way for a new railroad. Initially, the citizens of Rock Ridge harbor a racial bias toward their new protector. However, they warm to him after realizing that Bart and his perpetually drunk gunfighter friend Jim are their only defense against a wave of thugs sent to rid the town of its population.','/vNw1gOEDdYTDeNMuuq8OmiEHrfH.jpg','1974-02-07',93,'Released','...or never give a saga an even break!','Blazing Saddles',11072,9.6637,7.244,'bsP7QaMlzQk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6604,_binary '\0','/1zguy7AbooWaAWLD44ap7tCpK9K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071233',6.1,7694,'en','Blood for Dracula','Deathly ill Count Dracula and his slimy underling, Anton, travel to Italy in search of a virgin\'s blood. They\'re welcomed at the crumbling estate of indebted Marchese Di Fiore, who\'s desperate to marry off his daughters to rich suitors. But there, instead of pure women, the count encounters incestuous lesbians with vile blood and Marxist manservant Mario, who\'s suspicious of the aristocratic Dracula.','/cLyCHzPT5kLBEPn4DMcqgNbjwke.jpg','1974-08-13',103,'Released','He couldn\'t live without a virgin\'s blood..... ...So a virgin had to die!','Blood for Dracula',25944,3.2714,5.7,'xFu_QCZVqcg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6605,_binary '\0','/anMzDs9Hyo3Z5fMrUoeGqwIEh1D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071240',6.2,1416,'en','Born Innocent','A constant runaway is given over to the care of the state and finds herself in a remand centre for girls. She is soon caught between the uncaring bureaucracy, the sometimes brutal treatment from her peers and her own abusive family, and only one care worker sees her potential to rise above her tragic circumstances.','/mqQlrmCB3UEVSxs9GocOn0r7QG8.jpg','1976-01-01',98,'Released','A Young Girl Behind Bars... The Pain. The Abuse. The Revenge.','Born Innocent',30671,2.015,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6606,_binary '\0','/2I3oJvwhatyjOIq8BjAbtEKHna5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071241',6.3,2896,'fr','Borsalino and Co.','Marseille. Heaps of flowers and funeral wreaths... \"A man who no longer defends his colors is no longer a man.\"','/w8NRzyVyZSLlyW7b1cOWiQCe1jh.jpg','1974-10-23',110,'Released',NULL,'Borsalino and Co.',60181,2.2353,6.403,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6607,_binary '\0','/3U84leD4UV9HadHEHceZp9y2T6y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071249',7.4,23599,'en','Bring Me the Head of Alfredo Garcia','An American bartender and his prostitute girlfriend go on a road trip through the Mexican underworld to collect a $1 million bounty on the head of a dead gigolo.','/gRWVf3InNlIlFT3WB9MnFdOwcYQ.jpg','1974-08-01',113,'Released','Why is his head worth one million dollars and the lives of 21 people?','Bring Me the Head of Alfredo Garcia',11942,4.8016,7.1,'ZSa7f_igHzc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6608,_binary '\0','/qO3bfjdg2Wqhnb11oBx64C0iVZG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071256',4.6,3390,'es','El buque maldito','After a pair of models go missing from a boat, a rescue party discover an empty galleon carrying the coffins of the long dead Knights Templar. The rescue party board the galleon and then discover their own boat has vanished. The survivors struggle to fight off the spectral knights with what little knowledge they have of them.','/zASO7gtxGnlSiMcTMAB78UPSPK2.jpg','1974-06-28',89,'Released','Living Dead Men - Existing on the FLESH of the YOUNG & BEAUTIFUL!','The Ghost Galleon',28067,2.1976,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6609,_binary '\0','/wG3I6DiYeZquWvdtBkm38dW2QJy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071259',6.4,2560,'en','Busting','Defying orders to lay-off the case, two Los Angeles vice-squad cops go after a local mobster and use unorthodox methods to achieve results.','/99tAd8PINgZSu6OrH6ZKClREIpH.jpg','1974-02-27',92,'Released','What this film exposes about undercover vice cops can\'t be seen on your television set.','Busting',84209,2.0383,6.258,'jeTXt2Ac3og','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6610,_binary '\0','/82LpcxsvMdPszskzq4vJr5K7qX4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071266',5.3,3527,'en','Caged Heat','A young woman is convicted on drug offenses and sent to a women\'s penitentiary run by a repressed and oppressive female warden. When the prison\'s sadistic doctor begins conducting illegal \"therapeutic\" experiments on the inmates, the ladies plot their revenge.','/rPLvEqdADWH5MmzKz31dNndHbF6.jpg','1974-04-19',83,'Released','Women\'s prison U.S.A. - Rape Riot and Revenge! White Hot Desires melting cold prison steel!','Caged Heat',39775,5.5162,5.1,'Vve-N_WlPfg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6611,_binary '\0','/kEoenL1rhOv7jcnh37JypttjchS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071268',6.3,1413,'en','The California Kid','A sadistic small-town sheriff has a habit of deliberately forcing speeders to their deaths on the mountain roads leading into town. The brother of one of the victims rolls into town in his hot rod to investigate his brother\'s death.','/lHH7WrcNxd84sfswvOVIHExtTou.jpg','1974-09-25',74,'Released','In this town a speeding ticket is a death sentence.','The California Kid',53102,1.9408,6.3,'DNvNOOfKKRk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6612,_binary '\0','/k2BYzk2FxH9NY5TZKS3PbcyGBXR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071269',7.1,9449,'en','California Split','Carefree single guy Charlie Waters rooms with two lovely prostitutes, Barbara Miller and Susan Peters, and lives to gamble. Along with his glum betting buddy, Bill Denny, Charlie sets out on a gambling streak in search of the ever-elusive big payday. While Charlie and Bill have some lucky moments, they also have to contend with serious setbacks that threaten to derail their hedonistic betting binge.','/udVed0KSaQw93zURmwWY6JMYqPX.jpg','1974-08-07',108,'Released','…Being the story of two bet-on-anything guys who happily discover something called a \"winning streak.\"','California Split',32044,3.0058,6.527,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6613,_binary '\0','/2htKwdsvkEPgAMGgwqERaQOXM0f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071275',7.4,5990,'it','Cani arrabbiati','Following a bungled robbery, three violent criminals take a young woman, a middle-aged man, and a child hostage and force them to drive them outside Rome to help them make a clean getaway.','/coPfiRtfFvbEOJra64hnlXMsY8w.jpg','1995-11-01',96,'Released','Lock the doors, rollup the windows, and buckle up… for the ride of your life!','Rabid Dogs',5482,2.1362,7.46,'KC4LML-AeEE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6614,_binary '\0','/ouH59F2dmlYQtnw4iCWZqczEYAD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071276',6.3,6634,'en','Captain Kronos: Vampire Hunter','When several young girls are found dead, left hideously aged and void of blood, Dr. Marcus suspects vampirism. He enlists the help of the Vampire Hunter. Mysterious and powerful, Kronos has dedicated his life to destroying the evil pestilence. Once a victim of its diabolical depravity, he knows the vampire\'s strengths and weaknesses as well as the extreme dangers attached to confronting the potent forces of darkness.','/4i6vRcVl9sE3W7ouQ8KC2B5NiJD.jpg','1973-04-07',91,'Released','Evil ends here.','Captain Kronos: Vampire Hunter',18979,3.4673,6.2,'8PbRzrGTt2E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6615,_binary '\0','/xASLEiAaf5n1xwfKz5cUFy9sH5a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071281',6,3284,'en','Carry On Dick','Dick Turpin is terrorising the countryside around Upper Dencher. Captain Fancey and Sergeant Jock Strapp plan to put an end to his escapades, and enlist the help of the Reverend Flasher. Little do they know that the priest leads a double life. Then Madame Desiree and her \"Birds of Paradise\" arrive in the village...','/3ShJqgijkZHHrk0WiSkHhxeLzyn.jpg','1974-02-01',91,'Released',NULL,'Carry On Dick',26327,2.1273,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6616,_binary '\0','/LhNAYzoYqJssVojll2eyKLonu6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071282',5.6,5028,'en','The Cars That Ate Paris','After surviving a car accident, a young man finds himself trapped in the isolated town of Paris, where the local economy depends on deliberately causing crashes and salvaging the wreckage. As he becomes entangled in the town’s routines, tensions between its residents and a rebellious group of youths begin to surface.','/whuJ4BY2Fq2EuhKkSrtjJxNFYsc.jpg','1974-10-10',91,'Released','148 people live in the township of Paris and every one of them is a murderer.','The Cars That Ate Paris',62761,3.0154,5.6,'Q424p7lWD-U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6617,_binary '\0','/pyvkujOZ5qvY2NlQVC71flfgVWE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071315',8.1,380099,'en','Chinatown','Private eye Jake Gittes lives off of the murky moral climate of sunbaked, pre-World War II Southern California. Hired by a beautiful socialite to investigate her husband\'s extra-marital affair, Gittes is swept into a maelstrom of double dealings and deadly deceits, uncovering a web of personal and political scandals that come crashing together.','/kZRSP3FmOcq0xnBulqpUQngJUXY.jpg','1974-06-20',130,'Released','You get tough. You get tender. You get close to each other. Maybe you even get close to the truth.','Chinatown',829,9.8436,7.906,'RKdXf-fiBcw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6618,_binary '\0','/noedBW2lIFLo2PGL0ibi1zTJTmC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071330',6.8,2051,'it','Il cittadino si ribella','Carlo Antonelli, an engineer from Genoa, gets mugged and decides to take justice into his own hands. At first the muggers seem to get the upper hand, but then he\'s helped by Tommy, a young robber who takes his side.','/7LbC7GRYOOipSo5cgIMJiWL1dkj.jpg','1974-09-17',103,'Released','When There\'s No Where Else to Turn to.','Street Law',90092,1.9567,6.6,'AaCAubhmNF8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6619,_binary '\0','/uLggMgKTs7t786MDSdHYGW7enrB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071334',7.3,2942,'en','Claudine','Claudine is a single mother in New York City who endures an exhausting commute to the suburbs where she works as a maid for wealthy families. In one carefully tended white community, she meets Roop, a charismatic but irresponsible garbage collector. Romance quickly ensues, but Claudine doubts that their relationship is good for her six children, and Rupert, despite his good nature, is reluctant to take on fatherhood.','/9mLM4Vx0L5kjaHPFXSe3ZgBEBCx.jpg','1974-04-22',92,'Released','A heart and soul comedy. Can you dig it?','Claudine',55909,1.5161,7.1,'UP-v7kxrwdE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6620,_binary '\0','/dGjxDit73Waq8D2M6sKrDzsx4Uh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071338',6.9,2906,'en','Cockfighter','A man who trains fighting cocks vows to remain silent until one of his birds wins a championship.','/rfOLlxDwhnaXQ2NWOG8qYsOrEnr.jpg','1974-08-01',83,'Released','From Governor\'s Mansions to Cheap Hotels: The Big Money Sport that\'s Dirty-Violent and Outside the Law!','Cockfighter',27658,1.4367,6.1,'nJ40oo1sMRc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6621,_binary '\0','/f6fUU5urKQ1YaSjM0bmwdURsRST.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071357',4.8,2097,'en','Confessions of a Window Cleaner','Young Timmy starts as a window cleaner in the little company of his brother. Soon he learns that some female customers expect additional service. Young and curious as he is, he reluctantly accepts the juicy duty. However his heart belongs to Liz, who demands the highest commitment until she lets him go all the way.','/7AZjQkQ3gDWpi0p8xjlYkdoufk5.jpg','1974-08-16',90,'Released','Serviced with a smile!','Confessions of a Window Cleaner',33303,2.9513,5,'afPhf7Ogk68','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6622,_binary '\0','/rP8WkOQIJiNi2U371IF97tjCvVQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071358',7.3,2461,'en','Conrack','A young, white school teacher is assigned to Yamacraw Island, an isolated fishing community off the coast of South Carolina, populated mostly by poor black families. He finds that the basically illiterate, neglected children there know so little of the world outside their island.','/wiP6lRKlF4jngcH4yQZINWqqaUh.jpg','1974-03-27',106,'Released','One beautiful man. His story is true.','Conrack',30702,1.3783,6.7,'ZTePeZag_yI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6623,_binary '\0','/lv7bRurrhBo3vjcwJNztb2ZkDu9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071359',5.6,6403,'fr','Contes immoraux','Four erotic tales from various historical eras. The first, \'The Tide\', is set in the present day, and concerns a student and his young female cousin stranded on the beach by the tide, secluded from prying eyes. \'Therese Philosophe\' is set in the nineteenth century, and concerns a girl being locked in her bedroom, where she contemplates the erotic potential of the objects contained within it. \'Erzsebet Bathory\' is a portrait of the sixteenth-century countess who allegedly bathed in the blood of virgins, while \'Lucrezia Borgia\' concerns an incestuous fifteenth-century orgy involving Lucrezia, her brother, and her father the Pope.','/dFPQD3e5uonv7bKTYsi7TqtKxYx.jpg','1974-08-28',125,'Released','Four Erotic tales that take us back through the centuries.','Immoral Tales',46581,6.4097,5.9,'TWFEhSK0Cb8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6624,_binary '\0','/s7yfiwIshKQIT6M8ZcTnFKXHs8B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071360',7.7,137596,'en','The Conversation','A paranoid, secretive surveillance expert has a crisis of conscience when he suspects that the couple he is spying on will be murdered.','/dHqVBwcv1SGymOpUueRoKzcmdes.jpg','1974-04-12',115,'Released','Harry Caul is an invader of privacy. The best in the business.','The Conversation',592,7.9788,7.5,'mDgKPQWyjRk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6625,_binary '\0','/m0h8qVyCfLPMin2tgQT7JRWON6b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071361',6.4,4457,'en','Coonskin','A multi-layered satire of race relations in America. Live-action sequences of a prison break bracket the animated tale of Brother Rabbit, Brother Bear, and Preacher Fox, who rise to the top of the crime ranks in Harlem by going up against a con-man, a racist cop, and the Mafia.','/3zrxUkbeLl2KmSIRywNTwiGOZ2y.jpg','1975-08-20',84,'Released','This is it Folks!','Coonskin',27716,2.5265,6.1,'YQicmcbJYB0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6626,_binary '\0','/oSr9IXgkJtpI6yeUkoDU3gfffBe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071381',7.2,7207,'fr','Céline et Julie vont en bateau','Julie, a daydreaming librarian, meets Céline, an enigmatic magician, and together they become the heroines of a time-warping adventure involving a haunted house, psychotropic candy, and a murder-mystery melodrama.','/h62tGTMdVVUThFwl5b4EP18cBhb.jpg','1974-09-18',193,'Released',NULL,'Céline and Julie Go Boating',27019,3.2687,6.8,'CcVuBjWpIEI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6627,_binary '\0','/208aRGBlyf8wVACc3TjgzaDm91X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071384',7.6,2335,'fr','Daguerréotypes','An intimate portrait of the small shops and shopkeepers of the Rue Daguerre in Paris, a picturesque street that has been the filmmaker’s home for more than 50 years.','/3XXWWVKbePGBu6Q7e0ngve5cwBB.jpg','1978-02-28',80,'Released',NULL,'Daguerréotypes',49650,2.0314,7.3,'5iaIge_aVHk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6628,_binary '\0','/jy9lr7WLqZC4iT6P13PMqtnUpuK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071385',6.2,2327,'en','Daisy Miller','Despite mixed emotions, Frederick Winterbourne tries to figure out the bright and bubbly Daisy Miller, only to be helped and hindered by false judgments from their fellow friends.','/tNchFArEWzP20lrQH0yH5Isf0jl.jpg','1974-05-22',91,'Released','She did as she pleased.','Daisy Miller',4703,2.127,6.278,'_NhciYKjWEA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6629,_binary '\0','/xGyXNt6uI1rBl30NE3j854urOuJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071391',5.8,1571,'en','Dark Places','The heir of a mysterious estate must unveil its secrets and discover its treasures before a scheming doctor and his seductive sister can steal what is rightfully his.','/cdjzWGn8R2OsAyvgBM5KmqxoqFs.jpg','1973-05-01',91,'Released','There is more than death waiting for you in dark places.','Dark Places',120632,1.5515,5.5,'QrL4QnsgjAY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6630,_binary '\0','/ljYxHqrXTubIHPKyqmnMuFFQqgX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071396',6.3,8317,'en','Messiah of Evil','A young woman searching for her missing artist father finds herself in the strange seaside town of Point Dune, which seems to be under the influence of a mysterious undead cult.','/5oRbZ2vBCuOiboc0WJ928KOwKAD.jpg','1975-04-23',90,'Released','Terror you won\'t want to remember—in a film you won’t be able to forget.','Messiah of Evil',24923,2.5928,6.3,'Fz_dko_C4mU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6631,_binary '\0','/9blNOmgTobqZGpt9A3JbG0mpMi3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071402',6.9,48745,'en','Death Wish','After his wife is murdered by street punks, a pacifistic New York City architect becomes a one-man vigilante squad, prowling the streets for would-be muggers after dark.','/rNksI6UiuTgLtBy69WvKT1PrG0R.jpg','1974-07-24',93,'Released','Vigilante, city style — judge, jury, and executioner.','Death Wish',13939,8.1845,6.929,'FuDFXV56gQ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6632,_binary '\0','/cRm7qbkTMcW9r0vQOiaz3pQZvNS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071406',7.7,2930,'ja','田園に死す','A director faces creative block while working on his latest film – a reimagination of his adolescence growing up in a mountain village in rural Japan.','/bnCaJFugZUZI0iACm9O2vbU24Af.jpg','1974-12-28',101,'Released',NULL,'Pastoral: To Die in the Country',104251,2.0998,7.5,'-IDAna7QvIw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6633,_binary '\0','/2Zd4348R7I8ii27TDs7XKAN5c6y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071408',6.3,6684,'en','Deranged','A man living in rural Wisconsin takes care of his bed-ridden mother, who is very domineering and teaches him that all women are evil. After she dies, he misses her, and a year later digs her up and takes her home. He learns about taxidermy and begins robbing graves to get materials to patch her up, and inevitably begins looking for fresher sources of materials. Based loosely on the true story of Ed Gein.','/lHcXdp4hNx1QiIQyLl2NlyvKSB5.jpg','1974-02-02',83,'Released','Pretty Sally Mae died a very unnatural death...But the worst hasn\'t happened to her yet!','Deranged',39844,2.8251,5.8,'MFMcB9CXjns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6634,_binary '\0','/33hRze5MIFzwV2MR3kF5QzPkgjR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071411',8.2,36886,'ru','Дерсу Узала','A military explorer meets and befriends a Goldi man in Russia’s unmapped forests. A deep and abiding bond evolves between the two men, one civilized in the usual sense, the other at home in the glacial Siberian woods.','/bIOrDQ3Gg68k3qJAnRU7nIZr0BW.jpg','1975-08-02',141,'Released','There is man and beast at nature\'s mercy. There is awe and love and reverence. And there is the man called...','Dersu Uzala',9764,4.1678,7.9,'oXGB-dKchz8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6635,_binary '\0','/uR4CgkdLdzxB33NmojQ6IF3fBM7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071412',6,1930,'en','The Marseille Contract','An important drug lord settled in Marseille is suspected of having ordered the killing of an American agent, but it is impossible to impute him due to his political influences, so the dead agent\'s boss decides to hire the services of a hitman to kill him.','/l2oI6xQOKik3g42YIOJctLA5QHv.jpg','1974-09-04',91,'Released','They live the sweet life but they play a game of sudden death!','The Marseille Contract',72639,2.3647,6.034,'dPsrbLPQKzs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6636,_binary '\0','/cvvDneITQM7ZZSAqUTzzmpwxf5L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071413',5.1,2346,'en','Devil Times Five','Five extremely disturbed, sociopathic children escape from their psychiatric transport and are taken in unwittingly by a group of adult villagers on winter vacation.','/8wccgiKXUAFxdCS2pPc9B6qq8uw.jpg','1974-05-31',88,'Released','What Wendy just saw them do will make you sick to your stomach...if it doesn\'t make you faint first!','Devil Times Five',72648,1.7758,5.2,'akIuzl_CwnE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6637,_binary '\0','/uE0JxB9pdxNtxFymNg6cImZBY5Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071424',6.6,8669,'en','Dirty Mary Crazy Larry','Down-on-their-luck racers Larry and Deke steal from a supermarket manager to buy a car that will help them advance their racing chances. Their escape does not go as planned when Larry\'s one-night stand, Mary, tags along for the ride.','/8hLvJUBEFFQHgiJIPXywRD9KZft.jpg','1974-05-17',93,'Released','There\'s nothin\' they won\'t try!','Dirty Mary Crazy Larry',19017,3.6231,6.376,'sujCL06VSXY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6638,_binary '\0','/9xxF1MBsXJ3Y2EJQsqU61StzcNU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071431',6.7,10670,'it','Non si deve profanare il sonno dei morti','When a series of murders hit the remote English countryside, a detective suspects a pair of travelers when it is actually the work of the undead, jarred back to life by an experimental ultra-sonic radiation machine used by the Ministry of Agriculture to kill insects.','/jfa3HmGdq1MZSLaJKtj1st1MDF7.jpg','1974-11-28',95,'Released','They tampered with nature—now they must pay the price …','The Living Dead at Manchester Morgue',25627,2.8692,6.4,'wylJGnqcosA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6639,_binary '\0','/iSOv0jtjGnmeqL5CawoY0a0o5o8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071442',5.9,1356,'it','Identikit','A mentally disturbed woman arrives in Rome to find a city fragmented by autocratic law, leftist violence, and her own increasingly unhinged mission to find the most dangerous liaison of all.','/b2ehm2SbIcLmMt6TvLZlNjhuznu.jpg','1974-05-20',102,'Released','Was she really mad enough to plot her own murder?','Identikit',93510,1.7731,6.444,'PYTxb2bft2I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6640,_binary '\0','/tGNnGU6yJ2OSTNlWUlbb6eqmLVY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071448',6.9,1996,'sv','Dunderklumpen!','Dunderklumpen lives all alone in the mountains of Jämtland. One Midsummer\'s Eve when he feels very lonely he sets off on a journey to find friends.','/f9nxy65nhTVAbx7GkK2K62M9bKJ.jpg','1974-09-26',97,'Released','A fat little fellow from Thunder Mountain','Dunderklumpen!',13798,1.5132,6.5,'KzdSLN-Dmrk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6641,_binary '\0','/vPPF44KWsL1DzAxnjvvabJUJ75O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071455',6,18556,'en','Earthquake','Various interconnected people struggle to survive when an earthquake of unimaginable magnitude hits Los Angeles, California.','/6hJorsInxNpj1dIekh6dK6Kh9S6.jpg','1974-11-15',123,'Released','When the big one finally hits L.A.','Earthquake',11123,4.3634,6.2,'yV88FanNJlU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6642,_binary '\0','/cv6MxWigdHr1ga9AN4stzyzEG7r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071458',6.9,3085,'de','Fontane Effi Briest','When 17-year-old Effi Briest marries the elderly Baron von Instetten, she moves to a small, isolated Baltic town and a house that she fears is haunted. Starved for companionship, Effi begins a friendship with Major Crampas, a charismatic womanizer.','/wgQvixpxtDCQPprGaVJOTas9n4.jpg','1974-06-20',141,'Released',NULL,'Effi Briest',706,1.8595,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6643,_binary '\0','/yKsMX3Ril4FVNHJKZukuDe7JemW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071464',5.2,12471,'fr','Emmanuelle','An employee at the French Embassy in Bangkok invites his wife to join him – and enjoy the benefits of their open marriage.','/kFq1ffM4ruQmWH6C3SjVWJoqMi6.jpg','1974-06-25',95,'Released','Lets you feel good without feeling bad','Emmanuelle',24402,8.3276,6,'DsOXacenEk8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6644,_binary '\0','/m2xjEECVuVeG304kA4R2y7UJCvY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071483',6.8,4658,'de','Falsche Bewegung','Six days in the life of Wilhelm: a detached man without qualities. He wants to write, so his mother gives him a ticket to Bonn, telling him to live. On the train he meets an older man, an athlete in the 1936 Olympics, and his mute teen companion, Mignon. She\'s an acrobat in market squares for spare change.','/mXdpTmRMPZyZQKWcY7GA8M2gaae.jpg','1975-03-14',105,'Released',NULL,'Wrong Move',20017,2.7438,6.7,'n5dMkZ8EIhc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6645,_binary '\0','/mrLqmBNmj5U0QCjcOQ4esB6IBF9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071486',7.8,8073,'it','Fantozzi','A good-natured but unlucky Italian is constantly going on a difficult situations, but never lose his mood.','/elGj4wK8fz5NT0weWitmfGizpr8.jpg','1975-03-27',108,'Released',NULL,'Fantozzi: White Collar Blues',25606,2.7882,7.781,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6646,_binary '\0','/Ai3fiCnWzHl3bL4CZQQ1pt2uiOU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071487',7.7,18681,'fr','Le Fantôme de la liberté','This Surrealist film, with a title referencing the Communist Manifesto, strings together short incidents based on the life of director Luis Buñuel. Presented as chance encounters, these loosely related, intersecting situations, all without a consistent protagonist, reach from the 19th century to the 1970s. Touching briefly on subjects such as execution, pedophilia, incest, and sex, the film features an array of characters, including a sick father and incompetent police officers.','/f6cON5ebistPm6AS1XcZZMmKpIi.jpg','1974-09-10',104,'Released','Luis Bunuel\'s kinkiest comedy.','The Phantom of Liberty',5558,4.2785,7.5,'njRLew_veDc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6647,_binary '\0','/fp315t2MuJs3jOPPsoY2Jv7ZdPQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071502',6.6,10110,'it','Il fiore delle Mille e una notte','The final part of Pasolini\'s Trilogy of Life series is rich with exotic tales of slaves and kings, potions, betrayals, demons and, most of all, love and lovemaking in all its myriad forms. Mysterious and liberating, this is an exquisitely dreamlike and adult interpretation of the original folk tales.','/zDrAREfrNvq5O10lHDDh529i143.jpg','1974-06-20',131,'Released','Pier Paolo Pasolini unfolds the Sensual and Erotic tales of the fabled... 1001 Arabian Nights','Arabian Nights',47406,4.0195,6.5,'OiTCXrAsYFA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6648,_binary '\0','/fykA9GZlzR5l6Yz0UQUerant5O1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071507',5.6,1377,'it','Flavia, la monaca musulmana','Puglia, southern Italy, around 1400. A convent is invaded by the Tarantula cult, whose fanatical and crazed members desecrate the sacred place by committing obscene and bloody acts.','/7N1tNM00ic81sbvy6QiXTXaNP7E.jpg','1974-06-14',102,'Released','She launched a river of blood','Flavia the Heretic',64538,2.8491,5.9,'ZhDPI9BnkBM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6649,_binary '\0','/mhRXv5sSpl4BhkNgWgW2OoK7ghc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071508',5.8,7931,'en','Flesh for Frankenstein','Within the decadent walls of the Frankenstein mansion, the Baron and his depraved assistant Otto have discovered the means of creating new life. As the Baron\'s laboratory begins to fill up with stitched body parts, the Baroness dallies with the randy new manservant and soon the decadent, permissive household is consumed by an outrageous, bizarre and hilarious combination of death and dismemberment.','/9GRNVP3Vny8WRafI1bwsrsf2BC0.jpg','1973-11-30',95,'Released','We dare you to see...','Flesh for Frankenstein',3043,3.0202,5.775,'4wWwY2i7XT4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6650,_binary '\0','/6ZfEbAyUTVOTAl0sVE07CnQ0XCn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071512',6.6,1785,'zh','血滴子','The Emperor\'s armies have developed a new weapon: a thrown blade that can remove someone\'s head from long distance. As the paranoid Emperor begins decapitating anyone he fears might be a threat, his guard Mau Tang becomes disillusioned with the excesses of his master. He leaves his post and takes up the quiet life of farming and raising a family. Eventually, though, his past catches up with him, and he must find a way to fight the flying guillotine if he is to save his head.','/MYFhMjC4AdjLrtzlWD1HLgzhPu.jpg','1975-02-18',105,'Released',NULL,'The Flying Guillotine',62071,2.3502,6.7,'vvE9WfsP73A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6651,_binary '\0','/7lq6b2emYAvsvJDRWG3L68uI6UB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071514',6.2,2921,'en','For Pete\'s Sake','Henrietta Robbins borrows money from a loan shark to finance her husband\'s investment in the stock market. However, when their stock plummets, she scrambles to find a way to pay the money back.','/4xmt8uGDBJsWUHAmxIyIQ84kUmm.jpg','1974-06-26',90,'Released','Zany Barbra.','For Pete\'s Sake',31901,2.4037,5.8,'AnWTGf6GpzQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6652,_binary '\0','/qf6Y1lDrlkJhJ04NCw0SEJ6NCNN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071517',6.4,14410,'en','Foxy Brown','A voluptuous black woman takes a job as a high-class prostitute in order to get revenge on the mobsters who murdered her boyfriend.','/d0K6SWsZi1VrZm6nALMY4Y1PxZq.jpg','1974-04-05',94,'Released','She\'s brown sugar and spice but if you don\'t treat her nice she\'ll put you on ice!','Foxy Brown',22048,4.4447,6.278,'YHziuA9bM7k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6653,_binary '\0','/h9XmGb8iw5wbQkfgnT0ITGWJMRE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071519',6.2,5169,'en','Frankenstein and the Monster from Hell','Dr Simon Helder, sentenced to an insane asylum for crimes against humanity, recognises its director as the brilliant Baron Frankenstein, the man whose work he had been trying to emulate before his imprisonment. Frankenstein utilises Helder\'s medical knowledge for a project he has been working on for some time. He is assembling a man from vital organs extracted from various inmates in the asylum. And the Baron will resort to murder to acquire the perfect specimens for his most ambitious project ever.','/lKcAIHSOHquRgit3F59Z81vdMdl.jpg','1974-05-02',95,'Released','Your blood will run cold when the monster rises!','Frankenstein and the Monster from Hell',3117,2.7966,6.1,'Q4LEoYYhkxU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6654,_binary '\0','/3EzYSZMDJNp275F3A8VDdjbaPPX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071521',6.6,4089,'en','Freebie and the Bean','Two San Francisco detectives want to bring down a local hijacking boss. But they\'ll have to get to him before a hitman does.','/sM9YZqppgCfVtFRX1eAgaaeaJQx.jpg','1974-12-21',113,'Released','Above all... It\'s a love story.','Freebie and the Bean',20802,2.9871,6.1,'8kkCBLp_qxM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6655,_binary '\0','/7h4JB6E9oTDe4PO0Q7O28rhoIkt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071523',6.2,3041,'en','Frightmare','In 1957, Dorothy and Edmund Yates were committed to an institution for the criminally insane, she for acts of murder and cannibalism and he for covering up her crimes. Fifteen years later, they are pronounced fit for society and released. However, in Dorothy\'s case the doctors may have jumped the gun a bit. Edmund and eldest daughter, Jackie, try to discover just how far Mother\'s bloodlust has taken her. Meanwhile, youngest daughter Debbie begins to explore the crazy roots of her family tree as fully as possible.','/9lJdYMIMpPIdTBVoSsFIm3e6cVQ.jpg','1974-11-05',88,'Released','What terrifying craving made her kill... and kill... and kill...','Frightmare',38446,1.8084,6.4,'QdqGlszABPg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6656,_binary '\0','/k0YZgwDZtI9M80GKvAAbGMweAEH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071524',7.3,16831,'en','The Front Page','Ruthless Chicago newspaper editor Walter Burns resorts to dubious motives in order to get top reporter Hildy Johnson to cover one more big crime story before retirement.','/r4RtbJk8wVyZ1yk6yBZjzGD4ANU.jpg','1974-11-01',105,'Released','It\'s the hottest story since the Chicago fire...and they\'re sitting on it.','The Front Page',987,4.4029,7.298,'Os4KgsvJ9Ys','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6657,_binary '\0','/bJQwAiTDlFkhHKHafyvbtT6mby7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071532',7.1,7375,'en','The Gambler','New York City English professor Axel Freed outwardly seems like an upstanding citizen. But privately Freed is in the clutches of a severe gambling addiction that threatens to destroy him.','/wyZyUHOm14wmStWnuBjflOkzajt.jpg','1974-10-02',112,'Released','For $10,000 they break your arms. For $20,000 they break your legs. Axel Freed owes $44,000.','The Gambler',44800,3.5099,6.7,'veTaDgOd48Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6658,_binary '\0','/bOwh1mdPR4ACGa1a5KdrXuNajXc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071537',5.9,2410,'it','Gatti rossi in un labirinto di vetro','A group of American tourists is traveling through Spain when two of them are murdered by a mysterious serial killer who removes an eyeball from every one of its victims. The tour presses on as the murders continue, with the travelers and the police trying to deduce which one of them is the killer.','/baGVhqWvP2h1KTKyJPRSsiJpAps.jpg','1975-01-24',91,'Released','A blinding vision of horror.','Eyeball',40474,1.7816,5.7,'DPrfIzoH36o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6659,_binary '\0','/4vEZf15FzCDkhO2NQlrTUVfb5aS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071544',7.3,2145,'fr','Général Idi Amin Dada: Autoportrait','Filmmaker Barbet Schroeder shows the Ugandan dictator meeting his Cabinet, reviewing his troops, explaining his ideology.','/AwkE1rC3UEmoZAonUlcPxEFhgMT.jpg','1974-05-29',90,'Released','A self portrait.','General Idi Amin Dada',36665,1.6047,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6660,_binary '\0','/vZibmo3v32RLBWWdKzl3k1Icu7g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071550',6.3,1382,'fr','La Gifle','A Parisian teacher loses his cool when his teenage daughter tells him she plans to drop out of school and move in with her boyfriend.','/jV7ZW36smhVjjRWoBhFDIEBqqiT.jpg','1974-10-23',99,'Released',NULL,'The Slap',76198,1.9164,6.569,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6661,_binary '\0','/1koTZvNDS1DoPeNMdvvdtzvi9V5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071557',6.3,1520,'fr','Le Gitan','Two thieves, Hugo Sennart and Yan Kuq, wanted by the same police inspector, cross paths by chance.','/z2xWjXdOs5J19fu4ZkRyoISZ162.jpg','1975-12-05',103,'Released',NULL,'The Gypsy',77570,2.4063,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6662,_binary '\0','/kGzFbGhp99zva6oZODW5atUtnqi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071562',9,1512913,'en','The Godfather Part II','In the continuing saga of the Corleone crime family, a young Vito Corleone grows up in Sicily and in 1910s New York. In the 1950s, Michael Corleone attempts to expand the family business into Las Vegas, Hollywood and Cuba.','/8a1lJs7mFyGhGhZZDT1azJUoQiZ.jpg','1974-12-20',202,'Released','The rise and fall of the Corleone empire.','The Godfather Part II',240,37.9594,8.573,'9O1Iy9od7-A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6663,_binary '\0','/cVwPmOixrOwUU2m657U82aarG9S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071565',6.2,9204,'ja','ゴジラ対メカゴジラ','An Okinawan prophecy that foretells the destruction of the Earth is seeming fulfilled when Godzilla emerges to return to his destructive roots. But not all is what it seems after Godzilla breaks his ally Anguirus\'s jaw. Matters are further complicated when a second Godzilla emerges, revealing the doppelgänger as a mechanical weapon.','/ai92jga3nzkeWdPIeZBo6vyhUj5.jpg','1974-03-21',84,'Released','Flying through space and firing missiles! A dreadful Godzilla, whose whole body is a weapon, appears!','Godzilla vs. Mechagodzilla',38582,3.0636,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6664,_binary '\0','/wKVTdGf1FKOJPBh6qtsegx8V9Sm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071566',5.7,2968,'en','Gold','Rod Slater is the newly appointed general manager of the Sonderditch gold mine, but he stumbles across an ingenious plot to flood the mine, by drilling into an underground lake, so the unscrupulous owners can make a killing in the international gold market.','/6heOkqfljjSvc9swpyeinAXwyyO.jpg','1974-06-08',120,'Released','Everything they touch turns to pure excitement!','Gold',47737,2.8179,5.771,'qRQakZ35P3I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6665,_binary '\0','/izHLxrSRlATwwHFGe6eKQobGWlb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071569',6.8,12171,'en','The Golden Voyage of Sinbad','Sinbad and his crew intercept a homunculus carrying a golden tablet. Koura, the creator of the homunculus and practitioner of evil magic, wants the tablet back and pursues Sinbad. Meanwhile, Sinbad meets the Vizier who has another part of the interlocking golden map, and they mount a quest across the seas to solve the riddle of the map.','/2DQPnuAjD7H4ae6BeBAVhu9RLWa.jpg','1973-12-20',105,'Released','Sinbad battles the creatures of legend in the miracle of Dynarama','The Golden Voyage of Sinbad',17897,4.1034,6.7,'LmU8-5CutII','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6666,_binary '\0','/9Rw9dnT5PirFpNV8kP3ske75PYO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071571',6.3,10964,'en','Gone in 60 Seconds','Insurance investigator Maindrian Pace and his team lead double-lives as unstoppable car thieves. When a South American drug lord pays Pace to steal 48 cars for him, all but one, a 1973 Ford Mustang, are in the bag. As Pace prepares to rip-off the fastback, codenamed \"Eleanor\", in Long Beach, he is unaware that his boss has tipped off the police after a business dispute.','/qYyeAodAOe4nHuzkHdN35ValzLT.jpg','1974-07-28',105,'Released','You can lock your car. But if he wants it...it\'s GONE IN 60 SECONDS','Gone in 60 Seconds',16246,3.3248,6.235,'1HiKyQMyq_Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6667,_binary '\0','/syIACSAOLd5iHFDtFelF8kmPM2l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071577',6.4,29203,'en','The Great Gatsby','Nick Carraway, a young Midwesterner now living on Long Island, finds himself fascinated by the mysterious past and lavish lifestyle of his neighbor, the nouveau riche Jay Gatsby. He is drawn into Gatsby\'s circle, becoming a witness to obsession and tragedy.','/zCjwyhfDTFgunVVzBoEFzafpjbV.jpg','1974-03-27',144,'Released','Gone is the romance that was so divine','The Great Gatsby',11034,5.7287,6.3,'L-SGqutpxc0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6668,_binary '\0','/gO4iKzUWuLObU43pNznj19yNsV9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071583',5.7,2490,'en','The Groove Tube','Television programming takes it on the chin in this ribald spoof of the networks.','/gyfmgTW3a0gftxgVptvKBAf9GqY.jpg','1974-06-23',75,'Released','The most hilarious and wildest movie is here!','The Groove Tube',27977,1.7754,5.1,'RkG6HMPBJoo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6669,_binary '\0','/zuXlN8gTWI453Rv5JokmexftV2S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071585',7.3,5881,'it','Gruppo di Famiglia in un Interno','A retired professor of American origin lives a solitary life in a luxurious palazzo in Rome. He is confronted by a vulgar Italian marchesa and her lover, her daughter and her daughter\'s boyfriend, and forced to rent to them an apartment on the upper floor of his palazzo. From this point on his quiet routine is turned into chaos by his tenants\' machinations, and everybody\'s life takes an unexpected but inevitable turn.','/vLFdB2MsgAH7UCVb60EzLTjIoqN.jpg','1974-12-20',121,'Released','A tangled web of bizarre mystery','Conversation Piece',56142,3.1399,7.4,'XY_93j3gM1M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6670,_binary '\0','/aCkycjuy9zqLUxFUR94qAgJtQq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071587',7.3,1522,'fr','La Gueule ouverte','Monique is dying of cancer, lying in bed in the apartment above the store her family owns. Her philandering husband carries on with life, her son remains aloof, and her daughter-in-law wonders if she is witnessing her own decline. They all struggle to express, or feel, their love for one another.','/lOdKDFF6RhlbVKiLJNIxHoNPD8S.jpg','1974-05-08',87,'Released',NULL,'The Mouth Agape',93672,1.4888,6.6,'eP9DCWq3vss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6671,_binary '\0','/eAPj43jprYqhQvqzaP7B1LL7B0N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071598',7.3,6849,'en','Harry and Tonto','Harry Coombes is a retired teacher in his 70s who has lived in the Upper West Side of New York City all his life. When his building is torn down to make way for a parking garage, Harry and his beloved cat Tonto begin a journey across the United States — visiting his children, seeing a world he never seemed to have the time to see before, making new friends, and saying goodbye to old friends.','/2JIy2g5UoHBnmNnFpSU7oq5xdTG.jpg','1974-08-12',115,'Released','Get a lift.','Harry and Tonto',42448,2.1842,7.109,'aPZ87LqYzlM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6672,_binary '\0','/t5dzF5wHcra6cBsqMC8n5KeR25R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071604',8.2,6675,'en','Hearts and Minds','Many times during his presidency, Lyndon B. Johnson said that ultimate victory in the Vietnam War depended upon the U.S. military winning the \"hearts and minds\" of the Vietnamese people. Filmmaker Peter Davis uses Johnson\'s phrase in an ironic context in this anti-war documentary, filmed and released while the Vietnam War was still under way, juxtaposing interviews with military figures like U.S. Army Chief of Staff William C. Westmoreland with shocking scenes of violence and brutality.','/yXnpP2RAZbG3DQufUGcOM5hU4cF.jpg','1974-12-20',112,'Released','The Forever War. Goes On','Hearts and Minds',42449,2.1573,7.6,'QcE6CdR60NY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6673,_binary '\0','/vFjPid59AjCjmhQMRmEKlCB5Dmm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071607',5.7,9745,'en','Herbie Rides Again','The living Volkswagen Beetle helps an old lady protect her home from a corrupt developer.','/1k14PPykkUQfhjn3xXDrc55lfHl.jpg','1974-02-12',88,'Released','The Loveable Bug\'s back doin\' his thing!','Herbie Rides Again',10869,4.7395,6.2,'swDEaCgluWQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6674,_binary '\0','/ePMrWBFymjeEN2nbQsjUdfnusCt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071613',5.8,2292,'en','Holiday on the Buses','Due to a female passenger falling out of her top whilst running for the bus Stan is distracted and crashes the bus resulting in the depot managers car being written off. As a result Stan, Jack and Blakey are fired. Stan and Jack soon get new jobs as a bus crew at a Pontins holiday resort but discover that Blakey has also gotten a job there as the chief security guard.','/3ewJwuY28E4RzCRf2lklwvzPrsK.jpg','1973-05-19',85,'Released','Their Most Hilarious Yet!','Holiday on the Buses',19249,1.6853,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6675,_binary '\0','/oUceCsSe255ZKXCMsHhqXM1xuUp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071615',7.7,53272,'es','La montaña sagrada','The Alchemist assembles together a group of people from all walks of life to represent the planets in the solar system. The occult adept\'s intention is to put his recruits through strange mystical rites and divest them of their worldly baggage before embarking on a trip to Lotus Island. There they ascend the Holy Mountain to displace the immortal gods who secretly rule the universe.','/oaOyrFD4ZyZZwjO8wc4b12XHcgZ.jpg','1973-11-29',115,'Released',NULL,'The Holy Mountain',8327,4.4683,7.5,'DSON8vHpxzY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6676,_binary '\0','/2fxKUjqZjNy8KMvKwNZW3avI55c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071622',7.1,3193,'fr','L\'Horloger de Saint-Paul','Michel Descombes is a watchmaker who lives in Lyon with his teenage son Bernard. When the police visit and inform him that Bernard has killed a man and is on the run with a girl, Michel realises that he knew far less about his son than he thought.','/fLDETyjhqsEDmryQ17i46wV3ECr.jpg','1974-01-16',105,'Released',NULL,'The Watchmaker of St. Paul',8425,1.9229,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6677,_binary '\0','/vIE7vSHZFTp7XUNKM4imZzyJ0wg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071627',4.3,1859,'en','The House of Seven Corpses','A director is filming on location in a house where seven murders were committed. The caretaker warns them not to mess with things they do not understand (the murders were occult related), but the director wants to be as authentic as possible and has his cast re-enact rituals that took place in the house thus summoning a ghoul from the nearby cemetery to bump the whole film crew off one by one.','/mdZg9zbVNDR9RCyH8pQkOp7K4Nb.jpg','1974-02-01',90,'Released',NULL,'The House of Seven Corpses',42452,1.8625,4.7,'nZSsl-eEoKQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6678,_binary '\0','/4DL0B0F3H2mBWpoHKo2HgU26AVu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071628',5.8,2188,'en','House of Whipcord','Somewhere in the middle of the English countryside a former judge and a group of former prison warders, including his lover, run their own prison for young women who have not been held properly to account for their crimes. Here they mete out their own form of justice and ensure that the girls never return to their old ways.','/yTqBvDPRoF0d1RnDXjg9GDNW0Jc.jpg','1974-04-19',102,'Released','Only young girls may enter and no one leaves...','House of Whipcord',86643,2.5725,5.9,'mz6BM9YUecQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6679,_binary '\0','/6l3neUmnMyf2Vu8BAAEVI1dTrBd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071650',5.1,9356,'en','Ilsa: She Wolf of the SS','Ilsa, a warden at a Nazi death camp that conducts experiments on prisoners, strives to prove that women can withstand more pain and suffering than men, and therefore should be allowed to fight on the frontlines.','/toiyTNxp1DiCMK5wS63Q9eZcS2N.jpg','1975-10-01',97,'Released','The most dreaded Nazi of them all!','Ilsa: She Wolf of the SS',20850,4.031,6,'t7sjqF2BTFA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6680,_binary '\0','/9hW0Hyk81ucdRiW9EZ6biXJDJNs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071663',6.2,1400,'en','The Internecine Project','Offered a job as a presidential adviser, a professor is forced to dispose of those who knew him when he was a spy.','/7Cgc09odUzTfVKCEGkCoJupOh1A.jpg','1974-07-24',89,'Released','Who will be alive when the hands stop?','The Internecine Project',86600,1.9757,5.9,'rAQ73r-BynU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6681,_binary '\0','/u5uBdmMztudhylbM8ufMasEcC76.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071671',6.2,3590,'en','The Island at the Top of the World','A Victorian gentleman hopes to find his long-lost son, who vanished while searching for a mysterious Viking community in a volcanic valley somewhere in uncharted Arctic regions. The gentleman puts together an expedition team to go on the search, but when they reach their destination they must escape from some Viking descendants who will kill to keep their existence a secret.','/6jceLUcdtxgveyABliSM5JFRSRz.jpg','1974-12-16',94,'Released','Adventure beyond imagination','The Island at the Top of the World',42453,3.7844,6.51,'IjHnvAHr3is','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6682,_binary '\0','/gdD6776xzz6UZKQMDiDvdHoGzrB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071675',5.8,9867,'en','It\'s Alive','The Davises are expecting a baby, which turns out to be a monster with a nasty habit of killing people whenever scared. And it\'s easily scared.','/jRxJV0N5nox3IVwkculuytkzSjt.jpg','1974-04-26',91,'Released','There\'s only one thing wrong with the Davis baby...','It\'s Alive',28153,2.8822,6,'cDQmOcV53wY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6683,_binary '\0','/9vYYgAxMk5dihLVJhnneUbTL2Wb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071680',7.6,4427,'en','Italianamerican','Filmmaker Martin Scorsese interviews his mother and father about their life in New York and family history back in Sicily.','/5mznNfhBuABFctEuw2p0NHlEaZ2.jpg','1974-10-01',49,'Released',NULL,'Italianamerican',91459,1.892,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6684,_binary '\0','/9wN27MlPHhwAqVYfBVO9BoJHFyV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071682',7.6,1507,'cs','Jáchyme, hoď ho do stroje!','A sincere provincial young man, Frantisek Koudelka leaves to work in Prague. For the trip he buys a computer made horoscope with biorhythms charts, marked according to his date of birth, there are trappy, precarious, unsuccessful and even critical days and few successful days. The clumsy luckless person Frantisek has finally a guidance for his life.','/iT3KLI8yn9S9KRC6XYZHxNZVX6n.jpg','1974-08-30',95,'Released',NULL,'Joachim, Put It in the Machine',234426,1.3982,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6685,_binary '\0','/6LNvwNeEIaEl6L4ui1Hso3cVlh7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071687',7.5,1461,'cs','Jak utopit dr. Mráčka aneb Konec vodníků v Čechách','There are still water spirits among us. One group lives in Prague, led by Mr. Wassermann, who is using his wife\'s family as a servants. All they need is their old house near the river. But the house is to be demolished. They have to stop it. And the only way is to drown Dr. Mrácek, who is responsible for the demolition. But he falls in love with Wassermann\'s niece Jana. He changes to fish, is mistaken for water spirit from Germany, is drowned and revived again. The other problem is the flour with ears... and so on...','/dQVyR3WTgon5MuRwqZaykFKwJp8.jpg','1975-03-01',120,'Released',NULL,'How to Drown Dr. Mracek, the Lawyer',8704,1.5104,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6686,_binary '\0','/sbq7q2PkYvzgbOlVAICmzXBldWu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071688',7.1,1563,'de','Jakob der Lügner','A Jewish ghetto in the east of Europe, 1944. By coincidence, Jakob Heym eavesdrops on a German radio broadcast announcing the Soviet Army is making slow by steady progress towards central Europe. In order to keep his companion in misfortune, Mischa, from risking his life for a few potatoes, he tells him what he heard and announces that he is in possession of a radio - in the ghetto a crime punishable by death. It doesn\'t take long for word of Jakob\'s secret to spread - suddenly, there is new hope and something to live for - and so Jakob finds himself in the uncomforting position of having to come up with more and more stories.','/mT4DFHyanpXb3Ykd8M1Z9auyegL.jpg','1974-12-22',100,'Released',NULL,'Jacob the Liar',2200,1.7446,6.9,'Rzctv12-yNY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6687,_binary '\0','/3FBWf8D3UuVULrtWsRBKfhOaBSc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071690',6.6,3999,'fr','Je, tu, il, elle','A woman suffers a subdued psychological breakdown in the wake of a devastating breakup.','/4arnTs41WSLWsnENWdljFKo0pu1.jpg','1974-11-19',86,'Released',NULL,'Je Tu Il Elle',93934,2.5981,6.5,'pGq0MkMGQsM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6688,_binary '\0','/9zYXDMmhBKTbCbImJclf9hEbqZC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071691',7.6,20551,'de','Jeder für sich und Gott gegen alle','The film follows Kaspar Hauser, who lived the first seventeen years of his life chained in a tiny cellar with only a toy horse to occupy his time, devoid of all human contact except for a man who wears a black overcoat and top hat who feeds him.','/sQMgWXrhvzHylyXCPt7myVSG96I.jpg','1974-11-01',109,'Released',NULL,'The Enigma of Kaspar Hauser',11710,4.1359,7.3,'tzxreLUzuUI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6689,_binary '\0','/konLUHlmrw1UTOYJniEC0gZkUt9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071695',7.3,4813,'ja','子連れ狼 地獄へ行くぞ！大五郎','With most of his family already dead at Ogami Itto\'s hands, Retsudo launches one final plot to destroy him, and when that fails, unleashes the fury of every remaining member of the Yagyu clan.','/zRBOXoQDvcApwVWyY80G813qzHd.jpg','1974-04-24',83,'Released',NULL,'Lone Wolf and Cub: White Heaven in Hell',41486,1.8364,7.1,'izGPFfc3QfU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6690,_binary '\0','/hHrbg0tRhJ4ihxQJNuvtJII0Cjj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071696',7.3,1521,'ja','仁義なき戦い 頂上作戦','As Japan gears up for the 1964 Olympic Games, the cops start to crack down on the gangs, under pressure from the public and the press, adding a new dimension in the war for power among the yakuza families of Hiroshima.','/fYcMKQ4z0wrgahBsvLf9J4Z40B8.jpg','1974-01-15',101,'Released',NULL,'Battles Without Honor and Humanity: Police Tactics',52979,2.0354,7,'4w_rOSGUtUc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6691,_binary '\0','/ak3hN1cRKmmLvVdq2QjKPGHaPoo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071706',6.6,7396,'en','Juggernaut','A terrorist demands a huge ransom in exchange for information on how to disarm the seven bombs he has planted aboard a trans-Atlantic cruise ship. Inspired by real events.','/3c0qJYBVeDy1Jg0RBhlt60JA9x5.jpg','1974-09-25',109,'Released','The greatest sea adventure in history has just begun!','Juggernaut',29805,4.3256,6.297,'B4DsBoWVjvc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6692,_binary '\0','/kZQDyveWkkeOJgbfX2FmMOHRUqh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071717',5,2320,'en','Killdozer','A small construction crew on an island is terrorized when a spirit-like being takes over a large bulldozer, and goes on a killing rampage.','/mcXmSQeqerpUEMJMJQ5TgW3aN0w.jpg','1974-02-02',74,'Released','Everyone Knows a Machine Cannot Kill. Except the Machine.','Killdozer',20121,1.8445,5.3,'vU73kzrhWig','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6693,_binary '\0','/ulXiKO7u6HtOxz1YxQMgEtZ023b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071721',5.3,2025,'en','The Klansman','A small southern town has just been rocked by a tragedy: a young white woman has been raped by a black man. When young black man Garth witnesses the Ku Klux Klan\'s violent retaliation against his innocent friend, Garth declares a one-man war on the Klan and hunts them down one-by-one.','/3dqY2dRGc27rXuYwJL7ipMDs5WB.jpg','1974-10-25',112,'Released','Welcome to scenic Atoka County. Pop. 10,000. Cross burnings. Rape. Murder. Arson. It\'s a great place to live...if THEY let you.','The Klansman',77765,2.1039,5.6,'-wS9PSQWhEM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6694,_binary '\0','/ikO0koqdi0V7Z9CJXwwKf5tiTrs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071733',7.6,8511,'fr','Lacombe Lucien','In Louis Malle\'s lauded drama, Lucien Lacombe is a young man living in rural France during World War II who seeks to join the French Resistance. When he is rejected due to his youth, the resentful Lucien allies himself with the Nazis and joins the Gallic arm of their Gestapo. Lucien grows to enjoy the power that comes with his position, but his life is complicated when he falls for France Horn, a beautiful young Jewish woman.','/gHlorDyJrigxzcuZaQ5p4mseAPC.jpg','1974-01-30',138,'Released',NULL,'Lacombe, Lucien',55368,1.3599,7,'ekSHBWYlJao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6695,_binary '\0','/rM3lahhi1NnqErDb1Gt8xwCYlw7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071737',6.9,4768,'fr','Lancelot du Lac','Having failed in their quest for the Holy Grail, the knights of the Round Table return to Camelot, their number reduced to a mere handful. Seeing a rift developing between Lancelot and Mordred, Arthur urges his knights to bury their differences and become friends. However, the King is unaware that Lancelot is having an affair with his queen, Guinevere. Lancelot is torn between his duty to his king and his love for the queen, whilst Mordred is determined to use his infidelity to destroy him.','/mF5BQro2PC7YG4XY6i70jwXOzbl.jpg','1974-04-23',85,'Released',NULL,'Lancelot of the Lake',55848,2.3055,6.2,'9CSBUWiaxYQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6696,_binary '\0','/6zqFDzIKPKyGX1jwYAiJTGvYyXz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071746',7.5,19835,'en','Lenny','The story of acerbic 1960s comic Lenny Bruce, whose groundbreaking, no-holds-barred style and social commentary was often deemed by the establishment as too obscene for the public.','/Avhk4pGdz3YQrzqLU65icjnE6vn.jpg','1974-11-10',112,'Released','Lenny Said It. \"Hot Honey\" Did It. Together They Shocked America.','Lenny',27094,3.1306,7.3,'0EP_sAGnkGo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6697,_binary '\0','/hhxoxYmmx92dKfyibeeBMU2GbC2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071762',6.5,4401,'en','The Little Prince','After a pilot is forced to make an emergency landing in the Sahara Desert, he befriends a young prince from outer space; the friendship conjures up stories of journeys through the solar system for the stranded aviator.','/xAUiufPCoU8P4F1w4MqpjcxIVCO.jpg','1974-11-06',88,'Released','The entertainment that loves a lot, and lives a lot, and gives and gives and gives a lot.','The Little Prince',37627,3.174,6.9,'n3Iz3iczQXk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6698,_binary '\0','/tIXJy1WbgtILBrD1HALZiBhlfAD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071771',7.1,23531,'en','The Longest Yard','A football player-turned-convict organizes a team of inmates to play against a team of prison guards. His dilemma is that the warden asks him to throw the game in return for an early release, but he is also concerned about the inmates\' lack of self-esteem.','/2qtpPGRpMEnwhRRoq3iqyQm238V.jpg','1974-08-21',121,'Released','It\'s survival of the fiercest and funniest','The Longest Yard',4985,6.7625,6.7,'axYnHBSnNTk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6699,_binary '\0','/rs0FfmZ8EA9bJYNoR3MkMMmWZBx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071772',5.6,5575,'en','The Lords of Flatbush','Set in 1958, the coming of age story follows four lower middle-class Brooklyn teenagers known as The Lords of Flatbush. The Lords chase girls, steal cars, shoot pool, get into street fights, and hang out at a local malt shop.','/zmXNjWFK4zlkStngN2qdVZ9Vprh.jpg','1974-05-01',86,'Released','When was the last time someone gave you a hickey?','The Lords of Flatbush',38925,3.3779,5.8,'6wbZJmOWCQM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6700,_binary '\0','/mXvuS69nedObctAKsur8PeG4lMY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071782',6.4,1754,'it','Lucky Luciano','Lucky Luciano is one of the bosses of the Mafia. He orders the slaughter of 40 other responsibles, therefore becoming the only boss. But a few years later he is put into jail. In 1946, he got a pardon and is sent back to Sicilia. There, he begins becoming one of the chief of the Mafia. The US Army seems to refrain from interfering.','/gfKSiDcZRqoFLe6NNF6TlgwBa8S.jpg','1973-10-19',110,'Released','The real story behind Lucky Luciano, the high priest of crime','Lucky Luciano',59230,2.1921,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6701,_binary '\0','/q4yJiu2mDREKUSQG6XFs3V6oiA2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071788',6.5,1965,'en','Macon County Line','A vengeful Southern sheriff is out for blood after his wife is brutally killed by a pair of drifters. Low-budget film set in Georgia in 1953 and at the time of release, purported to be based on a true story.','/dWAyaQWfGkk0OWkXjdZFtQvAYwP.jpg','1974-08-08',89,'Released','They\'re on the bad side of the wrong man.','Macon County Line',42450,1.5667,5.9,'IW04ThswKaM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6702,_binary '\0','/a3rzGlFc6UmdWShekSzGbOLWUWk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071790',6.2,5285,'en','Madhouse','A horror movie star returns to his famous role after spending years in a mental institution, but the character seems to be committing murders independent of his will.','/uGvbgGotNIr24wyMrrfgYcSuH1r.jpg','1974-03-28',92,'Released','If stark terror were ecstasy...living here would be sheer bliss!','Madhouse',28715,1.7817,6.2,'LoYq9UezC5Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6703,_binary '\0','/qP5Yqu52CGwYFKQgTA5SszjYDt0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071797',7,3374,'en','Mahler','Famed composer Gustav Mahler reflects on the tragedies of his life and failing marriage while traveling by train.','/qtKHqPr8llaSk4BSFczsopmsIP.jpg','1974-04-04',115,'Released','An electrifying visual odyssey into musical madness and savage romance.','Mahler',84922,3.3792,6.8,'R2mIZpMVhG0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6704,_binary '\0','/ymq4zUU6grdJ7m2vaD8C7q8bzI5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071803',5.9,3765,'en','Mame','The madcap life of eccentric Mame Dennis and her bohemian, intellectual arty clique is disrupted when her deceased brother\'s 10-year-old son Patrick is entrusted to her care. Rather than bow to convention, Mame introduces the boy to her free-wheeling lifestyle, instilling in him her favorite credo, \"Life is a banquet, and most poor sons of bitches are starving to death.\"','/kcVNOOSGNgFcFNz49Sx3JdNyvEq.jpg','1974-03-07',131,'Released','She\'ll coax the blues right out of your heart!','Mame',35275,2.5897,5.8,'Qvw6Ha0rCcY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6705,_binary '\0','/3tpNEbRahT8smy7RraaWa0xg9Gv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071807',6.7,123091,'en','The Man with the Golden Gun','Cool government operative James Bond searches for a stolen invention that can turn the sun\'s heat into a destructive weapon. He soon crosses paths with the menacing Francisco Scaramanga, a hitman so skilled he has a seven-figure working fee. Bond then joins forces with the swimsuit-clad Mary Goodnight, and together they track Scaramanga to a Thai tropical isle hideout where the killer-for-hire lures the slick spy into a deadly maze for a final duel.','/xVkbKwGnBVNQ122GN5bCTMyPbWz.jpg','1974-12-04',125,'Released','The world\'s greatest villains tried to kill James Bond...now it\'s Scaramanga\'s turn to try!','The Man with the Golden Gun',682,10.2478,6.465,'QUvKxtSrHJs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6706,_binary '\0','/qH9fNrMwv7V8vFOGZhbtnfTjRa9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071824',6.2,6615,'en','McQ','Police Lieutenant Lon McQ investigates the killing of his best friend and uncovers corrupt elements of the police department dealing in confiscated drugs.','/l2s6ti9dFmqqxd9HvWmegAsC92p.jpg','1974-02-06',111,'Released','Wayne on wheels!','McQ',26185,3.2918,6.1,'KqjMldbaQ3s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6707,_binary '\0','/f8klF55U8filBYsIXeZAo8jSZcj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071833',7.1,1835,'fr','Mes petites amoureuses','Daniel lives with his grandmother and, after a year of high school, goes to live with his mother in the south of France; a harsher environment which rapidly changes his perception of friends, work, and women.','/roR2cQdgg6wXoAl99D2Dw9JDNxd.jpg','1974-12-20',124,'Released',NULL,'My Little Loves',64296,1.8528,6.694,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6708,_binary '\0','/r2ykNnW0w24wgCUq8XkPLiFaJNL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071838',6.4,1583,'en','The Midnight Man','An ex-convict, and ex-cop, finds himself in the midst of drama as a murder, of a female student, is commited at the university where he works as a night watchman. He is reluctantly drawn into the criminal investigation and eventually becomes a suspect in the case. Will he be able to find the real murderer and clear his own name, or not?','/rMSertsKUUrGhGL43cfjpcaTnfG.jpg','1974-03-07',119,'Released','One of them is a murderer. All of them make the most fascinating murder mystery in years.','The Midnight Man',116138,1.7384,5.6,'OR-2gGhvt2Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6709,_binary '\0','/3F37pERkV42zI9vX6d3kdCNX4Q8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071840',7.1,3392,'it','Milano odia: la polizia non può sparare','A psychotic small-time criminal realizes that the everyday robberies, rapes and murders he commits aren\'t profitable enough, so he figures to hit the big time by kidnapping the daughter of a rich man.','/gEbwgT6fgKCJJWky77Q4TMErvmZ.jpg','1974-08-08',99,'Released','There is a reason for every living creature ...with one exception.','Almost Human',50236,2.1049,7,'O0LhdkVXKRw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6710,_binary '\0','/nbP4dsVRycfpHpRLwcmoQtwwdCq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071847',8.1,1237,'en','The Missiles of October','Based in part on Robert F. Kennedy\'s book, \"Thirteen Days,\" this film profiles the Kennedy Administration\'s actions during the Cuban Missile Crisis.','/3xS4gNyO8vAGn1wObfd7HdYzfdN.jpg','1974-12-18',150,'Released','The most powerful docudrama ever produced on The Cuban Missile Crisis','The Missiles of October',59922,1.9126,7.5,'SH_SK6E-03E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6711,_binary '\0','/1KgXxv6tHXOnakqYvMPvFwYKWiw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071853',8.1,607948,'en','Monty Python and the Holy Grail','King Arthur, accompanied by his squire, recruits his Knights of the Round Table, including Sir Bedevere the Wise, Sir Lancelot the Brave, Sir Robin the Not-Quite-So-Brave-As-Sir-Lancelot and Sir Galahad the Pure. On the way, Arthur battles the Black Knight who, despite having had all his limbs chopped off, insists he can still fight. They reach Camelot, but Arthur decides not to enter, as \"it is a silly place\".','/7nTkHjETdGMYK1phHwDbPsrzbYl.jpg','1975-04-03',91,'Released','And now! At Last! Another film completely different from some of the other films which aren\'t quite the same as this one is.','Monty Python and the Holy Grail',762,11.1826,7.803,'4b52A3sKz-I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6712,_binary '\0','/mSSNG4KZzyFGgwpHqrhOMhHv4yb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071859',7.5,2626,'fa','مسافر','Hassan Darabi, a troublesome, amoral 10-year-old boy in a small Iranian town wishes to see the Iran national football team play an important match in Tehran. In order to achieve that, he scams his friends and neighbors.','/l90dkEYuJIx7443zzmtVNsFlf0M.jpg','1974-11-06',73,'Released',NULL,'The Traveler',54001,1.2821,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6713,_binary '\0','/a0Rt8J5LfQ64V5WI475bkF9DxL8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071863',6.4,1749,'fr','La moutarde me monte au nez','Pierre is a clumsy, overly serious math teacher at an all-girls high school. His life is thrown into chaos after encountering a beautiful British actress and the paparazzi that follow her around.','/cOaaMaNXuKp6NpEFdGs6529pUdC.jpg','1974-10-09',92,'Released','Laughter, misunderstandings and passion explode in an effervescent vaudeville.','I\'m Losing My Temper',51212,2.0929,6.057,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6714,_binary '\0','/e7HB7J6TG19lc9sVbB7zNHLjPvC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071864',6.7,2325,'fr','Le Mouton enragé','A shy bank employee unexpectedly invites a young woman to a café, leading to a one-night stand. When he shares this with his disillusioned friend, the writer helps him navigate a dazzling social ascent.','/gFSkffvu07hHnVYj1aCu4PlI26Y.jpg','1974-03-13',105,'Released','(And How to Get There)!','Love at the Top',60430,2.1785,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6715,_binary '\0','/7thKOA6SH1qd0zBHLOskoAtxlIn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071866',6.7,11606,'en','Mr. Majestyk','A melon farmer battles organized crime and a hit man who wants to kill him.','/hJR239Fep2R75f8gGc9uxei0Buh.jpg','1974-07-17',103,'Released','He didn\'t want to be hero... until the day they pushed him too far.','Mr. Majestyk',26173,3.547,6.805,'XEjMGyDV8kE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6716,_binary '\0','/tAXK5R0ytrN2l2qgGfyxums5J0w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071877',7.2,75469,'en','Murder on the Orient Express','In 1935, when his train is stopped by deep snow, detective Hercule Poirot is called on to solve a murder that occurred in his car the night before.','/oJjKcuoH7SuiqZaEpHt2Nd5ZxNY.jpg','1974-11-22',128,'Released','The who\'s who in the whodunnit!','Murder on the Orient Express',4176,8.7433,7.1,'E-YJjWoanCo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6717,_binary '\0','/qLnZ9U1jiAIXVWoLLGF8DAiKbq2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071890',6.6,1218,'fr','Nada','Nada, named after a gang of Spanish anarchists, is a small, confused band of French terrorists. They kidnap the American ambassador after one of his regular visits to an exclusive brothel. The gang starts to quarrel amongst themselves as to the diplomat\'s fate, while the police purge suspects in their attempts to destroy the Nada faction. As the violence escalates on both sides, the States and the terrorists are forced to use one another\'s methods in an increasingly desperate and relentless conflict.','/wxxNqUgtpQPCFS8Bkg50olhsBFA.jpg','1974-02-06',132,'Released',NULL,'The Nada Gang',4790,1.7978,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6718,_binary '\0','/kntOvP2Di1Y5WCwf3EEEkzLqwSL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071907',7.5,2374,'pl','Nie ma mocnych','The main characters are the same two quarreling peasant families introduced in \"Sami swoi\" (Our Folks). The action of the film starts 18 years later. The old quarrels have been forgotten, but new problems keep popping up. They have no successors to inherit the farms. They invent a tricky and clever plan. The young granddaughter is to take over both of the farms after her marriage. Both Kargul and Pawlak have no rest until they carry out the plan. In the end, after numerous adventures and obstacles their cunning intrigue is fulfilled - the young marry and the land remains in the family\'s hands.','/uKL4eeMadyxI3mu7ZEWqXDtWvZP.jpg','1974-05-28',89,'Released',NULL,'Take It Easy',38374,1.2497,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6719,_binary '\0','/hpjOpJTCZy6orJhkJwNcA3vWhso.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071908',7.4,1375,'pl','Nie ma róży bez ognia','Janek and Wanda live in a small room in a villa, while other rooms are occupied by offices of various institutions. Janek often stays at work after hours, just to avoid returning to the cramped apartment too early. One day, a man named Malinowski, who once lived in the same small room, visits the couple. He proposes to exchange their room for a new, two-room apartment that he has just received. Janek and Wanda are initially distrustful, but eventually, the exchange takes place. It turns out that Wanda\'s ex-husband, Jerzy, already lives in the new apartment. Despite the divorce, as he is registered with Wanda, he has the right to continue living in her apartment. Janek tries to find a way to get rid of the intruder.','/onwy4sFiUTfWMBNgjNw8QIQ7khG.jpg','1974-12-25',91,'Released',NULL,'A Jungle Book of Regulations',173171,1.2236,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6720,_binary '\0','/ljaYQnoTmdawkRqUquu4kCMQqO9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071910',6.6,16701,'it','Il portiere di notte','A concentration camp survivor discovers her former torturer and lover working as a porter at a hotel in postwar Vienna. When the couple attempt to re-create their sadomasochistic relationship, his former SS comrades begin to stalk them.','/zTUYhMdh2Jwk5s9jbrU4mCH3CY4.jpg','1974-04-03',118,'Released','The Most Controversial Picture of Our Time!','The Night Porter',26648,4.8469,6.7,'wC7NPWSyx0I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6721,_binary '\0','/eQRv4LzpUuAgGovRlagr1rp7Rtj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071913',5.2,3408,'en','The Nine Lives of Fritz the Cat','Fritz, now married and a father, is desperate to escape the domestic hell he now finds himself in. Lighting up a joint, he begins to dream about his eight other lives, hoping to find one to provide a pleasant distraction. The drug-induced journeys he takes include spells as an astronaut, Hitler\'s psychiatrist, a courier travelling in hostile territory during a race war, and as a pupil of an Indian guru in the sewers of New York.','/6aqDIrtkIsVqyaJxH6G8d2ksfFU.jpg','1974-09-18',76,'Released','\"I\'ve Come a Long Way, Baby!\"','The Nine Lives of Fritz the Cat',14683,2.8222,5.1,'r9VZZFm8ndQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6722,_binary '\0','/aOWS8agSB0STduUtMIaGHsvDi92.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071935',7,13654,'en','The Odessa File','Following the suicide of an elderly Jewish man, investigative journalist Peter Miller sets out to hunt down an SS Captain and former concentration camp commander. In doing so he discovers that, despite allegations of war crimes, the former commander has become a man of importance in industry in post-war Germany, protected from prosecution by a powerful organisation of former SS members called Odessa.','/j8uFsP2PxDMN3bdo5Ve6fYj0ebN.jpg','1974-10-17',130,'Released','Hamburg, Germany. 1963. Peter Miller is going inside the dreaded Odessa. More than a few people hope he doesn\'t get out... ever.','The Odessa File',21489,4.2403,6.6,'1tpINADkyJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6723,_binary '\0','/cIPiZqKJhr2NrJku0g34P5ZcLU6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071938',4.5,1493,'en','Vampira','In order to revive his long hibernating bride, Vampira, Count Dracula takes blood samples from several beautiful models, but during the transfusion, Vampira\'s race turns from white to black.','/s3xnVtBdDlpNpo3qAseI4B4zUGG.jpg','1974-10-10',88,'Released','If You Liked \"Young Frankenstein\" You\'ll Love \"Old Dracula!\"','Vampira',86214,1.6713,5.1,'KrxVxbCZndo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6724,_binary '\0','/nY7wLYaSvXH3AP6G6jPkqtKKh6d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071939',7.1,2208,'da','Olsen-bandens sidste bedrifter','The Olsen Gang has finally made it. They are in Mallorca, having fulfilled their dream. Almost, that is. They don\'t have any money, so Egon has to open a safe at a restaurant to get some. As usual, however, Egon ends up in prision. When they return to Denmark, he has a new plan.','/u2W9SStOJnFvYn7FIWB75g6IvpQ.jpg','1974-10-04',96,'Released',NULL,'The Last Exploits of the Olsen Gang',12269,1.7598,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6725,_binary '\0','/sjbJL3kTjz323K7ihtTyWXHwtqJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071949',8,1290,'fr','Les ordres','A fact-based account of ordinary citizens who found themselves arrested and imprisoned without charge for weeks during the October Crisis in 1970 Quebec.','/qddTj2jgakcuXX4nAU5hjoFAVZv.jpg','1974-09-27',109,'Released',NULL,'Orders',69765,1.6795,7.3,'CJU54L2mj8Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6726,_binary '\0','/aY5ScEWrBOpQmWiMfqoGtQKDpch.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071950',6.6,2965,'it','Le orme','Alice, a young translator, finds the real world slowly merging with her recurring nightmares as she tries to solve the puzzle of her recent memory loss. A postcard leads her to the island of Garma where the locals seems to know her. Is she who she thinks she is? And what significance does her dream of an astronaut abandoned on the moon have?','/hLEnjCTWzmxTpCgQBjuPhmkAi85.jpg','1975-02-01',96,'Released','Ecstasy beyond passion. Possession beyond lust. It is the ultimate fulfillment.','Footprints on the Moon',82362,1.6991,6.271,'2OKJis6KBSE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6727,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071956',8.2,1444,'sh','Otpisani','Careless lives of few Belgrade youths are shattered when Nazis occupy their town in 1941. Soon they join the resistance movement and their activities bring their names to Gestapo\'s termination list. This movie inspired the series that would get cult status in former Yugoslavia.','/3ni3KKKTArYJItK2EhZph6AOzE4.jpg','1974-04-29',88,'Released',NULL,'The Written Off',1514543,1.3788,9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6728,_binary '\0','/gzcT8KIf0bDk3RmoUUjsYb8bCAN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071960',7,6720,'en','The Outfit','A two-bit criminal takes on the Mafia to avenge his brother\'s death. Earl Macklin is a small time criminal who is released from prison after an unsuccessful bank robbery only to discover that a pair of gunmen killed his brother.','/wkJyP861TpDbx3i0mV1t1IB6Ro1.jpg','1973-10-19',103,'Released','Nobody plays rougher than The Outfit...','The Outfit',26762,3.1156,6.755,'Ibi36rJO1cI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6729,_binary '\0','/cMDKT5bRD0X4ZMHQHfH2iZFbIi6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071968',5.9,2063,'fr','Parade','The story of a big party during which Jacques Tati brings together audience members, performers, clowns, children, and himself.','/pa1jp4ItzasTzl8L04WZhx6leFL.jpg','1974-12-18',90,'Released',NULL,'Parade',58655,2.2805,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6730,_binary '\0','/xpLfNYeICRtVPHPU2RN0a20c5zy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071970',7.1,25131,'en','The Parallax View','An ambitious reporter gets in trouble while investigating a senator\'s assassination which leads to a vast conspiracy involving a multinational corporation behind every event in the world\'s headlines.','/5ClPRox438lwK2Eze7X5xySDaYC.jpg','1974-06-14',102,'Released','As American as apple pie.','The Parallax View',17365,3.9106,6.8,'Qz0qRlQPdCs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6731,_binary '\0','/zrAsAn9S6EPmWfBS7INcSoS7TlH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071976',7.6,1492,'es','La Patagonia rebelde','In 1920, workers from Patagonia, in Southern Argentina, gather around an anarcho-syndicalist society and go on strike, demanding better working conditions. When the situation turns unsustainable, President Yrigoyen sends Lieutenant Colonel Zavala to impose order.','/oj6OeVMhquRV64gIjxbyoHgaSCL.jpg','1974-06-13',103,'Released',NULL,'Rebellion in Patagonia',64978,1.2838,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6732,_binary '\0','/8KgVSZglXRO9Z71rUnhVAvYEmu5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0071994',7.3,26589,'en','Phantom of the Paradise','Singer-songwriter Winslow Leach seeks revenge on the nefarious music producer Swan, who steals both Winslow\'s music and his favorite singer for the grand opening of Swan\'s new rock palace, the Paradise.','/qDOtGWeSQNwB3dG7Amt1K0JW0az.jpg','1974-10-31',92,'Released','He sold his soul for rock n’ roll!','Phantom of the Paradise',27327,7.1492,7.469,'T9yof8cwli4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6733,_binary '\0','/52GxVlOz7EH7jfXWyhrOknZA15s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072007',6.9,3024,'it','La polizia chiede aiuto','An unidentified fifteen year-old girl is found hanged after an anonymous tip-off. The girl, Silvia Polvesi, is soon discovered to have been murdered. A peeping tom is caught with photos of her having sex with a teenage drop-out but he is later released due to lack of evidence. The investigation, conducted by Inspector Silvestri and the assistant public prosecutor Vittoria Stori, focuses on the girl\'s parents. Conspiracies and horrors pile up, as do the body parts.','/ubaVM4VuJQ0NdghwWj8oVxpWM4i.jpg','1974-08-10',96,'Released','Just another suicide until the police discovered... A bloody bathroom. A maniac with a cleaver. A schoolgirl sex ring.','What Have They Done to Your Daughters?',69578,2.2304,7.112,'-GCFZkmnncw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6734,_binary '\0','/2aFq3chP0ajjYAvT1cwepIj4y8c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072012',6.3,5542,'it','Porgi l\'altra guancia','Two missionaries come into conflict with the authorities when they turn their missionary into a parrot farm. The Bishop of Maracaibo calls them his \'black sheep\' and the Monsignore has been called to check on their behavior. Like usual, our heroes help the poor to defend themselves and provoke some funny fist fights in the process.','/emaRH39H6N2qPPWOjLN2SzDT7FK.jpg','1974-12-21',89,'Released','Those trinity twins tangle with the twisted truth!','The Two Missionaries',11681,3.5382,6.514,'UMu4NIOJwOw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6735,_binary '\0','/s89eDfWVe1Jlb8WSNpwAhvQWaNM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072021',7.6,3712,'pl','Potop','During the Swedish invasion of Poland, the brave warrior Andrzej Kmicic, considered a traitor to the nation, fights for a country, redemption and love across the 17th-century Polish territories.','/dYtOSWm5UnUcnKwKmkYfqEIZduV.jpg','1974-09-02',287,'Released',NULL,'The Deluge',36627,1.7473,7.242,'vBfhvt1zrfU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6736,_binary '\0','/cp5zHIDPslNF7qxR7XV40ZDf7co.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072030',7.3,1393,'es','La prima Angélica','When the single middle-aged Luis travels from Barcelona to bury the remains of his mother in the vault of his family in Segovia, he is lodged by his aunt Pilar in her old house where he spent his summer of 1936 with her. He meets his cousin Angelica, who was his first love, living on the first floor with her husband and daughter, and he recalls his childhood in times of the Spanish Civil War entwined with the present.','/68dsrXLsER3QU7n6GTouZV3C9EH.jpg','1974-04-28',107,'Released',NULL,'Cousin Angelica',54236,1.5399,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6737,_binary '\0','/hB63z12gXdURaxMuqq8t3kyFh17.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072034',6.7,4324,'en','The Prisoner of Second Avenue','Mel Edison has just lost his job after many years and now has to cope with being unemployed at middle age during an intense NYC heat wave.','/5UjoKjMQt7oE5PcKanfLLFwvAUL.jpg','1975-03-14',98,'Released','...and you think you\'ve got problems.','The Prisoner of Second Avenue',19221,2.7395,6.6,'-m8YzEace00','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6738,_binary '\0','/k0b3YNvv6G1p3aUqywJ2wRoh844.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072037',7.5,5817,'it','Profumo di donna','An army cadet accompanies an irascible, blind captain on a week-long trip from Turin to Naples.','/sfjOK5n0eaS04MMCiNz43xbbydc.jpg','1974-12-20',103,'Released',NULL,'Scent of a Woman',47848,2.6952,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6739,_binary '\0','/zWirklNGr8T8o47F0LMaYH4LDEn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072053',7,1993,'fr','Que la fête commence !','A look at 18th-century France, when the depravity of the authorities contributed to social oppression, and the uprisings flared up one after another.','/plGdhIngYVs0b123cgWAzHS7lcr.jpg','1975-03-23',120,'Released',NULL,'Let Joy Reign Supreme',76482,1.7951,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6740,_binary '\0','/huOsgWWpVPGDCawUoFXMcEnzaCG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072067',5.5,1326,'en','Act of Vengeance','A woman is sexually assaulted by a serial rapist wearing a hockey mask. She and other victims form a squad that targets would-be rapists, all the while searching for the mask wearing maniac that raped them all.','/4d2VnVngzzkSdO0ID1irc4tUjLt.jpg','1974-01-02',90,'Released','These women all had one thing in common, they had been violated in the same savage way.','Act of Vengeance',66765,2.1377,5.6,'YTzNtI3jM5o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6741,_binary '\0','/o3bSYbap4gDnHeAru7umPVWTzAP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072080',6.6,4533,'fr','Le Retour du Grand Blond','With \"little captain\" Cambrai raising serious doubts about the reality of the so-called \"super spy,\" Colonel Toulouse kidnaps Christine and forces Francois to play again the character of \"The Tall Blond Man with One Black Shoe\" in some fake adventures. All this to stop the investigation into the death of Colonel Milan.','/3sPd0v3SHRUl9qCwao7ggpW36uG.jpg','1974-11-12',81,'Released',NULL,'The Return of the Tall Blond Man with One Black Shoe',10939,2.8549,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6742,_binary '\0','/13MrwYAGc74LmhS5zhBeXYxs6hz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072081',7,32743,'en','The Return of the Pink Panther','The famous Pink Panther jewel has once again been stolen and Inspector Clouseau is called in to catch the thief. The Inspector is convinced that \'The Phantom\' has returned and utilises all of his resources – himself and his Asian manservant – to reveal the identity of \'The Phantom\'.','/cDi6lHXmY12SxtjcP6IdK7mB3W1.jpg','1975-05-21',113,'Released',NULL,'The Return of the Pink Panther',11843,6.4201,6.8,'a1AMga5GaEQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6743,_binary '\0','/l1Z925G8J44V3smpiuUXGZKPIx7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072136',4.7,1340,'en','Seizure','A disturbed author\'s house party becomes a scene of carnage when three of his homicidal creations appear.','/5vY4XtaLvSJxRHg3QQI9Zq0pH4f.jpg','1974-11-15',94,'Released','you cannot run from them… you cannot hide from them… their only purpose is the breath-stopping panic of seizure!','Seizure',29854,2.1246,5,'ji-yfYlCrbc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6744,_binary '\0','/3LaAk2KiYWQ8slA39lvNXc27RWT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072148',4.6,1329,'tr','Şeytan','12 year-old Gul becomes possessed by Satan after experimenting with a Ouija board. A troubled psychiatrist and an experienced exorcist become the girl’s only hope for salvation.','/paZggGOsYzPt8CzdqXUKmZqAC5G.jpg','1974-01-01',100,'Released',NULL,'The Exorcist',112170,1.6643,5,'CMYOLLyKfdI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6745,_binary '\0','/kw3F2VxO6AK3D8xtnnphRXjWsOu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072156',4.1,1327,'en','Shriek of the Mutilated','An anthropology professor has invited his class to a remote cabin in the mountains to research the mythical Abominable Snowman. Soon after they arrive, strange events begin to befall the students, including sightings of a huge, white, furry creature.','/7LPOf2XRubz5hFTH5JpASuVsOwf.jpg','1974-08-02',87,'Released','A frenzied hunt for a hideous beast uncovers a cult of killers on an island of terror!','Shriek of the Mutilated',84104,1.2277,4.6,'jtqOA7_Lono','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6746,_binary '\0','/kASXFiKOl7OCAd9knlMGnlajC5j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072157',6.3,4914,'ja','修羅雪姫 怨み恋歌','Lady Snowblood is caught by the police and sentenced to death for her crimes. As she is sent to the gallows she is rescued by the secret police who offer her a deal to assassinate some revolutionaries.','/tyn32kFaYJzOtfszozlKWCpOd9c.jpg','1974-06-15',89,'Released','Born in prison on a snowy night, she\'s on an endless journey of carnage','Lady Snowblood 2: Love Song of Vengeance',18818,2.2016,6.4,'ZIzQE4hX9lU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6747,_binary '\0','/9DdwzNapTo2JUWwSt93ibYuAtEw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072184',2.8,2242,'en','Snuff','The followers of a charismatic cult leader set out to murder a pregnant actress.','/1PWyhjQLPmXe4WyAyKoDd39F2O8.jpg','1976-01-16',80,'Released','The Bloodiest thing that ever happened in front of a camera!!','Snuff',49673,1.5051,3,'ryZahNdDqHo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6748,_binary '\0','/tkDruUs0xEXkRjl747kWuQLU9xk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072190',8.3,3211,'bn','সোনার কেল্লা','A young boy becomes a target for crooks, after he claims to remember his past life and mentions precious jewels in a golden fortress.','/4TBPQYszjzj6UKoXyZk4ooURlYq.jpg','1974-12-27',135,'Released',NULL,'The Golden Fortress',164990,1.2242,7.803,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6749,_binary '\0','/5Sb2Oy1YyvXGfvohrBZjWIQphYP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072195',6.5,1774,'en','Space Is the Place','Sun Ra and his Solar Myth Arkestra return to Earth after several years in space. Ra proclaims himself \"the alter-destiny\", meets with inner-city youths and battles with the devil himself to save the black race.','/5yPhG0iBQpBObowErVrZLPZzTq.jpg','1974-11-01',81,'Released',NULL,'Space Is the Place',16203,1.5605,5.8,'XaA-JV2Ut60','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6750,_binary '\0','/deVuMsEC2aJrZJ4HGPfkoLIYJ2n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072196',6,2519,'it','Spasmo','While walking along the beach, Christian and his girlfriend discover a mysterious woman washed ashore. The following day, Christian meets the woman again at a yacht party and soon finds himself entangled in a web of lust, intrigue and murder.','/ci9BT6Bgqop21fL0mYLlHbgar8U.jpg','1974-02-16',94,'Released',NULL,'Spasmo',94069,1.1713,6.056,'IndNdJ8La5A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6751,_binary '\0','/6YE0hLfI0GSFWravBxEc63oe63P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072198',6.4,2318,'en','The Spikes Gang','Three teenage farm boys stumble upon Harry Spikes, a local bandit wounded in a gun battle. While Harry is recuperating, he regales the young men with stories of his exciting past. The adventurous tales inspire them to start a gang of their own. Failing at their first attempt to rob a bank, the boys convince the gruff Spikes to teach them the ways of the desperado.','/sLUSBzsNSVcV2uMZdEjA8xaU3dP.jpg','1974-04-11',96,'Released','Three boys wanted to be like their hero, Harry Spikes. They got their wish. Soon they were worth a fortune. DEAD or ALIVE.','The Spikes Gang',38152,2.3647,6.7,'AtEqTFz_aOs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6752,_binary '\0','/kZmmis2MJzRfHFsLtX85NA0TduY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072201',6.5,1315,'en','Stardust','Jim MacLaine is now enjoying the nomadic \'gigs and groupies\' life on tour with his band. When he achieves all his wildest dreams of international stardom, the sweet taste of success begins to turn sour.','/kRy0iFx8KrNqWftoq6n2aCtlWvm.jpg','1974-10-24',107,'Released',NULL,'Stardust',27196,1.2611,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6753,_binary '\0','/xyaoViQOSkrYNtHKEHPb8X8Kxbk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072204',6.5,2786,'fr','Stavisky...','Biarritz, 1933. Charm and talent assist small-time swindler Serge Alexandre, alias Stavisky, to bribe his way into the centre of French politics. But when his great scam involving millions is exposed, he brings the government to the verge of collapse and the country to the brink of civil war.','/zFY7YNUeGr65fWVdPwxQjoyPmkA.jpg','1974-05-15',120,'Released',NULL,'Stavisky...',61296,2.5608,5.914,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6754,_binary '\0','/3TNb1J2xISgWTDCUBcnpwvlc98T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072206',6,1452,'en','Steppenwolf','In the bourgeois circles of Europe after the Great War, can anything save the modern man? Harry Haller, a solitary intellectual, has all his life feared his dual nature of being human and being a beast. He\'s decided to die on his 50th birthday, which is soon. He\'s rescued from his solipsism by the mysterious Hermine, who takes him dancing, introduces him to jazz and to the beautiful and whimsical Maria, and guides him into the hallucinations of the Magic Theater, which seem to take him into Hell. Can humour, sin, and derision lead to salvation?','/Aoy0l6O1x6lSjH8L06s6ZSRhY7a.jpg','1974-12-18',107,'Released','For madmen only.','Steppenwolf',74948,1.0544,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6755,_binary '\0','/ues3i10qn2KfD7I9hF5VvTZ4ZnA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072209',6.3,2103,'en','Stone','After one of its members witnesses a political assassination, an outlaw motorbike gang becomes the target of a string of murders, prompting a cop to join their ranks to determine who is responsible.','/vnXEtNLbwMeYCnZChXw48V8jdzP.jpg','1974-01-02',103,'Released','Take The Trip','Stone',14937,2.2807,6,'IUc7AL7fQos','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6756,_binary '\0','/mcKpcvRMR5APotccfZ44sdMkuxP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072225',5.8,2776,'en','Sugar Hill','When a nightclub owner is murdered by gangsters after refusing to sell his business to the mob boss, his grieving fiancé enlists the help of a voodoo priestess to avenge his death.','/rEQwADsvIOe43xpMywWSFSKSBWg.jpg','1974-02-01',91,'Released','Meet Sugar Hill and her zombie hitmen... The mafia has never met anything like them!','Sugar Hill',54008,1.1781,5.75,'pjSxal7RxWg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6757,_binary '\0','/cssKLoKClpgqaaGD2z3cjXgzPSM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072226',6.8,22525,'en','The Sugarland Express','Married small-time crooks Lou-Jean and Clovis Poplin lose their baby to the state of Texas and resolve to do whatever it takes to get him back. Lou-Jean gets Clovis out of jail, and the two steal their son from his foster home, in addition to taking a highway patrolman hostage. As a massive dragnet starts to pursue them across Texas, the couple become unlikely folk heroes and even start to bond with the captive policeman.','/csahjHhtJ9NzFKcxVcw7S4Pyfj.jpg','1974-03-31',110,'Released','A girl with a great following. Every cop in the state was after her. Everybody else was behind her.','The Sugarland Express',5121,4.0927,6.605,'Idj2FA06e9A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6758,_binary '\0','/mNnsIJtLNlu4q2Sr1NMHF8qP38g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072228',6.6,1238,'en','The Super Cops','The true story of two New York City cops. Greenberg & Hantz fought the system, became detectives and were known on the streets as \"Batman & Robin.\"','/wOXozZxOrXdyOvuSiE1gEPauTtF.jpg','1974-03-20',90,'Released','The true story of the two cops called Batman and Robin','The Super Cops',84324,1.6257,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6759,_binary '\0','/zjrofF5d9znhWavasqKVhWtkRtE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072231',7.3,3966,'ru','Свой среди чужих, чужой среди своих','Following the Russian Civil War, a loyal Red, Shilov, must prove he is at home among strangers as he attempts to recapture a shipment of gold that he was supposed to deliver to Moscow. Needed as a means of buying food for the people, the gold Shilov was entrusted with is stolen, initially by a group of assassins and then by a group of bandits. In tracking the gold’s whereabouts, Shilov’s motives are questioned and he is suspected of treason, in part because his brother was a devoted White. In an effort to clear his name, Shilov locates the gold, but he also discovers rampant greed and corruption.','/iJPDN8gYHN9357QsBLXspugzCw3.jpg','1974-11-11',97,'Released',NULL,'At Home Among Strangers, a Stranger Among His Own',38361,1.5164,6.629,'dPTHCaAoisw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6760,_binary '\0','/ck3BUeBWD7qwICULWlVVHx2kIdM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072233',6.4,1260,'en','Swallows and Amazons','On holiday with their mother in the Lake District in 1929 four children are allowed to sail over to the nearby island in their boat Swallow and set up camp for a few days. They soon realise this has been the territory of two other girls who sail the Amazon, and the scene is set for serious rivalry.','/lewCN0u5NOE7fBSPLP2NqGFrKeK.jpg','1974-06-01',92,'Released',NULL,'Swallows and Amazons',14685,1.2973,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6761,_binary '\0','/3nNk0ll1uV5dTL3NAntsQLeMz5l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072235',5.9,7115,'en','Sweet Movie','The winner of the Miss World Virginity contest marries, escapes from her masochistic husband and ends up involved in a world of debauchery.','/64SaF3kOOaLPUVflDhXZLrB0xjt.jpg','1974-06-12',98,'Released','A socio-erotic comedy.','Sweet Movie',1559,4.0679,5.3,'QO0BJi5j_wg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6762,_binary '\0','/xXfcDRQeNPYzKudbk3EhxAuLMZ8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072236',5.1,1517,'en','The Swinging Cheerleaders','In order to write an expose on how cheerleading demeans women, a reporter for a college newspaper infiltrates the cheerleading squad.','/hIpmpPjDEezCzcR3omTqM0GYoUh.jpg','1974-09-25',91,'Released','They gave their all for the team!','The Swinging Cheerleaders',22092,1.5033,5.7,'273cHG2T2ZQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6763,_binary '\0','/1gCLybfgz8Ep80YIyHtEcRPoHnt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072239',6.4,2056,'en','Symptoms','A young woman is invited by her girlfriend, who lives in an English country mansion, to stay there with her. The estate, however, isn\'t quite what it seems--and neither is the friend who issued the invitation.','/8iPfWp5Zo1e1ayzwQHXARV9xyNO.jpg','1974-05-10',91,'Released','Last night I dreamt that they had returned. They were here again…','Symptoms',110412,1.6467,6.3,'SeYmxm-bqBo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6764,_binary '\0','/h5ii4h7cltHwP5BOA11QijfTXMD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072245',4.7,1628,'en','TNT Jackson','A woman encounters thugs and drug dealers after traveling to Hong Kong to search for her missing brother.','/bQPhIDA9jbM39HIsbICudkkJe5b.jpg','1974-06-08',72,'Released','She\'ll put you in traction.','TNT Jackson',85673,1.5864,4.756,'kJEsVzZ0QHw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6765,_binary '\0','/wsaEt7XtlQucK8SC5Aet75xvIJT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072248',7.6,1574,'fa','طبیعت بی‌جان','A railway crossing guard and his wife live in a routine of total isolation and uneventfulness.','/iEXQDugjJzEUYyrf4RMYz2mxbxj.jpg','1974-06-29',90,'Released',NULL,'Still Life',213592,1.6413,7,'_utFbi1eSjM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6766,_binary '\0','/wDLUp63wIE6NeWHAcJkCijhI3M8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072251',7.6,41917,'en','The Taking of Pelham One Two Three','In New York, armed men hijack a subway car and demand a ransom for the passengers while the authorities question about the method of their escape.','/vNhywp9w1DVG6BytxKp4kjtaaGC.jpg','1974-10-02',105,'Released','We are going to kill one passenger a minute until New York City pays us 1 million dollars.','The Taking of Pelham One Two Three',8333,5.7005,7.5,'_WnD63TiceA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6767,_binary '\0','/iToUachuQtU0J5Oej7DFOmuFNTW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072253',6.4,2898,'en','The Tamarind Seed','During a Caribbean holiday, a British civil servant finds herself falling in love with a Russian agent.','/dOqd23Tj8ja448ajTOX5muah5rk.jpg','1974-07-11',125,'Released','The Tamarind Seed . . . where love grows and passion flowers.','The Tamarind Seed',52960,2.3881,6.2,'5TJT1LcYJhY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6768,_binary '\0','/9yQAjzAuy9Hh9qCXQq3ohtiIKbX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072260',4.7,1320,'en','The Teacher','18-year-old Sean\'s first summer after completing high school is much spent with 28-year-old teacher Diane, who\'s husband is too often motorcycle-racing instead of with her. Wacko Ralph also has \"the hots\" for Diane; and it doesn\'t help that Sean was with Ralph\'s younger brother, Lou, when Lou died','/nQzUltLrstyub09eCPsnQPkErHc.jpg','1974-05-29',98,'Released','She corrupted the youthful morality of an entire school! Her best lessons were taught after class!','The Teacher',87884,2.2448,4.5,'H7kp6O2-yJM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6769,_binary '\0','/qK4O4XINKAofDafO9tLfXPgKWHA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072263',5.7,3901,'en','And Then There Were None','Ten people are invited to a hotel in the Iranian desert, only to find that an unseen person is killing them one by one. Could one of them be the killer?','/JoBZj30v380XBiRrYwIhOoGJ1z.jpg','1974-09-24',98,'Released','The who\'s next whodunnit.','And Then There Were None',4883,4.1818,5.7,'VBQJ1liRfVU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6770,_binary '\0','/qdfcth09QUjcUqU1WQOeoQuOnaB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072267',5.6,2911,'en','The Terminal Man','As the result of a head injury, brilliant computer scientist Harry Benson begins to experience violent seizures. In an attempt to control the seizures, Benson undergoes a new surgical procedure in which a microcomputer is inserted into his brain. The procedure is not entirely successful.','/4kzqHiAe5pB2zaqtbpidVdpbsLY.jpg','1974-06-19',107,'Released','Harry Benson is a brilliant computer scientist. For three minutes a day, he is violently homicidal.','The Terminal Man',32940,2.325,5.444,'K1RqKKydW_E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6771,_binary '\0','/wvBx1Q1FcQE1BPLfBbgA3y9aaS1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072271',7.4,215937,'en','The Texas Chain Saw Massacre','Five friends head out to rural Texas to visit the grave of a grandfather. On the way, they stumble across what appears to be a deserted house, only to discover something sinister within. Something armed with a chainsaw.','/mpgkRPH1GNkMCgdPk2OMyHzAks7.jpg','1974-10-11',83,'Released','Who will survive and what will be left of them?','The Texas Chain Saw Massacre',30497,14.6206,7.292,'BKn9QIaMgtQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6772,_binary '\0','/2Y2fa6toXK1NJrhE9jBCOaJvred.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072272',7.8,5733,'en','That\'s Entertainment!','Various MGM stars from yesterday present their favorite musical moments from the studio\'s 50 year history.','/uao9fRNFxBXC6mqA8WyO01RU4dJ.jpg','1974-06-21',135,'Released','More than a movie. It\'s a celebration.','That\'s Entertainment!',33740,2.7893,7.4,'t7Gvc4fNKK0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6773,_binary '\0','/mJEWGeHG0NPvP6HHVoaRrwUbMEJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072274',6.9,5787,'en','Thieves Like Us','Three criminals escape from prison and embark on a robbery spree across USA. Along the way, one of them falls in love while they plan a final heist before going their separate ways.','/tENE8l8PHPX8S2bEMIb4WhpDKAt.jpg','1974-02-11',123,'Released','Robbing 36 banks was easy. Watch what happens when they hit the 37th.','Thieves Like Us',31656,2.2577,6.5,'KairZBVuvqQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6774,_binary '\0','/ljZtX8UZhGOOpQrgtcqSwPTTZJv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072281',7.1,20794,'en','The Three Musketeers','In 17th century France, young D\'Artagnan wants to join the King\'s Musketeers, but instead befriends three legendary musketeers—Athos, Porthos, and Aramis—and together, they become embroiled in the political intrigue surrounding King Louis XIII and his adversaries, particularly the powerful Cardinal Richelieu.','/6qjW1e31k2XhcWpzGz6lgHcRt5W.jpg','1973-12-11',107,'Released','. . . One for All and All for Fun!','The Three Musketeers',2926,6.4518,6.7,'Ubpu8IGJpNc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6775,_binary '\0','/o38PpOYAjd5eXNX6Hq13mtymn06.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072284',6.2,2044,'en','Three the Hard Way','After his wife is kidnapped by a group of White supremacists, a record producer teams up with a PR man and a martial artist to get her back and put a stop to their plot to poison the water supply with a toxin that only kills Black people.','/1cQiPL80qZuIjHgzQYNVEfkGbFA.jpg','1974-06-26',97,'Released','Action explodes all over the place when the big three join forces to save their race!','Three the Hard Way',63340,2.2112,6.2,'oz7LrgMCAfY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6776,_binary '\0','/8YMq728a1ElZq6tmM0ZI3RrwoOi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072285',6.4,9677,'sv','Thriller - en grym film','Madeleine, rendered mute after being sexually assaulted as a youth, accepts a lift from a wealthy and sadistic pimp who soon enslaves her into his prostitution racket. Despite her limited means, Madeleine embarks on a bloody road to revenge against her captors.','/pMYgdygJZ6oBpnC3dWrluevlZOt.jpg','1973-05-01',108,'Released','The movie that has no limits of evil!','Thriller: A Cruel Picture',15018,3.3239,6.3,'8CAZs88T0Jw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6777,_binary '\0','/pTfUxe3IpPQdSk44ZZY8uP1Ih7g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072288',7,33503,'en','Thunderbolt and Lightfoot','With the help of an irreverent young sidekick, a bank robber gets his old gang back together to organise a daring new heist.','/530RZ2HsxAgKVO4joNFjAgucbri.jpg','1974-05-23',116,'Released','Thunderbolt… the man with the reputation. Lightfoot… the kid who\'s about to make one!','Thunderbolt and Lightfoot',8348,4.6841,6.8,'Gjk-fB8fM0A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6778,_binary '\0','/gT3hatcFDbZWUlLZ7TClRDhZ9Pa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072308',7,53516,'en','The Towering Inferno','At the opening party of a colossal—but poorly constructed—skyscraper, a massive fire breaks out, threatening to destroy the tower and everyone in it.','/mFM1GbrRrT3DWUFFo8koSITFnYe.jpg','1974-12-14',165,'Released','One tiny spark becomes a night of blazing suspense.','The Towering Inferno',5919,6.6055,7,'nyTqrtZFWeQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6779,_binary '\0','/gcrzYur2gwsZOgSjwkE15LcZioM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072317',4.6,1661,'en','The Trial of Billy Jack','After Billy Jack in sentenced to four years in prison for the \"involuntary manslaughter\" of the first film, the Freedom School expands and flourishes under the guidance of Jean Roberts. The utopian existence of the school is characterized by everything ranging from \"yoga sports\" to muckracking journalism. The diverse student population airs scathing political exposes on their privately owned television station. The narrow-minded townspeople have different ideas about their brand of liberalism. Billy Jack is released and things heat up for the school. Students are threatened and abused and the Native Americans in the neighboring village are taunted and mistreated. After Billy Jack undergoes a vision quest, the governor and the police plot to permanently put an end to their liberal shenanigans, leaving it up to Billy Jack to save the day.','/xlYSv3tebgES8isB1hJWLc4cjy4.jpg','1974-11-13',173,'Released','It takes up where Billy Jack left off','The Trial of Billy Jack',83980,1.6964,5.9,'cKpFt-fLyVE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6780,_binary '\0','/8lbv9a4QivdrSmeFPGXHRrxwe72.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072325',6.9,4347,'en','Truck Turner','Truck Turner and his partner Jerry, who make their living as bounty hunters in Los Angeles, are hired to hunt down Gator, a pimp who has skipped bail.','/lMB0WY73s8AOns9cUmdAT3USreo.jpg','1974-06-26',91,'Released','Black, bold and bloody mean!','Truck Turner',22121,2.5216,6.522,'0NYQAfc2Gmc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6781,_binary '\0','/3SqqNI2dX6QK6NFgDCXEi2Mc9GD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072331',5,1355,'en','Horror High','A nerdy high school super whiz experiments with a chemical which will transform his guinea pig \"Mr. Mumps\" from a gentle pet into a ravenous monster. In a fit of rage against his tormentors at the high school, Vernon Potts goes on a killing spree, eliminating all of those who ever picked on him - the Gym Coach, the School Jock, The Creepy Janitor & his hated teacher, Ms. Grindstaff.','/3bwdcBhmxuCBuIrclZO2IK9oPbf.jpg','1973-09-20',85,'Released','There is something evil out there... Possessed by a force that doesn\'t belong to this world - and it\'s going to kill me!','Horror High',29389,1.2141,5.6,'yJBz_hsVg5g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6782,_binary '\0','/41rQ9Ebt2P89dYCuYyqkL7LdJcu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072349',6.3,1465,'it','L\'uomo senza memoria','In London, A man who has amnesia attempts to uncover the truth about his identity. A menacing individual accuses him of betrayal, and soon more pieces of his puzzling past begin to fall in place.','/gUe2BVWluOaIref31jRV7mmYRLe.jpg','1974-08-23',92,'Released',NULL,'Puzzle',93142,1.8693,5.736,'2Z3LExpWPkc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6783,_binary '\0','/xX0b98ePpgZaD3AtzFlsuZcT1OW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072351',6.6,3179,'en','Uptown Saturday Night','Two blue-collar buddies search the underworld for a winning lottery ticket lost in a nightclub holdup.','/qVLO2SoUa33Yvy5yme2cEuQIO4o.jpg','1974-07-26',104,'Released','They get funny when you mess with their money.','Uptown Saturday Night',29464,2.195,6.2,'Ij3LKTjpmd8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6784,_binary '\0','/v6WUPGU0tBOIO0jAkHsDNZVw1S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072353',7.1,10874,'fr','Les Valseuses','Two whimsical, aimless thugs harass and assault women, steal, murder, and alternately charm, fight, or sprint their way out of trouble. They take whatever the bourgeoisie holds dear, whether it’s cars, peace of mind, or daughters. Marie-Ange, a jaded, passive hairdresser, joins them as lover, cook, and mother confessor. She’s on her own search for seemingly unattainable sexual pleasure.','/1evmnMMSgUXORoECRwiMiqjwmN.jpg','1974-03-20',117,'Released',NULL,'Going Places',4031,5.6935,6.672,'E9RA83poDVI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6785,_binary '\0','/glB4P9UmydAoktMOKHbDCa0XMxb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072354',6,4961,'en','Vampyres','A duo of bisexual female vampires prey on passing motorists, whom they seduce and murder in the English countryside.','/xPA3n6HGiZccrkygDPq6tzeEDbU.jpg','1974-07-06',88,'Released','They shared the pleasures of the flesh and the horrors of the grave!','Vampyres',30885,2.6922,6,'B8MbVxcs8Ds','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6786,_binary '\0','/qxocP27gvQ1tJEwD5saIsEHhR4b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072355',4.3,1933,'fr','Vase de Noces','Alone on a farm, a man spends his days tending to his animals, with a particular love for his sow. After an illicit encounter between the two creatures, the pig gives birth. However, tragedy strikes when the man tries to force the newborn piglets to love him as he loves them.','/xYO7GWQjVOuPxjtmVGR6MZx6YNG.jpg','1975-10-01',80,'Released','He prefers a sow. And he will know the enjoyment and the joys of fatherhood.','Wedding Trough',35862,4.4268,5.4,'zAbwStdnaqI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6787,_binary '\0','/7utHSARwvPjjTDt6HZVhlnMyBHE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072368',7.3,3015,'fr','Vincent, François, Paul… et les autres','Three friends navigate mid-life crises: a blocked writer, a disillusioned doctor, and a charming man facing bankruptcy and divorce. As their struggles strain friendships, a younger man captures the attention of one friend\'s wife, complicating their lives further.','/lrffQNHaEKdD7ZTFlQqhxjxeFlx.jpg','1974-10-23',113,'Released',NULL,'Vincent, Francois, Paul and the Others',42454,2.2463,7.03,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6788,_binary '\0','/aE394YeI6Yf8NmzeXyP14EmP2O8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072400',6,1689,'en','Where Have All the People Gone','A strange series of solar flares proves fatal for inhabitants of the Earth, except for the fortunate few who are somehow immune from the effects. Animals go insane and human beings turn to white powder, leaving behind only empty clothing. A handful of survivors attempt to rebuild their lives on the de-populated Earth.','/74raQKLnfJwMRpm3QfnXFiULmSA.jpg','1974-10-08',74,'Released',NULL,'Where Have All the People Gone',108062,1.696,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6789,_binary '\0','/aRVN8Y1DlGr8VM3e6GDL29i1IVu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072401',7.2,1320,'en','Where the Lilies Bloom','A family of Appalachian children lives together in the backwoods so that they can stay together after the death of their widower father.','/ysGZRNsFU47Nmnp4bH7BOoB94ef.jpg','1974-04-10',97,'Released',NULL,'Where the Lilies Bloom',128364,1.9025,5.9,'nATYj7j0ZRQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6790,_binary '\0','/7ZDJIWmLzThqbqsb2o9Dq8sH0bG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072402',6.9,4152,'en','Where the Red Fern Grows','Billy Coleman works hard and saves his earnings for two years to achieve his dream of buying two red-bone coonhound pups. He develops a new trust in life as he faces overwhelming challenges in adventure and tragedy roaming the river bottoms of Cherokee country with his dogs, Old Dan and Little Ann.','/eipRC5W6XyPKThZ9Z1kQGov3Np0.jpg','1974-06-21',97,'Released','Glory and victory were theirs, but sadness waited too! And close by was the strange and wonderful power that\'s only found...','Where the Red Fern Grows',26514,2.3673,6.9,'KKv-F_k6LSI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6791,_binary '\0','/saTlrUSCWyrL8mMo2n4J4PqcfD6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072409',6.4,1470,'en','Willie Dynamite','Willie Dynamite is a pimp who operates in New York City. Willie was a big success as a pimp, but now, just as fast as he rose to the top, he has hit bottom. A former prostitute who has become a social worker tries to get Willie to clean up his life while it is still possible.','/lmjJ176Ff9R7cpT6TWB6T9dtRBl.jpg','1974-01-23',102,'Released','Ain\'t no one crosses WILLIE \"D.\" He\'s tight, together, and mean. Chicks, Chumps, he uses \'em all. He\'s got to be Number-One.','Willie Dynamite',46018,1.4169,6.4,'sAhVtcMMsqQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6792,_binary '\0','/uOLcJJYZ3hbFSrKQPDaLhrYnjUv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072417',8,34095,'en','A Woman Under the Influence','Mabel Longhetti, desperate and lonely, is married to a Los Angeles municipal construction worker, Nick. Increasingly unstable, especially in the company of others, she craves happiness, but her extremely volatile behavior convinces Nick that she poses a danger to their family and decides to commit her to an institution for six months. Alone with a trio of kids to raise on his own, he awaits her return, which holds more than a few surprises.','/6EJ4JoTxnH1QmGTE9pPzgtW1cLW.jpg','1974-11-18',155,'Released','A woman of today, her world, her passions.','A Woman Under the Influence',29845,5.9757,7.7,'d5O7ujg3VQU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6793,_binary '\0','/rn6iRJ8Q5vJBWQuVpV0pQ3y9gsK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072419',4.6,1641,'en','Wonder Woman','A super-hero uses her powers to thwart an international spy ring.','/eJuphyQM3MDWId1Hk8rF399I3dP.jpg','1974-03-12',75,'Released',NULL,'Wonder Woman',161620,2.0503,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6794,_binary '\0','/bFC1fipYNfp8s1FIVMRNPcdiesF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072424',7.7,13596,'en','The Year Without a Santa Claus','Feeling forgotten by the children of the world, old St. Nick decides to skip his gift-giving journey and take a vacation. Mrs. Claus and two spunky little elves, Jingle and Jangle, set out to see to where all the season\'s cheer has disappeared. Aided by a magical snowfall, they reawaken the spirit of Christmas in children\'s hearts and put Santa back in action.','/gc5vz1sZXk1DilIzkQLZ2ujuiWQ.jpg','1974-12-10',51,'Released',NULL,'The Year Without a Santa Claus',13397,2.6166,7.141,'pE0QHQe34R0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6795,_binary '\0','/rsI82F7DadIQcrZyPbuwmkhN5ty.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072431',8,181730,'en','Young Frankenstein','A young neurosurgeon inherits the castle of his grandfather, the famous Dr. Victor von Frankenstein. In the castle he finds a funny hunchback, a pretty lab assistant and the elderly housekeeper. Young Frankenstein believes that the work of his grandfather was delusional, but when he discovers the book where the mad doctor described his reanimation experiment, he suddenly changes his mind.','/3BvvVKPg9yucChlSvQtJxAbLmj9.jpg','1974-12-15',106,'Released','The scariest comedy of all time!','Young Frankenstein',3034,8.886,7.857,'7csc1O21jDU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6796,_binary '\0','/xxQ8zJEB6sSBdGfVGuJnZV3dLDy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072435',6.4,1519,'en','Zandy\'s Bride','Zandy Allan purchases a mail-order bride, Hannah Lund. He treats her as a possession, without respect or humanity, until their shared ordeal as they struggle to survive develops in him a growing love.','/b6QSdYiswlZdpnWksd8uQ7kLtgJ.jpg','1974-05-19',97,'Released','More Like a War Than a Marriage','Zandy\'s Bride',96337,1.9754,6.4,'4GBS_a_vj8g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6797,_binary '\0','/9ObCmnzl819pFqxMdPPPF3xhrGR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072439',7,1251,'ja','新座頭市物語・笠間の血祭り','Zatoichi, the famed blind swordsman, returns to his home village for the first time in many years. He is befriended by Omiyo, who had the same wet-nurse as Zatoichi. He also encounters a boyhood friend, Shinbei, who is now wealthy and appears not to remember Zatoichi. Shinbei seems to be interested in repaying the villagers\' debts, but is, in reality, manipulating the ownership of a now valuable rock quarry. Zatoichi learns of the subterfuge and confronts his old friend, who has a score of yakuza swordsmen backing his play.','/kJxvpauRjOfHUjQCJIPeQ360J7r.jpg','1973-04-21',88,'Released',NULL,'Zatoichi\'s Conspiracy',54307,1.1887,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6798,_binary '\0','/9UAcMhSCDJ2OCo5QdPpSERjhMA1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072443',7.9,58476,'ru','Зеркало','A dying man in his forties recalls his childhood, his mother, the war and personal moments that tell of and juxtapose pivotal moments in Soviet history with daily life.','/AttDP5OEsMxtHPPN7Z92p2Ntnmd.jpg','1975-03-07',107,'Released',NULL,'Mirror',1396,6.3098,7.9,'S2U9TXmYJ94','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6799,_binary '\0','/xQa198uEb8DLwQntDwO9jlilXcC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072446',7.8,4647,'pl','Ziemia obiecana','At the turn of the century, Lodz, Poland, was a quick-paced manufacturing center for textiles, replete with cutthroat industrialists and unsafe working conditions. Three young friends, a Pole, a Jew, and a German, pool their money together to build a factory.','/pjk8K5MpQJX0XczTC2KOVWNj0lC.jpg','1975-02-21',179,'Released',NULL,'The Promised Land',511,1.6052,7.4,'UGosYBfbRBc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6800,_binary '\0','/AvAsOjV1ibvFT7HnQwOKB2BglHV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072448',6.4,5146,'it','Zorro','A newly arrived governor finds his province under the control of the corrupt Colonel Huerta. To avoid assassination by Huerta, he pretends to be weak and indecisive so Huerta will believe he poses no threat. But secretly he masquerades as Zorro, and joins the monk Francisco and the beautiful aristocrat Hortensia in their fight for justice against Huerta and his soldiers.','/nfFRJkQjvajXHMknqjawhR9PVU5.jpg','1975-03-06',118,'Released','Zorro is back!','Zorro',18450,3.9621,6.6,'6hYNWrXbt_E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6801,_binary '\0','/AouYX4PbzjXSBoaPJRSEijrpXti.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072603',6.8,2166,'fr','Adieu poulet','When political thugs murder an opponent\'s volunteer and also kill a cop, chief inspector Verjeat believes the politician who hired them is as guilty as the murderous goon. Verjeat\'s pursuit of the councilman, Lardatte, gets him a warning from his superiors. When he embarrasses Lardatte while disarming a hostage (the dead volunteer\'s father), Verjeat is told he\'s being transferred within a week. He speeds up his hunt for the goon and, with Lefévre, one of his young detectives, he engineers a complicated scheme to buy more time before the transfer. How should Verjeat play out his values of honor and duty?','/6SCYW55I3fpW0EIqyPWcdg85QuG.jpg','1975-12-10',87,'Released',NULL,'The French Detective',58694,2.1859,6.699,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6802,_binary '\0','/jNmCru987ovKRNhvgndnFMPJTtn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072608',6,7946,'en','The Adventure of Sherlock Holmes\' Smarter Brother','After spending decades living in the shadow of his more famous and successful sibling, Consulting Detective Sigerson Holmes is called upon to help solve a crucial case that leads him on a hilarious trail of false identities, stolen documents, secret codes... and exposed backsides.','/mggqC6NsD3sYxDzcnzr0MIjuxUL.jpg','1975-12-14',91,'Released',NULL,'The Adventure of Sherlock Holmes\' Smarter Brother',29859,2.6272,6,'XkNdMNbZNyw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6803,_binary '\0','/ncpKFpHIRVprYWXd7eh0tSiZAj4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072610',6.4,2049,'en','The Adventures of the Wilderness Family','The story of a modern family bored with the hassles of the city life in Los Angeles. They head for the wilderness never to return.','/1t5JbM4gxjWyAaq884rbNEqKcRr.jpg','1975-12-19',105,'Released',NULL,'The Adventures of the Wilderness Family',28994,2.9683,5.9,'g3qJOjbaKe4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6804,_binary '\0','/mRXBRZXbYqJmcrWVhT5xpPY43F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072613',7.7,5797,'ru','Афоня','Afonya Borshev is a plumber who drinks a lot, flirts a lot and doesn\'t care too much about tomorrow. His wife left him, his boss placed him on probation, his whole life is falling apart, but he doesn\'t realize it. When Afonya met Katya at a dance club he didn\'t pay her much attention, yet she may be the only one who can help him.','/6wp40fUEK8qlfqyFE1uvTV8bg4e.jpg','1975-10-13',92,'Released',NULL,'Afonya',20870,1.7657,7.728,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6805,_binary '\0','/veFIiZkNnvA11Xdvv8OI2s9wRLb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072626',4.9,1428,'en','The House of the Dead','When a philandering husband accidentally finds himself lost during a rainstorm, he’s taken in by an elderly mortician and is forced to learn the ghastly origins of four freshly arrived corpses.','/77aIcIiYidhg4YFlNEXChaBk9R6.jpg','1978-11-22',80,'Released','Don\'t you dare go in there!','The House of the Dead',77156,1.7105,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6806,_binary '\0','/3q6XHCXII7qRZOx5EqU5NfYkVx8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072637',7.9,8814,'it','Amici miei','Four inseparable friends try to face their midlife crisis with daytrips and pranks at the expense of their families and the people around them.','/efQiC7hEXa6Vbn05FwNQoB8yGqX.jpg','1975-10-24',140,'Released','They played together, they drank together, they whorekistand together and when the semiwattle was in crispation, they had a boobchik of a time!','My Friends',20914,3.7834,8.099,'r81YlVmhJtk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6807,_binary '\0','/jIyilYNfrTCKgQuwqPjXMB1FnQ3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072648',7.4,2174,'de','Angst vor der Angst','After having her second child, a German housewife suffers from postpartum depression before inexplicably falling into a continually misdiagnosed mental state, befuddling her relatives.','/x1UEPsq7q7eUyCbWZRd1BwOPqb7.jpg','1976-10-15',88,'Released',NULL,'Fear of Fear',47239,1.3978,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6808,_binary '\0','/iRAYVV9JGz7aDNa5wXL5pkw4JrE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072653',6.4,7288,'en','The Apple Dumpling Gang','A roving bachelor gets saddled with three children and a wealth of trouble when the youngsters stumble upon a huge gold nugget. They join forces with two bumbling outlaws to fend off the greedy townspeople and soon find themselves facing a surly gang of sharpshooters.','/cSbRtW2rSpz6AxS4BwtunpFHma.jpg','1975-07-01',100,'Released','Wanted: For chicanery, skulduggery, tomfoolery and habitual bungling!','The Apple Dumpling Gang',18660,3.2838,6.6,'GnS0_UTEayY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6809,_binary '\0','/whCzAahkqhdbxalXY0pZrPWTASt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072662',6.4,1577,'it','L\'assassino è costretto ad uccidere ancora','Giorgio is a greedy adulterer who makes a deal with a serial killer to dispose of his wealthy wife, Nora. Unfortunately, a thrill-seeking young couple steal the killer\'s car with Nora\'s corpse in the trunk, ending up at a run-down seaside villa.','/dtzcnTq7rTDOcJCP4VIVHFHOCsC.jpg','1975-03-07',90,'Released',NULL,'The Killer Must Kill Again',63026,1.2749,6.3,'clTP-K_WNsc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6810,_binary '\0','/7iRHLpTuaJIqPVhnxvHZEV1MkpI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072665',5.4,1535,'en','At Long Last Love','Four socialites unexpectedly clash: heiress Brooke Carter runs into gambler Johnny Spanish at the race track while playboy Michael O. Pritchard nearly runs into stage star Kitty O\'Kelly with his car. Backstage at Kitty\'s show, it turns out she and Brooke are old friends who attended public school together. The foursome do the town, accompanied by Brooke\'s companion Elizabeth, who throws herself at Michael\'s butler and chauffeur Rodney James.','/5bAMJ8SU3zdggtyJ3Iy2tyXXSf2.jpg','1975-03-01',125,'Released','It\'s the top!','At Long Last Love',4704,2.3487,5.1,'7KDbo9HUn4E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6811,_binary '\0','/na4bdJD8rwKkmiEEcSPHMBAhlVX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072666',2.2,5421,'en','Zaat','A mad scientist unleashes his master plan: to transform himself into a mutated walking catfish, and gain revenge on those who have spurned him. His plans go wrong, and he becomes tempted to kidnap a nubile young woman to similarly transform her so that he can breed.','/g0kYZe6feiXQowaNsV6GBW5R5q0.jpg','1971-01-01',100,'Released','Is the monster man... fish... or devil?','Zaat',31116,1.434,2.8,'Cl64Ncac5Hk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6812,_binary '\0','/ef6SvWbSfCFlKodJZqpIaTvsRRP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072684',8.1,208277,'en','Barry Lyndon','An Irish rogue uses his cunning and wit to work his way up the social classes of 18th century England, transforming himself from the humble Redmond Barry into the noble Barry Lyndon.','/znfLskGQnXYB2xcOGM9eInRHPAV.jpg','1975-12-16',188,'Released',NULL,'Barry Lyndon',3175,10.453,8,'9lzSoKOs1fc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6813,_binary '\0','/ijGipE4DDF5YX3P0vg8JU6CmKSt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072685',8.1,1898,'es','La batalla de Chile (Parte 1). La insurrección de la burguesía','The chronicle of the political tension in Chile in 1973 and of the violent counter revolution against the democratically elected government of Salvador Allende.','/8IMwtQM7nm8ouF2bZOgo8eWMgv0.jpg','1975-03-18',97,'Released',NULL,'The Battle of Chile: Part I',132144,1.4845,7.6,'4FY3-dhym3g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6814,_binary '\0','/7uVY8w2iSjURPyv7Q0Eb8vhaWZE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072705',6.6,6605,'en','Bite the Bullet','At the beginning of the 20th century, a newspaper organizes an endurance horse race : 700 miles to run in a few days. 9 adventurers are competing, among them a woman, Miss Jones, a Mexican, an Englishman, a young cow-boy, an old one and two friends, Sam Clayton and Luke Matthews. All those individualists will learn to respect each other.','/2tg8EWatD9mwuKTsTJJ5A96oy5G.jpg','1975-09-26',132,'Released',NULL,'Bite the Bullet',32617,2.9163,6.432,'BSglJouYL4M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6815,_binary '\0','/luRLohOI29820ZKUgPg84wquMqi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072709',6.1,6748,'en','Black Moon','There is a global gender war between men and women. A teenage girl tries to escape this reality and arrives at a hidden place where a strange unicorn lives with a family: sister, brother, many children and an old, bedridden woman who stays in contact with the world through her radio.','/tsbauHYC5E7YK7UeMl3FM4U9xhK.jpg','1975-09-24',101,'Released','An apocalyptic Alice in Wonderland!','Black Moon',27361,2.103,6,'GXvo7U4kDwg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6816,_binary '\0','/ueG3GoXs1ZX22CnBl5amCGUFIBC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072725',6.3,3514,'en','Boss Nigger','Two black bounty hunters ride into a small town out West in pursuit of an outlaw. They discover that the town has no sheriff, and soon take over that position, much against the will of the mostly white townsfolk.','/4atyb5cZclgGgvkszWxIjkGhd2D.jpg','1975-08-17',93,'Released','White Man\'s Town... Black Man\'s Law!','Boss Nigger',26905,2.1856,6.7,'EgbVsuYsRuc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6817,_binary '\0','/sWOQBQYkJvm8W7HGk6J8OAjPl2V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072730',6.4,21045,'en','A Boy and His Dog','Set in the year 2024 in post-apocalyptic America, 18-year old Vic and his telepathic dog, Blood, are scavengers in the desolate wilderness ravaged by World War IV, where survivors must battle for food and shelter in the desert-like wasteland. Vic and Blood eke out a meager existence, foraging for food and fighting gangs of cutthroats.','/dMbkoFzD5sEQvEaqRsIh4pTBJVq.jpg','1975-03-23',91,'Released','A rather kinky tale of survival.','A Boy and His Dog',4917,4.0831,6.3,'eM7MCPF36xM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6818,_binary '\0','/t9dr5fN1mQzWGQaeqfMXx3wzQLy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072732',6.1,7375,'en','Brannigan','A hard-nosed Chicago cop is sent to London to bring back an American mobster being held for extradition. Brannigan in his Irish-American way brings American law to the people of Scotland Yard but has to contend with a stuffy old London first.','/n1kLe6y8hiPEOH9DhZcX7c12IP7.jpg','1975-03-21',111,'Released','Big Jim Brannigan takes on London - Chicago Style !','Brannigan',27396,2.367,5.975,'2Egn1FMTugk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6819,_binary '\0','/AqPFdlxpHZ61fnUdX5yCfkD20MF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072735',6.7,10502,'en','Breakheart Pass','At the height of the frontier era, a train races through the Rocky Mountains on a classified mission to a remote army post. But one by one the passengers are being murdered, and their only hope is the mysterious John Deakin, who\'s being transported to face trial for murder.','/li6BdgpVeMsgIjDugiVfHJGwPTp.jpg','1975-12-09',95,'Released','Revenge Mystery Danger Ambush','Breakheart Pass',8043,3.7944,6.598,'t_Iw47M_Ywc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6820,_binary '\0','/xje0XsHtR3TEZ1B8oujXHj59P6X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072737',6.1,5269,'en','Breakout','A bush pilot is hired for $50,000 to go to Mexico to free an innocent prisoner.','/lrpXrpmnOtFT0gJEQ5vVBL8tIlh.jpg','1975-05-01',96,'Released','Sentenced to 28 years in prison for a crime he never committed. Only two things can get him out - A lot of money and Charles Bronson!','Breakout',31671,3.3279,6.252,'jLSCf8nmGOQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6821,_binary '\0','/7uluvpT4FAY4dRgaTOXxtcVh6NZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072747',6.2,1989,'en','Bucktown','Duke Johnson visits a small Southern town, intent on burying his brother. After the funeral, he learns that he must stay for 60 days, for the estate to be processed. A few locals convince Duke to reopen his late brother\'s nightclub, and soon the local redneck policemen are intimidating Duke with threats of violence. Duke refuses to pay the bribes they demand, so then he and his lady friend Aretha are threatened and attacked by the crooked cops. Rather than take them on himself, Duke calls on his old pal Roy. Roy brings a few buddies to Bucktown, and they bring justice to the small town. With the redneck cops out of the way, Duke lets his guard down. Then the situation gets out of hand again. Finally, Duke must settle the score himself.','/x5UbYNscimgLYat7X0TcsqRDapA.jpg','1975-07-02',94,'Released','WHATEVER YOU WANT THEY\'VE GOT... And Bucktown is where you\'ll find it!','Bucktown',87774,1.3867,5.8,'HJR2Q45Jvz0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6822,_binary '\0','/8tcaUcZvUJ5mNzfcvNnArYAhSVP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072750',5.2,2914,'en','Bug','An earthquake releases a strain of mutant cockroaches with the ability to start fires, which proceed to cause destructive chaos in a small town. The studies carried out by scientist James Parmiter, however, reveal an intent with much more far-reaching consequences.','/fcGZcDb62IdfIKVsVIezKQy9l15.jpg','1975-06-06',99,'Released','Out of the worst nightmare!','Bug',62697,1.8669,5.3,'hlT_4kmVAhY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6823,_binary '\0','/xkzcyjeQJPBUqv8klb0eh6LMV2b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072752',5.7,6178,'fr','La Bête','The head of a failing French family thinks that fate has smiled down on him when the daughter of a wealthy man agrees to be married to his son. The daughter and her aunt then travel out to the French countryside to meet with the family, unaware that a mysterious \'beast\' is stalking the vicinity.','/jIKqdwBYutlyItSBed8uBS5mCJX.jpg','1975-08-20',98,'Released','Just About The Most Outrageous Erotic Fantasy Ever Committed To Film.','The Beast',44132,3.7847,5.4,'BVTpDEY-L00','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6824,_binary '\0','/6gcxLxZGFKhIywOGOS5zAhxhmiU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072761',5.7,3537,'en','Capone','Young Al Capone catches the eye of Johnny Torrio, a criminal visiting New York from Chicago. Torrio invites Capone to move to Illinois to help run his Prohibition-era alcohol sales operation. Capone rises through the ranks of Torrio\'s gang and eventually takes over. On top, he works to consolidate his power by eliminating his enemies, fixing elections to his advantage and getting rich. In his spare time, Capone courts the principled Iris Crawford.','/g2AoLfKPTFTGTFxvDDegFPLWAsV.jpg','1975-04-16',101,'Released','The Man Who Made the Twenties Roar','Capone',18710,3.4337,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6825,_binary '\0','/uVeArBcaFWAISlVbeFXncb8PL9I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072764',5.6,3295,'en','Carry On Behind','Professors Vooshka and Crump decide to visit an archaeological site to study the artifacts there. Lo and behold, it\'s right next to a caravan site where all manner of people are staying. With a randy Major owning the site, a snobbish mother, and the two professors\' constant innuendos, the story ends with a sinking caravan site and a striptease performance as a replacement for the cabaret night.','/a8IglMzitC581htTQ1Vsb0cRSJ8.jpg','1975-06-10',90,'Released',NULL,'Carry On Behind',19300,1.9407,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6826,_binary '\0','/1VKxIeY5POZ5OXZCTrTmiBvoafr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072777',8.2,5044,'hi','छोटी सी बात','Arun is a timid accountant in Bombay who dreams of romancing Prabha, but is too shy to share his feelings. While Arun twiddles his thumbs, the suave Nagesh steps into the picture and turns on the heat, prompting Arun to take \"love coaching\" from \"romance specialist\" Julius Nagendranath to win Prabha back.','/hNM2zk1iWGPyM6z4hhFqJDKFEeD.jpg','1976-01-09',123,'Released',NULL,'Chhoti Si Baat',71756,0.9844,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6827,_binary '\0','/teuyga76jorbE6TMs69v5cKCGtV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072783',8.3,14111,'hi','Chupke Chupke','Sulekha is in awe of her brother-in-law Raghavendra for his intelligence. Parimal, her husband, decides to take up the challenge of fooling Raghavendra and goes to work for him as a driver.','/yNZf2yhQE42f3uIcR1IXOiMQ72c.jpg','1975-04-11',129,'Released',NULL,'Chupke Chupke',21459,1.3944,7.2,'o_tlw3zQlX8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6828,_binary '\0','/bJ1jD1wkVY7mX9RjHGDLoIY4ulf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072791',5.6,1320,'en','Cleopatra Jones and the Casino of Gold','When fellow operatives and friends disappear during a mission in Hong Kong, Cleopatra Jones comes to help. She discovers the disappearance involves The Dragon Lady, a feared lipstick lesbian who runs a casino and the local drug trade.','/yqXTLGEnQ8wjo6RkzPOXY61WgVc.jpg','1975-07-11',94,'Released','6\' 2\" of dynamite caught in the web of international intrigue!','Cleopatra Jones and the Casino of Gold',2139,1.8976,5.8,'1TCAz7AFQLw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6829,_binary '\0','/upginjKHLQfHhOV9rdOVh7HazLt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072812',6.6,1244,'en','Conduct Unbecoming','A company of British soldiers in colonial India is shaken when the widow of their most honored hero is assaulted. A young officer must defend a fellow lieutenant from the charges in an unusual court-martial, while investigating the deepening mystery behind the attack.','/rDfn5refbG9f9blMoZlejjX6lYQ.jpg','1975-10-04',107,'Released','An unspeakable crime among officers and ladies.','Conduct Unbecoming',59144,1.8021,5.9,'1v7BCFGdxtI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6830,_binary '\0','/b4sLHOCqhBDVXwY55F87Q6Kocp8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072813',6.3,1607,'en','House of Mortal Sin','A troubled young girl goes to confession at the local church. Unfortunately, the sexually frustrated priest she confesses to becomes obsessed with her. At first, the priest stalks the girl, but later it is revealed that he will stop at nothing, including blackmail and murder, just to get close to her.','/rkzPQVQZcHy2h3T63pRTINAd1v6.jpg','1976-02-03',104,'Released','The Devil in Priest\'s clothing!','House of Mortal Sin',106679,1.9368,6.4,'Ni8cHAng0Rw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6831,_binary '\0','/pUXnj9429TsdvN9XTSrX1gO3ojd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072820',7.1,6308,'en','Cooley High','In the mid-1960s, a group of high school friends who live on the Near North Side of Chicago enjoy life to the fullest...parties, hanging out, meeting new friends. Then life changes for two of the guys when they are falsely arrested in connection with stealing a Cadillac. We follow their lives through to the dramatic end of high school.','/pObzSME61i5IszazNQm3cqLMAGZ.jpg','1975-06-25',107,'Released','Where the Student Body Was a Chick Named Veronica... The Senior Prom was a \'belly rub\' and the Class of \'64 ran a Permanent crap game in the Men\'s Room!','Cooley High',35711,1.9766,7,'VfwkA9lO4Eo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6832,_binary '\0','/8VjQ8hOjrrOtTJjCfdDg8eyFDUk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072824',6.9,6644,'en','The Count of Monte-Cristo','Young sailor Edmond Dantès is wrongfully imprisoned, escapes, finds treasure, and reinvents himself as the wealthy Count of Monte Cristo to exact revenge on those who betrayed him.','/jbXO1lV54yWLGyzpOxQjzBxMfLR.jpg','1975-10-31',119,'Released',NULL,'The Count of Monte-Cristo',4546,4.8344,6.845,'h3rYCfCd6mY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6833,_binary '\0','/w17aSMniqH4tZTf1tg0LuXqBGPL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072825',6.2,1473,'fr','La Course à l\'échalote','The whole intrigue is centered around carte-blanche documents kept in a vault. Whoever fills in the blank becomes the owner of a revue. Big money is involved. The nephew of the owner of the vault is trying to cheat his uncle and have his name in the documents. Everything is even more complicated because the manager of the bank has a finger in the pie, too. Who but a humble bank-teller (Pierre Richard) will ruin the scheme?','/z9fUXQ9GswK2uFUD7aaTda0tHUy.jpg','1975-10-08',95,'Released',NULL,'The Wild Goose Chase',38090,2.1741,6.133,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6834,_binary '\0','/67L4N9FRUwkRC0wX2yBqsYkQnND.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072826',6.7,1978,'fr','Cousin, Cousine','Two distant cousins meet at a wedding banquet for an elderly couple. Over time, a close friendship develops between them, but their spouses begin to think that they are more than just friends.','/ffGpsolcNX9oJZvJinQwFhePtAD.jpg','1975-11-19',95,'Released','A rare romantic comedy','Cousin, Cousine',5618,1.3586,6.133,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6835,_binary '\0','/nKmecN2dvKLjkcFol7MdKb6lbiC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072829',5.4,1235,'en','Crazy Mama','Melba Stokes, her mother Sheba and daughter Cheryl embark on a crime spree after their California beauty parlor is repossessed. Their destination is Arkansas, where the three generations of women want to reclaim the family farm.','/868gQ8gYhBggAy3meIx57fUfsDY.jpg','1975-06-01',83,'Released','In 1957 Cheryl Drove Her Mom\'s Chevy on a Heavy Date: Got Knocked Up, Knocked Over a Bank, Smashed Four Police Cars, and Kidnapped Her Stepfather. It Was a Crazy Year!','Crazy Mama',89602,1.9492,5.6,'TpR9Nma-Utg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6836,_binary '\0','/V7mjeIChGXJiZjvbmak7OvknVX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072831',5.4,1506,'en','Criminally Insane','An obese woman recently released from an insane asylum kills anyone who attempts to get her to stop eating.','/5z5DvkdCz2mNHzFBBtU2TQA8oGI.jpg','1975-07-12',62,'Released','She\'s 250 Pounds of Maniacal Fury!','Criminally Insane',89659,1.5517,5.5,'UswS3X68Xnw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6837,_binary '\0','/t6SQPU26qDgiyVhDG54ApZWJ5V3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072848',6.9,7091,'en','The Day of the Locust','Hollywood, 1930s. Tod Hackett, a young painter who tries to make his way as an art director in the lurid world of film industry, gets infatuated with his neighbor Faye Greener, an aspiring actress who prefers the life that Homer Simpson, a lone accountant, can offer her.','/m4T7R448djzbDbURK4eQgo5TllF.jpg','1975-05-07',145,'Released','By train, by car, by bus, they came to Hollywood... in search of a dream.','The Day of the Locust',5122,5.4967,6.434,'h7ZsPWW-MBw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6838,_binary '\0','/vcbTDYFSeGSBEoW15rm2qWxcPjg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072852',6.7,1331,'en','The Deadly Tower','The real-life story of Charles Whitman\'s deadly shooting spree at the University of Texas is retold. In August 1966, after killing his wife and mother, Whitman climbed to the top of the school\'s tower and opened fire on passers-by, killing 13 and wounding many others.','/tXdSO0BGue6c1iRWQ7XhiKDFWdj.jpg','1975-10-18',100,'Released',NULL,'The Deadly Tower',83723,1.9935,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6839,_binary '\0','/1WgFbHfTPSXKoqYdB9SbcAWpqrO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072856',6.2,33201,'en','Death Race 2000','In a boorish future, the government sponsors a popular, but bloody, cross-country race in which points are scored by mowing down pedestrians. Five teams, each comprised of a male and female, compete using cars equipped with deadly weapons. Frankenstein, the mysterious returning champion, has become America\'s hero, but this time he has a passenger from the underground resistance.','/kwM8kkNGtv62gfPWVhD6qFxjDzg.jpg','1975-04-30',80,'Released','In the year 2000, hit and run driving is no longer a felony. It\'s the national sport!','Death Race 2000',13282,4.6732,6.2,'ZLiU9tqE6Ns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6840,_binary '\0','/lx94BR9gILXSGptjaUSUPveBjJu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072860',8,13296,'hi','दीवार','Haunted by the past, Vijay turns to crime, while Ravi, his brother, becomes an honest police officer. Fate pits them against each other when Ravi is sent to nab Vijay.','/pwzfljCp52jieXTBE0lynz7bu2g.jpg','1975-01-24',174,'Released',NULL,'Deewaar',22460,1.6405,7.2,'DuJ_7UVyGIc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6841,_binary '\0','/mhgRdRehUW9kwlmjTnmdukydMzo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072867',4.3,1681,'en','I Don\'t Want to Be Born','A woman gives birth to a baby, but this is no ordinary one. The child is seemingly possessed by the Devil.','/5CYgf4kyNWe2XlCKEpxn9cZsHH3.jpg','1976-02-01',95,'Released','Pray for the Devil Within Her...before it preys on you!','I Don\'t Want to Be Born',28271,1.9353,5.2,'6fZ7oZ8rPkk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6842,_binary '\0','/lEJFN23Nvra7VKGZtY67Ikl081w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072869',5.1,5747,'en','The Devil’s Rain','A Satanist cult leader is burnt alive by the local church. He vows to come back to hunt down and enslave every descendant of his congregation, by the power of the book of blood contracts, in which they sold their souls to the devil.','/855mdgEriehXBmjvG5n74CaAjTU.jpg','1975-07-01',85,'Released','Absolutely the most incredible ending of any motion picture','The Devil’s Rain',38701,3.7826,5,'qmfNafRfYwk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6843,_binary '\0','/1kCexERbcnVBmTFGyftUW6YFKWo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072884',6.2,1967,'fr','Le Distrait','A comedy about an absent-minded man who works at a advertising company and topples from one problem to another.','/xyCy5FHF6A7W6uguOYZogPy5HoV.jpg','1970-12-09',85,'Released',NULL,'Distracted',62675,1.4377,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6844,_binary '\0','/3wwSJJ4DyOc7rCpG5Ax6EceEKEa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072886',5.4,2450,'en','Doc Savage: The Man of Bronze','In the Fabulous Thirties, Doc Savage and his five Amazing Adventurers are sucked into the mystery of Doc\'s father disappearing in the wilds of South America. The maniacal Captain Seas tries to thwart them at every turn as they travel to the country of Hidalgo to investigate Doc\'s father\'s death and uncover a vast horde of Incan gold.','/cckGRIiw4S9cK3OrQayknwOVqTD.jpg','1975-06-01',112,'Released',NULL,'Doc Savage: The Man of Bronze',39554,2.8592,5.2,'Pp7tPHnSNSs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6845,_binary '\0','/ahqTRP5mPOm3fMO8WjXbHlaF4Mo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072890',8,294580,'en','Dog Day Afternoon','Based on the true story of would-be Brooklyn bank robbers John Wojtowicz and Salvatore Naturile. Sonny and Sal attempt a bank heist which quickly turns sour and escalates into a hostage situation and stand-off with the police. As Sonny\'s motives for the robbery are slowly revealed and things become more complicated, the heist turns into a media circus.','/mavrhr0ig2aCRR8d48yaxtD5aMQ.jpg','1975-09-21',124,'Released','Anything can happen during the dog days of summer. On August 22nd, 1972, everything did.','Dog Day Afternoon',968,9.5759,7.9,'3STmwLDDBcI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6846,_binary '\0','/sytoeq1ScNHTbjUaAPRzshjtN63.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072895',5.7,7346,'en','Dolemite','Dolemite is a pimp who was set up by Willie Greene and the cops, who have planted drugs, stolen furs, and guns in his trunk and got him sentenced to 20 years in jail. One day, Queen B and a warden planned to get him out of Jail and get Willie Green and Mitchell busted for what they did to him.','/sc81lG0MdHq1UCY5b2B10c9wSKw.jpg','1975-04-26',90,'Released','With his All-Girl Army of Kung Fu Killers!','Dolemite',19174,1.4744,5.8,'WvMrqJU2jPY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6847,_binary '\0','/yQ0Nn4KIiLf60LTMDjEhRzPqTta.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072901',7.7,21674,'fr','Les 12 travaux d\'Astérix','Asterix and Obelix depart on an adventure to complete twelve impossible tasks to prove to Caesar that they are as strong as the Gods. You\'ll roar with laughter as they outwit, outrun, and generally outrage the very people who are trying to prove them \"only human\".','/7cZQZOYZFJcLjZnxWjO5PcUtmDZ.jpg','1976-06-26',82,'Released',NULL,'The Twelve Tasks of Asterix',9385,5.6701,7.3,'1WVGszqwkkI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6848,_binary '\0','/b9j6UsCuPKDpSu1Cn8BLKmDUJHE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072912',6.5,7058,'en','The Drowning Pool','Harper is brought to Louisiana to investigate an attempted blackmail scheme. He soon finds out that it involves an old flame of his and her daughter. He eventually finds himself caught in a power struggle between the matriarch of the family and a greedy oil baron, who wants their property. Poor Harper! Things are not as straight-forward as they initially appeared.','/pOV256yJv56997QZJEdYdCTiL8B.jpg','1975-07-18',109,'Released','Harper days are here again...','The Drowning Pool',32620,3.3484,6.3,'c5v9tnqqLfo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6849,_binary '\0','/sVMnO0iajgth9CSxOQPOBxfQJMO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072913',7.3,5233,'zh','獨臂拳王大破血滴子','A one-armed martial arts master is being stalked by an Imperial assassin, the master of two fighters killed in the previous film. When the One-Armed Boxer is invited to attend a martial arts tournament, his efforts to lay low are unsuccessful, and the assassin soon tracks him down with the help of his three subordinates: a Thai boxer, a yoga master, and a kobojutsu user.','/upa8qI25kJrrQHgYz66IO2ccvoH.jpg','1976-04-24',93,'Released','It\'s A Mean Machine - Cuts Your Head Off Clean!','Master of the Flying Guillotine',49636,2.0251,6.7,'RmdP1qTjGZY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6850,_binary '\0','/2fao0EDChNM0naadJs75IUeLHkY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072926',6.4,25035,'en','The Eiger Sanction','A classical art professor and collector, who doubles as a professional assassin, is coerced out of retirement to avenge the murder of an old friend.','/8654SvWhTdWQZ84C4NlidPqMBTB.jpg','1975-05-21',129,'Released','HIS LIFELINE - held by the assassin he hunted.','The Eiger Sanction',20187,4.5298,6.1,'bWgOoLeQa2Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6851,_binary '\0','/reoGcWlduK1p06bwzykKLWQL6bp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072930',4.6,2083,'it','Emanuelle nera','Internationally-renowned photographer Mae Jordan, professionally known as \'Emanuelle\', is hired by a wealthy British expat to go to Nairobi to shoot the ruins and wildlife. While there, she explores sexual situations with her hosts and their friends.','/fgeYUNbW4qpvWKBPUTwmSkR6z5B.jpg','1975-11-27',96,'Released','A NEW EXPERIENCE IN SENSUALITY. No one is ever the same after ...','Black Emanuelle',40348,4.8268,5.074,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6852,_binary '\0','/5u5BXfMuGLOkerR1qJPDBdg1fI9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072931',7.2,3144,'sv','Emil och griseknoen','Nursing a piglet back to life because it\'s the runt of the litter earns Emil a friend for life.','/8cMK2tiBrfV0TqCZPJA1O2t0Xko.jpg','1973-10-06',95,'Released',NULL,'Emil and the Piglet',11947,1.809,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6853,_binary '\0','/Aiw4qdIMzRDN79CxIFFCgqOaAP5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072933',4.9,4266,'fr','Emmanuelle: L\'antivierge','Emmanuelle returns to her husband in Hong Kong and proceeds to have several extramarital affairs -- with his knowledge, of course. Her husband\'s lover and American guest are both very puzzled by their openness.','/cuG4YTomxIOw2yxIcTJMvRiQNYK.jpg','1975-12-15',91,'Released','Nothing is wrong if it feels good','Emmanuelle: The Joys of a Woman',28209,4.2687,5.6,'KPVV_MRl-eA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6854,_binary '\0','/p7YwBEvUdl7GUnhXkap3KmdZYUC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072934',7,4115,'fr','L\'Emmerdeur','Ralf Milan, a hitman, arrives in Montpellier to kill an important witness. He checks in a hotel without knowing that his neighbour has become neurotic after his wife left him.','/gpiJSwmvFNrVvylqPCqVdxcI0G8.jpg','1973-09-20',85,'Released',NULL,'A Pain in the Ass',11670,2.3424,7.015,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6855,_binary '\0','/3m45wVVHCX6iIKFHG6NBd3TkRHZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072951',6.3,12536,'en','Escape to Witch Mountain','Tia and Tony are two orphaned youngsters with extraordinary powers. Lucas Deranian poses as their uncle in order to get the kids into the clutches of Deranian\'s megalomaniacal boss, evil millionaire Aristotle Bolt, who wants to exploit them. Jason, a cynical widower, helps Tia and Tony escape to witch mountain, while at the same time Tia and Tony help Jason escape the pain of the loss of his wife.','/cXicoCiCfO6FDfv6ozwcfQCnhVW.jpg','1975-03-21',97,'Released','Caught in a world where they don\'t belong... they have one chance to escape!','Escape to Witch Mountain',14821,4.8831,6.399,'nswae1s320k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6856,_binary '\0','/pzt8pTRDtkNcaXLPaO92KEtCD4B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072960',5.4,1666,'en','Exposé','A paranoid writer is unable to get started on his second novel. He hires a secretary and then his troubles really begin.','/7bEV13lR9QrVTpx7RVYk3ea1hkR.jpg','1976-03-01',84,'Released','Haunting intrigue... A shock to your system!!!','Exposé',39924,2.435,4.9,'ebZjVOJ_EOE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6857,_binary '\0','/kwwuAQpPvewf4voKVMN98KcXEPM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072962',7.7,19944,'fr','Vérités et Mensonges','Documents the lives of infamous fakers Elmyr de Hory and Clifford Irving. De Hory, who later committed suicide to avoid more prison time, made his name by selling forged works of art by painters like Picasso and Matisse. Irving was infamous for writing a fake autobiography of Howard Hughes. Welles moves between documentary and fiction as he examines the fundamental elements of fraud and the people who commit fraud at the expense of others.','/fVeIDxS73CrosoeVOaefQuCUGZg.jpg','1973-09-01',89,'Released','A magician is just an actor playing the part of a magician.','F for Fake',43003,3.1648,7.4,'ic0BI8L-spQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6858,_binary '\0','/r0EBtfYplRIagrYMfi0pni3xpzr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072973',7,11133,'en','Farewell, My Lovely','Private eye Philip Marlowe is hired by ex-con Moose Malloy to find his girlfriend, a former lounge dancer. While also investigating the murder of a client and the theft of a jade necklace, Marlowe becomes entangled with seductress Helen Grayle and discovers a web of dark secrets that are better left hidden.','/ygk9oP5BJM7viLut42RidNB5JPV.jpg','1975-08-08',95,'Released','\"I need another drink... I need a lot of life insurance... I need a vacation.... and all I\'ve got is a coat, a hat, and a gun!\"','Farewell, My Lovely',1835,3.8293,6.66,'tX1_kXyM50U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6859,_binary '\0','/shIMqYeRZArmAsUe3FYGhHgWAkM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072976',7.5,7692,'de','Faustrecht der Freiheit','Fox, a former circus performer, wins the lottery of DM 500,000 and can now have the life and things that he has always wanted. He enters an abusive relationship with wealthy industrialist Eugen in an attempt to climb the social ladder. His desperation for love and affection soon spirals into tragedy.','/uYHNK7VycMOcD9Jv5qgjIdvDwgG.jpg','1975-06-06',125,'Released','Survival of the fittest.','Fox and His Friends',42254,2.1827,7.188,'cVZ6_TZDo8Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6860,_binary '\0','/utsFSjBd6Ai56BwFB8s80S1a9bC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072979',7.1,11918,'en','Female Trouble','Teenage delinquent Dawn Davenport, incensed after her parents do not give her the cha-cha heels she wanted for Christmas, runs away from home. After an illegitimate child and hairstylist husband bring her more misery, she\'s enticed into a life of crime when the owners of her husband\'s salon promise her fame and fortune.','/cqhIufhoORDMuFKEinV1IIYUBxD.jpg','1976-02-15',98,'Released','Nice girls don\'t wear cha-cha heels.','Female Trouble',14267,2.7311,6.9,'jlNnzoOiFq8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6861,_binary '\0','/yrWKAPEwSz78hWvzMuiPAOsDz04.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072991',6.6,1612,'zh','少林五祖','Hu Te et al. escape the burning Shaolin temple after the Qing soldiers destroyed it in Shaolin Temple. The group of 5 decide to develop secret codes to identify fellow patriots, enlist those patriots and eventually meet up again to escape to the south away from the Qings, and also identify the traitor who sold out Shaolin temple. Ma Fu Yi, joins the Qing top fighters to eliminate the rebels but is exposed by Ma Chao-Tsing who gets captured by Ma Fu Yi. Hu meets up with a group of Shaolin men secretly posing as bandits to rescue Ma as their leader is killed in the process, thus the bandits join the rest of the Shaolin patriots.','/zqGPXKTZlhcTRJEp90ZI9UpusxA.jpg','1974-12-25',110,'Released',NULL,'Five Shaolin Masters',41383,3.0673,7.3,'djAAO9uPJKM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6862,_binary '\0','/fi0c9K6BSDro8AjNMDa03MY14az.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0072996',6.9,3528,'fr','Flic Story','The film story depicts Emile Buisson, following the death of his wife and child, escaping from a psychiatric institution in 1947 and returning to Paris. Buisson, who three years later would become France\'s public enemy number one, begins a murderous rampage through the French capital.','/zaQ0ypsYBkMeQaBsNIj0mJBmCJz.jpg','1975-10-01',112,'Released',NULL,'Flic Story',32653,2.9992,6.414,'AX94IGlXKlo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6863,_binary '\0','/txLUbP8OoNMmHFwF7SbyD4NQlPr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073000',8.4,15517,'no','Flåklypa Grand Prix','100 miles north, a bit east and up, is Pinchcliffe, the home of bicycle repairman Reodor Felgen and his two assistants, Solan Gundersen and Ludvig. Sponsored by oil sheik Ben Redic Fy Fazan, they build the car \"Il Tempo Gigante\" to race against Reodor\'s former assistant Rudolf Blodstrupmoen, who has stolen one of Reodor\'s inventions to become a world racing champion.','/iWnG4MrdUcrJ3dhB2pvwQZjKXIR.jpg','1975-08-28',88,'Released',NULL,'The Pinchcliffe Grand Prix',492015,3.1051,7.836,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6864,_binary '\0','/sOKFLbAkLYcZVIiuodCROtGG7qN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073008',5.7,3466,'en','The Fortune','A couple of bumbling 1920s hustlers attempt to obtain the fortune of an heiress. Nothing will stop them, not even murder.','/qdx9noBCQcKDf6Ieci5BbqTjJ6G.jpg','1975-05-20',88,'Released','Sexier than the Marx Brothers, handsomer than Laurel and Hardy but not as smart as The 3 Stooges.','The Fortune',70259,2.3538,5.397,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6865,_binary '\0','/zTHbv8qRzvBrlGuGCJh15H3eHtk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073012',6.9,12892,'en','The Four Musketeers','The Four Musketeers defend the queen and her dressmaker from Cardinal Richelieu and Milady de Winter.','/dm0ArEYWrrfyOkMUbKOE8ZnCc92.jpg','1974-10-31',107,'Released','What could be better than The Three Musketeers?','The Four Musketeers',12310,5.1351,6.5,'zJZoDf5Lz-Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6866,_binary '\0','/pGvv5tQAxwUh3tBOGKLpeo7YihS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073017',4.4,1797,'fr','Frauengefängnis','Maria, an unfortunate young woman, kills her rapist father in self-defense, and is later tried, sentenced, and shipped off to a woman\'s penitentiary where she and her fellow inmates are subjected to psychological and sexual abuse at the hands of a psychotic lesbian warden.','/3FBtK6Cn80qLESrWqIhbSh0uXLE.jpg','1976-04-22',81,'Released','Welcome to prison, Ladies!','Barbed Wire Dolls',28691,1.7027,4.7,'KXLEKb-ugBk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6867,_binary '\0','/ffI5k9rPEkEKRTYm4bS4da3Yh20.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073018',6.7,23394,'en','French Connection II','\"Popeye\" Doyle travels to Marseilles to find Alain Charnier, the drug smuggler that eluded him in New York.','/55slIJqWAJSd8JdNnmq2oYlqBkX.jpg','1975-05-18',119,'Released','The French Connection was only the beginning. THIS IS THE CLIMAX.','French Connection II',10711,3.9775,6.8,'UD_eYmfHrhc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6868,_binary '\0','/mLsp1PMVvNxF4ZdcwvrffKrKBZn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073019',6,3075,'en','Friday Foster','Friday Foster, a magazine photographer, goes to Los Angeles International airport to photograph the arrival of Blake Tarr, the richest black man in America. Three men attempt to assassinate Tarr. Foster photographs the melee and is plunged into a web of conspiracy involving the murder of her childhood friend, a US senator, and a shadowy plan called \"Black Widow\".','/dGADshou0bUIGGt0vompPORdKtn.jpg','1975-12-25',90,'Released','Wham! Bam! Here Comes Pam!','Friday Foster',56539,2.3031,6.1,'_UYKhuO-v8A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6869,_binary '\0','/wuZn3zmyYJISfxa3FyevEkVSwtN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073026',6.2,6242,'en','Funny Lady','Famous singer Fanny Brice has divorced her first husband Nicky Arnstein. During the Great Depression she has trouble finding work as an artist, but meets Billy Rose, a newcomer who writes lyrics and owns a nightclub.','/3F6BcS3hW9YolzHuAMluXSiDES7.jpg','1975-03-15',136,'Released','How Lucky Can You Get!','Funny Lady',39282,3.3237,5.3,'ENCRarJ9wi4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6870,_binary '\0','/8PDs33WTpVOFEUr7bMpWm0FXnQp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073036',6.2,6466,'it','Un genio, due compari, un pollo','Expert conman Joe Thanks teams up with half-breed Bill and naive Lucy to steal $300,000 from the Indian-hating Major Cabot. Their elaborate plan is full of disguises, double-crosses, and chases, but Joe always seems to know what he\'s doing.','/wVo9IIAmIPWztrmR2C25X31QHAk.jpg','1975-12-16',117,'Released','In the saddle... In the sack... In the sand','A Genius, Two Friends, and an Idiot',10915,3.4867,6.3,'DHAatVKGDGg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6871,_binary '\0','/uhEJwdWBcEXHIraV6G4oJ9pd7cW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073042',5.4,2112,'en','The Ghoul','In 1920s England, former clergyman Dr Lawrence keeps his cannibal son locked in the attic after the young man is exposed to savage practices in India. When an auto race is held at the estate, Lawrence worries that his son may escape and terrorise the youth.','/28A5LZfY2W9FUZqBxOzEYPlXxG0.jpg','1975-06-01',90,'Released',NULL,'The Ghoul',70810,1.4526,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6872,_binary '\0','/tY6uezxJR57Eag6IfWbI5qNNxHF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073043',3.4,5114,'en','The Giant Spider Invasion','A black hole hits North Wisconsin and opens a door to other dimensions. Giant 15 meter spiders emerge from it, who have an appetite for human flesh! Two NASA scientists try to save the world.','/jUaJOZlnrmSRTny7ProiupczO42.jpg','1975-10-16',80,'Released','Creeping!...Crawling!...Crushing!','The Giant Spider Invasion',39154,2.7932,4.1,'o3Mc0mgorZc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6873,_binary '\0','/rCsW4Vh8beOvxLeTUpkFqYZwpEX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073052',8,1682,'he','גבעת חלפון אינה עונה','Sergio Konstanza, a swindler, owes money to Mr. Hasson. He escapes to the desert where he joins a wacky army reserve unit whose Sergeant is engaged to one of Mr. Hasson\'s Daughters.','/b7Wv0A0z8CjmzxeddDt0jHBoM0k.jpg','1976-09-27',92,'Released',NULL,'Halfon Hill Doesn\'t Answer',24611,1.3174,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6874,_binary '\0','/xQdWCmtuwOBmjPD1XV5s3bHixGu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073075',6.8,7721,'en','The Great Waldo Pepper','A biplane pilot and WWI veteran takes up barnstorming and later a movie career in his quest for the glory days he misses.','/oe8ew2TXKbAoMTXHjHNIWWZKDBr.jpg','1975-03-13',108,'Released','The second greatest flyer in the world.','The Great Waldo Pepper',19740,3.2787,6.558,'aYUEOSbh4IE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6875,_binary '\0','/8gMOMHSkSTJ5NbHvHYK6amERLNM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073076',7.5,17103,'en','Grey Gardens','Edie Bouvier Beale and her mother, Edith, two aging, eccentric relatives of Jackie Kennedy Onassis, are the sole inhabitants of a Long Island estate. The women reveal themselves to be misfits with outsized, engaging personalities. Much of the conversation is centered on their pasts, as mother and daughter now rarely leave home.','/jb6o66HE1duy0L7MJzEZXvrrsux.jpg','1976-02-19',95,'Released','She was the girl who had everything - Money, good looks and social position. Her mother - a classic Bouvier beauty. Now they are living amongst the souvenirs of their lives. In Grey Gardens. This is their story. A love story. Sort of.','Grey Gardens',17346,2.2225,7.3,'mumWYU5aHBU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6876,_binary '\0','/cjA8bxjXcw3I63DlO3qa6uFwrH4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073092',7.2,14827,'en','Hard Times','In the depression, Chaney, a strong silent streetfighter, joins with Speed, a promoter of no-holds-barred street boxing bouts. They go to New Orleans where Speed borrows money to set up fights for Chaney, but Speed gambles away any winnings.','/yWIh8cMGd9XubkdhJB2TJ7buGy3.jpg','1975-08-13',93,'Released','New Orleans, 1933. In those days words didn\'t say much.','Hard Times',22094,4.7032,6.839,'Q3yN9U5aPrI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6877,_binary '\0','/k2JQgmdYIvwWus3hromBmqAjh70.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073096',6.5,1987,'en','Hearts of the West','Lewis Tater writes Wild West dime novels and dreams of actually becoming a cowboy. When he goes west to find his dream he finds himself in possession of the loot box of two crooks who tried to rob him.','/bOrOGtucFF39EAXXeM2kY5wGbTy.jpg','1975-10-08',102,'Released','Jeff Bridges is Lewis Tater, the Iowa farmboy who blazed a trail across the barren wastes of Hollywood and Vine in MGM\'s comedy surprise \"Hearts of the West.\"','Hearts of the West',84259,2.6416,5.6,'2WtWskZZGio','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6878,_binary '\0','/vr4fskAEI91XoBNMxEiW8Tx3Q6g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073104',6.6,1241,'hi','हेरा फेरी','Two con men, Vijay and Ajay, manage to hoodwink a number of wealthy people as well as Police Commissioner Khanna. Their lives undergo many changes, after a caper at a casino, where Vijay is recognized by a gangster named P.K., who decides to separate the two friends by claiming that Ajay is his long-lost son; insinuating that Vijay has not been completely forthright with Ajay; and implicating him in the murder of a male named Mac. Written by rAjOo (gunwanti@hotmail.com)','/hUlekD8DKi7GBTqy5HIrVovnU8i.jpg','1976-10-01',164,'Released',NULL,'Hera Pheri',170645,1.238,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6879,_binary '\0','/6PM9BRYYrYTkj0Ez7btxf46t7o0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073107',7,2488,'en','Hester Street','A Russian emigre prides himself on the way he\'s molded himself into a real Yankee in the USA, though the world he lives in, New York\'s Lower East Side in the late 19th century, is almost exclusively populated by other Jewish immigrants. When his wife finally arrives in the New World, however, she has a lot of assimilating to do.','/sEYKnLShvnJuXzYWFI870F1hqZK.jpg','1975-10-19',90,'Released','Goodbye O Lord, I\'m Going To America!','Hester Street',42257,1.8764,6.298,'D1TROnPKe_4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6880,_binary '\0','/wWxYyXU9EBI6YCeJlTI46ZuW1yu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073109',7.4,2660,'en','The Hiding Place','Corrie and Betsie ten Boom are middle-aged sisters working in their father\'s watchmaker shop in pre-World War II Holland. Their uneventful lives are disrupted with the coming of the Nazis. Suspected of hiding Jews and caught breaking rationing rules, they are sent to a concentration camp, where their Christian faith keeps them from despair and bitterness.','/eFQIDuXKTdowE2XDsTBycPXSO1.jpg','1975-05-04',150,'Released','The true story of a family that fought Nazi madness with the only weapon they had. Love.','The Hiding Place',37720,1.9721,6.9,'yjP7nTMX33s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6881,_binary '\0','/1daFkLpphDVzTyjBDw7rrHJajij.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073113',6.3,7352,'en','The Hindenburg','Colonel Franz Ritter, a former hero pilot now working for military intelligence, is assigned to the great Hindenburg airship as its chief of security. As he races against the clock to uncover a possible saboteur aboard the doomed zeppelin he finds that any of the passengers and crew could be the culprit.','/wl7WA2xWUNUD6ChRPuDYJnHlu7u.jpg','1975-12-25',125,'Released','The truth at last? What really happened to The Hindenburg?','The Hindenburg',17599,3.5652,6.3,'e7b_TdygluE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6882,_binary '\0','/9fTuRksyQvCAzyuzktof4kDc5Xt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073114',7.2,10041,'fr','L\'Histoire d\'Adèle H.','In the 19th century a mysterious woman named Adele H. crosses the ocean, from Europe to North America, to relentlessly pursue a handsome officer that denies her satisfaction.','/ymzUeHZP5SguHeyx28aN3PLBReA.jpg','1975-10-08',98,'Released','What kind of woman would wait her whole life for one man...? And what kind of man would deny her...?','The Story of Adèle H.',1829,3.1185,6.93,'2AIabm5_co8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6883,_binary '\0','/oehzS54FyGstwTdZCh3ALlJar5u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073115',5.3,7649,'fr','Histoire d\'O','The beautiful O is taken by her boyfriend, Rene, to a bizarre retreat, where she is trained in bondage and sexual perversion...','/x2hnSba2iyMHDPHrH1G1LB2K6lz.jpg','1975-08-27',97,'Released','\"O\" is the mistress of all mistresses.','The Story of O',4561,8.8682,5.5,'Gdrh0ZPAtqE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6884,_binary '\0','/lXoI0QruPYwthKYNPG1sLrr2mHx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073133',6.2,3280,'en','Hustle','The body of teenager Gloria Hollinger is found dead on a Los Angeles beach, and Lt. Phil Gaines is in charge of the investigation. Gaines learns that the girl, a stripper and prostitute, committed suicide, but he ignores the connection between her and a powerful mob lawyer, Leo Sellers. Hollinger\'s father, however, is not satisfied with Gaines\'s results, and attempts to investigate the case on his own.','/n52YsqFEkHDL1nbg6LLAWdR9G43.jpg','1975-12-25',120,'Released','She\'s the call girl. He\'s the cop. They both take their jobs seriously.','Hustle',4990,2.3244,5.764,'f5aA0e5kJV8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6885,_binary '\0','/hqSNaXa2dxbBrI2mVDhvvNp9ECL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073152',7.6,7352,'de','Im Lauf der Zeit','Itinerant projection-equipment repairman Bruno Winter and depressed hitchhiker Robert Lander - a doctor who has just been through a break-up with his wife and a half-hearted suicide attempt - travel along the Western side of the East-German border in a repair truck, visiting worn-out movie theaters, learning to communicate across their differences.','/wKSQ0pTOXYzDWaEXvJEXlhgj2PY.jpg','1976-03-04',177,'Released',NULL,'Kings of the Road',10834,2.7582,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6886,_binary '\0','/jqj5GL6OT1QWM6EASYjm3rbR50W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073155',7,5367,'fr','L\'Important c\'est d\'aimer','Servais Mont, a freelance photographer who works taking compromising photos, gets fascinated by Nadine Chevalier, a tormented low-budget movie actress married to an eccentric film photo collector.','/aMLrx6bRtLCrKiMPPfmGwGChBNd.jpg','1975-02-12',113,'Released',NULL,'That Most Important Thing: Love',3476,2.6299,7.05,'d2RALZ18z88','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6887,_binary '\0','/2m0CqpQEneojpexmQiypm6zbTN0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073163',6.4,2152,'fr','L\'Incorrigible','Victor Vautier is incorrigible: he\'s in constant motion, working several cons at once, using different names and changing disguises. He\'s charming and outrageous, incapable of uttering a sentence that isn\'t embellished or an outright lie. His life goal is to make enough money to build a sea wall to protect Mont-Saint-Michel. Charlotte, a parole officer, shows up: she\'s young and seems taken in by Victor. He discovers she lives above the Senlus Museum, where her parents are the curators. With two pals he decides to steal a priceless El Greco triptych and then ransom it back to the cultural ministry. What will Charlotte do when she realizes he\'s used her to make a fortune?','/7oebCmYVJvmG7qB46inErLLLJbX.jpg','1975-10-15',100,'Released',NULL,'Incorrigible',61226,2.9072,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6888,_binary '\0','/fBh1T0i1ODGiD8BNcQ4VGfdfTeN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073166',6.1,2972,'fr','India Song','Anne-Marie Stretter, the wife of a French diplomat in 1930s India, takes many lovers to relieve the boredom in her life.','/kCAla6EHtwymFS73o0Gu3lRbGMl.jpg','1975-06-04',115,'Released',NULL,'India Song',85927,1.8717,6.3,'EZUzAmPeCy0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6889,_binary '\0','/jgnD48dvKPGpFybKhiCJuPdByV1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073168',6.3,2540,'zh','中國超人','The surface of the Earth is under attack, thousands of people are killed in this unprovoked attacked. The cause, Princess Dragonmon and her army of monsters have decided to invade. Princess Dragonmon is an alien whose race has been hiding under us for centuries waiting to attack at the time is right. A doctor has been preparing for something like this and turns his assistant Rayma into the cyborg hero known as Inframan. Now only Inframan stands between the Earth and Princess Dragonmon but when a close friend is captured and brainwashed, can she be stopped with this inside man feeding her info?','/jZwmUr0QJRNYEw9XVrRtxkDy0DE.jpg','1975-08-01',90,'Released','The man beyond bionics.','The Super Inframan',40435,2.1837,6.1,'rLlecrotn0Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6890,_binary '\0','/9sev9luDFWVQS9n4XHpnplL1g8i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073169',6.8,2683,'fr','Les innocents aux mains sales','Saint Tropez. Julie Wormser and her lover, writer and neighbour Jeff Marle, plan the murder of her wealthy husband Louis, an alcoholic impotent. She hits him, and leaves the rest of the task to Jeff. Julie finds herself alone the following day, and becomes therefore the prime suspect. Where is Louis\' body? Where is Jeff? Is there any secret beyond a door?','/gzDj29F8pCZI8eZrRG1qgOC9KSh.jpg','1975-03-26',120,'Released','Savage Greed. Searing Sex. Shattering Suspense.','Innocents with Dirty Hands',3479,2.2877,6.213,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6891,_binary '\0','/e9g9qhjcjOjSwoL8cMCtwDPqpMe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073172',6.3,2794,'en','Inserts','A young, once-great Hollywood film director refuses to accept changing times during the early 1930s, and confines himself to his decaying mansion to make silent porn flicks.','/gPBFWOOjZdRXGFGFHMqVot5Kn1O.jpg','1975-02-20',117,'Released','A degenerate film, with dignity.','Inserts',32069,2.3696,5.7,'Omgg4tPtOig','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6892,_binary '\0','/1kShjfoNZe0wTF16jvPaX8OOel1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073179',8,15123,'ru','Ирония судьбы, или С легким паром!','A group of old friends have a tradition of going to a public bathing house on New Year\'s Eve. Occasionally too much vodka and beer makes two of them unconscious. The problem is that one of them (Sasha) has to go to Leningrad but another one (Zhenya) goes. Zhenya wakes up at Leningrad airport. Believing that he is still in Moscow he takes a taxi and goes home. The street name, building and even apartment number, the way an apartment complex looks the same and the key coincide completely - just typical Soviet-type \'economy\' architecture. Imagine the surprise of Nadya when she enters her apartment and finds a man without trousers in her bed. What\'s more - Nadya\'s fiancé also finds him there...','/zlkG0yVVamCyBnLLbD2zOaHMJEz.jpg','1976-01-01',192,'Released',NULL,'The Irony of Fate, or Enjoy Your Bath!',43430,2.2229,7.3,'sDdrTIp8mxs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6893,_binary '\0','/i1yf91svRHX45l9BXL8rVFzLoPH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073195',8.1,749897,'en','Jaws','When the seaside community of Amity finds itself under attack by a dangerous great white shark, the town\'s chief of police, a young marine biologist, and a grizzled shark hunter embark on a desperate quest to kill the beast before it strikes again.','/lxM6kqilAdpdhqUl2biYp5frUxE.jpg','1975-06-20',124,'Released','The terrifying motion picture from the terrifying No. 1 best seller.','Jaws',578,29.139,7.686,'8KxiYWYY3Kw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6894,_binary '\0','/y2nXnRDO5Ni26TdTB9BXuxrOy51.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073196',5.9,2609,'fr','Je t\'aime moi non plus','The petite waitress Johnny works and lives in a truck-stop, where she\'s lonely and longs for love. She develops a crush on the garbage truck driver Krassky, although her sleazy boss Boris warns her that he\'s gay.','/45WJFrBw9fa5mN4YOWlnbylIu5.jpg','1976-03-10',88,'Released',NULL,'I Love You, I Don\'t',4580,2.3384,5.8,'XLSZ38tDG5w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6895,_binary '\0','/2qL6rsvq29ueZ0ITh47Jj2F985R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073198',7.5,17865,'fr','Jeanne Dielman, 23, quai du Commerce, 1080 Bruxelles','A lonely young widow lives with her son following an immutable order: while the boy is in school, she cares for their apartment, does chores, and receives clients in the afternoon.','/fqfSu8Y1YSVFkoCJyiTXI6woYma.jpg','1976-01-21',202,'Released',NULL,'Jeanne Dielman, 23, quai du Commerce, 1080 Bruxelles',44012,3.5286,7.4,'YSRQ_oE-psg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6896,_binary '\0','/zHX28FhOkzxoVbHdaMbHu0k2kPY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073207',7.1,2198,'ja','仁義の墓場','A self-destructive man becomes a powerful member of the yakuza but quickly loses his self-control. Based on the true story of Rikio Ishikawa.','/akDVDztEBt2SZ1StpPWMDMbVlL8.jpg','1975-02-15',94,'Released','Only crows will cry when I die!','Graveyard of Honor',71851,1.9563,6.7,'AddoMpA2lxM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6897,_binary '\0','/aAKUY85PzNJXG4F1WWHfw6TopzG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073219',7.3,2649,'fr','Le Juge et l\'Assassin','France, 1893. Joseph Bouvier attempts to shoot his love who refused to marry him and to commit suicide. Upon release from the filthy asylum where he was placed, with bullets still remaining in his head, he wanders the country roads and rapes and murders many teenagers over years. The judge Rousseau captures him, but to serve his ambition seeks to avoid that Bouvier is simply declared insane.','/2FwFJvyktddFy8eJc9jMmn6efYv.jpg','1976-03-10',128,'Released',NULL,'The Judge and the Assassin',38080,2.0421,6.857,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6898,_binary '\0','/i98WafnsLBmgbFmSl37AmNN46GM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073221',7.2,2659,'fr','Juste avant la nuit','A married man who killed the wife of his best friend during a tryst feels compelled to turn himself in.','/8dWKLlwGMeofbunbVvWfM9lzMdK.jpg','1971-03-31',100,'Released',NULL,'Just Before Nightfall',76200,2.2072,6.528,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6899,_binary '\0','/od0ejkfTarHxh8HLCp6W1O7xi3n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073227',5.8,2411,'sv','Världens bästa Karlsson','Svante is a young boy who lives with his family in a Stockholm apartment. One day he meets Karlsson, a chubby little man in the prime of his life, who can fly using a propeller on his back and who lives in his little house on the roof.','/m02v0kOqAUZKvWecht5it3KZFYE.jpg','1974-12-02',99,'Released',NULL,'Karlsson on the Roof',30576,1.6064,5.9,'0lK00j1JYwA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6900,_binary '\0','/jmBZp22GAoEUoVPEz3fKEIERs6r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073233',6.7,2963,'nl','Keetje Tippel','In the late 19th-century, the Tippel family moves to rural Stavoren in search of greener pastures. However, their dreams are quickly shattered, as teenage Katie is terrorized by a male-dominated society who only see her as an object. Her situation worsens when, following her father\'s sacking and her elder sister\'s descent into alcoholism, her mother decides that, rather than starving, Katie becomes a prostitute.','/2xIaUVAzO5IM7PVOqDGxHbTrUf4.jpg','1975-03-06',102,'Released',NULL,'Katie Tippel',42258,1.8454,6.331,'xze0BQ0K4yI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6901,_binary '\0','/aa7l9RLRlxoZh6qds3ltb8bas5T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073240',5.9,8462,'en','The Killer Elite','Mike Locken is one of the principal members of a group of freelance spies. A significant portion of their work is for the CIA, and while on a case for them one of his friends turns on him and shoots him in the elbow and knee. His assignment, to protect someone, goes down in flames. He is nearly crippled, but with braces is able to again become mobile. For revenge as much as anything else, Mike goes after his ex-friend.','/z1eMj2FxgOBIqAcOIUXAiBIn74K.jpg','1975-12-19',122,'Released','They protect us from the enemy, but who protects us from them?','The Killer Elite',31604,3.0626,5.784,'mTLkEWMk3CY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6902,_binary '\0','/p9dUVuCMDLnlFDJvLNdw5FvYPgv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073260',5.7,8099,'en','The Land That Time Forgot','During World War I, a German U-boat sinks a British passenger ship and takes the survivors aboard. After getting lost in fog, the submarine surfaces near the unknown island of Caprona, a lost world where they find dinosaurs and Neanderthals.','/2Jtm4aP4kj4vHimFfnLqjnm8LqF.jpg','1974-08-13',90,'Released','THE ADVENTURE YOU WILL NEVER FORGET!','The Land That Time Forgot',27085,3.0767,5.7,'wxNhutT6gPQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6903,_binary '\0','/g226mZk7l2BXG4iTgzPEOjdAJbQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073273',7.3,2288,'en','The Legend of Lizzie Borden','A dramatization of the famous 1893 Massachusetts trial of the woman accused of murdering her father and stepmother with an ax.','/xP2zwHbzwe8ys0Jfu00ThzcQjZN.jpg','1975-02-10',96,'Released','Could this woman commit the crime of the century?','The Legend of Lizzie Borden',126706,2.5552,6.917,'_UnVnoSUpZQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6904,_binary '\0','/bwPgr8VqFUBerEAh3WwVSwIYWXu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073282',6.7,3646,'en','Let\'s Do It Again','Clyde Williams and Billy Foster are a couple of blue-collar workers in Atlanta who have promised to raise funds for their fraternal order, the Brothers and Sisters of Shaka. However, their method for raising the money involves travelling to New Orleans and rigging a boxing match.','/wOP0m66lUz75EGUnWNklJjakaCX.jpg','1975-10-11',113,'Released','It\'s the same two dudes from \"Uptown Saturday Night\"...but this time they\'re back with kid dyn-o-mite!','Let\'s Do It Again',29473,2.2946,6.9,'mxPCa3uFu5U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6905,_binary '\0','/6SuOxhp79bAdisY61ItOxqSVgbi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073298',6.1,3441,'en','Lisztomania','In the 19th century, Romantic composer/pianist Franz Liszt tries to end his hedonistic ways but keeps getting sucked back in by his seductive fellow composer Richard Wagner.','/slkgkRL8hu0Sj4sOkcb8NSkwdGd.jpg','1975-10-01',103,'Released','The erotic, exotic electrifying rock fantasy... It out-Tommy\'s TOMMY.','Lisztomania',67298,1.9027,6,'CeglJMCgnuw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6906,_binary '\0','/rJYnygAS5NqyIfCx8WCbJQ8DAkt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073310',7.7,1332,'en','Love Among the Ruins','An aging actress and socialite, Jessica Medlicott has ended her engagement with a younger man and is now being sued by her former fiancé. Esteemed barrister Sir Arthur Glanville-Jones is assigned to represent Jessica in the lawsuit, and he also happens to be an old suitor of hers from decades earlier. While Jessica claims not to remember him, and Arthur still smarts from her earlier rejection, the two form a close bond during the case.','/8aVb0GgTFYse3A8NwT75rLW4kzO.jpg','1976-04-12',100,'Released',NULL,'Love Among the Ruins',115507,1.8459,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6907,_binary '\0','/pgtHrfRnVpOWbiGYFVoHM3E9rN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073312',7.6,44201,'en','Love and Death','In czarist Russia, a neurotic soldier and his distant cousin formulate a plot to assassinate Napoleon.','/oJXFd1UHZoOQ1UtoLxbyBLGJDox.jpg','1975-06-10',85,'Released','The Comedy Sensation of the Year!','Love and Death',11686,3.947,7.4,'Nrf3X89aDhk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6908,_binary '\0','/byFvyxWDBcv6IhhLubSKREX4WiD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073317',5.3,1518,'en','Lucky Lady','When an American booze smuggler gets murdered in Prohibition-era Mexico, his widow, a nightclub singer, joins forces with her lover and a desperate loner to become rum-runners to the U.S.','/ZqXvQXzOGFBNP674rA5xrI6J23.jpg','1975-12-25',118,'Released',NULL,'Lucky Lady',78353,2.6796,5.6,'Yzpph_x-40c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6909,_binary '\0','/yf5DcibduoVkY5WDp4zd3RhII9Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073324',5.9,2684,'fr','Lèvres de sang','Frédéric sees a photograph of a ruined seaside castle, which triggers a strange childhood memory. He then goes on a strange quest, aided by four female vampires, to find the castle and the beautiful woman who lives there.','/KpdGQiCQfBUpGqMRZ9RvOtCYw.jpg','1975-05-17',88,'Released',NULL,'Lips of Blood',29128,1.6071,5.8,'Um1h2zQVQNg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6910,_binary '\0','/v4jXfcEpN0O9Lflb6Hmb9mhdJur.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073327',5.9,2361,'it','Macchie solari','A series of random suicides in Rome, Italy are attributed to a heatwave, but a young pathologist named Simona—who is working on a thesis about murders disguised as suicides—suspects otherwise. When a young girl associated with Simona\'s playboy father ends up dead in another supposed suicide, Simona teams up with the girl\'s priest brother to prove she was murdered and track down the unknown serial killer.','/o3XWyyQccWDy40hJJ4O9twA5f4D.jpg','1975-01-18',100,'Released','It\'ll take you... apart!','Autopsy',96167,1.5419,6,'JDMr-iryM0E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6911,_binary '\0','/kVzP2Hju0sjNCROGHk11bGpKhfc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073335',6.2,2616,'en','Mahogany','An aspiring designer from the slums of Chicago puts herself through fashion school in the hopes of becoming one of the world\'s top designers. Her ambition leads her to Rome spurring a choice between the man she loves or her newfound success.','/rHnquMeqgzXOkk2qckWPY1cyvuL.jpg','1975-10-08',109,'Released','Mahogany – the woman every woman wants to be – and every man wants to have','Mahogany',3554,1.2773,5.9,'us_A18e7rr0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6912,_binary '\0','/1Jgefbg5cKfCrppNbP0nPJm2TdR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073341',7.7,55983,'en','The Man Who Would Be King','Tired of life as soldiers, Peachy Carnehan and Danny Dravot travel to the isolated land of Kafiristan, where they are ultimately embraced by the people and revered as rulers. After a series of misunderstandings, the natives come to believe that Dravot is a god, but he and Carnehan can\'t keep up their deception forever.','/1FCpHiZSez9iaLpDmvyrNt9lBua.jpg','1975-12-03',129,'Released','Adventure in all its glory!','The Man Who Would Be King',983,4.904,7.5,'pJA9HIPbERk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6913,_binary '\0','/gYEPqXoNwfAC4CCpEI18mhfu9go.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073343',6.6,2214,'en','The Man from Hong Kong','Australian authorities arrest a man believed to be connected to the Sydney criminal underworld and send for Inspector Fang Sing Leng from Hong Kong to question him. After the alleged criminal is assassinated, Inspector Leng and the Sydney police try to hunt down those responsible and hope to solve their case along the way.','/lCLUFxMNxcutYcSXbMySWDJvAUd.jpg','1975-07-31',106,'Released','Fast! Fantastic! Fun! Nothing can stop him!','The Man from Hong Kong',21990,3.4502,6.645,'fS-wUJv2AqU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6914,_binary '\0','/4NWQO30ZES5Ma1SSFF859q9APpC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073345',7,1837,'en','The Man in the Glass Booth','Arthur Goldman is a rich Jewish industrialist, living in luxury in a Manhattan high-rise. He banters with his assistant Charlie, often shocking him with his outrageousness and irreverent musings on aspects of Jewish life. Nonetheless, Charlie is astonished one day when Israeli secret agents burst in and arrest Goldman for being a Nazi war criminal. Whisked to Israel for trial, Goldman forces his accusers to face, not only his presumed guilt, but their own.','/hl3kNLxWpUatLAgWE8jSH7c7Be4.jpg','1975-01-27',117,'Released','The kidnapping... The masquerade... The murder trial... Perhaps the most suspenseful shocker of our time.','The Man in the Glass Booth',48364,2.2416,6.15,'2fIe_TeKtQw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6915,_binary '\0','/vf5xvKEjwhSuJttR4NmVrOGXyrS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073349',6.5,4743,'en','Mandingo','Warren Maxwell, the owner of a run-down plantation, pressures his son, Hammond, to marry and produce an heir to inherit the plantation. Hammond settles on his own cousin, Blanche, but purchases a sex slave when he returns from the honeymoon. He also buys his father a new Mandingo slave named Mede to breed and train as a prize-fighter.','/bZXmb4HQt24OAzdKoBdSEqcFvBw.jpg','1975-06-06',127,'Released','Expect The Savage. The Sensual. The Shocking. The Sad. The Powerful. The Shameful. Expect The Truth.','Mandingo',38027,4.7359,6.6,'1priqpSfjvY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6916,_binary '\0','/nu5kvLgnLwhdG7l2tJu3Z6ahjCW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073363',7.8,3330,'tl','Maynila sa mga Kuko ng Liwanag','Julio, a young fisherman from a provincial village, descends into social alienation as he arrives in Manila to search for his loved one.','/iFM8bcQnyBPlzd0JItgWNn6TjT2.jpg','1975-07-16',127,'Released',NULL,'Manila in the Claws of Light',70580,2.3948,7.4,'27qwaj9143Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6917,_binary '\0','/1Vbf2asuzZqaYUBoTLliI2aP3QP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073373',6.1,6767,'ja','メカゴジラの逆襲','A submarine expedition to salvage the remains of Mechagodzilla is thwarted by a massive dinosaur named Titanosaurus. An Interpol investigation leads biologist Ichinose to uncover the work of Dr. Mafune and his mysterious daughter Katsura. Aligned with the Black Hole Aliens, Katsura\'s life becomes entwined with the resurrected machine.','/kHBJNwdxTJ4ub01bWg6WFpS3WF2.jpg','1975-03-15',83,'Released','Ogres from a black hole in space use monsters to seize Earth!','Terror of Mechagodzilla',19333,3.0247,6.8,'zU9bKEF9zpQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6918,_binary '\0','/tJo7fsNhfWVzSH1ztPhrs0iytLH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073391',7.4,1568,'hi','Mili','Shekhar is new to the block and it doesn\'t take long before the street noise and the children playing nearby push his tolerance to the limit. To the rescue comes Mili, who has the exact opposite disposition. While Shekhar may be at a loss over what to do with her at first, he eventually falls in love.','/iYklpvGph1FDCmKvVHg3rOzvc5m.jpg','1975-06-20',115,'Released',NULL,'Mili',199798,1.9177,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6919,_binary '\0','/btCHqzjZgzggZ5k1mHx5Sq8t8kC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073396',2.8,5079,'en','Mitchell','A tough-guy cop pursues two drug runners across the city to bust a large syndicate. Very much an anti-hero, Mitchell often ignores the orders of his superiors and demonstrates disdain for by-the-book development work as well as normal social graces.','/14Afu2In8RPbdhTacNJl5kRechp.jpg','1975-09-10',97,'Released','Brute Force With a Badge','Mitchell',32303,1.4178,3.3,'3RMqsRe-BxM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6920,_binary '\0','/dPLrBGjGGf0YUD8wpSIDu42Woqw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073406',6.5,2076,'it','Morte sospetta di una minorenne','Police detective Paolo Germi and the mysterious Marisa meet each other at a dance hall. Germi is unsuspecting of the secret Marisa is carrying with her: adverse conditions forced her into prostitution. As Germi finds the young girl brutally murdered, he decides to go after her killers. During his investigation, he enters a world of intrigue and obfuscation that leave an endless trail of blood.','/xqEbdB77oZ9k53WVhj3gaKuY2Uj.jpg','1975-08-12',100,'Released',NULL,'The Suspicious Death of a Minor',80067,1.9984,6.062,'avk238636f4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6921,_binary '\0','/yaHKeQKl6ECVXRd4jPLYVOEINmP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073424',7.5,2532,'de','Mutter Küsters\' Fahrt zum Himmel','Frau Emma Küsters prepares dinner late one seemingly-ordinary afternoon in her seemingly-ordinary Frankfurt kitchen. She wants to add canned sausages to the stew; her irritating daughter-in-law thinks otherwise. But the point is moot: Ernst Küsters has not only murdered the personnel director at the soap factory where he\'s employed but succeeded that by committing suicide.','/9xnA40LULMD2VQb2hFql2vHEeje.jpg','1975-07-07',108,'Released',NULL,'Mother Küsters Goes to Heaven',42260,1.7016,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6922,_binary '\0','/rNQQwQC31qXv1cbNGdKMLgubNHZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073438',7.8,2159,'en','The Naked Civil Servant','Story of the life of Quentin Crisp, an Englishman who was brave enough to live his life according to his own style even in the hostile days of WW2.','/bdKnysyR5WLkbr335Uti8FF9OJQ.jpg','1975-12-17',77,'Released','Never keep up with the Jonses. Drag them down to your level. It\'s cheaper.','The Naked Civil Servant',40950,2.5725,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6923,_binary '\0','/lHH8o3YWBjoteijAI8yTxG3qqpX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073440',7.6,31846,'en','Nashville','The intersecting stories of twenty-four characters—from country star to wannabe to reporter to waitress—and their connection through the music business in Nashville, Tennessee.','/twl4ovyjb8muFKvZmcCDzPR0hy1.jpg','1975-06-11',160,'Released','The damndest thing you ever saw.','Nashville',3121,4.7413,7.261,'Ty3oclCA-uM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6924,_binary '\0','/Api3ej14ucvcRsqz89YS6IQe954.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073442',7.6,2647,'ru','Не может быть!','The film includes three short stories based on the stories of Mikhail Zoshchenko: \"Crime and Punishment\", \"Fun Adventure\", and \"Wedding Event\" about the negative phenomena of the provincial life of the young country of the Soviets: stupidity, drunkenness, money-grubbing, lack of spirituality.','/rmxoa3hYcQxweULdO34BRoViqss.jpg','1975-10-23',92,'Released',NULL,'It Can\'t Be!',42275,1.3957,7.323,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6925,_binary '\0','/l4GA8NJ7wTxWI9K3ioF9MsDTy6e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073449',7.2,1226,'en','The New Original Wonder Woman','After a dogfight with a German plane, U.S. Army Air Force pilot Steve Trevor crash lands on an uncharted island in the Bermuda Triangle. Paradise Island is inhabited only by women, and their existence has been kept a secret for thousands of years. Learning of the Nazi German threat to humanity, the Amazon princess Diana is chosen to accompany Trevor back to the United States to battle the Third Reich. Garbed in a skimpy red, white, and blue costume and armed with a magic lasso that forces anyone within its grasp to tell the truth, Diana uses her powers as Wonder Woman to battle the forces of evil.','/qd77sab7cFvIas1ckCrz1CC6sUe.jpg','1975-11-07',74,'Released',NULL,'The New Original Wonder Woman',1610155,1.6722,10,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6926,_binary '\0','/bXZhQAI5Gm06QtN7Kj6JHIuSzc5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073453',7.1,21696,'en','Night Moves','Private detective and former football player Harry Moseby gets hired on to what seems a standard missing person case - a former Hollywood actress wants Moseby to find and return her daughter. Harry travels to Florida to find her, but he begins to see a connection between the runaway girl, the world of Hollywood stuntmen, and a suspicious mechanic when an unsolved murder comes to light.','/j3zMCyvhGlpw31BAWLVMEZNPfOX.jpg','1975-06-11',100,'Released','Maybe he would find the girl... maybe he would find himself.','Night Moves',32042,4.4328,6.7,'6iP6ugUiM4Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6927,_binary '\0','/t0WcfR1H9icGIg43LErKrg3wKy1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073461',5.7,2504,'es','La noche de las gaviotas','A bizarre cult that practices a ritual of sacrificing humans terrorizes a young doctor and his wife, who have just moved to the group\'s village.','/bYY7VvVYFRxyej5w9FFUjidWRiP.jpg','1975-08-11',89,'Released','Their Pagan God has Given his Command: 7 Nights, 7 Victims, 7 Human Hearts!','Night of the Seagulls',28071,1.9808,5.6,'XqGKLuGbn3A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6928,_binary '\0','/rnjMuuCNtaRl60YOpmY6UQ5SYKM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073470',5.6,3800,'it','Nude per l\'assassino','After a fashion model dies during a botched abortion, the doctor stages her death to exonerate himself but is murdered by a mysterious assailant who soon begins hunting down her agency colleagues.','/a9TEsOIljW3RBt2HScE3NXNUQTB.jpg','1975-08-24',98,'Released','Welcome to the Slashwalk!','Strip Nude for Your Killer',11226,2.978,5.494,'7n7_EOJJJ9o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6929,_binary '\0','/jUxguvT04U9aDxTcHWGuTMOXcK2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073482',7.3,2420,'da','Olsen-banden på sporet','Egon and his two cronies managed to sneak a fortune with them to Spain. Here they live a life in a whirl of pleasures, but they are not truly happy. While Egon always has the money chained to him, Bøffen still manages to steal them. Egon ends up in jail once again, and when he comes out, he has a brilliant plan.','/mQgsDUzKRQ6cX9vfXcvLWhjJpWl.jpg','1975-09-26',100,'Released',NULL,'The Olsen Gang on the Track',11391,2.0404,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6930,_binary '\0','/uA8eSNAUUUyfHNIrG4h0zHxzt9W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073486',8.6,1166933,'en','One Flew Over the Cuckoo\'s Nest','A petty criminal fakes insanity to serve his sentence in a mental ward rather than prison. He soon finds himself as a leader to the other patients—and an enemy to the cruel, domineering nurse who runs the ward.','/kjWsMh72V6d8KRLV4EOoSJLT1H7.jpg','1975-11-19',135,'Released','In this clean, orderly, disciplined world, who needs guys like McMurphy? Everybody.','One Flew Over the Cuckoo\'s Nest',510,21.8753,8.405,'3NSVJlBeGBA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6931,_binary '\0','/6GWatVM3dqOFqPhPOn2iw9uD4G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073488',7.7,3678,'ru','Они сражались за Родину','In July 1942, in the Second World War, the rearguard of the Russian army protects the bridgehead of the Don River against the German army while the retreating Russian troops cross the bridge. While they move back to the Russian territory through the countryside, the soldiers show their companionship, sentiments, fears and heroism to defend their motherland.','/6TI2mup2pB37qbo5aa75FI84h3E.jpg','1975-11-05',151,'Released',NULL,'They Fought for Their Motherland',86382,1.7804,6.963,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6932,_binary '\0','/bqKivYkj8empKPtCWe0MeHER3RA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073496',6.4,1468,'en','The Other Side of the Mountain','One year before the Olympics, Jill Kinmont, an 18-year-old skiing champion, suffers a fall during competition and is left paralyzed. With her life now completely altered, she undergoes an exhausting fight to regain some of what she has lost.','/eikUqnTC2DxVCZGwEUiuNzFpQVk.jpg','1975-11-14',103,'Released',NULL,'The Other Side of the Mountain',86233,1.8373,6.3,'uiDFIprlnIc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6933,_binary '\0','/8ejC2EQpMxAAOFHzrEZ4ZpoOuPx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073502',7.1,3799,'en','Overlord','During World War II, a young man is called up and, with an increasing sense of foreboding, undertakes his army training ready for D-Day, June 6th, 1944.','/2bpWZ9RwFRUwtu86v1v60p6QuYR.jpg','1975-07-01',83,'Released','Code name, D-Day, June 6th 1944','Overlord',55343,1.9123,6.796,'J7TJea3S160','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6934,_binary '\0','/ufOOBCOyZbCp6xNYiDH3Zwz5f96.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073535',6.9,4985,'fr','Peur sur la ville','A serial-killer frightens Paris by phoning young ladies at night, telling them insults about their lives. Minos, as he calls himself, wants to prevent the world from free women and he targets at first these ones. Commissaire Letellier is given the investigation and he has hard work with the maniac.','/c6GSsxdP7OqpV67724sNivK2GWL.jpg','1975-04-09',125,'Released',NULL,'The Night Caller',40180,3.2906,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6935,_binary '\0','/41Mlaj6wfjlF4wQaVH0tjfDXvMi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073540',7.3,46577,'en','Picnic at Hanging Rock','In the early 1900s, Miranda attends a girls boarding school in Australia. One Valentine\'s Day, the school\'s typically strict headmistress treats the girls to a picnic field trip to an unusual but scenic volcanic formation called Hanging Rock. Despite rules against it, Miranda and several other girls venture off. It\'s not until the end of the day that the faculty realizes the girls and one of the teachers have disappeared mysteriously.','/7BAXwmFN4pZDNb9N6kzmAAwdssi.jpg','1975-09-02',107,'Released','On St. Valentine\'s Day in 1900 a party of schoolgirls set out to picnic at Hanging Rock…Some were never to return.','Picnic at Hanging Rock',11020,4.0394,7.2,'CFtQMzXZZQs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6936,_binary '\0','/2GK6KVgIAKrqjqg9VPAm5qdOly.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073541',6.4,3969,'it','Piedone a Hong Kong','Inspector Rizzo is accused of drug trafficking. In order to clear his name he has to find out who is the person, from a Mafia ring, who has infiltrated his police department.','/pQuv3NrVxFFAtkVrcoHtNM8qHSt.jpg','1975-03-28',108,'Released',NULL,'Flatfoot in Hong Kong',11053,3.2505,6.2,'atuJJstERBU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6937,_binary '\0','/oGmjtyXNIjVAKjIv9EXYHQFjxHh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073559',6.5,2810,'en','Posse','A tough marshal with political ambitions leads an elite posse to capture a notorious train robber and his gang.','/vmgcz6KtHeRwAz60S3hPGNweItS.jpg','1975-06-04',92,'Released','\"Posse\" begins like most Westerns. It ends like none of them. It will knock you off your horse.','Posse',45874,2.8078,6.06,'zHqqgfjJQsw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6938,_binary '\0','/rSGv6akiaJZ97mdDVl8S7WJmfRC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073570',7.5,2710,'ru','Приключения Буратино','A wooden boy Buratino tries to find his place in life. He befriends toys from a toy theater owned by evil Karabas-Barabas, gets tricked by Alice the Fox and Basilio the Cat and finally discovers the mystery of a golden key given to him by kind Tortila the Tortoise.','/mQa6Trm7n5vDF5kNwRqCCAT8Vgz.jpg','1976-01-01',132,'Released',NULL,'The Adventures of Buratino',20899,2.8373,6.7,'YndqBTbMzRE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6939,_binary '\0','/9H64mSSezN1T9CQKgbgV06BCZM4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073580',7.4,29220,'it','Professione: reporter','David Locke is a world-weary American journalist who has been sent to cover a conflict in northern Africa, but he makes little progress with the story. When he discovers the body of a stranger who looks similar to him, Locke assumes the dead man\'s identity. However, he soon finds out that the man was an arms dealer, leading Locke into dangerous situations. Aided by a beautiful woman, Locke attempts to avoid both the police and criminals out to get him.','/A8jYH43plz70dNmHy82zAHGTqxN.jpg','1975-02-28',126,'Released','I used to be somebody else...but I traded him in.','The Passenger',9652,3.446,7.2,'fkA5YIzrAmI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6940,_binary '\0','/nIl67C3sKQ68y1kVxuDTLXBJqYX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073582',7.5,46786,'it','Profondo rosso','An English pianist living in Rome witnesses the brutal murder of his psychic neighbor. With the help of a tenacious young reporter, he tries to discover the killer using very unconventional methods. The two are soon drawn into a shocking web of dementia and violence.','/wq7RxV5gMvgO0EKeWpNhegnpJBh.jpg','1975-03-07',127,'Released','When was the last time you were really scared?','Deep Red',20126,4.993,7.7,'cjvuQcoFpz8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6941,_binary '','/2achxS5ubWPB5b7ybGaXj6hBAhM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073589',6.2,2085,'en','The Image','Jean discovers that Anne cannot get enough of being humiliated by her mistress, Claire. Gentleman that he is, he decides to partake in the activities. Ultimately, Claire surrenders to him as well.','/xnvcCMZ4q1veik89cKX5E3iTAHg.jpg','1975-09-10',89,'Released','Beyond The Story of O!','The Image',67018,0,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6942,_binary '\0','/i6Xty6GN05CL4DJQx1PqQZlFM2J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073594',6.3,3376,'it','I quattro dell\'apocalisse','Four petty criminals, three men and a woman, wander through the trackless terrain of the Wild West Utah and are hounded by a sadistic bandit.','/fXuIo8Qn3he4QRDQPWI3HDxx6Sf.jpg','1975-08-12',104,'Released',NULL,'Four of the Apocalypse',48855,4.5717,6.4,'8vv6bprjacw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6943,_binary '\0','/qseiYNSkexOGoRJsfohA1NEojK2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073600',6.6,8387,'en','Race with the Devil','Two couples vacationing together in an R.V. from Texas to Colorado are terrorized after they witness a murder during a Satanic ritual.','/4ezD93ytLd8707j3Qvg53Mpz5ff.jpg','1975-06-01',88,'Released','If you\'re going to race with the devil, you\'ve got to be as fast as Hell!','Race with the Devil',32051,3.6208,6.41,'DbKpXL-E8mg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6944,_binary '\0','/9HZA7WVJTd2qYPFfkugxOR0Cu7p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073605',6.3,2478,'en','Rancho Deluxe','Two drifters, of widely varying backgrounds, rustle cattle and try to avoid being caught in contemporary Montana.','/4YiawzqRAQZ6BdPLJfvzFFxm18k.jpg','1975-03-14',93,'Released','Oh give me a home, with a low interest loan, A cowgirl and two pickup trucks. A color TV, all the beer should be free, And that, man, is Rancho Deluxe.','Rancho Deluxe',42261,1.874,5.3,'t7G5wYYgtqU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6945,_binary '\0','/trOTeuZ0pFDNg1CsgvFTP7r3fAU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073615',6.4,2615,'en','The Reincarnation of Peter Proud','When college professor, Peter Proud begins experiencing flashbacks of an earlier life, he\'s mysteriously drawn to a place he\'s never been to, but which seems familiar and where he soon finds his previous incarnation\'s wife.','/2LwL6rOnJeKbV6i3UM539MoE2Vs.jpg','1975-04-25',105,'Released','Suppose you knew who you had been in your previous life. Where you had lived...whom you had loved and how you had died. What then?','The Reincarnation of Peter Proud',101422,2.1709,5.8,'KV9SDUMTYH4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6946,_binary '\0','/nOxgQ9wI2YYPf2UswEeE0whXVDM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073620',6.7,1566,'en','Report to the Commissioner','Police officer Patty Butler, alias \"Chicklet,\" is the live-in girlfriend of Thomas \'Stick\' Henderson to gather evidence. Detective Bo Lockley is instructed to try to find her, not knowing she\'s also a cop.','/k0G33xOTiu4TTGmsRt0basMSck7.jpg','1975-02-05',112,'Released','No One Knew She Was An Undercover Policewoman. Including The Detective Who Killed Her.','Report to the Commissioner',42262,2.2078,6.6,'quW2pSOOclA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6947,_binary '\0','/jeE852WunFBZg9hdSLths1deUeR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073623',6.3,2584,'ja','殺人拳２','Martial artist Takuma Tsurugi returns to take on a Yakuza family that may be embezzling money from charities to finance their own operations. Both the police and the Yakuza find themselves battling Tsurugi, but Tsurugi\'s fight ultimately is with the mob, and he concentrates on them.','/7JnWHCgLmpKEkdCdAZZQnLS2CjE.jpg','1974-04-27',83,'Released','The incredible Sonny Chiba is back! And he\'s meaner than ever!','Return of the Street Fighter',40812,1.5135,6.1,'2AvBMz9lokk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6948,_binary '\0','/AdzgsJAtec8eGLsbTp1dZ1qeQfG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073626',6.9,2586,'it','Revolver','An Italian prison official\'s wife is kidnapped, and the kidnappers demand that a notorious prisoner be released in order for the man to get his wife back. He gets the man released - but then kidnaps him himself, in order to ensure that the man\'s colleagues don\'t kill his wife. Enraged, the gang sets out to free their compatriot and kill the man who took him.','/pXCblJ5ucPV9KC1lhVCHqkchGkz.jpg','1973-09-27',110,'Released','The last battle between crime and the law in every major city in the world.','Revolver',4788,1.83,6.811,'IXtPhNQ33xU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6949,_binary '\0','/54aVU7tnvDKkX6ibzFg6ke03BV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073629',7.4,187918,'en','The Rocky Horror Picture Show','After getting a flat tire in the middle of nowhere, newly engaged couple Brad and Janet encounter the eerie mansion of the flamboyant, seductive Dr Frank-N-Furter and a variety of eccentric characters. Through elaborate dance and rock music, the mad scientist unveils his latest creation: a perfect, muscular man.','/3pyE6ZqDbuJi7zrNzzQzcKTWdmN.jpg','1975-08-14',100,'Released','A different set of jaws.','The Rocky Horror Picture Show',36685,10.9392,7.443,'4plqh6obZW4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6950,_binary '\0','/qV4zzpe4mfXnmFIOL6uugnUcM9R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073631',6.5,32794,'en','Rollerball','In a corporate-controlled future, an ultra-violent sport known as Rollerball represents the world, and one of its powerful athletes is out to defy those who want him out of the game.','/cmcipEfexlhVLYQXqeSWp1YcsPY.jpg','1975-06-25',125,'Released','In the not-too-distant future, wars will no longer exist. But there WILL be...The Game','Rollerball',11484,4.3969,6.266,'yku2CXuKKiU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6951,_binary '\0','/ncjxkqmOhep4AMQejTxbBRE2Okn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073634',6.1,1641,'en','The Romantic Englishwoman','A marriage crisis between a writer and his wife leads her to flee to Germany and eventually return with another man, through whom the writer is going to overcome his writer\'s block.','/wMqiH1N4rCEyGy0pLQvnt5iuyul.jpg','1975-06-11',116,'Released','The conflict of a love triangle','The Romantic Englishwoman',42266,1.7552,5.4,'neyzq0oEtCI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6952,_binary '\0','/gswGHqD14zzAR00qXUCeu6q9dod.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073636',6.8,14631,'en','Rooster Cogburn','After a band of drunken thugs overruns a small Indian Nation town, killing Reverend Goodnight and raping the women folk, Eula Goodnight enlists the aid of US Marshal Cogburn to hunt them down and bring her father\'s killers to justice.','/6R3X6KpHd70dI3LS22ZG5Rn422V.jpg','1975-11-01',108,'Released','The man of \"True Grit\" is back and look who\'s got him!','Rooster Cogburn',17538,3.8464,6.433,'BVfzM5CqhoY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6953,_binary '\0','/f5aTDiCddS8GVQQSzkEVpX5w7Ra.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073639',6.3,2301,'en','Royal Flash','Cowardly rogue Harry Flashman\'s (Malcolm McDowell) schemes to gain entry to the royal circles of 19th-century Europe go nowhere until he meets a pair of devious nobles with their own agenda. At their urging, Flashman agrees to re-create himself as a bogus Prussian nobleman to woo a beautiful duchess. But the half-baked plan quickly comes unraveled, and he\'s soon on the run from several new enemies who are all calling for the rapscallion\'s head.','/2IYuVuPSQodlfubbPs0yXJMexVm.jpg','1975-10-10',102,'Released','See Capt. Harry Flashman surrender his way to victory!','Royal Flash',54302,1.5631,5.9,'eLDBW7N02JU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6954,_binary '\0','/jw0waVQ4wpP4u1CLBiW8q5SIY10.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073640',6.6,5087,'en','Rudolph\'s Shiny New Year','Rudolph must find Happy, the baby new year, before the midnight of New Year\'s Eve.','/v4T0lazUxH5yBjzG5jL90RjXJGB.jpg','1976-12-10',50,'Released',NULL,'Rudolph\'s Shiny New Year',30059,2.0558,6.4,'TTASHUb3Evc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6955,_binary '\0','/wP1wgntZ6VIja8hprxV6UKdQugk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073650',5.8,73982,'it','Salò o le 120 giornate di Sodoma','Four corrupted fascist libertines round up 9 teenage boys and girls and subject them to 120 days of sadistic physical, mental and sexual torture.','/xnaDdiRfZlJaTf6JRc4in40eaeI.jpg','1976-01-10',117,'Released','The final vision of a controversial filmmaker.','Salò, or the 120 Days of Sodom',5336,6.6084,6.3,'0o2ul-UwOvU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6956,_binary '\0','/A25oVKZqKmKobsZHmj4q7mxBDzg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073662',5.9,1683,'en','Satan\'s Triangle','The female survivor of a shipwreck and two Coast Guard helicopter pilots sent to rescue her find themselves trapped in a mysterious part of the ocean known as Satan\'s Triangle.','/nzrBT5JrxA2bgljMxtlFdfu24fc.jpg','1975-01-14',74,'Released','A tale of mounting terror!','Satan\'s Triangle',87895,2.2685,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6957,_binary '\0','/AwjFxdmOkmdWRyCSDAK1JsI9j0y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073663',6.5,2462,'fr','Le Sauvage','A young Frenchwoman fleeing her Italian fiancé in Caracas thrusts herself and those around her into madcap events.','/9vMKQhHeFRSHC3QmzxVlALrnwJ.jpg','1975-11-26',107,'Released',NULL,'Lovers Like Us',76829,1.9815,6.577,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6958,_binary '\0','/oB53g2c26eg9TqxaTyHPQt5xYkh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073679',7.6,1919,'fr','Section spéciale','In Nazi-occupied France, a German officer is assassinated. The Germans demand justice, and the Vichy government is quick to capitulate. Unable to apprehend the actual culprits, Minister of Justice Joseph Barthélémy decides the execution of token Frenchmen will suffice, but the problem is finding judges and jurors eager to participate in a sham trial of innocent men. The solution is a Special Section, a court comprised of individuals handpicked for this exact purpose.','/rRko0kzrm3Z3o7saQA9kFo4fVo7.jpg','1975-04-23',110,'Released',NULL,'Special Section',79921,1.446,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6959,_binary '\0','/p0kpsv7ooxBId90MOECFV3TG5mE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073691',5,1566,'fr','La Honte de la jungle','Shame, the ape man of the jungle, is aghast when his woman, June, is kidnapped by a gang of giant penises. They take her to their queen, Bazunga, a bald woman with fourteen breasts. After tangling with a gang of great white hunters, a marauding lion and the Molar Men, Shame sets off to rescue her with only his faithful friend Flicka at his side. He heads for that darkest of areas','/l2rBrqaIGaMPPCkkdSItkpViyA.jpg','1975-09-04',68,'Released','First, there was \"Fritz, he Cat\"... Then, \"Heavy Traffic\"... And now The Funniest Adult Cartoon Ever!','Tarzoon: Shame of the Jungle!',50237,2.6418,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6960,_binary '\0','/2sDMMLK2A1aHh52abYRnzlTBy6t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073692',6.4,16128,'en','Shampoo','On Election Day, 1968, irresponsible hairdresser and ladies\' man George Roundy is too busy cutting hair and dealing with his girlfriends and mistress Felicia Karpf, whose husband Lester is having an affair with his ex-girlfriend Jackie.','/6jmFvXPV6OhtX3AkAVnH7rwdeUJ.jpg','1975-02-11',110,'Released','Your hairdresser does it better.','Shampoo',31121,3.4805,6,'NzjggCHJSF4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6961,_binary '\0','/napIGh92wPx02zsZTQgAJvFsKVE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073694',6,2326,'zh','少林門','A young monk must face the Extended Iron Claw technique of a powerful warlord seeking to destroy Shaolin.','/sbfkPstyOmJrxuL1CNBEWaHUbCN.jpg','1976-07-15',97,'Released','The hand of death strikes in 18 mysterious ways!','Hand of Death',38099,2.7397,6.611,'9lr4KPO2qGI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6962,_binary '\0','/uNexIq6VpyC3WjCFINdIQewc3tS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073697',5.7,2297,'en','Sheba, Baby','Sheba, a Chicago private detective returns back home to Louisville, Kentucky, to help her father fight mobsters.','/f1EWm3EoomLEMBJqIZzq61O0GBx.jpg','1975-03-26',90,'Released','Queen of the Private Eyes','Sheba, Baby',34459,2.2685,5.7,'1M7u156tzSo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6963,_binary '\0','/hKhsgLfJlIQVa88dZWR7kIEwgbI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073705',6.3,26538,'en','Shivers','The residents of a suburban high-rise apartment building are infected by parasites that turn them into mindless nymphomaniac fiends.','/5RUS0Amu2i1AljRz1P74XsTJlmy.jpg','1975-05-16',88,'Released','Being Terrified is Just the Beginning!','Shivers',27429,3.8094,6.4,'mQxcOJ0yEoY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6964,_binary '\0','/mUAvhPWY4r7O32txXa7VvzKMrhJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073707',8.1,63935,'hi','शोले','After his family is slain by notorious bandit Gabbar Singh, former Inspector Thakur Baldev Singh enlists low-level outlaws Jai and Veeru to capture Gabbar and seek revenge.','/ya9bwgqA4eNl5bQ9QqS0jcmRoBS.jpg','1975-08-15',208,'Released','The greatest cast ever assembled! The greatest story ever told!','Sholay',12259,2.8445,7.1,'RDY97iu1_q8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6965,_binary '\0','/in4QrkTbOtgL7XJLiDst88DJqul.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073714',6.4,1819,'ja','女必殺拳','Li Mansei is a martial-arts champion turned undercover agent. When he is captured by a drug lord, his sister Li Koryu turns to his former martial-arts school, including the powerful Sonny Kawasaka, for help in the inevitable battle royale.','/3pDkPHMqSXA69jU4yX3Wt305X8V.jpg','1974-08-31',86,'Released','He\'s a one man army. She\'s a one woman death squad.','Sister Street Fighter',47313,1.9003,6.7,'PyrhoifgbnQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6966,_binary '\0','/cRlC47BVF8PjfpXlNdcuW3zefu4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073720',6.2,1426,'sv','Släpp fångarne loss - det är vår!','Small and short Frida lives with her long, tall friend in a house in the countryside. Frida rejects the idea that people who have committed crimes should be locked up. One day their own house is burgled by Harald. He is sentenced to prison. Acting in accordance with her philosophy, Frida decides to use all means possible to make it possible for Harald to escape.','/aPpMA3RbUqcnDLYZlA37AfkHG3y.jpg','1975-12-06',97,'Released',NULL,'Release the Prisoners to Spring!',129467,1.3297,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000');
INSERT INTO `movies` VALUES (6967,_binary '\0','/dQabL85QJgk9xNxyP5GtV5z5v62.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073722',7.1,2804,'en','Smile','It\'s time again for California\'s \"Young American Miss\" beauty pageant, the biggest event of the year for Big Bob Freelander and Brenda DiCarlo, who give their all to put on a successful pageant. But Brenda is having marital difficulties and Bob\'s son is up to some mischief. Could this year\'s pageant be in jeopardy?','/vyeOUnl9A0RaLft6JL0tyMfBhsA.jpg','1975-07-09',113,'Released','This beauty pageant\'s about to get ugly.','Smile',42264,2.5103,6.011,'tbdKZQcxKYM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6968,_binary '\0','/13sya73SzhMgv639SZagCgmhkPz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073726',6.2,2326,'it','Il soldato di ventura','Medieval soldier of fortune Ettore is traveling through Europe with his partners looking for a fight where they can earn some money. When they come across a Spanish castle under siege by the French army, Ettore bides his time to determine which side is the winning one. This is at first the French, but the treatment he receives from them is unpleasant enough to make him change his mind and turn to the Spanish side. Somehow, Ettore must rally the weakened Spanish troops to battle their enemy long enough for reinforcements to arrive.','/izvk5EXAcpCDKDGAJAmPMVph27v.jpg','1976-02-19',95,'Released','Once a soldier, always a soldier!','Soldier of Fortune',11813,2.3775,6.3,'iLxoLy96cPk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6969,_binary '\0','/tmneS6Xh1gz7BnLOgNYQl2xzbJ7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073743',7.9,1422,'ru','Старший сын','Two students are late for the last commuter train and have to spend a night in a strange town. They rack their brains about where to find shelter and quite by chance they overhear a talk between father and son. The son is an adolescent who is head over heels in love with a girl several years his senior. He is living through the first drama of his life though his love is just puppy love. Then, being resourceful fellows, they think of a plan to pass one of them for the elder son of this family. The reason they give for his unexpected arrival is that he is a child of the father\'s long-forsaken love. They presume this cock-and-bull story will come off, and right they are!','/nigRHI7YOr50HXRQeG7VbR0YkAR.jpg','1975-06-06',140,'Released',NULL,'The Elder Son',65107,0.8308,6.486,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6970,_binary '\0','/pgVTwsJXv1i2GGZ2yB7KfiYqGAc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073747',6.9,22037,'en','The Stepford Wives','Joanna Eberhart comes to the town of Stepford, Connecticut with her family, but soon discovers there lies a sinister truth in the all too perfect behavior of the female residents.','/5z1ogJJmQkCoU62VJmut4nnc2qs.jpg','1975-02-12',117,'Released','Something is wrong with the women of Stepford.','The Stepford Wives',12223,4.3199,6.7,'Y9WOMDsMy78','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6971,_binary '\0','/e9R7tfierm4YgiGDv3E5lsYsVfP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073755',6,1714,'ja','逆襲！殺人拳','Terry Sugury is hired to recover one of two tapes containing a formula for making heroin for a price of 200 dollars a pound. But he gets double crossed. So he wants the tape back.','/kciiX68V94RM8oAuNZUuUFQP2TZ.jpg','1974-11-22',83,'Released','When getting even isn\'t good enough!','The Street Fighter\'s Last Revenge',40813,1.8316,5.5,'pVMuhwTc_78','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6972,_binary '\0','/4YkvLCApaaPtskaLNDhOuX4im60.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073756',6.9,6255,'ja','激突! 殺人拳','Takuma Tsurugi takes on the government, the police, the mafia and an international ring of kidnappers who aim to dispossess a beautiful young heiress of her millions.','/e0g4jc7RQLkQitIKADjCfnyjYoj.jpg','1974-02-02',90,'Released','If you\'ve got to fight - fight dirty!','The Street Fighter',40810,2.3879,6.8,'77r9kEnq_jQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6973,_binary '\0','/xEUiMTxDC7L7AdajF7vYim9CRmz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073760',5.9,4165,'en','The Strongest Man in the World','Medfield College science major Dexter Riley and his classmates have been working on a new vitamin compound when a lab accident creates a supercharged mix that ends up in Dexter\'s cereal box, giving him superhuman strength. The powerful formula comes to the attention of the college dean and two rival cereal companies, touching off a hilarious chain of events.','/ac9sN2mKrxZ1XmgzfAA65AmuN2x.jpg','1975-02-06',92,'Released','The biggest dumbbell on campus... and the secret formula got it off the ground!','The Strongest Man in the World',31654,3.6439,6.2,'51y8pMuGygg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6974,_binary '\0','/i5CKsYWx3eKbwSokg0qouLpHfqo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073766',7.1,7386,'en','The Sunshine Boys','Lewis and Clark, aka The Sunshine Boys, were famous comedians during the vaudeville era, but off-stage they couldn\'t stand each other and haven\'t spoken in over 20 years of retirement. Willy Clark\'s nephew is the producer of a TV variety show that wants to feature a reunion of this classic duo. It is up to him to try to get the Sunshine Boys back together again.','/e8g6sy7rBSzuBBgOZqH1Bkjquy7.jpg','1975-11-06',111,'Released','For the price of a movie, you\'ll feel like a million.','The Sunshine Boys',16561,2.6693,6.894,'aZmljfPQ2tg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6975,_binary '\0','/491YUaK0Au2kpnOIqH6PNrrcM2c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073768',5.8,6016,'en','Supervixens','Clint must flee after his wife is killed by a psychopathic cop, who tries to pin the murder on him.','/1xtBWyQj15pz28qQ255rUF5W9iw.jpg','1975-04-02',106,'Released','Too much ... for one movie!','Supervixens',5725,5.1175,5.7,'nbji7on0dxQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6976,_binary '\0','/ogHI9aLHXPIT8awXKyo2WEHbQii.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073778',6.5,4893,'en','Switchblade Sisters','The leader of an inner city girl gang is challenged when a new girl moves into the neighborhood.','/axVIxmkYZFBDwMMhifeUXLHzu56.jpg','1975-01-05',91,'Released','So Easy to Kill, So Hard to Love','Switchblade Sisters',52633,2.4942,6.3,'Ppxk9qgfm8E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6977,_binary '\0','/wuZPUSahUaZc0f8D8jNd1vMpaqH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073781',7.3,2105,'ru','Табор уходит в небо','This colourful, music-filled and sensual melodrama based on early stories by Maxim Gorky tells the fatal love story between the beautiful and rebellious girl Rada and the handsome horse thief Zobar. The story is set in early 20th century Bessarabia, now part of Moldova, then belonging to the Austro-Hungarian Empire.','/1AIhyecxthQuvJNvPC4cKxTxCRp.jpg','1976-04-05',101,'Released',NULL,'The Gypsy Camp Vanishes Into the Blue',50186,1.8627,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6978,_binary '\0','/pauccQiNqsIybWKnfYPayIU46Ee.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073784',5.7,1697,'en','Take a Hard Ride','After his cattle rancher boss dies, right-hand man Pike is given the job of returning $86,000 to some families who live across the border in Sonora, Mexico. Honest Pike is joined on the trip through the wilderness by a dishonest gambler named Tyree.','/exQBHadvEXRa3o3XOrfqmiS6faw.jpg','1975-10-29',103,'Released','It Rides With The Great Westerns','Take a Hard Ride',44697,2.6104,5.3,'kYp6wP2YP7I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6979,_binary '\0','/hTwQkujWnuXqCUtiDwlKeyWDWMf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073796',5.6,2746,'en','Ransom','Following a series of bomb attacks in London, a group of terrorists seize Britain\'s ambassador to Scandinavia. With the ambassador now a hostage in his residence, another group hijacks an airliner at the capital\'s airport, announcing that the passengers will not be freed until their demands are met. Colonel Nils Tahlvik, Scandinavia\'s resourceful and ruthless head of security, seeks to take an uncompromising stance against the terrorists yet his attempts meet resistance from unknown forces at every turn...','/v05Zi28HlV0ZJ3JlLbKQbISOD0r.jpg','1974-12-06',95,'Released','Hijackers. Kidnappers. Killers. Only one man can stop them.','Ransom',70627,3.0792,5.5,'7Y9Cybb1NY4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6980,_binary '\0','/rlUNDYAjvr1zfAXesT3ScxfBXLc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073800',7.8,4910,'el','Ο θίασος','A traveling theatre troupe tours the Greek countryside from 1939 to the early 1950s, staging “Golfo the Shepherdess”. As the years pass, its members endure persecution, betrayal, executions, and exile. Their personal stories become entangled with the country’s major historical events, in a seemingly endless cycle of violence and loss.','/o7e7bhYVYVJGCnxRqcvnYBeQ5dZ.jpg','1975-07-01',223,'Released',NULL,'The Travelling Players',689,1.7144,7.2,'9Fa5Ig1eDv0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6981,_binary '\0','/paaOfARLLJTV2IfqsPwM7pxxSHp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073802',7.4,70087,'en','Three Days of the Condor','When bookish CIA researcher Joe Turner finds all his co-workers dead, he, together with a woman he has kidnapped, must work together to outwit those responsible until he determines who he can really trust.','/zinwtZqdb7gnc4zMu8dfkK1fMN3.jpg','1975-09-24',117,'Released','His CIA code name is Condor. In the next seventy-two hours almost everyone he trusts will try to kill him.','Three Days of the Condor',11963,6.3475,7.269,'Sov8R9PNVwg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6982,_binary '\0','/5XSitXno6yxYkNppwP5gOhC7SfA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073812',6.6,24711,'en','Tommy','After a series of traumatic childhood events, a psychosomatically deaf, dumb and blind boy becomes a master pinball player and the object of a religious cult.','/pAImVnqBJwoFAKrcpAe17JjLGUs.jpg','1975-03-19',111,'Released','Your senses will never be the same.','Tommy',11326,4.3105,6.5,'GkD78qRf3gQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6983,_binary '\0','/dFXGxxVSwb9tYNfKMeFnxORmBlt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073817',7.5,7607,'it','Travolti da un insolito destino nell\'azzurro mare d\'agosto','A wealthy woman\'s yachting holiday with friends in the Mediterranean Sea takes an unexpected turn when she and one of the boat\'s crew are stranded on a desert island. Her capitalist beliefs and his communist convictions clash, but during their struggle to survive, social roles are reversed and heated passions come alive.','/8bkEUeQWVFBk3HE4qhluDarTMDj.jpg','1974-12-18',110,'Released',NULL,'Swept Away',37916,3.0134,7.4,'3rz8zh7tBro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6984,_binary '\0','/3W0XBpLeLYoOGphaVAvSRMNu6GP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073820',6.5,9986,'en','Trilogy of Terror','A horror anthology containing three stories: a female college professor is aggressively pursued by one of her students; a prudish brunette determines that her free-spirited blonde sister is evil; and a woman\'s night turns upside down after she purchases an ancient Zuni fetish doll.','/nE4ih0nzpqz0x154Vig0QJUc6Sr.jpg','1975-03-04',72,'Released','An electrifying experience - you won\'t believe your eyes!','Trilogy of Terror',38783,2.0412,6.3,'aMZ1z5JXR0Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6985,_binary '\0','/30VFInw6IUlMgKCYTxI3LgrNTqs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073822',7.4,5818,'sv','Trollflöjten','The Queen of the Night enlists a handsome prince named Tamino to rescue her beautiful kidnapped daughter, Princess Pamina, in this screen adaptation of the beloved Mozart opera. Aided by the lovelorn bird hunter Papageno and a magical flute that holds the power to change the hearts of men, young Tamino embarks on a quest for true love, leading to the evil Sarastro\'s temple where Pamina is held captive.','/3N0L2ijwcVjRLJRSXbv3AKT2Vnt.jpg','1975-10-04',134,'Released','We only see Bergman, we only hear Mozart','The Magic Flute',44864,2.7671,7.1,'2yS9-9ic9A4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6986,_binary '\0','/lERbduEQ32LSCAg1kw6s1E5QtOp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073835',5.6,2492,'en','The Ultimate Warrior','Only a few people still live in New York in 2012. They are organized in gangs with their own turf. One of them is led by Baron, another one by Carrot, and they are constantly at war with each other.','/1RyccpnEHahPtWOoKjwO40pGPmB.jpg','1975-10-02',94,'Released','A Film of the Future','The Ultimate Warrior',32053,1.9658,5.764,'BXO2o0peZGM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6987,_binary '\0','/7EkLWYI9y3WshPTSBzDH3YqIf1K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073836',6.1,4046,'it','L\'ultimo treno della notte','Two young women, Margaret and Lisa, are set to take the overnight train from Munich in Germany to stay with Lisa\'s parents in Italy for Christmas. Unfortunately a pair of psychotic hoodlums and an equally demented nymphomaniac woman terrorize the pair.','/2LDH11OuWVH1AdTqUVfSukkSfLa.jpg','1975-04-09',94,'Released','Most movies last less than two hours! This is one of everlasting torment!','Late Night Trains',39988,2.7488,6.1,'QV765-ltJqs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6988,_binary '\0','/eVlyhX5LoaYehepVqe8bLwuF35K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073841',7.3,1317,'ja','桜の森の満開の下','A mountain bandit abducts a woman who demands he kill his other wives to please her, leading to a cycle of violence and madness fueled by superstition and obsession.','/4yMImDRa7x2DXPRCX3uhEhf5AMD.jpg','1975-05-31',95,'Released',NULL,'Under the Blossoming Cherry Trees',108808,2.101,7,'sAwoLLZuFMQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6989,_binary '\0','/49nvRYWmO02QZz1kvLUUitzrq3v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073858',7.3,5358,'de','Die verlorene Ehre der Katharina Blum','After a chance encounter with a wanted man, a woman is harassed by the police and press until she takes violent action.','/d7Z1gzPkHm29jmiqnjvzXZg2koI.jpg','1975-01-10',104,'Released',NULL,'The Lost Honor of Katharina Blum',4762,3.2051,6.958,'P5zBH-PFjag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6990,_binary '\0','/mI81t7CG1QECwQWb1bJkCRvZMt1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073864',7.5,5972,'fr','Le Vieux Fusil','In Montauban in 1944, Julien Dandieu is a surgeon in the local hospital. Frightened by the German army entering Montauban, he asks his friend Francois to drive his wife and his daughter in the back country village where Julien has an old castle. One week later, Julien decides to meet them for the week end, but the Germans are already occupying the village.','/hLoEBn5kbMlnLA30Y5M3H6lwyUp.jpg','1975-08-20',103,'Released',NULL,'The Old Gun',3480,3.7789,7.527,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6991,_binary '\0','/plnVOkVl8q79HsHbEiAvmNmP8gN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073880',6,1692,'en','Walking Tall Part II','The Walking Tall legacy continues with Bo Svenson as Sheriff Buford Pusser, a one-man army trying to rid his town of corruption. Out to avenge his wife\'s death at the hand of the mob, Sheriff Pusser blows up their moonshine operation. With Buford breathing down their necks, the syndicate hires two hitmen; one a maniacal race car driver, the other a deadly gunslinger. Any other man would\'ve hightailed it out of there, but then Pusser is no ordinary man.','/bMrOljXbWHlC0oNEvfPUSsmvl3Y.jpg','1975-09-28',109,'Released','The story Buford Pusser wanted told...','Walking Tall Part II',72455,2.5896,5.4,'0GwAf1kdo4Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6992,_binary '\0','/zyrVRu0hK1nbJBcee0YIxY4SGhu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073896',6.1,2686,'en','White Line Fever','An independent trucker with a pregnant wife fights cargo crooks and the big shot they work for.','/cPXwaBrDGOUIkzGj6MeAElzUi3Z.jpg','1975-07-16',90,'Released','The organization says: Everybody drives for them. Carrol Jo says: I drive for myself.','White Line Fever',42267,2.1561,6.056,'bOFmdyNFsjI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6993,_binary '\0','/nO4yyJPgEKWn4XyAD5fjWcIdVtm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073901',6.4,2675,'en','The Wilby Conspiracy','Having spent 10 years in prison for nationalist activities, Shack Twala is finally ordered released by the South African Supreme Court but he finds himself almost immediately on the run after a run-in with the police. Assisted by his lawyer Rina Van Niekirk and visiting British engineer Jim Keogh, he heads for Capetown where he hopes to recover a stash of diamonds, meant to finance revolutionary activities, that he had entrusted to a dentist before his incarceration. Along the way, they are followed by Major Horn of the South African State security bureau and it becomes apparent that he has no intention of arresting them until they reach their final destination','/4BBXpqhBy18oGFkZW4zYqZgMKSU.jpg','1975-02-01',105,'Released','In the fight for freedom, you have to break all the rules.','The Wilby Conspiracy',7008,2.7092,6.3,'O1uh7kMvBVM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6994,_binary '\0','/4rw8hb8Idl48PXLss01sXbYnwDf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073906',6.8,11239,'en','The Wind and the Lion','At the beginning of the 20th century an American woman is abducted in Morocco by Berbers, and the attempts to free her range from diplomatic pressure to military intervention.','/3QLqEZL1kBBfKjVz3nAm5vJruRZ.jpg','1975-05-22',119,'Released','Between the wind and the lion is the woman. For her, half the world may go to war.','The Wind and the Lion',14815,3.6024,6.5,'1s587_qG8eg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6995,_binary '\0','/ew7DGhmG3vzqEShmZvS5OcKKoEV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073915',6.7,2219,'fr','Xala','A rich businessman in Senegal is cursed with crippling erectile dysfunction upon the day of his marriage to his third wife; the only cure is brutal public humiliation.','/4bx6Wceii1OZf0e3qp4EurUFoK7.jpg','1975-10-01',121,'Released',NULL,'Xala',76636,1.8782,6.833,'T-3AiU0c-Do','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6996,_binary '\0','/gd0T9aTZhnEHdkTrMUE3bbLPPwi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073918',7.2,11825,'en','The Yakuza','When George Tanner does business with high-ranking Yakuza Tono, Tono kidnaps his daughter, and George summons his old friend, private eye Harry Kilmer, to Japan to investigate.','/AgD8nbLXo6YpBxv71A2vdJHs03D.jpg','1974-12-21',112,'Released','A man never forgets. A man pays his debts.','The Yakuza',28415,4.412,7.13,'y1lQd2lz7n8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6997,_binary '\0','/hM1a5JndkgFs4w3YNhE5DhjbLWm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073927',7.4,1997,'ru','Здравствуйте, я ваша тётя!','A funny comedy based on famous Brandon Thomas\' play \"Charley\'s Aunt\".','/b0MK0IivTlGNzrvuuq8eTvOGtN8.jpg','1975-12-26',98,'Released',NULL,'Hello, I\'m Your Aunt!',72611,1.0541,7.069,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6998,_binary '\0','/3QKJi78gMiiiaAms9cA0bOmVdKN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073946',6.1,1261,'sv','Ägget är löst!','A fairy tale and satire about a wealthy industrialist, whose son has been subdued and oppressed and totally uninterested in his father\'s business.','/jnCVqnXZfoDclG7CtM9ULZa4OLD.jpg','1975-03-17',107,'Released',NULL,'Egg! Egg! A Hardboiled Story',135390,1.334,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(6999,_binary '\0','/5eB0TGOho0zYEsTzYWkMIqypUEG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0073948',7.2,1730,'hu','Örökbefogadás','When middle-aged Kata realises that her life will only be complete if she has a baby of her own, her longstanding-but-married boyfriend Joska refuses to comply. But by developing an unlikely friendship with the angst-ridden teenage orphan Anna, who is also involved in a controversial relationship, Kata discovers aspects of herself, and her role as a woman, that have gone unexamined throughout her entire, lonely life.','/rblFqH0CKL66LG0JA5qbmfaBsmP.jpg','1975-09-25',88,'Released',NULL,'Adoption',61703,0.9216,6.7,'BOjxTfuI6Lk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7000,_binary '\0','/Acocj2HlM1L5DYmxDRujTAJMas7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074080',5.4,1665,'en','\'Gator Bait','Desirée lives deep in the swamp and supports herself and her siblings by poaching. After an accident involving Deputy Billy and a friend, the Sheriff, Deputy and a family of locals go after Desirée. Soon the hunters become the hunted as she exacts her revenge for their violence against her family.','/8e5wUW4VCDzXCmprAOKVaqvxHjm.jpg','1974-10-12',88,'Released','UNTAMED AND DEADLY, she ruled the swamp with a BLAZING GUN and a LUSCIOUS SMILE','\'Gator Bait',88950,2.1871,4.963,'gZR-I0vnVJs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7001,_binary '\0','/cOIW0l0UVB8WhSA5pwB2lGXKmKf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074083',6.3,1282,'it','Una Magnum Special per Tony Saitta','After his younger sister is poisoned, a tough Ottawa cop embarks on a violent journey through Montreal to find her killer, which turns into a whirlpool of revenge and betrayal.','/kibftFdCPw7mIl8yTjb3jk5XqoQ.jpg','1976-03-09',100,'Released','Enter at your own risk... for there is no such thing as a truly empty room','Shadows in an Empty Room',84425,2.1659,5.8,'qKrTuW-dE8M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7002,_binary '\0','/x5948QrtMqvnf2OBP9ESpdmONQa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074084',7.6,28043,'it','Novecento','The epic tale of a class struggle in twentieth century Italy, as seen through the eyes of two childhood friends on opposing sides.','/deWzfCC59tmtEQvKSmflDe14FvR.jpg','1976-08-28',317,'Released','From the cradle to the grave - victims of history and change!','1900',3870,4.6792,7.811,'TY2hneWCiiQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7003,_binary '\0','/2xvA4HqerUcpAxByu2sa95sBIX6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074085',6.3,1400,'en','21 Hours at Munich','A dramatization of the incident in 1972 when Arab terrorists broke into the Olympic compound in Munich and murdered 11 Israeli athletes.','/kVYRTI7V8TQn24f9YY3HW58KGXY.jpg','1976-12-25',101,'Released','At 4:09 am on September 5, 1972, eleven Olympic athletes were taken hostage by terrorists. For the next 21 hours the world held its breath...','21 Hours at Munich',82598,2.4579,6.3,'PhETVvf2VbA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7004,_binary '\0','/g3L6tOvJIRWSkxnhmoEW1SKEvW3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074102',6.6,25546,'ja','愛のコリーダ','A passionate telling of the story of Sada Abe, a woman whose affair with her master led to an obsessive and ultimately destructive sexual relationship.','/AiFQbgjgSXWPfbi9iIYT39iXWMW.jpg','1976-09-15',102,'Released','Never before had a man and a woman loved each other so intensely.','In the Realm of the Senses',5879,12.6255,6.6,'w-o8EKjXJPQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7005,_binary '\0','/cHpBJ6EhBj2ZVCvMIsd8RJuoIjU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074103',7.2,13911,'fr','L\'Aile ou la Cuisse','Charles Duchemin, a well-known gourmet and publisher of a famous restaurant guide, is waging a war against fast food entrepreneur Tri- catel to save the French art of cooking. After having agreed to appear on a talk show to show his skills in naming food and wine by taste, he is confronted with two disasters: his son wants to become a clown rather than a restaurant tester and he, the famous Charles Duchemin, has lost his taste!','/ywkIu5l3iAgPZvLFEVBDYxLouH8.jpg','1976-10-27',104,'Released',NULL,'The Wing or the Thigh?',761,4.542,7.2,'ITD4MKaGpeg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7006,_binary '','/4eFKY4eggWXDQeLdjiOSQQ2zwQP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074113',6.2,3398,'en','Alice in Wonderland: An X-Rated Musical Fantasy','Alice offends her would-be lover William by rejecting his advances. Upset, she falls asleep reading Alice in Wonderland. The white rabbit appears to her in a dream and takes her into a sexual wonderland. The story loosely follows Carroll\'s original plot, and includes many of his characters, but with considerable sexual license.','/eqVNyI977x7JEe89y22WNqqQ1Lu.jpg','1976-12-08',88,'Released','The world\'s favorite bedtime story','Alice in Wonderland: An X-Rated Musical Fantasy',29160,0,6.4,'SFBHNoju8G0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7007,_binary '\0','/7hKpULJvzXkGL2lxGu3enYmnbPc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074114',6.5,1542,'fr','Alice ou la Dernière Fugue','One night Alice can\'t stand her husband anymore and she decides to leave him. It\'s a dark, rainy night and something smashes the windshield so Alice is forced to seek shelter in an old mansion. She is warmly welcomed but soon realises that strange things are happening. She tries to escape but it seems there\'s no way out.','/x47T7a9AR6J8OUmcbIQx1ZbtbQa.jpg','1977-01-19',93,'Released',NULL,'Alice or the Last Escapade',32722,1.6442,5.957,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7008,_binary '\0','/aAMn59bq6DZQtWoYqsIOUkVWSgc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074119',7.9,139388,'en','All the President\'s Men','During the 1972 elections, two reporters\' investigation sheds light on the controversial Watergate scandal that compels President Nixon to resign from his post.','/pCe6lfLxt1B58zPD4lgQrlnDS2j.jpg','1976-04-09',138,'Released','The most devastating detective story of this century.','All the President\'s Men',891,8.2334,7.7,'k5y8SW2KyTY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7009,_binary '\0','/v7AeBq31MyRS9S8ixZ9kkpt9k78.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074121',7.4,3578,'it','Allegro non troppo','An enterprising producer believes he has hit upon a winning concept: a program of original animated shorts set to classical music. Undeterred by warnings that this has already been done by an American named \'Prisney,\' he rallies an orchestra of geriatric women, a bullish conductor, and an animator that he keeps locked in the dungeon. What could go wrong?','/xRAnD7yd6Qx8NYXfoW5GN6K5jiC.jpg','1976-03-12',85,'Released',NULL,'Allegro non troppo',22561,2.1051,7.124,'8X54mKLsaD4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7010,_binary '\0','/giwEta86ga5JvMgkl178B4cULo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074123',6.5,2851,'fr','L\'Alpagueur','L\'Alpagueur is a free-lance spy from the French secret agency. He\'s put on the investigation about L\'epervier, a serial-killer who employs young boys to help him robbing banks before killing them.','/2JmSWZVcK9gQAbIY5ni53oCvkp1.jpg','1976-02-01',97,'Released',NULL,'Hunter Will Get You',11512,2.3945,6.534,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7011,_binary '\0','/1Z08RUb16Yz091IpzIUTM2s0P7U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074147',7.5,6735,'sv','Ansikte mot ansikte','A psychiatrist temporarily separated from her family begins to experience severe psychological distress while working at a mental hospital and returning to her childhood home. As her professional responsibilities and personal relationships intersect, she undergoes a breakdown that forces her to confront long-suppressed memories and fears. (Note: This entry refers to the 1976 theatrical feature film (approximately 135 minutes), created by condensing and re-editing the four-part Swedish television miniseries originally produced the same year.)','/ulh7ILYfvSZExCXENEhySvuZLLl.jpg','1976-04-05',114,'Released','A woman\'s most intimate encounter with the one person she didn\'t know. Herself.','Face to Face',29454,2.7528,7.22,'F8e0JyFHmSQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7012,_binary '\0','/sWZIBPlokdhi1RoQs1DS52n1D3J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074148',2.6,2224,'en','Ape','A newly discovered 36-foot gorilla escapes from a freighter off the coast of Korea. At the same time an American actress is filming a movie in the country. Chaos ensues as the ape kidnaps her and rampages through Seoul.','/zvjTUBCZNiQPH3bWOJQn6FKS7gv.jpg','1976-07-23',87,'Released','Not to be confused with King Kong','A*P*E',31126,1.3682,3.8,'wUGT6drsJLM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7013,_binary '\0','/goBPr2y6uMU063J08bXuJjCAlil.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074152',7.6,7016,'fr','L\'Argent de poche','The lives of a motherless young man, who\'s just starting to find interest in women, and his physically abused, poverty stricken friend, are mixed with more or less innocent childhood experiences and challenges most their age experience.','/lBOkXZ2RsL2BO6NlrFgR9yT7J4I.jpg','1976-03-17',104,'Released',NULL,'Small Change',1660,2.3523,7.143,'5cpxmlCJ118','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7014,_binary '\0','/dm1bqDSw3MJTjYCeuNUv122BXFp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074156',7.3,61771,'en','Assault on Precinct 13','A highway patrol officer, two criminals, and a station secretary form an unlikely alliance to defend a defunct Los Angeles precinct against a siege by a bloodthirsty street gang.','/RtGDEmXbSxE8NThCCY1SXFXLLw.jpg','1976-10-08',91,'Released','A white-hot night of hate!','Assault on Precinct 13',17814,5.1402,7.3,'7wnAjYDVObs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7015,_binary '\0','/yPzNawgSgQKnBoE0t1It23y561L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074157',5.1,6232,'en','At the Earth\'s Core','A huge burrowing machine tunnels out of control at ferocious speed, cutting clean through to the center of the earth, to the twilight world of pellucidar. Once there, Dr. Perry and David Innes are threatened by half human creatures, lizard-like birds, and man-eating plants.','/hDMmR5asPdAHNXjo1uijHlba9VX.jpg','1976-07-01',90,'Released','4,000 miles to the center of the Earth to a world within a world','At the Earth\'s Core',26398,3.57,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7016,_binary '\0','/jsMViXpdIBm7HY6XkInbQ1PU1OC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074174',7.3,27874,'en','The Bad News Bears','An aging, down-on-his-luck ex-minor leaguer coaches a team of misfits in an ultra-competitive California little league.','/kJNXMni0ObOXLth6v9xpUhWbtrp.jpg','1976-04-06',102,'Released','The coach is waiting for his next beer. The pitcher is waiting for her first bra. The team is waiting for a miracle. Consider the possibilities.','The Bad News Bears',23479,4.6214,6.9,'rdqJs5-N1-A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7017,_binary '\0','/4ZQRqc46edM2moWOmL3N5F1iETN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074205',5.7,4102,'en','The Big Bus','A nuclear-powered bus is making its maiden non-stop trip from New York to Denver. The journey is plagued by disasters due to the machinations of a mysterious group allied with the oil lobby. Will the down-on-his-luck driver, with a reputation for eating his passengers, be able to complete the journey?','/rcwW5YBEGvWPx8NBN5PxdvoYc0F.jpg','1976-06-23',88,'Released','At last — the first disaster movie where everybody dies (laughing).','The Big Bus',19133,3.3614,5.3,'68dTwJNvE1E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7018,_binary '\0','/mEvm3P25Wn1WDVkDr5BT11nSr6R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074207',6.8,2577,'en','The Bingo Long Traveling All-Stars & Motor Kings','Top baseball pitcher Bingo Long is fed up with how his Negro League team owner treats him, so he forms his own lineup, recruiting big-hitting Leon Carter and Charlie Snow, who dreams of playing in the majors. Boycotted by black teams, Long\'s outfit play minor league white teams, earning more attention as entertainers than as players. However, their success wins them a chance to play again in the Negro League, this time as equals.','/7kvjllELG8AGLifc433GhLzShj0.jpg','1976-07-16',111,'Released','They put the ball in baseball.','The Bingo Long Traveling All-Stars & Motor Kings',42243,2.374,6.1,'tLqLdiNUitA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7019,_binary '\0','/r3WQWhJIgyL8JUTW6pKNXTYNEJd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074220',6.6,2411,'pl','Blizna','When a political decision is made as to the location of a new large chemical factory, Stefan Bednarz is put in charge of it. This honest communist party man has to confront the local community opposing the construction.','/rSYBf7xXJafbHqeJrrck1uF33Il.jpg','1976-12-06',106,'Released',NULL,'The Scar',49134,2.0008,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7020,_binary '\0','/qi0bu2QWCPl62nAtLlicfcJiCLk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074225',5.4,1397,'en','The Blue Bird','Peasant children Mytyl and Tyltyl are led on a magical quest for the fabulous Blue Bird of Happiness by the fairy Berylune. On their journey, they\'re accompanied by the anthropomorphized presences of a Dog, a Cat, Light, Fire, and Bread, among other entities.','/fYfA91L3nA83UkM0hfuXoEteGva.jpg','1976-04-30',95,'Released','A cavalcade of magic. A carnival of fun. The Blue Bird is magic for everyone.','The Blue Bird',100922,2.7421,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7021,_binary '\0','/uxJmelKYiC7lLZTbS1ut4EMBGe7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074226',5.9,3609,'en','Blue Sunshine','At a party, someone goes insane and murders three women. Falsely accused of the brutal killings, Jerry is on the run. More bizarre homicides continue with alarming frequency all over town. Trying to clear his name, Jerry discovers the shocking truth...people are losing their hair and turning into violent psychopaths and the connection may be some LSD all the murderers took a decade before.','/kFH2Cug6i9ztE89QZn4XmCki65C.jpg','1977-12-02',94,'Released','Did you ever hear the words \"Blue Sunshine\"? Try to remember...your life may depend on it.','Blue Sunshine',40955,3.3915,5.7,'yk-29WjBy7o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7022,_binary '\0','/sdB47qpxcYDxHZSQDJHUxK4oAXg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074228',5.4,1654,'en','Bobbie Jo and the Outlaw','Aimless country girl Bobbie Jo Baker abandons her carhop job to join Wild West outlaw wannabe Lyle Wheeler for an adventure in theft, mayhem, and murder.','/m32mECgVlf6b4laxNf017lIlgDe.jpg','1976-03-01',89,'Released','It started out as a joy ride...It sure didn\'t end that way!','Bobbie Jo and the Outlaw',59902,3.7884,4.6,'lOtB8-5mRtY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7023,_binary '\0','/tI0Tn4XsWiCRfgAPEhxYWMcrFN8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074235',7.2,6105,'en','Bound for Glory','A biography of Woody Guthrie, one of America\'s greatest folk singers. He left his dust-devastated Texas home in the 1930s to find work, discovering the suffering and strength of America\'s working class.','/wMSR2CSPruCPkZDEQ5xjv5xqc05.jpg','1976-12-05',148,'Released',NULL,'Bound for Glory',42232,2.5894,6.897,'N938hAHUF_E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7024,_binary '\0','/jF4qtclnmfiGPnEaXosSxAXDeKm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074236',5.8,6089,'en','The Boy in the Plastic Bubble','Tod Lubitch is born with a deficient immune system. As such, he must spend the rest of his life in a completely sterile environment. His room is completely hermetically sealed against bacteria and virus, his food is specially prepared, and his only human contact comes in the form of gloved hands. The movie follows his life into a teenager.','/qZHhtOaXj3GhmivPhsmCnLkitpY.jpg','1976-11-12',96,'Released','A lifetime of loneliness...Or one day of love','The Boy in the Plastic Bubble',9878,4.2186,5.6,'BgesL8cVgmI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7025,_binary '\0','/w0KF71Bp6H2dBnOBpl4wqyo43On.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074251',7.4,1840,'pl','Brunet wieczorową porą','Modest editor, has shipped his wife and kids for the weekend, and is trying to relax in his house at the outskirts of Warsaw. His quiet evening is only disturbed by the accidental forecast made by a Gypsy woman, that at evening time he will murder a mysterious brunet.','/elxvBSf3Vg5gvFxmQUgBCU2FNW9.jpg','1976-10-18',90,'Released',NULL,'Brunet Will Call',81223,1.0788,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7026,_binary '\0','/lZzW1Y6sDGhbnOh8NuMwUlOVVVe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074252',7.7,9914,'it','Brutti, sporchi e cattivi','Giacinto lives with his wife, their ten children and various other family members in a shack on the hills of Rome. Some time ago he has lost his left eye while at work, and got a consistent sum of money from the insurance company, which he keeps hidden from the rest of the family. His whole life is now based on defending the money he sees as his own, while the rest of the family tries to kill him.','/rl2wUqZAZSEXymyvH3U7onEQfMN.jpg','1976-09-23',115,'Released',NULL,'Ugly, Dirty and Bad',19413,3.6788,7.5,'Rikqcbg1Fc0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7027,_binary '\0','/2JbySwrCjjZUasCwIbh6uxUlF8R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074254',6.1,5922,'en','Buffalo Bill and the Indians, or Sitting Bull\'s History Lesson','Buffalo Bill plans to put on his own Wild West sideshow, and Chief Sitting Bull has agreed to appear in it. However, Sitting Bull has his own hidden agenda, involving the President and General Custer.','/zyQZAJogUOECWM46v4N6wGDHd20.jpg','1976-06-24',123,'Released','The greatest buffaloer of them all!','Buffalo Bill and the Indians, or Sitting Bull\'s History Lesson',42233,2.7469,5.6,'Ig9o6TzCoss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7028,_binary '\0','/vF6HsyBdaJAZIYNUVs2hyY5itBy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074256',6.8,21128,'en','Bugsy Malone','New York, 1929, a war rages between two rival gangsters, Fat Sam and Dandy Dan. Dan is in possession of a new and deadly weapon, the dreaded \"splurge gun\". As the custard pies fly, Bugsy Malone, an all-round nice guy, falls for Blousey Brown, a singer at Fat Sam\'s speakeasy. His designs on her are disrupted by the seductive songstress Tallulah who wants Bugsy for herself.','/j9BPl3jkNCFgsYe5poKrirUqrf8.jpg','1976-07-22',93,'Released','Every year brings a great movie. Every decade a great movie musical!','Bugsy Malone',8446,3.8384,6.6,'NOrgDbldcA4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7029,_binary '\0','/sve315CAjMhSZBKBthDHJI77gmb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074258',6.4,15329,'en','Burnt Offerings','A family moves into a large old mansion in the countryside which seems to have a mysterious and sinister power over its new residents.','/2ipG69lXOjGMX7F7qxJQzUoiUsd.jpg','1976-10-18',116,'Released','Up the ancient stairs, behind the locked door, something lives, something evil, from which no one has ever returned.','Burnt Offerings',13549,3.811,6.5,'-7l5dUZEbug','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7030,_binary '\0','/y5R6AS5u9QapE314hjRx8reEyUI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074260',1.5,3025,'en','The Butterfly Ball','Roger Glover puts on a star-studded concert at the Royal Albert Hall for his concept album \"The Butterfly Ball and the Grasshopper\'s Feast\".','/g5NPfXpRZQg8dRj9c6GM8Z3GwEH.jpg','1977-04-01',85,'Released','A Fun Musical Extravaganza','The Butterfly Ball',285814,0.8283,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7031,_binary '\0','/qzJegLAwZ9pRgBRV1vVnNLLY0gA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074262',7.2,3210,'it','Cadaveri eccellenti','A detective is assigned to investigate the mysterious murders of some Supreme Court judges.','/ue4OgtZ9pUvthCNH9h3vK2xeNqL.jpg','1976-02-12',121,'Released',NULL,'Illustrious Corpses',62789,1.9924,6.761,'GPFLK9UEgZo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7032,_binary '\0','/fV7Faf2J5DyPVSSkNCLh2TqSHRt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074279',5.5,5909,'en','Cannonball','Coy \"Cannonball\" Buckman and his blazing red Pontiac enter the Trans-America Grand Prix, an underground road race spanning the continent in which there are no rules, no speed limits and no heed for the law. En route, Buckman jockeys with an international ensemble of racers for a $100,000 purse. But there are none more important than Cade Redman, his direct competition for a guaranteed spot on the elite Modern Motors racing team.','/u85Yi7wJRKS7lgLjQdpQqOxJNO7.jpg','1976-07-06',93,'Released','The annual Trans-American outlaw road race - A cross country demolition derby without rules!','Cannonball',21241,2.8768,5.6,'3ovP-2rVMLs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7033,_binary '\0','/huREhFo4qwUBAboF35WTpbBiD9Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074281',6.3,9175,'en','Car Wash','This day-in-the-life cult comedy focuses on a group of friends working at Sully Boyar\'s Car Wash in the Los Angeles ghetto. The team meets dozens of eccentric customers -- including a smooth-talking preacher, a wacky cab driver and an ex-convict -- while cracking politically incorrect jokes to a constant soundtrack of disco and funk. Some of the workers find romance as the day moves along, but most are just happy to get through another shift.','/bty0IdXh4l2BmoQNVeAH5PYKrMK.jpg','1976-10-22',97,'Released','Where anything can happen...and usually does!','Car Wash',15462,3.2618,6,'Jf7yn9GfJZ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7034,_binary '\0','/zwJFfKQdfiptK2GY6N8GkZFrAxJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074285',7.4,231296,'en','Carrie','Withdrawn and sensitive teenager Carrie White faces bullying from her classmates and abuse from her fanatically pious mother. When she begins to suspect that she has supernatural powers, things take a dark and violent turn.','/bJJ3xK4pMnfao0wfzySfC47dp8G.jpg','1976-11-03',98,'Released','If you\'ve got a taste for terror...Take Carrie to the prom!','Carrie',7340,12.5343,7.3,'zbdIXI1s3aU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7035,_binary '\0','/h3aycD1nPQDG01KPB4wVX03Hisr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074286',4.1,2468,'en','Carry On England','Captain S. Melly takes over as the new Commanding Officer at an experimental mixed sex air defence base. It\'s 1940 and England is under heavy bombardment, but the crew seem more interested in each other than the enemy planes above. Captain Melly plans to put a stop to all this, and becomes the target of a campaign to abandon his separatist ideals...','/e44o6rtxR1W3fLa9jumnff2bHXv.jpg','1976-10-01',89,'Released',NULL,'Carry On England',21251,1.604,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7036,_binary '\0','/hN8BEjmyqsPdwSPsdDWenoid1as.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074287',7,7318,'it','La casa dalle finestre che ridono','Stefano, a young restorer, is commissioned to save a controversial mural located in the church of a small, isolated village.','/oinsJI8Rlz8EjSOO6ahsFDsDhwN.jpg','1976-08-20',110,'Released','Today I portrayed the shameless one as she died...','The House with Laughing Windows',57447,2.1608,7.2,'tj7AM6PFmJY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7037,_binary '\0','/nn84IU1JFwvfcVhQ08teDM080yd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074291',7,9670,'it','Il Casanova di Federico Fellini','Imprisoned for practicing black magic, writer and adventurer Giacomo Casanova escapes and wanders Europe, using his fluid sexuality to find his place in life amid a variety of eccentric and strange characters.','/ygTsnjWEUY8fbXzFWIh07eEHf3w.jpg','1976-12-10',148,'Released','And Now... after four years of preparation and production...','Fellini\'s Casanova',42236,2.8368,6.876,'LOkiSgBakz4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7038,_binary '\0','/nr9br4LK2HA1BRa5hp4CfCmpHEK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074292',6.3,11272,'en','The Cassandra Crossing','Passengers on a European train have been exposed to a deadly disease, and nobody will let them off the train.','/33xSyxAOTJkCYXEjVixCSy0IXsW.jpg','1976-12-18',129,'Released','The Fear Is Spreading','The Cassandra Crossing',32037,6.3303,6.237,'Om_gSZkNUYM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7039,_binary '\0','/bhoU7nxXMhZORIZRxA7WHqoBZDe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074301',7,1229,'en','Charlie\'s Angels','The Angels head for wine country to discover what happened to a missing man before he\'s declared legally dead and the estate goes up for grabs.','/dpQerhkeYKnAh60bzHp3uS84B8e.jpg','1976-03-21',74,'Released','Money, mystery, murder. They\'re in it up to their gorgeous private eyes.','Charlie\'s Angels',1463597,1.288,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7040,_binary '\0','/6wtyrIsMeWp2NQfYyzLe0QKsSqX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074312',7.2,5115,'de','Chinesisches Roulette','Ariane and Gerhard Christ, a wealthy Munich couple, plan for the weekend on separate trips, lying to the other about their trysts. However, their itineraries are complicated when they both arrive at the family\'s country home with their respective lovers.','/9I0YkoGDM8nqHZcEsrGMcy9WhVy.jpg','1977-02-23',86,'Released',NULL,'Chinese Roulette',36226,2.1359,7.138,'qpBzi_NkJUY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7041,_binary '\0','/eCuiV7O8uvKyM4Lht4nbJendVRN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074343',4.5,1355,'en','Confessions of a Driving Instructor','Timothy Lea and his brother-in-law Sidney decide upon opening a driving school as their latest get-rich-quick scheme. Though he sincerely wants to teach, young Timmy finds that his female students are far more interested in keeping their eyes on him than on the road.','/vMTf2j4cvAOMZU9rgpipqnGoe9O.jpg','1976-09-01',90,'Released',NULL,'Confessions of a Driving Instructor',33301,2.3073,4.7,'FfByqJ2opDw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7042,_binary '\0','/eGaiKaD9KPbPMJ7qlazjLy3sGTU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074348',6.6,2847,'fr','Le Corps de mon ennemi','A man accused of murder discovers a trail of corruption leading to the powerful family of his former love. Going underground, he seeks allies in a town where trust is scarce.','/igEtq4fniKy6mExSTRlvSJdEaKu.jpg','1976-10-13',120,'Released',NULL,'The Body of My Enemy',51213,2.1692,6.401,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7043,_binary '\0','/jvtimoDt14OJuQfSO8qEM3heLF8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074356',5.1,2041,'en','Creature from Black Lake','When the word gets out of a mysterious Bigfoot-type creature, two researchers come to a small town to study and hopefully discover the true nature of the beast. With some help from the locals, the two men to learn that the creature may be a very angry and murderous missing link.','/rXYmNFbJyA1Jcr3x54hCNuOWnk4.jpg','1976-03-01',95,'Released','Terror has reached new depths…','Creature from Black Lake',43753,2.0416,5.2,'FOvYxG17-wY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7044,_binary '\0','/sc600L1efonWcAm1HDA6WMAAmn0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074360',7.9,12647,'es','Cría cuervos','Ana, an eight-year-old girl living in Madrid with her grandmother and two sisters, mourns the death of her mother.','/dzgMW3wK3WJITovR9BZBnGRUlI7.jpg','1976-06-03',105,'Released',NULL,'Cria!',51857,3.4751,7.5,'X6WPyYP2N38','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7045,_binary '\0','/l4ipHKIUCbCOAIj9UHdTYW3bhzI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074400',7.5,3068,'it','Il deserto dei Tartari','Lieutenant Giovanni Drogo is assigned to the old Bastiani border fortress where he expects an imminent attack by nomadic fearsome Tartars.','/nwNtJlzMo6TZ3FPIEyVWD0vvHb0.jpg','1976-10-29',140,'Released',NULL,'The Desert of the Tartars',48203,2.3549,6.8,'79JjUel7q3E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7046,_binary '\0','/keowerDoGeXOANg3sBjXor1bgNz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074404',6.8,1476,'en','The Devil\'s Playground','Australia, 1953. Thirteen-year-old Tom Allen attends a strict Catholic seminary for boys administered by De La Salle Brothers. The adolescent students and their adult instructors struggle deeply with sexual repression and religious doubt.','/jb42HMgDSEu2t1IJoQMOAcsz9hq.jpg','1977-12-23',107,'Released',NULL,'The Devil\'s Playground',32122,1.9755,6.3,'eHTdhzaRp9A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7047,_binary '\0','/5jVjETyJZbshkSWhFFtEJFq5T64.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074408',5.3,2120,'de','Jack the Ripper','A serial killer whose mother was a prostitute starts killing streetwalkers as a way of paying back his mother for her abuse.','/2MiGYPs4y3Ihs3zd9ZeKqMHJxYe.jpg','1976-09-23',92,'Released','Close your eyes and whisper his name...','Jack the Ripper',39567,1.9814,5.9,'E9yVykvUF8E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7048,_binary '\0','/5i32ShPbzn09S4vPJfEcHum9hfu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074412',5.2,1970,'en','Disco Godfather','Retired cop and celebrity DJ Tucker Williams (aka The Disco Godfather) takes to the streets as a dangerous hallucinogenic drug called Angel Dust begins to take hold of the neighborhood.','/1vqv7Pqooiis8PCpRZXikE3j3UN.jpg','1979-09-04',93,'Released','Touch him and you\'re dust!','Disco Godfather',77403,1.2137,5.6,'0Co40D7lmCo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7049,_binary '\0','/eelUozvoQkYgAmZHVyd3vM2ps7M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074419',4.8,1248,'en','Dogs','On the quiet campus of the remotely-located SouthWestern University, something strange is happening. All of the dogs in the area, once loyal, gentle pets, are now banding together in wild packs and hunting down their former masters. Could the strange transformation have anything to do with the secret government experiments being conducted in the school\'s physics laboratory? More importantly, can the dogs be stopped before it\'s too late?','/p9QYxAoSeVaUdvFw9HEqmzPUbdf.jpg','1976-11-11',91,'Released','Don\'t pet them... Fear them!','Dogs',104528,1.6241,5.6,'7To05NAu92I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7050,_binary '\0','/oywhfEULputgdS8VXXdl3NoQ5P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074422',6.8,1705,'en','Don\'s Party','On the night of the 1969 federal election, Don Henderson invites a group of friends to celebrate a predicted Labor Party victory, much to the dismay of his wife, Kath. The Hendersons and their nine guests drink, joke, make love, and fight, all while coming to terms with their individual struggles in life.','/ze1TSaRBNJkgvNjvDJpUiWmRt9T.jpg','1976-11-10',90,'Released','What a helluva night!','Don\'s Party',38919,1.3657,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7051,_binary '\0','/54upLqnMOkkmsh8KC1WirJrar0B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074423',6.6,1568,'it','La donna della domenica','Police commissioner Santamaria is investigating the murder of the ambiguous architect Mr. Garrone. The investigations soon drive him into the Torino\'s high society. Santamaria suspect Anna Carla and at the same time falls in love for her. Lello is the lover of Massimo, Anna Carla’s gay friend. He is following another direction in order to find out the truth, and his results are confusing the Policeman. But another murder happens...','/jb2Ocf9vNJUoM4JoISUIkxtGEDK.jpg','1975-12-23',109,'Released','The police have the victim, the weapon and the suspect. What they don\'t have is the Sunday Woman.','The Sunday Woman',57310,2.1306,6.5,'4jhcmUoXENs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7052,_binary '\0','/2vq6DRmyvzHOwoxcowNnlxjyG1k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074434',3.7,2417,'en','Drive-In Massacre','Two police detectives try to catch a serial killer who is stalking a rural California drive-in theater, randomly killing people with a sword.','/kXGQqNHEYouprwKzZBxMMURpv0n.jpg','1976-12-20',74,'Released','... YOUR NIGHTMARES ARE ABOUT TO COME TRUE','Drive-In Massacre',30833,1.2482,4.1,'aLI7M__tMMM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7053,_binary '\0','/zg73StIhidGmkvK8ugxrFN52MOa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074437',5.5,1243,'en','Drum','A mid-19th century mulatto slave is torn between his success as a pit-fighter and the injustices of white society.','/tKJUvemUAd0oXwyDuV4cpVzpkxh.jpg','1976-07-30',100,'Released','MANDINGO lit the fuse... DRUM is the explosion!','Drum',86194,2.2873,5.2,'8Ps9A6SqPSw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7054,_binary '\0','/4bIiZWdlCzD9go01jYKgNRqR21G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074441',5.8,2162,'en','The Duchess and the Dirtwater Fox','A female hustler is chasing after rich men, but becomes repeatedly mixed up with a suave con man and card shark through a series of misadventures before falling in love with him.','/uGPpWdIfWwPlZEYE9TfEodZVs2l.jpg','1976-04-01',103,'Released','Once upon a time, If the rustlers didn\'t get you, the hustlers did.','The Duchess and the Dirtwater Fox',54613,2.2531,6.1,'SSi5i3LAT-U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7055,_binary '\0','/Z8oLm2hKJ5aVlTyayQ83UqnK6S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074442',7.1,14416,'it','I due superpiedi quasi piatti','An attempted robbery turns to be an unexpected recruitment when two unemployed men mistakenly break into a police office instead of a store.','/z35E0qY8wkkSPIBT5ptQAyWvr8k.jpg','1977-04-01',115,'Released','Hill and Spencer! They\'re a pair of car-crashing, womanizing, rough-housing loudmouths... and they\'re the good guys!','Crime Busters',11689,4.8936,7,'ti4ldRJ0sRA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7056,_binary '\0','/6MRaICaejphtCjUQbFNSjeGfzEt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074443',6.9,2052,'fr','Duelle (une quarantaine)','Two enigmatic women, both with a hidden but shared motive, separately arrive in Paris. As they navigate the city and their search progresses, various characters become entangled within their conflict, one which increasingly comes to take a fantastical turn. These characters too, driven by their own desires, strive for their own goals in the fight. From a Paris, drenched in an otherworldly ambiance, a tale of desire and power emerges through mystery.','/6pYgnWXuSDVViwcFLQuptl0TVKV.jpg','1976-09-15',121,'Released',NULL,'Duelle (Une Quarantaine)',65707,1.7141,6.9,'2Oyl-A1_itk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7057,_binary '\0','/kDxL1EbO5sJ0oobbWnb1fEkhAg7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074447',7.7,1795,'ru','Двадцать дней без войны','War correspondent Lopatin takes a 20-day-leave from his hard work at the front in 1942. He travels to faraway Tashkent to meet the family of the killed soldier and visit the film set of the screen adaptation of his war-time stories. Lopatin also manages to walk the streets of Tashkent, take part in a factory workers\' meeting and have a short-lived love affair. Although with no bombings and fighting, the city dwellers breathe the atmosphere of the ongoing war.','/rwN9WaZkqn8lNKvAThUqwyZrOqu.jpg','1976-11-08',101,'Released',NULL,'Twenty Days Without War',133008,1.794,6.667,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7058,_binary '\0','/kk1EDdwnERVB89VRuqlJjPGHexu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074452',6.9,27627,'en','The Eagle Has Landed','When the Nazi high command learns in late 1943 that Winston Churchill will be spending time at a country estate in Norfolk, it hatches an audacious scheme to kidnap the prime minister and spirit him to Germany for enforced negotiations with Hitler.','/dxLuj7VIv0ZRdvaIB6eY5fApONF.jpg','1976-12-24',135,'Released','The daring World War II plot that changed the course of history.','The Eagle Has Landed',11372,5.9885,6.7,'anFz2h-zKwE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7059,_binary '\0','/2ZXKW9TMCBloNd7KVbdWe0U6rRd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074455',5.5,9988,'en','Eaten Alive','A psychotic redneck owns a dilapidated hotel in rural East Texas, where he murders those who upset him or his business, and then feeds their remains to his pet crocodile in the swamp beside his hotel.','/9pQk8hRRCNfvFEjlOuyUWFsXryS.jpg','1976-12-25',91,'Released','Meet the maniac & his friend.','Eaten Alive',30062,3.2626,5.517,'9cQGA5VRj50','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7060,_binary '\0','/myKJ6PaZTzK4IWE5yifXvnfMkUT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074462',8.1,3645,'no','Edvard Munch','Edvard Munch\'s childhood is overshadowed by death: he suffers the loss of his sister and mother, while enduring serious illness himself, almost dying. At university, Munch discovers his talent as a painter. As he immerses himself in the art world, he becomes part of a cultural revolution led by the likes of nihilist Hans Jæger.','/aXAkJld5UTIa0nijWvDm7DcyBe0.jpg','1974-11-12',174,'Released','A superlative film','Edvard Munch',50254,2.2052,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7061,_binary '','/1u0DES9ZCEyuhCWqK4hnf55axgc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074473',5.2,2213,'it','Emanuelle in America','The untameable photo reporter Emanuelle travels the world documenting the sexual practices of the rich and powerful, getting dangerously close to their most disturbing and hidden schemes.','/nkrect0e1EjTohYmnziiMuLmS3z.jpg','1977-01-05',100,'Released','The bare black Emanuelle in the decadent West!','Emanuelle in America',28682,3.8216,5.2,'AdCQiCRexcU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7062,_binary '\0','/e5q2xS27r8hFLpZgftZ397g9Ltv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074475',5.2,2015,'en','Embryo','A scientist doing experiments on a human fetus discovers a method to accelerate the fetus into a mature adult in just a few days.','/96NDgMsfzQl0AfcBOX8t0JaNtfG.jpg','1976-05-21',104,'Released','From Embryo to woman in 4 and a half weeks.','Embryo',113525,1.4357,4.7,'PcABy_epWOA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7063,_binary '\0','/tZpojTmOQcFbjAuKKW40gHVZrdW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074478',4.4,1503,'it','Emanuelle nera: Orient reportage','A reporter travels the world\'s hot spots, looking for lurid stories that usually involve her sexual participation in gaining those behind-the-scenes exclusives.','/p7UqSI8gzRyX2nZ096Y9kidlKQD.jpg','1976-05-07',94,'Released','She\'s hotter than ever!','Emanuelle in Bangkok',39965,2.2316,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7064,_binary '\0','/bAMxzr52aGwNOQrrxqYyIrvx9zk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074483',6.7,53614,'en','The Enforcer','Dirty Harry Callahan returns again, this time saddled with a rookie female partner. Together, they must stop a terrorist group consisting of angry Vietnam veterans.','/l0W85fpnsfnpLSSF3D6bKKlH1dD.jpg','1976-12-16',96,'Released','The dirtiest Harry of them all.','The Enforcer',10649,6.0312,6.726,'ocz7A2B9H-c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7065,_binary '\0','/ApB0mF2d5Oqioi3yxjuogiotSLI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074486',7.2,145659,'en','Eraserhead','First-time father Henry Spencer tries to survive his industrial environment, his angry girlfriend, and the unbearable screams of his newly born mutant child.','/mxveW3mGVc0DzLdOmtkZsgd7c3B.jpg','1977-09-28',89,'Released','Where your nightmares end...','Eraserhead',985,8.3375,7.334,'zVJICfUx8M0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7066,_binary '\0','/gc3eJlBJQfYHRkCko3BBZEtcbPd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074512',6.8,27134,'en','Family Plot','Spiritualist Blanche Tyler and her cab-driving boyfriend encounter a pair of serial kidnappers while trailing a missing heir in California.','/oQ9QbyBuIM2uYaheSKjs2x1xIQV.jpg','1976-04-09',120,'Released','There\'s no body in the family plot.','Family Plot',5854,4.3024,6.8,'YVazwgLDFvI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7067,_binary '\0','/iIa6ESmKS9HhaqGcK470Asp9PcO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074515',7,1591,'de','Der Fangschuss','A countess loves her brother\'s Prussian-officer friend in the 1919 Baltic area.','/aXQrL5wvL0DEmJz1ttEiJtiHixt.jpg','1976-10-21',95,'Released',NULL,'Coup de Grâce',42226,1.9475,6.4,'2j-gE9Qv4pA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7068,_binary '\0','/8cg1VtHc2fdiRJYchbvvo2srswZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074520',7.2,2527,'it','Febbre da cavallo','Bruno Fioretti, known as \"Mandrake\", is an inveterate gambler who never misses a day at the horse racing track in Rome. He is doubly unlucky: he bets too much on one horse, and his wife is sleeping with his best friend because Mandrake is always at the track. Penniless and cuckolded, Mandrake decides to make one last bet.','/zprLOtwwjjTF84YOGIZxakRu9Mc.jpg','1976-10-29',90,'Released',NULL,'Horse Fever',38528,1.4945,7.324,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7069,_binary '\0','/uDyynmrQV72gIifcIZ8Q9MrGPRk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074524',6.4,1786,'fr','Calmos','Two men, fortyish, worn out by their wives, abandon everything to go and live in the back of beyond. There they meet a truculent priest, a boozer, Émile who recalls them to life\'s simple pleasures. Calm is what they want. But soon their example inspires thousands of disorientated males...','/bOnd2yApKBVyjxchUjN1hG5E0kV.jpg','1976-02-11',81,'Released',NULL,'Femmes Fatales',63481,2.4306,6.129,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7070,_binary '\0','/45T9LZP05KxEmII4PgSBksAOOfE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074539',5.9,1659,'fr','La Flûte à six schtroumpfs','The evil knight Torchesac, who is at the service of the sinister lord of La Mortaille, gets a very powerful magic flute and uses it for evil purposes. Johan and Pirlouit, assisted by the magician Homnibus, travel to the land of the Smurfs, the only manufacturers of this sort of instrument, to get a new one and battle the usurpers.','/mrTcqCsW7W6H3LIBzI13ODFWT9g.jpg','1975-12-24',90,'Released','You\'re in for a \'SMURFING\' GOOD TIME… with those little blue people you love!','The Smurfs and the Magic Flute',53566,2.8715,6.5,'bciaEj-hNyA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7071,_binary '\0','/xeXkl6xhaCZgfPsCQpHotZVLozU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074540',4.7,5436,'en','The Food of the Gods','Morgan and his friends are on a hunting trip on a remote Canadian island when they are attacked by a swarm of giant wasps. Looking for help, Morgan stumbles across a barn inhabited by an enormous killer chicken. After doing some exploring, they discover the entire island is crawling with animals that have somehow grown to giant size. The most dangerous of all of these, however, are the rats, who are mobilizing to do battle with the human intruders.','/1aalvl6E6Ruz9S4B9UOPONytqyR.jpg','1976-06-18',88,'Released','Welcome to the Bottom of the Food Chain!','The Food of the Gods',42245,3.5289,5,'77KpoGDVkxk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7072,_binary '\0','/bJFKg1jx2grgZoUxkJFEs2LROhs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074553',6.5,3571,'en','From Noon Till Three','Bank robber Graham Dorsey spends a few hours with beautiful widow Amanda Starbuck, in which time his gang takes part in a disastrous holdup. Learning of his comrades\' demise, Dorsey goes on the lam. Believing her short-term lover was killed by the law, Amanda decides to make the most of having had a liaison with the supposedly deceased desperado by writing a book about him. Much to his confusion, the still-living Dorsey watches as his name becomes legendary.','/9n0F4swweH369HTI0etLc6fAuyi.jpg','1976-08-01',99,'Released','The most wanted men in the west!','From Noon Till Three',6476,3.2537,5.96,'eb1nIFn_EQE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7073,_binary '\0','/4cUpxWKuQ4Wr1hKbZM9cRUIfzVi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074554',7.3,10436,'en','The Front','A cashier poses as a writer for blacklisted talents to submit their work through, but the injustice around him pushes him to take a stand.','/dXXNbw7xeW2nuUiSSKJ59xNSf6N.jpg','1976-09-30',95,'Released','America\'s most unlikely hero.','The Front',1723,3.0401,7,'43cyj2POnkg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7074,_binary '\0','/kGdrLjZ1J3XlD57LFjUQN6npCFQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074559',5.7,13229,'en','Futureworld','Two years after the Westworld tragedy in the Delos amusement park, the corporate owners have reopened the park following over $1 billion in safety and other improvements. For publicity purposes, reporters Chuck Browning and Tracy Ballard are invited to review the park. Just prior to arriving, however, Browning is given a clue by a dying man that something is amiss.','/sH5b8w52rEt8iqc1ibt1SwU5P.jpg','1976-07-14',108,'Released','Is this you... or are YOU you?','Futureworld',10640,4.105,5.9,'McF81caWG2U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7075,_binary '\0','/l7sNa1FYIEevAMu1pCWOj615dIu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074564',5.8,5649,'en','Gator','After his release from prison, notorious ex-con and moonshine distiller Gator McKlusky moves in with his father in a cabin in the Okefenokee Swamp. His bootlegging plans are cut short, however, when a federal agent tells McKlusky that he will lose custody of his 9-year-old daughter unless he helps bring down local crime lord Bama McCall. McKlusky enlists the help of reporter Aggie Maybank and a few local eccentrics to bring down McCall\'s empire.','/n7mBSRhiH3qPHNgXqTc2evCx186.jpg','1976-08-25',115,'Released','Come and get him.','Gator',21882,2.7238,5.223,'uEyvYnUXD4M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7076,_binary '\0','/x0nrqyQNvWia4hVHsfoHRVDig3r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074565',7.8,3261,'fa','گوزنها','An urban guerrilla, wounded after a bank robbery, seeks refuge with his childhood friend—only to discover that his friend has fallen into addiction. The guerrilla hides in his house and gradually begins to influence him, helping him regain his courage and strength. Eventually, he entrusts the stolen money to him…','/zVQ1pYXKWGJeWfqdZyAAVgEBr6d.jpg','1976-01-28',120,'Released',NULL,'The Deer',268028,0.6922,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7077,_binary '\0','/gfLP3XDO8EXgbSaXPCeyDd1b8RW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074569',4.4,1838,'it','L\'ultima orgia del III Reich','Lise Cohen is taken to a special prisoner-of-war camp for female Jews, a camp run as a bordello to entertain the German officers and troops going in to battle. The camp is run with an iron fist by Commandant Starker and his minion Alma. Starker becomes frustrated when Lise demonstrates no fear, and devises cruel experiments to scare her, to no avail. Once she realizes her guilt is unfounded, Lise begins to play Starker\'s game, but even though she begins living a better life, she doesn\'t forget the atrocities she has seen and experienced.','/lLnhAs01wHT8wQ6zTXTwBYl1u8j.jpg','1977-01-21',81,'Released','The Sickest Entry in the Nazisploitation Genre!','Gestapo\'s Last Orgy',39987,2.7292,4.6,'3eRNgivhLyg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7078,_binary '\0','/5f3tOClRnQOXF45qU5gxwojppTU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074575',5,1933,'it','Diamante Lobo','Priest turned vigilante Father John hunts down a gang of criminals, led by Sam Clayton, who killed a man in a local bar. On the gang\'s return to the town, they kill the priest, leaving a young parishioner Johnny behind. He now seeks revenge for the death of the holy man.','/8NpAE7y4UVTj4yf9z0hTNz3Ksgd.jpg','1976-02-01',97,'Released','Two Brothers... One Took the Cross... The Other Took the Gun.','God\'s Gun',79194,2.7691,5,'20OXLTljSyY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7079,_binary '\0','/zZ33CrryvkEqTKJDpbBCRkAyltx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074586',7.1,1862,'it','Il grande racket','Nico Palmieri is a police inspector who battles a criminal gang terrorizing a sleepy Italian town, extorting cash from the local merchants. With the threat of violence, no one dares to act, except for a restaurant owner who is forced by Palmieri to tell the truth.','/fFCFIJzdorIRP39Dc55xO68glsc.jpg','1976-08-12',104,'Released','Someone\'s gonna pay...','The Big Racket',39979,1.6081,6.9,'boxrwXcVB_o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7080,_binary '\0','/u5AMpJMOQSMWxYjljlPcuTFUqWC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074588',6.1,1818,'en','The Great Scout & Cathouse Thursday','Sam Longwood, a frontiersman who has seen better days, spies the gold-mine partner, Jack Colby, who ran off with all the gold from a mine they were prospecting fifteen years earlier. He tells his other partners from that time, Joe Knox and Billy, and they confront Colby demanding not only the thousand dollars he took but an addition fifty-nine thousand for their trouble. After being thwarted in this attempt, they, and a would-be named Thursday, hatch a plan to kidnap Colby\'s wife, Nancy Sue, who is coincidently Sam\'s old flame, but find that Nancy Sue is not the sweet girl that Sam remembers.','/1qiDqaJEUc2mCqErJ5V7N40mgoN.jpg','1976-06-23',102,'Released','They Weren\'t Forgotten By History... They Were Left Out On Purpose!','The Great Scout & Cathouse Thursday',50953,1.9969,5.125,'pv4TUiMwoZc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7081,_binary '\0','/jGIYenhvcaxSbpErtYh0SicFunF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074593',5.2,6916,'en','Grizzly','An eighteen-foot grizzly bear figures out that humans make for a tasty treat. As a park ranger tries rallying his men to bring about the bear\'s capture or destruction, his efforts are thwarted by the introduction of dozens of drunken hunters into the area.','/uuEcmQCzDBOakOT4JaMzNn9GBcY.jpg','1976-05-21',91,'Released','18 feet of gut-crunching, man eating terror!','Grizzly',55784,2.8507,5.2,'CExyNKuEjXo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7082,_binary '\0','/uIU0aVlVKq0oeBsneRimcQ6ZYar.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074597',6.2,4958,'en','The Gumball Rally','A group of people from different backgrounds have one thing in common: when they hear the world \"gumball\" whispered by one of the others, they know that it\'s time for the Gumball Rally: a no-holds barred, secret, winner-take-all rally across the USA.','/zGUcAbSe8aMavsBdv7Vdo9DpAtJ.jpg','1976-07-28',105,'Released','It\'s a hilarious coast-to-coast, 180 mile-an-hour, go-for-broke, outrageous road race with the world\'s most expensive cars. And it\'s all just for glory and a gumball machine.','The Gumball Rally',25305,3.1554,6.1,'tKF390MNM7k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7083,_binary '\0','/segejWs9VMhL22HlPgyko0bQdaT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074599',5.7,2395,'en','Gus','The California Atoms are in last place with no hope of moving up. But by switching the mule from team mascot to team member, (He can kick 100 yard field goals!) they start winning, and move up in the rankings, Hurrah! The competition isn\'t so happy.','/p85XLgX858DoH5WjE07iABii7ja.jpg','1976-07-07',96,'Released','It\'s the league\'s leading laugh scorer!','Gus',20639,1.9836,5.9,'rg-9SemfezA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7084,_binary '\0','/pVspyFNl8uE8jAoY3C973XkjTgB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074605',8.2,7708,'en','Harlan County U.S.A.','A heartbreaking record of the thirteen-month struggle between a community fighting to survive and a corporation dedicated to the bottom line.','/4TQwyqULcE87BHCOIt7NvCEzfQi.jpg','1976-10-15',104,'Released','Which Side Are You On?','Harlan County U.S.A.',33324,2.325,7.6,'xiW_K2QLBGk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7085,_binary '\0','/jhrRI9bALno5OAh8jXD061wY9uA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074608',5.4,1429,'en','Harry and Walter Go to New York','Two hopelessly out of their class con-men attempt to pull off the largest bank heist of the 19th century — by gaining the enmity of the most famous bank robber in the world and the affection of a crusading newspaperwoman.','/2EUjz08MUVoZxekNnWZIasjZ5yh.jpg','1976-06-17',115,'Released','All the Digby-Hill-Chestnut gang need is two breaks... out of jail... into a safe.','Harry and Walter Go to New York',149445,2.002,5.6,'xqUN5c2p3RQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7086,_binary '\0','/gx29nj8kBz79kcnjJbIGx5ZL8av.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074611',6.2,3660,'en','Full Circle','After the death of her daughter, wealthy housewife Julia Lofting abruptly leaves her husband and moves into an old Victorian home in London to re-start her life. All seems well until she is haunted by the sadness of losing her own child and the ghosts of other children.','/jqOzORZjPWPZ0xdlBBQ2URm8p1B.jpg','1978-02-09',98,'Released','She had no one to play with for thirty years.','Full Circle',102283,2.2939,6.206,'yFsXaU5cNu4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7087,_binary '\0','/nnUPsBal4N7Pn9LavIRDDJzq62w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074626',6.8,7428,'de','Herz aus Glas','A small Bavarian village is renowned for its \"Ruby Glass\" glass blowing works. When the foreman of the works dies suddenly without revealing the secret of the Ruby Glass, the town slides into a deep depression, and the owner of the glassworks becomes obssessed with the lost secret.','/yaYs87zLoXTK1pPKSMfJQRnwxgL.jpg','1976-11-12',94,'Released',NULL,'Heart of Glass',27378,2.327,6.548,'rGdEeKxSrX4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7088,_binary '\0','/2fWPR6YBv4M6xcYkoiS7OAhDUzw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074633',5.8,1880,'en','Hollywood Boulevard','A Midwestern ingenue arrives in Hollywood to try her luck as an actress. An incompetent agent hooks her up with a production company which specializes in low budget B-movie fare, which starts being plagued by strange, deadly accidents.','/fPvzlPpaXcnj8QmQjqevyxZNcVi.jpg','1976-04-25',83,'Released','The street where starlets are made!','Hollywood Boulevard',29856,2.1031,5.6,'0BkjA_zwr4Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7089,_binary '\0','/q2y8XKJAXrUuqUo61MqMTKknMEu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074650',6.3,1533,'de','How Much Wood Would a Woodchuck Chuck: Beobachtungen zu einer neuen Sprache','A documentary short examining the language and performance of auctioneering, filmed at the World Livestock Auctioneer Championship in Pennsylvania.','/ozOhLCvivaRlTTregb7clqGkOEz.jpg','1976-10-30',47,'Released',NULL,'How Much Wood Would a Woodchuck Chuck',100224,1.3686,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7090,_binary '\0','/7DCtUu3IlAst17qr9ugJCq6GHLf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074653',6.1,2198,'en','The Human Tornado','Dolemite comes to the rescue of Queen Bee, whose nightclub is threatened by the Mafia.','/xTwLcUMwjktY6XZnUSJZlWGfWt0.jpg','1976-10-02',96,'Released','Nerve-shattering… Brain-battering… Mind-splattering… A ONE MAN DISASTER!','The Human Tornado',32100,1.6485,6.1,'TfgKJ9G_2fg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7091,_binary '\0','/zQ2pdITTjM0BxxAqUwTp5gxAFag.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074664',7.6,1661,'de','Ich will doch nur, dass ihr mich liebt','Peter grew up during the economic miracle, bereft of parental care and love. Learning early on that interpersonal relationships are based on the principles of exchange or purchase, he abides by these rules and gives generous presents to his family and his wife, Erika. But when he is unable to keep up this lifestyle, his story takes a horrendous turn...','/iWRLLbOwaX1ZrWXCw2W9Ee9OiJ0.jpg','1976-03-23',104,'Released',NULL,'I Only Want You to Love Me',93655,1.9854,7.29,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7092,_binary '\0','/e6Dl1F3uPc2YoW3EZDCXKK1cAdo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074670',5,3455,'en','Ilsa: Harem Keeper of the Oil Sheiks','Ilsa works for an Arab sheik who enjoys importing females to use as sex slaves.','/4VJCCR8pHotBu1hn62vpeSsii3S.jpg','1976-02-29',94,'Released','Ilsa\'s back! ...More fierce than ever! With brutal fury she enslaved an empire and shocked the world!','Ilsa: Harem Keeper of the Oil Sheiks',7392,4.0733,4.888,'v5IkT9t32k8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7093,_binary '\0','/j1R4wGpgfgY219Z7cDDZQJOM6TI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074686',7.4,4909,'it','L\'innocente','Tullio Hermil is a chauvinist aristocrat who flaunts his mistress to his wife, but when he believes she has been unfaithful he becomes enamored of her again.','/90WVQLoRRW0n4GObgtlYcr9xRp0.jpg','1976-05-18',130,'Released','Visconti\'s Sensual Epic of a Diabolical Marriage','The Innocent',4286,2.8613,6.897,'MVRP3zfr7d8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7094,_binary '\0','/b2dcI0hBjadtqq6rzQoGBcSvSDp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074691',7.1,1400,'ja','犬神家の一族','When a tycoon passes away, he unexpectedly leaves the family fortune to outsider Tamayo on the condition that she marries one of the grandsons, pitting blood against blood.','/591Ro8qtiwGYaxDg9V2gVBLkOQN.jpg','1976-10-16',146,'Released',NULL,'The Inugami Family',76715,2.3773,7,'ViUgudxJL8U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7095,_binary '\0','/edUMdGAWTwc6RA2uhvagZJkrhAw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074695',7.4,31915,'en','Cross of Iron','It is 1943, and the German army—ravaged and demoralised—is hastily retreating from the Russian front. In the midst of the madness, conflict brews between the aristocratic yet ultimately pusillanimous Captain Stransky and the courageous Corporal Steiner. Stransky is the only man who believes that the Third Reich is still vastly superior to the Russian army. However, within his pompous persona lies a quivering coward who longs for the Iron Cross so that he can return to Berlin a hero. Steiner, on the other hand is cynical, defiantly non-conformist and more concerned with the safety of his own men rather than the horde of military decorations offered to him by his superiors.','/fR6pqh5aFn0fawsn7sR2zC15swx.jpg','1977-01-28',133,'Released','On the Eastern front in 1943, the German soldiers no longer had any ideals. They were not fighting for the Party—but for their lives!','Cross of Iron',10839,5.8706,7.143,'PBn3kOvK_qI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7096,_binary '\0','/1CGhgCZ4qMNcbRyz8dPJgnK6tpP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074703',6,1721,'en','J.D.\'s Revenge','After notorious New Orleans gangster J.D. Walker is murdered in the 1940s, his spirit remains restless for three decades, until a hypnotist\'s supernatural nightclub act allows him to take over the body of a mild-mannered law student and seek revenge on those who had him killed.','/s9uQYcIJj3W4bsIhY1ohqpVYqga.jpg','1976-08-25',95,'Released','He came back from the dead to possess a man\'s soul, make love to his woman, and get the Vengeance he craved!','J.D.\'s Revenge',44690,2.3888,5.9,'kokkZwkQmD0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7097,_binary '\0','/2ntPUgGWnSuw7DjftoJaaZhhBbK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074706',6.1,1639,'en','Jackson County Jail','A young woman stumbles into a nightmare land of hijacking and humiliation while driving cross-country from California to New York.','/6oFezms8XgNvVdAWEB3abBpu6TP.jpg','1976-03-31',84,'Released','The cops are there to protect her… but who will protect her from the cops?','Jackson County Jail',21950,1.9148,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7098,_binary '\0','/xH7DjZC53RT0N1a36r3DXWJSVJd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074710',8.3,2013,'bn','জনঅরণ্য','A bright and idealistic young graduate steels himself for a dog-eat-dog world, only to flounder in a job market packed with thousands of other hopefuls. When he eventually decides to start his own business as a middle-man, he discovers that the world of business does not live up to his lofty ideals.','/6dOHOKvGzL1raSjWPLrnzllweqp.jpg','1976-02-20',131,'Released',NULL,'The Middleman',122445,1.0959,7.167,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7099,_binary '\0','/mok2DwxDXik93xx7BoIRsxXGKOf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074718',7.5,1331,'fr','Jonas qui aura 25 ans en l\'an 2000','A look at the lives of several men and women in their 30s as they confront the slim gains of the \"revolutionary\" sixties. Max, a dissatisfied copy editor; Myriam, a redhead into tantric sex; and Marie, a supermarket checker who gives unauthorized discounts to the elderly, search for renewed meaning on a communal farm. The title character, a six-year-old child, is the carrier of their hopes for the future.','/zwqnEiUygCOGRZJvbzaTRF6tbsC.jpg','1976-12-01',116,'Released',NULL,'Jonah Who Will Be 25 in the Year 2000',42237,1.4751,6.7,'N8fhqHyRj6M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7100,_binary '\0','/viADylz58ZMoNsnZPCrQMyDbHZY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074720',7.4,7379,'fr','Le Jouet','When Francois, a journalist, tours a big store for an article, he is chosen by the son of the newspaper\'s owner, Rambal-Cochet, as his new toy. Needing money and unwilling to quit his job, Francois agrees to this ridiculous assignment. Gradually befriending the spoiled boy, he induces him to play at making a newspaper, unveiling publicly the tyrannical way of life of the father. The powerful emotional climax we experience with the child astonishes both men.','/o4X5KTSqAvelfw49Gx5BZDUEYCm.jpg','1976-12-08',95,'Released',NULL,'The Toy',56648,3.8024,6.93,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7101,_binary '\0','/eZniG0hjAFIm1sOLczSxBHacbs9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074730',7.1,2752,'hi','कभी कभी','A story spanning two generations, where two lovers are forced to marry against their will, but hold onto memories of their romance. Years later circumstances force them to confront their spouses, their children and each other.','/zi7Gkgt1PHtC96tXafNzrNQwgRp.jpg','1976-02-27',177,'Released','Love is life.','Kabhi Kabhie',73443,1.2963,6.375,'fy1b8YbbAqU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7102,_binary '\0','/cx7kTGcguQi9UHSYWKgWrIkI70d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074740',7,6926,'it','Keoma','Half-breed Keoma returns to his border hometown after service in the Civil War and finds it under the control of Caldwell, an ex-Confederate raider, and his vicious gang of thugs. To make matters worse, Keoma\'s three half-brothers have joined forces with Caldwell, and make it painfully clear that his return is an unwelcome one. Determined to break Caldwell and his brothers\' grip on the town, Keoma partners with his father\'s former ranch hand to exact violent revenge.','/9Dq0J0mNkUM7SatXzZr7QRciZa5.jpg','1976-11-25',102,'Released','Keoma means freedom','Keoma',6609,2.7944,6.822,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7103,_binary '\0','/80lGNnQWgPHa8gTlJ8ma3MdI7MF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074747',4.9,1329,'zh','風雨雙流星','Mi Wey is a local hero named after \"Killer Meteors\", his secret weapon which makes him invincible. However, when \"Immortal\" Wa Wu Bin, another powerful local character seeks his assistance, Killer Meteor will face the greatest and the deadliest challenge of his life.','/yLdmeGoD668KelJ8HcK5rS44VGE.jpg','1976-08-21',104,'Released',NULL,'Killer Meteors',46111,2.1043,4.9,'nc2jqKUdERk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7104,_binary '\0','/71oqZMM6dgKvi1WQztOoUHSzDdZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074749',7.2,16669,'en','The Killing of a Chinese Bookie','Cosmo Vittelli, the proprietor of a sleazy, low-rent Hollywood cabaret, has a real affection for the women who strip in his peepshows and the staff who keep up his dingy establishment. He also has a major gambling problem that has gotten him in trouble before. When Cosmo loses big-time at an underground casino run by mobster Mort, he isn\'t able to pay up. Mort then offers Cosmo the chance to pay back his debt by knocking off a pesky, Mafia-protected bookie.','/lShPFOAbQ6y6oFYUfecmrj7BUu6.jpg','1976-02-15',135,'Released',NULL,'The Killing of a Chinese Bookie',32040,4.1132,7,'1UTPS2iwAX4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7105,_binary '\0','/iRSRs1RRIXzYt7geifmSeg7qCdr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074751',6,38781,'en','King Kong','An oil company expedition disturbs the peace of a giant ape and brings him back to New York to exploit him.','/paYKhEwUaxKA05vmOfU7FlleTln.jpg','1976-12-15',134,'Released','The most exciting original motion picture event of all time.','King Kong',10730,7.7395,6.301,'CeRD6sNB0Uk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7106,_binary '\0','/zDMxb4i20UfMlAKYgNXDkpFi5tu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074768',3.5,1699,'it','Lager SSadis Kastrat Kommandantur','Near the end of WW2, prisoners of war are used in experiments to perfect the Arian race.','/1s3NnoCbBbqEa50A4ch8WYLORti.jpg','1976-11-16',94,'Released','Sex experiments in pursuit of a better tomorrow!','SS Experiment Love Camp',56386,2.4819,5.4,'kuqcqFdRdO8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7107,_binary '\0','/oRtQs4p7pWhuET78yv405Ga1FUJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074769',4.3,2167,'en','The Devil\'s Men','A satanic cult led by Baron Corofax kidnaps three young people and Father Roche & Milo must save them from the hands of this evil.','/4FOaTeld70YIwcg1N1FE7z2zuTN.jpg','1976-08-11',90,'Released','Half man - Half beast - Trapped in a world forgotten by time!','The Devil\'s Men',37904,1.7742,4.1,'At8tsK1Rgh4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7108,_binary '\0','/6AfKmLyXsHgoD8tvyvAhMMMxR8n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074776',6.2,2901,'en','The Last Hard Men','In 1909 Arizona, retired lawman Sam Burgade\'s life is thrown upside-down when his old enemy Provo and six other convicts escape a chain-gang in the Yuma Territorial Prison and come gunning for Burgade.','/qS8zHHEi9TxC6fbIzQGnJyHq69b.jpg','1976-04-22',98,'Released','Too Mean to Forgive... Too Mad to Forget!','The Last Hard Men',38450,2.4106,6.088,'bW-s0eK1rL4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7109,_binary '\0','/ecM0WDKsryZ6FIDRARPwNSppCJp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074777',6.2,10386,'en','The Last Tycoon','Monroe Stahr, a successful movie producer, pursues a beautiful and elusive young woman — all the while working himself to death.','/sETEj1ieRCH4suyaW7D3q4XfFWJ.jpg','1976-11-18',123,'Released','He has the power to make anyone\'s dream come true... except his own.','The Last Tycoon',37774,3.2901,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7110,_binary '\0','/15hxdCGePVfk6edVXLV6WyiQqZ8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074798',6.6,2180,'en','Lifeguard','Rick is a Los Angeles County lifeguard who is in his thirties. At his 15-year high school reunion, he sees his old girlfriend who is now a divorced mother. After falling in love with her, Rick considers changing his career and lifestyle.','/u8vhmXoJhUfc7iVXO3VEskXDKgK.jpg','1976-07-23',96,'Released','Every girl\'s summer dream.','Lifeguard',5002,2.4051,6.132,'t0qqTsT8Vus','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7111,_binary '\0','/dGWjaECuh6MLPkqUrFlQsmig7KB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074799',6.6,1381,'en','The Likely Lads','With the destruction of their previous neighbourhood has inevitably come the destruction of the lads’ favoured watering hole The Fat Ox. Again, it’s Bob rather than Terry who is visibly distressed by this. Upset and much the worse for free alcohol, Bob then storms into the library to seek sympathy from Thelma - who is, predictably, unimpressed. So when Thelma finds out that Terry has been getting semi-serious with glamorous Finnish shop assistant Chris, she takes it upon herself to try and pair them off for good via planning first a dinner party and then that mainstay of 70s comedy, a camping expedition. Of course, things don’t go quite according to plan and before you can say ‘I can see the way this is going’ we are set up for japes, larks and embarrassing incidents aplenty, which culminate in the lads getting rather fed up with their partners’ attempts to inflict the rugged outdoor lifestyle upon them and trying to hitch up and drive off with the girls still asleep in the caravan.','/2iBgBGgSEYCMQwXQIrUADPwTtFL.jpg','1976-02-01',90,'Released','Emotion blazes across the big screen as Bob and Terry knock down the frontiers of human knowledge and Newcastle ale.','The Likely Lads',56837,1.3233,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7112,_binary '\0','/3j5JiRvHlvmsBABBxoPDlJXV0CI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074802',5.7,3050,'en','Lipstick','A top fashion model seeks justice after getting sexually assaulted by her teenage sister\'s obsessive music teacher.','/kJadg3azo3gHNhrVkJppFqJO62j.jpg','1976-04-02',89,'Released','It isn\'t always an invitation to a kiss.','Lipstick',59809,2.2068,5.405,'id30eXT404g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7113,_binary '\0','/iqoDhrRZWkEHcl3Id6NIMkApwDo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074806',7,20448,'en','The Little Girl Who Lives Down the Lane','13-year-old Rynn Jacobs lives in a New England beach town. Whenever the landlady inquires after Rynn\'s father, she claims that he\'s not available. But when the landlady\'s son, Frank, won\'t leave Rynn alone, she teams up with a neighbor Mario to maintain the dark family secret that she\'s been keeping to herself.','/qlH7atDoN2iOmq6pNsoFIlebhgA.jpg','1976-12-25',91,'Released','Ask her no questions, she\'ll tell you no lies. Ask her too many and somebody dies.','The Little Girl Who Lives Down the Lane',19971,4.4243,7,'BoXX8XHeGA4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7114,_binary '\0','/foS1hXCMagcl3GnK0hJHslNw9Ne.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074811',7.5,51957,'en','Le locataire','A quiet and inconspicuous man rents an apartment in Paris where he finds himself drawn into a rabbit hole of dangerous paranoia.','/4Qhzb1ICFMqE3isWoln497qSH7n.jpg','1976-05-26',126,'Released','Apartment for rent: Quiet building. Furnished. 2 rooms. Previous tenant committed suicide.','The Tenant',11482,6.2448,7.6,'GaAlkTJ0wqk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7115,_binary '\0','/yJXAo8N60RaVC6pEuXUQ6wFBCCA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074812',6.8,66449,'en','Logan\'s Run','In the 23rd century, inhabitants of a domed city freely experience all of life\'s pleasures — but no one is allowed to live past 30. Citizens can try for a chance at being \"renewed\" in a civic ceremony on their 30th birthday. Escape is the only other option.','/v3ILN8ROPcrNRJ8S7GH24JyihH8.jpg','1976-06-23',118,'Released','Welcome to the 23rd century. The perfect world of total pleasure...there\'s just one catch.','Logan\'s Run',10803,7.61,6.616,'JPauhZFMXo8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7116,_binary '\0','/4vPAdrrsOUJbZcgTy4RfhKyEFNj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074815',3.2,1403,'en','Look What\'s Happened to Rosemary\'s Baby','Baby Adrian is now all grown up and separated from his mother, wrestling with the occult influences that plague him, and trying to outrun Satan himself.','/7jd6uKpLv7FRkBMr9IuuZz89cQP.jpg','1976-10-29',96,'Released','Rosemary\'s baby rocked millions. Now, Satan\'s child comes of age!','Look What\'s Happened to Rosemary\'s Baby',117258,2.2463,3.5,'1HejANGdEHQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7117,_binary '\0','/uZF6FSaCjS3LCxgYFvTBYMu2LJu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074829',5,1642,'it','La lupa mannara','A woman has dreams that she is a werewolf so she goes out and finds men. She proceeds to have sex with them and then rip their throats out with her teeth. She eventually falls in love but then she is raped and her lover is murdered so she goes out for revenge.','/xvOpwD1repotP22ZWsyJo1Bz3pJ.jpg','1976-03-18',98,'Released','A true story so brutal and horrifying it was kept from the public for over a century!','Werewolf Woman',92751,3.843,4.7,'B9Hg-GCSc2g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7118,_binary '\0','/8BIsBqUC93Er67lG5sc10wDf6ma.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074836',6.1,2125,'en','Mad Dog Morgan','The true story of Irish outlaw Daniel Morgan, who is wanted, dead or alive, in Australia during the 1850s.','/f8auu89Ta3QcWFjez0vkSkYCxAE.jpg','1976-07-09',102,'Released','Beaten, branded, brutalized, but never broken.','Mad Dog Morgan',60269,1.8414,5.933,'QwtWMI_aslo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7119,_binary '\0','/5u1I4oja97hTKIL92iqjfU1RAKS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074845',4.3,1255,'en','Mako: The Jaws of Death','A man accidentally learns that he has a mystical connection with sharks, and is given a strange medallion by a shaman. Becoming more and more alienated from normal society, he develops an ability to communicate with sharks telepathically, setting out to destroy anybody who harms sharks. People enter into his strange world to exploit his weird passion, and he uses the animals to gain revenge on anybody who double crosses him.','/fr59VuliyXNQRtVYUAGXtfTZ0jK.jpg','1976-04-15',86,'Released','Filmed without the benefit of cages, mechanical sharks and other protective devices.','Mako: The Jaws of Death',97559,2.1372,4.4,'SCAXfuznbUk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7120,_binary '\0','/ew3x9p8A28p3sLE8OaHwUsb1mSQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074851',6.6,31612,'en','The Man Who Fell to Earth','Thomas Jerome Newton is an alien who has come to Earth in search of water to save his home planet. Aided by lawyer Oliver Farnsworth, Thomas uses his knowledge of advanced technology to create profitable inventions. While developing a method to transport water, Thomas meets Mary-Lou, a quiet hotel clerk, and begins to fall in love with her. Just as he is ready to leave Earth, Thomas is intercepted by the U.S. government, and his entire plan is threatened.','/gwmPVphE5DMFFGXGMhfEFyxOOYj.jpg','1976-03-18',139,'Released','Power, space, time and a visitor.','The Man Who Fell to Earth',991,6.0118,6.5,'KUtJ5FnwfCk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7121,_binary '\0','/qe4sD6Mbf4ACOVD0H3XN5JQm8Hi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074853',6.6,3862,'en','The Man in the Iron Mask','Years have passed since the Three Musketeers, Aramis, Athos and Porthos, have fought together with their friend, D\'Artagnan. But with the tyrannical King Louis using his power to wreak havoc in the kingdom while his twin brother, Philippe, remains imprisoned, the Musketeers reunite to abduct Louis and replace him with Philippe.','/hReotlx9HXp6WqJLoBqfehqyMiq.jpg','1977-07-17',100,'Released','The Classic Adventure of Heroism, Betrayal and Triumph.','The Man in the Iron Mask',4199,3.2901,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7122,_binary '\0','/nI0DoZzevFQ75xtZDYFplOgwp1P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074857',7.2,5815,'sv','Mannen på taket','When an inspector is murdered in hospital, the investigation led by Detective Martin Beck uncovers reports of misconduct and possibly revenge.','/5qFlUGPLD1BQEuNc3oSOI6ZC8WH.jpg','1976-10-01',108,'Released',NULL,'Man on the Roof',25699,1.8715,7.1,'0_YN9G39UcU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7123,_binary '\0','/t3j3HwSgOcpKHDg5CaYE4WnPQDC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074860',7.4,76528,'en','Marathon Man','A graduate student and obsessive runner in New York is drawn into a mysterious plot involving his brother, a member of the secretive Division.','/uPNgubSiri2yvBQRPtP77ViYjN.jpg','1976-10-08',126,'Released','One man\'s dangerous attempts to clear his father\'s name','Marathon Man',10518,4.7541,7.175,'8WmlhEO2cU4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7124,_binary '\0','/mdSgRCQLEsQmYjZGK96tbGckBmb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074865',8.1,2527,'cs','„Marečku, podejte mi pero!“','This comedy is about one average family. The father works as master in the factory and his son is studying on high school. One day father must start to visit the evening school. It\'s the same school as his son visiting. The lives both students are connecting together. The son must teach the math and physics his own father. The father getting to know, that the life of the students is not simple as he supposed.','/8ntcRPK1xXsh9Bdmv0wTRV7qSrJ.jpg','1976-10-08',91,'Released',NULL,'Marecek, Pass Me the Pen!',75023,1.4938,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7125,_binary '\0','/mR0Nrp9RvnZA1dyECEUKyiXT4GN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074868',5.1,1310,'fr','La marge','A businessman leaves his country home, and wife and young son for a business trip to Paris. While there he develops a sexual and spiritual bond with a call girl.','/lglqEFrAYHcAi8s6FeNtRru8P5O.jpg','1976-09-22',88,'Released','The line between love and lechery.','The Margin',65935,2.1384,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7126,_binary '\0','/uOetgTXdupZTgqSMEdnUYot5Ogs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074870',7,3262,'de','Die Marquise von O...','A German Marquise has to deal with a pregnancy she cannot explain and an infatuated Russian Count.','/z7oWathRvbObBUeCWae8AKrI5ZZ.jpg','1976-05-19',102,'Released',NULL,'The Marquise of O',48205,2.5922,6.7,'TGh3slt0jzo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7127,_binary '\0','/zp3CXHPJMK2YeVeZSeGWJ3z5BUK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074875',6.1,3406,'en','Massacre at Central High','Maimed by bullies at a California high school, a new student engineers acts of revenge.','/8NFPZ4y6PPaKrrsLZJaRM2VeTCO.jpg','1976-09-01',87,'Released','VIOLENCE-DRENCHED VARIETY','Massacre at Central High',16271,2.2965,5.8,'WG1zSLNbpvw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7128,_binary '\0','/y6rN93Sea9PpUrIWMdyXRbowSAe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074883',6.5,2724,'fr','Maîtresse','After breaking into a house he believes is empty, thief Olivier is caught by the owner, Ariane, who turns out to be a dominatrix. Improbably falling for her, Olivier returns periodically, and an impulsive romance blossoms despite Ariane\'s profession. Soon Olivier becomes more familiar with her work, even joining in on occasion. However, when he discovers that Ariane has a son, he attempts to \"fix\" her, hoping to give her a better life.','/4F9aPUvaWgU1ifvuHlaQgN6Ohnv.jpg','1976-02-11',112,'Released','She will open your eyes.','Maîtresse',46978,3.3914,5.9,'7QVBYbmHrPs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7129,_binary '\0','/ho9ZFVNEQLWqwWmd5IHCmpA8k3y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074888',7.1,1886,'fr','La Meilleure Façon de marcher','In 1960, Marc and Philippe are counselors at a summer camp in the French countryside. One night, Marc finds Philippe dressed and made up as a woman, and from now on, he will keep on humiliating Philippe.','/iW72f6PG7BAXdjIEvB2R7h4Gv6N.jpg','1976-03-03',82,'Released',NULL,'The Best Way to Walk',70460,1.6844,6.5,'0-nsSw-TI5Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7130,_binary '\0','/rqODzehgQ8Hl0tcUd7qIcy8Pc9Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074896',8.1,54379,'en','The Message','In sixth-century Mecca, Prophet Muhammad receives his first revelation from God as a messenger. Three years later, he\'s not alone in his quest and publicly declares his prophecy. Muhammad is fought by Abu Sufian and his wife Hind, rulers of Mecca. Muhammad\'s followers are hunted and tortured but he continues his calling.','/qVCBMg4ZuLPnWhIWJHD9IP4nIuY.jpg','1976-03-09',178,'Released','For the first time... the vast, spectacular drama that changed the world!','The Message',26842,3.9563,7.1,'06BE9SiWEwA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7131,_binary '\0','/2QCwYIcWkRcGMNSqHFrbdppZgX6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074899',6.8,23597,'en','Midway','This war drama depicts the U.S. and Japanese forces in the naval Battle of Midway, which became a turning point for Americans during World War II.','/vCzGV28YFmWubUn1jh8ytagYocR.jpg','1976-06-18',132,'Released','The glory, the suspense, the spectacular drama of the men who won the most decisive naval battle in our history!','Midway',11422,8.1649,6.6,'WjofsqGsDvY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7132,_binary '\0','/pzST8cae4CTsfj0nPP63YOdPLiO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074901',7.3,9653,'en','Mikey and Nicky','Nick is desperate, holed up in a cheap hotel, suffering from an ulcer and convinced that a local mob boss wants him killed. Terrified, he calls Mikey, his friend since childhood and a fellow gangster. So begins a long night…','/fnHC1OJ1EbdOX97nmXVYrXFgiQT.jpg','1976-12-21',106,'Released','...don\'t expect to like \'em.','Mikey and Nicky',59143,3.0653,6.9,'HL6ufL0xPjQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7133,_binary '\0','/3ZIb0qJcx8aK2KpuLiZWO5amsf9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074906',6.5,14007,'en','The Missouri Breaks','When vigilante land baron David Braxton hangs one of the best friends of cattle rustler Tom Logan, Logan\'s gang decides to get even by purchasing a small farm next to Braxton\'s ranch. From there the rustlers begin stealing horses, using the farm as a front for their operation. Determined to stop the thefts at any cost, Braxton retains the services of eccentric sharpshooter Robert E. Lee Clayton, who begins ruthlessly taking down Logan\'s gang.','/3fbAVOm9w66jt1TMbeTO8wLyqxO.jpg','1976-05-19',126,'Released','One steals. One kills. One dies.','The Missouri Breaks',42252,3.4157,6.5,'9Mx0elR30b0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7134,_binary '\0','/d6ELJEiJDoOZhoGe48o4L7qTQKa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074916',7.5,10746,'fr','Mr. Klein','Paris, France, 1942, during the Nazi occupation. Robert Klein, a successful art dealer who benefits from the misfortunes of those who are ruthlessly persecuted, discovers by chance that there is another Robert Klein, apparently a Jewish man; someone with whom he could be mistakenly identified, something dangerous in such harsh times.','/6FRa43WgyhIXzMYLO3yxDb0OY6O.jpg','1976-09-23',123,'Released','In the nightmare labyrinth of the Occupation','Mr. Klein',58925,3.2389,7.209,'EMq7B85H5D0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7135,_binary '\0','/keONAJeg39zkWyMbcTOsZDadJNf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074921',7.5,1451,'sh','Most','In order to check the German offensive, Partizans send an elite team of explosive experts to blow up a strategically important bridge. Besides being heavily guarded, that bridge is almost indestructible and the only man who knows weak spots in the construction is the architect who built it. He is, however, reluctant to cooperate because he doesn\'t want to see his masterpiece destroyed.','/hIcdPuKYaoR6xOj7dqe0ooiXphG.jpg','1969-01-01',105,'Released',NULL,'The Bridge',251210,2.6949,7.042,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7136,_binary '\0','/zisnExLhCAQ3cyaT7gBVTk6QYHp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074923',5.9,3635,'en','Mother, Jugs & Speed','To beat out competing ambulance services, an ace driver, an office secretary/paramedic and a suspended cop resort to some outrageous behavior to help people in distress. They\'re a crew whose condition is even more critical than their clients!','/ozIPoDZhBJ7WQAczMLLiSrrcQjT.jpg','1976-05-26',95,'Released','They don\'t call them that for nothing!','Mother, Jugs & Speed',26176,2.0768,5.39,'W0eHkp1ospg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7137,_binary '\0','/frM7pCS0vWnT1Utb81YyErmohmg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074937',7.2,46167,'en','Murder by Death','Lionel Twain invites the world\'s five greatest detectives to a \'dinner and murder\'. Included are a blind butler, a deaf-mute maid, screams, spinning rooms, secret passages, false identities and more plot turns and twists than are decently allowed.','/7YGYam05qzHy0ZSzfjBSDkVvvU7.jpg','1976-06-23',94,'Released','By the time the world\'s greatest detectives figure out whodunnit... you could die laughing!','Murder by Death',6037,4.33,7.1,'mXn8CsQU1-U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7138,_binary '\0','/aC7RdlR4HkEcUXJNRkoSFEkCYTB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074947',7.6,1780,'cs','Na samotě u lesa','The Lavicka\'s, a Czech family from the city, rents a house in the country with the option to buy. However, old Mr Komarek seems reluctant to sell the house as they agreed.','/b6KQtJB3pKV7GuEp1VrOOx2Ezc6.jpg','1976-09-10',92,'Released',NULL,'Secluded, Near Woods',75026,1.8052,7.378,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7139,_binary '\0','/4zyuCJtoGmrxqk9rp9KxBpzhklp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074952',7,1294,'it','Napoli violenta','Inspector Betti (Maurizio Merli) is transferred to Naples and immediately after his arrival receives a warm welcome from The Commandante (Barry Sullivan), the city\'s crime lord. Betti then goes on a personal mission against corruption and organized crime, and tries to force the syndicate out of town with any means necessary.','/rZLGP9fpTFOXjR0hf7QziMKy0b2.jpg','1976-08-07',95,'Released','He\'s the dirtiest law-enforcer ever to hit the streets...','Violent Naples',94809,1.9782,6.429,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7140,_binary '\0','/m4Iyzh9YVOh0ra7UwdMoJcrjxkx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074958',8,187729,'en','Network','When veteran anchorman Howard Beale is forced to retire his 25-year post because of his age, he announces to viewers that he will kill himself during his farewell broadcast. Network executives rethink their decision when his fanatical tirade results in a spike in ratings.','/qZomlHsaALUtkFeMDwdYmwS2Pbo.jpg','1976-11-27',122,'Released','Television will never be the same.','Network',10774,7.7267,7.8,'T-PyQ1gMT6o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7141,_binary '\0','/AdGXPG1XBKYWSUrQXLvyDGilUjs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074963',7,2747,'en','Next Stop, Greenwich Village','An aspiring Jewish actor moves out of his parents\' Brooklyn apartment to seek his fortune in the bohemian life of Greenwich Village in 1953.','/qYMvsrCG6qjIoJYPIdgeceDlhDR.jpg','1976-02-04',111,'Released','Greenwich Village, 1953. It was coffeehouses and high adventure, it was your first love and your best dream, it was girls who drank wine and your mother back home asking God to forgive you.','Next Stop, Greenwich Village',31913,2.0783,6.402,'o4M_p77j1tQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7142,_binary '\0','/4ppWOKSAXaOI1VnFVNhuyasdoim.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074964',6.2,3290,'en','Nickelodeon','In the silent film era, attorney Leo Harrigan and gunslinger Buck Greenway are hired to stop an illegal film production. However, they soon team up with the filmmakers and become important players in the show business industry. Leo learns he has a talent for directing, and Buck\'s cowboy persona quickly earns him leading-man status — but both men fall for beautiful starlet Kathleen Cooke, leading to a heated personal rivalry.','/8gStRD7PNLBjwrw6Tg5b6GxT3qN.jpg','1976-12-21',126,'Released','LOVE. ACTION. COMEDY. SUSPENSE. EXCITMENT.','Nickelodeon',104364,2.7523,6,'i5mHxgRvGDw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7143,_binary '\0','/5dXmcFaQYeYDDyw6aRN6G4NoypT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074968',6.4,1845,'en','No Deposit, No Return','Two rich children devise a way to escape their grandfather and visit their mother. Unfortunately for two hapless safe crackers, they become part of the plan.','/fodDFwLTQMFRCHPo8scc5DDM3vo.jpg','1976-02-05',112,'Released','A pair of jokers make double trouble in a hullaba-lulu of a caper','No Deposit, No Return',21147,2.1908,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7144,_binary '\0','/jldqANKBNQyomhcBXLLIMsNzXtt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074972',6.7,1999,'fr','La Victoire en chantant','French colonists in Africa, several months behind in the news, find themselves at war with their German neighbors. Deciding that they must do their proper duty and fight the Germans, they promptly conscript the local native population. Issuing them boots and rifles, the French attempt to make \"proper\" soldiers out of the Africans. A young, idealistic French geographer seems to be the only rational person in the town, and he takes over control of the \"war\" after several bungles on the part of the others.','/8G86Ow4Qcm7FEcHsJoR3pFIBCaj.jpg','1976-09-22',92,'Released','The picture that marches to a different drummer','Black and White in Color',42238,1.8154,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7145,_binary '\0','/kjIgQmRlgBI1u2YvjW7EcorzHbf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074991',6.7,13665,'en','Obsession','A wealthy New Orleans businessman becomes obsessed with a young woman who resembles his late wife.','/a0bOKTldOJVJivmPNGBHfMYJU9x.jpg','1976-08-01',99,'Released','A bizarre story of love.','Obsession',4780,4.08,6.7,'oYkV1s9hM-Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7146,_binary '\0','/rrE8THyTEsIRT6DZlfFWw6BIzJ0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0074995',6.6,2465,'en','Ode to Billy Joe','Set in sultry 1950s Mississippi, two teenagers grapple with surging hormones and the enticing promise of love, unknowing of the tragedy that looms ahead.','/emiEmqf9KwX2SMJ6lbLMu3Lx3bx.jpg','1976-06-04',105,'Released','What the song didn\'t tell you, the movie will.','Ode to Billy Joe',42239,1.6917,6.2,'4at4U6KLDXo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7147,_binary '\0','/ud8P5KDEjDDSfGph4h5eAGZedRJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075001',5.7,1236,'zh','油鬼子','A cripple takes revenge on criminals by using a magic spell that transforms him into an oily monster/superhero.','/6BIshgPviiIxsQpKEeQlewQU7YU.jpg','1976-09-18',84,'Released','It’s produced by the Shaw Brothers, it must be a good movie!','The Oily Maniac',88922,2.2992,5.5,'rtFsIQsFY04','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7148,_binary '\0','/njoo5eptD6cxvseVqL2wEuoQ4VP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075002',7.7,2741,'da','Olsen-banden ser rødt','Egon and the gang are hired to stage a robbery of an antique Chinese vase for an economically challenged baron. Naturally they fooled, which infuriates Egon. The gang tries to get back at the baron by switching the vase with a cheap Hong Kong copy. One attempt is made during the barons hunting party, where Egon ends up being bricked up in the catacombs. In another attempt, the gang has to coordinate breaking through several walls at The Royal Theater in Copenhagen with the \"Elverhøj\" overture.','/i8PtINTFHJKlOIw78M7z3WahhMq.jpg','1976-10-01',100,'Released',NULL,'The Olsen Gang Sees Red',11392,2.1407,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7149,_binary '\0','/5sfbPsenSrbH8pzVMjEd0LUu50Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075005',7.5,147787,'en','The Omen','Immediately after their miscarriage, the US diplomat Robert Thorn adopts the newborn Damien without the knowledge of his wife. Yet what he doesn’t know is that their new son is the son of the devil.','/mDcjjEu1fMNmsXi4l4D8IftlTix.jpg','1976-06-25',111,'Released','You have been warned. If something frightening happens to you today, think about it. It may be The Omen.','The Omen',794,9.8658,7.404,'mgjVPPVtnII','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7150,_binary '\0','/dVcUc7KFtOuoStXTTO8w1RJple9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075016',5.9,2120,'en','One of Our Dinosaurs Is Missing','Escaping from China with a microfilm of the formula for the mysterious \"Lotus X\", Lord Southmere, a Queen\'s Messenger, is chased by a group of Chinese spies.','/TD03DZvWSOKRJx6KLogMMDcqll.jpg','1975-07-09',94,'Released',NULL,'One of Our Dinosaurs Is Missing',29694,1.9,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7151,_binary '','/FIxdHljqvJBuiaPt1pv0yy8rgW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075018',6.7,1531,'en','The Opening of Misty Beethoven','Sexologist Dr. Seymour Love sets himself the challenge of transforming lowly streetwalker Misty Beethoven into the world\'s greatest lover.','/3YA0fVvnaHbQj70i4rch1xCqbxj.jpg','1976-03-19',85,'Released','She learned to swallow her pride...','The Opening of Misty Beethoven',36804,0,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7152,_binary '\0','/hXcqvxLo1e8CMufIntHxrAw7KQH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075019',7,2673,'en','Operation: Daybreak','Czechoslovakia, 1942. Three brave Czech patriots risk everything to rid their country of its brutal Nazi leader, SS-General Reinhard Heydrich.','/9JAYPCYXGkOFLeDEyjtn1dR13vU.jpg','1975-11-01',118,'Released','It was a hit and run operation with no place to run.','Operation: Daybreak',72882,2.6665,6.9,'DTfHhy6cJBs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7153,_binary '\0','/nEe0ziWyVhGTtuoXe2msdkz6NlO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075029',7.8,87956,'en','The Outlaw Josey Wales','After avenging his family\'s brutal murder, Wales is pursued by a pack of soldiers. He prefers to travel alone, but ragtag outcasts are drawn to him - and Wales can\'t bring himself to leave them unprotected.','/92BZIFPbyCPNhExyFScxA3xF1dy.jpg','1976-06-30',135,'Released','...an army of one.','The Outlaw Josey Wales',10747,8.0952,7.5,'YvXl6Ij-LhQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7154,_binary '\0','/4ilXtC261Kzam3DxriDAlPQJH2K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075040',7.7,7171,'it','Pasqualino Settebellezze','Pasqualino Frafuso, known in Naples as \"Pasqualino Seven Beauties\" is a petty thief who lives off of the profits of his seven sisters while claiming to protect their honor at any cost, Pasqualino is arrested for murder and later sent to fight in the army after committing sexual assault. The Germans capture him and he gets sent to a concentration camp where he plots to make his escape by seducing a German officer.','/i0ZLApe4mIQWopELhEPxOQziDBh.jpg','1975-12-20',116,'Released',NULL,'Seven Beauties',37550,2.0927,7.398,'CkxIi3bxFAE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7155,_binary '\0','/fjH4p9RFY9wcChRY3rc6bumfS23.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075066',7.1,34782,'en','The Pink Panther Strikes Again','Charles Dreyfus, who has finally cracked over inspector Clouseau\'s antics, escapes from a mental institution and launches an elaborate plan to get rid of Clouseau once and for all.','/GGCch9LNAKwp4ZADAcNz1hd1dn.jpg','1976-09-16',103,'Released','Why are the world\'s chief assassins after Inspector Clouseau? Why not? Everybody else is.','The Pink Panther Strikes Again',12268,6.7125,6.9,'3tgXUpKtEns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7156,_binary '\0','/cQwWgR5FXi6Jwq2jeUvzppytG0Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075082',6.9,2427,'fr','Police Python 357','A methodical police inspector becomes entangled in a web of deceit after a murder investigation reveals disturbing connections to his own department. As suspicion tightens around him, he must outwit both the killer and the system to survive.','/67ddTJ1msWwQtpRtksn0im0ysNW.jpg','1976-03-31',125,'Released',NULL,'Police Python 357',37455,2.7723,6.697,'F1kYUFPyTFo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7157,_binary '\0','/dbcliaHQJBm1eRyf9iVhyRBJJnm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075086',4.9,1454,'en','The Pom Pom Girls','A football player at Rosedale High School is amorous of one of the cheerleaders, who is going with another guy. Another player can\'t decide which of two cheerleaders he wants to be with. Meanwhile, the Big Game with Hardin High School is approaching, and a prank war is in full swing.','/sZ8EfaSU41qBsLMQaokklygrcaW.jpg','1976-05-01',89,'Released','How can anyone forget the girls who really turned us on?','The Pom Pom Girls',21955,2.7235,5.7,'IJkQ6oMgjIQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7158,_binary '\0','/bFScDzp95vkzMBolxQt1IGg4aIe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075094',8.1,1294,'sh','Povratak otpisanih','Prle and Tihi, being the only surviving members of their resistance group, had been forced to leave Nazi-occupied Belgrade and join Partisans in country. In Summer of 1944 somebody is assassinating resistance sympathizers, and Prle and Tihi must return to Belgrade deal with it. In order to cross through enemy lines, they use cars, clothes and documents of captured pro-Nazi minister. During their journey the minister escapes and warns the Gestapo.','/q6BCbN7NVBfCL3rjHbsmbdSsPIP.jpg','1976-12-14',95,'Released',NULL,'The Written Off Return',353784,1.4293,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7159,_binary '\0','/pJGIFTQZv6rgA5XriE5PSoofHLy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075097',5.3,1226,'en','The Premonition','When a deranged woman and her carny boyfriend plot to abduct her biological daughter from the girl\'s foster parents, the foster mother is plagued by premonitions and psychic visions.','/sbvQlhEQGfR8DD20V3man8iSYD9.jpg','1976-05-19',94,'Released','A masterpiece of terror and suspense.','The Premonition',139349,1.4438,5.1,'veY-kI81wPI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7160,_binary '\0','/sc703okgh7Rt3GbhhN9QTw7taBF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075119',7.3,1988,'ru','Раба любви','During the Russian Civil War, the production of a silent melodrama runs into numerous complications.','/r16SumTzPPaSXRO8WkbOQEcytjx.jpg','1976-09-27',90,'Released',NULL,'A Slave of Love',73100,2.0242,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7161,_binary '\0','/le6Jn8zWY1fxa2pjKbxSbNkSEZU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075128',6.5,1603,'no','Reisen til julestjernen','Once upon a time a little girl went out to find the Christmas Star.','/sQokJ1OyvwRzYgKwxjNp1NvH4hQ.jpg','1976-12-03',92,'Released',NULL,'Journey to the Christmas Star',60767,0.7789,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7162,_binary '\0','/1Nas9syOK93PltBGVjXJi9QvxM3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075132',6.1,2276,'en','The Return of a Man Called Horse','Lord John Morgan has returned to civilized life in England, but finds he has nothing but disdain for that life. Yearning to embrace the simplicity of the American West, and the Sioux tribe he left behind, Morgan returns to the their land only to discover that they\'ve been decimated by ruthless, government-backed fur traders. Led by Horse, they fight to repossess their land.','/rY1APSm1zlu0nX9VeIe10J67SRA.jpg','1976-06-28',129,'Released','The all-new adventures of the English Lord with the soul of an Indian.','The Return of a Man Called Horse',35200,2.6801,5.7,'8mOYyEwUyHo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7163,_binary '\0','/jGSJ9lZpNnkx7v25qxPqStlSQ60.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075137',4.4,1216,'en','Revenge of the Cheerleaders','The frisky cheerleading team at the anarchic Aloha High sets out to foil the plans of their local school board president, after he attempts to shut the school down in order to develop the land into a shopping mall.','/6KktagpFiU63gd9TH6E0znJb2hQ.jpg','1976-05-01',86,'Released','It\'s High School the Way We Remember It ... Although It Never Happened Quite Like This!','Revenge of the Cheerleaders',56675,1.9062,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7164,_binary '\0','/8GzX5egahS7tdo7gjIUROtRQFt9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075140',5.9,1237,'de','Der Richter und sein Henker','Hans Baerlach is a Swiss police detective who has dedicated much of his career to pursuing powerful and allegedly murderous businessman Richard Gastmann. Though Baerlach\'s partner meets his demise while investigating Gastmann, his replacement, Walter Tschanz, is undaunted. Meanwhile, the lovely Anna Crawley becomes involved in the case, which proceeds to take many twists and turns.','/aq5SwVQ37piQwRYVLBr1lARa4cR.jpg','1975-04-21',106,'Released',NULL,'End of the Game',72494,1.9872,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7165,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075142',1.9,1293,'en','Riding with Death','Agent Sam Casey is in a satellite explosion and the radiation turns him invisible. He gets a watch that keeps him visible, and he uses it to switch from visible to invisible. He is assigned to transport a chemical called Tripolydine, which is purported to be the most efficient fuel; when the cover is blown on that and he uncovers and stops the Tripolydine fraud, he must then stop a terrorist from blowing up race cars.','/s0AF31hJxRrsrtbyPfylYJfIA4e.jpg','1976-01-01',97,'Released','An unforgettable excursion into adventure.','Riding with Death',162042,1.2495,2.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7166,_binary '\0','/mdypkkTkpEQZsIMR1dwFot8OTE3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075143',8.9,12154,'ar','Al-risâlah','In sixth-century Mecca, Prophet Muhammad receives his first revelation from God as a messenger. Three years later, he\'s not alone in his quest and publicly declares his prophecy. Muhammad is fought by Abu Sufian and his wife Hind, rulers of Mecca. Muhammad\'s followers are hunted and tortured but he continues his calling.','/hQpLA5VtcUKlJ0M5UUI3JbxFBnX.jpg','1976-07-30',206,'Released',NULL,'The Message',881210,2.4549,8.51,'NAm0AWFy3b0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7167,_binary '\0','/qDJGsJ4BBMB6fnxY9MxxIkhRaZM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075144',6.8,3049,'en','The Ritz','To escape from a mobster, businessman Gaetano Proclo orders a cab driver to take him to a place where he can\'t be found. Unfortunately for Gaetano, the place turns out to be a gay bathhouse.','/h5z2AvjDFVMJmGN2EE4vS7tSw1C.jpg','1976-08-12',91,'Released','The funny season begins when you check in for a night at The Ritz.','The Ritz',63848,1.8675,6,'i8GNYal5YtE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7168,_binary '\0','/lw5HdgozS0j9rwqHWyDycgAa3GJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075147',6.5,15326,'en','Robin and Marian','Robin Hood, aging none too gracefully, returns exhausted from the Crusades to woo and win Maid Marian one last time.','/y2UlVt6U8mFeegVL42rZjD5y6c7.jpg','1976-03-11',106,'Released','Love is the greatest adventure of all.','Robin and Marian',10786,4.2308,6.3,'-GTXXfZR8IE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7169,_binary '\0','/bacOuUnRBoAO1NjMfsAGX2EKRrS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075148',8.1,701684,'en','Rocky','Rocky Balboa is a Philadelphia club fighter who seems to be going nowhere. But when a stroke of fate puts him in the ring with a world heavyweight champion, Rocky knows that it\'s his one shot at the big time — a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to go the distance and come out a winner!','/xSI0dbKLDETwhiVUy6hGE8KXUln.jpg','1976-12-03',120,'Released','His whole life was a million-to-one shot.','Rocky',1366,16.1971,7.799,'-Hk-LYcavrw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7170,_binary '\0','/xZG7Di3MB8vRjP1gcWCVJ3p9O6O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075151',6.6,1299,'en','Rogue Male','In 1939, Sir Robert Thorndyke takes aim at Adolf Hitler with a high powered rifle, but the shot misses its mark. Captured and tortured by the Gestapo and left for dead, Sir Robert makes his way back to England where he discovers the Gestapo has followed him. Knowing that his government would turn him over to German authorities, Sir Robert goes underground in his battle with his pursuers.','/2SizHGYx1fdiBh0D4MUBcE7JNhZ.jpg','1976-09-22',103,'Released',NULL,'Rogue Male',141752,1.4303,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7171,_binary '\0','/wr7ciELLh7TdHpm9IhbZ2xwbKxG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075152',6.9,2028,'it','Roma a mano armata','A tough, violent cop who doesn\'t mind bending the law goes after a machine-gun-carrying, hunchbacked psychotic killer.','/e3tyRaeZsX66e6LO5EanViBFJF.jpg','1976-10-10',94,'Released','He Lives by the Law - Tanzi\'s Law!','Rome, Armed to the Teeth',52808,1.859,6.6,'qAreUCokYdw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7172,_binary '\0','/7uaV0Ki5dyRZMYhRHdsilw3hPF6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075161',6.2,1862,'en','The Sailor Who Fell from Grace with the Sea','When a widowed mother falls in love with an American sailor, her troubled young son is pressured by the bullying leader of his clique to seek revenge.','/11JflHMNFgn84uH4B8YAh3Mgwah.jpg','1976-04-11',105,'Released','He gave his soul to the sea and his heart to a woman. Their love will arouse you. The story will disturb you. The ending will startle you.','The Sailor Who Fell from Grace with the Sea',92298,1.9901,6.4,'GdY59uZ9Ggg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7173,_binary '\0','/d2eOliwKBL9hbZjAkjMCLJJ3RVN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075163',5.4,5754,'it','Salon Kitty','In Nazi Germany, Kitty runs a brothel where the soldiers come to \'relax\'. Recording devices have been installed by a power-hungry official who plans to use the information to blackmail and usurp Hitler. One of the girls discovers the ploy and, with the madam\'s help, takes on the dangerous task of exposing the conspiracy.','/pAcHGO840kU3TtYWjv3pvFl3Vm1.jpg','1976-03-02',130,'Released','Depraved. Decadent. Damned.','Salon Kitty',40394,5.3877,5.6,'XaUSKzj_vOo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7174,_binary '\0','/d6H8PJC8ByRLqMSViSWr2GtRabc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075164',5.3,2543,'en','Satan\'s Slave','A young girl is caught up in a devil cult run by her wicked uncle and cousin. She can trust no one and even those she thought were dead return to haunt her.','/ke6j0ndC1HX2tRjMNopaBgHBove.jpg','1976-08-01',90,'Released','It\'s Catherine\'s birthday. You\'re invited to her torture party.','Satan\'s Slave',30788,1.6312,5.3,'YrjdLWVrAIk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7175,_binary '\0','/6YdiUH9EhwTGgML3jskPAc7c9OA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075165',6.7,2338,'de','Satansbraten','A famous poet who hasn\'t written a word in two years unconsciously plagiarizes the work of Stefan George, while dealing with several mistresses, his dimwitted brother, and a murder investigation.','/75p0IKwHpSqxPUnDmOq7HdhHYyT.jpg','1976-10-07',113,'Released',NULL,'Satan’s Brew',37512,2.086,6.382,'xnUBbp0ORoM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7176,_binary '\0','/x12t7AMcvHd4K4LdW5md4aFQGBA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075177',6.2,3514,'la','Sebastiane','Rome, AD 303. Emperor Diocletian demotes his favourite, Sebastian, from captain of the palace guard to the rank of common soldier and banishes him to a remote coastal outpost where his fellow soldiers, weakened by their desires, turn to homosexual activities to satisfy their needs. Sebastian becomes the target of lust for the officer Severus, but repeatedly rejects the man\'s advances. Castigated for his Christian faith, he is tortured, humiliated and ultimately killed.','/xBek1olo2OUVmK3j0NMYRvKprpA.jpg','1976-12-17',86,'Released',NULL,'Sebastiane',42241,1.9589,6.5,'SseNL9l4EP4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7177,_binary '\0','/b5YMMlMP9Yb5opqmTsmSDqlV4JH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075178',7.7,5142,'it','Il secondo tragico Fantozzi','The frustrating adventures of a humble employee who all the time has to fullfill the wishes and desires of his bosses.','/3qzZwMfwbcwsVYSLWzRJSGQqpfh.jpg','1976-04-15',110,'Released',NULL,'The Second Tragic Fantozzi',37769,2.1463,7.516,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7178,_binary '\0','/uRJ7DCHEpAAK1cLFRxgZqlCODep.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075194',6.6,5709,'en','The Seven-Per-Cent Solution','Concerned about his friend\'s cocaine use, Dr. Watson tricks Sherlock Holmes into travelling to Vienna, where Holmes enters the care of Sigmund Freud. Freud attempts to solve the mysteries of Holmes\' subconscious, while Holmes devotes himself to solving a mystery involving the kidnapping of Lola Deveraux.','/wvrFj27OmsrTC04n57huYciFFPT.jpg','1976-10-24',113,'Released','The story is true...only the facts have been made up.','The Seven-Per-Cent Solution',29578,2.4156,6.246,'CxzoWxT2E2Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7179,_binary '\0','/msEC7qhaFwNf5WVqdb36Aehwsdy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075200',5.8,3823,'en','The Shaggy D.A.','Wilby Daniels, a successful lawyer running for District Attorney, suddenly finds himself being transformed into an English sheepdog. Somehow he has to keep his change a secret and find just what is causing it, all the while eluding the local dog catcher.','/cSVu5gGSelx2QOykeEG5lEuzD1L.jpg','1976-12-17',91,'Released','The Only Candidate with a Law Degree and a Pedigree!','The Shaggy D.A.',15943,3.2823,5.8,'qFn9Tmjj-hY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7180,_binary '\0','/vQymkoP9DpWEYFZcer55ZcrDzbY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075201',6.3,3419,'zh','少林木人巷','Little Mute is an orphan traumatized into silence by the death of his father at the hands of a vicious fighting master. Living at the Shaolin monastery, he befriends a dangerous prisoner who teaches him a secret form of deadly kung fu. Seeing his intense determination, other masters share the wisdom of the Gliding Snake and Drunken Master techniques. In one of the most exciting fight scenes ever filmed, Little Mute must run the gauntlet of the famous 108 wooden men in an extreme test of skill and endurance. But if he becomes a master, will he use his unmatched force for redemption or revenge?','/uFbYnHPb5YGgce3Un0bgBgbt8DI.jpg','1976-10-10',97,'Released','Revenge is his destiny.','Shaolin Wooden Men',40829,3.3272,6.8,'n6RgHSa6Lwc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7181,_binary '\0','/oyKl6A2UTcAFJj9WoKhH0AoJpM9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075202',6.8,1588,'zh','少林寺','There is no place more hallowed in the martial art world than China\'s Shaolin Temple. This special place deserves a special epic, which is what the martial arts maestro delivers in this battle between a brave brand of Chinese boxers and literally thousands of Qing troops - complete with betrayals, intrigues, and such novel fighting machines as 108 wooden robots. The conflicts grow in complexity, intensity and even suspense as monks struggle to stay alive in the face of overwhelming odds.','/f6IALg4S0qujZha9xbFBLnELksZ.jpg','1976-12-22',126,'Released',NULL,'Shaolin Temple',45736,2.4711,6.2,'qgltK4S47MY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7182,_binary '\0','/sFphxjyqRoLGqdT7RRFVG8B8SSH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075208',5.7,1290,'en','Sherlock Holmes in New York','An affectionate bow to the master sleuth in this lavishly produced original that has Holmes rushing to New York City after discovering that his old nemesis, Moriarty, has kidnapped the son of the detective\'s long-time love, actress Irene Adler.','/bPnlPEt9A4BIpmUWrN7b6cKSvpy.jpg','1976-10-18',100,'Released',NULL,'Sherlock Holmes in New York',27200,2.1889,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7183,_binary '\0','/30uoQ0AHiAfDm7GdtUrTUntfS02.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075213',7.6,29715,'en','The Shootist','Afflicted with a terminal illness John Bernard Books, the last of the legendary gunfighters, quietly returns to Carson City for medical attention from his old friend Dr. Hostetler. Aware that his days are numbered, the troubled man seeks solace and peace in a boarding house run by a widow and her son. However, it is not Books\' fate to die in peace, as he becomes embroiled in one last valiant battle.','/ygz2Pux61NY3yP4yCxRhgmFQp5z.jpg','1976-07-21',100,'Released','He\'s got to face a gunfight once more to live up to his legend once more. To win just one more time.','The Shootist',12584,5.6012,7.098,'kIRKnR5xvHo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7184,_binary '\0','/4sE3w9fp6iapU9AcgDlRmWpfFtC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075214',6.2,3964,'en','Shout at the Devil','During World War One an English adventurer, an American elephant poacher and the latter\'s attractive young daughter, set out to destroy a German battle-cruiser which is awaiting repairs in an inlet just off Zanzibar. The story is based on a novel by Wilbur Smith, which in turn is very loosely based on events involving the light cruiser SMS Königsberg, which was sunk after taking refuge in Rufigi delta in 1915.','/1b3E45shfLbipuRc2lXrqSkkrn7.jpg','1976-04-12',147,'Released','A spectacular adventure you will always remember and a beautiful love story you will never forget.','Shout at the Devil',39419,4.5472,6.035,'TNlGAq45Rlo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7185,_binary '\0','/6MBo0C4G0O7A7JVVfVVJIJbh1fU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075222',6.7,19882,'en','Silent Movie','Aspiring filmmakers Mel Funn, Marty Eggs and Dom Bell go to a financially troubled studio with an idea for a silent movie. In an effort to make the movie more marketable, they attempt to recruit a number of big name stars to appear, while the studio\'s creditors attempt to thwart them.','/AeaoOSqEU3elkpDAlKbIWcdKLJ8.jpg','1976-06-17',87,'Released','Made In Hollywood. U.S.A.','Silent Movie',10970,4.1534,6.5,'sGwWrtVYXWs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7186,_binary '\0','/yLEvFfGVXsStEkNQwi9OxAcCDaa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075223',6.9,23718,'en','Silver Streak','A somewhat daffy book editor on a rail trip from Los Angeles to Chicago thinks that he sees a murdered man thrown from the train. When he can find no one who will believe him, he starts doing some investigating of his own. But all that accomplishes is to get the killer after him.','/gY1a4k9dalGx83D7TJ2C76xBprS.jpg','1976-12-03',114,'Released','By train, by plane, by the edge of your seat - It\'s the most hilarious suspense ride of your life!','Silver Streak',11558,4.8147,6.7,'rJ_1MkOVnNM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7187,_binary '\0','/koEybRiCwnSmAeyIbEUeHs8NNNW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075229',6,1310,'en','Sky Riders','When an industrialist\'s wife and kids are kidnapped by terrorists in Greece, the woman\'s ex-husband comes to the rescue with a plan involving hang gliders.','/yEzWDNm8IkyJvCiaAQBxYhGzk9F.jpg','1976-03-26',91,'Released','They soared from the skies to stage the most daring rescue ever filmed','Sky Riders',42551,1.9304,6.2,'6X2Dozk6Y9w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7188,_binary '\0','/zgqC7Gig2Q4fSyE5agLA5uKcXBT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075232',6.9,3645,'en','The Slipper and the Rose','Prince Edward wants to marry for love, but the King and court of the Kingdom of Euphrania are anxious for the Prince to wed no matter what. When the Prince meets Cinderella at a ball, he\'s sure she\'s the one, and when she loses her slipper upon exiting the dance, the Prince is determined to find and marry her.','/o7tQ79sqZwt5dQskCW5ymjtd13r.jpg','1976-03-25',146,'Released','You\'ll forget every other love story you ever saw . . . or sang to.','The Slipper and the Rose',16176,2.5135,6.9,'wrFY2-fyX0c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7189,_binary '\0','/cQZrNORK4JHi0ljkHQgU9fO36cU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075244',7.6,9740,'en','Led Zeppelin - The Song Remains the Same','The best of Led Zeppelin\'s legendary 1973 appearances at Madison Square Garden. Interspersed throughout the concert footage are behind-the-scenes moments with the band. The Song Remains the Same is Led Zeppelin at Madison Square Garden in NYC concert footage colorfully enhanced by sequences which are supposed to reflect each band member\'s individual fantasies and hallucinations. Includes blistering live renditions of \"Black Dog,\" \"Dazed and Confused,\" \"Stairway to Heaven,\" \"Whole Lotta Love,\" \"The Song Remains the Same,\" and \"Rain Song\" among others.','/tQzNsYcg4rVXVGw45ue7nkdMOgs.jpg','1976-10-20',137,'Released','In Concert And Beyond','Led Zeppelin - The Song Remains the Same',40440,2.0384,7.9,'5N65F-Odxb4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7190,_binary '\0','/rJHudLEcfTMx3qNccYjGFmVL25c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075249',6.7,2074,'en','Sparkle','Three sisters start out singing in their church choir in Harlem in the late 1950s and become a successful girl group in the 1960s.','/46xUOWfkuR20CUZT6cPGr3N4fmZ.jpg','1976-04-07',98,'Released','From downtown to uptown','Sparkle',21554,1.6141,7.3,'PsKBUPHYsng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7191,_binary '\0','/sSQRFaqr1onrpS4tQiRgYJCzAeY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075261',4.9,7121,'en','Squirm','A violent electrical storm topples power lines into the rain soaked earth that is home for an aggressive breed of worms. The high voltage causes the worms to mutate into larger, hostile hordes of man-eating worms that lie in wait for the residents of Fly Creek.','/j9mNz3y3UeGQydqBKBhcIPk5l6P.jpg','1976-07-30',92,'Released','This was the night of the CRAWLING TERROR!','Squirm',25241,2.8462,4.95,'1IcA6yTw5Hc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7192,_binary '\0','/sm91fnK0nOkqKiP0WqQNeG6vmZA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075263',6.2,3118,'en','St. Ives','A dabbler-in-crime and his assistant hire an ex-police reporter to recover some stolen papers.','/lIOyiNfJqrNB33fZeuN4X4PXBAN.jpg','1976-02-24',94,'Released','He\'s clean. He\'s mean. He\'s the go-between.','St. Ives',37626,2.2987,5.774,'GAJiajbLaxU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7193,_binary '\0','/kPn4M9dw7raRVQt2UPOWY0j2k0o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075265',6.1,14593,'en','A Star Is Born','Drunken, has-been rock star John Norman Howard falls in love with unknown singer Esther Hoffman after seeing her perform at a club. He lets her sing a few songs at one of his shows and she becomes the talk of the music industry. Esther\'s star begins to rise, while John\'s continues to fall. She tries desperately to get John to sober up and focus on his music, but it may be too late to save him.','/3Hr63lBDhvYGpSd8HxDpWvowZpY.jpg','1976-12-17',140,'Released','For anyone who has ever loved...','A Star Is Born',19610,4.7704,6,'a8c-wzsSwTU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7194,_binary '\0','/xAuYpBTyaBSE0N9lLa9diClP8F6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075268',5.6,5687,'en','Stay Hungry','A dishonest businessman asks rich layabout Craig Blake to help him buy a gym, which will be demolished for a development project in Alabama. But after spending time with weightlifter Joe Santo and gym worker Mary Tate Farnsworth, Craig wants out of the deal. The property negotiations turn ugly, causing a brawl at the gym and a spectacle at a big bodybuilding meet, as Craig learns that it\'s not easy to turn your back on fair-weather friends.','/6WNMcRYtk74QNL53ZxVIDjpBbzF.jpg','1976-04-23',102,'Released','If you\'ve got an appetite for life…','Stay Hungry',5228,2.6583,5.6,'XmufCRj9snc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7195,_binary '\0','/eM3Kbzk9v03wJc0yoSC0QGEOU9C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075276',7.7,16769,'de','Stroszek','Bruno Stroszek is released from prison and warned to stop drinking. He has few skills and fewer expectations: with a glockenspiel and an accordion, he ekes out a living as a street musician. He befriends Eva, a prostitute down on her luck and they join his neighbor, Scheitz, an elderly eccentric, when he leaves Germany to live in Wisconsin.','/wDq9ytRxoVpICRcx1BvagmXhd4t.jpg','1977-05-20',108,'Released','A Ballad','Stroszek',11698,2.421,7.3,'4fM4fL5KK5k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7196,_binary '\0','/eAjww5OTXdHmJJX6M7LwPnC4dRC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075294',6,2117,'en','Swashbuckler','A pirate and a hot-tempered noblewoman join forces to protect Jamaica from a tyrant.','/yeC8gs83BJfs1NENk5sPNyXGGxm.jpg','1976-07-29',101,'Released',NULL,'Swashbuckler',42242,3.139,6.193,'VG5-cbrfj8k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7197,_binary '\0','/9uddYYTNcLWpzUkl5iw1RUYhLhY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075314',8.2,1042096,'en','Taxi Driver','Suffering from insomnia, disturbed loner Travis Bickle takes a job as a New York City cabbie, haunting the streets nightly, growing increasingly detached from reality as he dreams of cleaning up the filthy city.','/ekstpH614fwDX8DUln1a2Opz0N8.jpg','1976-02-09',114,'Released','On every street in every city in this country, there\'s a nobody who dreams of being somebody. He\'s a lonely forgotten man desperate to prove that he\'s alive.','Taxi Driver',103,24.7869,8.12,'S7ORyD-e7-0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7198,_binary '\0','/nS0jjt3yLm19kHo9Ki1Oppt8tpR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075323',7.3,2588,'en','That\'s Entertainment, Part II','Gene Kelly and Fred Astaire present more golden moments from the MGM film library, this time including comedy and drama as well as classic musical numbers.','/yuvgOvG0OSOS33EW1L42ZM7PEI0.jpg','1976-05-16',133,'Released',NULL,'That\'s Entertainment, Part II',74719,3.0102,7,'KspAGeIKqoY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7199,_binary '\0','/mwBHbsadLOJoywhWPm1FN9rSMXq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075334',5.8,5864,'en','To the Devil a Daughter','An American occult novelist battles to save the soul of a young girl from a group of Satanists, led by an excommunicated priest, who plan on using her as the representative of the Devil on Earth.','/4rJQHeuhOxGqqT00uQ0tu0W6v51.jpg','1976-03-04',95,'Released','...and suddenly the screams of a baby born in Hell!','To the Devil a Daughter',40064,2.8579,5.5,'slTsyOxVy88','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7200,_binary '\0','/nDVwWowq6f3atlrUkHk9Q3Ke5Vo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075335',7.5,1964,'it','Todo modo','Set during a retreat of Christian Democrat politicians who practice spiritual exercises together, it is an allegory of corrupted power. Disturbing, claustrophobic settings are the background to a series of mysterious crimes.','/2AEPuT7lFo0sZgFq8atUioOgagj.jpg','1976-04-30',125,'Released',NULL,'One Way or Another',47096,1.7528,7.678,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7201,_binary '\0','/18t6Zq6aEdZAfcQXilDi2NrMNJ7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075342',6,11472,'en','The Town That Dreaded Sundown','When two young lovers are savagely beaten and tortured on a back country road in Texarkana, local police are baffled and must find \"the Phantom Killer\" before he can kill again.','/sI6kUePh4S3T1rDozPR0Etg7E8X.jpg','1976-12-24',86,'Released','In 1946 this man killed five people... Today he still lurks the streets of Texarkana, Arkansas.','The Town That Dreaded Sundown',48197,2.9347,5.8,'zMR_qvk2m1w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7202,_binary '\0','/wdTC54O5xJgWoDTRy4bLjKYObGN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075343',2.3,3990,'en','Track of the Moon Beast','Professor \"Johnny Longbow\" Salina, a man who really knows his stews, introduces Paul Carlson to the practical-joking Kathy Nolan. Paul and Kathy seem to hit it off rather well but, during a meteor storm, a meteorite fragment strikes Paul, burying itself deep in his skull, which has the unpleasant side-effect of causing Paul to mutate into a giant reptilian monster at night and go on murderous rampages. It turns out that this sort of thing has happened before, when Professor Salina rediscovers ancient Native American paintings detailing a similar event many centuries ago. Kathy, however, still loves Paul, and tries to save him.','/nB9N0WegYbEAEoSZKrHWv5RkuEY.jpg','1976-06-01',90,'Released','The Rising Moon Creates a Monster','Track of the Moon Beast',31134,1.2708,2.5,'VhFgeTXuv24','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7203,_binary '\0','/dUttBVsFoZCZaSKuFNK8wcyjf85.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075359',6.2,4944,'en','Two-Minute Warning','A psychotic sniper plans a massive killing spree in a Los Angeles football stadium during a major championship game. The police, led by Captain Peter Holly and the SWAT commander, learn of the plot and rush to the scene.','/qrQ6Y0kWmW89jvWy6I58PsbGZen.jpg','1976-11-12',115,'Released','91,000 people. 33 exit gates. One sniper…','Two-Minute Warning',6883,3.2917,6.3,'nLEbxZiSCvc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7204,_binary '\0','/2kF5LpkWFyrrNetRia4I6CBtI6E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075364',6.3,1720,'fr','La Dernière Femme','Psychological drama of the compelling relationship between a young French engineer and the girl he takes into his home after his wife has left him with their baby son.','/8zbLvPNwA2raK09aqFTYHab3vV9.jpg','1976-04-20',108,'Released','Love. Hate. Loneliness. Humor. Sensuality. Nothing will prepare you for the devastating climax.','The Last Woman',3935,2.9558,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7205,_binary '\0','/ocFCNVDP9qc1TLadFgFYKgVPhU7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075375',6.5,1857,'it','Uomini si nasce poliziotti si muore','Fred and Tony are members of an elite “special squad” of police in Rome who are undercover, licensed to kill, and love to live dangerously.','/pYTfa8hv9Ymk2VqbfGg34dkNG08.jpg','1976-03-11',96,'Released',NULL,'Live Like a Cop, Die Like a Man',77683,1.8604,6.2,'DlpP9QQumqA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7206,_binary '\0','/gTaZHBgI4D3hEO7N0cmbkVTJHh6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075376',5.7,3816,'en','Up!','Adolf Hitler is hiding out in California under the identity of Adolf Schwartz; however, he is soon murdered by a mysterious assailant. This coincides with the arrival of a mysterious woman in a nearby town. Whatever the case might be, nobody seems interested in investigating the crime, but there are many who are interested in her.','/kU6wvyu8yxIf7IynQmn8P0Gi6fN.jpg','1976-10-01',81,'Released','If you don\'t see Up! … you\'ll feel down!','Up!',5651,3.9327,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7207,_binary '\0','/6vJdframPoQ5E3PG4QSDqISuj5w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075391',5.9,1407,'en','Victory at Entebbe','The film is based on an actual event: Operation Entebbe and the freeing of Israeli hostages at Entebbe Airport (now Entebbe International Airport) in Uganda.','/bBa8AZkQTjhf9gLk8yzoEbQg9eI.jpg','1976-12-22',119,'Released','They considered every possibility - and then did the impossible !','Victory at Entebbe',30673,2.0142,5.2,'Bibp2XYxA9g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7208,_binary '\0','/39JKf9Xb1zbu5VrAHaMCCmAX39G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075393',5.3,1372,'en','Vigilante Force','In a small town in California, the quiet citizens find their lives disrupted by boisterous, lawless oil-field workers who have infested their community. One resident, Ben Arnold, enlists his brother Aaron, a Vietnam veteran, to assemble a group of men to restore law and order to the town. Though Aaron\'s crew succeeds, the newfound power goes to some of their heads, and Aaron and Ben must again reclaim the town for the citizens.','/boeL3TQ1UWm58ze3vUzZTBUv3nc.jpg','1976-09-09',89,'Released','They Hired Themselves A Hero - But All They Bought Was Trouble!','Vigilante Force',93018,1.7182,5,'b4_1qmYdwHo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7209,_binary '\0','/A2IJUMyMJZCowjWq32GWqLcEmg9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075404',8.2,12628,'ru','Восхождение','During a freezing WWII winter, two Soviet partisans on a mission to gather food contend with the temperature, the occupying Germans, and their own psyches.','/hJOju5XZfmq4Lg5dPa8IPVY3mDt.jpg','1977-04-02',110,'Released',NULL,'The Ascent',50183,3.0852,7.876,'5M7Y_zun-vg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7210,_binary '\0','/BGuZ49lKLHPh7tcFXmmLzp4M7X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075406',6.4,3981,'en','Voyage of the Damned','A luxury liner carries Jewish refugees from Hitler\'s Germany in a desperate fight for survival.','/zXIAI4nLLHyFzLJz3fTmtd4yErF.jpg','1976-12-22',155,'Released','It lasted 30 days... You will remember it as long as you live.','Voyage of the Damned',75641,3.8479,6,'FES7hmkFD6o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7211,_binary '\0','/yDoxGhbraztYnY8oyyK5cf7LLWF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075433',5.7,2886,'en','The Witch Who Came from the Sea','Anger stemming from being abused as a child drives an alcoholic\'s daughter to kill as an adult.','/rW1ofAyTSnEh3yHzSHXPf7Icd4r.jpg','1976-02-06',88,'Released','Molly really knows how to cut men down to size!!','The Witch Who Came from the Sea',54109,1.8496,5.9,'-hteIj01zyo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7212,_binary '\0','/tcoZj2kgjjLdacEjqD8nMjWMiEx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075439',5.5,2151,'zh','新精武門','A brother and sister escape from Japanese-occupied Shanghai to Japanese-occupied Taiwan, to stay with their grandfather who runs a Kung-Fu school there. However, the master of a Japanese Kung- Fu school in Taiwan has plans to bringing all other schools on the island under his domination, and part of his plan involves the murder of the grandfather.','/7Uk4Crwwuz3OHeEtOZIRxFSgSxY.jpg','1976-07-08',119,'Released','One man. One style. One legend.','New Fist of Fury',18666,3.1076,6,'Anm8HQ1RKbg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7213,_binary '\0','/1msC8NustIljEWLjZqhm68VrPQD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075441',7,1280,'ja','やくざの墓場 くちなしの花','A police investigator cracks down on yakuza business, but once he realizes the police are in negotiations with certain factions, he sides with his own syndicate of choice.','/bF0YXY1UOEfKphZaz5qWcv2lzhD.jpg','1976-10-30',97,'Released',NULL,'Yakuza Graveyard',64578,1.7896,6.6,'Rcm3aWXoYew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7214,_binary '\0','/jCE9q1UlrE4I5rm1Ja0pomXVSiN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075454',7.2,1263,'pl','Zaklęte rewiry','Set in the early 1930s, a young man finds a job as a dishwasher in a hotel and quickly works his way up the ladder. Loosely based on the novel by Henryk Worcell.','/jhatEl6SXhcTO9ekJlV2OCr8aX3.jpg','1975-11-27',94,'Released',NULL,'Hotel Pacific',208309,1.1839,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7215,_binary '\0','/fB6Al7U2jfW8DSFKwBqWB8PWAcm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075462',7.2,9036,'es','¿Quién puede matar a un niño?','A couple of English tourists arrive at the island of Almanzora, off the Spanish Mediterranean coast, where they discover that there are no adults in a small fishing village, only some children who stare at them and smile mysteriously.','/uLHgyZv6IRtMFFuglDFQIW31tos.jpg','1976-04-26',112,'Released','Suddenly… They were the only adults left alive on the island','Who Can Kill a Child?',43751,2.8338,7,'NoKr3DbGBpo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7216,_binary '\0','/6Y2H39ntwoOROwpmecWpkcGp8qt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075467',8.5,7428,'hu','Az ötödik pecsét','In 1944 Budapest, a watchmaker, a book seller and a carpenter are drinking in a bar with the owner, when they are joined by a stranger. The watchmaker poses a hypothetical that will change their lives forever.','/sXF5QK4pB1Nqklqq1zxQUaNC522.jpg','1976-10-07',112,'Released','Let Both The Guilty and the Innocent Live In Fear','The Fifth Seal',77660,1.6996,7.9,'2Cj1mJXNpWc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7217,_binary '\0','/qcXeklrcNP2wEix4oBPJNlHtDkO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075610',8,3137,'en','21 Up','After another 7 year wait, director Michael Apted revisits the same group of British-born children from Seven Up! and 7 Plus Seven. The subjects are interviewed as to the changes that have occurred in their lives during the last seven years.','/2T8mH3V4X428zCipN928ZsRkK7N.jpg','1977-05-09',100,'Released',NULL,'21 Up',20553,1.7826,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7218,_binary '\0','/pTmMEIW2cyOkcSRkWTCDEbd5if0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075612',7.7,20167,'en','3 Women','Two co-workers, one a vain woman and the other an awkward teenager, share an increasingly bizarre relationship after becoming roommates.','/uL5Yg8MEgHGXymTaJBYXn9g0xsH.jpg','1977-04-29',124,'Released','1 Woman Became 2, 2 Women Became 3, 3 Women Became 1.','3 Women',41662,4.388,7.1,'9K8nRZBZvqc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7219,_binary '\0','/mHeyQoYO5zyWLZxsyVzGZLymf15.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075614',6.8,7790,'it','Sette note in nero','A woman with psychic powers has a vision of a murder that took place in a house owned by her husband.','/uPKvZRB2KsJWEMv91GRqDBOm311.jpg','1977-08-10',97,'Released','Suddenly and without warning it\'s tomorrow... and you\'re dead.','The Psychic',27703,3.1634,7.012,'EBHG9t7cIyQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7220,_binary '\0','/vb4lRWUV0ZdFN1MyNqGGMNgE0xB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075617',6.5,4202,'en','ABBA: The Movie','A radio DJ in pursuit of an exclusive interview follows ABBA during their mega-successful tour of Australia.','/b6ELAAxwFiyiy8RreGQRDcleOkk.jpg','1977-12-15',95,'Released','Frontstage, Backstage & On The Road - Take The Tour','ABBA: The Movie',14336,2.5477,6.7,'W-HGQR9afws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7221,_binary '\0','/9s5ru1Xk3m35tDx57MdWELAfjt7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075620',4.1,1689,'en','The Bees','Corporate smuggling of South American killer bees into the United States results in huge swarms terrorizing the northern hemisphere. A small team of scientists work desperately to destroy the threat, but the bees soon mutate into a super-intelligent species that threatens the world.','/4H3odEasZuZKDimxDMUafm8T8a9.jpg','1978-11-01',92,'Released','They prey on HUMAN FLESH!','The Bees',29342,1.6644,4.7,'hZBXGVMOjJk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7222,_binary '\0','/4yJhOfYa1jHFhSJ6frhju2pjCKu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075627',6.6,3578,'en','Aces High','The first World War is in its third year and aerial combat above the Western Front is consuming the nation\'s favored children at an appalling rate. By early 1917, the average life-span of a British pilot is less than a fortnight. Such losses place a fearsome strain on Gresham, commanding officer of the squadron. Aces High recreates the early days of the Royal Flying Corps with some magnificently staged aerial battles, and sensitive direction presents a moving portrayal of the futilities of war.','/zsRNFxi4efOdIb36chcPOJf2nRt.jpg','1976-05-19',114,'Released','High above the trenches 14 days is a long life...This is the 15th day!','Aces High',44630,1.9839,5.928,'KKwXpyueIyc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7223,_binary '\0','/c6S1CqSkfFZZB61sL1f0P0UG5pK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075633',7.4,2341,'cs','Adéla ještě nevečeřela','When famous detective Nick Carter visits Prague, he becomes involved in strange case of a missing dog and even stranger carnivorous plant. He becomes convinced that he is standing against his greatest enemy, the Gardener, who supposedly died years ago in a swamp...','/4bEeCFpdaWjRpyN2wpOY2wuD42y.jpg','1978-08-04',106,'Released',NULL,'Adela Has Not Had Supper Yet',20087,1.545,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7224,_binary '\0','/flYEmZuMyDJKomYbprKzkbltXRw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075648',5.8,14084,'en','Airport \'77','Flight 23 has crashed in the Bermuda Triangle after a hijacking gone wrong. Now the surviving passengers must brave panic, slow leaks, oxygen depletion, and more while attempting a daring plan, all while 200 feet underwater.','/m9b3frZR0Wu8I3ayN3QPrxfZMvC.jpg','1977-03-11',114,'Released','Flight 23 has crashed in the Bermuda Triangle... passengers still alive, trapped underwater...','Airport \'77',7227,4.0846,5.6,'lGmVXP_JS6o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7225,_binary '\0','/jGyv9OChl6RmVF2D98jXAiKFd6w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075651',6.2,5511,'it','Schock','A couple is terrorized in their new house haunted by the vengeful ghost of the woman\'s former husband who possesses her young son.','/lAa9c7jxONjWNbaacZrIwb39bf0.jpg','1977-08-12',95,'Released','A new look at the face of evil.','Shock',5481,2.298,6.3,'ISVRokyp_Yk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7226,_binary '\0','/oGMXhZKiynT6XE3hhB1tr3tDt95.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075656',3.9,1547,'en','The Alien Factor','A spaceship containing specimens for an intergalactic zoo crashes on Earth near a small backwoods town. The specimens escape, and soon town folk start turning up mutilated.','/3XlKascfkq6CU6uzru8uLkMFZff.jpg','1978-05-12',80,'Released','Gripping Sci-Fi Terror From Beyond...','The Alien Factor',86633,1.3578,4.2,'MN8PLqOeZT0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7227,_binary '\0','/9LROEu7Ab1zVv8jgHZgCJgXYRYy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','t