6-10',95,'Released','They\'re Free! Ready to Serve You on the Big Screen!','Are You Being Served? The Movie',20155,1.9212,5,'sM1nF4iIAXg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7235,_binary '\0','/9ylZRaHbbbVjaLCvTy7CfDbtu9w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075704',5.8,7510,'en','Audrey Rose','A man is convinced that 11-year old girl, Ivy, is the reincarnation of his own daughter Audrey Rose, who died in a fiery car accident, along with his wife, two minutes before Ivy was born.','/nEkJHfLBDav9PELzMz23mF7bAAi.jpg','1977-04-06',113,'Released','Suppose a stranger told you your daughter was his daughter in another life? Suppose you began to believe him? Suppose it was true?','Audrey Rose',49126,3.0015,5.7,'qGcbsm37jb8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7236,_binary '\0','/tHoaQ452GY8Lvq9JKATEJ1OkMDw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075710',4.8,1758,'en','Lisa, Lisa','A group of three criminals on the run from the law, go about terrorizing the local townsfolk of a small community, before descending on an isolated farm which is home to a young girl named Lisa and her paralyzed grandfather. After being sexually assaulted by two of the gangsters, she retaliates using an axe and a razor blade.','/fj2PR0EnAakr9F0VhUe2uwESmII.jpg','1974-12-09',68,'Released','You\'ll DIE To Know Her Secret ...','Lisa, Lisa',56383,1.7875,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7237,_binary '\0','/mZP6RmsSUAA46s1Dl1tjhCzhTUs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075718',5.7,4059,'en','The Bad News Bears in Breaking Training','A troubled, rebellious teen drives his rambunctious baseball team out to Houston where they play an exhibition game and the boy meets his estranged father, and hires him as the teams coach.','/aGShIKIKWDCPVGDfeEXwTfmE4mi.jpg','1977-07-08',100,'Released','The Bad News Bears are one year older and one year wilder.','The Bad News Bears in Breaking Training',19050,2.2916,5.8,'C67D20c_Kls','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.