',50435,5.2386,5.4,'gpxRAfnd15U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7242,_binary '\0','/yuPXKynGLm1WDidnmC5Oyo7Y8IJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075765',6.8,10001,'en','Black Sunday','An Israeli anti-terrorist agent must stop a disgruntled Vietnam vet cooperating in a Black September PLO plot to commit a terrorist attack at the Super Bowl.','/kLPRiWRXTfN6gSTgzlvXYCB8mvh.jpg','1977-04-01',143,'Released','It could be tomorrow!','Black Sunday',50374,2.8163,6.7,'EolqMkHyVuI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7243,_binary '\0','/4iYivdr37E8GbJnUgR0WTqG72sF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075774',5.8,5285,'en','Bobby Deerfield','Bobby Deerfield, a famous American race car driver on the European circuit, falls in love with the enigmatic Lillian Morelli, who is terminally ill.','/99l4UONs9galDQSVJBlZTaMhudl.jpg','1977-09-29',124,'Released','He had to meet her - to find himself!','Bobby Deerfield',42217,2.8139,5.8,'h6LDJTteGTI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7244,_binary '\0','/gpAGraW59m8PSweLbThQrdlS94B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075783',4.4,4294,'en','Breaker! Breaker!','Truck driver searches for his brother, who has disappeared in a town run by a corrupt judge.','/gfYp4WG1l4uk5eoUf3Iqe3knwZY.jpg','1977-04-01',86,'Released','A town without justice. A hero without fear.','Breaker! Breaker!',19108,3.0366,4.9,'yHLAe1DkFwY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7245,_binary '\0','/1oRug23GWxgyQmqQGbX7ke974lp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075784',7.4,68622,'en','A Bridge Too Far','The story of Operation Market Garden—a failed attempt by the allies in the latter stages of WWII to end the war quickly by securing three bridges in Holland allowing access over the Rhine into Germany. A combination of poor allied intelligence and the presence of two crack German panzer divisions meant that the final part of this operation (the bridge in Arnhem over the Rhine) was doomed to failure.','/gneIarUvpURo2pQZ7j1bL3EbAES.jpg','1977-06-15',175,'Released','Out of the sky comes the screen\'s most incredible spectacle of men and war!','A Bridge Too Far',5902,8.9922,7.2,'TuGPMo1WKZg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7246,_binary '\0','/8uhQyS0nKh0MAgiZbxw42ZL8NSG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075788',7,1335,'en','Bruce Lee, the Legend','The Official Golden Harvest tribute to the Master of the Martial Arts Film, Bruce Lee.','/fdD3whXbdfHjlcDNt2oEy6jsxjD.jpg','1984-01-01',88,'Released',NULL,'Bruce Lee, the Legend',44645,3.9606,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7247,_binary '\0','/8PB8HLRcKjnkUDxm0ELtlwm7XzT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075790',7.1,7647,'sv','Bröderna Lejonhjärta','After brothers Jonathan and Crusty pass away, they reunite in Nangijala, the land of eternal spring. Casting a long shadow over their world is the tyrant Tengil, ruler of the country Karmanjaka, where he’s building his new fortress up in the Ancient Mountains.','/giPbP2p6R2pnIIETAEmWWhZ4jVJ.jpg','1977-09-23',102,'Released','From our world. To the world of the tales and the camp fires.','The Brothers Lionheart',11291,3.2065,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7248,_binary '\0','/2Kkqmy3EpXqBDqv1vvsNXX3pwww.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075793',8,9057,'it','C\'eravamo tanto amati','Three partisans bound by a strong friendship return home after the war, but the clash with everyday reality puts a strain on their bond.','/zGGWYpiKNwjpKxelPxOMqJnUgDs.jpg','1974-12-21',125,'Released','A many splendored thing.','We All Loved Each Other So Much',42269,6.4789,8.279,'GFaFeuPep5w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7249,_binary '\0','/6NMedeS4pbfsPfhycL3XH3tCH8U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075807',6.7,5488,'en','Candleshoe','When ex-con artist Harry claims that a secret treasure is hidden inside Candleshoe, an English estate, he creates an elaborate plan to find and steal the prize. By convincing a girl named Casey to impersonate the estate owner\'s long-lost granddaughter, Harry hopes to uncover the treasure\'s location. But when Casey has a change of heart, she must follow the clues and find the treasure, in order to save Candleshoe and stop Harry before it is too late.','/6Rq9u5fnS6PzWz9dgPQmBhgDvRJ.jpg','1977-12-16',101,'Released','For 10% of the action and a red Ferrari, she\'d con her own grandmother.','Candleshoe',14612,2.6413,6.859,'v32ce9150hc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7250,_binary '\0','/4wmT2KQrxA6pT6R4mN6kx8cqdFI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075809',6.2,13185,'en','The Car','The Utah community of Santa Ynez is being terrorized by a mysterious black coupe that appears out of nowhere and begins running people down. After the car kills off the town sheriff, Captain Wade Parent is determined to stop the murderous driver.','/gFM9yMrO4fQMiG440Lx6bazB517.jpg','1977-05-12',96,'Released','Is it a phantom, a demon, or the devil himself?','The Car',24655,5.0622,6.4,'PoAD3kUmN9s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7251,_binary '\0','/oJxViODljHew0cLmLl5iOD4t9aN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075811',7.5,1355,'cs','Čarodějův učeň','Beggar boy Krabat is lured to apprentice for an evil, one-eyed sorcerer. With a number of others, he works at the sorcerer\'s mill while learning black magic. Every Christmas, one of the lads has to face the master in a magical duel, where the boy never stands a chance because the master is the only person allowed to use a secret spell.','/lTQyzYE1K64CeihYjEwCJZHdauC.jpg','1978-03-01',73,'Released',NULL,'The Sorcerer\'s Apprentice',8128,1.4362,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7252,_binary '\0','/sa399JpuCtLBmkrk3sIqR9QrqMR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075820',4.5,1604,'en','Cathy\'s Curse','A young girl is possessed by the spirit of her dead aunt, who died in a car accident. Soon members of her family begin to mysteriously die off.','/bcX3fAUa1VhLN0rYLYV74eI8UQX.jpg','1977-07-29',82,'Released','She has the power... to terrorize.','Cathy\'s Curse',106774,1.2853,4.8,'OBTLK8C7PFU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7253,_binary '\0','/79ofDLTW1ozMSYDNWhDYe5cQzAa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075824',7.8,27239,'fr','Cet obscur objet du désir','After dumping a bucket of water on a beautiful young woman from the window of a train car, wealthy Frenchman Mathieu, regales his fellow passengers with the story of the dysfunctional relationship between himself and the young woman in question, a fiery 19-year-old flamenco dancer named Conchita. What follows is a tale of cruelty, depravity and lies -- the very building blocks of love.','/9iUdC4dftkjYSBUJq5DAxC6WqB9.jpg','1977-08-17',103,'Released','Luis Buñuel\'s masterpiece','That Obscure Object of Desire',5781,5.2529,7.4,'3-6OUqQk-SM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7254,_binary '\0','/vuf9EYqSkp3zM2TDRqiEXL2QrQm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075834',6,1639,'it','La ragazza dal pigiama giallo','Two seemingly separate stories in New South Wales: a burned, murdered body of a young woman is found on the beach, and a retired inspector makes inquiries; also, Linda, a waitress and ferry attendant, has several lovers and marries one, but continues seeing the others. The police have a suspect in the murder, but the retired inspector is convinced they\'re wrong; he continues a methodical investigation. Linda and her husband separate, and there are complications. Will the stories cross or are they already twisted together?','/3dlUKHP94rorboEGH2JWll3zo1Q.jpg','1977-12-31',104,'Released','Based on a true story.','The Pyjama Girl Case',61540,2.0862,5.8,'xV9X7B4pm2k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7255,_binary '\0','/s3deOdS2Hpl8cnfBMw4GAYVnpAe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075838',4.8,1669,'en','The Child','In early 20th century California, a young woman takes a job as a nanny to a young girl whose mother has recently died. On her way to the rural, secluded home, she meets a neighbor who warns her of the family\'s reputation. She soon meets the crabby, morbid Mr. Nordon, his awkward son Len, and the aloof Rosalie; who can seemingly animate objects when she is angry.','/iUkNBWZPTvdP5THpXNjg2yjTPwM.jpg','1977-06-02',82,'Released','Let\'s play hide and go kill!','The Child',83834,1.9771,4.3,'bpe9vjcoXno','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7256,_binary '\0','/f388pIkU5JiuFgTsOVLi6vdduWE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075845',5.6,2111,'en','The Choirboys','A group of Los Angeles cops decide to take off some of the pressures of their jobs by engaging in various forms of after-hours debauchery.','/2c70Xc6bZCIEISC9dRaEknL1e3o.jpg','1977-12-23',119,'Released','Don\'t look for these guys in church.','The Choirboys',48852,1.637,5.4,'4L5GPGdwGm0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7257,_binary '\0','/iBsfqlbjxDkox9RUlnLZ1tA6Mx5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075848',6.3,1488,'it','Ciao maschio','In metahistorical New York city electrotechnician Lafayette deals with a megalomaniac director of a wax museum of ancient Rome, an italian lonely anarchist, a group of feminist actresses - including Angelica who falls in love with him - and a small adopted chimpanzee.','/gw1PrkRwMe9XZUksQpdB81ExP1j.jpg','1978-02-24',113,'Released',NULL,'Bye Bye Monkey',42200,1.7112,6.2,'O0x_r8Ez6Fk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7258,_binary '\0','/cqWFXLqrFINrGPhxCCbcUKWBYtQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075849',5.6,1226,'en','Cinderella','Cinderella, with the help of her \"fairy\" godmother, is granted heightened sexual prowess to win over Prince Charming. After a blindfolded orgy at the royal castle, the nerdy Prince must sleep with every willing woman in his kingdom until he finds that one, mysterious lover who so \"stood out\" on the night of the sex Ball.','/nLP4FSHXRTNRbMy6PYPxEAX1xkm.jpg','1977-05-01',94,'Released','What the prince slipped Cinderella was not a slipper','Cinderella',62752,3.0234,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7259,_binary '\0','/1I0PpB7pqmOTCaZ53iP10wWM4Fx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075852',6.7,1506,'it','Il cinico, l\'infame, il violento','A vengeful criminal targets the inspector who put him away, but the inspector survives and fakes his death. Ignoring orders to flee, he sets out to bring the fugitive back to justice.','/AnKKiGULec4PsE0Udo23SEdGXk2.jpg','1977-02-03',100,'Released','A feast of violence and action!','The Cynic, the Rat & the Fist',52810,1.8386,6.615,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7260,_binary '\0','/yBCekmb7vK70xUhtsRQBcTu65sB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075860',7.6,238638,'en','Close Encounters of the Third Kind','After an encounter with UFOs, an electricity linesman feels undeniably drawn to an isolated area in the wilderness where something spectacular is about to happen.','/yaPx3cK9zGFX3SbcKwxWM1QIbUh.jpg','1977-12-14',137,'Released','We are not alone.','Close Encounters of the Third Kind',840,13.5889,7.357,'dSpQ3G08k48','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7261,_binary '\0','/AhPnZ0GaYXyXCz33iAd4Ti4Tj7z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075875',4.4,1332,'en','Confessions from a Holiday Camp','Timmy Lea and his brother-in-law Sidney Noggett are working as entertainment officers at Funfrall, a typical British holiday camp. The staff are lazy and inefficient, preferring to laze by the pool rather than organise activities for the holiday campers. A new owner, Mr. Whitemonk, an ex-prison officer, takes over the camp and is determined to install discipline into the staff. He is on the verge of dismissing Timmy and Sidney; however, Sidney\'s suggestion of organising a beauty contest changes his mind.','/nv8ecPVoCxSf1zy5baudqKlTxzZ.jpg','1977-08-01',88,'Released','Holiday Campers Exposed! The Funniest Take Off Of the Season!','Confessions from a Holiday Camp',50076,2.8501,5,'CdBnzUfyCRo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7262,_binary '\0','/2LLMJoUdgkorU0Cz99ObEyPm5Jp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075882',7.2,2144,'en','Count Dracula','Jonathan Harker visits the Count in Transylvania to help him with preparations to move to England. Harker becomes Dracula\'s prisoner and discovers Dracula\'s true nature. After Dracula makes his way to England, Harker becomes involved in an effort to track down and destroy the Count, eventually chasing the vampire back to his castle.','/pZqlsK4A5vAH7kKwsWZ9Fjh9Aeq.jpg','1977-12-22',150,'Released','We belong dead','Count Dracula',50448,1.9751,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7263,_binary '\0','/54YystppDh234m2TLmTBYaYU7xy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075888',3.6,1866,'en','The Crater Lake Monster','The heat of a meteor crashing into the lake incubates a prehistoric egg, which grows into a plesiosaur-like monster that terrifies the community.','/iEpdGQaagHhpJDBsLemMF5EGolB.jpg','1977-03-01',85,'Released','A beast more frightening than your most terrifying nightmare!','The Crater Lake Monster',37901,1.9213,3.9,'2ovG9kI4zfk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7264,_binary '\0','/36zif7dloaMlMUzrIW5xf1ymqV2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075902',7.6,5389,'pl','Człowiek z marmuru','A young Polish filmmaker sets out to find out what happened to Mateusz Birkut, a bricklayer who became a propaganda hero in the 1950s but later fell out of favor and disappeared.','/dQWfBHQmdQbcUAeyr0VS1j19uto.jpg','1977-02-25',153,'Released',NULL,'Man of Marble',224,1.586,7.1,'yVKdrnbmQlU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7265,_binary '\0','/eMMDskrOnepuahAilFZ1hKhkDXM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075909',5.3,6660,'en','Damnation Alley','Following World War III, four survivors at a desert military installation attempt to drive across the desolate wasteland of America to Albany, where they hope more survivors are living, using a specially built vehicles to protect themselves against the freakish weather, mutated plant and animal life, and other dangers encountered along the way.','/le6eG9xm7xmDWvnQIRK7prH5U69.jpg','1977-09-10',91,'Released','You have seen great adventures. You are about to live one.','Damnation Alley',25763,3.9661,5.15,'L9gmzuX6c5w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7266,_binary '\0','/h914VysrTeJz9ZtOwse6ZCvUZml.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075913',5.3,3696,'en','Day of the Animals','The depletion of the earth\'s ozone layer causes animals above the altitude of 5000 feet to run amok, which is very unfortunate for a group of hikers who get dropped off up there by helicopter just before the quarantine is announced.','/exMoNRUifMyFMUBnZrrghlojvHn.jpg','1977-05-13',97,'Released','A shocking vision of things to come...','Day of the Animals',64976,2.8646,5.2,'XcR6_VphJIs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7267,_binary '\0','/dlKvKjIGPC8voTCS5piLwMhpptl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075917',6.2,2246,'en','Dead of Night','This anthology tells three stories: a man buys a car that takes him back and forth through time; a tale of vampires; and a distraught mother asks for her drowned son to come back to life and gets more than she bargained for.','/rlggMFJz62yltZprMzl2dRP0WpZ.jpg','1977-03-29',76,'Released','Three tales of mystery, imagination and suspense.','Dead of Night',84898,1.9327,6.1,'AadptgdG2yA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7268,_binary '\0','/191Cv9JHPkceprzAPlCNUVCaU5Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075921',5.8,2367,'en','Death Game','George Manning is a well-to-do businessman, husband, and father. While his family is away on his birthday, he invites a pair of rain-soaked young women into his house to wait out an evening thunderstorm. The two girls seduce Manning and ultimately kidnap and torture him in his own home.','/a4emMnKA9b9RjDgOeMKvVRBmXAT.jpg','1977-05-01',87,'Released','The object is to stay alive.','Death Game',86743,2.6444,5.9,'L38IwbXMmUw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7269,_binary '\0','/xpbtcFg51CkVdOnO71Zcs5md3OY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075922',6,1629,'en','Death Weekend','Harry is a rich dentist who often brings women up to his rural lakehouse. One weekend, he invites Diane, a former fashion model. On their way to the house, Diane runs a gang of thugs off the road. Humiliated, the thugs track down the couple for revenge.','/64WSTKOOknDQCd6slTwBqbN6UUD.jpg','1976-09-17',87,'Released','They were going to rape her one by one. She was going to kill them....one by one.','The House by the Lake',40343,1.4858,5.8,'16laimgsR1I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7270,_binary '\0','/ma5pGfKNoEnfoDn1OA9c8Ura8a4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075925',6.3,15616,'en','The Deep','A pair of young vacationers are involved in a dangerous conflict with treasure hunters when they discover a way into a deadly wreck in Bermuda waters.','/z3HXf0nIN7tvpTF8fxiJrvD603f.jpg','1977-06-17',123,'Released','Is anything worth the terror of the Deep?','The Deep',20416,4.9231,6.1,'Pic2cThP7mU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7271,_binary '\0','/bJLbFDrUOASkPoUeDOX0UdFE7TD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075930',6.3,7525,'en','God Told Me To','A New York detective investigates a series of murders committed by random citizens who claim that \'God told them to\'.','/nbUjhJGCuSiDiMaNJs2kCtTL7ag.jpg','1976-10-22',90,'Released','The people of this city are being terrorized. The crimes have no motives. The killers have only one explanation...','God Told Me To',31579,2.8651,5.844,'dllpA8oTG6o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7272,_binary '\0','/UJZePu7YMnmj4B6d7ilmXMI0c5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075931',6.3,11460,'en','Demon Seed','A scientist creates Proteus, an organic supercomputer with artificial intelligence which becomes obsessed with human beings, and in particular the creator\'s wife.','/8rAbL1cI5TYB1RmXsPPHnLwnDsi.jpg','1977-04-07',94,'Released','Julie Christie carries the \"Demon Seed.\" Fear for her.','Demon Seed',18775,4.7691,5.904,'zNUEp5A9eKU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7273,_binary '\0','/pCFhLRoTotvGm0qCJfeLnbVSAnU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075932',7.4,3236,'fr','La Dentellière','Pomme is a meek and mild French beautician whose life takes a fateful turn during a vacation to Normandy. She becomes the lover of middle-class literature-student François. The relationship sours when François takes her home to meet his parents, thanks in no small part to their differing social backgrounds.','/aW7jaQr0TtijQfRauxXcG9wG4aS.jpg','1977-05-25',107,'Released',NULL,'The Lacemaker',56935,1.9757,6.75,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7274,_binary '\0','/pPzl3ae97wcU72yDE9PDl4qq446.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075936',7,6814,'en','Desperate Living','After killing her husband, Peggy Gravel and her murderous maid Grizelda wind up in the crazy town of Mortville, where Queen Carlotta presides over a sleazy collection of misfits.','/kqEZ1CbxtrXtpAT1jeYfo52um3s.jpg','1977-05-27',91,'Released','It isn\'t very pretty…','Desperate Living',14262,4.4312,6.4,'ndpvmPqWN04','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7275,_binary '\0','/mAtCjCDYN3c5Bjm6P4wOmDMlJLv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075938',7,5621,'fr','Le Diable probablement','Charles drifts through politics, religion and psychoanalysis, rejecting them all. Once he realises the depth of his disgust with the moral and physical decline of the society he lives in, he decides that suicide is the only option...','/8y00J2rVtxHntKMukkkzsYKQORe.jpg','1977-06-15',97,'Released',NULL,'The Devil, Probably',32097,2.8028,6.744,'qJ0I09h1c2M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7276,_binary '\0','/uXjV6j2M75J70UbgMbyvhkMz37Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075939',7,2017,'fr','Diabolo menthe','In the fall of 1963, Anne is becoming a teenager. She lives in Paris with her mother and her older sister, Frédérique. They\'re just back from summer at the beach with their father. School starts. A turbulent year awaits them both.','/5yQt2mefAXqNniQXiIrqaqbxMOI.jpg','1977-12-14',101,'Released',NULL,'Peppermint Soda',80220,1.8828,6.496,'UoVkHWq3-l0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7277,_binary '\0','/bx9GY1VD6hpoR19FgP1V9RqklWj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075950',5.7,3686,'en','The Domino Principle','Roy Tucker, a Vietnam war veteran with excellent shooting skills, is serving a long prison sentence when a mysterious visitor promises him that he will be released if he agrees to carry out a dangerous assignment.','/6weTBnv6tsFYpI5of123JSWQP5O.jpg','1977-03-23',98,'Released','Trust no one. No one.','The Domino Principle',32029,3.6556,5.8,'Cq-n_eWQOO8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7278,_binary '\0','/zO9ZzreCsmyxeMo0MEPSArzj1Ra.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075963',8,2209,'ka','ნატვრის ხე','Marita arrives at a small village in Georgia to live with her aunt. She meets a poor young lad, Gedia, and falls in love with him. But her relatives are determined to marry the girl off to a local rich man…','/pWt4grF2eztN53h1hs1fpiKZxBa.jpg','1976-12-19',107,'Released',NULL,'The Wishing Tree',150223,1.5935,7.1,'o-ssjFZtVoM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7279,_binary '\0','/xyVURBvbRIzsGJlD0h8vybkXjLs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075968',7.4,28981,'en','The Duellists','In 1800, as Napoleon Bonaparte rises to power in France, a rivalry erupts between Armand and Gabriel, two lieutenants in the French Army, over a perceived insult. For over a decade, they engage in a series of duels amidst larger conflicts, including the failed French invasion of Russia in 1812, and shifts in the political and social systems of Europe.','/nqjMYlUXnmmO8Jqucow4nj9alE5.jpg','1977-08-31',100,'Released','Fencing is a science. Loving is a passion. Duelling is an obsession.','The Duellists',19067,4.5339,7.3,'-yjl7u0Afqg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7280,_binary '\0','/t4GM77B8FgfGXg5ZxbmhduSaQeX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075975',6.8,1602,'fr','Une Histoire Simple','A middle-aged woman leaves her partner and drifts back to her ex-husband, while the lives of her middle class friends intersect with her own.','/2OyRQunGqWBMcBDjT4s0nFXFXsh.jpg','1978-11-22',107,'Released','...it could be yours','A Simple Story',3425,1.4421,6.017,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7281,_binary '\0','/grUXUNFnrpv2HLqVxJveXFTxyvB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075984',5,3628,'it','Emanuelle e gli ultimi cannibali','Intrepid photographer Emanuelle is taken deep into the Amazonian jungle to search for a cannibalistic tribe long believed to be extinct.','/823QxR2Gj8fDNTN0Bka9rlu2Sn5.jpg','1977-10-21',93,'Released','That Emanuelle girl is back more EROTIC & EXOTIC than ever.','Emanuelle and the Last Cannibals',28324,3.5431,5,'USCaDTTCLCk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7282,_binary '\0','/knubjU2jcD4qAPK2gTgppSgA1sQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075987',4.8,1354,'it','Emanuelle - Perché violenza alle donne?','The increasingly politicised Emanuelle gets deeper into fighting an international trade composed of sex, violence and high profile players.','/v5aRSDn97l8Y2CVIuZLg0zs2hfo.jpg','1977-09-16',102,'Released','Emanuelle\'s back to take you places you\'ve never been before!','Emanuelle Around the World',28325,4.0939,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7283,_binary '\0','/gkrF4A7MiKIU2ZvuP3XZ7MsyUlm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075988',8.1,5729,'en','Emmet Otter\'s Jug-Band Christmas','A poor otter family risks everything for the chance to win the cash prize of a talent contest for Christmas.','/jng1wnVzIBdtllpUWQdzkODIB4Z.jpg','1977-12-04',53,'Released','It\'s a Toe-Tapping Christmas in Frogtown Hollow!','Emmet Otter\'s Jug-Band Christmas',20785,2.1246,6.9,'gliKX4st0fY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7284,_binary '\0','/fZqKC0Dw420APMovCTdneSURJDb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075989',4.4,6224,'en','Empire of the Ants','A Florida real estate developer and her captain lure investors to a property in the Everglades called Dreamland Shores, under false pretenses that the swampland will soon be developed. After the group arrives on a small island, they find it has been overrun by giant mutated ants, brought on by the dumping of toxic waste in the area.','/6cmuKjH92h2wrBlbj0WPaTdnpnl.jpg','1977-06-29',89,'Released','For they shall inherit the earth... sooner than you think!','Empire of the Ants',42218,4.4173,5,'09TyNNYGbcs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7285,_binary '\0','/leD5pUm4aTIsSEdXXNhlr8Ko9Aq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075990',3.2,1472,'en','End of the World','After witnessing a man\'s death in a bizarre accident, Father Pergado goes on a spiritual retreat, where he encounters his alien double bent on world conquest.','/ixPm2F6ddHpVrQvCkNZeKT2sXP0.jpg','1977-08-01',88,'Released','There is everything to look forward to...except tomorrow','End of the World',3030,2.166,3.9,'RRsxe8q_xgc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7286,_binary '\0','/hJuAIIeYHvUOUPlpDZwTwpJFEnb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075993',6.9,1669,'en','An Enemy of the People','A small forest town is trying to promote itself as a place for tourists to come enjoy the therapeutic hot springs and unspoiled nature. Dr. Stockmann, however, makes the inconvenient discovery that the nature around the village is not so unspoiled. In fact, the runoff from the local tanning mill has contaminated the water to a dangerous degree. The town fathers argue that cleaning up the mess would be far too expensive and the publicity would destroy the town\'s reputation, so therefore news of the pollution should be suppressed. Dr. Stockmann decides to fight to get the word out to the people, but receives as very mixed reaction.','/vV11P8ICDO1EE618dubk0KbNBiV.jpg','1978-03-17',107,'Released','The tragedy of a an honest man destroyed by a town\'s greed.','An Enemy of the People',121890,2.3642,6.8,'gcPtvOBqdZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7287,_binary '\0','/2Oyu9SU0V4qBxHAlzKjFqjt9OxV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075995',7.1,9337,'en','Equus','A psychiatrist, Martin Dysart, investigates the savage blinding of six horses with a metal spike in a stable in Hampshire, England. The atrocity was committed by an unassuming seventeen-year-old stable boy named Alan Strang, the only son of an opinionated but inwardly-timid father and a genteel, religious mother. As Dysart exposes the truths behind the boy\'s demons, he finds himself face-to-face with his own.','/tGjbZqTaq73jcOrcYD3j0trMRKG.jpg','1977-10-16',137,'Released','I am yours and you are mine.','Equus',37258,2.1387,7,'ojNIzmwIIW0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7288,_binary '\0','/jXNJOtNC8qvrENlGljHJUJxHkPd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0075999',5.9,1491,'es','Escalofrío','After a chance encounter with a mysterious couple claiming to be old friends, Andrés and Ana are invited to spend the evening at a beautiful, secluded old villa. As the night winds down, they begin to sense that there are some rather strange things going on around them and, after agreeing to sleep over, find themselves unwittingly pulled into a series of bizarre sexual encounters which they slowly discover are part of a horrifying Satanic ritual designed to make them slaves to the Prince of Darkness!','/hmCV5MRwJL8VwHJDmZnp8Velw3Y.jpg','1978-08-12',82,'Released',NULL,'Satan\'s Blood',28485,2.4541,6.1,'6gSJvB18iTo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7289,_binary '\0','/b0F0k58AQmsqroqjBHQLFXhf00Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076001',7.3,2556,'es','La escopeta nacional','A catalan manufacturer of intercoms travels to Madrid, accompanied by his mistress, to attend a hunt that he has organized. Its main purpose is to mix with people of high society to improve their business. All seems well until the owner of the farm shows full authority over James, who is the real organizer of the meeting. The celebration is diverse characters who live next to absurd situations.','/rIYrY2pML6JdKv7J1ugusFnuOHi.jpg','1978-09-14',95,'Released',NULL,'The National Shotgun',116312,1.1443,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7290,_binary '\0','/wyRJPq5lUy7V5ETiiwihff9wl3G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076009',3.8,31209,'en','Exorcist II: The Heretic','Bizarre nightmares plague Regan MacNeil four years after her possession and exorcism. Has the demon returned? And if so, can the combined faith and knowledge of a Vatican investigator and a research specialist free her from its grasp?','/g9i3LTMYLRHvCYSKimZEfd1Vqy7.jpg','1977-06-17',118,'Released','It\'s four years later... What does she remember?','Exorcist II: The Heretic',11586,7.936,4.5,'zmMYylgRe4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7291,_binary '\0','/1LBwVIssvUfTwQVHpeJJSC5pFj9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076023',6.3,1942,'en','Fight for Your Life','A minister dispenses justice on three convicts who take his family hostage.','/AqKQAGzVqAK7EJaTK2dZ6tjrdUH.jpg','1977-10-03',82,'Released','There is no greater violence than a father\'s revenge for the rape of his daughter.','Fight for Your Life',39342,2.2501,5.9,'FT7tNr-lF-M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7292,_binary '\0','/cQLcIq9gKD8CvvxIZL93n0CKEWX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076028',5.8,1268,'en','Final Chapter: Walking Tall','It\'s the final chapter in this chilling, real-life story of Sheriff Buford Pusser, a good-hearted lawman set on keeping his town safe. Still distraught over his wife\'s death, he blows up every moonshine still in McNairy county and burns the brothels and whiskey joints to the ground. Having gone too far, he\'s voted out of office, but that doesn\'t stop the mob from seeking their revenge. Buford soon discovers how small his town is when he runs out of highway with the mob on his trail.','/vIIABXCtaMXCRcSLYUBqmnlILo4.jpg','1977-08-31',113,'Released','Unfortunately, a man who walks tall makes an awfully good target.','Final Chapter: Walking Tall',86651,1.9765,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7293,_binary '\0','/pqM1WLvIPXlhpBZTvLl2P6x0Ve3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076044',6,1336,'en','For the Love of Benji','Benji gets lost after a flight overseas and becomes a stray in Athens, Greece. He then tries everyday to reunite with his family while mysterious people pursue him, in a race to get a code which was secretly tattooed on his paw at the airport. But who are the bad guys and who are the agents that can be trusted? Will Benji and his kids and their nanny ever get to enjoy their vacation?','/iqB2iwZnteFdWH9rL50objGwmNk.jpg','1977-06-10',85,'Released','The world\'s most huggable hero!','For the Love of Benji',38802,1.826,5.8,'qtfHXbUTE-0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7294,_binary '\0','/wsapbputwZHPNUy3fLnEjmc7QZw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076054',6.3,15823,'en','Freaky Friday','School girl Annabel is hassled by her mother, and Mrs. Andrews is annoyed with her daughter, Annabel. They both think that the other has an easy life. On a normal Friday morning, both complain about each other and wish they could have the easy life of their daughter/mother for just one day and their wishes come true as a bit of magic puts Annabel in Mrs. Andrews\' body and vice versa. They both have a Freaky Friday.','/8kHZmN4Ao70LTgaiUti23Zl7fFq.jpg','1976-12-17',95,'Released','Annabel and her mother are not quite themselves today... In fact, they\'re each other!','Freaky Friday',16084,4.3789,6.1,'RQXG0wBV6So','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7295,_binary '\0','/uEnOR1sA0B8AMrMl4J6MHLFvRvS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076059',6.4,5284,'en','Fun with Dick and Jane','When an upwardly mobile couple find themselves unemployed and in debt, they turn to armed robbery in desperation.','/obBXkCU29eRzbVX5erjrAxugOpN.jpg','1977-03-18',95,'Released','A Tribute to American Ingenuity','Fun with Dick and Jane',24109,4.244,6.566,'ELG_z7z8_3I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7296,_binary '\0','/e9b8t7Bq1tg9wyDKwtTFIdZFcEd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076068',5.9,1705,'it','Il gatto dagli occhi di giada','A pharmacist is murdered, and a woman happens to see the culprit leave the scene. She soon finds herself being stalked by the killer.','/usxVuJOrjacrZJd7t9Dk3qekjuK.jpg','1977-08-06',95,'Released','When I go berserk...you\'re better off dead!','Watch Me When I Kill',40261,1.7562,5.6,'HN1b60vd1As','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7297,_binary '\0','/rkTCdSSwFQsTyZi5Z25XWQlNS97.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076070',6.4,27639,'en','The Gauntlet','Phoenix cop Ben Shockley is well on his way to becoming a derelict when he is assigned to transport a witness from Las Vegas. The witness turns out to be a belligerent prostitute with mob ties—and incriminating information regarding a high-ranking official.','/hYXkHixmH2W4hXA0qVJpT4ONPt1.jpg','1977-12-17',109,'Released','Clint Eastwood is the man in the middle of The Gauntlet','The Gauntlet',17689,4.7285,6.5,'ALtkgzVknHk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7298,_binary '\0','/6d7ymk1OWX6AkfkhOnSEfwiqo2y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076085',8.1,18975,'it','Una giornata particolare','Two neighbours — a persecuted journalist and a resigned housewife — forge a strong bond on the day of Adolf Hitler\'s historic 1938 visit to Rome.','/jzRn7N1mFowkQ5IkUkfWoxXJtYU.jpg','1977-08-11',106,'Released','A special film about two special people.','A Special Day',42229,4.0395,8.1,'KloWrqcHAF0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7299,_binary '\0','/n6hyE9Fl1uq7vumo0GHP0uhOiFj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076095',7.4,17862,'en','The Goodbye Girl','After being dumped by her live-in boyfriend, an unemployed dancer and her 10-year-old daughter are reluctantly forced to live with a struggling off-Broadway actor.','/xdaPFRARLPJuSdQIfxKVJSCOsmD.jpg','1977-11-27',111,'Released','Thank you Neil Simon for making us laugh at falling in love... again.','The Goodbye Girl',14741,4.5277,7,'4wiL-ry9XMI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7300,_binary '\0','/qab7TVaQmQTB3UYOSiDM4lfJG5v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076098',6.8,1494,'fa','گزارش‎‎','A tax collector is accused of taking bribes, and also has to deal with problems at home.','/dYKqtZejNk3OZr59qL2ZyvzC8rZ.jpg','1977-01-01',112,'Released',NULL,'The Report',149507,0.9611,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7301,_binary '\0','/2ukyfTI95R42yaTWBk76n8quiBL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076100',5.4,3212,'en','Grand Theft Auto','A rich girl steals her dad\'s Rolls Royce and heads off to Las Vegas to get married. However, her angry parents, a jealous suitor, and a bunch of reward seekers are determined to stop her.','/1EiL5frCBC9BQV9LHau4bAzgMOE.jpg','1977-06-16',84,'Released','See the greatest cars in the world destroyed!','Grand Theft Auto',19731,2.6987,5.3,'nIjxU5pIMzE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7302,_binary '\0','/fVyZzDlAV8EUpEN5a2k5165Lzda.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076101',7.3,5245,'it','Bluff - Storia di truffe e di imbroglioni','Belle Duke, in order to get revenge on her former lover Philip Bang, organizes his jail break. But instead of Philip, it is the Italian Felice Brianza, AKAS Felix, who escapes. Now Felix is obliged to help Philip to escape. He succeeds and the two join to defraud Belle. The swindle plot become more complicated when Felix falls in love for Philip\'s daughter.','/4A35BCPL2bIEtvxONiE8FxqDm1J.jpg','1976-04-15',105,'Released','They\'ll do anything for a buck!','The Con Artists',38362,2.9035,7.064,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7303,_binary '\0','/oV00UL6BYPCushfjeLRsX6x8dWs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076106',6.4,2249,'en','Greased Lightning','The true life story of Wendell Scott, the first black stock car racing driver to win an upper-tier NASCAR race.','/y5EWDeiTgklRJB3MDkU4QAEMsD5.jpg','1977-07-01',96,'Released','He drove \'em wild!','Greased Lightning',29737,2.2868,6.4,'19Xc-xbhu_c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7304,_binary '\0','/w9Sc3NcIhOV4zHbjNTcmOFKEwhq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076111',5.9,1789,'en','The Greatest','Muhammad Ali\'s life story up to the late 1970s, which includes his Olympic boxing triumphs as Cassius Clay, his conversion to Islam, his refusal of the Army draft and the legal battle after being stripped of his World Title.','/dkPVN51q9hbzkN5zmwybsLMhCej.jpg','1977-05-17',102,'Released','Winner. Loser. Lover. Loudmouth... THE MAN.','The Greatest',69903,2.2597,5.7,'5DUT6X7Wbjk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7305,_binary '\0','/gxP8QDpfGedWjFuxUZsPZL8D1uA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076112',4.5,3005,'de','Greta - Haus ohne Männer','A young woman feigns illness in order to infiltrate a mental hospital, where she investigates the disappearance of her sister, a former patient. Meanwhile, the hospital warden and her attendants abuse and torture their charges, forcing them to star in cheap skinflicks.','/mNQlgzkaMDBlgYyAJns6dA5gDNt.jpg','1977-01-21',88,'Released','Once commited to her care, You\'ll be too terrified to die!.. You\'ll choke with fear!.. Recoil in horror from her unleashed fury!..','Greta, the Mad Butcher',28656,2.7219,4.8,'89MToXLceWM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7306,_binary '\0','/rWJ1uWmdOQDzNl7y4nrigQ3XOfG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076137',5.7,8929,'en','Herbie Goes to Monte Carlo','Herbie, the Volkswagen Beetle with a mind of its own, is racing in the Monte Carlo Rally. But thieves have hidden a cache of stolen diamonds in Herbie\'s gas tank, and are now trying to get them back.','/4gMplOTJWAj1oNrv0QJG6SGhBNQ.jpg','1977-06-24',105,'Released','The Love Bug falls \'hood-over-wheels\' for a classy chassis!','Herbie Goes to Monte Carlo',14140,4.7391,5.9,'p0OtiZ0CMuA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7307,_binary '\0','/3c2nUCKlqdms2Hyo6ysBrtyvQ8C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076138',6.1,2425,'en','Heroes','A Vietnam veteran suffering from post traumatic stress disorder breaks out of a VA hospital and goes on a road trip with a sympathetic traveler to find out what became of the other men in his unit.','/ixScBPEizfgCM7BogZTpx3jgdVx.jpg','1977-11-04',112,'Released','Finding the one you love...is finding yourself.','Heroes',83061,1.7715,6.2,'_yO8f7rPlrA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7308,_binary '\0','/uZK6kGcO2RRteHoEgkpH4Mwa3lf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076141',6.6,26155,'en','High Anxiety','A psychiatrist with intense acrophobia (fear of heights) goes to work for a mental institution run by doctors who appear to be crazier than their patients, and have secrets that they are willing to commit murder to keep.','/qVuSJaGnomSPon8x3mIYywFGgD8.jpg','1977-12-25',94,'Released','Danger, intrigue, romance...and a touch of kinkiness!','High Anxiety',12535,3.9397,6.4,'zto1ZY9_6wY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7309,_binary '\0','/cdsSLZKKpQsl4O4zFWEzkpD50x5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076150',6.4,15333,'en','Alice, Sweet Alice','Alice is a withdrawn 12-year-old who lives with her mother and her younger sister, Karen, who gets most of the attention from her mother, leaving Alice out of the spotlight. When Karen is found brutally murdered in a church, suspicions start to turn toward Alice. But could a 12-year-old girl really be capable of such savagery?','/izawwwy80RH7U7YKkdV1OpdPohZ.jpg','1976-11-13',108,'Released','If you survive this night... nothing will scare you again.','Alice, Sweet Alice',23761,4.7026,6.4,'dwPfVlls1Kw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7310,_binary '\0','/1GqjUNcm2dzoS7HVppx0emcbJdD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076154',6.3,1227,'fr','L\'Homme pressé','Art collector Pierre Niox rushes through life, lives a frantic life, does everything in full speed -- searching for and acquiring works of art or real estate, marrying or even dying -- and in total disregard for any kind of morality. His misdeeds finally turn on him and destroy him.','/3N5FIexrH6VZ6ERVFj08ZiAkMCf.jpg','1977-08-10',91,'Released',NULL,'The Hurried Man',191101,1.6772,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7311,_binary '\0','/n2lLL7epkunVFtAYiHLDScvvx9l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076155',7.3,8235,'fr','L\'Homme qui aimait les femmes','At Bertrand Morane\'s burial there are many of the women that the 40-year-old engineer loved. In flashback Bertrand\'s life and love affairs are told by himself while writing an autobiographical novel.','/qAbqXoN6ucpN8jvHOxZOzwyP8pE.jpg','1977-04-27',119,'Released',NULL,'The Man Who Loved Women',1421,2.7836,7.114,'0HZ3vCsKflY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7312,_binary '\0','/upLyTMTt6ZPQ3LLWygSp2mb10hW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076161',4.5,1536,'en','The Hound of the Baskervilles','When a nobleman is threatened by a family curse on his newly inherited estate, detective Sherlock Holmes is hired to investigate.','/cDjlgsyWmOMFZBvZ0nAyqJ2URxA.jpg','1978-08-01',85,'Released','Sir Arthur Conan Doyle would turn in his Harris Tweeds if he saw what Pete and Dud have done to his classic tale of old rubbish!','The Hound of the Baskervilles',62847,2.466,4.4,'Hq38qfz58Fo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7313,_binary '\0','/5040XNTvwARvLq1KtfCgJXBj3LC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076162',7.2,40478,'ja','ハウス','Hoping to find a sense of connection to her late mother, Gorgeous takes a trip with her friends to visit her aunt\'s ancestral house in the countryside. The girls soon discover that there is more to the old house than meets the eye.','/ryZ3DdZPvXVCv9qRCtVRfmNbYAH.jpg','1977-08-26',88,'Released','In the heart of a violet forest, an old house awaits young girls.','House',25623,4.7272,7.3,'JemQPqfraYA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7314,_binary '\0','/cV592GNIOkyI1J4fz6jFUuytF9e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076164',5.4,2418,'zh','猩猩王','Word of a monster ape ten stories tall living in the Himalayas reaches fortune hunters in Hong Kong. They travel to India to capture it, but wild animals and quicksand dissuade all but Johnny, an adventurer with a broken heart. He finds the monster and discovers it\'s been raising a scantily-clad woman, Samantha, since she survived a plane crash years before that killed her parents. In the idyllic jungle, Johnny and Samantha fall in love. Then Johnny asks her to convince \"Utam\" to go to Hong Kong. Lu Tien, an unscrupulous promoter, takes over: Utam is in chains for freak show exhibitions. When Lu Tien assaults Samantha, Utam\'s protective instincts take over: havoc in Hong Kong.','/wWFzTiLcbay57ZJtsMTH5TzfDlH.jpg','1977-08-11',90,'Released','Action... Excitement... Spectacle beyond your wildest dreams!','The Mighty Peking Man',42230,2.6067,5.1,'UkJsHBB4xj0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7315,_binary '\0','/5VDexRf65D6a2mnyVGzFNUNiV0k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076168',6.8,2168,'zh','洪熙官','After the destruction of the Temple, a Shaolin disciple devotes years to mastering the Tiger style in order to defeat the martial arts master who killed his teacher. His wife, a Crane style specialist, has a feeling one style won\'t be enough.','/9PJyuHP1nNDMyJDZMpZWpwEduSL.jpg','1977-02-16',100,'Released',NULL,'Executioners from Shaolin',22124,2.849,6.7,'G3Buxr3G4QI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7316,_binary '\0','/dfK6asYwvpMuV2XkgfzlRDDJYDb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076172',6.4,1754,'en','I Never Promised You a Rose Garden','A disturbed and institutionalized 16-year-old girl struggles between fantasy and reality.','/AcumdxTlCtFBQXDjsIsiy1VyjpX.jpg','1977-07-14',96,'Released','When she tried to kill herself, it was just the beginning.','I Never Promised You a Rose Garden',66092,2.2982,5.9,'yIWJrd4Ybcs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7317,_binary '\0','/ubKqQUGdZogAfbU6cgECRrVFuPa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076175',6.3,4562,'en','March or Die','Just after World War I, Major Foster is incorporating new recruits into his French Foreign Legion platoon when he is sent to his former remote outpost located in the French Morocco to protect an archaeological excavation from El Krim, a Rifian leader who intends to unite all local tribes to fight the colonial government…','/jW21NrRlcrA4kucmD9hfnPbQEvL.jpg','1977-09-08',107,'Released','They obeyed but one command','March or Die',25388,3.3505,5.8,'15X-KYSGU_0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7318,_binary '\0','/eTGbkHzD8VijGgmXDjQze9eceUO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076190',6.9,2629,'en','The Incredible Hulk','An accidental overdose of gamma radiation causes a mutation in scientist David Banner\'s DNA: now whenever he becomes angry, he metamorphoses into a seven-foot-tall, 330-pound, mindless muscular green creature.','/nCstm2LAXwT60QkejeU0fcYUSXS.jpg','1977-11-04',95,'Released','A scientist is exposed to a massive dose of gamma rays and becomes a superhuman beast...','The Incredible Hulk',65294,6.1204,6.47,'pX_yN4ONSZ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7319,_binary '\0','/devWASeoLDUKuhWvCb5v18VFwOh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076191',4.3,5765,'en','The Incredible Melting Man','An astronaut exposed to cosmic rays outside of Saturn\'s rings returns to Earth and begins to melt away. Escaping from the hospital, he wanders around the backwoods looking for human flesh to eat.','/cMsdALx0PfSWRQu6we0p6qbtLz.jpg','1977-11-10',84,'Released','...come prepared!','The Incredible Melting Man',40231,3.1252,4.6,'slmxMbfrPaE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7320,_binary '\0','/rLziE1qpYYJbIpCRky7x48yFOgI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076200',4.8,1835,'it','Interno di un convento','On the surface the women at the convent are your average nuns. However, what they get up to in their spare time is far from what you\'d expect from nuns.','/y0IyN8X6FvBHYsbeDqMGD8pWALc.jpg','1978-01-25',95,'Released',NULL,'Behind Convent Walls',39340,3.5004,5.008,'XUDukNjBlaU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7321,_binary '\0','/yh89YGVqXxXZGGqnNz3XwfiuBUF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076208',7.7,2766,'el','Ιφιγένεια','The Greek army is about to set sail to a great battle, but the winds refuse to blow. Their leader, King Agamemnon, seeks to provide better food, but accidentally slays a sacred deer. His punishment from the gods, the sacrifice of his daughter Iphigenia.','/5DcgIrPtg8VKcGqkddjUJt5jdA2.jpg','1977-09-10',127,'Released',NULL,'Iphigenia',46278,2.1237,7,'LR7ujwJebDs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7322,_binary '\0','/t4d80bW4Vn86EVIQW0eV2NjhFBh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076210',5.9,8083,'en','The Island of Dr. Moreau','A ship-wrecked man floats ashore on an island in the Pacific Ocean. The island is inhabited by a scientist, Dr. Moreau, who in an experiment has turned beasts into human beings.','/q5kWAWxb3eWCkxFNT6WCipAnpQe.jpg','1977-07-13',99,'Released','A tropical paradise, untouched by man... where a bizarre civilization exists.','The Island of Dr. Moreau',26932,4.0876,5.7,'h56KU83R8q4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7323,_binary '\0','/zr1aI0clKiZigMo1EHwv5oslsT7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076211',6.5,1795,'en','Islands in the Stream','An isolated sculptor is visited by his three sons just before the start of WWII.','/5b8WIyAXdoY8ik2ZmqMw53MIcDQ.jpg','1977-03-09',104,'Released','How long has it been since you\'ve seen a really good movie? If it\'s been too long then see \"Islands in the Stream.\"','Islands in the Stream',70926,2.2885,6.5,'HxDWSvEtC10','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7324,_binary '\0','/2fEdUWSLswPlHVmG0NtetcJkf4p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076214',5,1834,'en','It Happened at Lakewood Manor','A lakeside resort comes under attack by a seemingly infinite hoard of flesh-eating ants.','/7XrLz0orwsZb9LwHeyzo5qiBhS9.jpg','1977-12-02',95,'Released','They\'ll Make Your Nightmares Come True.','It Happened at Lakewood Manor',67302,2.581,4.7,'rWy4HGErBfI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7325,_binary '\0','/hMtePcTyWLQjBbujHd4kiquQcZ3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076221',6.1,17320,'en','Jabberwocky','After the death of his father, young Dennis Cooper goes to town where he has to pass several adventures. The town and the whole kingdom is threatened by a terrible monster called \'Jabberwocky\'. Will Dennis make his fortune? Is anyone brave enough to defeat the monster?','/kprcqmFxWPU45L1ZnMXO5yPPMVA.jpg','1977-03-28',105,'Released','Jabberwocky: the monster so horrible that people caught the plague to avoid it','Jabberwocky',11834,3.4611,6.036,'9CLlFk97FBk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7326,_binary '\0','/67IcVZfR0CGlFwU7TtGhzUyjSWA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076227',5.3,1586,'zh','劍花煙雨江南','Young master Cao Le chases his pregnant girlfriend away from the family castle. He does it in order to save her from vicious bandits who are going to murder his family.','/n4tHrGkapp4LIN5kyj8IvjoYaUf.jpg','1977-07-22',106,'Released','He must fight one woman in order to save another.','To Kill with Intrigue',18758,2.6322,5.6,'jdiEijze1Bk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7327,_binary '\0','/841V3wMNiwzOVdGo8G1cgaoaWHF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076240',5.9,4088,'en','Jubilee','Queen Elizabeth I visits late 1970s England to find a depressing landscape where life has changed since her time.','/8HtAaaDZDCCx2F73n41xMDWDhwU.jpg','1978-02-01',106,'Released','Sex, drugs and punk rock. Add violence and time travel and you have Jubilee.','Jubilee',41426,1.9249,6,'7F4hjO9P2zE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7328,_binary '\0','/iAgMjPnY0jsQnIQkZbVHQu9Cbpk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076245',7,11530,'en','Julia','At the behest of an old and dear friend, playwright Lillian Hellman undertakes a dangerous mission to smuggle funds into Nazi Germany.','/qHtPzs9eVCilp88c1arq73gH6xk.jpg','1977-10-01',117,'Released','The story of two women whose friendship suddenly became a matter of life and death.','Julia',42222,3.6305,6.494,'U_u7Hvj14s0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7329,_binary '\0','/406l9abnDn7n8BNBSrBDH5Mu8XJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076252',7.5,1516,'fi','Jäniksen vuosi','Young advertising executive Vatanen suddenly quits his job and his whole life in Helsinki, and decides to spend a while in the Finnish wilderness. A wounded hare hit by a car becomes his travel companion. Together they find reclusion in the Finnish Lapland, soon to be disturbed by a noisy group of foreign tourists and their pretentious Finnish hosts. When the hare gets ill and needs to see a vet, Vatanen must return to the city and finally face the choice between his new and former life','/h0QUhDSy4g2jQ4juOTCtUV6V1am.jpg','1977-12-23',129,'Released',NULL,'The Year of the Hare',39008,0.7056,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7330,_binary '\0','/fiSvjqNpjGJJEFryM7n4pIVQV6f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076257',6.4,21874,'en','The Kentucky Fried Movie','A series of loosely connected skits that spoof news programs, commercials, porno films, kung-fu films, disaster films, blaxploitation films, spy films, mafia films, and the fear that somebody is watching you on the other side of the TV.','/qk0iXBQgP6b4xfS2bIUNBSENJAn.jpg','1977-08-10',83,'Released','The hottest, most out-of-control movie ever to stagger onto the screen!','The Kentucky Fried Movie',11598,4.7861,6.2,'wbhLuxJvr6o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7331,_binary '\0','/r763vsubExGcDJypctYuLLJmhB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076263',7.2,8775,'en','Killer of Sheep','An African-American man working at a slaughterhouse in the Watts area of Los Angeles leads a dissatisfied and listless existence.','/z1CqJKI6gmdAMprD1NOYSCHVXEv.jpg','1978-11-14',80,'Released',NULL,'Killer of Sheep',27432,1.5831,6.6,'bORJQ8dF9tQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7332,_binary '\0','/xtTEHLW0hfifWQeELlfyepTaOgF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076271',5.7,7177,'en','Kingdom of the Spiders','Investigating the mysterious deaths of a number of farm animals, vet Rack Hansen discovers that his town lies in the path of hordes of migrating tarantulas. Before he can take action, the streets are overrun by killer spiders, trapping a small group of townsfolk in a remote hotel.','/7NMnHnb721MwczHJ486Ltfo68F4.jpg','1977-08-24',97,'Released','A Living, Crawling, Hell on Earth!','Kingdom of the Spiders',30315,2.7963,5.6,'VZa5GWiLje4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7333,_binary '\0','/hL4J5AbITCkgiAE1VKx8bAemp0D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076276',8.7,18104,'sr','Ко то тамо пева','On Saturday, 5 April 1941, one day before the Invasion of Yugoslavia of the Kingdom of Yugoslavia, a colourful group of random passengers on a country road deep in the heart of Serbia board a dilapidated bus, headed for the capital Belgrade. The group includes two gypsy musicians, a World War I veteran, a Germanophile, a budding singer, a sickly looking man, and a hunter with a shotgun. The bus is owned by Krstic senior, and driven by his impressionable and dim-witted son Misko.','/1r4buAPUyqWwhdKxki1fyBeehsw.jpg','1980-10-23',86,'Released',NULL,'Who\'s Singin\' Over There?',17909,2.0497,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7334,_binary '\0','/erbtU86eebdgB2eTe5yq3ZKKDH8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076286',7.4,1221,'el','Οι κυνηγοί','During a hunting party on New Year\'s Eve 1976, five representatives of the bourgeoisie encounter with their companion the body of a partisan from the Civil War of the late forties. What they are most confused about is the fact that the corpse that lies at their feet is still bleeding…','/n7AUf7Ffi2PCw7hwz40i69p1yfk.jpg','1977-10-19',144,'Released',NULL,'The Hunters',114570,1.7117,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7335,_binary '\0','/lkAGt2UB9wtdGlX3eX6YlBvBSjW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076295',5,2564,'en','The Fun House','After being released from prison, a young gangster with a chip on his shoulder decides to punish society by making snuff films.','/wYeiI8HrVEwQIgYyXAKB4lQr54H.jpg','1977-05-06',78,'Released','IT\'S ONLY A MOVIE!','The Fun House',27328,1.3914,4.8,'TJC7afPY9V4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7336,_binary '\0','/uVZCGy4TgH0C5m1sfIgCO4ZGR9n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076297',6,2791,'en','The Last Remake of Beau Geste','Brothers Beau, John and Digby Geste join the Foreign Legion, where they fall under the rule of tyrannical Sergeant Markoff. Beau and John are assigned to Fort Zinderneuf, where Markoff tries to break their spirit, aware of a dark family secret concerning a fabulous jewel one of them carries. As tensions rise, Arabs attack the fort and rivalries must be thrown aside in a desperate battle for life.','/6GwMgIuOKxf1TCdgZGDQ56Kvyt.jpg','1977-06-15',85,'Released',NULL,'The Last Remake of Beau Geste',55628,2.2494,5.708,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7337,_binary '\0','/sPJmwvy9z5IpjdEXoYG6zxd7LO7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076299',6.9,12579,'en','The Last Wave','A Sydney lawyer defends five Aboriginal people in a ritualised taboo murder and in the process learns disturbing truths about himself and premonitions.','/7UwdJ0EMXirUuNFaohfK023Nuyr.jpg','1977-12-15',106,'Released','Hasn\'t the weather been strange ...could it be a warning?','The Last Wave',72277,2.0948,6.668,'XKvuUDBHipE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7338,_binary '\0','/NfDFi10ZHLvsZSVuf3GgkVNTVL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076301',6.8,3845,'en','The Late Show','An over-the-hill gumshoe in Los Angeles seeks to avenge the killing of an old pal, another detective who was involved in a case concerning a murdered broad, stolen stamps, a nickel-plated handgun, a cheating dolly, and a kidnapped pussycat.','/qii8jbAjid9MzBx7tUJf7URf8LO.jpg','1977-02-10',93,'Released','The nicest movie you\'ll ever see about murder and blackmail.','The Late Show',42228,1.8025,6.3,'HGKD9KWuKs0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7339,_binary '\0','/aEZFxWCLF3CUpeZHtIaWvjNKpbN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076312',5.3,1489,'de','Die Liebesbriefe einer portugiesischen Nonne','16-year-old Maria is forced into Serra D\'Aires convent, secretly run by Satanists.','/MfRKYui5BSpAgiabcsKd4ruI56.jpg','1977-03-10',85,'Released','Satanic lust behind cloister walls...','Love Letters of a Portuguese Nun',81189,2.0789,5.8,'xiLcCMs7lVQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7340,_binary '\0','/6WO4vBUcvl0GKXC947uwzQBVtHU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076313',6.2,1310,'fr','Les liens de sang','A Montreal police inspector cracks a murder case with clues from the victim\'s diary.','/tjGLOmhbJrhB1X7a2DR9UMplD5C.jpg','1978-02-01',100,'Released','The Most Intimate Act Of All Is... ...Murder!','Blood Relatives',47794,2.4169,5.7,'h7JZSrAGmFU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7341,_binary '\0','/63wi53sFR75jIJPjMOAKQbksg5S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076327',6.7,10112,'en','Looking for Mr. Goodbar','A short, unhappy affair with a married man leads a dedicated schoolteacher into the alcohol-and-drug fueled underworld of singles’ bars, where she begins to engage in a pattern of dangerous sexual activity.','/j1qKNKRvDEhnl0PQS26PirNF81v.jpg','1977-10-19',136,'Released','To her father, Theresa was a dutiful daughter. To the children she taught, Theresa brought warmth and hope. To the men she met in bars, Theresa was easy. All kinds of people loved Theresa. Diane Keaton plays Theresa in Looking for Mr. Goodbar.','Looking for Mr. Goodbar',37749,3.3577,6.3,'cikARr2qMeA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7342,_binary '\0','/jqeacwWLQ6qsoUIpJvsvZj5JOGq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076336',7.5,1903,'es','El lugar sin límites','Family honor, greed, machismo, homophobia, and dreams collide in a small Mexican town.','/gzgFtZ2JXfjyffvwrJHRUMFiwsT.jpg','1978-04-28',110,'Released','Below heaven is hell, and below hell there is...','The Place Without Limits',77360,1.4958,7.2,'FmANQBBFRSU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7343,_binary '\0','/kfpsgsV5EMFSze5rml35CTVEWvB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076340',7.8,1591,'ru','Мама','Mrs. Rada the Goat tells her five children to behave while she goes to the fair, and under no circumstances open the door to anyone except her. But the Big Bad Wolf, Kostika (Titi) Suru, and his nephew, the Little Bad Wolf, along with friends Rassul the Lynx and Petrika the Donkey has made a plan to kidnap the children while their mother is away. And when the eldest child, Matei, decides to disobey his mother and visit the fair himself, things start to go badly for the goat-family.','/8nj8b9hLMZp8LwrSQEKmLVKX5MY.jpg','1977-10-17',88,'Released',NULL,'Mama',38323,1.5648,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7344,_binary '\0','/h45HRg1Hm5kdUqaXRbatlNiXgjf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076342',6.5,5705,'en','MacArthur','The film portrays MacArthur\'s life from 1942, before the Battle of Bataan, to 1952, when he was removed from his Korean War command by President Truman for insubordination, and is recounted in flashback as he visits West Point.','/i0bcDA4uU3CKMhp715UwWEYG7Tf.jpg','1977-07-15',130,'Released','Where the legend ends and the man begins.','MacArthur',31037,3.9476,6.2,'DumkSZY-jYE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7345,_binary '\0','/qC23PvwjKwJ1Qi6oav0l9aJIMCl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076348',7.2,1987,'fr','La Vie devant soi','Madame Rosa lives in a sixth-floor walkup in the Pigalle; she\'s a retired prostitute, Jewish and an Auschwitz survivor, a foster mom to children of other prostitutes. Momo is the oldest and her favorite, an Algerian lad whom she raises as a Muslim. He asks about his parents; she answers evasively. As she ages and takes fewer children, Momo must do more for her; as money is tight, he tries to earn pennies on the street with a puppet. He\'s a beautiful man-child, and Madame Rosa makes him promise never to sell himself or become a pimp. A film editor, Nadine, befriends him, and his father appears as well. Madame Rosa reaches her last days in fear of hospitals, and Momo must act.','/o2yCU9XwakKnpD33D8TxenRSiNM.jpg','1977-11-02',105,'Released',NULL,'Madame Rosa',42223,2.3075,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7346,_binary '\0','/qGfVduq9UYjjPQx63w69O1ki4A9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076360',6.5,2209,'it','Mannaja','Maurizio Merli stars as a hatchet-wielding bounty hunter with a dark past and an even more desperate future. But when he disrupts the balance of power in a corrupt mining town, he unleashes a firestorm of brutality, betrayal and cold-blooded murder. Now, one man stalks a savage land where justice walks a razor and no bullets slice deeper than vengeance. He is A MAN CALLED BLADE.','/9hX2IlU9trlVThCV5fe0n3fBvcU.jpg','1977-08-13',96,'Released','Sharp shoots, gun and axe with great accuracy!','A Man Called Blade',19946,1.2958,6.553,'dCXUXxuffeM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7347,_binary '\0','/6qIQlvN1HuugUU9KGGwCpIVOSz8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076361',5.5,1549,'en','Mansion of the Doomed','An insane surgeon finds himself up to his armpits in eyeballs after guilt prompts him to begin removing the eyes of abducted people in hopes of performing transplants on his daughter who lost her own in a car-accident he caused.','/9AvD9lfGytbndj1OpgDICfvHZ6K.jpg','1976-10-01',86,'Released','What Happens to His Victims is Horrorfying Beyond Belief!','Mansion of the Doomed',40139,2.3636,6.2,'FzQ79gxXFzA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7348,_binary '\0','/sk2vIjjqxr8aBeCGx1zSxpscvzF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076391',8,7945,'ru','Мимино','Local Georgian pilot Mimino dreams of flying airplanes for major international airlines. To realize his aspirations, he goes to Moscow where he encounters a fellow comrade from the Caucasus, the Armenian Rubik. Many misadventures ensue.','/61reasUU2uxRFQhxfKdvVHHMOsl.jpg','1977-06-06',92,'Released',NULL,'Mimino',27861,1.7804,7.6,'d9PjkuE30vU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7349,_binary '\0','/8U31A3HgUkF83wy6BL4zgtE26fe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076410',6.8,3210,'fr','Mort d\'un pourri','In the middle of the night, deputy Philippe Dubaye wakes up his old friend Xavier Maréchal with disturbing news: he has just killed Serrano, a racketeer with extant political connections. Serrano kept proofs of Dubaye\'s involvement in corrupt dealings and was poised to use them against the deputy. Xavier readily agrees to cover up for his old pal Philippe, but he soon runs into difficulties. Nobody believes Dubaye\'s alibi. And everybody -- influential personalities, powerful businessmen, dubious go-betweens and the police -- wants to get hold of the documents that served to blackmail Dubaye; by all possible means...','/pba0ETxhAldp0ccDGoz4RM8JyJ9.jpg','1977-12-07',120,'Released',NULL,'Death of a Corrupt Man',69517,2.7782,6.526,'fbBj540jqHI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7350,_binary '\0','/4xjTQ8oeP73kNkIJG5gxMyhHEGR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076417',5.4,1645,'en','Mr. Billion','An Italian mechanic finds that he has inherited a billion-dollar company from his dead uncle, but he needs to be in San Francisco in 20 days to sign over the will. In the meantime, he is chased by kidnappers and the affected corporation\'s president.','/9yj42hZOjpYmFlDoSowKgJIQDYN.jpg','1977-03-03',89,'Released','The eyes of the nation are on . . . MR. BILLION!','Mr. Billion',44699,2.5244,5.5,'7_gfLPAzJPc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7351,_binary '\0','/guY9U0bFpQ5rUpxcnCE4Bp3JqCq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076446',7.7,4159,'ru','Неоконченная пьеса для механического пианино','On a summer day in late 19th century Russia, a group of bourgeois friends and acquaintances gather at a dilapidated country estate.','/5xoTcxLF7DrVw3qPEOZ8GwRb3QR.jpg','1977-09-05',98,'Released',NULL,'An Unfinished Piece for Player Piano',38837,1.8179,6.983,'BNo24lHSvQI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7352,_binary '\0','/5GFQZ8Qx3V8prszr1HyWKu27RLd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076448',6.8,2751,'en','Nestor, the Long-Eared Christmas Donkey','Nestor the donkey is a bit of an oddity--his long ears are enough for six donkeys and stretch all the way to the ground. One night, when Nestor is locked out in the cold, he begins to wander the desert.','/vx9q5vezpk2PJfMartzwHsMNdIw.jpg','1977-12-03',25,'Released','Back in the days of the Roman Empire, a small donkey is born with VERY long ears, that keep getting him into trouble...','Nestor, the Long-Eared Christmas Donkey',26537,2.0597,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7353,_binary '\0','/9lOh8t4qPBfqIcKNW0HT0VdMgEi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076451',6.6,24094,'en','New York, New York','An egotistical saxophone player and a young singer meet on V-J Day and embark upon a strained and rocky romance, even as their careers begin a long uphill climb.','/1nD40aUcPAxYdE1WxERrTjZuFGe.jpg','1977-06-21',163,'Released','The war was over and the world was falling in love again.','New York, New York',12637,5.5999,6.531,'alyW0SvO61o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7354,_binary '\0','/A37wxjHIy75UhpAi5K0p8iFRQgC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076452',7.3,3638,'fr','News from Home','Impersonal and beautiful images of Akerman\'s life in New York are combined with letters from her loving but manipulative mother, read by Akerman herself.','/nWqWaEySdo8hAKJsd1IS9mdnZpF.jpg','1976-11-12',89,'Released','Write to me, it’s all I ask.','News from Home',86814,1.1872,7.1,'wY65NKH0t3Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7355,_binary '\0','/yyeqmEDU3PEj12Ybi22RJNd9WCQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076470',6.8,1525,'fr','Nous irons tous au paradis','Having fortuitously discovered a photograph in which Marthe embraces someone unknown, Étienne Dorsay becomes jealous and imagines various stratagems to identify the lover. In the meantime, he and his friends acquire a weekend house for a very low price.','/gwUIueYeSvjQ3Ax1d2qB8H0S1qr.jpg','1977-11-09',110,'Released',NULL,'We Will All Meet in Paradise',40585,2.0803,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7356,_binary '\0','/wq1N2j3cjscFmpxu01W30S0CIZT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076489',6.6,11766,'en','Oh, God!','When God appears to an assistant grocery manager as a good natured old man, the Almighty selects him as his messenger for the modern world.','/9QrIWpKS24thkL0g4HrRYAznFDV.jpg','1977-10-07',98,'Released','Anybody who could turn Lot\'s wife into a pillar of salt, incinerate Sodom and Gomorrah and make it rain for forty days and forty nights has got to be a fun guy.','Oh, God!',24032,2.3089,6.4,'rEbM3tjV-3Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7357,_binary '\0','/i2JxbXPMfga2rXjpMU3AGE4mhNC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076495',6.7,1926,'da','Olsen-banden deruda\'','Egon is starting to be a little forgetful; he forgot the zone number, so he fails to open the strongbox. When he gets out of Vridslose State Prison, Kjeld and Benny have become associates of Yvonne\'s cousin Georg from America. He is not just some old-fashioned strongbox thief that can\'t remember like Egon, but a young hip IT criminal, that thinks that everyone else is inferior. However, Egon doesn\'t take lightly to the Georg\'s patronizing so he sabotages Georg\'s computer and ruins his cup. This time Egon\'s ambitions reaches a new high, when he and his gang break in to the World Bank, and they get away with it. Of course, thanks to Yvonne, they aren\'t rich very long.','/hU9olfYOg1pDqnH07Ydye3qCoKU.jpg','1977-09-30',105,'Released',NULL,'The Olsen Gang Outta Sight',12711,1.1527,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7358,_binary '\0','/mk6OaCtoImiLtUHVWaVTT57ia4V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076500',6.5,2239,'en','One on One','Henry Steele is a basketball phenom at his small town high school, but when he matriculates to a big city university on a scholarship, soon realizes that he has few skills outside the sport. Expected by his coach to contribute significantly to the team, Henry is overwhelmed by the demands on his time, the \"big business\" aspect of college sports, and the fact that he never fully learned to read. Things look bleak for Henry when Janet Hays, a pretty graduate student, is assigned as Henry\'s tutor. Her intellect and strength lift Henry out of his doldrums just in time to battle the coach, who attempts to rescind Henry\'s scholarship.','/xCK4RkUpjt1aKivID3G8eWHnyFc.jpg','1977-06-28',98,'Released','You\'re not big enough. You\'re not sharp enough. You\'ll never make it.','One on One',50379,1.557,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7359,_binary '\0','/3OTxHBZIQdjjsHU572SJxvtXTpk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076504',5.8,15158,'en','Orca','After witnessing the killing of his mate and offspring at the hands of a reckless Irish captain, a vengeful killer whale rampages through the fisherman\'s Newfoundland harbor. Under pressure from the villagers, the captain, a female marine biologist, and an Indigenous tribalist venture after the great beast, who will meet them on its own turf.','/uSascD0pN3n5d6BlyFdce0hRVzz.jpg','1977-07-22',92,'Released','Terror just beneath the surface.','Orca',12707,4.6144,6.2,'_0OqDH47JE4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7360,_binary '\0','/he3EammTtVLubEm2WwCAY8F5xrb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076507',6,2162,'en','The Other Side of Midnight','When French beauty Noelle Page falls in love with American pilot Larry Douglas, she believes he\'ll marry her. Instead, he returns to the U.S and marries the sweet but naive Catherine. Even though Noelle has found a new lover, an affluent Greek named Constantin, and has started a great career as an actress, she vows revenge on her onetime lover. But once her plan is in motion, she and Larry fall in love and plot Catherine\'s death.','/hX2Z3uaDBKUSzM4qKYpK3bz5vuo.jpg','1977-06-08',165,'Released','The Romance Of Passion And Power','The Other Side of Midnight',80844,3.1154,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7361,_binary '\0','/A7SnZ5qGt1ErSs6WfY07iiWAMVh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076516',5.9,1477,'en','The Pack','The residents of vacation spot Seal Island find themselves terrorized by a pack of dogs -- the remnants of discarded pets by visiting vacationers.','/gmH6ol9J8drRyIIhcLWLrE1mfIF.jpg','1977-11-20',98,'Released','They\'re not pets anymore.','The Pack',86239,2.176,6.8,'cXvyf4Oamfw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7362,_binary '\0','/1ftk6ewQVLdQpHQOA718rxEuuUZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076517',7.2,4779,'it','Padre padrone','The true story of the life of Gavino Ledda, the son of a Sardinian shepherd, and how he managed to escape his harsh, almost barbaric existence by slowly educating himself, despite violent opposition from his brutal father.','/6kGarhZIsbpFNcEHftRzNeuz6Sb.jpg','1977-05-20',114,'Released',NULL,'Padre Padrone',42225,2.2157,6.816,'P8z-iv2URAc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7363,_binary '\0','/ekzQRl3x91zkAbb7VpoFGtE8p8T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076518',6.1,1314,'it','I padroni della città','Tony, a mob loan collector, is dissatisfied with his station in life. Though he dreams of one day being rich, he is stuck with the dead-end job of beating up borrowers who fall behind in their payments. After meeting up with Napoli, another mob enforcer who\'s just been fired from his job, the two hatch a plan. Together, they will con mob boss Manzari out of a fortune, after which they can retire and live in luxury. Manzari, however, is not about to let them go so easily.','/emX3puWQnOtcJXVMI2Bltywfh6G.jpg','1976-12-03',96,'Released','...Meaner Than a Junkyard Dog!','Rulers of the City',65320,2.2946,6.38,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7364,_binary '\0','/ws6PMuMhMpT0k1KsRBClezampkT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076535',5.4,4116,'en','The People That Time Forgot','Major Ben McBride organizes a mission to the Antarctic wastes to search for his friend who has been missing in the region for several years. McBride\'s party find themselves in a world populated by primitive warriors and terrifying prehistoric creatures, all of whom they must evade in order to get back safely','/8IIrlm2CjGCY5UV94lMCNb9HC94.jpg','1977-07-06',90,'Released','FIRST \'The Land That Time Forgot\'. THEN \'At The Earth\'s Core\'. NOW a fantastic incredible world of savage mystery...','The People That Time Forgot',27591,3.7014,5.3,'L3buYepzl5o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7365,_binary '\0','/hoItQR25BE6qWLInEq1iRPgBDDZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076538',6.4,28412,'en','Pete\'s Dragon','Pete, a young orphan, runs away to a Maine fishing town with his best friend a lovable, sometimes invisible dragon named Elliott! When they are taken in by a kind lighthouse keeper, Nora, and her father, Elliott\'s prank playing lands them in big trouble. Then, when crooked salesmen try to capture Elliott for their own gain, Pete must attempt a daring rescue.','/noShGNQKAgMqNanJL5EiZlf6LCp.jpg','1977-11-03',128,'Released','Brazzle Dazzle Brilliance!','Pete\'s Dragon',11114,7.4907,6.326,'9xI2NouriHI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7366,_binary '\0','/nKUoCbSsDnGYq52GuF37QikW9iE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076543',6.5,1756,'en','A Piece of the Action','How does retired cop Joshua Burke (James Earl Jones) get two career criminals, Manny Durrell (Sidney Poitier) and Dave Anderson (Bill Cosby), to follow the straight and narrow? Con them into helping juvenile delinquents turn over a new leaf. But how? Burke has never been able to nail the duo, but he uses what he knows of their seedy past to blackmail them into volunteering.','/25MMJiTb9KPmINm8XN1LXyuZOG0.jpg','1977-10-07',135,'Released','A delightfully delicious dilemma!','A Piece of the Action',29493,2.1759,5.8,'suaDCyBbXXg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7367,_binary '\0','/giUXzKkVLWeU2opZNMKPK54Z07C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076544',6.2,4263,'it','Piedone l\'africano','Inspector Rizzo in Napoli gets a message from a policeman from South Africa who wants to meet him. Immediately before this meeting the South African policeman is killed. Dying he shows Rizzo a picture of his young son Bodo. Rizzo travels to Johannesburg to find out what the policeman was working on and to find Bodo.','/qNdEEsnYgKaaKIhlcRyAjSbpni4.jpg','1978-03-22',115,'Released',NULL,'Flatfoot in Africa',11055,2.3139,6.2,'Ej8R-sEH6_8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7368,_binary '\0','/kU6M85V1WSG09LrtRZc1qF4883F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076574',7.4,3775,'en','Providence','On the eve of his 78th birthday, ailing, alcoholic writer Clive Langham spends a painful and sleepless night mentally composing and recomposing scenes for a novel in which characters based on his own family are shaped by his fantasies and memories, alongside his caustic commentary on their behaviour.','/QUJfGGPg3LLIQGymrDIuAMFsV7.jpg','1977-01-25',110,'Released','A Movie of Rare Intelligence','Providence',54140,3.4645,6.6,'5-YW8OA38iU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7369,_binary '\0','/pqpOzayMENfhXNE9wzXdRGwUSho.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076578',7.3,26883,'en','Pumping Iron','Amateur and professional bodybuilders prepare for the 1975 Mr. Olympia and Mr. Universe contests as five-time champion Arnold Schwarzenegger defends his Mr. Olympia title against Serge Nubret and the shy young Lou Ferrigno.','/x0zmAcHKzvfjd6nBwUF6T659JjT.jpg','1977-01-18',86,'Released','Mind and body.','Pumping Iron',5205,3.1769,7.2,'TdP20ALOA3Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7370,_binary '\0','/jGUjRAKKjtN46GsJsGJhSO5PIrS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076584',6.5,11113,'it','Quel maledetto treno blindato','Set in Europe during WWII, a group of American soldiers on their way to military prison are beset upon by a German artillery attack, escaping with Switzerland in their sights. Before making it any farther, they volunteer to steal a V2 warhead for the French Underground - taking them deep into the heart of German territory.','/8f7PoX7TveyKrndh3bZZcBvR55Z.jpg','1978-02-08',99,'Released','If you\'re a kraut, he\'ll take you out!','The Inglorious Bastards',22311,3.2263,6.2,'qH2PeTVIpfs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7371,_binary '\0','/7ICl9c70ntA61ayFhlfmwtLzSqt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076590',6.3,23980,'en','Rabid','A young woman develops a taste for human blood after experimental plastic surgery, and her victims turn into bloodthirsty zombies, leading into a city-wide epidemic.','/gIsuIWnvDozlQP4ya6OZEXqDecj.jpg','1977-04-08',91,'Released','You can\'t trust your mother, your best friend, the neighbor next door…One minute they\'re perfectly normal, the next…RABID!','Rabid',29437,3.168,6.3,'Fr4ZLdhoQRY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7372,_binary '\0','/gzyoYBChRLSY6Gds7x1km7kAYv8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076591',7.2,4328,'en','Race for Your Life, Charlie Brown','The Peanuts gang, including Snoopy and Woodstock, have gone off to summer camp. After a few days of the usual activities, they all participate in a river-rafting race. Battling treacherous rapids, wild animals and cheating bullies from a rival tent, the teams make their way downriver to the finish line.','/zkrTxae5BkW6DwNbEsD568ZKVPf.jpg','1977-07-03',76,'Released','The entire \"Peanuts\" gang faces everything from bullies to rampaging rapids. \"Good grief\", will you have fun!','Race for Your Life, Charlie Brown',31718,2.4462,6.7,'_I3VqVX5Nrc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7373,_binary '\0','/q8LMCkMbvNHKXc57cADybYsyMaa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076593',6.8,1342,'en','Raggedy Ann & Andy: A Musical Adventure','Raggedy Ann and Andy, along with other toys, reside in the nursery of a little girl named Marcella. During Marcella\'s seventh birthday, Babette, from France, is introduced as the new doll from a large package. When the lecherous Captain Contagious kidnaps Babette and escapes from the nursery, Ann and Andy must navigate the Deep Deep Woods to save her.','/r8hhaVZ23UpUaQ8dWl2MBxrVqWa.jpg','1977-04-01',86,'Released','America\'s favorite doll on a whirlwind journey through fantasyland!','Raggedy Ann & Andy: A Musical Adventure',36748,2.0372,7,'sD4jIXa4z64','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7374,_binary '\0','/k98YDgWDQ0vEPTGlelnAitYHFFT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076594',6.7,4181,'en','Raid on Entebbe','Based on a true operation by Israeli commandos. An Air France flight is hijacked by the Popular Front for the Liberation of Palestine. The airplane landed in Uganda. The terrorists released some passengers, keeping 94 Jews and 12 air crew hostage. The Israeli government would not negotiate. A rescue plan was devised, and less than 100 commandos were flown across Africa to rescue the passengers in surprisingly successful operation.','/sqMHgs1IyT3B8PuyOYAmPXVLzh4.jpg','1976-12-26',145,'Released','The boldest rescue in history','Raid on Entebbe',31690,2.8263,6.042,'U7vvDjr2v9s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7375,_binary '\0','/dSlofjxxcTSLmnH6602WsSSELU5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076618',6.9,76171,'en','The Rescuers','Two agents of the mouse-run International Rescue Aid Society search for a little orphan girl kidnapped by sinister treasure hunters.','/9jpDjrRyvv9Nw0piXOpHHQTfxw9.jpg','1977-06-22',78,'Released','Two tiny agents vs. the world\'s wickedest woman in a dazzling animated adventure!','The Rescuers',11319,12.6927,6.792,'bz4vILhWO18','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7376,_binary '\0','/kZdhYWTE7fl3TSOfBm5NI0xs7Wu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076630',6.2,3641,'en','Rituals','Five doctors go camping in the remote woods of Northern Ontario. When their boots are stolen they begin to suspect they are being stalked.','/bl3XW3lr1coecrrDRqbIbkIVaoV.jpg','1977-07-21',99,'Released','If you go down in the woods today, you\'re in for a big surprise.','Rituals',67822,1.4312,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7377,_binary '\0','/80RuJ4hV9mR2qCw9w9Hs6ZPADpv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076632',6.6,1792,'it','Il signor Robinson - Mostruosa storia d\'amore e d\'avventure','A shipwreck strands a modern Italian businessman on a desert island. Like Robinson Crusoe he must find a way to return to civilization; unlike him--he\'s a 20th-century man, a totally different case.','/m5IvF1HC3LzuKCwTL1u2LFi9GPl.jpg','1976-12-23',107,'Released',NULL,'Mr. Robinson',63029,1.9131,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7378,_binary '\0','/pXUs9wl6jyTdarMLVcQ00pPhEPt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076636',6.3,7602,'en','Rollercoaster','A young terrorist kills and injures patrons of a Norfolk amusement park by placing homemade explosives on the track of one of its roller coasters. After staging a similar incident in Pittsburgh, he sends a tape to a meeting of major amusement park executives in Chicago, demanding $1 million to make him stop.','/dy23SSGZDp3dftzhDvHXOEM6OaN.jpg','1977-06-10',119,'Released','Somewhere in the crowd is a killer who can turn smiles into screams.','Rollercoaster',10670,2.3764,6,'naoZObQpamU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7379,_binary '\0','/y0BpUwUfeg27tSZN94Gj7sJIieX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076637',6.9,14845,'en','Rolling Thunder','A recently-returned Vietnam POW loses his family and his right hand during a violent home invasion, and seeks retribution against those responsible.','/9iZjVn6Q5FJa92SQLcFMrskpES9.jpg','1977-11-02',100,'Released','Major Charles Rane has come home to war!','Rolling Thunder',21948,2.765,6.8,'BY8te30b7gs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7380,_binary '\0','/pE9ayebFIg3YgVrGQ6SY78xnWal.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076644',4.5,1363,'en','Ruby','Ruby Claire, single mother of deaf-mute teenager Leslie, operates a drive-in theater, where she employs a number of ex-cons, some of whom begin to die in bizarre ways. Eventually, Ruby discovers that the spirit of her dead mobster husband has possessed Leslie, seeking revenge through the tormented girl. As Leslie picks off her father\'s former associates, she also begins to target Ruby herself.','/hAKlXyTc0LqvG2J7TbrvBfBZRHz.jpg','1977-06-23',85,'Released','Christened in blood. Raised in sin. She\'s sweet sixteen, let the party begin!','Ruby',85695,1.5853,4.5,'-rPcVQzNFgo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7381,_binary '\0','/pJg0P8LggXEVCmwM9MdTuq8xmpv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076649',3.7,2146,'it','La bestia in calore','In a remote village in occupied Europe, the SS pursue their inhuman treatment of captured partisans in efforts to force them to betray their comrades.... while Fraulein Krast, a sadistic biologist, concentrates her efforts on the womenfolk with refined tortures and humiliation, leaving them to the mercy of a sex-crazed half-man, half-beast she has created with experimental injections.... And as advancing Allied forces approach the village, Krast herself becomes a victim of her own fiendish rituals....','/nzcVBgdHk12IBJNa4uERIbB82lJ.jpg','1977-07-19',86,'Released','Horrifying experiences in the last days of the S.S.','The Beast in Heat',36879,3.5313,5.1,'GL9BlnrDrqE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7382,_binary '\0','/kZdW5RCKHVTyfYhcfpkWFhQimXU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076665',4.2,1507,'en','Satan\'s Cheerleaders','The janitor at a local high school is actually the scout for a coven of Satanists on the lookout for a virgin to sacrifice. One day he kidnaps the cheerleading squad to use for their rituals. However, unbeknownst to the devil-worshipers, one of the cheerleaders is actually a witch, and has plans of her own for the Satanists.','/fJ1pXNo6bjGZdO5vWY7gIxg8A7C.jpg','1977-03-18',92,'Released','When these girls raise hell... there\'s the devil to pay!','Satan\'s Cheerleaders',29114,1.4504,4.5,'jcKVf6rsYts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7383,_binary '\0','/iihMna17sTxP3zwlWBsKZbvDiGZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076666',6.8,95916,'en','Saturday Night Fever','Tony spends his Saturdays at a disco where his stylish moves raise his popularity among the patrons. But his life outside the disco is not easy and things change when he gets attracted to Stephanie.','/ylA7E5Md21aqgzxbwa2dFxX8LKV.jpg','1977-12-16',118,'Released','Where do you go when the record is over...','Saturday Night Fever',11009,7.1279,6.736,'lX2FffaLdks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7384,_binary '\0','/11z37T6OYiBdj1hNGTqCa4YrYSt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076670',5.8,1781,'en','Schizo','A recently-married woman who has been labeled as mentally unstable, begins to suspect that someone close to her is the culprit in a sudden string of murders.','/cjstIQcLXzXLndVVgmfcjP1BufZ.jpg','1976-11-11',109,'Released','Schizophrenia... When the left hand doesn\'t know who the right hand is killing!!','Schizo',33018,3.0625,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7385,_binary '\0','/fim57eBXhXCOVYsmNdx0PoBBvKS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076683',6.3,13754,'en','The Sentinel','As a young girl, Alison Parker attempted suicide after being traumatized by her father\'s sexual exploits. Now an elite fashion model, she moves to a Brooklyn Heights apartment building where she encounters a number of bizarre, eccentric tenants and attempts to uncover the building\'s sinister secret.','/zoLuOdAD63prJP0o3Z0zRaAfwXE.jpg','1977-01-07',92,'Released','She was young. She was beautiful. She was the next.','The Sentinel',18196,4.3718,6.1,'FtBw-uBigco','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7386,_binary '\0','/xHrt20Evw8KBz0MGgRTofQNV6ly.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076684',6.3,1868,'fr','La 7ème Compagnie au clair de lune','The third part of Seventh Company adventures.','/uJ2K5ghTJHnD06EdmGhxEV1YuY.jpg','1977-12-07',75,'Released',NULL,'The Seventh Company Outdoors',56589,2.1295,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7387,_binary '\0','/luHUQITsjkkRzStHlkbEejatTx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076686',6.6,6933,'en','The Serpent\'s Egg','In 1923 Berlin, following the suicide of his brother, an American acrobat struggles to survive while facing unemployment, depression, alcoholism, and the social decay of Germany during the Weimar Republic.','/n7z0doFkXHcvo8QQWHLFnkEPXRU.jpg','1977-10-28',120,'Released','The kind of terror that could never be... until now... until Bergman!','The Serpent\'s Egg',47474,3.4671,6.237,'AvMC4eY5Q2g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7388,_binary '\0','/cmWX4yGhcr0VKIHsrnYU0F9Ac4V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076696',7.5,4440,'hi','शतरंज के खिलाड़ी','In the year 1856, Nawab Wajid Ali Shah is the King of Awadh, one of the last independent kingdoms of India. The British intend to control this rich land and send General Outram to clear way for an annexation. Pressure is mounting amidst intrigue and political maneuvers, but the Nawab whiles away his time in pursuit of pleasure and religious practice. The court is of no help either — noblemen Mir and Mirza ignore all duties and spend their days playing endless games of chess.','/fb0gA6K2xyWBuxMOweUmEHTjt6.jpg','1977-10-02',129,'Released','Satyajit Ray\'s First Hindi feature Film','The Chess Players',80556,1.6778,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7389,_binary '\0','/dRaoGQbXnb3MGo7CxJgVHwGpZOP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076704',5.4,7190,'en','Shock Waves','Visitors to a remote island discover that a reclusive Nazi commandant has been breeding a group of zombie soldiers.','/ApYarwDS09ll1I1zZV9XFUe6aGe.jpg','1977-07-15',85,'Released','The Deep End of Horror!','Shock Waves',26680,2.9631,4.846,'8HCYxnKbkxs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7390,_binary '\0','/d3Gpv0adTHO7kcuKZvOcXSETSur.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076706',7,1763,'en','Short Eyes','A young man who is charged with child molestation is placed in New York City’s infamous Tombs prison. When the other inmates in his cell block find out what he is charged with, life becomes extremely difficult for him.','/mtgLebvVu9WLfkJXgcPyigcrozY.jpg','1977-09-28',100,'Released','\"Jesus help me, cause man won\'t.\"','Short Eyes',81462,1.6642,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7391,_binary '\0','/kKCA2KS9ShIQwOnK8ef6A4T2Zem.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076709',5.1,4051,'cn','死亡塔','In this dark tale of revenge, Bruce Lee \"returns\" as Billy Lo, whose best friend Chin Ku dies of a sudden illness. But suspicion of foul play arises when a gang tries to steal Ku\'s coffin at the funeral using a helicopter. When Lo\'s younger brother Lo hears about the incident, he leaves his Buddhist master to investigate the truth. His trail soon leads him to the Castle of Death, the last place Chin Ku was seen alive. There, he meets and befriends an unlikely ally--a cruel and merciless martial arts expert who is also the tower\'s master. But when the master dies under mysterious circumstances, Lo ends up dueling with someone far more terrifying.','/lVL0oX4ZA2owOtQwTsmbw92lhCp.jpg','1981-03-21',96,'Released',NULL,'Game of Death II',48773,4.3201,5.8,'U0h1XPw3R0U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7392,_binary '\0','/fa0WNzjuWJseqiOmXh6U3yxJHXh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076715',6.1,1755,'en','Silver Bears','Financial wizard \"Doc\" Fletcher is sent by crime boss Joe Fiore to buy a bank in Switzerland in order to more easily launder their profits. When he arrives, Fletcher finds that the bank, acquired by his associate Prince di Siracusa, consists of some shabby offices above a restaurant. To make up for this, the Prince suggests that Fletcher invests in a silver mine owned by Shireen and Agha Firdausi. This solves one problem, but the mine also attracts the attention of some of the most powerful people in the silver business. Fletcher must pull out all his wheeler-dealing skills in order to keep hold of everything he\'s worked for, in the process romancing a banker\'s discontented wife.','/uaJgZ1IDZToI3mB9MqY80pQm9la.jpg','1977-06-03',113,'Released','They were after silver and they struck gold.','Silver Bears',61642,1.9013,6.1,'o4j8xIaCYIU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7393,_binary '\0','/bJpDvcc2um0g2EA1vr8XlXHgkFk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076716',6.4,9809,'en','Sinbad and the Eye of the Tiger','Princess Farah refuses to marry Sinbad until Prince Kassim, her brother, is able to give his consent. However, the Prince\'s wicked stepmother, Queen Zenobia, has changed Kassim into a baboon in order to have her own son crowned as caliph. Sinbad, his crew, the Princess and the transformed Prince travel to a distant land, fighting every obstacle Zenobia places in their path, to seek the advice of a legendary wise man who can possibly tell how to end the spell.','/kMP5bg26ac1FmNCamOC5WZece6N.jpg','1977-05-25',113,'Released','Sinbad! The greatest of all adventurers in his biggest adventure of all!','Sinbad and the Eye of the Tiger',11940,3.8396,6.598,'gNOHaOd5BDQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7394,_binary '\0','/kAMgr9znXqu07SQjdbT1vwUeqYD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076723',7.2,45694,'en','Slap Shot','To build up attendance at their games, the management of a struggling minor-league hockey team signs up the Hanson Brothers, three hard-charging players whose job is to demolish the opposition.','/k5dvEA7ajd90mf3KrF6m6LnYXOv.jpg','1977-02-25',123,'Released','Slap Shot out slaps... out swears... out laughs...','Slap Shot',11590,4.8051,6.8,'vW67agGgWAM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7395,_binary '\0','/eIXit8FbjVofuRqvoyBhAd2YNU4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076725',6.4,1994,'en','Sleeping Dogs','Recluse Smith is drawn into a revolutionary struggle between guerrillas and right-wingers in New Zealand. Implicated in a murder and framed as a revolutionary conspirator, Smith tries to maintain an attitude of non-violence while caught between warring factions.','/u1gKAfqLMvz1uH3HQmz9HdJ9DBw.jpg','1978-07-13',107,'Released','What happens when you\'re hunted...and there\'s no place to run!','Sleeping Dogs',37582,1.6064,5.8,'lvuVWWKftdw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7396,_binary '\0','/qnALlAgoQu6rDVKsuFJ7WDvLQjm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076727',8.2,11879,'ru','Служебный роман','Anatoly Novoseltsev is a mousy single father and office stumblebum working at a statistics bureau in Moscow. In the hopes of being promoted, he is coaxed into charming his disagreeable and seemingly unfeeling boss, Ludmila Kalugina, or \"Meany\" as she\'s otherwise known by her subordinates. Helped by his colleagues Olya and Yura, Anatoly attempts to ease the yoke of Ms. Kalugina, and what follows in the wake of his graceless manoeuvres is completely unforeseen, as he awakens a side to her not yet known, even to herself..','/21TgZRiA5gDlyCwQEyYqZcqwMgN.jpg','1977-10-26',159,'Released',NULL,'Office Romance',31139,2.582,7.824,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7397,_binary '\0','/5P7uWjqxprRWVbKJFgxZs4iJOrU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076729',7,63724,'en','Smokey and the Bandit','A race car driver tries to transport an illegal beer shipment from Texas to Atlanta in under 28 hours, picking up a reluctant bride-to-be on the way.','/w4RqNZtVHB5Uzlnl6zQlMHft7QI.jpg','1977-05-27',96,'Released','\"What we have here is a total lack of respect for the law!\"','Smokey and the Bandit',11006,7.1936,7.01,'3U7j296Nxcs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7398,_binary '\0','/3LhHTcJMD5kZyAZYu737y2NZytH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076731',4.6,2671,'en','Snowbeast','A skier and his wife visit a friend\'s ski resort during a man beast\'s rampage, and must hide from the impending danger.','/l8myZtBJiucZag5yVSCKrfexKIH.jpg','1977-04-28',86,'Released','The legendary creature is half man... Half animal... And a cold blooded killer!','Snowbeast',49353,1.8383,4.3,'mn-OZddW7Ts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7399,_binary '\0','/uNhZCcxkXmrmzPfOH0ZxegMs6SL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076734',7.6,13637,'nl','Soldaat van Oranje','The lives of Erik Lanshof and five of his closest friends take different paths when the German army invades the Netherlands in 1940: fight and resistance, fear and resignation, collaboration and high treason.','/kdlk0cz97i8Fyb1ZFpp9tokHxGD.jpg','1977-09-22',148,'Released','Love first. Fight later','Soldier of Orange',633,2.4989,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7400,_binary '\0','/g7prwSflNODkHZI6792MYoU4qoh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076740',7.7,37806,'en','Sorcerer','Four men from different parts of the globe, all hiding from their pasts in the same remote South American town, agree to risk their lives transporting several cases of dynamite (which is so old that it is dripping unstable nitroglycerin) across dangerous jungle terrain.','/2b7oexm173SF1FSEq0DdgxZZNRH.jpg','1977-06-24',122,'Released','Four men...outlaws thrown together by fate...share a fantastic adventure and risk the only thing they have left to lose.','Sorcerer',38985,5.516,7.469,'394A13kSfLs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7401,_binary '\0','/9TxOcgxS7xRV5DQrFEBUBB1DHJb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076744',8.3,2241,'sh','Специјално васпитање','Educator and those educated in a home for juvenile delinquents in the same test: approach, take a peek into his soul to become a man. The story of a minor, neglected boys-offenders and their teachers who try to reject the old methods of rehabilitation.','/tUHmN9DJaMyfYdyxKXmo3GxxWil.jpg','1977-04-28',110,'Released',NULL,'Special Education',265686,1.0581,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7402,_binary '\0','/pQrIh0uZV7RdnMx5DJ4ZLuiBv6z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076747',5.7,1504,'en','The Spell','A distraught mother must cope with her embittered daughter who has the ability to cause \"accidents\" to happen.','/qna3z275c272vG7eYLC3mj62S4x.jpg','1977-02-20',86,'Released','A taunted, overweight teenager with a mysterious power to destroy her enemies!','The Spell',67744,1.2316,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7403,_binary '\0','/2AI3pSt5sbAEav6isVDIeCuiZql.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076749',5.5,2895,'it','Maladolescenza','Laura and Fabrizio have been meeting every summer in the forest by her parent\'s summer home. Fabrizio is a solitary boy with only his dog for company; Laura a sweet but unconfident child. This summer new aspects enter into their story as both are growing up. Laura is falling in love with Fabrizio, while he displays a new sexual awareness of her masked by his malice. Things develop further when they meet Sylvia who, unlike the innocent Laura, is confident and assertive. Fabrizio develops a fascination with her, eventually bribing Laura to fetch her to the forest to join them in play.','/nu5uj47KSF73VPEiIRYdPLJ96j7.jpg','1977-05-06',94,'Released',NULL,'Playing with Love',46853,8.512,5.239,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7404,_binary '\0','/lhPq8R8qgoyLNWvVTiqZSkYGLPX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076752',7,126588,'en','The Spy Who Loved Me','Russian and British submarines with nuclear missiles on board both vanish from sight without a trace. England and Russia both blame each other as James Bond tries to solve the riddle of the disappearing ships. But the KGB also has an agent on the case.','/3ZxHKFxMYvAko680DsRgAZKWcLi.jpg','1977-07-07',125,'Released','It\'s the BIGGEST. It\'s the BEST. It\'s BOND. And B-E-Y-O-N-D.','The Spy Who Loved Me',691,12.5588,6.8,'TqhzdF8m6q4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7405,_binary '\0','/zqkmTXzjkAgXmEWLRsY4UpTWCeo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076759',8.6,1588486,'en','Star Wars','Princess Leia is captured and held hostage by the evil Imperial forces in their effort to take over the galactic Empire. Venturesome Luke Skywalker and dashing captain Han Solo team together with the loveable robot duo R2-D2 and C-3PO to rescue the beautiful princess and restore peace and justice in the Empire.','/fai0rspsNeJCS69wHNjOdWxcI7P.jpg','1977-05-25',121,'Released','A long time ago in a galaxy far, far away...','Star Wars',11,34.6298,8.207,'i-vsILeJ8_8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7406,_binary '\0','/nnZq2BVgkWbvmqED8tt20H54FwZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076767',7,1667,'en','Storm Boy','Mike is a lonely Australian boy living in a coastal wilderness with his reclusive father. In search of friendship he encounters an Aboriginal native loner and the two form a bond in the care of orphaned pelicans.','/cCgXSP6NYKCp9lwVk4HvtnwovSl.jpg','1977-07-28',88,'Released','Wild things should be free.','Storm Boy',14302,1.0493,6.9,'LKjUVlk4Ba4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7407,_binary '\0','/9uXGLBPIJkPqmVwiyh3FI0iAe6n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076786',7.3,116599,'it','Suspiria','An American newcomer to a prestigious German ballet academy comes to realize that the school is a front for something sinister amid a series of grisly murders.','/sEcvc9h1X3hYZdFgtiiKMm6RB3f.jpg','1977-02-01',99,'Released','Do You Know Anything About Witches?','Suspiria',11906,7.8992,7.5,'x_FfT98QJks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7408,_binary '\0','/xK5mvxME1MjryR5w1317sYsevUp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076788',6.7,1833,'en','Sweeney!','When one of Regan\'s snouts complains that his girlfriend\'s recent suicide was murder, the flying squad detective feels compelled to investigate. He uncovers a conspiracy that reaches the heart of the government, and finds himself fitted up, suspended and under the scrutiny of Special Branch.','/nEyhV0vwH8HrCyKLe1goSNSwkji.jpg','1977-01-14',97,'Released','The roughest, toughest men from London\'s greatest crime squad smash their way onto the big screen!','Sweeney!',55762,1.5847,6.7,'XsvKXrTs3PM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7409,_binary '\0','/yheWWmGBLEf7lTePzl6cmXDOjEK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076804',6.5,6882,'en','Telefon','Nicolai Dalchimski, a mad KGB agent steals a notebook full of names of \"sleeping\" undercover KGB agents sent to the U.S. in the 1950\'s. These agents got their assignments under hypnosis, so they can\'t remember their missions until they\'re told a line of a Robert Frost poem. Dalchimski flees to the U.S. and starts phoning these agents who perform sabotage acts against military targets.','/dryfRzxf9lFuLI8UPJnjSoa3QxZ.jpg','1977-12-16',102,'Released','They\'ll do anything to stop Telefon. The operation that can trigger 51 human time bombs.','Telefon',22090,2.6563,6.613,'nji4LO0lUGw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7410,_binary '\0','/fvtE5EfU2iovfzfOgHrITndyISd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076808',6.7,1318,'fr','Tendre Poulet','When Lise\'s car bumps Antoine\'s bike, they recognize each other from a brief fling 20 years before while at the Sorbonne. He\'s now a professor of Greek; she\'s loathe to tell him she\'s a police inspector. A call interrupts their first dinner date: a Deputy of the National Assembly has been murdered. She has a suspect, another Deputy, and must track him while deflecting Antoine\'s eye from her vocation. All roads in the inquiry lead to Christine Vallier, the dead Deputy\'s mistress, a beguiling 22-year-old whose mother ran the Assembly\'s snack bar. When more deputies die and Antoine learns Lise\'s identity, she must act quickly solve the crime and save her future.','/rzHKScCssgA4gJZqNDxcYM4UgrU.jpg','1978-01-18',105,'Released',NULL,'Dear Inspector',33337,3.7631,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7411,_binary '\0','/80qK1EWekrJXVAheIE6GQJ37T0l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076809',3.8,5043,'it','Tentacoli','Several people disappear from and at the sea. Their bodies are found gnawed to the skeleton, even the marrow is missing. The scientists have no idea which animal could do such things. Dr. Turner begins to suspect that the company which builds a tunnel beneath the bay might have poisoned the environment and caused an octopus to mutate to giant dimensions...','/yusLLZO0sdEhWwT2YvJcrrca6qm.jpg','1977-02-25',102,'Released','It\'s Turning the Beach ... Into a Buffet!','Tentacles',49158,2.4847,4.6,'tFPsNrr1pxo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7412,_binary '\0','/oGsj5CxLvcW4RpNABTVKmAqdwi9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076825',4.1,1700,'es','Tintorera','Two shark hunters flirt with an attractive British lady while hunting down a large tiger shark terrorizing the Mexican East coast.','/gjukweJ6BuhZjwXI7w6ZnNrHdaS.jpg','1977-04-07',85,'Released','There\'s a monstrous killer churning up the sea...','Tintorera: Killer Shark',81471,1.7758,3.9,'6nBe4kzC0OE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7413,_binary '\0','/rlXOCkER3ajPMt9IqjyebWztZUx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076843',6.8,5655,'en','The Turning Point','As young dancers, they were best friends and fierce rivals. Deedee left the stage for marriage and motherhood, while Emma would become an international ballet icon. But when Deedee\'s teenage daughter is invited to join Emma\'s dance company and begins an affair with a young Russian star, the two women are forced to confront the choices they\'ve made, the resentments they\'ve hidden and the emotional truths they must face at the turning point.','/6CD90BQEDexEIMqIwMSnbJStF5x.jpg','1977-11-14',119,'Released','The generations change. But the choices remain the same.','The Turning Point',61280,2.524,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7414,_binary '\0','/loHXkz7HnsJknnRTjAPEK7pJBAj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076845',6.7,4249,'en','Twilight\'s Last Gleaming','A renegade USAF general, Lawrence Dell, escapes from a military prison and takes over an ICBM silo near Montana and threatens to provoke World War 3 unless the President reveals details of a secret meeting held just after the start of the Vietnam War between Dell and the then President\'s most trusted advisors.','/1qVUuzYepmj3lGyTgM43gztCH14.jpg','1977-02-09',146,'Released','We have invaded Silo 3. We are prepared to launch nine nuclear missiles. We demand ten million dollars, Air Force One... and you, Mr President.','Twilight\'s Last Gleaming',75938,3.0742,6.506,'dUbFJzF-1b0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7415,_binary '\0','/2CQBJsfAQ9Y99rl5vwTLTuCQLj8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076852',6.9,2757,'fr','Un éléphant ça trompe énormément','On an otherwise normal day, Étienne, a happily married man and a good father, sees something that stops him dead in his tracks: a gorgeous woman in a billowing red dress. Long after she has left his vision, her memory continues to haunt his mind. He falls instantly in love with her and tries everything to get to know her better. Helping Étienne snare his elusive lady in red are his three bumbling buddies, which all have secret affairs and/or cheat on their wives.','/kYNgxIPOJUlJiN984H4NHf46y66.jpg','1976-09-22',105,'Released','«Four million Frenchmen and 50,000 New Yorkers can\'t be wrong»','Pardon Mon Affaire',2459,2.6039,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7416,_binary '\0','/objMOhldbBBqjj2hSJRyyBorqKz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076853',5.8,2726,'en','The Uncanny','Wilbur Gray, a horror writer, has stumbled upon a terrible secret, that cats are supernatural creatures who really call the shots. In a desperate attempt to get others to believe him, Wilbur spews three tales of feline horror.','/kLfcSCWIDQd48OGU1Xo5cYLi6Yq.jpg','1977-08-24',89,'Released','They prowl by night...lusting for human flesh!','The Uncanny',75903,2.1924,5.8,'reKzSETwAe4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7417,_binary '\0','/tDOSQWVCRNrS9QfpHckzRtvSmPi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076855',7.4,3302,'fr','L\'une chante, l\'autre pas','The intertwined lives of two women in 1970s France, set against the progress of the women\'s movement in which Agnes Varda was involved. Pomme and Suzanne meet when Pomme helps Suzanne obtain an abortion after a third pregnancy which she cannot afford. They lose contact but meet again ten years later. Pomme has become an unconventional singer, Suzanne a serious community worker - despite the contrast they remain friends and share in the various dramas of each others\' lives, in the process affirming their different female identities.','/b3YTxT8LM1AWeWyrAXd3b0kjjzz.jpg','1977-03-09',122,'Released','You are not born a woman… you become one.','One Sings, the Other Doesn\'t',63318,2.3263,7.1,'e81uf9dyT7c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7418,_binary '\0','/j6HbreJXA1moTjYzOsxdi4I5SLu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076868',6,2605,'en','Valentino','The untimely death of silent screen star Rudolph Valentino prompts the many women in his past to reminisce about his troubled rise to superstardom.','/kOG6m9XBgzZCJDfHs7qjqfvNWsF.jpg','1977-09-07',128,'Released','In life he was a movie star, in death he became a legend.','Valentino',42603,2.9635,5.804,'tmFPHd3MxI8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7419,_binary '\0','/5JY98xaoEwexW0oPShQC7ooGb2w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076890',3.7,1530,'en','Viva Knievel!','The legendary stuntman plans his most incredible stunt yet while battling the mob in this action-adventure.','/6ZZiFHcZJ9tXm3HuIhFTG9droGu.jpg','1977-06-10',106,'Released','The one and only real live Evel Knievel in his first dramatic movie role.','Viva Knievel!',56533,1.3119,4,'4Yo3NEpt_sc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7420,_binary '\0','/1fbDlRDJQ1W1z5oPpEMTNvsRJni.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076893',7.9,1407,'hr','Vlak u snijegu','One class of school children from a small village make the trip to Zagreb. One of the boys gets sick and the class is forced to go home. During their journey the train gets stuck in a snowstorm.','/F2mpkkU12tQN4Qp3F0THgZ6cU.jpg','1976-06-10',84,'Released',NULL,'Train in the Snow',38817,0.8031,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7421,_binary '\0','/kI3nrKaSEc7MacMTxhcd3Tt5RjM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076910',5.7,1359,'en','Welcome to L.A.','The lives of a group of Hollywood neurotics intersect over the Christmas holidays. Foremost among them, a songwriter visits Los Angeles to work on a singer\'s album. The gig, unbeknownst to him, is being bankrolled by his estranged father, a dairy magnate, who hopes to reunite with his son. When the songwriter meets an eccentric housewife who fancies herself a modern-day Garbo, his world of illusions comes crashing down.','/2OlIqSuoilz6nLaOQNle1MXNtUx.jpg','1976-11-12',106,'Released','The City of the One Night Stands.','Welcome to L.A.',86241,2.2286,5,'nutdpiUr_9Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7422,_binary '\0','/axbVMxlMgHRmDpsgYueu7Ssv7QV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076913',6.2,2247,'en','Which Way Is Up?','Orange picker Leroy Jones inadvertently becomes a union leader and is forced out of town, leaving behind his sex-obsessed father, Rufus, and timid spouse, Annie Mae. He heads for Los Angeles, where he falls for union organizer Vanetta. Annie Mae seeks solace from local preacher Lenox Thomas, who eventually impregnates her. When Leroy catches wind, he heads home for a showdown with Lenox.','/4qJrXjVNJJwh4b2H6gwRasbMpVB.jpg','1977-11-04',94,'Released','Three times the Richard Pryor. Three times the laughs.','Which Way Is Up?',23312,1.9939,5.7,'oQmDOSMVSLk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7423,_binary '\0','/scf5Fgzbr66IFoqaxYwcmrJG0IA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076915',6.2,6204,'en','The White Buffalo','In this strange western version of Moby Dick, Wild Bill Hickok hunts a white buffalo he has seen in a dream. Hickok moves through a variety of uniquely authentic western locations - dim, filthy, makeshift taverns; freezing, slaughterhouse-like frontier towns and beautifully desolate high country - before improbably teaming up with a young Crazy Horse to pursue the creature.','/5iH5LrzCMJmtCyegtWDgnAvIul3.jpg','1977-05-01',97,'Released','Two legendary enemies unite to fight the charging white beast!!','The White Buffalo',47914,3.6347,6,'b9ha39SPSeM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7424,_binary '\0','/eTzdSb3YCFZvyzicBalPJ9O0zzJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076929',6.3,14891,'en','Wizards','After the death of his mother, evil mutant wizard Blackwolf discovers long-lost military technologies. Full of ego and ambition, Blackwolf claims his mother\'s throne, assembles an army, and sets out to brainwash and conquer Earth. Meanwhile, Blackwolf\'s gentle twin brother, the bearded sage Avatar, calls upon his own magical abilities to foil Blackwolf\'s plans for world domination — even if it means eliminating his own flesh and blood.','/jeAxoYepnVirGe0H7pmwviSZYul.jpg','1977-02-09',81,'Released','An epic fantasy of peace and magic.','Wizards',16220,3.3171,6.2,'YaaAOqSa0pE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7425,_binary '\0','/7UsjRXhqvshPXoDriw6pALsx3ih.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076933',5.8,2372,'en','The World\'s Greatest Lover','When frustrated movie studio mogul Adolph Zitz announces a talent search for a romantic leading man to rival the great Rudolph Valentino, thousands of hopefuls decend upon Hollywood. Rudy Valentine, a neurotic baker from Milwaukee, knows little about romance or acting. But when his wife leaves him for the real Valentino, Rudy goes to outrageous lengths to win the role of a lifetime and win back the love of his life.','/haPovTMNxoaxWz9HTrSi24yr3qb.jpg','1977-12-18',89,'Released','Go ahead - laugh!','The World\'s Greatest Lover',45579,2.4515,5.568,'6FlQPeu9TQM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7426,_binary '\0','/qL0dsnNeJRsjQ3iJ9RMCoNWZBx9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076935',7.3,1494,'ja','幸福の黄色いハンカチ','A convict, newly released from prison for murder, joins two strangers on a road trip through Hokkaido to visit his ex-wife, whom he hasn\'t seen in four years, knowing that if she puts a yellow handkerchief on the window, it would mean that she wants him back at home.','/vDO8WFYjpJgcEMP3rfvN2g2G9m2.jpg','1977-09-30',109,'Released','Three complete strangers embark on a road-trip to Hokkaido.','The Yellow Handkerchief',22557,5.7856,7,'eccxyf4mlIA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7427,_binary '\0','/udo5Z6thy1kfsVxjWf4NzYNgPiW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0076939',7,1253,'zh','鷹爪鐵布衫','Hwang Jang Lee is a corrupt Ming guard who frames John Liu for murder. A wanted fugitive, John hides out with a teen who is an expert in the infamous Iron Armor technique, a technique that means the expert can withstand anything. However, Hwang is an expert in it as well as the Eagle Claw\'s. Can John stop Hwang before it\'s too late?','/jJVKiX7AVhxKkEmJBRoWZpcCx8O.jpg','1977-06-29',90,'Released',NULL,'The Invincible Armour',56095,1.903,6.8,'97EqMXLKX00','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7428,_binary '\0','/8aad9uv6zD4D5f17ClfhNC29t6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077132',7,5699,'ja','愛の亡霊','A married woman and her lover murder her husband and dump his body into a well, but his ghost returns to haunt them as the local gossip intensifies.','/x7Kr9Q1riDmFzrNsacdXb68d6fZ.jpg','1978-09-06',105,'Released','The haunting of a passionate love.','Empire of Passion',49096,6.2494,6.8,'Eh3zv8_zjXU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7429,_binary '\0','/viyEqVStJ9bjgyGh71TNMVqOZI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077138',7.8,9526,'it','L\'albero degli zoccoli','On a turn-of-the-20th-century northern Italian farm, a group of sharecroppers eke out a threadbare existence. A priest advises Batisti and his wife Batistina that their young son Minec should be formally educated, so they sacrifice his help in the fields and send him to school. When Minec\'s wooden shoe breaks one day, Batisti--in an act of desperation--puts the family\'s future at risk to replace the clog.','/ld4l2XWuECX6c6lWd2BWv1olg2N.jpg','1978-09-21',187,'Released','When the family of man was still—a family.','The Tree of Wooden Clogs',31542,2.7802,7.6,'v6LAOc3M6b0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7430,_binary '\0','/uiiaZfx94GUyxs69QLUhajt6nGa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077147',7.3,7424,'en','The Rutles: All You Need Is Cash','The story of the rise and fall of the Pre-Fab Four.','/uZJ5r5mYH1uRYa6aW5JFpjHasrQ.jpg','1978-03-22',73,'Released','A living legend that will live long after other living legends have died.','The Rutles: All You Need Is Cash',16378,2.725,6.835,'fJqp_KvOHts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7431,_binary '\0','/pQNtLZvyLPbg271pzWEgYItZj6S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077157',7.2,2263,'en','American Boy: A Profile of Steven Prince','Martin Scorsese spends an evening with larger-than-life raconteur Steven Prince—a former drug addict, road manager for Neil Diamond, and actor—as he recounts stories from his colorful life.','/jnSQhFBaJ7KlJEWYmp8WfS0FVmU.jpg','1978-09-16',55,'Released',NULL,'American Boy: A Profile of Steven Prince',33470,2.1456,6.7,'cdeGH2kZwk4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7432,_binary '\0','/cCWM5An7Z8EQhfOnqOvVPBT55Xg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077158',6.9,1436,'en','American Hot Wax','This is the story loosely based on Cleveland disc jockey Alan Freed, who introduced rock\'n\'roll to teenage American radio audiences in the 1950s. Freed was a source of great controversy: criticized by conservatives for corrupting youth with the \"devil\'s music\"; hated by racists for promoting African American music for white consumption; persecuted by law enforcement officials and finally brought down by the \"payola\" scandals.','/9WVolrSXzdehGWEFzgF4KhJmBEI.jpg','1978-03-17',91,'Released','1959. New York City. The battleground was Rock and Roll. It was the beginning of an era. You shoulda been there.','American Hot Wax',42198,1.6357,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7433,_binary '\0','/qaQzfhVf2WMTnhhwQLvBrssTmzA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077174',5.7,1733,'en','Are You in the House Alone?','An average high school girl\'s life is turned upside down after she is attacked and savagely assaulted. When a mysterious person begins leaving her threatening messages and making unsettling phone calls, Gail realizes that the nightmare is only just beginning...','/aozTeKh7GLi8ytEHiTSOEz3htIs.jpg','1978-09-20',96,'Released','I’m watching you…','Are You in the House Alone?',55300,2.0744,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7434,_binary '\0','/69f9n3MlirrkbkW6rx4G1HZlwof.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077188',6.8,3633,'it','Autostop rosso sangue','A bickering couple driving cross-country through California pick up a psychotic hitchhiker with two million dollars who threatens to kill them unless they take him to Mexico.','/sHRt1alAIPDOBqaRu8E65ykDR9t.jpg','1977-04-30',104,'Released','Hitch a Ride ... Hitch a Date with Death!','Hitch Hike',54523,2.4803,6.708,'wnb15nKk9Ss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7435,_binary '\0','/scSdtpKbReIasH0HSSpFNQPmmZa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077189',3.8,2843,'en','Avalanche','After an avalanche of snow crashes into their ski resort, a holiday at a winter wonderland turns into a game of survival for a group of vacationers.','/zMORD6VDGIWo5thfMuA4Edb1mbj.jpg','1978-09-29',94,'Released','Six million tons of icy terror!','Avalanche',166680,1.8903,3.571,'F2kYCdgX3zE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7436,_binary '\0','/A7FKjE6jZyCnQRd4bOo7Yo0czLh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077191',5.8,1439,'it','Avere vent\'anni','Lia and Tina are two beautiful girls who meet and realize that they have a lot in common. They are both young, beautiful and pissed off, so they decide to hitchhike their way to Rome to find Nazariota\'s commune, a place to stay for free and have all the sex they want... or so they think. Things don\'t go as they have planned though, and soon they become involved in prostitution, the police and an aggressive gang.','/6QXcWnq8Ln0uypX9y1e3r1wEpF.jpg','1978-07-14',94,'Released',NULL,'To Be Twenty',55685,4.237,5.811,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7437,_binary '\0','/9c08OiyAJLQeoEoBEJ5BKFpXUsa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077199',3.7,3430,'en','The Bad News Bears Go to Japan','A small time promotor/hustler takes the pint-sized baseball team to Japan for a match against the country\'s best little league baseball team which sparks off a series of adventures and mishaps the boys come into.','/4NNRDDMCZAI4UEgcQPUqRD147cw.jpg','1978-06-30',92,'Released','They never met an adult they couldn\'t drive crazy.','The Bad News Bears Go to Japan',66946,1.7041,4.8,'A0yYfVYACrw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7438,_binary '\0','/aMUK0xevL0xTs8iKPAmErOLzneG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077204',6.9,2478,'fr','Lucky Luke: La Ballade des Dalton','The Dalton brothers are to receive their dead uncle\'s fortune if they eliminate the judge and jury responsible for his execution. And to accomplish this task, they must enlist the help of Lucky Luke.','/9clh0TPInNtDjnBYdbTxsOf64Ga.jpg','1978-03-10',82,'Released',NULL,'Lucky Luke: The Ballad of the Daltons',50166,2.8584,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7439,_binary '\0','/dVeKQzSpywVjktNB7YOdlXIjGzW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077210',4.1,1377,'en','Barracuda','Little coastal town is being terrorized by deadly Barracudas.','/razrwhyLx7Nx1CWRCUayyeQQ2sI.jpg','1978-10-16',98,'Released','You Can Almost Hear The Screams! as the water below becomes a CHURNING DEATHBED of FLASHING TEARING TEETH!','Barracuda',29957,1.2539,4.2,'HKcJtI-bu_Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7440,_binary '\0','/x33UTt4p91QBiGXwQ848rdFwH3v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077215',6.8,11870,'en','Battlestar Galactica','After the destruction of the Twelve Colonies of Mankind, the last major fighter carrier leads a makeshift fugitive fleet in a desperate search for the legendary planet Earth.','/96ETJEnHoVuptkCNMtxcEZ5iWzN.jpg','1978-10-25',122,'Released','A billion light years from Earth, the human race is fighting for survival.','Battlestar Galactica',148980,4.0311,6.9,'eZUHkZPK1AY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7441,_binary '\0','/lMq94SKSVA5iVER3u1cMY2uHwR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077222',8,2723,'ru','Белый Бим Чёрное ухо','A touching story about a white Gordon Setter with black ear, who became homeless because of his master\'s illness. His master, Ivan Ivanovich, a man far from being young, fond of hunting and nature, took a puppy to live with him, despite the dog\'s black ear being a \"shame of nature\" to his breed. The man always took his dog, whom he called Bim or Bimka, to hunting in country. Later, however Ivan Ivanovich began to have problems with heart and when the disease became worse was taken to a hospital. His dog couldn\'t bear waiting for the only person that ever cared for him and set out to find his master. Thus began the story of a homeless dog and his many breathtaking and exciting adventures, encounters of many people, kind and evil, and leads to an unexpected and heart-rending end.','/kFjELtk4O7hPeLpmUqKBerh18zQ.jpg','1977-09-15',182,'Released',NULL,'White Bim Black Ear',63899,1.5618,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7442,_binary '\0','/xTVFHh3A4TUXFeG213ejMI0iFnU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077228',5.3,1957,'en','The Betsy','Ruthless patriarch Loren hires racecar driver Angelo to build a more efficient vehicle against the wishes of his grandson. But things get even messier when Angelo romances two women in Loren\'s life -- his great-granddaughter and his grandson\'s mistress.','/gK8kTSDTV8JIca8m00pHi3a2bml.jpg','1978-02-02',125,'Released','The Harold Robbins people. What you dream...they do!','The Betsy',58628,2.8069,4.8,'8kNoviKFWBA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7443,_binary '\0','/f5QGIzd7A1yIEXTgQ3dkmvZZfwA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077233',6.4,2632,'en','The Big Fix','Private detective Moses Wine is hired by his former college girlfriend to investigate a political smear campaign and he sets out to find out who is responsible, with deadly results.','/maTu2lDmlrFwM1hS1tPYYXsHT6N.jpg','1978-10-06',108,'Released','Moses Wine, private detective...so go figure.','The Big Fix',42213,2.2822,5.857,'0o1lkRk_70o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7444,_binary '\0','/chKtE0MHc86s6nnUGiWEweO53vY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077234',5.8,6221,'en','The Big Sleep','Private eye Philip Marlowe investigates a case of blackmail involving the two wild daughters of a rich general, a pornographer and a gangster.','/moBuoPdT2ow7OVkzibWJcrGnkOX.jpg','1978-03-13',100,'Released','Meet Philip Marlowe. The toughest private eye who ever wore a trench coat, slapped a dame and split his knuckles on a jawbone.','The Big Sleep',1815,2.7187,5.8,'F7XjeHylJwc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7445,_binary '\0','/e20kROlZYqo2OAewVgdoTn5bNef.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077235',7.1,8176,'en','Big Wednesday','Three 1960s California surfers fool around, drift apart and reunite years later to ride epic waves.','/zMOZoNszmmlf3jUivDUEFgCrReo.jpg','1978-05-26',120,'Released','A day will come that is like no other... and nothing that happens after will ever be the same.','Big Wednesday',18387,3.1929,6.942,'-iP4bAuD4NM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7446,_binary '\0','/1BNv6MqZw5wFoblckm4fydIbmoR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077247',4.7,6750,'en','Blood Sucking Freaks','Sardu, master of the Theatre of the Macabre, and his assistant Ralphus run a show in which, under the guise of \'magic\', they torture and murder people in front of their audience. But what the punters see as a trick is actually real.','/sRFWfces1Aa2yPRzDt4NVuYrysQ.jpg','1976-11-03',88,'Released','Join The Fun! Human Dart Boards! \"Home Style Brain Surgery\" Dental Hijinks!','Blood Sucking Freaks',34023,2.6968,4.866,'_4Lj8sHhQo0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7447,_binary '\0','/rLA4Dr4r9JNcc43OLNwMGy1cnFB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077248',7.5,12314,'en','Blue Collar','Fed up with mistreatment at the hands of both management and union brass, and coupled with financial hardships on each man\'s end, three auto assembly line workers hatch a plan to rob a safe at union headquarters.','/7WBBcgzESyX1qEq9x7tg22dlORL.jpg','1978-02-10',114,'Released','\"Blue Collar\" is the American Dream. If you\'re rich, you can buy it. If you\'re anything else, you gotta fight for it.','Blue Collar',14839,2.8941,7.3,'6DZ2xabwETI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7448,_binary '\0','/3sjEoFwtHHlX6kdqJ8ZAUvt3kq6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077269',7,34334,'en','The Boys from Brazil','Nazi hunter Ezra Lieberman discovers a sinister and bizarre plot, masterminded by Dr. Josef Mengele, to rekindle the Third Reich.','/w7IZT1HJNmWcEj3Axwlwhya02OX.jpg','1978-10-05',125,'Released','If they survive… will we?','The Boys from Brazil',16241,4.6621,6.725,'MYC8kiHhL2c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7449,_binary '\0','/yTXnmh0kyWHzgfuwkQ3Vvm4ZmCn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077270',6.9,3933,'en','The Boys in Company C','Disheartened by futile combat, appalled by the corruption of their South Vietnamese ally, and constantly endangered by the incompetence of their own company commander, the young men find a possible way out of the war. They are told that if they purposely lose a soccer game against a South Vietnamese team, they can spend the rest of their tour playing exhibition games behind the lines.','/9nZyHahR2yrXgkha9IrbAGr3Yni.jpg','1978-02-02',125,'Released','To keep their sanity in an insane war, they had to be crazy.','The Boys in Company C',27521,2.2932,6.5,'hL2kBrg1orE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7450,_binary '\0','/a47hFXBVikioXVg1PrBXxlp6YlK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077272',6,1617,'en','Brass Target','General George S. Patton died in a car accident in 1945. But was his death actually a murder. Is he targeted by Nazis angered by Germany\'s defeat? Or by Russians who knew that Patton had argued in favor of invading the Soviet Union towards the end of the war? Or is it because Patton is investigating the theft of a quarter of a billion dollars of Nazi gold? Or is it because his subordinate Colonels - the flamboyantly gay Colonel and his worried lover are fearful that he is getting too close to discovering the truth.','/uhzqZFiJ0HF3aeSgIqufkpmAf1m.jpg','1978-12-22',111,'Released','The Nazis hid it. The Russians want it. The Americans stole it. General George S. Patton may die for it.','Brass Target',72412,2.2253,5.4,'ABbjHHOS6iQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7451,_binary '\0','/ct19JBp6sEnJxs78GjpWLgYuRi9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077275',6.5,3946,'en','The Brink\'s Job','In 1950, a group of unlikely criminal masterminds commits the robbery of the century. Led by Tony Pino, a petty thief fresh out of prison, and Joe McGinnis, who specializes in planning lucrative capers, the gang robs Brink\'s main office in Boston of more than $2 million. However, things begin to go awry when the FBI gets involved, the cops start cracking down on the gang and McGinnis refuses to hand over the loot...','/zXWJuGw8pFY0bWEE7dZ4Oz9qWS.jpg','1978-12-08',104,'Released','The robbery nobody thought could happen by the guys nobody thought could pull it off.','The Brink\'s Job',24429,3.0186,6.205,'m_Ig6Qb5c3I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7452,_binary '\0','/tf2mugFR3vWCuuUQt2hYRfr73vj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077276',6.7,8684,'fr','Les Bronzés','Holidaymakers arriving in a Club Med camp on the Ivory Coast are determined to forget their everyday problems and emotional disappointments. Games, competitions, outings, bathing and sunburn accompany a continual succession of casual affairs.','/cj82wH8irxpCijTQWIASfYkQylw.jpg','1978-11-11',105,'Released',NULL,'French Fried Vacation',11183,3.3277,6.6,'h74i8AGyWIM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7453,_binary '\0','/7lKSjFPFyTiigyJzfT70ILH7flc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077278',6.5,7797,'en','Buck Rogers in the 25th Century','Capt. William \"Buck\" Rogers is a jovial space cowboy who is accidentally time-warped from 1987 to 2491. Earth is engaged in interplanetary war following a global holocaust, and Buck\'s piloting skills make him an ideal starfighter recruit for the Earth Defense Directorate.','/up1T1QGSSCfoyuCra0Qnv2yItFt.jpg','1979-03-02',89,'Released','The original spaceman!','Buck Rogers in the 25th Century',3786,2.5696,6.171,'AkV6HK9jpz4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7454,_binary '\0','/tdpHGUxipEmJZvtEmTCcmpE2HMp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077280',7.2,11008,'en','The Buddy Holly Story','A chronicle of the rise and brief career of rock \'n\' roll star Buddy Holly, who aspires to play music the way he wants it to sound. Holly and his band, the Crickets, are first invited to record in Nashville, where they encounter creative differences with the producing staff. Later they play a major booking at the Apollo Theater, scheduled there under the mistaken assumption that they\'re a black band. Holly\'s career eventually goes solo -- until the tragic day the music dies.','/4Zu9YdN5O4jnXJmqBMHckkKpJ2S.jpg','1978-05-18',114,'Released','His story will have you singing, laughing, crying, cheering, and stomping your feet','The Buddy Holly Story',24153,3.2798,7.154,'FSzLTG5qkj4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7455,_binary '\0','/xkrLPXpDBwzKW0jzbUEzqnnusLb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077288',7.2,13317,'fr','La Cage aux folles','Two gay men living in St. Tropez have their lives turned upside down when the son of one of the men announces he is getting married. They try to conceal their lifestyle and their ownership of the drag club downstairs when the fiancée and her parents come for dinner.','/oMz9BUs3qIAx5UAO5BLiufzVwrr.jpg','1978-10-20',92,'Released',NULL,'La Cage aux Folles',4484,5.4392,6.8,'MKZkZr_ke_o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7456,_binary '\0','/blEloSAWpCRamzP0ezJaeSYCc2m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077289',6.2,9212,'en','California Suite','The misadventures of four groups of guests at the Beverly Hills Hotel.','/2IlgL7m1ByY3RIghbXNGGNvYfEE.jpg','1978-03-19',103,'Released','The best two-hour vacation in town!','California Suite',26686,3.7785,5.867,'-JB1S3hGhdM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7457,_binary '\0','/4i6Yljr0xsCGuwIUkTjGANc4HMQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077292',7.3,3500,'zh','残缺','A group of martial artists seek revenge after being crippled by Tu Tin-To, a martial arts master, and his son.','/eKdvNCKtiuUFvwCXtpwISw8jqZ5.jpg','1978-12-21',106,'Released','Where the better man stays alive!','Crippled Avengers',40081,2.5671,6.8,'qJdww5ck-TI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7458,_binary '\0','/d4qAHbs8wLBnRatYCPvtp3F48bO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077294',6.8,27619,'en','Capricorn One','In order to protect the reputation of the American space program, a team of NASA administrators turn the first Mars mission into a phony Mars landing. Under threat of harm to their families the astronauts play their part in the deception on a staged set in a deserted military base. But once the real ship returns to Earth and burns up on re-entry, the astronauts become liabilities. Now, with the help of a crusading reporter, they must battle a sinister conspiracy that will stop at nothing to keep the truth hidden.','/bxsCARg2rxQ2PzFW5ZsADLT9e9c.jpg','1977-12-10',123,'Released','The mission was a sham. The murders were real.','Capricorn One',11935,6.0775,6.8,'No6gBqauUMg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7459,_binary '\0','/xgUCwVn2wUDPPVBQbh4zBjm54e7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077295',6.4,1730,'fr','La Carapate','The lawyer is visiting a prison to meet with a violent criminal who has been condemned to death. During the visit, things turn bad, there is a riot where prisoners escape and the criminal escapes taking a lawyer hostage.','/tp9GLhiH4oelQAnVRm9EQFwPxrY.jpg','1978-10-10',100,'Released',NULL,'Out of It',61864,1.7746,6.561,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7460,_binary '\0','/lEEd6ffEH1D0M06W9k5tWDcadPR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077300',3.2,2356,'en','Carry On Emmannuelle','The beautiful and sex-starved Emmannuelle Prevert just cannot inflame her husband\'s ardour. In frustration she seduces a string of VIPs, including the Prime Minister and the American Ambassador. A jealous lover gives a list of all her conquests to the national press and a scandal ensues. But will she ever manage to get her own husband into bed?','/7rqbcS8SVPDI50JfhyeV5J0tFWx.jpg','1978-10-12',88,'Released',NULL,'Carry On Emmannuelle',34743,1.5731,3.9,'0hrKelipOYE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7461,_binary '\0','/yJZnQdnzNfUnzBPnq7Qw3yZCCbw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077304',5.6,1961,'en','The Cat and the Canary','A group of potential heirs gather in a forbidding old house to learn which of them will inherit a fortune. Later, they learn that a flesh-rending maniac is loose.','/pY7hFTUZ2hdO2fzpGILQoj06R8J.jpg','1978-11-01',98,'Released','For God\'s Sake, Stay in Your Rooms and Lock the Doors!','The Cat and the Canary',86182,1.8539,5.7,'NSvfNZtR8ds','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7462,_binary '\0','/wrtByjLIqkTFlChOMFPxYfmnJzC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077305',6,6813,'en','The Cat from Outer Space','A UFO is stranded on earth and impounded by the US government. Its pilot, a cat with a collar that gives it special powers, including the ability to communicate with humans, has eluded the authorities and seeks the help of a scientist in order to reclaim and repair his ship and get back home.','/jspJBPlYGuMlwLbSSo0hdgfbnY0.jpg','1978-06-09',104,'Released','A close encounter of the \'furred\' kind!','The Cat from Outer Space',19378,3.6976,6,'iv3yDQ83Jcc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7463,_binary '\0','/x3JHGnvJgffqnsfR18hlSE9XX5g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077309',6.6,1344,'fr','Ceddo','The Ceddo people try to preserve their traditional African culture against the onslaught of Islam, Christianity, and the slave trade. When King Demba War sides with the Muslims, the Ceddo kidnap his daughter, Princess Dior Yacine, to protest their forcible conversion to Islam.','/etYZJDjlFDFWEl57RiurNUiqwXV.jpg','1978-02-16',117,'Released',NULL,'Ceddo',97029,1.6192,6.658,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7464,_binary '\0','/vTG5rpUcNGl28iKsf6Pd3G312pp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077315',6.8,3556,'fr','La Chambre verte','A widower maintains a memorial room filled with his late wife\'s belongings. When fire destroys it, he transforms a chapel into a new shrine to preserve her memory.','/8D2Oty3FpihcNoNowuYbzOaXKsv.jpg','1978-04-05',95,'Released',NULL,'The Green Room',8070,1.7819,6.66,'J0GZVGbX3cQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7465,_binary '\0','/l8iQQU2EvxTemHWGmS7mLfolNDx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077318',7.3,2862,'en','The Chant of Jimmie Blacksmith','The true story of a part Aboriginal man who finds the pressure of adapting to white culture intolerable, and as a result snaps in a violent and horrific manner.','/rbyEtX16Tk58WMeii5rVEfB1OUm.jpg','1978-06-21',113,'Released','The chant of the underdog','The Chant of Jimmie Blacksmith',69069,1.6605,6.7,'hXuX-UwHKwI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7466,_binary '\0','/r5xE5fYiRfTg4tipG9eMrPBgpuV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077319',5.6,1228,'it','Charleston','Charleston is a 1977 Italian comedy film written and directed by Marcello Fondato. It reprises the style of the film The Sting.','/5S8Uygm5hRbMQuQ9w5DE9CF11BU.jpg','1977-03-05',93,'Released',NULL,'Charleston',46448,3.6719,5.7,'Hr015ypFmrg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7467,_binary '\0','/rVwsqRYQk3pz4irrqaOQcLTTKlM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077321',6.4,6543,'en','The Cheap Detective','A spoof of the entire 1940s detective genre. San Francisco private detective, Lou Pekinpaugh is accused of murdering his partner at the instigation of his mistress—his partner\'s wife.','/7poVN0zQuxCIorAR9N6JDJN0dGG.jpg','1978-06-23',92,'Released','He knows every cheap trick, cheap joke, cheap shot and cheap dame in the book.','The Cheap Detective',14584,3.507,6.355,'6OKbUnfU6Zs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7468,_binary '\0','/vTw5cU2Rym7kJSwElLEg0GauYRs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077327',6.1,1652,'it','Amore, piombo e furore','Gunslinger Clayton Drumm is about to be hanged when he is given a chance to live if he agrees to murder Matthew, a miner who has steadfastly refused to sell his land to the railroad company. Matthew’s refusal is a major obstacle to the railroad’s plans for expansion.','/uPLXVL9cvMI29McjLnBcldZizeJ.jpg','1978-08-04',105,'Released','The deadliest crossroad.','China 9, Liberty 37',22396,2.4293,5.4,'PGUs-QlFZiU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7469,_binary '\0','/tyyUgKhC07R8uEUaGIdVhS12eZH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077328',4.7,1508,'en','Spider-Man: The Dragon\'s Challenge','Spider-Man goes to China to help an official accused of World War II treachery. Two episodes of the TV series \"Spider Man\" edited together and released as a feature.','/wBmtFmSikG5u08FdGLRsF0Py59V.jpg','1980-12-05',92,'Released','The amazing super hero battles the masters of Kung-Fu.','Spider-Man: The Dragon\'s Challenge',225938,3.2152,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7470,_binary '\0','/TxQYAagBd3iXgcNWOFyDMbwql9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077332',5.5,1971,'en','Holocaust 2000','An executive in charge of a nuclear power plant in the Mid-East must stop his son-- who turns out to be the Anti Christ -- from blowing it up.','/leolSyDotDFWoaZ5xmmVrz0VUyD.jpg','1977-11-25',106,'Released','He will destroy the world. No man can stop him. No man will even try. He is The Chosen.','Holocaust 2000',46158,1.7642,5.8,'BUV9WTxJmBg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7471,_binary '\0','/oKl2qVFihZj2ZXxBXRNCmPV0tFl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077350',7.5,2166,'pl','Co mi zrobisz, jak mnie złapiesz','Tadeusz Krzakoski, the director of a failing state-owned company, is married with problems. His mistress, the daughter of a Communist party bigwig, says she\'s pregnant and Tadeusz knows he\'ll have to marry her to save his reputation and his job. But divorce is never simple and Bareja\'s screwball comedies are never boring.','/f88wQblaJrFL37CHPRAevf2AInS.jpg','1978-12-08',99,'Released',NULL,'What Will You Do When You Catch Me?',52920,1.226,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7472,_binary '\0','/vU6ZnOUcuP4RgB5esrWinzxWZUW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077355',6.9,23189,'en','Coma','When relatively healthy patients begin having \'complications\' during simple operations and ending up in comas, a concerned doctor defies her male superiors when she suspects a secret plot.','/kNMfXPm1f8OgVYFU4aEhmP9TJzO.jpg','1978-01-06',113,'Released','Imagine your life hangs by a thread. Imagine your body hangs by a wire. Imagine you\'re not imagining.','Coma',11223,5.0562,6.761,'YdfydKaw6ho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7473,_binary '\0','/6xAtxr27vW8M0Vbniv6klS3ke1R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077357',5.7,1617,'en','The Comeback','A singer holes up at a sinister estate to write new songs for his act. His ex-wife is brutally murdered, and the killer may be stalking him next.','/iEt3xNDng7mYhIMGWdkJxrVFkx3.jpg','1978-06-16',100,'Released','Millions loved him, could someone hate him enough to kill and kill again?','The Comeback',106682,2.2094,5.8,'lhdFiw-tOCU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7474,_binary '\0','/uuEF8CfsfhOgy21t1nAEGObJPBN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077360',6.3,4128,'en','Comes a Horseman','Ella Connors is a single woman who gets pressured to sell her failing cattle farm to her corrupt ex-suitor, Jacob Ewing. She asks for help from her neighbor, Frank Athearn. As Ella and Frank fight back through stampedes, jealousy, betrayal, and sabotage... they eventually find love.','/yAB1AmZWkHitsE2q7nLtrjuQe2k.jpg','1978-10-25',118,'Released','She was as strong as the land for which she fought. And as vulnerable.','Comes a Horseman',42201,3.0756,6.12,'i9mdQJpwIH0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7475,_binary '\0','/qhv8bDsB2U1C6R4DAntuAfelOiE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077362',7.3,16116,'en','Coming Home','In 1968 California, a Marine officer\'s wife falls in love with a former high school classmate who suffered a paralyzing combat injury in the war.','/jBsYWNBYNEi5EhT1hC8iexcTsWT.jpg','1978-02-15',127,'Released','A man who believed in war! A man who believed in nothing! And a woman who believed in both of them!','Coming Home',31657,3.5424,7,'8sSdLNcmsBs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7476,_binary '\0','/1AvdIZYSzPXgiDWIPldnja4awla.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077369',6.3,21165,'en','Convoy','Trucker Rubber Duck and his buddies Pig Pen, Widow Woman and Spider Mike use their CB radios to warn one another of the presence of cops. But conniving Sheriff Wallace is hip to the truckers\' tactics, and begins tricking the drivers through his own CB broadcasts. Facing constant harassment from the law, Rubber Duck and his pals use their radios to coordinate a vast convoy and rule the road.','/xjowoBInlikSlvfAYDRN9ubaODB.jpg','1978-06-27',112,'Released','Ain\'t nothin\' gonna get in their way!','Convoy',9584,6.0987,6.3,'BNYk9hMdvIo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7477,_binary '\0','/6GJUmjaD85VxdYnhUKHKzOaIfJc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077372',5.7,4351,'en','Corvette Summer','Ken loves to design and build exotic cars. When the High School shop class project car, a fully tricked out dream Corvette, is stolen, he begins searching for it. His search leads him to Las Vegas, where Vanessa, a teenaged prostitute wannabe, helps him try to track it down.','/v51WPMJQR5aZidDlLeyUOJDtICv.jpg','1978-0