s empire — and the world.','/nZBPvfAgy0GBTEw9YxAuWhoPj96.jpg','1978-06-09',107,'Released','The first time was only a warning.','Damien - Omen II',10766,6.3243,6.402,'57SQ9bDhxDY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7482,_binary '\0','/9OKzKuCfcMwpHVp56pjNI7J4xXR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077402',7.8,137592,'en','Dawn of the Dead','During an ever-growing epidemic of zombies that have risen from the dead, two Philadelphia SWAT team members, a traffic reporter, and his television-executive girlfriend seek refuge in a secluded shopping mall.','/70MY8H0bLMvXf8ED2SgVMPhDVVM.jpg','1978-09-02',127,'Released','When there’s no more room in HELL, the dead will walk the EARTH!','Dawn of the Dead',923,9.1738,7.481,'Y_EviQj5tvA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7483,_binary '\0','/zUqIL6H6d44se9ZOsfvvCuOsbap.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077405',7.7,69988,'en','Days of Heaven','In 1916, a Chicago steel worker accidentally kills his supervisor and flees to the Texas panhandle with his girlfriend and little sister to work harvesting wheat in the fields of a stoic farmer.','/rwxTYjOZmX2rGhz7avLe1qsjNqe.jpg','1978-09-13',94,'Released','She gave her hand to one man, but her heart to another.','Days of Heaven',16642,5.5962,7.5,'7LAqRFoT97o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7484,_binary '\0','/esdhJI8DcJuRJooQ7pAtK2ekNqE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077413',7.3,45161,'en','Death on the Nile','As Hercule Poirot enjoys a luxurious cruise down the Nile, a newlywed heiress is found murdered on board and every elegant passenger becomes a prime suspect.','/7qEymSp6wCT19AJxb7T3u6aKpi1.jpg','1978-09-29',140,'Released','A murderer strikes on board the luxury Nile steamer Karnak – and Hercule Poirot faces his most baffling case.','Death on the Nile',4192,8.9542,7.2,'_zEfPyO14J4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7485,_binary '\0','/uYx0Hu1SOiOUKMkQlj9tdAa5mnU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077414',4.1,2874,'en','Deathsport','1000 years into the future, after the Great Neutron Wars, the world is divided into desert wastelands and isolated city-states. Notorious \"Desert Ranger\" Kaz is forced to fight in the DeathSport, dueling on futuristic motorcycle \"Death Machines\". With the help of renegade vixen Deneer, Kaz must face his past and fight to save himself and his people.','/9UzEUTGfVftDWMqOnpepujv3VRn.jpg','1978-04-01',82,'Released','DeathSport isn\'t just a game. In the year 3000, it\'s the only way to survive!','Deathsport',28735,1.7125,4,'uL4dlyVJn9o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7486,_binary '','/6Ogsgg1Nf9b7TadOIpYB6YNdMt6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077415',5.8,3151,'en','Debbie Does Dallas','Debbie Benton is the captain of her high school cheerleading squad, and has been accepted to try out for the Texas Cowgirls. Her parents disapprove, though, and refuse to pay the fare to Texas. In a bid to help Debbie, her cheerleader friends Lisa, Roberta, Tammy, Pat, and Annie decide to accompany her to Texas. They have two weeks to raise the money, and swear off any sexual activity with their boyfriends and form a company, called \"Teen Services\", offering help.','/1OuS7AbbJ6IU225DtbcCWwZNL4G.jpg','1978-11-19',80,'Released','Everyone on the team scores when her pom-poms fly!','Debbie Does Dallas',188412,0,6.4,'Svfq2BqiHns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7487,_binary '\0','/a5zBQfXmLk3qqRYF7AioWpiAxk2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077416',8.1,389548,'en','The Deer Hunter','Three steelworkers enlist in the army and are sent to Vietnam, one leaving behind a rushed marriage, the others a shared love. What they encounter during the war changes their lives forever.','/bbGtogDZOg09bm42KIpCXUXICkh.jpg','1978-12-08',183,'Released','One of the most important and powerful films of all time!','The Deer Hunter',11778,14.2866,7.96,'g7q1SjVdsNk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7488,_binary '\0','/b0sO5XyhuqbdPvSpFxmz81IsCNR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077421',6.9,3018,'en','Despair','Berlin, 1930, during the rise of Nazism. Hermann Hermann, a Russian emigrant and chocolate manufacturer, married to the capricious Lydia, loses his temper more and more every day when dealing with his workers and other businessmen; until he meets Felix, a vagrant, who seems to be physically identical to him; a disconcerting fact that leads Hermann Hermann to plot a particular way out of a fake world he actually hates.','/4Mw8gaRsctMEHPkjsYM5d1RkGOe.jpg','1978-09-20',117,'Released','A hysterical comedy','Despair',42203,2.0119,6.5,'zFx8uptm37w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7489,_binary '\0','/3vZiAjtpiUiupoi96PYANpqIo7u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077427',6.8,1504,'de','Deutschland im Herbst','Nine fictitious documentaries and films reflect the mood of late 1970s Germany, particularly the two-month period in 1977 when a businessman was kidnapped by the RAF (Red Army Faction). The kidnap had been made to orchestrate the release of the original leaders of the RAF, aka the Baader-Meinhof.','/c647fe1s7gpjaHYY5ccl54K7mFA.jpg','1978-03-03',123,'Released',NULL,'Germany in Autumn',12578,1.8153,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7490,_binary '\0','/lsMblfXdmjm0CvtermqE9SfC4iY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077429',5.3,1722,'en','Devil Dog: The Hound of Hell','A canine minion of Satan terrorizes an unsuspecting suburban family.','/yaEEwdekGIciimxTmvVoybP9gAj.jpg','1978-10-31',95,'Released','Man\'s best friend... or the devil\'s spawn?','Devil Dog: The Hound of Hell',26702,2.4263,6.3,'YSAmUDlUUhQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7491,_binary '\0','/eatwiqv4vAwUqXdWd0tDfNBPC8K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077450',5.5,1414,'en','Dominique','The wife of a greedy man comes back to haunt him after he scares her to death.','/ltH05JELqFQ6ovN49B6m8Mwd5wU.jpg','1980-03-06',95,'Released','A story of the macabre... with a different twist.','Dominique',182117,1.4192,4.9,'j9kPcI21HFU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7492,_binary '\0','/1jMZUfDCLY3ytKlziU88jqe9KLK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077451',7.7,13610,'hi','डॉन','A ruthless gangster named Don is killed during a scuffle with the police. Since only DSP D\'Silva knows of this incident, he recruits Vijay, who is a spitting image of Don, to replace the original Don and infiltrate his gang. D\'Silva plans to nab the entire gang, but when he dies during a raid, the secret that Vijay is not Don is also buried with him.','/cLxX1pmZitRXGdxtmbLuPBq53Y9.jpg','1978-05-12',166,'Released',NULL,'Don',33104,1.6184,6.594,'znzNyRVXl2I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7493,_binary '\0','/bWsG4JAMerJmSb0MbTB2eQUpi58.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077452',6.9,4188,'pt','Dona Flor e Seus Dois Maridos','After the death of her handsome but good-for-nothing husband Vadinho, Flor, a widow, marries Dr. Teodoro, a respectable gentleman. Hilarity ensues when Vadinho\'s spirit returns into her life.','/jTkw5nnrYT0KpAAEm0wNdgQ7Bu3.jpg','1976-11-22',117,'Released','Dona Flor had two happy marriages. One was made in heaven.','Dona Flor and Her Two Husbands',42234,3.005,6.797,'GGDMXJgl8I0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7494,_binary '\0','/6iEel19duDJBH2DMCnywJ19LW8X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077469',5,2461,'en','Dr. Strange','A psychiatrist becomes the new Sorcerer Supreme of the Earth in order to battle an evil Sorceress from the past.','/hEyHVgBE28Jl13h2Qpbr3LH77sP.jpg','1978-09-06',93,'Released','Battle of the sorcerers burns the screen with electric flame','Dr. Strange',50468,2.2341,6,'u4SWirU14p0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7495,_binary '\0','/yga88rASy0eNTxjDUN87xtN9HJR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077470',4.5,1822,'en','Dracula\'s Dog','A Romanian vampire-hunter tracks Dracula\'s servant to Los Angeles, home of the last of his line.','/1QyGRki97G0Em458oZkaqfD6heW.jpg','1977-05-08',90,'Released','There\'s More To The Legend Than Meets… The Throat!','Zoltan… Hound of Dracula',26703,2.007,4.8,'-x8ao63ulfQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7496,_binary '\0','/qJiaKFJ25vElTeDgxOyU7QU5nGZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077474',7.1,22025,'en','The Driver','The Driver specializes in driving getaway cars for robberies. His exceptional talent has prevented him from being caught yet. After another successful flight from the police a self-assured detective makes it his primary goal to catch the Driver. He promises pardons to a gang if they help to convict him in a set-up robbery. The Driver seeks help from The Player to mislead the detective.','/zSpk2OH4MCgLGB06XDv4YUfBTv6.jpg','1978-06-08',91,'Released','To break the driver, the cop was willing to break the law.','The Driver',2153,5.3089,7.2,'K9HIFF8_26M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7497,_binary '\0','/gP1gBa01NNvqmehpxHuZqySxWIq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077482',7,2818,'it','Ecce bombo','Four friends, former 1968 student protesters who have checked out of politics and struggle to come to terms with the present, try self-criticism to figure out what to do with themselves, only to end up doing what they do best: sinking into endless talk without ever reaching a conclusion.','/c7t4aNyvRkLFVAE4XiPiY2U6RpP.jpg','1978-03-08',103,'Released',NULL,'Ecce Bombo',48282,1.3698,7.369,'asmOOr15rB0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7498,_binary '\0','/sKhgptv9H7muJF7dBDfdMot7yQE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077497',4,2418,'fr','Goodbye Emmanuelle','Emmanuelle and her architect husband continue their amoral lifestyle in the Seychelles. But when a casual dilliance between her and a film director starts to turn serious her husband shows very traditional signs of jealousy.','/6TMvJX8PHS6672JI9R5YuCllGB6.jpg','1977-10-14',100,'Released','The ecstasy continues','Emmanuelle 3',39412,5.1326,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7499,_binary '\0','/9p93IMBLEtKukXblsNKlMe3m97V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077504',6.1,4925,'en','The End','Wendell Lawson has only six months to live. Not wanting to endure his last few months of life waiting for the end, he decides to take matters into his own hands and enlists the help of a delusional mental patient to help him commit suicide.','/aFbxahzgLzJz7i70zcCzzmydwwL.jpg','1978-05-10',100,'Released','Are there laughs before death?','The End',35976,2.0123,5.637,'R0uyJ0fjS5Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7500,_binary '\0','/jkM6Vsnl4WjPLBjz4do5oZnyEfA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077523',6.3,31584,'en','Every Which Way but Loose','Philo Beddoe is your regular, easygoing, truck-driving guy. He\'s also the best bar-room brawler west of the Rockies. And he lives with a 165-pound orangutan named Clyde. Like other guys, Philo finally falls in love - with a flighty singer who leads him on a screwball chase across the American Southwest. Nothing\'s in the way except a motorcycle gang, some cops, and legendary brawler Tank Murdock.','/vcSfAskDGCgInfJAXwLLORPQLAO.jpg','1978-12-16',110,'Released','Clint Eastwood will turn you Every Which Way But Loose','Every Which Way but Loose',15417,5.9217,6.1,'pKEP4yQxvOA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7501,_binary '\0','/woXXOudHWLk70klkhDRW33SNFpZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077524',5.6,3664,'en','The Evil','Shortly after moving into a dark, brooding mansion, a psychologist and his co-workers are terrorized by a horrible evil being.','/LmdVqM8DrCZmcghCyPZDHLI1Xm.jpg','1978-05-05',89,'Released','Escape is just a nerve-shredding scream for salvation!','The Evil',44698,2.3495,5.8,'OpnZwRIike0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7502,_binary '\0','/r9iKfHI18XDlJiG7HBRq8sR4ffC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077530',6.2,13765,'en','Eyes of Laura Mars','A famous fashion photographer develops a disturbing ability to see through the eyes of a serial killer.','/b6njtFr9IkmJGzwCkZWpDIYI1oC.jpg','1978-08-02',104,'Released','She saw life through the camera’s eye. Then suddenly she saw death.','Eyes of Laura Mars',29143,3.8364,5.8,'KZEy46kUbzc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7503,_binary '\0','/soryIIVwUFTtD13eS41vfFBxjj9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077531',6.4,9472,'en','F.I.S.T.','Johnny Kovak joins the Teamsters trade-union in a local chapter in the 1930s and works his way up in the organization. As he climbs higher and higher his methods become more ruthless and finally senator Madison starts a campaign to find the truth about the alleged connections with the Mob.','/yiqQHB0vZg9O6z7VvAefV3fSPqX.jpg','1978-04-26',145,'Released','A story about a man, the woman he loved, and the men he fought for.','F.I.S.T.',28932,3.7817,6.5,'rAndBxYrTBE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7504,_binary '\0','/xdfugns0rC3ynRrhGdTBlY5rvw4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077532',6.3,1411,'en','FM','When a liberal music station\'s owners decide to introduce army recruitment ads, despite the protests of its manager, the rebellious DJs are determined to fight back, no matter the cost.','/zp8PLcseuX2z7VAtMrxjF0VmJiz.jpg','1978-04-28',104,'Released','A now story with now music!','FM',42204,1.4758,6.8,'5fah36O91cM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7505,_binary '\0','/lgWat1xjBURVHF8a7OOrOcyCzN1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077533',4.3,9725,'en','Faces of Death','A collection of death scenes, ranging from TV material to homemade super 8 movies.','/fhHzqDrdHLqjawXLXoV3w4FDOUd.jpg','1978-11-10',109,'Released','Experience the graphic reality of DEATH, close-up...','Faces of Death',12237,3.3389,4.6,'TXH7T74xdIQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7506,_binary '\0','/5j1ezbq2yJIilKRNL9W5z5ha5nR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077539',6.8,5972,'en','Fedora','Down-on-his-luck Hollywood producer Barry \'Dutch\' Detweiler attempts to lure Fedora, a famous but reclusive film actress, out of retirement, only to discover the horrifying truth behind her success.','/ArU150uZXJ9IVa5puxZKotw54DP.jpg','1978-06-29',109,'Released','Youth had been a habit of hers for so long that she could not part with it.','Fedora',54000,3.3806,6.678,'gCdWnm663X0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7507,_binary '\0','/lm3DePEC4aVHW0ocOunlY3vhu7S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077549',6.7,3146,'en','Fingers','A wanna-be concert pianist spends his days making a living by collecting debts for his Mafioso father, a lifestyle that could eventually ruin his dreams of a musical career.','/rcI2LUrK4SNY4JGMyjsWuNlLxGn.jpg','1978-03-02',90,'Released','Some will love it. Others will be angered by it. Everyone will be stunned by it!','Fingers',63435,2.0808,6.2,'d68Xf7YuUOo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7508,_binary '\0','/5kLaqaOeo8GNrImR2zLEpreoQe3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077559',7,8802,'zh','五毒','A dying master sends his last student to check up on five former pupils, who each know a special style of kung-fu.','/z446TqbbOb7emtN1S8iOrwTHz7Y.jpg','1978-08-12',101,'Released','Pick Your Poison!','The Five Venoms',13481,3.0433,6.558,'3aEl8kyCs-4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7509,_binary '\0','/lLTOW7yk8QjOYLrTLCXveTERDf7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077563',6.5,3549,'fr','Flic ou Voyou','When the local police inspector was found dead in a prostitute\'s house, police division commissioner Stan Borowitz is sent to investigate the situation. Posing as the prostitute\'s long-lost brother \"Antonio Cerruti,\" he discovers a mare\'s nest of police corruption. In fact, in this comedy thriller the whole town is corrupt. If they were closely examined, Stan\'s methods for pursuing this investigation might embarrass the police. For instance, he drives into a criminal\'s house in a fancy, expensive race car. In another incident, he callously blows up a casino owned by Musard , one of the town\'s crime bosses. On that occasion, he first forces Musard to remove his clothes, and the poor criminal watches his casino explode from across the square while standing naked in a phone booth. Meanwhile, Stan seduces the lovely Edmonde.','/2D76XBu7Vl4oMzGUsq9H6dfXjQN.jpg','1979-03-28',107,'Released',NULL,'Cop or Hood',40420,2.6027,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7510,_binary '\0','/5HzyoetjiRl3VJ4R6q0jiewGzQZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077572',6.4,21636,'en','Force 10 from Navarone','World War II, 1943. Mallory and Miller, the heroes who destroyed the guns of Navarone, are sent to Yugoslavia in search of a ghost from the past.','/3bFRwivCZuXx7fHWt4SpYaiHkNL.jpg','1978-08-16',114,'Released','Explosive high adventure!','Force 10 from Navarone',17339,5.2513,6.2,'V3gA-Gnm6hQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7511,_binary '\0','/dvIvwj6tZ60do6pCMHQOL6onpqq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077578',6.8,19777,'en','Foul Play','A shy San Francisco librarian and a bumbling cop fall in love as they solve a crime involving albinos, dwarves, and the Catholic Church.','/mk3enoeLNRXRnYGxKcvPXYY1xci.jpg','1978-07-14',116,'Released','It\'s a highly dangerous comedy!!','Foul Play',15659,5.2049,6.3,'CQ3Vz8CV9bo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7512,_binary '\0','/bgTgA6ZckxKMy0oQyEFenxmxdGK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077588',6.3,19263,'en','The Fury','When a devious plot separates CIA agent Peter Sandza from his son, Robin, the distraught father manages to see through the ruse. Taken because of his psychic abilities, Robin is being held by Ben Childress, who is studying people with supernatural powers in hopes of developing their talents as weapons. Soon Peter pairs up with Gillian, a teen who has telekinesis, to find and rescue Robin.','/uez7cenZAh9JORKyPq1AblMbe26.jpg','1978-03-10',118,'Released','An experience in terror and suspense.','The Fury',12611,4.3589,6.285,'bphHHR2aVM0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7513,_binary '\0','/Ae2fAp4SjKVsobi2RTb0Xl8yoY1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077594',5.9,22997,'cn','死亡遊戲','A martial arts movie star must fake his death to find the people who are trying to kill him.','/c6jgLHaQpdIPH1rC94KkjAqgE7O.jpg','1978-03-23',101,'Released','Bruce Lee challenges the underworld to a Game of Death.','Game of Death',13333,9.2155,6.399,'B-G-jRhjCfE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7514,_binary '\0','/2Vp1vuQjHm42F7tByDimMRyfWxM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077597',4.8,1340,'en','Gas Pump Girls','June and her friends take over a service station formerly run by her uncle. They perform every trick in the book to attract the customers.','/zaV4EyPppKu7LKdwEGXGP4uEWJT.jpg','1979-12-01',86,'Released','They give new meaning to the term \"full-service station\"!','Gas Pump Girls',119552,3.944,4.9,'5Surgwgitr0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7515,_binary '\0','/lq0HpBeKNLDJaPDczgAAqSVZL1o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077598',7.3,6700,'en','Gates of Heaven','A showcase of workers in the animal burial industry while dealing with heavier existential questions regarding mortality and the afterlife. Floyd \'Mac\' McClure believes that a graceful burial is as important for pets as it is for people; he chronicles his struggles to keep his niche business afloat, and interviews several of his associates and one of his competitors, the manager of a rendering plant.','/2VGQsyCvd2XJKpKZXHF4AWsADoA.jpg','1978-10-01',83,'Released','Death is for the living and not for the dead so much.','Gates of Heaven',24998,1.3834,6.8,'amwICex2pR4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7516,_binary '\0','/oj9QrJ8BDPZbKLFZ2z9gBr06H9I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077613',7.2,3708,'en','Girlfriends','A photographer and her best friend are roommates. She is stuck with small-change shooting jobs and dreams of success. When her roommate decides to get married and leave, she feels hurt and has to learn how to deal with living alone.','/qoExB0pawOo5kPK2UGiwnthcGEw.jpg','1978-08-11',88,'Released','Everyone has one, wants one, or is one.','Girlfriends',111469,2.5972,6.7,'78BuIA1COe8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7517,_binary '\0','/4yJBYZMQuUPDrvKsjNBGEza4DaB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077617',6.6,3605,'en','Go Tell the Spartans','A unit of American military advisors in Vietnam prior to the major U.S. involvement finds similarities between their helpless struggle against the Viet Cong and the doomed actions of a French unit at the same site a decade before.','/fUmid11VCcYixxEb2Odwy5dxe3J.jpg','1978-07-12',114,'Released','We\'re getting strafed, shelled, bombed, and blasted. And it isn\'t even our damned war!','Go Tell the Spartans',32052,2.9539,6.217,'6a_B2fhCC9s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7518,_binary '\0','/vfDdZC1mrhzHrh65PCPnEjerhKX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077621',6.2,8930,'en','Goin\' South','Henry Moon is captured for a capital offense by a posse when his horse quits while trying to escape to Mexico. He finds that there is a post-Civil War law in the small town that any single or widowed woman can save him from the gallows by marrying him.','/w8Bh4XSkFpXx0A5oQEqRSvcaSKG.jpg','1978-10-06',109,'Released','In 1868 Longhorn Texas, a convicted outlaw had two choices: get hung, or get married.','Goin\' South',34130,3.3035,5.814,'pmlR6Bl3uPM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7519,_binary '\0','/ttwB8ddwaDIJv2svt6swxXADHM3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077629',6.2,3981,'en','Gray Lady Down','The USS Neptune, a nuclear submarine, is sunk off the coast of Connecticut after a collision with a Norwegian cargo ship. The navy must attempt a potentially dangerous rescue in the hope of saving the lives of the crew.','/woWRnt1Go5LSSM580ySnTjeCFiI.jpg','1978-03-10',111,'Released','Trapped underwater... with time running out.','Gray Lady Down',31948,3.0885,6.5,'aQewlH-cggo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7520,_binary '\0','/2SRJMIoJzABzgyGw01U6VbQbvJD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077631',7.2,330003,'en','Grease','Australian good girl Sandy and greaser Danny fell in love over the summer. But when they unexpectedly discover they\'re now in the same high school, will they be able to rekindle their romance despite their eccentric friends?','/2rM7fQKpb7cs1Iq7IBqub9LFDzJ.jpg','1978-06-16',110,'Released','Grease is the word.','Grease',621,17.3895,7.365,'THd96gHV7Tg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7521,_binary '\0','/eoDqzMvSptI2JW9AKHVUCpoP0Ld.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077636',5.4,1498,'en','The Greek Tycoon','A lusty Greek shipping magnate courts the widow of an assassinated U.S. president.','/skNKybBwbo8CqZ6ceMsqAZEUCGO.jpg','1978-05-12',107,'Released','She was the most famous woman in the world. He was a peasant, a pirate, a shark. What he couldn\'t buy with money he stole with charm.','The Greek Tycoon',57578,2.4599,5.5,'iM8UtFSeSJM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7522,_binary '\0','/sHI9xlFRWCJ38AIIfOqnGjuEvXz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077651',7.7,343032,'en','Halloween','Fifteen years after murdering his sister on Halloween Night 1963, Michael Myers escapes from a mental hospital and returns to the small town of Haddonfield, Illinois to kill again.','/wijlZ3HaYMvlDTPqJoTCWKFkCPU.jpg','1978-10-24',91,'Released','The night he came home!','Halloween',948,40.843,7.557,'2Orp73nufs0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7523,_binary '\0','/2Qh8AHeYQlPD96O1aXU2yqKj4Il.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077655',7,2152,'cn','豪俠','Kao has purchased a new wife, but an enemy has paid her more money to kill him. Kao must recruit a pair of swordsmen to help defend himself and his family from his ruthless enemy. But Kao has his dark side as well.','/uv8gmLKluvZBEnKI4cRnQ7r4iKs.jpg','1979-11-22',106,'Released',NULL,'Last Hurrah for Chivalry',13514,2.5026,7.1,'Eq2tjbIx8dQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7524,_binary '\0','/77IamzhHqhMIojImuAkSCGCinlN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077660',5.8,1408,'en','Harper Valley P.T.A.','Stella Johnson is a single mother living in the town of Harper Valley. Most of the townsfolk, particularly those on the school PTA, think she is a little too liberal so they\'re making things tough for her and her daughter. So she runs for the position of PTA President, which infuriates them. Stella decides to get revenge with the help of her friends.','/yp8pvtUrJNPfP21ir3FZrK4VGr7.jpg','1978-08-02',102,'Released','The song was scandalous. The movie is hilarious!','Harper Valley P.T.A.',113777,1.6311,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7525,_binary '\0','/yucBYHGAMaTu2HsxM2k9JWRxSlj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077663',6.9,25974,'en','Heaven Can Wait','Joe Pendleton is a quarterback preparing to lead his team to the superbowl when he is almost killed in an accident. An overanxious angel plucks him to heaven only to discover that he wasn\'t ready to die, and that his body has been cremated. A new body must be found, and that of a recently-murdered millionaire is chosen. His wife and accountant—the murderers—are confused by this development, as he buys the L.A. Rams in order to once again quarterback them into the Superbowl.','/h1yOiO9cow6gwmGxSAWvPdY4lhJ.jpg','1978-06-28',101,'Released','Joe Pendleton... the only guy who ever raised Hell about going to Heaven.','Heaven Can Wait',12185,4.2501,6.7,'SDLbLbsxRKQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7526,_binary '\0','/e5ecjQw8AK0e924UIkMOUTxGhMj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077681',6.3,43176,'en','The Hills Have Eyes','Taking an ill-advised detour en-route to California, the Carter family soon run into trouble when their RV breaks down in the middle of the desert. Stranded, they find themselves at the mercy of monstrous cannibals lurking in the surrounding hills.','/1G2DBIEkoS0JdCiOFIeR3mD8ROE.jpg','1977-07-22',90,'Released','The lucky ones died first...','The Hills Have Eyes',12262,5.0707,6.2,'0fjBK6wuXZ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7527,_binary '\0','/qNVf39jp9fZSLd1bWMYjOrrEkI2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077687',6.7,19123,'en','The Hobbit','The story follows the adventures of Bilbo Baggins, a diminutive creative who resides in a place called Middle-Earth before he is compelled to go on a quest to find a treasure buried deep in the heart of the Lonely Mountain.','/2ohvyMPhvjftLrM6S6Ljr6QrL0u.jpg','1977-11-27',77,'Released','The greatest adventure is what lies ahead...','The Hobbit',1362,4.6153,6.588,'f_JMOPCo31M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7528,_binary '\0','/7R2GVQ1dhkshjZGOR2FJ7Q6ex1W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077696',6.4,9011,'en','Hooper','Legendary stunt man Sonny Hooper remains one of the top men in his field, but due to too many stressful impacts to the spine and the need to pop painkillers several times a day, he knows he should get out of the industry before he ends up permanently disabled.','/3qYgqCIrcKyq7eis9cOjIlGWRDE.jpg','1978-07-28',99,'Released','Ain\'t nobody can fly a car like Hooper!','Hooper',16214,3.8388,6.303,'r_ttOm_pcqo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7529,_binary '\0','/if5PHyaafqhOH4aUfgKoOkZ14LA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077698',6.1,1631,'en','Hot Lead & Cold Feet','Twin brothers -- one rough and tough, the other a city-bred milquetoast -- compete for their father\'s fortune.','/cUaeR4l3aSzO8UpGaKbnHOxeQ8k.jpg','1978-07-05',90,'Released',NULL,'Hot Lead & Cold Feet',28736,3.2998,5.9,'fRJK8C5smXI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7530,_binary '\0','/3pc2ByWLlWHhJBcm12azGj7FVG1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077699',6.6,2166,'en','House Calls','Charley is a surgeon who\'s recently lost his wife; he embarks on a tragicomic romantic quest with one woman after another until he meets up with Ann, a singular woman, closer to his own age, who immediately and unexpectedly captures his heart.','/w1dPYHsQHc9gE7usBblY2dysBuX.jpg','1978-03-15',98,'Released','A funny love story.','House Calls',36361,1.8065,6.4,'t8UxMNgu0Lg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7531,_binary '\0','/yiaWfTF7OZMRhcncdoJQxG5a4FU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077707',7.4,1357,'fr','L’hypothèse du tableau volé','Two narrators, one seen and one unseen, discuss possible connections between a series of paintings. The on-screen narrator walks through three-dimensional reproductions of each painting, featuring real people, sometimes moving, in an effort to explain the series\' significance.','/4PTfpEp96NccwdaFQkiq0wVkFQO.jpg','1978-04-04',66,'Released',NULL,'The Hypothesis of the Stolen Painting',88034,2.057,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7532,_binary '\0','/ozNapY9iczRr6FYKRbLLM00szCW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077711',8.1,43435,'sv','Höstsonaten','After a seven-year absence, Charlotte Andergast travels to Sweden to reunite with her daughter Eva. The pair have a troubled relationship: Charlotte sacrificed the responsibilities of motherhood for a career as a classical pianist. Over an emotional night, the pair reopen the wounds of the past. Charlotte gets another shock when she finds out that her mentally impaired daughter, Helena, is out of the asylum and living with Eva.','/6beNbtCXv3GkzHkxkGYf38ib7v8.jpg','1978-10-08',93,'Released',NULL,'Autumn Sonata',12761,5.3336,8,'WDOTDB2cTSg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7533,_binary '\0','/6BMkto59sKvORnbRDjGBxJnISOn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077713',5.7,34952,'en','Day of the Woman','A young, beautiful career woman rents a backwoods cabin to write her first novel. Attacked by a group of local lowlifes and left for dead, she devises a horrific plan to inflict revenge.','/nMCkOo26GtISoxJmpkTAJyMqBO8.jpg','1978-11-02',101,'Released','After it was all over... she waited... then she struck back in a way only a WOMAN can!','Day of the Woman',25239,5.397,6,'CYtIfQU0gzw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7534,_binary '\0','/jfrvSROMkP7omBa1bCzTqI2GQYi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077714',6.9,6354,'en','I Wanna Hold Your Hand','If they miss The Beatles\' first appearance in the U.S.A., they will hate themselves for the rest of their lives - so four young girls from New Jersey set off even though they don\'t have tickets for the show! The journey is full of surprises and misfortunes but the young ladies are determined to reach their idols.','/bsswhzIRIKfIYgplvnblKDkEdp7.jpg','1978-04-01',99,'Released','Some girls will do anything to meet their idols.','I Wanna Hold Your Hand',55457,2.6925,6.3,'QEPDFYuhkDI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7535,_binary '\0','/dBdX0I8QNNhTFxZbMgPQQQdVMTl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077716',6.6,4526,'en','Ice Castles','Alexis is on top of the world until a tragic accident dashes her hopes and dreams of becoming a world-class figure skater. Only with the help of those who love her can she prove to the world — and herself — that she still has the potential to realize her dreams.','/5iS3EJD286IYkJ83L5pEVoNF3xn.jpg','1978-12-31',108,'Released','Together they reached for the impossible.','Ice Castles',50541,3.3699,7.4,'UqJswRe3Rp0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7536,_binary '\0','/rgduSnz2ETdKPk1D3QigAceEqny.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077729',7.3,5237,'de','In einem Jahr mit 13 Monden','Elvira Weishaupt, once a burly working-class butcher, has made an enormous sacrifice for love. She has undergone a sex change for a romantic interest who has abandoned her, and she now must struggle to reconcile her past life with her present identity.','/kauXmH1RQRNbFBiAKA1EpQZILP3.jpg','1978-11-17',124,'Released',NULL,'In a Year with 13 Moons',42206,2.6165,6.6,'ksJWxr_ScDY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7537,_binary '\0','/oFFSZANj9DgiXEcT7VWjEwujsb4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077734',6.9,1310,'it','L\'ingorgo','A tremendous congestion hits the Rome highway ring. The biggest traffic jam ever seen lasts more than 36 hours. At the beginning the people blocked in their cars react normally. But as more time passes, the more we witness personal dramas, hysteric reactions and other grotesque situations. All the episodes are linked as if in a single plot. Cars and their hosts are a microcosm of stories part of a larger universe: the congestion.','/dHIHwdcYy2cdb1aveOgaMecZ5dw.jpg','1979-01-12',121,'Released',NULL,'Traffic Jam',74080,1.5289,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7538,_binary '\0','/yfxwNfjhnE5aIrEXTw29AuR7cOO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077735',5.7,1582,'en','The Initiation of Sarah','Shy misfit Sarah Goodwin has a secret gift: the ability to control — and destroy — with her mind. When Sarah goes off to college with her more outgoing and popular sister, Patty, their plans to join the most prestigious sorority on campus are scuttled by snobby president, Jennifer Lawrence. Separated from her sister, Sarah is taken in by a rival, less popular sorority, whose mysterious house mother, Mrs. Hunter, is harboring a secret of her own: a scheme to harness Sarah\'s terrifying power for revenge. Betrayed by Patty, humiliated by Jennifer, it can only be a matter of time before Sorority Hell Week erupts in flame!','/scDcr5mSsV3OGKWKGH7Bxkefgz0.jpg','1978-02-06',96,'Released','She Was Born With Devastating Psychic Powers. And She\'s Forced To Unleash Them In A Shocking Finale!','The Initiation of Sarah',23692,1.9484,5.5,'k2EyHaxvlhE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7539,_binary '\0','/o30k6ehjyiNwFoHeytZH9Gcdo64.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077740',7.5,2440,'tl','Insiang','A story about the life of a young girl living with her mother in the slums of Manila, which becomes unbearable when her mother\'s young boyfriend moves in with them.','/v8ABYJ28OXvzEceox2NrN9Vgycr.jpg','1976-12-25',95,'Released',NULL,'Insiang',108949,2.0035,7,'9ssGbkBNPUg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7540,_binary '\0','/pW5UUdIWYfDWk2BAOR0fspYGb7q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077742',7.2,22676,'en','Interiors','When Eve, an interior designer, is deserted by her husband of many years, Arthur, the emotionally glacial relationships of the three grown-up daughters are laid bare. Twisted by jealousy, insecurity and resentment, Renata, a successful writer; Joey, a woman crippled by indecision; and Flyn, a budding actress; struggle to communicate for the sake of their shattered mother. But when their father unexpectedly falls for another woman, his decision to remarry sets in motion a terrible twist of fate…','/sTPy6Kfa1FRED1eaZdVex8b2MdB.jpg','1978-08-02',93,'Released','The serious side of Woody Allen...','Interiors',15867,3.6171,6.838,'sINxS7X8fFQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7541,_binary '\0','/2UfIeGDKdOvzMgwGjvDyAfDqMX4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077743',5.9,1784,'en','International Velvet','Sarah Brown is sent to England after her parents die in a car crash. There, she lives with her aunt Velvet who introduces Sarah to the world of equestrian competition and gives her the last foal of her own prize horse, The Pie. Under the watchful eye of her aunt and horse trainer Capt. Johnson, Sarah develops into a talented rider who might have a shot at the Olympics.','/xWvDYwyY3rZTlSy4UFrvZjA06Q9.jpg','1978-07-19',127,'Released','In Every Girl is the Woman She is Destined to Become... And in Every Woman is the Girl She Used to Be.','International Velvet',42207,1.7522,7.4,'sni6D5Hf6A4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7542,_binary '\0','/lyHnFsWafILUlizalpCSikJT7Ui.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077745',7.4,83325,'en','Invasion of the Body Snatchers','The residents of San Francisco are becoming drone-like shadows of their former selves, and as the phenomenon spreads, two Department of Health workers uncover the horrifying truth.','/skS02wdeH2C0nrbCQP3qKwJdZtZ.jpg','1978-12-20',116,'Released','The seed is planted... terror grows.','Invasion of the Body Snatchers',11850,10.0122,7.22,'4FEYUa-Txh0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7543,_binary '\0','/2f9NZUDifPRbGO9NsOed7oQ1tPQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077751',7.3,2314,'ar','إسكندرية ليه؟','Amid the poverty, death, and suffering caused by World War II, 18-year-old Yehia retreats into a private world of fantasy and longing. Obsessed with Hollywood, he dreams of studying filmmaking in America but struggles to pursue his dream, given the constraints of his life in the middle class and the horrors of war.','/k68nAl2BJpX9405UCqs4Xhw2S7n.jpg','1979-08-23',133,'Released',NULL,'Alexandria… Why?',40939,1.2613,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7544,_binary '\0','/wStMdZZys6rlAowsQiCrbwOmmeC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077756',5.2,3060,'en','It Lives Again','Maternity wards echo with the patter of tiny claws as more murderous baby-faced monsters are born. But rather than kill their monstrous offspring during delivery, cursed parents flee to secret incubation hideouts.','/kMQUMhYc6PipkMRsShYr0yGwi5a.jpg','1978-05-10',91,'Released','The \"IT\'S ALIVE\" Baby is Back... Only Now There are Three of Them!','It Lives Again',28155,2.3737,5.397,'YYdNgmoL9vQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7545,_binary '\0','/q46nyik6GeDkUV6wQGiZQ97UuP6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077766',5.8,92801,'en','Jaws 2','Police chief Brody must protect the citizens of Amity after a second monstrous shark begins terrorizing the waters.','/cN3ijEwsn4kBaRuHfcJpAQJbeWe.jpg','1978-06-16',117,'Released','Just when you thought it was safe to go back in the water...','Jaws 2',579,7.1076,6,'2-KIByGsyaI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7546,_binary '\0','/qzX3QcRYdUj7DS2v2VBp22fsEbb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077768',6.4,1811,'fr','Je suis timide... mais je me soigne','Pierre is a hotel cashier in Vichy, so shy that he answers an ad from the Psychology Institute and can\'t say no to the salesman, Aldo; he spends 6,000 francs on tapes, books, and a punching bag. Soon after, he\'s smitten by Agnes, a hotel guest with a model\'s looks and photographers wherever she goes. When she leaves for Nice, he follows, meeting Aldo on the way. Aldo becomes his boldness coach. Pierre gets a job washing dishes where Agnes is staying, but after a week or so, she\'s off to Deauville, with Aldo and Pierre in pursuit. Using funds they get by selling Aldo\'s car, this time Pierre poses as a polo-playing jet setter. Will this win the heart of Agnes?','/t8xxzwIGcwINlnxql3LHXNS1DJj.jpg','1978-08-23',88,'Released',NULL,'Too Shy to Try',40054,1.9814,6.429,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7547,_binary '\0','/5Y2ADUj8wrcq3mBkrfXPMmuPEqS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077775',7.9,2663,'bn','জয় বাবা ফেলুনাথ','Set in the holy city of Benares, this is the second film about the detective Feluda, who goes on a holiday with his cousin, Topshe, and his friend, Lalmohan Ganguly. But the theft of a priceless deity of Lord Ganesh (the Elephant God) from a local household forces him to investigate.','/osdTflcvp6V4VR5BIzVVnUAHyRy.jpg','1979-01-04',120,'Released',NULL,'The Elephant God',165432,1.4012,7.262,'A72f1hKHgA4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7548,_binary '\0','/aXG4pz86rBhD42ro4cycHGeCYr3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077788',4.6,3738,'en','KISS Meets the Phantom of the Park','The tale of rock band KISS and their efforts to thwart a diabolical plan by mad scientist Abner Devereaux. Devereaux has found a way to clone humans into robots in his laboratory at an amusement park. It just so happens that he plans to use the KISS concert as a platform to unleash his plan on the world. KISS must use their special powers to stop him.','/u0u1dRl5UKXmgdfJRlAb5Lui57u.jpg','1978-10-28',96,'Released','KISSterical! KISStounding! KISStoric!','KISS Meets the Phantom of the Park',39704,2.7446,5.2,'zmy5WhWdQCE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7549,_binary '\0','/8Bxh4EtH6o1MSEDFGo2iT7BeDfg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077800',4.2,2703,'en','Killer Fish','Jewel thieves attempt to recover treasure from piranha infested waters. Mistrust and betrayals happen amongst the gang in the quest for gold.','/sz19oHOnmB9EQxYm0oEU060DNPc.jpg','1979-12-07',100,'Released','The adventure that drags you in, pulls you under and tears you apart!','Killer Fish',36275,3.1821,4.7,'T_Ws7tLfLUg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7550,_binary '\0','/9y3FHVPq9xlKFbseaT9GHx9w7RR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077807',6.3,1692,'en','King of the Gypsies','Zharko, leader of the Romanis in NYC, passes his position of leadership on to his unwilling grandson, Dave, leading to infighting between Dave and his father.','/3wLk1iApQx5lxMiB0p6F7iS91c3.jpg','1978-12-20',112,'Released','They have their own language... Their own codes of sex, honor and vengeance... And their own way of choosing a king.','King of the Gypsies',20863,2.7162,5.9,'osQX7Tjv58I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7551,_binary '\0','/t24S7W6VPqB99MIIxaBD5rt9kVq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077814',7,1969,'pl','Kochaj albo rzuć','Pawlak and Kargul - neighbors, frenemies, and grandfathers to Ania- both receive invitation to America from Pawlak\'s brother- John. All three of them travel to Chicago, where they discover John has passed away, and they arrived just in time for his funeral. But first- they need to find his illegitimate daughter. Set in late 70\'s story of two, charming, Polish villagers\' adventures in Chicago is a third installment of Pawlak and Kargul adventures.','/jlHmHT0lbrQk60tXnWfNAbXrqUR.jpg','1977-06-13',116,'Released',NULL,'Big Deal',38375,0.8633,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7552,_binary '\0','/7nzsQIF5tLzw60ok5jdHeFwpqed.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077834',2.9,7234,'en','Laserblast','Happy go-lucky teen Billy Duncan discovers an otherworldly laser gun in the southern California desert, making him the target of a pair of aliens who had recently executed its previous owner.','/jxv1Z0URENuWADDRwvRINUWUsP.jpg','1978-03-01',83,'Released','Billy was a kid who got pushed around... Then he found the power.','Laserblast',17874,2.0087,3.4,'nSggSblAjnc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7553,_binary '\0','/noOz8qEQKBJZ7aEk7VboOUsJyR2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077838',8.1,22442,'en','The Last Waltz','Martin Scorsese\'s documentary intertwines footage from The Band\'s incredible farewell tour with probing backstage interviews and featured performances by Eric Clapton, Bob Dylan, Joni Mitchell, Van Morrison, and other rock legends.','/2K7CFH0AIHnGrA4yQjPCoIB5CmQ.jpg','1978-04-26',117,'Released','It Started as a Concert. It Became a Celebration.','The Last Waltz',13963,3.3861,7.7,'jvDx5mCzkYg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7554,_binary '\0','/a7m4NkcKcN6ancZdIs3jBCvNIBU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077864',6.7,6771,'it','Lo chiamavano Bulldozer','The \"Bulldozer\", a former football star, is now working as a fisherman. As a group of street-people arranges a football match against the local Armybase, he is asked to be their trainer. His boat was damaged by a submarine and he currently has no work, so he agrees.','/qVaw72xh9ViQ5GHoegAbzcmBQb.jpg','1978-09-15',102,'Released',NULL,'They Called Him Bulldozer',11144,3.1087,6.9,'gZzr4m8BKd8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7555,_binary '\0','/brTVy2DABmSu2mcwR24SCYLjIzY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077868',7.3,1243,'zh','冷血十三鷹','Eagle Chief Yoh Xi-hung raises orphans to be his personal killers. One such is Chik Ming-sing who now wants to put his killer life behind him. When the Eagle Clan come after him, a stranger called Cheuk comes to his assistance It turns out that Cheuk is the son of a family who were robbed and murdered by the Eagles. Now they will team up to destroy the evil clan.','/tpOVfLNNmWQFNJrfrAnLmdsx8pT.jpg','1978-09-13',90,'Released','Death was his way of life!','The Avenging Eagle',83876,2.0684,7.5,'__NFC1JXk3Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7556,_binary '\0','/TXSxV23MWYkezZ3219gtgcSX6n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077869',6.2,38629,'en','The Lord of the Rings','Young Hobbit Frodo Baggins is thrown into an amazing adventure when he\'s tasked with destroying the One Ring, created by the dark lord Sauron. Frodo must travel in a small fellowship of nine warriors and accomplices. But it won\'t be an easy journey for the Fellowship of the Ring, on the ultimate quest to rid Middle-earth of evil.','/liW0mjvTyLs7UCumaHhx3PpU4VT.jpg','1978-11-15',132,'Released','Fantasy...beyond your imagination.','The Lord of the Rings',123,7.7479,6.586,'wPe6BNPUmI0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7557,_binary '\0','/aZ6u2xJGZYBqgsqDqfUttlEne5W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077879',7.4,2018,'sh','Lude godine','Teenagers Marija and Boba fall in love. When Marija gets pregnant, Boba\'s friends come up with a plan to help the young couple out.','/bw6ov1RZGevj4CLO58ww3ZVQ5b1.jpg','1977-12-15',83,'Released',NULL,'Foolish Years',55111,0.8195,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7558,_binary '\0','/o0qTNliLQK7t31UVSNQBvxj8dpN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077889',6.8,15817,'en','Magic','A ventriloquist is at the mercy of his vicious dummy while he tries to renew a romance with his high school sweetheart.','/nkDUIHyr7MlDRgbHv98YbH0jvYr.jpg','1978-11-08',107,'Released','A terrifying love story.','Magic',34193,3.2798,6.8,'GjKHbdQRHeo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7559,_binary '\0','/gTNhf6GRHifjSXAKr5uQQqdv60D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077904',5.4,3804,'en','The Manitou','A psychic\'s girlfriend finds out that a lump on her back is a growing reincarnation of a 400 year-old demonic Native American spirit.','/vxTgbgiDUiv66xk0R28hlUua1P6.jpg','1978-04-28',104,'Released','Evil does not die… It waits to be re-born!','The Manitou',40060,3.0189,5.4,'Y2Ie04C5ECk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7560,_binary '\0','/iydSAnElj8xZusCiLrgZYZ0GOrZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077912',4,1328,'en','Mardi Gras Massacre','Police try to capture someone who is commiting ritual murders of women during Mardi Gras in New Orleans.','/p8dXisOBFbff2dkMpAERjnix0As.jpg','1978-08-11',97,'Released','...and that was only the beginning.','Mardi Gras Massacre',58644,1.0269,4.1,'LaTpy8UieHo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7561,_binary '\0','/jYtgrQa9dPw2CPwereWZBAoKzwQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077914',6.9,14239,'en','Martin','A young man, convinced he\'s a vampire, goes to live with his elderly and hostile cousin in a small Pennsylvanian town, where he tries to suppress his bloodlust.','/2UaQChRF3leBWlxYgVnUim7Conj.jpg','1978-05-10',95,'Released','He could be the boy next door...','Martin',26517,2.579,6.768,'Cgs3U-gLZwE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7562,_binary '\0','/7aY1ji2fVHVTAW9DjkpFvPMyLi9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077921',6.9,8566,'en','The Medusa Touch','A French detective in London reconstructs the life of a man lying in hospital with severe injuries with the help of journals and a psychiatrist. He realises that the man had powerful telekinetic abilities.','/lSJZA6hSwxv8O3d1DfyuN7wZ0Zi.jpg','1978-04-13',109,'Released','Richard Burton is the man with the medusa touch... he has the power to create catastrophe.','The Medusa Touch',11623,3.8229,6.825,'Mx4yXJkGo2g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7563,_binary '\0','/f4dcx5U9X3w27e8iithmsaohF5t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077928',7.5,95741,'en','Midnight Express','Billy Hayes is caught attempting to smuggle drugs out of a country. The courts decide to make an example of him, sentencing him to more than 30 years in prison. Hayes has two opportunities for release: the appeals made by his lawyer, his family, and the American government, or the \"Midnight Express\".','/6GXioArQEdxcYqOcEfMdpyJPlwx.jpg','1978-08-31',121,'Released','Walk into the incredible true experience of Billy Hayes. And bring all the courage you can.','Midnight Express',11327,8.1152,7.4,'lhuutAnXBzQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7564,_binary '\0','/58NrRvMmdJoPXKsYStyKldOVvLB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077936',7.3,2166,'en','Les Misérables','In 19th century France, Jean Valjean, a man imprisoned for stealing bread, must flee a relentless policeman named Javert. The pursuit consumes both men\'s lives, and soon Valjean finds himself in the midst of the student revolutions in France.','/ymNTn7ZKW7j1MUr9e3qmJZ7YavG.jpg','1978-12-27',150,'Released','A classic tale of one man\'s search for freedom and another\'s quest for revenge.','Les Misérables',4479,2.3208,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7565,_binary '\0','/auCQQkgZ9jeCxN9Iloez9qlTBXR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077937',6.8,2056,'en','Mission Galactica: The Cylon Attack','A compilation of Battlestar Galactica episodes 10–12 and 21, with alternate footage. Running low on fuel, the Battlestar Galactica receives the help of the supposedly lost Battlestar Pegasus which is taking the offensive with the Cylons.','/ywfIGWGUMh3psvTrkGyYq5VgCd.jpg','1979-08-09',108,'Released','Their very existence menaced by a strange civilization.','Mission Galactica: The Cylon Attack',9640,2.5487,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7566,_binary '\0','/3NfSguGnHItr6LBOUwGZw50vXM6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077942',3.3,1396,'en','Moment by Moment','Trisha Rawlings, a Beverly Hills socialite suffering from loneliness following the separation from her womanizing husband, develops a May–December romance with a young drifter named Strip.','/pubJy2ZBPbqXI8LqRDfdCMrWgoj.jpg','1978-12-22',102,'Released','The only thing they have in common... is each other.','Moment by Moment',110598,1.4676,3.6,'IvGq95RM76w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7567,_binary '\0','/6tvmjwB81hCkLCgnXKHuA1rJ0W4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077945',5.2,5316,'it','La montagna del dio cannibale','A woman and her brother fly to New Guinea to look for a lost expedition, led by her husband, which has vanished in the great jungle.','/9l5LRfNkWzxzNOFRJt7E5PYDO90.jpg','1978-07-12',102,'Released','THEIR CULT WAS DEATH... THEIR LUST WAS FOR BLOOD!','Slave of the Cannibal God',39973,4.3434,5.2,'ZnOmRIaTpso','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7568,_binary '\0','/jrVELg88uxw1scWJD0N5pZ657LF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077952',6.4,1409,'en','Movie Movie','Three movie genres of the 1930s, boxing films, WWI aviation dramas, and backstage Broadway musicals, are satirized using the same cast.','/ibbixbVqqAcs2fot7dUcyOALFsD.jpg','1978-11-01',108,'Released','It\'s the swellest. It\'s the cream of the silver screen. It\'s got buckets of tears and a million laughs.','Movie Movie',85420,1.999,6.1,'_e-cGy7MIwQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7569,_binary '\0','/qsgZnHsxL62draUQ4EPccp52dyI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077973',6.9,1467,'zh','南少林與北少林','Three North Shaolin teachers are called on by the Manchus to teach their soldiers and are urged to challenge the current South Shaolin teachers. They defeat the South Shaolin teachers and, that night, the head general kills the South Shaolin teachers and blames their death on the North Shaolin teachers. The South Shaolin master sends more of his pupils, who are killed accidentally by the North Shaolin teachers. He finally sends two more of his students to train with old masters and trains one student himself with the goal of finally defeating the North Shaolin experts.','/gZ9KLwe4dKDWI0S83n0uk3nAG4D.jpg','1978-11-19',106,'Released','Expert in the fine art of killing.','Invincible Shaolin',48297,2.3116,6.5,'Bb8s4irJiBk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7570,_binary '\0','/dBTWOjGU7ry4jGgP9fp63FZs83y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0077975',7.4,136855,'en','Animal House','At a 1962 College, Dean Vernon Wormer is determined to expel the entire Delta Tau Chi Fraternity, but those troublemakers have other plans for him.','/fWooBbipMRIKeSRhEzmeaDV0T8H.jpg','1978-07-28',109,'Released','It was the Deltas against the rules... the rules lost!','Animal House',8469,8.5964,6.949,'-mSQag4Re4Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7571,_binary '\0','/2nVYvUMo8lMbjG2d7QvH3ivz1fe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078012',7,2483,'it','I nuovi mostri','A collection of dark-humoured vignettes, including tales of a cardinal with a liberal congregation, a motorist and a hitchhiker, mentally challenged tramps, parents contemplating their daughter\'s participation in a pornographic film, and a conniving husband.','/pcDAZ2pSmS6fgJKB8lEqlEhA8d2.jpg','1977-12-15',115,'Released',NULL,'The New Monsters',45004,4.3492,6.985,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7572,_binary '\0','/baWaggqRR1OiMImqIQwdNz4ggcW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078026',7,2011,'da','Olsen-banden går i krig','Some criminal EU ministers plan to turn Denmark into a gigantic fair ground and holiday paradise. Egon gets his hand at some important documents which could both make him rich and take care of Denmark\'s future.','/3i8vNc8tJPsRFsEKRDnwrQ6KDfb.jpg','1978-10-06',107,'Released',NULL,'The Olsen Gang Goes to War',12592,1.7184,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7573,_binary '\0','/zWzFHaoOqSA7vlydDtdDIeMLlVj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078054',7.4,2602,'cs','Panna a netvor','Julie, the youngest daughter of a bankrupt merchant, sacrifices her life in order to save her father. She goes to an enchanted castle in the woods and meets Netvor, a bird-like monster. As Netvor begins to fall in love with Julie, he must suppress his beastly urge to kill her.','/i2i1TGWaONfdPkqi3GnwX9LphdK.jpg','1979-03-02',91,'Released',NULL,'Beauty and the Beast',70349,2.4996,7.5,'ShbMfeoBIpM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7574,_binary '\0','/pzjUH9OmMhaSWzzmpdllTUGZP1M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078056',5.7,6892,'en','Paradise Alley','Three Italian-American brothers, living in the slums of 1940\'s New York City, try to help each other with one\'s wrestling career using one brother\'s promotional skills and another brother\'s con-artist tactics to thwart a sleazy manager.','/tF3YenU48fn1Ml0AMRvsG6nSP9V.jpg','1978-09-22',107,'Released','The Carboni Boys. They haul ice, lay out stiffs and dance with monkeys.','Paradise Alley',23916,4.8206,5.9,'lMsiks5A0z4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7575,_binary '\0','/2OPIWYGSRUPc0UPiA0Xn4gG7CBe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078058',7.1,11316,'it','Pari e dispari','A bumbling government agent recruits a trucker whose gambling knowledge can help crack an illegal Florida operation.','/ankqh5ykTnjXiDizWtnbKRu8LPo.jpg','1978-10-28',115,'Released','The most unlikely pair ever to take on the mob!','Odds and Evens',11367,0.1891,6.96,'6rWH3yrRYhU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7576,_binary '\0','/jc4rnqG9K7cefgqXTIXYIfNfEVV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078062',4.1,2783,'en','Parts: The Clonus Horror','An escaped clone tries to expose a government plot to clone everyone and make a perfect society.','/tFAQLUDuoa2XVAVYMhLTXFh5bGD.jpg','1979-08-01',90,'Released','The only thing they don\'t use... is the scream.','Parts: The Clonus Horror',98851,2.4429,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7577,_binary '\0','/xCm5hR7onkGXGzGXkkkhzgyeFm1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078067',6.2,4585,'en','Patrick','A comatose hospital patient harasses and kills through his powers of telekinesis to claim his private nurse as his own.','/qxydnHE4D5ArBRNtihlVs5rhhO2.jpg','1978-10-01',113,'Released','He\'s in a coma... Yet, he can kill...','Patrick',17212,2.3292,6.1,'2UqO8nf77O8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7578,_binary '\0','/aST9UfzhV4LQ4lHCNj1OCB4it0a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078073',6.9,1724,'fr','Perceval le Gallois','The film chronicles Perceval\'s knighthood, maturation and eventual peerage amongst the Knights of the Round Table, and also contains brief episodes from the story of Gawain and the crucifixion of Christ.','/hvywz6133UMPfKRVcMWav151Ci5.jpg','1978-10-08',140,'Released',NULL,'Perceval',75733,1.7667,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7579,_binary '\0','/3GZaqiBRCc6gsP5fTVwGRtC6ICV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078077',6,3331,'fr','Les Raisins de la mort','A young woman discovers that the pesticide being sprayed on vineyards is turning people into murderous lunatics.','/j3PAWSSjm8nAwpofY1bQ9ZTBtYi.jpg','1978-07-05',91,'Released','When the wine flows, the terror begins…','The Grapes of Death',29107,2.1266,5.818,'_-Lp0gfPlIo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7580,_binary '\0','/gYcHhPDVheL993ZpTUvsZXEGmQ6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078078',6.1,1793,'en','Petey Wheatstraw','Petey Wheatstraw is a candidate to become the devil\'s son-in-law. The storyline is a scaffolding on which Rudy Ray Moore\'s standup humor can be unfolded. Beginning life as the afterbirth to a watermelon, the young Wheatstraw becomes a martial artist, but is unable to best the evil comedy team of Leroy and Skillet, who also indulge in wholesale murder. Satan restores the comedians\' victims to life, and charges Petey with the task of marrying his clock-stoppingly ugly daughter to give him a grandchild. When Petey attempts to default on the deal, he is pursued by the devil\'s henchmen.','/bQFFMMMupaCAdWcgnBjVVlbK5wq.jpg','1977-11-01',99,'Released','Have No Fear, It\'s the Comedy Smash of the Year!','Petey Wheatstraw',34792,0.9299,5.5,'gzd2XY0Giyg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7581,_binary '\0','/dAi5Zx6g082IaooVRPBNku5l6Fh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078084',7.3,4275,'sv','Picassos äventyr','A farcical biopic about Pablo Picasso, from his early years, to his middle years, to the years right before his death, and some of the years before and in-between that.','/yVWYfdhjWHvwndVB0CCBxNVrfKY.jpg','1978-05-20',115,'Released','A thousand loving lies by Hans Alfredson and Tage Danielsson','The Adventures of Picasso',45691,2.2315,6.828,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7582,_binary '\0','/xWTFlDi5ktVBU7fHELDx7pLaYQS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078087',5.9,28484,'en','Piranha','When flesh-eating piranhas are accidentally released into a summer resort\'s rivers, the guests become their next meal.','/oaz0Le3fT3R8jzlkXkNV7JAsd7x.jpg','1978-08-03',94,'Released','A hideous death lurked unseen in the river...','Piranha',24831,4.8271,6,'XoCKGvVlNYM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7583,_binary '\0','/nbZ1YxuwDDuJksW6CXIQ1aUUINR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078089',3.8,2160,'en','Planet of Dinosaurs','A spaceship gets lost and is forced to make an emergency landing on an unknown planet. The planet looks much like Earth, only with no trace of civilization. Soon the crew discovers that there are bloodthirsty dinosaurs on the planet. The crew hopes to be found and rescued, but until then, they must fight to survive.','/a8wYyolN2DV7Orhrh5YfzLfOh3d.jpg','1977-11-18',84,'Released','Trapped On A Lost World of Prehistoric Monsters','Planet of Dinosaurs',38020,1.4145,4,'S2DqiQtWuDA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7584,_binary '\0','/nehq8TDd7WnwBnTLnvv8BQNekzW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078111',6.5,14436,'en','Pretty Baby','In 1917 New Orleans, a 12-year-old girl is raised in a brothel by her prostitute mother.','/smBDqEIwEZbtOYdAEVpY0QYJyRG.jpg','1978-04-05',110,'Released','The image of an adult world seen through a child\'s eyes.','Pretty Baby',26973,6.4863,6.96,'PzngoXom1tg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7585,_binary '\0','/vtasUI25QQHG8cwwk7dNyAdk6vh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078122',6.9,4777,'fr','Préparez vos mouchoirs','Solange is seriously depressed, and her kindhearted husband, Raoul, makes it his mission to cure her doldrums. After many failed attempts to cheer her up, Raoul hits upon a possible solution: find his wife a lover. Unfortunately, his choice, Stéphane, proves to be just as ineffectual in restoring her flagging spirits. In the end, the gorgeous Solange finds her own, highly problematic tonic to her troubles in the form of a 13-year-old boy.','/vS4BlPEJV9QBS7W0urYlomYNWG7.jpg','1978-01-11',108,'Released','The Delicious Anarchy of Love and Devotion','Get Out Your Handkerchiefs',4267,2.2194,6.6,'mo5KITRF03s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7586,_binary '\0','/cXr02FMlFfjBhLF01a5Zuc68QmR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078128',5.8,2893,'cn','拳精','Jackie Chan plays the part of the class clown in a shaolin temple whose deadliest secret is stolen. All is lost until Jackie\'s character discovers dancing blue ghosts with bright red hair who haunt the library.','/5NwhAvXqaVDacl3fvXlfsYXt8Dw.jpg','1978-11-23',99,'Released',NULL,'Spiritual Kung Fu',18760,2.9093,6.029,'jgSVVD0V4Wo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7587,_binary '\0','/pIfgyyXqIJLDJD4qi7H6gmGWh0b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078150',6.3,2145,'en','Remember My Name','Just released from prison, a young woman arrives in town to \"start a new life,\" but soon begins stalking a married construction worker for no apparent reason, turning his life inside out and eventually terrorizing him and his wife.','/stqQ9ImdkIKeEYlMo9OHnVhFune.jpg','1978-02-10',95,'Released','Everyone knows a woman is fragile and helpless. Everybody\'s wrong.','Remember My Name',84207,1.9245,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7588,_binary '\0','/upRrVdUCP4QbiIlVpRiJQnG1sQQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078152',7.3,2724,'fr','Les Rendez-vous d\'Anna','Detached filmmaker Anna Silver arrives in Germany to show her latest film; over the course of some days, she encounters a variety of new and old faces, some of whom make personal revelations to her to little affect.','/1ZoR7DQQrkAEqFgllXmPxCUoNvS.jpg','1978-10-08',128,'Released',NULL,'The Meetings of Anna',93669,2.2616,7,'VbjwmbZMK64','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7589,_binary '\0','/YvT6G99txkuY3VD5NXFfW6lC12.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078155',5.4,2256,'en','Rescue from Gilligan\'s Island','When a decaying Russian satellite crashes on the island, the Professor uses a key component for a barometer. With that device, he learns that a massive wave is going to swamp the island. In desperation, the castaways lash their huts together into one structure in order to have any chance to ride the disaster out.','/oOzFIycJHZYqXygsFAdfQ1Krao7.jpg','1978-10-14',95,'Released',NULL,'Rescue from Gilligan\'s Island',32677,2.225,4.561,'xVtUfWIs8-A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7590,_binary '\0','/j8UaZvy0t2tDGmDIWFDkHpol1fP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078158',5.7,6191,'en','Return from Witch Mountain','Tony and Tia are other-worldly twins endowed with telekinesis. When their Uncle Bene drops them off in Los Angeles for an earthbound vacation, a display of their supernatural skill catches the eye of the nefarious Dr. Gannon and his partner in crime, Letha, who see rich possibilities in harnessing the children\'s gifts. They kidnap Tony, and Tia gives chase only to find Gannon is using her brother\'s powers against her.','/2bnmbL5YkqfR3OkQRzgoCf3vs4V.jpg','1978-03-10',95,'Released','Sinister forces from this world against two young space travellers from another.','Return from Witch Mountain',14822,3.441,5.846,'WJ4Tx4Vq_K8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7591,_binary '\0','/qOxSzq4bAbsqCUjP9Na4PTCDAZe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078163',6.6,25285,'en','Revenge of the Pink Panther','Chief Inspector Jacques Clouseau is dead. At least that is what the world—and Charles Dreyfus—believe when a dead body is discovered in Clouseau\'s car after being shot off the road. Naturally, Clouseau knows differently and, taking advantage of not being alive, sets out to discover why an attempt was made on his life.','/pvFiI8Kkq6JIf9uxDUU5FEvet7f.jpg','1978-01-08',99,'Released','Just when you thought it was safe to go back to the movies.','Revenge of the Pink Panther',6081,6.3856,6.413,'M81t8Wbnhyk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7592,_binary '\0','/5YqRkuIrq7ze7i58XTPCuSY2tnz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078187',6.9,2005,'ja','ルパン三世 ルパンVS複製人間','While attempting to win the affections of a beautiful rival, a master thief risks death to learn the secret intentions of a wealthy and seemingly immortal, but certainly ruthless, recluse.','/rgxMZcUW9HQOSFy6fzUWFA8BLo1.jpg','1978-12-16',102,'Released','Sometimes, being able to put together a world-class art collection takes a thief... this time it takes an extraordinary thief!','Lupin the Third: The Mystery of Mamo',30143,3.6888,7,'-_J5qnCqTCo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7593,_binary '\0','/g3yCzSnN5z6EvwdbQN4ncRuHr08.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078199',7.2,7548,'en','Same Time, Next Year','A man and woman meet by chance at a romantic inn over dinner and, although both are happily married to others, they find themselves in the same bed the next morning questioning how this could have happened. They agree to meet on the same weekend each year—in the same hotel room—and the years pass each has some personal crisis that the other helps them through, often without both of them understanding what is going on.','/58un6toArCEcOfctQ5a2fuQrm4o.jpg','1978-04-23',119,'Released','They couldn\'t have celebrated happier anniversaries if they were married to each other.','Same Time, Next Year',37672,2.8822,6.5,'erO-SVdfNqI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7594,_binary '\0','/e6yFrMa4ZttMY4ayxgqGNVXiPfY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078204',6.9,1317,'hi','सत्यम शिवम सुंदरम','Rajeev falls in love with Roopa, a beautiful singer who hides the fact that half her face is disfigured. However, he soon discovers her secret after marriage and begins to ignore her.','/5k5owbottAeIk7gPjFnnkmO94wQ.jpg','1978-03-24',172,'Released','Love Sublime','Satyam Shivam Sundaram',143975,1.4303,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7595,_binary '\0','/17oM6sCRxTHwa8MW8jsPzV2qcXb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078212',7.1,1303,'de','Die Schweizermacher','This romantic drama follows two policemen whose job is to investigate the lives of foreigners who have applied for Swiss citizenship. Among the applicants they must screen are a French psychiatrist and his wife, and a ballet dancer. The married couple are quickly accepted, but the dancer\'s life offers some objections. However, since the younger policeman has fallen in love with her, there is a chance that she, too, will win Swiss citizenship.','/cWEJjqK1nYHWYR1xVKKn9N5c3SM.jpg','1978-11-03',107,'Released',NULL,'The Swissmakers',34666,1.442,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7596,_binary '\0','/a0Euc1jiZDBjfC42pMx2pzUKON9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078222',6.9,2405,'hi','सीता और गीता','Long-suffering heiress Seeta is treated worse than a servant by her abusive money-grubbing aunt. Meanwhile, her long-lost twin sister Geeta grows up to be a gutsy street performer. One day, the girls unintentionally swap places.','/niLfmqUTvA06Wz3S8KfVm59tYEB.jpg','1972-11-17',151,'Released',NULL,'Seeta and Geeta',35751,1.6038,6.987,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7597,_binary '\0','/dgdddTP3I145Vj7VSjPievfC3Jf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078227',5.9,3984,'en','Semi-Tough','A three-way friendship between two free-spirited professional football players and the owner\'s daughter becomes compromised when two of them become romantically involved.','/s1N7WKW3TepZzQvAK8p1ASSPeRz.jpg','1977-11-18',108,'Released','They Lead The League In Scoring... After The Game!','Semi-Tough',4988,2.4472,5.4,'JkDB7Z6NZpQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7598,_binary '\0','/ezOM6ZRz8MS9B1TxTWfDqlcOeXu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078238',3.9,1648,'en','Sextette','On the day of her wedding to her sixth husband, glamorous silver screen sex symbol Marlo Manners is sought to intervene in a political dispute between nations, which leads to chaos.','/zWSHj9oSGWevfJicBHirkBLHcMa.jpg','1978-03-03',85,'Released','She won\'t be satisfied until she\'s loved by all mankind, one man at a time.','Sextette',116760,1.6032,4,'as6Iv5R1G0M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7599,_binary '\0','/55k4k2KeYvZDFOHzKoZTrCsDQA0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078239',4.3,7677,'en','Sgt. Pepper\'s Lonely Hearts Club Band','A small town band makes it big, but loses track of their roots, as they get caught up into the big-time machinations of the music biz. Now, they must thwart a plot to destroy their home town. Built around the music of The Beatles, this musical uses some big name groups like Peter Frampton and Aerosmith.','/Ben7ogJNNjWhzwVeo7LZYgiHPH.jpg','1978-07-21',111,'Released','A splendid time is guaranteed for all!','Sgt. Pepper\'s Lonely Hearts Club Band',36759,3.1237,4.4,'PQf5Q9NQvhA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7600,_binary '\0','/Hn10dZqkUfr18pQZYMKzCFPPCP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078243',7.6,20728,'zh','少林三十六房','During the Qing Dynasty, a fishmonger is killed by the reigning Manchu government for supporting the anti-government movement; his son manages to escape to Shaolin Temple, where he plans to learn its secretive brand of martial arts to seek revenge.','/ldLQCM3TdzOlprGtnKz02noIXsQ.jpg','1978-02-02',116,'Released','He who struggles initially, might succeed eventually, and even finally.','The 36th Chamber of Shaolin',11841,4.6608,7.5,'dx43uPkFwTY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7601,_binary '\0','/AieuZkb1u3O8BNoZW5apmlBCzEz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078251',6.4,3284,'cn','蛇鶴八步','Jackie Chan stars as the young warrior Hsu Yiu Fong. Hsu has been entrusted with the book of the \"Art of the Snake and Crane,\" after the mysterious disappearance of the eight Shaolin Masters who had written it. He must fight off numerous clans who are all attempting to steal the book from him, to find out the true reason for the disappearance of the Shaolin Masters.','/r4okXfWfTdnZESaEkBeFnAJrTmI.jpg','1978-03-08',96,'Released',NULL,'Snake & Crane Arts of Shaolin',35170,2.9094,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7602,_binary '\0','/jPybVtmqT68Pw0LCLXeypViQPFh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078252',7.3,14318,'cn','蛇形刁手','Everyone abuses and humiliates a downtrodden orphan until he befriends an old man, who turns out to be the last master of the snake fist fighting style. Jackie becomes the old man\'s student and finds himself in battle with the master of the eagle\'s claw style, who has vowed to destroy the snake fist clan.','/oCt4990zVSNILSU0Q6DStmdbpIA.jpg','1978-03-01',98,'Released',NULL,'Snake in the Eagle\'s Shadow',11537,5.4644,7.3,'YdQ_7mhfqNw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7603,_binary '\0','/vImleBhNfUQXxmWXivZsA2Bc4Lb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078259',6.5,6198,'en','The Shout','A traveller by the name of Crossley forces himself upon a musician and his wife in a lonely part of Devon, and uses the aboriginal magic he has learned to displace his host.','/xwfcl8BZGWTnVGBmMn4axvKDiAr.jpg','1978-06-16',86,'Released','A film of intense perversity - the madness of the mind.','The Shout',48131,2.8301,6,'Q3PKNygNQVQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7604,_binary '\0','/uU0N4WJjQlExGM7MBkla2qAGBrr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078269',7.4,9390,'en','The Silent Partner','Toronto, Canada. A few days before Christmas, Miles Cullen, a bored teller working at a bank branch located in a shopping mall, accidentally learns that the place is about to be robbed when he finds a disconcerting note on one of the counters.','/mN5kB6uXIKETr2DcsG0u3wSFolN.jpg','1978-09-07',102,'Released','It\'s not about the money… It\'s about revenge.','The Silent Partner',25338,3.1299,7.06,'iHck4aO33IE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7605,_binary '\0','/1TuV089QOQ46WhA2q4kelBYIvUK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078277',4.1,1639,'en','Spawn of the Slithis','A nuclear leak creates a mutant Slithis sea monster, which terrorizes the variety of pets, winos, and hippies who hang around Venice, California.','/kk2yyfgTA9qtBhtu7016jdeOzJP.jpg','1978-07-21',86,'Released','Hell hath no fury... like Slithis','Spawn of the Slithis',83172,1.5983,4.5,'ASqk9LPMckw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7606,_binary '\0','/otb0Qr7dgdS3fiPkJq3txaruFLI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078288',6.3,2315,'it','Solamente nero','A schoolgirl was murdered seven years ago, and the case was never solved; now, the murderer seems to be back.','/1BeYs9TuxUDCuMTqywwmBwKZhGo.jpg','1978-06-02',109,'Released','Once the killing had started… it could never stop!','The Bloodstained Shadow',99261,1.5446,6.2,'4vuyP6xt_1s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7607,_binary '\0','/k2ReC71gRNxpyXYHfI09h5mqGtE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078295',6.5,6576,'en','Someone\'s Watching Me!','A young woman moves to a high-rise apartment building and soon begins to be tormented by an unknown stalker who seems to know her every move.','/o5pIEWzjnMMz7WgOcB6wVXayE0D.jpg','1978-11-29',97,'Released','All those windows… and he’s behind one of them!','Someone\'s Watching Me!',31428,3.0549,6.217,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7608,_binary '\0','/uyHzWxaM03PWnDJc5ps8ZmohCGT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078299',8.1,2374,'fa','سوته دلان','Desiderium lyrically charts the hapless loves of a three brother: Majid, they young handicapped brother with a deformed head falls in love with Aghdas, a prostitute hired by his eldest brother Habib to entertain him, not knowing the truth about her profession. Karim, the middle brother is so infatuated with a quail that he almost completely ignores his wife and her emotions. Habib himself is in love with Foroogh, a tailor lady who lives with them, while his sense of responsibility about Majid keeps him from requiting her affections.','/aWqNn2VJYWPKuxvnydKESmpc08z.jpg','1977-11-24',120,'Released',NULL,'Desiderium',315023,1.0312,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7609,_binary '\0','/oEEh71KLuqPxtKYF1PYbhpSuYqM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078300',5.1,1718,'it','La sorella di Ursula','While searching for their estranged mother, two beautiful sisters, Dagmar and Ursula, arrive at a luxurious seaside hotel. At the same time, a mysterious killer starts murdering promiscuous women in the area.','/iIvZxR9okIOmXiDoeFZgeihaz9g.jpg','1978-10-18',95,'Released',NULL,'The Sister of Ursula',91256,2.3524,4.931,'5nI8-7fHt0o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7610,_binary '\0','/aKEINUeg3y324PxOwZfwM0uWmk7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078308',5,1263,'en','Spider-Man Strikes Back','At the New York State University, one of Peter Parker\'s tutors has accidentally given three students all the materials they need to create an atomic bomb. While Peter Parker tries to find out what\'s happened, the police suspect him of the crime, and Peter has to deal with an attractive journalist determined to get an interview with Spider-Man. Then dastardly millionaire Mr. White shows up, and will stop at nothing to get his hands on the atomic bomb. Spider-Man must defeat this scheming villain and stop him blowing up the World Trade Centre.','/mwRss4cA5m4fH6izoTwwPfF3ZOU.jpg','1978-12-21',89,'Released','His greatest challenge...','Spider-Man Strikes Back',225925,2.7448,5.8,'Xfj41ol5M5k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7611,_binary '\0','/css92P5JvODJEWXp38Eo7qZdFd6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078320',5,1658,'de','Steiner - Das Eiserne Kreuz Teil II','Starting in late May 1944, during the German retreat on the Eastern Front, Captain Stransky (Helmut Griem) orders Sergeant Steiner (Richard Burton) to blow up a railway tunnel to prevent Russian forces from using it. Steiner\'s platoon fails in its mission by coming up against a Russian tank. Steiner then takes a furlough to Paris just as the Allies launch their invasion of Normandy.','/n0XQXNSbDsHaJYHwuPPa8IfjmBY.jpg','1979-03-01',93,'Released','Burton...Mitchum...Steiger...Enemies...Yet Allies In Combat With Destiny!','Breakthrough',10841,2.6659,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7612,_binary '\0','/pEZ2w4DGCJD4DoK7ifQZLUDT7oK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078326',7.4,11576,'en','Straight Time','After being released on parole, a burglar attempts to go straight, get a regular job, and just go by the rules. He soon finds himself back in jail at the hands of a power-hungry parole officer.','/qht8SAqj7dEeEzv9yXalFB35ycb.jpg','1978-03-18',114,'Released','\"Please God, don\'t let him get caught.\"','Straight Time',23397,3.4081,7.1,'guSVEVHeloo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7613,_binary '\0','/r8x3hxKHt7rrG1yAWuYCs7uFtAQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078330',5.5,3690,'en','Stranger in Our House','After a country family of five take in charming cousin Julie, whose parents recently died in a car crash, their teenage daughter Rachel grows to suspect that Julie has a sinister agenda.','/jgyK4IzdzgTWUuBkjpPeDYgsJqz.jpg','1979-08-16',99,'Released','Can she survive a nightmare of evil?','Stranger in Our House',37938,2.787,5.3,'HeDCg1CiXvA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7614,_binary '\0','/zr2ScyHN6mvkUk7rHpLR19FR8NQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078333',4.4,1316,'en','The Stud','Fontaine Khaled is the London wife of wealthy Arab businessman Benjamin, whose money she blows on partying and on her nightclub, \"The Hobo\". She hires handsome Tony to manage her club, but it\'s understood that his job security is dependent on his satisfying her nymphomaniacal demands. He soon loses interest, and turns his attention to her stepdaughter Alexandra, who uses him to get back at Fontaine for cheating on her father.','/sNduWNPPh2qy0npxKCKIEZi5LC8.jpg','1978-08-17',96,'Released','...satisfaction guaranteed','The Stud',120386,1.6123,4.9,'wB_HhxJr6ZM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7615,_binary '\0','/jf8burkyGfZcKURKYBKae7pAK9X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078343',5.1,2731,'it','Suor Omicidi','A demented nun sliding through morphine addiction into madness, while presiding over a regime of lesbianism, torture and death. Sister Gertrude is the head nurse/nun in a general hospital, whose increasingly psychotic behavior endangers the staff and patients around her.','/eAFJOwTZWU13kC1q3o8vQah2MWH.jpg','1979-05-09',89,'Released','From the Secret Files of the Vatican!','Killer Nun',42211,1.8901,4.824,'9afZlt1LlAE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7616,_binary '\0','/5PfHGXosySGs0l1JfeREspy3v6G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078346',7.4,208909,'en','Superman','Mild-mannered Clark Kent works as a reporter at the Daily Planet alongside his crush, Lois Lane. Clark must summon his superhero alter-ego when the nefarious Lex Luthor launches a plan to take over the world.','/d7px1FQxW4tngdACVRsCSaZq0Xl.jpg','1978-12-14',144,'Released','You\'ll believe a man can fly.','Superman',1924,17.6913,7.168,'cvrRJ5RzmaI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7617,_binary '\0','/85DvqETKn8IF0bq74cY8H56NPU8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078350',4.5,9478,'en','The Swarm','Scientist Dr. Bradford Crane and army general Thalius Slater join forces to fight an almost invisible enemy threatening America; killer bees that have deadly venom and attack without reason. Disaster movie-master Irwin Allen\'s film contains spectacular special effects, including a train crash caused by the eponymous swarm.','/pO5qEEpjxdQ40ScLcFOowyziNiT.jpg','1978-06-26',116,'Released','Monsters by the millions - and they\'re all for real!','The Swarm',46878,3.2627,5,'Q1UjsSY0BFI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7618,_binary '\0','/w8I8hCd9ohuTIEA4d2Jsj9cINHS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078355',8.1,5773,'tr','Sürü','Because of a local blood feud, a peasant family decides to sell its sheep - a most precious commodity - in far away Ankara. During their long train ride, bribes must be paid to petty officials, sheep are stolen or die in the packed, airless wagons, and the sick wife of one of the family\'s sons becomes deathly ill.','/4Yb9BEfdcWvdbV9O7DNUWU1bidz.jpg','1978-09-27',117,'Released',NULL,'The Herd',84014,0.9623,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7619,_binary '\0','/k2rK35gM0OoEOufrUo2ELVONosA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078382',5.5,3572,'en','Thank God It\'s Friday','It\'s Friday and everyone is going to the hottest new disco in Los Angeles. The Commodores are scheduled to play if Floyd shows up with the instruments and Nicole dreams of becoming a disco star. Other characters are there to win the dance contest, or to put a little excitement into a fifth anniversary.','/tZQsCjoenn7IqoIKBDMMd202huH.jpg','1978-05-19',89,'Released','After 5000 years of civilization, we all need a break.','Thank God It\'s Friday',42212,2.3856,5.3,'2QyAyvg0maA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7620,_binary '\0','/k9XrJkxjMxlYjNvMIIwjhqn0TQH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078389',6.6,3218,'en','The Thirty Nine Steps','The year is 1914 and Richard Hannay, Mining Engineer who is visiting Britain for a short time before returning to South Africa, is shocked when one of his neighbours, Colonel Scudder, bursts into his rooms one night and tells him a story that Prussian \'sleeper\' agents are planning to pre-start World War I by murdering a visiting foreign minister. However, Scudder is murdered and Hannay is framed for the death by the \'sleepers\'. Fleeing to Scotland Hannay attempts to clear his name and to stop the agents with the aid of Alex Mackenzie but not only is he is chased by Chief Supt Lomas for Scudder\'s death but by the agents who are headed by Appleton who has managed to hide himself in a high-placed position in the British Government...','/pnUMLpPoce6wslljzhePJQlaEnx.jpg','1978-11-04',102,'Released','Every second counts in the adventure of a lifetime!','The Thirty Nine Steps',60287,2.6227,6.8,'v_E365Wh0HM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7621,_binary '\0','/47y1ZZGpQOSF9ITg7YTlTMecce3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078398',4.7,2343,'en','Ilsa, the Tigress of Siberia','Siberia 1953: Ilsa is now working in a Gulag prison camp. Her mission is to \"retrain the minds\" of those who don\'t agree with the communists.','/r8zD8k2TKzEeLBtmgnEZk0XGxPs.jpg','1977-09-29',92,'Released','When she bares her claws ... You\'ll cringe with fear!','Ilsa, the Tigress of Siberia',28746,3.0335,4.9,'EgCBWJP9GZo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7622,_binary '\0','/sdr6xFfj6HSTPvyA1WR9dKYHmZ1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078405',5.2,5703,'en','The Toolbox Murders','A ski-masked maniac kills apartment complex tenants with the contents of a toolbox.','/d9ghDjhGW5zQ0MYFFWG8ioH70uE.jpg','1978-03-03',93,'Released','Bit by bit...By bit he carved a nightmare!','The Toolbox Murders',27495,2.4703,5.548,'4P6YS-QCb9I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7623,_binary '\0','/qyuUtggGUUPB9yc5Phg2lAYpuSG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078417',4,1989,'es','The Bermuda Triangle','The passengers and crew of a boat on a summer cruise in the Caribbean stray into the famed Bermuda Triangle and mysterious things start happening.','/bpdRJaCC6xhj0NfmuYF64MQNTE5.jpg','1978-02-10',112,'Released','What strange forces are at work here?','The Bermuda Triangle',160816,1.941,4.1,'rO5Cpr1Nbg8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7624,_binary '\0','/4Lve3AOBWTBkrQj42LmmCib7v5y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078418',7.6,2852,'hi','त्रिशूल','Vijay Kumar is the illegitimate son of a construction baron, Raj Kumar Gupta and his first love, Shanti, whom Raj had given up in order to marry a wealthy heiress. Raj does not know of this son, who grows up and after his mother\'s death comes to Delhi to take revenge on the Gupta family by destroying the family\'s business and their relation with each other.','/tmxAyMFJRYDambW54HnSs5lqfpY.jpg','1978-05-05',167,'Released',NULL,'Trishul',108016,1.4644,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7625,_binary '\0','/9ozakGBc59GQGwv0K8b2nZRtC6h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078435',5,1934,'ja','宇宙からのメッセージ','The peaceful planet of Jillucia has been nearly wiped out by the Gavanas, whose leader takes orders from his mother rather than the Emperor. King Kaiba sends out eight Liabe holy seeds, each to be received by a chosen one to defend the Gavanas. Each recipient, ranging from hardened General Garuda to Gavana Prince Hans to young Terrans Meia, Kido, and Aaron all have different reactions to being chosen.','/gLUYuY5dc4zE44zQ5tHN58Dy0vO.jpg','1978-04-29',105,'Released','Where fantasies are real & reality is fantastic.','Message from Space',54160,2.1854,5.9,'9Id84sEppHY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7626,_binary '\0','/xVkseUmDqseTua63V48ihhEnq8u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078437',5.9,4673,'it','Ultimo mondo cannibale','An oil prospector escapes from capture by a primitive cannibal tribe in the Philippine rain forest and heads out to locate his missing companion and their plane to return home.','/q5MEqvaBLueVEEnetKdhax0DXhy.jpg','1977-02-08',93,'Released','A stone-age world of horrors ... ONLY ONE SURVIVED.','Last Cannibal World',30876,2.8903,5.8,'iRWouwvwoaU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7627,_binary '\0','/nBSIspn1vSfBfZSBd26o2JbADnF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078444',7.2,6994,'en','An Unmarried Woman','A wealthy woman from Manhattan\'s Upper East Side struggles to deal with her new identity and her sexuality after her husband of 16 years leaves her for a younger woman.','/pJ6BLvNcLhNxvVCGgTynO5BJtQq.jpg','1978-05-24',124,'Released','She laughs, she cries, she feels angry, she feels lonely, she feels guilty, she makes breakfast, she makes love, she makes do, she is strong, she is weak, she is brave, she is scared, she is… an unmarried woman.','An Unmarried Woman',38731,3.141,6.767,'xneTKSwNkug','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7628,_binary '\0','/eEG0Wq8TFg11HFuaKnetw0dQNUy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078446',6.9,43935,'en','Up in Smoke','An unemployed pot-smoking slacker and amateur drummer, Anthony Stoner ditches his strict parents and hits the road, eventually meeting kindred spirit Pedro de Pacas. While the drug-ingesting duo is soon arrested for possession of marijuana, Anthony and Pedro get released on a technicality, allowing them to continue their many misadventures and ultimately compete in a rock band contest, where they perform the raucous tune \"Earache My Eye.\"','/bZclIeyzmybXLe3hTbFOIqlyPE0.jpg','1978-09-15',86,'Released','It will make you feel VERY funny!','Up in Smoke',11455,4.7527,6.621,'zpvv81988v0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7629,_binary '\0','/lQH7ZASIhyXwfvN71FbFSrHq8BY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078467',7.1,2809,'fr','Violette Nozière','Paris, 1933. The daughter of a respectable lower middle class couple, Violette Nozière, leads a disreputable double life. Far from being the innocent 18-year-old her parents mistake her for, she spends her nights with dissolute young men in the less salubrious areas of the city.','/6I5SxAjsNSXtaZZ1M7clcRmhfgW.jpg','1978-05-24',124,'Released','The Story of an Extraordinary Crime.','Violette Nozière',2813,2.3542,6.706,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7630,_binary '\0','/3E1pZ1DR7hfC7SOAkO2tFnh2HiV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078474',5.5,3320,'en','Warlords of Atlantis','Searching for the lost world of Atlantis, Prof. Aitken, his son Charles and Greg Collinson are betrayed by the crew of their expedition\'s ship, attracted by the fabulous treasures of Atlantis. The diving bell disabled, a deep sea monster attacks the boat. They are all dragged to the bottom of the sea where they meet the inhabitants of the lost continent, an advanced alien race that makes sailors their slaves.','/r3NqnqdTxkN1GxpgEwlw6GTDq7g.jpg','1978-05-01',96,'Released','An incredible tale of terror and suspense... above and below the sea.','Warlords of Atlantis',30117,4.4285,5.7,'A4POKzW3rys','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7631,_binary '\0','/wJmrzkRyOYwMed24E7QcwrLVFIF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078477',6.1,1624,'en','The Water Babies','Grimes, an amoral chimney sweep, occasionally likes to steal valuables from his clients. One day, on the verge of being caught, he frames his young apprentice, Tom, for the crime. Tom runs away and jumps into a river where, instead of drowning, he finds himself transformed into a mystical aquatic creature. Swimming and breathing effortlessly, he discovers a colorful underwater world replete with creatures both cruel and kind.','/vpgFomQKyvpsxazK0SB5pB7S8xo.jpg','1978-06-23',92,'Released','Catch a Wave to a World Full of Wonder!','The Water Babies',34467,2.1806,6.2,'-ACpWUFttTI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7632,_binary '\0','/fcp2yZ6ZzrV7RVVbU8BSKhOmpzN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078480',7.5,43847,'en','Watership Down','When the warren belonging to a community of rabbits is threatened, a brave group led by Fiver, Bigwig, Blackberry and Hazel leave their homeland in a search of a safe new haven.','/q9ZcNxfquJbMTd6UfhAlJbmLBts.jpg','1978-10-14',92,'Released','All the world will be your enemy, Prince with a Thousand Enemies, and when they catch you, they will kill you... but first they must catch you.','Watership Down',11837,5.2671,7.2,'PKYgmsjZzUM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7633,_binary '\0','/jZDD1orkxLkTBllVqV8IboeDi3v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078481',7,4295,'en','A Wedding','Muffin\'s wedding to Dino Corelli is to be a big affair. Except the ageing priest isn\'t too sure of the ceremony, only the families actually turn up as the Corelli Italian connection is suspect, security guards watch the gifts rather over-zealously, and Dino\'s grandma expires in bed just as the reception starts. Could be quite an occasion.','/u7cs5RMLbnA6a0u87ychiyHdxbV.jpg','1978-09-27',125,'Released','More than one Family Secret hides behind A Wedding','A Wedding',45695,2.0361,6.3,'nRr-6_sRVDs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7634,_binary '\0','/pxguvoO28L6VGNZ5NgpPZA6WLNo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078488',6.4,3024,'en','Who Is Killing the Great Chefs of Europe?','Mystery abounds when it is discovered that, one by one, the greatest chefs in Europe are being killed. The intriguing part of the murders is that each chef is killed in the same manner that their own special dish is prepared in. Food critics and the (many) self-proclaimed greatest chefs in Europe demand the mystery be solved.','/N98Pdb4hdNqZsYO5bBXXb897RS.jpg','1978-09-13',112,'Released','The Mystery-Comedy That Tastes as Good as It Looks','Who Is Killing the Great Chefs of Europe?',42216,2.3312,6.2,'05YIFRMKI0o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7635,_binary '\0','/70h14yIq4UQ52dSuCD7eLDgpnDs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078490',6.6,3897,'en','Who\'ll Stop the Rain','John, a disillusioned Vietnam War journalist, turns to heroin smuggling. He cons Ray, an equally burnt out veteran into delivering the drugs stateside to his wife. Everything soon falls apart and Ray ends up on the run with John\'s wife trying to evade crooked narcotics agents.','/rnJepCsvb2adCmEmCSDBqhTV2Wy.jpg','1978-08-02',126,'Released','A week ago they were strangers. An hour ago they were lovers. Now they are targets.','Who\'ll Stop the Rain',31941,3.7454,6.442,'BNUWm7DSFWI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7636,_binary '\0','/egamWHfqdyHwHHHTFp6hyjG0hT9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078492',6.8,15942,'en','The Wild Geese','A British multinational company seeks to overthrow a vicious dictator in central Africa. It hires a band of (largely aged) mercenaries in London and sends them in to save the virtuous but imprisoned opposition leader who is also critically ill and due for execution. Just when the team has performed a perfect rescue, the multinational does a deal with the vicious dictator leaving the mercenary band to escape under their own steam and exact revenge.','/sISC4RURtA5l8QXcnVgK3dP0VHn.jpg','1978-06-28',134,'Released',NULL,'The Wild Geese',7010,5.9098,6.8,'Tg_kgX2CEOU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7637,_binary '\0','/4CILG3fepXV2niGGp8XIJHDDOHZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078504',5.7,20031,'en','The Wiz','Dorothy Gale, a shy kindergarten teacher, is swept away to the magic land of Oz where she embarks on a quest to return home.','/rgfB8hBRSwbEb0SK7pt9mW9jsyP.jpg','1978-10-24',134,'Released','The wiz! The stars! The music! Wow!','The Wiz',24961,5.7011,6.235,'6lAEKXV7O4c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7638,_binary '\0','/mc7tt8Xenubu31lW6W1j54rfKgI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078513',7.1,1893,'ja','柳生一族の陰謀','Following the death of the second Tokugawa shogun, it is revealed that he was poisoned by retainers of his son Iemitsu in hopes of gaining him the shogunate despite the stammer and birthmark which undermine his respect. Iemitsu and his brother Tadanaga become bitter rivals for the shogunate, and the land is split into factions, eventually erupting into warfare. Iemitsu\'s mentor, his fencing instructor Yagyu, is fixated upon securing Iemitsu the shogunate and ends up betraying everyone, even his own family, in pursuit of the goal.','/jodipMyJcNwdSDfWJ6Chr2BG84k.jpg','1978-01-21',130,'Released',NULL,'Shogun\'s Samurai: The Yagyu Clan Conspiracy',34546,1.9727,7,'-XUzUorbiXs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7639,_binary '\0','/9EZN68wCWCe9MQKSFmm2ndRYKsa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078517',7.2,1752,'cn','贊先生與找錢華','In an attempt to save his village from being taken over by brutes, Wah is beaten to a pulp and his mother brutally murdered. Determined to take revenge, Wah learns the art of Wing Chun and enters into a showdown with the nasty villains.','/vTuruwDwrvzjJH5hTNT9PNRL3RH.jpg','1978-12-28',95,'Released','The definitive tribute to the legend of Wing Chun.','Warriors Two',64316,2.5496,7.3,'2uG5fQwbAgo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7640,_binary '\0','/msk2t0Lriy9vbGWPSEI1hH3ZcUJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078528',6.4,4732,'fr','La Zizanie','Guillaume has made it: A machine that can clean dirty air by simply sucking all dirt into air balloons and then shipping them far far away so his explanation. Some Japanese business guys, after dinner with a lot of alcohol, order 5,000 pieces. His only problem: His production capacity is way to small so he gets to produce the machines in his private house. His wife Bernadette is far from being happy about it. Her private life goes down the line so she decides to leave Guillaume and to finally have revenge she candidates for major against her husband...','/lQ3IUf65maoUtVIhfHurD0KzduD.jpg','1978-03-16',90,'Released',NULL,'The Discord',11530,2.325,6.381,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7641,_binary '\0','/2Le14AZIvSfi08Cr2XA2UFJ8mdR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078718',7.4,46646,'en','...And Justice for All','An ethical Baltimore defense lawyer disgusted with rampant legal corruption is forced to defend a judge he despises in a rape trial under the threat of being disbarred.','/fGFkpJUsouxxBGWfYqeuJfH210T.jpg','1979-10-19',119,'Released','Once in a while someone fights back.','...And Justice for All',17443,5.9689,7.1,'m6-tlGGKYcI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7642,_binary '\0','/rlu0VPvvRZWbcX4OTlv8C1lDorz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078721',6.2,19349,'en','10','A Hollywood songwriter goes through a mid-life crisis and becomes infatuated with a sexy blonde newlywed.','/uUCr4WTogPnb7LOILL8opxSyxGw.jpg','1979-10-05',122,'Released','A temptingly tasteful comedy for adults who can count.','10',9051,4.3162,5.8,'HsI1gzpvWR4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7643,_binary '\0','/wtJIV3BI3FbCJ2wKJCb9KngdEv2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078723',5.7,40179,'en','1941','In the days after the attack on Pearl Harbor, panic grips California, where a military officer leads a mob chasing a Japanese sub.','/52Bn5yC6IHQuVxPUza3Q6RZCZTu.jpg','1979-12-14',118,'Released','Soon the screen will be bombarded by the most explosive barrage of クソッ ever filmed.','1941',11519,5.3376,5.8,'6_KOLqpo7z8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7644,_binary '\0','/4YHUI1X2N2i39Sr2zY1CrAwkh33.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078736',6.2,4021,'en','Agatha','England, 1926. An American journalist looks for mystery writer Agatha Christie when she suddenly disappears without explanation, leaving no trace.','/rxjoGsAvcMUM23ciIYOERGZUxSE.jpg','1979-02-09',99,'Released','On December 4th, 1926, Agatha Christie, the world\'s most famous mystery writer, disappeared. What may have happened during the next eleven days is far more suspenseful than anything she ever wrote.','Agatha',31200,2.0453,6.1,'bO8FjkULpQ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7645,_binary '\0','/bPGJgUhxuyRmTJZIiJhMutfdHJo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078740',4.5,7691,'en','The Concorde... Airport \'79','Aviation disaster-prone Joe Patroni must contend with nuclear missiles, the French Air Force and the threat of the plane splitting in two over the Alps.','/bsKUgMi01dme7IDdEWRJSMBNj6R.jpg','1979-08-17',123,'Released','At twice the speed of sound, can the Concorde evade attack?','The Concorde... Airport \'79',29723,4.1476,4.723,'teIkS6Fdw2w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7646,_binary '\0','/AmR3JG1VQVxU8TfAvljUhfSFUOx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078748',8.4,1076744,'en','Alien','During its return to the earth, commercial spaceship Nostromo intercepts a distress signal from a distant planet. When a three-member team of the crew discovers a chamber containing thousands of eggs on the planet, a creature inside one of the eggs attacks an explorer. The entire crew is unaware of the impending nightmare set to descend upon them when the alien parasite planted inside its unfortunate host is birthed.','/vfrQk5IPloGg1v9Rzbh2Eg3VGyM.jpg','1979-05-25',117,'Released','In space no one can hear you scream.','Alien',348,35.7329,8.174,'L2VWfWC-wI4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7647,_binary '\0','/qB9ByLtpl0soAgntH9sIOUxReVx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078749',3.7,1978,'it','Alien 2 - Sulla terra','A group of cave explorers are confronted in an underground cavern by a mysterious living rock. Little do they know that it bears home to deadly, flesh-eating creatures, intent on wiping out the entire human population. An ultra low-budget, unofficial and unauthorized sequel to the 1979 film Alien, although the plot has little connection to the original film.','/3spieazZ7PYxRovI4X6deQX8F2l.jpg','1980-04-11',85,'Released',NULL,'Alien 2: On Earth',42872,2.4265,3.5,'Zd68r8Fo3sY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7648,_binary '\0','/l84VREaJb5h2rY3ffBqQKeTTECF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078751',5.9,1820,'en','Alison\'s Birthday','During a Ouija board session with her teenaged friends, 16-year-old Alison gets a message from beyond the grave not to go home for her birthday three years later.','/uiVFQQPhuUr7gr9uzXQ8jcm3zXS.jpg','1981-05-01',99,'Released','She\'ll never forget her party… and neither will you!','Alison\'s Birthday',147641,1.502,5.3,'Lyqh3SHNvTs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7649,_binary '\0','/Awo2WTB3p5NDGniBHZ8lRuKczR0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078753',7.1,11628,'en','All Quiet on the Western Front','At the start of World War I, Paul Baumer is a young German patriot, eager to fight. Indoctrinated with propaganda at school, he and his friends eagerly sign up for the army soon after graduation. But when the horrors of war soon become too much to bear, and as his friends die or become gravely wounded, Paul questions the sanity of fighting over a few hundreds yards of war-torn countryside.','/lQdUlvbX6DfJruknXbyOmZK7RoS.jpg','1979-11-14',150,'Released','They left for war as boys, never to return as men.','All Quiet on the Western Front',10912,4.3991,6.7,'xl4A2fJG4ws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7650,_binary '\0','/u218sykbUQIh6EWtTdJzguU5LcG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078754',7.8,41278,'en','All That Jazz','Joe Gideon is at the top of the heap, one of the most successful directors and choreographers in musical theater. But he can feel his world slowly collapsing around him - his obsession with work has almost destroyed his personal life, and only his bottles of pills keep him going.','/culCEdj4srLljefgn4XKd6k3C5t.jpg','1979-12-16',123,'Released','All that work. All that glitter. All that pain. All that love. All that crazy rhythm.','All That Jazz',16858,6.5864,7.5,'8_aIhkKlrwk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7651,_binary '\0','/zMzh7y3bcvFdHxPFedOOp8zFgOS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078763',7.8,9243,'pl','Amator','Filip buys an 8mm movie camera when his first child is born. Because it\'s the first camera in town, he\'s named official photographer by the local Party boss. His horizons widen when he is sent to regional film festivals with his first works but his focus on movie making also leads to domestic strife and philosophical dilemmas.','/q2GE3qqj5tecyJ31ifjUjPrrzo8.jpg','1979-11-16',112,'Released',NULL,'Camera Buff',42164,1.8602,7.5,'D8HS50Cp2Ag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7652,_binary '\0','/y666syISUPxZePuWUCzzunKQWjY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078764',6.8,1970,'en','An American Christmas Carol','In Depression-era New England, a miserly businessman named Benedict Slade receives a long-overdue attitude adjustment one Christmas Eve when he is visited by three ghostly figures who resemble three of the people whose possessions Slade had seized to collect on unpaid loans. Assuming the roles of the Ghosts of Christmas Past, Present, and Future from Charles Dickens\' classic story, the three apparitions force Slade to face the consequences of his skinflint ways, and he becomes a caring, generous, amiable man.','/uLGpoMTIgVXeV6vmRozjpRtpuL4.jpg','1979-12-16',98,'Released','Charles Dicken\'s Victorian London becomes America\'s great Depression in this exciting new film','An American Christmas Carol',52055,1.6578,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7653,_binary '\0','/gN5OCSeJTJcsYWlQBjJVKwV3zBS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078767',6.2,49576,'en','The Amityville Horror','George Lutz, his wife Kathy, and their three children have just moved into a beautiful, and improbably cheap, Victorian mansion nestled in the sleepy coastal town of Amityville, Long Island. However, their dream home is concealing a horrific past and soon each member of the Lutz family is plagued with increasingly strange and violent visions and impulses.','/7VMscq0659xKmcXzd86de1DGV4W.jpg','1979-07-27',118,'Released','For God\'s sake, get out!','The Amityville Horror',11449,6.2026,6.3,'f1NHTILX0QE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7654,_binary '\0','/7LmhNfSkSkE296AvQbLZK4jgbnp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078771',7,8322,'fr','L\'Amour en fuite','Now in his thirties, Antoine Doinel is a divorced proofreader in love with a record seller. Colette Tazzi, now a lawyer, buys his first published autobiography, leading them to a chance meeting.','/nfRNUq4TG4isD236QJ8pSPXeGnC.jpg','1979-01-24',93,'Released','Antoine Doinel. He\'s got four ladies ... Nine lives ... and Plenty of alibis!','Love on the Run',259,2.8307,7.034,'-PNKgCsQsUc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7655,_binary '\0','/nSG1Ydpdo0cjVrbrxozU1YdPpAk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078778',2.3,2193,'en','Angels\' Brigade','Seven women decide to fight the local drug cartel. When Las Vegas pop singer Michelle\'s brother is found severely beaten, he\'s discovered to have been on illegal drugs. Michelle meets with April, her brother\'s teacher, who reveals that she\'s secretly been gathering intelligence on the cartel\'s local processing plant, and Michelle agrees to help April with a plan to destroy the plant. With Michelle\'s fame opening the door, they recruit four more women with special skills and connections to help them carry out their audacious goal.','/l4TzXV6PiMndm1Hdm3Uvs9cVHZ3.jpg','1979-02-01',97,'Released','They\'ll blow you away!','Angels\' Brigade',31251,1.2058,3.1,'43fqIstqGN8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7656,_binary '\0','/poMPSIr5jzLZQU2tDT1J0SewYxY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078780',6.8,2556,'en','Animalympics','Animalympics is all about the Animal Olympics Contest where all the animals around the world gather to take part in everything from skiing in North America to the very long marathon race in humid conditions.','/hmvKcJq7BKObGe0df8lpPHXQil6.jpg','1980-04-11',78,'Released','Presented by ZOO, the network that brings out the beast in sports!','Animalympics',19247,2.3359,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7657,_binary '\0','/ysmDIVncpBpZYeMQ5CFXApcwREf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078784',7.7,1348,'sv','Ett anständigt liv','A decade has gone by and the spirit of the preceding film, Dom kallar oss mods, has disappeared. Kenta is an alcoholic and lives with his girlfriend Eva. Together they have a son, Patric. Kenta\'s mom is in jail for manslaughter and Kenta goes to Kronoberg to greet her. Heroin also comes to play and Stoffe is one of those who falls victim to it. He lives with his girlfriend Lena and their young son, Janne. Lena later throws Stoffe out their home when she gets enough of his abuse, and he is forced to live with his mother. Kenta calls Stoffe and decides to meet him, and he tries to persuade him to give up heroin, but the two have a falling out and they separate. This film features other users from the previous film, such as Jajje and Kenta Bergkvist. The film ends with the death of a prominent person in the trilogy.','/XZm3pCtH6rAYkbLZxs8SncAdQz.jpg','1979-03-26',102,'Released',NULL,'A Respectable Life',56503,1.1215,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7658,_binary '\0','/49fzLedFVKgGgFChLMuulDJBY1c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078788',8.4,778014,'en','Apocalypse Now','At the height of the Vietnam war, Captain Benjamin Willard is sent on a dangerous mission that, officially, \"does not exist, nor will it ever exist.\" His goal is to locate - and eliminate - a mysterious Green Beret Colonel named Walter Kurtz, who has been leading his personal army on illegal guerrilla missions into enemy territory.','/gQB8Y5RCMkv2zwzFHbUJX3kAhvA.jpg','1979-05-19',147,'Released','This is the end...','Apocalypse Now',28,26.0791,8.261,'9l-ViOOFH-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7659,_binary '\0','/4U5jyrK8UmbgPGZXBOSxvfqi3eG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078790',6,3638,'en','The Apple Dumpling Gang Rides Again','Amos and Theodore, the two bumbling outlaw wannabes from The Apple Dumpling Gang, are back and trying to make it on their own. This time, the crazy duo gets involved in an army supply theft case -- and, of course, gets in lots of comic trouble along the way!','/oPGACB1ZfPM9bKlQva2TFpCkWSD.jpg','1979-06-27',88,'Released','As belles, they were ding-dongs... they enlisted, and were rotten to the corps... and when things got hotter... they went to the cooler... now, they\'re on the loose again!','The Apple Dumpling Gang Rides Again',22328,3.222,6.418,'kK3z45uaOOE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7660,_binary '\0','/aaaG2BcSj7AXdC8fNZSo4HgzZmf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078792',5.7,1326,'en','Arabian Adventure','An evil caliph offers his daughter’s hand in marriage to a prince if he can complete a perilous quest for a magical rose. Helped by a young boy and a magic carpet, Prince Hasan has to overcome genies, fire-breathing monsters, and treacherous swamps to reach his prize and claim the hand of the Princess Zuleira.','/9dH9JDUQUygOSqCizzI1R10bnpj.jpg','1979-07-08',99,'Released','Soar into a Magical World of Action, Excitement and Enchantment!','Arabian Adventure',82430,2.8119,5.9,'K0dyw9YGuFw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7661,_binary '\0','/i9aUSqk1eaxFYfBvsRm3G6kBCnv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078797',6.8,4041,'es','Arrebato','José Sirgado is a low-budget filmmaker whose heroin addiction distorts his perspective of the real world. Although he is a depressed and unstable individual, his mood improves when he receives the mysterious films of Pedro, with whom he shares his passion for cinema.','/rJlEhLIVsQHPi2uVM26VK0in9hG.jpg','1980-06-09',110,'Released',NULL,'Rapture',4494,1.4273,6.7,'THr0r_mHXKU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7662,_binary '\0','/iVrLvBY1pI9Cued3zmEPGyfsG1T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078801',5.4,2330,'en','Ashanti','Dr. Anansa Linderby is kidnapped in a medical mission in Africa by a slave trader. From this moment, her husband will do anything to recover her and to punish the bad guys, but that will be not an easy task.','/26Xd07LUsQorC11D9dL6MAVBWkA.jpg','1979-02-21',118,'Released','Only two men could rescue her. One driven by love, the other by revenge.','Ashanti',57926,1.8664,5.813,'Z1KeeHc29mM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7663,_binary '\0','/36GwJFe9Nn865FALqSuhhvzXDla.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078812',4.9,1988,'en','Avalanche Express','CIA agent Harry Wargrave is sent to aid Gen. Marenkov, a senior Russian official, who is defecting to the west. Wargrave decides they should travel to safety on a train across Europe, the \"Atlantic Express\". During the journey, they must survive attacks by terrorists and an avalanche, all planned by Russian spy-catcher Nikolai Bunin.','/mxCZj8tbz64uPcdzdv02ODIeucy.jpg','1979-09-27',85,'Released','The Fast Track For All-Star Adventure.','Avalanche Express',2036,2.1112,4.8,'joxnllqOWmU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7664,_binary '\0','/zPGBsl1DvMtr0KEgkdvy1zaWYtp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078813',6.6,5834,'fr','L\'Avare','The children of Harpagon, Cléante and his sister Elise, are each in love but they still haven’t spoken to their father yet. Harpagon is a miser who wants to choose the right man and the right woman for his children. Based on Molière’s play.','/jgFsAJDaSxNj8xpW3q8kvKtL0Au.jpg','1980-03-05',125,'Released',NULL,'The Miser',11680,3.7516,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7665,_binary '\0','/67t3dSgVDYyG8l2hqToe2BZJdAx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078831',7.6,1219,'es','La batalla de Chile (Parte 3). El Poder Popular','Guzmán’s final installment shifts from covering the actions of Allende’s opponents to those who battled to revive & promote their toppled leader’s vision for a new Chile.','/vF1bO0MY0mOLUOoGkaTOi01zaKC.jpg','1979-03-15',78,'Released',NULL,'The Battle of Chile: Part III',132150,1.1185,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7666,_binary '\0','/8cNxGWBnCsJYxI7Cf56vYggXArm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078836',5.9,3117,'en','Bear Island','A group of people converge on a barren Arctic island. They have their reasons for being there but when a series of mysterious accidents and murders take place, a whole lot of darker motives become apparent. Could the fortune in buried Nazi gold be the key to the mystery? Donald Sutherland and Vanessa Redgrave investigate','/wV47h3DO46jb8eZPluCXq5unHTR.jpg','1979-12-05',118,'Released','Below freezing and beyond fear... Will anyone survive its terror?','Bear Island',38629,2.4178,6.1,'-sWpksBO91M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7667,_binary '\0','/hddFwpiSpmAsVtCvKuKEUEmXAlr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078841',7.9,82614,'en','Being There','A simple-minded gardener named Chance has spent all his life in the Washington D.C. house of an old man. When the man dies, Chance is put out on the street with no knowledge of the world except what he has learned from television.','/yFHi5wiCB45loSa1D1O6KAFMC3A.jpg','1979-12-19',130,'Released','Getting there is half the fun; being there is all of it!','Being There',10322,5.5559,7.6,'oOOghKacg40','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7668,_binary '\0','/ySmAJZRdhPwlHr7XxhF9LZLNJ0F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078846',5.4,3908,'en','Beneath the Valley of the Ultra-Vixens','Believe it or not, even Smalltown USA, those unfulfilled and unrelieved in the midst of plenty reside. Levonna and Lamar could have the perfect relationship, were it not for Lamar\'s obsession with rear entry.','/i1MCj9yhC2qZmfP1Mgh0YKNcd1b.jpg','1979-05-11',93,'Released','Six Chicks in search of a Cluck! ...and so hilariously funny!','Beneath the Valley of the Ultra-Vixens',5157,2.9716,5.3,'GKgPrstGJN0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7669,_binary '\0','/wewqHW59Sloa4PJujVva6gvFAjb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078856',4.7,6622,'en','Beyond the Poseidon Adventure','After \"The Poseidon Adventure\", in which the ship got flipped over by a tidal wave, the ship drifts bottom-up in the sea. While the passengers are still on board waiting to be rescued, two rivaling salvage parties enter the ship on search for money, gold and a small amount of plutonium.','/1hIBVv7ioQg6fZTKb2il7SZTsvh.jpg','1979-05-18',114,'Released','Before her fate is sealed by the deep, the superliner Poseidon will reveal one last secret.','Beyond the Poseidon Adventure',31638,3.6927,5,'ELYBQJyGzHk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7670,_binary '\0','/xLT2nC0nmp6yt8HOZhRCRkkwO6U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078867',3.9,1378,'en','The Bitch','The owner of a trendy disco starts having problems with the men in her life and the Mafia, which is trying to move in on her place.','/qc2xwjbp1OFnthbEe04Hy43IMeM.jpg','1979-09-20',89,'Released','After the Stud','The Bitch',50672,1.5322,4.3,'UF9B2n3r2Ls','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7671,_binary '\0','/j1QLptktNCs09AhNxk5I4bcpVCn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078868',7.4,1247,'hu','Bizalom','Janos and Kata are thrown together during the Second World War and forced to pose as husband and wife to hide from the Nazis. The intensity and suffocating intimacy of their new relationship and the circumstances in which they find themselves, forces them to confront past prejudices and assumptions and challenge what they truly believe.','/fqueQgCoTttLRYMWWp6Kdqh7uk9.jpg','1980-01-10',105,'Released',NULL,'Confidence',49139,1.4805,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7672,_binary '\0','/dfNNSNVdbaFgDt4DLJf55CZsB5L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078869',5.9,30590,'en','The Black Hole','The explorer craft USS Palomino is returning to Earth after a fruitless 18-month search for extra-terrestrial life when the crew comes upon a supposedly lost ship, the USS Cygnus, hovering near a black hole. The ship is controlled by Dr. Hans Reinhardt and his monstrous robot companion, but the initial wonderment and awe the Palomino crew feel for the ship and its resistance to the power of the black hole turn to horror as they uncover Reinhardt\'s plans.','/gCqOJWvOK5UPospyrLANKfwRBlG.jpg','1979-12-19',98,'Released','A journey that begins where everything ends.','The Black Hole',9570,5.8724,5.8,'0FKJNcV9Ym4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7673,_binary '\0','/am84QBW5S17uKUeuWvjLIS8urrr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078872',7.4,15565,'en','The Black Stallion','While traveling with his father, young Alec becomes fascinated by a mysterious Arabian stallion that is brought on board and stabled in the ship he is sailing on. When it tragically sinks both he and the horse survive only to be stranded on a deserted island. He befriends it, so when finally rescued both return to his home where they soon meet Henry Dailey, a once successful trainer. Together they begin training the horse to race against the fastest ones in the world.','/uZtNc31LR5Ik3ZVo2jxwOvhkNRC.jpg','1979-10-13',118,'Released','From the moment he first saw the stallion, he knew it would either destroy him, or carry him where no one had ever been before…','The Black Stallion',17264,4.9272,7.1,'kGp9u56FJKs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7674,_binary '\0','/uZJjc4hMgckb3H3tVkTmbmcBhIT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078875',7.4,28163,'de','Die Blechtrommel','In 1924, Oskar Matzerath is born in the Free City of Danzig. At age three, he falls down a flight of stairs and stops growing. In 1939, World War II breaks out.','/z4QsBWJbbBxct2zU7LnYSOw8UFz.jpg','1979-05-02',162,'Released','A savage, sweeping epic of society in chaos.','The Tin Drum',659,7.4273,7,'NTKLqhT-tTo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7675,_binary '\0','/ewS7KWgEFj8TQ6SeWyJaV2Zlvlh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078879',4.6,2120,'en','Bloodline','A pampered heiress inherits her father\'s pharmaceutical empire when he dies in a suspicious accident, and soon finds herself surrounded by ruthless board members and grasping family members who will seemingly stop at nothing to profit.','/bMiBusE5lhrZN0z4DXHlg3LXkSf.jpg','1979-06-29',116,'Released','The line between love and death is the bloodline.','Bloodline',3013,2.3736,4.9,'qPi9eOJLrGg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7676,_binary '\0','/yNjrT8bsr5WR9bmRjLsIwIoZtFR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078902',7.7,27849,'en','Breaking Away','Dave, nineteen, has just graduated high school, with his three friends: the comical Cyril, the warm hearted but short-tempered Moocher, and the athletic, spiteful but good-hearted Mike. Now, Dave enjoys racing bikes and hopes to race the Italians one day, and even takes up the Italian culture, much to his friends\' and parents\' annoyance.','/k7b5GsVJK1hfdwoYqcczN9pBba6.jpg','1979-05-24',101,'Released','The movie that tells you exactly what you can do with your high school diploma!','Breaking Away',20283,4.1238,7.2,'J1jzs6dk4bs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7677,_binary '\0','/3EJJClmGZwu7e6nsj1l0OBNdXfT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078907',7.4,10335,'fr','Les Bronzés font du ski','In this sequel to Les Bronzes (1978) summer has passed, but that doesn\'t mean the fun has to end for Bernard, Nathalie, Gigi, Jerome, Popeye, Jean-Claude, and Christiane.','/tEiNHF6SqfguCKBdxwukrK10KbH.jpg','1979-11-22',87,'Released',NULL,'French Fried Vacation 2',33701,3.3126,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7678,_binary '\0','/mDr6XaqC9IKA2j35c24cGdc5a0W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078908',6.8,38551,'en','The Brood','A man tries to uncover an unconventional psychologist\'s therapy techniques on his institutionalised wife, amidst a series of brutal murders.','/zSEt4QXRI4Gypd9xvzvucOmPNl5.jpg','1979-05-25',92,'Released','The Ultimate Experience in Inner Terror.','The Brood',28942,4.5765,6.7,'m-8iJ1rsiKA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7679,_binary '\0','/ler7oT35s8nxJ5H1bnoKufvMQzX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078913',7.2,7245,'fr','Buffet froid','Alphonse Tram is unwittingly involved in several murders despite having no memory of committing the crimes. His confusion lead him to confess to his neighbour, Inspector Morvandieu. Alphonse and Morvandieu become the axis around which murders occur.','/j6Yzrhn9bSwJprYTYl0xIC4NNPi.jpg','1979-12-19',93,'Released',NULL,'Buffet Froid',38438,2.1037,7.048,'9GQNSrP8WCU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7680,_binary '\0','/ysL5BiUTbdSaCAXtlzCU507kj6W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078915',7.3,4841,'en','The Bugs Bunny/Road Runner Movie','A collection of Warner Brothers short cartoon features, \"starring\" the likes of Daffy Duck, Porky Pig and Wile E. Coyote. These animations are interspersed by Bugs Bunny reminiscing on past events and providing links between the individual animations which are otherwise unconnected. This 1979 feature-length compilation includes several of his best cartoons. Among the 11 shorts shown in their entirety are the classics \"Robin Hood Daffy,\" \"What\'s Opera, Doc?,\" \"Bully for Bugs,\" and \"Duck Amuck\". The Bugs Bunny Road Runner Movie provides a showcase not only for Jones\'s razor-sharp timing, but for the work of his exceptional crew, which included designer Maurice Noble, writer Mike Maltese, composers Carl Stalling and Milt Franklyn, and voice actor Mel Blanc.','/5fogEHQJvyVkqk1R9ZzVyxtT5gH.jpg','1979-09-28',98,'Released','It\'s classic encounters of the funniest kind!','The Bugs Bunny/Road Runner Movie',20007,2.9699,7.375,'lX51bfLKeb0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7681,_binary '\0','/uLhkS7zERAe4YJVbCSaKrRHsdf9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078916',6.2,6302,'it','Buio Omega','A disturbed young embalmer digs the grave of his recently deceased girlfriend and brings her body to his family villa with help from his strange housekeeper. But his bouts of insanity are just beginning.','/tel3ZG4zvbsR3PPEQlQxCjvWrd1.jpg','1979-11-15',94,'Released','A fate worse than death!','Beyond the Darkness',5425,6.19,6.484,'a59L5e1Xojs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7682,_binary '\0','/6RjZe7tKOcCZwVbyunOSMAfHQKe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078919',5.7,1874,'en','Butch and Sundance: The Early Days','Before the adventures that made them legends, they were charming mastermind Robert Leroy Parker, alias Butch Cassidy, and crack-shot outlaw Harry Alonzo Longabaugh, soon to be known as The Sundance Kid. This is the \'prequel\' of how they met, their first clumsy robberies, the heroic dangers that abound them together, the secret that nearly tore them apart, and the impossible train heist that made them notorious for life. Saddle up and ride with the showdowns, shootouts, bad guys and good times in the days before the fame when fun was the name of the game.','/yW0rCUcp2MdFbZ0SUrsNtikHc82.jpg','1979-06-15',111,'Released','Before the fame when fun was the name of the game.','Butch and Sundance: The Early Days',37598,2.3244,5,'Pj4E2IqSwFA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7683,_binary '\0','/fhPSg2a8tuGfTv3vohoOgRLFhQG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078935',5.7,67916,'it','Cannibal Holocaust','A New York University professor returns from a rescue mission to the Amazon rainforest with the footage shot by a lost team of documentarians who were making a film about the area\'s local cannibal tribes.','/otxZzMh53TsN7yYFqSZ3rwH1yMd.jpg','1980-02-07',96,'Released','They eat and they are eaten!','Cannibal Holocaust',8689,17.4057,6.263,'cZ-Xp6VC7RQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7684,_binary '\0','/cR7nW2Pu0kannWcJjMAPYVlLalb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078936',3.4,1364,'it','Mondo cannibale','A man is on safari in the jungle with his wife and daughter when the wife gets eaten and the daughter is captured by cannibals. Several years later he goes back to see if his daughter is still alive.','/xTQD2oshhOhwn8clVjclavo99xn.jpg','1980-09-15',90,'Released','Kidnapped by cannibals! Raised to eat human flesh!','White Cannibal Queen',104973,5.3593,4.5,'BOKGaiP5j4A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7685,_binary '\0','/l2vddRxLkQGLRXR8OLdC0M3oKQ6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078937',3.5,2782,'en','Captain America','Artist Steve Rogers is nearly murdered by spies, seeking his late father\'s national secrets. He is saved during surgery via a secret formula; this serum not only heals him but also gives him fantastic strength and lightning reflexes. To help solve the mystery behind his father’s murder and bring those guilty to justice, a government agency equips him with a special motorcycle loaded with gadgets and an indestructible shield. Now armed, he battles against the nation\'s enemies as the Sentinel of Liberty, Captain America.','/gNGq4u0cymxZqGADZrx7AWrSB5m.jpg','1979-01-19',97,'Released','Sentinel of Liberty','Captain America',197467,2.9158,3.9,'LD6UJ6hdT7g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7686,_binary '\0','/911CxMNSN8EycQSnTcaIXC7DBx0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078938',3.7,2065,'en','Captain America II: Death Too Soon','Crimefighting Captain America rights more wrongs by doing battle with a fanatical terrorist who uses his deadly drug that causes accelerated aging to finance his world revolution.','/pocmh0P8Ddf5w33pP3Vuqm0JRP9.jpg','1979-11-23',88,'Released','Sentinel of Liberty Returns','Captain America II: Death Too Soon',197481,2.8678,3.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7687,_binary '\0','/op0a9xUPuGskQKwuXr3omz3K158.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078950',6.8,9993,'en','The Champ','Billy used to be a great boxer, but he\'s settled into a hardscrabble life that revolves around drinking, training horses, and the one bright spot in his existence — his young son, T.J. Although Billy has had custody of T.J. since his wife, Annie, left the family years ago, her return prompts a new struggle for the former fighter. Determined to hold on to his son, Billy gets back into the ring to try and recapture his past success.','/8GyHL4TftI4SKVA8Jj9JpthhIu6.jpg','1979-07-07',121,'Released','The more you love... the harder you fight.','The Champ',30547,3.4663,7,'6w5Gqdono-M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7688,_binary '\0','/vi24cJ9TCKYM9JNq0BGl4X4eOL1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078952',6,1443,'en','Chapter Two','George Schneider is an author whose wife had just died. His brother Leo gives him the number of Jennie Malone, and somehow they hit it off. And just when things are moving along, the memory of his first wife comes between them.','/xikReu6tBkPWrTHXUR9ldGWFHQq.jpg','1979-12-14',127,'Released','It\'s not supposed to happen twice in your life, but it can.','Chapter Two',42168,1.6341,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7689,_binary '\0','/iN5jSaKD21AC2wwHaV3BMkiGwKp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078966',7.4,36213,'en','The China Syndrome','While doing a series of reports on alternative energy sources, opportunistic reporter Kimberly Wells witnesses an accident at a nuclear power plant. Wells is determined to publicize the incident, but soon finds herself entangled in a sinister conspiracy to keep the full impact of the incident a secret.','/uHwwQIlt4XwpTFhX9ZT1A8xSW7F.jpg','1979-03-16',122,'Released','People who know the meaning of \"The China Syndrome\" are scared... Soon you will know.','The China Syndrome',988,5.7344,7.122,'bIGH1AfIS18','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7690,_binary '\0','/8zZTHqP8odTc0pgN6N8U8MZjfyd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078975',5.7,2854,'en','Circle of Iron','In a mystical desert kingdom, young martial arts fighter Cord loses a contest to determine who will journey to take the powerful Book of All Knowedge from Zetan, an evil wizard. Despite his lack of a sponsor, Cord\'s rule-breaking nature leads him to try retrieving the book anyway. Help is offered by a mysterious blind man who gives advice as Cord fights his way through multiple opponents, discovering more about himself as he gets closer to Zetan.','/iIlXKisxeMZAWbonYRIrWoqxAGD.jpg','1978-07-25',102,'Released','The challenge of a lifetime...','Circle of Iron',23739,2.41,5.556,'CA0HRb_mk7c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7691,_binary '\0','/rvlIz1uWjzsINYSrzRj4H4yVYP7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0078976',4.5,1793,'en','City on Fire','An ex-employee of a city oil refinery creates an explosion at the facility which starts a chain-reaction of fires that engulf the entire city.','/AlSaxV84P4yEU4kuYBEQAFmtbB5.jpg','1979-07-11',106,'Released','What Happened to Them Could Happen to You... In Any City Anywhere!','City on Fire',140648,2.3348,5.1,'PCgNk8LfGaQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7692,_binary '\0','/j8OfZWpjceQNUeprLfeJGv1DWz1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079002',7.2,2673,'fr','Coup de tête','François, a miserable football player, becomes a town hero after bringing victory in an extremely important game. He uses his fame for revenge on the team star for the previous mockeries.','/fcwt2EwN2WcwXiJutDynMsuLWpc.jpg','1979-02-14',89,'Released',NULL,'Hothead',10792,1.5476,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7693,_binary '\0','/eQK2FZmXTlSMfpZX5PGHSFZCdO8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079010',7.7,4976,'it','Cristo si è fermato a Eboli','In the fascist Italy of 1935, a painter trained as a doctor is exiled to a remote region near Eboli. Over time, he learns to appreciate the beauty and wisdom of the peasants, and to overcome his isolation.','/gHcB9EFbBQfaJNPbMjcsfmNuLMt.jpg','1979-02-23',220,'Released',NULL,'Christ Stopped at Eboli',42169,2.1799,7.212,'QWTxHudGmoM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7694,_binary '\0','/9CPVLczI2NBnq2MwkXBdYwjE1uw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079013',5.6,3189,'en','Cuba','A British mercenary arrives in pre-Revolution Cuba to help train the corrupt General Batista\'s army against Castro\'s guerrillas while he also romances a former lover now married to an unscrupulous plantation owner.','/1mAemPkRF6IwUkEehwqTJVEPmq6.jpg','1979-12-21',122,'Released','Part Heaven... Part Hell... Pure Havana.','Cuba',62001,2.5796,5.5,'1-e7Kqkkfv8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7695,_binary '\0','/nnxPFfZ5GAApA6Ww0zeMDOJIOvo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079020',7.4,2152,'ru','Да здравствует Мексика!','Having revolutionized film editing through such masterworks of montage as Potemkin and Strike, Soviet director Sergei Eisenstein emigrated West in hopes of testing the capabilities of the American film industry. Quickly ostracized from Hollywood, Eisenstein, Grigory Alexandrov, and photographer Eduard Tisse (at the urging of author Upton Sinclair) wandered south of the border, where they began filming a highly stylized documentary about the people and volatile social climate of Mexico. Unfortunately, a lack of funds prohibited the film\'s completion, and the famed director was unable to edit the film. In 1979, by referring to Eisenstein\'s extensive notes and sketches, Alexandrov assembled the most definitive version of the film; as close to Eisenstein\'s vision as one is ever likely to see.','/yBlXOXozag5OGsNM9LEl8YPA4HY.jpg','1979-10-01',85,'Released',NULL,'¡Qué Viva México!',63107,1.104,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7696,_binary '\0','/bjT7eI9xqSvYgqRrjkDaxNmrErq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079027',4.2,2258,'en','The Dark','At night the Mangler stalks the streets of Los Angeles, killing and mutilating random victims. On the trail are a TV reporter, the father of one of the victims, and a police detective, but despite their efforts only the mysterious psychic DeRenzy knows what the killer is and how to stop it.','/iZygDHDL6FAzYJCqhINtYwCR7oK.jpg','1979-04-27',92,'Released','An alien mutilator stalks and kills human prey during the night.','The Dark',87706,2.0732,4.6,'RbhZU_IF4wI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7697,_binary '\0','/bEFfAFQcEgIXbe8lrMG2EIv3DpG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079041',7,1298,'ja','夜叉ヶ池','When a lone traveller stumbles upon a remote, drought-stricken village, he finds himself engulfed in a whirlpool of myth, mystery, and magic: in a nearby pond reside spirits who hold the fate of the town’s inhabitants, including lovers Akira and Yuri, in their hands.','/aoMAhw8udztiQyolNoaXbvijHQF.jpg','1979-10-20',124,'Released',NULL,'Demon Pond',117215,1.9754,6.6,'XyDo2dP-U6Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7698,_binary '\0','/iduLybl59XhwnvyA4Fu1WXMkUy0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079063',7.5,1418,'it','Don Giovanni','The famous nobleman Don Giovanni travels from town to town conquering women’s hearts, until the troubles he has created return to his own doorstep.','/t4avKNH3REZtyZiCHBwq8TvRKNu.jpg','1979-11-06',176,'Released',NULL,'Don Giovanni',61638,1.3014,6.9,'GoLv5Tn7eFw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7699,_binary '\0','/9aDnMjUHhfX0WaCicEaejdKgvlV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079073',6.5,12672,'en','Dracula','In 1913, charming, seductive, and sinister Count Dracula travels to England seeking an immortal bride.','/gU0BMydJQV9HES5fRAEAPs2qw2M.jpg','1979-07-20',109,'Released','Throughout history he has filled the hearts of men with terror, and the hearts of women with desire.','Dracula',33521,2.7785,6.375,'XjdG6A4PjWo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7700,_binary '\0','/ejNnuzHFwYWKBelYq9vpluLHFih.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079082',5.2,9533,'en','The Driller Killer','An artist slowly goes insane while struggling to pay his bills, work on his paintings, and care for his two female roommates, which leads him taking to the streets of New York after dark and randomly killing derelicts with a power drill.','/qeFh14wpyxtmEZrpnPX1L4q5AJG.jpg','1979-06-15',101,'Released','The Blood Runs In Rivers... And The Drill Keeps Tearing Through Flesh And Bone.','The Driller Killer',13553,1.563,5.153,'gy23UT85piY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7701,_binary '\0','/b4stwmnEHm8gr2uNWpRGhlPV7Xg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079083',6.7,3128,'de','Die dritte Generation','A wildly anarchic satire of guerrilla terrorism in which a band of leftist radicals inadvertently become puppets of the West German government, which uses them to justify its authoritarian policies.','/i83LSPgoioCuywFQmDrAyoTVUFq.jpg','1979-05-30',110,'Released',NULL,'The Third Generation',122683,1.6402,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7702,_binary '\0','/7czwE0kfk5nrPs1UwLXuCBSK5Tf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079087',6.6,2148,'sv','Du är inte klok, Madicken','Madicken is a Swedish girl from the upper level family, growing up during the time of first world war which did not include Sweden. She lives happily with her family, experiencing the world and making brave and crazy things.','/dkI20XzqUNLUk6Qa0sTKZcTauaz.jpg','1979-12-13',98,'Released',NULL,'You\'re Out of Your Mind, Madicken',27598,1.9921,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7703,_binary '\0','/ejp6CZQ64mEvewfit2fSIpOYxGR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079095',7.7,16418,'de','Die Ehe der Maria Braun','Maria marries a young soldier in the last days of World War II, only for him to go missing in the war. She must rely on her beauty and ambition to navigate the difficult post-war years alone.','/tXjZEzlf4WQwZ4Dt53gXeJVuO7p.jpg','1979-03-23',120,'Released',NULL,'The Marriage of Maria Braun',661,3.5772,7.4,'pQGznARA69s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7704,_binary '\0','/dwvdks9USPFPPYkDKPkxTzhurvo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079100',6.5,10122,'en','The Electric Horseman','A former champion rodeo rider is reduced to using his saddle skills to promote a breakfast cereal in a gaudy Las Vegas show. When he\'s asked to perform with a $12 million horse, he discovers it is being doped to remain docile. He flees into the desert astride the beast in an act of defiance. A story-hungry female reporter gives chase.','/x9wifiDa8q7oK4GIBpJnUjGVSww.jpg','1979-12-21',122,'Released','He\'s a washed-up loser. But sometimes losers can be heroes...','The Electric Horseman',11145,3.2803,6.1,'gE6BOu2dAlk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7705,_binary '\0','/iru06HSbB0IxGJHrhjI7vnChhw5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079103',6.9,5775,'en','Elvis','This biopic traces Elvis Presley’s life from his impoverished childhood to his meteoric rise to stardom to his triumphant conquering of Las Vegas.','/fYsrWZrLZMH9duwXPtaoheunUz4.jpg','1979-02-10',168,'Released','The King lives on!','Elvis',40047,2.1435,6.9,'aJcfClx5nag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7706,_binary '\0','/lfLVH3F8Xt8nITqG9cn97b54au1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079116',7.5,166868,'en','Escape from Alcatraz','San Francisco Bay, January 18, 1960. Frank Lee Morris is transferred to Alcatraz, a maximum security prison located on a rocky island. Although no one has ever managed to escape from there, Frank and other inmates begin to carefully prepare an escape plan.','/uORr2GXQnyqgBOg6tVsRCJD2qxc.jpg','1979-06-22',113,'Released','No one has ever escaped from Alcatraz… and no one ever will!','Escape from Alcatraz',10734,9.0307,7.5,'5bLmGl_USn8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7707,_binary '\0','/gHjNgesKqyIlW2fpUKyX0egXx1k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079117',5.7,6660,'en','Escape to Athena','During the World War II, the prisoners of a German camp in a Greek island are trying to escape. They not only want their freedom, but also seek an ineffable treasure hidden in a monastery at the summit of the island\'s mountain.','/c4SeQMQnc2eIpQgDTnLRNg0d6iR.jpg','1979-05-21',125,'Released','The patriot, the professor, the comic and the stripper... were fighting for what they believed in... Getting rich!','Escape to Athena',28981,3.6863,5.749,'uVsPoRpRVWA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7708,_binary '\0','/A7lbu014Gfr5dhohXP79fg72VkO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079118',6.4,4124,'he','אסקימו לימון','Benji, Bobby, and Huey are three 17 year olds who spend their days chasing girls and hanging out at Montana\'s Ice Cream Parlor. In their constant pursuit for sex, they are caught in the apartment of local nymphomaniac Stella by her boyfriend and get more than they bargained for from hooker Ze Ze! Meanwhile, Benji has fallen for new girl Nikki and is the only person who comes to her aid after Bobby gets her pregnant then dumps her.','/14tlbgXfd3Q3bGIdAPdBfSAyTM0.jpg','1978-04-21',95,'Released','Three boys, one summer... Only one thing on her mind!','Lemon Popsicle',10580,3.297,6.208,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7709,_binary '\0','/aAuAX3bYcW9mjQjZ1UaRN8ZM51C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079123',6.1,1321,'en','The Europeans','An adaptation of Henry James\' novel about the Countess Eugenia Münster and her brother Robert, expatriate Americans who have grown up in Europe. Returning to prosperous relatives in New England, Eugenia hopes to make an advantageous marriage with a wealthy cousin. While Eugenia encounters obstacles, Robert finds his suit bearing fruit.','/3STrqQkZaDSXPhWCPKC462yUj76.jpg','1979-05-01',91,'Released',NULL,'The Europeans',42175,1.8408,5.6,'88rN8QOMLkA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7710,_binary '\0','/a5JsvCdyk0rj4vNYcIuV3RJFQFy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079128',5.5,1520,'en','The Evictors','A nice young couple move into an eerie house located in a small Louisiana town, unaware of its violent history.','/5qpMxcPDt9PP7YCQ1z6GkOVzy27.jpg','1979-04-17',92,'Released','It was a small Louisiana town where people live and love and die and no one ever thought of locking their doors… except in the Monroe house.','The Evictors',99194,1.3955,6.4,'zEGmAnsWEOI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7711,_binary '\0','/j8B7BLgwHN6jRATC0b142rXaA91.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079135',6,4273,'fr','Fascination','A runaway criminal breaks into an eerie chateau, taking its two frightened chambermaids hostage. As night falls, a group of mysterious aristocratic women arrive and the criminal begins to realize the women are hiding a sinister secret.','/1vzkcD8DU0youIAXJSOYKzDbQvJ.jpg','1979-11-01',80,'Released','Now tell me the truth, who’s coming here tonight? DEATH!','Fascination',29562,2.3952,6.1,'hUSvyvDSxaE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7712,_binary '\0','/18Mo8zLWsL4uUFMjkZyDQrzhfdj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079138',5.4,3157,'en','Fast Company','After his sponsor replaces him with his archrival, a race-car driver decides to steal the car and race it himself.','/rNpBNzzLUPl1df3nCUhEvfNzOEE.jpg','1979-03-18',93,'Released','Strap yourself into a car that flies 240 miles an hour down a quarter mile track.','Fast Company',38493,1.8716,5.1,'G1lREAiBTBA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7713,_binary '\0','/4T8YiXiCPL3jq1H3L0xmadlkps5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079144',5.2,1648,'en','Felicity','Felicity studies at a remote Roman Catholic boarding school in Australia. Consumed by curiosity about sex and heavily indulging in popular erotic novels as well as a lesbian affair with her friend Jenny, she yearns for a real-world experience.','/w9pRJqvf7lbfWysuMGiFtxswulA.jpg','1978-10-09',94,'Released','She ain\'t Mama\'s little girl no more!','Felicity',45048,2.2396,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7714,_binary '\0','/rBizI1cMLwHlqGLYpr8UDjMiFUA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079147',6.7,1345,'cn','瘋猴','A disgraced former Kung Fu expert makes a living as a merchant with the help of a hot headed friend. When the men are harassed by gangsters, the merchant decided to teach his friend monkey boxing so they can defend their business.','/1rKpD7PRrArgcEgPj1kXHCROrbg.jpg','1979-10-05',116,'Released',NULL,'Mad Monkey Kung Fu',46736,1.7836,6.7,'y3UXdlbrcFk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7715,_binary '\0','/trbgJ5faGwLJNtozGZvSm8tsYMo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079153',5.1,1357,'en','Firepower','A mercenary is hired by the FBI to track down a powerful recluse criminal, a woman is also trying to track him down for her own personal vendetta.','/9ykGoekx1Ce4zhl70ScuDiyiqIz.jpg','1979-04-27',104,'Released','The Target: The world\'s richest man. The Deal: Bring him back alive. The Prize: A million in cash.','Firepower',47561,1.7257,4.968,'GNAF3LuNs3k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7716,_binary '\0','/9ahfMwFratA2kIaSxxz9aKdByuX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079154',5.4,1375,'en','The Fish That Saved Pittsburgh','The Pittsburgh basketball team is hopeless. Maybe with the aid of an astrologer, and some new astrologically compatible players, they can become winners.','/heDHvyI0ICaG4MogaIQNawdhsJc.jpg','1979-11-06',102,'Released',NULL,'The Fish That Saved Pittsburgh',67627,2.2112,5.9,'15C8dHfTvhM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7717,_binary '\0','/drOKd22Ezc2iZVcewDbIHbRGYHr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079156',4.5,1708,'it','Il fiume del grande caimano','Tourists on a tropical island anger an island god, who turns himself into a giant alligator and stalks them.','/bxxM6aY0KDsl6KB1RU6K791RYg9.jpg','1979-11-03',88,'Released','It is not an animal, it is a demon!','The Great Alligator',67219,2.0122,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7718,_binary '\0','/iLGPSH7FOnPCANAW5ZUwy05UFUp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079168',5.2,5032,'en','A Force of One','Karate champion Matt Logan is enlisted by the police to train officers in self-defense after narcotics agents are killed by an assailant using the martial arts.','/onSySvgh0Jp7UjenNuIjcg89nwu.jpg','1979-06-01',90,'Released','He hears the silence. He sees the darkness. He\'s the only one who can stop the killing.','A Force of One',21376,2.5967,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7719,_binary '\0','/bzbecY5SogVyTBHIwVrqBkAd8aa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079180',6.4,11234,'en','The Frisco Kid','Rabbi Avram arrives in Philadelphia from Poland en route to San Francisco where he will be a congregation\'s new rabbi. An innocent and inexperienced traveller, he is tricked by con men to pay for the trip to go west, then they leave him and his belongings scattered along a deserted road. He is befriended by a stranger, Tommy, who is a bank robber and have many adventures during their journey.','/j2Oo1Ds4Vbns5WP4BfSnU3wXwpn.jpg','1979-07-06',119,'Released','This kosher cowboy hasn\'t got a prayer -- but plenty of laughs.','The Frisco Kid',16972,3.0868,6.1,'bu4r_NmgRLk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7720,_binary '\0','/dJnL1UmpXJEXSPqBklbmxEkzGcw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079182',7.6,8191,'ja','復讐するは我にあり','A thief, a murderer, and a charming lady-killer, Iwao Enokizu is on the run from the police.','/7mzlay0miUkplT0EsKdR8znOVpe.jpg','1979-04-21',140,'Released','Living only for today — for pleasure. A killer who gets what he wants — including death.','Vengeance Is Mine',42170,4.5522,7.531,'5cTE_HrQb8U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7721,_binary '\0','/frnkWiz4yfkQrm4CplhpFSNg2OQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079193',8,4922,'ru','Гараж','An automotive highway is scheduled to be built through the territory of a garage cooperative. A special meeting of the cooperative takes place to reduce the number of garages. As all was already decided and arranged by the chairholder and the board, the decision passes easily at the meeting. But one unexpected event happens - the meeting room\'s entrance has been locked by an anonymous member and the key is missing...','/6RnHUa3h5Dfe1fRXjdvsJFDaWSO.jpg','1979-11-23',101,'Released',NULL,'The Garage',56547,1.2868,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7722,_binary '\0','/zIb0iS1wem45wfmhpdDjQN8vD91.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079200',6.3,10594,'fr','Le Gendarme et les Extra-terrestres','The bungling inspector Cruchot finds himself trying to save the residents of St. Tropez from some oil-drinking humanoid aliens. The only way to tell the aliens from the real people, besides their constant thirst for oil-products, is that they sound like empty garbage cans when you touch them. Chaos is ahead.','/pWfQXnhqF27fqHeC0gVSRM2zro8.jpg','1979-01-31',96,'Released',NULL,'The Gendarme and the Creatures from Outer Space',10516,4.2995,6.1,'ROc5JdNZ9ss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7723,_binary '\0','/xXIoSZnLPt57Blbm8AwhTPmHziV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079207',5.1,1586,'it','Giallo a Venezia','Inspector Angelo De Paul is assigned to investigate a horrifying series of murders that have gripped Venice and left the authorities baffled.','/ty5K5c4PfBWYRbUkxMcb9VSh04O.jpg','1979-12-31',99,'Released',NULL,'Giallo in Venice',40528,3.2222,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7724,_binary '\0','/mooTHZUefP2kFKk86woIHa2zKP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079218',5.7,2034,'he','אסקימו לימון 2: יוצאים קבוע','It\'s the greasy 50\'s, and girls are still causing problems for the Lemon Popsicle boys! Benji falls head over heels in love with new girl Tammy but manages to ruin the relationship by pushing her to go all the way. Benji is the object of Martha\'s affections, even though she is dating Huey, and as usual Bobby is finding it hard to stay faithful to just one girl! Going Stead is set against a backdrop of sunlit beaches, moonlit nights... and Rock \'n\' Roll!','/fHvOqYo5dqkT3PwcnyvzHvTuIdp.jpg','1979-05-31',87,'Released',NULL,'Going Steady',10581,2.0444,6.185,'kg-7y0c7YFs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7725,_binary '\0','/ma0olstWWYm6JfGnLJoykH9ln4y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079219',7.1,4577,'en','Going in Style','Three kindly old men decide to light up the dimming twilight of their lives with a last blaze of glory – by sticking up a Manhattan bank in broad daylight.','/4TYdgaA6FV6PoKsJ34vQpzMlzMv.jpg','1979-12-25',97,'Released','Whether they win or lose, they\'ll be \"Going in Style\"','Going in Style',65066,3.5283,7,'D96Ww7RXQ9g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7726,_binary '\0','/pfXRHq26dBOJxUs0OlApCFpat1y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079221',8.5,22310,'hi','गोल माल','A man\'s simple lie to secure his job escalates into more complex lies when his orthodox boss becomes suspicious.','/uPW269Qx8VxfiQI2PFHcSJkGOI2.jpg','1979-04-19',144,'Released',NULL,'Gol Maal',30066,1.7877,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7727,_binary '\0','/gZ2GqPavjpLlhFo9AlML8mM7iyg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079227',5.2,4475,'en','Good Guys Wear Black','The former leader of a commando rescue attempt into Vietnam tries to discover why his squad members are being murdered, one-by-one, after the war is over.','/qe6YEwpegOGzXhmGS7Xkwz9XxVR.jpg','1978-06-01',95,'Released','Chuck Norris is John T. Booker and Booker is fighting back.','Good Guys Wear Black',42205,3.1008,5.1,'sa6AweY-hoU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7728,_binary '\0','/5ngHbTzsdIIp9vQG7jfUKnMDjho.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079239',7.2,8012,'en','The Great Santini','As he approaches manhood, Ben Meechum struggles to win the approval of his demanding alpha male father, an aggressively competitive, but frustrated marine pilot.','/xvoHFQlSAq0696rvONsEAWj1fcm.jpg','1979-10-26',115,'Released','The bravest thing he would ever do was let his family love him.','The Great Santini',21887,2.1158,6.8,'VAZHa2zVLQ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7729,_binary '\0','/hRqwp6ee3qKnUWLw6S4nj9yMwv0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079240',6.9,22075,'en','The First Great Train Robbery','In Victorian England, a master criminal makes elaborate plans to steal a shipment of gold from a moving train.','/4LqLUNoCwoPQNmrRuDZa0zC3hT8.jpg','1978-12-14',110,'Released','Never have so few taken so much from so many.','The First Great Train Robbery',11583,4.7541,6.7,'U63utlzxJ-A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7730,_binary '\0','/2X2QQ4SPXuAPjyr85l0Ct5hk16m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079252',5.9,2838,'fr','Le Guignolo','After the failure of his recent criminal exploits, international con artist Alexandre Dupré sets off for Venice to try to dupe some Japanese business men into buying a fake copy of a stolen Caneletto. On the aeroplane, a stranger asks him to look after his briefcase until after they have landed. Alexandre agrees, but the stranger is shot dead soon after and Alexandre himself becomes the target of enemy agents who are keen to recover the briefcase...','/vPMYgLcegBdu60hQEVQlsMugG8b.jpg','1980-03-26',108,'Released',NULL,'Le Guignolo',12541,2.9453,6.047,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7731,_binary '\0','/8SIXWtGRhQvtcjABNoDo2vvY30m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079257',4.7,2110,'en','H.O.T.S.','Four girls spurned by the popular Sorority on campus decide to start their own and steal all the men on campus away from the house that rejected them.','/vOnW3QMCeJDPoc8VMCkb8sbM19u.jpg','1979-05-01',98,'Released','Some like it H.O.T.S.!','H.O.T.S.',59181,2.3694,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7732,_binary '\0','/4yeRx7cGDMIzIkzLRhcw1LymSYC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079261',7.5,44717,'en','Hair','Upon receiving his draft notice and leaving his family ranch in Oklahoma, Claude heads to New York and befriends a tribe of long-haired hippies on his way to boot camp.','/z0ctToyPWCB2RgIkMpD6RhRKAeH.jpg','1979-03-15',121,'Released','Let the sunshine in!','Hair',10654,5.35,7.3,'PSBuEh2ELR0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7733,_binary '\0','/t1kuC898ZbcbnXS5RILVI5Q1Egf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079268',6,6460,'en','Hanover Street','Margaret is a nurse in England during WW2, and married to a secret agent. Things get complicated when she falls for David, an American pilot.','/v7omq2zlGrWXDfOkLJR0ADqPjac.jpg','1979-05-18',109,'Released','The fateful entanglements of two men in love with the same woman.','Hanover Street',26659,3.5808,5.6,'YigOeYvBhtg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7734,_binary '\0','/o9waw6sQvm6NeEMdDXeoCQI0nYo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079271',7.1,17217,'en','Hardcore','A conservative Midwest businessman ventures into the sordid underworld of pornography in search of his runaway teenage daughter who’s making hardcore films in the pits of Los Angeles.','/g6m9xBTAzxXVhdJ624s9BLK9o6.jpg','1979-02-09',108,'Released','“Oh my God, that\'s my daughter.”','Hardcore',42172,3.9965,6.8,'boKe4FSYhJM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7735,_binary '\0','/4V5BVaqbKcfey3bu9Gg4qqJIz0P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079278',7,2325,'en','Chilly Scenes of Winter','Charles is a bored civil servant struggling through a harsh Utah winter. He spends most of his time reflecting on his romance with Laura, a coworker who left him to return to her husband, an A-Frame salesman.','/teN4NJdGcHbIm9IwXerysNknmGh.jpg','1979-10-19',95,'Released','A romantic comedy for all seasons','Chilly Scenes of Winter',42173,2.4931,6.8,'OFpbQx0SwTU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7736,_binary '\0','/QJkAxxvQEgXs6K4H5nW8DkNfal.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079285',5.1,11844,'en','Saturn 3','In the future, Earth is overcrowded and the population relies on distant bases to be fed. In the Saturn 3 station, Major Adam and the scientist Alex, who is also his lover and has never been on Earth, have been researching hydroponics for three years in the base alone with their dog Sally. Captain Benson arrives Saturn 3 with Hector, incapable to controlling his emotions he transfers his homicidal tendency and insanity to Hector. Now Major Adam and Alex are trapped in the station with a dangerous psychopath robot.','/zAoLR1azwd8QbglnjWpOwJ4PI6C.jpg','1980-02-15',87,'Released','Some thing is watching... waiting... and wanting on...','Saturn 3',19761,4.4688,5.3,'7RI2t3yW4sU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7737,_binary '\0','/ze2rEgxLZsIj415hEfYs6JhSOOr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079308',6.2,1770,'en','Hot Stuff','When a police department\'s burglary task force is facing the possibility of being shut down because of their low conviction rate decides to try a new approach to apprehending their targets. They take over a pawn shop where thieves go to unload their merchandise. They record them as they bring stuff in and get them to tell them where they got it. Eventually they\'re threatened by the mob.','/eeS2Fz3W9mHBRgORm4GqZQ4r4fR.jpg','1979-08-10',91,'Released','You can\'t turn this mob over to the cops. They are the cops.','Hot Stuff',99977,2.2463,7,'98Dsf6pR_bE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7738,_binary '\0','/jN1l0dIjZfH4r3NjUPl8KeZ8sd3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079315',6.6,6211,'cn','笑拳怪招','Lung is a talented fighter but prefers to spend his time loafing around and picking fights, despite orders from his grandfather not to fight. Unknown to him, a brutal general has been slaughtering all the people from his grandfather’s clan. When the general recognizes Lung’s style of kung fu during one of his street fights, he hunts down Lung’s grandfather and kills him.','/bmQR6gtoBJHUkgALLb1eGruKPll.jpg','1979-02-17',97,'Released',NULL,'Fearless Hyena',19274,3.8567,6.67,'MQSUruKozOY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7739,_binary '\0','/w9IdCHryST0DuiYoiGs98m2Prnn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079322',7.8,5203,'fr','I… comme Icare','Following the assassination of President Marc Jarry, a member of the investigation committee refuses to sign off on the committee\'s final findings.','/q3t1r7zabpfUDTzpbN7ecsl0Rp2.jpg','1979-12-19',129,'Released',NULL,'I... for Icarus',25264,2.3582,7.626,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7740,_binary '\0','/5WUmqHCZzReWZCIo3WwNkHts6on.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079336',7.3,11220,'en','The In-Laws','In preparation for his daughter\'s wedding, dentist Sheldon Kornpett meets Vince Ricardo, the groom\'s father. Vince, a manic fellow who claims to be a government agent, then proceeds to drag Sheldon into a series of chases and misadventures from New York to Central America.','/dt82c6NAqBgENPiy7LHNwYiBKkY.jpg','1979-06-15',103,'Released','The FIRST Certified Crazy Person\'s Comedy.','The In-Laws',19827,3.7378,6.613,'LPLb6Ompg9E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7741,_binary '\0','/4sWfuneMGgZ1Dvwe1zGt29yu5S2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079351',6.6,10398,'it','Io sto con gli ippopotami','In 1950, in Africa. Tom organizes safaris for tourists, secretly equipping them with guns loaded with blanks. When Slim, Tom’s cousin—a sly slacker and staunch environmentalist—arrives, the two men come into conflict with Jack Ormond, a local animal trafficker. A doctor, a friend of the duo, denounces Mr. Ormond’s exploitation of animals in a newspaper, prompting Ormond to send his henchmen to destroy the clinic where the good doctor practices. But at the medical facility, Ormond’s henchmen find Tom and Slim waiting for them, and in the blink of an eye, the two cousins wipe out these thugs in a brawl. Ormond then tries to bribe the two cousins, and when that fails, has them imprisoned for a theft they never committed. After escaping from prison, the two men rush toward Ormond’s ship, beating the merchant’s men to a pulp...','/voImabKBh1yzuOj7jfpApHuTW1s.jpg','1979-11-30',95,'Released',NULL,'I\'m for the Hippopotamus',9031,5.0231,6.777,'gGL7yARWWqw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7742,_binary '\0','/mo4DCNr7wEUruuS82JcroFYJV4H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079357',6.8,5244,'en','Jack Frost','Pardon-me Pete, the official groundhog of Groundhog Day, tells the story of Jack Frost, who falls in love with a beautiful young woman and begs Father Winter to make him human so that she can see him. His request is granted, but only on the condition that by the Spring he has a house, a bag of gold, a horse and a wife. But Jack finds that life as a human is more complicated than he thought.','/rky3WOB9AZ4fELooSKWwmO9qRQq.jpg','1979-12-13',48,'Released',NULL,'Jack Frost',26538,1.814,6.5,'UxQGoqjONnk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7743,_binary '\0','/xlfnuI20UHQzlviGXghtjilT2rt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079366',7,2432,'en','The Jericho Mile','A runner, serving a life sentence at Folsom Prison, works at becoming the world\'s fastest miler and wins a chance to compete for a spot on the Olympic team.','/cinQBqd5K5jDqEJ0ECbXA58dXt4.jpg','1980-10-31',97,'Released','Behind the wall of this prison is a man traning to challenge the Olympic record..','The Jericho Mile',57537,2.0661,6.08,'-XvILNCff7c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7744,_binary '\0','/llVPUs3j9RywSMstGRepSeS8vSL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079367',7.1,69401,'en','The Jerk','After discovering he\'s not really black like the rest of his family, likable dimwit Navin Johnson sets off on a hilarious misadventure that takes him from rags to riches and back again. The slaphappy jerk strikes it rich, but life in the fast lane isn\'t all it\'s cracked up to be and, in the end, all that really matters to Johnson is his true love.','/mIjOWtUofyt9Jawge7FbvITjU3D.jpg','1979-12-14',94,'Released','A rags to riches to rags story.','The Jerk',6471,4.4763,6.884,'lduFFNqBFPs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7745,_binary '\0','/AoicJhQgrJWXtFfeIle0lxp1BpD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079368',7.2,3107,'en','Jesus','Three and a half years of Jesus\' ministry, as told in the Gospel of Luke.','/9bdfGfWj3Ef9Gucrxysbcwyx7Uo.jpg','1979-10-19',117,'Released','The story of Jesus according to the Gospel of Luke.','Jesus',45139,3.3977,8.3,'IXqjcDchr14','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7746,_binary '\0','/bHHkyYDzjmwHYZov8NIXDip5Q3t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079372',7,2018,'zh','金臂童','Jin bei tong opens with a group of escort guards preparing to move a shipment of gold from the local government to an area stricken by famine... one of the very few Venom films where all six Venom actors are present within a single film.','/aCAiIBRYcxsqAIxMG7J42ZZ6C37.jpg','1979-11-02',86,'Released','Be good or be dead!','Kid with the Golden Arm',13513,2.753,6.8,'kqYVe2ZhhOI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7747,_binary '\0','/dq5UwnkvNssb60ZyuDVcCp5nz2W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079386',7.6,3212,'hi','काला पत्थर','Vijay Singh is a disgraced former Merchant-Navy officer who is branded as a coward after he abandons his crew during an emergency. Guilt-ridden and trying to forget his past, he takes up work at a coal mine where he gets trapped with other miners after a flood hits them.','/2LgFnPtL8dUYb0FH8NbgodmoFWF.jpg','1979-08-09',176,'Released',NULL,'Kaala Patthar',30627,1.1064,7.5,'tePeQkt0HFI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7748,_binary '\0','/8aBVwfbUvIJKgOzi1Q1Qor9DebG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079400',8,4172,'en','The Who: The Kids Are Alright','Through concert performances and interviews, this film offers us a comprehensive look at the British pioneer rock group, The Who. It captures their zany craziness and outrageous antics from the initial formation of the group in 1964 to 1978. It notably features the band\'s last performance with long-term drummer Keith Moon, filmed at Shepperton Studios in May 1978, three months before his death.','/30KLQduKvVzuYbqHMrWBcDHKs7O.jpg','1979-06-15',101,'Released','One film that won\'t f-f-f-f-fade away','The Who: The Kids Are Alright',22984,2.1565,7.3,'sTpyocmlzcM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7749,_binary '\0','/9pUh1fC8TqVtYPeKpdfNyVK0qnn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079417',7.8,168159,'en','Kramer vs. Kramer','Ted Kramer is a career man for whom his work comes before his family. His wife Joanna cannot take this anymore, so she decides to leave him. Ted is now faced with the tasks of housekeeping and taking care of himself and their young son Billy.','/3CUP5V5SWfHSK4qvkZF7lMNyugY.jpg','1979-12-07',105,'Released','There are three sides to this love story.','Kramer vs. Kramer',12102,7.4389,7.6,'TuDnCnr504A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7750,_binary '\0','/bOKIpYOm5WSeMCI6nGHWbEavCER.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079428',6,3412,'en','The Lady Vanishes','On the eve of World War II, zany heiress Amanda Kelly travels by train to Switzerland. While passing through Germany, she meets a sweet elderly lady, who suddenly vanishes. Distraught, she questions her fellow passengers who claim that the woman was never there. Unsure if it\'s all in her mind or if there\'s a more sinister plot afoot, Amanda teams up with photographer Robert Condon to discover the truth.','/xw0GhX9M3zjbFd7OeYdNHrmZSiH.jpg','1979-04-30',97,'Released','Had she vanished into thin air...Or was she never really there?','The Lady Vanishes',4706,2.7812,6,'GK-9rYdCczs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7751,_binary '\0','/R8tcwYm0fPPLHLcSgBBxVdDSNT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079429',6.3,1725,'en','The Lady in Red','A farm girl\'s life turns upside down after she moves to Chicago and becomes trapped in a vicious cycle of prostitution and crime.','/x6By21xOmC2JfEnco2WFWDrDGsT.jpg','1979-07-01',93,'Released','She\'s made of bullets, sin & bathtub gin!','The Lady in Red',39771,2.4191,5.592,'u7elNfBSYo4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7752,_binary '\0','/jDKrk1QFIfYDLfnXYQIIfBNXRRv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079432',7.1,1881,'cn','爛頭何','A prince enlists a thief to serve as his bodyguard to protect him from assassins.','/o2aj0CSXeC6tlT3eZCv6t6JqHKJ.jpg','1979-08-04',103,'Released',NULL,'Dirty Ho',54182,2.0179,7.3,'8E-nkSbV8Sg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7753,_binary '\0','/bnqwiyvqv5NdD1w45742h24DQw0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079437',6,4042,'en','Last Embrace','Secret agent Harry Hannan suffers a mental breakdown when a botched mission in Mexico results in the death of his wife. He is sent to a mental asylum, after which he eventually returns to work. But, once again, he begins to doubt his sanity when he receives a bizarre death threat written in Hebrew. Not knowing which of his colleagues wants to kill him, Hannan teams up with pretty young college student Ellie Fabian to attempt to unravel the mystery.','/hKhZnaSnQT591plckYcFrr0k5ib.jpg','1979-05-04',102,'Released','It begins with an ancient warning. It ends at the edge of Niagara Falls. In between there are 5 murders. Solve the mystery. Or die trying.','Last Embrace',37923,3.9553,5.5,'68RJ9-23pzk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7754,_binary '\0','/7PfzL69Nc7ywcHjIaAOfDaMIA8R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079449',5.6,1721,'fr','Laura, les ombres de l\'été','A blinded French sculptor completes a statue of a friend\'s daughter by using his sense of touch.','/tMe9eKcaOXNLGkM01KAB4sGpKfP.jpg','1979-11-28',95,'Released',NULL,'Laura',54145,3.7046,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7755,_binary '\0','/mpQmjs1GNfppZY3nyZOx6fLRIrv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079450',5.8,3855,'en','The Legacy','A couple attempts to unravel a sinister plot within the English countryside estate of a dying man who has gathered an eclectic and notable group of house guests.','/uYlDAZvB8g06PGGEOQIQcCVlHOz.jpg','1978-09-29',102,'Released','It is a birthright of living death...','The Legacy',42215,2.7581,5.4,'5dPEDKtvzDw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7756,_binary '\0','/lOrM3OQhHlzEkpF7Ih3GghecrA8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079470',8,435908,'en','Life of Brian','Brian Cohen is an average young Jewish man, but through a series of ridiculous events, he gains a reputation as the Messiah. When he\'s not dodging his followers or being scolded by his shrill mother, the hapless Brian has to contend with the pompous Pontius Pilate and acronym-obsessed members of a separatist movement. Rife with Monty Python\'s signature absurdity, the tale finds Brian\'s life paralleling Biblical lore, albeit with many more laughs.','/lSSA64WF0M0BXnjwr2quMh6shCl.jpg','1979-08-17',94,'Released','He\'s not the messiah...he\'s just a naughty boy.','Life of Brian',583,11.2624,7.764,'7FIZGHax55c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7757,_binary '\0','/7w5tTzlLUFdhcNAFweVn4iIF76m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079472',7.2,2914,'cn','林世榮','A plump butcher student of Wong Fei Hung, Lam Sai-Wing gets into trouble with a rival kung-fu school known as Five Dragons. He is accused of raping the Head of that school\'s goddaughter and killing his son. Now Ko, the Head of Five Dragons, wants revenge.','/7zU373WqLUfuDOkdWOhelnbexKQ.jpg','1979-12-19',108,'Released',NULL,'The Magnificent Butcher',18812,2.5121,7.2,'pJ3UJQT_MJU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7758,_binary '\0','/sNdTKQ1cTNmbTMmorpRDUkPqdsM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079474',7,2826,'en','The Lion, the Witch and the Wardrobe','Four children pass through a mystic portal in a wardrobe and discover the magical kingdom of Narnia, a land of talking animals and mythical creatures. There, an evil witch\'s spell has cast the land into eternal winter. Fearing that an ancient prophecy is coming to fruition, and that the children are Narnia\'s rightful rulers, the White Witch tricks their youngest brother into betraying his family, enacting an ancient magic that she can use to halt the fulfillment of the prophecy. Now, only Aslan, noble lion and High King above all kings in Narnia, can help them defeat the witch, restore springtime to Narnia, and claim their rightful places on the throne.','/5ebzw3VOkceR4gq9w3ZQ5nptOS4.jpg','1979-04-01',95,'Released',NULL,'The Lion, the Witch and the Wardrobe',40611,3.0612,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7759,_binary '\0','/z7cqP2bizuR0jUCDg57g9fKYrD0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079477',7.4,7222,'en','A Little Romance','Intellectually precocious teenager Lauren King lives in Paris with her somewhat ditzy mother. On a movie set, she strikes up a friendship with teenage film buff Daniel Michon. After Lauren\'s mother forbids her to date the outspoken Daniel, the young lovebirds team up with eccentric pickpocket Julius to run away to Venice, where, according to legend, a couple who kiss under the Bridge of Sighs will stay together forever.','/i6M3sxY2jHVey55qWmgTPomSuvc.jpg','1979-04-27',108,'Released','America is having a love affair with \"A Little Romance\"','A Little Romance',20813,2.5578,6.9,'JUbs1rDQLgE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7760,_binary '\0','/5IsTrvzM3dEB5w4Yj5FNX3j0FIK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079482',6.5,7060,'en','Long Weekend','When a suburban couple goes camping for the weekend at a remote beach, they discover that nature isn\'t in an accommodating mood.','/roZ7DGi30lA1O4zhtPwBh6q8JV6.jpg','1979-03-29',95,'Released','Their crime was against nature. Nature found them guilty.','Long Weekend',39995,1.4528,6.1,'2Zb_g-6PNpo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7761,_binary '\0','/1NiTbmIFh2HvvpmRU2rux54Brcu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079484',6.1,3301,'zh','龍拳','After the death of his master, martial arts student Tong Huo-wan travels with his adoptive family to seek redress from the man responsible but finds himself torn between righteousness and filial piety after becoming entangled in a feud between a local clan and gangsters.','/4bTvTDjcbxdf8NvGTRacr9wM2jh.jpg','1979-04-21',97,'Released',NULL,'Dragon Fist',46124,2.8405,6.3,'AsX3MlwJSQM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7762,_binary '\0','/qUEkUvotsvFjNbX7c4SVq42trKQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079488',5.6,2726,'en','Love and Bullets','Jackie Pruit is the girlfriend of notorious gangster Joe Bomposa. When it looks as if Bomposa\'s goons are threatening Jackie\'s life, the FBI moves in to protect her, hoping that she\'ll have incriminating evidence. Veteran agent Charlie Congers is assigned to watch over Jackie, and while it soon becomes apparent that she knows almost nothing about Bomposa that would be of any use to the FBI, he falls in love with her. Bomposa decides it would be more convenient to have Jackie out of the way, ordering her to be executed. Bomposa\'s henchmen slip through FBI security and murder her, but now they have to answer the angry and vengeful Congers.','/zdKxBSl1BEjHTRa8ERLXnZLr8oU.jpg','1979-04-05',103,'Released','Somebody\'s bound to catch the kiss of death!','Love and Bullets',38082,2.1798,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7763,_binary '\0','/mb2vifzTEOUevT2v2QDPZmDgoCq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079489',6.1,7015,'en','Love at First Bite','Dracula and Renfield relocate to \'70s era New York in search of Cindy Sondheim, the reincarnation of Dracula\'s one true love, Mina Harker. \"Trouble adjusting\" is a wild understatement for the Count as he battles Cindy\'s psychiatrist, Jeffrey Rosenberg, a descendant of Van Helsing, who may be in love with Cindy too.','/e4RDjX46zJ0sfh5wZW1rrKkezXJ.jpg','1979-04-26',96,'Released','Your favorite pain in the neck is about to bite your funny bone!','Love at First Bite',18966,3.1715,6,'2OXapi0WlIU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7764,_binary '\0','/i6ET2elKjwMeZs6SphgcTpQOYY6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079495',6.3,6015,'it','La Luna','While touring in Italy, a recently-widowed American opera singer has an incestuous relationship with her 15-year-old son to help him overcome his heroin addiction.','/4mO1Asyzl3gmuvFWYtfzI73LhXQ.jpg','1979-08-29',142,'Released','Between a mother and son. Between the delicate boundaries of love.','Luna',30636,3.8193,6.289,'7KILkhUguEs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7765,_binary '\0','/mWQg2INejtX1PCWRAN4vseadA6H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079501',6.8,247072,'en','Mad Max','In the ravaged near-future, a savage motorcycle gang rules the road. Terrorizing innocent civilians while tearing up the streets, the ruthless gang laughs in the face of a police force hell-bent on stopping them.','/5LrI4GiCSrChgkdskVZiwv643Kg.jpg','1979-04-12',91,'Released','The maximum force of the future.','Mad Max',9659,15.2773,6.68,'E3F8IegOcjA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7766,_binary '\0','/7js7kXHrf9fYe2t3QU28NkBFF7e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079509',4.6,2234,'zh','迷你特攻隊','A force of loners and fighters is put together to try and rescue the generals and save the war effort with the promise of gold and pardons of past crimes.','/irKjRoSKk8cywZ9UbYfFF5kmJrU.jpg','1983-02-13',90,'Released',NULL,'Fantasy Mission Force',38425,2.9695,4.788,'Y8Wsnc5GQZo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7767,_binary '\0','/t85i9xfFzQeSNNVv8DN8B8JGl4X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079510',5.6,3632,'en','The Main Event','A bankrupt entrepreneur attempts to recoup some of her losses by getting a washed-out boxer she picked up as a tax loss back into the ring — an idea her protégé isn\'t fond of.','/t1qBqBkSOeWDXMkFyhDNF2wo0sy.jpg','1979-06-22',112,'Released','A Glove Story','The Main Event',42176,2.3962,5.3,'CsPFeh2yhzU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7768,_binary '\0','/rTlId9gCuHtiy985Mrf0mim8GtS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079514',5,1559,'en','Malibu High','When a high school senior is dumped by her boyfriend, her grades fall drastically...to avoid failing, she begins seducing her male teachers. Thus begins her downward spiral into drug addiction and prostitution, and ultimately assassinations for a kingpin mob boss.','/zn1TLhSMlFaD5J2w2HF4ORbb9ed.jpg','1979-05-01',92,'Released','Every teacher in school wanted to flunk her . . . but nobody dared!','Malibu High',66745,1.2161,4.8,'LdB-lxeom1Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7769,_binary '\0','/vdiWoDs9qHipim4zb9XBkqZLkqt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079517',7.1,1497,'es','Mamá cumple 100 años','Ana and her husband Antonio arrive in the manor in the countryside of Spain where she worked as a nanny many years ago, for the centennial birthday of the matriarch.','/hkIumqh8ebEXJiMVI9vfxFwoN31.jpg','1979-09-17',92,'Released',NULL,'Mama Turns 100',107288,1.5928,6.3,'Lf7Gudwmyvs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7770,_binary '\0','/adnSTomHU9YyqV2lx38CgM0UxLS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079522',7.8,153539,'en','Manhattan','Manhattan explores how the life of a middle-aged television writer dating a teenage girl is further complicated when he falls in love with his best friend\'s mistress.','/k4eT3EvfxW1L9Wmt04UqJqCvCR6.jpg','1979-04-25',96,'Released','Woody Allen\'s New Comedy Hit','Manhattan',696,5.0646,7.701,'5Xo-AnBn8H0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7771,_binary '\0','/3ilxOEXSBGQhCCBIeYeeBNfK0Uf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079523',6.4,1690,'it','Mani di velluto','Engineer Quiller has become rich by selling his completely indestructible shop-window glass to jeweleries around the world. But this got him lots of enemies too: the insurance agencies, who\'ve lost hundreds of customers, and the burglarers. When he temporarily looses his memory and voice in an accident, of all people, a family of thieves finds and cares for him - believing he\'s a pocket-picker. Things get complicated when he falls in love with his host Tilli.','/29rdASAEPwujLR7VIWXx1WrrJr0.jpg','1979-12-20',98,'Released',NULL,'Velvet Hands',63274,1.9977,6.368,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7772,_binary '\0','/bIpASor2NGXCtx3BSCF8ejfiK52.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079540',6.2,26442,'en','Meatballs','Tripper is the head counselor at a budget summer camp called Camp Northstar. In truth, he\'s young at heart and only marginally more mature than the campers themselves. Tripper befriends Rudy, a loner camper who has trouble fitting in. As Tripper inspires his young charges to defeat rival Camp Mohawk in the annual Olympiad competition, Rudy plays matchmaker between Tripper and Roxanne, a female counselor at Northstar.','/9YA2erSNcca9NWd0xePC9ArFWnx.jpg','1979-06-28',92,'Released','Are you ready for a good time?','Meatballs',14035,4.8348,5.846,'FKQrvH33QUA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7773,_binary '\0','/1u9cgw5Nqt1Oft0VNhgqxqNztZL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079542',7.1,1354,'en','Meetings with Remarkable Men','The story of G.I. Gurdjieff an Asian mystic who after a lifetimes study developed a form of meditation incorporating modern dance.','/mQL4SAmo3NHA4dhGlwrRmMNFKFq.jpg','1979-08-05',108,'Released',NULL,'Meetings with Remarkable Men',108758,1.6982,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7774,_binary '\0','/fqWjR25Vo0VZbYDGC2OLfA69GH1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079550',5.1,9604,'en','Meteor','After a collision with a comet, a nearly 8km wide piece of the asteroid \"Orpheus\" is heading towards Earth. If it hits, it will cause an incredible catastrophe that will probably extinguish mankind. To stop the meteor, NASA wants to use the illegal nuclear weapon satellite \"Hercules,\" but discovers soon that it doesn\'t have enough firepower. Their only chance to save the world is to join forces with the USSR, which has also launched such an illegal satellite. But will both governments agree?','/xMUuS1KFHRTFSf3PAY2tsbBdqkL.jpg','1979-10-19',107,'Released','It\'s five miles wide... it\'s coming at 30,000 m.p.h... there\'s no place on Earth to hide!','Meteor',40160,3.3733,5.158,'HHn16y8F2-0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7775,_binary '\0','/mrDC5DLx2wljt4HZGwgkmqlzfcF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079574',6.3,118882,'en','Moonraker','After Drax Industries\' Moonraker space shuttle is hijacked, secret agent James Bond is assigned to investigate, traveling to California to meet the company\'s owner, the mysterious Hugo Drax. With the help of scientist Dr. Holly Goodhead, Bond soon uncovers Drax\'s nefarious plans for humanity, all the while fending off an old nemesis, Jaws, and venturing to Venice, Rio, the Amazon...and even outer space.','/6LrJdXNmu5uHOVALZxVYd44Lva0.jpg','1979-06-26',126,'Released','Where all the other Bonds end… this one begins!','Moonraker',698,8.4837,6.2,'qz7uoU7Xvjg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7776,_binary '\0','/goSQIulkk8E4VEV6MjKHJCLSlIg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079576',5.4,5622,'en','More American Graffiti','College graduates deal with Vietnam and other issues of the late \'60s.','/dnHmQgxeHqgc1A78hE3AdzhlJsW.jpg','1979-08-03',111,'Released','The sights and sounds of the \'60s. There were bittersweet times. There were funny times. And it was all unforgettable.','More American Graffiti',33258,3.1378,5.212,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7777,_binary '\0','/eVbDEVjNIj2fRBiWObMTcuI5bI3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079579',8,16040,'ru','Москва слезам не верит','Living together in a workers\' dorm, Katerina and her friends are determined to make it in Moscow. But when a boorish cameraman forces himself on her, Katerina finds herself pregnant and alone as her friends move on. Twenty years later, Katerina is a factory director, outpacing her old roommates career-wise, yet still alone but for her daughter. Love seems possible again when she meets a genial mechanic.','/r0VULHcfJ2njqOI0GuQHe4TNF5e.jpg','1980-02-11',142,'Released','The Funniest, Tenderest Love Story of the Year.','Moscow Does Not Believe in Tears',21028,3.8338,7.6,'a3XiIKqK9KI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7778,_binary '\0','/y5VDcV9hUlkqa66T6A4H9QAfDEW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079584',6.5,1630,'hi','नटवरलाल जी','When a police officer is framed for bribery by a criminal, his younger brother creates a secret identity for himself and poses as underworld figure Mr Natwarlal, determined to slowly but surely get revenge on his brother\'s behalf.','/cOcZWCL3Zydilqu2EJCzqG6tc86.jpg','1979-09-07',148,'Released',NULL,'Mr. Natwarlal',65804,0.9654,6.3,'DMWw51FYxPA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7779,_binary '\0','/9mbXZSLINbwNQateHLGRhtaZzZB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079588',7.6,43131,'en','The Muppet Movie','The Muppets gather to watch their newly-finished big-budget rich-and-famous feature film: a talent agent persuades Kermit the Frog to leave the swamp to pursue a career in Hollywood. On his way there, he meets a bear, a pig, a whatever (his future muppet crew), and some special celebrity guest stars, while being chased by the desperate owner of a frog-leg restaurant!','/8LUjnIW5ph6pHoXDE3Zg4iVi6BV.jpg','1979-06-22',97,'Released','More entertaining than humanly possible!','The Muppet Movie',11176,8.2101,7.223,'qDfXXaqfc2k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7780,_binary '\0','/6mJtaegyKdgcnSi2m1Nkj4MTZ3C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079590',7.4,3384,'hi','Muqaddar Ka Sikandar','Sikandar, an orphan, makes many friends and foes as he works his way up to become rich, but his heart only yearns for his unfulfilled childhood love, Kaamna. Though he finds temporary comfort in an enchanting prostitute named Zohra, all hell breaks loose when Kaamna falls for Sikandar\'s best friend.','/lm4Zlk53kuByV7eK2Y0PKTqvrU0.jpg','1978-10-27',189,'Released',NULL,'Muqaddar Ka Sikandar',71298,0.8926,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7781,_binary '\0','/xHZ4ws882XSmz6mYtDUyceRjKIx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079592',6.8,7896,'en','Murder by Decree','Sherlock Holmes is drawn into the case of Jack the Ripper, who is killing prostitutes in London\'s East End. Assisted by Dr. Watson, and using information provided by a renowned psychic, Robert Lees, Holmes finds that the murders may have their roots in a Royal indiscretion and that a cover-up is being managed by politicians at the highest level, all of whom happen to be Masons.','/vjuO0XKak8v3uUdNjWr5sNIlJ4b.jpg','1979-02-01',124,'Released','The Jack the Ripper Murders. Sherlock Holmes lifts the veil of secrecy, corruption and terror at the heart of the throne of England itself. Clue by clue... Murder by murder...','Murder by Decree',34374,3.575,6.349,'rpD-4UR9M38','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7782,_binary '\0','/kewdBa1MYOZwUhcbOHxxXLIquBI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079596',7.1,5601,'en','My Brilliant Career','A young woman who is determined to maintain her independence finds herself at odds with her family who wants her to tame her wild side and get married.','/s89ZolmE0tD5stOJhy6Jh4V3txZ.jpg','1979-08-17',100,'Released',NULL,'My Brilliant Career',16659,2.6092,6.2,'hKA0huXBs80','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7783,_binary '\0','/zPNDsFKy023kUrFxE0EZmtV1lwd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079606',8.4,4640,'sh','Национална класа до 785 ccm','One week in life of Branimir Mitrovic \"Floyd\", a young rally driver from the National class (up to 785cc), dreaming of promotion to the higher category. He lives a carefree life of a Belgrade dandy boy, neglecting his girlfriend, avoiding his draft calls, and refusing to deal with any life responsibility in general. The decisive race on Saturday is only what he cares about.','/lGFi2d6gjWTK7pbT31aT6hy7yO8.jpg','1979-01-09',105,'Released',NULL,'National Class Category Up to 785ccm',144973,2,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7784,_binary '\0','/8elobM4kHWwEibECgXyL2d4v16H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079615',8.3,4215,'ro','Nea Mărin miliardar','At a swanky hotel in a Black Sea resort, Gogu, one of the hotel employees, meets his uncle Marin, an Oltenian peasant who has come to visit. Gogu says he can sneak Marin into the hotel, as one of the rooms is empty awaiting the arrival of an American billionaire, Mr. Juvett. Marin is amazed by the revealing clothing worn by women at the resort, while the hotel guests are fascinated by his quaint peasant costume. In the hotel room, Marin is perplexed by the various gadgets. Meanwhile, the gangsters learn that Juvett has arrived at the hotel. Juvett is the father of the kidnapped girl, and is coming to pass over a million dollar ransom. A rival gang, who know about the kidnapping, plan to take the ransom for themselves. They follow Marin, believing him to be Juvett.','/48UBOmZPPRjNLB3g9ZPT2gKGJqy.jpg','1979-02-05',88,'Released',NULL,'Uncle Marin, the Billionaire',179519,1.5937,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7785,_binary '\0','/gwRS8rZMGLMhjauNZpoHJ9FI8Zt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079619',7.6,2807,'ru','Несколько дней из жизни И.И. Обломова','St. Petersburg, mid 19th century: the indolent, middle-aged Oblomov lives in a flat with his older servant, Zakhar. He sleeps much of the day, dreaming of his childhood on his parents\' estate. His boyhood companion, Stoltz, now an energetic and successful businessman, adds Oblomov to his circle whenever he\'s in the city, and Oblomov\'s life changes when Stoltz introduces him to Olga, lovely and cultured. When Stoltz leaves for several months, Oblomov takes a country house near Olga\'s, and she determines to change him: to turn him into a man of society, action, and culture. Soon, Olga and Oblomov are in love; but where, in the triangle, does that leave Stoltz?','/ero51WWvP9UJXPMnH3DyZLjIofR.jpg','1980-09-08',140,'Released',NULL,'Oblomov',83446,2.038,6.3,'HEcFeUsw-F8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7786,_binary '\0','/jJYaALcoWaVCB4a61xOXUZJbmzx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079631',5.2,2094,'en','Nightwing','Killer bats plague an Indian reservation in Arizona.','/i3nXT6Cn4Jc4Ta2AJGnBH1Tu21A.jpg','1979-06-22',105,'Released','The day belongs to man. The night is theirs.','Nightwing',65603,2.0198,4.9,'Mz5FvsRjhek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7787,_binary '\0','/5l58tPlYA1JaacBvcojq3YMQyL5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079638',7.3,14212,'en','Norma Rae','Norma Rae is a southern textile worker employed in a factory with intolerable working conditions. This concern about the situation gives her the gumption to be the key associate to a visiting labor union organizer. Together, they undertake the difficult, and possibly dangerous, struggle to unionize her factory.','/6au7WBVYoKhV1jORyFSIRszb46S.jpg','1979-03-02',110,'Released','The story of a woman with the courage to risk everything for what she believes is right.','Norma Rae',40842,3.005,7.2,'45CX8W9peTs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7788,_binary '\0','/oANMWF0YoIjAgEZq7YN4BB5GhJ3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079639',6.7,1525,'en','The North Avenue Irregulars','When crooks set up operations in a traditional town, a minister and a group of church ladies are willing to do anything, no matter how wacky, to get them out.','/gyEaTIil42yWyLoYVKzWJWzDN9J.jpg','1979-02-09',100,'Released','The FBI couldn\'t do it... the CIA couldn\'t do it... so they sent for... Hill\'s Angels.','The North Avenue Irregulars',65156,2.1836,6.6,'BgzXE-_6MzQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7789,_binary '\0','/8m4dh4E4PzqnndK6Gv5LdvWGbLv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079640',6.9,6523,'en','North Dallas Forty','A semi-fictional account of life as a professional football player. Loosely based on the Dallas Cowboys team of the early 1970s.','/v5TjfmQT81YTJYs398ZbKWWoEKV.jpg','1979-08-03',119,'Released','Wait till you see the weird part.','North Dallas Forty',29786,3.6482,6.7,'8HtZp_DwDyw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7790,_binary '\0','/uHudMff1vp2GDXqHD8QOA78QpNW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079641',7.3,49888,'de','Nosferatu - Phantom der Nacht','A real estate agent leaves behind his beautiful wife to go to Transylvania to visit the mysterious Count Dracula and formalize the purchase of a property in Wismar.','/jHKzGYwf7P34vz8MhJBTN6cnaYD.jpg','1979-01-17',107,'Released','It is fear and fun. It is a scream of horror and a cry of delight. It is Nosferatu, the Vampyre.','Nosferatu the Vampyre',6404,6.7617,7.277,'S1Rachk7ipI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7791,_binary '','/3CFC8Bn3bHtG8lWjis0m9Om2LRG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079642',4.2,1666,'it','Le notti erotiche dei morti viventi','A sailor takes an American businessman and his girlfriend to an island where the businessman wants to build a resort. Soon a weird voodoo couple show up and warn them of bad things that are going to happen. It doesn\'t take long for the zombies to show up and start chowing down on human flesh.','/a3zkPRXAg848c62vCqYtUg3r5bg.jpg','1980-11-06',111,'Released',NULL,'Erotic Nights of the Living Dead',5422,0.0714,4.511,'yNrdpCiYFLY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7792,_binary '\0','/8c9Qn0BIkv4ATYjllz6s8v1otzF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079652',6.6,1460,'en','The Odd Angry Shot','A group of Australian SAS regiment soldiers are deployed to Vietnam around 1967/8 and encounter the realities of war, from the numbing boredom of camp life and long range patrols, raids and ambushes where nothing happens, to the the terror of enduring mortar barrages from an unseen enemy. Men die and are crippled in combat by firefights and booby traps, soldiers kill and capture the enemy, gather intelligence and retake ground only to cede it again whilst battling against the bureaucracy and obstinacy of the conventional military hierarchy. In the end they return to civilization, forever changed by their experiences but glad to return to the life they once knew.','/5etko0Lq8gMHk6MbWTeVAfQcljZ.jpg','1979-03-01',92,'Released','In Vietnam, the name of the game is survival.','The Odd Angry Shot',29582,2.298,6.1,'EobaEWlYebo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7793,_binary '\0','/sDhDeXl6si50rJuSjkNKklrzp1M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079655',7.1,1275,'es','Operación Ogro','Spain, 1973. Dictator Francisco Franco has ruled the country since 1939 with an iron fist; but he is now a very old and sick man. The future of the weakened regime is in danger. Admiral Carrero Blanco is his natural successor. The Basque terrorist gang ETA decides that he must die to prevent the dictatorship from continuing.','/iqxC1i7nnCPZM9icd2WeMV0Bpgs.jpg','1979-09-28',101,'Released',NULL,'Operation Ogre',64834,3.3235,6.922,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7794,_binary '\0','/uGWxfVncuBII4rqVGRCGuMEnXrG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079662',6.8,1987,'da','Olsen-banden overgiver sig aldrig','Egon plans to exploit knowledge gained during his latest term of incarceration. By stealing the unmanipulated financial records of DanInvest he obtains the majority of the stocks in the department store Magasin du Nord, just in time for their closing sale. The attempt to get the red suitcase that will save the day they rob the main vault at the EEC headquarters in Brussels and end up hijacking a tank.','/vpV9dlPjjJg7p8UlRJFPBx4YvKC.jpg','1979-12-26',108,'Released',NULL,'The Olsen Gang Never Surrenders',12712,1.5526,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7795,_binary '\0','/iUsvXEn5avXC1AXkQUu6CUxbUjw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079668',6.8,6296,'en','The Onion Field','An LA police officer is murdered in the onion fields outside of Bakersfield. However, legal loopholes could keep his kidnappers from receiving justice, and his partner is haunted by overwhelming survivor\'s guilt.','/9XQiG3wiaHnJnAU2uNz5OaTBgBy.jpg','1979-09-09',122,'Released','What happened in the onion field is true. But the real crime is what happened after.','The Onion Field',33831,3.2508,6,'JZlqGRwivpQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7796,_binary '\0','/gp7rYRo09ir7NEnrQURymsD95RG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079672',7.8,14306,'en','Opening Night','Actress Myrtle Gordon is a functioning alcoholic who is a few days from the opening night of her latest play, concerning a woman distraught about aging. One night a car kills one of Myrtle\'s fans who is chasing her limousine in an attempt to get the star\'s attention. Myrtle internalizes the accident and goes on a spiritual quest, but fails to finds the answers she is after. As opening night inches closer and closer, fragile Myrtle must find a way to make the show go on.','/5i1331f4Q2sNHUp9X3BOwWPS2Gg.jpg','1977-12-22',144,'Released','The Show Must Go On…','Opening Night',33665,3.5808,7.6,'eRZZAvWIBAo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7797,_binary '\0','/8KELZaEYdKe6M4Vn7Q6B9EjmkDJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079679',7.8,4186,'ru','Осенний марафон','Middle-aged university professor desperately tries to strike a balance in his life between his wife and his mistress, slowly getting bogged down in his own lies.','/vAAkpQ1Z9hpVO9j7lfJWZNeU6Tz.jpg','1979-11-23',89,'Released',NULL,'Autumn Marathon',27924,1.7373,7.1,'rtVOC8xyNic','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7798,_binary '\0','/tZEJL00TB6Md5sC5o36aI8pk1LV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079688',7.2,9454,'en','Over the Edge','A group of bored teenagers rebel against authority in the community of New Granada.','/aFJJF4GLQTEcg9qwW0deRJFhskU.jpg','1979-05-18',95,'Released','Nobody listened. Nobody cared. Until the night they went \"Over the Edge\"','Over the Edge',23957,3.6913,7.1,'6l-4MW_jbfg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7799,_binary '\0','/d6P2YYCEYbzc1xr5LW9FhalctTd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079696',7.3,1664,'pl','Panny z Wilka','Set in the late \'20s. A thirtyish young man, who heads a small factory, faints at the funeral of a close friend. He decides to go home to his aunt and uncle for a while, but gets involved with a family of five women who had been in love with him at one time though he had apparently loved only one, who, unknown to him, has died since his departure. The women are mainly disillusioned with life or estranged from husbands while the youngest has a crush on him.','/3C5lc2b4jhoNciDiK80v5gX6wkv.jpg','1979-09-04',116,'Released',NULL,'The Maids of Wilko',117483,1.3327,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7800,_binary '\0','/fcw0RMlhjJ3bVxlbQ9bRnh1uVOr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079700',6,2576,'en','The Passage','During WW 2, a Basque shepherd is approached by the underground, who wants him to lead a scientist and his family across the Pyrenees. While being pursued by a sadistic German.','/8kXQJWwWntjzAJv14IcYqPhgd46.jpg','1979-03-09',99,'Released','An ice-swept escape route in front of them. A cold-blooded killer behind them. The only way out is up.','The Passage',51543,2.5345,6.009,'bZ0zknhn2rk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7801,_binary '\0','/uNbdOhz3oKYG3aVCMA1Z3JeB6RG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079709',5.7,1414,'en','Penitentiary','A hitchhiker named Martel Gordone gets in a fight with two bikers over a prostitute, and one of the bikers is killed. Gordone is arrested and sent to prison, where he joins the prison\'s boxing team in an effort to secure an early parole and to establish his dominance over the prison\'s toughest gang.','/1XQOTbjwaFSSEdoJlhTcwRsJxG.jpg','1979-12-01',99,'Released','There\'s only one way out, and 100 fools stand in the way!','Penitentiary',65448,1.1253,5.3,'ZJcznox7DxU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7802,_binary '\0','/71L3VXCRqpfdrSVy3iIWmyKXLTX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079714',6.6,45518,'en','Phantasm','A teenage boy and his friends face off against a mysterious grave robber, known only as the Tall Man, who employs a lethal arsenal of unearthly weapons.','/eR0uJ0Wje1lYJ4aHEpkcjgIM8d7.jpg','1979-03-28',89,'Released','If this one doesn\'t scare you...you\'re already dead!','Phantasm',9638,4.9829,6.5,'xOi66melBOY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7803,_binary '\0','/n2kJpUFSW2NRQNHd3UuDOXbalp6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079718',6.1,4032,'it','Piedone d\'Egitto','Inspector Rizzo and Marshal Caputo go to Egypt and look for Professor Cerullo, who is missing.','/oZjyq2RLgZ0ksDXDBudAqvOOwKl.jpg','1980-03-01',104,'Released',NULL,'Flatfoot in Egypt',11160,2.9305,6.2,'yjwEvzssehs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7804,_binary '\0','/w8eMgVq6XClSU9cGdUwGMyakmyn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079727',6.5,3017,'en','The Plumber','A young couple, living in a campus apartment complex, are repeatedly harassed by an eccentric plumber, who subjects them to a series of bizarre mind games while making unnecessary repairs to their bathroom.','/oPdqhZSGAkAGMOEX3OdDqGlv0rA.jpg','1979-06-08',77,'Released','When your waterworks come back to haunt you!','The Plumber',96909,1.6382,6.4,'Y6g_aEUEwSM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7805,_binary '\0','/gwDUbcioMCSyfXMf7xPMRRjCQ87.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079738',7.2,3712,'en','Porridge','Times are hard for habitual guest of Her Majesty Norman Stanley Fletcher. The new prison officer, Beale, makes MacKay look soft and what\'s more, an escape plan is hatching from the cell of prison godfather Grouty and Fletcher wants no part of it.','/ugFjZndHPI4lKZQtOVxWabmsi7K.jpg','1979-08-12',93,'Released','Fletcher\'s inside story - even funnier as a film','Porridge',38293,1.4944,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7806,_binary '\0','/nchAb2I3vuP3nVE6BYYkaK55pQv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079753',5.3,1514,'en','The Prisoner of Zenda','Anthony Hope\'s classic tale gets a decidedly \'un-classic\' treatment at the hands of Peter Sellers. Following the story somewhat, friends of the new King Rudolph of Ruritania fear for his life, and switch him with a look-a-like London cabby. Throw in two(!) lovely blondes, treachery, and a battle for life and honour, and enjoy life at its zaniest.','/qu9PmZs3qBNpJyjYr84RngAaFnO.jpg','1979-08-17',108,'Released',NULL,'The Prisoner of Zenda',1732,2.3485,5.72,'IJ4sG8trTPw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7807,_binary '\0','/i76LnMcUE38uBWM3K1Rol53sk2A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079758',5.6,7146,'en','Prophecy','When a dispute occurs between a logging operation and a nearby Native American tribe, Dr. Robert Verne and his wife, Maggie, are sent in to mediate. Chief John Hawks insists the loggers are poisoning the water supply, and, though company man Isley denies it, the Vernes can\'t ignore the strangely mutated wildlife roaming the woods. Robert captures a bear cub for testing and soon finds himself the target of an angry mutant grizzly.','/8jCyz5IRWmu8R5FhRO2BqtQXnCj.jpg','1979-09-14',102,'Released','She lives. Don\'t move. Don\'t breathe. There\'s nowhere to run. She will find you.','Prophecy',31915,2.8883,5.4,'8FOuhUa8u9I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7808,_binary '\0','/o5GFE1PdgnFhak7jGDjkUgppIEA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079759',7.1,5571,'it','Prova d\'orchestra','An orchestra assembles for a rehearsal in an ancient chapel under the inquisitive eyes of a TV documentary crew, but an uprising breaks out.','/rtspkCHNKoDJxJnozzfoPY1qAct.jpg','1979-02-22',72,'Released','The Decline of the West in C# Major','Orchestra Rehearsal',47850,1.8659,6.7,'sF9Xqa5wt-o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7809,_binary '\0','/8iV8G0INldplJzubAHZ7p4Cdsyn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079764',7.5,1574,'ru','Пять вечеров','The end of the 1950s. Aleksandr Petrovich Ilyin travels to the city where he lived before the war. Visiting the telephone operator Zoya, he sees a familiar house through the window and decides to go there for only fifteen minutes. So Aleksandr gets into a communal apartment, where the love of his youth Tamara Vasilyevna lives. They met twenty years ago and fell in love, but the war separated them. Now Ilyin and Tamara Vasilyevna met again, and love broke out with renewed vigor...','/uvI4y7fi1b95pcSRdd87qan40Cc.jpg','1979-06-04',103,'Released',NULL,'Five Evenings',47851,1.2984,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7810,_binary '\0','/n31i51vwTOOUxKd1DWU2r6if0XR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079766',7.2,22820,'en','Quadrophenia','Based on the 1973 rock opera album of the same name by The Who, this is the story of 60s teenager Jimmy. At work he slaves in a dead-end job. While after, he shops for tailored suits and rides his scooter as part of the London Mod scene.','/4sRR3pvrAZMG7GEvnR9XzqyHHfD.jpg','1979-09-14',120,'Released','A Way of Life','Quadrophenia',10373,3.674,7,'7bIYnHj-OKA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7811,_binary '\0','/4gIrc2OGZJgloQadWdS427rPJ6Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079770',5,4001,'en','Quintet','During a future ice age, dying humanity occupies its remaining time by playing a board game called Quintet. For one small group, this obsession is not enough. They play the game with living pieces, and only the winner survives.','/kjAzxXZzzoixPca518dwKRnJ0Km.jpg','1979-02-09',118,'Released','One man against the world.','Quintet',45169,1.3464,4.9,'HWnZuykuYFw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7812,_binary '\0','/pwDuUpAypSJJuNsE4WJ8l0YpSL9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079773',6.5,1373,'en','Radio On','A London radio DJ receives news of his brother\'s suicide and travels west to Bristol to find out more.','/4KHfHnCq0GEEJSHNaKGsFppNQbv.jpg','1979-11-30',104,'Released',NULL,'Radio On',45945,1.4999,5.9,'BjXz4lw_phI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7813,_binary '\0','/7kPoeekpoMzZch04zdGAKX1HOCa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079781',7,4758,'en','Real Life','A pushy, narcissistic filmmaker persuades a Phoenix family to let him and his crew film their everyday lives, in the manner of the ground-breaking PBS series \"An American Family\".','/ihN6hpMI8IUGgUvivU5HUT2M16c.jpg','1979-03-02',99,'Released','An American Comedy','Real Life',33250,2.2499,6.598,'DOAihCRr1y4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7814,_binary '\0','/4v3Z4bEyR9s8Caz6jVTXRkSAWrX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079788',5.2,6646,'it','Zombi Holocaust','After Malukan immigrants engage in a string of corpse mutilations at various New York City hospitals, a doctor and a morgue assistant travel to the Maluku Islands to investigate.','/6PQvNbV0s8vZKPMySRjniL8LQPl.jpg','1980-03-28',89,'Released','He\'s a depraved, homicidal killer...and he makes house calls!','Doctor Butcher M.D.',7216,3.0783,5.5,'d9wkXRhv__E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7815,_binary '\0','/o5OvGR2teEZcxtmZs01ZuEHhPUd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079794',6.5,4524,'sv','Repmånad eller Hur man gör pojkar av män','It\'s time for Jonsson to return to his old regiment to rehearse what he learned during conscription a few years ago. He meets his old friends, platoon leader Larsson and the music loving captain \'Beethoven\'. Jonsson and his comrades doesn\'t take it very serious - but they have a jolly good time. A female journalist follows the exercise to write an article, and gets interested in him.','/kWx9ymAlun2Jm1yWmhjP3k2bq2u.jpg','1979-02-23',85,'Released',NULL,'The Call-up',18142,1.2447,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7816,_binary '\0','/fBzwSM5zl4xp9L3rFu1PihmY0vh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079802',5.7,5649,'en','The Return of the King','Two Hobbits struggle to destroy the Ring in Mount Doom while their friends desperately fight evil Lord Sauron\'s forces in a final battle.','/lTwUT4NsSyUQlHV20Mx3C96JHq4.jpg','1980-05-11',98,'Released',NULL,'The Return of the King',1361,3.6513,6.4,'gfLXFkzQRSI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7817,_binary '\0','/79tVYfh4lRHb1Ql2Tc2lslJMloa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079807',8,6257,'en','Richard Pryor: Live in Concert','Richard Pryor delivers monologues on race, sex, family and his favorite target—himself, live at the Terrace Theatre in Long Beach, California.','/zguG43yzPkiiNOyR9P1HglVNYOl.jpg','1979-01-26',78,'Released',NULL,'Richard Pryor: Live in Concert',22975,1.9219,7.417,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7818,_binary '\0','/xe8kPoHIc9liTcJE71MttqxFIXL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079808',6.4,1591,'en','The Riddle of the Sands','In the early years of the 20th Century, two British yachtsmen (Michael York and Simon MacCorkindale) stumble upon a German plot to invade the east coast of England in a flotilla of specially designed barges. They set out to thwart this terrible scheme, but must outwit not only the cream of the German Navy, but the feared Kaiser Wilhelm himself.','/xLJDkngQr2y6HYQG08NoBCXiibe.jpg','1979-10-02',103,'Released','In these shifting sands, men can disappear without a trace . . . and their secrets with them.','The Riddle of the Sands',11765,1.712,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7819,_binary '\0','/5LIIvrECXVaWyiwWrflkOJh9og0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079813',6.6,12381,'en','Rock \'n\' Roll High School','A group of rock-music-loving students, with the help of the Ramones, take over their school to combat its newly installed oppressive administration.','/kxoDBrtLqMsjMlfWb2caRRY92Xg.jpg','1979-04-20',93,'Released','Will your school be NEXT?','Rock \'n\' Roll High School',26326,2.986,6.3,'qYUzYGRHEo4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7820,_binary '\0','/ahBJZf8YUYPrGxOmQ1IzmPIt8FV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079815',7.4,2438,'en','Rockers','Horsemouth, a drummer living in a ghetto of Kingston, plans to make money selling records. After his prized motorcycle is stolen, his plans fall through and he\'s forced to adapt.','/raCmgkcU6yMfKSkxQD1qRrHUfEq.jpg','1979-11-23',100,'Released','It\'s Dangerous','Rockers',15717,1.123,7.2,'CopS9rPE9D0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7821,_binary '\0','/78jvhi792WFjk1zSwqpfDOudO78.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079817',7.3,254387,'en','Rocky II','After Rocky goes the distance with champ Apollo Creed, both try to put the fight behind them and move on. Rocky settles down with Adrian but can\'t put his life together outside the ring, while Creed seeks a rematch to restore his reputation. Soon enough, the \"Master of Disaster\" and the \"Italian Stallion\" are set on a collision course for a climactic battle that is brutal and unforgettable.','/nMaiiu0CzT77U4JZkUYV7KqdAjK.jpg','1979-06-15',119,'Released','Once he fought for a dream. Now he\'s fighting for love!','Rocky II',1367,9.4326,7.295,'yZrmRBj1r_E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7822,_binary '\0','/pSL75Sg1APD4OHpQs4VyFb8pIFv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079820',7.7,6156,'fr','Le Roi et l\'Oiseau','A young shepherdess and a chimneysweep plan to get married and escape the clutches of a tyrannical king in love with her, assisted by the guile of a cheeky mockingbird, the king\'s archenemy.','/yDbfVUrb9b0Dkm1TptWtzkujXBk.jpg','1980-03-19',83,'Released',NULL,'The King and the Mockingbird',22504,2.6416,7.758,'4tE5902k3nE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7823,_binary '\0','/tsGTKW6nTcGNJkgYfQiyO9VsidJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079822',4.7,2245,'en','Roller Boogie','Teen lovers Bobby and Terry band together with other roller skaters to try and prevent a powerful mobster taking over the land their favourite skating rink sits on, and compete in the Boogie Contest.','/qzerjrsQSnijpA1PuZzRbCXMnqR.jpg','1979-12-19',104,'Released','It\'s love on wheels!','Roller Boogie',75759,1.7753,5.6,'7NRnIIQ9bnc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7824,_binary '\0','/jfbwe2vlMYZKNGpRxwdkVgXtuXz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079826',7,9945,'en','The Rose','Rock-and-roll singer Mary Rose Foster\'s romantic relationships and mental health are continuously imperilled by the demands of life on the road.','/3hYyA2g5r0TDRbkSAOEeKelylh2.jpg','1979-11-07',125,'Released','She gave and gave, until she had nothing left to give','The Rose',16323,2.6378,6.7,'DKir4VZKd4g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7825,_binary '\0','/9bBUH5OfA19jri8YOpXTty1dB0v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079828',6.3,3041,'en','Rudolph and Frosty\'s Christmas in July','Winterbolt is trying to make the North Pole his evil wonderland, and it is up to Frosty the Snowman, Rudolph the Red-Nosed Reindeer and others to stop him.','/v24SYZqlfvzvjyQpt6MtQLQNJ0u.jpg','1979-07-01',97,'Released','A magical, musical fun-filled fantasy!','Rudolph and Frosty\'s Christmas in July',40246,2.0395,6.408,'eKH0lZtn_po','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7826,_binary '\0','/fCf8WfsRJEDFf1N6gA6o4ICRYp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079833',7.6,36288,'ja','ルパン三世 カリオストロの城','After a successful robbery leaves famed thief Lupin the Third and his partner Jigen with nothing but a large amount of expertly crafted counterfeit bills, he decides to track down the forgers responsible—and steal any other treasures he may find in the Castle of Cagliostro, including the \'damsel in distress\' he finds imprisoned there.','/p7xL3WYeclgtGCLrWfBrXKdBV7d.jpg','1979-07-06',102,'Released','Believe in the Thief.','The Castle of Cagliostro',15371,8.0047,7.506,'689aLLvscPo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7827,_binary '\0','/6VCQcDIEBgz8LGAXlxcpwBf2TqV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079836',6.2,1708,'en','S.O.S. Titanic','The Titanic disaster as seen through the eyes of one couple in each of the three classes on board.','/wy5ut2GVpPaNxxXFRdkIywjRpeO.jpg','1980-02-29',144,'Released',NULL,'S.O.S. Titanic',86938,3.0337,6,'UOf01rd7BUs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7828,_binary '\0','/eeWeiZ96fOhkP5vnTX7KoaZIhD1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079839',7.2,3196,'it','Un sacco bello','Three characters\' misadventures in semi-deserted, summertime Rome: a dim-witted mama\'s boy falls for a tourist; a would-be womanizer struggles to find company for his sex tourism trip to Kraków; a hippie is drawn into his father\'s schemes to bring him back into polite society.','/bm51SNYlcohegsZOy9thxy1JtOg.jpg','1980-01-19',97,'Released',NULL,'Fun Is Beautiful',37767,1.5137,7.134,'Na048hpQY_0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7829,_binary '\0','/8T07oMYbl9WH3uXtDJzKVfJiCPQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079843',7,3362,'en','Saint Jack','Jack Flowers is an American hustler trying to make his fortune in 1970s Singapore in small time pimping. His dreams of building a fortune by running a brothel himself and returning to the States is materialized when he is offered the opportunity by the CIA to run a brothel for the R&R activities of U.S. soldiers on leave in Singapore.','/kWrjxCM9fxzw1hdk4gXLWO8tqtD.jpg','1979-04-27',115,'Released','\"People make love for so many crazy reasons-- why shouldn\'t money be one of them?\" - The Gospel According To Saint Jack','Saint Jack',77166,2.5007,6.7,'MJFJL6Alit4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7830,_binary '\0','/p8NHG9uNXn7MSrknNk0LbBjJxQc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079854',6.5,4355,'fr','Sauve qui peut (la vie)','A look at the sexual and professional lives of three people — a television director, his ex-girlfriend, and a sex worker.','/hA69SHZQ3jixYq2wykoTlH2VgjI.jpg','1980-10-12',87,'Released',NULL,'Every Man for Himself',113479,2.6927,6.2,'n0_7IXbI_1I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7831,_binary '\0','/efcPOvtaanJr4rciqxell9SiLZz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079855',4.5,1996,'en','Savage Weekend','Several couples head upstate to the country to watch a boat being built. Unfortunately they are stalked by a murderer behind a ghoulish mask.','/g5qACdzMomhi6N1q2kTE373Dw73.jpg','1979-03-09',87,'Released','You have been chosen. You are doomed. Prepare for a... SAVAGE WEEKEND','Savage Weekend',94874,1.6636,4.4,'ibPlt2Xeb98','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7832,_binary '\0','/2hWDoQrxKR0A4rCJYNNxFHelvKc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079858',5.8,3441,'en','Scavenger Hunt','An eccentric games inventor dies and leaves behind an inheritance worth hundreds of millions of dollars - which will only be given to the person or team, amongst his family and hired help, who wins a madcap scavenger hunt.','/in8CHWcEoLyPCJvb624x5PmVGEv.jpg','1979-12-21',116,'Released','Winner takes all!','Scavenger Hunt',23050,2.5949,5.6,'puEEwVWbesM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7833,_binary '\0','/qviAZShx8MVNwZjk1MoFFEdLUnx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079859',6.1,4735,'it','Uno sceriffo extraterrestre... poco extra e molto terrestre','The town of Newnan are seeing little green men everywhere. The military have arrived and are on the lookout for UFOs. Everyone\'s high strung and Sheriff Hall (Bud Spencer) is left to deal with the aftermaths of the hysteria. On his way home from patrol he happens upon a little boy claiming to be an alien by the name of H7-25. At first the sheriff doesn\'t believe the boy, but with the mounting evidence, even he must eventually concede. Soon the military is after Sheriff Hall and H7-25, and it is up to the sheriff to keep the boy safe and beat up large swaths of soldiers so H7-25 can go home.','/hQKM2cefRD80N21NMFeztk3PnAk.jpg','1979-08-10',88,'Released',NULL,'The Sheriff and the Satellite Kid',10770,2.9302,6.406,'fRqCur5l_cc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7834,_binary '\0','/mBxGnrSWmJlWhTARlZbcaNgNn5U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079867',5.4,1316,'de','Schöner Gigolo, armer Gigolo','After World War I, a war hero returns to Berlin to find that there\'s no place for him--he has no skills other than what he learned in the army, and can only find menial, low-paying jobs. He decides to become a gigolo to lonely rich women.','/y6Ztqro1S3b1TIEImILjAMLOgaa.jpg','1978-11-16',147,'Released',NULL,'Just a Gigolo',12826,2.3957,5,'W8wULhH-Gzo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7835,_binary '\0','/aLwCAYMGhjx2TgSRvEbLUFg3sJc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079871',7.5,14785,'en','Scum','Carlin is a new reform school inmate with a reputation as a hard case. The authorities encourage gang leader Pongo to humble Carlin, but Carlin overtakes Pongo as Daddy of the ward. The guards institute a reign of terror and neglect, with Carlin emerging as an unlikely leader.','/7jgzCmnF4QwRGbv2ubK9VIOAkJp.jpg','1979-09-12',96,'Released','In Borstal, survival rules!','Scum',25476,3.075,7.075,'Sq6oDIRC1N4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7836,_binary '\0','/xQBQj380XvvYYNLwsrabDkmteca.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079875',6.1,2157,'en','The Seduction of Joe Tynan','Respected liberal Senator Joe Tynan is asked to to lead the opposition to a Supreme Court appointment. It means losing an old friend and fudging principles to make the necessary deals, as well as further straining his already part-time family life. But it could be a big boost to his career, so he takes it on. Helping him prepare the case is pretty southern researcher Karen Traynor, and their developing relationship further complicates and compromises his life.','/xxBuqJPGP6sCuLa3QarRZSKh80x.jpg','1979-08-17',108,'Released','There are many ways to be seduced. Fame. Power. Love. Joe Tynan knows them all.','The Seduction of Joe Tynan',47906,2.4363,5.9,'cO7-JZCNrqQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7837,_binary '\0','/edCzlih5knHkHMvivPd665TvWCd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079886',7.4,1524,'zh','山中傳奇','A traveling scholar is intent on translating a Buddhist sutra that is said to have power over the creatures of the afterlife. He slowly finds himself entangled in a mysterious plot involving witchcraft, demons, and a battle to preserve his own soul from the attacks of the supernatural underworld.','/94ZZwpRyTlstNNSw67jFxCJQhYr.jpg','1979-10-04',192,'Released',NULL,'Legend of the Mountain',191531,1.8743,7.4,'Sx8tvBQjiPA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7838,_binary '\0','/2VRqEymQe0rFMK4BFeDI42t5rHr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079889',8.8,2764,'te','శంకరాభరణం','Sankara Shastri is a devout and famous classical singer who finds a fan in Tulasi, a prostitute\'s daughter. She wants to devote herself to his service, but her mother has other plans for her.','/9LDbi3KsrpBQL48uXIPWTYsdjyF.jpg','1980-02-02',143,'Released',NULL,'Sankarabharanam',30088,0.976,5.895,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7839,_binary '\0','/jmLVkQDxQfK8kkchz9t1c7khtr1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079891',6.8,5167,'zh','少林寺','The Tang emperor is betrayed by one of his generals, who installs himself as emperor in the East Capital. The son of one of his slave workers escapes to the Shaolin Temple, learns kung fu, and sets out to kill the traitor who killed his father.','/mKt2c9nvc9qHIoa530XdZi4X1WZ.jpg','1982-01-21',100,'Released',NULL,'Shaolin Temple',10275,4.5462,7,'4ClFErO2jGI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7840,_binary '\0','/8FMHwSIA7XflnGSYraMV34qL4YE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079894',3.2,1619,'en','The Shape of Things to Come','Planet Earth is a devastated wasteland, and what\'s left of humanity has colonized the Moon in domed cities. Humanity\'s continued survival depends on an anti-radiation drug only available on planet Delta Three, which has been taken over by Omus, a brilliant but mad mechanic who places no value on human life. Omus wants to come to the Moon to rule and intends to attack it by ramming robot-controlled spaceships into the domes. Dr. John Caball, his son Jason, Jason\'s friend, Kim, and a robot named Sparks embark on Caball\'s space battlecruiser on an unauthorized mission to Delta Three to stop Omus.','/yXKgpRHS65NrsEDKa6dXgrcpzpW.jpg','1979-05-04',98,'Released','Beyond the earth... Beyond the moon... Beyond your wildest imagination!','The Shape of Things to Come',41415,2.2651,4.1,'bUT4Lp8P0Mo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7841,_binary '\0','/nyecOt0K9j2XhG5KY45l3Fep8VN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079907',7.9,2535,'ru','Сибириада','The story about a very small god-forgotten village in Siberia reflects the history of Russia from the beginning of the century till the early 1980s. Three generations try to find the land of happiness and to give it to the people. One builds the road through taiga to the star over horizon, the second \'build communism\' and the third searches for oil.','/vDEOq1Blm5QIYFWviDf1L012gHP.jpg','1979-11-28',275,'Released',NULL,'Siberiade',68553,2.2629,7.194,'ug3dXDa_Dpw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7842,_binary '\0','/k1KnMf4b0ZKLdAkyU4HvBxZCdD2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079920',6.4,1358,'fr','Les Sœurs Brontë','In a small presbytery in Yorkshire, England, living under the watchful eyes of their aunt and father, a strict Anglican pastor, the Bronte sisters write their first works and quickly become literary sensations.','/jhohlLsMo8J1R0BJ8mra3CBuFQZ.jpg','1979-05-09',120,'Released',NULL,'The Bronte Sisters',91901,2.8634,5.8,'w1AwrJP9VL0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7843,_binary '\0','/6yrbWzzrPp7pwz6zHdifspJk8t3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079944',8,158036,'ru','Сталкер','Near a gray and unnamed city is the Zone, a place guarded by barbed wire and soldiers, and where the normal laws of physics are victim to frequent anomalies. A stalker guides two men into the Zone, specifically to an area in which deep-seated desires are granted.','/1qhOyf5C4s9ZdvY8d5JDx9DFMeT.jpg','1979-05-25',162,'Released','There\'s no need to speak. You must only...concentrate and recall all your past life. When a man thinks of the past, he becomes kinder.','Stalker',1398,9.0893,8.1,'JCuwthnCRpg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7844,_binary '\0','/rPaOAtK6OpnHQ9r61WPM4WWNxaH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079945',6.4,102266,'en','Star Trek: The Motion Picture','When an unidentified alien destroys three powerful Klingon cruisers, Captain James T. Kirk returns to the newly transformed U.S.S. Enterprise to take command.','/wfiAfNwH6CMKxz4vRaW8CPTabtk.jpg','1979-12-07',131,'Released','The human adventure is just beginning.','Star Trek: The Motion Picture',152,10.095,6.5,'zrXvBaFFu80','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7845,_binary '\0','/tyNMdZ79VpDsX6y0oSqirJlYJNi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079946',4,8965,'it','Starcrash','A pair of smugglers manage to pick up a castaway while running from the authorities, who turns out to be the only survivor from a secret mission to destroy a mysterious superweapon designed by the evil Count Zartharn. The smugglers are soon recruited by the Emperor to complete the mission, as well as to rescue the Emperor\'s son, who has gone missing.','/npJt35Q36aGcTYpcg9epbwQIIkz.jpg','1978-12-21',92,'Released','A galactic adventure beyond your wildest dreams!','Starcrash',22049,3.2011,4.2,'4cOPzFj2BQw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7846,_binary '\0','/y50gto8KjSGnabp6SCO1nNTqrkk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079948',6.4,3768,'en','Starting Over','After divorcing his ambitious singer wife, a middle-aged man begins a new relationship with a teacher.','/kvhfunLx3iL3VM0rjmFLV2dcEyd.jpg','1979-10-05',105,'Released','Phil Potter would like to straighten out his life... One way, or the other.','Starting Over',54663,4.2631,6.41,'wNo3rmGbLIo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7847,_binary '\0','/dTtuL3I7LoWCTBaF5NjWWIbN5TY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079963',6.5,1354,'hi','Suhaag','Durga and Vikram Singh have been married for years. Vikram has taken to crime in a big way, and as a result has antagonized a rival gangster, Jaggi. Durga gives birth to twins, and Jaggi steals one of them, and sells him to a bootlegger, Pascal. Durga is upset when she finds her son missing, but is devastated when Vikram abandons her. With a lot of difficulty, Durga brings up her son, Kishan, and has given up on finding her other son. Kishan has grown up and is now a dedicated police officer. On the other hand, Pascal has exploited Amit, kept him illiterate, doing petty crime, and alcoholic. This gets him in confrontation with Kishan, but ironically the two settle their differences and become fast friends. Vikram is still alive, and is not aware of his two sons and wife being alive.','/vpdD87CumkhUoCdDwFDD5N0xv3V.jpg','1979-10-29',164,'Released',NULL,'Suhaag',161433,1.3365,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7848,_binary '\0','/wwIJSgNDugIHBJ2aM7HFOXjwDUh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079980',7.3,3971,'fr','Série noire','In the shadowy outskirts of Paris, a desperate door-to-door salesman crosses paths with a mysterious young woman trapped in a grim world. As his obsession deepens, his grip on reality begins to slip—and the line between escape and destruction starts to blur.','/1NUWLFB9QwwxCDHgdaYw8fcV84q.jpg','1979-04-25',111,'Released',NULL,'Serie Noire',64349,1.4063,7.4,'jXdNc76aPVc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7849,_binary '\0','/82lAkdyuka7lDa8unf37Q6FMLws.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0079985',7.2,1589,'sh','Tajna Nikole Tesle','Life and times of Nikola Tesla, famous scientist whose inventions were stolen, but whose greatest contribution to mankind remain a mystery to this day.','/teuDrqS7xj1mCKrORarJFCxSs43.jpg','1980-02-19',115,'Released','The Genius Who Lit The World','The Secret of Nikola Tesla',51444,1.7657,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7850,_binary '\0','/hEVAABU2c86MU42jlnGRM9FcCq5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080009',7.3,20141,'en','Tess','A strong-willed peasant girl is sent by her father to the estate of some local aristocrats to capitalize on a rumour that their families are from the same line. This fateful visit commences an epic narrative of sex, class, betrayal, and revenge.','/xejUFnoAVxzvU95o2jlzG2USmY.jpg','1979-10-06',172,'Released','She was born into a world where they called it seduction, not rape. What she did would shatter that world forever.','Tess',11121,4.0593,7.062,'hKZQ7xJvTgA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7851,_binary '\0','/xt9ORdxwAk42xNpGuH0fN9pLcE5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080012',6.7,1423,'en','That Sinking Feeling','Ronnie, Wal, Andy and Vic are four bored, unemployed teens in dreary, rainy Glasgow. Ronnie comes up with a great idea. He has noticed that stainless steel sinks are worth a lot of money and comes up with a complicated scheme: to steal sinks from a warehouse dressed as girls and using a stop-motion-potion.','/kOyW53nAqEY7V2PXuWWV9flWsxD.jpg','1980-10-01',93,'Released','There\'s got to be more to life than committing suicide.','That Sinking Feeling',26771,1.1316,6.1,'Vo0trI_lYeY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7852,_binary '\0','/pt28sGYZ7na4WmdsDd4bjxQuWdU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080016',5.8,2156,'en','Thirst','The descendant of Elizabeth Bathory is abducted by a cult of self-proclaimed supermen who achieve this state of superiority by drinking from the \"blood cows\" kept at the \"dairy farm\", and they try to get her to join them.','/tYB9ms0DxhQ9GCTV2jpICSnLgo8.jpg','1979-09-28',95,'Released','This ancient Evil is now a modern industry.','Thirst',61689,1.9752,6.1,'9CKjc9uM1gE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7853,_binary '\0','/dgRkUEKky71NHb2UyoVM2TroTKd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080024',6.4,4089,'en','Tim','Handsome but backward gardener Tim Melville has a new woman in his life. She is Mary, his widowed employer, a woman who had given up on love until she had found Tim. At first they are friends. But soon they become lovers, as Mary, drawn to Tim\'s innocence and magnetism, begins to teach him all about life - and love.','/k7UqiUso1CS3EFs3BP6P12Sez47.jpg','1979-07-13',109,'Released','A Heartrending Story of Courage and Devotion','Tim',31179,2.4079,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7854,_binary '\0','/1HDpR7nLqQcGSdbC41pSxCPjjyH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080025',7,21553,'en','Time After Time','Writer H. G. Wells pursues Jack the Ripper to modern day San Francisco after the infamous serial killer steals his time machine to escape the 19th century.','/A4SXZxQempzTUReRlQiFaYc6KaC.jpg','1979-09-28',112,'Released','H.G. Wells Races Through Time To Catch Jack The Ripper!','Time After Time',24750,4.2583,6.8,'GyM_8Al0_yw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7855,_binary '\0','/1Pq4E7G2m8pyUAciAMOV7T9POf5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080031',6.8,6830,'en','Tom Horn','A renowned former army scout is hired by ranchers to hunt down rustlers but finds himself on trial for the murder of a boy when he carries out his job too well. Tom Horn finds that the simple skills he knows are of no help in dealing with the ambitions of ranchers and corrupt officials as progress marches over him and the old west.','/2psanhsRyBxZOlg9zg9uE54M32w.jpg','1980-03-28',94,'Released','See him before he sees you.','Tom Horn',5917,2.2097,6.4,'4HnhdJ2Fx_4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7856,_binary '\0','/m6D6i7VUY8nlD2CWe0CcBpJjPpt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080037',8.3,4412,'ru','Тот самый Мюнхгаузен','A philosophical and poetic portrait of the famous (or maybe infamous?) Baron Munchhausen. His crazy, yet very merriment, stories, views and behavior is what sets him apart from others. He becomes alienated from the society that failed to grasp his brilliance. In fact, his brilliance is what underlines the faults with the society itself. It\'s a beautiful yet tragic story that is filled with dense and intellectual dialogue.','/ofW7l89csAAe9XpVINFCjlQIpiv.jpg','1979-12-31',142,'Released',NULL,'The Very Same Munchhausen',27937,1.4489,7.612,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7857,_binary '\0','/zOfIcQhwElCp0tLX0dU02wJq3Nj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080040',6,15297,'en','Tourist Trap','After their car breaks down, a group of young travelers find themselves stranded at a roadside museum run by the enigmatic Mr. Slausen and populated by his collection of life-like wax mannequins.','/c19pSkUfNElrmVn0iYtiJys5dK8.jpg','1979-03-14',89,'Released','You\'ll never be the same again!','Tourist Trap',13570,3.2833,6.11,'BbLCNWVaIgY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7858,_binary '\0','/fL9ca2p8wCW0FwT0tCNCzGiHw1x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080057',6.8,33717,'it','Zombi 2','After an abandoned boat sails into New York harbor with a zombie aboard, a reporter teams up with the daughter of the boat\'s missing captain to investigate the island where he was last seen conducting research—the site of an alleged zombie outbreak.','/jc17a3PqDnQeBzT7GbK0dp8TDvx.jpg','1979-08-25',91,'Released','We are going to eat you!','Zombie Flesh Eaters',7219,3.4463,6.75,'7q8VMyNiYxM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7859,_binary '\0','/eMDc7DYW2J331gU9xis2EPDer6W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080058',4,1482,'it','L\'umanoide','Hoping to overthrow his brother as ruler of the planet Metropolis, the evil Graal enlists the help of the insane Dr. Kraspin, who has invented a chemical capable of turning an ordinary person into a perfect soldier. They test this chemical on the pilot Golob, turning the unsuspecting victim into a mindless but indestructible automaton possessing superhuman strength. The people of Metropolis must somehow outwit Graal before he can create an army of these soldiers, or their planet will be destroyed.','/mUPf4cx3o9IWtC4dDs46B4oNb9b.jpg','1979-04-11',100,'Released','Light years beyond tomorrow...','The Humanoid',73065,2.0025,3.7,'OUOsqkn7IDI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7860,_binary '\0','/bQti2lJ7cXKM5uucqpK2OjFQScK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080062',5.2,1566,'en','Unidentified Flying Oddball','A NASA spacecraft proves Einstein right when, traveling faster than light, it ends up near King Arthur\'s Camelot. On board are big-hearted Tom Trimble and Hermes, the look-alike robot he built. Tom immediately makes friends with pretty Alisande while becoming enemies with the evil knight Sir Mordred. It seems Mordred has joined up with the Sorcerer Merlin and they are both up to no good. It is now up to Tom to try and use 20th century technology to foil their plans.','/ryc2shc5sOxweNOuwM2j0v0eqLU.jpg','1979-07-19',93,'Released','Chaos in the Cosmos!','Unidentified Flying Oddball',65596,2.1739,5.6,'AL6mRmUyroE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7861,_binary '\0','/abid0ec5tLGxaDYdPz8myxYc22O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080080',3.9,1263,'en','Vampire Hookers','A sinister vampire sends out a horde of undead beauties to bring back victims for his dinner.','/3IbXVjvGnfyEQbhjY4TrdeeX9Y9.jpg','1978-07-01',82,'Released','Warm blood isn\'t all they suck!','Vampire Hookers',119586,3.0204,3.6,'rINz05v3tJw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7862,_binary '\0','/hRsGatlfENkYugXiazvpqAI9bQA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080097',5.3,8542,'en','The Villain','Handsome Stranger has agreed to escort Charming Jones to collect her inheritance from her father. But Avery Simpson wants the money and hires notorious outlaw Cactus Jack to ambush Charming. However, Cactus Jack is not very good at robbing people.','/kqLCiWYfQu5hAq7NZoSXV59a4yX.jpg','1979-07-26',89,'Released','...the fastest fun in the west!','The Villain',163907,3.6822,5.8,'Ohrzfr3BI6U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7863,_binary '\0','/bVsGMzJ1jpJpxCzzGbXjvrd4Hcq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080100',5.2,5257,'en','Stridulum','An ancient intergalactic warrior arrives on Earth to put a stop to a demonic child\'s plot to reproduce Satan\'s next generation of evil.','/o8UceYrcX1KuFznKxMtp9N7JpQR.jpg','1979-03-22',109,'Released','They know we are here...','The Visitor',54013,2.4481,5.319,'8hDxJg78Iew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7864,_binary '\0','/3O4RorU1xt56mv4o8yTMMPL7FbQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080116',5.5,1707,'en','Wanda Nevada','In the American Southwest of the 1950s, middle-aged vagabond Beaudray Demerille survives as a cardsharp who moves from town to town. But his latest victory brings him unwanted spoils in the form of Wanda Nevada, a fiery 13-year-old. At first Beaudray does everything he can to ditch Wanda -- until the girl chances upon a treasure map. But Wanda and Beaudray aren\'t the only ones after the loot, and they must contend with a ruthless pair of crooks.','/bEwdIkXKKcGWYSpEms7T0GyJF66.jpg','1979-06-01',107,'Released','A PRO & A CON. The rest is history.','Wanda Nevada',46460,2.0949,5.8,'uBR5iCsd1pE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7865,_binary '\0','/c4hWk3pBYlpukYNFeEq29wpxAO1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080117',7.3,13632,'en','The Wanderers','The streets of the Bronx are owned by \'60s youth gangs where the joy and pain of adolescence is lived. Philip Kaufman tells his take on the novel by Richard Price about the history of the Italian-American gang ‘The Wanderers.’','/p8vxJHlCbmmnUX3p8bEAzXZfcIT.jpg','1979-07-13',117,'Released','It was The Wanderers against the world ... and the world never had a chance!','The Wanderers',233,4.8824,7,'LacD6mHpBhY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7866,_binary '\0','/i4Fp0AJsqAzbeVQyCoG0adRRfdh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080120',7.5,120940,'en','The Warriors','Prominent gang leader Cyrus calls a meeting of New York\'s gangs to set aside their turf wars and take over the city. At the meeting, a rival leader kills Cyrus, but a Coney Island gang called the Warriors is wrongly blamed for Cyrus\' death. Before you know it, the cops and every gangbanger in town is hot on the Warriors\' trail.','/d6YZpBq4BhQr1K985J3CuL1cA8J.jpg','1979-02-01',94,'Released','These are the armies of the night. They are 100,000 strong. They outnumber the cops five to one. They could run New York City. Tonight they\'re all out to get the Warriors.','The Warriors',11474,9.7393,7.68,'IAn_PrquNIY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7867,_binary '\0','/3dK12SaczU7Tf8btq7K2F5HQg6F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080130',6.4,16167,'en','When a Stranger Calls','A student babysitter has her evening disturbed when the phone rings. So begins a series of increasingly terrifying and threatening calls that lead to a shocking revelation.','/mdhpKVuuNZcc9noZzYXruxeIxdJ.jpg','1979-08-24',97,'Released','Every babysitter\'s nightmare becomes real...','When a Stranger Calls',45964,3.6893,6.2,'2oC4QJtPMH0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7868,_binary '\0','/2u0VxcEoI9RqnV7yugE5Dihlkc6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080139',6.2,4437,'en','Winter Kills','The younger brother of an assassinated US President is led down a rabbit hole of conspiracies and dead ends after learning of a man claiming to be the real shooter.','/qDGAY2FCuRX82VOfi0Lr47SCnTl.jpg','1979-05-11',97,'Released','Something funny is happening in WINTER KILLS. Take it seriously!','Winter Kills',42178,2.8647,5.746,'wMCJcLvTKY8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7869,_binary '\0','/6DCf47GiqRqW5v2IfBfURpCQdlT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080140',6.9,7180,'en','Wise Blood','A Southerner--young, poor, ambitious but uneducated--determines to become something in the world. He decides that the best way to do that is to become a preacher and start up his own church.','/gSZQC6u86iaugBSs1KBrXST7KSL.jpg','1979-10-24',106,'Released','An American Masterpiece!','Wise Blood',42179,2.0069,6.4,'GtvjLdwEBMM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7870,_binary '\0','/7J9mhvkKH6kvjshBNNcEJungJvG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080149',6.9,11606,'de','Woyzeck','Having fathered an illegitimate child with his lover, Marie, feckless soldier Franz Woyzeck takes odd jobs around his small town to provide some extra money for them. One job is volunteering for experiments conducted by a local doctor, who puts Woyzeck on a diet of peas. This serves to drive him close to madness, and the discovery that Marie is involved in an affair with the local drum major exacerbates the situation. Pushed too far, Woyzeck resorts to violence.','/lxJThwhfqvyIRD6VszknCNCSokK.jpg','1979-05-25',82,'Released','Shame, vengeance, terror... love.','Woyzeck',10319,1.9041,6.642,'HFRRq-UGOHc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7871,_binary '\0','/2G3nx1OqnfsUr0Ht3RpKGQj2GJN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080157',6.4,3995,'en','Yanks','During WWII, the United States set up army bases in Great Britain as part of the war effort. Against their proper sensibilities, many of the Brits don\'t much like the brash Yanks, especially when it comes to the G.I.s making advances on the lonely British girls. One relationship that develops is between married John, an Army Captain, and the aristocratic Helen, whose naval husband is away at war. Helen loves her husband, but Helen and John are looking for some comfort during the difficult times.','/zsTyD3U9iiFDYGWW3Xix4Q2Opuf.jpg','1979-09-19',138,'Released','In 1942 everyone loved a soldier','Yanks',21666,3.3057,5.9,'jZ8QEeUiJS8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7872,_binary '\0','/rD8uu75LCuvTLi2rNzPdmHdbLDY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080166',7.2,1748,'cn','雜家小子','After being cheated out of some money, two small time crooks convince a martial arts expert to take them on as students.','/aAaGCa6X8E0AnwM96nCLvNcDIB5.jpg','1979-04-12',105,'Released',NULL,'Knockabout',39901,2.8984,7,'G6xBFeEEwbU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7873,_binary '\0','/codlz54xeVezTm1GrZoq3rM3ovi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080172',7.5,3158,'zh','中華丈夫','When a series of martial misunderstandings spirals into an international incident, a Chinese martial arts student struggling to relate to his new Japanese wife is forced to take on seven of Japan\'s most powerful martial arts masters, each an expert in a different discipline, ranging from karate to samurai to ninjitsu.','/h06JtkvCkOChzcm13O8DYVwmspP.jpg','1978-12-30',101,'Released','There is nothing more terrifying than the ninja... except death!','Heroes of the East',40980,2.5849,7.299,'R_Exl1eek3k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7874,_binary '\0','/oxQJT3CCwxRRDgnPUZvT6xmts61.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080179',7.4,48376,'cn','醉拳','After getting into trouble, a mischievous young man is sent to train under a brutal, but slovenly old beggar, who teaches him the secret of the Drunken Fist.','/cf43J2SH8tECZVl9N5n0Q6Ckche.jpg','1978-10-05',111,'Released','The Original Kung Fu Comedy!','Drunken Master',11230,17.8908,7.394,'GDBi7uwFwRA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7875,_binary '\0','/jHPmZcPryuzMg63CWexgo0GelmJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080180',6.7,8432,'en','Zulu Dawn','In 1879, the British suffer a great loss at the Battle of Isandlwana due to incompetent leadership.','/ctFPU9UfW3epa53x1FNylSCR6iC.jpg','1979-05-14',117,'Released','The sun dawned bloodied... two great armies met face to face... and the earth trembled to the sound of the Zulu death chant!','Zulu Dawn',18061,3.5316,6.1,'gu8usgmMzDQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7876,_binary '\0','/bU5zz7pHFmI2Za0PQiecWq1Cpj0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080310',7.8,15564,'en','Breaker Morant','During the Boer War, three Australian lieutenants are on trial for shooting Boer prisoners. Though they acted under orders, they are being used as scapegoats by the General Staff, who hopes to distance themselves from the irregular practices of the war. The trial does not progress as smoothly as expected by the General Staff, as the defence puts up a strong fight in the courtroom.','/Nr46BDNjBtz3s0wRvm84eK3PXl.jpg','1980-06-11',107,'Released','A powerful true story of bitter revenge...','Breaker Morant',13783,4.0199,7.1,'yIItaUtWJnE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7877,_binary '\0','/5nPdiQPru77rqQXHbtNDZIPmZlC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080319',7,48382,'en','Nine to Five','Three female employees of a sexist, egotistical, lying, hypocritical bigot find a way to turn the tables on him.','/wndwKY8WnSfhCUn7iSXI37dE7yo.jpg','1980-12-18',110,'Released','The power behind the throne.','Nine to Five',19494,8.087,7,'3R2WsyoS2FM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7878,_binary '\0','/qbJBWsZNXGiydz9sCWYKJGsVFNE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080321',8.3,1374,'en','AC/DC - Let There Be Rock','1. Live Wire 2. Shot Down In Flames 3. Hell Ain\'t A Bad Place To Be 4. Sin City 5. Walk All Over You 6. Bad Boy Boogie 7. The Jack 8. Highway To Hell 9. Girls Got Rhythm 10. High Voltage 11. Whole Lotta Rosie 12. Rocker 13. Let There Be Rock AC/DC: Let There Be Rock was filmed on 9 December 1979 at the Pavillon de Paris in Paris, France, and also contains interviews with members of the band, including lead vocalist Bon Scott, who died two months after filming. The concert film was re-released on a Blu-ray/DVD double pack along with a collector\'s tin, concert pictures, a souvenir guitar pick, and a 32-page booklet, or just as Blu-ray or DVD individual sets on 7 June 2011. Only 90,000 of the collectors tins were made, and each labeled with a number out of 90,000 on the base of the tin.','/1OVX8H4vXRCuCUNQDYVuRfskX0N.jpg','1980-09-01',95,'Released','The only movie powered by AC/DC','AC/DC - Let There Be Rock',50125,2.1223,8,'PXODLkJ9h1s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7879,_binary '\0','/dpEa6ucT1ovIH8Hxo3M7BqJtiwk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080322',7.9,1341,'hi','आक्रोश','In the 1980s, a lawyer defends a tribal man who is under arrest for killing his own wife. As he proceeds with the case, he learns about the harsh life of scheduled tribes in India.','/uJRbl9X6agXb3gTjHsmJebW7HDh.jpg','1980-01-01',144,'Released',NULL,'Aakrosh',190213,1.1925,7.433,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7880,_binary '\0','/wQyvrsNSTzFVEGgarZbFkFyIciy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080339',7.7,292592,'en','Airplane!','An ex-fighter pilot is forced to take over the controls of an airliner when the flight crew succumbs to food poisoning.','/7Q3efxd3AF1vQjlSxnlerSA7RzN.jpg','1980-06-27',88,'Released','What\'s slower than a speeding bullet, and able to hit tall buildings at a single bound?','Airplane!',813,21.0199,7.304,'HMnVs287AJ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7881,_binary '\0','/kwLKJHtHQxYQjEwTTAW3zHeb5rh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080341',7.6,3134,'bn','আকালের সন্ধানে','A young, idealistic director arrives in a village to make a picture set during the Great Bengal Famine. It’s a film that he hopes will reveal the problems and privations still current in rural India.','/mmYSY3ZjjjK45nzC6lW2bV0lEVU.jpg','1981-01-04',128,'Released',NULL,'In Search of Famine',214386,0.9095,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7882,_binary '\0','/kjGj3dEWhKWDVAmXLjqC3cPofkG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080346',2.8,1431,'en','The Alien Dead','A meteor strikes a houseboat in the swamps near a southern town populated by Yankees with fake accents. The people on the houseboat become zombies who feed on the alligators in the swamp. Once they run out of alligators, they start going for the citizens. A local scientist tries to figure out what\'s happening to people once they start disappearing.','/sqXgqVEYBH3msXc5nI01oQk8axD.jpg','1980-06-01',74,'Released','The Bodies Are Dead: The Remains Live On…','The Alien Dead',25712,1.3014,3.1,'cTH12l0TCtc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7883,_binary '\0','/5zd5IfpPcN11HkIJ1BxPYcKsQHr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080354',6.1,18750,'en','Alligator','A baby alligator is flushed down a toilet and survives by eating discarded lab animals that have been injected with growth hormones. The now gigantic animal escapes the city sewers and goes on a rampage, pursued by a cop and a big-game hunter.','/bWANAIIeNPzwEmrYUvZFECTbBX6.jpg','1980-11-14',91,'Released','It lives 50 feet beneath the city. It\'s 36 feet long. It weighs 2,000 pounds...And it\'s about to break out!','Alligator',33518,5.3635,6,'4_f3-h4tGFQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7884,_binary '\0','/4iJQItnH2qmV7fZVDGvdE4XyxcO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080360',6.9,43046,'en','Altered States','A research scientist explores the boundaries and frontiers of human consciousness. Using sensory deprivation and hallucinogenic mixtures from Native American shamans, he explores these altered states of cognizance and finds that memory, time, and reality itself are states of mind.','/fsoaPN5SWYgZ4B7GG9nRNj33so.jpg','1980-12-25',103,'Released','In the basement of a university medical school, Dr. Jessup floats naked in total darkness. The most terrifying experiment in the history of science is out of control... and the subject is himself.','Altered States',11542,5.8327,6.7,'0XNVQ4ILPBA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7885,_binary '\0','/ixS4JvfuIqqMWW5kxxz1m3Vc0P4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080362',4.7,1268,'it','L\'altro inferno','A priest investigates paranormal activity at a nuns\' convent where a deep, dark secret is about to resurface in the guise of murder! Could the devil be behind this, or is that just what Mother Superior wants everyone to believe?','/fUQkx1nLYd4Jvmno2oJfwI4sgdK.jpg','1981-01-22',88,'Released','Say Your Prayers.','The Other Hell',124393,1.0689,4.9,'GHlBZRPS3VQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7886,_binary '\0','/74FYuO2hDNmFt4Yz3IQ1ORcp5K9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080365',6.3,31424,'en','American Gigolo','Julian makes a lucrative living as an escort to older women in the Los Angeles area. He begins a relationship with Michelle, a local politician\'s wife, without expecting any pay. One of his clients is murdered and Detective Sunday begins pumping him for details on his different clients, something he is reluctant to do considering the nature of his work. Julian begins to suspect he\'s being framed. Meanwhile Michelle begins to fall in love with him.','/igXGCwti23PHOjLKQX6eGIGzQiJ.jpg','1980-02-01',117,'Released','He\'s the highest paid lover in Beverly Hills. He leaves women feeling more alive than they\'ve ever felt before. Except one.','American Gigolo',2768,7.1526,6.2,'A26Vndy7WaM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7887,_binary '\0','/xOxXrSBkxYl9Zcch5YBa0vDPer0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080377',6.1,22796,'en','Any Which Way You Can','Philo takes part in a bare knuckle fight – as he does – to make more money than he can earn from his car repair business. He decides to retire, but when the Mafia come along and arrange another fight, he\'s pushed into it. A motorcycle gang and an orangutan called Clyde all add to the \'fun\'.','/cjqS8TXTy0GvqPBfdB4CAbFCYW6.jpg','1980-12-17',115,'Released','Get it with Clint and Clyde','Any Which Way You Can',17169,5.2083,5.8,'-ukQ1Ov0PlM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7888,_binary '\0','/ygAhmnjvrfCfP3HTeJEfqh1WyuK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080379',5.5,4936,'it','Apocalypse Domani','Released from captivity in Vietnam, two American Army officers return to civilian life and discover they have acquired an insatiable taste for human flesh. A city is terrorised... as they stalk the inhabitants to satisfy their primitive appetites.','/tc15RXXTM5LDNvJy6vrJs5eKzaY.jpg','1980-08-04',96,'Released','POW\'s in Vietnam... starved in captivity... released with a taste for human flesh.','Cannibal Apocalypse',8692,2.1188,5.504,'O46ulAjjRpg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7889,_binary '\0','/3L05HQS4GiR8PXCq0JjqXShoLRF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080380',4.3,3167,'en','The Apple','In a pseudo-futuristic 1994, a square couple enter the corrupt world of the music industry, and subsequently a maze of drugs, sex, and temptation.','/yQxFFhPzH3hzzmlEeCU0aKyOC4T.jpg','1980-11-21',88,'Released','The Power of Rock... In 1994','The Apple',49069,2.0696,4.6,'OXEi1f_tuMc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7890,_binary '\0','/27Y0dGVBW0ZowwRjfa6nHbfP2aR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080388',7.3,20001,'en','Atlantic City','In a corrupt city, a small-time gangster and the estranged wife of a pot dealer find themselves thrown together in an escapade of love, money, drugs and danger.','/t7COhy9HkznR0gcdhTNwtHmBN31.jpg','1980-09-03',104,'Released','Where dreamers can be winners.','Atlantic City',23954,4.1135,6.794,'fwDjsStvBbA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7891,_binary '\0','/n8jSLMc8zT2p1rELAUyRCc3VN7B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080391',4.6,16636,'en','Attack of the Killer Tomatoes!','After a wave of reports of mysterious attacks involving people and pets being eaten by the traditionally docile fruit, a special government task force is set up to investigate the violent fruit and put a stop to their murderous spree.','/flCZ7TcuFsT8K5pz6vDZ0Gjk7Nu.jpg','1978-10-04',87,'Released','A new musical-comedy-horror show!','Attack of the Killer Tomatoes!',2182,3.6136,5.1,'nWu6uOBSCVc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7892,_binary '\0','/lg7D3qZsTONUKiHYayL5f9vq1zU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080393',6.3,1871,'it','Attila flagello di Dio','The misadventures of Attila and his band of barbarians as they take up arms against the Roman Empire in their native Milano','/ecizJo3j1PPvLBMhl3thYk82rXK.jp