 quickly turns into a deeply passionate love affair that threatens to overtake them both. When Milena ends up in the hospital from an overdose, Alex is taken into custody by Inspector Netusil.','/raLS93dykOabizFuguWZ9KeCKAS.jpg','1980-03-02',123,'Released','His terrifying obsession took them to the brink of death and beyond.','Bad Timing',33214,2.749,6.578,'3BOqQGMdIVE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7897,_binary '\0','/qD3yYekQketJread9YEByPL3HpU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080421',5.5,11732,'en','Battle Beyond the Stars','A young farmer assembles a band of diverse mercenaries to defend his peaceful planet from an evil tyrant.','/2PKjoWF8Y46lYjPDS2ARgNAnzC0.jpg','1980-09-08',103,'Released','A battle beyond time, beyond space.','Battle Beyond the Stars',14460,4.5581,5.374,'2t7z_44nGio','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7898,_binary '\0','/sB7INCchbQHl4iLN20DbZOnVRHI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080431',4.2,1287,'en','Beyond Evil','Middle-aged newlyweds Larry & Barbara spend their honeymoon at a palatial Filipino mansion, unaware that it is inhabited by the vengeful spirit of a notorious voodoo witch queen who was murdered a century ago. The woman\'s evil spirit promptly begins precipitating a variety of violent deaths in accordance with a diabolical ritual intended to bring her back to life -a process which is ultimately consummated by taking possession of Barbara\'s body.','/mFE1K45Lo0YRDw8hC9VSiHW1k3D.jpg','1980-05-01',94,'Released','Beyond Death. Beyond Pain. Beyond Evil.','Beyond Evil',88410,1.597,4.2,'rB-rEHHT7cE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7899,_binary '\0','/6m0Q9oHooJGNY6sQZHOuWxJ4X0y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080436',5.7,6449,'en','The Big Brawl','A young Asian American martial artist is forced to participate in a brutal formal street-fight competition.','/jFl2hmGWFX9mw0NvOOn08Zr8bn5.jpg','1980-08-18',95,'Released','Where the only rule is to stay alive.','The Big Brawl',19267,5.6759,5.9,'4wohGrgSCes','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7900,_binary '\0','/mpRSzmUX0Lsimgg0M8hZRS2xrDC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080437',7.1,23087,'en','The Big Red One','A veteran sergeant of World War I leads a squad in World War II, always in the company of the survivor Pvt. Griff, the writer Pvt. Zab, the Sicilian Pvt. Vinci and Pvt. Johnson, in Vichy French Africa, Sicily, D-Day at Omaha Beach, Belgium and France, and ending in a concentration camp in Czechoslovakia where they face the true horror of war.','/h0VcqQ3z1RroKk7WtiW0E6DDho2.jpg','1980-05-28',162,'Released','Only chance could have thrown them together. Now, nothing can pull them apart.','The Big Red One',16121,4.8447,6.7,'D911lxh4tm0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7901,_binary '\0','/97tbLFiIBbj31a9wUeVTW8cyjvS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080439',7.6,11756,'it','Il bisbetico domato','A rich farmer is well known for being very unkind. He\'s misanthropic, misogynous and cantankerous. Until he meets by chance a gorgeous girl...','/3B5MA242hHcnpf54hGWKbVovPmX.jpg','1980-12-20',104,'Released',NULL,'The Taming of the Scoundrel',10986,4.5179,7.1,'1GT3cSCpwyY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7902,_binary '\0','/mSdpQhD0AzwKiwGiWhMqn04XbWB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080440',5.8,4874,'it','Black Cat: Gatto nero','Townspeople of a small English village begin to die in a series of horrible accidents, and a Scotland Yard inspector arrives to investigate a mysterious local medium who records conversations with the dead.','/69bYJOdhjXXVycXd8mZdlpyYgyr.jpg','1981-04-04',92,'Released','When you hear this cat breathing down your neck… start praying… before you finish your Amen… you\'re dead!','The Black Cat',26503,2.7468,6.1,'2M8Wdum_B6c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7903,_binary '\0','/oVqEe0Y4UrwlCDPjWdSRUjyVxVt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080448',3.9,1310,'en','Bloodeaters','After drug crops are sprayed with a chemical by a passing airplane, the growers of the crop are poisoned by the chemical and turn into zombie-like mutants.','/jcH558y4ygT6XTRYd4jmoW4TLIP.jpg','1980-10-01',89,'Released','They Thought They Were Just Killing Some Weeds. Instead, They Grew A Whole New Kind Of Crop!','Bloodeaters',59734,1.5874,4,'SuiDZlhEKtQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7904,_binary '\0','/4HYBkZPz2Gb7LWXludvvOfATzGS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080453',5.8,84227,'en','The Blue Lagoon','Two small children and a ship\'s cook survive a shipwreck and find safety on an idyllic tropical island. Soon, however, the cook dies and the young boy and girl are left on their own. Days become years and Emmeline and Richard make a home for themselves surrounded by exotic creatures and nature\'s beauty. But will they ever see civilization again?','/hg57Zr63A96mpIQKHxOjHYqCVhI.jpg','1980-07-05',104,'Released','A story of natural love.','The Blue Lagoon',5689,12.7279,6.1,'DYhhph8uZyk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7905,_binary '\0','/bk2fTuIhQIvdAA3RbnrnvLvuaTc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080455',7.9,231819,'en','The Blues Brothers','Jake Blues, just released from prison, puts his old band back together to save the Catholic home where he and his brother Elwood were raised.','/b0hq1d2d7FIvRGNLewKLm79JNTK.jpg','1980-06-16',133,'Released','They\'ll never get caught. They\'re on a mission from God.','The Blues Brothers',525,10.8732,7.715,'asM2-YAMWxg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7906,_binary '\0','/cL7KkB2lVgFP5Fs8ISAxYYI65YF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080461',7.1,3907,'en','Bon Voyage, Charlie Brown (and Don\'t Come Back!)','Charlie Brown, Linus, Peppermint Patty and Marcie travel to France as foreign exchange students. Also along is Snoopy and Woodstock. While everyone is excited about the opportunity to travel to a foreign country, Charlie is disturbed by a letter he receives from a mysterious girl from France who invites him as a her guest only to find that he does not seem welcomed to her Chateau.','/eds4cxarUjHn7OdDd26SauphUnR.jpg','1980-05-30',76,'Released','Travel with the PEANUTS gang on their first overseas adventure','Bon Voyage, Charlie Brown (and Don\'t Come Back!)',31112,2.2884,6.4,'SgNh34IPrCI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7907,_binary '\0','/qDyIT21aMK843bPRsFya3IQUpoJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080464',4.7,5863,'en','The Boogey Man','A young girl witnesses the brutal murder of her stepfather at the hands of her brother, by mirror reflection. Years later, when the mirror is accidentally shattered, a dark and vengeful curse is unleashed on the family, and anyone unlucky enough to come into contact with its shards falls victim to heinous murder.','/bhEJ6lOAtdTGyupOSL0Snzv8qj7.jpg','1980-11-07',82,'Released','The most terrifying nightmare of childhood is about to return!','The Boogey Man',40220,2.0658,4.9,'ouwyN4NSGJI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7908,_binary '\0','/4zxILTp3C2umrzvru0J4ThUXl34.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080465',6,2761,'en','Borderline','Jeb Maynard is a patrolman guarding the U.S.-Mexican border, whose partner and buddy Scooter has just been murdered. Maynard knows that a smuggler of illegal aliens is responsible for Scooter\'s death, but the feds insist that drug dealers committed the crime.','/5WAdcyfJf5t8HVkp8zvcYllqErO.jpg','1980-12-19',104,'Released','Somewhere along a thousand miles of barbed wire border, the American dream has become a nightmare.','Borderline',8490,2.7179,6,'M1PA4IJHRWg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7909,_binary '\0','/dXn8zGN8mnt9mGihXKl6VtIEMiX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080468',6.5,1279,'en','Brave New World','A man who grew up in a primitive society educating himself by reading Shakespeare is allowed to join the futuristic society where his parents are from. However, he cannot adapt to their repressive ways.','/aBxmm8PeNmhiEaQry6P17XVtlgm.jpg','1980-03-07',180,'Released',NULL,'Brave New World',38699,2.062,6.1,'xfHtPUfwM34','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7910,_binary '\0','/diHub90cz2dNPWFVyQGRmQv09Hs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080469',6.8,1803,'en','Breaking Glass','Breaking Glass is the story of punk singer Kate and her meteoric rise to stardom. Starting out in the rock pubs of London, Kate, assisted by her manager Danny, becomes a huge star overnight. Once at the top the pressure is immense as Kate\'s band are squeezed out and she is left to cope alone in the spotlight.','/4RAp59Kp81uetLN3R7Sai1qcm8D.jpg','1980-10-01',104,'Released','The rock n\' roll dream that couldn\'t last.','Breaking Glass',26803,2.0639,6.9,'2lMfjwxmaPM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7911,_binary '\0','/p7UdytaRwrx5jd0Ccpz50Idnr9F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080472',6.2,13940,'en','Bronco Billy','An idealistic, modern-day cowboy struggles to keep his Wild West show afloat in the face of hard luck and waning interest.','/qiWVmWUq4M9Hc2Ui4jPkAnX6oAz.jpg','1980-06-11',116,'Released','The most outrageous of \'em all.','Bronco Billy',21866,4.4351,6.3,'oqyBr-07Eh0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7912,_binary '\0','/1mrub90uU3Q36Nvnwz2fzZdItwl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080474',7.2,21704,'en','Brubaker','The new warden of a small prison farm in Arkansas tries to clean it up of corruption after initially posing as an inmate.','/fjf3elnOC32m1BdNyxiL8CzNc6t.jpg','1980-06-20',131,'Released','One man against a cruel system.','Brubaker',1623,4.5099,7.095,'-eVzHtmJR7g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7913,_binary '\0','/rD4ktz5ycjXos7fCk6oMrUx6Lbj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080479',6.8,2256,'ja','新幹線大爆破','A Japanese bullet train is threatened with a bomb that will explode automatically if the train slows below 80 km/h, unless a ransom is paid. Police race to find the bombers so the train crew can learn how to defuse the bomb.','/eXaBBPqJRkW4SGqkbiLHNzDbzIf.jpg','1975-07-05',152,'Released','They said it couldn\'t happen... But for 1500 passengers Bullet Train 109 became a nightmare journey that just couldn\'t be stopped!','The Bullet Train',47634,2.8323,6.9,'KAwhEW1wvcY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7914,_binary '\0','/1LvhLEd6lHg7wQth03qIn731nE6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080482',7.4,2431,'pt','Bye Bye Brasil','The Caravana Rolidei rolls into town with the Gypsy Lord at the mike: he does magic tricks, the erotic Salomé dances, and the mute Swallow performs feats of strength. A young accordion player is completely enamored of Salomé, and he begs to come along. The Gypsy Lord shrugs, and the accordionist and his pregnant wife, Dasdô, join the troupe.','/sRzzduxIr4FKKZGTg3dtjwNi2YT.jpg','1980-02-08',110,'Released','Television is their enemy as they go from the coast deep into the Amazon','Bye Bye Brazil',42167,1.4458,6.8,'XuY-guU9NQw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7915,_binary '\0','/tuLs7l2j4WWEgyGHiKoNimt5nD6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080485',5.3,1556,'en','Caboblanco','Giff Hoyt, a cafe owner in Cabo Blanco, Peru after World War II is caught between refuge-seeking Nazis and their enemies. After the murder of a sea explorer is passed off as accidental death by the corrupt local police, Giff becomes suspicious. The police chief also intimidates a new arrival Marie, and Giff intervenes to help her. Giff suspects Beckdorff, a Nazi refugee living in the area. Beckdorff, it emerges, is seeking to uncover sunken treasure.','/e6YnBMCWCuFw0iCHetwOrDZ9ijb.jpg','1980-01-23',87,'Released','Caboblanco. Where legends are born.','Caboblanco',11767,1.9836,5.369,'MN2-IpDMnQw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7916,_binary '\0','/dvuCQ5Kpr5sQE7Hx9bJIHY7V5hw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080486',3.6,1797,'es','El caníbal','The lovely Laura, on a modelling job in South Africa, is kidnapped by a gang who carry her off into the jungle from where they demand a huge ransom. Two men set off in a helicopter to rescue her, little knowing what horrors Laura is enduring in the meantime in the savage clutches of a primitive and bloodthristy world. Laura\'s rescuers not only have to face the cruel violence of her captors - but also the horrifying lust for blood of a primitive and cruel god.','/2eccYH8f7WPqOyaIQ6vFHxRXNAz.jpg','1980-12-05',102,'Released','Hunted, raped, and tormented out of her mind...','Devil Hunter',84362,2.8772,4.436,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7917,_binary '\0','/3tqRm30c1Nbe82xvBOdRhYh0Uet.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080487',7.2,134448,'en','Caddyshack','At an exclusive country club, an ambitious young caddy, Danny Noonan, eagerly pursues a caddy scholarship in hopes of attending college and, in turn, avoiding a job at the lumber yard. In order to succeed, he must first win the favour of the elitist Judge Smails, and then the caddy golf tournament which Smails sponsors.','/lXnNz7zOXCsftMDVoU3VSo0Eioi.jpg','1980-07-25',98,'Released','Some people just don\'t belong.','Caddyshack',11977,6.1785,6.581,'vKlecXacidE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7918,_binary '\0','/uMBU0OtH9CAgem7sUPQRmGY2Lqx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080489',5.7,2490,'fr','La Cage aux folles II','In a move to make his partner, Renato, jealous, the flamboyant Albin waits in a local cafe - dressed as a woman - hoping to be picked up. But Albin gets more than he bargains for when the fly he catches in his web is actually a spy, who uses him as an unwitting courier of secret microfilm. Now on the run from ruthless agents, Albin and Renato flee to Italy where they attempt to hide out on a farm, with Albin posing as Renato\'s wife. Can Albin escape the deadly pursuit of these relentless spies or does he have to sustain this charade - as a woman - forever?','/larXxegvNf6DwwbUWZ94zYfreWP.jpg','1980-12-10',101,'Released',NULL,'La Cage aux Folles II',11684,2.7333,6.1,'rQakf8JGEZ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7919,_binary '\0','/cT6xO3YjzfZKYGhZ8S7plNlA27F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080491',5.4,42226,'it','Caligola','After the death of the paranoid emperor Tiberius, Caligula, his heir, seizes power and plunges the empire into a bloody spiral of madness and depravity.','/vNXAY6r9Pb6WkMCGmNeW2PlznLQ.jpg','1979-08-14',156,'Released','Absolute power corrupts','Caligula',9453,10.345,6,'Nn8cKrkQ9cs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7920,_binary '\0','/cGIKqJnM984ZKI8Xjej267wloa3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080492',4.3,4883,'en','Can\'t Stop the Music','A loose biography of seminal disco hit-makers The Village People and their composer Jacques Morali.','/j4Qu0WPS04bYOLwV3d9vSSsvYQb.jpg','1980-06-20',124,'Released','The movie musical event of the 80\'s!','Can\'t Stop the Music',40932,2.1514,4.9,'fU21LKlfrmA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7921,_binary '\0','/o4TjUgg7sdwWh8nYygWVNfPCEKr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080500',6.4,2754,'en','Carny','Tired of being a small-town waitress, Donna departs with the latest carnival show, living with entertainers Frankie and Patch in a tense, emotional triangle.','/jXiS5rTxZ9hNdXJbTTIQ1ICtGKP.jpg','1980-05-23',107,'Released','When you\'re young and going nowhere... the Carny looks like a good way out.','Carny',32027,1.9665,6.222,'3AZyNOcCoa0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7922,_binary '\0','/wJH14cztFkPsYmReNhvvaWr12On.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080503',5.7,6586,'it','La casa sperduta nel parco','A posh couple experience car trouble on their way to a villa party and stop into a local mechanic\'s shop for assistance, unaware of his shady background. After he and his mentally challenged assistant fix the car, the couple invite them to the party to return the favor, leading to an evening of mayhem.','/xrIT8dkdKdgHcEwXNsSRxzNn1fN.jpg','1980-11-06',92,'Released','Anything Could Happen… Everything Did!','House on the Edge of the Park',28679,2.392,5.9,'_dG7fixNK_I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7923,_binary '\0','/xRgeev3XrWgLVUgM5QkQQdjXkEi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080513',5.4,1475,'en','The Chain Reaction','Contaminated by a nuclear-plant spill, an Australian worker hides with a woman and tries to warn the public.','/sstLy91wB3nMqgXaPCAC3faad4m.jpg','1980-09-25',92,'Released','One terrifying mistake and there was no return!','The Chain Reaction',60591,2.0836,5.5,'mVNUArDx-YM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7924,_binary '\0','/7kANseofOHUGbZvNEJPdx6srn2f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080515',5.2,1252,'en','A Change of Seasons','Marriage takes a sour turn when a middle-aged husband falls for a young and sexy woman. Things get even more complicated when his wife starts a hot affair with a younger lover of her own.','/eFjpzGCbb02D7lvpre1hNOLJ0Wm.jpg','1980-12-01',102,'Released','\"She may be 20 and gorgeous, but I have not yet begun to fight.\"','A Change of Seasons',60816,1.9161,5.7,'2npFAxfms58','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7925,_binary '\0','/r4nx6BZY4PfLPrThytBtAuwN8uV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080516',7.1,45145,'en','The Changeling','After a tragic event happens, composer John Russell moves to Seattle to try to overcome it and build a new and peaceful life in a lonely big house that has been uninhabited for many years. But, soon after, the obscure history of such an old mansion and his own past begin to haunt him.','/z4nTYj3JZ5jWAhDgrmEhW2GRAzb.jpg','1980-03-28',107,'Released','Whatever you do… Don\'t go into the attic','The Changeling',13550,5.6357,7,'UwUI7d5TgGA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7926,_binary '\0','/77hMVxYiR5JTeMo0ppU6Kpfhuej.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080520',6,14708,'en','Cheech & Chong\'s Next Movie','Perennially stoned Cheech and Chong tear through the city of Los Angeles, causing trouble wherever they go. After Cheech loses his job, the two pot enthusiasts head to the welfare offices where Cheech\'s girlfriend, Donna, works. Instead of collecting unemployment, they find themselves thrown back on the streets, searching for a way to earn new income. But when Cheech\'s cousin, \"Red\" Mendoza, arrives, things get even crazier.','/hetHB9L84jOLxajKZLKgaNBRDJ9.jpg','1980-07-18',99,'Released','Just what we all need...a really good hit!','Cheech & Chong\'s Next Movie',13612,4.0918,5.9,'ICeeD9T9uyQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7927,_binary '\0','/a3s6X1KCM4mUWhv3rUWtASSW2iK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080527',5.4,3408,'en','The Children','A nuclear-plant leak turns a bus-load of children into murderous atomic zombies with black fingernails.','/9aJnz1MFL01xDududqIwuEJLhCb.jpg','1980-06-13',93,'Released','...thank God they\'re somebody else\'s!','The Children',84107,1.3257,5.1,'Hwn2fGZ3FtE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7928,_binary '\0','/GKk8QS6TtSUgEcWBy2HxZcSusP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080530',5.8,3405,'it','Chissà perché... capitano tutte a me','Following the events of The Sheriff and the Satellite Kid, Sheriff Hall and H-725 (using the official identity of Charlie Warren) still get no rest from the military - because the little alien has not yet grasped the meaning of keeping a low profile. They are constantly on the move, and H-725\'s father has had to pick them out of a tight spot too many times already.','/Ajt4KB0wXm74BJ6v8slHNEK8KbN.jpg','1980-12-11',99,'Released',NULL,'Why Did You Pick On Me?',11039,3.0076,6.2,'8Uz48rJvAAs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7929,_binary '\0','/v3OBPtCS4iHOGKNBwiO22QFfMQ1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080539',6.9,8932,'it','La città delle donne','The charismatic Snaporaz encounters an alluring woman on a train and pursues her through a forest. He ends up at a hotel populated by women gathered for a feminist conference, where he is an unwanted presence. Snaporaz soon discovers he’s entered a phantasmagoric world where women have taken power.','/hSX2YnpQebGlw5ljNlr1jnNSt5q.jpg','1980-03-28',140,'Released',NULL,'City of Women',11936,3.3286,6.965,'6UjQqbNXdDw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7930,_binary '\0','/s4IECqMbpnR9oTl1ZZMunxlUkqF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080546',6.9,1232,'en','The Club','The club buys a talented young player, Geoff, for a record sum of money. The team members do not like their new star and friction develops immediately. Game after game is lost until Geoff begins to realize that there is more at stake than just his own career.','/cg3WeX4Fq9Ide76xSd0NR7WODGI.jpg','1980-09-18',96,'Released','In this club nobody plays by the rules...','The Club',38920,1.1949,6,'MV1xIDOrFCo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7931,_binary '\0','/Aa4UDJWVckGXwPZxY5qpRifQFYp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080549',7.5,22506,'en','Coal Miner\'s Daughter','Biography of Loretta Lynn, a country and western singer that came from poverty to fame.','/bzHFDAdUad4QcHPi2UOqvaQKNWA.jpg','1980-03-07',125,'Released','She became a singer because it was the only thing she could do. She became a star because it was the only way she could do it.','Coal Miner\'s Daughter',16769,4.6772,7.2,'UFPqPSQoZFE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7932,_binary '\0','/1SEPQTtrH1ywdioeSVz8QYdCQwl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080556',6.6,3095,'en','The Competition','The movie centers on a piano competition whose winner is assured of success. It is Paul\'s last chance to compete, but newcomer Heidi may be a better pianist. Can romance be far away? Will she take a dive despite the pressure to win from her teacher, Greta, or will she condemn Paul to obscurity?','/14iMtdJY3HjwrmqPUZ55F4LzuCd.jpg','1980-12-03',123,'Released','If you\'re really in love... nothing\'s going to stand in your way','The Competition',42158,1.7415,6.1,'xRo17th3osE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7933,_binary '\0','/kWXU5pAISVlwh6cn0cbDq7n08l4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080561',7.1,1375,'pl','Constans','A young man is confronted with corrupt and vindictive colleagues at work and negligent officials at the hospital where his mother is dying. As he searches quixotically for a steadfast moral code by which to live, he suffers from the knowledge of human frailty and our darker inclinations to do harm.','/mXvxXOt7UgH9h4ptWysM0lS8zNO.jpg','1980-06-04',87,'Released',NULL,'The Constant Factor',198500,2.1259,7.2,'XMl4dWNLRAM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7934,_binary '\0','/5OYkNG4QOyZNCr1veyjwx5UVAU3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080565',6.6,3732,'fr','Le Coup du parapluie','Grégoire Lecomte, the unlucky actor anxious to find a \"real job\", goes to take a screen test for a role of a killer, but gets to mafiosi by mistake. He takes their don for a producer, and they mistake him for a hitman with whom they had an appointment. Deluded Lecomte signs contract with them. He is supposed to kill gun dealer Otto Krampe at his birthday party in Saint-Tropez by piercing him with a cap of the umbrella with a built-in syringe with potassium cyanide. Lecomte is not aware that it has to be a real murder.','/njGqjXVblNCQjA8Wg7QQbcOKKvE.jpg','1980-10-08',95,'Released',NULL,'Umbrella Coup',60194,2.3766,6.915,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7935,_binary '\0','/6Dm3hMRAFJqMS9wGkCY14XbZFrm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080569',6.5,31480,'en','Cruising','When New York is caught in the grip of a sadistic serial killer who preys on patrons of the city\'s underground bars, rookie cop Steve Burns infiltrates the S&M subculture to try and lure him out of the shadows.','/bb9CND0WyfwdHOZY5XmP4Qn8taz.jpg','1980-02-15',102,'Released','Al Pacino is Cruising for a killer.','Cruising',27958,5.4634,6.6,'IymZTPZ5Tng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7936,_binary '\0','/162ER50AVtr7Gn2HsIZktf4nAaw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080594',7.7,1356,'en','The Day After Trinity','Through interviews with Manhattan Project scientists and newly declassified archival footage, this documentary examines the life of physicist J. Robert Oppenheimer and his leadership of the Manhattan Project. The film traces the development and testing of the first atomic bomb and follows Oppenheimer’s later opposition to nuclear proliferation during the early years of the Cold War.','/yvNoCvCe4F52KumCuoUePsw7dsN.jpg','1980-11-14',89,'Released',NULL,'The Day After Trinity',59314,1.5941,7.6,'-0R7dDn9bbk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7937,_binary '\0','/c2iWVCKxu4gDzbPUmr5LKPOlS6e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080596',3.6,2520,'en','The Day Time Ended','Deep in the desert, a rural American family is forced to endure a night of inter-dimensional, extra terrestrial terror when a UFO appears over their home.','/4D5fgWAKmBLWllsdKEjF2y7NYeR.jpg','1980-11-01',80,'Released','Their Adventure Began...','The Day Time Ended',57949,2.3152,3.7,'EBavHsAHmeQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7938,_binary '\0','/tYCrbmnQlmrCnGMO78qVG5jOM79.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080603',4.8,6630,'en','Death Ship','Survivors of a tragic shipping collision are rescued by a mysterious black ship which appears out of the fog. Little do they realise that the ship is actually a Nazi torture ship which has sailed the seas for years, luring unsuspecting sailors aboard and killing them off one by one.','/w5FDs2a7MLuwDJPQWbVbYrL2NJy.jpg','1980-03-07',91,'Released','Those who survive the ghost ship are better off dead!','Death Ship',31703,3.1173,5.099,'sUwzFW290Oc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7939,_binary '\0','/bGaKmoXgSO0sDnudHEfmeqnKlsn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080605',6.1,1690,'en','Defiance','Tommy takes up temporary housing in a New York neighborhood plagued by a violent gang called the Souls. Tommy is waiting for his next assignment as a seaman and though he tries to avoid the gang and his neighbors, it does not work. Soon he is battling the Souls and not only changing their attitudes, but the attitudes of his previously intimidated neighbors as well.','/60tQXho1pIxH4tCfArJ80u6I82h.jpg','1980-03-14',103,'Released','There comes a time when we have to stand up and be counted. This is the story of one man who did.','Defiance',179798,1.5266,6.4,'ITwfbhtuTHA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7940,_binary '\0','/u97pGlftKRNbUn0jOoQgIobSBvb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080610',7.3,17047,'fr','Le Dernier Métro','In occupied Paris, an actress wed to a Jewish theater owner must keep him hidden from the Nazis while doing both of their jobs.','/t8KMFg9PiD9GSIHXlzast2WhZex.jpg','1980-09-17',131,'Released','A story of love and conflict.','The Last Metro',1716,5.0779,7.2,'0N2BfFD1QTo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7941,_binary '\0','/dW6zDhGReASLfLR4UesVbBVwAE7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080623',5.6,2422,'zh','招半式闖江湖','A young daydreamer assumes the identity of a dead martial arts hero and quickly finds himself caught up in a plot by several clans to steal famous martial arts artifacts being transported by an escort company.','/lH11m3LC8itFSTWzkS4xVYL6nB.jpg','1978-06-30',97,'Released',NULL,'Half a Loaf of Kung Fu',18867,2.8637,6.2,'vQgyu8JMsog','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7942,_binary '\0','/eqnUZhmCilXLNmDIxQJoN91pTtx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080641',6.3,11151,'en','The Dogs of War','Mercenary soldiers Jamie and Drew are hired by a large corporation to liberate Zangaro, a small African nation, from an despot. Havoc ensues.','/zAVFOLcjqYoEDYBF7UPNY4DIV2I.jpg','1980-12-17',118,'Released','Cry \'Havoc!\' and let slip...','The Dogs of War',20681,5.2374,5.8,'CuyxbyZU3Bg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7943,_binary '\0','/h3vVOBXhtg5JxVy7ewWM7eRW2Ud.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080645',4.8,2416,'en','Don\'t Answer the Phone!','A Vietnam veteran that spends his days photographing pretty girls, and his nights strangling them, sets sights on the patients of a radio psychiatrist.','/xKEeGK44NzyMzo6Ram5rgG893P.jpg','1980-02-29',95,'Released','...He\'ll Know You\'re Alone!','Don\'t Answer the Phone!',40102,1.6946,4.6,'hYP9hZBQ9OI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7944,_binary '\0','/d8aNzyXkXrvlSMrS2n6jL2CSoTi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080646',5.6,5992,'en','Don\'t Go in the House','As a child, Donald was tormented by his mother who used fire as a punishment. Now a deranged adult, Donald stalks women at clubs, then takes them home where he kills them with a flamethrower.','/fj7sn4eT4p7X30LNLFlWJkQUyhD.jpg','1979-11-01',82,'Released','In a steel room built for revenge they die burning... in chains.','Don\'t Go in the House',39867,2.1388,5.7,'26a-s3Kwyp0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7945,_binary '\0','/ntVqAeFfAIzgvecbJuSbrNjRFcn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080652',7.3,1673,'sh','Došlo doba da se ljubav proba','Though the problem of Marija\'s pregnancy may be solved, her relationship with Boba causes a rift between the Pavlović and Todorović families.','/cmJr4oknReZKTVk05YpEVW84EPX.jpg','1980-01-31',93,'Released',NULL,'The Time Has Come for Love to Try',55113,1.0062,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7946,_binary '\0','/mdyTdN6lrH8xkNQbT0HglaTcDCR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080653',6.4,1278,'hi','दोस्ताना','Two close friends decide to enter law enforcement – one a police officer, the other a lawyer – but their friendship begins to unravel when they both fall in love with the same woman.','/nYUgAxGTeZ3DvIKno5OpHJt0e4k.jpg','1980-10-17',153,'Released',NULL,'Dostana',143844,1.3375,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7947,_binary '\0','/8UZfEjAlFq1iUiAkHMkJViq4ZO0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080661',7,56361,'en','Dressed to Kill','After witnessing a mysterious woman brutally slay a homemaker, prostitute Liz Blake finds herself trapped in a dangerous situation. While the police thinks she is the murderer, the real killer is intent on silencing her only witness.','/oy1m5dd44foNrxV8U9l6Walx82V.jpg','1980-07-25',105,'Released','The latest fashion in murder.','Dressed to Kill',11033,7.6995,7,'aR8tpdj5WL8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7948,_binary '\0','/mvbejC3lQ0kZGJFCRw8VgnR6iBk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080662',7.1,4556,'da','Du er ikke alene','Young teenager Bo is too sensitive for the hothouse atmosphere of a boarding school run by a cold, unfeeling would-be man of the cloth. Lonely and scared, he finds a soulmate in the headmaster\'s son Kim with whom he forms a bond of friendship... that slowly grows into something more.','/23e1Pf86VtcnRhNcQFoqIFDHm0l.jpg','1978-02-23',93,'Released','Love thy neighbor as thyself.','You Are Not Alone',39555,2.7403,7.381,'5pMAMD_rKvo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7949,_binary '\0','/srBlUH3bQMdzz6F2wntjhTjZycC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080671',6.8,2024,'en','The Earthling','Recently diagnosed with a terminal illness, a man returns home to Australia to die in the wilderness. His plans become complicated when he comes across a young boy whose parents have been killed and decides to take him under his wing.','/zwWgJilOBk3NdFY5pCKdQXqYIXb.jpg','1980-07-24',97,'Released','Two alone in the wilderness. One learned to survive, the other to love.','The Earthling',69716,1.7989,6.371,'emo0uffHltk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7950,_binary '\0','/6huSptAsqYg3wbsi1jbMognSgmp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080678',8.2,284447,'en','The Elephant Man','A Victorian surgeon rescues a heavily disfigured man being mistreated by his \"owner\" as a side-show freak. Behind his monstrous façade, there is revealed a person of great intelligence and sensitivity.','/u0wpPYjuSt8DIe1Y3Vapnh8jcKE.jpg','1980-10-09',124,'Released','A true story of courage and human dignity.','The Elephant Man',1955,9.9103,8.052,'AF9gNKJi79g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7951,_binary '\0','/k9pshruhCpJAdH9RaGJO6jaWQ4X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080684',8.7,1523382,'en','The Empire Strikes Back','The epic saga continues as Luke Skywalker, in hopes of defeating the evil Galactic Empire, learns the ways of the Jedi from aging master Yoda. But Darth Vader is more determined than ever to capture Luke. Meanwhile, rebel leader Princess Leia, cocky Han Solo, Chewbacca, and droids C-3PO and R2-D2 are thrown into various stages of capture, betrayal and despair.','/nNAeTmF4CtdSgMDplXTDPOpYzsX.jpg','1980-05-20',124,'Released','The Star Wars saga continues.','The Empire Strikes Back',1891,18.2861,8.393,'4_46P3Dzvvw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7952,_binary '\0','/lmTbufMBEvi6ZNwvdbvz9wQkyXy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080707',5.7,7420,'en','The Exterminator','When a man\'s best friend is killed on the streets of New York, he transforms into a violent killer, turning New York into a war zone.','/8u49TsGXYYR3mkiuJ12GswGtkCA.jpg','1980-09-10',98,'Released','In war, you have to kill to stay alive... On the streets of New York, it\'s often the same.','The Exterminator',37835,3.1276,5.478,'92YNeYwYuQI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7953,_binary '\0','/jKc3u2HgON3Rx1wXRZ2T0K5PBXE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080711',6.1,6024,'en','Fade to Black','A lonely film buff embarks on a killing spree against those who browbeat and betray him, all the while stalking a Marilyn Monroe lookalike.','/wQA5HMwryIjOwnmN6uumCz6mjJs.jpg','1980-10-14',102,'Released','Eric Binford lives for the movies...Sometimes he kills for them, too!','Fade to Black',40034,2.3536,5.679,'i85KXkJTLtU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7954,_binary '\0','/stLzTxfpbQbzX5OYDY9F4u4gYuf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080715',7.1,1842,'en','The Falls','Told in the form of a mock documentary in 92 short parts, nineteen million people are left obsessed with birds and flight following a strange occurrence. A documentarian analyses the lives of all the survivors whose surnames begin with FALL to uncover the truth behind the event.','/ioEVXwJTUTwu9gtEUoGC1r8IZn9.jpg','1982-08-06',187,'Released',NULL,'The Falls',33356,1.0031,7.3,'dTKNMR9KDZg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7955,_binary '\0','/jekdv0OUnppLnpbPdBIkwCoeENo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080716',6.6,26703,'en','Fame','A chronicle of the lives of several teenagers who attend a New York high school for students gifted in the performing arts.','/ewuGn4kxsqbYfgSO8Y5kzYlBcKE.jpg','1980-05-16',134,'Released','If they\'ve really got what it takes, it\'s going to take everything they\'ve got.','Fame',3537,4.5164,6.4,'gUepLHaY760','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7956,_binary '\0','/xaP2Jw3T4kGe0HZSGOCNEW7XP8J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080719',7.1,3770,'it','Fantozzi contro tutti','The third film in the saga of the unlucky clerk Ugo Fantozzi, played by its creator, Paolo Villaggio.','/1cly7IQqU6ojjppynkSgbvlN7V8.jpg','1980-11-13',93,'Released',NULL,'Fantozzi Against the Wind',41663,1.687,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7957,_binary '\0','/ee7cEqy8KoqdhgWVOj0cNpZQCX9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080724',6.2,2578,'en','Fatso','Dominick DiNapoli is a man who loves food and is overweight as a result. After an obese cousin dies due to health problems, Dominick\'s sister Antoinette sets out to help him lose weight. Although he has a hard time trying to slim down, Dominick finds inspiration when he meets and falls for shop owner Lydia. Can he get up the courage to ask her out, or will he go back to the comfort of overeating?','/rYJLFdW1sucYRvqgfhC6MkX8Sme.jpg','1980-02-01',93,'Released','Starving for a great movie?','Fatso',38922,1.5278,5.8,'kMW3KkuVQ1k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7958,_binary '\0','/lkS9SAwibcNK3CUYmtVk1cuOsg0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080728',7.4,5911,'fr','La Femme de l\'aviateur','A student is devastated when he finds that his girlfriend is cheating on him. In order to find out why she did it, he decides to spy on her and her airline pilot lover. Then he sees the pilot with a blonde woman and he begins to follow them…','/xgXj1Fcgq1nHjhj9i7BiqvZarn5.jpg','1981-03-04',106,'Released','One can’t think of nothing.','The Aviator\'s Wife',27145,2.5386,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7959,_binary '\0','/bzDJ6dSojMJoCHXYIFycGxjWSYR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080731',4.9,2572,'en','The Fiendish Plot of Dr. Fu Manchu','Fu Manchu\'s 168th birthday celebration is dampened when a hapless flunky spills Fu\'s age-regressing elixir vitae. Fu sends his lackeys to round up ingredients for a new batch of elixir, starting with the Star of Leningrad diamond, nabbed from a Soviet exhibition in Washington. The FBI sends agents Capone and Williams to England to confer with Nayland Smith, an expert on Fu.','/cl1YGv5RQCWs8Tsc5SwBfPIfvMP.jpg','1980-08-08',108,'Released','BEWARE! See this movie - An hour later you\'ll want to see it again!','The Fiendish Plot of Dr. Fu Manchu',3486,2.1364,4.9,'dIy37fEVnwo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7960,_binary '\0','/5mO6N0SOlPQmoGYGjzOZfuX4Nmm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080736',6.7,30401,'en','The Final Countdown','During routine manoeuvres near Hawaii in 1980, the aircraft-carrier USS Nimitz is caught in a strange vortex-like storm, throwing the ship back in time to 1941—mere hours before the Japanese attack on Pearl Harbor.','/nJmWPdreWnbdjMpmXB5rnJMvsK1.jpg','1980-01-31',103,'Released','Trapped outside the boundaries of time and space... 102 aircraft... 6,000 men... all missing.','The Final Countdown',8738,6.4997,6.6,'YD-RVjtyuCA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7961,_binary '\0','/6MzGiJSXSrxggAE2qNoXnYVefJI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080738',5.9,2571,'en','The First Deadly Sin','A serial killer is stalking New York City. Inspector Edward Delaney is an NYPD detective, nearing retirement, who is trying to put together the pieces of the case. Are the victims somehow linked? What does the brutal method of death signify?','/cnsEK0xxGmR5s84b0gC4zPPnOFW.jpg','1980-10-03',112,'Released','He\'s searching for a killer. She\'s searching for a miracle .... And time is running out.','The First Deadly Sin',28614,2.6764,5.9,'35L9jo_dnro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7962,_binary '\0','/oeaLHGanPOKzKIyn6Elgd8Y5kGJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080741',2.4,1333,'en','Fist of Fear, Touch of Death','A television reporter interviews fighters and promoters about Bruce Lee in preparation for a tournament to claim the title of “Successor to the Bruce Lee legacy”. Footage from Bruce Lee\'s films and interviews is repurposed in pseudo-documentary style.','/4yQtzkPKD7z3ZqRraoGXhwMUKwU.jpg','1980-09-01',86,'Released','The 3 Greatest Masters!','Fist of Fear, Touch of Death',31249,1.5512,4.4,'fBkDDXDJHK8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7963,_binary '\0','/fU92iWyQbysjAQmkfkuFxNlWzz1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080745',6.5,67016,'en','Flash Gordon','A football player and his mates travel to the planet Mongo and find themselves fighting the tyranny of Ming the Merciless to save Earth.','/eTdEaRjtVnFbd5KVhxLRfbYW46e.jpg','1980-12-05',111,'Released','Pathetic earthlings...who can save you now?','Flash Gordon',3604,7.8911,6.3,'SG_3tABvcp4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7964,_binary '\0','/pAOLiapALC7Q5pcCPDTA6P9pRuv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080749',6.8,92850,'en','The Fog','Strange things begin to occur as a tiny California coastal town prepares to commemorate its centenary. Inanimate objects spring eerily to life; Rev. Malone stumbles upon a dark secret about the town\'s founding; radio announcer Stevie witnesses a mystical fire; and hitchhiker Elizabeth discovers the mutilated corpse of a fisherman. Then a mysterious iridescent fog descends upon the village, and more people start to die.','/12EeSboRofP3CI4SPmMFNNXCbtY.jpg','1980-02-01',90,'Released','What you can\'t see won\'t hurt you...it\'ll kill you!','The Fog',790,8.1123,6.741,'XU-47N87G9M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7965,_binary '\0','/2m7URnwkBzXMRHvzb8SicI0x4rt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080752',6.5,6016,'en','Forbidden Zone','A mysterious door in the basement of the Hercules house leads to the Sixth Dimension by way of a gigantic set of intestine. When lovely exchange student Frenchy slips through the door, the diminuitive King Fausto falls in love with her. The jealous Queen Doris takes Frenchy prisoner, and it is up to the Hercules family and friend Squeezit Henderson to rescue her.','/z4lrDkJVkW2kQZnNcHtUQ38DDAb.jpg','1982-03-21',74,'Released',NULL,'Forbidden Zone',16127,2.1118,6.235,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7966,_binary '\0','/xrloqzB22qCZILIfcvi6P2ACjJN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080754',5.6,3125,'en','The Formula','While investigating the death of a friend and fellow cop, Los Angeles police officer Barney Caine stumbles across evidence that Nazis created a synthetic alternative to gasoline during World War II. This revelation has the potential to end the established global oil industry, making the formula a very valuable and dangerous piece of information. Eventually, Caine must contend with oil tycoon Adam Steiffel, who clearly has his own agenda regarding the formula.','/VPqOGV7Cg6f3kYao6xUCFb5UFj.jpg','1980-12-19',117,'Released','Big Oil. Big Money. Big Mystery. Everyone’s out to make a killing.','The Formula',31603,2.1693,5.5,'exwlNfdBYbc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7967,_binary '\0','/tmw8jussxvWW3uv0KtUAaHa6ceo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080756',6.1,5485,'en','Foxes','A group of friends come of age in the asphalt desert of the San Fernando Valley, as set to a blazing soundtrack and endless drinking, drugs and sex.','/4BML3pbeopzTbwMNFhUWX0MerGE.jpg','1980-02-29',106,'Released','Daring to do it!','Foxes',32020,2.0127,5.965,'7J2G8OMZrrA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7968,_binary '\0','/16zzKM5vDxnYiqG6Tg6wOkOLSmj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080761',6.4,177124,'en','Friday the 13th','Camp counselors are stalked and murdered by an unknown assailant while trying to reopen a summer camp that was the site of a child\'s drowning.','/uGGpnWHOmWTARVN9wbC1nPxNgps.jpg','1980-05-09',95,'Released','They were warned...They are doomed...And on Friday the 13th, nothing will save them.','Friday the 13th',4488,12.1157,6.4,'8nYuu5jpWVs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7969,_binary '\0','/IQd6lZThafAnZQ7FJB7HPh0Fyq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080764',5.8,3557,'it','Macabro','A middle-aged woman, traumatized from the death of her adulterous lover, moves into a room at a New Orleans boarding house where the blind landlord becomes suspicious to her activities of continuing her affair with her dead lover.','/yI3zSIWZaxcZNvJ8yAdYlTD6ujH.jpg','1980-04-17',91,'Released','Prepare yourself for the Shock of a Lifetime! Once she kept a lover on the side. But that\'s nothing compared to what she\'s keeping in the freezer.','Macabre',67737,1.5503,5.7,'BKQZSR7UhAA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7970,_binary '\0','/zxUm7SBcU7ewjYVDceW8ihWAoRi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080768',6.2,3577,'ja','復活の日','Scientists in Antarctica desperately try to find a cure to a military virus that was released in a plane crash and has wiped out the rest of the world.','/hUkLBDDUISSEv19xXRj2tFWNzMj.jpg','1980-06-26',156,'Released','Autumn 1982: Mankind has been wiped out except 863 persons on Antarctica. Who will inherit the earth?','Virus',41972,4.811,6.3,'XI-iiLpS8i8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7971,_binary '\0','/33uKXAkqrBTO2qsvq2cqMst5AS2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080771',3.7,3758,'en','Galaxina','Galaxina is a lifelike, voluptuous android who is assigned to oversee the operations of an intergalactic Space Police cruiser captained by incompetent Cornelius Butt. When a mission requires the ship\'s crew to be placed in suspended animation for decades, Galaxina finds herself alone for many years, developing emotions and falling in love with the ship\'s pilot, Thor.','/A66Uw4QFyESPwnDnlvudKKR2Qsv.jpg','1980-06-06',95,'Released','She\'s too good to be true...and too real to be otherwise.','Galaxina',33155,2.3293,3.9,'j9yt40bIAe8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7972,_binary '\0','/nWl3zdwN2G1l6oEv7tJo1y3Tszn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080772',7.4,2685,'ja','銀河鉄道999','In the future, one can achieve immortality by obtaining a mechanized body. Orphaned, young Tetsuro hitches a ride on the space train Galaxy Express 999 in the hope of obtaining a cyborg body to avenge his mother\'s death. Along the way, he meets Maetel, who is the spitting image of his dead mother.','/yBNzT42ErObWemedi5ZalZnRTwn.jpg','1979-08-04',128,'Released','Your imagination is the final destination','Galaxy Express 999: The Movie',15227,2.6392,6.9,'IUDif3IDmNE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7973,_binary '\0','/fQDUMVXqPnzv2ZTD8Nbq41Hepay.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080789',7.1,1340,'en','Gideon\'s Trumpet','True story of Clarence Gideon\'s fight to be appointed counsel at the expense of the state. This landmark case led to the Supreme Court\'s decision which extended this right to all criminal defendants.','/eaquX0IKVaeRujPBQFlaspE0fDg.jpg','1980-04-30',104,'Released',NULL,'Gideon\'s Trumpet',63505,2.0446,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7974,_binary '\0','/393vpNuxZfveyfz219qV8wZJDhH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080798',7.1,13374,'en','Gloria','When a young boy\'s family is killed by the mob, their tough neighbor Gloria becomes his reluctant guardian. In possession of a book that the gangsters want, the pair go on the run in New York.','/mrYZInXp0JEoZYXs0Z108l2jN0C.jpg','1980-10-01',122,'Released','She\'s tough… but she sides with the little guy. And she\'s out to beat the mob at their own game.','Gloria',10889,2.8517,6.9,'12ql7orFSgQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7975,_binary '\0','/3gzI0UrLqIR9D40qshwduhGZCp3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080801',7.3,63656,'en','The Gods Must Be Crazy','A Coca-Cola bottle dropped from an airplane raises havoc among a normally peaceful tribe of African bushmen who believe it to be a utensil of the gods.','/IgBfj5LfT7nwpodCZ34QCHp17x.jpg','1980-09-10',109,'Released','The critics are raving... the natives are restless... and the laughter is non-stop!','The Gods Must Be Crazy',8393,8.7846,7.3,'Ah7qQ_K-OnU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7976,_binary '\0','/mLdkXarWPOV1wVbea2n4294rfve.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080802',5.3,1583,'en','The Godsend','An English family of six takes in a pregnant woman who disappears shortly after giving birth. They raise the baby girl as their own, but over the years the strange deaths of their children make them consider whether the little girl is more than she appears.','/2kXPEcqpWue0TZfztnvmpC2w1lp.jpg','1980-01-25',90,'Released','If Bonnie is a gift from Heaven...for God\'s sake take her back..!','The Godsend',80624,2.4051,5.4,'RYsRTgBJYzM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7977,_binary '\0','/mUShQuVUrLUtdGylu1IAkNOUW51.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080806',6.6,1518,'pl','Golem','Pernat finds himself in a police interrogation, accused of a murder, and unable to recall any details of the crime, or even his own life. He\'s released back into a world of raving lunatics and deranged dentists, murderous doctors and scientists who believe the secret of human creation is inside the walls of a cast-iron oven.','/vvae3Jqex1PTGEq3s3PLvU9dPcF.jpg','1980-03-18',93,'Released',NULL,'Golem',107983,1.198,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7978,_binary '\0','/9Z3Pa8VsOz2E9wBJD7bz4pWt9se.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080813',6.4,2582,'en','The Great Rock \'n\' Roll Swindle','A rather incoherent post-breakup Sex Pistols \"documentary\", told from the point of view of Pistols manager Malcolm McLaren, whose (arguable) position is that the Sex Pistols in particular and punk rock in general were an elaborate scam perpetrated by him in order to make \"a million pounds.\"','/A8Q8rhuv8YszuFuYrsCAo9281mt.jpg','1980-09-11',103,'Released',NULL,'The Great Rock \'n\' Roll Swindle',16149,2.1619,6.4,'eizQ9l9Qu0A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7979,_binary '\0','/9yIgoqsnbGmXu8o9myKD5cSQBrx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080827',7,3297,'cn','鬼打鬼','\"Big Guts\" Cheung, a man well known in his local village for his lack of fear, is put to the test after being tricked into spending the night in a temple full of spirits, zombies, and vampires.','/pca4RsHaV1dzSR0Ex9zeE0ONrj4.jpg','1980-12-24',104,'Released','You\'ve heard of Voodoo! You\'ve heard of Ninja! NOW HERE\'S BLACK MAGIC IN KUNG FU!!!','Encounters of the Spooky Kind',15724,3.753,6.8,'_flyhBBR9sE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7980,_binary '\0','/wZogPx6SgmISFOaabGlIN7SfWsf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080836',5.4,3581,'en','Hangar 18','During a Space Shuttle mission a satellite rams a unidentified flying object. The UFO afterwards performs an emergency landing in the deserts of Arizona. However the White House denies its existence because of the near presidential elections. The UFO is brought to the secret Hangar 18 and the accident is blamed on the incompetence of the astronauts Bancroff and Price. But the two fight against this and try to hunt down the UFO.','/kORjGwOggAmJb0r5l8xoapXiBTW.jpg','1980-07-01',97,'Released','It started with an accident in space . . . and led to the terrifying secret in . . . HANGAR 18','Hangar 18',54287,1.916,5.2,'FZcKECFYAw4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7981,_binary '\0','/a39bpc7OlIldrbyGYNA1ZxfRcwH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080842',6.1,2082,'en','Harlequin','Up-and-coming senator Nick Rast\'s young son is terminally ill with leukemia. A mysterious faith healer, Gregory Wolfe, appears and seems to cure the boy. Rast\'s wife Sandy falls in love with Wolfe, but the powerful interests behind Rast\'s career, represented by geriatric monster Doc Wheelan are less happy with events.','/cpKPjzuACboHbH0BEJgPz4EaH6A.jpg','1980-03-28',95,'Released','Are His Powers More Than Magic?','Harlequin',79785,1.2595,6.4,'sSiXKAeLr8s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7982,_binary '\0','/AjH5DOvTgwFp55qmg4Sa7tvGOE8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080846',5.3,4716,'en','Hawk the Slayer','Hawk the Slayer, after seeing both his father and bride die at the hands of his malevolent brother, Voltan, sets out for revenge and the chance to live up to his title. Tooling himself up with the \"mind-sword\" and recruiting a motley band of warriors — a giant, a dwarf, a one-armed man with a machine-crossbow, and an elf with the fastest bow in the land — Hawk leads the battle against Voltan to free the land from the forces of evil and avenge his loved ones.','/rOuvXCzJoyR8eJnmArF5CtbLkN5.jpg','1980-08-27',93,'Released','Beyond the edge of darkness there is a world of sword and sorcery.','Hawk the Slayer',25628,2.3997,4.8,'kK1v2cyM9_U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7983,_binary '\0','/sUpuvr9nQbbkq8SuyVApEUFfegp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080850',5.1,4672,'en','He Knows You\'re Alone','A reluctant bride-to-be is stalked by a serial killer who only kills brides and the people around them. While her friends get whacked one by one, a hard-boiled renegade cop whose bride had been killed years before tries to hunt the killer down before it is too late.','/90rdztFCRAxQsEfy35cxH9qt3N1.jpg','1980-08-29',94,'Released','Every girl is frightened the night before her wedding. But this time...there\'s good reason!','He Knows You\'re Alone',65262,2.5403,5.2,'zx44_gnvasI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7984,_binary '\0','/ipH7gjYiRmjD73VS98h6hhTkWI8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080853',4.9,2832,'en','The Hearse','A schoolteacher moves into her deceased aunt’s house in a small Californian town, and is harassed by unfriendly locals and a mysterious hearse.','/uhRNtXZqXYkbykIZrZ17cRAulo7.jpg','1980-06-01',99,'Released','The Barrier Between Life and Death is no Greater than the Thickness of a Door...and now that Door is Open!','The Hearse',53950,2.103,5.3,'HSp7kn0AUY4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7985,_binary '\0','/v0DsJiF7LAeJtqFObQfq3eU6rag.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080855',6.7,19369,'en','Heaven\'s Gate','Harvard graduate James Averill serves as the sheriff of prosperous Jackson County, Wyoming, standing at the center of a conflict between impoverished immigrants and affluent cattle farmers. Politically connected ranchers enlist mercenary Nathan Champion—who is also vying for the affections of local madam Ella Watson—to combat the immigrant uprising. As tensions escalate, both Averill and Champion start to question their decisions.','/kW4Vk31nhtKPKGuYMaVATq3wcHC.jpg','1980-11-19',217,'Released','What one loves about life are the things that fade.','Heaven\'s Gate',10935,5.8267,6.7,'3Q3dHN9uWTY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7986,_binary '\0','/943ZTnFp42woYnfyV8ggcAP20hi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080856',8.8,3467,'bn','হীরক রাজার দেশে','When Goopy and Bagha learn about Hirak Raja\'s tyranny, they try to set him right with the help of Udayan, a school teacher, and their magical powers.','/mlAftRRDUvN7BP8UVdhYiWFJ1Md.jpg','1980-12-18',118,'Released',NULL,'The Kingdom of Diamonds',206789,1.2043,8.032,'X60UQfape8c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7987,_binary '\0','/ljSJWMuIzN3NWnJRfj2IzlsN3Gw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080861',4.9,6912,'en','Herbie Goes Bananas','The adorable little VW helps its owners break up a counterfeiting ring in Mexico.','/7cBOYLDhHMA351ndLthSxBCwO5N.jpg','1980-06-25',93,'Released','Yes, We Have A Bananza!','Herbie Goes Bananas',12129,4.1858,5.4,'NsKl0dpczJw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7988,_binary '\0','/qqq7QuLJXdLC3L45pwr1uZBLeRW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080863',5.9,2185,'en','Hero at Large','An idealistic but struggling actor finds his life unexpectedly complicated when he stops a robbery while wearing the costume of Captain Avenger, a superhero character of a film he is hired to promote. He decides to dabble at being a superhero only to find that it is more difficult and dangerous than he ever imagined.','/s5y93WClZAZfYXNRB9uuw4VWIzY.jpg','1980-02-08',98,'Released','Help is on the way!','Hero at Large',44004,1.9151,5.87,'9YLv4fq4xBw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7989,_binary '\0','/y0evpko41DD8VObgDD7lENJgNgr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080881',6.2,5743,'en','The Hollywood Knights','Led by their comedic and pranking leader, Newbomb Turk, the Hollywood Knights car gang raise hell throughout Beverly Hills on Halloween Night, 1965. Everything from drag racing to Vietnam to high school love.','/nKTXjzFW52n61rlXT80MGIcnEG4.jpg','1980-05-18',91,'Released','Beverly Hills and the civilized world will never forget them.','The Hollywood Knights',21879,2.1768,5.8,'S7sh4j0GXJI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7990,_binary '\0','/u2IdqAZziVoLCyzDZbJ7WFVpA7T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080888',6.3,2106,'en','Honeysuckle Rose','Buck Bonham is a country singer on the road caught in a romantic triangle with Dyan Cannon and Amy Irving, the daughter of one of his longtime musical sidekick.','/k1SODZtlyJ66YyLL9gaqfFxQPnv.jpg','1980-07-18',119,'Released','For 20 years he\'s been singing to the country. But he never figured he\'d be living his own love songs.','Honeysuckle Rose',22288,1.5445,5.4,'kBigymwSW7o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7991,_binary '\0','/8Wg4Mdv8nOpPVxT3AP5daVUKeON.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080889',7.1,10188,'en','Hopscotch','When CIA operative Miles Kendig deliberately lets KGB agent Yaskov get away, his boss threatens to retire him. Kendig beats him to it, however, destroying his own records and traveling to Austria where he begins work on a memoir that will expose all his former agency\'s covert practices. The CIA catches wind of the book and sends other agents after him, initiating a frenetic game of cat and mouse that spans the globe.','/7ZTasNoTehrypra0X97zh8Amk3.jpg','1980-09-26',104,'Released','The most dangerous man in the world. He\'s about to expose the CIA, the FBI, the KGB ... and himself.','Hopscotch',32030,2.7039,7.008,'NX-TqWefqRQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7992,_binary '\0','/uTOLx6jKiKeUEElhkkWmFb01j9K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080895',6,2292,'en','How to Beat the High Cost of Living','In order to beat inflation and subsidize their alimony checks, three suburban housewives plot to steal $1 million from a large plastic ball which is displayed in a local shopping center.','/rLsM8mUxPfuEl5M86VL82YiVTK7.jpg','1980-07-11',105,'Released','A hilarious new comedy for everyone who ever wanted to give the oil companies gas pains, turn off the power companies lights and make the banks stand in line for a change.','How to Beat the High Cost of Living',119617,2.4554,5.382,'9-77VpXSygs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7993,_binary '\0','/jX1lMK3YIJZyNTV7mK6f2LRaQk6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080903',6.1,1813,'en','The Human Factor','When a leak of information in the African section of British Intelligence is discovered, a security man is brought in to investigate.','/9u3aUUbjPGFKgdtkR0wlHGPddMh.jpg','1979-12-18',115,'Released','Every man in love is a potential traitor.','The Human Factor',39293,2.8981,5.8,'wShScvZOZiw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7994,_binary '\0','/r8yPArXK4Wbn0MTmSn4E4ibI7a2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080904',5.7,12733,'en','Humanoids from the Deep','After a new cannery introduces scientifically augmented salmon to a seaside town in the Pacific Northwest, a species of mysterious, mutated sea creatures begin killing the men and raping the women.','/jVqNWDvTIwjcHsMyNSUT0sfGrq9.jpg','1980-05-01',80,'Released','From the Ocean Depths They Strike...To Terrorize...To Mate...And To Kill!','Humanoids from the Deep',29343,3.8703,5.7,'mwA-URWvaVY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7995,_binary '\0','/u85pNHeAmas7UDfYGzl7j3mH8OO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080905',7.1,2637,'zh','洪文定三破白蓮教','The Qing emperor releases all detained Shaolin disciples, but the vindictive White Lotus clan decides to exterminate all the disciples. One martial artist survives the onslaught, and constantly trains while in hiding for revenge.','/pEzzzy3vzge65hdbKsTNFYcDdyO.jpg','1980-01-01',95,'Released','Deadly Needle Kung Fu Against The Invincible Armor of White Lotus!','Clan of the White Lotus',41377,2.2511,6.6,'lKDg3uHUzYY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7996,_binary '\0','/uJThm2CPZZbnoH3HG9rDRXkZuj6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080907',6.2,7851,'en','The Hunter','During his long career, bounty hunter Ralph \"Papa\" Thorson has caught over 5,000 criminals. Now, while he is working on apprehending fugitives in Illinois, Texas and Nebraska, he himself is being hunted by a psychotic killer.','/k3bTmSw62c0yP3oxbVICeho4PCB.jpg','1980-08-01',93,'Released','He\'s not as fast as he used to be... That\'s what makes him human. He\'s a bounty hunter... And that\'s what makes him dangerous.','The Hunter',5922,3.1822,5.9,'XffbneC-h-U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7997,_binary '\0','/awYcdQIdFs6kt9WpoYIrxZ5slTq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080913',6.9,1689,'en','The Idolmaker','Based on the life of rock promoter/producer Bob Marucci, who discovered, among others, Frankie Avalon and Fabian.','/sQoGkwIMsfIhfC0ukouBvWOTIpK.jpg','1980-11-14',117,'Released','He\'s got the look... He\'s got the talent... He\'s got the Idolmaker... He\'s got it all!','The Idolmaker',42159,2.0307,5.6,'3x4D5-xM7hA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7998,_binary '\0','/lb7NPBlatM4S6r0waTE3TvWRUPs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080917',5.5,1351,'en','In God We Tru$t','A naive monk, named Brother Ambrose, is sent by the abbot on a mission to raise $5,000 in order to save their monastery from closing. He goes to Hollywood where he encounters a number of eccentric characters.','/cG43nFNfy5OWt5tSqW8M9WCHTHk.jpg','1980-09-26',97,'Released','This is Brother Ambrose. Lead him not into temptation. For he\'s sure to follow.','In God We Tru$t',112739,2.2896,6.079,'tGxMWbHcDeM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(7999,_binary '\0','/eJGbf7RB8YNE9s3YLCt6lgqAOB9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080923',6.5,26629,'it','Inferno','A young man returns from Rome to his sister\'s satanic New York apartment house.','/A92SmwJ4w2GSF6Mp2m8xE9GbG39.jpg','1980-02-07',107,'Released','Come face to face with Hell.','Inferno',16395,3.4658,6.6,'wg75f-38L3E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8000,_binary '\0','/7zngvXZjuhsTB2LxZASgZ5ftvsR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080928',7,2706,'en','Inside Moves','After a failed suicide attempt leaves him partially crippled, Rory begins spending a lot of time at a neighborhood bar full of interesting misfits. When Jerry the bartender suddenly finds himself playing basketball for the Golden State Warriors, Rory and the rest of the bar regulars hope his success will provide a lift to their sagging spirits. Will Jerry forget his friends? What about his junkie hooker girlfriend and her pimp?','/A65YXgdnVgRjkaeA0hSMzfoAlZz.jpg','1980-12-19',113,'Released','It\'ll make you feel good again, and that ain\'t bad.','Inside Moves',39503,2.2743,6.3,'mLtWKGqQxUA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8001,_binary '\0','/smjDot1kB0dm067iZ1ZuoiI8FNB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080929',6.2,2419,'fr','Inspecteur La Bavure','A detective, fresh out of the academy (lowest mark in class), gets the assignment to bodyguard a spoiled rich girl reporter. She\'s been interviewed on TV and has questioned the virility of a mobster who kidnaps her later.','/bASEmSrZXQ9y9rMIDmMKgMC27LP.jpg','1980-12-03',100,'Released',NULL,'Inspector Blunder',24260,2.1853,6.293,'9uEBDPn_idM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8002,_binary '\0','/zo3crcyMrDvOfehezcJcwfBRE7U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080931',5.6,7437,'it','Incubo sulla città contaminata','A reporter and his doctor wife try to escape from the hordes of bloodthirsty, undead people exposed to nuclear radioactivity as military leaders fight a losing war of attrition against the relentless attacks.','/jbOkO2kxxfISyBWPCSKsVJS0MFc.jpg','1980-12-11',91,'Released','Now They Are Everywhere! There Is No Escape!','Nightmare City',28319,2.5125,5.7,'MvyaGSFnD50','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8003,_binary '\0','/9MVGH5OR9DzWu7foCSHQBWcGztv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080934',5.3,5226,'en','The Island','David Nau leads a band of modern day pirates who raid yachts and sail boats of people on vacation in the Caribbean. When reporter Blair Maynard and his son arrive to investigate the mystery of the disappearing boats, Nau and his band of raiders decide to induct them into their tribe.','/8jU7tYTUM0cNH9f145uqIDOgHSA.jpg','1980-06-13',114,'Released','For three hundred years a terrifying secret has been kept from the outside world.','The Island',7988,2.7625,5.2,'1SB0kHvB7wI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8004,_binary '\0','/socX3pheSHvBYEOLLplGQwxRxdd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080936',5.5,1322,'en','It\'s My Turn','A successful but stressed mathematics professor goes to her father\'s wedding and falls in love with her father\'s bride\'s son, a prematurely retired pro baseball player. She must choose between him and her current boyfriend, between Chicago and New York, and between research and administration.','/zbjXgNDEXtCzetTtiUC3Eax7Lw4.jpg','1980-10-24',91,'Released','Just when she thought she had everything right... in stepped Mr. Wrong.','It\'s My Turn',214181,1.9571,5.8,'xsKDh4KxFL0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8005,_binary '\0','/mpfeUI1AZaS3BU67S0wG8V2RheK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080948',6,5803,'en','The Jazz Singer','A young Jewish man is torn between tradition and individuality when his old-fashioned family objects to his career as a jazz singer.','/mljSKNWC5yYoIsERfDHDiJcEZYW.jpg','1980-12-17',115,'Released','His story will make you cry. His music will make you sing. His triumph will make you cheer.','The Jazz Singer',15310,2.829,5.9,'hj6DH69r1zg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8006,_binary '\0','/7qsKE8GsgjreeQ2mTLd5oKZ7Tbf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080979',7.9,41367,'ja','影武者','Akira Kurosawa\'s lauded feudal epic presents the tale of a petty thief who is recruited to impersonate Shingen, an aging warlord, in order to avoid attacks by competing clans. When Shingen dies, his generals reluctantly agree to have the impostor take over as the powerful ruler. He soon begins to appreciate life as Shingen, but his commitment to the role is tested when he must lead his troops into battle against the forces of a rival warlord.','/fJgqj9s8HNZz9zwX6femVJn8HEB.jpg','1980-04-26',180,'Released','The Shadow of a man can never stand up and walk on its own.','Kagemusha',11953,5.4808,7.8,'w6jYtVvor6s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8007,_binary '\0','/jZg9HtD8NJDeAXziVcpCbujNz6d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0080993',6.3,1620,'en','The Gambler','This Western adventure, inspired by Kenny Rogers\' hit song, tells how fictional gambler Brady Hawkes, going in search of a young son he never knew he had, teams up with an impetuous young admirer and a shady lady on his journey, which also involves him with an arrogant railroad owner and a gang of villains.','/16qBOtkbv9z8PE6pym3M4rgQ3yu.jpg','1980-04-08',94,'Released','You Got To Know When To Hold \'Em, Know When To Fold Em...','The Gambler',44789,2.0277,5.9,'n8_YGWwD62s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8008,_binary '\0','/mlvN6Le0T2U1j0XyHGlaOKdU7kC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081027',3.2,3815,'fr','Le Lac des morts vivants','In a small village, somewhere in France, German soldiers, killed and thrown into the lake by the Resistance during WWII, come back.','/ui0yDzDLKVB3dQnZoy59RXCgsTc.jpg','1981-05-13',87,'Released','God help us if they rise again!','Zombie Lake',22130,2.4654,3.2,'rPoRkUkWoNk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8009,_binary '\0','/q9AjUl2DRCyC7TOxheLElRTCtuH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081031',5.7,1672,'en','The Last Flight of Noah\'s Ark','The only chance to escape a desert island is to convert the plane carrying many different animals into a boat.','/1mXYd5YrlCN40V55NRzmSv9ekTw.jpg','1980-06-24',97,'Released','Lost. 2,000 miles at sea in a 40 year old bomber.','The Last Flight of Noah\'s Ark',35101,2.5046,5.6,'GhojNP79Ags','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8010,_binary '\0','/lTKWc4HWs0aKLzEOIfXq1GLB7Uz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081036',7.1,3030,'en','The Lathe of Heaven','George Orr, a man whose dreams can change waking reality, tries to suppress this unpredictable gift with drugs. Dr. Haber, an assigned psychiatrist, discovers the gift to be real and hypnotically induces Mr. Orr to change reality for the benefit of mankind --- with bizarre and frightening results.','/xQwNDyCXROg7LalX9f7mqTrCFfg.jpg','1980-01-09',104,'Released','Ursula K. Le Guin\'s Science Fiction Masterpiece','The Lathe of Heaven',27864,1.9792,6.598,'sbs3Y2HSoiw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8011,_binary '\0','/utB1Qx30hoJv2d5Bpuu6hDelldW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081055',6.6,1748,'en','Lightning Over Water','Director \'Nicholas Ray\' is eager to complete a final film before his imminent death from cancer. Wim Wenders is working on his own film Hammett (1983) in Hollywood, but flies to New York to help Ray realize his final wish. Ray\'s original intent is to make a fiction film about a dying painter who sails to China to find a cure for his disease. He and Wenders discuss this idea, but it is obviously unrealistic given Ray\'s state of health.','/dFIaPUhcHCx51kEHfwWoBBgtLg0.jpg','1980-10-01',91,'Released',NULL,'Lightning Over Water',42156,1.56,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8012,_binary '\0','/6hCRE8o7yy0UQkt46NYaB6p9aNY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081059',8.2,19074,'en','Lion of the Desert','Resistance leader Omar Mukhtar opposes Italian colonization before World War II. The brutal guerrilla war against Italian General Rodolfo Graziani and the Fascist forces of Benito Mussolini highlights the struggle for Libyan independence and the harsh tactics utilised by the colonisers.','/xm7CKN5mo09RNAcL1IP1xmJ5avT.jpg','1981-04-17',173,'Released','He was a man of honor in a war without any.','Lion of the Desert',26843,5.2957,7.3,'s_lpj5k0TnU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8013,_binary '\0','/kfil9bBRtRkQEZZaSVMu8UpDVUC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081060',6.5,7451,'en','Little Darlings','Two 15-year-old girls from different sides of the tracks compete to see who will be first to lose their virginity while at camp.','/mMRPB4IvMw7c3zIHIEfaOGv0V5h.jpg','1980-03-21',94,'Released','Don\'t let the title fool you.','Little Darlings',27458,3.5487,6.5,'CZgwXFJSQ90','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8014,_binary '\0','/8CdC61bvZTEwDlgFrXyYubjyMWc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081062',7.5,6215,'en','Little Lord Fauntleroy','Young Cedric Errol and his widowed mother live in genteel poverty in 1880s Brooklyn after the death of his father. Cedric\'s grandfather, the Earl of Dorincourt, has long ago disowned his son for marrying an American. But after the death of the Earl\'s remaining son, he decides to accept Cedric as his heir.','/7rLhBRseh1ZVNMQIFUxhy9IcWvi.jpg','1980-12-01',103,'Released','The enchanting story of a small boy who inherits an earldom','Little Lord Fauntleroy',38602,2.9179,7.319,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8015,_binary '\0','/tzveFqGwgjytM2TVbHNaNiM9Un.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081063',6.4,1999,'en','Little Miss Marker','Sorrowful Jones is a cheap bookie in the 1930s. When a gambler leaves his daughter as a marker for a bet, he gets stuck with her. His life changes a great deal with her arrival and he finds sudden love for a woman also involved in gambling operations.','/clqmOwegCW2YeIxxl6Aoo1omQMq.jpg','1980-03-21',103,'Released','A wildly romantic comedy about a cookie, a bookie, and the kid they bet their hearts on.','Little Miss Marker',47876,1.9794,6.6,'mrJn4MAfN_E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8016,_binary '\0','/vXjf4iCdZB1OvNQuJZyKeSkVWlH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081070',7.5,30234,'en','The Long Good Friday','In the late 1970s, Cockney crime boss Harold Shand, a gangster trying to become a legitimate property mogul, has big plans to get the American Mafia to bankroll his transformation of a derelict area of London into the possible venue for a future Olympic Games. However, a series of bombings targets his empire on the very weekend the Americans are in town. Shand is convinced there is a traitor in his organization, and sets out to eliminate the rat in typically ruthless fashion.','/pXS667me5Jfoj1b0xuxgjEMKunF.jpg','1980-11-01',114,'Released','Who lit the fuse that tore Harold\'s world apart?','The Long Good Friday',14807,6.0579,7.2,'aCp2dY6X_Qg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8017,_binary '\0','/hFidONuvMRoWdpgsysBRknXU74J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081071',6.9,14915,'en','The Long Riders','The origins, exploits and the ultimate fate of the James gang is told in a sympathetic portrayal of the bank robbers made up of brothers who begin their legendary bank raids because of revenge.','/1Dk9dieSkZeiEVarZFsPJdF9Qel.jpg','1980-05-16',100,'Released','\"All the world likes an outlaw. For some damn reason they remember \'em.\" - Jesse James','The Long Riders',14729,6.0093,6.7,'x-iV2P0eP-M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8018,_binary '\0','/am9UgBlF0LkNUsPXj0D1Y1hQ1j9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081073',6.1,1266,'en','Loophole','When architect Stephen Booker loses his partnership, he finds jobs hard to come by, and with money in short supply, he unwittingly becomes involved in a daring scheme to rob one of London\'s biggest bank vaults.','/pqOPDPz0WfvvUDsocHEGSdg8NWh.jpg','1981-06-25',105,'Released','One heist. One chance.','Loophole',141824,2.0399,6.286,'92sLrZYrwq4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8019,_binary '\0','/A89qKnhI2UiqdnmbsCd6v1ussvQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081076',6.6,4071,'fr','Loulou','A bored wife leaves her husband for an unemployed, petty criminal.','/qTujCgEaVs9SkZxKOMkDH1t23ji.jpg','1980-09-03',106,'Released',NULL,'Loulou',39415,2.8149,6.202,'1VbQhHfBBBQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8020,_binary '\0','/tZx2vMOLfgTlglt7azI2Uf2d1Pa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081081',6.5,2498,'it','Luca il contrabbandiere','Cigarette smugglers in Naples run into problems with cocaine operations being set up by a rival smuggler.','/f7loB7aO9JPJlt7hPoiiijnBaYw.jpg','1980-08-08',97,'Released',NULL,'Contraband',39996,2.1379,6.3,'6AQ2hcuffUg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8021,_binary '\0','/i12ii6PDfNld9sjIb4hdUlpxJa3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081099',6.4,1824,'sv','Madicken på Junibacken','A second movie based on Astrid Lindgren\'s novel \"Madicken och Junibackens pims\", which is about two sisters and their adventures in 1910s Sweden.','/klRD7VUMwER6Ba9ZYBFDYP7jNv7.jpg','1980-10-18',82,'Released',NULL,'Madicken of June Hill',8445,1.5496,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8022,_binary '\0','/zjEvPW46VCSsXqHObE8gNtAE5sX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081104',8.1,1902,'sh','Majstori, majstori','The staff of elementary school prepare the retirement party for their cleaning woman. The complicated relations within the school will emerge to the surface on the same night.','/nbTuoODLTH5r9b1yE5S8Zm6qpaf.jpg','1980-10-27',83,'Released',NULL,'Handymen, Handymen',230574,1.4694,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8023,_binary '\0','/sLuPY3dqJHCb9egToTN4tKl3HUB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081109',6,1340,'en','The Man Who Saw Tomorrow','Hosted by Orson Welles, this documentary utilizes a grab bag of dramatized scenes, stock footage, TV news clips and interviews to ask: Did 16th century French astrologer and physician Nostradamus actually predict such events as the fall of King Louis XVI, the rise of Napoleon, the assassination of President John F. Kennedy? And are there prophecies that have yet to come true?','/dEf5Dfi0ZKDXRTJzCyTzF8PUkmx.jpg','1981-01-09',90,'Released','He foretold our yesterdays...and tomorrows.','The Man Who Saw Tomorrow',46973,1.7782,6.9,'gaGPshMoD1U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8024,_binary '\0','/afMwERTn7Z1mGBAlWeRuWHFx6yb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081112',5.1,5416,'it','Mangiati vivi!','A woman\'s search for her missing sister leads her to the jungles of New Guinea, where she and an expatriate guide encounter a cult leader and flesh-hungry natives.','/7h5LH5UNjYO4Hvv2myKqGeoaSo7.jpg','1980-03-19',93,'Released','Trapped in a jungle of crazy flesh eaters! The terrifying nightmare that became reality!','Eaten Alive!',8690,3.4236,5.2,'fv4kGSzv3rc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8025,_binary '\0','/f1csUYDRIdlqV8P77qsTAqNJQDh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081114',6.3,22731,'en','Maniac','A psychotic man, troubled by his childhood abuse, kills and mutilates young women and local models on the streets of New York City.','/cW67gScjmRn3uyFvldNcShBxJuC.jpg','1980-11-14',88,'Released','I warned you not to go out tonight!','Maniac',27346,2.4193,6.4,'pupXI2Bl8-Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8026,_binary '\0','/wjwdZinFCWNJDafi4jDc45FxTtc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081144',6.7,2600,'en','McVicar','John McVicar was a London Bad Boy. he graduated to armed bank robbery and was Britain\'s \"Public Enemy No. 1\". He was captured and put into a high security prison. Will even the highest security prison be able to hold him? This is the true story of his life, his criminal exploits and his eventual rehabilitation.','/oA2yUKbEKRMEtinpMtcRQsm0nt3.jpg','1980-08-01',112,'Released','Sentenced to 23 years-and he won\'t accept one day of it','McVicar',38539,1.612,6.5,'CHUFVExGmZ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8027,_binary '\0','/yxp2PrJX3zYIabLZJukaL19k6hb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081148',7.4,1324,'el','Ο Μεγαλέξαντρος','Alexander, a tribal warlord and former political prisoner, kidnaps British tourists, holding them for ransom until Britain and the Greek puppet government in Athens meet his demand for amnesty for his band of freedom fighters.','/oFfwZGdJdD3al5mXL69iMbjifgK.jpg','1980-09-08',210,'Released',NULL,'Alexander the Great',111988,1.3819,7.1,'za-DnILAUG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8028,_binary '\0','/lnRJEtthNXF3ded8aI0ND5ETjf9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081150',6.8,5821,'en','Melvin and Howard','The story of hard-luck Melvin Dummar, who claimed to have received a will naming him an heir to the fortune of Howard Hughes. Inspired by real events.','/23HqZIaW5Hg3yIOge4BMOdniLjo.jpg','1980-09-19',95,'Released','Poor Melvin. All he wanted was to be Milkman of the Month. Instead, he lost his job, his truck, and his wife. Then Howard Hughes left him $156,000,000.','Melvin and Howard',38772,2.1377,6.494,'mGeLSef8S7M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8029,_binary '\0','/k3CEd5irIMZlzkYAr5eWVKjgxSW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081159',6.3,4259,'en','Midnight Madness','A genius grad student organizes an all-night treasure hunt in which five rival teams composed of colorful oddballs furiously match wits with one another while trying to locate and decipher various cryptic clues planted ingeniously around Los Angeles.','/n4WP23kmCYQ2VjcLgtgPRrQ7fxX.jpg','1980-02-08',112,'Released','The most fun you\'ll ever have... in the dark!','Midnight Madness',17971,2.5704,5.775,'gLusAy-aOJY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8030,_binary '\0','/zAd78FMw4U9ltGD01AKs3qnLZXf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081163',6.2,11454,'en','The Mirror Crack\'d','Jane Marple solves the mystery when a local woman is poisoned and a visiting movie star seems to have been the intended victim.','/5rirt2BbnEDzgWfUzsAew0qHm1N.jpg','1980-02-06',105,'Released','Mirror, mirror on the wall, who is the murderer among them all?','The Mirror Crack\'d',6028,4.3153,6.1,'p63taTOIVu4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8031,_binary '\0','/fvUj0nF6u5iigfzZpGfAmTxWozi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081176',7.6,7441,'fr','Mon oncle d\'Amérique','Professor Henri Laborit uses three people\'s stories to discuss behaviourist theories of survival, combat, rewards and punishment, and anxiety: René is a technical manager at a textile factory and must face the anxiety caused by corporate downsizing; Janine is a self-educated actress/stylist who learns that the wife of her lover is dying and must decide to let them reunite; and Jean is a controversial career-climbing writer/politician at a crossroads in life.','/e9gbeslzPIav8ELEPRrKB1EzonF.jpg','1980-05-21',126,'Released',NULL,'My American Uncle',39543,2.6281,6.995,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8032,_binary '\0','/wrFvTM1A7YHNFMgzsPw0sTc9Xq2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081178',5.9,5246,'en','The Monster Club','A vampire attacks a horror author on the street and then invites him to a nearby club as a gesture of gratitude, which turns out to be a meeting place for assorted creatures of the night. The vampire then regales him with three stories, each interspersed with musical performances at the club.','/AnNIp3GDXX95nljypGPhcZnEGts.jpg','1981-04-11',98,'Released','You\'ll meet some interesting people and hear some great songs at the Monster Club','The Monster Club',39578,2.5372,5.8,'nbHNFwfi2KU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8033,_binary '\0','/hjqOmIZVSZLqqUkTuzZmTUUmoQP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081182',6.5,3939,'fr','La Mort en direct','In a future world where the disease has been finally defeated and everything can be sold, even the crude spectacle of death, the rare case of a dying woman becomes the morbid theme of a revolutionary reality show, broadcast through the curious eyes of a peculiar camera.','/wSuvftmbs0fInDe69u8yDUtElsp.jpg','1980-01-23',131,'Released','She\'s the target of every eye… including eyes only science could create.','Death Watch',3418,2.7104,6.361,'jemCpIu2Fek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8034,_binary '\0','/fs56yURwBoqsY12zjNGVkos3E6B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081184',6,15380,'en','Motel Hell','Farmer Vincent Smith and his sister Ida run a motel attached to a farm where they capture unsuspecting travelers, bury them alive, fatten them up and then harvest their bodies as ingredients for his famous brand of \"smoked meats.\"','/sb63i9ZDqin0Mh37B5sLiZSQY6A.jpg','1980-08-14',102,'Released','It takes all kinds of critters to make Farmer Vincent fritters!','Motel Hell',30924,3.4942,5.8,'e2aFGvT658k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8035,_binary '\0','/aDyUBdpSoLG5QbpzBcJYa2E9X23.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081186',5.3,7078,'en','Mother\'s Day','Three girls discover that two men are willing to do anything to impress Mother and what impresses Mother is watching her sons commit acts of rape and murder. Now these women are prisoners and lowered to pawns in the game of checkers between two dim wits and their Maniac Mommy and the question becomes, can any of them escape, alive?','/qONbGJ5jMb57zThorE5ozHDztDL.jpg','1980-09-19',91,'Released','If you go down to the woods today.','Mother\'s Day',14929,2.0766,5.5,'jt3RRxI_Vm8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8036,_binary '\0','/piZ9uASkg1x1FhQsNU9pAqjGBA7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081187',6.3,2934,'en','The Mountain Men','The story concerns two grizzled mountain men -- Bill Tyler and Henry Frapp -- during the dying days of the fur-trapping era. The plot begins when Running Moon runs away from her abusive husband Heavy Eagle and comes across the two seedy fur trappers. The mountain men take her in, unaware that Heavy Eagle has dispatched an army of Indian braves to reclaim her.','/hHezig8cJK9tvkvT1ORU4gfL8X2.jpg','1980-06-01',102,'Released',NULL,'The Mountain Men',75552,4.1286,5.9,'j1jF0PMgNts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8037,_binary '\0','/xfgbVM4ZiMacZRdYCo0nTaYHVPN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081190',7.9,1290,'en','Mr. Krueger\'s Christmas','Willy Krueger, a lonely and aging widower, lives in a basement apartment with only his cat George for company. Finishing his work for the day as the custodian for the building, he ventures out on Christmas Eve to buy a tree and on the way, he imagines he is a well-dressed gentleman while peering at some fine tailoring in a shop window along the snowy street. Returning home, he falls asleep listening to an LP by The Mormon Tabernacle Choir, dreaming that he is conducting them in carols of the season. Awakening to find some carollers outside his window, he beckons them to visit him offering hot chocolate, but they leave after only one song. In trimming the tree, he places upon it the mittens left behind by Clarissa, the youngest of the carolling group. Handling figures of the small nativity beneath his tree, Willy finds himself in the manger for the very first Christmas.','/shhvBsmCqWzbRoL3jwgprrgnlVc.jpg','1980-12-21',26,'Released',NULL,'Mr. Krueger\'s Christmas',50941,1.9236,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8038,_binary '\0','/i6THTq8VgAzReacsJN6cypoZgmR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081204',7.4,1364,'fr','Mur murs','Venturing from Venice Beach to Watts, Varda looks at the murals of LA as backdrop to and mirror of the city’s many cultures. She casts a curious eye on graffiti and photorealism, roller disco & gang violence, evangelical Christians, Hare Krishnas, artists, angels and ordinary Angelenos.','/dFU0gAIUeSS0k96it0LhCNN8v9R.jpg','1982-01-20',82,'Released',NULL,'Mur Murs',230048,1.2445,7.4,'ZblByouNqw4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8039,_binary '\0','/cd5ntfLmtqUqkUGn2B5s2zBLjde.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081207',7.1,11840,'en','My Bodyguard','Clifford Peache, an easygoing teenager, is finding less than easy to fit in at his new high school, where a tough-talking bully terrorizes his classmates and extorts their lunch money. Refusing to pay up, Clifford enlist the aid of an overgrown misfit whose mere presence intimidates students and teachers alike. But their \"business relationship\" soon turns personal as Clifford and the troubled loner forge a winning alliance against their intimidators - and a very special friendship with each other.','/agk3tSS6OLiSdyrieDhPpuQ7CEZ.jpg','1980-07-11',96,'Released','Terrorized in the Toilets? Chased after school? Shaken down for lunch money? GET A BODYGUARD','My Bodyguard',21873,3.6657,6.4,'22_0SIwqWWY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8040,_binary '\0','/18clzZvF4E2nfq50liqn8l82WBC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081229',4.7,2927,'en','Night of the Demon','An anthropology professor and his students attempt to track down a Bigfoot responsible for a rash of violent murders, only to uncover something even more sinister.','/tyOCBfMFX783oPvwp82meUQn4Sw.jpg','1980-02-04',96,'Released','An evil mutation embarks on a wave of brutal butchery.','Night of the Demon',40146,2.4693,4.8,'3vaGp9ylSDs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8041,_binary '\0','/vGKXERtAAOvfaumOUqbfivFQj8G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081230',6.9,2403,'en','Night of the Juggler','When a twisted psychotic kidnaps a young girl, mistaking her for the daughter of a wealthy developer, her father, a hardened ex-cop, doggedly hunts them through New York\'s seamy streets.','/fv9LeLgbzR08UHjGyfbsEKf5JkO.jpg','1980-06-06',101,'Released','In the heart of every victim is a hero and he\'ll tear apart a city to prove it.','Night of the Juggler',44686,2.8214,6.8,'60QTMV3DxFw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8042,_binary '\0','/rflNo8MqOQnkyA4aplRweprlwwe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081237',6.7,10284,'en','The Ninth Configuration','Army psychiatrist Colonel Kane is posted to a secluded gothic castle housing a military asylum. With a reserved calm, he indulges the inmates\' delusions, allowing them free rein to express their fantasies.','/jlQMBckfnLhiCusar62sJ7WCKBv.jpg','1980-02-29',118,'Released','How do you fight a war called madness?','The Ninth Configuration',18910,3.2194,6.4,'EUrI6wD3InA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8043,_binary '\0','/yw3x4a4nPgn4SA2K5rFPNAeJN99.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081248',5.6,7336,'it','Le notti del terrore','A cursed country estate is besieged by horny houseguests, undead Etruscans, and the unusual relationship between a mother and her young son.','/6dhaGjDyqRyXjhK1Qs1m0e1QMRT.jpg','1981-01-23',85,'Released','The gates of hell have opened.','Burial Ground',24919,2.9972,5.405,'X8yk4ZnPAtY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8044,_binary '\0','/6a3ujnxG9ssrxPHO9NzBs3Cg8v5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081249',5.1,3785,'en','The Nude Bomb','When KAOS develops a bomb that can dissolve all clothing, Maxwell Smart is brought in to foil the evil plot.','/1Cw5dYefeLfQ2NkMSEuRoWfsXt9.jpg','1980-05-09',94,'Released','Would you believe...Maxwell Smart goes undercover to expose a plot to make the world naked?','The Nude Bomb',26200,4.1296,5.342,'DFa8mWrva4I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8045,_binary '\0','/mPAhEIcSNOkVnPYFOAhoXhIgrDT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081250',5.5,2467,'fr','La Nuit des traquées','A woman with no memories runs in fear through the night when she is rescued by a man passing by. They will both have to figure out who her mysterious enemies are and what they want to achieve.','/186ES2dz1JlQdkOLbHNuqZ7MRj.jpg','1980-08-20',87,'Released',NULL,'The Night of the Hunted',29565,2.4532,5.551,'AVSoSzXlQUw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8046,_binary '\0','/zmUPKYqYUYHdmiAl4BqPfK8j28S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081256',7.8,1277,'ru','О бедном гусаре замолвите слово','The small town agog Hussars entry. Love between cornet and the young actress suddenly faces intrigue made by a St. Petersburg bureaucrat. The actress father dies after being involved in this game and perspectives look dark... But evil will eventually be defeated by the nobility, loyalty and love.','/jlUvdZBN4n7h7NXID7ZkYlpi0IA.jpg','1980-01-01',161,'Released',NULL,'Say a Word for the Poor Hussar',37175,0.8944,6.838,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8047,_binary '\0','/9bwdNuXE9dFXAsTaRbpqqXYtP3I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081259',5.1,7133,'en','The Octagon','Scott James, a veteran martial arts expert, is recruited as the protector of the wealthy and beautiful Justine after she becomes the target of a ninja clan. When Scott finds out that his ruthless arch-nemesis, McCarn , is involved with the stealthy and dangerous criminals, he is eager to settle old scores. Soon Scott is facing off against McCarn and the entire ninja horde in an effort to take them all down.','/nmU47EXTeEWRJDHqX1pa3JnDKrw.jpg','1980-08-14',104,'Released','In a world of choices, for one man there is no choice... he must face The Octagon.','The Octagon',24825,2.287,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8048,_binary '\0','/anqF4leHwJ9mEoPXUJTpzPjTNd3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081268',5.3,2786,'en','Oh, God! Book II','God appears before 11-year-old Tracy Richards to ask for her help to spread his word and influence over the world which she suggests the slogan \'Think God.\' Naturaly, Tracy\'s divorced parents think Tracy\'s crazy, and plot to halt her \'heaven-sent\' mission to spread God\'s word.','/9gH1Ip7zxdgNg6M8EID8oS5oiTM.jpg','1980-10-03',94,'Released','And the Lord said: \"Let there be another movie.\" And lo, there was another movie.','Oh, God! Book II',38147,2.3846,5.5,'3xi85-hb_J0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8049,_binary '\0','/fUbaNqwMMWZNnGXyFv8J4PXLALs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081269',5.4,2974,'en','Oh! Heavenly Dog','Browning is a PI with a bad cold, who\'s sent to investigate a case by a mysterious client. He stumbles across the body of a young woman and is stabbed to death, and when he wakes up in heaven, they tell him he\'s \"marginal material,\" and they can only decide on his final destination through one last assignment: to go back and solve his own murder. As a dog. A cute fluffy little dog (Benji). Undaunted, Browning begins to investigate the case as best he can around his canine disabilities (dialing the phone presents a special challenge) to solve the murders, save the girl, and see justice done.','/snlRys3j7LI5i4u3uw3mvFWBqXQ.jpg','1980-07-11',103,'Released','An adult tail of murder, mystery, and forbidden love.','Oh! Heavenly Dog',26179,1.6509,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8050,_binary '\0','/b41vIycq9VqLCbSHgdyYpzznPiI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081276',6.2,1220,'fr','On a volé la cuisse de Jupiter','Antoine, a professor of Greek, and Lise, a police inspector, honeymoon in Greece. There they meet a young couple, Charles, an archaeologist, and Agnes, a dishy flirt. Charles unearths the lovely buttocks of a classical statue and is determined to donate it to the Louvre. Agnes wants to sell it and gets a handsome local sailor to take it for an appraisal. When the sailor is murdered, the police suspect Charles and arrest Antoine as his accomplice. Lise swings into action, but before she can clear the men, Agnes springs them from jail, and now Lise must help them elude the police, find the real murderer, and recover the statue fragment. More art goes missing. What is the statue\'s secret?','/9SMaPrA63VxxvZnBIoHZ5p4o4ue.jpg','1980-02-06',100,'Released',NULL,'Jupiter\'s Thigh',61243,2.0535,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8051,_binary '\0','/81LV5HJ9nUXGCMhrJpFNjwvbEZl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081283',7.7,62647,'en','Ordinary People','Beth, Calvin, and their son Conrad are living in the aftermath of the death of the other son. Conrad is overcome by grief and misplaced guilt to the extent of a suicide attempt. He is in therapy. Beth had always preferred his brother and is having difficulty being supportive to Conrad. Calvin is trapped between the two trying to hold the family together.','/5gQLGRmBV8XoqWgkxuRFwe3jZV7.jpg','1980-09-19',124,'Released','Everything is in its proper place... except the past.','Ordinary People',16619,7.3701,7.4,'vtpsjMEGbaE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8052,_binary '\0','/4YebE5t0ZATyJL7o3K7MhGsEKW2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081291',7.2,5035,'en','Out of the Blue','A young girl whose father is an ex-convict and whose mother is a junkie finds it difficult to conform and tries to find comfort in a quirky combination of Elvis and the punk scene.','/rEWfWQDbx2upk9CAPRDDjCjc9a8.jpg','1981-04-29',94,'Released','She\'s 15. The only adult she admires is Johnny Rotten.','Out of the Blue',39269,2.7147,6.962,'9ua8Axep434','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8053,_binary '\0','/whhv9CuZAQ9NfiNVpl1u7yXAf4N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081318',6.2,21278,'it','Paura nella città dei morti viventi','A psychic seemingly dies of fright during a séance where she sees a vision of a Dunwich priest hanging himself in a church cemetery. New York City reporter Peter Bell investigates and learns that the priest\'s suicide has somehow opened a portal to Hell that must be sealed by All Saints Day, or else the dead will overtake humanity.','/8ymAiDW9ct2GSywWkqATEiKE8OB.jpg','1980-08-11',93,'Released','From the bowels of the Earth they came...To collect the living!','City of the Living Dead',24920,4.4892,6.5,'M-tU_HCF5i4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8054,_binary '\0','/5Egh8kLnbLERbDvHW1U59oC6lM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081323',6.1,6999,'es','Pepi, Luci, Bom y otras chicas del montón','After a young heiress is assaulted by a policeman, she seeks revenge by befriending the policeman’s mousy wife and introducing her to her circle of outrageous punk friends.','/xL72JwMDJLGZBUtXgjx7eERJ8nj.jpg','1980-10-27',82,'Released',NULL,'Pepi, Luci, Bom',4499,2.4636,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8055,_binary '\0','/gv0z1HxAYyRhvCJd1a5BzxB2wh8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081344',7.3,3035,'en','Playing for Time','When a Jewish songstress is plucked from the stage and sent to Auschwitz, she and other musicians find themselves assigned to a terrible task—using their talents to soothe fellow prisoners who are sentenced to die in the gas chambers.','/vpUrgBytFwSempcJQvhBUgbRBnK.jpg','1980-09-30',150,'Released',NULL,'Playing for Time',51681,2.4215,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8056,_binary '\0','/4sqnnRFg89RJMVZyX4wH5QPjvxA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081349',7.4,1927,'hu','A Pogány Madonna','The unique statue of the ancient fertility goddess Demeter, known as the \"Pagan Madonna\" is stolen from the museum, located in a small town on Lake Balaton. At the same time seriously wounded a servant of the museum. The abduction of the museum\'s priceless statues of pure gold is investigated by the then young and inexperienced investigator Kardos and lieutenant \"Droplet\".','/xAmaILotHQHaU64YYSVGlrsutac.jpg','1981-05-28',98,'Released',NULL,'The Pagan Madonna',79244,1.3921,7.1,'V4yWFcuCXsI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8057,_binary '\0','/Arb8ZOPXczej8DlMNSgELDFA2dP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081353',5.4,38093,'en','Popeye','Popeye is a super-strong, spinach-scarfing sailor man who\'s searching for his father. During a storm that wrecks his ship, Popeye washes ashore and winds up rooming at the Oyl household, where he meets Olive. Before he can win her heart, he must first contend with Olive\'s fiancé, Bluto.','/hCCp4pESgYY6uTFARYf4UYV1BdU.jpg','1980-12-12',114,'Released','Haves a happy holiday with me an\' Olive!','Popeye',11335,5.877,5.6,'npUqfsI_L34','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8058,_binary '\0','/itUVvN7k9Jbsj2Tz3mYSP2NjbU6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081363',7.5,2993,'cs','Postřižiny','Francin, manager of a small-town brewery, has a charming wife whose abundant blonde locks are an adornment to the town. Maryska looks ethereal but loves meat and beer, while Francin is an ascetic. The strict members of the brewery board of directors come to audit the accounts, but are diverted from concentrating on Francin\'s detailed reports by Maryska, who has organized a pig-killing feast and is ably assisting the butcher. When she invites the old curmudgeons on the board to enjoy the fresh pork, they are too happy to agree. Francin doesn\'t know whether he is going to get a permanent contract. To make things worse his brother Pepin - eccentric, noisy and garrulous - turns up on an indefinite visit.','/1C1oGhqssgiUSxVwGSvbn3jDZD.jpg','1981-02-06',93,'Released',NULL,'Cutting It Short',51178,1.3956,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8059,_binary '\0','/bMWO0HQwfIe85CmXbWSI8Q6cCC2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081375',6.2,31232,'en','Private Benjamin','A sheltered young high society woman joins the US Army on a whim and finds herself in a more difficult situation than she ever expected.','/maIiPNXddZXKHQCi0HyULd5kces.jpg','1980-10-06',110,'Released','The Army was no laughing matter until Judy Benjamin joined it.','Private Benjamin',10765,4.3191,6,'xdCrMdDRENA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8060,_binary '\0','/yskKkKahJJ9XYjbgrufpoOZDBdn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081376',6.5,4037,'en','The Private Eyes','The lord and lady of a capacious manor are killed, and the lord\'s ghost seems to have returned to knock off the staff one by one, causing Inspector Winship and Dr. Tart to investigate the wacky house and its inhabitants.','/sIG0xrld1OW1HavH03KACNTxz0w.jpg','1980-04-17',91,'Released','Who better to solve England\'s most puzzling mystery than these two international crime busters?','The Private Eyes',13762,2.0702,6.1,'MCOQP_LaWtQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8061,_binary '\0','/sv4QooO9pBFsn95mA7ExXA2BBBS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081383',5.3,24263,'en','Prom Night','At a high school senior prom, a masked killer stalks four teenagers who were responsible for the accidental death of a classmate six years prior.','/r2Ew7wUP96PsePEZseK6JqcPWY9.jpg','1980-07-18',93,'Released','If you\'re not back by midnight...You won\'t be coming home!','Prom Night',36599,6.187,5.7,'Fuzsgc0Xpe8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8062,_binary '\0','/tvNuhRlpRozDgsX1zR9gQ2aHv1X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081398',8.1,414127,'en','Raging Bull','The life of boxer Jake LaMotta, whose violence and temper that led him to the top in the ring destroyed his life outside of it.','/1WV7WlTS8LI1L5NkCgjWT9GSW3O.jpg','1980-11-14',129,'Released','I don’t go down for nobody.','Raging Bull',1578,11.6294,7.9,'F2UKuKxCJqc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8063,_binary '\0','/k0mwvvXFvBAVTrlYf5D2sETXMHX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081400',5.3,6252,'en','Raise the Titanic','To obtain a supply of a rare mineral, a ship raising operation is conducted for the only known source, the Titanic.','/XvukyvRCbkYKKv1TdtlyNxvzEl.jpg','1980-08-01',115,'Released','They\'ve found the Titanic. There\'s just one thing left to do...','Raise the Titanic',24575,4.0112,5.4,'KqWnM2xZ0gw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8064,_binary '\0','/oOSRhoplrujWiPgxG1ww6b9dbR5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081414',7.1,3760,'en','Resurrection','The story of a woman who survives the car accident which kills her husband, but discovers that she has the power to heal other people. She becomes an unwitting celebrity, the hope of those in desperate need of healing, and a lightning rod for religious beliefs and skeptics.','/8Oq0lF2a0Cqzp5NA8spLPola0lN.jpg','1980-09-26',103,'Released','It\'s not supposed to happen. Be there when it does.','Resurrection',98864,1.684,6.5,'QB7Inm8snWQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8065,_binary '\0','/cZyFIHao8gUf8t7gQmsdHcwF4aA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081415',5.8,1322,'es','El retorno del Hombre Lobo','An evil witch brings back to life the infamous Elizabeth Bathory, who was executed several hundred years previously for murdering young women and bathing in their blood.','/sboBM7ENejxQGtAJxsbEgdW9g0k.jpg','1981-04-08',92,'Released','It used to be only a myth','Night of the Werewolf',29906,1.6035,6.111,NULL,NULL,NULL,'202