c1Wf.jpg','1982-04-03',84,'Released','SEX and the DEVIL... A Wicked Combination.','Black Candles',27400,1.9452,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8070,_binary '\0','/jmvrvcJge7YnbjyS5dsk6IDDlfW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081433',5.3,1496,'en','Roadie','A young Texas good ol\' boy has a knack with electronic equipment, and that talent gets him a job as a roadie with a raucous traveling rock-and-roll show.','/4vAzTfw0g70BM1dAx7vdRNIhKMm.jpg','1980-06-13',106,'Released','Bands make it Rock...Roadies make it Roll!','Roadie',21024,1.4476,5.9,'0JKdChhd_P4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8071,_binary '\0','/w6U2JwqcantYuCOUwaUh0eUIjkr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081439',5.7,1729,'en','Rough Cut','Two sophisticated jewel thieves join forces to steal $30 million in uncut jewels.','/omQO3KUJH0g6BntveHhjpiqekNv.jpg','1980-06-19',112,'Released','They\'re all gems. But who\'s the fake?','Rough Cut',49375,2.4988,5.837,'ZOClUMq4Oho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8072,_binary '\0','/9ju9Ton7iB9klWc2Qt0BKGoltTQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081441',6.4,1885,'en','Rude Boy','Rude Boy is a semi-documentary, part character study, part \'rockumentary\', featuring a British punk band, The Clash. The script includes the story of a fictional fan juxtposed with actual public events of the day, including political demonstrations and Clash concerts.','/46tzKLP9Huzjf1L09qEEdvNAdx0.jpg','1980-07-25',133,'Released','Grab the future... by its face!','Rude Boy',27930,1.1496,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8073,_binary '\0','/1qxQvGJXlkFRqfGallca9DXmynS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081455',6.7,68432,'en','Scanners','A scientist trains a man with an advanced telepathic ability called \'scanning\' to stop a dangerous Scanner with extraordinary psychic powers from waging war against non-Scanners.','/VTqLdveNXxGsIAZL5I4RliTTt7.jpg','1981-01-14',103,'Released','10 Seconds: The Pain Begins. 15 Seconds: You Can’t Breathe. 20 Seconds: You Explode.','Scanners',9538,4.6803,6.7,'8C_yd8Dufhw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8074,_binary '\0','/eYAqTTXshxTC9eUpqztO6G3To40.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081457',4.3,1445,'en','Scared to Death','A series of hideous murders is taking place, and Inspector Capell and cop-turned-novelist Lonergan are investigating. The murders are found to be the work of an out-of-control experiment in genetic engineering. The two men must descend into the city\'s sewer systems to destroy the horrific miscreation. It won\'t be hard to find, as it\'s already looking for its next victims...','/xSW42sBxRslex2OUAtr6OMSjiR3.jpg','1980-03-01',93,'Released','Is it alien, or was it once human?','Scared to Death',97942,1.6715,4.1,'XtLs8bT3uPE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8075,_binary '\0','/sxtEioCrOsdTiZAWZUgxObCwqca.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081459',5.1,2414,'en','Schizoid','When Dr. Pieter Fales\' patients start receiving ominous letters and getting murdered by an unknown black-clad assailant, he and his daughter both come under suspicion.','/5lgnTYvJHIMu6zivRCJnfQ36VAL.jpg','1980-09-01',89,'Released','Hide the Scissors.','Schizoid',79823,1.6647,5.2,'IoP46HnEQyc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8076,_binary '\0','/klYg6tPTOZAjuIt5RidSBfZDyxA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081467',5.3,2958,'it','L\'isola degli uomini pesce','After their prison ship sinks in the Caribbean, a group of prisoners and a doctor wash ashore on a seemingly deserted island. They soon discover a strange couple, who invite them to stay at their house. While the prisoners plan an escape, the doctor does some investigating, and soon finds out just what the pair are really doing, and why the prisoners keep disappearing mysteriously.','/dP7AhdcbTsW92ovcGUFf3dyr8m2.jpg','1979-01-18',93,'Released','Killers from the deep guard the forbidden treasures on...','Island of the Fishmen',27905,2.5866,5.7,'ow6wdppqmOM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8077,_binary '\0','/aa1DTTkZa8yFP65Q7C0wrSm98NN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081470',6.3,6108,'en','The Sea Wolves','A German spy is passing on information about the location of Allied ships in the neutral harbor of Goa, India, with catastrophic results. Unable to undertake a full military operation in the Portuguese stronghold, English intelligence brings out of retirement a crew of geriatric ex-soldiers, veterans from World War I, using their age as cover. These old soldiers are asked to take to the seas and pull off an unlikely undercover mission.','/kb1YjjKpCrqqsmJDXnlbieJ3wC6.jpg','1980-07-03',120,'Released','The Last Charge of the Calcutta Light Horse','The Sea Wolves',19664,3.4297,5.9,'hZVhYgjLGgI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8078,_binary '\0','/wqtK1JgJ1n5BB1cWu8PzOuBcrXn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081480',6.7,12089,'en','Seems Like Old Times','After being falsely accused of robbing a bank, a writer seeks the help of his lawyer ex-wife to clear his name. However, hilarity ensues when he must hide from her husband, who’s throwing a party for law enforcement officials.','/5gslMsppM01WafyogPpHevrMeGg.jpg','1980-12-19',102,'Released','A husband, 6 dogs, a wife, a larcenous chauffeur, an ex-husband, a temperamental maid, 2 bank robbers, a governor, 2 cats, 2 bad cats and a whole bunch of policemen get together to help you celebrate!','Seems Like Old Times',28124,3.0868,6.277,'kw9TPR93kPk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8079,_binary '\0','/ey11qAO0jST1YP25GuqdAtD4Y3M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081485',6.5,1274,'en','Serial','A man resists the California fads that his wife, friends and wealthy Marin County neighbors embrace.','/8JxAZlcYOyZtNiUTUtBzgzskFN9.jpg','1980-03-28',90,'Released','\"Honor thy wife, and everyone else\'s.\"','Serial',41034,1.9431,5.6,'iu46PZHV5zU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8080,_binary '\0','/2tAeSoXHDWFYUUozECS7C3l75y8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081491',7,3432,'hi','शान','DSP Shiv Kumar returns home to his wife Sheetal and their young daughter and announces that he has been transferred to Bombay. Shiv Kumar has two brothers, Vijay and Ravi, who live in Mumbai. They are intelligent and capable guys, but spend their time loafing about the city and swindling unsuspecting people.','/ba0dM3b0FGV3XXwxa8RPNH5hT8V.jpg','1980-12-12',181,'Released',NULL,'Shaan',31235,1.2863,6.8,'E0tGuDweD48','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8081,_binary '\0','/3DDFmCXdMnhneGm7HphYA670Wq0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081494',6.9,4658,'zh','少林搭棚大師','The workers of a dye factory have their pay cut by 20% when the factory owner brings in some Manchu thugs to try and increase production. Desperate to reclaim their full wages, the workers hire an actor to impersonate a priest and kung-fu expert from the temple of Shaolin. The factory owner proves the actor a fraud, and punishes all those involved. The young actor feels he has let the workers down, and promises to atone. He sets out for Shaolin, determined to be accepted as a kung-fu pupil at the elite temple.','/4eZz8xkIiGDpt7Q4TLzu7wfY7U4.jpg','1980-08-24',101,'Released','Back for the rest!','Return to the 36th Chamber',48301,3.1776,6.8,'Ek5u5XIRqUg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8082,_binary '\0','/lFuo2EY659uWBHbWrQMc69BplGl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081499',7,9323,'cn','師弟出馬','Youthful martial arts master Lung is searching for his missing brother, when he is mistaken for a criminal on the run. He must prove his innocence by solving the case himself, while local lawmen and merciless mercenaries are hot on his trail.','/sSZwTKQgY9pudxFOqxKCSf8r5qF.jpg','1980-02-09',107,'Released',NULL,'The Young Master',11563,4.095,7.006,'LKXHnyvqAG4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8083,_binary '\0','/AdKA2F1SzYPhSZdEbjH1Zh75UVQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081505',8.4,1243245,'en','The Shining','Jack Torrance accepts a caretaker job at the Overlook Hotel, where he, along with his wife Wendy and their son Danny, must live isolated from the rest of the world for the winter. But they aren\'t prepared for the madness that lurks within.','/uAR0AWqhQL1hQa69UDEbb2rE5Wx.jpg','1980-05-23',144,'Released','A masterpiece of modern horror.','The Shining',694,28.4192,8.2,'ANKdpe4J2h0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8084,_binary '\0','/umvWI03KADbMJ9NxK8lCPmQKcwG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081506',7.3,12155,'en','Shogun Assassin','A Shogun who grew paranoid as he became senile sent his ninjas to kill his samurai. They failed but did kill the samurai’s wife. The samurai swore to avenge the death of his wife and roams the countryside with his toddler son in search of vengeance.','/t376p5q8zvhyQ2FOroytJsRvlL8.jpg','1980-11-11',85,'Released','He whips out his sword and relieves his victims of their heads!!','Shogun Assassin',15119,3.3926,6.843,'ZxAPEyzcCtU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8085,_binary '\0','/t6qi5BiazglcrKfouMGQFtCfQeI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081515',5.7,2594,'en','Silent Scream','Scotty moves into Mrs. Engels\' seaside mansion where three other college students are boarding. Mrs. Engels prefers to stay in her room in the attic, but her son Mason helps the students get settled. Soon one of the students is killed. The policemen on the case begin uncovering the Engels family secret as the remaining students become endangered','/9si55E97ooMEBtzLYK4v7yAuLCd.jpg','1979-11-23',87,'Released','Terror so sudden there is no time to scream.','Silent Scream',28380,1.8249,5.7,'MkUm49Ponb0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8086,_binary '\0','/ahaPgkVmHIVMVVMtqhcvRT8QAXT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081529',5.3,19351,'en','Smokey and the Bandit II','The Bandit goes on another cross-country run, transporting an elephant from Florida to Texas. And, once again, Sheriff Buford T. Justice is on his tail.','/cYNZM1xdhOH6NybMcX9E1LPOl3l.jpg','1980-08-15',101,'Released','The Bandit is back and better than ever!','Smokey and the Bandit II',12705,5.2744,5.557,'RdCUque5H2M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8087,_binary '\0','/d7gEJYEookiF0SHPD8fMXcCgpC9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081534',7.2,37003,'en','Somewhere in Time','Young writer Richard Collier is met on the opening night of his first play by an old lady who begs him to \"Come back to me\". Mystified, he tries to find out about her, and learns that she is a famous stage actress from the early twentieth century. Becoming more and more obsessed with her, by self-hypnosis he manages to travel back in time—where he meets her.','/hmdegiSwVYUNvEfihaE3HRM3Sos.jpg','1980-10-02',103,'Released','Someday in the past he will find her...','Somewhere in Time',16633,5.4193,7.5,'9uicvPZSKIM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8088,_binary '\0','/v6pxOOj17l2BcrRUKUm7nL3tMzS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081541',6.5,4799,'fr','Les sous-doués','The story centers around a graduating class of \"less-gifted\" students in a private Versailles high school. Only a miracle has brought the students this far along, and after a practical joke misfires and the whole school is dynamited, the students are in deep trouble. They have to present themselves in court for their punishment and it could not be worse: If they don\'t pass their high-school graduation exams, they go to prison!','/6lw59oTZ0nCPmjYzxwM50vo0aGE.jpg','1980-04-30',92,'Released',NULL,'The Under-Gifted',60175,2.8224,6.463,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8089,_binary '\0','/aIG4JBfaXOqUYGKn3NsXvBDz2Pa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081547',6.7,6437,'nl','Spetters','Amateur dirt-bikers Rien and Hans–and their mechanic Eef–each fall in love with Fientje, a young woman who, with her brother Jaap, works a concession stand at the races. Everyone seeks a better life: Fientje wants out of the business and away from Jaap; and Rien and Hans aim to make their marks as pro racers, like their hero, Gerrit Witkamp.','/1wwfUnwGtyfWOytbBtZguYkfXJ4.jpg','1980-02-28',120,'Released','There is no such thing as simple love','Spetters',40072,2.8352,6.397,'M5xraocUMeA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8090,_binary '\0','/phSIp0IbGhPgKyLduTnQ4z2IzsD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081554',7.2,25402,'en','Stardust Memories','While attending a retrospect of his work, a filmmaker recalls his life and his loves: the inspirations for his films.','/y1EHgpL2hMVRcr6tIOy7VGLxaPs.jpg','1980-09-26',89,'Released','Woody Allen in his most amusing and witty effort!','Stardust Memories',11337,3.6483,6.9,'ThwMJkiTBDg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8091,_binary '\0','/33ToWRPVOnrx6GKXHZMNUE3ulLW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081562',6.7,32945,'en','Stir Crazy','New Yorkers Skip Donahue and Harry Monroe have no jobs and no prospects, so they decide to flee the city and find work elsewhere, landing jobs wearing woodpecker costumes to promote the opening of a bank. When their feathery costumes are stolen and used in a bank robbery, they no longer have to worry about employment — they\'re sent to prison.','/ehCdQewg9SxjhnimJrKwNKbr80C.jpg','1980-12-12',111,'Released','Two jailbirds who just want out of the cage.','Stir Crazy',21629,4.645,6.517,'1U1h0aYcXyQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8092,_binary '\0','/kT0cqJ4XAhXRJKqx4ljVBg5LUl9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081568',6.9,11827,'en','The Stunt Man','A fugitive stumbles onto a movie set just when they need a new stunt man, takes the job as a way to hide out and falls for the leading lady while facing off with his manipulative director.','/yk7sVvXxAOO2oncDkjaon4C7ErX.jpg','1980-11-03',131,'Released','If God could do the tricks that we can do, he\'d be a happy man...','The Stunt Man',42160,3.0489,6.594,'YLpgCcoixlY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8093,_binary '\0','/e77VeVcrXhxfCdJWD9rameYn7Qn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081573',6.8,124877,'en','Superman II','Three Kryptonian criminals led by General Zod team up with Lex Luthor to conquer Earth, forcing a depowered Superman to regain his strength and stop them.','/3xk5cno9BHcnwc97XO9k21aI1Zi.jpg','1980-12-04',127,'Released','The Man of Steel meets his match!','Superman II',8536,10.5245,6.754,'8FF60gilDng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8094,_binary '\0','/i4ZwZdt7nUNI7ovrbzvbGqkZpgf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081590',7.2,10050,'sv','Sällskapsresan eller Finns det svenskt kaffe på grisfesten','Stig-Helmer and Ole Bramserud on a trip to the Canary Islands for Christmas.','/ebBdGB4CCSFbhw8M3fUG0kvYt4Z.jpg','1980-08-22',107,'Released','Finns det svenskt kaffe på grisfesten','Package Tour',16026,1.935,6.9,'ydktt6Q22Xs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8095,_binary '','/hUzWAgAVGJ8NviaoGHOVxxyHlEo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081593',6.9,2185,'en','Taboo','When Barbara Scott\'s husband leaves her, she\'s left alone, without a source of income, and charged with taking care of their teenage son, Paul, who she begins to fantasize about as erotic tension grows...','/fLh69JdW4chwaIOIMX9zLCmfJUy.jpg','1980-03-07',86,'Released','If charity begins at home...why not sex','Taboo',42019,0.0714,7.659,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8096,_binary '\0','/36sGdksVobQVWz9lSyo6YAordcL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081606',6.6,2016,'de','Taxi zum Klo','Frank, a dedicated schoolteacher, embraces the sexual freedoms of the city’s underground scene—navigating a double life in public restrooms, cinemas, and cruising spots. When he meets Bernd, a sweet and steady museum worker, he finds himself torn between the comfort of domestic partnership and the allure of anonymous desire.','/zJHMI2UQ9LSA3OLqwb0oBw4greq.jpg','1981-01-09',95,'Released','Do you want to come with me on my adventures?','Taxi to the Toilets',35125,1.5658,6.3,'UkyrgRgOY1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8097,_binary '\0','/dOwHLZMS8nvolTrE7rIOI7oTs2Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081609',6.6,1466,'ru','Тегеран-43','This story starts in 1980 in Paris as the memories of Andrei Borodin, a Soviet agent, take the action back to 1943 during the Teheran meetings of Stalin, Roosevelt and Churchill. A high-ranking Nazi officer developed a plan to assassinate the three world leaders in order to undermine the Allied forces. He commissioned the German agent Max Richard to carry out his plan, but it failed miserably due to the quick action and thinking of Andrei. While in Teheran, Andrei met a French woman, Marie Louni, living in the city and they had a brief but intense affair. Nearly four decades later, the Nazi officer has been captured - but not for long. Freed by terrorists, the officer is hunting down the German agent who failed to carry out the planned assassinations. Max lives at Françoise, a young French woman, who hides him.','/cXrwys3cRpIttyKEvN0wGhqEMFA.jpg','1981-07-08',192,'Released',NULL,'Teheran \'43',2371,1.9136,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8098,_binary '\0','/fz5rODyDPyIPInB6oaUAaosnJNP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081614',5.4,2603,'fr','Tendres Cousines','Teenage Julien loves his teenage cousin Julia among flowers in summer of \'39 France.','/jITSqc5btIXBRsiZbC3RkZaoY4U.jpg','1980-11-19',92,'Released',NULL,'Tender Cousins',73134,5.3116,5.747,'5h0TDJ5viHw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8099,_binary '\0','/rjEoEfJDhDlYW0bMdeIntKFuSkS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081616',7.1,2217,'it','La terrazza','Eight Italian politicians from the communist party gather on a terrace in Rome for a get-together. They discuss about their past, present and future.','/9VQpe6Olw355r0PmxmgBBs5BFSk.jpg','1980-02-08',160,'Released',NULL,'The Terrace',77334,1.8766,7