he Last Shark',40383,2.3847,5.4,'z0l9f29zdBQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8107,_binary '\0','/3pHBNRiRJ4SOsjgkos74CufzRTB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081678',7.4,1702,'fr','Un mauvais fils','Bruno is released from prison. He looks for a job and tries to start a new life. His first stop is at his father\'s apartment.','/k0lWS1qIiNHAnwirb8b6GKwI8sU.jpg','1980-10-14',110,'Released','A film by Claude Sautet','A Bad Son',61389,1.7503,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8108,_binary '\0','/sE5gqaRgOSAQ2AYVDjxmsfeJVTu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081693',2.3,4862,'it','L\'uomo puma','Thousands of years ago, aliens visited Earth and fathered the Pumaman, a man-god with supernatural powers entrusted by a gold mask with the ability to control people\'s minds, which in present-day London, falls into the wrong hands.','/1cmJeLWhqezudWa168KKy4REFbp.jpg','1980-02-14',97,'Released','An ancient gold mask with the power to control minds...','Pumaman',31278,1.9875,2.9,'MH9uUBAQw8M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8109,_binary '\0','/zaWaVDevRN0gmgWoMPw1yUtWX6n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081695',4.7,2054,'en','Up the Academy','Four boys are sent, for different reasons, to a Military Academy. The life of discipline asks a lot of the four geeks. Of course these boys know how to make a party out of the hard times. Will they be \"real men\" after one year.','/oAV7DzHETyijMY2AsRSzoIcIxoj.jpg','1980-06-06',87,'Released','The education they got wasn\'t in books.','Up the Academy',33670,1.8828,4.8,'GETlgTdtT5M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8110,_binary '\0','/ySh8pIJ7iWdbtDLmhFbX28TQnU9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081696',6.5,18771,'en','Urban Cowboy','After moving to Pasadena, Texas, country boy Bud Davis starts hanging around a bar called Gilley\'s, where he falls in love with Sissy, a cowgirl who believes the sexes are equal. They eventually marry, but their relationship is turbulent due to Bud\'s traditional view of gender roles. Jealousy over his rival leads to their separation, but Bud attempts to win Sissy back by triumphing at Gilley\'s mechanical bull-riding competition.','/2uKWi1Hb6yqkmOixRgKVwrzxljA.jpg','1980-06-06',132,'Released','Hard Hat Days And Honky-Tonk Nights.','Urban Cowboy',17496,3.7328,6.5,'h3tEUBsJGPs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8111,_binary '\0','/6zMevCRj7ybKCAqxAsZkiFreCQ9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081698',6.7,18888,'en','Used Cars','When the owner of a struggling used car lot is killed, it\'s up to the lot\'s hot-shot salesman to save the property from falling into the hands of the owner\'s ruthless brother and used-car rival.','/h9hqesyEBaag8ZkgrBSaUGgGNFF.jpg','1980-07-11',113,'Released','Like new, great looking and fully loaded with laughs.','Used Cars',14475,5.3808,6.43,'xzN9QR66fWw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8112,_binary '\0','/el6IkQec3Hj5E7BQ6xTACE6SH9S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081712',6.3,2714,'sv','Vi hade iallafall tur med vädret ...','The Backlund family is going on a caravanning holiday. According to the father Gösta it is the best way to see Sweden. The son Johan does not want to do anything but bathing and the daugther Lotta don\'t even want to come along. You get to see the Backlunds in resturants, beaches and caravan sites. Gösta likes to rule his family but it does not go very well.','/x6QdiKdfzjyF395ky9O6Lg6vrPh.jpg','1980-02-27',57,'Released',NULL,'Well, We Were Lucky with the Weather',18920,1.3744,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8113,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081730',7.9,2501,'cs','Vrchní, prchni','A comedy concerning a down on his luck bookshop owner with a penchant for women who decides to make some money by pretending to be a waiter and collecting cash from unsuspecting diners.','/sTSItkshq63vzg64txKeNJ5SC1j.jpg','1981-01-09',88,'Released',NULL,'Run, Waiter, Run!',36919,1.