ree his people from slavery, but Moses keeps getting all the credit.','/2k9h9F9gf3YJAJojl2TzevTZaaa.jpg','1980-06-13',103,'Released','The story of Herschel. He wanted to be Moses...but he didn\'t have the right connections.','Wholly Moses',33076,1.8507,4.7,'D7s_2hNcQKE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8118,_binary '\0','/c01p9MLzHqU0NJyeEz05fgp0ZNE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081760',6.7,1341,'en','Windwalker','An ancient Indian warrior who has reached the end of his life is brought back from his \'death\' to save his family from a raiding party of enemy Indians in this unique story of \'Indians without a single cowboy.','/rPbAGObhxzMRWMJdxGZVa6CleIh.jpg','1980-12-12',108,'Released','He conquered love and death...now he walks the winds of eternity!','Windwalker',85548,1.4201,6.292,'6xuS737IlOM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8119,_binary '\0','/gwinmVbatxw4jY4jsXrAjCBetsI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081764',5.1,5778,'en','Without Warning','When a mountain town is besieged by aliens, stranded teens Sandy and Greg team up with a local hunter as a paranoid war vet becomes convinced they\'re the enemy.','/q25eMSP4T8g9BNA0XdNyVllWtBN.jpg','1980-09-19',89,'Released','It Preys On Human Fear. It Feeds On Human Flesh.','Without Warning',44932,2.9483,5.2,'JLkhKBEO1B4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8120,_binary '\0','/sMfWv9eaacE4yHueu2Hq15JeONi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081766',6.9,2280,'en','The Wizard of Speed and Time','A Hollywood filmmaker makes a short for an evil film studio. Unbeknownst to him, the producer has placed a bet of $25,000 that he won\'t come up with anything with a use. Luckily, our film creator gets the help of his friends.','/jSKFfau4MPTPgMN3Ljz8AyhIy7Q.jpg','1989-09-22',98,'Released','His Life Is a Special Effect...','The Wizard of Speed and Time',44276,1.9811,6.387,'elF68qCwnxM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8121,_binary '\0','/tj0UzAnR1texxcYi0eeafY4fRGZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081777',5.4,17234,'en','Xanadu','Kira, a Greek muse incarnated on Earth to inspire people, helps Dan McGuire and an artist named Sonny Malone to meet. She inspires them to build a huge disco roller rink called Xanadu.','/4r1cHzhksHO3u1QS1Ct9mId7kQL.jpg','1980-08-08',96,'Released','A Fantasy, A Musical, A Place Where Dreams Come True.','Xanadu',15668,3.4008,5.7,'qdK5W-S0sW4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8122,_binary '\0','/gZ4frhcopB1P8M4F20hiXopuPqD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081793',5.6,9921,'en','Christmas Evil','Garbed in his red suit, Harry, a toy factory worker, decides that the only thing he can do to save the spirit of Christmas is to become Santa Claus himself and make all of the naughty townspeople pay... in blood!','/c3R6U8sOGoyY45Ovqho0DkqB5hK.jpg','1980-11-01',94,'Released','You Better Watch Out!','Christmas Evil',27230,2.4224,5.5,'t2zPRNgzBrM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8123,_binary '\0','/21h4GsFuTIIeROPP1qf5OmutG65.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081796',6.7,1425,'fi','Tulitikkuja lainaamassa','In Eastern Finland, in Liperi to be exact, Anna-Liisa Ihalainen asks her husband Antti to get some matches from the Ihalainen household. Unfortunately that trip takes a little longer than expected...','/tlH4ePoG8ER6lSXxXPzavCG5qwQ.jpg','1980-01-18',100,'Released',NULL,'For the Matches',78132,1.5519,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8124,_binary '\0','/vcimMFe7I7EpRC02uQ1NMORIpjn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081809',6.3,6468,'en','ffolkes','When terrorists take over two oil rigs, and threaten to blow them up if their demands are not met, an eccentric anti-terrorism expert volunteers his unique commando unit to stop them.','/v7YvYI95fGgadM1Vsz15UbscI9g.jpg','1980-02-18',100,'Released','When the next 12 hours could cost you 1,000 million pounds and 600 lives you need a man who lives second by second','North Sea Hijack',390253,2.954,6.316,'6UwQkNPjRVM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8125,_binary '\0','/vFP89GE4Qhou9yGUE7O05wtKLyt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081915',8,2209,'en','The Pee-wee Herman Show','The original adult-oriented version of what would eventually become an award-winning children\'s classic. This version of the show features Pee-wee\'s playhouse and many of the characters of the later series, but with irreverent overtones and jokes including \'mirror shoes\' and others.','/uwFd0JGrDTjEjD9U6ddKYVkBy5K.jpg','1981-09-11',58,'Released',NULL,'The Pee-wee Herman Show',20363,1.9461,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8126,_binary '\0','/1myLye2AOLJrIMZoOz64FIJTVDo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081964',6.4,2680,'en','...All the Marbles','A two-bit promoter tries to take a women\'s wrestling team to the top.','/qv0WuNiP93ahEEYDFwC5DcjJmOS.jpg','1981-03-01',113,'Released','The California Dolls and their best friend Harry...Together they\'re going for...All The Marbles','...All the Marbles',30709,3.1814,6.107,'pLwjP0SRceY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8127,_binary '\0','/yujtsvYA9dVc8qdUvQtBntfEqnD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081974',6.9,16776,'en','Absence of Malice','Megan Carter is a reporter duped into running an untrue story on Michael Gallagher, a suspected racketeer. He has an alibi for the time his crime was allegedly committed—but it involves an innocent party. When he tells Carter the truth and the newspaper runs it, tragedy follows, forcing Carter to face up to the responsibilities of her job when she is confronted by Gallagher.','/sEmQFj17MUEWyqU1xa6yQ0VW5CA.jpg','1981-11-19',116,'Released','In America can a man be guilty until proven innocent?','Absence of Malice',19429,3.8099,6.6,'bLeWVq7tQgQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8128,_binary '\0','/fSDx53srDrl05xLL87eL25ld76D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081975',6.5,2232,'en','Absolution','At a Catholic boys\' school, domineering disciplinarian Father Goddard rules over his pupils with an iron hand. When one of his teenage charges confesses to murder, the dogmatic but deeply repressed Goddard finds his faith challenged and his life spiralling dangerously out of control.','/nfeL1pF5TqDvFhChQR88V1V9x7E.jpg','1978-06-05',95,'Released','One man, two boys... one deadly game.','Absolution',77128,1.9651,6.52,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8129,_binary '\0','/6SqFwDJbCz05WTyep06Yye5Th7p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0081991',7,1851,'ru','Агония','As an adviser to the emperor Nicholas II, mystic Grigori Rasputin holds great influence over the empire. However, many in St Petersburg begin to regard Rasputin, with his strange practices and mesmerizing qualities, as a liability and plot his assassination. When Rasputin, known to many as the \'Mad Monk\', leads Nicholas to embrace an ill-conceived military strategy, a group of determined conspirators set down a plan to eliminate him.','/rBu6tRn8DYINYx1jjpIOGVKiEOa.jpg','1981-09-01',142,'Released','Monk. Heretic. Messiah. Madman.','Agony: The Life and Death of Rasputin',42138,1.5672,6.76,'_o7m__WKbxo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8130,_binary '\0','/qIIOgtvJ4NaLjrtCzqnrFzhT5Ko.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082000',5.1,5946,'en','Contamination','A former astronaut helps a government agent and a police detective track the source of mysterious alien pod spores, filled with lethal flesh-dissolving acid, to a South American coffee plantation controlled by alien pod clones.','/eCUSieEikP6vt0dBbIKnEGpyEK2.jpg','1980-08-02',95,'Released','You can feel them in your blood!','Contamination',39916,2.0631,5.231,'O96wNns29Eo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8131,_binary '\0','/tZqBwfuDjfuggj6jmiUMs7GXEmW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082001',5.5,2206,'en','All Night Long','Executive George Dupler loses his temper and is demoted to the night manager at a 24 hour drugstore. After he suggests to his teenage son Freddie that he stop having an affair with suburban housewife Cheryl Gibbons, who is a distant cousin, Cheryl tries to seduce George. At home, in front of his mother, Freddie accuses his dad of stealing his girl, because he found Cheryl serving George a meal in the middle of the night, while her husband Bobby was on duty at the fire station. George then separates from his wife Helen, quits his job, moves into a warehouse, and asks Cheryl to move in with him.','/rUe694KlHdlVvtgSRsGdrEkbtSr.jpg','1981-03-06',87,'Released','She\'s got a way with men. And she\'s getting away with it...','All Night Long',140413,2.5389,5.27,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8132,_binary '\0','/A8uNZxUSkcESdLcVSwZpBKTfs70.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082005',5.9,1474,'en','The Amateur','A researcher for the CIA who convinces his superiors to send him to the eastern bloc in order to avenge the murder of his wife by enemy agents discovers a web of deception underneath his wife\'s death.','/6B3QqpsRraPPQA6SthhOQs4DL1p.jpg','1981-12-11',112,'Released','In a world of professional assassins, there is no room for an amateur.','The Amateur',21294,2.1586,5.4,'gNwCJaX-DCw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8133,_binary '\0','/n82OZ74V3KBDQKrSVqgVzE8nnjs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082009',7.2,6233,'en','American Pop','The history of American popular music runs parallel with the history of a Russian Jewish immigrant family, with each male descendant possessing different musical abilities.','/svrATPrggBUauEhCyhiF7K175T9.jpg','1981-02-13',96,'Released','All those years, all those dreams, all those sons... one of them is going to be a star.','American Pop',29204,2.283,6.882,'2U7sY6fgrXs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8134,_binary '\0','/4js6VLf6qHWUbW42BpXiQKPBP7t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082010',7.5,136276,'en','An American Werewolf in London','American tourists David and Jack are savagely attacked by an unidentified animal while hiking on the Yorkshire Moors. After retiring to the home of a beautiful nurse to recuperate, David soon begins experiencing disturbing changes to his body and mind.','/hVEqUASJmCQaolkKFEySCHZ8uKG.jpg','1981-08-21',97,'Released','Beware the moon.','An American Werewolf in London',814,12.1802,7.389,'3q_T4oRsfpY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8135,_binary '\0','/ufwJmWFk3Ztu4SI5cugogkVUh4s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082025',6.2,1514,'en','The Appointment','Prophetic nightmares precede a family\'s confrontation with an evil, unseen force.','/luyBANHZ2hivNxznmXcTNkGl0O2.jpg','1983-01-15',90,'Released','A chilling tale of the supernatural!','The Appointment',157276,1.5686,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8136,_binary '\0','/s7m59L9kv1JufLXsrWRRow9k2vT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082031',6.9,34018,'en','Arthur','Arthur is a 30-year-old child who will inherit $750 million if he complies with his family\'s demands and marries the woman of their choosing.','/m8yOFRDVZPxtsr4D2hVdzls6q6t.jpg','1981-07-17',97,'Released','The most fun money can buy.','Arthur',13665,3.6235,6.51,'D5gABBndg-w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8137,_binary '\0','/gmlEbVEWEbUUqE6ZCTGMnTYSeC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082034',6.4,2568,'it','Asso','Asso (Ace), the best poker-player in town, was killed in his wedding night, because he won too much against a bad loser. In the \"final\" game in heaven the clerk on duty also lost, so Asso can come back to this world as a ghost to search for a good man for his wife (widow). Who is good enough for the wife of Asso ?','/8vwIz284JtxsSPNRGkTKyYWe66n.jpg','1981-04-09',90,'Released',NULL,'Ace',37765,7.6373,6.179,'QbX-PuIlDlM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8138,_binary '\0','/3aClURRSl7ujSTgOCXqJOzGPIQD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082045',6.3,9873,'it','Banana Joe','Island farmer Banana Joe helps the local community by trading his bananas for goods. When gangsters arrive with plans to construct a banana processing plant, Joe kicks them out, but the mob boss discovers that Joe is operating without a license. After the mob tips off the authorities and Joe\'s boat is impounded, he ventures into a big city for the first time to seek help.','/jMFM6rbvpglsazWkTBTbF9RUKXH.jpg','1982-03-24',96,'Released',NULL,'Banana Joe',11340,3.4424,6.7,'pE3gD4ihsWA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8139,_binary '\0','/aLFhIjAZG8UjW2dmQ5yCz3FP60X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082053',6.9,4238,'fr','Le Beau Mariage','Sabine vows to give up married lovers, and is determined to find a good husband. Her best friend Clarisse introduces her to her cousin Edmond, a busy lawyer from Paris. Sabine pursues Edmond, with the encouragement of Clarisse, but Edmond does not seem very interested.','/gccR9f3A75Hs2TrdSLKE7QFoM7O.jpg','1982-05-19',97,'Released',NULL,'A Good Marriage',2861,2.0596,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8140,_binary '\0','/PH9U1z8Xk8bUVFUcLBYig9VAaZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082054',6.9,4412,'fr','Beau-père','Rémi is a man trapped in a deteriorating marriage. When his wife is unexpectedly killed in a car accident, Rémi is left with his stepdaughter, Marion, who chooses to stay with him rather than live with her birth father. After the initial shock passes, Rémi is caught off-guard when Marion begins expressing her attraction to him. Initially repulsed, Marion\'s mature beauty wears him down as he finally caves to her seductions.','/sF6wgE9Lg4CUsLzNMnuotESplFF.jpg','1981-09-16',123,'Released',NULL,'Beau Pere',42337,7.0939,6.424,'REly3JRDITk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8141,_binary '\0','/kjxnYiITXakTCeu2Ob8JIidGrAe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082073',7.4,4795,'it','Bianco, rosso e Verdone','Three very different Italians travel to their hometowns on election day: Pasquale, a Southern immigrant living in Munich, finds a country far removed from the one he left behind; Roman civil servant Furio\'s relentless nitpicking threatens to push his wife Magda over the edge; young Mimmo\'s journey is repeatedly interrupted by concerns about his grandmother\'s health.','/tS5ca077KEMbJHBVNLa1nCnycXJ.jpg','1981-02-20',110,'Released',NULL,'Bianco, rosso e Verdone',37775,1.6685,7.327,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8142,_binary '\0','/3SGxsg9DiPouBLoghsQPLPqHATA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082081',7.3,3031,'de','Die bleierne Zeit','Germany, 1968: The priest\'s daughters Marianna and Juliane both fight for changes in society, like making abortion legal. However their means are totally different: while Juliane\'s committed as a reporter, her sister joins a terroristic organization. After she\'s caught by the police and put into isolation jail, Juliane remains as her last connection to the rest of the world. Although she doesn\'t accept her sister\'s arguments and her boyfriend Wolfgang doesn\'t want her to, Juliane keeps on helping her sister. She begins to question the way her sister is treated.','/lOPTepFzMlwJzupQDPe481hI0sN.jpg','1981-09-04',106,'Released',NULL,'Marianne and Juliane',42142,1.6872,7,'AjCYE18UVhQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8143,_binary '\0','/c0Ss6YF6HQiQChrtdKCRRMXBmlp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082083',4.5,3254,'en','Blood Beach','Something or someone is attacking people one by one on the beach. Some of them are mutilated, but most of them are sucked into the sand, disappearing without a trace. What is the creature responsible? Where does it live, and where did it come from? And is there any chance of it reproducing? Meanwhile, David Huffman and Mariana Hill are once-almost-married old friends, reunited over the death of her mother on the beach, and searching for clues in the abandoned buildings where they used to play when they were young.','/3BfSQmwTm8LGv2KZKcDJnFuBbIC.jpg','1980-09-01',92,'Released','Just when you thought it was safe to go back in the water - you can\'t get to it.','Blood Beach',37843,2.6076,4.8,'LaKYBzvScUc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8144,_binary '\0','/phP0kZP6Sn6ybnwRG1xOQ8qqfNb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082084',5.7,6401,'en','Bloody Birthday','In 1970, three children are born at the height of a total eclipse. Due to the sun and moon blocking Saturn, which controls emotions, they have become heartless killers ten years later, and are able to escape detection because of their youthful and innocent facades. A boy and his teenage sister become endangered when they stumble onto the bloody truth.','/3NHxjIQI6lpMo7gYCOFBrLH4WuN.jpg','1981-04-28',85,'Released','The nightmare begins with the kids next door.','Bloody Birthday',55538,2.4151,5.9,'sj84CIc7-SM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8145,_binary '\0','/nk87CtgZ7wd86W37oJHGYAJbmLz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082085',7.4,78079,'en','Blow Out','While recording sound effects for a slasher flick, Jack Terry stumbles upon a real-life horror: a car careening off a bridge and into a river. Jack jumps into the water and fishes out Sally from the car, but the other passenger is already dead — a governor intending to run for president. As Jack does some investigating of his tapes, and starts a perilous romance with Sally, he enters a tangled web of conspiracy that might leave him dead.','/uFzMscVLDrTaYd6KXOXlr6dly7w.jpg','1981-07-24',108,'Released','Murder has a sound all of its own.','Blow Out',11644,7.8464,7.4,'rDve1A5EAvk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8146,_binary '\0','/1rVXkgcdcxoV6PBxZ6WdGMsZ2bk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082088',7.4,2216,'es','Bodas de sangre','A dance troupe prepares for and completes a dress rehearsal of Federico García Lorca\'s tragic play \"Blood Wedding,\" which is about a bride who runs away from her wedding with a former boyfriend.','/lfLdKbwayLuXkU8ZHFJoNSsbPI1.jpg','1981-03-09',68,'Released',NULL,'Blood Wedding',42139,1.6682,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8147,_binary '\0','/g6seVGyULRgvHQfHZswlcbZlr1E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082089',7.4,44820,'en','Body Heat','During an extreme heatwave, a beautiful Florida woman and a seedy lawyer engage in an affair while plotting the murder of her rich husband.','/5LipPcaW1J9IjAP7TOTesw8OcMS.jpg','1981-08-28',113,'Released','As the temperature rises, the suspense begins.','Body Heat',14412,7.0334,7,'UWnHLgmcwAw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8148,_binary '\0','/yr01M6XOo2rw7Pwl0O7RKao9ezl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082094',5.5,3693,'en','The Boogens','Otherworldly creatures inhabit the bootlegging tunnels underneath a small town mining community, and they kill any of the townsfolk who invade their home.','/rWjxVVDBOm6WiOO7cmYChwHdl0j.jpg','1981-09-25',95,'Released','Some Things Shouldn\'t Be Disturbed...','The Boogens',33721,1.5009,5.5,'8JmwzacLEQ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8149,_binary '\0','/zzzhbZnSPMOON9uGt0LsdUJWYoC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082096',8.3,290509,'de','Das Boot','A German submarine hunts allied ships during the Second World War, but it soon becomes the hunted. The crew tries to survive below the surface, while stretching both the boat and themselves to their limits.','/u8FhQPncOAkwcei2OI9orPWhV6K.jpg','1981-09-17',150,'Released','On land they dreamed of being heroes. Beneath the sea they pray to be survivors.','Das Boot',387,10.9086,8.084,'r37MmBuFoc0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8150,_binary '\0','/An4QeEvTDmWBnDmorMo0H8xxn6w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082100',6.7,12068,'fr','La Boum','A thirteen-year-old French girl deals with moving to a new city and school in Paris, while at the same time her parents are getting a divorce.','/usGV1Q7KWR0Uq4dOIppGZ0ba8kz.jpg','1980-12-17',110,'Released',NULL,'The Party',166,4.0232,6.6,'gKCCz59QtVE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8151,_binary '\0','/dnKeOvOLev8zVF29FnMTiCyo10q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082106',7.5,1236,'en','Brooklyn Bridge','Today it\'s a symbol of strength and vitality. 135 years ago, it was a source of controversy. This documentary examines the great problems and ingenious solutions that marked the construction of the Brooklyn Bridge. From conception to construction, it traces the bridge\'s transformation from a spectacular feat of heroic engineering to an honored symbol in American culture.','/tYx9GYyA34giTiJQL95TSxpLZ6q.jpg','1981-11-08',58,'Released',NULL,'Brooklyn Bridge',67079,1.8315,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8152,_binary '\0','/7GNxGLF7jUL1bjG3xmnknMavML3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082111',6.5,5591,'en','Buddy Buddy','During a high-profile Mafia testimony case in Riverside County, a hired killer checks into a hotel room near the courthouse, while his depressed neighbor contemplates suicide over marital problems.','/7oZcpghGYhLgw60JbJU3btDCHMg.jpg','1981-04-02',96,'Released','The greatest movie buddies of all time are back!','Buddy Buddy',36133,2.5899,6.109,'gAISu32kAZs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8153,_binary '\0','/6yjwUGVheiW40wfkjurP5J0iUeb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082114',6.8,2978,'en','The Bunker','Dramatization depicting the events surrounding Adolf Hitler\'s last weeks in and around his underground bunker in Berlin before and during the battle for the city.','/c0meiXebNi3GqFfceTG0ynGd08B.jpg','1981-04-15',150,'Released',NULL,'The Bunker',41407,2.6814,6.3,'93oW783CkaI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8154,_binary '\0','/hkt9cbyS3gRkiBqc9a8oukd3oXt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082118',6.2,25528,'en','The Burning','A caretaker at a summer camp is burned when a prank goes tragically wrong. After several years of intensive treatment at hospital, he is released back into society, albeit missing some social skills. What follows is a bloody killing spree with the caretaker making his way back to his old stomping ground to confront one of the youths that accidentally burned him.','/d8as1GtCAhlc5rirarnUUd85gJA.jpg','1981-05-08',91,'Released','A legend of terror isn\'t a campfire story anymore!','The Burning',24124,4.083,6.203,'KTvr0SJQ_WM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8155,_binary '\0','/xsxK9qHfB2qYyZI4ls4Qv5ZaEWA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082121',6.1,4128,'en','Bustin\' Loose','After ex-con Joe Braxton violates his probation, he is given a second chance. All he has to do is drive a group of special kids across the country.','/dOs3shYBvRjXG0XSdyKfh47iyYQ.jpg','1981-05-22',94,'Released','He\'s mad. He\'s bad. And he\'s Bustin\' Loose.','Bustin\' Loose',31361,2.0305,6.2,'D9hr4RGGj8Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8156,_binary '\0','/ap7mFztKlrYXjZ8ZxBGfQ3Cy0S0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082122',4.7,1749,'en','Butterfly','Jess Tyler lives a quiet life next to an abandoned mining factory by himself in the desert. His life is turned upside down when a sexually provocative young woman comes to visit him and tells him she\'s his daughter. Jess finds it hard to adapt to his newfound parenting role, as a mutual attraction grows between them.','/nzcjcO4dX1laL6zP2Poq5gcwM3R.jpg','1982-02-05',108,'Released','A Controversial Thriller of Murder and Revenge.','Butterfly',34697,3.8837,4.9,'2HJ7r-sue-I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8157,_binary '\0','/9X1sGqxX4OxZosppJkMFJF72KnI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082133',4.6,1346,'it','Caligola: La storia mai raccontata','An insane young emperor finds his love of brutality and degradation surpassed only by his hunger for enslaved virgins, cruel vengeance, extreme acts of \'horseplay\' and beyond.','/s9SSrlp8O91dv8gJ8Df7UOatIH0.jpg','1982-02-02',109,'Released','The most powerful man in the Empire has gone insane!','Caligula: The Untold Story',148850,4.3724,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8158,_binary '\0','/6Jw1a3ctW5eQjonmPCwPrOeYVNN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082136',6.3,44227,'en','The Cannonball Run','A cross-country road race is based on an actual event, the Cannonball Baker Sea to Shining Sea Memorial Trophy Dash, organized by Brock Yates to protest the 55 mph speed limit then in effect in the U.S. The Cannonball was named for Erwin G. \"Cannonball\" Baker, who in the roaring 20\'s rode his motorcycle across the country. Many of the characters are based on ruses developed by real Cannonball racers over the several years that the event was run.','/yDO1xRq4LOAv720xqJHHEVz5Sr9.jpg','1981-06-19',95,'Released','You\'ll root for them all...but you\'ll never guess who wins.','The Cannonball Run',11286,8.0859,6.152,'45RKZDSsdvY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8159,_binary '\0','/xxG51xJVTSJhiBJBZJ7P1zelUt1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082138',5.7,3806,'en','Carbon Copy','A middle-aged married wealthy white corporate executive is surprised to discover that he has a working-class black teen-age son who wants to be adopted into the almost-exclusively-white upper-middle-class community of San Marino, California.','/gFmDrQ3yHENKHhfk3LH1wClhN14.jpg','1981-08-06',92,'Released','Any resemblance between father and son is purely hysterical.','Carbon Copy',53922,2.2188,5.807,'lSllh1_hRio','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8160,_binary '\0','/3jQFPMk9DanjVy3s930aWuOFN2j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082146',5.8,9446,'en','Caveman','Disgraced and cast out of his tribe for lusting after Lana, the mate of the tribe\'s head muscle man, Atouk stumbles along gathering other misfits and learning a bit about the world outside of his cave. Eventually he and friends Lar and Tala learn the secrets of fire, cooked meat, and how to defend themselves from the brutal, yet very stupid dinosaurs.','/cfZfl3wxO8QxHKJsiWUHZg1D62B.jpg','1981-04-17',91,'Released','Back when you had to beat it before you could eat it...','Caveman',18905,4.1768,6.7,'82tGAgBUsUU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8161,_binary '\0','/nEeq7iQDbsj4qRt9E11PvQOWKvQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082158',7.1,71698,'en','Chariots of Fire','In the class-obsessed and religiously divided UK of the early 1920s, two determined young runners train for the 1924 Paris Olympics. Eric Liddell, a devout Christian born to Scottish missionaries in China, sees running as part of his worship of God\'s glory and refuses to train or compete on the Sabbath. Harold Abrahams overcomes anti-Semitism and class bias, but neglects his beloved sweetheart in his single-minded quest.','/qnRaum8k0HqGRml2i7OawFqUtEb.jpg','1981-05-15',123,'Released','This is the story of two men who run, not to run, but to prove something to the world. They will sacrifice anything to achieve their goals... except their honor.','Chariots of Fire',9443,6.4897,6.8,'AawHrbzbuMI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8162,_binary '\0','/wtW8gJaN0WLmMZFFUr0FZjj06h5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082159',4.1,1618,'en','Charlie Chan and the Curse of the Dragon Queen','Famous detective Charlie Chan is called out of retirement to help a San Francisco detective solve a mysterious series of murders. With his bumbling grandson as his sidekick, Chan also encounters an old nemesis known as the Dragon Queen who is the prime suspect.','/8gyBGOJpIZrUm8y0Q83L2yuwAPs.jpg','1981-02-13',97,'Released','Murderer who turn victim into human baked potato have real appetite for crime.','Charlie Chan and the Curse of the Dragon Queen',66592,3.2788,5.153,'0LnAwcU44k0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8163,_binary '\0','/aBMG8TPWCMhHWCGuRLF6HHHHQOB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082162',7.9,2917,'hi','Chashme Buddoor','Womanizing slackers Omi and Jai attempt to woo the new girl in the neighborhood, and fail - miserably. Their third roommate - shy, and a bookworm - succeeds, much to their chagrin. The two scheme up comical ideas to split the two lovebirds, so that their secrets and humiliation are not revealed.','/6J69y5YMvzPp3g1nHptG1bST8lq.jpg','1981-04-30',145,'Released',NULL,'Chashme Buddoor',60392,1.142,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8164,_binary '\0','/mtdd7jmJhutdsIyqVRSjsK1PetX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082163',6.1,8662,'en','Nice Dreams','Nice Dreams - it rhymes with ice creams. And that\'s what Cheech and Chong are selling in this thoroughly wacky comedy. The outrageous, permanently spaced-out duo sells enough of their \"specially mixed\" ice cream to take the cash and realize their fondest dreams: new guitars, islands in the sun and beautiful women. But, of course, not everything goes as planned. While celebrating their wealth in a new wave Chinese restaurant, Cheech meets his long-lost love Donna, and promptly escorts her to her posh penthouse. He soon learns, however, that Donna\'s boyfriend, an ex-con named Animal, is on his way to her boudoir. Meanwhile, Chong has unwittingly exchanged all their money for a worthless bank check - and the only way to get it back is to escape into a nearby insane asylum.','/r9rsnbe3R9WtjzIhwajHVft9Fp3.jpg','1981-07-24',88,'Released','The story of two enterprising young men who make an amazing amount of money selling ice cream.','Nice Dreams',20075,2.8651,5.8,'6SbNEZnf_Ck','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8165,_binary '\0','/8SIPa9qHEjPuJi8gQddjCxL6sFg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082173',6.9,2403,'fr','Le choix des armes','A former crook is pulled out of retirement when a gang on the run turn to him for shelter after a prison break.','/5Uc6peRx1TamJLBsQkW8LFoaf3E.jpg','1981-08-19',135,'Released','Three People. Two Love Stories. One Choice.','Choice of Arms',42145,2.8242,6.593,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8166,_binary '\0','/7Hu3TMEcdtACZBXTBe4CiNVSIIV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082175',7.2,2674,'en','The Chosen','In a 1940s New York, two Jewish teenage boys are determined to remain friends despite the deep differences between their families.','/wtw4jMMKz5CfB4H408XGAa87XHp.jpg','1981-08-20',107,'Released','One boy. Two worlds. A time to choose.','The Chosen',25773,1.8933,7.1,'RAMz8_MoqrM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8167,_binary '\0','/vhu2Nscn4HTi5gwYBRXU3OJqVCo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082176',7.5,35955,'de','Christiane F. - Wir Kinder vom Bahnhof Zoo','A teen girl in 1970s Berlin becomes addicted to heroin. Everything in her life slowly begins to distort and disappear as she befriends a small crew of junkies and falls in love with a drug-abusing male prostitute.','/2uNlG5V0l3X4UjEtRnPUWOGCGK9.jpg','1981-04-02',131,'Released','The image of a generation.','Christiane F.',9589,5.4403,7.338,'qQytv4hYVks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8168,_binary '\0','/6VsJhrSpatiowoLctdK8BdzmpQB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082183',7.3,12134,'fr','La Chèvre','When the boss\' unlucky daughter is missing in South America, Campana is sent to watch the boss\' most unlucky employee who is sent as a private detective in hopes he can duplicate the daughter\'s mistakes.','/h4LISjDFnpWtAVsp4kFbDaKw6UZ.jpg','1981-12-09',94,'Released',NULL,'La Chèvre',19123,3.971,7.1,'6R0gEQe-hCA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8169,_binary '\0','/rX42FtLbTQC0936u12pYNeuRGyF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082186',6.9,52104,'en','Clash of the Titans','To win the right to marry his love, the beautiful princess Andromeda, and fulfil his destiny, half-God-half-mortal Perseus must complete various tasks including taming Pegasus, capturing Medusa\'s head and battling the feared Kraken.','/5JCLODNLJH6alc3KmyoiC21Nlob.jpg','1981-06-12',118,'Released','Experience the fantastic','Clash of the Titans',10323,8.7524,6.9,'IopYAEDa6uU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8170,_binary '\0','/fNp2ikvY8WZTyVbK1iXW84RLbO5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082198',6.9,175686,'en','Conan the Barbarian','A horde of rampaging warriors massacre the parents of young Conan and enslave the young child for years on The Wheel of Pain. As the sole survivor of the childhood massacre, Conan is released from slavery and taught the ancient arts of fighting. Transforming himself into a killing machine, Conan travels into the wilderness to seek vengeance on Thulsa Doom, the man responsible for killing his family. In the wilderness, Conan takes up with the thieves Valeria and Subotai. The group comes upon King Osric, who wants the trio of warriors to help rescue his daughter who has joined Doom in the hills.','/qw2A587Ee61IwcSOLNFRhuOACZZ.jpg','1982-03-16',130,'Released','Thief. Warrior. Gladiator. King.','Conan the Barbarian',9387,11.6593,6.805,'mwLBes2Gr8E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8171,_binary '\0','/kJn4aK6QMn890jnXEeEDLm9zDyK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082199',5.7,5842,'en','Condorman','Comic artist and writer Woody performs a simple courier operation for his friend Harry who works for the CIA. But when he successfully fends off hostile agents, he earns the respect of the beautiful Natalia, who requests his assistance for her defection. Woody uses this request as leverage to use the CIA\'s resources to bring his comic book creation, Condorman, to life to battle the evil Krokov.','/wRe9kAvjN5IGAjPd0oCKhjyQDt0.jpg','1981-07-02',90,'Released','An action adventure romantic comedy spy story.','Condorman',19379,2.345,5.5,'BHbsm86xKS0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8172,_binary '\0','/xm2mmF7F1XprBZ9FoZOyWswMZ2o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082200',6.2,6139,'en','Continental Divide','A hard-nosed Chicago journalist has an unlikely love affair with an eagle researcher.','/jwLFNA10RJBcQ4Fe0SoySkSFr0V.jpg','1981-09-18',103,'Released','When they met they heard bells. And that was just round one.','Continental Divide',26560,2.2415,6.1,'V-8tEye8evg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8173,_binary '\0','/pE7XVUxxQ9qdCQKhBWalYNA57I8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082206',7.3,7388,'fr','Coup de torchon','A pathetic police chief, humiliated by everyone around him, suddenly wants a clean slate in life, and resorts to drastic means to achieve it.','/sYlANrZi5vxaHhmPaktuPlsO2Wz.jpg','1981-11-04',128,'Released',NULL,'Coup de Torchon',35797,2.4032,7.033,'mQq-htLBZ-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8174,_binary '\0','/p5cbr6otCjYv0WQlNbi8WNE133q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082210',7.4,2199,'es','El crack','Private detective Germán Areta el Piojo gets a terminally ill client who wishes to see his long lost, runaway daughter before he dies.','/thPZa2lHHV8wJu71kOHTR90OQ3p.jpg','1981-03-26',121,'Released',NULL,'El crack',60794,1.0606,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8175,_binary '\0','/gFvXNjwDGgwwIViGAZiTY9p3cxv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082213',3.6,1967,'en','Spaceship','A farce satirizing extraterrestrial horror movies such as Alien. Alternate titles include \"The Creature Wasn\'t Nice\" and \"Naked Space\" (1999 re-release trying to capitalize on Nielsen\'s \"Naked Gun\" success).','/pihIOXhwXpvYPBeF8vnJqP8ROmX.jpg','1983-07-01',88,'Released','Get your rockets off on...','Spaceship',36220,1.3761,3.9,'BEyEL-BvbqQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8176,_binary '\0','/g8wlcoLYzxOgukkLasp4G8NkpP5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082220',6.8,9109,'en','Cutter\'s Way','Alex Cutter is a boozy, belligerent and deeply cynical Vietnam veteran whose encounter with a landmine during the war has left him minus an eye, a leg and an arm. When his drifter playboy friend Richard Bone is falsely accused of murder, Cutter sets out for revenge in his own inimitable style.','/7IhITThoRNFmJe3fwwx1q6h6k5L.jpg','1981-03-19',109,'Released','Cutter does everything his way. Fighting. Loving. Working. Tracking down a killer.','Cutter\'s Way',31593,3.3576,6.5,'FPFgPSkw6Oo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8177,_binary '\0','/row4sMw5mVzKCWRbyrAQ39zvyLX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082222',7.3,4275,'pl','Człowiek z żelaza','In Warsaw in 1980, the Communist Party sends disgruntled radio reporter Winkel to Gdańsk to dig up dirt on the shipyard strikers - particularly on Maciek Tomczyk, an independent labour union leader whose father was killed in the December 1970 protests. Posing as sympathetic, Winkel interviews the people surrounding Tomczyk, including his detained wife, Agnieszka.','/22wNUqKyz2m6wzAt31f26H8Y433.jpg','1981-07-27',147,'Released',NULL,'Man of Iron',225,1.5642,7,'CGWQfuhefI8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8178,_binary '\0','/r87fqhLLQnXmpBdLVEv4EIHnMbb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082235',6.7,10210,'en','Dark Night of the Scarecrow','Bubba, an intellectually disabled man, is falsely accused of attacking a young girl. Disguised as a scarecrow, he hides in a cornfield, only to be hunted down and shot by four vigilante men. After they are acquitted due to lack of evidence, the men find themselves being stalked one by one.','/pershJo6I8qqun0MEuwqmPSg9hH.jpg','1981-10-24',97,'Released','The Original Classic','Dark Night of the Scarecrow',30931,3.9687,6.459,'SVXfNEiNCqs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8179,_binary '\0','/46MUvtPCCArWYNfoddm8idP4xfV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082237',3.9,1655,'en','Dawn of the Mummy','A group of fashion models disturb the tomb of a mummy and revive an ancient curse. Along with the mummy rising, slaves who were buried in the desert thousands of years before, also rise, with a craving for human flesh.','/nL8y7FtSwXI9ZiD5Bh1SQFAuag3.jpg','1981-12-11',93,'Released','A monstrous, chilling terror stalking the living…','Dawn of the Mummy',40467,1.7439,4.1,'e7qP7Q-P8xM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8180,_binary '\0','/zqNOCCVhZRjryQ7BcvpIHTY10Uf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082242',6.5,16903,'en','Dead & Buried','After a series of gory murders commited by mobs of townspeople against visiting tourists, the corpses appear to be coming back to life and living normally as locals in the small town.','/aMZD57u1M9TQAKf12OYUUcv9hjn.jpg','1981-05-29',94,'Released','It will take your breath away. All of it.','Dead & Buried',24274,4.0907,6.4,'MPxTlbnih-8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8181,_binary '\0','/lbjakR2EWqGrThFiLp8N1sPoZQE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082243',5.6,2884,'en','Strange Behavior','When the teenagers in a small Illinois town start getting murdered, the police chief makes a connection to the mysterious scientific experiments being done at the local university and must stop them before his own son is dragged into the deadly scheme.','/yom3R0L2U7gM4VX6LpXyHbwmFiN.jpg','1981-10-16',99,'Released','Town population is down... about six feet','Strange Behavior',40041,1.8443,5.5,'T7laKFz62MU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8182,_binary '\0','/o6UNDjXPBJQ0oRu0V1FguLSIYKm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082245',5.5,8125,'en','Deadly Blessing','When a former member of a religious cult dies in a mysterious accident, Martha, who now lives alone and close to the cult\'s church, begins to fear for her life and the lives of her visiting friends.','/uVbllQDWJAglLyXYbWwgEGWpIu9.jpg','1981-08-14',104,'Released','Pray you\'re not blessed.','Deadly Blessing',33016,3.3614,5.5,'SKQkF-j_RnM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8183,_binary '\0','/m7OyQ5NREEzEemOcLjhvLSShZQH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082247',6.9,9177,'en','Death Hunt','Yukon Territory, Canada, November 1931. Albert Johnson, a trapper who lives alone in the mountains, buys a dog almost dead after a brutal dogfight, a good deed that will put him in trouble.','/j9nVLvOv2Sz3KekD7elwGZII8F9.jpg','1981-04-15',97,'Released','Savage pursuit in the wilderness!','Death Hunt',26444,3.7921,6.676,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8184,_binary '\0','/yXqdxVT3CqPMxT3SgjtWFYkv6Jw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082250',6,20607,'en','Death Wish II','Paul Kersey is again a vigilante trying to find five punks who murdered his housekeeper and daughter in Los Angeles.','/lt91fEbThol6K8JDW6jFgPgxCjN.jpg','1982-02-20',92,'Released','He\'s Planning to Clean Up the City. HIS way!','Death Wish II',14373,5.2556,6.2,'3m2XrgV3GmI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8185,_binary '\0','/f8xL5NhRuZNyai9Sijb9aykU1z5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082252',7.5,5825,'en','The Decline of Western Civilization','The Los Angeles punk music scene circa 1980 is the focus of this film. With Alice Bag Band, Black Flag, Catholic Discipline, Circle Jerks, Fear, Germs, and X.','/36YfDJQKZfoCn5NLJ7mcrekE511.jpg','1981-07-01',100,'Released','See it in a theater.... where you can\'t get hurt.','The Decline of Western Civilization',21137,2.1293,7.2,'_H7f9IRt_4A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8186,_binary '\0','/mStP3cmQf4XEktqNmk5pVGnAyHD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082257',4.7,2209,'en','Demonoid','A British woman visits her husband at the Mexican mine he is attempting to reopen and discovers that the workers refuse to enter the mine, fearing an ancient curse. The couple enter the mine to prove there is no danger and inadvertently release a demon which possesses people\'s left hands and forces them to behave in a suitably diabolical manner.','/7sx4sN83iFlEEO9yyFPCwOF7waS.jpg','1981-02-27',80,'Released','Up from the depths of hell comes the ultimate horror!','Demonoid',103071,1.6153,4.8,'HBEjItlZlzU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8187,_binary '\0','/lIqkuG6gvNwqkgoyMl6lTt8H8WI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082259',7,2127,'es','Deprisa, deprisa','Angela is a young waitress who turns her back on society when she meets and falls in love with Pablo, a reckless criminal delinquent. Along with Pablo’s gang of car thieves, the pair embark on a drug and disco-fueled robbery spree as they hurtle toward oblivion.','/93aeKG6qQ2feWX2lAZcjUATYpwc.jpg','1981-03-25',99,'Released',NULL,'Faster, Faster',47211,2.7362,6.419,'9evKFOJW6s4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8188,_binary '\0','/1r3qQd5OxIf7jStKOYCcISjnh5P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082263',5,1560,'en','The Devil and Max Devlin','When Max dies in an accident, he goes straight to Hell. But the Devil Barney makes him an offer: if he manages to get three innocent youths to sell him their souls in the next two months, he may stay on Earth. Max accepts, and returns to Earth, equipped with special powers. However, his task is harder than expected, especially when seven year old Tobi demands that he marry his mother.','/b5XOONi82ThL4r5K20BKsWIhmi6.jpg','1981-03-06',96,'Released','A new high in being lowdown.','The Devil and Max Devlin',40866,1.9525,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8189,_binary '\0','/elG982NKWQDhAdJ7KO5i3mBsbtW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082269',7.1,15479,'fr','Diva','Jules, a young Parisian postman, secretly records a concert performance given by the opera singer Cynthia Hawkins, whom he idolises. The following day, Jules runs into a woman who is being pursued by armed thugs. Before she is killed, the woman slips an audio cassette into his mail bag...','/x5fOCdfv0lRdeI71qLFdNEKWDsc.jpg','1981-03-11',117,'Released','Her voice was his calling.','Diva',4485,4.2997,6.719,'6PDM-i7pzeI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8190,_binary '\0','/yhLtni4eZfPQawtRpqdvLFfKcBB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082272',6.1,1732,'fr','Docteur Jekyll et les Femmes','In 19th century London, a sex maniac sneaks into the engagement party of Dr. Henry Jekyll and Miss Fanny Osbourne, turning the event into a nightmarish whirlpool of murder and debauchery.','/yXk7H4DzWItDdbFimfbZsdNbNZ2.jpg','1981-06-17',92,'Released','Evil runs rampant against the laws of human restraint!','The Strange Case of Dr. Jekyll and Miss Osbourne',64534,1.9966,5.48,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8191,_binary '\0','/8yrymDMaJm5jCuQpypyyfAqdDJ1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082275',6.9,1522,'fr','Documenteur','After separating from the father of her son, a young French woman tries to find lodging and a fresh start in L.A. for herself and her son.','/hmfyf1qlkSigmiJf3c7Wu0528vt.jpg','1982-01-20',65,'Released',NULL,'Documenteur',157160,1.9976,6.6,'LW8aKWTsCW4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8192,_binary '\0','/1x3jqGIqHuQdAUySTbyjWpw2lmt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082279',4.9,2818,'en','The Dorm That Dripped Blood','A crazed killer stalks college students who gave up their vacation to clean a deserted dormitory.','/zzZCWxroewVrcKPtz6Xi1x9SinU.jpg','1982-04-02',88,'Released','When the kidding stops… the killing starts!','The Dorm That Dripped Blood',54132,1.9302,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8193,_binary '\0','/wbNKvMdPgOjrsydymIXxHLqIlOZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082288',6.6,20920,'en','Dragonslayer','A sorcerer and his apprentice are on a mission to kill an evil dragon to save the King’s daughter from being sacrificed according to a pact that the King himself made with the dragon to protect his kingdom.','/92VXAEwbjebYqTeUa7uX5bBtDuD.jpg','1981-06-26',108,'Released','In the Dark Ages, Magic was a weapon. Love was a mystery. Adventure was everywhere...And Dragons were real.','Dragonslayer',848,4.4061,6.6,'vWVJr7JbJZc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8194,_binary '\0','/ysCpbgA1zxOmkb1IWKzwhTxDxk3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082307',6.5,28284,'it','...E tu vivrai nel terrore! L\'aldilà','New Yorker Liza Merril inherits an old hotel in Louisiana and invests her savings to reopen the place, unaware that the hotel houses the body of a dead painter murdered decades earlier, and that the location is about to become a gateway to Hell.','/kMSZHq9VYQV1FCbM8nz2zrZShzx.jpg','1981-04-22',88,'Released','Beyond death...Beyond Evil...Beyond the dreaded gates of hell.','The Beyond',19204,5.2926,6.9,'9asxICiFPlY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8195,_binary '\0','/jSOn1dwIo70ltHjgJnn5wL6TTWZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082309',6.6,1240,'fr','Eaux profondes','On the island of Jersey, off the French coast, Mélanie, a beautiful woman gifted with a captivating personality, enjoys having unimportant love affairs that her husband Victor, a perfumer older than her, seems to endure with total indifference.','/sDGmUshiPrQw7VyQobLVeQjdsO5.jpg','1981-12-16',95,'Released',NULL,'Deep Water',77146,1.2406,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8196,_binary '\0','/46aNLeBnnhTWeyPC1FNq9msQgsP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082314',7.5,4867,'hi','एक दूजे के लिए','A love story between a Tamil man a North Indian woman, who are neighbours in Goa. They come from totally different backgrounds and can hardly speak the other\'s language. Their parents despise each other and they have regular skirmishes. When they admit their love, there is chaos in their homes, and their parents reject the idea.','/qEh6ihTizXYc8QPcPSjEFi6Izty.jpg','1981-06-04',163,'Released',NULL,'Ek Duuje Ke Liye',161792,1.3365,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8197,_binary '\0','/7qoRAL3ceJ5LH0pZ0KxkqkC0JMW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082317',8.2,2323,'pt','Eles Não Usam Black-Tie','Otavio is an idealistic union leader trying to organize workers at a factory to resist the company\'s exploitative practices. His son, Tião, one of the employees, is more of a realist and doesn\'t want to risk losing his job by striking. This clash of perspectives puts the father and son at odds. Fortunately, Tião\'s mother, Romana, is on hand to act as a moderator between the two opinionated men.','/z45EcE3hthpvGh5jZ7YT7VVJz0K.jpg','1981-09-28',122,'Released','The class struggle is, above all, familiar.','They Don\'t Wear Black Tie',203158,1.9222,8.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8198,_binary '\0','/ihReuNraXGoV7nmDQkkX0m8hTwf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082328',5.9,1952,'pt','Encarnação do Demônio','Released from the Mental Health Wing of São Paulo State Penitentiary after forty years, the sadistic undertaker Zé do Caixão is back on the streets, haunted by ghostly visions and spirits of past victims but still set upon the goal that sent him to prison in the first place: finding a woman who can give him the perfect child.','/nWn21LVME0BePF6aUnHb9Nsr3DR.jpg','2008-08-08',94,'Released','The return of the master of horror','Embodiment of Evil',23508,1.7946,5.326,'k6uTzFKsDqk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8199,_binary '\0','/4uqroGxERT4PJKGNwzQLkvK4uF4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082329',4.9,10815,'en','Endless Love','As their romance unfolds, Jade and David\'s growing love for one another becomes the scorn of Jade\'s father. However, when Jade\'s grades begin to drop, her father forbids the young couple from seeing each other for 30 days. Driven insane with frustration and desire, David attempts to reverse the decision, with catastrophic results.','/eAU5kEn3n2PROao46iqs0w57Tqr.jpg','1981-07-17',116,'Released','She is 15. He is 17. The love every parent fears.','Endless Love',19114,7.198,5.668,'33msTt1jAu8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8200,_binary '\0','/a9otxDx07KcoOSHbiypoUsqgu8M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082332',5.3,6326,'en','Enter the Ninja','A newly trained ninja warrior journeys to the Philippines, where he must defend his former war comrade\'s property against a determined adversary.','/2zYvNCPRX4W0s2gNxWqpsdk2OCT.jpg','1981-07-17',100,'Released','Hired assassins ...human killing machines!','Enter the Ninja',17205,1.4755,5.5,'bSMLczgFs4Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8201,_binary '\0','/vboAWZiHNEEWdLeXGwWmVVoqU9M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082334',6.7,20673,'en','The Entity','A single mom is raped by an invisible force. Her psychiatrist believes the experience stems from childhood trauma, while she knows something supernatural is at play.','/aUm4Jn9q55OhdHVzYWAUBXNY4G7.jpg','1982-09-30',125,'Released','There is no escape from something you cannot see.','The Entity',24740,7.4157,6.85,'PkPaOvXd10o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8202,_binary '\0','/f7zZNswz2YEGd8HgKCFGPAO3Imx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082338',5.9,4887,'en','Turkey Shoot','In the near future, after an unspecified holocaust, survivors are herded into prison camps. There, they are hunted for sport by the leaders of the camp. Paul, one of the newest prisoners, is determined not to go down as quietly as the others.','/837jSfdQYvhqToMPfAGdci6zszG.jpg','1982-03-25',93,'Released','Experience The Year 2000...And Hope To Hell You Can Escape!','Turkey Shoot',39899,4.0412,5.4,'C4epmyHEzZg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8203,_binary '\0','/aXPCXYFzFzdveVVk1HjVf9fHUcn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082340',7.1,175384,'en','Escape from New York','In a world ravaged by crime, the entire island of Manhattan has been converted into a walled prison where brutal prisoners roam free. After the US president crash-lands inside, war hero Snake Plissken has 24 hours to bring him back.','/vH9llaphjAssRGi0k7e75tD40Ce.jpg','1981-05-23',99,'Released','1997. New York City is a walled, maximum security prison. Breaking out is impossible. Breaking in is insane.','Escape from New York',1103,12.4875,7.044,'10OoccK7dIw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8204,_binary '\0','/vAjEkQUCPcosuPucLFlPgNK2bfI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082342',6.6,1482,'fr','Espion, lève-toi','Sebastien Grenier, a former French spy, is working as a financial analyst in Zurich. However, his peaceful existence starts to disintegrate when he is recruited by a top French intelligence operative to discover how one of their own secret agents was found out and executed in broad daylight.','/4EYQ72FmW86PDMU6oyoaVzgp2Cl.jpg','1982-01-27',98,'Released',NULL,'Spy, Stand Up',15468,2.056,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8205,_binary '\0','/d9igQsf6YU9gWFYxlqTqlivo999.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082346',5.6,5720,'en','Evilspeak','Bullied by classmates, a pudgy military-school student fights back by computer with the devil.','/xoFmhndSAlNqPGd3nALD0cpmazx.jpg','1981-08-22',93,'Released','Remember the little kid you used to pick on? Well, he\'s a big boy now.','Evilspeak',39868,1.9443,5.3,'9EKzDMbJApI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8206,_binary '\0','/6mN7LnTejYw5OtxJIvvF0KPgvVP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082348',7.3,74829,'en','Excalibur','Arthur fulfills his fate by bringing together the Knights of the Round Table at Camelot and unifying the country. However, this flawed monarch faces greater tests ahead in pursuit of love, the Holy Grail, and his nation\'s survival.','/cTWF6zkr5mUOnheowKODIijWYcN.jpg','1981-04-10',141,'Released','Forged by a god. Foretold by a wizard. Found by a king.','Excalibur',11527,8.3469,7,'6QR6_17mn5s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8207,_binary '\0','/s0KKZu4VqQsEckGrjxo1BQVVcSL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082350',5.6,5305,'en','An Eye for an Eye','Sean Kane is forced to resign from the San Francisco Police Department\'s Narcotics Division when he goes berserk after his partner is murdered. He decides to fight alone and follows a trail of drug traffickers into unexpected high places.','/389JSntj1J7LtTjUxvKCy3JJfuj.jpg','1981-08-14',106,'Released','Kane\'s justice is revenge. Kane\'s weapon is himself.','An Eye for an Eye',42566,4.008,5.3,'pN75wRRkT4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8208,_binary '\0','/ckGyKfhdLzaUjGZfocH63jshhdx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082351',7.1,14325,'en','Eye of the Needle','Great Britain, 1944, during World War II. Relentlessly pursued by several MI5 agents, Henry Faber the Needle, a ruthless German spy in possession of vital information about D-Day, takes refuge on Storm Island, an inhospitable, sparsely inhabited island off the coast of northern Scotland.','/nDPnfXCuh280WHPk7xTfG7cDlAh.jpg','1981-07-24',108,'Released','To love a stranger is easy. To kill a lover is not.','Eye of the Needle',10863,6.0694,6.7,'BqwjTSLsjp8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8209,_binary '\0','/38VIYJXjGTtN2z5nG1fpToz801d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082352',6,3708,'en','Eyes of a Stranger','A TV newswoman catches a pervert watching her sister who cannot see, hear or speak.','/6uAQkwCIgK1LHacoHPHqWelzn8G.jpg','1981-02-11',84,'Released','\"Sorry, your party is dead...\"','Eyes of a Stranger',79649,2.6557,5.9,'7TaIVF7P3TY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8210,_binary '\0','/84hrHsxKSTY16nQl5KRMQ9GVvx2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082353',5.9,6358,'en','Eyewitness','NYC custodian Daryll Deever is a big fan of local news reporter Tony Sokolow, so he is intrigued when she shows up to cover a story at his workplace. There\'s been a murder in the office building, and Tony suspects that Daryll may have insight into the crime, a notion that he furthers to stay close to her. However, when those behind the killing begin to think that he really knows something, they target the pair to keep their secrets hidden.','/dxMbBWegmjtPfZNmw6HHJjgZkQt.jpg','1981-02-13',103,'Released','Only the best murder cases make the six o\'clock news.','Eyewitness',31679,2.4995,5.6,'TByM-VfPOYk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8211,_binary '\0','/hS2WS0PD7uUWoM5EdaUpTl61CYp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082356',7.6,1216,'sh','Бановић Страхиња','Banović Strahinja takes place during the middle ages in Serbia. While estate owner Strahinja is hunting, a Turkish bandit, Alija, attacks his castle. The Turks kill his servants and kidnap his beloved Andja. When he discovers what has happened, Strahinja gathers a together a group of scoundrels and chases the bandits.','/zVTiB2JLlY71hETWTIcx8TVxtpj.jpg','1983-03-29',105,'Released',NULL,'The Falcon',178222,1.2964,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8212,_binary '\0','/8MTk7ErYPf7huu4Caxg3GdEucMF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082361',6.6,2352,'de','Der Fan','The hero-worship that Simone has for a pop singer is built to a crescendo until she passes out when she finally sees him up-close in a crowd of fans. She is later shocked when he lets her know that he does not love her.','/igLYepYwgDtA4jqUN3LWsnRddv4.jpg','1982-06-04',92,'Released','An obsession gone mad.','The Fan',105184,1.915,6.571,'jXtuqdAb05A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8213,_binary '\0','/lQgglLMrEmotBToWUmdIcdCUwwl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082362',5.8,3343,'en','The Fan','A record store clerk is an obsessed fan of an actress of stage and screen. However, when faced with rejection, the fan strikes out in increasingly violent ways.','/uBUfrSpgQacEnjcMjpDszQTTqsL.jpg','1981-05-15',95,'Released','The final act is murder.','The Fan',74899,2.4183,5.8,'NObST_DECN8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8214,_binary '\0','/5srwZxiPJSVfLH0FAtg02yX9ReZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082367',4.7,2036,'en','Fear No Evil','Brilliant and aloof teenager Andrew is always the butt of his classmates\' jokes — but little do they know that he is actually the demon Lucifer. As the evil wells up within him, he avenges himself in acts of demonic murder and destruction. But his foe, the archangel Gabriel, has assumed the form of 18 year old student Julie.','/hIsjhPl3YkPYHpmCjyxMdyANxOB.jpg','1981-01-19',99,'Released','Alexandria High… class of \'81 - All the students are going to hell, except Andrew… he sent them there!','Fear No Evil',91817,1.9601,4.6,'ki24MmSbUBo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8215,_binary '\0','/OUsYvkuqmGuE63IE5a2QQqW426.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082370',7.2,9671,'fr','La Femme d\'à côté','Two ex-lovers wind up living next door to each other with their respective spouses. Forbidden passions ensue.','/nxBf3Y7Q9XVuKvUl0df8MW2IsQ7.jpg','1981-09-30',106,'Released','A destructive passion between desire and madness.','The Woman Next Door',12579,3.5478,7.068,'awkemUBoswM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8216,_binary '\0','/dEqZHcaj0EXAtDmQw5hkQjbSVOW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082377',5.5,26049,'en','The Final Conflict','Damien Thorn has helped rescue the world from a recession, appearing to be a benign corporate benefactor. When he then becomes U.S. Ambassador to the United Kingdom, Damien fulfills a terrifying biblical prophecy. He also faces his own potential demise as an astronomical event brings about the second coming of Christ.','/jDW2C77QNMQe6Lp2jeqAQXe2uaX.jpg','1981-03-20',108,'Released','The power of evil is no longer in the hands of a child.','The Final Conflict',10768,5.5466,5.8,'WoiZD_KxLvk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8217,_binary '\0','/qe7axCDpuDr1hBPXDYURZud17Dm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082378',4.6,5213,'en','Final Exam','In a small college in North Carolina, only a select few students are left to take mid terms. But, when a killer strikes, it could be everyone\'s final exam.','/zRSF8rruLln8VVmEqgaRKlSzTcf.jpg','1981-06-05',90,'Released','Some may pass the test… God help the rest.','Final Exam',40469,1.5453,5.1,'kzAa3XPt9rI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8218,_binary '\0','/6sXLQh9nkhz4NiQCqqYJ4sXr0oA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082379',5.2,4736,'en','The Final Terror','A group of friends head out for what is expected to be a vacation of hiking, camping and a good time, but when a backwoods mama finds them on her turf, it becomes anything but a vacation.','/nQaY8o8LtdkSDUYzeyJ1CcHhh1J.jpg','1983-05-01',82,'Released','Without knowing they have awakened an unknown force. Can anyone survive?','The Final Terror',4288,5.4595,5.1,'v-ng-vRdx7Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8219,_binary '\0','/kIJRhonhWUJr764c5S7Wu4kvwZw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082382',6.4,1768,'en','First Monday in October','For the first time in history a woman is appointed to the U.S. Supreme Court, where she becomes a friendly rival to a liberal associate.','/8a4K7e83WoCTOwje4LEhTwtOu0a.jpg','1981-08-21',98,'Released','In the Supreme Court, there are only eight of them against all of her.','First Monday in October',85058,2.4317,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8220,_binary '\0','/z7Jp7HAsY7MqXzPYzTjJnmOQk2r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082398',6.7,117609,'en','For Your Eyes Only','A British spy ship has sunk and on board was a hi-tech encryption device. James Bond is sent to find the device that holds British launching instructions before the enemy Soviets get to it first.','/xV4Nnr6DjjERlqNikqDQX8LUgua.jpg','1981-06-24',128,'Released','No one comes close to James Bond, 007.','For Your Eyes Only',699,11.2225,6.551,'27EeX86rj2g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8221,_binary '\0','/b8xkS4nTK1sAUNR3RUeQguNbcVN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082402',6.7,7891,'en','Fort Apache, the Bronx','From the sight of a police officer this movie depicts the life in New York\'s infamous South Bronx. In the center is \"Fort Apache\", as the officers call their police station, which really seems like an outpost in enemy\'s country. The story follows officer Murphy, who seems to be a tough cynic, but in truth he\'s a moralist with a sense for justice.','/8p57OvRAG5qswa5UW9O5Y6xZjAV.jpg','1981-02-06',125,'Released','No cowboys, no Indians, no cavalry to the rescue, only a cop.','Fort Apache, the Bronx',23668,3.3983,6.511,'GqTKWhfgPq0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8222,_binary '\0','/2J2E0KsJbJjkGw06nLDkWBXII4F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082404',7,2169,'en','Four Friends','A young immigrant comes to America in the 60s and is caught up in the counterculture movement which tests his bonds of friendship and love.','/4qWB2CtUOOvmlBNc0KTZQno0Edj.jpg','1981-12-11',115,'Released','All the boys love Georgia... and Georgia loves all the boys!','Four Friends',70971,1.86,6.8,'F-bAb0Q3TNA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8223,_binary '\0','/EQoUAJltkAqWxNGdqSxgHYRuni.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082405',6.8,8227,'en','The Four Seasons','Three middle-aged wealthy couples take vacations together in Spring, Summer, Autumn and Winter. Along the way we are treated to mid-life, marital, parental and other crises.','/bNLuiBVpRYP28VCyyVEhxYBGhyl.jpg','1981-05-22',107,'Released','Here\'s to our friends... and the strength to put up with them.','The Four Seasons',25113,2.8938,6.3,'l-LdyHyH4MA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8224,_binary '\0','/lNmIAX1IuPIEPMHhLBEm4wmhYX0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082406',7.2,111729,'en','The Fox and the Hound','When a feisty little fox named Tod is adopted into a farm family, he quickly becomes friends with a fun and adorable hound puppy named Copper. Life is full of hilarious adventures until Copper is expected to take on his role as a hunting dog -- and the object of his search is his best friend!','/bbPEYD1z1DN13UJMr9sjhMh8DJx.jpg','1981-07-10',82,'Released','A story of two friends who didn\'t know they were supposed to be enemies.','The Fox and the Hound',10948,11.0815,7.176,'LhV6BBvt8Vs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8225,_binary '\0','/7MIgvo5HPBxJLO6dWliaywhPDVy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082407',6.7,2067,'it','Fracchia la belva umana','The world\'s greatest criminal and the world greatest loser share the same face... now they\'ll share the same life!','/uNgg1a3K4NlqKFSi33TbfMbXU21.jpg','1981-12-22',99,'Released',NULL,'Fracchia The Human Beast',41610,1.6045,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8226,_binary '\0','/fFut8u46jemrFjIQNfi1JmsyBGL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082410',2.1,1441,'en','Frankenstein Island','Four balloonists and their dog are stranded on a remote island with a woman believed to be a descendant of Frankenstein, who is conducting experiments on lost sailors.','/cyQ9LrACK0ynI73ZyvW1XVEAIut.jpg','1981-11-27',97,'Released','The power is 7,000,000 volts--it\'s alive!','Frankenstein Island',3165,1.3382,3.5,'aaWrLKN3pSI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8227,_binary '\0','/tz5X61rJyhhKEYbW35HdntNjcvv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082416',6.9,16954,'en','The French Lieutenant\'s Woman','In this story-within-a-story, Anna is an actress starring opposite Mike in a period piece about the forbidden love between their respective characters, Sarah and Charles. Both actors are involved in serious relationships, but the passionate nature of the script leads to an off-camera love affair as well. While attempting to maintain their composure and professionalism, Anna and Mike struggle to come to terms with their infidelity.','/zqpeqPjziAH3VXMqwQ0Ds3Ffx9b.jpg','1981-08-28',124,'Released','She was lost from the moment she saw him.','The French Lieutenant\'s Woman',12537,5.4179,6.47,'y4vXZPATrOA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8228,_binary '\0','/80emEEa0svrT0YJDZLgLUu85ttp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082418',6.1,88781,'en','Friday the 13th Part 2','Five years after the horrible bloodbath at Camp Crystal Lake, new counselors roam the area, not sensing the ominous lurking presence that proves that the grisly legend is real.','/92rGctBMTv4uaSlIBVnhz01kRWL.jpg','1981-05-01',86,'Released','The body count continues...','Friday the 13th Part 2',9725,9.401,6.193,'3mNnJuOoI80','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8229,_binary '\0','/5uJCt4iaTnb8V8HuM9UG5CRWHpk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082422',5.3,2299,'fr','Les Fruits de la passion','A girl named O loves a rich, and much older man. She is subjected to a variety of humiliating experiences to prove her unconditional obedience to him in a Chinese brothel. A poor boy sees her and falls in love with her. To get the money needed to sleep with her, he takes part in rebellious acts.','/6vikaRo0SoRz7ieRnT4VoS9rC7b.jpg','1981-06-03',79,'Released','The story of \"O\" continues in the Orient.','Fruits of Passion',64252,3.5012,5.314,'oPUXfwCcPos','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8230,_binary '\0','/cNGckbYGNs03fUoDHv6aLZGPMpH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082425',4.8,1923,'en','Full Moon High','After a trip to Romania, popular high school quarterback Tony Walker becomes a werewolf, and struggles to come to terms with his hirsute situation.','/i81COenmVVnkfyOC3JOR7lXO1jm.jpg','1981-08-04',95,'Released','He\'s today\'s teenage werewolf… only the rules have changed!','Full Moon High',107430,2.1815,4.4,'MLdjBUZen40','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8231,_binary '\0','/uDIZFlKa3h9ufzxpGXerCbIgmLc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082427',5.9,18667,'en','The Funhouse','Rebellious teen Amy defies her parents by going to a trashy carnival that has pulled into town. In tow are her boyfriend, Buzz, and their friends Liz and Richie. Thinking it would be fun to spend the night in the campy \"Funhouse\" horror ride, the teens witness a murder by a deformed worker wearing a mask. Locked in, Amy and her friends must evade the murderous carnival workers and escape before it leaves town the next day.','/9eFgNrkTbXk1TBPuzxdOEjutNoC.jpg','1981-03-13',95,'Released','Pay to get in. Pray to get out!','The Funhouse',13555,3.1959,5.9,'teb0r_wdLyc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8232,_binary '\0','/ejcK06TXgfZFafpv6g5q70sQ6D6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082431',5,10762,'en','Galaxy of Terror','As a lone spaceship proceeds on its long voyage across space, the crew are surprised to encounter a strange pyramid form. Surprise turns to horror as one by one, they discover that their darkest nightmares are all starting to become real. The pyramid has to be behind it all somehow, but how can they save themselves from its influence?','/429ot4ktpg6q7JR2ThaX9kthfLb.jpg','1981-10-01',81,'Released','ALIEN was the beginning… Hell Has Just Been Relocated!','Galaxy of Terror',28893,4.6539,5.3,'IQIoOjhdW0g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8233,_binary '\0','/cQtEnazTk07zcfcf2MYLCiPRfY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082432',7.4,45059,'en','Gallipoli','Two Australian sprinters face the brutal realities of war when they are sent to fight in the Gallipoli campaign in the Ottoman Empire during World War I.','/un7VCqTmjrq3u75mQ204a8tofD4.jpg','1981-08-13',112,'Released','From a place you never heard of...a story you\'ll never forget.','Gallipoli',11646,3.5255,7,'CT1JHKpSHXA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8234,_binary '\0','/fTWPF5adhbRaflQLEygH4IU15Wv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082436',7.6,6567,'fr','Garde à vue','Martinaud, an illustrious notary suspected of being the perpetrator of two horrendous crimes, voluntarily agrees to be questioned by Inspector Gallien on New Year\'s Eve. What initially is a routine procedure, soon becomes a harsh interrogation that seems to confirm the initial suspicions.','/lKB8bOpJhTTxfiK5OWjilZeZ0Kc.jpg','1981-09-23',84,'Released',NULL,'The Inquisitor',5062,1.8598,7.521,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8235,_binary '\0','/w4XRI9Wwiennp05Oz2yFoDapZGQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082449',6.3,11218,'en','Ghost Story','Four successful elderly gentlemen, members of the Chowder Society, share a gruesome, 50-year-old secret. When one of Edward Wanderley\'s twin sons dies in a bizarre accident, the group begins to see a pattern of frightening events developing.','/awnN2k2726xqzqsmd3YcSe6lSj0.jpg','1981-12-18',110,'Released','The Time Has Come to Tell the Tale','Ghost Story',24634,4.1753,6.033,'p2UlwI-7etc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8236,_binary '\0','/w8J5FSQzsiCODmaupfEq4oCuXSV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082464',6.8,1458,'en','Goodbye Pork Pie','Gerry hires a car in Kaitaia with a stolen licence and travels to Invercargill with John, whose wife has just left him. The ultimate New Zealand road trip adventure.','/17AsRf31gx9d2SJMBlFrE13pF1o.jpg','1981-02-05',105,'Released',NULL,'Goodbye Pork Pie',16124,1.4202,6.7,'qDEH7wLQD64','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8237,_binary '\0','/uljOSSLD1HomW4pmMNYDhp66gxS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082467',4.8,6050,'en','Graduation Day','After the death of a high school track star during a race, a mysterious killer in a fencing mask begins murdering her friends and teachers.','/bbNtkM0oFTCnFfblOzeEuaDUaZB.jpg','1981-05-01',96,'Released','The Class of ‘81 is running out of time!','Graduation Day',27420,1.8694,5.2,'ud-uVrKYTOs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8238,_binary '\0','/p5qPj9klS3IKXBbnWurZYlmSpHx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082474',7.1,18591,'en','The Great Muppet Caper','Kermit and Fozzie are newspaper reporters sent to London to interview Lady Holiday, a wealthy fashion designer whose priceless diamond necklace is stolen. Kermit meets and falls in love with her secretary, Miss Piggy. The jewel thieves strike again, and this time frame Miss Piggy. It\'s up to Kermit and the rest of the Muppets to bring the real culprits to justice.','/lnJc4B4njeyNHWqG00ozuUIhtu5.jpg','1981-06-26',97,'Released','The Muppets... Scotland Yard... jewel thieves... lead to high adventure in London.','The Great Muppet Caper',14900,4.3305,6.943,'aEQw79tKm6I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8239,_binary '\0','/bqp2A3fzk6eEVYIO2dNtaPLIJkn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082476',5.5,1248,'en','Green Ice','A down on his luck engineer gets involved in an adventure with a mysterious woman and an emerald magnate.','/9mOmpiaBo0DUWyzqY2YeALVIXMb.jpg','1981-05-21',116,'Released','He wanted adventure... She craved revenge... Emeralds held the answer.','Green Ice',107028,10.1164,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8240,_binary '\0','/fEiOrpMvC4IXVWhZPfJd53sclUJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082477',7.1,10168,'en','Gregory\'s Girl','A teenager falls hard for the female soccer player who has replaced him on the team and attempts to pursue her.','/tW12On2JtLeOQPaWAs3PMmsG08o.jpg','1980-11-29',91,'Released','This has to be the match of the day...','Gregory\'s Girl',21764,2.3631,6.789,'XK5aZQ9lbvE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8241,_binary '\0','/4TERVFInENnpSW1pJcjfdzKjMYW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082479',5.3,7922,'it','Antropophagus','Tourists take a boat to a remote island, where they find that most of the people have disappeared, and something is stalking them. They find a hidden room in the big mansion on a hill, and an ancient diary, which gives them clues to the source of the terror.','/k3y6P2tlbx8Cjr2Bmyqs7AFh4tW.jpg','1980-08-07',92,'Released','It\'s not fear that tears you apart...it\'s him!','Anthropophagous',5424,2.9417,5.4,'46-Yl0fwlh8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8242,_binary '\0','/5l3Xb2WQR0nXiVhbj5rAv0z4xsZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082484',7.3,26754,'fr','La Guerre du feu','In the prehistoric world, a Cro-Magnon tribe depends on an ever-burning source of fire, which eventually extinguishes. Lacking the knowledge to start a new fire, the tribe sends three warriors on a quest for more. With the tribe\'s future at stake, the warriors make their way across a treacherous landscape full of hostile tribes and monstrous beasts. On their journey, they encounter Ika, a woman who has the knowledge they seek.','/tyzW1M00xfHKNtmTlT6wJ3F4pNr.jpg','1981-12-16',100,'Released','A Science Fantasy Adventure','Quest for Fire',62204,7.532,7,'2pcGGKtPpSE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8243,_binary '\0','/axAxuaCRFg7ZH74pniX5uuCSVsz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082486',6.4,1531,'da','Gummi-Tarzan','Ivan is a very lonely 8 year boy who is bullied almost every day in school. Even his father taunts him because Ivan litteraly is a weakling (That should explain the title Rubber Tarzan). As a result of this Ivan spends a lot of his time on daydreaming until he meets a kind of kindred spirit - the friendly and lonely crane driver Ole.','/gzaUxIpMWUGepZjSumZ3QHylnD7.jpg','1981-10-15',89,'Released',NULL,'Rubber Tarzan',21279,2.3798,6.375,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8244,_binary '\0','/srnxykgaJZ8dREAO2FzNCz6MI3J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082490',5.8,4879,'sv','Göta Kanal eller Vem drog ur proppen?','To secure an order for 1 000 cabin cruisers from an Arab prince, two companies have to compete by racing each other by canal from Stockholm to Gothenburg. A small family owned company on the brink of bankruptcy is pitted against a much larger competitor and both resort to dirty tricks in order to reach the goal line first.','/s0IdVBOA3eqdSPtDyq81UP1H8lm.jpg','1981-12-18',99,'Released',NULL,'Who Pulled the Plug?',22435,1.5992,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8245,_binary '\0','/lDXQNRmQKzJGdEJSDxWrjIZb7gB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082495',6.5,113430,'en','Halloween II','After failing to kill stubborn survivor Laurie and taking a bullet or six from former psychiatrist Dr. Sam Loomis, Michael Myers has followed Laurie to the Haddonfield Memorial Hospital, where she\'s been admitted for Myers\' attempt on her life. The institution proves to be particularly suited to serial killers, however, as Myers cuts, stabs and slashes his way through hospital staff to reach his favorite victim.','/3nX5HHGgOKaVMxXwMLT9DHO1Ne6.jpg','1981-10-30',92,'Released','More of the night he came home.','Halloween II',11281,9.3863,6.6,'W34hF0rsj94','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8246,_binary '\0','/25ambHMixc35CVBZlibnfbMABsF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082497',5.5,7606,'en','The Hand','Jon Lansdale is a comic book artist who loses his right hand in a car accident. The hand was not found at the scene of the accident, but it soon returns by itself to follow Jon around, and murder those who anger him.','/zUSAV9rObBlJfYIK9y4o88hmmdd.jpg','1981-04-24',104,'Released','It lives. It crawls. And suddenly, it kills.','The Hand',42149,3.9212,5.83,'QrhHW314l2M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8247,_binary '\0','/roV5ssle7MSL9jpek9f88zNeK8i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082498',6,12675,'en','Happy Birthday to Me','Virginia is proud that she belongs to a clique. The best students at a private school. But before her 18th birthday, a gruesome set of murders take place and her friends are the ones who are falling prey. Could it be her? She suffers from blackouts due to a freak accident one year earlier. We soon learn the truth behind her accident and what is going on.','/8s8Z58Xah3VSe4kfKZFTUJTT33g.jpg','1981-05-15',110,'Released','Six of the most bizarre murders you will ever see.','Happy Birthday to Me',37936,4.5367,5.977,'1va6tAD7Uz4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8248,_binary '\0','/u3GuVAdzlaX0PCbQlywGkVknVdy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082507',4.3,1844,'en','Heartbeeps','Two domestic robots fall in love and run off together.','/zxK1jyN8apEUyYerMLStaHIM2z8.jpg','1981-12-18',78,'Released','Meet a modern nuclear family unlike any other.','Heartbeeps',73247,1.4951,4.534,'GrGBmi3BVfo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8249,_binary '\0','/cw6g3LTu9DrMezcVkVYyfKI02J7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082508',7.2,1515,'en','Heartland','Widowed Elinor Randall and her young daughter Jerrine arrive in a barren stretch of Wyoming in 1910 after Elinor\'s application for work as a housekeeper is accepted by Clyde Stewart, a rancher. The work is back-breaking and the isolation is brutal, particularly as winter arrives. Elinor begins to think about homesteading her own property near Stewart\'s ranch, but Stewart tries to dissuade her with explanations about the killing conditions and poor rewards, especially for a woman with no man to help her ranch. Although their temperaments are different and little affection exists, Elinor and Stewart agree to marry and combine homesteads. What lies ahead is the severest test of all.','/cNLBqiPJE5jpo6PPHKuTFDFfxtj.jpg','1981-08-23',96,'Released','Heartland is about roots and origins. Heartland is about love and survival.','Heartland',49427,1.739,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8250,_binary '\0','/obApq0Prmf740t0b3QoxoSxjYW1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082509',6.6,42205,'en','Heavy Metal','The embodiment of ultimate evil, a glowing orb terrorizes a young girl with bizarre stories of dark fantasy, eroticism and horror.','/atUtWrDlLzT1yeVK2EoYtvbS963.jpg','1981-08-07',90,'Released','A step beyond science fiction.','Heavy Metal',11827,5.0641,6.5,'-Fvzpl5wTPo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8251,_binary '\0','/k3LHANNXnGoXlgCJwSgDCNbpOeh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082511',5.6,9981,'en','Hell Night','As an initiation rite into Alpha Sigma Rho fraternity, four pledges must spend a night in Garth Manor, twelve years to the day after the previous resident murdered his entire family.','/2IqqzSQmZFAon2C1lQZeZCUUx8K.jpg','1981-08-28',101,'Released','Scream and you\'re dead!','Hell Night',28377,3.0628,5.5,'jrzWXF5SUm8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8252,_binary '\0','/7JT8uvw4FlDVEUwWQpFIgw2yVRN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082516',5.6,1411,'en','High Risk','Four American friends, badly needing money, decide to make a commando-like raid into a South American drug lord\'s compound.','/hWRFdEQiUeKNovLzjhzEcO6JDDN.jpg','1981-05-01',94,'Released','Getting in was easy... getting out was war!!!','High Risk',47201,2.0487,5.9,'-z90i3K9qT8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8253,_binary '\0','/huW5dZywslw6muqmpDtMl6Ywl3m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082517',6.8,59595,'en','History of the World: Part I','An uproarious version of history that proves nothing is sacred – not even the Roman Empire, the French Revolution and the Spanish Inquisition.','/1bMaEfI76yrGjCSDquCippAFIDI.jpg','1981-06-12',92,'Released','Ten million years in the making. The truth, the whole truth, and everything, but the truth!','History of the World: Part I',10156,3.1226,6.746,'1TASJymwQeo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8254,_binary '\0','/ifOhFPaYm5qYib3cCQfYDAoa6zZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082525',5.2,1353,'en','Honky Tonk Freeway','Ticlaw, a small town in Florida, has only one attraction: a safari park. The government constructs a freeway that passes near Ticlaw, but decides not to put an exit into the town. The people of Ticlaw, leaded by its Mayor, will do anything in order to convince the governor to alter the project.','/acnf2aGOQt5nAixcS2oA8OixoHe.jpg','1981-08-21',107,'Released','Something funny is happening on this freeway.','Honky Tonk Freeway',47871,2.2419,5.357,'9936o8FKoXQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8255,_binary '\0','/gCaWMc8uFZHkqfYXAbWwk9qDl7a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082527',5,4041,'en','Hospital Massacre','When Susan was a little girl, she rejected the Valentine of a lovestruck classmate. Decades later, she’s come to the hospital for a routine medical examination, and finds herself trapped in a bizarre nightmare, made all the worse as her vengeful childhood valentine, disguised among the hospital staff, begins murdering everyone in his path as a means of proving his undying ‘romantic’ obsession…','/1ScSFs8uJA42eI5acIEo8n7YaDE.jpg','1981-10-16',89,'Released','Bad Medicine.','Hospital Massacre',63590,2.0425,5.2,'CvQhyQ1Aqxo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8256,_binary '\0','/lKCh4SYfFq8RZ5RCr7OViJlm1WX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082528',5.7,2206,'he','אסקימו לימון 3: שפשוף נעים','Further adventures of Bobby, Benji, and Huey in their pursuit of sex in the 50\'s. While preparing for their final exams, they try to work out if it\'s better to be going steady with one girl, and if changing girlfriends all the time leads to too many complications. This leads to frustrations with girls who wont go all the way, and problems with girls will go all the way with anyone!','/t8VUFFbq68NyoLTuWI9Lj9D7lLK.jpg','1981-04-07',90,'Released','The Lemon Popsicle boys are at it again!','Hot Bubblegum',10582,3.9114,5.855,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8257,_binary '\0','/mv4fsd6dzuHynHkOtYgfOOYEBVy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082533',6.5,45311,'en','The Howling','After a bizarre and near fatal encounter with a serial killer, a newswoman is sent to a rehabilitation center whose inhabitants may not be what they seem.','/nRTonikdpMUYr3y3RXESLBhRUov.jpg','1981-01-21',91,'Released','Imagine your worst fear a reality.','The Howling',11298,6.6272,6.6,'yI7qGLXZQJI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8258,_binary '\0','/cxrwd2c2iecO34U13nQiqdnEZPA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082537',4.9,2445,'en','Humongous','The monstrous offspring of a violent crime grows up in seclusion on a remote island, where a boatful of hapless teens have shipwrecked, unaware of what\'s lurking in the woods.','/i5JtRqH6RZI1Hn1v0mU9DWKVW6G.jpg','1982-06-11',94,'Released','It\'s loose... It\'s angry... And it\'s getting hungry!','Humongous',30670,1.4794,4.926,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8259,_binary '\0','/agt0S1wOcioTiApLzOY8N5Ytyqa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082539',6.4,1261,'fr','Hôtel des Amériques','Helene, a pill-addicted anesthesiologist, is mourning the death of her boyfriend when, through a car accident she causes, she chances to meet the lethargic Gilles, a young man who lives for free at his mother\'s hotel. Gilles pursues Helene romantically, and she eventually softens up. Gilles, however, is also devoted to Bernard, a petty crook who revels in mugging gay men. All three struggle with relationships that seem to be going nowhere.','/uJMKIDfHolHXSEy3Deoa8nk5C7z.jpg','1981-12-02',95,'Released',NULL,'Hotel America',76821,2.6879,6.169,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8260,_binary '\0','/3SUklFJRlii2DA4KROL3hyfNbjJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082558',5.5,5567,'en','The Incredible Shrinking Woman','After being exposed to a bizarre mixture of household chemicals, Pat Kramer begins to shrink. This baffles scientists, makes parenting difficult, warms the hearts of Americans, and captures the attention of a group of people who want to take over the world. This evil group plots to kidnap Pat and perform experiments on her so that they can eventually shrink everyone.','/cyVWzXAGbj5b76k8XYOB4mZzUMn.jpg','1981-01-30',88,'Released','Lily Tomlin in an epic comedy (Give or take an inch)','The Incredible Shrinking Woman',12472,2.8055,5.4,'YeOsjN5cZWo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8261,_binary '\0','/bxjjXy3hCMscW3CO019JaLvzjk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082559',4.8,6663,'it','Virus','A rat causes a chemical leak at a Papua New Guinea research facility, leading a group of eco-terrorists to demand the closure of all facilities. When a team of Interpol commandos are enlisted to eliminate the terrorists, they find themselves embroiled in a zombie outbreak.','/wzpwd2GrLLJot4O1KVvvVK5rtLy.jpg','1980-11-17',101,'Released','When the Creeping Dead Devour the Living Flesh!','Night of the Zombies',21380,1.9138,5.4,'OnuHk2Rgtf4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8262,_binary '\0','/2b0m5uZY7ZFheQwg7qPuWks1Lz0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082562',6.9,5188,'it','Innamorato pazzo','Cristina is a rich, spoiled princess visiting Rome with her royal parents. The mission of their visit is to marry her off to a super-wealthy corporate type and thereby start to turn around the losses their small kingdom is experiencing in its casino business. These less-than-noble intentions get derailed when Barnaba, a zany bus driver enters their lives and falls madly in love with the gorgeous Cristina. He is nuts enough to succeed in this romantic chase after royalty, as love seems to fuel his determination to rid Cristina of her elitism and to make her see his own irrepressible attractions.','/9Mo9IKxv7XOMJrdVpWY0iZqPMhe.jpg','1981-12-18',100,'Released',NULL,'Madly in Love',11441,2.6083,6.68,'nm-0XQVtBqU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8263,_binary '\0','/dqHOhehf6Nr4aCcGF4Sae5196EC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082592',6,8003,'en','Just Before Dawn','In the Oregon mountains, a pair of hunters encounter a machete-wielding killer in an abandoned church. Meanwhile, five campers arrive to examine some property one of them has inherited but are warned by the forest ranger not to venture forth. Soon after they set up camp, they begin hearing strange noises, encounter a mysterious singing girl and start disappearing one by one.','/sHzea0SEqS0sAm9qxwIciXuXnTZ.jpg','1981-10-14',90,'Released','Will Anyone Survive Those Hours Just Before Dawn?','Just Before Dawn',39982,4.8091,6,'iiC-boBcZQY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8264,_binary '\0','/cnx5NSH9quhGHVJ6kBon9WwKw0Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082594',6.7,1947,'hi','कालिया','Kaalia - A name that spells terror in the minds of people and the police, but Kaalia was not always like this. Years ago he was a mere simpleton. Living simply in a shanty chawl with his elder brother, Shyamlal, Bhabhi (Sister- in-law), whom he adored and their daughter Munni. Apart from them there is no one else in Kallu\'s little world until one day, an enemy in the guise of Shahani Seth appears. Shahani shatters the happiness in Kallu\'s life. That same day the young Kallu dies, and the dreaded Kaalia is born. Kaalia\'s main motive in life becomes wealth, and to destroy Shahani. This path of violence leads Kaalia to inspector Raghubir Singh\'s jail. Outside of jail, Shahani starts reclaiming his power, and inside jail, Kaalia clashes with Raghubir Singh.','/i8zLyTb3CuGwpVDj6irbiWBFsgN.jpg','1981-12-25',175,'Released',NULL,'Kaalia',121125,1.0012,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8265,_binary '\0','/pbrP6SqBE4Za3rfC0eZWVRbdpeU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082602',7.2,1249,'ru','Карнавал','A young Russian girl is in love with show business and wants to leave her small town for Moscow and make it big in the big city. She encounters her long missing, remarried father and gets a boy friend who uses her and then leaves her.','/14ypslXrZws6f0CcHbSjJBfnWwu.jpg','1981-11-08',151,'Released',NULL,'Carnival',37174,1.1337,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8266,_binary '\0','/kmZI8YxyYC0XDSEfehARUnCxAss.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082622',6.3,6190,'en','Knightriders','A medieval reenactment troupe struggles to maintain its family-like dynamic amid pressure from local authorities, interest from talent agents, and their so-called king\'s delusions of grandeur.','/lawtQYZvwrjHMNkvrKWAF93tIoK.jpg','1981-04-10',147,'Released','The Games... The Romance... The Spirit... Camelot is a state of mind.','Knightriders',22167,3.7978,6.162,'5RB3DoJRoYc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8267,_binary '\0','/oq2PTdIPPxfuPhgu8XOsZLeKWIU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082633',7.2,2051,'da','Kundskabens træ','As a group of Danish children pass into adolescence, gradually the most popular girl becomes an outcast, for trivial reasons that she never understands.','/6qD6Apcx7h2EescAIgQP1CljiN0.jpg','1981-11-13',110,'Released',NULL,'Tree of Knowledge',16029,1.0734,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8268,_binary '\0','/mV6gplI7dCkZnSJbKvsaKMBDxMb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082639',6.7,3537,'en','Ladies and Gentlemen, the Fabulous Stains','Corrine Burns retreats far into plans for her band, The Fabulous Stains, after her mother\'s death.','/tEFBKyD22O1rq9a7mTZCJjrzc9u.jpg','1982-10-01',87,'Released','Do you wanna be a professional?','Ladies and Gentlemen, the Fabulous Stains',27016,2.2792,6.35,'MABzHD6ip4o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8269,_binary '\0','/7ufdUZj0HLaHoMp96eolLo6oDmH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082640',5.2,3815,'en','Lady Chatterley\'s Lover','After a crippling injury leaves her husband impotent, Lady Chatterly is torn between her love for her husband and her physical desires. With her husband\'s consent, she seeks out other means of fulfilling her needs.','/3H58M1rUGO9AOve8GR0svRGmjau.jpg','1981-06-29',104,'Released','The most notorious novel of the century.','Lady Chatterley\'s Lover',35685,4.5551,5.421,'1CsgoDjpAV8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8270,_binary '\0','/z7rF8JTiR5EAWA3e99PuBV5HUQb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082642',4.5,1330,'en','The Last Chase','Twenty years after the American people have been told the oil has run out and disease has scared them into complacency, the United States has become a fascist state. One man, former race car driver Franklyn Hart, now a puppet spokesman for public transportation, rebuilds his race car and sets off to California from Boston where people have returned to living life like they were twenty years prior.','/3K7uld44ek6TQEHXkzHUz5xI9Jv.jpg','1981-04-01',101,'Released','The oil finally ran out... and somewhere in the future, the chase has begun.','The Last Chase',35453,1.6134,3.9,'tnuVxQG6e9Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8271,_binary '\0','/1IgviiTU97WCweA3mP2CtWd8DFF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082644',7,2712,'hi','Laawaris','Left in the care of an alcoholic Gangu Ganpat, young Heera, who named himself after a stray dog, wrestles with life in his young age. Years later, now a young man , he works for Mahendar Singh and is in love with Mohini, who will not have anything to do with him due to his lack of ancestry. Heera is now determined to find out who his parents are, and the only one who can help him is the elusive, alcohol-induced and incoherent Gangu Ganpat.','/pXe5nIyi5hJhSvjb7CVLVl3KL4O.jpg','1981-05-22',203,'Released',NULL,'Laawaris',71301,1.0273,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8272,_binary '\0','/eODsuOFr7pyecZ5iKHmMDX3yQmY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082648',5,2822,'en','The Legend of the Lone Ranger','When the young Texas Ranger, John Reid, is the sole survivor of an ambush arranged by the militaristic outlaw leader, Butch Cavendich, he is rescued by an old childhood Comanche friend, Tonto. When he recovers from his wounds, he dedicates his life to fighting the evil that Cavendich represents. To this end, John Reid becomes the great masked western hero, The Lone Ranger. With the help of Tonto, the pair go to rescue President Grant when Cavendich takes him hostage.','/6AgJFQsZm3JHry8ek13X0xKGWt6.jpg','1981-08-06',98,'Released','The untold story of the man behind the mask, and the legend behind the man.','The Legend of the Lone Ranger',38665,3.102,4.9,'PSwWziJYoss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8273,_binary '\0','/oPSDUtgVjFiWOve4e2dDZUpa50n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082661',7.1,4784,'de','Lili Marleen','The story of a German singer named Willie, who while working in Switzerland, falls in love with a Jewish composer named Robert, whose family is helping people to flee from the Nazis. Robert’s family is skeptical of Willie, thinking she could be a Nazi as she becomes famous for singing the song “Lili Marleen”.','/gJAS4FCOuFVQprgGfPuOnkZOtp0.jpg','1981-01-14',120,'Released',NULL,'Lili Marleen',265,2.5295,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8274,_binary '\0','/hxkOBHirXDJc0voBOFHGtzE8ndK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082666',7.1,1621,'sh','Ljubi, ljubi, al\' glavu ne gubi','Mary and Bob continuing his love spend the summer in the voluntary youth but their parents affect the foolish. The peak occurs when the life Zika, after a brief flirtation with Marys mother implicate two German girls Elza and Giza.','/x7QDWkFggAos1M0sQEjsTsyX23f.jpg','1981-02-26',90,'Released',NULL,'Kiss, Kiss, But Don\'t Lose Your Head',55114,1.008,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8275,_binary '\0','/bJd8rcyl6hAt6nDbEFhrxKlBrNJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082671',7.4,7509,'de','Lola','Germany in the autumn of 1957: Lola, a seductive cabaret singer-prostitute exults in her power as a temptress of men, but she wants out—she wants money, property, and love. Pitting a corrupt building contractor against the new straight-arrow building commissioner, Lola launches an outrageous plan to elevate herself in a world where everything, and everyone, is for sale. Shot in childlike candy colors, Fassbinder’s homage to Josef von Sternberg’s classic The Blue Angel stands as a satiric tribute to capitalism.','/rZqgDP5kRqh2eaPj5uLzYEbWz40.jpg','1981-08-20',113,'Released',NULL,'Lola',2264,2.9266,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8276,_binary '\0','/xVcpaQwIoVPZq4zW1sNZdKa6nEQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082677',6.1,7088,'en','Looker','Plastic surgeon Larry Roberts performs a series of minor alterations on a group of models who are seeking perfection. The operations are a resounding success. But when someone starts killing his beautiful patients, Dr. Roberts becomes suspicious and starts investigating. What he uncovers are the mysterious - and perhaps murderous - activities of a high-tech computer company called Digital Matrix.','/dQtdfoA0HKyI3YDHCngx6Rp8ePy.jpg','1981-10-30',94,'Released','If Looks Could Kill...','Looker',21874,2.4061,6.18,'1tiDwnwZjlg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8277,_binary '\0','/nGYx6cCKsx8ZR31DUIncHxKemj4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082679',7.1,2907,'en','The Looney, Looney, Looney Bugs Bunny Movie','Bugs Bunny hosts an award show featuring several classic Looney Tunes shorts and characters.','/2hsUFCUVvURJCvxofQaqMN9noDU.jpg','1981-11-20',79,'Released','Academy Award Winner Friz Freleng\'s Greatest Warner Bros. Comedy Classics Plus All New Cartoons For the Big Screen.','The Looney, Looney, Looney Bugs Bunny Movie',41394,4.445,7.321,'z5KN9m6MOw8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8278,_binary '\0','/MMSI9WzRmOdqXarevQ3Kqnytrx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082694',7.6,215107,'en','Mad Max 2','Max Rockatansky returns as the heroic loner who drives the dusty roads of a postapocalyptic Australian Outback in an unending search for gasoline. Arrayed against him and the other scraggly defendants of a fuel-depot encampment are the bizarre warriors commanded by the charismatic Lord Humungus, a violent leader whose scruples are as barren as the surrounding landscape.','/l1KVEhkGDpWRzQ0VqIhZqDDuOim.jpg','1981-12-24',96,'Released','Just one man can make a difference.','Mad Max 2',8810,11.0999,7.389,'bwcADuJZDNA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8279,_binary '\0','/nYLlApF2ucvJJ2p2yxVYg1bOqql.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082696',5.1,7941,'en','Madman','Madman Marz, an old folklore legend who murdered his family before escaping into the woods, is inadvertently summoned to a campsite to finish the spree he started decades ago.','/2pZxY7b22LicdcvWNMCyX8VseVG.jpg','1981-10-30',89,'Released','They thought they were alone.','Madman',47957,1.9887,5,'Xv6divDHQb8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8280,_binary '\0','/twEbAu2SH4FqP6VXC0y4OAQ07I7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082699',6.6,1513,'ja','魔界転生','After surviving the slaughter of many Christians 350 years ago, a samurai denounces God for ignoring the pleas of believers. He sells his soul to Satan and receives the power to resurrect the dead to join him in a murderous rampage.','/1RREOQRTYdjkzNxMv37winNPXFt.jpg','1981-06-06',122,'Released','Death from Beyond the Grave!','Samurai Reincarnation',74289,2.9808,5.9,'oHrNG9KbjWM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8281,_binary '\0','/rBSuFanR0QyetbwkCxrPc48Oprn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082700',5.1,11831,'it','Cannibal Ferox','Three friends out to disprove cannibalism meet two men on the run who tortured and enslaved a cannibal tribe to find emeralds, and now the tribe is out for revenge.','/ogvtVVsPSuzXKiQY1FCCKwIfBec.jpg','1981-04-24',93,'Released','They raped and murdered his sister while he watched helplessly. Now it\'s his turn to make them die slowly.','Cannibal Ferox',8691,5.6512,5.366,'RS8kDxRg5fg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8282,_binary '\0','/aDeO5w3Ne8HV4q6tGFtgqhFZ5Xk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082714',7.7,4310,'it','Il marchese del Grillo','In 18th-century Rome, impish aristocrat Onofrio del Grillo amuses himself by playing pranks on all sorts of people — his reactionary family and fellow nobles, the poors, the French occupiers trying to modernize society, and even the Pope himself.','/ew6UD5tZhADSctIhkbN9RSoyBVv.jpg','1981-12-23',139,'Released',NULL,'The Marquis of Grillo',32480,2.0162,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8283,_binary '\0','/ngwNFqd425XnZGihzW9AKW0JMUy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082726',5.9,1307,'fr','Le Maître d\'école','After having lost his job for having saved a child accused of shop lifting, Frédéric Barbier decides to become a school teacher with some funny results.The great comedy actor Coluche is excellent as a simple school teacher.','/2ToezxqfIvCcuFzVmGp82FOBkQy.jpg','1981-10-28',95,'Released',NULL,'The School Teacher',53179,2.4013,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8284,_binary '\0','/aWelzaq3cmOWPCQV3rgZmPiTakW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082727',7.1,5582,'en','Meantime','A working-class family in London\'s East End is struggling to stay afloat during the recession under Prime Minister Margaret Thatcher\'s premiership. Only the mother Mavis is working; father Frank and the couple\'s two sons Colin, a timid, chronically shy individual and Mark, an outspoken, headstrong young man, are on the dole. This situation is contrasted by the presence of Mavis\'s sister Barbara, and her husband John, whose financial and social loftiness appears to be a comfortable facade over the unspoken soreness of a lackluster marriage.','/aYeCvrkgUCylSQwmMFcqXV27WvD.jpg','1983-10-16',107,'Released',NULL,'Meantime',57978,1.682,6.7,'Llcgzs1jNOM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8285,_binary '\0','/dPDnJSzMkALlzbJG9v7DTwFBFiL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082729',7.5,1787,'hu','Megáll az idő','A Budapest high school in the beginning of the 1960s. Dini suffers the torments of adolescence. His father had to leave Hungary after the uprise in 1956, and since then Dini\'s mother has had to take care of her two sons on her own. A friend of Dini’s father, Bodor, is released from prison and moves in with them. Dini and his brother are far from happy about this intrusion on their family life.','/3Xla9F2wjXnVEcGYVoSsG7nTLvJ.jpg','1982-10-07',99,'Released',NULL,'Time Stands Still',42132,1.3411,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8286,_binary '\0','/ncO9pjB0PZ603Tp1LgbNpkeUxzL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082736',7.7,12704,'de','Mephisto','A German stage actor finds unexpected success and mixed blessings in the popularity of his performance in a Faustian play as the Nazis take power in pre-WWII Germany. As his associates and friends flee or are ground under by the Nazi terror, the popularity of his character supercedes his own existence until he finds that his best performance is keeping up appearances for his Nazi patrons.','/SNJoUTU8PSxQlj3RkrwYGOQPyj.jpg','1981-02-11',145,'Released',NULL,'Mephisto',11911,2.6632,7.3,'HZ5zGyuH8Bw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8287,_binary '\0','/p4KhT3E16smLzVJy4nkHG0k653o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082744',5,1424,'en','Midnight','While hitchhiking to escape an abusive home life, a teenage girl is picked up by a couple on a camping trip. The trip turns deadly when a group of Satanists, hellbent on resurrecting their dead mother, attack the campers.','/v4Nmsv4fwlOUO2GMtE0N2MUpW3H.jpg','1982-12-31',94,'Released','A Startling & Shocking Adventure - As Three College Students Take a Strange Detour to the Land of the LIVING DEAD!','Midnight',104729,3.9418,5.4,'Qw2fyAZ_dYk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8288,_binary '\0','/2ToE0hZaf16U4cM0D84L4DzQnSx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082748',6,14741,'es','Mil gritos tiene la noche','A frustrated Boston detective searches for the maniac responsible for mutilating a number of university coeds.','/pYviMR1o0g8VMUZJK5WTvnZBS2g.jpg','1982-08-23',85,'Released','You don\'t have to go to Texas for a chainsaw massacre!','Pieces',47886,3.4616,5.93,'mnnr8vcl8aU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8289,_binary '\0','/qJLvB4Ewtx0IPzkuNlnX9EOjFVK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082749',7,1362,'fr','Mille milliards de dollars','A young journalist uncovers an assassination disguised as a suicide, linked to an American multinational seeking to dominate French industries. Determined to expose the truth, he races against time to gather evidence before more lives—and his own—are at stake.','/9v3jDcSKto0gEqy4jjrBDyGm98H.jpg','1982-02-09',132,'Released',NULL,'A Thousand Billion Dollars',4023,2.1656,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8290,_binary '\0','/l3LTs1Q6n9DWBDSx2IToD8bcmPd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082755',8.1,7261,'pl','Miś','En route to London, Bear discovers at the border checkpoint that his passport is missing a few pages, which may prevent him from traveling to the city with the sports team he manages.','/mvPR52hepNXBNBezFeLtEorbruo.jpg','1981-05-04',110,'Released',NULL,'Teddy Bear',31407,2.5284,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8291,_binary '\0','/fVXucngyv5W8XrKmHMB61MWYiIj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082763',5,6280,'en','Modern Problems','Jealous, harried air traffic controller Max Fielder, recently dumped by his girlfriend, comes into contact with nuclear waste and is granted the power of telekinesis, which he uses to not only win her back, but to gain a little revenge.','/aH21h3sMMN3r6d9I8VSBw28fW7V.jpg','1981-12-25',89,'Released','Chevy has the power to make this Christmas the funniest ever!','Modern Problems',16471,2.034,5.4,'YeK3jIoPuhY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8292,_binary '\0','/pPmHIpDCiMoq87kDFoXYxSeQbxl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082764',7,5389,'en','Modern Romance','A film editor breaks up with his girlfriend, unsure if he is in love.','/iDRBGabz2BqlqjidUOtTvYOaSli.jpg','1981-03-13',93,'Released','Robert was madly in love with Mary. Mary was madly in love with him. Under the circumstances they did the only thing they could do... they broke up.','Modern Romance',63443,1.8846,6.833,'9x-a4NV5j-o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8293,_binary '\0','/2vObOLMqve3TCcrhXZYCtNdg11b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082766',6.7,20305,'en','Mommie Dearest','Renowned film star Joan Crawford\'s abuse towards Christina, her adopted daughter, intensifies as her professional and romantic relationships turn sour.','/3Amv5uQfadEonn7SmYLfNnoeOSu.jpg','1981-09-16',129,'Released','Faye Dunaway is Joan Crawford. A star...a legend...and a mother...the illusion of perfection.','Mommie Dearest',15660,4.6977,6.4,'HfFS0vrB8zY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8294,_binary '\0','/3jyrAlZOzioFMjfQFg15iQqAJKT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082770',6.5,2260,'sv','Montenegro','Marilyn Jordan, an American, lives in Stockholm with her Swedish husband and family. Her behavior is bizarre, perhaps mad: she poisons the dog\'s milk and advises the dog not to drink it; she sets the sheets afire as her husband sleeps; she crawls under the dining table to sing. While detained at airport customs for carrying pruning shears, she meets a young Yugoslav woman and goes with her to a Gypsy enclave where she\'s fought over, takes a lover, helps with the sordid entertainment at a bar, and returns home more dangerous than before. The film also tells parallel stories of Marilyn\'s daughter becoming a junior homemaker as the young immigrant practices her striptease.','/aqjTU2Tqpid0349OSBvSuz523bf.jpg','1981-10-09',96,'Released','A sultry, erotic comedy.','Montenegro',82523,0.9601,6.2,'sbUIBEFZNa0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8295,_binary '\0','/vXrZ7pyHHQGBSyfXC791b62Ouxv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082776',6.8,15502,'en','Ms .45','After being attacked and raped twice in one day, a timid, mute seamstress becomes a violent agent of revenge for wronged women.','/9ulPP8hcBjIrWRqeXsZVjL0uX3E.jpg','1981-04-24',81,'Released','She was abused and violated. It will never happen again!','Ms .45',22171,4.065,6.7,'DN8dH41a69U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8296,_binary '\0','/i1fbDt7CWQuF7AD1SYpafb4k89J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082778',5.9,1452,'en','The Munsters\' Revenge','The lovable Munster family finds their placid world turned into turmoil by the diabolical Dr. Diablo, the mastermind of an art heist using monster robots, including clones of Herman and Grandpa.','/zgmc7vMmCzR9JTBXsjYxGfn3AFW.jpg','1981-02-27',96,'Released',NULL,'The Munsters\' Revenge',30002,1.3909,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8297,_binary '\0','/dpzt9sJQ6ZPN3ksYmGGh4RyDNiQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082782',6.3,28413,'en','My Bloody Valentine','Twenty years after a Valentine\'s Day tragedy claimed the lives of five miners, Harry Warden returns for a vengeful massacre among teen sweethearts gearing up for another party.','/kl3mewFceFtYIavvGts2atzB0e0.jpg','1981-02-11',90,'Released','There\'s more than one way to lose your heart...','My Bloody Valentine',39874,3.8508,6.443,'3TqauDE3Z2A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8298,_binary '\0','/r3zwnGMmRb7LaDNQluHVXAkZNoY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082783',7.6,31230,'en','My Dinner with Andre','Wally, a struggling playwright and actor, reluctantly agrees to catch up with his old friend Andre, a theater director who disappeared several years prior in order to travel the world. Meeting at a posh Manhattan restaurant, the two share life stories, anecdotes and philosophical musings over the course of an evening meal.','/lakuk8UpDUBrO5c8uoWbKxy5j0e.jpg','1981-10-11',112,'Released',NULL,'My Dinner with Andre',25468,3.4606,7.5,'n7hSY0QOkII','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8299,_binary '\0','/qKTOdbwTZcNi2X2NJpO6Vw7mEOF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082796',7.3,1300,'hi','नरम गरम','An impoverished employee tries to prevent his superiors and employers from marrying his sweetheart.','/yoBt6cziVCnf35hijHhMgO2qnes.jpg','1981-02-28',133,'Released','An impoverished employee tries to prevent his superiors and employers from marrying his sweetheart.','Naram Garam',84693,1.1019,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8300,_binary '\0','/qosEsXxL0E9z44cfCh53L6itGUv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082797',7.1,2242,'hi','नसीब','The lives of friends Namdev, Raghu, Damu and Jaggi take a turn for the worse when they win a lottery. Raghu and Damu murder Jaggi and frame Namdev who later returns to seek revenge.','/oDUddLemim047H3V9tNrkhTotOK.jpg','1981-05-01',197,'Released',NULL,'Naseeb',67605,1.5307,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8301,_binary '\0','/A35sjUDTng6fZsDjNARI6z4DQzY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082799',3.3,1508,'en','National Lampoon\'s Movie Madness','A parody of film genres composed of three shorts, spoofing personal growth films, glossy soap operas, and police stories.','/rvWZkYAo0MfFP0jmdLm1knDJmpk.jpg','1982-04-23',89,'Released','National Lampoon sends up Hollywood sky high!','National Lampoon\'s Movie Madness',33782,2.5947,3.512,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8302,_binary '\0','/qT5fDp27ppI8Exjj1yay8Hxfe8n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082801',5.5,9535,'en','Neighbors','One man\'s quiet suburban life takes a sickening lurch for the worse when a young couple move into the deserted house next door. From the word go it is obvious these are not the quiet professional types who *should* be living in such a nice street. As more and more unbelievable events unfold, our hero starts to question his own sanity... and those of his family.','/eJ9AU7JY4lbda7EeXA0ONncV5Dm.jpg','1981-12-18',95,'Released','Lock the doors... here come the Neighbors','Neighbors',19507,2.5217,5.6,'HUO1OugYbRk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8303,_binary '\0','/ifeZogbli251QzNZgOE2Y4PTYph.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082804',4.9,1960,'en','The Nesting','A New York writer of gothic fiction finds her mansion full of ghosts from a brothel massacre.','/9BbjJKFuQlAR3qrDTvAHuIfLdXW.jpg','1981-05-01',104,'Released','The terror that hides inside your mind.','The Nesting',40236,1.4751,5.3,'atKKrpO02xA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8304,_binary '\0','/bfSU13FFwhX7lmhn1ilQXJ2mIHR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082806',5,4599,'en','New Year\'s Evil','During a live punk-rock New Year\'s Eve TV programme, the presenter gets a phone call from a psycho calling himself \"Evil\" saying that when New Year\'s strikes in each US time zone, he will murder someone.','/eEIpELOvXZZJvHx1MNga8wwn7GI.jpg','1980-12-26',86,'Released','Don\'t Dare Make New Year\'s Resolutions... Unless You Plan To Live!','New Year\'s Evil',69165,2.1675,4.877,'tivSU9zQXfs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8305,_binary '\0','/3SKYSCndT6SeqcSUz16RVgFUdVQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082810',6.5,1743,'en','Night Crossing','Two men want to escape from East Germany (under Communist rule) but they will only go if they can take their families with them. Based on a true story.','/t0m54hI5yUK5lFJENP4yMoyrFfi.jpg','1982-02-05',107,'Released','The East German border: 836 miles of barbed-wire walls, automated machine guns, armed guards, and deadly land mines. On September 15, 1979 two families tried to cross it.','Night Crossing',58995,2.9037,6.1,'TZaj_x20DAI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8306,_binary '\0','/xJfoUoXOoDeJSDFWlSAoJU6E3W1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082812',5.7,3897,'en','Night School','A Boston police detective investigates a series of gruesome decapitations of various college coeds, committed by a helmeted, black-leather clad serial killer.','/uW7b1TW4dLSbmplgIdyRxoEI7dQ.jpg','1981-01-07',88,'Released','A lesson in terror.','Night School',54118,1.7135,5.7,'4ky2EC-rhRA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8307,_binary '\0','/v0O3YOPkbUXladaKvoMJ3hYnFyZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082813',6.3,6747,'en','Butcher, Baker, Nightmare Maker','Rejected by her lover, the only man left in Cheryl\'s life is the orphaned nephew she has raised as her own son. She\'ll stop at nothing to keep Billy with her. When her plans misfire, she is swept up into an insane frenzy that means death to anyone who comes between her and her obsession. But the investigating detective is convinced that Billy is the real killer - and determined to prove it. Madness and fanaticism work together to drag all concerned into a terrifying vortex of blood-letting that adds a nightmarish twist to the classic Oedipus story.','/a1EpGJRGSxsM8HKOSFpSJYbbZOI.jpg','1981-11-20',96,'Released','She was lonely. He was all she had. No one would take him from her…and live.','Butcher, Baker, Nightmare Maker',67740,2.6911,6.5,'M_HOYykia3E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8308,_binary '\0','/aNNXlmD7US6QSRgHvGdWYHGTtum.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082816',5.9,1241,'en','The Night the Lights Went Out in Georgia','An aspiring country singer and his feisty younger sister/manager struggle to reach their dreams of Nashville stardom-as long as she can keep her brother out of trouble with the ladies and the law-in this drama \"inspired by,\" but not really connected to, the hit \'70s ballad.','/wTTJcK66wvIStNph8v5kKhTMKQ8.jpg','1981-06-05',112,'Released','You\'re never too young to learn the score.','The Night the Lights Went Out in Georgia',75596,1.9151,5.8,'YC7E1n9JI5Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8309,_binary '\0','/ivc30gIDwLfAJLNDqjiVpX9Cn62.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082817',6.3,23899,'en','Nighthawks','When one of Europe\'s most lethal terrorists shows up in New York, an elite undercover cop is assigned to take him down by any means necessary.','/2QgpCgOmlgvOPMMC0OrgCv5EKIf.jpg','1981-03-17',99,'Released','One man can bring the world to its knees and only one man can stop him.','Nighthawks',21610,4.606,6.4,'1P1czdpi5fU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8310,_binary '\0','/9NZVtsa2QnZHgdh7iOd4mc8CgmA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082818',5.6,5002,'en','Nightmare','A drug-treated schizophrenic plagued by horrible nightmares is released from the hospital and goes on a killing spree.','/OFysFt0EIXHW89iv38VURpKpKW.jpg','1981-10-23',99,'Released','The Dream You Can\'t Escape ALIVE!','Nightmare',40368,1.6224,5.6,'-fVYXktzC-Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8311,_binary '\0','/ryl56oQAyTtdqpVuL8NIi0Mj2Ai.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082835',6.5,4124,'it','Occhio alla penna','Outlaw drifter Buddy is mistaken for a doctor after his Indian companion inadvertently steals a bag of surgical instruments.','/fslVCyATK3Tzt7axYPRHQ9yCXhQ.jpg','1981-05-14',90,'Released',NULL,'Buddy Goes West',46445,2.5363,6.2,'2ouMZ7mClR8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8312,_binary '\0','/t2IkQXv30jaUQnQAy0qYYYZCFDZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082842',6.9,1953,'da','Olsen-banden over alle bjerge','Criminal genius Egon Olsen presents his accomplices Benny and Keld with yet another infallible plan that can only end badly. The booty is a red suitcase containing values ​​worth five million. The sinister mastermind Bang-Johansen carries the suitcase. The Olsen Gang follows him to Paris, where they put their cunning and carefully organized plan into motion.','/qNGjDYC5jEdCYrhVQ4uCnYYnS7v.jpg','1981-12-26',100,'Released',NULL,'The Olsen Gang Long Gone',15537,1.7626,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8313,_binary '\0','/qm8H8Lf9ENN3Ozhcu4eovEcbNP0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082843',6.8,1803,'da','Olsen-bandens flugt over plankeværket','As usual, Egon has an ingenious plan. And, as usual, it works just fine until one of the gang members makes some kind of funny error. This time, however, even Egon\'s life is in danger, for some international criminals try to get rid of him by throwing him into a container filled with acid.','/jV9slWgGWYbgfWm5KftRW3XSi67.jpg','1981-10-16',100,'Released',NULL,'The Olsen Gang Jumps the Fence',15539,1.5676,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8314,_binary '\0','/ydGY4z0hN8XebemBOJgnTD4ceiJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082846',7.6,38132,'en','On Golden Pond','For Norman and Ethel Thayer, this summer on golden pond is filled with conflict and resolution. When their daughter Chelsea arrives, the family is forced to renew the bonds of love and overcome the generational friction that has existed for years.','/ic4f03J6pnf9cpQmVDABFhUpbCU.jpg','1981-12-04',109,'Released','When life is at its finest... when love is at its fullest...','On Golden Pond',11816,4.1371,7.3,'whi7V5qkJwQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8315,_binary '\0','/1MoaiB4PRfCSkSinXsC25koeTo7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082853',6.4,1850,'en','Only When I Laugh','A boozy Broadway actress comes out of a 12-week cure to face the problems of her best friends as well as her needy daughter. She tries to balance the terrors of returning to work with the demands of all around her with humor and insight, while staying off the booze.','/wmoUyAX4YaMafcsArz5XiOh5N4E.jpg','1981-09-25',120,'Released','It\'ll make you laugh...\'til you cry.','Only When I Laugh',42146,2.1503,5.7,'gye7BgKgoqc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8316,_binary '\0','/ahkWMsdPUQwmMX3fKUFXfZczFO6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082869',6.6,36020,'en','Outland','On the sunless moon Io, Marshall William T. O’Niel goes toe-to-toe with the corrupt manager of a mining colony and his gang of roughnecks while investigating a rash of worker suicides.','/qmjlDkV8CfCboa8WV06ytZaThqx.jpg','1981-05-22',110,'Released','On Jupiter\'s moon he\'s the only law.','Outland',10540,5.6621,6.4,'Z7OzKVHzfiI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8317,_binary '\0','/59K0mHlt2nJx6Cw8pwlvTcn4lsY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082886',5,1269,'en','Paternity','Buddy Evans manages events at Madison Square Garden in New York City. He is a confirmed bachelor who lives with his housekeeper Celia. After coming into contact with several children, Buddy decides that he is ready to be a father. Buddy decides to hire a surrogate mother in the hope of having a son.','/ouPpysYIRgmb3i77e8eh1iB5q0w.jpg','1981-10-02',94,'Released','He wants YOU to have his baby!','Paternity',54660,1.8697,5.2,'zfMXKhOMWCg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8318,_binary '\0','/t52i0d78cmvpjYHty78M1cj80Mb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082893',6.6,1522,'it','La pelle','Based on the memoirs of author Curzio Malaparte, diplomatic liaison between the Allied and Italian forces after the defeat of the Nazis in Italy, The Skin follows the collapse of Italian society under the US occupation and the desperate measures required for survival.','/76BT7xQFchy6FO3jAKj3IMKu66T.jpg','1981-08-27',131,'Released','The skin moves the world!','The Skin',63186,2.073,6.378,'o5H3mgkU7gs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8319,_binary '\0','/8ESZCvqWnHRDJ4xorwQZ37RbXPb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082894',6.5,6903,'en','Pennies from Heaven','During the Great Depression, a sheet music salesman seeks to escape his dreary life through popular music and a love affair with an innocent schoolteacher.','/7dlangnB2vOcviHEwWy1IRGHLtk.jpg','1981-12-11',108,'Released','There\'s a world on both sides of the rainbow where songs come true and every time it rains, it rains Pennies from Heaven.','Pennies from Heaven',17450,2.733,6.1,'6E6jggkbkaA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8320,_binary '\0','/27IZSY74Wmr4JrrhG8oDzO23mRE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082910',3.8,11102,'en','Piranha II: The Spawning','A scuba diving instructor, her biochemist boyfriend, and her police chief ex-husband try to link a series of bizarre deaths to a mutant strain of piranha fish whose lair is a sunken freighter ship off a Caribbean island resort.','/gOPhCh4Ko5crlsyQewPsq1sYLiA.jpg','1982-07-13',94,'Released','It started as a vacation...','Piranha II: The Spawning',31646,4.8107,4.292,'mLmnR-hHMj4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8321,_binary '\0','/w5LnXI69GudhtN3f04fTn80Y16i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082911',5.1,1460,'de','Piratensender Powerplay','Tommy and Mike operate a famous pirate radio station, Germany\'s most listened-to radio station. The police and the operators of the Bavarian Broadcast Company try to stop their illegal broadcast.','/4l58tFPxE1SdbNguszr6R9y8Sv6.jpg','1982-01-14',85,'Released',NULL,'Piratensender Powerplay',11840,1.4051,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8322,_binary '\0','/88SnnUEY4CmUJTjzhqYfY3zffEC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082912',7.9,11120,'pt','Pixote: A Lei do Mais Fraco','10-year-old Pixote endures torture, degradation, and corruption at a local youth detention center where two of its members are murdered by policemen who frame Lilica, a 17-year-old trans hustler. Pixote helps Lilica and three other boys escape and they start to make their living by a life of crime which only escalates to more violence and death.','/zaBtclnYKv2JkgRDQ7OiFtWHm4e.jpg','1980-09-26',127,'Released','They can\'t outrun the law of the weakest.','Pixote',42148,2.8197,7.881,'YgKYTnap_iM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8323,_binary '\0','/lprN6r3ufTAeCtRf1K1uD9eIska.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082924',6.3,9209,'it','Poliziotto superpiù','While delivering a parking ticket to a small village in the Florida everglades, Officer Dave Speed finds himself in the middle of a radiation experiment conducted by the American government and NASA, where a detonated nuclear missile gives him a multitude of superpowers.','/8kSgFV7nvzLVJhmVkq8n4k2VoC0.jpg','1980-09-18',104,'Released','Dave Speed is saving the world from crime... but who is saving the world from Dave Speed?','Super Fuzz',11333,4.0758,6.478,'bNruMmoqdO8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8324,_binary '\0','/xdKzEzW6yWBd7RS69e9xzOgFnpI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082926',7,10291,'en','Polyester','Blessed with a keen sense of smell and cursed with a philandering pornographer husband, a parasitic mother, and a pair of delinquent children, the long-suffering Francine Fishpaw turns to the bottle as her life falls apart -- until deliverance appears in the form of a hunk named Todd Tomorrow. Originally screened with \"Odorama\" scratch and sniff cards so the audience could (at their own risk) smell along with the film.','/14RfMqOe8eF17bUajPsy4HtRsVC.jpg','1981-05-29',86,'Released','It’s Scentsational!','Polyester',14269,3.7157,7,'0lNlEp5qH3E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8325,_binary '\0','/eAm42QGfavLsAAW98niNlAigOl9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082927',6.7,1542,'fr','Le Pont du Nord','Marie is just out from prison when she runs into Baptiste, a young paranoid needing companionship. In their pursuit of a mysterious briefcase carried by Marie\'s former lover, they roam the street of Paris, transformed into a giant board game, a maze spotted with mysterious traps, puzzling clues, and chance encounters. Maybe they are bricks in some sinister scheme, maybe they are playing a board game, maybe it\'s a fairy tale, maybe it\'s yet something else...','/olNvDYC1SyZXxMaa4IayWj7Sq4K.jpg','1982-03-24',129,'Released',NULL,'Le Pont du Nord',59484,2.0879,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8326,_binary '\0','/zfw3fcF7d4KcWYEvps4zUfl303b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082933',7.2,60340,'en','Possession','A young woman left her family for an unspecified reason. The husband determines to find out the truth and starts following his wife. At first, he suspects that a man is involved. But gradually, he finds out more and more strange behaviors and bizarre incidents that indicate something more than a possessed love affair.','/A9bnRn05riOKWftvQlLKa2gl51n.jpg','1981-05-27',124,'Released','Inhuman ecstasy fulfilled.','Possession',21484,10.0497,7.3,'Ah4Z1yIAoFM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8327,_binary '\0','/nd6CVurZnDebDXYOuWI5eNjnFLb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082934',6.6,28139,'en','The Postman Always Rings Twice','The sensuous wife of a lunch wagon proprietor and a rootless drifter begin a sordidly steamy affair and conspire to murder her Greek husband.','/k52pPgVOHPwjIyMdvNZZi3Z7zFR.jpg','1981-03-20',122,'Released','You can get away with anything. Once.','The Postman Always Rings Twice',11027,5.7019,6.5,'-uTyP-fQpZ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8328,_binary '\0','/dl9hAJA2n7BspUZuR79z2mFbJze.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082935',6.4,2585,'fr','Pour la peau d\'un flic','Victim of manipulation, Cop Choucas is wanted for two murders and searched for by every cop in town.','/2RXZnmk4acVaUl3YRDPAcBErnK6.jpg','1981-09-09',105,'Released',NULL,'For a Cop\'s Hide',118732,2.5672,5.863,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8329,_binary '\0','/teEcBDHiT14m4uHOUhUfXrXnT7u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082945',7.4,10808,'en','Prince of the City','New York City detective Daniel Ciello agrees to help the United States Department of Justice eliminate corruption in the police department, as long as he will not have to turn in any close friends. In doing so, Ciello uncovers a conspiracy within the force to smuggle drugs to street informants.','/511ulkuQ46NYiwAc39rXMBIB34r.jpg','1981-08-19',167,'Released','A cop is turning. Nobody\'s safe.','Prince of the City',32047,4.0603,6.992,'h4qEy-shFqo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8330,_binary '\0','/qp6qyypoTTq0lgi3OFt6O1hGrXx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082948',5.1,4899,'en','Private Lessons','Phillip Filmore is a naive, 15-year-old, preoccupied with sex, who develops a crush on Nicole Mallow, the new 30-something, French housekeeper and sitter to look after him when Phillip\'s father is out of town for the summer on a \"business\" trip. But Mr. Filmore\'s unscrupulous chauffeur, Lester Lewis, takes advantage of Phillip\'s crush on Nicole to hire her to seduce the youth, then draws her into a plot to fake her own death in a blackmail scheme aimed to drain Phillip\'s trust fund.','/dTkBOgOv3tpCnfMY6kX2MCYibo3.jpg','1981-05-01',87,'Released','When EMANUELLE\'s Sylvia Kristel is your teacher the bedroom is the classroom','Private Lessons',41280,5.6427,5.7,'KNgU-6P8Swc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8331,_binary '\0','/vW3zPkA9OdSr2UvDfa4b0UGc1Id.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082949',7.4,19505,'fr','Le Professionnel','Josselin Beaumont, a French secret agent, is tasked with assassinating Njala, the president for life of Malawi in Africa. A shift in French policy means that assassinating Njala is no longer an option. But instead of recalling their agent, high-ranking officials deliberately sacrifice Beaumont by handing him over to the Malawian authorities. Arrested, tried, and imprisoned, he nevertheless manages to escape. Back in Paris after a two-year absence, he informs his superiors through Colonel Martin that he will fulfill his contract during Njala’s upcoming official visit to Paris between the 12th and 15th of this month, and that he has a few scores to settle with the D.G.S.E. The question is, should Beaumont be stopped or not?','/dhAZ8T0tTlTNw3D7Cn8wc87sk1w.jpg','1981-10-21',108,'Released','Never leave vengeance to amateurs.','The Professional',1672,4.6344,7.2,'kNBcTM9so8k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8332,_binary '\0','/kXqbAK6p2MamuLEAGdx7geyDmIn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082951',5.9,14546,'en','The Prowler','Thirty years after a murder on the night of Avalon Bay\'s graduation dance, the sleepy town\'s teens meet grisly ends at the hands of a prowler once thought to be a jilted soldier home from war.','/g4sq725mXv5urY6nLQvYmv3RvcO.jpg','1981-11-06',89,'Released','If you think you\'re safe... you\'re DEAD wrong!','The Prowler',44247,2.8954,5.8,'RihvAgpC01w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8333,_binary '\0','/paUvKT63MKjU8PTc9aHfRhl3Z7i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082956',5.9,1833,'en','Puberty Blues','Two teenage surf chicks from the southern suburbs of Sydney ingratiate themselves with a new group of boys.','/kq2Vd0DkY3A5VpUOSsTamG59oEJ.jpg','1981-12-10',87,'Released','The coolest things to do are the things they say we can\'t do.','Puberty Blues',14630,1.5845,5.3,'fGhu5VGnjIc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8334,_binary '\0','/vHvfO2YuiznAbdOXNcCzVMLqV8Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082958',5.6,1684,'en','The Pursuit of D.B. Cooper','A speculation on the fate of the famous hijacker who parachuted with his ransom and disappeared in the mountains. Has Cooper succeeded in following a meticulous plan to disappear into anonymity despite the best efforts of a dogged cop?','/4uDT9RF7JlZf1T0bn0p68DRVmNv.jpg','1981-11-13',100,'Released','Who says you can\'t take it with you?','The Pursuit of D.B. Cooper',45226,2.2942,5.361,'9PmwF5B9EXQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8335,_binary '\0','/Ai8IfYhlhlg6PWXaczKLCpB6aLu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082964',6.2,2227,'fr','Quartet','When her husband\'s arrest leaves her penniless, a woman accepts an invitation to move in with a strange couple.','/e6mAdf5RoWBxnPNbDA3zgTPl91Q.jpg','1981-10-25',101,'Released',NULL,'Quartet',67022,1.3585,5.762,'SJXINaiKmGw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8336,_binary '\0','/vdokrAQX8D2SfNY12GB8f3YdCaT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082966',6.1,18190,'it','Quella villa accanto al cimitero','After a doctor kills his mistress and himself while researching the mysterious previous owner of his Boston home, his colleague, Dr. Norman Boyle, takes over his studies and moves his family into the Boston mansion. Soon after, Boyle\'s young son Bob becomes plagued by visions of a young girl, who warns him of the danger within the house.','/yNUXcoopDqshs5xd2lOwUl1g4Df.jpg','1981-08-14',87,'Released','You may have just mortgaged your life.','The House by the Cemetery',28794,3.517,6.3,'DzowSWg6GfE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8337,_binary '\0','/7crSHnRA9tmt4aOEVOBpFonOmzs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082968',5.6,1336,'en','Race for the Yankee Zephyr','In a lake high in the mountains of New Zealand, hunter Gibbie Gibson discovers a plane wreck from WW2. When word gets around, a gang of crooks turns up and threatens him and his daughter, because they know there is 50 million dollars of gold in the wreck. Gibbie, his partner and helicopter pilot Barney, and his daughter Sally, are caught up in a race for the Yankee Zephyr.','/3GM4f4QduTsoyrP03dQz5PzghGL.jpg','1981-11-28',110,'Released','Finding it after four decades is quite a challenge…. but holding onto it is really an adventure!','Race for the Yankee Zephyr',86295,2.3021,5.9,'IfqK-Q6mZKU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8338,_binary '\0','/rNkXQSZoslH70cI8o4QV88jFGCG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082969',6.8,2122,'en','Raggedy Man','A divorced mother of two boys is stuck working as a telephone operator in a small Texas town during World War II. Her friendship with a Navy sailor on shore leave causes gossip in town.','/nYYAq3645BZPwdmfw7rsSTp8HFE.jpg','1981-09-18',94,'Released','Sometimes it takes a stranger to give you the courage to follow your heart.','Raggedy Man',96966,1.9309,5.7,'bkBBqUlc3Ho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8339,_binary '\0','/affAxDjzMZnQvXmq2zBrsjTxkRI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082970',7.3,11688,'en','Ragtime','A young black pianist becomes embroiled in the lives of an upper-class white family set among the racial tensions, infidelity, violence, and other nostalgic events in early 1900s New York City.','/vRjyakxRrMfj6sgyUJte9mVI1D9.jpg','1981-11-20',155,'Released','The passion, the violence, the birth of America\'s Gilded Age.','Ragtime',25566,3.0401,7.023,'NnZqsdIBSSw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8340,_binary '\0','/zPACwR32amTNvzId9qyapCWXYDJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082971',8.4,1120846,'en','Raiders of the Lost Ark','When Dr. Indiana Jones – the tweed-suited professor who just happens to be a celebrated archaeologist – is hired by the government to locate the legendary Ark of the Covenant, he finds himself up against the entire Nazi regime.','/ceG9VzoRAVGwivFU403Wc3AHRys.jpg','1981-06-12',115,'Released','The return of the great adventure.','Raiders of the Lost Ark',85,26.3005,7.927,'0xQSIdSRlAk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8341,_binary '\0','/7k77AgyjRCuHDMMnGiDTSWuokMf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082973',6.8,2800,'sv','Rasmus på luffen','9-year old orphan called Rasmus runs away from the orphanage. He meets a vagabond they call Paradise Oskar who likes to sing and play his accordion. Oskar makes the Rasmus world seem like a better place.','/eKUNhrNCWok7ekZlRk85ghqs5fB.jpg','1981-12-12',105,'Released',NULL,'Rasmus and the Vagabond',21393,1.8674,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8342,_binary '\0','/cDdB8JBflT4vBYlftoopSdTf4Wz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082979',7.3,27046,'en','Reds','An account of the revolutionary years of the legendary American journalist John Reed, who shared his adventurous professional life with his radical commitment to the socialist revolution in Russia, his dream of spreading its principles among the members of the American working class, and his troubled romantic relationship with the writer Louise Bryant.','/AeiKdVVM93fwfQG1m3N0cgVZgHl.jpg','1981-12-25',195,'Released','Not since Gone with the Wind has there been a great romantic epic like it!','Reds',18254,4.2319,6.9,'MLAnTuCs6_g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8343,_binary '\0','/8iduOfZe6fMCzIfED8wA9zwxevR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0082992',5.8,2292,'en','Rich and Famous','Two literary women compete for 20 years: one writes for the critics; the other one, to get rich.','/9nuZSHfHoZquBBd9RBJDQmldj9D.jpg','1981-09-23',115,'Released','From the very beginning, they knew they\'d be friends to the end. What they didn\'t count on was everything in between.','Rich and Famous',109962,2.3145,5.5,'MrEVHiI0e_g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8344,_binary '\0','/gRlEnn9qyJCirqoJ34LqstyDwx7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083000',6.6,11144,'en','Roadgames','A truck driver plays a cat-and-mouse game with a mysterious serial killer in a van who lures young female hitchhiker victims on a desolate Australian highway.','/zj3eE1lNkp3oWWnOHu4Aj7Gkqj2.jpg','1981-02-27',101,'Released','The truck driver plays games. The hitchhiker plays games. And the killer is playing the deadliest game of all!','Roadgames',43089,2.5282,6.475,'bMheJFjh-5o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8345,_binary '\0','/iJCJ1ThBmuYtJyi3rgQWl56qVXt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083001',6.1,5409,'en','Roar','Roar follows a family who are attacked by various African animals at the secluded home of their keeper.','/7AoDfoRDQ0hfoyasvl0J2PIFUJ0.jpg','1981-10-30',95,'Released','No animals were harmed in the making of this movie. 70 members of the cast and crew were.','Roar',2989,2.9612,5.835,'9RmnuHTJI9U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8346,_binary '\0','/nnnxx4QlArue0T99JSMLMHRRyBG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083004',7.3,1833,'ru','Родня','The story follows Maria Konovalova who travels from her rural village to visit her daughter Nina in the city. Maria\'s arrival exposes the stark contrasts between rural and urban lifestyles and reveals deep-seated family tensions. Interestingly, Родня (Rodnya) in Russian sounds very similar to the word Родина (Rodina), which means \"Motherland.\" The film features three generations of women — Maria, her daughter Nina, and her granddaughter Irina — symbolizing three different Russias: one from the past, one modern, and one representing the future.','/nzWA2iamMrWuoifTNQoxGIyYO6a.jpg','1982-03-01',98,'Released',NULL,'Kin',83620,1.4574,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8347,_binary '\0','/rcJFPsBPPGa0KfK03sX9VlQZ00o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083006',5.4,1628,'en','Rollover','The wife of a murdered petrochemical company chairman and a banker investigating the liquidity of his new bank stumble upon an international financial scheme that could lead to global economic collapse.','/nKHS1gqfZL0imDyN4CLqloYXDWr.jpg','1981-10-11',116,'Released','The most erotic thing in their world was money.','Rollover',47888,1.8644,5.1,'cDpsFPM2NF4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8348,_binary '\0','/tIwD1x5ihVEaUIOsA583UaCkkjq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083015',6.4,6967,'en','S.O.B.','A movie producer who made a huge flop tries to salvage his career by revamping his film as an erotic production, where its family-friendly star takes her top off.','/6irq1xZdQ8rC4AuxPDlA9NkPyYs.jpg','1981-07-01',121,'Released','The man who painted the panther pink, and taught you how to count to \"10\" now gives you Hollywood bull... at it\'s funniest and sexiest.','S.O.B.',27225,2.4453,6.02,'571J6Kt2860','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8349,_binary '\0','/cI67XT8vjfLkwe5hrK9hzqkQO8i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083019',4.7,1338,'de','Sadomania - Hölle der Lust','Soon after newlyweds Olga and Michel set foot on the grounds of a notorious women\'s prison, they\'re arrested by topless guards and ushered behind bars where the warden quickly dismisses Michel but demands that Olga do a little time.','/c6i2FcMuUnKjWDH7Ruc49ERyQZB.jpg','1981-03-27',104,'Released',NULL,'Sadomania',90730,3.3444,5.052,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8350,_binary '\0','/hB6yUlvrQ2MQ0ySxviBgFaK2CDG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083021',6.3,1228,'ja','セーラー服と機関銃','A high-school girl inherits a declining yakuza organization, which seeks to repair its fortunes under her leadership.','/6gSmxfFhzVXr1hGXfda0K86rIIA.jpg','1981-12-19',112,'Released',NULL,'Sailor Suit and Machine Gun',66788,2.1484,7,'gXIIW2iEnrU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8351,_binary '\0','/6ZfxLHlCyTvFodA49BXIN6VzQHg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083033',4.6,5869,'en','Saturday the 14th','After his family moves to a new house, a young boy discovers a mysterious book that details a curse hanging over the date of Saturday the 14th. Opening the book releases a band of monsters into the house and the family must join together to save themselves and their neighborhood.','/e7FmmDumVkPxr9urQABScaOSEAQ.jpg','1981-10-30',76,'Released','Just when you thought it was safe to look at the calendar again.','Saturday the 14th',20472,2.9498,5.1,'Yf_0-GpNOi8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8352,_binary '\0','/ain9YlGMpUSHUw7tqmeUYEGofxw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083050',6.3,1400,'ja','戦国自衛隊','A squadron of Japanese Self-Defense Force soldiers find themselves transported through time to their country\'s warring states era, when rival samurai clans were battling to become the supreme Shogun.','/8nfWhI3eesenG2w01aMG1LZVIse.jpg','1979-09-17',139,'Released',NULL,'G.I. Samurai',73990,2.7084,5.8,'8EFwmOILSiM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8353,_binary '\0','/akSm1tjJrUfOg8oGq9CzodRpH83.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083053',7,1889,'ja','セロ弾きのゴーシュ','Gauche is a diligent but mediocre cellist who plays for a small town orchestra and the local cinema in the early 20th century. He struggles during rehearsals and is often berated by his conductor during preparations for an upcoming performance of Beethoven\'s Sixth Symphony. Over the course of four nights, Gauche is visited at his mill house home by talking animals as he is practicing.','/31I321F0eePRVzsoMcbInmOgb22.jpg','1982-01-23',63,'Released',NULL,'Gauche the Cellist',41017,2.4669,7.3,'eoCE6PTgPgI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8354,_binary '\0','/rrasmKhEx12xXcko6wFxUvBjR7o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083064',6.3,7421,'en','Sharky\'s Machine','Police officer Tom Sharky gets busted back to working vice, where he happens upon a scandalous conspiracy involving a local politician. Sharky\'s new \'machine\' gathers evidence while Sharky falls in love with a woman he has never met.','/ardH3Ian8CK7kxyHrmhdx9mb4F0.jpg','1981-12-18',122,'Released','Nobody leans on Sharky\'s Machine.','Sharky\'s Machine',14664,3.757,6.213,'A_WH-zkNqv4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8355,_binary '\0','/m7f3oqY3tCzcgNNjD8IMgxPYoCq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083067',5.7,5933,'en','Shock Treatment','Brad and Janet Majors find their strained marriage put to the test on popular Denton TV show Marriage Maze. Poor Brad is heavily sedated and institutionalised, whilst Janet is given a radical makeover and primed for stardom. But what are the real motivations behind the kooky DTV crew and their enigmatic head-honcho, Farley Flavors?','/obUmsgTu0MqXiEU5PtSOuAqnl05.jpg','1981-08-21',94,'Released','Trust me, I\'m a doctor!','Shock Treatment',27997,2.097,5.869,'iGoUwRkT56k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8356,_binary '\0','/5qwxpbAztaKMKJXHZmq5Xq3E6tr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083081',7.1,3584,'hi','Silsila','When his brother\'s tragic death leaves his pregnant fiancée devastated, playwright Amit selflessly marries her to protect her from societal contempt. However, when fate brings him face-to-face with his former flame, love proves to be stronger than marital vows.','/7uzX38mxGZBBEdbxB4yxEw2vFvF.jpg','1981-07-29',182,'Released','Love is faith... and faith is for ever','Silsila',28472,1.2064,6.25,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8357,_binary '\0','/ct47RDVgl3FaIo6sYxjLrqHelev.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083089',7.5,7396,'sh','Sjećaš li se, Dolly Bell?','Growing up in 1960s Sarajevo, a young man comes of age under the shadow of his good, but ailing father, but is attracted by the world of small-time criminals. He\'s hired to hide a young prostitute, whom he falls in love with.','/mkH1PigvNINeYQxi07RsdzSuTDB.jpg','1981-04-10',107,'Released',NULL,'Do You Remember Dolly Bell?',49934,2.5411,7.321,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8358,_binary '\0','/uJy8ctBizlGWSslY3PZ8Pi0BWgt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083096',7,1335,'en','Smash Palace','Al Shaw\'s life revolves around motor racing and his back country junkyard, the \"Smash Palace\". His French wife, Jacqui, doesn\'t appreciate the lack of attention due to Al\'s obsession with cars. When Al finds her in the arms of another man, he takes his daughter, Georgie and heads for the bush, desperately hoping to hold on to the only family he has left.','/84u6i9r8jsqTYVG6SRd0CvlaoP6.jpg','1981-05-01',108,'Released','She\'s my daughter and I\'ll do what I like!','Smash Palace',33310,1.1567,6.3,'OxHTosSfB3E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8359,_binary '\0','/jrwpRJ5INESpVbJvQzs3pjyCpYR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083099',5.1,1506,'en','So Fine','While trying to get his father out of a financial jam, a man comes up with an idea that turns into an unexpected overnight financial fashion success - the bottomless pants.','/9OnCXaNQ0HwnTnVPi9NyUI24Tyh.jpg','1981-09-25',90,'Released','A revealing comedy.','So Fine',84735,2.2538,4.704,'ZWqV7o7O35c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8360,_binary '\0','/fXQoHufxtWORXdv24piGqLgbD2t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083102',6.9,1437,'it','Sogni d\'oro','Michele is a young filmmaker frustrated by the lack of understanding his work receives and at odds with the film industry, especially a colleague making a musical on the \'68 student protests. As he struggles to complete his own film about Freud\'s mother, Michele\'s insecurity and creative block manifest in a series of unsettling nightmares. Nanni Moretti\'s self-inquiry into cinema, political ennui, and men\'s relationships with their mothers.','/4TSmNeUdA1EtGyqKS7UH00i9kew.jpg','1981-09-10',100,'Released',NULL,'Sweet Dreams',57967,1.4361,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8361,_binary '\0','/vFf0mpQdZWNVLBQ5ahnZBcsoddT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083107',5.8,1898,'en','Some Kind of Hero','A Vietnam vet returns home from a prisoner of war camp and is greeted as a hero, but is quickly forgotten and soon discovers how tough survival is in his own country.','/4TV2IIkGsRj3r1YzQtJ5BR6c3X0.jpg','1982-04-02',97,'Released','Richard Pryor is in a new kind of comedy... about some kind of hero... in some kind of mess.','Some Kind of Hero',37607,2.2585,5.6,'vbDSVPdRgVQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8362,_binary '\0','/6FLkGMQXlEJDDpkynZCYlchx2E0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083109',6.5,10785,'fr','La Soupe aux choux','Two buddy farmers are visited by aliens who like their domestic cabbage soup.','/eT52CpkNpVrFqamL2WD6iMZuChf.jpg','1981-12-02',98,'Released',NULL,'The Cabbage Soup',9317,4.0263,6.393,'B4KDBDQIkGI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8363,_binary '\0','/ahzJ24TiUeU2R1zd2d2cqxyN73I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083110',4.9,1835,'fr','Les Sous-Doués En Vacances','A group of friends are planning how to spend their summer vacation. One plans to go to the Seychelles with his American girlfriend. At the airport she dumps him for another guy. He has no money so he steals a backpack and goes camping. Somehow he meets a pretty girl and convinces her to share his tent. But a famous singer sees the girl and wants her too. He convinces the luckless guy to act like a fool and the girl leaves him and goes with the singer to the French Rivera.','/tUPJoNHTb1pCNnnyeoQBU5zphev.jpg','1982-03-10',95,'Released',NULL,'Les Sous-Doués En Vacances',51925,2.1297,5.376,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8364,_binary '\0','/1pXco8EiCGtYyBZuNSQIu6980lf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083111',7.1,23749,'en','Southern Comfort','A squad of National Guards on an isolated weekend exercise in the Louisiana swamp must fight for their lives when they anger local Cajuns by stealing their canoes. Without live ammunition and in a strange country, their experience begins to mirror the Vietnam experience.','/nBPOcxiqc0PsG7Hz58JxSUN5BF0.jpg','1981-09-24',106,'Released','It\'s the land of hospitality... unless you don\'t belong there.','Southern Comfort',12528,3.8743,6.8,'SbjrFYzVnDw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8365,_binary '\0','/rYzvq0CwDQo3dLyLySegcy73NC9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083113',5.2,2024,'en','Sphinx','Egyptologist Erica Baron finds more than she bargained for during her long-planned trip to The Land of the Pharoahs - murder, theft, betrayal, love, and a mummy\'s curse!','/kqAEPlF6TzBHZJK5RKusam0Y79Y.jpg','1981-02-11',118,'Released','Beyond the sealed door was the last undiscovered treasure in Egypt. And it\'s all hers - if she can get out alive!','Sphinx',47890,2.4043,5.7,'t2o_rkihLMw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8366,_binary '\0','/RtNJPHoCYXLdc0ckyBd4E3Xlkf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083131',6.8,86853,'en','Stripes','Hard-luck cabbie John Winger, directionless after being fired from his job and dumped by his girlfriend, enlists in the U.S. Army with his close pal, Russell Ziskey. After his barely satisfactory performance in basic training, the irreverent Winger emerges as the figurehead for a ragtag band of misfits. However, his hijinks threaten to cause an international scandal when he inadvertently commandeers a military assault vehicle behind enemy lines.','/toyyN62VLUXoUudFbHPdrrmRFSZ.jpg','1981-06-26',106,'Released','The story of a man who wanted to keep the world safe for democracy...and meet girls.','Stripes',10890,7.6864,6.6,'sKHwEoCIYqA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8367,_binary '\0','/i1ll1vfS2NqeX0Socg43kUchYMI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083133',5.4,6074,'en','Student Bodies','This zany send-up of teen slasher flicks features a maniacal psycho known as the Breather, who stalks –and murders– promiscuous students at a suburban high school. The fanatical killer\'s unusual weapons include paper clips, blackboard erasers and eggplants.','/4zY7FeYeHLspAOeLxEpMlgI2Z4X.jpg','1981-08-07',86,'Released','At last the world\'s first comedy horror movie.','Student Bodies',21515,2.693,5.2,'YM-gFnlnO-o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8368,_binary '\0','/3nCXtObBWwITY20VMC1KWAXH1Zs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083144',5.2,1571,'en','The Survivor','When a 747 crashes shortly after take-off, the sole survivor is the pilot. Virtually unhurt, he and the investigators look for the answers to the disaster. Meanwhile mysterious deaths occur in the community and only a psychic, in touch with the supernatural, can help the pilot unravel the mystery surrounding the doomed plane.','/htgPAKGUIGCYjU6OyBKecXxhmWV.jpg','1981-07-09',98,'Released','A tale of death, and of an evil which transcends death','The Survivor',84628,1.7667,5.1,'ofrHCKRJqcs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8369,_binary '\0','/tWUZf0y6lCMqI9j3MLvScmF4NtY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083146',5.1,3225,'en','Sweet Sixteen','A beautiful lonely girl named Melissa tries to make new friends from a town she\'s currently living in. The only problem is, each of the boys that she spends time with end up brutally murdered. Her sixteenth birthday is on the way, but Melissa turns out to be a suspect when it seems she\'s the last person who has seen her boyfriends alive.','/gPnuYWok19qgYZi6NiOi6KQegM8.jpg','1982-11-12',90,'Released','What terrors are unleashed when a girl turns...','Sweet Sixteen',78552,2.0126,4.9,'BDBSUm8dCnY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8370,_binary '\0','/bR2pdAgFo3QidjneaIhdDtsb1WT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083156',5.3,3261,'de','Die Säge des Todes','After being released from a mental asylum, a disfigured man becomes obsessed with a student at his sister’s boarding school while grappling with his dark past.','/sL7ZTff2d0bLx5b70R1UwwewE5y.jpg','1981-03-27',90,'Released','Don\'t Panic... It only happens once in a... Bloody Moon.','Bloody Moon',39918,2.2005,5,'bYdcYfJhSm4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8371,_binary '\0','/oRGJpLt01YzGPbHiDtbB4OQ1rzs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083162',7.1,1766,'cs','Tajemství hradu v Karpatech','In 1897, in a castle near the town of Werewolfville in the Carpithians, a slightly deranged Professor Orfanik experiments with his new inventions which include, even at this early date, television and a film camera. He is also an obsessed opera fan, keeps the body of his favorite diva preserved in a crypt in the castle. In order to keep away nosy visitors, the baron\'s mad-scientist assistant invents all sorts of spooky phenomena in order to give the castle a creepy reputation.','/nepGOBUOaKqz5Qxzwig4LusBHEB.jpg','1981-10-02',97,'Released',NULL,'The Mysterious Castle in the Carpathians',54755,2.2883,6.075,'zca9nCm8McY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8372,_binary '\0','/vpkhxXlhBdykd0cicgIZzSvpaRc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083169',6.8,22213,'en','Taps','Military cadets take extreme measures to ensure the future of their academy when its existence is threatened by local condo developers.','/m6w9QiuYQSBle3jygH9oV5JC8sP.jpg','1981-12-20',126,'Released','“This school is our home, we think it\'s worth defending.”','Taps',10627,4.7159,6.7,'Ob2DIURBXts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8373,_binary '\0','/spEq9QLZN1vG47t6A6Sz2lnlr7F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083170',3.5,6608,'en','Tarzan the Ape Man','The Tarzan story from Jane\'s point of view. Jane Parker visits her father in Africa where she joins him on an expedition. A couple of brief encounters with Tarzan establish a (sexual) bond between her and Tarzan. When the expedition is captured by savages, Tarzan comes to the rescue.','/nYoH03aBoyi4Bp0VXodrsc4JI6O.jpg','1981-08-07',115,'Released','The most beautiful woman of our time in the most erotic adventure of all time.','Tarzan the Ape Man',26325,4.4392,4.1,'cBTRGd0QZVE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8374,_binary '\0','/iM00v7z7q7lKMNJMab00eOxFGIL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083189',6.2,3655,'en','They All Laughed','New York\'s Odyssey Detective Agency is hired by two different clients to follow two women suspected of infidelity. Ladies\' man John Russo trails Angela Niotes, the elegant wife of a wealthy Italian industrialist, while Charles Rutledge and Arthur Brodsky follow Dolores Martin, the beautiful young wife of a jealous husband. Their respective cases are complicated when John falls for Angela, and Charles falls for Dolores.','/peLIepJoUXzfF0hXqH00dvxr51z.jpg','1981-11-20',115,'Released','Some of them promised they\'d never fall in love.','They All Laughed',31921,2.59,5.9,'h2M9SLlHzzA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8375,_binary '\0','/3pYudqkEC8rkjqpBw8pqoLUtGHe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083190',7.4,51501,'en','Thief','Frank is an expert professional safecracker, specialized in high-profile diamond heists. He plans to use his ill-gotten income to retire from crime and build a nice life for himself complete with a home, wife and kids. To accelerate the process, he signs on with a top gangster for a big score.','/bpjRGwfYJ71bU0hNhLIz7g3t6Oy.jpg','1981-03-27',123,'Released','Tonight, his take home pay is $410,000... tax free.','Thief',11524,4.9524,7.239,'PQdgQs7ozdw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8376,_binary '\0','/tiGvJOIp8Z4oIBMGLt3HWKf8rdg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083193',7.6,1789,'en','This Is Elvis','Though several actors portray Elvis Presley at different stages of his life, this documentary is comprised mostly of actual performance footage and interviews with Elvis, his fans and those close to him. This biographical docu-drama features rare footage of Elvis and dramatically recreated scenes from Elvis\' life.','/1pJGeuZVtc9NSOpLude7Ce9tid3.jpg','1981-04-03',102,'Released','This is the sound he created and performed. The rare personal films never before seen by the public. The private moments. The public triumphs. Intimate memories and reflections in his own words.','This Is Elvis',109264,1.886,7,'w4XdWJMTXqI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8377,_binary '\0','/hDHf09aazDPRzyHTBD2WBR1BzWN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083199',7.3,1405,'cn','第一類型危險','Three lazybones friends manufacture a firebomb and place it in a cinema. Pearl, a sadistic young girl, has observed the scene, follows the bombers and starts to manipulate them. The four criminals plan more and more daring acts.','/6xgOH1EEROz9mWYWYo9wRoiwUuC.jpg','1980-12-04',100,'Released','It started as a joyride; the terror never ended...','Dangerous Encounters of the First Kind',104287,1.8624,7.2,'T_1XPsUqHdM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8378,_binary '\0','/rg4XBpSQqMDiA0YQiSTxoWJYsIL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083203',7.8,1609,'es','Tiempo de revancha','Two coworkers decide to blackmail the corrupt demolition company they work for by setting up a fake accident.','/toMHQMl23CGboMUX9dR7V3OxbsF.jpg','1981-07-30',112,'Released','An honest man is something very dangerous nowadays.','Time for Revenge',43428,0.9763,7.5,'C-6ExvULsC0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8379,_binary '\0','/yWdlOunLPsqACjLBrZll8fpX2Ok.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083226',7,1966,'it','Tre fratelli','In a farmhouse in southern Italy, an old woman dies. Her husband summons their sons: from Rome, Raffaele, a judge facing a political case for which he risks assassination; from Naples, the religious and ideological Rocco, a counselor at a correctional institute for boys; from Turin, Nicola, a factory worker involved in labor disputes. Once home, each encounters the past and engages in reveries of what may come.','/7sSuFTKNvno73Gn1CII5PuAgTWU.jpg','1981-03-19',113,'Released','The Memorable World of Italian Dreams... The Private World of Three Brothers','Three Brothers',42150,1.4465,6.3,'YmbnDvYS_iM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8380,_binary '\0','/zb2l9iPzBRAYIngSslK6nNj2A4T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083232',6.3,10412,'en','True Confessions','A cop clashes with his priest brother while investigating the brutal murder of a young prostitute.','/qwTwHKesH4QcvSBkS1dE89AIFst.jpg','1981-09-25',108,'Released','Two brothers out to save everyone else. But they couldn\'t save each other.','True Confessions',32077,3.4024,6.1,'iqk_iCcq6PM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8381,_binary '\0','/tHFKxINpNDjMCDsjsO35dWZUad2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083248',7.7,1259,'hi','امراؤ جان','Amiran is sold to a brothel by a corrupt cop after her father testifies against him. Many years later, she grows up to be an accomplished poetess and a renowned courtesan, Umrao Jaan.','/6aMPSDh6x9z96MdDilD0mHQxJYE.jpg','1981-03-16',150,'Released',NULL,'Umrao Jaan',71303,1.3806,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8382,_binary '\0','/xHSOLh7E8YF8otfk3QokhHMfugk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083254',5.3,3344,'en','Under the Rainbow','In World War II era Los Angeles, the manager of the Culver Hotel leaves his nephew in charge for a weekend. The nephew changes the name to the Hotel Rainbow and overbooks with royalty, assassins, secret agents, Japanese tourists, and munchkins. Secret Service agent Bruce Thorpe and casting director Annie Clark find romance amidst the intrigue and confusion.','/mCdXzpghn4tPz6hbQcvS2UwOh1C.jpg','1981-07-31',98,'Released','Who knew so many little people would throw such a huge party?','Under the Rainbow',47941,1.8015,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8383,_binary '\0','/uLSQy99Tk5Ux3EeCpcvAwPs6f5H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083260',7.3,3078,'fr','Les uns et les autres','The film follows four families, with different nationalities (French, German, Russian and American) but with the same passion for music, from the 1930s to the 1960s. The various story lines cross each other time and again in different places and times, with their own theme scores that evolve as time passes. The main event in the film is the Second World War, which throws the stories of the four musical families together and mixes their fates. Although all characters are fictional, many of them are loosely based on historical musical icons (Édith Piaf, Josephine Baker, Herbert von Karajan, Glenn Miller, Rudolf Nureyev, etc.) The Boléro dance sequence at the end brings all the threads together.','/1hNwf4zvZ3xkVmBsm77Vd5h4B39.jpg','1981-05-27',184,'Released','The dance of life!','Bolero',37335,2.957,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8384,_binary '\0','/eILzOeP1U9UMZXIfQQ8tD3F2l7W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083261',5.3,2625,'en','The Unseen','A trio of female reporters find themselves staying overnight in a house occupied by a hostile being lurking in the basement','/66BAwSfIef99UztzXgVBt8sNR4W.jpg','1980-09-01',94,'Released','The Ultimate Hidden Terror','The Unseen',40241,2.0556,4.9,'gbJujboVwLU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8385,_binary '\0','/y4tFR7iZTPJ2pREvDTlTkauvWZ5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083271',7.8,5674,'pl','Vabank','October 1934. Poland. Famous bank robber Kwinto decided to quit his dangerous criminal job, but after his friend\'s death, he changed his mind and organized a burglary of famous and well protected bank which belonged to his former partner in crime, backstabbing and double-crossing Kramer. Kwinto designs a clever plan not to only rob the Kramer\'s bank but to make it look like Kramer himself did it.','/37ebywpv1oe5xAnejnv4V58qc1C.jpg','1981-10-01',104,'Released',NULL,'Vabank',22257,1.3914,7.649,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8386,_binary '\0','/yFlCLzoNVQouBCMb6cesGDcsuDa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083275',8.1,3417,'sh','Вариола вера','An Albanian pilgrim, infected with an unknown disease, is on his way back to Belgrade from the Middle East. When doctors realize that it is a disease that has been considered eradicated, it is already too late - variola vera begins to languish and the hospital is quarantined.','/dibhRUd9Fm4DeFYFdlzDJ1ykwZO.jpg','1982-07-09',104,'Released',NULL,'Variola Vera',129828,2.049,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8387,_binary '\0','/n8ADiKZjFKbeVd8L7cC4UfXuwNv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083276',6.4,5011,'sv','Varning för Jönssonligan','A botched burglary leads to the arrest of the Jönsson gang’s leader, Sickan. After serving ten months in prison, he is released and unexpectedly recruited by the enigmatic banker Wall-Enberg Jr. to steal the legendary Bedford Diamonds in Switzerland. Though Sickan successfully carries out the heist, he is betrayed and nearly captured. Returning to Sweden and reuniting with his old accomplices, he sets out to take calculated revenge on the man who double-crossed him.','/xkW9DJAeGzMnOWCDcCX2hEWe9y2.jpg','1981-12-04',89,'Released',NULL,'Beware of the Jönsson Gang',35343,1.6682,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8388,_binary '\0','/1hQ9eDTXLdUN17gLJTdHXZyDL1G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083281',7,3962,'en','Vernon, Florida','Early Errol Morris documentary intersplices random chatter he captured on film of the genuinely eccentric residents of Vernon, Florida. A few examples? The preacher giving a sermon on the definition of the word \"Therefore,\" and the obsessive turkey hunter who speaks reverentially of the \"gobblers\" he likes to track down and kill.','/dqcUISuve7pUcGT75Kwa0E8Sz6H.jpg','1981-10-08',55,'Released',NULL,'Vernon, Florida',30142,1.9904,6.8,'7RMRMf_-j0s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8389,_binary '\0','/cWOpRLx5Fzz92D3zdesIcsQQxX9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083284',6.7,36328,'en','Escape to Victory','A group of POWs in a German prison camp during World War II play the German National Soccer Team in this powerful film depicting the role of prisoners during wartime.','/3j6H0dnbvjNXLK1l9nKguXw5vvO.jpg','1981-06-17',116,'Released','Now is the time for heroes.','Escape to Victory',17360,7.1416,6.9,'mfn5jjFIZJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8390,_binary '\0','/hfI0UMSYO2l5PxY9drr3hJAPoHh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083287',6.3,1707,'fr','Viens chez moi, j\'habite chez une copine','Guy is fired from is job, and asks to stay with his friend and his girlfriend in their apartment. The longer he stays, the more disaster he creates.','/fNSRXUkdJadKgqhhlJlRLZjFjAi.jpg','1981-01-25',85,'Released',NULL,'Come to My Place, I Live at a Girlfriend\'s',69044,1.753,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8391,_binary '\0','/aFmSGx6F0x33FLWPkjccmvyWzSF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083296',5.7,5447,'en','Visiting Hours','A deranged, misogynistic killer assaults a journalist. When he discovers that she survived the attack, he follows her to the hospital to finish her off.','/caqqCAlRtcWhfmTmUTga0HwDzmj.jpg','1982-05-21',105,'Released','So frightening you\'ll never recover.','Visiting Hours',46885,3.552,5.5,'QQgGxVxiF0s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8392,_binary '\0','/siiKOXLZSOB1w8aly3yZ1nHF2T5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083310',4.9,1676,'en','Wacko','Thirteen years after the \"Lawnmower Killer\" killed her sister, high school student Mary Graves and obsessed detective Dick Harbinger are on the lookout for the killer to reappear during the annual Halloween Pumpkin Prom.','/lqvizlTs67bL5N2OwqFxNW8m1Oq.jpg','1982-11-12',85,'Released','At last! A motion picture made by, for, and about people.... just like you!','Wacko',76681,1.5922,5.057,'qtAr1t2J1P8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8393,_binary '\0','/ZJaxnayAGXaaoEIAgW3599XXYa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083316',7.1,3648,'en','The Wave','A teacher conducts an experiment in an American high school where students learn how easy it is to be seduced by the same social forces which led to the horrors of Nazi Germany.','/ua2Z4aWCF2NBk3MuMP0JfCMqlys.jpg','1981-10-04',44,'Released',NULL,'The Wave',31074,1.5631,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8394,_binary '\0','/9osI0Zd8MAXlsD60XBJAMjIFSEK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083326',7.3,3756,'en','Whose Life Is It Anyway?','Ken Harrison is an artist that lives to make sculptures. One day he is involved in a car accident, and is paralyzed from his neck down. All he can do is talk and move his head, and he wants to die. Whilst he is in hospital he makes friends with some of the staff, and they support him when he goes to trial to be allowed to die.','/qutLxh74RsoGEWfrI205yvwAlnr.jpg','1981-12-02',119,'Released','The ultimate drama in the human comedy.','Whose Life Is It Anyway?',31695,2.527,7,'LENk6lPRsNk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8395,_binary '\0','/yYxsfNOOmTmWyDYdciuVorwiJU4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083335',6.9,1481,'pl','Wojna światów - następne stulecie','Poland, Christmastime. A band of hyperintelligent, bloodthirsty Martians take over the country and enlist hapless television newscaster Iron Idem as the voice of their propaganda machine. But when Iron dares to go off message, he makes an enemy even greater than the aliens—the state itself.','/2a9C1Sq1AQlK8eXDN1KCnK55XZI.jpg','1981-11-01',94,'Released',NULL,'The War of the Worlds: Next Century',185354,1.8666,6.8,'yapgkKNqUmw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8396,_binary '\0','/2emn3D5215BfQrMBNXGV9Y8xInJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083336',6.3,12965,'en','Wolfen','A New York City cop and an expert criminologist trying to solve a series of grisly deaths in which the victims have seemingly been maimed by feral animals discover a sinister connection between the crimes and an old legend.','/hb4TJBeElGyIa7tmF2466iwwItB.jpg','1981-07-24',115,'Released','They can hear a cloud pass overhead, the rhythm of your blood. They can track you by yesterday\'s shadow. They can tear the scream from your throat.','Wolfen',10725,4.2467,5.94,'w1BH0uPIruQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8397,_binary '\0','/kC336yt6MdLzxZHqW7BAI1apCCF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083349',6.9,2167,'hi','Yaarana','Bishan loses his fortune while helping his friend Kishan in his singing career. Now successful, will Kishan return the favour?','/kW0veaorkSOzfzHsYLeZUuoWe9O.jpg','1981-01-10',138,'Released',NULL,'Yaarana',159420,0.93,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8398,_binary '\0','/tPSFUi2ed7ZOneACv6THCfgrq9S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083352',7.1,1281,'cn','勇者無懼','Mousy, a timid laundryman, crosses paths with a violent criminal known only as White Tiger, who hides amongst a theatre troupe, murdering anyone who discovers his identity.','/ag5eCwLN78wWLhyVK3bR5E6Uu6r.jpg','1981-03-26',95,'Released','Nothing, but nothing, can stand in the way of his fists.','Dreadnaught',64305,1.8831,7.1,'3M5kTNBDiSg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8399,_binary '\0','/nruIXBvV9cBHYxp8F037L2UHzKS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083365',6.7,1535,'en','Zoot Suit','Part fact and part fiction, Zoot Suit is the film version of Luis Valdez\'s critically acclaimed play, based on the actual Sleepy Lagoon murder case and the zoot suit riots of 1940s Los Angeles. Henry Reyna is the leader of a group of Mexican-Americans being sent to San Quentin without substantial evidence for the death of a man at Sleepy Lagoon. As part of the defense committee, Alice Bloomfield and George Shearer fight the blatant miscarriage of justice for the freedom of Henry and his friends.','/itSXh6MxBZWvQ7xhSxusk2RwjfM.jpg','1981-10-02',103,'Released','An American original.','Zoot Suit',76397,2.1726,6.4,'Wycz0Z7LCk8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8400,_binary '\0','/mguRtt0wvPCVhAFkXjvGIamofC2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083366',6.3,5319,'en','Zorro, The Gay Blade','In 19th century Mexico, legendary swordsman Zorro has passed on his weapon and his sense of duty to his noble son, Diego, a dashing swashbuckler like his father. But after an injury sidelines Diego, he is forced to hand the mask over to his twin, Ramon.','/qNrJKDXx0hPKPKcNFRXMI7MjPSD.jpg','1981-07-17',93,'Released','Zexy, Zany, Zensational!','Zorro, The Gay Blade',19317,2.6102,6,'DC84CY3I3l4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8401,_binary '\0','/ivxR6kP71Tj7zhf6f4LSYJ4Uanx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083449',6.2,3044,'en','The Missionary','In 1905, after 10 years of missionary work in Africa, the Rev. Charles Fortesque is recalled to England, where his bishop gives him his new assignment - to minister to London\'s prostitutes.','/xDr1EsYWOrteJ0EP9O2WYm1uiT5.jpg','1982-11-02',90,'Released',NULL,'The Missionary',52083,1.9232,5.6,'hSY0aIbcEPI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8402,_binary '\0','/eLSGqYsD4PDMZj3krnKd8fqal0u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083465',7.9,3439,'ru','Покровские ворота','Stories from the lives of the tenants of the Moscow\'s communal apartment: Kostik, who is a college student, lives with his aunt while studying; Arkady Velyurov who is a performing artist; Khobotovs, who are a divorced couple; and Sava, who is Margarita Khobotov\'s new fiancé. All these people live in one apartment and their lives constantly touch each other\'s.','/wrf1p3LFAllzrm7wgXRWOg6c4We.jpg','1983-02-11',140,'Released',NULL,'The Pokrovsky Gates',37176,1.3086,7.272,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8403,_binary '\0','/xQTSGz5dvIAYFssPWhD160AcR7Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083511',6.9,94402,'en','48 Hrs.','A hard-nosed cop reluctantly teams up with a wise-cracking criminal temporarily paroled to him, in order to track down a killer.','/rvvjXHzEDBIvIVDBHNOwHS7hVPu.jpg','1982-12-07',96,'Released','One cop. One con. No mercy.','48 Hrs.',150,9.5213,6.676,'24XiqMIC6q8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8404,_binary '\0','/dZn66IIpFvamJ0prsku0zfoEQ54.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083526',4.4,1269,'en','The Aftermath','After a lengthy space mission, two astronauts return to an Earth transformed by nuclear war. As renegade gangs and mutants rule Los Angeles, the astronauts join two pretty women and a couple of kids in a growing resistance movement.','/lR7H61fx5Mn9cUq8oqT1moDBgxK.jpg','1982-03-22',95,'Released','What comes after World War III?','The Aftermath',46522,1.8726,4.188,'-sVquQ1xvO0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8405,_binary '\0','/mtRGjKv3ky39BGXfwJDwoKumVIT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083530',6.2,61519,'en','Airplane II: The Sequel','A faulty computer causes a passenger space shuttle to head straight for the sun, and man-with-a-past Ted Striker must save the day and get the shuttle back on track – again – all the while trying to patch up his relationship with Elaine.','/zs7Pjyabt0fwe2XqIx0gnF9Q4np.jpg','1982-12-10',84,'Released','For the ride of your life... All you need for Christmas are your two front seats!','Airplane II: The Sequel',2665,7.8981,6.078,'-O42Vu_GnSc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8406,_binary '\0','/fINubjjuoesIAaDq7cetIrdq8Ml.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083541',5.3,1287,'en','Alley Cat','After her grandparents are savagely attacked, Billie uses her knowledge of martial arts to begin dishing out her own brand of vigilante justice.','/sBu7zHHahw6n0Xwp0aAoom6fL4N.jpg','1984-03-01',83,'Released','A one woman vigilante squad!','Alley Cat',89125,1.7506,5.5,'0J-xWU_pge4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8407,_binary '\0','/d0QQii706R7jbXed432WRZRLtkd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083542',6,8009,'en','Alone in the Dark','A quartet of murderous psychopaths break out of a mental hospital during a power blackout and lay siege to their doctor\'s house.','/5ybBuHOTUMtW000G15WHh31aMNn.jpg','1982-11-12',93,'Released','When the lights go out, the terror begins.','Alone in the Dark',40952,3.7463,5.795,'b4VtV83RKh4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8408,_binary '\0','/AtaH2jdp845H6oK59bkLlf25XXC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083549',7.6,3643,'it','Amici miei - Atto II°','The four old friends meet on the grave of the fifth of them, Perozzi, who died at the end of the first episode. Time has passed but they are still up for adventures and cruel jokes, and while they recall the one they created together with the late friend, new ones are on their way, starting right there at the cemetery.','/fkEx0jDetl0yfU0K9wyaaz0A9w4.jpg','1982-12-22',130,'Released',NULL,'My Friends Act II',24160,2.1732,7.62,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8409,_binary '\0','/vsZUdpngUDvPfFjixjdSJR2OI0H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083550',5.6,14393,'en','Amityville II: The Possession','Anthony and Dolores Montelli, along with their four children, move into their dream house in Amityville and are immediately plagued by a string of paranormal experiences. When the abusive Anthony wrongly places the blame on the children, Dolores recruits a local Catholic priest to exorcise the house.','/xx9K2m2Arr5EZUQtmggKtEK1f2a.jpg','1982-09-24',104,'Released','If these walls could talk...They would shriek!','Amityville II: The Possession',16235,5.9945,5.727,'n-1wwxK2wIs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8410,_binary '\0','/7EwzruqMhiXiVBntRoUjOhey8ap.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083552',5.7,1748,'pt','Amor Estranho Amor','A man remembers forty-eight crucial hours in his life when, as a child, he visited his mother, the favorite woman of an important politician, in a bordello owned by him, right before some important political changes in 1937 Brazil. In those hours, he discovers his own sexuality.','/zVsoVAaKc9U2x4luIpDm22sMalV.jpg','1982-01-11',123,'Released','For them, everything was permited.','Love Strange Love',54989,6.8979,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8411,_binary '\0','/ltwE3005Xz6VBjuvEo9MifmRh63.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083557',5.8,2778,'en','Android','Eccentric scientist Dr. Daniel and his shy assistant Max lead a quiet life on their space station, carrying out illegal research on androids, until they receive an unwelcome visit from three fugitives one of whom is female. Both Dr. Daniel and Max show an interest in her, but one of the other visitors has more sinister intentions.','/2exixpei6yaOBrnKgYun1fybsoM.jpg','1982-10-15',80,'Released','Meet Max 404. He\'s a little over five years old. He just met his first woman. It\'s time to get down to Earth.','Android',38849,1.7838,5.415,'wg2oMlsKFts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8412,_binary '\0','/uP8eElA1j4I2lE0V67bhQaUipkc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083564',6.6,54398,'en','Annie','An orphan in a facility run by the mean Miss Hannigan, Annie believes that her parents left her there by mistake. When a rich man named Oliver \"Daddy\" Warbucks decides to let an orphan live at his home to promote his image, Annie is selected. While Annie gets accustomed to living in Warbucks\' mansion, she still longs to meet her parents. So Warbucks announces a search for them and a reward, which brings out many frauds.','/xopqD99S1GqQOG8UAeSElsX9MeP.jpg','1982-05-21',127,'Released','The movie of \'Tomorrow.\'','Annie',15739,5.2436,6.5,'I78xulb-l0s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8413,_binary '\0','/5iCSRxyPm35JOwivMkRrP18XDNp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083578',7.8,1730,'hi','अर्थ','The semi-autobiographical film was written by Mahesh Bhatt about his extramarital relationship with actress Parveen Babi.','/dtSdmEr5RVVWdg2zhsgv7yjqu0O.jpg','1982-12-03',138,'Released',NULL,'Arth',96156,1.1418,6.867,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8414,_binary '\0','/3XEmvqOLNoGTLc8JluZbaZ9Y7CQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083579',7.3,1476,'fi','Arvottomat','Manne, Harri, and Ville Alfa are rootless twenty-somethings in search of purpose for their banal lives. After Manne steals a priceless painting from a group of petty criminals, Manne and Harri flee from the gangsters across Finland, while Ville goes to Paris. On the road they meet Veera, an old girlfriend of Harri\'s, and try to avoid the gangsters in pursuit.','/hzhN6JADywiaqV1VHSVXe0y4O2F.jpg','1982-10-15',119,'Released',NULL,'The Worthless',33481,1.2722,6.4,'u_CnPk6zUGs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8415,_binary '\0','/1rLPWregu9q8m28w94syxsDenK5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083580',6.6,4762,'fr','L\'As des as','In this action comedy the French boxer Jo Cavalier is charmed on the train to Berlin for the Olympics in Hitler\'s Germany by the little boy Simon Rosenblum who asks his autograph; when it turns out his adorable young fan is a Jewish orphan in danger of persecution, he risks his one shot at Olympic glory to save Simon and his family, helped only by a German officer-gentleman who became his friend in World War I, by an adventurous escape to Switzerland, Nazi troops on their heals and braving impossible odds in roller coaster-style.','/k9qMoIocHqEYiQY5IZdHbBOioX7.jpg','1982-10-27',100,'Released',NULL,'Ace of Aces',71524,3.4501,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8416,_binary '\0','/yDrAyZMQpEKAK2HiK5NujvutilM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083590',7.6,4890,'en','The Atomic Cafe','A disturbing collection of 1940s and 1950s United States government-issued propaganda films designed to reassure Americans that the atomic bomb was not a threat to their safety.','/9kTkv6o25fuWVSRu1AgOsF0cwz.jpg','1982-03-17',86,'Released','A hot spot in a cold war.','The Atomic Cafe',26851,1.7034,7.321,'AymBFIo2-sM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8417,_binary '\0','/oIP4Pb0KzpACa9VJQ5JnhmQhC4b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083591',5.4,3208,'en','Attack Force Z','Sent to rescue survivors from the site of a plane crash in the South Pacific during WWII, Captain Kelly and his elite squad of Australian commandos must keep tabs on a defecting Japanese official who could hold the secret to peace.','/9u2ry5cW1vq8MzNFgph6iNAqM2C.jpg','1982-06-01',93,'Released',NULL,'Attack Force Z',43279,2.8776,5.9,'Ag-6sYwF2LA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8418,_binary '\0','/yn0VocCJizZde1fsvPKdsl3AIDi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083598',6.2,6206,'en','Author! Author!','A broadway playwright is burning the candle at both ends. He is dealing with pressure from a production nearing premiere, a wife who is leaving him, and 5 children 4 of which belong to her.','/t23OHqoicdzDOlQcpHJkuKJcQKd.jpg','1982-06-18',110,'Released','Anyone can be a father. But not every father deserves a standing ovation.','Author! Author!',41760,3.2559,6,'lDpDO5qONeI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8419,_binary '\0','/A1ZHzJIskmiigtgvadHaoBYkJ1g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083611',6.5,1577,'fr','La Balance','A Paris police detective plays rough with a prostitute and her pimp/lover, whom he wants as an informant.','/zQ5OfelytoqlK5o7hPAtgISkJQa.jpg','1982-11-10',103,'Released',NULL,'La Balance',86404,1.5233,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8420,_binary '\0','/hlcpL3fRCfvHG4V5txFlsKuldNK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083618',6,1968,'fr','Banzaï','Michel works there manically solving people\'s problems over the phone. He is about to tie the knot with his girl friend Isabelle, an airline hostess. She flies all over the world, he hates to leave the office. A series of madcap mishaps involving theft or injury (as you would expect in his line of work) ensues after Michel promises Isabelle nothing will delay their marriage and she promises in turn that she\'s done flying. Once this unlikely promise is made, it becomes premise and both are forced into escalating white lies to maintain the appearance of keeping their word. Their predicament mounts as Isabelle is forced to do a few more flights, while Michel is compelled to travel to New York, Tunisia, and finally Hong Kong, where they are finally reunited in the throes of a contrived and hilarious drug deal involving a 747, water taxi chases, and martial arts.','/mJxlrfnVXhXNGRCBY5GrbIGHv3r.jpg','1983-03-23',102,'Released',NULL,'Banzaï',52557,1.5955,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8421,_binary '\0','/ytykrwuypP3CTAjqrmnhretHG3V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083619',6.3,2348,'en','Barbarosa','Karl Westover, an inexperienced farm boy, runs away after unintentionally killing a neighbor, whose family pursues him for vengeance. He meets Barbarosa, a gunman of near-mythical proportions, who is himself in danger from his father-in-law Don Braulio, a wealthy Mexican rancher. Don Braulio wants Barbarosa dead for marrying his daughter against the father\'s will. Barbarosa reluctantly takes the clumsy Karl on as a partner, as both of them look to survive the forces lining up against them.','/nfxPWtxocxrHutDpAdJhaHVEUek.jpg','1982-02-19',90,'Released','The outlaw...the outcast...and the legend that was bigger than both of them.','Barbarosa',31665,3.1751,5.9,'QOmNwG0c8kc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8422,_binary '\0','/qGa0xgIKTmSa4Rlw5pEhShDTGwU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083624',6.2,24418,'en','Basket Case','A young man carrying a big basket that contains his extremely deformed, formerly conjoined twin brother seeks vengeance on the doctors who separated them against their will.','/ciyzEBzJ1TnafkgGXr6DqEVh1wk.jpg','1982-04-02',91,'Released','The tenant in room 7 is very small, very twisted, and very mad.','Basket Case',27813,2.3618,6.2,'TuJq47pxeyM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8423,_binary '\0','/vCJtp7oflTaJ1aZp4s5mP096P2Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083625',6.4,1713,'fr','Le Battant','Jacques Darnay has served 8 years for robbing a jeweller. Now he is out of prison and looking for his loot worth 6 million francs.','/AqjSPW1ExVcVNj95ugRqJcPv8ai.jpg','1983-02-02',121,'Released',NULL,'The Fighter',146877,1.6305,5.765,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8424,_binary '\0','/4YYop3zboztHPX48t6xAHORdD3y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083628',4.9,2011,'en','The Beach Girls','School is out, and three girls head to the beach for vacation. Two of the girls are world-wise party-goers who attempt to loosen up their naive, virginal friend, whose uncle has allowed the girls to stay at his beach house. When the near-sighted, drug smuggling Captain Bly dumps his cargo of marijuana, the bales wash up on shore. The two party girls, Ginger and Ducky, quickly stuff the dope into giant bags and spirit it back to the beach house, where it fuels a party with assorted misfits, delivery persons, and passersby.','/f83xGpjLVwAYqsTr6vlrRxUxUP7.jpg','1982-03-26',91,'Released','Celebrate summer and fun with a slew of bikini-clad beach bunnies!','The Beach Girls',54803,2.3538,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8425,_binary '\0','/icsarGf6OBZBUO4jMr7CHThkvKc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083629',5.6,5420,'en','The Beast Within','A horrified teen mutates into a crazed cannibalistic swamp creature, and must uncover the terrifying secret identity of his father before his nasty natural tendencies force him to make jambalaya out of the locals.','/4ZYbhYQflIF1FV2cmOfQHBUtiQe.jpg','1982-02-12',98,'Released','He Was On The Verge Of Becoming A Man... Eater!','The Beast Within',40219,2.6662,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8426,_binary '\0','/zHTnieWaWlObW2wLQO3ePkwHlom.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083630',6.2,27645,'en','The Beastmaster','Dar, the son of a king, is hunted by a priest after his birth and grows up in another family. When he becomes a grown man, his new father is murdered by savages and he discovers that he has the ability to communicate with animals, which leads him on a quest for revenge against his father\'s killers.','/ytaKNYpHdQnClTbWL2m19Xv6PXZ.jpg','1982-08-16',118,'Released','Born with the courage of an eagle, the strength of a black tiger, and the power of a god.','The Beastmaster',16441,5.6132,6.3,'26Xa7S-9tu0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8427,_binary '\0','/fkATjjwcSiHZCMwY9TdIHW37Dg8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083641',5.5,3590,'en','Best Friends','When a professional couple, who have lived and worked together for many years, finally decide to marry, their sudden betrothal causes many unexpected difficulties. They soon find that being married is often quite different from being \"best friends.\"','/kM78uHJJvUdqW3Aczb1ALNOAGW.jpg','1982-12-17',116,'Released','What a present for Christmas','Best Friends',45840,1.9531,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8428,_binary '\0','/2da9Hqr5FxMLYpcYi3BW2LyLIwf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083642',6.2,14319,'en','The Best Little Whorehouse in Texas','When a Conservative TV crusader threatens to shut down beloved brothel The Chicken Ranch, proprietress Miss Mona Stangley and her girls won\'t go down without a fight.','/yw3PNR3NVeKKfLWv8SgFQnXoHZh.jpg','1982-07-23',114,'Released','With Burt and Dolly, this much fun just couldn\'t be legal!','The Best Little Whorehouse in Texas',16363,8.1157,6.2,'L3a_V6YntQw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8429,_binary '\0','/92DAD8HDfsYu4mdSwkXb2rXprvs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083652',8.1,3837,'en','Bill Cosby: Himself','A 1983 stand-up comedy film featuring the comedy of Bill Cosby. Filmed before a live audience at the Hamilton Place Theatre, in Hamilton, Ontario. Cosby gives his comedic views on people who drink too much and take drugs, going to the dentist, marriage and parenthood.','/t685Vbw4q2PxgnrlBFpgZO607D0.jpg','1983-05-20',105,'Released',NULL,'Bill Cosby: Himself',20120,1.2516,7.6,'FDzffQc6B2M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8430,_binary '\0','/ykRdDnySMvsvaqIwQPPqNrdG0Oy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083655',6,2606,'it','Bingo Bongo','The ape-man, found somewhere in the jungles of Congo, transferred to Milan and named Bingo Bongo. The only one who believes in the human qualities of him is Laura, a woman anthropologist , so their affection for each other even grows to love.','/5ve4VuCwi7Xas5s50ynEB7uFjM2.jpg','1982-12-23',102,'Released',NULL,'Bingo Bongo',62029,4.8854,5.693,'Z3aVa2a-la4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8431,_binary '\0','/2spEHYDcyE9r9mS7AFEscfKVDzO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083658',8.1,891356,'en','Blade Runner','In the smog-choked dystopian Los Angeles of 2019, blade runner Rick Deckard is called out of retirement to terminate a quartet of replicants who have escaped to Earth seeking their creator for a way to extend their short life spans.','/63N9uy8nd9j7Eog2axPQ8lbr3Wj.jpg','1982-06-25',118,'Released','Man has made his match ...now it\'s his problem.','Blade Runner',78,25.9624,7.936,'6Ilbh612RUc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8432,_binary '\0','/tftXzSlqF9yk8OZFfKTLaknjLHU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083661',4.5,2159,'en','Blood Tide','An adventurer hunting for treasure in Greece accidentally frees a monster that forces local villagers to sacrifice virgins.','/yWSFit9usBUjK5a0govjZdGEa9I.jpg','1982-09-24',82,'Released','Evil lurks in the Ocean Depths','Blood Tide',58790,1.5273,5.1,'JHqUrYbwajU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8433,_binary '\0','/fDytEEdC5o4zXk2004JVEktzkRD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083670',3.7,1370,'en','Boardinghouse','A boarding house is reopened years after gruesome murders were committed there. Suddenly, the body count begins once more!','/k5sF7CvHXd1Y9fmVhHMUmmmKjhY.jpg','1982-12-31',88,'Released','Where the rent won\'t KILL you, but something else WILL!','Boardinghouse',40464,1.6141,3.7,'5XSPS43LjiM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8434,_binary '\0','/bE5aeaFL5Da4l9SLXNDrvrT2U4X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083675',6.2,4827,'it','Bomber','Bomber is an unemployed boat captain. One day he meets Jerry, a manager of boxers who are struck by the force of his fists. That is when they see the chance to win big money.','/n82A7mfaWZHajDo2VhYyQpRbwvu.jpg','1982-08-05',101,'Released',NULL,'Bomber',11614,2.5136,6.5,'SGy-_Iwbpvw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8435,_binary '\0','/fQXIjPiXwErUOyVvVK3mqXsD1Nc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083678',6.4,7717,'en','The Border','A corrupted border agent decides to clean up his act when an impoverished woman\'s baby is put up for sale on the black market.','/73yotjKSU8QCxlhoPm1hATrFHvT.jpg','1982-01-29',108,'Released','When Charlie Smith went down to the border, he found more than a boundary between Texas and Mexico. He found a line within himself.','The Border',22023,2.6327,6,'NbIxhAGTtC0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8436,_binary '\0','/mdyeJRmLW3IPCo0e1oEmR8WBklm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083680',6.9,3061,'it','Borotalco','Sergio Benvenuti is a shy seller of contracts for a Roman company of music, but because of his character he cannot find even a customer, so he asks for help from a fellow named Nadia.','/2IMlCia3G1EoI2fetNZkCVEkAzq.jpg','1982-01-22',97,'Released',NULL,'Talcum Powder',37768,8.4965,6.808,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8437,_binary '\0','/fsPJRCb3n1tTaraMY0QoA8taXUb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083686',6.3,5827,'fr','La Boum 2','A young French teenage girl after moving to a new city falls in love with a boy and is thinking of having sex with him because her girlfriends have already done it.','/pbkccDoxH1H1VdqWcQYycZxHTIK.jpg','1982-12-08',109,'Released',NULL,'The Party 2',171,3.7,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8438,_binary '\0','/parHqUVYqPVtRPiSaoQkjRrznBY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083693',6.4,1882,'en','Brimstone & Treacle','A mysterious stranger inserts himself into a troubled family\'s life, blurring the lines between good and evil as he cares for their disabled daughter.','/rcR0B75hEY5gO7S0fnXVUnnn1EF.jpg','1982-10-01',87,'Released','Mirror, mirror on the wall, who wreaks havoc on us all?','Brimstone & Treacle',73116,1.6577,5.9,'wBAWUKWm2E0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8439,_binary '\0','/zQGJm9GUaBBLAFDNVZ5JKqOFn9m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083694',6.2,3178,'en','Britannia Hospital','Britannia Hospital, an esteemed English institution, is marking its gala anniversary with a visit by the Queen Mother herself. But when investigative reporter Mick Travis arrives to cover the celebration, he finds the hospital under siege by striking workers, ruthless unions, violent demonstrators, racist aristocrats, an African cannibal dictator, and sinister human experiments.','/jbqfoco8nzpaPEHSxQIBTgGpAed.jpg','1982-05-27',116,'Released','Will they ever recover...?','Britannia Hospital',26639,2.9231,6.2,'sl3z95reTxU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8440,_binary '\0','/5pDoHPXtrCBy7Ol0TyWkITKO7b8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083701',7,2458,'en','Bugs Bunny\'s 3rd Movie: 1001 Rabbit Tales','If Bugs Bunny were to direct his signature inquiry--\"What\'s up, doc?\"--toward the modern-day Warner Bros. creative team, he wouldn\'t be far off. For 1001 Rabbit Tales, they\'ve doctored up a batch of classic cartoons featuring the carrot muncher and his bumbling comrades and bundled them, near seamlessly, into a feature-length film. Here\'s the premise: Bugs and Daffy, both book salesmen, are competing to sell the most copies of a kids\' book. Instead of burrowing a beeline to his sales territory (he should have made a left at Albuquerque), Bugs ends up in the castle of Yosemite Sam, here a harem-leading honcho. Sam\'s pain-in-the-spurs son, Prince Abalaba, needs somebody to read him stories; Bugs, who\'d sooner take the job than suffer the alternative, that involving being boiled in oil, signs on.','/wDXqtMTh88qCY0afA6JSXTxYHn3.jpg','1982-11-19',74,'Released','The movie that leaves all other sequels behind!','Bugs Bunny\'s 3rd Movie: 1001 Rabbit Tales',26730,2.9841,7.164,'X1fF5PFPyYg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8441,_binary '\0','/7xZdsIpgyDJtxEctCOM2xDmauwA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083702',7.9,9296,'en','Burden of Dreams','The Amazon rain forest, 1979. The crew of Fitzcarraldo (1982), a film directed by German director Werner Herzog, soon finds itself with problems related to casting, tribal struggles and accidents, among many other setbacks; but nothing compared to dragging a huge steamboat up a mountain, while Herzog embraces the path of a certain madness to make his vision come true.','/qJuD9yZ7Mn9QCVqKO9WarNNYo4R.jpg','1982-10-01',97,'Released',NULL,'Burden of Dreams',42124,1.9887,7.6,'IbAk8IZrWmc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8442,_binary '','/ppQt4tOt0i7vmc97JJkqDvzdHRQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083707',6.2,1227,'en','Café Flesh','In the future, humans are divided into Sex Negatives and Sex Positives. The Negatives get sick if they have sex, so every night they go to Café Flesh to see Positives who are forced to perform on stage for their entertainment.','/1zvAU3M1eBb0AYNYACWt18OQSL3.jpg','1982-11-20',75,'Released','THE TIME... Five Years After The Nuclear War. THE SURVIVORS... Post-Nuke Thrill Seekers Lookin\' For A Kick.','Café Flesh',30824,0.05,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8443,_binary '\0','/bDnVkPvPYUW1L8eiAGo9atI75lI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083715',5.6,2545,'it','Cane e gatto','A Lothario, in trouble for fooling around with a Senator\'s wife, becomes an unwitting witness to a mob murder. Police Lieutenant Parker tries to solve the case in enough time to take his long-suffering family on vacation.','/zs81YnizFSwcNZHxUyCY7CCjSH5.jpg','1983-02-11',101,'Released','May the \'Police Farce\' be with you...!','Thieves and Robbers',11613,2.8802,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8444,_binary '\0','/4pgCm4Z8vH4NVyxB8fDMnhiViUk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083717',6.6,4398,'en','Cannery Row','Doc, who has just moved to Cannery Row, realizes that the only entertainment is the brothel. There he meets the spunky Suzy and they fall in love, giving them both a renewed chance at life.','/4U0NCom1slWMgGL9dCKsQdq82fP.jpg','1982-02-12',120,'Released','You don\'t have to be crazy to live here... but it helps.','Cannery Row',25297,1.9648,5.9,'s9rHCftqjDo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8445,_binary '\0','/f6bYn4s7fa24XVzUvvkbezc81aw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083722',6.2,26918,'en','Cat People','After years of separation, Irena Gallier and her minister brother, Paul, reunite in New Orleans. When zoologists capture a wild panther, Irena is drawn to the cat – and zoo curator Oliver to her. Soon, Paul will have to reveal the family secret: that when sexually aroused, they revert into predatory jungle cats.','/nYcQnkbTD4LDmp11HCReQuUoMKD.jpg','1982-04-02',118,'Released','They are something more than lovers who are about to become something less than human.','Cat People',6217,5.9342,6.1,'-S6RdNgB-Lg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8446,_binary '\0','/oRtZcgMPOalplWExLkW6wij2eW6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083726',6.2,3049,'en','The Challenge','Rick, a down-and-out American boxer, is hired to transport a sword to Japan, unaware that the whole thing is a set up in a bitter blood-feud between two brothers, one who follows the traditional path of the samurai and the other a businessman. At the behest of the businessman, Rick undertakes samurai training from the other brother, but joins his cause. He also becomes romantically involved with the samurai\'s daughter.','/j91nghOu6UDRXGUHoxOwZXMqgo3.jpg','1982-07-23',109,'Released','He has trained every thought, every muscle, every nerve, for the moment of truth!','The Challenge',39274,2.0786,5.9,'vwZupRgKY34','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8447,_binary '\0','/7XTfI78Iy5KVmUG1IR3pc9QCdQ1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083727',6.6,2013,'fr','Chambre 666','During the 1982 Cannes Film Festival, Wim Wenders asked a number of global film directors to, one at a time, go into a hotel room, turn on the camera, and answer a simple question: \"What is the future of cinema?\"','/pnYr6mght2wysxekHpTZQJxy56q.jpg','1985-02-24',45,'Released','Is cinema a language about to get lost, an art about to die?','Room 666',118257,1.7033,6.6,'-ueQimD3wO8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8448,_binary '\0','/iR97rVOrZSncn678PrF88TEJ01Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083728',7.1,2150,'en','Chan Is Missing','Two cabbies search San Francisco\'s Chinatown for a mysterious character who has disappeared with their $4000. Their quest leads them on a humorous, if mundane, journey which illuminates the many problems experienced by Chinese-Americans trying to assimilate into contemporary American society.','/tox88i0SL3Nv0E7dy5EBboN6j46.jpg','1982-04-24',76,'Released',NULL,'Chan Is Missing',14272,1.267,6.7,'OwS483iVZCg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8449,_binary '\0','/a7sOwNj0uXTPE8PY2seDlsT41LN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083730',7.1,2295,'ru','Чародеи','In a small Russian town, there is a Research Institute for magic. One of the witches, Alyona Sanina, is going to marry a guy named Ivan Puhov (not a magician). A jealous Apollon Sataneev tells her boss Kira Shemahandskaya that Sanina is going to marry not Ivan Puhov, but Ivan Kivrin, whom Shemahandskaya is going to marry herself. Enraged, Shemahandskaya, who is a powerful witch, orders Sanina to forget about her Ivan and marry Sataneev instead. And this will be final unless Alyona kisses Puhov before midnight on New Year. Alyona\'s friends call Puhov to the rescue.','/1wC5WNWYKxosp9jcKPZvk9Q8HiW.jpg','1982-12-31',154,'Released',NULL,'Magicians',41977,1.1568,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8450,_binary '\0','/2MPZBIPVKN1iiTQrfY8qYDT6MdC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083734',5.8,1289,'fr','Le Choc','Martin Terrier wants to quit his job as a hired hitman, but his organized crime employers are unwilling to see him turned out to pasture, Terrier knows too much, and he is still useful to the organization. He escapes to the countryside where he meets Claire, and the two soon fall in love. Back in Paris to confront his employers, Terrier learns that they\'ve stolen all his money from the bank. They give him an ultimatum—do one last job for them and he gets his money and his freedom...','/tXSPRvXNK48THuuJzj8cfZXec41.jpg','1982-04-28',100,'Released',NULL,'The Shock',124352,1.8718,5.303,'Ev3HeATHY2M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8451,_binary '\0','/ke6cDBFg4IPb8MWjPOBlIhtosQ0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083739',6.5,14994,'en','Class of 1984','Andy is a new teacher at an inner city high school that is unlike any he has seen before. There are metal detectors at the front door and the place is basically run by a tough kid named Peter Stegman. Soon, Andy and Stegman become enemies and Stegman will stop at nothing to protect his turf and drug dealing business.','/qIu9UGDLeACl7YGuAAgTFfQ0j8I.jpg','1982-08-20',98,'Released','\"We are the future! ...and nothing can stop us.\"','Class of 1984',11564,4.7785,6.4,'9T81o2K29-c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8452,_binary '\0','/jisgzizpxQnMZ1qwfuQcYebEp4I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083743',7.1,1270,'es','La colmena','As in the novel of the same title from Camilo Jose Cela, \"La Colmena\" is a sad composition with the stories of many people in the Madrid of 1942, just the postwar of the spanish civil war. The main theme of the film is the contrast between the poets, surviving close to misery under the Franco\'s regime, and the winners of the war, the emerging class of the people that makes easy money with illegal business.','/uJUO2vceur1qsSH7EyfIPzzMs2r.jpg','1982-10-11',112,'Released',NULL,'The Beehive',104435,1.2077,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8453,_binary '\0','/zJvl00opIasv1T0l2v9BDSipLy8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083745',7.2,5857,'en','Come Back to the 5 & Dime, Jimmy Dean, Jimmy Dean','On the 20th anniversary of his death, the members of a James Dean fan club gather at a five-and-dime for a reunion.','/bnXigd6wq4XVfGLa67185cvXJuY.jpg','1982-11-12',110,'Released','A cup of coffee and a side of dreams.','Come Back to the 5 & Dime, Jimmy Dean, Jimmy Dean',67772,2.0091,5.9,'ENerUlAdviA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8454,_binary '\0','/8aqTmCHLkktH7RZNALeaOMneHSl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083767',6.8,58298,'en','Creepshow','Five grisly tales from a 1950s-style comic, including a murdered father rising from beyond, a bizarre meteor, a vengeful husband, a mysterious crate\'s occupant, and a plague of cockroaches.','/4SoyTCEpsgLjX6yAyMsx3AsAyRQ.jpg','1982-11-10',120,'Released','The most fun you\'ll ever have BEING SCARED!','Creepshow',16281,5.5034,6.903,'owdnnaNs2RI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8455,_binary '\0','/azsdBXsRuGPZNgAEYrpnfaPVDWg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083789',7.4,8523,'fr','Danton','Danton and Robespierre were close friends and fought together in the French Revolution, but by 1793 Robespierre was France\'s ruler, determined to wipe out opposition with a series of mass executions that became known as the Reign of Terror. Danton, well known as a spokesman of the people, had been living in relative solitude in the French countryside, but he returned to Paris to challenge Robespierre\'s violent rule and call for the people to demand their rights. Robespierre, however, could not accept such a challenge, even from a friend and colleague, and he blocked out a plan for the capture and execution of Danton and his allies.','/az5XParmpea0fxAjwEgHpUrXzw0.jpg','1983-01-12',136,'Released',NULL,'Danton',4202,4.3422,6.856,'zT4e8D80xXI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8456,_binary '\0','/dlIkuHYT977POygUBGZyOszFUB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083791',7.1,77968,'en','The Dark Crystal','On another planet in the distant past, a Gelfling embarks on a quest to find the missing shard of a magical crystal and restore order to his world, before the grotesque race of Skeksis find and use the crystal for evil.','/fZPxRaa6gvCyGCh9Xk5kyPqz7fp.jpg','1982-12-17',93,'Released','Another world, another time... in the age of wonder.','The Dark Crystal',11639,7.3072,7.2,'P5Dj3jhy7xM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8457,_binary '\0','/hhxrMW0WY30ulaCGMu5mVezktHQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083798',6.8,26062,'en','Dead Men Don\'t Wear Plaid','Juliet Forrest is convinced that the reported death of her father in a mountain car crash was no accident. Her father was a prominent cheese scientist working on a secret recipe. To prove it was murder, she enlists the services of private eye Rigby Reardon. He finds a slip of paper containing a list of people who are \'The Friends and Enemies of Carlotta\'.','/cwYwZBEE73PakUWzbICzxYKlXAz.jpg','1982-05-21',89,'Released','Laugh, or I’ll blow your lips off...','Dead Men Don\'t Wear Plaid',9442,4.3269,6.6,'OQMbPy1_5h8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8458,_binary '\0','/nMfMWPq0cnBvrxbzVjmhJuCWi3n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083801',5,1841,'en','Deadly Eyes','Corn grain contaminated with steroids produces large rats the size of small dogs who begin feeding on the residents of Toronto. Paul, a college basketball coach, teams up with Kelly, a local health inspector, to uncover the source of the mysterious rat attacks and they eventually try to prevent the opening of a new subway line as well as find the mutant rats nest quickly, or there will be a huge massacre of the entire city!','/6lBpTv2bIOZsqxWM4naEqdCMzHH.jpg','1982-10-23',87,'Released','Tonight they will rise from the darkness beneath the city... to feed!','Deadly Eyes',49332,1.939,5.6,'khywOKn-j6k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8459,_binary '\0','/f09U3JCbCvyWsz7pYyph9NhSYd8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083805',5.5,2166,'en','Death Valley','A divorced mother, her young son and her new boyfriend set out on a road trip through Death Valley and run afoul of a local serial killer.','/XHuvwszXiK1lc2B79PLQUSCnBV.jpg','1982-05-07',87,'Released','Not even a scream escapes.','Death Valley',72574,1.3171,5.1,'9dvziH7igGY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8460,_binary '\0','/pk5GvHFVB1a5ifKPrtFTcyLBWsO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083806',7,18126,'en','Deathtrap','A Broadway playwright puts murder in his plan to take credit for a student\'s script.','/fwrqCTcu5rAkU2dL2YqG6jjrLPn.jpg','1982-03-19',116,'Released','The trap is set... For a wickedly funny who\'ll-do-it.','Deathtrap',17590,3.4699,6.7,'8AQ2GlTw7x4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8461,_binary '\0','/oBtAhRbnXCDawtBiXF169WrXpbF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083824',5.8,1946,'fr','Deux heures moins le quart avant Jésus-Christ','In ancient Rome, a simple pepboy for chars becomes involved in a coup against Cesar. Rahatlocum is a North African Roman colony where Julius Caesar came to spend an expensive holiday. The revolt rumbles among the locals who find a leader in the person of Ben-Hur Marcel.','/jHMFNT9xvzEVkic5QW50CZeCkVE.jpg','1982-10-06',82,'Released',NULL,'Quarter to Two Before Jesus Christ',49398,2.717,6.04,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8462,_binary '\0','/teiop9EWCTTlQ833jrhUPKkK5fs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083833',7,23826,'en','Diner','Set in 1959, Diner shows how five young men resist their adulthood and seek refuge in their beloved Diner. The mundane, childish, and titillating details of their lives are shared. But the golden moments pass, and the men shoulder their responsibilities, leaving the Diner behind.','/2vKIdZ6JkFIzcQeaHg3xtdvOyRO.jpg','1982-03-05',110,'Released','Suddenly, life was more than French fries, gravy, and girls.','Diner',13776,3.7349,6.827,'__Q6_27KKEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8463,_binary '\0','/tKhQOzt1qM4TQvRWoIXjPCz4Wc6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083844',6.4,1706,'en','Don\'t Go to Sleep','One year after a young girl dies in a car accident, her sister begins seeing visions of her, while the family home is plagued by strange happenings.','/8ymD6s6w5ECAjG2c2Tm3ZhxFCsf.jpg','1982-12-10',93,'Released','Mary thinks there is something alive under her bed. Mary is right.','Don\'t Go to Sleep',85195,1.837,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8464,_binary '\0','/4cExyNONv6JNlOuBH1qcUvIyd8O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083851',7.2,12117,'en','The Draughtsman\'s Contract','R. Neville, a brash young draftsman, is hired to make a dozen landscape illustrations at the estate of Mr Herbert and his wife Virginia. Aside from monetary compensation, the arrangement includes a sexual liaison offered to Neville by Virginia while her estranged husband is away. But when the murdered body of Mr Herbert is discovered at the estate, mysterious clues found in Neville\'s drawings point to the identity of the killer.','/ljeTWR2kowGXijMc8LMuy72ULM3.jpg','1982-11-12',108,'Released','A landscape of lust and cunning.','The Draughtsman\'s Contract',10831,2.8565,7.1,'CmCMumlxfX0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8465,_binary '\0','/4OPMvIA3uyFdNm4v19RdOBK5JdN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083865',7.8,1591,'hu','Dögkeselyű','Two old women who happen to be pickpockets stole money from Simon, the taxi driver. The police are unable to find the thieves, so Simon decides to find them himself.','/qIhVUSqd5m9fZEfIfrd4KBnHdVM.jpg','1982-07-29',115,'Released',NULL,'The Vulture',96411,0.8582,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8466,_binary '\0','/mXLVA0YL6tcXi6SJSuAh9ONXFj5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083866',7.9,476817,'en','E.T. the Extra-Terrestrial','An alien is left behind on Earth and saved by the 10-year-old Elliott who decides to keep him hidden in his home. While a task force hunts for the extra-terrestrial, Elliott, his brother, and his little sister Gertie form an emotional bond with their new friend, and try to help him find his way home.','/an0nD6uq6byfxXCfk6lQBzdL2J1.jpg','1982-06-11',115,'Released','He is afraid. He is totally alone. He is 3,000,000 light years from home.','E.T. the Extra-Terrestrial',601,18.7832,7.518,'NsvdZ_z56c0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8467,_binary '\0','/fVE95lHDCtWJxT2h71bvD5XD25r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083869',6.8,10067,'en','Eating Raoul','A prudish married couple feel put upon by the swingers living in their apartment building. One night, by accident, they discover a way to both rid themselves of the “perverts” down the hall and simultaneously realize their dream of opening a restaurant.','/bwbp2QoDH0MWxcoJCbErsfQpJmr.jpg','1982-03-24',87,'Released','A tasty comedy of bad manners.','Eating Raoul',28940,2.5499,6.442,'qSq7GhMqPTE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8468,_binary '\0','/do4ucRbhjnTH5lMJXj4zz5mc1mC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083871',6.5,1505,'it','Eccezzziunale... veramente','Diego Abatantuono in the shoes of three huge fans: the Juventus truck driver Tirzan, the head of the ultra Milanese Donato and the Franco inter.','/e5spEevuXcY2NXPYbxPblUWNhNE.jpg','1982-03-04',98,'Released',NULL,'Eccezzziunale... veramente',38289,1.3017,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8469,_binary '\0','/gYBboRVFw198odH4xH5PkSOujZj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083885',5.8,1381,'en','Endangered Species','A retired New York cop on vacation in America\'s West is drawn into a sheriff\'s investigation of a mysterious series of cattle killings.','/lBmVdwGCTn9xrXwDKRkLN07nT7S.jpg','1982-09-10',97,'Released','What you don\'t know can kill you.','Endangered Species',65300,2.2866,4.9,'6GdBILv2DqE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8470,_binary '\0','/wIHzG3wMCYLhXWUlIttPDu9xDYB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083888',7.5,4192,'sv','Den enfaldige mördaren','The feeble-minded Sven\'s mother dies and he gets work as a farm-hand at the rich, affluent Höglund\'s farm. He has to work without pay and sleeps together with the cows. He meets the disabled Anna who is the first one to treat him as an adult. One day he has had enough of Höglund\'s maltreatment and moves in with Anna\'s family. Plot by Mattias Thuresson.','/jzKjJVWiUfHqScib0nb5tFgkmO3.jpg','1982-02-12',108,'Released',NULL,'The Simple-Minded Murderer',24129,2.4308,7,'bq1YWG2nesY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8471,_binary '\0','/9DOYTzJS25XTnbCAJqBfR9jaejX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083891',5.9,1920,'en','Enigma','Five highly-trained KGB agents are sent to the west to assassinate several Soviet dissidents. In order to stop the diabolical plot, an American agent must infiltrate Soviet intelligence and obtain information from a Russian computer.','/ecHQt4UVRsFMzVKFEutAXJ1C1Zu.jpg','1982-10-15',122,'Released','He was a man without a country. A face they couldn\'t trace. A man without a chance. An enigma.','Enigma',4628,2.1377,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8472,_binary '\0','/xsZpB16yOEMyZuBqgRdqhbedfvt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083906',5.9,4427,'en','Eureka','After striking it rich on a large gold strike, a prospector retires to the quiet life on a Caribbean island but ends up coping with an alcoholic wife, a headstrong daughter, and Miami mobsters who want to build a casino.','/fkeXtf4ePBRvrAAtOeytNwsUHxn.jpg','1983-05-01',130,'Released','Richer than Getty, stranger than Hughes, the bizarre tale of Jack McCann.','Eureka',37943,2.4786,5.31,'2osPsBXyoNM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8473,_binary '\0','/onq6lsJLX8ay5iwxEbKX3qJKeO9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083907',7.3,257004,'en','The Evil Dead','In 1979, a group of college students find a Sumerian Book of the Dead in an old wilderness cabin they\'ve rented for a weekend getaway.','/54C1qdaiSijIU5NeNb4WsPJdNkG.jpg','1983-01-16',85,'Released','The ultimate experience in gruelling terror.','The Evil Dead',764,16.5707,7.3,'0cQmKgV0cug','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8474,_binary '\0','/kv20JYfmzLyYi1vV0ocryyju3zl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083908',7.1,24457,'en','Evil Under the Sun','An opulent beach resort provides a scenic background to this amusing whodunit as Poirot attempts to uncover the nefarious evildoer behind the strangling of a notorious stage star.','/rQNMZoVVURf9YyYiBTsrOTEKALH.jpg','1982-03-05',117,'Released','Evil is everywhere. Even in paradise.','Evil Under the Sun',4193,6.2299,6.882,'ySOqao8nB0A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8475,_binary '\0','/xWAXwiPdC4gH7kkSXGMdghiM5Qs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083909',7,2306,'en','The Executioner\'s Song','In this fact-based made-for TV film, Gary Gilmore, an Indiana man who just finished serving a lengthy stay in prison, tries to start anew by moving to Utah. Before long, Gary begins an ill-advised romance with the troubled Nicole Baker, a teenage single mother. As their relationship quickly deteriorates, Gary goes on a murderous rampage, leaving two dead. During his trial, he demands capital punishment; a media circus ensues and outsiders look to profit from his story.','/32ymu9RHJ5shUuJI5fmY8LiMwr7.jpg','1982-09-10',135,'Released','The story of two people who fell in love.....and kept on falling.','The Executioner\'s Song',19373,2.9486,5.8,'a2-swVvfZyg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8476,_binary '\0','/8reX3CMog1QHqGoym2Esvuk5MnK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083922',8.1,71857,'sv','Fanny och Alexander','As children in the loving Ekdahl family, Fanny and Alexander enjoy a happy life with their parents, who run a theater company. After their father dies unexpectedly, however, the siblings end up in a joyless home when their mother, Emilie, marries a stern bishop. The bleak situation gradually grows worse as the bishop becomes more controlling, but dedicated relatives make a valiant attempt to aid Emilie, Fanny and Alexander.','/q8jlA3Wc1Z987hNKRFA44g5OugC.jpg','1982-12-17',188,'Released',NULL,'Fanny and Alexander',5961,5.1378,7.8,'UCXoXFdNa1o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8477,_binary '\0','/1A4OTl5yRkFxVi60tGUpr7YNWSw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083925',7.1,1408,'fr','Les fantômes du chapelier','A hatter in a provincial town (Michel Serrault) leads the life of a respectable citizen but is in fact a serial murderer. The only person to suspect this is his neighbour the tailor (Charles Asnavour).','/aszKckJOrQvZmX3GuZ9MweqUmM.jpg','1982-05-26',120,'Released',NULL,'The Hatter\'s Ghost',55035,1.7568,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8478,_binary '\0','/mHbnNX6jxpndW03yGXslHcBOaZv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083929',7.1,126322,'en','Fast Times at Ridgemont High','A group of Southern-California high school students ignore their studies in favor of indulging in their teenage distractions.','/e15rmfjf0m6EGLe4MnNhwD3Dd1W.jpg','1982-08-13',90,'Released','At Ridgemont High, only the rules get busted!','Fast Times at Ridgemont High',13342,8.7624,6.797,'Of5jkwF3J7A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8479,_binary '\0','/nV5bIMguQKNVmuO9NGvZcInjcul.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083931',7.8,3989,'hu','Fehérlófia','A horse goddess gives birth to three powerful brothers who set out into the Underworld to save three princesses from three evil dragons and reclaim their ancestors\' lost kingdom.','/cYYYIfBFG5nszjDk5xea4MQHyDS.jpg','1981-10-22',86,'Released',NULL,'Son of the White Mare',41077,3.0339,7.645,'nl1MZ3x0sNE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8480,_binary '\0','/awUAZoAvUbdCUgRvc3XLO0qaKkU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083941',6.4,4254,'en','Who Dares Wins','When SAS Captain Peter Skellen is thrown out of the service for gross misconduct due to unnecessary violence and bullying, he is soon recruited by The People\'s Lobby, a fanatical group aiming to hold several US dignitaries hostage. But Skellen\'s dismissal is a front to enable him to get close to the terrorist group. Can he get close enough to stop the Lobby from creating an international incident?','/v3SmUZCJweaS4LzltjmXC2x5vTK.jpg','1982-08-26',125,'Released','The 60 second war begins now!','Who Dares Wins',19322,3.3381,6.3,'m3woLvvYQxg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8481,_binary '\0','/3mOZ5ZpU3TeibDjFkUV7NkqfX4q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083943',5.9,31763,'en','Firefox','The Soviets have developed a revolutionary new jet fighter, called \'Firefox\'. Worried that the jet will be used as a first-strike weapon—as there are rumours that it is undetectable by radar—the British send ex-Vietnam War pilot, Mitchell Gant on a covert mission into the Soviet Union to steal the Firefox.','/xP6VaKdFEriMzPXe3j5YyDF3ryS.jpg','1982-06-18',136,'Released','...the most devastating killing machine ever built... his job... steal it!','Firefox',10724,8.1527,6.1,'T5W4MiBuEnY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8482,_binary '\0','/hCxxOJojCUFyuahDx167glJgp7E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083944',7.7,305763,'en','First Blood','When former Green Beret John Rambo is harassed by local law enforcement and arrested for vagrancy, he is forced to flee into the mountains and wage an escalating one-man war against his pursuers.','/a9sa6ERZCpplbPEO7OMWE763CLD.jpg','1982-10-22',93,'Released','This time he\'s fighting for his life.','First Blood',1368,24.5484,7.518,'M9Fy2Vq_SX8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8483,_binary '\0','/46iMqI1qzAtnXJxGRNCFwYNYqOo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083946',7.9,43678,'de','Fitzcarraldo','Fitzcarraldo is a dreamer who plans to build an opera house in Iquitos, in the Peruvian Amazon, so, in order to finance his project, he embarks on an epic adventure to collect rubber, a very profitable product, in a remote and unexplored region of the rainforest.','/oBCnYEKcg1rMhr5JjDnrRpilvDd.jpg','1982-03-02',157,'Released','Dare to dream the impossible.','Fitzcarraldo',9343,4.6855,7.6,'H_OgtTZMSXI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8484,_binary '\0','/5hRn3i3lD2hLB08ivUyvrf7Haz8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083947',6.1,1431,'en','Five Days One Summer','A 1930s Scottish doctor goes climbing in the Alps with an infatuated niece he passes off as his wife.','/pAu8cdw7QExCFE6lpw0XPNk7FLA.jpg','1982-11-12',108,'Released','An obsession, a love, a memory.','Five Days One Summer',89571,2.628,5.7,'S7pll9qRXaA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8485,_binary '\0','/cEobU3Z74T6zRppJRyqI3tx6igB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083959',5.1,7745,'en','Forbidden World','In the distant future, a federation marshal arrives at a research lab on a remote planet where a genetic experiment has gotten loose and begins feeding on the dwindling scientific group.','/5iDgpYgCbaEs0IpUY33X4BTDwJk.jpg','1982-05-07',77,'Released','Part alien … part human … all nightmare.','Forbidden World',42251,2.7797,5.3,'0jU6GbOuEZw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8486,_binary '\0','/x6wKuV2Ip1M3DhmfDAGn4O3w61f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083960',5.6,3907,'en','Forced Vengeance','A casino security guard is forced into violence from when the Hong Kong mob threatens his friends.','/3AaPWvywczDIeGFCjUvohBIMzJL.jpg','1982-07-30',90,'Released','A walking weapon that never misses!','Forced Vengeance',32065,3.5528,5.5,'TLetzL3SN7M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8487,_binary '\0','/gPpgjFsSBc9hWHvxyK40GppUcNE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083967',7.2,9475,'en','Frances','The true story of Frances Farmer\'s meteoric rise to fame in Hollywood and the tragic turn her life took when she was blacklisted.','/eyUq8VBgoHncr0cXFTKgg3VPyfi.jpg','1982-12-03',140,'Released','Her story is shocking, disturbing, compelling... and true.','Frances',3526,2.8512,6.872,'7GBOE5YPlwk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8488,_binary '\0','/dtEkXmWPRwja6CtwPFcVpuMb7tW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083972',5.6,68905,'en','Friday the 13th Part III','An idyllic summer turns into a nightmare of unspeakable terror for yet another group of naïve friends. Ignoring Camp Crystal Lake\'s bloody legacy, one by one they fall victim to the maniacal Jason, who stalks them at every turn...','/9kukTSlgFgXnQGdpcHvHcpTDiUc.jpg','1982-08-13',95,'Released','A new dimension in terror…','Friday the 13th Part III',9728,8.3164,5.88,'SDdBhDJ7wdA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8489,_binary '\0','/mBqeB3Lg02rJDz0m6bviHndTIYn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083973',4.7,2169,'en','Frightmare','Drama students decide to pay tribute to their favorite horror star by stealing his body from his crypt for a farewell party. They fail to realize their violation of the tomb has triggered powerful black magic, and Conrad hasn\'t taken his final bows yet.','/joQ36TBtUfMlQilc44gcRiY5Nqv.jpg','1983-07-27',86,'Released','To the limit...','Frightmare',85198,1.9268,4.577,'mRrtGtKO3bU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8490,_binary '\0','/NZJrp4ufy2tYjhXUppnZbLjVHq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083976',5.1,2360,'en','Cries in the Night','A young woman arrives at her grandmother\'s house, which used to be a funeral home, to help her turn the place into a bed-and-breakfast inn. After they open, however, guests begin disappearing or turning up dead.','/lglKODPrvTuLGgqEJbPSlHDHG8l.jpg','1980-10-03',93,'Released','They were warned, they were all warned...Don\'t go down to the cellar!','Cries in the Night',71503,1.9839,5.13,'0Arv22Lgafo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8491,_binary '\0','/gum3tuO1zKHBdElSQPS08PJ1w67.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083987',8,247103,'en','Gandhi','In the early years of the 20th century, Mohandas K. Gandhi, a British-trained lawyer, forsakes all worldly possessions to take up the cause of Indian independence. Faced with armed resistance from the British government, Gandhi adopts a policy of \'passive resistance\', endeavouring to win freedom for his people without resorting to bloodshed.','/rOXftt7SluxskrFrvU7qFJa5zeN.jpg','1982-12-01',192,'Released','His triumph changed the world forever.','Gandhi',783,7.9935,7.6,'vziq3CA_C30','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8492,_binary '\0','/gQQrbB0PkA1XWttFyl5zUn7SQ5j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0083996',6.2,9273,'fr','Le Gendarme et les Gendarmettes','Cruchot\'s police office moves into a new building. They do not only get high tech equipment, but also four young female police officers to educate. All of them scramble to work with them -- and cause pure chaos while being distracted by the fine ladies. Then they get into real trouble when one after the other of their female colleagues is kidnapped.','/l9jLkaM30pm99rNWketbGo3AtFO.jpg','1982-10-03',100,'Released',NULL,'The Gendarme and the Gendarmettes',11915,4.1019,6.035,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8493,_binary '\0','/6WHVG3RzDVsir5y4sB8E4YJZUqd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084018',5.7,1430,'it','Grand Hotel Excelsior','Taddeus is the manager of the Grand Hotel Excelsior. The Summer season begins in May and since then many odd persons frequent the hotel. There is Ilde Vivaldi, in love with Taddeus and the boxer Pericle Coccia who has an important match and falls in love with Maria. There is the Mago di Segrate trying to win world fame by levitating thirty meters high. And there is the waiter Egisto whose daughter is in a Swiss College believing her father is a man of importance.','/4PEoY5oquthqwZdOrt2996ETast.jpg','1982-10-07',111,'Released',NULL,'Grand Hotel Excelsior',38271,1.5858,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8494,_binary '\0','/oScpMm0gmUMf7EY6vKomi7tboc6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084021',4.6,41773,'en','Grease 2','It\'s 1961, two years after the original Grease gang graduated, and there\'s a new crop of seniors and new members of the coolest cliques on campus, the Pink Ladies and T-Birds. Michael Carrington is the new kid in school - but he\'s been branded a brainiac. Can he fix up an old motorcycle, don a leather jacket, avoid a rumble with the leader of the T-Birds, and win the heart of Pink Lady Stephanie?','/ufWc8AR5D66lwB2UZvZ9xvGcDSD.jpg','1982-06-11',115,'Released','The Music and Feeling go on Forever.','Grease 2',9037,5.8102,5.3,'bIWUWksk8Ns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8495,_binary '\0','/3o0R2TDAyTaBsd0hS78NMj6cuvF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084028',5.3,4222,'it','Rosso sangue','A priest-doctor chasing a man with supernatural regenerative abilities, who has recently escaped from a medical lab, reaches a small town where the mutant goes on a killing spree.','/iFmnOINa3hB33W9LuBAMQsLGqiF.jpg','1981-10-01',94,'Released','Pray you survive the hunt.','Absurd',5421,5.2915,5.455,'RQNjESE_ZrM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8496,_binary '\0','/zwJDnWeRDrzPtNlvVnxjQ7uwPgq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084042',7.3,1473,'ar','حدوتة مصرية','After we last see him in \"Alexandria, Why?\" Egyptian filmmaker Yehia Mourad is in his thirties, and successful in his work, he has grown distant from his wife and children and suﬀers a symbolic blockage of the heart while shooting the final scenes of his latest film. After being flown to England for evaluation, it\'s determined that Yehia must undergo emergency surgery. Fact and fiction blend seamlessly—with healthy doses of cleverly absurdist fantasy—as the film explores the various personalities and forces that have made Yehia (and Youssef Chahine) the man he has become.','/z0zDBvwtKA34DKFu4TAaeOt5fWS.jpg','1982-09-27',120,'Released',NULL,'An Egyptian Story',123651,1.3238,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8497,_binary '\0','/8VGu9r2HCT9f9oHM54v2PvTEQN3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084045',7.4,1836,'tr','Hakkâri\'de Bir Mevsim','An urban Turkish teacher is transferred for political reasons to a backward Kurdish village in the mountains near the Iranian border. He is welcomed with distrust, but during that harsh year the mutual cultural misunderstandings fade away.','/wD5RlQFWI0HkGLv7d2XKWxX2sZw.jpg','1983-01-02',110,'Released',NULL,'A Season in Hakkari',263547,1.2432,6.8,'Vuh05NfkSG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8498,_binary '\0','/1SiIky42dl9yB5BW25ADbxQHt3i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084049',5.7,3556,'en','Hanky Panky','Naïve Michael Jordon is drawn into a web of government secrets when a girl carrying a mysterious package gets into a taxi with him. When she\'s later murdered, Michael becomes the chief suspect and goes on the run.','/ecEgoav8AqNWiPpAr4dZWrPm1d6.jpg','1982-06-04',103,'Released','When you\'re wanted for a murder you didn\'t commit, chased for secrets you didn\'t steal, and running from people who want to kill you, the worst mistake you can make is falling in love...','Hanky Panky',25001,3.3981,5.3,'DObluZx_ShM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8499,_binary '\0','/6YuxS3EY13Dqyu0holYCRoZrHdk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084058',6.4,2426,'en','Heat and Dust','Anne is investigating the life of her grand-aunt Olivia, whose destiny has always been shrouded with scandal. As Anne delves into the history of her grand-aunt, she is led to reconsider her own life.','/sfPW0AZAy2IU5rXN6mXOk4TXPkH.jpg','1983-01-01',133,'Released',NULL,'Heat and Dust',67794,2.4001,6,'8Q39fIVE9WQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8500,_binary '\0','/3dImuwqmgzKW82MtwYo0eCB0vI9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084070',6.1,1557,'en','Hey Good Lookin\'','In 1953 Brooklyn, charismatic hood and The Stompers leader Vinnie Genzianna, his friend and second-in-command Crazy Shapiro, and their respective girlfriends Roz and Eva get wrapped up in an escalating conflict with the rival Black gang, The Chaplains, lead by Boogaloo Jones.','/fIt4qBa6CPMcaC8MMjPsi14Llqs.jpg','1982-10-01',77,'Released','Ralph Bakshi, creator of \"Fritz the Cat\" and \"Heavy Traffic\" brings you the outrageous \'50s the way they really were.','Hey Good Lookin\'',32202,1.7888,5.5,'s_RRdJjbuMI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8501,_binary '\0','/zqoWkhg7Z82Yg2vjnQnltcSpI5k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084085',6.5,1501,'fr','L\'Homme blessé','A fleeting encounter in a train station draws a withdrawn young man into a shadowy world of desire and danger. As obsession deepens, innocence destroyed, and an irreversible transformation begins.','/5nANrxycKkV70hpUL0JB2iKLrNI.jpg','1983-05-25',110,'Released','Out of the Shadows.','The Wounded Man',2304,2.2587,5.7,'2L1ooVmp75k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8502,_binary '\0','/bffk4DDqj1353BOKz9TnD1v6nj6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084088',6.6,10365,'en','Honkytonk Man','During the Great Depression, a young boy leaves his family\'s Oklahoma farm to travel with his country musician uncle who is trying out for the Grand Ole Opry.','/aRTtUYJrg53jhK8DiHu4SC31yfp.jpg','1982-12-15',123,'Released','The boy is on his way to becoming a man. The man is on his way to becoming a legend.','Honkytonk Man',37917,3.3094,6.3,'JC84Kax2a0E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8503,_binary '\0','/bIz9u9hrGgOaoBjLrTKBnuqMLJC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084090',4.1,5034,'en','Inseminoid','A crew of interplanetary archaeologists is threatened when an alien creature impregnates one of their members, causing her to turn homicidal and murder them one by one.','/2jMmN4nuRC0xBDxN3RDQ5WWkL2L.jpg','1981-01-23',91,'Released','Conceived in violence, carried in terror, born to devastate and brutalize a universe!','Inseminoid',46364,2.5942,4.124,'7SMwavgzjxM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8504,_binary '\0','/t9FHQ5CVKGsRFtgQVa8Cbjegqzg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084096',4.6,1582,'en','The House Where Evil Dwells','At the prompting of his diplomat friend, Alex, writer Ted Fletcher takes his wife, Laura, and daughter, Amy, on an extended working holiday. Alex finds a house for them in Kyoto, Japan, and the Fletchers move in, laughing off rumors that the place is haunted. But the ghost of 19th-century samurai Shigero turns out to be very real, and is intent on making the family re-enact an ancient murder-suicide.','/kfG3zZd6eUON364BSJn3psEQlBw.jpg','1982-05-14',88,'Released','An ancient curse has turned their lives into a nightmare of lust and revenge.','The House Where Evil Dwells',86068,1.8577,4.1,'7600UZaMXsM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8505,_binary '\0','/7iNoVg8eNFF06dlFJxMlhIQjRAe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084100',6.3,1618,'en','The Hunchback of Notre Dame','Quasimodo, the hunchback bellringer of Notre Dame\'s cathedral, meets a beautiful gypsy dancer, Esmeralda, and falls in love with her. So does Quasimodo\'s guardian, the archdeacon of the cathedral, and a poor street poet. But Esmeralda\'s in love with a handsome soldier. When a mob mistakes her for a witch, it\'s up to Quasimodo to rescue her and claim sanctuary for her in the cathedral.','/AltsK3wrdWJLUmwO3axZjjPNsvf.jpg','1982-02-02',102,'Released',NULL,'The Hunchback of Notre Dame',80385,2.5408,5.7,'5gh1ocxt72g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8506,_binary '\0','/l7bx8zOJDNUfeZtuU34gdtfv93a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084112',5.9,2059,'en','I, the Jury','Jack Williams was the best friend of Vietnam veteran and detective Mike Hammer. When Jack is murdered, Mike makes it his business to solve the crime. He is helped by his secretary Velda, and partly helped, partly hindered by the Chief of Police, Pat Chambers. On the trail of the killer, Mike discovers government conspiracies, and plots used by the CIA and the Mafia.','/11UUzdaxwPjX8Mfw1ZIpMTY3y6.jpg','1982-04-22',111,'Released','The cops, the mob, the broads, everyone\'s after Hammer!','I, the Jury',37191,2.5377,5.7,'p5G-m6lLBLI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8507,_binary '\0','/ApHMimmIYcIW0Foz17aTZNX7Ef3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084116',6.6,3610,'it','Identificazione di una donna','Movie director Niccolò has just been left by his wife. Subsequently he embarks on an obsessive relationship with a young woman who eventually leaves him and disappears while searching for her, he meets a variety of other willing girls. This gives him the idea of making a movie about women\'s relationships. He starts to search for a woman who can play the leading part in the movie.','/kdYb8WOQwMADvzOIeIhQzmvlInT.jpg','1982-10-15',128,'Released',NULL,'Identification of a Woman',53234,2.2593,5.866,'_t5Za_vuM70','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8508,_binary '\0','/d0uISP0ZxxSEWeKcAxzdCfFo9mD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084131',6.3,1530,'it','In viaggio con papà','Armando is the daddy, Cristiano is the adult son. Each of them lives his life in a different way respect the other: Armando is an old play-boy and often he \"buys\" his women with his money; Cristiano is a shy guy who lives in a community with other guys like him. The movie proceeds showing us, ironically, the differences, the different ways to think, to act, to treat the women between father and son.','/dAp4UQZIfQfJTyn7N4fdQdtSYRF.jpg','1982-12-18',108,'Released',NULL,'Journey with Papa',47245,1.6765,6.389,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8509,_binary '\0','/mJetKnZ27WdvaRxY1MA8Rcof6X5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084133',5.5,3609,'en','Incubus','In a small town in Wisconsin, a young teenage boy claims he has dreams of young women being brutally raped and murdered. A doctor and the local sheriff discover that the boy\'s dreams are real and that a sinister cult might be behind the brutal murders. They must track down the vicious killer, who may be the indestructible incarnation of a demon spawned from hell.','/ij2SMX25rcm3hd36pfuoad9gJJz.jpg','1982-02-24',93,'Released','He is the Destroyer.','Incubus',79319,2.6198,5.6,'4eOl5VGfXeo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8510,_binary '\0','/cmut591ASCNLH7XemJqjItn1C34.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084136',7.2,1518,'sv','Ingenjör Andrées luftfärd','The Swedish 19th century engineer Salomon August Andrée sets out to become the first man on the north pole. His idea is to launch a polar expedition using a hydrogen balloon, together with two friends. The balloon, \"The Eagle\", takes off from Svalbard in 1897, but the three men are never heard from again.','/azCz5nVSHUuHt3HQ99cZSNf2heA.jpg','1982-08-26',140,'Released','An insane dream to make the impossible possible.','The Flight of the Eagle',72785,2.0426,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8511,_binary '\0','/nIeDSslAKs7xZTrFOsCLWxVgQ0H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084157',6.7,6251,'en','Ivanhoe','Ivanhoe, a worthy and noble knight, the champion of justice returns to England after the holy wars, and finds England under the reign of Prince John and his henchmen and finds himself being involved in the power-struggle for the throne of England.','/rxlRUnpg8bFF1r2kBfB3w2rUAH4.jpg','1982-02-23',137,'Released','The adventure of a lifetime!','Ivanhoe',39382,2.8474,6.389,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8512,_binary '\0','/ijGHbdhjSxZSo9jiH6AZzsnNOL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084171',6,1612,'en','Jekyll and Hyde... Together Again','While conducting a research experiment intended to bring about an alternative to modern surgery, exhausted Los Angeles surgeon Dr. Daniel Jekyll falls asleep and accidentally inhales the white powders, transforming him into a wildly uninhibited nymphomaniac.','/o3CTFJuHGEBE9UzyXjGX6Vy74aC.jpg','1982-11-10',87,'Released','The comedy that examines modern living through chemistry.','Jekyll and Hyde... Together Again',3028,2.3117,5.037,'IxZK0VaKz1Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8513,_binary '\0','/qn409bhscdT6iWIn8JqiPwjfoDy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084173',4.7,1371,'en','Jinxed!','Harold, a professional gambler, and his girlfriend Bonita, a lounge singer, follow Willie, a young blackjack dealer, around the western U.S. Harold has a jinx on Willie and can\'t lose with him. Bonita and Willie meet and fall for each other and plot to do away with Harold and collect on his life insurance.','/x0qfhkkrKK9z1Sh2qbunXLTcp2m.jpg','1982-10-22',103,'Released','America\'s favorite tootsie is on a roll.','Jinxed!',79008,1.3367,4.5,'uZj-kY-DpQo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8514,_binary '\0','/srtEAbZSG6mDlretmXAiCjaxUcJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084189',6.2,4661,'sv','Jönssonligan & DynamitHarry','Sickan, Vanheden and Rocky try to rob the Berns nightclub one night, but Vanheden has made the mistake to invite his constantly drunk cousin, the old dynamiter Dynamite-Harry and he ruins the plan. Sickan is arrested, and has to spend 10 months in a small, locked room. When he is released, he has a new plan, but Rocky and Vanheden have decided to go straight. Together with Dynamite-Harry, Sickan plans to rob a cold store, managed by their arch-enemy, Wall-Enberg.','/rnwoaPImq7OJBUuIAxbEH0tpllC.jpg','1982-09-17',106,'Released',NULL,'The Jönsson Gang & Dynamite Harry',29224,1.4374,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8515,_binary '\0','/AvMZ2urQcgCONNmHkhPyHKwnUZP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084210',6,2709,'en','Kiss Me Goodbye','Not until three years after the death of her husband Jolly, Kay dares to move back into their former home, persuaded by her new fiancée Rupert. But soon her worst expectations come true, when not only her old memories haunt her, but also Jolly\'s ghost, who doesn\'t approve of her new mate. Invisible to anyone but Kay, he tries to prevent the wedding.','/jUhCiZb4iqG5xZgy66ewCLBd1lv.jpg','1982-12-22',101,'Released','A hauntingly romantic comedy.','Kiss Me Goodbye',81001,2.0712,5.9,'xPiF36HxBfU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8516,_binary '\0','/4Pw8XRiNuuvUiczCJqPuYCTvVqZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084228',6.1,5147,'es','Laberinto de pasiones','An array of outrageous people, including a desperate nymphomaniac and a terrorist with an acute sense of smell, seek love and happiness in Madrid.','/jkyRAC2RVfm65LPA6KdqdiobDe2.jpg','1982-09-29',94,'Released','The Craziest and Funiest!','Labyrinth of Passion',8219,2.2499,6.051,'3BP493nCWJU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8517,_binary '\0','/o5L8YjAV3TpNHD8sPFxSrrAOWhN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084234',6.3,11089,'en','The Last American Virgin','The friendship of a group of young friends struggling with teen sex, drugs, and work is jeopardized by a romantic interest which may turn pals into bitter rivals.','/ttGdSGgYDUGnPpJNyG2qGs4cd3C.jpg','1982-06-26',93,'Released','The comedy that puts ZIP into being a teen...','The Last American Virgin',27088,5.0461,6.631,'1GBLd8XJ3no','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8518,_binary '\0','/fwxOQkzYtRVKs3kzcyukdbsyIuh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084237',7.3,33680,'en','The Last Unicorn','A unicorn learns from a riddle-speaking butterfly that she is supposedly the last of her kind, all the others having been herded away by the monstrous Red Bull. The unicorn sets out to discover the truth behind the butterfly\'s words. She is eventually joined on her quest by Schmendrick, a second-rate magician, and Molly Grue, a middle-aged woman who dreamed all her life of seeing a unicorn. Their journey leads them far from home, all the way to the castle of King Haggard.','/MRHFtXTjxC74MGCzHACcuqvHiw.jpg','1982-11-19',93,'Released','There\'s magic in believing!','The Last Unicorn',10150,6.5115,7.3,'t-UpwWauZ50','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8519,_binary '\0','/8EwI75q6lirfo9PWRnMe9O0mKqc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084266',6.3,5069,'cn','龍少爺','Dragon and his madcap pal Cowboy spend their days getting into mischief, frustrating the elders, chasing girls, and competing in the village sport. When Dragon overhears a fiendish plot by smugglers to sell China\'s national treasures overseas, the pair leap into action. Also, Cowboy\'s wealthy father is kidnapped by the villainous and lethal Big Boss, and the scene is set for a furious martial arts showdown.','/qjQhm2jwV4DSTauOydFJVhVyMS3.jpg','1982-01-21',96,'Released','Fists and fun fly fast and furious when the Dragon Lord fights to save his nation\'s treasure.','Dragon Lord',16407,3.4089,6.539,'7jGg3TzP_cA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8520,_binary '\0','/pRUP4ToRA6aXD70jOAPf3kIlqFR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084267',7.2,2264,'cn','龍之忍者','A Japanese master of ninjutsu and a Chinese expert in kung fu, put their differences aside after their master is killed by a mortal enemy.','/gILpX25f0WoPNmKNpTZ3rVOq6Fi.jpg','1982-06-23',95,'Released',NULL,'Ninja in the Dragon\'s Den',18813,2.4209,7.7,'RmgggbpqYQs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8521,_binary '\0','/ozqCSHGpJz0cZmNS6yVFX0sWGMw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084287',7.2,8454,'en','Made in Britain','16-year-old skinhead Trevor has no regard for authority, and would rather spend his time stealing cars than sitting in the detention centre to which he is sent. Social worker Harry Parker tries his best, but Trevor is only interested when there\'s something in it for him. The centre authorities try to conform Trevor to the norms of society, but he takes no notice, and would rather speak in a torrent of four-letter words and racial abuse.','/8ygBME2MULEQVxqFZzBfje7Jnhz.jpg','1983-07-10',76,'Released','Trevor is an angry young man.','Made in Britain',31858,1.896,7.026,'7g48giVjmf0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8522,_binary '\0','/mcs99q0tnX67SSmfWktEhnlYkEW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084293',6.9,3259,'en','Making Love','A perfect typical LA couple find their happily-ever-after life broken when the husband confronts his long-repressed attraction for other men.','/wRH2fvcYqz0kZ1Gid6nJ7Y0t8gm.jpg','1982-02-12',113,'Released','There’s more to love than…','Making Love',41913,2.1014,6.9,'WaowR67NICg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8523,_binary '\0','/vlMzSehjjVmOsJzeMz4ef9y29sF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084296',7.2,10927,'en','The Man from Snowy River','Jim Craig has lived his first 18 years in the mountains of Australia on his father\'s farm. The death of his father forces him to go to the lowlands to earn enough money to get the farm back on its feet.','/1alAfoJf7Pjn0QuwzO9wY7SLQCt.jpg','1982-03-25',104,'Released','The story of a boy suddenly alone in the world. The men who challenge him. And the girl who helps him become a man.','The Man from Snowy River',24266,4.3933,7.006,'08rdCBgP-GY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8524,_binary '\0','/lLqmVSW3ozeOwjB9BiCPWE3gv8l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084298',4.9,3786,'it','Manhattan Baby','An archaeologist opens an Egyptian tomb and accidently releases an evil spirit. His young daughter becomes possessed by the freed entity and, upon their arrival back in New York, the gory murders begin.','/cHqAB06ofzOisT0kRRfiSeHdnHM.jpg','1982-08-12',89,'Released','It\'s looking at you... from hell!','Manhattan Baby',30875,1.3636,5,'cerwtYtMLnY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8525,_binary '\0','/pxr3jWnyCkT1PbB1uHdCUxLYy6M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084302',8.8,18321,'sr','Маратонци трче почасни круг','The Topalović family has been in the burial business for generations. When the 150-year-old Pantelija dies, five generations of his heirs start to fight for the inheritance.','/areHIloTHM5Es8hD4DgQgsjRhr9.jpg','1982-03-04',92,'Released',NULL,'The Marathon Family',29450,1.7362,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8526,_binary '\0','/8zteMEIB7WYGDQnEGi5vN0HEict.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084304',8.3,1550,'fa','مرگ یزدگرد','A poetic imagining of the circumstances leading to the death of Yazdgerd III, the last of the Sassanid kings of Iran. His death in 651, during the Arab invasions that brought Islam to this Zoroastrian realm, remains mysterious: his corpse is discovered in a mill, but the cause of death—and the whereabouts of his remains—are unknown.','/qbydlak7pDDH2malxcI3TsvteVP.jpg','1982-04-01',113,'Released','Marg-e Yazdgerd','Death of Yazdgerd',266225,1.0026,8,'sVJHpVWe7ek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8527,_binary '\0','/A3QZT4yMvLE8RsnBxISrWgTdzQq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084314',4.2,4864,'en','Mazes and Monsters','Bound together by a desire to play \"Mazes and Monsters,\" Robbie and his four college classmates decide to move the board game into the local cavern. Robbie loses his mind, and the line between reality and fantasy fuse into a harrowing nightmare.','/4i0ISVGGZczwl3RaTIAa8BMu6Df.jpg','1982-12-27',100,'Released','Danger lurks between fantasy and reality.','Mazes and Monsters',27348,3.3193,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8528,_binary '\0','/eOgq3wNremNJ5V3hxapQop7JXvP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084315',7.3,7740,'fr','Les maîtres du temps','On planet Perdide, an attack of giant hornets leaves young Piel alone in a wrecked car with his dying father. A mayday message reaches their friend Jaffar, an adventurer travelling through space. Onboard Jaffar’s shuttle are the renegade Prince Matton, his fiancée, and Silbad, who knows Perdide well. Thus begins an incredible race across space to save Piel.','/4ktdTOrJnSk7iCtX6Q2QR0sR9Je.jpg','1982-03-24',80,'Released',NULL,'Time Masters',22501,3.4071,7.267,'D4f4tprXSiA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8529,_binary '\0','/b3Yne4Ir8WSx4yQUgs2WU6NZ8j9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084316',3.7,4645,'en','MegaForce','MegaForce is an elite multi-national military unit that does the jobs that individual governments won\'t. When the peaceful Republic of Sardun in under threat from their more aggressive neighbor, the beautiful Major Zara and General Byrne-White see the help of Ace Hunter and MegaForce.','/hX5p2thHjpARwAs6MvBlrrvwutL.jpg','1982-06-25',99,'Released','There has never been a superhero like ACE HUNTER!','MegaForce',27380,2.4559,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8530,_binary '\0','/7Xvj0qarnOQaS6ClI0mbny84Hvr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084324',7.2,1653,'hi','मेरी जंग','When evil lawyer Thakral prosecutes innocent family man Deepak and sends him to his death, his family is shattered--and when his son Arun grows up, he\'s determined to avenge his parents\' suffering.','/iwOgiQbN9a9EJzPXnpZ7ANIcwBY.jpg','1985-08-11',164,'Released',NULL,'Meri Jung',54654,1.3999,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8531,_binary '\0','/jN8QlFopLe2i4Eyzl8WKyVvnMwW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084329',6.6,22107,'en','A Midsummer Night\'s Sex Comedy','A nutty inventor, his frustrated wife, a philosopher cousin, his much younger fiancée, a randy doctor, and a free-thinking nurse spend a summer weekend in and around a stunning - and possibly magical - country house.','/8ahPxayLX8STeSeCy2MRWt4YiYV.jpg','1982-07-16',88,'Released','Six characters in search of love','A Midsummer Night\'s Sex Comedy',8288,4.3336,6.5,'MsW2EFm3nSY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8532,_binary '\0','/49rQkLwYxUK7zQP69e87MspS4E2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084335',7.7,24649,'en','Missing','Based on the real-life experiences of Ed Horman. A conservative American businessman travels to Chile to investigate the sudden disappearance of his son after a military takeover. Accompanied by his son\'s wife he uncovers a trail of cover-ups that implicate the US State department which supports the dictatorship.','/fAAhC4RkpXu7SJgIESWQwVxcelo.jpg','1982-02-12',123,'Released','Ed Horman thought that being an American would guarantee his safety. His family believed that being Americans would guarantee them the truth. They were all wrong.','Missing',15600,2.9994,7.2,'HILCFL3-2ys','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8533,_binary '\0','/9oOX4acZZhEJAliPWCDnIC44WDs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084345',7.4,3042,'ru','Мой друг Иван Лапшин','Russian provincial town in the middle of the 1930s Stalin\'s Great Purge. Ivan Lapshin, the head of the local police, does what he has to do. And he does it well.','/cFz8PUfnEtN1KaNFnkhqJCB4FIc.jpg','1985-01-03',95,'Released',NULL,'My Friend Ivan Lapshin',83491,1.3446,6.655,'M-JdNriLu5g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8534,_binary '\0','/gAclP547gxtTuv2D4oJ2mgocwYv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084352',7.8,15167,'en','Monty Python Live at the Hollywood Bowl','Monty Python perform many of their greatest sketches at the Hollywood Bowl, including several from pre-Python days.','/7sQPWnIUVswWtIl35Lj3VKW3Pz0.jpg','1982-06-25',80,'Released','Never before in the history of human civilization has there been a movie called \"Monty Python Live at the Hollywood Bowl\"','Monty Python Live at the Hollywood Bowl',11949,3.5201,7.375,'bpWlcIlb-Q4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8535,_binary '\0','/idRGgGTYTRu0UVrc8qMyBiJeet8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084354',7.3,4086,'en','Moonlighting','A Polish contractor, Nowak, leads a group of workmen to London so they can provide cheap labor for a government official based there. Nowak has to manage the project and the men as they encounter the tempations of the West and loneliness and separation from their families. Nowak is the only one of the group who speaks English, and he uses this as a tool over his team. When the unrest in Poland leads to a military takeover, Nowak is faced with a much more difficult situation than he expected.','/bCYuIZAVCLVrjmTrSX6NETgIvUT.jpg','1982-09-26',97,'Released',NULL,'Moonlighting',42134,2.6106,7.1,'Kjf4f7ONltg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8536,_binary '\0','/s6wg0hdWZsYGwqJeRD2yqZBCpjv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084357',5.8,3059,'fr','La morte vivante','A toxic spill revives a beautiful, dead heiress who, with the help of her childhood friend, must quench her insatiable thirst for blood.','/42tNjk8Y9tqu1ooIzPO7UwuviEq.jpg','1982-10-23',86,'Released',NULL,'The Living Dead Girl',77010,1.8395,6,'1-94q5kFX7M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8537,_binary '\0','/yqonUMWpRIWZviIdKrNXWI2cmvJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084358',6.8,3239,'fr','Mortelle randonnée','A P.I. is obsessed with a cute woman, who seduces and kills rich men around W. Europe.','/oqAvTlI4eQM3om2Z8mWA0o0kSIw.jpg','1983-03-09',120,'Released','On the trail of a mystery, where obsession becomes a matter of life and death.','Deadly Circuit',62981,4.4343,6.112,'h_LNyK7STag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8538,_binary '\0','/SEAaID8GLohvL2K3szh4S1ZJID.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084359',5.7,1905,'en','Mother Lode','A couple of young adventurers go into the wilderness of British Columbia in search of a lost colleague. Their plane crashes and they find themselves at the mercy of a crazed old Scottish miner, who has lived in isolation for many decades searching the mountain caves for a chamber of long lost gold. He is prepared to do anything - including murder - to keep his gold for himself.','/dyhxbM4lSQjb3jvvSIpiru4HmKz.jpg','1982-08-06',103,'Released','The lure of Gold can make a man do anything. Anything.','Mother Lode',79257,3.139,5.692,'nxuZECT430k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8539,_binary '\0','/fzQ3ObTe924mzrq5M0qI64gzBvb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084370',7.3,11373,'en','My Favorite Year','Fledgling comic Benjy Stone can\'t believe his luck when his childhood hero, the swashbuckling matinee idol Alan Swann, gets booked to appear on the variety show he writes for. But when Swann arrives, he fails to live up to his silver screen image. Instead, he\'s a drunken womanizer who suffers from stage fright. Benjy is assigned to look after him before the show, and it\'s all he can do to keep his former idol from going completely off the rails.','/xksAhZJx1WmHM03OaePNe9IiEBt.jpg','1982-10-01',92,'Released','The year the dreams came true.','My Favorite Year',31044,2.6524,6.6,'JqQWY8T5nok','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8540,_binary '\0','/ojDhlnFd5GhueA3olHxcYJx430V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084385',7.2,3162,'hi','नमक हलाल','Young Arjun is brought up by his Daddu (paternal grandfather). His Daddu decides for him to go to the city in search of a new job and life. While in the city he meets up with Bhairon who guides him into an interview in a 5-star hotel owned by Raja.','/mPaT9BUc8RiBVdZ05VLTDuwdr56.jpg','1982-04-30',179,'Released',NULL,'Namak Halaal',51615,1.0206,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8541,_binary '\0','/76phbJ3Brq4VmpOomEOW9bNy8C5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084390',7.8,10093,'ja','楢山節考','In a small village in a valley everyone who reaches the age of 70 must leave the village and go to a certain mountain top to die. If anyone should refuse they would disgrace their family. Old Orin is 69. This winter it is her turn to go to the mountain. But first she must make sure that her eldest son Tatsuhei finds a wife.','/h3iNimtw6HsFTtAvEDF3XYZ4Y5T.jpg','1983-04-29',130,'Released','Only Time Could Change the Cruelty of Tradition… Only Their Love Could Survive It…','The Ballad of Narayama',42113,5.9514,7.5,'Lw08P2VDdgM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8542,_binary '\0','/fj2veI2FLhx6w6OS9XZRzvKlXkm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084395',4.6,2592,'en','Class Reunion','Lizzie Borden High\'s class of \'72 are going through the motions at their tenth-year reunion, until deranged alum Walter Baylor, driven insane by a sadistic senior-year prank, escapes from the mental institution and crashes the party. When guests start getting bumped off, the other alumni, including snooty yacht salesman Bob Spinnaker, class tease Bunny Packard, and class zero Gary Nash, spring into action to uncover the culprit.','/9Ci3ywt4fbrN6TP5iknNcQ1FHDf.jpg','1982-10-29',84,'Released','No class has less class than this class','Class Reunion',33374,1.9665,5,'cgP09BXk27I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8543,_binary '\0','/tj6ZHl9rxg86O8JH3wzGmhYuL0b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084408',6.2,5280,'en','Next of Kin','After Linda inherits a retirement home, she witnesses a series of strange events which seem connected to a dark and unspeakable evil.','/oIgyJIr0TJaolj6hj8PLoGMpxVg.jpg','1982-04-30',89,'Released','There is something evil in this house.','Next of Kin',84993,2.3034,6.2,'mZUxu8JcQI0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8544,_binary '\0','/1ohSQFrdDRVntlkgNqHxRVX3Xzj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084412',6.5,20203,'en','Night Shift','A nebbish of a morgue attendant gets shunted back to the night shift where he is shackled with an obnoxious neophyte partner who dreams of the \"one great idea\" for success. His life takes a bizarre turn when a prostitute neighbor complains about the loss of her pimp. His partner, upon hearing the situation, suggests that they fill that opening themselves using the morgue at night.','/iS78MFtMDwWDP748juZQBK57C9o.jpg','1982-07-30',106,'Released','Ever since two enterprising young men turned the City Morgue into a swinging business, people have been dying to get in.','Night Shift',14742,4.3802,6.1,'bE2zds0_9v0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8545,_binary '\0','/oWtUJSIfN4umPrwiHwawhMuDZlL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084422',7.2,5106,'it','La notte di San Lorenzo','The Night of San Lorenzo, the night of the shooting stars, is the night when dreams come true in Italian folklore. In 1944, a group of Italians flee their town after hearing rumours that the Nazis plan to blow it up and that the Americans are about to arrive to liberate them.','/u9QgkfHj90rr33KhjLlk5tr7bVg.jpg','1982-09-16',105,'Released',NULL,'The Night of the Shooting Stars',42130,2.3445,7.1,'ADIph1-og3o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8546,_binary '\0','/iu76fwO3PFTE3Lb9tthl14eFWz3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084423',7.2,2833,'fr','La Nuit de Varennes','During the French Revolution, a surprising company shares a coach, trying to catch up something - the time itself, perhaps.','/Af9qxvsxzv45VnszT1MKFbHj4NJ.jpg','1982-05-15',151,'Released',NULL,'That Night of Varennes',42131,2.8126,6.893,'_2u0LJdSqRM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8547,_binary '\0','/yM8zfS5tWMl8XuE3DVNdcouxw3Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084424',4.6,3438,'it','I nuovi barbari','Two mercenaries help wandering caravans fight off an evil and aimless band of white-clad bikers after the nuclear holocaust.','/u1CfbdztfE2WiLBVXtA6OFO1TLY.jpg','1983-06-10',91,'Released','Dealers in death... exterminators in the 21st century...','The New Barbarians',48490,2.1764,4.3,'oLm8Bvpmris','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8548,_binary '\0','/w1lWBgc1FWtS2EM0vksA6bZtRYw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084434',7.1,67082,'en','An Officer and a Gentleman','Zack Mayo is an aloof, taciturn man who aspires to be a navy pilot. Once he arrives at training camp for his 13-week officer\'s course, Mayo runs afoul of abrasive, no-nonsense drill Sergeant Emil Foley. Mayo is an excellent cadet, but a little cold around the heart, so Foley rides him mercilessly, sensing that the young man would be prime officer material if he weren\'t so self-involved. Zack\'s affair with a working girl is likewise compromised by his unwillingness to give of himself.','/69adZbLeRk5TNQ3e0008dMnde9p.jpg','1982-07-28',124,'Released','Life gave him nothing, except the courage to win...and a woman to love.','An Officer and a Gentleman',2623,8.2623,7,'VEpu6TcmcJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8549,_binary '\0','/5QEqz09x8tU3QS0VaNVhpZjuh8k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084445',6.5,9203,'en','One from the Heart','In a dazzling, dreamlike Las Vegas, longtime couple Hank and Frannie break up on their fifth anniversary and each pursue the fantasy of new love over one neon-soaked night—he with a free-spirited acrobat, she with a seductive musician. But as illusion and reality blur, both must decide whether passion or devotion truly defines the heart.','/5EyIQksa8C9tm82rHIJYGQXZ5Vs.jpg','1982-02-11',99,'Released','When Francis Ford Coppola makes a love story… don\'t expect hearts and flowers.','One from the Heart',41291,4.7569,5.9,'G8OdSGjOBR4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8550,_binary '\0','/8RMTSC8A1tA3zBJnnR9P3LRqQFK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084464',5.1,1785,'en','Pandemonium','A former high school student who always wanted to be a cheerleader decides to reopen the cheerleading program at her former high school after years of closure for being targeted by a serial killer.','/3e2POUduuwxQMejbmusZUtfkgeJ.jpg','1982-04-01',82,'Released','Finally, a movie that is totally taste-free.','Pandemonium',84784,1.5068,4.8,'pbME1773n2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8551,_binary '\0','/ciL1NT4CsnZ0MSebbrxkUwVfmSh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084465',7.1,1522,'hu','Panelkapcsolat','Using verite conventions, a young couple with a baby and a child are worn away by the monotony of their lives.','/7CnQdDj9lq45OA2wRJpsoIxYRto.jpg','1982-12-09',102,'Released',NULL,'The Prefab People',60261,1.7845,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8552,_binary '\0','/8f7TgUsnDTvJpdfOh6hPKmXiyuI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084469',4.9,3399,'en','Paradise','After their caravan is attacked and their respective families butchered by Arab marauders, teenagers David and Sarah flee across the desert. But the desert is filled with danger from the elements, animals and the unwholesome appetite of the Jackal, a sheik who wants Sarah for himself. However, the desert also holds temptation and love. David and Sarah hide out in an oasis and build a life for themselves, discovering each other in new ways.','/vPWQ02RbO82ijIede7SYHcnhzoT.jpg','1982-03-12',102,'Released','If only it could have been forever.','Paradise',23942,4.1892,6,'QMsP13Cj4L8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8553,_binary '\0','/5qVLF9WTdBDA08fsZ9H5clJ6umI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084472',4.1,3469,'en','Parasite','Paul Dean has created a deadly parasite that is now attached to his stomach. He and his female companion, Patricia Welles, must find a way to destroy it while also trying to avoid Ricus & his rednecks, and an evil government agent named Merchant.','/4DGPORlVIDIQvsuSDnM4uXKMjWS.jpg','1982-03-12',85,'Released','You will not feel the terror until you experience the movie!','Parasite',48311,3.3558,4.9,'cGnTUz_4EZE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8554,_binary '\0','/mTKi9Lf62Rd31F747o3mOPj83T6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084477',5.3,1644,'en','Partners','After a series of murders in Los Angeles\'s gay community, heterosexual police officer Sgt. Benson is assigned to go undercover as half of a gay couple with Officer Kerwin, a Records Clerk','/gHVThPfNan8kBdQdw6aSC9cbZu2.jpg','1982-04-30',93,'Released','Benson is a cop who wants to clean up the streets...his partner just wants to redecorate.','Partners',72340,1.6004,5.5,'ShskN6k4X5U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8555,_binary '\0','/zSZKZoNJz6stifCF7iFqPKfF0tp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084479',6.6,1317,'fr','La Passante du Sans-Souci','Max Baumstein is a reputable businessman who founded an international organization fighting against violations of human rights. Why would he commit an act that apparently negates the principles he has striven for so long to uphold? As he is tried for first-degree murder for killing a Paraguayan ambassador in cold blood, he reveals a secret about himself that he kept hidden from his wife Lina. His act is the conclusion of a struggle that started many decades earlier in his childhood...','/k67NPm1Id6Hl09oCdcCRqON2Axq.jpg','1982-04-14',110,'Released',NULL,'The Passerby',5063,3.0329,6.209,'N_llU9Nl7JM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8556,_binary '\0','/vYK9XjsqFL4z92J1lhXsLzx16iY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084481',6.2,3131,'fr','Passion','While shooting a film, the director becomes interested in the unfolding struggle of a young factory worker that has been laid off by a boss who did not like her union activities.','/hQ1zhDRbuNkN63eWTSKuHLKM6gs.jpg','1982-05-26',87,'Released','There are no rules.','Godard\'s Passion',32692,1.6296,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8557,_binary '\0','/54o7yGJVp4wbUaQVrCi7AwPtzHA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084488',6.1,11830,'en','Permanent Vacation','In downtown Manhattan, twentysomething Allie, whose father is not around and whose mother is institutionalized, is a big Charlie Parker fan. He almost subconsciously searches for meaning in his life and meets some idiosyncratic characters along the way.','/sISTkyG2cDOiox1Z4QvQf6r8NGf.jpg','1981-03-06',75,'Released',NULL,'Permanent Vacation',37997,2.1643,5.9,'B2Jc5Y1dmFE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8558,_binary '\0','/njsZ2rBTKXbwurqmA4h0OKlUnNM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084489',6.3,3560,'en','Personal Best','Young sprinter Chris Cahill is having difficulty reaching her potential as an athlete, until she meets established track star Tory Skinner. As Tory and her coach help Chris with her training, the two women form friendship that evolves into a romantic relationship. Their intimacy, however, becomes complicated when Chris\' improvement causes them to be competitors for the Olympic team.','/sQbIDpQ421ioiEhyo1VSXCDp1Si.jpg','1982-02-05',124,'Released','When you run into yourself you run into feelings you never thought you had.','Personal Best',27609,2.1746,5.9,'a5ukNSl3Z5Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8559,_binary '\0','/Ag4eANWzHEwC7rQVyvcGsL34ieP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084503',8,90616,'en','Pink Floyd: The Wall','A troubled rock star descends into madness in the midst of his physical and social isolation from everyone.','/aElHyIdF5jmctFGhlhhaPFsbBJC.jpg','1982-07-14',95,'Released','The memories. The madness. The music... The movie.','Pink Floyd: The Wall',12104,6.8972,8,'T3BBEX_pyQA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8560,_binary '\0','/lrnyM0Pfz9dwuBzVjpBXu2bzksL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084504',5.4,5195,'en','The Pirate Movie','Left behind by her friends on a boat trip, contemporary teen Mabel takes pursuit but is knocked unconscious on an island, where she has a dream involving pirates, sisters, a modern major-general, romance, and adventure.','/9tIR7zyExuzhJ9c9ZWHqCkJsSPB.jpg','1982-08-06',104,'Released','Buckle Your Swash and Jolly Your Roger for the Funniest Rock \'N Rollickin\' Adventure Ever!','The Pirate Movie',25872,2.0252,5.3,'E9jhc5SHkPo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8561,_binary '\0','/FwV9a72BGBtaRpAEwvPaYfCMon.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084509',7.7,10225,'en','The Plague Dogs','Two dogs, Rowf and Snitter, struggle to survive in the countryside after escaping from an animal research laboratory. They\'re pursued by search parties and then the military after rumours spread that they could be carrying the bubonic plague.','/aPlkqs5cmOgaZJhekW5CvGywSkx.jpg','1982-10-01',103,'Released','Escape to a different world...and share the adventure of a lifetime.','The Plague Dogs',30060,4.0223,7.8,'0vqWzquBh0c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8562,_binary '\0','/bvkPno6U02lLyvPWCnmibq4eIaN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084516',7.3,196940,'en','Poltergeist','The Freelings\' suburban home becomes the center of paranormal activity that opens a portal to the \'other side\'. With help, they must cross over to get their daughter back.','/4eMN3GANH5GG4kXdHkrTZEUuQ9M.jpg','1982-06-04',114,'Released','\"They\'re here.\"','Poltergeist',609,10.357,7.164,'29iJ5nsm5iM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8563,_binary '\0','/nJ59MBTjeN2gQfI20CtuRYbAJJ1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084518',7.5,1568,'ru','Полеты во сне и наяву','On the eve of his fortieth anniversary Sergei Makarov looks back at his life and learns that he has achieved nothing. He was not able to be happy and to bring happiness to the closest people in his life, neither to his long-suffering wife nor young mistress nor friends nor work... It is about the men who never grew up and could not find themselves in the time of stagnation – gifted, charming, but infantile and lost, they never were able to realize themselves...','/p3qjOc9jLl7QBoUIkF77JgoidPp.jpg','1983-01-17',92,'Released',NULL,'Flights in Dreams and in Reality',83486,1.5814,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8564,_binary '\0','/97f4GFF2Vv6v40Ee5S00nuvAr4i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084522',6.2,49380,'en','Porky\'s','In 1954 Florida, a group of high school boys head to a strip club in the Everglades in an attempt to lose their collective virginity. When the club\'s owner and his sheriff brother swindle them out of their money and embarrass them, the boys plan revenge.','/AqCOt1cWfKqCepxK7LIdT812idH.jpg','1981-11-13',94,'Released','Keep an eye out for the funniest movie about growing up ever made!','Porky\'s',10246,4.7559,6.4,'4GjwSezHG6Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8565,_binary '\0','/y9u7s3463LUy1K0Fz6WIl7r9nzx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084540',6.7,1872,'fr','Le Prix du danger','In a futuristic society, contestants pit their survival skills against each other in a fight to the death for cash prizes, and the contest is aired live on television.','/gqhdK3tEArToLDakoFtM6izqnT2.jpg','1983-01-25',100,'Released',NULL,'The Prize of Peril',51259,2.411,6.487,'NLXgvmmvi4E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8566,_binary '\0','/hTkBjpiUjzhrJEBE6b25hMfA9CW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084548',7.9,4116,'pl','Przesłuchanie','In Stalinist Poland, cabaret singer Tonia decides to spend the evening drinking with a group of friends. The next morning, she awakes to find that, for reasons unknown to her, she has been jailed as a political prisoner. As prison officials interrogate, torture and humiliate her, she fights for survival and to maintain her innocence by refusing to sign a false confession. As her years of imprisonment pass, her relationship with her captors grows more complicated.','/9v0ZByK1cradwYBmtmtrp2US8od.jpg','1989-12-13',118,'Released',NULL,'Interrogation',18614,2.1939,7.1,'vcWrYYdejjE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8567,_binary '\0','/eTSRN1Bwce60rpAORwkKbPRDT6V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084549',7.7,12430,'pl','Przypadek','Witek runs after a train. Three variations follow on how such a seemingly banal incident could influence the rest of Witek\'s life.','/rMnXNxBKF8TnYn9NSE2nPTFn5Fq.jpg','1987-01-10',114,'Released',NULL,'Blind Chance',127,2.1197,7.5,'3Oq_rrjEWHo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8568,_binary '\0','/wqDy23S6NJaPbUyVecv1WyCuMmy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084555',7.4,11654,'fr','Le père Noël est une ordure','Two neurotics, working for a suicide hotline on the night of Christmas Eve, get caught up in a catastrophe when a pregnant woman, her abusive boyfriend, and a cross-dresser visit their office.','/z86yqhtqmNxQN214OK4PUDbpBOq.jpg','1982-08-25',88,'Released','\"There was a very rude gentleman who wanted to fuck Therese!\"','Santa Claus Is a Stinker',14645,3.1196,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8569,_binary '\0','/16ipaP7TnijuXopfVeZG5LGVRG5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084556',6,10930,'en','Q','A fleeing gangland flunky discovers the New York nest of Aztec deity Quetzalcoatl, the man-eating flying serpent.','/uFdZ1e96OaV27Khii02JrYcm4uU.jpg','1982-09-08',93,'Released','Its name is Quetzalcoatl. Just call it Q. That\'s all you\'ll have time to say before it tears you apart!','Q',27726,3.9393,5.714,'9bjsag2vYlQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8570,_binary '\0','/cINtl1Bh47Ut4NhwLokLHQXgre0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084565',6.6,8719,'en','Querelle','French sailor Querelle arrives in Brest and starts frequenting a strange whorehouse. He discovers that his brother Robert is the lover of the lady owner, Lysiane. Here, you can play dice with Nono, Lysiane\'s husband: if you win, you are allowed to make love with Lysiane; if you lose, you have to make love with Nono... Querelle loses on purpose.','/7rakWIm1EeXvmInWljMqugxBqK2.jpg','1982-09-08',109,'Released','It will take you into a surreal world of passion and sexuality, further than most would dare to go.','Querelle',42135,3.7172,6.6,'Yc_UOKmPp2E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8571,_binary '\0','/itW5kKcm3B8F2iZEQGe0XU8ZHSA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084573',5.3,2757,'en','Raw Force','A group of martial arts students are en route to an island that supposedly is home to the ghosts of martial artists who have lost their honor. A Hitler lookalike and his gang are running a female slavery operation on the island as well. Soon, the two groups meet and all sorts of crazy things happen which include cannibal monks, piranhas, zombies, and more!','/tREHKq24p5vpMcOUy17Mbch70uv.jpg','1982-07-01',86,'Released','…Invaders of the Jade Tombs!','Raw Force',30644,1.8396,5.4,'oKZ-NjAzh0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8572,_binary '\0','/RH3yBITcVZsmYGvQG0PJP1ZtcJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084586',6.6,1319,'zh','人皮燈籠','A psychotic craftsman pits two rival Kung-Fu masters against each other while designing special lanterns from a disturbing source.','/v5a25FBIPqzVvLqhrBhUvMoB7mk.jpg','1982-07-14',99,'Released',NULL,'Human Lanterns',64992,2.4278,6.1,'96YQR1n6ycY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8573,_binary '\0','/qKkSrN52k5XXltaBhhBMWKqqIdG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084589',7.4,5303,'fr','Le Retour de Martin Guerre','Village of Artigat, southern France, summer 1542, during the reign of Francis I. Martin Guerre and Bertrande de Rols marry. A few years later, accused of having committed a robbery, Martin suddenly disappears. When, almost a decade later, a man arrives in Artigat claiming to be Martin, the Guerre family recognizes him as such; but doubts soon arise about his true identity.','/wNMjsqJYUt79YYwdO43OF7mpAKV.jpg','1982-05-14',107,'Released','Truth and falsehood have both alike countenances...','The Return of Martin Guerre',4483,2.7597,6.7,'0AN8bS3bvlM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8574,_binary '\0','/66fSPNuzWxvqaboYAoWhUkEdQOX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084591',6.8,1482,'en','Reuben, Reuben','A drunken Scottish poet who has not written a word in years feels compelled to regain control of his life and work after meeting a beautiful young woman.','/bFSkGEkFuJQ8wl09xLVEDY6FEqU.jpg','1983-12-19',101,'Released','Congratulations Gowan, you\'ve finally turned failure into an art form!','Reuben, Reuben',31944,1.0724,6.4,'Ls6In41vXOo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8575,_binary '\0','/tLhQsabJnYbs1oCK0JgcZ4DPRnL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084597',7.6,4809,'en','Richard Pryor: Live on the Sunset Strip','Richard Pryor\'s stand-up act includes his frank discussion about his freebasing addiction, as well as the infamous night on June 9, 1980 that he caught on fire.','/rK9eAYCr68dwv1mw4weaJu6Lx3W.jpg','1982-03-12',82,'Released',NULL,'Richard Pryor: Live on the Sunset Strip',21923,1.4666,7.425,'Ta3HlhFICcg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8576,_binary '\0','/ljOHSIyTbxdkQFjcJyWKfGm2i2r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084602',6.9,232586,'en','Rocky III','Following Rocky Balboa\'s intense battle with his most powerful adversary yet – the ferocious Clubber Lang – Rocky joins forces with former rival Apollo Creed in an effort to get back his fighting spirit.','/uqw16i2kmwVqkJHzjzbDU4xZ0Pl.jpg','1982-05-28',100,'Released','The greatest challenge.','Rocky III',1371,9.9012,6.907,'o7vbDPUMWDc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8577,_binary '\0','/ooAZ163OMcF7uPcTBaqAhvOHdNH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084620',7.6,1788,'cs','S tebou mě baví svět','Three middle-aged go for a vacation into the mountains with their children. How will they cope with their youngsters every-day needs without their wives? The annual men\'s ride of three fathers becomes something like a kindergarten in the winter countryside due to the wives\' vigorous intervention. It turns out that in certain situations, fathers make better moms than moms themselves, which is especially true when moms aren\'t in sight. Their parenting methods are very peculiar and cause a lot of confusion and hilarity...','/bUU0tpIaTnNP5w0sUxMgUDayToc.jpg','1983-01-01',82,'Released',NULL,'With You The World Is Fun',50873,1.3991,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8578,_binary '\0','/lns7roobSPQQTF54oSPzkT3qH1q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084628',7.7,13261,'fr','Sans soleil','A woman narrates the thoughts of a world traveler, meditations on time and memory expressed in words and images from places as far-flung as Japan, Guinea-Bissau, Iceland, and San Francisco.','/2ZmVbnecEeGoZCimxMhpY0Nz7eh.jpg','1983-03-02',100,'Released','He wrote me...','Sans Soleil',1563,2.5214,7.5,'0K8j3MU9dw4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8579,_binary '\0','/DVYCAjocVsqwfE9uB9xWf8lsej.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084629',5.4,1604,'he','אסקימו לימון 4: ספיחס','The Lemon Popsicle boys - Bobby, Benji, and Huey - have been drafted into the army, but they\'re not quite ready to give up the freedom they\'ve enjoyed for so long and submit to army discipline. They spend most of their time chasing women, trying to get out of doing any work and avoiding their no-nonsense sergeant.','/rwyeRg7nqKhKKQBnSDPTE16bdbW.jpg','1982-12-11',96,'Released','Those Lemon Popsicle boys are at it again!..Naughtier than ever in...','Private Popsicle',10583,2.485,5.726,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8580,_binary '\0','/jbYSBYjmozccj36vog7uoJIaFRz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084630',7.2,4047,'hi','सत्ते पे सत्ता','After the passing away of their parents, Ravi Anand, the eldest of seven brothers, takes it upon himself to raise them - albeit a little wild and kinda animal-like. The brothers all sport long beards, hate taking showers/baths, and above all hate Ravi bossing them around. rest of the story is about how a look a like Ravi comes in to there life','/xBBHP0BUdu4RT1VTmQCsQ1csYmT.jpg','1982-01-22',166,'Released','\'Seven Brides for Seven Brothers\' meets Bollywood!','Satte Pe Satta',33145,1.2567,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8581,_binary '\0','/7e39FmoTx4JAxTgF1IkKpvrldX6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084633',7.2,2447,'en','Savannah Smiles','The young daughter of a politician runs away due to lack of attention. She hides in the car of two not too bright crooks who are slowly converted into parent figures as the police web closes down on the supposed kidnappers.','/xSR2Qss4bpcpeKq1JXov9C7mpp9.jpg','1982-04-09',105,'Released','...and love will never be the same.','Savannah Smiles',17132,1.7356,6.5,'PNKciVl_rS0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8582,_binary '\0','/1uBhI3YTROQBvm2pL8Lamus8NYv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084637',7.6,5649,'en','The Scarlet Pimpernel','During the French Revolution, a mysterious English nobleman known only as The Scarlet Pimpernel (a humble wayside flower), snatches French aristos from the jaws of the guillotine, while posing as the foppish Sir Percy Blakeney in society. Percy falls for and marries the beautiful actress Marguerite St. Just, but she is involved with Chauvelin and Robespierre, and Percy\'s marriage to her may endanger the Pimpernel\'s plans to save the little Dauphin','/89jU2EH7ccpK6jDEJ6fO9bIe2RN.jpg','1982-11-09',142,'Released',NULL,'The Scarlet Pimpernel',23615,3.1525,6.8,'tz02Pg0104U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8583,_binary '\0','/rVARQIfs2gOsAqQYsnmw4xueDSe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084646',7.3,1304,'it','Scusate il ritardo','Vincenzo, a 30 years old apathetic and lazy man who still lives with his mother, has no job and no desire to improve. He meets Anna and fell in love with her but to keep the relationship alive he has to learn to accept more responsibility.','/zfjaHGdhXEauoz8JFSZjN0li0I7.jpg','1983-03-10',108,'Released',NULL,'Sorry for the Delay',56784,0.9644,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8584,_binary '\0','/zhw2gjDMedftoaoPeQYertgTAo2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084649',7.5,49437,'en','The Secret of NIMH','A widowed field mouse must move her family -- including an ailing son -- to escape a farmer\'s plow. Aided by a crow and a pack of superintelligent, escaped lab rats, the brave mother struggles to transplant her home to firmer ground.','/prNrnOKlkV9wl5Sl3zwHu1f3t2z.jpg','1982-06-17',83,'Released','Right before your eyes, and beyond your wildest dreams.','The Secret of NIMH',11704,7.5313,7.439,'2s8wJ7Q1VCQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8585,_binary '\0','/fPpIjYedAjjnH58VXZ8PJrBkAkc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084652',5.1,1778,'en','The Seduction','A beautiful newscaster is stalked and tormented by a photographer obsessed with her beauty.','/7AOxZI5dzXlcsRVfRdbpPS02xJ6.jpg','1982-01-22',104,'Released','Alone... Terrified... Trapped like an animal. Now she\'s fighting back with the only weapon she has... Herself.','The Seduction',30038,2.18,5.8,'Z-xNxuFt_T4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8586,_binary '\0','/xATzVfo4XOmkVHsnkXuEshkjHks.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084654',7.6,8418,'de','Die Sehnsucht der Veronika Voss','In Munich 1955, German film star Veronika Voss becomes a drug addict at the mercy of corrupt Dr. Marianne Katz, who keeps her supplied with morphine. After meeting sports writer Robert Krohn, Veronika begins to dream of a return to stardom. As the couple\'s relationship escalates in intensity, Veronika begins seriously planning her return to the screen -- only to realize how debilitated she has become through her drug habit.','/A09gh5oWVfincs6BbRz91HL4Rgc.jpg','1982-05-13',105,'Released','Stars don\'t die, they fade away.','Veronika Voss',2262,2.8495,7.2,'0_H3fSWOtC0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8587,_binary '\0','/zZkCfEi8hoI3QbXwfIDOHAPkJpn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084658',6,2653,'en','The Sender','A disturbed telepathic man is able to transmit his dreams and visions into the minds of the people around him.','/t1gAtGXv74SA3JP4tTHXKt5oRy5.jpg','1982-10-22',91,'Released','He has the power to make you live his nightmares... And he\'s dreaming about you.','The Sender',69870,2.0636,5.6,'6eM3exJ3X10','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8588,_binary '\0','/oFWpSxGEBd06ebXSrHaQgxllpNL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084666',6.6,3689,'en','The Shadow Riders','After starring in \"The Sacketts\", Tom Selleck and Sam Elliott team up again but this time as Mac and Dal Traven, in a movie based on a classic Louis L\'Amour novel. They are brothers, who meet up at the end of the Civil War fighting on opposite sides. They go home only to find their family in dire need and their sisters and brother kidnapped by ruthless raiders. They set out to rescue their family.','/tbILlAZ0YaIs1J1huAFUZwuuFZM.jpg','1982-09-28',96,'Released','Sometimes you have to start a war to finish one.','The Shadow Riders',22765,3.2392,6.5,'fQKDOKXxGC0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8589,_binary '\0','/ntyHrFNzxIqRDLYgfs55TFsMmYv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084667',7.6,2641,'hi','शक्ति','A policeman\'s son becomes a criminal after a childhood incident creates a rift between them.','/2Gz21c2XNYIOWty9JaFMc3h825E.jpg','1982-09-22',165,'Released','A Clash of Titans.','Shakti',159487,1.3632,7.3,'s6ykVDaju-g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8590,_binary '\0','/zTXULJpA7cjcOXjXwF05O3qgtd9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084671',6.8,2076,'cn','十八般武藝','Legendary Weapons of China is a martial arts fantasy film taking place during the late Qing Dynasty when Empress Dowager Cixi dispatches her agents to various factions of the Boxer Rebellion in order find supernatural martial artists that are invulnerable to western bullets. When one of the leaders of these groups disbands his forces, assassins from the remaining factions are sent out to kill him.','/eQ3WAYY69A7vIt2BTNfnart5GV2.jpg','1982-01-21',101,'Released',NULL,'Legendary Weapons of China',19156,1.7789,7.1,'FHsfMVRuKbE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8591,_binary '\0','/3gxGELiJ6wVJdKxlEuvagDV8UyN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084675',6.8,3489,'en','Shoot the Moon','After fifteen years of marriage, an affluent couple divorce and take up with new partners.','/uSCOB7EdghUcaSO9Q6VF5fgIuw.jpg','1982-01-22',124,'Released','There\'s one thing about marriage that hasn\'t changed... The way you hurt when it begins to fall apart.','Shoot the Moon',52772,2.1699,6.275,'CTpB6ebs4f0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8592,_binary '\0','/8PKqcN6IREm2Xy43lzhPZ2ORzQi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084684',5.5,7837,'en','Silent Rage','A mentally ill man in a small Texas town goes on a killing rampage and is fatally wounded by police. When doctors use an experimental serum to bring him back to life, the killer develops superhuman strength and the town sheriff must pursue him.','/fEC99jHKmt6FczEe1Kv2fKzVMHh.jpg','1982-04-02',103,'Released','Science created him. Now Chuck Norris must destroy him.','Silent Rage',27150,3.5648,6.1,'Mv6r7cv45c4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8593,_binary '\0','/1n99doKUvScQ7EQUbDPxEFSZL0J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084690',6.1,3760,'en','Six Pack','Stopping briefly in a small Texas town, an itinerant race car driver finds that his stock car, on a trailer behind his motor home, has just been quickly and expertly stripped. He chases down the miscreants, who turn out to be six orphan children. He has no recourse to the law, for the corrupt local sheriff takes most of the proceeds of their thievery in exchange for not putting them in an orphanage. They are charming rogues who are in turn charmed by him. Disliking their arrangement with the sheriff, they stow away with him, and he finds himself becoming a reluctant stepfather. Thanks to their enthusiasm and incredible mechanical know-how, he begins to make a name for himself on the racing circuit. But the sheriff doesn\'t take kindly to losing his extra income...','/etxC3zXOFWPHBxDEhBMqiwMj4CM.jpg','1982-07-16',108,'Released','Kenny Rogers is Brewster Baker. His racing career was going in reverse, until six car-crazy kids joined his pit crew and put him back on the track.','Six Pack',46925,1.9939,6.5,'WXseWz8zZxo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8594,_binary '\0','/z3DNDiKtXBufTsNIU6Fox1JxkMr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084694',5.2,3599,'en','The Slayer','Siblings, Eric & his surreal artist sister Kay, her doctor husband David, her sister-in-law Brooke along with pilot Marsh become stranded on a rugged isle face off against a supernatural beast drawn to Kay who dreams of its killings.','/aqC7SxLPXHh9IgHZi8EVBN4T4jw.jpg','1982-10-08',80,'Released','She searched through the dark corridors of the unknown only to find ... The Slayer','The Slayer',54121,1.4117,5.3,'kzd2YrmzKyo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8595,_binary '\0','/3A8hf7Va32HjGAAgatMa0ibPD9E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084695',5.6,21645,'en','The Slumber Party Massacre','Trish invites her high school basketball teammates over for a night they\'ll never forget when an unexpected guest crashes the party: an escaped psychopath with a portable power drill.','/rh65oDy8CNJoEAOf7oudhIt3DM6.jpg','1982-09-10',76,'Released','You know the drill.','The Slumber Party Massacre',27475,3.8695,5.6,'8NzLJ0tDSm8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8596,_binary '\0','/1PyJzcHGC6irRaBRmjP0pUli7UT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084698',6.7,3239,'en','Smithereens','A narcissistic runaway engages in a number of parasitic relationships amongst members of New York\'s waning punk scene.','/jp29gfdiP7AxtjqzlzyaztFORMF.jpg','1982-11-09',94,'Released','She was a legend in her own mind.','Smithereens',94066,1.9218,6.4,'foPtweycZE4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8597,_binary '\0','/hrFgnngT0iQ2CxZV4eNsQ5I5b90.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084704',5.3,1756,'en','The Soldier','Terrorists take over a plutonium bomb and threaten to detonate it in a Saudi Arabian oil field. A special anti-terrorist unit is sent in to stop them.','/1aIohAxW05nOL6PXh05dCDgLFeS.jpg','1982-06-01',88,'Released','You don\'t assign him. You unleash him.','The Soldier',76395,2.3683,5.302,'3vNZcP84laU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8598,_binary '\0','/uiUpvnv8zgA2pm1J7tT8DPLxh84.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084707',7.5,56413,'en','Sophie\'s Choice','Stingo, a young writer, moves to Brooklyn in 1947 to begin work on his first novel. As he becomes friendly with Sophie and her lover Nathan, he learns that she is a Holocaust survivor. Flashbacks reveal her harrowing story, from pre-war prosperity to Auschwitz. In the present, Sophie and Nathan\'s relationship increasingly unravels as Stingo grows closer to Sophie and Nathan\'s fragile mental state becomes ever more apparent.','/rZDPbPTFwuKgr5b9jixGFNYkGYt.jpg','1982-12-08',151,'Released','Between the innocent, the romantic, the sensual, and the unthinkable. There are still some things we have yet to imagine.','Sophie\'s Choice',15764,7.2966,7.303,'STPJVf6wqCk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8599,_binary '\0','/fJMR2Zy9P1yoV2TrtIRuDhGtriO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084714',6.3,1384,'en','Split Image','An impressionable young man finds himself enslaved by a modern-day religious cult. In an effort to bring him back to reality, the boy\'s parents hire a deprogrammer to kidnap him and return him to his family.','/5cwOd5VQvjCgWWPvp915xxliVfb.jpg','1982-10-03',111,'Released','Homeland has kidnapped Danny\'s mind. Only this man can steal it back...for $10,000 cash, no questions asked.','Split Image',52777,2.9552,6,'NrCyXWkDP8A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8600,_binary '\0','/stnOZzvpyc3R04GFoiMxHq02qae.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084716',6.8,2668,'ru','Спортлото-82','Adventurous comedy about a bunch of people hunting the winning lottery ticket.','/bUsKu4NPaBT8eLTlfVOV5kK71CS.jpg','1982-08-02',89,'Released',NULL,'SportLotto - 82',71051,1.0771,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8601,_binary '\0','/dQBDaw2afx2Cx7WuGC3bDE5s6w2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084719',6.3,14032,'it','Lo squartatore di New York','A burned-out New York police detective teams up with a college psychoanalyst to track down a vicious serial killer randomly stalking and killing various young women around the city.','/pi2Ft9zZWr6MCO4TmmxRzqJilSk.jpg','1982-03-04',93,'Released','Slashing up women was his pleasure.','The New York Ripper',30874,3.6171,6.3,'vbNSmZYwMbQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8602,_binary '\0','/cqwdCT3KiToWHIkhxMCKu6gqJrC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084725',6.9,4031,'de','Der Stand der Dinge','On location in Portugal, a film crew runs out of film while making their own version of Roger Corman\'s The Day the World Ended (1956). The producer is nowhere to be found and director Munro attempts to find him in hopes of being able to finish the film.','/gHFOZph5GuFcDKe3Xgmrcc2sYwP.jpg','1982-03-22',121,'Released','They didn\'t want to kill him. They just wanted a story.','The State of Things',30363,2.1061,6.4,'qj3V17L_Sm4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8603,_binary '\0','/meqmvZjKpQ7WRhpZvIoKIAvioSD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084726',7.7,137010,'en','Star Trek II: The Wrath of Khan','The starship Enterprise and its crew is pulled back into action when old nemesis, Khan, steals a top secret device called Project Genesis.','/uPyLsKl8Z0LOoxeaFXsY5MxhR5s.jpg','1982-06-04',113,'Released','At the end of the universe lies the beginning of vengeance.','Star Trek II: The Wrath of Khan',154,8.005,7.5,'vOIYaRb6XpQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8604,_binary '\0','/qpHLqaaqE59dI87jjjOMFYteL6a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084728',6.8,1389,'en','Starstruck','A Sydney teen tries to make it as a rock singer, with help from her odd 14-year-old cousin.','/lFa9lMfMwo1DX8dLLyIRPPuP5c3.jpg','1982-04-08',96,'Released','A modern musical comedy.','Starstruck',49409,1.1048,5.4,'ucf3bzv-e9M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8605,_binary '\0','/a2kzu1bfp9RWQLlK3TtsIRqZn5X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084732',6,7980,'en','Still of the Night','When one of his patients is found murdered, psychiatrist Dr. Sam Rice is visited by the investigating officer but refuses to give up any information. He\'s then visited by the patient\'s mistress, Brooke Reynolds, whom he quickly falls for despite her being a likely murder suspect. As the police pressure on him intensifies, Rice decides to attempt solving the case on his own and soon discovers that someone is trying to kill him as well.','/qRTOsV47tfFIWF5QUx5KJtDPQwV.jpg','1982-11-19',91,'Released','If looks could kill...','Still of the Night',32048,3.3957,5.725,'8m8lotjVfLQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8606,_binary '\0','/is8ILmHWfT0tbsFtMGewURgmLoM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084737',5.8,4905,'en','Summer Lovers','Michael Pappas and his girlfriend, Cathy, are enjoying the white sand beaches of a Greek island as well as the freewheeling nature of the locals. When Michael meets Lina, who is in Greece from Paris doing archaeological work, he is enamored with the beautiful foreigner. Cathy, unhappy about Lina getting close to Michael, confronts the woman -- only to be unexpectedly wooed by her charms as well.','/94Q5xC4MrSzpyO9x4kYG8yR4DnF.jpg','1982-07-16',98,'Released','Sun, surf, sand... and the sexy adventure of a lifetime.','Summer Lovers',19415,4.0796,5.442,'1GQuSTLLodg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8607,_binary '\0','/eFsF9Z4rI44ibX0Bbb0inADhTif.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084739',5.7,3811,'en','Superstition','A witch put to death in 1692 swears vengeance on her persecutors and returns to the present day to punish their descendants.','/a6X3AVdhVXIPEp4A3bg2tKCV0sp.jpg','1982-08-26',85,'Released','You\'ll believe it just before you die...','Superstition',52702,2.4304,6.1,'fkoU01NwHlE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8608,_binary '\0','/1zdXOqfLlMW9LCmr3fIw3d9YPn3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084740',7.8,7504,'es','El sur','A woman recalls her childhood growing up in the North of Spain, focusing on her relationship with her father.','/bAyghNTLIwHIxoQOha6kHfwmxS6.jpg','1983-05-19',94,'Released',NULL,'El Sur',48139,1.663,7.636,'Ox_Vs1T2AWM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8609,_binary '\0','/cNSt4oSf5a0jREjMYps4JvjTt5W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084745',5.3,19235,'en','Swamp Thing','Mutated by his own secret formula, Dr. Alec Holland becomes Swamp Thing, a half-human, half-plant superhero who will stop at nothing to rescue government agent Alice Cable and defeat his evil arch nemesis...even if it costs him his life.','/7BGaE9A7UeyxH29aeFbQfzEmIi0.jpg','1982-02-19',91,'Released','Science transformed him into a monster. Love changed him even more!','Swamp Thing',17918,4.1717,5.418,'76debmQRiFw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8610,_binary '\0','/1tLQaNLr8jvz3SOoRU8ecKf3DTs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084747',8.3,4140,'en','Sweeney Todd: The Demon Barber of Fleet Street','In 1846, Anthony Hope sails into London with the mysterious Sweeney Todd, a once-naive barber whose life and marriage was uprooted by a corrupt justice system. Todd confides in Nellie Lovett, the owner of a local meat pie shop, and the two become partners, as Todd swears revenge on those that have wronged him and decides to take up his old profession.','/7Aes0rgHVM1PT0FmeXDzvgb2yJ0.jpg','1982-09-12',140,'Released','A musical thriller.','Sweeney Todd: The Demon Barber of Fleet Street',24745,2.2333,8.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8611,_binary '\0','/2UPzDBkfOsClubCtG6Hk44jI2rT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084749',5.5,9165,'en','The Sword and the Sorcerer','A mercenary with a three-bladed sword rediscovers his royal heritage when he is recruited to help a princess foil a brutal tyrant and a powerful sorcerer\'s plans to conquer the land.','/3804sBcpgNvpNpLc53hb4MMB6f7.jpg','1982-04-01',100,'Released','A kingdom ruled by evil. A princess enslaved by passion. A warrior driven by justice.','The Sword and the Sorcerer',13945,4.0069,5.497,'DREG0dOW8jw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8612,_binary '\0','/v1wZkPjY7Lnp5yAEwTZjSBmZC9o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084750',4.4,2869,'en','Sword of the Valiant: The Legend of Sir Gawain and the Green Knight','Gawain was a squire in King Arthur\'s court when the Green Knight burst in and offered to play a game with a brave knight. Gawain journeys across the land, learning about life, saving damsels, and solving the Green Knight\'s riddle.','/mqcmaLS8yECWb1skKJnmO9vGIj4.jpg','1984-08-17',102,'Released','Only the Brave or the Foolish dared to play the Green Knight\'s deadly game...','Sword of the Valiant: The Legend of Sir Gawain and the Green Knight',30584,3.0317,5.2,'9AJzP13f0bs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8613,_binary '','/wnMxHFeaiDKmrdJYEm3zJDStzVc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084755',6.9,1475,'en','Taboo II','The story of seduction continues from the Scott family to the McBride’s, where mother and son, brother and sister, father and daughter enter the perverse world of incestuous pleasures.','/cxu0vWX5rXLA9oZXSfl8sgpctkg.jpg','1982-05-03',97,'Released','More Than Brother And Sister... THEY WERE LOVERS!','Taboo II',37795,0,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8614,_binary '\0','/o6PMUYlC6qqTKx3UT2YyrLzVDeY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084776',6.4,3002,'en','Tempest','A sobering mid-life crisis fuels dissatisfaction in Philip Dimitrius, to the extent where the successful architect trades his marriage and career in for a spiritual exile on a remote Greek island where he hopes to conjure meaning into his life - trying the patience of his new girlfriend and angst-ridden teenage daughter.','/wGhnc6SAOMH3p8wzFihLtHIKsyt.jpg','1982-08-13',140,'Released','Most men dream their fantasies. Phillip decided to live his.','Tempest',48249,1.785,5.9,'qmZNlhXn9Fo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8615,_binary '\0','/toYJpo6mezPMzO91hWfH8TU6kPF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084777',7,31496,'it','Tenebre','A razor-wielding serial killer is on the loose, murdering those around Peter Neal, an American mystery author in Italy to promote his newest novel.','/uWNCyUX9sjtnhleqyw2W5ECijlP.jpg','1982-10-28',101,'Released','Terror Beyond Belief!','Tenebre',29702,3.154,6.8,'0KwE5u-B3Cw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8616,_binary '\0','/jfKqhQcTSRa8ZgqTJDdPptzO27S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084780',8.2,4175,'sh','Tesna koža','At 56 years of age Mita Pantic is still only a junior clerk in his company. Another typical workday for him is starting at 6 a.m. as frustration awaits at every turn from the moment he gets up. Trying to get ready to go to work, he can barely get a turn to use the bathroom in the crowded apartment. Other members of the household are not without their frustrations either, meaning that nagging and shouting are a staple of their home life at any time of day.','/b8v5AYELvY62pWiJS9Rpu0VN9U9.jpg','1982-09-20',92,'Released',NULL,'Tight Skin',50752,1.8114,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8617,_binary '\0','/to2OiVxKjfihu7lcbSNAXtTnXsV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084783',6.5,2805,'en','Tex','After their mother dies and their father leaves them, teenage brothers Tex and Mason McCormick struggle to make it on their own.','/j9p9IHzjRNoswTPqWpUiOisHuEs.jpg','1982-07-30',103,'Released',NULL,'Tex',27332,1.7142,6.1,'wVkovfR5FCk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8618,_binary '\0','/lpQ3Fz80MMi0hm6qheserTKW3WU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084786',5.6,2086,'en','They Call Me Bruce?','While working as a cook for the Cosa Nostra, an Asian immigrant who everyone calls Bruce because of his resemblance to Bruce Lee, is duped into making deliveries of \"Chinese Flour\"- cocaine - all across the U.S.','/frDWWWsVgEatmdkyJV9lDFmOpqW.jpg','1982-11-10',85,'Released','With a little practice... anyone can be as good as Bruce Lee!','They Call Me Bruce?',24830,2.722,4.859,'TDIhTRKKkUs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8619,_binary '\0','/r9leYNa8nTRCceZrZhP1DXkgKVb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084787',8.2,535319,'en','The Thing','A research team in Antarctica is hunted by a shape-shifting alien that assumes the appearance of its victims.','/tzGY49kseSE9QAKk47uuDGwnSCu.jpg','1982-06-25',109,'Released','Anytime. Anywhere. Anyone.','The Thing',1091,19.9651,8.074,'ySvzHdtCiWE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8620,_binary '\0','/cvDGTJPUWw7F9gtxehLUvpbHRn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084788',5.8,4015,'en','Things Are Tough All Over','Everybody has problems these days, and Cheech and Chong are no exceptions. They\'re hired by Slyman and Habib to drive a limousine to Las Vegas with $5 million secretly stashed in the front seat. In order to get there, the pair sells off the car piece by piece, including the seven-figure front seat. Cheech and Chong then have a much bigger problem - Slyman and Habib are after them, swearing to kill them after the appropriate torture.','/2dxvPRZkTuYyZVUK0JwtvORlW1W.jpg','1982-08-04',90,'Released','The original HIGH Rollers hit the strip!','Things Are Tough All Over',20197,3.0087,5.6,'JDxKS04UhCc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8621,_binary '\0','/robXbyftpvfK3sw0PSRN9F4jQCx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084796',3.8,2497,'en','Time Walker','From deep within the tomb of the Egyptian pharaoh Tutankhamun, Professor Douglas McCadden ships the coffin of Ankh-Vanharis to the California Institute of Sciences where X-rays reveal five diamond-like crystals hidden within the coffin. Technician Peter Sharpe steals the crystals but doesn\'t notice that the powerful X-ray has revived a green fungus. When the coffin is opened at a university press conference, the reporters uncover more than they bargained for. The mummy has disappeared... and the Time Walker is alive again!','/dzL1rGs3ZSv5Gp3E5U5FdFPWCkm.jpg','1982-11-01',83,'Released','For eons they traveled the galaxies. For centuries one was trapped in a Pharaoh\'s tomb. Now he is free.','Time Walker',30049,1.4847,4.1,'u-WTXghUiSE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8622,_binary '\0','/dGRGes6Yw0vK1IymLatHBXGvvpS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084805',7.4,123900,'en','Tootsie','When struggling, out of work actor Michael Dorsey secretly adopts a female alter ego—Dorothy Michaels—in order to land a part in a daytime drama, he unwittingly becomes a feminist icon and ends up in a romantic pickle.','/ngyCzZwb9y5sMUCig5JQT4Y33Q.jpg','1982-12-17',116,'Released','What do you get when you cross a hopelessly straight starving actor with a dynamite red sequined dress? You get America\'s hottest new actress.','Tootsie',9576,6.0267,7.2,'IS-rkKwfuJU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8623,_binary '\0','/8uxcz8W9GZ4dGiL7N6b4PvaZWwh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084807',7.6,2018,'cn','投奔怒海','A Japanese photojournalist revisits Vietnam after the liberation to document the nation, and begins following and documenting the young children from a poor Vietnamese family.','/bdyxE6bXtozYG2jQiWKZUz3u4LD.jpg','1982-10-13',109,'Released',NULL,'Boat People',72445,2.0455,7.6,'PjSUOqr9ZSg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8624,_binary '\0','/3gSqZ9cKFibs60gXrZNoiXAizsO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084808',6.8,1407,'fr','Toute une nuit','Following over two dozen different individuals in the almost wordless atmosphere of a dark night in a Brussels town, acceptance and rejection in the realm of romance is examined.','/q3asH6robNOysEYHQsWV7dE0kq1.jpg','1982-10-27',90,'Released',NULL,'Toute une nuit',63215,1.3611,6.6,'-O7jy3vqi0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8625,_binary '\0','/67HuYlHXNK9JzRTP9kefj7K43k0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084809',5.8,14433,'en','The Toy','On one of his bratty son Eric\'s annual visits, the plutocrat U.S. Bates takes him to his department store and offers him anything in it as a gift. Eric chooses a black janitor who has made him laugh with his antics. At first the man suffers many indignities as Eric\'s \"toy\", but gradually teaches the lonely boy what it is like to have and to be a friend.','/yt7Z37Uo2zls64XikaYh8nCwTAv.jpg','1982-12-10',102,'Released','When Jackie Gleason told his son he could have any present he wanted, he picked the most outrageous gift of all...Richard Pryor.','The Toy',23805,3.6506,5.909,'4mjqWFB_tBI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8626,_binary '\0','/sngUVNXhF6HrmoULBugytp991KB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084813',6.6,1264,'it','La tragedia di un uomo ridicolo','The son of the owner of a large Italian cheese factory is kidnapped, but as the factory is on the verge of bankruptcy the owner hatches a plan to use the ransom money as reinvestment in the factory.','/yLXtOtcrPhAhjUjYSTHTCMobJNv.jpg','1981-10-01',116,'Released',NULL,'Tragedy of a Ridiculous Man',42144,1.8427,6.531,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8627,_binary '\0','/nOHtfBfbMqMoZ2XkqFaiePNlV78.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084814',4.8,12297,'en','Trail of the Pink Panther','The Pink Panther diamond is stolen once again from Lugash and the authorities call in Chief Inspector Clouseau from France. His plane disappears en-route. This time, famous French TV reporter Marie Jouvet sets out to solve the mystery and starts to interview everybody connected to Clouseau.','/l2Gv4I8CN28aflcqecPgb0NKh63.jpg','1982-12-03',96,'Released','The Newest and Funniest \'Panther\' of them all.','Trail of the Pink Panther',9699,6.1851,5.14,'rFHmRFe7Bs0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8628,_binary '\0','/kwth6yEhDpBktGKWsyymzsesxR2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084821',7.6,1609,'it','La traviata','This “Traviata” became one of the most succesful of all opera films, especially in France, where 800,000 Parisian cinemagoers flocked to it in the first six week. It was nominated for two Oscars (for production and costume design) and won BAFTAs in those two categories, as well as receiving BAFTA and Golden Globe nominations as 1983’s Best Foreign-Language Film.','/vYGZgwpfS4kutHCcbs1ENxeffHx.jpg','1982-10-07',109,'Released',NULL,'La traviata',48561,1.5453,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8629,_binary '\0','/820ySPVXX4FIBVgP58hI2URx4Mc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084824',7.1,1285,'fr','Les Trois couronnes du matelot','Shortly after murdering his professor, a young man encounters a sailor who offers him a position on his ship in exchange for 3 Danish crowns and his attention as he recounts his life story.','/yJNAPehs3uz1dkVmzALNhqZC3NM.jpg','1991-10-04',117,'Released','A voyage on the sea of dreams','Three Crowns of the Sailor',64441,1.8521,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8630,_binary '\0','/6Ntx0ia1dpaHMOi2qzrpj0N5kdZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084825',3.9,1713,'en','Trick or Treats','A baby sitter is stuck watching over a young brat on Halloween night who keeps playing vicious pranks on her. To add to her trouble the boy\'s deranged father has escaped from an asylum and is planning on making a visit.','/5C2d9EqVe0Rn8zyx0YE9ACKZA3O.jpg','1982-10-29',91,'Released','Halloween\'s over. Now it\'s the kids\' turn to get even!','Trick or Treats',85202,1.6519,4.05,'kSeXLPdaSOg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8631,_binary '\0','/vUmeBHiGp5r2ydd8aEvbNLamTVD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084827',6.7,147551,'en','Tron','When brilliant video game maker Flynn hacks the mainframe of his ex-employer, he is beamed inside an astonishing digital world and becomes part of the very game he is designing. In his mission through cyberspace, Flynn matches wits with a maniacal Master Control Program and teams up with Tron, a security measure created to bring balance to the digital environment.','/jigY9B6TKz4qlfikZcd18qtzTK4.jpg','1982-07-09',96,'Released','Journey now into a startling new dimension where energy lives and breathes. A world inside the computer where man has never been. Never before now.','Tron',97,8.7787,6.624,'EtyHX7z8fi8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8632,_binary '\0','/14VQVLYrx2kBojsJyrJYNz9QqZI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084843',6.7,1873,'fr','Une chambre en ville','Set against the backdrop of an increasingly violent strike, a worker falls in love with the middle-class daughter of his landlady.','/eDO1onM1IxTouTFSXM747Wd7Psj.jpg','1982-10-27',94,'Released',NULL,'A Room in Town',4269,2.453,6.368,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8633,_binary '\0','/s6NtI8moMtatcBEsZeL9cf25vdn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084845',5.8,1382,'fi','Uuno Turhapuro menettää muistinsa','Uuno Turhapuro hits his head and loses his memory. Meanwhile, his friend Härski Hartikainen founds a new peace movement with unorthodox methods.','/11qeC3TUvgG309Nmm04Npqf2Jpf.jpg','1982-09-17',87,'Released',NULL,'Uuno Turhapuro menettää muistinsa',62897,1.4964,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8634,_binary '\0','/xHbpL55I16JB7f1oV2iR57Gxh8Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084854',5.8,3765,'en','Venom','International terrorists attempt to kidnap a wealthy couple\'s child. Their plan comes unstuck, however, when a deadly Black Mamba, sent by mistake instead of a harmless snake, escapes and terrorizes both them and their hostages.','/v44VNoH2suoaCPnUj2YyXcvgGfn.jpg','1981-11-28',93,'Released','The kidnap that became a murder, that became a siege, that became a death trap.','Venom',30789,2.0051,5.681,'LJpTHfSByqc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8635,_binary '\0','/sgsW7aqUXg4jG2GcoLKotSvp807.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084855',7.7,51369,'en','The Verdict','Frank Galvin is a down-on-his-luck lawyer and reduced to drinking and ambulance chasing, when a former associate reminds him of his obligations in a medical malpractice suit by serving it to Galvin on a silver platter—all parties are willing to settle out of court. Blundering his way through the preliminaries, Galvin suddenly realizes that the case should actually go to court—to punish the guilty, to get a decent settlement for his clients... and to restore his standing as a lawyer.','/iYEuFP1bpj5yOenKliiRFcNO3VE.jpg','1982-12-08',129,'Released','Frank Galvin has one last chance to do something right.','The Verdict',24226,5.721,7.5,'wwqUtCeODOk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8636,_binary '\0','/hcZd21om9WomNqeUUXDvOw5m4hO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084861',6.4,3693,'en','Vice Squad','An unlikely Hollywood hooker helps a detective set a trap for a mutilator pimp.','/3uvyU3s9cKiDcgdsDrkdUWemaNo.jpg','1982-01-22',97,'Released','On the street, the real trick is staying alive.','Vice Squad',63460,1.8447,6.221,'HzrCUXw_O5E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8637,_binary '\0','/tcMG8GQ0m61PWIWkdJfOERrl1sJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084865',7.6,25890,'en','Victor/Victoria','A struggling female soprano finds work playing a male female impersonator, but it complicates her personal life.','/mCjXcPRM3Rc7gOCGeVrBdPvF2bk.jpg','1982-04-25',134,'Released','The disguise surprise comedy of the year!','Victor/Victoria',12614,4.3497,7.275,'t8hi31nDDEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8638,_binary '\0','/ktce78LE6UjfWOufROWc0GKrLPU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084867',6.5,5462,'en','Vigilante','New York City factory worker Eddie Marino is a solid citizen and regular guy, until the day a sadistic street gang brutally assaults his wife and murders his child. When a corrupt judge sets the thugs free, he goes berserk and vows revenge.','/zq1VG3UtUb5nRwumWmZQuWz8ik5.jpg','1983-01-04',90,'Released','There\'s only one way to stop them...','Vigilante',23587,3.1521,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8639,_binary '\0','/j9FxvsK0TMmTxluA3i0a3uN40vS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084869',4.6,1218,'it','Violenza in un carcere femminile','Laura Kendall, also known as Emanuelle, arrives at a remote prison with a long, fictional rap sheet that will allow her to go undercover to report on the cruelties behind bars.','/2xZhQL4ZbIDPmJj4WHBMFEoQmPg.jpg','1982-09-09',98,'Released','The strong ones take, the weak ones give.','Violence in a Women\'s Prison',28574,2.6711,5.683,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8640,_binary '\0','/v1NhZcgFwf0kV60C9mpyLbHCz4F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084873',7.8,4246,'ru','Вокзал для двоих','Platon is travelling by train to visit his father. He gets off to have lunch where he meets Vera, a waitress. He refuses to pay for the food after which a series of unfortunate events unfold for the pair.','/qKQAFPdfIx95NUzhklbnjUxfaib.jpg','1983-02-11',142,'Released',NULL,'Station for Two',32336,1.5994,7.273,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8641,_binary '\0','/wf2DfT6vJ1VPGmNRCPbuBFlbZa2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084874',6.9,1819,'es','Volver a empezar','A Nobel prize winner returns to his natal city looking for his home.','/v1KY4B6lEyos8Zh28hmr2NKNPMp.jpg','1982-03-01',87,'Released',NULL,'Begin the Beguine',81346,1.1856,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8642,_binary '\0','/8hpZU2JVbI5rAV5tf6Kjn7fTEFj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084887',5,1840,'en','Battletruck','It\'s the 21st century, the Oil Wars have made a mess of the planet and the land outside major cities is lawless. After Hunter comes to the aid of Corlie, who has run away from the villainous Straker, he takes her to the peaceful community of Clearwater. Unfortunately for the citizens of Clearwater, Straker fully intends to get Corlie back.','/vKzIyRYkKfrUgHewh067a6i4Wj3.jpg','1982-01-01',91,'Released','A science fiction adventure of the near future.','Battletruck',27873,2.6094,4.6,'dekG-Vrl-HU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8643,_binary '\0','/5QxjV44JzRqI1RjqXyqRkCBKFG3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084897',7.1,1248,'de','Die weiße Rose','During the Second World War, a small group of students at Munich University begin to question the decisions and sanity of Germany\'s Nazi government. The students form a resistance cell which they name the \"White Rose\" after a newsletter that is secretly distributed to the student body. At first small in numbers and fearful of discovery, the White Rose begins to gain massive support after a Nazi Gauleiter nearly incites a student riot after a provokative speech. At this point, the matter is taken over by the German Gestapo, who pledge to hunt down and destroy the members of the White Rose.','/a2LVdGxEcmrL1FFSfonD5n4xtkK.jpg','1982-09-24',123,'Released',NULL,'The White Rose',11057,1.5452,6.1,'ommb3-FoJNE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8644,_binary '\0','/yYddTCIoWvpVl9hbyqEQV3OsX61.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084899',7,11774,'en','White Dog','Samuel Fuller’s throat-grabbing exposé on American racism was misunderstood and withheld from release when it was made in the early eighties.Today, the notorious film is lauded for its daring metaphor and gripping pulp filmmaking. Kristy McNichol stars as a young actress who adopts a lost German shepherd, only to discover through a series of horrifying incidents that the dog has been trained to attack black people, and Paul Winfield plays the animal trainer who tries to cure him. A snarling, uncompromising vision, White Dog is a tragic portrait of the evil done by that most corruptible of all animals; the human being.','/2oU700G9pDwFt7px5GxOqDHFPfR.jpg','1982-07-07',90,'Released','When man’s best friend becomes his fiercest enemy…','White Dog',47955,3.269,6.629,'IhkrvBNnAcw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8645,_binary '\0','/iA7TuFOthwAt3C35OlCyQnSFvLb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084901',7.3,1374,'pl','Wielki Szu','Fresh out of prison, a seasoned poker hustler finds himself teaching the trade to a young cab driver chasing his first big win.','/fsRmY3yxFXSr1yvldbiuCkfrPHs.jpg','1983-05-16',96,'Released',NULL,'Big Shar',81208,1.0682,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8646,_binary '\0','/rVSMDp4LvwaUuys5EvAsyC2wBJR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084904',7,3320,'en','Wild Style','Legendary New York graffiti artist Lee Quinones plays the part of Zoro, the city\'s hottest and most elusive graffiti writer. The actual story of the movie concerns the tension between Zoro\'s passion for his art and his personal life, particularly his strained relationship with fellow artist Rose.','/bhlf38aasEZjgdWQOzXwMhaOvGU.jpg','1982-08-01',82,'Released','Break Dancing Graffiti Rap','Wild Style',14243,1.4654,6.1,'iq96MJpFrsA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8647,_binary '\0','/ssHfXldBDgGYBaGNQc9zMWuxy5W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084911',7.1,1457,'en','Witness for the Prosecution','An ailing barrister is thrust back into the courtroom in what becomes one of the most unusual and eventful murder cases of the lawyer\'s career when he finds himself defending a man being tried for the murder of a socialite.','/kw7hn71Lxx88FhHcpg14HsCIFT4.jpg','1982-12-04',97,'Released','Is he lying or telling the truth','Witness for the Prosecution',5972,2.6852,6.6,'4010OuOH7cA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8648,_binary '\0','/danXDS9yif7sG1giWcsgOEgTehX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084917',7.1,31386,'en','The World According to Garp','A struggling young writer finds his life and work dominated by his unfaithful wife and his radical feminist mother, whose best-selling manifesto turns her into a cultural icon.','/9ItRFdSCb7Sz3AC9LRxAzbH73kG.jpg','1982-07-23',136,'Released','Robin Williams is Garp. He\'s got a funny way of looking at life.','The World According to Garp',11307,4.4886,6.7,'VmRPh1xwab8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8649,_binary '\0','/xTie9vRW4EctwRIAV1PCJcgIPBE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084920',5.6,2488,'en','Wrong Is Right','Political double-talk, dirty tricks, hidden microphones, spy satellites, bugging the Oval Office and a nuclear bomb for sale are all ingredients in this swift, funny and frightening look at the possibilities in today\'s political arenas. Sean Connery stars as TV Newsman Patrick Hale on an international chase to track two suitcase sized nuclear weapons and to uncover the twisting maze of apparent involvement of US Government agencies.','/bFEucZZiCvKMX8GLlyepwppoX9f.jpg','1982-04-16',117,'Released','In a moment World War III...but first a word from our sponsor.','Wrong Is Right',31661,2.577,5.556,'gT3PS5czmPo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8650,_binary '\0','/s8TmpqtjePsScfylqEjRI6ScbN0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084921',7.2,3623,'zh','五遁忍術','A young martial artist vows to take revenge against the ninja who murdered his martial arts master and brothers. He finds a new teacher and faces, together with his new brothers, the Five Element Ninja challenge.','/WnfqFz8qQ35RMpOrv5X8FJxPwB.jpg','1982-04-21',108,'Released','Stronger than the Dragon... More powerful than the Tiger... Call them the SUPER NINJAS!','Five Element Ninjas',41378,2.3634,6.8,'vAyalHtQUkE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8651,_binary '\0','/x03QH4nwFTLhFchMj8FUYKXh19P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084924',7.2,2709,'cn','生死決','In 16th century, during the Ming dynasty era, every ten years the greatest swordsman from Japan faces the greatest swordsman from China in a duel to the death for their nation\'s honor. As a duel approaches, Chinese champion Bo Ching-Wan and Japanese champion Miyamoto uncover a plot to rig the fight.','/a6diqDVVpvagC3KPZctCipMcmgs.jpg','1983-01-13',86,'Released','Two Countries. Two Warriors. One Battle. One Survivor.','Duel to the Death',50572,2.544,6.8,'2Q71tcsiyXU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8652,_binary '\0','/ql80H0Lfv2EWTSEZBLyenxa8vj5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084934',7.9,15568,'tr','Yol','When five Kurdish prisoners are granted one week\'s home leave, they find to their dismay that they face continued oppression outside of prison from their families, the culture, and the government.','/oblv2iaKFvrleCqBMLNHzcOCufR.jpg','1982-09-01',110,'Released','The story of three families\' search for freedom.','The Road',52556,2.5249,7.3,'F4xo8hMJ_24','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8653,_binary '\0','/wS8BqmSiiyLPgz5oybAybDHeXTy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084935',4.4,3771,'it','Il mondo di Yor','Yor is an extremely blond prehistoric warrior who comes to question his origins, particularly with regard to a mysterious medallion he wears. When he learns of a desert goddess who supposedly wears the same medallion, Yor decides that he must find her and learn his true identity. Along the way, he encounters ape-men, dinosaurs, and a strange futuristic society.','/8cMkOOHlJaeQKgGPakxc6sEHHKJ.jpg','1983-08-19',89,'Released','He was a powerful warrior from the future, trapped in a prehistoric land, battling for the survival of his people.','Yor: The Hunter from the Future',38219,2.3815,4.2,'6RaHFiwlzcQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8654,_binary '\0','/sK795D4XmDnZzVLCPooYH9nzG0h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084938',5.5,3693,'en','Young Doctors in Love','An \'Airplane!\'-style spoof of hospital soap operas—a brilliant young trainee can\'t stand the sight of blood; a doctor romances the head nurse in order to get the key to the drugs cabinet; and there\'s a mafioso on the loose disguised as a woman.','/9JTPSVDEFilY09hqtWPHrCDFneV.jpg','1982-07-16',95,'Released','Warning: This Movie May Be Dangerous To Your Health. You May Never Stop Laughing.','Young Doctors in Love',47947,3.832,5.3,'nR_9zz59vYc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8655,_binary '\0','/vNg71YpRRoVrpqz6RMjgwPjggik.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084945',5,8802,'en','Zapped!','Peyton and Barney are fun loving high school students working on a science project with white mice. When one of the mice begins to move food toward itself with out touching it, Barney finds he has accidently discovered a formula for telekinetic powers. Now, how much trouble can a high school boy who can move things with just his mind get into?','/gpDRBziCjSoi1vOSTzq9rkCCSuI.jpg','1982-07-23',98,'Released','They\'re getting a little behind in their classwork.','Zapped!',23943,3.9299,5.187,'y1kacStIMH0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8656,_binary '\0','/1l105nsYYlwCMCcjbzYWphGPBrv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084953',7.8,4419,'pl','Znachor','A famous surgeon is beaten by drunken bullies, loses his memory and cannot recollect who he was before. He gets to a village, lives in a not so well to do family and becomes the Quack - he slowly regains his talent for medicine and saves the lives of several village patients.','/guBFgARkmdGljlAoH2NbErBjf7v.jpg','1982-04-12',128,'Released',NULL,'The Quack',68797,2.1682,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8657,_binary '\0','/wUfM71xLbKV9YbEtuBc3DfjgMia.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0084955',6.6,2126,'cn','最佳拍檔','The police track down a notorious burglar in order to apprehend him. However, he is given a chance to make up for his ways by working with the police on a case involving stolen diamonds.','/g186YJh9foDkBb9CLstXTDFbJic.jpg','1982-01-16',93,'Released',NULL,'Aces Go Places',2644,2.6229,6.5,'ANRCuc7R4Ew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8658,_binary '\0','/qOgRgJwgWN4FjgkP27zCSuejFaP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085121',6.3,10915,'en','10 to Midnight','Warren Stacy, an office equipment repairman, begins murdering women after they reject his advances. To minimize the evidence, Stacy always kills while naked, wearing nothing but gloves, and further evades the law with his strong alibis. Veteran detective Leo Kessler is convinced of Stacy\'s guilt and begins using questionable methods to catch him.','/ykeDbePv1xtyyWsE6PhmunvDTKw.jpg','1983-03-11',102,'Released','A cop... A killer... A deadline...','10 to Midnight',18587,4.0578,6.201,'300YlPG_aEo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8659,_binary '\0','/dPSgR1xruQ8Wa40wWyZFgfuSXEX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085124',5.2,4580,'it','1990: I guerrieri del Bronx','In post-apocalyptic New York City a policeman infiltrates the Bronx which has become a battleground for several murderous street gangs.','/w8s5YdbaXmlaXYaumDxbsuCL3c0.jpg','1982-08-22',93,'Released','The first to die were the lucky ones!','1990: The Bronx Warriors',61755,2.4742,5,'j4gbkquHURM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8660,_binary '\0','/4HaQjDaxgr2YqFqrFCfgG6S0dRf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085125',5.5,3614,'it','2019 - Dopo la caduta di New York','After a nuclear war society breaks down into two groups, the evil Euraks, and the rebel Federation. A mercenary named Parsifal is hired by the Federation to infiltrate New York City, which is controlled by the Euraks, to rescue the only fertile woman left on Earth.','/nAGrOGYNZYReZFE5CGvCvvK30Ax.jpg','1983-07-22',96,'Released','In The Year 2019, The Future Depends on One Man.','2019: After the Fall of New York',23807,2.3897,5.4,'pksZ3_RdAEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8661,_binary '\0','/bBuhStsvG48xAfatOxtHxSL2w0L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085127',7.2,20746,'cn','A計劃','In late 19th century Hong Kong, the British may rule the land, but the pirates rule the waters. Coast Guard officer Dragon Ma is determined that his beloved Coast Guard will not be made a fool of.','/AvTu2bmJbVZGXPxdx6VllGXCtLG.jpg','1983-12-22',105,'Released','Rip-roaring adventure on the old China Coast.','Project A',21519,8.0418,7.268,'Xn-b_DoUXnE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8662,_binary '\0','/hjYY1aQo5UTsKhmVjnDEasefSmQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085154',6,21199,'en','All the Right Moves','Sensitive study of a headstrong high school football star who dreams of getting out of his small Western Pennsylvania steel town with a football scholarship. His equally ambitious coach aims at a college position, resulting in a clash which could crush the player\'s dreams.','/y8OSutSNEi84ROcqyV7Tu7p8xYg.jpg','1983-10-21',91,'Released','He has everything at stake. He can\'t afford to lose. He\'s got to make all the right moves.','All the Right Moves',18172,5.6232,5.8,'iOKk79bzSdM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8663,_binary '\0','/xRWwI4l1jYrf0HaoBeMg1LNkstk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085159',4.2,8417,'en','Amityville 3-D','To debunk the Amityville house\'s infamous reputation and take advantage of a rock-bottom asking price, skeptical journalist John Baxter buys the place and settles in to write his first novel.','/gYvFL6REedBvjTSzVAhyk5imJgq.jpg','1983-11-18',93,'Released','Inside these walls, nothing is impossible... except survival.','Amityville 3-D',27214,4.3968,4.6,'6SOBXnEY-Cc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8664,_binary '\0','/40EJ7LogJjhpCB3mjx3ICfS8raY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085178',8.1,2474,'hi','अर्ध सत्य','A newly appointed police rookie deals with corruption, romance, and brutality.','/uBefh0aCQ3OJu48Fzk5CWPvBAhg.jpg','1983-08-19',123,'Released',NULL,'Ardh Satya',103073,1.6693,7.068,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8665,_binary '\0','/a62YSsCwYd5EyzB5EbaeX2FmM4m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085180',7.3,13340,'fr','L\'Argent','A forged 500-franc note is passed from person to person and shop to shop, until it falls into the hands of a genuine innocent who doesn\'t see it for what it is—which will have devastating consequences on his life.','/tqt9D4TH702ZXEUKWa3e6UdFAvY.jpg','1983-05-18',85,'Released',NULL,'L\'Argent',42112,3.7789,6.9,'jBMLpghqQj4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8666,_binary '\0','/6k5MHtvcLmS2ED3Aswokk0CdIkL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085183',3.3,3294,'it','Ator l\'invincibile','The son of Torren learns of his heritage, goes to avenge the deaths of his fellow villagers, and rescue his sister/love interest from the evil Dakkar and his spider cult.','/pwDOAEZN0UVTafivxdjUOvwpQVc.jpg','1982-10-07',92,'Released','He was born to wield the mighty sword of Thoren.','Ator, the Fighting Eagle',40075,2.3263,3.9,'1uL3kV5XR1U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8667,_binary '\0','/J36PWOn2ciOvzxZiTB8Jzsaeto.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085204',5.5,6772,'en','BMX Bandits','Teens P.J. and Goose get their thrills on BMX bikes, performing hair-raising tricks all across Sydney, Australia. Along with their new friend Judy, they discover a box of walkie-talkies -- and find out that a gang of criminals intends to use them to monitor police signals during a bank robbery. When the young trio snatches the devices, it propels them on a hair-raising adventure in which their pedaling skills might just save their necks.','/4WdK6WHPRncDiE8ngspO4EE8fH9.jpg','1983-12-29',92,'Released','They\'re burning up the streets!','BMX Bandits',17381,3.3157,5.6,'kXlkrchnDBM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8668,_binary '\0','/cJD2nWAbnb5HaSbWN7ZA9puuXB0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085208',6.4,2399,'en','Baby It\'s You','In a 1966 New Jersey high school, Jill and new student Sheik from the other side of the tracks make their way in a first love romance.','/6DGZKCnWVjdG9y5vqBc22N3gynO.jpg','1983-03-04',105,'Released','There\'s the first one. There\'s the right one. And there\'s the one you never forget.','Baby It\'s You',42103,3.1406,6,'teuHlfad9MQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8669,_binary '\0','/yIpaahwOBk4uVUBNcHkoZdcXPCK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085210',7.2,19043,'en','Bad Boys','Mick O\'Brien is a young Chicago street thug torn between a life of petty crime and the love of his girlfriend. But when the heist of a local drug dealer goes tragically wrong Mick is sentenced to a brutal juvenile prison where violence is a rite of passage and respect is measured in vengeance.','/5nHZ3wflOifKJMUcTCw0isKhmCv.jpg','1983-03-25',123,'Released','There\'s only one person left who believes Mick O\'Brien can make it... Mick O\'Brien.','Bad Boys',13633,7.6528,6.988,'_xLT-Nkv1u4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8670,_binary '\0','/qY7Er6d1E8NUhMtQtk8KmpyVUO9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085211',7.3,3817,'cn','敗家仔','A rich man\'s son believes himself to be the best kung fu fighter in Canton. Unfortunately, his father, anxious for his son\'s safety, bribes all his opponents to lose. After a humiliating defeat at the hands of an actor in a traveling theatre company, the son resolves to find a better teacher.','/9ickK7UAYvemICk3jaibCCIOqEs.jpg','1981-11-10',100,'Released','The fighting men in Chinese opera house.','The Prodigal Son',41380,2.7636,7.048,'7Bds2xQ4hDI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8671,_binary '\0','/aBPTu88INshGvRxLZSoxYn8ZRgD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085213',7.6,3335,'fr','Le Bal','In a French nightclub, choreographed song and dance routines are performed, rather than a streamlined narrative. They tell the story of Parisian culture and politics from the 1920s—1980s. A disparate, anachronistic series of characters, including an ordinary waiter, a Nazi collaborator, resistance fighters, and 1960s student protestors gather to celebrate and satirize 20th century France\'s icons, demons, and social changes.','/cAWB2CFtLg2cKYlQqbaHPEA2vBF.jpg','1983-12-21',112,'Released',NULL,'Le Bal',60612,1.528,7.044,'o9JkhyCs9dI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8672,_binary '\0','/2ynTqo3pjMBYUyTxfP9fye6StDv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085215',7.7,3153,'sh','Балкан експрес','In this entertaining, clever satire, it is the beginning of World War II and a group of con artists and thieves decide to pose as musicians under the rubric \"The Balkan Express\".','/qG8pAl98H5L6cXfr9YFBeXfQKna.jpg','1983-01-24',102,'Released','A band whose music is a cover for survival.','Balkan Express',54649,1.2112,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8673,_binary '\0','/bWui2Vgxp4f3REKQZcwwWAA5Pd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085218',8,10621,'ja','はだしのゲン','A story about the effect of the atomic bombing of Hiroshima on a boy\'s life and the lives of the Japanese people.','/kVqQToQ47e27b9uoryttWgTPiik.jpg','1983-07-21',83,'Released','The bombing of Hiroshima as seen through the eyes of a young boy.','Barefoot Gen',14087,2.9205,7.647,'KjLYP_X80GA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8674,_binary '\0','/2D2tmsVkNGRfRSrPrc2uInn6vsd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085224',4.4,2338,'en','The Being','Toxic waste dumping in a small Idaho town turns a young boy into horrible mutant monster. The town\'s police chief and a government scientist team up to stop the monster, which is quickly killing off the town\'s citizenry.','/gaiiYALkRbwd3Dl9jF7zEu3JDBO.jpg','1983-11-18',81,'Released','The ultimate terror has taken form...','The Being',73218,1.9068,4.9,'MoeW_qXxQYQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8675,_binary '\0','/4cu1qmE8Ene9WAHUMv0u5O6uZeU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085226',6.3,1579,'fr','La Belle Captive','Walter is told by his boss, Sara, to deliver an urgent letter to Henri de Corinthe. On the way he finds a beautiful woman he had been eying in a nightclub, lying in the road, bound up. He takes her to a villa to get a doctor, and ends up being locked in a bedroom with her. While she is making love to him, he has visions of surrealistic images from René Magritte\'s paintings. In the morning, the girl, Marie-Ange, has vanished, the villa looks derelict, and his neck is bleeding. Was it all just a nightmare?','/pe4P55RqRG2yPcirvHolXxsxDip.jpg','1983-02-16',88,'Released',NULL,'The Beautiful Prisoner',104338,1.9839,6.1,'ZaR_0GzMIAo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8676,_binary '\0','/rptrUX7tapj5L4PYiyjrcAOoNTj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085234',6.9,1902,'en','Betrayal','An affair between a literary agent and his best friend\'s wife, unfolding in reverse-chronological order.','/63pHI5M1og4pc7CdGKpAW0Fntxf.jpg','1983-02-19',95,'Released','In every life...for every love...with every trust...there is a risk of Betrayal.','Betrayal',139383,1.3927,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8677,_binary '\0','/wiOdyUHFYAkOK4YlpFPjYWNs2gl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085236',5.7,1775,'en','The Honorary Consul','Set in a small politically unstable Latin American country, the story follows the half English and half Latino Dr. Eduardo Plarr, who left his home to find a better life. Along the way he meets an array of people, including British Consul Charley Fortnum, a representative in Latin America who is trying to keep Revolution from occurring. He is also a remorseful alcoholic. Another person the doctor meets is Clara, whom he immediately falls in love with, but there is a problem: Clara is Charley\'s wife.','/zSkNhwE6yiAN9CknSXzxAjOUKW9.jpg','1983-09-30',104,'Released','First they betrayed him. Then they gambled with his life.','The Honorary Consul',69007,6.2237,5.8,'KVkxiUsLtP0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8678,_binary '\0','/rQY1Rkjxa7EJXYrv2jbUjLcCC4l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085240',7.3,4063,'it','Bianca','Michele, a young mathematics professor, moves into a new flat. Lonely, depressed and neurotic, he spends his time obsessively monitoring the couples around him, especially his neighbors, a young pair struggling to make their relationship work. When Bianca, a new teacher at the local high school, enters his life, Michele finds himself falling in love. At the same time, a string of murders rocks the neighborhood, casting suspicion on him.','/lnXZLkJ3MFgAFAiyVJGfTUykNkU.jpg','1984-02-23',96,'Released',NULL,'Bianca',15014,1.6042,7.519,'FHpQmhk_YNA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8679,_binary '\0','/rzaoRlc9xzopMvb464kFmotqsES.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085244',7.1,46015,'en','The Big Chill','Seven old college friends gather for a weekend reunion after the funeral of one of their own.','/rU8kjMEL5Mn0EWm3gOShPHBEZ4l.jpg','1983-09-30',105,'Released','The story of eight old friends searching for something they lost, and finding that all they needed was each other.','The Big Chill',12560,4.5452,6.8,'Ua-MspPHTtI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8680,_binary '\0','/xXvwQhnJpcsgHD32qVAUQXMjxWr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085248',5.9,2592,'en','The Black Stallion Returns','\"Black\" is a stunning fire-and-silk stallion celebrated the world over. But to his young American owner, Alec Ramsay, he\'s much more. So, when the amazing animal is stolen, Alec will stop at nothing to get him back. Alec finally unravels the mystery of Black\'s theft...only to discover that he must overcome even greater odds to reclaim his beloved horse.','/bozQVxJLeHMXMdfY76YLSAwVQBI.jpg','1983-03-25',103,'Released','They came by night to steal the magnificent stallion. Now, the boy will journey halfway around the world, brave any danger, take any risk. He had to save The Black.','The Black Stallion Returns',24883,3.3059,6.5,'uftJNUrgOZc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8681,_binary '\0','/mXEKGETmIJ9jkVoA8FuEb17uFb9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085250',4.6,1387,'it','Blade Violent - I violenti','Emanuelle is framed by a corrupt D.A. while investigating a drug smuggling operation and has to tough it out under lock and key, dealing with a strict warden and abusive guards.','/d648Kstj9gGUa4RsktDukHsFpjm.jpg','1983-05-06',88,'Released','The killing never stops...','Women\'s Prison Massacre',45233,7.3446,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8682,_binary '\0','/wmwhmih3Jdp8IIjjLrbHB98XzbO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085253',5.8,6592,'en','Nightmare at Shadow Woods','Twins Todd and Terry seem like sweet boys -- that is, until one of them takes an axe to the face of a fellow patron at the local drive-in.','/h18CdUhYxNt6RquvEleGRU2V2T4.jpg','1987-03-29',79,'Released','Not all the evil is on Elm Street ...','Nightmare at Shadow Woods',28264,2.8553,5.834,'3jwQ11osTWw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8683,_binary '\0','/jmHM6qTdb9WuKkwywDhPdXeQdav.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085255',6.4,24783,'en','Blue Thunder','Los Angeles, California. Officer Murphy, a veteran Metropolitan Police helicopter pilot suffering from severe trauma due to his harsh experiences during the Vietnam War, and Lymangood, his resourceful new partner, are tasked with testing an advanced and heavily armed experimental chopper known as Blue Thunder.','/tYoCkgVHGUAd5BgvRMWrAScY549.jpg','1983-02-05',110,'Released','He\'s out there…','Blue Thunder',6341,8.2279,6.3,'aI_GoXZqoYs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8684,_binary '\0','/7QUIa9M2iS3Sl7ePLKPrYOBz7sx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085266',2.2,1329,'en','Boogeyman II','Lacey, the shaken survivor of a bloody supernatural rampage in the countryside, is flown to Los Angeles where a slick movie producer plans to cash in on her story. At a decadent Hollywood party, plans for the beginning of a new horror movie franchise are torn asunder when a fragment of the original haunted mirror turns these hotshot movers and shakers into screamers and quakers!','/mgvWLAl6qdPoMXJ6uCZLfua8jC5.jpg','1983-08-24',79,'Released','Mirror mirror... on the wall... who\'s the deadest of them all!','Boogeyman II',54127,1.2699,3.1,'Xtw8RFT4f9A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8685,_binary '\0','/pC9qonwPXvvPx5kOT48X8U4sOTq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085267',6.6,2853,'en','Born in Flames','In near-future New York, ten years after the “social-democratic war of liberation,” diverse groups of women organize a feminist uprising as equality remains unfulfilled.','/oTznCn0JG8eXm7C4B3GOtNg2uJg.jpg','1983-04-01',80,'Released',NULL,'Born in Flames',36832,2.1303,6.2,'qQnYxdXbaY4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8686,_binary '\0','/hog8OhWLCqUY3az5cKUAZfnZ3Od.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085271',6.4,14603,'en','Brainstorm','Two brilliant research scientists have invented a device capable of recording and playing back sensory experiences only to have devastating results when one of them records their own death.','/afiRgLXIfH12NemvtthCkrwNtAu.jpg','1983-09-30',106,'Released','The door to the mind is open.','Brainstorm',15050,3.635,6.24,'NNiZP2G-nEM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8687,_binary '\0','/xdCPiNCC9ERbc7XJ6z26cRyT9pq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085276',6,12147,'en','Breathless','Jesse, a small-time criminal, high-tails it to Los Angeles to rendezvous with a French exchange student. Stealing a car and accidentally killing a highway patrolman, he becomes the most wanted fugitive in L.A.','/ipnsEbOsnQYO0HMrHTyqsO5osUV.jpg','1983-05-13',100,'Released','He\'s the last man on earth any woman needs...and every woman wants.','Breathless',1058,3.5181,5.9,'98arUBmTT6A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8688,_binary '\0','/zLuhQvcB2xFPpuU4Qjs8nd1rM0Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085289',5.8,1440,'fr','Canicule','A criminal shows up at a farmhouse with the law on his heels and several million dollars in his possession.','/4Ksmiykh2a92jPMK0dJDnhqQqYf.jpg','1984-01-10',101,'Released',NULL,'Dog Day',78321,1.3828,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8689,_binary '\0','/lOS3bt8AQZ37T9xJN7bOQHLCE38.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085297',7.4,3897,'es','Carmen','While rehearsing a flamenco ballet adaptation of Bizet\'s opera “Carmen”, Antonio, the choreographer, falls in love with the main dancer, Carmen, a fiercely independent woman. Antonio is slowly consumed by jealousy and possessiveness towards Carmen, just like Don José in the original opera, blurring the lines between fiction and reality.','/qieLqTENb8YwnR391ipUMV2Rjlq.jpg','1983-05-06',102,'Released',NULL,'Carmen',42106,1.49,6.7,'DUQDKjqAOPs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8690,_binary '\0','/hCulzUFMVA7clteeulNlzOlJsdv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085303',5.9,4588,'it','La casa con la scala nel buio','Bruno, an up and coming film composer, has been hired to write the score to a new horror movie. After moving into a secluded villa, life begins to imitate art as a vicious killer starts bumping off anyone and everyone who happens to pay him a visit.','/AmrG8GLjiQmrvIQxylEwPXhVgsG.jpg','1983-08-06',109,'Released','Don\'t Go Down the Stairs.','A Blade in the Dark',39991,2.3052,5.659,'z9OWVzyJekk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8691,_binary '\0','/5RwrEx5BdIbOD0KiE3HYaIanvWV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085318',5,2883,'en','Chained Heat','After killing a man in a drunk driving accident, a young woman is sent to a prison where both the inmates and the corrupt leadership are violent and abusive.','/iS3XhJEEmK7BfwsFFMoLVSCMQrn.jpg','1983-05-27',99,'Released','What these women did to get into prison is nothing compared to what they\'ll do to get out.','Chained Heat',18406,5.1647,5.1,'n_BQiU1JKos','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8692,_binary '\0','/2bCcm0ENZYvInREBoEYGFxg96Kb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085327',7.1,14397,'it','Chi trova un amico trova un tesoro','Alan gets a map to some war treasure which the Japanese army left behind on a small Pacific island at the end of World War II. But some gangsters try to steal the map from him and so he hides on Charlie\'s boat which just leaves the harbor. He manipulates the ship\'s compass so that Charlie is not aware that he is sailing to the treasure island. But when they step on the island, they discover that it is not as abandoned as they believed: there are some natives - and a Japanese soldier still defending the treasure','/8fl6sXVv5fWMpDxFDab54qc71tv.jpg','1981-12-09',102,'Released',NULL,'Who Finds a Friend Finds a Treasure',6399,4.4898,6.9,'FS_sEBdUuNo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8693,_binary '\0','/bYbnlh6VXFRtcSX82UMDsBDLB5j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085328',5.4,3771,'it','La chiave','In 1940s Venice, after twenty years\' marriage, retired art critic Nino Rolfe and his younger wife Teresa feel their passion waning. To help her shed her inhibitions and rekindle their relationship, the professor records his sexual fantasies in a diary.','/e6g2geNLgFzMbriH6EvSJZD78nx.jpg','1983-10-19',110,'Released','TOO HOT for Italian cinemas! Judges close down all theatres screening \"THE KEY\"!','The Key',28468,11.6391,6,'ss1x2aZ58E4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8694,_binary '\0','/6goydaLavDu3d2g3kFJHECZiddt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085333',6.8,103875,'en','Christine','Nerdy high schooler Arnie Cunningham falls for Christine, a rusty 1958 Plymouth Fury, and becomes obsessed with restoring the classic automobile to her former glory. As the car changes, so does Arnie, whose newfound confidence turns to arrogance behind the wheel of his exotic beauty. Arnie\'s girlfriend Leigh and best friend Dennis reach out to him, only to be met by a Fury like no other.','/mMtUJke2TtIoT6JB9hkvERmsSu8.jpg','1983-12-09',110,'Released','How do you kill something that can\'t possibly be alive?','Christine',8769,8.6399,6.877,'wMoHFqV3aX8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8695,_binary '\0','/feCcRTZNGUop3LnWBLTToYhd03S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085334',7.9,180250,'en','A Christmas Story','The comic mishaps and adventures of a young boy named Ralph, trying to convince his parents, teachers, and Santa that a Red Ryder B.B. gun really is the perfect Christmas gift for the 1940s.','/34nSHYqmb7222tiqiuKqKJmZiQa.jpg','1983-11-18',93,'Released','A tribute to the original, traditional, one-hundred-percent, red-blooded, two-fisted, all-American Christmas.','A Christmas Story',850,5.653,7.236,'k85XdUXcOGw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8696,_binary '\0','/7XYoCSmIPNCm9Dw5oI40AR20bzY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085335',7.6,2150,'ru','Чучело','A twelve years old girl Lena who has come to live with her grandfather in a small Russian town is being bullied by her classmates. She took the rap of being a class traitor because she was in love with the boy who had betrayed his classmates when they were bunking off and going to cinema instead of a literature lesson. The class is penalized for that, not being allowed to go to Moscow for fall holidays with the rest of the school. Lena is being ostracized, \"boycotted\" however not telling the truth, waiting that the boy himself would confess to be guilty.','/dh2uZhItHiR3cqpbRfYVuffLzRX.jpg','1983-12-31',127,'Released',NULL,'Scarecrow',63573,1.2533,6.827,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000');
INSERT INTO `movies` VALUES (8697,_binary '\0','/iNqjagxLOK3OMC7znXqwBlGAThV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085346',6,14009,'en','Class','Naive Midwestern prep student Jonathan bonds with his more worldly roommate, Skip, who takes the small-town boy under his wing. At Skip\'s urging, the inexperienced Jonathan is emboldened to seek out older women in the cocktail lounges of nearby Chicago, where he meets and beds the alluring Ellen, who unfortunately turns out to be Skip\'s mother. The division between the friends is further deepened when a cheating scandal engulfs the school.','/iDFeOVxNOSmAcsdmvtt4kZWB8GA.jpg','1983-07-22',98,'Released','The good news is Jonathan\'s having his first affair. The bad news is she\'s his roommate\'s mother.','Class',21500,4.2064,6,'C5jZnTC3Tew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8698,_binary '\0','/s72ijbHb5yUB3SpC5unhUYpAmtl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085354',6.9,7642,'fr','Les Compères','Unable to find her runaway son, a woman deceives two of her ex-lovers from her youth, a mild-mannered teacher and a tough journalist, that each is the real father in order to obtain their help.','/rkFslveTXi5vIIGX0Icys8Hz8Zc.jpg','1983-11-23',92,'Released',NULL,'The ComDads',10484,2.3737,6.626,'vXvoUT_7J2k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8699,_binary '\0','/5if7wtyH95UM8QuTKuSp5Quc1L2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085356',5.2,3389,'it','Conquest','To mark his passage into manhood, young Ilias is gifted a magical bow by his father and embarks upon a journey into the wilderness to rid the land of evil, all the while battling the witch Ocron, who wishes to steal the bow for her own nefarious ends.','/fwEZHv3nksttbsSkRYAdb5dfaBn.jpg','1983-06-02',88,'Released','In a place beyond time, comes a terrifying challenge beyond imagination!','Conquest',27232,1.7982,5.2,'vPcEnsSfltM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8700,_binary '\0','/s3vDshSRGK4Wh8iI1TFyw7fAOZ8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085361',6.6,3091,'hi','कूली','When Iqbal gets separated from his mother and brother by a flood, he becomes a coolie at Mumbai railway station. He then fights for the coolies rights and faces challenges from a businessman.','/rT2GUcSQYIopRw23mx09yWHKbZH.jpg','1983-12-02',169,'Released','If you have an item of death in your hands then I have God’s name in my heart.','Coolie',25505,1.2899,6.463,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8701,_binary '\0','/e0bro6DF5E5dxOH4fcgtzjlYX4Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085363',2.2,2926,'en','Copper Mountain','Two friends travel to a ski resort, with one looking to hit the slopes, while the other spends time trying to pick up women.','/y4EUqnad8cGfucthSkmYe2OLiNL.jpg','1983-07-07',60,'Released','Jim Carrey in one of his first and funniest films, running riot on the Colorado ski slopes.','Copper Mountain',19809,1.918,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8702,_binary '\0','/yKHBRztwj8ooaEnvwksMrdOlpYe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085366',5.5,1287,'en','Copkiller','A NYPD officer imprisons and tortures an admitted cop-killer, but finds the tables turned when his victim refuses to break and in fact urges more punishment.','/lEdauUmLl9tJqCsbroHHWPpEtZX.jpg','1983-03-15',117,'Released','He is young, he is rich. He doesn\'t do it for money.','Copkiller',68050,1.5989,6,'3lNCe1ZoKYI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8703,_binary '\0','/gVXdi22TXARlO8EdE3tEPJ3Nhr2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085370',7,2541,'fr','Coup de foudre','In 1942 in occupied France, a Jewish refugee marries a soldier to escape deportation to Germany. Meanwhile a wealthy art student loses her first husband to a stray Resistance bullet; at the Liberation she meets an actor, gets pregnant, and marries him. Lena and Madeleine meet at their children\'s school in Lyon in 1952 and the intensity of their relationship strains both their marriages to the breaking point.','/lUKJi4IwkMuD9mL7YxV6fSfHmLN.jpg','1983-04-06',111,'Released',NULL,'Entre Nous',42108,1.532,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8704,_binary '\0','/emp0evYWsvSHBbbRTXpWzJ8mZAH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085380',6.9,2422,'en','Cross Creek','In the 1930s, Marjorie Kinnan Rawlings moves to Florida\'s backwaters to write in peace. She feels bothered by affectionate men, editors and confused neighbors, but soon she connects and writes The Yearling, a classic of American literature.','/klil5YyD3GunFzEIYBbwLRjsVUb.jpg','1983-09-21',127,'Released','The portrait of a woman who, at the edge of survival, found a world of meaning.','Cross Creek',115332,1.9269,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8705,_binary '\0','/8MHv31RHBbyvBiC4AjJx6opebTm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085382',6.1,55161,'en','Cujo','A friendly St. Bernard named \"Cujo\" contracts rabies and conducts a reign of terror on a small American town.','/uNBt2YxrQdyOjnm2rDQ5QiCmQ0K.jpg','1983-08-10',93,'Released','Now, there\'s a new name for terror.','Cujo',10489,5.2495,6.2,'45vzCiU01O4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8706,_binary '\0','/gBLmWgSDwAXhWMMPO7yXocuE1PC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085384',4.4,7433,'en','Curse of the Pink Panther','Inspector Clouseau disappears, and the Surete wants the world\'s second best detective to look for him. However, Clouseau\'s enemy, Dreyfus, rigs the Surete\'s computer to select, instead, the world\'s WORST detective, NYPD Sgt. Clifton Sleigh. Sleigh obtusely bungles his way past assassins and corrupt officials as though he were Clouseau\'s American cousin.','/vd4bjWY1wJrjjl0c0ar2wccGT96.jpg','1983-08-12',109,'Released','He\'s been bombed, blasted and plugged in the parachute... Is this any way to welcome the World\'s Greatest Detective?','Curse of the Pink Panther',36576,4.3422,4.605,'RL0AdV41EsY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8707,_binary '\0','/3vHADbVJiv5bB3HPuu6j9oORowT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085385',5.5,7067,'en','Curtains','Six young actresses auditioning for a movie role at a remote mansion are targeted by a mysterious masked murderer.','/jpMClX0G1Gsia1Dn1HaFGPXqjd0.jpg','1983-03-04',89,'Released','Behind every curtain, someone is waiting...something is watching.','Curtains',67087,1.6665,5.3,'BDf-1F0qmXI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8708,_binary '\0','/uPIUrO4zhFpCG0fq0gF6hwwCgWH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085387',5.6,5736,'en','D.C. Cab','The tale of a hapless group of cabbies and a rundown cab company owned by Harold. Albert comes to town with a dream of starting his own cab company but needs to motivate Harold\'s employees to want to make something out of themselves. It is only when Albert is kidnapped that the cabbies must decide whether or not they are loyal to Albert and his cause.','/7ToBZQaV5qspXjM8hat8kcbNcQc.jpg','1983-12-16',100,'Released','When these guys hit the streets, guess what hits the fan.','D.C. Cab',27679,2.605,5.2,'sKAyGTT1_m8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8709,_binary '\0','/Zw58auxBY3coGpOSy0nItQWHpT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085390',6.9,2370,'en','Daffy Duck\'s Movie: Fantastic Island','Daffy Duck and Speedy Gonzales find a treasure map that leads them to a wishing well, which for a penny will grant any wish (through old cartoon footage). Daffy sets up a resort around the well and various Looney Tunes characters have their dreams come true. Meanwhile, Yosemite Sam and the Tasmanian Devil hunt for the varmints who stole their treasure map!','/rYhasRbxKl8tregggAstihE1DwK.jpg','1983-08-05',78,'Released','Daffy Finally Gets His Own: ☒ Movie, ☒ Funny Business, ☒ Cartoon Riot','Daffy Duck\'s Movie: Fantastic Island',80607,2.9706,6.692,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8710,_binary '\0','/bs0QTuo2EBqiWTyeGUxke37TAfK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085398',6.6,1793,'en','Daniel','The fictionalized story of Daniel, the son of Paul and Rochelle Isaacson, who were executed as Soviet spies in the 1950s. As a graduate student in New York in the 1960s, Daniel is involved in the antiwar protest movement and contrasts his experiences to the memory of his parents and his belief that they were wrongfully convicted.','/5wr27gUyfi0sDdiTPa1jg48MvmK.jpg','1983-08-26',130,'Released',NULL,'Daniel',55819,2.1275,6.6,'S4m4U8RHFIU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8711,_binary '\0','/84Om9plJBF47M5zwrfqdkEJm3im.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085400',7.2,1620,'fr','Dans la ville blanche','Fed up with the sea, Paul, a Swiss mechanic working in the noisy bowels of a merchant ship, lands in Lisbon.','/sKoDVfcxElkqbhXjjVVmv1l6IM2.jpg','1983-03-11',109,'Released',NULL,'In the White City',33802,2.0287,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8712,_binary '\0','/AfBGTLp9JtsWNUJC6rP1U1XCPCE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085404',7,20695,'en','The Day After','In the mid-1980s, the U.S. is poised on the brink of nuclear war. This shadow looms over the residents of a small town in Kansas as they continue their daily lives. Dr. Russell Oakes maintains his busy schedule at the hospital, Denise Dahlberg prepares for her upcoming wedding, and Stephen Klein is deep in his graduate studies. When the unthinkable happens and the bombs come down, the town\'s residents are thrust into the horrors of nuclear winter.','/brieV17D6R6HcubOqehLNYuxnvs.jpg','1983-12-10',127,'Released','They told us it would be impossible to make this movie. They told us it would be impossible for you to watch it. We hope nothing is impossible.','The Day After',7012,5.9459,6.798,'gIk6aBLCoHg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8713,_binary '\0','/icvgQHxrKEDx92VQ5WHiEmEAUKH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085407',7.1,85579,'en','The Dead Zone','Johnny Smith is a schoolteacher with his whole life ahead of him but, after leaving his fiancee\'s home one night, is involved in a car crash which leaves him in a coma for 5 years. When he wakes, he discovers he has an ability to see into the past, present and future life of anyone with whom he comes into physical contact.','/9yTVaeS8eIkOpbwIycVFm7EQrgF.jpg','1983-10-21',103,'Released','In his mind, he has the power to see the future. In his hands, he has the power to change it.','The Dead Zone',11336,9.6245,7,'iKZz8Gy5ceU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8714,_binary '\0','/V3Aloyv0FcCjU19gEOSf44tluG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085412',4.7,4777,'en','Deal of the Century','Arms dealers from several companies vie to sell the most expensive and highest tech weapons to a South American dictator. There are complications; understanding the exact nature of how \'gifts\' are used to grease the wheels of a sale, a religious conversion from one of the salesman and a romance that begins to grow between two competitors.','/db2rZF0XO0hzH2AT8ZsDgeHlAYz.jpg','1983-11-04',99,'Released','Chevy Chase and his partners are arms dealers. They sell second-rate weapons to third world nations. But they\'re not out to stick it to anyone.','Deal of the Century',20545,3.1139,4.7,'o-MJm7Nkuz8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8715,_binary '\0','/x4yMBio5kuK6UCNkRbsOEKzLTH7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085415',4.4,1727,'en','Death Screams','Late one night, a young couple are brutally murdered at a make-out spot by an unseen assailant, their bodies tossed into the nearby river. As the lifeless lovers drift slowly downstream, the residents of the town excitedly prepare themselves for their annual carnival, unaware that a machete-wielding maniac with a twisted grudge is lurking in their midst. When a group of teen revellers plan a late-night after party down in the local cemetery, they unwittingly set the stage for a bloodbath.','/zdIMJz1mpNo8qKvWRjKJN4s5ue9.jpg','1982-05-01',88,'Released','The last scream you hear... is your own!','Death Screams',85199,1.1624,4.4,'fodlnrzbvHA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8716,_binary '\0','/cbr0KMMvUNtrGdBvYCi0GVdz2zH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085426',6.7,7125,'fr','Le Dernier Combat','The plot explores the devastation of civilization and issues of brutality, hostility and isolation. Pierre Jolivet stars as the main character (identified only as \"The Man\" in the end credits) who is menaced by \"The Brute\" (played by Jean Reno) on his journey through a world filled by people rendered nearly mute by some unknown incident.','/Ag3cM67YCiOIyc0MLVNnDZ0avf4.jpg','1983-04-06',90,'Released',NULL,'The Last Battle',19184,3.0722,6.3,'bRWN_QtzBLk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8717,_binary '\0','/asqiMWQclyDbWdDiCDttaKNSpto.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085434',5,1633,'en','The Devonsville Terror','Dr. Worley investigates a 300-year-old witch\'s curse in the New England town of Devonsville. Three liberated, assertive women move into town, which angers the bigoted, male-dominated town fathers. One of the women is a reincarnation of the witch, who proceeds to exact revenge on them.','/w4K67t8odo35Y3Quz5t15hGOEAX.jpg','1983-10-24',82,'Released','Three hundred years ago they burned her as a witch. Now she\'s back!','The Devonsville Terror',98012,1.3741,4.7,'3Nq_Qrp8jpc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8718,_binary '\0','/cFatLWWye35gTB1FvWI5X5jqrs3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085450',5.3,6586,'en','Doctor Detroit','A shy but gentle man named Clifford Skridlow is a professor of comparative literature at the financially-strapped fictional Monroe College in Chicago. A chance encounter with four beautiful women at a restaurant changes his life forever.','/aluYVLiLMn5cRPBJV6YyXkItwyZ.jpg','1983-05-06',89,'Released','He\'s making the world safe for insanity.','Doctor Detroit',23096,2.5556,5.113,'KNf9gCzJrbw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8719,_binary '\0','/pO81gxXEskO2JQQoPgAWWv8XFAn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085454',5.6,2478,'it','Don Camillo','A priest helps the small town he\'s stationed in to resolve conflicts by working together.','/2T1EaovVOLlADfYkeVyXQz9s5Dz.jpg','1984-02-08',126,'Released',NULL,'Don Camillo',11539,1.9395,5.6,'1JuMWqTlf58','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8720,_binary '\0','/awQ4MzI19Po2Fd33D81GfYhWSxt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085461',7.4,6450,'en','The Dresser','In a touring Shakespearean theater group, a backstage hand - the dresser - is devoted to the brilliant but tyrannical head of the company. He struggles to support the deteriorating star as the company struggles to carry on during the London Blitz. The pathos of his backstage efforts rival the pathos in the story of Lear and the Fool that is being presented on-stage, as the situation comes to a crisis.','/o3IBu0gk7yEZ57BD8MAloP1cGeS.jpg','1983-12-06',118,'Released','What happens backstage is always true drama. And often pure comedy.','The Dresser',42122,2.3299,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8721,_binary '\0','/qX4wNvBhonB1E2PMDL5ihxaKWf3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085470',6.2,11462,'en','Easy Money','To inherit his mother-in-law\'s colossal fortune, a hard living gambling addict must change his unhealthy ways before it gets the best of him.','/nREZhCfkUgl6XqMZAvd6DCbVj2c.jpg','1983-08-19',95,'Released','No cheating! No gambling! No booze! No smoking! No pizza! No nothin\'!','Easy Money',18391,2.7575,6.01,'dLrnqcsfK2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8722,_binary '\0','/1LLOLshwT5MzuYQ9ncz7DcZDoE5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085473',5.6,1416,'en','Eddie Macon\'s Run','Eddie Macon is running from a nightmare... running to a dream... running for his life and his time is running out. He\'s escaped a Texas prison for the second time (risking life imprisonment if caught) to make it back to his wife and son. Relentlessly pursued by ruthless truant officer, Carl Marzack, who feels he must prove he can still \'get his man\' by returning Macon to jail at any cost.','/zbUX1AktQHOQkiUmBllX9KwLcP2.jpg','1983-03-23',94,'Released','Eddie Macon is running from a nightmare... running to a dream... and running for his life.','Eddie Macon\'s Run',35834,2.7842,5.9,'COfzAs2FWQ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8723,_binary '\0','/jXND39wsOOjWoE7FrpAFJ60OaLM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085475',6.9,9898,'en','Eddie and the Cruisers','A television newswoman picks up the story of a 1960s rock band whose long-lost leader — Eddie Wilson — may still be alive, while searching for the missing tapes of the band\'s never-released album.','/hse8fpBYuIYcFPuc2VqjQv2fpm5.jpg','1983-09-23',95,'Released','Rebel. Rocker. Lover. Idol. Vanished.','Eddie and the Cruisers',21721,2.5528,6.646,'1nXj8RkP7xQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8724,_binary '\0','/4WaqsTQUhGzRRuuY7FXPVM1lLda.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085478',7.2,15957,'en','Educating Rita','Rita, a witty 26-year-old hairdresser, wants to \'discover\' herself, so she joins the Open University where she meets the disillusioned professor of literature, Dr. Frank Bryant. His marriage has failed, his new girlfriend is having an affair with his best friend and he can\'t get through the day without downing a bottle or two of whisky. What Frank needs is a challenge... and along comes Rita.','/xwxgiRzw2zxzWNIYp98faJ0rUy5.jpg','1983-06-16',106,'Released','Sometimes students end up being the best teachers.','Educating Rita',38291,3.3354,6.9,'-9v_36XKfos','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8725,_binary '\0','/5G54yKy3A6MFfwzQ5Q6rrYyjvrY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085482',7.7,6095,'es','El Norte','Brother and sister Enrique and Rosa flee persecution at home in Guatemala and journey north, through Mexico and on to the United States, with the dream of starting a new life.','/bgpz7gTpWmmBb26CcjVtiPE7Kfo.jpg','1983-10-11',141,'Released',NULL,'El Norte',17435,2.1376,7.138,'jPoqBCvyG9k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8726,_binary '\0','/23qbrvlNPgR6s7RykEIWzONddpp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085486',3.5,2030,'fr','Emmanuelle 4','In order to escape from her former lover Marc, Sylvia goes to Brazil where Dr. Santamo transforms her into the beautiful Emmanuelle...','/vAtkVmsxR1jWoMWMm07loHgW0bU.jpg','1984-02-15',89,'Released','The erotic adventure continues','Emmanuelle 4',40978,3.7761,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8727,_binary '\0','/njHtlpln6iBMonTkXGI7plRMaIM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085496',6.5,9384,'es','Entre tinieblas','After her drug pusher boyfriend overdoses on heroin, a cabaret singer finds refuge from the authorities in a convent for fallen women.','/AB9cm20W0lGebbI39swUmdYZAV.jpg','1983-10-03',100,'Released',NULL,'Dark Habits',8220,2.3689,6.6,'jDXIGpMzX3A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8728,_binary '\0','/hIU7U2MxhcxVo48IY4tYn9u7Xsu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085514',5.1,1524,'en','Il giustiziere della strada','It\'s the year 3000 and a nuclear war has turned the earth into a desert wasteland. A group of survivors living in a cave run out of water and desperately need to locate a new supply. The last guy they sent out to find water never returned, and now his 10 year old son Timmy wants to join the next search team. They think they know where there\'s an untapped well of water, but to get there they have to travel through dangerous terrain controlled by a savage gang of motorcyclists under the bloodthirsty reign of \'Crazy Bull\'. On their mission, Timmy and his team run into a lonesome stranger named Alien (Robert Iannucci) who may be able to help them against the marauding motorcyclists. Can the struggling survivors looking for water in this barren world defeat Crazy Bull and his exterminating minions? Hang on tight - the battle has just begun!','/4BRH5lAsCzhwx4q8CN2CXcrDgYj.jpg','1983-08-13',87,'Released','A futuristic film of survival','Exterminators of the Year 3000',115042,2.199,4.8,'9fffw8_KHeY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8729,_binary '\0','/8NtxjzJx9poLMx1AXlWlBHdujTA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085515',6.2,2995,'en','Eyes of Fire','In 1750, an adulterous preacher is ejected from a small British colony with his motley crew of followers, who make their way downriver to establish a new settlement of their own beyond the western frontier.','/mxT0psJTjT2yri8QOvHE4N7iANo.jpg','1983-10-21',86,'Released','The secret is sleeping in the trees.','Eyes of Fire',72349,2.3086,5.667,'A8_HDMaOMro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8730,_binary '\0','/cjvb1NROa39QbsVwq3bRm7X3Pid.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085518',3.9,2379,'en','Faces of Death II','This film continues along the same lines as F.O.D. 1 with short scenes of material related to death. Mortuaries, accidents, police work are filmed by television equipment and domestic video cameras.','/kE86sUyDJfrruVcKeYPctGvajVP.jpg','1981-05-01',79,'Released','WHEN MAKE BELIEVE IS JUST NOT ENOUGH!','Faces of Death II',15900,2.3266,4.1,'3vgVOWVH68g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8731,_binary '\0','/7XHRntPB5HeRzkFxHbsZ4khxFQf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085524',6.5,2798,'it','Fantozzi subisce ancora','After a hard day at work and a condominium-board meeting, accountant Ugo Fantozzi goes on a trip with his family. Unfortunately, he will face a nasty surprise upon his return.','/axZDc4lmjlQTiInmoVye2Ad1qSK.jpg','1983-12-22',85,'Released',NULL,'Fantozzi Still Suffers',26285,1.6234,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8732,_binary '\0','/l6cLuZBjvdYYj8eV3ZnMVMoL5bZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085529',5.9,1266,'fr','La Femme de mon pote','The charming Pascal, owner of a clothing store in Courchevel, and the chubby and scruffy Micky, disc jockey in a nearby club, are best of friends. Pascal accumulates women, much to the chagrin of Micky, who is consoled of his failures by listening to his friend talk about his successes. Viviane arises, ravishing and icy, but she\'s seasonal. Pascal, sincerely in love, seduces her and then leaves. This is a dire situation for Micky: Pascal is far away and the beauty is so kind to him. Complications arise once Pascal returns.','/hCHc6v0XIggcRlkvWkbXCDejKYL.jpg','1983-08-31',99,'Released',NULL,'My Best Friend\'s Girl',64504,1.7941,5.73,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8733,_binary '\0','/k9umWAxbyVZQkd1zTKoo9HeOab2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085533',7.3,2286,'zh','風櫃來的人','Ah-Ching and his friends have just finished school in their island fishing village, and now spend most of their time drinking and fighting. Three of them decide to go to the port city of Kaohsiung to look for work. They find an apartment through relatives, and Ah-Ching is attracted to the girlfriend of a neighbor. There they face the harsh realities of the big city.','/r6evRAtqfodrY9eytNt7Oc7gg0a.jpg','1983-07-13',98,'Released',NULL,'The Boys from Fengkuei',105703,1.8279,7.196,'z4r8KSb8e04','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8734,_binary '\0','/tMOukv9bSjVW2AMevSmkU5l9sGb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085542',6.5,15033,'en','Fire and Ice','The villainous Nekron and his mother, Queen Juliana, plot against the human race from their frigid fortress. Creating mass destruction with huge glaciers, mother and son incur the wrath of Larn, a warrior whose entire village was destroyed by ice. When Nekron\'s underlings kidnap the beautiful Princess Teegra, Larn sets out to rescue her, assisted by the fierce and enigmatic Darkwolf.','/qj7j4vbdQKW8JXjyFHpIJlFrbmY.jpg','1983-03-25',82,'Released','It\'s a magical world you\'ll never want to leave.','Fire and Ice',15035,5.2845,6.7,'0u64CLs_yb4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8735,_binary '\0','/k6BDdDhWeTlj0LVUL5eADZtR0cz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085549',6.2,65150,'en','Flashdance','Alex Owens, a young woman juggling between two odd jobs, aspires to become a successful ballet dancer. Nick, who is her boss and lover, supports and encourages her to fulfil her dream.','/ziiy6ORt8BlxWFXskBChBMInvDA.jpg','1983-04-14',95,'Released','Something happens when she hears the music... it\'s her freedom. It\'s her fire. It\'s her life.','Flashdance',535,9.0587,6.5,'NV6IbcZVjuk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8736,_binary '\0','/vft58FknLvj4k4uYCQOCVLvFr1A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085551',6.5,1676,'en','Get Crazy','Mega-promoter Colin Beverly plans to sabotage the New Year\'s 1983 concert of small-time operator Max Wolfe. Wolfe\'s assistants Neil Allen and Willie Loman find romance while trying to save the drugs, violence, and rock and roll from Beverly\'s schemes.','/biOonZmJloMVqdz4g0ghFEnDtEr.jpg','1983-08-05',92,'Released','It was the greatest rock event ever... until the place EXPLODED!','Get Crazy',29628,1.633,6.1,'T681L5QKMGY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8737,_binary '\0','/dN3mR3W7LJUPPJZSbgKzxye5S60.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085574',5.3,1674,'sv','G - som i gemenskap','Three friends, Robban, Alexander and Kim has just left the compulsory school, and now they consider themselves grown-up and mature, being 16 years old. During the summer holiday they also get a bit of experience of the world: Robban becomes a full-time drug addict, Alexander plays in a rock band but leaves it and Kim is desperate to get the girl of his dreams.','/kPZlKDjWVzETCkOSvjrLTVzkQSn.jpg','1983-02-25',109,'Released',NULL,'G',36961,1.4969,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8738,_binary '\0','/uMKrWvrgwH3lnx6z4Fb8GoM7Hmp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085575',6.2,1525,'pt','Gabriela','In 1925, Gabriela, a poor, uneducated, yet charming woman becomes cook, mistress, and then wife of Nacib, a bar owner in Ilhéus, a small Brazilian coastal town run by the local colonels.','/ho99cPnYeKj1RepZxB4XWYzTyfY.jpg','1983-03-24',99,'Released',NULL,'Gabriela',42109,3.4471,5.9,'8h8BqDRqDh0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8739,_binary '\0','/g6VIS5UoyJYAiAb7wFX7LWnd3wd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085599',7.4,1870,'el','Γλυκιά Συμμορία','The diary of the life and death of a group of \'amoral\' young people, who have reached the point of no return and seek something to believe in and to die for. Their behavior brings the attention of the State. A discreet surveillance begins. A vigilante group monitors their house, headed by a nameless blonde man.','/tTolMQR8qOU3jCqICVUzSbY2FiX.jpg','1983-10-08',152,'Released',NULL,'Sweet Bunch',131476,0.9409,6.364,'jHvEUpyvKBM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8740,_binary '\0','/8jCS8ngr5CPrsSY1oR259402MVP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085601',7.1,12337,'it','Nati con la camicia','After Doug picks up hitchhiking Rosco with his truck, they are mistaken for two bank robbers by the traffic police. They manage to escape only to be confused for two secret agents while trying to take a flight at the airport.','/gfv6ctg1BTtpQeOkwThe4EzDSK9.jpg','1983-02-01',107,'Released',NULL,'Go for It',11616,5.0948,7,'aodcFMp6_Hw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8741,_binary '\0','/qwLp1yLJcTjLQQlvJovk6Q2D2l7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085603',5.2,2303,'en','Going Berserk','John Bourgignon, a drummer-chauffeur engaged to the daughter of a United States senator, encounters a sleazy film director, the leader of an aerobics cult, and other crazed characters in the days leading up to his wedding.','/c95ObKoRhgUh7zNv885G3VyzWy3.jpg','1983-09-30',85,'Released',NULL,'Going Berserk',24772,2.3409,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8742,_binary '\0','/dO8qUkabhQwBy8lPGawtvWQkdKd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085615',6.7,18504,'en','Gorky Park','Police Inspector Renko tries to solve the case of three bodies found in Moscow\'s Gorky Park but finds his attempts to solve the crime impeded by his superiors. Working on his own, Renko seeks out more information and stumbles across a conspiracy involving the highest levels of the government.','/xQFH7XlMk8pLPDzK5XVEj5McsRm.jpg','1983-12-15',128,'Released','Murder In Moscow','Gorky Park',8289,4.8969,6.3,'2WgOZ6W6Ug4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8743,_binary '\0','/5m3iuO5ACGuOE15Gv1TXmNweXRK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085622',7.3,2937,'en','The Grey Fox','Old West highwayman Bill Miner, known to Pinkertons as \"The Gentleman Bandit,\" is released in 1901 after 33 years in prison. A genial and charming old man, he re-enters a world unfamiliar to him, and returns to the only thing that gives him purpose — robbery.','/ycE2WBSczxBgM1vtRQ9KTtwGTMR.jpg','1982-12-16',92,'Released','In 1901, after 33 years in San Quentin Prison, Bill Miner, \"The Gentleman Bandit\", was released into the Twentieth Century.','The Grey Fox',42136,1.4862,6.9,'bqWv-3IkV-0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8744,_binary '\0','/AwDCPQseSrJvRyCz7Wjaf1pgxI7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085627',4.8,2017,'it','I guerrieri dell\'anno 2072','In the future, two television networks compete for ratings by producing violent game shows. One network produces a modern day version of the Roman gladiators, only on motorcycles instead of chariots, and uses convicted murderers as the participants, The network decides it needs a champion for this sport, so they frame a constant winner from another game for murder, and place him on the show.','/jJXmfSrZEGH6WP2IBh012esfd5P.jpg','1984-01-28',94,'Released','Champions of Death','Warriors of the Year 2072',40352,2.6066,5.1,'SQaVzsVHiuM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8745,_binary '\0','/olnkSPwpvy1UlriaBIUH3Zdvitu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085635',7.6,1876,'zh','海灘的一天','Two friends who haven\'t seen each other for thirteen years reunite. One is a successful concert pianist just back from a European tour and the other has just started a new business.','/83GRYRWEXWkfGbDBIpEhXdEhONA.jpg','1983-04-11',166,'Released',NULL,'That Day, on the Beach',106373,1.8328,7.492,'WUk7PRE0W9c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8746,_binary '\0','/eyOKqtgNeEEIp7zYMHnpISpsaS3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085636',5.2,68647,'en','Halloween III: Season of the Witch','After a terrified toy salesman is mysteriously attacked and brought to the hospital clutching the year\'s most popular Halloween mask, Dr. Daniel Challis sets out to investigate the strange events and finds himself thrust into a nightmarish conspiracy.','/WABfdeaThFYXCySGIOvRNv2sSW.jpg','1982-10-22',98,'Released','The night no one comes home.','Halloween III: Season of the Witch',10676,7.9027,5.3,'kk8QJdD5ExE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8747,_binary '\0','/fGntQlOFZxPptDmmZsc9bENf5ZT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085640',6.4,4049,'en','Hammett','Chinatown, San Francisco, 1928. Former private detective Dashiell Hammett, a compulsive drinker with tuberculosis who writes pulp fiction for a living, receives an unexpected visit from an old friend asking for help.','/ssaXsTAhAYklEmhhjsMZfeyPCuD.jpg','1982-06-09',98,'Released','He created \"The Maltese Falcon,\" \"Sam Spade\" and \"The Thin Man.\" But he didn\'t write this mystery thriller...he lived it.','Hammett',28307,2.125,6.2,'brcmR0whE54','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8748,_binary '\0','/tIVVXNWKDcKf3rxc7ab0Cyx2gDU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085656',6.8,1741,'en','Heart Like a Wheel','Shirley Muldowney is determined to be a top-fuel drag racer, although no woman has ever raced them before. Despite the high risks of this kind of racing and the burden it places on her family life, she perseveres in her dream.','/6P06Op4wLd4epWPuobdMUTRuf8I.jpg','1983-04-01',113,'Released','She did something women were forbidden to do, and became a World Champion.','Heart Like a Wheel',34599,2.2624,5.9,'8yLZGqj8zh0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8749,_binary '\0','/xY8vAc6M39vappej93vlKa3ZiFc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085672',4.2,4951,'en','Hercules','Hercules, a semi-divine being, squares off against King Minos, who is attempting to use science to gain power and take over the world. With the help of a benevolent sorceress, Circe, Hercules tries to save his beloved Cassiopeia from being sacrificed by Minos, and struggles against laser-breathing creatures and an evil sorceress.','/x02VMg4z7frtezt7bGSAw37mHqg.jpg','1983-08-12',98,'Released','The strongest man on Earth.','Hercules',26452,2.4036,4.9,'GoSqkNrSdEY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8750,_binary '\0','/qToL8r6czDJEZwSorQAMbcbkERJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085678',6.1,6532,'en','High Road to China','A biplane pilot is saddled with a spoiled industrialist\'s daughter on a search for her missing father through Asia that eventually involves them in a struggle against a Chinese warlord.','/pkD3oIkZQSg3CiqwDwX3EWjhkG7.jpg','1983-03-18',105,'Released','Take the High Road to China... for an adventure you\'ll never forget.','High Road to China',19606,2.9375,6,'wmf7lVvPVtg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8751,_binary '\0','/cnxM2BK0lmK785zJNQ6SDlGFMUz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085679',5.5,2020,'en','High School U.S.A.','Set in a senior high school class, J.J. pursues the girlfriend of a rival from a higher clique which culminates in a race at the end of the movie between the two rivals in this light comedy.','/jV9Zg3DCWltwxRuOktMoXm4gx2q.jpg','1983-10-16',100,'Released','Pick up your speed or get out of the way.','High School U.S.A.',38923,2.5883,5.5,'G98AJyCrpFQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8752,_binary '\0','/oQ3WqDO06AV4gzElJmiiD6vr3oK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085692',6.5,1830,'en','The Hound of the Baskervilles','When a nobleman is threatened by a family curse on his newly inherited estate, detective Sherlock Holmes is hired to investigate.','/knEO4TxWPv9M2WwydYU9k0rXua5.jpg','1983-11-03',100,'Released','Holmes and Watson\'s most chilling case... an age-old curse... a ravenous monster...','The Hound of the Baskervilles',83579,2.5304,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8753,_binary '\0','/uPSwOMmDf1kP4viZUjvNc61mGVB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085693',6.2,5766,'en','House of the Long Shadows','An American writer goes to a remote Welsh manor on a $20,000 bet that he can write a classic novel like \'Wuthering Heights\' in 24 hours. However, upon his arrival he discovers that the apparently empty manor has several rather odd inhabitants.','/21ZGFNeqOSeDNhbQCuCpUupqy1U.jpg','1983-06-17',100,'Released','Room for every nightmare… A nightmare in every room.','House of the Long Shadows',39164,3.2712,6.4,'8UP8A1LtChw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8754,_binary '\0','/eWtgW9vdFijpRyXwkcZbXg1Z13j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085694',5.8,11486,'en','The House on Sorority Row','When the senior sorority sisters of Theta Pi decide to do in their demented house mother, someone seeks revenge, and begins a night of terror and madness.','/x2e22IVGkbCNCCDcw4gg5HezrSQ.jpg','1982-11-19',91,'Released','Sorority sisters... Sisters in life. Sisters in death.','The House on Sorority Row',40229,3.3691,5.8,'-ldHJHXY8KA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8755,_binary '\0','/qw9p7gBroQt99fjG0cwtLHohQR9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085701',6.6,32456,'en','The Hunger','Five-thousand-year-old vampire Miriam promises her lovers the gift of eternal life. When John, her cellist companion for centuries, discovers that he has suddenly begun growing old, he attempts to seek out the help of Dr. Sarah Roberts, a researcher on the mechanisms of aging.','/lFTDtRtK8J55A1LTpwigV7QGQg7.jpg','1983-04-29',97,'Released','Nothing human loves forever.','The Hunger',11654,7.0212,6.656,'g7DzTgy6_Vk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.0000