, Spider and Wendell -- go on a series of misadventures when they head to Tijuana, Mexico, for a night of cruisin\', causing trouble, and to lose their virginity.','/7BQP8GzBW4ZZxqcc5tDH68yNeAI.jpg','1983-04-08',100,'Released','The last word...about the first time.','Losin\' It',33676,2.9571,5,'s3ZKyllapso','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8778,_binary '\0','/dpfIsCtDkXw6zX5Dlf3En8Tygho.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085872',6,3845,'en','The Loveless','Trouble ensues when a motorcycle gang stops in a small southern town while heading to the races at Daytona.','/3aZcW9NBsLX7ZldQkDtbKkHMfUq.jpg','1984-01-20',83,'Released','Sworn to fun... Loyal to none!!','The Loveless',36826,1.8938,5.7,'LJmU9KUJxGA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8779,_binary '\0','/AebCnhxpSPLqakzvWBvwwQkBDLD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085878',5.9,1683,'fr','La Lune dans le caniveau','A dockworker seeking revenge on the killer of his sister finds himself the object of desire for two women.','/dYNC5c8IdzzVKs2pIkMlm6tj2OG.jpg','1983-05-18',138,'Released',NULL,'The Moon in the Gutter',47489,2.4909,5.681,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8780,_binary '\0','/z3SBKjtZ5lSqMAU78e66ueBAtPq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085891',5.3,2856,'en','The Man Who Loved Women','A womanizing sculptor seeks help from a psychiatrist to cure him of his obsession with women.','/uO8atMbKAAbagLtAKhgjnsJqA0O.jpg','1983-12-18',110,'Released','Deciding which woman in the world he loves most is driving him out of his mind.','The Man Who Loved Women',69928,2.8442,4.9,'oOKspMKuHss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8781,_binary '\0','/p8HJznvwvFCkXJb2eKiJCfCIIM5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085894',6.4,29876,'en','The Man with Two Brains','A brain surgeon marries a femme fatale, causing his life to turn upside down. Things go more awry when he falls in love with a talking brain.','/jSnGiPE17sgicRyTPrE6UB0pnEU.jpg','1983-06-10',93,'Released','Steve Martin is a world famous surgeon. He invented screw top, zip lock brain surgery. Trust him.','The Man with Two Brains',11591,4.0727,6.2,'P5m_9MmmduM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8782,_binary '\0','/pSjh05C0JIA583CKToVSY4pMz4z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085900',6.4,4053,'fr','Le Marginal','Philippe Jordan is a policeman prone to advancing the cause of justice by any means necessary. On his agenda is a powerful drug cartel working out of Paris and Marseilles, with a drug lord who is essentially inaccessible -- but not immortal.','/li1IrkJldDlHNm8DtcA79b251fS.jpg','1983-10-26',100,'Released',NULL,'The Outsider',12504,2.7132,6.8,'ALaOGyK6FhM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8783,_binary '\0','/uuxY0hpf3B2bThoZXnQztnlIGPY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085913',8.3,4797,'hi','मासूम','A loving husband and father\'s joyful family life is rocked to its core upon the discovery that he has a young son borne from a past extramarital affair.','/a2PVNqiTbALVhyQVuqDMROy21Pt.jpg','1983-01-10',138,'Released','Can this child destroy your family?','Masoom',21462,1.9215,6.667,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8784,_binary '\0','/wDUMDFMq1nwWGf2OHnpCOxlOx3N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085918',5.1,3788,'en','Mausoleum','By way of an unnatural urge during her Mother\'s funeral, Susan enters her family\'s mausoleum, which unleashes an evil presence to lurk inside of her.','/ja8PGBkwYu347N08iAyR5rs7YZE.jpg','1983-05-01',97,'Released','Centuries of Evil Have Just Awakened.','Mausoleum',17923,1.4923,5.1,'-FklxBhsZ4Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8785,_binary '\0','/1JiAfaorx2V6vaHWUuDpRa1gm5v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085919',6.7,4274,'en','Max Dugan Returns','An English teacher and struggling single mother has her life disrupted when the father who abandoned her as a child comes back into her life.','/wYOmBIJwliiu43CwWqx79f8Zp8Z.jpg','1983-03-25',98,'Released','Prices are double. Your love life\'s in trouble. The car won\'t start. Your boss has no heart. The door squeaks. The roof leaks. Your stereo just went mono. All you need is a little Max Dugan.','Max Dugan Returns',1793,2.3762,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8786,_binary '\0','/aPA8444jAYLrknwpbXkCPoWAsqb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085932',7.5,1722,'ru','Мэри Поппинс, до свидания','A family hires a babysitter who seems to possess magical powers.','/lnoDwn5eA4bZuPghbVCoPT2p9nV.jpg','1983-06-06',141,'Released',NULL,'Mary Poppins, Goodbye',77060,1.6241,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8787,_binary '\0','/6NaWU3u3OwHMcEyNOLrXhFYr7Th.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085933',7.2,22742,'ja','戦場のメリークリスマス','Island of Java, 1942, during World War II. British Major Jack Celliers arrives at a Japanese prison camp, run by the strict Captain Yonoi. Colonel John Lawrence, who has a profound knowledge of Japanese culture, and Sergeant Hara, brutal and simpleton, will witness the struggle of wills between two men from very different backgrounds who are tragically destined to clash.','/sKeZzN7sXPLRe5rRlOuoXsh1qPA.jpg','1983-05-28',124,'Released','Java, 1942 — A clash of cultures, a test of the human spirit.','Merry Christmas, Mr. Lawrence',11948,5.1592,7.3,'6GxiqbFG_Dw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8788,_binary '\0','/x4vAM824lRq1FeGSirQozimDL91.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085935',3.9,2142,'en','Metalstorm: The Destruction of Jared-Syn','A seeker named Dogen rescues Dhyana after her father is murdered by the evil Jared-Syn. To avenge her father\'s death, Dogen must find Jared-Syn\'s hideout in the mysterious \"Lost City\". The only person who knows its location is an aging, burned-out seeker named Rhodes. Along the way, they must battle the hunter Baal and his Cyclopean minions for a final encounter with Jared-Syn.','/8vxTrg2dik0DQdgGjzyUW321xlM.jpg','1983-08-19',84,'Released','It\'s High Noon at the End of the Universe.','Metalstorm: The Destruction of Jared-Syn',47364,2.1392,4.58,'c0Cel28xvgk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8789,_binary '\0','/gt8M1FhIQqnXVMoirRRSWfqQs87.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085937',4.2,3642,'en','Microwave Massacre','Construction worker Donald is having a hard time getting anything good to eat since his wife has decided to only cook gourmet foods. That and her constant harping causes him to snap, so he whacks her. Somewhere in the confusion he comes up with a new use for the microwave oven, and begins to eat much better. Soon he\'s experimenting with different recipes. And different meats.','/saPYOf3E92zNy6eM0aA738JN75X.jpg','1983-08-31',76,'Released','They Came For Dinner... To Find They Were It!!','Microwave Massacre',87852,1.2923,4.3,'brIgFXDAiS0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8790,_binary '\0','/rHPyhAfz1hTmZfiLYN3bP01ou30.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085951',7,2576,'cn','魔','After his brother was crippled in the ring by a cheating Thai boxer, Chan Hung goes to Thailand to avenge him, and finds the key to an omen which may release their family from an ancient curse. He is then caught up in a spiraling web of fate, Buddhist curses, and black magic.','/tIOUIqHvjFyv80NoEIuIJxmr8VA.jpg','1983-10-23',105,'Released','Mysterious! Intriguing! Horrifying! Don\'t miss it!','The Boxer\'s Omen',49239,2.0367,6.6,'q3AnjfBA3iw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8791,_binary '\0','/eIcJq4QDmToJeu4g6fS4iLPKY8n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085959',7.5,130836,'en','Monty Python\'s The Meaning of Life','Life\'s questions are \'answered\' in a series of outrageous vignettes, beginning with a staid London insurance company which transforms before our eyes into a pirate ship. Then there\'s the National Health doctors who try to claim a healthy liver from a still-living donor. The world\'s most voracious glutton brings the art of vomiting to new heights before his spectacular demise.','/9yavZ9WgEZIpWi2EbVW8At9RPdo.jpg','1983-03-31',107,'Released','It took God six days to create the heavens and the earth...and Monty Python ninety minutes to screw it up.','Monty Python\'s The Meaning of Life',4543,8.0212,7.3,'wMJ24QwHdCY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8792,_binary '\0','/zzGgdKmUSnJx6cEiW3Nfh5ruOOy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085970',6.6,31454,'en','Mr. Mom','Jack and Caroline are a couple making a decent living when Jack suddenly loses his job. They agree that he should stay at home and look after the house while Caroline works. It\'s just that he\'s never done it before, and really doesn\'t have a clue...','/QuTlgKKykL7j0PnZZd3LNFVhCX.jpg','1983-07-22',91,'Released','When mom goes to work, dad goes berserk!','Mr. Mom',13105,4.2931,6.6,'wFXuRHFW3Wk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8793,_binary '\0','/j5MchqvLcavTkzgQYLFnipyY7pa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085980',5.2,4528,'en','My Tutor','High school senior Bobby Chrystal fails his French class, which will block him from entering Yale. His rich, authoritarian father hires an attractive 29-year-old to tutor Bobby over the summer and help him pass a make-up exam. While Bobby\'s friends lead him away into strange excursions aimed at losing their virginity, Bobby finds all the extracurricular activities he needs with his new tutor.','/gMIEasZXQImHpRHos5XsVg80ERV.jpg','1983-03-04',97,'Released','School\'s out...But Bobby\'s education has just begun','My Tutor',2193,4.1907,5.1,'S1Q3GYSCe_k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8794,_binary '\0','/aDHE5f3941tvcYYy10tRYn4x0Kn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085991',7.6,1956,'ja','南極物語','Two Japanese scientists, Ushioda and Ochi, develop a bond with their sled dogs while on an expedition in Antarctica.','/rSVGUA8DATylRYoxXerl5gORxqw.jpg','1983-07-23',143,'Released','Amidst the coldest, harshest surroundings on earth, this true story celebrates the mystery and the warmth of life.','Antarctica',17895,1.8304,7.2,'7H_RZdGv79w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8795,_binary '\0','/peurZarmL2Pp6ZAeWAu1o6PS25T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085994',6.1,2640,'en','Nate and Hayes','Nathaniel Williamsen is taken to an island mission with his fiancee Sophie. Their ship, the Rona, is captained by the roguish Bully Hayes, who also takes a liking to Sophie. When Sophie is kidnapped by slave trader Ben Pease \"Nate\" teams with Hayes in order to find her.','/hdDrNP08oWGfbETiYKZ622PdQMm.jpg','1983-11-18',99,'Released','He\'s a scoundrel... A hero... A lover of danger and the last of the adventurers... This is the story of Bully Hayes!','Nate and Hayes',35432,2.4654,6.1,'PbtsVIFptR0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8796,_binary '\0','/rBL73dGfdEqTr7Xj0HytF9s9SbM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0085995',7.3,129701,'en','National Lampoon\'s Vacation','Clark Griswold is on a quest to take his family to the Walley World theme park for a vacation, but things don\'t go exactly as planned.','/q3DvoqY06yZnRp9faH6uge7n7VP.jpg','1983-07-29',99,'Released','Every summer Chevy Chase takes his family on a little trip. This year he went too far.','National Lampoon\'s Vacation',11153,10.8133,7.111,'LGJplbPcJFA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8797,_binary '\0','/xDzub52wGcLB2XJwtRIhiW1u7TY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086005',7.5,9576,'en','Never Cry Wolf','A scientific researcher, sent on a government study: The Lupus Project, must investigate the possible \"menace\" of wolves in the north. To do so, he must survive in the wilderness for six months on his own. In the course of these events, he learns about the true beneficial and positive nature of the wolf species.','/e61tGxVtobTQuFPmAC7xWwdC4O1.jpg','1983-10-07',105,'Released','They thought he couldn\'t do the job. That\'s why they chose him.','Never Cry Wolf',14280,2.3736,7,'V1nHaO4da_U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8798,_binary '\0','/45uCcAUB8Ljz3uKb1y1JHtT5aCT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086006',6.1,79304,'en','Never Say Never Again','James Bond returns as the secret agent 007 to battle the evil organization SPECTRE. Bond must defeat Largo, who has stolen two atomic warheads for nuclear blackmail. But Bond has an ally in Largo\'s girlfriend, the willowy Domino, who falls for Bond and seeks revenge.','/zhoAL4o1STGgLbLxJ9r1ijfyHC9.jpg','1983-10-07',134,'Released','Sean Connery is James Bond 007','Never Say Never Again',36670,9.4388,6.088,'B9KQmIVnT0o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8799,_binary '\0','/ywAVAzmaWoKPxJHEyTqy2ditoYm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086011',4.3,1592,'en','A Night in Heaven','Faye Hanlon is a community-college professor with an emotionally depressed husband and an abundance of sexual frustration. Her sister drags her to a male strip-club for a girls-night out, where she discovers that one of the dancers is her failing student Rick Monroe, a.k.a. \"Ricky the Rocket\". A heated affair between teacher & student ensues, as Faye struggles to reconcile her emotions and make consequential life choices: Continue her lustful sessions with the studly-but-shallow teen stripper? Or break it off with Ricky & work to salvage her marriage to the loving-but-distant husband?','/gWnPdamQ3xGX1IKabSbmmTU5SHM.jpg','1983-11-18',83,'Released','In class, he\'s just another face in the crowd. In \"Heaven\", the hottest dance club in town, he\'s the main attraction.','A Night in Heaven',5686,2.6051,4.5,'Act25GkD9pQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8800,_binary '\0','/sTtNyxhOZbaNeiqot1uG2xmyWth.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086013',4.3,2798,'en','Nightbeast','A creature from outer space crash lands in Baltimore and starts a killing spree that quickly escalates.','/wkcBUK3vAbCtidPArf6HLPgEEZy.jpg','1982-11-01',81,'Released','If you have the guts...IT WANTS THEM!','Nightbeast',66881,2.5941,4.1,'KNYU22tIno8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8801,_binary '\0','/lh3ifZZXObk78PrgokcKGTUVZsX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086014',5.7,4160,'en','Nightmares','A collection of short stories. In one a woman who leaves her house late at night to drive to the store while a killer is loose encounters some problems. In the second an arcade whiz kid\'s obsession with a game leads to deadly consequences. In the third a small town priest loses his faith and decides to leave town, but in the desert is stalked by a mysterious black pick-up truck. In the final story, a family\'s problem with a rat is larger than they think.','/7spL1SrfmAWQ0O2m2u459WsuSkV.jpg','1983-09-02',99,'Released','Nightmares... is this year\'s sleeper.','Nightmares',42114,2.8873,5.822,'vd0-yBz5DZI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8802,_binary '\0','/z0ZAEC2aZuflzua3HOSygVzE6Jq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086022',7.9,33650,'ru','Ностальгия','Russian poet Andrei Gorchakov journeys through Italy with his interpreter Eugenia to research the life of an 18th-century Russian composer who once lived abroad. Isolated and consumed by an unrelenting longing for his homeland, Andrei becomes drawn to Domenico, a radical mystic obsessed with spiritual redemption. Through austere imagery and extended temporal rhythms, Tarkovsky examines exile, memory, and the profound melancholy of being unable to belong fully to either place or language.','/fCYSidPXp3LpDa9wlLNv0gZvjyF.jpg','1983-05-01',124,'Released',NULL,'Nostalgia',1394,3.9466,7.773,'QDax5tf2aqo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8803,_binary '\0','/nKFUvuTM2dyHMI40EZYMjgrG7W8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086026',2.2,4952,'es','Los nuevos extraterrestres','After a meteor-like object lands in the woods, poachers unearth a cave filled with alien eggs. As they attempt to destroy the eggs, one of them is killed by an unseen creature, leaving one egg intact. A young boy named Tommy finds the remaining egg and brings it home to hatch. As more murders occur around town, Tommy learns that his new pet alien, who he names Trumpy, possesses telekinetic powers.','/qxCxjUMv3TvARye7OxLHDcn6t9.jpg','1983-12-13',84,'Released','The Fate of the Earth is in Their Hands','Extraterrestrial Visitors',28445,1.3952,2.6,'If0v-54scGY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8804,_binary '\0','/xTS1qCmhzH3vq7cuextO5vQA6eW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086034',6.5,121114,'en','Octopussy','James Bond is sent to investigate after a fellow “00” agent is found dead with a priceless Fabergé egg. Bond follows the mystery and uncovers a smuggling scandal and a Russian General who wants to provoke a new World War.','/yoosZitM9igSk3Sd0sBXIhKlAh1.jpg','1983-06-05',131,'Released','James Bond’s all time high!','Octopussy',700,8.9938,6.4,'q1hLWZzgZvU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8805,_binary '\0','/9GItoC0VWXwzOUCmBXa9Zhc2rIn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086036',6.1,4396,'en','Of Unknown Origin','A man who recently completed rebuilding a townhouse becomes obsessed with a rat infestation until it becomes an interspecies duel.','/btZt9kQIhYTsgoitcYFUhkEUmMl.jpg','1983-11-23',88,'Released','Two forces have claimed the house. Only one will survive.','Of Unknown Origin',37227,3.1987,5.8,'-y46qyXpYB0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8806,_binary '\0','/m1M29L3P25PWQ80x6N2hz64vKnj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086050',5.5,4572,'en','One Dark Night','A strange man named Karl Rhamarevich dies shortly after discovering a way to become even more powerful in death through telekinesis. On the night of his burial in a crypt, Julie is to spend the night there as part of an initiation rite, supervised by two other girls. The crypt becomes a scene of horror as Raymar returns to life and deploys his horrifying telekinetic powers.','/gVPa4JaMKqMBiR8BuGjYJTa87DJ.jpg','1982-12-31',94,'Released','A night to remember - until the day you die!','One Dark Night',37935,2.503,5.45,'tzWaJRfNuME','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8807,_binary '\0','/j7PsSv5ybSYy5u5LunMbrCLt5cK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086058',5.8,10264,'en','The Osterman Weekend','The host of an investigative news show is convinced by the CIA that the friends he has invited to a weekend in the country are engaged in a conspiracy that threatens national security.','/h1x7nwYS3AdzKnkpacgMFFTh5DC.jpg','1983-10-14',103,'Released','The one weekend of the year you won\'t want to miss.','The Osterman Weekend',12239,2.9211,5.587,'W_a7MudMsvM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8808,_binary '\0','/hpzbQDjl2yzf6MwrYOrbDJCmojc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086066',7,111257,'en','The Outsiders','In 1960s Tulsa, class divisions ignite a violent rivalry between the working-class Greasers and the privileged Socs. When a deadly encounter forces two Greasers, Ponyboy and Johnny, to flee, their struggle for survival and redemption exposes the fragile innocence and enduring bonds of youth on the wrong side of town.','/l9os0HcXY8BOkvUWAx4rvby3j6L.jpg','1983-03-25',91,'Released','They grew up on the outside of society. They weren\'t looking for a fight. They were looking to belong.','The Outsiders',227,10.658,7.2,'3ud6PLVjY5Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8809,_binary '\0','/gWP0xqcpeapXBqKKPFqLFc2rxDQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086079',6.7,3870,'fr','Papy fait de la résistance','It is 1943 in Paris. Like so many others, the Bourbelle family\'s home has been taken over by the Germans and they now live in their cellar. Little do they know that the son, Guy-Hubert Bourdelle, is far from being the cowardly hairdresser he pretends. He is in truth the Germans’ most feared opponent: le super-résistant!','/tYAaRDKCHSofMnUDqjg6AIAmTfi.jpg','1983-10-26',102,'Released','The movie that cost more than the D-Day Landings','Gramps Is in the Resistance',48769,2.497,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8810,_binary '\0','/oRUeAhJD49EE9RiOrv8nD6ceti9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086087',7.3,12077,'fr','Pauline à la plage','Marion is about to divorce from her husband and takes her 15-year-old niece, Pauline, on a vacation to Granville. There, she meets an old love...','/osw9SwpoQEEjQdKh747MC8fT2VM.jpg','1983-03-23',94,'Released','Romance, wit, seduction and the foolishness of love','Pauline at the Beach',10293,3.7225,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8811,_binary '\0','/ewE89eFwE7F8aN8PqJx2nyOPz7d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086102',7.2,2150,'en','Phar Lap','Phar Lap, the big bold chestnut reigned as the king of the turf in the depression that gripped Australia of the 1930s. From his humble beginnings the New Zealand bred horse raced on to become the hero of a nation.','/4FOvyRaEYRx7Wps8tpzaR6Saelu.jpg','1983-08-11',107,'Released','Hero to a nation','Phar Lap',36527,1.3695,6.9,'pXFJY_2DPo8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8812,_binary '\0','/o55iCtiu26j1g8SI2JUWy9hFYox.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086104',6.8,1457,'es','El pico','Paco, the teenage son of a Civil Guard commander in Basque Country, becomes addicted to heroin.','/mlfN47IL2wBBJEXHqM5xViACX9G.jpg','1983-09-04',105,'Released',NULL,'Overdose',98596,1.2249,6.638,'MmJfkDN1D-Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8813,_binary '\0','/1vcvmSf3NsQEmjMM5e9eFjpeIs8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086112',7.1,4299,'en','The Pirates of Penzance','As a young child, Frederic had been apprenticed to a pirate by mistake when he should have been apprenticed to a pilot. Now, having reached his 21st year, Frederic\'s indentures are at last over and he happily leaves the service of the pirates. When Frederic meets the beautiful Mabel, one of the many daughters (or wards in Chancery) of Major-General Stanley, they fall in love and decide to marry. However, complications arise when the pirates decide to marry the rest of the Major-General\'s daughters, themselves - and Frederic\'s birthdate turns out to be not all it seems.','/f2bvgBjzvTXU3qA1EWFhcNRb6Xv.jpg','1983-02-18',112,'Released',NULL,'The Pirates of Penzance',15716,2.4821,6.104,'lbwl9QNZgfI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8814,_binary '\0','/8WOde04E2LpI81lORyOwzKsQ4ez.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086113',5.7,4059,'en','The Pit','Twelve year-old Jamie Benjamin is a solitary misunderstood boy in his preteens. His classmates pick on him, his neighbors think he\'s weird and his parents ignore him. But now Jamie has a secret weapon: deep in the woods he has discovered a deep pit full of man-eating creatures he calls Trogs... and it isn\'t long before he gets an idea for getting revenge and feeding the Trogs in the process!','/lzBk5p7RQoekL6RUgWIQUQjRg4Y.jpg','1981-10-23',97,'Released','Jamie wouldn\'t kill anyone… unless Teddy told him to!','The Pit',47038,1.7423,5.7,'T-fSOX9tyoY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8815,_binary '\0','/y3jFTq9K46XeQzEXqo1QXpmhXmY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086129',5,13649,'en','Porky\'s II: The Next Day','When the students of Angel Beach High decide to stage \"An Evening With Shakespeare,\" their efforts are threatened by Miss Balbricker, who views the works of Shakespeare as obscene. She enlists the help of Reverend Bubba Flavel, a religious fanatic who brings along his flock of followers to pressure the school into shutting down the production.','/rZjSlaXM8Ez91ZV39frILApGuKg.jpg','1983-06-24',98,'Released','If you thought the night before was funny, wait till you see the next day.','Porky\'s II: The Next Day',19698,4.1368,5.7,'jaeR_RtjwDY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8816,_binary '\0','/5FROgu8ovhUAJmxlssfs4c6GvCo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086135',4.8,2674,'it','I predatori di Atlantide','A team of scientists working to raise a sunken Russian nuclear submarine on an ocean platform off the coast of Miami, Florida, unearth an ancient Atlantean relic from the sea floor and bring in an expert to make some sense of it. But while attempting to raise the sub, radioactive leakage from its missles triggers the re-emergence of Atlantis, and the resulting tidal wave destroys the platform and leaves only a small group of survivors. Rescued by two Vietnamvets-turned-heavies who are out relaxing after their latest job, their boat eventually runs aground on a Carribean island nearby where, upon going ashore, it is discovered that everything has been destroyed and everybody killed. The culprits, a vicious group of well-armed raiders, and their leader, Crystal Skull, are descendants of Atlantis\' original race who set about reclaiming the world and adding the survivors to the list of victims as they struggle to stay alive and defeat the raiders and send Atlantis back to the ocean floor.','/qNeaKk9Wy345IvoU1h67J2IdldS.jpg','1983-11-25',92,'Released','Adventure Beyond the Edge of Time','Raiders of Atlantis',29173,2.4639,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8817,_binary '\0','/faeNq2UW1SOI2Q5PajKj6xg3ajY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086136',4.6,1417,'fr','Premiers désirs','Three teenage girls decide to visit a romantic island and find love. They get shipwrecked and end up on different sides of the island. Each girl begins her own romantic adventure either with a man, a boy or even another girl.','/f7ZAvetDYh0W5VYiuCnMS1e9TZo.jpg','1983-12-11',93,'Released','Beautiful innocence cast-away in paradise.','First Desires',54156,3.1043,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8818,_binary '\0','/hnM4ogLIdE9QirIk2W7hyObCWF3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086137',4.4,2327,'en','The Prey','Three young couples set off into the mountains for a weekend of climbing, drinking and lovemaking; little do they know that they are stumbling into the terrain of a fearsome predator – a wild man, horrifically burned as a child many years ago in a fire which engulfed his gypsy 