and the U.S. Army? Has the nameless agent finally met his match against the superhuman powers of the Snake and the twin evils of the psychopathic mercenaries, Gold and Silver?','/nOTFmar2FyhDEDFNIMQL97K5Pcg.jpg','1983-05-28',91,'Released','He shoots...he scores...he\'ll blow you away!','Golgo 13: The Professional',17922,2.8729,6.253,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8822,_binary '\0','/3Wm76b8SY47zqIU6pJRnYRzPPln.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086153',6.3,4986,'fr','Prénom Carmen','A woman involved with a terrorist group becomes dangerously close to the police officer guarding the bank they plan to rob.','/wzQl2c2HQdSYzFQFWSMYRyXm1B.jpg','1983-12-01',85,'Released','The Revolutionary New Fable of Erotic Destiny from the Director of BREATHLESS and ALPHAVILLE','First Name: Carmen',32689,4.0346,6.013,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8823,_binary '\0','/6w4WKcZc0Qqi1fm9LfaIER7Hr0L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086154',6.6,35682,'en','Psycho II','Norman Bates is declared sane and released from the facility in which he was being held, despite the complaints of Lila Loomis, sister of his most famous victim. Is he really cured, or will he kill again?','/sJAPRj3vHmjV4z97YK84iDovYlm.jpg','1983-06-03',113,'Released','It\'s 22 years later, and Norman Bates is coming home.','Psycho II',10576,5.2343,6.5,'5Z-boNBbohc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8824,_binary '\0','/tX7dLyIvqY7yLRP5CjBFldsW4hB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086161',6.3,1222,'en','Quarterback Princess','The Maida family has moved to Oregon, and daughter Tami wants to play quarterback for the high school football team. There\'s just one problem. She\'s a girl. With everyone from the coach to her next door neighbor against her, she\'s out to prove that not only can she can play football, but she can win the state championship. (Based on a true story)','/lzXKi5wgx8JwvGHSogDL1Kyw08l.jpg','1983-12-03',96,'Released',NULL,'Quarterback Princess',142216,1.3