tL.jpg','1983-06-03',160,'Released','In love with art, and each other.','Sagara Sangamam',30153,1.3885,7.76,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8836,_binary '\0','/iLq0HR9Ydpb1lefCdlLqHwMQ2Ov.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086232',4.9,2457,'en','Sahara','Intent on winning a competition in place of her distinguished late father, beautiful young heiress Dale takes on the guise of a man and competes in his spot, embarking on a car race that crosses the unforgiving Sahara desert.','/uwt6dTKixLjkh2T3UGtfGh4yszO.jpg','1983-12-01',111,'Released','She challenged the desert, its men, their passions and ignited a bold adventure.','Sahara',47808,4.5395,5.833,'qvRb4_nGLEI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8837,_binary '\0','/fg0NgT5Ie4O0s99e4bc9tjRcpQU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086240',6.1,1399,'it','Sapore di mare','A comedy about the adventures of several families during their sea vacations.','/z1uwF07RxBOORBPqHvS4fDGdWG6.jpg','1983-02-17',94,'Released',NULL,'Taste of the Sea',43559,1.4083,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8838,_binary '\0','/sPyvoKH0K1pu2ENXibRXJWzCREM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086242',7.2,1954,'ja','細雪','This sensuously beautiful film chronicles the activities of four sisters who gather in Kyoto every year to view the cherry blossoms. It paints a vivid portrait of the pre-war lifestyle of the wealthy Makioka family from Osaka, and draws a parallel between their activities and the seasonal variations in Japan.','/rEZnnJ21zvTXC70BovvR64qFj8q.jpg','1983-05-21',140,'Released',NULL,'The Makioka Sisters',42116,2.947,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8839,_binary '\0','/2ybWIHxrJxQZ1IJIM9gqpKuesIU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086244',6.5,1599,'ja','里見八犬伝','The evil Hikita clan rises from the dead to fulfill a curse on the Satomi clan by restoring the face of their warlord by using the skin of Princess Shizu. In the process of trying to capture her, the clan murders her entire family, but Princess Shizu escapes their clutches. She enlists the aid of eight samurai warriors, possessors of powerful magic crystal, led by Dosetsu (Sonny Chiba!) to help rescue the remaining members of her court and revenge her family. Along the way, they must fight undead warriors, evil spirits, poisonous beauties and a giant centipede.','/51jQTnjpGKRhdvP5IbwW6OCivBM.jpg','1983-12-10',133,'Released',NULL,'Legend of the Eight Samurai',47578,2.5275,5.8,'XLQlLxlmQ7s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8840,_binary '\0','/xntEHVz8zXUfi2pSi7WEpfrwSU6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086248',4,1727,'en','Scalps','A silly group of college science students go an dig around in an indian burial ground for artifacts. Unfortunately, one of them becomes possessed by the evil spirit of Black Claw so he must therefore slaughter all of his friends.','/zWAef4geukiEEiuD2Zi0UYi6Rif.jpg','1983-12-03',84,'Released','They came out of the grave... to get REVENGE!','Scalps',5733,1.2215,3.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8841,_binary '\0','/cCvp5Sni75agCtyJkNOMapORUQV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086250',8.3,1034554,'en','Scarface','After getting a green card in exchange for assassinating a Cuban government official, Tony Montana stakes a claim on the drug trade in Miami. Viciously murdering anyone who stands in his way, Tony eventually becomes the biggest drug lord in the state, controlling nearly all the cocaine that comes through Miami. But increased pressure from the police, wars with Colombian drug cartels and his own drug-fueled paranoia serve to fuel the flames of his eventual downfall.','/iQ5ztdjvteGeboxtmRdXEChJOHh.jpg','1983-12-09',170,'Released','He loved the American Dream. With a vengeance.','Scarface',111,27.8978,8.153,'5JfyFrJfJmI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8842,_binary '\0','/manPK0qPPyp1fXFs9cvW0gNratx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086251',7.5,4451,'en','The Scarlet and the Black','Fr. Hugh O\'Flaherty is a Vatican official in 1943-45 who has been hiding downed pilots, escaped prisoners of war, and Italian resistance families. His activities become so large that the Nazis decide to assassinate him the next time he leaves the Vatican.','/f6nTRZC0RbdrUhauvhFjWlcbiTM.jpg','1983-02-02',143,'Released','Gregory Peck stars as the man who led thousands in a daring escape to freedom - right under the nose of the Gestapo.','The Scarlet and the Black',44691,2.5842,7.045,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8843,_binary '\0','/zsV3q97pTv0Fqqw4JvCsNed2wyc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086262',2.7,1237,'en','Scream','A group of people on a rafting excursion happen upon a deserted town and decide to set up camp. Out of the blue, a murder occurs.','/fENI8R4NOIqBMEbx7TlQHRLLbgx.jpg','1981-01-08',82,'Released','It was the perfect weekend vacation until THE NIGHTMARE BEGAN!','Scream',85191,1.1919,3.9,'uAng8i-XX88','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8844,_binary '\0','/f03VYCRNJ8XjWFHsfBs0749HhTJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086263',4.9,1285,'en','Screamtime','Compilation of three short horror films: \"That\'s The Way To Do It\", \"Dreamhouse\" and \"Do You Believe In Fairies?\" plus some new linking material.','/b4udMZ6vDrOaqqDxPlVIuVifKpr.jpg','1983-01-01',91,'Released','An unholy trinity of terror, three times the horror, three times the murders.','Screamtime',84986,1.1965,4,'gZeH7td8Bbc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8845,_binary '\0','/kISUmL823U3mfXEfE7NG5SWXLBy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086264',4.5,4220,'en','Screwballs','Welcome to T & A High, where the entire student body including campus virgin Purity Busch, chronic masturbator Melvin Jerkovski, repressed Principal Stuckoff and blonde bombshell Bootsie Goodhead all must rise to the challenges of freshman breast exams, bikini cheerleader attacks, inappropriate uses of bowling ball holes and much more.','/t3AUhmBVq4TQfb0DpNhIDViAhlO.jpg','1983-04-01',80,'Released','The comedy that goes all the way!','Screwballs',25164,2.1226,5,'VhyWsyrksB0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8846,_binary '\0','/A3tqSUYBSfBxdxZ5Bf7gR5ZZYHa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086274',6,1257,'it','Segni particolari: bellissimo','Forty-something Mattia has every woman in town lusting after him. But every time a woman wants to get hitched, he drags out his \'daughter\' (actually the girl next door) to pass judgment on this woman.','/21iV9mKxvy8MJXdfUnWQBISFQhE.jpg','1983-12-22',95,'Released',NULL,'Special Features: Handsome',68275,1.7727,5.89,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8847,_binary '\0','/cJiCYRUqrfvfI3ML1FeOChwHHlk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086276',6.6,1654,'en','Siege','During a police strike in Nova Scotia\'s capital city, a gang of hoodlums end up unintentionally causing the owner of a gay bar to be killed. This escalates into a string of murders with a lone survivor trying to not be next.','/iUBs5c61lSWkZDRRE2UKPGBB1Y1.jpg','1983-06-10',84,'Released','Today, their city. Tomorrow... yours!','Siege',40169,1.5286,6.1,'9g75F_KYxHU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8848,_binary '\0','/kfTzlMz584NOxZXlETW0oniCNiD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086301',6.2,1911,'zh','少林小子','Romance blossoms between two rival families practicing Shaolin and Wudang kungfu respectively. despite familial opposition - until they overcome a gang of scheming bandits together.','/1V6EGfuYUmbkjpHjXXwBtgbIf2I.jpg','1984-01-26',103,'Released',NULL,'Kids from Shaolin',37030,3.102,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8849,_binary '\0','/vA91k47vif3PiW27Gsr6lCMJMsp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086308',6.6,3396,'cn','新蜀山劍俠','5th century western China: As constant civil wars scars the nation, to evade death, Ti, a young scout, jumps through a crevice in the Zu mountains where he becomes entangled in a great battle against the Blood Demon, a supernatural entity seeking to wreak havoc upon the world.','/9vJi1xPMlC4qb41h08kvKZQXyFj.jpg','1983-02-05',98,'Released',NULL,'Zu: Warriors from the Magic Mountain',38155,3.5903,6.8,'ku3kF6xZdeQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8850,_binary '\0','/1UHZ53y6dcfPElyuQ5UkqgAxwHi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086312',7.1,25102,'en','Silkwood','Like most of the people in her town, Karen Silkwood works at the local nuclear plant producing highly radioactive plutonium. Exposed one day to a lethal dose of radiation, Karen faces the blank walls of corporate indifference and denial. As her illness increases, her protest grows louder and she becomes an obvious danger to the powers that be.','/sGB81v70nnZqPMKFasvCpOmPcfq.jpg','1983-12-14',131,'Released','On November 13, 1974, Karen Silkwood, an employee of a nuclear facility, left to meet with a reporter from the New York Times. She never got there.','Silkwood',12502,3.7105,6.937,'iNyrSR5JGh8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8851,_binary '\0','/nCkHdboHBnOb8TTz8CJ6UeYPm4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086319',7.5,1796,'cs','Slavnosti sněženek','An episodic film about the inhabitants of Kersko, their hardships and their joys, most prominently hunting. A lyrical and humorous adaptation of writings by Bohumil Hrabal.','/och5s3EHiNfSFd1Ki9Wr5zJHjOF.jpg','1984-01-01',83,'Released',NULL,'The Snowdrop Festival',45039,1.4334,6.652,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8852,_binary '\0','/nQbvPYjj3U3pz8alPpHIdvVIoHx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086320',6.2,44900,'en','Sleepaway Camp','Years after a terrible boating accident, Angela is sent to Camp Arawak where a series of bizarre and violent \"accidents\" begin to claim the lives of various campers.','/icRAuGsmXl62Ns0qrTuo9uiP6U1.jpg','1983-11-18',85,'Released','…you won\'t be coming home!','Sleepaway Camp',13567,5.3323,6.3,'_YAawYhXT8Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8853,_binary '\0','/y2PYm2taHx0tIg3NHWvslKHIOjU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086325',3.5,10399,'en','Smokey and the Bandit Part 3','The Enos duo convince Cletus, aka The Bandit, to come out of hiding and help them promote their new restaurant. With a little coaxing, he agrees, producing an almost-creaky Trigger as his mode of transport. But his nemesis, Sheriff Buford T. Justice, is on the hunt, forcing Cletus and Trigger to hit the road. Can they steer clear of the vengeful sheriff?','/ec6qP3Mn2u2XUqHnkxoZYbM33iF.jpg','1983-08-12',85,'Released','Smokey\'s back! And the Bandit is at it again!','Smokey and the Bandit Part 3',15120,4.1151,4.39,'Tu4Ht2opvqY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8854,_binary '\0','/28BYjdzw6nJjFMIKjfUu1JA6tNC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086336',6.7,13125,'en','Something Wicked This Way Comes','In a small American town, a diabolical circus arrives, granting wishes for the townsfolk, but twisted as only the esteemed Mr. Dark can make them. Can two young boys overcome the worst the devil himself can deal out?','/94dMO6kAawyFUk0sCDGIjAnchED.jpg','1983-04-29',95,'Released','What would you give a man who could make your deepest dream come true?','Something Wicked This Way Comes',24808,4.6408,6.505,'SHWEGBbhGfA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8855,_binary '\0','/8JhmQlJRgj2e3qrHHyi26PI3RDf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086340',4.4,3321,'en','Sorceress','Twin warrior sisters, raised in the wilderness and trained for battle, must survive a bizarre world of monsters, cultists, zombies, and barbarians as they prepare for a final showdown with the father who once tried to destroy them.','/fXbCl3j08WviEpapDr9HWd7mI4u.jpg','1982-03-01',83,'Released','Good and evil clash in the ultimate cosmic struggle!','Sorceress',41889,1.9488,4.4,'BW8wveUro4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8856,_binary '\0','/5l3EfMuytfx9mNS0D6QlJ8x0EfV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086343',5.8,1885,'it','Sotto il vestito niente','Bob Crane has long maintained a psychic connection to his twin sister, Jessica, who works as a fashion model in Milan. When Bob senses that his sister might be injured or killed, he travels to Italy to look for her, only to discover that she\'s vanished without a trace. Enlisting the help of about-to-retire Commissioner Danesi, Bob soon finds himself embroiled in a web of mystery and terror, when a scissors wielding killer begins to strike and all clues lead back to Jessica...','/hjUbUqkKmajJL184Mbzz2VE92qz.jpg','1985-11-07',90,'Released','Chasing fame is murder.','Nothing Underneath',62558,2.0157,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8857,_binary '\0','/qtC9kiY7udNTC3JYZaIjPKDRAvr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086345',4.5,1977,'en','Space Raiders','A futuristic, sensitive tale of adventure and confrontation when a 10 year old boy is accidentally kidnapped by a spaceship filled with a motley crew of space pirates.','/bsGP4IhqHluCuRVSOs04fOniBq2.jpg','1983-07-01',84,'Released','He\'s ten years old and they\'ve taken him ten-million miles into space.','Space Raiders',7269,2.1544,4.654,'XBham6MnKYE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8858,_binary '\0','/7uRVGZklOdfVQ5EG82K6sEUGjk0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086346',5.5,7382,'en','Spacehunter: Adventures in the Forbidden Zone','On a distant planet inhabited by mutants, two bounty hunters race to rescue three Earth female captives from the clutches of an evil warlord.','/hXIis8l0rqCThFHlhvELf31pSXz.jpg','1983-05-20',90,'Released','Journey with Wolff and Niki, an interstellar adventurer and young rebel. On a mission to rescue three stranded women from a planet no one has warned them about. Because no one has ever returned.','Spacehunter: Adventures in the Forbidden Zone',26978,2.9827,5.378,'z351Gqxiv8E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8859,_binary '\0','/kwzdH6w7pMhKlj6JI9eKtvidPOC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086349',4.4,1367,'en','Spasms','A gigantic serpent is captured on a remote island and shipped to an American college for experimentation.','/o11a36QWsdfOHkgO346EoalIzWQ.jpg','1983-10-28',90,'Released','You scream, you expand, you explode. A new source of evil is discovered and is out of control.','Spasms',98106,2.2488,4.6,'vAQ-K4DUUtA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8860,_binary '\0','/azRTTHIoePFExbZt7SxofwMlzpL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086350',7.5,1565,'en','Special Bulletin','An evening of TV programming is interrupted by breaking news: in Charleston, South Carolina, two Coast Guard personnel and two members of a local news team have been taken hostage by a group of terrorists who are seeking to destroy the triggers of all local nuclear devices. Moreover, the terrorists threaten to detonate their own device if their demands are not met.','/zRhDjn2xZNOILNYDQokIGtR63vc.jpg','1983-03-20',103,'Released',NULL,'Special Bulletin',69266,1.6114,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8861,_binary '\0','/dLe6IQl35xSuLbGhdAFWpf19HG6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086352',4.9,3885,'en','Spring Break','Two sets of two college guys spend a spring break together in Fort Lauderdale, Florida. There they have lots of fun in and out of the sun.','/pC12FUSDIYIraix7BTjtW5ewNU9.jpg','1983-03-25',102,'Released','Like it\'s really, totally, the most fun a couple of bodies can have. You know?','Spring Break',21148,2.1649,4.9,'qitvKcHCmdo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8862,_binary '\0','/oNppOS0bctF6668pYNy2Ltx3m9W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086355',6.8,8931,'en','Star 80','Paul Snider is a narcissistic, small time hustler who fancies himself a ladies man. His life changes when he meets Dorothy Stratten working behind the counter of a Dairy Queen. Under his guidance Dorothy grows to fame as a Playboy Playmate. But when Dorothy begins pursuing an acting career, the jealous Paul finds himself elbowed out of the picture by more famous men.','/b2SkA02fXbZYnV1qjOIQprjXloF.jpg','1983-11-10',103,'Released','The price of stardom was more than she bargained for.','Star 80',30707,2.8226,6.5,'E_VsB_NZLSs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8863,_binary '\0','/f8O32f2JOnDXwiVOl2IUsXZ5ABt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086356',6.4,8430,'en','The Star Chamber','As violence escalates in Los Angeles and heinous murders are committed, Steven Hardin, a young judge of the California Supreme Court, must struggle with his tortured conscience and growing despair as he watches helplessly as the ruthless criminals brought before his court go free because clever lawyers find obscure loopholes in the law.','/uXtsxFFWQmoUQu4qbBdOprEpv2Y.jpg','1983-08-05',105,'Released','They meet. They judge. They execute.','The Star Chamber',12633,3.2611,6.037,'53VNG-mk9mk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8864,_binary '\0','/i7UTsUZhWSeBqnsL3YuF0aj9MwV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086357',4.9,1555,'en','Starflight: The Plane That Couldn\'t Land','Starflight One, a commercial aircraft that can whisk passengers around the globe in a matter of hours, embarks on its maiden voyage. The trip goes horribly awry, however, when the aircraft is forced out of the atmosphere and into outer space. As it is too dangerous to attempt reentry, Captain Cody Briggs, his passengers and his crew brave declining levels of oxygen while NASA scientists scramble to launch a rescue mission in a race against time.','/24wBAt0OAbFukArnE8SLKp0JYP3.jpg','1983-02-27',105,'Released',NULL,'Starflight: The Plane That Couldn\'t Land',15494,2.3466,5,'kb8rrkkfEnQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8865,_binary '\0','/brLxRhtcD3WsXFzElR2HCJ4iP9N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086358',7.9,1562,'it','State buoni se potete','Around the year 1500, the Italian priest Don Filippo Neri helps street kids and orphans in his poor little chapel.','/Fq4foRnHjIfqzrsYAdhBHpG75R.jpg','1983-04-01',149,'Released',NULL,'State buoni se potete',82820,1.7212,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8866,_binary '\0','/iyFHI7gbp5WvzouookqZdjImHmx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086361',4.8,18979,'en','Staying Alive','Five years later, Tony Manero\'s Saturday Night Fever still burns. Now he\'s struts toward his biggest challenger yet - making it as a dancer on the Broadway stage.','/mFyTQt1HRlqr5SCEkuO4NoHM5B9.jpg','1983-07-11',96,'Released','Tony Manero knows the old days are over. But nobody\'s gonna tell him he can\'t feel that good again.','Staying Alive',10805,4.7582,5.816,'wfCaqIudqbE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8867,_binary '\0','/6covo36v2O4Vwc63C8bpN0Zlq07.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086366',5.4,8457,'en','Still Smokin','Cheech & Chong are invited to a celebrity party in Amsterdam. When they get there, however, it turns out that the guy who invited them has taken off with all the money. They are actually expecting Burt Reynolds and Dolly Parton, so our heroes get to be Mr. Burt and Mr. Dolly.','/m4Fup0uvurH2aBUYwRCsad8x7bV.jpg','1983-05-06',91,'Released','They\'ll have you rolling in your seats!','Still Smokin',12695,5.7323,5.367,'-uoXLDSphr0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8868,_binary '\0','/plzGj1h3TKjRUIg0W3Ls5F0iz3V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086369',6.7,1449,'nl','De stilte rond Christine M.','When three women with no previous acquaintance kill a male shopkeeper in the middle of the day, the female psychiatrist assigned to the case sets out to understand why.','/uGhs4woh7yfRupCYOYFMFj9DUPN.jpg','1982-02-18',92,'Released',NULL,'A Question of Silence',96529,1.956,6.278,'mO-gVvLQuTE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8869,_binary '\0','/deL3YJtsB1ZrQhXvHiOjPiC9xtx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086370',4.9,2576,'en','The Sting II','Hooker and Gondorf pull a con on Macalinski, an especially nasty mob boss with the help of Veronica, a new grifter. They convince this new victim that Hooker is a somewhat dull boxer who is tired of taking dives for Gondorf. There is a ringer. Lonigan, their victim from the first movie, is setting them up to take the fall.','/oWySCxbLK4vB7BY5CzonJZuLYa7.jpg','1983-02-18',102,'Released','The con is on... place your bets!','The Sting II',36912,2.1042,4.7,'HPKVmzX9EaY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8870,_binary '\0','/y5yCGyPKS0gk5IOne2y1FYuzJQm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086373',6.6,20338,'en','Strange Brew','Something is rotten at the Elsinore Brewery. Bob and Doug McKenzie (as seen on SCTV) help the orphan Pam regain the brewery founded by her recently-deceased father. But to do so, they must confront the suspicious Brewmeister Smith and two teams of vicious hockey players.','/rScplcvRHX7o7XK88SFb5mddo8y.jpg','1983-08-26',90,'Released','Something funny is brewing at Elsinore Castle...','Strange Brew',12921,3.1308,6,'JfUyZ6bEYGo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8871,_binary '\0','/7HZQ7Hn6X6jmFXXE2TO12VMyTTn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086374',5.4,4065,'en','Strange Invaders','Alien beings, who settle in a small midwestern town, are disturbed by a young professor determined to rescue his daughter from their clutches.','/aFeucuLcWHEiaITxJyT79fo8SUx.jpg','1983-09-16',92,'Released','25 years ago, they arrived from another galaxy. Surprise — they\'re still here.','Strange Invaders',47892,2.6148,5,'xuwk_TuQlks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8872,_binary '\0','/5pNMXTknzL8NCHQBWy0fs32pkri.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086377',6.4,2293,'en','Streamers','Four young recruits about to be sent to Vietnam confront their prejudicial feelings toward one another when it\'s learned one of them is gay.','/pSSlOQ8nAHYWlpH7wsO52GyWRAB.jpg','1983-09-05',118,'Released',NULL,'Streamers',66487,1.9387,5.6,'1xmr5jWEl2E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8873,_binary '\0','/f78w3VL3O22CHHmYSH1Z467aRI5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086379',5,4794,'en','Stroker Ace','Stroker Ace, a champion NASCAR driver, is standing at the top of his career, but is getting fed up with having to do as he\'s told. In between rebelling against his sponsor (a fried chicken chain)\'s promotion gimmicks (like making him dress up in giant chicken suit) he spends the rest of the movie trying to bed the buxom Pembrook.','/dwN6w9yIScxSCsc39FMWg7B2MrQ.jpg','1983-07-01',94,'Released','He\'s hot on the track...and off!','Stroker Ace',19258,1.997,4.826,'QdTdQ6jIfB8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8874,_binary '\0','/vjA6MbA8aI4A3GSN1wWSsi9OGNl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086383',6.6,52869,'en','Sudden Impact','When a young rape victim takes justice into her own hands and becomes a serial killer, it\'s up to Dirty Harry Callahan, on suspension from the SFPD, to bring her to justice.','/fSADY0EEM7ntpK5IwumcGS4UNNE.jpg','1983-12-08',117,'Released','Dirty Harry is at it again.','Sudden Impact',10650,8.9435,6.6,'8AnAgwxJk0Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8875,_binary '\0','/ui3oiC5mdwxTPZSLBvqoBqckTQ4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086393',5,81200,'en','Superman III','Aiming to defeat the Man of Steel, wealthy executive Ross Webster hires bumbling but brilliant Gus Gorman to develop synthetic kryptonite, which yields some unexpected psychological effects. Between rekindling romance with his high school sweetheart and saving himself, Superman must contend with a powerful supercomputer.','/c4oR6qgZW2s5foGkQi2Dd86KuAS.jpg','1983-06-17',125,'Released','If the world\'s most powerful computer can control even Superman...no one on earth is safe.','Superman III',9531,8.6193,5.504,'-7qo4Iy0ULk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8876,_binary '\0','/54rgnOAw63J6UgnyaixHPTo5m5b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086394',4.6,1467,'de','Die Supernasen','Tommy loses his job as a make-up artist at Bayerischer Rundfunk after fogging an announcer with hairspray and then insulting her; Mike is dumped by his girlfriend because, on the one hand, he only cares about his music and, on the other hand, he is financially stranded. So they both need money and decide to become detectives. On behalf of a rich industrialist, they are to shadow his wife and take photos of her cheating. So Mike and Tommy travel to Bad Spänzer, where the lady is staying. But she is as faithful as gold, so Mike, disguised as a Prussian, makes advances to her so that Tommy can take the required photos. But Tommy soon has to slip into a costume, too: Since Tommy looks deceptively similar to an Arab sheik, he is hired by the sheik\'s secret service to double him. What Tommy doesn\'t know: assassins want to kill the sheikh at all costs.','/swuEI62oB90tuHGkplbNtELJixd.jpg','1983-09-08',88,'Released',NULL,'Die Supernasen',11981,1.5609,4.8,'3MB2sC95VmU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8877,_binary '\0','/rhZBikv1XTRA3vCitswbxkv5VNU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086397',5.8,6322,'en','The Survivors','Having both lost their jobs, two strangers become unlikely friends after a run in with a would be robber, who is actually a hitman with a grudge against the two.','/eb7DrR2h2GjUCZRozH46CqU1A9d.jpg','1983-06-24',103,'Released','Once they declare war on each other, watch out. You could die laughing.','The Survivors',28466,2.5328,5.7,'NasAAMMfcQk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8878,_binary '\0','/5mvR6DzYxs5usizlXTLWl49Vpnw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086410',6.6,3376,'it','Storie di ordinaria follia','Poet/lecturer Charles Serking awakens from his alcoholic haze long enough to take a bus back to L.A. and plunge into an orgy of drink and sexual depravity.','/riWT9Y5JJ6bzxw2hK1PqAHeFFJV.jpg','1981-09-11',101,'Released',NULL,'Tales of Ordinary Madness',69014,3.184,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8879,_binary '\0','/noGOjlooQTwSeUTg0lhpnLQWkf4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086420',7.3,3649,'fr','Tchao Pantin','In the 18th Arrondissement of Paris, Lambert, an aloof garage manager working the night shift at a petrol station spends his time drinking on the job, content in his own company. One night, Bensoussan, a small-time drug pusher in dire straits falls in on a stolen moped pretending to need a spark plug. The two men develop an unlikely friendship.','/1D9o6nZDPhB0utyahu5WiSlKMLl.jpg','1983-12-20',94,'Released',NULL,'So Long, Stooge',58833,1.477,7.3,'QVorR0THsh8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8880,_binary '\0','/hPIcRAdwsIb3UhHJ3RuyCcDL4qK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086423',7.3,14687,'en','Tender Mercies','Alcoholic former country singer Mac Sledge makes friends with a young widow and her son. The friendship enables him to find inspiration to resume his career.','/fBP6uK0K4EnV8dtt4SJQrMdX0wb.jpg','1983-03-04',92,'Released','His struggle for fame was over. His fight for respect was just beginning.','Tender Mercies',42121,3.8176,6.8,'Bms1Yy355gw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8881,_binary '\0','/rZXTcmx7mKysaseyWZHs6wzPAcZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086425',7.4,71425,'en','Terms of Endearment','Aurora, a finicky woman, is in search of true love while her daughter faces marital issues. Together, they help each other deal with problems and find reasons to live a joyful life.','/l77DRjJuykqKMtD9GTK4YT7qKHW.jpg','1983-11-20',132,'Released','Come to laugh, come to cry, come to care, come to terms.','Terms of Endearment',11050,6.0357,7.1,'7BToOAoehA0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8882,_binary '\0','/teBOQUIRnsSNVX7cZzb07Kvyw8F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086429',6.9,8208,'en','Testament','It\'s just another day in the small town of Hamlin until something disastrous happens. Suddenly, news breaks that a series of nuclear warheads has been dropped along the Eastern Seaboard and, more locally, in California. As people begin coping with the devastating aftermath of the attacks — many suffer radiation poisoning — the Wetherly family tries to survive.','/sIc7cgiGi1p4YK4zFEiObCUztXj.jpg','1983-11-04',90,'Released','They never had a chance to see their children grow up. To watch each other grow old. To fix up the house, to take that vacation. Because it only took an instant to shatter their dreams.','Testament',21259,2.7053,6.423,'9o_VkYWDSy4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8883,_binary '\0','/nKp9JsmBjgIZKLIYT6385lswJYW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086443',5.4,2755,'en','Timerider: The Adventure of Lyle Swann','Lyle Swann is a successful off-road racer who mistakenly gets sent back in time 100 years. When a band of outlaws robs Swann of his motorcycle, he\'s forced to outfox the gangsters and give in to the seductions of a gorgeous local lady. With only his smarts and a map from an Exxon station, Lyle must try to make it out of the Old West alive and find a way back to modern times.','/cOWtzBF4mKGes4VMXszU5gbra9P.jpg','1982-08-27',93,'Released','Lyle Swann is a champion off-road racer. But to the people of 1877, he\'s something very, very different...','Timerider: The Adventure of Lyle Swann',32014,2.4655,5.5,'sN37U-DJ2QU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8884,_binary '\0','/trbO9M9wIeYtiJVDTx9WxmoLnh4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086449',4.6,2892,'en','To All a Goodnight','A group of teenagers at a party find themselves being stalked by a maniacal killer in a Santa Claus costume.','/aAoKKJH5wqyPbogT4FTgP0TQYy.jpg','1980-01-30',87,'Released','You\'ll Scream \'til Dawn','To All a Goodnight',85181,1.935,4.5,'7Fc_rTBnzQg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8885,_binary '\0','/qT9Nb4CmSmzdUPysn0KggAh1Efu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086450',6.9,13033,'en','To Be or Not to Be','A bad Polish actor is just trying to make a living when Poland is invaded by the Germans in World War II. His wife has the habit of entertaining young Polish officers while he\'s on stage, which is also a source of depression to him. When one of her officers comes back on a Secret Mission, the actor takes charge and comes up with a plan for them to escape.','/5VDZskShjJKAn3NP34LxnOVYek5.jpg','1983-12-16',107,'Released','THAT is the movie!','To Be or Not to Be',22998,4.5678,6.722,'YgNW4Pl4L2g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8886,_binary '\0','/3FO1kbQmRlU1H6Kmn7sTfmd7mw9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086465',7.5,184593,'en','Trading Places','A snobbish investor and a wily street con-artist find their positions reversed as part of a bet by two callous millionaires.','/8mBuLCOcpWnmYtZc4aqtvDXslv6.jpg','1983-06-07',116,'Released','They\'re not just getting rich... They\'re getting even.','Trading Places',1621,13.5762,7.229,'Fupg2r1EJ9w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8887,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086477',7.8,1429,'cs','Tři veteráni','It is a story of three veterans released from the army. During one night spent camping in the country they one by one wake up and meet three elvish brothers. Each of the veterans is given a magic item - one gets magic harp that provides him with servants by wish, other one endless pouch of gold and the last one owns magic hat that can create all the staff excluding money and people.','/1Rlq42VH5JQtRufuLJ2Nsmjxo2m.jpg','1984-07-01',93,'Released',NULL,'The Three Veterans',46091,1.6638,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8888,_binary '\0','/6iCVOqsSrfIPROeCvXag17FPzNX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086486',2.8,2793,'es','La tumba de los muertos vivientes','In a remote desert oasis, a fortune in gold was hidden by the Nazis during World War 2. 50 years later, a bunch of fortune-hunters converge on that selfsame oasis. Imagine their discomfiture upon discovering that the gold is being guarded by an army of zombies.','/A2r6rwwHPi0WiBXyPjspsiVrDd5.jpg','1982-04-20',85,'Released','There\'s No Rest for the Wicked in the Desert of the Living Dead','Oasis of the Zombies',36835,1.8693,3.3,'USzOWDS52cs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8889,_binary '\0','/yS3AGFYDRAbqjvkVH00zQX8hWlf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086489',6.9,1361,'en','Twice Upon a Time','In the world of the Murkworks where nightmares are made, the evil Synonamess Botch hatches a scheme to make non-stop nightmares. Only Ralph and Mumford, misfits from the cheery land of Frivoli where good dreams are made, can stop him.','/abx7BQF3O23LJGTDTmQQ0CTwc8c.jpg','1983-08-05',73,'Released','The funniest heroes you\'ll ever meet... They came. They saw. They screwed up.','Twice Upon a Time',36751,2.0385,6.6,'pqCRgiHHvB4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8890,_binary '\0','/8z8uPdpCBxGMQQGr8IfxRSbXNFs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086491',6.4,43805,'en','Twilight Zone: The Movie','An anthology film presenting remakes of three episodes from the \"Twilight Zone\" TV series—\"Kick the Can\", \"It\'s a Good Life\" and \"Nightmare at 20,000 Feet\"—and one original story, \"Time Out.\"','/sDWARc5aYTUKE8Y2FIGVgWXuI4K.jpg','1983-06-24',101,'Released','You\'re travelling through another dimension. A dimension, not only of sight and sound, but of mind. A journey into a wondrous land whose boundaries are that of imagination. Next stop, the Twilight Zone!','Twilight Zone: The Movie',15301,8.0569,6.5,'Vcx-Kx_WOvQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8891,_binary '\0','/pgSp6BmSDnafDkZizucH6Q4SElT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086494',4.8,4881,'en','Two of a Kind','God has had enough of the bad behavior and attitude of humankind, and has decided to start it all over. It is up to a struggling inventor and a bank teller, both with very amateur criminal minds, to save the world by falling in love.','/b0VdTJJLbOfSXOGAhdJUH9DYir.jpg','1983-12-13',88,'Released','It took a twist of fate to make them two of a kind.','Two of a Kind',32644,3.4572,6,'EvZhmjRzcf4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8892,_binary '\0','/f1B5fksvFtdq1A2DHVaYqWKqaqe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086497',6.9,1594,'en','Utu','In New Zealand in the 1860s the native Māori people fought the British colonials to keep the land guaranteed to them by treaty. The warrior Te Wheke fights for the British until betrayal leads him to seek utu (revenge). The settler Williamson in turn seeks revenge after Te Wheke attacks his homestead. Meanwhile Wiremu, an officer for the British, seems to think that resistance is futile.','/jSPTs6c9MQrd2rsrnqMJXQ0o3xz.jpg','1983-01-31',118,'Released',NULL,'Utu',42123,1.1346,7,'CsTqvrgPOHE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8893,_binary '\0','/guytolQfVbQbDkaWLat3f34W79n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086508',6.3,13646,'en','Uncommon Valor','A group of Vietnam War veterans re-unite to rescue one of their own left behind and taken prisoner by the Vietnamese.','/92gPncxWevFlPLOz0a0uoob7jFL.jpg','1983-12-16',105,'Released','Seven men with one thing in common...','Uncommon Valor',9967,5.9052,6.2,'VHF9AoznACI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8894,_binary '\0','/z6P7azdkZcNuEdOcqfZxqzRBMJ1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086510',7,9895,'en','Under Fire','Three U.S. journalists get too close to one another and their work in 1979 Nicaragua.','/yw73rD95RDqm6cMXi5Gw87KffId.jpg','1983-10-21',128,'Released','The first casualty of war is the truth.','Under Fire',12503,4.015,6.7,'MglSoMaXCOM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8895,_binary '\0','/stTmJizMu8LklEIIkSu7NqHchdH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086525',6.4,21495,'en','Valley Girl','Julie, a girl from the valley, meets Randy, a punk from the city. They are from different worlds and find love. Somehow they need to stay together in spite of her trendy, shallow friends.','/mQSrU9jerYSIOWeLBqFA1gcUU59.jpg','1983-04-08',99,'Released','She\'s cool. He\'s hot. She\'s from the Valley. He\'s not.','Valley Girl',19053,4.0864,6,'GJU88bssElo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8896,_binary '\0','/eBS1nvaQ7BMdsSlkoLyKapf0FEY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086541',7.2,114735,'en','Videodrome','As the president of a trashy TV channel, Max Renn is desperate for new programming to attract viewers. When he happens upon \"Videodrome,\" a TV show dedicated to gratuitous torture and punishment, Max sees a potential hit and broadcasts the show on his channel. However, after his girlfriend auditions for the show and never returns, Max investigates the truth behind Videodrome and discovers that the graphic violence may not be as fake as he thought.','/qqqkiZSU9EBGZ1KiDmfn07S7qvv.jpg','1983-02-04',88,'Released','First it controls your mind. Then it destroys your body.','Videodrome',837,6.275,7.248,'X2EyfTGzwY4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8897,_binary '\0','/mNZ0UKZi5cWa6lyGczGP0FKDfA0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086542',6.1,1334,'fr','La vie est un roman','In this whimsical fable, Resnais deftly interweaves three story lines: the creation of an early-20th-century utopia; romantic high jinks at a school conference; and a fantasy sparked by F/X pioneer Georges Méliès.','/vazCrUC6EbzgZnDGGse0Wyt7G56.jpg','1983-04-20',110,'Released',NULL,'Life Is a Bed of Roses',63978,3.653,5.7,'vgDO63nI8Qk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8898,_binary '\0','/pDbusBxuQdGw8nmtTYBuxe8yGND.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086543',7.1,9451,'nl','De vierde man','A writer whose lover is a woman widowed three times begins to suspect she may be responsible for her husbands\' deaths.','/iO7pYvGHcxekOqmQKsY4qeSygAi.jpg','1983-03-23',98,'Released','Christine is young, beautiful and rich. Her three husbands all died tragically. It\'s time for Christine to find her fourth man.','The 4th Man',29140,2.9899,6.696,'O-EW1wufaUE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8899,_binary '\0','/dKbOK5DPQDWfiKLteO2U08PPcky.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086545',7.2,1229,'fr','La Ville des pirates','A surreal odyssey in which a melancholic maidservant crosses paths with a homicidal little boy, travels to a tiny island of pirates and encounters a man with multiple personalities.','/yrew6oTju5QlEx6WM5txPtB2mJj.jpg','1984-02-22',108,'Released',NULL,'City of Pirates',68757,1.5825,7.2,'T3a-sAbbGrE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8900,_binary '\0','/9W3ZsrUFSKLeDSqZ8mREg0NsMAV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086551',7.2,8164,'fr','Vivement dimanche !','After he\'s implicated in several murders, a real estate agent goes on the lam while his intrepid secretary does some private investigating of her own to locate the killer.','/i3B2jDsdxzNpe5Y0gp86uHEVTzT.jpg','1983-08-10',110,'Released',NULL,'Confidentially Yours',2455,2.6179,7.074,'z9_pNmzcGGk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8901,_binary '\0','/qtamfYGFfDLfGRcucx1zNwohRts.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086567',7.1,123112,'en','WarGames','High school student David Lightman has a talent for hacking. But while trying to hack into a computer system to play unreleased video games, he unwittingly taps into the Department of Defense\'s war computer and initiates a confrontation of global proportions. Together with his friend and a wizardly computer genius, David must race against time to outwit his opponent and prevent a nuclear Armageddon.','/zZ1rN4LoPxKNfAp67Xl300WxVeD.jpg','1983-06-03',114,'Released','Is it a game, or is it real?','WarGames',860,8.9933,7.069,'-hfz7qDg-Bg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8902,_binary '\0','/llCw53gVVb1fHNqctuwYBRdddgE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086582',4.9,1708,'en','The Wicked Lady','Caroline is to be wed to Sir Ralph and invites her sister Barbara to be her bridesmaid. Barbara seduces Ralph, however, and she becomes the new Lady, but despite her new wealthy situation, she gets bored and turns to highway robbery for thrills. While on the road she meets a famous highwayman, and they continue as a team, but some people begin suspecting her identity, and she risks death if she continues her nefarious activities.','/wpePR1PBAT3gQDsmDZQtB3q6ZLi.jpg','1983-04-21',98,'Released','She\'s wild. She\'s wicked. And she really knows how to whip up a good time!','The Wicked Lady',110683,2.3652,4.944,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8903,_binary '\0','/1t0SonlKEQy4XHZcIu0SgQNrdJ5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086589',6.9,6782,'en','Suburbia','When household tensions and a sense of worthlessness overcome Evan, he finds escape when he clings with the orphans of a throw-away society. The runaways hold on to each other like a family until a tragedy tears them apart.','/vydIE7nizxO04ER9EcDdbdaHh8c.jpg','1984-04-13',94,'Released','The kids from... The Wild Side... The Side You\'ve Never Seen.','Suburbia',28054,2.1171,6.693,'3DAhIHu7mYE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8904,_binary '\0','/hhnzRodAKHCkIYoaOcN6GXQBM3g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086590',7.5,2059,'en','The Wind in the Willows','One spring, Mole decides that he can ignore the spring cleaning for a little longer, and begins a series of adventures with his new friend Rat. They go for a picnic on the riverbank, on a caravan expedition with Toad, until Toad switches allegiance to his new car and his reckless driving makes Mole and Rat search out Badger for help in curbing Toad\'s profligate habits. But Toad gets away from them and gets a 20-year sentence from the magistrate for theft, reckless driving, and Gross Impertinence. While Toad works his wiles on the jailer\'s daughter and escapes jail dressed as a washer woman, Badger tries to guard Toad Hall from the machinations of the Weasels and is badly beaten. And it requires a plan of attack and all four comrades to regain Toad Hall.','/Dgg7N0bukwmVJU2c1UtgxpdpDB.jpg','1983-12-30',78,'Released',NULL,'The Wind in the Willows',38782,1.6645,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8905,_binary '\0','/nm53pmsaJ1tUCT9OrwKLb5inwlB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086593',7.1,2544,'en','Without a Trace','English professor Susan Selky lives alone in a Brooklyn apartment with her young son, Alex. When Alex fails to return home from school one afternoon, a frantic Selky contacts the police. Detective Al Menetti, a father himself, takes an interest in the case that quickly turns into an obsession. As a devastated Selky struggles to come to terms with Alex\'s disappearance, Menetti steps out from behind the badge to continue investigating.','/xegLaEuvt5Ii21eochgdystk6x6.jpg','1983-02-04',120,'Released','One morning, Alex Selky got dressed, waved goodbye to his mother, set off for school and disappeared.','Without a Trace',47944,1.9414,5.4,'eRNA7EHYHu8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8906,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086597',7.5,1380,'hi','वो सात दिन','Maya, coming from poor family, is married to the affluent Dr. Anand; but she tries to commit suicide on the nuptial night. She tells Anand that she was in love with Prem whose ambition was to be a music director. He too was in love with her but thought she would not be happy as his wife. Anand tells Maya that he had married her only for his mother who was on her death bed. When the mother dies Anand wants to unite Prem and Maya but Prem says it is against Hindu culture and disappears from their life.','/dQVT9A3iwejfsjRNrVSlvKqTL7e.jpg','1983-02-23',139,'Released',NULL,'Woh 7 Din',87167,1.0106,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8907,_binary '\0','/wkGrNviFNJxgI8RU19kaEd7ldg7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086605',6.6,6538,'cn','奇謀妙計五福星','Five friends are released from prison and do their best to stay out trouble. While trying to mind their own business (and run their 5-Star Cleaning Service), they are caught up in a war between rival Triad gangs fighting for control of the counterfeit currency market.','/ngFYme3fGnwkssHkPXZr3peI6iW.jpg','1983-07-07',108,'Released',NULL,'Winners & Sinners',25539,4.7948,6.985,'h-d_Jsu6834','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8908,_binary '\0','/yq5f7SUW2ZxW6m6ahC9EujWLRfK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086606',7.4,4183,'cn','五郎八卦棍','The Yangs are betrayed by a government official conspiring with the Mongols. All of the Yang family males except the 5th and 6th brother are killed. Fu Sheng loses his mind after the death of his family, while the other brother takes refuge in a Buddhist temple.','/lme6eIZ12ar3fsOodNCUuVul9cq.jpg','1984-02-17',98,'Released',NULL,'The 8 Diagram Pole Fighter',32520,2.8234,6.992,'ATQZnWXIuk8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8909,_binary '\0','/jayLkSF1eUPLwk7yxjZJ2HRLbi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086610',5.6,9302,'en','Xtro','Tony\'s father Sam, abducted by aliens three years earlier, returns to earth and seeks out his wife and son, but Rachel has since been living with Joe and the reunion is awkward. Joe doesn\'t trust Sam, and Rachel can\'t quite decide what her feelings are for her two men. Sam is not the same as when he left, and he begins affecting Tony in frightening ways.','/bGw37akayvsHK6LZ4IUHKIHoKl2.jpg','1982-12-06',86,'Released','Some extra-terrestrials aren\'t friendly.','Xtro',25834,2.8848,5.698,'3BJAb0fm2oA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8910,_binary '\0','/jsv8eASSZmkKhYXMZqliYO9ntnd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086617',7.1,25107,'en','The Year of Living Dangerously','A young Australian reporter tries to navigate the political turmoil of Indonesia during the rule of President Sukarno with the help of a diminutive photographer.','/y9GIM95xWWU4urqqu0kziby0Ykg.jpg','1982-12-17',114,'Released','A love caught in the fire of revolution.','The Year of Living Dangerously',11541,4.3519,6.7,'5yBV7pGccgQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8911,_binary '\0','/bPanV7AwE7OwjmcSgY8YJN99gDa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086618',5.9,9471,'en','Yellowbeard','For years Yellowbeard had looted the Spanish Main, making men eat their lips and swallow their hearts. Caught and convicted for tax evasion, he\'s sentenced to 20 years in St. Victim\'s Prison for the Extremely Naughty. In a scheme to confiscate his fabulous treasure, the Royal Navy allows him to escape and follows him, where saucy tarts, lisping demigods and some awful puns and punishments await.','/qom9prcVvoERJ6bzOOcBSdSUzin.jpg','1983-06-24',96,'Released','A Shipload of Laughs.','Yellowbeard',11609,3.7766,5.6,'3RC69keaDGo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8912,_binary '\0','/oMRr5B0OkOJ8vjwR2w5Xw7YNp9W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086619',6.6,17650,'en','Yentl','In a time when girls were forbidden to study religious scriptures, a Jewish girl masquerades as a boy to enter religious training and unexpectedly finds love along the way.','/AcCX4tKqwP5BTfRTQEqZW3qabl3.jpg','1983-11-18',132,'Released','In a time when the world of study belonged only to men, there lived a girl who dared to ask...\"why?\"','Yentl',10269,3.1302,6.7,'v3OeBLaKYnI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8913,_binary '\0','/tdttKDpSebKcktfWUuTDyuVs2k9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086636',6.2,2758,'it','Zeder','A young journalist buys a used typewriter and notices some text still legible on the ribbon; he reconstructs the story of a scientist who discovered that some types of terrain have the power to revive the dead.','/79RQWnc44i5mDfEcvxDV7M6x9T8.jpg','1983-08-25',98,'Released','One man\'s search for an ancient secret...and the dead will rise from their graves!','Revenge of the Dead',38074,1.9936,6.465,'imS9c7EEfmQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8914,_binary '\0','/oCC3rSccbJV9bxMDRedtqI6pnla.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086637',7.6,46314,'en','Zelig','Fictional documentary about the life of human chameleon Leonard Zelig, a man who becomes a celebrity in the 1920s due to his ability to look and act like whoever is around him. Clever editing places Zelig in real newsreel footage of Woodrow Wilson, Babe Ruth, and others.','/bfs67JaV4B5xVBvtXd3O4R7nk9G.jpg','1983-07-15',79,'Released','You wanted more when it was all over!','Zelig',11030,2.8219,7.4,'-ih7lQxrtds','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8915,_binary '\0','/2fwxqpsnDgHKzmyfPL2f0LqKfms.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086640',6.5,1272,'cn','種鬼','After the wife of a taxi driver is raped and killed by two teenage hooligans, he pleads with a sorcerer to lift the hex and exact revenge.','/y6aUgCjbsEFqxEVHfjXehVuOQTu.jpg','1983-12-29',90,'Released',NULL,'Seeding of a Ghost',40070,2.2415,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8916,_binary '\0','/1rWqDwDLssO1bDDAcPMcbUsHpcH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086643',7.6,3202,'en','Ziggy Stardust and the Spiders from Mars','Hammersmith Odeon, London, July 3, 1973. British singer David Bowie performs his alter ego Ziggy Stardust for the very last time. A decadent show, a hallucinogenic collage of kitsch, pop irony and flamboyant excess: a musical symbiosis of feminine passion and masculine dominance that defines Bowie\'s art and the glam rock genre.','/dz4erM8bFxDjMpZmKLWKS6ryHER.jpg','1983-12-23',90,'Released','The historic farewell performance of the king of glitter rock.','Ziggy Stardust and the Spiders from Mars',34759,2.0084,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8917,_binary '\0','/8wbHaMPgjG0lUqqAma8bzSLe091.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086646',6.6,1544,'cn','最佳拍檔大顯神通','An assassin called Filthy Harry is hired by a shady figure and charged with killing the heroes. The men are framed twice for different robberies by King Kong\'s new girlfriend, nearly committed to a mental hospital by their devious boss, and forced to battle Filthy Harry\'s weaponry-laden robot while covered with time bombs.','/xsPtqkTo12JEeZcu1chFHHRCUKe.jpg','1983-02-06',102,'Released',NULL,'Aces Go Places II',2645,3.3446,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8918,_binary '\0','/n0hy2FtvgPTc6SIYgOnCRj2eUNb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086650',7.1,7872,'fr','À nos amours','Fifteen-year-old Suzanne seeks refuge from a disintegrating family in a series of impulsive, promiscuous affairs. Her fulsome sexuality further ratchets up the suppressed passions of her narcissistic brother, insecure mother and brooding, authoritarian father.','/D1R80A0ZepdofdI3mmx1igqNny.jpg','1983-11-16',102,'Released',NULL,'A Nos Amours',2282,2.4776,6.82,'7Gki-BOZsmg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8919,_binary '\0','/rfOYH5CWX6KEmijHJlNumR1afEr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086655',7.2,6243,'fr','L\'Été meurtrier','Shortly after Elle Wieck moves to a small French village, she begins dating Pin-Pon, a quiet young mechanic who has grown obsessed with the beautiful newcomer. But Elle has her own reason for the relationship...','/87DkoAQuc3o1yNjEPJ1CcwMUp3R.jpg','1983-05-11',133,'Released',NULL,'One Deadly Summer',9041,3.1937,7,'S9iyWQy7PQw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8920,_binary '\0','/8zvo2J1rKbzcfxaX9lHRgHgOEf0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086837',6.7,61642,'en','2010','While planet Earth poises on the brink of nuclear self-destruction, a team of Russian and American scientists aboard the Leonov hurtles to a rendezvous with the still-orbiting Discovery spacecraft and its sole known survivor, the homicidal computer HAL.','/mEWKXuCMv7mFMxXVSTI3v8UOQuq.jpg','1984-12-06',116,'Released','In the very near future, a small group of Americans and Russians set out on the greatest adventure of them all...to see if there is life beyond the stars.','2010',4437,9.2783,6.66,'rqvdHik5bog','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8921,_binary '\0','/g9G5SUe17L3zPq7bvAycRFBJdJ9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086846',6.8,1736,'de','Abwärts','It\'s Friday evening. The lift repairman leaves the building and wants to finish his work on Monday. But he doesn\'t know there are four men in the building. They use the lift but stay in it about 100 meters from the floor. They have little oxygen and must survive…','/wimasu8RQfZbupONckZE6X8A3OB.jpg','1984-05-04',90,'Released','6.30PM - Friday evening in an empty office building. Three men and one woman, trapped and terrified, 25 floors up. Help will reach them Monday morning - if they live that long.','Out of Order',10672,1.39,6,'R_zkXNnkCrc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8922,_binary '\0','/x1m4kDPv4qmmEFvUVdxh9WN672H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086850',6.6,2057,'it','Acqua e sapone','A school janitor pretends to be a priest in order to give private lessons to a young top model.','/yvT8NykVhVqJ06IIuB9KPJ0REmv.jpg','1983-10-27',109,'Released',NULL,'Soap and Water',37777,1.3284,6.738,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8923,_binary '\0','/rYla2HuNYbuVU0ZhszkjtGDw3si.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086856',6.2,33387,'en','The Adventures of Buckaroo Banzai Across the 8th Dimension','Adventurer/surgeon/rock musician Buckaroo Banzai and his band of men, the Hong Kong Cavaliers, take on evil alien invaders from the 8th dimension.','/jWZh2ChereoxKgTl3AmSAKNpnmO.jpg','1984-08-10',103,'Released','Beings from another dimension have invaded your world. You can\'t see them... but they can see you. Your only hope is Buckaroo Banzai.','The Adventures of Buckaroo Banzai Across the 8th Dimension',11379,6.5114,6,'jcXunlDAQ-I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8924,_binary '\0','/e04RvD1Ps5ptQ9zA3bmS3tWFkeM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086859',6,15796,'en','Against All Odds','Terry Brogan, a cynical former football star, is hired to find Jessie Wyler, the runaway mistress of ruthless LA nightclub owner Jake Wise. But trouble brews when he tracks down and falls in love with the beautiful Jessie on a Mexican island—and Jake dispatches his henchman to bring the lovers back.','/Ac0m41QYoxYBfRoU4cL491vOfEv.jpg','1984-03-02',121,'Released','Sometimes love is the most dangerous game of all.','Against All Odds',22160,5.836,5.7,'Ub4yCGzFE70','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8925,_binary '\0','/8te2MPnA9qtcvY6XwxUv4E3DzO2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086862',6.6,5514,'en','Airwolf: The Movie','Airwolf is capable of supersonic speeds, invisible to radar and armed with ultra state-of-the-art hardware. Airwolf is the most awesome aerial weapon ever developed. When the helicopter is stolen by Libyan mercenaries, Michael Archangel, Project director for the CIA, enlists the help of Vietnam veteran Stringfellow Hawke and his closest friend Dominic Santini, to attempt to recover the Airwolf. The mission throws them into the midst of Middle Eastern violence and destruction, where they come face to face with danger, romance and intrigue in their battle to re-possess the deadliest aerial weapon ever used.','/7oxBfH1k2OvMcByjoIji9VQnWg7.jpg','1984-06-26',85,'Released',NULL,'Airwolf: The Movie',61968,3.3457,5.8,'4HtyoB5htxY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8926,_binary '\0','/uTos3MyM8mgUkDx4GyjdnkmEFXa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086863',6.8,1509,'pl','Akademia Pana Kleksa','Thanks to the powers of magic, Adaś Niezgódka is transported to the fairy tale land of Mr. Blot – the protagonist of Jan Brzechwa’s classic book. Mr. Blot is a teacher and a magician in one. His lessons cannot be boring. Especially when bIotology is the subject. Adaś learns about the miracles of the enchanted land, but also gets to know its dark secrets.','/xwdxTVcPS6GyXnKwef04RUKQppq.jpg','1984-01-30',166,'Released',NULL,'Mister Blot\'s Academy',78359,1.2184,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8927,_binary '\0','/jFuC0VhwOWX8RJT1OOk0Gb2iNeC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086872',5.3,1814,'en','Prey','A deadly shape-shifting alien infiltrates a country house occupied by two lesbians, and proceeds to study their behaviour for a sinister purpose.','/72Hw50XkxWBH6z55uhFLatqA1ez.jpg','1977-10-05',85,'Released','His savage hunger makes us all... Alien Prey','Prey',103578,1.3831,5.2,'YrjdLWVrAIk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8928,_binary '\0','/eX3kXD0Z2z6inMWl4UfLbjvje7S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086873',6.7,21548,'en','All of Me','Just before stubborn millionaire Edwina Cutwater dies, she asks her uptight lawyer, Roger Cobb, to amend her will so that her soul will pass to the young, vibrant Terry Hoskins – but the spiritual transference goes awry. Edwina enters Roger\'s body instead, forcing him to battle Edwina for control of his own being.','/psPV28pJfFXN3RNxPe2CPkZwUMl.jpg','1984-09-21',93,'Released','They say that behind every great man there\'s a woman. But in this case it\'s ridiculous.','All of Me',10631,3.7317,6.5,'y2FgCNpq7II','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8929,_binary '\0','/dKZSzoNufvLVgClNunVqfhgJem7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086874',6.9,3014,'it','L\'allenatore nel pallone','Oronzo Canà is called to coach Longobarda, the football team of a small town of Northern Italy, newly promoted to the First Division. His only task is not to be relegated, but Longobarda\'s owner plots against him, finding the team\'s current ranking far too expensive, and his top Brazilian striker is affected by a deep saudade.','/kgSJzoh9HALYx4nJxnkZGPZeK2y.jpg','1984-10-26',98,'Released',NULL,'L\'allenatore nel pallone',39371,1.6375,6.521,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8930,_binary '\0','/9x51wNZAYTKMJjWHYKPmsgDm1Nz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086877',5.2,1275,'en','Alphabet City','A New York City drug dealer decides to get out of the business, but has to flee from mobsters.','/6usQSU0ftXQMTa3yRCENxFqIn4k.jpg','1984-03-04',85,'Released','At 19, they gave him the streets. Tonight, they\'re going to take them back.','Alphabet City',124167,2.5775,4.7,'3ezB6ofYo1A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8931,_binary '\0','/rnQyWw68dPHPRtvSWMtLSueXf05.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086879',8.4,473341,'en','Amadeus','Disciplined Italian composer Antonio Salieri becomes consumed by jealousy and resentment towards the hedonistic and remarkably talented young Salzburger composer Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart.','/gQRfiyfGvr1az0quaYyMram3Aqt.jpg','1984-09-19',160,'Released','The Man... The Music... The Madness... The Murder... The Motion Picture.','Amadeus',279,12.3485,8.025,'ZQV9yySOmhs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8932,_binary '\0','/vH5aUXmiQ5bs7slbbwxmMhz31H9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086886',6.6,1871,'en','American Dreamer','American housewife Cathy Palmer loses her memory on a trip to Paris after being hit by a car. She wakes up in the hospital believing she\'s the fictional international spy, Rebecca Ryan.','/6ktp34gT3sohJrS1Vby70e5GDpl.jpg','1984-10-26',105,'Released','She was an ordinary housewife until her trip to Paris turned into an extraordinary adventure.','American Dreamer',52471,2.0005,6.326,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8933,_binary '\0','/7Yj42hXB0c0bSam1BLt1PeUoBVg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086890',6.6,1293,'fr','L\'Amour à mort','Elisabeth and Simon have been deeply in love for two months when Simon momentarily dies, but returns to life. Despite declining further medical tests, the couple are forced to grapple with the possibility of his death. Eventually, they tell their close friends Jérôme and Judith Martignac about the event. The Martignacs are both clerics, and Judith has just been giving a funeral service for a villager who committed suicide, though Jérôme would have nothing to do with suicide...','/4uvd60k4s5TgXfKx52Cp4Ga9kZO.jpg','1984-09-05',93,'Released',NULL,'Love Unto Death',60623,2.2271,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8934,_binary '\0','/dCGnro9iiwavXqWxSNEUSDnPQK2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086896',5.8,5589,'en','Angel','Molly Stewart, a teen at the top of her class who survives by working nights as a prostitute on Hollywood Blvd, finds her world beginning to fall apart when a depraved, necrophiliac serial killer begins targeting LA’s streetwalkers.','/cLrOR7QqV5fZ9g85bGJL0s5cHTo.jpg','1984-01-13',93,'Released','High School Honor Student by Day. Hollywood Hooker by Night.','Angel',1803,3.6022,6.034,'I5Jve6T5akg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8935,_binary '\0','/aVfWlcj1r8WlYHLovUaRsGxLTl5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086902',5.6,1706,'fr','L\'Année des méduses','Chris, a sexy teenager who appears mostly bare-breasted on the French Riviera, has a crush on Romain, her mother\'s lover. In reaction to her inability to attract his attention, she experiments with other risque affairs.','/9S29XZco4KzV3BspXVTfoivAmdz.jpg','1984-11-07',110,'Released',NULL,'Year of the Jellyfish',25290,3.1224,5.79,'cyhtb-Z5NHI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8936,_binary '\0','/1ZWs0xwjnpea58Ob5WUTsZlCBpH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086904',6.9,8116,'en','Another Country','In Moscow in 1983, an American journalist interviews Guy Bennett, who recalls his last year at public school, fifty years before, and how it contributed to his becoming a spy.','/njhQ5GKN5zrt53NjMQOraFAm7QF.jpg','1984-06-01',87,'Released','Convention outraged. A class abandoned. A country betrayed.','Another Country',31939,3.3306,6.4,'bJ8ErcWRjCs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8937,_binary '\0','/kuQd2RU7Os1tgCAzBQukDZp5E8D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086907',7.2,1893,'ja','アントニー・ガウディー','Catalan architect Antonio Gaudí (1852-1926) designed some of the world\'s most astonishing buildings, interiors, and parks; Japanese director Hiroshi Teshigahara constructed some of the most aesthetically audacious films ever made. With camera work as bold and sensual as the curves of his subject\'s organic structures, Teshigahara immortalizes Gaudí on film.','/5avrBzIW7mXrUmUAz8gNz8KxXhB.jpg','1984-05-25',72,'Released',NULL,'Antonio Gaudí',37239,0.802,7.1,'lTzJ5qsYzpQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8938,_binary '\0','/jsNp356FabwKafMmgHtof2MH0Hy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086911',4.9,1253,'de','Das Arche Noah Prinzip','The year is 1997, and World Peace seems to have come, with most classic weapons of mass destruction having been abandoned. However, orbiting the Earth there is the European/American space station FLORIDA ARKLAB, capable of controlling the weather at any location on the planet underneath. A civil project by nature, it might be abused as an offensive weapon, since it could deliver devastation to any potential adversary simply by creating natural disasters such as storms and floods. No wonder the space station soon becomes the central point in rising political tensions between East and West, next stop World War 3 (as indicated by the tagline \"The end of our future has already begun\"). We follow the main protagonist Billy Hayes, an astronaut aboard the station, as he wades through a plot of secrecy and sabotage trying to tell friend from foe in the process.','/pL0MgUCmRddLiUkGeqzgBhwATbZ.jpg','1984-02-24',100,'Released',NULL,'The Noah\'s Ark Principle',10880,2.1871,5.074,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8939,_binary '\0','/l9oodIbxeAQwFWzsW1ZXHHNLhYj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086926',5.5,1333,'he','אסקימו לימון 5: רומן זעיר','Bobby, Benji, and Huey are back and Benji is smitten with Bobby\'s little sister, who has blossomed into a beautiful young woman. The two start dating in secret, but are soon discovered by Bobby, who wrongly assumes that Benji has taken advantage of his sister. A sad series of events proves Bobby wrong and he reaches Benji just in time as he sits at the top of a cliff. More sexual misadventures set against an amazing 50\'s soundtrack.','/cIHyZb2sNLr0YYPsOzpc1CuxDuZ.jpg','1984-03-09',80,'Released',NULL,'Baby Love',38172,2.5434,5.882,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8940,_binary '\0','/ff1y897CAnQpLQ2QiyfDJtX9Qcq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086927',6.3,44082,'en','Bachelor Party','On the eve of his wedding to his longtime girlfriend, unassuming nice guy Rick is dragged out for a night of debauchery by his friends.','/dZf3UpPZDvJYTODSUJQy7wYEop.jpg','1984-06-29',105,'Released','A man\'s tradition every woman should know about.','Bachelor Party',12309,6.4713,6.3,'L9jE1xQCc-g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8941,_binary '\0','/zf962uaL7C1GwobFePKET5NCsox.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086935',8.7,13590,'sh','Балкански шпијун','Convinced that his subtenant is a spy and an enemy of the state, Ilija Čvorović falls into deep paranoia which leads to an absurd and destructive chain of events.','/2YxqcDSawVkJ99jU0Ji1gJAKJan.jpg','1984-02-23',92,'Released',NULL,'Balkan Spy',31400,1.8443,7.7,'AvaoNm6NVkY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8942,_binary '\0','/pv0RhWO764w4uORvY4YhSlRBIbo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086936',7.2,1218,'de','Ballade vom kleinen Soldaten','A group of Miskito Indians use Nicaraguan child soldiers in their resistance against the Sandinistas.','/u8XDHRexM6jiBUqkyfnjrrSOjQ9.jpg','1984-11-05',46,'Released',NULL,'Ballad of the Little Soldier',140003,1.6194,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8943,_binary '\0','/p0lmNFvKztoVYtiYqQ7aVG0uBvw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086946',6.5,4848,'en','Beat Street','An aspiring DJ, from the South Bronx, and his best friend, a promoter, try to get into show business by exposing people to hip-hop music and culture.','/cn0gXtGgQXT7EVVXKJRhK4E1nOc.jpg','1984-06-08',105,'Released','Takin\' the beat to the streets!','Beat Street',17667,2.6071,6.9,'7bYXW4x7RXk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8944,_binary '\0','/9rltda9SgPGYQjLQhI978GEA3ni.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086955',3.9,6768,'en','Best Defense','An engineer fails to get the bugs out of a tank before an Army officer has to use it in Kuwait.','/uBXYsO3jUU3H59YBILMPHbN9wiP.jpg','1984-07-20',94,'Released','Unfortunately, they\'re both on our side.','Best Defense',11221,3.6074,4.3,'iaGY6TmpRT8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8945,_binary '\0','/p256RduW9wMC3uhGJTerywmGiiX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086960',7.4,234594,'en','Beverly Hills Cop','Fast-talking, quick-thinking Detroit street cop Axel Foley has bent more than a few rules and regs in his time, but when his best friend is murdered, he heads to sunny Beverly Hills to work the case like only he can.','/eBJEvKkhQ0tUt1dBAcTEYW6kCle.jpg','1984-12-05',105,'Released','He\'s been chased, thrown through a window and arrested. Eddie Murphy is a Detroit cop on vacation in Beverly Hills.','Beverly Hills Cop',90,21.3456,7.212,'1UV-lUZIyQk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8946,_binary '\0','/xjcQI6O8xZCFtLVjp2IckYgDqV6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086961',7.3,6322,'pl','Bez końca','1982, Poland. A translator loses her husband and becomes a victim of her own sorrow. She looks to sex, to her son, to law, and to hypnotism when she has nothing else in this time of martial law when Solidarity was banned.','/3pdF1guvIxNgmhDkmXJHCCk0PkC.jpg','1985-06-17',108,'Released',NULL,'No End',124,2.258,7,'YboLTZz5sWU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8947,_binary '\0','/areRi1MjYzEm9nShIDhvTHab2wW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086967',3.7,1309,'en','Biohazard','A group of skeptical government officials headed by General Randolph are brought to a remote laboratory for a demonstration in \"Psychic Materialization\", a successful side effect of an experimental drug. But the project scientists had warned that not enough testing had been completed to access safety concerns. In a freak accident during the demonstration to the politicians, a vicious creature is created! Unable to contain the monster, it unleashes unbelievable havoc & destruction against mankind! Reproducing itself at an alarming rate, and all known weapons seemingly powerless against the creature, the scientists are gravely concerned for the survival of mankind!','/6nPxykXfrfTxRLpRdgshgNvZ0bk.jpg','1985-08-03',79,'Released','Sense It. Feel It. Fear It. Be Very Afraid.','Biohazard',5734,1.2516,3.4,'eFm-bCrxH18','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8948,_binary '\0','/7dfXj49DeTmx3Nl5CffBfBQ5LmC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086969',7.2,26852,'en','Birdy','Two young men are seriously affected by the Vietnam War. One of them has always been obsessed with birds - but now believes he really is a bird, and has been sent to a mental hospital. Can his friend help him pull through?','/weIn0Huxx4SQU8PB5ZggzA4PLIE.jpg','1984-12-14',120,'Released','A soaring experience unlike anything you\'ve ever seen before.','Birdy',11296,4.9918,7.1,'IVEzG-u5x84','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8949,_binary '\0','/vcxKCvcQyvveKIVkrNscH8hXBF0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086972',2.4,4008,'it','Ator 2 - L\'invincibile Orion','Muscle-bound Ator and his mute Asian sidekick travel from the ends of the Earth to save his aged mentor from the evil mustachioed Zor.','/86xqVycd3h2MzTsXNcFu3P1Ucl1.jpg','1983-05-27',92,'Released','Warrior. Magician. Hero. Thief. They called him...','The Blade Master',31264,2.5798,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8950,_binary '\0','/zYeYZuqXuB2nfIR4zfKhaDWHeF6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086973',5.8,13349,'en','Blame It on Rio','Matthew Hollis is man on holiday in Rio with his best friend. Both men have teenage daughters with them. When Matthew falls for his best friend\'s amorous daughter named Jennifer, they embark on a secret, if slightly one-sided relationship. Jennifer\'s father is furious when he finds out about the \'older man\' in his daughter\'s life, and sets out to hunt him down with the aid of Matthew!','/yzNtmqL6HUFC7FZl9DnGmhnCQUL.jpg','1984-02-17',100,'Released','She\'s the hottest thing on the beach. She\'s also his best friend\'s daughter!','Blame It on Rio',14347,4.8189,5.8,'nSlYxLdAI_I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8951,_binary '\0','/3a5QsMJLolnUcNdvCuv94Kf21dl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086978',4.9,1569,'en','Blind Date','A man goes blind when remembering his lost girlfriend, but the doctors can\'t find anything wrong with his eyes. They fit him with an experimental device which allows him to see with the aid of a computer interface and brain electrodes. Meanwhile, a taxi driver is taking young women up to their apartments, giving them gas, and performing a little fatal amateur surgery on them. Their paths inevitably converge, and the blind man must try to stop the psychopath.','/totM9TbQJ31X2qfp0D5G7baccXm.jpg','1984-03-15',106,'Released','You won\'t be coming home alone.','Blind Date',80965,2.2596,4.3,'QpX3XM6yZSY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8952,_binary '\0','/rGPoNNk4fvgG2mvkNAxJJPlszOu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086979',7.5,115121,'en','Blood Simple','The owner of a seedy small-town Texas bar discovers that one of his employees is having an affair with his wife. A chaotic chain of misunderstandings, lies and mischief ensues after he devises a plot to have them murdered.','/n8D1gVXUgmW4kkDzUzzoezAmUUa.jpg','1985-01-18',97,'Released','Passion led to Adultery. Adultery led to Murder. It all seemed so simple...','Blood Simple',11368,7.2118,7.2,'CO54LvO26zs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8953,_binary '\0','/tz3nwuoMZC8rx3mtB4K5jA6meOo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086981',5,3552,'en','Bloodbath at the House of Death','Six scientists arrive at the creepy Headstone Manor to investigate a strange phenomena which was the site of a mysterious massacre years earlier where 18 guests were killed in one night. It turns out that the house is the place of a satanic cult lead by a sinister monk who plans to kill the scientists who are inhabiting this house of Satan.','/6K5CzOmI5TFmpdJ8s0adURMY3lx.jpg','1984-03-29',91,'Released','The movie that took a lot of guts to make!','Bloodbath at the House of Death',52528,2.2113,5.3,'kXwEfie4ub4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8954,_binary '\0','/h5QkdbRmG2VodOCSB0QMhSGcCkI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086984',6.8,46123,'en','Body Double','After losing an acting role and his girlfriend, Jake Scully finally catches a break: he gets offered a gig house-sitting in the Hollywood Hills. While peering through the beautiful home\'s telescope one night, he spies a gorgeous woman dancing in her window. But when he witnesses the girl\'s murder, it leads Scully through the netherworld of the adult entertainment industry on a search for answers—with porn actress Holly Body as his guide.','/lRFm5P2AdOGpELwm3HHhmUz6k5I.jpg','1984-10-25',114,'Released','You can\'t believe everything you see.','Body Double',11507,7.8989,6.74,'_B6KEJD605M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8955,_binary '\0','/nbvzXhZ0jFQjyK8LNcbw9tCRo21.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086987',3,6545,'en','Bolero','Follows the tale of a young woman’s sexual awakening and subsequent journey around the world in pursuit of her ideal lover. Encounters include an Arabian sheik and a Spanish bullfighter. Her friend and butler accompany her and help to arrange her couplings.','/pQNjzG51FB9ngy8pi2HVELeFEkS.jpg','1984-08-03',105,'Released','An adventure in ecstasy.','Bolero',5896,2.236,3.452,'PpAk1A04gng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8956,_binary '\0','/mxssjbAmCuD8ocq2BYY6V4ebsRX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086992',6.1,2772,'en','The Bostonians','A bored lawyer and a suffragette vie for the attention of a faith healer\'s charismatic daughter.','/4ibCpYEPY3ZzUdYf8jkmUVPnsCr.jpg','1984-05-01',122,'Released','An intimate and exquisite probe of the feminist heart.','The Bostonians',40775,2.0037,5.5,'4JfzGSN_-94','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8957,_binary '\0','/aOHACmU6271TJjzK5X8bF6wISVM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086993',7.1,35385,'en','The Bounty','An idyllic voyage to Tahiti in 1789 turns a crew aboard the H.M.S. Bounty against its captain when they find a tropical paradise.','/hXFXIc6F4NXI5emWCKcUwqEPjIZ.jpg','1984-05-04',132,'Released','After 200 years, the truth behind the legend.','The Bounty',2669,5.4133,6.757,'EP1t8lSp8Zc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8958,_binary '\0','/vFIC5xBv81hPHKnGU2noTid0HjE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086994',6.8,4455,'fr','Boy Meets Girl','In Paris at night, a young aspiring filmmaker grapples with heartbreak after his girlfriend leaves him for his best friend. After a failed attempt to confront his friend, he wanders the streets and encounters a girl who has just been abandoned. Their paths cross at a party, bringing together two tormented souls.','/xTKs2ztBMnwHog8hnzS65gKLmli.jpg','1984-11-21',104,'Released',NULL,'Boy Meets Girl',63418,2.1707,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8959,_binary '\0','/1b3GHjn2ecFvYxFd0rXo0uYlwP8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086998',5.9,8043,'en','Breakin\'','A struggling young dancer joins forces with two breakdancers and together they become a street sensation.','/kwIqaI4yXKDlRurc9zTrgavMrFF.jpg','1984-05-04',90,'Released','Push it to pop it! Rock it to lock it! Break it to make it!','Breakin\'',15259,3.0876,6.7,'kVB6y-4-I4c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8960,_binary '\0','/iy7vybBK8pRUKaip9sIfUbxl3Fd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0086999',5.2,5264,'en','Breakin\' 2: Electric Boogaloo','The dance crew from \"Breakin\'\" bands together to save a community center from a greedy developer bent on building a shopping center in its place.','/3RV0NNZ8p3XcdVnrr8bLILuH1x9.jpg','1984-12-21',94,'Released','They\'re Back... For Everyone Who Believes In the Beat.','Breakin\' 2: Electric Boogaloo',17464,3.3592,5.4,'wnNLY8yDwyk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8961,_binary '\0','/q8sDyc25U5zCTRKEArOg6pB281h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087001',5.6,2280,'en','A Breed Apart','A conservationist and a widow meet a mountain climber hired to steal bald-eagle eggs.','/yhHIn8F1SDPCN7vRELiUF5fG4Tr.jpg','1984-06-01',101,'Released','One man protects a secret. The other tries to steal it. And only one woman can stop them from destroying each other. Together they are... a breed apart.','A Breed Apart',96404,2.4208,5.9,'dqr9BQEOyNA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8962,_binary '\0','/sSOb9iof1C3GLd81x9LigSOCRPQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087003',7.4,28418,'en','Broadway Danny Rose','A hapless talent manager named Danny Rose, by helping a client, gets dragged into a love triangle involving the mob. His story is told in flashback, an anecdote shared amongst a group of comedians over lunch at New York\'s Carnegie Deli. Rose\'s one-man talent agency represents countless incompetent entertainers, including a one-legged tap dancer, and one slightly talented one: washed-up lounge singer Lou Canova, whose career is on the rebound.','/oUgolImcg0PRiT33UNjK409aQoJ.jpg','1984-01-27',84,'Released',NULL,'Broadway Danny Rose',12762,3.2243,7.135,'q3f2DabnAg0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8963,_binary '\0','/tyxq6nV8hBqWdw0ht90h33koyuf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087004',6.8,7127,'en','The Brother from Another Planet','A mute alien with the appearance of a black human is chased by outer-space bounty hunters through the streets of Harlem.','/jsIKSThUHCjWXzLCp7YV3LZAzZN.jpg','1984-09-07',108,'Released','He\'s not just another out-of-towner...','The Brother from Another Planet',26889,3.0038,6.7,'DsgcgfFcSe0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8964,_binary '\0','/mfmp9E5riyXMYlB9m9jzgrhm1Im.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087006',5.8,1540,'en','The Buddy System','A school truant officer uncovers a young boy\'s attempt to fake his residential address and subsequently befriends the kid and his mother.','/j1Ozz1hXrOXt9k4Tzd5FjctEYMs.jpg','1984-05-04',110,'Released','One day 11 year old Timmy decided his mother needed a playmate.','The Buddy System',61471,1.7367,4.9,'tJi_NpF-y0I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8965,_binary '\0','/6ivaSOF1OfNIqJWdM17URfJNDXR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087010',7.2,4011,'en','The Burning Bed','An abused battered wife has had enough of husband beating up on her. Everywhere she turns for help, there\'s not much anyone will do. After he rapes her one night, she sets the bed on fire with him in it asleep.','/eOElJBqX7u8gz94oQ3UpzpbSPiG.jpg','1984-10-08',100,'Released','He didn\'t know how to stop it... she did.','The Burning Bed',60573,2.1509,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8966,_binary '\0','/w2kcHY0AP3lnrHHXGQnzLhccUEa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087013',7.1,1746,'da','Busters verden','The television series was based on a play by Danish author Bjarne Reuter. In 1984 Reuter published his collection Tre skuespil (\"Three Plays\"); a collection containing also En dag i Hector Hansens liv (\"A Day in the Life of Hector Hansen\") and Kom der lys i neonrøret, gutter? (\"Was There Light in the Neon Tube, Boys?\") – in addition to Busters Verden.','/wFOBwBNTXN7BTcNmMbGDXzZYtIF.jpg','1984-01-07',91,'Released',NULL,'Buster\'s World',21273,1.0281,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8967,_binary '\0','/zY9ahWKd9wVgQ6Rj5iL2zo0UvOt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087015',5.6,15672,'en','C.H.U.D.','A rash of bizarre murders in New York City seems to point to a group of grotesquely deformed vagrants living in the sewers. A courageous policeman, a photojournalist and his girlfriend, and a nutty bum, who seems to know a lot about the creatures, band together to try and determine what the creatures are and how to stop them.','/8BVw5RIDBTZwdMAR1VKpAkwrMjj.jpg','1984-08-31',96,'Released','They\'re not staying down there anymore!','C.H.U.D.',23730,4.5763,5.6,'lL2yQ1akHwg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8968,_binary '\0','/hczAdfGHC1sjl9FOjMaoaTIfp3T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087019',6.5,1838,'en','Cal','Cal, a young man on the fringes of the IRA, falls in love with Marcella, a Catholic woman whose husband, a Protestant policeman, was killed one year earlier by the IRA.','/8fCYIX5CP8DP8VG0dwHuaeIM8nn.jpg','1984-08-24',102,'Released',NULL,'Cal',42084,1.6293,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8969,_binary '\0','/vbbxn85rbcfchIcLDpxfhssundR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087020',6.9,4603,'fi','Calamari Union','A group of men all called Frank—except for one named Pekka—have had enough of life in their working-class neighborhood, so they set off for a better existence in the magical seaside district of Eira. But the way is long, and the group face many hurdles including stray dogs and defunct streetlights.','/1rS3Rl17upvBEnaUE67lCPowDEs.jpg','1985-02-08',81,'Released',NULL,'Calamari Union',59388,2.0169,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8970,_binary '\0','/1BH1XATWO5NmJezvaGnvkfe6mq2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087027',6.9,1698,'es','Camila','In 1847 Buenos Aires, a young noblewoman and a young Jesuit fall in love, much to the disapproval of her family and the Church.','/h0tSZtLgvzYjc3PHiF3p8ilcorU.jpg','1984-05-17',109,'Released','Love against all odds','Camila',42085,2.1596,7.2,'BTCm6R_EL_g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8971,_binary '\0','/rmTU5rLkN9g3EUEulfXdctJ5gpl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087032',5.1,19101,'en','Cannonball Run II','When a wealthy sheikh puts up $1 million in prize money for a cross-country car race, there is one person crazy enough to hit the road hard with wheels spinning fast. Legendary driver J.J. McClure enters the competition along with his friend Victor and together they set off across the American landscape in a madcap action-adventure destined to test their wits and automobile skills.','/sdXjbUcdESA5CKCyez6A29c2vq3.jpg','1984-06-29',108,'Released','The popcorn\'s in the lobby. The nuts are on the screen.','Cannonball Run II',11950,8.7885,5.412,'-vT8_gg7VU8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8972,_binary '\0','/lQ9p9iaXOaH9NE1L9AuDOnI8KBF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087034',7.4,1836,'fr','Carmen','In the early 19th century, in Seville and the surrounding area, Carmen seduces the sergeant Don José, who deserts the army to be with her. But the beautiful gypsy falls in love with the bullfighter Escamillo, much to Don José’s despair.','/oiODmFnXZnmafoVwcOJD59uoWzJ.jpg','1984-03-14',152,'Released',NULL,'Carmen',21193,1.7377,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8973,_binary '\0','/7ERwRcdudfSoH9P2hAXBIZoq8q2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087042',4.6,4794,'en','Cheech & Chong\'s The Corsican Brothers','Two brothers who can feel each others\' pain and pleasure mess up the French revolution.','/vB186e2eiUaKLVlZwvKv4dIJ9GS.jpg','1984-07-27',91,'Released','They saw Paris. They saw France. They saw the Queen in her underpants.','Cheech & Chong\'s The Corsican Brothers',14774,2.8336,4.929,'P6AZLL1xF9Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8974,_binary '\0','/1IKOtiErR3I4JMgK4LjCFc2DQ0d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087050',5.6,63472,'en','Children of the Corn','A traveling couple end up in an abandoned Nebraska town inhabited by a cult of murderous children who worship a demon that lives in the local cornfields.','/jJTrFHu3rjAgP1lryKGEsC9hqyM.jpg','1984-03-09',92,'Released','And a child shall lead them...','Children of the Corn',10823,6.4871,5.726,'COFgZpeaK54','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8975,_binary '\0','/tEc74NqUNHExvPSYMIp1kYG2nwc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087054',6.7,3573,'en','Choose Me','Several lost-soul night-owls, including a nightclub owner, a talk radio relationship counselor, and an itinerant stranger have encounters that expose their contradictions and anxieties about love and acceptance.','/koNvG8XTMvKmkEv15PjBKUMNdEc.jpg','1984-08-29',106,'Released','In the middle of the night, when there\'s no one else...','Choose Me',42086,2.2401,6.087,'yFNvRXAt3dE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8976,_binary '\0','/1WQ4bHXzS7DpGppkS2PcpFvpY7T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087056',7.8,21862,'en','A Christmas Carol','Miser Ebenezer Scrooge is awakened on Christmas Eve by spirits who reveal to him his own miserable existence, what opportunities he wasted in his youth, his current cruelties, and the dire fate that awaits him if he does not change his ways. Scrooge is faced with his own story of growing bitterness and meanness, and must decide what his own future will hold: death or redemption.','/m3T3iLdE6J5PrqvvP0XNHBvM2bm.jpg','1984-10-09',101,'Released','A new powerful presentation of the most loved ghost story of all time!','A Christmas Carol',13189,4.3297,7.46,'sVObHkzoFPg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8977,_binary '\0','/wY3j3priVkWXV4BbGHzL4n3O2Ua.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087060',7,3190,'nl','Ciske de Rat','Lovable Amsterdam street urchin, 11 year old Ciske is nevertheless much in need of love as the Dutch 1984 title suggests. He is a scamp with a heart of gold. He causes havoc in the classroom pouring ink over his teacher yet when a polio-crippled boy joins the class Ciske is one of the only children to befriend him and is bullied as a result. His mother works in a bar and Ciske helps out often late into the night - his father is at sea and his mother supplements her income with prostitution. Ciske is also a very angry young man and he smoulders with rage at life\'s injustices.','/gENwOREHKvAOdkMvOJHR32sw85T.jpg','1984-03-29',107,'Released',NULL,'Ciske the Rat',35574,1.4344,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8978,_binary '\0','/1pIJjHLPfXs7OkWvlS33DH323Sq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087062',5.5,11925,'en','City Heat','Set in Kansas City in 1933, Eastwood plays a police lieutenant known simply by his last name, Speer. Reynolds plays a former cop turned private eye named Mike Murphy. Both Speer and Murphy served on the force together and were once good friends, but are now bitter enemies. When Murphy\'s partner is slain they team up again to fight the mob.','/gESRbXstISpeELPpYQYiTM3nRF1.jpg','1984-12-07',97,'Released','When a hotshot cop and a wise-guy detective get together... the heat is on!','City Heat',16969,3.2916,5.5,'dPiK2Hnlwf4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8979,_binary '\0','/eF765MoTYrRiXSda5xHVXrFeeQm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087065',6.6,9347,'en','Cloak & Dagger','Davey Osborne is an average 11-year-old boy with an overactive imagination. He spends his days playing video games and pretending to be a spy with his imaginary father-figure, Jack Flack - a substitute for his real father, who is struggling with the recent death of Davey\'s mother. However, fantasy becomes reality for Davey after he witnesses the murder of an FBI agent, who in his dying breath, gives Davey a mysterious video game cartridge called Cloak & Dagger, which in actuality contains top-secret government information. With the help of his younger friend Kim, the tech savvy Morris, and even a little help from his fictional secret agent mentor, Davey must stay one step ahead of pursuers as he tries to survive a real-life game of espionage in the streets of San Antonio, Texas.','/v42bfxsJwujF8L892RXXqiYslZ1.jpg','1984-06-01',101,'Released','It\'s not just a game anymore.','Cloak & Dagger',48677,3.4105,6.4,'h0xMbWlVFRI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8980,_binary '\0','/wikVknVnnBEWFS4HoIwhuKPAo1l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087068',5.1,1222,'it','Code Name: Wild Geese','Commander Robin Wesley, leader of a group of mercenaries, go to the Golden Triangle in Southeast Asia to overthrow the dictator, who is a major manufacturer and dealer of the world\'s opium.','/7zWv91cybCaQ7wz4zHTllqNXPp3.jpg','1984-10-05',101,'Released',NULL,'Code Name: Wild Geese',138595,2.0308,5.3,'GaH-W0z3KpA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8981,_binary '\0','/330JGLfUg9dl51RrXz4Wg2TQgNZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087072',6.6,2640,'en','Comfort and Joy','Radio host Alan \'Dickie\' Bird witnesses how an icecream van is attacked and destroyed by angry competitors. This leads him into the struggle between two Italian families over the icecream market of Glasgow.','/yeeO80JAqpFzr6EM1lk3pYapi4P.jpg','1984-08-14',106,'Released','A serious comedy','Comfort and Joy',30278,1.572,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8982,_binary '\0','/8LMKwSUdHxU8AGPVY7BV4wS5TeQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087075',6.6,21267,'en','The Company of Wolves','An adaptation of Angela Carter\'s fairy tales. Young Rosaleen dreams of a village in the dark woods, where Granny tells her cautionary tales in which innocent maidens are tempted by wolves who are hairy on the inside. As Rosaleen grows into womanhood, will the wolves come for her too?','/2g2YPws1MiEWTodUE8u3qOf78XS.jpg','1984-09-21',95,'Released','The Desire...The Fantasy...The Nightmare.','The Company of Wolves',11905,4.9668,6.3,'Ir34SoEgik0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8983,_binary '\0','/kAhjS7czQu0gtMVwDqfSBR2KjTF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087078',5.9,91375,'en','Conan the Destroyer','Conan is commissioned by the evil queen Taramis to safely escort a teen princess and her powerful bodyguard to a far away castle to retrieve the magic Horn of Dagoth. Unknown to Conan, the queen plans to sacrifice the princess when she returns and inherit her kingdom after the bodyguard kills Conan. The queen\'s plans fail to take into consideration Conan\'s strength and cunning and the abilities of his sidekicks: the eccentric wizard Akiro, the warrior woman Zula, and the inept Malak. Together the hero and his allies must defeat both mortal and supernatural foes in this voyage to sword-and-sorcery land.','/m5i7S46DT1ESy7URkh2l92awGRr.jpg','1984-06-29',103,'Released','The most powerful legend of all is back in a new adventure.','Conan the Destroyer',9610,9.0235,6.1,'lpUb4tBnWPA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8984,_binary '\0','/8vroa5RYUxD7Nv7vUGUoxZTyz7P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087089',6.6,21382,'en','The Cotton Club','Harlem\'s legendary Cotton Club becomes a hotbed of passion and violence as the lives and loves of entertainers and gangsters collide.','/jgCsLhIRLKlvUy1p1iImCi0nPnX.jpg','1984-12-14',130,'Released','Where deals were made, lives were traded and the legends of jazz lit up the night.','The Cotton Club',2148,6.4405,6.5,'7LXPGJnBK6Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8985,_binary '\0','/wR9Ftexcr9dZ8FfsCiBLRwllF1f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087091',6.6,2440,'en','Country','Jewell and Gil are farmers. They seem to be working against the odds, producing no financial surplus. Gil has lost hope of ever becoming prosperous, but Jewell decides to fight for her family.','/2lcDRkDJVtFt06Z1oueZtobcJJz.jpg','1984-09-29',105,'Released','In this country, when the land is your life... you fight for your life.','Country',42087,1.3018,6.5,'aCK9GhpAeJM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8986,_binary '\0','/dKA6LX3W1MkXyJBnqq2dMAyIetZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087096',5.2,1693,'en','Crackers','Down-and-out Weslake is reduced to minding the counter at a San Francisco pawn shop when he stumbles onto a scheme by some of the boss\'s disgruntled misfit clients to rob the place. Rather than blow the whistle, however, he insinuates himself as the heist\'s mastermind.','/AkfLpER2b9gAtOH49z6KnvbxzuI.jpg','1984-02-17',98,'Released','The Comedy that dreams the impossible scheme!','Crackers',87235,1.7935,4.722,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8987,_binary '\0','/bcpHVeaATZnRtw27V6NxNr8csoN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087100',6.4,9841,'en','Crimes of Passion','Fashion designer Joanna Crane leads a double life. By night she is China Blue, a prostitute who\'s attracted the attention of a sexually frustrated private detective, and a psychopathic priest in possession of a murderous sex toy.','/tstF6JMrZe75AdEAoPejwPrDfMA.jpg','1984-10-19',107,'Released','It\'s a Lovely Life.','Crimes of Passion',40814,5.9627,6.3,'MA2RASz9RKE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8988,_binary '\0','/6nZx19dEENHeguYB0hfvuSUNVuG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087123',8,5053,'sh','Давитељ против давитеља','When it comes to crime, Belgrade is same as any other modern metropolis, except for having its own serial killers. That blank is filled when a flower salesman begins strangling women. A popular, but very disturbed rock star soon becomes telepathically connected with the killer.','/reUt1XAJkqCg9Mw6O9A25XTzNkh.jpg','1984-06-18',93,'Released',NULL,'Strangler vs Strangler',15203,1.4591,6.892,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8989,_binary '\0','/1yCnjiA0maCWlCGr2vvql7jWZPP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087127',4.6,8392,'en','Deathstalker','The warrior Deathstalker is tasked by an old witch lady to obtain and unite the three powers of creation - a chalice, an amulet, and a sword - lest the evil magician Munkar get them and use them for nefarious purposes. After obtaining the sword, Deathstalker joins with other travelers going to the Big Tournament to determine the strongest warrior. The false king holds the true princess in captivity, and plots to have Deathstalker killed, and Deathstalker must fight to free the princess.','/vuX0IwRF03lcNXuhRNIVbBEByqo.jpg','1983-09-02',80,'Released','Journey to an age of awesome magic','Deathstalker',15895,2.4822,4.8,'P8FTMs4hzZk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8990,_binary '\0','/lppNOAle6eRGnn4nuwjw6auwpDL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087129',6.3,1305,'de','Decoder','F.M. discovers that different sonic frequencies induce different patterns of behaviour in listeners, first in his own studio but later in the local \"H-Burger\" restaurant where the passive muzak appears to be wiping people\'s emotions.','/lHxPGSwDTgyuw8sivGl81vn3e1k.jpg','1984-02-19',87,'Released','Information is like a bank. Our job is to rob the bank.','Decoder',90652,1.5543,6.2,'-Vu2ySzInU8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8991,_binary '\0','/mV8DiIihfq4MobBIIzaWPqfOcHG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087130',4.5,2537,'en','DEFCON-4','Two men and a woman circle the globe in a satellite armed with a nuclear device. The third world war breaks out, and a few months later the satellite crashes. They survive the crash but one man gets killed by survivors and the other man gets caught. The woman stays by the remains of the the satellite but is soon caught by evil punks who have taken power.','/qPQ8gUy228PrCkIFQlUVMppaD5.jpg','1985-03-15',88,'Released','The last defense. The last hope. The battle for the future of the world has begun.','DEFCON-4',42033,1.6677,4.5,'QwDjCTN4V2w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8992,_binary '\0','/tIqcAOe23mIGghMUQR7sT6Y2WMj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087144',6.6,1705,'fr','La Diagonale du fou','During the Cold War, the World Chess Championship clashed complete opposites - personal and political.','/erbO9GYdVc7ska0fpzQ8qqLrgC6.jpg','1984-04-15',100,'Released',NULL,'Dangerous Moves',46088,1.543,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8993,_binary '\0','/rlXt2ccXC1OCcLawaXwcJ2HTAPY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087147',6.6,1258,'de','Didi - Der Doppelgänger','A wealthy businessman and the owner of a rundown pub share one thing in common - they look like identical twins! When the businessman hears of a plot against him, he hires the pub owner as a decoy. However, the pub owner is accident prone and causes more trouble than he is worth. An action-packed, physical comedy.','/l84YVSKTNxwxWRhg4Nu8jbfzTd.jpg','1984-02-17',96,'Released',NULL,'Non-Stop Trouble with my Double',8821,0.9897,6.8,'Ww-IE5VHW2M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8994,_binary '\0','/qhNkZPVUclodLa4IzgP26D96Glm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087160',7.5,1258,'en','The Dollmaker','During World War II, hard-luck farmer Colvis Nevels leaves his rural Kentucky home to take a factory job in bustling Detroit. Reluctantly accompanying Colvis is his long-suffering wife, Gertie, a talented woodcarver set in her traditional ways. When the perils of city life and Colvis\' reckless squandering of money send the Nevels into precarious financial straits, Gertie starts a business making hand-carved dolls in order to provide for her family.','/hxtkWi3F2rUxex7ciVJUCPB8f1U.jpg','1984-05-13',142,'Released',NULL,'The Dollmaker',63092,1.4585,7.7,'EDbJTDSOiwA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8995,_binary '\0','/b0Jsfl5xW87GOAAFEoqaf3GAIXF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087164',7.6,2146,'zh','冬冬的假期','A coming-of-age story about a young brother and sister whom spend a pivotal summer in the country with their grandparents.','/gnmZGNut8TLk5630yiGgoMvPaah.jpg','1984-11-24',93,'Released',NULL,'A Summer at Grandpa\'s',92989,2.4796,7.5,'8lcQU2vgrTE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8996,_binary '\0','/qtdLpv0Qtqv1QMnmmnyRP0hf2Ek.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087175',6.3,18904,'en','Dreamscape','In order to diagnose the psychic traumas suffered by his patients, Dr. Paul Novotny gets young Alex Gardner to enter their dreams.','/gRLhwWhXS9asnE4c1mt84t1iEER.jpg','1984-08-15',99,'Released','Close your eyes and the adventure begins.','Dreamscape',24099,3.7117,6.1,'4ybHzYtF3ZM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8997,_binary '\0','/5wJ2tckpvwcxGCAgZiccodwEJpf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087182',6.2,194125,'en','Dune','In the year 10,191, the most precious substance in the universe is the spice Melange. The spice extends life. The spice expands consciousness. The spice is vital to space travel. The spice exists on only one planet in the entire universe, the vast desert planet Arrakis, also known as Dune. Its native inhabitants, the Fremen, have long held a prophecy that a man would come, a messiah who would lead them to true freedom.','/4kJmUCE7mkVJjXa7A0g2rY4IGTm.jpg','1984-12-14',136,'Released','A world beyond your experience, beyond your imagination.','Dune',841,14.4357,6.196,'hjRG8kvMFw0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8998,_binary '\0','/lg8qHPCrn3GUsxXHyMbZAprSDcq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087188',7.4,7476,'it','E la nave va','In 1914, a cruise ship sets sail from Naples to spread the ashes of beloved opera singer Edmea Tetua near Erimo, the isle of her birth. During the voyage, the eclectic array of passengers discovers a group of Serbian refugees aboard the vessel. Peace and camaraderie abound until the ship is descended upon by an Austrian flagship. The Serbians are forced to board it, but naturally they resist, igniting a skirmish that ends in destruction.','/kAJEaXgZ5sO0tBaB9By260JZUQg.jpg','1983-10-07',129,'Released','One of the world\'s great directors invites you to join him on a voyage...','And the Ship Sails On',5622,2.7311,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(8999,_binary '\0','/4rFITVhZgz1LaYF4V4GYLWYRrEP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087193',7.1,3323,'sv','Efter repetitionen','Rational, exacting, and self-controlled theater director, Henrik Vogler, often stays after rehearsal to think and plan. On this day, Anna comes back, ostensibly looking for a bracelet. She is the lead in his new production of Strindberg\'s A Dream Play. She talks of her hatred for her mother, now dead, an alcoholic actress, who was Vogler\'s star and lover.','/uHgcLxoF0pxH9JmriF01MHV11du.jpg','1984-06-21',74,'Released',NULL,'After the Rehearsal',42090,2.3372,6.9,'Q4SbE_T2bKA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9000,_binary '\0','/bMLQAoEtRMi36wq66qXyJ17yVQd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087197',6.4,10060,'en','Electric Dreams','Miles Harding buys a state-of-the-art computer that starts expressing conscious thought and emotion after an interaction with spilled champagne. Things begin getting out of hand when both Miles and Edgar, the computer, fall in love with beautiful neighbor Madeline Robistat.','/2XWmN9EXYrHSRDvkAV9VhvngHGn.jpg','1984-07-20',96,'Released','Meet Edgar. He\'ll make you sing, make you dance, make you laugh, make you cry, make you jealous, make you nuts.','Electric Dreams',19596,4.8411,6.4,'Ek08KvgqFGM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9001,_binary '\0','/yr8bQ7IZISm97WyGEqXakQd041J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087222',5.9,5419,'en','The Evil That Men Do','A former assassin (Charles Bronson) comes out of retirement to avenge the brutal murder of his friend at the hands of a sadistic torturer (Joseph Maher) employed by an oppressive foreign dictatorship.','/8sRe3JvO8f0QxphJ6dLj1Q1dSPr.jpg','1984-03-14',90,'Released','Most criminals answer to the law. The world\'s most savage executioner must answer to Bronson.','The Evil That Men Do',53426,3.1913,5.814,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9002,_binary '\0','/waWPYcXrbENXEoJkrQt7zFUdq14.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087225',5.3,13694,'en','The Ewok Adventure','Wicket the Ewok and his friends agree to help two shipwrecked human children, Mace and Cindel, on a quest to find their parents.','/4GrECLKaJhYA6ooSTOG0XEuPnSl.jpg','1984-12-21',97,'Released','You\'ll live the adventure... You\'ll love its heroes.','The Ewok Adventure',1884,3.9867,5.8,'HenB3gt6SAY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9003,_binary '\0','/8orv5u3H6OktB0LZOWEZYYeG8l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087229',4.6,3118,'en','Exterminator 2','The flamethrower-wielding vigilante John Eastland returns to rid New York of a drug lord and his gang.','/7n6lIVgfM2PVNqcEFSLbiQooHlA.jpg','1984-09-14',89,'Released','In \'The Exterminator\' he made the streets of New York safe. All has been quiet - until now!','Exterminator 2',69343,2.177,4.1,'AEjSBGKgyc0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9004,_binary '\0','/qmy3lk8YY9tBFfwMoPavUEM59u5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087231',6.8,14281,'en','The Falcon and the Snowman','The true story of a disillusioned military contractor employee and his drug pusher childhood friend who became walk-in spies for the Soviet Union.','/oDeaorrKpjzYgH1c9ePoJ3x9qvw.jpg','1985-01-25',132,'Released','They came from the best of families. And they committed the worst of crimes.','The Falcon and the Snowman',26578,4.1175,6.4,'pvI9A8NGpdg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9005,_binary '\0','/kKoiL1jeLFqqH2StTKvFnT54exu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087233',6.5,17002,'en','Falling in Love','During shopping for Christmas, Frank and Molly run into each other. This fleeting short moment will start to change their lives, when they recognize each other months later in the train home and have a good time together. Although both are married and Frank has two little kids, they meet more and more often, their friendship becoming the most precious thing in their lives.','/c8Ti4tOwAmY6RhUxV9JsXl2W4l7.jpg','1984-11-21',106,'Released','Sometimes magic is the only thing that\'s real.','Falling in Love',52744,5.0743,6.649,'bOFyOQ_qkqA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9006,_binary '\0','/8Mgk4N6ge4x4wVblJY8LUS7zGcG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087243',4.8,1934,'en','Fatal Games','The young athletes of Falcon Academy are training hard to earn their place in the nationals. But when these burgeoning sports stars start disappearing one after the other, Dr. Jordine and his team - who’ve started plying their athletes with new and untested performance-enhancing drugs - are baffled.','/3Ws6JO9PwToGTfxj6X41rZBoh8a.jpg','1984-01-01',88,'Released','There can only be one winner in this contest. Their mistake was to even compete!','Fatal Games',30706,2.0642,4.43,'GQQ6EOBe5Mg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9007,_binary '\0','/iei7d1QcCgRpmIaCrKAVGPTaBHq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087247',5.8,5284,'en','Fear City','Strippers in Manhattan are being stalked and murdered by a psycho. A hard-nosed police detective and a conflicted ex-boxer-turned-private-eye, hired by the strip club owners, set out to find him before he strikes again.','/qVcumIAhNCZ9xGYEk0ByLV9Hwbd.jpg','1984-07-18',95,'Released','No showgirl is safe on the streets of... Fear City.','Fear City',18680,3.0378,5.419,'ey-dJUeppXU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9008,_binary '\0','/t28kCBe0hngvt4ViIsnrwNBrhq8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087250',6.4,2047,'fr','La Femme publique','An inexperienced young actress is invited to play a role in a film based on Dostoyevsky\'s \'The Possessed\'. The film director, a Czech immigrant in Paris, takes over her life, and in a short time she is unable to draw the line between acting and reality. She winds up playing a real-life role posing as the dead wife of another Czech immigrant, who is manipulated by the filmmaker into commiting a political assassination.','/5MXaIoOKGfxanGqxgrLgv0OtV39.jpg','1984-06-16',113,'Released',NULL,'The Public Woman',70410,4.0931,6,'GGncTncww1A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9009,_binary '\0','/svz9gu0NKUFD5Fs2wjazdLIQPUA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087258',2.4,3606,'en','Final Justice','Due to his violent past, Deputy Sheriff Thomas Jefferson Geronimo III has been transferred to a rural outpost. When two thugs kill the sheriff, Geronimo shoots one, and the other vows revenge. The thug turns out to be a mob boss, and the court orders Geronimo to extradite him back to Sicily. When their plane is hijacked, the adversaries find their roles reversed.','/b44vKrjk2f9PTYf13C3S4yJVY5T.jpg','1984-10-28',90,'Released','Joe Don Baker is looking for trouble.','Final Justice',31128,1.2462,2.744,'S_xpmwaZMHI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9010,_binary '\0','/pwcBFd39mbFhiBwSvUkjCua5fmy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087260',5.3,1241,'en','Finders Keepers','On the run from the police and a female roller derby team, scam artist Michael Rangeloff steals a coffin and boards a train, pretending to be a soldier bringing home a dead war buddy. He gets more than he bargained for from the train and the coffin.','/a9yuKKkZcJfGFN0d4TINsk1QwEL.jpg','1984-05-18',96,'Released','Michael O\'Keefe, Beverly D\'Angelo, David Wayne and Louis Gossett, Jr. on a coast to coast joy ride.','Finders Keepers',5508,2.0505,5.471,'ORgnBVwLGQo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9011,_binary '\0','/tGvV6JZJxOh7yTRfcR5Hvo22aln.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087262',6.1,39993,'en','Firestarter','Charlene \"Charlie\" McGee has the amazing ability to start fires with just a glance. Can her psychic power and the love of her father save her from the threatening government agency which wants to destroy her?','/2ux5lqNuibd8eOkwwUhzfzAJBqD.jpg','1984-05-11',114,'Released','She has the power to set objects on fire with just one glance!','Firestarter',11495,3.8833,6.254,'DfcuksWVRt8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9012,_binary '\0','/5WOfB6oiiiJCSQwBtXKCmwKK9PV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087263',6.2,3466,'en','Firstborn','Because he\'s the oldest, Jake has been the man of the house, since his parents divorce. When Mom starts seeing Sam, who always seems to be trying some new way to get rich quick, and declares he\'s the man of the house now, Jake puts up with it. Until he discovers Sam\'s illegal activities.','/99jvmDl1fmXLeeEow06zi88PqA6.jpg','1984-10-26',103,'Released','Jake Livingston had to grow up fast... because his mother didn\'t.','Firstborn',54752,2.1907,6.1,'4AI-B6vBGVA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9013,_binary '\0','/uP380OUxtBQEizzKftV8e8abvLO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087265',6.2,6594,'en','The Flamingo Kid','Brooklyn teenager Jeffrey Willis, thoroughly unhappy with his modest homestead, embraces the other-world aspects of his summer job at the posh Flamingo Club. He spurns his father in favor of the patronage of smooth-talking Phil Brody and is seduced by the ample bikini charms of club member Carla Samson. But thanks to a couple of late-summer hard lessons, the teen eventually realizes that family should always come first.','/hNCYkAXB9WIQBABXTV6Vs9kFrLY.jpg','1984-12-21',100,'Released','A legend in his own neighborhood.','The Flamingo Kid',25010,2.6166,6,'Kf6kjsSgd38','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9014,_binary '\0','/7NDDwYGy6AqhUcdjvWERPZMaVIW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087268',6.4,3548,'en','Flashpoint','Two Texas border guards find a jeep buried in the desert, with a skeleton, a scoped rifle, and a box with $800,000 in cash. Before they decide whether to keep the money or report it, they privately investigate the clues and unravel a decades old mystery.','/xAMzujbmShAG6W13z71ov5wnfTA.jpg','1984-04-19',94,'Released','They drink together. Work together. Party together. They live for trouble. Now they\'ve uncovered a secret and their troubles are just beginning.','Flashpoint',47825,1.9012,6.197,'e1MRZiqq4CY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9015,_binary '\0','/t8n5mvmnJUYJkyfOPWYEtvqePuM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087277',6.6,103171,'en','Footloose','When teenager Ren and his family move from big-city Chicago to a small town in the West, he\'s in for a real case of culture shock after discovering he\'s living in a place where music and dancing are illegal.','/9JEDjBCXCx3eKTSkXwispf0UN3O.jpg','1984-02-17',107,'Released','The music is on his side.','Footloose',1788,7.7149,6.695,'xxOuSqokKok','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9016,_binary '\0','/zpkSkHXm81jlFgXmTmmGQ4TuUzo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087280',6.6,12383,'da','Forbrydelsens element','Fisher, an ex-detective, decides to take one final case when a mysterious serial killer claims the lives of several young girls. Fisher, unable to find the culprit, turns to Osbourne, a writer who was once respected for his contributions to the field of criminology. Fisher begins to use Osbourne\'s technique, which involves empathizing with serial killers; however, as the detective becomes increasingly engrossed in this method, things take a disturbing turn.','/sfg5KUOdR4bfoPiDf63LVG7mlfw.jpg','1984-05-14',104,'Released',NULL,'The Element of Crime',9063,2.5875,6.4,'yWb81mBw6XE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9017,_binary '\0','/trU1I9Jn88uCZVIHTRVgF5wJ7uX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087284',6.3,1232,'fr','Fort Saganne','In 1911, a willful and determined man from peasant stock named Charles Saganne enlists in the military and is assigned to the Sahara Desert under the aristocratic Colonel Dubreuilh.','/8srIfF14GCPwaLUrOtVT4Y6tMcw.jpg','1984-05-11',180,'Released',NULL,'Fort Saganne',4274,2.1301,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9018,_binary '\0','/2bbEE2aLu47unsPJwS57UZW0YF4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087298',6,67561,'en','Friday the 13th: The Final Chapter','After his revival in a hospital morgue, Jason fixes his vengeful attention on the Jarvis family and a group of hitherto carefree teenagers.','/1J7zudfR3VLPwAf9lK5YPfSu0n6.jpg','1984-04-13',91,'Released','Three times before you have felt the terror, known the madness, lived the horror. But this is the one you\'ve been screaming for.','Friday the 13th: The Final Chapter',9730,8.9164,6.132,'8zcPf9fuDPg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9019,_binary '\0','/z9EtVguD5WZRupYMD9TSwdthVjk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087301',8.2,1739,'zh','芙蓉镇','Based on a novel by the same name written by Gu Hua, a melodrama about the life and travails of a young woman who lives through the turmoil of the Cultural Revolution.','/7risyxU8FhHjjQ5jL0UdQiW3Oyj.jpg','1987-03-05',164,'Released',NULL,'Hibiscus Town',122973,2.7787,7.922,'LYVb5Ae8hKc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9020,_binary '\0','/8v21imc2RgPmSuTrBSGib60HkFe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087313',6.4,2081,'en','Garbo Talks','When New York accountant Gilbert Rolfe finds out his mother has a brain tumor, he is devastated. His incorrigible mother, Estelle, has one last wish: to meet the great Greta Garbo. Gilbert, wanting to do this last thing for her, sets out on a wild goose chase through the streets of New York City to track down the iconic star, at the expense of his personal life and much to the chagrin of his wife, Lisa. Can he find Garbo before it\'s too late?','/eanplWrug7tnMtEXdB3d5joqDdT.jpg','1984-10-12',103,'Released','Sometimes you can catch a star...','Garbo Talks',105404,1.5242,6.3,'X6xZnpVmQL8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9021,_binary '\0','/jigM91a1Q4fj7wjDoI7Bd1hvvCY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087317',7.4,1372,'de','Gasherbrum - Der leuchtende Berg','Werner Herzog follows mountaineers Hans Kammerlander and Reinhold Messner during their expedition into climbing the Gasherbrum mountains, which has some of the most difficult peaks to be conquered, and they\'ll do it without the use of oxygen tanks. Herzog also takes some time to hear about their past experiences with other mountains, their personal tragedies and the reasons why they are so involved with such activity.','/h8ISYTosbDEYNEgml7lPhbr8Etw.jpg','1985-03-09',45,'Released',NULL,'The Dark Glow of the Mountains',139945,1.6756,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9022,_binary '\0','/onJ2tY8Bja4JUjhiD81Ze0Uj7IX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087328',7.5,2053,'bn','ঘরে বাইরে','In the early 1900s, Nikhilesh, a wealthy Westernized Hindu in colonial East Bengal, feels compelled to test the love of his wife, Bimala. He introduces her to his friend Sandip, a politician agitating against British rule, and Bimala is equally taken with both Sandip\'s anti-colonial fervor and the man himself. Personal and political tensions subsequently flare as the now assertive Bimala has to make a crucial decision.','/vEU1eKvWPzzdMAcwzXjsH69dKro.jpg','1985-01-04',140,'Released','TRADITION VERSUS MODERNISM','The Home and the World',42092,1.0388,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9023,_binary '\0','/c6yfABGVKuB5cjoOwdX4AJMlzUz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087332',7.8,490739,'en','Ghostbusters','After losing their university jobs, three parapsychologists start a ghost-catching business in New York City and uncover a supernatural threat that could destroy the world.','/7E8nLijS9AwwUEPu2oFYOVKhdFA.jpg','1984-06-08',105,'Released','They\'re here to save the world.','Ghostbusters',620,19.6879,7.496,'kQxMJFyap8k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9024,_binary '\0','/fsMlT0nRLupETI3Ucfd941taUkm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087336',4.9,2371,'en','Girls Nite Out','The students of DeWitt University are preparing themselves for a night of fun and frolics in the form of an all-night scavenger hunt. Little do they know that they are in fact the ones being hunted.','/zWW7IF7klwhvmWXk2JBxnNHbXWM.jpg','1982-06-20',96,'Released','They all went in, but only a few got out!','Girls Nite Out',59738,1.9455,4.7,'4ahtMtOZjRo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9025,_binary '\0','/5FT6bnsqsWbk4hlK5YUTHIbOEOe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087337',5.2,1870,'en','Give My Regards to Broad Street','When the mastertape of McCartney\'s latest album is misplaced, he must discover its whereabouts in less than 24 hours or else risk losing his recording company to the lowlife Mr. Rath.','/ecR5d9T1CpFNMtveQhXwzjt215i.jpg','1984-11-28',109,'Released','Six million dollars says they won\'t find Harry by midnight.','Give My Regards to Broad Street',34748,1.893,5.1,'RUKEkRP3LXc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9026,_binary '\0','/5zH1u5XwGVVW89AQRNyyBolIR3x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087344',6.1,7386,'ja','Godzilla 1985','Originally released in Japan as \"The Return of Godzilla\" in 1984, this is the heavily re-edited, re-titled \"Godzilla 1985\". Adding in new footage of Raymond Burr, this 16th Godzilla film ignores all previous sequels and serves as a direct follow-up to the 1956 \"Godzilla King of the Monsters\", which also featured scenes with Burr edited into 1954\'s \"Godzilla\". This film restores the darker tone of the original, as we witness the nuclear destruction of giant lizard terrorizing Japan.','/blKtf1L6LA3mFW8aVJzxnaI8CLn.jpg','1985-08-23',87,'Released','Prepare yourself: the greatest star of all has returned.','Godzilla 1985',39256,3.3091,6.8,'27OaNDxUmEE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9027,_binary '\0','/gZTbDaWubQvzpSUwthuWTeXu91P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087349',8.6,2581,'ka','ცისფერი მთები ანუ დაუჯერებელი ამბავი','An author - a passive young man - enters the Soviet-controlled bureaucracy of Georgia attempting to get his novel published only to be neglected and compartmentalized at every turn.','/rUC1JXRQ0VuxCk5xYS98VLqbAy3.jpg','1983-12-18',97,'Released',NULL,'Blue Mountains, or an Unbelievable Story',142798,1.6595,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9028,_binary '\0','/sQFV0SrWQtDQFtcZg3FFAwRGmF1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087359',5.5,2568,'en','Grandview, U.S.A.','Life in the small town of Grandview, Illinois is one that is just like any other city or town. Tim Pearson, soon to be graduating high school wants to go to Florida to study oceanography. He meets Michelle \"Mike\" Cody and is attracted to her. She runs the local Demolition Derby place. Ernie \"Slam\" Webster is one of the drivers in the derby whose wife is cheating on him and wants to later on be with Mike. Tim falls for Mike and a big love triangle is about to happen.','/zjwdW85VNLuNxAutlGRHtoY0srR.jpg','1984-08-03',97,'Released','Where dreams have a funny way of coming true.','Grandview, U.S.A.',84116,3.9473,5.8,'LrzTpelAFVA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9029,_binary '\0','/5UX6M0aEphiW6Xmy5rpYX75glbo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087363',7.3,277482,'en','Gremlins','After receiving an exotic small animal as a Christmas gift, a young man inadvertently breaks three important rules concerning his new pet, which unleashes a horde of malevolently mischievous creatures on a small town.','/6m0F7fsXjQvUbCZrPWcJNrjvIui.jpg','1984-06-08',106,'Released','Cute. Clever. Mischievous. Intelligent. Dangerous.','Gremlins',927,16.9542,7.1,'26TJGkNzceA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9030,_binary '\0','/m7kARS3kMIEFaTtTeSY8w8GHtaF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087365',6.4,21458,'en','Greystoke: The Legend of Tarzan, Lord of the Apes','A shipping disaster in the 19th Century has stranded a man and woman in the wilds of Africa. The lady is pregnant, and gives birth to a son in their tree house. Soon after, a family of apes stumble across the house and in the ensuing panic, both parents are killed. A female ape takes the tiny boy as a replacement for her own dead infant, and raises him as her son. Twenty years later, Captain Phillippe D\'Arnot discovers the man who thinks he is an ape. Evidence in the tree house leads him to believe that he is the direct descendant of the Earl of Greystoke, and thus takes it upon himself to return the man to civilization.','/rdtEIdzqJTVhSLsjuR4U9t1KKxp.jpg','1984-03-30',143,'Released',NULL,'Greystoke: The Legend of Tarzan, Lord of the Apes',11002,5.2974,6.4,'eMLj1H_43uU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9031,_binary '\0','/h7BsTTniQ9UqLhoFuviILYwongH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087373',7.5,2346,'fr','La guerre des tuques','As the Christmas holidays begin, a group of 10 war-obsessed kids have a wave of inspiration: What if they spend the next two weeks engaged in a simulated war, armed only with shields, wooden swords, snowballs, and a fierce sense of competition? With a bounty chest waiting for the winners, the two sides gradually grow in size, and the war grows in importance, taking over all aspects of their lives.','/qcSY8yGixq5CgHmbljISWNDAkfy.jpg','1984-10-03',92,'Released','War, peace, love and honor...in the world of children','The Dog Who Stopped the War',37168,1.7218,7,'aMVKFaN9vCE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9032,_binary '\0','/gRVjQ5c4Pvxaeni50zr67hmg0uZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087377',7,1342,'ja','逆噴射家族','Shortly after moving to the suburbs, the Kobayashis start to come undone. Convinced a family curse is at the root of their erratic behavior, the man of the house takes it upon himself to course-correct before it takes the last of their sanity.','/2MlayGlNRFGr3uH4J4zpkjuurYT.jpg','1984-06-24',107,'Released','They\'re just like yours.','The Crazy Family',67255,1.9277,7.1,'6pgF5y1LVhM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9033,_binary '\0','/9RFB5EfVoJk7dR5i3Buk8kRe1z8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087385',4.9,4770,'en','Hardbodies','Three middle-aged daddies visit California to have a marvelous time at the beach. When they learn that a nice apartment and an expensive cabriolet isn\'t enough for them to score with the chicks, they employ a student to help them. At first he\'s as disgusted of them and his job as his girlfriend, but soon they find out how to use the situation to everyone\'s benefit.','/9z7lbMRQSbcohiPV7WzMbTqhbnI.jpg','1984-05-04',88,'Released','If you don\'t know what they are, you don\'t know what you\'re missing.','Hardbodies',52736,2.6555,4.8,'iIpfCCPYpmk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9034,_binary '\0','/nIWyiZD1fYXytFoLzcM5GWoTiE0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087386',5.8,2676,'en','Harry & Son','Widower Harry Keach is a construction worker who was raised to appreciate the importance of working for a living. He takes a dim view of his sensitive son Howard\'s lackadaisical lifestyle and has a strained relationship with his daughter Nina as he does not approve of her husband. When Harry is fired from his job, his life changes drastically as he is made to focus on the relationships around him.','/kl9yUlWRBEyXNGIXav1WIRBy5te.jpg','1984-03-02',117,'Released','Two men with nothing in common... except the blood in their veins.','Harry & Son',91767,1.8759,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9035,_binary '\0','/ylrd1QeNvaRXSmXwDLqhaGJ6S9K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087414',7,11597,'en','The Hit','Ten years after ratting on his old mobster friends in exchange for personal immunity, two hit men drive a hardened criminal to Paris for his execution. However, while on the way, whatever can go wrong, does go wrong.','/hKNIz9iids9uPyEpmJjLFM96KXI.jpg','1984-09-07',98,'Released','Even bad guys have bad days.','The Hit',19621,2.5299,6.453,'xyNVTkemjgQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9036,_binary '\0','/rQAx8h4Hh1bgsF9Mp8eytt5XoOX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087425',5.1,4671,'en','Hot Dog... The Movie','When a hopeful young American hot-dogger goes pole-to-pole with an arrogant Austrian pro, the snow really starts to fly! But as hot as it is on the mountain, it gets even hotter off when the pro\'s ex-girlfriend sets her eyes on the new blood. Who\'ll win the competition and the girl? Only a race to end all races can determine which skier can really cut the mustard!','/qJ4tVNjjapCLigrVJi3ZXNX6xvB.jpg','1984-01-13',96,'Released','There\'s more to do in snow than ski.','Hot Dog... The Movie',21989,3.0148,4.9,'jxZEbFiL-aQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9037,_binary '\0','/6ja3HVez4A4XPNSMHhuOiu2UTXm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087428',5.8,9864,'en','The Hotel New Hampshire','Over the course of several years beginning in the 1950s, a man and his oddball family run hotels in New England and Vienna, as unexpected events change their lives forever.','/9XGGGniMtBqhox7JAV5JujlUqFz.jpg','1984-03-09',110,'Released','The successes and failures of an American family.','The Hotel New Hampshire',11308,3.4177,5.663,'9tZt0NJhXMk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9038,_binary '\0','/jMRNIpiAKxkbYd4c5bOE34gW5FV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087432',6.7,2750,'is','Hrafninn flýgur','Vikings pillage Ireland, seeking silver and slaves, slaying men and women in the process. A young boy is spared when a Viking takes pity on him instead of killing him. Twenty years later the boy returns to Iceland take his revenge.','/5o5JDusORcQnpLiPONakdIbIQEs.jpg','1984-02-04',109,'Released',NULL,'When the Raven Flies',16852,1.2224,6.6,'EGbd-rprQRs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9039,_binary '\0','/9a8rTHiVxVphC02qqz7lTpjvT4s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087433',7.1,2808,'zh','黄土地','A communist soldier is sent to a remote region of China in order to collect folk songs. Staying with a peasant family (a widower with two small children), he discovers a community whose way of life is completely alien to him, but he gradually wins their trust.','/i9zxjL9cLgBysC8YR3BTPlppn1Z.jpg','1984-08-19',91,'Released','After tradition… comes revolution.','Yellow Earth',92990,2.0156,7.2,'sIhuNRtGHtQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9040,_binary '\0','/3r1cDI6CsdaLX43eACto9trx6Ey.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087436',4.6,1745,'en','Hundra','Born in a tribe of fierce warrior women, Hundra has been raised to despise the influence of men. An archer, fighter and sword fighter, Hundra is superior to any male. Hundra finds her family slain and takes a vow of revenge until one day she meets her match.','/2A1kb3iJel9RZ0X3VJpXAQ4aWzC.jpg','1983-07-23',109,'Released','A Woman who could not be tamed!','Hundra',48242,1.6326,4.8,'uMcNR2DUhwI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9041,_binary '\0','/3QtpB5RxBcz385UHN6IxjJXVBvG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087451',5.7,12877,'en','The Ice Pirates','In the not too distant future, where by far the most precious commodity in the galaxy is water. The last surviving water planet was somehow removed to the unreachable centre of the galaxy at the end of the galactic trade wars. The galaxy is ruled by an evil emperor presiding over a trade oligarchy that controls all mining and sale of ice from asteroids and comets.','/tv2iZbQYWwKcWOUWVFxOhcchKZT.jpg','1984-03-16',94,'Released','A totally SPACED adventure! ...You have to be there to see it.','The Ice Pirates',10179,3.98,5.658,'H5gHZWxxVhk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9042,_binary '\0','/n3cFRS59vaXIE97lZKrtCc9H518.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087452',6.2,6589,'en','Iceman','A team of Arctic researchers find a 40,000 year-old man frozen in ice and bring him back to life. Anthropologist Dr. Stanley Shephard wants to befriend the Iceman and learn about the man\'s past while Dr. Diane Brady and her surgical team want to discover the secret that will allow man to live in a frozen state.','/4HllE4JWVl3YbaWKmHXsBVkH4Sr.jpg','1984-04-13',100,'Released','A stone age man in a space age world... ...All he wants is a friend.','Iceman',24749,3.005,6.2,'rKmSnrUqN9M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9043,_binary '\0','/yDjGRibGF6O58HCtjIeKeO49Nv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087464',5.8,2024,'en','Impulse','After a small earthquake in a tiny, quiet town, local citizens start to exhibit bizarre, violent and self-destructive behaviour.','/80SZWcSwdAAym8mHN71RTL3l3JI.jpg','1984-09-28',91,'Released','The madness inside us all.','Impulse',14157,2.3855,5.291,'NaIWtTj6c_M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9044,_binary '\0','/f133nWlU6yUkZqqwcCXCbTEJWHr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087469',7.5,573803,'en','Indiana Jones and the Temple of Doom','After arriving in India, Indiana Jones is asked by a desperate village to find a mystical stone. He agrees – and stumbles upon a secret cult plotting a terrible plan in the catacombs of an ancient palace.','/gpdVNUaa4LhRMLfJOPj1AZdhAZ3.jpg','1984-05-23',118,'Released','If adventure has a name... it must be Indiana Jones.','Indiana Jones and the Temple of Doom',87,22.4827,7.309,'WBdyLyijZhU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9045,_binary '\0','/5gv7uaqi8sNH32n87vwOyTZ2GMV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087472',5.6,5192,'en','The Initiation','An amnesiac sorority member who has been plagued by a recurring nightmare is stalked alongside other coeds by a killer in a deserted department store where they are completing a hazing ritual.','/fO5wtb8CIrYNTzq8wJ3ZjowMFuw.jpg','1984-12-07',93,'Released','Be young, stay young ... and die young.','The Initiation',63360,2.0879,5.5,'jSkHQZmde2I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9046,_binary '\0','/cEKi2NlvzV3avL00XyZlwRfRBaT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087480',5.1,2576,'en','Invitation to Hell','Family man Matt Winslow accepts a new job in Silicon Valley and quickly finds that his associates are obsessed with a mysterious local country club whose manager, Jessica Jones, holds sway over the community.','/fTYftDbvVv9U2tQibt2cmSGTXCE.jpg','1984-05-24',100,'Released','Your nightmares will never be the same again.','Invitation to Hell',81009,2.2769,5.1,'V_gUTI0sU8g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9047,_binary '\0','/ualoh6ldiiAZU4A1thzmF58mGaW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087481',7.1,13049,'it','Non c\'è due senza quattro','A stuntman and a saxophonist stand in for two billionaires threatened by killers.','/eARQ5FY1Z1mSPgoyLJKJdl75RxJ.jpg','1984-10-19',100,'Released',NULL,'Double Trouble',8833,4.7753,7,'67dXfeWvE1s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9048,_binary '\0','/c08CoaUvRGgJLgiRtN9Idc8H06L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087482',5.8,3660,'en','Irreconcilable Differences','Alternating between the past and the present, a precocious little girl sues her selfish, career-driven parents for emancipation, surprising them both.','/jBr9FR2pUpjOERgxljxaNtpIj9c.jpg','1984-09-28',113,'Released','They\'ve got everything... including a 10 year old daughter who\'s suing them for divorce.','Irreconcilable Differences',47874,2.1098,5.6,'sRjOCIkC6YA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9049,_binary '\0','/dkl22XWm3QESKRdtUtdmSyPzmFc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087488',8.3,1244,'hu','István, a király','István, a király (\"Stephen, the King\") is a Hungarian rock opera written by Levente Szörényi (music) and János Bródy (lyrics), based on the life of Saint Stephen of Hungary. The storyline was based on the play Ezredforduló (Turn of the Millennium) by Miklós Boldizsár, who co-wrote the libretto. The opera was first staged in 1983 on an open-air stage in Budapest. This first performance was also made into a 1984 film, directed by Gábor Koltay, and its music released on an album. The musical became a smash hit and is still very popular in Hungary and among Hungarian minorities in neighboring countries.','/te2cpF0VyYgT4rmL3KGP4hfG1TF.jpg','1984-04-19',93,'Released',NULL,'Stephen, the King',168601,1.1693,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9050,_binary '\0','/dEzguwQUQAGoCFZRHdbmdTpMbr0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087507',6.5,17760,'en','Johnny Dangerously','An honest, goodhearted man is forced to turn to a life of crime to finance his neurotic mother\'s skyrocketing medical bills.','/1cvCWlLDt9cIWN3ZUI6UKgV210x.jpg','1984-12-21',90,'Released','Organized crime has never been this disorganized!','Johnny Dangerously',16806,3.1775,6.298,'BMVW8y8o11g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9051,_binary '\0','/2ZNd4eesz4i4ygbc5Ft3UYmsEuR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087513',4,1264,'en','Joy of Sex','Mistakenly believing that she has just weeks to live, teenager Leslie Hindenberg tries to lose her virginity before she dies.','/tEPG8OTQl7azJ9WCSTRGtNUbmyf.jpg','1984-08-03',93,'Released','Somewhere between virginity and senility lies paradise.','Joy of Sex',85509,2.3903,4.1,'gXcroiJ7_MU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9052,_binary '\0','/hTbz0rF2y70nSIiL8fV7Wo3Kbma.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087514',6.2,3369,'fr','Joyeuses Pâques','Chronic serial womanizer Stephane Margelle drops his wife Sophie off at the airport so she can go away for Easter weekend. He immediately picks up beautiful young Julie, who has just had a fight with her married boyfriend. He gets her back to his apartment and is preparing for a sexy weekend, when his wife suddenly returns home. He makes up a bizarre, on-the-spot, spur-of-the-moment story that the gorgeous girl is actually his long-lost daughter. Julie plays along, but this leads to a whole series of increasingly ridiculous lies and comical situations (such as when her real mother shows up).','/85SKkTXk5LzXvYdBQYnnWxdP47L.jpg','1984-10-24',94,'Released',NULL,'Happy Easter',40061,2.1744,5.928,'Q1XQqordpaI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9053,_binary '\0','/p1xyCWH3rzFID0EAHBo28VAnuwU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087520',6,1602,'fr','Le Jumeau','Matthias Duval is in love, but he can\'t choose between the two twin sisters Betty and Liz Kerner. To pick up the two sisters, he invents his own twin brother and will play both characters.','/2ctu39oPSwB9Wp2L1nwieZdBwOD.jpg','1984-10-10',104,'Released',NULL,'The Twin',39978,1.5603,6.09,'A0oXEofpNmI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9054,_binary '\0','/asYH7ASJQ1qAojXNIS6c4romKso.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087527',6.3,4806,'sv','Jönssonligan får guldfeber','Sickan has a new plan. This time, the gang are going to steal a small computer micro chip which contains a top secret plan of what the government intends to do with Sweden in the future. But, Wall-Enberg is also planning to steal the chip. The payment will be 55 million Swedish crowns in gold and diamonds to whoever can deliver the chip to the foreign investors. Who will grab hold of the chip, the Jönsson gang or Wall-Enberg?','/6tbPYgBRvgjxX4dAkgo5eNHR0bX.jpg','1984-10-19',101,'Released',NULL,'The Jönsson Gang Gets Gold Fever',37727,1.6723,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9055,_binary '\0','/pg2haJ0f3KJAdPLBEhalyf9yknA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087530',7.4,1320,'fa','کمال الملک','The movie chronicles the life of the famous painter Kamololmolk, and his relationship with various kings.','/sfTvR49WVAnsPmBbE5JLFzXyDwV.jpg','1984-11-09',122,'Released',NULL,'Kamalolmolk',486183,1.0323,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9056,_binary '\0','/shKWUHVNRl2lNQCGDbI09pH5Xxe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087537',7.8,3405,'it','Kaos','Five stories center on a werewolf, a feudal landlord, peasants, a ghost, and a mother and her sons.','/5iQSh2TM2Y8qOPT7LPjW6X7Qfat.jpg','1984-11-23',188,'Released',NULL,'Kaos',38164,1.5253,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9057,_binary '\0','/j1xaeJZOEOiVBD1rk3dg4YaAk23.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087538',7.4,274708,'en','The Karate Kid','New Jersey teen Daniel LaRusso moves to Los Angeles with his mother, and soon strikes up a relationship with Ali. He quickly finds himself the target of bullying by a group of thugs, led by Ali\'s ex-boyfriend Johnny, who study karate at the Cobra Kai dojo under ruthless sensei John Kreese. Fortunately, Daniel befriends Mr. Miyagi, an unassuming repairman who just happens to be a martial arts master himself. Miyagi takes Daniel under his wing, training him in a more compassionate form of karate for self-defense and, later, preparing him to compete against the brutal Cobra Kai.','/1mp4ViklKvA0WXXsNvNx0RBuiit.jpg','1984-06-22',127,'Released','He taught him the secret to karate lies in the mind and heart. Not in the hands.','The Karate Kid',1885,14.9833,7.23,'r_8Rw16uscg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9058,_binary '\0','/ulVUa2MvnJAjAeRt7h23FFJVRKH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087544',8,199363,'ja','風の谷のナウシカ','After a global war, the seaside kingdom known as the Valley of the Wind remains one of the last strongholds on Earth untouched by a poisonous jungle and the powerful insects that guard it. Led by the courageous Princess Nausicaä, the people of the Valley engage in an epic struggle to restore the bond between humanity and Earth.','/tcrkfB8SRPQCgwI88hQScua6nxh.jpg','1984-03-11',95,'Released','Flee, fly, foe, fun! Here\'s an adventure for everyone.','Warriors of the Wind',81,16.4051,7.941,'6zhLBe319KE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9059,_binary '\0','/spDVc3kjAOp7gYVqgZnZQzEMtK2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087545',7.1,1324,'ja','家族ゲーム','A sendup of the stereotypical Japanese family: dad is a salaryman jerk, unable to relate to anyone; mom is a hopeless housewife; the older son is a moderate academic success; but the younger son is a rebellious goof-off for whom a tutor must be hired. The tutor proceeds to blow the entire family apart.','/9znuGejLUDldMZNM2F0wSEu4zQn.jpg','1983-05-04',107,'Released',NULL,'The Family Game',117129,1.5009,6.8,'308ozh1YkOE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9060,_binary '\0','/c7OeJd34rc9bI1DXqd4ucb1wVrf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087553',7.8,64331,'en','The Killing Fields','New York Times reporter Sydney Schanberg is on assignment covering the Cambodian Civil War, with the help of local interpreter Dith Pran and American photojournalist Al Rockoff. When the U.S. Army pulls out amid escalating violence, Schanberg makes exit arrangements for Pran and his family. Pran, however, tells Schanberg he intends to stay in Cambodia to help cover the unfolding story — a decision he may regret as the Khmer Rouge rebels move in.','/cX6Bv7natnZwQjsV9bLL8mmWjkS.jpg','1984-11-23',142,'Released','Here, only the silent survive.','The Killing Fields',625,6.3172,7.5,'mTfqXmVVjPU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9061,_binary '\0','/bhJwUazhSk735vkZLkmrBeqDxSH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087578',7,17524,'cn','快餐車','Cousins Thomas and David, owners of a mobile restaurant, team up with their friend Moby, a bumbling private detective, to save the beautiful Sylvia, a pickpocket.','/zCii0fXuI7xzroEEG1KBJDlqu0O.jpg','1984-08-17',108,'Released','Not since Don Quixote has Spain had so much fun!','Wheels on Meals',11205,6.5812,6.873,'_BUE_KEJ6UA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9062,_binary '\0','/idiObYae7RaWeQv3waFl8dgHewt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087589',5.8,2964,'en','Lassiter','A handsome jewel thief is arrested and in order to avoid prison, must break into the heavily guarded German Embassy to steal millions in gems.','/2VUCOHBd6YwtzJpZrYx25R1bCNZ.jpg','1984-02-17',100,'Released','When the law has a job they can\'t handle... they need a man outside the law.','Lassiter',56821,2.7872,5.433,'EEvc3gsetww','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9063,_binary '\0','/nK0PbzrByeEggsiYEqw7HtAl9Zr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087592',5.6,2982,'en','The Last Horror Film','A New York taxi driver stalks a beautiful actress attending the Cannes Film Festival, which coincides with a series of violent killings of the lady\'s friends.','/sle6lVqKK2Dq0kzX3Gr0GKmlmtu.jpg','1982-08-12',87,'Released','She\'s Dying To Be In His Film…','The Last Horror Film',57901,2.837,5.25,'0_3dDjyHGG0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9064,_binary '\0','/tw0YQznBe0WdQrQDzQpshq0LOP1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087597',6.7,50362,'en','The Last Starfighter','Video game expert Alex Rogan finds himself transported to another planet after conquering the video game The Last Starfighter, only to find out it was just a test. He was recruited to join the team of best Starfighters to defend their world from the attack.','/A7oAHTjtYnIEQjJs62IONRufooq.jpg','1984-07-13',101,'Released','Alex Rogan was a small town boy with big dreams. But in his wildest dreams, he never suspected that tonight he would become The Last Starfighter.','The Last Starfighter',11884,5.2443,6.606,'4R2UFlSc4mI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9065,_binary '\0','/cQN81yk6v4StOZadSQXkedpeMDg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087606',7.3,2471,'ka','ამბავი სურამის ციხისა','A film version of a well-known Georgian folk-tale. A young boy has to be immured into the walls of a fortress in order to stop it from crumbling to pieces.','/kbgvvcLwQyuH8QPVdite1vvEbCK.jpg','1985-12-01',83,'Released',NULL,'The Legend of the Suram Fortress',103590,1.8541,6.8,'Gdg9BGhSUSY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9066,_binary '\0','/tdiaASUze9AhO35ne3law87FLgd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087616',4.5,1778,'es','Leviatán','Victor Raven, a famous rock star, returns to his childhood home to shoot a music video. Believing his presence is responsible for the return of a monstrous hound that killed folks when he was kid, the locals decide to do something violent about it.','/sUcJ2Rzy1qp7VdSlRFQDKTrD4iz.jpg','1988-08-16',84,'Released','The fear… the nightmare… the terror… they will never forget it!','Monster Dog',87148,1.9921,5,'pJ986wFa1Vk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9067,_binary '\0','/uAeREr76Zs4zKDnElMgcTeQCgPq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087617',5.5,1221,'en','License to Kill','A grieving family whose daughter was killed in a car crash with a drunken driver is outraged and frustrated as they encounter the inevitable bureaucratic delays in bringing the case to trial. Once in the courtroom, they are horror-stricken as the young, hard-pressed district attorney seems unable to overcome the technicalities and maneuverings that the driver\'s attorney uses to keep his client out of jail and still on the streets as a legal driver. When the judge is forced to rule time and again in favor of the defense, it appears that the driver might escape punishment altogether.','/zGIb8i63KLjNzKEUuHE6tdaSDjh.jpg','1986-12-16',96,'Released','He is their only hope for justice.','License to Kill',48733,1.7272,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9068,_binary '\0','/pEmHRVpaE1Btys9VE5AgiXog7V3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087622',6.1,8763,'nl','De Lift','A lift technician finds himself drawn into a web of mystery and peril as he investigates the perplexing deadly accidents occurring in the elevators of a new office building.','/33b8JpZPoECFj4dB1U6rhbl8AHo.jpg','1983-05-11',95,'Released','Take the stairs, take the stairs. For God\'s sake, take the Stairs!!!','The Lift',11417,2.5063,5.8,'7Qei7UP4BQU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9069,_binary '\0','/njFkzgo1yWVFdgizQag56pVMKlL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087629',6.1,2784,'en','The Little Drummer Girl','An American actress with a penchant for lying is forceably recruited by Mossad, the Israeli intelligence agency, to trap a Palestinian bomber, by pretending to be the girlfriend of his dead brother.','/5KuqrUbp4YfAWNtmtMEat8tCN19.jpg','1984-10-19',130,'Released','She will become their most deadly weapon. As long as they can make her fall in love.','The Little Drummer Girl',32088,2.3992,5.6,'92r3FMn99ow','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9070,_binary '\0','/tthLxMtg6Mq3JayQBkIhW0RhlEI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087631',7.8,1275,'en','Little House: The Last Farewell','While Charles and Caroline are visiting Walnut Grove, the townspeople learn that a land development tycoon has acquired title to all the land in Hero Township. They are inspired by Laura to vent their anger at this injustice.','/85ymymFvoCPK1WxXjCrcbGnqQD0.jpg','1984-02-06',100,'Released',NULL,'Little House: The Last Farewell',472797,2.0898,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9071,_binary '\0','/l6w9H8tS3eK9zTBpJiy01jkKgCn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087635',6.2,8248,'en','The Lonely Guy','A writer for a greeting card company learns the true meaning of loneliness when he comes home to find his girlfriend in bed with another man.','/y6HWtKt6m41SMZuUeFcs94nWfHs.jpg','1984-01-27',90,'Released','Meet Larry Hubbard …lonely guy','The Lonely Guy',27171,3.804,6.212,'QawfWX6FcgE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9072,_binary '\0','/gxo0Tw1MUy2eo3s1VLfdN5ebt8G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087644',7.6,7568,'en','Love Streams','Two closely-bound, emotionally wounded siblings reunite after years apart.','/c5uyQfWvzCVsCHL13J5JBZ61SQJ.jpg','1984-03-22',141,'Released','She loved too much. He didn\'t love anyone. One fine day, their paths met.','Love Streams',52109,2.9152,7.217,'X1HKmvSICFE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9073,_binary '\0','/7qhcCzR62VqT6i3iMuzi47MOhGN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087650',7.8,6521,'ru','Любовь и голуби','In a remote Siberian village, a work injury sends Vasily Kuziakin on a paid trip to a Black Sea resort as compensation. There, he meets femme fatale Raisa Zaharovna and decides to stay with her. Such is the beginning of a new life for him, exciting and strange, but lacking his home, his wife and children, and his pigeons.','/njP3HZQpCyI9vDyVAHjYqMKdYNC.jpg','1984-01-07',107,'Released',NULL,'Love and Pigeons',32334,2.0714,7.572,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9074,_binary '\0','/f1MwrnVB8eQyeJc3wQV7k1sZsz1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087660',7.6,3792,'ja','超時空要塞マクロス 愛・おぼえていますか','It is A.D. 2009 and the human race is caught in a war between giant humanoids, male Zentrans and female Meltrans. Returning from the edge of our solar system after making a space fold, the SDF-1 Macross makes the long journey back to Earth with survivors of South Ataria Island.','/oxGCI4H0ANXD8YoXnt3ZmjTjNIM.jpg','1984-07-21',114,'Released','Explore the outer limits of imagination where humans battle a race of giant bionoids.','Macross: Do You Remember Love?',14132,3.4786,7.2,'uY4fme_AvW4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9075,_binary '\0','/osaRpol64esMWnFGSRWL8t8dfK5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087666',5.6,1770,'en','Making the Grade','Lazy preppie Palmer Woodrow hires street-smart Eddie Keaton to go to school for him while he lives it up in Europe. Eddie falls in love with preppie gal Tracey, upsetting Biff, the Hoover Academy bully. When his bookie from the old neighborhood, Dice, comes to collect on Eddie\'s gambling debts and Palmer returns early from Europe, the scheme slowly starts to unravel. Soon, Eddie can\'t even tell whose side he\'s really on.','/mihPxIkGvGPzDgi1fMrE6cx5Ykq.jpg','1984-05-18',105,'Released','If you can\'t make it...fake it!','Making the Grade',55727,1.6234,5.1,'-4hdQUQ5VrA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9076,_binary '\0','/aaxOd39HAp9UyZBBIbtWWd1LUp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087677',6.9,3068,'sv','Mannen från Mallorca','On 13 December (St Lucy\'s Day), a bandit daringly robs a crowded post office. Within a fortnight, two witnesses are dead. Vice cops Johansson and Jarnebring, the first to the scene of the crime, pursue all leads and identify a suspect, an arrogant member of the elite secret police, assigned to guard the country\'s Minister of Justice. Just as they think they\'ve tightened the noose around the suspect, loose ends appear, witnesses lose certainty, alibis arise, and even the cops doubt what they\'ve seen. Who\'s protecting the suspect and why?','/sHlJJd4dGYo7OPJumDkPON8yt7W.jpg','1984-10-12',102,'Released',NULL,'The Man from Majorca',52331,1.491,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9077,_binary '\0','/6ZB72VH6i3yRkE520WH1cnvQMmQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087681',6.6,1886,'fr','Marche à l\'ombre','Two friends, one a musician the other constantly depressed wander around Greece and France till they get to Paris without a penny to their name. Here they spend nights in the underground, and squat in houses with the African immigrants. One day they both fall in love with Mathilde a blond dancer and follow her to New York.','/2L2MXqqsThVoCZwe1IyScZBb0Z4.jpg','1984-10-17',90,'Released',NULL,'Marche à l\'ombre',55976,1.9091,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9078,_binary '\0','/gJZEZRpWRyoalaboAR6kpIHGK4u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087682',6.5,3208,'en','Maria\'s Lovers','A World War II prisoner returns home to his childhood sweetheart. However, back home, he discovers that he has to compete to win her love.','/tWDuhuZaH6lsCnkBYXuWxJPJnkI.jpg','1984-07-15',109,'Released','They all loved her... too much.','Maria\'s Lovers',77985,3.9267,6,'7yCTziwChio','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9079,_binary '\0','/zFBafjX8NAENcSsvqj8xR2h4bHI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087688',6.7,1224,'en','Mass Appeal','A young seminarian rattles the established order at a Catholic parish run by an older pastor.','/k2b2CUKrmYEw0VN1kFbJPdL2XzM.jpg','1984-12-14',99,'Released','Somewhere between laughter and tears, they found something to believe in.','Mass Appeal',110643,1.8416,6,'ripvy6dmMuE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9080,_binary '\0','/wYl0svtQixrkVM4G9m7lYUKzfdA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087700',3.9,3208,'en','Meatballs: Part II','Camp Sasquatch will be bought out and closed unless owner Coach Giddy wins the boxing competition scheduled for the end of the summer. Tough city punk Flash, who\'s performing his community service time at the camp, is the coach\'s best hope. Flash reluctantly offers to help and so must use his raw sparring talents to get a motley group of adolescent misfits into fighting shape, while also trying to win the heart of pretty Cheryl.','/uMhPQ6Nzt6TwqMvaBwRJz2b4t1a.jpg','1984-07-27',87,'Released','The insanity continues...','Meatballs: Part II',40771,2.7052,4,'5NqbbyVcOo0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9081,_binary '\0','/5uGIQ0BnQ9y0p9sBpGhFHCAOFsh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087718',6,3673,'en','Micki & Maude','TV reporter Rob Salinger longs for a baby. But his career-minded wife, Micki, is too busy for motherhood. A romantic fling with a seductive cellist, Maude, leads to her pregnancy. Rob receives another shock when Micki announces that she\'s also expecting! In love with both women, he marries Maude and starts leading a double life full of complicated and riotous situations.','/nMezOmpy8pIqYxX3fMPfmUXo1Al.jpg','1984-12-21',118,'Released','Micki was the only woman he ever wanted to marry. Until he met Maude. So, he did what any honorable man would do. He married them both.','Micki & Maude',42094,2.3764,5.7,'P4cNM_cuee8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9082,_binary '\0','/gsOXLRiP6atxKZXZMf4oK3ygHrD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087720',6.8,3263,'da','Midt om natten','Benny and Arnold are homeless and along with others living on Nørrebro in Copenhagen. The police is set to clear the building they squat in, but on the night of the forced eviction, local acid head Spacy jumps from the sixth floor.','/739gDLbIA4SgEESTd3toHkftJOu.jpg','1984-03-09',131,'Released',NULL,'In the Middle of the Night',33416,1.3833,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9083,_binary '\0','/alwWizIBV1t2hm8hPVaJZcQhc4M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087722',5.7,1438,'en','Mike\'s Murder','Betty has a crush on her tennis instructor Mike. He promises to call her for a date, but never does – she doesn’t know he sells drugs on the side. After botching a deal on someone else’s turf, Mike has to disappear for a while. He contacts Betty – then he’s killed before they can meet. Betty tries to find out what happened, leading her straight into a hornet\'s nest of vice.','/cOL77kZUxKqYmvc17WRAAm4Nk7q.jpg','1984-03-09',109,'Released','The mystery that led her into a world of incredible danger.','Mike\'s Murder',31043,1.5156,5.45,'MPtn89Y8fcc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9084,_binary '\0','/8GVHeU77wFodIkwetIufkTVPgOF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087727',5.5,18966,'en','Missing in Action','American servicemen are still being held captive in Vietnam and it\'s up to one man to bring them home in this blistering, fast-paced action/adventure starring martial arts superstar Chuck Norris. Following a daring escape from a Vietnamese POW camp, Special Forces Colonel James Braddock (Norris) is on a mission to locate and save remaining MIAs.','/nBrDcnNQca88ed1gRwZ1Q5cjNxE.jpg','1984-11-16',101,'Released','The war\'s not over until the last man comes home.','Missing in Action',15379,4.5478,5.9,'hWiQlmsd5fQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9085,_binary '\0','/yaKCrCZa4CvLExhXkpVRtiv2toU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087731',8,1630,'cs','S čerty nejsou žerty','Dorota, a bad woman married the miller, out of sheer greed drives him to death. She then took the mill away from his son Peter and threw him out of the home. Lucifer, who is known to rule in hell, sends out the devil Janek. He is supposed to fetch Dorota because the measure of her earthly sins is overflowing. But the devil himself can not handle this evil woman and flees to the military. There he meets Peter. By joining forces, they finally succeed in transporting the wicked Dorota to hell. Since then hell is hell. But for Peter, who is suddenly in possession of a magic mantle, begins a nice time, because strangely, the prince shows great interest in him.','/5m8vX4K8E4CTNKjY5TWkBubQLQZ.jpg','1985-10-01',95,'Released',NULL,'Give the Devil His Due',54333,1.5965,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9086,_binary '\0','/fL7sZoMkhhpTeRYa1Dy7OCU2rsT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087742',6.1,2624,'fr','Les Morfalous','April 5, 1943: a battalion of the Foreign Legion arrives in El Ksour, Tunisia, to escort a fortune in gold bars to the home front. A German ambush awaits, and all but four die. Thanks to the street smarts of Sergeant Augagneur, the Legionnaires successfully counter attack. The bank manager and his seductive wife arrive, and so does a German lieutenant, whom the French arrest. Augagneur wants to steal the gold; warrant officer Mahuzard wants to do his duty. A series of alliances form and break apart, the group dwindles in number, and the gold heads south toward Betahoua. But in whose possession?','/f3C4gZ9uZdsJzWUJYcMXlRQZ8WT.jpg','1984-03-28',95,'Released',NULL,'The Vultures',72664,1.8298,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9087,_binary '\0','/bqoLLF8tjgAaXUWsVTtz3R771S1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087746',5.1,3694,'en','Mortuary','A young woman investigates the seemingly accidental death of her father, revealing many unsettling secrets and putting her in mortal danger.','/lFjv4XTWRW1Q84A42ACzkQgBIDR.jpg','1982-05-07',92,'Released','...where nobody rests in peace.','Mortuary',44859,2.6214,5.2,'tCb4y5WOvIk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9088,_binary '\0','/qKZNKurkt3A8d3ga7wmYXfJFPAr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087747',6.5,14329,'en','Moscow on the Hudson','A Russian circus visits the US. A clown wants to defect, but doesn\'t have the nerve. His saxophone playing friend however comes to the decision to defect in the middle of Bloomingdales. He is befriended by the black security guard and falls in love with the Italian immigrant from behind the perfume counter. We follow his life as he works his way through the American dream and tries to find work as a musician.','/cQtyCH6E2Xg5cqlsykwfdvbhB5y.jpg','1984-04-06',115,'Released','Vladimir Ivanoff walks into a department store to buy blue jeans, walks out with a girl friend, an immigration lawyer and a buddy. His life and theirs will never be the same again.','Moscow on the Hudson',23111,3.9448,6.3,'FMhEwdbhrYc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9089,_binary '\0','/5vOTgcPvfBsnWTG7pN0VhoOIAVo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087751',6.1,3949,'en','Mrs. Soffel','Kate Soffel is married to a prison warden in Pittsburgh, and is the mother of their four children. Ed Biddle is a convicted murderer awaiting execution on death row with his brother Jack. When Kate meets Eddie through her Bible readings to the prisoners, she is drawn to him, and they pursue a clandestine relationship. She agrees to help the brothers escape, and begins a treacherous journey with them to freedom in Canada.','/fT1HUPb74lAnDWyK0v5cBdYk6Qa.jpg','1984-12-26',112,'Released','A true story.','Mrs. Soffel',31955,2.5151,6,'iWPWsD-kPm0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9090,_binary '\0','/t97xZTGkK1bBzIhjxoRdGnF9tcl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087755',6.9,24498,'en','The Muppets Take Manhattan','When the Muppets graduate from Danhurst College, they take their song-filled senior revue to New York City, only to learn that it isn\'t easy to find a producer who\'s willing to back a show starring a frog and a pig. Of course, Kermit the Frog and Miss Piggy won\'t take no for an answer, launching a search for someone to take them to Broadway.','/nMPm9TNoW8zwNibTFJAePryXUgT.jpg','1984-06-27',94,'Released','They\'re coming to take on Broadway!','The Muppets Take Manhattan',11899,4.6014,6.618,'6-X5vRN1l3I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9091,_binary '\0','/vOCLmdJtSwxBIzxyRv2GQaTzEd1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087759',5.5,2799,'it','Murderock - Uccide a passo di danza','The world of dance can be brutal. The rehearsals are grueling. The competition is fierce. At the Arts for Living Centre in New York City, the best of the best are dying for a part in a major production. But only a select few will be chosen. The selection process seems to be at the hands of mysterious killer who pierces women\'s bare breasts with a hatpin, puncturing their hearts. Ambition and jealousy appear to be the motive, which makes everybody a suspect!','/e8pH1u0P8t2FIkBgiXZS9oJ20yj.jpg','1984-04-20',93,'Released','Save the last dance... for hell!','Murder-Rock: Dancing Death',40145,2.5066,5.6,'2NUUmGf08qI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9092,_binary '\0','/w9clWe4Ymb7Kt7SB36V7PitVBry.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087763',7.1,1224,'en','My Brother\'s Wedding','A young African-American man, living in Los Angeles without direction in his life, reluctantly agrees to be the best man for his brother, an upwardly mobile lawyer.','/zNTkmyNtdncmMFHOavpgevwsh6o.jpg','1985-03-01',81,'Released',NULL,'My Brother\'s Wedding',91735,1.4856,7.1,'8nhBGDlNbTM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9093,_binary '\0','/uSwcYGeRCCcDRhCcTqohBpI17Mj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087777',5.5,1844,'en','The Naked Face','Chicago psychiatrist Judd Stevens is suspected of murdering one of his patients when the man turns up stabbed to death in the middle of the city. After repeated attempts to convince the cops of his innocence, Dr. Stevens is forced to go after the real villains himself.','/4RHE44sgmW44pd6Klf4cfGVOm0C.jpg','1984-06-01',103,'Released','Somebody wants him dead for a secret he doesn\'t have!','The Naked Face',87151,2.2778,5.6,'o1oSQm0YIQ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9094,_binary '\0','/sqZGYcHJWWNHsECBl57FOCfjpFX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087781',7.4,58368,'en','The Natural','An unknown middle-aged batter named Roy Hobbs with a mysterious past appears out of nowhere to take a losing 1930s baseball team to the top of the league.','/fwn1gYeOkS1XHKVFdNorKSIpix8.jpg','1984-05-11',137,'Released','He lived for a dream that wouldn\'t die.','The Natural',11393,5.91,6.9,'ihRtZcxghIE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9095,_binary '\0','/fboSTXYVc3vNonSVFrS6lGm0PJA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087795',4.7,1960,'en','Night Patrol','Melvin White, a neurotic, accident-prone cop who gets demoted to the night shift, secretly moonlights as the Unknown Comic, an anonymous stand-up comedian who performs with a paper bag over his head. When someone using the same guise commits a string of bar robberies in town, some begin to suspect that White is the culprit.','/hTYkhu0dT09EDbuI0VActNjkuEo.jpg','1984-11-16',87,'Released','The long arm of the law has reached an all time low!','Night Patrol',73621,1.8379,4.3,'RrHfHHHoL5c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9096,_binary '\0','/83tdkAhGal1gdK0YeQQZX3KPKro.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087796',5.1,3582,'en','Night Shadows','When brothers Josh and Mike go to a small southern town for a vacation, they find most of the residents either dead or missing. Mike soon disappears as well, leaving Josh to team up with the local sheriff and school teacher to find him in a town that’s hiding a dark, twisted secret.','/hpgDqHb72lv0ldw4JzkwbnTd4eW.jpg','1984-07-06',99,'Released','Mankind\'s Deadliest Threat Will Not Come From The Skies.','Night Shadows',40026,2.6607,5.1,'mvmFXtFDDvA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9097,_binary '\0','/8wnPTq7NRz7P7abGpfFK5o9zfWQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087797',6.5,1998,'en','The Night They Saved Christmas','An oil company is exploring two Arctic sites for oil. The needed blasting at the first site rocks Santa Claus\' North Pole village. He realizes that any blasting at the second site will destroy his home. He enlists the aid of a woman and her children to convince her husband (who works for the company) that the first site is where the oil they want is. Along the way, Santa explains all his secrets in delivering presents all around the world.','/7eo67hB52x59UbC61weOqWu6CaG.jpg','1984-12-13',92,'Released',NULL,'The Night They Saved Christmas',40934,1.8877,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9098,_binary '\0','/6emfZPFODaEfw8fTCa9Ynv3XMd1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087798',4.2,3151,'en','Night Train to Terror','God and Satan are on a train discussing the fate of three individuals. The stories of the people in question are told in a trio of very strange vignettes. One involves an insane asylum with some very interesting treatment plans. Another involves a \'death club\'. The final story shows us the adventures of a server of Satan.','/6IievUk5C2Z0GbhrPVGkaIJjPUY.jpg','1985-05-01',98,'Released','A one-way ticket to Hell...and beyond.','Night Train to Terror',49352,2.2534,4.487,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9099,_binary '\0','/wE1x0OinNZ7RxFOLfXRSHZ91gx8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087799',6.3,27414,'en','Night of the Comet','After a comet wipes out most of life on Earth, two Valley Girls find themselves fighting against cannibal zombies and a sinister group of scientists.','/xNXnLXu73LotJ9APaJZZXflBelQ.jpg','1984-11-16',95,'Released','They came. They Shopped. They saved the world!','Night of the Comet',18462,4.5763,6.2,'F13mpUTYS3E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9100,_binary '\0','/nzSjTiecdosBfwMGAdpt9CxltCI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087800',7.4,294765,'en','A Nightmare on Elm Street','Teenagers in a small town are dropping like flies, apparently in the grip of mass hysteria causing their suicides. A cop\'s daughter, Nancy Thompson, traces the cause to child molester Fred Krueger, who was burned alive by angry parents many years before. Krueger has now come back in the dreams of his killers\' children, claiming their lives as his revenge. Nancy and her boyfriend, Glen, must devise a plan to lure the monster out of the realm of nightmares and into the real world...','/tI0RQFYevX97NSdDSYmn0Z19i3r.jpg','1984-11-09',91,'Released','If Nancy doesn\'t wake up screaming, she won\'t wake up at all.','A Nightmare on Elm Street',377,22.8011,7.354,'-kQegK3bCiQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9101,_binary '\0','/alxkhwiANOXV1MOysWnDoUqIw8O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087803',7,89612,'en','Nineteen Eighty-Four','Winston Smith is a government employee whose job involves the rewriting of history in a manner that casts his fictional country\'s leaders in a charitable light. His trysts with Julia provide his only measure of enjoyment, but lawmakers frown on the relationship -- and in this closely monitored society, there is no escape from Big Brother.','/hrdQlicxuyTg3zyVqq78EsA4Z6J.jpg','1984-11-09',113,'Released','George Orwell\'s terrifying vision comes to the screen.','Nineteen Eighty-Four',9314,9.3354,6.8,'djx5i7nNZ-Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9102,_binary '\0','/hwGnb39LPVkZH5ySosyeeU5T1Va.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087805',5.4,5948,'en','Ninja III: The Domination','An aerobics instructor becomes a ruthless assassin after being possessed by a slain ninja\'s spirit, leading to a showdown with a martial arts expert.','/6uUMJelRS3CGFehLyspQOS1R4z6.jpg','1984-09-14',94,'Released','He\'s the ultimate killer. She\'s the perfect weapon.','Ninja III: The Domination',28148,3.9347,6.187,'LIOelgaYlM8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9103,_binary '\0','/7ZFWVtOm8n9ZN7okdkevICZ5kbN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087810',5.6,2767,'en','No Small Affair','A 16-year-old aspiring photographer pursues a beautiful \"older woman\" of 22, a down-on-her-luck rock singer.','/vwtsHfe7zrkGFD10K7AkhEQk5cE.jpg','1984-11-09',102,'Released','He\'s 16. She\'s 22. All he wanted was her picture. What he got was... no small affair.','No Small Affair',44772,2.1707,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9104,_binary '\0','/jBP00fK8DfAhmmc2d6y1nUkhdjY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087814',7.6,8113,'it','Non ci resta che piangere','Two 20th-century friends accidentally stumble into the year 1492, where they meet a charming teen and try to alter history.','/4CX5fwuwZBehGDt6PhSMr49aMT7.jpg','1984-12-20',112,'Released',NULL,'Nothing Left to Do But Cry',27670,2.5967,7.73,'ezoVaby2rMg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9105,_binary '\0','/sOgXX1rsw01UeDN808d9T2F9XBZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087818',6.3,1459,'fr','Notre histoire','Robert Avranche, a middle-aged, alcoholic garage owner, is sitting on a train, reflecting on the emptiness of his life. An attractive young woman, Donatienne, suddenly enters the compartment and offers to make love to him. Robert accepts but, when the woman leaves the train afterwards, he decides to follow her...','/vhceLoMLFlyqd53NaEduPGazQ1g.jpg','1984-05-23',110,'Released',NULL,'Our Story',58619,2.3565,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9106,_binary '\0','/9RKsW96d3D93Z96HE46j7Pz5nlA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087821',7.2,6116,'fr','Les Nuits de la pleine lune','Feeling suffocated by a possessive boyfriend, work and suburban life, a young woman starts spending the weekends in her Paris apartment in order to reclaim some of her lost freedom.','/5HQU7dfVnB8HHRkdZzo1hV724gs.jpg','1984-08-29',102,'Released',NULL,'Full Moon in Paris',27102,2.783,6.847,'947EZoZ10aQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9107,_binary '\0','/mmSCv7xRYoBIm9DlkzensBEme6l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087835',5.5,3048,'en','Oh, God! You Devil','George Burns is back as God, but oops, here he is as Satan, too. A young rock star is ready to sell his soul to Satan, and Satan is all too happy to oblige. Oops! Seems the fellow was watched over by God as a baby, so now the almighty and his nemesis have to duke it out over the soul.','/c5h3BXUQfOPPaKMaq3nsOi5H1Bl.jpg','1984-11-07',97,'Released','That\'s funny, they both look like George Burns.','Oh, God! You Devil',38148,2.8794,5.7,'bAXlvLKapFU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9108,_binary '\0','/xlDUjb0Q5Dv6jPQRF5VE4IMjIy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087843',8.3,412115,'en','Once Upon a Time in America','A former Prohibition-era Jewish gangster returns to the Lower East Side of Manhattan over thirty years later, where he once again must confront the ghosts and regrets of his old life.','/i0enkzsL5dPeneWnjl1fCWm6L7k.jpg','1984-05-23',139,'Released','Crime, passion and lust for power.','Once Upon a Time in America',311,22.4751,8.369,'5vrbUpDihxs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9109,_binary '\0','/xSbG71YzxW6cTySgyEEoQvXqwsB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087852',5.2,1580,'en','Ordeal by Innocence','Dr. Arthur Calgary visits the Argyle family to return an address book lost some time ago by Jack Argyle, only to find out that Jack has been executed for the murder of his mother. Calgary can prove that Jack was innocent. In spite of opposition from a hostile family, he is determined to solve the crime.','/eNQcr8cParH56l0Ss8UI2a3bsFh.jpg','1984-06-22',90,'Released','Once the murder was solved, the real mystery began…','Ordeal by Innocence',108387,2.2893,5.1,'gvyMbGTavY0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9110,_binary '\0','/micBq6IA8zfB7A3o7uT8ogcQr9W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087855',7.1,1853,'hu','Őszi almanach','In this dense setting, the inhabitants of a large, claustrophobic apartment reveal their darkest secrets, fears, obsessions and hostilities.','/w1zFwAX87FwLvx9JEHnhFCf5kZj.jpg','1984-08-15',119,'Released',NULL,'Autumn Almanac',74903,1.0611,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9111,_binary '\0','/meU637lfjE8tpxj0dxXRIkj0G8B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087864',5.6,1696,'en','Over the Brooklyn Bridge','A put-upon Jewish deli owner in Brooklyn dreams of getting out from underneath the thumb of his domineering father and his haughty fashion-model girlfriend by buying his own restaurant in midtown Manhattan.','/aYO5Dxvf1L5zT0f17sfE5YMuZ49.jpg','1984-03-02',108,'Released','A Comedy that spans 1 mile, 2 romances, 3 careers, 4 days, 5 relatives and $379,000.','Over the Brooklyn Bridge',251260,1.8476,5.1,'1GJdAF9xRwY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9112,_binary '\0','/rt8iSFeAM40pE7s9ojzXNL30m9r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087866',5.4,3853,'en','Oxford Blues','A young American hustler in Las Vegas spots a rich English Lady. Smitten, he pursues her to England, where his only chance of getting together with her is to enroll in Oxford and join the rowing team.','/oRMVwWuQEbHm74aN2cr2G9o0o2U.jpg','1984-08-24',97,'Released','He\'s conned his way into Oxford University . . . now he\'s learning to be a WINNER!','Oxford Blues',30231,2.186,5.5,'T8j47fK6lVE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9113,_binary '\0','/fWrq3u16gaBJ6nYNWcR3XaOhQPq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087884',8.1,144767,'en','Paris, Texas','A man wanders out of the desert not knowing who he is. His brother finds him, and helps to pull his memory back of the life he led before he walked out on his family and disappeared four years earlier.','/sP27Qm4THyRZyHjHYMfIDtJP6YE.jpg','1984-07-16',145,'Released','A place for dreams. A place for heartbreak. A place to pick up the pieces.','Paris, Texas',655,12.8374,8.1,'3j8ypqxfiT4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9114,_binary '\0','/vhexJUk3sTEldSl3cI3eRzt6SZ5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087892',7.3,23557,'en','A Passage to India','Cultural mistrust and false accusations doom a friendship in British colonial India between an Indian doctor, an Englishwoman engaged to marry a city magistrate, and an English educator.','/rvBWlGRKte2U6qElHV13h6JvmSe.jpg','1984-12-14',163,'Released','David Lean, the Director of \"Doctor Zhivago\", \"Lawrence of Arabia\" and \"The Bridge on the River Kwai\", invites you on . .','A Passage to India',15927,4.0259,6.8,'7mIHIofacDg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9115,_binary '\0','/hRv0CivbDR1QTu4isfA1CLVLA8x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087903',5.2,3841,'fr','Gwendoline','A beautiful woman hires an intrepid adventurer to help find her father, who has disappeared in the jungle while searching for a rare and priceless butterfly. Along the way they run into cannibals, a race of Amazon warriors and all the usual attractions one would expect to find in a lost jungle.','/jrdG8apgpfsC7YUNplObUZnG2e3.jpg','1984-02-08',88,'Released','Adventure without shame! A lost, lost civilization where no man has ever been...And for good reason!','Gwendoline',19400,4.4011,4.922,'rwzobD93vws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9116,_binary '\0','/kOjyY3tKquqBha0e9f6IzBof2Ad.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087909',6.7,33590,'en','Phenomena','A young girl, with an amazing ability to communicate with insects, is transferred to an exclusive Swiss boarding school, where her unusual capability might help solve a string of murders.','/dhk14s8ogQkbf6re3HLKV2UBHjx.jpg','1985-01-25',115,'Released','Jennifer has a few million close friends. She\'s going to need them all!','Phenomena',29161,4.0192,6.8,'MyUOj6DNw5s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9117,_binary '\0','/4wPZaKaucs4lN7V4JWwkCN8vSwp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087910',6.1,18379,'en','The Philadelphia Experiment','Based on an \"actual event\" that took place in 1943. About a US Navy Destroyer Escort that disappeared from the Philadelphia Naval Shipyard, and sent two men 40 years into the future to 1984.','/loKzciPI19uLZ6GeSYjInzdGg60.jpg','1984-10-05',102,'Released','The experiment that should never have happened 41 years ago...is still going on.','The Philadelphia Experiment',10606,5.0708,6.1,'3f730YH3-Lo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9118,_binary '\0','/r9XdfG1tqspRP5s0ir9zf5TIf0J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087921',7.4,15926,'en','Places in the Heart','In 1935 rural Texas, recently widowed Edna Spaulding struggles to survive with two small children, a farm to run, and very little money in the bank - not to mention a deadly tornado and the unwelcome presence of the Ku Klux Klan. Edna is aided by her beautician sister, Margaret; a blind boarder, Mr. Will; and a would-be thief, Moze, who decides to teach Edna how to plant and harvest cotton.','/bmWg3uVn700inqOiadxeFTmiqmV.jpg','1984-09-11',111,'Released','The story of a woman fighting for her children, for her land, for the greatest dream there is... the future.','Places in the Heart',13681,5.793,7.167,'PzCPWZbsN2E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9119,_binary '\0','/6qAYgsvnH4wUS9fAcrxUvUtCM6x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087928',6.7,150642,'en','Police Academy','New rules enforced by the Lady Mayoress mean that sex, weight, height and intelligence need no longer be a factor for joining the Police Force. This opens the floodgates for all and sundry to enter the Police Academy, much to the chagrin of the instructors. Not everyone is there through choice, though. Social misfit Mahoney has been forced to sign up as the only alternative to a jail sentence and it doesn\'t take long before he falls foul of the boorish Lieutenant Harris. But before long, Mahoney realises that he is enjoying being a police cadet and decides he wants to stay... while Harris decides he wants Mahoney out!','/3PriqoVUQcPwcyvk0SJRiMTdBJK.jpg','1984-03-22',97,'Released','The new police recruits. Call them slobs. Call them jerks. Call them gross. Just don\'t call them when you\'re in trouble.','Police Academy',9336,12.7951,6.724,'725QU19eHWI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9120,_binary '\0','/xsTOlHPAl1hhIvqy0qAfu8XxuHN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087932',6.6,11211,'en','The Pope of Greenwich Village','Charlie and his troublesome cousin Paulie decide to steal $150,000 in order to back a \"sure thing\" race horse that Paulie has inside information on. The aftermath of the robbery gets them into serious trouble with the local Mafia boss and the corrupt New York City police department.','/5U0HNeGoJVK3xic7hK9lz89Ki9i.jpg','1984-06-22',121,'Released','Charlie and Paulie. Two dreamers fighting to get lucky.','The Pope of Greenwich Village',32081,3.1059,6.36,'mKGfuZlJD3g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9121,_binary '\0','/fUMoJvxZ7qra66tkQHbDqeS6WLt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087945',3.7,1579,'en','Star Slammer','Two women who have been unjustly confined to a prison planet plot their escape, all the while having to put up with unhinged guards, crazed wardens and mutant rodents.','/clBB3cpaASKvId3aCHJ6f1ngx0q.jpg','1986-10-10',86,'Released','Untamed. Uncaged. Unleashed In Space.','Star Slammer',68171,1.8203,3.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9122,_binary '\0','/p0A2OuaLxTaCY93BmcjwClk4PDm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087951',5.5,5742,'en','Protocol','A Washington waitress saves the Emir of Ohtar\'s life, launching her diplomatic career and a scandal.','/7iCRH6gcLhYCQBpiJisKNKuTqwE.jpg','1984-12-21',96,'Released','There\'s something funny going on in Washington. Goldie\'s about to become a diplomat.','Protocol',37296,1.9474,5.5,'8KKdm8Uycw8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9123,_binary '\0','/s3WFrpZV1QIo8Aao2TaAI5ERUTO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087957',6.5,26818,'en','Purple Rain','A victim of his own anger, the Kid is a Minneapolis musician on the rise with his band, the Revolution, escaping a tumultuous home life through music. While trying to avoid making the same mistakes as his truculent father, the Kid navigates the club scene and a rocky relationship with a captivating singer, Apollonia. But another musician, Morris, looks to steal the Kid\'s spotlight -- and his girl.','/vkQmzaSuDj8QyXmwNhCceCAmwUe.jpg','1984-07-27',111,'Released','Before he created the music, he lived every bit of it.','Purple Rain',13763,3.6674,6.704,'fzp2HP4gaJ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9124,_binary '\0','/bYvQfuqbelrw8Ty9e8zVciAyAfN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087968',6.6,5698,'en','Racing with the Moon','In a small coastal California town, Henry and Nicky are pals from blue collar families with only a short time before they ship off to World War II. Henry begins romancing new-to-town Caddie Winger, believing her to be wealthy. Mischievous and irresponsible, Nicky gets into trouble which forces the other two to become involved, testing their relationship, as well as the friendship between the boys.','/qanKEFnNtHCOFVqu3fEl2drrLWR.jpg','1984-03-23',108,'Released','It was 1943. And young men were counting the days before they went off to war...','Racing with the Moon',47359,3.5563,6.3,'7QCC7ufdbpQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9125,_binary '\0','/nrlkA1yUj1cryt7qEz8qbrMGAOu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087971',6.9,2765,'it','Il ragazzo di campagna','A man is forced to completely change his habits when he decides to move from the country to the city.','/A7Krc9fQqTQSKXpgldSOjvNBg89.jpg','1984-12-20',92,'Released',NULL,'The Country Boy',38285,1.7304,6.808,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9126,_binary '\0','/4GkQjSoyN7eLGUpHycyF5ey7gwB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087980',6.4,6379,'en','The Razor\'s Edge','An American WWI veteran undertakes a spiritual quest that takes him from Paris to Nepal to the Himalayas and back to his hometown. Upon his return, he discovers he is not the only one who has changed.','/tBiw9KXH9agSgi4WhgVkFuEhYjO.jpg','1984-10-19',129,'Released','The story of one man\'s search for himself.','The Razor\'s Edge',24453,3.474,6.4,'kp3khtzYgAc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9127,_binary '\0','/kswnGodb2w99U4rdThk2mVjjzqR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087981',6,8959,'en','Razorback','In the Australian outback a vicious wild boar kills and causes havoc to a small community.','/227exUUzUWkCYOVoPxap5RaVmTM.jpg','1984-04-19',95,'Released','It\'s waiting outside and it can sense your fear. No nightmare will prepare you for it!','Razorback',26178,2.6598,5.9,'5DZvQfK5BuU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9128,_binary '\0','/1Dr9FKvCIXNxzvaGVtt41nl7vCZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087983',6.2,2712,'en','Reckless','Teenager Johnny Rourke is reckless. Born on the wrong side of the tracks, he breaks the law and girls\' hearts with equal cool. Cheerleader Tracey Prescott is reckless too. She dumps her conventional life and boring boyfriend to follow Johnny wherever his dangerous path leads.','/AmPWfm3oN8LkRoe9zWBQALkSbu5.jpg','1984-02-03',94,'Released','Girls like Tracy never tell their parents about guys like Rourke.','Reckless',38702,2.4041,5.8,'BBuaFcjT8jI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9129,_binary '\0','/9fOfsVHZHig6MHPHczv0zMY6cKc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087985',6.4,69547,'en','Red Dawn','It is the dawn of World War III. In mid-western America, a group of teenagers band together to defend their town—and their country—from invading Soviet forces.','/a2GkHcioc2QEFJbQk1NTB85u3vD.jpg','1984-08-10',114,'Released','In our time, no foreign army has ever occupied American soil. Until now.','Red Dawn',1880,6.0861,6.3,'cMYIe9sxLVU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9130,_binary '\0','/5K5oPo1NJrAVUeaPzcXFH13Xplo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087995',6.8,46182,'en','Repo Man','A down and out young punk gets a job working with a seasoned repo man, but what awaits him in his new career is a series of outlandish adventures revolving around aliens, the CIA, and a most wanted \'64 Chevy.','/bjuu5UceuVUNUjnOC2fBzL3hZKC.jpg','1984-03-02',92,'Released','It’s 4 a.m. Do you know where your car is?','Repo Man',13820,4.3847,6.643,'NK8ETgSLRpA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9131,_binary '\0','/f78gGGQO8KKWhvWdH6TAb0dzoYv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0087998',5.9,6070,'en','The Deadly Spawn','When a meteorite touches down in the New Jersey woods carrying a monstrous alien slug, it’s up to four teens to stop it before its terrifying brood consumes all life on Earth!','/9MswcRiOrYCs3xNo2eGqEyGTmUR.jpg','1983-04-22',81,'Released','They came to Earth to feed on human flesh!','The Deadly Spawn',40059,1.4839,5.6,'UGxs5q39AFY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9132,_binary '\0','/84J4XwvJ0tb7pmgqLQ87TgQHnyN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088000',6.6,62797,'en','Revenge of the Nerds','At Adams College, the jocks rule from their house on high, the Alpha Beta fraternity. So when a group of socially-challenged misfits try to go Greek, they\'re instantly rejected by every house on campus. Deciding to start their own frat to protect their outcast brothers, the nerds soon find themselves in a battle royale as the Alpha Betas try to crush their new rivals.','/v8aETLufi4WIinhQ994oWkehtaC.jpg','1984-07-20',90,'Released','They\'ve been laughed at, picked on and put down. But now it\'s time for the odd to get even!','Revenge of the Nerds',14052,5.8314,6.4,'kIZH5TKnEeg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9133,_binary '\0','/lebVbYZV8vxQfknZwbym3rf9KW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088001',4.1,8841,'en','Rhinestone','After a big-time country singer brags that she can turn anybody in to a country-singin\' star, she\'s out to prove she can live up to her talk when she recruits a cab-driver as a country singer. He\'s scheduled to sing at a big-time NYC country night club and she puts her ample powers to work in preparing her protege.','/sEptnLBR09J87sR6d67QJzvnif3.jpg','1984-06-22',111,'Released','She\'s bet everything, and we mean everything, that she can turn this New York cabbie into an overnight sensation. He has other things in mind. But he\'s never had a trainer like this one!','Rhinestone',16551,3.5779,4.871,'opFT4agnVB4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9134,_binary '\0','/vdokXTdAIx3jrYYG7moT0vop4ZO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088002',7.2,5633,'fr','Les Ripoux','A streetwise Paris policeman who takes kickbacks from the minor criminals on his beat to allow them to continue is assigned an idealistic new partner fresh from police academy. He sets out to corrupt him...','/kvILcin1mGcEyu0rrME8MlmD9b3.jpg','1984-09-19',107,'Released',NULL,'My New Partner',10260,2.3219,6.639,'dtWlc2dwbR4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9135,_binary '\0','/tEodwsC1kRFFbI4CJCZJopdX0D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088007',6.3,8449,'en','The River','Tom and Mae Garvey are a Tennessee farming couple battling violent floods to save their land. In addition to natural disasters, the Garveys fight to stop a selfish land developer and a local corporation from foreclosing on their farm. While Mae stays at home to care for their children and tend to the crops, Tom finds work as a scab at a steel mill to preserve his family\'s property.','/bXIlE2QVIarVug9wpyPIz2xiWxf.jpg','1984-12-01',122,'Released','He might be able to hold back the river. But could he hold back the greed of man?','The River',38557,2.9169,6.4,'2fzExjAHQ2Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9136,_binary '\0','/vPkv7QDDa6sVHYOORP0ux7F1Ix2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088008',5.4,1354,'en','Roadhouse 66','Beckman driving a \'55 Thunderbird on Route 66 hooks up with Johnny after hoodlum Hoot and his gang shoot his car. Continuous conflicts between Hoot and Beckman make Beckman and Johnny determant to teach him a lesson.','/pesakl0gFiXaeOSCa5FMGv7ZWBb.jpg','1984-08-31',90,'Released','Fast, furious and gunning for trouble!','Roadhouse 66',128826,1.8526,5.1,'kzZobCpYEkc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9137,_binary '\0','/zcYbG1IF5SJ62WeHqXg48ASPwP6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088009',7.1,1565,'pl','Rok spokojnego słońca','Shortly after World War II an American soldier (Norman) and a Polish refugee (Emilia) fall in love. Eventually he will return to the U.S. and both expect that she will soon follow him with her mother. Emilia\'s mother is sick, but will recover with the right medicine. But the mother, and not Emilia, knows that there will only be one ticket...','/jMxB1CzBRzy48JjFbrdgVArTolc.jpg','1984-09-09',110,'Released',NULL,'A Year of the Quiet Sun',42096,1.4998,6.5,'8PRNbdGO_8Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9138,_binary '\0','/t2JVeiLvv3k7KlHFUou8tkrMZTN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088011',6.9,113184,'en','Romancing the Stone','Though she can spin wild tales of passionate romance, novelist Joan Wilder has no life of her own. Then one day adventure comes her way in the form of a mysterious package. It turns out that the parcel is the ransom she\'ll need to free her abducted sister, so Joan flies to South America to hand it over. But she gets on the wrong bus and winds up hopelessly stranded in the jungle.','/qfIlVOYZH5RiZ0ndFKUpr5Zn2Bx.jpg','1984-03-30',106,'Released','She\'s a girl from the big city. He\'s a reckless soldier of fortune. For a fabulous treasure, they share an adventure no one could imagine... or survive.','Romancing the Stone',9326,8.8772,6.8,'DL40GuLfxA8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9139,_binary '\0','/lPYts3qpBDMlJaGjzd7nA5Piyd2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088015',7.3,13098,'sv','Ronja Rövardotter','Ronia lives happily in her father\'s castle until she comes across a new playmate, Birk, in the nearby dark forest. The two explore the wilderness, braving dangerous Witchbirds and Rump-Gnomes. But when their families find out Birk and Ronia have been playing together, they forbid them to see each other again. Indeed, their fathers are competing robber chieftains and bitter enemies. Now the two spunky children must try to tear down the barriers that have kept their families apart for so long.','/gatMa1qfwpJqiawPjJxodUvdB0.jpg','1984-12-14',126,'Released',NULL,'Ronia: The Robber\'s Daughter',271,4.3122,7,'iwZSoyHKjgY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9140,_binary '\0','/gzFiZIXzl6k9M8fafoXL7bSXPir.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088024',5.9,16399,'en','Runaway','In the near future, a police officer specializes in malfunctioning robots. When a robot turns out to have been programmed to kill, he begins to uncover a homicidal plot to create killer robots... and his son becomes a target.','/8xMeKeXGHY2KbiMjSpEGqlIjAEp.jpg','1984-12-14',100,'Released','IT IS THE FUTURE. Machines are being programmed to turn against us. Someone must stop the madman who started it all.','Runaway',9507,3.6965,5.6,'zCZY9Z6WvSY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9141,_binary '\0','/sb1YwjQdDTQO0h2WU7OpdCS49Oh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088031',8.1,2131,'hi','Saaransh','A retired school teacher and his wife come to terms with life after the death of their only son in a mugging incident on the streets of New York.','/pSGvEfaQvKGyH1N8dQBt3F2lJKK.jpg','1984-05-25',137,'Released',NULL,'Saaransh',132338,1.5401,6.824,'CLn6nomZowQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9142,_binary '\0','/deGrGTIKoFNRGhtxB5d8kDm7ZRu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088040',8.1,5391,'es','Los santos inocentes','In 60s Extremadura, Paco el Bajo and his relatives work during day in a farmhouse, and silently suffer submission to their masters, who exploit them and treat them almost like animals. Meanwhile, Paco dreams that one day his children will be able to study.','/qbUhhlZ0gSGTp4WARxt2mm8J9Ze.jpg','1984-04-04',107,'Released',NULL,'The Holy Innocents',75877,1.6802,7.8,'mJ8ilSMJQW0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9143,_binary '\0','/mYGxfMf1Nc4xmkRPawvdI3mg8l9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088044',6.2,6410,'en','Savage Streets','Brenda, vivacious leader of the \"Satins\", a fun-loving group of pretty high school girls, searches for deadly vengeance against the gang members who assaulted her deaf-mute sister.','/bLRqlWUSlz7DJh8AAP9m9ic9fPl.jpg','1984-08-30',93,'Released','They raped her sister and killed her best friend. An eye for an eye.','Savage Streets',14673,3.5812,6.265,'7hEhAShRiuQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9144,_binary '\0','/8LB6yceaEcFKboh2icudxT9KMMp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088050',6.4,2527,'nl','Schatjes!','A peaceful family-life is suddenly disturbed when the children enter puberty. The children take over the house and disrupt the lives of their parents.','/zvVudY32bpguVS8vDXtXrXnUdft.jpg','1984-02-08',101,'Released','A family declares war - on itself!','Darlings!',40071,1.8757,5.7,'e1nMLT5FZFs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9145,_binary '\0','/xW143D0y1w47wtEFI4WfKFv4SdU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088066',5.8,1563,'en','Scream for Help','A teenaged girl discovers that her stepfather is trying to murder her and her mother, but when she tells people, no one will believe her.','/3YLJrWOk6o88luMQUodbBC2SmZl.jpg','1984-07-03',90,'Released','Alone and afraid... Was she imagining or was it real...','Scream for Help',84996,1.688,5.3,'XOzeCPE5CI0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9146,_binary '\0','/hDXPjIv95FFm3DRFl9BdrZbHHHK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088074',7.2,3774,'en','Secret Honor','In his New Jersey study, Richard Nixon retraces the missteps of his political career, attempting to absolve himself of responsibility for Watergate and lambasting President Gerald Ford\'s decision to pardon him. His monologue explores his personal life and describes his upbringing and his mother. A tape recorder, a gun and whiskey are his only companions during his entire monologue, which is tinged with the vitriol and paranoia that puzzled the public during his presidency.','/hYiadiL0xgIqpPgKj02NkYsb988.jpg','1984-07-06',90,'Released','Anyone can be the president.','Secret Honor',50034,1.2793,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9147,_binary '\0','/36nTaD0feaC8fXry2eG9qOCJJfc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088083',7.5,15962,'pl','Seksmisja','Two scientists are chosen as guinea pigs for a time experiment: they are placed in hibernation and should be brought back to life after three years. In the meantime, however, World War III breaks out and life has been wiped off the surface of Earth. When they wake up, it turns out that not only 50 years have passed but also that they are the only living specimens of the male sex in a new, underground society composed exclusively of women.','/8zh3AuXBxGbgtebL5DpaDxJgMeW.jpg','1984-05-13',117,'Released','The two last men against a female world.','Sexmission',19673,4.7654,7.225,'2rHia6FcBjE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9148,_binary '\0','/xQu5CyXb7MyL7jjXhr8TtTj0wkO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088097',7,1262,'cn','上海之夜','In 1937 Shanghai, a soldier and a young woman have an awkward meet-cute in darkness under a bridge as they seek refuge during a bomb raid. Ten years later, the soldier, now a burgeoning songwriter and tuba player in a marching band, is back in town desperately searching for his would-be soulmate. As fate would have it, they end up living in the same building, unbeknownst to each other.','/f8O7AmHGOyyqQNfilWJhap4miZV.jpg','1984-10-11',103,'Released',NULL,'Shanghai Blues',143479,1.8832,6.936,'2Is65Spkya4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9149,_binary '\0','/vwyxeJKk09GCwjNUKXCPOcyJeJp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088099',7.3,3463,'hi','शराबी','A workaholic businessman neglects his only son after his wife\'s death. The son grows up to be a rebellious alcoholic.','/9spEnoxSCLqMmXLiASWECfJ1IpN.jpg','1984-10-27',180,'Released',NULL,'Sharaabi',71304,0.9285,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9150,_binary '\0','/60niStgy2scQab1fSKqgnYzHim0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088100',2.9,4061,'it','Shark - Rosso nell\'oceano','A marine biologist, a dolphin trainer, a research scientist, and a local sheriff try to hunt down a large sea monster, a shark/octopus hybrid, that is devouring swimmers and fishermen off a south Florida coast.','/7PyU4giw8m1Sl6vdugkNf4j1lbH.jpg','1984-09-07',94,'Released','Sink your teeth into pure terror!','Monster Shark',28820,2.2618,3.353,'iJ9jglZtzt4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9151,_binary '\0','/bIgSbKHjCXEijKPwE0lJuXUWPiw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088103',4.9,6097,'en','Sheena','Sheena\'s parents are killed while on Safari. She is raised by the mystical witch woman of an African tribe. When her foster mother is framed for the murder of a political leader, Sheena and a newsman, Vic Casey, are forced to flee while pursued by the mercenaries hired by the real killer, who hopes to assume power. Sheena\'s ability to talk to the animals and knowledge of jungle lore give them a chance against the high tech weapons of the mercenaries.','/g3MC1eYoW1Se9fQzCOZ5tfyMatl.jpg','1984-08-17',117,'Released','Part animal. Part legend. All woman.','Sheena',24264,5.2597,5.6,'9Vroml-GvR8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9152,_binary '\0','/6UNxnpLXSQSKFknAaxZihJTSVPf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088107',7.1,1235,'cn','省港旗兵','A group of desperate Chinese criminals hope to make a quick, effortless score in Hong Kong. Things go afoul, and the gang must hide out until the heat dies down, besmirched with the blood of an undercover cop.','/pJT7VIl329hk6mXsO7jQNibb1Uy.jpg','1984-07-11',106,'Released',NULL,'Long Arm of the Law',69599,2.0457,6.9,'CooFDDAkUAw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9153,_binary '\0','/pZG36ITyZH6ZQllXugqaexJNdb2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088111',6.8,1642,'en','The Shooting Party','1913, shortly before the outbreak of WWI. A group of aristocrats gathers at the estate of Sir Randolph Nettleby for a weekend shoot. As the terminal decrepitude of a dying class is reflected in the social interactions and hypocrisy of its members, only world weary Sir Randolph seems to realise that the sun is setting.','/cjFDPj3hrcHwrRhAqlFYtff8PbQ.jpg','1985-02-01',98,'Released','It is 1913 and Edwardian England is about to vanish into history...','The Shooting Party',57300,1.424,6.6,'nPvF88suY1Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9154,_binary '\0','/kmfr4KuQPBKtQKGiTrGel2Nu30W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088116',5.1,2038,'en','Silent Madness','A psychiatrist poses as an ex-sorority sister to stop a slasher freed by a computer error.','/o8GugfPjY4SdSL18volr4sfNy4m.jpg','1984-10-26',93,'Released','He\'s out now... The terror has just begun!','Silent Madness',42710,1.5178,4.9,'LYJ7ae18njM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9155,_binary '\0','/x2vgmjG6yPh6dT6U4057KqsWXKh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088117',5.8,22441,'en','Silent Night, Deadly Night','After a man dressed as Santa Claus brutally murders Billy Chapman\'s parents, little Billy then endures the cruelty of a sadistic nun at his orphanage. Years later, when adult Billy has to fill in for an absent in-store Santa, his childhood trauma brings him to the breaking point.','/ypj2JwAN4vWcc4zSqFCTgUwMbJV.jpg','1984-11-09',79,'Released','He knows when you\'ve been naughty.','Silent Night, Deadly Night',27414,4.6018,5.9,'hNBJfv5pIdY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9156,_binary '\0','/6hgpBRaa1mWIrDGvkkf8BIusTZ4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088128',7,136515,'en','Sixteen Candles','With the occasion all but overshadowed by her sister\'s upcoming wedding, angst-ridden Samantha faces her 16th birthday with typical adolescent dread. Samantha pines for studly older boy Jake, but worries that her chastity will be a turnoff for the popular senior. Meanwhile, she must constantly rebuff the affections of nerdy Ted, who is unfortunately the only boy in school who seems to take an interest in her.','/A3WGCAgJF33kZdlxUdyXHYdbYax.jpg','1984-05-04',93,'Released','Turning sixteen isn\'t easy, when you\'ve fallen in love... for the first time.','Sixteen Candles',15144,7.0046,6.749,'FDQu9IiPbOM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9157,_binary '\0','/95Dwih7xB72mlT9cwrQ8aOlZSDo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088146',7.2,12769,'en','A Soldier\'s Story','In a rural town in Louisiana, a black Master Sergeant is found shot to death just outside the local Army Base. Military lawyer, Captain Davenport—also a black man—is sent from Washington to conduct an investigation. Facing an uncooperative chain of command and fearful black troops, Davenport must battle with deceit and prejudice in order to find out exactly who really did kill the Master Sergeant.','/vSLrddsvH8bJzryOS5BD9qtTtFa.jpg','1984-09-14',101,'Released','Alone, far from home, and far from justice, he has three days to learn the truth about a murder... and the truth is a story you won\'t forget.','A Soldier\'s Story',26522,6.3795,6.8,'pwrR_zIVFa8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9158,_binary '\0','/hgyzQhmvO1aaIZ0kjeiTt5cBOCB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088157',5.4,1778,'en','Special Effects','Reality and illusion collide as megalomaniacal filmmaker Chris Neville murders a young would-be actress, then sets about making a feature about the deed, casting the deceased\'s clueless husband as the patsy, and finding a dead ringer to play the late actress.','/caTSwbCFlHZOhyNdpiSWKoitTyE.jpg','1984-11-16',106,'Released','Mary Jean is just dying to get in the movies… She\'s about to get her wish.','Special Effects',97975,1.5707,4.781,'Fs0A0UVF9UM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9159,_binary '\0','/nvz6Bu17ipOHGHpWRm3ezpE76j2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088161',6.3,89267,'en','Splash','A successful businessman falls in love with the girl of his dreams. There\'s one big complication though; he\'s fallen hook, line and sinker for a mermaid.','/7FutTsMWBwVhjk1Ujf1wtndUVZh.jpg','1984-03-09',110,'Released','She was the woman of Allen\'s dreams. She had large dark eyes, a beautiful smile and a great pair of fins.','Splash',2619,6.3684,6.263,'uMIsXdoj2vU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9160,_binary '\0','/9Uo107jlYcjVAxU8W6PnGVPGztU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088167',6.4,1383,'fr','Les Spécialistes','While being transferred to another prison, two convicts - Stéphane Carella and Paul Brandon - effect a miraculous escape. They are pursued across the Verdon Gorge before arriving at an isolated farmhouse whose owner, Laura, offers them sanctuary. Since the death of her husband, Laura has longed to get her own back on the police and she agrees to help Carella and Brandon in their scheme to rob a casino in Nice. After a shoot out with the casino’s owners, Carella realises that not everything is what it seems. Brandon is not what he appears...','/cY2O270hCbwbPsBM9uiR5gpUXox.jpg','1985-03-13',94,'Released',NULL,'The Specialists',12111,1.5165,6.6,'aZ2mV9o47Ag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9161,_binary '\0','/hFXXFpqrD0tvZPhILN4uqtNZDpY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088170',6.7,91551,'en','Star Trek III: The Search for Spock','A surprise visit from Spock\'s father provides a startling revelation: McCoy is harboring Spock\'s living essence.','/yqEj0oPfKBMCz7YcCARHDgH7VFm.jpg','1984-06-01',105,'Released','A dying planet. A fight for life. The search for Spock.','Star Trek III: The Search for Spock',157,6.4386,6.589,'4wzG1u4zStM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9162,_binary '\0','/a34NyULWqPXALmAF6rE3kne9ZfX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088172',7,59514,'en','Starman','When an alien takes the form of a young widow\'s husband and asks her to drive him from Wisconsin to Arizona, the government tries to stop them.','/cgDeFWkYi6e9FT5RiQPCbQ9HlXZ.jpg','1984-12-13',115,'Released','In 1977 Voyager II was launched into space, inviting all lifeforms in the universe to visit our planet. Get ready. Company\'s coming.','Starman',9663,5.8954,6.9,'m9GbkmUG0PM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9163,_binary '\0','/28wF1wIcOJYNqmtZS9bayOpAmN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088175',7.2,1498,'sh','Šta se zgodi kad se ljubav rodi','Misa in the music school falls in love with a young Russian girl Natasha, who was then located in Belgrade. But their parents think that they are too young for love. Natasha\'s parents do not allow that connection, so they go back to Moscow. Unlike parents who want to end their relationship Zika and Milan are on their side. Zika begins to learn the Russian language.','/jsjWhMmzrKKKqLKfYK5nxwzit0H.jpg','1984-06-28',73,'Released',NULL,'What Happens When Love Comes to Town',55118,1.1853,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9164,_binary '\0','/kPDmoP4BCFaELJVBog4nIV4CPge.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088178',8.7,24537,'en','Stop Making Sense','A concert film documenting Talking Heads at the height of their popularity, on tour for their 1983 album \"Speaking in Tongues.\" The band takes the stage one by one and is joined by a cadre of guest musicians for a career-spanning and cinematic performance that features creative choreography and visuals.','/utNpurUe1MMjEaHqvpkfxgfpSnV.jpg','1984-10-19',88,'Released','Why stop making sense? Why a movie? Why a big suit? Where do the odd movements come from? What will the band do next?','Stop Making Sense',24128,6.0293,8.3,'-rjMwSTeVeo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9165,_binary '\0','/zhSELy6slpnyDTkCX8bIyBtwoK6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088184',7.4,43692,'en','Stranger Than Paradise','New York layabout Willie forms an unexpected bond with his young Hungarian cousin Eva when she pays him a surprise visit. Later, Eva moves in with their aunt in Cleveland, and Willie takes his best friend Eddie to see her—a visit that culminates in a strange, eventful trip to Florida.','/Q9wdlNjBOti4JhAjAQXphzShw3.jpg','1984-10-01',90,'Released','A new American film','Stranger Than Paradise',469,3.6972,7.2,'0k4s4oEOZMo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9166,_binary '\0','/7rE6SyTySkcpnHSuBMkOOTivOxg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088194',6.7,27859,'en','Streets of Fire','Raven Shaddock and his gang of merciless biker friends kidnap rock singer Ellen Aim. Ellen\'s former lover, soldier-for-hire Tom Cody, happens to be passing through town on a visit. In an attempt to save his star act, Ellen\'s manager hires Tom to rescue her. Along with a former soldier, they battle through dangerous cityscapes, determined to get Ellen back.','/tmYHBKCZkbmiUfhfOQKgfh0jvXK.jpg','1984-06-01',93,'Released','Tonight is what it means to be young.','Streets of Fire',14746,6.7933,6.892,'eWB09th5cgw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9167,_binary '\0','/bTi7ggNJeNpmyHAaehtDXp9cmdm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088196',8.2,3861,'en','Streetwise','This documentary about teenagers living on the streets in Seattle began as a magazine article. The film follows nine teenagers who discuss how they live by panhandling, prostitution, and petty theft.','/fW9z3HXWYTKzlqE3CYMMxaXyyy2.jpg','1984-12-07',91,'Released','The streets - your only chance for life.','Streetwise',42098,2.0933,7.7,'MWhExsCeoqI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9168,_binary '\0','/nKtAn2ZIhWjnIRZreDVc5J4uP4Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088206',4.4,26171,'en','Supergirl','After losing a powerful orb, Kara, Superman\'s cousin, comes to Earth to retrieve it and instead finds herself up against a wicked witch.','/o49a2RDChZkry84LomEORCPDWfk.jpg','1984-07-01',124,'Released','Her first great adventure.','Supergirl',9651,8.7381,5.4,'NMUeFT7iqSQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9169,_binary '\0','/1ZAam2nTybrINKZOEykBWHWDH5C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088207',5.3,1390,'en','Surf 2','Evil Nerd Menlo wants to get revenge on some surfers by selling a bad batch of soda called Buzz Cola which turns people into mutant zombies. Its up to Jocko, Chuck, Bob and their surfer buddies to save the day.','/sRMJ7rE40XTd1kiUVpa6gqLTwmT.jpg','1984-01-13',91,'Released','The movie that gives insanity a bad name.','Surf 2',30411,3.0416,4.7,'K7p8WzhMhs8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9170,_binary '\0','/vKWAvI1K6C7FZN2flVdgY8NntKe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088213',6,5978,'en','Swing Shift','In 1941 America, Kay and her husband are happy enough until he enlists after Pearl Harbor. Against his wishes, she takes a job at the local aircraft plant where she meets Hazel, the singer from across the way. The two soon become firm friends and with the other girls become increasingly expert workers. As the war drags on, Kay finally dates her trumpet-playing foreman and life gets more complicated.','/1Q8YQ35rqzJmZ6tQDPXkT9WATZQ.jpg','1984-04-13',100,'Released','When America marched off to war the women marched into the factory. From then on...nothing was the same.','Swing Shift',18446,2.6722,5.6,'DW9B0bbf6Qc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9171,_binary '\0','/wOis85Mrc0WYfYQcnFgOAtRwcaw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088222',6.9,1653,'ja','台風クラブ','Offering a caustic immersion into the lives of disaffected junior high students on the cusp of adulthood, the film takes place over the 5-day period before, during, and after a ferocious, seemingly liberating typhoon, which six of the students endure while marooned in their school.','/jsvWuaYE1l30qR62RQA4VN98HOi.jpg','1985-08-31',115,'Released','We\'re in the gym at midnight, we\'re in the eye of the typhoon!','Typhoon Club',108634,2.3527,6.5,'WhDXkSZCh6c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9172,_binary '\0','/wDB7q0mAHEcGxh2LS5Xx0PfRXTG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088224',5.8,5414,'en','Tank','After relocating his family - and his prized restored Sherman tank - to a small Georgia town, Sargeant Major Zack Carey butts heads with the local sheriff. Zack doesn\'t agree with the ways of the local police, and when the sheriff goes after Zack\'s son, it\'s time for Zack to roll out the Sherman tank and wage a little war of his own.','/3FIacxCzFP3eLndNVvhRlFjNVc6.jpg','1984-03-16',113,'Released','A tank a day keeps the law away.','Tank',21871,2.9617,5.7,'gAbkNu_rF50','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9173,_binary '\0','/qKS8ajwiQm1NmBUm4eYlSipnGYe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088241',7.7,3627,'el','Ταξίδι στα Κύθηρα','An old communist returning to Greece after 32 years in the Soviet Union is disillusioned with the state of things.','/nAcvV1WnZ7xk5gvvSOt2eyhGdjz.jpg','1984-04-21',139,'Released',NULL,'Voyage to Cythera',47792,2.2516,7.135,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9174,_binary '\0','/tFgZqPvW1XBnjBaizxuPfmydOcn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088242',6.1,4987,'en','Teachers','A teacher reconnects with an old student who is now an attorney representing a family who is suing the school for graduating their son who still cannot read or write. Amid the daily chaos of teaching in an inner city school, Alex Jurel tries to decide if he will lie at his deposition to protect the school or tell the truth and risk throwing away his career.','/foWZXdAeNtMubNrjYqSni6iDuVp.jpg','1984-10-05',107,'Released','They fall asleep in class. Throw ink on each other. Never come in Mondays. And they\'re just the teachers.','Teachers',31601,2.4066,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9175,_binary '\0','/ffdqHMWkh1h9MABwIfbfRJhgFW6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088247',8.1,1018136,'en','The Terminator','In the post-apocalyptic future, reigning tyrannical supercomputers teleport a cyborg assassin known as the \"Terminator\" back to 1984 to kill Sarah Connor, whose unborn son is destined to lead insurgents against 21st century mechanical hegemony. Meanwhile, the human-resistance movement dispatches a lone warrior to safeguard Sarah. Can he stop the virtually indestructible killing machine?','/qvktm0BHcnmDpul4Hz01GIazWPr.jpg','1984-10-26',108,'Released','Your future is in its hands.','The Terminator',218,45.7011,7.696,'nGrW-OR2uDk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9176,_binary '\0','/ni4mU8eg8xL1VhB3FrGEEz8jmqa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088249',6.4,2503,'en','Terror in the Aisles','A non-stop roller coaster ride through the scariest moments of the greatest terror films of all time.','/afLENQhXg04QPf2e9rlKtprTzjJ.jpg','1984-10-26',84,'Released','It\'s a cut above the rest.','Terror in the Aisles',47894,2.9338,6.148,'eb7dTxwYXIU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9177,_binary '\0','/hih8wlrOtMZrBd4AXe6nziMvPR8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088255',5.1,1717,'en','They\'re Playing with Fire','A married college professor decides to seduce her student, whom she hired as a handyman for her yacht. The hesitant student succumbs to his buxom professor, but their romance is interrupted by her corrupt husband and a masked murderer.','/rvsWF6BWsPbm9p9dQz4pu9mkrW8.jpg','1984-04-01',96,'Released','From his French maid, he got Private Lessons. Now his English professor is giving him a REAL education.','They\'re Playing with Fire',84997,3.8356,5.078,'5Hs61UICdME','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9178,_binary '\0','/amvcq28G3gPqZxkqoa6Q62j1Ma8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088256',5.8,2101,'en','Thief of Hearts','A woman trapped in a boring marriage begins an affair with a handsome man who seems able to read her mind. She doesn\'t know that he has broken into her house and read her diaries, where she has recorded her deepest thoughts and fantasies.','/be08f4q9Doq5HvHgBCS5NzQ6jja.jpg','1984-10-19',100,'Released','In the night, secrets are stolen.','Thief of Hearts',48482,2.8922,5.543,'sk5__AbCjO4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9179,_binary '\0','/a3FaHEGActk76BeCBingyOvEqnm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088258',7.9,161675,'en','This Is Spinal Tap','\"This Is Spinal Tap\" shines a light on the self-contained universe of a metal band struggling to get back on the charts, including everything from its complicated history of ups and downs, gold albums, name changes and undersold concert dates, along with the full host of requisite groupies, promoters, hangers-on and historians, sessions, release events and those special behind-the-scenes moments that keep it all real.','/b3lllDltoBws5uKZzBYVSjpjjJx.jpg','1984-03-02',82,'Released','Prepare to crank those amps up to eleven.','This Is Spinal Tap',11031,7.0584,7.4,'_9leMez8sQ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9180,_binary '\0','/72nzOfZ7CWO3rIpCiBSzFZCPQa7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088272',6.3,21122,'en','Tightrope','Wes Block is a detective who\'s put on the case of a serial killer whose victims are young and pretty women. The murders are getting personal when the killer chooses victims who are acquaintances of Block. Even his daughters are threatened.','/5WEGUQIFpwUh4T4ZMMdzECsvXNS.jpg','1984-08-17',115,'Released','A cop on the edge.','Tightrope',11707,4.1635,6.2,'T5CyXkOdon8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9181,_binary '\0','/hc9GwSmb0G4brW1xTfLwuwY5e4N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088275',8.2,7298,'en','The Times of Harvey Milk','Harvey Milk was an outspoken human rights activist and one of the first openly gay U.S. politicians elected to public office; even after his assassination in 1978, he continues to inspire disenfranchised people around the world.','/icHnX0RALT9Mn8CVhtqBl04jqXi.jpg','1984-10-07',90,'Released','He was powerful, charismatic, compassionate and gay. After eleven months in office he was assassinated.','The Times of Harvey Milk',33138,2.1792,7.3,'Jet-Ubwk5l8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9182,_binary '\0','/yI0xd7X8UktQ6cb8TdWKNTOWxhm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088286',7.2,83665,'en','Top Secret!','Popular and dashing American singer Nick Rivers travels to East Germany to perform in a music festival. When he loses his heart to the gorgeous Hillary Flammond, he finds himself caught up in an underground resistance movement. Rivers joins forces with Agent Cedric and Flammond to attempt the rescue of her father, Dr. Paul, from the Germans, who have captured the scientist in hopes of coercing him into building a new naval mine.','/hRTbfR27xghnVMs3ZJ3EhK3zzud.jpg','1984-06-22',90,'Released','Don\'t tell anyone.','Top Secret!',8764,6.5059,7.11,'Q5zen7sHQFI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9183,_binary '\0','/puxIQxDQHv9YqpUQQkWoidMKsjJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088299',7.3,2132,'da','Tro, håb og kærlighed','Danish teens come of age in 1963. Bjorn and Erik are close friends. Bjorn is pursued by Kirsten, a future Stepford wife, but he falls for Anna, who initiates him into love and sex. Erik is somber, caring for his home-bound mentally-ill mother while his strict father rules his life. He desires Kirsten, but she\'s unattainable. Pregnancy, a horrific abortion, an engagement party, and a revelation about the rectitude of Erik\'s father lead to a climax: Bjorn and Erik must stand up to controlling adults.','/jWsYJQg02E3k7W4ru1zpmk5BZwa.jpg','1984-12-26',107,'Released',NULL,'Twist and Shout',20661,1.6043,6.8,'Yfrgooc_SjM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9184,_binary '\0','/mduzaj09cChqdPccOcqMYEpIVXX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088315',6.5,2480,'fr','Un amour de Swann','In Belle Époque Paris, a 19th-century Parisian aristocrat falls in love with a lower-class prostitute who seduces him but never loves him.','/r5viJgAJrfxw226K1OMnAkcoDCz.jpg','1984-02-23',110,'Released','Volker Schlöndorff\'s Masterly Film','Swann in Love',119623,3.0152,5.522,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9185,_binary '\0','/tju4HwFkAAc3xn0KJ5Nk4tUEd5T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088318',7.4,3537,'fr','Un dimanche à la campagne','In France, before WWI. As every Sunday, an old painter living in the country is visited by his son Gonzague, coming with his wife and his three children. Then his daugther Irene arrives. She is always in a hurry, she lives alone and does not come so often... An intimist chronicle in which what is not shown, what is guessed, is more important than how it looks, dealing with what each character expects of life.','/qymxYwTuND3tiKZh5d1uKjykZ3U.jpg','1984-04-11',94,'Released','Bertrand Tavernier\'s magnificent portrait of French family life on the brink of World War I','A Sunday in the Country',42102,2.1608,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9186,_binary '\0','/pTbbsnyzCfCUPYU8gshsdRDz6VD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088322',6.8,6914,'en','Under the Volcano','Against a background of war breaking out in Europe and the Mexican fiesta Day of Death, we are taken through one day in the life of Geoffrey Firmin, a British consul living in alcoholic disrepair and obscurity in a small southern Mexican town in 1939. The consul\'s self-destructive behaviour, perhaps a metaphor for a menaced civilization, is a source of perplexity and sadness to his nomadic, idealistic half-brother, Hugh, and his ex-wife, Yvonne, who has returned with hopes of healing Geoffrey and their broken marriage.','/414VrLFf8gffMUNTGm0zlg2UuHh.jpg','1984-06-20',112,'Released','One cannot live without love.','Under the Volcano',41089,3.9884,6.551,'Y3aBcnYkJd4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9187,_binary '\0','/rKmOe5pb5a6P1HmQAzpRw20gORp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088323',7.3,172593,'de','Die unendliche Geschichte','While hiding from bullies in his school\'s attic, a young boy discovers the extraordinary land of Fantasia, through a magical book called The Neverending Story. The book tells the tale of Atreyu, a young warrior who, with the help of a luck dragon named Falkor, must save Fantasia from the destruction of The Nothing.','/ddYCa91iDXfJCxaqSYzwi2fjfnl.jpg','1984-04-06',101,'Released','A boy who needs a friend finds a world that needs a hero in a land beyond imagination!','The NeverEnding Story',34584,11.0908,7.2,'ToUgsvlsemo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9188,_binary '\0','/ewrXUoGCW8gt2xVxDqFq7dxERj9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088326',6,3388,'en','Unfaithfully Yours','A composer—who suspects his wife of cheating—plots to kill her and frame it on her lover, but things don\'t turn out as planned.','/iYP2jXHbjEshvCYhEhODH7kqevs.jpg','1984-02-10',96,'Released','A beautiful woman is like a symphony. It can drive you crazy if you think someone else is scoring.','Unfaithfully Yours',50812,2.9716,5.618,'g4Tj8vZWPZc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9189,_binary '\0','/8XOYSbs0e4nji8Dixnsb5vkbAC4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088333',5.5,4575,'en','Up the Creek','Bob McGraw is in his 12th year of college, goofing his way through life. Bob, Irwing, Gonzer and Max are the four losers forced and bribed to represent their university in an intercollegiate raft race. Forced and bribed into this role, they make some friends, the lovely Heather Merriweather, but mostly enemies, among others a whole team of marines, and preppy IVY-leaguers determined to win.','/cNk9qVfIkLu7r1QCSONnhIMMHhR.jpg','1984-04-06',96,'Released','Who says a bunch of boobs can\'t win a race?','Up the Creek',28692,3.0779,5.7,'idf-41fOG84','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9190,_binary '\0','/cBL5ImXZKPzYoohKUGdrJEqKys1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088334',7.4,2484,'ja','うる星やつら2 ビューティフル・ドリーマー','As the perpetually lecherous Ataru and his friends prepare for a carnival at Tomobiki High School, they gradually realize the days are literally repeating themselves. Any effort to break the pattern dumps them back where they started.','/wxSwZBgUquBIv61IkITmHJHGqu3.jpg','1984-02-11',95,'Released','Life is but a dream...','Urusei Yatsura: Beautiful Dreamer',43967,2.4126,7.277,'uOX9vuy3ZiI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9191,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088336',6.8,2736,'fi','Uuno Turhapuro armeijan leivissä','Uuno is forced to complete his mandatory military service when it is revealed that he only spent one day in the army in his youth. As is typical of the Turhapuro series his family and friends become closely tied in with these events. His friends Härski Hartikainen and Sörsselssön return to the army for a refresher course and by chance Uuno\'s father-in-law, Councillor Tuura is made the Finnish Defence Minister. In one of the most memorable scenes, Uuno\'s wife, Elisabeth, dresses as Uuno and substitutes him for a day as Uuno has an apparently urgent meeting (at a restaurant) and while becoming lost in the woods with a malfunctioning radio, Tuura accidentally declares war on Sweden.','/tLsT18nSTiCHLGiNc4LCWFad7rm.jpg','1984-08-31',107,'Released',NULL,'Uuno Turhapuro armeijan leivissä',36768,1.3796,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9192,_binary '\0','/gg0vsaBPFTcbPqkZgYc8tjT0g9s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088338',8.4,6806,'sh','Varljivo leto \'68','For the young man who lives in Serbian province town, the maturing coincides with the turbulent political events of the year 1968.','/f9h6MIgZTPUzbwNLVTHgk57T3kT.jpg','1984-01-30',91,'Released',NULL,'The Elusive Summer of \'68',148034,2.1246,7.439,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9193,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088377',7.7,1430,'de','Die Wannseekonferenz','A real time recreation of the 1942 Wannsee Conference, in which leading SS and Nazi Party officals gathered to discuss the \"Final Solution to the Jewish Question\". Led by SS-General Reinhard Heydrich, the Wannsee Conference was the starting point for the Jewish Holcaust which led to the mass murder of six million people.','/wZno9DqrpOYJYnAHlg8Cq2s2EC3.jpg','1984-12-19',87,'Released',NULL,'The Wannsee Conference',42088,1.569,6.942,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9194,_binary '\0','/k715ev14cNXUXnxSPsgpjKTD3le.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088379',4.3,3046,'en','The Warrior and the Sorceress','The mighty warrior, Kain, crosses the barren wastelands of the planet Ura, where two arch enemies, Zeg and the evil degenerate Balcaz, fight incessantly for control of the village\'s only well. Kain sees his opportunity and announces that his sword is for hire... but his eyes stay clearly on the beautiful captive sorceress Naja, and his newly awakened purpose.','/8jSoWzOuuNQgeAXWGK3cB64H18I.jpg','1984-09-07',81,'Released','An age undreamed of. An age of mystery and magic. Of swords and sorcery.','The Warrior and the Sorceress',46500,2.2935,4.3,'yQASnIbXQQw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9195,_binary '\0','/dlq14bCOOoGIUzNSddrlqDStlU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088380',2.7,3154,'en','Warrior of the Lost World','A nomad mercenary on a high-tech motorcycle helps bring about the downfall of the evil Orwellian government, the Omega.','/xRtGeMm3ETvM5i51HgGzIsN3hhl.jpg','1983-01-01',92,'Released','Only one rider can destroy the Omega Force.','Warrior of the Lost World',52837,2.2729,2.9,'j9Un8h9JeM8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9196,_binary '\0','/mxxXWiNfUJDg2LczfSTJssuZDGk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088393',4.8,1299,'en','Wheels of Fire','The Future is now. There are no rules and no place to hide from the deadly Highway Warriors who ravage the roads in machines of destruction.','/c0fx4ZIu4lTSCPZSDC0HobcV2zA.jpg','1985-04-11',81,'Released','One Last Hero...','Wheels of Fire',107319,1.618,4.2,'ADfLrdNe8_4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9197,_binary '\0','/t8cnV4jnLSNHfyDBxUZ27eogjPm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088395',4.3,1605,'en','Where the Boys Are','Four college co-eds travel to Fort Lauderdale for their Easter week of Spring Break, and become involved in a series of adventures and misadventures','/etNghqetJYdPaWE4A8NYcePSXUL.jpg','1984-04-06',94,'Released','When girls want a vacation filled with fun, sand, and romance, they go to Fort Lauderdale...','Where the Boys Are',59897,5.5587,4.5,'-fEzPY9ez1o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9198,_binary '\0','/ebB5EC7NbKTX324vD84Z1rNArkS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088402',6,3607,'en','The Wild Life','Eighties teen romp involving Bill and his new apartment, Jim and his rebellious antics, Tom and his crazy self, and Anita with her older man David.','/w7Iie9bFahDJVQ7AeKL6vMOz1VT.jpg','1984-09-28',96,'Released','It brings all your fantasies to life.','The Wild Life',38980,3.4891,6.1,'OMCKBotk3p0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9199,_binary '\0','/x8YgNond1tLZq3YbhpczonVKig2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088412',7,2996,'de','Wo die grünen Ameisen träumen','The Australian Aborigines (in this film anyway) believe that this is the place where the green ants go to dream, and that if their dreams are disturbed, it will bring down disaster on us all. The Aborigines\' belief is not shared by a giant mining company, which wants to tear open the soil and search for uranium.','/60oMOwmWwpN8dnOkRIjoUA7i5K.jpg','1984-08-31',100,'Released',NULL,'Where the Green Ants Dream',27221,2.2337,6.9,'dddMp8iknTA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9200,_binary '\0','/j2BAqmsrtImgWizHxs4aaVowqmx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088414',6,19714,'en','The Woman in Red','When a happily married family man, who would never consider an affair, meets a beautiful woman in red, he is totally infatuated and desperate to make her acquaintance. However, as he tries out various schemes to sneak out to meet her, he realizes that adultery is not quite as easy as it looks.','/4cBhKj5wVEyJdXwZfxHB1E4P749.jpg','1984-08-15',87,'Released','He\'s head over heels and headed straight for trouble!','The Woman in Red',5968,5.8793,6.307,'45ofiq9cWiY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9201,_binary '\0','/kyjeclAVRRRJ85c163syEDanwUF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088445',7.3,3262,'da','Zappa','Denmark, 1961. Bjørn, a middle-class boy in his early teens, wants to be accepted by Steen, a bullying peer of his with wealthy but freezingly cold parents. Bjørn\'s other good friend is Mulle, a cheerful and more childish working-class boy. All three seem friends at first, but gradually Steen starts pushing Mulle away while pulling the impressionable Bjørn with him towards more and more violence.','/sVlxMRMdwhHxsHKBKhjvtz6jOJy.jpg','1983-03-04',103,'Released',NULL,'Zappa',16039,1.3786,6.971,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9202,_binary '\0','/jJYasNGPK2dPwk1iSOV4yiddfXH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088457',5.8,1373,'cn','最佳拍檔III之女皇密令','While vacationing in Paris, King Kong is kidnapped by a British agent called James, who seeks to recover one of the stolen crown jewels, the Star of Fortune, supposedly at the request of the Queen of England. The jewel is hidden at the Hong Kong Police Headquarters and Kong will have to steal the jewel without his partner-in-crime, Detective Albert \'Baldy\' Au, finding out. When James\' devious intentions are revealed and Baldy and his wife, Supt. Nancy Ho, discover Kong\'s heist, Kong finds himself at a crossroad.','/hRMdyvA08rBhAi59nebbAz9Lt1N.jpg','1984-01-25',96,'Released',NULL,'Aces Go Places III: Our Man from Bond Street',2646,3.1137,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9203,_binary '\0','/dgp3j52f2MeNVrp7PY8A1pCtRZT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088461',7.1,12220,'es','¿Qué he hecho yo para merecer esto?','A henpecked housewife ekes out a meager existence, surrounded by a host of colorful characters: her ungrateful husband, her delinquent sons, her headstrong mother-in-law, and her sex worker neighbor, among others.','/eMgvMt3fV57JmNpsaEQefjvw1hl.jpg','1984-10-25',102,'Released','The Hell of Home.','What Have I Done to Deserve This?',8221,2.4435,7.1,'POnayAHs0vw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9204,_binary '\0','/nKqPwRYh5muLul3cN6zni0fJs11.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088650',8.1,3311,'en','28 Up','Just two years away from turning 30, participants in Michael Apted\'s documentary series are facing serious questions of identity and purpose, wondering whether they\'ve found their place in the world.','/1MR6M5bX9r9HNf5SCWP9MRrEm8P.jpg','1984-11-20',136,'Released','Imagine yourself at 7, 14, 21 & 28.','28 Up',20561,1.8591,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9205,_binary '\0','/yMqYPqirckRbQqOp7Cs1ZYazfOv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088678',7.2,3951,'en','The Adventures of Mark Twain','Based on elements from the stories of Mark Twain, this feature-length Claymation fantasy follows the adventures of Tom Sawyer, Becky Thatcher and Huck Finn as they stowaway aboard the interplanetary balloon of Mark Twain. Twain, disgusted with the human race, is intent upon finding Halley\'s Comet and crashing into it, achieving his \"destiny.\" It\'s up to Tom, Becky, and Huck to convince him that his judgment is wrong and that he still has much to offer humanity that might make a difference. Their efforts aren\'t just charitable; if they fail, they will share Twain\'s fate. Along the way, they use a magical time portal to get a detailed overview of the Twain philosophy, observing the \"historical\" events that inspired his works.','/wUYyl69qvIZOTuRJnwK07BbYSyy.jpg','1985-03-01',86,'Released','Where dreams become reality.','The Adventures of Mark Twain',19947,2.6679,6.748,'kAS1-lCF3yM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9206,_binary '\0','/tV2KZZR5JaqTSXiNKowGqQMQtex.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088680',7.6,100707,'en','After Hours','Desperate to escape his mind-numbing routine, uptown Manhattan office worker Paul Hackett ventures downtown for a hookup with a mystery woman.','/8upjM945SVY99tu2Z8OG27Jd4m6.jpg','1985-09-13',97,'Released','When it\'s after midnight in New York City, you don\'t have to look for love, laughter and trouble. They\'ll all find you!','After Hours',10843,7.5688,7.5,'LQRawYZl-ls','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9207,_binary '\0','/jtpnnGqe8tiDPsFsW91kB8wHKfa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088683',6.6,8708,'en','Agnes of God','When a dead newborn is found, wrapped in bloody sheets, in the bedroom wastebasket of a young novice, psychiatrist Martha Livingston is called in to determine if the seemingly innocent novice, who knows nothing of sex or birth, is competent enough to stand trial for the murder of the baby.','/m2QrxkojSmQb9k4DN6qhovDHLwD.jpg','1985-09-13',98,'Released','That night, murder wasn\'t the only sin.','Agnes of God',24735,5.1669,6.3,'JAc0C_1G0B8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9208,_binary '\0','/55CKfZ4tFSWHKFGHEd2su6dllWI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088689',6.1,1514,'en','Alamo Bay','A despondent Vietnam veteran in danger of losing his livelihood is pushed to the edge when he sees Vietnamese immigrants moving into the fishing industry in a Texas bay town.','/1TYFizw8sdvoQVG79Ui8dytb3tR.jpg','1985-04-03',98,'Released','Alamo Bay. A place where everyone risked everything for a piece of the American Dream.','Alamo Bay',177335,1.7295,6,'8k3Jdc4rVNQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9209,_binary '\0','/9yPojPY2WGbo3ORT7zCy0IHZ72n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088707',6.5,7395,'en','American Flyers','When Dr. Marcus Sommers realizes that he and his troubled, estranged brother David may be prone a fatal brain disease that runs in their family, he decides to make peace with his sibling, and invites him on a trip to the Rockies. There, the brothers bond over their shared enthusiasm for cycling and decide to enter a grueling bike race through the mountains. However, Marcus\' health soon begins to fail, and David must compete without his brother at his side.','/sa8otETzs4ZJ77s7LypCmD0zzQe.jpg','1985-08-16',113,'Released','Two brothers challenge the road. And life itself.','American Flyers',14040,2.8171,6.2,'QxNWzbM7BjA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9210,_binary '\0','/7zY3QYzr2eZs2YNbEB0JObH7A9O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088708',5.5,18850,'en','American Ninja','Joe Armstrong, an orphaned drifter with little respect for much other than martial arts, finds himself on an American Army base in the Philippines after a judge gives him a choice of enlistment or prison. On one of his first missions driving a convoy, his platoon is attacked by a group of rebels who try to steal the weapons the platoon is transporting and kidnap the base colonel\'s daughter.','/oH8eKi4Bt50tyXQIsYaM2KJqXd3.jpg','1985-08-30',95,'Released','The deadliest art of the Orient is now in the hands of an American.','American Ninja',12500,4.8161,5.979,'JInNMEkyPkE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9211,_binary '\0','/dGjzcK6mOhKy8AFwECLWiKpqesS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088710',6.3,1845,'it','Amici miei - Atto III°','This time the \"amici\" (friends) are just four: Necchi, Meandri, Mascetti and Sassaroli. Nevertheless they are older they still love to spend their time mainly organizing irresistible jokes to everyone in every kind of situation. Mascetti is hospitalized in a geriatric clinic. Of course the place become immediately the main stage for all their jokes. After some jokes they decided to place an ultimate incredible and farcical joke to the clinic guests.','/zefd273r73rKAap75OGhMIMP3Cs.jpg','1985-06-06',110,'Released',NULL,'My Friends Act III',24161,2.5967,6.391,'4BbnOTmLq6s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9212,_binary '\0','/8yHPjRj7xAYEAvtHN8NkzFuVd2N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088714',5.9,1752,'fr','L\'Amour braque','After a successful bank robbery, Micky hopes to take back his girlfriend Marie who has been taken from him. On the way to Paris he meets Leon, a neurotic dreamer whom he considers an idiot. Leon can hardly understand what Micky is up to but he follows him everywhere and soon falls in love with Marie.','/fW0bg6cUuxjLd8TIefjJUwVxUNg.jpg','1985-02-27',101,'Released',NULL,'Mad Love',98927,3.3959,5.7,'fTBSxNva9sQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9213,_binary '\0','/1KItTdBzRTp6VIoRhEEDBh1rwSb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088748',6.8,11578,'fr','Astérix et la Surprise de César','Obelix falls for a new arrival in his home village in Gaul, but is heartbroken when her true love arrives to visit her. However, the lovers are kidnapped by Romans; Asterix and Obelix set out to rescue them on a dangerous journey that will involve gladiators, slavers and beauracracy - and a personal encounter with the Emperor himself, Julius Caesar...','/8LlqOgKKU0BeZzEo1PMMIjtLuj4.jpg','1985-03-06',79,'Released',NULL,'Asterix vs. Caesar',8868,3.8317,6.5,'zlM0a3hIWwM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9214,_binary '\0','/v3dTTMRfpxCSuzFMUvHpKPtXDs1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088757',4.9,2319,'en','Avenging Angel','Molly Stewart, now a law student at UCLA, is determined to leave her prostitute past behind. After learning that the detective who helped save her life has been murdered, she quickly finds herself pitted against an underworld of mob figures who might be more than she\'s bargained for...','/6rksWEKXrg0QgdxyTxOajArn2Ub.jpg','1985-01-11',93,'Released','It\'s 4 years later. She\'s graduating college. The cop who got her off the street has been murdered. ANGEL\'S back... with a vengeance!','Avenging Angel',67390,2.1891,5.2,'MPcpWZwBoKM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9215,_binary '\0','/3RnsHenzhwPAfRXOVUknRPTB9Ki.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088758',5.6,1729,'en','The Aviator','A 1920s mail pilot and a rich man\'s daughter crash-land on a mountain full of hungry wolves.','/gJXxGAmrOEpos4kSTm5OxoOYOC7.jpg','1985-03-01',96,'Released',NULL,'The Aviator',73462,2.0709,5.725,'lBs6FIP7t3c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9216,_binary '\0','/dUmE2mHym2B2otA3PIFU88di7Ru.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088760',5.1,3753,'en','Baby: Secret of the Lost Legend','A paleontologist and her husband discover a mother and baby brontosaurus in Africa, and try to protect them from hunters who want to capture them.','/AvIT5XHXrxeNHxTHmyRalm7tfSM.jpg','1985-03-29',95,'Released','The greatest adventure ever born!','Baby: Secret of the Lost Legend',19736,2.7116,5.2,'Wy58kS1Deb4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9217,_binary '\0','/5bzPWQ2dFUl2aZKkp7ILJVVkRed.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088763',8.5,1475432,'en','Back to the Future','Eighties teenager Marty McFly is accidentally sent back in time to 1955, inadvertently disrupting his parents\' first meeting and attracting his mother\'s romantic interest. Marty must repair the damage to history by rekindling his parents\' romance and - with the help of his eccentric inventor friend Doc Brown - return to 1985.','/vN5B5WgYscRGcQpVhHl6p9DDTP0.jpg','1985-07-03',116,'Released','He was never in time for his classes... He wasn\'t in time for his dinner... Then one day... he wasn\'t in his time at all.','Back to the Future',105,38.3735,8.3,'C-4Pr9kBtGc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9218,_binary '\0','/dCRE3ABhW8sozqYQqmMdpCce6TJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088765',4.7,1579,'en','Bad Medicine','Jeff Marx wants to study medicine and become a physician. However, his grades are far from enough to get him into an American medical school. But then he gets a chance to study medicine abroad in a small Latin American dictatorship governed by the dictator Ramon Madera who has a big interest in how the medical students behave.','/bnXZRn9MINkA8iDOxaSGmgcVLk7.jpg','1985-11-22',98,'Released','The comedy that teaches a new low in higher education.','Bad Medicine',78235,1.9384,5.107,'X38A_EGawNc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9219,_binary '\0','/hswOmcqk817xuw9rFbGwNSZLZaV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088771',4.2,3920,'en','Barbarian Queen','Set during the days of the Roman Empire. A simple village is raided by Roman troops, and most of the people are whisked off to be slaves or killed. Three women survive and set off to liberate their people. When they arrive at the Roman city, they team up with the local underground to seek vengeance and liberation of the slaves.','/u1W6PBK6okOq2D9uJK5UKSyOFEP.jpg','1985-11-30',70,'Released','No man can touch her naked steel.','Barbarian Queen',29903,3.2633,4.4,'dVl26rgNB-w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9220,_binary '\0','/5ImZ5rIcO8ZdsCR6DkLknvQuFt0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088772',2.6,3870,'en','Boggy Creek II: And the Legend Continues','Having heard tales of Bigfoot wreaking havoc in the swamps of Louisiana, a zoology professor sets out to investigate these strange occurrences for himself, aided by a ragtag team. Hitting the road in their camper, the group encounter person after person who relay their strange and often frightening encounters with the beast, while the creature itself remains elusive...','/55tjsHfdIk0BtgxemqzKaBHa3xK.jpg','1984-02-13',92,'Released','The Legend Too Monstrous To Die… Surfaces Again','Boggy Creek II: And the Legend Continues',31263,1.0669,2.7,'7Gn9QBVucWI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9221,_binary '\0','/pv5Rri2bPHyJTaIbOdpwXonKL3x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088782',7.6,1313,'en','Before Stonewall','New York City\'s Stonewall Inn is regarded by many as the site of gay and lesbian liberation since it was at this bar that drag queens fought back against police June 27-28, 1969. This documentary uses extensive archival film, movie clips and personal recollections to construct an audiovisual history of the gay community before the Stonewall riots.','/5LQNv5TQHgD5A5ZdlNIUibiM04S.jpg','1984-09-15',87,'Released',NULL,'Before Stonewall',32728,1.3633,6.5,'atrlRznk4Z4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9222,_binary '\0','/iztQyzQRWeBmpxGvvxpPC3gB8Gi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088794',7.1,54272,'en','Better Off Dead...','High school student Lane Meyer sinks into suicidal depression when his girlfriend dumps him for jock Roy Stalin, the high school ski racing champion. Meanwhile, he has to deal with his eccentric family, a tenacious paperboy and an obnoxious neighbor whose mother is hosting a beautiful French exchange student named Monique.','/pHmbSkpxdB7jXozrovEfacArtW0.jpg','1985-08-23',97,'Released','Insanity doesn\'t run in the family, it gallops.','Better Off Dead...',13667,6.8969,6.597,'NdSavg_i_lw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9223,_binary '\0','/dQgzIGv3UjuZa52rH49gXKGS9pD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088814',6.3,45961,'en','The Black Cauldron','Taran is an assistant pigkeeper with boyish dreams of becoming a great warrior. However, he has to put the daydreaming aside when his charge, an oracular pig named Hen Wen, is kidnapped by an evil lord known as the Horned King. The villain hopes Hen will show him the way to The Black Cauldron, which has the power to create a giant army of unstoppable soldiers.','/h64i9e6oJs2jrDZ4QzspXMqZhPF.jpg','1985-07-24',80,'Released','Hidden by darkness. Guarded by witches. Discovered by a boy. Stolen by a king. Whoever owns it will rule the world. Or destroy it.','The Black Cauldron',10957,10.1929,6.438,'7WObSDdhO8E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9224,_binary '\0','/srouzMjFQ3tCZ2xtG4S3BOlXvQQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088816',6.1,1221,'en','Blackout','A police officer suspects that a local husband and father, who has recently undergone facial surgery because of injuries received in a car accident, is in reality the same man who committed a quadruple murder several years before.','/y3j0wddj5U6W9ZBL8NxPQOxLgJo.jpg','1985-07-28',100,'Released','His obsession would become her nightmare.','Blackout',226630,1.3279,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9225,_binary '\0','/gm6DXZAqHijTa9kdgbFjAPMI2y5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088818',5.7,1705,'en','Blastfighter','An ex-cop, fresh out of prison, returns home to find it ruled by violent rednecks and must fight to protect himself and his daughter, using his combat skills and a powerful grenade launcher.','/dCv591lbALZtzkFWpQ1KBS7j7ne.jpg','1984-07-14',87,'Released','The Force Of Vengeance','Blastfighter',104274,1.3351,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9226,_binary '\0','/d8AEsMPQmWanzwCFuzTdFpaEQfa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088821',6.7,1531,'en','Bliss','An advertising executive dies and goes to hell... except nothing changes. Well, his daughter is buying drugs with sexual favours from her brother, and the number of cancer-causing products is on the increase. But the notes he writes to himself to prove he hasn\'t gone insane are getting more disjointed, and he runs off with an ex-prostitute called Honey Barbera.','/e2K9Ii2DGDMKKnrD5hLCP7kCtRB.jpg','1985-10-04',112,'Released','After Harry Joy dropped dead... his life was never the same again.','Bliss',54407,1.1585,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9227,_binary '\0','/plQeOQKigDZh8H6KbR1RqSIKUuE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088827',4.3,1218,'en','Blood Tracks','A film crew producing a rock music video decides to shoot at an abandoned factory above the snow line. When an avalanche strands them, a murderous family living in the factory attacks and kills many of them.','/nkEyp0N9m6FOCygZIDqT8bu65TX.jpg','1985-11-01',89,'Released','Their beat and music knocked them dead!!','Blood Tracks',85001,1.4378,4,'NfuxG-1gz8I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9228,_binary '\0','/9IYyCLf5NNAQFK9pNtqzEU9HWzM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088846',7.8,223207,'en','Brazil','Low-level bureaucrat Sam Lowry escapes the monotony of his day-to-day life through a recurring daydream of himself as a virtuous hero saving a beautiful damsel. Investigating a case that led to the wrongful arrest and eventual death of an innocent man instead of wanted terrorist Harry Tuttle, he meets the woman from his daydream, and in trying to help her gets caught in a web of mistaken identities, mindless bureaucracy and lies.','/2w09J0KUnVtJvqPYu8N63XjAyCR.jpg','1985-02-20',143,'Released','It\'s only a state of mind.','Brazil',68,7.9052,7.66,'A_7ATU9dslE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9229,_binary '\0','/s5HDOmFZaPVQFjk9BxxDrLu1T0g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088847',7.8,477375,'en','The Breakfast Club','Five high school students from different walks of life endure a Saturday detention under a power-hungry principal. The disparate group includes rebel John, princess Claire, outcast Allison, brainy Brian and Andrew, the jock. Each has a chance to tell his or her story, making the others see them a little differently -- and when the day ends, they question whether school will ever be the same.','/gp4zlj7wgbiofLMNsTPndMuO3PN.jpg','1985-02-15',98,'Released','They only met once, but it changed their lives forever.','The Breakfast Club',2108,11.016,7.7,'c7VUZ29Ezcc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9230,_binary '\0','/hiL9QOIj5qT5FK61EGlM47vTAho.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088850',6.5,47726,'en','Brewster\'s Millions','Monty Brewster, an aging minor-league baseball player, stands to inherit $300 million if he can successfully spend $30 million in 30 days without anything to show for it, and without telling anyone what he\'s up to... A task that\'s a lot harder than it sounds!','/t4p8r8kfB2jHiK8J36XnfSP8cRO.jpg','1985-05-22',97,'Released','You don\'t have to be crazy to blow 30 million dollars in 30 days. But it helps.','Brewster\'s Millions',11064,5.1998,6.6,'V7g0tqdNy7M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9231,_binary '\0','/x87Oiv4cNJsJA5l1DayKjIcyK5e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088851',5.4,3983,'en','The Bride','Doctor Frankenstein creates a mate for his monster, a woman called Eva, who promptly rejects the male creature. In turn, the doctor becomes obsessed with Eva, and tries to make her a perfect Victorian woman.','/a5cCwJEnVSPtTqHgIE9UxHIoWFl.jpg','1985-08-16',114,'Released','A woman born of electricity. A man driven by obsession.','The Bride',29077,3.3219,5.4,'vD4ZVUDtvZw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9232,_binary '\0','/tQ1cTW2ezz73st9BDX1uXL0kqgz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088879',7.1,1941,'it','Il camorrista','Young Franco is imprisoned for murder and rises to become the feared and powerful \'Professor\', taking control of Naples\' underworld from behind bars.','/nhGRBChReXq4n2AQbE9nu3VRyrB.jpg','1986-09-12',171,'Released','The man who taught the Godfather','The Professor',54953,3.0007,7.1,'YHcYcMwLYAw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9233,_binary '\0','/ne2WgRhr1SAytggoZ3vAInbpqqq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088885',5.6,6399,'en','The Care Bears Movie','The Care Bears team up with a troubled brother and sister who just moved to a new town to help a neglected young magician\'s apprentice whose evil spell book causes sinister things to happen.','/hInHHG8oiKLLXPtO87aUZ9txX4q.jpg','1985-03-23',76,'Released','What happens when the world stops caring?','The Care Bears Movie',11243,4.4377,6.3,'Sc3zCd-5yxg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9234,_binary '\0','/59ydwHREhqXB8iIZo79Laaluvr1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088889',6.3,30954,'en','Cat\'s Eye','Three short stories linked by a stray cat that roams from one tale to the next, in this creepy triptych that begins as Dick tries to quit smoking by any means necessary. Next, we meet Johnny, an adulterous man who\'s forced by his lover\'s husband onto a building\'s hazardous ledge. Finally, Amanda is threatened by an evil gnome who throws suspicion on the family cat.','/kKyq7izpMkmr8sT2nLic5qAuJPo.jpg','1985-04-12',94,'Released','Follow the newest cat-and-creature game as played through.','Cat\'s Eye',10552,5.6647,6.7,'zYTMcFOMSYk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9235,_binary '\0','/khzSXVdexNA2WmrTyNju4MjC3Nt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088912',4.5,1937,'en','Chiller','A wealthy industrialist arranges for his body to be kept on ice in a high-tech cryonic chamber. When the instructions are not followed properly, he emerges from the frozen crypt as an empty, soulless creature with an appetite for destruction.','/cyvUJr26ohLzfuR49NygBM2uloY.jpg','1985-05-22',100,'Released','Frozen for 10 Years... He Returns To The Living Without His Soul','Chiller',58798,1.4811,4.2,'VnKntIpQJWs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9236,_binary '\0','/AvPLYsn8SyDWFFBzBqmsohZ5p8x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088915',6.2,12974,'en','A Chorus Line','A group of dancers congregate on the stage of a Broadway theatre to audition for a new musical production directed by Zach. After the initial eliminations, seventeen hopefuls remain, among them Cassie, who once had a tempestuous romantic relationship with Zach. She is desperate enough for work to humble herself and audition for him; whether he\'s willing to let professionalism overcome his personal feelings about their past remains to be seen.','/bQzbO6y6gxePrEcU57Su8HJ9UdH.jpg','1985-12-10',118,'Released','One singular sensation!','A Chorus Line',1816,4.6998,6.2,'2QewMK9y4H8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9237,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088925',2.6,1681,'en','City Limits','A series of teenage gangs struggle against each other in a not-so-distant future. Eventually they unite against an evil corporation, as represented by evil CEO Robby Benson who wants to control everything.','/2jigpy6ULAPYw8Y8Zklwm4Mgv8k.jpg','1985-09-01',86,'Released','On the border of adventure. At the edge of danger.','City Limits',108059,1.306,2.8,'bNezueNxCJA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9238,_binary '\0','/rsclb1vtH6IkxmVBuCC37biEBT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088930',7.3,127384,'en','Clue','Clue finds six colorful dinner guests gathered at the mansion of their host, Mr. Boddy -- who turns up dead after his secret is exposed: He was blackmailing all of them. With the killer among them, the guests and Boddy\'s chatty butler must suss out the culprit before the body count rises.','/aRxbYOYHS8T73nzR8hsLousoplR.jpg','1985-12-13',94,'Released','It\'s not just a game anymore.','Clue',15196,8.8691,7.214,'KEXdWfsKZ1k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9239,_binary '\0','/fi3QUbgcXnMEZdtPHO2KOqkFrG2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088931',5.9,3841,'en','The Coca-Cola Kid','An eccentric marketing guru visits a Coca-Cola subsidiary in Australia to try and increase market penetration. He finds zero penetration in a valley owned by an old man who makes his own soft drinks, and visits the valley to see why. After \"the Kid\'s\" persistence is tested he\'s given a tour of the man\'s plant, and they begin talking of a joint venture. Things get more complicated when the Coca-Cola man begins falling in love with his temporary secretary, who seems to have connections to the valley.','/yBfZ52KgC3gnt8UrBULVRp43liC.jpg','1985-07-14',98,'Released','A movie felt never so refreshing!','The Coca-Cola Kid',42048,2.768,5.4,'V0l9S_MGCCg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9240,_binary '\0','/SOROsJCXjEkeJ9zohXi7lEC58R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088933',6.7,74079,'en','Cocoon','When a group of trespassing seniors swim in a pool containing alien cocoons, they find themselves energized with youthful vigor.','/1rMrT8GW90as9kd4oVGhYQgGCLM.jpg','1985-06-21',117,'Released','It is everything you\'ve dreamed of. It is nothing you expect.','Cocoon',10328,5.5367,6.6,'h77perEoYNY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9241,_binary '\0','/9NxAYKOO9l9zxAxAA5WclZngMlj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088934',5.9,1285,'en','Code Name: Emerald','In preparation for Operation Overlord, the Allied invasion of Nazi occupied territory, the \'overlords\' were the few Allied agents who knew the details of the operation. When one them is captured by the Germans, a double agent must infiltrate occupied Paris, with the help of a high level German officer and the French Resistance.','/hJzZBuwHn0VBK3jnxlVdgTjhjdF.jpg','1985-09-07',95,'Released','Double agent. Double cross. Trained by the Americans. Trusted by the Nazis. One man holds the secret to the invasion of Normandy.','Code Name: Emerald',74974,2.1027,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9242,_binary '\0','/eTIZrKfOdE42Y9J9L0yekWLp936.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088936',6.1,11525,'en','Code of Silence','A Chicago cop is caught in the middle of a gang war while his own comrades shun him because he wants to take an irresponsible cop down.','/yE1Xh7Q7M6uDrm28ib0MMcuhO4L.jpg','1985-05-03',101,'Released','Eddie Cusack\'s a good cop having a very bad day.','Code of Silence',20721,4.5272,5.928,'X02oDAXOCwg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9243,_binary '\0','/lh6MbyxwCribn3hdAo81xLdPGoV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088939',7.7,105391,'en','The Color Purple','An epic tale spanning forty years in the life of Celie, an African-American woman living in the South who survives incredible abuse and bigotry. After Celie\'s abusive father marries her off to the equally debasing \'Mister\' Albert Johnson, things go from bad to worse, leaving Celie to find companionship anywhere she can. She perseveres, holding on to her dream of one day being reunited with her sister in Africa.','/6bvxkcTAXyqxGRwo38mxw92D6Xr.jpg','1985-12-18',154,'Released','It\'s about life. It\'s about love. It\'s about us.','The Color Purple',873,7.2946,7.724,'QvpgNiU018s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9244,_binary '\0','/gvao0WZchzudp2oMF5sjgzwHY0q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088944',6.7,189709,'en','Commando','John Matrix, the former leader of a special commando strike force that always got the toughest jobs done, is forced back into action when his young daughter is kidnapped. To find her, Matrix has to fight his way through an array of punks, killers, one of his former commandos, and a fully equipped private army. With the help of a feisty stewardess and an old friend, Matrix has only a few hours to overcome his greatest challenge: finding his daughter before she\'s killed.','/ollPAAAgZ7euU8VisfqU3cuXhZ6.jpg','1985-10-03',90,'Released','Somewhere, somehow, someone\'s going to pay.','Commando',10999,12.1214,6.744,'m264f4tfG2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9245,_binary '\0','/qUgWksUV1BCJrMRjm7FZKDNMcei.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088947',5.9,1328,'en','Compromising Positions','An ex-newspaper woman, who is now a suburban housewife, can\'t resist getting involved in an investigation of the murder of a philandering dentist who had been having affairs with several of her neighbors.','/m4CarihzzUHKr63EHZLcD59ed8o.jpg','1985-08-30',99,'Released','You\'re about to find out why the women of Shorehaven would rather kill than miss an appointment with Dr. Bruce Fleckstein.','Compromising Positions',126499,1.5427,5.3,'i8A4chm78GQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9246,_binary '\0','/fmXL93OWFCu2FjnNpdVekZJf782.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088960',6.1,3684,'en','Creator','With the help of student assistant Boris and stolen university equipment, Dr. Harry Wolper plans to clone his dead wife. But then he meets Meli, an egg donor for his experiment, and they fall in love. Faced with choosing between his deceased wife and Meli, Dr. Wolper sees his situation in a new light when Boris\' own new love, Barbara, falls into a coma. Meanwhile, another professor tries shutting down the cloning project.','/53zIIzpBGwcvxZtGibMavnawMYM.jpg','1985-09-20',107,'Released','It\'s potentially dangerous, probably illegal and definitely crazy.','Creator',41243,2.9858,6.156,'tJC9kDxCCsU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9247,_binary '\0','/kLYYE04tobczLNYsKWZE5SdkoJc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088961',4.5,5370,'en','Creature','A crew of scientists arrives on a far, cold planet to examine archaic artifacts of unknown origin. They discover that their German enemies already have a ship there. When they seek their help after a failed landing, they only find the Germans’ bodies, obviously slaughtered by one of the archaic creatures, awoken to new life. Now the alien is after them.','/tv4xMEUqYvfJAW9BtUF25JnCHqS.jpg','1985-05-08',97,'Released','It\'s been sleeping peacefully on a moon of Saturn for 2000 centuries ... until now!','Creature',58903,1.9001,4.669,'B0s8IR7oBGU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9248,_binary '\0','/xLryKAwhsEKX2YQcYZyhTWeBNGR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088967',5.5,7565,'en','Crimewave','A pair of whacked-out cartoon-like exterminator/hitmen kill the owner of a burglar-alarm company, and stalk the partner who hired them, his wife, and a nerd framed for the murder, who tells the story in flashback from the electric chair.','/1bP8zmzcJiIqMwUAfpfYgP5IHif.jpg','1985-04-12',83,'Released','Extermination is not just a business. It\'s a way of life','Crimewave',21627,2.0518,5.511,'W5UXIn-vfiE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9249,_binary '\0','/6Ld4ivkOa2tmvP2F0Fo4eRiuMkz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088979',6.3,15596,'en','D.A.R.Y.L.','Daryl is a normal 10-year-old boy in many ways. However, unbeknown to his foster parents and friends, Daryl is actually a government-created robot with superhuman reflexes and mental abilities. Even his name has a hidden meaning -- it\'s actually an acronym for Data Analyzing Robot Youth Life-form. When the organization that created him deems the \"super soldier\" experiment a failure and schedules Daryl to be disassembled, it is up to a few rogue scientists to help him escape.','/87huhTOQijJy0pLhusZfest1MoZ.jpg','1985-06-14',100,'Released','He can fly a jet, race a car and outsmart a computer. The government created him and now they want him destroyed.','D.A.R.Y.L.',16248,4.5014,6.407,'b16ORBT0ImE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9250,_binary '\0','/1pWB4U7LrrBnlSg3TVVzrbvW4cR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088987',6.6,3261,'en','Dance with a Stranger','Ruth Ellis lives with her ten-year old son Andy next to a night club. One night she meets David Blakely, and they start a love affair. However, for David with his upper-class background, it is impossible to uphold the relationship. He breaks up with her, something which makes Ellis, obsessed by him, very upset.','/nwAXFN8qHnfaeeGx1a0OMqmCwcD.jpg','1985-03-01',96,'Released','It wasn\'t simply love. It was a case of cold-blooded passion.','Dance with a Stranger',40913,2.4093,6.105,'DdrynRqBm7E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9251,_binary '\0','/fUDpdaHbMn27JOW9B6oQK50sXt4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088992',7.6,2964,'fa','دونده','A young orphan named Amiro lives alone in an abandoned tanker in the Iranian port city of Abadan. He survives by shining shoes, selling water, and collecting deposit bottles. Although he sometimes finds himself at odds with both adults and competing older kids, he finds solace in dreams about departing cargo ships and airplanes—and by running.','/4X2Lle2CWxGCKcoYyMgqT2x43rR.jpg','1984-12-20',94,'Released',NULL,'The Runner',213938,1.356,7.171,'gEQ-6MryfYc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9252,_binary '\0','/sZUnqJCjEUtdZ0vhPO3oe1PFYV9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0088993',7.1,80505,'en','Day of the Dead','As the world is overrun by zombies, scientists and military personnel in an underground Florida bunker must decide on how they should deal with the undead.','/bi7SO5F4VyyGQTlxQirbH1dwKzW.jpg','1985-07-03',101,'Released','The darkest day of horror the world has ever known!','Day of the Dead',8408,7.0409,7.01,'G8gMvjmGv4k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9253,_binary '\0','/3zsyRuzncmSSYmKA60jXNsDWMbs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089002',4.6,1550,'en','Death Warmed Up','A kid is hypnotized by a scientist to kill his parents and ends in a mental institution. As a grown up he returns to seek revenge over the scientist.','/isV8EJK4EH5zRQAQybCcMLTGV5L.jpg','1984-11-22',80,'Released','YOU HAVE ONLY ONE LIFE TO LIVE... BUT THERE ARE MANY WAYS TO DIE...','Death Warmed Up',77361,1.4409,4.5,'ApMXRIq54Vc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9254,_binary '\0','/8YGhmpLrP8qNdaWorVxZbWq34ED.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089003',5.8,19457,'en','Death Wish 3','Architect/vigilante Paul Kersey arrives back in New York City and is forcibly recruited by a crooked police chief to fight street crime caused by a large gang terrorizing the neighborhoods.','/mc33TytXxkC9cSKyztDJzwF3lbn.jpg','1985-11-01',90,'Released','He\'s back in New York bringing justice to the streets...','Death Wish 3',24873,6.122,6.241,'f81KM4KF5T0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9255,_binary '\0','/ujpM3LTjgZpwAzIVjXfpssUcPvG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089006',7.2,12558,'en','Death of a Salesman','Willy Loman, an aging, failing salesman, struggles to accept reality and his failure to achieve the American Dream.','/tIRmjfaLmVHjGFaIcNGD3hggvbO.jpg','1985-08-16',136,'Released','Its passion cannot be overstated. Its power must not be overlooked.','Death of a Salesman',12615,3.4799,6.9,'zsJhonpcetk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9256,_binary '\0','/f2Kz6YDQ14TGMSpPH7f4c7NFV0k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089009',6.5,2807,'en','Defence of the Realm','A reporter named Mullen \'stumbles\' onto a story linking a prominent Member of Parliament to a KGB agent and a near-nuclear disaster involving a teenage runaway and a U.S. Air Force base. Has there been a Government cover-up? Mullen teams up with Vernon Bayliss, an old hack, and Nina Beckam, the MP\'s assistant, to find out the truth.','/hoUzgwdOk4J3ooomwxB1qwhzSbo.jpg','1986-05-09',96,'Released','Just how far will a government go to hide the truth?','Defence of the Realm',29627,2.0212,6.4,'SSARJZgNZEg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9257,_binary '\0','/4anqXDsl5iZ26qeTRX3yZWylMgY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089013',6.6,30015,'it','Dèmoni','A group of people are trapped in a West Berlin movie theater infested with ravenous demons who proceed to kill and possess the humans one-by-one, thereby multiplying their numbers.','/ym0mtcSt6i45NIcAoSBQhop0wSP.jpg','1985-10-04',89,'Released','They will make cemeteries their cathedrals and the cities will be your tombs.','Demons',14029,4.2393,6.6,'58AnqYSGVE4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9258,_binary '\0','/naXcvWfRZ4pDHPP9xJfZ4K1MgvG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089015',7.1,8702,'en','Desert Hearts','While waiting for her divorce papers, a repressed literature professor finds herself unexpectedly attracted by a carefree, spirited young woman named Cay.','/klAHoWOZgL8sR74Tnl7K7z4Lziq.jpg','1985-10-01',91,'Released','In 1959, Vivian Bell came to Reno, Nevada for a quick divorce. Of all the people she met there, the one who surprised her the most was herself.','Desert Hearts',294,4.4843,7.1,'m075dap8xP4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9259,_binary '\0','/hr1JookM2iftEu2k8HaFfDD6QSC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089017',6.2,29497,'en','Desperately Seeking Susan','A bored New Jersey suburban housewife\'s fascination with a free-spirited woman she has read about in the personal columns leads to her being mistaken for the woman herself and into a chaotic adventure of amnesia and self-discovery.','/ighImRgzYzZ88skBHaT4B7ntJG8.jpg','1985-03-29',104,'Released','Every man is desperate to have her. One woman is desperate to be her. But someone is desperate to kill her. If they can figure out who she is.','Desperately Seeking Susan',8130,5.0695,6.1,'ngAdpRVhHzY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9260,_binary '\0','/wqZ8srpGacl6BVdvERdlD47Jw8J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089026',5.1,2843,'en','The Dirty Dozen: Next Mission','Major Reisman is \"volunteered\" to lead another mission using convicted army soldiers, sentenced to either death or long prison terms. This time their mission is to kill a Nazi general who plans to assassinate Hitler.','/IziImBRpTvMXptgaIRUoYtXhvh.jpg','1985-02-04',95,'Released','They\'re back... and deadlier than ever!','The Dirty Dozen: Next Mission',36571,3.0156,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9261,_binary '\0','/6JJZTvHBoMnqrf6wpQz9KrCpcb0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089029',6.3,2426,'zh','霹靂十傑','Monk San Te tries to support and protect Shaolin and her Fang Shih-yu who purposely attacks corrupt Ching officials.','/glQQHkfTAsqSCf1cZLMQZTrjk0q.jpg','1985-05-17',93,'Released',NULL,'Disciples of the 36th Chamber',50571,3.0776,6.333,'4Ed677Y6TG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9262,_binary '\0','/2iHzJ4qSYruHjsyiAG1uAhONPnt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089034',6.2,1661,'en','The Doctor and the Devils','In Victorian England, graverobbers supply a wealthy doctor with bodies to research anatomy on, but greed causes them to seek an easier means of getting the job done.','/nC3YFz9NTd2Q4l9tUSKSzBJzXXd.jpg','1985-10-04',93,'Released','A man of medicine... A pair of murderers... An unholy alliance.','The Doctor and the Devils',80368,3.0604,6.3,'M1Ms62bDmyA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9263,_binary '\0','/6ERCPRGkG8kx0AYsnYXcUlpROgc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089038',4.7,3642,'en','Don\'t Open Till Christmas','It\'s just days before Christmas in London, but not everyone is full of good cheer - as a maniac with a pathological hatred of Santa Claus stalks the streets, butchering any man that’s unlucky enough to be wandering around dressed as Old Saint Nick.','/8uvEijsQVg6HEg6x58LAeL6qjeF.jpg','1984-12-07',87,'Released','The gift of terror just won\'t wait!','Don\'t Open Till Christmas',84422,1.7146,4.882,'hlMQzYI1b8Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9264,_binary '\0','/7g36WijwJlJ2ZzkKRDo75khSVrL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089052',6.6,1953,'en','Dreamchild','80-year-old Alice Hargreaves is about to visit Columbia University to attend a reception in honour of author Lewis Carroll. As a child, Alice\'s close friendship with the writer was the creative catalyst for Carroll\'s most beloved work. However, as Alice reflects on her experiences with the author, she slowly realises the complexity of their bond has had lasting, deeply felt ramifications.','/vgmONyJ6Io0sPibW9SRiZFHVOO0.jpg','1985-10-04',94,'Released','He loved the child we will never forget...','Dreamchild',42034,2.1479,6.6,'vNyxQDzA3F8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9265,_binary '\0','/euGKS7XDRlrDPKUHAwZ3fzUr3q6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089060',4.6,3627,'en','The Dungeonmaster','A computer whiz is yanked into a twisted digital world by the sadistic wizard Mestema and forced through a gauntlet of wild, deadly trials, from mutant goblins to metal mayhem, with his girlfriend’s soul on the line.','/eQFTE3v1RwBAt6DRJ5Woy8OXuVH.jpg','1984-08-24',73,'Released','He is the overlord of strange beasts and stolen souls…','The Dungeonmaster',27244,2.2386,4.932,'iBlWucW69fg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9266,_binary '\0','/yw2JsmZnK27Ak31aAxQHqP2KmO3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089066',5.7,2668,'fr','Détective','Emile Chenal and his wife, Françoise, leaned on boxing manager Jim Fox Warner to cough up the considerable sum of money that he owes them, with both the police and the mob circling the situation. In the same hotel, Inspector Neveu looks into a murder that took place years before, and his storyline overlaps with the arc of the Chenals.','/5olbP0zwKKYMPW2ZZSFNfLYcFHl.jpg','1985-08-23',95,'Released','A woman, two men, a love story, a murder, a boxing-match, the mafia...','Detective',52710,2.6838,5.2,'NuGa7WLlANY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9267,_binary '\0','/lTMRAA9cXBoMu0ydHWYnaej261E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089069',8,2384,'en','An Early Frost','Successful lawyer Michael Pierson is gay, but he has always hidden this part of his life from his mother, Katherine, father, Nick, and grandmother Beatrice. But when Michael discovers he has AIDS and is dying of complications from the disease, he must open up to his parents and the rest of his family. Though fearful of their reactions, he introduces them to his longtime lover, Peter, and looks to them for support.','/jLMT8s04nEYyfS6LVTHhVhNli5V.jpg','1985-05-01',100,'Released','When AIDS hits home... what does a family do?','An Early Frost',84884,1.7297,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9268,_binary '\0','/daJx3bOPZX2Yezu9ryiwiE68dEF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089072',6.8,2403,'fr','L\'Effrontée','Charlotte Castang is a working-class 13-year-old girl, who lives in a drab, run-down neighbourhood, and is ready to become an adult. Her mother died giving birth to her, and she lives with her crass brother and a father whose attention is elsewhere. Her only friend is Lulu, a sick 10-year-old she regards as a pest. Charlotte is antisocial, bored and dreams of a better life. Her life improves when she meets Clara Bauman, a pianist prodigy.','/yMwEgLPSZ1Q8F2kp1GGgse9wd2B.jpg','1985-12-11',96,'Released',NULL,'An Impudent Girl',61991,1.8431,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9269,_binary '\0','/fBlNEdSBOPYCbX6IsTR4mJc4z3B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089074',7.4,1563,'hu','Egészséges erotika','In the box factory standing in the middle of nowhere only women work, and they themselves only waste their time, as the unmarketable boxes pile up in the yards. The fireman in duty, who stores stolen gasoline in the inflammable plant, sets up cameras in the women\'s locker room the sake of \'business\'.','/2QFJDYFkPzumSvIOyVQMoZDJ7nU.jpg','1986-07-10',94,'Released',NULL,'Sound Eroticism',41060,1.3695,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9270,_binary '\0','/emYiRRiVH7wuSQyIjdy7VmSFTg4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089077',5.1,1240,'de','Die Einsteiger','Movie fan Mike has invented a machine with which he is able to take part in every movie which is currently running on his video tape recorder. But he and his friend Tommy are watched while trying out this new device and soon two electronic companies are on their trail to discover the secret of this invention.','/wzDCUch6Nchs7hPxURsl5Hnfw4L.jpg','1985-10-03',100,'Released',NULL,'The Beginner',10853,1.4576,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9271,_binary '\0','/y6tY3jYeO3weN3vYzkxwXodQRkj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089079',6.9,1892,'en','Eleni','Nick is a writer in New York when he gets posted to a bureau in Greece. He has waited 30 years for this. He wants to know why his mother was killed in the civil war years earlier. In a parallel plot line we see Nick as a young boy and his family as they struggle to survive in the occupied Greek hillside. The plot lines converge as Nick\'s investigations bring him closer to the answers.','/3bXy4qj9FIBAYg6JlNI0AeqOC8g.jpg','1985-11-01',114,'Released','The Echo of a Mother\'s Voice. Fuels a Son\'s Revenge.','Eleni',42834,2.1562,5.976,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9272,_binary '\0','/saWBWBPPArHiwSZSdTCNL3w8Z15.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089085',7.1,1343,'fr','Elvis Gratton, Le King des Kings','A Québécois Elvis impersonator is disillusioned to find a Chinaman participating in an Elvis contest. He later takes his wife on vacation to the island of Santa Banana.','/tImszlZ0jEeIWuj9y9qt0VeWiT2.jpg','1985-10-31',89,'Released',NULL,'Elvis Gratton, Le King des Kings',44792,1.2227,6.4,'lZS7sOOpELI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9273,_binary '\0','/8JH97RT7J2zMRDx3ia7wwywkIwV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089087',6.9,12254,'en','The Emerald Forest','For ten years, engineer Bill Markham has searched tirelessly for his son Tommy who disappeared from the edge of the Brazilian rainforest. Miraculously, he finds the boy living among the reclusive Amazon tribe who adopted him. And that\'s when Bill\'s adventure truly begins. For his son is now a grown tribesman who moves skillfully through this beautiful-but-dangerous terrain, fearful only of those who would exploit it. And as Bill attempts to \"rescue\" him from the savagery of the untamed jungle, Tommy challenges Bill\'s idea of true civilization and his notions about who needs rescuing.','/fdRlqPnPFaPyQqS3KiBLJwWQPBe.jpg','1985-06-22',114,'Released','What kind of man would return year after year for ten years to rescue a missing boy from the most savage jungle in the world? His father.','The Emerald Forest',11532,5.2512,6.6,'WSX09PJj0s4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9274,_binary '\0','/2dAkR9s5ES4ErhyxzuqBCdweTQc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089091',5.1,1711,'it','Endgame - Bronx lotta finale','A telepathic mutant recruits a post World War III TV game show warrior to lead her band of mutants to safety.','/1vr1ru5obpajhCnSTyiYXEQp2ec.jpg','1983-11-05',98,'Released','A future world where violence explodes in duels to the death...','Endgame',28850,2.8207,4.9,'-C5BucD0grE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9275,_binary '\0','/dMjNyPk3aBwXYYfAuSAwSRz1ewa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089092',6.9,55307,'en','Enemy Mine','A soldier from Earth crashlands on an alien world after sustaining battle damage. Eventually he encounters another survivor, but from the enemy species he was fighting; they band together to survive on this hostile world. In the end the human finds himself caring for his enemy in a completely unexpected way.','/a3dr9L8VIjhEvivzQ2M12VQDere.jpg','1985-12-12',108,'Released','Enemies because they were taught to be. Allies because they had to be. Brothers because they dared to be.','Enemy Mine',11864,6.4626,7,'J8wLPApYGOw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9276,_binary '\0','/aPJo1Hv9ZAOtRwHUXvQziBYtRkg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089104',4.7,3392,'it','Fuga dal Bronx','A ragtag group of people have to fight extermination squads amid their ruined city.','/qCAP4uwtJ51mehSxz0L580u2XLH.jpg','1983-08-15',89,'Released','They\'re back and out for blood!','Escape from the Bronx',69152,2.6658,4.9,'mqilEQOm-To','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9277,_binary '\0','/3c9csN2cguE6KwIEcJJ06pQVl5s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089108',8,8593,'es','Esperando la carroza','Mama Cora, who is almost eighty years old, has three sons and a daughter. She lives with one of them, who has serious financial problems. The family meets one day to celebrate an anniversary meal, and that is when the problem arises: which of them will take care of her?','/qkSThbNiC6kimvLlWrgeTNYLCeq.jpg','1985-05-06',87,'Released','An out of the ordinary weekend in the life of an Argentine family','Waiting for the Hearse',13651,1.4841,8.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9278,_binary '\0','/9NzIEfKqqCyeY9pP7lbAkmblxxB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089109',3.7,2056,'en','Evils of the Night','Sex-hungry teens are kidnapped by auto mechanics, who take them to a rural hospital run by aliens who need their blood as the key to their own longevity.','/8Jj9BVTc7SXPzftRyZ7ft3WRshQ.jpg','1985-10-10',84,'Released','They Thought They Were Alone','Evils of the Night',67642,5.8178,3.713,'FXIC18SrpBA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9279,_binary '\0','/xdH8k2O6mpLv4szeLkQGiM1aSOC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089110',5.4,11829,'en','Ewoks: The Battle for Endor','The army of the Marauders, led by King Terak and the witch Charal, attack the Ewoks village, killing Cindel\'s family. Cindel and the Ewok Wicket escape and meet Teek in the forest, a naughty and very fast animal. Teek takes them to a house in which an old man, Noa, lives. Like Cindel, he also crashed with his Starcruiser on Endor. Together they fight Terak and Charal.','/ntgKdekb7xMKscyh2Hei706LBLf.jpg','1985-11-24',100,'Released','An adventure on a world beyond the stars.','Ewoks: The Battle for Endor',10372,5.7789,5.411,'HurMzSQ5dmc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9280,_binary '\0','/ijNmO643l3HYM5k3i1L1ivSdWEb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089114',6.4,25896,'en','Explorers','Middle schooler Ben spends his free time watching sci-fi films, playing video games and reading comic books. Surprisingly, his affinity for all things fantastical yields a real result – when he has a vivid dream about technology, his prodigy best friend Wolfgang manages to create a working spacecraft. Joined by their buddy Darren, the boys take off into outer space and encounter some very odd extraterrestrial life.','/oFJosj5ECYjf1jkvpTEjGNzPx2x.jpg','1985-07-12',109,'Released','The adventure begins in your own back yard.','Explorers',9872,4.4002,6.3,'kz33wgHjQNE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9281,_binary '\0','/4JO4qqCWh5BAfFwphC7ZAnhsM0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089118',6.7,25230,'en','F/X','A movies special effects man is hired by a government agency to help stage the assassination of a well known gangster. When the agency double cross him, he uses his special effects to trap the gangster and the corrupt agents.','/dxqWgIQkwFVCSkB64EjD3fc1lwG.jpg','1986-02-07',109,'Released','Murder by illusion.','F/X',9873,3.6721,6.6,'A5a4i1mlQyk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9282,_binary '\0','/sJCwiTHjgKff1PNq7sorRbemGQQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089122',5.9,2206,'en','Fair Game','A young woman running a wildlife sanctuary in the Australian outback is in for trouble when she is confronted by three kangaroo hunters. Bored with killing kangaroos, they decide to kill the animals in the sanctuary, and when they see how attractive the owner is, they decide to have a little \"fun\" with her, too. Turns out that they may get a bit more \"fun\" than they bargained for.','/dOY9aKB1ls7LjzTMvVxSNSz25Ux.jpg','1986-07-24',90,'Released','They hunted her... Terrorised her... And now they pay the price','Fair Game',49237,1.3496,5.8,'sWAB_5RsyKA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9283,_binary '\0','/rZs4l2gwhzCk3G9OhSiLEbB35i1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089126',6.7,9864,'en','Fandango','In 1971, five college buddies from the University of Texas embark on a final road trip odyssey across the Mexican border before facing up to uncertain futures, in Vietnam and otherwise.','/7hdQUp17uXp8tZJWB8eWh25DWbc.jpg','1985-01-25',91,'Released','In every living species there is a stage of growth between infancy and adulthood... In most animals, it occurs during the first year of life... In humans, it happens right after college.','Fandango',20348,2.8291,6.7,'I5Xpi1FHnjw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9284,_binary '\0','/nDzwztUurslvbBBZdKVXu2KGA1h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089153',6.7,22572,'en','Flesh + Blood','A band of medieval mercenaries take revenge on a noble Lord who cheated them by kidnapping his son\'s fiancée. As the plague and warfare cut a swathe of destruction throughout the land, the mercenaries hole up in a castle and await their fate.','/bjUYC4uC82oASTMPkb6iGCYOO2e.jpg','1985-08-30',126,'Released','Betrayed by power. Corrupted by love. Bound by honor.','Flesh + Blood',12775,5.5527,6.5,'4g_xqC4VBFQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9285,_binary '\0','/caRqs1GIhwoJqn8JA3LakIUR0v3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089155',6.9,62025,'en','Fletch','When investigative reporter Irwin \"Fletch\" Fletcher goes undercover to write a piece on the drug trade at a local beach, he\'s approached by wealthy businessman Alan Stanwyk, who offers him $50,000 to murder him. With sarcastic wit and a knack for disguises, Fletch sets out to uncover Stanwyk\'s story.','/nKDnMvVynvj7lwdv1iAZO1DzTYn.jpg','1985-05-31',98,'Released','Meet the only guy who changes his identity more often than his underwear.','Fletch',9749,4.4581,6.8,'VYsRIZsd2xI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9286,_binary '\0','/8RE7gJV8tqEJ52C5dlRTWUinieO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089160',6,3456,'en','Fool for Love','A woman is waiting in a motel for her boyfriend, when an old flame turns up and tries to take her back to the life she is trying to leave behind.','/zZciKF71Fa96kx7UZ3nl57pgkdA.jpg','1985-12-06',106,'Released','Desire beyond the edge of passion.','Fool for Love',71125,1.9291,5.7,'sbvPkB1NlNI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9287,_binary '\0','/zgv2tBADJEw2p11R0ooQmIl9S4v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089167',5.3,3136,'en','Fraternity Vacation','A nerd gains the friendship of two of his frat brothers when his dad offers them his condo for the week in Palm Springs, and also offers the fraternity a hot tub and jacuzzi if they can help his son find a girl. They meet two guys from a rival fraternity, and make a bet on who can nail the Designated Babe first.','/sHglZYlTpIFqORB5TzTA3ACNdhn.jpg','1985-12-04',94,'Released','Astronomy major Wendell Tvedt has studied galaxies, charted planets and pondered the universe. But in Palm Springs, he\'ll encounter his first full moon.','Fraternity Vacation',24585,2.2139,5.2,'kQ5hMDWDVtU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9288,_binary '\0','/pQy1GaR0TLwvb3Bpqk5teovzoDY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089173',4.8,50287,'en','Friday the 13th: A New Beginning','Homicidal maniac Jason returns from the grave to cause more bloody mayhem. Young Tommy may have escaped from Crystal Lake, but he’s still haunted by the gruesome events that happened there. When gory murders start happening at the secluded halfway house for troubled teens where he now lives, it seems like his nightmarish nemesis, Jason, is back for more sadistic slaughters.','/ewnIs4aCuWnKQ13Eaj8f3ybrQc8.jpg','1985-03-22',92,'Released','If Jason still haunts you... You\'re not alone.','Friday the 13th: A New Beginning',9731,7.5171,5.257,'cZ5cMK-3Z_I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9289,_binary '\0','/36MQ5hJJW4K28urrJIYImz9MOfa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089175',7,89159,'en','Fright Night','Charley Brewster, a high school student, accidentally discovers the true and creepy nature of Jerry Dandrige, his dashing and enigmatic new neighbor; but no one seems willing to believe him.','/euIh75MwNDrYkTEVSkw7VXWGXoE.jpg','1985-08-02',107,'Released','There are some very good reasons to be afraid of the dark.','Fright Night',11797,8.5413,7,'PMRH0RIEjnc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9290,_binary '\0','/nqku4NcsbNsqkzMhvNOFosVDo6a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089177',6.3,6965,'cn','福星高照','Two Hong Kong cops are sent to Tokyo to catch an ex-cop who stole a large amount of money in diamonds. After one is captured by the Ninja-gang protecting the rogue cop, the other one gets his old Orphanage gang, dubbed the \"Five Lucky Stars,\" to help him. They don\'t like this much, but they do it.','/dZzHBIcJsld2XMvwR75OZGf4NM2.jpg','1985-02-10',96,'Released','Asia\'s top action-comedy team takes on the Tokyo underworld.','My Lucky Stars',10044,4.9244,6.645,'mlBavkK4z4E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9291,_binary '\0','/7crgWbBgNnYfhT0KR9kJlFTWtuC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089199',4.7,1441,'en','Get Out of My Room','Cheech Marin and Tommy Chong attempt to finish a \"video album\" for their novelty record.','/r1tGF8XMOphHnREgmsb6rJgmX4b.jpg','1985-10-01',53,'Released',NULL,'Get Out of My Room',31609,2.5054,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9292,_binary '\0','/jcnqV2LS5z3XtecPragGCPB6Ajs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089200',4.2,11696,'en','Ghoulies','A young man and his girlfriend move into the man\'s old mansion home, where he becomes possessed by a need to control ancient demons.','/yV8z6deULhH4oJAUj2YdhITPwfc.jpg','1984-11-16',81,'Released','They\'ll get you in the end.','Ghoulies',18498,2.5778,4.9,'gTZPOh21q2Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9293,_binary '\0','/oHroNlwL1bkxaw4I1uM3hL1ERsO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089206',7,2913,'ja','銀河鉄道の夜','Lonely and awkward, Giovanni struggles with his sick mother, absent father, and an afterschool job that isolates him from his peers. But on the night of the Festival of Stars, he is magically transported onto a celestial train with his only friend, Campanella. Together, they embark on an extraordinary journey through the galaxy, encountering mysterious characters and grappling with life\'s deepest questions.','/lhuPBTDmQzFCK7ZkWeIzrFY4dXL.jpg','1985-07-13',108,'Released','Japan\'s most beloved children\'s book is now a hauntingly beautiful feature film.','Night on the Galactic Railroad',37585,5.8388,7.144,'QpNrSr92mCk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9294,_binary '\0','/8m0msdeGoPzK8gCEMIGPlzyx5Ys.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089208',6,12937,'en','Girls Just Want to Have Fun','Janey is new in town. She soon meets Lynne, a classmate who shares her passion for the local show \'Dance TV\'. When a competition is announced to find new Dance TV performers, Janey and Lynne are determined to audition. The only problem is that Janey\'s father doesn\'t approve of that kind of thing.','/yhbuTnTA6wu5hOXL5uc3rRFLnCl.jpg','1985-04-12',87,'Released','Getting into trouble is easy but getting out of it is all the fun!','Girls Just Want to Have Fun',16263,4.1646,6.1,'hF8xTBL3pGI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9295,_binary '\0','/5qsyqA7FeYRymBmNbPBqBgqWPO4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089218',7.7,330476,'en','The Goonies','Young teen Mikey Walsh and his friends set off on a quest to find Pirate One-Eyed Willie\'s treasure in hopes of saving their homes from demolition. However, on their quest to find the treasure, they run into a family of recently escaped criminals, determined to capture the kids and reach the treasure first.','/eBU7gCjTCj9n2LTxvCSIXXOvHkD.jpg','1985-06-07',114,'Released','They call themselves \"The Goonies.\" The secret caves. The old lighthouse. The lost map. The treacherous traps. The hidden adventure. And Sloth… Join the adventure.','The Goonies',9340,14.8071,7.513,'AaM2vMbY4_Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9296,_binary '\0','/iG8HRE45X13dxZSzSgFcEms85O5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089222',6.2,8960,'en','Gotcha!','A student on a trip to France is tricked into smuggling secrets across the Iron Curtain by a sexy spy.','/8qHvL1w0NYemVeppB1UKlAd1pS0.jpg','1985-05-03',101,'Released','His first time may be his last.','Gotcha!',27590,2.8053,5.973,'rm9oMGJDY-8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9297,_binary '\0','/hxvH7VQxAIGdrOQEJYx6MzwQECY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089243',4.4,5018,'en','Gymkata','U.S. agents send a gymnastic martial artist to secure a missile-base site in the savage country of Parmistan.','/y8RhLH1TTJppX0sr4pHGLdKFbc9.jpg','1985-05-03',90,'Released','The skill of gymnastics, the kill of karate.','Gymkata',14570,1.6645,5.3,'9PisYF8sNV0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9298,_binary '\0','/yD24dgazea7WqzoBWZQ8X6jD27A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089254',4.5,2005,'en','Hard Rock Zombies','A hard rock band travels to the tiny and remote town of Grand Guignol to perform. Peopled by hicks, rubes, werewolves, murderous dwarves, sex perverts, and Hitler, the town is a strange place but that doesn\'t stop the band\'s lead singer from falling in love with a local girl named Cassie. After Nazi sex perverts kill the band to satisfy their lusts, Cassie calls the rockers back from the grave to save her, the town, and maybe the world.','/7nWiQJbNVSIr7Py1gUKfUG8NQ5L.jpg','1985-08-28',98,'Released','They came from the grave to Rock n\' Rave and misbehave.','Hard Rock Zombies',28128,1.7849,3.7,'jUEK6FlOmkY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9299,_binary '\0','/rJnY56RDLdCTX7FTpnOaoR8q6Iv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089264',6.9,5575,'en','Heaven Help Us','Sixteen-year-old Michael Dunn arrives at St. Basil\'s Catholic Boys School in Brooklyn circa 1965. There, he befriends all of the misfits in his class as they collide with the repressive faculty and discover the opposite sex as they come of age.','/pZ345bJOpi30Nb5ZN6qDGySOAOf.jpg','1985-02-08',104,'Released','If God had wanted them to be angels, He would have given them wings!','Heaven Help Us',40929,2.6096,6.361,'dIrtQAibsNA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9300,_binary '\0','/sx1pAjShtzYPvIIsAZ4xNqERJcc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089265',6.3,6365,'en','The Heavenly Kid','After dying in a car crash, Bobby Fantana is forced to pay for his misdeeds by becoming someone\'s guardian angel. He reluctantly agrees to watch over awkward high schooler Lenny Barnes, teaching him how to be cool and confident. As Bobby teaches Lenny, the two form a close bond.','/yn4ri4OJI29M6wvn2ziXhHd8EuX.jpg','1985-07-26',90,'Released','Thou shalt be cool!','The Heavenly Kid',23614,2.7627,6.6,'PR2Bm59Hp8Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9301,_binary '\0','/vZEl9im8IQ1ezBhrfAQ8tqT960h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089269',5,1379,'en','Hellhole','An unlucky woman’s mother is murdered by a scarf-wielding killer named Silk, leaving the woman injured, traumatised and suffering from amnesia. She’s committed to a mental institution, where Silk follows her, looking for the papers he was trying to get from her mother. And Silk’s only the beginning of her problems, since the asylum is run by a mad doctor, performing experiments in chemical lobotomies!','/g6wm2BVwIjgFoi2ylT2EmksM1Ry.jpg','1985-03-15',96,'Released','CAPTIVES... Stripped Naked, Forced To Submit To The Ultimate Experiment!','Hellhole',28734,1.3787,4.9,'NTV2ErDXWh0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9302,_binary '\0','/jKzGT9BjzewzgwrlZqA40TzuX8b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089271',4,1857,'en','The Adventures of Hercules','Hercules searches for the Seven Thunderbolts of Zeus, which have been stolen by renegade gods.','/pZNFBf5SRMGxt7NBnORfGEDKozk.jpg','1985-05-02',88,'Released','The man with supernatural strength returns to battle the forces of evil!','The Adventures of Hercules',30577,2.5292,4.8,'rPnCdZIjPI8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9303,_binary '\0','/a9F2cldYpiwyOvR528D66wZ4git.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089274',3.8,8255,'en','The Hills Have Eyes Part 2','A motocross team on their way to trial a new super-fuel head out across the desert lead by Rachel, who, unbeknownst to the rest of the group, is a survivor of the cannibal clan which menaced the Carter family several years before.','/cGLzgE2BTcHHyCXxS1lMxyY0iuc.jpg','1985-08-02',90,'Released','So you think you\'re lucky to be alive...','The Hills Have Eyes Part 2',18477,3.1508,4.3,'FcZHVs8lHTo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9304,_binary '\0','/qYQmznfMC433HrX5m58MJB0QOlK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089276',7.7,11915,'es','La historia oficial','Buenos Aires, Argentina, 1983. In the last and turbulent days of the military dictatorship, Alicia, a high school history teacher, begins to ask uncomfortable questions about the dark origins of Gaby, her adopted daughter.','/kkeUKaETggOrR0eW9nzPOIoZkZH.jpg','1985-04-03',112,'Released','A truth too frightening to ignore','The Official Story',29263,2.3388,7.5,'4IbHh9ixyxQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9305,_binary '\0','/xVRFR46X0asgsSCW3y0lQcrGmBx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089280',2.3,12809,'en','Hobgoblins','A band of misfit teenagers, along with a film studio security guard, must recapture escaped hobgoblins with the ability to make people live out their wildest fantasies.','/rwSVqMihUeRQR94UxWkGnRbn2ZJ.jpg','1988-07-14',88,'Released','Be careful what you wish for... you just might get it!','Hobgoblins',31245,1.7667,3.6,'o0fhewrzBRM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9306,_binary '\0','/bNsXy0ewCPm2hCvjw0CHXpRrSqr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089283',5.7,4420,'en','The Holcroft Covenant','A man who was a confidant of Adolf Hitler dies and leaves a fortune to make amends for his Nazi past—but his son has to search the world to find it.','/eQtcX6Y1fBAxZL3dm2BGN0lIaEH.jpg','1985-09-20',112,'Released','Noel Holcroft is suddenly heir to one of the greatest fortunes in history. Now, all he has to do is stay alive to collect it.','The Holcroft Covenant',35201,2.2388,5.51,'zPUsnsKoVwo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9307,_binary '\0','/1DuRq7RRKv3j0wOqVDOE7f1ezEL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089284',6.5,3636,'fr','Hold-up','Dressed as a clown, the clever rascal Grimm holds up the most secure bank of Montreal and takes 30 hostages. While confusing and ridiculing the police with his strange behavior, he calmly manages to rid the bank of a fortune. But then an unsatisfied companion arouses trouble...','/zjsNO85RElSg7A949oN9MalmcLV.jpg','1985-10-23',114,'Released',NULL,'Hold-up',40411,3.0231,6.191,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9308,_binary '\0','/nIKGIOYyOEm3UE31CAIpFUPh8Pr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089297',7.4,2278,'pt','A Hora da Estrela','Macabéa has just moved to the big city after her aunt, who raised her, died. She gets a job as a typist and moves into a boarding house with three other women. In her spare time, she listens to a radio station called Time; on Sundays, she likes to ride the metro. Then she meets Olímpico, a northeasterner like herself, who has dreams of becoming a congressman.','/wjjq98Og5LTIpfBZri4giCs0xvx.jpg','1986-04-25',96,'Released',NULL,'Hour of the Star',42031,2.4946,7.3,'jCVVei38HZs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9309,_binary '\0','/hZ3ZYxFmLXMqucV7WYviPzfQmHX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089308',3.8,9343,'en','Howling II: Stirba - Werewolf Bitch','When a young journalist dies in violent circumstances, her brother soon learns, by way of the mysterious Stefan Crosscoe, that his sister has succumbed to the werewolf curse.','/zeVbDQ4FuyiKRZWOLubRuFiGkqV.jpg','1985-08-28',91,'Released','The rocking, shocking, new wave of horror!','Howling II: Stirba - Werewolf Bitch',29794,3.5686,4.9,'6tWoswwyONY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9310,_binary '\0','/aS46Kr6DCqUAKdLW0k1mOO8xmle.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089338',5.6,3024,'it','Inferno in diretta','A reporter and her cameraman connect a surviving Jonestown leader and a TV exec\'s missing son to a drug war where jungle installations are being massacred by an army of natives and a skilled white assassin.','/nM79J0phqXnnXxR2rYBIk880gRv.jpg','1985-08-08',90,'Released','The one story you won\'t be seeing on the 6 o\'clock news!','Cut and Run',30877,2.5611,5.308,'ySj2qt06XdA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9311,_binary '\0','/dI1tVcS6yz8uiU9eLToTfDBCKMK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089343',6.4,4342,'en','Insignificance','Four 1950s icons meet in the same hotel room, and two of them discover more in common between them than they ever anticipated.','/priidLcX1Qxp0m0vaTa9vSwZ8ZZ.jpg','1985-08-02',109,'Released','A comedy about life, death, sex, and the Universe... relatively speaking.','Insignificance',42035,2.3211,6.4,'UguoW3xKP8U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9312,_binary '\0','/4BzmhmxdhAjsK1gcZfytYGAibr0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089346',6.4,14955,'en','Into the Night','Ed Okin used to have a boring life. He used to have trouble getting to sleep. Then one night, he met Diana. Now, Ed\'s having trouble staying alive.','/voqfHibbZVtl9o6D2MRcdQmN42i.jpg','1985-02-22',115,'Released','A dangerous romance','Into the Night',11338,5.1206,6.5,'ocj8ceZPM9Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9313,_binary '\0','/4FGUzyY421gOjPwfRr3jNvEsJVX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089348',5.5,13376,'en','Invasion U.S.A.','A one-man army comes to the rescue of the United States when a spy attempts an invasion.','/mE5dSRTKW1dzV7D0pgP8sMxyIa9.jpg','1985-09-27',107,'Released','America wasn\'t ready...but HE was!','Invasion U.S.A.',15983,5.3792,5.8,'-ttJX4Z1hzk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9314,_binary '\0','/oPQqAgvVLpvmQOalLHxXlRQtHYY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089360',6.5,18835,'en','Jagged Edge','After a wealthy heiress is murdered in her beach house, her devastated husband becomes the prime suspect. He hires a lawyer who hasn’t taken a criminal case in years, and as they work together, a complicated romance develops amidst the trial.','/wHYjo3NLc293ZEXVSGhRIUr3Iqi.jpg','1985-10-04',108,'Released','When a murder case is this shocking, which do you trust? Your emotions or your evidence?','Jagged Edge',12235,5.3687,6.2,'ZnQa0AI10ic','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9315,_binary '\0','/9vSZmqmVIJOZY7sHKjAXqm2FqjZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089366',6.3,4083,'fr','Je vous salue, Marie','A college student gets pregnant without having intercourse, affecting people close and unrelated to her in different ways.','/oh1dJ1rlWqRuUa1ceRTBqEikmRF.jpg','1985-01-23',72,'Released',NULL,'Hail Mary',32720,2.445,6.2,'h1E8c6sSk_w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9316,_binary '\0','/6QstEy47t8yLY3FZCqukbKlYIH3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089370',6.1,66783,'en','The Jewel of the Nile','Joan Wilder is thrust back into a world of murder, chases, foreign intrigue... and love. This time out she\'s duped by a duplicitous Arab dignitary who brings her to the Middle East, ostensibly to write a book about his life. Of course, he\'s up to no good, and Joan is just another pawn in his wicked game. But Jack Colton and his sidekick Ralph show up to help our intrepid heroine save the day.','/6VjsIhnIcrz2XdQVHdsMj5DdSa1.jpg','1985-08-01',106,'Released','They\'re back again...and romancing a brand new stone.','The Jewel of the Nile',10303,7.3374,6.211,'K8ZvVDiYc88','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9317,_binary '\0','/cg7EbS8B0bPMOFljWnhy3DaSdgy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089371',7.2,5444,'cn','殭屍先生','After the planned reburial of a village elder goes awry and the corpse resurrects into a hopping vampire, a Taoist priest and his two disciples attempt to stop him.','/9PxDXGCOsGiuoi0frojdErKflNX.jpg','1985-11-07',98,'Released',NULL,'Mr. Vampire',67342,3.4015,6.9,'JojYPtVqfXY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9318,_binary '\0','/eYDAnSidN4rIEuneS5gEJkTyk3l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089374',7.5,47236,'cn','警察故事','Officer Chan Ka Kui manages to put a major Hong Kong drug dealer behind the bars practically alone, after a shooting and an impressive chase inside a slum. Now, he must protect the boss\' secretary, Selina, who will testify against the gangster in court.','/1eFB0Iy1TMU4VO5hMcoCE064JAT.jpg','1985-12-14',99,'Released','From the master of action comes more screen excitement than you\'ve ever seen.','Police Story',9056,7.13,7.558,'EpXMJ3wo0kI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9319,_binary '\0','/8JRNR4r7a998im5Zqb1DRJtzsjT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089378',4.7,2118,'de','Joey','A nine year old boy named Joey, who after the tragic death of his father, begins to experience psychic powers such as allowing him to move inanimate objects with his mind, set things on fire, and even communicate with his dead father. However, not everything is good for Joey as his newly gained powers accidentally awake an evil supernatural force that is contained inside the body of an old ventriloquist\'s dummy that Joey found in an abandoned house. The supernatural Dummy shows similar powers to Joey\'s, and soon he puts the lives of everyone near Joey in danger as the evil Dummy has dark plans for Joey\'s special powers.','/3RM5CqGzcG5f5gnt1vtOoMDFv0t.jpg','1985-11-21',94,'Released','Only he can see it. Only he shares its magic. Only he knows the danger.','Making Contact',7011,2.5913,5.5,'fGrFEQNsHq0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9320,_binary '\0','/wUvn8kcausADaBOAabm7X1pQtoi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089385',7,7870,'en','The Journey of Natty Gann','America is in the depths of the Great Depression. Families drift apart when faraway jobs beckon. A courageous young girl confronts overwhelming odds when she embarks on a cross-country search for her father. During her odyssey, she forms a close bond with two diverse traveling companions: a magnificent, protective wolf, and a hardened drifter.','/z2eHb3ih4k9zannMKn3wmVvYAis.jpg','1985-09-27',101,'Released','The journey that made the impossible come true.','The Journey of Natty Gann',35144,4.3476,6.826,'leaqKfAB12o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9321,_binary '\0','/wXYv3mC6mZPVChHBMxF2tVILcLb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089393',6.5,20556,'en','Just One of the Guys','When Terry Griffith loses her high school\'s writing competition, she\'s convinced that it\'s because she\'s a girl. So Terry decides to change high schools and pose as a boy to prove her point. Her brother, Buddy, helps her pass as a guy so well that she is soon making friends with the boys at school, including the attractive Rick, who becomes her new best friend. But her gender-swapping makes things difficult when she falls in love with him.','/7ffvsRv8ueYYK0H3zocmNRPd8yN.jpg','1985-04-26',100,'Released','She\'s about to go where no girl has gone before!','Just One of the Guys',24548,7.5738,6.427,'XN_py_XHZmg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9322,_binary '\0','/fT11CFfHP1FCFqDHv9e2S5BpAht.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089413',7.5,1273,'hi','Khamosh','A young actress is found to have committed suicide at the filming location. Things take a different turn when further investigation reveals it to be a cold-blooded murder and the killer is someone within the film crew.','/dVRX6EZG0Z672wArMtWQZX5DuQj.jpg','1986-03-14',102,'Released','Classic whodunit','Khamosh',188719,0.9542,7.4,'8hFnEAAT3yo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9323,_binary '\0','/oIX9RraqTaqfyFQkrsbVt1oN3mn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089420',5.3,2791,'en','King David','This is a movie about the life of Israel\'s king David.','/pFdaND8Dl4yLGvzIBlahiqAaec3.jpg','1985-03-29',114,'Released','The story of the man.','King David',42040,2.9463,5.741,'ocE-Zs2E3Kc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9324,_binary '\0','/aVgqxRQ8M8aJnfO1eUZEmNJSTxm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089421',5.2,16922,'en','King Solomon\'s Mines','Ever in search of adventure, explorer Allan Quatermain agrees to join the beautiful Jesse Huston on a mission to locate her archaeologist father, who has been abducted for his knowledge of the legendary mines of King Solomon. As the kidnappers, led by sinister German military officer Bockner, journey into the wilds of Africa, Allan and Jesse track the party and must contend with fierce natives and dangerous creatures, among other perils.','/kpaW2gh0hjMPwoz30JL3gRKi2Ho.jpg','1985-11-22',100,'Released','An action packed adventure, full of laughs and heroics.','King Solomon\'s Mines',9838,7.3854,5.4,'LI4xsKHBx8c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9325,_binary '\0','/sQSKR3iDCtayRTN2Nr9LiRYy6TT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089424',7.3,19654,'en','Kiss of the Spider Woman','The story of two radically different men thrown together in a Latin American prison cell. One is Valentin, a journalist being tortured for his political beliefs. The other is Molina, a gay window-dresser who fills their lonely nights by spinning romantic fantasies drawn from memories of old movies.','/lbrn4gOjYKrLrINn3uUJRlV2NZO.jpg','1985-07-26',120,'Released','Once upon a time... in a tropical island far away, there lived a strange woman…','Kiss of the Spider Woman',11703,4.529,7,'8ljMaR_hSaU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9326,_binary '\0','/oZRpEhbiKHcRZrXhZFZoaSVny8t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089444',6.4,3828,'en','Krush Groove','Russell Walker is a young, successful manager of rap performers, handling acts for the Krush Groove label, including Run-DMC and The Fat Boys. When Run-D.M.C. has a hit record and Russell needs more money to press more copies, he borrows it from a street hustler and soon regrets his decision.','/83jp1uZp9405rkHKzDuX8qnJbhw.jpg','1985-10-25',97,'Released','It\'s chillin\'!','Krush Groove',29463,1.924,6.4,'herEmuXyoDM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9327,_binary '\0','/DNb1rBm6R75IJ88PKOd0wfCHm6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089457',6.9,55873,'en','Ladyhawke','Captain Etienne Navarre is a man on whose shoulders lies a cruel curse. Punished for loving each other, Navarre must become a wolf by night whilst his lover, Lady Isabeau, takes the form of a hawk by day. Together, with the thief Philippe Gaston, they must try to overthrow the corrupt Bishop and in doing so break the spell.','/l3nRJ9Cs7C1AZ7das8S76QqwqjI.jpg','1985-03-27',121,'Released','No force in Heaven will release them. No power on Earth can save them.','Ladyhawke',526,6.5302,7,'iGs4o_5jyhw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9328,_binary '\0','/9pqox4KAKGdfqYTkdXeDImUWWmJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089461',6.8,18454,'en','The Last Dragon','A young man searches for the \"master\" to obtain the final level of martial arts mastery known as the glow. Along the way he must fight an evil martial arts expert and rescue a beautiful singer from an obsessed music promoter.','/r5QnLY30gXlZ8luiJE3quDs1WNF.jpg','1985-03-22',109,'Released','His family thinks he\'s crazy. His enemies think he\'s no challenge. But she knows he\'s THE LAST DRAGON.','The Last Dragon',13938,4.3843,6.6,'10qwLUnm4qE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9329,_binary '\0','/3g8rLMw0SbA0h2GHiOCBoqFTXVq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089469',6.3,81265,'en','Legend','Set in a timeless mythical forest inhabited by fairies, goblins, unicorns and mortals, this fantastic story follows a mystical forest dweller, chosen by fate, to undertake a heroic quest. He must save the beautiful Princess Lili and defeat the demonic Lord of Darkness, or the world will be plunged into a never-ending ice age.','/6n3PQSYpZRK5YPk2w8JEwED7AZk.jpg','1985-08-28',94,'Released','There may never be another dawn.','Legend',11976,10.3267,6.3,'ybnoJErfDas','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9330,_binary '\0','/d6fvHVaOia07EACi5RmZmV05u85.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089470',6.7,13355,'en','The Legend of Billie Jean','Average Texas teen, Billie Jean Davy, is caught up in an odd fight for justice. She is usually followed and harrased around by local boys, who, one day, decide to trash her brother\'s scooter for fun. The boys\' father refuses to pay them back the price of the scooter. The fight for \"fair is fair\" takes the teens around the state and produces an unlikely hero.','/x2u2YtbJ9XySs3MdaIly8Gfp66.jpg','1985-07-19',95,'Released','When you\'re seventeen, people think they can do anything to you. Billie Jean is about to prove them wrong.','The Legend of Billie Jean',15982,4.8563,6.577,'FTyHPlRVTPI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9331,_binary '\0','/qUJ3W51NQchrStTLIs05e8gH15P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089477',6.7,1866,'en','Letter to Brezhnev','The factories, pubs, clubs, hotels and streets of 1980s Liverpool form the backdrop for this tale of love, friendship, sex and a letter to the Soviet leader, Leonid Brezhnev. Two Liverpool lasses, Teresa and Elaine meet two Russian sailors, Sergei and Peter and hook up for a night of fun and frolics. Teresa is looking for sex and a smile, Elaine wants love, romance and the dream of a life far away from the grime of the Liverpool docklands. A classic British romantic comedy filled with new wave tunes, 80s fashion, a little politics and a lot of heart.','/1N5A2OdF4GUGu094wBdbqmruoc4.jpg','1985-11-15',91,'Released','A new wave comedy … from Liverpool with Love.','Letter to Brezhnev',60363,1.5355,6.5,'5xGbyyoCvF4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9332,_binary '\0','/s9HTDDMNUhMVAusrjBL2gkWD372.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089488',7.2,1705,'en','The Life and Adventures of Santa Claus','The Great Ak calls a council of the Immortals to ask that Santa Claus be given immortality. And to justify it, he tells the history of Santa Claus. The Ak found an abandoned baby and gave it to a lioness and a fairy to raise, who named him Claus. When Claus grew up, the Great Ak showed him the evil and hardship in the world and Claus decides to live there and relieve some of the suffering. He decides to make toys for orphans, but King Awgwa, the ruler of the valley where Claus lives doesn\'t want the children to be happy, and there is a great battle among Immortals.','/1qHANHUA3T751EPEylfuHWcB2Rf.jpg','1985-12-17',50,'Released',NULL,'The Life and Adventures of Santa Claus',48880,1.7637,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9333,_binary '\0','/8SnnGg0cqfa3bmorOERNrXvZ8Mn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089489',6.2,35356,'en','Lifeforce','A race of space vampires arrives in London and infects the populace, commencing an apocalyptic descent into chaos.','/AeLmyhJNQd2BMFGER36ctAeDhIp.jpg','1985-06-21',102,'Released','In the blink of an eye, the terror begins.','Lifeforce',11954,7.3488,6.2,'B18wv1oAJGc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9334,_binary '\0','/4Oc02EALUgJSo5BBwwakh8zLIKY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089501',4.4,1723,'en','Loose Screws','What happens when four high school screw-ups are forced to attend an academy summer school to graduate? They turn their scholastic sentence into a wacky game of trying to improve their scores... with the women. The ultimate conquest for the 100-point prize is the sexy new French teacher, but she proves to be a bigger challenge than their failing grades. The unforgiving principal foils every scheme, and their sidesplitting last chance is the academy\'s anniversary celebration.','/lUYuorrNoVvEmee8SPtATKnWqvd.jpg','1985-08-01',77,'Released','More fun than you can shake your stick at!','Loose Screws',44191,1.6451,5.2,'ftVwPKfHueM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9335,_binary '\0','/8YtiBznNpHgbvbDWXPSZMh3Blwu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089503',4.7,2091,'en','The Lost Empire','A police officer and her two companions battle an evil genius with diabolical plans to destroy the world. Whoever can find the three sacred jewels can anticipate total power.','/gb0mIk4hp6M7ybxjqU1MHX3g7lP.jpg','1984-06-22',83,'Released','A Roaring Adventure with Blistering Action and Eye-Popping Women!','The Lost Empire',100697,2.3301,4.7,'qPtfDoFPPrg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9336,_binary '\0','/7XpgGenPC31U3nsqIQPJCr8OdhY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089504',7,11637,'en','Lost in America','David and Linda Howard are successful yuppies from LA. When he gets a job disappointment, David convinces Linda that they should quit their jobs, liquidate their assets, and emulate the movie Easy Rider, spending the rest of their lives traveling around America...in a Winnebago.','/j7QiwUekGiYOmjKratNORIr35zg.jpg','1985-02-08',91,'Released',NULL,'Lost in America',27223,2.5454,6.878,'bW-m70vJU1o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9337,_binary '\0','/6VGdPgZXy1pZIJdcYNsojuPBIVc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089523',5.9,4115,'en','Lust in the Dust','Assaulted by outlaws, donkey-riding Rosie joins a silent drifter\'s search for gold in the Old West.','/5QNVgDTlM551UUaAxwdVMcZ7aWT.jpg','1985-03-01',84,'Released','He rode the West... The girls rode the rest! Together they ravaged the land!','Lust in the Dust',47107,2.814,6,'GVp4HIj1JcA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9338,_binary '\0','/cO8zcdPhLT3UdykkXCvfhIVrgHK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089530',6.2,163625,'en','Mad Max Beyond Thunderdome','Mad Max becomes a pawn in a decadent oasis of a technological society, and when exiled, becomes the deliverer of a colony of children.','/jJlxcEVVUHnrUeEkQ0077VeHQpb.jpg','1985-06-29',107,'Released','Hold out for Mad Max. This is his greatest adventure.','Mad Max Beyond Thunderdome',9355,10.9108,6.216,'YOol44WGats','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9339,_binary '\0','/4hShA64zX3yz3CdPUG63Nb1d7KF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089537',6.5,4733,'en','Mala Noche','Walt is a lonely convenience store clerk who has fallen in love with a Mexican migrant worker named Johnny. Though Walt has little in common with the object of his affections — including a shared language — his desire to possess Johnny prompts a sexual awakening that results in a tangled love triangle.','/gAtkeNjk054tEl3jCHtF1wOFCx1.jpg','1987-06-19',75,'Released','If you fuck with the bull, you get the horn!','Mala Noche',383,1.942,6.1,'jjzmk4kPkqo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9340,_binary '\0','/pbC6zKR2biiSD80VRHfVkzpnHXf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089538',4.9,1355,'en','The Malibu Bikini Shop','After inheriting a failing bikini shop, two recent grads decide to make a go of it. One, in the hopes of building it into a successful business, the other, in the hopes of getting to look at lots of women in (and out) of swimsuits. As they try more and more outrageous ways of drumming up business, their antics begin attracting some unwanted attention.','/qD0Q7Q9K6LSKFtug1heQdjAllvG.jpg','1986-11-01',99,'Released',NULL,'The Malibu Bikini Shop',30296,2.4267,4.5,'IJ4rF-g7mk0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9341,_binary '\0','/mHJ3u9eSRo6EdbnELxggV6diMX4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089539',4.7,3369,'en','Malibu Express','In this erotic spy tale private eye Cody Abilene teams up with the Contessa Luciana and policewoman Beverly McAfee to infiltrate a mansion and discover who is sending computer secrets to the Russians.','/6ssdfTlmT3ORRoJNnLBYiOhDlf7.jpg','1985-03-01',101,'Released','Packing Heat From Texas To Malibu Beach','Malibu Express',64494,3.1882,4.8,'4be4fc6ACtM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9342,_binary '\0','/1iwpwlP9SafsCxMKieZVlxCjYaa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089543',5.7,17902,'en','The Man with One Red Shoe','A man is mistaken as a spy by the CIA when he arrives at the airport with one red shoe.','/lD44uiCKnLVCKiEnB0urtqIR0nE.jpg','1985-07-18',92,'Released','Mugged, bugged, chased and seduced. Why is every one after Tom Hanks?','The Man with One Red Shoe',10905,5.0112,5.7,'sKUqdMHoPNQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9343,_binary '\0','/zsNqsUoon93MfsmXEoKBrfyoeaP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089552',6.3,2478,'hi','Mard','King Azad gets locked in a dungeon by the British general Dyer who wants to take over his kingdom. Years later, Azad\'s son decides to put an end to Dyer\'s tyranny and comes to his father\'s rescue.','/9GF0wzkQd1LcecHkuwe0BFulC2s.jpg','1985-10-09',177,'Released',NULL,'Mard',223091,1.3426,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9344,_binary '\0','/xhaIbAXa6HOpYFn387a63Ser2wy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089560',7.2,35535,'en','Mask','A significantly deformed but highly intelligent teenage boy and his biker gang mother attempt to live as normal a life as possible under the circumstances.','/yO54XMNbbLukU4YCuPWPxhzn70z.jpg','1985-03-08',120,'Released','They told 16 year old Rocky Dennis he could never be like everyone else. So he was determined to be better.','Mask',11177,4.9833,7.3,'VbH-Q3OL63M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9345,_binary '\0','/qpwaBWGLRyHDoCGRRlMATndEolV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089562',5.2,2797,'it','Nudo e selvaggio','A plane crashes in the Amazon jungle, and its passengers must battle their way through cannibals, slave traders, wild animals and murderous piranha fish to safety.','/sMgQpcbb1l2G2oZDgxVV0MmOCYS.jpg','1985-08-13',88,'Released','A journey into the cannibal inferno!','Massacre in Dinosaur Valley',86640,2.4226,5.1,'aPr6F8hzoMs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9346,_binary '\0','/8zvH5egZREfyS3AiuSPlsfC0AA0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089565',4.2,1309,'en','Mata Hari','In August 1914, war between France and Germany seems imminent. Mata Hari, a beautiful Dutch-born dancer working in Paris, accepts an invitation to travel to Berlin as part of a show. On the train, she meets a young German army officer but any thoughts of romance are cut short when a French agent is murdered while in her company. She is arrested in Germany but freed when the officer intervenes. While in Germany, WWI breaks out and Hari is recruited by German Intelligence to spy on France.','/caGQ9SFwLku7ceIu63bbKYKGkUu.jpg','1985-09-05',108,'Released','Infamous in her time, a legend in ours.','Mata Hari',70903,1.8563,4.115,'1llqI5-qREE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9347,_binary '\0','/s9hG97rLL7S3H9Wq28c6ctEjPsV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089568',7.1,2510,'en','Max Headroom: 20 Minutes into the Future','While trying to expose corruption and greed, television reporter Edison Carter discovers that his employer, Network 23, has created a new form of subliminal advertising (termed \"blip-verts\") that can be fatal to certain viewers.','/qL2kwjt2Ggt83YBjDhZcmVp3zkN.jpg','1985-04-04',57,'Released','Bringing you the truth in a world gone Max.','Max Headroom: 20 Minutes into the Future',35933,2.0594,6.538,'6cVDrhljZBE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9348,_binary '\0','/grl4dwJgNyFeEi37XhDLyNveyF9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089569',5.5,1284,'en','Maxie','When Nick and Jan move into their new apartment in San Francisco, the batty landlady upstairs tells them about a girl who used to live there in the 20\'s: a brash young party girl named Maxie, who died in a car crash the morning before her big audition for a Hollywood studio. The trouble is, Maxie, or rather her ghost, hasn\'t left the house. Worse, she can take over Jan\'s body. And the only way she\'s going to leave is if she gets that audition.','/A8r4kohTjz3rL7RdLDl2FRsQVHY.jpg','1985-09-27',98,'Released','Her big movie comeback has a ghost of a chance.','Maxie',89300,1.4371,5,'N92Up4PeNo4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9349,_binary '\0','/sR8OooMcYWktkeYHJbbLNOzXnBB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089572',6.1,6549,'en','The Mean Season','A routine investigation of a shocking murder takes a bizarre twist when the killer contacts the reporter and appoints him his personal spokesman. As the killer\'s calls and clues increase, the reporter is lured into a deadly trap.','/dCPzsNt2Hznkr54J6wfGzpnE1Z4.jpg','1985-02-15',103,'Released','A time between summer... and murder.','The Mean Season',31652,3.1397,6.2,'JWfqjRsVJWI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9350,_binary '\0','/8DTBYMJCjBn7RonrRP3l9Iocmws.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089584',7.2,2269,'it','La messa è finita','Young Father Giulio returns to Rome, where he was born and raised, to replace a priest who has left the clergy to start a family. He is delighted to reunite with his loved ones, especially his mother, sister, and old friends. Once radical leftists like Giulio himself, the latter are now each coping in their own way with the defeat of the revolution. Soon, however, Giulio realizes that despite his best efforts, he seems unable to solve the problems troubling those around him.','/eCdfHMyFRc5uDG2cdIOlc5rBGUd.jpg','1985-11-15',94,'Released','His hopes shattered, now it is time for another place...','The Mass Is Ended',60732,2.1315,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9351,_binary '\0','/sS0MhzRDPAUxT412DqAyhhs6yFY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089591',6.1,9326,'it','Miami Supercops','In 1978, $20 million was stolen from a Detroit bank. One of the robbers was caught, one was found dead, and the third disappeared. The money was never found. Seven years later, the robber who was caught was released from jail. He immediately went to Miami, only to be found dead the next day. Now FBI agents Doug Bennet and Steve Forest have been called in to investigate the case while posing as Miami police officers. Somewhere in Miami the third robber is hiding with his $20 million, and he has a seven-year head start on the authorities.','/j0zfJkOfQr4DfcxjjeCVFjirKpu.jpg','1985-12-11',96,'Released',NULL,'Miami Supercops',10295,4.4432,6.4,'k2dvrTiRLLc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9352,_binary '\0','/l4jlHRXi1FpT0HWXK1fsdFctRmP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089593',6.4,2693,'en','The Midnight Hour','Phil, Melissa, Mitch, Mary, and Vinnie are high school friends, who unwittingly raise the dead on Halloween night. Once the dead have returned, Pitchford Cove will never be the same again....or will it?','/ge4JJ1T8dD36IdEAo0U8lz3CBas.jpg','1985-11-01',94,'Released','Ghouls just want to have fun...','The Midnight Hour',35564,2.4561,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9353,_binary '\0','/qYCSR5V7E6AupsLdifUW1txJUtT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089598',4.9,2906,'it','Miranda','In 1950s Ferrara, a lonely innkeeper explores a series of relationships while awaiting her missing husband’s return from war.','/5SZMrHVRmnFzsZPhfO0ZOwX1YRc.jpg','1985-10-15',100,'Released',NULL,'Miranda',52212,5.3906,5.1,'ksc3tUsXzVg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9354,_binary '\0','/xJX4zFywyO7CeJIUJIIOZccePhz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089599',7.8,1726,'hi','मिर्च मसाला','Early-1940s, rural British India. When a woman decides to fight against the village\'s despotic subedar and is supported by the guard of the local spice factory, more women join to defy the prevailing oppression.','/9lY52bfpPrnwhZOctMZX8qDfPOI.jpg','1987-02-18',121,'Released',NULL,'Mirch Masala',232791,1.3262,7.857,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9355,_binary '\0','/l5LZO6B55GS5Q3JBBYNZXfY0yTu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089601',6.5,7759,'en','Mischief','1956: The shy Jonathan\'s luck with girls changes when he wins the rebellious Gene as a friend in his last year of high school. Gene is adored by many girls and manages to teach Jonathan a few lessons. Gene himself would rather just be with one girl: his girlfriend Bunny. But since his father is poor, her parents don\'t accept him.','/ejZ2AUQKnKiSoLegCQXT2Rdjm7r.jpg','1985-02-08',93,'Released','The first time seems like the worst time, but it\'s the one time you\'ll never forget!','Mischief',14750,4.3231,6.655,'2GRuURIX7Ds','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9356,_binary '\0','/PnwQJeWhmx9wh9wWM0a0YhLmE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089603',7.9,17243,'ja','Mishima: A Life in Four Chapters','A fictional account of the life of Japanese author Yukio Mishima, combining dramatizations of three of his novels and a depiction of the events of November 25th, 1970.','/4kIXsE4SwUjO0eUqpolsHNO5GLH.jpg','1985-09-20',121,'Released','On November 25, 1970, Japan\'s most celebrated writer, Yukio Mishima, shocked the world.','Mishima: A Life in Four Chapters',27064,5.6217,7.8,'5nVKJDSrxNg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9357,_binary '\0','/7xADC2HSQw9fAQuPMPsZS2XVPV7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089604',5.4,10697,'en','Missing in Action 2: The Beginning','Prequel to the first Missing In Action, set in the early 1980s it shows the capture of Colonel Braddock during the Vietnam war in the 1970s, and his captivity with other American POWs in a brutal prison camp, and his plans to escape.','/vOgiL2KQYyTHJ225lT5QB5B9kO0.jpg','1985-03-01',95,'Released','Chuck Norris is back! A one-man time bomb set to explode!','Missing in Action 2: The Beginning',12764,3.7103,5.8,'eap1lshAjIg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9358,_binary '\0','/zKqzUT0ZAljEYPLceye6ZT4H9By.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089606',7.6,23094,'sv','Mitt liv som hund','A boy, obsessed with comparing himself with those less fortunate, experiences a different life at the home of his aunt and uncle in 1959 Sweden.','/eVg9IsX2HtR1BNYH0UAhF4JPHi7.jpg','1985-12-12',102,'Released','It could have been worse. I\'ve actually been lucky. If you compare...','My Life as a Dog',8816,4.8191,7.2,'VxzO8Qx96O4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9359,_binary '\0','/9fO4f0H653e1YzrpYm1sQwr2YZE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089622',4.5,2351,'en','Morons from Outer Space','The story begins on a small spaceship docking with a refueling station. On board are a group of four aliens, Bernard, Sandra, Desmond, and Julian. During a particularly tedious period of their stay at the station, the other three begin playing with the ship’s controls while Bernard is outside playing spaceball. They accidentally disconnect his part of the ship, leaving him stranded while they crash into a large blue planet close by...','/2C7h2FMGBeMVZNO8IHXd2XjDAx6.jpg','1985-03-29',90,'Released','They came, they saw, they did a little shopping...','Morons from Outer Space',33525,2.742,4.9,'kZy6jOBqY84','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9360,_binary '\0','/2zEn0hhAOSEJiRnmRc7ijlHK6bH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089629',5.8,4807,'en','Moving Violations','A group of careless and unlucky drivers are sentenced to attend traffic school to keep their records clean.','/fHkEoH8APuiSZOcw28WPsoXCjOw.jpg','1985-04-19',90,'Released','A crash course in traffic school.','Moving Violations',31462,3.5515,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9361,_binary '\0','/vrqWxqg1ANAChv4RLI1UCeUXt0J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089640',6.3,1761,'en','Murder with Mirrors','When Miss Jane Marple arrives at palatial Stonygates, one thing is certain. Before there\'s time to lather a warm scone with marmalade and place a tea cozy, murder most foul is bound to occur.','/yIolMf9VRsEOzLok8H808pODNJy.jpg','1985-02-20',94,'Released',NULL,'Murder with Mirrors',6032,2.0683,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9362,_binary '\0','/oFKibkbBsT6Uy8Iih4xGyXlwKQg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089643',7,8079,'en','Murphy\'s Romance','Emma, a divorced single mother seeking to start her life over, moves to a small town in Arizona. She befriends Murphy, the older local pharmacist, but things turn complicated when her ex-husband shows up.','/hCl1X4Fh8LTQV283AJ5sKUanxV7.jpg','1985-12-25',107,'Released','Just when you think you\'ve found the right guy, someone even worse comes along.','Murphy\'s Romance',34322,2.2303,6.2,'HoX-xki1yHQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9363,_binary '\0','/2KDfY3QCRz23Xdi21Ey6ATa7Oe8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089652',6,7236,'en','My Science Project','His high school teacher issues an ultimatum: turn in a science project or flunk. So Mike Harlan scavenges a military base\'s junk pile for a suitable gizmo. He finds one... and unwittingly unleashes the awesome power and energy of the unknown. Twisted dimensions. Time warps. A fantastic realm where the past, present, and future collide in a whirling vortex of startling adventure and superlative special effects.','/1fbVPx5VVEsgJ7M9sTzvbDjhgks.jpg','1985-08-09',94,'Released','We must not destroy the world.','My Science Project',18252,2.8539,6.3,'hd2pyxmIPbE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9364,_binary '\0','/4oRTxCzg0tHY8bpjji0L40VpukM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089656',6.6,1425,'de','Männer','A successful, womanizing middle-aged man decides to move out of the house he shares with his wife after she confesses to having an affair. He looks for a new place to live and ends up moving into his wife\'s lover\'s apartment as a roommate. The husband begins to take an interest in the artistic work of the lover and coaches him for a big job interview. Little does he know that the job he\'s helping the lover to get is within his own company... A story about strange circumstances and the limits of friendship.','/sjNTqLlB1QBQTOXRoKgzYtaVcTf.jpg','1985-12-19',95,'Released',NULL,'Men...',10146,2.4405,6.1,'95_TWoEctnc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9365,_binary '\0','/2vwdO2ist8YgKg60p4N7S8Hwd0A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089670',6.2,75617,'en','National Lampoon\'s European Vacation','The Griswolds win a vacation to Europe on a game show, and so pack their bags for the continent. They do their best to catch the flavor of Europe, but they just don\'t know how to be be good tourists. Besides, they have trouble taking holidays in countries where they CAN speak the language.','/hZL7g1oSDrA0Lx5wcHpEl99MYKi.jpg','1985-07-25',95,'Released','For over two thousand years, Europe has survived many great disasters. Now for the real test. Chevy Chase & his family are coming from America!','National Lampoon\'s European Vacation',11418,6.5146,6.2,'vbF_7TiG5bg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9366,_binary '\0','/64mrdtS30ubr8lprr6yGR5cs7LS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089679',6.1,4841,'en','The New Kids','A brother and his young sister come to a small town to find out a local gang terrorizes the population.','/rFmDfsFgEtqhc49e95QK1rvg2l7.jpg','1985-01-18',90,'Released','The kids learned three things about southern hospitality, blood, sweat and terror.','The New Kids',72508,2.7996,6.373,'HtdYU7chrTw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9367,_binary '\0','/8cxB1CiiODiWFayDPxLsAeviZvc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089686',5.5,87298,'en','A Nightmare on Elm Street Part 2: Freddy\'s Revenge','A teenage boy is haunted in his dreams by deceased child murderer Freddy Krueger, who is out to possess him in order to continue his reign of terror in the real world.','/53kxYw0G3o55yJ23K7s7KMaOyAM.jpg','1985-11-01',87,'Released','The man of your dreams is back.','A Nightmare on Elm Street Part 2: Freddy\'s Revenge',10014,10.2585,5.795,'9iqNVyjwLFA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9368,_binary '\0','/daMs4Nzl7mWmqXo2ygD12JEovKA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089689',3.9,1762,'en','9 Deaths of the Ninja','A trio of specialized soldiers is called in to stop a group of drug traffickers who have hijacked a busload of tourists in the Philippines and threaten to kill them all if one of their companions is not released from jail and the government does not stop its anti-drug policies.','/2eXzrLX6nWZhHDvVHQjJ2qO2Z2M.jpg','1985-04-15',94,'Released','The Ninja Master… is now the Ninja Avenger','9 Deaths of the Ninja',51878,2.3011,5.2,'TeyoCbvver4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9369,_binary '\0','/3An1UnuPMWPkvLNSuUwYfSjyzXD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089695',5.6,20868,'en','No Retreat, No Surrender','The mob is trying to strongarm local martial arts schools, forcing young Jason Stillwell and his family to move after his father is injured defending their dojo. With his father now rejecting violence, Jason is forced to train on his own to protect himself and his best friend from the members of a rival karate school.','/bDwcHvRXIRVCD2RLACEsykzoHPe.jpg','1986-05-02',94,'Released','Tonight, He either fights for his life or he\'ll be running for the rest of it.','No Retreat, No Surrender',12721,5.7615,6.3,'2b9RBJGdU3Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9370,_binary '\0','/gTCMaobK5xfU5MP5cNyTA5o2qS2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089714',7.2,2635,'pl','O-bi, o-ba. Koniec cywilizacji','The world has been ravaged by nuclear war. The planet is frozen and radiation kills anyone or anything that ventures outside of \'The Dome\'. Soft is a shepherd for the last remnants of humanity who have gathered together as they await rescue from a mysterious craft known only as \'The Ark.\' He wanders among the masses, performing his regular daily tasks; keeping morale from plummeting, wooing prostitutes, squashing rebellions, and sometimes feeding the hungry. But as the true and sinister nature of \'The Dome\' comes to light, Soft must ask himself if humanity is worth saving...','/k1TBJxMMWKiyGIkJWDopU1TdtcE.jpg','1985-01-28',89,'Released','The Ark Does Not Exist.','O-Bi, O-Ba: The End of Civilization',71933,1.8194,6.912,'HuE-Q_w1j7w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9371,_binary '\0','/sN5ZbXF3Uq7RpVyDMJ84ev5xxhI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089715',5.3,1612,'en','O.C. and Stiggs','O.C. and Stiggs aren\'t your average unhappy teenagers. They not only despise their suburban surroundings, but they also plot against it. They seek revenge against the upper-middle-class Schwab family, who embody all they detest: excess.','/9km7ke6zDSmaahZhO2IVnczJcDh.jpg','1987-07-10',109,'Released','Adventures in upper middle class suburbia.','O.C. and Stiggs',27464,1.9594,4.6,'0rKC5ro11tc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9372,_binary '\0','/5Q9WdOH1fH3dKUTyaszZfiqxrP5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089716',7.4,3680,'de','Oberst Redl','Set during the fading glory of the Austro-Hungarian empire, the film tells of the rise and fall of Alfred Redl, an ambitious young officer who proceeds up the ladder to become head of the Secret Police only to become ensnared in political deception.','/oSOwBgEfMzJa3KqkqNUjBuV2DnT.jpg','1985-02-20',152,'Released',NULL,'Colonel Redl',29471,2.404,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9373,_binary '\0','/tOo41T9upKd5IaSbpl1yMeJ8Rqa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089730',5.6,19733,'en','Once Bitten','Mark wants to lose his virginity, but his girlfriend wants to wait. Unfortunately for both of them, a 400-year-old vampire Countess needs to turn a virgin into a vampire before Halloween in order to preserve her own youthful appearance, and when she finds Mark, she turns his life upside-down.','/eK3dxRrMQGpZ1kLD9wdyOI8urFZ.jpg','1985-11-15',94,'Released','Mark Kendall just found out his one-night stand has been around for centuries.','Once Bitten',19064,4.0826,5.799,'Qmgspdr_fwY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9374,_binary '\0','/pmhYWaMg11hgDKHhInlHtozStlo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089731',6.4,5140,'en','One Magic Christmas','Ginny Grainger, a young mother, rediscovers the joy and beauty of Christmas, thanks to the unshakable faith of her six-year-old daughter Abbie and Gideon, Ginny\'s very own guardian angel.','/kiKa6GhHDPRLgo4VAFRmeMBrvdB.jpg','1985-11-22',88,'Released',NULL,'One Magic Christmas',13380,2.8699,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9375,_binary '\0','/gduEO5xWcVbtrmJn1FJE1uPSnTc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089740',6.8,2366,'no','Orions belte','Live to tell the truth. What can one man do against the most lethal army on earth? Local fishermen/smugglers/tourist guides Tom, Lars and Sverre discover the Soviet Union aren\'t just mining for coal in the arctic archipelago of Svalbard. This is a secret too big for any of them, and soon they find themselves hunted down by Soviet forces and secret agents.','/kXLZJiSoMEJVq1x9s99zxd0Y7b1.jpg','1985-02-08',98,'Released',NULL,'Orion\'s Belt',27817,1.2861,5.778,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9376,_binary '\0','/aVo7EjNWnilRXwsFyzcH2l4K04o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089746',7.2,2350,'ja','お葬式','When Wabisuke\'s father-in-law unexpectedly dies, the family goes through a series of random events and occurrences as the funeral unfolds over three days in their home.','/qZ2o9jMfucCvGCcZxSNeLAAnF7G.jpg','1984-11-17',125,'Released','…A deadly comedy.','The Funeral',42095,3.2027,7.2,'p7eAHTmNqvs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9377,_binary '\0','/7heMAaXlsI3BwTatyxBSNTP3GhO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089748',7.7,10905,'sh','Otac na službenom putu','In a post-WWII Yugoslavia still under Stalinist rule in the 1950s, six-year-old Malik is oblivious as to why his father, Mehmed, has suddenly disappeared. In truth, Mehmed has been sent to a labor camp as punishment for acts of sexual indiscretion involving young girls. Malik\'s mother, Senija, however, has no answers, and the family must cope in the father\'s absence.','/jhTu6UwP32jPwiBccGAkZq0yqvV.jpg','1985-01-15',136,'Released',NULL,'When Father Was Away on Business',21042,3.0534,7.306,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9378,_binary '\0','/mQ6dQVRO0fjWtrf51Cfauy8piQ5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089753',6.4,5091,'de','Otto - Der Film','East Friesian Otto moves to the big city Hamburg. There he gets into trouble with a loan shark and needs to find a way to impress his love interest Silvia.','/5iE6qrXexeZfjV5PtUeKEbgJSCq.jpg','1985-07-19',85,'Released','Awarded Six Ottifants','Otto - The Movie',9657,1.8381,6.5,'rSc_T2etOyQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9379,_binary '\0','/5hCGJLTuRlD5WoscKhVPHVnD4gz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089755',7.2,94204,'en','Out of Africa','Tells the life story of Danish author Karen Blixen, who at the beginning of the 20th century moved to Africa to build a new life for herself. The film is based on her 1937 autobiographical novel.','/6oMKqh08TfxmvnoFR4mm1wZB67P.jpg','1985-12-20',161,'Released','Based on a true story.','Out of Africa',606,7.9648,7.147,'5RrEv9-ks2Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9380,_binary '\0','/fPN2G3efZVZnAQXVU729HJuQ3Ib.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089759',2.4,2718,'en','Overdrawn at the Memory Bank','Computer programmer Aram Fingal\'s virtual vacation in the classic film Casablanca is removed by a totalitarian government and accidentally trapped in the virtual reality simulation. He must find a way out before he expires.','/kGRzs4UbPbZXutXt102YfJh04QY.jpg','1984-09-22',83,'Released','Caught in a future world, his only escape is back in time.','Overdrawn at the Memory Bank',118641,1.4341,2.8,'eUdi80KOr7M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9381,_binary '\0','/lSH1j2uChyuxKmslXRf1AGyi43p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089767',7.3,71740,'en','Pale Rider','A mysterious preacher protects a humble prospector village from a greedy mining company trying to encroach on their land.','/kpAN5WnDEVWYzMDPkXHTbrDQuak.jpg','1985-06-28',115,'Released','...and hell followed with him.','Pale Rider',8879,6.7843,7.2,'SGzz3hh1jHc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9382,_binary '\0','/s02R8uCnblAVp7Yp5G4OUBCtG35.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089776',5.6,1463,'fr','Parole de flic','Cop\'s Honor (Parole de Flic) is a 1985 French crime movie directed by José Pinheiro and starring Alain Delon as retired police officer Daniel Pratt. His teenager daughter was killed by a gang of mysterious hooded killers so Pratt began his own investigation to avenge the killers and their backroom leader.','/fbe8BK4EsLelG5bsdqV7VHUsZjQ.jpg','1985-08-21',93,'Released',NULL,'Cop\'s Honor',170033,1.92,5.365,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9383,_binary '\0','/urPmCP7bkm2g3doTsg70tukLYUX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089789',5.9,3178,'en','The Peanut Butter Solution','Peanut butter is the secret ingredient for magic potions made by two friendly ghosts. Eleven-year-old Michael loses all of his hair when he gets a fright and uses the potion to get his hair back, but too much peanut butter causes things to get a bit hairy.','/p2DgMuccpBd5VFQA87JSMeaXw7V.jpg','1985-12-06',93,'Released','A hair-raising comedy adventure!','The Peanut Butter Solution',19425,1.9675,5.7,'3sagldiSHbs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9384,_binary '\0','/8qob0r37GT8YV3lA7pIfcnp0FBQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089791',7.1,64095,'en','Pee-wee\'s Big Adventure','The eccentric and childish Pee-wee Herman embarks on a big adventure when his beloved bicycle is stolen. Armed with information from a fortune-teller and a relentless obsession with his prized possession, Pee-wee encounters a host of odd characters and bizarre situations as he treks across the country to recover his bike.','/414IUXc54mrhX88ZUQiRDLXn01i.jpg','1985-07-26',91,'Released','The story of a rebel and his bike.','Pee-wee\'s Big Adventure',5683,5.9979,6.5,'1UWsZ9k3Rds','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9385,_binary '\0','/2IUST8dE4Nfd6zAFppTJh69SNdW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089798',4.8,6732,'en','Perfect','A female aerobics instructor meets a male reporter doing a story on health clubs, but it isn\'t love at first sight.','/tb1jZGi23w2pIittaBBdaN6CGRI.jpg','1985-05-15',115,'Released','John Travolta and Jamie Lee Curtis work up a sweat together!','Perfect',49370,2.5205,5.623,'Sd7tVAIOWjI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9386,_binary '\0','/yX6ATW3BfsHx9DgbJH9y6onnbfk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089800',7.5,1516,'sk','Perinbaba','A fairy-tale about an old lady who takes care of snow and Jakub who does not fear death. It reflects the idea of people\'s longing for happiness, love and understanding, their effort to overcome troubles and win over death. It criticizes greed and evil desires.','/cCQl5SCsBCeAqtOua9CnFVRPIGo.jpg','1985-10-01',89,'Released',NULL,'The Feather Fairy',29180,1.6668,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9387,_binary '\0','/gErkgBa235TaRAdoCSLdRFk82g8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089816',6,3600,'en','Plenty','David Hare\'s account of a one-time French freedom fighter who gradually realizes that her post-war life is not meeting her expectations.','/x45XteYF8kw1GvwHWgJ2Kizyfnq.jpg','1985-09-20',124,'Released','To know the pleasure of power. To feel the heat of passion. To stretch life to the absolute limit. She would settle for nothing less.','Plenty',41166,1.8422,5.7,'bPf5KHiOkds','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9388,_binary '\0','/aoNkbptNDtE9ICBBGJwE6xua9Tt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089820',6,1671,'en','Poison Ivy','Two teenage summer camp counselors struggle with their younger campers, providing a variety of humorous situations and romantic encounters.','/b9udutukCTPgYQh3UjFDZQOWeGv.jpg','1985-02-10',97,'Released','If parents only knew what really went on at summer camp!','Poison Ivy',46830,1.9271,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9389,_binary '\0','/ydNd3ZtWgvu4Fpsx1Vcg0x0igsj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089821',6.5,3343,'fr','Police','Mangin, a police inspector in Paris, leans hard on informants to get evidence on three Tunisian brothers who traffic in drugs. He arrests one, Simon, and his girl-friend Noria. Simon\'s brothers go to their lawyer. He springs Noria, who promptly steals 2 million francs that belong to the Tunisians. They suspect her of the theft; her life as well as the lawyer\'s is in danger. Meanwhile, Noria is playing with both the lawyer and Mangin\'s affections. Mangin is mercurial anyway: intimidating and bloodying suspects, falling for a police commission trainee before flipping for Noria, wearing his emotions on his sleeve. Can he save the lawyer and Noria, and can he convince her to love?','/rMBanDuFv1M3LrJgVlwJqVFEujx.jpg','1985-09-04',113,'Released',NULL,'Police',6320,1.8215,6,'oYaPZOH_P_Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9390,_binary '\0','/2xpxgucXMQRfzlkumna1DXsxFPk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089822',5.8,64094,'en','Police Academy 2: Their First Assignment','Officer Carey Mahoney and his cohorts have finally graduated from the Police Academy and are about to hit the streets on their first assignment. Question is, are they ready to do battle with a band of graffiti-tagging terrorists? Time will tell, but don\'t sell short this cheerful band of doltish boys in blue.','/9E6tigDzRptEtkZl07bCIKzuOXL.jpg','1985-03-28',87,'Released','To protect, to serve... and make you laugh. America\'s funniest crimebusters are back!','Police Academy 2: Their First Assignment',10157,8.0055,6.101,'K_pccyu6ipY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9391,_binary '\0','/cWNL9H7wz0VDAAUjVFM83VDzu3R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089826',4.8,9890,'en','Porky\'s Revenge','As graduation nears for the class of 1955 at Angel Beach High, the gang once again faces off against their old enemy, Porky, who wants them to throw the school\'s championship basketball game since he has bet on the opposing team.','/Ad3F9Fm7zdZmBqBSvJIAJRfac9m.jpg','1985-03-22',92,'Released','The pig strikes back!','Porky\'s Revenge',23919,2.6049,5.5,'06jLunu_9fY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9392,_binary '\0','/5xTCco8MkrPk5XMcf7Guu1TSY9u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089832',6.5,2493,'fr','Poulet au vinaigre','Unorthodox detective Jean Lavardin is called to a provincial French town after a prank turns deadly.','/zsCkiQYaTvkhQj1vytiTejQyK3A.jpg','1985-04-10',110,'Released',NULL,'Cop au Vin',4898,1.8871,6.1,'nkgIhE5CTaU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9393,_binary '\0','/k4QV305UXztZzCFBdb8TMRAeiAn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089835',5.7,2637,'en','Pray for Death','Akira Saito, a Japanese businessman lives in Tokyo with his Japanese-American wife Aiko and their children, Takeshi and Tomoya. When the family has a chance to move to the United States so that Aiko can teach the children about their American heritage, they pack up and head for Houston, Texas and run a restaurant. This is where the trouble begins....','/h8lcXvFQqii1FmsWr9UbD82G8yG.jpg','1985-01-11',92,'Released','The Master Ninja is Back.','Pray for Death',35106,1.8011,6.1,'suSnAd7M3sI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9394,_binary '\0','/yfVpEeMdwH71ugPoOA0QC8BglQo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089838',6.5,3778,'en','A Private Function','In the summer of 1947, Britain prepares to commemorate the wedding of Princess Elizabeth and Prince Phillip. To get around food-rationing laws, Dr. Charles Swaby, accountant Henry Allardyce and solicitor Frank Lockwood are fattening a black-market pig for the big day. Egged on by his wife, meek Gilbert Chilvers steals the swine, but the couple must conceal it from inspector Morris Wormold.','/8OC2OqimnYqB8d9S38MdQS2DkeQ.jpg','1984-11-09',96,'Released','When a clandestine party goes wild, it\'s all about pork... and prestige.','A Private Function',57565,2.1869,6.4,'Tadk96y3saE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9395,_binary '\0','/a3TQHfoNkM3QX3lwobmAMOBLtsd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089839',5.3,10078,'en','Private Resort','Chasing women for the weekend at a luxurious Miami resort, teen buddies Ben and Jack get more than they bargained for after crossing paths with a crafty criminal.','/temhAEeniTralG3G9NyjPmTgzIe.jpg','1985-05-03',82,'Released','Spend a weekend with no reservations!','Private Resort',17824,4.1467,5.7,'9aNxqORENSY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9396,_binary '\0','/lW4nIRGJAglS6Pt7gTgRIrmSHA2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089841',6.7,28872,'en','Prizzi\'s Honor','Charley Partanna is a hitman who works for the Prizzis, one of the richest crime families in the US. When he sees Irene Walker, it\'s love at first sight. But he soon finds that she, too, is a killer for hire. Charley can overlook his suspicions, but he can\'t turn off his heart. And the couple must remember that even if they love each other, the Prizzis love only money.','/5azGfZXuUFYjYfz6etYOdlyLXwL.jpg','1985-06-14',124,'Released','Hired killers by day. Devoted lovers by night. Until they found out their next assignment was each other.','Prizzi\'s Honor',2075,4.3598,6.4,'VEz13l-ULX0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9397,_binary '\0','/sJlkgtEGXj2Y8lDi0Oko0OEVKrQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089847',5.8,6072,'en','The Protector','Billy Wong is a New York City cop whose partner is gunned down during a robbery. Billy and his new partner, Danny Garoni, are working security at a fashion show when a wealthy man\'s daughter, Laura Shapiro, is kidnapped. The Federal authorities suspect that Laura\'s father is involved with Mr. Ko, a Hong Kong drug kingpin, so the NYC police commissioner sends the two cops to Hong Kong to investigate.','/ri2yctGQr4DPLBODZZ2Ky2yqBoL.jpg','1985-06-15',94,'Released','Now, New York has a new weapon - A cop with his own way of fighting crime.','The Protector',45408,6.7594,5.933,'3f_vTpJKpU4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9398,_binary '\0','/uSwWQLDaHuROPaX5N1xpOdkZW5K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089851',5.3,1571,'ko','불가사리','In feudal Korea, a group of starving villagers grow weary of the orders handed down to them by their controlling king and set out to use a deadly monster under their control to push his armies back.','/8a4qgqegVHqtjFEuFfsYRWzTR21.jpg','1986-02-28',95,'Released','The monster movie masterpiece that the whole world has been waiting for.','Pulgasari',26974,1.836,5.5,'_6OqNGbw8Ek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9399,_binary '\0','/afbfZtBOZIfxlzzvHCOfauI6pna.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089853',7.6,58450,'en','The Purple Rose of Cairo','Cecilia is a waitress in New Jersey, living a dreary life during the Great Depression. Her only escape from her mundane reality is the movie theatre. After losing her job, Cecilia goes to see \'The Purple Rose of Cairo\' in hopes of raising her spirits, where she watches dashing archaeologist Tom Baxter time and again.','/ccsint43E44B7NGceEhVimD93Yt.jpg','1985-03-01',82,'Released','She\'s finally met the man of her dreams. He\'s not real, but you can\'t have everything.','The Purple Rose of Cairo',10849,5.3546,7.38,'u9qate1rGAg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9400,_binary '\0','/lTe6MryUoCQJyO05Ie3IOUvcyB5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089860',6.7,1950,'fr','Péril en la demeure','A wealthy wife\'s affair with her daughter\'s guitar tutor is threatened when the tutor is attacked and rescued by a hired killer, leading him to suspect their secret is out.','/9G8o7COiTr65OtgXH3tAXE6ocnl.jpg','1985-02-13',101,'Released','Some eroticism with your thrills!','Death in a French Garden',24583,2.2231,6.012,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9401,_binary '\0','/zMNDdSvLxkVjOD5iGacsRsdgjKW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089866',7.6,4979,'zh','青梅竹馬','A young woman urgently seeks to navigate the maze of contemporary Taipei and find a future. She hopes that her boyfriend Lung is the key to the future, but Lung is stuck in a past that combines baseball and traditional loyalty that leads him to squander his nest egg bailing her father out of financial trouble.','/veJ93QUnTBX4WXk5qSl1s42Uosj.jpg','1985-05-01',120,'Released',NULL,'Taipei Story',106380,2.8853,7.5,'GYQO9aez1WE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9402,_binary '\0','/acNTpCRoAHueT1VoJzEQPYXdXy5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089869',6.7,29770,'en','The Quiet Earth','After a top-secret experiment misfires, a scientist may be the only man left alive in the world.','/6uvRcSy1DCh0zONGMRO4bEj44hq.jpg','1985-09-08',91,'Released','The End of the World is Just the Beginning','The Quiet Earth',10176,3.7555,6.6,'JnyxaSAY_M0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9403,_binary '\0','/h4gTSd7P7RhHs1EdOOOPOsXWPZc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089877',6.8,1585,'en','Rainbow Brite and the Star Stealer','Rainbow Brite, and her magical horse Starlite, must stop an evil princess and her underlings from taking over the planet Spectra. When they meet Orin, the wise Sprite tries to make the two children get along and work together to stop the evil Princess. Orin tells them that they can only destroy her by combining their own powers against her. Getting in the way of their mission is the sinister Murky Dismal and his bumbling assistant Lurky who, as usual, are lavishing in the new gloom created by the darkening of Spectra, as well as trying to steal Rainbow\'s magical color belt.','/wuDqKIf574BW2NhdxkbsPAcPzdg.jpg','1985-11-15',85,'Released','Rainbow Brite lights up the screen in her first big movie.','Rainbow Brite and the Star Stealer',47296,2.6453,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9404,_binary '\0','/aPlgkT2FlD7EcE6Vi10I4RTzRqb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089880',6.5,198323,'en','Rambo: First Blood Part II','John Rambo is released from prison by the government for a top-secret covert mission to the last place on Earth he\'d want to return - the jungles of Vietnam.','/fVwRtWqEPdsCH21BVDGqgkAQcff.jpg','1985-05-22',96,'Released','No man, no law, no war can stop him.','Rambo: First Blood Part II',1369,17.0671,6.7,'TY8LVqaLHwY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9405,_binary '\0','/3ssNAWypRl47iriwBFNx7RUEUub.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089881',8.2,154606,'ja','乱','Shakespeare\'s King Lear is reimagined as a singular historical epic set in sixteenth-century Japan where an aging warlord divides his kingdom between his three sons.','/dGgiXMWDcS5aJTBEFu7bmaQPNox.jpg','1985-06-01',160,'Released','In a mad world, only the mad are sane.','Ran',11645,12.1583,8.023,'29ukiH4_GvQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9406,_binary '\0','/ogojPeWqjHBVUGCPGhfMxyQJLZ7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089885',7.1,79550,'en','Re-Animator','Conducting clandestine experiments within the morgue at Miskatonic University, scientist Herbert West reveals to a fellow graduate student his groundbreaking work concerning the re-animation of fresh corpses.','/7FYhY70LTumoFfQgTI8TK0UDdsF.jpg','1985-10-18',86,'Released','Herbert West has a good head on his shoulders...and another one on his desk.','Re-Animator',1694,6.4005,7.051,'wLJ8Z3PDEGU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9407,_binary '\0','/5gx3ZkoETzszwhEgdFW6M3roasH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089886',6.9,41792,'en','Real Genius','When teenage geniuses Mitch Taylor and Chris Knight, working on an advanced laser project, learn that the military wants to use it as a weapon, they decide to thwart the plan.','/8az0Tr8hEGDmrUH9WlFz1QIKsMy.jpg','1985-08-07',106,'Released','When he gets mad, he doesn\'t get even… he gets creative.','Real Genius',14370,5.5996,6.678,'xuv7SIVNkx8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9408,_binary '\0','/iWFnany1vDQ4EoBgvm7E3Pb0RyS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089893',5.1,48738,'en','Red Sonja','The tyrant Gedren seeks the total power in a world of barbarism. She raids the city Hablac and kills the keeper of a talisman that gives her great power. Red Sonja, sister of the keeper, sets out with her magic sword to overthrow Gedren.','/83v0W5cCSFsWpI0cAj8DRlihySN.jpg','1985-04-09',89,'Released','A woman and a warrior that became a legend.','Red Sonja',9626,7.3689,5.4,'1NObNUxwPzY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9409,_binary '\0','/eunBATE0s5ZXNRhqWbM2Jjj1O1k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089901',6.4,15419,'en','Remo Williams: The Adventure Begins','Tough Brooklyn street cop Sam Makin is unwillingly recruited as an assassin for a secret United States organization known as CURE, who fake his death and give him a new identity: Remo Williams. With his appearance surgically altered, Williams is trained to be a human killing machine by his aged, derisive and impassive Korean martial arts master Chiun.','/it52uz6io8cA6WGzWxSbn9jgRlu.jpg','1985-10-11',121,'Released','A hero who doesn\'t exist must save America from an enemy we never knew we had.','Remo Williams: The Adventure Begins',10553,5.5514,6.3,'RUJBnsrWsow','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9410,_binary '\0','/oQWHso793x78CPSYyg52Jpwecp6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089902',6.4,3425,'fr','Rendez-vous','Nina is a young, carefree actress who arrives in Paris searching for her big break. There, she finds drama both on- and offstage as she becomes involved with three men: a mild-mannered real-estate agent who offers her stability, a bad-boy actor who lives dangerously on the edge, and an intense theater director who casts her in a production of “Romeo and Juliet.” As opening night approaches, the emotional extremes of Nina’s love life fuel her art.','/rICHxS03w4peWxcdGgT8pyb9eOp.jpg','1985-05-15',82,'Released',NULL,'Rendez-vous',34093,2.3989,5.6,'nQRggUjvM7s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9411,_binary '\0','/jxQaxzwNanwhQVgSFA3Y4FPDpLO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089904',6.8,2285,'en','Restless Natives','Two lads in Edinburgh embark on a non-violent spree of robberies. They dress up in clown masks and act as modern highwaymen, robbing coach loads of tourists in the highlands. In the process they become folk heroes to the locals.','/HSgeevfF3pkh0okq3oO3A4DKw0.jpg','1985-06-01',89,'Released','Scotland\'s most notorious public enemies','Restless Natives',29907,1.4218,6.8,'tM9rUC18JFs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9412,_binary '\0','/1FrQyuhqvQm5G1SqTEgpZtrkitd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089907',7.3,78644,'en','The Return of the Living Dead','Two employees at a medical supply warehouse accidentally release a toxic gas from a misplaced top-secret U.S. Army shipment, causing the dead to rise from a nearby cemetery with an insatiable hunger for human brains.','/oNsV9BychAe4Sk6xFKp558Rlpyz.jpg','1985-04-25',91,'Released','They\'re back from the grave and ready to party!','The Return of the Living Dead',10925,8.3656,7.2,'KeSAFGWzft8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9413,_binary '\0','/p6zh3jTuuhNfsUhUCEajEizDC9K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089908',6.7,34525,'en','Return to Oz','Dorothy, saved from a psychiatric experiment by a mysterious girl, finds herself back in the land of her dreams, and makes delightful new friends, and dangerous new enemies.','/dyMwaXA9nVhPiA5wYHsvfUAnbaB.jpg','1985-06-21',109,'Released','An all-new adventure down the yellow brick road.','Return to Oz',13155,5.397,6.7,'14EEGw_sdDQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9414,_binary '\0','/qkA2NPLmKLieMIggjC3LtRgEE6S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089913',5.3,8292,'en','Revolution','New York trapper Tom Dobb becomes an unwilling participant in the American Revolution after his son Ned is drafted into the Army by the villainous Sergeant Major Peasy. Tom attempts to find his son, and eventually becomes convinced that he must take a stand and fight for the freedom of the Colonies, alongside the aristocratic rebel Daisy McConnahay. As Tom undergoes his change of heart, the events of the war unfold in large-scale grandeur.','/m4LPxSJ8G8KVtySaleJhlTJqKBF.jpg','1985-12-25',126,'Released','The war that won a nation its freedom, a woman her destiny, a young man his independence, and a father his son\'s love.','Revolution',12701,3.2385,5.4,'XOJpN9GnGw4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9415,_binary '\0','/uiUb4KJ6tadldqlJme49TW1r3jA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089927',6.9,249529,'en','Rocky IV','Rocky Balboa holds the world heavyweight championship, but a new challenger has stepped forward: Drago, a six-foot-four, 261-pound fighter who has the backing of the Soviet Union. This time, Rocky\'s training regimen takes him to Siberia, where he prepares for a globally televised match in the heart of Moscow. But nothing can truly prepare him for what he\'s about to face – a fight to the finish, in which he must defend not only himself, but also the honor of his country!','/2MHUit4H6OK5adcOjnCN6suCKOl.jpg','1985-11-21',91,'Released','He\'s facing the ultimate challenge. And fighting for his life.','Rocky IV',1374,12.7439,7.1,'4qjV0bB2V0Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9416,_binary '\0','/9GHsA3bt6MYW7Cpur91GeVBQKIC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089941',7.2,37559,'en','Runaway Train','A hardened convict and a younger prisoner escape from a brutal prison in the middle of winter only to find themselves on an out-of-control train with a female railway worker while being pursued by the vengeful head of security.','/yEvMuhIdwPhhEtikAihxUTM1u75.jpg','1985-11-15',111,'Released','Desperate, and determined to survive.','Runaway Train',11893,6.8231,6.955,'nOgYzEV-XFQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9417,_binary '\0','/21QnPWq9Fcih2JmEylPG6Opus5T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089945',6.4,2822,'en','Rustlers\' Rhapsody','A singing cowboy roams the Wild West with his sidekick, dancing horse and fancy wardrobe.','/gm0BhC6Q2uTggUpAWG6NLaPpHWj.jpg','1985-05-10',88,'Released','Rex O\'Herlihan. The great big Western Hero. To a lawless land he brought truth, justice, some fancy riding and wonderful outfits.','Rustlers\' Rhapsody',19014,1.711,5.52,'-eFpAdqu8OE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9418,_binary '\0','/bVMrrI8ZamKlKp3l9Kzcp8Bu2yB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089957',7.4,2615,'ru','Самая обаятельная и привлекательная','Nadya Klyueva is a single woman. Persuaded by her friend, she decides to charm her co-worker whom she doesn\'t really love, but who is the most popular man around.','/phy8a5Gja6avjQFialfRMNXKqNA.jpg','1985-11-10',89,'Released',NULL,'The Most Charming and Attractive',65142,1.1664,7.027,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9419,_binary '\0','/tKsFh8qpYyi2AMg5O8QTVdChm4k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089960',7.6,16142,'fr','Sans toit ni loi','Mona Bergeron is dead, her frozen body found in a ditch in the French countryside. From this, the film flashes back to the weeks leading up to her death. Through these flashbacks, Mona gradually declines as she travels from place to place, taking odd jobs and staying with whomever will offer her a place to sleep. Mona is fiercely independent, craving freedom over comfort, but it is this desire to be free that will eventually lead to her demise.','/2KFfwiPct1hwqi9dkKqoom0BenC.jpg','1985-12-04',106,'Released',NULL,'Vagabond',44018,4.5792,7.4,'i9pD323U_Hc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9420,_binary '\0','/xLDSKsyAGFFCNYDmNynEOsms5jp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089961',6.3,17441,'en','Santa Claus: The Movie','In ancient times, a man named Claus, who delivers toys in his small village, fulfils his destiny to become Santa Claus after meeting an expert toy-making elf, Patch, in the North Pole. In the present day, Santa Claus has become overwhelmed by his workload, and the disgruntled Patch flees the workshop to New York City. There, Patch unknowingly threatens the fate of Christmas by taking a job at a failing toy company run by a scheming businessman.','/tZvGQF2623FD0MZgvOy18J5d7x5.jpg','1985-10-29',108,'Released','You\'d better watch out! This year he REALLY IS coming to town.','Santa Claus: The Movie',13764,4.1418,6.3,'M_P4Bz_go5o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9421,_binary '\0','/8xOfEhVwQqt4JqnmlDCFLkDpBES.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089974',4.2,1566,'en','School Spirit','The only thing keeping Billy Batson from the girl of his dreams is one little condom—or rather the lack of one. Lucky Billy finds one at an all-night roadhouse—but speeding back to his girl, he is killed in a head-on collision. Now invisible, Billy must find his sweetheart and rekindle her fire.','/e32ycfsGllbghXstP3PMvDZfm6M.jpg','1985-10-30',90,'Released','This is one ghost who should be busted','School Spirit',77850,2.0853,4.5,'0Z5kMgThPXA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9422,_binary '\0','/otElW2B6kTSObMEzaFGkZdPRRbE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089981',6.5,9150,'en','Secret Admirer','An anonymous love letter left in Michael Ryan\'s locker on the last day of school wreaks havoc on his life and the lives of everyone who comes in contact with it.','/4kJQ1R7zD1ckFPFfmyxI7kwPSiM.jpg','1985-06-14',98,'Released','He never knew what hit him.','Secret Admirer',24742,4.1899,6.709,'CDouD5E7H90','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9423,_binary '\0','/pfC41MO3o6qRiunDGBtusb2jOiq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089984',7.2,3775,'en','He-Man and She-Ra: The Secret of the Sword','After experiencing traumatic nightmares of a time now past, the Sorceress summons Prince Adam and Cringer to Castle Grayskull to give Adam a precious, jeweled sword and send the pair to the planet Etheria to investigate its secrets.','/ojQBGjDr8HDXp1etZTLKeUiYivl.jpg','1985-03-22',100,'Released',NULL,'He-Man and She-Ra: The Secret of the Sword',19386,3.3402,7,'C2WO8QsZAgE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9424,_binary '\0','/kO1PMdDcuZ6HEDpgH9vu8HLMl7z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089994',6.8,6165,'en','Follow That Bird','Big Bird is sent to live far from Sesame Street by a pesky social worker, who thinks it would be better for him to live with other birds. Unhappy, Big Bird runs away from his foster home, prompting the rest of the Sesame Street gang to go on a cross-country journey to find him.','/kkhgC0IDWtmPYX6FxMrVGx7jJnn.jpg','1985-08-02',88,'Released','It\'s Big Adventure! It\'s Big Laughs! It\'s Big Bird on the Big Screen!','Follow That Bird',36536,3.724,6.5,'VIhGZxzf3uE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9425,_binary '\0','/9r7iqUt4y8H4NOdMo0Mc5sgKgUI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0089997',5.9,2311,'en','Seven Minutes in Heaven','Natalie allows her classmate Jeff, who has run away from home, to stay at her place while her father is away on a business trip. Natalie soon starts dating Jeff\'s friend James Casey, who isn\'t as faithful as she thinks, while her best friend Polly falls in love with baseball player Zoo Knudsen.','/fIvg1lnhK2t4WVltHAkCn1J6aSv.jpg','1986-05-09',88,'Released','When you\'re fifteen, being in love is more than just...','Seven Minutes in Heaven',38981,2.8836,6.1,'lCV--ARbeAY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9426,_binary '\0','/ocbX565t2eL7jVs3KNPm6XEwlDl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090009',4.8,2370,'en','She','In a backward post-apocalyptic world, She aids two brothers\' quest to rescue their kidnapped sister. Along the way, they battle orgiastic werewolves, a psychic communist, a tutu-wearing giant, a mad scientist, and gladiators before standing against the odds to defeat the evil Norks.','/n4IHaMTl89DKvY1wdzbiig7WkDb.jpg','1984-05-15',106,'Released','Sandahl Bergman tempted Conan and now she is ready to take on the world!','She',47345,1.9025,5.056,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9427,_binary '\0','/bJolDsqM8vnlusFJdnCi9rg1nX7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090015',8.7,11735,'fr','Shoah','Director Claude Lanzmann spent 11 years on this sprawling documentary about the Holocaust, conducting his own interviews and refusing to use a single frame of archival footage. Dividing Holocaust witnesses into three categories – survivors, bystanders, and perpetrators – Lanzmann presents testimonies from survivors of the Chelmno concentration camp, an Auschwitz escapee, and witnesses of the Warsaw Ghetto Uprising, as well as a chilling report of gas chambers from an SS officer at Treblinka.','/yvwF7dfSCybFcBOklUzKpE46bHM.jpg','1985-04-21',566,'Released',NULL,'Shoah',42044,2.6408,8.2,'2g-Lc2ZSutA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9428,_binary '\0','/dRKPz3iZiuYpgdfbBQ3Af6Wo63R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090021',6.4,35920,'en','Silver Bullet','The small city of Tarker\'s Mills is startled by a series of sadistic murders. The population fears the work of a maniac, but sightings of a mysterious, hairy creature soon spread. People lock themselves up at night, but there\'s one boy who\'s still outside…','/52CvWYuJyWcMTPvsfcmsxaVHi7f.jpg','1985-10-10',95,'Released','It started in May. In a small town. And every month after that whenever the moon was full...It came back.','Silver Bullet',17898,5.8781,6.7,'n1dClCykQys','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9429,_binary '\0','/rPDcuFniW2yZrSRbLjeNdQy7P45.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090022',7.2,54804,'en','Silverado','Four unwitting heroes cross paths on their journey to the sleepy town of Silverado. Little do they know the town where their family and friends reside has been taken over by a corrupt sheriff and a murderous posse. It\'s up to the sharp-shooting foursome to save the day, but first they have to break each other out of jail, and learn who their real friends are.','/k6zurzegRKsNGMICXZ57VJDUzXO.jpg','1985-07-10',133,'Released','Four strangers become friends. Four friends become heroes. On the road to Silverado.','Silverado',11509,6.4176,6.9,'oPLSventoUI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9430,_binary '\0','/hq7TBOjxQlOtzqxeG2N9vJdt4f3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090036',4.4,1365,'en','The Slugger\'s Wife','Darryl Palmer is a major league baseball player who meets and pursues an attractive singer. After some setbacks, the two are married and sent on an emotional journey that sees his career take off, while hers doesn\'t. She can\'t escape unhappiness when she gives up her dreams to support her husband. With a separation on the horizon, Darryl must choose between his big-league life and his one true love.','/g5psR5tS3uFKRwcUGmHQcycc6iF.jpg','1985-03-29',104,'Released',NULL,'The Slugger\'s Wife',78364,2.8247,3.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9431,_binary '\0','/bAt0ilmt37IxSIn6TFGkdy4cf29.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090037',6.6,3925,'en','Smooth Talk','Connie, the fifteen-year-old black sheep of her family, finds her summertime idyll of beach trips, mall hangouts, and innocent flirtations shattered by an encounter with a mysterious stranger.','/tPfGFKRXD0sVOGhwjxPHadTa8Y1.jpg','1985-11-17',92,'Released',NULL,'Smooth Talk',33766,1.8127,6.2,'k6B_BEmo7ws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9432,_binary '\0','/9RJGN6CaCFOzs9H1yie2aPxLUoX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090056',6.4,55308,'en','Spies Like Us','Two bumbling government employees think they are U.S. spies, only to discover that they are actually decoys for nuclear war.','/s0Sx8nd9Irq0aCPbsN78s0DYVlG.jpg','1985-12-06',102,'Released','With spies like these, who needs enemies?','Spies Like Us',9080,5.7875,6.194,'JiNYpzK7lX0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9433,_binary '\0','/4bspHpwUVbMBYu5afukIo7n4oN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090057',4.8,5198,'en','Spookies','Taking a wrong turn, travelers find themselves trapped in a mysterious house. One horror after another threatens them, as the sorcerer who lives within needs sacrifices to give eternal life to his beautiful bride.','/tcRccnLpM2wsNjEv39O6UgkrNYI.jpg','1986-05-14',85,'Released','Gremlins chased you, Ghoulies terrified you, Now beg for your life...','Spookies',26679,1.6436,4.7,'BEsZ2yjmGfI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9434,_binary '\0','/uhAzDn1U51rANMuxQGxxqLORFZs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090060',6.4,51124,'en','St. Elmo\'s Fire','Reluctant to let go of college life, a close-knit team of seven friends--irresponsible saxophone player Billy, young Republican Alec, his girlfriend Leslie, struggling journalist Kevin, drama queen Jules, lovesick waiter Kirby, and Wendy, a social worker with a heart of gold--realise the party is over. And as the burdens of maturity close in on the young dreamers, the complexities of adulthood and the daily struggle of growing up put their sacred friendship to the test. But everyone knows life is not a bed of roses. It won\'t be easy, but when all is said and done, what will it take for St. Elmo\'s clique to find its place in the real world?','/g2SL3XHJas7hebZ2hhTrYLpKToD.jpg','1985-06-28',108,'Released','The passion burns deep.','St. Elmo\'s Fire',11557,5.8765,6.125,'dsPFF5xBeMk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9435,_binary '\0','/mLPqyFYnVnMqDtVrelD1JITbo6v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090065',6.5,2923,'en','Starchaser: The Legend of Orin','Set on the subterranean Mine-World, a band of human worker are treated like slaves under the power of the evil overlord Zygon until one, Orin, unearths the hilt of a mythical sword that only he can master. Escaping the planet, he runs into the rogue smuggler Dagg and a pair of helpful droids and the princess, who all team up to return to the Mine-World with a plan to defeat Zygon and free Orin\'s enslaved people.','/zC5OU1G1eeIN1xTnXPWibolYrf6.jpg','1985-05-17',107,'Released','A spectacular 3-D adventure for the entire family.','Starchaser: The Legend of Orin',32147,2.4881,6.3,'x8UZ2WfLG70','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9436,_binary '\0','/g6m49G1EtItlEmLaP3tnuPcOYBf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090073',5.7,2542,'en','Stick','After getting out of jail, car thief Ernest \"Stick\" Stickley witnesses the murder of his friend Rainy during a drug deal. To avoid getting killed by the same people, who work for mobster Chucky, Stick gets a job as a chauffeur for millionaire Barry Braham and lies low. As he gets used to his new routine, Stick woos Barry\'s financial consultant, Kyle McClaren, but must fight back when Chucky\'s men come after him.','/bHZ50vtexlvgXRjAKXxLRT8H6tr.jpg','1985-04-26',109,'Released','It\'s his last chance. And he\'s going to fight for it.','Stick',32387,2.7374,5.435,'mPmm8jr4muk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9437,_binary '\0','/tbYg8aKDTLia2ZjT3b4ykAAHyel.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090094',5.9,21937,'en','The Stuff','Amalgamated Dairies hires David Rutherford, an FBI man turned industrial saboteur, to investigate a popular new product called “the Stuff,” a new dessert product that is blowing ice cream sales out of the water. Nobody knows how it’s made or what’s in it, but people are lining up to buy it. It\'s got a delicious flavor to die for!','/bT0PxmeePfzX8YrZHGaAXau9RLN.jpg','1985-06-14',86,'Released','Are you eating it... or is it eating you?','The Stuff',18502,4.4133,5.976,'7oRLNc1X2es','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9438,_binary '\0','/oJuxVwei4MEWr6NJZFKWvzm6u6r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090095',6.5,18064,'fr','Subway','Fred, a raffish safe blower, takes refuge in the Paris Metro after being chased by the henchmen of a shady businessman from whom he has just stolen some documents. While hiding out in the back rooms and conduits of the Metro, Fred encounters a subterranean society of eccentric characters and petty criminals.','/5EOFUWs0ImeyiRUtFpbHuGGTNUx.jpg','1985-04-10',104,'Released','A seductive fable','Subway',10656,3.3976,6.5,'UdpLg2NHIco','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9439,_binary '\0','/tAqTDzbDAkQCKI8XRYVz6YN1vmE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090098',6.3,20546,'en','Summer Rental','Jack Chester, an overworked air traffic controller, takes his family on vacation to the beach. Things immediately start to go wrong for the Chesters, and steadily get worse. Jack ends up in a feud with a local yachtsman, and has to race him to regain his pride and family\'s respect.','/kNkDCXB2JXGnaG3KwvzAAjmZiV8.jpg','1985-08-09',87,'Released','Life is a beach.','Summer Rental',19357,4.6594,6.107,'KacBBqLb1DI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9440,_binary '\0','/ga8A76kyH4MhDEeIKx4xgeY75y8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090101',6.4,2478,'it','Super Fantozzi','Superfantozzi (1986) is an Italian film from 1986. It is the fifth film in the saga of the unlucky clerk Ugo Fantozzi, played by its creator, Paolo Villaggio. In this film, Fantozzi is portrayed in a surreal historical journey, from Genesis to 1980s.','/rS6SZB9cIlVT6mxSGH9ZyEuLhhP.jpg','1986-12-23',88,'Released',NULL,'Super Fantozzi',44268,1.892,6.293,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9441,_binary '\0','/6E0GtHsx8335YHJE7dD9oL1gk9i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090103',7,24536,'en','The Sure Thing','Gib, a beer-guzzling slob, and Alison, an uptight Ivy-Leaguer, are an unlikely duo stuck together on a cross-country trip during Christmas break. At first they get on each other\'s nerves but, as time passes, they find their divergent natures complement each other. Now they need to realize what they\'ve already found before it\'s too late.','/a9cuohQn5kczi4htWZAZjEZvXkZ.jpg','1985-03-01',95,'Released','A sure thing comes once in a lifetime... but the real thing lasts forever.','The Sure Thing',8992,4.1609,6.532,'fxo6F6rJv7E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9442,_binary '\0','/2PYbXyHG4KDefiLsIq0Q9rID7M5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090110',7,5937,'en','Sweet Dreams','The story of Patsy Cline, the velvet-voiced country music singer who died in a tragic plane crash at the height of her fame.','/3BuTH2W1s2AQTZAfiLoUMTx1PmM.jpg','1985-10-02',115,'Released','She fought harder, loved more and went further than most people ever dream','Sweet Dreams',42045,2.0715,6.4,'Tged0mdmzaI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9443,_binary '\0','/ivDIWhbcqzHQB79r8eXzTElr5dN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090115',6.7,8032,'sv','Sällskapsresan II - Snowroller','Stig-Helmer takes another vacation with his norwegian friend Ole. This time it\'s time for a skiing vacation in the Alps. Of course, Stig-Helmer has never learnt downhill skiing, but he attends a ski school. And together they manage to charm two women also on vacation.','/2EnsIGAfIJs7b083yZcw7SWtSgi.jpg','1985-10-04',91,'Released',NULL,'Snowroller',19181,1.2553,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9444,_binary '\0','/qUnqakZT80gjcspVeC7K2EQ8hfO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090130',5.9,5626,'en','Target','A Texan with a secret past searches Europe with his son after the KGB kidnaps his wife.','/2yL873UZkBHOrrt709rDeAm2Fba.jpg','1985-11-08',117,'Released','The threat. The search. The truth.','Target',31600,2.0221,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9445,_binary '\0','/d1RYJQcljAlSOwTizaGS3oWnPEk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090142',6.1,66313,'en','Teen Wolf','When a shy teenager\'s new-found powers help him score at basketball - and with the popular girls - he has some pretty hairy decisions to make.','/bv9rY9eoue2Hat6tcvrKVQ0ow8v.jpg','1985-08-23',92,'Released','He always wanted to be special... but he never expected this!','Teen Wolf',11824,9.0036,6.213,'KjxTIvkD2ls','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9446,_binary '\0','/71J5BdofL1578TJLlLZ3PfT7XYE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090145',5.6,1248,'en','Tenement','A drug-dealing band of violent street thugs terrorize the tenants of a South Bronx apartment building.','/m52I0tP2gwVtYXMoKzIfVpOMPPm.jpg','1985-09-20',94,'Released','A bloodbath in the Bronx!','Tenement',87905,1.7898,5.3,'3a3l28W9OX0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9447,_binary '\0','/dBs5MsoH2RGvBzeSN6GfwhxYBw0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090151',6.1,2942,'en','That Was Then... This Is Now','A delinquent teenager\'s only link to society is the attachment he feels towards an older brother-figure. When the older boy starts spending time with a new girlfriend, the teenager begins to feel even more alienated, and gets involved with drugs and the police.','/9uXl1EtvGo9qBPdtsJqwEcuckAZ.jpg','1985-11-08',102,'Released','Life as a teenager isn\'t always easy.','That Was Then... This Is Now',64945,2.3364,5.7,'ZDH72P28xsQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9448,_binary '\0','/8mTuAV09N8We9n1zzhbMGwSfXOE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090152',7.2,1245,'en','That\'s Dancing!','A documentary film about dancing on the screen, from its origins after the invention of the movie camera, over the movie musical from the late 20s, 30s, 40s, 50s, and 60s, up to the break dance and music videos from the 80s.','/mAQZhdP6HIXq6JKYZtgEo2rU2bZ.jpg','1985-01-18',105,'Released',NULL,'That\'s Dancing!',42047,1.9329,6.9,'DMjhXyXo26E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9449,_binary '\0','/7OUMUPYW1EZ34WdY6mnCWpV0jZd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090156',6.2,3053,'en','Thirteen at Dinner','Actress Jane Wilkinson wants a divorce, but her husband, Lord Edgware, refuses. She convinces Hercule Poirot to use his famed tact and logic to make her case. Lord Edgware turns up murdered, a well-placed knife wound at the base of his neck. It will take the precise Poirot to sort out the lies from the alibis - and find the criminal before another victim dies.','/id2wDf7mKgI5oHIRefIz31hhrXC.jpg','1985-09-19',95,'Released',NULL,'Thirteen at Dinner',6103,4.078,5.9,'Tcqy8beFZYc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9450,_binary '\0','/hA5A3srsuVmKe5tR4UePS2ZPaDw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090163',7.9,28581,'en','Threads','Documentary style account of a nuclear holocaust and its effect on the working class city of Sheffield, England; and the eventual long run effects of nuclear war on civilization.','/lBhU4U9Eehr9shstPem6I7BdkxK.jpg','1984-09-23',117,'Released','The closest you\'ll ever want to come to nuclear war.','Threads',17835,4.3818,7.6,'2-jrwwCNCxE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9451,_binary '\0','/1asVOmgViSEn4yi0EylEdtlL5H9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090180',7.3,50546,'en','To Live and Die in L.A.','When his longtime partner on the force is killed, reckless U.S. Secret Service agent Richard Chance vows revenge, setting out to nab dangerous counterfeit artist Eric Masters.','/2iW3pSihBIhXjnBQmUJ0mAiZbB5.jpg','1985-11-01',116,'Released','A federal agent is dead. A killer is loose. And the City of Angels is about to explode.','To Live and Die in L.A.',9846,5.8714,7.126,'BQGB-wufbQU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9452,_binary '\0','/g49r83xwdZ0T5ziq4apxRyL5J2n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090182',7.3,4193,'de','Tokyo-Ga','German director Wim Wenders tries to explore the Tokyo that was depicted in the films of Yasujiro Ozu and finds a very different city.','/uNH1TqJPFuoxW0YZmwBuiZqSBU1.jpg','1985-04-24',92,'Released',NULL,'Tokyo-Ga',76406,1.5438,7.1,'LyD5ePbdIdM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9453,_binary '\0','/aVoZzmSEzH1Nd5rVyQgdlLVrUWU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090184',4.8,2088,'en','Tomboy','A budding female race-car driver finally meets her racing idol and unbelievably they fall in love...a love that\'s quickly put to the test when, having received the chance to show her racing talents, the two find themselves in a race for a multi-million dollar sponsorship contract.','/apxNcHNOgUe4uMgmRTMg8zEkVyv.jpg','1985-01-25',91,'Released','It\'s not just a man\'s world anymore.','Tomboy',2189,2.0347,4.9,'LNC8svtSjZA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9454,_binary '\0','/6SO3WcfmoByOt0SBB7tOCmPtkVF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090185',7.5,3984,'zh','童年往事','An autobiographical film based on Taiwanese director Hou Hsiao-hsien\'s memories of his youth growing up in Taiwan after emigrating from mainland China.','/7yFSUy939rX5CncqieINpajnM3q.jpg','1985-08-03',136,'Released',NULL,'The Time to Live and the Time to Die',45999,2.4031,7.2,'1aZgpykUmpY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9455,_binary '\0','/7DOuHRMoYhhSIVGBDqNdZpUoVsq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090190',6.2,36376,'en','The Toxic Avenger','A gang of thugs devise a cruel hoax that goes horribly wrong as Melvin, a nerdy emaciated janitor at the local health club, is cast through a third story window into a vat of hazardous toxic waste.','/vuxRW5GKuCnKvdYlUAYNxlicm54.jpg','1984-05-15',110,'Released','He was 98 lbs. of solid nerd until he became...the Toxic Avenger!','The Toxic Avenger',15239,4.2905,6.2,'sKeONEIskWI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9456,_binary '\0','/ubl78MVPqDBWkWPl16lzkgSwiQb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090192',6,9152,'en','Trancers','Angel City trooper Jack Deth is sent back in time from 2247 to 1985 L.A. to inhabit the body of his ancestor. Deth\'s assignment is to find his archenemy, Whistler, who turns people into zombies, before the fiend is able to kill all the ancestors of the future\'s governing council.','/4Qx4KrimPXFNw8yRUBaZldcN8Ma.jpg','1984-11-07',77,'Released','His name is Deth. He hunts Trancers. Even in the 20th Century.','Trancers',5677,3.14,5.951,'05O5PGq_dlo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9457,_binary '\0','/nm2DbTBLVKLbSLd5xLoV7phVrJq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090196',5,9351,'en','Transylvania 6-5000','Two reporters travel to a strange castle in Transylvania to investigate the apparent reappearance of Frankenstein, and encounter the sensitive Wolfman, the Vampiress Odette and a whole cast of other weirdos.','/5Avsb4cCfGdPrd6gt94EOG4pLgr.jpg','1985-11-08',93,'Released','WANTED: Two thrill-seeking reporters, brains optional, looking to dig up the story of the century. For information call...','Transylvania 6-5000',25133,2.5748,5.309,'ulPZNXkpa5s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9458,_binary '\0','/j3ARCHmsYDqjYRzkKMvDVd6ctLY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090197',6.7,5598,'es','Tras el cristal','A mysterious teenager named Ángelo cares for Klaus, a German doctor with a dark past who lives trapped in an iron lung.','/HVqbcXIjk5YFJvQVWBJTyKbnsu.jpg','1986-08-06',112,'Released',NULL,'In a Glass Cage',46767,1.3721,6.8,'7M3s0969x5o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9459,_binary '\0','/iqgZXnNN9Sa6ufvlGuX8MwesE8y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090203',7.4,5941,'en','The Trip to Bountiful','Carrie Watts is living the twilight of her life trapped in an apartment in 1940s Houston, Texas with a controlling daughter-in-law and a hen-pecked son. Her fondest wish – just once before she dies – is to revisit Bountiful, the small Texas town of her youth which she still refers to as \"home.\"','/qJ6A6fvp8PLFxxLVPLveFUmTOCG.jpg','1985-12-20',108,'Released',NULL,'The Trip to Bountiful',47908,2.8981,7.2,'X2MO1gqdZOs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9460,_binary '\0','/21i0STBZUzhdNqJ2SpiBFpUGWZw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090206',6.6,4334,'fr','3 Hommes et un couffin','Three young men - Jacques, Pierre, and Michel - share an apartment in Paris, and have many girlfriends and parties. Once, during a party, a friend of Jacques\' tells him he has a quite compromising package to deliver, and asks him if he can leave it discreetly at their place. Jacques agrees and, as he works as a steward, flies away for a one-month trip in Japan, telling Pierre and Michel about the package. Then, one of Jacques\' former girlfriends drops a baby before their door, making Pierre and Michel believing it is the package they are waiting for. Their lives are then completely changed.','/3TfJL5jbyWFUOe1NB81iI8w7Gct.jpg','1985-09-18',106,'Released','In one split second, their lives went from party to potty.','Three Men and a Cradle',4180,2.0546,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9461,_binary '\0','/uHhvKpVXFjOUTdTdLBGsiHMrZL8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090209',6.3,2962,'en','Trouble in Mind','The lives of an ex-con, a coffee-shop owner, and a young couple looking to make it rich intersect in the hypnotic Rain City.','/3qyepsmFJ8tYFwk1FImAtsJmmXk.jpg','1985-12-11',112,'Released','Drugs, sex, crime… Rain City has it all. Here everyone gets what they want — or what they deserve.','Trouble in Mind',31694,2.2441,5.8,'RyxrU7Wxzz8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9462,_binary '\0','/ziWL35cQqm8BbFfIcMwQBgaPS5v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090213',6,7037,'en','Tuff Turf','The new guy in a Los Angeles high school, Morgan, does some singing and fights hotshot Nick over disco dancer Frankie.','/9FueZsXEXNqFlmB2o2WuGQPdkv5.jpg','1985-01-11',112,'Released','Meet Morgan Hiller. He\'s a rebel about to become a hero.','Tuff Turf',28410,4.4991,5.953,'OhBIJuS3AvM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9463,_binary '\0','/dFNR8y8inY9fz8mgJtnEFjS0AF6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090215',7.4,3234,'fi','Tuntematon sotilas','Second silver screen adaption of the Finnish war book by Väinö Linna. The story is based on Linna\'s experiences as an infantry man in the Finnish army during the so called \"Continuation War\" (1941-1944).','/7GFnQOBBKOafcoozoL7aqSZk4DL.jpg','1985-12-06',199,'Released',NULL,'The Unknown Soldier',41205,1.7352,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9464,_binary '\0','/rqkbPhGt1fZnv6oPlmiFefqJsGK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090217',6,4361,'en','Turk 182!','After New York City firefighter Terry Lynch is unable to receive any compensation for an injury incurred during the off-duty rescue of a young girl, he grows suicidal. Furious, his brother Jimmy attempts to have Mayor Tyler intervene, but the corrupt politician instead denounces Terry as a drunk. Determined to get justice, Jimmy begins a graffiti campaign of embarrassing slogans mocking the mayor, which soon captivates the city.','/HlpFZ60MBnEChXYM4Jc4HmpNPb.jpg','1985-02-15',102,'Released','Who said you can\'t fight City Hall?','Turk 182!',27969,1.3454,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9465,_binary '\0','/brPMxVY4omak8bE54uSpVQwKbK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090223',6.4,1782,'en','Twice in a Lifetime','A middle-aged steelworker is content with his job and his family, but feels that something is missing in his life. On his 50th birthday, he stops in at a local bar for a drink to celebrate. He finds himself attracted to the young, very sexy barmaid--and, to his surprise, he finds that she is also very attracted to him.','/bpPkDnPuLuFumbaJ99UdPXwMC0g.jpg','1985-10-23',111,'Released',NULL,'Twice in a Lifetime',123049,2.2529,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9466,_binary '\0','/yJETbK0I5vjERjPq0e2V0Q31c84.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090233',4,1471,'en','Transmutations','When high class hooker Nicole is kidnapped from her brothel, Rich businessman Hugo Motherskille hires her ex love Roy Bain to find her. Investigating the disappearance, he eventually finds traces that lead to Dr. Savary, who has produced a strange white powder that\'s coveted by a race of deformed human beings who live in the underworld in the sewers below the city.','/mXQhaHoJ7Jc27aiMEsClbKD4gEt.jpg','1985-11-29',103,'Released','A horrible experiment. A criminal empire. One thing in common...','Underworld',92766,1.963,4,'AtTH1uvXxeQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9467,_binary '\0','/t16rXVuAp4EYYqNTM9PifymH9cb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090245',6.1,1890,'fi','Uuno Epsanjassa','Uuno Turhapuro is searching for a job and takes a correspondence course in tour guiding. Eventually he gets a job in a small travel agency and takes a group of Finnish tourists to Marbella, Spain. Unfortunately Uuno\'s father-in-law Tuura is in the group, too, with his wife and daughter, Uuno\'s wife Elisabet. Tuura tries to get a signature to an important paper from a minister who\'s having a holiday in the area. Meanwhile, Uuno just relaxes and enjoys the sun.','/4EsFMtAKTJyrHDBmfvPkry09Eei.jpg','1985-09-27',105,'Released',NULL,'Uuno Epsanjassa',36769,1.9238,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9468,_binary '\0','/3B7KJva0uuF0CqihJeQozImiiqo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090246',7.4,3344,'pl','Vabank II czyli Riposta','A sequel to \"Vabank\" (1981), introduces the same characters entangled in a duel between a former safecracker and a crooked bank manager.','/kHmXAQq8T6xb8CTUX4mpm73x8uU.jpg','1985-05-06',97,'Released',NULL,'Vabank II',56078,1.4957,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9469,_binary '\0','/1zs8iKZMKrtIh2MulIwwU6Gs9EK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090248',7,19505,'ja','バンパイアハンターD','In a far-future time ruled by the supernatural, a young girl requests the help of a vampire hunter to kill the vampire who has bitten her and thus prevent her from becoming a vampire herself.','/xS4WXii5OUKXIkVtObnVciRT8dt.jpg','1985-12-21',80,'Released','When our darkest dreams become real ...reality becomes a nightmare!','Vampire Hunter D',9463,5.2597,6.6,'6bc9z5Tmq4w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9470,_binary '\0','/dWxaJaZUXedrNP2oADPRQLMV190.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090249',6.8,1609,'es','¡Vampiros en La Habana!','Professor Von Dracula, a vampire scientist, leaves Transylvania for Cuba, where he invents \"Vampisol,\" a potion that allows vampires to survive in sunlight. When the professor announces his intention to donate the formula free-of-charge to vampires all over the world, the Vampire Mafia from Chicago and the European Group of Vampires from Düsseldorf try to muscle in and steal the formula. The action escalates crazily as an assortment of bad guys, police, vampires and other monsters, and our hero and his girlfriend are all caught up in the chase.','/sbmsBRzKKr08PwJixfcdqye7Fg1.jpg','1985-07-30',80,'Released','Not since FRITZ THE CAT has there been such a freewheeling sexy cartoon romp!','Vampires in Havana',90063,1.3431,6.2,'9c9OifE5DSQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9471,_binary '\0','/pm3l0g98hEyEJEEPJyNre905EPm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090250',7.5,2389,'es','La vaquilla','During the Spanish Civil War a platoon of mismatched Republican soldiers cross the front-line to steal the bull that the enemy is going to fight on the local holiday of the nearby village. In addition to ruining the Nationalist faction\'s celebration they want the animal in order to butcher it and feed their famished troops. They get caught in the process and have to go through a series of funny and pathetic incidents before they can get back to their side.','/rUJW2FYGgn98DNCbODKUCf5EiBo.jpg','1985-03-06',122,'Released',NULL,'The Heifer',71799,1.3815,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9472,_binary '\0','/y7Ii1GLh2LsQk7gXfC8cdtFnOl9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090251',6.1,1673,'en','Variety','A young woman becomes obsessed with pornography and the mysterious rich patrons of the Times Square porn theater where she works selling tickets.','/hwqY6igW7oRM9NJyotQ8oSt6BcF.jpg','1985-02-27',101,'Released','Christine watches men watch women','Variety',85129,1.5912,5.4,'4IwXNrlYZpI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9473,_binary '\0','/wxeNbOL1oulCKDKYY3WXnStb3mX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090257',7.8,5250,'cs','Vesničko má středisková','The movie\'s main storyline follows the life of Otík, a young man, in a tight-knit village community. The sweet-tempered Otík works as an assistant truck driver with Mr. Pávek, his older colleague and practical-minded neighbor. Pávek\'s family takes care of Otík, whose parents are dead. However, the two coworkers become at odds over Otík\'s inability to perform even the simplest tasks. Pávek demands that Otík be transferred to assist another driver, who happens to be a choleric and suspicious man named Turek (Turk in Czech). Rather than work with Turek, Otík decides to accept an offer of employment in Prague, but finds he does not fit in to the city life. After discovering that the transfer of Otík to Prague was a trick by a crooked politician to get a deal on Otík\'s large inherited house, Pávek agrees to give Otík a second chance and retrieves him from the city to resume their work together.','/WAv3g9UbBw7kd4ikOSGxgVjRGf.jpg','1985-08-01',98,'Released',NULL,'My Sweet Little Village',31410,1.877,7.42,'kM8I4yDQS5w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9474,_binary '\0','/9qNGaAZ8P6YSXkvS0WncnILObak.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090259',7.5,2038,'es','El viaje a ninguna parte','The Iniesta-Galván family is a theatre company that goes from town to town offering its performances. Over the years, its members will have to adapt to changes and make decisions, like that of whether or not to continue performing. One day, unexpectedly, a son that he has fathered on his travels presents himself to Carlos Galván.','/bzYqYZHiZYDuPk4akpLhbWBxZHl.jpg','1986-10-15',134,'Released','First The Holy Innocents. Now a comedy film','Voyage to Nowhere',156453,1.6087,7.5,'npXIHHCJDGg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9475,_binary '\0','/hvGWyyC8wER1I8ExSXNtFBs7Mgd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090264',6.3,113987,'en','A View to a Kill','A newly-developed microchip designed by Zorin Industries for the British Government that can survive the electromagnetic radiation caused by a nuclear explosion has landed in the hands of the KGB. James Bond must find out how and why. His suspicions soon lead him to big industry leader Max Zorin who forms a plan to destroy his only competition in Silicon Valley by triggering a massive earthquake in the San Francisco Bay.','/arJF829RP9cYvh0NU70dC5TtXSa.jpg','1985-05-24',131,'Released','Has James Bond finally met his match?','A View to a Kill',707,13.2912,6.256,'pxQS8iAlr9w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9476,_binary '\0','/waUvIPIUxDRZOigwjEEOWGVIPDX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090270',6.7,11907,'en','Vision Quest','After deciding he needs to do something meaningful with his life, high school wrestler Louden Swain sets out on a mission to drop weight and challenge the area\'s undefeated champion, which creates problems with his teammates and health. Matters are complicated further when Louden\'s father takes in an attractive female drifter who\'s on her way to San Francisco.','/l3g4e6ocqGA8aNL1hIrIVWLkljL.jpg','1985-02-15',105,'Released','All he needed was a lucky break. Then one day she moved in.','Vision Quest',30069,4.6412,6.394,'-he8aLdB0KA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9477,_binary '\0','/xuwqYwzsgwfr0mk6sBNRy6C8JpK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090274',5.5,11837,'en','Volunteers','After graduating from Yale in 1962, womanizing Lawrence flees a gambling debt that his rich dad won\'t pay and takes his roomie\'s place as a Peace Corps Volunteer in the Thai Golden Triangle with two other PCVs. Will he survive two years?','/tua28Wyv9uGBtPTBGCP7GsN3Znu.jpg','1985-08-16',107,'Released','Ready or not, here they come.','Volunteers',19259,3.2509,5.5,'bBmLrIpWpNk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9478,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090275',7.1,1403,'nl','Voro-Nova',NULL,'/fpszkFyNbdR3yvWMZ2q9gLmSQ1h.jpg',NULL,86,'Released',NULL,'Voro-Nova',1415650,1.1227,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9479,_binary '\0','/9SSPezaZ3VrilgXmSvYuuTnzF8R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090293',6.1,3190,'en','Warning Sign','An accident occurs in an ultra-secret government biological weapons laboratory spreading a sinister bacteria.','/fILeip7L7fd8CWgizhIma2euFgg.jpg','1985-08-23',99,'Released','Modern man. Science has given him the ultimate power to create new forms of life. But with that power comes overwhelming responsibility...and danger.','Warning Sign',34028,3.7022,6,'_sINnqU6Jf0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9480,_binary '\0','/fz3JoREbHzUdwjlfiUq0BU9ibpM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090297',6,2862,'en','Water','The British governor of a tiny island nation in the Caribbean Commonwealth finds his idyllic existence thrown into chaos when an American drilling company finds a huge source of natural mineral water there.','/iBwZRLoNjvzplQ5bForJ2dEC0QH.jpg','1985-01-11',98,'Released',NULL,'Water',19127,2.3237,6.1,'NVOjxMEJJ0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9481,_binary '\0','/2oaTLhpbnX8kfrlJTostT27uL5j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090305',6.6,106801,'en','Weird Science','Two unpopular teenagers, Gary and Wyatt, fail at all attempts to be accepted by their peers. Their desperation to be liked leads them to \"create\" a woman via their computer. Their living and breathing creation is a gorgeous woman, Lisa, whose purpose is to boost their confidence level by putting them into situations which require Gary and Wyatt to act like men.','/AsFxOHwUlK7mTOkC5p6SySsdEjz.jpg','1985-08-01',93,'Released','It\'s all in the name of science... Weird Science.','Weird Science',11814,8.1081,6.535,'hnLH2f7ZTm0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9482,_binary '\0','/lEiyTTfpYcfMby6GDtXMPxeQIPi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090310',6.5,1916,'en','Wetherby','The mysterious death of an enigmatic young man newly arrived in the suburb of Wetherby releases the long-repressed, dark passions of some of its residents.','/koVPZF3r1jFS1gKMTK27dco6crv.jpg','1985-06-19',102,'Released','A small town... a random act of violence... an unsolved mystery.','Wetherby',147747,1.335,6,'htQAjObrc6k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9483,_binary '\0','/lnOGnHqDlZMRGQTEukwWBu5s7fd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090315',7.7,15228,'en','When the Wind Blows','With the help of government-issued pamphlets, an elderly British couple build a shelter and prepare for an impending nuclear attack, unaware that times and the nature of war have changed from their romantic memories of World War II.','/sQ7CgHdDcKnnzhCXA7wC2JVL7qq.jpg','1986-10-24',84,'Released','...it\'s no fairy tale.','When the Wind Blows',10857,4.2555,7.472,'9pJKdTqYijY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9484,_binary '\0','/nEs4WAMmfsywZWLkJHtKQh3LDpa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090319',6.7,9188,'en','White Nights','After his plane crashes in Siberia, a Russian dancer, who defected to the West, is held prisoner in the Soviet Union. The KGB keeps him under watch and tries to convince him to become a dancer for the Kirov Academy of Ballet again. Determined to escape, he befriends a black American expatriate and his pregnant Russian wife, who agree to help him escape to the American Embassy.','/ampweVzwwWQHSwFvz2YTyRIrJza.jpg','1985-11-22',136,'Released','Two men. Not soldiers. Not heroes. Just dancers. Willing to risk their lives for freedom-and each other.','White Nights',16082,4.0094,6.7,'VHpKeRSLnF8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9485,_binary '\0','/vLvi7jHjBjZjLO772x4NS3NBXXz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090322',5.5,1398,'it','Wild Beasts - Belve feroci','PCP is unexplainably released into the Frankfurt water supply and sends the zoo inhabitants crazy. One evening after a malfunction of zoo security the gonzo critters rampage through the city eating and killing whatever they fancy, wreaking a night of bloody terror.','/76vlHowxWy3GPPuE1asttNT47yw.jpg','1984-02-15',92,'Released',NULL,'Wild Beasts',80653,1.9456,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9486,_binary '\0','/sAWuJf2G4qzI9pB8pZ1lHnLgwDt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090323',4.9,1788,'en','Wild Geese II','A group of mercenaries is hired to spring Rudolf Hess from Spandau Prison in Berlin.','/mqlQdtfWzDmWZA3GQPz1Hr0RV06.jpg','1985-10-18',125,'Released','They\'re back in the most spectacular rescue mission ever filmed!','Wild Geese II',46971,2.3366,4.8,'GhJosrcNm7U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9487,_binary '\0','/oMKG9VmiPkOUR64Pp628CMkZwhw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090327',5.7,9603,'en','Witchboard','Playing around with a Ouija board, a trio of friends succeeds in contacting the spirit of a young boy. Trouble begins when the evil spirit, Malfeitor, takes over one of their bodies.','/d5lDHBzEgBkgAarXpUl56u2vM8c.jpg','1986-12-31',98,'Released','It\'s more than just a game.','Witchboard',17994,3.0343,5.701,'mfvgWqJ2vfc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9488,_binary '\0','/aDn3wL0ObbA5TCn5ZLri9xI2kUZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090329',7.3,115453,'en','Witness','While protecting an Amish boy—the sole witness to a brutal murder—and his mother, a detective is forced to seek refuge within their community when his own life comes under threat.','/kOymD1rChAMykmDVEzJpIh4OYS7.jpg','1985-02-08',112,'Released','A big city cop. A small country boy. They have nothing in common... but a murder.','Witness',9281,6.2327,7.088,'WY1e01OVu-Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9489,_binary '\0','/jUql7CUpp4vsidsZ0PoX4qxzGMp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090333',3,2363,'en','Wizards of the Lost Kingdom','Simon, son of the king, must flee when the empire is overthrown by the evil Shurka. Schooled in the arts of magic, he must find the Ring of Magic and the Sword of Power and defeat the wizard who killed his father. He is joined in his quest by the swordmaster Kor, his faithful protector Gulfax, and the Forest Wizard Hurla.','/3DHquDuiTx0Wp1SOH0oZSQUbkvc.jpg','1985-10-01',79,'Released','A brave boy and a great warrior seek the ring of ultimate power.','Wizards of the Lost Kingdom',7234,2.0167,3.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9490,_binary '\0','/4a1icLlGeh212x35R63UQXlOimH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090334',2.1,1297,'en','Wizards of the Lost Kingdom II','Three kingdoms have been overtaken by three evil lords and only Tyor, a teenage boy with magical powers, can restore peace to the land with the help of a bumbling elder, wizard and a hero in each kingdom. Tyor fights alongside them and eventually becomes a powerful wizard in his own right.','/39Emk29cNi1lBfW86yGFCVOawzp.jpg','1989-03-01',79,'Released',NULL,'Wizards of the Lost Kingdom II',7237,1.9445,2.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9491,_binary '\0','/6QnesTGAwuBlK39BB7OF1penVhY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090342',6.2,5055,'cn','夏日福星','The third installment in the Lucky Stars series, following Winners and Sinners and My Lucky Stars. The team are released from prison to play detective in order to stop a ruthless gang from ruining their reputations, taking their lives, and that of a key witness in an upcoming trial. They must battle their way through and with the help of Muscles, take down the bad guys.','/ojeCl4Qw4CmMP7jjpiJU4ZlbsV.jpg','1985-08-15',94,'Released','This time those cock-eyed crime-busters land in more trouble than anyone could safely handle.','Twinkle, Twinkle Lucky Stars',18707,5.3992,6.5,'9Z34v34VJyM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9492,_binary '\0','/nE7p7AgZtRmQdEu7Z275f4729k2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090350',6.8,19979,'en','Year of the Dragon','In New York, racist Capt. Stanley White becomes obsessed with destroying a Chinese-American drug ring run by Joey Tai, an up-and-coming young gangster as ambitious as he is ruthless. While pursuing an unauthorized investigation, White grows increasingly willing to violate police protocol, resorting to progressively violent measures -- even as his concerned wife, Connie, and his superiors beg him to consider the consequences of his actions.','/c8SfIgwR5mfu0c0qTBKbsvBfecJ.jpg','1985-08-16',134,'Released','It isn\'t the Bronx or Brooklyn, it isn\'t even New York. It\'s Chinatown... and it\'s about to explode.','Year of the Dragon',11018,4.688,6.8,'_8FmxPf13vA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9493,_binary '\0','/depMebS7tRuR8ebxghxdkIlnX3s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090357',6.8,25544,'en','Young Sherlock Holmes','Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson meet as boys in an English Boarding school. Holmes is known for his deductive ability even as a youth, amazing his classmates with his abilities. When they discover a plot to murder a series of British business men by an Egyptian cult, they move to stop it.','/aOxVYvQoAfNSns4hW5Ah55GBzgq.jpg','1985-12-04',109,'Released','Before a lifetime of adventure, they lived the adventure of a lifetime.','Young Sherlock Holmes',11904,4.5795,6.763,'PVTHS6vyOZw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9494,_binary '\0','/7NVTbSEsUYxAzv0prODP7OCzuPl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090366',7.2,8218,'en','A Zed & Two Noughts','Identical twin zoologists lose their wives in a car crash caused by a white swan. They become obsessed with the death and decay of animals, and develop a strange and unusual relationship with the driver of the car, a woman who is now an amputee.','/55eiU0JNfNRqWbpabsf6NukntI2.jpg','1985-10-04',116,'Released',NULL,'A Zed & Two Noughts',33078,3.3685,7,'Fk6byMb-d4w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9495,_binary '\0','/i9jxoPhQp7SE8CZYYQU3oG2mlKM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090368',7.9,4484,'ru','Жестокий романс','In the town of Bryakhimov, noble but poor widow Harita Ignatyevna Ogudalova seeks to arrange marriages for her three daughters. She maintains an “open house”, hoping to attract gentlemen well-off enough to marry a dowry-less girl for love.','/q8On932TIIuOspcZnD9bu6jahbF.jpg','1984-06-06',142,'Released',NULL,'Ruthless Romance',66091,1.586,7.261,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9496,_binary '\0','/fdyRR3R1urnk6oYiChCMu6bFaFb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090555',6.7,125502,'en','Crocodile Dundee','When a New York reporter plucks crocodile hunter Mick Dundee from the Australian Outback for a visit to the Big Apple, it\'s a clash of cultures and a recipe for good-natured comedy as naïve Dundee negotiates the concrete jungle. He proves that his instincts are quite useful in the city and adeptly handles everything from wily muggers to high-society snoots without breaking a sweat.','/pduPduL1ub5kok3lPYT15ryC9L6.jpg','1986-09-26',97,'Released','There\'s a little of him in all of us.','Crocodile Dundee',9671,11.1833,6.4,'HhmlgCCXaXc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9497,_binary '\0','/oFoxGYKbpBMLzTyaytSuDrGgJgr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090556',7.5,2840,'en','\'night, Mother','A mother and daughter spend a night together after the daughter reveals that she will kill herself by the end of it.','/qMUD4HGqjH1I8LBZI9kcT6Dxmyh.jpg','1986-09-12',96,'Released',NULL,'\'night, Mother',34760,2.5762,7.4,'3E2kkkaq5mc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9498,_binary '\0','/nxxdhhcKreBWItIzN2MQohoIeCY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090557',7.4,6513,'en','\'Round Midnight','Inside the Blue Note nightclub one night in 1959 Paris, an aged, ailing jazzman coaxes an eloquent wail from his tenor sax. Outside, a young Parisian too broke to buy a glass of wine strains to hear those notes. Soon they will form a friendship that sparks a final burst of genius.','/8aNGnEsvLBldNvaBkfYkGGgZDhe.jpg','1986-09-23',131,'Released','The music and the magic come together...','\'Round Midnight',14670,3.4951,7.1,'dTvfgMULsKY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9499,_binary '\0','/hZVBkgxgezyKEkWIbPVLiWAOsrl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090563',7.3,24221,'fr','37°2 le matin','A lackadaisical handyman and aspiring novelist tries to support his younger girlfriend as she slowly succumbs to madness.','/dGkxgj2ozlD4yRtsJL35EUXegFv.jpg','1986-04-09',120,'Released',NULL,'Betty Blue',11986,6.0734,7.205,'lRvPEJsM3aE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9500,_binary '\0','/gl1Db1GugLrWybuIVwPWzD8sOjJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090565',7.4,4162,'fr','4 aventures de Reinette et Mirabelle','Two young girls meet, Reinette from the countryside and Mirabelle from Paris, and decide to take a flat together in Paris where they attend University. Four successive stories about their daily lives illustrate the very different views, characters and relation to the world of these two friends.','/iXydrbtUGX7CUutomhtMtlUd3Cb.jpg','1987-02-04',95,'Released',NULL,'Four Adventures of Reinette and Mirabelle',37189,2.3377,7.408,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9501,_binary '\0','/heayRHS4N4ySt7ooN1Hts0PiB35.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090567',6.4,8496,'en','52 Pick-Up','Harry Mitchell is a successful Los Angeles manufacturer whose wife is running for city council. His life is turned upside down when three blackmailers confront him with a videotape of him with his young mistress and demand $100,000. Fearing that the story will hurt his wife\'s political campaign if he goes to the police, Harry pretends that he will pay the men, but does not follow through.','/ru8dtoh6tNi7kKAbLgbaE9J5SGf.jpg','1986-11-07',110,'Released','His Wife... His Mistress... His Career... A Deadly Trap','52 Pick-Up',18588,3.8301,6.093,'yK-ajlxnyOY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9502,_binary '\0','/cTB1DtDLqEH4FrgICvEaNDeJiPU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090568',5.8,7010,'en','8 Million Ways to Die','Scudder is a detective with the Sheriff\'s Department who is forced to shoot a violent suspect during a narcotics raid. The ensuing psychological aftermath of this shooting worsens his drinking problem and this alcoholism causes him to lose his job, as well as his marriage.','/anxyPdDX3I0vtSwL68qQmpLqp05.jpg','1986-04-25',115,'Released','Death comes to all except those who deserve it most.','8 Million Ways to Die',20858,3.4792,5.457,'Rk4pc_5JAoo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9503,_binary '\0','/pW5TdAIHk8sIgYRmDOCOxgqgSrv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090570',7.4,12477,'en','84 Charing Cross Road','When a humorous script-reader in her New York apartment sees an ad in the Saturday Review of Literature for a bookstore in London that does mail order, she begins a very special correspondence and friendship with Frank Doel, the bookseller who works at Marks & Co., 84 Charing Cross Road.','/sbImaHsRP9TpCNIi4xMizaphZhk.jpg','1987-02-13',100,'Released','A big love affair that began in a little bookstore at 84 Charing Cross Road.','84 Charing Cross Road',15677,3.786,7.163,'s7vOZTosT_w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9504,_binary '\0','/10ZasIEIS66gfucorBsbOWLiyxU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090575',7.1,1788,'hi','आखिरी रास्ता','David is an old prisoner, released after twenty-four years in a penitentiary for a crime he hasn\'t committed. The three men who framed him and sent him away, are now prominent citizens of his town. David walks out of the prison straight into a confessional booth at his church. He tells the priest that he is about to kill three prominent men, for which he seeks God\'s pardon in advance. He must find his old friend, bootlegger and the custodian of David\'s only son. David had believed in his friend to bring up his son as the worst criminal and seek revenge from the men who put him away. On meeting him, David finds that his son is a Cop instead. Devastated, David continues on his own. When he is about to kill the three men, his son has vowed to protect the citizens under any circumstances. David and his son are at war..who will prevail?','/zeOByJ06LPHctubIWZzOfpdPzYQ.jpg','1986-06-02',164,'Released',NULL,'Aakhree Raasta',267504,1.4171,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9505,_binary '\0','/n5DLPRibl9ysKoHqc7DvMvs4T89.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090576',7.2,3671,'nl','De Aanslag','At the end of WWII the Dutch resistance kills a German officer in front of the house of a Dutch family. Years after the war the young boy who witnessed the killing runs into the members of the resistance who committed the killing.','/wvklfVmpr4i5BexkvytKtpfu7DM.jpg','1986-02-06',144,'Released',NULL,'The Assault',2753,1.5228,6.8,'Xf53HPH1Nsw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9506,_binary '\0','/5k7X69OY6pp3Sa94N1fob0ezcnq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090579',7.4,2735,'nl','Abel','Abel has never left home (literally). After failing with doctors and psychiatrists, Abel\'s father Victor brings home Christine, a friend, in an attempt to teach Abel basic social skills. But Victor\'s wife Duif accuses him of having an affair, and in the ensuing row Abel is thrown out into the street. But help is at hand when he runs into kind-hearted stripper Zus - whose show Victor is obsessed with…','/sPFbXoTXolVS1HeUwprnT06toLh.jpg','1986-02-27',100,'Released',NULL,'Abel',2754,1.6566,6.4,'x3UvqjcAZJ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9507,_binary '\0','/8UqukRNZFNfJZE9WnG2J0IDy2Yi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090583',6.3,19471,'en','About Last Night...','A man and woman meet and try to have a romantic affair, despite their personal problems and the interference of their disapproving friends.','/9KqG5OFi3NLJYBbsDSA8pZ3dln.jpg','1986-07-02',113,'Released','Making love was easy...being in love difficult.','About Last Night...',18169,4.8097,6.058,'Ouub45fF_MQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9508,_binary '\0','/fh7l9kG5eXbrmk9LYvDJ5zztNYd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090585',5.6,3998,'en','Absolute Beginners','A musical adaptation of Colin MacInnes\' novel about life in late 1950s London. Nineteen-year-old photographer Colin is hopelessly in love with model Crepe Suzette, but her relationships are strictly connected with her progress in the fashion world. So Colin gets involved with a pop promoter and tries to crack the big time. Meanwhile, racial tension is brewing in Colin\'s Notting Hill housing estate...','/tq67vYAINghy7GzK7BE4462r0FR.jpg','1986-04-04',108,'Released','Welcome to the world of your dreams!','Absolute Beginners',42017,2.4742,5.527,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9509,_binary '\0','/bPMAfe7ba6Mwp3dEJyWLWKfmTxb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090601',5.4,3999,'it','Superfantagenio','A teenager in modern-day Miami finds a magic lantern and out pops a genie, who\'s been asleep for 200 years and in his gratitude grants the boy several wishes.','/zlnzJd4v8XyW4usXGoKkzRH1n2M.jpg','1986-12-23',92,'Released',NULL,'Aladdin',9807,2.3603,5.6,'HQR-k6QW5tU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9510,_binary '\0','/4kix6fAblJIH6eMs0Ku2loyZJXK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090605',8.4,848198,'en','Aliens','Ripley, the sole survivor of the Nostromo\'s deadly encounter with the monstrous Alien, returns to Earth after drifting through space in hypersleep for 57 years. Although her story is initially met with skepticism, she agrees to accompany a team of Colonial Marines back to LV-426.','/r1x5JGpyqZU8PYhbs4UcrO1Xb6x.jpg','1986-07-18',137,'Released','This time it\'s war.','Aliens',679,26.3522,7.966,'8OxirbuHsBA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9511,_binary '\0','/hZ7oCK4pWbsnHwX6OXhw0VgjSSl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090610',6.8,2754,'sv','Alla vi barn i Bullerbyn','The story of the children who live in Bullerbyn, Sweden, through the spring and summer months.','/3J8XDd1MmwfWlUFktdw313otVbR.jpg','1986-12-06',90,'Released',NULL,'The Children of Noisy Village',21394,3.1168,6.3,'dzXzve2uXTs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9512,_binary '\0','/p12UKVrLRWNwe6GtfGmJpjLkZwX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090627',4.2,1726,'en','Amazons','An epic from the dark ages about the legendary lost tribe of warrior women! The girls fly into danger, come up against fierce tribes, fall prey to sorcery, put to rest a family rivalry of centuries past and battle to victory!','/zYiwXG8UBkSSbtiDiZH48aEZYLg.jpg','1986-10-26',76,'Released','An age of magic and mystery... A land where no man has entered.','Amazons',48180,3.4058,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9513,_binary '\0','/vj7kKjbgywk4lK9rLZteKaDB1hB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090630',4.2,1760,'en','America 3000','900 years after a nuclear war in the USA, mankind is back to the stone ages. Amazon women rule the tribes, while the men are weak and dumb - either kept as slaves or living wild as animals. Only Korvis and a friend are intelligent enough to flee and found a tribe of their own. Will they manage to teach the women to love men again?','/7RwuEJ5Xho0Bsfj3oleZHntEPHC.jpg','1986-04-08',84,'Released','Back to the beginning','America 3000',27270,2.3882,4.1,'gGAHRT5VXa0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9514,_binary '\0','/6jlDsaPeaIBJitfcMKgfIMf8nRT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090631',4.9,1876,'en','American Anthem','Steve is a talented gymnast who has given up competition and is working at his father\'s bike shop. Julie is the new girl at his old gym, who has moved to town to train with their powerful coach. Inspired by Julie, Steve resumes training. While dealing with the conflicts in their personal lives and the stress of training, they prepare for the US Olympic Trials.','/cLFdihWnglEZVB98ruxMHC8Vrr6.jpg','1986-06-27',102,'Released','The struggle. The striving. The sweat. The hopes. The heartbreaks.','American Anthem',45930,2.0859,5.2,'EswsTaTCQhw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9515,_binary '\0','/WRgAzhlujb9BRnSj97TZVMIvpz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090633',6.9,62123,'en','An American Tail','A young mouse named Fievel and his family decide to migrate to America, a \"land without cats,\" at the turn of the 20th century. But somehow, Fievel ends up in the New World alone and must fend off not only the felines he never thought he\'d have to deal with again but also the loneliness of being away from home.','/51pLurrIQDhXZab4cv8lHP32UiR.jpg','1986-11-21',80,'Released','Meet Fievel. In his search to find his family, he discovered America.','An American Tail',4978,7.521,6.8,'1XC0REIj_F0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9516,_binary '\0','/huPLaQFhsPf0eWRVEkbw1gK2tx8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090644',6.7,4867,'es','Angustia','An ophthalmologist\'s assistant with an unhealthy interest in human eyeballs goes on a killing spree to collect eyeballs for his overbearing mother\'s collection. Reality soon takes a bizarre turn, both for the characters and the audience.','/pcgTyhl00GDmlKyZvEOJ3qDxEgP.jpg','1987-03-23',88,'Released','The eyes of the city are mine.','Anguish',42002,2.7407,6.3,'Yrax4wwDWdA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9517,_binary '\0','/lLxz3D3LBhyO3q9F0eBqSjepoD4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090655',6.2,20316,'en','April Fool\'s Day','On April Fool\'s Day weekend, a group of college friends gather together at a secluded island mansion to celebrate their final year of school, where they soon become prey for an unseen murderer.','/prNp2xFZXIE6IwO2uOnqwtdfRQI.jpg','1986-03-27',89,'Released','Guess who\'s going to be the life of the party?','April Fool\'s Day',24913,3.7638,6.044,'tjT58KaVI3s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9518,_binary '\0','/dvz8C6SXhNMw9SIv6WWYpLLECoj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090660',5.8,14250,'en','Armed and Dangerous','After policeman Frank Dooley is framed for theft and loses his job on the force, he joins a security guard agency and teams up with inept former defense lawyer Norman Kane. When the two botch a job guarding a local warehouse, they begin to uncover corruption within the company and their union.','/wqDfHzqyuv7iRMMyFLvn5g7u30I.jpg','1986-08-15',88,'Released','Undercover. Overdressed. And keeping you safe from the scum of the earth.','Armed and Dangerous',2620,4.6032,5.7,'jfTI5jgm__s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9519,_binary '\0','/mzmJAIO1mYHapSPVSFRATuGxfKU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090665',6.7,2399,'ar','عصفور السطح','Twelve-year-old Noura dangles uncertainly in that difficult netherworld between childhood and adulthood. His growing libido has gotten him banned from the women\'s baths, where his mother took him when he was younger, but he\'s not yet old enough to participate in grown-up discussions with the men of his Tunisian village. Noura\'s only real friend is a troublemaker named Salih -- the village political outcast.','/uI7hb9flZetd0KZoN2BGHLq4uvZ.jpg','1990-09-14',98,'Released',NULL,'Halfaouine: Boy of the Terraces',44281,2.0161,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9520,_binary '\0','/cNwnAack1iyaLoWqGyTGocMOarg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090667',7.1,13723,'fr','Astérix chez les Bretons','One little ancient British village still holds out against the Roman invaders. Asterix and Obelix are invited to help. They must face fog, rain, warm beer and boiled boar with mint sauce, but they soon have Governor Encyclopaedius Britannicus\'s Romans declining and falling. Until a wild race for a barrel of magic potion lands them in the drink.','/10L5R1l03MqDx36e0LJ99NKLGD3.jpg','1986-12-03',79,'Released',NULL,'Asterix in Britain',9318,5.7357,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9521,_binary '\0','/ceFgHH7mnpwrKoK8dVRjfvIVr5e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090670',6.9,20920,'en','At Close Range','Brad Whitewood Jr. lives in rural Pennsylvania and has few prospects. Against his mother\'s wishes, he seeks out his estranged father, the head of a gang of thieves in a nearby town. Though his new girlfriend supports his criminal ambitions, Brad Jr. soon learns that his father is a dangerous man.','/bOkXqMmLowHBZY9lptWi3ljOXx4.jpg','1986-04-18',116,'Released','Like father. Like son. Like hell.','At Close Range',13715,4.8837,6.82,'7xFJiylekCQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9522,_binary '\0','/6WykdA4hfmceDShUir6CjTVAwoH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090678',5.8,3903,'en','Avenging Force','A senator is targeted by the Pentangle, a right wing paramilitary group. His pal, a former CIA agent and martial artist, tries to help him. The group kidnaps the agent\'s sister and tries to hunt him down, \"The Most Dangerous Game\" style.','/nR2SSO740LzAAL43l8iDdik5flP.jpg','1986-09-12',104,'Released',NULL,'Avenging Force',52657,2.9686,5.7,'tiwCMrnxFvA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9523,_binary '\0','/lBGWicMFQCbmTakVPbYZ9AHUkFL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090683',5.2,4562,'en','Babes in Toyland','11-year-old Lisa has no time for toys; she\'s too busy taking care of her siblings and cooking for her mother. During the Christmas Eve blizzard, Lisa travels to Toyland in Wizard of Oz-like fashion and arrives just in time for a wedding. Young Mary Contrary is about to marry mean, old Barnaby Barnacle, despite the fact that she loves Jack Be Nimble. Lisa tries to stop this terrible wedding and, together with her new friends, discovers that Barnaby wants to take over Toyland. Lisa, Mary, Jack, and Georgie Porgie ask the Toymaster for help, but he can\'t help them as long as Lisa doesn\'t truly believe in toys.','/mTg72oYoK18oV1uuuZGW2JI752x.jpg','1986-12-19',95,'Released',NULL,'Babes in Toyland',26984,3.2246,5.5,'Lw_PmtdWjzk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9524,_binary '\0','/35cMosW05B9P9VgPkbg79n6mkM9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090685',6.7,40084,'en','Back to School','Self-made millionaire Thornton Melon decides to get a better education and enrolls at his son Jason\'s college. While Jason tries to fit in with his fellow students, Thornton struggles to gain his son\'s respect, giving way to hilarious antics.','/nspYnZ6QwqAQXaCLjbGKfEA83tf.jpg','1986-06-13',96,'Released','He enrolled in college for the pursuit of finer things...like co-eds, shapely professors, fun and rock and roll.','Back to School',15596,6.0144,6.3,'fHRECtiZ7E8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9525,_binary '\0','/yX317H7RxKVICjetVoAeS0bmBuj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090693',6.2,3584,'en','Band of the Hand','An Indian Vietnam veteran trains five street punks in the Everglades to fight vice in Miami.','/ypfbaT6qB8cUfeflK7PO9F4hvsm.jpg','1986-04-11',109,'Released','They\'re back on the mean streets. But this time, they\'re the good guys.','Band of the Hand',33762,3.7487,6.258,'UeshhQehpwo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9526,_binary '\0','/b7ywYnXH05b1PJjsw3upv9Sb5VR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090713',6,9092,'en','The Best of Times','A small-town loser determines to have one more shot at the big time by winning a football game.','/9KSuob3tStXyxaQ52Fceu9Mc015.jpg','1986-01-31',104,'Released','A comedy about life, hope, and getting even.','The Best of Times',30653,3.9998,5.7,'WJnsnZPTqT0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9527,_binary '\0','/Ai9jCcEzJbbaEpaMYzHdez0UPcK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090727',5.2,1787,'en','Big Trouble','Leonard Hoffman is an insurance salesman struggling to make ends meet. The fact that he has triplet sons who all want to go to Yale isn\'t making things any easier. Blanche Rickey is also worried about money; her husband is a millionaire with a weak heart, and she worries that he\'ll blow through all his cash before he finally dies. When Blanche meets Leonard, she devises a murderous plan that she claims will fix both their problems.','/1fQ9ryGMLt1fZxX45CI9xfVWPG9.jpg','1986-05-30',93,'Released','In the next 48 hours, the people below will find themselves in a big scheme, to get big money, that will land them in Big Trouble.','Big Trouble',78041,1.9431,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9528,_binary '\0','/mAxA5ltgqNXLXlm7PO5XrWSo9U1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090728',7.2,169463,'en','Big Trouble in Little China','Truck driver Jack Burton gets embroiled in a supernatural battle when his best friend Wang Chi\'s green-eyed fiancée is kidnapped by henchmen of the sorcerer Lo Pan, who must marry a girl with green eyes in order to return to the human realm.','/gI2Qs1yTTj3NcESJyttCkbmJ4k9.jpg','1986-05-30',100,'Released','Jack Burton\'s in for some serious trouble and you\'re in for some serious fun.','Big Trouble in Little China',6978,8.9798,7.2,'AXsBBqPb5YE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9529,_binary '\0','/n4dwnGHe6aOr9HKMVjInbyoCfIQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090729',5.6,3819,'en','Biggles','Unassuming catering salesmen Jim Ferguson falls through a time hole to 1917 where he saves the life of dashing Royal Flying Corps pilot James \"Biggles\" Bigglesworth after his photo recon mission is shot down. Before he can work out what has happened, Jim is zapped back to the 1980s......','/9dsO33VTBp265IQDcLG2HNFtUdO.jpg','1986-05-30',108,'Released','Fast food executive Jim Ferguson stepped out of his 47th floor office to go to the bathroom... and ended up in the middle of World War I. History will be grateful forever.','Biggles',22976,2.4868,5.253,'RKbNQOxaJZM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9530,_binary '\0','/6Kx7bxFJuEeK5tZLcSoUj5b8jhU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090735',5.5,7816,'en','Black Moon Rising','An FBI free-lancer stashes a stolen Las Vegas-crime tape in a high-tech car stolen by someone else.','/2KNhZ3D0YkBDaO82aqWN6WxVvJS.jpg','1986-01-10',100,'Released','Meet Sam Quint... Stealing from him is the biggest mistake you can make.','Black Moon Rising',36349,3.6368,5.5,'grWQ6CZqtOE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9531,_binary '\0','/xvt55bd9icHideORq3X2pVyohKn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090738',6.4,12167,'en','Black Widow','Federal agent Alexandra Barnes believes that Catherine Petersen is a serial killer who marries rich men and then murders them for their money. But since Catherine is seemingly a master of disguise and has multiple identities, Alexandra can\'t prove anything with conventional detective work. With no other option, she goes undercover, pursuing the same man as Catherine, and hoping that Catherine will slip up and reveal her true identity.','/iAlUN6XFuvSz1it58aH2cuEITrt.jpg','1987-02-06',102,'Released','She mates and she kills.','Black Widow',19345,4.7026,6.182,'sDQjTZvVXWU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9532,_binary '\0','/9VpXipoCINIxej3dpFMgUZTTA2s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090750',4.4,2098,'en','Blood Hook','During a local fishing contest, people are being mysteriously dragged into the lake and killed by a giant fish hook. After a sufficient number of deaths, the killer is finally revealed.','/9aI7QJb6rYKx1RhjMYS2pCLxghB.jpg','1987-04-01',92,'Released','Fishing was never like this!','Blood Hook',99424,1.609,4.6,'iIhl5rKXcK0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9533,_binary '\0','/kVzJWhZuYmt8aETlJreZ4F12XqE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090753',4.5,1574,'en','Blue City','Returning to the small Florida town where he grew up, Billy Turner learns that his father has been killed. With little help from the police, Billy will take matters into his own hands and go up against a ruthless local mob boss in a desperate search to find the killer.','/hvSyqFNflkAFaR28R1G8dV9lQh0.jpg','1986-05-02',83,'Released','It\'s below Miami and above the law.','Blue City',83078,2.0482,4.8,'2Ap0vTrDkpo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9534,_binary '\0','/s1CBwblInR0ZBIv59CSko2QdLD3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090756',7.7,249025,'en','Blue Velvet','The discovery of a severed human ear found in a field leads a young man on an investigation related to a beautiful, mysterious nightclub singer and a group of psychopathic criminals who have kidnapped her child.','/6v1zYh2FKOYVddY5pCQhd4PO9uX.jpg','1986-09-19',120,'Released','It\'s a strange world, isn\'t it?','Blue Velvet',793,11.7012,7.607,'k8v4-jxOm0s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9535,_binary '\0','/lWgwBbYDQsfT9clPj12I3JMk3Hw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090768',6.6,7192,'en','The Boy Who Could Fly','Milly and Louis, and their recently-widowed mom, Charlene, move to a new neighborhood. Once there, they all deal with a variety of personal problems, but Milly finds a friend in Eric, her autistic next door neighbor. Eric has a fascination with flight, and as the story progresses, he exerts an enthralling force of change on all those around him.','/gPNKA4uL39DrzngMRMx3EULPmvq.jpg','1986-08-15',114,'Released','A very special love. And a very special magic. But is it real magic or just an illusion?','The Boy Who Could Fly',24086,10.223,6.3,'ASRJd1vLFxM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9536,_binary '\0','/jyGlrPTITVJqWdk0WIvdO36LS7M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090769',5.3,1582,'en','The Boy in Blue','Ned Hanlan was Canada\'s most successful sculling champion at the turn of the 20th century. This dramatization of his life begins in his youth, when the wild young man is informally adopted by a gambler who promotes Ned on the sculling circuit, betting on the boy\'s rowing skills solely to make money off him. Later, a ruthless businessman named Knox takes over Ned\'s career, but when Ned realizes how dishonest Knox is, he finds another manager. Walter is an inventor and the first honest man Ned has dealt with in his career and, under Walter\'s guidance, Ned rises to great success in the sculling world.','/5O3ULQhgZXNxqDLfEvUmGqdQYbY.jpg','1986-01-17',100,'Released','Every era has its own kind of hero.','The Boy in Blue',83105,2.5409,5,'I1vc2MdwTj8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9537,_binary '\0','/nnbEmlo90sjQoswgQKR0xVfcjPH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090770',6.4,4131,'en','The Boys Next Door','Roy and Bo leave their small town the weekend after graduation for a short road trip to LA. Soon, they find themselves lashing out and leaving a trail of bodies behind them. The violence escalates throughout.','/zfH0EINXeLFJmwaC5YnfUIaLO4L.jpg','1986-03-14',91,'Released','The anger. The destructiveness. The urge to kill in cold blood. They weren\'t born with it...','The Boys Next Door',22323,3.2415,6.2,'KMXIUnrZ-CY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9538,_binary '\0','/6OjYBVNf4tj4EYVwniyZXGZ7fEd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090771',3.8,2945,'en','Breeders','An otherwordly perpetrator has been attacking female virgins in Manhattan. As Dr. Pace and Detective Andriotti work together to identify the strange organic materials found on the women, the victims begin arising in a trance and leaving the hospital.','/6KsmmjZYqk0t3Go93EgcqmjI06e.jpg','1986-05-02',77,'Released','Anything this hideous must be stopped from breeding.','Breeders',40078,2.5093,4.6,'cYC-qnG7Bmg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9539,_binary '\0','/2bwPiYKu1H4vTNYUxOlq5fA3Rqw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090774',6.8,4191,'en','Brighton Beach Memoirs','Eugene, a young teenage Jewish boy, recalls his memoirs of his time as an adolescent youth. He lives with his parents, his aunt, two cousins, and his brother, Stanley, whom he looks up to and admires. He goes through the hardships of puberty, sexual fantasy, and living the life of a poor boy in a crowded house.','/gbvxPS3xCvihxGNLB2xabGnsAoZ.jpg','1986-12-26',108,'Released',NULL,'Brighton Beach Memoirs',32060,1.9348,6.6,'By3sv0_4I6A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9540,_binary '\0','/3PaRgQQiCseq7p9Fyacj2QsvPyf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090775',5.5,2678,'en','The Brotherhood of Justice','High-school students start a vigilante group in their neighbourhood but, as their power increases, they become more abusive and dangerous.','/xXh7NVsOIIn5c4FE6apl5ToXgr0.jpg','1986-05-18',93,'Released','They were the best kids in the neighborhood ... until they decided it was time to fight back.','The Brotherhood of Justice',41263,3.0365,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9541,_binary '\0','/4T2UUdjznzq99T5BjM7TIOm1kyg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090788',4.8,3101,'it','Camping del terrore','A bodybuilder, a junk-food addict and a wild blonde nymph and their friends are stalked by a terrifying figure. An horrific tale of murder as a fun-loving group of college students explore the Colorado wilderness.','/4yfQEFECJrSo1Y7sXdZHdbeBDPS.jpg','1986-10-28',87,'Released','The woods are alive with the sound of screaming','Body Count',30879,1.4906,5.1,'aSMKxEpAU4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9542,_binary '\0','/6srA1KSWjnysZivKIFZmROTzZuI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090798',6.5,7914,'en','Caravaggio','A retelling of the life of the celebrated 17th-century Baroque painter Michelangelo Merisi da Caravaggio through his brilliant, nearly blasphemous paintings and his flirtations with the underworld.','/4TsayIEhoId7iahurgpKSNdSdEo.jpg','1986-08-29',93,'Released','His passion came with a price.','Caravaggio',20537,3.2281,6.13,'Su6avUbq-1E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9543,_binary '\0','/q3q84bUKgtYs4QOSZfPzSH64IKX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090799',5.6,2699,'en','Care Bears Movie II: A New Generation','True Heart Bear and Noble Heart Horse touch down on Earth to boost the spirits of some unhappy kids at summer camp. But the evil Dark Heart has other plans, and convinces one of the campers to help him capture the Care Bears.','/tFUCGJnLy1Idj8JKMQAsvZpL5a.jpg','1986-03-21',76,'Released','Come Help The Care Bears Save the Kingdom of Caring.','Care Bears Movie II: A New Generation',19975,3.2356,6.3,'0KSMd_DYDvc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9544,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090812',7.5,1905,'hi','चमेली की शादी','Charandas, a young man in a village has no aim in life except to be a pehelwaan (wrestler). He takes an oath that he will not court or marry a girl until he hits the age of forty. But things changes when Charandas meets Chameli and falls in love with her. A hilarious take on the caste system of India, as both of them come from different castes and try hard to marry each other.','/63oQbEExYTafwNqphV58b2F2cjW.jpg','1986-02-21',137,'Released',NULL,'Chameli Ki Shaadi',96159,0.9415,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9545,_binary '\0','/fiC5azwRjJmrwI59BlVpLqIegU1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090830',7.2,20233,'en','Children of a Lesser God','Starting his new job as an instructor at a New England school for the deaf, James Leeds meets Sarah Norman, a young deaf woman who works at the school as a member of the custodial staff. In spite of Sarah\'s withdrawn emotional state, a romance slowly develops between the pair.','/yAiJlASIXC306qpqe5NZX2GgVlQ.jpg','1986-09-13',119,'Released','She is the most mysterious, independent, beautiful, angry person he has ever met. He is the first man who has ever gotten close enough to love her.','Children of a Lesser God',1890,4.3035,6.919,'E0AMKG31wME','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9546,_binary '\0','/1ctiV8HodFkFOwIjQp3T2znHE19.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090837',5.6,20556,'en','Chopping Mall','High-tech robots equipped with state-of-the-art security devices have been recruited as the new mechanical \"night watchmen\" for the Park Plaza Mall. When a jolting bolt of lightning short-circuits the main computer control, the robots turn into \"killbots\" on the loose after unsuspecting shoppers!','/ggHbJPYJsjiJnEwHi4xUyJxWpmS.jpg','1986-11-14',77,'Released','Where shopping costs you an arm and a leg!','Chopping Mall',28941,3.0875,5.8,'RLMyInUPQ2g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9547,_binary '\0','/vx8lWctKheIN0KV85lHmcPTY9wo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090848',5.4,7547,'en','The Clan of the Cave Bear','Natural changes have the clans moving. Iza, medicine woman of the \"Clan of the Cave Bear\" finds little Ayla from the \"others\"\' clan - tradition would have the clan kill Ayla immediately, but Iza insists on keeping her. When the little one finds a most needed new cave, she\'s allowed to stay - and thrive.','/jbftdduVujKeoib5fwDBbEMamdj.jpg','1986-01-17',98,'Released','At The Dawn Of Mankind, A Woman Led The Way.','The Clan of the Cave Bear',13853,3.3108,5.301,'vSakccTtj5A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9548,_binary '\0','/zXGyIySqNPWSG2jrMRyD8js7wtB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090849',5.6,10657,'en','Class of Nuke \'Em High','The pupils at a high school next to a nuclear power plant start acting and looking strange after buying contaminated drugs from a plant worker.','/2AljZDgKhzFaKO6i9tgmcytEA2b.jpg','1986-12-12',86,'Released','Readin\', Writin\' and Radiation!','Class of Nuke \'Em High',26554,2.5131,5.567,'ee-SZRVtJNU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9549,_binary '\0','/4oxpF2O8Hpnfc0xfc2aUNApcDDr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090852',6.6,14801,'en','Clockwise','School headmaster Brian Stimpson is obsessed with timeliness, order, and discipline. Brian misses his train after meticulously preparing a speech for an education conference. With no one else to turn to, he asks young former student Laura Wisely for a ride. Laura, upset over a break-up, agrees to drive him in her parents\' car - which alarms her mother and father, who worry that she has run away with a married man and subsequently alert the police.','/uRetBG6n8ScyIdtkJNGngTqX75c.jpg','1986-03-01',96,'Released','Mr. Stimpson ran his life and everyone else\'s by the clock. Then one day at 2:09 and 43 seconds... The clock decided to strike back.','Clockwise',11938,3.1355,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9550,_binary '\0','/vnrtOV2PWMJOsskeWro7WQ4Pp6Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090856',5.2,7625,'en','Club Paradise','When Chicago firefighter Jack Moniker retires and moves to a small Caribbean island, he is befriended by the owner of a run-down resort. Together they renovate the resort and lure tourists to Club Paradise in an effort to fight off corrupt officials and businessmen who want to claim the resort as their own.','/y79MRJPUH5zV8doA9uunDV0G9PU.jpg','1986-07-11',96,'Released','The vacation you\'ll never forget - no matter how hard you try.','Club Paradise',26555,4.2204,5.2,'fi19QYGHd0c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9551,_binary '\0','/zPDpHMdbbE4O0TxVkMcgD6j2ImR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090859',5.8,86855,'en','Cobra','A tough-on-crime street cop must protect the only surviving witness to a strange murderous cult with far reaching plans.','/rCN9c1NfxjfgMkTPFATOzUkNEyg.jpg','1986-05-22',87,'Released','Crime is a disease. Meet the cure.','Cobra',9874,7.6697,6.2,'QoGoSu4NEyo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9552,_binary '\0','/hhCp6ZLDjS5wUHkGg7k3VGvH3Xm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090863',7,102699,'en','The Color of Money','Former pool hustler \"Fast Eddie\" Felson decides he wants to return to the game by taking a pupil. He meets talented but green Vincent Lauria and proposes a partnership. As they tour pool halls, Eddie teaches Vincent the tricks of scamming, but he eventually grows frustrated with Vincent\'s showboat antics, leading to an argument and a falling-out. Eddie takes up playing again and soon crosses paths with Vincent as an opponent.','/dVdnHmdQu3JtLAAksjTmTEF76gD.jpg','1986-10-17',119,'Released','The Hustler isn\'t what he used to be. But he has the next best thing. A kid who is.','The Color of Money',11873,7.8983,6.9,'HgLvznCiNUo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9553,_binary '\0','/wHGDKTTkIncDRPNNr1FHeohH3oy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090865',5.3,1312,'en','Combat Academy','\"Police Academy\"-style comedy set in a military school. Two errant high-school students are ordered by a judge to spend a year at a prestigious military academy, where one of the cadets finds out who is responsible for a spate of midnight thefts.','/lKa3OuZrYGPNpEsfYDFavlAqaWI.jpg','1986-11-23',96,'Released',NULL,'Combat Academy',50524,1.7701,5.4,'bmaCvI4C2ag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9554,_binary '\0','/fdpC19z0yrBK4zwTxzZrmCjlvhb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090866',6.2,3747,'en','Combat Shock','A dangerously disturbed Vietnam veteran struggles with life 15 years after his return home, and slowly falls into insanity from his gritty urban lifestyle.','/oCGUSrJVVjFPwkxcdVnOa7880S.jpg','1986-05-01',97,'Released','Fighting, killing, maiming. Agent Orange and the torture cages were the easy part!','Combat Shock',26558,1.9675,6.4,'aLZQJh3MUYk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9555,_binary '\0','/bk2zPmljHwxucjtuVF0b39hJExB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090881',5.4,4517,'en','Crawlspace','A man who runs an apartment house for women is the demented son of a Nazi surgeon who has the house equipped with secret passageways, hidden rooms and torture and murder devices.','/hzrHUY2aksJcLGchBkLg6fTFgI8.jpg','1986-05-21',80,'Released','Someone is watching ...','Crawlspace',56705,2.1179,5.391,'S88zrSWCZX8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9556,_binary '\0','/n7mI520idCPHVsqTljNDNtNiCL9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090886',6.3,5050,'en','Crimes of the Heart','Three sisters try to come to grips with the meaning of their mother\'s suicide.','/lg8npIjYrO0f4UsuNwWwd1TQhW6.jpg','1986-12-12',105,'Released','Meg just left one. Lenny never had one. Babe just shot one. The MaGrath sisters sure have a way with men.','Crimes of the Heart',48259,2.9964,6.1,'QjcTQ2d5yqo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9557,_binary '\0','/omoQkyiQ94FfyR4gUmA66VXQyZ9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090887',6.1,41932,'en','Critters','Carnivorous aliens arrive unannounced at a Kansas family farm; two intergalactic bounty hunters soon follow, determined to blow them off the planet.','/dxBy4WePZY06Bk5KvXb4K3UnjCy.jpg','1986-04-11',86,'Released','The battle began in another galaxy. It\'s about to end in the Brown\'s backyard.','Critters',3980,5.3388,6.488,'CRGyKnW3zW4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9558,_binary '\0','/k8TtcMVQFBfEEiVNYMBB5v1Ez7v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090888',7.1,19670,'en','Crossroads','A wanna-be blues guitar virtuoso seeks a long-lost song by legendary musician, Robert Johnson.','/2sMo7gwZ8L7KttiW210T0ueJ2eX.jpg','1986-03-14',99,'Released','Where second best never gets a second chance.','Crossroads',15392,5.3271,7.4,'ntrCbhQw8yg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9559,_binary '\0','/5qg946XqE9Lo4rGVwC4tAq0OEum.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090903',5.3,2286,'it','Il miele del diavolo','A young woman abducts a doctor whom she holds responsible for the death of her boyfriend and subjects him to various sexual torture acts.','/nojczE1ZYuwQAAmLHoM7nHqzVhp.jpg','1986-08-21',83,'Released','Having a lover is dangerous, but losing a lover is deadly.','The Devil\'s Honey',30872,3.1234,5.45,'FboVLUe1sqk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9560,_binary '\0','/qjWx2S3XrVxYkYUe940DNDe1NKZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090904',5.5,1760,'en','Dangerously Close','Rebel without a cause or a clue at an elite but uptight college discovers some of his classmates have formed an even more elite clique more or less hell-bent on ridding the school, and quite possibly American society, of what they deem to be its undesirables because of ethnicity, politics, etc. Our hero recruits a teacher and some other \"less desirable\" classmates to undermine the elitists, and, naturally, things get quite violent.','/84iACBvqazsjMvJ2cz40mJF1boo.jpg','1986-05-09',95,'Released',NULL,'Dangerously Close',71841,2.179,4.84,'sgYptS-vI3U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9561,_binary '\0','/3SrVa2yrtj7SeK794vLDl5CI8CZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090907',6.8,1758,'bo','盗马贼','Devout Buddhists, Norbu and Dolma live with their young son Tashi in a clan in Tibet. Norbu is a highwayman. After Norbu is charged with stealing from the temple, he and his family are banished. Impoverished and marginalized, they can do little when their beloved son becomes ill. Tashi dies of a fever. After a second son is born, Norbu focuses his every action on keeping this child alive, seeking re-admission to the clan for his wife and child, then risking all to save them from isolation and starvation in winter.','/s4hIycQ1SAQQEB14R6V9BsKdWMP.jpg','1986-01-01',88,'Released',NULL,'The Horse Thief',42018,1.0551,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9562,_binary '\0','/fGjGVeP7EvM81nS0Rzm79PG0CT4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090914',6.3,2626,'en','Dead Man\'s Folly','During a murder hunt game at a country house, to which Hercule Poirot is invited as an \"expert\", a real murder occurs.','/n9qvcggDgYq8paZzHfpfih03VKZ.jpg','1986-01-08',90,'Released',NULL,'Dead Man\'s Folly',6105,3.3073,6.4,'mkvjY4XvWCU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9563,_binary '\0','/mq3qzXHhiCCqHZLjiY9XIRVzVIr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090915',5.9,4494,'en','Dead End Drive-In','In the future, a health nut and his tag-along girlfriend become trapped in a drive-in theater that has become a concentration camp for outcast youths.','/z5EEuLaHD8uHBaRmoKVVSp5JE33.jpg','1986-08-13',87,'Released','There\'s a party every day, a movie every night, and all the junk food you can eat. What more can a kid want... except to get out.','Dead End Drive-In',47340,2.5448,5.62,'axkkfkf80Kc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9564,_binary '\0','/AlCqrEHsJ1c3kYITJPu6VYwNKgp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090917',5.6,9996,'en','Deadly Friend','When tragedy strikes his remarkable robot and the beautiful girl next door, lonely teenage genius Paul tries to save them by pushing technology beyond its known limits into a terrifying new realm.','/24X1pdzeU9x2QCVDu957tpUA0kp.jpg','1986-10-10',91,'Released','There\'s no one alive who\'ll play with the girl next door.','Deadly Friend',33278,3.6473,6.2,'EUww3bkN3lY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9565,_binary '\0','/vo7lHgGCMm8mvZfjXZfDlPvYxY2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090927',5.7,24720,'en','The Delta Force','A 707 aircraft jetliner, en route from Athens to Rome and then to New York City, is hijacked by Lebanese terrorists, who demand that the pilot take them to Beirut. What the terrorists don\'t realize is that an elite team of commandos have been called in to eliminate all terrorists on the jetliner.','/jBx4an9yU7FFbXv4tWc1HRJomGJ.jpg','1986-02-14',129,'Released','They don\'t negotiate with terrorists... they blow them away!','The Delta Force',16113,8.5315,5.986,'eEqj2cBYUAo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9566,_binary '\0','/fZysWhyBOXND2oO5FdDuLBVjwpB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090930',5.9,13515,'it','Dèmoni 2… L\'incubo ritorna','A group of tenants and visitors are trapped in a 10-story high-rise apartment building infested with demons who proceed to hunt the dwindling humans down.','/gAJGt3E6hoL9wRJodpoAKFaXHXd.jpg','1986-10-09',91,'Released','The Nightmare Returns.','Demons 2',40342,3.8539,6.1,'yiDmpU79kUc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9567,_binary '\0','/vL7PMp7lHLH4Qnm80q41lVXAqNV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090944',5.6,2256,'it','Diavolo in corpo','An Italian high school student becomes infatuated with a woman he sees outside his class window. Her fiancée is in jail for being involved in a radical movement, and she spends much time in court providing moral support. At first she resists the student\'s advances, but eventually begins an affair with him. Their situation is condemned by her family and his father, who is the woman\'s psychologist.','/3TqW1QCHjZVBXSrZ0wLhuXLvPN7.jpg','1986-04-22',114,'Released',NULL,'Devil in the Flesh',35705,3.4115,5.637,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9568,_binary '\0','/ivwWWvosh7KMePR5XxF2YmWYezV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090948',5.3,1684,'en','The Dirt Bike Kid','When his mother sends Jack off with money to buy groceries, he comes home with a magic supercharged dirt bike instead. His mother is furious, but when Jack uses the magic bike to save the local hot dog stand from the clutches of corrupt big business, he becomes the town hero.','/eJ6ciRPyZrAMjlEoJDbSZjw5uxB.jpg','1985-11-24',91,'Released','When the going gets tough... the tough go flying!','The Dirt Bike Kid',33321,2.5942,6.1,'rEzz-dI95oA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9569,_binary '\0','/kUUPHesQLQePqobQNjW7UD6WOdA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090952',7.3,3370,'cn','刀馬旦','In 1913 Beijing, three fierce women—disguised rebel Tsao Wan, jewel-seeking Sheung Hung, and opera heiress Pai Niu—embark on a daring quest filled with intrigue and betrayal, challenging societal norms amidst political turmoil and the vibrant world of Peking Opera.','/6IcSrruE0hpBvqo40DRfX65nBRX.jpg','1986-09-06',105,'Released',NULL,'Peking Opera Blues',39776,2.7506,7.239,'7BeNzmpB0ZM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9570,_binary '\0','/qwYf2MbQN2F13BxYNAPjYoUw1qV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090956',7.1,3707,'cn','東方秃鷹','A motley group of Chinese prisoners held in the US is sent on a covert mission with the promise of a pardon: to go deep into Vietnam and destroy a secret depot of missiles that the US left behind during the pull-out.','/vp1qOZJThAGHfrB4uOlmg0JsPvO.jpg','1987-07-09',97,'Released','A lethal secret arsenal was left behind in the jungle of Vietnam. Their job: find it and destroy it!','Eastern Condors',68942,3.298,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9571,_binary '\0','/g6VLgLRtdY334NO0VWlIo1Wckw8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090966',6.3,20175,'en','Down and Out in Beverly Hills','Beverly Hills couple Barbara and Dave Whiteman find their lives altered by the arrival of a vagrant who tries to drown himself in their swimming pool.','/5bfbUsKcJD4HHFmlTcpHBI2wR2k.jpg','1986-01-31',103,'Released','See what happens when a dirty bum meets the filthy rich.','Down and Out in Beverly Hills',9941,4.8368,5.9,'q3OHpuHpl9c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9572,_binary '\0','/8kVPLOzuZ1G9EBYxcOrzaHbxCeC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090967',7.6,59222,'en','Down by Law','A disc jockey, a pimp and an Italian tourist escape from jail in New Orleans.','/4IyxoUQ7BB5kcSd7gASe2dTyWu7.jpg','1986-09-20',106,'Released','It\'s not where you start - It\'s where you start again.','Down by Law',1554,3.5621,7.4,'7OHg4Ayewao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9573,_binary '\0','/XXgiRzaHCgRTFPSPVTVPmDMWys.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090982',7.9,4653,'tr','Duvar','Produced, written and directed by Yılmaz Güney within his own personal experiences of capital offense, he dedicates Duvar to male teenagers aged 13 to 19 living behind the bars under diabolical treatments. These teenagers get barbaric corporal punishments, injurious harrows, tortures and sexual abuses just for taking the responsibility of their destiny on a wrong turn.','/5jIMiyyPJkNvoT9sO7YuY8GRnqd.jpg','1983-02-01',117,'Released',NULL,'The Wall',47680,1.4968,7.2,'-wJjrBAef7Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9574,_binary '\0','/yItBvynVmSCTvAkzAm5PllP4oth.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0090985',7.1,9206,'fr','Le Déclin de l\'empire américain','Four very different Montreal university teachers gather at a rambling country house to prepare a dinner. Remy (married), Claude (a homosexual), Pierre (involved with a girlfriend) and Alain (a bachelor) discuss sex, the female body and their affairs with them. Meanwhile, their four female guests, Louise (Remy\'s wife of 15 years), Dominique (a spinster), Diane (a divorcée) and Danielle (Pierre\'s girlfriend) are spending the time at a downtown health gym. They also discuss sex, the female body and, naturally, men. Later in the evening, they finally meet at the country house and have dinner. A ninth guest, named Mario, who used to know Diane, drops in on the group for some talk and has a surprise of his own.','/j5Bi5lr7Z2tr9fEJI0YuS0AS2iG.jpg','1986-06-19',101,'Released','A spontaneously funny sex comedy!','The Decline of the American Empire',18499,2.4046,6.7,'a7R4YFi_qhA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9575,_binary '\0','/b3fbZnhAmLEe3KhbHbPQyxhiIsl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091002',4.5,1340,'it','Undici giorni, undici notti','In eleven days time, Michael is due to wed his fiancée Helen. However, a chance meeting with Sarah, a total stranger, threatens to destroy all his plans as he is seduced on the spot and finds himself unable to resist her.','/gXmH0Fk9VLx9gjGaRxAKsRnh1mr.jpg','1987-03-27',101,'Released',NULL,'Eleven Days, Eleven Nights',125157,5.1057,5.1,'H4TSNNItulg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9576,_binary '\0','/ylU0kZPqDlPyaKkZ9TI7tvvGvAC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091003',4.9,2761,'en','Eliminators','A former pilot rebels against his creator, teaming up with the scientist responsible for android technology, her pet robot Spot, a rough-and-tumble riverboat guide, and a martial arts warrior.','/9RBzZcSKmBhVbJWtLwELyvU7V4G.jpg','1986-01-31',96,'Released','Mandroid. Mercenary. Scientist. Ninja. Each one a specialist. Together they are ELIMINATORS!','Eliminators',47822,2.1079,4.9,'uuX8lPofuME','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9577,_binary '\0','/cb1ltycrzQZyqDBYVXcAIRvvGkx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091019',5.8,2963,'en','Every Time We Say Goodbye','A Protestant World War II pilot and a Jewish girl fall in love in Jerusalem, even though their diverse backgrounds threaten to pull them apart.','/fMiWlS4jNZysUquP6CZfKswukMo.jpg','1986-11-14',95,'Released','In a time and a world of impossible love, he would accept nothing less than everything.','Every Time We Say Goodbye',35866,2.732,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9578,_binary '\0','/ugW4dl7kOXU1YP0FXkSWU7hKwAf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091024',6.3,5001,'en','Extremities','A woman escapes from the man who is about to rape her, but leaves her purse behind. Afraid that her attacker might come after her, she goes to the police, but with no proof of the incident, they can do nothing. In fact, the man does use the information in her bag and comes to her apartment with the intent of rape, but she sprays him in the face with insect repellent, and then holds him captive. She is then faced with deciding whether to go to the police who might not believe her and release him, or to kill him.','/AnzuqWIL840oE2vgtW81q1p1CAL.jpg','1986-08-22',89,'Released','When fear made her a victim, she turned fear into a weapon.','Extremities',44326,3.0528,6.2,'a1qutuhHjpY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9579,_binary '\0','/qvXcOmTQI7Ijh0J58juNZ4xzFLr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091027',5.7,3050,'en','Eye of the Tiger','Buck is a Vietnam vet, recently released from prison. He returns home to discover the town being terrorized by a vicious motorcycle gang. When the bikers murder his wife and traumatize his daughter, Buck and his friends arm themselves to the teeth and wage war against the gang to destroy them once and for all.','/9Gu1ihgAeO7MBbXe7nUKV7LyQpy.jpg','1986-07-07',92,'Released','\'Nam was hell... Prison unbearable... But coming home meant murder.','Eye of the Tiger',27271,2.8855,6.1,'M5DO3ODHc6I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9580,_binary '\0','/jehzP4JKiFzgTWIaASLFOJocJke.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091042',7.8,420605,'en','Ferris Bueller\'s Day Off','After high school slacker Ferris Bueller successfully fakes an illness in order to skip school for the day, he goes on a series of adventures throughout Chicago with his girlfriend Sloane and best friend Cameron, all the while trying to outwit his wily school principal and fed-up sister.','/9LTQNCvoLsKXP0LtaKAaYVtRaQL.jpg','1986-06-11',103,'Released','Leisure rules.','Ferris Bueller\'s Day Off',9377,11.3663,7.559,'0ZDbKhkLxTs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9581,_binary '\0','/sbf2v2wvLYqoPq7uFDepr4Hjx4n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091051',4.8,1859,'en','A Fine Mess','Two friends discover a plot to fix a horse race and try to capitalize on it, but soon have to deal with the two men who fixed it, the police investigating it, and the mob boss whose amorous wife is mixed up in it.','/cjIPWHHX92WrnmCVh05rlkdmnOD.jpg','1986-08-08',90,'Released','A Hilarious New Comedy','A Fine Mess',48609,1.9608,4.6,'KPe_V__TEbE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9582,_binary '\0','/x2l5pGtlYQoFNip1LIdIE0qzAq9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091053',6.4,2118,'en','Fire with Fire','A tough, street-smart kid serving a sentence in a state youth reformatory meets a beautiful, innocent girl studying at a nearby convent. When forbidden love blossoms between them, they must fight the prison authorities, their parents and the law.','/1lCi4gHuQmnqn5laJFYZZfaEW9F.jpg','1986-05-09',103,'Released','Two lovers. One chance. No time.','Fire with Fire',85654,3.2402,6.2,'OABhXafL9jw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9583,_binary '\0','/s2479rHYhMekJWDHJxXQXgdFkl6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091055',5.2,9096,'en','Firewalker','A pair of adventurers try to track down an ancient Aztec/Mayan/Egyptian/Apache horde of gold.','/qFUBCOH0HxI9qRcjoG9xChfwEsk.jpg','1986-11-21',104,'Released','A pair of down-and-out fortune hunters cash in on high adventure!','Firewalker',12715,4.2184,5.335,'7MMshCVkS2E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9584,_binary '\0','/i4f3rnvwY70SMsajTt3LIlmYdBf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091059',6.9,55993,'en','Flight of the Navigator','12-year-old David is accidentally knocked out in the forest near his home, but when he awakens eight years have passed. His family is overjoyed to have him back, but is just as perplexed as he is that he hasn\'t aged. When a NASA scientist discovers a UFO nearby, David gets the chance to unravel the mystery and recover the life he lost.','/tdRgQWMximj0tL6OWu9kRTtePmI.jpg','1986-07-30',90,'Released','David Freeman is eight years late for dinner, and his family wants to know why. But David\'s got an absolutely fantastic excuse.','Flight of the Navigator',10122,6.5079,6.973,'XnB7rIL2fy8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9585,_binary '\0','/wsY9QOF5OeFS2mTJwjTiFrsmWPM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091060',6.7,8505,'nl','Flodder','A low-class antisocial family ends up in a rich upper-class neighborhood and causes all sorts of trouble.','/rbQX4kpoyj3Xj3Km4fPmWO7edst.jpg','1986-12-18',111,'Released','A Family Movie','Flodder',10570,1.6143,6.363,'mLtBV6lkBt4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9586,_binary '\0','/g1FzhbtWYKk9WMJYi1X26kf2Q4Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091064',7.6,227373,'en','The Fly','When brilliant, eccentric scientist Seth Brundle makes a huge technological breakthrough in teleportation, he decides to test it on himself. Unbeknownst to him, a common housefly manages to get inside the device and the two become one.','/8gZWMhJHRvaXdXsNhERtqNHYpH3.jpg','1986-08-15',96,'Released','Be afraid. Be very afraid.','The Fly',9426,33.9153,7.4,'YPhM5T1DViw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9587,_binary '\0','/zxm3D5vISbBo8FOQQom2bDFbmmy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091069',7,3826,'en','Fortress','After being kidnapped by four masked men, a teacher and her students rebel by plotting against the criminals.','/hSWb2jtn1kP36007A5xBQczViq1.jpg','1985-11-24',88,'Released','For one teacher and nine children, the lesson of the day is kill or be killed.','Fortress',37929,2.7009,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9588,_binary '\0','/93tvkTtV6tQQiYhxhij9tuODNOq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091080',6,58290,'en','Jason Lives - Friday the 13th Part VI','Tommy Jarvis, tormented by the fear that maybe Jason isn\'t really dead, unwittingly resurrects the mass murderer for another bloody rampage.','/6vdUpHvkspQonXBdWcLWW5ciEPJ.jpg','1986-08-01',86,'Released','Kill or be killed.','Jason Lives - Friday the 13th Part VI',10225,10.3997,6.286,'4ETsQHtUqcs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9589,_binary '\0','/sKcdPHvsGCNdDOD7LJdOibZuvUQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091083',6.6,36382,'en','From Beyond','The Resonator, a powerful machine that can control the sixth sense, has killed its creator and sent his associate into an insane asylum. When a psychiatrist becomes determined to continue the experiment, she unwittingly opens the door to a hostile parallel universe.','/zwmyxaKzIRLD4iUqZAQW940omdm.jpg','1986-10-24',85,'Released','Humans are such easy prey.','From Beyond',14510,6.1033,6.5,'1g6zAkYiCOU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9590,_binary '\0','/9zXa3edRy3YyiKpWvUvvHmdW7NU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091091',6.9,2601,'cn','富貴列車','What happens when a glamorous express, with high government officials, wealthy merchants, concubines and a gang of brigands on board, speeds towards the small town of Hanshui, where escaping bank robbers, corrupt officials, and gamblers await? Well, let\'s just say the Titanic had a smoother maiden voyage.','/aRO3NFtjIu1g8YWbnqpI95Yy0mC.jpg','1986-01-30',108,'Released','All aboard for non-stop action on the wildest ride of your life!','Millionaires\' Express',59843,4.0894,6.742,'LISgv3LcenQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9591,_binary '\0','/cbz3HdoFVFmd49CVpWG2OzuT4dT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091093',7,9028,'fr','Les Fugitifs','Coming out from jail, Lucas has decided to change his life and behave like a good citizen. But when he is taken hostage in a bank by a hare-brained robber, no cops can believe he is not part of the action.','/dmrVlsTFOW6RRUpEANVpiOytHFK.jpg','1986-12-17',85,'Released',NULL,'The Fugitives',30163,3.0095,6.79,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9592,_binary '\0','/bFqNe01gV4cod4cbIWNUsDVpXvd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091096',6.9,1256,'pl','Ga, Ga. Chwała bohaterom','Scope is a prisoner on a behemoth space station and is chosen, like all his fellow prisoners, to \'volunteer\' for the exploration of far-away planets. Landing on planet Australia 458, he is given a hero\'s welcome with all the sex, booze, and violence that any one man can stomach. But as his new caretakers push him towards even more heinous and deplorable acts, Scope finds that his freedom comes with a high price; his own violent demise, broadcast live for the viewing pleasure of Australia 458\'s inhabitants.','/ngCuPQv3tAPwzQQ40BxpEossdQZ.jpg','1986-09-26',81,'Released','Hard to be a Hero','Ga-ga: Glory to the Heroes',91691,1.7802,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9593,_binary '\0','/sB8CoY9aVRyMOb4KTMRKhDTXr5H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091106',6,1310,'en','The George McKenna Story','Washington plays a school principal in a tough inner city Los Angeles high school out to rid it of drugs, gangs, low moral of teachers, and restore educational values. Based on a true story.','/3giHNZZ347b7vsCEEzddJPAWS5O.jpg','1988-08-01',100,'Released',NULL,'The George McKenna Story',41869,2.6308,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9594,_binary '\0','/7YjjphrUKt9tdtVEcm5mJQZ4DYX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091113',7.2,5956,'it','Ginger e Fred','Amelia and Pippo are reunited after several decades to perform their old music-hall act, imitating Fred Astaire and Ginger Rogers, on a TV variety show.','/nuhHvDVQLIDzpLpomBHilS1hliL.jpg','1986-01-22',125,'Released','The movie that looks at television through the eyes of Fellini.','Ginger and Fred',42021,2.3527,6.858,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9595,_binary '\0','/wCT10p7jpFF6V0RBt1Fsl5NEqA6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091129',6,64072,'en','The Golden Child','After a Tibetan boy, the mystical Golden Child, is kidnapped by the evil Sardo Numspa, humankind\'s fate hangs in the balance. On the other side of the world in Los Angeles, the priestess Kee Nang seeks the Chosen One, who will save the boy from death. When Nang sees social worker Chandler Jarrell on television discussing his ability to find missing children, she solicits his expertise, despite his skepticism over being \"chosen.\"','/9gPphtcGmna90U9CEsWlUVaSkAw.jpg','1986-12-12',94,'Released','Eddie Murphy is the chosen one.','The Golden Child',10136,7.6104,5.936,'S7d9PyMIFFY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9596,_binary '\0','/itG5rMUHXC1GZzXEjVS5XpTI1iH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091142',5.7,10114,'en','Gothic','Living on an estate on the shores of Lake Geneva, Lord Byron is visited by Percy and Mary Shelley. Together with Byron\'s lover Claire Clairmont, and aided by hallucinogenic substances, they devise an evening of ghoulish tales. However, when confronted by horrors, ostensibly of their own creation, it becomes difficult to tell apparition from reality.','/xGXj6wpJimmWkQMahZryM7xB9EX.jpg','1987-02-27',88,'Released','Conjure up your deepest, darkest fear... now call that fear to life.','Gothic',33516,2.1631,5.7,'93SrqYZT4yM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9597,_binary '\0','/dgg7NFl5wgmiNeNaF6cqV4ok0kQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091148',5.6,1961,'it','Grandi magazzini','A series of skits involving customers and store personnel from several departments of the big department store.','/aNGOictqiSNtnXufFARxydvXGtC.jpg','1986-06-06',110,'Released',NULL,'Department Store',38262,1.4636,5.838,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9598,_binary '\0','/ijCfzdRLhrdu9OUIaPsVt08ogT5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091149',7.1,59685,'en','The Great Mouse Detective','When the diabolical Professor Ratigan kidnaps London\'s master toymaker, the brilliant master of disguise Basil of Baker Street and his trusted sidekick Dawson try to elude the ultimate trap and foil the perfect crime.','/9uDr7vfjCFr39KGCcqrk44Cg7fQ.jpg','1986-07-02',74,'Released','London\'s crime-fighting ace on his most baffling case!','The Great Mouse Detective',9994,12.278,7.047,'J9u_0d8k2_c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9599,_binary '\0','/aUrWcND2fLLbgtKDpi5c0HbtBvR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091159',6.3,15168,'en','Gung Ho','When a western Pennsylvania auto plant is acquired by a Japanese company, brokering auto worker Hunt Stevenson faces the tricky challenge of mediating the assimilation of two clashing corporate cultures. At one end is the Japanese plant manager and the sycophant who is angling for his position. At the other, a number of disgruntled long-time union members struggle with the new exigencies of Japanese quality control.','/sxnlQEb8dugTFK2KyFrq3iv3bHn.jpg','1986-03-14',111,'Released','When East meets West, the laughs shift into high gear!','Gung Ho',13698,4.3073,6.095,'9Ty5vIzKFKU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9600,_binary '\0','/1nq7Zp0onGrtlOEzH7n0IrYRcAu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091164',5.4,3020,'en','Half Moon Street','Dr. Lauren Slaughter, a research fellow at the Arab-Anglo Institute in London is utterly frustrated by her job. To supplement her income, she starts moonlighting at the Jasmine Escort Service, where she has more control over men and money than she does at the office. On one of her \'dates\', Lauren meets the politician Lord Bulbeck who is trying to mediate a peace accord between the Arabs and Israelis. Bulbeck falls in love with his escort, and unwittingly, Lauren becomes a pawn in some very dirty politics.','/sMTmNED6YowXId1WX7ffoKTlSaz.jpg','1986-08-13',90,'Released','Dr. Lauren Slaughter, professor, emissary, hooker, target.','Half Moon Street',36372,2.2636,5,'g6I2Ne6h9PY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9601,_binary '\0','/VTyHlDfQ25yaZGHREeco7jjCBd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091165',4.8,2156,'en','Hamburger: The Motion Picture','Russell has been expelled from several schools for lewd, crude and nude conduct. Busterburger University is his last chance at education and satisfying his disappointed parents.','/phvXzZDieOOp0eOXBdHBIfqLb8v.jpg','1986-01-31',91,'Released','...it\'s funny enough to eat!','Hamburger: The Motion Picture',52117,2.0665,4.5,'JUpWMN9Rm5Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9602,_binary '\0','/9iyWrtZounrqjKDRCHRKpcpCXHi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091166',5.3,3312,'it','Vendetta dal futuro','A story about a cyborg who is programmed to kill a scientist who holds the fate of mankind in his hands.','/6A5L3i0HAqZUnXtJ5nJEUYWJsmm.jpg','1986-03-26',94,'Released','30% human, 70% robot, 100% lethal.','Hands of Steel',67221,2.3054,5.2,'up0Dkn2sFCE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9603,_binary '\0','/jx6jUMCLhRWB05ngVjaGxPpLq5x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091167',7.8,82193,'en','Hannah and Her Sisters','Between two Thanksgivings, Hannah\'s husband falls in love with her sister Lee, while her hypochondriac ex-husband rekindles his relationship with her sister Holly.','/gARgIRb2QFRFVrsziwWE389u1pK.jpg','1986-02-07',107,'Released','A story between two Thanksgivings.','Hannah and Her Sisters',5143,6.2277,7.456,'8YPsjtK60ds','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9604,_binary '\0','/lOSqRvsvVTvvXn7mmxWmSKj5ESg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091173',3.4,1458,'en','Hardbodies 2','A film crew is travelling from America to Greece to produce a movie. Before their work is done they will have to face many unusual situations, along with numerous opportunities for the actresses to take their clothes off.','/7rBv4zSyuXYflczYMUkKZsryEMK.jpg','1986-09-12',88,'Released','It\'s sun, sand, and sex in the Greek Islands.','Hardbodies 2',61117,2.0379,3.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9605,_binary '\0','/3oQbVh2x1V4T2KoMvexykxHKixR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091178',5.7,8881,'en','Haunted Honeymoon','Radio personalities Larry Abbot and Vickie Pearle are stars of a mystery show. Since they announced their engagement, Larry has been plagued by speech problems and, seeking out an unconventional cure, he returns to his boyhood home, a mansion in the countryside, bringing Vickie along. Larry reunites with numerous family members, but discovers that there are sinister things afoot within the walls of the creepy estate.','/jBCucUiw7Incipok1xvUa9AVhW.jpg','1986-07-25',82,'Released','…A Comedy Chiller','Haunted Honeymoon',24103,2.9382,5.4,'gaXuVjBr5cw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9606,_binary '\0','/wEE1qHpHUvdmJ04hyVPtuMB8ec7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091183',5.4,1946,'en','Head Office','In this comic take on big-business wheelings and dealings, an ambitious senator\'s son moves up the corporate ladder through undeserved promotions. But against his better judgment, he falls for a woman (the chairman\'s daughter, no less) who\'s leading a protest against the company\'s shady business practices.','/u7MSmYbkLvkt2jdTAsb10N82kwZ.jpg','1985-06-06',90,'Released','An Outrageous Comedy About Making It Big In Big Business','Head Office',41625,2.2932,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9607,_binary '\0','/ydF3hT1fjrM71AbNAYBZKnq6rtL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091187',6.8,52967,'en','Heartbreak Ridge','A hard-nosed, hard-living Marine gunnery sergeant clashes with his superiors and his ex-wife as he takes command of a spoiled recon platoon with a bad attitude.','/aMr99UigkMCTSPnLTpkzJeLmpyc.jpg','1986-12-05',130,'Released','...the scars run deep.','Heartbreak Ridge',10015,7.1715,6.907,'AzmKOwtSCkg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9608,_binary '\0','/f43mO9U6ohYQT8UYsaLUwQ2PT6i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091188',6.1,14290,'en','Heartburn','She\'s a magazine writer who gives up her career for love and family. He\'s a playboy newspaper columnist who can\'t quite give up his old tricks. And if that combination doesn\'t give a relationship heartburn, nothing will.','/pF1uPAi9TWRSRLf9SHfIDQle2NK.jpg','1986-07-25',108,'Released','Sex. Love. Marriage. Some people don\'t know when to quit.','Heartburn',13818,4.2033,6.002,'k79DDjvl9vE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9609,_binary '\0','/gQl5nm1YHeTJoRfxFY8ytma8DUP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091192',5.2,1835,'en','Hell High','A teacher still haunted by the death of two teens that she accidentally caused as a young girl goes berserk when four teens start harassing her and then attack her in her home.','/ajQi43EMdGnzt2HJLo1ZCo6vb6r.jpg','1989-05-12',84,'Released','The teachers are tough... but their exams are murder.','Hell High',78253,1.8866,4.9,'YuJ7Bj9uStc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9610,_binary '\0','/2EfbAWLq8s2f1LxTAIuLGYpKETV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091203',7,160845,'en','Highlander','He fought his first battle on the Scottish Highlands in 1536. He will fight his greatest battle on the streets of New York City in 1986. His name is Connor MacLeod. He is immortal.','/8Z8dptJEypuLoOQro1WugD855YE.jpg','1986-03-07',116,'Released','There can be only one.','Highlander',8009,12.371,6.86,'koTNFnABag0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9611,_binary '\0','/frs1y0gf2En7REwpCcOeU9WbNMK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091209',7.2,59926,'en','The Hitcher','On a stormy night, young Jim, who transports a luxury car from Chicago to California to deliver it to its owner, feeling tired and sleepy, picks up a mysterious hitchhiker, who has appeared out of nowhere, thinking that a good conversation will help him not to fall asleep. He will have enough time to deeply regret such an unmeditated decision.','/89giuiFssSVCUxkCP386v66cry8.jpg','1986-01-17',98,'Released','The terror starts the moment he stops.','The Hitcher',9542,9.0533,6.95,'dTs-9jKh5_U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9612,_binary '\0','/yhquZtwnsCZdXHxiaMuzVqFW8qC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091214',7.6,5061,'es','Hombre mirando al sudeste','A new patient mysteriously appears in a psychiatric ward. He claims to come from another planet to study humans and their behavior. The alien is gentle but criticizes humans for their harsh treatment of each other. The assigned psychiatrist is himself unhappy, and affected by the patient\'s insight. But he is ordered to treat the patient according to institutional procedure.','/yyqsxtP0GeO77kz4FZQOExGtUpz.jpg','1987-04-02',109,'Released','Somewhere Between The Insane And The Unreal Lies The Mystery Of The Man Facing Southeast.','Man Facing Southeast',48797,1.8708,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9613,_binary '\0','/sz31PrTT4ZyJn2gbzHdxTilt1md.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091217',7.4,57784,'en','Hoosiers','Failed college coach Norman Dale gets a chance at redemption when he is hired to coach a high school basketball team in a tiny Indiana town. After a teacher persuades star player Jimmy Chitwood to quit and focus on his long-neglected studies, Dale struggles to develop a winning team in the face of community criticism for his temper and his unconventional choice of assistant coach: Shooter, a notorious alcoholic.','/dHpjZQXEdoi1xNLubM1rPmTHJYz.jpg','1986-11-14',114,'Released','They needed a second chance to finish first.','Hoosiers',5693,4.2941,7,'12h5KGHU8Mg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9614,_binary '\0','/6NuoAB5atGEhvhyNPm3bwQwlyjF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091223',6.1,33229,'en','House','A divorced horror novelist coming to terms with the disappearance of his young son inherits an old mansion home to malevolent supernatural residents.','/jhfbMS620H29FK0miTk8TCgMK9w.jpg','1985-12-06',92,'Released','Horror has found a new home.','House',11415,4.3238,6.2,'9TSRT-cl-y8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9615,_binary '\0','/3KQe8Vzma7ZAYE25mJjgIG4Gj5e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091225',4.8,55316,'en','Howard the Duck','A scientific experiment unknowingly brings extraterrestrial life forms to the Earth through a laser beam. First is the cigar-smoking drake, Howard, from the duck\'s planet. A few kids try to keep him from the greedy scientists and help him back to his planet, but then a much less friendly being arrives through the beam...','/30tnH0hy6S5FjGCfCdnkBd3wqS2.jpg','1986-08-01',110,'Released','More adventure than humanly possible.','Howard the Duck',10658,6.9587,5.461,'yeU4UlDWfKI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9616,_binary '\0','/4yVePhsYuGbd1qBjLR27Kyclobb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091229',7,2647,'cn','皇家戰士','When a tough policewoman learns about a group of violent terrorists, she, along with her partner and a Japanese detective, does everything it takes to take them down.','/79QtxrBbDG2FbvgJSxWQpYCKJbM.jpg','1986-06-26',96,'Released','She\'s the last line of defense. And it\'s a line you don\'t want to cross.','Royal Warriors',45450,3.3801,7.06,'2CP5822jI4M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9617,_binary '\0','/3Na31ta8vDuKOgQuPLdSZLs8bCB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091251',8.3,126552,'ru','Иди и смотри','The invasion of a village in Belarus by German forces sends young Flyora into the forest to join the weary Resistance fighters, against his family\'s wishes. There he meets a girl, Glasha, who accompanies him back to his village. On returning home, Flyora finds his family and fellow peasants massacred. His continued survival amidst the brutal debris of war becomes increasingly nightmarish, a battle between despair and hope.','/qNbMsKVzigERgJUbwf8pKyZogpb.jpg','1985-10-17',142,'Released','The cruelest side of war.','Come and See',25237,10.9076,8.2,'UHaSQU-4wss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9618,_binary '\0','/rEHKXkijhv5txPwEOiX0eyJkDYj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091256',8.3,1944,'hi','इजाज़त','An estranged couple accidentally meet in a railway station\'s waiting room and revisit their past.','/6b8bMbbVYDcw78m2ts0d6PMC2HO.jpg','1987-10-24',137,'Released',NULL,'Ijaazat',118133,1.0786,6.333,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9619,_binary '\0','/itxRzMrKSyQJ3nOcsNYQFzjDSc7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091270',6.5,1776,'fr','Inspecteur Lavardin','Inspector Lavardin is called to a provincial village to investigate a murder – only to find that one of his ex-lovers is the victim’s widow.','/hUqQ716XR6WYoKmTbJgeIMQl2G8.jpg','1986-03-12',100,'Released',NULL,'Inspector Lavardin',63322,2.3757,6.148,'zZCNVS3OIEA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9620,_binary '\0','/prXg39FFxNgmab46jS5wkNbjQSt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091276',5.5,12245,'en','Invaders from Mars','A boy tries to stop aliens that have taken over his town and are brainwashing its inhabitants.','/3CMwhPbFgGAC7wKltlfeWMqXSAl.jpg','1986-06-06',100,'Released','Their conquest has already begun. . . . He knows they’re here.','Invaders from Mars',31909,3.9093,5.6,'wVH4RWzKZvk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9621,_binary '\0','/mz4ozla1GGt2jgYNdqiS6lcNeTu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091278',5.6,17291,'en','Iron Eagle','When Doug\'s father, an Air Force Pilot, is shot down by MiGs belonging to a radical Middle Eastern state, no one seems able to get him out. Doug finds Chappy, an Air Force Colonel who is intrigued by the idea of sending in two fighters piloted by himself and Doug to rescue Doug\'s father after bombing the MiG base.','/h1qFAZkVusLf3zcArMCaLpnjg55.jpg','1986-01-17',117,'Released','Break the sound barrier.','Iron Eagle',11037,5.2039,5.6,'0S2CdOrSJ-8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9622,_binary '\0','/zplhBXCSk8pMoQ0NBvcsqErYpf2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091282',4.9,1229,'en','Jake Speed','Jake Speed (Wayne Crawford) is the lead character in some of the biggest page-turners of the 1940s. A chiseled, heroic action figure, Speed saves lives on paper, but when a young girl is kidnapped and her sister (Karen Kopins) begs the real-life Speed for help, he must find a way to be as gallant as the book hero whose creation he\'s inspired. Accompanied by the victim\'s sibling, Speed flies to Africa to see if he\'s up to the task.','/9zlGxL1aBYH0bqQQ1CmoBiiZNBg.jpg','1986-05-30',100,'Released','More than a myth. Less than a legend. And a bit too big for his boots','Jake Speed',71141,3.244,4.632,'ukGBLSBhhjo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9623,_binary '\0','/qNBxyt60hnzBRSHo1uRkRU34fYE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091288',8.1,29698,'fr','Jean de Florette','In a rural French village, an old man and his only remaining relative cast their covetous eyes on an adjoining vacant property. They need its spring water for growing their flowers, and are dismayed to hear that the man who has inherited it is moving in. They block up the spring and watch as their new neighbour tries to keep his crops watered from wells far afield through the hot summer. Though they see his desperate efforts are breaking his health and his wife and daughter\'s hearts, they think only of getting the water.','/atjyDRdOnOi2S28X3mNtJ7CQmFj.jpg','1986-08-27',122,'Released','For some men, land and water are more precious than flesh and blood.','Jean de Florette',4480,3.9903,7.7,'rDJXPiyvQfg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9624,_binary '\0','/wtoOQVkDG6yQR8YxHa8BuHSDM9R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091295',6.4,2611,'en','Jo Jo Dancer, Your Life Is Calling','Although Jo Jo Dancer has achieved success as a stand-up comedian, he hasn\'t found happiness. After receiving severe burns in a narcotics-related incident, Jo Jo remains in a coma, and, while in this state, he looks back on his life. Drifting off into memories of his troubled childhood, Jo Jo revisits his youth, recalling his eventual rise to fame and the decadence that followed. As he considers his existence, he must decide if he wants to go on living or not.','/iId4ABGALLN6gF1OoYW8KGiG25V.jpg','1986-05-02',97,'Released','A comic with one eye on his audience and another eye on the truth.','Jo Jo Dancer, Your Life Is Calling',63510,2.1142,6.5,'QjZAX46xpSM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9625,_binary '\0','/l9jj1CwgCWeCHE2rhzY5Hb0zXcZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091306',6,22015,'en','Jumpin\' Jack Flash','Terry works for a bank, and uses computers to communicate with clients all over the world. One day, she gets a strange coded message from an unknown source. After decoding the message, Terry becomes embroiled in an espionage ring. People are killed, and Terry is chased. Throughout, she remains in contact with this mysterious person, who needs Terry\'s help save his life.','/znVUM7RUBwQ16Q9lTmuMpaWJ7so.jpg','1986-10-09',105,'Released','A man named Jack has got her jumpin\' and the world may never be the same!','Jumpin\' Jack Flash',10945,4.2896,6.1,'ak1AHhLU9c0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9626,_binary '\0','/fi0nHrGjMZ0KQQkhtA4zS38O6uN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091313',4.3,2383,'en','Born American','A trio of American students vacationing in Finland cross the border into the USSR and are soon imprisoned following a skirmish with Soviet soldiers.','/tBUetiqyYC4u7Ua7ceE8OUn8wwi.jpg','1986-01-14',97,'Released','Freedom is just a word… until you lose it.','Born American',103960,1.8871,4,'FaGgrGEo93g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9627,_binary '\0','/a45PIfrFjvtEgV8ZjyHHdgrzpGH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091314',6.2,4355,'sv','Jönssonligan dyker upp igen','As always, Sickan has come up with a new plan. This time he wants to rob the IKEA furniture store. During their nightly break-in Sickan discovers that the store is used as a secret smuggling central for sending American computers to the Soviet Union. The computers are picked up by Soviet submarines sneaking into the Swedish archipelago. Naturally, it is their arch enemy Wall-Enberg who is behind all of this.','/zz2lW37nwwl7wGBq7m9g85Q9jXx.jpg','1986-10-24',88,'Released',NULL,'The Jönsson Gang Turns Up Again',22192,1.384,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9628,_binary '\0','/7rfcRXbFD0xr8NteNq1hwXUd4Af.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091326',6.2,111124,'en','The Karate Kid Part II','Summoned by his dying father, Miyagi returns to his homeland of Okinawa, with Daniel, after a 40-year exile. There he must confront Yukie, the love of his youth, and Sato, his former best friend turned vengeful rival. Sato is bent on a fight to the death, even if it means the destruction of their village. Daniel finds his own love in Yukia\'s niece, Kumiko, and his own enemy in Sato\'s nephew, the vicious Chozen. Now, far away from the tournaments, cheering crowds and safety of home, Daniel will face his greatest challenge ever when the cost of honor is life itself.','/k0OwgRR6PNu7h3SiqpCbRdZWNaG.jpg','1986-06-18',113,'Released','One more lesson to share. The price of honor. The power of friendship. And the way you must fight when only the winner survives.','The Karate Kid Part II',8856,11.0782,6.3,'siRMz-PyjZI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9629,_binary '\0','/qXp4sQEq1xyTY6lwxSNaeTzCaRn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091328',7.2,2690,'hi','Karma','When senior police inspector Vishwa Pratap Singh arrests Dr. Michael Dang, the leader of the international terrorist group PSO, the group blast the jail Dang is lodged in killing huge numbers of inmates including two of Vishwa\'s sons and his daughter-in-law; with Dang escaping in the process. Vishwa, who now calls himself Dada Thakur, enlists three death row inmates and sets out to avenge his family\'s slaughter.','/vN0o0M9ftz1yd3vFYTmb78ZvYoi.jpg','1986-08-08',192,'Released','Fight against terrorism!','Karma',170845,1.1786,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9630,_binary '\0','/viHDt7yHqZYjnzvLbfP8BCWXmdx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091338',5,2982,'en','Killer Party','It\'s April Fool\'s Day and the sisters of Sigma Alpha Pi believe they\'ve found the perfect place to throw a party: the abandoned fraternity house where the guillotined pledge once lost his head in a hazing gone awry.','/ym1KgAPOfmVYSh31mzK56jytqfT.jpg','1986-05-09',92,'Released','By the end of the dance, some of the sorority sisters were dead on their feet.','Killer Party',74225,2.5941,5.031,'2Q-K-pgh_j8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9631,_binary '\0','/gFbdf5Aeupl6P0xsVE8DnZMRXWx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091339',4.6,3423,'en','Killer Workout','Two years ago, a young woman named Valerie was burned after entering a tanning salon. Now, Rhonda runs a local gym where all of a sudden, people are being murdered.','/rzc3kwNze4Cy4Mqp8VntA6KPCYA.jpg','1987-04-16',84,'Released','The workout will kill you!','Killer Workout',5752,2.035,4.7,'5FMlel1b1uE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9632,_binary '\0','/iN2Sez3yNI5RYAQM6ziEAnlYSms.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091341',7.8,15631,'ru','Кин-дза-дза!','Two Soviet humans previously unknown to each other are transported to the planet Pluke in the Kin-dza-dza galaxy due to a chance encounter with an alien teleportation device. They must come to grips with a language barrier and Plukian social norms (not to mention the laws of space and time) if they ever hope to return to Earth.','/xmCxrS5bxXl3wadSNqxoFlM2Cqa.jpg','1986-12-01',135,'Released',NULL,'Kin-dza-dza!',20874,2.7876,7.7,'HxSHlpAldTg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9633,_binary '\0','/kYZNaF79kwGb8RceJV7Q2EifKJG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091343',5.7,3233,'en','The Kindred','Amanda\'s deathbed request to her son, John, was for him to destroy all the lab notes etc. from her last experiment. She also blurts out he had a brother. At the funeral John meets Melissa, who claims to be his mother\'s biggest fan. Together with some of John\'s friends they go to Amanda\'s house, but none are prepared for what they find there.','/bDMUr5IQWAwUpFZFFxltLuAIb7N.jpg','1987-01-09',93,'Released','John\'s got a half brother... half human... half something else!','The Kindred',48660,2.6595,6.1,'Vg8IJgbSr0o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9634,_binary '\0','/lSSPpUWS8i5JVL84HZA14pIUzqB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091344',4,7557,'en','King Kong Lives','After falling from the Twin Towers, Kong lies in a coma for ten years. When his heart begins to fail, scientists engineer an artificial heart, and a giant female ape is captured to serve as a source for a blood transfusion. When Kong awakens following his heart transplant, he senses the nearby presence of the female ape and the two escape to wreak havoc together.','/gI37vg2otF348OHxsx97hWCVvNI.jpg','1986-12-16',105,'Released','America\'s biggest hero is back... and he is not happy.','King Kong Lives',31947,5.307,5.2,'C0HvmgZfbl8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9635,_binary '\0','/vooAbSV1zJqwRNHxCxFQ8fVDm38.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091355',7.7,6378,'zh','恐怖份子','An uncompromising look into urban life from the eyes of a voyeuristic photographer, a rebellious teenager, and a married couple teetering on the edge of adultery.','/7uX1PVn9Tob81hqwdzAjqPeaXZO.jpg','1986-12-19',109,'Released',NULL,'Terrorizers',78450,2.5979,7.376,'CrduKni-i-w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9636,_binary '\0','/zPeX8rVwRKFsrUafNk3lNBbiOxd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091364',7.7,7023,'ru','Курьер','Ivan Mirosnikov, a cheeky young man in the Gorbachev era, is trying to figure out what to do with his life (he\'s not in college, and the 2-year mandatory military service is looming large ahead of him). Meanwhile, he lives with his divorced mother, and works as a courier at a Russian newspaper. Through his job, he meets patronizing Professor Kuznetzov and his rebellious daughter Katya. To annoy the professor, Ivan claims to have an affair with Katya. To his surprise, Katya backs his story up.','/tme4oPYFDiW6HWonNlcmx8Ukevs.jpg','1986-06-06',88,'Released',NULL,'Messenger Boy',70966,1.7169,7.381,'uN8eris65VI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9637,_binary '\0','/mGkleIuPO2flRyvP8yBcUykSQsp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091369',7.3,166918,'en','Labyrinth','Frustrated with babysitting on yet another weekend night, Sarah, a teenager with an active imagination, summons the Goblins to take her baby stepbrother away. When little Toby actually disappears, Sarah must follow him into a fantastical world to rescue him from the Goblin King. Guarding his castle is the labyrinth itself, a twisted maze of deception, populated with outrageous characters and unknown dangers.','/pejayhTVBEL4w8YKSfrhOjjWVlH.jpg','1986-06-27',101,'Released','Where everything seems possible and nothing is what it seems.','Labyrinth',13597,10.9131,7.291,'8bJy0GF2RZ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9638,_binary '\0','/dMx5BCbLI4NXiwdpf27YPlnjf1K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091374',7.1,7593,'en','Lady Jane','The death of King Henry VIII throws his kingdom into chaos because of succession disputes. His weak son, Edward, is on his deathbed. Anxious to keep England true to the Reformation, a scheming minister John Dudley marries off his son, Guildford to Lady Jane Grey, whom he places on the throne after Edward dies. At first hostile to each other, Guildford and Jane fall in love, but they cannot withstand the course of power which will lead to their ultimate downfall.','/h0N4lG6g2r77C4yGTuvOBHhGYXP.jpg','1986-02-07',142,'Released','Some of the greatest battles are fought with the heart.','Lady Jane',21867,4.111,6.9,'D7X0Wm_Cc5k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9639,_binary '\0','/4EYrgH2ydn6jQH5WctwwIsa7wdS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091383',6.3,1316,'en','The Last Days of Patton','Gen. George S. Patton now works a desk job for the U.S. military after World War II. In the midst of dealing with the difficulty of adapting to his dramatic change of lifestyle, Patton is involved in an auto wreck that leaves him in critical condition. While his body fails him, Patton introspectively reminisces about his relationship with his spouse, Beatrice; his childhood; and his days on the WWI battlefields.','/kqgkn5cr5mUNh3czr4XhXinQ77i.jpg','1986-12-15',146,'Released',NULL,'The Last Days of Patton',139262,2.0259,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9640,_binary '\0','/kL9mUbw8QJBh1vz643o956XZ0uj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091396',6,13371,'en','Legal Eagles','Assistant District Attorney Tom Logan is set for higher office, at least until he becomes involved with defence lawyer Laura Kelly and her unpredictable client Chelsea Deardon. It seems the least of Chelsea\'s crimes is the theft of a very valuable painting, but as the women persuade Logan to investigate further and to cut some official corners, a much more sinister scenario starts to emerge.','/RH9bXtsxy12YKXqvAwKd5XmGvq.jpg','1986-06-18',116,'Released','Tom Logan has a law partner who put a dog on the witness stand. A client who can\'t enter a room without a crime being committed. And a case that could turn out to be the murder of the year. His.','Legal Eagles',9930,4.399,6.033,'Bu22X2wwgDM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9641,_binary '\0','/bCO0MRqIuNyVBjzpWcVvwK9Xicm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091398',8,2887,'sh','Lepota poroka','In the mountains of Montenegro people have lived by strict and Draconian laws for centuries, almost untouched by modern civilization. However, a young couple are going to seek their fortune on the more liberal coast and there they find jobs in the nudist colony. Hundreds of naked bodies and atmosphere of joie d\'vivre make the husband and wife question their rigid way of life.','/wpM2lbfua9HT5RiheMqZXzdvHPn.jpg','1986-01-06',109,'Released',NULL,'The Beauty of Vice',4560,1.3048,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9642,_binary '\0','/5sieW2Qylvu7nAPc9bq2eKmNsDf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091400',5.3,1751,'en','Let\'s Get Harry','Harry Burck has been kidnapped by South American terrorists, and when the US Government refuses to intervene, Harry\'s friends decide to take matters into their own hands!','/qyKxAZbcnzmn24oATeUX7DqQ7aB.jpg','1986-10-31',102,'Released','An adventure about the hero in all of us','Let\'s Get Harry',32031,2.4323,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9643,_binary '\0','/bPCDEt4ALVkGKpA6rZBDcbuytbe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091406',7.6,3695,'zh','戀戀風塵','A-yuan and A-yun are both from the small mining town of Jio-fen. They move to Taipei, where A-yuan is an apprentice by day and goes to night school, and A-yun works as a helper at a tailors. Everyone thinks they are meant for each other, and so do they. They fail to see time and fate are beyond their control.','/9QbsT3gkG0WdchoDY8kqIwcVN0i.jpg','1986-05-09',109,'Released',NULL,'Dust in the Wind',45996,2.17,7.6,'vMD48kNgQfY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9644,_binary '\0','/tTaiOystuU603tSOPdmhYAFx4ED.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091415',5.9,4471,'en','Link','Young graduate student Jane Chase becomes the new assistant to an eccentric zoology professor at the remote home he shares with two brilliant chimpanzees and an elderly orangutan butler named Link. But when one of the chimps is found dead and the professor mysteriously disappears, Link becomes dangerously aggressive towards Jane. Now, the time for “monkey business” is over and the true terror is about to begin.','/t5jQOHK9ZsxtDG8Pjah4j6ogFvP.jpg','1986-03-05',103,'Released','Man is no longer in control!','Link',62131,2.3482,6.129,'GF9Kh6-jTHw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9645,_binary '\0','/z9y41Biv1isRtErpt7Ecv01ru0W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091419',7.1,95918,'en','Little Shop of Horrors','Seymour Krelborn is a nerdy orphan working at Mushnik\'s, a flower shop in urban Skid Row. He harbors a crush on fellow co-worker, Audrey Fulquard, and is berated by Mr. Mushnik daily. One day, Seymour finds a very mysterious unidentified plant which he calls Audrey II. The plant seems to have a craving for blood and soon begins to sing for its supper.','/iKkbN17OmFosaW6asCNZTTsyvpu.jpg','1986-12-19',94,'Released','A singing plant. A daring hero. A sweet girl. A demented dentist. It\'s the most outrageous musical comedy in years.','Little Shop of Horrors',10776,9.7181,7,'HqX9g3Qwb5A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9646,_binary '\0','/n0Wm2mInXLPeB9Jb4dJ75ZUuquJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091427',6.3,5936,'cn','龍的心','A policeman forsakes his dream of world travel to care for a mentally impaired brother, who is later kidnapped by gangsters.','/hmMI1yb0yrpri1aanEjijdfxVL1.jpg','1985-09-14',91,'Released','If you ever get in this much trouble you\'ll wish you had a brother like Jackie Chan.','Heart of Dragon',18763,3.6684,7,'JELCWsVTHNg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9647,_binary '\0','/16F5j6veljrsOas69PbdwQnCtvk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091428',6,1880,'cn','龍在江湖','A man is framed for murder by his drug-dealing best friend who covets his girlfriend, leading to eight years in jail and a vow of revenge upon release.','/xJl59Cb60xLRYTM0AQlSMLi1w6P.jpg','1986-12-20',87,'Released',NULL,'Legacy of Rage',68590,2.8969,7.2,'Z9KU7ogm-6c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9648,_binary '\0','/lF0JRUvbi5AFaXcA5O4ZpHdosAC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091431',6.9,24753,'cn','龍兄虎弟','After an adventurer known as the Asian Hawk steals a mysterious sword known to be a piece of the Armour of God, a magical suit of armour that dates back to the Crusades, a cult of Satanic monks kidnap his ex-girlfriend and demand he turn over the sword and recover the rest of the armour.','/phCpGqCSBWJqutKxj73COACrlPt.jpg','1986-08-16',97,'Released','Jackie Chan in his greatest adventure ever!','Armour of God',10974,9.9415,7,'3C-Y9K6j_TQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9649,_binary '\0','/aadZCmphLHOzG1B9OgW7JoHjOSy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091445',6.9,19048,'en','Lucas','A brilliant but socially inept 14-year-old experiences heartbreak for the first time when his two best friends – Cappie, an older-brother figure, and Maggie, the new girl with whom he is in love – fall for each other.','/7qq4sxYj59Aq6wmnnIlot5iXaux.jpg','1986-03-28',100,'Released','It\'s about falling in love. For the first time.','Lucas',13346,4.4773,6.7,'Wnqcag_24kE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9650,_binary '\0','/gGZbx1baQ08FhQmIvXjBwWb5Ghj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091462',4.6,1492,'en','The Majorettes','A hooded psycho is murdering high-school girls. A devil-worshiping, drug-dealing biker gang is suspected.','/5pcxksaO7W29RpPi4EBKJnyWrn9.jpg','1986-10-27',92,'Released','Sis, Boom, Blood. You\'re Dead!','The Majorettes',85141,2.0292,5,'O4qkiyWXjbw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9651,_binary '\0','/ldNq6kIMo1LbhshMVZJsXtEwzZF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091464',7.1,3173,'en','Malcolm','Malcolm is a chronically shy mechanical genius, who has just been fired for building his own tram. He gets Frank, who has just been released from jail, to move in to help pay the bills. With Frank\'s help, Malcolm turns to a life of crime.','/pLGCwLKEBJC5cWCmOnsQpOOBGfl.jpg','1986-07-20',86,'Released','A comedy of hopes and schemes.','Malcolm',28685,1.3473,6.6,'wffDBsSgS5Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9652,_binary '\0','/eI2Bn6dYBVf5N4ZpSaoWZYCltPf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091466',5.5,1516,'nl','Mama is boos!','When a wife and mother of two finds out her husband has an affair, she tries to make his life a living hell. The sequel to Dutch move hit Schatjes!','/lbSkIlhWsW8fmgMwbqlIH2UJCDb.jpg','1986-03-20',110,'Released',NULL,'Hitting the Fan!',57590,1.4586,4.68,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9653,_binary '\0','/kfGRT4o60d3pWlRsMamz5kC4Vl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091472',6.1,7591,'en','The Manhattan Project','A gifted high school student steals plutonium from the secret nuclear weapons facility in his home town in order to construct his own nuclear bomb, win a national science fair, and expose the government\'s secrets.','/lwZMCXVJujnfRWWXPznPw3jreRn.jpg','1986-06-13',118,'Released','Paul Stevens\' high school science project has gotten a little out of hand. He just built an atomic bomb. Now he\'s got 11 hours to make sure it doesn\'t work.','The Manhattan Project',30194,2.819,6.225,'fEcwt0U6BYM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9654,_binary '\0','/zOO8GRa02x9o1iGOIIAJD50YcMW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091474',7.2,93551,'en','Manhunter','FBI Agent Will Graham, retired after catching notorious cannibal Hannibal Lecter, returns to duty to engage in a risky cat-and-mouse game with Lecter to capture a new killer.','/6rb24x39vV8n5301IelC8rCPJTH.jpg','1986-08-15',120,'Released','It\'s just you and me now, sport…','Manhunter',11454,0.3926,7,'fywNBuzD2SU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9655,_binary '\0','/4JqXcnG6v8eHzeib2sAOLwTLVds.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091480',8,26079,'fr','Manon des sources','In this, the sequel to Jean de Florette, Manon has grown into a beautiful young shepherdess living in the idyllic Provencal countryside. She plots vengeance on the men who greedily conspired to acquire her father\'s land years earlier.','/1qpu6Zc1PSDL3UbDNIZJ6YuhJDW.jpg','1986-11-19',115,'Released','They destroyed her father. Now they offered her love. But the only thing she desired was revenge.','Manon of the Spring',4481,4.6014,7.6,'BxScSXKXwPc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9656,_binary '\0','/sZPmrn6XRGoR8mtMCrASfEwn3gA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091495',6.9,14274,'es','Matador','A conflicted youth confesses to crimes he didn\'t commit while a man and woman aroused by death become obsessed with each other.','/gdqyLupS8sQ8qQRuHutiaNAKyz3.jpg','1986-03-07',105,'Released',NULL,'Matador',8047,3.1564,6.7,'K4sMuwHX0CQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9657,_binary '\0','/sRY16xQIV5lHL1yTotyqPyyjsju.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091497',7.1,10314,'fr','Mauvais Sang','Two aging crooks are given two weeks to repay a debt to a woman named The American. They recruit their recently deceased partner\'s son to help them break into a laboratory and steal the vaccine against STBO, a sexually transmitted disease that is sweeping the country. It\'s spread by having sex without emotional involvement, and most of its victims are teenagers who make love out of curiosity rather than commitment.','/yjUmAFx8Z3E0K1IUpQSyUilL5P9.jpg','1986-11-26',119,'Released','Love that burns fast but lasts forever.','Mauvais Sang',64131,3.623,7.1,'r_nJz2KTKIk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9658,_binary '\0','/tyqSX1VonD5TkaSNQFaR92BImrS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091498',6,1427,'fr','Max mon amour','The wife of a British diplomat in Paris takes a chimpanzee as her lover.','/zJQMNi8wbP5O31Xrda7cmBFHtLE.jpg','1986-10-22',97,'Released','A love triangle of primate proportion.','Max My Love',64097,2.3662,5.8,'frXy1f1fGJw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9659,_binary '\0','/m6q0Q6bwJnzoMHWFCplDarmBtIK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091499',5.4,40520,'en','Maximum Overdrive','When a comet passes close to the earth, machines all over the world come alive and go on homicidal rampages. A group of people at a desolate truck stop are held hostage by a gang of murderous 18-wheelers. The frightened people set out to defeat the killer machines…Or be killed by them.','/8pGYesuatPnMS8lhS4NvwiDjKbG.jpg','1986-07-13',98,'Released','Imagine your worst nightmare...machines take over the world!','Maximum Overdrive',9980,6.9178,5.836,'61qkt8191lg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9660,_binary '\0','/j5mVeVYoZcxS7xgGckHa9e0SqH7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091506',7.2,3367,'el','Ο Μελισσοκόμος','Following the wedding of his daughter, stone-faced beekeeper Spyros makes an annual journey from the north of Greece to the south, traveling along with his hives. En route, he meets an erratic, young female drifter, with whom he strikes up an unusual, self-destructive relationship.','/owuAPJZlkBTTyDkmolF6gRyfsZs.jpg','1986-10-23',122,'Released',NULL,'The Beekeeper',48210,2.6057,7.045,'6EVm034s_IM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9661,_binary '\0','/djhUo7oKs8V7FK1d4xfkWZMdxrb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091507',7.1,1984,'fr','Mélo','In 1920s Paris, violinists and lifelong friends Pierre Belcroix and Marcel Blanc are happy with their lives, although Marcel has become famous and Pierre has not. Pierre is married to Romaine, a stylish young flapper. However, Marcel meets and falls in love with her, which Marcel little suspects.','/2D1lwqQLAmx507ne0B538QDpFID.jpg','1986-09-03',112,'Released',NULL,'Mélo',59847,2.0423,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9662,_binary '\0','/jldaXnpHGg3DtIJ1JEN0mBx2yuB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091508',4.8,1217,'en','The Men\'s Club','Seven men have a group session and share their feelings on women, love, life and work.','/uvskVvh6t3RLrIe3gmjcOv8qi56.jpg','1986-09-19',101,'Released','Growing up is hard to do.','The Men\'s Club',93263,2.1211,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9663,_binary '\0','/izgDdMvuRvTtA2azhKwPvfITZU1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091530',7.4,70388,'en','The Mission','When a Spanish Jesuit goes into the South American wilderness to build a mission in the hope of converting the Indians of the region, a slave hunter is converted and joins his mission. When Spain sells the colony to Portugal, they are forced to defend all they have built against the Portuguese aggressors.','/6K9cG6LOOtySZF4D4xBu1MApC1N.jpg','1986-09-06',125,'Released','One will trust in the power of prayer. One will believe in the might of the sword.','The Mission',11416,8.3039,7.4,'HU14R9hbUFc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9664,_binary '\0','/fu7npxpA8YPUvkG61PvPgWVx5cT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091534',5.8,1902,'en','Modern Girls','Margo, Kelly, and CeCe have three things in common: they\'re roommates, they\'re gorgeous, and they\'re hooked on the glamour and excitement of L.A.\'s rock and roll nightlife. When they get mixed up with a rock star, an arrogant ex-boyfriend, a pseudo-sadist, and the nicest nerd in the City of Angels, it\'s a full night to say the least!','/sv6npOvxRoNENgErAlSsyx7fHZk.jpg','1986-11-07',84,'Released','Never stand in line. Never pay for your own drinks. Never stand next to a dweeb.','Modern Girls',38916,2.8845,5.5,'i6ONkIVYnvw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9665,_binary '\0','/k4w45fpj9fyi5oGGFEaeUMxVKSw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091537',6.5,2389,'de','Momo','Momo is a young orphan girl who lives in the ruins of an old Roman amphitheater and becomes friends with everybody in the neighborhood. But when a powerful international corporation starts stealing everybody’s time, nobody has any time left for her, let alone their friends or families. Momo, together with Master Hora, the custodian of time, are the only ones who can go up against the time thieves before all is lost forever.','/wth0MTgrfuekyrXxM0d6DjoTV7X.jpg','1986-07-16',101,'Released',NULL,'Momo',2265,2.7203,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9666,_binary '\0','/awqquwDxMN9iuOAgDJZSkUO9yf7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091538',7.3,19635,'en','Mona Lisa','George is a small-time crook just out of prison who discovers his tough-guy image is out of date. Reduced to working as a minder/driver for high class call girl Simone, he has to agree when she asks him to find a young colleague from her King\'s Cross days. That\'s when George\'s troubles just start.','/geBGfbhkgKHld8rM9XuLfzPGZ6I.jpg','1986-06-13',105,'Released','Sometimes love is a strange and wicked game.','Mona Lisa',10002,3.4469,6.901,'86lXsR5iX2Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9667,_binary '\0','/2C2kUFxhs5u2G9xeg4KQ0FZvFFA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091541',6.4,67735,'en','The Money Pit','After being evicted from their Manhattan apartment, a couple buy what looks like the home of their dreams—only to find themselves saddled with a bank-account-draining nightmare. Struggling to keep their relationship together as their rambling mansion falls to pieces around them, the two watch in hilarious horror as everything—including the kitchen sink—disappears into the Money Pit.','/bohhidIi1WWU5NNYF9l5wLQu3Ii.jpg','1986-03-26',91,'Released','For everyone who\'s ever been deeply in love or deeply in debt.','The Money Pit',10466,8.8574,6.5,'ZO8svUiRDNE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9668,_binary '\0','/1Ry5foExrCFr6mMsF848Y53R3TR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091544',5,3318,'en','Monster in the Closet','After several people and a dog are found dead in their closets a \"mild-mannered\" reporter, a college professor, her son and a befuddled professor band together to uncover the mystery but not without involving the U.S. Army and mass panic.','/xWHhre5M8DZvvr5MNL653rKD051.jpg','1986-05-15',90,'Released','It\'s Out! It\'s Out! It\'s Out!','Monster in the Closet',50382,2.4725,4.9,'-lrJj5nZr4c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9669,_binary '\0','/zC9SVUUQ2RNWplLoeeXByyJDY1U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091554',5.9,7996,'en','The Morning After','Failed actress Alex Sternbergen wakes up hungover one morning in an apartment she does not recognize, unable to remember the previous evening -- and with a dead body in bed next to her. As she tries to piece together the events of the night, Alex cannot totally rely on friends or her estranged husband, Joaquin, for assistance. Only a single ally, loner ex-policeman Turner Kendall, can help her escape her predicament and find the true killer.','/kxuR1RpAUWRHKzCwbjg2bw6RTGI.jpg','1986-12-25',102,'Released','Last night she drank to forget. Today she woke up to a murder. Is he her last hope or the last man she should trust?','The Morning After',31924,2.8336,6,'7EiXXSp7MIk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9670,_binary '\0','/1ss9OxkiSZEmN1wEXJsEIXz1QEm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091555',6,1657,'sv','Morrhår och ärtor','Life isn\'t easy for the indecisive 40-year-old Claes-Henrik. Should he choose his mom or his girlfriend?','/wmJj9jd0k4j6U2DAGAT6lxqhZ4B.jpg','1986-02-07',101,'Released',NULL,'Peas & Whiskers',49718,1.2173,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9671,_binary '\0','/9tQZwA2yidynkdgYdlnNzf3FylD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091557',6.6,34007,'en','The Mosquito Coast','An inventor spurns his city life and moves his family into the jungles of Central America to make a utopia.','/8A1iDYSp8H5WORWZVCV3E3SpkGD.jpg','1986-11-26',119,'Released','He never bargained for what he found.','The Mosquito Coast',11120,4.0079,6.3,'eC2eC_pN7ZE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9672,_binary '\0','/6h09XC2To0MlJqqSzVGsmK8joUg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091559',8.4,4880,'ta','மௌனராகம்','Divya, a college student, is forced to marry Chandrakumar due to family pressure. However, she asks for a divorce as a wedding gift, revealing her past.','/oXy8bx56Fx53sxozHubeLLDItF7.jpg','1986-08-15',146,'Released',NULL,'Mouna Raagam',82124,1.2015,7.865,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9673,_binary '\0','/hfsnS4AOa6NT1A9qhs28xmKtaqz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091560',4.6,2130,'en','Mountaintop Motel Massacre','After several years in an insane asylum, Evelyn, the keeper of the Mountaintop Motel, is released and resumes doing business. She kills her young charge out of anger, but convinces the police it was an accident - and pushed into insanity, she then proceeds to target her guests, first by releasing vermin into their rooms, but then by using her trusty sickle.','/rMVOZtHLfNcaTMNtU4EIs3ECszv.jpg','1983-07-15',96,'Released','Please do not disturb Evelyn. She already is.','Mountaintop Motel Massacre',29600,1.6033,4.4,'b8QduPy1MX0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9674,_binary '\0','/rMMcyGgq0qO7o7dzUFmlx5LxxnA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091572',6.2,2669,'en','Murder in Three Acts','In Acapulco, Hercule Poirot attends a dinner party in which one of the guests clutches his throat and suddenly dies. The causes seem to be natural until another party with most of the same guests produces another corpse.','/2qEaWC5N5q2VcAsphXkljZlfvFH.jpg','1986-09-30',94,'Released',NULL,'Murder in Three Acts',6107,3.8346,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9675,_binary '\0','/y9zmtCPXFVVNhlgzPTr7qXA87k7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091574',5.7,1700,'en','The Murders in the Rue Morgue','A detective comes out of retirement to help his daughter\'s fiance prove that he did not commit a series of murders.','/roGb7CTNwNiRFeJLyJvIEPgz97g.jpg','1986-12-07',100,'Released','How can you stop what you don\'t understand?','The Murders in the Rue Morgue',6174,1.9285,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9676,_binary '\0','/zDtVa8r0qbZIIyqSzvk2NvJUZyX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091575',5.9,7513,'en','Murphy\'s Law','A tough police detective escapes from custody after being framed and arrested for the murder of his ex-wife, and must now find the real killer and prove his innocence.','/tTXl2YPptbfad0UQ3zWHSmo7IrV.jpg','1986-04-18',100,'Released','He\'s a cop, She\'s a thief, together they\'re running for their lives','Murphy\'s Law',33055,3.1342,6.1,'FkeyKGbN86k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9677,_binary '\0','/nO7raOhTt6QcrYjkb1dL8VaTA3e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091578',6.8,18946,'en','My Beautiful Laundrette','A young Pakistani Briton manages a rundown laundrette with his lover while dealing with tension in his family, the local Pakistani community, and a persistent mob of skinheads.','/hfGWxrtbRnxg19ouEYBtQKtMZcN.jpg','1985-11-16',98,'Released','A sharp, sophisticated, funny, sexy, compassionate picture.','My Beautiful Laundrette',11240,3.2956,6.7,'O3yJ0H2HZ9c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9678,_binary '\0','/m6MPVQ3auHGmK0HF3wmtk4lYhpV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091579',5.5,2323,'en','My Chauffeur','A feisty young woman accepts a mysterious offer to become a chauffeur for a Beverly Hills limousine business, much to the chagrin of her older male coworkers and the disbelief of her customers.','/kfNxWVRUuJbdRswHlxYf7XAUJD3.jpg','1986-01-24',97,'Released','He fell in love with the help... Beverly Hills will never be the same.','My Chauffeur',39406,1.4904,6,'HIOHsMNIuEQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9679,_binary '\0','/wR808c14RSmSqEx0gwc1wCJwEMf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091584',6,3122,'en','My Little Pony: The Movie','The first day of Spring is on its way and the Little Ponies are preparing for it with a big festival. But all the fun may come to an end if the witch Hydia has her way! Can the Ponies defeat Hydia and her evil daughters, Reeka and Draggle? More importantly, can they save Ponyland from the witches’ concoction, the strange purple goo called Smooze, that’s threatening to bury the whole town?','/rB0nNtMedX30xiymlGxArmh2BQL.jpg','1986-06-06',86,'Released','The happiest, most fun-filled adventure you\'ve ever seen.','My Little Pony: The Movie',25400,3.3168,6.4,'oAwjSbIEalo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9680,_binary '\0','/bp5b5dzUsHKeTnCbId1xonNMUvi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091598',7.3,1277,'hi','Naam','A widow raises two sons, one of whom is not her biological child (unbeknownst to him). Her biological child leaves India to work in Dubai, but eventually finds himself in the criminal underworld.','/uqmVLT9dXl1Nwn7I6dp8DmTo3kL.jpg','1986-09-29',180,'Released',NULL,'Naam',232820,1.1738,7.25,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9681,_binary '\0','/5XIrFvk1ovwC2SMxFj0r9BmSCQb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091601',6.4,1387,'hi','नगीना','The story follows Rajni, a shape-shifting cobra (Ichchadhari Naagin) who marries a civilian, Rajiv, to avenge the death of her spouse at the hands of an evil saint. Rajiv, who comes from a wealthy family, returns to India after studying in London. His mother wants him to marry Vijaya Singh, but he falls in love with Rajni, an orphan. His mother initially opposes the marriage but later agrees. Their happiness is disrupted when Bhairon Nath, a sadhu with the ability to control snakes, arrives and reveals that Rajni is actually a Naagin seeking revenge. Bhairon Nath has his own sinister motives—he wants to capture Rajni because she knows the location of a hidden Mani, a sacred jewel that would grant him immense power. A dramatic battle ensues, leading to Bhairon Nath’s defeat, and Rajiv and Rajni live happily ever after.','/zzv7ZAwTEDyVgcmbEOZMjqBpG9F.jpg','1986-10-15',138,'Released',NULL,'Nagina',143889,1.6776,7.1,'y0g7qV5NXSE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9682,_binary '\0','/bVBckurlSfkJXaGeSqcNMlcln0K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091603',5.3,1221,'en','The Naked Cage','A young woman is falsely convicted of a bank robbery and sent to a maximum-security prison run by a corrupt warden, where she is forced to suffer various indignities.','/5iCjhrn0wltvOnuIq9be0VxGW9B.jpg','1986-03-01',97,'Released','Raw violence and hot rage explode behind bars.','The Naked Cage',42030,2.0138,4.9,'LOI0oJqlGsw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9683,_binary '\0','/v4d6PPfqHeUNSdcyBVQ2Xb8yBk0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091605',7.7,128612,'en','The Name of the Rose','14th-century Franciscan monk William of Baskerville and his young novice arrive at a conference to find that several monks have been murdered under mysterious circumstances. To solve the crimes, William must rise up against the Church\'s authority and fight the shadowy conspiracy of monastery monks using only his intelligence; which is considerable.','/2BuVu0j6v2kNY2gGxtO3sDGyob2.jpg','1986-09-24',130,'Released','Who, in the name of God, is getting away with murder?','The Name of the Rose',192,10.7471,7.5,'BX2u0cxj-KU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9684,_binary '\0','/mcYYFEONBY5XzTDoT7d4xrhkTwt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091607',6.4,2852,'zh','南北少林','In ancient China, Zhi Ming trains at the legendary Northern Shaolin temple to avenge the death of his father at the hands of a nefarious magistrate.','/5Gk38G7JcGJY6aR4cdrZ8sftSsv.jpg','1986-02-01',94,'Released',NULL,'Martial Arts of Shaolin',37032,2.9837,6.3,'MZ9KthGwgTE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9685,_binary '\0','/9g6Md7R2bP92AhesUID7V1mp0wK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091621',4.9,2390,'en','Never Too Young to Die','Secret agent Drew Stargrove is brutally murdered by the ruthless hermaphrodite gang leader Velvet Von Ragnar. The murdered secret agent\'s son, Lance Stargrove is thrust into the dangerous and intriguing world of secret agents and espionage when he seeks revenge. Danja Deerling teams up with Lance as his sidekick and love interest.','/7zWdiRzjw5XNevv4GAV8znwNUDR.jpg','1986-06-13',92,'Released','Action: Bond style. Beauty: Vanity style. Hero: American style.','Never Too Young to Die',27408,2.1401,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9686,_binary '\0','/rKr2NzAvxlTDCI7iSSNLaCXt0Aj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091630',6.7,29184,'en','Night of the Creeps','In 1959, an alien experiment crashes to earth and infects a fraternity member. They freeze the body, but in the modern day, two geeks pledging a fraternity accidentally thaw the corpse, which proceeds to infect the campus with parasites that transform their hosts into killer zombies.','/A3s2tQGNb6mhlr1hPZeE5F8IUwp.jpg','1986-08-21',88,'Released','The good news is your date is here. The bad news is...He\'s dead.','Night of the Creeps',15762,4.6181,6.8,'_PmPuYg6nqM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9687,_binary '\0','/xRSqKyWbhjxhMtqlZYwohLk3wcb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091631',3.6,1478,'en','Nightmare Weekend','A female scientist performs experiments on three college girls that turn them into drooling, murderous mutants.','/jPndIgw2VyGbtVZfGeWV4wDGGnJ.jpg','1986-05-12',86,'Released','Two Days And Nights Of Relentless Terror. Who Will Survive?','Nightmare Weekend',119592,1.286,3.6,'NF4Pac2fn48','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9688,_binary '\0','/cf7jOkeY8tqSnVRzAbdlUKQynhe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091635',5.9,47501,'en','Nine 1/2 Weeks','An erotic story about a woman, the assistant of an art gallery, who gets involved in an impersonal affair with a man. She barely knows about his life, only about the sex games they play, so the relationship begins to get complicated.','/aE1iunrgO8UHfoXKJcjCy4Ih17n.jpg','1986-02-09',117,'Released','They broke every rule.','Nine 1/2 Weeks',10068,10.2875,6.1,'bRIsOxLzLLM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9689,_binary '\0','/K8kewK0DfVnMsAA1yGOMkbNyvA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091637',5.7,9438,'en','No Mercy','An unconventional undercover Chicago cop and his partner are recruited to commit the murder of a New Orleans criminal kingpin.','/e3GLsfBLy7fdM3dJKAkzQlTIqII.jpg','1986-12-19',106,'Released','He is entering her world to track down the killer she is desperate to be free of. Murder brought them together. Passion keeps them there.','No Mercy',26789,4.7733,5.8,'wcwT_B1t5ec','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9690,_binary '\0','/f0aKdbxNRcUX4YrTSN3s06w8fMz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091647',5.2,6189,'en','Nomads','One night, in a Los Angeles hospital, Dr. Flax attends to a seriously injured man who, apparently crazed, whispers mysterious and disconcerting words in French into her ear.','/rqPl4jsFmBvl2odkYHtUeTqBCjT.jpg','1986-03-07',89,'Released','A terrifying story of the supernatural','Nomads',26725,2.2047,4.841,'zrnNbHRudWo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9691,_binary '\0','/yxdFS674ZBnJxBPeFeSQuKRE5PT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091651',5.1,2104,'it','Nosferatu a Venezia','Professor Paris Catalano visits Venice, to investigate the last known appearance of the famous vampire Nosferatu during the carnival of 1786.','/9WoZrEl55sPbyd1OKieidPa1CRR.jpg','1988-09-10',97,'Released',NULL,'Nosferatu in Venice',28198,2.6951,5.857,'bHsSwdx2NCI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9692,_binary '\0','/tMH0vpz9s0GfA4rnl7k1x3nyRdl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091653',5.9,8790,'en','Nothing in Common','A successful advertising executive finds his freewheeling life crashing to a halt when his parents end their longtime marriage.','/m2G6Idl1CKJwOt8aFsnJk08sfDP.jpg','1986-07-29',118,'Released','It\'s a comedy. And a drama. Just like life.','Nothing in Common',29968,3.7894,5.9,'8evvm4s-C98','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9693,_binary '\0','/jFrIqkIcgiMKHLo7WXC2XRtiEkx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091658',6.9,1586,'en','Nutcracker: The Motion Picture','In this Pacific Northwest Ballet performance, it is Christmas Eve and festivities are underway. Clara is excited when her godfather arrives with a bag full of gifts, one of which is an intriguing wooden nutcracker. That night, while the household sleeps, Clara visits the Christmas tree to inspect her nutcracker and soon finds herself immersed in a dream world both dark and enchanting.','/rEskWZgPj4SCkTMJPDCYxP94CB.jpg','1986-11-26',85,'Released','A magnificent Christmas spectacular.','Nutcracker: The Motion Picture',71316,1.8288,6.7,'GySZbZQj_es','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9694,_binary '\0','/48y1eAboPFgt7rKcynRAPPvtJ1E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091670',7.8,35573,'sv','Offret','Alexander, a journalist, philosopher and retired actor, celebrates a birthday with friends and family when it is announced that nuclear war has begun.','/v7nEBG4ulpGol1QKC5EHnLomFa.jpg','1986-05-09',149,'Released','The final film of Andrei Tarkovsky','The Sacrifice',24657,4.4015,7.707,'ODJb2-PLu7Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9695,_binary '\0','/3b2clZrmDvLquqrWp2CXjUJYRFX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091671',5.7,3442,'en','From a Whisper to a Scream','The uncle of an executed murderess relates four stories of his hometown, Oldfield, to a reporter. In the first, an elderly man pursues a romance with a younger woman, even to the grave and beyond. In the second, a wounded man on the run from creditors is rescued by a backwoods hermit who holds the secret to eternal life. In the third, a glass-eating carny pays the ultimate price for looking for love on the outside. And in the fourth, a group of Civil War soldiers are held captive by a household of orphans with strange intentions for them.','/h2UzUndAmuqJsluhCK7vZuVjyhu.jpg','1987-09-25',100,'Released','Welcome to Oldfield. Stop in for a night of pure terror.','From a Whisper to a Scream',39895,2.1242,5.8,'_YDP4MDo0gw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9696,_binary '\0','/iqVTYYKbmfKJLtOnR77dTWG0WkH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091680',6.4,18547,'en','One Crazy Summer','An aspiring teenage cartoonist and his friends come to the aid of a singer trying to save her family property from developers.','/hwrMVPwGFB3fouqD5PhhmbafB7G.jpg','1986-08-08',93,'Released','They\'re out of school, out on Nantucket, and out of their minds. With this crowd, anything can happen!','One Crazy Summer',18282,4.8577,6.032,'araGhvv2IDg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9697,_binary '\0','/yWchXAZ6eCBSSfgh8jrky7sjvkn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091706',5.5,2412,'en','Out of Bounds','Farm boy Daryl Cage\'s parents ship him off to the big city to live with his brother, hoping he will have a better life there. After a baggage mixup at the airport, Daryl finds himself in possession of a drug cache, which a ruthless drug dealer wants back. The dealer murders Daryl\'s brother and the small town boy ends up all alone in the big city, being pursued by both the drug dealer and the police, who suspect him of the murder.','/aOp7kLTkp1UAT6LjTX5V7rlnGqs.jpg','1986-07-25',93,'Released','Eighteen years on an Iowa farm never prepared him for a summer in L.A.','Out of Bounds',46743,2.6955,5.403,'Y19-OOmvGHM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9698,_binary '\0','/oMl3CT8Ggo7coxhyYMULHDQbRE7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091707',5.1,2764,'en','The Outing','A group of high schoolers decide to stay in a natural museum after closing hours, but a newly acquired and mysterious lamp hiding a deadly force will turn the fun into horror.','/jPVanJPUGHjBuXScbpbopZvMKKv.jpg','1987-09-11',87,'Released','They\'re not coming back.','The Outing',26675,2.2458,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9699,_binary '\0','/xg7ebOP4qBEVc6lGihqjwwi32xi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091721',6.1,2490,'en','The Parent Trap II','Two best friends plot to get their single parents together to stop one of them from moving to New York.','/AcEQTEBs7bzkrfTLgKX0K0M1fpj.jpg','1986-07-26',81,'Released','Hayley Mills is at it again !','The Parent Trap II',51881,3.1033,5.5,'2IgYk37jv8Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9700,_binary '\0','/fd1vGYI8DFa78hbO5d1S9x1jljX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091724',6.1,2711,'en','The Park Is Mine','A Vietnam vet takes forceful control of Central Park to remember those who served and died in the Vietnam War.','/iaNFpGIq5LdzBwQ9HdvVaqcI11P.jpg','1986-07-24',102,'Released',NULL,'The Park Is Mine',53157,2.8506,5.6,'WfoWxWkOHNE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9701,_binary '\0','/3W1l1W4PWHNAsaIpoislEROwa13.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091725',7.1,3469,'en','Parting Glances','Michael and Robert, two gay men living in Brooklyn, spend their last day together before Robert leaves for Africa on work assignment. Michael still has feelings for his friend Nick, who has AIDS.','/maiMV50kpDCHe66zTNveVuGNsts.jpg','1986-02-19',90,'Released','A (very) independent film','Parting Glances',32446,2.8153,6.9,'31cTX5kmro8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9702,_binary '\0','/xCtyGEn5VGMKV7S9xRbQJyojgYf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091738',6.4,43433,'en','Peggy Sue Got Married','At her 25th high school reunion, Peggy Sue faints and awakens in 1960—back in her senior year, before her marriage and all her regrets. Given a second chance to relive her youth, she must decide whether to change the choices that shaped her life or embrace the past that made her who she is.','/tfuQcvQmURiMqB2VPwytU3cPpEm.jpg','1986-10-10',103,'Released','Knowing what you know now, what would you do differently?','Peggy Sue Got Married',10013,4.8873,6.1,'091_NXuANgg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9703,_binary '\0','/jBfHr0cZqHXbORe7g6tDKB16MhL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091757',6,10264,'en','Pirates','The adventures of pirate Captain Red and his first mate Frog.','/cuSnexGO0vq0ynefeHJvSwGYPU2.jpg','1986-05-08',124,'Released','Our Ship\'s Highly-Trained Staff Awaits You.','Pirates',11483,3.3419,6.322,'LsGsNLt3Jr0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9704,_binary '\0','/lLvIoN4fHSrmOuK0CvVgkqA6Sa4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091759',7.5,4727,'ru','Письма мертвого человека','In a desolate world following the nuclear apocalypse, a scholar helps a small group of adults and children survive in the basement of a former museum of history. In his mind, he writes letters to his only son that will never be read and tries to find shreds of hope in his new reality.','/uPfG3ZnXCdRdxZ88DqMe0UuIwBS.jpg','1986-12-12',83,'Released','Remember your humanity and forget the rest.','Dead Man\'s Letters',73920,2.4719,7,'anz6k4WTDtY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9705,_binary '\0','/vr0gwTvit5pTZs2wXOkvpsxCfli.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091763',8,477077,'en','Platoon','As a young and naive recruit in Vietnam, Chris Taylor faces a moral crisis when confronted with the horrors of war and the duality of man.','/m3mmFkPQKvPZq5exmh0bDuXlD9T.jpg','1986-12-19',120,'Released','The first casualty of war is innocence.','Platoon',792,13.2383,7.747,'R8weLPF4qBQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9706,_binary '\0','/zIp8rPr0UzL2QhB5JCU04DqPeHQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091777',5.4,52507,'en','Police Academy 3: Back in Training','When police funding is cut, the Governor announces he must close one of the academies. To make it fair, the two police academies must compete against each other to stay in operation. Mauser persuades two officers in Lassard\'s academy to better his odds, but things don\'t quite turn out as expected...','/pBxGgWSR0CMaCVMA2kQS5MWU1z3.jpg','1986-03-20',84,'Released','Run for cover!','Police Academy 3: Back in Training',12118,8.1275,5.8,'oodRggGr_l0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9707,_binary '\0','/qTR9c6R2p4sgax4D2npccHrv4Ze.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091778',5.7,33186,'en','Poltergeist II: The Other Side','The Freeling family move in with Diane\'s mother in an effort to escape the trauma and aftermath of Carol Anne\'s abduction by the Beast. But the Beast is not to be put off so easily and appears in a ghostly apparition as the Reverend Kane, a religious zealot responsible for the deaths of his many followers. His goal is simple - he wants the angelic Carol Anne.','/tVQPv69XWIgzF5n1MRrTuhPyNr5.jpg','1986-05-23',91,'Released','\"They\'re back.\"','Poltergeist II: The Other Side',11133,5.3641,6,'mjhr8EdGyD0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9708,_binary '\0','/8ekazzF0sUaC8pfKdk5hL2j0uWl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091786',5.7,3785,'en','Power','Pete St. John is a powerful and successful political consultant, with clients spread around the country. When his long-time friend and client Ohio senator Sam Hastings decides to quit politics, he is rapidly drafted to help with the campaign of the man destined to succeed him, unknown and mysterious businessman Jerome Cade...','/6sj8HFCODqHah4DTCWs8uPp4IyL.jpg','1986-01-31',111,'Released','More seductive than sex… More addictive than any drug… More precious than gold. And one man can get it for you. For a price.','Power',46948,2.3292,5.8,'qjv6Z9QmoAw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9709,_binary '\0','/bZneRu42OnfMJzQJ0Mn39kCI5v3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091790',6.7,96458,'en','Pretty in Pink','Andie is an outcast, hanging out either with her older boss, who owns the record store where she works, or her quirky high school classmate Duckie, who has a crush on her. When one of the rich and popular kids at school, Blane, asks Andie out, it seems too good to be true. As Andie starts falling for Blane, she begins to realize that dating someone from a different social sphere is not easy.','/jeFJyzJBufJexpOuywuPp8q2tCJ.jpg','1986-02-28',97,'Released','Blane\'s a pretty cool guy. Andie\'s pretty in pink. And Duckie\'s pretty crazy.','Pretty in Pink',11522,6.3074,6.7,'KWraqt9FL2o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9710,_binary '\0','/vR1566wspGHecSjMhOHRnPT6Xv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091794',6.9,1677,'ja','プロジェクトA子','Earth. The not too distant future. A city is miraculously reborn just sixteen years after being completely destroyed by a giant meteor. At the prestigious Graviton High School for Girls, two new students are introduced. A-ko and her ditzy sidekick, C-ko.','/tnOzcaxpL8PR1nIB02JgMqr97hb.jpg','1986-06-21',83,'Released','For these three high-school students, repelling an alien invasion is as easy as a-b-c!','Project A-Ko',42025,2.7336,6.7,'YD4HTrCy6Ik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9711,_binary '\0','/vzkuGQe1596nXK5pluip9OHwFXF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091799',5.5,18690,'en','Psycho III','When Maureen Coyle, a suicidal nun who resembles Norman\'s former victim, Marion Crane, arrives at the motel, all bets are off and \"Mother\" is less than happy.','/tgV4eeW0X7os7p3SYbNwDI0NYGa.jpg','1986-04-02',93,'Released','Norman Bates is back to normal. But mother\'s off her rocker again.','Psycho III',12662,5.0846,5.669,'TZ0ms3z6ey0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9712,_binary '\0','/jhUg1Q2mBddGGt5BpAlmQHNFKdi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091810',6.1,2501,'en','Frog Dreaming','American boy Cody lives in Australia with his guardian, Gaza. Cody is very imaginative, inventive and inquisitive. He comes across some strange events happening in Devil\'s Knob national park associated with an aboriginal myth about \"frog dreamings\". Cody tries to investigate...','/7S0VFsQw0QDQ2QeEPLtSFxQZ76C.jpg','1986-05-01',93,'Released','Cody is an adventurer who is about to explore the depths of a legend.','Frog Dreaming',25666,1.7477,5.6,'DEC_evPtrJo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9713,_binary '\0','/7YogkDxqrpmncoYnJP7c9nfVlxy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091814',5.7,5860,'en','Quicksilver','Jack Casey used to be a hot-shot stock market whiz kid. After a disastrous professional decision, his life in the fast lane is over. He loses his nerve and joins a speed delivery firm which relies on bicycles to avoid traffic jams of San Francisco, is attracted to a fellow bicycler, Terri, and befriends Hector, a budding entrepreneur. Can Jack regain his nerve and his self-respect, and rebuild his life on a more sound basis?','/9E5eUvyIJoygfmKX36EmoRvOMGg.jpg','1986-02-14',105,'Released','Kevin Bacon is Jack Casey. He traded in his three-piece suit for a ten-speed and the streets.','Quicksilver',21332,3.2249,5.6,'gPTu2F450sk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9714,_binary '\0','/y4Kw8lT0BEBHaEm4hqw12AKJNoZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091817',6.7,8092,'en','Rad','A BMX racer, who lives in a small town with his mother and sister, is faced with a tough decision, qualify for Helltrack or take his SATs in order to attend college.','/yg7TR7U4f2xRrVrM0IyDUGuFSHa.jpg','1986-03-21',93,'Released','A hometown kid on his BMX against the best in the world. At Helltrack... the heat is on.','Rad',13841,2.4712,6.543,'0EBi9mnLxBg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9715,_binary '\0','/A76sKlrRcAHhQ3OtKPMBcR9psFx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091818',5.5,2189,'en','Radioactive Dreams','After an atomic war Phillip Hammer and Marlowe Chandler have spent 15 years on their own in an bunker, stuffed with junk from the 40s and old detective novels. Now, 19 years old, they leave their shelter to find a world full of mutants, freaks and cannibals. They become famous detectives in the struggle for the two keys that could fire the last nuclear weapon.','/8eUEbWEpeE9xQ4ywv3Opos0atQw.jpg','1986-07-14',94,'Released','Meet Phillip and Marlowe, the post-nuclear private eyes. They\'re looking for good times and fast women. Their first case could be the world\'s last.','Radioactive Dreams',47342,1.4873,5.4,'aFl-TC2aTLE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9716,_binary '\0','/eJ1UkFvKCQUqVW5lswBMYMRKn4Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091828',5.6,41595,'en','Raw Deal','Mark Kaminsky is kicked out of the FBI for his rough treatment of a suspect. He winds up as the sheriff of a small town in North Carolina. FBI Chief Harry Shannon, whose son has been killed by a mobster named Patrovina, enlists Kaminsky in a personal vendetta with a promise of reinstatement into the FBI if Patrovina is taken down. To accomplish this, he must go undercover and join Patrovina\'s gang.','/1Y2GgDyNJFELoSIVlRhFQSs23Uo.jpg','1986-06-04',106,'Released','The system gave him a raw deal. Nobody gives him a raw deal.','Raw Deal',2099,6.9421,5.854,'FL0Al0ZVjsM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9717,_binary '\0','/gZrZnrHTA8NsLnvM673hLRAknt6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091829',5.2,7620,'en','Rawhead Rex','Ireland will never be the same after Rawhead Rex, a particularly nasty demon, is released from his underground prison by an unwitting farmer. The film follows Rex\'s cross country rampage, while a man struggles to stop it.','/vIEaIVlV5XRIUVoaptsymIexaL2.jpg','1986-10-01',89,'Released','He\'s pure evil, pure power, pure terror','Rawhead Rex',13511,3.21,5.22,'06YwV1KRQWk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9718,_binary '\0','/jfDTQuovn57QIBvoGDom6FNQrkl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091830',7.6,12263,'fr','Le Rayon vert','A lonely Parisian woman comes to terms with her isolation and anxieties during a long summer vacation.','/1E3pliSC7lXWw6zJhMvG6ba0UNX.jpg','1986-08-29',99,'Released',NULL,'The Green Ray',54898,3.3577,7.5,'D7mPj2AkFfI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9719,_binary '\0','/zluy2WXlLamRPHe8OaTFShRfrmY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091836',5.4,3326,'en','Reform School Girls','Jenny is sent to a women\'s reform school. It is run by evil warden Sutter and her henchwoman Edna. Jenny will stop at nothing to escape but she also has to deal with Charlie the bully.','/vcAnrOJgGsXDCas67P4VPLVVBkA.jpg','1986-08-22',94,'Released','So young... So bad... So what?!','Reform School Girls',29492,3.2641,5.575,'Ctz8Qjup1Rk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9720,_binary '\0','/vfphkP2UBaOTT7RB9puXNeI8GJ3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091837',7.6,1851,'it','Regalo di Natale','On Christmas night, four estranged friends reunite to rip off a wealthy businessman in a game of poker, but old grudges get in the way.','/i2UDcAcNK9sXxt5e0kOFTQRGt7v.jpg','1986-10-04',101,'Released',NULL,'Christmas Present',61218,1.1358,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9721,_binary '\0','/5j2AmYFIDV7jpEIEFVthUzNgeWE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091846',6.9,1322,'en','Return to Mayberry','After being away for awhile, Andy Taylor returns home to Mayberry to visit Opie, now an expectant father. While there he ends up helping Barney Fife mount a campaign for sheriff.','/cn6O2M0C4C0LqT9iyfwmOxKgtCd.jpg','1986-04-13',95,'Released',NULL,'Return to Mayberry',151937,1.3293,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9722,_binary '\0','/aAFs22BozLKNlXaUnQXnMKhQxgD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091859',6.6,5432,'en','Rita, Sue and Bob Too','On a run-down Bradford council estate, teenagers Rita and Sue both share a job babysitting for Bob and Michelle\'s children. On the way home one night, Bob takes Rita and Sue up to a deserted, countryside landscape. Knowing what he has in mind, the girls are only too happy to oblige and both have a sexual encounter with him that becomes a regular occurrence.','/bNofq5QmwFeFTILeUOzwG9hPe1X.jpg','1987-05-20',94,'Released','Thatcher\'s Britain with her knickers down','Rita, Sue and Bob Too',18125,2.0058,6.2,'g8Ebm541gSk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9723,_binary '\0','/rQehKh69FjD7m4uAlXab0JGCWZT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091860',6.8,23765,'en','River\'s Edge','A group of high-school friends must come to terms with the fact that one of them, Samson, killed another, Jamie. Faced with the brutality of death, each must decide whether to turn their friend in to the police, or to help him escape the consequences of his dreadful deed.','/bT68aKa9d7zDF7Z8MaskbWBRqzb.jpg','1986-10-10',100,'Released','Which was worse? The murder or what came after?','River\'s Edge',21309,4.3111,6.571,'e44kb0lDpk4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9724,_binary '\0','/7BawlYbO8j434ovY0xTHpaNNE0Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091867',7.2,53136,'en','A Room with a View','When Lucy Honeychurch and chaperon Charlotte Bartlett find themselves in Florence with rooms without views, fellow guests Mr Emerson and son George step in to remedy the situation. Meeting the Emersons could change Lucy\'s life forever but, once back in England, how will her experiences in Tuscany affect her marriage plans?','/5xRAqywVo6tNUNQbAESGVP930la.jpg','1986-03-07',117,'Released','An Edwardian Romance','A Room with a View',11257,5.8228,6.9,'DgZkCc3xFl4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9725,_binary '\0','/qhYUFeyu05eBb9kmS9LStql8P53.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091869',6.9,2143,'de','Rosa Luxemburg','Polish socialist and Marxist Rosa Luxemburg works tirelessly in the service of revolution in early 20th century Poland and Germany. While Luxemburg campaigns for her beliefs, she is repeatedly imprisoned as she forms the Spartacist League offering a new vision for Germany.','/xsbuAzu2ZsZsV0hROoiarPTOsPv.jpg','1986-04-10',122,'Released',NULL,'Rosa Luxemburg',55562,1.6087,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9726,_binary '\0','/dVJBibP6PzGm2RsegzUMLDjk8Uc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091875',6.5,17633,'en','Running Scared','Two street-wise Chicago cops have to shake off some rust after returning from a Key West vacation to pursue a drug dealer that nearly killed them in the past.','/btSCLq1vijy0fYO3dcIlUGb1uuI.jpg','1986-06-27',107,'Released','Two of Chicago\'s finest?','Running Scared',15698,4.7634,6.1,'ZTtq9sEHaGo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9727,_binary '\0','/pLuVm0Y37m2uuztLoaQbfimipqN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091877',6.9,33403,'en','Ruthless People','Sam Stone hates his wife Barbara so much that he wants her dead. He\'s ecstatic when she\'s taken by a duo of kidnappers who want $500,000 ransom in exchange for her life. Fully intending to ignore every one of the kidnappers\' demands in the hopes that they do him a favor and murder her for him, the two confused kidnappers have to figure out how they\'re going get their money, and what they\'re going to do with the overbearing Barbara.','/fA3f8bsXoVbIALq4EdiAwptF1ws.jpg','1986-06-26',94,'Released','Sam Stone\'s wife has just been kidnapped... And he doesn\'t want her back!','Ruthless People',12151,5.4867,6.6,'JjFhnqo9nQI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9728,_binary '\0','/6DSXD0cSOOQJd9YX7KUekv6bKLr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091886',7.3,25753,'en','Salvador','In 1980, an American journalist covering the Salvadoran Civil War becomes entangled with both the leftist guerrilla groups and the right-wing military dictatorship while trying to rescue his girlfriend and her children.','/c5JgUmzN7syTFy9suwoHF3vhNsN.jpg','1986-04-23',123,'Released','Dateline: 1980, El Salvador. Correspondent: Richard Boyle, Photojournalist - Guatemala, Iran, Vietnam, Chile, Belfast, Lebanon, Cambodia...','Salvador',6106,2.7269,7,'JyRHCEt4JHs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9729,_binary '\0','/rL1agLvoquKFIsPlXaMpD7XW9wH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091902',4.7,2377,'it','Schiave bianche: violenza in Amazzonia','A young woman seeks vengeance and finds love when her parents are killed in the Amazon and she is taken prisoner by an indigenous tribe of headhunters.','/bvRjoKZkHgZxP7I9QY45Gw8M5hE.jpg','1985-08-09',90,'Released','Only one thing kept her alive.','Amazonia: The Catherine Miles Story',28676,3.8666,6,'Hl5pA84_Imo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9730,_binary '\0','/i0qppKk3364NFS9zxTtYYS27vbS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091911',5.8,1543,'it','Scuola di ladri','Frenetic in its pacing and with miniscule character development, this trite slapstick farce stars three Italian comics - Paolo Villaggio, Lino Banfi, and Massimo Boldi as the idiot-nephews of a wealthy invalid (Enrico Maria Salerno). The uncle\'s plan is to teach the trio how to successfully steal for a living but the plan does not have a chance against their exaggerated ineptitude.','/oVqcXZoZmBRHhMhc3I00MtGwPmH.jpg','1986-09-25',96,'Released',NULL,'School of Thieves',38313,2.2277,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9731,_binary '\0','/wFVXz8Fc1jT2TXBVBvnz2WuPN1Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091920',5.8,1737,'en','Seize the Day','Tommy Wilhelm is a salesman. An honest, hard-working guy who has lost his job, his girlfriend, and left part of his sanity behind as he heads to New York to pick up the pieces of his life. He\'s always been able to sell, but caught in a downward spiral, he must, in addition, face the father who never really understood him, while trying to balance his newly precarious existence.','/41wKKe0aRYkqHdPDIsE3WJ9KxIG.jpg','1986-09-09',93,'Released',NULL,'Seize the Day',140071,2.1125,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9732,_binary '\0','/l97Sh8wzhPUaXeZElGEEe7rsQrd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091925',6,1575,'it','7 chili in 7 giorni','Two not very clever young doctors open a fitness center and promise to let people lose seven kilos in seven days. When the enterprise fails they open a gourmet restaurant.','/u9ASwuqvb6nliGsJ7zZB8ylvtkk.jpg','1986-12-18',105,'Released',NULL,'7 Kilos in 7 Days',43211,1.6029,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9733,_binary '\0','/bKFHdrSfQCHmJwajs647gmfRmSK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091934',3.3,6170,'en','Shanghai Surprise','Glendon Wasey is a fortune hunter looking for a fast track out of China. Gloria Tatlock is a missionary nurse seeking the curing powers of opium for her patients. Fate sets them on a hectic, exotic, and even romantic quest for stolen drugs. But they are up against every thug and smuggler in Shangai.','/8zsU3Vq9FG9Q0kTEYrl0CWDlvX2.jpg','1986-08-29',97,'Released','A romantic adventure for the dangerous at heart.','Shanghai Surprise',58048,3.1744,4.28,'NbW06buYw0Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9734,_binary '\0','/aqUYYwKMNRzmqvkBvNM1gqRerb1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091939',6.7,17872,'en','She\'s Gotta Have It','The story of Nola Darling\'s simultaneous sexual relationships with three different men is told by her and by her partners and other friends. All three men wanted her to commit solely to them; Nola resists being \"owned\" by a single partner.','/qiJuXvPONqTSSnzhbCBqE7EotV.jpg','1986-08-08',84,'Released','A seriously sexy comedy.','She\'s Gotta Have It',27995,3.3568,6.6,'Pd9oTGr_1DA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9735,_binary '\0','/ce8iO3sSv4CCoesn3uiSQXofkbM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091943',7.2,2992,'en','Sherman\'s March','Documentarian Ross McElwee originally set out to make a travelogue of sorts tracing General William T. Sherman\'s infamous scorched-earth march through the Confederacy in the latter stages of the Civil War. Instead, haunted by a recent breakup with a girlfriend, McElwee ends up documenting his progress -- or lack thereof -- in starting a new relationship. His journey then becomes one of self-reflection and self-discovery rather than a historical/sociological exploration.','/55YscDYNXdffYwDGMrpveqnsa9d.jpg','1986-09-05',158,'Released','An improbable search for love','Sherman\'s March',41480,1.6877,6.3,'Oy6e2X7a0PU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9736,_binary '\0','/fytpsMuKVm8GynH0n3DCzIBp092.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091949',6.6,71548,'en','Short Circuit','After a lightning bolt zaps a robot named Number 5, the lovable machine starts to think he\'s human and escapes the lab. Hot on his trail is his designer, Newton, who hopes to get to Number 5 before the military does. In the meantime, a spunky animal lover mistakes the robot for an alien and takes him in, teaching her new guest about life on Earth.','/e3eimdUK6lLe0iaSlLrYVQF3yeL.jpg','1986-05-09',98,'Released','Something wonderful has happened... No. 5 is alive.','Short Circuit',2605,7.7733,6.652,'nxu3Z920Yz8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9737,_binary '\0','/pLdutWHlPIHf7ldH31akiVLUHQQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091954',7,37269,'en','Sid and Nancy','January 1978. After their success in England, the punk rock band Sex Pistols venture out on their tour of the southern United States. Temperamental bassist Sid Vicious is forced by his band mates to travel without his troubled girlfriend, Nancy Spungen, who will meet him in New York. When the band breaks up and Sid begins his solo career in a hostile city, the turbulent couple definitely falls into the depths of drug addiction.','/wHzCbMCfipDJ38GW5IyBTWDflMz.jpg','1986-09-12',114,'Released','Love Kills.','Sid and Nancy',14924,4.8583,6.7,'TubehkbjOuI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9738,_binary '\0','/h4sfaayNQ97lIrOlKx72oNV8Pmj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091969',5.3,7956,'en','Slaughter High','Eight different people are invited to their 10-year high school reunion at their now-closed down high school where a former student, disfigured from a prank gone wrong, is there to seek revenge.','/n6FWYMoU7Plpz4In9AtYdla5HAT.jpg','1986-11-14',91,'Released','Where the student body is going to pieces.','Slaughter High',27886,2.5066,5.8,'Ln2n9ZyUflA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9739,_binary '\0','/ihrT3E8ijkmayIotl8ivRtHGYfT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091975',7,1546,'en','A Smoky Mountain Christmas','A country-western singer on a trip through the Tennessee mountains runs into a reclusive backwoodsman — and a witch.','/aSId7LLral6TWDuLTCryAigbXbS.jpg','1986-12-14',94,'Released',NULL,'A Smoky Mountain Christmas',60629,2.446,5.9,'tBRRjeitUhM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9740,_binary '\0','/oFUDnSUG8nPZ3V3yr21kQp3colL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091981',4.8,5495,'en','Solarbabies','In a future in which most water has disappeared from the Earth, we find a group of children, mostly teenagers, who are living at an orphanage, run by the despotic rulers of the new Earth. The group in question plays a hockey based game on roller skates and is quite good. It has given them a unity that transcends the attempts to bring them to heel by the government. Finding an orb of special power, they find it has unusual effects on them. They escape from the orphanage (on skates) and try to cross the wasteland looking for a place they can live free as the storm-troopers search for them and the orb.','/vKNdxHrWTmG80WXdmLWM6YddZvP.jpg','1986-11-26',94,'Released','From a distant star a powerful and mystical force comes to Earth. And for those brave enough to follow, it will change their lives forever.','Solarbabies',36677,2.2347,5.3,'Rw4GR_byjEE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9741,_binary '\0','/wvbrMf8tg2HXLGfIb0tYWgkdkuE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091982',5.8,2118,'fr','Le Solitaire','In Paris , Commissioner Stan Jalard and Inspector Simon Lecache plan to quit the police to go and enjoy a more peaceful life in the West Indies. In a nightclub, during a routine visit, they spot Schneider, a dreaded gangster and public enemy. At the time of his arrest, Simon is killed at close range by the criminal. Stan then decides to stay in the police to avenge Simon. Being the godfather of Christian, Simon\'s son, who sometimes lives in a boarding school, sometimes at home, he takes charge of his education. Two years later, Stan has been promoted, and he\'s told that Schneider had resurfaced in the capital. A long hunt begins.','/2He4IwsJF6bjr7kjDeE5ngJbym0.jpg','1987-03-18',100,'Released',NULL,'The Loner',72655,1.7785,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9742,_binary '\0','/cAx07D2s8uCwy1YtJTTMJAlaFDo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091983',6.9,24321,'en','Something Wild','A free-spirited woman \"kidnaps\" a yuppie for a weekend of adventure. But the fun quickly takes a dangerous turn when her ex-con husband shows up.','/344lhBozqFWKxBb4fp6azYQMLEy.jpg','1986-11-07',114,'Released','Something Different. Something Daring. Something Dangerous.','Something Wild',11300,4.9622,6.6,'r_B6fLIdhgo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9743,_binary '\0','/q3vACaClas2wNzWgGCkkQgNiifg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091990',4.4,4738,'en','Sorority House Massacre','Upon joining a sorority, Beth is plagued by nightmares of a knife-wielding killer, when her past comes back to haunt her.','/oU2i9iabbzBbDdKxv1PqQjoqSbw.jpg','1986-10-10',74,'Released','They\'ve pledged to be sisters... to the end.','Sorority House Massacre',40760,1.7936,4.6,'-iOtUe9MvqE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9744,_binary '\0','/1lzCgkvj10jSMK3aXopNNAETTXH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091991',5.3,9957,'en','Soul Man','A white prospective grad student\'s affluent family won\'t pay his way through law school, so he takes tanning pills to darken his skin in order to qualify for an African-American scholarship at Harvard. He soon gets more than he bargained for, as he begins to learn what life is really like for blacks in America.','/d6jh6qiowC4QHePBgpy7Zrytbba.jpg','1986-10-24',104,'Released','He didn\'t give up, he got down.','Soul Man',12278,3.3887,5.257,'z2zMrjBLwn8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9745,_binary '\0','/cX6eYmP3juvsf3TA4hMN7ZNdHvu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0091993',5.8,15665,'en','SpaceCamp','Andie Bergstrom, an astronaut eagerly awaiting her first trip to space, runs a summer camp for teenagers with her NASA-employed husband, Zach. One night during an engine test, Andie and four teenage campers are accidentally shot into space. Together, the group -- which includes Kathryn, a pilot-in-training, and Tish, a ditz with a perfect memory -- must work together to operate the spacecraft and return home.','/wWw2yJHQxqATtXw4roPDVuoE9Xs.jpg','1986-06-06',107,'Released','The stars belong to a new generation.','SpaceCamp',13766,2.8631,5.9,'ISPHII9F1nQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9746,_binary '\0','/xQZQhtkRM0zR50LovaGaSb3KtzZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092003',5.9,1685,'en','Stagecoach','Story follows a stagecoach ride through Old West Apache territory. On board are a cavalry man\'s pregnant wife, a prostitute with a broken heart, a Marshal taking in his prisoner Johnny Ringo, a crooked gambler, and the infamous Doc Holliday','/4oMOufGBtSbh4o2lgSRACBDdP2s.jpg','1986-05-18',100,'Released',NULL,'Stagecoach',33410,2.2098,5.4,'4pohPIhANlM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9747,_binary '\0','/yjGllQUm28R4X9xD9T5xMszirgw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092005',8.1,494878,'en','Stand by Me','After learning that a boy their age has been accidentally killed near their rural homes, four boys decide to go see the body. Gordie, Vern, Chris, and Teddy encounter a mean junk man and a marsh full of leeches, but they also learn more about one another and their very different home lives. Just a lark at first, the boys\' adventure evolves into a defining event in their lives.','/vz0w9BSehcqjDcJOjRaCk7fgJe7.jpg','1986-08-08',89,'Released','\"If I could only have one food to eat for the rest of my life?\" \"That\'s easy. Pez. Cherry flavor Pez. No question about it.\"','Stand by Me',235,15.0348,7.835,'2rBenGsz23E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9748,_binary '\0','/hF59zEHvSWTbIJvhzeG6qhmVWHP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092006',3.5,1390,'en','Star Crystal','Crew members aboard a space ship encounter an alien life form intent on killing them.','/hPi0JjIctx5yo7pEJwkXdDJOeTT.jpg','1986-03-01',91,'Released','...In Space scientists have discovered a new life form...they are about to wish they hadn\'t...','Star Crystal',69900,1.3056,4.2,'V-dia_4jIBo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9749,_binary '\0','/2LiU13aDAWpU2mX25JdacTzBnyr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092007',7.3,97637,'en','Star Trek IV: The Voyage Home','When a huge alien probe enters the galaxy and begins to vaporize Earth\'s oceans, Kirk and his crew must travel back in time in order to bring back whales and save the planet.','/xY5TzGXJOB3L9rhZ1MbbPyVlW5J.jpg','1986-11-26',118,'Released','Star date: 1986. How on Earth can they save the future?','Star Trek IV: The Voyage Home',168,10.2943,7.2,'4IJVV2sjPT8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9750,_binary '\0','/biiHSHno73E3kzOgsyxsBoRzPzt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092035',5.8,3206,'en','Sweet Liberty','Michael Burgess is an academic who has written a scholarly book on the American Revolution which Hollywood has bought the film rights to. The arrival of the film crew seriously disrupts him as actors want to change their characters, directors want to re-stage battles, and he becomes infatuated with Faith who will play the female lead in the movie. At the same time, he is fighting with his crazy mother who thinks the Devil lives in her kitchen, and his girlfriend who is talking about commitment.','/asLW0DZYI0BFc1o4IiMVmgV9i1P.jpg','1986-05-16',106,'Released','Michael Burgess wrote a book about the American Revolution. Now, Hollywood\'s come to his town to make a movie of it -- Plunging him into a summer of madness.','Sweet Liberty',66600,1.6069,5.356,'DsH_rZjkP3A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9751,_binary '\0','/omAUa9d00QAYwzg5E6li75TKeH6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092038',7.1,1478,'en','Sword of Gideon','Chronicles a Mossad team hand picked to hunt down the terrorists involved in the 1972 Munich Olympic massacre of Israeli athletes.','/xohJrnuUGlij7raPx9wcA6xY6GO.jpg','1986-09-01',173,'Released','What drives men of peace to commit acts of vengeance!','Sword of Gideon',43626,1.5809,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9752,_binary '\0','/A9ajUmVZ6CtI04BeleMFEkKNtlC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092042',5.6,2144,'en','Tai-Pan','The film begins following the British victory of the first Opium War and the seizure of Hong Kong. Although the island is largely uninhabited and the terrain unfriendly, it has a large port that both the British government and various trading companies believe will be useful for the import of merchandise to be traded on mainland China, a highly lucrative market.','/inAgrq4xzZeMUb2OMViLTtwGRho.jpg','1986-11-07',127,'Released','Smuggler. Prince. Murderer. Father. Sinner. Saint.','Tai-Pan',29584,2.1653,5.3,'6ptnPIEkosY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9753,_binary '\0','/oq8HM9TOSbH54Xy0OBJGzYrtUC7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092048',7.9,27426,'ja','タンポポ','In this humorous paean to the joys of food, a pair of truck drivers happen onto a decrepit roadside shop selling ramen noodles. The widowed owner, Tampopo, begs them to help her turn her establishment into a paragon of the \"art of noodle-soup making\". Interspersed are satirical vignettes about the importance of food to different aspects of human life.','/ArYdSuX3zY9fMsE4LqmBl7xJq5R.jpg','1985-11-23',115,'Released','The first Japanese Noodle Western.','Tampopo',11830,3.9833,7.8,'sur_pxcpuoE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9754,_binary '\0','/3cyjYtLWCBE1uvWINHFsFnE8LUK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092067',8,200707,'ja','天空の城ラピュタ','A young boy and a girl with a magic crystal must race against pirates and foreign agents in a search for a legendary floating castle.','/41XxSsJc5OrulP0m7TrrUeO2hoz.jpg','1986-08-02',125,'Released','One day, a girl came down from the sky…','Castle in the Sky',10515,12.7012,7.972,'6s_wR3uuWec','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9755,_binary '\0','/47HERRutkIUYreAyIYXqNv9H4kC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092068',6.8,4034,'fr','Tenue de soirée','A bisexual petty criminal named Bob encounters a married couple arguing in a bar. Bob breaks up the fight and proceeds to seduce first the wife and then the husband. Then Bob teaches the couple how to be burglars and they join him in his criminal exploits.','/3BYCKoekoV93YnkLB1of4D8gVTN.jpg','1986-04-23',84,'Released',NULL,'Ménage',3934,1.9654,6.6,'y7pHZL6Z-ko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9756,_binary '\0','/yQIEl9eYMgQ7BKv0wkISJmC38GM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092074',5.6,8664,'en','TerrorVision','After Stanley Putterman installs a state-of-the-art satellite dish in his backyard, a strange monster leaps off the screen and needs to feed on humans for survival. The Putterman children Sherman and Suzy—along with Suzy\'s metalhead boyfriend O.D.—are left to figure out what to do.','/9s9s2VchHi4gAiVGfFkrQyQLTzH.jpg','1986-02-14',85,'Released','People of Earth: Your planet is about to be destroyed... We\'re terribly sorry for the inconvenience.','TerrorVision',24194,3.0822,5.7,'d5vqoziQZRA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9757,_binary '\0','/5MMnUP4mzay6tVNZ8DF3HBeEUMX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092076',5.6,44604,'en','The Texas Chainsaw Massacre Part 2','A radio host is victimised by the notorious cannibal family while a former Texas Marshal hunts them.','/cO1Dvg7k87lHSPOdumn3ddJEKdX.jpg','1986-08-22',100,'Released','After a decade of silence... the buzzz is back.','The Texas Chainsaw Massacre Part 2',16337,12.2828,5.666,'VE49XnwIBck','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9758,_binary '\0','/3srkEkBA2o2eLrg392Zw8ic8vt0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092079',6,1994,'en','That\'s Life!','A wealthy architect struggles with a severe case of male menopause at the approach of his 60th birthday.','/opZSLqdoRoAIg6oW99iiNmrSgAp.jpg','1986-10-10',102,'Released','That\'s love. That\'s laughter. That\'s crazy. \"That\'s Life!\"','That\'s Life!',52961,1.8056,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9759,_binary '\0','/ouoi01NpFt3WxpfIwfOVQ9p8gKk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092085',6.4,5764,'en','Thrashin\'','Corey and his band of skater buddies sometimes make mischief, but they\'re more interested in girls and having fun on their boards than in getting into any real trouble. Notorious enemy crew the Daggers, led by Tommy Hook, get their kicks terrorizing the locals at Venice Beach. When Corey starts dating Tommy\'s kid sister Chrissy, the Daggers are furious. The boys then take their beef to the \"L.A. Massacre,\" a deadly skate race down a canyon road.','/7yq7P9bqtbMGkWoikQDegyepuDh.jpg','1986-08-29',93,'Released','It\'s not a kid\'s game anymore.','Thrashin\'',35371,3.5885,6.3,'MKyZ7R-tDQg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9760,_binary '\0','/sBt6tZpyzgZxc7woBn6vhyHEX1u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092086',6.5,93530,'en','¡Three Amigos!','A trio of unemployed silent film actors are mistaken for real heroes by a small Mexican village in search of someone to stop a malevolent bandit.','/dUNRnhl2cwjFJ6TOsaPJmZeMZ0S.jpg','1986-12-12',103,'Released','They\'re down on their luck and up to their necks in señoritas, margaritas, banditos and bullets!','¡Three Amigos!',8388,7.2792,6.341,'3tFFFUw4D5I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9761,_binary '\0','/dBgxEkWe17R0AJDAvAhpeVELQx2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092099',7,561179,'en','Top Gun','For Lieutenant Pete \'Maverick\' Mitchell and his friend and co-pilot Nick \'Goose\' Bradshaw, being accepted into an elite training school for fighter pilots is a dream come true. But a tragedy, as well as personal demons, will threaten Pete\'s dreams of becoming an ace pilot.','/xUuHj3CgmZQ9P2cMaqQs4J0d4Zc.jpg','1986-05-16',110,'Released','Up there with the best of the best.','Top Gun',744,24.304,7.072,'ArOMXELHiLw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9762,_binary '\0','/gzA2s08vclqcnmXQ9lwakEUoGfx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092105',6.3,8497,'en','Tough Guys','Harry Doyle and Archie Lang are two old-time train robbers, who held up a train in 1956 and have been incarcerated for thirty years. After serving their time, they are released from jail and have to adjust to a new life of freedom. and soon realize that they still have the pizzazz when, picking up their prison checks at a bank, they foil a robbery attempt.','/eDp0MPUSCeXrIziaZC65iUHISLs.jpg','1986-10-03',104,'Released','They\'re Out To Teach A New World Some Old Tricks.','Tough Guys',11038,2.87,6.019,'AqFsg6eLvLU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9763,_binary '\0','/e0djmN1YD6NcbLX6T0nSNKIvrrT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092106',7.2,45187,'en','The Transformers: The Movie','The Autobots must stop a colossal planet-consuming robot who goes after the Autobot Matrix of Leadership. At the same time, they must defend themselves against an all-out attack from the Decepticons.','/xJ5W0mOAWCVaXmU0pBZh4NjSRv2.jpg','1986-08-08',85,'Released','Beyond good. Beyond evil. Beyond your wildest imagination.','The Transformers: The Movie',1857,25.9983,7.151,'OtgnqWLYqHo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9764,_binary '\0','/7z70u9gAVTeUfSIxf2jbiDZTry1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092112',5.9,9493,'en','Trick or Treat','Eddie Weinbauer, a metalhead teen who is bullied at school, looks to his heavy metal superstar idol, Sammi Curr, for guidance. When Curr is killed in a hotel fire, Eddie becomes the recipient of the only copy of his unreleased album, which, when played backwards, brings the rocker back to life. As Halloween approaches, Eddie begins to realize that this isn\'t only rock \'n roll...It\'s life and death.','/ycCrGbfuOEcKSCwxQeKA1VEPs7O.jpg','1986-10-24',97,'Released','What are you afraid of? It\'s only rock & roll.','Trick or Treat',25438,3.5623,6.1,'PXD_xfKv7MY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9765,_binary '\0','/oDKhYf1ROWqvvHUDOebNUQysuGx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092115',4.7,13000,'en','Troll','When a family moves into a San Francisco apartment, an opportunistic troll decides to make his move and take possession of little Wendy, thereby paving the way for new troll recruits, the first in his army that will take eventual control of the planet. We soon discover Torok is the ex-husband of Eunice St. Clair, a resident in the building who was married to Torok.','/rqU0HnCty94ds8e4At4TzEH3CcY.jpg','1986-01-17',83,'Released','Worlds of magic, mystery and menace.','Troll',33061,2.7963,5.1,'2LuiOcbDNKk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9766,_binary '\0','/7OrQ4XqjgAl830UY5BReLstzlA0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092116',6.5,1624,'it','Troppo forte','Oscar dreams of becoming an actor or a stuntman. To contact a manufacturer he stages an accident and consequently injures a young actress, then tries to limit the damage by taking the girl to his home.','/dSLGHuYPDMAoVebdl7OPPDXfqfO.jpg','1986-01-30',110,'Released',NULL,'Too Much',23273,2.2923,6.456,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9767,_binary '\0','/lhuqyVPpbsenpQfNYF2JGJotAfl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092117',7.3,8579,'en','True Stories','A small but growing Texas town, filled with strange and musical characters, celebrates its sesquicentennial and converge on a local parade and talent show.','/sngF8cskFWz2cig7b63ZaDNaQXr.jpg','1986-10-10',89,'Released','A Completely Cool, Multi-Purpose Movie.','True Stories',24798,2.0038,6.7,'5MIHT9d25wY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9768,_binary '\0','/rW50Vi80BfD1JRUvpXCAo0oQXDn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092133',5.1,4204,'en','Under the Cherry Moon','Two friends from Miami are in the French Riviera enjoying life by scamming money off of rich women. One day, they read about a young woman set to inherit $50 million from her father. At first, Tricky has Christopher Tracy talked into romancing her for her money, but in getting to know her, Christopher falls in love with her. This love comes between the brothers, and Tricky tells about the plan.','/82EvqDBW6CCQLt0hRyOQ7UI3ua3.jpg','1986-07-02',100,'Released','See It - Hear It - Feel It - Live It','Under the Cherry Moon',33345,2.1638,5.4,'Ri7GHE0hBNU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9769,_binary '\0','/9VU1cRrn2BeIYs8vMo276U9Hs8D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092144',6,1454,'fi','Uuno Turhapuro muuttaa maalle','Uuno\'s father-in-law councillor Tuura moves to the country with his wife and daughter Elisabeth. Uuno joins them when it turns out Tuura\'s mansion is on the construction site of a new road. Tuura however is set on preventing this.','/rDCARvhh12ss3cG1MuaqaEP90Ot.jpg','1986-08-29',106,'Released',NULL,'Uuno Turhapuro muuttaa maalle',62898,1.2468,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9770,_binary '\0','/d3zD3SZbi6mPSOt8BnLvo0OD3MF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092147',5.9,8283,'en','Vamp','Two fraternity pledges go to a sleazy bar in search of a stripper for their college friends, unaware it is occupied by vampires.','/fWXjESqmqU8QCrfWowVcdeC8Uij.jpg','1986-07-18',93,'Released','Ever have one of those nights?','Vamp',34223,4.0399,5.812,'pk39I43qto0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9771,_binary '\0','/l94l89eMmFKh7na2a1u5q67VgNx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092149',7.4,8862,'fi','Varjoja paratiisissa','Nikander, a rubbish collector and would-be entrepreneur, finds his plans for success dashed when his business associate dies. One evening, he meets Ilona, a down-on-her-luck cashier, in a local supermarket. Falteringly, a bond begins to develop between them.','/nj01hspawPof0mJmlgfjuLyJuRN.jpg','1986-10-17',74,'Released',NULL,'Shadows in Paradise',3,2.7825,7.265,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9772,_binary '\0','/1YtAKUcYHwJrGWaNJtQoGD2xKtP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092172',4.9,1272,'en','The Vindicator','An employee of a secret company operation becomes the victim of the company\'s special weapons project. He is transformed into a robotic killing machine that, because of his programming must destroy anything that comes near him.','/vgdqGHVBYQJX9QDuWjmrwbB54T1.jpg','1986-02-14',93,'Released','They thought they took his life...now he wants theirs. Invincible. Unstoppable. Indestructible. He\'s out on the street and out of control!','The Vindicator',3201,1.4278,4.6,'ncmbYrWdR80','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9773,_binary '\0','/n2fy22mgbsnUMf2UN5lgBMCytF2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092173',5.8,1279,'en','Violets Are Blue','After fifteen years of traveling around the world, Gussie, a famous photographer, returns to the Maryland coastal resort where she grew up. She meets her high school sweetheart, Henry, who is now married and running the local newspaper he inherited from his father. An awkward and tension-filled romance ensues.','/lszTi2XNnUfXgVg96ILSGxJqfaJ.jpg','1986-04-04',88,'Released','There\'s a summer you\'ll always remember, and a hope that if you go back, it will all happen again.','Violets Are Blue',215875,1.861,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9774,_binary '\0','/nRXJrvVhNolzfQrwr1E9LDjRWXn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092206',6.2,2951,'en','The Whistle Blower','A war veteran tries to investigate the murder of his son who was working as a Russian translator for the British intelligence service during the Cold War. He meets a web of deception and paranoia that seems impenetrable...','/zmkhdouM05tCQDIEQVqKwpK2NGh.jpg','1986-11-21',100,'Released',NULL,'The Whistle Blower',25720,4.5106,5.8,'gQlY51oKMMQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9775,_binary '\0','/e42onq7kRUxYIKdGY3HF4rLQ9Z7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092214',6.1,16056,'en','Wildcats','High school track coach Molly McGrath knows just as much about football as anyone else on the planet. When a football coach\'s position becomes vacant, she applies for the job, despite snickers from fellow staff members and her former husband.','/5uQc18I6Mfsg6plBb0VjDrzSZEa.jpg','1986-02-14',106,'Released','Her dream was to coach high school football. Her nightmare was Central High.','Wildcats',29355,3.3267,6.3,'QNkLFBTU6pU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9776,_binary '\0','/k27eOAX1DLy2ZjAfb88Z5OJBq6v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092225',5.8,3939,'en','Wisdom','Unable to find work after a past felony, graduate John Wisdom and his girlfriend embark on a cross-country bank-robbing spree in order to aid American farmers.','/jJiKZG7vauFCeax5Aj5fahrcKUO.jpg','1986-12-31',109,'Released','They\'re on the wrong side of the law for all the right reasons.','Wisdom',41090,1.5859,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9777,_binary '\0','/mBOl4RHVpIxIXaPapG6RIr3qH1Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092226',5.6,6954,'en','Wise Guys','Harry Valentini and Moe Dickstein are both errand boys for the Mob. When they lose $250,000, they are set up to kill each other. But they run off to Atlantic City and comedy follows.','/oN4xnH6SqigBlyTlOnOkZ2tdWAB.jpg','1986-04-17',92,'Released','What kind of guys gamble with the boss\'s money, swipe a killer\'s Cadillac, and party on the mob\'s credit card?','Wise Guys',31659,2.5483,5.4,'y7TKTypiIjw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9778,_binary '\0','/7zIDgoNUk5orB6nlWQMxYw8qQJp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092238',6.8,2686,'en','Working Girls','A lesbian college graduate, trying to bankroll her own photography business, works as a high-priced New York City escort.','/rNL99DhSMHPba0jdZ6BdbWhBJSZ.jpg','1987-02-27',93,'Released','All In A Day\'s Work.','Working Girls',96349,2.0639,6.2,'OKDIcqv3Kdk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9779,_binary '\0','/aaPPyLUQC1KkYjEPLqc8jBImZY5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092239',6.8,3558,'en','The Worst Witch','Mildred is one of the young girls at a prestigious witch academy. She can\'t seem to do anything right and is picked on by classmates and teachers. The headmistress of the school, Miss Cackle, has an evil twin sister who plans to destroy the school. Can Mildred foil the plan before the Grand Wizard comes to the Academy for a Halloween celebration you\'ll never forget?!!','/e1i5qV3z3538hO16OQWJlHgpZNI.jpg','1986-10-22',70,'Released','Things never go right for Mildred Hubble...','The Worst Witch',24054,3.5361,6.1,'dOZNE7IPUkc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9780,_binary '\0','/oRwBASyG34mwSpIR1CSao123Xi4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092240',5.9,22113,'en','The Wraith','Packard Walsh and his motorized gang control and terrorize an Arizona desert town where they force drivers to drag-race so they can \'win\' their vehicles. After Walsh beats the decent teenager Jamie Hankins to death after finding him with his girlfriend, a mysterious power creates Jake Kesey, an extremely cool motor-biker who has a car which is invincible. Jake befriends Jamie\'s girlfriend Keri Johnson, takes Jamie\'s sweet brother Bill under his wing and manages what Sheriff Loomis couldn\'t; eliminate Packard\'s criminal gang the hard way...','/vHrNnqqRYWzkkrJV8MtmUGgC4Kk.jpg','1986-10-01',93,'Released','He\'s not from around here...','The Wraith',10017,7.5205,6.4,'TTfy3obpWQU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9781,_binary '\0','/mgTZFhBGOE0Qyckynhm81CQLrP2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092263',7.4,29629,'cn','英雄本色','A reforming ex-gangster tries to reconcile with his estranged policeman brother, but the ties to his former gang are difficult to break.','/uxZIWxOm2yonHyjLARzW37aEZjF.jpg','1986-08-02',95,'Released','Brothers by blood. Enemies by chance. Killers by nature.','A Better Tomorrow',11471,6.2798,7.4,'P3c6MGMHTDQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9782,_binary '\0','/qRWe8QN18RjdTg3j9rchqze7yQ0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092264',6.3,1789,'cn','英雄無淚','The Thai government hires a group of Chinese mercenaries to capture a powerful drug lord from the Golden Triangle. The mercenaries manage to capture the drug lord, but soon find themselves pursued by his forces, and the forces of a bitter Thai officer. The Chinese mercenaries are vastly outnumbered, and as their numbers begin to dwindle, their desperation pulls them into a corner as their enemies close in on them.','/4pHMcQeumCxVur57XN79BelfQfo.jpg','1984-11-30',87,'Released','They didn\'t know the road to freedom goes through hell.','Heroes Shed No Tears',69161,2.432,6.4,'8Zf_K7jM0pg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9783,_binary '\0','/7BlCuxZ0MT2Ix2Wah48oo821QIT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092272',6.2,16035,'en','Youngblood','A skilled young hockey prospect hoping to attract the attention of professional scouts is pressured to show that he can fight if challenged during his stay in a Canadian minor hockey town. His on-ice activities are complicated by his relationship with the coach\'s daughter.','/SLQRH3AlTJHXk6ZuW0yMAelMlj.jpg','1986-01-31',110,'Released','The ice... The fire... The fight... To be the best.','Youngblood',17465,4.3947,6.2,'PVdMWqVQrV4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9784,_binary '\0','/gDw23uS6QucZLJhykU4OKPQVaD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092273',6.7,2346,'cn','原振俠與衛斯理','When Dr. Yuen attempts to rescue a girl about to be sacrificed by the Worm Tribe in the middle of a jungle in Thailand, he is damned with seven deadly \"blood curses\" and must return there to find a permanent cure.','/cRbK5H0nwALC2CyCPpKBHr4kgwf.jpg','1986-11-22',83,'Released','A show-stopping midnight movie!','The Seventh Curse',39900,3.3642,6.795,'jjLRY6kH9vQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9785,_binary '\0','/hFgqO7PCqGfJmVoasmKPaqgikR6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092288',5.2,2252,'en','The Zero Boys','A group of friends travel to a wilderness area to play a survival game. Soon they unexpectedly find themselves in a real-life survival situation.','/nYXu46nwTYsG5Uyp4ED3MVJemcB.jpg','1986-07-24',89,'Released','Dawn Of A New Breed Of Heroes','The Zero Boys',109213,1.6663,5.063,'CbIZtrOOv7k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9786,_binary '\0','/3hoeaioE7l9bmQqpdWeDk4TrvUa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092297',2.8,4144,'en','Zombie Nightmare','Tony Washington is killed in a hit-and-run after saving the local bodega clerk from robbers. Molly Mokembe is a Haitian voodou practitioner who brings him back as a zombi from a debt owed by Tony\'s late dad in an act of sacrifice that saved her. Jimbo, the kid that iced Tony, is embracing some new sadistic feelings. What follows is a revenge that can only be sated once all of those who were with Jimbo that night have had their due.','/4jC4ghLWYnnmh5auuY0Hj90288c.jpg','1987-10-13',89,'Released','The Wasted Ain\'t Wasted','Zombie Nightmare',31385,1.9897,3.383,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9787,_binary '\0','/a1vvx1yq2SytzIcVpiJMousNyZl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092298',5.2,2164,'en','Zone Troopers','American soldiers, led by The Sarge, are stuck behind Nazi enemy lines. As they make their way across the Italian countryside, they come across an alien spaceship that has crash-landed in the woods. The alien pilot is dead, but one of the ship\'s passengers is on the loose. As the GIs hunt down the alien by splitting into smaller groups, they\'re not only tracked by the Nazis, but also a whole host of other aliens come to save their stranded party.','/zi2E7woqsF9NaFNo13qySOfH3tg.jpg','1985-10-01',86,'Released','They Take War To A New Dimension.','Zone Troopers',17790,2.1031,5.4,'RdrBCBSyFRk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9788,_binary '\0','/9OHuCKzTFwLetq8dhgyG7XxcetB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092493',5.7,64945,'en','Crocodile Dundee II','Australian outback expert protects his New York love from gangsters who\'ve followed her down under.','/2Nf0xeDuToLHysdkWj3aT5r42rC.jpg','1988-05-19',111,'Released','The world\'s favorite adventurer is back for more. Much more!','Crocodile Dundee II',9396,6.7741,5.867,'564imYX8G-c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9789,_binary '\0','/AdSU7O4KhqqZuYadNAdWSEROSNg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092494',6.6,39510,'en','*batteries not included','In a soon to be demolished block of apartments, the residents resist the criminal methods used to force them to leave so a greedy tycoon can build his new skyscraper. When tiny mechanical aliens land for a recharge, they decide to stay and help out.','/8NkpnpdLd8J6zCR8ZGTeGTur4uO.jpg','1987-12-18',107,'Released','Five ordinary people needed a miracle. Then one night, Faye Riley left the window open.','*batteries not included',11548,5.1971,6.7,'ASWO43n3QkQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9790,_binary '\0','/sDGYsbLUC8bQc3WxwMIUxyD9amF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092497',7.6,2807,'en','Miss Marple: 4.50 from Paddington','Travelling on the 4.50 from Paddington, Mrs McGillicuddy witnesses a murder on a passing train - but where is the body?','/9injrauN55jBEmhNCLOw9Wxc6IV.jpg','1987-12-25',110,'Released',NULL,'Miss Marple: 4.50 from Paddington',499292,2.9325,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9791,_binary '\0','/rvpN5CrzCdwvwlBq0PDvoUYh9WE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092501',7,12756,'cn','A計劃續集','Dragon is now transferred to be the police head of Sai Wan district, and has to contend with a gangster kingpin, anti-Manchu revolutionaries, some runaway pirates, Manchu Loyalists and a corrupt police superintendent.','/oY6wOuPmeeDoKjPdPlMwwmDCYmA.jpg','1987-07-25',105,'Released','This A Is for Action!','Project A - Part II',21521,5.7855,7.124,'9MT6HKZpiQY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9792,_binary '\0','/bddWCMRxVW7e1VJCz3pEZug5oJx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092513',7,54925,'en','Adventures in Babysitting','When plans with her boyfriend fall through, high school senior Chris Parker ends up babysitting the Anderson kids, Brad and Sara. What should be a quiet night in, however, turns into a series of ridiculous exploits, starting when they leave the house to pick up Chris\' friend Brenda. Soon, Brad\'s buddy Daryl is involved, and the group must contend with car thieves, blues musicians and much more.','/8QiAj0Xw2UMeZMIIfZKeNoIsszs.jpg','1987-07-01',102,'Released','She thought babysitting was easy money - until she started hanging out with the Andersons.','Adventures in Babysitting',14367,4.9173,6.87,'4c5tGEJ-mH0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9793,_binary '\0','/ygEbwdcusmVKU0gj7hS0I1a6KOC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092516',5.1,3901,'it','Ænigma','The spirit of a comatose teenage girl possesses the body of a newcomer to her girls\' boarding school in order to enact bloody revenge against the elitist, lingerie-clad coeds responsible for her condition.','/peoWlwonqRSiD71gBf1PaGoLUn6.jpg','1987-12-30',90,'Released','They made a clown out of Kathy once too often!','Ænigma',40461,2.2002,5.3,'3Jyj_7JA7sY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9794,_binary '\0','/aDbMF0Fub5b5QtFzfeseolYJqxI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092530',3.9,1532,'en','The Falling','Three young friends who are on vacation in Spain and a NASA scientist must join forces to save themselves and the rest of the world from an alien menace.','/kHIP3l6p0lOdoQm2RQfMPySWQZY.jpg','1986-08-05',90,'Released','There is no place to hide','The Falling',52318,1.399,5,'MSxY8QtL_Lw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9795,_binary '\0','/rwD8N3wvfxcDBborM1BCZ6AiExZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092532',3.4,4763,'en','Alien from L.A.','When her archaeologist father disappears on an expedition, Wanda sets out to look for him. What she finds is a secret underground world, where no one believes in life on the surface and where she and her father are taken for spies.','/dTonC1wYMfdvbV82y0RHdVFO6ak.jpg','1988-02-26',87,'Released','The people at the center of the earth are about to get a visitor.','Alien from L.A.',31397,2.9317,3.5,'sLcSP7dzRyo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9796,_binary '\0','/xRE3wbcmV77CnqTiBXcHkogbmdd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092534',4.6,11665,'en','Allan Quatermain and the Lost City of Gold','After his brother Robeson disappears without a trace while exploring Africa in search of a legendary \'white tribe\', Allan Quatermain decides to follow in his footsteps to learn what became of him. Soon after arriving, he discovers the Lost City of Gold, controlled by the evil lord Agon, and mined by his legions of white slaves.','/fz9QrK7OF4EoQbdSO8KSPgJWiZB.jpg','1986-12-17',99,'Released','Richard Chamberlain returns in the sequel to \'King Solomon\'s Mines\'','Allan Quatermain and the Lost City of Gold',9710,4.5172,4.859,'h5IuW2hW5BI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9797,_binary '\0','/kHaMpmTDIDgBXkUXfYpwrF5dQ0q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092537',4.4,1652,'en','The Allnighter','Molly, Val and Gina are graduating college, but on their final night, frustrations are aired. Molly is still looking for real love and Val is beginning to doubt if that is what she has found. Gina is too busy videotaping everything to really notice. When the final party at Pacifica College kicks off, things do not go exactly as planned.','/wyXiYgMpV7gHmsWuness6Q1dRUb.jpg','1987-05-01',95,'Released','Who says you can\'t do it all in one night?','The Allnighter',37818,1.8026,4.7,'DG9q-D69gx0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9798,_binary '\0','/4u3l3EXukBgKBCveVIxawZK3NSP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092545',5.9,1625,'en','Amazing Grace and Chuck','Average American boy Chuck Murdock goes on a school outing to a nuclear weapons facility, where he learns about the destructive power that sits at the fingertips of the military. Knowing that the world could end with the push of a button, he protests against nuclear war by walking out on his Little League team during a game. Chuck\'s stunt ends up in the local paper, and as the story snowballs, basketball star \"Amazing Grace\" Smith decides to boycott sports, too.','/uEp2ZuH22RN4uPXRX6Y40XCcqWF.jpg','1987-05-22',114,'Released','A boy raised a question, a man answered and the world paid attention.','Amazing Grace and Chuck',74340,1.8095,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9799,_binary '\0','/nAl380kw8qxE7FeSdbbghKuUlp6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092546',6.2,12180,'en','Amazon Women on the Moon','Centered on a television station which features a 1950s-style sci-fi movie interspersed with a series of wild commercials, wacky shorts and weird specials, this lampoon of contemporary life and pop culture skewers some of the silliest spectacles ever created in the name of entertainment.','/p77UlHHzyBUCKgdbLosrAnltDgw.jpg','1987-09-18',84,'Released','See amazing thrills, spine-tingling chills, and something else that rhymes with \"thrills\".','Amazon Women on the Moon',5709,5.1581,5.887,'d-xmbx56IkM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9800,_binary '\0','/vu7Pbne8Fwpkj1su4DuHW7WQH9k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092548',5,10861,'en','American Ninja 2: The Confrontation','On a remote Caribbean island, Army Ranger Joe Armstrong investigates the disappearance of several marines, which leads him to The Lion, a super-criminal who has kidnapped a local scientist and mass-produced an army of mutant Ninja warriors.','/4a4pASHNv68ZhfKJESekI2b6Dse.jpg','1987-05-01',90,'Released','The ultimate American fighting machine is back!','American Ninja 2: The Confrontation',25678,4.3698,5.557,'-fZ6oeDJ2tE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9801,_binary '\0','/2O3maDqfW2deVJRtONsYIEenXVD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092549',5.6,7601,'en','Miami Connection','In a world where ninjas dream of being rock stars and rock stars dream of being ninjas, a martial arts rock band goes up against a band of motorcycle ninjas who have tightened their grip on Florida\'s narcotics trade.','/pfysfJ8f1JcVVOeGQ5EZSxeSka8.jpg','1987-08-18',87,'Released','Greetings from the most dangerous jungle in the world: the streets of Miami.','Miami Connection',59558,1.2657,5.17,'VpZu69OB2KM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9802,_binary '\0','/7P7Gd5iiqISDI3UUsmryBUK8rMj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092550',7.5,6437,'fr','L\'Ami de mon amie','Middle-class Parisian suburbs: Blanche and Léa, office worker and student, meet and become friends. Léa is going out with Fabien, but is thinking of leaving him. Blanche falls for Léa\'s handsome and witty friend Alexandre, but is tongue-tied whenever she meets him. Léa goes on holiday and Blanche, still smitten with the dashing Alexandre, begins to get to know Fabien.','/obfJYuVMGFZRlMeNQklFlvhShFu.jpg','1987-08-26',103,'Released','The friends of my friends are my friends too','Boyfriends and Girlfriends',64544,2.9084,7.151,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9803,_binary '\0','/kmzcHzrzbD7KBd59tIrsRT2jB2H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092558',7.5,5248,'tr','Anayurt Oteli','Zebercet is an obsessive man living a monotonous life in a hotel with few customers. This monotonous life changes with the arrival of a woman who does not even give her name. She stays only one night in the room she has rented and leaves the hotel to come back a week later.','/q5GTHLyafufhjNjiH1AIunNwuu3.jpg','1987-10-23',101,'Released',NULL,'Motherland Hotel',96051,1.8687,6.826,'buBL_TioZF0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9804,_binary '\0','/9wvZY2VD2SaOV7fb8SMmq6W2A4t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092559',4.5,2327,'en','And God Created Woman','In this variation on director Vadim\'s own, more acclaimed Et Dieu Créa La Femme (1956, the same title in French), the vamp Robin Shea marries charming carpenter Billy Moran, only to get out of prison, but soon decides to seduce James Tiernan, who runs for state governor.','/taznRSey1cI962s1h8RqOmBDOY.jpg','1988-03-04',100,'Released','On the Seventh Day, He got Creative.','And God Created Woman',61651,3.5393,4.3,'0fC_-Q61uGQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9805,_binary '\0','/viDonz5uLmengw9RUAh3Rf65dQG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092563',7.2,105594,'en','Angel Heart','A down-and-out Brooklyn detective is hired to track down a singer on an odyssey that will take him through the desperate streets of Harlem, the smoke-filled jazz clubs of New Orleans, and the swamps of Louisiana and its seedy underworld of voodoo.','/h5v3wjJQNB7q2RntEnKDLhKtTFE.jpg','1987-03-06',113,'Released','It will scare you to your very soul.','Angel Heart',635,7.5097,7.12,'oLNHY7x055E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9806,_binary '\0','/5i9Et2apVwrfHoCMS3CxCbU1qf7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092576',6.6,10866,'it','Deliria','While a group of young actors rehearse a new musical about a mass murderer, a notorious psychopath escapes from a nearby insane asylum.','/m9oNxIzu4OLBolUCjEvZSY003Xc.jpg','1987-02-08',90,'Released','Theatre of Delirium.','Stage Fright',20465,2.2764,6.4,'BMoozoM84jU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9807,_binary '\0','/dkEcmpGqx9P3Qh7MFGBBM6kJe7S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092580',5.7,3396,'en','Aria','Ten short pieces directed by ten different directors, including Ken Russell, Jean-Luc Godard, Robert Altman, Bruce Beresford, and Nicolas Roeg. Each short uses an aria as soundtrack/sound, and is an interpretation of the particular aria.','/bt7zLQo5ca8UmQAmkdw29TwVPNi.jpg','1987-05-27',97,'Released','Ten great directors. One unforgettable film. The most sensual experience you\'ll ever have in a movie theater.','Aria',25832,1.9591,5.4,'Q0wMZtZbbkc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9808,_binary '\0','/oCNW4LhsW2K45WCsotpADQ91zE2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092585',5.2,4293,'en','Assassination','Jay Killon is the bodyguard of the recently elected US president, but he is assigned to the first lady (Lara Royce). Lara hates Killon so she does all she can to escape. The story complicates when someone tries to kill Lara.','/5wGAfVATbWAL6g91XMnMZeMKz5F.jpg','1987-01-09',88,'Released','A presidential bodyguard is assigned to protect an objecting first lady, as repeated attempts are made on her life.','Assassination',48686,2.3757,5.727,'LE6QoeownZM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9809,_binary '\0','/xaRQqHgXMZCyqLFGZ7E3oDZx0ki.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092593',8,38937,'fr','Au revoir les enfants','Au revoir les enfants tells a heartbreaking story of friendship and devastating loss concerning two boys living in Nazi-occupied France. At a provincial Catholic boarding school, the precocious youths enjoy true camaraderie—until a secret is revealed. Based on events from writer-director Malle’s own childhood, the film is a subtle, precisely observed tale of courage, cowardice, and tragic awakening.','/lXP90Vx7OcviBfbbokcaG6zVnPG.jpg','1987-10-07',105,'Released',NULL,'Au Revoir les Enfants',1786,4.1426,7.5,'qIaTVS7iQQk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9810,_binary '\0','/iFl8eN4vWcMNNozmJk8E7cLgeT9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092603',7.7,24229,'da','Babettes gæstebud','A French housekeeper with a mysterious past brings quiet revolution in the form of one exquisite meal to a circle of starkly pious villagers in late 19th century Denmark.','/3ibptSbnAHd0SUBnOKapNZQBpCl.jpg','1987-08-11',104,'Released','Artistic, sensual and sacred passions unite in Babette\'s Feast.','Babette\'s Feast',11832,4.4647,7.182,'H5w9skKcdnA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9811,_binary '\0','/i3aD438nOLOASyf1KOZrDZxQXfX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092605',6.4,21423,'en','Baby Boom','J.C. Wiatt is a talented and ambitious New York City career woman who is married to her job and working towards partner at her firm. She has a live-in relationship with Steven, a successful investment broker who, along with J.C., agreed children aren\'t part of the plan. J.C.\'s life takes an unexpected turn when a distant relative dies and the will appoints her the caretaker of their baby girl, Elizabeth. The baby\'s sudden arrival causes Steven to leave, breaking off their relationship. Juggling power lunches and powdered formula, she is soon forced off the fast track by a conniving colleague and a bigoted boss. But she won\'t stay down for long. She\'ll prove to the world that a woman can have it all and on her own terms too!','/4Jy5U4HITJWUDYJc1NGgJLIjbWz.jpg','1987-10-07',110,'Released','JC Wiatt, corporate powerhouse, just received an inheritance. And it sucks.','Baby Boom',11215,5.5175,6.403,'28OSjGVqOrQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9812,_binary '\0','/xn3U9S7fjsvUlbOGlZiipsWg2TL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092608',6,3786,'en','Back to the Beach','A former beach boy and his wife go to California to visit their daughter and become part of the new beach scene.','/geA6raOQ8rnEkX31r6a8mteJCW8.jpg','1987-08-07',92,'Released','All killer...no filler!!','Back to the Beach',26477,2.6595,5.9,'KyakKVH1zy4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9813,_binary '\0','/ewacCZjc710KBjxztABTwoWMken.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092610',6.4,51773,'en','Bad Taste','A team from the intergalactic fast food chain Crumb\'s Crunchy Delights descends on Earth, planning to make human flesh the newest taste sensation. After they wipe out the New Zealand town Kaihoro, the country’s Astro-Investigation and Defense Service (AIaDS) is called in to deal with the problem. Things are complicated due to Giles, an aid worker who comes to Kaihoro the same day to collect change from the residents. He is captured by the aliens, and AIaDS stages a rescue mission that quickly becomes an all-out assault on the aliens’ headquarters.','/msttMX3undIiaeJLZbMRq94v1bw.jpg','1987-12-11',91,'Released','Watch out Aliens... here comes Derek!','Bad Taste',9964,2.8143,6.3,'7IHwKJOZZ6U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9814,_binary '\0','/z2aPUvFw6Ge8huY9YYC60icToGV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092615',5.1,6133,'en','The Barbarians','Orphaned brothers Kutchek and Gore are adopted by a tribe led by Canary the owner of a powerful jewel. The evil Kadar wants both Canary and the jewel. Attacking the tribe he kidnaps Canary but the stone eludes him. The brothers are taken to be trained as gladiators and years later have grown to be VERY big. They escape and set off on a quest to find the jewel and rescue Canary.','/dYr9p8YOOw5gERVpg8cJHA5PsnY.jpg','1987-03-20',87,'Released','Warriors. Conquerors. Heroes.','The Barbarians',27551,3.2916,5.425,'QqLsIQ-6rGU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9815,_binary '\0','/whKhDehBYjOlJboo3by0JTSQsjv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092618',7.1,23747,'en','Barfly','Downtrodden writer Henry and distressed goddess Wanda aren\'t exactly husband and wife: they\'re wedded to their bar stools. But, they like each other\'s company—and Barfly captures their giddy, gin-soaked attempts to make a go of life on the skids.','/uAsAVy7yoMZ2r5ZBQQXw4PKX3JY.jpg','1987-09-02',100,'Released','Some people never go crazy. What truly horrible lives they must lead.','Barfly',10937,4.0621,6.882,'8USMIMdzaTA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9816,_binary '\0','/AqtnPJkwKq9gO9tecTGLbbnGt1q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092622',3.8,2138,'en','Bates Motel','A mentally disturbed man who roomed with the late Norman Bates at a psychiatric facility inherits the infamous Bates Motel after his death and attempts to fix it up as a respectable business.','/9RbbMBMjJDD2Su6ierduGT1rNf5.jpg','1987-07-05',95,'Released','There\'s always room for one more.','Bates Motel',86330,3.6444,4.5,'NrBxCSdw7Ns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9817,_binary '\0','/wHzZ3lj0TPSsmVYrGDXtY1RCGSl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092627',6.4,7936,'en','The Bedroom Window','Baltimore, Maryland. Sylvia sees a girl being attacked from her lover Terry\'s bedroom window. The assailant flees and his victim is saved. But that same night another girl is found murdered.','/7JT5mzLBuABKqDNvCvfnjrvYQC6.jpg','1987-01-16',114,'Released','A violent crime. A secret affair. A single witness.','The Bedroom Window',39074,3.4373,6.3,'MxcY_8t2Ns0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9818,_binary '\0','/cxzMbuaAMaZkM8q8vF27lfdK2yv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092632',6.1,9720,'en','The Believers','Mourning the accidental death of his wife and having just moved to New York with his young son, laconic police psychologist Cal Jamison is reluctantly drawn into a series of grisly, ritualistic murders involving the immolation of two youths.','/wMDOgjHoDdKKj3UNZzjP8AW0wxR.jpg','1987-06-09',114,'Released','Nothing can stop them, no one can help you. They know who you are.','The Believers',32076,3.7309,5.883,'KKlqc5LUGMA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9819,_binary '\0','/cLSMoqNcBtwIAvyG5rirqfRkkkP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092637',6.9,6732,'en','The Belly of an Architect','Stourley Kracklite, a driven, detail-obsessed architect, travels from America to Rome with his much younger wife, Louisa, to oversee an architectural homage to a personal hero, 18th-century master builder Etienne-Louis Boullée. En route by train, Stourley and Louisa conceive a much-wanted child — but Stourley\'s obsession with his wife\'s expanding belly, her perceived infidelity, and his own recurrent bouts of abdominal pain reach epic and dangerous proportions.','/gjS08AHtZ7b44WC2NCuYWpJRoCM.jpg','1987-09-23',118,'Released','Art is the food for madness.','The Belly of an Architect',17238,2.5184,6.8,'M75Y6l7XdDw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9820,_binary '\0','/iPAMreszojqokGFvXL9hzQ6xliQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092638',6.3,3723,'en','Benji the Hunted','Benji has become stranded on a remote island after a boating accident. He finds himself struggling to survive in the wilderness, avoiding close encounters with a wolf, a bear, and a territorial female cougar with her cub.','/g4mlRGzUKCXfRDUJqSRPY0mKPMC.jpg','1987-06-05',88,'Released','Benji\'s Back! In the most exciting adventure of his life!','Benji the Hunted',21299,2.4615,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9821,_binary '\0','/eztBIRcRDz7zGpZiHeEORJX1aVP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092641',6.4,7349,'en','Best Seller','Hit man Cleve approaches writer/cop Dennis about a story for his next book: How Cleve made a living, working for one of the most powerful politicians in the country. To get the story right, they travel around the country to gather statements and evidence, while strong forces use any means they can to keep the story untold.','/gURIzutUWsQSed0jKodbRoeVVaR.jpg','1987-09-25',95,'Released','Writing A Book Is Easy. Writing A Best Seller Is Murder.','Best Seller',4639,2.7301,5.948,'jWKyXlgcYoA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9822,_binary '\0','/bIA65PCRtIQfBvIoKohJbtOPl3M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092644',6.6,148299,'en','Beverly Hills Cop II','Axel Foley returns to the land of sunshine and palm trees to investigate the near-fatal shooting of police Captain Andrew Bogomil. With the help of Sgt. Taggart and Det. Rosewood, they soon uncover that the shooting is associated with a series of \"alphabet\" robberies masterminded by a heartless weapons kingpin—and the chase is on.','/egDakU8O5yUwpUJP9IMAUVtIDll.jpg','1987-05-18',103,'Released','Axel Foley is back. Back where he doesn\'t belong.','Beverly Hills Cop II',96,11.7309,6.536,'rcrM8c9uuwM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9823,_binary '\0','/hCVZweDh7gvsrHsDieWD6ljg0Yf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092646',4.7,1560,'en','Beyond Therapy','Manhattanites Bruce and Prudence are each looking for a meaningful romantic relationship and have been encouraged by their psychiatrists to find someone through the personal ads. Their first meeting is disastrous, but they begin to hit it off during their second date. However, Bruce\'s bisexual, live-in lover does not want to share Bruce and is willing to do whatever it takes to keep him to himself.','/zYAykpqOMogGlvKxZ33RWitcf8L.jpg','1987-02-27',93,'Released','Comic relief for incurable romantics.','Beyond Therapy',83726,1.8062,3.9,'6A9vuf549hs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9824,_binary '\0','/39Q1onEqOFhlFzHcSBbxSzl3dC9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092651',7.2,2550,'fa','بای‌سیکل‌ران','The wife of Nasim, an Afghan immigrant in Iran, is gravely ill. He needs money to pay for her care, but his day labor digging wells does not pay enough. A friend connects Nasim to a two-bit promoter who sells tickets to watch Nasim ride a bicycle continuously for a week. The promoter brings in sick and aged spectators, haranguing them to find hope in Nasim\'s strength. Aided by his son, who feeds him as he rides, Nasim grinds out the days and shivering nights. Local officials believe this may be a plot and Nasim may be a spy; they try to sabotage him as do those who bet he won\'t finish the week. Will desperation alone get Nasim the money? Is any triumph an illusion?','/46PrHGTqvm5KVXzeSDuRRBmAZNY.jpg','1989-02-01',79,'Released',NULL,'The Cyclist',44072,1.3406,6.643,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9825,_binary '\0','/4RBQjZlgojXfTraDlAWo3ecY3pw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092654',6.5,15207,'en','The Big Easy','Remy McSwain is a New Orleans police lieutenant who investigates the murder of a local mobster. His investigation leads him to suspect that fellow members of the police force may be involved.','/fqAzCnU1c8OzmNNhvN8nXlU1YtY.jpg','1986-11-27',102,'Released','He\'s got to hide the truth. She\'ll stop at nothing to find it. But tonight, everything\'s off the record.','The Big Easy',11028,4.4806,6.2,'Ic2AhqLWuI0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9826,_binary '\0','/7ztz8vNbVFu0SpA6LpmqVns1LJt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092656',5.9,2875,'en','The Big Town','It is 1957. J.C. Cullen is a young man from a small town, with a talent for winning at craps, who leaves for the big city to work as a professional gambler. While there, he breaks the bank at a private craps game at the Gem Club, owned by George Cole, and falls in love with two women, one of them Cole\'s wife.','/dAYpcKfokjbzE1RwbRGQDurTtiO.jpg','1987-09-25',109,'Released','Lady luck is always on his side. Tonight, she\'s on fire.','The Big Town',67307,2.5008,5.566,'8XkYj57bqXY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9827,_binary '\0','/uVGNcJeDIcDhZihBBnNWeQiX5w9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092666',6,26179,'en','Blind Date','When bachelor Walter Davis is set up with his sister-in-law\'s pretty cousin, Nadia Gates, a seemingly average blind date turns into a chaotic night on the town. Walter\'s brother, Ted, tells him not to let Nadia drink alcohol, but he dismisses the warning and her behaviour gets increasingly wild. Walter and Nadia\'s numerous incidents are made even worse as her former lover David relentlessly follows them around town.','/cLb3akSpZhU5qkmCO46IHfJtcs0.jpg','1987-03-27',95,'Released','A date with her is every man\'s dream come true. And with dreams like her - who needs nightmares?','Blind Date',918,4.7084,6,'Q54vCqr1jtQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9828,_binary '\0','/gIKm4gzfZzNxaAvNw2xihAh9o3F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092669',5.3,6163,'en','Blood Diner','Two cannibalistic brothers kill various young women to make their flesh part of a new special dish at their rundown restaurant while seeking blood sacrifices to awaken a dormant Egyptian goddess.','/q8Y9BhkWj5Hi7hCQ5QPsDHC95jR.jpg','1987-07-24',88,'Released','First They Greet You, Then They Eat You.','Blood Diner',62132,2.1284,5.396,'P_7DN4YhsZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9829,_binary '\0','/6eN8D8Znc5dTUcPAl5S4yeoQUE7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092671',4.6,2161,'en','Blood Harvest','A college student returns home to find her parents missing, and their home vandalized. Soon, matters take a turn for the worse, when she finds herself stalked, and her friends disappearing one by one.','/kUhCjKXEjMil9tVdWWKFoLHWHPn.jpg','1987-01-01',88,'Released','A Cocktail of vengeance and lust','Blood Harvest',78068,1.3308,4.4,'aC1y7KoWZbw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9830,_binary '\0','/aSA7RuKmCQBnYKn70GYPi6ckgoY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092675',6.8,104694,'en','Bloodsport','An American Army Major goes AWOL to Hong Kong for an outlawed martial arts contest called the Kumite.','/kndxR9TRK0kJ5hxzDprRSS80F2W.jpg','1988-02-26',92,'Released','The true story of an American ninja.','Bloodsport',11690,11.7507,7.068,'bCZ1CIQ64YQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9831,_binary '\0','/cc88IM0mwJg84EtLIHwaoV6tfTF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092676',4.5,2744,'en','Bloody New Year','A group of friends take refuge in an island hotel decorated for New Year\'s. The problem is, it\'s early summer, and soon enough, even the walls themselves are striking out against them.','/oJK4nvg9NFV4ltYSjAgEzJzV56G.jpg','1987-05-11',94,'Released','Should old acquaintance be forgot? Or just brutally murdered.','Bloody New Year',30478,1.463,5.181,'b9NY0YJek2I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9832,_binary '\0','/jt7D0sx25O465JW50ou6hkdRVUO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092677',4.9,1814,'en','Blue Monkey','While working in a greenhouse, a man receives an insect bite after touching an exotic plant. Immediately, he falls ill and is taken to an emergency room where the doctors diagnose him as suffering from an unknown bacteria, and a strange parasite which emerges from his mouth as a large slimy wormlike creature. Soon, there are more cases of bacterial infection, but the more immediate problem for the hospital is the wormlike creature which after accidental exposure to a genetic growth stimulant grows to monstrous proportions and starts a reign of terror and bloodshed in the hospitals abandoned wing.','/6cOwZtocb7icG3WON8DejxHgFWc.jpg','1987-09-25',96,'Released','THEY BREED. THEY HATCH. THEY KILL. Maybe it\'s just a phase they\'re going through.','Blue Monkey',89394,2.5275,4.9,'aNb-8UQpgXI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9833,_binary '\0','/wTVPvPh3EmP5MMiSwk2rLm6EWpF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092684',5.2,1683,'en','Body Slam','M. Harry Smilac is a down-on-his-luck music manager who is having a hard time attracting talent and booking gigs for his band, Kicks (The most recent of the gigs is a Dairy Queen opening!!). When making arrangements for a campaign fund-raiser, he mistakes Rick Roberts, a professional wrestler, for a musician and hires him. At that moment he becomes a wrestling manager and starts to book matches for him and his teammate Tonga Tom. The team is a success, and Harry decides to take his wrestlers and his band on a \"Rock n\' Wrestling\" tour. The tour is a success, and Harry feels what it is like to be a winner again.','/h3nDVRacsvB1kLQYz1F9hzyYORv.jpg','1986-11-21',89,'Released','He\'s down but never out...','Body Slam',83415,1.4906,5.1,'o0UhHMdhlIQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9834,_binary '\0','/lgENInNUKf7ZgpucK4pCqYxr0Al.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092690',6.1,7323,'en','Born in East L.A.','Rudy, an American of Hispanic descent, whose south-of-the-border looks show him no mercy during an immigration raid in a migrant worker factory. As his luck goes, he is caught with neither money nor his ID and is deported to Mexico - without speaking a word of Spanish!','/fkRqsMOCkSu7l3F3JIcgyqV69lW.jpg','1987-08-21',84,'Released','A comedy bordering on insanity.','Born in East L.A.',19324,2.8958,5.8,'-2gIwHq_d3w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9835,_binary '\0','/clqEWCcN75czQvFF4g7b4e252pd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092693',7.3,1803,'es','El bosque animado','In Galicia, in northern Spain, Malvís, a frustrated day laborer who, fed up with his life, has become a clumsy bandit, tries to make a name for himself by robbing travelers passing through a forest inhabited by colorful characters.','/s15kGF76r78zPBsVelCt72kHnL9.jpg','1987-10-02',108,'Released',NULL,'The Enchanted Forest',60311,1.2268,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9836,_binary '\0','/1StdeuPCUYSo78OOFgy7fxQfW0h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092695',7.2,29838,'en','The Brave Little Toaster','A group of dated appliances, finding themselves stranded in a summer home that their family had just sold, decide to seek out their eight year old \'master\'.','/mEZcPMNRqTcotOZSttN5MtmJbu1.jpg','1987-07-09',90,'Released','Plug into the adventure!','The Brave Little Toaster',19933,5.3803,6.9,'bpGLpD25dpU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9837,_binary '\0','/wHSZJ8s0JfWIjoHkRknq6ZtGlZr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092699',7.3,37195,'en','Broadcast News','A high-strung news producer finds herself in a love triangle between a talented but self-doubting reporter and a charming news anchor who embodies the growing trivialization of news that she is determined to fight against.','/kQNR1Lc0qAF5xuBySpDn481KVjb.jpg','1987-12-16',133,'Released','It’s the story of their lives.','Broadcast News',12626,5.3079,6.8,'WXYq-X3E7Ag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9838,_binary '\0','/boA6GizLzRawG4QrW1KilG7BWVX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092709',6.3,1544,'it','Il burbero','Traveling from New York to Italia, pretty Mary rushes into moody macho lawyer Tito. The girl immediately falls for the guy with the gruffy manners and in an very impertinent way, she leans on him as she gets in trouble: Not only that she gets tied up in her suite by some Gangsters, but also, her new husband is found dead.','/e0QTnKEBP67A2vjU60wIqg91nP4.jpg','1986-12-20',101,'Released',NULL,'Il burbero',35634,1.6158,6.377,'R-d-BMmsYH4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9839,_binary '\0','/bSFqyA1WlttgzivRVcNT2PlMSkd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092710',5.2,5133,'en','Burglar','Bernice \"Bernie\" Rhodenbarr is a burglar by trade, and she runs a bookstore as well. Her friend Carl Hefler is a dog groomer. After a successful burglary, it\'s discovered that a dead body was in the house she burgled. As she\'s the only one who can be placed at the scene of the crime, she has to use her criminal skills to clear her name of the murder AND avoid getting charged with the burglary.','/t3cRLXAdjsWQbXsiACosuTwrwmm.jpg','1987-03-20',103,'Released','A first rate comedy about a second story woman.','Burglar',38921,3.0327,5.186,'LhTmA9sqxeI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9840,_binary '\0','/nJCJzBribIsi1l9wEHm38X1LQ0H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092713',7.3,1414,'pl','C.K. Dezerterzy','Set in 1918, this World War I drama follows a group of Austro-Hungarian soldiers—Czechs, Jews, Italians, and others—confined in a provincial barracks under German officers. Subjected to the cruelty of a sadistic lieutenant, they rebel, humiliate him, and later attempt escape. Disguised as guards for veterinary surgeons in Budapest, the deserters are eventually recaptured and returned for court-martial, forced once more to face their tormentor.','/iglVl2oUjgqxWf7si6UtHwGDkcn.jpg','1986-09-22',155,'Released',NULL,'H.M. Deserters',36264,1.4035,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9841,_binary '\0','/orSiH0y4r0BwFxNdWhNKkgPocQx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092718',6.8,46661,'en','Can\'t Buy Me Love','Nerdy high schooler Ronald Miller rescues cheerleader Cindy Mancini from parental punishment after she accidentally destroys her mother\'s designer clothes. Ronald agrees to pay for the $1,000 outfit on one condition: that she will act as though they\'re a couple for an entire month. As the days pass, however, Cindy grows fond of Ronald, making him popular. But when Ronald\'s former best friend gets left behind, he realizes that social success isn\'t everything.','/qK3yiqo84U3twOOKOx81c407Hpr.jpg','1987-08-14',94,'Released','Ronald is making an investment in his senior year. He\'s hiring the prettiest cheerleader in school to be his girlfriend.','Can\'t Buy Me Love',12919,6.9745,6.884,'hiS42RHaKyg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9842,_binary '\0','/lFkyDwdpjHmfWJNH16mZ7cvKaQb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092720',4.7,1509,'it','Capriccio','After the renewed flings with their former lovers prove to be disastrously unlike the romantic memories, an unfaithful couple returns to each other.','/4jmE1e9sGIgNhFcs0u6RG78lR56.jpg','1987-02-25',98,'Released',NULL,'Love & Passion',50268,2.9357,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9843,_binary '\0','/10YAxPbDVrB00oBWC5OExNGiBRr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092723',5.9,1415,'en','The Care Bears Adventure in Wonderland','The cuddly Care Bears and their cousins star in this charming third feature-length film incorporating characters from Alice in Wonderland. A young girl named Alice and the Care Bears travel together into the whimsical land of the Mad Hatter and the Cheshire Cat. In this magical story about friendship and self-esteem, they try to thwart an evil wizard\'s attempt to become the King of Wonderland.','/yRuyXsh8aMXt95Mjj2Gaj9zADwb.jpg','1987-08-07',75,'Released',NULL,'The Care Bears Adventure in Wonderland',33838,2.0837,5.8,'h06fnGngHlw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9844,_binary '\0','/bpBcgPYG3PRjzxdBCuli8jeEslw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092732',5.8,3747,'en','Castaway','Middle-aged Gerald Kingsland advertises in a London paper for a female companion to spend a year with him on a desert island. Young Lucy Irving takes a chance on contacting him, but once on the island, things prove a lot less idyllic than in the movies. Gradually, it becomes clear that it is Lucy who has the desire and the strength to try and see the year through.','/mphJksO1hwAEmcMawNFvRZJJ5n.jpg','1986-03-05',117,'Released','One Year on a Deserted Tropical Island. \'Wife\' 20-30 needed to accompany man 35+. Write to Box 775 with details and evening phone number.','Castaway',52886,1.9787,6.3,'BT8AzDeHTYA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9845,_binary '\0','/fCFrFvSElm2JXofee0cWFX1CuLs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092744',4.7,4477,'en','Cheerleader Camp','A cheerleader named Alison is plagued by nightmares about the upcoming all-state finals and attends a summer training camp with her teammates. When a number of deaths start occurring at the camp, Alison\'s nightmares turn twisted and brutal, and she begins to believe that she may be responsible for the mayhem.','/7rRki4MybU4wKLo9em6BTHhGJtM.jpg','1988-06-21',89,'Released','Competition was murder at…','Cheerleader Camp',40087,2.1719,4.947,'UJcJfb6WN6s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9846,_binary '\0','/nQd4VWlm63lHLfL8Br7fukeO9m9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092745',7.6,4063,'ru','Человек с бульвара Капуцинов','Mr. Johnny First goes to the Wild West to present the art of the Cinematograph, and the lives of everyone in the frontier town of Santa Carolina change as a result of this.','/9GAPbG2B0NEBaWXRO04VHnJ1UVg.jpg','1987-06-23',98,'Released',NULL,'A Man from the Boulevard des Capucines',45227,1.3359,7.118,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9847,_binary '\0','/2EUOCvS8VcvP45JuSfdY6zFOJ9J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092746',5.6,11865,'en','Cherry 2000','When successful businessman Sam Treadwell finds that his android wife, Cherry model 2000 has blown a fuse, he hires sexy renegade tracker E. Johnson to find her exact duplicate. But as their journey to replace his perfect mate leads them into the treacherous and lawless region of \'The Zone\', Treadwell learns the hard way that the perfect woman is made not of computer chips and diodes.','/t3uds00MHLsibhKLCL0BbCEGxXb.jpg','1987-11-10',99,'Released','Need A Bounty Hunter? She\'s Your Man.','Cherry 2000',15785,3.9474,5.953,'zKkdgnDu3MA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9848,_binary '\0','/m0lmDVKbQ1TA9sQoUxgBorgFsI5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092751',6.3,2892,'en','China Girl','Teenage lovers Tony and Tyan-Hwa tip the balance of power in New York\'s Little Italy and Chinatown.','/4Bu4hRHBHw0eL5g8RX2qMRlD4js.jpg','1987-09-25',90,'Released','He\'s Italian. She\'s Chinese. Their gangs are sworn enemies. They are secret lovers... caught in the crossfire.','China Girl',47212,2.8486,6,'WonOBoFfsDQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9849,_binary '\0','/ung9i4OVPj3keSAAjzbtI4xRdTi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092752',7.2,6576,'en','The Chipmunk Adventure','The Chipmunks and the Chipettes go head to head in a hot air balloon race, and the winner gets $100,000. Unbeknownst to the participants, the \"race\" is actually a diamond smuggling ring!','/o0d8qJL8anmGG14UfjBC7HHATJK.jpg','1987-05-22',77,'Released','At last! Alvin\'s first motion picture.','The Chipmunk Adventure',21793,3.1652,7,'fN6Lu6piMQk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9850,_binary '\0','/hYbzLECmri38TIIeVrWoARTHWbg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092758',7.7,1671,'en','Chuck Berry: Hail! Hail! Rock \'n\' Roll','St. Louis, 1986. For Chuck Berry\'s 60th, Keith Richards assembles a pickup band of Robert Cray, Joey Spampinato, Eric Clapton, himself and long-time Berry pianist, Johnnie Johnson. Joined on stage by Etta James, Linda Ronstadt and Julian Lennon, Berry performs his classic rock songs. His abilities as a composer, lyricist, singer, musician and entertainer are on display and, in behind-the-scenes interviews, are discussed by Bo Diddley, Little Richard, Jerry Lee Lewis, Bruce Springstein, the Everly Brothers, Roy Orbison and others. There\'s even a rarity for Berry—a rehearsal. Archival footage from the early 1950s and a duet with John Lennon round out this portrait of a master.','/l2UO83nc3Z2xluh355pD8ZWgjpd.jpg','1987-10-09',120,'Released',NULL,'Chuck Berry: Hail! Hail! Rock \'n\' Roll',42003,1.4842,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9851,_binary '\0','/nZEYRFne7BmmbyteqXJb8JT5lxR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092783',6.4,7731,'en','Cop','An obsessive, insubordinate homicide cop is convinced a serial killer is loose in the Hollywood area and disobeys orders in order to catch him.','/gvk4Q4Txjegmup4A1QVyQm2Lb6d.jpg','1988-02-05',110,'Released','A killer on the loose. A cop on the edge.','Cop',31701,2.8169,6.356,'m3CQqoarH-w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9852,_binary '\0','/apjYHDtdhalyTooZSD7skxGpoWF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092794',6.6,1698,'nl','Crazy Love','Three \'Bukowskian\' torrid nights in the life of a man, Harry, in search of love. The first is as a youth, the second on the day of his high school graduation, and the third as a lonely, middle-aged man.','/ar9PMY3jJb9g7Ql2j0ynG3g3GH9.jpg','1987-10-01',83,'Released',NULL,'Crazy Love',53741,1.2839,6.042,'kCG3SYRt4pc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9853,_binary '\0','/eARnPYLAkjjvREBMaCsIIJm5rsn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092795',4.1,3626,'en','Creepozoids','Five Army deserters wander the post-apocalyptic, post-industrial Los Angeles landscape, seeking shelter from an increasingly toxic environment and poisonous rain.','/xgXlJIq8oyzZch2FvlHT0Fs1UuW.jpg','1987-10-02',72,'Released','Your flesh will crawl right off your bones!','Creepozoids',28223,2.231,4.5,'8xTG6Sii-uQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9854,_binary '\0','/w6RisE566EXIekhfLqIUprYtxbU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092796',6.1,31199,'en','Creepshow 2','Three macabre tales from the latest issue of a boy\'s favorite comic book, dealing with a vengeful wooden Native American, a monstrous blob in a lake, and an undying hitchhiker.','/bbanIymLuTYmQGis9nlCkFlT1eg.jpg','1987-05-01',92,'Released','When the curtain goes up, the terror begins.','Creepshow 2',16288,5.1689,6.2,'H8l077UCW-Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9855,_binary '\0','/UXeD3bt6LB3VdqKckfBrZJHwn3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092798',5.4,4262,'en','Critical Condition','Eddie is a con artist. When he\'s framed and comes before a judge, he hopes to get off the hook by claiming insanity—but instead ends up in a hospital for a mental assessment. That night, a storm causes a power failure and, in the ensuing chaos, Eddie is mistaken for a doctor and suddenly finds himself in charge of the hospital.','/ajJXJhnvmMlb768jKdOzEkoqgyX.jpg','1987-01-16',100,'Released','A comedy of epidemic proportions.','Critical Condition',31563,3.471,5.5,'WUfhLG-7QHU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9856,_binary '\0','/nC0Z7yIhMr2RsNMyK5uQaUYX1l2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092800',6.6,1430,'it','Cronaca di una morte annunciata','This suspenseful Italian crime drama is set in a Colombian river town and chronicles the series of events that led up to murder. Based on a novel by distinguished author Gabriel Garcia Marquez, the tale begins in the present as a middle-aged doctor returns to the village after a twenty-year absence to investigate the murder that occurred just before he left.','/umcKJZB2eQpRux2OWKNR6gyw1ME.jpg','1987-05-08',109,'Released',NULL,'Chronicle of a Death Foretold',163706,2.6387,7.3,'mpYMZYlhox8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9857,_binary '\0','/cQMJxgt9xGmdgLEKA8eRow2Dcyh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092802',5.7,1411,'en','Cross My Heart','A man and a woman go out on a \"big\" third date. He\'s ashamed to admit he just lost his job, and she\'s afraid he\'ll run away if he finds out that she has a kid. Small lies lead to bigger ones and the night gets crazy very soon.','/uxLHTkClfhUaKJvOlgjQTBF57pX.jpg','1987-12-13',90,'Released','A COMEDY YOU CAN STILL RESPECT IN THE MORNING','Cross My Heart',57738,1.3747,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9858,_binary '\0','/pW4fqfsAKKGJv736xPvisSM91u2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092804',7.4,15469,'en','Cry Freedom','A dramatic story, based on actual events, about the friendship between two men struggling against apartheid in South Africa in the 1970s. Donald Woods is a white liberal journalist in South Africa who begins to follow the activities of Stephen Biko, a courageous and outspoken black anti-apartheid activist.','/zEONV1NAzzoQGFFgSIEs7vJzDrN.jpg','1987-11-06',157,'Released','The true story of the friendship that shook South Africa and awakened the world.','Cry Freedom',12506,4.3236,7,'iq4VjE0_AVQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9859,_binary '\0','/8f3tYue2JR2NIUarLW82Ny4pddp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092809',5.1,4665,'en','The Curse','Nathan Hayes is a religious man trying to hold onto his farm and keep his family in line. A real estate developer is trying to buy most of the farm property in the area, including Mr. Hayes’ family farm, in the hope that the Tennesse Valley Authority will choose the town for the site of a new dam and recreational area. The night of a terrible storm, an unidentified, glowing object crashes on the Hayes farm and with it comes a horrible curse for the family and other members of the community.','/zTvk4P1JJLE7amgXSFse8sIBT6s.jpg','1987-09-11',92,'Released','It took seed...now it needs to feed.','The Curse',74747,1.8955,5,'lVgikAaoKtE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9860,_binary '\0','/uETejbCQnrsY35l3cYcw3aTJeG7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092812',4.5,1285,'en','Cyclone','Rick has developed the ultimate motorcycle, the Cyclone. It is a $5 million bike equipped with rocket launchers and laser guns. Rick meets his fate and it is up to his girlfriend Teri to keep the Cyclone from falling into the wrong hands. Teri can trust no one but herself.','/9H2XnNehu3bGZyAvtd9RUzAdDT9.jpg','1987-06-05',89,'Released','The ultimate team of woman and machine','Cyclone',81573,1.5542,4.1,'-fSnLe4C7dQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9861,_binary '\0','/eV5nemTdC2hD64xdHMVq9ZgCDcs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092830',6.1,1851,'en','Dark Age','In the Australian outback, a park ranger and two local guides set out to track down a giant crocodile that has been killing and eating the local populace..','/dDHpW5Xgg905AIyfDi9Ld3EYKIg.jpg','1987-05-21',91,'Released','Death is only one bite away.','Dark Age',83866,1.1898,5.7,'ststjV0ztf4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9862,_binary '\0','/zJhGAmSLyx2KzMRNkYu9NJ8qMxJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092831',4.2,1598,'en','Dark Tower','An architect, a security chief, a parapsychologist and an exorcist face evil in a Barcelona skyscraper.','/5nZcDsJFerQg604nydPPpHpRGV9.jpg','1987-10-29',92,'Released','In a city that never sleeps... this building is a nightmare.','Dark Tower',106280,1.7197,3.9,'JzXks7p2Y0c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9863,_binary '\0','/A9sGtL2mvcQNDhNaNPPYP91wjqJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092834',5.6,3428,'en','Date with an Angel','Aspiring composer Jim Sanders is engaged to spoiled rich girl Patty. But the morning after his bachelor party, Jim wakes up to discover a beautiful, broken-winged angel in his pool. When everyone finds out about his heavenly houseguest, Jim must cope with a dangerously jealous fiancée, an exploitive future father-in-law and a group of buddies with an outrageous business plan!','/g9CjIIyZdCybuCRkn4Ad8uWBclu.jpg','1987-11-20',105,'Released','Jim is about to marry a princess... but he\'s in love with an angel.','Date with an Angel',28370,3.798,6.8,'OAQXV8_Oi7w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9864,_binary '\0','/tuHFUZFyidc1JIcWMjO9CEgKmgD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092842',6.2,5503,'en','Dead of Winter','A fledgling actress is lured to a remote mansion for a screen-test, soon discovering she is actually a prisoner in the middle of a blackmail plot.','/t98G6rq7UpGGiFdURecUDCiBqaT.jpg','1987-02-06',100,'Released','Katie McGovern will do anything to become an actress. Even if it kills her… tonight it might.','Dead of Winter',70199,2.8244,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9865,_binary '\0','/dOC74DSvbBnE9117wyJzOdmG9Kz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092843',7.2,10168,'en','The Dead','After a convivial holiday dinner party, things begin to unravel when a husband and wife address some prickly issues concerning their marriage.','/hFLUqiwvvtcUqA5NZNejaaNpTv0.jpg','1987-09-03',83,'Released','A vast, merry, and uncommon tale of love.','The Dead',39507,3.4707,6.9,'nNgMhgnt4FY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9866,_binary '\0','/dHre4chV2C61t6Ri6R5G2icTiK8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092848',5,3794,'en','Deadly Prey','A group of sadistic mercenaries led by Col. John Hogan kidnap Michael Danton from his home, and set him loose on the grounds of their secret camp to be used as training for new recruits. Danton has been called the \"most perfect killer ever.\" Now, he\'ll have to prove it again. This prey has become DEADLY!','/aG4hUQ0vw56B1zx0YJJKhaMR1DT.jpg','1987-11-02',85,'Released','In Vietnam, he was the best... He still is!','Deadly Prey',5753,1.9467,4.9,'FQySDbFb97s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9867,_binary '\0','/clQI6qbrYRHxlQsGKA0Wcri5mvy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092850',4.7,3084,'en','Deadtime Stories','A babysitting uncle tells his charges three horror stories: about a killer witch; Little Red Riding Hood and a werewolf; and Goldi Lox and the three bears.','/wlpPBlg5YqVxEqlF4ZsGwaO9OLZ.jpg','1986-04-13',93,'Released','You made your bed… now die in it!','Deadtime Stories',66194,2.0627,4.9,'gXZpCKRSab4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9868,_binary '\0','/rKGGlT76Aywnaee7Kq9xNItIwAq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092851',7.9,2061,'en','Dear America: Letters Home from Vietnam','Real-life letters written by American soldiers, sailors, airmen, and Marines during the Vietnam War to their families and friends back home. Archive footage of the war and news coverage thereof augment the first-person \"narrative\" by men and women who were in the war, some of whom did not survive it.','/mxtyyPSPcuCn1aNCzpkGfV4eLi.jpg','1987-10-01',84,'Released','Addressed to the heart of America.','Dear America: Letters Home from Vietnam',61777,1.9155,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9869,_binary '\0','/zuuic1DWoUBTrkTVqD2xIcphckZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092854',4.9,1261,'en','Death Before Dishonor','Gunnery Sergeant Burns reports for duty to an American Embassy in the Middle East. However due to the \'enlightened\' views of the Ambassador, the marine security detachment he is in charge of is severely restricted in their functions and presence to avoid upsetting the host government. As a result, when terrorists attack the compound, they are able to kidnap hostages and escape with little opposition. Burns ignores the Ambassador\'s restrictions, and throws the rule books out the window, as he becomes a one man army in an attempt to rescue the hostages, and wipe out the terrorists.','/1DFradW5Qqi9saz3m1zq4zcfyI0.jpg','1987-02-20',91,'Released',NULL,'Death Before Dishonor',62185,1.5593,4.7,'6t7Z3lHmsxc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9870,_binary '\0','/be8hrZ0W2OiJ2WAag4SMnxGkUpz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092857',5.5,12640,'en','Death Wish 4: The Crackdown','After the death of his girlfriend\'s daughter from a drug overdose, Paul Kersey takes on the local drug cartel.','/r8HwJQJyKRyJ2JypwiVR5p0ZV84.jpg','1987-06-11',99,'Released','This time it\'s war!','Death Wish 4: The Crackdown',26263,4.6106,5.705,'N4OaITyRBG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9871,_binary '\0','/bDFayg4joYfc21ynNKmRIJZKx6M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092860',5.2,4845,'en','Deathstalker II: Duel of the Titans','Deathstalker helps Reena the Seer out of a few jams, and she solicits his help for a bigger task. She reveals that she is actually Princess Evie, but the evil sorcerer had her abducted and cloned in order to seize control of the kingdom. Together they travel to the evil sorcerer\'s stronghold to restore the princess to her rightful position, encountering challenges along the way both from the sorcerer\'s goons and the fierce Amazon women.','/uWWGVspUqMezWpXcaaB3yglWp8F.jpg','1987-06-03',77,'Released','Twice The Action. Twice The Passion. Twice The Adventure.','Deathstalker II: Duel of the Titans',28218,2.8764,5.726,'gYyulM9Xzgc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9872,_binary '\0','/wu8rsXeCpjsB4wCMYSgh1dva6y2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092863',4.5,1323,'en','Deep Space','Secretly engineered and blasted into space by government scientists, a vile monster crash-lands back on Earth and begins killing everyone it encounters. As the death toll rises, veteran cop McLemore bravely steps forward to crush the scary creature.','/m2dqszB02pXb83zAp35FNXblgKC.jpg','1988-05-01',90,'Released','They created a monster over lunch. Now it\'s back for dinner...','Deep Space',27662,1.6891,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9873,_binary '\0','/1eddqJqBUUxG93oRGtZbIrqL5x8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092865',5.5,1295,'it','Un delitto poco comune','Police Comissioner Datti is investigating the murder of a female doctor whose murderer seems to be a thirty-fivish year old man. Soon another murder follows: Pianist Robert Dominici\'s girlfriend is found killed. The killer also challenges Datti on the phone and says he can\'t be caught since he has a secret which makes him invulnerable. In the meantime the clues seems to point in strange directions...','/x7ccBCVMzHPjy9APVRhIePew46t.jpg','1988-03-11',92,'Released',NULL,'Phantom of Death',29169,1.7243,5.6,'IKedVdmqaUQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9874,_binary '\0','/2qfDH8kVW9if08W49e2djmhy8bU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092879',7.7,3637,'ru','Десять негритят','Ten strangers are forced to come face-to-face with their dark pasts after receiving an anonymous invitation to an isolated island off the coast of England.','/1eLoGaival4wpXvnJYmNHZcWmUP.jpg','1987-12-28',137,'Released',NULL,'Ten Little Indians',4885,1.4101,7.506,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9875,_binary '\0','/6iDQCBUSZKzY8Rnu8ECwl2gXcfG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092890',7.1,284539,'en','Dirty Dancing','Expecting the usual tedium that accompanies a summer in the Catskills with her family, 17-year-old Frances \'Baby\' Houseman is surprised to find herself stepping into the shoes of a professional hoofer—and unexpectedly falling in love.','/9Jw6jys7q9gjzVX5zm1z0gC8gY9.jpg','1987-08-21',100,'Released','First dance. First love. The time of your life.','Dirty Dancing',88,18.4747,7.3,'0rzsa_KEoKs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9876,_binary '\0','/uo0AAzb6f9It6INtN61yhta1Uxp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092891',5.2,1413,'en','The Dirty Dozen: The Deadly Mission','Learning of a Nazi plot to attack Washington, D.C. with a deadly nerve gas, Major Wright leads twelve convicts on a suicide mission deep into occupied France to destroy the secret factory where the poison is made.','/kq4hYyXQypTfSFDC0QnWnTJ8sgU.jpg','1987-03-01',90,'Released','When it\'s impossible... send in the Dozen.','The Dirty Dozen: The Deadly Mission',36572,2.4529,5,'Phnmsi0TcVQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9877,_binary '\0','/iVB892EHzKpgZYOzaKCVKcd4OqU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092897',5.1,2820,'en','Disorderlies','As not-quite-orderlies who\'re downright Disorderlies, rap-music favorites The Fat Boys rule. Playing the freewheeling caretakers of the frail Dennison, they stir up a comedic culture clash in Palm Beach society that only proves laughter is the best medicine this side of a tax refund.','/8BZn8MBlc9gjObeO9vhObazBAlc.jpg','1987-08-14',86,'Released','This is the movie you\'re gonna laugh yourself sick over.','Disorderlies',24826,2.9661,4.9,'X6IxAUGCzLE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9878,_binary '\0','/gnHeY1sOxqYvqVs1s4OsIUdI1Dm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092904',6.4,1490,'en','Dogs in Space','The place is Melbourne, Australia 1978. The punk phenomenon is sweeping the country and Dogs In Space, a punk group, are part of it. In a squat, in a dodgy suburb, live a ragtag collection of outcasts and don\'t-wanna-bes who survive on a diet of old TV space films, drugs and good music. And the satellite SKYLAB could crash through their roof at any moment...','/170HfrEGMYMrHxceh27XCAe6J5G.jpg','1986-12-18',103,'Released','Between heaven and hell','Dogs in Space',30994,1.6977,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9879,_binary '\0','/sxLGIJmQgqqbknXJVR7boa4uG4F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092905',7.3,1399,'ru','Долгие проводы','A single mother is confused by the changes in her teenage son, who has become distant since spending summer vacation with his father.','/tiyH6ulGfsGDdYs3JVSwDYYPUpd.jpg','1971-08-01',94,'Released',NULL,'The Long Farewell',148822,1.3009,6.5,'fZFy-2C2IZ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9880,_binary '\0','/aOH67myzG6Gk0MrHIldOR5odTZW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092906',6.3,14571,'en','Dolls','A precocious girl, her nasty parents, two punk-rock losers and a weak-kneed salesman inadvertently become the guests of two ghoulish senior citizens in their dark, haunted mansion.','/oMCysbLhEK3xHTavrTLayWT6bnN.jpg','1987-03-12',77,'Released','They walk. They talk. They kill.','Dolls',24341,3.4343,6.4,'aFaNbnLGRoM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9881,_binary '\0','/3ShPhAcdczflovQszzKXxn5iHJP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092910',4.6,2839,'en','Doom Asylum','A demented former lawyer uses autopsy equipment to kill off the teenagers who trespass on the long-abandoned asylum he inhabits. Filmed on location in an actual abandoned asylum.','/3JF6jxFpg7vJftePtIBy42F8p0v.jpg','1988-03-02',79,'Released','SLASHING with a snicker, SLAUGHTER with a smirk...','Doom Asylum',67729,1.4706,5.2,'IwVQlRrO9ZA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9882,_binary '\0','/qbe8WKCS0FpsuIjGR928QK3jn6z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092925',6,40358,'en','Dragnet','LAPD Sgt. Joe Friday -- the equally straight-laced nephew of the famous police sergeant of the same name -- is paired up with a young, freewheeling detective named Pep Streebeck. After investigating some strange robberies at the local zoo and the theft of a stockpile of pornographic magazines, they uncover cult activity in the heart of the city and are hot on the case to figure out who\'s behind it all.','/77H17YDeHoJCHebpfGF1rY3Dfof.jpg','1987-06-26',106,'Released','\"Just The Facts.\"','Dragnet',10023,4.6981,5.99,'G-9wTJoNUnI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9883,_binary '\0','/8HiCwYGET0rHwAQnMridjgPD2uk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092929',7.1,10665,'en','Drowning by Numbers','Cissie Colpitts drowns her cheating husband and, in the ensuing cover-up, enlists the help of lonely coroner Henry Madgett, an old friend with a longstanding weakness for her charms. But when Cissie\'s daughter and granddaughter—both also named Cissie Colpitts—decide to resort to the same methods for solving conflicts with their own frustrating husbands, the women and their repeated appeals for help begin to wear on Madgett\'s conscience.','/7VSvsr87TazqEvxqTDTWMDCbjwt.jpg','1988-09-02',119,'Released','Three Women And A Coroner.','Drowning by Numbers',27362,2.8177,7,'5tBxhzpFO1M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9884,_binary '\0','/6uWtSE0NxODIgHNqAYUdtQjLV5G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092933',5.6,1975,'en','Dudes','Two punks from the big city, traveling across the country in a Volkswagen bug, embrace the western ethos when they must take revenge against a group of rednecks for killing their friend in this lighthearted road movie. Along the way, they enlist the help of a young woman who runs a wrecking service.','/2NThzQWYfuVbhq6qq2TxWnbVOZy.jpg','1987-08-01',90,'Released','They were looking for the American Dream. . . They found the American Nightmare.','Dudes',26574,2.2554,5.7,'fTjtNE4J6H8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9885,_binary '\0','/zTXMEdV26OiM6rTfZfKjjoHS3yH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092944',5.9,1769,'en','Eat the Rich','Alex is a disgruntled waiter at a snobby exclusive restaurant who falls on hard times. Forced to deal with the contempt and disgust of the upper class, Alex & cohorts attempt to go on a rampage. Meanwhile, General Karprov and Spider plot to involve the inept anarchists into their plans to derail the prime-minister-to-be\'s campaign.','/yFGWfpzH1sR4sL1T7J0Kae59UE9.jpg','1987-10-23',90,'Released','You are what you eat!','Eat the Rich',4292,2.1144,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9886,_binary '\0','/zAP5PZVtSIOZwweMaHmNKHJ3xTF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092948',7.6,21982,'en','Eddie Murphy Raw','Eddie Murphy delights, shocks and entertains with dead-on celebrity impersonations, observations on \'80s love, sex and marriage, a remembrance of Mom\'s hamburgers and much more.','/irVU3PHIdg36Rh8tSKnKCdmHLEO.jpg','1987-11-25',90,'Released','Shock has its value.','Eddie Murphy Raw',17159,3.1259,7.3,'rZu7bYiXryg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9887,_binary '\0','/kPw38zOlgudC1ys6J9CVDT4WzxF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092962',3.2,1291,'en','Emmanuelle 5','Emmanuelle, the sexiest woman in the world, endures a streak of bad luck that begins when she\'s stripped by a mob of adoring fans at an international film festival. Emmanuelle\'s lousy luck continues when she\'s abducted from her yacht off the South of France and forced to submit to the erotic desires of an Arab sheik.','/anR5lxDx7RUKwV59RFSD3uF3fTj.jpg','1987-01-07',85,'Released','She\'s hot, but she\'ll have to stay cool to stay alive.','Emmanuelle 5',146047,1.9698,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9888,_binary '\0','/pDDAfCdglMVzIWhJFep7xnUu1yG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092963',8.1,2455,'ja','ゆきゆきて、神軍','Kenzo Okuzaki, a 62-year-old veteran of the New Guinea campaign in World War II, sets out to conduct interviews with survivors and relatives to find the truth behind atrocities committed by Japanese military, in particular the unexplained killing of two Japanese privates in his unit.','/eJXoEt4FXd6sBTwy5W70zCeHd1F.jpg','1987-08-01',122,'Released',NULL,'The Emperor\'s Naked Army Marches On',51929,1.3475,7.6,'uXn7aFPedKc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9889,_binary '\0','/xt7boIC763DdceVQIGJdnmKlDVu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092965',7.7,144893,'en','Empire of the Sun','Jamie Graham, a privileged English boy, is living in Shanghai when the Japanese invade and force all foreigners into prison camps. Jamie is captured with an American sailor, who looks out for him while they are in the camp together. Even though he is separated from his parents and in a hostile environment, Jamie maintains his dignity and youthful spirit, providing a beacon of hope for the others held captive with him.','/gEaCzjwHoPgyQFcwHql7o5YLHAU.jpg','1987-12-09',153,'Released','To survive in a world at war, he must find a strength greater than all the events that surround him.','Empire of the Sun',10110,10.537,7.508,'NsU11wxFMbY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9890,_binary '\0','/869hD01hVERzIlEKVInIdPo3xxB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092969',6.2,1404,'en','Enemy Territory','An insurance salesman inadvertently gets trapped after dark in an apartment building that is terrorized by a street gang called \"The Vampires.\"','/qfMhoCpdhl0EWonPoACHgpUpznF.jpg','1987-05-22',89,'Released','In ENEMY TERRITORY they take no prisoners. You\'ve got to kill your way out.','Enemy Territory',100269,1.7585,5.6,'z28nzQI6fgY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9891,_binary '\0','/dLiEN68i1HgTf2voTzPAtsI1P1m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092972',5.9,6745,'da','Epidemic','A filmmaker and a writer collaborate on a screenplay, in which an epidemic spreads about the whole world. Like the protagonist, they do not notice, that a real epidemic is developing around them.','/5MvCaYCS3BLvSYdWpRDHahKbQZv.jpg','1987-09-11',106,'Released',NULL,'Epidemic',29445,1.9378,5.7,'cVv8--KUBV8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9892,_binary '\0','/hBew3uipRuqCcxQYFJcdaY2Upeu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092974',5.5,13476,'en','Ernest Goes to Camp','Ernest, a lovable loser who works as a summer camp handyman and dreams of becoming a guidance counselor, must find a way to inspire a group of juvenile delinquents while stopping a shady strip mining company from closing the camp as well.','/14GzgM3U2ABJ3h4ixhOkWpoQJAj.jpg','1987-05-22',92,'Released','Welcome to Kamp Kikakee, the craziest summer camp ever!','Ernest Goes to Camp',18935,3.7401,5.278,'dZF5WILuqZI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9893,_binary '\0','/sOhrxGvSJOaAJdBXHu1vQImfGuj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092978',7.3,10983,'en','Escape from Sobibor','The true story of WWII\'s notorious Sobibor Nazi death camp, where a courageous inmate orchestrates and leads the escape of over 300 prisoners.','/sAeljrIHTtKgJ2BaVoa9oCTmD4u.jpg','1987-04-12',169,'Released',NULL,'Escape from Sobibor',25318,3.7925,7.162,'Sg28i77xaNI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9894,_binary '\0','/8BjsbRzi8P9qkVG2MKK0VxCDqQS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092983',6.2,1499,'es','La estanquera de Vallecas','Leandro, an unemployed mason and his friend, Tocho, attempt to rob a tobacconist in the Vallecas district of Madrid, but Mrs. Justa, the tobacconist, impedes it alerting the neighbors who notify police. Inside the shop, the confrontation between the two friends and their \'hostages\', the tobacconist and her niece Angeles, is relaxing, and a budding sympathy arises between them.','/sYVf05vuuHZ53iJLJg1o1hdwHPq.jpg','1987-04-09',106,'Released',NULL,'The Tobacconist of Vallecas',111708,1.9319,6.3,'XubNxmaQOw0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9895,_binary '\0','/dOvEJK2u0slAGTfhdZOjnNgCQet.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092991',7.6,200327,'en','Evil Dead II','Ash Williams and his girlfriend Linda find a log cabin in the woods with a voice recording from an archeologist who had recorded himself reciting ancient chants from \"The Book of the Dead.\" As they play the recording an evil power is unleashed taking over Linda\'s body.','/4zqCKJVHUolGs6C5AZwAZqLWixW.jpg','1987-03-13',84,'Released','Kiss your nerves goodbye!','Evil Dead II',765,10.918,7.5,'s7WNgzilRBw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9896,_binary '\0','/4cd9YihTHx1j8oRdlwEa1emKiAl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092995',5.6,6802,'fr','Les Exploits d\'un jeune Don Juan','In 1914, sixteen year old Roger returned home from boarding school during vacation to find his puberty hit hard in a house filled with beautiful women. These women have previous engagements with other men who are away, and during this time, Roger impregnates them all, including his aunt and sister, then devises plans to cuckold the men.','/xvtRgQIRegLjsjaIkKQbh0hk3Qy.jpg','1986-11-04',100,'Released',NULL,'Exploits of a Young Don Juan',81774,14.866,6.166,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9897,_binary '\0','/l48O8fatTpS1nccR2MtJnh4EqRb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0092997',6.7,10083,'en','Extreme Prejudice','Lean, mean Texas Ranger Jack Benteen locks horns with a former friend, Cash Bailey, now a ruthless drug kingpin. Though they\'re on opposite sides of the law, they share a love interest in the sensual Sarita. When a crew of rogue soldiers descends upon the border town for an off-the-books mission, all roads lead to a bloody, to-the-death showdown, as loyalties shift and the lines between good and evil are blurred.','/fqN3duCLrjcsF8dfiP1XCCtlWZC.jpg','1987-04-24',105,'Released','An army of forgotten heroes, all officially dead. They live for combat. Now they\'ve met the wrong man.','Extreme Prejudice',20287,3.2813,6.275,'U1lJxpLK068','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9898,_binary '\0','/7QOWrNwtxDDpiSobrR442SIuMyC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093004',7.4,2837,'it','La famiglia','Formal portraits, bookends in this 80-year saga, enclose the central story, which opens with the baptism of Carlo, a baby in his grandfather\'s lap, and ends with Carlo as a grandfather with a baby in his arms. And never once do we get out of the house, whose rooms provide structure. Comfort or passion? Carlo can\'t really decide until it\'s too late.','/kq7CCOOWAEedCf2OpZ2kO6qBumq.jpg','1987-12-01',127,'Released','In 1906 Carlo was born into a very large family...','The Family',42008,2.0643,7.5,'7fq7W-_veeQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9899,_binary '\0','/j5W9P4DRL9qUvy38rzB4FIzjyjy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093006',6.6,1622,'en','Family Viewing','An emotionally constrained view of the displacement of human feelings in our video saturated society. Van regularly visits his grandmother in a run-down nursing home. His father depends on phone sex for guidance meanwhile erasing family homevideos of happier times with homemade pornography. Will Van rescue his grandmother and memories of his mother in time?','/xe1fz3anfmWAZUUQRPp90UPltxV.jpg','1987-09-09',86,'Released','Some things possess you at the strangest times','Family Viewing',26964,1.1719,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9900,_binary '\0','/2UlBdiveZcOVrlNe5MYcI6TYeA7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093010',6.9,112957,'en','Fatal Attraction','A married man\'s one-night stand comes back to haunt him when that lover begins to stalk him and his family.','/vjB9XwJKnYqFKKjhWcE6WpAf5Ki.jpg','1987-09-18',119,'Released','A look that led to an evening. A mistake he\'ll regret... FOR THE REST OF HIS LIFE.','Fatal Attraction',10998,10.1104,6.8,'e3oF8Po4qWc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9901,_binary '\0','/rDwXMJgt2hMfAEcjc1izABD6vys.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093011',5.4,4558,'en','Fatal Beauty','Detective Rita Rizzoli is accustomed to donning costumes and going undercover to nail crooks. But she\'ll be required to use all of her get-ups and more when a major cocaine ring is suspected of turning out a potent new strain of the drug, called \"Fatal Beauty.\" With the help of her partner and a former bodyguard for a local cartel, Rita will do whatever it takes to find out who\'s dealing Fatal Beauty and stop them.','/hm6wUVyFm1iRlvkQXBugDPItUec.jpg','1987-10-30',104,'Released','An earthquake is about to hit L.A. It\'s called Detective Rita Rizzoli.','Fatal Beauty',35463,2.5073,5.6,'_ApZB7W0-8A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9902,_binary '\0','/5KwIMLRVOfwVmYId7IEkhF5vssp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093015',7.1,10714,'cn','飛龍猛將','A hot-shot lawyer is hired by a Hong Kong chemical plant to dispose of opposition to their polluting ways. But when he falls for a beautiful woman out to stop the plant, he is torn in a conflict of interest and asks his trusty friends Samo and Biao to help out at least until they discover the true purpose of the plant.','/lt94C482UqyVlq1UdK5nvXukaw7.jpg','1988-02-11',93,'Released','Don\'t mess with these dragons!','Dragons Forever',21733,5.2551,7.246,'fDycgA5U7nw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9903,_binary '\0','/8N5ryumaXkftZtiPsCn0bXetxel.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093029',6.1,4107,'en','Five Corners','A psychotic young man returns to his old neighborhood after release from prison. He seeks out the woman he previously tried to rape and the man who protected her, with twisted ideas of love for her and hate for him.','/sjCavnds8Yfk57fG5GGtBhnNjrt.jpg','1987-09-11',94,'Released','Friends last forever. Goodness is its own reward. ...And there ain\'t no Indians in the Bronx.','Five Corners',71881,2.1125,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9904,_binary '\0','/sUfG1q7IDtxZbhjt9wec1erPmEk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093036',5.8,12370,'en','Flowers in the Attic','After the death of her husband, a mother takes her kids off to live with their grandparents in a huge, decrepit old mansion. However, the kids are kept hidden in a room just below the attic, visited only by their mother who becomes less and less concerned about them and their failing health, and more concerned about herself and the inheritence she plans to win back from her dying father.','/upcJxm5AquYh9lTPaJEQ6tgoVbg.jpg','1987-11-20',93,'Released','Home sweet home is murder.','Flowers in the Attic',15658,4.2772,6.267,'YcigQrW8CMY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9905,_binary '\0','/jh0xmnqv2nIuPBjEzoUfnxLFsKi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093043',5.7,3098,'it','Le foto di Gioia','Gioia is a buxom centerfold working for Pussycat magazine. In such a profession, having an admirer or two is expected, but Gioia\'s admirer is a vicious killer! He murders her fellow magazine models one at a time, using a variety of twisted implements of death. Gioia is the lucky recipient of a collection of photos, each with murdered bodies arranged around posters of her.','/zLlnOkp9othRluCi2WGIkynVozX.jpg','1987-04-02',94,'Released','Beauty is in the eye of the beholder.','Delirium: Photo of Gioia',28327,3.289,5.5,'58kVuoyE7IM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9906,_binary '\0','/48wk2XbofCCX5SJbgX1aF8jJUVa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093044',6.5,12354,'en','The Fourth Protocol','Led by Kim Philby, Plan Aurora is a plan that breaches the top-secret Fourth Protocol and turns the fears that shaped it into a living nightmare. A crack Soviet agent, placed under cover in a quiet English country town, begins to assemble a nuclear bomb, whilst an MI5 agent attempts to prevent its detonation.','/7CQdgXMGUHfej4hCoOIEUq8gMUW.jpg','1987-03-20',119,'Released','If the Fourth Protocol is ever breached, there would be no warning, just a nuclear explosion from a bedsitter... The unthinkable has just begun.','The Fourth Protocol',4918,4.0755,6.315,'j0iTmHQzyno','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9907,_binary '\0','/kUfnew2U5ZeWoqe9MJuv8g7DZdL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093051',6.1,2812,'en','From the Hip','Apprentice lawyer Robin Weathers turns a civil suit into a headline grabbing charade. He must reexamine his scruples after his shenanigans win him a promotion in his firm, and he must now defend a college professor who is appearantly guilty of murder.','/jkwzakMmaasylJc2Uj9LvL8bSOk.jpg','1987-02-06',111,'Released','Getting To The Top Means Working Like A Dog!','From the Hip',24081,1.4651,5.9,'xPjkWFB4FwY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9908,_binary '\0','/3k2TRmqMjgt7tcwkYwZQdctnty3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093058',8.2,859417,'en','Full Metal Jacket','A pragmatic U.S. Marine observes the dehumanizing effects the U.S.-Vietnam War has on his fellow recruits from their brutal boot camp training to the bloody street fighting in Hue.','/kMKyx1k8hWWscYFnPbnxxN4Eqo4.jpg','1987-06-26',117,'Released','In Vietnam, the wind doesn\'t blow. It sucks.','Full Metal Jacket',600,17.4525,8.119,'3Un-WBlVHPw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9909,_binary '\0','/rGWnAU5UUKnSf0QJ87ll5vlu91t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093072',2.7,9384,'en','The Garbage Pail Kids Movie','Crude, grotesque, pint-sized aliens known as the Garbage Pail Kids® help a young boy exact revenge on his bullies and win the girl of his dreams.','/v6PqKUptGhQjTTgqN2s2uPdNW0h.jpg','1987-08-22',96,'Released','Out of the garbage pail and into your heart!','The Garbage Pail Kids Movie',14443,3.1198,3.6,'VotzSOJYcOI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9910,_binary '\0','/iOhj9IPNRppo5oiJbYSniYtAffZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093073',6.3,6870,'en','Gardens of Stone','At Arlington National Cemetery during the Vietnam era, veteran sergeant Clell Hazard trains young soldiers while mourning those lost in combat. Unable to return to war himself, he mentors Jackie Willow—the idealistic son of a fallen comrade—hoping to prepare him for the realities of Vietnam and the cost of duty.','/bptiOG8kCoq1WUpWEwMyAIaMED4.jpg','1987-05-05',111,'Released','The story of the war at home, and the people who lived through it.','Gardens of Stone',28368,3.8159,6.2,'nXbEHBE7DFc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9911,_binary '\0','/vxRUX12ZXoTwffLcqS7RAZqcknj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093075',6.1,22088,'en','The Gate','Three young children accidentally release a horde of nasty, pint-sized demons from a hole in a suburban backyard. What follows is a classic battle between good and evil as the three kids struggle to overcome a nightmarish hell that is literally taking over the Earth.','/ik7AfGWpwKnjaQeth3LZqrqzvfB.jpg','1987-04-21',86,'Released','Pray it\'s not too late.','The Gate',6917,3.1846,6.1,'2EtfZocT0Fo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9912,_binary '\0','/vtV0N41RHLJ7QS6GQqAGlkI3J3I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093090',4.8,3339,'en','La casa 3','A group of unlikely companions receive a radio call leading to a deserted house with a grisly past.','/hC7qz0fYeomKqcieHmcBV1wRx0R.jpg','1988-05-21',95,'Released','We dare you to go inside...','Ghosthouse',30997,1.6748,5.1,'bYxHXN7SWUQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9913,_binary '\0','/2k9ii9qcZ3nbR5J1LOocJfbR2oc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093091',4.7,6296,'en','Ghoulies II','Four bloodthirsty demons stow away on a truck belonging to the owners of a carnival attraction and, after arriving at the fairgrounds, hole up inside the ride, which becomes a sensation after patrons believe the creatures are part of the show.','/1UlogpztvssNEjdIfs1MUiD0xM0.jpg','1987-07-31',90,'Released','They\'ll get you in the end...again!','Ghoulies II',28605,2.422,5.5,'8z3oCwxXqJ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9914,_binary '\0','/o955wc8tZaZHiQGw2FSV8mbsdqI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093093',7.1,2455,'en','The Glass Menagerie','An aging Southern Belle complicates life for her ambitious son and crippled daughter because of her own warped views of what life should be.','/zF02disLmOSyb3BSS4c50MC7xNo.jpg','1987-05-27',134,'Released',NULL,'The Glass Menagerie',52780,1.8296,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9915,_binary '\0','/76DYy8N4meTRFGFHcqCcMmbJlQm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093104',6.7,1877,'it','Good Morning, Babilonia','After the bankruptcy of their father\'s stonemasonry firm, brothers Nicola and Andrea emigrate to America to restore their fortunes. After many adventures and near-disasters, they end up in Hollywood, designing sets for D.W. Griffith, and marry beautiful actresses. However, tragedy strikes with the arrival of World War I, which finds the brothers fighting on opposite sides...','/nQmPgRyabH8HUmtda0JbpEsaK1F.jpg','1987-05-13',117,'Released',NULL,'Good Morning, Babylon',48149,2.0702,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9916,_binary '\0','/mbgJEkrJ0uBOakLwpufdmW4K8Im.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093105',7.3,167469,'en','Good Morning, Vietnam','A disk jockey goes to Vietnam to work for the Armed Forces Radio Service. While he becomes popular among the troops, his superiors disapprove of his humor.','/sreISlFUn5TyR41QNjlfAdX5SEW.jpg','1987-12-23',121,'Released','The wrong man. In the wrong place. At the right time.','Good Morning, Vietnam',801,7.4997,7.299,'3mJoHqmtFcQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9917,_binary '\0','/aRL7LeGlLkaTooSLmpPCY4ixx0u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093111',7.3,1972,'fr','Le Grand Chemin','Louis, a nine-year-old boy from Paris, spends his summer vacation in a small town in Brittany. His mother Claire has lodged him with her girlfriend Marcelle and her husband Pelo while she\'s having her second baby. There Louis makes friends with Martine, the ten-year- old girl next door, and learns from her about life.','/aLHEn5Yw8SDkhbqnOU0gpOOGzY5.jpg','1987-03-25',104,'Released',NULL,'The Grand Highway',60797,1.875,7.272,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9918,_binary '\0','/tY1vqXkowv5dkV4TdGew2mOG8g3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093113',5.3,1492,'it','Django 2 - Il grande ritorno','Former gunfighter Django has become a monk and abandoned his violent former ways. His daughter is kidnapped by rogue Hungarian soldiers using slave labor to run a silver mine. Django casts off his habit and digs up his machine gun to practice a little liberation theology.','/1rkSeuO2cGcT3CQ47ZxLRHMcGZ8.jpg','1987-10-22',96,'Released','Forget Young Guns. Here comes the BIG GUN.','Django Strikes Again',77079,2.2055,5.1,'vDWvt4Sp6CM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9919,_binary '\0','/k4majNU63nK1XTeh7wCdaMSUYqK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093119',2.6,2369,'en','Grizzly II: Revenge','All hell breaks loose when a giant grizzly, reacting to the slaughter of her cubs by poachers, attacks a massive rock concert in the National Park. [This sequel to \"Grizzly\" (1976) was left unfinished after production wrapped prematurely in 1983, and was not officially released until 2020, though a bootleg workprint version had been in circulation for some years prior to this.]','/dKHoRIicgHLoNPKiRJpRPHd96Gx.jpg','2020-02-17',74,'Released','The Stage Is Set... And The Dinner Is Served.','Grizzly II: Revenge',38258,2.8078,3.121,'fzweOFrZ0xM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9920,_binary '\0','/AiFmwDpFYuTa3XhKGQ1gisxHLAu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093132',7.9,6464,'ja','ハチ公物語','The tragic, true story about Hachikō, an Akita dog who was loyal to his master, Professor Ueno, even after Ueno\'s death.','/3g5oG4bQCC4sk9DkVQACK89fa7Y.jpg','1987-08-01',107,'Released','Love between a dog and his master. A story of devotion, which transcends time and space.','Hachiko',31743,3.2604,7.8,'d_u1FrfgSwo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9921,_binary '\0','/pRpg9OAe4hrThTPxPSPzc185f0D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093137',6.7,30316,'en','Hamburger Hill','The men of Bravo Company are facing a battle that\'s all uphill… up Hamburger Hill. Fourteen war-weary soldiers are battling for a mud-covered mound of earth so named because it chews up soldiers like chopped meat. They are fighting for their country, their fellow soldiers and their lives. War is hell, but this is worse. Hamburger Hill tells it the way it was, the way it really was. It\'s a raw, gritty and totally unrelenting dramatic depiction of one of the fiercest battles of America\'s bloodiest war. This happened. Hamburger Hill - war at its worst, men at their best.','/a84FDoIm64qcyKq6BEMB9Ycldpt.jpg','1987-08-07',110,'Released','War at its worst fought by young men at their best','Hamburger Hill',10652,5.2458,6.6,'58n3NpuYw9Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9922,_binary '\0','/YbzfnWSeZvfABKn0zSyY3IY0IV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093139',6.8,2776,'fi','Hamlet liikemaailmassa','When Hamlet discovers his father’s deceased body, he finds himself pulled into a power struggle as his scheming uncle attempts to secure a monopoly on the Scandinavian rubber duck industry. Will Hamlet avenge his father? Will he become the king of rubber ducks? Does any of it really matter?','/5OjVh44NDV3m8ePTt2BXMWTzlH5.jpg','1987-08-21',89,'Released',NULL,'Hamlet Goes Business',8749,1.121,6.7,'MFofx9xoBBY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9923,_binary '\0','/kqudnrpORxq70WvtzUrkyYuyGiW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093142',2.9,1316,'en','Hangmen','Rob Greene has information about an undercover terror team inside the CIA led by Joe Connelly. To stay alive with the knowledge, he is advised to stay undercover by his supervisor Andrews. Connelly\'s men try to kill Greene, but he can escape and warns his son Danny that he also may be in danger and that he should look for Dog Thompson.','/gtSD18nFsPjOz2AnFVOoiUWHTf6.jpg','1987-05-01',90,'Released','In this world no one is innocent, and if you want to live, you\'ve got to beat the Hangmen.','Hangmen',47749,2.2897,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9924,_binary '\0','/6mIwrIINTuae7GwgnNrl0UhuX9b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093143',6.1,1329,'en','The Hanoi Hilton','Lionel Chetwynd\'s film documents the horrific struggles that faced American POWs held in the North Vietnamese prison Hoa Lo -- more infamously known as the Hanoi Hilton -- between 1964 and 1975. Williamson (Michael Moriarty) leads a group of American servicemen who are prisoners at the detention camp. He assumes command after Cathcart (Lawrence Pressman) is dragged off to be tortured.','/48Jl0Do3c4VBvg24S7uJ7jvJAlo.jpg','1987-03-27',126,'Released','For Americans captured in Vietnam, one war ended. Another was about to begin.','The Hanoi Hilton',73091,1.7467,5.3,'aSBDyj0Ex4E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9925,_binary '\0','/xCRSG7hiTgAZsuSiaslpsXAG1vp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093144',6.5,1675,'en','Hansel and Gretel','Hansel and Gretel tells the tale of two young children driven from home by their scolding mother. Losing their way in the dark forest they stumble upon the cottage of a kindly old woman. But is this kindly old woman everything she seems...?','/t7JGa8XRHtBgDcIOnQp9ZMJu5yr.jpg','1988-12-10',84,'Released','They lost their way...but found a magical adventure!','Hansel and Gretel',72984,3.664,7.1,'yIyGnhpxMTA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9926,_binary '\0','/re26fPPEHFBqPNs89Zfq7mcINRk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093146',5.1,6274,'en','Hard Ticket to Hawaii','A Molokai-based civilian pilot and an undercover DEA agent intercept a delivery of diamonds intended for druglord Seth Romero. Seth, his henchmen, and other island undesirables launch a full-scale assault on the duo. If they\'re going to survive, they\'ll need the help of agent Rowdy Abilene and his partner/kickboxing expert Jade.','/yZBHqhCZYAAihDBgMvQziITtLUO.jpg','1987-03-01',96,'Released','Pay the price for paradise!','Hard Ticket to Hawaii',26011,3.9194,5.035,'UV7h4-2ZUqE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9927,_binary '\0','/4DGZNuxMMcCjVjmn2INTUu66mWX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093148',6.1,39966,'en','Harry and the Hendersons','Returning from a hunting trip in the forest, the Henderson family\'s car hits an animal in the road. At first they fear it was a man, but when they examine the \"body\" they find it\'s a \"bigfoot\". They think it\'s dead so they decide to take it home (there could be some money in this). As you guessed, it isn\'t dead. Far from being the ferocious monster they fear \"Harry\" to be, he\'s a friendly giant.','/5ZNWhOEsuNHIQ1gbtwdTGK7srCr.jpg','1987-06-05',110,'Released','When you can\'t believe your eyes, trust your heart.','Harry and the Hendersons',8989,6.0822,6.119,'5DOX1Poxro4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9928,_binary '\0','/8VT51c3E2LyO4gdbXubfFjoooyz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093159',6.7,1765,'en','A Hazard of Hearts','In a desperate bid to cover his debts, compulsive gambler Sir Giles Staverley stakes his estate and his daughter\'s hand on a game of chance. Serena Staverley soon finds herself bound to a mysterious victor and trapped in a cliff-top manor.','/Atqiil78fDTMaMwVrdHqejHOpiK.jpg','1987-12-27',90,'Released','Where strangers are brought together by a game of chance.','A Hazard of Hearts',48406,2.544,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9929,_binary '\0','/6oatLAm5s5mNPVju17ngimwL5o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093164',5.7,3020,'en','Heat','Reynolds plays an ex-soldier-of-fortunish character in Vegas, taking \"Chaperone\" jobs, fighting with the mob, and trying to get enough money together to move to Venice, Italy.','/wsfL3kmdCbf34r2lykibFjavqVT.jpg','1986-10-16',101,'Released',NULL,'Heat',42023,2.0464,5.79,'S99H3S1L0pY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9930,_binary '\0','/aeNkgFCMlbtVN3sWHfDqTR6BCiP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093169',6.8,2314,'nl','Hector','Hector\'s parents sent him to an orphanage in treatment for smallpox but... they never picked him up. 35 years later, he still lives in the orphanage, surrounded by children, his playmates. Till a forgotten aunt remembers that he exists. She\'ll get him to participate in the bakery of her husband, Achilles, to work. Hector shows his skills on the basis of unexpected inventions. So he helps Jos, the son of Achilles, to accomplish his dream to be a cycling champion. Hector\'s good humor and childlike manner overcomes all resistance and pulls his entire entourage along on the path to success. From now on he can learn what love is...','/1fB477SW0unE2IZJ7dQ64R7THAc.jpg','1987-10-19',95,'Released',NULL,'Hector',44417,1.1875,6.7,'8Mu-M_Vf3cg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9931,_binary '\0','/8yscpKDJQnMz2O98bZKiHyknn64.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093170',6.1,8402,'cn','黑太陽731','Japanese troops round up Chinese and Russian prisoners of war and take them to unit 731, where they\'re horribly tortured and experimented on to test new biological weapons.','/vTbOXA1gBIhuumN5CnRhxfDp9xY.jpg','1988-12-01',105,'Released','Awful, bloody, sick and… true!','Men Behind the Sun',25998,4.5119,6.284,'qT8YIpyJFXg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9932,_binary '\0','/2E3DhgwTK7RnQ9oO2zjiYVpXIn2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093171',5.6,8810,'en','Hell Comes to Frogtown','\'Hell\' is the name of the hero of the story. He\'s a prisoner of the women who now run the USA after a nuclear/biological war. Results of the war are that mutants have evolved, and the human race is in danger of extinction due to infertility. Hell is given the task of helping in the rescue of a group of fertile women from the harem of the mutant leader (resembling a frog). Hell cannot escape since he has a bomb attached to his private parts which will detonate if he strays more than a few hundred yards from his guard.','/7ry5Sh2oFBUj8zqWzAx5Xm8j79i.jpg','1988-01-29',88,'Released','A new breed of enemy has taken over the world... Sam Hell has come to take it back.','Hell Comes to Frogtown',22572,3.0109,5.528,'G7ouC--Yr2E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9933,_binary '\0','/piDfTEdgPABqE9JC0LsuMvcVqtK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093175',5.3,4061,'en','Hello Again','A suburban housewife chokes to death and is brought back to life by a spell cast by her wacky sister.','/mbNJ7Qe33XtN2aenO0ildCOpG0y.jpg','1987-11-06',96,'Released','Her life hasn\'t been the same since her death.','Hello Again',35151,2.7791,5.711,'D3Gr1P6oM7I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9934,_binary '\0','/w6OKe2d54o9CUnCGBgUmvDT8loU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093176',5.8,9069,'en','Hello Mary Lou: Prom Night II','Mary Lou Maloney, Hamilton High\'s Prom Queen of 1957, is killed during her coronation ceremony due to a prank gone wrong by her jilted boyfriend, Billy Nordham. Thirty years later, teen Vicki Carpenter is in the running for Prom Queen, but accidentally unleashes the vengeful spirit of Mary Lou, who will stop at nothing to be rightfully crowned, even if it means taking Vicki\'s poor body for a cruise!','/RCjdqmiz0yT3X16uWfuizg0qHQ.jpg','1987-10-16',97,'Released','You Can\'t Keep a Bad Girl Down!','Hello Mary Lou: Prom Night II',39929,3.6509,6.1,'cxKUQENmcsg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9935,_binary '\0','/jInJNDIyzlYBV79nx8Qb5s2xjfM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093177',6.9,155867,'en','Hellraiser','A hedonistic man finds a mysterious puzzle box that summons a group of gruesome beings known as the Cenobites. These otherworldly entities open the doors to a dominion where pain and pleasure are indivisible.','/3Z0oPHyLnk3Vx6ZMC1MiVwIrKhO.jpg','1987-09-11',93,'Released','Demon to some. Angel to others.','Hellraiser',9003,9.6703,6.892,'mtJDaFk_va4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9936,_binary '\0','/2NmdN2nUxoxRtZWa0qa2b9etoKy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093185',7,26050,'en','The Hidden','When average, law-abiding citizens suddenly turn to a life of hedonistic behavior and violent crime, Detective Tom Beck is tasked with helping young FBI agent Lloyd Gallagher determine the cause.','/pCoFtULUIebq13EU9glcZjfdC1a.jpg','1987-10-30',97,'Released','It\'s only human on the outside...','The Hidden',12476,6.0321,6.9,'9GzW7dx6FoI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9937,_binary '\0','/fZLYwPvee0FzKuKEDmgCgfhXNhv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093186',6.3,4720,'en','Hiding Out','A very successful stock broker is called to court to testify against a mob boss who was into some inside trading. Andrew Morenski must become Max Hauser and go back to high school for protection from the mob.','/3WSSvu6dTBZFPfLEMTX2exzquBO.jpg','1987-11-06',98,'Released','There\'s only one thing more frightening than murder.. High School','Hiding Out',26156,1.7551,5.84,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9938,_binary '\0','/7TlGXrB4WQ3wbpOCUQnBXseCuOl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093191',7.9,84853,'de','Der Himmel über Berlin','Two angels, Damiel and Cassiel, glide through the streets of Berlin, observing the bustling population, providing invisible rays of hope to the distressed but never interacting with them. When Damiel falls in love with lonely trapeze artist Marion, the angel longs to experience life in the physical world, and finds — with some words of wisdom from actor Peter Falk — that it might be possible for him to take human form.','/iZQs2vUeCzvS1KfZJ6uYNCGJBBV.jpg','1987-09-23',128,'Released','There are angels on the streets of Berlin.','Wings of Desire',144,9.0324,7.762,'0iAzYofuItM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9939,_binary '\0','/nF4OKHPBAbVzqP4RQ5SknzD93T7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093200',6.9,7274,'en','Hollywood Shuffle','Aspiring actor and hot-dog stand employee Bobby Taylor catches the ire of his grandmother for auditioning for a role in the regrettably titled exploitation film \"Jivetime Jimmy\'s Revenge.\" When Tinseltown Studios casts Taylor in the title role, he has a series of conflicted dreams satirizing African-American stereotypes in Hollywood, and must reconcile his career goals with his desire to remain a positive role model for his little brother.','/xidkzvrJfBeZ6wVcVOxobZruiR7.jpg','1987-03-20',81,'Released','Bobby Taylor was on his way to becoming a star, when a funny thing happened...','Hollywood Shuffle',34101,2.4255,6.514,'iUM9Hkvf0Co','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9940,_binary '\0','/4bjVA2NrkrdNPPpKUt7eR2P3xlf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093206',7.3,10804,'zh','红高粱','An old leper who owned a remote sorghum winery dies. Jiu\'er, the wife bought by the leper, and her lover, identified only as \"my Grandpa\" by the narrator, take over the winery and set up an idealized quasi-matriarchal community headed by Jiu\'er. When the Japanese invaders subject the area to their rule and cut down the sorghum to make way for a road, the community rises up and resists as the sorghum grows anew.','/2CP2eazEBKJ3njm4HM63pMfs5tW.jpg','1988-10-10',91,'Released',NULL,'Red Sorghum',42006,2.9061,7.2,'MFppekhfpgQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9941,_binary '\0','/wft4xh2dZnP7zeapkRMoB6lHU5l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093207',7.2,6346,'ja','王立宇宙軍 オネアミスの翼','On a future Earth, war between the Kingdom of Honneamise and its rival, The Republic, is inevitable. As evolving technology creates new ways to wage war, a small group seeks to propel mankind into space in their world’s first spaceflight program. For astronaut candidate Shirotsugh Lhadatt, it’s a personal odyssey as he grows from an aimless young man into a leader willing to put everything on the line in order to move the human race forward and away from the brink of Armageddon.','/iIwFPYZS1BxGydf9weYH8hBFVfK.jpg','1987-03-14',121,'Released',NULL,'Royal Space Force - The Wings of Honneamise',20043,3.8062,6.89,'IMSGLZ-1Rmo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9942,_binary '\0','/7PktT8qvNEvGi7iTa5FEjG5DzJA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093209',7.3,16067,'en','Hope and Glory','A middle-aged man recalls his childhood growing up in and around London during World War II.','/4xE9oW222uiaJwMWqAdGQw4puOX.jpg','1987-09-03',113,'Released','The epic story of a world at war. And a boy at play.','Hope and Glory',32054,3.5807,6.9,'32wyLEBf60c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9943,_binary '\0','/m34KEAggTP3e5YCSUVnU73INxZC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093215',5.8,4532,'en','Hot Pursuit','High school student Dan Bartlett misses the plane he was supposed to be on with his rich girlfriend and her family on the way to a Caribbean vacation during a school break. He flies there alone, and runs into a series of characters and misadventures as he tries to catch up.','/rCHL7yjawXxz9WLZ7Z5Q615OIHt.jpg','1987-05-08',93,'Released','She promised him ten days together in paradise. He never dreamed how far he\'d have to go.','Hot Pursuit',14464,3.4922,5.7,'Fz7mMvSp_R8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9944,_binary '\0','/wgnJ5q5fENe9ekFJ63RfTfuV5Bd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093220',5.4,13489,'en','House II: The Second Story','Jesse moves into an old family property where his parents were mysteriously murdered years before. He soon finds himself with unexpected guests in the form of his mummified great-great grandfather, a mystical crystal skull, and a zombie cowboy.','/o58So9NfjKPITUQhQdpCUdTi9Vn.jpg','1987-05-14',88,'Released','It\'s getting weirder!','House II: The Second Story',37530,5.1697,5.6,'uF70pbMatKc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9945,_binary '\0','/fPZIQ0l7zCvQQqpYXVeFvjcyGpj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093223',7.2,26160,'en','House of Games','A psychiatrist comes to the aid of a compulsive gambler and is led by a smooth-talking grifter into the shadowy but compelling world of stings, scams, and con men.','/4i27Ut4cIoLbcNpW7aeuUQErEPE.jpg','1987-10-11',102,'Released','Human nature is a sucker bet.','House of Games',26719,3.0156,6.818,'iihr5J6Oky4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9946,_binary '\0','/sETDgbocuqM3StaXxY0vamlZLUA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093225',7.1,3344,'en','Housekeeping','In the Pacific Northwest during the 1950s, two young sisters whose mother has abandoned them wind up living with their Aunt Sylvie, whose views of the world and its conventions don\'t quite live up to most people\'s expectations.','/chLoHQjsw484y6nUYTtSgr5BKBF.jpg','1987-11-25',116,'Released','The story of a woman slightly distracted by the possibilities of life.','Housekeeping',65501,1.9828,6.6,'Ask1brD5nLA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9947,_binary '\0','/kDHTfwcok9RVVJDyJXi6ChYSrV3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093227',3.6,6153,'en','The Marsupials: The Howling III','A strange race of human-like marsupials appear suddenly in Australia, and a sociologist who studies these creatures falls in love with a female one. Is this a dangerous combination?','/jzYXHaEe8fnOXC3kn2SZnv2Dv2h.jpg','1987-05-15',98,'Released','The fear is breeding… fast!','The Marsupials: The Howling III',32595,3.6606,4.5,'MrNCGVO84w0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9948,_binary '\0','/gx5POm4v5uwres9jSM10Aq9BHyt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093229',6.6,3921,'cn','皇家師姐','Two unlucky thieves break into a just murdered man\'s hotel room and steal his passport, with a hidden microfilm, wanted by a triad boss. Two ass-kicking women cops—one Chinese, one British—are on the case.','/4KcufMSckdPInz4VAxg3VTpQtDo.jpg','1985-11-30',93,'Released',NULL,'Yes, Madam!',39448,3.3944,7.217,'BbG39mFhz9Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9949,_binary '\0','/wxXmcJLiRLMWH8o1oXLGvcwQu2p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093231',4.7,1677,'en','Hunk','A \"devilish\" tale about an ordinary guy who is visited by a beautiful apparition promising him popularity and drop-dead good looks in exchange for his soul. Transformed overnight into a \"hunk,\" he soon discovers there may be hell to pay for his new lifestyle!','/3a6kcPgxU7yTxEJ0MZoYqzJ2FOa.jpg','1987-03-06',102,'Released','He made a devil of a deal... Now there\'s hell to pay!','Hunk',32227,2.4468,5.6,'iHXFpWT8cds','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9950,_binary '\0','/evlWZL4Cs5ua61R7DxlmpbGxHgt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093239',6.7,2149,'en','I\'ve Heard the Mermaids Singing','Scatterbrained Polly gets a job as a secretary in Gabrielle\'s art gallery. Polly aspires to be a professional photographer, and idolizes Gabrielle for her artistic ability. When Gabrielle rekindles an old romantic relationship with the younger painter Mary, Polly becomes jealous, and discovers Gabrielle isn’t exactly who she claims to be.','/ms97uqYfxGVyT3X2J9KT08h1LFi.jpg','1987-09-11',81,'Released','Isn\'t life the strangest thing you\'ve ever seen?','I\'ve Heard the Mermaids Singing',117233,1.8121,5.7,'f-TU9CoxAx0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9951,_binary '\0','/4kpbkS9V4QJcQBnvxvRfRojdFyI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093258',7.3,4275,'cn','胭脂扣','Amid the opulent teahouses of 1930s Hong Kong, a humble courtesan and the wayward scion of a wealthy family fall in love and embrace death by suicide pact. Fifty years later, her ghost returns to find him, drawing a young contemporary couple into her quest to rekindle a passion that may be as illusory as time itself.','/q2wAAeGagOmqmqEkEgveLJYBj89.jpg','1987-12-05',96,'Released','They loved across two generations and two different worlds.','Rouge',68883,2.9224,7.4,'GESBqO7UDxU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9952,_binary '\0','/pM4tWr37Y2cOB0mVGmvbshKpvmP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093260',6.9,70822,'en','Innerspace','Test pilot Tuck Pendleton volunteers to test a special vessel for a miniaturization experiment. Accidentally injected into a neurotic hypochondriac, Jack Putter, Tuck must convince Jack to find his ex-girlfriend, Lydia Maxwell, to help him extract Tuck and his ship and re-enlarge them before his oxygen runs out.','/nuK4HEeIByWg1BSJrXAAQ4pIAJW.jpg','1987-07-01',120,'Released','An adventure of incredible proportions.','Innerspace',2614,7.0523,6.8,'HdCHKpppaCA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9953,_binary '\0','/au9b2tTuEC9T57rB2JAaEGReqky.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093267',7,3634,'it','Intervista','Federico Fellini welcomes us into his world of film making with a mockumentary about his life in film, as a Japanese film crew follows him around.','/laP2XdPEPrpTgv0ZjS8c9f47X2t.jpg','1987-10-01',108,'Released',NULL,'Intervista',47715,1.549,6.8,'yCzMCZ0aCIY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9954,_binary '\0','/tAfLlU2ZoGu1z4jsWyiuPZIK1bi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093276',3.7,1253,'it','Ator il guerriero di ferro','The Fighting Eagle returns again, sans Thong, to the legendary realm of Dragor to do battle with Phaedra, an evil sorceress. Her main weapon is an unstoppable warrior, known as the Master of the Sword, who continuously battles Ator to a draw, until finally revealing his secret connection to the Blademaster.','/a1ufdI5znyl6nu7nXZpryra5ZvW.jpg','1987-01-09',83,'Released','Born of a sorceress... sired by a dragon... baptized in blood!','Iron Warrior',48193,2.0283,4.7,'GuMbC_T6q-E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9955,_binary '\0','/2WrVjk2CFpEmNGXEvbhiFPIzLgp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093277',6.7,10814,'en','Ironweed','An alcoholic drifter spends Halloween in his hometown of Albany, New York after returning there for the first time in decades.','/rqVu5FREmvI83jyPpY4jxLTVRxd.jpg','1987-12-18',143,'Released','Hard times and Good times. Francis and Helen.','Ironweed',40962,2.8537,6.3,'w_0TJ6GtaLM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9956,_binary '\0','/lrGiV89QtomvweMugwAhwKpJkeV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093278',4.8,12941,'en','Ishtar','Two terrible lounge singers get booked to play a gig in a Moroccan hotel but somehow become pawns in an international power play between the CIA, the Emir of Ishtar, and the rebels trying to overthrow his regime.','/2n6cDGd84I1KvCeYlTju7MBC9sN.jpg','1987-05-15',107,'Released','Telling the truth can be dangerous business.','Ishtar',12704,2.739,4.576,'z6_Odb-Bd1E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9957,_binary '\0','/r4nLjfKc2QvqnOG2nyRJHOEo0s4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093286',4.9,2525,'en','It\'s Alive III: Island of the Alive','The mutant babies have been placed by court order on a deserted island. Appalled by the cynicism and exploitation by the legal system and the media, the man responsible leads an expedition to the island to free them.','/rmi6F3qtYnP0NdLiL0zkABtg1MY.jpg','1987-05-27',94,'Released','They do something worse than kill. They multiply.','It\'s Alive III: Island of the Alive',49684,2.7316,5.3,'P_HfT3LQ7H0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9958,_binary '\0','/wn4iwTix9AVcMMVbWNOG9ddstuI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093295',7.2,1899,'fr','Jane B. par Agnès V.','The interests, obsessions, and fantasies of two singular artists converge in this inspired collaboration between Agnès Varda and her longtime friend Jane Birkin. Made over the course of a year and motivated by Birkin’s fourtieth birthday—a milestone she admits to have some anxiety over—Jane B. by Agnès V. contrasts the private, reflective Birkin with Birkin the icon.','/bBILEecu4pEZiW4DhL86OhIiGt.jpg','1988-03-02',99,'Released',NULL,'Jane B. by Agnès V.',53028,2.7841,6.8,'nATEW42x75I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9959,_binary '\0','/grIaRfJJz7VrMSpFxTTdD5GEbE4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093300',3.1,53159,'en','Jaws: The Revenge','After another deadly shark attack, Ellen Brody decides she has had enough of New England\'s Amity Island and moves to the Caribbean to join her son, Michael, and his family. But a great white shark has followed her there, hungry for more lives.','/ebYw9tR0iqBzDGA6HVBhtd2xJM3.jpg','1987-07-17',89,'Released','This time it\'s personal.','Jaws: The Revenge',580,6.9763,4.094,'PMXarjDD86E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9960,_binary '\0','/znCviSD3g65irVaIQjxmavpiiZE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093304',7.2,3937,'cn','監獄風雲','A veteran inmate takes a newcomer under his wing as the pair confront both other violent inmates and the prison\'s corrupt wardens.','/59o7OyB8J37GwOAod9mhgJjhgH2.jpg','1987-11-13',98,'Released',NULL,'Prison on Fire',53653,3.5974,7,'qF8jHJO7_g8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9961,_binary '\0','/mlo31XZhJ9mEgS7Is6L3cz75UyQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093312',8.1,1602,'en','Jimi Plays Monterey','Jimi Hendrix\'s debut American set at 1967\'s Monterey Pop Festival is generally considered one of the most radical and legendary live shows ever. Virtually unknown to American audiences at the time, even though he was already an established entity in the UK, Hendrix and his two-piece Experience explode on stage, ripping through blues classics \"Rock Me Baby\" and Howlin\' Wolf\'s \"Killing Floor,\" interpreting and electrifying Bob Dylan\'s \"Like a Rolling Stone,\" debuting songs from his yet-to-be-released first album and closing with the now historic sacrificing/burning of his guitar during an unhinged version of \"Wild Thing\" that even its writer Chip Taylor would never have imagined. Hendrix uses feedback and distortion to enhance the songs in whisper-to-scream intensity, blazing territory that had not been previously explored with as much soul-frazzled power.','/lpO4JSRMzGH1A8KbXhyDFvlNe3D.jpg','1987-10-16',50,'Released',NULL,'Jimi Plays Monterey',26028,1.6007,7.5,'JfwysuXH4Rk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9962,_binary '\0','/tMOtsQrizNSnc6NfBBw9x2G3rd3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093336',7.1,1264,'de','Die Katze','Two bank robbers hold the clerks hostage and demand 3 million German marks as ransom. What the police do not realize is that the true criminal mastermind watches them from outside the bank, anticipating every move.','/3CulpHDM3QzSno1Vc0sm1rUUeLa.jpg','1988-01-21',118,'Released',NULL,'The Cat',148866,1.3967,6.4,'KdhlJLJUiYg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9963,_binary '\0','/ylBiGZhgBsly0frseG2PvqoYM4o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093342',8.1,23687,'fa','خانه‌ی دوست کجاست؟','An 8-year-old boy must return his friend\'s notebook he took by mistake, lest his friend be punished by expulsion from school.','/lrrtMVv2X8PNO7UA0Ce0gTtfuC8.jpg','1987-07-01',83,'Released',NULL,'Where Is The Friend\'s House?',49964,7.2745,7.922,'run-u_2zAdA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9964,_binary '\0','/hReApbw8C8603VdeqYmuf1pRz89.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093347',5.3,1438,'en','The Killing Time','After a psychopath murders a man who was on his way to a job as a deputy sheriff in a small California town, he assumes the deputy\'s identity and arrives in town to start his new \'job\'. What he doesn\'t know is that the recently appointed sheriff and his mistress are plotting to murder her evil husband—and blame it on the new deputy.','/3qeMJxptbXVDuCQeGkomZmEMw76.jpg','1987-10-23',94,'Released','To commit the perfect murder, you need planning, guts, and luck. Practically nobody has luck.','The Killing Time',32039,1.934,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9965,_binary '\0','/jTE51uGW3YT9ghnhbRcZx5OUfbS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093349',5.5,1774,'en','King Lear','A descendant of Shakespeare tries to restore his plays in a world rebuilding itself after the Chernobyl catastrophe obliterates most of human civilization.','/qWTubgW7ehbdsHbnd3iCYtaQ18W.jpg','1988-01-22',91,'Released','Jealous love leads to destruction.','King Lear',50012,1.9545,6.5,'nb4jN8rS3ls','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9966,_binary '\0','/p5OSk41qSfhoh18ZkF7tzg4QjIN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093371',6.9,2575,'fr','Kung-Fu Master!','A lonely 40-year old woman finds herself shattering taboos by falling in love with the 14-year old Julien – but is it romance, or a desperate attempt to turn back time in the face of middle age?','/ymnlN8fhRDx0dmkqmZW4mQCbLXs.jpg','1988-03-09',80,'Released','He was 15. She was 40. Love is where you find it.','Kung-Fu Master!',47429,2.2961,6.4,'ADXW_ml4Vf4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9967,_binary '\0','/jXDanAOPM6gmypt72WlkZwrPuK0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093378',7,38954,'en','La Bamba','Los Angeles teenager Ritchie Valens becomes an overnight rock \'n\' roll success in 1958, thanks to a love ballad called \"Donna\" that he wrote for his girlfriend. But as his star rises, Valens has conflicts with his jealous brother, Bob, and becomes haunted by a recurring nightmare of a plane crash just as he begins his first national tour alongside Buddy Holly.','/6Znulqtc7cdqlUC69HGf26Ef5fi.jpg','1987-07-24',108,'Released','Born into poverty. Destined for stardom. He lived the American dream.','La Bamba',16620,5.8648,7.3,'OaEWHrwF0fc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9968,_binary '\0','/k29qVmwWwR0i5A1UMIws1Vmv6hV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093389',7.7,120976,'en','The Last Emperor','A dramatic history of Pu Yi, the last of the Emperors of China, from his lofty birth and brief reign in the Forbidden City, the object of worship by half a billion people; through his abdication, his decline and dissolute lifestyle; his exploitation by the invading Japanese, and finally to his obscure existence as just another peasant worker in the People\'s Republic.','/7TILJhdeJAaEyDiwvJZMo9SQBoe.jpg','1987-10-04',163,'Released','1500 slaves. 353,260,000 royal subjects. Warlords. Concubines. And 2 wives. He was the loneliest boy in the world.','The Last Emperor',746,10.2653,7.591,'9Vc22ZkdMM0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9969,_binary '\0','/wY9FOehhxHDOPQtxCzvaml8oaVc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093393',6.4,1661,'en','The Last of England','The artist\'s personal commentary on the decline of his country in a language closer to poetry than prose. A dark meditation on London under Thatcher.','/hndDDerUhEe0PYIFlpG9Kz2dzah.jpg','1987-08-23',87,'Released',NULL,'The Last of England',41970,2.0734,6.1,'3wh_KpDHGRM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9970,_binary '\0','/z70jgMXjK1CPGippUpITskvaOFo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093405',2.2,8884,'en','Leonard Part 6','After separating from his wife, Leonard Parker quit the spy business and became a restaurateur. His wife refuses to speak with him, and his daughter, who changes her career more often than her clothes, has begun dating a man old enough to be Leonard\'s father! On top of it all, the government has asked him to come back and save the world again.','/ouT2pkDmasvSUZNUmVIm5Gki6H.jpg','1987-12-18',85,'Released','Our world is in safe hands.','Leonard Part 6',24828,1.4854,2.9,'WqnT4VmH2ek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9971,_binary '\0','/6Otwiru3uklbKPavWLdOLsgLFJU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093407',6.4,23974,'en','Less Than Zero','A college freshman returns to Los Angeles for Christmas at his ex-girlfriend\'s request, but discovers that his former best friend has an out-of-control drug habit.','/8pFMuyJJwJLqOJ3Ljq3M5BFGbTF.jpg','1987-11-06',98,'Released','It only looks like the good life.','Less Than Zero',13703,4.3997,6.4,'DEYe7h0ydio','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9972,_binary '\0','/xinJKZQiqkdJhoYc2SXuEnhehXz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093409',7.6,298807,'en','Lethal Weapon','A veteran cop and an unstable detective become partners who must put their differences aside in order to bring down a heroin-smuggling ring run by ex-Special Forces.','/6gt44oqb4nE8vflPElffeGwsHVl.jpg','1987-03-06',110,'Released','If these two can learn to stand each other... the bad guys don\'t stand a chance.','Lethal Weapon',941,19.3738,7.304,'5IlMS-dQb2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9973,_binary '\0','/kx3KdTmefo87oQEEhGqm6dLlAg0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093412',7.1,15608,'es','La ley del deseo','Pablo, a successful film director, disappointed in his relationship with his young lover, Juan, concentrates in a new project, a monologue starring his transgender sister, Tina. Antonio, an uptight young man, falls possessively in love with the director and in his passion would stop at nothing to obtain the object of his desire.','/tAKaUaYGPCUStvlOaLwsJldrOJQ.jpg','1987-02-07',102,'Released','An Outrageously Funny Tale of Lust, Passion and Jealousy!','Law of Desire',4043,5.0123,7.1,'PIJqY2ptTVI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9974,_binary '\0','/93jrizwNFDke7YZuQouOdu90yVJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093415',5.6,3616,'en','Light of Day','Cleveland siblings rise with a rock band while coping with personal problems.','/hFXnASDyZd3i9TOuBPUtJRvfZsK.jpg','1987-02-06',107,'Released','When your family is closing you in, music may be the only way out.','Light of Day',2115,2.3138,5.508,'iiaPL17889A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9975,_binary '\0','/2mTe0BhrqA79IkaMO0YPJbYH0XV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093416',6.8,2275,'en','The Lighthorsemen','In 1917 when the British forces are bogged down in front of the Turkish and German lines in Palestine they rely on the Australian light horse regiment to break the deadlock.','/h0U0l94ILsSb2Wbq8hLvLR92mQA.jpg','1987-09-10',131,'Released','They did what they were told... They didn\'t know it was impossible!','The Lighthorsemen',18389,1.8623,6.1,'KdFsIYiq_jU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9976,_binary '\0','/b9Soyrxwbp1Kn5RJgLl3XyrCmbl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093418',5.3,6978,'en','Like Father Like Son','Dr. Jack Hammond has best chances to become medical superintendent in the clinic. So he\'s completely absorbed in his work and has no understanding for his teenage son Chris\' problems with school. By accident one of them drinks a brain-exchanging serum, and it switches their identities. This leads of course to extraordinary complications in school and at work, but also to insight in the problems and feelings of each other.','/68OY9pYmKc3F2G6yxaXhxhnnFcU.jpg','1987-10-02',96,'Released','Chris and his dad have accidentally changed bodies - but no big deal. Chris gets the Jag and the Gold Card. Dad gets the fake ID and the bio final.','Like Father Like Son',36914,4.3109,5.76,'gdY-6oZqkVc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9977,_binary '\0','/bNTFhyQq4LbDaeX82kxhyWKMDwz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093426',7.4,2837,'cn','秋天的童話','Hong Kong native Lee Kay moves to NYC\'s Chinatown while attending college. When she learns that her boyfriend\'s cheating, her cousin comforts her.','/4q7CAw4lC5T12u9d2Zn9t7MuMww.jpg','1987-07-16',98,'Released','A story about a New York Chinatown waiter who falls for a college student.','An Autumn\'s Tale',64015,2.3432,7.4,'S7RKXY2GpUc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9978,_binary '\0','/vhPl9k80mgiTbR3hkaGjTU0fyQI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093427',8.6,1277,'en','Queen: Budapest','On 27 July 1986, Queen performed the largest-ever stadium concert at the Népstadion in Budapest in front of 80,000 ecstatic fans. The concert was part of the famed Magic Tour, which was the last time the band toured with lead singer Freddie Mercury.','/dCsCez4aVeXqMiALdWYp4LFsztI.jpg','2012-09-20',96,'Released',NULL,'Queen: Budapest',142773,7.8113,8.2,'DYdPhqkw0pU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9979,_binary '\0','/ebaq0ecL1Tu39rIExfHwE4ToFl2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093428',6.7,115840,'en','The Living Daylights','After a defecting Russian general reveals a plot to assassinate foreign spies, James Bond is assigned a secret mission to dispatch the new head of the KGB to prevent an escalation of tensions between the Soviet Union and the West.','/1oRlmWX9hewpn2B44wawBjHd7dx.jpg','1987-06-29',130,'Released','The new James Bond...living on the edge.','The Living Daylights',708,13.5036,6.6,'2m7VT6zXCmE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9980,_binary '\0','/efGXGeVwcNPSADsErWIUxsJqSY3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093431',7,1477,'en','The Lonely Passion of Judith Hearne','A penniless middle-aged spinster scrapes by giving piano lessons in the Dublin of the 1950s. She makes a sad last bid for love with a fellow resident of her rundown boarding house, who imagines she has the money to bankroll the business he hopes to open.','/g8Nv1flxRFzjhSywUVApHKWeAMV.jpg','1987-12-23',116,'Released','An unlikely relationship based on love, faith, and a little deception.','The Lonely Passion of Judith Hearne',35841,1.7417,6.6,'40LZgMFMA-g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9981,_binary '\0','/897P91WT0XCpVIejMi9gBbQOzIe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093433',7.7,1313,'en','Long Gone','Story of the Tampico Stogies, a low minor-league baseball team, and its star player and manager, Stud\' Cantrell, as they battle for the league championship amidst the corruption and racism of the American south.','/tlxOYZuvTUVokfnpfNndZ3lD7ky.jpg','1987-05-23',110,'Released','They had one shot at the pennant. The last shot.','Long Gone',88231,1.9018,6.1,'fuswzQG2sCk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9982,_binary '\0','/ONKOwS1xCipE5tMr8VsVJySzcH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093435',7.1,9198,'cn','龍虎風雲','Ko Chow is an undercover cop who is under pressure from all sides. His boss, Inspector Lau, wants him to infiltrate a gang of ruthless jewel thieves; his girlfriend wants him to commit to marriage or she will leave Hong Kong with another lover; and he is being pursued by other cops who are unaware that he is a colleague. Chow would rather quit the force, feeling guilty about betraying gang members who have become his friends.','/uOgCKhHsQvOFVNxOUdewPwc0Z9N.jpg','1987-02-13',105,'Released','He thought he knew the risks of going undercover.','City on Fire',42120,3.3136,6.951,'KF1wFE5GfFY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9983,_binary '\0','/6zvbeKxgc80xQsZLJ4eQVZSKXO8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093437',7.2,180262,'en','The Lost Boys','When an unsuspecting town newcomer is drawn to local blood fiends, the Frog brothers and other unlikely heroes gear up to rescue him.','/nH1lvyQvfbL5GKScTtT6zkIvDEn.jpg','1987-07-31',97,'Released','Sleep all day. Party all night. Never grow old. Never die. It\'s fun to be a vampire.','The Lost Boys',1547,9.8041,7.1,'Q786UsnOcsY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9984,_binary '\0','/uGat0Py4K5DI3ODtKMFU4tl5Lae.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093467',6.2,4013,'en','Made in Heaven','Deceased drifter Mike arrives in Heaven and quickly falls for newborn soul Annie, soon to start her assignment on Earth. When Annie leaves, Mike follows.','/zJ6LiVvnIL9Nuiskrf1swGJ2fwE.jpg','1987-11-06',103,'Released','12,000 babies will be born in the United States today. Two will already have fallen in love.','Made in Heaven',42010,2.5866,6.5,'JGLu15SJ1no','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9985,_binary '\0','/1ibA1r3Zy4RlKsgZzJEZCuMMtsz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093468',5.5,3086,'en','Madhouse','A woman is pursued by her murderous, psychopathic twin sister in the days leading up to their birthday.','/6ebCs7FLor0um97T41UULuXd5EM.jpg','1981-03-04',93,'Released','Many people visit… no one ever leaves.','Madhouse',54133,1.6383,5.6,'0Lh15ib5EE8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9986,_binary '\0','/3tLtQoODodmbdDlemQWMOnDZ576.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093476',5.6,3869,'en','Maid to Order','Spoiled Jessie Montgomery, whose wild behavior and spending excesses cause her well-meaning but exasperated millionaire father Charles to wish he never had her, is visited by fairy godmother Stella. In an effort to save Jessie, Stella casts a spell which causes Charles to no longer have a daughter. Jessie, now penniless and without a friend, must take a maid\'s job to earn a living, and hopefully to learn her lesson.','/l5XNXwjRieKMixWL7rGgtLANf75.jpg','1987-07-10',93,'Released','She was raised in a Beverly Hills mansion. Now, she\'s got to clean one.','Maid to Order',2608,2.1357,5.5,'OuPWK_antUI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9987,_binary '\0','/3lWiWGJMtHlOZbYv2AWtBK4wifY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093477',5.6,3447,'en','Making Mr. Right','When image consultant Frankie Stone is hired by a tech company to teach a scientist’s “Ulysses Robot” how to be a man, she winds up developing very real feelings for the faux human.','/qsJFNUQz1ObK85kRk06ahyW5dKr.jpg','1987-04-03',98,'Released','A man with a good warranty is hard to find.','Making Mr. Right',32058,2.0657,5.2,'2jxDLz-e5Gs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9988,_binary '\0','/uPeLGj9psrkOvvfsgn3isLnZHuJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093483',5.8,4134,'en','Malone','Erstwhile C.I.A. assassin Richard Malone hopes for a tranquil retirement in the placid Pacific Northwest, but what he gets is a rumble with a right-wing extremist plotting a secret revolution.','/uA32G48OnKutmWdifMSi9hp2jed.jpg','1987-05-01',92,'Released','Ex-cop. Ex-CIA. Ex-plosive.','Malone',27342,2.3025,6,'EiUoHEEvByw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9989,_binary '\0','/kV0loE9YnoPRoIbQK5RXnLGfjBH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093489',5.8,3716,'en','Man on Fire','Creasy, a traumatized ex-CIA agent, gets a job as a bodyguard for Samantha, the twelve-year-old daughter of a wealthy Italian family living in a swanky villa on the shores of Lake Como.','/tQhcV9vPC8bfbmJgZwznAjKCVO9.jpg','1987-09-04',93,'Released','For an ex-CIA agent, the job of bodyguard for a 12-year old girl should have been a breeze…','Man on Fire',49712,3.3168,5.7,'p6sl07pG3es','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9990,_binary '\0','/rbYlmgMV96GcvTe700peiTH5JcS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093493',6,40338,'en','Mannequin','Jonathan Switcher, an unemployed artist, finds a job as an assistant window dresser for a department store. When Jonathan happens upon a beautiful mannequin he previously designed, she springs to life and introduces herself as Emmy, an Egyptian under an ancient spell. Despite interference from the store\'s devious manager, Jonathan and his mannequin fall in love while creating eye-catching window displays to keep the struggling store in business.','/oHMA8euTiZdDFXDi5zaIQQXwl0K.jpg','1987-02-13',89,'Released','Just because Jonathan\'s fallen in love with a piece of wood, it doesn\'t make him a dummy.','Mannequin',10019,5.9599,6.9,'gDoRcg42lQI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9991,_binary '\0','/5qVTD9eQEdesae4AMHXWtZ6q4ZQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093502',7.2,2519,'ja','マルサの女','Intrepid tax investigator Ryoko Itakura sets her sights on the mysterious and philandering Hideki Gondo, a suspected millionaire and proprietor of a thriving chain of seedy hourly hotels, who has for years succeeded at hiding the true extent of his assets from the Japanese authorities. Itakura and Gondo soon find themselves engaged in a complicated, satirical battle of wits.','/pOSBz0pCQ9DoLVmL0g9cPieQtgY.jpg','1987-02-07',128,'Released','He has a Yen for her, but he won\'t tell her where it\'s hidden...','A Taxing Woman',42011,3.8823,6.7,'YE8n9ybN5Yk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9992,_binary '\0','/A4PR3OzqUdaWhpsDTpoMhFbpRNH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093505',6.8,2040,'fr','Masques','In this deadly game of cat and mouse, Roland Wolf is writing a book on the life of game show host Christian Legagneur--or is he?','/xBt7ygSNNqSLLyq37z6CXHcqhbl.jpg','1987-02-11',100,'Released','France\'s master of stylish and witty suspense presents his delightfully dark and hauntingly humorous game of cat and mouse','Masks',60760,1.216,6.7,'Ns4tr2pqGUo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9993,_binary '\0','/v2IoEKNJIvBneE6qBgntY0nlmhM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093507',5.4,53492,'en','Masters of the Universe','When He-Man is driven from Eternia after Skeletor seizes Castle Grayskull, a stolen portal device strands the fight on Earth, where a pair of teenagers become entangled in a war that spans worlds.','/gaUecXFd31V68yOTJPJYaB9YhAf.jpg','1987-08-07',106,'Released','A battle fought in the stars...now comes to Earth.','Masters of the Universe',11649,10.0685,5.914,'s6eOHaGzkwI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9994,_binary '\0','/v0zxM7p4GlwJDfUUSK2YFimfL7F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093509',7.9,10744,'en','Matewan','Filmed in the coal country of West Virginia, \"Matewan\" celebrates labor organizing in the context of a 1920s work stoppage. Union organizer, Joe Kenehan, a scab named \"Few Clothes\" Johnson and a sympathetic mayor and police chief heroically fight the power represented by a coal company and Matewan\'s vested interests so that justice and workers\' rights need not take a back seat to squalid working conditions, exploitation and the bottom line.','/kdQ2MCsrsC39Ta9x05sWOb9wi5B.jpg','1987-08-28',132,'Released','It takes more than guns to kill a man.','Matewan',24276,3.1741,7.4,'Cjh29QNKLCc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9995,_binary '\0','/rN1OKiEp8gNQ9RB6GeZeqOqVsjk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093512',7.6,27628,'en','Maurice','After his lover rejects him, Maurice attempts to come to terms with his sexuality within the restrictiveness of Edwardian society.','/8HhCyxxzoUqEBmVGK25Jq69LhVo.jpg','1987-09-18',140,'Released','A love story of unforgettable passion.','Maurice',26371,5.0815,7.6,'Mzj8v3J-Fxo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9996,_binary '\0','/8ffeQYpdRT1mTEsySavYEyjLgrE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093516',3.6,2769,'en','Meatballs III: Summer Job','The ghost of a dead porn star comes to Earth to help a nerd with his sex life.','/2N9rjuNg5vgQhKGrQJQLEDX7s70.jpg','1986-10-27',96,'Released','Rudy struck out two summers in a row... this will be his year to score!','Meatballs III: Summer Job',40772,2.9806,4.1,'VtTJweR7wjA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9997,_binary '\0','/3vAitd3jYRBhJyF7hN77Fpy0QN1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093524',6.7,1528,'sv','Mer om oss barn i Bullerbyn','There are only a handful of children living in Bullarby. This film follows their story through the fall and winter, picking up at the moment \"The Children of Noisy Village\" finishes.','/jUOOU0Bh8OwA7dOwI4BjSIXWHoO.jpg','1987-09-05',89,'Released',NULL,'More About the Children of Noisy Village',26111,2.2862,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9998,_binary '\0','/aFHd6jI03L8EQP8qdhRkE2MUZ32.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093543',6.3,6607,'en','Mio min Mio','Under the watch of his unkind realtives, lonely Bosse\'s luck is changed when he is sent to the land where his real father is the King. In that country, he sets out on a quest, together with his new friend, to destroy the evil Knight Kato.','/3C5JsV8Id21pVfOAmWBZjrMZ6GZ.jpg','1987-08-18',99,'Released','They\'re two best friends, a million miles from home. On an incredible adventure, beyond the boundaries of space and time. In a place called...','Mio in the Land of Faraway',14499,2.7164,6,'eQ1jtGWdIuA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(9999,_binary '\0','/kNOEfXXNMsiuIXbeqn0MuPrv87Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093546',5.7,2262,'en','The Misfit Brigade','War story of the 27th Panzers, Hitler\'s heavy-duty combat regiment composed of prisoners.','/4gzKUnPsnPUz17566fCejSW1bMI.jpg','1987-07-02',99,'Released','The German Dirty Dozen','The Misfit Brigade',21840,2.3859,5.7,'N2ZUiBHRljY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10000,_binary '\0','/thYgTJfMO2HG7OJTVIAbbuHCx2D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093560',6.9,39767,'en','The Monster Squad','Count Dracula returns to the world of humans accompanied by Frankenstein\'s Monster, the Wolfman, the Mummy, and the Gillman. The uglies are in search of a powerful amulet that will grant them the ability to rule the world. A group of horror-loving heroes are the only ones daring to stand in their way.','/8EVuqCcqFzQvc7X8E3fx3w4B5Td.jpg','1987-08-14',82,'Released','You know who to call when you have ghosts. But who do you call when you have monsters?','The Monster Squad',13509,6.2149,6.7,'bdLO3riTwJU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10001,_binary '\0','/8JGukOOmot89PA8HTMm23V5pYIa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093562',6.8,2353,'en','A Month in the Country','A destitute WWI veteran is hired to help carry out restoration work on a medieval mural in a rural Yorkshire church. While living in the quiet village, he forms a close friendship with an archaeologist and begins to come to terms with his trauma.','/sbEinEvaz0mWcjbGqAx2764R1Ys.jpg','1987-09-27',96,'Released','They hoped to heal the scars of war away in a small English village. But the war within was just beginning…','A Month in the Country',63639,2.5861,6.5,'vrCzQFYX3ro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10002,_binary '\0','/5RQ5SIcrtKeUYeYeJLRTljR8LcN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093565',7.2,79410,'en','Moonstruck','37-year-old Italian-American widow Loretta Castorini believes she is unlucky in love, and so accepts a marriage proposal from her boyfriend Johnny, even though she doesn\'t love him. When she meets his estranged younger brother Ronny, an emotional and passionate man, she finds herself drawn to him. She tries to resist, but Ronny, who blames his brother for the loss of his hand, has no scruples about aggressively pursuing her while Johnny is out of the country. As Loretta falls for Ronny, she learns that she\'s not the only one in her family with a secret romance.','/2mnVWpvsHEHHnfvLn1NXYVvBGl5.jpg','1987-12-16',102,'Released','Life. Family. Love.','Moonstruck',2039,9.0108,6.8,'MN3sPq9RJKM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10003,_binary '\0','/uM0yXriGYhPGiqLQF13PFKnlUjX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093578',7.7,20754,'hi','मिस्टर इंडिया','A poor but big-hearted man takes orphans into his home. After discovering his scientist father\'s invisibility device, he rises to the occasion and fights to save his children and all of India from the clutches of a megalomaniac.','/nqDJ8vuVFYymUhOUKcGCZoHy4tu.jpg','1987-05-25',179,'Released',NULL,'Mr. India',41903,1.9205,6.9,'5XJxoDYkk8o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10004,_binary '\0','/iGaaukuyOnRgGpvGYxJQ4KGsihL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093582',4,2634,'en','Munchies','Simon Watterman, a space archaeologist, discovers the \"Munchies\" in a cave in Peru. Cecil Watterman, Simon\'s evil twin brother and snack food entrepreneur, kidnaps the creature. What Cecil does not know is that the creature, when chopped up, regenerates into many new creatures and are they mean!','/51eGxEkyGMcHSGDLRjnf1oOKx2W.jpg','1987-03-01',87,'Released','... Just when you thought it was safe to raid the fridge!','Munchies',4365,2.4125,4.8,'o-1jN3UhHCM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10005,_binary '\0','/73ZXbBmT1m1UITtuRuFcQ6kaxLo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093589',4.7,1873,'en','My Demon Lover','Denny has yet again been left by her thug boyfriend Chip. It seems as if she is doomed to be stuck with awful guys, this time she has to choose between nerdy Charles and the strange Kaz, who turns into a monster when sexually aroused.','/hKUZUfy8rnNTJYRysMG21lpK5oc.jpg','1987-04-24',90,'Released','She was a dream come true. He was a good reason not to go to sleep.','My Demon Lover',51521,1.9275,5.3,'GLMLFrOaxB4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10006,_binary '\0','/5nZ0ax5n5k9MogcGX3IxVjlCMRt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093593',7.1,6587,'pl','Na Srebrnym Globie','A small group of cosmic explorers, including a woman, leaves Earth to start a new civilization. They do not realize that within themselves they carry the end of their own dream. They die one by one, while their children revert to a primitive native culture, creating new myths and a new god.','/fOeMeTdGBlueTPtXgdamH8CkioX.jpg','1989-02-10',165,'Released',NULL,'On the Silver Globe',27072,3.5564,7.655,'zBFRiSlcBAg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10007,_binary '\0','/AgiBouLTSIFvpfBPP2R5b9wH7Xh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093596',5.5,4804,'en','Nadine','Hairdresser Nadine Hightower wants to retrieve the risqué photos she once posed for, but when she visits the photographer at his office, he\'s murdered by an intruder. Nadine talks her estranged husband, Vernon, into going along when she returns to the office, where they stumble across plans for a less than legal construction project. But when Vernon tries to turn the documents into a cash windfall, he and Nadine are pursued by goons with guns.','/mim8TLLXmD3ui03f9jVmOXGACv8.jpg','1987-08-07',83,'Released','The cops want her. The killers want him. They want a divorce. Ain\'t love grand!','Nadine',61178,2.364,5.418,'4o-AGzZaWtI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10008,_binary '\0','/u4iRTMD0oJPUP2kjmH3XIEhsDKF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093603',8.6,28217,'ta','நாயகன்','Velu Naicker, who witnesses the brutal murder of his father, kills a corrupt policeman and escapes to Mumbai, only to become a gangster.','/hnCKKPG5VkUiGQV0DTniyMTEZsT.jpg','1987-10-21',156,'Released','Are you a good man or a bad man?','Nayakan',29971,2.1835,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10009,_binary '\0','/fLqhMfRyMySsqORn0xq7iFWRdcM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093605',6.9,50173,'en','Near Dark','A farm boy reluctantly becomes a member of the undead when a girl he meets turns out to be part of a band of vampires who roam the highways in stolen cars.','/hVhFNn3IQxxARvnpLIKMx8ZfTtG.jpg','1987-10-02',94,'Released','...pray for daylight.','Near Dark',11879,6.9896,6.8,'7HL3JgadNlY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10010,_binary '\0','/yk7p4gFa37Fza41ETkH9v6mh1wZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093608',4.8,12405,'de','Nekromantik','An employee of Joe\'s Streetcleaning Agency, a company that cleans up after grisly accidents, Rob brings home an entire decomposing corpse, much to the delight of his girlfriend, Betty.','/uZZGYPcpRKg3zcdgF9Pua2pxKxI.jpg','1988-01-29',72,'Released','Death is just the Beginning','Nekromantik',11822,3.1293,5.087,'nPgia_-R-jU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10011,_binary '\0','/flVqKeNGCPzWKKgORAp23XFJ3NR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093624',6.1,22062,'en','Night of the Demons','When partygoers at a deserted funeral home decide to have a séance on Halloween night, they awaken something evil with a thirst for blood.','/2VcJ4wpIx8TO14rXZnYPhzKL7Tp.jpg','1988-09-09',90,'Released','Angela is having a party, Jason and Freddy are too scared to come... But you\'ll have a hell of a time.','Night of the Demons',24924,5.1373,6.2,'tQ7gSRfUCH0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10012,_binary '\0','/3pBxXCIwuv9WgyntkVEHK5FFHnz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093626',4.3,1544,'en','Nightflyers','A scientific group set out on a journey into space to find a magical creature. What they find is a killer computer on the ship they chartered.','/zWl070rZSrSl7XiAW1tIEdTbhDs.jpg','1987-10-23',89,'Released','Where they\'re headed isn\'t the mystery. What\'s taking them there is.','Nightflyers',63381,2.1469,4.7,'A8wtmcLu_Lw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10013,_binary '\0','/euXJlfeYSyrdkOoFQ9gtUG8OOhH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093629',6.7,101069,'en','A Nightmare on Elm Street 3: Dream Warriors','A psychiatrist, familiar with the knife-wielding dream demon Freddy Krueger, helps teens at a mental hospital battle the killer who is invading their dreams.','/qbtZewU6EGvxi8yFVzwZ31NijLX.jpg','1987-02-27',96,'Released','If you think you\'ll get out alive, you must be dreaming.','A Nightmare on Elm Street 3: Dream Warriors',10072,5.0824,6.726,'wizAi-_TzKA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10014,_binary '\0','/6WWJKsT5qHyyEBS6jmmHVz4K93J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093633',7,1390,'zh','尼羅河女兒','Lin Hsiao-yang tries to keep her family together while working as a waitress at Kentucky Fried Chicken and going to night school. With no mother and her father currently working out of town, it is up to Lin Hsiao-yang to take care of her younger siblings, who are slipping into a life of crime.','/1yyyOWllCPAHhi7PJnigJYmhTb5.jpg','1987-08-22',91,'Released',NULL,'Daughter of the Nile',99599,1.1486,7.2,'Z_D2orPvmPA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10015,_binary '\0','/dk1OPZcIUF9MEFdK13mS8lYYmmR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093638',6.1,6212,'en','No Man\'s Land','A rookie cop goes undercover to infiltrate a gang of car thieves led by smooth and charming Ted. The rookie becomes too involved and starts to enjoy the thrill and lifestyle of the game, and becomes romanticly involved with the leaders sister.','/h3F9Pm9Tav6aQolv3DqQ0DVvIYs.jpg','1987-10-23',106,'Released','Once you get a taste of the good life it\'s hard to let go. Even if your life depends on it.','No Man\'s Land',34379,4.1835,6.008,'WPJW95URgyI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10016,_binary '\0','/9F6zZuETJWUtkcSEnOc0JLqBHAK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093640',7.1,56511,'en','No Way Out','Navy Lt. Tom Farrell meets a young woman, Susan Atwell, and they share a passionate fling. Farrell then finds out that his superior, Defense Secretary David Brice, is also romantically involved with Atwell. When the young woman turns up dead, Farrell is put in charge of the murder investigation. He begins to uncover shocking clues about the case, but when details of his encounter with Susan surface, he becomes a suspect as well.','/93CzsBvRhg035yvQosRtSsTL19v.jpg','1987-08-14',114,'Released','Is it a crime of passion, or an act of treason?','No Way Out',10083,9.3064,6.9,'-NaBMu3pooM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10017,_binary '\0','/buanXqsCE9jB6ccSMnPHzbv6k6D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093648',6.6,3289,'en','North Shore','On a small stretch of coastline as powerful as a man\'s will, Rick Kane came to surf the big waves. He found a woman who would show him how to survive, and a challenge unlike any other.','/wYXZHdoxWbbqNacbxCrDoVFbiBF.jpg','1987-08-14',96,'Released','The peak...the dream...the ultimate test.','North Shore',22915,1.8543,5.865,'AJkUsQfgsvI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10018,_binary '\0','/laor08rFlOiZK3oMw0FFQ5ge6oT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093649',6.1,1464,'en','Not Quite Human','Dr. Jonas Carson, a scientist, invents Chip, an android teenager. Dr. Carson sends Chip to school with his daughter Becky to see whether an android could interact with others. But his former employer decides to try and make a profit by stealing the mechanical boy.','/7W9CyqfOJ06Oi5rXm8uQ4Yi9OSW.jpg','1987-06-19',97,'Released',NULL,'Not Quite Human',20473,1.2261,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10019,_binary '\0','/rbZsJxy26bbNsSvaYUv8MwFq9zc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093660',6.7,8065,'en','Nuts','A high-class call girl accused of murder fights for the right to stand trial rather than be declared mentally incompetent.','/wm2dlVDFsxHayrq8D4DEi0Om9ja.jpg','1987-11-20',116,'Released','Mad As In Angry. Or Just Plain... NUTS','Nuts',40634,2.0528,6.4,'sbTtxtE_waI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10020,_binary '\0','/metcg6lwJqJMZeQx41ISgh62iVl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093664',7.3,3862,'ru','Очи черные','Aboard a ship early in the 20th-century, a middle-aged Italian tells his story of love to a Russian.','/bXu1AWvAUg0OWHNjB5O1kKJ4AUt.jpg','1987-02-01',121,'Released',NULL,'Dark Eyes',44658,2.6797,6.692,'1RGFdkYdal8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10021,_binary '\0','/bWoGpYfhHjod5795MpFgH8zMoFj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093668',7.1,6015,'se','Ofelas','Around the year 1000 AD warlike people, the so-called \"tjuder\", roam in northern Scandinavia. As they brutally kill a family in a remote area, including the parents and their little daughter, the family\'s teenage son, Aigin, observes the slaughter. He manages to flee from these killers and reaches a camp with other Sámi whose inhabitants are worried if he has been able to hide his track. Afraid of the murderous people, they decide to flee to the coast. The boy stays alone to avenge his family\'s murder. Unfortunately, they get him before he can do anything and force him to lead them to the other Sámi. He guides them but has a plan to destroy the barbarous people before reaching the camp.','/cpJvdyNZaD3j2DUHO10Xa7vG8rJ.jpg','1987-09-03',86,'Released','When the invader comes...the hardest path to find is survival.','Pathfinder',2172,2.2219,6.944,'5BBn-7H2kEk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10022,_binary '\0','/jh1TMz3AUe40HbCigQ7weCDEW0d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093677',6.9,22025,'it','Opera','A young opera singer is stalked by a deranged fan bent on killing the people associated with her to claim her for himself.','/v5VBvSVu2sWLAmyQhKQwBV5aPJA.jpg','1987-12-19',107,'Released','Obsession. Murder. Madness.','Opera',20115,3.7136,6.749,'58UOa2b29tc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10023,_binary '\0','/xTujzOoSxXCti7GcR8P4gxuFWdX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093690',6.2,9369,'en','Outrageous Fortune','Refined actress Lauren Ames finally has a chance to study with the great theatre professor Stanislav Korzenowski. Sandy Brozinsky, a brash, loud actress, decides through happenstance to also study with Korzenowski. The two women end up dating the same man (who turns out to be a double agent) and follow him across the country to force him to choose between them.','/bZdQaa9HymxGfjBo3mFhhpWXVeG.jpg','1987-01-30',100,'Released','The CIA is trailing them, the KGB is tracking them, the phone company is tracing them, the police are chasing them, the cowboys are herding them, and the Indians are hunting them. Are they going to fall for all of that?','Outrageous Fortune',20242,3.1874,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10024,_binary '\0','/mKIbnKhIwQToFfrUXE6ibRBo8p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093692',5.9,66144,'en','Over the Top','Lincoln Hawk a hard-luck big-rig trucker takes us under the glaring Las Vegas lights for all the boisterous action of the World Armwrestling Championship. Relying on wits and willpower, Hawk tries to rebuild his life by capturing the first-place prize money, and the love of the son he abandoned years earlier into the keeping of his rich, ruthless father-in-law.','/a926UPf4EYbHfjdzf012M5YHiQ5.jpg','1987-02-13',94,'Released','Some fight for money... Some fight for glory... He\'s fighting for his son\'s love.','Over the Top',1825,8.8306,6.471,'l_qa_mLrQmY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10025,_binary '\0','/lekXv2HA6pbhNicUGgGn74yhKFK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093693',6.9,77770,'en','Overboard','Heiress Joanna Stayton hires carpenter Dean Proffitt to build a closet on her yacht—and refuses to pay him for the project when it\'s done. But after Joanna accidentally falls overboard and loses her memory, Dean sees an opportunity to get even.','/v9MVFgUTvNRXmm2WWOzST6UXb5x.jpg','1987-12-16',112,'Released','From opulence... to rags... to love.','Overboard',10780,6.8158,6.849,'H5K4xU2QOc4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10026,_binary '\0','/dXUiiryxCk1QqvS9F4MhIAPjpF3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093713',7.7,12795,'da','Pelle Erobreren','In the late 19th century, two Swedish emigrants, Lasse Karlsson and his son Pelle, arrive on the Danish island of Bornholm hoping to find work on a farm and save enough money to travel to the United States of America.','/oSsu4khg459yTR1sw4qjEC4LO5J.jpg','1987-12-21',157,'Released','They thought the world would be theirs.','Pelle the Conqueror',11174,2.6891,7.288,'wIoZ5OYc9RE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10027,_binary '\0','/rGpY61zOW5ApyyZEnvVRBi6wJ4a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093727',6.3,2063,'en','Personal Services','Fed up with working hard just to scrape by, Christine Painter comes up with a bold plan to become the madam of a brothel and earn her financial freedom: she opens a house of spanking to fabulous reviews.','/q7opjmMn5uVfvQjKObc7VbHnKyU.jpg','1987-02-12',105,'Released','The future lies in kinky people','Personal Services',44201,2.0601,6,'cbrR3Aot2Pw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10028,_binary '\0','/r1SKoJwyvvUTL80vkEP0L4kJmXH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093731',3.7,1483,'en','Phoenix the Warrior','In a post-apocalyptic world, women warriors battle each other from junkyards to gravel pits as they determine the fate of the entire world.','/ysCgqtzftq8RE7JdYHXUJmxsanK.jpg','1988-10-31',85,'Released','Women Rule','Phoenix the Warrior',26440,1.501,3.8,'Gs_SYVBSJ68','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10029,_binary '\0','/dmcvkRzfT0AYaa4vGadLibss8oC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093737',5.4,8375,'en','The Pick-up Artist','A womanizer meets his match when he falls for the daughter of a gambling addict who is in debt to the mob.','/qMhtuRY6iF5akKeKd0t6BeM0mJT.jpg','1987-09-18',81,'Released','The Pick-Up Artist... has finally met his match.','The Pick-up Artist',17258,4.6619,5.7,'fmlrfhsLYl8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10030,_binary '\0','/2J40g5hjg8jpzKaLyvxZrLTu4X1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093744',5.9,5014,'en','The New Adventures of Pippi Longstocking','After her father\'s ship is carried off by a sudden storm, the spunky Pippi Longstocking is stranded with her horse, Alfonso,and her pet monkey, Mr. Neilson, and takes up residence in the old family home, which is thought by neighborhood children to be haunted. Soon, two children, Tommy and his sister Anika, venture into the house only to meet up with Pippi. The three soon become friends and get into various adventures together, including cleaning the floor with scrubbing shoes, dodging the \"splunks\", going down a waterfall in barrels, and helping Pippi with the problem of having to go to an orphanage. Older children will probably get the most out of this movie.','/a9o3WEzGjr36YjqTnzuikxHvyET.jpg','1988-03-01',100,'Released','Come see Pippi as you\'ve never seen her before!','The New Adventures of Pippi Longstocking',19051,3.8239,5.9,'HpVQLewSMC0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10031,_binary '\0','/4f8JBqvWyPObKTrjvJnp9BeOUyY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093748',7.6,182163,'en','Planes, Trains and Automobiles','An irritable marketing executive, Neal Page, is heading home to Chicago for Thanksgiving when a number of delays force him to travel with a well meaning but overbearing shower curtain ring salesman, Del Griffith.','/fwi2cET87xArJCb8MdbWq2BZO3n.jpg','1987-11-26',92,'Released','What he really wanted was to spend Thanksgiving with his family. What he got was three days with the turkey.','Planes, Trains and Automobiles',2609,8.5353,7.254,'vHhG2MsGxGI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10032,_binary '\0','/b6rWjJbPePlyLGLebdmf30042Ok.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093754',8,5512,'ka','მონანიება','The day after his funeral, the corpse of Varlam Aravidze, the mayor of a small Georgian town, turns up in his son\'s garden. Although it is secretly reburied, the corpse keeps returning until the police capture the local woman who is responsible. This woman says that Varlam should never be laid to rest since his Stalin-like reign of terror led to the disappearance of her family and friends.','/9kZqQ2tlwfts6ch2s4ibKhjQgzW.jpg','1987-05-01',153,'Released','A masterful, nightmarish political vision from Georgia\'s foremost modern director!','Repentance',96920,2.1513,7.1,'EiOUaoecdRI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10033,_binary '\0','/9KzNVjbXdt7qufCpRObIkERCE0M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093756',5,49103,'en','Police Academy 4: Citizens on Patrol','A new batch of recruits arrives at Police Academy, this time a group of civilian volunteers who have joined Commandant Lassard\'s new Citizens on Patrol program. Although the community relations project has strong governmental support, a disgusted Captain Harris is determined to see it fail.','/vvk5aWBJE3EqDX2ln6M4J4UiUXr.jpg','1987-04-02',88,'Released','On land, on sea, or in the air, no place is safe from them!','Police Academy 4: Citizens on Patrol',10587,7.6011,5.5,'VMc2efsEFgQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10034,_binary '\0','/WhnbkWrzx4QAfgoPYEOtWKpH04.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093771',6.3,6469,'en','A Prayer for the Dying','Martin, an I.R.A. hitman, is seen by a Catholic priest while carrying out a hit. He grows a bond with the priest and his niece. But his past and his former employers put all their lives in danger.','/fLkkVH9u75sciAzTUNZNwFp1smp.jpg','1987-09-11',107,'Released','Freedom always comes with a price.','A Prayer for the Dying',33851,3.0976,5.9,'VJrzXlss82Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10035,_binary '\0','/YL3GPOiDcNraIJOVDCZsoOBoDy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093773',7.8,506624,'en','Predator','A team of elite commandos on a secret mission in a Central American jungle come to find themselves hunted by an extraterrestrial warrior.','/k3mW4qfJo6SKqe6laRyNGnbB9n5.jpg','1987-06-12',107,'Released','Soon the hunt will begin.','Predator',106,22.2668,7.583,'SFoQL6gqhFM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10036,_binary '\0','/oNMNGqEq3e5t2T5p4KFb3p0zeZy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093776',7.1,7024,'en','Prick Up Your Ears','When the young, attractive Joe Orton meets the older, more introverted Kenneth Halliwell at drama school, he befriends the kindred spirit and they start an affair. As Orton becomes more comfortable with his sexuality and starts to find success with his writing, Halliwell becomes increasingly alienated and jealous, ultimately tapping into a dangerous rage.','/yLrWxmqPqAQFjyefJtYjoaDxGpi.jpg','1987-04-17',111,'Released','They shared everything... except success.','Prick Up Your Ears',27857,3.0389,6.7,'GpYSqJZosEU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10037,_binary '\0','/9FYa8R1VQdgfuX4QcgZgvbaQ2ca.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093777',6.6,56322,'en','Prince of Darkness','A priest discovers an ancient canister containing a strange liquid in an abandoned church. When a group of graduate students and scientists are tasked with studying it, they unknowingly unleash an evil force waiting to destroy all of humanity.','/jjcAOhtGuX4p8XvlVn1WXUT1jWi.jpg','1987-10-23',102,'Released','Before man walked the earth...It slept for centuries. It is evil. It is real. It is awakening.','Prince of Darkness',8852,7.412,6.769,'D5I3Lt8PwyQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10038,_binary '\0','/onACwa3TjpeaY7EVHSZZbeNkd2q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093779',8,491070,'en','The Princess Bride','In this enchantingly cracked fairy tale, the beautiful Princess Buttercup and the dashing Westley must overcome staggering odds to find happiness amid six-fingered swordsmen, murderous princes, Sicilians and rodents of unusual size. But even death can\'t stop these true lovebirds from triumphing.','/2FC9L9MrjBoGHYjYZjdWQdopVYb.jpg','1987-09-25',99,'Released','It\'s as real as the feelings you feel.','The Princess Bride',2493,18.6024,7.7,'KmXptjknRa8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10039,_binary '\0','/4OH161N3H7SjKJXK0S6fzviLZap.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093780',6.3,12930,'en','The Principal','Burglary. Drugs. Assault. Rape. The students at Brandel High are more than new Principal Rick Latimer bargained for. Gangs fight to control the school using knives - even guns - when they have to. When Latimer and the head of security try to clean up the school and stop the narcotics trade, they run up against a teenage mafia. A violent confrontation on the campus leads to a deadly showdown with the drug dealer\'s gang, and one last chance for Latimer to save his career... and his life.','/kwwDruwoHwNMY6tV7KOdVGcEusT.jpg','1987-09-18',109,'Released','He\'s teaching the students at Brandel High two words... NO MORE.','The Principal',10081,4.6693,6.44,'kGu4TUB39lU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10040,_binary '\0','/9nfRkyoayxlTwG6oHODBFvgP6NV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093791',7.1,1249,'el','Πρωινή Περίπολος','In a deserted city, a woman walks alone trying to approach and enter the forbidden zone. Traps and the morning patrol lurk everywhere. Electronic voices summon the (non-existent) people to abandon the city. Can a love affair survive?','/mF6JIbnVizvUo7MMF5N4tONkv1Q.jpg','1987-10-08',105,'Released',NULL,'Morning Patrol',76825,1.1066,6.724,'rpXXbviQ4kU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10041,_binary '\0','/mfV9zDaHSGPRwPvodMrbuF9XE0B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093793',6.2,12347,'en','Project X','A young inductee into the military is given the task of looking after some chimpanzees used in the mysterious \'Project X\'. Getting to know the chimps fairly well, he begins to suspect there is more to the secret project than he is being told.','/eJdxrTbDVMZJf4lZnZY8Xc7BPGx.jpg','1987-04-17',108,'Released','When the Air Force assigned Jimmy Garrett to a top secret project, he didn\'t know what he was in for. Neither did they.','Project X',18410,3.1503,6.2,'T0de66wOE4Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10042,_binary '\0','/yEMpFlEHCFsrMPvWKYJMv7Zj7Ie.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093800',5.6,1623,'en','Psychos in Love','A strip-joint owner and a manicurist find that they have many things in common, the foremost being that they are psychotic serial killers. They fall in love and are happy being the family that slays together, until one day they come up against a plumber who also happens to be a cannibal.','/wQwd8QDZTWfOZ9MnpKlYQSplaxu.jpg','1987-05-01',88,'Released','Love hurts...','Psychos in Love',48789,1.3153,5.6,'AkZ4UmzHRJE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10043,_binary '\0','/2rsrEot0ODJT1ivyziwznBFfpZq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093811',6.8,3482,'en','The Quick and the Dead','In 1876 Wyoming, the gun is the only law. And for Duncan and Suzanna McKaskel, newly arrived settlers beset by outlaws, rugged frontiersman Con Vallian is the only hope.','/9VAY6pSG6Tx1NCmFvg8VhGvlV33.jpg','1987-02-28',90,'Released','A mysterious stranger is about to make a woman forget she\'s a wife and a man remember he\'s a hero.','The Quick and the Dead',26939,3.9542,6.396,'NfRrEUz62Lw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10044,_binary '\0','/rn3E4Kd7EUOGOF95Hsd0aOhQqZg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093818',7.4,39135,'en','Radio Days','The Narrator tells us how the radio influenced his childhood in the days before TV. In the New York City of the late 1930s to the New Year\'s Eve 1944, this coming-of-age tale mixes the narrator\'s experiences with contemporary anecdotes and urban legends of the radio stars.','/ljZ3yyYznAiq1vF6nHITdJn6qXB.jpg','1987-01-30',89,'Released','Tuning in.','Radio Days',30890,4.6716,7.036,'CEd8tjKsYT4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10045,_binary '\0','/oSFshBf9Wrv5UcmZYAmy28BwSSh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093822',7.3,162257,'en','Raising Arizona','When a childless couple—an ex-con and an ex-cop—take one of a wealthy family’s quintuplets to raise as their own, their lives grow more complicated than anticipated.','/niKyjOqiB4XVl0BqgKTHIlHOCeF.jpg','1987-03-13',94,'Released','Their lawless years are behind them. Their child-rearing years lay ahead...','Raising Arizona',378,7.096,7.1,'OjWu8i6eMZo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10046,_binary '\0','/57f96GAYR25Olk7EdV3cT7LHdsV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093828',5.9,5438,'en','Real Men','A womanizing CIA agent and an insecure insurance agent are paired together to make sure a deal goes through with aliens for the future of mankind.','/48RNciPt5K9myWDPcfNhLWUYLgf.jpg','1987-09-25',85,'Released','The fate of the world is in their hands. God help us all.','Real Men',44801,3.2368,6,'NmbbXbGtoxI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10047,_binary '\0','/hEnwoGVYq6cdChZr93VH3hNXX8x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093840',5.8,1261,'es','Remando al viento','In the summer of 1816, Percy Shelley, his mistress Mary, and her stepsister Claire visit Lord Byron at Lake Geneva. Byron challenges each to write a horror story, and Mary begins her novel, Frankenstein. She imagines the monster becoming real, and for the next six years, as tragedy befalls those around her, she believes the personification of her imagination is the cause. Against this backdrop, Claire has Byron\'s baby then is estranged from him and barred from her daughter. Byron and Percy continue their friendship, the one self-centered and decadent, the other wildly idealistic. The Shelleys take up residence near Pisa.','/t1FqqT8fP1LTGBUNd95Y2nmESQl.jpg','1988-09-19',95,'Released',NULL,'Rowing with the Wind',80047,1.7201,5.8,'92U3orszabY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10048,_binary '\0','/3vcVjlyB4jxoWG1GtCgaIzNxu0s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093843',5.6,1480,'en','Remote Control','A video store clerk stumbles onto an alien plot to take over earth by brainwashing people with a bad \'50s science fiction movie. He and his friends race to stop the aliens before the tapes can be distributed world-wide.','/5jB44zLKtSrPA11LTPTEZH6mS0Z.jpg','1988-04-07',88,'Released','Your future is in their hands.','Remote Control',60410,2.1059,5.5,'S4RSr9ecSfA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10049,_binary '\0','/blV6DCUzFSDXxCE8lLf6jRCxGNu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093853',6.3,1306,'en','The Return of the Six-Million-Dollar Man and the Bionic Woman','Ten years after his retirement from the government, Colonel Steve Austin must again team up with Jaime Sommers to stop a terrorist group. Complicating matters for Austin are his estranged son Michael, who struggles for his father\'s acceptance as he graduates from flight school, and Jaime, who must cope with her and Steve\'s past. When Michael is severely injured in a crash, Steve must make the same decision about fitting him with bionics that he had to make with Jaime years ago after her accident.','/mpXR4j7s4vDLOfEjxcuOwGVYum6.jpg','1987-05-17',98,'Released','With America on the brink of destruction... They changed their minds about early retirement!','The Return of the Six-Million-Dollar Man and the Bionic Woman',82085,3.1379,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10050,_binary '\0','/xutd42AYja7C21GuK5d6yR7VJLB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093854',4.5,4291,'en','Return to Horror High','A few years ago, a mysterious serial-killer caused panic on Crippen High School. The killer was never caught. A movie company, Cosmic Pictures, has decided to make a feature movie about these events - on location, at the now abandoned school. Since members of cast and crew disappear without a trace, it seems as if history is repeating itself...','/glZ0Wz5u2Vr7TzM6Kj1f4e6EliU.jpg','1987-01-28',94,'Released','School spirit has never been this dead.','Return to Horror High',45878,2.9707,5.2,'lJVTHLvg6f4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10051,_binary '\0','/vG0xZrv6yehD7T2tNQNCF2iO3Ny.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093855',4.3,5625,'en','A Return to Salem\'s Lot','Anthropologist Joe Weber takes his son on a trip to the New England town of Salem\'s Lot, unaware of its vampire population. When the inhabitants reveal their secret, they seek Weber to write a bible for them.','/sc3jWWodUIaofc176PlYUQzUslj.jpg','1987-09-11',100,'Released','American Vampires as only Stephen King could create them.','A Return to Salem\'s Lot',27740,3.3555,5.928,'3Nn2iZKR1XY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10052,_binary '\0','/9aQzTn1CNgT1FvYdoguozYzpjUk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093857',5.1,16429,'en','Revenge of the Nerds II: Nerds in Paradise','The members of Lambda Lambda Lambda travel to Fort Lauderdale for a fraternity conference. They\'ll have to fend off the attacks of their rival frat, the Alphas, if they want to maintain their self-respect — and, of course, if they want to get anywhere with the pretty girls!','/cza5sS7AzexM4rLQSvfGzGX8a3N.jpg','1987-07-10',98,'Released','They\'re back!','Revenge of the Nerds II: Nerds in Paradise',16889,4.6382,5.57,'h1XXfRwh66w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10053,_binary '\0','/xcaX6BZ1JUPSVMH2gBkWIckLLaA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093870',7.6,312403,'en','RoboCop','In a violent, near-apocalyptic Detroit, evil corporation Omni Consumer Products wins a contract from the city government to privatize the police force. To test their crime-eradicating cyborgs, the company leads street cop Alex Murphy into an armed confrontation with crime lord Boddicker so they can use his body to support their untested RoboCop prototype. But when RoboCop learns of the company\'s nefarious plans, he turns on his masters.','/hHtOgGb3NihlyRATHlKPaFApbrd.jpg','1987-07-17',102,'Released','Part man, part machine, all cop.','RoboCop',5548,13.4151,7.367,'3mYNl6GcCWQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10054,_binary '\0','/j0LNLUeQqGTN3Goz5uMCe9CtMIV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093872',2.4,2379,'en','Robot Holocaust','Neo, a drifter from the atomic-blasted wastelands, arrives with his klutzy robot sidekick at a factory where slaves labor to fuel the sinister Dark One\'s Power Station. There, he meets a comely woman who convinces him to help rescue her scientist father, who has invented a device that can break the Dark One\'s control over the slaves. Gathering a motley crew of allies on the way, Neo and pals travel to the Power Station, where they confront the Dark One\'s evil servants.','/9DiMdtWFAcykVd4c8WCpN8PcJdo.jpg','1986-04-14',79,'Released','It\'s machine vs. man in the ultimate battle for the future!','Robot Holocaust',84760,1.5653,3.3,'hG2G3NIQPwk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10055,_binary '\0','/lr8RIp94UMLcbVryy35XDkSKFH5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093873',3.9,2292,'en','Rock \'n\' Roll Nightmare','At an old farmhouse, a family mysteriously dissapears at the hands of evil. Years later, hair metal band The Tritons comes to the farmhouse, whose barn now features a 24-track recording studio. Lead singer John Triton gets the band to perform their first night in the farmhouse after dinner, and weird little beasties suddenly appear, and strange things start to happen. Band members (and their tagalong girlfriends) begin to act strangely and vanish one by one. Soon, only John Triton remains, and he holds a secret. Finally, the evil shows itself and a battle between heaven and hell ensues....','/uR5B3T9lGW0ISM5xJ1esb5L9N7U.jpg','1987-07-10',83,'Released','When you raise Hell...the Devil must be paid - in full!','Rock \'n\' Roll Nightmare',36762,1.6568,4.6,'PAR4qDJkDPA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10056,_binary '\0','/tksAgCt4vG2fU7ojf7oJBpP6QdG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093881',5.8,2155,'en','The Rosary Murders','A priest is put in a dilemma when the serial killer who has been murdering priests and nuns confesses to him.','/dmMiS1vHbQJyjrEdxlrszfEmFbR.jpg','1987-08-28',105,'Released','God works in mysterious ways. Man works in the deadliest.','The Rosary Murders',126954,1.9778,5.7,'BLAAQ4ttzbU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10057,_binary '\0','/8YYg4SXMJK5Qc7ddxEXoGrNxTGH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093886',6.6,50356,'en','Roxanne','In this modern take on Edmond Rostand\'s classic play \"Cyrano de Bergerac,\" C. D. Bales is the witty, intelligent, and brave fire chief of a small Pacific Northwest town who, due to the size of his enormous nose, declines to pursue the girl of his dreams, lovely Roxanne Kowalski. Instead, when his shy underling Chris McConnell becomes smitten with Roxanne, C.D. feeds the handsome young man the words of love to win her heart.','/c2XSGkpAIIof6Oi8Sr6wBvwt1Lk.jpg','1987-06-19',107,'Released','Roxanne dreamed of a handsome, intelligent, romantic man. C.D. Bales is two out of three—but looks aren\'t everything.','Roxanne',11584,3.5976,6.4,'BTZImXfnrXM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10058,_binary '\0','/ssQ7IcGmgUJdFLv8cHY3vC3OR4f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093894',6.6,193392,'en','The Running Man','By 2017, the global economy has collapsed and U.S. society has become a totalitarian police state, censoring all cultural activity. The government pacifies the populace by broadcasting a number of game shows in which convicted criminals fight for their lives, including the gladiator-style The Running Man, hosted by the ruthless Damon Killian, where “runners” attempt to evade “stalkers” and certain death for a chance to be pardoned and set free.','/GTAUOhO4BN0peJVvxGEQydJvUO.jpg','1987-11-13',101,'Released','It is the year 2019. \"The Running Man\" is a deadly game no one has ever survived. But... Schwarzenegger has yet to play.','The Running Man',865,11.8361,6.543,'i2FMhBg0h_8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10059,_binary '\0','/g1wNQMP7JQUsSoMEzg3hjEcvU86.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093898',5.5,1807,'en','Russkies','A group of American boys discovers a Russian sailor washed up on the coast of Florida and decide to befriend him, assuming that he is friendly and will bring them no danger and thus go against the ideas of their parents, as well as the government.','/A7utYbyrvaKKIbGTH3tsPeSZA20.jpg','1987-11-06',99,'Released','Sometimes the worst of enemies can become the best of friends.','Russkies',27738,1.6771,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10060,_binary '\0','/gnvq3Imx58HKx4Auy95a6HFcFNd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093913',6.6,1644,'en','Sammy and Rosie Get Laid','Sammy and Rosie are an unconventional middle-class London married couple. They live in the midst of inner-city chaos, surround themselves with intellectual street people, and sleep with everybody - except each other! Things become interesting when Sammy\'s father, Rafi, who is a former Indian government minister, comes to London for a visit. Sammy, Rosie, and Rafi try to find meaning through their lives and loves.','/1qqhHVnrIyQAIpJn9H4yqtAoTw1.jpg','1987-10-30',100,'Released','While London burns...','Sammy and Rosie Get Laid',42013,2.206,5.7,'e1fOQTm9mR4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10061,_binary '\0','/yyLEcGxt09da8YoWdBpUClCYgTZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093935',7.1,2138,'en','The Secret Garden','When a spoiled English girl living in 19th century India loses both parents in a cholera epidemic, she is sent back to England to live in a country mansion. The lord is a strange old man-- frail and deformed, immensely kind but so melancholy. She wishes to discover what has caused him so much sorrow and to bring joy back to the household. It all must have something to do with the screams and wails which echo through the house at night and no one wants to talk about.','/42Y7COT8Mpn4h7SnSbH5dgaYQx9.jpg','1987-11-30',100,'Released','The timeless tale of a special place where magic, hope and love grow.','The Secret Garden',46975,2.0088,7.7,'P6tSA4ltZC0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10062,_binary '\0','/tqm00kwclq6nibl7u9De8u3cq0X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093936',6.5,39670,'en','The Secret of My Success','Brantley Foster, a well-educated kid from Kansas, has always dreamed of making it big in New York City, but once there, he learns that jobs - and girls - are hard to get. When he visits his uncle, Howard Prescott, who runs a multi-million-dollar company, he is given a job in the mail room.','/yT4vQVUI4DoQar4elkqbHB1pjf0.jpg','1987-04-10',111,'Released','There\'s no such thing as an overnight success. Brantley Foster took two weeks.','The Secret of My Success',10021,6.4139,6.5,'6_umhEEi-dU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10063,_binary '\0','/XZociOva4LhCObUNEgqFfFPPHr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093940',6.4,11197,'en','September','After a suicide attempt, Lane has moved into her country house to recuperate. Her best friend, Stephanie, has come to join her for the summer. Lane\'s mother, Diane, has recently arrived with her husband Lloyd, Lane\'s stepfather. Lane is close to two neighbors: Peter, and Howard. Howard is in love with Lane, Lane is in love with Peter, and Peter is in love with Stephanie.','/gTsFkvUt9wrGOZh6JNDSFd2LIBT.jpg','1987-12-18',83,'Released','A compelling, emotional drama from one of the finest directors of our time... Woody Allen.','September',22477,1.9904,6.2,'dhY09NEEyP4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10064,_binary '\0','/qDyFe7gMnom72qfUEYzWrgwB4ss.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093949',6.3,2821,'hi','शहँशाह','Inspector Srivastav is framed by a wily and cunning gangster, J.K., and unable to prove his innocence, hangs himself, leaving behind his wife, and son, Vijay. Years later, Vijay has grown up and has joined the police force as an Inspector. Unlike his dad, he is corrupt and does accept bribes to turn a nelson\'s eye to crime. The City Police are assigned the task of apprehending a customed man called \"Shahenshah\", who operates at night and targets, tries and kills gangsters in a \"Judge and Executioner \"style. No one knows the real identity of Shahenshah, as he is feared by the police department, and respected by the poor and middle-class.','/2ZUpj73MzEh2YwVzJNVUqBSu2LZ.jpg','1988-01-29',180,'Released',NULL,'Shahenshah',62201,2.5641,6.532,'QSjCQPQw7Zg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10065,_binary '\0','/6eH6cyXGKiTrt7GsF5o1Bgjj1Sc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093964',6.6,1737,'en','Shy People','A Cosmo Magazine journalist and her daughter leave New York City to visit their distant relatives deep in the bayous of Louisiana.','/6GWGbFWk6fB9FuYSF5c5EuR3Jfp.jpg','1987-12-04',118,'Released','Women from separate worlds bound by a secret that will haunt them forever.','Shy People',69040,2.3664,6.4,'d4HZW76FInI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10066,_binary '\0','/qcxXFE9XEfnyUmAdbvtJqXYtAqc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093966',5.4,5927,'en','The Sicilian','Egocentric bandit Salvatore Giuliano fights the Church, the Mafia, and the landed gentry while leading a populist movement for Sicilian independence.','/3zjrYyAtTs0uxX1a4hhDR3Ir5Rz.jpg','1987-10-07',116,'Released','In Sicily, you stand by the law or by the Mafia. Only one man ever dared to stand alone.','The Sicilian',31945,4.6448,5.2,'0gFqc3uT7VY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10067,_binary '\0','/bNVUGpdOn7mfxWJL86CWhWc3904.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093969',5.5,2600,'en','Siesta','American Claire wakes up blood-soaked and bruised at the end of a runway in Spain. As she tries to account for her state, she has flashbacks from the past few days. She thinks she\'s killed someone, but isn\'t sure, and now she\'s wandering the Spanish streets without money or a clear memory.','/qkBcoO3yHJC0WeAVdiZhw78kBem.jpg','1987-11-11',97,'Released','The time of day when mystery and passion become one.','Siesta',42014,2.0042,5.3,'A3YMbqD1f_w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10068,_binary '\0','/3shjgi6hvL6Aq01SsWZkMabqB4h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093970',8,3031,'en','Prince: Sign \'o\' the Times','In 1987, to capitalize on his growing success in Europe, Prince toured extensively to promote the album of the same name and sales increased accordingly. However, the United States remained resistant to his latest album, and sales began to drop; it was at this point that Prince decided to film a live concert promoting the new material, for eventual distribution to theaters in America. Featuring the band that accompanied Prince on his 1987 Sign o\' the Times Tour, including dancer Cat Glover, keyboardist Boni Boyer, bassist Levi Seacer, Jr., guitarist Miko Weaver, drummer Sheila E. and former member of The Revolution keyboardist Dr. Fink, the film sees the group perform live on stage (although \"U Got the Look\" is represented by its promotional music video).','/zk0C7KOk30M2Awr3vecEUKB2JPP.jpg','1987-11-20',84,'Released','If you go to only one concert this year... the Prince movie is the one!','Prince: Sign \'o\' the Times',38178,2.11,7.5,'ncDxgkcBBmA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10069,_binary '\0','/gxAwYyGguTQEupsSR6Tzv7Nvrcn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093974',3.9,10582,'en','Silent Night, Deadly Night Part 2','Ricky is released from a mental hospital, taking with him the memory of his brother Billy\'s death and embarking on a journey of relentless revenge.','/bg2wBjg5zNoVxZnt7RarVQBxUuj.jpg','1987-04-10',88,'Released','The nightmare is about to begin... AGAIN!','Silent Night, Deadly Night Part 2',50719,3.2152,4.366,'5_tWURpBVVE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10070,_binary '\0','/A89LDBfE4I7peBt9flR29LjtBdf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093978',7.3,12927,'cn','倩女幽魂','A naïve young tax collector for the imperial government winds up spending the night in a haunted temple. There he falls in love with a beautiful woman who, unfortunately, is dead. With the aid of a powerful Daoist Swordsman, he must defeat undead hordes, overcome a sinister Tree Demoness, and descend to the pits of hell, to fight for the spirit he loves.','/oZitiEjIm1jjsB4bTIEZkawhMpx.jpg','1987-07-18',95,'Released','Old Evil is coming to collect the bride.','A Chinese Ghost Story',30421,7.3214,7.3,'5I1blOtGrck','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10071,_binary '\0','/LXgbTJBomPLMvgFAhUbQlLzCRH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093980',5.5,1566,'en','Sister, Sister','Sisters Charlotte and Lucy Bonnard live together in the gloomy Louisiana family mansion that they’ve turned into a boarding house. But when a mysterious young man enters their lives, the sisters are forced to confront their dark pasts.','/dP2ZuWIcnGGLAV6SMTxgjUSQdZH.jpg','1987-09-13',91,'Released','Love Kills','Sister, Sister',98486,2.4756,4.7,'iYxQPqsvQMs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10072,_binary '\0','/sL9ywhpBd7XP6xbs99uQE0nhDur.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093986',5.2,2059,'en','Slam Dance','When framed for the murder of a sultry blonde, an underground cartoonist is drawn into a web of corruption, blackmail and deceit.','/Tr0GSshJUqH21tGLzyXPkf7A6F.jpg','1987-10-02',99,'Released','It\'s not about dancing!','Slam Dance',78691,2.2818,4.9,'qoT0iXDWWCA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10073,_binary '\0','/9NvxLTLFfTKHbmD5f8lqvsHBwJo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093990',5.3,3491,'fr','Slaughterhouse','Faced with the town lawyer, the sheriff, and a rival slaughterhouse owner trying to purchase his land, Lester Bacon decides to take matters into his own hands, ordering his hulking and mentally deranged son to permanently dispose of anyone who conspires against them.','/8k7w4Jh9KWMqCoZzpBaoZPzqNdr.jpg','1987-08-28',85,'Released','You\'ll never get out in one piece!','Slaughterhouse',85160,1.8937,5.2,'uN5YZpCegm4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10074,_binary '\0','/iNJPVy7bbzrgGefnEa9ZFStLmQE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093995',5.3,6846,'es','Slugs: muerte viscosa','People are dying mysteriously and gruesomely, and nobody has a clue what the cause is. Only health worker Mike Brady has a possible solution, but his theory of killer slugs is laughed at by the authorities. Only when the body count begins to rise and a slug expert from England begins snooping around does it begin to look like Mike had the right idea after all.','/lkUYI3fy8d2Z613UwaGcofmT4p.jpg','1988-02-05',89,'Released','They ooze. They slime. They kill.','Slugs',28452,2.0449,5.698,'A0OINhjABu0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10075,_binary '\0','/d7wDFWW2IeRdXn4RPOgw6ozrILu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0093996',4.7,8825,'en','Slumber Party Massacre II','Courtney is tormented by dreams of the infamous Driller Killer returning to wreak havoc... only to find that the murderous monster is reincarnated as an evil rocker.','/n1j7gCi3g2puzqyn7A2rPntHqjx.jpg','1987-10-16',76,'Released','Sleepless nights.','Slumber Party Massacre II',27764,2.6908,5.114,'zkKv4YqMVWg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10076,_binary '\0','/k5LISwQzFyNiw0o1G0azI3YmFnO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094006',7,38039,'en','Some Kind of Wonderful','Keith Nelson, an artsy high school outcast, tries to land a date with popular girl Amanda Jones with some help from his tomboy best friend, Watts. However, Watts realizes she likes Keith as more than just a friend and tries to convince him to stop pursuing Amanda. Matters are further complicated when Keith\'s invitation draws the ire of Amanda\'s rich yet snobby ex-boyfriend, Hardy Jenns, who makes plans to get even.','/6z6ZUrwbAJl9Nq43OY77O7iY80x.jpg','1987-02-27',95,'Released','Before they could stand together, they had to stand alone.','Some Kind of Wonderful',15143,5.1456,6.9,'pe-fpKAhjsk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10077,_binary '\0','/4lCritA97pEdHCTEerfrkv3BMDH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094008',6.1,13456,'en','Someone to Watch Over Me','Claire Gregory, an upper class New York personality, witnesses a murder in a luxurious nightclub. Detective Mike Keegan, recently promoted, is assigned to protect her.','/tal154ck3msMspyDWiWOArmnkKK.jpg','1987-10-09',103,'Released','If you ever see me again, you never saw me before.','Someone to Watch Over Me',31650,4.5322,5.857,'ErFGGccIfkc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10078,_binary '\0','/vAuzj3V6PoHn8GyiSofWbRnTLAo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094011',6.7,4201,'fr','Sous le soleil de Satan','Satan tempts Father Dossignan, who is trying to save the soul of a young girl who killed one of her lovers.','/mWqd19oWODYyHK6RHGsAdW8wtL5.jpg','1987-08-01',98,'Released',NULL,'Under the Sun of Satan',31300,1.9069,6,'jNWwVmKC9sw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10079,_binary '\0','/5j77rB8NRa7lXuu1Sgmm6wfgrzZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094012',7.1,228859,'en','Spaceballs','When the nefarious Dark Helmet hatches a plan to snatch Princess Vespa and steal her planet\'s air, space-bum-for-hire Lone Starr and his clueless sidekick fly to the rescue. Along the way, they meet Yogurt, who puts Lone Starr wise to the power of \"The Schwartz.\" Can he master it in time to save the day?','/kNbaxEsnCyWBTfANVPHayujBsxp.jpg','1987-06-24',96,'Released','May the schwartz be with you.','Spaceballs',957,28.9795,6.9,'LYqTjnSrDuQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10080,_binary '\0','/8TSV0GY4pDvbFUpjkk9H8G6jt5y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094021',4.9,1696,'en','The Squeeze','Harry Berg is both a con artist and an actual artist -- he constructs large sculptures out of television sets -- but he is not particularly successful in either role. He owes some money, which gets him involved with Rachel Dobs, a police detective who works with a collection agency. When Harry comes into possession of a strange parcel, both the con man and the detective find themselves wrapped up in a sinister corporate plot to fix the lottery.','/sJEuDQ64KTXQhxfwGltZrhHBfJP.jpg','1987-07-10',101,'Released','Just a few short weeks ago, nobody even cared if Harry Berg was alive. Now everybody wants him dead. For Harry, that\'s progress.','The Squeeze',109161,2.5656,5,'ppIZf91F-e4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10081,_binary '\0','/t6cgMy0nJXEBuCFxjerZiHbBJiy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094025',6.7,30787,'en','Stakeout','Two detectives observe an escaped convict\'s ex-girlfriend, but complications set in when one of them falls for her.','/mxHqKry4Tn1jYg1lC5o0ObVILZO.jpg','1987-08-05',116,'Released','It\'s a tough job but somebody\'s got to do it!','Stakeout',10859,4.0224,6.483,'EJTsQLUmvvQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10082,_binary '\0','/fSmCPURM80YLuXNvSmU6zoJ52ZN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094027',7.3,22744,'en','Stand and Deliver','Jaime Escalante is a mathematics teacher in a school in a hispanic neighbourhood. Convinced that his students have potential, he adopts unconventional teaching methods to try and turn gang members and no-hopers into some of the country\'s top algebra and calculus students.','/A9pfzwk02iNl6i9wyk8lNcBkvc.jpg','1988-03-11',103,'Released','At a tough school, someone had to take a stand...and someone did. Together, one teacher and one class proved to America they could...','Stand and Deliver',29154,6.4247,7.8,'sG-Cxs8eYkI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10083,_binary '\0','/nMIxOWlFHoiIU51Rkk5ZRsrtw38.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094033',5.1,6060,'en','Steel Dawn','In a post-apocalyptic world, a warrior wandering through the desert comes upon a group of settlers who are being menaced by a murderous gang that is after the water they control.','/3Gx8nqBccCn5eaeajRi7tpHR4Yo.jpg','1987-11-06',97,'Released','He is the desert warrior, carving the future with his sword.','Steel Dawn',27786,2.3947,5,'W0YNBkO2SI4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10084,_binary '\0','/dkT3zHMMEULn1o79xktvVbjWM7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094035',6.7,21084,'en','The Stepfather','Seemingly mild-mannered Henry Morrison has just murdered his entire family. After adopting a new identity and skipping town, he begins building a new relationship with a widow and her teenage daughter. However, he soon begins struggling to hide his true identity and maintain a grip on reality.','/r5CKg3VJQjYvSWTRojK2tE7LpM0.jpg','1987-01-23',89,'Released','He wanted a perfect family in a perfect town. But they couldn\'t measure up...Neither could the others...','The Stepfather',25155,5.6534,6.55,'Gg2YlWCZtLI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10085,_binary '\0','/8Z3z9zGRJK6nzoG0aoXiyv0RjSu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094037',4.3,1810,'en','Stewardess School','A group of varied misfits (including a former prostitute/stripper and a bumbler who can\'t see more than 6 inches in front of his face) enter a school to become flight attendants. Somehow, the group makes it through to the final test: a cross-country flight.','/gv3RXJ0epHMahYd5HBJhApDQHXG.jpg','1986-08-01',93,'Released','This is one flight you\'ll never forget.','Stewardess School',51743,2.1782,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10086,_binary '\0','/vbzBzaKRnsHy4vPtfoymTe0ZqYL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094048',5.6,3161,'en','Straight to Hell','A gang of bank robbers with a suitcase full of money go to the desert to hide out. After burying the loot, they find their way to a surreal town full of cowboys who drink an awful lot of coffee.','/n024xDQXXjtabakNYdRtRKCyvEd.jpg','1987-06-26',86,'Released','A story of blood, money, guns, coffee, and sexual tension.','Straight to Hell',9698,1.9816,5.551,'XKmFR7kbB1I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10087,_binary '\0','/7C2nS9ieQdtjcGQ5F5O00EbJjpA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094056',6.4,4722,'en','Street Smart','A New York journalist lies when his fake story about a pimp describes a real pimp up for murder.','/7aPwpPjrEozWWBr4fZEwmFeTEh5.jpg','1987-03-20',97,'Released','Never let the truth ruin a good story.','Street Smart',60631,3.1349,5.989,'pvra-DfXCas','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10088,_binary '\0','/owbWSs528xtvL2CTSi3ofMf0rfc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094057',5.9,13231,'en','Street Trash','A group of hobos begin melting into multicolored piles of goo after drinking sixty-year-old liquor. At the same time, the psychotic Vietnam War vet who rules the hobo camp snaps and begins killing at random. Two brothers set out to stop the liquor and the killer.','/vwy81HbDoSvccWvculRMUVY39dD.jpg','1987-02-22',100,'Released','Things in New York are about to go down the toilet...','Street Trash',22172,2.9697,6.098,'Ryg9KYXXq0U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10089,_binary '\0','/terZf8tsBWWn5n8JrvZS4KTmaha.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094059',5.1,1331,'it','Strike Commando','The sole survivor of a Vietnam mission is ordered by his commanding officer to photograph Soviets.','/bwjLhZ781E6tOHPT3TEaAjcUU7e.jpg','1987-08-26',104,'Released','A One-Man War Machine!','Strike Commando',86251,1.7423,4.865,'JKAX1M3trI4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10090,_binary '\0','/vXgQGANjRpVvk63KYzr1PbOz887.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094061',4.9,2111,'en','Stripped to Kill','A Los Angeles policewoman\'s partner has her pose as a stripper to lure a killer of strippers.','/rDZ63RGL3EoSHZibdAL1p3hKNfP.jpg','1987-03-20',88,'Released','A Maniac is Killing Strippers. Detective Sheehan Has One Weapon to Stop Him. Her Body.','Stripped to Kill',27795,2.3236,4.7,'AvxNnqXwEeo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10091,_binary '\0','/wy4yQpONIh1e5qyvi0j7a9ha8Kp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094072',6.6,24381,'en','Summer School','A high-school gym teacher has big plans for the summer, but is forced to cancel them to teach a \"bonehead\" English class for misfit goof-off students. Fortunately, his unconventional brand of teaching fun field trips begins to connect with them, and even inspires ardor in some.','/s1Ad6q0XnVS6u1yoaYghHw5dskv.jpg','1987-07-22',97,'Released','At Ocean Front High, what do they call a guy who cuts classes, hates homework, and lives for summer vacations? Teacher.','Summer School',14671,4.1384,6.4,'R0zK5ggTyYQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10092,_binary '\0','/pMNlspaO16rf3eBlqrCwaKFOUlz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094074',3.8,58195,'en','Superman IV: The Quest for Peace','With global superpowers engaged in an increasingly hostile arms race, Superman leads a crusade to rid the world of nuclear weapons. But Lex Luthor, recently sprung from jail, is declaring war on the Man of Steel and his quest to save the planet. Using a strand of Superman\'s hair, Luthor synthesizes a powerful ally known as Nuclear Man and ignites an epic battle spanning Earth and space.','/nJFBeU1oKIaIoLVyQYUeB36DW55.jpg','1987-07-24',90,'Released','Nuclear Power. In the best hands, it is dangerous. In the hands of Lex Luthor, it is pure evil. This is Superman\'s greatest battle. And it is for all of us.','Superman IV: The Quest for Peace',11411,8.9463,4.594,'J3IFSj4ebwU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10093,_binary '\0','/cwS7oXcv7KXsMn29l4xXMLms6Uj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094077',3.8,6513,'en','Surf Nazis Must Die','When a Black oil well worker is killed by a band of California neo-Nazis, his gun-wielding grandmother busts out of her retirement home to avenge him.','/gVECT5DHulQJyo9oqS1tdDSGowI.jpg','1987-07-03',81,'Released','The Beaches Have Become Battlefields... The Waves Are A War Zone!','Surf Nazis Must Die',28070,2.7022,3.9,'8gfwKxX5Lz4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10094,_binary '\0','/tu6eVyOkfBuvSppptjgIWZ5bwVx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094078',5.4,1411,'en','Surrender','A wealthy writer who has had terrible experiences with money-hungry girlfriends & ex-wives pretends to be a broke, washed-up novelist to see if the woman he loves wants him for himself or just for his money.','/uVoxj5KgGx2TX9vwiFg4PLoQ3JL.jpg','1987-10-09',105,'Released','A comedy about two people who wanted each other in the worst way...and that\'s how they got each other.','Surrender',123392,1.7759,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10095,_binary '\0','/b2vMEdoIYcySuE5a5y1xe643zAI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094082',6.6,13207,'en','Suspect','When a Supreme Court judge commits suicide and his secretary is found murdered, all fingers point to Carl Anderson, a homeless veteran who\'s deaf and mute. But when public defender Kathleen Riley is assigned to his case, she begins to believe that Anderson may actually be innocent. Juror Eddie Sanger, a Washington lobbyist, agrees, and together the pair begins their own investigation of events.','/hL79lrrMgRZO21otWbTTiljufeU.jpg','1987-10-23',121,'Released','She\'s a lawyer who broke two laws of her profession... Never get involved with a juror and don\'t look for clues in dangerous places.','Suspect',12623,3.5187,6.6,'WFKq_RApsuI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10096,_binary '\0','/65FiYiD0cmo50lF8J1iSVMOLZLW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094089',7.6,2588,'en','Swimming to Cambodia','Spalding Gray sits behind a desk throughout the entire film and recounts his exploits and chance encounters while playing a minor role in the film \'The Killing Fields\'. At the same time, he gives a background to the events occurring in Cambodia at the time the film was set.','/33gl89Dw4y51pVK2PcSWi0PaKVi.jpg','1987-03-13',85,'Released',NULL,'Swimming to Cambodia',42015,1.5363,7,'B3huAuetHDk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10097,_binary '\0','/54HMwbDcMxFf16sTHF2nPMnZbja.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094105',7,1515,'fr','Tandem','Michel Mortez travels around France hosting a radio game show he created 25 years ago. He is famous among the average Frenchmen. Rivetot, his assistant and technician, always goes with him. He is the only one who knows what really lies under Mortez\'s appearance of a playful don Juan. When the program is canceled, Rivetot delays telling Mortez as long as possible...','/iQSg0AnEY69sC0q5ATbkRZlikrz.jpg','1987-06-17',86,'Released',NULL,'Tandem',56520,1.4216,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10098,_binary '\0','/qeDgecvGMKPuiPhpku7eD9yMMx1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094118',3.5,13269,'en','Teen Wolf Too','Although awkward college student Todd Howard is particularly adept at science, he\'s paying for school with an athletic scholarship that he will lose should he not fare well in an upcoming boxing tournament. Luckily for Todd, he has inherited the same family curse that once turned his cousin into a werewolf. As he transforms into the hairy, fanged, howling monster, he finds both his physical agility and his popularity skyrocketing -- but at what cost?','/unfbmoUTIsQzQF09RJZVN1GKr6b.jpg','1987-11-20',95,'Released','High school was easy. But college is a whole different ANIMAL.','Teen Wolf Too',15582,3.4922,4.17,'rMaAZ1yWNEE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10099,_binary '\0','/rVp4XrInBkLC37n64nk5g5Wpf7F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094137',6.2,62254,'en','3 Men and a Baby','Three bachelors find themselves forced to take care of a baby left by one of the guy\'s girlfriends.','/oYetboAljWR2N5A7MU3i63DvUtd.jpg','1987-11-27',102,'Released','They changed her diapers. She changed their lives.','3 Men and a Baby',12154,6.8209,6.2,'ki1tNXq9vIU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10100,_binary '\0','/hrD8UN3J7XMC2b9ponFzGDk0kYG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094138',7.1,14574,'en','Three O\'Clock High','Nerdy high schooler Jerry Mitchell is assigned to write an article for the school paper about the infamous new delinquent transfer student, Buddy Revell. When Jerry accidentally invades Buddy\'s personal space and touches him, Buddy challenges Jerry to an afterschool fight in the parking lot, which Jerry tries to avoid at all costs.','/8IKEBJdaFWVBxPmsmUx5eICRwKf.jpg','1987-10-09',99,'Released','Jerry Mitchell just bumped into Buddy Revell. Now Jerry isn\'t thinking about math or english. Because at three o\'clock, he\'s history.','Three O\'Clock High',13339,4.9903,6.794,'pjLqimENb1A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10101,_binary '\0','/7hiBcUlvXgoTVw7L5DBjvs4ag8h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094140',5.4,1313,'en','Three for the Road','A crafty political aide and his soft-spoken pal are assigned the job of delivering a senator\'s out-of-control teenage daughter to an institution.','/nimPeNINKgYaUtiXv7veOzoPiYL.jpg','1987-04-10',88,'Released','...a little fun goes a long way.','Three for the Road',116064,2.3355,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10102,_binary '\0','/eKSbKlvuLKlMkgtGH4cpjeODh2l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094142',6.3,44729,'en','Throw Momma from the Train','Larry Donner, an author with a cruel ex-wife, teaches a writing workshop in which one of his students, Owen, is fed up with his domineering mother. When Owen watches a Hitchcock classic that seems to mirror his own life, he decides to put the movie\'s plot into action and offers to kill Larry\'s ex-wife, if Larry promises to murder his mom. Before Larry gets a chance to react to the plan, it seems that Owen has already set things in motion.','/fwcIsCwTwF8AXNxvNkrZ5dZlGPz.jpg','1987-12-11',88,'Released','Owen asked his friend Larry for a small favor.','Throw Momma from the Train',11896,5.2244,6.2,'XHyRyDx75Ck','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10103,_binary '\0','/pZWvTEk3BX3hnVx6DZleybhzCm5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094152',4.3,1350,'en','The Time Guardian','In the distant future, the human race nears extinction and a new race of beast-like creatures rule the earth. The few surviving people live in the City, a huge protected construction with the ability to travel in both space and time. The City travels back to our time to save humanity...','/uP71xrn6X5wuMi4f2BB6EBSB9BU.jpg','1987-12-03',87,'Released','Pray he\'s not too late.','The Time Guardian',32064,2.1961,4.9,'sCIifRGFwQE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10104,_binary '\0','/wk2F8Dn9HM1F9qzrUcfZJ5Kzxpp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094153',2.3,1313,'ja','Time of the Apes','A female scientist and two children are accidentally transported into a future dominated by primates.','/u8flqkhabppFOvry4UjRI8TNpWL.jpg','1987-05-15',97,'Released',NULL,'Time of the Apes',47444,1.4294,3.4,'JN0dXUNOC5g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10105,_binary '\0','/t4RTiXnhMxvAr6HheyjdngOw8qv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094154',5.6,1800,'en','Timestalkers','History professor Scott McKenzie makes an anachronistic discovery in a photograph from the Old West and he is soon joined by beautiful time-traveler Georgia in a time-skipping adventure to stop her colleague from the future from erasing her from existence.','/pVmex70jR8nipO3osMZUjLV9kfW.jpg','1987-03-10',83,'Released','It\'s Way Past Time To Kill The Future...','Timestalkers',50551,1.7461,5.4,'OBX828BCWD0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10106,_binary '\0','/A3NklJi0P1tx9d05NZstJVmL5JS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094155',6.6,10779,'en','Tin Men','A minor car accident drives two rival aluminum-siding salesmen to the ridiculous extremes of man versus man in 1963 Baltimore.','/5rWE9ft0Uc2kuDWlkg5vQth58XZ.jpg','1987-03-06',112,'Released','The American Dream changes. The people who sell it don\'t.','Tin Men',10896,3.1828,6.3,'ajetxCpdwbY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10107,_binary '\0','/kkaEVy8sni5qY2ZGddRTbqrBk9D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094169',5,2209,'en','Tough Guys Don\'t Dance','Tim Madden awakens one morning to discover a fresh tattoo on his arm, his car covered in blood, his girlfriend in bed with the town sheriff, and a woman\'s severed head in his weed stash. Sensing a setup and in desperate need to clear his name, he begins an investigation that soon begins to expose a web of corruption in the small coastal community of Provincetown.','/dXXLAyfFSl7kW1JN2xcIEQz2kla.jpg','1987-09-18',109,'Released','A love story haunted by murder.','Tough Guys Don\'t Dance',78146,2.384,4.7,'ARjauXcHVBE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10108,_binary '\0','/i1oWUGVDNBhGBykcCRBlX326udb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094226',7.8,357078,'en','The Untouchables','Elliot Ness, an ambitious prohibition agent, is determined to take down Al Capone. In order to achieve this goal, he forms a group given the nickname “The Untouchables”.','/tPq0R4jTO4Ey8ZspFaWK9wGA4Ls.jpg','1987-06-03',119,'Released','What are you prepared to do?','The Untouchables',117,18.5933,7.752,'YbzkK06MJjE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10109,_binary '\0','/4GTigFnSCANLWLBkgVgAhfEf2we.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094238',7.1,2787,'da','Valhalla','Two children in the Viking age find their way into the magical world of Norse mythology.','/x9hNX29TfdNzMZMiYEQhkH3vDzI.jpg','1986-05-12',76,'Released',NULL,'Valhalla',12646,2.4349,6.8,'XwAGt9dvZdo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10110,_binary '\0','/8BmxtHpyh3X1TcXMWyMag4OQbTn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094242',7.7,1522,'sh','Вeћ виђeно','Mihajlo, an introvert piano teacher starts romance with a pretty careerist who teaches modeling at the university in Belgrade where they both work. His feelings are awakened after a long period, but this relationship makes him see the flashbacks, as well as yet unseen images that remind him of his troubled childhood - as if he experienced this already. When their university wins a contest to hold public TV performance, Mihailo fails to play the piano on the decisive night and she dumps him. The boiling point is about to come.','/8k3Wf9soKQv8taEBVMexX3AnbMs.jpg','1987-02-01',102,'Released',NULL,'Reflections',264239,0.873,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10111,_binary '\0','/tSSuJOUwGGzIst9Q8pNyr4xGQDk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094271',2.9,1227,'de','Violent Shit','A demented, wicked, deformed, cannibalistic killer named K. The Butcher Shitter, escapes from the police and slaughters people in many gory, bloody ways.','/oX53KkEaGF2MfwOOJaBOYASALNC.jpg','1989-01-01',75,'Released','Experience a Lesson in Real Bad Taste; Expect the Worst','Violent Shit',36900,0.8078,3.2,'unH3jIi41BM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10112,_binary '\0','/3shPX0JxJC4ZD5s67No48dkaex9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094288',4.8,1728,'en','Walk Like a Man','Bobo, a feral man raised by wolves, is reunited with his family by a researcher. However, this disappoints his brother, Reggie, who has no intentions of sharing the family inheritance with him.','/7CiceN03UnHLx1QzkTWGMjsNbU4.jpg','1987-04-17',86,'Released','What does a $30,000,000 inheritance mean to a guy who thinks he\'s a dog? It means his brother Reggie wants him to roll over and play dead.','Walk Like a Man',40752,2.2671,4.7,'hVmYkXSWMNo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10113,_binary '\0','/v46Uq29FXcl4huvu1Nh7tJ5qAjZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094291',7.3,175999,'en','Wall Street','A young and impatient stockbroker is willing to do anything to get to the top, including trading on illegal inside information taken through a ruthless and greedy corporate raider, who takes the youth under his wing.','/2tQYq9ntzn2dEwDIGLBSipYPenv.jpg','1987-12-10',126,'Released','Every dream has a price.','Wall Street',10673,9.7916,7.2,'2KqKHuPa2J8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10114,_binary '\0','/wJPXK4XqYasbGQ3mJHxstdZ5jZw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094293',5.9,7010,'en','Wanted: Dead or Alive','Nick Randall is a Los Angeles-based bounty hunter and an ex-CIA operative who is asked by a former co-worker to help track down terrorist Malak Al Rahim. However, Malak Al Rahim is also looking for Randall, forcing a showdown on the waterfront.','/3aW1EJYJ7C3ZLLF1KlvCE5PS3U1.jpg','1987-01-16',104,'Released','Nick Randall is a loner. A legend. A bounty hunter. He\'s the best there is at the job he hates.','Wanted: Dead or Alive',23599,3.8962,5.966,'Qu-PHgl7CNM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10115,_binary '\0','/hnocmiBckaI9cBG2vRAuaJL01FZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094298',3.4,1446,'en','Warrior Queen','In ancient Pompeii, slaves are bought and sold for household chores and sex. A mysterious queen moves among the elite, meantime secretly helping the slaves to escape. Eventually her life is also in jeopardy, and as the volcano erupts she and the slaves attempt to escape while being chased by the military.','/P0j17mJRpSIZOglbtPkakHSD1S.jpg','1987-01-26',79,'Released','Untamed passion. Untold power.','Warrior Queen',30484,6.0988,3.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10116,_binary '\0','/qgHvctioYxreVgJ9UnT0SVTKFBF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094315',7.1,5886,'en','The Whales of August','Two aged sisters reflect on life and the past during a late summer day in Maine.','/hQ4yKrRaC3KTOfanyJWJD0CmCs.jpg','1987-10-14',90,'Released','The Screen\'s Immortals... A movie you\'ll never forget.','The Whales of August',49815,2.6753,7,'GAVMbVJexx0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10117,_binary '\0','/fjsAltpDL9A85SmieuOmIya94DW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094317',6.4,3550,'en','White Mischief','A millionaire past his prime and his young wife arrive in Kenya circa 1940 to find that the other affluent British expatriates are living large as the homefront gears up for war. They are busy swapping partners, doing drugs, and attending lavish parties and horse races. She begins a torrid affair with one of the bon vivants, and her husband finds out and confronts them. The husband and wife decide to break up peacefully, but the bon vivant is murdered and all the evidence points to the husband.','/h05byiWZxjwJ5FghK2LmOqW0oBB.jpg','1987-11-10',107,'Released','In a world of wife swapping, drugs and chocolate covered lobsters, murder seemed so uncivilised.','White Mischief',60041,3.6202,6.103,'vy40g6aMy2M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10118,_binary '\0','/14oCrQ2HQnc3hHi9P7vSgQXsW9J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094318',6.2,6506,'en','White Water Summer','When the experienced guide Vic accompanies the city boy Alan and his three friends on their first wilderness experience, he not only hopes to teach the four boys lessons about the wilderness, but about themselves. Vic pushes them to the limit. Soon after alienating the boys, Vic finds himself in desperate need of help and must rely on his students in order to survive.','/jvoxMkXms4O490OlCNuJk4y7ZB4.jpg','1987-07-10',90,'Released','Hold on for the wildest ride of your life','White Water Summer',19209,3.3702,6.191,'_QBmRr7h7Fw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10119,_binary '\0','/6aLSnAgqOyqz8ngf0ibOQeQCN2B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094320',6.1,3390,'en','White of the Eye','In a wealthy and isolated desert community, a sound expert is targeted as the prime suspect of a series of brutal murders of local suburban housewives who were attacked and mutilated in their homes. As he desperately tries to prove his innocence, his wife starts to uncover startling truths...','/aLFoGmQpknOvcyx4imCP7Fuvoip.jpg','1987-06-19',111,'Released','No woman is safe… while he is loose!','White of the Eye',33592,2.4939,5.8,'u4WMa5SfqJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10120,_binary '\0','/nPLS4lsCl34nIIMb1MBYtHsd5hY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094321',4.9,12160,'en','Who\'s That Girl','An uptight New York City tax lawyer gets his life turned upside down one day when he\'s asked to escort a feisty free-spirited ex-convict who asks him to help prove her innocence of her crime.','/2Yu6ciKKgSWIZAzUg4IrrifO23z.jpg','1987-08-07',93,'Released','A funny thing happened on the way to the bus station.','Who\'s That Girl',26827,22.3352,5.5,'rDjeOyO2Biw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10121,_binary '\0','/mmaG8lju6ldvjfbTpMw3eqmQlHg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094327',5.1,1480,'en','The Wind','Mystery writer Sian Anderson leaves her boyfriend John for three weeks of intense writing in the isolated Greek town of Monemvassia. Upon her arrival in the ancient, deserted, walled-in fortress, she is met by Elias Appleby, the round eccentric landlord who guides her through mysterious underground passageways to the house where she will work. He warns her to stay inside at night because of the killer winds that arrive after dark.','/vLlS3DqLwy7EuwHiKvptxQImmVR.jpg','1986-11-17',92,'Released','Sian Anderson is writing a book about murder. Its first chapter is going be her last.','The Wind',30919,1.5632,5.2,'Mv6hLmaPwNU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10122,_binary '\0','/4BLMhP2NwaGMOyv6zw3VyKqDiUA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094331',6.8,3765,'en','Wish You Were Here','In a staid English seaside town after the Second World War, young Lynda grows up with her widowed father and younger sister. Rebellious Lynda has been swearing constantly from an early age. At sixteen, she becomes more exhibitionist and seeks out sexual encounters challenging the prevailing lower-middle class attitudes to sex.','/cULL2vpyXLK6F3CAsO3h5nCzNQV.jpg','1987-07-24',92,'Released','Some people march to the beat of a different drummer. Lynda’s got her own brass band.','Wish You Were Here',46976,2.5102,6.4,'bdjmYfELanI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10123,_binary '\0','/5xgtdWDqBhc2nD5e6zlgyjeQ6XD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094332',6.6,85294,'en','The Witches of Eastwick','Three single women in a picturesque village have their wishes granted, at a cost, when a mysterious and flamboyant man arrives in their lives.','/p5OivnZuXfy5E3BKKFIeSidmwys.jpg','1987-06-12',118,'Released','Three beautiful women. One lucky devil.','The Witches of Eastwick',6069,8.4408,6.547,'mLs1y_KSTKk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10124,_binary '\0','/bOgKCymrdPHPHozhRBNr9XhVD87.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094336',7.5,53011,'en','Withnail & I','Two out-of-work actors -- the anxious, luckless Marwood and his acerbic, alcoholic friend, Withnail -- spend their days drifting between their squalid flat, the unemployment office and the pub. When they take a holiday \"by mistake\" at the country house of Withnail\'s flamboyantly gay uncle, Monty, they encounter the unpleasant side of the English countryside: tedium, terrifying locals and torrential rain.','/i18cIp8A10A2JgByrfA9oIC9299.jpg','1987-06-19',108,'Released','If you don\'t remember the 60s don\'t worry, neither can they.','Withnail & I',13446,4.8614,7.223,'PCJ2gzSeTdE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10125,_binary '\0','/sy4geqUjHc6YPlFrnul4bPTil5c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094347',7.3,2462,'en','The Year My Voice Broke','Set in 1962, a young prepubescent boy in rural Australia watches painfully as his best friend and first love blossoms into womanhood and falls for a thuggish rugby player, changing the lives of everyone involved.','/eThAKG78ypcpyZSysue7exgMuZS.jpg','1987-10-15',105,'Released','It was incredible. It was the year that changed everything. Forever.','The Year My Voice Broke',19958,2.131,7.1,'rjylFJeNftI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10126,_binary '\0','/qNYWkqaVzgJm2dkGW5TlPMW18eO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094349',6.9,3048,'bm','Yeelen','A young man with magical powers journeys to his uncle to request help in fighting his sorcerer father.','/xjckmcnKK6Ex6wHrVydu4F21h3t.jpg','1987-07-01',105,'Released',NULL,'Yeelen',71329,2.1849,6.604,'GRlNG9lJ6rs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10127,_binary '\0','/2pPPazrrSGWWW9OhgKiUh0nYGvS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094351',6.3,1252,'cn','義膽群英','A respected and well liked gang-boss is betrayed and killed. One of his three adopted sons are to take his place. One of them is the traitor.','/9XFE1bSI0QnWEW2HTcGww2BQ8IO.jpg','1989-09-14',97,'Released',NULL,'Just Heroes',74287,2.2832,6.6,'CC2XcZ0e4kg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10128,_binary '\0','/yckQAuGfxw3mGLTpVXoXOyfF5LP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094357',7.1,12990,'cn','英雄本色2','A restauranteur teams up with a police officer and his ex-con brother to avenge the death of a friend\'s daughter.','/e8352Dw1SeM4rNAGYDZVkQ0aenz.jpg','1987-12-17',104,'Released',NULL,'A Better Tomorrow II',18305,4.6297,7.077,'DB5hSQp2irI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10129,_binary '\0','/urmqanJmSjVReGhbJtv1iiCzKdg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094374',7.1,2585,'cn','執法先鋒','Jason Chan, a Hong Kong lawyer, is angry at the way the law protects criminals and decides to take the law into his own hands, dishing out vigilante justice when a key witness and his entire family are murdered. But hotshot cop Cindy Si is soon on Chan\'s case, and the situation unravels into a fight that only a few will survive.','/diXiT68DC6mIlzv3WsOS2iYkl36.jpg','1986-11-27',96,'Released',NULL,'Righting Wrongs',66212,2.6594,7.6,'jJK0cMB7nMs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10130,_binary '\0','/dz0E515ONty4UY65HnoOTELQDt1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094375',6.5,1583,'cn','中華戰士','A daredevil airplane pilot and spy, who fights against the occupying Japanese forces in China, must rescue the ruler of the city of Kaal from the hands of a ruthless Japanese general and his advancing army.','/2oCT6fZknLmI8ET8wggMHshvWm9.jpg','1987-04-16',92,'Released','An exotic city in faraway land, a dark and brutal empire, and one incredible hero.','Magnificent Warriors',43637,2.0706,6.6,'1mHBC7hRV3A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10131,_binary '\0','/qMK95QwYv4A57sxWATfzpQLRQQC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094383',4.3,1641,'en','Zombie High','A freshman begins to notice that students at her new school are losing their individuality. She discovers that the faculty are operating on the students\' brains to make them docile and productive.','/a49DawYmrilzmSITTozQWoG2yQm.jpg','1987-10-02',90,'Released','THEY\'LL DRAIN YOUR BRAIN!','Zombie High',55539,2.4876,4.1,'yWxxwe10Li4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10132,_binary '\0','/A9YapTDvV4iBKikYl6V1nBJaoxF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094407',7.4,4665,'de','Ödipussi','Paul Winkelmann is the CEO of a successful business in Hamburg that he took over after the death of his father eight years ago. But he is still strongly dominated by his 78 year old mother who cares for him as a child, and who cannot understand why he took an apartment on his own after all these years. The real \"problem\" starts when Paul gets to know psychologist Margarethe Tietze whose relationship to her parents is also not so easy after all.','/akKq4D7XoE7zmNbhRSAeOJgsoL4.jpg','1988-03-10',88,'Released',NULL,'Ödipussi',4645,1.1923,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10133,_binary '\0','/fJNcvIhNAk0Z7BFsgztrsVahxVg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094590',8.1,2316,'en','Depeche Mode: 101','A fascinating documentary focusing on backstage realities of art and business during the British synthesizer band\'s 1988 American tour.','/pc3cBfBxtK9EXKmYaNpL6wtEPuC.jpg','1989-04-27',120,'Released',NULL,'Depeche Mode: 101',26360,1.3572,8,'h2G7YY8Zr88','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10134,_binary '\0','/mZxTLpYupWkwoQcs7szKy9r9tsG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094593',5.8,5564,'en','18 Again!','81-year-old millionaire Jack Watson switches bodies with his 18-year-old grandson David, leading the two to experience life on opposite ends of the age spectrum. But when David, trapped in Jack\'s aged body, ends up in a coma, his grandfather must use his meager knowledge of the youth to prevent his family from pulling the plug.','/kDMgcjSNadUBmpkbMuX3u48qgI4.jpg','1988-04-08',100,'Released','His mind was 81. His body was 18. When Jack Watson found his fountain of youth, it overflowed with comedy.','18 Again!',38965,3.1336,5.6,'_CPxn0HqWAY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10135,_binary '\0','/8WP2GzfQPxMHBpJ1S83t6BTdPeM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094594',5.8,4225,'en','1969','Two rebellious youths, Ralph and Scott, find themselves struggling with adulthood as the Vietnam War rages. Feeling trapped in their small town, Scott battles with his conservative veteran father, Cliff, and Ralph deals with his desperately sexual mother, Ev. When tragic news arrives from overseas, the entire town, inspired by Ralph and Scott\'s antiwar efforts, reevaluates its attitude toward the war.','/lM8B5gsF28UNKMJY3ZVSkpy5Ie.jpg','1988-08-18',95,'Released','The year the country split apart and a generation came together.','1969',47817,1.6738,5.6,'cJ8Db-VHnpk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10136,_binary '\0','/uqcYcBve5TDElL5buSzOMHWIqPA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094596',6,1720,'fr','36 Fillette','A 14-year-old pursues romance with a man while vacationing with her family in Switzerland.','/fjqm3VnyDh6X6Yx5o9wANj7glaA.jpg','1988-03-23',88,'Released',NULL,'36 Fillette',465,2.9941,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10137,_binary '\0','/mk1KeasAfwUGfFfzlbUVKINxC7Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094597',5.1,6827,'en','976-EVIL','A bullied unpopular high school student named Hoax finds an ad for 976-EVIL, a number that provides daily \'horrorscopes\'. But when he calls the number he gains demonic powers, which he uses to seek vengeance against those who bullied him.','/qQVLe0h2k06aamoAI5KjOle7mJR.jpg','1988-12-09',92,'Released','Revenge is on the line.','976-EVIL',24038,3.2935,5.355,'UeGhg75Ag6k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10138,_binary '\0','/qvrayOIHOQMo9y9B3u7ACGimuo2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094602',6,37450,'en','Above the Law','Nico Toscani is an Italian immigrant, American patriot, ex-CIA agent, aikido specialist and unorthodox Chicago policeman. He is as committed to his job as he is to his personalized brand of justice—expert and thorough bone-crushing.','/pS6j4cIrv1LWSIk5NxYvpQwNTsT.jpg','1988-04-08',99,'Released','He\'s a cop who believes no one is above the law.','Above the Law',9395,7.3991,6.1,'08pYpAgiEHU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10139,_binary '\0','/ucEgYBXB1N7iP7Zx8YEHXFVwOnd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094606',6.7,18727,'en','The Accidental Tourist','After the death of his son, travel writer Macon Leary seems to be sleep walking through life. Macon\'s wife is having similar problems. They separate, and Macon meets a strange, outgoing woman who brings him \'back down to earth\', but his wife soon thinks their marriage is still worth another try.','/dyk2BqPajLRBpVQ6jsSJJdgfuXe.jpg','1988-12-23',121,'Released','Macon Leary was set in his ways. The way he lived, thought and worked. He imagined it would always be like that. Until an unusual woman showed him the way it could be.','The Accidental Tourist',31052,3.4954,6.263,'lRENOT13vBM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10140,_binary '\0','/l6RKD2IjmGvtauSvx1xs2UY6CqU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094608',7.1,43547,'en','The Accused','Out drinking one night after a fight with her boyfriend, three men brutally rape Sarah Tobias in a bar while people watch and cheer. District Attorney Kathryn Murphy takes the case; however, she allows the rapists to receive a mild sentence. A distraught Sarah decides to seek punishment for the men who witnessed and encouraged the rape. To get justice, Sarah must take the stand and revisit the night of her attack.','/5DlWHYb5Q65GaHYHDo6PqGOuoF1.jpg','1988-10-14',111,'Released','The first scream was for help. The second is for justice.','The Accused',10868,6.6338,7.1,'zDujtATPuBk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10141,_binary '\0','/wz9Fntmcqvrd4bqtPCTLp5DeEwc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094612',5.6,13787,'en','Action Jackson','Vengeance drives a tough Detroit cop to stay on the trail of a power hungry auto magnate who\'s systematically eliminating his competition.','/vWBGkHT91My4T2iV3xgynpBTKtQ.jpg','1988-02-12',96,'Released','It\'s time for \"Action\".','Action Jackson',10117,4.6679,5.5,'lnnA33SPYXU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10142,_binary '\0','/rjzSmq6nEq2A2W7kSf9dw0uMiwJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094620',4.3,3188,'it','After Death - Oltre la morte','Seeking the cure for cancer, a woman goes back to the island where her parents were killed, and accidentally raises the dead by angering a voodoo priest.','/yBjQiteWRpTogARRq4LseRvmtTO.jpg','1990-07-27',88,'Released',NULL,'After Death',5796,1.6736,5,'WuWiJF7Ah3Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10143,_binary '\0','/lQiVXN5CutQCxqSwkNFkys2kV4U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094621',7.7,1556,'ta','அக்னி நட்சத்திரம்','Two step sons of an honest noble man choose different professions. One becomes a police office and the other turns into a goon. The rest of the film revolves around how the two confront each other.','/rnm8qlFvQnU9Acj0o1tvJsKlzmk.jpg','1988-04-15',146,'Released',NULL,'Agni Natchathiram',78748,1.0755,6.964,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10144,_binary '\0','/fK40VGYIm7hmKrLJ26fgPQU0qRG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094625',8,231838,'ja','AKIRA','A secret military project endangers Neo-Tokyo when it turns a biker gang member into a rampaging psychic psychopath that only two teenagers and a group of psychics can stop.','/neZ0ykEsPqxamsX6o5QNUFILQrz.jpg','1988-07-16',124,'Released','Neo-Tokyo is about to E.X.P.L.O.D.E.','Akira',149,19.1829,7.941,'Jq4ER-P6NCQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10145,_binary '\0','/1HjfzGlX0Y92dFxHbRgsmxHSYIv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094627',5.3,3530,'es','Al filo del hacha','An axe murderer terrorizes a small Northern California mountain community, while two young computer-obsessed adults attempt to solve the killings.','/lgtWQIYjIkg736oOYMsAi3ATcp6.jpg','1988-05-20',91,'Released','There is nothing silent about the nights in Paddock County.','Edge of the Axe',30794,1.5132,5.2,'wgz4kT8_KNc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10146,_binary '\0','/bsPZIQNhyqRZ5TbQbTGjbaUCdxt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094631',6.3,17999,'en','Alien Nation','A few years from now, Earth will have the first contact with an alien civilization. These aliens, known as Newcomers, slowly begin to be integrated into human society after years of quarantine.','/2wEyQkFXX6ReyW44YQa1kLQYkCg.jpg','1988-10-07',91,'Released','Prepare Yourself.','Alien Nation',10128,4.1405,6.1,'TmDRQWn7jgk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10147,_binary '\0','/tzOyiIgc4qY2tJPk9oNxQbC8JJ3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094641',7.4,4682,'es','Amanece, que no es poco','Teodoro, a Spanish engineer working as a professor in the United States, returns to Spain to enjoy a sabbatical year.','/lQX1gTROwLPFVWrXBy2uCHOLyby.jpg','1989-01-17',106,'Released',NULL,'Dawn Breaks, Which Is No Small Thing',20607,1.9962,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10148,_binary '\0','/z4BeLiuYm9pFzAPzf4Fkx12odDu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094642',5.8,5391,'en','American Gothic','When six friends fly off on a weekend getaway and are suddenly plagued by engine trouble, they\'re forced to land on a remote island. Looking for shelter, they\'re grateful to encounter Ma and Pa and their children - an eccentric family living in the island\'s backwoods. But what begins as simple hospitality turns into a terrifying race for survival as the friends start disappearing one by one ... and turning up dead.','/rKal4piPoNlIGC0swuiHb7QfCiA.jpg','1987-08-17',90,'Released','The family that slays together stays together.','American Gothic',51442,2.0924,5.9,'c5WXJN6GEyA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10149,_binary '\0','/cbo6XxLWVtZCJpKHx5IZ8C0q7OE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094651',6.6,11411,'nl','Amsterdamned','A mysterious diver hiding in Amsterdam\'s canal system embarks on a rampage of gruesome murders, terrifying city officials and leaving few clues for the city\'s best detective, who doesn\'t suspect that both his new girlfriend and twelve-year-old daughter may be closer than he is to finding the killer.','/uNPQUEd13n9fIDliOYfOyxfyY4Y.jpg','1988-02-11',114,'Released','The danger lies just below the surface','Amsterdamned',2093,3.2386,6.4,'frPRkkh6GXE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10150,_binary '\0','/2cH8vxci9QjUP9oT2OLW2OHn6U6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094663',7.2,16478,'en','Another Woman','Marion is a woman who has learned to shield herself from her emotions. She rents an apartment to work undisturbed on her new book, but by some acoustic anomaly she can hear all that is said in the next apartment in which a psychiatrist holds his office. When she hears a young woman tell that she finds it harder and harder to bear her life, Marion starts to reflect on her own life. After a series of events she comes to understand how her unemotional attitude towards the people around her affected them and herself.','/ds4CcnlACh0r1r3VGa7y85dz72R.jpg','1988-10-13',84,'Released','Relationships and the choices we make in life','Another Woman',22478,4.094,6.835,'6xywx45nA_8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10151,_binary '\0','/jjyP7XNS6JZMsgZHukU8RHtEPo5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094667',6.8,4392,'en','Apartment Zero','In a rundown area of Buenos Aires, at the dawn of the 1980s, Adrian LeDuc owns both a struggling movie theater and a shabby apartment building filled with eccentric, squabbling tenants. To make ends meet, Adrian takes in a roommate, Jack Carney, but soon begins to suspect that the quiet American is responsible for a series of political assassinations that are rocking the city.','/cVXGyReSl955Wr2c8ythuxRmJRK.jpg','1989-09-02',124,'Released',NULL,'Apartment Zero',5333,1.7161,6.7,'oLXQHWcvjkg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10152,_binary '\0','/kg4bbWQCe0Mx8UiXmAKKPoiD6dk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094669',6.1,8250,'en','Appointment with Death','Emily Boynton, the stepmother to three children, blackmails the family lawyer into destroying a second will of her late husband that would have freed the children from her dominating influence. She takes herself, the children, and her daughter-in-law on holiday to Europe and the Holy Land. At a dig, Emily is found dead and Hercule Poirot investigates.','/fnHtgkOgYznDOh9lmK5MLiJpxVU.jpg','1988-04-15',102,'Released','An invitation to murder!','Appointment with Death',4281,4.466,6.1,'JSDBvzsPkgM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10153,_binary '\0','/hQ4pYsIbP22TMXOUdSfC2mjWrO0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094675',7.4,10029,'fi','Ariel','A Finnish man goes to the city to find a job after the mine where he worked is closed and his father commits suicide.','/ojDg0PGvs6R9xYFodRct2kdI6wC.jpg','1988-10-21',73,'Released',NULL,'Ariel',2,3.2081,7.114,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10154,_binary '\0','/yGXVBYMEEzcEZebWDSDi2cg0SFt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094678',4.7,7185,'en','Arthur 2: On the Rocks','Arthur loses his fortune for staying with Linda, right as the two were preparing to adopt a child. As their marriage suffers, Arthur plans for a way to get his money back, but first he must sober up and get a real job.','/srb9GKWGZtdyANHHGkXufG3lTAT.jpg','1988-07-08',113,'Released','No money. Still funny.','Arthur 2: On the Rocks',26044,2.5338,5.46,'S9j4GzzGKiI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10155,_binary '\0','/rCvNZWomA7ySCPsvN7xn4375Gkc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094681',7.2,2544,'ka','აშიკ-ქერიბი','Wandering minstrel Ashik Kerib falls in love with a rich merchant\'s daughter, but is spurned by her father and forced to roam the world for a thousand and one nights. Now presumed dead by those he loves, he performs for the poor and unfortunate on his journeys through the wilderness.','/hcaXCtZusW6x30xG2iLgn2JRFNp.jpg','1988-07-03',76,'Released',NULL,'Ashik Kerib',92663,1.6446,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10156,_binary '\0','/tNSawhPreTeqUJae8aEOAPhsc51.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094683',7.6,3571,'ru','Асса','A young musician falls for a mobster\'s young mistress.','/5fl1UIUaWK8KouCOUwN506ys5VP.jpg','1987-11-01',150,'Released',NULL,'Assa',47985,1.7632,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10157,_binary '\0','/4t8EZWc2Qeq8GnIpyjpaVhCg2I3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094701',5.7,4757,'en','Bad Dreams','Unity Field, a \"free love\" cult from the \'70s, is mostly remembered for its notorious mass suicide led by Harris, its charismatic leader. While all members are supposed to burn in a fire together, young Cynthia is spared by chance. Years later, the nightmare of Unity Field remains buried in her mind. But when those around Cynthia start killing themselves, and she begins having visions of Harris, she may be forced to confront the past -- before it confronts her.','/jIsulLLmM50PC7fG5UwV1jO43xo.jpg','1988-04-08',86,'Released','When Cynthia wakes up, she\'ll wish she were dead...','Bad Dreams',59797,2.3946,5.7,'vPtEkP5yACk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10158,_binary '\0','/6mwqs7gqMfRDIrRtueeca2o9pkc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094709',6.8,1320,'fr','La Bande des quatre','Anna, Joyce, Claude, and Cécile are four young actresses sharing a Paris apartment while attending intense acting workshops led by their demanding teacher Constance. As they rehearse scenes and navigate the tensions of living together, their personal lives begin to grow complicated when Joyce becomes involved with a mysterious older man whose presence slowly pulls the others into a web of secrets and suspicions, blurring the boundary between the roles they perform and the lives they\'re actually living.','/18syAOybiKSQSurFGqUl5gmXb0a.jpg','1989-02-08',160,'Released',NULL,'Gang of Four',55853,1.9612,6.8,'OoWz7EaP23M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10159,_binary '\0','/6u1QXz9XVv2d0dLRuKHBP65TiEt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094712',6.5,10777,'en','Bat★21','Lt. Col. Iceal \"Ham\" Hambleton is a weapons countermeasures expert and when his aircraft is shot over enemy territory the Air Force very much wants to get him back. Hambleton knows the area he\'s in is going to be carpet-bombed but a temporary shortage of helicopters causes a delay. Working with an Air Force reconnaissance pilot, Capt. Bartholomew Clark, he maps out an escape route.','/tiwhsOX3zm9QGfdFK4IfrGvZWJj.jpg','1988-07-21',105,'Released','Trapped behind enemy lines. A whole army after him... And only one man can save him.','Bat★21',14911,2.9724,6.3,'wYATgINGVlM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10160,_binary '\0','/qTjC4nKRM8UIFdWMogL5FredB87.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094713',6.7,3187,'fr','Baxter','A white Bull Terrier named Baxter is given to an elderly woman by her daughter. As time passes, the dog develops aggressive and murderous behavior in order to be adopted by another family.','/c77bDsP7jfMiEeRM5wd0UV0Aine.jpg','1989-01-18',82,'Released','Beware of the dog who thinks.','Baxter',52794,1.4042,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10161,_binary '\0','/sO2pl7lp81dgEY1oUbIWk6w3d1j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094715',7,31516,'en','Beaches','A privileged rich debutante and a cynical struggling entertainer share a turbulent, but strong childhood friendship over the years.','/vol5TCGHDbi8r0yo0TrIGFiGxJ7.jpg','1988-12-21',123,'Released','Some Friendships Last Forever','Beaches',15592,4.2545,6.7,'G59ivoXtmW4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10162,_binary '\0','/xCeB8qPu4UvOGaScq0qVeit9O7G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094716',7.3,11780,'en','The Beast of War','During the war in Afghanistan a Soviet tank crew commanded by a tyrannical officer find themselves lost and in a struggle against a band of Mujahadeen guerrillas in the mountains.','/fMymKHTtCikQEx1HVQeahc2wiNU.jpg','1988-09-14',111,'Released','War brings out the beast in every man.','The Beast of War',15267,4.9556,7.068,'PxS3CL-IewY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10163,_binary '\0','/yRKyJJYIzfeiVDHBe4LXguPQCvD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094721',7.4,422528,'en','Beetlejuice','A newly dead New England couple seeks help from a deranged demon exorcist to scare an affluent New York family out of their home.','/nnl6OWkyPpuMm595hmAxNW3rZFn.jpg','1988-03-30',92,'Released','In this house... if you\'ve seen one ghost... you haven\'t seen them all.','Beetlejuice',4011,17.0014,7.367,'GuyNP-XyFHs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10164,_binary '\0','/swsExqohr2YJK312eLlUCnhSQNh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094730',5.7,2719,'sv','Besökarna','Frank, Sara and their two children have recently moved into the house of their dreams on the countryside. Frank is disturbed by mysterious sounds and somebody tears down the wallpaper from the walls. He contacts a ghost-hunter, Allan, to find out the truth.','/lrndhfRfb1i8yTQCuOSKLJcVqKD.jpg','1988-04-29',102,'Released','They\'ve come to stay…','The Visitors',16079,1.4869,6.2,'ZylByv_L4A0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10165,_binary '\0','/Ag3rEep1yl0a9Zn0dGvFeJNjWCw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094731',6.4,7974,'en','Betrayed','An FBI agent posing as a combine driver becomes romantically involved with a Midwest farmer who lives a double life as a white supremacist.','/eilzKLdafTPGZTq9BhHlsjM70JG.jpg','1988-08-26',127,'Released','Suspect. Investigator. Passion. Betrayal.','Betrayed',31618,2.5332,6.1,'2XTeI5KRG00','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10166,_binary '\0','/bi9ihIMB9DoXs7odkS5oKkHoK2o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094737',7.3,263587,'en','Big','When a young boy makes a wish at a carnival machine to be big, he wakes up the following morning to find that it has been granted and his body has grown older overnight, but he is still the same 13-year-old boy inside. Now he must learn how to cope with the unfamiliar world of grown-ups, including getting a job and having his first romantic encounter with a woman.','/eWhCDJiwxvx3YXkAFRiHjimnF0j.jpg','1988-06-03',104,'Released','Have you ever had a really big secret?','Big',2280,10.7507,7.196,'YM8zgY7sG_g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10167,_binary '\0','/fH08Brcs0QmunZJ2JoyLI9e4KLe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094739',6.4,17137,'en','Big Business','In the 1940s in the small town of Jupiter Hollow, two sets of identical twins are born in the same hospital on the same night. One set to a poor local family and the other to a rich family just passing through. The dizzy nurse on duty accidentally mixes the twins unbeknown to the parents. Our story flashes forward to the 1980s where the mismatched sets of twins are about to cross paths.','/dxbXbR1P44caMUKtBdq7sX6aSgw.jpg','1988-06-10',97,'Released','Mixed up at birth, two sets of twins finally meet their match.','Big Business',12710,3.868,6.4,'58yY53mjDxQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10168,_binary '\0','/6XRvhUFkiHBUsDo6c90yPD5Jm92.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094744',5.2,10914,'en','Big Top Pee-wee','Paul Reubens stars as Pee-wee Herman in his second full-length film about a farmer who joins the circus after a storm drops a big tent in his front yard. Pee-wee, along with an outlandish cast of animals and circus performers, puts on the best show ever.','/t9AiFl6kt5vMhXzMHTZ6651TECl.jpg','1988-07-22',86,'Released','Hero. Lover. Legend.','Big Top Pee-wee',30502,3.7097,5,'9fk8FRzsQkg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10169,_binary '\0','/x351MSYFH0sT2aSHeTP5qv8WJOm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094746',6.7,17622,'en','Biloxi Blues','A Jewish teenager sets three goals: lose his virginity, become a writer, and survive World War II.','/vAhQegSNb0OYwBN2KbSr8GRSUsI.jpg','1988-03-25',106,'Released','The Army made Eugene a man. But Daisy gave him basic training!','Biloxi Blues',19382,4.4936,6.3,'EeRcr3gt0mw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10170,_binary '\0','/1lnrkpvnw6cRxJS9VyMMei9Ed6g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094747',7.1,14499,'en','Bird','Saxophone player Charlie ‘Bird’ Parker comes to New York in 1940 and is quickly noticed for his remarkable way of playing. He becomes a drug addict but his loving wife Chan tries to help him.','/rTCp6M98RQAxRl0x0guU9GlH7HS.jpg','1988-06-01',161,'Released','\"There are no second acts in American lives.\"','Bird',24679,3.0711,6.847,'O9GGJO8HJ1E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10171,_binary '\0','/wRqyerpR1vhnaK4xhTDyq0Kuik6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094750',3.9,9180,'en','Black Eagle','One of the US Air Force\'s most modern tactical aircrafts, an F-100 with a new laser guidance system, crashes into the sea near Malta - a region where the Soviet forces are highly present, too. The CIA immediately sends out their best secret agent, Ken Tani, to salvage the system before it falls into enemy hands. To ensure his loyalty, they bring his two young sons to a nearby hotel on the island.','/hMm9hIhErPcgONWknYBgfQP2Z00.jpg','1988-05-01',93,'Released','There are no armies. There is no glory. This fight is one on one.','Black Eagle',18214,3.8115,5.02,'hKnpf_vP2h0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10172,_binary '\0','/xDEFbPGvISeXxnGmfnvUMrBtS4E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094752',5.2,3132,'en','Black Roses','Teens in a small conservative town are turned into evil demons thanks to the music of the titular heavy metal band.','/qq6z78PY9d7W9PhzHUyuUP4pdxK.jpg','1988-11-01',90,'Released','Live for one night only... that\'s all they ever need.','Black Roses',84289,1.5522,5.2,'6t6rjMabvuY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10173,_binary '\0','/4jE05ewCowiHQuXHD1FyI1GO002.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094754',7.9,14770,'en','Blackadder\'s Christmas Carol','After a genial spirit shows the benevolent Ebenezer Blackadder visions of his unscrupulous ancestors, he resolves to mend his generous ways.','/zJD1sTuPlw3DoDyrC2XU7b5LVX0.jpg','1988-12-23',43,'Released',NULL,'Blackadder\'s Christmas Carol',942609,3.0364,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10174,_binary '\0','/v92h7ys8fRuG5pFny7rE24meLLI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094761',6.7,49909,'en','The Blob','In Arborville, California, three high school students try to protect their hometown from a gelatinous alien life form that engulfs everything it touches.','/n6nT4SMY6fLozm7AuGySpXUmjry.jpg','1988-08-05',95,'Released','Terror has no shape.','The Blob',9599,7.191,6.87,'vq0our4mceQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10175,_binary '\0','/4SHACXdVAxg464kuRuqxurDAUl5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094764',6.4,8384,'en','The Blood of Heroes','Set in a futuristic world where the only sport that has survived in a wasted society is the brutal game known as jugging. Sallow, the leader of a rag-tag team, has played in the main Leagues before, but was cast out because of indiscretions with a lady. Now joined by a talented newcomer, Kidda, an ambitious young peasant girl, he and his team find they have one last chance for glory.','/ykdEyq2GCKRr8TsUBuVkRWuWkLj.jpg','1989-10-19',100,'Released','When juggers play there is only one way to live - THE HARD WAY!','The Blood of Heroes',21512,3.9469,5.837,'ZqHV_N7_Mak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10176,_binary '\0','/h0wGTnJX2acXOyOkWOzVINyXQiZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094783',6.1,2718,'en','The Boost','Lenny Brown moves to California to find his fortune in tax shelter investments. When the federal government changes the tax laws, poor Lenny finds himself $700,000 in hock with nowhere to turn. His friend, Joel, introduces him to cocaine to give Lenny that needed \"boost\". What ensues next is a descent into drug addiction and insanity as Lenny tries to regain control of his life, all the while needing that extra \"boost\".','/zZnPXPXBEcW4sKOqjNuDs1PemUt.jpg','1988-12-23',95,'Released','Imagine having all the power, passion and pleasure money can buy. Now imagine losing them.','The Boost',94440,1.4128,5.6,'uY60t5g_jys','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10177,_binary '\0','/deWrpB0Wv3oz6Wa7KsbqyC50BmM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094792',5,8286,'en','Braddock: Missing in Action III','When Colonel James Braddock is told that his Asian wife and 12-year-old son are still alive in Communist Vietnam, he mounts a one-man assault to free them. Armed with the latest high-tech firepower, Braddock fights his way into the heart of the country and ends up battling his way out with several dozen abused Amerasian children in tow! Struggling to keep them alive while outmaneuvering a sadistic Vietnamese officer, Braddock ignites the jungle in a blazing cross-country race for freedom.','/y8Gp0TAQr8Z2Cy4ROSYzvOiMEMf.jpg','1988-01-22',102,'Released','He\'s fighting for everyone who can\'t fight back.','Braddock: Missing in Action III',27352,3.5854,5.739,'BzxjMRdxAqM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10178,_binary '\0','/2u0bhTWIBTbgtfDmJqrsQqydojh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094793',6.5,14967,'en','Brain Damage','Brian comes under the addictive spell of a parasite with the ability to induce euphoric hallucinations in its hosts.','/nNJbQXlut92RIpcnPyoICzdJvJs.jpg','1988-04-15',86,'Released','It\'s a Headache from Hell.','Brain Damage',27814,2.2713,6.7,'fxMoQyVPS9k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10179,_binary '\0','/eLHSLBX6svkE1146PGEjJgHklMZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094794',5.2,4230,'en','The Brain','Dr. Blake runs a TV show called \"Independent Thinkers\", which is sort of a Scientology-like self-help/religion program. But he\'s not making his audience think any more independently – with the help of an alien organism he calls The Brain, he\'s using brainwashing and mind control. The only thing that stands between them and world domination is a brilliant but troubled high school student with a penchant for pranks...','/2kCTNR4709IFljoKoID5Ii06Rj6.jpg','1988-11-03',92,'Released','Mind over matter','The Brain',40222,1.9829,5.264,'OqfpQVIvL_k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10180,_binary '\0','/AocqLoXjXoXzgkEsh8Ez8l9bRYm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094799',5.7,9825,'en','Bright Lights, Big City','A disillusioned young writer living in New York City turns to drugs and drinking to block out the memories of his dead mother and estranged wife.','/pimtITTxB2cJftgRhso2Xm195Co.jpg','1988-04-01',107,'Released','It\'s 6.00 am. Do you know where you are?','Bright Lights, Big City',17170,3.5841,5.672,'zmeTsRQ6STE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10181,_binary '\0','/6N852AJyrSV1noX9odRyoZQthcN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094812',7,63589,'en','Bull Durham','Veteran catcher Crash Davis is brought to the minor league Durham Bulls to help their up and coming pitching prospect, \"Nuke\" Laloosh. Their relationship gets off to a rocky start and is further complicated when baseball groupie Annie Savoy sets her sights on the two men.','/q3T9bO6p74NcTxWOhdUA6fASQ5T.jpg','1988-06-15',108,'Released','Romance is a lot like baseball. It\'s not whether you win or lose. It\'s how you play the game.','Bull Durham',287,6.2467,6.632,'qnWSvSrb1-I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10182,_binary '\0','/kmN9qkdHb4p6Clsej65TJ6h1ZNK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094813',4.9,1577,'en','Bulletproof','A group of dangerous terrorists succeeds to get hold of a tank of the army and all its crew.','/fWptnYgquQnu7MoCc80xCeCGPz8.jpg','1988-04-20',94,'Released','Improbable Odds. Unstoppable Force.','Bulletproof',87533,1.5443,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10183,_binary '\0','/kfAIkvInICBDi7WqwegT3eTZLfA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094819',5.9,4786,'en','Buster','Buster is a small time crook who pulls a big time job. When he finds that the police will not let the case drop, he goes into hiding and can\'t contact his wife and child. He arranges to meet them in Mexico where he thinks they can begin again, but finds that he must choose between his family and freedom.','/oNiyCIkbO0SdiKejdgXFaMqW1UE.jpg','1988-09-16',102,'Released','He\'ll steal your heart','Buster',24782,1.8862,5.6,'TzD3t47vTSA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10184,_binary '\0','/kQKpcvDZfWeO4JCvpIWSBJ0ZUNA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094824',3.8,17359,'en','Caddyshack II','When a crass new-money tycoon\'s membership application is turned down at a snooty country club, he retaliates by buying the club and turning it into a tacky amusement park.','/iHvCXCjiLN6bLf39CnKdDzGbku2.jpg','1988-07-22',98,'Released','The shack is back!','Caddyshack II',18509,4.5569,4.2,'rz3bXZan474','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10185,_binary '\0','/tM0iSNKRaSSsrltOIjEZ1kKkujX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094827',5.3,1221,'en','Call Me','After agreeing to meet an obscene caller at a bar, a young New York reporter witnesses a murder and becomes an unwilling player in a dangerous game of cat-and-mouse.','/iXG5ZDn02moIruBi3nbK2EzppMd.jpg','1988-05-20',96,'Released','Her fantasies could be fatal.','Call Me',41950,2.5016,4.5,'T9oGT-DQrdQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10186,_binary '\0','/aNuFvpgWjhsvkHyzg8p2UUMHq6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094828',7.3,8054,'fr','Camille Claudel','The life of Camille Claudel, a French sculptor who becomes the apprentice of Auguste Rodin and later his lover. Her passion for her art and Rodin drive her further away from reason and rationality.','/bZWvwcum4mMjqJsWcIaLOhYE3gq.jpg','1988-12-07',175,'Released',NULL,'Camille Claudel',11709,2.4149,6.782,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10187,_binary '\0','/2ISrgCLETLaVSF9UrJjqBv2HFJU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094834',4.8,3889,'en','Cannibal Women in the Avocado Jungle of Death','The U.S. government, eager to protect the nation\'s avocado supplies, recruits feminist professor Margo Hunt to make contact with the Piranha Women, an all-female tribe who believe men are only good as a source of food. Accompanying Dr. Hunt on her trip are Jim, a guide of questionable competence, and Bunny, a student of unquestionable incompetence.','/98qUwoXF4sGb0pCxkK8S4fLdrSr.jpg','1989-03-15',89,'Released','These women are serious about their taste in men.','Cannibal Women in the Avocado Jungle of Death',26369,3.4524,4.4,'Etq7k_hJPHk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10188,_binary '\0','/11ySJAAN9s0vxY7i2sZRZb7fKWK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094846',5.1,4591,'en','Casual Sex?','Two girls go away to a holiday resort looking for a change of pace, hoping to meet some nice men for a change. They discover that they can\'t find the perfect man, and this forces them to reconsider their attitudes to men in general.','/tifvnrOuVN7iq6V58G1yeN9rmlk.jpg','1988-04-22',88,'Released','Stacy and Melissa are in search for the world\'s most endangered species... The Perfect Man.','Casual Sex?',34604,3.3412,5.2,'PQtytHaJwOc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10189,_binary '\0','/pDtUVsQujpidmYddrxcmalej8C8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094849',6.8,1903,'en','Celia','In 1950s Australia, young Celia is growing up with a sense of isolation and mistrust of the world that surrounds her. Her mother and father won\'t let her play with the kids next door because their parents are communists. Then her pet bunny is taken away because of rabbit overpopulation. And, more traumatizing yet, when her grandmother dies, she\'s the one to discover the corpse. To cope, she retreats into elaborate fantasies.','/vrhapMkOMjaX2sPGgAryxyH9S8L.jpg','1989-05-18',103,'Released','A tale of innocence corrupted.','Celia',69141,1.3604,6.3,'swUx12IUUVc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10190,_binary '\0','/fdo234GOojbkiLjB4n9P8GksKPA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094850',5.1,3899,'en','Cellar Dweller','A book artist, Whitney Taylor, is doomed to repeat history in a most grotesque way when she unleashes a demon after drawing it.','/66v0nPMbT5GxlUVtthWVG9PdeUd.jpg','1988-09-20',78,'Released','It\'ll Eat You Out Of House And Home...','Cellar Dweller',58797,2.6285,5.011,'ICowXgx69c4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10191,_binary '\0','/gB9RJwVlTb32IqrXRyNp6Okjhtp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094860',6.2,10425,'it','La chiesa','In a Gothic cathedral built on the mass grave of a Teutonic purge, an ancient discovery by the new librarian will release an unholy maelstrom of madness, violence, and demonic vengeance.','/i44N7Es8ei8glNwTO0Sjx9rL51k.jpg','1989-03-10',102,'Released','The Eleventh Commandment.','The Church',40364,2.7517,6.056,'BjVt_mhpv14','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10192,_binary '\0','/edghRD7vw1XgWEpMLpGt1VSGB5w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094862',6.7,133946,'en','Child\'s Play','After being shot in a toy store, a serial killer transfers his soul into a Good Guy doll. A mother then gifts it to her six-year-old son Andy, which unleashes terror upon the city.','/wvpgvcWNkF2HLuTEMIM7K83MvZ.jpg','1988-11-09',87,'Released','You\'ll wish it was only make-believe.','Child\'s Play',10585,15.3275,6.773,'sjiyV8mtXiU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10193,_binary '\0','/3H1yL8bIeEr7hl7tLFK0bCD8PHM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094868',7.3,5246,'fr','Chocolat','On her way to visit her childhood home in a colonial outpost in Northern Cameroon, a young French woman recalls her childhood, her memories concentrating on her family\'s houseboy.','/opJnIodpg8HPu9UiNXkKX8UXFsw.jpg','1988-05-18',104,'Released',NULL,'Chocolat',41951,2.6174,6.9,'K2y-h4fUR4c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10194,_binary '\0','/3mkMielTSGSCFlcXqFWh33pnYeT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094869',6.6,2658,'en','The Chocolate War','Jerry, a new student at an elite Catholic prep school, must face the hazing practices handed down by the Vigils, a group of powerful students. When teacher Brother Leon pushes the students to sell chocolates for a fundraiser, the head of the Vigils, Archie, gets Jerry to reject selling for 10 days. However, Jerry decides to keep up the refusal past the original time frame, which pits him against the Vigils and the school staff.','/sft956vBp7kRX3ra0E5JnLyIgzb.jpg','1988-11-18',100,'Released','Sometimes revenge is bitter, not sweet.','The Chocolate War',32086,1.3988,6.3,'8peL7jS4PU0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10195,_binary '\0','/1wzai6q5bqFDIm60fiScw2JbUJ1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094882',6.1,2760,'en','Clara\'s Heart','David is a teenager whose parents are in a deteriorating marriage after their infant daughter dies. Clara is a chambermaid at a Jamaican resort who\'s hired to be a housekeeper. She and David develop a close bond, opening his eyes and heart to new experiences, and eventually leading to a disturbing secret in Clara\'s past.','/sb5fGw0l8PVFPL14lu2UN7Ibed0.jpg','1988-10-07',108,'Released','Clara\'s wisdom. Clara\'s warmth. Clara\'s secret.','Clara\'s Heart',73079,2.0658,5.5,'4fYg2S6c84s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10196,_binary '\0','/awVbKi9qebgdC8IjZ77ruvciY2x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094884',6.7,7914,'en','Clean and Sober','Hotshot real estate salesman Daryl has a bad cocaine habit. After embezzling his company\'s money, he wakes up next to a girl who overdosed. To hide from the police, he checks into a rehabilitation program guaranteeing anonymity. Under the mentorship of counselor Craig, Daryl accepts that he has a substance abuse problem. As he falls in love with fellow patient Charlie, Daryl begins committing to a newly sober life.','/cU2VrB1SbKg3WypvK2Z0u1jLQEK.jpg','1988-08-10',124,'Released','Thirty remarkable days in the life of an ordinary man.','Clean and Sober',14441,2.7043,6.4,'gu_PiJcVtCk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10197,_binary '\0','/c26CQTrAyEu8mjVqaAXv2upfzMv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094886',5.4,5692,'en','Clownhouse','Three teenage brothers are terrorized by a trio of escaped mental patients disguised as clowns.','/lRhXNf7zrOShQumPmMxHifUUUhz.jpg','1990-04-21',81,'Released','...A circus of the mind.','Clownhouse',25756,2.6793,6.1,'3GCxN9UJkTQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10198,_binary '\0','/uHwJaXKtIsjI4IrtaFLnJjLZMrs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094888',6.9,9317,'de','Cobra Verde','A fearsome 19th century bandit, Cobra Verde cuts a swath through Brazil until he arrives at the sugar plantation of Don Octávio Countinho. Not knowing that his new guest is the notorious bandit and impressed by his ruthless ways, Don Octávio hires Cobra Verde to oversee his slaves. But when Cobra Verde impregnates Don Octávio’s three daughters, the incensed plantation owner exiles the outlaw to Africa where he is expected to reopen the slave trade. Following his trans-Atlantic journey, Cobra Verde exploits tribal conflicts to commandeer an abandoned fortress and whips an army of naked warriors into a frenzied bloodlust as he vies for survival.','/5Cce5ZgJ9yyDqCmwAi6mcULfIop.jpg','1987-12-03',111,'Released',NULL,'Cobra Verde',11513,2.8909,6.911,'qDo7YdFfXK0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10199,_binary '\0','/knYXryj3073w9fBMD5Xatk0ECiS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094889',6,99440,'en','Cocktail','After being discharged from the Army, Brian Flanagan moves back to Queens and takes a job in a bar run by Doug Coughlin, who teaches Brian the fine art of bar-tending. Brian quickly becomes a patron favorite with his flashy drink-mixing style, and Brian adopts his mentor\'s cynical philosophy on life and goes for the money.','/jFRhEPhtsln9tDwzMdZN3OlhUob.jpg','1988-07-29',104,'Released','When he pours, he reigns.','Cocktail',7520,6.1382,6.112,'Tyd6Dh_6v74','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10200,_binary '\0','/hvMbN6oWjXo2pv3c8IpfkFetvtX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094890',5.4,18382,'en','Cocoon: The Return','The reinvigorated elderly group that left Earth comes back to visit their relatives. Will they all decide to go back to the planet where no one grows old, or will they be tempted to remain on Earth?','/xBsXdBl8qCXoQsWX6vfsVjWOMGk.jpg','1988-09-13',116,'Released','Journey to the most wonderful place in the universe... home.','Cocoon: The Return',11285,4.9404,6.46,'E288zThpr8Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10201,_binary '\0','/aWPZsW1rJpcmjnQ7vdsdRu0Mpq5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094894',6.7,34063,'en','Colors','A confident young cop is shown the ropes by a veteran partner in the dangerous gang-controlled barrios of Los Angeles, where the gang culture is enforced by the colors the members wear.','/5KueYME8A449pxaKTJZp3cWKKSX.jpg','1988-04-15',120,'Released','70,000 gang members. One million guns. Two cops.','Colors',10126,4.868,6.5,'WZvatzKVM2g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10202,_binary '\0','/vsCIw7ARCKQVPT2K2hkkFVl7yo5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094898',7.1,242423,'en','Coming to America','An African prince decides it’s time for him to find a princess... and his mission leads him and his most loyal friend to Queens, New York. In disguise as an impoverished immigrant, the pampered prince quickly finds himself a new job, new friends, new digs, new enemies and lots of trouble.','/djRAvxyvvN2yqlJKDbT3uy4vOBw.jpg','1988-06-29',117,'Released','This summer, Prince Akeem discovers America.','Coming to America',9602,14.8201,6.9,'ZDme5Y5E-bI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10203,_binary '\0','/lgvDsg2dA1G1oshflzD3QVcBg9C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094901',7.2,3205,'it','Compagni di scuola','A group of former high school classmates meets for a reunion 15 years after graduation, only to discover that any innocence or friendship is long lost.','/yi8QUpo6U3nmYn6fStNG2nvANEL.jpg','1988-12-21',118,'Released',NULL,'Compagni di scuola',56825,2.4434,7.116,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10204,_binary '\0','/hSklMIxwYZzQyrg3QfCZ2HbjF3Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094910',5.8,6250,'en','The Couch Trip','The escaped mental patient and delinquent John W. Burns Jr. replaces Dr. Maitlin on a radio show, saying he\'s the psychiatrist Lawrence Baird.','/jk0qx7XyFYKK1flXbxO1N3z6zAd.jpg','1988-01-15',97,'Released','A comedy of truly loony proportions.','The Couch Trip',23752,2.5858,5.5,'9yxeoyC4tn0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10205,_binary '\0','/vke5tKoDCB117w2mrWWOalUsXRD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094919',5.6,18576,'en','Critters 2','Three bounty hunters from space fly back to the town of Grovers Bend, hoping to save local residents from a new batch of Critter eggs.','/5rR3dVJXnXskkBBWKbLg5EDKWtT.jpg','1988-04-29',86,'Released','It\'s everyone\'s turn for seconds.','Critters 2',10127,5.2136,6.242,'QVyfEgnA678','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10206,_binary '\0','/dBpBqk8I2pY7A3HYvHXylQUY8Zo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094921',7,6243,'en','Crossing Delancey','Thirty-something Isabelle spends her time going from her tiny, solitary West Side apartment to that of her grandmother on the Lower East Side. While her grandmother plots to find her a romantic match, Isabelle is courted by a married, worldly author, Anton, yet can\'t seem to shake the down-to-earth appeal of Sam, a pickle vendor.','/62GF6vgxIvEpSPrH0WXHtCHm3zB.jpg','1988-08-17',97,'Released','A funny movie about getting serious.','Crossing Delancey',27397,2.593,5.9,'EZZalVKauEM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10207,_binary '\0','/cRtKOGLLqa5g4MMrCG4nfh1CLaS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094923',6.1,1355,'en','Crusoe','Robinson Crusoe is shipwrecked and he finds himself all alone on a tropical island. With a few tools he manages to rescue from the wreck he has to learn to support himself until help arrives.','/v2l2B7dvzqTCh57OzhHroTRAFXp.jpg','1989-03-30',91,'Released',NULL,'Crusoe',41953,1.8259,5.737,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10208,_binary '\0','/lDULCevM5oreITICKy1t75wAuqB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094924',6.9,12274,'en','Evil Angels','Based on the true story of Lindy Chamberlain who, during a family camping trip to Ayers Rock in central Australia, claimed she witnessed a dingo take her baby daughter, Azaria, from their tent. Azaria\'s body was never found and, after investigations and two public inquests, she is charged with murder.','/auyoK8OZh1sZldjJfy9RGzS6crV.jpg','1988-11-03',120,'Released','A family torn apart. A public filled with outrage. A woman accused of murder.','Evil Angels',35119,3.3224,6.8,'NLEDeJteQak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10209,_binary '\0','/20cRKwfrzCOkfzW4WjDutrpq42g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094929',4.9,1819,'en','Curse II: The Bite','After a young man is bitten on the hand by a radioactive snake, his hand changes into a lethal snake head, which attacks everyone he comes into contact with. Also, his body becomes filled with snakes. Now, he must prevent himself from hurting others.','/lLLeb7vySU4f17ATJlMfYk6LYCd.jpg','1989-06-27',98,'Released','Sometimes the Body Has A Mind of Its Own.','Curse II: The Bite',87704,2.3945,5.1,'W1kYy8p7T-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10210,_binary '\0','/yClc4f5aUjigBTP63NxysTwPt9i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094933',6.1,11828,'en','D.O.A.','Dexter Cornell, an English Professor becomes embroiled in a series of murders involving people around him. Dexter has good reason to want to find the murderer but hasn\'t much time. He finds help and comfort from one of his student, Sydney Fuller.','/zelnD4ZCB7lBHHOr9Tyw7cepjt9.jpg','1988-03-18',96,'Released','Someone poisoned Dexter Cornell. He\'s got to find out who. He\'s got to find out why. He\'s got to find out now. In 24 hours, he\'ll be Dead On Arrival.','D.O.A.',9748,2.7555,6.309,'G5rtVBgOJVI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10211,_binary '\0','/zcelH1QmItPseCXJrmos5ekee84.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094939',7,2991,'en','Daffy Duck\'s Quackbusters','In this feature-length film combining footage from classic Warner Brothers cartoon shorts with newly animated bridging sequences, Daffy Duck, after having induced laughter in an ailing millionaire and forestalled the millionaire\'s death for a time (as chronicled in Daffy Dilly (1948), is the beneficiary for the deceased millionaire\'s assets. But the millionaire\'s will clearly stipulates that Daffy must use the money for the common good, by providing a service, and should Daffy think of pursuing selfish aims, the millionaire\'s ghost will \"repossess\" his millions by making them disappear from Earthly existence. Under the pretense of community service, Daffy opens an exorcism agency and employs Porky Pig, Sylvester Cat, and Bugs Bunny to track and eliminate ghosts, ghouls, and other monsters, while Daffy secretly schemes to use his learned \"ghost-busting\" talents to rid himself of the millionaire\'s nagging spirit.','/d9s1aOsnXfeSOlzYuX6VVmORrFo.jpg','1988-09-24',72,'Released','It\'s everything it\'s quacked up to be.','Daffy Duck\'s Quackbusters',23521,2.9506,6.758,'Vb9FcQBALCw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10212,_binary '\0','/cPA8jzDWpe6zVe3J5GbKqCLy89G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094941',6.8,1309,'en','Dance \'Til Dawn','The seniors of Herbert Hoover High School hold a prom they will never forget. Popular girl Shelley ditches her date and ends up spending the night with the more unpopular Dan; Kevin the jock goes out with nerdy Angela because he has heard she is easy; Patrice blames her boyfriend Roger for everything that doesn\'t go the way she wants it to.','/fXA0q8hZdKVeoEmkUUsaCytvDsP.jpg','1988-10-23',100,'Released','The kids had plans for a wild, all-night prom. But no one expected a party like this!','Dance \'Til Dawn',24626,1.673,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10213,_binary '\0','/xH9mjObdAatWoHpT912DDK8hEYG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094947',7.5,80775,'en','Dangerous Liaisons','In 18th century France, Marquise de Merteuil asks her ex-lover Vicomte de Valmont to seduce the future wife of another ex-lover of hers in return for one last night with her. Yet things don’t go as planned.','/7etDozwd9Pf5oCcyo4h1Hki6U13.jpg','1988-12-21',119,'Released','Lust. Seduction. Revenge. The game as you\'ve never seen it played before.','Dangerous Liaisons',859,7.383,7.2,'dO3U2dBwuWA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10214,_binary '\0','/xBweo68xm3IgCeP4sl8pf95NE9H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094959',7.2,1321,'fr','De bruit et de fureur','This drama depicts the misery of neglected children in big cities. 13 years old Bruno is of a good family, but since the death of his grandmother he spends most of his time alone, in a phantasy world, while his mother is away at work. But then he befriends the violent Jean-Roger, who\'s from a severely disturbed family, where nobody cares what he\'s doing. In school Jean-Roger drives their teacher into despair just for fun. To separate the two boys, she starts to stimulate Bruno\'s interests by giving him extra lessons. When Jean-Roger fears loosing his one and only friend, he becomes even more aggressive.','/cCQ6NR6JJXBzbCubqiaWa7wyZJY.jpg','1988-06-01',95,'Released',NULL,'Sound and Fury',51228,1.3886,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10215,_binary '\0','/4YXapzUiQHsgkR1aVdt2IJ9fVIC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094961',6.1,10561,'en','Dead Heat','Detective Roger Mortis is killed in action while investigating a string of mysterious robberies: until he\'s brought back from the dead with a chemical company\'s secret re-animation technology. Now he has twelve hours to solve the case of his own death before he dies: And stays dead.','/7jBtDMQrXpHlyuJImTAs6Oexv7H.jpg','1988-05-06',86,'Released','You can\'t keep a good cop dead.','Dead Heat',40095,4.1107,6.178,'Dl488OINL90','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10216,_binary '\0','/fJMLD9WsyiMY2IQYRSBgI2a43Jp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094962',5,3692,'en','The Dead Next Door','The government sets up a zombie squad after an epidemic has made the world run rampant with living corpses. The team head off to Ohio to try and find a cure but soon run into a crazy cult of zombie lovers who are set on preserving the walking dead as they believe it\'s God\'s will.','/v0YY0O4hnsd8fiJ3TnBOfZZR4hQ.jpg','1989-11-10',84,'Released','How do you kill something that won\'t die? Where do you run when they\'re everywhere?','The Dead Next Door',25028,2.2501,4.9,'2Zkk_oe8IFE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10217,_binary '\0','/buhzGe9AqpB8da99iEEK7GxOhAU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094963',6.3,51650,'en','The Dead Pool','Dirty Harry Callahan returns for his final film adventure. Together with his partner Al Quan, he must investigate the systematic murder of prominent figures. By the time Harry learns that the murders are part of a sick game to predict such deaths, it may be too late.','/krxLLDnFuDtjagN7KrCjuH6QrcW.jpg','1988-07-13',91,'Released','Dirty Harry just learned a new game.','The Dead Pool',10651,6.8226,6.3,'n41u5nOsuBM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10218,_binary '\0','/n3QtJ6tqE0fnf4Qaxb0iujBk0lH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094964',7.2,59601,'en','Dead Ringers','Elliot, a successful gynecologist, works at the same practice as his identical twin, Beverly. Elliot is attracted to many of his patients and has affairs with them. When he inevitably loses interest, he will give the woman over to Beverly, the meeker of the two, without the woman knowing the difference. Beverly falls hard for one of the patients, Claire, but when she inadvertently deceives him, he slips into a state of madness.','/ofXwDfM8uYAaftD7cBPcIWdCpMn.jpg','1988-09-23',115,'Released','Two bodies. Two minds. One soul.','Dead Ringers',9540,5.8218,7.126,'-ZHbu3msmes','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10219,_binary '\0','/tRyR9eI9yTJ3eOgjIUyHVpBzk9f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094979',5.9,1500,'hi','The Deceivers','India, 1825: the country lives in mortal fear of cult members known as the “Deceivers.\" They commit robbery and ritualistic murder. Appalled by their activities, an English military man, Captain William Savage, conceives a hazardous plot to stop them. In disguise, he plans to himself become a “Deceiver” and infiltrate their numbers. Ever present in Savage’s adventures is a sense of dread; he is in constant fear of betrayal and vengeance and also undergoes a disturbing psychological transformation as he experiences the cult’s blood lust firsthand.','/dwno7eKJbzNZ2prc5wI1istvnyj.jpg','1988-09-02',102,'Released','How far can a man journey into darkness...and still find his way back?','The Deceivers',41968,1.7163,5.2,'FQpHT3EvFYA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10220,_binary '\0','/AlpslskDPx4RuAXdRcdRakzRn7U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094980',7.2,4956,'en','The Decline of Western Civilization Part II: The Metal Years','An exploration of the heavy metal scene in Los Angeles, with particular emphasis on glam metal. It features concert footage and interviews of legendary heavy metal and hard rock bands and artists such as Aerosmith, Alice Cooper, Kiss, Megadeth, Motörhead, Ozzy Osbourne and W.A.S.P..','/obJGzd7ExOdc9Y7PFskra36nKpI.jpg','1988-06-17',93,'Released','It\'s more than music...it\'s a way of life.','The Decline of Western Civilization Part II: The Metal Years',36724,2.702,6.8,'63ApcpF-NLw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10221,_binary '\0','/iwJl6FIvCxR0ODBscfrD4ALWvCK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0094998',4.8,1310,'en','Demonwarp','A man and his daughter are attacked in the woods by what they believe is a Bigfoot-type creature. However, they soon begin to suspect that they may have stumbled onto a nest of aliens in a hidden spacecraft.','/zg4jUEjRhHmTD1iu2MlpTfWXbn1.jpg','1988-03-01',91,'Released','Enter a prime-evil world of future shock and alien terror.','Demonwarp',29315,2.5212,4.1,'Y0YfEM6vfLA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10222,_binary '\0','/2To1kBMsmykqUTXVuPwbxMplZ8Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095005',4.8,1240,'en','Destroyer','A prison riot breaks out at the moment of a serial murderer\'s execution by electrocution, and his fate becomes indeterminate when the prison is shut down. 18 months later, a team of filmmakers converge on the prison to film a women-in-prison exploitation flick, but find that a certain somebody is disrupting their shooting schedule...','/sCbT12PLsRgODgIC3MKWlhNup5p.jpg','1988-04-01',94,'Released','3,000 voltz couldn\'t kill him... It just gave him a buzz.','Destroyer',85163,1.4503,4.9,'fSr1lJi3mU4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10223,_binary '\0','/f3lrCW306jyBkh16QwM5gEtH1kI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095012',7,3667,'pl','Diabeł','Young Polish nobleman Jakub is saved from imprisonment by a stranger. In return, the stranger wants to obtain a list of Jakub’s fellow conspirators. As he follows his mysterious savior across the country, Jakub is affected by the overall chaos and moral corruption; he goes insane and becomes a mass murderer.','/12vWPiAnnI7Ua2ByPBsVegrXfJo.jpg','1972-01-01',125,'Released','Pray for us sinners now and at the hour of our death.','The Devil',95043,2.782,7.2,'4T7345mq7LA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10224,_binary '\0','/bvk2AAH64lP2YZs02Q3jskfHT8j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095016',8.2,1039986,'en','Die Hard','High above the city of L.A. a team of terrorists has seized a building, taken hostages, and declared war. One man has manages to escape... An off-duty cop hiding somewhere inside. He\'s alone, tired... and the only chance anyone has got.','/7Bjd8kfmDSOzpmhySpEhkUyK2oH.jpg','1988-07-15',132,'Released','40 stories of sheer adventure!','Die Hard',562,24.605,7.817,'4Wi28Vsi_ZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10225,_binary '\0','/8kxc1rCp4TwCAcoq9qAOAAml1iX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095022',5,1513,'en','The Dirty Dozen: The Fatal Mission','A renegade team of World War II soldiers. This time, one of the 12 is a woman and, with a Nazi spy within their midst, they\'re up against German wartime geniuses out to establish a Fourth Reich.','/hpt8qLDeqg0KWWDcZlJgIKvcKXX.jpg','1988-11-10',94,'Released',NULL,'The Dirty Dozen: The Fatal Mission',36573,2.5825,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10226,_binary '\0','/cDDH3WzL2qqpGB45NNolZhRJRBA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095031',7.4,87411,'en','Dirty Rotten Scoundrels','Con artist Lawrence Jamieson is a longtime resident of a luxurious coastal resort, where he enjoys the lavish fruits of his deceptions -- that is, until a competitor, Freddy Benson, shows up. When the new guy\'s lowbrow tactics impinge on his own sophisticated work and believing him to be the infamous conman \'The Jackal\', Lawrence resolves to get rid of him. Confident of his own duplicitous talents, he challenges Freddy to a winner-takes-all competition: whoever swindles their latest mark, American heiress Janet Colgate, out of $50,000 first can stay, while the other must leave town.','/3176xH21fSetstKpEtAD1giHbyT.jpg','1988-12-14',110,'Released','Nice guys finish last. Meet the winners.','Dirty Rotten Scoundrels',10141,6.1588,7.1,'exqXoi878M4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10227,_binary '\0','/aix01AG7io9RENJt2hrdE66dZFk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095037',7.4,5798,'en','Distant Voices, Still Lives','Siblings Maisie and Tony, along with their mother, gather for their sister Eileen\'s wedding. It is a joyous occasion, but through flashbacks, it becomes clear that the family was not always happy. Their father was physically abusive to his wife and left the children emotionally traumatized. As a result, the children have grown into unhappy adults, looking for love they didn\'t receive when they were young.','/7tixkjzGHY2tBh6j6L4azkx6OQc.jpg','1988-11-16',84,'Released','In memory, everything happens to music.','Distant Voices, Still Lives',41799,2.2769,6.9,'IdlslMb3KJY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10228,_binary '\0','/jsHwwnP1LHbegitVc1NzTjLf80.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095047',4.7,1702,'en','Doin\' Time on Planet Earth','Ryan Richmond is an eccentric teenager living with his mother, father, sister and brother in the Holiday Inn they own in Sunnyvale, Arizona, the prune capital of the world. Is it any wonder that he wants to go to Saudi Arabaia for college and leave Sunnyvale far, far behind? He spends his days at school with his sex-obsessed best friend Dan Forrester and lusts after Lisa Winston, the sexy lounge singer who his parents have hired to perform at the Holiday Inn. Stuck without a date for his brother\'s wedding to a senator\'s daughter, Ryan goes to a computer dating service, which asks him such questions as \"Can you breathe foreign substances?\" Soon, Ryan is told that he may be an alien stuck on Earth along with thousands of others. Soon, Charles and Edna Pinsky show up and tell him that he may an alien prince meant to lead his brethren home. And that\'s when things get out of control...','/utbzkl04N9Sm7QRjSlAjykE3Hxa.jpg','1988-09-16',85,'Released','A story of teenage alienation.','Doin\' Time on Planet Earth',251377,1.7287,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10229,_binary '\0','/IuxLukGNiHg669ftVKrdu2FdI6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095050',7,3447,'en','Dominick and Eugene','Dominick and Eugene are twins, but Dominick is a little bit slow due do an accident in his youth. They live together, with Dominick working as garbage man to put Eugene through medical school. Their relationship becomes strained when Eugene must decide between his devotion to his brother, or his need to go away to complete his training. Things are also not helped by Dominick\'s co-worker, or Eugene\'s budding romance.','/uSxAr4qqJmLOZz3hhgGa54LShx5.jpg','1988-03-18',111,'Released',NULL,'Dominick and Eugene',49314,1.5718,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10230,_binary '\0','/7hVO1FMqP546LWUYSDGPn3F5S9t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095063',5.6,1788,'en','Dream Demon','As her marriage to decorated war hero Oliver draws near, well-heeled Diana moves into an apartment within an otherwise unoccupied, sprawling London house where she starts to experience strange and terrifying nightmares. But are these troubling night terrors merely the symptom of an unsettled mind, or the sign of something far more sinister at work? Hounded by a pair of sleazy journalists, Diana soon crosses paths with American tourist Jenny, who appears to have a strange connection to the foreboding house and its dark past.','/eYq8GNsI5nUdLEYBh7rqgA8SpYi.jpg','1988-10-06',86,'Released','Two women trapped in a savage nightmare...','Dream Demon',49343,2.0131,5.8,'KiXfygCsPCo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10231,_binary '\0','/6v594uUI5VOBjdlxiV0d6EOjvW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095082',7.2,24297,'en','Eight Men Out','Buck Weaver and Hap Felsch are young idealistic players on the Chicago White Sox, a pennant-winning team owned by Charles Comiskey - a penny-pinching, hands-on manager who underpays his players and treats them with disdain. And when gamblers and hustlers discover that Comiskey\'s demoralized players are ripe for a money-making scheme, one by one the team members agree to throw the World Series. But when the White Sox are defeated, a couple of sports writers smell a fix and a national scandal explodes, ripping the cover off America\'s favorite pastime.','/9nh0w2C9h9KfJb0OsVg65O65b5s.jpg','1988-09-02',120,'Released','When the cheering stopped, there were... Eight Men Out.','Eight Men Out',13554,4.4223,6.8,'A1NFDfHL-D8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10232,_binary '\0','/U83yK37p0jwf0fF8rHqRCZrwUM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095086',7.6,1305,'hu','Eldorádó','A deep drama about life in Hungary after the WW2 until the revolt against Russians in \'56. The main character is the head of the black market in Budapest. He thinks he can buy everyone and everything but at the end he must face that he can\'t buy life. A must-see for everyone. Casting involves some of the greatest Hungarian actors. The story takes place in the eighth district of Budapest focusing on the market place on Teleki square which is still working. The movie contains some archive footage of real fight during the revolution.','/7hYxsSh4008qZmLZDJMx7fXCmji.jpg','1989-02-09',104,'Released',NULL,'The Midas Touch',131056,1.5822,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10233,_binary '\0','/iIQJ3clyNpHOFcUYOom8cG3NmgV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095088',6.6,23446,'en','Elvira: Mistress of the Dark','Arriving in the small town of Fallwell, Massachusetts to claim her inheritance, horror hostess Elvira receives a less than enthusiastic reception from the conservative locals, including her sinister uncle Vincent.','/tr9ajyzn0xRZhgp30SMdwhzFNJW.jpg','1988-09-30',96,'Released','Elvira makes her Big Scream Debut in her Hot New Comedy.','Elvira: Mistress of the Dark',5680,6.6951,6.7,'e6ZY8wPSrqk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10234,_binary '\0','/jVwySo05V97pGx9wShsMcuvYBMs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095107',5.8,14433,'en','Ernest Saves Christmas','When Santa Claus decides to retire and pass on his magic bag of Christmas surprises to a new Saint Nick, he enlists the aid of a hilarious assortment of characters. A perky teen runaway and hapless taxi driver Ernest P. Worrell must convince a skeptical kiddie-show host to take over the post of Father Christmas.','/4XYMlJg9sqM1e80pNb9lCK3oJ4v.jpg','1988-11-11',91,'Released','A Holiday Comedy Unlike Any Other!','Ernest Saves Christmas',26386,2.7556,5.4,'vFZeIJgoLDU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10235,_binary '\0','/nQCxfMTLNGrDijquyIS895TIZrY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095111',7.8,1380,'ar','الهروب','Ahmed Zaki plays a peasant, Mountasir, who gets involved in a criminal racket run by his friend Midhat. Mountasir is betrayed by Midhat and goes to jail. Upon discovering that his wife was forced into prostitution by Midhat, he swears to extract revenge when he leaves jail.','/k96z9r7LwJgwGGO3hzzp8HtbhRC.jpg','1991-04-16',120,'Released',NULL,'The Escape',396867,0.8591,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10236,_binary '\0','/61852uiXwEaXxxDqUqa6azkFwfs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095119',6.2,3662,'en','Everybody\'s All-American','Louisiana football star Gavin Grey had it all. He was an All-American champion who married his high-school sweetheart, homecoming queen Babs Rogers, and who was a hero to his hometown. Yet after a failed professional career, Gavin realizes that fame and success have passed him by and that he no longer is the hero everyone keeps reminding him he should still be. His dissatisfaction with his life leads to strains in his marriage, and Gavin begins to wonder who he is, if he\'s not a hero anymore.','/kU8DdARin8VwV0j3G27mFEEitCy.jpg','1988-11-04',127,'Released','Their life story is a love story','Everybody\'s All-American',34053,2.5026,5.4,'cX8XMavabiU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10237,_binary '\0','/2VaOvpgnKIz1WcWC0Jw13dv5cTT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095120',4.8,1734,'en','Evil Laugh','A group of medical students take a weekend to fix up an old house where a mass murder occurred 10 years earlier.','/nPZ1MwWx2Aic0nxUn1kCcVyIzGe.jpg','1986-04-01',87,'Released','Ten years ago something terrible happened in this house... This weekend it\'s about to happen AGAIN.','Evil Laugh',85165,1.854,5,'Rs-LImwFm80','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10238,_binary '\0','/A3UxFGdmiMjwmO2R2YeF8gjatRZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095125',5.8,2161,'en','Faceless','A detective investigating a missing model in Paris uncovers a plastic surgeon’s horrifying secret.','/hsYqZzbO3R493ysHv1Ki961Bu1o.jpg','1988-01-31',98,'Released','Come Face to Face with Evil','Faceless',28768,1.6183,5.7,'GcdvqMOqShg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10239,_binary '\0','/rxPaVWl6Ravm0nhQ2EBopYBF4lm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095134',6.2,2255,'it','Fantozzi va in pensione','After thirty years in the big corporation, Ugo Fantozzi retires. Suddenly, he needs things to do in everyday life and he tries a number of activities: helping Pina shopping; babysitting grand-daughter Uga; a trip to Venice; learning golf. He then fakes documents to get a new job, but in the end he becomes a hypochondriac and doesn\'t even take a long-awaited chance with Miss Silvani.','/1nuWobezouM9ZneUtmB08ZeIAsc.jpg','1988-12-22',95,'Released',NULL,'Fantozzi Retires',41664,1.9852,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10240,_binary '\0','/surpQs4jrCEeUF3Zle7vaozYEWS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095145',5.6,3841,'en','Feds!','Ellie DeWitt and Janis Zuckermann are admitted to the very strict FBI Training Academy. They get a hard course, in which they learn to deal with guns and to recognise crimes. They also get a physical training. It appears that Ellie is a real fighting- machine, in contrast with Janis, the great student. They have to help each other, all the way to graduation.','/a8g0q2R4cwLc5a9SSBuqq6GhSlq.jpg','1988-10-28',82,'Released','Sleep Tight America. These Women Carry Guns.','Feds!',25884,2.0704,5.795,'kR5gwO31Qw0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10241,_binary '\0','/nNLOEK9HGhhZIOgdVUO9F7ndTIw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095159',7.5,167326,'en','A Fish Called Wanda','While a diamond advocate attempts to steal a collection of diamonds, troubles arise when he realises he’s not the only one after the collection.','/hkSGFNVfEEUXFCxRZDITFHVhUlu.jpg','1988-07-15',109,'Released','A tale of murder, lust, greed, revenge, and seafood.','A Fish Called Wanda',623,13.0478,7.216,'0WTwVpEEMps','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10242,_binary '\0','/8dr56fZVMDk4q0wPXvBPLskeFuB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095169',6,5589,'en','For Keeps','Young high school couple Darcy Elliot and Stan Bobrucz are one year from graduation, with promising futures ahead of them. But their paths take a drastic turn when Darcy becomes pregnant. Unwilling to go through an abortion or an adoption — despite their parents\' pleas — Darcy and Stan decide to sacrifice their college experiences and degrees in order to keep and raise the baby. After a quick marriage, the two realize it won\'t be as easy as they thought.','/q1o2jt1UXNuZmRN1Y2vg1y2T8qE.jpg','1988-01-15',98,'Released','\"You\'re what?!\"','For Keeps',26355,2.9334,6.5,'QletIGfOPuc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10243,_binary '\0','/bGjLKZVw8Ya0ZD2r75hzuWZKamt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095174',6.8,62175,'en','Frantic','The wife of an American doctor suddenly vanishes in Paris. To find her, he navigates a puzzling web of language, locale, laissez-faire cops, triplicate-form filling bureaucrats and a defiant, mysterious waif who knows more than she tells.','/QExlx41lQEizHpPq7FxYw6zpak.jpg','1988-02-19',120,'Released','Danger. Desire. Desperation.','Frantic',10675,5.6678,6.7,'lZ397XS9r1c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10244,_binary '\0','/d7A9rXqG5mD0zHzkuL3YHpLdD77.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095178',5,2496,'en','Fresh Horses','A Cincinnati college student breaks off his engagement to his wealthy fiancée after he falls in love with a backwoods Kentucky girl he meets at a party. She says she\'s 20, but he finds out she\'s 16 and married to an abusive husband.','/sEPTYt17NsmRGXxza5WjSQpIORk.jpg','1988-11-18',105,'Released','Love doesn\'t have to last a lifetime.','Fresh Horses',38982,2.2676,5.309,'j7Xakz1ovV4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10245,_binary '\0','/roHX6N0VkySKBlramHUw1zdMQHB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095179',5.2,48302,'en','Friday the 13th Part VII - The New Blood','Tina Shepard, a telekinetic teenage girl, accidentally unchains Jason from his watery grave, allowing him to go on another killing spree in the area.','/rUzk9Qnyz2FZGxHMBrq6DYIQZkO.jpg','1988-05-13',88,'Released','On Friday the 13th, Jason is back. But this time someone\'s waiting.','Friday the 13th Part VII - The New Blood',10281,7.2323,5.48,'7AyRUWJriuY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10246,_binary '\0','/amug5GrzqF3Xgz0zgaddVHNUFP6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095188',6.2,25775,'en','Funny Farm','Sportswriter Andy Farmer moves with his schoolteacher wife Elizabeth to the country in order to write a novel in relative seclusion. Of course, seclusion is the last thing the Farmers find in the small, eccentric town, where disaster awaits them at every turn.','/i4ExIbPuAe0rAjpYcteiFx4QEfY.jpg','1988-06-03',101,'Released','Chevy Chase finds life in the country isn\'t what it\'s cracked up to be!','Funny Farm',14170,3.5837,6.2,'UVzkcK0yhUc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10247,_binary '\0','/ukgp2u7y7gGv4ZTeqtiaBrOuNzz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095215',5.4,2084,'en','Ghost Town','Deputy Langley tracks a kidnapped girl to an abandoned ghost town. However, the town is not abandoned, but haunted by the spirits of an outlaw, Devlin, and his gang, who hold the equally deceased townspeople hostage until the outlaws can be killed by a lawman.','/mMw96ItmxOKp4lAtmoN3BPf1ayT.jpg','1988-05-26',85,'Released','The good. The bad. The Satanic.','Ghost Town',90926,2.0109,5.2,'hgcNbMUKYo4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10248,_binary '\0','/nwrmBgavtMQjjacEe4QYg2qjiZX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095217',6.8,2097,'en','Ghosts... of the Civil Dead','The inmates and guards of a modern, clean and efficient maximum security wing are slowly and increasingly brutalized until they erupt in violence.','/8bVg6xhBWCae5jrUB1spFySpxBj.jpg','1988-08-01',93,'Released','They come Back to haunt you.','Ghosts... of the Civil Dead',31219,1.4878,5.8,'w-5NSmrbmEY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10249,_binary '\0','/bHbs6KE30piRLJntPjazfVpuYMg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095238',5.7,1902,'en','The Good Mother','After finding a sexually liberated boyfriend, a divorced woman gets sued over daughter\'s custody, by her ex, who claims that her lover has a bad influence on the kid.','/13AsjChBPvhefDsAazSqukmNCSu.jpg','1988-11-04',104,'Released','Can a court determine how we should live, how we should love, how we should raise our children? Now Anna must prove that she is the Good Mother.','The Good Mother',104301,2.34,5.7,'inx3yOAs3Jk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10250,_binary '\0','/4vBuTXx5yBZzRv0KIh8MXtohHo2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095241',3.6,2620,'en','Gor','American professor Tarl Cabot is transported via a magical ring to planet Gor, where he must help an oppressed country overthrow its evil king and his barbarian henchmen.','/aENzdgQX4xkxOwUQMSWY9JiMoNW.jpg','1987-05-08',94,'Released','A new dimension in fantasy.','Gor',86337,2.4732,3.8,'uKN1tl-cDhU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10251,_binary '\0','/emsVRCzClwdu30KP2lQkMaFMAxI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095243',7.1,31600,'en','Gorillas in the Mist','The story of Dian Fossey, a scientist who came to Africa to study the vanishing mountain gorillas, and later fought to protect them.','/utptKpx6cXxmbEGu4N4HIoSZ6IS.jpg','1988-09-23',129,'Released','At the far ends of the earth she found a reason to live, and a cause to fight for.','Gorillas in the Mist',10130,4.4043,7.029,'teHNaI8houQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10252,_binary '\0','/ejFYAet054QRRgyhHjkRz0HkV6a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095244',7.3,3116,'ru','Город Зеро','Going on a business trip, the hero of the film suddenly finds himself in a fantastic city. It is very similar to our world, only the hidden absurdity of everyday life here has become apparent.','/qZfKokBI7regpiHwjczym2oa4P.jpg','1988-10-01',97,'Released',NULL,'Zerograd',74711,1.5351,6.7,'trD6eAbB7m8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10253,_binary '\0','/1J28PJOkusMN5Ab9Q3oF310e11k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095250',7.5,59365,'fr','Le Grand Bleu','Childhood friends Jacques and Enzo share a passion for the danger of free diving. Jacques, following in the footsteps of his father, who died at sea when Jacques was a boy, harbors a remarkable ability to adjust his heart rate and breathing patterns in the water, with his vital signs more closely resembling those of dolphins than men.','/3t5t7yaFiTJQlqxiTkXJMFZdkh3.jpg','1988-05-10',168,'Released','Danger...Like Passion...Runs Deep','The Big Blue',175,9.6672,7.442,'WNkIjVyf3UQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10254,_binary '\0','/lLvTqn3P1MFiCSAWEjSoR3MxRsX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095253',6.6,56908,'en','The Great Outdoors','It\'s vacation time for outdoorsy Chicago man Chet Ripley, along with his wife, Connie, and their two kids, Buck and Ben. But a serene weekend of fishing at a Wisconsin lakeside cabin gets crashed by Connie\'s obnoxious brother-in-law, Roman Craig, his wife, Kate, and the couple\'s two daughters. As the excursion wears on, the Ripleys find themselves at odds with the stuffy Craig family.','/zxIoPZiqKOxrWvieumpxA6bOgkt.jpg','1988-06-17',91,'Released','This is no holiday… this is war!','The Great Outdoors',2617,4.7959,6.447,'gpP_l-atlT4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10255,_binary '\0','/psmo4qzaipFhuIDKBs4NJ96oCKt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095256',4.4,1570,'en','Grotesque','A gang of crazed punkers breaks into a family\'s vacation home in the mountains and slaughters the entire family, except for one daughter who gets away. As the gang pursues the girl through the snow, they slowly realize that some kind of murderous creature is chasing them...','/pHmeDfltAp4g98nJ4t4qXobALCI.jpg','1988-09-09',89,'Released','There is a Fate Worse Than Death','Grotesque',59744,1.4386,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10256,_binary '\0','/n3EkptNDWc72UunXcTz7H26bTZ4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095262',7.2,2669,'ja','機動戦士ガンダム 逆襲のシャア','In UC 0093, the Federation has recovered from its defeat and has created a new anti-colonial special forces unit to deal with rebel forces: Londo Bell. Elsewhere in space, Char Aznable reappears out of self-imposed hiding with a declaration that he now commands his own Neo-Zeon movement, and intends to force the emigration of Earth\'s inhabitants to space by bringing about an apocalypse.','/8I8gWpTtzMLt2lBlBoS7lM436nA.jpg','1988-03-12',120,'Released',NULL,'Mobile Suit Gundam: Char\'s Counterattack',16157,4.268,7.2,'B9LQhyBYSeg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10257,_binary '\0','/ersVrGMSzq2WU6ynBQrHJhwuQ85.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095270',7,25740,'en','Hairspray','\'Pleasantly plump\' teenager Tracy Turnblad achieves her dream of becoming a regular on the Corny Collins Dance Show. Now a teen hero, she starts using her fame to speak out for the causes she believes in, most of all integration. In doing so, she earns the wrath of the show\'s former star, Amber Von Tussle, as well as Amber\'s manipulative, pro-segregation parents. The rivalry comes to a head as Amber and Tracy vie for the title of Miss Auto Show 1963.','/n78VVWG1jsEpMCtcye13wy1RiAx.jpg','1988-02-26',92,'Released','The world was in a mess... but their hair was perfect!!','Hairspray',11054,6.1313,6.8,'6zgCEgeKoMk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10258,_binary '\0','/zE4I9YvrrMUfwDZ3zLiN10eRZxG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095271',5.8,65360,'en','Halloween 4: The Return of Michael Myers','Ten years after his original massacre, the invalid Michael Myers awakens on Halloween Eve and returns to Haddonfield to kill his seven-year-old niece.','/eFSOkXF9n9hsfGv45MDsPixiOyx.jpg','1988-10-21',88,'Released','Ten years ago he changed the face of Halloween. Tonight, HE\'S BACK.','Halloween 4: The Return of Michael Myers',11357,8.6642,6.2,'27PbiWvVyUA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10259,_binary '\0','/be6CE6CGu84zWpbtvVZcJLXg9nW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095274',6.5,2745,'en','A Handful of Dust','English aristocrat Tony Last welcomes tragedy into his life when he invites John Beaver to visit his vast estate. There Beaver makes the acquaintance of Tony\'s wife, Brenda. Together, they continue their relationship in a series of bedroom assignations in London. Trusting to a fault, Tony is unaware that anything is amiss until his wife suddenly asks for a divorce. With his life in turmoil, Tony goes on a haphazard journey to South America.','/rsXpH3r3PEmZGWE5CH4bKPkXMRQ.jpg','1988-06-24',118,'Released','It\'s a long fall from high society','A Handful of Dust',46021,2.8261,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10260,_binary '\0','/ccCKqQjaBttiTNq9gShVV0rFmcF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095276',7.1,2095,'hu','Hanussen','A man\'s story parallels Hitler\'s rise. Austrian Klaus Schneider, wounded in World War I, recovers in the care of Dr. Emil Bettleheim. Bettleheim discovers that Schneider possesses powers of empathy and of clairvoyance, such that could aid suicidal patients. After the war, with one friend as his manager and another as his lover, Schneider changes his name to Eric Jan Hanussen and goes to Berlin, as a hypnotist and clairvoyant performing in halls and theaters. He always speaks the truth, which brings him to the attention of powerful Nazis. He predicts their rise (good propaganda for them) and their violence (not so good). He\'s in pain and at risk. What is Hanussen\'s future?','/AdehGdaBe86j9PRScCeyae1K0qB.jpg','1988-05-20',140,'Released','He saw the future. And it was war.','Hanussen',29932,1.1324,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10261,_binary '\0','/fVThoyMZuEPLx1OE4wb0F3WZY86.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095286',5.4,2048,'en','Heart of Midnight','A young woman who is getting back on her feet after a mental breakdown, Carol Rivers discovers that her late uncle has left her a rundown nightclub. Carol decides to renovate the venue, but, in the process, uncovers dark secrets about the club and her dead relative. After a series of disturbing events, Carol becomes increasingly unstable, but she finds some measure of comfort in Sharpe, an enigmatic older detective.','/u6VYMx0fsWU3X8d9UePo1SHQqnv.jpg','1988-11-10',93,'Released','Forbidden secrets live in a club called Midnight.','Heart of Midnight',65572,1.8239,5.7,'MGNf5RK9VOQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10262,_binary '\0','/eF90cbP6Qe7UmF7Obl8xku1AylA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095288',5.7,1673,'en','Heartbreak Hotel','When a teen tries to set up a band at his school, his mother - who was a big fan of Elvis Presley - gets in a wreck. He and his band members then decide to kidnap Elvis and hook him up with his mother.','/9FeHaHPHXsZZle8qAQWTJSGPOji.jpg','1988-09-30',97,'Released','1972. My family needed some help, my town needed a hero, and my band needed a break. So I borrowed Mom\'s pink Cadillac and I kidnapped Elvis Presley, and our lives were never the same again.','Heartbreak Hotel',38615,1.6158,5.1,'pV_dlulnaME','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10263,_binary '\0','/pl5OzUABUK5AgAsMlQg2VyybRHL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095294',6.4,61603,'en','Hellbound: Hellraiser II','Now confined to a mental hospital, young Kirsty insists her supposedly dead father is actually stuck in Hell following his wife’s betrayal. Few believe the young woman’s lurid stories aside from the thrill-seeking Dr. Channard. Kirsty is undeterred and, with the help of a fellow patient, heads to Hell for a rescue.','/auPOq1wgZuYSaADejOskBKG6fuV.jpg','1988-12-23',97,'Released','Time to play.','Hellbound: Hellraiser II',9064,6.4144,6.413,'WdiWUPOYL-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10264,_binary '\0','/9AMtW0LZfKY8smK6yJKM6HvlTlA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095296',5.3,5201,'en','Hero and the Terror','Danny O\'Brien is back in action fighting the notorious Simon Moon, also known as The Terror. Three years earlier O\'Brien had single-handedly captured The Terror and was called Hero by the people of L.A. Now Simon has escaped and has started killing women again, and O\'Brien is the only man who can stop him.','/5gTaTSAkYfxC6oRIzjlwmPQQmnK.jpg','1988-08-26',96,'Released','Heroes hit hardest.','Hero and the Terror',38950,2.849,5.3,'nj5qKJp5ujY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10265,_binary '\0','/vOSzJZhRGgrbkO3A5xV33BWUoZP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095299',5.2,2408,'en','Hide and Go Shriek','A group of teenagers spend the night in a furniture shop for a graduation party. When one of them talks her boyfriend into a game of hide-and-seek, a psycho killer starts hunting them down one by one.','/8jZRJyQHfSAXnfwtOVCYPcPK07a.jpg','1988-11-01',90,'Released','Close your eyes. Count to 10. And run for your life.','Hide and Go Shriek',68964,1.5458,5,'2j3vFtdZUR0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10266,_binary '\0','/yc01i1AneAgphcDbhR5KYugAFFO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095302',7.4,6376,'en','High Hopes','Working-class couple Shirley and Cyril are in conflict over whether they should have children, their problems with \'yuppies\' moving into the neighbourhood and outpricing them, and the advent of Cyril\'s ageing mother\'s seventieth birthday.','/uDTFcJbZDexghaQVvkKNXWvVw11.jpg','1989-01-13',108,'Released',NULL,'High Hopes',47870,2.2952,7,'8mpy1rZyq0g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10267,_binary '\0','/47lhxD1BTxDxnig0OYIBcDBnYjK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095304',5.8,12330,'en','High Spirits','When a hotelier attempts to fill the chronic vacancies at his castle by launching an advertising campaign that falsely portrays the property as haunted, two actual ghosts show up and end up falling for two guests.','/8X6VQF4oMWyIf8GwtlfXRqnVd4k.jpg','1988-11-18',99,'Released','He\'s an American. She\'s a ghost. Vacation romances are always a hassle.','High Spirits',21362,3.3924,5.8,'2RIHuK89xEw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10268,_binary '\0','/xp6gln8PZOXkz3c5YBAfbc6tlLW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095312',5.4,4611,'en','Hollywood Chainsaw Hookers','Los Angeles private eye Jack Chandler is hired by a worried mother to find her missing runaway daughter, Samantha. As Chandler searches for her whereabouts, he uncovers an evil cult that worships an Egyptian god, whose followers commit human sacrifices with chainsaws to appease their deity. He soon learns that Samantha has revenge in store for the cult leader and his bevy of blood-thirsty, chainsaw-wielding hookers.','/2IRG18T8Jt6H8oa0dNM01Ikxc5e.jpg','1988-03-01',75,'Released','They charge an arm and a leg!','Hollywood Chainsaw Hookers',27412,2.7598,5.7,'dA1UeYkDKLs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10269,_binary '\0','/223mNqnZpZqvFbLu1TE38GVeGaW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095316',5.8,3171,'en','Homeboy','Johnny Walker is a cowboy and a boxer. He is very shy and a bit of a fool. He is in love with Ruby, but he cannot tell her. He is also a bit old to keep on boxing, but its the only thing he does well.','/kBgj9y1mrzFCxtnktsnZeVWRgVC.jpg','1988-08-24',116,'Released','Some people live life blow by blow.','Homeboy',12787,1.6698,5.093,'ySKgtxWv0fE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10270,_binary '\0','/eIAkiliiFgC2aa0TyVDG2y75GRR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095326',4.5,3912,'en','Hot to Trot','Fred P. Chaney receives as inheritance after the death of his mother a speaking horse that also has good knowledge about the stock-market. With the help of this horse Fred gains a lot at the stock-market of Chicago.','/6rkBnog30LqNXxw0QxJp9VBT7Wt.jpg','1988-08-26',88,'Released','\"When I talk, you\'re gonna laugh yourself hoarse.\"','Hot to Trot',30690,2.2125,5.2,'o5NPVpqDeQg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10271,_binary '\0','/aHaqZpOL7UyVu0nKqp3SMz0o2E1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095327',8.5,396262,'ja','火垂るの墓','In the final months of World War II, 14-year-old Seita and his sister Setsuko are orphaned when their mother is killed during an air raid in Kobe, Japan. After a falling out with their aunt, they move into an abandoned bomb shelter. With no surviving relatives and their emergency rations depleted, Seita and Setsuko struggle to survive.','/k9tv1rXZbOhH7eiCk378x61kNQ1.jpg','1988-04-16',89,'Released','Why do fireflies have to die so soon?','Grave of the Fireflies',12477,0.0194,8.45,'QZbcx0WNrMU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10272,_binary '\0','/xWKA8SmFE7bgnmoW88eSszrMN29.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095330',7.8,6512,'en','The Hound of the Baskervilles','When a nobleman is threatened by a family curse on his newly inherited estate, detective Sherlock Holmes is hired to investigate.','/2T9IFr9j8MhC8DpsF9TQ4Zg9NnL.jpg','1988-08-31',105,'Released',NULL,'The Hound of the Baskervilles',68352,2.6652,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10273,_binary '\0','/2CvgTzE4ZGVH6yvL2YF1WumcHEi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095333',6.2,3257,'en','The House on Carroll Street','A reporter, fired after refusing to give names to a 1951 House Un-American Activities Committee, takes a part-time job as companion to an old lady. While working she overhears a noisy argument in the neighboring house, being conducted largely in German and involving her HUAC prosecutor. She begins to investigate, enlisting the help of the FBI Agent initially detailed to surveil her.','/kqYP8ZWYTObqzrGEDafUSfEQyFg.jpg','1988-03-04',101,'Released','Emily Crane left her home one morning and stepped into a nightmare.','The House on Carroll Street',75889,2.7341,5.9,'FxWkM66khDQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10274,_binary '\0','/suxg30jaOoTLHQlvaz5ulUcxJQd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095341',7.6,1796,'en','Hôtel Terminus: The Life and Times of Klaus Barbie','Marcel Ophuls\' riveting film details the heinous legacy of the Gestapo head dubbed \"The Butcher of Lyon.\" Responsible for over 4,000 deaths in occupied France during World War II, Barbie would escape—with U.S. help—to South America in 1951, where he lived until a global manhunt led to his 1983 arrest and subsequent trial.','/gyU6I5h7K4M59QxFLCPJTMSzkDC.jpg','1988-11-01',268,'Released',NULL,'Hôtel Terminus: The Life and Times of Klaus Barbie',41954,1.4542,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10275,_binary '\0','/z3tAdLDRWqoMgtl349aStimMtIs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095348',6.6,16732,'en','I\'m Gonna Git You Sucka','Jack Spade returns from the army in his old ghetto neighbourhood when his brother, June Bug, dies. Jack declares war on Mr. Big, powerful local crimelord. His army is led by John Slade, his childhood idol who used to fight bad guys in the 70s.','/s92HcoJmUHGvZ6o5RvIQjemzMap.jpg','1988-11-10',88,'Released','It\'s tough to be a black hero.','I\'m Gonna Git You Sucka',17006,4.5863,6.4,'Fe_fIUawRt8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10276,_binary '\0','/lsMQQewAc6q9jJggMjzQZlNIDcq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095350',4.3,1537,'en','Iced','A group of childhood friends are invited to the opening of a posh ski resort, unaware that an old nemesis has murderous plans in mind for them.','/x9Kv6EpgAc0xLjXQNBs5rSFhxmd.jpg','1989-02-07',86,'Released','A downhill vacation becomes a nightmare of terror. Get off the hill before you get...','Iced',83283,0.9389,4.4,'bmOknyg3uHk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10277,_binary '\0','/9C2Z6HMNaspb4JZJCsMqq6iFwrD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095357',4.3,1366,'en','Illegally Yours','Called up for jury duty, Richard Dice finds his first crush and only real, but unrequited love, on trial for murder. Richard desperately tries to prove Mollys innocence while untangling a complicated web of murder, blackmail and perjury, and still trying to win over the girl of his dreams.','/vZthIpgpfikXDOXbe4aSjXbt07z.jpg','1988-05-13',102,'Released','A girl on her way to being convicted. A smitten juror who\'s really conflicted. A lawless affair that\'s totally restricted.','Illegally Yours',48719,1.7171,4.5,'lr4FWdXToZw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10278,_binary '\0','/uwNyHyxfk1a8hfw58I3MFCB4ya1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095360',7.8,5445,'en','Imagine: John Lennon','The biography of former Beatle, John Lennon—narrated by Lennon himself—with extensive material from Yoko Ono\'s personal collection, previously unseen footage from Lennon\'s private archives, and interviews with David Bowie, his first wife Cynthia, second wife Yoko Ono and sons Julian and Sean.','/whND9JruVi676VN1hZzV28XEvNE.jpg','1988-09-30',100,'Released','Discover John... the angry youth, the musician, the radical, the husband, the father, the lover, the idealist... through his own words','Imagine: John Lennon',26723,2.0468,7,'q9tcpBR-Fxs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10279,_binary '\0','/p2IB0CBiTGZtnPI4aXxmq5d3UAw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095366',7.1,1266,'en','In the Line of Duty: The F.B.I. Murders','It is 1985, and a small, tranquil Florida town is being rocked by a wave of vicious serial murders and bank robberies. Particularly sickening to the authorities is the gratuitous use of violence by two “Rambo” like killers who dress themselves in military garb. Based on actual events taken from FBI files, the movie depicts the Bureau’s efforts to track down these renegades.','/2jYE4EsBEhvR8VYYTmXzPp3Zw0L.jpg','1988-11-27',92,'Released',NULL,'In the Line of Duty: The F.B.I. Murders',31362,2.139,6.2,'knoWnTrnr0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10280,_binary '\0','/bRlsLlie6DXLAnHBg8IwfOAN87z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095368',5.7,4058,'en','The Incredible Hulk Returns','Years after the end of the original series, David Banner continues his wandering search for a cure for the condition that turns him into the Hulk. He reunites with former colleague Don Blake, unaware of his mystical connection to Thor. When a criminal organization threatens their lives, Banner is forced to unleash the Hulk once again, marking the character’s return after the series finale.','/rDAWdpW0uzUj9c4YPeuanPGWHBq.jpg','1988-05-22',94,'Released','His pent-up anger has been seething for 6 long years. Tonight, the incredible explosion!','The Incredible Hulk Returns',26881,3.7922,6.246,'DHyGrsoAUVM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10281,_binary '\0','/tlyuwQj2siPdX0BQxR1T2FK9fpk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095379',6.1,13705,'en','Intruder','The overnight stock crew of a local supermarket find themselves being stalked and slashed by a mysterious maniac.','/pib25gFtNCShcyRpFvp1jrcJ1Xk.jpg','1989-01-27',88,'Released','He’s just crazy bout this store!','Intruder',31150,2.5236,6.2,'W_wQdP52Lng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10282,_binary '\0','/ynX6Hu0qaFm5sDXmIwmaMdfAzN0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095382',3.9,5765,'en','Iron Eagle II','Chappy Sinclair is called to gather together a mixed Soviet/U.S. strike force that will perform a surgical strike on a massively defended nuclear missile site in the Middle East. Chappy finds that getting the Soviet and U.S. Pilots to cooperate is only the most minor of his problems as he discovers someone in the Pentagon is actively sabotaging his mission.','/yQNq0zbInR0Vx6nWJCEBN4d0pPI.jpg','1988-11-11',105,'Released',NULL,'Iron Eagle II',11955,2.9853,4.5,'aY1aikAa-Xs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10283,_binary '\0','/tTz1kdkgxRTH7K5VwCBPOrVbSjx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095386',6.9,3144,'fr','Itinéraire d\'un enfant gâté','A foundling, raised in the circus, Sam Lion becomes a businessman after a trapeze accident. However, when he reaches fifty and becomes tired of his responsibilities and of his son Jean-Philippe, he decides to disappear at sea. However, he runs into Albert Duvivier, one of his former employees. He comes to realise that he has ignored the important things in his life.','/9yZaH3bmvrN5EQktVZouaRTGKgQ.jpg','1988-11-30',135,'Released',NULL,'Itinerary of a Spoiled Child',38198,2.1098,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10284,_binary '\0','/cD8GvoHyeTJenHHiAxO3Ed9iLK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095389',5.8,5071,'en','Jack\'s Back','A young doctor is suspected when a series of Jack the Ripper copycat killings is committed. However, when the doctor himself is murdered, his identical twin brother claims to have seen visions of the true killer.','/ldQdtJOA0czii9DHzB2Ys0dIF8u.jpg','1988-05-06',97,'Released','One hundred years ago, in the City of London, in the East-End slum of Whitechapel, a man shocked the world by murdering, raping and mutilating five women. He was never caught.','Jack\'s Back',41959,2.1125,5.422,'jLGnal9GXGA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10285,_binary '\0','/6o6XqTAZyHHuQiLiZIzvoa1Wwu0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095403',7,25583,'cn','警察故事續集','The Hong Kong super-cop must stop a group of blackmailing bombers at the same time that the villains of the first Police Story are out for revenge.','/kjq1FXtHh9i2sIuM0JaoYf43FDU.jpg','1988-08-13',105,'Released','Jackie Chan escalates his one-man war on crime.','Police Story 2',10753,5.5629,7.1,'rkQBl5enUuE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10286,_binary '\0','/1MVfgFdoUOzy7NcNcoZuA5teaKs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095409',4.6,8164,'en','Johnny Be Good','It\'s recruiting time and despite being short and scrawny, Johnny Walker is America\'s hottest young football prospect. His dilemma: should he take one of the many offers from college talent scouts or should he attend the local state college with his girlfriend and give up his football career?','/xYHplg2N28n4z4WW0VeoZMRI58X.jpg','1988-03-22',86,'Released','Every college in the country wants Johnny. \'Cause when he\'s good he\'s very very good. And when he\'s bad he\'s better.','Johnny Be Good',20443,4.0226,4.628,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10287,_binary '\0','/uskG4enRvZ5zNr3qDu6TzaOllEQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095428',5.5,1545,'en','Kansas','A young man returning home to attend a wedding hooks up with a drifter who turns out to be a violent bank robber. Before he knows it, the man finds himself involved in the robber\'s plans.','/6fTbENf7RVzPKElXtcuADK2MiZI.jpg','1988-09-23',110,'Released','In a life of crime, no one can be trusted... Not even your friend.','Kansas',77670,1.8138,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10288,_binary '\0','/yKVsApIMgQVGEvaVn2Tmr48OSp3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095441',7.8,2939,'ru','Холодное лето пятьдесят третьего','In 1953, the year Stalin died, many prisoners (some political, but mostly common criminals) were released from the Soviet Gulags. This is the story of a remote settlement which was under attack by a bunch of these recently-released blood-thirsty thugs in the summer of 1953, and the townspeople, along with a two political prisoners, who try to stop them.','/aVSvsoYiyyiHyn0o5KRbph7breW.jpg','1988-01-06',101,'Released',NULL,'The Cold Summer of 1953',71393,1.8745,7.346,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10289,_binary '\0','/ibFzbRVlVUTWBf4IZ8Osm9xSgWm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095444',6.2,53474,'en','Killer Klowns from Outer Space','Aliens disguised as clowns crash land on Earth in a rural town to capture unsuspecting victims in cotton candy cocoons for later consumption.','/lHdAk5T42ofyi3NTjmrdyR7xPmY.jpg','1988-05-27',86,'Released','It’s craazzy!','Killer Klowns from Outer Space',16296,5.8909,6.7,'ETiSMS4i1as','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10290,_binary '\0','/7tZUw8sD9VcYlO0GrNqhxWGFA6t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095452',7.3,3723,'pl','Kingsajz','The story follows a young scientist in the contemporary world, who actually came from the world of dwarves, thanks to a magic potion, held by the Big Eater, ruler of the dwarves. The dwarf kingdom, Shuflandia, exists in a cellar of a library, and only the most obedient get the chance to grow to king size and inhabit the larger world. Once there, nobody wants to return to Shuflandia. Also, there are no women in Shuflandia.','/yxohn09CnLEeDE2rINNxGFkQmQD.jpg','1988-05-02',105,'Released',NULL,'King Size',36391,7.7253,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10291,_binary '\0','/ddTFNZT90Vd9zjurSKv4caGbBhv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095454',5.5,2170,'en','The Kiss','After the death of her mother, a teenage girl is faced with bizarre supernatural occurrences when her mother\'s estranged sister arrives and begins to infiltrate her and her father\'s lives.','/wGsdpuVjToJxoCRmKpIsCkQd90d.jpg','1988-10-14',101,'Released','Don\'t do it with your eyes closed.','The Kiss',57744,2.7831,5.8,'erE_uE8nx14','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10292,_binary '\0','/mvPL6z8QFhmk67n6o7sNmU2J1fd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095467',8.1,28648,'pl','Krótki film o miłości','19-year-old Tomek whiles away his lonely life by spying on his opposite neighbour Magda through binoculars. She\'s an artist in her mid-thirties, and appears to have everything - not least a constant stream of men at her beck and call. But when the two finally meet, they discover that they have a lot more in common than appeared at first sight...','/kLAMz50Or2So1aEzHYv0R8iXo46.jpg','1988-08-21',87,'Released',NULL,'A Short Film About Love',31056,3.7285,7.8,'-iovDnkgGFI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10293,_binary '\0','/wsZm5xX4r2ARPsjz5sRxHh3hA6D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095468',7.9,24698,'pl','Krótki film o zabijaniu','Jacek climbs into the taxi driven by Waldemar, tells him to drive to a remote location, then brutally strangles him, seemingly without motive.','/x8zenootZTTB1iEdUQA9dnEuLqv.jpg','1988-03-11',85,'Released',NULL,'A Short Film About Killing',10754,2.4574,7.6,'FfEfyRLlXwU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10294,_binary '\0','/7Pif8jhgMB74O8CUecpGJD3qqwN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095473',6.2,1262,'fi','Kuutamosonaatti','A female fashion model Anni Stark takes leave from the fashion business and goes to Finland\'s Lapland for a vacation. Little does she know that there\'s a totally lunatic bunch of local hillbillies living in a nearby farmhouse. The plot thickens as one of the residents begins to harass Anni, who is left alone in the wilderness with only her dog to protect her. Too bad for her that her dog turns out to have divided loyalties.','/oh5y8z6VgoqwinkQxswrDL4GU6o.jpg','1988-11-04',86,'Released',NULL,'The Moonlight Sonata',112427,1.0181,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10295,_binary '\0','/m6sHDQ7Hsc2q3Tn5hMbWkTMIXup.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095475',7.6,7843,'hu','Kárhozat','Karrer plods his way through life in quiet desperation. His environment is drab and rainy and muddy. Eaten up with solitude, his hopelessness would be incurable but for the existence of the Titanik Bar and its beautiful, haunting singer. But the lady is married and Karrer is determined to keep her husband away...','/iW1WHmZEk9QTeY4qp7gjaDcCPDS.jpg','1988-10-20',116,'Released',NULL,'Damnation',20122,3.1988,7.646,'x8LvUAdqkAE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10296,_binary '\0','/hBU2INkYLe3OBKZspT0TRd3nTxX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095483',5.5,2338,'en','Pembalasan Ratu Laut Selatan','The spirit of an ancient evil queen possesses the body of a young anthropological student, who then goes on a murderous rampage.','/lwOK1GHK8KRgiWhfBkEnQKPLgEi.jpg','1988-06-08',81,'Released','She Mates... Then She Terminates','Lady Terminator',61904,2.7137,5.333,'Wx_agCH3xmk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10297,_binary '\0','/tMNCR3JQ7AsjmQ9ovUU0Ohg3RPB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095484',6.6,9231,'en','Lady in White','Locked in a school closet during Halloween 1962, young Frank witnesses the ghost of a young girl and the man who murdered her years ago.','/AevfLQ5c0ZGtO3clHawg9L2XAQ2.jpg','1988-04-22',113,'Released','The year is 1962. The place is Willowpoint Falls. Nobody talks about what happened in the school cloakroom 10 years ago. Now, in the dead of night, Frankie Scarlatti is going to find out why.','Lady in White',49365,3.5256,6.1,'dzBK95kyxNg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10298,_binary '\0','/eeBXjRQikfiIlagI0EWTAE1ymLr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095488',6.1,16910,'en','The Lair of the White Worm','When an archaeologist uncovers a strange skull in a foreign land, the residents of a nearby town begin to disappear, leading to further inexplicable occurrences.','/mHY7MwqrsCJNEAPt6K5PcNXmAfL.jpg','1988-09-21',93,'Released','Some legends really bite.','The Lair of the White Worm',11347,5.3573,5.9,'H9QSDuew2eo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10299,_binary '\0','/sXfQGa7juaTpZ5IF17Xa6hI53nx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095489',7.4,108550,'en','The Land Before Time','An orphaned brontosaurus named Littlefoot sets off in search of the legendary Great Valley. A land of lush vegetation where the dinosaurs can thrive and live in peace. Along the way he meets four other young dinosaurs, each one a different species, and they encounter several obstacles as they learn to work together in order to survive.','/7phV1ETZnQrLsEeuk4hNeceEl25.jpg','1988-11-18',69,'Released','It is the dawn of time, the land of the dinosaur. Lost and alone, Littlefoot and his friends are about to embark on the journey of a lifetime.','The Land Before Time',12144,9.8447,7.2,'4BInhb4GkG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10300,_binary '\0','/cJuOR48DKVOGDUjiODLM3oO67H9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095491',6.9,2482,'cn','老虎出更','A seasoned cop and his rookie partner try to solve the murder of a heroin trafficker.','/7zDa367XD4He3oX4lE2d7RPPlg4.jpg','1988-03-19',94,'Released',NULL,'Tiger on the Beat',65649,2.8044,6.5,'emYb22jwenE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10301,_binary '\0','/74YUE0OgtBDowQsSa7t5OOOpTyL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095496',5.2,1580,'en','Last Rites','After witnessing her lover being murdered by his jealous wife, Angela seeks refuge in a church where she encounters a young priest named Michael, who gives her sanctuary. But the killing was not a simple act of passion, as the victim had ties to organized crime, and, surprisingly, so does Michael, whose father is a powerful don. When the priest finds himself falling in love with Angela, his religious vows and family ties are both severely tested.','/7bnmtc9TIdibB6hUsDSKpRHve2M.jpg','1988-11-18',103,'Released','Passion. Betrayal. Revenge.','Last Rites',95152,1.9149,4.7,'aEMw99SxjJE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10302,_binary '\0','/rBqdcQeM1h05YjF9rFtPWnNaDO2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095497',7.5,68974,'en','The Last Temptation of Christ','Jesus, a humble Judean carpenter beginning to see that he is the son of God, is drawn into revolutionary action against the Roman occupiers by Judas -- despite his protestations that love, not violence, is the path to salvation. The burden of being the savior of mankind torments Jesus throughout his life, leading him to doubt.','/7L4qwrC1mipZXJfU5oRgQWChLv1.jpg','1988-05-28',164,'Released',NULL,'The Last Temptation of Christ',11051,6.8043,7.2,'DCqn0gkwLEM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10303,_binary '\0','/2fZgJKHakwvOEKGibtGLGdpaAMg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095511',7,1936,'fr','La Lectrice','A young woman passionate about reading immerses herself in the adventures of a fictional character who makes reading her profession. As she explores different neighborhoods and wintertime Provence, her imagination blends with reality, revealing the mysteries behind each word.','/oElAqwPGT0FQVoZ6UZyoyL5BYcW.jpg','1988-08-17',99,'Released',NULL,'La Lectrice',49693,1.3432,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10304,_binary '\0','/7ro9Y7Wyti93UFQ4FsmLc8yfWlP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095512',7.7,1385,'ja','銀河英雄伝説 わが征くは星の大海','For the past 150 years, humanity’s two greatest nations have been deadlocked in a meaningless war. In what is hoped to be a miraculous victory, the Alliance embarks on a battle to break through the Empire’s frontline. Like many other “decisive” battles, this can only end in disaster; a sentiment shared by Imperial nobleman Reinhard von Lohengramm and Alliance Commodore Yang Wen Li, both of whom realize how to turn the fight in their favor. And while the tides of war may never change, these two men must rise to the occasion, solidifying their place in history as heroes.','/uNP14Hw2mZemR9loAaDyMwgvuRy.jpg','1988-02-06',59,'Released','Perhaps man is a creature that must fight until the last one is dead.','Legend of the Galactic Heroes: My Conquest Is the Sea of Stars',154738,2.3752,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10305,_binary '\0','/cMDGYZVrx7CPvFmkkMFIPBLAM49.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095513',7.1,2506,'it','La leggenda del santo bevitore','Andreas Kartak, a homeless man living under the bridges of Paris, is lent 200 francs by a stranger as long as he promises to repay it to a local church when he can afford to. Kartak is determined to pay back his debt but circumstances, and his alcoholism, forever intervene.','/qaLuGuFcGGi9y27d0Kx3BA7MqU0.jpg','1988-09-02',128,'Released',NULL,'The Legend of the Holy Drinker',54990,2.1328,6.611,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10306,_binary '\0','/aCIcZUtcmOYux5h3k10wlod4VgO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095515',7.7,2646,'en','Let\'s Get Lost','Documentary about jazz great Chet Baker that intercuts footage from the 1950s, when he was part of West Coast Cool, and from his last years. We see the young Baker, he of the beautiful face, in California and in Italy, where he appeared in at least one movie and at least one jail cell (for drug possession). And, we see the aged Baker, detached, indifferent, his face a ruin. Includes interviews with his children and ex-wife, women companions, and musicians.','/voAn1Btvyy9icPHaf7HNwBfFZor.jpg','1988-09-15',120,'Released',NULL,'Let\'s Get Lost',37640,2.1977,7.1,'4TefNYBLMSQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10307,_binary '\0','/x7hYxRqj9s3NjpPGzdzMlsUJcvd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095519',6.4,24794,'en','License to Drive','Teenager Les Anderson thinks his life can\'t get any worse after he flunks his driver\'s exam, but he\'s wrong. Even though he didn\'t receive his license, Les refuses to break his date with the cool Mercedes Lane, and he decides to lift his family\'s prize luxury car for the occasion. Unfortunately, Mercedes sneaks some booze along and passes out drunk, and a confused Les makes the bad decision of enlisting his rebellious friend, Dean, to help.','/cSGV9uXOKxu8j9mj6NmTix4GLFa.jpg','1988-07-06',90,'Released','Some guys get all the brakes!','License to Drive',13704,4.3475,6.7,'a4KJtDxTqWQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10308,_binary '\0','/omysgecSqildPjk4LL8To0L3tgm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095525',6.9,6567,'fr','Gandahar','On the planet Gandahar where peace reigns and poverty is unknown, this utopian lifestyle is upset by reports of people at the outlying frontiers being turned to stone. Sylvain is sent to investigate this mysterious threat.','/cjwEa9RZ8BqoGMddrrYm8ftP9f9.jpg','1987-12-11',83,'Released','‘In a thousand years, Gandahar was destroyed, and all its people massacred. A thousand years ago, Gandahar will be saved, and what can’t be avoided will be.”','Gandahar',22500,2.9375,6.9,'u55roqzrOwQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10309,_binary '\0','/mogHGupMqYXj3tR3JZ5xLSyTZJ4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095530',7.1,1372,'en','Little Dorrit','Amy Dorrit spends her days earning money for the family and looking after her proud father who is a long term inmate of Marshalsea debtors\' prison in London. Amy and her family\'s world is transformed when her employer\'s son, Arthur Clennam, returns from overseas to solve his family\'s mysterious legacy and discovers that their lives are interlinked.','/61uclYiDIhkbV3o8XsjqUK0jbXD.jpg','1987-12-11',357,'Released',NULL,'Little Dorrit',47282,2.0458,6.4,'XIgwnz0zlUw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10310,_binary '\0','/oMKWgAANc2nE5Kdw8LVeVFlSz4R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095532',5.9,6414,'en','Little Nikita','An FBI agent works to uncover an all-American family as Soviet sleeper agents, and gets caught up in friendship with their oblivious teenage son.','/xdzugDI6avIlba05pstUFqh2mI2.jpg','1988-03-17',98,'Released','He went to bed an all-American kid and woke up the son of Russian spies.','Little Nikita',12505,2.6639,6,'jWsrjotWzEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10311,_binary '\0','/jqEcW3Y4nsOUsEnYM78RUodhUMa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095542',5.9,1242,'cn','龍在天涯','Jimmy and Tiger are members of the Chinese national wushu team. The two are in San Francisco to perform exhibitions. However, for Tiger, he plans to defect to America to make a name for himself. When Jimmy learns of Tigers plan to defect, an attempt to stop him fails and Jimmy ends up missing his flight to China. Now a fish out of water, Jimmy\'s only hope is Andy, a wisecracking youngster in S.F. Meanwhile, Tiger works for a mafia boss. When Tiger loses a fortune in cocaine in a detergent box that Andy accidentally took, Andy and Jimmy soon have no choice but to face the wrath of Tiger and his men. Their only ally is Penny, the girlfriend of Tiger\'s boss. Two men who were once best friends have now become bitter enemies.','/v5fEeD0O0rKFNGKvNqj4B11PpwN.jpg','1989-09-01',96,'Released',NULL,'Dragon Fight',35038,2.9031,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10312,_binary '\0','/2shhKQsnL4DxZvY3m5PkAHnPOLf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095560',3.4,15855,'en','Mac and Me','A Mysterious Alien Creature (MAC) escaping from nefarious NASA agents, is befriended by a young boy in a wheelchair. Together, they try to find MAC\'s family from whom he has been separated.','/gZsIgK2W9K6e1ebNro3WT7u5yGX.jpg','1988-08-12',99,'Released','Eric\'s new in the neighborhood. Mac\'s new on the planet.','Mac and Me',20196,3.4502,4.539,'2xGVQBJ2MmM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10313,_binary '\0','/jRypGPiO8BmBLqIKfCJtcZQhLxY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095564',6.6,1782,'en','Madame Sousatzka','In London, eccentric piano instructor Madame Sousatzka takes on a new prize protégé, Manek, a teenage Bengali immigrant who displays incredible talent. Manek forms a close bond with his teacher, but soon discovers that she expects her pupils to become disciplined in all areas of life, and not just behind the piano. As he struggles to meet the challenges, Manek must also deal with his mother, who vies with his teacher for his attention.','/iXBUkgTfFzT9OC9B4egsF0rSAPr.jpg','1988-10-14',122,'Released','I teach not only how to play, but how to live.','Madame Sousatzka',118098,2.0341,6.87,'bQ0Mu5kniXI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10314,_binary '\0','/xYgcdCZkjmFKe74MxxFHy4Y5FGA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095574',6.9,2383,'ru','Маленькая Вера','Vera is a troubled teenager fresh out of school feeling trapped in her provincial port town during the turbulent times of perestroika. Her days and nights are filled with drinking, sex, and family dysfunction.','/fiObKeqzQ09Ejy3DBmwHfoUpRgI.jpg','1988-10-01',128,'Released',NULL,'Little Vera',41961,7.8636,5.955,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10315,_binary '\0','/z8nAzqIsljgjIXYe3iIgBn7UIWl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095579',6.6,1294,'de','Man spricht deutsh','A very middle-class Bavarian family spend the last day of their Mediterranean vacation on the beach, day-dreaming and muttering racist remarks about Italian people.','/6wy4q1GYBlJksJ4YR5tvB0kfJjC.jpg','1988-02-18',84,'Released',NULL,'Man spricht deutsh',7458,1.3672,6.9,'uIR9ebcZfdY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10316,_binary '\0','/9GYvt6C9hzoW7tS4kaz00omOTb5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095583',6,23930,'en','Maniac Cop','A killer dressed in a police uniform begins murdering innocent people on the streets of New York City.','/YS4Q7xHZLjZ5HvffqVDmJLjxce.jpg','1988-05-13',85,'Released','You have the right to remain silent…forever.','Maniac Cop',14240,4.569,6.124,'Yu9ImAto0os','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10317,_binary '\0','/5PytFwJURkmjomopVKqzaMfPAhu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095593',6.3,22285,'en','Married to the Mob','Angela de Marco is fed up with her gangster husband\'s line of work and wants no part of the crime world. When her husband is killed for having an affair with the mistress of mob boss Tony \"The Tiger\" Russo, Angela and her son depart for New York City to make a fresh start. Unfortunately, Tony has set his sights upon Angela -- and so has an undercover FBI agent looking to use her to bust Tony.','/gkOsxv1RvV5smRnm6wrmn2wDXyZ.jpg','1988-08-19',104,'Released','They\'re her family... Whether she likes it or not.','Married to the Mob',2321,5.7497,6.006,'utU7opft6F4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10318,_binary '\0','/xTYht4kr0N3V4uMPSMpXM87VOag.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095599',6.1,5404,'en','Masquerade','A recently orphaned heiress meets a young racing yacht captain on Long Island. He shows interest in her and, being heiress to $200,000,000, love may not be the reason.','/vf2fZMZ0s44STAjF6kE7wVcKiw1.jpg','1988-03-11',91,'Released',NULL,'Masquerade',41963,2.7759,5.675,'EW_vDV8g1JE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10319,_binary '\0','/6SPLfYeLpE8bpLaNzYBnPGXtfGF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095607',7.1,3949,'da','Medea','Medea after having helped the man she loves, Jason, and given him to birth two children, is driven into fury and vengeful madness after he decides to abandon her to become successor to the throne by marring Glauce, the daughter of Creon, king of Corinth.','/cvTeUfwf2za9Yx2xn7W1unrW3ot.jpg','1989-08-08',76,'Released','She sacrifices something she loves, to harm someone who perhaps she loves even more.','Medea',34870,2.4678,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10320,_binary '\0','/ewMTZpH0QQj77Di2A2KnZseWOh7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095611',4.1,1545,'en','Memorial Valley Massacre','Campers on a holiday are terrorized by an axe-wielding maniac.','/tYPUNAXPKScLdlrhd0snN7AnBam.jpg','1988-12-09',93,'Released','Just When You Thought It Was Safe To Go Back In The Tent...','Memorial Valley Massacre',85170,1.6064,4.2,'8kDyaLKS6zU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10321,_binary '\0','/sqkxf0pnijbYoQc98fGUlTNGp60.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095613',5.7,1427,'en','Memories of Me','After a heart attack, Abbie Polin (Crystal), a New York doctor, goes to Los Angeles to see his father, Abe (King), who works in Hollywood as the \"king of the extras.\" Their relationship has been strained for several years. Lisa, the romantic interest in Abbie\'s life, bonds with Abe, who gets along famously with everyone but his son. Abe begins having memory loss and eventually is diagnosed with a brain aneurysm. He and his son grow closer in time and, before it\'s too late, Abbie tries to get Abe a speaking role in a film.','/sveCOcLBNrUPzcgEGrcRzdqfCvH.jpg','1988-09-28',103,'Released','Abbie Polin never told anyone the terrible secret about his father... he\'s alive and well and living in Hollywood.','Memories of Me',107569,2.415,5.4,'4W4fBNWyX6M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10322,_binary '\0','/tLlxZ7uNED6OurHDpU5AjAfRnGZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095626',5.5,4001,'en','Messenger of Death','A Denver reporter investigates the mass murder of a family of Mormons in rural Colorado.','/7Mu2xlGiltNK8pYyv5zArhWo4sf.jpg','1988-09-16',91,'Released','What the cops can\'t do, he will.','Messenger of Death',26172,2.5923,6.052,'RLz-s_ABQOs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10323,_binary '\0','/5bJuEI1jHkZIktD3vnshdWkJSH8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095631',7.5,105299,'en','Midnight Run','A bounty hunter pursues a former Mafia accountant who is also being chased by a rival bounty hunter, the F.B.I., and his old mob boss after jumping bail.','/yx0touyDQ9enWDsFgS4MbBwCSNd.jpg','1988-07-20',126,'Released','This could be the beginning of a beautiful friendship.','Midnight Run',9013,8.8931,7.2,'Geo_tNuNgD8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10324,_binary '\0','/fc749aCZmIdcq46cFULDfiCmcly.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095638',6.8,7382,'en','The Milagro Beanfield War','The accidental breakdown of an irrigation valve launches a hot confrontation between the mainly Latino farmers in a tiny New Mexico town and the real estate developers and politicians determined to acquire their land for a golf resort.','/rVLZuiNfKua7C2x3rGUiAR8wGEc.jpg','1988-03-18',117,'Released',NULL,'The Milagro Beanfield War',13482,3.379,6.5,'uuaKVk4hNAY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10325,_binary '\0','/wJWosQ5wTwsG1dBxhT09SxTjWQO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095640',5.7,1678,'en','Miles from Home','Two brothers who are forced off their farm in the debt stricken mid-west become folk heroes when they begin robbing the banks that have been foreclosing on farmers.','/6hPmtpzFo8fMALE4XZiylcmuppj.jpg','1988-09-16',108,'Released','Two brothers. All they wanted was their share of the American dream.','Miles from Home',50020,2.3529,5.4,'9mx_sSSHEeM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10326,_binary '\0','/sYpNbnOlIKW5nlrPDFOGpnCUlz9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095647',7.8,128880,'en','Mississippi Burning','Two FBI agents investigating the murder of civil rights workers during the 60s seek to breach the conspiracy of silence in a small Southern town where segregation divides black and white. The younger agent trained in FBI school runs up against the small town ways of his partner, a former sheriff.','/hTv8Bkq3W1vwKi1IWCLWQW9PNU4.jpg','1988-12-08',128,'Released','1964. When America was at war with itself.','Mississippi Burning',1632,8.8115,7.676,'0nxToB95XJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10327,_binary '\0','/e0tGFtNYjv0rUZtFuwlixDRauJs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095649',6.6,2219,'en','The Moderns','Nick Hart is a struggling American artist who lives amongst the expatriate community in 1920s Paris. He spends most of his time drinking and socializing in local café\'s and pestering gallery owner Libby Valentin to sell his paintings. He becomes involved in a plot by wealthy art patroness Nathalie de Ville to forge three paintings. This leads to several run-ins with American rubber magnate Bertram Stone, who happens to be married to Hart\'s ex-wife Rachel.','/7ENbrVNqcoCJqyqfyoFv1ox08fC.jpg','1988-04-15',126,'Released','Paris, 1926... there was nothing more modern.','The Moderns',41971,2.3329,5.9,'HZ1xM-eewTA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10328,_binary '\0','/6yjyTfX3bupv91OAh9LGXWb718w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095652',6.2,14885,'en','Monkey Shines','A quadriplegic man is given a trained monkey help him with every day activities, until the little monkey begins to develop feelings, and rage, against its new master and those who get too close to him.','/zbxrAWN2Ss5RXK1uDvMW82xFh0n.jpg','1988-07-29',113,'Released','Once there was a man whose prison was a chair. The man had a monkey, they made the strangest pair. The monkey ruled the man, it climbed inside his head. And now as fate would have it, one of them is dead.','Monkey Shines',29787,4.2041,6.309,'HD8TBmk6lIM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10329,_binary '\0','/9s1oPgSexlX6caN1PWX39b8iTlO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095654',6,7075,'en','Moon Over Parador','Underappreciated actor Jack Noah is on location in Parador at the time the dictator dies. The dictator\'s right-hand man makes Jack an offer he cannot refuse... to play the dictator. Jack\'s acting skills fool the masses but not close friends and employees of the dictator.','/3qVL6RqJTr6uQxV4O72H0j9tv0K.jpg','1988-09-09',103,'Released','He\'s not the first actor to impersonate a president... but he may be the last.','Moon Over Parador',34014,2.3633,5.9,'a123Dpj6Tq8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10330,_binary '\0','/ihIVjdiuvtVuFUaCqfNJwajIs3i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095655',6.1,20809,'en','Moonwalker','This fantastical movie inspired by the music of Michael Jackson features imaginative interpretations of hit tracks from the iconic 1987 album “Bad”.','/3GwTPQkAcgDeAirRpEuJG8HDdRz.jpg','1988-10-29',93,'Released','A movie like no other.','Moonwalker',13192,6.3531,7.1,'muOfjiMAIKw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10331,_binary '\0','/3EBbRt7eZt2DTCSEMSR7NjCUvJT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095657',8.8,4612,'ro','Moromeții','Story of a family. Problems, marriage, taxes, revenge, friendship, army, life and much more.','/4J0AN9hUPkzFoTRPsElyDfoXsDA.jpg','1987-09-28',142,'Released',NULL,'The Moromete Family',32601,0.7823,7.5,'w514PHlKf9Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10332,_binary '\0','/2cOPAaUYnCpaze23WrXYQ6l0zg9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095662',6.1,7010,'en','Moving','Arlo accepts what seems to him to be a dream promotion to Idaho. He soon discovers, however, that moving has its own share of problems.','/ucqwtWWJ9WMYvODuihXLMsRp61c.jpg','1988-03-04',89,'Released','One family\'s experience with the M-word.','Moving',29739,2.3246,5.5,'93KEjWkurmI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10333,_binary '\0','/oqUlGZ8wifE0BpNfbYi9NpRC7j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095665',5.9,1751,'en','Mr. North','Mr. North, a stranger to a small, but wealthy, Rhode Island town, quickly has rumors started about him that he has the power to heal people\'s ailments...','/5svk8saTxXGQ9WKE9MEIIbxcnwh.jpg','1988-07-22',93,'Released','Some say he\'s a miracle man. Some say he\'s a fraud. You are about to meet a most unusual young man.','Mr. North',77233,2.5662,5.3,'cIfuoLnMuiY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10334,_binary '\0','/eRzwmzyz4sSq2QqjXWehWNkU0Us.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095675',7.5,51327,'es','Mujeres al borde de un ataque de nervios','After being dumped by her lover, Pepa finds her life and the lives of those around her spiraling out of control in a deliciously chaotic series of events.','/lOehCiqghODNrNBpI1JS76zl6Lx.jpg','1988-03-25',88,'Released','A new comedy about someone you know.','Women on the Verge of a Nervous Breakdown',4203,4.4884,7.4,'1cVBr894wHs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10335,_binary '\0','/8XFujzZkRPi6Iasv2HExriyn7zc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095684',6.1,4872,'en','My Best Friend Is a Vampire','Shortly after high school student Jeremy Capello goes on a hot date, he finds he can\'t stand garlic or see his reflection in mirrors.','/nWvPMQ7b767G6zOrKCBU3MNbEyf.jpg','1987-10-01',89,'Released','Vampires and teenagers are a lot alike. They\'re just misunderstood.','My Best Friend Is a Vampire',21151,2.7486,6,'OogsmR9DOEo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10336,_binary '\0','/qN231DYaVUdEnFUHHPJ0kgpuV82.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095687',5.4,29739,'en','My Stepmother Is an Alien','Trying to rescue her home planet from destruction, a gorgeous extraterrestrial named Celeste arrives on Earth and begins her scientific research. She woos quirky scientist Dr. Steve Mills, a widower with a young daughter. Before long, Celeste finds herself in love with Steve and her new life on Earth, where she experiences true intimacy for the first time. But when she loses sight of her mission, she begins to question where she belongs.','/SIt5FbgvoxlZr8ay3cfi79pV6z.jpg','1988-12-09',108,'Released','She\'s gorgeous, and she\'s never been kissed. Needless to say, she\'s from another planet.','My Stepmother Is an Alien',12120,7.8535,5.8,'qfX8yIgpgaI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10337,_binary '\0','/czGSXzONlaJNntsWR4t1elodavq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095690',6.4,38011,'en','Mystic Pizza','Three teenage girls come of age while working at a pizza parlor in Mystic, Connecticut.','/2wqMKLJEMjenT7U8UqnuI070cUC.jpg','1988-10-13',104,'Released','A romantic comedy with the works.','Mystic Pizza',11191,4.9985,6.295,'phKgLzz15KQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10338,_binary '\0','/qpjuVCGZvNsbDa4UyxrbAa4Dno3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095705',7.6,225653,'en','The Naked Gun: From the Files of Police Squad!','When the bumbling Lieutenant Frank Drebin investigates events following the shooting of his partner, he stumbles upon an attempt to assassinate Queen Elizabeth II.','/zT0mhZqZQJE1gSY5Eg9qcGP4NYo.jpg','1988-12-02',86,'Released','You\'ve read the ad, now see the movie!','The Naked Gun: From the Files of Police Squad!',37136,14.7367,7.278,'PACTQutbow4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10339,_binary '\0','/a5kImJOOgKOiCNHvYwTJPnJMzQr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095709',6.6,4353,'en','The Navigator: A Medieval Odyssey','Cumberland, 1348. The plague is spreading in medieval England. The remote village of little Griffin is also threatened. But the 9-year-old boy has a recurring dream that holds the key to a tiny hope of survival: a lake with a coffin floating on it. A white church with an iron cross. A falling glove. A falling silhouette. A torch tumble through a dark shaft into infinity. With his brother he recognizes in it a prophecy to escape the Black Death. So they embark with a few men on a journey to a distant cathedral, where they want to set up an iron cross as an offering to God. Her path leads them through a deep and dark mine shaft into an unknown land and completely outlandish time - into the present-day New Zealand of the 1980s.','/3jgWf292UUNZyaaLppFlYWFpDOE.jpg','1988-12-15',92,'Released','An Odyssey Across Time.','The Navigator: A Medieval Odyssey',34637,2.339,6.2,'DGMVw-ptbTY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10340,_binary '\0','/ztUsikFoLgUx4Uce6EqF3l5LEUZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095715',7.4,15350,'cs','Něco z Alenky','A quiet young English girl named Alice finds herself in an alternate version of her own reality after chasing a white rabbit. She becomes surrounded by living inanimate objects and stuffed dead animals, and must find a way out of this nightmare - no matter how twisted or odd that way must be.','/8o460rJZt7GY3j7QmLPeJrQWNwD.jpg','1988-08-03',86,'Released','A film made for children… perhaps?','Alice',18917,3.186,7.4,'Nxugr1jEYj8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10341,_binary '\0','/uKVz2h6oRz7ws0M1f3RUIWpZvyZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095719',5.3,3698,'en','The Nest','Horrifying shocker as a biological experiment goes haywire when meat-eating mutant roaches invade an island community, terrorizing a peaceful New England fishing village and hideously butchering its citizens.','/suRyQyDDRNPErMM53dYb7ynPiwk.jpg','1988-05-13',89,'Released','Roaches have never tasted flesh... until now. She\'s just an appetizer.','The Nest',87710,2.223,5.2,'CAeOsLIGimM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10342,_binary '\0','/a3SWGndhPySAYxfzmMCOpJSMVAO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095728',6.2,1497,'it','Il nido del ragno','A young professor travels to Budapest to locate a lost colleague. Once there, he gets tangled up in a supernatural mystery.','/ogslEcLdm7eV60Nk1RcriwRsccd.jpg','1988-08-25',86,'Released',NULL,'The Spider Labyrinth',104308,1.9913,6.4,'QfrJ0J1pqSU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10343,_binary '\0','/uAWNhTbaCkxkm7bmKdxx7WCpQ3l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095730',6.1,4195,'en','The Night Before','A popular beauty surprisingly asks a nerd to take her to the prom. He wakes up hours later in a sleazy alley. She\'s missing but he remembers nothing about it.','/o3GOrWh7ytlKsdOGI77WFauZORr.jpg','1988-04-15',85,'Released','You lost your father\'s car. Sold your prom date. And a guy named \'Tito\' wants you dead.','The Night Before',38966,2.8121,6.1,'UPpSPotDGME','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10344,_binary '\0','/mLJA7F4Tp52MlzltbAFfgK3QvOk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095736',5.5,3352,'en','A Night in the Life of Jimmy Reardon','A recent high school graduate is faced with two options, either go to a business school where his father wants him to go to, or get a full time job. However he decides to defy his father and go to Hawaii. Trouble is he has no money. Along the way he comes to understand his parents and eventually bonds with his father.','/2hBR9hq45QvMnTD9via4duMhyDi.jpg','1988-02-26',93,'Released','He\'s got 24 hours to convince the one girl he really loves that he\'s honest, faithful, and fully committed. It\'s going to be a long night.','A Night in the Life of Jimmy Reardon',47818,3.0087,5,'kpHuW1POfDo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10345,_binary '\0','/iWYr93CtpoYq9iWpYuau4stPATf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095740',5.4,3705,'en','Nightmare Beach','In Miami, Florida, biker gang leader Edward \"Diablo\" Santer is about to be executed for murder when he proclaims his innocence and vows revenge from the grave. When a mysterious biker comes to town during Spring Break festivities, leaving several teenagers electrocuted to death, some begin to suspect that Santer has made good on his promise.','/febAGZx40j1PMReqqUCZFxdztlL.jpg','1989-07-14',90,'Released','The beach of terror','Nightmare Beach',74646,2.038,5.491,'Z4FSfaDDqjw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10346,_binary '\0','/eH9XCRkbpLq9gm1YiQGm66TYkZd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095742',5.6,68857,'en','A Nightmare on Elm Street 4: The Dream Master','Freddy Krueger returns once again to terrorize the dreams of the remaining Dream Warriors, as well as those of a young woman who may be able to defeat him for good.','/boStYG7jKdoIZTduiOOsUVknD13.jpg','1988-08-19',93,'Released','Terror beyond your wildest dreams.','A Nightmare on Elm Street 4: The Dream Master',10131,7.3254,5.884,'jc-9vF9F_eg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10347,_binary '\0','/gsblesGQT04voA1YCZiXpD5C4wS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095756',5,3030,'en','Not of This Earth','An alien arrives on Earth looking to take human blood in an attempt to preserve his dying planet.','/wHSYPs9W3AmKdzeYhNxB0mtswlv.jpg','1988-05-20',81,'Released','Traci must battle forces from another galaxy!','Not of This Earth',40028,3.082,4.781,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10348,_binary '\0','/zoVeIgKzGJzpdG6Gwnr7iOYfIMU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095765',8.5,320725,'it','Nuovo Cinema Paradiso','A filmmaker recalls his childhood, when he fell in love with the movies at his village\'s theater and formed a deep friendship with the theater\'s projectionist.','/9JhfVOveaY00o8njQu2Xrp4YWud.jpg','1988-11-17',124,'Released','An enchanted village. A wonderful friendship. Star-crossed lovers. And the magic of the movies.','Cinema Paradiso',11216,15.0648,8.432,'JMyVSD6OvO8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10349,_binary '\0','/wK6QTWdPqB9oXAJRl6OKoSQoh3R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095774',6.2,3837,'en','Off Limits','McGriff and Albaby are probably doing the worst law enforcement job in the world - they are plain clothes U.S. military policemen on duty in war-time Saigon. However, their job becomes even harder when they start investigating the serial killings of local prostitutes. Their prime suspect is high ranking U.S. Army officer which brings their lives in danger.','/1c3ueMtlIdu0u5bjEaXLPj2sScG.jpg','1988-03-11',102,'Released','Being a cop is tough. But in Saigon, 1968, being a cop is crazy.','Off Limits',38617,3.4963,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10350,_binary '\0','/k18aKqDPrbTsijtN9jRpnTHxQks.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095776',6.6,57729,'en','Oliver & Company','Putting its own \'twist\' on the story of Oliver Twist, the orange runt of a litter of kittens must fight for survival on the rough streets on New York City, finding unlikely friends in the dogs owned by a down-on-his luck man named Fagin. Soon, Oliver and his new band of comrades must fight for survival when Fagin is unable to pay his debts.','/x8XqdiZ0Oxu5iXF9SiFub9Lae8J.jpg','1988-11-18',74,'Released','The first Disney movie with attitude.','Oliver & Company',12233,12.2012,6.7,'acVUTB3YjBo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10351,_binary '\0','/8CS3Qoi2sBG66ZYr1u4M4TD6nri.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095799',5.8,2922,'de','Otto - Der Neue Film','Otto is Friesland\'s answer to Rambo and stands between two worlds, two women and two animals. While he\'s trying to cure a dog with bite inhibition and a cat with suicidal tendencies, the dream of his sleepless nights crosses his path: Gaby. Otto falls instantly in love, but Gaby thinks only of Amboss, a real guy with muscles of steel and a brain of rubber. Well, Otto on the other hand is not exactly well built and attractive. But he\'s determined to get the lady\'s attention, even if it means taking part in body-building competitions...','/oqdAKOsVczoZ82mxShIZEBBTtTS.jpg','1987-07-16',82,'Released',NULL,'Otto – The New Movie',9252,1.9566,5.668,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10352,_binary '\0','/3wcDKBiMnCEZBIg5ADN1dZ7L44i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095800',7.7,20657,'fr','L\'Ours','An orphan bear cub hooks up with an adult male as they try to dodge human hunters.','/ry4A1Y2udvqyDlVHLtSeP1u9qwJ.jpg','1988-10-21',97,'Released','He\'s an orphan... at the start of a journey. A journey to survive.','The Bear',2383,4.1285,7.127,'S0tX2wKi6O0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10353,_binary '\0','/xNZwsgmAt3aqjKZYWQmUzEij6XD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095801',7.4,16750,'de','Out of Rosenheim','A German woman named Jasmin stumbles upon a dilapidated motel/diner in the middle of nowhere. Her unusual appearance and demeanor are at first suspicious to Brenda, the exasperated owner who has difficulty making ends meet. But when an unlikely magic sparks between the two women, this lonely desert outpost is transformed into a thriving and popular oasis.','/zeEa3jVkLE8C0KjOiiKqMbhHgaL.jpg','1987-11-12',108,'Released','Off Route 66 between Vegas and nowhere a little magic\'s going on...','Bagdad Cafe',3543,3.6741,7.2,'et3JU_5DY0c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10354,_binary '\0','/4LYBygf2cw6ji7ZULkfvd5X0LE3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095803',5.4,1916,'en','Out of the Dark','A deranged killer wearing a clown mask begins preying on a group of young women working at a phone-sex company.','/hO5mCzOKuEXGil8bwBkxpHvNTCj.jpg','1988-06-02',89,'Released','The phone sex line was for fantasy... now it\'s for murder!','Out of the Dark',30652,2.8263,5.6,'S6x9I-2K0Zc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10355,_binary '\0','/3h7JENuXqM68EWHKyUsKgXKu1KM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095812',4.4,1660,'it','Paganini Horror','A female rock band acquires an infamous composition by Niccolò Paganini that was used in satanic rituals. When the band decides to record the song and film a video in Paganini\'s old mansion, the spirit of the deceased composer is summoned and the band unlocks a portal to Hell.','/jGRfupGOElwgqSSFMdHE4Al6R3p.jpg','1989-06-06',83,'Released','KILLER MUSIC.','Paganini Horror',67183,1.2788,4.4,'wum3Bssmbjo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10356,_binary '\0','/r0I09Zf67cQxbDqMBvrltWwVuXj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095827',6.7,1697,'en','Pascali\'s Island','1908: Pascali, a spy for the Sultan, sends reports to Istanbul that nobody reads. His suspicions are roused when a British archaeologist appears, who may not be quite what he seems.','/fNBIQ68VmeAgmXzKN07w4AQqRnk.jpg','1988-07-22',104,'Released','At the end of an empire, a mystery began.','Pascali\'s Island',116345,2.9931,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10357,_binary '\0','/7No68SmTNviVwr5xZizSILE2eCr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095836',6.3,2802,'en','Patty Hearst','The true story of a rich girl who was abducted by American revolutionaries in the 1970s. Her time spent with her captors made her question herself and her way of life. She eventually joined their cause, sparking controversy.','/tKXJOVLOVG7lO2enlB89n9tkv7T.jpg','1988-09-23',108,'Released','Heiress. Victim. Terrorist.','Patty Hearst',70202,2.3022,5.7,'co_904WytvM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10358,_binary '\0','/disE4kPp6jkIR8MJhVsdYuKyv3q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095853',6.4,2507,'en','Permanent Record','David Sinclair seems to have everything going for him: he\'s smart, musically talented, and very successful. To top off his senior year in high school, his band is trying to get a recording session. Therefore, David\'s suicide leaves everyone, especially his best friend and bandmate, Chris, with a lot of questions.','/AsoyWPJwtuRJuHyMhXpcsK0XrbX.jpg','1988-04-22',92,'Released','High school. Senior year. His suicide shattered their world. Their courage drove them to pick up the pieces.','Permanent Record',51321,2,6.4,'ym6bPQuPg8Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10359,_binary '\0','/rC2HpslTzrhzJ605DHBPkeITpt2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095863',6.4,18297,'en','Phantasm II','Mike, after his release from a psychiatric hospital, teams up with his old pal Reggie to hunt down the Tall Man, who is at it again. A mysterious, beautiful girl has also become part of Mike\'s dreams, and they must find her before the Tall Man does.','/cZ5mPtOXcvmg224oBM2k1db5Fnn.jpg','1988-07-08',97,'Released','The ball is back!','Phantasm II',15158,4.0723,6.2,'e2ImjirHLz4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10360,_binary '\0','/jKfK0ulRBKH5mL3ZY87LzRRg9bj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095867',4.6,2084,'en','Picasso Trigger','Double agent Picasso Trigger is assassinated in Paris by double-crossing bad guy Miguel Ortiz. Then Ortiz begins eliminating agents of The Agency who were involved in his brother\'s death. The Agency (belatedly) springs into action to stop Ortiz\' heinous activities. The usual gunplay, romance, and nifty toys with bombs ensue.','/1f7GDCqPe7qneZGwe6iYdiZonLn.jpg','1988-02-01',99,'Released','They take their art seriously. They kill.','Picasso Trigger',50560,2.3826,4.352,'mR7rqptSgLs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10361,_binary '\0','/cpoCmsmKGsqxwSRPWFKegZbmoQz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095869',6.9,4506,'it','Il piccolo diavolo','Father Maurice, a priest living in a residential college for priests in Rome, is called out one day to \"exorcise\" the devil from someone. The devil turns out to be in the form of a fun-loving man called Giuditta. What Father Maurice doesn\'t know is that this type of devil will turn his life around.','/ck1dLdsmjwYljlnwQRNj4XhBa55.jpg','1988-07-01',99,'Released',NULL,'The Little Devil',43645,2.7945,6.725,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10362,_binary '\0','/yDuhznnNmR4Pehf9QubGnLkEBNC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095871',6.5,6099,'en','Pin','Pin, a plastic medical dummy, has been the fixation of Leon since youth. Now grown up and orphaned in an accident, Leon brings Pin home to live with him and his sister Ursula, much to her reluctance. Soon, however, Leon\'s fixation on Pin spirals out of control, and Ursula must face the devastating consequences.','/ouUfJtdHPkRXFJ0zDLPvgbPHPjd.jpg','1988-11-25',103,'Released','A Plastic Nightmare','Pin',41966,2.3165,6.8,'2RP67quuC8Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10363,_binary '\0','/wDgvbSRKlu8gSwnlOWN22bk8zXR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095877',5.4,2506,'en','Platoon Leader','West Point graduate lieutenant Jeff Knight meets cynicism when taking command of sergeant Michael McNamara\'s tour veterans platoon in a Vietnamese trench camp. Unlike his predecessor, who hid till the end of his tour, Jeff takes charge, experiences the manual doesn\'t allow coping with all realities and gets wounded. He returns, now fully respect by men and superiors. Besides the Vietcong, the platoon wrestles with the inscrutable villagers, which the G.I.\'s officially protect, but also fear as some collaborate with them, other covertly with the Cong, either way subject to bloody reprisals.','/y7b14dEHSAfyna1DmigZAehz1oZ.jpg','1988-10-01',97,'Released','War is hell. This was worse...','Platoon Leader',48457,1.8189,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10364,_binary '\0','/jR2i87UypZkLeoLTIeIgh7vGYb9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095878',4.6,1511,'en','Pledge Night','A fraternity pledge returns from the grave to even the score with the members who caused his death 20 years ago.','/fO7yzwXUUfYZel6PuEIzbvss1bU.jpg','1990-12-07',86,'Released','Brothers to the end... the very end.','Pledge Night',71048,1.8501,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10365,_binary '\0','/qUYNcbiYkRehth3xnxqHv7NKJ0H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095882',4.7,39924,'en','Police Academy 5: Assignment Miami Beach','The Police Academy misfits travel to Miami Beach for Commandant Lassard to be honored with a prestigious lifetime award pending his retirement. Things take a turn when Lassard unknowingly ends up in possession of stolen diamonds from a jewel heist.','/4m1qfTiVxdEDv0fgUf0FI7CA9Fe.jpg','1988-03-17',90,'Released','Hold everything! The cadets are dropping in on Miami Beach for an all new adventure.','Police Academy 5: Assignment Miami Beach',11825,6.4651,5.2,'arQAsNE4fcI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10366,_binary '\0','/ByfZdzqCfOTrV0GRaxMJ7GG1JJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095888',6.5,2883,'tr','Polizei','Working as a modest garbage collector and part-time theater assistant in Berlin, Ali Ekber feels betrayed by his friends. After getting his hands on a theater prop Politzei uniform, he uses it to pose as a Politzei and impress his love - waitress Babett.','/35CFvV5N9xArfEO6UhhLqosUZQn.jpg','1988-11-01',88,'Released',NULL,'Polizei',301093,1.9214,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10367,_binary '\0','/exQwGehuaGAjqVwSoVfAA8sybna.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095889',4.7,22694,'en','Poltergeist III','Carol Anne has been sent to live with her Aunt and Uncle in an effort to hide her from the clutches of the ghostly Reverend Kane, but he tracks her down and terrorises her in her relatives\' appartment in a tall glass building. Will he finally achieve his target and capture Carol Anne again, or will Tangina be able, yet again, to thwart him?','/pLewUibOJLGISvMqB94mAMdjz2q.jpg','1988-06-10',98,'Released','No matter where Carol Anne goes... she never goes alone.','Poltergeist III',10306,5.6713,5.222,'_lCfugr2qJU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10368,_binary '\0','/dvareNwtZqPGoEt2eIrPAGqiLfL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095895',7.2,9481,'en','Powaqqatsi','An exploration of technologically developing nations and the effect the transition to Western-style modernization has had on them.','/xh8Pvtq4dYry9B4uRT3VbmSI4Wi.jpg','1988-04-29',100,'Released','Life in transformation','Powaqqatsi',24348,1.811,7.2,'be3-6V8VGrY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10369,_binary '\0','/dbh1TWT21i5ZRJf31BnDfWFPIwx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095897',6,21508,'en','The Presidio','Jay Austin is now a civilian police detective. Colonel Caldwell was his commanding officer years before when he left the military police over a disagreement over the handling of a drunk driver. Now a series of murders that cross jurisdictions force them to work together again. That Austin is now dating Caldwell\'s daughter is not helping their relationship.','/pHYtq4wFaUy5Rfa8lRi24QMUwRY.jpg','1988-06-10',97,'Released','He didn\'t want to share the murder investigation. There\'s no way he\'s going to share his daughter.','The Presidio',11851,3.6101,5.8,'L0D-qlZkD8A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10370,_binary '\0','/vzL6klPoUMgRC2wEkG25EiP7GcU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095904',5.8,5274,'en','Prison','After Charles Forsyth was sent to the electric chair for a crime he didn\'t commit, he forever haunts the prison where he was executed. Flash forward several years when the prison is reopened, under the control of its new warden Eaton Sharpe, a former security guard who framed Charlie. When prisoners are ordered to break down the wall to the execution room, they unknowingly release the angry spirit of Charles Forsyth, a powerful being distributing his murderous rage to all, leading up to the Warden himself.','/bB6iCnYO1dlVA1kZp04acFyXTpg.jpg','1987-12-08',102,'Released','Horror has a new home.','Prison',48309,2.3375,5.81,'y1jBASXIgzs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10371,_binary '\0','/2I0Vcayz0gyxAM6oC54E3UfntEM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095916',5.6,1679,'en','Promised Land','Three recent high school grads - star athlete Hancock, his cheerleader girlfriend, Mary, and the awkward Senator - aim to leave their small town behind and realize big dreams, but their idealistic plans collide with life\'s harsh realities.','/gP5lHwLdK73EDrKDbFp44wrNikO.jpg','1988-01-22',102,'Released','Life on the edge of the American Dream.','Promised Land',62327,1.735,5.1,'pReXm9W0_Qg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10372,_binary '\0','/od2UQW5hCVyWwRAroigGWK9FpmD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095922',4.4,1731,'en','Psycho Cop','Officer Joe Vickers would probably make a good policeman if it weren\'t for his two nasty habits. Firstly, he is a devoted satanist; secondly - he likes to kill people. When he meets a group of teenagers spending their vacation in a wood hut, he decides to investigate.','/fK6Mq1xaitZC8pXpHwL2vdbIbm7.jpg','1989-11-28',87,'Released','He\'s the last cop you\'ll ever meet.','Psycho Cop',29692,1.1654,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10373,_binary '\0','/gkmNKbuFa5rB4AfdHy0pVKiiw0K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095924',5.5,3318,'en','Pulse','An intelligent pulse of electricity moves from house to house, terrorizing occupants through their own appliances. Having already destroyed one household in a quiet neighborhood, the pulse finds itself in the home of a boy and his divorced father.','/3klryy0WVJFh5HAkMWrY6TY6QiP.jpg','1988-03-04',91,'Released','The ultimate shocker.','Pulse',32033,2.135,5.2,'0TOmjasJ3gs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10374,_binary '\0','/vCNXAsuDHxHT1ylHqTDSDqaehUG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095925',6.2,31738,'en','Pumpkinhead','When a group of teenagers inadvertently kill his only son, Ed Harley seeks the powers of a backwoods witch to bring the child back to life.','/gx7Gej5Srp3E13oqy1Kghtox2VZ.jpg','1988-06-09',86,'Released','A grim fairy tale.','Pumpkinhead',26515,4.1016,6.5,'4uIQ4Zn9Ijc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10375,_binary '\0','/sjeuEHadWkWu7Yyvxhnpdey65fh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095927',5.9,9924,'en','Punchline','Lilah Krytsick is a mother and housewife who\'s always believed she could be a stand-up comedian. Steven Gold is an experienced stand-up seemingly on the cusp of success. When the two meet, they form an unlikely friendship, and Steven tries to help the untried Lilah develop her stage act. Despite the objections of her family and some very wobbly beginnings, Lilah improves, and soon she finds herself competing with Steven for a coveted television spot.','/dgbLnnEJIGldXOMt6OWy3X1l0AC.jpg','1988-10-07',123,'Released','Dying is easy. Comedy is hard.','Punchline',40820,2.8195,5.55,'Fk6AHn48MCY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10376,_binary '\0','/idMagL42q5mFNLDbjLGVDAjxGov.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095930',4.6,1308,'en','Purple People Eater','A kid plays the old novelty song \"Purple People Eater\" and the creature actually appears. The two then proceed to help an elderly couple who are being evicted by their greedy landlord.','/8DjpY5mqzudxLOgGMruNJNUDpGy.jpg','1988-12-01',90,'Released','The one-eyed... one horn... flying...','Purple People Eater',79397,2.0924,5.1,'5K_xMNj7NEU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10377,_binary '\0','/eDvVI9iMa1Y9XQF0TXu7YGUDyGO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095936',7.4,11975,'hi','क़यामत से क़यामत तक‎','Both Dhanraj Singh and Randhir Singh are two bitter and old time enemies. They faced a disastrous situation when their children, Raj and Rashmi fall deeply in love. They openly declare their hatred for one another and will do anything in their power, even kill - but they will not accept their children\'s choice. But Raj and Rashmi are dedicated to their love and are not willing to accept the fact that their fathers are mutual enemies.','/rWF3RMf7SKfZx5CObQusnemnhmU.jpg','1988-07-09',162,'Released',NULL,'Qayamat Se Qayamat Tak',27964,1.4784,6.817,'Y-mLv7Xe_XI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10378,_binary '\0','/jMT9D1ySJzYBzNfO5I983g0ky5Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095942',4.5,1262,'it','Quella villa in fondo al parco','After a model is brutally murdered on a Caribbean island, her sister\'s investigation uncovers a horrifying rat-like creature.','/5bqFnf9wLJOFgKZIG7I1je3f2vP.jpg','1988-04-20',82,'Released','He\'s the Critter from the Shitter!','Rat Man',94016,2.0768,5.1,'0-u1pQ5iiVU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10379,_binary '\0','/hMmhuLa1h6bUghyYF8pcigoSMQ6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095943',7,1359,'fr','Quelques jours avec moi','After being discharged from a mental institution, a man is tasked by his mother to revive a struggling supermarket in Limoges. He must navigate unexpected responsibilities and the challenges of managing the store\'s staff.','/pDSVwVnXZGlI5g8RbqMWb36jOf2.jpg','1988-08-14',131,'Released',NULL,'A Few Days with Me',2025,1.9104,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10380,_binary '\0','/b3tos7Tsd6lsTe52Nn4TMrEQg65.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095953',8,589885,'en','Rain Man','When car dealer Charlie Babbitt learns that his estranged father has died, he returns home to Cincinnati, where he discovers that he has a savant older brother named Raymond and that his father\'s $3 million fortune is being left to the mental institution in which Raymond lives. Motivated by his father\'s money, Charlie checks Raymond out of the facility in order to return with him to Los Angeles. The brothers\' cross-country trip ends up changing both their lives.','/iTNHwO896WKkaoPtpMMS74d8VNi.jpg','1988-12-12',134,'Released','A journey through understanding and fellowship.','Rain Man',380,11.7161,7.749,'wwmctS4nldM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10381,_binary '\0','/nEuPSz6LhmrtYp7K56dbsmomuqA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095956',5.8,151273,'en','Rambo III','Combat has taken its toll on Rambo, but he\'s finally begun to find inner peace in a monastery. When Rambo\'s friend and mentor Col. Trautman asks for his help on a top secret mission to Afghanistan, Rambo declines but must reconsider when Trautman is captured.','/1eSQvGuD25ezKaiaQsyDDG3e9iN.jpg','1988-05-24',102,'Released','The first was for himself. The second was for his country. This time is for his friend.','Rambo III',1370,10.4932,6.209,'SMLUwNSVX5Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10382,_binary '\0','/eyUBcXFPAmRcLoOJwYW28n9iTNq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095958',6.2,3166,'en','Rampage','Liberal district attorney decides to seek the death penalty for a man who slaughtered a family at Christmastime, then drank their blood. He escapes, though, and starts killing again.','/oW6HqRb2DiyptApYUn527FkpgMw.jpg','1987-09-01',91,'Released','This is the face of Charles Reece, a mass murderer. He doesn\'t think he\'s done anything wrong. The real crime is that the jury may agree.','Rampage',99749,1.7529,6,'Smn0hoPz0pM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10383,_binary '\0','/ziva4O2Zcur37MPkvwyKTVWEgrO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095963',6.2,82226,'en','Red Heat','A tough Russian policeman is forced to partner up with a cocky Chicago police detective when he is sent to Chicago to apprehend a Georgian drug lord who killed his partner and fled the country.','/AoJTHXmO01EZgT0p1YTsGBEQxLj.jpg','1988-06-17',104,'Released','Moscow\'s toughest detective. Chicago\'s craziest cop. There\'s only one thing worse than making them mad. Making them partners.','Red Heat',9604,7.6711,6.2,'wX_UeU9loXk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10384,_binary '\0','/cQfGdk1TCE8f6hE5hChlG8cFZbH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095975',6.2,3569,'en','Renegade','While on his travel across the Southwestern United States, with his Jeep CJ Renegade and his chestnut colt named Joe Brown, Luke meets Matt, son of a friend of his, Moose, who is in jail. Moose asks Luke to take care of Matt, and to help him to take possession of a piece of land. So starts their travel, full of adventures...','/zgwKoRfTaOgA3uWAEGhN3gsO7c0.jpg','1987-10-30',92,'Released','You call me Trinity - they call me Renegade.','Renegade',11496,2.3236,6.2,'EFe8G64yBRU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10385,_binary '\0','/Acv9hIhzxDukQFmrHJGtjrm8ybV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095977',4.8,2350,'en','Rent-a-Cop','Detective Tony Church is forced to retire and become a store rent-a-cop when his drug sting operation comes to a tragic end by a masked killer. He joins forces with a prostitute, the only one able to identify the killer, to bring him to justice.','/7uZzYa6hfHGfwA4YVMQ2aY4LwsG.jpg','1987-11-28',92,'Released','Deadlier than Dirty Harry, faster than Cobra','Rent-a-Cop',80287,2.9915,4.7,'WB0S0CtDu-E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10386,_binary '\0','/llPOt9y73HN4iCap1RqhWejb6yB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095981',5.6,1485,'en','The Rescue','A team of Navy Seals are sent to destroy a disabled submarine so it will not fall into the \"wrong\" hands. They complete their mission, but are captured before they can return to their base. The U.S. Government will not mount a rescue mission to free the soldiers, so their teenage children take over. The kids find a way to venture into the foreign country and then must overcome many obstacles.','/eYB1bLNMvZX0hmoFNa63cQDJnCp.jpg','1988-08-05',97,'Released','An elite U.S. Special Forces team is imprisoned behind enemy lines. The Pentagon calls them expendable. Five young heroes call them Dad. Now they\'ll risk everything to bring them home.','The Rescue',41368,2.0244,5.3,'tI6zdRbN604','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10387,_binary '\0','/vkMTwptspOFn9tFytRkZnyW1DDI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095984',5.9,1452,'en','Retribution','After a depressed artist miraculously survives a suicide attempt, a series of horrific murders leads him to realize he may have been possessed by the vengeful spirit of a murdered gangster.','/5syhJI9wAWjES01c6Dr3tn81eQV.jpg','1987-10-01',107,'Released','The time is now!','Retribution',82315,2.5312,6,'8YHDIo9ZZlY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000');
INSERT INTO `movies` VALUES (10388,_binary '\0','/p6Q58KUkE4qd2TdMffNsaPDH8dF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095989',5.3,8332,'en','Return of the Killer Tomatoes!','Crazy old Professor Gangreen has developed a way to make tomatoes look human for a second invasion.','/gO6mxCEMcyP6teOQb32Yvq9ERCA.jpg','1988-04-22',98,'Released','They were out for blood, and rotten to the core. Now they\'re back ...','Return of the Killer Tomatoes!',15482,2.8933,5.623,'2aIXhmygh3A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10389,_binary '\0','/o8sHDEdPa9oxkGlHkXATXzNoniR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095990',5.7,23745,'en','Return of the Living Dead Part II','A group of kids discover one of the drums containing a rotting corpse and release the 2-4-5 Trioxin gas into the air, causing the dead to once again rise from the grave and seek out brains.','/2zY8kt1HnQ8p8mjKcqBp9yQEC8x.jpg','1988-01-15',89,'Released','Just when you thought it was safe to be dead.','Return of the Living Dead Part II',24929,6.4254,6.4,'X1Ea5xNfh1U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10390,_binary '\0','/qh9cuV51Lx5L7eJtotTEpLWn0Wy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0095993',6.6,3017,'en','The Man From Snowy River II','After a few years trying to earn money to marry Jessica Harrison, Jim Craig returns to Snowy River. But he finds that a lot of things have changed.','/6I94myoMi28trV8lxDq2DWhzLFe.jpg','1988-03-24',110,'Released','The man is back!','The Man From Snowy River II',13965,2.7028,6.8,'i9IHwlcKMBE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10391,_binary '\0','/bZ8tRs61o61j9txVI9Q0HWRJ7kA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096000',4.4,1656,'it','Robowar - Robot da guerra','A group of commandos heads into the jungles of Venezuela on a highly classified mission and encounters a robotic killing machine.','/ps4uhlLu9arQeImGZoncftRVh1.jpg','1988-01-01',92,'Released',NULL,'Robowar',105927,1.8283,4.4,'onbkXlzzywU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10392,_binary '\0','/9hSSQzTZ0rMwIwAXk3fpsuiinKC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096003',6.5,2356,'en','Rocket Gibraltar','A man\'s family comes for his 77th birthday and while he loves all of his children and their children, he and his children don\'t exactly connect. However, he connects with his grandchildren. And he tells them what he wants for his birthday and they do what they can to give it to him.','/4yA9LoOXHl5gTxfizEpl4407phT.jpg','1988-09-02',99,'Released','One unforgettable weekend, one family met some remarkable, crazy, loving people. Each other.','Rocket Gibraltar',58434,1.8062,6,'YY0bqQhVoHM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10393,_binary '\0','/xZGCJleQaeqi5jFsvcOoqfsMZvT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096018',7.6,20279,'en','Running on Empty','The Popes are a family who haven\'t been able to use their real identity for years. In the late sixties, the parents set a weapons lab afire in an effort to hinder the government\'s Vietnam war campaign. Ever since then, the Popes have been on the run with the authorities never far behind. Their survival is threatened when their eldest son falls in love with a girl, and announces his wish to live his life on his own terms.','/kzhyruFxY4Z5Ert8M9tuM2MV8dd.jpg','1988-09-09',116,'Released','They chose their lives. Now their son must choose his.','Running on Empty',18197,4.6065,7.4,'06sU0RVSl-w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10394,_binary '\0','/48SOz2T8k1uscc8gqr2Mf4G2il4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096022',6.2,6009,'sv','SOS - en segelsällskapsresa','The landlubber Stig-Helmer and his Norwegian friend Ole get on a barge by mistake. They arrive at an archipelago and have to spend Midsummer among the fancy rich boat people, their yachts and summer houses.','/tI0AHXooAbubqd4cDQapAv5xTmJ.jpg','1988-12-25',104,'Released',NULL,'Swedes at Sea',17172,1.2472,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10395,_binary '\0','/9wR8tVP9Ln8sYCfk3UULe0hZQH5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096028',7.9,11327,'hi','Salaam Bombay!','When a revengeful Krishna destroys his brother\'s motorbike, his mother asks him to return home only when he earns INR 500 to repair it. In a turn of events, he finds himself in a Bombay slum.','/405GFXA7NKwVxqP9WHD5RaKZ84C.jpg','1988-08-24',113,'Released',NULL,'Salaam Bombay!',45129,1.7339,7.254,'1EwzP71pDVQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10396,_binary '\0','/fPOFWIGtlqmazz2GIQkk2ZAF9rW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096029',6.4,2248,'en','Salome\'s Last Dance','London, England, November 5th, 1892, Guy Fawkes Night. The famous playwright Oscar Wilde and his lover Lord Alfred Douglas discreetly go to a luxury brothel where the owner, Alfred Taylor, has prepared a surprise for the renowned author: a private and very special performance of his play Salome, banned by the authorities, in which Taylor himself and the peculiar inhabitants of the exclusive establishment will participate.','/lOmY5qiOOB3gqnGiqkI7VSEXwrl.jpg','1988-05-06',89,'Released','Notorious, scandalous, Wilde!','Salome\'s Last Dance',70842,2.1146,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10397,_binary '\0','/7Z1nWKV6xHjraPbBdScVcJpuafq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096030',4.9,1391,'en','Salsa','Fatherless barrio Puerto Rican Rico is a menial car mechanic by day, but lives for the nights, when he dances and dates hot dancing girls, cockily convinced the title of Salsa king in fancy nightclub La Luna\'s upcoming contest is to be his. He encourages his best friend, courteous gentleman Ken, to date his sister Margarita so he gets a free hand with her flirtatious classmate Lola. The reigning salsa queen Luna\'s interest in Rico as dance-partner threatens his on-off relationship with Vicki. More jealous trouble follows when Ken and Margarita fall in true love.','/e57jcyyQYKDruSuoy7g7alsjbrd.jpg','1988-07-09',98,'Released','The Dirtiest Dancing Of Them All!','Salsa',38909,1.8785,6.9,'7RInN6TLhz4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10398,_binary '\0','/9FEsUbdKxHuPRoekodWHWlOFSzL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096037',5,4147,'en','Satisfaction','When a young rock group called The Mystery gets its first gig at a club, it\'s an opportunity to see what life is all about. Fresh out of high school, the rockers are hired by an exclusive beach resort thanks to a faded \'60s songwriter. There, they meet with romance and adventure. But street-smart lead singer Jennie Lee faces a dilemma: pursue her budding career or finish high school.','/yvLIYS4lDfsQL4khLly73cDczaM.jpg','1988-02-12',92,'Released','One Band. One Dream. One Summer.','Satisfaction',17126,2.237,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10399,_binary '\0','/ciO8veuklMJFDGjyS8KBaPEyE42.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096046',5.3,6385,'en','Scarecrows','Five men heist the Camp Pendleton payroll and kidnap a pilot and his daughter, who are forced to fly them to Mexico. Enroute a double cross has one of the thieves parachute with the loot into an abandoned farm surrounded by strange scarecrows. The rest of the team jump after their loot and their former partner. Everything happens during the course of one very dark night.','/xaUdO29mwujiz2NcicSAk4u1NIJ.jpg','1988-09-28',83,'Released','Trespassers will be violated','Scarecrows',40168,1.8368,5.185,'lAa5K-NrBqM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10400,_binary '\0','/39K04cmwBMFUuBn1aOtgmiAoXGX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096054',6.1,8785,'en','School Daze','Fraternity and sorority members clash with other students at a historically black college during homecoming weekend.','/vnfjKHcmah7ReMxLNF18JMXFgSZ.jpg','1988-02-12',121,'Released','A new comedy with music.','School Daze',36739,3.5443,5.7,'snxtT7xr-nY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10401,_binary '\0','/6Cld2xtKYfWnWK3w3gfJRRA82vd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096061',6.9,129702,'en','Scrooged','Frank Cross is a wildly successful television executive whose cold ambition and curmudgeonly nature has driven away the love of his life. But after firing a staff member on Christmas Eve, Frank is visited by a series of ghosts who give him a chance to re-evaluate his actions and right the wrongs of his past.','/uO0znfB2ZzTXA1IS7jkrjNbpkYK.jpg','1988-11-22',101,'Released','The spirits will move you in odd and hysterical ways.','Scrooged',9647,6.6409,6.786,'3YjrsSEEreY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10402,_binary '\0','/z0ALFPZjhaAQjXThyMO9b3dIrz4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096071',6.4,28797,'en','The Serpent and the Rainbow','A Harvard anthropologist is sent to Haiti to retrieve a strange powder that is said to have the power to bring human beings back from the dead. In his quest to find the miracle drug, the cynical scientist enters the rarely seen netherworld of walking zombies, blood rites and ancient curses. Based on the true life experiences of Wade Davis and filmed on location in Haiti, it\'s a frightening excursion into black magic and the supernatural.','/b7yjF5FUM2LpgjXRwDfukeFdjq4.jpg','1988-02-05',98,'Released','Don\'t Bury Me...I\'m Not Dead!','The Serpent and the Rainbow',11503,4.5383,6.415,'LNRnOcW5yqs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10403,_binary '\0','/6XbzKjQ4TFcnpAGQ8gsqcfhatFg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096073',5.8,17250,'en','The Seventh Sign','Abby is a pregnant woman with a curious new boarder in the apartment over her garage. Turns out he\'s heaven-sent and is speeding along the Apocalypse by bloodying rivers, egging on plagues and following scripture word for word.','/vAgVzkPmfe2pcgzkpoz8cZ9i9wm.jpg','1988-04-01',97,'Released','It was foretold there will be seven signs. The seventh sign will be a woman. Her hope is all we have left.','The Seventh Sign',11082,6.5153,6,'1yxCT_gSky0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10404,_binary '\0','/uuKaiG4G0Zqdl7rfSIHcXsfRkeU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096087',6,4535,'en','Shakedown','When a local drug dealer shoots a dishonest cop in self-defense, lawyer and renegade undercover cop join forces to clear him. But when their investigation leads them into a maze of greed and corruption, they learn that in a town where everything is for sale, anything can happen.','/plAXkoFiYPPB1acri2VcoiNDklL.jpg','1988-05-06',93,'Released','In a city where everyone is for sale... They\'re the best money can\'t buy.','Shakedown',38558,2.4352,5.82,'gCL6SQ8XD8Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10405,_binary '\0','/fgbtHz2boMda31gqzVfHaaixa9N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096094',6,14629,'en','She\'s Having a Baby','Jake and Kristy Briggs are newlyweds. Being young, they are perhaps a bit unprepared for the full reality of marriage and all that it (and their parents) expect from them. Do they want babies? Their parents certainly want them to. Is married life all that there is? Things certainly aren\'t helped by Jake\'s friend Davis, who always seems to turn up just in time to put a spanner in the works.','/7arFsU8I5mE7nmxff05Gpib3ZBL.jpg','1988-02-05',106,'Released','Man. Woman. Life. Death. Infinity. Tuna casserole. One movie dares to tell it all.','She\'s Having a Baby',12714,4.7353,5.9,'YoVqSVg32_g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10406,_binary '\0','/oDXHbnE2XTaGkEmlhRCXSmYlFF9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096098',6.8,16376,'en','Shoot to Kill','When a cunning murderer vanishes into the rugged mountains of the Pacific Northwest, pursuing FBI agent Warren Stantin must exchange familiar city streets for unknown wilderness trails. Completely out of his element, Stantin is forced to enlist the aid of expert tracker Jonathan Knox. It\'s a turbulent yet vital relationship they must maintain in order to survive... and one that becomes increasingly desperate when Knox\'s girlfriend Sarah becomes the killer\'s latest hostage!','/tvp2vmD7qRgrh7rjiL7qI8XYxne.jpg','1988-02-12',109,'Released','It\'s about staying alive.','Shoot to Kill',9717,3.7949,6.6,'YLSkajKIRYw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10407,_binary '\0','/hyI49UsyxEeljfjyjjXIXHQkw6V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096101',5.8,28477,'en','Short Circuit 2','Robot Johnny 5 moves to the city to help his friend Ben Jahrvi with his toy manufacturing enterprise, only to be manipulated by criminals who want to use him for their own nefarious purposes.','/vXzkNsPEA59EON5PMVXsURe8o67.jpg','1988-07-06',110,'Released','The adventures of America\'s most electric leading man continue.','Short Circuit 2',11966,6.4925,6.225,'RaKYwiYUrXI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10408,_binary '\0','/6z0SBWOlssV2Lang73WkwgtuLiA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096117',4.5,1784,'en','Slaughterhouse Rock','A man visits Alcatraz prison after having dreams about all the people who died there. When he gets there, his brother is possessed by an evil cannibal demon. The ghost of a female heavy metal singer who was killed there tries to help the man fight the monster.','/hFZzWoqOgIz5McMV4FPShhjiekC.jpg','1988-05-21',90,'Released','Alcatraz. For 39 years it held society\'s most depraved killers. Now it\'s home to something even worse...','Slaughterhouse Rock',38412,1.8687,4.4,'d5YMnfJI2d4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10409,_binary '\0','/xXXUXxjZcuRE2zExhwtYG5RBat4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096118',5.5,15323,'en','Sleepaway Camp II: Unhappy Campers','Angela Baker escapes from a mental hospital and surfaces at a summer camp as a counselor who lectures her teenage charges on proper moral behavior. Those teens who break her strict rules -- from the camp chatterbox or a sex-obsessed girl to the boys who are peeping Toms -- are murdered by the impostor in various gruesome ways. As more campers go missing, intrepid counselor Molly begins to piece together the truth.','/iXQNeUSB7pVLu4S3VRj9S3UFPrV.jpg','1988-08-26',80,'Released','She\'s back...','Sleepaway Camp II: Unhappy Campers',34311,3.6776,5.8,'-koz9LRQHIQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10410,_binary '\0','/8Z0edRCeyfA36d7RV5CDZq13Ajt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096119',5,10791,'en','Sleepaway Camp III: Teenage Wasteland','Psychotic Angela is itching to do what she does best: slaughter dozens of teenage campers. As luck would have it, the previous site of her murders has been renamed and converted into an experimental summer camp meant to bring together privileged and lower-class teens. On the day the youths are boarding the buses to camp, Angela runs over a potential camper with a garbage truck and assumes her identity. Once she has infiltrated the camp, the real terror begins.','/2YQFABNldAEdMVZOjfKUp4Ig4yp.jpg','1989-08-04',79,'Released','Angela... the angel of death is back!','Sleepaway Camp III: Teenage Wasteland',34312,4.367,5.4,'uD-rsKTl6w4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10411,_binary '\0','/v9UtQvfasBZ40kQRTF2Tzx2FnVz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096126',8.5,10643,'ru','Собачье сердце','In 1920s Moscow, shortly after the October Revolution, a stray dog named Sharik is taken in by Professor Preobrazhensky, a wealthy and respected surgeon. The professor performs a daring medical experiment on the dog that changes him into a human being. As the newly transformed Sharikov begins to navigate life in the professor’s apartment, his crude behavior and revolutionary ideas turn the household upside down.','/2kG3DWJ5OIaUZ0RtFEz6O9hEYDf.jpg','1988-11-11',136,'Released',NULL,'Heart of a Dog',43680,2.3022,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10412,_binary '\0','/eWK7RcC5h5l98q2LKK68b6R76Ir.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096142',4.9,5793,'en','Sorority Babes in the Slimeball Bowl-O-Rama','Out to steal a trophy from a local bowling alley, a group of college students accidentally unleash the imp -- a sadistic little spirit that creates demons and loves sexy women.','/2I7yv8T9rX1C1cBtJOrdOxoh7W3.jpg','1988-01-29',80,'Released','In a bowling alley from Hell, there\'s only one way to score...','Sorority Babes in the Slimeball Bowl-O-Rama',27390,2.2771,4.8,'-VHcdmh6JwA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10413,_binary '\0','/kGgLHHbFqhMLmrg5jJAuAL4gecJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096149',2.1,7626,'en','Space Mutiny','A pilot is the only hope to stop the mutiny of a spacecraft by its security crew, who plot to sell the crew of the ship into slavery.','/ziGqFxqpjpPgDYeenw8GtYctinD.jpg','1988-08-01',93,'Released','There Is Nowhere To Hide From The Enemy Within.','Space Mutiny',32148,1.7939,2.7,'ITLbGC3vAxI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10414,_binary '\0','/5yYRhmINVjW2CGkfYQvqyhaBBSi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096152',5.9,3515,'en','Spellbinder','After leaving work one night, Los Angeles attorney Jeff Mills and his colleague rescue a young, beautiful woman from an abusive boyfriend. Jeff soon becomes romantically involved with her and embroiled in the web of intrigue that follows her, despite a string of ominous happenstances and repeated warnings from his secretary.','/lthWQAcAmcJ3InuauNuCMgqEVHX.jpg','1988-09-23',99,'Released','A chance encounter. A dream come true. A man would do anything for a girl like Miranda','Spellbinder',36778,3.4161,5.81,'sN9K_whIJxg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10415,_binary '\0','/a1Vr3kMvIYqk7yOMMK23B3xDTb6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096153',4.8,1402,'en','Spellcaster','A group of people are killed one by one while participating at a million dollar treasure hunt in a mysterious Italian castle.','/39xRU4lRSIZuVvvAG35eNYmy0iw.jpg','1988-01-14',83,'Released',NULL,'Spellcaster',112525,1.6685,5.3,'wgQiYJeXZYs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10416,_binary '\0','/cNlQHf6otxOYbTTfUQBaXykFqYt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096160',7.1,1258,'it','Splendor','Splendor is the name of an old movie theater managed by Jordan, who inherited it from his father. The theater is in decay and only generates debts and trouble, but Jordan gets aid in his almost Quixotian quest from projectionist Luigi and ushurette Chantale.','/83j7YRrgNQev6lexFX7hg8RmxRc.jpg','1989-02-16',110,'Released',NULL,'Splendor',58526,1.4641,6.569,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10417,_binary '\0','/s3zPMEo34HeqCbEYFrmQg8orGqc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096161',5.3,1289,'en','Split Decisions','When a boxer is killed because he wouldn\'t take a dive, his brother tries to find a way to avenge him even if only symbolically.','/7pKZmcbByBcTK8JwsMt0cfsI37N.jpg','1988-06-11',95,'Released',NULL,'Split Decisions',93457,1.9348,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10418,_binary '\0','/gcXbxHjkUwLV4HrE2oJcbP7UGTA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096163',7.6,56156,'nl','Spoorloos','Rex and Saskia, a young couple in love, are on vacation when they stop at a busy service station. Saskia is abducted in broad daylight and three years pass with no answers or closure surrounding her disappearance. Rex has nearly given up all hope when he suddenly begins receiving letters from her abductor.','/eE5bbuRJluooG2MjEAsLEYyuJoa.jpg','1988-10-27',106,'Released','Who Has Seen This Woman?','The Vanishing',8740,4.9605,7.4,'KlO2oIieI44','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10419,_binary '\0','/hNKRqiXxDPhWCsJn5r2Q7hWRDfS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096171',6.6,5505,'en','Stealing Home','Billy Wyatt, a former high school and minor-league baseball player, receives a telephone call from his mother revealing that his former child-sitter, and later in his teens, his first love, Katie Chandler, has died. Wyatt returns home to deal with this tragedy, reminiscing over his childhood growing up with his father, Katie, and best friend Alan Appleby.','/pwl2DNSO4nnOYUTMubBC2DpMpOQ.jpg','1988-08-26',98,'Released','Stealing hearts, stealing laughs, stealing memories','Stealing Home',32331,3.881,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10420,_binary '\0','/1HFNGmvd33dEIiKkr7UOBl8u2OS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096180',6.2,5028,'en','Stormy Monday','When a corrupt American businessman tries to strong arm his way into businesses in Newcastle, England, he is thwarted by a club attendant and his waitress girlfriend.','/qYrfUdkZmGoB1QtGbYnDR2ZL8XR.jpg','1988-05-01',93,'Released','The Most Dangerous Choices Are Made With The Heart.','Stormy Monday',25497,2.4646,5.7,'gtHFmFHY074','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10421,_binary '\0','/lOn712rEdwZfDVxLTgnKCrYa7qH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096184',5.9,3223,'sv','Strul','Conny is a chemistry teacher who is framed for drug possession. Unable to prove his innocence he ends up in prison. When he finds a secret exit some inmates \"persuade\" him to participate in a heist. Things become extremely hectic as he tries to prove his innocence as well as \"helping\" his inmates. When Conny thinks that it couldn\'t possibly get any worse he meets Susanne, a policewoman...','/7c31Z66SqGrxc6GnO3JakQkVONj.jpg','1988-02-26',101,'Released','An action movie with Björn Skifs made by Jonas Frick','Framed',35327,2.1108,5.8,'ndkOthBD-No','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10422,_binary '\0','/u8nixC0Ob974xRn3c1X1S69SjrN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096189',7.2,1434,'en','A Summer Story','A young lawyer from London, Mr. Ashton, and his best friend are hiking across Dartmoor. When he twists his ankle, Ashton is forced to seek help at a nearby farmhouse and stays there for a few days. Innocent beauty Megan David catches the attention of Ashton. He decides to stay longer, and he and Megan fall in love, much to the displeasure of Megan\'s aunt and her loutish son.','/3uy8p48wyd4gBBtJKbyQPvE0nze.jpg','1988-08-11',95,'Released','For every man and every woman there is that one great love. A love that touches the heart, fires the soul, and lingers in the memory forever.','A Summer Story',123623,1.6668,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10423,_binary '\0','/3hCvw42LIde6cFnCjsW4JK4iYYH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096193',5.7,5098,'en','Sunset','Tom Mix and Wyatt Earp team up to solve a murder at the Academy Awards in 1929 Hollywood.','/hQZtPZwcVMBNoT8hrNpOFNIPQv0.jpg','1988-04-29',107,'Released','They broke every rule, loved every woman, took every risk and solved the most shocking murder in the history of Beverly Hills. And it\'s all true. Give or take a lie or two.','Sunset',38560,2.1107,5.7,'NraEv8NOqts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10424,_binary '\0','/pZoMNbZPxFVyFIFXAShxlUZpbPG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096203',5.9,4511,'en','Switching Channels','A television news chief courts his anchorwoman ex-wife with an eleventh-hour story.','/sTK6Ke7mrNPBTqA0PgkdBf4p5MQ.jpg','1988-03-05',105,'Released','There\'s a lot more going on around here than news, weather, and sports.','Switching Channels',26798,3.0091,6.1,'UmAioMISJec','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10425,_binary '\0','/bgzHRy8QPLammnR4psTDzh4gfmR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096211',5.6,2572,'en','Taffin','When a small Irish town is terrorized by a corrupt business syndicate, a lone hero wages an all out war.','/niIHSyg2Wgj3v4POepjtlMaWUtw.jpg','1988-02-26',96,'Released','He didn’t get mad… He got even.','Taffin',28975,2.1057,5.58,'3QhHuMP8rec','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10426,_binary '\0','/1IQHNxKpanAHBv6MinIBQwkewEV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096218',6.6,1622,'en','Tales from the Gimli Hospital','While their mother is dying in the modern Gimli, Manitoba hospital, two young children are told an important tale by their Icelandic grandmother about Einar the lonely, his friend Gunnar, and the angelic Snjofrieder in a Gimli of old.','/xdiM4mEaY1KJepNJ48hr63jjbIB.jpg','1988-04-15',64,'Released','It all happened in a Gimli we no longer know.','Tales from the Gimli Hospital',41967,1.3175,5.9,'epRtPpBFayY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10427,_binary '\0','/sWYGSwasBPCi3HgZKgqEDF5MF4Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096219',7.2,15734,'en','Talk Radio','A rude, contemptuous talk show host becomes overwhelmed by the hatred that surrounds his program just before it goes national.','/e9dnVJMg3LW80sHnsuBoTBwJgRm.jpg','1988-12-23',109,'Released','The last neighborhood in America.','Talk Radio',10132,3.4478,7.1,'M5E9RV9TyEo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10428,_binary '\0','/nYdtHkaOTA3bDTb8YChE4nLq397.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096223',5.7,4584,'en','Tapeheads','The story of Ivan and Josh, two dimwitted ex-security guards who love music videos. Out of work, with no job prospects, they form a music video production company. They soon learn the ins and outs of the business in LA, and with some help from Mo Fuzz, they soon become hot property. But not all goes smoothly when they try to resurrect the career of their favorite R&B duo, the Swanky Modes.','/aVNP2JdzqKaqvOzBcYvI4s68rKY.jpg','1988-10-21',93,'Released','A FAST FORWARD MUSIC COMEDY.','Tapeheads',25447,1.9525,5.4,'IWfGv4MsaJs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10429,_binary '\0','/8TcLT2gSyGemEFOIrENaayYoggM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096236',6.8,1472,'cn','特警屠龍','Something fishy is going on in the anti-Drug Trafficking Unit of the HK Police, and only a few honest cops know that the corruption goes all the way to the top. However, they must prove their case quickly, and by unconventional means, after they are framed for murder and drug-trafficking themselves. Dodging bullets from cops and criminals alike, the race is on to clear their names, protect their loved ones, and bring their corrupt colleagues to justice.','/3evbtScpCceIFxWOc9cIZ1mMhX7.jpg','1988-07-28',92,'Released',NULL,'Tiger Cage',58409,2.0138,6.5,'D2sAIG8qKtM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10430,_binary '\0','/4di5IW8cYOsy1A95d4TEdNdRwOH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096243',6.8,2349,'en','The Tenth Man','During World War 2 the Germans arrested people at random off the streets of Paris and in retaliation to sabotage by the resistance announced the execution of one in ten prisoners. Chosen as one of the victims, lawyer Chavel trades his place with another man in return for all his possessions. At the end of the war he returns to his house and tries to integrate himself with the family of the man who traded places with him, all the while hiding his true identity. However matters are complicated when a stranger arrives claiming to be Chavel.','/xTQL6sw8waCWynVpRmS10zNVQMg.jpg','1988-12-04',100,'Released',NULL,'The Tenth Man',109669,2.2194,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10431,_binary '\0','/A58HGJ5aXf9dKIXmeSv41NSCDPN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096244',6.1,36621,'en','Tequila Sunrise','In a seaside California town, best friends Mac and Nick are on opposite sides of the law. Mac is a former drug dealer trying to clean up his act, while Nick is a high-profile detective trying to take down a Mexican drug lord named Carlos. Soon Nick\'s loyalties are put to the test when he begins an affair with restaurateur Jo Ann -- a love interest of Mac\'s -- unwittingly leading his friend into a police-orchestrated trap.','/8LoG0GL5N5e7zvvXezwwGnUfRHL.jpg','1988-12-02',115,'Released','A business on the line. A friendship on the edge. A woman caught in the middle.','Tequila Sunrise',10396,5.3338,6.061,'WWO1byHI26U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10432,_binary '\0','/bWBgtHebpmQI3ATpZkoMWe54TgT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096246',4.7,2778,'en','The Terror Within','Experiments in biological warfare have destroyed all but a few remnants of the human race. Alone in a lab, eight students work feverishly to create a vaccine before they are forced outside in search for food. It is then that the surviving scientists discover creatures mutated by the plague. Now they prepare to do battle against their worst fear: The Terror Within.','/rJRd9qUoNpW0BOcYcZRLhvZS1z.jpg','1989-01-20',90,'Released','It Wants To Get Out!','The Terror Within',29345,2.0275,4.5,'q6I8biEDxI4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10433,_binary '\0','/xt75NSIlfzwPwuBsuarB3i1mBxj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096251',6.9,29525,'ja','鉄男','A \"metal fetishist\", driven mad by the maggots wriggling in the wound he\'s made to embed metal into his flesh, runs out into the night and is accidentally run down by a Japanese businessman and his girlfriend. The pair dispose of the corpse in hopes of quietly moving on with their lives. However, the businessman soon finds that he is now plagued by a vicious curse that transforms his flesh into iron.','/lARc59hUAKW3ziWddftUnZ99R8c.jpg','1989-07-01',67,'Released',NULL,'Tetsuo: The Iron Man',41428,3.722,7,'LP8xB94Epd4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10434,_binary '\0','/opbsQApZHcXl6R2swKZC3sHJYXA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096252',6.9,2816,'hi','Tezaab','After his parents are killed, Mahesh\'s life is ruined as he gets imprisoned and separated from Mohini, who suffers due to her cruel father. Mahesh returns to save Mohini and settle old scores.','/6AQ0dIsxNKGlFlV4zhCdS9pp6Ij.jpg','1988-11-11',174,'Released',NULL,'Tezaab',61271,1.2543,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10435,_binary '\0','/bwyLycDaQdS3rS4crpbYssYLJRy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096256',7.2,167127,'en','They Live','A lone drifter stumbles upon a unique pair of sunglasses that reveal aliens are systematically gaining control of the Earth by masquerading as humans and lulling the public into submission.','/ngnybFTuopfbfmmEeX9jjBQQmF6.jpg','1988-11-04',93,'Released','You see them on the street. You watch them on TV. You might even vote for one this fall. You think they\'re people just like you. You\'re wrong. Dead wrong.','They Live',8337,12.0891,7.311,'vSVQ975eTBI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10436,_binary '\0','/9ndhlUu1VQ44pX5dVFo5Y19KqAl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096257',7.9,26399,'en','The Thin Blue Line','An unorthodox investigation into the wrongful conviction of Randall Dale Adams for the 1976 murder of Dallas police officer Robert Wood. Using stylized reenactments and interviews with key figures, conflicting testimonies and evidence are presented to argue that Adams was framed by a corrupt justice system, ultimately leading to his exoneration.','/4w4BJk3l8y9gYwPPLRs6uPHOmGL.jpg','1988-08-28',103,'Released','Erases the border between art and activism.','The Thin Blue Line',14285,3.8474,7.7,'MzZROKde8Nc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10437,_binary '\0','/lzq2B01WiKCF1oXjxCaIGhomTxd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096259',7,4436,'en','Things Change','Jerry, a misfit Mafia henchman, is assigned the low-level job of keeping an eye on Gino, a shoe repairman fingered by the Mob to confess to a murder he didn\'t commit. But Gino\'s mistaken for a Mafia boss, and the two are suddenly catapulted to the highest levels of mobster status. Only friendship will see them through this dangerous adventure alive!','/xKjGI2AAg5UHaBvVVR7oI865Zth.jpg','1988-10-21',100,'Released','Dealing with the mob is always a gamble.','Things Change',52770,2.4132,6.2,'Pm_vqahGYM0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10438,_binary '\0','/oDUDO6N5MyK358V3ZMpDZidITqu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096267',4.7,1253,'en','Tiger Warsaw','Chuck brought sorrow to his family when he shot his father who is now a semi-invalid. After 15 years of self destruction, he returns home to seek forgiveness.','/5aMoJCN2VsVFHksMfJ2vyJiRO7H.jpg','1988-05-11',93,'Released','Years ago he shattered his life. Now he\'s back to pick up the pieces.','Tiger Warsaw',116635,2.2354,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10439,_binary '\0','/bGBHVnde3HQ7WIkWxA1tcHQKU9m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096280',6.1,1787,'en','To Kill a Priest','A young priest speaks out against the Communist regime in Poland and is killed for it.','/ogfmZi2EtQUTTdc85g7N86HkK8R.jpg','1988-09-07',117,'Released',NULL,'To Kill a Priest',47493,2.4908,6.2,'8c82OU4LvsA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10440,_binary '\0','/h3GeBgDseft6nTyzRQPx5TaUFsC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096282',6.7,1270,'en','Tommy Tricker and the Stamp Traveller','When the joker Tommy Tricker plays some practical jokes on some of his friends, his best friend Ralph, a stamp collector, discovers the secret of \"stamp travel\" to make him travel around the world on a stamp to bring back the mysterious Charles Merriweather, who never returned on a stamp for 75 years.','/3lmyqrYZrSG78RgtMDNm72AtnvQ.jpg','1988-12-08',105,'Released','Running to a theatre near you, December 16th.','Tommy Tricker and the Stamp Traveller',32038,2.1258,6,'JRwGpSPTFQk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10441,_binary '\0','/zkThiZAaAie8Lw7RAc5yPTOewBV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096283',8.1,439798,'ja','となりのトトロ','Two sisters move to the country with their father in order to be closer to their hospitalized mother, and discover the surrounding trees are inhabited by Totoros, magical spirits of the forest. When the youngest runs away from home, the older sister seeks help from the spirits to find her.','/rtGDOeG9LzoerkDGZF9dnVeLppL.jpg','1988-04-16',86,'Released','He\'s your friendly neighbourhood forest spirit!','My Neighbor Totoro',8392,20.921,8.068,'I0103wkhQ-c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10442,_binary '\0','/aU5eWmxfzuNIFJFOZZI0uwTUzDa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096288',7.9,11437,'el','Τοπίο στην ομίχλη','Two Greek children embark on a journey to search for their father, who supposedly lives in Germany.','/icNqzWxjwXuD6FSRtTWNj8sa5B1.jpg','1988-09-10',125,'Released',NULL,'Landscape in the Mist',47795,3.853,7.6,'7TdoJWHnaLM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10443,_binary '\0','/oDGXonGryIJ38XgPSRC3NfYQ6lg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096289',7.8,8363,'en','Torch Song Trilogy','Arnold Beckoff is looking for love and acceptance, but as a gay man working as a female impersonator in 1970s New York City, neither come easily. After a series of heartaches, Arnold believes he has found the love of his life in Alan, and the couple make plans to adopt. But when tragedy strikes, Arnold\'s life is shaken to its very core, leading to a confrontation with his overbearing mother, who has never approved of her son\'s lifestyle.','/uoMiWYfycupTa7PxJ1XUwqnN6gO.jpg','1988-12-14',120,'Released','It takes a lot of guts and a helluva sense of humor to live life in Arnold\'s shoes.','Torch Song Trilogy',8463,2.8884,7.4,'rdmPoTTbigw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10444,_binary '\0','/cmaNiYrqiSnYRD5P4nblY3Oau2D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096294',5.8,2779,'en','Track 29','Years after a desperate teenage Linda gives up her baby for adoption, she finds herself face-to-face with Martin, a young man claiming to be her long-lost son. Linda embraces Martin and in him finds a welcome reprieve from her unhappy marriage to the neglectful Henry. But soon Martin grows violent and becomes obsessed with Henry -- a philandering man whose only offspring is an expansive model train set that devours his waking hours.','/u1gTB8VWIdPM8nkFhOctl8h1LV2.jpg','1988-05-15',86,'Released','Was he her dream or obsession? Was she his mother or his lover?','Track 29',41974,2.306,5.6,'PAszjRTHeUk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10445,_binary '\0','/xZq2ICYw5qCnvDRPxgI1J1UZadk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096310',5.5,2748,'en','Troma\'s War','A small group of typical Tromaville citizens find themselves in the path of a terrorist army controlled by the power elite...','/5juN2j8A2IJo34YrleEMvCJimDz.jpg','1988-12-09',105,'Released',NULL,'Troma\'s War',28173,1.1658,5.412,'kOXHgy7x1Nc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10446,_binary '\0','/evVZ3tKKOQ9gxwTGRQRZxh12MGB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096316',6.9,22862,'en','Tucker: The Man and His Dream','Ypsilanti, Michigan, 1945. Engineer Preston Tucker dreams of designing the car of future, but his innovative envision will be repeatedly sabotaged by his own unrealistic expectations and the Detroit automobile industry tycoons.','/uph7wz8WASLHwHyC5SYfQgqaoV7.jpg','1988-08-12',111,'Released','When they tried to buy him, he refused. When they tried to bully him, he resisted. When they tried to break him, he became an American legend. The true story of Preston Tucker.','Tucker: The Man and His Dream',28176,4.7074,6.743,'ZokjNUOEkEM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10447,_binary '\0','/sAtK99PjOX1IzDUV24N2nab803R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096320',6.2,151002,'en','Twins','Julius and Vincent Benedict are the results of an experiment that would allow for the perfect child. Julius was planned and grows to athletic proportions. Vincent is an accident and is somewhat smaller in stature. Vincent is placed in an orphanage while Julius is taken to a south seas island and raised by philosophers. Vincent becomes the ultimate low life and is about to be killed by loan sharks.','/stJx9BQZbXrZnTGf9Erc7d2UMVc.jpg','1988-12-09',107,'Released','Only their mother can tell them apart.','Twins',9493,8.3094,6.056,'eRdcL2qKt6k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10448,_binary '\0','/5mbISmHyRyA3Lix0dWd3a7UXPQG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096321',5.2,2550,'en','Twister','An oddball family on a Kansas farm are trapped in their farmhouse by an impending storm. The patriarch of the clan is a retired soda pop tycoon. He is currently dating a children\'s TV evangelist. Also living at the farm is his layabout daughter and her precocious 8 year old daughter, his would-be artist son, the son\'s fiancée, and the black maid. Also thrown into the mix is the daughter\'s ex-husband, a ne-er-do-well who is seeking to get back in his ex-wife\'s good graces.','/f3Wf4mR6SmqzLae7extudBfpL4b.jpg','1989-06-30',94,'Released','A Comic Adventure In Windy Living','Twister',77780,2.7014,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10449,_binary '\0','/yIf7O6Pnc8cMT2myAEZ8mcGlHge.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096324',5.1,7319,'en','Two Moon Junction','A young Southern débutante temporarily abandons her posh lifestyle and upcoming, semi-arranged marriage to have a lustful and erotic fling with a rugged drifter who works at a local carnival.','/g3KQuCGX7ISTQ0EPyieGeH7M4L0.jpg','1988-04-29',104,'Released','What\'s love got to do with it','Two Moon Junction',5241,4.7181,6.1,'xax38BVMCUM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10450,_binary '\0','/3g1AsieuHpGEhGSJNgzz7hXoCEy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096328',7.6,6432,'en','U2: Rattle and Hum','A concert movie on an unprecedented scale, Rattle And Hum captures U2 - on and off the stage - during their triumphant Joshua Tree tour. From the giant technicolour stadium celebrations to the black-and-white intensity of the indoor shows, this is U2 at their best. Follow the group across America, exploring new influences, playing with the legendary B.B. King from Dublin to Graceland.','/h78np6cU2cZCs9YPpvP5vz0SA7f.jpg','1988-11-03',98,'Released',NULL,'U2: Rattle and Hum',18161,1.9137,7.1,'MSrDZO3Ho5I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10451,_binary '\0','/hGeghWhxZVp6sVmITJTSKiya8QN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096329',7.8,2363,'ru','Убить дракона','Dragon is a bloody dictator, who kills every opponent. People live hopelessly, until Lancelot comes to save the beautiful Elsa. Lancelot can only win, if all people become free from fear, that is feeding the Dragon\'s power. Dragon\'s multiple personalities, ranging from a \"dragon\" to a \"samurai\" to a \"Nazi\", scare the hell out of all people, except Lancelot. Finally Dragon drops all his masks, to become the most dangerous of his incarnations - \"himself\". And the battle begins','/9wcSIyPe3MmFKL0JwOfmg505BF1.jpg','1988-11-11',123,'Released',NULL,'To Kill a Dragon',27942,1.1176,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10452,_binary '\0','/wru4lC7aK4BYJzxAOoDI0vlfXL7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096332',7.2,41043,'en','The Unbearable Lightness of Being','Successful surgeon Tomas leaves Prague for an operation, meets a young photographer named Tereza, and brings her back with him. Tereza is surprised to learn that Tomas is already having an affair with the bohemian Sabina, but when the Soviet invasion occurs, all three flee to Switzerland. Sabina begins an affair, Tom continues womanizing, and Tereza, disgusted, returns to Czechoslovakia. Realizing his mistake, Tomas decides to chase after her.','/g1kPEwATsCI8DnGx6ViAhUVKQSI.jpg','1988-02-05',171,'Released','A lovers’ story.','The Unbearable Lightness of Being',10644,6.8754,6.836,'UyxFXH0kzmE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10453,_binary '\0','/uVyHoOtk7N1e3aEoHIuJbT6IBJg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096336',7.5,6467,'fr','Une affaire de femmes','France, World War II. In order to somehow make ends meet, the mother of two children, Marie Latour, does underground abortions and rents a room to a familiar prostitute. She doesn\'t pay any attention to her husband, who returned from the war because of his injury, and lives her own life. Abortions gradually begin to bring a good income, and boredom can be easily dispelled by starting up with a young lover.','/gIBOAemklR8MVYP0Vn5RE0MYYWT.jpg','1988-09-14',108,'Released',NULL,'Story of Women',41975,3.049,7.3,'lyUi4u541ro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10454,_binary '\0','/2UXZzAu7NyEvdPMmpx2hbaIdJbh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096340',5.1,2274,'en','The Unholy','A priest battles a demon that kills sinners in the act of sinning.','/oPyGrEVmjtt1NiPunNDyjE1SVNh.jpg','1988-04-22',102,'Released','Seduction. Submission. Murder. Tonight... evil goes over the edge.','The Unholy',86680,3.2492,5.4,'3gsOOv1DNEo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10455,_binary '\0','/ecZN1pCJeWAhYHrn0Oa5WGEIhjc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096344',4.8,3609,'en','The Unnamable','Students from Miskatonic University decide to spend the night in the Winthrop house, a spot widely believed to have been haunted for the past 300 years, ever since Joshua Winthrop was horribly murdered and mutilated by the hideous creature born of his wife.','/6A5cb9mMUkezHXs3iSYHRw1FyHv.jpg','1988-06-01',87,'Released','There are things on God\'s Earth that we can\'t explain and we can\'t describe.','The Unnamable',40549,2.1572,4.6,'C8sAQdGrSOc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10456,_binary '\0','/pk4cxGnzOTvQ20N3FnNRu5zgl6A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096376',6,2538,'en','A Very Brady Christmas','Almost 20 years after the start of the original \"Brady Bunch\" the kids are grown up and have kids of their own. Everyone is having a wonderful time back at the family house for Christmas, until Mike learns of a structural problem in one of the buildings he designed. As he is inspecting the problem, the building collapses, trapping him inside. As the whole family waits by the pile of rubble, they fear the worst. Will Dad be all right?','/o3F7vQJYKeDJoVJXBrQS5H2D1za.jpg','1988-12-18',94,'Released',NULL,'A Very Brady Christmas',49358,2.0906,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10457,_binary '\0','/v5GHcSnIKWCjcIn9dGp8iLgelXa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096378',5.7,5762,'en','Vibes','Medium Sylvia Pickel and psychometrist Nick Deezy meet at a psychic research facility in New York. Not long after, they\'re contacted by Harry Buscafusco, who offers them $50,000 to find his lost son in South America, in the heart of Incan territory where they discover an ancient mystical secret, and each other.','/yAT8QJquco2dGBEwqQJBLfP7wtM.jpg','1988-08-05',99,'Released','The psychic comedy that\'s out of its mind.','Vibes',21185,2.4827,5.6,'rKSpTTL1Bvc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10458,_binary '\0','/indT0Jfms3lN4nDFuRSSSdpCQ6s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096380',6,11291,'en','Vice Versa','A mysterious oriental skull transforms a father into his son, and vice versa.','/6XOY24NV30EI62sqsCOlmZdmKfh.jpg','1988-02-25',98,'Released','Just when he was ready for mid-life crisis, something unexpected came up. Puberty.','Vice Versa',26603,4.4581,5.8,'nR_WJ-SjctM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10459,_binary '\0','/veVadjT1OFnU34KOupKy8pUFp7o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096386',6.8,5195,'fr','La vie est un long fleuve tranquille','Two babies are switched at birth. When the mistake is discovered 12 years later, it leads to complications in the lives of both families. One family is affluent, with dutiful and (apparently) contented children. The other family is poor, with rambunctious (even delinquent) children, often hungry, but with lots of laughter in the house.','/nYLueszPL3jydtdyXY0f6rNeFA5.jpg','1988-02-03',90,'Released','Those Two families should never have met','Life Is a Long Quiet River',4271,2.0723,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10460,_binary '\0','/pC4gylUWA74b19ZdnZ2Q3awX5yr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096402',5.2,1942,'en','Voyage of the Rock Aliens','Aliens land in the mythical town of \"Speelburgh, U.S.A\" searching for the source of rock & roll. What they find is a gang of teenagers, led by Dee Dee and Frankie, along with Frankie\'s posse/rock band, the Pack. The leader of the aliens takes a shine to Dee Dee and all sorts of trouble breaks out.','/yLcacYupUbApAZyCeouGd5pLJB5.jpg','1984-03-09',97,'Released','Is it a bird? Is it a plane? No, it\'s a Rock Alien!','Voyage of the Rock Aliens',38265,2.8019,4.8,'5ZGOsJa0HHg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10461,_binary '\0','/5Zb7JrcOggfcPKMEpJ781MVgbxb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096403',9,2631,'bg','Време разделно','In the 17th century, a Bulgarian Christian region is selected by the Ottoman rulers to serve as an example of conversion to Islam. A Janissary who was kidnapped from the village as a boy is sent to force the reluctant inhabitants to convert. The Turkish governor seeks a peaceful solution, but ultimately torture, violence, and rebellion break out.','/9WlHXGwybZQodaVJhVlaix1gdaP.jpg','1988-03-28',288,'Released',NULL,'Time of Violence',48879,1.0922,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10462,_binary '\0','/1rBjjrKbBB9T81O1jyY67hNH8fe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096409',6.7,5056,'en','Walker','William Walker and his mercenary corps enter Nicaragua in the middle of the 19th century in order to install a new government by a coup d\'etat.','/1C0oYAeNjIBLuj7CVWz3HTIUdeP.jpg','1987-12-04',95,'Released','Before Rambo... Before Oliver North...','Walker',28448,2.4959,6.5,'Nn45GsPoZrc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10463,_binary '\0','/hYy3cB5lYOi2mGtZXDaLFF1L7qe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096425',5.4,5720,'en','Watchers','A boy takes in a stray dog, later finding out that it\'s an ultra-intelligent runaway from a genetic research lab. Unbeknownst to him, the dog is being stalked by another escaped creature that\'s not quite so friendly.','/fOOsMzORvtoQbFzKEXcPWpJsUm7.jpg','1988-12-02',91,'Released','It started as a secret experiment... It ended up as a new breed of terror.','Watchers',33172,3.1796,5.3,'DUaItM3mkHI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10464,_binary '\0','/x0sEJCg6UsLoGs8r9b4l8rp1oxe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096426',6.1,15829,'en','Waxwork','Wealthy slacker Mark, his new girlfriend Sarah, and their friends, are invited to a special showing at a mysterious wax museum which displays eighteen of the most evil men of all time. After his ex-girlfriend and another friend disappear, Mark becomes suspicious…','/48RXt1Zu8iNL0mgCojydmqBsjsC.jpg','1988-06-17',97,'Released','Stop on by and give afterlife a try.','Waxwork',29095,4.7,6.2,'yjCjSoF72oE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10465,_binary '\0','/udIE8Cdon9wnYmVIOFYrBPfA2Mq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096438',7.7,235284,'en','Who Framed Roger Rabbit','Toon star Roger is worried that his wife Jessica is playing pattycake with someone else, so the studio hires detective Eddie Valiant to snoop on her. But the stakes are quickly raised when Marvin Acme is found dead and Roger is the prime suspect.','/lYfRc57Kx9VgLZ48iulu0HKnM15.jpg','1988-06-22',104,'Released','It\'s the story of a man, a woman, and a rabbit in a triangle of trouble.','Who Framed Roger Rabbit',856,13.8274,7.5,'XEIJpS26aAw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10466,_binary '\0','/3sF6AibdbTTkswfSRxXEGCt5w6s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096446',7.2,139395,'en','Willow','The evil Queen Bavmorda hunts the newborn princess Elora Danan, a child prophesied to bring about her downfall. When the royal infant is found by Willow, a timid farmer and aspiring sorcerer, he\'s entrusted with delivering her from evil.','/pAIRGMIdN7ZdZhflazdV2ezuJ9f.jpg','1988-05-20',126,'Released','A world where heroes come in all sizes and adventure is the greatest magic of all.','Willow',847,8.0326,7.012,'9KhFp9fqrHc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10467,_binary '\0','/wsu3LmI11VEwWsooN0v7zY1u3sI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096453',4.4,2704,'en','La casa 4','A student and her photographer boyfriend visit an island off of Massachusetts to research a hotel supposedly haunted by a witch.','/rrXE92wmEPOrjAfGhjvjBGc2GRq.jpg','1988-12-01',95,'Released','It can seduce your soul','Witchcraft (Evil Encounters)',4457,1.986,5,'lcsxFcSZwbY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10468,_binary '\0','/xQQsgdVRBqM8zwWTxWMCOiNiw9x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096454',6.9,12224,'en','Without a Clue','Sherlock Holmes is as dashing as ever, but with a little secret: Dr. Watson is the brains behind the operation. When Reginald Kincaid, the actor he has hired to play Holmes becomes insufferable, Watson fires him and tries to go out on his own, but finds that he has done too good a job building Holmes up in the public\'s mind.','/uZmoKYDfF965UAgPrUSz0FbavsE.jpg','1988-05-05',107,'Released','The flip side of Sherlock Holmes','Without a Clue',12582,3.7971,6.7,'lWXw-QZDdNo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10469,_binary '\0','/tEqeyPPBJfyDJl0lO08YiqefYqd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096461',7,14448,'cn','旺角卡門','Mid-level gangster Wah falls in love with his beautiful cousin, but must also continue to protect his volatile partner-in-crime and friend, Fly.','/5xMtbxqRXOMO0ovvhAyU4y4JI1E.jpg','1988-06-09',98,'Released',NULL,'As Tears Go By',24163,3.8104,7,'sGPv0lE1V9w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10470,_binary '\0','/lRWIiRSOMH7qQT6UGcmx8Uykix3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096463',6.8,68716,'en','Working Girl','When a secretary\'s idea is stolen by her boss, she takes a risky chance to reclaim it by impersonating him and running the project from his position.','/q2jfFzZvAzjTaArQR0tjilIZ5aJ.jpg','1988-12-20',114,'Released','For anyone who\'s ever won. For anyone who\'s ever lost. And for everyone who\'s still in there trying.','Working Girl',3525,7.3903,6.605,'va1UqFivi6A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10471,_binary '\0','/y2IHNomsqj5pNFDS8gDcPnfoPJS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096464',7,1979,'en','A World Apart','A White enclave in Johannesburg, South Africa, in the 1960s. Molly Roth, 13 years old, is the daughter of leftist parents, and she must piece together what\'s happening around her when her father disappears one night, barely evading arrest, and, not long after, her mother is detained by the authorities. Some of Molly\'s White friends turn against her, and her family\'s friendships with Blacks take on new meaning. Relationships are fragile in the world of apartheid. How will she manage?','/rLo4PwbuT3C7k2VxAGbMQU1aINp.jpg','1988-06-17',113,'Released','South Africa, 1963. A mother\'s love. A family\'s courage.','A World Apart',41949,1.6681,6.4,'cu9iAXav7bU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10472,_binary '\0','/7WFLGDqV1l0Ie5N0FrOMLNndiux.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096465',5.1,1257,'en','World Gone Wild','In the nuclear ravaged wasteland of Earth 2087 water is as precious as life itself. The isolated Lost Wells outpost survived the holocaust and the inhabitants guard the source of their existence. Now an evil cult of renegades want control of their valuable water supply. And the villagers are no match for such brute military force. Only one man can help the stricken community - a mercenary living in a distance cannibal city. But even he, and his strange henchmen, may not be able to survive in the world gone wild.','/gJ5iqjzIKfMCtVq5xBl1n9myuf4.jpg','1987-10-01',95,'Released','Fifty years after the end of the world, the only ones left are nuked out, zoned-out burnouts. The wildest adventure of all is about to begin.','World Gone Wild',38141,2.0911,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10473,_binary '\0','/ke8MuTHVveodT0YQxV1TcTh4BXd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096486',5.3,9729,'en','Young Einstein','Albert Einstein is the son of a Tasmanian apple farmer, who discovers the secret of splitting the beer atom to put the bubbles back into beer. When Albert travels to Sydney to patent his invention he meets beatuiful French scientist Marie Curie, as well as several unscrupulous types who try to take advantage of the naive genius and his invention.','/6D4yLH2gMBt8S64f8Arrt39cFFb.jpg','1988-12-15',91,'Released','The Incredible Untold Story of the Greatest Mind of All Time.','Young Einstein',10001,1.8793,5.2,'dEL_BT_Z6Yg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10474,_binary '\0','/AoFo9HeJU7jiHAUNawpwhs3zQbd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096487',6.8,74766,'en','Young Guns','A group of young gunmen, led by Billy the Kid, become deputies to avenge the murder of the rancher who became their benefactor. But when Billy takes their authority too far, they become the hunted.','/3AgCq7xY1rHRAAn0iVcnNr2OWL.jpg','1988-08-12',107,'Released','Six reasons why the west was wild.','Young Guns',11967,9.9117,6.7,'2OAF9_lUryk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10475,_binary '\0','/kHOxb8mD1aYgoRzixEPFFYre1Ux.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096507',5.7,2252,'cn','中華英雄','Jet, a young soldier at the end of the Second World War must overcome some abusive Americans who are bullying him as well as the Chinese people.','/cXWSVoL3WrzRhjN5AfWY9kXMBWG.jpg','1988-02-16',92,'Released','Once upon a time in China, a new hero emerged...','Born to Defence',15770,3.3561,6.3,'HWRY_VJzxPA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10476,_binary '\0','/sYGV4GBS7feI2H95QDB7D6XeSQ6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096511',4.9,6062,'it','Zombi 3','When a terrorist\'s body, infected with a stolen chemical, is recovered by the US military, the corpse is cremated, unintentionally releasing a virus and bacteria into the atmosphere over a small island.','/wrDsu509h1gIZdtna9rmpGaOLdy.jpg','1988-06-01',95,'Released',NULL,'Zombie Flesh Eaters 2',34814,2.0857,5.2,'3p4YCWNv2-o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10477,_binary '\0','/7750THD8ryYj5nIMx3IPIIzy0eR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096517',6.6,2202,'fr','À gauche en sortant de l’ascenseur','Yan is a successful artist. One day he is waiting for his date Florence to turn up at his apartment. As the doorbell rings, he finds another young woman in underwear on his doorstep: his neighbor Eva! She tells him she locked herself out of her apartment and insists that he helps her. Whilst Yan is trying to enter Eva\'s apartment via their adjoining balcony, his phone rings. It is Florence, and she is not impressed when a female voice answers the phone. At this point, Eva\'s rabidly jealous boyfriend Boris returns home. Seeing Yan in his apartment, he deduces that Eva has been having an affair behind his back. Florence then turns up and Yan tries in vain to explain the situation. By chance, Florence\'s husband suddenly puts in an appearance. After that, it all starts to get a bit complicated.','/f545ywREytB7X4NtksT6w7p0zvJ.jpg','1988-08-31',83,'Released',NULL,'Door on the Left as You Leave the Elevator',39422,2.8026,6.196,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10478,_binary '\0','/5nNwnV1iqDr7I0oKhi55g7q2mqq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096523',5.8,2699,'fr','L\'étudiante','An ambitious teaching student\'s finals studies are interrupted by a passionate affair with a jazz musician.','/tDx9zW0Edb83qh9PAGrgP3Zh9RP.jpg','1988-10-05',100,'Released',NULL,'The Student',52286,3.4497,5.854,'hM4Ctg51IeY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10479,_binary '\0','/pyeknyOKRLBd4ROOeYL6kV103ov.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096734',6.8,93473,'en','The \'Burbs','When secretive new neighbors move in next door, suburbanite Ray Peterson and his friends let their paranoia get the best of them as they start to suspect the newcomers of evildoings and commence an investigation. But it\'s hardly how Ray, who much prefers drinking beer, reading his newspaper and watching a ball game on the tube expected to spend his vacation.','/jwYKzJS0C3A711hmg1G4ptI0InF.jpg','1989-02-17',102,'Released','He\'s a man of peace in a savage land... Suburbia.','The \'Burbs',11974,8.379,6.8,'cJ7bZpwzNfg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10480,_binary '\0','/eUwjXePwAoh7S9Ly8Eo2Vla4L5d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096741',6.4,3372,'fr','36.15 code Père Noël','Thomas de Frémont, a precocious child obsessed with action films, sets himself up for a terrifying Christmas Eve after he unwittingly makes contact with a deranged psychopath who claims he\'s Santa Claus.','/3XcvA3QElu0oqEO9xTVGsrKQQIe.jpg','1990-01-17',88,'Released','When the world of childhood encounters that of horror.','Dial Code Santa Claus',46959,2.433,5.963,'RoqQ0dcrK0Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10481,_binary '\0','/lv8vz7uSzEMDiwgpCUB3O4d8eqH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096744',6.7,2249,'en','84 Charlie Mopic','An Army cameraman is embedded with a reconnaissance patrol and charts their mission across territory controlled by the North Vietnamese.','/vu5zyYcQlUJmGJzzUnrrXKsxnKd.jpg','1989-03-22',90,'Released','You\'ll be more than a witness...','84 Charlie Mopic',55149,2.0141,6.256,'yrc3U4X2aZ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10482,_binary '\0','/mW6XzxelLY8T2oW2NjciG9LpZT5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096754',7.5,210715,'en','The Abyss','A civilian oil rig crew is recruited to conduct a search and rescue effort when a nuclear submarine mysteriously sinks. One diver soon finds himself on a spectacular odyssey 25,000 feet below the ocean\'s surface where he confronts a mysterious force that has the power to change the world or destroy it.','/2dCit3XAtv9KWCJvRKdPkJ0FAkH.jpg','1989-08-09',140,'Released','When you get there, you will understand.','The Abyss',2756,13.5117,7.359,'7cCVYAcIIAo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10483,_binary '\0','/mBh3NXCkSCasZGovzAuc9UlFCru.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096764',7.1,60310,'en','The Adventures of Baron Munchausen','An account of Baron Munchausen\'s supposed travels and fantastical experiences with his band of misfits.','/oiOwGRqwrKpg1EMUlPgRjVC49bn.jpg','1988-12-07',126,'Released','Remarkable. Unbelievable. Impossible. And true.','The Adventures of Baron Munchausen',14506,7.6308,6.979,'vuqBKiKycbA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10484,_binary '\0','/84EHUNZIxdIYI9D3umPyR58c3x9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096769',5.5,2923,'en','After Midnight','A college professor teaching a course called \"The Psychology of Fear\" brings his students (including a psychic) to his home, one dark and stormy night to tell scary stories. The first involves a young couple whose car breaks down by an old, abandoned house. The second has four trendy teenage girls getting lost in a bad part of town and chased by a pack of vicious dogs. Last, a woman on crutches confronting a stalker at the answering service where she works the night shift.','/8IYYw7b3tbizUr7FDWTVNUIj6i6.jpg','1989-11-03',90,'Released','Terror Has No Curfew.','After Midnight',66192,2.0677,5.7,'X_y0J6siKTw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10485,_binary '\0','/zrACZMzuVwPVbejUOw0PKnsqTrT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096786',3.3,2015,'en','Alienator','A space commander sends a female android to Earth to destroy an escaped convict.','/3kem76xYVBDp1P8j8et545lwoAH.jpg','1990-02-08',93,'Released','An android hunter from outer space is about to create hell on earth.','Alienator',86094,2.5358,3.6,'SeuigfKWKJA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10486,_binary '\0','/haJ6SsjxfhSRG61LMy4QJWxCNAb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096787',6.8,50147,'en','All Dogs Go to Heaven','When a casino-owning dog named Charlie is murdered by his rival Carface, he finds himself in Heaven. Wanting to get back at his killer, he cons his way back to the living with the warning that doing so damns him to Hell. Once back, he teams with his old partner, Itchy, to prep his retaliation. He stumbles upon an orphan girl who can talk to the animals, thus allowing him to get the inside info on the races to ensure his wins to finance his plans. However, all the while, he is still haunted by nightmares of what\'s waiting for him on the other side unless he can prove that he is worthy of Heaven again.','/nmWh1NglDinfkHD9zCNqGWyhl7Q.jpg','1989-11-17',84,'Released','But not all dogs stay there!','All Dogs Go to Heaven',11497,9.5617,6.8,'fhRvSKLbM-0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10487,_binary '\0','/pIb1CLl08DxciZXJr7AK4qmkArA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096794',6.4,35951,'en','Always','The spirit of a recently deceased expert pilot mentors a newer pilot while watching him fall in love with the girlfriend that he left behind.','/r7LTwkgqUPPABnHpxceVylMf8M0.jpg','1989-12-22',122,'Released','They couldn\'t hear him. They couldn\'t see him. But he was there when they needed him... Even after he was gone.','Always',11352,5.2494,6.2,'4RmC8mVFwMc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10488,_binary '\0','/odDztRjaqUWRVMMD5uddIuI2vAU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096804',3.8,6447,'en','American Ninja 3: Blood Hunt','Jackson is back, and now he has a new partner, karate champion Sean, as they must face a deadly terrorist known as \"The Cobra\", who has infected Sean with a virus. Sean and Jackson have no choice but to fight the Cobra and his bands of ninjas.','/oiKM4CAEXrhAfDkpnhBW8RpOQC7.jpg','1989-02-24',89,'Released','Now his most deadly enemy ... is time.','American Ninja 3: Blood Hunt',25682,3.19,4.8,'xNzMcuBo4q8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10489,_binary '\0','/A8bGWMCZSM5QIsMR4yVU1vdUltE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096808',4.4,4185,'en','Amityville: The Evil Escapes','After moving into their matriarch\'s gothic seaside mansion, the Evans family soon becomes host to an uninvited demonic force in the form of a mysterious lamp that once resided in the Amityville house.','/pTQbogvsf4f7Fuz80XJqgtrVPiU.jpg','1989-05-12',95,'Released','From the creators of the original AMITYVILLE comes the most terrifying chapter...','Amityville: The Evil Escapes',55377,3.137,4.6,'LRTTDv8E0tE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10490,_binary '\0','/q0nzZlJzGezhALWMJkMtRhsoz0U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096827',8.3,5154,'ta','அபூர்வ சகோதரர்கள்','An honest police officer pays a heavy price after he gets involved with a group of criminals. Years later, his son goes on a vengeance spree but his twin is mistaken as the culprit.','/jqhffaAgfjNf5TlHUwqdTHVx3Cz.jpg','1989-04-14',150,'Released',NULL,'Apoorva Sagodharargal',66365,1.4969,7.571,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10491,_binary '\0','/r0Hee2zRc9glDDOHapwfbjH5aG2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096841',6.5,1658,'ru','Астенический синдром','In the old days it was called hypochrondria, or black melancholia. Now, apparently, it\'s termed the Asthenic Syndrome. Whatever it is, Nikolai, a teacher of epicly indifferent pupils, has got it, and it\'s not much fun.','/kE0HAjG6Awe0nOta9uvnzVKVgsH.jpg','1989-12-01',153,'Released',NULL,'The Asthenic Syndrome',97039,1.2601,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10492,_binary '\0','/bkS4p4DykCYnblycxzG2VArq7P0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096842',6.4,9698,'fr','Astérix et le Coup du menhir','Due to an unfortunate accident involving Obelix throwing a menhir, Getafix the druid not only loses his memory, but goes completely mad. Now deprived of the wisdom of their beloved druid and the protection provided by his magic potion, the Armorican village falls prey to a proclaimed soothsayer who comes with ominous predictions and overweening ambitions. It\'s up to Asterix to keep his villager friends within reason and hopefully get Getafix to remember the magic potion\'s recipe before the impending Roman attack.','/7KFAtZRXzD00Zw9sWxusrInLHgJ.jpg','1989-10-04',81,'Released',NULL,'Asterix and the Big Fight',11625,4.6218,6.3,'M0j63vN8l3A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10493,_binary '\0','/yZq6UtScwm8atkK2pPIGEWUrBM8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096852',6.4,1283,'de','Aufzeichnungen zu Kleidern und Städten','Wim Wenders talks with Japanese fashion designer Yohji Yamamoto about the creative process and ponders the relationship between cities, identity and the cinema in the digital age.','/1VVxGn3K0gj6V6jEN5UnzrUC1YT.jpg','1989-12-20',81,'Released',NULL,'Notebook on Cities and Clothes',77352,1.4557,6.3,'8o7gyUsoAw0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10494,_binary '\0','/NV1IxvmfqxrVsHrDcapgULDdeX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096863',7,2319,'hu','Az én XX. századom','A tale of twin girls, Dóra and Lili, who are born in 1880 Budapest at the same moment Thomas Edison presents his electric lightbulb to the world. The sisters are soon orphaned and separated in childhood, and follow different paths: one grows up to be a naïvely idealistic, bomb-toting anarchist, the other a pampered, hedonistic courtesan. Their paths cross once again on the Orient Express on New Year\'s Eve 1899...','/sXdS2zI9cRnZzwyxbjduvxPoj64.jpg','1989-09-01',102,'Released',NULL,'My Twentieth Century',49978,1.7736,6.5,'VUlI1JtBorc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10495,_binary '\0','/sasvqU6rRMQUlp7AKE3U75uTydl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096866',6.7,8056,'en','The BFG','Sophie is snatched from her orphanage early one morning by the BFG (Big Friendly Giant), whom she witnesses engaged in mysterious activities. She is soon put at ease, as she learns that BFG\'s job is to collect, catalog and deliver pleasant dreams to children. She joins him that night, but a mean giants follow them, planning to eat the children of the world.','/gjA5u7ZLgwkSoNCGCUfNSMv4fYn.jpg','1990-12-25',87,'Released',NULL,'The BFG',15433,2.3329,6.4,'4DYGiFKP2_0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10496,_binary '\0','/qkxlM8gkenS6OrNUckpeJCJ0I9b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096869',6.3,1228,'en','Babar: The Movie','Children\'s book authors Jean and Laurent de Brunhoff\'s most beloved elephant comes to the big screen in this animated family tale. Elephant monarch King Babar tells the tale, that unfolds via flashback, of how a much-younger Barbar and his girlfriend Celeste save her village from the pugnacious rhinoceroses that have come to raid it.','/iKc7iG1vfD22ciOQZDlSqJol5Ir.jpg','1989-07-28',70,'Released','A feature-length adventure that\'s fit for a king!','Babar: The Movie',35927,2.0479,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10497,_binary '\0','/lvCVpejHfC8MQeXzZ3uKJLfW6Fk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096870',1.8,15100,'en','Going Overboard','A struggling young comedian takes a menial job on a cruise ship where he hopes for his big chance to make it in the world of cruise ship comedy.','/tRyhUrLDhVYie2GBX3rXF64Jom1.jpg','1989-05-11',97,'Released','In the world of comedy, it\'s sink or swim.','Going Overboard',19157,3.7055,2.364,'MKNZqnJ0hzU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10498,_binary '\0','/Ai3wuik4S7CzJGHH6TCsjORD8nd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096871',6,2817,'fr','Baby Blood','A cruel circus owner beats and abuses his pregnant wife. One day the circus receives a leopard newly captured in Africa, but the animal soon dies. However, an evil creature that was inside the leopard bursts out of the animal\'s body, burrows into the wife\'s body and takes over her fetus. It soon starts demanding blood, and the woman goes searching for victims for her new \"baby.\"','/qMLmTUwbAlPsfsIPuoiGKkYDZq2.jpg','1990-01-24',88,'Released','It\'s time to feed the baby.','Baby Blood',40258,2.0227,5.7,'Um0zC5qnlbI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10499,_binary '\0','/w6tPctxWAsHoQXeKxxNOT6lYKpx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096874',7.8,629413,'en','Back to the Future Part II','Marty and Doc are at it again as the time-traveling duo head to 2015 to nip some McFly family woes in the bud. But things go awry thanks to bully Biff Tannen and a pesky sports almanac. In a last-ditch attempt to set things straight, Marty finds himself bound for 1955 and face to face with his teenage parents -- again.','/hQq8xZe5uLjFzSBt4LanNP7SQjl.jpg','1989-11-22',108,'Released','Getting back was only the beginning.','Back to the Future Part II',165,37.0424,7.784,'MdENmefJRpw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10500,_binary '\0','/hDqLF0Vfo32oli2gNUvZLxybwjY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096875',5.3,5254,'en','Catchfire','A witness to a mob assassination flees for her life from town to town, switching identities, but cannot seem to elude Milo, the chief killer out to get her.','/9cKFLrXTwzNO8NGfF1kf9nQcsNT.jpg','1990-04-03',116,'Released','When murder is your business, you\'d better not fall in love with your work.','Catchfire',32924,3.5108,5.3,'I3U0E5hVQSk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10501,_binary '\0','/6Uec5IEBspUbwxzRmmYL4S5BxY5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096894',8,3909,'fa','باشو غریبهٔ کوچک','During the Iran-Iraq War, young Bashu loses his home and family. Orphaned, he sneaks into a truck leaving the area, and gets off in the Northern country, where everything from landscape to language is different. He meets Naii, trying to raise her two young children on a farm while her husband is away. Despite cultural differences and a language barrier, Bashu and Naii slowly form a strong bond.','/63ta6SW20iJNstuKoAd7EbJ1mdr.jpg','1989-02-13',120,'Released',NULL,'Bashu, the Little Stranger',43980,1.3924,7.372,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10502,_binary '\0','/rhc7OF7tC9HPu0X8DBKQJzaGRbu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096895',7.5,436047,'en','Batman','Having witnessed his parents\' brutal murder as a child, millionaire philanthropist Bruce Wayne fights crime in Gotham City disguised as Batman, a costumed hero who strikes fear into the hearts of villains. But when a deformed madman known as \'The Joker\' seizes control of Gotham\'s criminal underworld, Batman must face his most ruthless nemesis ever while protecting both his identity and his love interest, reporter Vicki Vale.','/cij4dd21v2Rk2YtUQbV5kW69WB2.jpg','1989-06-21',126,'Released','Justice is always darkest before the dawn.','Batman',268,18.5125,7.234,'ftNOhfNjXjk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10503,_binary '\0','/fClREI48zqOyESHlP5SZAgFfp3k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096908',7.7,7143,'zh','悲情城市','The story of a family embroiled in the \"White Terror,\" the Kuomintang government\'s anti-communist political repression that was wrought on the Taiwanese people from 1947-1987.','/n1aIYLgnrlsUrh77G2OdQT9NV1.jpg','1989-10-21',158,'Released',NULL,'A City of Sadness',49982,5.4825,7.5,'caU7X7LV-5E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10504,_binary '\0','/emv82F28iyu1leZKfuGuIC4D6Zr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096920',5.2,1789,'en','Beyond the Door III','A shy co-ed and her classmates travel to Europe to see a ritual. With a satanist/professor with them, he lures them into deadly traps to become sacrifices to Satan. One co-ed is a virgin, the main key to bring Satan back to life. But can the co-ed lose her virginity before Satan controls the world?','/kXiqqfjsoH2nVYubD5UrP9XyWBa.jpg','1989-10-01',94,'Released','Some doors are best left closed!','Beyond the Door III',33767,1.7139,4.8,'zf1KkNM_0iI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10505,_binary '\0','/3mvSLJWHp3Ws2IM6LW4aMk5SV78.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096921',5.2,1552,'en','Beyond the Stars','Teenager Eric, the son of a computer scientist who worked for the Apollo mission which sent the first human to the moon, is determined to become an astronaut himself one day, and befriends Paul Andrews, the first man on the moon. Paul is avoided by other astronauts nowadays, because he was very rude and rebuffing when he returned from space. Only slowly Eric learns, that he discovered something during his excursion on the moon, that he keeps as a secret.','/hfOnqwPoXJHeFAap69LfmW5KZCa.jpg','1989-03-31',88,'Released',NULL,'Beyond the Stars',92331,2.4079,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10506,_binary '\0','/3UtzDbJugZjVJtfFIu3Gl0QiXYS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096925',6,1814,'en','Big Man on Campus','In this version of \"The Hunchback of Notre Dame\", a hunchback is found living in the bell tower of UCLA. He discovers life as two students bring him out of the tower and into society.','/oHJIvSEm6D1nXi01XCYSrTkMWut.jpg','1989-12-12',105,'Released','A comedy of heroic proportions.','Big Man on Campus',44403,2.3531,5.896,'6Kq60VlP6V0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10507,_binary '\0','/tozIozRtjbpDcYoBkT3dyZpayXf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096926',6.2,6166,'en','The Big Picture','Hollywood beckons for recent film school grad Nick Chapman, who is out to capitalize on the momentum from his national award-winning student film. Studio executive Allen Habel seduces Nick with a dream deal to make his first feature, but once production gets rolling, corporate reality begins to intervene: Nick is unable to control a series of compromises to his high-minded vision, and it\'s all he can do to maintain his integrity in the midst of filmmaking chaos.','/olQw61BotSq74LgpwQTn4qPYAk1.jpg','1989-09-15',100,'Released','Film school prepared Nick for everything... everything but Hollywood.','The Big Picture',45225,3.4221,5.9,'ya-OzgeBDbg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10508,_binary '\0','/aMASmAmkn7NT0nEq8PBZEgwBfGN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096928',6.9,150936,'en','Bill & Ted\'s Excellent Adventure','Two rock-\'n-rolling teens, on the verge of failing their class, set out on a quest to make the ultimate school history report after being presented with a time machine.','/tV25lGWGWGEqUe3U0xjQTBgilSx.jpg','1989-02-17',90,'Released','History is about to be rewritten by two guys who can\'t spell.','Bill & Ted\'s Excellent Adventure',1648,6.7553,6.8,'gxFxklxvE_w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10509,_binary '\0','/blV6DCUzFSDXxCE8lLf6jRCxGNu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096931',5.8,1427,'en','Bionic Showdown: The Six Million Dollar Man and the Bionic Woman','The Bionic Woman and the Six-Million-Dollar Man reunite--with a few younger bionic assistants--and try to catch a bionic spy.','/c5ojVzzQTzdx5tiSuF05HxL2LYc.jpg','1989-04-30',96,'Released','The Six Million Dollar Man and the Bionic Woman are back- But this time they\'ve met their match!','Bionic Showdown: The Six Million Dollar Man and the Bionic Woman',97262,2.2792,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10510,_binary '\0','/4xAxAvrcnelGOBA5mQsW0aEHpqW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096933',6.6,65464,'en','Black Rain','Two New York cops get involved in a gang war between members of the Yakuza, the Japanese Mafia. They arrest one of their killers and are ordered to escort him back to Japan. However, in Japan he manages to escape, and as they try to track him down, they get deeper and deeper into the Japanese Mafia scene and they have to learn that they can only win by playing the game—the Japanese way.','/funhGWt9ee3Uwb6Ar8SGCCvbJdV.jpg','1989-09-22',125,'Released','An American cop in Japan. Their country. Their laws. Their game. His rules.','Black Rain',4105,9.6898,6.6,'RBP-zNZyewo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10511,_binary '\0','/owLNNRJq92Buej6xDJor89zwzZq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096936',5.1,1504,'en','Blades','A peaceful country club becomes the hunting ground for a demonically possessed lawnmower with a taste for human flesh.','/3cdIbcuNMcmgFp97T38TMIXDaNB.jpg','1988-10-25',98,'Released','Just when you thought it was safe to putt.','Blades',121390,1.6287,5.5,'lM-tCDnYh-o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10512,_binary '\0','/1LLSYj84EA8nrdPclinJXFd1JRm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096943',6,4482,'en','Blaze','A middle-aged Louisiana governor falls in love with a young stripper, which jeopardizes his political career and the radical policies which have made him a controversial figure.','/upb42GxljtsmhoLxXbD6REm5Iwg.jpg','1989-12-15',117,'Released','A governor. A stripper. Forced to chose between the office he held and the woman he loved, he chose both.','Blaze',22711,1.714,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10513,_binary '\0','/fa8kC5StEx4Ne78McOMEwlzyDnS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096945',6.3,20550,'en','Blind Fury','A blind Vietnam vet, trained as a swordfighter, comes to America and helps to rescue the son of a fellow soldier.','/ufbA7v7b2xt85Cf1tocr69cwuCO.jpg','1989-08-17',86,'Released','He\'s lucky he can\'t see what he\'s up against.','Blind Fury',19124,7.7101,6.5,'FU169GhEa9Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10514,_binary '\0','/68qm0hmf5Okbwa24o2fpJBcdWZV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096952',4.8,1532,'en','Bloodfist','To avenge the brutal murder of his brother, Jake Ray journeys to the Philippines, where his search for truth finds him battling both in and out of the ring. But the weapons are always the same: bare fists, bare feet. And the rules never change: last man standing wins.','/u2OrhWH9sDC7weiUBcCjD3nJoO3.jpg','1989-09-22',85,'Released',NULL,'Bloodfist',42552,1.4325,4.8,'GnbRMF-o4_U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10515,_binary '\0','/e5Z5EtFSnaEWnKcCEOzwScgf0Vi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096953',5.3,1532,'en','Bloodhounds of Broadway','On New Year\'s Eve 1928, in the New York underworld, a gambler sells his body to science, a gangster needs a transfusion, and a gambler is on the run','/z77iVAuCKKPehv4RXiEOr9kMP69.jpg','1989-11-03',93,'Released','When Life Was Glittering, Glamorous... And Dangerous...','Bloodhounds of Broadway',72096,2.5209,5.7,'qok1dBlphVI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10516,_binary '\0','/mBDZc6YreHy6DIlkitvu197lAXB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0096966',7.6,3083,'sh','Бој на Косову','In 1389, the Serbian prince Lazar Hrebeljanović refused to submit to the Turkish Sultan Murat, who was invading Serbia with a large army, in order to continue conquering Europe through it.','/nHs8Q67k87eNBGuekRQnKPG6CGM.jpg','1989-06-12',117,'Released',NULL,'Battle of Kosovo',108107,1.3245,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15: