military experiment to create a race of super-warriors goes awry, as legions of murderous zombies are unleashed upon a suburban neighborhood.','/zQWaE9q97jXzzRGEHzLXu9Cq4an.jpg','1989-05-05',85,'Released','This C.H.U.D.\'s for you!','C.H.U.D. II: Bud the Chud',53150,2.3954,4.4,'Nv1_Ig58V2Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10521,_binary '\0','/u2Z5gaD5IgGf1gnmW7FvXTrRGKJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097004',3.9,1494,'en','Caged Fury','Kat arrives in Los Angeles to audition for movies. However, after meeting a sleazy producer, she and her new friend find themselves in a women\'s prison run by sadistic guards and a lesbian warden.','/bkDD3t7z5mIOOb7WLDMieF9nVnL.jpg','1990-03-01',95,'Released','They Learned Their Lesson The Hard Way.','Caged Fury',91612,3.3495,5.1,'hr9025fw8Pg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10522,_binary '\0','/251aoC9SVba0a1xwLUgGVBWc44j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097007',6,2167,'en','The Caller','One night, an unusual stranger in need asks a woman living alone in a house in the woods if he can use her phone. It soon becomes clear that they\'re playing a strange mind game and that there\'s something very wrong about the woods.','/p2QncmwniZv4ScBF9b5XAoghJsc.jpg','1987-05-01',97,'Released','A strange visitor. A mysterious woman. A surprise ending...','The Caller',110327,2.2035,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10523,_binary '\0','/coYyDflDLlDO2mFy5uHTrrYftWl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097008',5.1,1286,'en','Cameron\'s Closet','A father who experiments with his son\'s psychokinetic powers is unaware that these experiments have released a demon from hell which lives in his son\'s closet, preparing to take over the young boy\'s soul.','/vpkwVBiH9yp7fwijY9iAMZZUQbf.jpg','1988-12-02',87,'Released','A new place to look for terror.','Cameron\'s Closet',59735,2.0605,4.7,'dbdpYUFzxbk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10524,_binary '\0','/vyf0iEHJJQSPpm3j8gXFZ3GE31j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097015',7.3,2735,'en','Miss Marple: A Caribbean Mystery','While on vacation at a resort hotel in the West Indies, Miss Marple correctly suspects that the apparently natural death of a retired British major is actually the work of a murderer planning yet another killing.','/jFN090M13cF2nnOq40F6fNz0HJN.jpg','1989-12-25',104,'Released',NULL,'Miss Marple: A Caribbean Mystery',578561,2.794,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10525,_binary '\0','/p7JtTqnR17AeYma72oX9O29XqTq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097021',5.7,1581,'it','La casa nel tempo','A gang of ruthless thugs intent on robbery prey upon a seemingly harmless elderly couple, Vittorio and Sara. The simple plan turns into a terrifying nightmare, as Vittorio\'s antique clock collection mysteriously turns back time. Now the hunters become the hunted and the old couple becomes a vengeful, malevolent force.','/qQjBerIRbkV6B0BzA3rF1AzhlNe.jpg','1989-07-01',84,'Released',NULL,'The House of Clocks',39992,1.4786,5.6,'KZq6liKZJ-4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10526,_binary '\0','/asg9dWAGNVjgztjOIhbaWQIYqrr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097027',7.1,52355,'en','Casualties of War','During the Vietnam War, a soldier finds himself the outsider of his own squad when they unnecessarily kidnap a female villager.','/3SerZUDoU9TMCXMsQqiXvSWm0uL.jpg','1989-08-18',113,'Released','Even in war… murder is murder.','Casualties of War',10142,6.0093,7.2,'2S5uKG0uCLo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10527,_binary '\0','/rl4TM9Wwt6GvV1Y8eMCoK6zwpUh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097028',5.2,1689,'en','Cat Chaser','A Miami hotel owner finds danger when he becomes romantically involved with the wife of a deposed general from the Dominican Republic where he fought many years back.','/zFsJnqGlehiiCgelYWpqGKrylAM.jpg','1989-09-13',90,'Released','Passion. Greed. Murder. Tonight they pay.','Cat Chaser',35888,1.6185,5,'phSUnthn638','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10528,_binary '\0','/rL9hKQyU7GGcoyyJttSjqEjnf48.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097044',6.5,13846,'en','Chances Are','Louie Jeffries is happily married to Corinne. On their first anniversary, Louie is killed crossing the road. Louie is reincarnated as Alex Finch, and twenty years later, fate brings Alex and Louie\'s daughter, Miranda, together. It\'s not until Alex is invited to Louie\'s home that he begins to remember his former life, wife and best friend. Of course, there\'s also the problem that he\'s attracted to Louie\'s/his own daughter.','/1HFExVaxxIGaFjy3NVxK29gvucR.jpg','1989-03-10',108,'Released','Alex has a lifetime full of wonderful memories. Unfortunately, they\'re not his.','Chances Are',3064,4.8811,6.6,'0N-8LPlQQsc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10529,_binary '\0','/wfJJkqw9z44W5olmLlt4IhieXZK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097045',6.7,2398,'hi','चाँदनी','Fate leaves Chandni shattered as her love Rohit disappears from her life. She meets Lalit and they befriend each other until Rohit knocks on her door.','/4CDmZFSPddbsXUt2lhjxQbxjNcQ.jpg','1989-09-14',180,'Released',NULL,'Chandni',32680,1.4806,7,'gtMwC6DP0D0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10530,_binary '\0','/j3BQMBBJI66nufbC6j54S2JCuE5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097050',6.8,13619,'ja','子猫物語','When Milo the cat and Otis the dog are separated, they each set off on an adventurous and often perilous quest across mountains, plains, and snow-covered lands to reunite with one another.','/imHIqEfWRZuJ2vLow0UJ9aqjyEO.jpg','1986-06-27',75,'Released','Milo is one lucky cat. He\'s got nine lives and a best friend.','The Adventures of Milo and Otis',47951,3.2318,6.5,'JZSqJWeZXaA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10531,_binary '\0','/7aMsbdxLKkC5aYwhMRvSMYtVQN5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097051',7.3,1556,'it','Che ora è','A father and son who lived separate for some time meet one day to try to reconcile and understand their diametrical differences.','/ySrAaDxglZN1D6PGFTbLmJqXZPU.jpg','1989-09-27',92,'Released',NULL,'What Time Is It?',58187,1.9068,7.44,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10532,_binary '\0','/rkhawf6MQnFXwTEvYDJTHqvZeYv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097053',5.9,1320,'en','Cheetah','An American boy and girl, spending six months in Kenya with their scientist parents adopt a cheetah, only to realize that they must set it loose so that it can learn to hunt and be free. However, when the animal is captured by poachers planning to race it against greyhounds, the two city kids, together with a young African goat herder they befriended, head off into the wild to rescue the cheetah.','/m4FoSWnkrBpUaUehWU12XWKRxjs.jpg','1989-08-18',83,'Released',NULL,'Cheetah',65157,2.0431,6.2,'TIhDYNPeDRM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10533,_binary '\0','/cmXcXeCfTxod7XTO46MtUHDcCSJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097074',6.3,3091,'en','Cohen and Tate','A boy kidnapped by two mismatched hitmen puts them at each other\'s throats while being driven to their employers, possibly to be killed. Cohen, an older professional becomes increasingly irritated with his partner Tate, a brutish killer, when their prisoner uses unnatural guile and resourcefulness to play them off against each other.','/mtl43J82BOX49DKsplg4KPRkbn8.jpg','1989-01-27',86,'Released',NULL,'Cohen and Tate',32079,2.434,6.5,'ngBHm2rIPpA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10534,_binary '\0','/7LSpJ439BQ7K4zHlhCpRsoWmZXf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097081',4.7,1911,'en','Collision Course','A Japanese investigator and a Detroit cop team up to track down a stolen prototype turbocharger.','/xpyePeVClwq85miKvY1r4T8ps5.jpg','1989-04-27',100,'Released','The only thing stopping these two cops from solving the crime of the century, is each other.','Collision Course',102059,2.3457,4.2,'Nh5S04pmCPM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10535,_binary '\0','/2r1ndsOzcTR8T6smB6g1vywPZTx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097095',7,2132,'de','Coming Out','Philipp, a closeted teacher, is dating a female colleague to keep up appearances. One night he stumbles into a gay bar and falls for a man. Transformed by this love, he is no longer afraid to face up to who he is.','/aby6RcCkawv38i8hs2VR4wbrzL4.jpg','1989-11-09',113,'Released','In the end, you have to follow your heart.','Coming Out',36672,1.1822,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10536,_binary '\0','/7oUEj29KvQf6MTyMUpVlKMJcRi2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097099',8.1,1256,'en','Common Threads: Stories from the Quilt','On the eve of 1987\'s Second National March on Washington for Lesbian and Gay Rights, surviving families and friends of people who have died of AIDS prepare panels to be added to a large-scale memorial quilt project. Drawing from the sea of names memorialized, director Robert Epstein focuses on the lives of six people. Alongside the intimate profiles offered, through news footage and interviews, Epstein puts the AIDS crisis in the larger context of social and government response to the disease.','/4yE2UQfSlMO1OygWuiJK5qmYhcB.jpg','1989-12-01',80,'Released',NULL,'Common Threads: Stories from the Quilt',114524,1.8624,6.9,'L9wc4yVBJ5A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10537,_binary '\0','/vb7hke97pbAsZcCG1C7vhDtAiMk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097100',5.5,8978,'en','Communion','A novelist\'s wife and son see him changed by an apparent encounter with aliens in the mountains.','/unDk9honWK30AMUTwSknhplFI5G.jpg','1989-11-10',103,'Released','The true story of one man\'s terrifying journey into the unknown.','Communion',28774,2.4739,5.367,'FPwqqIXyCIE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10538,_binary '\0','/oK5jsCVz1yIsAPw3lxrQuGKHoM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097106',7.1,6646,'fr','Conte de printemps','The story of an introverted young girl just reaching adulthood who takes a liking to an older woman she meets at a party and determines to match her off with her father, despite the latter\'s already having a lover of his own.','/2MDvnal22vJiGJuq2JQwmAFugKk.jpg','1990-04-04',107,'Released',NULL,'A Tale of Springtime',28213,2.4065,6.8,'ey5Jjl3LL_g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10539,_binary '\0','/rzaf3eCT8pVCGvuS7P8g2nPitqC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097108',7.5,45491,'en','The Cook, the Thief, His Wife & Her Lover','When churlish mobster Albert Spica acquires an upscale French restaurant in London, he dines there nightly, effectively scaring off the clientele with his bad manners. His wife, Georgina, is especially disgusted by him, and soon begins an affair with regular guest Michael. Despite their best efforts to keep it secret, Spica learns about their trysts, and he plots a terrible revenge.','/15xMqAnFsROopAT66zdRyu2Dtek.jpg','1989-10-13',124,'Released','Lust...Murder...Dessert. Bon Appetit!','The Cook, the Thief, His Wife & Her Lover',7452,6.8399,7.3,'gxpQomMfvIM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10540,_binary '\0','/55Ak5o04S62RiHhITVrMxdn3KJb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097109',5.5,1685,'en','Cookie','Cookie Voltecki is the illegitimate daughter of mobster Dino Capisco, who has just finished thirteen years in prison. Since being released from jail, all that Dino wants is to settle some old scores, and make up for lost time with his daughter.','/z37uyPcHdQoXFXSywqsUJTeFAPc.jpg','1989-08-02',94,'Released','She\'s a chip off the old block.','Cookie',86093,2.0301,5.6,'V5Vv75zKOOQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10541,_binary '\0','/px6Jjw0pm1oAMjNsU1BX1hq1nNH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097116',6.4,5432,'en','Cousins','When Larry and Maria learn that their respective spouses are cheating on them, they try to turn the tables on them by pretending to have an affair. However, they soon find themselves falling in love.','/sjwJGkf1Dq4cOcDfEWYpg1tatl.jpg','1989-02-10',109,'Released','Love at first sight. Consequences to follow.','Cousins',31674,3.0131,6,'XV2__mru5g0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10542,_binary '\0','/xDPaSuwaOizRNPitEvNiuY7i6iE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097123',7.8,63775,'en','Crimes and Misdemeanors','A renowned ophthalmologist is desperate to cut off an adulterous relationship…which ends up in murder; and a frustrated documentary filmmaker woos an attractive television producer while making a film about her insufferably self-centered boss.','/6vC6MLYUICH57MmEVi1UaNaj2Qs.jpg','1989-10-13',104,'Released','It\'s about love and reality. Faith and delusion. Good and evil. Success and failure.','Crimes and Misdemeanors',11562,4.2282,7.4,'JBzlQ7bUtKk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10543,_binary '\0','/9yNWi2G5c0CkbsqiTWUhAj41CGa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097125',5.7,5494,'en','Criminal Law','Ben Chase is an on-the-rise Boston attorney currently defending a wealthy client in a high-profile murder case. Martin Thiel is the wealthy young man on trial for a particularly brutal murder. The verdict sets Thiel free. Within 24 hours another grizzly and all-too-familiar murder has taken place with striking similarities to the first crime. Chase inexplicably agrees to act as his defense attorney; but this time it will be to gather evidence that will put away his client for good.','/r5cPgWYrJtXBzJZuPmzhlYrEmrV.jpg','1989-04-28',114,'Released',NULL,'Criminal Law',41952,3.1327,5.6,'VXtQRA7bmzc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10544,_binary '\0','/uuPTM2ZG52hwv0QN5tZG3XT6z07.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097131',6.6,1313,'fr','Cruising Bar','Saturday, 12 p.m. The countdown has begun for four men on the make for women. Massage studios, last minute shopping, bodybuilding; our men ardently throw themselves into the ritual of appearance. It is impossible to resist the ferociously burlesque and remarkably stereotypical behavior of these characters. We will meet Gérard known as The Bull, Patrice known as The Lion, Jean-Jacques known as The Peacock and Serge known as The Earthworm. All of this is set in the clubs and bars of late night Montréal.','/1tH7g51H2FtS728jgNFuoCEuQI8.jpg','1989-07-14',96,'Released',NULL,'Cruising Bar',33987,1.2158,6.3,'vGdwAS8ibow','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10545,_binary '\0','/3vgNtm1pUMZIh114fRE0EJ7gI3U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097132',7.8,1865,'en','A Cry for Help: The Tracey Thurman Story','Tracy Thurman was married to a man who abused her. But he continues to harass her after she gets a restraining order, and the police do little to help. When he brutally beats her and slashes her throat in front of police, she sues the city and the police department for failing to protect her.','/1WoVIk4ND6PzI9eD3uLLKqry4ug.jpg','1989-10-02',96,'Released',NULL,'A Cry for Help: The Tracey Thurman Story',107244,1.9471,8.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10546,_binary '\0','/kLtAh588N91zZup6UIubGPQMisJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097136',4.6,7273,'en','Cutting Class','High school student Paula Carson\'s affections are being sought after by two of her classmates: Dwight, the \"bad boy\", and Brian, a disturbed young man who has just been released from a mental hospital where he was committed following the suspicious death of his father. Soon after being released, more murders start happening. Is Brian back to his old tricks, or is Dwight just trying to eliminate the competition?','/zxJAqSdJTc9YaGKVq2SfJDVVVco.jpg','1989-04-24',91,'Released','No one said surviving high school would be easy.','Cutting Class',21799,4.0901,5.051,'79iQi-2ZL9w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10547,_binary '\0','/lUHhwf9VRcdnP5gQjnqa337L33M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097138',5.1,37465,'en','Cyborg','A martial artist hunts a killer in a plague-infested urban dump of the future.','/nOspcG8HP6KPdMvzezavRbzYCEw.jpg','1989-04-07',86,'Released','He\'s the first hero of the 21st Century... and he\'s our only hope.','Cyborg',10134,6.5634,5.7,'-dv3bpt8_s8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10548,_binary '\0','/66jPR8KMmdGzo8wa4VsSDevLTAf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097142',6.3,5603,'en','Dad','A busy executive learns during a meeting that his mother may be dying and rushes home to her side. He ends up being his father\'s caretaker and becomes closer to him than ever before. Estranged from his own son, the executive comes to realize what has been missing in his own life.','/l43BVUdXxbsSt3stBgiW53Dql1n.jpg','1989-10-27',117,'Released','Sometimes the greatest man you ever meet... is the first one.','Dad',21291,3.3938,6.4,'5_kuWCNT258','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10549,_binary '\0','/omwdpCwOSD4tTA3GTerKyDdxF8w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097152',6.7,1609,'en','Danny the Champion of the World','Somewhere in England, in the Autumn of 1955, a widowed father and his son live an idyllic life together. Only their gas station happens to sit on a piece of land that a local developer wants to buy. And when he won\'t take no for an answer, and sets government inspectors and social works onto Danny and his father, Danny and his father decide to get even with Hazell and his pheasant- shooting friends in a manner in keeping with their own family tradition.','/4nq8rvTTox4NTk8Vvbe1crUQhI2.jpg','1989-07-28',99,'Released',NULL,'Danny the Champion of the World',53524,2.0936,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10550,_binary '\0','/obUtKEx6Eb8Rib330c30BbckF1W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097162',6.8,49128,'en','Dead Calm','An Australian couple takes a sailing trip in the Pacific to get over the recent loss of their son. While on the open sea, they come across a sinking ship with one survivor who is not at all what he seems.','/hXpav86ZX5N1YIfVfVtzuZLNrjW.jpg','1989-04-07',96,'Released','High seas. Deep terror. Try to stay calm.','Dead Calm',10493,5.7288,6.559,'SkqZd3h3f2U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10551,_binary '\0','/lFIXZpwwlF9hg8NM3RazaIJDuaj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097165',8.1,668990,'en','Dead Poets Society','At an elite, old-fashioned boarding school in New England, a passionate English teacher inspires his students to rebel against convention and seize the potential of every day, courting the disdain of the stern headmaster.','/tNvKkSnnn4Z6RCBThyK1gfCSSvv.jpg','1989-06-02',129,'Released','He was their inspiration. He made their lives extraordinary.','Dead Poets Society',207,30.6177,8.295,'rLCJaTDdWtw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10552,_binary '\0','/oV9Nww1Mc96DkQWqlke8HKbhO0Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097166',6.1,5054,'en','Dead Bang','Los Angeles homicide detective Jerry Beck searches for the murderer who killed a police officer on Christmas Eve. The investigation takes Beck inside the violent world of hate groups and white supremacists, who are hatching a deadly plot to attack even more innocent people. Beck must also confront his own personal demons, including his growing problem with alcohol, if he wants to track down and stop the violent neo-Nazis before it is too late.','/qqi8hxYEuPfdVJZ6Kxu3jOKUf8S.jpg','1989-03-24',105,'Released','For one cop this isn\'t just a case. It\'s a war.','Dead Bang',4925,2.3804,6.4,'EubAIqVb74E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10553,_binary '\0','/bjbVtLwO4CFtcyV4aGItWwUTHhF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097174',2.9,2665,'en','Deathstalker III: The Warriors from Hell','Deathstalker’s back—and this time he’s facing off against Troxartes, an evil wizard with a zombie army and two magical jewels that hold the key to the lost city of Erendor. Teaming up with Princess Carissa, Deathstalker must protect the third gem, storm a heavily guarded fortress, and ride a bolt of lightning straight into battle.','/v02COOci4mePyLwn2447PdbnCxz.jpg','1988-01-01',86,'Released','The most action packed Deathstalker yet!','Deathstalker III: The Warriors from Hell',47360,2.2126,3.6,'6GroZT9dZT4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10554,_binary '\0','/nC15YUPsHVmdoj1CJhevZ8nEiDV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097179',5.4,15026,'en','DeepStar Six','The crew of an experimental underwater nuclear base are forced to struggle for their lives when their explorations disturb a creature who threatens to destroy their base.','/ueQQx7fyPjN643EwKIMHNF8A1Cw.jpg','1989-01-13',99,'Released','Not All Aliens Come From Space. Save Your Last Breath... To Scream.','DeepStar Six',11607,4.8144,5.5,'GY2T_QLbtK8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10555,_binary '\0','/2zyawAgCpCEfi017Uoulk3MsRIS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097195',7.3,1582,'ko','달마가 동쪽으로 간 까닭은?','About three monks in a remote monastery; an aging master, a small orphan and a young man who left his city life to seek Enlightenment.','/vkdKLYsfIzr1ImacKMQDJmtScky.jpg','1989-09-29',145,'Released',NULL,'Why Has Bodhi-Dharma Left for the East?',62637,1.791,7.1,'IBKeCVjFPdY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10556,_binary '\0','/jetidiki3UjVJEpFwcK2kUrvoR5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097202',7.7,56237,'cn','喋血雙雄','Mob assassin Jeffrey is no ordinary hired gun; the best in his business, he views his chosen profession as a calling rather than simply a job. So, when beautiful nightclub chanteuse Jennie is blinded in the crossfire of his most recent hit, Jeffrey chooses to retire after one last job to pay for his unintended victim\'s sight-restoring operation. But when Jeffrey is double-crossed, he reluctantly joins forces with a rogue policeman to make things right.','/8hTxlSqMAHBXAh1eB69ir0BXhzE.jpg','1989-03-24',110,'Released','One vicious hitman. One fierce cop. Ten thousand bullets.','The Killer',10835,6.8065,7.592,'0pWmMNXE3YI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10557,_binary '\0','/HJHcyhLEHp1HiVUvZyU2fpaYQP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097211',6.3,2907,'en','Disorganized Crime','Lou Diamond Phillips and Fred Gwynne team up with a gang of professional criminals who have everything it takes to rob a bank. The only things they do have going for them are a cop and his partner, who are dumber than they are! By the time the gang hits the bank vault, it\'s a safe bet there\'s going to be organized insanity and disorganized crime!','/rQHt9X3Q4NhDe6LotqUDiZme2l8.jpg','1989-04-14',98,'Released',NULL,'Disorganized Crime',30352,2.1767,5.362,'mAbceeQ9a0E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10558,_binary '\0','/xnLh9CNRxkpkSNikVhi5qLwcfUG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097216',7.9,126241,'en','Do the Right Thing','Sal is the Italian owner of a pizzeria in Brooklyn. A neighborhood local, Buggin\' Out, becomes upset when he sees that the pizzeria\'s Wall of Fame exhibits only Italian actors. Buggin\' Out believes a pizzeria in a black neighborhood should showcase black actors, but Sal disagrees. The wall becomes a symbol of racism and hate to Buggin\' Out and to other people in the neighborhood, and tensions rise.','/63rmSDPahrH7C1gEFYzRuIBAN9W.jpg','1989-06-14',120,'Released','It\'s the hottest day of the summer. You can do nothing, you can do something, or you can...','Do the Right Thing',925,8.6116,7.8,'yVAD4fYRcvA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10559,_binary '\0','/kWNvrV0lZY1kYGo50hIUq4n76vC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097223',8.1,34819,'sh','Dom za vešanje','Perhan is a gypsy teenager with telekinetic powers. A wealthy gypsy, Ahmed, visits the village and promises to get Perhan\'s sister the medical treatment she needs if they join him to Italy. Perhan soon discovers that Ahmed\'s business activities are in fact quite shady and he is soon lured into the elder\'s corrupt surroundings.','/fF9kWNMjiXC6f4YrdVFA0ScnWgQ.jpg','1988-12-21',142,'Released',NULL,'Time of the Gypsies',20123,3.365,7.6,'J9K1iQ57LbQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10560,_binary '\0','/mlYzA8xjGlUS8FBvMaxtd3sttCP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097228',6,2022,'en','Dr. Caligari','Mrs. Van Houten has shown signs of losing touch with reality, and her husband discusses possible treatment with Dr. Caligari, who says Mrs. Van Houten has a disease of the libido.','/wdHFzsyPWl9Qk6nAkSDeZdfsC6A.jpg','1989-12-01',78,'Released','the MAD doctor is in.','Dr. Caligari',35642,1.5123,5.8,'RAutRvgwR_s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10561,_binary '\0','/xw4ffBqSFPIolJx286psPVvr55P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097235',6.5,16260,'en','The Dream Team','Four mental patients on a field trip in New York City must save their caring chaperone, who ends up being taken to a hospital in a coma after accidentally witnessing a murder, before the killers can find him and finish the job.','/lBVjTP8Cb66GBabUBQaBUtV6OqD.jpg','1989-04-07',113,'Released','This morning they were playing ping-pong in the hospital rec room. Now they\'re lost in New York and framed for murder. This was never covered in group therapy.','The Dream Team',14550,4.1088,6.1,'BNjSr8QIFIE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10562,_binary '\0','/dxrahqMSpyyAtVkxiPxIHWnKlGk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097236',5.7,8805,'en','Dream a Little Dream','Bobby Kellar has a crush on Lainie Diamond, girlfriend of school jerk Joel. Coleman is working on an experiment which will help him move into a place where Dreams are reality. When an accident occurs Coleman finds himself in Bobby\'s body and can only contact Bobby in his dreams.','/h73heOhdqIV45m3t4vwV92pZXDP.jpg','1989-03-03',115,'Released','With dreams like these who needs reality?','Dream a Little Dream',15142,3.1453,5.773,'RWIlihA-DBo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10563,_binary '\0','/4XC0HwRNOvub6xksENsOl68zHOn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097239',7.3,124651,'en','Driving Miss Daisy','The story of an old Jewish widow named Daisy Werthan and her relationship with her black chauffeur, Hoke. From an initial mere work relationship grew in 25 years a strong friendship between the two very different characters, in a time when those types of relationships were shunned.','/iaCzvcY42HihFxQBTZCTKMpsI0P.jpg','1989-12-13',99,'Released','The funny, touching and totally irresistible story of a working relationship that became a 25-year friendship.','Driving Miss Daisy',403,6.5984,7.2,'pKRj7QCIXnY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10564,_binary '\0','/zf52xLEyao2xcVnpThmzW2Xl0aj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097240',7.2,43427,'en','Drugstore Cowboy','Portland, Oregon, 1971. Bob Hughes is the charismatic leader of a peculiar quartet, formed by his wife, Dianne, and another couple, Rick and Nadine, who skillfully steal from drugstores and hospital medicine cabinets in order to appease their insatiable need for drugs. But neither fun nor luck last forever.','/1URuvqnZcwL4wy8hIIwQ9p9AxVq.jpg','1989-10-20',102,'Released','Sooner or later, someone will pay the price.','Drugstore Cowboy',476,5.9126,7.077,'5_Rs8c08hM8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10565,_binary '\0','/2SPjdXnbyFBUjG7NjkrDfyFnGpW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097243',7,6970,'en','A Dry White Season','During the 1976 Soweto uprising, a white school teacher\'s life and values are threatened when he asks questions about the death of a young black boy who died in police custody.','/6Wx9oZ7WUoootNLv70EDq6nyDqW.jpg','1989-09-20',107,'Released',NULL,'A Dry White Season',32075,5.0792,6.7,'bRJp3C8isMo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10566,_binary '\0','/acJVlyIdHDIy2U7aW1BodyTB5rr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097244',7.2,7392,'cn','賭神','Ko Chun, a renowned gambler, loses his memory in an accident and starts behaving like a child. Little Knife, an amateur gambler, offers him shelter and realizes that he has a penchant for gambling.','/lmAVK6B4uR8xgYTytjvAfoLuEBG.jpg','1989-12-14',126,'Released','High stakes… A deadly gamble.','God of Gamblers',16269,4.3877,7.2,'hRH6m3IBXn0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10567,_binary '\0','/rSK9U2acisLsqMpiabzZspcH93D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097253',7.5,1739,'pl','Deja vu','After Mick Nich, a 1930\'s Chicago gangster, sells out his own gang to the police, the Mafia hires the best hitman in town, Johnny Pollack, to follow him to Odessa, USSR. Upon arrival, Pollack loses his memory and goes on various adventures with a group of thick-headed Odessa locals who think he is a harmless butterfly collector.','/wZ8UYRvIeVjC9GjxBMERWvzpt4a.jpg','1990-04-18',108,'Released',NULL,'Déjà vu',72955,1.2244,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10568,_binary '\0','/6qQZ54iVgQWOFaVWss77yHy8YHu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097257',5.5,26348,'en','Earth Girls Are Easy','In this musical comedy, Valerie is dealing with her philandering fiancé, Ted, when she finds that a trio of aliens have crashed their spaceship into her swimming pool. Once the furry beings are shaved at her girlfriend\'s salon, the women discover three handsome men underneath. After absorbing the native culture via television, the spacemen are ready to hit the dating scene in 1980s Los Angeles.','/lwFR24fEGf8Q6mGMsGcQuQTLL9T.jpg','1988-09-08',100,'Released','Valerie\'s about to discover how far a girl has to go to find Mr. Right.','Earth Girls Are Easy',2210,4.1565,5.6,'UYelLENqNzA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10569,_binary '\0','/yPDChpWV8tfeS8Knk6pOUX6tUFl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097262',6.3,3562,'en','Eddie and the Cruisers II: Eddie Lives!','In the sixties, Eddie and the Cruisers were the hottest band around. But the tragic death of its lead singer broke the band up...only Eddie is not dead. He works as a carpenter in Montreal, but his love of music forces him to create a new band which will have to struggle with its anonymity.','/9kWnamFFjyECih8JfJ6k0D42Kv8.jpg','1989-08-18',104,'Released','The Legend, The Music, The Man.','Eddie and the Cruisers II: Eddie Lives!',25005,1.7543,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10570,_binary '\0','/sLKrx55Zz8xNFfkH82mgwiR1Fha.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097263',5.4,2105,'en','Edge of Sanity','When his experiments into a powerful new anesthetic go hideously awry, respected physician Dr. Jekyll transforms into the hideous Jack Hyde. As his wife Elisabeth passes her time in charitable work, rehabilitating the district\'s fallen women, Hyde is drawn into an escalating cycle of lust and murder that seems to know no bounds.','/dNsHnJulEgVGqqARv2i2sJTMH8v.jpg','1989-04-14',91,'Released','Beware the beast within!','Edge of Sanity',91683,1.7346,5.364,'hgUbxlFsCPY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10571,_binary '\0','/AhHQivhVyuaz1oXJPaMh9el6uPi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097270',7.1,3451,'en','Elephant','A chilling depiction of a series of violent killings during the Troubles in Northern Ireland.','/wznG0m1gY5lqEU7A14H2WESsqJX.jpg','1989-01-25',38,'Released','\"For some of us, \'The Troubles\' is the elephant in our living room\"','Elephant',37055,1.2818,6.523,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10572,_binary '\0','/gucZzLv4zP56veDlPPMh02lAk9g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097276',6.6,2849,'en','Enemies, a Love Story','A ghostwriter finds himself romantically involved with his current wife, a married woman and his long-vanished wife.','/g0zh75AWArVtadhaNKZjs231TwF.jpg','1989-12-13',119,'Released','The war was over. But can there ever be peace for a man with three wives?','Enemies, a Love Story',116014,2.1268,6.2,'vcrpoa_jv1w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10573,_binary '\0','/rZlMfuYPGxtyxOUzNLLF4iyM0lF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097289',6.2,15357,'en','Erik the Viking','Erik the Viking gathers warriors from his village and sets out on a dangerous journey to Valhalla, to ask the gods to end the Age of Ragnorok and allow his people to see sunlight again. A Pythonesque satire of Viking life.','/tRaNvLehJf0OVsBexo4u4NRKLJ4.jpg','1989-09-01',107,'Released','A Middle Ages Crisis.','Erik the Viking',11828,4.7137,5.931,'Gdq8u9lTdlA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10574,_binary '\0','/oDtrJiviv8Ef7iqGPfarLg9RHqQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097292',6.4,1416,'de','Es ist nicht leicht, ein Gott zu sein','Another planet in the period of medieval times. An employee of the institute of experimental history from Earth, who is send under the name of noble don Rumata of Estor as a spy with a mission to contact the local resident of the institute, arrives in the city of Arkanar. But the resident perishes under an unlucky attempt to make a palace coup, and Rumata have to take his place as the resident. Soon he meets all the horrors of the medieval society - a peasant war, palace coups, mass executions. To continue to be an indifferent watcher of all these horrors turns out to be simply impossible...','/xZemCzsolndSy3IzOYnAPyB9ZlG.jpg','1990-01-25',119,'Released',NULL,'Hard to Be a God',64508,2.1219,6,'dDm2ZUc0CUc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10575,_binary '\0','/rYS7g0ScGc4HGZYhUYlKNXuam66.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097314',5,2975,'en','The Experts','Travis and Wendell are two down-on-their-luck New Yorkers who think they\'re relocating to a small town in Nebraska to open a nightclub. What they don\'t know is they\'ve actually been abducted by a KGB operative and flown to the Soviet Union, where they\'ll unwittingly serve as \"experts\" on all things cool in America. The town, created expressly for KGB spies-in-training, is meant to serve as a training ground for Soviet agents. What can these two hapless Americans possibly teach the Soviet spies, and will they ever learn they are not actually in Nebraska?','/9fqmi4s3PNdenZ1s2cYvVNCJl0w.jpg','1989-01-13',94,'Released','Two abducted Americans are going to tell the Russians everything they know. Poor Russia.','The Experts',55699,2.5483,4.675,'u5b5q1iH540','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10576,_binary '\0','/iUpEDBcoYzND2MhIWr10C93ikFV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097322',6.9,28057,'en','The Fabulous Baker Boys','The lives of two struggling musicians, who happen to be brothers, inevitably change when they team up with a beautiful, up-and-coming singer.','/1nS8AxnoYE2Y1ANMpVKZnm8iLxP.jpg','1989-10-13',114,'Released','For 31 years it\'s been just the Fabulous Baker Boys... but times change.','The Fabulous Baker Boys',10875,4.0547,6.6,'iGlZruBbYQ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10577,_binary '\0','/xVTt5RHaTAuCStfAVrOCPMWA1ye.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097328',5.8,15079,'en','Family Business','Jessie is an aging career criminal who has been in more jails, fights, schemes, and lineups than just about anyone else. His son Vito, while currently on the straight and narrow, has had a fairly shady past and is indeed no stranger to illegal activity. They both have great hope for Adam, Vito\'s son and Jessie\'s grandson, who is bright, good-looking, and without a criminal past.','/nALlbKdoKxlvwx9LDglOHZj0hs9.jpg','1989-12-06',110,'Released','There\'s nothing like a good robbery to bring a family together.','Family Business',10551,3.6657,5.7,'v_M1fSXfDyg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10578,_binary '\0','/q7UGbAIgUHA7dyxrXA7X33EgwLp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097332',5.6,2596,'en','Far from Home','Charlie Cox should have stopped for gas in California. While he\'s on a cross-country trip with his teenage daughter, Joleen, his car hits empty in a creepy town in Nevada. With nary a drop of fuel to be found, Charlie and Joleen stop for the night at a dilapidated trailer park. There, Joleen catches the eye of two teenage boys, Jimmy and Pinky -- either of whom could be the serial killer currently terrorizing the town.','/7Sbb0DbjvwZLi7Zb8DSK3sZ9Bsc.jpg','1989-06-30',86,'Released','One boy wants her love. One boy wants her dead.','Far from Home',27984,2.3013,5.5,'56h7Q5aFwTc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10579,_binary '\0','/wlUlotxtDdh8QpOWdPbleN85HCF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097334',6.2,3376,'en','Farewell to the King','An American soldier who escapes the execution of his comrades by Japanese soldiers in Borneo during WWII becomes the leader of a personal empire among the headhunters in this war story told in the style of Joseph Conrad and Rudyard Kipling. The American is reluctant to rejoin the fight against the Japanese on the urging of a British commando team but conducts a war of vengeance when the Japanese attack his adopted people.','/TflAOAoV7C0XPqNyIhjhOelr8F.jpg','1989-03-03',117,'Released','In the midst of war, one man vanished into the jungle, and emerged as king.','Farewell to the King',20713,2.5536,6,'iXwdnHQ86qk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10580,_binary '\0','/5yW6uJ3o4oKyXcuBv5wFcy0IQvc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097336',6.5,9921,'en','Fat Man and Little Boy','Assigned to oversee the development of the atomic bomb, Gen. Leslie Groves is a stern military man determined to have the project go according to plan. He selects J. Robert Oppenheimer as the key scientist on the top-secret operation, but the two men clash fiercely on a number of issues. Despite their frequent conflicts, Groves and Oppenheimer ultimately push ahead with two bomb designs — the bigger \"Fat Man\" and the more streamlined \"Little Boy.\"','/4CLeeHTMUesP8MCFt5phmdPSS5k.jpg','1989-10-20',127,'Released','The story of the extraordinary people who changed our world.','Fat Man and Little Boy',27461,3.9175,6.2,'IgdiGI2RbNA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10581,_binary '\0','/g5gwbwR98yN1TvycqHCJZhCPa7O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097351',7.5,142384,'en','Field of Dreams','Ray Kinsella is an Iowa farmer who hears a mysterious voice telling him to turn his cornfield into a baseball diamond. He does, but the voice\'s directions don\'t stop -- even after the spirits of deceased ballplayers turn up to play.','/oeM7nAw6FVFICwUaXKCRkDsKjqO.jpg','1989-04-21',105,'Released','All his life, Ray Kinsella was searching for his dreams. Then one day, his dreams came looking for him.','Field of Dreams',2323,7.6331,7.1,'-jUOGhUqGdk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10582,_binary '\0','/4pNCX4viS1a9FbEtrkPjtpwobXg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097364',4.3,1442,'en','Flesh-Eating Mothers','A venereal disease turns an entire town of two-timing mothers into cannibals!','/iBHTQHz8RGSXL9oN3rsITx9Y8Fc.jpg','1988-09-16',89,'Released','…They bit off more than they could chew!!!','Flesh-Eating Mothers',30993,1.2518,4.6,'XWDTao6p8zU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10583,_binary '\0','/oosem39ovF5nLnqTebFD8g6jMRp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097365',3.8,1814,'en','Flesh Gordon Meets the Cosmic Cheerleaders','Space-faring hero and galactically-renowned stud Flesh Gordon is kidnapped by a group of space cheerleaders hoping to use him to save their planet. A being simply known as Evil Presence has been rendering the men of their world impotent, and the women are desperate for some form of relief. Flesh\'s girlfriend Ardor, meanwhile, is following behind to try to keep him out of trouble, but soon finds herself kidnapped by Evil Presence\'s henchman who has plans of his own. Can Flesh get the men of this planet standing tall once again?','/mHdkAxWjPNjwHwMgNkC68ZBazh1.jpg','1990-07-11',98,'Released','Coming to save the universe from a diabolical menace…GALACTIC IMPOTENCE!','Flesh Gordon Meets the Cosmic Cheerleaders',3688,2.1796,4.5,'psoCuK2kgiA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10584,_binary '\0','/5a6ExKIhLAMRN72eQ3nwuFGtpbJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097366',6.1,24701,'en','Fletch Lives','Fletch is a fish out of water in small-town Louisiana, where he\'s checking out a tumbledown mansion he\'s inherited. When a woman he flirts with turns up dead, he becomes a suspect and must find the killer and clear his name.','/A30iCFQVKXvQzGHEE4hyVC0QtrD.jpg','1989-03-17',95,'Released','When there\'s more trouble than one man can handle...there\'s more than one man for the job.','Fletch Lives',14628,3.3155,6.011,'cX78XXrtOZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10585,_binary '\0','/vj8ZmAqj6QZMQ6K12VXoLaPOagr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097368',5.2,26631,'en','The Fly II','Martin Brundle, born of the human/fly, is adopted by his father\'s place of employment (Bartok Inc.) while the employees simply wait for his mutant chromosomes to come out of their dormant state.','/gORksEPahEgO409HYJOZlNVyEpe.jpg','1989-02-10',105,'Released','Like father. Like son.','The Fly II',10344,7.7945,5.8,'-yS6E2EXlnI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10586,_binary '\0','/kFzsCAntTMa8TpJwD6mkdb3BJdC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097371',4.2,1539,'en','Food of the Gods II','A growth hormone experiment gets out of hand, when the the resulting giant man-eating rats escape, reaking havoc on the unsuspecting campus. Much blood-letting follows.','/qraPjfqWfNNBQsXIqRfCTv52LMw.jpg','1989-05-18',91,'Released','It\'s their party... you can die if you want to.','Food of the Gods II',68347,1.9753,4.5,'BYZJPWKNuO8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10587,_binary '\0','/jQzQm6YPBab5ucysHaGnGzfXKCh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097372',8.1,7373,'en','For All Mankind','A testament to NASA\'s Apollo program of the 1960s and \'70s. Composed of actual NASA footage of the missions and astronaut interviews, the documentary offers the viewpoint of the individuals who braved the remarkable journey to the moon and back.','/7k8ylisWiEGxdRSlAf6v4PWiAjH.jpg','1989-11-01',80,'Released','From 1968 til 1972, twenty-four human beings went to the moon. Their journey lives as the ultimate adventure story.','For All Mankind',20423,1.9844,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10588,_binary '\0','/btweaFGLpU1kamkLt3iVYh0tlnn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097373',5.6,2816,'en','For Queen & Country','A retired British soldier struggles to adjust to everyday life, with increasing difficulty.','/rwiOZ5gT6dbRQVgpvrAmYvRoDFs.jpg','1988-05-17',105,'Released',NULL,'For Queen & Country',42347,2.2051,5.3,'lmg18YjGoIs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10589,_binary '\0','/tIZcNhg1ipg8a5GlwEMRMKQ4l8l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097383',6.3,1940,'en','Francesco','The life of St. Francis of Assisi (1181-1226) as related by followers who gather after his death to tell stories so that Leone can record them: a privileged and virile youth, a prisoner of war, an heir who turns away from his father and gives all to the poor, a beggar for others, and an inspiration to friends who accept the Gospels\' life of poverty.','/8hfyrgk66U2KkT49dvJUy5oWQ0d.jpg','1989-03-22',157,'Released',NULL,'Francesco',84981,2.022,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10590,_binary '\0','/6U5sEPgkf3nnQC51kUUKcKzNSyR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097388',4.5,49013,'en','Friday the 13th Part VIII: Jason Takes Manhattan','Jason ships out aboard a teen-filled \"love boat\" bound for New York, which he soon transforms into the ultimate voyage of the damned.','/6ezOsZ9UzqGnbDokaatxdOWP6e9.jpg','1989-07-28',100,'Released','New York has a new problem.','Friday the 13th Part VIII: Jason Takes Manhattan',10283,7.3137,4.941,'PkC417SQKao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10591,_binary '\0','/lmAsNDUXVFSytRVwJKrSIjPfyKK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097390',6,15836,'en','Fright Night Part 2','After three years of therapy Charley Brewster, now a college student, is convinced that Jerry Dandridge was a serial killer posing as a vampire. But when Regine, a mysterious actress and her entourage move into Peter Vincent\'s apartment block, the nightmare starts again - and this time it\'s personal!','/yvbRJTnZbGkGy2VHMfTTTFV8Io2.jpg','1988-04-07',104,'Released','Do you have a taste for terror? The suckers are back.','Fright Night Part 2',18086,6.6647,6.5,'W83ZB-TMm4o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10592,_binary '\0','/ahZyJmxv9Ngkwt7ElUG9S2sPhVR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097408',6.3,1467,'pl','Galimatias, czyli kogel-mogel II','Kasia and Pawel, having got married, live in the village of Brzozki, 10 kilometres from Grabow. Kasia wants to return to her pedagogical studies, so she does not want to have children yet. Pawel announces that he wants to break away from the traditional village farm and focus on specialised sheep breeding, which causes a family argument. Kasia\'s parents anxiously await the birth of their grandchildren. Things get even more complicated when the Wolanskis arrive in Grabow. They offer to help Kasia go back to university, but in return Kasia has to look after little Piotr as the docent is leaving for London where he has received a month-long study grant.','/nBKLIt73RbFxzDZ7BENoKLPEiEJ.jpg','1989-09-27',93,'Released',NULL,'Topsy Turvy, or Egg Nogg 2',57723,1.0307,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10593,_binary '\0','/tmYQUgBsHjsnLVdkel8kHKLYdOG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097409',7.3,1739,'bn','Ganashatru','Ashoke Gupta is an idealistic doctor working in a town near Calcutta. He discovers that the water at a popular temple is the source of an outbreak of typhoid and hepatitis. In order to save lives, he risks his career to try and call attention to this polluted water source, while a local group of building contractors attempt to discredit him in various ways.','/4Vi3K7TwPtsWPXUBms4A1Pbj4m2.jpg','1990-01-19',99,'Released',NULL,'An Enemy of the People',197562,1.6005,7.268,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10594,_binary '\0','/ubIn0u79glPmmgbL4qfrpBNI21X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097410',5.3,1244,'ja','ガンヘッド','High-concept Sci-Fi adventure about an island that actually is a computer called Kyron 5, itself created to design and manufacture super-advanced robots to be used as slaves for the rest of the world. One day Kyron decides that human beings are unnecessary, so it declares war on the world. But Kyron cannot be tamed, and after many lives are lost in the attempt, mankind decides to leave Kyron to its own devices.','/ySNPwAzfLwrUz2Yar3HCWK3huLx.jpg','1989-07-22',100,'Released','2038. Computer domination is a reality. Gunhed: man\'s last defence in the great robot war','Gunhed',8415,2.0866,4.8,'gzHtD2cD2zM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10595,_binary '\0','/yI2Dvc2yNhL5pf9RGSrieKL1FXs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097416',7.1,2383,'ta','காதலன்','Prabhu, a college student, falls in love with Shruthi, a governor\'s daughter. On knowing about their love affair, her father imprisons Prabhu and forbids him to meet Shruthi.','/pt56OBUH0MjPIDSgx6YpJQRc5vA.jpg','1994-09-17',170,'Released',NULL,'Kaadhalan',59265,1.1551,6.675,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10596,_binary '\0','/9EClyBsaZO9W6hh8y4BUsVgE95D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097423',6.1,1843,'en','Get Smart, Again!','KAOS has invented a weather machine so Maxwell Smart and Agent 99 are called back into action to foil this evil plan.','/fbVfOONUteNXlEN7gBMyaxNyAGx.jpg','1989-02-26',96,'Released',NULL,'Get Smart, Again!',33787,2.7057,5.474,'sbxht5LPVMA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10597,_binary '\0','/tgHO1DdnaS0xHcRxBHxE4kOQeIm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097428',6.6,241656,'en','Ghostbusters II','The discovery of a massive river of ectoplasm and a resurgence of spectral activity allows the staff of Ghostbusters to revive the business.','/iUZPi31KDP0n5ycpycEsvl51BdV.jpg','1989-06-16',108,'Released','Guess who\'s coming to save the world again?','Ghostbusters II',2978,15.3598,6.603,'weIqC-oUGmA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10598,_binary '\0','/b2p8GKgeylD0o0Ka9FfSbBYXQMg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097437',8.3,3235,'te','గీతాంజలి','Prakash, who is diagnosed with terminal cancer, and Geethanjali, an equally ill patient, fall in love with each other. However, when she learns about his illness, she decides to move out of his life.','/qZVWloCwvgP5JtaqBWoFY6YspzT.jpg','1989-05-10',137,'Released',NULL,'Geethanjali',148808,1.3488,7.15,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10599,_binary '\0','/lBTk2RgneFZqSQyKBGHfpknT1RK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097438',6.3,10038,'en','Gleaming the Cube','An Orange County teenager\'s carefree life of ditching class and skateboarding abandoned pools comes to a screeching halt when someone close to him dies. The cops rule the death a suicide, but the bereaved skater believes he was murdered. It\'s up to him to solve the case, with a skateboard.','/dpwbqnG2vmkwBBIpfQmFUf5l120.jpg','1989-01-13',106,'Released','All he cared about was gleaming the cube...until the night they killed his brother.','Gleaming the Cube',1380,3.0046,6,'PnA7p1LXtUc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10600,_binary '\0','/3yHddfnAwI1kWOGjoQXZoqhnU5Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097441',7.8,154235,'en','Glory','Robert Gould Shaw leads the US Civil War\'s first all-black volunteer company, fighting prejudices of both his own Union army and the Confederates.','/pGDzBjZvzmSCIEduQBfESLMiwtp.jpg','1989-12-15',122,'Released','Their innocence. Their heritage. Their lives.','Glory',9665,10.4849,7.5,'-OS-OE1EcHI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10601,_binary '\0','/y64wCtYwQe4KIUK8m9JgLVK20sj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097443',6.8,19259,'en','The Gods Must Be Crazy II','Xixo is back again. This time, his children accidentally stow away on a fast-moving poachers\' truck, unable to get off, and Xixo sets out to rescue them. Along the way, he encounters a couple of soldiers trying to capture each other and a pilot and passenger of a small plane, who are each having a few problems of their own.','/sxPpBTB2Rd5PHs97E2zn0t9GCSp.jpg','1989-07-01',98,'Released','This Time, Everybody\'s Going Crazier.','The Gods Must Be Crazy II',11937,5.3613,7.056,'_USEsg4JtYs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10602,_binary '\0','/wh832wXrqIVdSC5271fkJIuyji4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097444',6.5,8635,'ja','ゴジラvsビオランテ','After the previous Godzilla attack, a miniature arms race ensues to collect his cells. Concerned over Godzilla\'s possible return, the Japanese government uses the cells to create a new bio-weapon, ANEB (Anti-Nuclear Energy Bacteria). They seeks the aid of geneticist Genshiro Shiragami, who\'s experiments result in a new mutation.','/dAr3SzPTfKP23uILP4BBiML8MVG.jpg','1989-12-16',105,'Released','The winner of this battle would be the most enormous enemy against human beings.','Godzilla vs. Biollante',18289,4.1093,7.3,'TGUiDiIKy9g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10603,_binary '\0','/iv55tFwMKD2210HzKV4mqhWTJ6o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097455',5.1,2149,'en','Grandmother\'s House','Recently orphaned teenagers David and Lynn are sent to California to live with their grandparents who they discover are harboring a terrifying secret.','/wHSST0TCHUGEg00dVaKhyvhLuZT.jpg','1988-12-16',90,'Released','She\'ll Spoil You To Death!','Grandmother\'s House',69158,1.3963,5.4,'bh1ER79C2sQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10604,_binary '\0','/A4sFrTjB4JOrmCQLRqnfz91BQTK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097457',6.3,18699,'en','Great Balls of Fire!','The story of Jerry Lee Lewis, arguably the greatest and certainly one of the wildest musicians of the 1950s. His arrogance, remarkable talent, and unconventional lifestyle often brought him into conflict with others in the industry, and even earned him the scorn and condemnation of the public.','/cb0zpDUnHBj8PxWQG5L96m3rxrk.jpg','1989-06-30',108,'Released','The true story of a legend.','Great Balls of Fire!',11465,4.5559,6.279,'ueSrpfNoIwk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10605,_binary '\0','/sNbcxcZnuePRVnPIupVTUo1v8ij.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097458',6.2,4353,'en','Gross Anatomy','Joe Slovak is a brilliant first-year med student whose casual, nonconforming approach to life gets tested when he enrolls in Gross Anatomy, the toughest course in med school.','/nYP7HFuHfy3QchskZiywbJAQ8a0.jpg','1989-10-20',109,'Released','No one thought a real rebel like Joe would make it through medical school. But they didn\'t know Joe.','Gross Anatomy',17190,1.9396,5.7,'fIiOpQrvbxU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10606,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097469',7.3,1594,'en','Guts and Glory: The Rise and Fall of Oliver North','Guts and Glory: The Rise and Fall of Oliver North follows the military career of Marine Lt. Col. Oliver North, beginning with his Naval Academy days through to his role in the Iran-Contra scandal.','/nOs5cQFVGu3chZySyHKn1Yp9GPv.jpg','1989-04-30',187,'Released','An enemy of the state... or a hero of the people.','Guts and Glory: The Rise and Fall of Oliver North',357286,1.673,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10607,_binary '\0','/cZGpp2cD3dh15rrnA1jrAppZHyt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097474',4.9,52684,'en','Halloween 5: The Revenge of Michael Myers','After lying in a coma for a year, Michael Myers awakens and stalks his way back to his small hometown in Illinois, intent on killing his niece, Jamie, who has been confined to a mental institution since his last attempt to slay her.','/rYvP6yMXCIVHnkVtwGaAXFmpzkB.jpg','1989-10-12',98,'Released','Michael lives. AND THIS TIME THEY\'RE READY!','Halloween 5: The Revenge of Michael Myers',11361,7.6659,5.3,'ilHM_qpy-zM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10608,_binary '\0','/9SR8WDtMjU9pPF1hvRilYyck3Eb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097478',5.8,2156,'en','Happy Together','Christopher is an ambitious college freshman, striving to become a writer. Through a computer fault he\'s assigned the same room as Alex, a real party freak and... a girl! He\'s annoyed and tries to get a different room as soon as possible, but when he learns to know her, he also starts to like her. She not only improves his sexual life, but also his writing skills','/3ekqpIww56hYDSsVFU7GcNfoBGv.jpg','1989-05-04',102,'Released','Roommates by accident... lovers by choice.','Happy Together',55059,2.6444,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10609,_binary '\0','/tUPLfffhiJqvb75onmrC0nUkWax.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097481',6.1,27626,'en','Harlem Nights','\'Sugar\' Ray is the owner of an illegal casino and must contend with the pressure of vicious gangsters and corrupt police who want to see him go out of business. In the world of organised crime and police corruption in the 1920s, any dastardly trick is fair.','/mHX0aYjxc2cIOBfYBuaYN9SvbUf.jpg','1989-11-17',116,'Released','They\'re up to something big.','Harlem Nights',9085,6.3835,6.07,'En27DgNW0nY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10610,_binary '\0','/7EFotxDpmKp2eqWD7C4pGUorpDR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097487',6.7,1312,'en','Hawks','Two terminally ill patients in a hospital yearn for relief from their predicament. With little or no friends, they form an uneasy alliance and plot an escape for one last wild time.','/3nSwYUFp1qEIULwtx2K8jg8DtnI.jpg','1988-08-05',110,'Released','They soared above the ordinary.','Hawks',115616,1.2234,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10611,_binary '\0','/5pLaYZGbweHYULiNiRehPxYuUnn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097493',7.1,127506,'en','Heathers','A girl who halfheartedly tries to be part of the \"in crowd\" of her school meets a rebel who teaches her a more devious way to play social politics: by killing the popular kids.','/rtzcrwgsuESV2adSDhIuLyQoZmp.jpg','1989-03-31',103,'Released','Best friends, social trends and occasional murder.','Heathers',2640,8.1589,7.253,'4Z87JRcieIE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10612,_binary '\0','/tRKV6SKfbeYOmrRJ5h1Cd9HNqw6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097498',3.7,1910,'en','Hellgate','A motorcycle gang kidnaps a young woman, Josie, from a diner and brutally kills her. Many years later, the girl\'s father finds a magic crystal that can bring the life back to dead objects. He uses it to re-animate his daughter. He lets her seduce any young man that comes to visit the small town and then kills them. Four young students, two boys and two girls spend a vacation near the town, Hellgate. They hear about the story and get involved.','/exIf15lOtbcrRFFmkchcoxsWrwE.jpg','1989-02-03',91,'Released','Beyond the darkness terror lives forever.','Hellgate',83613,1.1056,3.5,'Nql9Yoo0K-o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10613,_binary '\0','/uAIsWqlLwsL5YN40HYce04wz7Xb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097499',7.4,33591,'en','Henry V','In 1415, in the midst of the Hundred Years\' War, the young King Henry V of England embarks on the conquest of France.','/w9R2HsYNnfF3m9uEo2UAmPNJr8a.jpg','1989-10-05',137,'Released','The great adventure of a king who defied the odds to prove himself a man.','Henry V',10705,4.5565,7.1,'tksPrKi5wUg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10614,_binary '\0','/43ulP7yoTO5xf9Lx9eZ8QpneYcH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097500',5.8,8582,'en','Her Alibi','A writer of BAD detective novels is in full writers\' block. He pretends to be the alibi of a beautiful woman who was arrested for murder at first thinking her innocent, but as she shows more and more interesting abilities (such as knife throwing) he begins to doubt his first assessment.','/zPewmxWwDOMucFnaXXH26tfAv7m.jpg','1989-02-03',94,'Released','Falling for a beautiful woman can be murder!','Her Alibi',17819,3.8284,5.426,'VVszRIBAT8A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10615,_binary '\0','/cpMrhXxOX3clbuZrUCpen7Z3NAu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097503',6,2392,'en','Hider in the House','A deranged man hides in the attic of a new house and becomes obsessed with the unsuspecting family that moves in.','/nBJ85rRodk41pcaJvZfy0KCNN3j.jpg','1989-05-13',108,'Released','You can\'t lock him out. He\'s already in.','Hider in the House',56669,3.4108,6,'jwbV-K49oqk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10616,_binary '\0','/vbD8UxVZPQdYS5oQ9kiD9VqCysf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097521',5.3,2197,'en','Homer and Eddie','A mentally disabled man gets help from a sociopath when he tries to reunite with his dying father, who years earlier disowned him.','/b4gM4Yh40QnYXkXiFao6nDFomjL.jpg','1989-08-17',100,'Released','She\'s ruthless - He\'s witless - They\'re on the road together and falling apart at the seams','Homer and Eddie',46786,1.9307,5.6,'B-oiqLfDomY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10617,_binary '\0','/jQuP23kN9iEBglGpw4AxRagoqBf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097523',6.5,179091,'en','Honey, I Shrunk the Kids','The scientist father of a teenage girl and boy accidentally shrinks his and two other neighborhood teens to the size of insects. Now the teens must fight diminutive dangers as the father searches for them.','/omQOzahi2NIeiYznNxHFDvNbvo6.jpg','1989-06-23',93,'Released','The most astonishing, innovative, backyard adventure of all time!','Honey, I Shrunk the Kids',9354,14.0048,6.334,'PVF9Wz3LBgs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10618,_binary '\0','/tZcOail3NuHDWUxh77FihNpsnH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097527',5.2,5386,'en','The Horror Show','Vowing revenge on the detective who apprehended him, serial killer \"Meat Cleaver\" Max Jenke returns from beyond the grave to launch a whole new reign of terror.','/uQackO1zZttqWhmLVMTK28TW01O.jpg','1989-04-28',95,'Released','They tried to electrocute \"Meat Cleaver\" Max. It didn\'t work.','The Horror Show',38084,4.2404,5.4,'Dk3Ee9eHQ1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10619,_binary '\0','/kmO4lAb8PywDmxAYmkTHf9eOMKk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097530',5.8,2521,'en','How I Got Into College','High school senior Marlon Bowne is smitten with overachieving classmate Jessica Kailo. But, if he wants to have a shot with her, he\'ll have to find a way to get into Ramsey College, Jessica\'s top choice of schools. It won\'t be easy, since the college is highly selective and Marlon\'s grades are hardly impressive. That means the lovelorn teen will have to find a way to score high on the SATs and win over the college admissions committee.','/hm2sHodii3Av5OLRKFr1m3hdPzw.jpg','1989-05-19',86,'Released','A horror story so intense, so barbaric, so frightening it will have you running for your local army recruiter.','How I Got Into College',27307,2.4211,5.966,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10620,_binary '\0','/vULZzghc0E4nfi95AH9kGBgHZ2G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097531',6.8,7191,'en','How to Get Ahead in Advertising','Pressure from his boss and a skin-cream client produces a talking boil on a British adman\'s neck.','/8T1UacG5YV063PDbaHH2RaqA6Wc.jpg','1989-05-05',95,'Released','The career where two heads are better than one.','How to Get Ahead in Advertising',14776,2.4105,6.284,'OpfQ_6iL1rg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10621,_binary '\0','/vjzHGQ8U6g88LU5rNTeAznfjM2C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097539',7.1,2115,'cn','皇家師姐IV直擊證人','Two detectives who are up to their necks in trouble and in each other\'s face, as they try to shut down a drug-trafficking scheme that could be connected with international ties to organized crime. But in the midst of their investigation, innocent immigrant dock worker Luk Wan-Ting gets caught up in the mix when he witnesses the murder of an intelligence operative and is framed for the crime.','/w3IqNotgwl8RRS17P50xCOB9EEB.jpg','1989-07-21',94,'Released',NULL,'In the Line of Duty 4',39854,3.6506,7,'1zRHgp6S9pg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10622,_binary '\0','/hdKSZoabjKZ1WIciA5l2QBVFDkE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097550',5.4,1885,'en','I Bought a Vampire Motorcycle','When a motorbike gang kills an occultist, the evil spirit he was summoning inhabits a damaged bike. The bike is then bought and restored, but reveals its true nature when it tries to exact vengance on the gang, and anyone else who gets in its way.','/dCbFIzq64uUo5ZR4W3vLFhaJenk.jpg','1990-07-06',101,'Released','Most motorcycles run on petrol, this one runs on blood!','I Bought a Vampire Motorcycle',41153,2.7992,5.3,'43rAACwFPRk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10623,_binary '\0','/xYleOkjssy1sEfJAHUr27AtOgkd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097557',5.9,4680,'en','I, Madman','A bookshop clerk starts seeing the disfigured killer from her favorite 1950s pulp novels come to life and start killing people around her.','/vmM7hNVmPMQM8ijiI9P235jjlLQ.jpg','1989-04-07',89,'Released','Lose Yourself in a Good Book.','I, Madman',40353,2.6987,5.808,'nntco1JGmMQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10624,_binary '\0','/fqaLxiKNbTtAmDdXehp8yCpnegT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097561',6.9,3491,'ru','Игла','Moro returns to Alma-Ata to collect money owed to him. While waiting out an unexpected delay, he visits his former girlfriend Dina and discovers she has become a morphine addict. He decides to help her kick the habit and to fight the local drug mafia responsible for her condition.','/jY89jWUNT53D854qY4J7T6RsywL.jpg','1989-02-13',76,'Released','Tsoi, drugs and Soviet rock.','The Needle',20847,1.9042,6.763,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10625,_binary '\0','/oQUPobJh3Hak55rFSLkOumLlrn8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097567',6.1,1908,'en','Immediate Family','Linda and Michael, married for ten years, desperately want a baby and turn to an adoption agency which introduces them to Lucy, a teenage girl expecting her first baby. The three agree that Linda and Michael will adopt Lucy\'s baby and that Lucy will sign away custody. Things don\'t go quite to plan however..','/reQw2irRqjbqYNJx1AqOzsXItJk.jpg','1989-10-27',95,'Released','The toughest choices are made with the heart.','Immediate Family',59585,1.8258,5.9,'2O7rS54yd9A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10626,_binary '\0','/hOljV0Ikm0WWg8C6F0xW0OmL0ly.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097570',5.9,3431,'en','In Country','Samantha Hughes, a teenaged Kentucky girl, never knew her father, who died in Vietnam before her birth. Samantha lives with her uncle Emmett, who also served in Vietnam. Emmett hangs around with Tom, Earl, and Pete, three other Vietnam vets who, like Emmett, all have problems of one kind or another that relate to their war experiences. Samantha becomes obsessed with finding out about her father.','/rLyxWz5O2QfOBbqLDlloUHQyuru.jpg','1989-09-15',120,'Released',NULL,'In Country',32855,2.5646,5.6,'Y4mfE-R0cEs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10627,_binary '\0','/7KGdTzKux4fp5sW7hUM33NWqBU1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097576',8.2,871533,'en','Indiana Jones and the Last Crusade','In 1938, an art collector appeals to eminent archaeologist Dr. Indiana Jones to embark on a search for the Holy Grail. Indy learns that a medieval historian has vanished while searching for it, and the missing man is his own father, Dr. Henry Jones Sr.. He sets out to rescue his father by following clues in the old man\'s notebook, which his father had mailed to him before he went missing. Indy arrives in Venice, where he enlists the help of a beautiful academic, Dr. Elsa Schneider, along with Marcus Brody and Sallah. Together they must stop the Nazis from recovering the power of eternal life and taking over the world!','/sizg1AU8f8JDZX4QIgE4pjUMBvx.jpg','1989-05-24',127,'Released','Have the adventure of your life keeping up with the Joneses.','Indiana Jones and the Last Crusade',89,17.7936,7.856,'DKg36LBVgfg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10628,_binary '\0','/9f02RFq8J4K5ZWN8sZjvD6ygyne.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097579',6.5,8362,'en','An Innocent Man','Jimmie Rainwood was minding his own business when two corrupt police officers (getting an address wrong) burst into his house, expecting to find a major drug dealer. Rainwood is shot, and the officers frame him as a drug dealer. Rainwood is convicted of drug dealing, based on the perjured evidence of a police informant. Thrown into a seedy jail, fighting to prove his innocence is diffucult when he has to deal with the realities of prison life, where everyone claims they were framed.','/fDgR7vq3fqtlo2w2wPN3pNXyDm5.jpg','1989-10-06',113,'Released','Falsely accused. Unjustly convicted. Determined to survive on the inside. Demanding justice once he\'s on the outside.','An Innocent Man',29185,3.7587,6.1,'MFqQ42aiMuo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10629,_binary '\0','/rvkQoZSxKptvtZ1EzAHZZx6GHuG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097584',7,1833,'ru','Интердевочка','A hospital nurse becomes an \"international girl\" — a prostitute who caters to foreigners with hard currency.','/nUi1vuuemOgSehUzyLixUyt3m7C.jpg','1989-01-21',143,'Released',NULL,'Intergirl',83524,2.154,6.519,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10630,_binary '\0','/nebmYBArHREnSJlsJfRQ6TAUbq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097607',6.4,7133,'en','Jacknife','A conflict develops between a troubled Vietnam veteran and the sister he lives with when she becomes involved romantically with the army buddy who reminds him of the tragic battle they both survived.','/i3tnWvBTV6d0YOldO3guhpLS8WT.jpg','1989-10-05',102,'Released','Three buddies in Vietnam. Two survived. Only one is really alive.','Jacknife',39787,3.4777,6.4,'x80VcDHVq7g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10631,_binary '\0','/6KUNcsjzLUmRwahwzNr5876HcIJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097613',5.5,9010,'en','The January Man','Nick and Frank Starkey were both policemen. A scandal forced Nick to leave the force, now a serial killer has driven the police to take him back. A web that includes Frank\'s wife, bribery, and corruption all are in the background as Nick tries to uncover the secret of where the killer will strike next, and finally must lay a trap without the police.','/5CZznrNvFLacr0mb4CYmlpJ4Tsw.jpg','1989-01-13',97,'Released','Catching a serial killer takes a seriously twisted cop.','The January Man',32059,3.8684,5.027,'-FKwi3_8068','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10632,_binary '\0','/gZ7sWQrewOaICaRcLuoJ8V0IvcG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097618',6.6,1354,'cn','急凍奇俠','When 16th-century Ming guard Fong Sau-Ching sets out to capture vicious rapist Fung San, both men end up falling into a glacier to be frozen in time. Thawed out by scientists over 300 years later, the confused guard must learn to cope with the modern world and continue in his quest to vanquish his opponent.','/6bKp7GuqjQEEzET8MX33ERWEoLD.jpg','1989-08-12',114,'Released','Across the centuries – the war between good and evil can never end.','The Iceman Cometh',45454,2.6851,7.4,'anovRgh2_sM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10633,_binary '\0','/3rJ0EjEh1nlXY8TlA2f26jlCoom.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097626',6.1,12103,'en','Johnny Handsome','A career criminal who has been deformed since birth is given a new face by a kindly doctor and paroled from prison. It appears that he has gone straight, but he is really planning his revenge on the man who killed his mentor and sent him to prison.','/hHilmOkEJzsDHsXBoY8fWiMuDqo.jpg','1989-09-12',94,'Released','They changed his looks, his life and his future... but they couldn\'t change his past .','Johnny Handsome',505,3.6823,6.35,'8Nq5er9hq9g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10634,_binary '\0','/7NLmoAQ6qaJKFjzQAdmng9Egh5v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097630',2.6,1583,'en','Journey to the Center of the Earth','An English nanny and one of two brothers fall down a Hawaiian cave, all the way to Atlantis.','/yHjOfJ0WMYWdH9iY7Us9GXD4p9n.jpg','1988-07-30',80,'Released','Explore the Impossible.','Journey to the Center of the Earth',122894,2.6319,3.241,'uz1dZyBrOKk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10635,_binary '\0','/kEaYlYkb5wZQ6ZtydGfNhoujbQn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097635',7.5,7926,'fr','Jésus de Montréal','A group of actors putting on an interpretive Passion Play in Montreal begin to experience a meshing of their characters and their private lives as the production takes form against the growing opposition of the Catholic church.','/evtfMmuJyCQch2JIdWO2SdGWgJA.jpg','1989-05-15',119,'Released',NULL,'Jesus of Montreal',4486,1.7947,6.865,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10636,_binary '\0','/1zZL0NDA3PhRENwu3YbDw4zgMDZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097636',6,4506,'sv','Jönssonligan på Mallorca','Vanheden and Dynamit-Harry, together with Harry\'s fiancée Doris, are in Mallorca while Sickan is still in Stockholm. However, Wall-Enberg talks him into doing a break-in at Las Palmas cathedral in Mallorca. Once persuaded, he can\'t resist the temptation and travels to Mallorca as well. However, Wall-Enberg obviously can\'t be trusted. Sickan is framed, caught and put in jail. While being escorted home to Sweden again, Vanheden and Harry sets up a plan to break him free. Sickan, once free, wants payback. The gang discover that an antiques dealer called Germann has something to do with the whole thing and that she\'s also collaborating with Wall-Enberg. The gang then decide to take a closer look at her and her antiques and they discover that there\'s a heist being planned against the cathedral in Palma.','/fJyOupPvVi3f8dFnctDtekSEgs1.jpg','1989-11-03',101,'Released',NULL,'The Jönsson Gang in Mallorca',37728,1.7191,5.7,'aXspkvq6TN0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10637,_binary '\0','/vDBdstmX7z7g0yMQMWtWHJszJ4q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097637',6.1,37979,'en','K-9','The extravagant cop Michael Dooley needs some help to fight a drug dealer who has tried to kill him. A \"friend\" gives him a dog named Jerry Lee (Officer Lewis), who has been trained to smell drugs. With his help, Dooley sets out to put his enemy behind the bars, but Jerry Lee has a personality of his own and works only when he wants to. On the other hand, the dog is quite good at destroying Dooley\'s car, house and sex-life...','/21mBNUe0X4WYywe6w5DyihltmAn.jpg','1989-04-28',101,'Released','Meet the two toughest cops in town. One\'s just a little smarter than the other!','K-9',10345,4.2503,6.2,'m8lk5PWFUKQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10638,_binary '\0','/c12c7Rpq4kakQiaZIQgp5aTaDFB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097647',5.4,78754,'en','The Karate Kid Part III','Despondent over the closing of his karate school, Cobra Kai teacher John Kreese joins a ruthless businessman and martial artist to get revenge on Daniel and Mr. Miyagi.','/lVZ3r0iDwGejlCvFEvXGzhQB9ds.jpg','1989-06-16',112,'Released','First it was teacher to student. Then it was father to son. Now, it\'s man to man.','The Karate Kid Part III',10495,8.6491,5.9,'0YFWFJOvjwQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10639,_binary '\0','/8l0yJJLJ2F2FrNIJVHLMMRxdryq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097648',6.9,1602,'en','The Karen Carpenter Story','Story of the meteoric rise and sudden fall of Karen Carpenter, who became a famous singer before battling anorexia and bulimia. This made-for-TV movie is the authorized version of the life of Karen Carpenter and was made with the approval of Richard Carpenter and the Carpenter family.','/2EVVJIpi0WVLTg5Dbxpa3xtsFpo.jpg','1989-01-01',92,'Released','She\'d only just begun... and suddenly it was over.','The Karen Carpenter Story',69898,2.1414,7.2,'QCyjYJS8eXs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10640,_binary '\0','/sl7hpSJR11FlfcewMJ6ihsbbAuJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097659',6.4,67282,'en','Kickboxer','If your enemy refuses to be humbled... Destroy him. Accompanied by his brother Kurt, American kickboxing champion Eric Sloane, arrives in Thailand to defeat the Eastern warriors at their own sport. His opponent: ruthless fighter and Thai champion, Tong Po. Tong not only defeats Eric, he paralyzes him for life. Crazed with anger, Kurt vows revenge.','/tXSD8U5aVdGscQNcyY6C2ANVEuh.jpg','1989-04-20',98,'Released','An ancient sport becomes a deadly game.','Kickboxer',10222,7.9025,6.8,'H6Yxw4gxfpI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10641,_binary '\0','/7SLDr3SA3NSpl6il6uIhR2VuDrH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097662',6.3,6945,'en','Kill Me Again','After Faye and her psychotic boyfriend, Vince, successfully rob a mob courier, Faye decides to abscond with the loot. She heads to Reno, where she hires feckless private investigator Jack Andrews to help fake her death. He pulls the scheme off and sets up Faye with a new identity, only to have her skip out on him without paying. Jack follows her to Vegas and learns he\'s not the only one after her. Vince has discovered that she\'s still alive.','/vuYSteL8OqGLXhXfnnBVtxjxyuN.jpg','1989-10-27',94,'Released','Her last request was his first mistake.','Kill Me Again',31583,2.838,6.158,'4w15dcexYvw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10642,_binary '\0','/5JphdsJ0clJ3pAwbye5FqRdc6re.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097670',5.5,4526,'en','Kinjite: Forbidden Subjects','A brutal Los Angeles police lieutenant is determined to bust up an organization that forces underage girls into prostitution.','/7Xajyek8VgKTt43hfvs8SIpBE4B.jpg','1989-02-03',97,'Released','Desire. Temptation. Revenge.','Kinjite: Forbidden Subjects',59201,2.8222,5.584,'-Ri--GrmRRs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10643,_binary '\0','/wGV8w2PHOqS4p14JJewqyBKTt9K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097676',6.7,2312,'pl','Kogel-mogel','Following the emotions associated with entrance examinations to the faculty of pedagogy, Catherine Solska returns to his native village. And here she will surprise - the family without their knowledge to begin preparations for engagement with a rich neighbor Kolasa. Girl falls into despair, tries to oppose the decision of the parents, but is closed in his room. On visits to her fiance and flees out the window calling mail to the university. Receives misleading information and is convinced that was not accepted to college. Resigned returns home and agrees to the wedding. Meanwhile, on the eve of the wedding the postman brings the notice of acceptance to the university.','/7DNrgyNWBiGyr12Sab6LUUlhxFy.jpg','1988-08-15',105,'Released',NULL,'Egg Nogg',36392,1.9631,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10644,_binary '\0','/zX4dTyfvFoyo7dTgQa9i6s3TY3r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097694',7.8,4426,'ja','黒い雨','Shigematsu Shizuma, who lives with his family in a village near Fukuyama, was in Hiroshima with his wife and niece just after the devastating atomic bombing, a tragedy that cruelly took the lives of thousands of people and forever marked the harsh existence of the survivors.','/uHL1uJoXZeU2zG0MMcXhfgw00tB.jpg','1989-05-13',123,'Released','We do not live only to die.','Black Rain',185987,1.6848,7.6,'W2MOeUzgsQA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10645,_binary '\0','/giVwDcKUrmOqVHUi94TXgGZ1ZM7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097700',6,2966,'en','L.A. Takedown','The tale of two skilled professionals--one a cop, the other a criminal--who aren\'t as different as they think. Vincent Hanna is an intense cop on the trail of ruthless armed robber Patrick McLaren. After a botched heist, the two men confront each via a full scale battle on the seedy streets of Los Angeles.','/tzPBYA8CR2m9ChptqiR1Puob04N.jpg','1989-08-27',94,'Released','If you thought Miami was rough, you haven\'t worked the streets of L.A.','L.A. Takedown',25964,3.0735,5.5,'c4Kd-72iLug','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10646,_binary '\0','/8sCgnu9ijQdfo6CVLFjseBHrZ9E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097714',6.8,7739,'en','Last Exit to Brooklyn','A gallery of characters in Brooklyn in the 1950s are crushed by their surroundings and selves: a union strike leader discovers he is gay; a prostitute falls in love with one of her clients; a family cannot cope with the fact that their daughter is illegitimately pregnant.','/89Lg30XE7gwVZpJUk0RKqV8CtND.jpg','1989-07-26',103,'Released','The Novel That Shocked The World Is Now A Movie','Last Exit to Brooklyn',12774,3.7904,6.456,'tYZxzZ-25wo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10647,_binary '\0','/9ZcQBxhXOhsfyzBKlD48cDfe1CA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097719',6.3,1225,'de','Laurin','In a small port town, at the turn of the century, children are disappearing. A mysterious man in black who stalks the town may be Death itself. And nine-year-old Laurin is suffering terrifying dreams and hallucinations of a man carrying a sack and frightened children calling for help from behind closed windows.','/3rmse88RwfOiYNncUI3ngwWrg7w.jpg','1989-11-30',84,'Released',NULL,'Laurin',114349,1.2812,5.5,'yLk8UbpW468','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10648,_binary '\0','/f4cilOhPkg90LfH8jgzNuuVx12H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097722',7.4,25077,'en','Lean On Me','When principal Joe Clark takes over decaying Eastside High School, he\'s faced with students wearing gang colors and graffiti-covered walls. Determined to do anything he must to turn the school around, he expels suspected drug dealers, padlocks doors and demands effort and results from students, staff and parents. Autocratic to a fault, this real-life educator put it all on the line.','/7xOyz2NlaoqZ6xIjJh0Goptm0tP.jpg','1989-03-03',108,'Released','Eastside High was out of control...until Joe Clark took it back.','Lean On Me',14621,5.2285,7.299,'evA9nkdOhKU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10649,_binary '\0','/9DPNXojDaPgembBoOaH6OpvBIZF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097727',7.4,1747,'hu','A legényanya','In the small village of Rátót, every male is called Béla. When a woman gives birth to her child, she names him Józsi...','/dBCV0xUfOm3k7rJ1sPit8HpOgRl.jpg','1989-08-03',80,'Released',NULL,'The Pregnant Papa',40405,0.8052,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10650,_binary '\0','/kevyDBlyEJvQOPGd0b3BbtPKqrK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097728',7,9607,'fi','Leningrad Cowboys Go America','The Leningrad Cowboys, a group of Siberian musicians, and their manager, travel to America seeking fame and fortune. As they cross the country, trying to get to a wedding in Mexico, they are followed by the village idiot, who wishes to join the band.','/rYI5IAKwqOl6nPcAYL58VzI0EXN.jpg','1989-03-24',79,'Released',NULL,'Leningrad Cowboys Go America',11475,2.4971,7,'hwkyuWcLfJ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10651,_binary '\0','/tuKshkbc77RAZKbLfE1XOXgXrxV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097731',6.8,7406,'en','Let It Ride','An average kind of guy who has a slight problem with gambling goes to the track, and mystically, it seems as though he can\'t lose, no matter how he bets; and he has an incredible day.','/t5sJfj99wACezWFz2jtHQplQkUM.jpg','1989-08-18',90,'Released','Everyone in the world deserves a day like this.','Let It Ride',19118,2.8572,6.333,'qQetzM5zJus','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10652,_binary '\0','/uY8i4RABFyBpH2cmFWMVLEswopD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097733',7.3,203199,'en','Lethal Weapon 2','Riggs and Murtaugh are on the trail of South African diplomats using their immunity to engage in criminal activities.','/1EEIUw0tkX7AJZ1ikZrtKZZKlC6.jpg','1989-07-07',114,'Released','The magic is back!','Lethal Weapon 2',942,14.7992,7.048,'xGcCI8JWCic','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10653,_binary '\0','/21JdNVQc49WnLVjYtvDgBJ5AymB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097737',5.8,27465,'en','Leviathan','Underwater deep-sea miners encounter a Soviet wreck and bring back a dangerous cargo to their base on the ocean floor with horrifying results. The crew of the mining base must fight to survive against a genetic mutation that hunts them down one by one.','/extm7kFsxr0qMoi1G5F3w5Lwlt4.jpg','1989-03-17',98,'Released','How long can you hold your breath?','Leviathan',14372,4.6271,6,'8t_ScV5C_J8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10654,_binary '\0','/p6VFbg5lhWj0RCgXf5dj6IDMPvt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097742',6.7,121762,'en','Licence to Kill','After capturing the notorious drug lord Franz Sanchez, Bond\'s close friend and former CIA agent Felix Leiter is left for dead and his wife is murdered. Bond goes rogue and seeks vengeance on those responsible, as he infiltrates Sanchez\'s organization from the inside.','/8nzJve63EXA79HGAyidZwivZrQ2.jpg','1989-06-13',133,'Released','James Bond is out on his own and out for revenge.','Licence to Kill',709,16.2409,6.4,'cebTl_S2dJw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10655,_binary '\0','/rOrJibswZOECnu59lXUiG8Qd2SU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097756',5.3,1413,'en','Listen to Me','It was the best time of their lives. A kid from Oklahoma. An immigrant\'s daughter. A senator\'s son, a society girl, and a college professor with a dream. They had one thing in common...the will to win. A group of college debaters learn about the world, friendships, love, dreams and family.','/jjSrr8gtYUKOIVuutjAGFsxAGrS.jpg','1989-05-05',107,'Released','It\'s about real life.','Listen to Me',86408,1.9065,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10656,_binary '\0','/qGZXYHvWR1TYOU9raCaEABrj9m7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097757',7.6,315478,'en','The Little Mermaid','This colorful adventure tells the story of an impetuous mermaid princess named Ariel who falls in love with the very human Prince Eric and puts everything on the line for the chance to be with him. Memorable songs and characters -- including the villainous sea witch Ursula.','/plcZXvI310FkbwIptvd6rqk63LP.jpg','1989-11-17',83,'Released','Somewhere under the sea and beyond your imagination is an adventure in fantasy.','The Little Mermaid',10144,24.9713,7.4,'ZGZX5-PAwR8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10657,_binary '\0','/1zE5hF4ZsOzruEaWYq3oZ0qnUW6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097758',6.1,15590,'en','Little Monsters','A young boy is scared of the monster under his bed. He asks his 6th grade brother to swap rooms for the night as a bet that the monster really exists. Soon the brother becomes friends with the monster and discovers a whole new world of fun and games under his bed where pulling pranks on kids and other monsters is the main attraction.','/ynQT9NA4SBfoswIRkyrwqHe4aBz.jpg','1989-08-25',102,'Released','They cause all the trouble. But you’ll have all the fun.','Little Monsters',15138,4.3742,5.818,'t_J3AIv39pI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10658,_binary '\0','/ux4QfxmTy01AvEfdjse1CIrVjWv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097769',5.6,1836,'en','The Local Stigmatic','Two symbiotic sociopaths play obscurely deviant mind games with each other while engaging in perversely brutal acts of violence against victims apparently chosen at random','/iP1q3x2EIcmq6jRem9AwpVEjGZw.jpg','1990-03-01',56,'Released','Turning back was never an option.','The Local Stigmatic',72781,1.7387,5.1,'OogcDeakw1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10659,_binary '\0','/ktjvcmg2L2PvKjb6z96rkQg3wTv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097770',6.4,48909,'en','Lock Up','Frank Leone is nearing the end of his prison term for a relatively minor crime. Just before he is paroled, however, Warden Drumgoole takes charge. Drumgoole was assigned to a hell-hole prison after his administration was publicly humiliated by Leone, and has now arrived on the scene to ensure that Leone never sees the light of day.','/WihoHaU9yvhhdoSqDAhiIlNN8g.jpg','1989-08-04',109,'Released','How much can a man take...before he gives back?','Lock Up',9972,7.7571,6.796,'dUFLTi-nKmk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10660,_binary '\0','/yBtlggwkBiu47uBdXLh075Fp40M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097775',5.7,3245,'cn','黃飛鴻92之龍行天下','When old martial arts master Master Tak disappears, his best student, Jet, steps in to find him. However, when he learns that Tak\'s life is in danger, he decides to protect him at all costs.','/j9Eji1A8AyelmdHCJTlVBCZziGK.jpg','1992-05-28',92,'Released','Loyalty. Honor. Vengence.','The Master',20811,3.3243,6.6,'VlJF107CNHM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10661,_binary '\0','/q6EN30g9zFkYuKujLVfv9EKZnZB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097778',6,90616,'en','Look Who\'s Talking','After a single, career-minded woman is left on her own to give birth to the child of a married man, she finds a new romantic chance in a cab driver. Meanwhile, the point-of-view of the newborn baby is narrated through voice-over.','/uVM0D7Q6U9H6xMSZmMdfwECih5h.jpg','1989-10-12',96,'Released','He\'s hip, he\'s cool, and he\'s only 3 months old.','Look Who\'s Talking',9494,7.6926,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10662,_binary '\0','/5C58nV1nl8jIaBwdUFh2ylHq8Cz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097781',2.7,1617,'en','Lords of the Deep','Man has finally conquered the ocean. America\'s first self-contained undersea laboratory is the pride of the nation, and expectations are high for an elaborate undersea mining operation. What wasn\'t expected was the inhabitants of an undiscovered world.','/uCxcVt1FMCc7dXckfuNCndgZ5zw.jpg','1989-06-02',77,'Released','The ultimate underwater adventure!','Lords of the Deep',222323,2.4036,3.3,'Z5MiaKZv7b0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10663,_binary '\0','/kVstr8qLiYHZZRshEZAz9yn4Uc5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097790',6.1,9693,'en','Loverboy','Randy Bodek works as a pizza delivery boy at Señor Pizza to make a few extra bucks. Some customers are special, though: When the order is for a pizza with extra anchovies, it means the female customers are looking for some loving. But, as Randy soon learns, life as a professional gigolo can get pretty complicated.','/qqg2U5Jk4jnQUWDXZjq489V2D0A.jpg','1989-04-28',99,'Released','Randy Bodek has no idea how to treat a woman . . . but he\'s working on it.','Loverboy',17362,3.6371,6.1,'3WL36Bmvu4A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10664,_binary '\0','/ooGaNXI2OYszAajCFdIXLr73E1S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097814',7.8,191910,'ja','魔女の宅急便','A young witch, on her mandatory year of independent life, finds fitting into a new community difficult while she supports herself by running an air courier service.','/Aufa4YdZIv4AXpR9rznwVA5SEfd.jpg','1989-07-29',103,'Released','I was feeling blue, but I\'m better now.','Kiki\'s Delivery Service',16859,14.0731,7.839,'4bG17OYs-GA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10665,_binary '\0','/v37dE7vn1xogzcxOrHoVbdG2pH3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097815',7.3,84134,'en','Major League','When Rachel Phelps inherits the Cleveland Indians from her deceased husband, she\'s determined to move the team to a warmer climate—but only a losing season will make that possible, which should be easy given the misfits she\'s hired. Rachel is sure her dream will come true, but she underestimates their will to succeed.','/ypUedY9zX4nGGf1lQv1UGc8PhPA.jpg','1989-02-16',107,'Released','A comedy with bats and balls.','Major League',9942,6.159,6.908,'7O6QHXQE6Cc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10666,_binary '\0','/ufiaba4f14mY2xM8VqX0B9ur1Kw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097839',6.7,1780,'fr','Marquis','On the eve of revolution, French activist and author Marquis and his talking penis, Colin, await judgment in the Bastille for allegedly plotting against the state. While Marquis dedicates himself to his art and Colin longs for action, the provocative pair unwittingly rouse the interest of competing ideological factions.','/nYuJROKtanslSpoKCPj60CHOhKX.jpg','1989-04-26',83,'Released','A bizarre tale of sex, lust, and the French Revolution','Marquis',36068,2.3984,6.5,'TurGEdz-y_Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10667,_binary '\0','/fnwHwKWBbIvNPcED6tSpkVtzh8R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097841',7.3,2623,'it','Marrakech Express','After learning that an old friend of theirs has been arrested in Morocco on drug charges, four former college buddies set out for Marrakech to bail him out.','/9QOS44UiZLhnXSD9Df8S5u4QOfM.jpg','1989-05-11',106,'Released',NULL,'Marrakech Express',41583,1.3127,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10668,_binary '\0','/u5C1idyRNKs4m0MS3fkgzOh0WRu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097843',7.8,2480,'fa','مشق شب','Young male students at a local Iranian school are asked about their feelings on homework.','/x1rOem03BuSjLWbAiOXr5JGzCBr.jpg','1989-01-01',78,'Released',NULL,'Homework',145075,1.5555,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10669,_binary '\0','/qH5csXNM6ji8YaTM139fCHWAorc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097851',8.2,1828,'ml','മതിലുകൾ','Mathilukal (\'Walls\') is a free adaptation of the novelette of the same name, written by the celebrated Malayalam writer, Vaikom Muhammad Basheer. Autobiographical in character, it is set against the background of India’s freedom struggle in the ’40s when he was serving a term of imprisonment in the Trivandrum Central Jail. When the film opens, we see Basheer in a police lock-up, quite at home in the company of a few petty criminals. He has been languishing there for more than a year now without a trial.','/gPZDmGkzOvJSRaHK3LF8Fb7kPX.jpg','1990-05-18',120,'Released','What is Freedom?','Mathilukal',255607,2.2318,7.6,'hRryXGnKP_Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10670,_binary '\0','/fji432Vjgj89p0ISOJONYyfNUmy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097858',6.6,22027,'en','Meet the Feebles','Heidi the Hippo, star of \'The Feebles Variety Hour\', discovers her lover Bletch the Walrus is cheating on her. And with all the world waiting for the big show, the assorted co-stars must contend with drug addiction, extortion, robbery, disease, Vietnam flashbacks, drug dealing, and murder.','/31DqGazwdE9N4Y9FHC6Q4NvstuW.jpg','1989-08-12',93,'Released','Welcome to the jungle!','Meet the Feebles',8216,2.8735,6.347,'FON5KnEKReA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10671,_binary '\0','/5y98LdgXJPSo2n4vLJhTLCN78PS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097870',7.4,1412,'it','Mery per sempre','Marco, a teacher from Milan, relocates to Palermo and takes a temporary job teaching in a juvenile detention centre while he waits for a high school teaching position. He tries to understand and motivate his handful of students, encouraging them to stand up for their rights, finding out about their histories: Natale, in for murder and enamored with the Mafia; Pietro, who can\'t seem to stay out of jail; Claudio, barely 14 and learning to stand up for himself; and Mery, a trans sex worker, who was arrested after a fight with a trick who didn\'t want to pay her, and is now stuck in a male prison.','/iGgJH7580UkEaqrwxMolpqQ7a1X.jpg','1989-05-04',102,'Released',NULL,'Mary Forever',41585,2.0021,7.431,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10672,_binary '\0','/jbKXgSUmx4DRAYt1oNgD3XdLem3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097871',6.7,1278,'fr','Mes meilleurs copains','They are the best friends of the world. Five friends who shared everything: may 68, hippies years, the rock and their love for Bernadette. This Bernadette has left them to become a rock-star, and is back 15 years later for a weekend. Jean-Marie Poire describes with this movie the portrait of a generation with lots of humor served by excelent actors.','/noc88VmiOh2RD4OuXH6MlspoYdT.jpg','1989-03-01',110,'Released',NULL,'My Best Pals',51326,1.3567,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10673,_binary '\0','/wXf4G2Urk0Vq42hD2w5mSmW47N8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097872',6,2546,'fr','Mes nuits sont plus belles que vos jours','Lucas has invented a new computer language but at the same time he has been informed about his strange terminal illness during which he has been gradually losing his memory. Shortly after that he meets Blanche who acts as a medium in a bizarre traveling show. Dying Lucas follows her to the sea resort where they spend together several days and nights.','/jrQHMMVBRIlGREEvPzvgC5HkVd4.jpg','1989-04-19',110,'Released',NULL,'My Nights Are More Beautiful Than Your Days',73764,3.0183,6.1,'TT0iYpsOiBU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10674,_binary '\0','/l3jmOKhIVzjYsYme3uylVjBXSUu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097874',4,1269,'en','Metamorphosis','A geneticists working on a drug to stop ageing tries it upon himself with horrendous consequences.','/5JD2gl3IKH2B8mueEjD7KGvVeVu.jpg','1990-08-07',96,'Released','Witness the Change!','Metamorphosis',36529,1.1319,4.2,'7dQXov518XU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10675,_binary '\0','/qccvASmkC7b9uCrEeTVGTkEbdjH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097880',6,7784,'en','The Mighty Quinn','Police chief Xavier Quinn investigates the gruesome murder of Donald Pater, one of the wealthiest residents on a Caribbean island. He was found decapitated in his Jacuzzi. Although the local political establishment, especially crooked Governor Chalk, insists that small-time thief Maubee is responsible, Xavier has his doubts. This view is complicated by the police chief\'s personal history with Maubee: The men have been friends since childhood.','/4slxiAx6kBl7h80df2xOobWRUTZ.jpg','1989-02-17',98,'Released','The chief of police and the chief suspect know each other too well to let a little thing like murder get in their way.','The Mighty Quinn',31004,2.9853,6,'CcbcAUnYbrs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10676,_binary '\0','/coikapUWLhdIie0PdmEjf881zmF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097883',5.8,7715,'en','Millennium','An investigator seeking the cause of an airline disaster discovers the involvement of an organisation of time travellers from a future Earth irreparably polluted who seek to rejuvenate the human race from those about to die in the past. Based on a novel by John Varley.','/mFGCK7RnFnRXR6CweAhQw030Zv7.jpg','1989-08-25',105,'Released','Beyond the boundaries of time... they are waiting for you!','Millennium',4296,2.4308,5.4,'S0k8xDtHnNM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10677,_binary '\0','/q5j9eGUnA9LZkasdv0To2DzqEs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097884',7.2,3682,'fr','Milou en Mai','During the events of May 1968 in France, different worldviews of conflicting relatives collide in their family estate.','/8AnNzNDKuteS7BthVJGwqv31B6i.jpg','1990-01-24',107,'Released',NULL,'May Fools',1785,2.2803,6.9,'9ECPrxe6aCU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10678,_binary '\0','/5BXxxMvcnWQiFnrnB756uyOl7RX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097889',7,15418,'en','Miracle Mile','After 30 years of searching, Harry has finally met the girl of his dreams. Unfortunately, before they even have a chance to go on their first date, Harry intercepts some chilling news: WWIII has begun and nuclear missiles will destroy Los Angeles in less than an hour!','/9qRCVO9L3s3CsPnoUO9c3iZm6aB.jpg','1989-05-19',88,'Released','There are 70 minutes to the end of the world. Where can you hide?','Miracle Mile',24739,4.39,6.9,'PtaM2hFve_o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10679,_binary '\0','/z4i4lQhZ6jGmfK5INFMets2HkF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097891',6.1,1306,'en','Wilt','Henry Wilt is a more or less failed teacher who fantasizes about murdering his dominant, non-attentive wife Eva. At a party who gets stuck in an inflatable doll and makes a complete fool of himself. Eventually, he dumps the doll in a hole at a building site. However, he has been witnessed getting rid of the doll and when his wife disappears on the night after the party, the police and Inspector Flint have strong suspicions on Mr Wilt.','/bCtlP8MmcQig98jsmcLYKQaxkCD.jpg','1989-05-12',92,'Released','Has the shocking truth about Henry Wilt been inflated?','Wilt',44561,1.039,6.4,'0XThUxhog2o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10680,_binary '\0','/egQTbn08qF5IjpPZB71FlS7laJ8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097892',6.1,2543,'en','Miss Firecracker','Unhappy Carnelle Scott is desperate to escape her reputation as Yazoo City\'s \'Miss Hot Tamale.\' She throws herself into a do-or-die effort to win the Mississippi town\'s big talent contest, an honor won ten years ago by her older sister and unattainable role model Elain.','/pgCceswgp74CKtss7JmdtXDljiD.jpg','1989-04-28',102,'Released','An explosive comedy!','Miss Firecracker',39197,2.0259,5.8,'KR-sknz8f9A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10681,_binary '\0','/1iKSLAWr5cC1EzKwybwm1INeIEq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097904',7.5,7711,'fr','Monsieur Hire','A French man spies on a lovely younger woman across the way. When he\'s spotted by the woman shortly after being questioned by the police about a local murder, the man\'s simple life becomes more complicated.','/kMsBEphWESeTs4uUAuPpjkIFSKg.jpg','1989-05-24',79,'Released',NULL,'Monsieur Hire',38695,2.1087,7.242,'elNCMX8EzAM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10682,_binary '\0','/sWExgcLS5zqCsVeGpuhVqK8Q4YO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097910',5.1,6386,'en','Moon 44','Year 2038: The mineral resources of the earth are drained, in space there are fights for the last deposits on other planets and satellites. This is the situation when one of the bigger mining corporations has lost all but one mineral moons and many of their fully automatic mining robots are disappearing on their flight home. Since nobody else wants the job, they send prisoners to defend the mining station. Among them undercover agent Stone, who shall clear the whereabouts of the expensive robots. In an atmosphere of corruption, fear and hatred he gets between the fronts of rivaling groups.','/ia7Ew8QXiN1Urh63xYFYZ7ZfF2t.jpg','1990-02-15',98,'Released','In the outer zone... you need a friend','Moon 44',2927,2.9241,5.1,'3M9CKUPzUjc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10683,_binary '\0','/cJyspgBEmxhtYhQKEXox41aC7Cq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097911',4.8,4310,'en','Moontrap','The Space Shuttle returns to earth, but some of the equipment brought back on it begins to behave strangely. Scientists are unsure what is happening, and decide to take all necessary precautions.','/9FNWwOSBF7HjzXrKHamk3A3m0QC.jpg','1989-04-28',92,'Released','14,000 Years It Has Waited For Us','Moontrap',14916,2.5037,4.828,'QkUb2iy47cQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10684,_binary '\0','/zjKg04EquTcnVZUfjHboXnXzjcF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097937',7.8,85985,'en','My Left Foot: The Story of Christy Brown','No one expects much from Christy Brown, a boy with cerebral palsy born into a working-class Irish family. Though Christy is a spastic quadriplegic and essentially paralyzed, a miraculous event occurs when, at the age of 5, he demonstrates control of his left foot by using chalk to scrawl a word on the floor. With the help of his steely mother — and no shortage of grit and determination — Christy overcomes his infirmity to become a painter, poet and author.','/GRAAl0bMQFoFIjV3aunc5jsM5u.jpg','1989-04-07',103,'Released','A film about life, laughter, and the occasional miracle.','My Left Foot: The Story of Christy Brown',10161,6.5216,7.538,'xj7yME23Hes','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10685,_binary '\0','/snbXJYXzFrzk739tMCqSkT0hiP7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097938',4.5,1524,'en','My Mom\'s a Werewolf','The frustrated housewife Leslie visits an animal shop to purchase a flea-collar. Unknowing that the owner is a werewolf, she accepts his invitation to lunch and later in his apartment. Through a bite in her toe he starts her slow transformation in a werewolf. Home again, she desperately tries to hide the often disgusting process from her family, but her daughter Jennifer and her - from horror magazines well educated - friend recognize what\'s going on, and help to kill the non-human.','/7Wu3uPNbmmaAsZI1CFK6PY87XGN.jpg','1989-05-11',88,'Released','Jennifer\'s mother is having an identity crisis.','My Mom\'s a Werewolf',2199,2.5002,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10686,_binary '\0','/nmSGsYxdshs3ubXtwe407knCnvu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097939',7.3,1521,'en','My Name Is Bill W.','Based on the true story of Bill W. (James Woods), a successful stock broker whose life falls apart after the stock crash of the 20\'s and how he comes to grips with his alcoholism. Along with a fellow alcoholic (James Garner) he forms a support group that would eventually become Alcoholics Anonymous.','/54Ggd8vaWs7PzGuTKLDsWP38OAv.jpg','1989-04-30',100,'Released',NULL,'My Name Is Bill W.',15727,2.4263,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10687,_binary '\0','/t0GxYLiPkTtFBuzoPLmLU3HSKEN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097940',7.5,33307,'en','Mystery Train','In Memphis, Tennessee, over the course of a single night, the Arcade Hotel, run by an eccentric night clerk and a clueless bellboy, is visited by a young Japanese couple traveling in search of the roots of rock; an Italian woman in mourning who stumbles upon a fleeing charlatan girl; and a comical trio of accidental thieves looking for a place to hide.','/f11xq7dBGhz9UDc3dabldAGeXVH.jpg','1989-09-06',106,'Released',NULL,'Mystery Train',11305,4.7226,7.3,'ZzyMVe-pKvo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10688,_binary '\0','/2WnitfiMDe57udXnPFRSje8guag.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097942',5.7,1713,'id','Leák','An anthropologist named Cathy travels to Bali with her lover to conduct research on black magic. There, they encounter the queen of the Leák cult, a shapeshifting witch who feasts on blood and soon makes Cathy carry out her evil deeds.','/wilJzt8iRKXbgOf2w5cN6khbWuB.jpg','1981-01-01',85,'Released','She sold her soul to possess the secrets of black magic...','Mystics in Bali',71821,2.2178,5.8,'-vmhWPvDca8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10689,_binary '\0','/klH8ti8LUaEhktnjdHb1RW8Yq6w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097958',7.5,248985,'en','National Lampoon\'s Christmas Vacation','It\'s Christmastime, and the Griswolds are preparing for a family seasonal celebration. But things never run smoothly for Clark, his wife Ellen, and their two kids. Clark\'s continual bad luck is worsened by his obnoxious family guests, but he manages to keep going, knowing that his Christmas bonus is due soon.','/oat42hUw8XzKYUmfy0YLAxYd484.jpg','1989-11-30',97,'Released','Yule crack up!','National Lampoon\'s Christmas Vacation',5825,12.8555,7.232,'tLVd4ipC5Lc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10690,_binary '\0','/41EKMZkoZY2GSGwGLVsZIRVFViM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097965',6.4,21090,'en','New York Stories','Three tales of love, ambition, and neurosis unfold in the city that never sleeps. In \"Life Lessons\" (Martin Scorsese), a tormented painter channels heartbreak into his art. In \"Life Without Zoë\" (Francis Ford Coppola), a precocious 12-year-old navigates privilege and loneliness in a Manhattan hotel. And in \"Oedipus Wrecks\" (Woody Allen), a man’s domineering mother literally becomes a looming presence over New York.','/mViGEH5dfsAnUgJmce1RJkFycAi.jpg','1989-03-10',124,'Released','One city. Three stories tall.','New York Stories',9686,4.9037,6.2,'mqNoTUstmDc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10691,_binary '\0','/gYtBxbJIeJTOFEIdCzYITSHIB4d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097967',5.9,12636,'en','Next of Kin','Truman Gates, a Chicago cop, sets out to find his brother\'s killer. Meanwhile, another of his brothers, Briar (a hillbilly) decides to find the killer himself.','/ieM9upg9O4agtodEvlZIiuNKZsN.jpg','1989-10-20',108,'Released','A Chicago cop from the hills of Kentucky. Hunting his brother\'s killer. Seeking justice country style.','Next of Kin',27418,4.6063,5.9,'hHWC5Kvl3-c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10692,_binary '\0','/miD9sMBWE7NUjien5lqFNxsKtde.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097971',5.1,2014,'en','Night Game','A police detective tracks a serial killer who is stalking young women on a beach front after each game that a baseball pitcher wins.','/kZg7ECrfCQfbsCPvnfrsyGrERxV.jpg','1989-09-15',95,'Released','Three Strikes...She\'s Dead','Night Game',84071,2.0538,4.667,'mR60v8i-Jw0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10693,_binary '\0','/48eGqD1OvrCPC7zqCEaD6GDiqoT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097981',5.1,56623,'en','A Nightmare on Elm Street: The Dream Child','The pregnant Alice finds Freddy Krueger striking through the sleeping mind of her unborn child, hoping to be reborn into the real world.','/kizvpgXQfrAgN8FhOd87LbKk6kO.jpg','1989-08-11',89,'Released','Freddy delivers.','A Nightmare on Elm Street: The Dream Child',10160,7.4271,5.4,'LFm_jiI8RiA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10694,_binary '\0','/1upyFSMYBu2kKeGqPNoE039Wvn3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097987',4.4,7747,'en','No Holds Barred','Rip is the World Wrestling Federation champion who is faithful to his fans and the network he wrestles for, but Brell, the new head of the World Television Network, wants Rip to wrestle for his network.','/6BmhGmMF53mIsJuUYSwyLfCaTfu.jpg','1989-06-02',93,'Released','No Ring · No Ref · No Rules','No Holds Barred',39002,2.3993,4.7,'H7vx5iVDnYY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10695,_binary '\0','/2eIOiCLslKcsuSiyVcrs2ti8R4S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097991',5.1,2561,'en','No Retreat, No Surrender 2: Raging Thunder','In this sequel, Scott Wylde, an American kickboxer, must go to Cambodia to rescue his Vietnamese girlfriend from Russian and Vietnamese troops.','/lkcccWO9UtQIzJIGXCT0Maem39o.jpg','1987-11-05',104,'Released','It\'s not a rematch, it\'s war!','No Retreat, No Surrender 2: Raging Thunder',42012,3.7665,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10696,_binary '\0','/h8jhI6FiMcCCKpSxl1ehCkhtPaX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0097995',6.8,3114,'fr','Noce blanche','A philosophy professor has an illicit affair with one of his students, a bright yet troubled girl who lives alone.','/AoR69wN0JDzq7DWW9a5rhiMSNZq.jpg','1989-11-08',92,'Released',NULL,'White Wedding',37533,3.5985,6.614,'nkTUryhP9ms','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10697,_binary '\0','/onJcliYmFoGM8NrAWs6sZl8mpCB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098019',6.9,6166,'cn','奇蹟','A country boy becomes the head of a gang through the purchase of some lucky roses from an old lady. He and a singer at the gang\'s nightclub try to do a good deed for the old lady when her daughter comes to visit.','/70OnveJQzlYji1TOoODNGrU9Mjj.jpg','1989-06-15',126,'Released','Meet the original gangster!','Miracles: The Canton Godfather',25074,4.6904,7.109,'68runFBrG5M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10698,_binary '\0','/n7jXcwLwbxIblE5UlDuhZveZ4Cd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098022',5.7,2261,'en','Old Gringo','A writer forms a triangle with a schoolmarm and a Mexican general on the run.','/oNy1OOaCXJ6IQOrZaeLhDGnt4XD.jpg','1989-09-13',120,'Released','A woman inspired by a man of dreams swept into the arms of a general, and drawn into a worlds of danger.','Old Gringo',43345,1.6854,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10699,_binary '\0','/22NBpdNrQm4zbjjcYpYBDY2WCcP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098040',5.8,3019,'de','Otto - Der Außerfriesische','Otto is the only one who is able to save his Frisian fatherland; but he needs the help of his brother, who is abroad. But his brother does not want to fulfill what he has sworn as a child. So it takes Otto a while to convince him while time is running low for his plans to save East-Frisia.','/eM89lVuj3qRu0q4e7N4ZyCd1GHv.jpg','1989-07-12',92,'Released',NULL,'Otto – The Alien from East Frisia',9379,1.8945,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10700,_binary '\0','/gfrljp4a3imYQbqAzbEhKJCZzF6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098048',2.5,2230,'en','Outlaw of Gor','An Earthman returns to the planet Gor, and fights against tyranny.','/ct1HFjuesjSFgb564EzMWrrlOPP.jpg','1988-12-01',89,'Released',NULL,'Outlaw of Gor',31131,1.575,2.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10701,_binary '\0','/5P3EeDAzFPScaDx0IAJbPJJxWOW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098051',6.4,14549,'en','The Package','Experienced Green Beret sergeant Johnny Gallagher is escorting a prisoner, Airborne Ranger Thomas Boyette, back to the US, but Boyette escapes and Gallagher must risk life and limb to catch him.','/pInBodZ7xrX8JL7KPL4G9kM5gRW.jpg','1989-08-25',108,'Released','He\'s one man racing against time to stop the most explosive conspiracy in history.','The Package',31606,4.6687,6.1,'fuxCToaPa7Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10702,_binary '\0','/qAdQ7ZmzlMSVOc2dPtNq5tjroEZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098052',5,1328,'it','Paganini','Legendary \"devil violinist\" Niccolo Paganini sets all of 19th century Europe into frenzy.','/mDjPdNgI8xTvm2sjyYCcsJRgO35.jpg','1990-05-25',85,'Released',NULL,'Paganini',62734,1.9506,5.3,'ZC6J_AfpLI4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10703,_binary '\0','/57mx95upTi0lEB9VTN53tsWakfE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098055',7.1,3469,'it','Palombella rossa','Michele is an MP for the Italian Communist Party who loses his memory in a car crash, though hardly anyone around him seems to notice. During a crucial water polo match on the eve of election day, he gradually begins to remember his past life, revealing a man whose personal and political identity crisis mirrors that of Italian communism itself.','/kk8Xv0j7m3CGrSRPoIEitxtEP3N.jpg','1989-09-15',89,'Released',NULL,'Palombella rossa',56521,1.8799,7.139,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10704,_binary '\0','/q73LK360vOxcH1VS8MuLBj8TaXJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098061',6.6,6851,'en','Paperhouse','A young girl lost in the loneliness and boredom of reality finds solace in an ill boy, whom she can visit in a surreal dream world that she drew in her school composition book.','/ZblvybDhNSbEheAF9h8i0iUrdl.jpg','1988-09-10',92,'Released','A drawing that became a dream. A dream that became reality.','Paperhouse',41965,2.3562,6.5,'BOE0WQ-GVEA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10705,_binary '\0','/xj8k8qWuX0XstkxRloYX0ls0OsG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098063',5.5,6413,'it','Paprika','In 1957 Trieste, a few months before the general ban on brothels, inexperienced country girl Mimma becomes Paprika to finance her useless boyfriend as a prostitute. Amid the hustle and bustle of Rome, Paprika drifts from one brothel to another as she learns the ropes and works her way up one client at a time. However, as Paprika embarks on a stormy journey of self-discovery and sexual liberation, the sense that something is missing haunts her. Is Paprika meant to experience a passionate romance and solve the great mystery of true love?','/oNnvAJkPWH5enUBexmmbrxxebxR.jpg','1991-02-13',116,'Released','Tinto Brass re-opens the closed houses!','Paprika',50270,2.4694,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10706,_binary '\0','/zdWdI9k8UroWuMjALiftO6WTXu1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098067',7.1,59627,'en','Parenthood','The story of the Buckman family and friends, attempting to bring up their children. They suffer/enjoy all the events that occur: estranged relatives, the \'black sheep\' of the family, the eccentrics, the skeletons in the closet, and the rebellious teenagers.','/29Y6yg0gSurkFYTh54yxDzLBmrT.jpg','1989-07-31',124,'Released','It could happen to you.','Parenthood',1552,5.0779,6.7,'RgrbuRNc-AQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10707,_binary '\0','/AnZ4CfOxOW1GXMfCF4XBeaO8NWi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098068',6.1,9840,'en','Parents','Michael is a young boy living in a typical 1950s suburbanite home... except for his bizarre and horrific nightmares, and continued unease around his parents. Young Michael begins to suspect his parents are cooking more than just hamburgers on the grill outside, but has trouble explaining his fears to his new-found friend Sheila, or the school\'s social worker.','/uGRD9xksz3t4qdOMXcrf6NWtNsO.jpg','1989-01-27',82,'Released','There\'s A New Name For Terror...','Parents',27607,1.87,5.9,'VVDxDXq1VEY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10708,_binary '\0','/iVVxQrerIrXVsdi5ffdJC83V5qu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098072',5.1,1251,'it','Paura nel buio','A sick young man drives around in his daddy\'s camper, looking for lone stray females to kidnap, torture, rape and murder.','/5EvkUDS2Epdqbx7j8KsUw7jYx7w.jpg','1989-01-01',95,'Released',NULL,'Hitcher in the Dark',28318,1.1886,4.6,'Y4EcOVlQtNQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10709,_binary '\0','/eE7mVFd0NvWV93BkUggGaYmo9CA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098073',5.7,2162,'en','Penn & Teller Get Killed','The \"bad boys of magic\" go over the edge in this mind-blowing, role-switching comedy murder mystery set in the dizzying world of Atlantic City casinos. In a TV interview, Penn mentions his idea of a fun practical joke: \"I wish someone were trying to kill me. It would give focus to my life, excitement. I\'d be like James Bond.\" Twenty million people hear him. One decides to deliver a punchline he\'ll never forget. Made by people who thought Psycho was a comedy, Penn & Teller Get Killed (they also wrote the piece) features Caitlin Clarke as the femme fatale and David Patrick Kelly as the Edgar Allan Poe-esque nutcase with a new mission. Arthur Penn, known for hip masterpieces like Bonnie and Clyde, Alice\'s Restaurant and Little Big Man, directs with roller-coaster pacing and subversive intelligence.','/UAa8AVZfNiISv3K8eKfyuzSAxI.jpg','1989-09-22',89,'Released','What more do you want?','Penn & Teller Get Killed',37146,1.8631,5.6,'2Kx5Ex3848k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10710,_binary '\0','/xWq3T9P4NU2pTdZ3hXFygsNnAq4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098084',6.5,125442,'en','Pet Sematary','After the Creed family\'s cat is accidentally killed, a friendly neighbor advises its burial in a mysterious nearby cemetery.','/8ZtH1V4rhrtP53ezlEWrCaMALXF.jpg','1989-04-21',103,'Released','Sometimes dead is better.','Pet Sematary',8913,13.0307,6.7,'jpjpUOXQZac','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10711,_binary '\0','/dSDxg5smngWUVao6KiDd80saw7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098087',6.8,2583,'fr','La Petite Voleuse','In a small town in post-WWII France, 16-year-old Janine tries to improve her conditions by any means necessary. Three people—Michel, a married lover; Raoul, a fellow thief; Mauricette, a photographer she meets in prison—will help her learn from her mistakes.','/dyKrL3Al1f1T4VWHOyAjSgORBq2.jpg','1988-12-21',110,'Released',NULL,'The Little Thief',8768,2.5108,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10712,_binary '\0','/wFmjT6dz0u6tqXHUdjxe9XVEOMM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098089',5.4,2697,'en','Phantom of the Mall: Eric\'s Revenge','A young man named Eric apparently dies in a suspicious house fire after saving his girlfriend, Melody. One year later, a new mall is constructed atop where Eric\'s house once stood, where a shadowy, uninvited guest is preying on the mall\'s crooked developers.','/wYRa7WT8NMvdcgtBtx1rL7iHtib.jpg','1989-12-01',91,'Released','Prices Aren\'t The Only Thing Being Slashed!','Phantom of the Mall: Eric\'s Revenge',86326,2.0662,5.3,'EwRF-lto0y0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10713,_binary '\0','/aOeMR8hakZfkZ5aSw7Kkz7TxfIv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098090',5.5,4969,'en','The Phantom of the Opera','An aspiring opera singer finds herself transported back to Victorian-era London -- and into the arms of a reclusive, disfigured maestro determined to make her a star.','/ie03D5WcIKW5AHXM59KTU6TRvmf.jpg','1989-11-04',93,'Released','ROBERT ENGLUND Was \"Freddy.\" Now he\'s the... Phantom OF THE OPERA!','The Phantom of the Opera',86962,3.1003,5.667,'WMPlkaqBNSo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10714,_binary '\0','/gUzpYrDORlQabSnLXqdgagxPpgI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098093',5.2,2333,'en','Physical Evidence','A police officer suspended and now accused of murder is forced to join forces with his court-appointed attorney to assemble the pieces of a deadly puzzle to find the missing link before time runs out.','/3tBOiYvoDKlimXBrK5MCXXKkyHe.jpg','1989-01-27',99,'Released','If he\'s innocent, the truth could save him. If he\'s guilty, the lies could kill her.','Physical Evidence',41938,2.6557,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10715,_binary '\0','/9RhXdYh1fYMpz1s1AyKTeh6XrW4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098097',5.4,13308,'en','Pink Cadillac','A skip tracer helps out a bail-jumper after her child is kidnapped by a group of ethno-nationalist thugs, of which her husband is a member, going by the name of Birthright. The baby is taken as leverage because, although initially oblivious, she has their money!','/akIQcT3IErdrvK3r7JIktucXQsy.jpg','1989-05-26',122,'Released','It takes a real man to bring in a lady in a pink Cadillac.','Pink Cadillac',20006,4.4337,5.5,'I5P2UWe-c1I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10716,_binary '\0','/fVuhshAl0izxOaWSqNOHLQUcoPM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098105',4.4,34226,'en','Police Academy 6: City Under Siege','Our favourite police men are called together to deal with a gang who rob banks and jewelers. Using their various talents as well as their extraordinary luck, the crooks stand no chance against our men and women in blue.','/gRFJ3xLewH1rwEplZBfKS4vGpFV.jpg','1989-03-09',84,'Released','The Grads are going undercover in the city to unmask the mastermind of crime.','Police Academy 6: City Under Siege',11895,7.27,5.1,'unhfOWzPy9M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10717,_binary '\0','/nJWyiTiZJLJ0XpH0b7nuyc880Xx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098115',6.5,7294,'en','Prancer','Jessica, the daughter of an impoverished apple farmer, still believes in Santa Claus. So when she comes across a reindeer with an injured leg, it makes perfect sense to her to assume that it is Prancer, who had fallen from a Christmas display in town. She hides the reindeer in her barn and feeds it cookies, until she can return it to Santa. Her father finds the reindeer and decides to sell it to the butcher, not for venison chops, but as an advertising display.','/g3JfCGX9fgHwmmKFhRzu7BYc29d.jpg','1989-11-17',99,'Released','Something magical is about to happen.','Prancer',24951,2.5672,6.2,'2Gd_naEgqow','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10718,_binary '\0','/nFUMmcWVHn8xiccha8RsfPH4KuI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098136',4.7,2965,'en','Prom Night III: The Last Kiss','Mary Lou, the prom queen burned to death by her boyfriend back in the fifties, has escaped from hell and is once again walking the hallways of Hamilton High School, looking for blood.','/bJOpzoUXeYhruTAc3PBbvKAeLpd.jpg','1990-03-30',96,'Released','A Romantic Comedy from Hell','Prom Night III: The Last Kiss',41828,2.1586,5.1,'2pRvaN0yUe0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10719,_binary '\0','/tFmrdnfXM0p6ihMTFpptYOKEfSl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098141',5.7,29292,'en','The Punisher','The avenging angel of Marvel Comics fame comes brilliantly to life in this searing action-adventure thriller! Dolph Lundgren stars as Frank Castle, a veteran cop who loses his entire family to a mafia car bomb. His ex-partner believes Castle survived the blast and became the Punisher, living in the sewers and exacting vigilante violence against mob bosses throughout the city. When the populace is caught in the midst of a gang war that he caused, Castle must again emerge from the shadows and save the innocent.','/tA0O0hYyHX7Hl2Fl8VEtGtfBtjI.jpg','1989-10-05',89,'Released','If society won\'t punish the guilty, he will.','The Punisher',8867,7.507,5.765,'WvcieGlrp68','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10720,_binary '\0','/1zVQPclg4xQu0qdHOXYSlT5GQmU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098155',7.3,1455,'cn','群龍戲鳳','Lo Tung and his friend Malted Candy, pedicab drivers working the streets of Macao, have both fallen in love. The problem is that both their objects of affection - one a baker, the other a prostitute - are working under cruel and lecherous bosses. Somehow, the pair must find a way to win the ladies\' hearts and free them from their unpleasant jobs.','/mSZYsyvikyM7VJj9x7H9vl82uVZ.jpg','1989-02-11',95,'Released',NULL,'Pedicab Driver',29014,2.7954,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10721,_binary '\0','/wnp6aB3VorlWZpqjo0pRkkhxS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098156',2.7,4095,'en','R.O.T.O.R.','Robotic Officer Tactical Operation Research. A prototype robot intended for crime combat escapes from the development lab and goes on a killing rampage.','/pmSDuCOm96NM9acHkxd6U3u4RH4.jpg','1987-10-01',90,'Released','Judge, Jury, and Executioner.','R.O.T.O.R.',31127,1.7688,4.5,'XJV3qFsaozE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10722,_binary '\0','/1jDKZPZTpNGpTs5XIM0z3QbuNGi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098157',4.9,2589,'en','Les mémés cannibales','A large family gathers in the country side for their very elderly grannies\' birthday. One gift happens to be from their ostracized, black sheep nephew, and upon opening it, the two loveable grannies turn into rabid, flesh-eating monsters.','/e7M2Ptj3unacWHjFO8YKLCB4iej.jpg','1988-12-12',96,'Released','They just love their grandchildren... well done!','Rabid Grannies',21381,1.8908,5.2,'AyNAw9oBqRQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10723,_binary '\0','/zRUqmCks72ZVPAHuMTZZIoz2u1J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098160',5.9,2430,'en','The Rachel Papers','Poised to attend Oxford University, 19-year-old Charles Highway decides it\'s high time to have a romantic encounter with an older woman. With the help of a computer program and several eccentric relatives, Highway sets his sights on seducing Rachel Noyce, a stunning American in her 20s. However, Highway has his work cut out for him. Noyce has a boyfriend, DeForest, and is not exactly receptive to Highway\'s advances — at first, anyway.','/15KvepBOjWQb2YJ8nYiHkievVIv.jpg','1989-05-12',95,'Released','She\'s curious, he\'s nervous','The Rachel Papers',41944,2.9321,5.1,'EP4bYc_HrMo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10724,_binary '\0','/zjSexpo4ZPysjlmfKg1KDkjd5mu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098165',6.3,2017,'en','The Rainbow','Born to a rich landowner in the waning days of the Victorian era, Ursula Brangwen grows into a beautiful young woman full of imagination and ambition. The free-spirited Ursula begins to feel trapped by her prim surroundings, but her life changes when she has an erotic experience with Winifred, a bisexual teacher. From then on, Ursula puts all of her passion and creativity into the pursuit of sexual fulfillment. But her insatiable quest becomes a source of anguish.','/cwhWeS0HTOMJgqWpDZJxMg68Z7X.jpg','1989-05-05',113,'Released','Ken Russell\'s film of D.H. Lawrence\'s...','The Rainbow',41945,1.8248,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10725,_binary '\0','/6Zm50WdNBgVJ9w7KiBiB5cBg0TF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098168',6.8,3304,'hi','Ram Lakhan','Sharda vows vengeance when her husband is murdered by his two evil cousins, Bhishamber and Bhanu, and she and her two young sons are thrown out on the street. Years after their father\'s murder, Ram and Lakhan grow up to become policemen. Their personalities are like day and night: while one strives to do what is right, the other often makes poor choices.','/eg5Zt8EPvqjuKR0YXNSQIfXVoi8.jpg','1989-01-27',174,'Released','Both are brothers...both are police officers but...action is the difference','Ram Lakhan',72127,1.6558,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10726,_binary '\0','/rhETVPBrxhj5KYT4h23lCH96tPw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098175',7.3,1620,'pt','Recordações da Casa Amarela','Lisbon, 1989. A middle-aged poor man, tormented by an illness, lives in a cheap room in a family boarding house, in the old section of the city\'s waterfront.','/o8kUzrxzOKtGhHdxUWMDtCGfIS0.jpg','1989-10-12',122,'Released',NULL,'Recollections of the Yellow House',73930,1.492,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10727,_binary '\0','/gOvT2J5upwmFqiYYZ5z7u6QZokr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098180',5.2,10814,'en','Red Scorpion','A Soviet commando is sent to eliminate a rebel leader in Africa. Soon he finds himself doubting his mission.','/vzLQeJWGIKBQldk3HsAea5OFucI.jpg','1988-12-24',105,'Released','They think they control him. Think again.','Red Scorpion',12663,4.422,6,'rqNEHhdPpt4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10728,_binary '\0','/ouuFdKu9N7KfQjEsyezTsPXQ7Ya.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098184',5.9,2092,'en','Relentless','Two Los Angeles police detectives hunt for a serial killer who randomly chooses his victims from a phone directory.','/9P23snECnN4st50r9kD86DeVEHH.jpg','1989-08-30',92,'Released','Killers aren\'t born. They\'re made.','Relentless',87462,2.4694,5.3,'VyAhPp2eXCc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10729,_binary '\0','/mIbrIA4XKxbMjwvusFhdN7Nk3SO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098188',5.5,4255,'en','Renegades','While investigating police corruption in his department, undercover cop Buster McHenry is forced to participate in a heist, leading to innocent casualties and the theft of an ancient Lakota tribal spear. After McHenry ends up severely wounded, he is taken in by Native American Hank Storm, who is out to recover the spear and avenge the death of a loved one in the heist.','/cjO1uOtR91o0LaCKXJHaiThIao.jpg','1989-06-02',105,'Released','This time, they\'ve brought their guns to the city.','Renegades',20307,2.2953,5.3,'b7_mAHxM3cs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10730,_binary '\0','/cqPn700D5diX27NcJY2oKoCQX2O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098189',7.3,1630,'sv','Resan till Melonia','When a ship sinks during a storm, a slave from the industrial island of Plutonia is washed up on the beaches of paradise island Melonia, where the \"all-powerful\" wizard Prospero and his strange friends reside.','/dMCsWJfZLPGqJp0AX7IB70koJCR.jpg','1989-12-15',101,'Released','Fantasies of Shakespeare\'s \'The Tempest\'','The Journey to Melonia',50201,2.1097,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10731,_binary '\0','/vTGbFAFh3cGAFeLaXS8M3l3sl9z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098193',4.7,7105,'en','The Return of Swamp Thing','The Swamp Thing returns to battle the evil Dr. Arcane, who has a new science lab full of creatures transformed by genetic mutation, and chooses Heather Locklear as his new object of affection.','/5sm1Yi1hgj805b9o2a1uC6BXhqw.jpg','1989-05-11',84,'Released','Why can\'t men be more like plants?','The Return of Swamp Thing',19142,3.5757,5.468,'xnVrJXv4M1U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10732,_binary '\0','/wDPdVRi8li7ElkwGVD2RoTp9ypx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098194',5.9,4217,'en','The Return of the Musketeers','It\'s 1649: Mazarin hires the impoverished D\'Artagnan to find the other musketeers: Cromwell has overthrown the English king, so Mazarin fears revolt, particularly from the popular Beaufort. Porthos, bored with riches and wanting a title, signs on, but Aramis, an abbé, and Athos, a brawler raising an intellectual son, assist Beaufort in secret. When they fail to halt Beaufort\'s escape from prison, the musketeers are expendable, and Mazarin sends them to London to rescue Charles I. They are also pursued by Justine, the avenging daughter of Milady de Winter, their enemy 20 years ago. They must escape England, avoid Justine, serve the Queen, and secure Beauford\'s political reforms.','/5KP0TNYT2yH1yo7sfV5hQWQ4qWA.jpg','1989-04-12',102,'Released',NULL,'The Return of the Musketeers',41946,2.6161,6.2,'4QBKBEKMzAw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10733,_binary '\0','/9ZjkcBzfLKFF6q6gJrCjsb3EBpm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098205',4.5,1825,'en','River of Death','An adventurer (Hamilton) decides to go in search of the Lost City in the Amazon jungle. A motley crew of other people decide to join him for the wealth of the city, for reasons of their own. But to their horror they find out that they have bitten off more than they can chew, what with a Nazi doctor still using the place for his human experiments.','/wyx2DOxlDvYpmIeiZbto0l56Fmb.jpg','1989-09-29',107,'Released','The last chance to stop the rebirth of the Master Race.','River of Death',38652,2.7485,5.105,'2MFBqCqKdwY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10734,_binary '\0','/cUrFALlZP6Zh5SYRPSUnOYXfMhr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098206',6.7,113809,'en','Road House','The Double Deuce is the meanest, loudest and rowdiest bar south of the Mason-Dixon Line, and Dalton has been hired to clean it up. He might not look like much, but the Ph.D.-educated bouncer proves he\'s more than capable – busting the heads of troublemakers and turning the roadhouse into a jumping hot spot. But Dalton\'s romance with the gorgeous Dr. Clay puts him on the bad side of cutthroat local big shot Brad Wesley.','/n7Ra0BRYQVn47kiqOMyS8vdY0QS.jpg','1989-05-19',114,'Released','Dalton lives like a loner, fights like a professional. And loves like there\'s no tomorrow.','Road House',10135,5.7975,6.764,'YH3BMICpXyA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10735,_binary '\0','/1TFrt5rlgbAS7WdHfCp142NPt4s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098213',7.5,28324,'en','Roger & Me','A documentary about the closure of General Motors\' plant at Flint, Michigan, which resulted in the loss of 30,000 jobs. Details the attempts of filmmaker Michael Moore to get an interview with GM CEO Roger Smith.','/vSi4YK4E63geptUAxtizRUeTCFu.jpg','1989-09-01',91,'Released','The story of a rebel & his mike.','Roger & Me',1779,2.9422,7.097,'xPNmHPjkxdk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10736,_binary '\0','/k0tWymmZyaTxnkenSe6576awvuM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098214',8,2450,'es','Rojo amanecer','On October 2, 1968, a student uprising descends into violence after the Mexican government begins to use lethal force against the protesters.','/e64pw9gmbQJik2H6C4buiX1ilB7.jpg','1990-10-18',96,'Released','Do Not Forget October 2nd','Red Dawn',47916,6.9542,8.283,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10737,_binary '\0','/jH66Uq0MsTQNp5FvB7RtA6yaGqX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098219',7.2,2640,'en','Romero','Romero is a compelling and deeply moving look at the life of Archbishop Oscar Romero of El Salvador, who made the ultimate sacrifice in a passionate stand against social injustice and oppression in his county. This film chronicles the transformation of Romero from an apolitical, complacent priest to a committed leader of the Salvadoran people.','/rM4YcDw3U3w396RNslstu1OXRDz.jpg','1989-08-12',105,'Released','In defense of the poor in El Salvador, he fought with the only weapon he had... the truth.','Romero',32767,1.6815,7,'HDUwjD_hM6I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10738,_binary '\0','/tZINo8RkwoeKPBIkGmV8bn4fgv3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098220',6.8,2087,'fr','Romuald et Juliette','A company president gets framed with a food-poisoning scandal and the only person who can help him is the evening cleaning-woman, who always seems to be at the right place at the right time.','/p5tziFYNFJEaybMhpCP20m8G317.jpg','1989-03-22',108,'Released',NULL,'Romuald & Juliette',11480,1.8929,6.669,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10739,_binary '\0','/vvy6E7dt5pZaD0dytm1S53y6sZC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098230',4.8,1546,'en','Rude Awakening','In the later 1960s, two hippies are forced to leave their friends as they are wanted by the FBI, who sees them as criminals. They hide in the jungle for 20 years, secluded from the outside world. In the later 1980s, the find out that a secret war is about to start in the US, and decide to return to New York to tell someone about it.','/3i6wviquq8F8hTVAGdMOXBwmtGX.jpg','1989-08-16',98,'Released','Two hippies came back from 1969 to get the bad news. Nobody wants to save the world anymore. They just want to buy it.','Rude Awakening',24254,1.2011,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10740,_binary '\0','/3NpGjRbZS2VAYeEZh0ligquwzb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098238',7.7,2260,'fr','La Révolution française','A history of the French Revolution beginning from the decision of the king to convene the Etats-Generaux in 1789 in order to deal with France\'s debt problem. Part one spans the event until August 10, 1792 (when the King Louis XVI lost all authority and was imprisoned). Part two carries the story through the end of the terror in 1794.','/qkIOwWwXQTNxr9q8X9YSfeYgvmA.jpg','1989-05-10',335,'Released',NULL,'The French Revolution',4228,2.6465,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10741,_binary '\0','/xwINNMWHY5mlN7IRStb5LDX3FXq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098251',4.6,1310,'de','Sangre y arena','Remake of the tale of an acclaimed matador who finds himself involved with a beautiful woman, jeopardizing both his marriage and career.','/xrY362Il79McRTsCQs6UOUNFm7w.jpg','1989-09-22',113,'Released','His courage brought them together. Her desire tore them apart.','Blood and Sand',75892,2.8766,5,'0km5zKJhxXI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10742,_binary '\0','/uvMII3LgacbzXS2UYNgvPQ6Wv8z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098252',7.3,1312,'pt','O Sangue','Nino, tough but sickly, and his older brother Vicente live in the country with their father. After their father disappears ― we’re never sure why ― murder is suggested. Vicente brings his girlfriend to the house, and a different kind of family is established as the three youngsters grow fiercely protective of each other. But their uncle grows suspicious about the fate of the missing father and forcibly kidnaps Nino, taking him away to the city and leaving Vicente to locate him there.','/d36emiQPzuHjwmj4BlFYCaw30j5.jpg','1989-12-07',95,'Released',NULL,'Blood',46821,1.249,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10743,_binary '\0','/6LJUfxWh7Ru42pClv2wwPZKEja0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098253',7.4,25915,'en','Santa Sangre','A former circus artist escapes from a mental hospital to rejoin his armless, cult leader mother, and is forced to enact brutal murders in her name.','/6VTra0NR4ygRnq3bD922I4rU0Mq.jpg','1989-11-24',122,'Released','Forget Everything You Have Ever Seen...','Santa Sangre',19236,3.8949,7.2,'qcw8aCoddX8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10744,_binary '\0','/bAdIO0Jt886Ad1eY9bDXXeCpXsV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098258',7.3,103988,'en','Say Anything...','Average student and eternal optimist Lloyd Dobler seeks to capture the heart of Diane Court, a beautiful but unattainable valedictorian classmate. He surprises just about everyone - including himself - when she returns the sentiment. However, Diane\'s divorced, over-protective father soon begins to disapprove of the match, and Lloyd realises that it\'s going to take more than just the power of love to conquer all.','/nkucKciFGSRalw6dJtsglWqOXMC.jpg','1989-04-14',100,'Released','A Lloyd meets girl story.','Say Anything...',2028,8.1837,7.002,'Se_eSeEAoX0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10745,_binary '\0','/stVjJg6rtqwVqZP1eEi6Bq04IVA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098259',7.4,1657,'ru','Приключения пингвинёнка Лоло','Scamper is a little penguin who loves wandering around the Artic where he lives with his parents. Unfortunately his little adventures tend to get he, and his friend Snowflake into trouble, especially when he disobeys his father and goes exploring with seagulls who want to eat him flying above, and men and dogs on the ground with them. One day the adventure goes too far and they float out to sea, only to be caught by men who want to sell them to the zoo. Scamper, Snowflake and their new friend, a macaroni penguin named Louie, must escape and get back to their families to warn them.','/zr4vrqU2i6ATJ73l9nkZwJl7Gyo.jpg','1987-06-26',78,'Released','This Penguin Marches to a Different Tune','The Adventures of Scamper the Penguin',56391,1.4687,6.7,'GpMpKZguE3w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10746,_binary '\0','/A1eaLqbn4HfYKrtvsTx5llECzBP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098260',6.5,6058,'en','Scandal','An English bon-vivant osteopath is enchanted with a young exotic dancer and invites her to live with him. He serves as friend and mentor, and through his contacts and parties she and her friend meet and date members of the Conservative Party. Eventually a scandal occurs when her affair with the Minister of War goes public, threatening their lifestyles and their freedom.','/pV8e033wi9Fvf3be8Ku1R3gJ2L7.jpg','1989-03-03',115,'Released','The story that seduced the world is now the most controversial film of the year.','Scandal',32261,3.0389,6,'rUkmjQO-AUM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10747,_binary '\0','/u8oJq3FQQWk4rycIXpNYCKYRJo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098261',5.9,1531,'en','Scenes from the Class Struggle in Beverly Hills','A wealthy Beverly Hills resident who has just become a widow, Clare Lipkin temporarily takes on her friend Lisabeth as a house guest. As the two women deal with their upper-class woes, Clare\'s driver, Frank, and Lisabeth\'s servant, Juan, make a wager to see who can be the first to seduce the other\'s boss.','/4Q8yE7ijikNXWItWnAJkjt9yWvn.jpg','1989-06-09',95,'Released','Just another weekend of shameless sexual adventures, ill-fated romance and accidental death.','Scenes from the Class Struggle in Beverly Hills',60276,1.5808,5.4,'8DBH2aRrNYQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10748,_binary '\0','/8she0UIhlxoUnzWhO5AZpPlL0uf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098273',6.8,49212,'en','Sea of Love','Seen-it-all New York detective Frank Keller is unsettled - he has done twenty years on the force and could retire, and he hasn\'t come to terms with his wife leaving him for a colleague. Joining up with an officer from another part of town to investigate a series of murders linked by the lonely hearts columns he finds he is getting seriously and possibly dangerously involved with Helen, one of the main suspects.','/vJ88WmJ12eAK9CRb3cggn9CJthH.jpg','1989-09-15',113,'Released','Deception is dangerous. Desire is deadly.','Sea of Love',12150,7.3925,6.6,'a1ovghcj8v4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10749,_binary '\0','/yvHVfbb55uKmk3wPAR8Ea9yIh6Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098276',4.4,1636,'en','Second Sight','Wills is an ex-cop who pairs up with Bobby, a wacky psychic, to form the \"Second Sight Detective Agency.\" Bobby\'s clairvoyant abilities come in handy during their investigations. When a nun recruits them for a case involving car theft, they suddenly find themselves dealing with the abduction of a prominent cardinal who has a chance of becoming the next pope. Bobby\'s psychic powers go haywire as they pursue the case.','/rml1HBcC7lmRhyK1IgPDI1zl9k6.jpg','1989-11-03',83,'Released',NULL,'Second Sight',55492,1.526,4.4,'Yf3gNbptm4A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10750,_binary '\0','/e39yv0bmJMt8w0nD0hMGdZuTjkn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098282',6.9,62915,'en','See No Evil, Hear No Evil','A murder takes place in the shop of David Lyons, a deaf man who fails to hear the gunshot being fired. Outside, blind man Wally Karue hears the shot, but cannot see the perpetrator. Both are arrested, but escape to form an unlikely partnership. Being chased by both the law AND the original killers, can the pair work together to outwit them all?','/e9JrnUotqhKTUQEgg2UzDQ7nME2.jpg','1989-05-12',102,'Released','MURDER! The blind guy couldn\'t see it. The deaf guy couldn\'t hear it. Now they\'re both wanted for it.','See No Evil, Hear No Evil',11185,7.5225,6.8,'_Zz2kM7nbGQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10751,_binary '\0','/xUMzKSiqm14Z9GPmIaNcbrnGYVS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098300',6.5,5337,'en','Shag','Summer of 1963. Carson is getting married to her boyfriend so her friends Melaina, Pudge and Luanne take her to Myrtle Beach for one last irresponsible weekend.','/gIxA8FkPBk0wJLkF4znqBdWD8HX.jpg','1989-04-14',98,'Released','On a summer weekend in 1963, four girlfriends made memories that would last a lifetime.','Shag',38043,1.9436,6.2,'PqlnS7kTs1c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10752,_binary '\0','/sS5DVCBBN59SC7SUbIl9KbwIUm4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098308',5.4,5326,'en','She\'s Out of Control','A Los Angeles radio-station manager\'s girlfriend shows his teenage daughter how to be sexy.','/wTQ4FIz8D0YsSSpcgGjR6EWFvhs.jpg','1989-04-14',97,'Released','Girls go wild, boys go crazy, and dads go nuts!','She\'s Out of Control',47045,3.4417,5.2,'3iNo_nRsAfE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10753,_binary '\0','/vHRxxSB9oiZvRyBlLAs3KZkM6T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098309',5.8,21429,'en','She-Devil','A cunning and resourceful housewife vows revenge on her husband when he begins an affair with a wealthy romance novelist.','/jWYAXtdYF804aT1muO0G6FuR2Fa.jpg','1989-12-08',99,'Released','The story of the greatest evil ever known to man... His ex-wife.','She-Devil',11157,5.6322,6,'axFD68ha1_4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10754,_binary '\0','/a2A8ftKtoe89b7YTcHYXoWorrzo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098319',7.3,10008,'en','Shirley Valentine','Wondering what has happened to herself, now feeling stagnant and in a rut, Shirley Valentine finds herself regularly talking to the wall while preparing her husband\'s chips and egg. When her best friend wins a trip-for-two to Greece Shirley begins to see the world, and herself, in a different light.','/rrRrHNhur1DTp1KOp0YfFWvymQD.jpg','1989-08-30',108,'Released','No one thought she had the courage, the nerve, or the lingerie.','Shirley Valentine',18683,2.7949,6.346,'G_7MJQnk4M8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10755,_binary '\0','/1F5OOV5gipfGbfSJgQdV29xlNi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098320',5.5,19520,'en','Shocker','About to be electrocuted for a catalog of heinous crimes, the unrepentant Horace Pinker transforms into a terrifying energy source. Only young athlete Jonathan Parker, with an uncanny connection to him through bizarre dreams, can fight the powerful demon.','/m5EKmXhFFq8wg6xE15eEoKaHfnO.jpg','1989-03-23',111,'Released','No More Mr. Nice Guy','Shocker',12521,3.3865,5.6,'mZJc7RhF_JE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10756,_binary '\0','/b4oyUTJzHQ4Q2CNoDYtvFJkm29q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098321',4.3,2268,'it','Terminator 2','In a polluted future Venice researchers work to improve the situation. One day, unknown forces start killing them. A team of soldiers and a couple of civilians is sent to investigate. Soon, they encounter strange murderous creatures.','/tztmdSyvfvQBVyzqyh6sKQeJP5g.jpg','1989-03-17',90,'Released',NULL,'Shocking Dark',66664,1.3568,4.5,'gI_hkwuYm5w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10757,_binary '\0','/aI4PZbPUeuOc91OCi7TmjFza5Rk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098327',7.6,19386,'de','Der siebente Kontinent','Chronicles three years of a middle-class family seemingly caught up in their daily routines, troubled only by minor incidents. Behind their apparent calm and repetitive existence, however, they\'re planning something much more sinister.','/hPwtcwwmOnW7Mqr1s170LHxa74A.jpg','1989-10-20',107,'Released',NULL,'The Seventh Continent',32761,3.1986,7.471,'tD-D1IVV8F4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10758,_binary '\0','/n2K8BsXiafvIBaEUsG7UQfDyffT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098328',6.8,3846,'en','The Siege of Firebase Gloria','A Marine patrol stops at Firebase Gloria at the start of the Tet Offensive during the Vietnam war. With the firebase attacked, the patrol remains to help defend it.','/cAN1OLcfRt6ONQOLGGGEcAtC6tn.jpg','1989-01-27',97,'Released','Against all odds they went to hell and back.','The Siege of Firebase Gloria',33545,2.2856,5.6,'0mUBU9PBjbc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10759,_binary '\0','/pys8Y7SJ7YLQyQrLyT1LpAResne.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098333',4.3,2164,'en','Sinbad of the Seven Seas','Sinbad returns from the sea to find his country subjected to the will of two unscrupulous sorcerers.','/lXntPpDQeqvW7wl3B7B32SaaJPW.jpg','1989-04-01',93,'Released','He must conquer evil on land and at sea!','Sinbad of the Seven Seas',44126,2.1417,4.2,'m41xiIUKlRU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10760,_binary '\0','/gnZU2JQRka4jt5ZmTw2Rbe0gI8b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098343',6.1,5679,'en','Skin Deep','Hard-drinking novelist Zach Hutton spirals out of control after his wife and mistress both leave him. Alone and crippled by a bad case of writer\'s block, Zach slips in and out of casual relationships and one-night stands, while his drinking becomes more and more severe. With the help of a bartender and his therapist, Zach confronts his demons — women and alcohol.','/mNFq1Bk9oXD774hVyvdPlNCtwPt.jpg','1989-03-03',97,'Released','The comedy that glows in the dark.','Skin Deep',12478,2.7759,6.2,'TBTMP1s32E0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10761,_binary '\0','/ncwI0OMdoTn4nN54kRhZyB9GBYl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098347',5.6,1265,'en','Slaves of New York','Meet the denizens of New York City: artists, prostitutes, saints, and seers. All are aspiring toward either fame or oblivion while hoping for love and acceptance. Instead they find high rent, faithless partners, and dead-end careers.','/dftp493orT07ITbw77UgVlHz4ox.jpg','1989-03-18',124,'Released','Slaves of art. Slaves of love.','Slaves of New York',49788,1.9803,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10762,_binary '\0','/4LVglnqmB0WVNV8J5NnrOPyJdx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098350',4.7,3520,'en','Slipstream','In the near future, where Earth has been devastated by man\'s pollution and giant winds rule the planet, bounty hunter Matt kidnaps a murderer out of the hands of two police officers, planning to get the bounty himself.','/vdheFSJHXDr2Z7F4mJHJkQt8I3N.jpg','1989-06-22',102,'Released','From the depths of the earth. To the edge of existence... The hunt is on!','Slipstream',22379,1.6843,4.3,'GX6r9zXVOk8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10763,_binary '\0','/cIpD6PGtCRG3ynaaBWZmf5cw8C5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098354',6.5,25411,'en','Society','Bill Whitney is worried that he is different to his sister and parents. They mix with other upper-class people while Bill is more down to earth. Even his girlfriend seems a bit odd. All is revealed when Bill returns home to find a party in full swing.','/8Yg51sD6loLBYIlUcMDCO0bUGSh.jpg','1990-03-30',100,'Released','The rich have always fed off the poor. This time, it\'s for real.','Society',22244,6.98,6.7,'2ZTwNbOzAac','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10764,_binary '\0','/qtvze6htERwkxZZaGe2b6umTcXH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098356',5.7,4394,'en','Some Girls','While on Christmas break, college student Michael journeys to Quebec City to spend time with his attractive girlfriend, Gabriella. Not long after he arrives, Gabriella breaks up with him, but her two equally gorgeous sisters waste no time showing romantic interest. In the meantime, Michael is left to deal with Gabriella\'s eccentric grandmother and offbeat father, an academic who spends most of his time naked.','/iZz3RKDstcniOSyo0yFr2DP9liB.jpg','1988-09-09',94,'Released','There\'s nothing that love, laughter and a little therapy can\'t fix!','Some Girls',31083,3.1894,5.8,'muSJLjg91EE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10765,_binary '\0','/52Lu2SxYuckF0f1Bz9yDvy1cVLa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098360',7.1,14334,'ja','その男、凶暴につき','A detective breaks all rules of ethical conduct while investigating a colleague’s involvement in drug pushing and yakuza activities.','/5tLNkaPeDgtcet3uzHvJEpWrOcb.jpg','1989-08-12',103,'Released',NULL,'Violent Cop',12622,3.2728,7.2,'0dyEmKsIf6c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10766,_binary '\0','/lXL5mZSCv6zZtwaOIvPiBppYGHb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098368',6.6,1820,'en','Speaking Parts','Hotel employee Lisa develops an obsession with her co-worker Lance, a struggling actor who has appeared in several films as an extra.','/xRVyrjLeyvpEJfCkyRUXyXsKpUt.jpg','1990-02-16',92,'Released','Love. Passion. Obsession.','Speaking Parts',85556,1.6888,6,'8pgupPiKgKc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10767,_binary '\0','/xt91Cj5eLtfxVCXoZHrt3clmS7h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098369',4.5,4048,'en','Speed Zone','An illegal race that takes place over the United States and nothing will stop this bunch of racers except for the occasional cop or a damsel in distress. Jackie Chan\'s car is not in this one, but many new cars make up for that. Who will win? Who will crash? Who will not even finish? Sit down and buckle up for the ride of your life.','/cmAgnjrH7TlKjYUpS9NMGMlbkre.jpg','1989-04-21',94,'Released','A comedy that\'s over the limit and beyond the law!','Speed Zone',12236,3.3774,4.5,'w4Z-HjKHf_w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10768,_binary '\0','/ilZXd2AouJ8J4nG11OvXxaKHtP2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098375',4.9,3529,'en','Spontaneous Combustion','A young man learns that his parents had been used in an atomic-weapons experiment shortly before his birth, and that the results have had some unexpected effects on him.','/44RKxTOBEJggUK9jHzsaIWFb668.jpg','1989-05-11',97,'Released','The Cleanest Kill on Earth.','Spontaneous Combustion',39195,2.6063,4.7,'PcLzB9rk7Lc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10769,_binary '\0','/y0klN15XPVyYtd4P7HYecgJXSsZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098382',5.5,68588,'en','Star Trek V: The Final Frontier','A renegade Vulcan with a startling secret hijacks the U.S.S. Enterprise in order to find a mythical planet.','/uiXr41VLYsuug3CZbFrKLSNahuZ.jpg','1989-06-09',106,'Released','Adventure and imagination will meet at the final frontier.','Star Trek V: The Final Frontier',172,7.9045,5.7,'XE7_pOy_jZk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10770,_binary '\0','/nvrQW1NmhkQ7B4FjNik7uqMOldP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098384',7.3,72266,'en','Steel Magnolias','A young beautician, newly arrived in a small Louisiana town, finds work at the local salon, where a small group of women share a close bond of friendship and welcome her into the fold.','/7ExUSN9s9gX9bhVM17zDLEizano.jpg','1989-11-15',117,'Released','Six extraordinary friends. They share each other\'s laughter. They dry each other\'s tears.','Steel Magnolias',10860,8.504,7.193,'d8nojAKKijA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10771,_binary '\0','/70wKVDoSHTprFSJBoBvvFGCYe2Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098385',5.6,5661,'en','Stepfather 2','\"Stepfather\" Jerry Blake escapes an insane asylum and winds up in another town, this time impersonating a marriage counselor. With a future wife and new stepson who love him, Blake eliminates anyone who stands in his way to building the perfect family.','/ncRcvOZnCdbgkyGFAC5zkiyoU6e.jpg','1989-11-03',93,'Released','Tonight - Daddy\'s coming home - to slice up more than just the cake!','Stepfather 2',30666,3.8428,5.5,'rvUBt0YB-ds','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10772,_binary '\0','/erC12NG14vbc9nw6qT5TR8Rc86k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098407',5.3,1566,'en','El sueño del mono loco','An American writer in Paris is hired to do a script for an edgy young director he can\'t stand. When he falls in love with the director\'s cold and manipulative pretty sister, his life starts to unravel and he realizes that he\'s been used.','/qISuU2idmInI1HoNAxy6BC3PdDT.jpg','1989-09-05',108,'Released',NULL,'Twisted Obsession',110928,2.4685,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10773,_binary '\0','/ub8PtLpApCwBi7mr7Yi7Sja5qfD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098412',6,4258,'en','Sundown: The Vampire in Retreat','Reclusive vampires lounge in a lonely American town. They wear sunscreen to protect themselves. A descendant of Van Helsing arrives with hilarious consequences.','/azGQ5X7stOwG8mc9VhX4yRu56lY.jpg','1991-11-02',104,'Released','There are only two kinds of folks in Purgatory. Vampires and lunch.','Sundown: The Vampire in Retreat',16159,2.9951,6.1,'4wXPOlAEhcY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10774,_binary '\0','/qIDtJMztPm92k5vGUF0zK3519KD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098415',6,1401,'en','Survival Quest','A bunch of city slickers from different backgrounds go into the wild mountains to be one with nature, but basically to have a good time. However, a paramilitary group has chosen the same time to go camping. When one of the soldiers thinks their boss has been killed by one of the city slickers, he coaxes his team into exterminating all of them. They will have to rely on their wits and on each other in order to survive.','/weaF990jmJw6VIAlxKyxvH7bAJP.jpg','1989-06-01',96,'Released','In the wilderness you can’t call 911.','Survival Quest',100110,1.783,5.543,'ci30UXgbtsE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10775,_binary '\0','/y1bstk8A5AxHMKQXDq2vm6LLpbY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098436',6.2,5275,'en','The Tall Guy','An American actor in England tries to find love and work.','/6tGHCij3jJu80RYSSpV0LBRLTN3.jpg','1989-02-01',92,'Released','Scandalous! Shocking! Outrageous! Finally a comedy you can look up to.','The Tall Guy',24077,2.0418,5.7,'NvTWeC6paas','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10776,_binary '\0','/2yzsv6n5uM15gpYmYukiUMNuyha.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098437',7.5,9265,'fi','Talvisota','After Nazi Germany invades Poland in September 1939, Russia attacks Finland two months later. Finnish reservists leave home and go to war. Brothers Martti and Paavo Hakala, farmers from the municipality of Kauhava in the province of Pohjanmaa/Ostrobothnia, serve in a Finnish platoon.','/m2sZm9bl4J0q2pIoSxXcDLX2U9E.jpg','1989-11-30',189,'Released','They held back the Russian Juggernaut in a frozen Hell!','The Winter War',29383,1.6194,6.916,'A1EfoFiJBX4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10777,_binary '\0','/vzvHhP8ZrDvOOx5fa9YC0OzDNIU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098439',6.4,120900,'en','Tango & Cash','Ray Tango and Gabriel Cash are two successful narcotics detectives who can\'t stand each other. Crime lord Yves Perret, furious at the loss of income they have caused him, plots an elaborate revenge against them.','/jxxxjTu87OSmQYkMFF7MgOEDXRn.jpg','1989-12-22',104,'Released','Two of L.A.\'s top rival cops are going to have to work together… Even if it kills them.','Tango & Cash',9618,7.9304,6.513,'DoacpCpBptU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10778,_binary '\0','/hAwEhYPCrv59as7AY8AEa7Ezegz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098442',6.6,2006,'en','Tap','Max Washington has just been released from prison after serving time for burglary. He returns to his old hangout, a hoofer club. His old girl friend, Amy, who still works at the club as a Tap instructor, is less than thrilled to see him. Her father, Little Mo, is happy to see him, because he has plans for a show involving Max. In addition, Max\'s old partners in crime have another job for him.','/cjy45SaOAzcyReyl4pr6jWss6uS.jpg','1989-02-12',111,'Released','Sometimes, no matter what, you can\'t escape the rhythm.','Tap',16560,2.3578,6.597,'4wG1qSlmUvo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10779,_binary '\0','/vRfo7aDU9k10G1FUSixOCPbcBmr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098453',6,11927,'en','Teen Witch','Louise is not very popular at her highschool. Then she learns that she\'s descended from the witches of Salem and has inherited their powers. At first she uses them to get back at the girls and teachers who teased her and to win the heart of the handsome footballer\'s captain. But soon she has doubts if it\'s right to \'cheat\' her way to popularity.','/uJBIybU3r5NaKnbxdm4Ek9dOQPI.jpg','1989-04-28',94,'Released','Fall under her spell.','Teen Witch',25199,5.4447,6,'-JpWYIhdSi0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10780,_binary '\0','/x4Nb1ZAEAPs13wTYxl6vVNIJLvT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098454',4.7,2089,'en','Ten Little Indians','Ten people are invited to go on an African safari, only to find that an unseen person is killing them one by one. Could one of them be the killer?','/nkh9NY3PMYqpCVQqo9yJFe8u0eq.jpg','1989-09-27',100,'Released',NULL,'Ten Little Indians',103761,1.8692,4.9,'1HOXmRriKD0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10781,_binary '\0','/nlXcPIrPkeiDN3fRXJFj7SRr2N8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098465',7.5,1494,'en','Thelonious Monk: Straight, No Chaser','A documentary film about the life of pianist and jazz great Thelonious Monk. Features live performances by Monk and his band, and interviews with friends and family about the offbeat genius.','/8My1tlPk7Bz5Q6hzIpNZShDj37T.jpg','1988-10-25',90,'Released',NULL,'Thelonious Monk: Straight, No Chaser',41973,1.8243,7.4,'dx0E9-ThvKc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10782,_binary '\0','/fRJKTmRji1LewYJvzCkYp3GCD7o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098471',6.2,13672,'en','Three Fugitives','On his first day after being released from jail for 14 armed bank robberies, Lucas finds himself caught up in someone else\'s robbery. Perry has decided to hold up the local bank to raise money so that he can keep his daughter, Meg, and get her the treatment she needs. Dugan, a detective, assumes Lucas helped plan the robbery, and hence Lucas, Perry and Meg become three fugitives.','/qUNgtb0LEkRcHGanKHO0B3JWsw9.jpg','1989-01-27',96,'Released','They rob banks. She steals hearts.','Three Fugitives',31608,5.9568,6.659,'xnfkn6_bR7g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10783,_binary '\0','/m6IKfCeZU90sYKuIWdTwgTZNV4l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098486',6.3,3245,'de','Der Todesking','Seven episodes, each taking place on a different day of the week, on the theme of suicide and violent death.','/d1dsVW5sWIwQCBZCHZwFa2tk7kA.jpg','1990-01-25',80,'Released',NULL,'The Death King',15736,2.6289,6.3,'i8FgLDo9WEM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10784,_binary '\0','/7nkc6FEalesKjvW1lWDlObdjWa4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098502',4.4,6119,'en','The Toxic Avenger Part III: The Last Temptation of Toxie','Desperate to raise money for the experimental surgery that could restore his blind fiancee\'s eyesight, Toxie accepts a lucrative job with the evil multinational conglomerate Apocalypse Inc.','/2jb84AnOjaYuhR2vaWkAOfItP9B.jpg','1989-11-24',102,'Released','The REAL American superhero!','The Toxic Avenger Part III: The Last Temptation of Toxie',28169,3.1486,4.958,'uF8rq8023AA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10785,_binary '\0','/oZQNh7OuSsLyPDyyEXPOFILQ6ko.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098503',5,8605,'en','The Toxic Avenger Part II','Melvin Junko was a nerdy weakling until he fell into a vat of toxic waste, turning him into the first ever superhuman creature from New Jersey. This time, he takes on Tokyo.','/m5o7B3VSAjvinjtSYxXD38senvb.jpg','1989-07-15',95,'Released','The first super-hero from New Jersey is back!','The Toxic Avenger Part II',28165,2.8943,5.4,'HGIxHDhMIYw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10786,_binary '\0','/apshJk3Dp2WG4DO3ZzovyXlWwX6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098512',5.8,3496,'en','The Trial of the Incredible Hulk','Falsely accused of assault, Dr. David Banner is arrested and placed on trial, facing the possibility of a long prison sentence. Blind attorney Matt Murdock takes on his defence, while secretly operating as the vigilante Daredevil. As the courtroom battle unfolds, Banner’s struggle to control the Hulk leads to a dangerous confrontation with criminal mastermind Wilson Fisk.','/jaaeLvonWry3TdTXaGSu2VveNEG.jpg','1989-05-07',95,'Released','Superheroes Hulk and Daredevil join forces in an explosive new adventure!','The Trial of the Incredible Hulk',26883,3.3806,6.426,'MuNk8x9piIU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10787,_binary '\0','/uAr0WNk16NMBT5ezoaIFVqFVCgQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098513',6.8,3148,'en','Triumph of the Spirit','During World War II, Salamo Arouch, a passionate boxer, is arrested and sent to a concentration camp. Soon, he is forced to box against his fellow prisoners for the sake of entertainment.','/dxaSARmpCiFOCaxwGvjYAXMYPE4.jpg','1989-12-08',120,'Released','Win and he lives to fight again. Lose and his family dies with him.','Triumph of the Spirit',56179,2.7345,6.5,'xoGJJang7X0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10788,_binary '\0','/qL3ENRNsgygM3Z0ACV7lrU54kVz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098519',6,12799,'en','Troop Beverly Hills','A Beverly Hills housewife in the middle of a divorce tries to find focus in her life by taking over her daughter\'s Wilderness Girls troop.','/2HOzh7t2THdZ3r9BaDucEjfzLlL.jpg','1989-03-24',106,'Released','When the going gets tough, the tough go shopping!','Troop Beverly Hills',22102,3.4562,5.7,'rWn0IWPTOHs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10789,_binary '\0','/c7xxv25wD4ZNHRfytkgdK0i4Sds.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098520',6.6,3284,'fr','Trop belle pour toi','A car dealer, well-to-do and with a beautiful wife, finds himself attracted to his rather plain new temporary secretary. Despite her own commitments she feels the same and the two soon embark on an affair. Though it would seem it has happened before his wife finds this particular entanglement of her husband\'s very difficult to accept.','/eGgg6qufHcMHrKvG3eoPhCEVDnI.jpg','1989-10-21',91,'Released',NULL,'Too Beautiful for You',48524,2.1586,6.341,'HblzguQpZp8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10790,_binary '\0','/yZpAb2uqzcSJmdF9K9ks6yhvB2l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098524',6.7,6089,'en','True Believer','Eddie Dodd is a burnt out former civil rights lawyer who now specializes in defending drug dealers. Roger Baron, newly graduated from law school, has followed Eddie\'s great cases and now wants to learn at his feet. With Roger\'s idealistic prodding, Eddie reluctantly takes on a case of a young Korean man who, according to his mother, has been in jail for eight years for a murder he didn\'t commit.','/ouL2ibaIdTMobM1CUlZxKauJBaM.jpg','1989-02-17',105,'Released','Someone got away with murder...until now.','True Believer',31863,3.9567,6.2,'f-0abazgJfQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10791,_binary '\0','/tHF5OIcguut0Y83BXzqHtGdJOAf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098532',7.5,13927,'fi','Tulitikkutehtaan tyttö','Iris is a shy and dowdy young woman stuck in a dead-end job at a match factory, who dreams of finding love at the local dancehall. Finding herself pregnant after a one-night stand and abandoned by the father, Iris finally decides the time has come to get even and she begins to plot her revenge.','/zHfabvr3RKEbNfksFBs2Cder91i.jpg','1990-01-12',69,'Released',NULL,'The Match Factory Girl',7974,3.9945,7.4,'Vf_D3ZzYLy0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10792,_binary '\0','/yGCAyKBiHIuM9IdqjxhJ1BhbAgV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098536',6.2,81767,'en','Turner & Hooch','Detective Scott Turner has three days left in the local police department before he moves to a bigger city to get some \'real\' cases—not just misdemeanors. When Amos Reed is murdered, Scott sets himself on the case, but the closest thing to a witness to the murder is Reed\'s dog, Hooch, which Scott has to take care of—to avoid Hooch being \'put to sleep\'.','/nllMNbjgvUpw378czm5vBYzZqg1.jpg','1989-07-28',99,'Released','The oddest couple ever unleashed!','Turner & Hooch',6951,7.6183,6.3,'kwUgKPZvuMw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10793,_binary '\0','/nKFwXAWdd2A1xCTLRHIVdAPCuOG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098544',5.7,1402,'sv','Täcknamn Coq Rouge','His name is Carl Hamilton from a Swedish noble family - trained by the CIA and a army SEAL. When a group of terrorists based in Sweden threatens to initiate their diabolic plans - the Coq Rouge Carl Hamilton is activated.','/fe82di5xK7GODNhnhkugdNNXIP9.jpg','1989-08-25',87,'Released',NULL,'Code Name Coq Rouge',31292,1.1984,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10794,_binary '\0','/dAz8vPSI2daM4ZVrHSKnpNLUvDM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098546',6.9,34720,'en','UHF','The eccentric new manager of a UHF television channel tries to save the station from financial ruin with an odd array of programming.','/wxx5YQLKVH1WMSRXQAUnC76r4iY.jpg','1989-07-21',97,'Released','A lot of TV stations have forgotten what \"quality\" means, but not Channel 62. They NEVER knew what it meant.','UHF',11959,3.7923,6.7,'3M8m6GllnG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10795,_binary '\0','/mpEc2EPp6aJt3omHxw5IMZTDjt3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098554',7.1,122949,'en','Uncle Buck','Buck Russell, a lovable but slovenly bachelor, suddenly becomes the temporary caretaker of his nephew and nieces after a family emergency. His freewheeling attitude soon causes tension with his older niece Tia, loyal girlfriend Chanice, and just about everyone else who crosses his path.','/euWPWqpujKQg2KnfBUVkBSZ6kf4.jpg','1989-08-16',100,'Released','He\'s crude. He\'s crass. He\'s family.','Uncle Buck',2616,7.6523,6.8,'_9A0FGHHFtw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10796,_binary '\0','/ynwD883IA6aPoM13lRVciIy4bVF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098559',8,1216,'sv','Undergångens arkitektur','Featuring never-before-seen film footage of Adolf Hitler and the Nazi regime, The Architecture of Doom captures the inner workings of the Third Reich and illuminates the Nazi aesthetic in art, architecture and popular culture. From Nazi party rallies to the final days inside Hitler\'s bunker, this sensational film shows how Adolf Hitler rose from being a failed artist to creating a world of ponderous kitsch and horrifying terror. Hitler worshipped ancient Rome and Greece, and dreamed of a new Golden Age of classical art and monumental architecture, populated by beautiful, patriotic Aryans. Degenerated artists and inferior races had no place in his lurid fantasy. As this riveting film shows, the Nazis went from banning the art of modernists like Picasso to forced euthanasia of the retarded and sick, and finally to the persecution of homosexuals and the extermination of the Jews.','/802z31I21EFE8TfsOloTnVSKrHI.jpg','1989-10-13',119,'Released','The Nazi philosophy of beauty through violence','The Architecture of Doom',68348,2.0637,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10797,_binary '\0','/dEQeZ1dfX5tkE8XPV8fx681UTn7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098573',8.2,8429,'tr','Uçurtmayı Vurmasınlar','Sent to prison along with his mother after her drug conviction, a young boy develops a warm, tender relationship with a political prisoner.','/oEiAfij9usfev6rSWoKi9dsjRyD.jpg','1989-04-14',90,'Released',NULL,'Don\'t Let Them Shoot the Kite',49769,1.2119,7.813,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10798,_binary '\0','/upZUY8Tj9RHHLKPpGKU40qQ0Y1R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098575',7,15541,'en','Valmont','Set in Baroque France, a scheming widow and her lover make a bet regarding the corruption of a recently married woman. The lover, Valmont, bets that he can seduce her, even though she is an honorable woman. If he wins, he can have his lover to do as he will. However, in the process of seducing the married woman, Valmont falls in love.','/AuCnhQII6ZNgRDrr2N5KyDCnhnj.jpg','1989-11-17',137,'Released','As unpredictable as love itself.','Valmont',37606,5.6349,6.7,'3bQxJ24_EXo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10799,_binary '\0','/rrmavNBz1aKSY11jbGGnj1Q5CTo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098577',6.1,25311,'en','Vampire\'s Kiss','A publishing executive is visited and bitten by a vampire and starts exhibiting erratic behavior. He pushes his secretary to extremes as he tries to come to terms with his affliction.','/bEwvlXvvrVLPFwCOND5E38qly01.jpg','1989-06-02',104,'Released','Seduction. Romance. Murder. The things one does for love.','Vampire\'s Kiss',7091,5.0016,6,'C8XAY9iTwX4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10800,_binary '\0','/1SWcGnljbOz5BgQQuLefOJqzbiw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098596',7.5,2311,'fr','La Vie et rien d\'autre','In 1920, Major Dellaplane, a man of honor and ethics, searches for missing French soldiers. He meets Madame Irène de Courtil, a politically connected Parisian, and their paths cross.','/qxyXttnO7UkKovpFo0QmxxgZNAP.jpg','1989-09-06',135,'Released',NULL,'Life and Nothing But',41936,1.891,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10801,_binary '\0','/zrRX9nGQNTSNeeB5ATHs3UvnfzB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098598',7.3,1431,'hu','Vili, a veréb','Vili fakes illness so he doesn\'t have to take a math test. Instead, he starts shooting at sparrows from the window with an air rifle. The kindly old lady who feeds the birds turns out to be a real-life fairy who tries to turn Vili into a good boy.','/xDeOmFzH7MA2xL0OjJTPfoq9Uuq.jpg','1989-03-30',76,'Released','What would it feel like to be a bird and fly over the trees and housetops?','Willy the Sparrow',37587,1.2642,6.6,'mVMFXG-4BJ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10802,_binary '\0','/knj9ilZjKlkux9wEZXLLO42MRbV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098600',4.7,1275,'en','The Vineyard','Dr. Elson Po is one of the world\'s most famous wine growers and has a magic potion which has kept him handsome and alive for centuries. However, the magic which rejuvenates him seems to become less and less effective. As a side project, he makes movies and invites a group of young, aspiring actors to his island for a party, believing that the young, beautiful actress, Jezebel, can be his new source of life.','/hwxlCwHwUAoLCXkdV4053l6hYF1.jpg','1989-07-01',95,'Released','An island of death fueled by the blood of its victims.','The Vineyard',58690,1.6846,4.6,'uc3GgKM9s9s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10803,_binary '\0','/cq6So4kDrMRQQS284qLxrTwy69d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098606',6.3,3696,'it','La voce della luna','Odd couple Ivo Salvini, recently released from a mental asylum, and former prefect Gonnella wander through the countryside and discover a dystopia made of television commercials, beauty pageants, rock music, Catholicism, and pagan rituals.','/1E9bSjMK72pqYvpPioFuQd3IUBx.jpg','1990-03-05',120,'Released',NULL,'The Voice of the Moon',59050,2.2214,6.694,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10804,_binary '\0','/2fdvCbGsTMIoOS2mRXCTy52FvCH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098621',6.9,63411,'en','The War of the Roses','Barbara and Oliver Rose live happily as a married couple. When Barbara starts to wonder what life would be like without Oliver and likes what she sees, the two begin a campaign to force each other to leave their house, with their divorce lawyer D\'Amato caught in the middle.','/9VWwYsuXhRImUtrJGvN6bYJB2He.jpg','1989-12-08',116,'Released','Once in a lifetime comes a motion picture that makes you feel like falling in love all over again. This is not that movie.','The War of the Roses',249,6.9359,6.9,'CU-kRUErQdQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10805,_binary '\0','/tVQjkTxxg7t17Fgp4qyii89pCH2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098622',6.2,21138,'en','Warlock','In 17th century New England, witch hunter Giles Redferne captures an evil warlock, but the conjurer eludes death with supernatural help. Flung into the future, the warlock winds up in the 1980s and plans to bring about the end of the world. Redferne follows the enchanter into the modern era and continues his mission, but runs into trouble in such unfamiliar surroundings. With the help of a young woman, can Redferne finally defeat the warlock?','/1QHjr4lBd3vBN4kEqdDFlnJbsa7.jpg','1989-06-01',103,'Released','Satan also has one son.','Warlock',11342,5.3258,6.3,'cTNcZn2KfDw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10806,_binary '\0','/tWEz8BNLThtkbyXLIgHxilViHLK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098625',6.1,26505,'en','We\'re No Angels','Two escaped cons\' only prayer to escape is to pass themselves off as priests and pass by the police blockade at the border into the safety of Canada.','/5XBVURkON7jyzxr0cONWeTbgAov.jpg','1989-06-02',106,'Released','Escaped convicts disguised as priests. It\'ll take a miracle to get away with this one.','We\'re No Angels',5971,5.1967,6.2,'I5I2PvGbZRA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10807,_binary '\0','/xbGROemZqyVYrIlMOHKqmV2qmG0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098627',6.5,69048,'en','Weekend at Bernie\'s','Two young insurance corporation employees try to pretend that their murdered employer is alive by puppeteering his dead body, leading a hitman to attempt to track him down to finish him off.','/4RtjBkBSqHG46uieHgTtM7oKlpo.jpg','1989-07-05',98,'Released','Bernie may be dead, but he\'s still the life of the party!','Weekend at Bernie\'s',8491,6.6701,6.427,'nt4qeydCH3Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10808,_binary '\0','/orq7v7J0Esq9TWpKitCXPbevOdW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098635',7.7,275139,'en','When Harry Met Sally...','Sex always gets in the way of friendships between men and women. At least, that\'s what Harry Burns believes. So when Harry meets Sally Albright and a deep friendship blossoms between them, Harry\'s determined not to let his attraction to Sally destroy it. But when a night of weakness ends in a morning of panic, can the pair avoid succumbing to Harry\'s fears by remaining friends and admitting they just might be the perfect match for each other?','/rFOiFUhTMtDetqCGClC9PIgnC1P.jpg','1989-07-12',96,'Released','Can two friends sleep together and still love each other in the morning?','When Harry Met Sally...',639,13.0705,7.407,'TQpG579MsQ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10809,_binary '\0','/pR2UeB0QXN1n8Rs68ryMHDgEibq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098645',5.9,19480,'en','Who\'s Harry Crumb?','Harry Crumb is a bumbling and inept private investigator who is hired to solve the kidnapping of a young heiress which he\'s not expected to solve because his employer is the mastermind behind the kidnapping.','/6iUoyyaMklULVoGJDyHcN4nGgSX.jpg','1989-02-03',94,'Released','Nerves of steel. Body of iron. Brain of stone.','Who\'s Harry Crumb?',11718,4.4732,5.966,'UM6-VeQ_KPk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10810,_binary '\0','/jaThbMk4mSRkXtTN4JSfKjO3qYa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098649',4,2577,'en','Wicked Stepmother','A pair of witches descend upon a family and wreak havoc. Now it\'s up to the family\'s matriarch, a private detective, and a suspended police officer to stop them.','/qjjd9jQKwVb6afW5iZwKu6tKsHF.jpg','1989-02-03',93,'Released','Which Witch is which?','Wicked Stepmother',35826,2.179,4.7,'6mhUY2vQnIg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10811,_binary '\0','/y46KkReTFHqSgBGi4UUMRcnQUDE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098659',6.2,1916,'en','Winter People','Wayland Jackson, a widower with a young daughter, moves to a small, impoverished mountain village in North Carolina, circa 1934. They are taken in by Collie Wright, a single mother with an illegitimate baby, and she and Wayland soon fall in love. Trouble starts when the identity of her baby\'s father is revealed.','/uttDBa6mvuDWXXWcL1yPS35ehFv.jpg','1989-04-14',110,'Released','A passion so strong it kills.','Winter People',108969,2.7968,5.6,'PjgWPRrrp44','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10812,_binary '\0','/69b4DcNGsVnZBQ43UX1Yj0U2JSt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098662',4.6,1647,'en','Witchtrap','A group of parapsychologists, as well as a skeptical cop, are terrorized by a Satanic ghost in a bed-and-breakfast.','/4GW3hR4R6sY0BNObEsAvLngrTiU.jpg','1989-04-21',92,'Released','This Time, It\'s Not a Game','Witchtrap',103424,1.5075,5.2,'vQKDEpa1EW0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10813,_binary '\0','/uDNujlgku4FgHDeOdrfEQk1FtW1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098663',6.1,17815,'en','The Wizard','A boy and his brother run away from home and hitch cross-country, with help from a girl they meet, to compete in the ultimate video game championship.','/dtgNNq3TBbpBX6RXHLt5gAMdwPV.jpg','1989-12-15',100,'Released','It\'s more than a game...it\'s the chance of a lifetime.','The Wizard',183,4.1399,6.035,'P8DHtumRAtY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10814,_binary '\0','/bdlSmGexTiam0Pz4IQsGIoAAvzf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098672',7,7103,'en','The Woman in Black','A lawyer travels to a small seaside town to settle the estate of a recently deceased woman, but soon becomes ensnared in something much more sinister.','/qVNCJJlU2Z99ulRRJyhMp7T3q4Q.jpg','1989-12-24',100,'Released','A spine-chilling ghost story','The Woman in Black',16182,2.4576,6.9,'wYfKkf_0Pnc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10815,_binary '\0','/sAopYgNmyWW6rYzurVaT0nSrxrK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098678',5.7,2042,'en','Worth Winning','Taylor is a man who has no problems with women. So confident is he that he accepts a challenge from his friends: he has to secure proposals of marriage from three women of their choice.','/cYJrnizH2npzhiZOCLr2GnYGRhf.jpg','1989-10-27',103,'Released','An engaging comedy about a bachelor and three near Mrs.','Worth Winning',32330,1.7828,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10816,_binary '\0','/mYC9iqowIl2vCH1T7pu8IGmTdyw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098691',5.9,4356,'cn','英雄本色3：夕阳之歌','Before the events of A Better Tomorrow (1986), Mark \'Gor\' Lee heads to Saigon during the Vietnam War to bring home his uncle and cousin, but his task becomes complicated when a well-known criminal tries to help him.','/cKvP5yunS8HxA66qlxw6AhFuAbN.jpg','1989-10-20',118,'Released',NULL,'A Better Tomorrow III: Love and Death in Saigon',41244,3.8875,6.4,'Kb2DwvxCOn8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10817,_binary '\0','/rmhhTF2fr8w6iNh8KHNi6EqWLZv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098692',6.7,12097,'ja','妖獣都市','A peace treaty between the Earth and the Black World, a parallel universe of demons, is coming to an end. Two cops, Taki, a human male, and Maki, a female demon, are assigned to protect a diplomat who will help secure another treaty. A radical group of demons from the Black World are out to assassinate the diplomat and prevent the treaty; only the bond that forms between the two cops can save the Earth from destruction.','/aFtLwGv6pcqO72M1v5iQYZOCkZ5.jpg','1987-04-19',82,'Released','For centuries a treaty has existed between the human world and the realm of the demons.','Wicked City',21453,4.109,6.725,'3wOqciTZRik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10818,_binary '\0','/cecix8bTK1GffmOvtUtQuve5ztZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098694',7.2,1875,'cn','阿郎的故事','Ah-Long, a father living a low-class lifestyle, while trying to raise his son, Porky. The strong bond between father and son is tested when a chance encounter from Ah-Long\'s ex-girlfriend changes the course of their lives.','/uitGYHaROmywcpJs2dBGrZHS5NG.jpg','1989-03-16',95,'Released','A painful story of a man to learn the hard facts of life…','All About Ah-Long',76257,2.2871,7.3,'wp6lzDnw-bA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10819,_binary '\0','/wD95UmpUazo9820qnbbjRtbQ884.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098724',7.2,65276,'en','sex, lies, and videotape','Ann, a frustrated wife, enters into counseling due to a troubled marriage. Unbeknownst to her, her husband John has begun an affair with her sister. When John’s best friend Graham arrives, his penchant for interviewing women about their sex lives forever changes John and Ann’s rocky marriage.','/dE0u4uB5UPfVIdz258Ye2XEPuuh.jpg','1989-08-04',101,'Released','the husband. the wife. her sister. his friend.','sex, lies, and videotape',1412,9.3601,7,'6BMZrfINaUk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10820,_binary '\0','/16idNRmOLHtNymKpsn0TnxltbQr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098725',6.7,5938,'en','Sweetie','The buttoned-down, superstitious Kay is attempting to lead a normal existence with her new boyfriend Louis. That’s until Sweetie, her rampaging, devil-may-care sister, returns home after an absence, exposing the rotten roots of their family and placing a strain on Kay and Louis’ relationship.','/25lpQtxNWXzOimnXmbwF0Y0GYej.jpg','1989-09-28',100,'Released','There will not be a more extraordinary film than “Sweetie” in a long long time!','Sweetie',65015,2.749,6.1,'o8JJdI-Yziw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10821,_binary '\0','/xaf8UrRPRrMJG327u1eRmK6F1mp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098966',5.5,28965,'en','3 Men and a Little Lady','Sylvia\'s work increasingly takes her away from the three men who help bring up Mary, her daughter. When she decides to move to England and take Mary with her, the three men are heartbroken at losing the two most important women in their lives.','/4VWWEnhX0zddRKwZWGtIdDcV5U7.jpg','1990-11-21',104,'Released',NULL,'3 Men and a Little Lady',11630,4.3317,5.848,'tzwQWUYtiUE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10822,_binary '\0','/ewCZBw1MlYg1Juk01IIo7vEra3C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098967',6.8,8228,'ja','３－４Ｘ１０月','Masaki, a baseball player and gas-station attendant, gets into trouble with the local Yakuza and goes to Okinawa to get a gun to defend himself. There he meets Uehara, a tough gangster, who is in serious debt to the yakuza and planning revenge.','/cyOqtWxEtMPThNYdydH0W7sYlVp.jpg','1990-09-15',96,'Released',NULL,'Boiling Point',26936,4.5365,6.874,'lrXX9nn4cEU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10823,_binary '\0','/jbGbFD9DgGgrfDVyV8RVuKZjTcW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098987',6.4,20436,'en','The Adventures of Ford Fairlane','To the Los Angeles elite, Ford Fairlane is known as \"Mr. Rock \'n\' Roll Detective.\" This loudmouthed ladies\' man serves an exclusive rock star clientele, who depend on his keen eye and smug discretion. So when a heavy-metal musician dies mid-concert, Fairlane is on the case before the lights come up. But things turn shocking when radio personality Johnny Crunch hires Fairlane to find a missing groupie mere hours before he is electrocuted live on air.','/u6accimG7LmroR8WgNklEJS7oFq.jpg','1990-07-11',102,'Released','Kojak. Columbo. Dirty Harry. Wimps.','The Adventures of Ford Fairlane',9548,5.4038,6.12,'O1s3pfSsjWw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10824,_binary '\0','/veet1q4F3tG3TlqW9Jf5YEF0kJJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098994',6.5,4878,'en','After Dark, My Sweet','Three desperados try to kidnap a wealthy child in hope of turning their lives around.','/6fWrEcIEoFuwYt4MUY4RtZwuMo9.jpg','1990-08-24',114,'Released','All they risked was everything.','After Dark, My Sweet',25501,2.7892,5.667,'atwuYdjbLpg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10825,_binary '\0','/aYiCymYGLrSElxiK6qCxSqGKtmY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0098999',7.6,10078,'hi','अग्निपथ','A young boy\'s father is lynched before his eyes; fifteen years later he returns home for revenge.','/kKCWrcIi6pAXNvPnC1LWtV4hB8u.jpg','1990-02-16',174,'Released','The path of fire.','Agneepath',37403,1.7434,6.351,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10826,_binary '\0','/8Hxzj5RLOMpcb4IzAvCRCgrqXZX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099005',5.8,32758,'en','Air America','Air America was the CIA\'s private airline operating in Laos during the Vietnam War, running anything and everything from soldiers to foodstuffs for local villagers. After losing his pilot\'s license, Billy Covington is recruited, and ends up in the middle of a bunch of lunatic pilots, gun-running by his friend Gene Ryack, and opium smuggling by his own superiors.','/2cVANiDU7AdSLGgs4T7dpgyU2SK.jpg','1990-08-10',112,'Released','The few. The proud. The totally insane.','Air America',11856,4.5929,5.8,'spsxCrPDCi4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10827,_binary '\0','/ofIyN1TZJFvoCePNpbJebsg54D4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099012',6.6,16444,'en','Alice','Alice Tate, mother of two, with a marriage of 16 years, finds herself falling for a handsome sax player, Joe. Stricken with a backache, she consults herbalist Dr. Yang, who realizes that her problems are not related to her back, but in her mind and heart. Dr. Yang\'s magical herbs give Alice wondrous powers, taking her out of her well-established rut.','/g6PGzYqXNofrrGKS7dixoc2P5M7.jpg','1990-12-25',102,'Released','A younger man and a bolder woman','Alice',8217,3.7862,6.343,'oFOsWXU06c8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10828,_binary '\0','/nfpa01wLXNT2QJ7ioNRG1I8hcOB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099018',5.6,5345,'en','Almost an Angel','Terry Dean is an electronics wizard and thief. After he is released from jail, he is hit by a car while saving a little girl\'s life. While in the hospital, he dreams that God visits him and tells him he\'s an Angel, and must start doing good things to make up for his past life. Not believing it at first, he soon becomes convinced he must be an Angel. Not having any Angel powers yet, he must use his own experiences and talents to make good things happen.','/7QDWGSVBzGUWhN1PTnQlZcPjS2A.jpg','1990-12-21',95,'Released','Who does he think he is?','Almost an Angel',25943,2.6219,5.8,'_5ZGcob1q7s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10829,_binary '\0','/sbQKiunr1kHseePuDLI552eTbEG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099026',6,5230,'en','The Ambulance','One minute Josh Baker is meeting the woman of his dreams. The next, he\'s watching her whisked away by a mysterious ambulance that never arrives at the local hospital. Doubted by the police, Josh is forced to carry on a one-man crusade that leads to a discovery more frightening than his worst fears.','/nq9zbzTY93Hg8nhi2axGqobw1sc.jpg','1990-03-22',96,'Released','You\'ll be in perfect health before you die.','The Ambulance',79509,4.0055,5.8,'kTKDxHH9mAU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10830,_binary '\0','/ee1XnlSE5YmmC0OMoCGhDNSEP4M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099028',7.7,1221,'en','American Dream','When workers at the Hormel meatpacking plant in Austin, Minnesota are asked to take a substantial pay cut in a highly profitable year, the local labor union decides to go on strike and fight for a wage they believe is fair. But as the work stoppage drags on and the strikers face losing everything, friends become enemies, families are divided and the very future of this typical mid American town is threatened.','/da6DPUrYsi3K2HzwalUpphtOHec.jpg','1990-10-06',98,'Released','The award-winning film of American lives, American courage, and the...','American Dream',41326,0.9811,7.3,'7eZMfQqcjmM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10831,_binary '\0','/eDX4FucYbcuK1qKGEuh7gbE97SX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099040',7.4,9530,'en','An Angel at My Table','Based on the autobiographical work of New Zealand writer Janet Frame, this production depicts the author at various stage of her life. Afflicted with mental and emotional issues, Frame grows up in an impoverished family and experiences numerous tragedies while still in her youth, including the deaths of two of her siblings. Portrayed as an adult by Kerry Fox, Frame finds acclaim for her writing while still in a mental institution, and her success helps her move on with her life.','/sDICHxQRDkS4TvIDcUgO9URJxu1.jpg','1990-09-20',158,'Released','Based on the autobiographies of Janet Frame','An Angel at My Table',2891,3.2632,7,'AaqhNnRYTfc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10832,_binary '\0','/6IcgPtqOBQXp158CZxr3iGm9G2b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099043',8.2,3360,'ta','அஞ்சலி','After a few years, Chitra learns that her child, who was believed to be dead, is alive but is suffering from a mental illness. However, her family faces many challenges while looking after her child.','/sCIqLX6yNBmFgI4OSLklVJP0Umh.jpg','1990-07-12',150,'Released',NULL,'Anjali',223365,1.0885,7.292,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10833,_binary '\0','/6x7yvYQjVvqGHf9fkLUUlHAFo9R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099044',5.9,48179,'en','Another 48 Hrs.','For the past four years, San Francisco cop Jack Cates has been after an unidentified drug kingpin who calls himself the Ice Man. Jack finds a picture that proves that the Ice Man has put a price on the head of Reggie Hammond, who is scheduled to be released from prison on the next day.','/ixeygHHDsuzsg67H1IPTc3Qp8cR.jpg','1990-06-08',95,'Released','The boys are back in town.','Another 48 Hrs.',11595,6.9917,6.005,'iKMpn9mTV_w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10834,_binary '\0','/w1PDaPJuW3D1TfSxesY7nGZZYS7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099052',6.5,81452,'en','Arachnophobia','A large spider from the jungles of South America is accidentally transported in a crate with a dead body to America where it mates with a local spider. Soon after, the residents of a small California town disappear as the result of spider bites from the deadly spider offspring. It\'s up to a couple of doctors with the help of an insect exterminator to annihilate these eight legged freaks.','/lHjpwv1Yv2RcGcTQb4Lc1cKw1y9.jpg','1990-07-20',109,'Released','Eight legs, two fangs and an attitude.','Arachnophobia',6488,4.1802,6.5,'p2EZkRcw3LA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10835,_binary '\0','/cdgRgfed3CYr7Q1JR8r32A0RXgS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099053',6.3,1901,'en','Archangel','At the height of the October Revolution during the 1919 allied intervention in Arkhangelsk, the exploits of one-legged Canadian soldier Lt. John Boles are told, after he is taken in from the cold by a dysfunctional Russian family and mistakes a local woman for his presumed dead lover.','/fatUPhfZZAs2f8zW6heo1C6yne.jpg','1990-09-01',82,'Released','A Tragedy of the Great War','Archangel',85559,1.0489,5.5,'-2bBKhWVpvg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10836,_binary '\0','/lwaItfvrlvCZl1rAnRZ1d3JMFVi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099073',7.2,7559,'en','Avalon','A Polish-Jewish family comes to the U.S. at the beginning of the twentieth century. There, the family and their children try to make themselves a better future in the so-called promised land.','/lsyPs8pU6hIJCS5sw0H9Q8Tl1nJ.jpg','1990-10-05',126,'Released','Three generations of family. They shared a dream called America in a place called Avalon.','Avalon',2302,3.5776,6.7,'b37auo3dSuM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10837,_binary '\0','/tRKTlMoTsAhYpuq19V8Wk3RFY4O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099077',7.8,178804,'en','Awakenings','Dr. Malcolm Sayer, a shy research physician, uses an experimental drug to \"awaken\" the catatonic victims of a rare disease. Leonard is the first patient to receive the controversial treatment. His awakening, filled with awe and enthusiasm, proves a rebirth for Sayer too, as the exuberant patient reveals life\'s simple but unutterably sweet pleasures to the introverted doctor.','/9gztZXuHLG6AJ0fgqGd7Q43cWRI.jpg','1990-12-04',120,'Released','There is no such thing as a simple miracle.','Awakenings',11005,9.1165,7.789,'7exeVt7CaE4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10838,_binary '\0','/9w3nn4PYprcqxyjm1EPaLt5j6m0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099080',5.9,2048,'hi','Baaghi: A Rebel for Love','Saajan is a college youth, enjoying his life, meets with Kajal the girl of his dreams at a brothel. Kajal is an innocent victim of Dhanraj, who runs this brothel. Saajan eventually falls in love with Kajal, but this love affair is not acceptable to the society, which includes his parents Mr. and Mrs. Sood. Saajan\'s dad Col. Sood wants his son to join the Indian army. On the other side, this relationship of love is also not acceptable to Dhanraj, since he doesn\'t want any of his brothel girls to go into normal respectable society. Trapped between both, Saajan, along with his friends, rescues his love from the brothel. But the question remains: Will Saajan\'s parents accept him along with Kajal or Will Dhanraj\'s evilness overcome the couple\'s love?','/rmKu3ZUUipA0NFjhck8cE6Lf5Hj.jpg','1990-12-11',157,'Released',NULL,'Baaghi: A Rebel for Love',161392,1.5482,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10839,_binary '\0','/AtF7TESJEMmImBRUj9Z7HmW2ZH0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099088',7.5,526378,'en','Back to the Future Part III','The final installment finds Marty digging the trusty DeLorean out of a mineshaft and looking for Doc in the Wild West of 1885. But when their time machine breaks down, the travelers are stranded in a land of spurs. More problems arise when Doc falls for pretty schoolteacher Clara Clayton, and Marty tangles with Buford Tannen.','/crzoVQnMzIrRfHtQw0tLBirNfVg.jpg','1990-05-25',119,'Released','They\'ve saved the best trip for last... But this time they may have gone too far.','Back to the Future Part III',196,15.1653,7.495,'DTdBq1fQOBU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10840,_binary '\0','/c29gQq9hAV2ODfyxb1CoIjZpkGz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099091',6.3,11764,'en','Bad Influence','Wimpy young executive Michael is about to get pulverized by a jealous boyfriend in a bar when a handsome, mysterious stranger steps in—and then disappears. Later that night, Michael runs into a stranger on a pier, who wheedles his way into Michael\'s life and turns it upside down.','/8s4TwiCCBVnikc140osRlhjFFS0.jpg','1990-03-09',99,'Released','When fantasy becomes a fatal distraction.','Bad Influence',24249,4.3272,5.99,'tCUzYCUouMA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10841,_binary '\0','/jywg6eQrXBepgs3Nz30Hlmj0EQa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099108',5.4,6516,'en','Basket Case 2','Duane and his basket-bound mutant brother are taken in by a secret home for wayward freaks.','/sqw2XSwhsfMcoVRnnXcbOeh9IrH.jpg','1990-03-02',90,'Released','This time he\'s not alone.','Basket Case 2',27815,2.034,5.673,'y4OLuDBWKjo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10842,_binary '\0','/bdF4uL620bgzfKjWgP1fetdZIJR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099128',5.7,4281,'en','Betsy\'s Wedding','Offbeat fashion student Betsy Hopper and her straight-laced investment-banker fiancé Jake Lovell just want an intimate little wedding reception, but Betsy\'s father Eddie, a Long Island construction contractor, feels so threatened by Jake\'s rich WASP parents that he blows the ceremony up into a bank-breaking showpiece, sending his wife Lola into a financial panic.','/qV2J2Fprk73ivclpL6JXPsBaCA5.jpg','1990-06-22',94,'Released','The wedding picture doesn\'t always tell the real story.','Betsy\'s Wedding',18913,2.9781,5.7,'umn4udQPlw4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10843,_binary '\0','/3maAvA1cM1LYRq12zGhcjLxTNJR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099136',5.7,1628,'en','The Big Man','An unemployed Scottish miner is forced into bare-knuckle boxing to make ends meet.','/8isAs4kKkC1gqEms6SnllOOQ3Qj.jpg','1990-08-31',116,'Released','Nothing hits as hard as the things that are really worth fighting for...','The Big Man',54833,2.0283,4.9,'9qrbkrMi3xk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10844,_binary '\0','/xdhzKFRMaasOHW54rWvBwg9Tshk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099138',6.9,1704,'en','The Big Steal','Danny wants two things in life more than anything else, one is a Jaguar and the other is Joanna Johnson. After he is conned into trading his Nissan Cedric for a 1973 Jaguar, he plots to win Joanna and get revenge against the sleazy car dealer Gordon Farkes.','/ftSsSxHQ3Sl5wXhNagcKSW0ANht.jpg','1990-09-20',99,'Released',NULL,'The Big Steal',16217,1.8433,5.7,'OAdAstKidvM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10845,_binary '\0','/coTUjqmUcrNLhxVISDdAAphemLt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099141',6,51330,'en','Bird on a Wire','An FBI informant has kept his new identity secret for 15 years. Now an old flame has recognised him, and the bad guys are back for revenge.','/m98qoFAJg09nZmWyI6gricLagX.jpg','1990-05-18',110,'Released','He’s every woman’s dream and one woman’s nightmare.','Bird on a Wire',1727,8.557,6.2,'CJmVVz8sT5U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10846,_binary '\0','/v1so5ZqrSBJkrL0v6qAOJ9yrRsS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099142',5.8,2085,'sv','BlackJack','Kaj, Lennart and Robert are 30-somethings who go out to dance every weekend. At one dance they meet Inger, whom Kaj falls in love with. Kaj has some friends who are playing in a band. The drummer Tommy is known for being the local Casanova, seducing women when ever he gets the chance. It doesn\'t take him long to have an affair with Inger, behind Kaj\'s back.','/cCUdv3ndI407chs1puVCUeNRW4X.jpg','1990-10-07',111,'Released','A film about committed relationships and loose connections.','BlackJack',46977,1.276,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10847,_binary '\0','/lhqahvb6CxF4Ib4l16XPjQ8X0e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099143',6,2353,'en','Black Rainbow','Martha Travis is a medium who makes contact with spirits \"on the other side\" and connects them with their loved ones still alive, in public performances. Trouble begins when she gives a message to Mary Kuron from her husband, Tom. But Tom isn\'t dead... yet. And Martha not only knows he will die, she also knows who killed him. And the murderer knows she knows...','/y7SL4Tl0I2iv6sCZuKYNluTEtJz.jpg','1989-12-05',103,'Released','She has just witnessed a murder that hasn\'t happened yet.','Black Rainbow',71373,3.0527,5.89,'2jsKkKfb4ig','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10848,_binary '\0','/4JoCJjBdVmnKVkiWxFKnwYPtMKp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099151',5.5,1779,'en','Blood Games','When a women\'s softball team win a game against a group of rough talking and dirty playing men, they find themselves unwittingly involved in a new competition with much higher stakes: life and death. After being horribly attacked and assaulted by their male competitors, the women are forced to use both their wits and strength to escape their tormentors and avenge their teammates.','/3WVCpkHtshJByC4766zIBjLkGAG.jpg','1990-12-12',90,'Released','America\'s favorite pastime just turned nasty!','Blood Games',109425,2.4538,5.9,'HDHuGsgvOho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10849,_binary '\0','/3ZohISQDjkS0PtjCJss72MFaBEj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099160',5.8,19368,'en','Blue Steel','Rookie cop Megan Turner orders a burglar to drop his gun. He whirls to shoot. Too late. Turner fires, killing him instantly. When someone lifts the assailant\'s gun from the crime scene, the police hold Turner accountable for killing an unarmed man. That same someone carves Turner\'s name into the bullets and uses them in a series of murders. Turner teams up with detective Nick Mann to clear her name and catch the killer. But she is drawn into a deadly game of wits with a psychopath who\'s always one step ahead… and much closer than she thinks!','/mPUrodB3k8NYcvr4WPwtjSe1Mv9.jpg','1990-03-16',102,'Released','For a rookie cop, there\'s one thing more dangerous than uncovering a killer\'s fantasy...becoming it.','Blue Steel',9491,4.9167,5.8,'KBQif5SBZjc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10850,_binary '\0','/uSInqX82oDeEHSDUwekneCJ2HLc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099165',5.6,27635,'en','The Bonfire of the Vanities','After his mistress runs over a black teen, a Wall Street hotshot sees his life unravel in the spotlight; A down-and-out reporter breaks the story and opportunists clamber to use it to their advantage.','/pdrPrygZ5dVKi8UxrUXMmq1k2iO.jpg','1990-12-21',125,'Released','Take one Wall Street tycoon, his Fifth Avenue mistress, a reporter hungry for fame, and make the wrong turn in The Bronx...then sit back and watch the sparks fly.','The Bonfire of the Vanities',9586,5.5604,5.6,'ZIz_RlNZZlg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10851,_binary '\0','/3DzNIhkERNLiudXGN5Koxxi0oEv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099166',6.2,1412,'en','Book of Love','John Twiller takes down his high school yearbook and begins to reminiscence about that time he first moved into the neighborhood in 1956. His teenage self, Jack is obsessed with Lily one of the more popular girls around. The sole obstacle is Angelo, her bullying boyfriend. With the help of his pals Crutch, Floyd, and Spider, he makes every attempt possible to change her mind.','/euB7qu0yqFWqWlPfgNeOTjEIZCD.jpg','1990-08-03',82,'Released','Some things never change.','Book of Love',52560,2.1325,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10852,_binary '\0','/jVxPhpgZf7uAl2CSC1cPaBPXULl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099172',7.9,1436,'sh','Браћа по матери','This story about two maternal half-brothers, a Croat and a Serb. Although they never met, and both lose their loved ones in ethnic clashes, there is a bond between them. Filmed in 1988, it prophetically forsees the war that would engulf former Yugoslavia three years later.','/b6CrQFkyZHG2mQwgSUVvXayFFab.jpg','1988-09-10',105,'Released',NULL,'Maternal Half-Brothers',67633,1.4015,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10853,_binary '\0','/6DePw8frw8aKunbYIbiXXz8v1Nl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099173',5.8,6539,'en','Brain Dead','In a battle of man versus machine, Martin, a top neurosurgeon who\'s studying brain malfunctions that cause mental illness, delves deep into his own mind to save himself from a megalomaniacal corporation.','/eaoGvqROCuJTKKKRUze8ZUSlzba.jpg','1990-01-16',85,'Released','You have nothing to lose... except your mind.','Brain Dead',5898,2.2633,5.7,'MFT1iP1RS4I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10854,_binary '\0','/mNHraRnc6Q1CHU4A6l720xZojPF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099180',6.2,19333,'en','Bride of Re-Animator','Unperturbed by the disastrous outcome of his previous meddling with the dead, Dr. West continues his research into the phenomenon of re-animation; only this time, he plans to create life – starting with the heart of his young protégé Dan\'s dearly deceased Meg Halsey.','/7t9PmI65umna8yq0BPU9YoKn62I.jpg','1990-09-01',96,'Released','Date. Mate. Re-animate.','Bride of Re-Animator',18111,4.0773,6.4,'7BzXFXw4Ers','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10855,_binary '\0','/fAJidbMQQzjHJFUCWvUmto3OviG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099187',4.5,1442,'en','Buried Alive','A young woman goes to teach at the Ravenscroft Institute, a spooky old girls\' school overrun by ants and staffed by some unusual types. Spurred on by a series of horrific hallucinations, she begins to investigate the mysterious disappearances of several students.','/mHanO22Os21g6ivNpCpK19dCbyI.jpg','1989-09-01',92,'Released','The Dead Return!','Buried Alive',30711,3.778,4.3,'yOZQ10eqIj4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10856,_binary '\0','/o1jzMqBiziQILkPVEONuYS4QluX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099188',6.5,5887,'en','Buried Alive','A married woman and her lover plot to kill her husband to make off with the insurance money. However, their attempt to murder him using poisonous fish toxins backfires in surprising ways.','/75X5BCuZIsfZYxWZfhi02v4MudO.jpg','1990-05-09',94,'Released','One of them put an end to the marriage, until the other came back for revenge.','Buried Alive',37865,2.9957,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10857,_binary '\0','/1Gvk4XqPmavZeM8PbSanpuKCpAv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099197',6.8,4696,'en','By Dawn\'s Early Light','A nuclear warhead launched by Soviet insurgents protesting the waning Cold War destroys the Ukrainian city of Donetsk. The destruction sets off a race between American and Soviet politicians to prevent a nuclear holocaust. While the U.S. president feverishly works to keep the military and political machine from going into overdrive, various subordinates panic. When the president is believed to be killed in a helicopter crash, zealous advisers take over.','/yhNcI8fpXVj3fjCYV2OfyHdBUN3.jpg','1990-05-19',101,'Released','Four people... Three minutes... Two choices... One chance for survival.','By Dawn\'s Early Light',20674,2.9496,6.5,'56UeHe6dBy4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10858,_binary '\0','/2vwdoHlFhxEHLptHVly1rXXUFsj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099204',5.8,17735,'en','Cadillac Man','Joe\'s a car salesman with a problem—he has two days to sell 12 cars or he loses his job. This would be a difficult task at the best of times but Joe has to contend with his girlfriends (he\'s two-timing), a missing teenage daughter and an ex-wife.','/fRwrbKVyFEZEPFmeTDea5PlUO77.jpg','1990-05-18',97,'Released','If you can\'t trust a car salesman who can you trust?','Cadillac Man',10164,4.0513,5.815,'n6cVm9wkmUA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10859,_binary '\0','/vPxVLoAMSW17utSeRNPTTe7sMx8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099212',5.7,1261,'en','Camp Cucamonga','Standard camp shenanigans and romance amongst the counselors and the campers at a lake front summer camp.','/hhPLBTZgWwDIMW0vj3tybRdgnwf.jpg','1990-09-23',93,'Released','The zaniest, most hilarious vacation ever!','Camp Cucamonga',49497,2.0698,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10860,_binary '\0','/1ggiVCeJDwfrkgKrtOTbZsgZF6w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099242',6.3,2750,'en','Chattahoochee','In 1955 Florida, a Korean vet has a breakdown and is incarcerated in a \"maximum security\" mental health prison, where patients are abused.','/yr44A2Hf06a8To57nlffvNMZIOO.jpg','1990-04-20',98,'Released',NULL,'Chattahoochee',86763,1.3937,5.7,'C0bYclLdVFI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10861,_binary '\0','/fNkt4S5iXgBD4ea5bP9MZRHO8su.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099253',6,65472,'en','Child\'s Play 2','Chucky is reconstructed by a toy factory to dispel the negative publicity surrounding the doll, and tracks young Andy Barclay to a foster home where the chase begins again.','/2tPQbPQeHEYAGoXFSW61IWNmoce.jpg','1990-11-09',84,'Released','Sorry Jack... Chucky\'s back!','Child\'s Play 2',11186,10.0628,6.4,'A1LRR3jLNBs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10862,_binary '\0','/zaI2GlwFhEhNOuguwprmst9NN4g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099260',5.4,2105,'en','China O\'Brien','China O\'Brien; big city police woman; martial arts trainer, is forced to hand in her badge and head home to her father and the small town where she grew up. The peaceful town she knew is now struggling against the clutches of organized crime. When her father, the town sheriff, is killed China decides to run for his position and clean up the town. The poll results spark a series of confrontations that finally decide who runs the town . . .','/bJ8ZR3bg5DMKtCXAzXzzy8GGhsW.jpg','1990-02-01',90,'Released','She is the ultimate weapon.','China O\'Brien',13293,1.7056,5.5,'lmtcLf-06PE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10863,_binary '\0','/kjcHGce2T3ODLpllZNJ8kKtN0Id.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099263',7.7,1711,'en','The Christmas Toy','It\'s Christmas Eve and the playroom is alive with excitement for the new toys that will arrive the next day. Balthazar, the old and wise bear, explains to the other toys that they must welcome the newcomers even though each of them may be replaced as one of the children\'s new favorite toys.','/d6vCW5OxKD7HyH77rCBiBHi8BvN.jpg','1986-12-06',50,'Released','The toys are stirring, as the magic of Christmas approaches!','The Christmas Toy',47670,1.7026,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10864,_binary '\0','/q0Gpa9SmAEjyNI5nOWNJfqMuzg0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099266',7.6,6182,'fr','Le Château de ma mère','To his chagrin, young Marcel Pagnol and his family move back to their home in Marseille, France, far from their pastoral holiday cottage in the hills. Determined, Marcel makes the long voyage back to the cottage on foot and lands himself in trouble. One day Marcel\'s father discovers a shortcut to the cottage, but it requires trespassing. Despite their trepidations, Marcel and his family begin using the secret trail to reach their cottage.','/hw8Ec4jFuxSNCMUZiUpBKOMl65G.jpg','1990-10-26',99,'Released','Return to childhood in Provence.','My Mother\'s Castle',12717,2.6069,7.2,'B7RSYfXIjj8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10865,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099273',6.5,2165,'en','Zycie miejskie','A kaleidoscopic panorama of the world. A visual anthology of twelve short stories by twelve innovative directors from all over the world.','/mVqZjzHrcPjJEAzEwD9aXdDiEK4.jpg','1990-01-26',251,'Released',NULL,'City Life',128028,0.8719,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10866,_binary '\0','/aSNagpdVCD9UFI1PWrH8jOLnRN1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099277',5.9,10069,'en','Class of 1999','The time is in the future and the youth gang violence is so high that the areas around some schools have become \"free-fire zones\", into which not even the police will venture. When Miles Langford, the head of Kennedy High School, decides to take his school back from the gangs, robotics specialist Dr. Robert Forrest provides \"tactical education units\". These are amazingly human-like androids that have been programmed to teach and are supplied with devastatingly effective solutions to discipline problems. So when the violent, out-of-control students of Kennedy High report for class tomorrow, they\'re going to get a real education... in staying alive!','/yz5dyOHrJ5SdzWrue6ofkdX6cXI.jpg','1990-04-01',96,'Released','The ultimate teaching machine... out of control','Class of 1999',23535,4.2454,6,'3w-ph46XYWQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10867,_binary '\0','/wtoCRQkf3apyi9IXROsBb2KM9nC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099291',6.7,3311,'en','Come See the Paradise','In this drama from director Alan Parker, on-the-lam Jack McGurn flees to Los Angeles and takes a job as a projectionist at a movie theater owned by a Japanese-American man. Jack falls for the owner\'s daughter, Lily, but they are forced to elope to Seattle when her father forbids the relationship. The couple marry and have a daughter, but when World War II breaks out, Jack is powerless to stop his new family\'s forced internment.','/uBdJXVfcQkhKBg2SfydhoTqtcBr.jpg','1990-08-17',133,'Released','In 1942 over 100,000 Americans were interned in prison camps. In America.','Come See the Paradise',59820,2.8855,6.2,'pBxqOy937j0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10868,_binary '\0','/wxar2zWRu7FK4FylQnnDdHlXs0h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099292',6.3,7280,'en','The Comfort of Strangers','An Italian diplomat\'s son follows and seduces English lovers in Venice.','/iMhWT5wdVLnDiz4hUEAOYcTqbGf.jpg','1990-11-01',107,'Released','A story of passionate obsession.','The Comfort of Strangers',41925,3.9063,5.9,'BfiHiqXaRVk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10869,_binary '\0','/xQuAtOd8huwXZi6IvUvjM5lIHwO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099293',5.8,1756,'it','Le comiche','Two silent movie actors escape from their film. Forced to find a way to survive in the real world, they will only cause troubles to the people they will meet along the way.','/uJ4IFom4EL8hC2H5VKmm8hLxbJi.jpg','1990-10-28',90,'Released',NULL,'The Comics',43646,0.9786,5.825,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10870,_binary '\0','/kk6pEnKHM5xu8YyJyfW0sFgLLiX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099310',6.7,2787,'en','Coupe de Ville','Meet the Libner brothers: Marvin, the oldest, is a sergeant in the U.S. Air Force. Buddy, the middle child, is a timid dreamer. Bobby, the youngest, is a handsome rebel in reform school. As kids, they fought a lot and as adults, they barely speak. In the summer of 1963, their tough and eccentric father, Fred, gives them a task: to bring a 1954 Cadillac, bought for their mother, Betty, from Detroit to Miami. As the trip goes on, the three brothers fight and begin to reconnect with each other, while trying to keep the Caddy in mint condition.','/gji7RKz0CuSwjDYQQdZwuzOi25e.jpg','1990-03-09',99,'Released','A comedy for everyone who ever struggled to love a brother...or strangle one.','Coupe de Ville',39062,1.8092,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10871,_binary '\0','/sKZIbs5GFilVHrqXEHFFR2iKWSn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099312',4.5,1895,'en','Cover-Up','Mike Anderson, a tough American reporter on a dangerous foreign assignment, finds his own life in jeopardy when he uncovers a deadly labyrinth of political intrigue that threatens the lives of thousands. Dispatched to investigate a mysterious and fatal attack on an overseas US naval base, Anderson, a leading investigative journalist and ex-US marine, finds himself back on familiar ground. Instinct makes him question the official CIA explanation that cites an unknown terrorist group called Black October. Alone, and armed only with his combat training and determination to uncover the truth, he sets out to expose a complex and dangerous political web.','/rn9qE7iQSKs8gUwESqhHSfDkstk.jpg','1991-02-22',90,'Released','If the lies don\'t kill you – the truth will.','Cover-Up',88067,2.9731,4,'XeTKbswdmgg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10872,_binary '\0','/5uM5NIxyKgl8ykBYUKwHiczc2nR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099316',6,5134,'en','Crazy People','A bitter ad executive, who has reached his breaking point, finds himself in a mental institution, where his career actually begins to thrive with the help of the hospital\'s patients.','/xadRX5tAr5hsGLWRhoubQwKiWgD.jpg','1990-04-13',90,'Released','Warning: Crazy People are coming.','Crazy People',16814,2.6275,5.9,'B8sgkc2E5oM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10873,_binary '\0','/r5Gk86L6tfxh9PU1HOXlszxMNxL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099327',5.8,1321,'en','A Cry in the Wild','13-year-old Brian is the sole survivor of an unreported plane crash. Alone in the Yukon wilderness, Brian must learn to survive by his wits, find food and shelter, and brave wild, hungry animals until or if he is found.','/o2xNHWOk6jXmwm1Cqbv1HAjByWf.jpg','1990-06-01',82,'Released',NULL,'A Cry in the Wild',25373,2.2932,5.6,'e5Lx2V6gNZQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10874,_binary '\0','/2PQTdo555CTsSfgPWCHv7sxmDxR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099329',6.5,69360,'en','Cry-Baby','A prim and proper schoolgirl goes against her society grandmother\'s wishes when she dates a motorcycle-riding juvenile delinquent.','/o3zl5Nd1L5OVv5HTVcMBF23OSy2.jpg','1990-04-06',85,'Released','Good girls want him bad. Bad girls want him worse.','Cry-Baby',9768,5.2216,6.5,'wkk5_7OH0kE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10875,_binary '\0','/bvpYJgsC5jcMJd43HRHXUQw7j5O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099334',7.5,27826,'fr','Cyrano de Bergerac','Famed swordsman and poet Cyrano de Bergerac is in love with his cousin Roxane. He has never expressed his love for her as he his large nose undermines his self-confidence. Then he finds a way to express his love to her, indirectly.','/80XJ5UkGuYTKDuALeG03BLk1OT1.jpg','1990-03-28',137,'Released',NULL,'Cyrano de Bergerac',11673,3.3317,7.3,'fJyaXzAmYPs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10876,_binary '\0','/ywWva4trKw7f3wtbz81Fe3FnrtC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099348',8,313190,'en','Dances with Wolves','Wounded Civil War soldier John Dunbar tries to commit suicide—and becomes a hero instead. As a reward, he\'s assigned to his dream post, a remote junction on the Western frontier, and soon makes unlikely friends with the local Sioux tribe.','/hw0ZEHAaTqTxSXGVwUFX7uvanSA.jpg','1990-11-09',181,'Released','Inside everyone is a frontier waiting to be discovered.','Dances with Wolves',581,14.6132,7.839,'N4gr-uXUg1M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10877,_binary '\0','/AmYRSICb6OjblGlyAEFiJ4cMfKF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099365',6.4,75594,'en','Darkman','Dr. Peyton Westlake is on the verge of realizing a major breakthrough in synthetic skin when his laboratory is destroyed by gangsters. Having been burned beyond recognition and forever altered by an experimental medical procedure, Westlake becomes known as Darkman, assuming alternate identities in his quest for revenge and a new life with a former love.','/9fxGRzlINIvfPFhizMgbQaDDrK.jpg','1990-08-24',95,'Released','They destroyed everything he had, everything he was. Now, crime has a new enemy and justice has a new face.','Darkman',9556,5.5126,6.4,'L58rdhCfDIU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10878,_binary '\0','/t61Pj0FsdvM5JSEdzTcbpLM4ZaH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099371',6.2,106678,'en','Days of Thunder','Talented but unproven stock car driver Cole Trickle gets a break and with the guidance of veteran Harry Hogge turns heads on the track. The young hotshot develops a rivalry with a fellow racer that threatens his career when the two smash their cars. But with the help of his doctor, Cole just might overcome his injuries-- and his fear.','/8UvcoeMJag8UWGF8sg7eYspzq0Q.jpg','1990-06-27',107,'Released','You can\'t outrun the thunder.','Days of Thunder',2119,11.5266,6.397,'zyTrK5tqJg0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10879,_binary '\0','/hScy7EZ0rGWu6rP2UHouv0VJdZx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099377',6.4,3166,'en','Deadbeat at Dawn','Goose leaves the gang life behind after pleas from his girlfriend. But it isn\'t long before he\'s pulled back into the world of violence.','/FmXGssWDpWbUwpiGOD90ftybV3.jpg','1988-11-18',81,'Released','He quit the gangs. They killed his girl. He became...','Deadbeat at Dawn',86252,1.1958,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10880,_binary '\0','/fOnlkrTC4iKeNDZh6mY6lBGTSaE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099381',4.7,1594,'en','Deadly Manor','A group of teenagers take refuge in an old, deserted mansion. Soon the members of the group start turning up dead, and the teenagers realize that they\'re not alone in the mansion.','/vxHRvcAvwcEAUNyaOD5OyQpIU0S.jpg','1990-03-07',87,'Released','She has a lust for life - pray it\'s not yours!','Deadly Manor',128188,1.0275,5.1,'GDVgTCrmh7c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10881,_binary '\0','/pslxxnls9RVdHTpA2K9cFN3GsN8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099384',5.2,4464,'en','Death Spa','Michael\'s health club is beseiged with a series of terrible murders involving killer saunas and other grisly devices. Michael\'s wife killed herself a while before and her brother holds Michael responsible. Michael needs to stop the bloodshed before he loses all of his clients.','/5MgYDkLLOLf3y03s2lyxpjIGXe2.jpg','1988-07-29',87,'Released','You’ll sweat blood!','Death Spa',28389,2.0075,5.2,'Awqleezg__c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10882,_binary '\0','/mYiTorq97lCQHUDTbk7M4jiT5B0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099385',5.7,23572,'en','Death Warrant','Canadian policeman Louis Burke is assigned in a jail to investigate the murders of prisoners and jailors. While there, Louis, using his outstanding martial arts skills, is able to save his life and make himself respected in this violent world.','/95mcKAcTgvonhx3BS5psLguyEVu.jpg','1990-09-14',89,'Released','He loves a good fight.','Death Warrant',17466,7.5444,6.27,'SRS5y3kC0ms','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10883,_binary '\0','/ytU25LDO2Mv1B6XWWf8FgAYfJmV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099387',5.7,2914,'en','The Death of the Incredible Hulk','In his final attempt to free himself from the curse of the Hulk, Dr. David Banner becomes involved in a dangerous international espionage mission that may finally lead to a cure. As forces close in and the stakes rise, Banner faces an ultimate sacrifice, bringing his tragic journey to a definitive and emotional conclusion.','/6q6CviMLR97ssODmKhxgyxQuoYp.jpg','1990-02-18',95,'Released','For 12 years, he\'s been running. Tonight, it\'s over. Tonight, David Banner will find freedom... or death.','The Death of the Incredible Hulk',19593,3.6654,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10884,_binary '\0','/pk3EbTs1Vz0umXmFRAkRhbQLzhO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099388',3.7,1313,'en','Deathstalker IV: Match of Titans','What begins as a grand tournament soon turns sinister when fighters start disappearing without a trace. Drawn into the mystery, Deathstalker uncovers a wicked queen’s plot and her army of unstoppable stone warriors. Now, with his fellow champions in danger and a new love to protect, Deathstalker must fight his greatest battle yet—or become just another casualty in her twisted game.','/sbFVPFuikx4RFOOrMn7qr0gea0q.jpg','1991-07-13',75,'Released','Out of legend rides one man with an invincible sword!','Deathstalker IV: Match of Titans',47363,1.4528,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10885,_binary '\0','/fTPi0tXFf4BSDDdf7J9pq5V9XyG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099395',5.3,2841,'en','Def by Temptation','An evil succubus is preying on libidinous black men in New York, and all that stands in her way is a minister-in-training, an aspiring actor, and a cop that specializes in cases involving the supernatural.','/cC96OjOeYXmBF6RuePlxA709tkz.jpg','1990-03-23',95,'Released','A terrifying tale of vampires and lust!','Def by Temptation',71853,2.5487,4.8,'FB4DLSJsmDA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10886,_binary '\0','/pYk1FlnMZ5HX3qGL66fLf1UQMeJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099397',5.5,1375,'en','Defenseless','A Los Angeles lawyer defends her former college roommate, whose husband — her lover — has been slain.','/sLz1VIkQM51vELVI76XEYh1nPYC.jpg','1991-08-23',104,'Released','Stalked by a madman. Framed by a killer. Terrified by the truth.','Defenseless',41787,2.032,4.9,'tXMow1nLBhY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10887,_binary '\0','/bxD9dOUhAT2hcuhhv0rL0WXQkRC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099399',5,9203,'en','Delta Force 2: The Colombian Connection','When DEA agents are taken captive by a ruthless South American kingpin, the Delta Force is reunited to rescue them in this sequel to the 1986 film.','/9rBVHD1gYSx5bOwCgqSdljUXKY8.jpg','1990-08-24',110,'Released','Norris and the force are back','Delta Force 2: The Colombian Connection',19086,4.4985,5.6,'q-8LgRGZ5hI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10888,_binary '\0','/zqvDiDE5YsvKIqA1gJRSTHl61H7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099401',4.8,3872,'en','Demon Wind','The strange and brutal deaths of Cory’s grandparents has haunted him for years. Determined to discover the truth, he has returned to the desolate region where they lived, along with a group of friends, to try and uncover the mystery. Ignoring warnings from the locals that the area is cursed, Cory and his friends soon realize that the legend is true, as the Demon Wind, possesses and destroys them, one by one, turning them into monsters from hell.','/j2H1ilFKFcD73o1G52NOJMkO8DI.jpg','1990-07-05',96,'Released','It\'ll Blow You Away','Demon Wind',58899,2.6437,4.9,'8Jo4t-aTVe4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10889,_binary '\0','/gc1Y41h4Pfx9MyBKhTo7rtRC7xs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099409',5.4,9390,'en','Desperate Hours','An escaped con, on the run from the law, moves into a married couple\'s house and takes over their lives.','/gtIRVVHRRr4iWN8yJ6tQs0CqWV2.jpg','1990-10-05',105,'Released','Desire is the deadliest weapon of all.','Desperate Hours',31676,3.7292,5.4,'MYMJIMEVYpY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10890,_binary '\0','/zW4vA16M8h8GPPmJFosTY6MUhBR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099422',6.2,70749,'en','Dick Tracy','The comic strip detective finds his life vastly complicated when Breathless Mahoney makes advances towards him while he is trying to battle Big Boy Caprice\'s united mob.','/sjeP4bpgsUvAGE8oFcICy2GaHxw.jpg','1990-06-15',105,'Released','Their turf. Their game. Their rules. They didn\'t count on HIS law...','Dick Tracy',8592,5.7926,6.2,'-4rzqSsqaqA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10891,_binary '\0','/cDtefl7KGnKrDziEUXetMnztvqr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099423',7.2,410019,'en','Die Hard 2','One year after his heroics in Los Angeles, John McClane is an off-duty cop who is the wrong guy in the wrong place at the wrong time. On a snowy Christmas Eve, as he waits for his wife\'s plane to land at Washington Dulles International Airport, terrorists take over the air traffic control system in a plot to free a South American army general and drug smuggler being flown into the US to face drug charges. It\'s now up to McClane to take on the terrorists, while coping with an inept airport police chief, an uncooperative anti-terrorist squad, and the life of his wife and everyone else trapped in planes circling overhead.','/ybki0UWO3OPhaM6MSniuKC7sy1R.jpg','1990-07-03',124,'Released','Die harder.','Die Hard 2',1573,18.7515,7,'IoZCfS5290M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10892,_binary '\0','/llPr868m7jtx63Xr0ZItmvYZokv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099426',7.5,13614,'cn','喋血街頭','Three childhood friends from the slums of Hong Kong flee to war-time Saigon after accidentally murdering a gang leader, but their troubles only escalate.','/zsLcRua8Jt5RtD8l8NAq1voXDfg.jpg','1990-08-17',136,'Released','Once The Best of Friends, Now The Worst of... Enemies!','Bullet in the Head',11909,6.6628,7.561,'86tatNXDTME','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10893,_binary '\0','/1Z9MVVGopIu0NAvzO9pQCQO2WLn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099429',6.6,6211,'hi','दिल','Raja lives a poor lifestyle along with his dad, Hazariprasad and mom. He attends college where he has several run-ins with wealthy fellow-collegian, Madhu Mehra. Matters escalate to such an extent that she accuses him of sexually molesting her. When his dad comes to know, he decides to seize this chance to get rich quickly, masquerades as a wealthy businessman, approaches Mr. Mehra, and arranges for their children to get married. Murphy\'s law prevails at the time of the engagement - changing everyone\'s lives forever.','/aecBFir2aF59MOflpYimaFu7hnI.jpg','1990-06-22',172,'Released','Love only listens to the heart','Dil',65683,1.8797,6.461,'yP4XNR9q-6k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10894,_binary '\0','/wuSvmesQeVTqDit6UQ3iu14tvv3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099450',5.7,3561,'en','Don\'t Tell Her It\'s Me','Gus is a fat cartoonist that recently won a battle against cancer, which explains his baldness. But he is also lonely. Therefore, his caring sister tries to set him up with suitable woman. But to do so, she must turn him into an irresistible man. When he falls in love with Emily, Gus takes the identity of a mysterious biker from New Zealand.','/6r1jVWG8PK7qfsOiwLQrXqCilg5.jpg','1990-09-21',101,'Released','A romantic comedy about true love under false pretenses.','Don\'t Tell Her It\'s Me',21433,2.5548,5.8,'K0-Ir38NGKw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10895,_binary '\0','/n23dBKQHqy7dlWVhW4Oc96xaGNa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099460',5.7,2350,'en','Downtown','Officer Alex Kearney patrols an upscale neighborhood in Philadelphia, where he pulls over a well-connected white collar executive who promises to get even with the policeman. Soon, Kearney learns that he is off the cushy suburban beat and must now work in the deadliest precinct in Philly, where he is partnered with tough veteran cop Dennis Curran. Tensions are high between them, but Kearney soon proves he can play just as rough as the crooks.','/mNZxZ9VcpNBTipjaKyZqEvvsKjB.jpg','1990-01-12',96,'Released','When you pound this beat, it pounds you back.','Downtown',60778,1.9686,5.6,'96340xjWxI4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10896,_binary '\0','/rpFJFmZplfOp2JzpmsWzmX72hJK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099472',6.8,30680,'en','DuckTales: The Movie - Treasure of the Lost Lamp','With his nephews and niece, everyone\'s favorite rich uncle, Scrooge McDuck, treks from his mansion home in Duckburg in search of the long-lost loot of the thief Collie Baba. But finding the goods isn\'t quite what it\'s \"quacked\" up to be! Their thrilling adventure leads to comical chaos, magical mayhem, and a lesson about what is far more valuable than money, gold and jewels.','/tXya1Z9SC51kNOHsFxRqL1GIBua.jpg','1990-08-03',74,'Released',NULL,'DuckTales: The Movie - Treasure of the Lost Lamp',10837,9.1694,6.701,'lcpCapjKT9I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10897,_binary '\0','/2VUh6KYFL04sbAMXVYyzScDCBXT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099479',6.2,1807,'no','Døden på Oslo S','A young boy named Pelle falls in love with the drug addict Lena. Then he and his friend Proffen try to save her from drugs.','/4iMPSDMutxOuTMs72nvEL1ByJ8H.jpg','1990-08-30',99,'Released',NULL,'Death at Oslo Central',34982,1.5461,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10898,_binary '\0','/jz6QSRsQWQUsj8iIdcHltbKkBs3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099484',5.5,4701,'es','Las edades de Lulú','Fifteen-year-old Lulu has never known any affection from her family. But when she goes to a rock concert with Pablo, a friend of the family, he introduces Lulu to her first sexual experience. Years later, Pablo and Lulu have married; Pablo has created a sheltered, private world for Lulu, into which nothing intrudes. However, Lulu tires of her cloistered existence, and begins hanging out in shady bars, looking for vicarious thrills and danger.','/reyEwMbNZ88RjS9JP9FkY7vptp4.jpg','1990-12-03',95,'Released','A scorching Spanish sexual awakening.','The Ages of Lulu',53932,5.9968,6.394,'BLW8D2qI6jE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10899,_binary '\0','/uNLIMPxknsV4n3IAEDpS1iqF5dm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099487',7.8,570482,'en','Edward Scissorhands','A small suburban town receives a visit from a castaway unfinished science experiment named Edward.','/e0FqKFvGPdQNWG8tF9cZBtev9Em.jpg','1990-12-07',105,'Released','Innocence is what he knows. Beauty is what she sees.','Edward Scissorhands',162,23.5273,7.719,'S8bBjpUBbro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10900,_binary '\0','/y0qgmasTa