he office where it is held up as a fine example of employees intending to do career.','/jJWsCKzOtDHqoRQlW6S8j5a29eX.jpg','1990-12-21',82,'Released',NULL,'Fantozzi to the Rescue',37770,1.1785,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10908,_binary '\0','/A5cyvRBMqLMQwV9qQghCyr4Eech.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099546',4.9,1350,'en','Far Out Man','An aging hippie sets out on a trip across America to find his family.','/17ivrq2ziE8CZ4oknJXuXEBVE3T.jpg','1990-05-11',84,'Released','No brain, no pain.','Far Out Man',25111,1.7787,5.5,'8swgEVCJGzE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10909,_binary '\0','/w5qoRmZb4GVtn5njiTZlZAV1cyq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099557',5.9,1685,'en','Fear','A psychic helps police solve murders by mentally linking with the murderer. Then she discovers a murderer with the same talent, who wants to share the fear of his victims with her!','/A36ATn3m63VnjMR8lMJu2Z5L1dv.jpg','1990-07-15',95,'Released','Your First Impulse Your Last Sensation','Fear',52395,1.5808,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10910,_binary '\0','/7aSAcFotWDxz2g8wQWBPPWL9yHr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099558',7.2,25085,'cn','飛鷹計劃','Hired by a Spanish baron, Hong Kong treasure hunter Jackie, a.k.a. \"Asian Hawk\" and his entourage seek WWII Nazi gold buried in the Sahara Desert.','/25kyDgsGz1HzW4SqJTylhBaU5sW.jpg','1991-02-07',107,'Released','On his most dangerous mission ever, the world\'s toughest secret agent isn\'t going in alone.','Operation Condor',10975,6.8944,7.3,'Q5hmNJoo7ek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10911,_binary '\0','/j8ajhpIpX2mR3SEfc6kSsdZefGR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099566',7.3,7692,'en','The Field','\"Bull\" McCabe\'s family has farmed a field for generations, sacrificing much in the name of the land. When the widow who owns the field decides to sell it in a public auction, McCabe knows that he must own it. While no local dare bid against him, a wealthy American decides he requires the field to build a highway. \"Bull\" and his son decide they must try to convince the American to let go of his ambition and return home, but the consequences of their plot prove sinister.','/ppF5pUheNoL0EPuGRIEnHz1ewp7.jpg','1990-09-21',110,'Released','It Owns Him...It Possesses Him...And It Could Even Destroy Him','The Field',31651,2.395,7,'fP1OGWznR68','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10912,_binary '\0','/xhZq2hvIMCDNlVOP7sEiqxPFKfs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099575',4.8,8031,'en','Fire Birds','A joint task force operation between the Drug Enforcement Administration and the U.S. Army has been formed to dismantle one of the largest drug cartels operating in South America. Multiple attempts to assault the cartel\'s mountainous compound have been thwarted by a Scorpion-attack helicopter piloted by a cartel leader, Eric Stoller (Bert Rhine). After having several aircraft shot down, most notably a pair of UH–60 Black Hawks and their AH–1 Cobra escorts, the army turns to the new AH–64 Apache attack helicopter, which can match its enemies\' maneuverability and firepower.','/ccqyNqhesnxc090uNKgMOeIef3n.jpg','1990-05-25',85,'Released','The best just got better','Fire Birds',6470,2.8842,5,'eclSe15AeMU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10913,_binary '\0','/zrOOuJbNmULSWqsXOaVjwmtiavI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099578',5.7,5904,'en','The First Power','A dedicated L.A. police detective and a female psychic must stop a demonic serial killer who was given the powers of resurrection, teleportation and possession.','/6FNwKIHiALTv6Lt16pAVtP8L1tc.jpg','1990-04-06',98,'Released',NULL,'The First Power',41374,2.8009,5.667,'qwkpaM0qssc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10914,_binary '\0','/fu8pdH9bV7ILcgoRqPiMOQB41Bx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099581',6.2,6059,'en','Flashback','A hippie radical, Huey Walker has been a fugitive for decades, accused of a crime that he may not have committed. Finally apprehended, Walker is escorted to trial by uptight 20-something FBI agent John Buckner. While the two seem to be polar opposites, it turns out that Buckner may have more in common with Walker than is initially apparent, a point that is driven home when the pair faces off against a sinister small-town sheriff.','/zHJbL26SdgeWbKFJVKNfEI4LJwS.jpg','1990-02-02',108,'Released','A \'60s radical. An uptight fed. It\'s gonna be a real trip!','Flashback',12719,1.9708,6.4,'Y_z0FPNBeio','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10915,_binary '\0','/kI1wLZdD5n28SknQaRIkSoSRfas.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099582',6.6,99193,'en','Flatliners','Five medical students experiment with \"near death\" experiences, until the dark consequences of past tragedies begin to jeopardize their lives.','/wda3j7p7YHXKpFIlSzoTCtP7myF.jpg','1990-08-10',115,'Released','Some lines shouldn\'t be crossed.','Flatliners',1551,6.3424,6.5,'7FlbnHrrLd8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10916,_binary '\0','/6JVtYVIqJzsD1XmmhYO8O9bUVc8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099587',5.8,8525,'en','Flight of the Intruder','U.S. Navy pilot Lt. Jake Grafton and his bombardier buddy, Lt. Cmdr. Virgil Cole, are two soldiers embedded in the Vietnam War growing frustrated by the military\'s constraints on their missions. Despite the best efforts of their commanding officer, Cmdr. Frank Camparelli, to re-engage them, this disillusioned pair decide to take the war effort into their own hands with an explosive battle plan that could well get them court-martialed.','/tzjCePBItSRfZxLnOd3KBGHQIJl.jpg','1991-01-18',115,'Released','The only thing they can count on is each other.','Flight of the Intruder',18886,3.8101,5.8,'jg0s5ljjShQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10917,_binary '\0','/ogyNsxYbXrLJZcHdKgebIw2eakb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099595',4,2038,'en','The Forbidden Dance','A princess in the Amazon rain forests tries to fight a conglomerate threatening the forests by going to Los Angeles. There she links up with a rich kid who tells her that she must get on television to succeed with her mission. Quick as a wink, the two come up with the idea of winning a lambada dance contest.','/2qdAXHzx1VLmBsS3TvPbHg4RnO7.jpg','1990-03-16',97,'Released','LAMBADA...If it got any hotter, it wouldn\'t be dancing!','The Forbidden Dance',118430,2.7799,6.1,'i0uLH8MnHzU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10918,_binary '\0','/7famJkkEBoC3ezGSIeSNd3hEwlg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099606',5.5,2293,'en','The Fourth War','Cold War adversaries Col. Jack Knowles and his Russian counterpart, Col. Valachev, are stationed on opposite sides of the German-Czech border. Both men are responsible for a group of troops in their remote settings, and both have been shaped by their combat experiences and a shared aversion to their superiors\' ways of doing things. After a defector is killed, things escalate into a full-fledged battle with serious geopolitical ramifications.','/sxSLCQQ37QP0YZxUITtB18bynHS.jpg','1990-01-12',91,'Released','Two proud heroes with no one left to fight... But each other.','The Fourth War',51434,2.2333,5.3,'ACqYwWEPeUg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10919,_binary '\0','/pI56isyuRNOr4fFr0jRlIPnr3wv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099611',6.2,17328,'en','Frankenhooker','A medical school dropout loses his fiancée in a tragic lawnmower incident and decides to bring her back to life. Unfortunately, he was only able to save her head, so he goes to the red light district in the city and lures prostitutes into a hotel room so he can collect body parts to reassemble her.','/s8Oubzkc2pPdOdj4D23ljZSKRbg.jpg','1990-06-01',85,'Released','A terrifying tale of sluts and bolts.','Frankenhooker',27274,3.7201,6.3,'8-LQ01M32LA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10920,_binary '\0','/8xUn8X9tUyFRGEbyUuMo17nEu3g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099612',5.4,4586,'en','Frankenstein Unbound','The ultimate weapon, claimed to be safe for mankind, produces global side-effects including time slides and disappearances. The scientist behind the project and his car are zapped from the year 2031 to 1817 in Switzerland where he meets Dr. Victor Frankenstein, Mary Shelley and others.','/r5l1RDSOShMrUmRtiADxrq3ig00.jpg','1990-11-02',85,'Released','Classic terror is now state-of-the-art shock.','Frankenstein Unbound',3072,2.7232,5.9,'FrNfBd_uYbk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10921,_binary '\0','/xbYDtVWOOL84KaZjM5JnQ5QYAuX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099615',6.5,23470,'en','The Freshman','After a film student gets his belongings stolen, he meets a mobster bearing a startling resemblance to a certain cinematic godfather. Soon, he finds himself caught up in a caper involving endangered species and fine dining.','/tKeZDE3Hbne5w43k7ASFolDKroC.jpg','1990-07-20',102,'Released','He was on his way to the Dean\'s List, but he wound up on the hit list.','The Freshman',10168,4.9433,6.306,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10922,_binary '\0','/M7eWujni01Fl7D1paisYsE3qjQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099623',4.9,1671,'en','Funny About Love','As political cartoonist Duffy and his bride Meg fail to conceive, he and sorority girl Daphne succeed.','/gei3BmOGgFifatN3DvW1Sx3nsJx.jpg','1990-09-21',101,'Released','Everyone has a biological clock. Duffy Bergman\'s is about to go off.','Funny About Love',39140,2.0838,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10923,_binary '\0','/pyP0Ly6JwDHYEPoQJxbTBD2Oc5z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099624',3.4,1349,'en','Future Force','In the future, a cop protects a reporter from an organization of crooked, renegade cops who thinks she knows too much about them.','/fHXxRYSwIT9v4BYlE9T7V9brrOl.jpg','1989-02-08',84,'Released','Each crime has a price... Each \'criminal\' a warning... Each bounty: dead or alive!','Future Force',67716,1.6616,3.7,'LG0mjcPf_Iw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10924,_binary '\0','/d9hNsOcc4jT3Fy3o9IaZ5B54wCT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099629',6.4,1225,'cn','咖喱辣椒','Two best friends and cop partners become the subject of a beautiful news reporter\'s documentary. The two soon find themselves competing for screen time as well as the love of the reporter while after a murderous arms dealer.','/cmNu9zI4Aq4v1jkpvcA4ZVpHs6k.jpg','1990-05-23',101,'Released','The best partners in the police station.','Curry & Pepper',148380,2.7304,6.5,'FNWMBSsj-3Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10925,_binary '\0','/yvZjm8ywdV8ovzHssx1AA3dR9Vv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099634',6.4,1280,'en','The Garden','A nearly wordless visual narrative intercuts two main stories and a couple of minor ones. A woman, perhaps the Madonna, brings forth her baby to a crowd of intrusive paparazzi; she tries to flee them. Two men who are lovers marry and are arrested by the powers that be. The men are mocked and pilloried, tarred, feathered, and beaten. Loose in this contemporary world of electrical-power transmission lines is also Jesus. The elements, particularly fire and water, content with political power, which is intolerant and murderous.','/sDeEZAdPFwzTUEp8Ba9M8Naw2dG.jpg','1990-09-06',88,'Released',NULL,'The Garden',110838,1.5967,5.7,'0Isqs99trtk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10926,_binary '\0','/x7r5VjnpUu3tz15mzvHC5GZc45K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099636',4.9,3088,'en','Gate II','It\'s been five years since Terry\'s friend Glen discovered The Gate to hell in his backyard. Glen has now moved away and Terry begins practicing rituals in Glen\'s old house and eventually bringing back demons through The Gate and leading to demoniac possession and near world domination.','/3XyBlFPfr1mAeplN1deQfQ3oHmb.jpg','1990-05-24',93,'Released','There\'s only one thing more terrifying than the first visit. The second.','Gate II',40729,1.8588,5.5,'PsuSLHW27y8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10927,_binary '\0','/kuBteThO5WTAlZrVz3N3RGOMc7X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099637',5.5,4302,'it','Un gatto nel cervello','The master of Italian horror, Lucio Fulci, stars as... Lucio Fulci, a filmmaker with a reputation for gruesome horror films. His body of work has started to plague his mental state, and he is haunted by the grotesque set-pieces his mind has conjured up during his career. His psychiatrist, Egon Schwarz, uses a hypnotised Fulci as an avatar to carry out his own disturbed fantasies, in hopes of ruining the master’s reputation once and for all.','/7slcRVlqFthzjTbnXFLoQ7LE053.jpg','1990-08-08',93,'Released','Hitchcock invented the thriller… Fulci perfected it!','A Cat in the Brain',30870,1.929,5.7,'Jp4J6Fm9FlI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10928,_binary '\0','/tbI1HaA2dYQIYnUOrrfn1XHV0KY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099652',7.7,5680,'hi','घायल','Ajay is framed by Balwant Rai for his brother\'s murder and sent to prison. Later, he befriends three convicts and sets out to seek revenge against Balwant Rai.','/r8n2JqfyxoL1qBEp8JnnyiFg2fU.jpg','1990-06-22',163,'Released',NULL,'Ghayal',71308,1.4707,6.917,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10929,_binary '\0','/6nLdSON3ErniBZTXWG7WRqs5jGz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099653',7.1,259459,'en','Ghost','After a young man is murdered, his spirit stays behind to warn his lover of impending danger, with the help of a reluctant psychic.','/w9RaPHov8oM5cnzeE27isnFMsvS.jpg','1990-07-13',127,'Released','Before Sam was murdered, he told Molly he\'d love and protect her forever.','Ghost',251,17.2208,7.247,'jWvUTmvaOyU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10930,_binary '\0','/6y9xCLljUMMAsI2XV16j5D02Ji.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099654',4.4,8869,'en','Ghost Dad','Elliot Hopper, a widower with three children, is working on a business deal to get his family out of financial straits when he is suddenly killed in a taxi accident. With the aid of a paranormal researcher, Elliott attempts to complete the deal from the beyond, ensuring his family will be taken care of.','/vYNIUUkJSZixxrfpMLFgVlagbaf.jpg','1990-06-29',84,'Released','He\'s been walking through doors. He\'s been falling through floors. He\'s been going through a lot lately, but he\'s still Dad.','Ghost Dad',10485,3.4289,5,'Gaj4ALV9IAw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10931,_binary '\0','/7MN7nGpSdG1pAHPfroIOHalapUV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099656',2.2,3114,'en','Ghosts Can\'t Do It','Elderly Scott kills himself after a heart attack wrecks his body, but then comes back as a ghost and convinces his loving young hot wife Kate to pick and kill a young man in order for Scott to possess his body and be with her again.','/i3Is8tatxA3UFSds3LIf0Ncw0q5.jpg','1989-10-17',95,'Released','Only her desire can make him rise again','Ghosts Can\'t Do It',31281,2.2783,2.7,'hEYEGGx-k5U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10932,_binary '\0','/bjvKom2HhetBSCjBCtAf88tEQSp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099669',7.6,7657,'fr','La Gloire de mon Père','Raised by his science teacher father, Joseph Pagnol, and seamstress mother Augustine, young Marcel grows up during the turn of the century in awe of his rationalist dad. When the family takes a summer vacation in the countryside, Marcel becomes friends with Lili, who teaches him about rural life.','/4zwgcaKqIJ5GB6kCPpyMLZuNyoi.jpg','1990-08-29',105,'Released','A childhood in Provence.','My Father\'s Glory',12716,2.5221,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10933,_binary '\0','/6fHq7EJ0cWalgIYdTNAENo6krpe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099673',6.4,1234,'sv','God afton, herr Wallenberg','Swedish account of Raoul Wallenberg, the man responsible for the largest rescue of Jews during World War II.','/unWo9e3VrfnT6vfb3PKtzjvBfC7.jpg','1990-10-05',118,'Released','A Passion History from Reality.','Good Evening, Mr. Wallenberg',80849,2.0286,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10934,_binary '\0','/zNnjHLDtV8Ti3aworltaeaLMov4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099674',7.5,460655,'en','The Godfather Part III','In the midst of trying to legitimize his business dealings in 1979 New York and Italy, aging mafia don, Michael Corleone seeks forgiveness for his sins while taking a young protege under his wing.','/lm3pQ2QoQ16pextRsmnUbG2onES.jpg','1990-12-25',162,'Released','All the power on earth can\'t change destiny.','The Godfather Part III',242,48.7007,7.416,'qQR85-nGk2M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10935,_binary '\0','/gILte6Zd7m1YneIr6MVhh30S9pr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099685',8.7,1412750,'en','GoodFellas','The true story of Henry Hill, a half-Irish, half-Sicilian Brooklyn kid who is adopted by neighbourhood gangsters at an early age and climbs the ranks of a Mafia family under the guidance of Jimmy Conway.','/9OkCLM73MIU2CrKZbqiT8Ln1wY2.jpg','1990-09-12',145,'Released','Three decades of life in the mafia.','GoodFellas',769,30.3217,8.45,'PTBRNXGQR9Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10936,_binary '\0','/1MPcOVe0lnyBVtEKwzlzKJye6XH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099691',4.7,9085,'en','Graffiti Bridge','It\'s got that Purple Rain feeling through and though. And it\'s got The Kid, too! For the first time since Purple Rain, Prince is back as The Kid. And where he goes, there\'s music! With Thieves in the Temple, New Power Generation, Elephants and Flowers and more red-hot Prince tunes from the Platinum-selling Graffiti Bridge soundtrack. What time is it? Party time! Morris Day and the Time play Release It, Shake! and more. And you\'ll also see and hear George Clinton, Tevin Campbell, Robin Power, Mavis Staples and other hot performers, too. Graffiti Bridge is where the movie meets the music. Cross over on it now.','/AiZ9vWZfHtdtMxnx14Dgeo5aH91.jpg','1990-11-02',95,'Released','Music is the power. Love is the message. Truth is the answer.','Graffiti Bridge',41762,1.8023,5.2,'nJN7lveRMzk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10937,_binary '\0','/d69Mloif5hP7Ajl0YbJjREyrfXC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099697',5,14396,'en','Graveyard Shift','John Hall is a drifter who wanders into a small town in Maine. He needs a job and decides to seek employment at the community\'s top business: a large textile mill. He is hired to work the \"graveyard shift\" -- from around midnight to dawn -- and, along with a few others, he is charged with cleaning out the basement. This task strikes the workers as simple enough, but then, as they proceed deeper underground, they encounter an unspeakable monstrosity intent on devouring them all.','/vITvLxFsDbbg6TMgpYWWscMOf0G.jpg','1990-10-26',89,'Released','Stephen King took you to the edge with The Shining and Pet Sematary. This time... he pushes you over.','Graveyard Shift',19158,5.1592,5.376,'IP3wG_VPwPg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10938,_binary '\0','/gDopsdEzZEX81jmSidXn7tFb8fw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099699',6.3,27776,'en','Green Card','Urban horticulturalist Brontë Mitchell has her eye on a gorgeous apartment, but the building\'s board will rent it only to a married couple. Georges Fauré, a waiter from France whose visa is expiring, needs to marry an American woman to stay in the country. Their marriage of convenience turns into a burden when they must live together to allay the suspicions of the immigration service, as the polar opposites grate on each other\'s nerves.','/9UweLsv3pCORu25Uq72m2IBkKaK.jpg','1990-12-23',108,'Released','The story of two people who got married, met and then fell in love.','Green Card',12157,3.8886,6.1,'JkB9NBoHrLw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10939,_binary '\0','/iR3tV8NXFls4UKzPA60D4zrI7Jh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099700',6.5,120325,'en','Gremlins 2: The New Batch','Young sweethearts Billy and Kate move to the Big Apple, land jobs in a high-tech office park and soon reunite with the friendly and lovable Gizmo. But a series of accidents creates a whole new generation of Gremlins. The situation worsens when the devilish green creatures invade a top-secret laboratory and develop genetically altered powers, making them even harder to destroy!','/35F5yD7MljvBE2AC0NHAVCoPGEi.jpg','1990-06-15',106,'Released','Here they grow again.','Gremlins 2: The New Batch',928,12.0706,6.528,'Aamzs_Wn91U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10940,_binary '\0','/kyUt1OyNF2NFyVMLfLpd7EmLRYH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099701',4.7,3544,'en','The Rift','An experimental submarine with a very experienced crew, the \"Siren II\" is sent to find out what happened to the \"Siren I\" after it mysteriously disappeared in a submarine rift. Things go awry when they begin to find things that shouldn\'t be there...','/nyigQNqSK7acJD0lcF7eY9uIvmn.jpg','1990-03-09',82,'Released','\'You Can\'t Hold your Breath & Scream at the Same Time\'','The Rift',28450,2.2392,4.7,'vRfpDWAN2uk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10941,_binary '\0','/i8vHWue4YFBQPI4wsnnBJq2RQV9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099703',6.8,33731,'en','The Grifters','A small-time conman has his loyalties torn between his estranged mother and his new girlfriend, both of whom are high-stakes grifters with their own angles to play.','/zMpGfkiDIdg5bB7WGcAT3Fdrfpt.jpg','1990-08-08',110,'Released','Seduction. Betrayal. Murder. Who’s conning who?','The Grifters',18129,4.0218,6.5,'Y-aSj4uiR90','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10942,_binary '\0','/bZA0oyTPhH6kuFfG7IKZbjo8lCV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099704',5.5,1258,'en','Grim Prairie Tales','Two travelers meet on the open prairie, and pass their time together by trading stories with each other. Their tales become a sort of competition, each attempting to relate something which might disturb the other.','/uf59HOhM3GRXt3VQiABgKoca7p8.jpg','1990-09-14',86,'Released','Hit the Trail... To Terror','Grim Prairie Tales',66706,1.7707,5.8,'RbD6HdXJYbM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10943,_binary '\0','/pTDfAJRWLa8iMNd6GS9UNqGFzIL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099710',5.4,7249,'en','The Guardian','Phil and Kate select the winsome young Camilla as a live-in nanny for their newborn child, but the seemingly lovely Camilla is not what she appears to be...','/yIVqiwhkWos3C9gt34ZeEQ0c3xm.jpg','1990-04-27',92,'Released','Tonight, while the world is asleep... an ancient evil is about to awaken.','The Guardian',32043,3.7385,5.7,'Uy6a-nfmdKg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10944,_binary '\0','/mJvvEgkus4COSwzyS2tRwjvHrlY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099726',6.7,25246,'en','Hamlet','Hamlet, Prince of Denmark, finds out that his uncle Claudius killed his father to obtain the throne, and plans revenge.','/cB5HbaiFoQLLmGeN2eeJjBGrp8U.jpg','1990-12-19',130,'Released','The extraordinary adaptation of Shakespeare\'s classic tale of vengeance and tragedy.','Hamlet',10264,3.3137,6.59,'tMvqWk7q8Ss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10945,_binary '\0','/sXZdE0p7Du4RmM0mpJVUnWj1Avv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099729',7.8,7770,'fa','هامون','Hamoon\'s wife is leaving him. He is also unsuccessfully trying to finish his Ph.D. thesis. He is forced to reexamine his life. In a series of flashbacks and dreams, Hamoon tries to figure out what he did wrong.','/jgPMr5r1bwl2T40kKCnh4orHhOz.jpg','1990-02-01',120,'Released',NULL,'Hamoon',43761,1.1137,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10946,_binary '\0','/ti84zQAKUm049pf2yLIZqy53Hw1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099731',6,12588,'en','The Handmaid\'s Tale','In a dystopian, polluted right-wing religious tyranny, a young woman is put in sexual slavery on account of her now rare fertility.','/cnkKQyRzoCMZliMaknTOXHqXKaz.jpg','1990-02-15',108,'Released','A haunting tale of sexuality in a country gone wrong.','The Handmaid\'s Tale',20815,5.2664,6.081,'oTnhx_N7nro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10947,_binary '\0','/9ZqyX10VPXKQrPtRkAh7iDUTaox.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099733',5.6,2904,'en','Happily Ever After','In the aftermath of her more famous adventure, Snow White must team up with the dwarves\' seven female cousins to battle the late Evil Queen\'s warlock brother and rescue the captured Prince.','/jCwebz8P7m5nq4r5XuKetqp3Gdm.jpg','1989-06-30',75,'Released','Whatever happened to Snow White?','Happily Ever After',44283,2.808,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10948,_binary '\0','/7eBAGOeAX7PWqYo9QVVeGjndMRk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099739',5.8,34906,'en','Hard to Kill','Mason Storm, a \'go it alone\' cop, is gunned down at home. The intruders kill his wife, and think they\'ve killed both Mason and his son too. Mason is secretly taken to a hospital where he spends several years in a coma. His son meanwhile is growing up thinking his father is dead. When Mason wakes up, everyone is in danger - himself, his son, his best friend, his nurse - but most of all those who arranged for his death','/nmtMNxslljllSTVtt7VIOXdxSZp.jpg','1990-02-09',95,'Released','He\'s L.A. Detective Mason Storm. Three hired assassins left him for dead. And he\'s waited seven years to even the score.','Hard to Kill',9569,7.2735,5.993,'BNyo-VEe-Kc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10949,_binary '\0','/nC1qaINaRBY1crPCQoFVPhSrq16.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099740',6,16928,'en','Hardware','Mark 13 is a government-built killing machine programmed with artificial intelligence, able to repair and recharge itself from any energy source. Through a series of coincidences, the cyborg\'s head ends up in the home of a sculptress as a bizarre Christmas present from her boyfriend. Once inside its new home, the cyborg promptly reconstructs the rest of its body using a variety of household utensils and proceeds to go on a murderous rampage.','/ybauOsdo6ColZ1WsALqIYjpUg4X.jpg','1990-09-14',94,'Released','You can\'t stop progress.','Hardware',11309,5.8102,5.9,'e0k2YvEns-M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10950,_binary '\0','/7KYZ5nW4ZoUdyrk3W7eEY3x1cKu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099747',6.1,9267,'en','Havana','During the revolution, a high-stakes gambler arrives in Cuba seeking to win big in poker games. Along the way, he meets and falls in love with the wife of a Communist revolutionary.','/7IxH2lzX5yFOVxKHSRbfsiqSKcm.jpg','1990-12-11',144,'Released','A gambler who trusted no one. A woman who risked everything. And a passion that brought them together in the most dangerous city in the world.','Havana',22189,2.3514,5.8,'ojuquGS2aSo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10951,_binary '\0','/coAER61FKM8Rk8ufeZtDMV2X2jR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099750',5.6,4484,'en','Heart Condition','Racist police officer Jack Moony has a vendetta against Napoleon Stone, a charismatic black lawyer who is sleeping with Jack\'s old flame Crystal Gerrity. Jack has a heart attack, but his life is saved when he receives Stone\'s heart, since Stone died mysteriously the same night as Jack was stricken. Stone is not completely gone, however, and as a ghost he is all too happy to give Jack advice on how he should do his job and live his life.','/2ApuvU24UEBlWeBiQGRyyOYFeqe.jpg','1990-02-02',100,'Released','A tough cop. A dead lawyer. Every partnership has its problems.','Heart Condition',41817,3.7435,5.683,'U5_C6IrxLWY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10952,_binary '\0','/kEXmVBiZtrmdu6qV1NYFPkam2Vs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099753',6.8,1221,'ja','天と地と','Warlords Kagetora and Takeda each wish to prevent the other from gaining hegemony in feudal Japan. The two samurai leaders pursue one another across the countryside, engaging in massive battles of cavalry and infantry. Younger and less brutal, Kagetora must find the strength to be as brutal as his opponent, but at what cost?','/qp9OdVRSzol2kFo4I8VDzQnfBCn.jpg','1990-11-24',104,'Released',NULL,'Heaven and Earth',41845,1.7027,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10953,_binary '\0','/6jF3HdLkHsEJtw8qKoEyZ9oJ7qB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099762',6.3,15047,'en','Henry & June','While traveling in Paris, author Henry Miller and his wife, June, meet Anais Nin, and sexual sparks fly as Nin starts an affair with the openly bisexual June. When June is forced to return to the U.S., she gives Nin her blessing to sleep with her husband. Then, when June returns to France, an unexpected, and sometimes contentious, threesome forms.','/cDMQLwT5LpdbA4dc4Twn43sbGRw.jpg','1990-09-28',136,'Released','A true adventure more erotic than any fantasy','Henry & June',17993,4.8777,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10954,_binary '\0','/nLr8MU3e4YVwdSMpzhtiKRsO79b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099763',7,45017,'en','Henry: Portrait of a Serial Killer','Arriving in Chicago, Henry moves in with ex-con acquaintance Otis and starts schooling him in the ways of the serial killer.','/diVMzTarVLgjc3jyODyhZMadfwD.jpg','1986-09-24',83,'Released','He\'s not Freddy, he\'s not Jason...he\'s real.','Henry: Portrait of a Serial Killer',10692,4.1849,6.7,'qxxZ8yspQyw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10955,_binary '\0','/7K6al25y1WBolpXO1RYjvhwYNBz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099768',6.9,5441,'en','Hidden Agenda','In Ireland, American lawyer Ingrid Jessner and her activist partner, Paul Sullivan, struggle to uncover atrocities committed by the British government against the Northern Irish during the \"Troubles.\" But when Sullivan is assassinated in the streets, Jessner teams up with Peter Kerrigan, a British investigator acting against the will of his own government, and struggles to uncover a conspiracy that may even implicate one of Kerrigan\'s colleagues.','/ceaYwvuTMfgRu7XCrLHmeK1LDzN.jpg','1990-11-21',108,'Released','Every government has one.','Hidden Agenda',47869,2.2327,6.979,'LmEKz95RCe4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10956,_binary '\0','/puTxjGPJALnjxXsO2k5OEHzf1ME.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099776',7.5,18784,'de','Europa Europa','A Jewish boy separated from his family in the early days of WWII poses as a German orphan and is taken into the heart of the Nazi world as a \'war hero\' and eventually becomes a Hitler Youth.','/CCaA0tjLNjwFfi34XsouCy9Lm6.jpg','1990-11-14',112,'Released','A True Story','Europa Europa',8996,4.3871,7.218,'JqMBNCo7LPE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10957,_binary '\0','/ih2xVgeMS8R5WUetYE8Mr9hVTlB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099785',7.8,754835,'en','Home Alone','Eight-year-old Kevin McCallister makes the most of the situation after his family unwittingly leaves him behind when they go on Christmas vacation. When thieves try to break into his home, he puts up a fight like no other.','/onTSipZ8R3bliBdKfPtsDuHTdlL.jpg','1990-11-16',103,'Released','A family comedy without the family.','Home Alone',771,1.6845,7.5,'dzdpqRGA1qc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10958,_binary '\0','/x3wFxF9rEpoxmsp8a80oWv5te6X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099797',6.4,15803,'en','The Hot Spot','Upon arriving to a small town, a drifter quickly gets into trouble with the local authorities — and the local women — after he robs a bank.','/320b0P6ogWiz7MuUs8f06rUNpTC.jpg','1990-10-12',130,'Released','Sex is never safe. It’s dangerous.','The Hot Spot',14864,9.9179,6.3,'tcc4jaiQA_U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10959,_binary '\0','/vBaBRMCYiYRHHPKDl765HD42n9O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099800',6.5,18397,'en','House Party','Young Kid has been invited to a party at his friend Play\'s house. But after a fight at school, Kid\'s father grounds him. None the less, Kid sneaks out when his father falls asleep. But Kid doesn\'t know that three of the thugs at school have decided to give him a lesson in behavior.','/hmUsEUI7RdgvTznkLCNSOHnjU4O.jpg','1990-01-20',104,'Released','If they get caught, it\'s all over. If they don\'t, it\'s just the beginning!','House Party',16094,5.7338,6.39,'X4Cgazhox24','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10960,_binary '\0','/5jCpCFrku6wmCZOYZWhHOC2j8IU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099810',7.5,234203,'en','The Hunt for Red October','A new technologically-superior Soviet nuclear sub, the Red October, is heading for the U.S. coast under the command of Captain Marko Ramius. The American government thinks Ramius is planning to attack. Lone CIA analyst Jack Ryan has a different idea: he thinks Ramius is planning to defect, but he has only a few hours to find him and prove it - because the entire Russian naval and air commands are trying to find Ramius, too. The hunt is on!','/yVl7zidse4KiWtGMqHFtZCx4X3N.jpg','1990-03-02',135,'Released','Invisible. Silent. Stolen.','The Hunt for Red October',1669,13.5358,7.4,'kxL8uBmdulY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10961,_binary '\0','/bCFGsHGeF64KWuK1cDC5VW1igQC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099812',5.7,4324,'cn','火燒島','Someone in a prison run by a corrupt warden fakes the deaths of convicts to later use them as expendable assassins. A police officer is sent into the prison to gather evidence of the corruption.','/1sGDNO8HlpcVmXpBxOAKEV270cI.jpg','1991-03-28',124,'Released','When you\'re looking for the living dead you start your search in hell!','Island of Fire',18767,4.1682,6.258,'sET33uIBMZg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10962,_binary '\0','/wKFllZyiIFl1JfjKDxLePqVP5Z4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099816',6.5,3540,'no','Håkon Håkonsen','A young Norwegian boy in 1850s England goes to work as a cabin boy and discovers some of his shipmates are actually pirates.','/b1taxayvlKB6Qiera4O6gM8SocT.jpg','1990-10-03',92,'Released',NULL,'Shipwrecked',71805,1.1046,6.711,'Lol61ybhgC0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10963,_binary '\0','/3a3Ch56Y7n8ouiAXPdFDmVLnvWz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099817',6.1,16608,'en','Dark Angel','Jack Caine is a Houston vice cop who\'s forgotten the rule book. His self-appointed mission is to stop the drugs trade and the number one supplier Victor Manning. While involved in an undercover operation to entrap Victor Manning, his partner is killed, and a sinister newcomer enters the scene...','/zwsesgAluQKDmdAA2nhlEc4FhFd.jpg','1990-01-26',91,'Released','Jack Caine. Houston cop. Human. What he\'s up against, isn\'t.','Dark Angel',19384,7.0458,6.2,'pqYFgmZkUtQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10964,_binary '\0','/g1Ny96j46cI2e4lTpM1SbLK7DYU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099818',7.1,9106,'en','I Hired a Contract Killer','After losing his job and realizing that he is alone in the world, a businessman opts to voluntarily end his life. Lacking courage, he hires a contract killer to do the job. Then, while awaiting his demise, he meets a woman and promptly falls in love.','/p343X7QppeByj9Sz6i003jNkens.jpg','1990-10-12',80,'Released',NULL,'I Hired a Contract Killer',7975,2.2296,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10965,_binary '\0','/joBJxmTxjQNN9q14UoCMkTBiIMH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099819',6.4,16687,'en','I Love You to Death','Joey Boca is the owner of a pizza parlour, and has been married to Rosalie for years. When Rosalie discovers that Joey is a womanizer and has been cheating on her for a long time, she goes to extreme lengths to punish him.','/8LdWJLUfEa5JeUJ7SljJQMIJikZ.jpg','1990-04-06',94,'Released','With these people trying to kill him, Joey Boca may just live forever.','I Love You to Death',3101,4.4147,6.399,'lIOWPJZ-BGg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10966,_binary '\0','/2uMvHQytz3NRQrHFZvfP2erO9Gl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099826',5.1,1443,'en','If the Shoe Fits','A modern Cinderella in Paris: While the plain Kelly Carter works as a dresser for the famous fashion designer Francesco, she dreams of designing shoes for him. However she can\'t win his attention... until she helps a good fairy on the street who, unbeknownst to Kelly, enchants a pair of Kelly\'s shoes so that she turns into a supermodel whenever she wears them. She attends Francesco\'s Ball and immediately wins his heart. Now, how can she make him love her real self?','/dp8AwqwR12MZoHk2GQJMeO9cSkE.jpg','1990-12-12',86,'Released','It must be love.','If the Shoe Fits',61535,2.3296,5.6,'GRAgcRVE17Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10967,_binary '\0','/zhk8PZORXwAHm5LW8aYgksjuaoL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099832',5.8,1679,'en','Impulse','A Los Angeles vice cop, caught between her undercover role as a sex worker and her personal relationships, is thrown into a web of murder and deceit.','/fYLlJy415AgnEG1XW9z6x65PzhL.jpg','1990-04-06',109,'Released','It\'s easy to lose control.','Impulse',37131,2.0224,5.649,'0fq_hCLzu_g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10968,_binary '\0','/a7RMVypNmxvEG0SzG9kXBJivfxX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099850',6.5,25066,'en','Internal Affairs','Keen young Raymold Avila joins the Internal Affairs Department of the Los Angeles police. He and partner Amy Wallace are soon looking closely at the activities of cop Dennis Peck whose financial holdings start to suggest something shady. Indeed Peck is involved in any number of dubious or downright criminal activities. He is also devious, a womaniser, and a clever manipulator, and he starts to turn his attention on Avila.','/A4pH8DiNFEf2AgXkM4zk3ZpblV.jpg','1990-01-12',115,'Released','Trust him... he\'s a cop.','Internal Affairs',11060,4.9437,6.4,'tWMzNDEZWgU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10969,_binary '\0','/8XgAmw31UtUIDa0ec33Sj9yaSxi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099856',4.3,3153,'en','The Invisible Maniac','An invisible scientist escapes from an asylum and teaches high-school physics to nubile teens.','/vl1TIs9CUFbHlL8QdD6BvRX2uPN.jpg','1990-07-13',86,'Released','The new physics professor has a disappearing act that\'s a real scream.','The Invisible Maniac',28340,3.026,4.3,'QynNtGLmcFo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10970,_binary '\0','/oubk1SEFtg3Q8eOncFvGQVa6OoP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099871',7.4,130959,'en','Jacob\'s Ladder','After returning home from the Vietnam War, veteran Jacob Singer struggles to maintain his sanity. Plagued by hallucinations and flashbacks, Singer rapidly falls apart as the world and people around him morph and twist into disturbing images. His girlfriend, Jezzie, and ex-wife, Sarah, try to help, but to little avail. Even Singer\'s chiropractor friend, Louis, fails to reach him as he descends into madness.','/ufLcHIi1aXjjH8MediAMvnwDsVI.jpg','1990-11-02',113,'Released','The most frightening thing about Jacob Singer\'s nightmare is that he isn\'t dreaming.','Jacob\'s Ladder',2291,9.529,7.357,'2AiwCLI04PY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10971,_binary '\0','/oViuNA8PZltEMVaUPpBJJYCnH7X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099875',6.1,1564,'en','Jekyll & Hyde','Henry Jekyll is a troubled man. His wife died of pneumonia. He wants his sister-in-law, but her father forbids any contact. And his experiments into the dual nature of man have yielded a personality-splitting drug that he has tested on himself, changing him into an uninhibited brute who seeks violent and undignified pleasures. Jekyll quickly becomes addicted to the sordid freedom induced by the drug. He can commit the most enjoyably revolting deeds, then return to his laboratory and use an antidote to change back to his original form, so that his lofty persona remains untarnished.','/hj12czMNEw0OVzXmbBXvdidR7lr.jpg','1990-01-06',96,'Released','Unnatural, uncontrollable, unleashed.','Jekyll & Hyde',48747,1.6639,5.9,'prrT1XISbqc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10972,_binary '\0','/lQdlgYjRoiZPQElWhuIkwCnAxS7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099878',5.6,6195,'en','Jetsons: The Movie','George Jetson is forced to uproot his family when Mr. Spacely promotes him to take charge of a new factory on a distant planet.','/u7MciwvfyYrvZEua22wz48Puu7O.jpg','1990-06-06',82,'Released','The first movie from the family that\'s truly ahead of its time!','Jetsons: The Movie',17009,4.1753,6.1,'-nuo5QfemCE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10973,_binary '\0','/qZ8t05qidOjhSSsaByxxpu6CKOH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099892',5.9,42534,'en','Joe Versus the Volcano','Hypochondriac Joe Banks finds out he has six months to live, quits his dead end job, musters the courage to ask his co-worker out on a date, and is then hired to jump into a volcano by a mysterious visitor.','/fwjMUuDZUxedfsUpVQKQN8cYfzB.jpg','1990-03-09',102,'Released','An average Joe. An adventurous comedy.','Joe Versus the Volcano',2565,5.7713,5.8,'yNYFtQIMB2Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10974,_binary '\0','/rbzz2hsNa3SWGRKjuZsLiFCUwui.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099902',7.6,9761,'zh','菊豆','Tianqing falls in love with Ju Dou, his uncle\'s wife who is tortured for being childless. However, after they have an affair, they discover that his uncle is impotent and try to conceal the truth.','/ejvX1lukPZZ10jatUWmKaXbhjGI.jpg','1990-04-21',95,'Released','An Erotic Tale of Forbidden Passion.','Ju Dou',41821,2.7893,7.2,'vhigeA0ewQU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10975,_binary '\0','/qWP5TlH1448Pt9ayyuLZJY0NXWj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099938',6.3,177751,'en','Kindergarten Cop','Hard-edged cop John Kimble gets more than he bargained for when he goes undercover as a kindergarten teacher to get the goods on a brutal drug lord while at the same time protecting the man\'s young son. Pitted against a class of boisterous moppets whose antics try his patience and test his mettle, Kimble may have met his match … in more ways than one.','/nKnHWwkXyvhzCYWm3FyRAv3qBrl.jpg','1990-12-21',111,'Released','Go ahead, YOU tell him you didn\'t do your homework.','Kindergarten Cop',951,6.8379,6.141,'T4gV5yDqFqc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10976,_binary '\0','/oQMuvptruDYovmB9VFpnYDnVk5j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099939',6.9,49870,'en','King of New York','A former drug lord returns from prison determined to wipe out all his competition and distribute the profits of his operations to New York\'s poor and lower classes in this stylish and ultra violent modern twist on Robin Hood.','/1MyH4MJAJZJbb6wDVeOc2bTECtK.jpg','1990-07-18',103,'Released','Not everyone who runs a city is elected.','King of New York',9558,7.7521,6.8,'bt94pENFmjc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10977,_binary '\0','/4lV7RWF2XnoWlExYQM0ibfVS4or.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099949',7.4,1865,'pl','Korczak','The story of Polish pedagogue Janusz Korczak and his dedication to protecting Jewish orphans during the war.','/blBFDoyRWlmtbsaCwEOoqsUI7lP.jpg','1990-05-06',115,'Released',NULL,'Korczak',47430,1.3527,7.1,'xzyxKFDRol8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10978,_binary '\0','/r0W2dFpNgQKzowI7q9IbJ5P5vLI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099951',6.6,9814,'en','The Krays','Twins Ronnie and Reggie Kray are raised in east London, under the influence of their hateful but doting mother Violet. As they grow up, Ronnie\'s violent nature takes over, and Reggie follows his brother\'s lead. The two become notorious crime lords who rule over the East End club scene. But at the height of their power, the brothers veer into different lives, giving the older crime bosses a chance to reclaim what the Krays took from them.','/e7GqmnQJRWXYs8Y8uXma6p7Amcw.jpg','1990-04-27',119,'Released','When people are afraid of you... you can do anything. Remember that.','The Krays',21344,2.3593,6,'xrYMO0TN05k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10979,_binary '\0','/3xuNYG9lzElkZB1IAFORF0czZF7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099969',3.5,1273,'en','Lambada','Kevin Laird is a Beverly Hills school teacher by day and a mystery man by night. Using his lambada dance moves to first earn the kid\'s respect and acceptance, Kevin then teaches them academics. But when a jealous student exposes Kevin\'s double life, his two worlds collide, threatening his job and reputation.','/hvSbOvacS0gzykkfenuaqLEPoic.jpg','1990-03-16',104,'Released','Go all the way!','Lambada',117269,1.7832,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10980,_binary '\0','/qyLpUSWQPjqykLleHY3pMuOZiJT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099978',3.6,2844,'en','Laser Mission','A CIA agent is sent to get Professor Braun before the KGB can seize him as the Prof\'s knowledge, together with a recently stolen diamond, could be used to make a laser cannon.','/9DVTsh96dGeHJoaUCJd7H6cZE6y.jpg','1989-11-01',84,'Released','«A secret agent. A beautiful accomplice. A daring mission to prevent World War III. One thrilling adventure!»','Laser Mission',35632,2.5963,3.9,'37i1Adt8OFc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10981,_binary '\0','/qjKvsZp2yxiAuJwmmy06RHNkjOX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099991',5.8,1928,'en','The Last of the Finest','An elite group of vice cops are fired from the L.A.P.D. for being over-zealous in their war against drugs. It is immediately apparent that some of their superiors are involved in the drug ring. Banded together, four of the banned cops (which quickly becomes three when one is killed early) band together to fight the drug ring undercover. They gain capital for weapons by ripping off minor drug dealers. Then well-armed they go after the kingpin (Boyd).','/q8EfhcI5BVtiv2Qh0McmL5pCA4z.jpg','1990-03-09',106,'Released','It\'s time for heroes again.','The Last of the Finest',123770,2.3539,5.9,'KPtVNki3s3w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10982,_binary '\0','/1XVfmGPQslh25GMJeaggGtYPc9E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0099994',5,22225,'en','Leatherface: The Texas Chainsaw Massacre III','Two college students driving coast to coast are lured off the main highway and onto a deserted Texas road where they are stalked by the menacing Leatherface and his family.','/4Vhv0vRqirhvbudRcNctFgxoFtI.jpg','1990-01-12',81,'Released','The terror begins the second it starts.','Leatherface: The Texas Chainsaw Massacre III',25018,5.439,5.4,'6qUo2U3gWsg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10983,_binary '\0','/fpaVxLcSQnnMdtcCRdZV0eTjJPg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100014',5.6,1439,'cn','聊齋艷譚','After one thousand years, three vixens transform into humans. They seduce a poor young scholar who soon finds himself in a horrifying situation.','/fTUCwsxVoLFuodAtlL6aITP1B45.jpg','1990-05-19',88,'Released',NULL,'Erotic Ghost Story',60898,9.5241,6.2,'g5YuUoJgBHA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10984,_binary '\0','/kbqpkmB1hxQqxXcEnIMEWECXoOk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100024',7.4,12274,'en','Life Is Sweet','Just north of London live Wendy, Andy, and their twenty-something twins, Natalie and Nicola. Wendy clerks in a shop, Andy is a cook who forever puts off home remodeling projects, Natalie is a plumber and Nicola is jobless. This film is about how they interact and play out family, conflict and love.','/zdkKNQzzwyciP9vAohAPFZdujlA.jpg','1991-03-22',103,'Released',NULL,'Life Is Sweet',36843,2.8116,6.963,'DQEuy8pnlkg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10985,_binary '\0','/vxB5L14mQdszDWPPlvYnfM4FnXB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100029',6.2,43706,'en','Lionheart','Lyon Gaultier is a deserter in the Foreign Legion arriving in the USA entirely hard up. He finds his brother between life and death and his sister-in-law without the money needed to heal her husband and to maintain her child. To earn the money needed, Gaultier decides to take part in some very dangerous clandestine fights.','/kf3qx5fzsYyLv7PEAORUGxwzQEk.jpg','1990-06-07',105,'Released','When the streets are a jungle... There can only be one king.','Lionheart',9399,8.8191,6.6,'XZ4x4HqSGFk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10986,_binary '\0','/bMjQLYTuJQLlyzlncc1pFdg7vjA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100031',5.9,2756,'en','Lisa','A teenage girl becomes infatuated with a stranger who is, unbeknownst to her, a serial killer.','/oUx58fFzQE1bIFjURE4FlxMpbsz.jpg','1990-04-20',95,'Released','Someone Out There Is Lisa\'s Fantasy. Pray She Never Meets Him.','Lisa',95730,1.7407,5.6,'E_h5KrSGuC4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10987,_binary '\0','/wgKWecDF29zSa0nfCx589S4Dejy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100046',7.3,5804,'en','The Long Walk Home','Two women, black and white, in 1955 Montgomery Alabama, must decide what they are going to do in response to the famous bus boycott led by Martin Luther King.','/7T2oVjLHHIDY6FQH9e04oOgPWQa.jpg','1990-12-21',97,'Released','A story of an incredible friendship.','The Long Walk Home',51763,4.0205,7.663,'J-YwJKIqyOE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10988,_binary '\0','/8zCtMtMQCNSfgV6py5QMpi8KR5s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100047',6.4,1320,'cn','龍的傳人','Chow Siu-lung leaves his hometown in order to study kung fu in the city but ends up getting conned by his own uncle instead.','/6fp4TRZzmHBnHIJdlYXtPylACuf.jpg','1991-03-07',96,'Released',NULL,'Legend of the Dragon',56118,2.779,6.131,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10989,_binary '\0','/aiyrszCc3vxLDRjAPw7KodZzCKj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100049',7.6,6571,'en','Longtime Companion','During the summer of 1981, a group of friends in New York are completely unprepared for the onslaught of AIDS. What starts as a rumor about a mysterious \"gay cancer\" soon turns into a major crisis as, one by one, some of the friends begin to fall ill, leaving the others to panic about who will be next. As death takes its toll, the lives of these friends are forever redefined by an unconditional display of love, hope and courage.','/lHIGo1VI71DQgDbbm6XWBjaPxCz.jpg','1989-10-11',99,'Released','…a motion picture for everyone','Longtime Companion',39934,2.4563,6.7,'mGCeQC805vY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10990,_binary '\0','/6KIAGiR2F4ffzZu8lXyxP2JliXk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100050',4.7,51507,'en','Look Who\'s Talking Too','Mollie and James are together and raising a family, which now consists of an older Mikey and his baby sister, Julie. Tension between the siblings arises, and as well with Mollie and James when Mollie\'s brother Stuart moves in. Mikey is also learning how to use the toilet for the first time.','/m409mVHmvDOZJltNzHJYigUthsW.jpg','1990-12-14',81,'Released','Mikey’s back and about to face his greatest challenge… his new sister.','Look Who\'s Talking Too',9356,6.2363,5.519,'_S_ux6f1Z_U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10991,_binary '\0','/hrHqIhT6epCWOsoAouRqOoZqNEe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100053',4.9,5790,'en','Loose Cannons','Mac, the two-fisted, savvy cop finds that he\'s being saddled with a new partner, a known burnout, to work with him on a new and difficult case. The new partner is Ellis, an amazing detective, one who puts Sherlock Holmes to shame with his lightning-fast deductions. But he keeps assuming the personalities of entire casts of Television shows. This can be a problem when people begin shooting at them.','/ezzfFY9S8r4PkhXLqw9x7gAaStd.jpg','1990-02-09',94,'Released','Detective Mack Stern is facing the greatest challenge of his career... His new partner.','Loose Cannons',24558,3.193,5.021,'ZagcMf8vK1c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10992,_binary '\0','/wQJnGGTqEDXzXbgic2T3kHt0I7a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100054',6.4,36094,'en','Lord of the Flies','When their plane crashes, 25 schoolboys find themselves trapped on a tropical island, miles from civilization.','/xhxWsFgBYyDfRWfOhM1OrV88QDJ.jpg','1990-03-16',91,'Released','No parents. No teachers. No rules... No mercy.','Lord of the Flies',10847,6.8589,6.4,'1nqycSp77MY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10993,_binary '\0','/55bvjAYe5SmoxPGsJd6HaoC1349.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100065',5.7,1662,'en','Love at Large','Inept private investigator Harry Dobbs meets vampish new client Miss Dolan, who wants him to follow her abusive lover. But Dobbs sets about tailing a different person entirely – a mysterious character leading a double life. Harry, however, discovers that he himself is being followed by a distaff gumshoe.','/A2l54MDhZjc2aD6sQPB7IeRAJjt.jpg','1990-03-09',97,'Released','Love is the only lead worth following.','Love at Large',32035,1.5367,4.9,'c5J2wRN_inw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10994,_binary '\0','/3fL0qK6u4PNfCmWHlTz2R3Y0bhs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100070',4.7,1238,'pt','Lua de Cristal','The fairy tale story of Maria da Graça, a small town girl with big time dreams of becoming a singer, who moves to Rio de Janeiro to pursue her ambitions.','/ykEm0EvCtGI0727XK6xt7fCbUlQ.jpg','1990-06-22',90,'Released',NULL,'Crystal Moon',45179,1.0279,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10995,_binary '\0','/rVE2a2Iw1Ph7MQSH7aCQCc7UcVo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100079',5.2,1713,'en','Luther the Geek','A psychotic killer convicted of multiple murders is released on parole after spending twenty years in prison. His psychosis immediately takes over and he goes on a killing spree.','/iD0VRF0QQtbV0dQfpvUsbK4FGqK.jpg','1989-07-01',80,'Released','A movie with a fowl bite!','Luther the Geek',67515,1.7704,5.1,'Fd1Vwf6ZK3E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10996,_binary '\0','/yJOyHsDy3YSyx5fhftGP16gDw4q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100083',6,1288,'sv','Macken - Roy\'s & Roger\'s Bilservice','Roy and Roger decide to close their gas station for the summer, to try to find where, what, and how their lost father is. Roger also falls in love, and much more.','/2LuXbMcfmc6ZL0l9bpncnm9L9nc.jpg','1990-12-23',92,'Released','A movie about two brothers and a gas station.','Macken - Roy\'s & Roger\'s Bilservice',53703,1.1962,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10997,_binary '\0','/rleDLcv2mktrAIU9djiVc9lb4he.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100087',5.5,4043,'en','MadHouse','The luxurious villa of Mark and Jessie Bannister, a yuppie couple, is overrun by loads of uninvited guests who turn the house up side down.','/l8BBcinqXq50PeKObT2lvLdTkYb.jpg','1990-02-16',90,'Released','The bad news is you have houseguests. There is no good news.','MadHouse',51036,2.5929,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10998,_binary '\0','/9B6kd0SJtjQBQB9g7vCrGZoiEQp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100095',7.3,14117,'hi','मैंने प्यार किया','After Suman\'s father leaves her in the care of another family while he travels abroad, she falls in love with Prem. However, in order to for them to marry, Prem has to prove to Suman\'s father that he is not the same as his own dad.','/aqZ9CEbXVLrEVAZFpT2F7PAE7dV.jpg','1989-12-29',192,'Released',NULL,'Maine Pyar Kiya',27624,1.3313,6,'kW3gjVoXv9I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(10999,_binary '\0','/c6NEPu9EKzk6Ukv0rjzDpcpSg7a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100107',5.9,10057,'en','Maniac Cop 2','Undead cop Matt Cordell rises from the grave, and is after the criminals who murdered him in prison.','/NWeLUBpxn7lcMpCPvnTGmtHwmj.jpg','1990-07-18',87,'Released','You have the right to remain silent forever..... again!','Maniac Cop 2',28090,4.0845,6,'WoTGyCiCePs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11000,_binary '\0','/lN4P0OJTgVh4LC7zPkY2vie2jK8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100112',7.1,11207,'fr','Le Mari de la coiffeuse','Antoine has always been fascinated by a hairdresser\'s delicate touch, the beguiling perfume, and the enticing figure of a woman with an opulent bosom. After all, he had always known he would marry one, completing his idealized love fantasy.','/d0CCZOP1VILxL33O6OiVzUYVNPT.jpg','1990-10-03',82,'Released',NULL,'The Hairdresser\'s Husband',11796,3.8365,6.801,'NCeLfMsOy0Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11001,_binary '\0','/rCTf5W1531LiFxJzUhdAcV9EDav.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100114',5.9,26617,'en','Marked for Death','Just retired from the Drug Enforcement Agency, John Hatcher returns to his hometown and quickly discovers that drugs have infiltrated his old neighborhood. Determined to drive the dealers out, Hatcher crosses paths with a ferocious Jamaican drug lord who vows that Hatcher and his family are now marked for death.','/xYaetJsSm5FC1zxhdW8UR1NVXzc.jpg','1990-10-05',93,'Released','He\'s a good cop. In a bad mood.','Marked for Death',10173,6.6686,6.1,'eb2-ojUuEQ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11002,_binary '\0','/mUT02KuwhzXn18DEPrS6tvxQfn4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100129',5.5,2899,'en','Meet the Applegates','Modelling themselves after an idyllic cookie-cutter suburban 1950s family, a colony of insects move from South America into the United States with the intent of getting access to the nation\'s nuclear resources.','/j79gY4zUgtpcDNpYh8esIer2aWS.jpg','1990-06-06',90,'Released','A new species of comedy','Meet the Applegates',76516,1.9036,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11003,_binary '\0','/8kVhN0OC5AmdHJJ1BxKCakZhvQO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100133',6.9,32317,'en','Memphis Belle','The \"Memphis Belle\" is a World War II bomber, piloted by a young crew on dangerous bombing raids into Europe. The crew only have to make one more bombing raid before they have finished their duty and can go home. In the briefing before their last flight, the crew discover that the target for the day is Bremen.','/epsraI4swsSu9Fyefj7vPPhsOHK.jpg','1990-09-07',107,'Released','Brave young men who rode on the wings of victory.','Memphis Belle',12651,4.396,6.754,'M3HOGf8ajWw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11004,_binary '\0','/rtvK9piiHSdwevyfBoGHYkTBeMy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100134',6.6,3007,'en','Men Don\'t Leave','A widowed mother and her two sons move to Baltimore and struggle to adjust to urban life, encountering numerous eccentric characters along the way.','/8sgKZiKaOh8QJxSbrW2Ds2wvWr9.jpg','1990-02-02',115,'Released','A comedy about the drama of life.','Men Don\'t Leave',91217,2.5022,6.3,'v_rjYSca124','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11005,_binary '\0','/gaG4QLl41v9WwHk3D3NqE9XzB5Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100135',5.9,29880,'en','Men at Work','Two garbage men find the body of a city councilman in a trash can on their route. With help from a supervisor, the duo must solve the case and find the man\'s killer while hiding the body from the cops.','/6bd0rOeZtTmVJObOAXHXBMurvyt.jpg','1990-08-24',99,'Released','Two garbagemen who know when something smells funny!','Men at Work',10169,4.4899,5.686,'uNuMbGYPVXA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11006,_binary '\0','/d4p6VPoN70CnTV74jbW5ltlDgsh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100140',6.7,41842,'en','Mermaids','Fifteen-year-old Charlotte Flax is tired of her wacky mom moving their family to a different town any time she feels it is necessary. When they move to a small Massachusetts town and Mrs. Flax begins dating a shopkeeper, Charlotte and her 9-year-old sister, Kate, hope that they can finally settle down. But when Charlotte\'s attraction to an older man gets in the way, the family must learn to accept each other for who they truly are.','/1VufMcp0euY2LpmKiVv8xnbB9Om.jpg','1990-12-14',110,'Released','Mom is many things... normal isn\'t one of them.','Mermaids',4587,4.7356,6.717,'t1ykJQ9ACp8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11007,_binary '\0','/hyHp1MgvUXw40GLjhqfjxwMWD4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100142',7.2,13890,'en','Metropolitan','A radical student is adopted by a group of young New Yorkers, serves as a catalyst to alter his and their lives. Gathering in a Manhattan apartment, the group of friends meet to discuss social mobility, Fourier\'s socialism and play bridge in their cocoon of upper-class society - until they are joined by a man with a critical view of their way of life.','/852ZwTRj9tRxkGOT0Pu0Ep8yimk.jpg','1990-08-03',99,'Released','Finally... A film about the downwardly mobile.','Metropolitan',15389,2.1307,7,'_spYUaPcRp4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11008,_binary '\0','/tkMPZ6sPmK2SH93Nkkc9qb5UwnC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100143',6.4,11727,'en','Miami Blues','After Junior is released from prison, he plans on starting a new life in Miami. But when he kills a man in the airport, he flees the scene and finds Susie, a mild-mannered prostitute searching for stability. The two opposites become romantically involved, and Junior steals a badge and gun from a veteran detective. Using the officer\'s identity, Junior embarks on a crime spree and convinces Susie that he is the perfect man.','/eOqOf2qG0sjsfhFdYp6SbZuorSF.jpg','1990-04-20',97,'Released','Real badge. Real gun. Fake cop.','Miami Blues',14931,2.3144,6.032,'iuJMsULvnGY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11009,_binary '\0','/ye6cY4qhz5dXkqJgn9jifOKMjqW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100148',5,1261,'en','Midnight Ride','A house wife just left her cop husband, when she picks up Justin McKay she\'ll wish she never did as she\'s plunged into a nightmare and the grip of a psychotic killer.','/c9RpMH0z5gILV9iAf6Z5ijtfv14.jpg','1990-07-20',93,'Released','Somewhere round the next bend, lies the road to terror','Midnight Ride',31942,1.6871,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11010,_binary '\0','/1Ww44JvMIPgBg2tysPO9hcuU7vN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100150',7.7,149268,'en','Miller\'s Crossing','Set in 1929, a political boss and his advisor have a parting of the ways when they both fall for the same woman.','/mbFUr8hTOzrBCgAekAVRiXYgj2H.jpg','1990-09-21',115,'Released',NULL,'Miller\'s Crossing',379,7.5666,7.4,'R1kRUyVeEOg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11011,_binary '\0','/w3tVTngwuBaFn2Q2PPZu0seKyRD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100151',7.6,3422,'en','Mindwalk','On the French island of Mont Saint-Michel, Jack, a failed presidential candidate, Tom, a poet and Sonia, a physicist, engage in an intellectual conversation about politics, philosophy and life over the course of a single day.','/1gw9BlsexGu8xTZYqxFOsd2j3fW.jpg','1991-12-05',111,'Released','A film for passionate thinkers','Mindwalk',48745,1.5849,6.915,'BW9Os6nhCKM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11012,_binary '\0','/x8OJVenhG32UNd27otRDlA5xDcb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100152',5.2,3294,'en','Mindwarp','Revolting mutants hunt human outcasts and underground fighters (Bruce Campbell, Marta Alicia) in a future world of mind control.','/fNUdqTW2oZfpNoPcpQLiD4wsFpY.jpg','1992-05-25',91,'Released','In the future, life will be a dream. And reality a nightmare.','Mindwarp',45779,1.4879,5.2,'UvGV5RHSaGo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11013,_binary '\0','/5984e60r0MjHCG8b4KGrDwn7COg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100156',5.5,2761,'en','Mirror Mirror','Shy teenager Megan moves to a new town with her widowed mother and quickly becomes the most unpopular girl in high school. But when she starts to communicate with a mysterious mirror, her tormentors begin to meet with a horrifying series of \'accidents\'. Is the mirror a reflection of Megan\'s own inner demons... or has she unwittingly opened the doorway of the damned?','/tjRW3VQjhrXiC0oAfme6AQTJUdH.jpg','1990-10-19',104,'Released','A reflection of pure terror...','Mirror Mirror',70351,1.8682,5.2,'7AEeN0ijGqs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11014,_binary '\0','/rUAn3Ul1tL7JXMjZ951UOI3F0UA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100157',7.8,269286,'en','Misery','After an accident, acclaimed novelist Paul Sheldon is rescued by a nurse who claims to be his biggest fan. Her obsession takes a dark turn when she holds him captive in her remote Colorado home and forces him to write back to life the popular literary character he killed off.','/klPO5oh1LOxiPpdDXZo1ADgpKcw.jpg','1990-11-30',107,'Released','Paul Sheldon used to write for a living. Now, he’s writing to stay alive.','Misery',1700,12.9629,7.753,'9HU-RfV7QA0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11015,_binary '\0','/j1AHOKhtIc3LmjugSy2K7IjDkSd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100161',5.9,3160,'en','Mister Frost','Frost is arrested and committed for murder after he is apprehended burying his victims in the garden. However, even while under psychiatric care and tight hospital security, it becomes obvious that Mr. Frost is not all he seems to be.','/8v70cbt6Qqh044nNzKLkZ7q96Eb.jpg','1990-04-10',104,'Released','He hasn\'t spoken in two years. No one knows his identity. Officially he doesn\'t exist... but 24 corpses do. Call evil by its proper name.','Mr. Frost',27720,1.7396,6.1,'mAiVwAzn27A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11016,_binary '\0','/5T01b2OxE85HC3nSKeULBDf98cP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100168',6.7,15155,'en','Mo\' Better Blues','Talented but self-centered trumpeter Bleek Gilliam is obsessed with his music and indecisiveness about his girlfriends Indigo and Clarke. But when he is forced to come to the aid of his manager and childhood friend, Bleek finds his world more fragile than he ever imagined.','/sEa6m5RjfrqfTzY1eHkC85shiUF.jpg','1990-08-03',129,'Released',NULL,'Mo\' Better Blues',41823,5.2537,6.5,'io8Jw9BRRFY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11017,_binary '\0','/BQrkHLRCQVfS0SDkFRwmd4uyRK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100173',6.5,1367,'en','A Mom for Christmas','A department store mannequin comes to life during the holiday season for a motherless little girl who wishes she had a mom for Christmas, and proceeds to charm her hard-working dad, too.','/5FPRqHffN16IyIjZQPrPG6M8D1e.jpg','1990-12-17',96,'Released','A tale of Christmas magic.','A Mom for Christmas',51310,2.2032,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11018,_binary '\0','/xCCqXJQx9Yr1qc2IABO1fwJT2lR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100196',7.1,4778,'en','Mountains of the Moon','The story of Captain Richard Francis Burton\'s and Lt. John Hanning Speke\'s expedition to find the source of the Nile river in the name of Queen Victoria\'s British Empire.','/4xjKTherAouW0LQy9O6neBUPYqk.jpg','1990-02-16',136,'Released','Two strangers made friends by a savage land. Two friends made enemies by the civilized world.','Mountains of the Moon',33796,3.3687,6.6,'9ETq5HUeG1A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11019,_binary '\0','/egl2Z6XhIaUcDo1MnCIDQ4OQpjk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100200',6.6,3961,'en','Mr. & Mrs. Bridge','Set during World War II, an upper-class family begins to fall apart due to the conservative nature of the patriarch and the progressive values of his children.','/e7YO2jyW4jmLGZybpTWIKtN7F1.jpg','1990-11-23',126,'Released','Divided by time and tradition. United by love and hope. The story of an unforgettable family.','Mr. & Mrs. Bridge',111815,2.2887,6.1,'IpTxY-fEdms','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11020,_binary '\0','/fey7Bj8CULtpAeuF76O17txzJ3z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100201',6.5,14518,'en','Mr. Destiny','Larry Burrows is unhappy and feels powerless over his life. He believes his entire life could have turned out differently had he not missed that shot in a baseball game when was a kid. One night he meets this mysterious man, who could change his fate by offering him that alternative life he always dreamed of. But as Burrows embarks on this journey of self discovery he realises that even this new life has its problems and drawbacks..','/zlYxDFP9l1YcUnspNzuIa8KVo4N.jpg','1990-10-12',110,'Released','Larry Burrows Wished For It All... Until All That He Wished For Came True!','Mr. Destiny',2612,3.6091,6.29,'U8E2QhBqpr0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11021,_binary '\0','/9ekWqOIkVbhwzheV0gqj5jCNd9d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100211',7.4,9848,'en','Music Box','A lawyer defends her father accused of war crimes, but there is more to the case than she suspects.','/iHumUQOIJWWx6x77fOcB2PVBu53.jpg','1989-12-22',124,'Released','As a lawyer all she wanted was the truth. As a daughter all she wanted was his innocence. How well do you really know your father?','Music Box',2263,2.7568,7.155,'DyiF7bAfZ5s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11022,_binary '\0','/hTeelpOsNYPMRNxwABSZmJQ5No0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100212',6.3,24295,'en','My Blue Heaven','FBI agent Barney Coopersmith is assigned to protect former Mafia figure turned informant Vincent Antonelli. In the witness protection program one is supposed to keep a low profile, but that is something that Antonelli has trouble doing. Coopersmith certainly has his hands full keeping Antonelli away from the Mafia hitmen who want to stop him testifying, not to mention the nightclubs...','/ggk34Nr1e8LOeAdVncuYz6pyYDe.jpg','1990-08-17',97,'Released','A comedy about a government witness who gives suburbia a culture shock.','My Blue Heaven',16384,4.0521,6.09,'k8ofblxbI08','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11023,_binary '\0','/w05q78LmawRoGRZtWnQhBKw2mHl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100224',6.6,12195,'en','Narrow Margin','An L.A. District Attorney attempts to take an unwilling murder witness back to the United States to testify against a top-level mob boss. Frantically attempting to escape two deadly hitmen sent to silence her, they board a Vancouver-bound train only to discover that the killers are onboard with them. For the next 20 hours, as the train hurls through the beautiful but isolated Canadian wilderness, a deadly game of cat and mouse ensues in which their ability to tell friend from foe is a matter of life and death.','/2qUkMhyBzLbGxng4dMDXGTHntC.jpg','1990-09-21',97,'Released','It will take you to the edge of suspense.','Narrow Margin',31597,3.7558,6.4,'JI7DvhBnYYI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11024,_binary '\0','/3t1qZqP1e17wQshpPKSqII1OogM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100234',8.2,27434,'fa','کلوزآپ ، نمای نزدیک','This fiction-documentary hybrid uses a sensational real-life event—the arrest of a young man on charges that he fraudulently impersonated the well-known filmmaker Mohsen Makhmalbaf—as the basis for a stunning, multilayered investigation into movies, identity, artistic creation, and existence, in which the real people from the case play themselves.','/m9HG2N9ZKCmNN9qOHJTNyy18wn3.jpg','1990-05-09',98,'Released','A real-life situation based on a real incident in actual locations with actual people involved.','Close-Up',30017,3.7554,8,'YeFZ448yQ-0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11025,_binary '\0','/22328gc644F4pZn30nWPPUo4I93.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100240',5.1,29293,'de','Die unendliche Geschichte II - Auf der Suche nach Phantásien','Once again, Bastian is transported to the world of Fantasia which he recently managed to save from destruction. However, the land is now being destroyed by an evil sorceress, Xayide, so he must join up with Atreyu and face the Emptiness once more.','/5QfUCbgKzWzjHO5X4ANsDmuTxNQ.jpg','1990-10-25',90,'Released','Begin an all new adventure as a young boy returns to a world of wonder on the wings of his imagination.','The NeverEnding Story II: The Next Chapter',34636,5.2419,5.789,'SHMeWhBmXts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11026,_binary '\0','/4CYo6O6p0bANfXLIwQZJpXPxmPc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100258',6.8,49519,'en','Night of the Living Dead','A ragtag group barricade themselves in an old Pennsylvania farmhouse to remain safe from a horde of flesh-eating ghouls ravaging the Northeast.','/7WkSCClUvcAq8JNEp4pM4A9hiDU.jpg','1990-10-19',88,'Released','There IS a fate worse than death.','Night of the Living Dead',19185,6.689,6.9,'21bYsumzkeg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11027,_binary '\0','/vt7ZQ38ZLOpq63DXu7pi3Rf5T24.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100260',6.5,29233,'en','Nightbreed','A troubled young man is drawn to a mythical place called Midian where a variety of friendly monsters are hiding from humanity. Meanwhile, a sadistic serial killer is looking for a patsy.','/1ChluYH0BEvJo3gtYoFHnMZI660.jpg','1990-02-16',102,'Released','A new reason to fear the night.','Nightbreed',20481,4.8134,6.4,'55kw4xDCs3A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11028,_binary '\0','/feKbd8Xly9pVR2psf0ZtoQ91wA0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100261',5.1,1712,'en','Nightmare at Noon','Scientists poison the water supply of a small town, turning the residents into homicidal maniacs who kill each other and anybody who passes through.','/mZbBzPraF6poMZ1vqtdDzWTxnxr.jpg','1988-06-29',96,'Released','An experiment in terror.','Nightmare at Noon',53355,1.9898,4.8,'gxgC3mMahew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11029,_binary '\0','/rk56vslwBXUCcNlQ74s6gmpJqxa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100263',7.2,82367,'fr','Nikita','A beautiful felon, sentenced to life in prison for the murder of a policeman, is given a second chance – as a secret political assassin controlled by the government.','/1ulQDewUG4KKHOhpXdGKm3GdLFq.jpg','1990-02-21',117,'Released','She murders. So she can live.','Nikita',9322,6.8139,7.105,'Gh8RoDMUUsA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11030,_binary '\0','/awvC8fYA2n4xabb4CJlqeGWv6Sp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100264',5.7,1247,'sv','Nils Karlsson Pyssling','Based on the novel with the same name by Astrid Lindgren. Lonely little Bertil befriends the tiny Nils Karlsson-Däumling, who lives in a mouse hole under his bed and teaches him a magic spell to shrink down and share wondrous adventures in his secret world. Their idyllic fun, however, is threatened by the sinister rat Schofeline, forcing Bertil to summon all his newfound courage.','/tEgkIQ64RIZ18rw9Fk2rCW3Yxm4.jpg','1990-11-09',75,'Released',NULL,'Nils Karlsson Pyssling',30583,1.4136,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11031,_binary '\0','/6jOouoRad9npUjPKqjIA8faJrgv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100266',5.3,1310,'en','No Retreat, No Surrender 3: Blood Brothers','Two feuding brothers of differing political views, one a policeman, the other a martial artist, join forces to avenge the death of their father, a retired agent who was brutally murdered by the mafia.','/3r3ENoHaOt4dUrqRKiKa3sqfMa0.jpg','1990-01-25',101,'Released','The first was for honour, The second for his country, This time it\'s family.','No Retreat, No Surrender 3: Blood Brothers',36884,3.534,6.74,'FmyAawQWT9Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11032,_binary '\0','/tkvePoq5eWC426u3XmOR4J1V4b5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100274',6.4,1797,'fr','Nouvelle Vague','Composed entirely of literary quotations from many different sources and from several historical periods, the loose narrative concerns a drifter found by a rich woman who soon falls in love with him. A drowning accident takes place and the drifter dies, but some time later he reappears in the woman’s life looking for a job. Or could it be the man’s twin brother?','/pFofqGMcfiIoDISZBjctw2qggla.jpg','1990-05-23',89,'Released',NULL,'Nouvelle Vague',32691,1.4403,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11033,_binary '\0','/elBPA8Ra4DOe1ROoJkAVRaCU5kj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100280',6,9771,'en','Nuns on the Run','Set up by their boss to be knocked off following a final heist, soon-to-retire crooks Brian Hope and Charlie McManus get wind of their impending demise and run off with the spoils of their crime. Fleeing their boss, the drug dealers they robbed, the police, and Brian\'s angry girlfriend, the duo take refuge in a training convent for nuns. In disguise, they convince Sister Superior that they\'re nuns, a charade they\'re forced to maintain as their enemies arrive.','/adcFqqwa7df4LzvnI8Z0e90rI5H.jpg','1990-03-16',89,'Released','From now on, it\'s every nun for himself!','Nuns on the Run',11131,3.1418,5.9,'8oytFAZZayA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11034,_binary '\0','/reaRowxl6ahfMxcmEdUhnOaneCt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100281',6.8,2929,'en','The Nutcracker Prince','After young Clara receives a wooden nutcracker as a Christmas gift, she dreams about a fantastical battle between her Nutcracker Prince and the evil Mouse King. At stake is the Nutcracker\'s freedom - and Clara\'s future happiness.','/9VVL7lYutdQV4KxP6OANF0gwiXV.jpg','1990-11-21',75,'Released','Join us in a classic tale of adventure, romance, bravery and a really mean mouse.','The Nutcracker Prince',13759,3.2649,6.5,'nJ-WoxN9QC8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11035,_binary '\0','/jNFGmJnCodWDD8uA09KtAW9mL0x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100288',6.7,1891,'en','The Old Man and the Sea','Based on the novel by Ernest Hemingway. Santiago goes out on his usual fishing trip and makes a huge catch, the biggest of his life. Then a shark attacks and tries to steal his catch.','/tlX71ziFH52SecHM3pdVcFj3Tbr.jpg','1990-03-25',93,'Released',NULL,'The Old Man and the Sea',79775,2.5763,6.3,'8hf5SCIXKiQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11036,_binary '\0','/xSMdnlntZ7o0dqBVrQCflUlV7N6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100301',6,3685,'en','Opportunity Knocks','Eddie and Lou are a couple of two-bit con men on the lam from a loan shark. They hide out in someone\'s house and they hear on the answering machine that (A) the owner of the house is out of the country for a month or two and (B) the housesitter supposed to watch the house for the absent owner won\'t be able to watch the house due to a new job in another part of the country. This provides for a pretty nifty arrangement for Eddie and Lou...until the relatives of the house owner drop by to visit. Eddie quickly adopts the guise of the person supposedly housesitting for the owner, and the shenanigans start from there.','/2X2uPNrUAtHDC007SYFuGeOkwgP.jpg','1990-03-30',103,'Released','In a world of cons... Eddie\'s a pro.','Opportunity Knocks',24073,2.4774,5.607,'8jJs4Cu_P_k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11037,_binary '\0','/4Fld6nMua3gHTNsR0YcHlXl6f7P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100303',6.1,3481,'fr','L\'Opération Corned Beef','The unsanctioned efforts of a covert unit to gather evidence about illegal arms shipments with the unwitting help of an embassy employee.','/5dt2ojhQfX57zLrqlIZ6BbPeiQ.jpg','1991-02-06',105,'Released',NULL,'L\'Opération Corned Beef',40223,3.1101,6.188,'kYG0Ueq33Ik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11038,_binary '\0','/7wf6C9Ladz3BBFgAysY3wChTcbf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100318',6.4,26122,'en','Pacific Heights','A couple works hard to renovate their dream house and become landlords to pay for it. Unfortunately one of their tenants has plans of his own.','/tXHIpUD9o99QzsjVnjonnzyI4ZG.jpg','1990-09-28',102,'Released','They were the perfect couple, buying the perfect house. Until a perfect stranger moved into their lives.','Pacific Heights',2990,6.3804,6.3,'qdg-XGFBS9E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11039,_binary '\0','/1DOLRxIQbRxhZcllLVx4DUAGqfS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100332',8.2,21690,'en','Paris Is Burning','Where does voguing come from, and what, exactly, is throwing shade? This landmark documentary provides a vibrant snapshot of the 1980s through the eyes of New York City\'s African American and Latinx Harlem drag-ball scene. Made over seven years, PARIS IS BURNING offers an intimate portrait of rival fashion \"houses,\" from fierce contests for trophies to house mothers offering sustenance in a world rampant with homophobia, transphobia, racism, AIDS, and poverty. Featuring legendary voguers, drag queens, and trans women — including Willi Ninja, Pepper LaBeija, Dorian Corey, and Venus Xtravaganza.','/90rCWH41mj9hjHUEy2SOHfuAOl3.jpg','1991-03-13',78,'Released','Having a ball… Wish you were here','Paris Is Burning',31225,3.6962,8,'9SqvD1-0odY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11040,_binary '\0','/qefNMPqhf6xL32liPXcslK0u9up.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100337',7.4,1380,'ru','Паспорт','Merab, a Georgian taxi driver who mistakenly crosses into Israel while seeing off his Jewish brother, Yasha, gets stuck without documents. He gets entangled in bureaucratic nightmares, mistaken identity, and KGB plots while trying to return home.','/wNv2a38elHJwqbgTlrimXlbOtxA.jpg','1990-06-06',103,'Released',NULL,'The Passport',27926,0.942,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11041,_binary '\0','/h1iPLE2jTWFPKdM8YIDiTgEgbAf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100339',7,6407,'ja','機動警察パトレイバー 劇場版','A mysterious suicide and a series of unmanned robot run-aways sparks off a Police investigation into the suspicious software on-board thousands of industrial robots around Tokyo.','/dp3CNNo7Oj704cQKiwM4MJqlW0I.jpg','1989-07-15',100,'Released',NULL,'Patlabor: The Movie',14571,2.5608,6.9,'FryjehLkYZA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11042,_binary '\0','/5DQTIIi4E0sQg6bzKaMfNUwMReP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100369',6,6142,'en','The Pit and the Pendulum','Set during the height of Spanish Inquisition. The beautiful and kind-hearted Maria is arrested as a witch when she inadvertently cries out in horror at the public whipping of a child. As Maria’s husband Antonio tries to save her, Torquemada, the Grand Inquisitor, determines to punish Maria with torture for the desire she inflames in him. Loosely based on Edgar Allen Poe\'s classic short story.','/xq4pLMaMlVmDEzaxTrDqDa4ET25.jpg','1991-06-27',97,'Released','A bizarre descent into hell from the creator of Re-Animator.','The Pit and the Pendulum',47090,3.0577,5.795,'I1lbnW19-rU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11043,_binary '\0','/uuOw885XJq3i2UYi2etF8ml1d7K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100395',6.7,22782,'en','Postcards from the Edge','A substance-addicted actress tries to look on the bright side even as she\'s forced to move back in with her mother to avoid unemployment.','/uF7bO5UcenRgag0jpbVvKsGyfBK.jpg','1990-09-14',101,'Released','Having a wonderful time, wish I were here.','Postcards from the Edge',22414,4.7852,6.644,'gSm7CJNzEFY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11044,_binary '\0','/8GGAXEXaTPMDGa0sCPyFcitvlD9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100403',6.3,204366,'en','Predator 2','A police chief in the war-torn streets of Los Angeles discovers that an extraterrestrial creature is hunting down residents - and that he is the next target.','/83X4VwY9sdSJykskmsplIVG0a4h.jpg','1990-11-21',108,'Released','Silent. Invisible. Invincible. He’s in town with a few days to kill.','Predator 2',169,13.8132,6.315,'Vhqt1ynaoq0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11045,_binary '\0','/dxoYbFNaIBhtOUb1Q3tEOuSdwMc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100404',6.9,53592,'en','Presumed Innocent','Rusty Sabich is a deputy prosecutor engaged in an obsessive affair with a coworker who is murdered. Soon after, he\'s accused of the crime. And his fight to clear his name becomes a whirlpool of lies and hidden passions.','/jSPWptOsqU1nxXQe6muSPB0kD3c.jpg','1990-07-27',127,'Released','Some people would kill for love.','Presumed Innocent',11092,8.2744,6.8,'1baqsbEddrY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11046,_binary '\0','/rleTwPqymtOpeD2bR7asJGEmldV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100405',7.1,411972,'en','Pretty Woman','Vivian is a carefree, streetwise diamond in the rough when she meets sophisticated billionaire Edward in a chance encounter that turns into a week-long business arrangement. But Vivian\'s energetic spirit challenges Edward\'s no-nonsense approach to life, and soon they are teaching each other – and falling in love!','/oVKX1Pt1q7jXTkTk51mu2S0sAB0.jpg','1990-03-23',120,'Released','She walked off the street, into his life and stole his heart.','Pretty Woman',114,19.4511,7.441,'2EBAVoN8L_U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11047,_binary '\0','/zP9nH7BpQ2BAmAkfx5FObVkLxrB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100419',5.5,35923,'en','Problem Child','Ben Healy and his social climbing wife Flo adopt fun-loving seven year old Junior. But they soon discover he\'s a little monster as he turns a camping trip, a birthday party and even a baseball game into comic nightmares.','/4cJK28DhybQGEldJJPtTdKlSbWB.jpg','1990-07-27',81,'Released','Attila the Hun. Ivan the Terrible. Al Capone. They were all seven once.','Problem Child',11077,7.3868,6.205,'cxFT8zYZ3dU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11048,_binary '\0','/j1Q9PSiRxpUZPtzislzEsyDgRCy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100436',7.2,33857,'en','Pump Up the Volume','Mark Hunter, a lonely high school student, uses his shortwave radio to moonlight as the popular pirate DJ \"Hard Harry.\" When his show gets blamed for a teen committing suicide, the students clash with high school faculty and the authorities.','/s1SyKrARJG2R7FyS4zkNdaekLAW.jpg','1990-08-22',102,'Released','TALK HARD. STEAL THE AIR.','Pump Up the Volume',8428,5.6744,7.1,'uo-km-qfJe8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11049,_binary '\0','/qQWlRTI59a9wtj43pE9WToKdBoT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100442',6.6,8307,'en','Q & A','A young district attorney seeking to prove a case against a corrupt police detective encounters a former lover and her new protector, a crime boss who refuses to help him.','/q45dAIysDhTNiLrqAyhEhWwxxCj.jpg','1990-04-27',132,'Released','When the questions are dangerous, the answers can be deadly.','Q & A',31598,3.5797,5.9,'3XwVB17AzaQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11050,_binary '\0','/fVKTOZwkLer18dG3piAzSPWFlY5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100449',6.8,24330,'en','Quick Change','With the aid of his girlfriend, Phyllis Potter, and best friend, Loomis, Grimm enters a Manhattan bank dressed as a clown, creates a hostage situation and executes a flawless robbery. The only thing left for the trio to do is make their getaway out of the city and to the airport. It sounds simple enough, but it seems that fate deserts them immediately after the bank heist. One mishap after another conspires to keep these robbers from reaching freedom.','/8q0VQYwOhhuRFMsyzdZ5JoB676g.jpg','1990-07-13',89,'Released','The bank robbery was easy. But getting out of New York was a nightmare.','Quick Change',10729,6.1502,6.702,'8uyE3H2r_n4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11051,_binary '\0','/pyQ9wYgY8YDd7cy6QWeP15wFRfB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100456',5.8,1671,'en','The Rainbow Thief','A petty crook, in search of the pot of gold at the end of the rainbow, hopes to cash in by befriending an heir to a huge fortune.','/7rSarDJxbC9sNyaAczwzk8bNXKs.jpg','1994-01-19',87,'Released',NULL,'The Rainbow Thief',35165,1.9742,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11052,_binary '\0','/y5xRzPzLk1gEnatnAfI6YKcHkCr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100469',6.7,10706,'en','The Reflecting Skin','In 1950s rural Idaho, a young boy watches helplessly as his friends and brother fall under the spell of a mysterious widow living up the road and becomes convinced that she is a vampire.','/ehUosbTVyCQtf6nAfpmQ8Q3XSd7.jpg','1990-08-28',95,'Released','Sometimes terrible things happen quite naturally.','The Reflecting Skin',21168,2.9451,6.659,'rvmHOGhHBQM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11053,_binary '\0','/6UyKfxOKWIDyoNIljjoXgo2F81B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100470',7.5,2595,'de','Reise der Hoffnung','In a village in eastern Turkey, tales of the economic success of Turks in Switzerland inspire Haydar to convince his wife Meryem that they must go. He sells their livestock and small plot of land in exchange for passage for two. He wants to leave their seven children in the care of the eldest and his parents; his father advises him to take one son to be educated in Europe. Will anyone reach the land of promise?','/dbNpWp7sGGIN2Qk8v10oxvNKFfq.jpg','1990-09-28',110,'Released',NULL,'Journey of Hope',41834,1.2091,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11054,_binary '\0','/uIrRLzxpgHnx5Lfdt2hHmOBktrG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100475',4.8,11041,'en','Repossessed','It\'s been some time since Father Jebedaiah Mayii exorcised the Devil from little Nancy Aglet, who is now grown up with a husband and two children of her own. But the prince of darkness wants to go a second round and has returned to repossess her! With Father Mayii unwilling to help, Father Luke Brophy tries his best to help Nancy, even when TV\'s Ernest Weller plans to air the exorcism live on TV.','/jDTP5KgWwvuKfOyJ2PJfTqVYnxJ.jpg','1990-09-14',84,'Released','The Devil\'s back. But he\'s never dealt with an exorcist like this!','Repossessed',11510,4.3875,5.3,'XIejyo2gOOY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11055,_binary '\0','/nOAmKHegzi3uXZ8tkYiiZWBdUl5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100477',6.8,51845,'en','The Rescuers Down Under','A lawless poacher wants to capture a majestic and rare golden eagle, so he kidnaps the boy who knows where to find the bird. Not to worry -- the Rescue Aid Society\'s top agents, heroic mice Miss Bianca and Bernard, fly to Australia to save the day. Accompanying the fearless duo are bumbling albatross Wilbur and local field operative Jake the Kangaroo Rat.','/5koTDBmMAkJOgAe4PL4163UKjvG.jpg','1990-11-16',77,'Released','Hang on for the most thrilling ride of your life!','The Rescuers Down Under',11135,2.4526,6.6,'KeFPQ0DvFWU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11056,_binary '\0','/jCJ4CVxg5Ic21FlpWIlz11mxNMh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100485',6.2,23033,'en','Revenge','Michael ‘Jay’ Cochran has just left the Navy after 12 years and he\'s not quite sure what he\'s going to do, except that he knows he wants a holiday. He decides to visit Tiburon Mendez, a powerful but shady Mexican businessman who he once flew to Alaska for a hunting trip. Arriving at the Mendez mansion in Mexico, he is immediately surprised by the beauty and youth of Mendez’s wife, Miryea.','/83diOZcg6ZiY8voNy2k4BX9TsMf.jpg','1990-02-16',123,'Released','A passion that cannot be denied. A betrayal that cannot be forgiven.','Revenge',14249,5.8056,6.5,'QILIRoDUiNU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11057,_binary '\0','/efFQxWf7EmhPwyXogl9JUXILgln.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100486',7.1,21741,'en','Reversal of Fortune','Wealthy Sunny von Bülow lies brain-dead, husband Claus guilty of attempted murder; but he says he\'s innocent and hires Alan Dershowitz for his appeal.','/jEmFeHPsoyHk6RRZslKzC5NVFad.jpg','1990-10-19',111,'Released','The Case of Claus Von Bulow. An American Saga of Money and Mystery.','Reversal of Fortune',38718,3.9165,6.7,'KWWdt-NZwCA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11058,_binary '\0','/5jvyHDS0mxxec1CdoJRQOMVSoqI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100491',7,5288,'en','Riff-Raff','Stevie, fresh from prison in Scotland, finds a job on a London construction site. Working conditions are poor and most of the men are working under aliases, due to immigration status and to not conflict with unemployment. Some help Stevie secure housing, squatting in a council estate. Then Stevie meets Susan, from Ireland, an aspiring singer.','/4IMy908JxRDw9xYPuJ0OLFy0cjK.jpg','1991-06-21',95,'Released',NULL,'Riff-Raff',59058,2.4266,6.7,'6TkyRQkpEtI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11059,_binary '\0','/6KxrK6I1qSHiIui5p8eSyvxo0TR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100496',6.2,2440,'fr','Ripoux contre Ripoux','The partners are back and are in a tight spot! Francois is going through a moral crisis, and Rene is experiencing the same. But, honesty is not always the best policy. After being suspended for their actions, they return to face their far more crooked replacements.','/exiz9yOOHEjdjo36x3Ic4YMSgc8.jpg','1990-02-07',107,'Released',NULL,'My New Partner II',22240,2.1189,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11060,_binary '\0','/cT0YCYCtAQC8wi56VWK1JRGgk3a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100502',5.9,100997,'en','RoboCop 2','After a successful deployment of the RoboCop Law Enforcement unit, OCP sees its goal of urban pacification come closer and closer, but as this develops, a new narcotic known as \"Nuke\" invades the streets led by God-delirious leader Cane. As this menace grows, it may prove to be too much for Murphy to handle. OCP tries to replicate the success of the first unit, but ends up with failed prototypes with suicidal issues... until Dr. Faxx, a scientist straying away from OCP\'s path, uses Cane as the new subject for the RoboCop 2 project, a living God.','/nhqBxhOJXUJeFsyLxTFkctH9H5F.jpg','1990-06-22',117,'Released','He\'s back to protect the innocent.','RoboCop 2',5549,7.8004,6.041,'HNcy89RqF5Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11061,_binary '\0','/ht7aGrZ0TknjlgealXSbR43gu6a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100504',4.7,1449,'en','Rock \'n\' Roll High School Forever','Those rambunctious kids are back in school and back in trouble in a smash sequel to the 1978 worldwide hit. Corey Feldman leads a rock and roll rally at Ronald Reagon High, but must triumph over the evil plans of the school\'s fascist principal, Vadar, who wants to halt the school dance and run their school like a prison.','/fuIWxjyKavDuz8LOA8phRjKBE1J.jpg','1991-05-23',94,'Released',NULL,'Rock \'n\' Roll High School Forever',34742,2.1988,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11062,_binary '\0','/fz7wBqkKJ7BPx2yTI4ufArwxNYB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100506',5.2,1462,'en','Rockula','Ralph is a sexually frustrated vampire who suffers from a peculiar curse. He\'s condemned for eternity to watch his one true love, Mona, be murdered by a pirate wielding a ham bone. But now? Now it\'s 1990, and Ralph is determined to break Mona\'s cycle of reincarnation. His first order of business is winning her affections, which he does by starting Rockula: a rock band that\'s sure to stake a claim on her heart.','/oDTW0B2nnfhQz8oCHbbP858eJtx.jpg','1990-02-23',87,'Released','He\'s a vampire who hasn\'t scored in 400 years. Tonight\'s the night!','Rockula',77824,1.3914,4.9,'ABG-nHoJ7pQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11063,_binary '\0','/2TIzE3Ekpbl8Eb0Y6pYxVLXQF4A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100507',5.4,164165,'en','Rocky V','A lifetime of taking shots has ended Rocky’s career, and a crooked accountant has left him broke. Inspired by the memory of his trainer, however, Rocky finds glory in training and takes on an up-and-coming boxer.','/tevHaVxtrMTaUi8f3YjLWYSSY8A.jpg','1990-11-16',104,'Released','In Russia, he fought the greatest fight of his life. Now...where does a champion go when he takes off the gloves?','Rocky V',1375,7.9855,5.773,'C2_k8p3RQx4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11064,_binary '\0','/gxUbVZvBqQEtzEjL0xMSViQhP4C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100508',6.9,1295,'es','Rodrigo D. No futuro','Rodrigo and his friends, restless teenagers from the marginalized neighborhoods on the hillsides of Medellín, spend their time causing trouble. But Rodrigo dreams of playing rock music and brings his friends together to form a punk band that becomes a lifeline amid a web of disorientation, violence, drugs, and fear.','/AqsLzU6AQUIHuDsQnqHT1qy0HVV.jpg','1990-07-23',92,'Released','Sera Muerte Vivir Tanto?','Rodrigo D. No Future',177579,0.9413,7,'UnM3J-j1CU8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11065,_binary '\0','/6FrYiUSViThISdz4dhqePBtLQxu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100514',5.9,32072,'en','The Rookie','Veteran cop Nick Pulovski is used to playing musical partners; many of the partners he\'s had in the past have died on the job, and often as a result of Nick\'s risky tactics. But the rookie who\'s been assigned to help Nick bust a carjacking ring is almost as hotheaded as he is … and when Nick gets kidnapped, his newbie partner is his only hope.','/pr37i12Qe1gGxMBf6GTIDZvfFIT.jpg','1990-12-07',121,'Released','Packing years of experience and a .45 automatic, L.A. detective Nick Pulovski figures he\'s got all the help he needs. He\'s also got all the help he doesn\'t need. His new partner is The Rookie.','The Rookie',6723,8.3578,5.9,'j2AuK8nu63s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11066,_binary '\0','/9FwYdx0XiAIFWQQ4vWoHrVYVfkH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100519',7.3,26011,'en','Rosencrantz & Guildenstern Are Dead','Rosencrantz and Guildenstern, minor characters from the play \'Hamlet\', find themselves on the road to Elsinore Castle at the behest of the King of Denmark. The duo encounter a band of players before arriving to find that they are needed to try to discern what troubles the prince Hamlet. Meanwhile, they ponder the meaning of their existence.','/6RI9sYpRxIdqlmsF6kBOiF7Bxug.jpg','1991-02-08',117,'Released','A man talking sense to himself is no madder than a man talking nonsense not to himself.','Rosencrantz & Guildenstern Are Dead',18971,4.2166,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11067,_binary '\0','/vPdb3zCAS4nxdRkc5S2hp1zh4pQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100530',6.1,19911,'en','The Russia House','Barley Scott Blair, a Lisbon-based editor of Russian literature who unexpectedly begins working for British intelligence, is commissioned to investigate the purposes of Dante, a dissident scientist trapped in the decaying Soviet Union that is crumbling under the new open-minded policies.','/fFvwQGcpEdXkuPJaS15Xtl6h6P4.jpg','1990-12-21',118,'Released','Their love was as dangerous as the secrets they kept.','The Russia House',10170,4.3488,6.1,'8Ah92MnooKU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11068,_binary '\0','/oiDOntaJQyr9nSL0AwehUYAzrhh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100536',6.6,1448,'fr','S\'en fout la mort','Dah and Jocelyn come from former French colonies to coach their rooster, \"S\'en fout la mort\", for an illicit cock-fight in the basement of a restaurant.','/8ZrxzxS9KWQj5UdYFGxH4nKXNea.jpg','1990-09-05',93,'Released',NULL,'No Fear, No Die',97041,2.112,6.1,'KeF1Gic2XVg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11069,_binary '\0','/vyKNfLCoORGBSphMHeWB06PsgOV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100557',7.3,2985,'de','Das schreckliche Mädchen','When a young woman investigates her town\'s Nazi past, the community turns against her.','/N5F5WM2bNmoWaVQ3yFYQpneQjG.jpg','1990-02-15',92,'Released',NULL,'The Nasty Girl',4339,1.7643,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11070,_binary '\0','/dXDmQKuvIL0hh8XRYxxnR2HYZye.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100581',6,4194,'it','La setta','A spree of grisly murders is perpetrated in Frankfurt by a group of Satan worshippers. A lonely schoolteacher almost runs over an elderly man and takes him in, unbeknown to her the man has plans for her – plans that involve a permanent future with the Satanic cult.','/ccOxxUuCQarqHeZdE8Ug2eopELP.jpg','1991-03-01',116,'Released','Darkness has found a new bride. Heaven help us.','The Sect',38706,1.7873,6.237,'foroacPuxbQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11071,_binary '\0','/hG5hqg1HeA8lON7Yz0rgqrhTNqp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100586',5,1844,'en','Shadowzone','After someone is killed in the subterranean project called \"Shadowzone,\" a NASA captain is called in to investigate. In the project, sleeping subjects are induced into a deep EDS state whereby they become portals to a parallel universe. Unfortunately this causes adverse reactions in the subject, and something gets through the portal, the consequence of which is an attrition problem.','/1cjKHs3zD3vScNvmGfY4i0HyGEB.jpg','1990-02-22',88,'Released','On The Dark Side Of Dreams, A New Terror Takes Shape.','Shadowzone',58200,1.5291,4.9,'h1y4ou5Exzs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11072,_binary '\0','/qXguGlOoYwIcg8A4Swt2Mivojrm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100589',5,2952,'en','Shakma','A murderous baboon escapes from a laboratory and roams the research building, and begins to kill some teenagers who are also in the building playing a Dungeons-and-Dragons type game.','/aVrOi48ZJGmUPGYtFGnQtqgFSzJ.jpg','1990-10-05',101,'Released','The world\'s most aggressive primate just got mad.','Shakma',36992,2.0316,5.5,'dL3hX1VtgFw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11073,_binary '\0','/27nvfP0Y7cBP2Bd7ewqv90HZltq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100594',6.7,14943,'en','The Sheltering Sky','An American couple drift toward emptiness in postwar North Africa.','/mcaypmWykltQMLjjSuD2vxylZHV.jpg','1990-10-25',138,'Released','A woman\'s dangerous and erotic journey...','The Sheltering Sky',24016,3.0519,6.5,'kKzAaSI_OEM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11074,_binary '\0','/eu5YCAQF6rR4ZULgLsBIRlxRqmB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100602',6.6,6605,'en','A Shock to the System','When experienced advertising executive Graham Marshall loses out on a promotion to a young man, he goes down in a path of vengeance.','/8V0zLIEuMQicvhoSPAXZTT39GYT.jpg','1990-03-23',91,'Released','Climbing the corporate ladder can be murder.','A Shock to the System',20876,2.8939,6.468,'p65Tvvc7yl4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11075,_binary '\0','/jQRuRqhiIBR0X8AGMymvAXAuQex.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100604',6.4,3018,'en','Short Time','As a result of a misdiagnosis, Detective Burt Simpson is told he has just weeks to live. He gains a new respect for his life and loved ones but learns that in order for his wife, Carolyn, and son, Dougie, to collect any insurance money, he must be killed in the line of duty. He then becomes the most reckless man on the police force, volunteering for dangerous assignments over the objections of his by-the-book partner.','/AdzsLtDtwOJxYhANEQyCtrgTNGi.jpg','1990-05-04',97,'Released','Getting killed isn\'t as easy as it looks.','Short Time',24731,2.4831,6.5,'qNIgbi4Mo-A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11076,_binary '\0','/1HIUO5hPKhVYOxWctN5mLPNebFi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100608',5.6,1700,'en','The Shrimp on the Barbie','Carlos has failed in show-biz and currently works as a waiter in a Mexican restaurant. There he meets Alex and dumb footballer Bruce celebrating their engagement with her parents. Alex\' father is less than thrilled of her fiancée and says he\'d rather accept anybody else. Eventually Alex hires Carlos to present him as her new fiancée.','/8UnWJss37wVLTVj4fTzKyv3Mrbp.jpg','1990-08-31',90,'Released','She\'s an ice-cool heiress. He\'s hot-to-trot. It\'s Desire Down Under!','The Shrimp on the Barbie',34564,2.2071,5.665,'C7aHhn_FXj4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11077,_binary '\0','/cqi6BIqbAQQg1xR3g9lAMx1YSGO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100611',5.4,3221,'en','Sibling Rivalry','Marjorie Turner is suffocating in her marriage and day to day life. An extramarital affair with a stranger seems to be the answer until her paramour has a fatal heart attack, and turns out to be less of a stranger than she could have thought...','/nBrfiqeiB8L6VU04NSZy1e3qc2v.jpg','1990-10-26',87,'Released','She did it. And boy, is she sorry.','Sibling Rivalry',108553,3.4099,5.2,'QRIgNV9oKrQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11078,_binary '\0','/63b6FaOiswnr611he4bqX38qix9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100613',5.6,2716,'en','Side Out','A law student comes to California for the summer and ends up playing professional volleyball.','/jAuywGtaKhXOjpkIM2gzHT0FSXG.jpg','1990-03-30',104,'Released',NULL,'Side Out',52741,1.9883,5.3,'9CLRhxzpOTE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11079,_binary '\0','/q1B2ynMiQlkRFdYe9U9g8S6GgGF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100623',6.4,3274,'el','Singapore Sling: Ο άνθρωπος που αγάπησε ένα πτώμα','Singapore Sling pursues Laura, a romantic memory from his past. One night, he finds himself at a mysterious villa, watching two women bury a body. He falls into their trap and, in an atmosphere of isolation and decadence, the trio act out insane pleasure games and a ritual of blood and murder.','/btTYcALtXvE9j8xjvlGOnLT1cQI.jpg','1990-12-06',112,'Released','Trapped in a deadly game of torture and murder!','Singapore Sling',1560,1.7651,6.584,'u_BqVv0LcQU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11080,_binary '\0','/9c7riUPW9E8HhybB2In62yzPdLE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100625',6.8,4632,'cn','倩女幽魂II人間道','After escaping false imprisonment, Ling Choi-San crosses paths with a pair of rebellious women. Though mourning the loss of his ghostly love, his broken heart must heal in a hurry in order to face a new series of paranormal encounters and adventures.','/uh9xhW3OX77fisjYNhhy4hrUtRZ.jpg','1990-07-13',102,'Released','The Ultimate Ghost Saga Continues.','A Chinese Ghost Story II',9050,3.8403,6.794,'sqjk453__as','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11081,_binary '\0','/qYnG9NmCgVZnVlwTDtvUFPbUPbf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100631',5.1,4538,'en','Ski Patrol','Pops isn\'t worried about the renewal of the lease for his ski lodge - the safety record is unblemished in spite of the crew of misfits who make up his ski patrol. But a scheming land developer has other plans and the ski patrol is thrust into a skiing showdown in order to save Pops\' mountain.','/clkV5VCiapnKJ5c5yg2brxATIja.jpg','1990-01-12',91,'Released',NULL,'Ski Patrol',22585,2.6458,4.8,'qggFUkhuV84','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11082,_binary '\0','/8IArH7qxzFMYXSwH3piefaix2CM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100639',4.5,3911,'en','Slumber Party Massacre III','After a hard day of volleyball at the beach, a teen whose parents are away decides to have a slumber party with her girlfriends. Their boyfriends predictably show up to scare them, but a stranger from the beach is also seen lurking around the house. Soon the group begins experiencing an attrition problem.','/rtwbZi9dIs9pcTi2pQFtLxUUonB.jpg','1990-09-07',87,'Released','It\'s driller time... And this bits for you!','Slumber Party Massacre III',27767,2.2585,5,'ne-88bVmbNI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11083,_binary '\0','/ldmlO9gxbZvShdCVQdyUDfeWubZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100645',4.6,1524,'en','Snake Eater','The Snake Eaters are an elite division of the Marines especially trained for search and destroy missions. This actioner chronicles the exploits of one of them who has become a cop. Known as a tough loner, he returns to find the band of backwoods bad-guys who killed his parents and abducted his sister.','/8FJHgOzztxVsoe773f9yerMxf06.jpg','1989-02-22',94,'Released','As dirty as Dirty Harry, as dangerous as Deliverance','Snake Eater',71200,1.6661,5.4,'uV6ZNvuaC2U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11084,_binary '\0','/2DALChI060gUghE96J9KP7RcgLb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100649',4.1,2303,'en','Solar Crisis','A huge solar flare is predicted to fry the Earth. Astronauts aboard the spaceship Helios must go to the Sun to drop a bomb equipped with an Artificial Intelligence and a Japanese pilot at the right time so the flare will point somewhere else.','/Hbv6CPtv4ehgE60dXOYKmIrcV1.jpg','1992-08-06',112,'Released','In the year 2050, the battle to save the earth will be fought on the sun.','Solar Crisis',2102,2.3461,4.4,'_z8iii7lIHk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11085,_binary '\0','/b33Szmyrd1bMmunvM8KaqErN3RC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100663',4.8,2611,'en','Sorority House Massacre II','Five college women buy the old Hokstedter place for their new sorority house. They got it cheap because of the bloody incidents from five years before. They decide to stay in it for the night so they can meet the movers in the morning, but begin to get the creeps when the weird neighbor Orville Ketchum starts poking around. Shortly after the women take showers and consult a Ouija board they begin experiencing an attrition problem.','/oxNLpMybAZkxBD1WQsIFdbmplnx.jpg','1990-10-05',80,'Released','It\'s Cleavage vs. Cleavers and the result is Delta Delta Deadly!','Sorority House Massacre II',40446,2.2961,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11086,_binary '\0','/mBnX69ySNRHkL5OLpKQ9fvdwppt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100665',2.5,4009,'en','Soultaker','Four teenagers are killed in a car accident. Two of the teenagers refuse to go with \"The Grim Reaper\" and a race between life and death ensues!','/QE0p9zG2WSuB523dUnBsSsnm0i.jpg','1990-10-26',94,'Released','Trapped in the Twilight Between Life and Death','Soultaker',31276,0.8523,2.8,'RgpvXuCPpa0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11087,_binary '\0','/2z2A7LHAMF8t3ZfZoODfWQw2IgF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100666',5.4,4287,'en','Spaced Invaders','A crew of Martians overhears a radio broadcast of Orson Welles\' \"War of the Worlds\" coming from Earth, and, thinking the Martian fleet is attacking Earth, they land their broken-down ship in a backwater mid-American town. As luck would have it, they land on Halloween and get mistaken for trick-or-treaters. Comedy ensues as the Martians try to get taken seriously.','/vchyoV7mnaUd46meVO81yolXH2D.jpg','1990-04-27',100,'Released','For years, science has speculated on the existence of intelligent life in space... Now, there is living proof there is no such thing.','Spaced Invaders',34086,2.6249,4.8,'pK9hWU_7DNk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11088,_binary '\0','/scQculNdcFH75Jpru1OWkODhhe2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100680',6.4,9547,'en','Stanley & Iris','An illiterate cook at a company cafeteria tries for the attention of a newly widowed woman. As they get to know one another, she discovers his inability to read. When he is fired, she takes on trying to teach him to read in her kitchen each night.','/ydDNS3aCnBWOT9jQiEVmN56rk2i.jpg','1990-02-09',104,'Released','Some people need love spelled out for them.','Stanley & Iris',36094,3.6048,6.5,'3JjoqdRORos','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11089,_binary '\0','/d0wx0E8NrXPhGzgTbUsbKaP4uvZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100681',7.6,4981,'it','Stanno tutti bene','Matteo Scuro is a retired Sicilian bureaucrat, a widower with five children, all of whom live on the mainland and hold responsible jobs. He decides to surprise each with a visit and finds none as he imagined.','/zHCK2Czp4kx8TSaU7Hyh2UYFUOc.jpg','1990-09-19',121,'Released','A story of family love... and family secrets.','Everybody\'s Fine',45799,2.4317,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11090,_binary '\0','/rQfoRwxlkU8hdUnruoicnCuc4XO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100685',7.1,29964,'en','State of Grace','Hell\'s Kitchen, New York. Terry Noonan returns home after a ten-year absence. He soon reconnects with Jackie, a childhood friend and member of the Irish mob, and rekindles his love affair with Jackie\'s sister Kathleen.','/dNMeRLY3MeY2FFeh639plHai3F1.jpg','1990-09-14',135,'Released','… where crime is a family affair.','State of Grace',1662,5.8882,7,'ndeXbZgJ9fw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11091,_binary '\0','/usYUwfhSAX3M9I8TRZ64WeDgX4G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100688',5.3,1316,'en','Steel and Lace','After her attackers go free, Gaily Morton, the victim of a vicious assault, commits suicide. Her vengeful brother, brilliant robotics engineer and scientist, Dr. Albert Morton, decides to use his skills to enact vengeance, transplanting his sister\'s brain into a humanoid cyborg with bone-crushing strength and an array of built-in torture devices...','/nuAUg7UIiTDM3eS6bDK702RRJ5A.jpg','1991-01-30',94,'Released','Iron. Carbon. Anger.','Steel and Lace',31154,2.2126,4.935,'HRv-Sy0DSMU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11092,_binary '\0','/vZlubhXN7WjAfYqO29DtTROQT8R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100691',6.2,3077,'en','Stella','Barmaid Stella Claire and blueblood Stephen Dallas have very little in common -- except they\'ve fallen in love. When their relationship fails, Stella decides to raise the child they had, Jenny, alone. But Jenny and Stella are far from the perfect mother-daughter pair.','/hQOd9c9IpzsRC1sipxUmR8X6ApV.jpg','1990-02-02',109,'Released','She sacrificed her own dreams to make her daughter\'s dreams come true.','Stella',47329,1.9356,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11093,_binary '\0','/2zIEXlkd8iH10vFIG4zhjxSngKR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100732',7.2,1593,'hu','Szürkület','In the dense and murky woodlands of provincial Hungary, the search for a child murderer drags a once-respected detective into an all-consuming obsession enshrouded by irresolution and despair, even long after he has been taken off the case. What emerges is not a crime story, but a harrowing venture through the darkness of the human soul.','/7gwAZ38t4VXgafdq9hJfkE6BBBP.jpg','1990-09-28',100,'Released',NULL,'Twilight',110379,1.7734,7.1,'WjtSP8qnxPU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11094,_binary '\0','/fGEOTZQHYrfB509jdhmfo1rpref.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100740',6.2,21219,'en','Tales from the Darkside: The Movie','A young boy tells three stories of horror to distract a witch who plans to eat him.','/5q8WK4gW45Knxhpb29IVOCbbfI7.jpg','1990-05-03',93,'Released','Four Ghoulish Fables In One Modern Nightmare!','Tales from the Darkside: The Movie',20701,6.4241,6.2,'R9lVoUKk-8Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11095,_binary '\0','/6vb1iP6IooCB2HMBOG0fiKHV1ph.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100747',7.1,3980,'fr','Tatie Danielle','A black comedy about a widow who mourns the death of her husband by tormenting everyone she meets.','/pZcRzToSNZ1V3OTzWABDFiV4fhV.jpg','1990-04-04',111,'Released',NULL,'Auntie Danielle',6444,1.6508,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11096,_binary '\0','/rWiCVPrwuKwWfIJVmwxJv7BRhdj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100757',7.3,2189,'ru','Такси-блюз','Ivan is old Russia: thick, dour, hard-working, often brutish; he misses Communism. He drives a taxi and one night meets Alexi, a new Russian, a musician, an alcoholic, irresponsible. Alexi stiffs Ivan for the fare, so Ivan tracks him down and a love-hate relationship ensues. When Alexi lets the bath water run over in Ivan\'s flat and Ivan must pay 500 rubles for repairs, he tries to force Alexi into day labor to repay him. It\'s hopeless. Then, suddenly, Alexi is discovered, goes on a jazz tour of America, becomes a celebrity, and returns in triumph. Ivan longs to renew the friendship, and it looks as if he may get what he wants.','/sOWdSyompSqcyynAPP7LQSjkHwM.jpg','1990-10-17',110,'Released',NULL,'Taxi Blues',41842,1.2337,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11097,_binary '\0','/qXM08jXRwlT9rm10iAC2uoq0Kn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100758',6.8,113646,'en','Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles','A quartet of humanoid turtles, trained by their mentor in Ninjutsu, must learn to work together to face the menace of Shredder and the Foot Clan.','/shfAU6xIIEAEtsloIT3n9Fscz2E.jpg','1990-03-30',93,'Released','Hey dude, this is NO cartoon.','Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles',1498,10.7563,6.7,'3y9C_P7dG6s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11098,_binary '\0','/1ZyuKCnYYZOtIqwWWT6PcMjnRCd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100777',7.3,2400,'cn','天若有情','After a young Triad member takes an upper-class girl hostage during his escape from a jewelry heist, the two find themselves falling in love, in spite of the repercussions caused by their forbidden relationship.','/uO6TjYi6vWKRhjmBFScbjh4ja86.jpg','1990-06-14',92,'Released',NULL,'A Moment of Romance',81128,3.3121,7.2,'S5u7eBsb3Vc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11099,_binary '\0','/zR9JPzQljgjmcxM0caE316VsBv9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100791',7.1,3592,'en','To Sleep with Anger','An enigmatic drifter from the South comes to visit an old acquaintance who now lives in South-Central LA.','/k97OYGAbHIP6MNuOOGDUgYDnncW.jpg','1990-10-12',102,'Released','When Harry comes to town, he brings good times, bad times… And a lot of trouble!','To Sleep with Anger',94725,1.9259,6.8,'_H4pK3iDhgg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11100,_binary '\0','/sZlb6FAyeKkOXHOuwSCi7blYaJ2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100797',5.9,4656,'en','Too Young to Die','An abused 15 year old is charged with a murder that carries the death penalty in this fact-based story.','/GGo6AblNm3BuBOJvKKxYjvmjec.jpg','1990-02-26',92,'Released','They were young, in love and wanted for murder.','Too Young to Die',10917,3.4254,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11101,_binary '\0','/x2wOlXuK4NzPDQ0OBZiJjNNOp6Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100802',7.5,384901,'en','Total Recall','Construction worker Douglas Quaid\'s obsession with the planet Mars leads him to visit Rekall, a virtual vacation company that manufactures memories. When something goes wrong during Quaid\'s memory implant procedure, his life turns upside down, leading him to question what is reality and what isn\'t.','/wVbeL6fkbTKSmNfalj4VoAUUqJv.jpg','1990-06-01',113,'Released','Get ready for the ride of your life.','Total Recall',861,17.4723,7.328,'2xbodk7S2KA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11102,_binary '\0','/frfbAejN3wD1eCzxzNQTSy6hK6X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100813',7,6678,'en','Treasure Island','Young Jim Hawkins, while running the Benbow Inn with his mother, meets Captain Billy Bones, who dies at the inn while it is beseiged by buccaneers led by Blind Pew. Jim and his mother fight off the attackers and discover Billy Bones\' treasure map for which the buccaneers had come. Jim agrees to sail on the S.S. Hispaniola with Squire Trelawney and Dr. Livesey to find the treasure on a mysterious island. Upon arriving at the island, ship\'s cook and scallywag Long John Silver leads a mutiny of crew members who want the treasure for themselves. Jim helps the Squire and Hispaniola officers to survive the mutiny and fight back against Silver\'s men, who have taken over the ship.','/mIj8UjP9qYxQd1pLeudjmrV3PFv.jpg','1990-06-07',131,'Released','Sail the high seas. Battle the pirates. Live the adventure.','Treasure Island',26612,4.7054,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11103,_binary '\0','/3L3DUwfRLW18OUiLSdmovfICyY3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100814',7.2,168394,'en','Tremors','Val McKee and Earl Bassett are in a fight for their lives when they discover that their desolate town has been infested with gigantic, man-eating creatures that live below the ground.','/cA4ggkZ3r1d5r9hOAUWC8x5ul2i.jpg','1990-01-19',96,'Released','They say there\'s nothing new under the sun. But under the ground…','Tremors',9362,11.9393,6.949,'msngBcC75LI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11104,_binary '\0','/mzJHjlJ090EOQSI8wFnAiadbYLr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100816',6.5,2546,'hi','त्रिदेव','A honest but disgraced Police Inspector\'s attempts to clear his name pits him against terrorists and the brother of his sweetheart.','/ytxwoZLN9F2JAcnsSE3ABgMWEWs.jpg','1989-07-07',173,'Released','A Volcanic Saga of Three Angry Men','Tridev',27641,1.5418,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11105,_binary '\0','/ltuTwhowD0Z7UVUcc4rZL615csD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100822',6.1,2154,'en','Tune in Tomorrow...','Martin works at the local radio station, which just hired a new scriptwriter with a reputation for great drama, Pedro Carmichael. Martin’s aunt Julia, not related by blood, returns home after many years away and Martin falls for her. Once Pedro finds out about this romance, he starts incorporating details of it into the script of his daily drama series. Soon, Martin and Julia are not only hearing about their fictional selves over the radio, but about what they are going to do next.','/cMabi4aTi9mYs29tFS5Bh2DSEPi.jpg','1990-10-26',107,'Released','...for the year\'s most outrageous romantic comedy.','Tune in Tomorrow...',41927,2.0836,5.5,'MSAWCXT_fxg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11106,_binary '\0','/wWucXwUmJiA5iUNqegJHbcy2Mzy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100827',6.1,9237,'it','Due occhi diabolici','A duo of Edgar Allan Poe adaptations about a greedy wife\'s attempt to embezzle her dying husband\'s fortune, and a sleazy reporter\'s adoption of a strange black cat.','/zVWaQfaSZ7AWE0XqbMT57szVmXo.jpg','1990-01-25',120,'Released','When I Wake You... You\'ll Be Dead.','Two Evil Eyes',29514,3.2502,6.127,'isooRU2d5DQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11107,_binary '\0','/kXGdcYuCpT5mep4tYk8XSbhShB1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100828',6.1,15844,'en','The Two Jakes','Real estate developer Jake Berman hires private investigator and war veteran Jake Gittes for some run-of-the-mill matrimonial work. After Berman shoots his wife\'s lover, who happens to be his business partner, Gittes is drawn into a web of conspiracy and deceit involving the oil reserves beneath Los Angeles. While investigating, Gittes hears a voice from his past that causes him to revisit a traumatic case in Chinatown.','/49DSKcjPUdLjzyMpf8OIKep0cLN.jpg','1990-08-10',137,'Released','They say money makes the world go round. But sex was invented before money.','The Two Jakes',32669,4.6397,6,'WWbiQAr8miI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11108,_binary '\0','/sKE6dfuO56T0xq88xuiHahuDDNA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100842',7.2,6887,'en','The Unbelievable Truth','After serving time for murder, Josh Hutton returns to his home town where he meets Audry Hugo. No one can remember exactly what Josh did...','/36Gqgyh1nOguvnIH8RBfhj7EpjH.jpg','1990-07-20',90,'Released','Can a nice girl from Long Island find happiness with a mass murderer?','The Unbelievable Truth',38545,1.9518,6.843,'iZpuazT6MrA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11109,_binary '\0','/duw70XDZhv8cyDCFyB6l2zjYNmM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100851',7,1668,'fr','Uranus','After World War II, a small French village struggles to put the war behind as the controlling Communist Party tries to flush out Petain loyalists. The local bar owner, a simple man who likes to write poetry, who only wants to be left alone to do his job, becomes a target for Communist harassment as they try and locate a particular loyalist, and he pushes back.','/7TQmoUsKYY7UP9rDfZiXyY4Fm6X.jpg','1990-12-12',100,'Released',NULL,'Uranus',41930,1.7422,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11110,_binary '\0','/mMVmRtcAvVDRe9VpusjoCL1pw6s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100873',6.9,4538,'en','Vincent & Theo','The tragic story of Vincent van Gogh broadened by focusing as well on his brother Theodore, who helped support Vincent. Based on the letters written between the two.','/hKsYwJoncAf42hqzCVbp1LBwUxv.jpg','1990-12-02',140,'Released','An obsessive vision. A desperate dream. A world that didn\'t understand… And a brother that did.','Vincent & Theo',55309,1.6887,6.3,'t6Vm55JitLg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11111,_binary '\0','/8KPo3OtEtw4JMsaRMmxPR9eYabm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100881',5.1,1556,'it','Voci dal profondo','Wealthy businessman Giorgio Mainardi has died of a stomach hemorrhage, but his ghost is not so sure that it was a random misfortune and wants to know the truth. Unfortunately, almost everyone around him is happy to see him gone. Everyone, that is, except for his daughter Rosy, who still feels affection for her father even though they have drifted apart. With her medical student boyfriend, Johnathan, Rosy will try to get to the bottom of her father\'s death.','/6GFIyyR0tqt2Cd0Vayi5T3vN82f.jpg','1991-03-01',91,'Released',NULL,'Voices from Beyond',30871,1.1179,5.5,'V_MkNhaoz1A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11112,_binary '\0','/xYAGzJjN1LYutNhXTxkK2WpMHpy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100904',4.6,1584,'en','Watchers II','A genetically re-engineered dog develops a psychic link with a monster created in a lab experiment which goes awry.','/iU7Yy5dRIaoFvmgv40Fb2feSISt.jpg','1990-08-16',101,'Released','Don\'t look back or you\'ll never see anything again.','Watchers II',70247,2.245,4.7,'CGzr591XSR8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11113,_binary '\0','/snNj2CZeaBHkP5xT5ep1efxa6rY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100911',5.9,6678,'en','Welcome Home, Roxy Carmichael','Movie star Roxy Carmichael is abandoning the bright lights of Hollywood, Calif. and returning to her small Ohio hometown -- at least long enough to dedicate a city building. And now the whole town of Clyde is bracing for Carmichael\'s return, most of all her now-married old flame Denton Webb and troubled teen Dinky Bossetti. An orphan with few friends, Dinky is convinced that Carmichael is her birth mother, and that the actress will reclaim her when she returns.','/7ygtZksyPjzkjdFL036YfnSTc1F.jpg','1990-10-12',95,'Released','She doesn\'t want much. Just a whole new life.','Welcome Home, Roxy Carmichael',31923,2.7395,6.1,'o-uRSRale-w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11114,_binary '\0','/kZWSn5WgIUNwxLlUdSlaOwWJc1T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100912',6.8,6854,'de','Werner - Beinhart!','Comic artist Brösel trades a magic pen that helps him come up with funny stories for the promise to fulfill one of Rumpelstiltskin\'s wishes. The resulting animated films show episodes of the life of Werner, a plumber apprentice and motorbike enthusiast and his friends. They are interspersed with the live-action portions.','/vptblYAQRE8qrYJmYVnl6pSU7YA.jpg','1990-11-29',93,'Released',NULL,'Werner and the Wizard of Booze',9742,1.9455,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11115,_binary '\0','/iIdRMGCNNAaaQF9wf1iBYJQb9vC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100924',5.9,1915,'en','Where the Heart Is','A wealthy businessman shows his young adult kids how tough life can be.','/i3DAggUcSsQX3DUFBOS3igTVQz.jpg','1990-02-23',107,'Released','Stewart McBain is showing his kids a new side of life. The Outside.','Where the Heart Is',48864,2.6199,6.2,'0S-rhrfIw3w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11116,_binary '\0','/1ae6AzOM7GjIlNSPjsujbUPavXh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100928',6.5,14465,'en','White Hunter, Black Heart','Renowned filmmaker John Wilson travels to Africa to direct a new movie, but constantly leaves to hunt elephants and other game, to the dismay of his cast and crew. He eventually becomes obsessed with hunting down and killing one specific elephant.','/ppO7yFEqxuYqauKKJy43BLmiKGs.jpg','1990-05-16',112,'Released','An adventure in obsession...','White Hunter, Black Heart',28761,3.9898,6.4,'YflvYAX3hJM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11117,_binary '\0','/dKnB6n8lWVMKbFX4ooYJdMAExYg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100931',5.7,1660,'en','Why Me?','A jewel thief steals a sacred ruby which sets off a chase by the police, the Turkish government, nutty American terrorists, and the CIA.','/pj7CohDGed93oqA3755GeT6Qrad.jpg','1990-02-08',87,'Released','Bruno and Gus made the ultimate hit... now they\'re the targets.','Why Me?',142946,2.4059,5.7,'5uI086keEN4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11118,_binary '\0','/f3jxLETlVbHEoGqPR9X7ZB0LG8u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100934',4.5,13820,'en','Wild Orchid','A woman lawyer becomes mesmerized by a self-made millionaire during an encounter in Rio setting off a series of erotic encounters.','/6UfS8J9Ixn0BAv1aeuAFWom5YEk.jpg','1989-12-22',105,'Released','An adventure of the senses.','Wild Orchid',5203,11.161,5.3,'SPh-q9vqGgc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11119,_binary '\0','/6xJ2odkMFmO2LptVUBR8t8wBldQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100935',7.2,113129,'en','Wild at Heart','Young lovers Sailor and Lula hit the road to start a new life together away from the wrath of Lula’s deranged, disapproving mother, who has hired a team of hitmen to cut the lovers’ surreal honeymoon short.','/uLUFI5sJIfWrBUWB2Y1dEuyvvVy.jpg','1990-08-17',125,'Released','A wild and crazy love story.','Wild at Heart',483,8.6328,7,'dQIdBfrF0Ik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11120,_binary '\0','/hehaK1jIuTOvRPGPccVivZcZ2Cb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100944',6.8,59960,'en','The Witches','While staying at a hotel in England with his grandmother, Helga, a young boy named Luke inadvertently spies on a convention of witches. The Grand High Witch reveals a plan to turn all children into mice via a magical formula. When they discover the eavesdropper, the witches test the formula on him. Now, with the help of Helga and hotel manager Mr Stringer, Luke the mouse must fight back against the witches.','/mPYBjVkeHakkPGY7WaKyyNU4RWm.jpg','1990-05-25',91,'Released','Saving the world from witches is a tall order for a boy they\'ve turned into a mouse!','The Witches',10166,6.853,7,'7mmbKELT2VU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11121,_binary '\0','/p44hXmcLTfLRBFEhqXETXTZAw3t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100963',6.9,4687,'cn','武狀元蘇乞兒','The heir to a noble and influential family finds the love of his life, but she will only accept him if he becomes a kung-fu master. He becomes a legendary folk hero who tries to save the emperor.','/wKNXgt7W65khSFjqoqUuJ0aEClj.jpg','1992-12-17',96,'Released',NULL,'King of Beggars',47648,4.244,7.1,'01b-aHZgNws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11122,_binary '\0','/3T23wNGVoj9aVrs5Usj839STgzZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100967',6.9,1596,'cn','洗黑錢','An ex-cop and divorce lawyer team up with a gangster to clear their names after getting involved in a dirty money scheme led by a vicious money launderer, who plans to expand his business and wipe out anyone who stands in his way.','/7DKQvMAiYBHBRVNtgc3qAxoAe6l.jpg','1990-08-11',96,'Released',NULL,'Tiger Cage II',58412,2.9134,6.8,'8Q_R8lQfWjs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11123,_binary '\0','/7fmjPFw5vvLx4bvqOV8S0IBF4kK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100973',6.8,2930,'cn','笑傲江湖','A kung-fu manual known as the Sacred Scroll is stolen from the Emperor\'s library. An army detachment is sent to recover it. Meanwhile, a young swordsman and his fellow disciple are accidentally drawn into the chaos.','/tnbQngk3fKAqwqyVmqxBXvoD3DZ.jpg','1990-04-05',117,'Released',NULL,'Swordsman',18860,3.2619,7,'UkOl0099Ki4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11124,_binary '\0','/sQbyKuDwfOplT78peqIWcvssVkt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100975',3.4,2105,'en','Xtro 2: The Second Encounter','An underground government facility is locked down by its A.I.-controlled computer when an alien entity travels through a dimensional portal and threatens the lives of everybody inside.','/rKAViKJOJYwcFYA7SjvTSKwxlvE.jpg','1990-05-04',92,'Released','Part Alien. Part Predator. All Terror.','Xtro 2: The Second Encounter',55952,2.1327,4.741,'LEycrJPD_G0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11125,_binary '\0','/vsDS55XwnRveHp4jgCHQ75LJzlp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100991',6.2,2095,'ja','ヒルコ／妖怪ハンター','A school was built on one of the Gates of Hell, behind which hordes of demons await the moment they will be free to roam the Earth. Hiruko is a goblin sent to Earth on a reconnaissance mission. He beheads students in order to assemble their heads on the demons\' spider-like bodies. Hieda, an archaeology professor, and Masao, a haunted student, investigate the gory deaths.','/59D3kAu88UHbBRiOUSoFEx07Qtc.jpg','1991-05-11',89,'Released','Slam the door shut!','Hiruko the Goblin',38405,2.406,6.3,'g0vnQYyTzTs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11126,_binary '\0','/sQNPWOTzl5kkZTW5ogSu0uSnreB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100994',6.5,41003,'en','Young Guns II','Three of the original five \"young guns\" — Billy the Kid, Jose Chavez y Chavez, and Doc Scurlock — return in Young Guns, Part 2, which is the story of Billy the Kid and his race to safety in Old Mexico while being trailed by a group of government agents led by Pat Garrett.','/7kMjla98srGHlFzAEmoGRcr6GN1.jpg','1990-08-01',104,'Released','The west just got wilder.','Young Guns II',9086,6.1504,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11127,_binary '\0','/g2Y4A9qgkHhecPBnYMaAIzTlmcN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0100998',7.7,33297,'ja','夢','Eight visually rich vignettes drawn from Kurosawa’s own dreams—fox weddings and vanished orchards, a soldier’s ghosts, a walk through Van Gogh’s canvases, nuclear nightmares, and a water-mill utopia—meditate on childhood, art, mortality, and humanity’s uneasy bond with nature.','/ua17wrOrUjyqxuYmnUrmOVBMf4G.jpg','1990-05-11',119,'Released','The past, present, and future. The thoughts and images of one man... for all men. One man\'s dreams... for every dreamer.','Dreams',12516,5.2737,7.7,'zFX_AMcPQkI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11128,_binary '\0','/lG236SGLln8fov2Przpbb8pL3Em.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101004',4.4,4562,'en','Zandalee','Bored with her marriage to burnt out poet turned corporate executive Thierry, Zandalee falls prey to an old friend of her husband, the manipulative and egotistical Johnny and becomes enmeshed in a sensual, passionate and destructive affair.','/sW7nX30z07kmmstuI9S9s5ZSSAb.jpg','1991-05-09',100,'Released','One woman... two men... one driven by desire. The other driven to the edge.','Zandalee',36630,3.8419,4.3,'4ZghHws9OuQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11129,_binary '\0','/r0K79o2AI4VoXFCxXW01HZCwvUh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101020',6.7,8293,'cn','縱橫四海','Three orphans grow up to become art thieves under the tutelage of a crime boss. Romance complicates matters when the trio are double-crossed.','/xCm4qIID3oyhBxRNKsYo3TpDivF.jpg','1991-02-02',108,'Released','They only stop to reload.','Once a Thief',47423,3.9448,6.9,'7evMksa_NOY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11130,_binary '\0','/rrtP938krWZXswyAslgITgWIYp5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101025',7.1,3652,'es','¡Ay, Carmela!','During the Spanish Civil War, a group of comics lightens the days of the Republican troops. Tired of life in the front lines, they make their way to Valencia, accidentally entering enemy land and falling prisoner.','/bxJ1QpzC0XVgG6Z3iWdCn9oI5vt.jpg','1990-03-16',102,'Released','Across the battlefields of Spain, she won the heart of every man.','Ay, Carmela!',41806,2.3602,6.7,'IwMhiwIqnVg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11131,_binary '\0','/ovxdPoXYb3raXOAqokCqkCR83Jx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101026',7,33901,'es','¡Átame!','After being released from a mental hospital, a troubled young man tracks down an actress he once had sex with and forces her into captivity, determined to make her part of his life.','/4eNyqA543ixNCME8pcADgP9wb1i.jpg','1990-01-22',102,'Released','A love story... with strings attached!','Tie Me Up! Tie Me Down!',2469,3.7721,6.8,'HIlLD2PFldU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11132,_binary '\0','/7C4ZQfYI6x6a1smHnOSzVKL3R5i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101244',6.3,1290,'hi','100 Days','Devi is gifted with Extra Sensory Perception (ESP). Her gift comes to light one day while playing tennis with her friend, Sudha, when she has a vision of her sister, Rama, being shot to death by a man in a black raincoat. She telephones Rama, finds she is safe and is relieved. Shortly thereafter Rama disappears, the police are notified, but are unable to find any trace of her. Devi then meets multi-millionaire, Ram Kumar, both fall in love and get married. She moves into his once abandoned and legally disputed bungalow, and that\'s when she starts having visions again. These visions lead her to a wall that is loosely plastered','/pZJcxCrwjBl9bRLwOD8u5HfDT0x.jpg','1991-05-31',161,'Released',NULL,'100 Days',55627,1.5338,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11133,_binary '\0','/xxtG3bsOIWwvOQrdTUcLe7D5adN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101252',7.1,3556,'en','29th Street','After winning $6.2 million in the 1976 New York State Lottery, he is arrested for throwing rocks at a church. He then tells his story at the police station.','/49qYMV5re5pug1ybxNQ4VUp6Owv.jpg','1991-11-01',101,'Released','There\'s no telling where luck will take you','29th Street',43267,2.6087,6.9,'MwF1XSyJYZ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11134,_binary '\0','/8vIR41Yq02O37gCkZFvj1rqMF1z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101254',8,2914,'en','35 Up','Director Michael Apted revisits the same group of British-born adults after a 7 year wait. The subjects are interviewed as to the changes that have occurred in their lives during the last seven years.','/blgrNJpi1jdGhKCKqRjKCl1u9qT.jpg','1991-08-29',116,'Released',NULL,'35 Up',20562,2.1206,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11135,_binary '\0','/NC1g6WrrSPMnZ5Ip627skD2FEG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101256',4.4,2093,'en','976-EVIL II','After being bestowed with demonic powers following a phone call to Hell, a psychotic teacher begins a rampage of death and destruction in a small town, forcing a teen and her boyfriend to fight him off so that they can get away.','/9NUTvPGPXmtH0BXsBAqWZTOhLrL.jpg','1992-01-29',93,'Released','This time Satan returns the call…','976-EVIL II',28751,2.2179,4.5,'rK3g9TGaoco','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11136,_binary '\0','/oBK7lTywbhvpY8AIdyS43yCVPbt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101258',7.4,28941,'cn','阿飛正傳','Yuddy, a Hong Kong playboy known for breaking girls\' hearts, tries to find solace and truth after discovering the woman who raised him isn\'t his mother.','/g0nbZt1eFlL8FqG8r524iXnpoQV.jpg','1990-12-15',94,'Released','You can hold me, but not my heart.','Days of Being Wild',18311,6.2632,7.3,'BuMyyKQOle8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11137,_binary '\0','/2p6qfYmPji0PRL1knsKXt8ptH2g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101264',2.9,2658,'en','Abraxas, Guardian of the Universe','An alien policeman comes to Earth to hunt down a renegade of his own race.','/1DwaSuBcK2bdWFhVa543DYYmDE2.jpg','1990-12-18',90,'Released','An adventure across time and space','Abraxas, Guardian of the Universe',37926,1.93,3.5,'HYCqnNyaET8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11138,_binary '\0','/nCYDeR9ofZCXY3nUVZgJ6ml5LUf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101268',5.8,3050,'en','Across the Tracks','When Billy returns from reform school he has to attend a different high school at the other side of town. He tries to start with a clean slate but his old rival doesn\'t make it easy on him and his buddy Louie tries to make him go astray again. His brother Joe, quite the opposite of Billy, is a good runner and determined to win a track scholarship. He suggests Billy to join his school\'s track team, which pits the two brothers against each other.','/5hEAQFEGTdEMcaEhBYzVaK7je3.jpg','1991-02-15',100,'Released',NULL,'Across the Tracks',48448,2.2498,5.853,'AGjwttet6KU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11139,_binary '\0','/7OxGhxUYAdtuike29VMzEFxJx7y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101272',7,203211,'en','The Addams Family','When a man claiming to be long-lost Uncle Fester reappears after 25 years lost, the family plans a celebration to wake the dead. But the kids barely have time to warm up the electric chair before Morticia begins to suspect Fester is fraud when he can\'t recall any of the details of Fester\'s life.','/qFf8anju5f2epI0my8RdwwIXFIP.jpg','1991-11-22',100,'Released','Weird is relative.','The Addams Family',2907,15.559,7.082,'A6X4VAHdDVg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11140,_binary '\0','/1MLmaLQfzdYT4VteHrGprN4BcjH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101273',6.6,4097,'en','The Adjuster','An uptight insurance man and his film-censor wife become a kinky couple\'s landlords.','/bwf8eDggGiaUsdgwxyFnLIWLJBV.jpg','1991-11-27',102,'Released','Some people work in mysterious ways.','The Adjuster',41796,1.7558,6,'YbJkc2ojlQM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11141,_binary '\0','/ahxm4f0LpsoS0nDjPVCBLuumfOz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101276',5.8,1432,'en','Afraid of the Dark','A little boy, obsessed with blindness and violence, slowly gets trapped in his own delusions.','/vnMNulSEBYX6yE21SM8ZVnCrV3N.jpg','1992-01-22',91,'Released','You can\'t escape what you can\'t see.','Afraid of the Dark',60158,1.8764,5.7,'pS2Q4kh19yc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11142,_binary '\0','/k2985gSbHlV4DqWokzjOB8wsUt8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101279',8,4815,'bn','আগন্তুক','A well-off family is paid an unexpected, and rather unwanted, visit by a man claiming to be the woman\'s long lost uncle. The initial suspicion with which they greet the man slowly dissolves as he regales them with stories of his travels, tales that are at odds with their conventional middle class perspective on the world.','/uNYlRzs8PBGCvJO5O9NO3Hx7L3x.jpg','1991-05-07',114,'Released',NULL,'The Stranger',41781,1.6165,7.586,'YKg6u7Xbsaw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11143,_binary '\0','/obJtxmIqI3MmvSwC5x5svOO3AF0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101283',5.3,1654,'hi','Ajooba','The evil Vizier of Baharistan kills the royal family and takes power for himself. The real prince, who has survived his machinations, returns to his homeland to avenge his parents as a masked vigilante.','/Ai4kr0EVDnEwIvD4r5RKVkNFu7b.jpg','1991-04-12',178,'Released',NULL,'Ajooba',146255,1.0287,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11144,_binary '\0','/nJ0O5fqDzLPz1rPo0s5e0BDfBBY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101301',5.9,6167,'en','All I Want For Christmas','Siblings Ethan and Hallie O\'Fallon plot to get their divorced parents back together in time for Christmas.','/3Fcyjwyg7Qjp0qUKo4HfoC7JIf.jpg','1991-11-08',92,'Released','How far would you go to make a wish come true?','All I Want For Christmas',13644,3.0999,5.6,'rjRILzo_Nu0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11145,_binary '\0','/nOumVCMi06REnGXU8TysPe2aoQl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101309',4.1,3943,'en','Alligator 2: The Mutation','A giant mutated alligator runs riot in a small town after the sewer system washes it into a lake.','/ggHWRDlEcKRdypvWxtjxTN1HKuo.jpg','1991-07-05',92,'Released','It crashed out of the sewers... now there\'s hell to pay!','Alligator 2: The Mutation',40800,2.5519,4.9,'5JN9Fd2NPF8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11146,_binary '\0','/mygq3cQkS4v1MoLxo22KABiK90l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101316',6.8,25597,'fr','L\'Amant','A poor French teenage girl engages in an illicit affair with a wealthy Chinese heir in 1920s Saigon. For the first time in her young life she has control, and she wields it deftly over her besotted lover throughout a series of clandestine meetings and torrid encounters.','/lgBGy8QaIFD9jQJWgi837czobEp.jpg','1992-01-22',115,'Released','She gave her innocence, her passion, her body. The one thing she couldn\'t give was her love.','The Lover',10995,10.7476,7.019,'bUSUfOHwC48','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11147,_binary '\0','/7U2BQKbJTr3XwdtNdjhZp6TFLlk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101317',6.9,3718,'es','Amantes','A torrid affair between a recently discharged serviceman and an attractive widow leads to murder.','/1QcqoV8HwHJQEvhAcV5OAAq0WuY.jpg','1991-02-23',103,'Released','This landlady has more than just rent on her mind','Lovers: A True Story',41782,1.8026,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11148,_binary '\0','/6vWdQxx4yqV5kEeAqtzBHndo3Eg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101318',7.6,17621,'fr','Les Amants du Pont-Neuf','Set against Paris\' oldest bridge, the Pont Neuf, while it was closed for repairs, this film is a love story between two young vagrants: Alex, a would be circus performer addicted to alcohol and sedatives and Michele, a painter driven to a life on the streets because of a failed relationship and an affliction which is slowly turning her blind.','/un81oln6mAv66sqnkgPSpWONUqP.jpg','1991-10-16',126,'Released','Romance... In a most unlikely place.','The Lovers on the Bridge',2767,5.3224,7.4,'R_bvzzcpwdA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11149,_binary '\0','/5bNFZlMjLPLgM0blOAlMlZaQW7O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101326',4,5834,'en','American Ninja 4: The Annihilation','The two American Ninjas, Joe Armstrong and Sean Davidson, team up to do battle against a terrorist and his band of Ninjas.','/3MoXMlTDQgpLr54veMT39rCyaTz.jpg','1990-10-30',99,'Released','The tradition lives on!','American Ninja 4: The Annihilation',25528,3.5353,5.292,'qMiIV4nVrWk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11150,_binary '\0','/qQNFOI3ZlLBKaiJDU8Gmow4ecQm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101327',5.9,1836,'en','American Shaolin','After facing brutal humiliation in the ring, a young karateka travels to China in order to study the ancient art of Shaolin Kung Fu, becoming the first American Shaolin.','/vCUHCkMJ94KqvfzaVviOngjZgLm.jpg','1991-10-01',106,'Released',NULL,'American Shaolin',36934,3.121,6.9,'E1fzrBAhF_s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11151,_binary '\0','/8UpJ8svNnwVtpu8n62vGke8MOJf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101329',6.5,30521,'en','An American Tail: Fievel Goes West','Some time after the Mousekewitz\'s have settled in America, they find that they are still having problems with the threat of cats. That makes them eager to try another home out in the west, where they are promised that mice and cats live in peace. Unfortunately, the one making this claim is an oily con artist named Cat R. Waul who is intent on his own sinister plan.','/k4aLupAkHWwHiEDwvqsZFAnUYF.jpg','1991-11-21',75,'Released','Look out pardners, there\'s a new mouse in town!','An American Tail: Fievel Goes West',10380,7.2358,6.3,'klGXjnh3NQo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11152,_binary '\0','/3HFcvBSndugw7mfH8CxPlA2arlo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101356',5.3,4774,'en','Another You','George has been in a mental hospital for 3 years and is finally ready to go out into the real world again. Eddie Dash, a dedicated con-man, is supposed to keep him out of trouble, but when people begin to recognise George as a missing millionaire, Eddie wants to take advantage of the situation.','/vKF0hCjv4JZhTt9XoxVsKLtteaM.jpg','1991-07-26',94,'Released','Meet Two Big Liars','Another You',23303,3.7641,5.5,'rk0I0TtjwZY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11153,_binary '\0','/wxWmyP3FzwzMpSYID7lOgkfPiJa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101366',5.4,3726,'en','Arena','On a distant space station far in the future, the best fighters from every planet vie for the championship in an intergalactic fighting competition. After over fifty years of no human contenders, Steve Armstrong emerges having trained all his life for a shot at the title, only to come up against a ruthless extra-terrestrial crime lord who wants him dead.','/1T4k7EsxqLm1UgjUUiOZjqXWdIg.jpg','1989-03-29',94,'Released','For a thousand years no human has been the champion. He wants to be the first.','Arena',44796,2.0892,5.3,'fHKnU-YkOE4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11154,_binary '\0','/ylz25u9OvVcUfWb8vVeZe4cn7zj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101371',6.2,3941,'en','Article 99','Dr. Richard Sturgess leads a team of compassionate doctors at a veteran\'s hospital. Along with Drs. Morgan, Handleman and Van Dorn, he fights to deliver adequate care to needy veterans in the face of funding cuts and a corrupt administration. To succeed, the staff may have to bend the rules and circumvent the villainous \"Article 99,\" a bureaucratic loophole that prevents veterans from receiving the benefits they deserve.','/vqgKO2qredWaXjwHg3GBDOzLErx.jpg','1992-03-13',100,'Released','When your hospital is a war zone, you have to fight to save lives.','Article 99',25269,2.5787,6.1,'erW3359qa_A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11155,_binary '\0','/be5Ech9euP9wtemqoDXDZ2I80ss.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101373',6.8,3758,'en','At Play in the Fields of the Lord','Martin and Hazel Quarrier are small-town fundamentalist missionaries sent to the jungles of South America to convert the Indians. Their remote mission was previously run by the Catholics, before the natives murdered them all. They are sent by the pompous Leslie Huben, who runs the missionary effort in the area but who seems more concerned about competing with his Catholic \'rivals\' than in the Indians themselves. Hazel is terrified of the Indians while Martin is fascinated. Soon American pilot Lewis Moon joins the Indian tribe but is attracted by Leslie\'s young wife, Andy. Can the interaction of these characters and cultures, and the advancing bulldozers of civilization, avoid disaster?','/mySgPPUOxKOHGzTtuVSfGegCBRg.jpg','1991-12-06',189,'Released','An adventure beyond the limits of civilization, faith and passion.','At Play in the Fields of the Lord',51515,2.0832,6.568,'xcJF-5MPHX4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11156,_binary '\0','/h31eRhdKxq7KqgfMU6vikBU7JAm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101376',6.6,2075,'fr','Atlantis','Atlantis is filmmaker Luc Besson\'s celebration of the beauty and wonder of the world beneath the sea, expanding upon themes touched on in his film The Big Blue. Combining stunning underwater cinematography and a hypnotic score by Eric Serra, Besson\'s singular vision defies dialogue or narrative structure to explore ocean life as you\'ve never seen it before. Following the colossal success of The Big Blue, Luc Besson crisscrossed the world\'s seas and oceans to film the beauty and diversity of marine life: from the giant octopuses of Vancouver to the manta rays of the Pacific (New Caledonia), and the grey sharks of Tahiti. A film with no actors or sets other than the underwater world. A breathtaking view of marine species: sharks, dolphins, manatees, octopuses. An exploration of the seabed in the Bahamas, the Galapagos, Vancouver, and Tahiti.','/Y9GVuu0tVPUWvcFufTkBLg2840.jpg','1991-08-21',74,'Released',NULL,'Atlantis',15466,2.7248,6.283,'ZYZFE_uwM2g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11157,_binary '\0','/bnwAfstkZ3KzJ75kM6o66r8rEzf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101393',6.7,94981,'en','Backdraft','Two feuding siblings carrying on a heroic family tradition as Chicago firefighters. But when a puzzling series of arson attacks is reported, they are forced to set aside their differences to solve the mystery surrounding these crimes.','/bymJtYNIdiAiBR1LRetaJXbfryc.jpg','1991-05-24',137,'Released','Silently behind a door, it waits. One breath of oxygen and it explodes in a deadly rage. In that instant it can create a hero...or cover a secret.','Backdraft',2924,8.5128,6.662,'DlXcUyFjNgA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11158,_binary '\0','/cW1XlxgvxZIFkakYc9yrLpDoYhK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101410',7.6,136523,'en','Barton Fink','A renowned New York playwright is enticed to California to write for the movies and discovers the hellish truth of Hollywood.','/oDkp5iClJ9WKJGtKHz8BydodHC3.jpg','1991-08-01',117,'Released','There\'s only one thing stranger than what\'s going on inside his head... What\'s going on outside.','Barton Fink',290,5.3772,7.5,'yglo5I1znpQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11159,_binary '\0','/mlrFQuAiEltbkiU4GuXWRaiJzkc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101412',4.2,3921,'en','Beastmaster 2: Through the Portal of Time','The Beastmaster Dar is forced to travel to earth to stop his evil brother from stealing an atomic bomb, and turning their native land from a desert into... well... a desert!','/3bIxjt2uyyeinjU23k115YPhXe1.jpg','1991-06-08',107,'Released','An awesome hero. An invincible villain. Time travel to a distant world. It\'s gonna be a wild weekend.','Beastmaster 2: Through the Portal of Time',27549,3.2419,4.7,'ceHcqZoO0AU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11160,_binary '\0','/fW4ZCoEZRBqLAJGFQ2g5AdAfPQR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101414',8,509651,'en','Beauty and the Beast','Follow the adventures of Belle, a bright young woman who finds herself in the castle of a prince who\'s been turned into a mysterious beast. With the help of the castle\'s enchanted staff, Belle soon learns the most important lesson of all -- that true beauty comes from within.','/hUJ0UvQ5tgE2Z9WpfuduVSdiCiU.jpg','1991-10-22',84,'Released','The most beautiful love story ever told.','Beauty and the Beast',10020,27.5679,7.723,'UUVpyeS_fVw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11161,_binary '\0','/GtblqNxBX0fUbLVNhempSYwCWe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101420',5.5,12919,'en','Begotten','Begotten is the creation myth brought to life, the story of no less than the violent death of God and the (re)birth of nature on a barren earth.','/tddYsHrlWBOcG3M333jQXQjU2vv.jpg','1991-06-05',72,'Released',NULL,'Begotten',1483,5.5287,6,'JVpksHJ8jQI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11162,_binary '\0','/bFXrPXV6GjWK5mQZYMncve0bisi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101428',7.5,10733,'fr','La Belle Noiseuse','The former famous painter Frenhofer lives quietly with his wife on a countryside residence in the French Provence. When the young artist Nicolas visits him with his girlfriend Marianne, Frenhofer decides to start again the work on a painting he long ago stopped: La Belle Noiseuse. And he wants Marianne as model.','/n6f7I9RUdoDa9AgM9X2oAc3pk4l.jpg','1991-09-04',238,'Released',NULL,'La Belle Noiseuse',12627,4.8048,7.3,'wtfsLeDXlpg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11163,_binary '\0','/n3FhxmJai1DZe0BJqACySfQXG12.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101435',7.2,2118,'en','Bernard and the Genie','Bernard Bottle, a mild mannered art buyer, is fired by his greedy boss, abandoned by his girlfriend and discovers a genie in an old bottle. The genie immediately embraces the modern world and helps Bernard on the side.','/fEHObAiSDCjg8eZdlZfK8IuHJF2.jpg','1991-11-23',70,'Released',NULL,'Bernard and the Genie',24046,1.863,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11164,_binary '\0','/dq10OfEaeTg2FXkClEV6SuerK5T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101437',6.3,2859,'hi','Beta','Beta is the story of Raju, the only child of a widowed multi millionaire. Raju\'s father can provide him anything he wants but Raju\'s only desire is to get mother\'s love, in order to please Raju, his father gets married to Nagmani, thinking that she will take care of Raju more than his real mother would. Raju becomes completely devoted to his stepmother, doing whatever she wishes. Time passes by, Raju grows up and gets married to Saraswati. Saraswati discovers that Nagmani\'s motherly love for Raju is fake and all what Nagmani is interested in, is capturing Raju\'s wealth.','/1RUOf9MCf8PsKxrefcwFqb0JCKL.jpg','1992-04-03',155,'Released',NULL,'Beta',107747,0.8936,5.929,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11165,_binary '\0','/aNZvGlgGitPj1htNCBZ5M990jq3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101444',6.3,2399,'en','Big Girls Don\'t Cry... They Get Even','A girl fed up with her quirky, dysfunctional family runs away from home, causing all of them to spend time with each other.','/gWG6PMlu1jTst0HPokQ1FjskxLg.jpg','1992-05-08',96,'Released','What’s a teenage girl to do with a crazy new stepfamily?','Big Girls Don\'t Cry... They Get Even',46972,2.6048,6.1,'6Wp2kFAQE2w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11166,_binary '\0','/4PMSgLOzPFgyzARQBhhX4vS9oOW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101452',6.3,85708,'en','Bill & Ted\'s Bogus Journey','Amiable slackers Bill and Ted are once again roped into a fantastical adventure when De Nomolos, a villain from the future, sends evil robot duplicates of the two lads to terminate and replace them. The robot doubles actually succeed in killing Bill and Ted, but the two are determined to escape the afterlife, challenging the Grim Reaper to a series of games in order to return to the land of the living.','/tldtDfLnPFOtTWp758EmIP2Hbz5.jpg','1991-07-19',93,'Released','Once... they made history. Now... they are history.','Bill & Ted\'s Bogus Journey',1649,5.8838,6.3,'2KQsgx7A1F8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11167,_binary '\0','/dDetOS2oUNIIoEZHgpXjUaMBE5Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101453',5.9,13661,'en','Billy Bathgate','In the year 1935, a teen named Billy Bathgate finds first love while becoming the protégé of fledgling gangster Dutch Schultz.','/zDC0bY6IvGIf1SrDipLZJxR0Z2d.jpg','1991-11-01',106,'Released','In 1935, a New York kid was looking for a hero. He found Dutch Schultz.','Billy Bathgate',12647,4.9499,5.8,'3BSOLW7gDRk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11168,_binary '\0','/3dbysGhZ5tpzL8vXnVoLqVQxdZS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101455',5.1,3372,'en','Bingo','A dog named Bingo escapes a circus and befriends a young boy named Chuckie. When Chuckie’s family moves away and leaves Bingo behind, the brave canine sets off on a perilous cross-country trek to reunite with his friend, overcoming countless obstacles—including dangerous criminals and his own fear of fire.','/giooyb8azHrgbwqWUWCn7QhIBBS.jpg','1991-08-09',90,'Released','More hip than humanly possible!','Bingo',16790,2.5761,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11169,_binary '\0','/wF08MKJWgBIJqmTQXSWwXbQe0OU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101458',6.8,12762,'de','Bis ans Ende der Welt','In 1999, a woman\'s life is forever changed after she survives a car crash with two bank robbers, who enlist her help to take the money to a drop in Paris. On the way, she runs into another fugitive from the law — an American doctor on the run from the CIA. They want to confiscate his father\'s invention – a device which allows anyone to record their dreams and visions.','/sDpYWgYkBlrVnpySXQNsxVvDAAG.jpg','1991-09-12',158,'Released','. . . the ultimate road movie','Until the End of the World',10341,4.4426,6.7,'7BCqJpMThEw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11170,_binary '\0','/7Gm9NXq1Ydje7uyx9Ogr1FxFkIa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101465',7.1,8382,'en','Black Robe','Missionary Father LaForgue travels to the New World in hopes of converting Algonquin Indians to Catholicism. Accepted, though warily, by the Indians, LaForgue travels with the Indians using his strict Catholic rules and ideals to try and impose his religion.','/kaogaZD8WkwfRJnr7zvktiY5E2p.jpg','1991-10-04',101,'Released','In the winter of 1634, an extraordinary man began a perilous journey into the North American wilderness.','Black Robe',41784,2.6436,6.5,'a6MxdjqPfM8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11171,_binary '\0','/lqSjo0x0WUNIkL0wDMZI9AjOasU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101492',5.7,5646,'en','Body Parts','A criminal psychologist loses his arm in a car crash, and becomes one of three patients to have their missing limbs replaced by those belonging to an executed serial killer. One of them dies violently, and disturbing occurrences start happening to the surviving two.','/8hFSFiLMy0wnyVaaJ4EHFlPD1yf.jpg','1991-08-02',88,'Released','Where does evil live, the heart, the mind or the flesh?','Body Parts',32146,3.117,5.9,'3iuSPLth6PY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11172,_binary '\0','/wd3LaNaPuwONQ0LjRLDDqOKoG47.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101497',5.6,2257,'en','The Boneyard','Children turned into zombies wreak havoc in a coroner\'s building with just a burned-out psychic, an experienced cop and two coroners to stop the madness.','/3WlAP1kenMpYFjlushv17kJGpGL.jpg','1991-06-12',98,'Released','Dare to Enter, Try to Leave...','The Boneyard',58864,1.6093,5.7,'tKQdMnI2WhU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11173,_binary '\0','/3u0HSjHq7G8bNcUmbyK8Q9Vwogt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101502',5.3,2447,'en','The Borrower','Aliens punish one of their own by sending him to earth. The alien is very violent, and when the body he occupies is damaged, he is forced to find another.','/h9dvb82gcM3EriHb50MXYnygFfe.jpg','1991-08-16',90,'Released',NULL,'The Borrower',40221,2.9212,5,'X0PJQtbDEjw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11174,_binary '\0','/ojzo9tMl8ZLrQgdGApZJFLuS331.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101507',7.8,170622,'en','Boyz n the Hood','Three friends growing up in South Central Los Angeles navigate a neighborhood plagued by violence, unemployment, and crime, each responding differently to the harsh realities of street life. As tragedy strikes close to home, their friendship, choices, and hopes for a better future are put to the ultimate test.','/kaS8BkTZESnkoB5i1zRQ02FIRGk.jpg','1991-07-12',112,'Released','Once upon a time in South Central L.A. ... It ain\'t no fairy tale.','Boyz n the Hood',650,11.6049,7.641,'ZI-qlj-4cpk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11175,_binary '\0','/t353Hj5sFXWQFriVzB1GiT3TSlm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101516',6.8,34039,'en','Bugsy','New York gangster Ben \'Bugsy\' Siegel takes a brief business trip to Los Angeles. A sharp-dressing womanizer with a foul temper, Siegel doesn\'t hesitate to kill or maim anyone crossing him. In L.A. the life, the movies, and most of all strong-willed Virginia Hill detain him while his family wait back home. Then a trip to a run-down gambling joint at a spot in the desert known as Las Vegas gives him his big idea.','/hSGncpMByW8zx2aOSXdZB0e70yA.jpg','1991-12-10',136,'Released','Glamour was the disguise.','Bugsy',10337,4.1441,6.3,'btj7FNzT2j8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11176,_binary '\0','/zYehTPDDLnHcxxrJVvUUSBvsdr2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101518',4.5,1692,'en','Bullseye!','Spies force two British con men to pose as look-alike scientists peddling cheap-energy fusion.','/7ihf9zzomI0qLi2fw6ntt3NSG1d.jpg','1990-11-02',95,'Released','On target... and totally off the wall!','Bullseye!',60577,1.7647,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11177,_binary '\0','/gRJ9kS0PMBaU7O8xmJuKwZsmAoV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101523',5.4,8129,'en','The Butcher\'s Wife','A clairvoyant woman thinks that she\'s met her future husband because she\'s seen him in a dream. They marry and he takes her back to his butcher shop in New York city, where her powers tend to influence everyone she meets while working in the shop. Through her advice, she helps others and eventually finds the true man of her dreams.','/oKwvnb2bypMyXD2UraWdXxUoqLY.jpg','1991-10-25',107,'Released','She\'s a psychic who\'s turning New Yorkers into lovers. Obviously, she\'s from out of town.','The Butcher\'s Wife',20096,4.6263,5.677,'hRAYMV8b52I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11178,_binary '\0','/3S074DrRQg8yC4p1p23O1if3XzW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101524',6.4,1883,'en','By the Sword','An elderly man named Max comes to the famous fencing coach Villar and asks to take him on as a coach. But the coach does not like his weapon technique, and he only takes Max as a cleaner.','/rYn9yLa4zh3BSNZkBdwWuGPJir2.jpg','1991-10-07',91,'Released','They come from everywhere to challenge their fate...','By the Sword',42570,1.9491,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11179,_binary '\0','/zhwJ7H82DyXV26kvE7YAYJ3r6pN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101526',7.2,1706,'is','Börn náttúrunnar','An elderly couple leave their retirement home to make one last journey back to their home in the Western Fjords.','/inDXi1BUndnvu1KjY5O0pGpUGvO.jpg','1991-08-01',85,'Released','Sometimes a first love becomes a last love','Children of Nature',26880,1.2603,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11180,_binary '\0','/jioytlcdQfIWxrxZK8znJ0HqX25.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101529',6.9,1293,'es','Cabeza de Vaca','In 1528, a Spanish expedition flounders off the coast of Florida with 600 lives lost. One survivor, Alvar Nunez Cabeza de Vaca, roams across the American continent searching for his Spanish comrades. Instead, he discovers the Iguase, an ancient Indian tribe. Over the next eight years, Cabeza de Vaca learns their mystical and mysterious culture, becoming a healer and a leader. But soon this New World collides with the Old World as Spanish conquistadors seek to enslave the Indians, and Cabeza de Vaca must confront his own people and his past.','/x8X3HtTRSoUdj6gEVQLadM5Wqvg.jpg','1991-10-11',111,'Released',NULL,'Cabeza de Vaca',41785,1.7375,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11181,_binary '\0','/x4v9o31butQaqTvOeeMFYidRptS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101531',6.5,6931,'en','Cadence','As punishment for drunken, rebellious behavior, a young white soldier is thrown into a stockade populated entirely by black inmates. But instead of falling victim to racial hatred, the soldier joins forces with his fellow prisoners and rises up against the insanely tyrannical and bigoted prison warden.','/aPzyKG7eqjtmnKxrFcoJ8v7Ro5b.jpg','1990-11-16',97,'Released','Sometimes you\'ve got to stand out to fit in.','Cadence',28553,2.2165,6.7,'q1R90m3gW54','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11182,_binary '\0','/ntgpger7OwFNlEldxuvvFHDKzjW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101540',7.3,250042,'en','Cape Fear','Sam Bowden is a small-town corporate attorney. Max Cady is a tattooed, cigar-smoking, Bible-quoting, psychotic rapist. What do they have in common? 14 years ago, Sam was a public defender assigned to Max Cady\'s rape trial, and he made a serious error: he hid a document from his illiterate client that could have gotten him acquitted. Now, the cagey Cady has been released, and he intends to teach Sam Bowden and his family a thing or two about loss.','/meJZAAuVcjic2ipvbOPz5UlE4P9.jpg','1991-11-13',128,'Released','Sam Bowden has always provided for his family\'s future. But the past is coming back to haunt them.','Cape Fear',1598,10.3481,7.3,'mPsOIhZJug4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11183,_binary '\0','/y9UU2JNjoFPI7ZvCuiWzpN9GJHZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101545',5.9,21481,'en','Career Opportunities','After falling asleep in a Target dressing room, an unhappy heiress wakes up locked inside the store overnight with a local slacker and notorious liar, leading the two unlikely companions to bond over their shared desire to escape their lives.','/xi0fBIBDZQqJ8U0hUvwhpxFd4jM.jpg','1991-03-29',83,'Released','He took the job that no one wanted... and got the girl that everyone did.','Career Opportunities',16270,7.6348,6.863,'WW9BFI1ii40','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11184,_binary '\0','/2dkxyWdrclt4QGZ7sCdgtaQdWpG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101550',6.3,6070,'en','Cast a Deadly Spell','In a fantastical 1940s where magic is used by everyone, a hard-boiled detective investigates the theft of a mystical tome.','/aLGaVrMBga6TyLYSGfSnPB3WkN5.jpg','1991-09-07',96,'Released','Bullets! Demons! The end of the world! Can’t hold a man like this!','Cast a Deadly Spell',52660,3.421,6.081,'7jK3q1fNLeA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11185,_binary '\0','/wE2koUdIZPVQERB3GqrUEdplV6s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101561',6.9,1493,'en','Chameleon Street','William Douglas Street is bored with his life. Working for his father is getting to him, his wife wants more money, and he\'s had enough. His solution is to re-invent himself. He becomes a chameleon, taking on whatever role suits the situation. From reporter to doctor to lawyer, he impersonates anyone he feels a need to be and he can earn money being.','/b6Ljg2yvb9Yht3L41SADgVLi1TZ.jpg','1991-04-24',94,'Released','I Think, Therefore I Scam.','Chameleon Street',102831,1.1203,6.7,'ad1KSsGhRa8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11186,_binary '\0','/6aavXoygR0nZP4kIKQLdaXLO3z0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101587',6.8,67986,'en','City Slickers','Three New York businessmen decide to take a \"Wild West\" vacation that turns out not to be the relaxing vacation they had envisioned.','/9DVZpm9pQNB3M17cRo752zqUYhL.jpg','1991-06-07',114,'Released','Yesterday they were businessmen. Today they\'re cowboys. Tomorrow they\'ll be walking funny.','City Slickers',1406,6.7658,6.5,'o4k7AK6oK9U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11187,_binary '\0','/4R41EloaBaYWWK32qWZtLqizjLk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101588',7.3,2963,'en','City of Hope','This gritty inner-city film follows various people living in a troubled New Jersey setting, most notably Nick Rinaldi, a disillusioned contractor who has been helped along his whole life by his wealthy father. Other characters in this ensemble drama about urban conflict and corruption include Asteroid, an unstable homeless person, and Wynn, an idealistic young politician.','/cPCahQHDhAOAaw2mU4L5Hfpq6OF.jpg','1991-10-11',129,'Released','Welcome to the American city. You buy your way in and you fight your way out. Who says it\'s a free country?','City of Hope',1772,2.1062,6.7,'Dp8ypzCa2Q4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11188,_binary '\0','/zwOsUoCfISumZvAiSbJ03efxxjz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101590',6.4,9029,'en','Class Action','A liberal activist lawyer alienated his daughter Maggie years ago when she discovered his many affairs. Now a conservative corporate lawyer, Maggie agrees to go up against her father in court. To gain promotion, she must defend an auto manufacturer against charges that their explosion-prone station wagons are unsafe. As her mother begs for peace, Maggie takes on her dad in a trial that turns increasingly personal and nasty.','/9BOsvZL2DuE2JFGYOssynTjs8K6.jpg','1991-03-15',105,'Released','A father and a daughter, divided by a case, endangered by the truth.','Class Action',15771,3.4084,6.3,'vkmMWLwvXzw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11189,_binary '\0','/202dlr5rXx0St5flL9SS4N4rhwZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101591',4.5,2812,'en','Class of Nuke \'Em High 2: Subhumanoid Meltdown','At the Tromaville Institute of Technology\'s nuclear plant, Prof. Holt has perfected \"subhumanoids\": living beings without emotions who perform menial tasks. When school reporter Roger Smith meets a beautiful subhumanoid named Victoria, they fall in love and he becomes determined to save her and the school from a giant mutant squirrel, Tromie.','/bYbLg6xgdPQqKDCXfc0dlJVwkRZ.jpg','1991-03-29',95,'Released','Student Power Meets Nuclear Power!','Class of Nuke \'Em High 2: Subhumanoid Meltdown',26230,1.84,4.623,'P4qn5VEteyU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11190,_binary '\0','/zQe8zFX9g6fqOtJkVPkS84ijSto.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101592',6.9,2099,'en','Clearcut','A white lawyer finds his values shaken when he is paired with an angry Indigenous activist who insists on kidnapping the head of a logging company to teach him the price of his destruction.','/6r1PkbA2EdOGNaGxNJIZKbk2GQi.jpg','1991-09-10',98,'Released','The violence has begun.','Clearcut',116494,1.3389,6.9,'rb9QHMnI__s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11191,_binary '\0','/smpifJr0V8SsSa9FblO4TkC4lJD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101595',6.2,3987,'en','Close My Eyes','After some years of tension, Richard begins a sexual relationship with his sister Natalie. Now married, the relationship proves dangerously obsessional.','/HVMvJ3TzjbNOqlOILZWPkfZXt0.jpg','1991-11-22',109,'Released','There are some relationships so taboo they\'re irresistible.','Close My Eyes',53896,2.6634,5.8,'JoT3VwlQdXE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11192,_binary '\0','/mBwWJgiF8kCNSjCdFY3aWl3SZA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101597',7,3292,'en','Closet Land','A young writer is interrogated by a sadistic secret policeman. She is accused of embedding political messages in her children\'s stories. The entire movie takes place in one room, with only the two actors. The movie is set in an unidentified, modern police state.','/enPJOFxKkvEoW0nX8r5dchOAdSs.jpg','1991-03-06',94,'Released','No one can hurt you in your imagination.','Closet Land',58648,1.7119,6.691,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11193,_binary '\0','/bQHHEFYBZc23nhbo0z0qB7nxW31.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101605',7.6,43763,'en','The Commitments','Jimmy Rabbitte, just a thick-ya out of school, gets a brilliant idea: to put a soul band together in Barrytown, his slum home in north Dublin. First he needs musicians and singers: things slowly start to click when he finds three fine-voiced females virtually in his back yard, a lead singer (Deco) at a wedding, and, responding to his ad, an aging trumpet player, Joey \"The Lips\" Fagan.','/iccBDq9aS1gwi6b8aJjBgPU4t2D.jpg','1991-08-14',118,'Released','They had nothing to lose, they risked it all.','The Commitments',11663,4.9145,7.254,'PG3uEHpUflA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11194,_binary '\0','/yVm5jUCGeECsVh719kW6or9C2ee.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101606',5.7,3942,'en','Company Business','An aging agent is called back by \"the Company\" to run a hostage trade of a Soviet spy for an American agent.','/vwWexi2O70Efr4MkckbxjeIgchb.jpg','1991-09-06',98,'Released','You can\'t judge a man by the company that keeps him!','Company Business',32074,2.3303,5.3,'g1k6hspZz10','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11195,_binary '\0','/3esJNqyYhDA6Hc06FaMQurirG7N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101609',7.2,2531,'en','Conagher','Mrs. Evie Teale is struggling to stay alive while raising her two children alone on a remote homestead. Conn Conagher is an honest, hardworking cowboy. Their lives are intertwined as they fight the elements, indians, outlaws, and loneliness.','/8Ur2JSDhldj5hnbNrNkIAD9Jcyk.jpg','1991-07-01',117,'Released','None tougher. None faster. None deadlier.','Conagher',37307,2.6805,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11196,_binary '\0','/omIwEChfCzIfN4g6mIYaknKIB5s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101615',3,10884,'en','Cool as Ice','Freewheeling, motorcycle-riding musician Johnny rolls into a small town with his band, and meets Kathy, an honor student who catches his eye. Meanwhile, Kathy\'s father, after being in the Witness Protection Program, is finally tracked down by two corrupt cops he escaped from years ago, who want the money he owes them.','/fO0YbAJiMPFMquixdZgbC98I3MP.jpg','1991-10-18',91,'Released','When a girl has a heart of stone, there\'s only one way to melt it. Just add Ice.','Cool as Ice',1496,4.1523,5.11,'3LMnFmAGTCs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11197,_binary '\0','/1atGn0u8OJAuWOxTO1gX5oIBxMM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101616',6.6,6383,'hi','Coolie No. 1','Raju is a poor coolie who falls in love with a rich girl. He pretends to be rich and tells one big lie after another to marry her.','/pxdbdWA6EQb15YIEhRVt5iIdStA.jpg','1995-06-30',143,'Released',NULL,'Coolie No. 1',63345,1.2818,6.083,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11198,_binary '\0','/8jzKxUSKvT31tVphKfD9ylFLfid.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101625',5.8,6480,'en','Once Upon a Crime','On their way to Monte Carlo, Monaco, Marilyn and her husband, Neil, meet several other married couples, including Julian and Phoebe, who are traveling with a lost dog they plan to return to its wealthy owner for a large reward. But, when the dog\'s mistress is murdered, the travelers become the prime suspects, and Inspector Bonnard is determined to track them all down.','/13zU7il6WMJ0QlXTMokJyBYSsYE.jpg','1992-03-06',94,'Released','Monte Carlo can be hard on tourists. This weekend it\'s murder!','Once Upon a Crime',27465,4.3076,5.7,'WTQ9FZiHnhw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11199,_binary '\0','/mCK4c04c4D4c80qZJXuDaIMiQtl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101627',4.5,14576,'en','Critters 3','As fanged, furious furballs viciously invade an L.A. apartment building and sink their teeth into the low-rent tenants, Josh leads the battle to beat back the conniving critters and save the planet.','/frjklbq23pRgBjhekEq6drQkrZm.jpg','1991-12-11',86,'Released','First they destroyed a farm. Then they terrorized a town. Now they\'re ready to do some REAL damage!','Critters 3',12702,4.9048,5.3,'Z3sz13TVNw0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11200,_binary '\0','/7Lzqpkdwmhmok2WGxmNWgBp82s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101628',4.1,9279,'en','Critters 4','A super strain of genetically engineered mutants are designed to take over the universe, hungry to conquer the galaxy, with an appetite for mankind.','/k1Xio02tnxgyFA9PnlP2OSCIK2C.jpg','1992-08-20',87,'Released','In space, they love to hear you scream!','Critters 4',12525,3.9383,5.035,'Ic3pHEu9FV4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11201,_binary '\0','/hhuDtyJrRl2vThjNyGdUi6RbdqL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101629',5.9,1298,'en','Crooked Hearts','An upper-middle class family in Washington state deals with failures, infidelities and troubling secrets. Charley is 26 and still lives at home, despite his simmering anger at his father, Edward. Charley\'s younger brother, Tom, just dropped out of college and returned home to live. Tom\'s unstable new girlfriend, Marriet, has designs on joining the family, but she\'s hardly a calming influence on the crumbling home.','/8ujU8WGPsOIMNkFFkxKC2fPTeuv.jpg','1991-09-06',113,'Released',NULL,'Crooked Hearts',93002,1.5432,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11202,_binary '\0','/xVUdQA5KNUUV61cySRfI1jcZZWg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101632',7.7,1387,'hu','Csapd le csacsi!','The story happens in 1989 in the suburbs of Budapest, where the neighbor maintains an underground worker\'s guard training base, while the youngsters fall victim to a mistakenly posted letter.','/gDD2IjujcnsvQasouRftrW5xnld.jpg','1992-02-21',80,'Released',NULL,'Slap-Jack',41055,0.7724,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11203,_binary '\0','/b7nNVBVKjuuvyoxj7WFvddI1ML3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101635',5.9,25149,'en','Curly Sue','Bill is a penniless drifter who scams strangers out of just enough money to feed himself and his partner in crime, an orphan girl known as Curly Sue. Bill and Curly Sue target Grey, a yuppie lawyer, but their con takes an unexpected turn when the successful woman begins to like the ramshackle duo. But there\'s one problem—Grey\'s jealous, conniving boyfriend, Walker.','/cndkzlP5frVWxng5HLd4JvA2g2y.jpg','1991-10-25',102,'Released','A funny story about a family... And the little girl who started it.','Curly Sue',11894,4.8018,6.4,'Th_YcHGAkwk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11204,_binary '\0','/9UCHfC9tYojD4mMVBm0boyzYEQq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101640',8.1,38472,'zh','大红灯笼高高挂','In 1920s China, 19-year-old Songlian becomes a concubine of a powerful lord and is forced to compete with his three wives for the privileges gained.','/j6MGZpg55cTqlHHwahBtzI2qQg1.jpg','1991-12-18',125,'Released','China, 1920. One master, four wives.','Raise the Red Lantern',10404,4.9617,7.914,'tLYJzEtmavg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11205,_binary '\0','/zmr611Q4JGZEDKvsT8tfuDLB4nG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101649',8.5,16206,'ta','தளபதி','Surya, a courageous man who was raised in the slums, fights for the rights of the poor and befriends Deva, who hires him as his commander and changes his life completely.','/dpF1Ck1UvpW0ItT1EoX0xNYEhS8.jpg','1991-11-05',157,'Released',NULL,'Thalapathi',29811,1.5111,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11206,_binary '\0','/qAqFfB9J4QY6yxjfl7SiX7FXBwV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101660',5.7,2798,'en','The Dark Backward','A man pursues stand-up comedy encouraged by his fellow garbage man. Though his friend, who accompanies him on accordion, continues to tell him how great he is, he actually stinks. When the \"comedian\" grows a third arm out of his back, the friend uses this twist to get him signed up with a sleazy talent agent, and it begins to look like his career is on the move, even though his girlfriend has left him.','/18jN1J9lwGeKFTVzfz2DJ9gGmky.jpg','1991-07-26',101,'Released','It\'s the world inside out.','The Dark Backward',69342,2.1003,5.7,'sE-c7CV8PDU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11207,_binary '\0','/guKFCL7DcAKP8IKWcZfm00CNBBB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101669',6.8,33064,'en','Dead Again','In 1949, composer Roman Strauss is executed for the murder of his wife. In 1990s Los Angeles, a detective comes across a mute amnesiac woman who is somehow linked to the Strauss murder.','/irEnDVtxox6gnRJuwtEZuxvl2vZ.jpg','1991-08-23',107,'Released','How many times can you die for love?','Dead Again',11498,5.1441,6.436,'kq5M5tC7H0Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11208,_binary '\0','/ms2LdaUyctsmX2DSoLAuIHYNCIR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101670',5.1,1314,'en','The Dead Come Home','A group of friends decide to renovate an old house located in the middle of nowhere, in the hope of turning it into their crash pad, but shortly after arriving, a strange and seemingly senile old woman is found to be lurking around the premises.','/tHnVLQLYBhV1dj0OEBZpWaC5FX.jpg','1989-10-27',94,'Released','Where Trespassing is a Matter of Life or Death!','The Dead Come Home',69869,1.4487,4.9,'YnNe38900U4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11209,_binary '\0','/5zObpuvgSbt08v3ZX0mMCb8Iy4O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101675',3.6,1937,'en','Dead Space','On the planet Phaebon, a controlled research facility had been thought to be safe... until a breach unleashes alien terrors unknown.','/v0zd6iubTjBuf8X5UAHeYHwJzD.jpg','1991-10-21',72,'Released','In the coldness of space — even hell freezes over.','Dead Space',48291,2.8415,3.89,'UPIKUlcodsQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11210,_binary '\0','/6EFRyskOTlAvmVsZqDzU0QDdig9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101692',6.4,2008,'en','Death in Brunswick','A reserved man in need of a job, Carl Fitzgerald finds employment at a Greek restaurant. Upon meeting waitress Sophie, Carl begins dating the attractive woman. Though it seems things are improving for Carl, an unexpected situation leads to the death of Mustafa, a shady coworker, and Carl must figure out how to cover up the incident. Unsure of what to do, Carl enlists the help of his buddy, Dave, to get rid of Mustafa\'s corpse.','/brdFxKGP3dhABbZzadsApsfs0Rj.jpg','1991-04-24',109,'Released','Carl Fitzgerald has decided to clean up his act... but first he has to get rid of the body.','Death in Brunswick',37820,1.5965,6.1,'FwQfpaXNR8Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11211,_binary '\0','/tkXEGcyXEzuFGSPnHT56Fsebuxs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101694',6.2,8826,'en','Deceived','The murder of a museum curator places art dealer Jack Saunders under suspicion for selling forged treasures to museums. When Jack suddenly dies in a car crash, his wife Adrienne tries to discover what he did on her own. She finds that she knew little about the man she was married to. The more she learns about her husband\'s possible illegal activities and double life, the more she places her daughter, and herself, in grave danger.','/j18E6rNmvPf6ALnWHrvn9IBvI7H.jpg','1991-09-27',104,'Released','She Thought She Had The Perfect Life. But She Was Dead Wrong.','Deceived',28455,3.0459,5.824,'YjRVKP1pGPM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11212,_binary '\0','/9BQtqeJGKnSGdn6UF2SxhShUTgy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101698',7.2,23881,'en','Defending Your Life','Is there love after death? After he dies suddenly, the hapless advertising executive Daniel Miller finds himself in Judgment City, a gleaming way station where the newly deceased must prove they lived a life of sufficient courage to advance in their journey through the universe. As the self-doubting Daniel struggles to make his case, a budding relationship with the uninhibited Julia offers him a chance to finally feel alive.','/flXJ4AnKYq8DH1f1TmQ4QrqSwsB.jpg','1991-03-22',111,'Released','The first true story of what happens after you die.','Defending Your Life',12186,4.1227,6.9,'YEWQqxZF9n0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11213,_binary '\0','/A3qvUUd36LUF5sfPYOHEd3ahDp2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101700',7.5,94885,'fr','Delicatessen','In a post-apocalyptic world, the residents of an apartment above the butcher shop receive an occasional delicacy of meat, something that is in low supply. A young man new in town falls in love with the butcher\'s daughter, which causes conflicts in her family, who need the young man for other business-related purposes.','/gNtOgQHxE5B8e08zuNRAdDpmK5Z.jpg','1991-04-17',99,'Released','A futuristic comic feast.','Delicatessen',892,5.7762,7.3,'GVL5_I4CvTc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11214,_binary '\0','/9xC3iKX8URURYMWZrDQKmYKTzO4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101701',5.8,11001,'en','Delirious','A soap opera writer gets hit on the head and wakes up as a character in his own show.','/Irafvzuw1lkJfBrsPv7ahYOPq9.jpg','1991-08-09',96,'Released','A comedy about a soap opera writer who\'s typing without a ribbon.','Delirious',28117,2.2138,5.705,'ffZdSTJ7Xy4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11215,_binary '\0','/ro2MhbNxhijplYSkgeN5RU1zoUY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101725',5.2,2496,'en','Diary of a Hitman','A veteran hitman, Dekker is ready to call it quits and leave the profession. His final job, however, proves to be trickier than expected when a sadistic man recruits the assassin to kill his wife, Jain, and their baby, but he can’t bring himself to do the job, complicating all of their lives.','/rF4Qz69ConQqoedsAtiv38O7UX0.jpg','1991-11-20',90,'Released','Nothing personal. Just business.','Diary of a Hitman',50185,3.5695,5.4,'eR1hth_V8Yc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11216,_binary '\0','/3znBFtDFd8D9WDeJ8Drrcfrvy28.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101732',4.9,2034,'hi','दिल आशना है','A cabaret dancer who was raised in a brothel sets out to find her biological mother.','/zKCbrXhRqBYpbw7H6JtqMbVqSBK.jpg','1992-10-23',164,'Released','The Heart Knows the Truth','Dil Aashna Hai',141166,1.6608,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11217,_binary '\0','/587yOAuB2hz4sMC5QSlKoggTdxG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101733',7.2,5049,'hi','दिल है कि मानता नहीं','Runaway heiress in search of her beloved falls in love with another man on the way.','/8fFgE7DnHbQZ2t0W6doLxQxYiuH.jpg','1991-07-12',154,'Released',NULL,'Dil Hai Ke Manta Nahin',137439,1.4397,6.893,'v2MVIPm6e_U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11218,_binary '\0','/9Vp4761sywoBOdHOjGN1a6pFk61.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101745',6.3,43212,'en','Doc Hollywood','After leaving Washington D.C. hospital, plastic surgeon Ben Stone heads for California, where a lucrative practice in Beverly Hills awaits. After a car accident, he\'s sentenced to perform as the community\'s general practitioner.','/36yGVgFWg7PvDdZ10Csg1uHpcZd.jpg','1991-08-02',104,'Released','He was headed for Beverly Hills to be a plastic surgeon... but he took an exit to a town that didn\'t take plastic.','Doc Hollywood',11821,5.8259,6.364,'STvC6FXu1-M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11219,_binary '\0','/gQe6gGBozQ5Gj8GUUD6UFhDBDL6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101746',7,6284,'en','The Doctor','Jack McKee is a doctor with it all: he\'s successful, he\'s rich, and he has no problems.... until he is diagnosed with throat cancer. Now that he has seen medicine, hospitals, and doctors from a patient\'s perspective, he realises that there is more to being a doctor than surgery and prescriptions.','/rExMpi701EIvEGu49FlOS8I0Kag.jpg','1991-07-24',122,'Released','An Uplifting Story About Finding New Meaning In Life.','The Doctor',26142,3.6032,6.5,'OIPv-pjABbk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11220,_binary '\0','/hPYr9jAw0dAOz6KAgtPAEEuZLmt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101748',7.3,11444,'en','Dogfight','In the fall of 1963, Eddie Birdlace is an 18-year-old Marine Corps volunteer who is about to ship out with three of his buddies for a tour of duty in Vietnam. Planning a massive blowout for their last night in San Francisco, Eddie, his buddies, and a number of other Marines set up a contest they call a \"dogfight”.','/1sEJy723hW629jzzX8H5k5MTVMq.jpg','1991-10-04',94,'Released','The rules of the dogfight were simple. Everyone puts in fifty bucks. The guy with the ugliest \"date\" wins.','Dogfight',14667,2.774,6.9,'uuN8aKCCbJA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11221,_binary '\0','/bF4YrmQKdA3v5CNZq8pc0CIqver.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101757',6.4,40825,'en','Don\'t Tell Mom the Babysitter\'s Dead','Sue Ellen Crandell is a teenager eagerly awaiting her mother\'s summer-long absence. While the babysitter looks after her rambunctious younger siblings, Sue Ellen can party and have fun. But then the babysitter abruptly dies, leaving the Crandells short on cash. Sue Ellen finds a sweet job in fashion by lying about her age and experience on her résumé. But, while her siblings run wild, she discovers the downside of adulthood','/wIYhjykSq0yumZWBisKlAa83bUe.jpg','1991-06-07',105,'Released','No rules. No curfews. No baths. No nagging. No pulse.','Don\'t Tell Mom the Babysitter\'s Dead',15413,4.8803,6.2,'VDR9rilzaDU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11222,_binary '\0','/p4XrrXZqxeqXKH7zBeP6wRkDbhc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101761',7.2,108098,'en','The Doors','The story of the famous and influential 1960s rock band and its lead singer and composer, Jim Morrison.','/x1LM3dzGuG6xOz0aT2e71o11vhu.jpg','1991-03-01',140,'Released','The ceremony is about to begin.','The Doors',10537,7.9656,7.1,'qJu9nfVCQmk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11223,_binary '\0','/7p6q2TvF8T39z7CACZ6Dc1aIxih.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101763',6.8,4107,'cn','賭俠','Sing finds Michael \"Dagger\" Chan in order to become Ko Chun\'s next disciple, but the two must put aside their differences when they discover that a gang boss is bent on ruining the God of Gamblers\' name.','/fxMnoMI8whHqz2nziR5E0ovefD0.jpg','1990-12-13',104,'Released',NULL,'God of Gamblers II',57663,4.0082,6.9,'Fs1TbRCHBs4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11224,_binary '\0','/iI0n28l5vn3K1GdXHVoA54kRemv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101764',5.7,48210,'en','Double Impact','Jean Claude Van Damme plays a dual role as Alex and Chad, twins separated at the death of their parents. Chad is raised by a family retainer in Paris, Alex becomes a petty crook in Hong Kong. Seeing a picture of Alex, Chad rejoins him and convinces him that his rival in Hong Kong is also the man who killed their parents. Alex is suspicious of Chad, especially when it comes to his girlfriend.','/tmzwvSqoMC37Tgqwj4mA2dHNSmw.jpg','1991-07-31',110,'Released','One packs a punch. One packs a piece. Together they deliver...','Double Impact',9594,9.8634,6.2,'txTgynA3iFo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11225,_binary '\0','/vjsFyeCf5W5rxCFpS9MIAEZJkIG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101765',7.6,57637,'fr','La Double Vie de Véronique','Véronique is a beautiful young French woman who aspires to be a renowned singer; Weronika lives in Poland, has a similar career goal and looks identical to Véronique, though the two are not related. The film follows both women as they contend with the ups and downs of their individual lives, with Véronique embarking on an unusual romance with Alexandre Fabbri, a puppeteer who may be able to help her with her existential issues.','/oqRyO9xrNBRaxqF9pCHHgLuaATx.jpg','1991-05-15',98,'Released','Each of us is matched somewhere in the world, by our exact double - someone who shares our thoughts and dreams.','The Double Life of Véronique',1600,4.7707,7.5,'_baGBH7_G4U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11226,_binary '\0','/9iUOv2jTlL8neUhyLaIfJyfibJp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101772',7,2445,'da','Drengene fra Sankt Petri','A group of school-mates form a resistance group in nazi-occupied Denmark.','/nl17JQNO7lMEqS7pFAZLIyCFaog.jpg','1991-10-11',111,'Released',NULL,'The Boys from St. Petri',38586,1.7901,6.5,'_ujJ1i_zPCE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11227,_binary '\0','/h8EZTu4ZqzTsXWo7N14t8qEj3gN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101775',6,34144,'en','Drop Dead Fred','An unhappy housewife gets a lift from the return of her imaginary childhood friend, Drop Dead Fred.','/v2kadCRcRdq8a0aRbQg4yVk3Xmd.jpg','1991-04-19',99,'Released','Dishes. Relationships. Wind. This Guy Breaks Everything.','Drop Dead Fred',10379,3.527,5.8,'YEd3SYVZ36E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11228,_binary '\0','/y3acUDGce4I9P1ChOdkgqmkunrJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101783',6.6,2997,'cn','賭俠 III 之上海灘賭聖','While battling a psychic gambler, Sing hurtles back in time to 1937 Shanghai. Now he must come to grips with his family history and get back to 1991.','/dmhdQ61SfG8p44ySNIhRrq8F70M.jpg','1991-08-21',116,'Released',NULL,'God of Gamblers III: Back to Shanghai',53658,3.7446,7,'S0zpNBvRvMw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11229,_binary '\0','/xZZ1dV4K5rvPxc1pBXV8cSX1agn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101786',6.5,15503,'en','Dutch','To get to know his girlfriend\'s son, a man volunteers to pick him up from a prep school... only to learn that her son\'s not the nicest kid.','/diBUesRJ2w6ilSbAizpk062Sajh.jpg','1991-07-19',107,'Released','They\'re the best of friends... And they\'ve got the scars to prove it.','Dutch',25330,2.7775,6.5,'aUFzngANOUQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11230,_binary '\0','/1vfyThiuGBuAS8IGs9ovDQMjkLZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101787',6,18310,'en','Dying Young','After she discovers that her boyfriend has betrayed her, Hilary O\'Neil is looking for a new start and a new job. She begins to work as a private nurse for a young man suffering from blood cancer. Slowly, they fall in love, but they always know their love cannot last because he is destined to die.','/nLVV8TETjCxWQmIip6t3HO1znVJ.jpg','1991-06-20',111,'Released','She\'s given him something nobody else could. A reason to live.','Dying Young',9079,4.6972,6.7,'A8p0w_Ec1NY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11231,_binary '\0','/47t1CrvgO1ZnNAwZN5L2gB1eLpo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101798',6.7,3383,'en','Edward II','England, 14th century. King Edward II falls in love with Piers Gaveston, a young man of humble origins, whom he honors with favors and titles of nobility. The cold and jealous Queen Isabella conspires with the evil Mortimer to get rid of Gaveston, overthrow her husband and take power…','/sB3ktIeyCoudoRMJgzo9goA9k1v.jpg','1991-09-11',90,'Released','A classic tale of sex, revenge, and love','Edward II',43654,2.5306,6.3,'zCmT99luGRE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11232,_binary '\0','/hjkAO8GDwipwEL3gyItLxrfiIsw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101811',7.3,7860,'en','Enchanted April','When married British women Rose Arbuthnot and Lottie Wilkins decide to take a break from their respective spouses, they stay at a castle in Italy for a quiet holiday. Joining the ladies is Caroline Dester, a young socialite, and Mrs. Fisher, an older aristocrat. Liberated from their daily routines, the four women ease into life in rural Italy, and each finds herself transformed by the experience.','/b4Jrg23Q3y7p8GS7aMnPdFiEcnP.jpg','1991-11-27',95,'Released','It\'s April in Italy, and anything can happen... even love.','Enchanted April',26561,2.4317,6.7,'1-HsRAM2Ink','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11233,_binary '\0','/peCePXWzXT6O1YfIZWBZDfkAnTw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101821',5.9,14353,'en','Ernest Scared Stupid','Well-intentioned, eternally bumbling Ernest P. Worrell accidentally releases an evil demon from its sacred tomb. As the demon flexes its power and goes on a ruinous rampage, good-guy Ernest tries to step in to save the town from mass destruction. Trouble is, a 200-year-old curse has scared Ernest stupid, and that means hilarity all around! So, kick back and let the laugh-ridden adventures begin.','/qnMtX8eKFFrJVEPZijFZqzDbckK.jpg','1991-10-11',91,'Released','A comedy so funny it\'s scary!','Ernest Scared Stupid',32685,2.7808,5.4,'daxX6NY1tVM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11234,_binary '\0','/9vOfO3CP8mqqq0oqCNl9R7M07xE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101829',7.5,24891,'de','Europa','In 1945 Germany, following the end of World War II, Leopold Kessler, an American of German descent, is hired by his uncle as a sleeping car conductor on the Zentropa train line. Leopold\'s wish is to be neutral to the ongoing purges of loyalists by Allied forces and do what he can to help a hurting country, but ultimately finds himself being used by both sides.','/pyFtuYQReoSmhNs55kRJedA5wEJ.jpg','1991-06-27',113,'Released','World War II had finished, but it left indelible marks.','Europa',9065,2.4748,7.4,'awJEAVdKeZI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11235,_binary '\0','/344zsxo6PaXZ1WNMIhhgEDPWyi0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101831',5,2863,'en','Eve of Destruction','Eve is a military robot made to look exactly like her creator, Dr. Eve Simmons. When she is damaged during a bank robbery, the robot becomes an unstoppable killing machine. Colonel Jim McQuade is assigned to stop the robot and with the help from Dr. Simmons they have to predict where she will go next.','/lssgv86oGv5zMvfRV0bxcZN9Yuk.jpg','1991-01-18',99,'Released','They gave her looks. Brains. Nuclear capabilities. Everything but an \"off\" switch.','Eve of Destruction',45096,2.1396,4.7,'_sARb0uQvpI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11236,_binary '\0','/rXWgjIMZIVLC8Lwh17sDLEpGCQO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101844',5.3,1488,'en','Eyes of an Angel','John Travolta is a downtrodden single father raising his daughter under difficult circumstances in Chicago. The young girl comes upon and then nurses a wounded Doberman used for fighting, back to health. Duped by underworld types he was working as a courier for, father and daughter leave the dog and flee cross-country to Los Angeles with both canine and mobsters in pursuit.','/245VToHQ4z0zFhqXIfsFZDhuj7w.jpg','1991-07-26',95,'Released',NULL,'Eyes of an Angel',50677,2.742,7.3,'I1cC_KcEVD0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11237,_binary '\0','/cWRwP7nBMI0c5JXNLxGpGdAX8O5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101846',5.9,11591,'en','F/X2','F/X man Rollie Tyler is now a toymaker. Mike, the ex-husband of his girlfriend Kim, is a cop. He asks Rollie to help catch a killer. The operation goes well until some unknown man kills both the killer and Mike. Mike\'s boss, Silak says it was the killer who killed Mike but Rollie knows it wasn\'t. Obviously, Silak is involved with Mike\'s death, so he calls on Leo McCarthy, the cop from the last movie, who is now a P.I., for help and they discover it\'s not just Silak they have to worry about.','/dxfR8JnfabPi7YUg4PFsuAa7geW.jpg','1991-04-16',108,'Released','The Deadly Art of Illusion','F/X2',16820,2.6939,6.329,'0HzhRMBuMCQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11238,_binary '\0','/hWUUxtDEhbmii3vrcnPmP5eehPS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101862',6.6,94523,'en','Father of the Bride','George Banks is an ordinary, middle-class man whose 22 year-old daughter Annie has decided to marry a man from an upper-class family, but George can\'t think of what life would be like without his daughter. His wife tries to make him happy for Annie, but when the wedding takes place at their home and a foreign wedding planner takes over the ceremony, he becomes slightly insane.','/bU7HzJbJpY5OiLdqWhKSqGPtYii.jpg','1991-12-20',105,'Released','Love is wonderful. Until it happens to your only daughter.','Father of the Bride',11846,8.1531,6.48,'o-JEkllZPDE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11239,_binary '\0','/yA3E4VJ7mifiY12S9MUTGdtHn2o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101863',6.1,1265,'en','The Favour, the Watch and the Very Big Fish','A farce, Hoskins plays a photographer who specializes in religious pictures who searches for a model for Jesus. He does a favor for a friend and finds himself doing a voice track for a porno movie with Natasha Richardson. Hoskins finds his model for Jesus in Jeff Goldblum and a romantic triangle begins in which Goldblum finds adoring crowds believing him to be Jesus and then begins to believe it himself.','/4399IIxZ3L2kP4vXMhs8Rhg3DYr.jpg','1991-05-01',89,'Released','The catch of the day is fresh comedy.','The Favour, the Watch and the Very Big Fish',107131,1.8753,5.9,'0QHypu5ZHcs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11240,_binary '\0','/otq0Et6zuiA5uyuduNSqkiVfwp3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101864',5.3,1409,'cn','非洲和尚','Two guys, one of them a magician, are transporting an ancient chinese vampire who can only be controlled by a series of yellow tapes, and is the ancestor of the other guy. On the way, while flying over Africa, their plane stalls. And of all places, where do they land? That\'s right, in the village of the tribe of \"The Gods Must Be Crazy\".','/bULIYu1m6h9aJfV3Odz6k1DbZzc.jpg','1991-07-05',96,'Released',NULL,'Crazy Safari',50507,4.0202,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11241,_binary '\0','/3NyCi98Y2lqLawrV41kNCcyo6Ab.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101889',7.5,97612,'en','The Fisher King','Two troubled men face their terrible destinies and events of their past as they join together on a mission to find the Holy Grail and thus to save themselves.','/hwIYw22HmAUMobV4zsX69MgfVUz.jpg','1991-09-20',138,'Released','A Modern Day Tale About The Search For Love, Sanity, Ethel Merman And The Holy Grail.','The Fisher King',177,8.2723,7.3,'zyKILTuhFFg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11242,_binary '\0','/7VxkSN5vAdYovqyrdGnxgwNyxQD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101891',7.6,5556,'en','The Five Heartbeats','In the early 1960s, a quintet of hopeful, young African-American men form an amateur vocal group called The Five Heartbeats. After an initially rocky start, the group improves, turns pro, and rises to become a top flight music sensation. Along the way, however, the guys learn many hard lessons about the reality of the music industry.','/mmNKtRPFVfyUKCe8e89pGkeBlRK.jpg','1991-03-29',121,'Released',NULL,'The Five Heartbeats',29475,2.7391,7.3,'IKhZXOU5SCg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11243,_binary '\0','/b0XBtMcqkIGBk6m1uG17m757EfW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101898',7.1,6798,'en','Flirting','Two freethinking teenagers - a boy and a girl - confront with authoritarian teachers in their boarding schools. The other students treat this differently.','/aJDz0TLsGFZY9XYIqIcVa2DP98y.jpg','1991-03-20',99,'Released','Here\'s to risks.','Flirting',21828,2.2494,6.713,'NDwVFQkOeLc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11244,_binary '\0','/40wFMzA25CLcHaJ2lyyKLoDeZvk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101902',6.4,6476,'en','For the Boys','Talented USO entertainer Dixie Leonard and comedian Eddie Sparks deal with their relationship over the course of 5 decades from World War II to the Vietnam War era to their twilight era in the 90\'s.','/m1pIYwjYVzfQMe6lOPf2vf6lL1m.jpg','1991-11-22',138,'Released','Laughter and tears. Tragedy and triumph. They lived it all. For the boys.','For the Boys',25221,2.9534,6.4,'cLkFzP0oFac','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11245,_binary '\0','/mXn2VhwaRKAKahulvqLdM5i3t7D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101912',6.8,39369,'en','Frankie and Johnny','When Johnny is released from prison following a forgery charge, he quickly lands a job as a short-order cook at a New York diner. Following a brief fling with waitress Cora, he develops an attraction for Cora\'s friend and fellow waitress Frankie. While Frankie resists Johnny\'s charms initially, she eventually relents when her best friend, Tim, persuades her to give Johnny a chance.','/zSOh7hriX4mQNVxhCz1yVY4aykn.jpg','1991-10-11',118,'Released','You never choose love. Love chooses you.','Frankie and Johnny',3784,4.8078,6.773,'DlY-Rs-cTzQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11246,_binary '\0','/j0ZugvhxSwvAIDpAKDdtPBjETMy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101917',4.7,56436,'en','Freddy\'s Dead: The Final Nightmare','Just when you thought it was safe to sleep, Freddy Krueger returns in this sixth installment of the Nightmare on Elm Street films, as psychologist Maggie Burroughs, tormented by recurring nightmares, meets a patient with the same horrific dreams. Their quest for answers leads to a certain house on Elm Street -- where the nightmares become reality.','/e4qh58n2WaG4Gyh9VhjOUeN9Mhv.jpg','1991-09-05',89,'Released','They saved the best for last.','Freddy\'s Dead: The Final Nightmare',11284,9.86,5.291,'MiyCvEIsNGg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11247,_binary '\0','/ApnB7gY4MrWoPqIw17lEMp1mXJD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101921',7.7,93449,'en','Fried Green Tomatoes','Amidst her own personality crisis, a southern housewife meets an outgoing old woman who tells her the story of Idgie Threadgoode and Ruth Jamison, two young women who experienced hardships and love in 1920s Whistle Stop, Alabama.','/g71l1vbJwyAAYk8zKCkIQQ58qcb.jpg','1991-12-27',130,'Released','The secret of life? The secret\'s in the sauce.','Fried Green Tomatoes',1633,8.6789,7.7,'vxDDX2V9LrQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11248,_binary '\0','/ahvD5ymf2wtz2p0PDbZ0Trdm04T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101956',6.9,1446,'tr','Gizli Yüz','A woman is searching for a face in photographs taken by a photographer. The face she hopes to meet one day belongs to a watch repairman, but the shop has long since closed.','/yPBxlzA6MbvEercVxJyy5ye1Zg2.jpg','1991-11-22',110,'Released','A mystical journey where time becomes an important leitmotif.','The Secret Face',203975,1.6621,6.7,'5zno4HzUbRU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11249,_binary '\0','/vym0cmNYexmBH4Y4p7HhGlR7LFo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101960',6,1852,'de','Go Trabi Go','Family Struutz lives in Bitterfeld (GDR). After the fall of the wall, they take the opportunity to go on holiday with their car, an old Trabant. They simply want to visit Italy. But there are some incidents during their journey.','/wtc8VETDc5jOZ90E6SzoMqr11ta.jpg','1991-01-17',92,'Released',NULL,'Go Trabi Go',11691,0.0974,5.7,'X2PNsatxzmk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11250,_binary '\0','/c1vrJxyuKhswMm9IbRJJhsFXm0I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101961',7.8,1219,'en','The Godfather Family: A Look Inside','A documentary on the making of the three Godfather films, with interviews and recollections from the film makers and cast. This feature also includes the original screen tests of some of the actors for \"The Godfather\" film, and some candid moments on the set of \"The Godfather: Part III.\"','/jDdybr7reoVABPthX9OSlazvncD.jpg','1990-07-12',73,'Released',NULL,'The Godfather Family: A Look Inside',56205,2.0592,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11251,_binary '\0','/8W2rvs3y7x4KGwjN8dO6HmVPU82.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101962',6.5,8391,'ja','ゴジラvsキングギドラ','The Futurians, time-travelers from the 23rd century, arrive in Japan to warn them of the nation\'s destruction under Godzilla. They offer to help erase Godzilla from history by preventing his creation. With Godzilla seemingly gone, a new monster emerges as the Futurians\' true intentions are revealed.','/lhJAwiVMflnMWnZGEdVDHWBwIZq.jpg','1991-12-14',103,'Released','At the end of the century, the greatest battle has begun!','Godzilla vs. King Ghidorah',36679,3.5702,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11252,_binary '\0','/akWPz9TFPWylcDPknaT9KJZnKSd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101969',6.8,17577,'en','Grand Canyon','The lives of six residents from different backgrounds intertwine in modern-day Los Angeles. At the center is the unlikely friendship of two men from different races and classes brought together when one finds himself in jeopardy in the other\'s rough neighborhood.','/gpqLukoUXAXkyMZ0jPSuAbWf5Nx.jpg','1991-12-25',134,'Released','A story of friendship and other natural wonders.','Grand Canyon',13697,2.5502,6.4,'0PI8VXaQiWs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11253,_binary '\0','/y0aXFiCRAKOLsRG5kmY7V0EP0Nz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101984',6.6,10595,'en','Guilty by Suspicion','Owing to his alleged involvement with communist parties, film director David Merrill is forbidden from working in Hollywood. He decides to fight for his rights and faces numerous challenges.','/fUpxydE70PNWr7Tu5WpefNnTv2i.jpg','1991-03-15',100,'Released','All it took was a whisper','Guilty by Suspicion',22423,4.4677,6.463,'z1XnOxfE5lg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11254,_binary '\0','/hypv7bDxzqdhJfEpjRKf1aQbdc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101985',8.2,15415,'zh','牯嶺街少年殺人事件','A boy experiences first love, friendships and injustices growing up in 1960s Taiwan.','/3l8fOAwiN3N5n3hHnZ51eog7Zu2.jpg','1991-07-27',237,'Released',NULL,'A Brighter Summer Day',15804,5.7221,8.2,'n4pHZ_IrKDk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11255,_binary '\0','/kVU8aXUODqdcNs6xS2SgBv61jaz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101988',5,7071,'en','The Guyver','FBI agent Max Reed witnesses Dr. Tetsu Segawa - a researcher for the mysterious Chronos Corporation - being murdered. Dr. Segawa had stolen an alien device known as \"The Guyver\" from Chronos. College student Sean Barker, whose girlfriend\'s father was Dr. Segawa, finds the Guyver\'s hiding spot while watching the forensic team investigating the crime scene.','/g4RYPu0ewWd5XIbPZPpfLpsMgp3.jpg','1991-03-18',92,'Released','Lost for centuries... only one man can activate it!','The Guyver',15026,2.5578,5.6,'Dn15hkXqzuM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11256,_binary '\0','/e5HYzlk7MwfB3Xp2AUbiYnJDZL5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101991',7.2,8359,'ja','八月の狂詩曲','An elderly Nagasaki hibakusha spends a summer caring for her four grandchildren, whose curiosity about the 1945 bombing stirs buried memories and moral questions. When an American nephew from Hawaii visits, the family confronts grief, guilt, and the possibility of reconciliation across generations.','/hjJy3Ph0h0ybr86G9ZCMPpoBfCy.jpg','1991-05-25',98,'Released','Tears. Laughter. Innocence. It was a summer of remembering.','Rhapsody in August',20645,6.1823,7.2,'342LbwLJh5w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11257,_binary '\0','/pK8B94K33XNn1Ix4ajF7f3naN7j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0101998',6.9,1701,'en','Hangin\' with the Homeboys','Two African-Americans and two Puerto-Ricans (though one pretends to be Italian) go out on the town on a Friday night. They will be forced to get to know each other — and even worse, learn to like each other as friends.','/toGCmWnd4t3vmwOcdV60RH0RUF9.jpg','1991-04-05',89,'Released',NULL,'Hangin\' with the Homeboys',74395,2.1401,5.8,'wHT8eO2Q4Go','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11258,_binary '\0','/fvpDegC0EGBZCZPDHDineAL4P8F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102004',6.4,24191,'en','The Hard Way','Seeking to raise his credibility as an actor and to land a role as a tough cop on a new show, Hollywood action star Nick Lang works a deal with New York City Police Capt. Brix, who by chance is one of his fans. Nick will be paired with detective Lt. John Moss and learn how to act like a real cop. But when Nick drives John crazy with questions and imitating him, he gets in the way of John\'s pursuit of a serial killer.','/k7RhWe8ebHGPp40DDTfFTEoL6CO.jpg','1991-03-08',111,'Released','There\'s only one way these two are going to get along...','The Hard Way',11384,5.6208,6.2,'0axnlV3jAFc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11259,_binary '\0','/iwZPgwUE7dJZwAo2T7xv9WAjWVL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102005',6.1,25549,'en','Harley Davidson and the Marlboro Man','It\'s the lawless future, and renegade biker Harley Davidson and his surly cowboy buddy, Marlboro, learn that a corrupt bank is about to foreclose on their friend\'s bar to further an expanding empire. Harley and Marlboro decide to help by robbing the crooked bank. But when they accidentally filch a drug shipment, they find themselves on the run from criminal financiers and the mob in this rugged action adventure.','/4WRdrjHyLuHRwep2UJWBoIn6KTW.jpg','1991-08-23',98,'Released','Who says there are no more heroes?','Harley Davidson and the Marlboro Man',2453,5.4953,6.3,'D55_Ba3Ktls','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11260,_binary '\0','/tXW9HXUDIazN8jOx6lX6obJ29MC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102007',6.2,2623,'en','The Haunted','When the Smurl family moves into a duplex, they find out it\'s haunted. When the Catholic Church is no help, they reach out to famous demonologists Ed and Lorraine Warren','/daLoku3ViXkUKOJB9X39v72KlDq.jpg','1991-05-06',100,'Released','A true story of fear, evil and possession.','The Haunted',49396,3.1561,5.9,'UZvWyh7HacY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11261,_binary '\0','/1y43OB6R4vfBKEuVpGxyFENMAqh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102011',5.7,7222,'en','He Said, She Said','Womanising, right-wing Dan Hanson and quiet, liberal Lorie Bryer work for the Baltimore Sun. Rivals for the job of new writer of a vacant column, the paper ends up instead printing their very different opinions alongside each other, which leads to a similarly combative local TV show. At the same time their initial indifference to each other looks like it may evolve into something more romantic.','/5uYv11zTTa83WMWwI3B6EOZtI0Z.jpg','1991-02-22',115,'Released','The story of true love. Both versions.','He Said, She Said',17956,3.3108,5.9,'-fhsJJNuxBA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11262,_binary '\0','/ns6V1elw5gDg1ouDDDjy5HsHM6z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102014',7,2087,'en','Hear My Song','Singer Josef Locke fled to Ireland 25 years ago to escape the clutches of the tax man and police Chief Jim Abbott. What he also left behind was the love of his life Cathleen Doyle. Now, Micky O’Neill is desperate to save both his ailing Liverpool nightclub ‘Heartly’s’ and his failing relationship with the beautiful Nancy, Cathleen’s daughter. The solution? Book the infamous Josef Locke.','/xD8hh10Atodan4tzYg3K2QFCrJ1.jpg','1991-12-27',104,'Released','There\'s definitely magic in the air','Hear My Song',54405,1.8743,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11263,_binary '\0','/crw9RXI54qmSfc0tIiH5hip79uw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102015',8.1,26086,'en','Hearts of Darkness: A Filmmaker\'s Apocalypse','A chronicle of the production problems — including bad weather, actors\' health, war near the filming locations, and more — which plagued the filming of Apocalypse Now, increasing costs and nearly destroying the life and career of Francis Ford Coppola.','/nVMCtL3r2nj4fySihDDvamaVkfx.jpg','1991-11-27',96,'Released','The magic and madness of making Apocalypse Now','Hearts of Darkness: A Filmmaker\'s Apocalypse',4539,2.9708,7.9,'NuxlYozLpeI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11264,_binary '\0','/qopU2FBsdQ2cgTvt4ILLclLz3qn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102032',6.5,2355,'en','High Strung','Thane Furrows, an extremely cynical but unintentionally hilarious children\'s book writer, wakes up one morning, and, since pretty much everyone and everything annoys him, begins another day of complaining to himself. However, the day proves to be much different than normal when Thane begins to recieve strange phone calls, letters, and voices in his head, all indicating that something will happen at 8 o\'clock. As the day goes on, Thane rants and raves about the things that annoy him, as the clock slowly ticks closer and closer to his destiny.','/myl4HdGadeQll6UY2DBZQ7ZXnoc.jpg','1992-01-08',94,'Released','The story of a guy with a few too many hang-ups.','High Strung',22792,1.5032,6,'XlJcPRbEpAg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11265,_binary '\0','/5GszfyuRYWBptoxI14fKgfHiTZK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102034',4.2,50919,'en','Highlander II: The Quickening','The Prize has been won. Connor MacLeod is mortal... Now an old man on the verge of death, memories of his past on the planet Zeist resurface, where a vengeful enemy, General Katana, plots to destroy him once and for all.','/qxKeykPNGbKAK0DJijMUaZ5cVPo.jpg','1991-01-13',100,'Released','It\'s time for a new kind of magic.','Highlander II: The Quickening',8010,5.8307,4.672,'rV2yoL_GkEY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11266,_binary '\0','/zIZ3EB1dsZGPrw75T4TopDGpgCM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102035',7,1575,'en','Highway 61','A naive Canadian barber who knows US popular culture inside and out meets a flamboyant roadie who needs someone to drive her and her \"brother\'s\" corpse from Thunder Bay, Ontario to New Orleans. Chaos ensues after the barber agrees to drive her, the corpse, and the drugs stashed within all the way.','/kUJNsyvl3yezjbWuQG2Mh7HtPmc.jpg','1991-09-05',103,'Released','Where Else Would You Go To Bury Rock N\' Roll?','Highway 61',8468,1.3564,6.8,'R7AwygkhuL8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11267,_binary '\0','/dsfPjQPvaOaCSESopobK02j16Ft.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102043',5,1309,'en','Hired to Kill','A fashion photographer and seven models travel to a South American island fortress, ostensibly to do a fashion shoot. In reality, the photographer is a mercenary and their job is to free an imprisoned rebel leader','/shK0x8Eq4bPO12SDEIIAkFNrGrf.jpg','1990-04-28',96,'Released','No man on earth could get him out of prison alive. Seven women did.','Hired to Kill',96635,2.2376,4.8,'0ySw1wC391k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11268,_binary '\0','/tNzWjlDk7GjPulTLkPNOjHgoNVV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102045',5.4,4966,'en','The Hitman','After surviving an attempt on his life by his former partner, officer Cliff Garrett (Norris) exacts revenge on those who wronged him by going undercover as a hit man. He works to gain the reputation and trust needed in order to be accepted by the burgeoning Seattle-area criminal underworld, but it is all done in order to take it down from within.','/skiXX2axTlVlOX8Cr3qVzcVJHL.jpg','1991-05-01',95,'Released','He\'s so far undercover he may never get back.','The Hitman',31544,4.2642,5.514,'3wq_NacnCX4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11269,_binary '\0','/7GoQaUpyJPL7WaDQSBMrCXemUFF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102048',6.9,9002,'en','Homicide','While investigating the ruthless murder of an elderly woman, a Jewish police detective unravels a bizarre conspiracy involving a Zionist organization.','/eTfz8CTaHkYFCccZt6p6iop2e6U.jpg','1991-05-28',101,'Released','Powerful. Provocative. Controversial.','Homicide',22828,2.3087,6.3,'P9-Q0ZRFk7g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11270,_binary '\0','/kJSZsEzhvEOs2lKk9GCqvQ2c3r7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102050',6.7,3841,'de','Homo Faber','April 1957: Rational engineer Faber\'s plane crashes in Mexico, where he learns that he became a father in 1938. He takes a ship from NYC to France and meets cute, young Sabeth. Is it fate?','/cIjMYgRRGjgdvBlVYYN6b5MS9OV.jpg','1991-03-21',117,'Released','Destiny is the most powerful coincidence of all.','Voyager',10171,1.8293,6.2,'L2RsIFx4FIQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11271,_binary '\0','/39OxcFZjX4uc6vYzexUh5qXghxE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102057',6.8,294731,'en','Hook','The boy who wasn\'t supposed to grow up—Peter Pan—does just that, becoming a soulless corporate lawyer whose workaholism could cost him his wife and kids. During his trip to see Granny Wendy in London, the vengeful Capt. Hook kidnaps Peter\'s kids and forces Peter to return to Neverland.','/a6rB1lGXoGms7gWxRfJneQmAjNV.jpg','1991-04-10',142,'Released','To live would be an awfully big adventure.','Hook',879,11.9244,6.844,'c-vwgt8cwEM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11272,_binary '\0','/4RriqSJFCQkYpRhxFnQGh3sxZYY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102059',6.7,126185,'en','Hot Shots!','The gang that created Airplane! and The Naked Gun sets its sights on Top Gun in this spoof. Topper Harley is a talented but unstable fighter pilot with an axe to grind: clearing the family name. His mission is to avenge his father and save a mission sabotaged by greedy weapons manufacturers. He also gets involved in a relationship with Ramada Thompson, a woman with an unusually talented stomach. Hot Shots! makes fun of a variety of other films, from Dances with Wolves to The Fabulous Baker Boys.','/koLIB5263emHxewmwgBBK26vjeS.jpg','1991-07-31',85,'Released','The mother of all movies.','Hot Shots!',9595,10.9615,6.584,'ih78dz2XyLc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11273,_binary '\0','/uXtUBwwcOLSOyAHCCUDsE2PLOwc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102065',5.3,7524,'en','House Party 2','Kid\'N\'Play leave their neighborhood and enter the world of adulthood and higher education. Play attempts to get rich quick in the music business while Kid faces the challenges of college.','/4iKDkzUZtS6vzINfbwYHAb1bNbA.jpg','1991-10-23',94,'Released',NULL,'House Party 2',16096,2.5759,5.5,'Fcv3v2JIj34','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11274,_binary '\0','/bwnp7w4n7484bZFwz7IuvFQszAY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102070',5.7,65230,'en','Hudson Hawk','Eddie Hawkins, called Hudson Hawk has just been released from ten years of prison and is planning to spend the rest of his life honestly. But then the crazy Mayflower couple blackmail him to steal some of the works of Leonardo da Vinci. If he refuses, they threaten to kill his friend Tommy.','/2AiR7HZuIOUdJp6LYOEOA8z7pF3.jpg','1991-05-23',100,'Released','Shy. Sensitive. Law-abiding. Polite. Respectful... I don\'t think so.','Hudson Hawk',9292,7.7828,5.7,'rGAf_STSlrY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11275,_binary '\0','/pqIZjQjprUVR094pP7TOcCRZkvP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102071',6.9,3785,'hi','Hum','Tiger works for the local Don Bhaktawar but never hesitates to revolt against him if he harms his friends or family. When his girlfriend Jumma\'s brother Gonsalves is killed by Bhakhtawar for revolting against him, Tiger promises revenge.','/blnhL1cIxjjLgNdlDA8tIbvbCCO.jpg','1991-02-01',184,'Released',NULL,'Hum',65954,1.1729,5.988,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11276,_binary '\0','/mmhw9ekCTtysCJwaUvHuA0z32FM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102095',5.8,8443,'en','If Looks Could Kill','Michael Corben, along with the rest of his high-school French class, sets out for a trip to France when he is mistaken for an agent of the same name. He is beseiged by both the good guys and the bad guys. British Intelligence outfits him with a series of James-Bond-like gizmos, and Steranko sends more would-be assassins after him. Can Michael stop the evil Steranko\'s plans for European domination?','/rTjcoGpHONeacV4zewHi1oSttW.jpg','1991-03-15',88,'Released','He\'s having the adventure of someone else\'s life.','If Looks Could Kill',22434,4.0432,6.135,'vpRk6InCz_0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11277,_binary '\0','/gKWHRVgcXgzOylUdkt6TLmP45Oz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102103',6.8,6026,'en','Impromptu','In 1830s France, pianist/composer Frédéric Chopin is pursued romantically by the determined, individualistic woman who uses the name George Sand.','/np3Ogsy0JMsQ7HaLI2fHvA76e8A.jpg','1991-04-12',107,'Released','He\'s about to fall in love with the most scandalous woman of his time.','Impromptu',17990,3.3344,6.114,'b4rUHTrewuY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11278,_binary '\0','/wRq5LjJYRbtDb2k7bEtDvFezCeI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102116',6.9,10479,'en','The Indian Runner','Two brothers cannot overcome their opposite perceptions of life. One brother sees and feels bad in everyone and everything, subsequently he is violent, antisocial and unable to appreciate or enjoy the good things which his brother desperately tries to point out to him.','/1NmjsvXcqe4yyGKfOwLDcxl4HLY.jpg','1991-09-20',127,'Released',NULL,'The Indian Runner',25598,3.7432,6.5,'iEU3RsJdWGY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11279,_binary '\0','/9kgf0rsqh8Cftz57JZ8OQRy94kr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102136',6.7,1618,'fr','J\'embrasse pas','A good-looking but naive lad leaves his mountain village to try and make his way in Paris. He thinks maybe he will try acting but things don\'t go too well for him. Eventually he is forced to sell himself to men and though he meets an attractive girl she is herself a prostitute with a vicious pimp.','/s2Bzo5CNnrHSGEld8hnhG3MdyDt.jpg','1991-11-20',115,'Released','I\'ll do almost anything for money. ...but I don\'t kiss.','I Don\'t Kiss',47718,1.4518,6.2,'Kac4lOfEFDU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11280,_binary '\0','/77gjiDyD94aJfqZq6AJAcMLxZhd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102138',8,183460,'en','JFK','Follows the investigation into the assassination of President John F. Kennedy led by New Orleans district attorney Jim Garrison.','/r0VWVTYlqdRCK5ZoOdNnHdqM2gt.jpg','1991-12-20',189,'Released','The story that won\'t go away.','JFK',820,8.633,7.6,'kunQ6rEOTcQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11281,_binary '\0','/mmLJoiJOBqlxtZos6DRX9pl5Orm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102141',7.6,2388,'fr','Jacquot de Nantes','Jacquot Demy, the son of a garage owner and a hairdresser, is fascinated by cinema and decides to pursue his dream of becoming a filmmaker by any means necessary.','/cg0Z7kqFbDOBWNanI7uYHzsTiU5.jpg','1991-05-15',120,'Released',NULL,'Jacquot',41789,2.0449,7.5,'CrhUTCfGmb0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11282,_binary '\0','/aKNctt6HWvN152JQUf7JrbVxuQg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102164',7.2,12533,'it','Johnny Stecchino','Good hearted but not very wordly-wise, Dante is happy driving the school bus for a group of mentally handicapped children, while feeling he is somehow missing out on life and love. So he is very excited when after nearly being knocked down by her car he meets Maria, who seems immediately enamoured of him. He is soon invited to her sumptuous Palermo villa, little suspecting that this is part of a plot. He bears an amazing likeness to Maria\'s stool-pigeon gangster husband and it would be convenient for them if the mobster, in the shape of Dante, was seen to be dead and buried.','/5scWsRsH5MUJEgXB52w0fM6I2gM.jpg','1991-10-24',115,'Released','Sometimes a banana is just a banana!','Johnny Stecchino',12776,2.6099,7.326,'x-J6XyNHM3I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11283,_binary '\0','/f5DYkRjFQoN34wsAZ0euA46Lxrb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102167',7.1,1721,'en','The Josephine Baker Story','Biography of the African-American who became a major performer in the Paris cabarets of the 1920s and 1930s. The film follows her life beginning as a struggling performer in 1917 St. Louis, her frustrations leading to her move to France, and follows to her death in 1975. Written by John Sacksteder','/mjwf8huzfK4TULeraBZeQxrA2Kr.jpg','1991-03-16',130,'Released','Before Madonna. Before Marilyn. There was Josephine.','The Josephine Baker Story',88614,1.9685,6.025,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11284,_binary '\0','/2YQfKfYX0mvHPnFMP5wiL1kYYBU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102175',6.6,21223,'en','Jungle Fever','A successful and married black man contemplates having an affair with a white girl from work. He\'s quite rightly worried that the racial difference would make an already taboo relationship even worse.','/pw7cOdwCylBuiv6rvosBSkcgKEe.jpg','1991-06-07',132,'Released',NULL,'Jungle Fever',1713,6.5021,6.396,'kZ64smS4Lyk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11285,_binary '\0','/izGizT2wzaHrnkVb6iDG6WaMKxO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102178',6.3,7844,'en','K2','They call it the savage mountain. 27 people have perished trying to reach the summit on K2, the world\'s second highest peak. A U.S. climbing team, funded by millionaire Clairborne is determined to conquer K2.','/neAOSoPFnSAiyMH3SDYxhWBn9FY.jpg','1991-10-10',102,'Released','28,000 feet. You\'re hanging on by your fingernails. The adrenaline alone could kill you.','K2',24734,3.9993,5.7,'grv3d55FOkk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11286,_binary '\0','/sMIxDDigJfUhNsaiEBv96JILrU5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102181',6.8,11209,'en','Kafka','After a colleague is murdered, insurance worker Kafka gets embroiled in an underground group who are attempting to thwart a secret organization that controls the major events in society.','/ozjedSZGp3d7Pgh8HZ5yz1VpUBT.jpg','1991-11-15',98,'Released','To solve a mystery he will enter a nightmare.','Kafka',2297,3.0187,6.4,'amEKXMbTDtw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11287,_binary '\0','/7pgWbror7QscZu4YLU5ZKUWffAQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102202',4.6,6846,'en','Kickboxer 2: The Road Back','In this rousing sequel to Kickboxer, Tong Po broods about his defeat at the hands of Kurt Sloan. Po and his managers resort to drastic measures to goad Kurt\'s brother into the ring for a rematch.','/pNvuLT77H9eSStoqmB7EMLdlffv.jpg','1991-01-30',91,'Released','When the enemy is angry, confuse him. When he is unaware, surprise him, and if he refuses to submit, ...destroy him.','Kickboxer 2: The Road Back',24993,4.2984,5.6,'rAndsw-cStk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11288,_binary '\0','/jeDUtGhVYoiKUUPIT8WwrOuNWZa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102216',5.4,18050,'en','King Ralph','As the only relative in line to ascend the Royal throne, a down-on-his-luck American slob must learn the ways of the English.','/fRHq4KerVgNRLaDwwuYpCAHIQJX.jpg','1991-02-15',97,'Released','A comedy of majestic proportions.','King Ralph',10804,3.5661,5.4,'2FEsismdGWY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11289,_binary '\0','/qnAy2XthzsPzquzNNa4jSSmdszt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102217',5.9,2324,'en','The King of the Kickboxers','Jake, a New York policeman poses as an actor to expose the making of martial-arts death movies in Thailand.','/srDVrofFvU8lC9MVNZn17cmqNRk.jpg','1990-11-01',99,'Released','In the ring of death, only one man can be king!','The King of the Kickboxers',68895,3.7963,6.9,'tSudpY75cX8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11290,_binary '\0','/k3Sxv3bjQh6yL5Oa33858faonAk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102220',5.8,6473,'en','A Kiss Before Dying','Infatuated with the idea of becoming rich, college student Jonathan Corliss secretly dates Dorothy Carlsson to gain the approval of her wealthy father. When Dorothy tells Jonathan that she is pregnant and that her father will deny her inheritance if he finds out, Jonathan murders her, but he stages her death as a suicide. As Jonathan works his way onto Mr. Carlsson\'s payroll, Dorothy\'s twin sister, Ellen, investigates the apparent suicide.','/n4aT62Y1kKBpAgmEk4FILZAJpPn.jpg','1991-04-26',95,'Released','Loving him was easy. Trusting him was deadly.','A Kiss Before Dying',31696,4.3811,5.6,'Gfo3YLPMfC0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11291,_binary '\0','/rcJWnb2ziCW0Jwplui7amMkm4XW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102223',8.3,3258,'ar','الكيت كات','Sheikh Hosny is a blind man who lives with his old mother and his frustrated son in the Kit Kat neighborhood. His son Youssef dreams of going to Europe to find work, and has a relationship with a divorced woman named Fatima. Sheikh Hosny refuses to admit his handicap and dreams of riding a motorcycle like every sighted person, he also spends his nights smoking hash with the locals in order to forget his miseries after the loss of his wife and selling his father\'s house.','/u58To5A37XPHY6O5O4T6NGb1zqp.jpg','1991-09-09',130,'Released',NULL,'Kit Kat',68738,0.8073,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11292,_binary '\0','/1fJI20nsujsbO7TZfcao0aIiCoF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102227',4.6,3875,'en','Knight Rider 2000','In the future, guns are banned and criminals are frozen for the duration of their sentences. A recent spate of killings involving handguns brings Michael Knight back to fight for justice, but he insists of the help of KITT, his artificially-intelligent car from decades ago. The only problem is that KITT has been deactivated.','/9hrGmhIdDvVkk9i26lK9QsZNurw.jpg','1991-05-19',95,'Released',NULL,'Knight Rider 2000',10969,3.6423,5.6,'kCXYWpkQ9NQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11293,_binary '\0','/jfs0mFGPMVqIgkfPE0sUCIONcFP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102237',6.8,1440,'pl','Kroll','Marcin Kroll deserts from his military unit that’s headed to the training ground. Lieutenant Arek is sent after him, tasked with bringing Kroll back to the unit before an official investigation begins. The officers fear a scandal: the inquiry could expose the brutal conditions in the unit that drove several soldiers to suicide.','/bsBuFbD4WJvoUtC9GmhxkgJDkSO.jpg','1991-10-11',101,'Released',NULL,'Kroll',36394,1.8191,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11294,_binary '\0','/tNZjrQyXvuEuwuoJWjoWkqEAf7J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102240',6.1,1396,'da','Krummerne','The tween, Mads, finds it hard to fit in. Having feelings for a girl in class and a clumsy farther who is a teacher at his school doesn\'t help. By an unforeseen chance of events, Mads becomes somewhat of a hero, but will he win the girl?','/9qvwQPvXjgOUtJBWo9MIxUuoQye.jpg','1991-10-04',86,'Released',NULL,'The Crumbs',53693,1.2013,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11295,_binary '\0','/cgEyCFwQ1vZ2yagwZTrrR19EIKQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102250',6.7,34983,'en','L.A. Story','With the help of a talking freeway billboard, a \"wacky weatherman\" tries to win the heart of an English newspaper reporter, who is struggling to make sense of the strange world of early-90s Los Angeles.','/At97val6UZyQoQtmH1b2Pe7bWqG.jpg','1991-02-08',95,'Released','Something funny is happening in L.A.','L.A. Story',2107,3.9523,6.5,'tl9WCvUZVrE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11296,_binary '\0','/8Tjj4bis80w1lU5ZT9juHPvjxNn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102258',7.2,3477,'hi','लम्हे','Viren falls for Pallavi, but she marries Siddharth. The couple dies, leaving behind their daughter, who grows up to look just like her mother and falls in love with Viren.','/cPO3btLrT5EpxwrhppqVEybaoZr.jpg','1991-11-04',187,'Released',NULL,'Lamhe',64879,1.5369,6.704,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11297,_binary '\0','/8AZ8Hjcr4Jr1eR93OW70g9jjUr9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102266',7,122136,'en','The Last Boy Scout','Somewhere in Los Angeles, the city of broken dreams, a stripper is murdered. Now, the private detective she had hired and her ex-footballer boyfriend are going to find her murderer... if they don\'t kill each other first. But the more they dig, the deeper they become enmeshed in a web of extortion, blackmail and corrupt politics hidden beneath the surface of professional football.','/glPswihcZYoAQ4YM2uJF4UACy8T.jpg','1991-12-13',105,'Released','Everyone had counted them out. But they\'re about to get back in the game.','The Last Boy Scout',9319,9.7637,6.8,'1uP5LGTkdQU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11298,_binary '\0','/kjCsM54XVpEpcHDEjSCTQQkL7XI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102279',6.5,2020,'en','Late for Dinner','Two young men, one in need of medical attention, are cryogenically frozen in the early 1960s. The two are preoccupied with the fact that the police are pursuing them to realise what they are doing. The next thing they know is that they are in a strange new world (thirty years on).','/5gE5LOeUVc4k1Q4zj4Fxs9c6VMC.jpg','1991-09-20',93,'Released','Sometimes you can be gone forever and still make it back in time.','Late for Dinner',56120,1.4107,5.7,'4jvnC_FAVlQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11299,_binary '\0','/tmfKqdXU0CUsZP3QIHkw4YYiiDA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102288',7.1,4061,'en','Let Him Have It','In 1950s England, slow-witted Derek Bentley falls in with a group of petty criminals led by Chris Craig, a teenager with a fondness for American gangster films. Chris and Derek\'s friendship leads to their involvement in the true case which would forever shake England\'s belief in capital punishment.','/mJAKJWV7JPI0SA8oWHqWDktihqA.jpg','1991-10-04',115,'Released','The shocking story of an unbelievable miscarriage of justice.','Let Him Have It',64167,2.5246,6.7,'h1yY455LrY4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11300,_binary '\0','/ing3zXED5b3XnWOQ88S3S7wvU8I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102293',7,16828,'cn','力王','In 2001, where all correctional facilities have been privatized, martial artist Ricky finds himself victim to the corrupt system, found \"guilty\" of the manslaughter of an infamous crime boss.','/dzG0PAbBDLbJSYuv2SM2Mjxw2MH.jpg','1991-10-05',93,'Released',NULL,'Riki-Oh: The Story of Ricky',17467,5.0144,6.9,'yqjMI5dyMyM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11301,_binary '\0','/xJrLEJdM9j03PLysjOOSIdtqNt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102299',5.8,1799,'en','Liebestraum','A man returns to his hometown and a series of dark secrets are revealed.','/3gA0Be1ouqyO6T4vV1V609WLIBI.jpg','1991-09-13',112,'Released','A story of lust, murder and dreams.','Liebestraum',44414,2.5628,5.4,'YsCQ9X2HXJE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11302,_binary '\0','/umDfiTpF5zFzEMfN1rLSorHmS6F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102303',5.9,12564,'en','Life Stinks','Affluent and arrogant businessman Goddard Bolt, feuding with rival Vance Crasswell over a land deal, makes a bet with Crasswell that he has the wits and street smarts to live penniless and anonymous on the rough streets of Los Angeles for thirty days. But Bolt has a rude awakening when the reality of homelessness hits him. Still, he finds a silver lining in a burgeoning romance with Molly, a former Broadway dancer who has fallen on hard times.','/uRyxlMbGQwONnN2Ez9ECMPVHxok.jpg','1991-06-05',92,'Released','From Fortune 500 ... to fortune\'s fool.','Life Stinks',6524,4.4262,5.7,'G0MVdcNKhZc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11303,_binary '\0','/kTu8o04UGSB1n0OV8cXwenHzg2k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102307',6.9,11540,'en','Light Sleeper','John LeTour is a recovering drug user who suffers insomnia and still deals to a high-end New York clientele, even though he’s trying to move on from the business. John’s professional midlife crisis becomes something more acute — and dangerous — when he re-encounters an old flame while a string of seemingly drug-related murders rocks the city.','/fFSdOYKp80rcK81KuNW3rz7FcLX.jpg','1992-08-21',103,'Released','He was a good man in a deadly business. She was his only way out.','Light Sleeper',36351,3.1792,6.7,'s8g8-5qSmFk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11304,_binary '\0','/bAKdtx0F4U2jgUPmClEh9fVHVQr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102313',6.2,2219,'en','The Linguini Incident','A waitress, a barman and an underwear designer try to rob a New York restaurant where two of them work.','/lsMCeo4Cs72yoGOQsJoCdQ9hEWA.jpg','1991-05-01',93,'Released','He wants to be tied down. She wants to be tied up. It\'s not what you think.','The Linguini Incident',47252,1.9412,6.6,'2rjLQPwtig4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11305,_binary '\0','/lY1dSP8rtLxtnTPS1KM6ywYQK6Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102316',6.6,18124,'en','Little Man Tate','Dede is a sole parent trying to bring up her son Fred. When it is discovered that Fred is a genius, she is determined to ensure that Fred has all the opportunities that he needs, and that he is not taken advantage of by people who forget that his extremely powerful intellect is harboured in the body and emotions of a child.','/eXf4xhJEc9c2NElBrExmiWFe4Pz.jpg','1991-09-06',99,'Released','It\'s not what he knows. It\'s what he understands.','Little Man Tate',11521,6.0355,6.598,'k4CSE7hsNC4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11306,_binary '\0','/fDu9wWlsTi5LZznuf5OglAI4FCn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102340',4.4,1295,'en','Love Crimes','An Atlanta prosecutor sets her own trap for a sex offender who poses as a famous photographer.','/l2zE5VYf3SlC66GTpR80bwcWDn4.jpg','1992-01-24',90,'Released','He\'s a master of seduction. Every woman\'s fantasy. Every woman\'s nightmare. In order to trap him, a female district attorney will have to make the ultimate sacrifice. Herself.','Love Crimes',39479,1.7535,4.3,'zhQE9TqEJHw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11307,_binary '\0','/dXGECXMTs0SEJGg4qwuisHbe2vc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102343',5.7,16216,'en','Love Potion No. 9','Unlucky in love, chemist Paul Matthews visits gypsy Madame Rosa for help. Quickly realizing he is a hopeless nerd, she gifts him with Love Potion No. 8, which makes anyone who wears it irresistible to the opposite sex for four hours. Paul and animal psychologist coworker Diane Farrow decide to test it on themselves. The awkward pair suddenly find themselves alluring to anyone they approach, but soon realize they are most attracted to each other.','/n0DYahGGueR96mhajPGGgZpFL4k.jpg','1992-11-13',97,'Released','Imagine if sex appeal came in a bottle.','Love Potion No. 9',26255,4.9586,6.199,'uh6ir2m5SLw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11308,_binary '\0','/bQNP3bAyba0vLBzZRXimT6jsfcI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102351',5.2,4564,'en','Lucky Luke','Lucky Luke becomes the Sheriff of Daisy Town and runs out all the criminals. Then the Dalton brothers arrive and try to get the Indians to break the peace treaty and attack the town.','/cnBw87wu31s6VM6LKilokFwgqZu.jpg','1991-07-04',92,'Released',NULL,'Lucky Luke',11175,2.4677,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11309,_binary '\0','/m4gGt73A0bEMPRS4eiIrRuDk5KW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102368',6.6,5006,'fr','Madame Bovary','In 19th-century France, doctor\'s wife Emma Bovary seeks to escape her dull provincial life through various extramarital affairs and extravagant spending, leading to tragic consequences.','/cBJtWAgDTCqxNJJOZjnRSh5Vxa5.jpg','1991-03-03',143,'Released','Two souls adrift on the waves of the Seine','Madame Bovary',2528,3.317,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11310,_binary '\0','/kgrq1zBv5R9C86oBboApRC002Lc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102369',8.4,5515,'fa','مادر','The film progresses along two distinct but interwoven series of events. The first series involves young members of a family who have gathered round their old mother and revive their common childhood memories. the second line focuses on the old woman\'s preparations for her last journey and her joyous cooperation in arranging for the ceremonies that are to be observed after her death.','/ijHzM4emJSsGGo1VvTLfvKhGbYn.jpg','1990-12-31',108,'Released',NULL,'Mother',253366,0.6909,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11311,_binary '\0','/tIj48gA5trtzHv5onQd5HpC5pmS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102370',6.5,10594,'en','Madonna: Truth or Dare','From the rains of Japan, through threats of arrest for \'public indecency\' in Canada, and a birthday tribute to her father in Detroit, this documentary follows Madonna on her 1990 \'Blond Ambition\' concert tour. Filmed in black and white, with the concert pieces in glittering MTV color, it is an intimate look at the work of the icon, from a prayer circle before each performance to bed games with the dance troupe afterwards.','/kJHCqwDgS9MEhdChIkGn7QAUoyL.jpg','1991-05-10',119,'Released','The Ultimate Dare is to tell the Truth.','Madonna: Truth or Dare',10174,3.5799,6.2,'CtYp9YKhUZ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11312,_binary '\0','/4X5QrfdMvBAXFi6wa0fgYcL3YFN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102383',6.3,1354,'de','Malina','An unusual story of a triangular relationship in Vienna. A woman shares an apartment with a man named Malina. The woman meets Ivan and falls under his spell. It will be her last great passion. Her feelings are so strong and all-encompassing that Ivan can neither understand nor return them.','/sbohIG5vFkg84ZoMTElAZX4cBJL.jpg','1991-01-17',125,'Released',NULL,'Malina',66557,2.0401,6.2,'z5NSyfZPjOs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11313,_binary '\0','/8odZHjwMWWUg2gntUjndLIb8sT0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102388',7.2,22079,'en','The Man in the Moon','Maureen Trant and her younger sibling Dani share a strong connection, but local boy Court Foster threatens to throw their bond off balance. Dani and Court meet first and have a flirtatious rapport -- but when he meets Maureen, he falls hard and they begin a passionate affair. The new couple try to keep their love hidden from Dani, but she soon learns the truth, disavowing her sister. But a heartbreaking accident later reunites the girls.','/57r0TXlqV5GIn4h0Htgh81OZou9.jpg','1991-09-30',99,'Released','Remember when you couldn\'t wait for your life to begin... and then, one day, it did?','The Man in the Moon',17474,6.3773,7.4,'NVCD5sfNigI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11314,_binary '\0','/99CGPrKgqwu3XuWjTv6arr6b8ai.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102395',4.5,7357,'en','Mannequin Two: On the Move','Although Jason works as a department store clerk, he is also a reincarnated prince. Long ago, his beloved Jessie was snatched away from him by an evil wizard who used his powers to transform her into wooden statue. Now Jessie is in Jason\'s department store as a mannequin. When he encounters her, she awakens from her thousand-year sleep. They quickly revive their romance, but the evil wizard has been reincarnated as well, and he\'s up to no good.','/3OOpLGW4Nz113XVyUCes6wm8M7E.jpg','1991-05-17',95,'Released','She\'s been frozen for a thousand years...now it\'s time to break the ice.','Mannequin Two: On the Move',34376,4.0755,5.8,'J1oy_TQ9tyE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11315,_binary '\0','/oyYrix2ryWAUzMtpTWSROgIug2r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102396',4.7,1361,'de','Manta - Der Film','Life is tough on car fanatic Fred. As soon as he has convinced the beautiful hairdresser Tina, he wins an Opel Manta in a raffle and is rid of the lady immediately. From now on, Tina prefers to turn to the photographer Phil. He has what Fred always wanted: a Golf GTI. To make matters worse, he now has to listen to the mocking remarks of his fellow men at every traffic light. But Fred doesn\'t give up. He finally finds support in the Manta Club. In a big race he finally wants to put his rival GTI-Phil in his place.','/798G8opEUfVr299ySNbuVBOabJE.jpg','1991-09-18',90,'Released',NULL,'Manta - Der Film',2169,1.5871,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11316,_binary '\0','/lbwhLH0rQQj9GYwZBwSOBFmxcUu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102397',5.7,6465,'de','Manta, Manta','A not-so-clever guy called Bertie with an Opel Manta (a low-budget European sports coupé from the \'80s) gets competition in a street race from a guy with a fast Mercedes, and another slick guy with a Ferrari tries to get his hands on Bertie\'s girlfriend.','/kZPQxmWrlHQXE2RuXkbnk86MvXA.jpg','1991-10-03',91,'Released',NULL,'Manta, Manta',1915,3.721,5.775,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11317,_binary '\0','/egPhb7iQthVnyWyuhEeGqscpJ6P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102411',5.8,6748,'en','The Marrying Man','Charley Pearl, wealthy heir and gadabout, is slated to marry Adele, the daughter of a Hollywood tycoon. But, during a wild bachelor party in Las Vegas, Charley strikes up a flirtation with nightclub crooner Vicki Anderson that soon leads to her bedroom. When the couple are discovered by Vicki\'s beau, infamous gangster Bugsy Siegel, he makes a surprising pronouncement -- they\'d better marry, or Charley is a dead man.','/xvT93kHpn4y6gACgemA3Apc34gG.jpg','1991-04-05',116,'Released','Every man has a weakness. For millionaire Charley Pearl she\'s blonde, beautiful and loves to say \"I do\".','The Marrying Man',31633,3.2611,5.526,'4hZo0-kISX8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11318,_binary '\0','/zAknHqv66ItMOSGEYEsnNy8dVE1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102421',7.5,3794,'fr','Mayrig','Henri Verneuil was born Achod Malakian of Armenian parentage on October 15, 1920, in Rodosto, Turkey, and his family fled to France and settled in Marseilles when he was a young child. He later recounted his childhood experience in the novel Mayrig, which he dedicated to his mother and made into this 1991 film with the same name.','/tgkknyTJWWjwIYkmsGqmMER2iJF.jpg','1991-11-27',157,'Released',NULL,'Mother',151227,2.4466,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11319,_binary '\0','/vEbWCdrHeoHmwDlq3tz4QFG4NWx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102422',4.9,2690,'en','McBain','Santos attempts to lead a people\'s revolt in Colombia to overthrow the Presidente. When his revolt fails and he is killed, his sister Christina goes to New York to find McBain, a lieutenant Santos rescued during the Vietnam War. McBain agrees to help, recruits his old war buddies, raises some cash by killing a few drug dealers, then leads an attack to topple the Colombian government.','/tOYtB42P1njhR5vN7gulIKf6TVu.jpg','1991-09-20',107,'Released','The drug lords have the power, the money, the connections. They didn\'t count on McBain','McBain',27350,2.1377,4.37,'Ktm7ETY-BS4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11320,_binary '\0','/o2alIK1pBH0xVQIswPXWJwLGy48.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102426',7.4,17982,'it','Mediterraneo','Greek Sea, World War II. An Italian ship leaves a handful of soldiers in a little island; their mission is to spot enemy ships and to hold the island in case of attack. The village of the island seems abandoned and there isn\'t a single enemy in sight, so the soldiers begin to relax a little. Things change when their ship is hit and destroyed by the enemy, and the soldiers find themselves abandoned there.','/omFU47TZSR7xAAZcDHKM48SmVwe.jpg','1991-02-02',96,'Released','On a magical Greek island a soldier is about to discover that it is better to make love instead of war','Mediterraneo',38251,2.852,7.605,'Q3WJvaEjAlU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11321,_binary '\0','/67zQHjQTUBrtpcgDusrVpg1ebT0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102428',6.6,1493,'en','Meeting Venus','Celebrated Swedish opera star Karin Anderson is slated to appear in an internationally-telecast production of Tannhauser. Ms. Anderson balks at the notion of working with obscure Hungarian conductor Zoltan Szanto. The much-anticipated production may never get off the ground, thanks to labor-management difficulties, intramural jealousies, and clashing egos. Amidst all this chaos, the mismatched Anderson and Szanto fall in love.','/zCId7g6MCWBM3bcwQV4ZkSNvWvz.jpg','1991-09-18',119,'Released',NULL,'Meeting Venus',117825,1.4533,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11322,_binary '\0','/6EqVRQ8xp2mYmK5uDOik68rJRMn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102436',6.5,1522,'fr','Merci la vie','Camille, a naïve schoolgirl, meets an intriguing influence in Joelle, a slightly older and much more experienced spirit. Camille follows her new friend through the discovery of sex and the darker side of life. As the film progresses, Camille discovers AIDS and the fear that she may have picked up the disease in her early encounters.','/pdDxrDGQXqOgzhED11qCA0IhzlB.jpg','1991-03-13',117,'Released',NULL,'Thank You, Life',32853,1.7505,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11323,_binary '\0','/4qVxStjaY4UrXXlEDqlfzcfKV1P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102439',7.5,3261,'el','Το μετέωρο βήμα του πελαργού','A reporter notices an old man in a border town who may be an important Greek politician who disappeared mysteriously years ago.','/xRO8mgYDV8DBrI92bSEcmTm3d5Z.jpg','1991-12-04',142,'Released',NULL,'The Suspended Step of the Stork',47432,1.8288,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11324,_binary '\0','/qDDaOIwlahViQMFMOnPeBYcUp3X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102443',7.1,10722,'en','A Midnight Clear','In 1944 France, an American Intelligence Squad locates a German Platoon wishing to surrender rather than die in Germany\'s final war offensive. The two groups of men, isolated from the war at present, put aside their differences and spend Christmas together before the surrender plan turns bad and both sides are forced to fight the other.','/cOLBAnK2PvHxwjdEHQl4n3pZI14.jpg','1992-04-24',108,'Released','At the frontlines of life, near the end of innocence, came the beginning of manhood.','A Midnight Clear',23908,2.9307,6.534,'iSimkm8AOQw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11325,_binary '\0','/PFrzqXuT0yEGEmcbXDwPOUKCsS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102456',6.8,7656,'en','Mississippi Masala','Years after her Indian family was forced to flee their Uganda home, twentysomething Mina finds herself co-operating a motel in the faraway land of Mississippi. Her passionate romance with charming Black carpet cleaner Demetrius challenges the prejudices of their conservative families and exposes the rifts between the region\'s Indian and African-American communities.','/b2Gks4Stt98FRI5isaL6Wu1luhh.jpg','1991-09-18',118,'Released','Passion. Tradition. Mix it up.','Mississippi Masala',41791,3.1418,6.4,'seHuOmdcJqg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11326,_binary '\0','/4o7TR3cXROgKBeN3ulras4pATDz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102458',6.4,1386,'en','Mister Johnson','In 1923 British Colonial Nigeria, Mister Johnson is an oddity -- an educated black man who doesn\'t really fit in with the natives or the British. He works for the local British magistrate, and considers himself English, though he has never been to England. He is always scheming, trying to get ahead, which lands him in a lot of hot water.','/pkvaIlFJOw4CKm7820Rhw7t9xUJ.jpg','1991-03-22',101,'Released','Africa 1923: A clash of cultures between British imperalists and a black man too smart for his own good.','Mister Johnson',123772,1.7488,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11327,_binary '\0','/mA9W30ULHSq4EEOaPygxOxBYMy8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102460',5.9,10382,'en','Mobsters','The story of a group of friends in turn of the century New York, from their early days as street hoods to their rise in the world of organized crime...','/l7GfcGzH4UQzzP0Q3EfBiDbm5yu.jpg','1991-07-26',104,'Released','They didn\'t take orders...They took over.','Mobsters',21219,3.0421,6.312,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11328,_binary '\0','/ilzci8evsVgZGYZVOXmqMAQ0VNf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102465',6.1,3124,'fr','Mon père, ce héros','Veronique, living with her divorced mother, is going on holiday to Mauritius with her father. To impress a local boy, Benjamin, she manages to complicate the situation by making up stories about her father. She presents him as her lover, a mercenary and even a secret agent which gets her into trouble and then her father has to start playing along...','/yk7z3gksMdu8YLivoJGmW9Q9Veu.jpg','1991-10-23',105,'Released',NULL,'My Father the Hero',20978,2.6619,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11329,_binary '\0','/via3WWcbprE8uuOwsJtNfAVdiRa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102469',5.8,10660,'en','Mortal Thoughts','A loathsome man ends up dead, but it\'s not clear who\'s to blame. If ever a person got what he deserved, it\'s James Urbanksi, an abusive drunk who steals from his wife, Joyce, and promises her close friend Cynthia Kellogg that she\'ll be the next target of his rage. At a group outing, James bleeds to death after someone cuts his throat. But because he\'s such a terrible human being, police aren\'t sure which of his acquaintances decided to kill him.','/3Py7bFBsRjMVdOI5IlNSz6aa385.jpg','1991-04-19',104,'Released','Something terrible happened that night. Something everyone wanted to talk about. Something no one was telling the truth about.','Mortal Thoughts',30815,3.9897,5.7,'gq6N0hzaQWU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11330,_binary '\0','/fqZxzpo1pd7tHbgTGPbYGxNEZ8u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102482',6.3,1399,'en','Murder 101','Charles Lattimore, an author of a book about a famous murder trial, arranges to meet with one of his students one night. When the student is found murdered and Lattimore has no alibi, he suspects he is being framed by the subject of his book.','/6Z6GYIpljSkKpqBrACBGgl8FUwg.jpg','1991-03-20',100,'Released',NULL,'Murder 101',27494,1.8786,5,'7i2oopv-TXs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11331,_binary '\0','/vSd89kiENYeFa6mPHzsM5BgliPm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102492',6.9,99356,'en','My Girl','Vada Sultenfuss is obsessed with death. Her mother is dead, and her father runs a funeral parlor. She is also in love with her English teacher, and joins a poetry class over the summer just to impress him. Thomas J., her best friend, is \"allergic to everything\", and sticks with Vada despite her hangups. When Vada\'s father hires Shelly, and begins to fall for her, things take a turn to the worse...','/qyJJNHteA7BUwQSey05t7qP4vRV.jpg','1991-11-21',103,'Released','When your Dad\'s an undertaker, your Mom\'s in heaven, and your Grandma\'s got a screw loose...it\'s good to have a friend who understands you. Even if he is a boy.','My Girl',4032,6.9477,7.4,'KSyKO0Lklmo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11332,_binary '\0','/stSaFz5CtMXwIj3r4MDjqxqWRot.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102494',6.9,68004,'en','My Own Private Idaho','In this loose adaptation of Shakespeare\'s \"Henry IV,\" Mike Waters is a hustler afflicted with narcolepsy. Scott Favor is the rebellious son of a mayor. Together, the two travel from Portland, Oregon to Idaho and finally to the coast of Italy in a quest to find Mike\'s estranged mother. Along the way they turn tricks for money and drugs, eventually attracting the attention of a wealthy benefactor and sexual deviant.','/p9TF90Pb5yg2MNb2UztzyXktMm4.jpg','1991-02-01',104,'Released','Wherever, whatever, have a nice day.','My Own Private Idaho',468,7.2549,7,'cNENMVQfOus','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11333,_binary '\0','/tdNaqH7hqTjCvpG3ff6jZbgbptx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102500',6,3585,'en','Mystery Date','Tom McHugh quickly learns that his perfect big brother Craig isn\'t all he\'s cracked up to be while on a night on the town with the girl next door, during which Tom is harassed by unpleasant strangers, threatened by mobsters, pursued by police, attacked by an irate florist, accused of murder, and has his date kidnapped—all because everyone thinks he\'s Craig...and the classic 1959 DeSoto Firesweep he borrowed off his brother has two dead bodies in the trunk.','/vof40ryhBNTEvtjHl1somhdrXm.jpg','1991-08-16',97,'Released',NULL,'Mystery Date',53027,2.3246,5.798,'P2i6ML7w3Yc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11334,_binary '\0','/kCW0C3Bv5IsasICx3StdNEejfB5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102510',6.9,143199,'en','The Naked Gun 2½: The Smell of Fear','Bumbling lieutenant Frank Drebin is out to foil the big boys in the energy industry, who intend to suppress technology that will put them out of business.','/v9niLQWVzVPB1cP1ThNdEaLZG1Q.jpg','1991-06-28',85,'Released','If you see only one movie this year... you ought to get out more often.','The Naked Gun 2½: The Smell of Fear',37137,11.5199,6.818,'WvY-X4P5y7Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11335,_binary '\0','/mBteXONDhdVyXRNxj54eMNGNqyT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102511',6.9,61428,'en','Naked Lunch','Blank-faced bug killer Bill Lee and his dead-eyed wife, Joan, like to get high on Bill\'s pest poisons while lounging with Beat poet pals. After meeting the devilish Dr. Benway, Bill gets a drug made from a centipede. Upon indulging, he accidentally kills Joan, takes orders from his typewriter-turned-cockroach, ends up in a constantly mutating Mediterranean city and learns that his hip friends have published his work -- which he doesn\'t remember writing.','/u01kh5jKUWjhom76mguRqUgdvja.jpg','1991-12-27',115,'Released','Exterminate all rational thought.','Naked Lunch',2742,4.7561,7,'nj04OcONu2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11336,_binary '\0','/vKADL4Ux4liQqnNJEv2RT66gdzZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102517',6.2,14079,'en','Necessary Roughness','When the Texas State University Fightin\' Armadillos football team is disqualified for cheating and poor grades, the University is forced to pick from a team that actually goes to school. Will they even win a single game?','/lZsD4izDMKbV1KTRUQ5UVWZrnLJ.jpg','1991-09-27',108,'Released','This gang of loners, loonies and losers are about to become something they\'ve never been before... a team.','Necessary Roughness',20704,3.0668,5.5,'Z0zgO-bMeqc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11337,_binary '\0','/3fSlO6VMj5vFxIKvSXCryZVE6M8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102522',5.2,4759,'de','Nekromantik 2','Monika lives with Rob, a corpse she loves. Her dilemma intensifies when she meets Mark and considers a normal life with him. She must choose between her affection for Rob and a new relationship.','/q1CtldLFgg4kRP81o0mY9f42ubJ.jpg','1991-05-07',103,'Released','The return of the loving dead','Nekromantik 2',48636,3.0131,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11338,_binary '\0','/u3fFEz0NdoyXL3UUxTPNqeM2vrc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102526',6.7,42821,'en','New Jack City','A gangster, Nino, is in the Cash Money Brothers, making a million dollars every week selling crack. A cop, Scotty, discovers that the only way to infiltrate the gang is to become a dealer himself.','/k9VjzXyGElRAxXyXgPvtRRSznyL.jpg','1991-03-08',101,'Released','They\'re a new breed of gangster. The new public enemy. The new family of crime.','New Jack City',10952,5.2666,6.74,'V3UsuLYfwKo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11339,_binary '\0','/xOeGBXInQnwV9BGlneL8r65nL3q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102536',7.6,71750,'en','Night on Earth','A quintet of cabbies in five cities and their remarkable fares on the same eventful night.','/ktejUHCo6c8DekpOtR3uSb6oDXr.jpg','1991-12-12',129,'Released','Five taxis. Five cities. One night.','Night on Earth',339,5.0332,7.509,'F1m6GlPyOSU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11340,_binary '\0','/cUqqeHxAeJ6heHOJjCKczNc9lhb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102555',6.6,18139,'en','Not Without My Daughter','An American woman, trapped in Islamic Iran by her brutish husband, must find a way to escape with her daughter as well.','/aEMncPIHISpaIJmYaIstS0TVnb7.jpg','1991-01-11',116,'Released','In 1984, Betty Mahmoody\'s husband took his wife and daughter to meet his family in Iran. He swore they would be safe. They would be happy. They would be free to leave. He lied.','Not Without My Daughter',9585,5.3861,6.9,'5rEuC5Mx_gY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11341,_binary '\0','/5Uo0vXeg7KDTDwodKy9FC5f5K8N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102558',5.2,30658,'en','Nothing but Trouble','While attempting to seduce gorgeous lawyer Diane Lightson, wealthy gadabout Chris Thorne agrees to drive her to Atlantic City, N.J. But, when some reckless driving draws the attention of a deeply critical cop, they and the flamboyant \"Brazillionaires\" who tagged along end up in the court of a grotesque and vengeful judge, who has a special vendetta against the wealthy and erudite.','/Apk5Hbby70diyeMHd2VhxUSHNW.jpg','1991-02-15',94,'Released','All they wanted was a little getaway. All they got was nothing but trouble.','Nothing but Trouble',11933,6.2634,5.3,'DbvIjtP7lxE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11342,_binary '\0','/4w6KujcSnUaaxV9lztg5Tedwe05.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102562',5.9,1555,'cn','女機械人','When evil inventor Ryuichi Yamamoto transfers his mind into that of a powerful cyborg, he becomes a murderer and rapist. But when one of his victims, Police officer Selina Lam becomes super robot Eve-R27, she teams up with android sidekick Ann and together they seek to bring the criminally insane scientist to justice.','/3ikwwNbk7GVorndt8lUyzaqIWpu.jpg','1991-05-31',98,'Released',NULL,'Robotrix',64348,4.7269,5.9,'6Ar03JnjKVs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11343,_binary '\0','/giYIlMVOAC04l2QHbQdrC4vxW77.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102569',2.7,1945,'en','A Nymphoid Barbarian in Dinosaur Hell','In a post-Armageddon world, a young woman finds herself in a fight for survival against mutant cavemen, dinosaurs and other prehistoric animals.','/WRBIxSWgzG0SZDrYhIVycbSieb.jpg','1990-12-21',82,'Released','Where the prehistoric meets the prepubescent.','A Nymphoid Barbarian in Dinosaur Hell',31647,1.4483,3.4,'rls1bGh5Hmg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11344,_binary '\0','/7ycZDUVlJnPRUwJjUvG8po6yPq7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102571',7.7,3519,'cs','Obecná škola','The time is 1945-46. 10 year old Eda and his friend Tonda live in a small village outside Prague. In school, their class is so wild and indisciplined that their teacher quits and is replaced by the militant Igor Hnidzo. He is very strict – but also very fair. His weakness though, is his interest in young women.','/zki69hEHaqyirdq7mn5Qq1FRVgC.jpg','1991-08-08',100,'Released',NULL,'The Elementary School',18141,1.7468,7.312,'3WGneTMMfdc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11345,_binary '\0','/4r01MVXD2iUc7bv9q5K9dGvL4CF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102573',5.6,2504,'en','The Object of Beauty','American couple Jake and Tina are living in an expensive London hotel above their means, incurring a sizeable debt. When they are asked to pay a lavish dinner bill and Jake\'s card is declined, he suggests they sell Tina\'s tiny, expensive Henry Moore sculpture to cover the debt. After they hatch a scheme to claim the sculpture was stolen in order to collect insurance on it, the sculpture mysteriously goes missing.','/vtxTzSrjCDH7Ray4RK8FPUrrlSy.jpg','1991-04-12',103,'Released','Love is more than dollars and sex.','The Object of Beauty',88818,2.6699,5.2,'SzHOBTbU1Xg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11346,_binary '\0','/dyKYoPOtfuyng0cVhxIBxgybgwp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102579',5.7,5428,'sv','Den ofrivillige golfaren','I bet anyone can get better at golf than you are in one week, a golfer says to her golfing businessman for a boyfriend in a quarrel. Unfortunately Stig-Helmer is standing nearby when the boyfriend accepts the bet, and he is chosen to be the competitor. Stig-Helmer has never played the game before, but his Norwegian friend Ole promises to help him.','/zmcWIVrAZLreCapAjp02bQOHp7y.jpg','1991-12-25',107,'Released',NULL,'The Accidental Golfer',24646,1.4228,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11347,_binary '\0','/an9gpNYJtdFgxchfZieNwWM4kRs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102583',7.5,1976,'fr','Olivier, Olivier','Olivier, the nine-year-old son of Elisabeth and Serge, a country veterinarian, vanishes one afternoon on the way to his grandmother\'s house. The emotional aftermath of his disappearance sends his father packing and nearly destroys his mother.','/zCQu2vWMuVKzKTRhDdPCwYTJhZY.jpg','1992-10-28',104,'Released','Life is never as innocent as it seems.','Olivier, Olivier',124096,2.0927,6.3,'LtNu5-w3uwA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11348,_binary '\0','/7IJHdLr4Bi0rCBgXblVzHGfeyAg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102585',3.9,9052,'en','Omen IV: The Awakening','Damien Thorn is dead, but his prophecy is reborn in a mysterious girl named Delia, who is adopted by two attorneys.','/oRcRyiVRnR1u3LJQL8VMryvyatF.jpg','1991-07-19',97,'Released','Damien\'s prophecy is reborn!','Omen IV: The Awakening',17792,4.9537,5.032,'QgFR3GWl5OI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11349,_binary '\0','/jsIxoKIuH6lLt4Y3NW7Tf1BwcIO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102587',7.6,43138,'ja','おもひでぽろぽろ','In lyrical switches between the present and the past, Taeko contemplates the arc of her life, and wonders if she has been true to the dreams of her childhood self.','/tOSnFE9e82iH3ZAzSTtuOkBsabJ.jpg','1991-07-20',119,'Released','I\'m going on a trip with me.','Only Yesterday',15080,8.0251,7.395,'5gSKk-wwLsY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11350,_binary '\0','/6Nir2XRqtFM68bxTm3s6wolmERN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102590',6.5,5502,'en','Once Around','A struggling woman finds unexpected love with a charismatic older salesman at a real estate seminar. Their passionate relationship clashes with the values of her family, particularly her father.','/A8uBNt0C5hpj1N1UqAUAqHexT3A.jpg','1991-01-18',115,'Released','The Bellas were one big happy family. Then Renata met Sam...','Once Around',39233,2.2575,6.1,'Bnm0HBGrq9c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11351,_binary '\0','/iwOolqARbddbajguEIxM2ClP3aw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102592',7.1,16993,'en','One False Move','Following a series of drug deals and murders, three criminals -- Fantasia, Ray Malcolm and Pluto -- travel from Los Angeles to Houston, finally arriving in a small Arkansas town to go into hiding. Two detectives from the LAPD, who are already on the case, contact the town\'s sheriff, Dale Dixon, to alert him of the fugitives\' presence in the area. Underestimating Dixon, the criminals have no idea what they are about to face.','/x5xCkGw4jutMcc8nmWLKNzbDKht.jpg','1992-05-08',105,'Released','There was no crime in Star City, Arkansas. No murder. And no fear. Until now.','One False Move',21128,4.0872,6.7,'FN24JTHbdoo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11352,_binary '\0','/v0sPbGwxAbXWOdOSb6BjxN1oEri.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102593',5.9,5010,'en','One Good Cop','When his partner is killed in the line of duty, Artie Lewis becomes the legal guardian of his three orphaned girls. But during his investigation of the case, Lewis finds his life – and that of his newfound family – on the line. That\'s when the guilty crime-lord comes face to face with one man\'s rage, one man\'s fury, one man\'s justice.','/iGhP7xi3Dm7dDgg7JbnQvTPBgYw.jpg','1991-05-03',104,'Released','How far will one man go to be a good father and stay...','One Good Cop',71142,3.3698,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11353,_binary '\0','/dt4Hj4TMHAIz8DRJs7x36giLY8o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102598',6.4,13577,'en','Only the Lonely','Danny Muldoon, a Chicago policeman, still lives with his overbearing mother Rose. He meets and falls in love with Theresa Luna, whose father owns the local funeral parlour. Naturally, his mother objects to the relationship, and Danny and Theresa must either overcome her objections or give up the romance.','/rfHLYKddffTEfPbnXNrp8Oc4Owj.jpg','1991-05-24',104,'Released','Before he can tie the knot, he has to untie the apron strings.','Only the Lonely',2611,4.8115,6.2,'o-ti18c-FE8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11354,_binary '\0','/6fAIKXVzkIil9NEyYuwvSivWvV9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102603',6.6,37446,'en','Oscar','Angelo \"Snaps\" Provolone made his dying father a promise on his deathbed: he would leave the world of crime and become an honest businessman. Despite having no experience in making money in a legal fashion, Snaps sets about to keep his promise.','/rGJOzUwHlkx8MKy2oR2qEiT7g4G.jpg','1991-04-26',109,'Released','In crime and comedy, timing is everything.','Oscar',11890,4.3074,6.4,'wdqHmipO4ac','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11355,_binary '\0','/mTy8uXEkLS50kwtZYNgEYhPRrNp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102609',6.2,10211,'en','Other People\'s Money','When a corporate raider threatens a hostile takeover of a \'mom and pop\' company, the patriarch of the company enlists the help of his wife\'s attractive daughter—who is a lawyer—to stop the takeover. However, the raider soon becomes infatuated with her, and enjoys the legal manoeuvring as he tries to win her heart.','/obnOuFa2yJRorRM3rab3rXZFfEh.jpg','1991-10-18',103,'Released','Meet Larry the Liquidator. Arrogant. Greedy. Self-centered. Ruthless. You gotta love the guy.','Other People\'s Money',6463,3.851,6.1,'QMNOgmIDle8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11356,_binary '\0','/vh4b3D4SOTAQzuPVrZPiETQuUlW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102614',6.1,28244,'en','Out for Justice','Gino Felino is an NYPD detective from Brooklyn who knows everyone and everything in his neighborhood. Killing his partner was someone\'s big mistake... because he\'s now out for justice.','/nmfM1diysOyrX4JbvwS7uOomyes.jpg','1991-04-12',91,'Released','He\'s a cop. It\'s a dirty job... but somebody\'s got to take out the garbage.','Out for Justice',14362,7.7909,6.176,'CWWgwldxwII','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11357,_binary '\0','/770r9zi6lzjDPBcvepyZv83IEeQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102629',7.9,6323,'de','Pappa ante Portas','Heinrich Lohse, a strict and highly efficient purchasing manager at a company bulk-orders 40 tons of mustard and enough typewriting paper for 40 years just to get discount. Heinrich\'s boss decides it’s time for him to retire early. Heinrich suddenly finds himself with nothing to do—except micromanage his household, much to the dismay of his wife Renate and their son Dieter','/vtJOj6mkZ8kKwDNjUgZmYwEforq.jpg','1991-02-21',84,'Released',NULL,'Pappa ante Portas',4695,1.819,7.6,'msVuas9XxfQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11358,_binary '\0','/c18bq6rmBHYaL8nqoo0ldnh6x7j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102631',6.7,3459,'en','Paradise','A 10-year-old boy spends a summer in the country with a childless couple and a precocious girl.','/yZ5va4MN4AMNhkRM0bl7VuvZjpE.jpg','1991-09-18',111,'Released','It would take a miracle to save their love... and that\'s just what they got.','Paradise',68430,2.2524,6.2,'J4Mwo8MyI10','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11359,_binary '\0','/l0ZrCJM2HDfoldzZjAwBh9uYmS7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102636',7.8,4175,'hi','Parinda','Brothers Kishan and Karan grow up in Bombay. Karan soon leaves to study in America while Kishan enters into a life of crime, falling under the sway of Anna Seth, a drug lord. When Karan returns to Bombay, Kishan intends to keep him as far away from his criminal life as possible, but things don\'t go as planned.','/5iVDKpzPr1egzNsKjIDL2maVEe5.jpg','1989-11-03',154,'Released','The Most Powerful Film Ever Made','Parinda',58045,1.7635,7.214,'JLDXahysxZ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11360,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102638',6.4,1806,'en','Paris Trout','Paris Trout is a vile Southern bigot. He owns a store and is a loanshark. He often sues people, and so his lawyer, Harry Seagraves, eventually meets Paris\' wife Hannah. A former schoolteacher, she made the mistake of her life when she married Paris, who brutalizes her. Soon Paris goes beyond the overgenerous bounds of what a man in his position can get away with even in the segregated South, leading to a spiral of perverse insanity.','/boLdI99ZK1jmtJyaVnHPDoxacyG.jpg','1991-04-21',93,'Released','A brutal murder in a small town. A triangle of passion, power and rage.','Paris Trout',54191,1.5962,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11361,_binary '\0','/eo35maafdMVSFkzK8kgcrdwmRa0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102645',5.6,1444,'hi','पत्थर के फूल','Suraj falls in love with Kiran and doesn\'t know that she is the daughter of an underworld kingpin. Suraj\'s life takes a drastic turn when the same criminal kills his father.','/KzHGIzbHB7YVf9OFdpRx2zglBk.jpg','1991-02-12',161,'Released',NULL,'Patthar Ke Phool',161395,1.0651,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11362,_binary '\0','/33mHc2mDmhhhSEmulKZxDWuKeJH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102655',6,5470,'en','The Perfect Weapon','Jeff, a young delinquent, is enrolled by his father in a kenpo school, in the hopes of teaching the boy some self-discipline. Years later, Jeff\'s mentor, Kim, is being threatened by one of the Korean mafia families. Jeff tries to help his old friend, but is too late to prevent Kim\'s death at the hands of an unknown hitman. Vowing revenge, Jeff takes on all of the families, using his martial arts skills to find the man who killed his friend.','/cCXDdDDgNxvtQVzBw9TfTz1QYjm.jpg','1991-03-15',85,'Released','No gun. No knife. No equal. Just try him.','The Perfect Weapon',34421,4.0485,6.4,'DLorSv91q0Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11363,_binary '\0','/9uqZnK1AYYp9RsWHS1xcDGJuBlm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102667',5.9,1643,'it','Un piede in paradiso','Bull Webster is a taxi driver with some work problems on his hands: the Spider Corporation, a giant financial holding company, has decided to buy out his taxi co-operative in order to make it go bankrupt and purchase its land at a low cost.','/fM0MHqHn11rJhcNrIhkUF0GyR9o.jpg','1991-03-15',99,'Released',NULL,'Speaking of the Devil',11719,2.5584,5.9,'0sjAl_Yr9Ek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11364,_binary '\0','/n6yn7shFhcx4m1XSArn4MovbjSH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102674',6.8,1573,'en','Pistol: The Birth of a Legend','A story about the great basketball player \"Pistol\" Pete Maravich when he was in the eighth grade. He plays on the varsity basketball team at Daniel High School but has some very difficult obstacles standing in his way of playing. The only support he has is from his father, retired basketball pro Press Maravich.','/p4R0VvSecMgQ3QG8aZ8ksR40IRe.jpg','1991-09-29',104,'Released','The story behind the life of one of the greatest basketball players of all time.','Pistol: The Birth of a Legend',50503,1.5163,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11365,_binary '\0','/yGOHbICOQwlJ20UjK8F2ChGJjvl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102685',7.3,229655,'en','Point Break','In Los Angeles, a gang of bank robbers who call themselves The Ex-Presidents commit their crimes while wearing masks of Reagan, Carter, Nixon and Johnson. Believing that the members of the gang could be surfers, the F.B.I. sends young agent Johnny Utah to the beach undercover to mix with the surfers and gather information.','/tlbERIghrQ4oofqlbF7H0K0EYnx.jpg','1991-07-12',122,'Released','100% pure adrenaline.','Point Break',1089,14.5852,7.2,'KywiWyPjrOg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11366,_binary '\0','/qo249QOxhnvHfTqaSUuGQmPfR34.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102687',6.3,5528,'en','Poison','A trio of interweaved transgressive tales, telling a bizarre stories of suburban patricide and a miraculous flight from justice, a mad sex experiment which unleashes a disfiguring plague, and the obsessive sexual relationship between two prison inmates.','/MW47kViKJcFtt8hQV3EYaOw6zI.jpg','1991-04-05',85,'Released',NULL,'Poison',47620,2.4225,6,'CDJZp7fOmsY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11367,_binary '\0','/pw83xdkoZdJoKWaNzRn2HQc8mNC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102690',5.9,7211,'en','Popcorn','While holding a horror film festival, a group of students are stalked by a madman who may have a sinister connection to a cult leader.','/o6peTotMLdRLQ5Hq2oJI5EYurIR.jpg','1991-02-01',91,'Released','Buy a bag. Go home in a box.','Popcorn',39875,2.1588,5.765,'jdzj8iKYEos','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11368,_binary '\0','/sJfAqctKqTzX2EsoPxaxtjVdKxE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102691',5.1,1761,'en','The Pope Must Die','A less-than-qualified and far-from-perfect priest is mistakenly named the new pope. As the pontiff, he must deal with Vatican corruption, the Mob and the reappearance of his old lover.','/8oIN7fEJsCs9fAXXM3dszcv53TQ.jpg','1991-06-21',99,'Released','Our Father who art in trouble...','The Pope Must Die',79927,2.2924,5,'RWA_4EWEoGA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11369,_binary '\0','/a810fMdI8ZDKZhBl6lyDZVmKrm7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102701',8,2447,'hi','प्रहार','Prahaar is the story of Major Chavan, a tough and stern soldier, trained to destroy the enemy. He can see the enemy on our borders but is unaware of the invisible enemy within ourselves. When one of Major\'s Commandos - Peter D\'Souza is killed, he is shown the harsh reality revolving around us, the enemy is within ourselves. The battlefield changes and Major Chavan makes his final attack on the enemy within this crumbling society.','/1k45jZdMMo7i8GuMI749lEu5Kkr.jpg','1991-01-01',166,'Released','The Final Attack','Prahaar',140883,1.0774,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11370,_binary '\0','/68eSXBnSpPhPNuNntk2GaYUxtq7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102703',5.6,3056,'en','Prayer of the Rollerboys','Griffin, a rollerblader in the not so distant future of an economically wrecked Los Angeles, races against time to save both his younger brother and the city from the fate dealt out by the fascist rollerblading street gang, the Rollerboys.','/7YjtI2teTkhNZouCiFLvfmsOHQw.jpg','1991-03-21',95,'Released','In the 21st Century, it\'s gonna take one man and his blades to save the world from another man...and HIS blades.','Prayer of the Rollerboys',44568,2.724,5.7,'w-_7EVc0JXs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11371,_binary '\0','/9mxPnHTvBXpzMSFwWS38BvzgEgc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102709',5.4,2020,'en','Rage - Furia primitiva','A scientist at a Florida university inadvertently creates a \"rage virus\" while performing experiments intended to restore dead brain tissue in baboons. When a journalist for the college paper breaks into the campus lab, he\'s bitten by one of the infected baboons; the virus soon spreads to a trio of rapists and a valley girl, all of whom go on killing sprees.','/y6bZk79VHK4XvZo6dAJd6Z9JgKq.jpg','1988-12-01',92,'Released','There\'s a new party animal on campus. She\'ll bring out the beast in you!','Primal Rage',90941,2.0929,5.3,'nwJqWwq99as','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11372,_binary '\0','/oqosaCWqrh3geYMksXhBaZQjwOJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102713',6.8,21708,'en','The Prince of Tides','A troubled Southern man talks to his suicidal sister\'s psychiatrist about their family history and falls in love with her (and New York City) in the process.','/1AyeW3YlwfhRwLDeUCW686obceb.jpg','1991-12-25',132,'Released','A story about the memories that haunt us, and the truth that sets us free.','The Prince of Tides',10333,5.4598,6.6,'gyy_A4wNQa8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11373,_binary '\0','/qb2XAxTtfucni9Y1I6GTD2SMWfE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102715',6.6,1254,'en','Prisoner of Honor','France, 1897: Colonel Georges Picquart challenges the government when he discovers the obscure political maneuvers that leads to the imprisonment of the Jewish Captain Alfred Dreyfus after being convicted of espionage three years earlier.','/pSCqyMQrSnmM4f4FUSl5leGCYIG.jpg','1991-11-02',88,'Released','As the battle raged, one man fought alone','Prisoner of Honor',233156,1.4216,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11374,_binary '\0','/eMQ8pdAgOQ3LHpyylkm5F51OChW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102719',5,25415,'en','Problem Child 2','Junior and his father, Ben, move from Cold River to Mortville. Junior becomes threatened by Ben\'s desire to date again and find a new mother for Junior, and sabotages each of his dates.','/dnmw3F3rdbxb08zSdfHHMwfXMLI.jpg','1991-07-03',90,'Released','He’s bad. She’s worse.','Problem Child 2',28597,6.1167,5.958,'Qmvf4Jr0AEg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11375,_binary '\0','/1EVBIHiydd9p1PiiIqshWZrpQTo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102721',7.2,7627,'en','Proof','Martin, a young blind photographer, is divided between his friendship with restaurant worker Andy and the exclusive love that Celia—who is terribly jealous of this new friendship—has for him.','/sDWGe24TVQOHy0ZBQ8yek4P8fZn.jpg','1991-08-15',90,'Released','Before love, comes trust. Before trust, comes...','Proof',14904,2.1064,6.7,'PixfPsnh5Xw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11376,_binary '\0','/cRC3YsfboAmLnVwlYNaHIQquJUJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102722',6.8,7108,'en','Prospero\'s Books','An exiled magician finds an opportunity for revenge against his enemies muted when his daughter and the son of his chief enemy fall in love in this uniquely structured retelling of the \'The Tempest\'.','/lF9uNTBDtpQOGHrKGWc6rqDDwbM.jpg','1991-08-30',126,'Released','A magician\'s spell, the innocence of young love and a dream of revenge unite to create a tempest.','Prospero\'s Books',5048,2.3236,6.8,'ZRNLYaXP_h0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11377,_binary '\0','/1n5pOyD8aseJ5oyPY3RlK5SS1hW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102724',5.4,11204,'en','Psycho IV: The Beginning','When he hears talk radio host Fran Ambrose discussing the topic of matricide, Norman calls in under a false name to tell his story.','/vxWTkQRAvTvA6rbBhsdC4pdnHuq.jpg','1990-11-10',96,'Released','You\'ve met Norman, now meet Mother...','Psycho IV: The Beginning',40377,3.9444,5.7,'DbotJWP9zZc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11378,_binary '\0','/c6DUP4WP18Ei5nUZK6EfNDiFKoy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102729',5.8,8300,'en','Pure Luck','The daughter of a wealthy businessman has disappeared in Mexico, and all the efforts to find her have been unsuccessful. A psychologist, knowing that the girl has an ultra bad luck, persuades her father to send to Mexico one of his employees, an accountant with super bad luck, to find her. Perhaps he will be lucky, and his bad luck could help to find the unlucky girl.','/3ZFbRfsSa04TTHzqcEFZtk6YYPe.jpg','1991-08-09',96,'Released','Somewhere on the Mexican Riviera, a beautiful, rich heiress has gone missing. Only one man can find her. Unfortunately, they sent two.','Pure Luck',19065,3.8833,5.6,'1v62J4tishs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11379,_binary '\0','/k7QF9LH6isFe4XzkvTKnq7qClzl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102737',6.5,1311,'cn','情聖','Valentino is a mediocre con artist who crosses paths with Kwan, a fellow con artist. Together, they impersonate various people and create numerous schemes to make money. Meanwhile, gangsters are making a scheme of their own.','/dQxM0RkVtxhDbMRWl91QsG3gr0E.jpg','1991-10-09',96,'Released',NULL,'The Magnificent Scoundrels',56124,2.7436,6.5,'77w5-T_J96U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11380,_binary '\0','/dAih755ASdQ3cGC2TIf7zxtPdd0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102741',5.7,2012,'en','Queens Logic','When childhood friends Al, Dennis and Eliot get together for Ray\'s wedding, which may or may not happen, they end up on a roller-coaster ride through reality. During one tumultuous, crazy weekend, they face adulthood and each other with new found maturity and discover what Queens Logic is all about. This comedy takes a look at friendship, loyalty, and love.','/3hFeEhS6xr7f0JUNu5m0okitJai.jpg','1991-02-01',114,'Released','We\'re Talkin\' Human Experience Here!','Queens Logic',49792,2.6631,5.8,'JYOZu5EETT0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11381,_binary '\0','/acceAT7dXF46O6ksnowcVAbnkY3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102744',6.9,27797,'en','Quigley Down Under','American Matt Quigley answers Australian land baron Elliott Marston\'s ad for a sharpshooter to kill the dingoes on his property. But when Quigley finds out that Marston\'s real target is the aborigines, Quigley hits the road. Now, even American expatriate Crazy Cora can\'t keep Quigley safe in his cat-and-mouse game with the homicidal Marston.','/93HWOYFsjLsCJC8RawGLv1ANZwS.jpg','1990-10-17',119,'Released','The West was never this far west.','Quigley Down Under',9588,5.0743,6.7,'IpbydeNAmJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11382,_binary '\0','/9NVKd2ca8gXs6p4uKuAzCcmEK3F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102749',5.9,2552,'en','A Rage in Harlem','A beautiful black gangster\'s moll flees to Harlem with a trunkload of gold after a shootout, unaware that the rest of the gang, and a few other unsavoury characters, are on her trail. A pudgy momma\'s boy becomes the object of her affections and the unlikely hero of the tale.','/nPzZ0DVolHLUMcu8dhQ6EKdNNrW.jpg','1991-05-03',115,'Released','In the next 24 hours they\'ll have to outrun the law, outsmart the mob and outshoot the competition.','A Rage in Harlem',41780,4.0938,5.5,'Ubq6xo4SkfA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11383,_binary '\0','/uAr9ideK1TCMDVTwRRaXr36Kha2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102753',6.5,6184,'en','Rambling Rose','In the Deep South of the 1930s, Rose is taken in by the Hillyer family to serve as housemaid so that she can avoid falling into a life of prostitution. Her appearence and personality is such that all men fall for her, and she knows it. She can\'t help herself from getting into trouble with men.','/hAoluBzewlMqRH4mgFJvr4EPOMw.jpg','1991-09-10',112,'Released','Innocence has never been so seductive.','Rambling Rose',32221,2.6363,6.2,'6uo8yTTrydU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11384,_binary '\0','/ylXFsNIhzq8A5nEqLhPdDYPOnVo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102757',6.3,6487,'en','The Rapture','A lonely telephone operator leading an empty, amoral life finds God – only to have her faith continually tested in ways beyond what she could have imagined.','/4EkFm13ecqO0eszr7OKT8vf1YjJ.jpg','1991-10-04',100,'Released','All will be forgiven... all but one','The Rapture',1411,2.7371,5.7,'QuttvF_nf48','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11385,_binary '\0','/8QZMXIjksrlIQ5BZLtVpUnhh09Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102768',6.7,36540,'en','Regarding Henry','After being shot, a lawyer loses his memory and must relearn speech and mobility, but he has a loving family to support him.','/1gyViKAIpy1jAcM3B17iXNbiHrh.jpg','1991-07-10',108,'Released','The story of a man who had everything, but found something more.','Regarding Henry',11364,6.4452,6.5,'PtipW0DoQBs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11386,_binary '\0','/8vREmZvEKvsz5Ptp1gazc9rAhts.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102782',5.2,23569,'en','Return to the Blue Lagoon','In this sequel to the 1980 classic, two children are stranded on a beautiful island in the South Pacific. With no adults to guide them, the two make a simple life together and eventually become tanned teenagers in love.','/jhUTLuPgc3Qcvr5xtji8oiWSfYy.jpg','1991-08-02',98,'Released','Return to the Romance, Return to the Adventure...','Return to the Blue Lagoon',13888,6.679,6.164,'_qDaxkLUcTM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11387,_binary '\0','/hctxhcBs97EyE0vEWA6Ti9kvTOG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102789',6.2,23114,'en','Ricochet','An attorney is terrorized by the criminal he put away years ago when he was a cop.','/5isHYEcUY0nE90uMhkGrs1nnal.jpg','1991-10-04',102,'Released','This is one case that\'s going to be settled out of court.','Ricochet',9546,5.1404,6.1,'LLTM-Hggcbc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11388,_binary '\0','/A1h79bMECZsYKiDlBm0AP9G5Mlg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102797',5.7,6485,'en','Robin Hood','The Swashbuckling legend of Robin Hood unfolds in the 12th century when the mighty Normans ruled England with an iron fist.','/3wvHxskniqALjqFBjHn6xPbUvzj.jpg','1991-04-26',104,'Released','The Adventure. The Romance. The Legend.','Robin Hood',30840,4.9605,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11389,_binary '\0','/kuLk79GQq8WQb8fZxc6MtvIhPaC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102798',6.9,224341,'en','Robin Hood: Prince of Thieves','Nobleman crusader Robin of Locksley breaks out of a Jerusalem prison with the help of Moorish fellow prisoner Azeem and travels back home to England. But upon arrival he discovers his dead father in the ruins of his family estate, killed by the vicious sheriff of Nottingham, Robin and Azeem join forces with outlaws Little John and Will Scarlett to save the kingdom from the sheriff\'s villainy.','/hbRnWUNJkKKVN5mkcuC5ooqjE4e.jpg','1991-06-14',143,'Released','For the good of all men, and the love of one woman, he fought to uphold justice by breaking the law.','Robin Hood: Prince of Thieves',8367,12.8696,6.855,'DJSsMR5NUuc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11390,_binary '\0','/6lEEh8re6Ge1p7rCG8tvZbkp8ck.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102800',5.5,8233,'en','Robot Jox','50 years after a nuclear war, the two superpowers handle territorial disputes in a different way. Each fields a giant robot to fight one-on-one battles in official matches, each piloted by a man inside, known as robot jockeys or jox. The contest for possession of Alaska will be fought by two of the best. The conscientious Achilles fights for the Americans. Opposing him is a Russian, Alexander.','/j8JgIZkmbpJ80HdR5mBT7fFpRSP.jpg','1990-11-21',85,'Released','The ultimate killing machine. Part Man. Part Metal.','Robot Jox',15618,2.3345,5.527,'8Kd642Ix5ks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11391,_binary '\0','/9iqygVCxucOpxL4hpHTn4D5BUQR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102802',6,11659,'en','Rock-A-Doodle','Chanticleer is a foolhardy farm rooster who believes his crows can actually make the sun come up and shine. When the sun rises one morning without Chanticleer\'s crow, he leaves the farm in disgrace and runs off to become a rock \'n\' roll singer. But in his absence, a sinister, sunshine-hating owl prepares to take over.','/q5xSS8MNmrwR3em6VB6OC3992d6.jpg','1991-08-02',74,'Released','The rousing, rollicking adventure of the world\'s first rockin\' rooster!','Rock-A-Doodle',20421,4.1397,6.2,'w7axM3VHFqs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11392,_binary '\0','/2fQ6d8B0wgKTr2c7aHcDW8DqwIB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102803',6.6,66442,'en','The Rocketeer','A stunt pilot comes across a prototype jetpack that gives him the ability to fly. However, evil forces of the world also want this jetpack at any cost.','/2tDFRESFwKww1LHRE8W1Exj9edH.jpg','1991-06-21',108,'Released','An Ordinary Man Forced to Become An Extraordinary Hero.','The Rocketeer',10249,7.406,6.5,'EWTFiomK4mw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11393,_binary '\0','/yDLFUmq4ublCJFktG3zpMb3tUfR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102812',6.8,3763,'ja','老人Z','Mr. Takazawa, an elderly invalid who is cared for at his home by Haruko, a young nursing student, is chosen by the Japanese Ministry of Public Welfare to test the Z-001, a computerized hospital bed with robotic features that allegedly displays more efficiency and skills than any human nurse, but Haruko mistrusts a machine unable to consider human feelings.','/kpJBEfjC9l7BFhmmGPmkNB8gl6h.jpg','1991-09-14',80,'Released',NULL,'Roujin Z',35648,5.316,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11394,_binary '\0','/tFlb2omDVP8NeHPp2NAz45AO2VC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102813',5.9,3634,'en','Rover Dangerfield','Rover, a street-smart dog owned by a Las Vegas showgirl is dumped off Hoover Dam by the showgirl\'s boyfriend. Rather than drowning, Rover winds up in your basic idyllic farm in a classic city-boy-in-country shtick.','/dM73WqNaIPDj7lwRBOT2ioMFAsq.jpg','1991-07-01',74,'Released','The dog who gets no respect','Rover Dangerfield',22466,2.9371,5.549,'Yf4S8z6496w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11395,_binary '\0','/tdIhdv2NikLvSah9fFXjGX4TeVG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102815',7.1,1779,'pl','Rozmowy kontrolowane','Ryszard Ochódzki receives a special assignment for UB - infiltrating the \"Solidarity\" party branch in Suwałki. His arriving there coincides with the imposition of martial law on Poland.','/vsdp6mpUHd6jYaqqurFY9Rm5Sem.jpg','1991-12-13',93,'Released',NULL,'Controlled Conversations',57721,0.9017,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11396,_binary '\0','/sZhMWwFYPpgnmhntFeg3jyL7nnR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102816',7.4,3254,'cn','阮玲玉','Based on the tragic true story of China\'s first prima donna of the silver screen, Ruan Lingyu, chronicling her rise to fame as a movie actress in Shanghai during the 1930s.','/mrRQD7dJzZ39sgwhbsFQ8kK8UjT.jpg','1991-11-29',155,'Released',NULL,'Center Stage',68004,2.8919,7.3,'SzBtM0Zfckg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11397,_binary '\0','/qBO69YpWWJBR04m08epZyABCbgp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102817',7,2202,'en','Rubin & Ed','Reclusive Rubin Farr teams up with vocal but unsuccessful multi-level salesman Ed Tuttle on a quest to bury Rubin\'s dead cat in the \"perfect spot.\" Their trip takes them across Utah\'s desert where they have run-ins with Ed\'s ex-wife Rula and an elusive Andy Warhol critic.','/tky5hpVgeOuA9cel0sDSZkFdqYP.jpg','1992-05-15',82,'Released','As soon as Ed saves Rubin\'s life, he\'s gonna kill him.','Rubin & Ed',41792,1.2659,6.5,'Ltjw-LiwOiQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11398,_binary '\0','/hD5F3Y98ksgjikInJoRsGD19efp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102818',6.2,3491,'en','Run','When a law student accidentally kills the son of a mob boss in a fight, he finds himself relentlessly pursued by the mob and the police.','/w4sxXgXpALEDFexRZE9cb3j8bb2.jpg','1991-02-01',91,'Released','...because your life depends on it!','Run',48129,2.6313,6.007,'gpcO-cUR_1A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11399,_binary '\0','/cEIOmkANxPKiZulLIdlbpQyt5s8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102820',6.7,11328,'en','Rush','Undercover cop Jim Raynor is a seasoned veteran. His partner, Kristen Cates, is lacking in experience, but he thinks she\'s tough enough to work his next case with him: a deep cover assignment to bring down the notoriously hard-to-capture drug lord Gaines. While their relationship turns romantic during the assignment, they also turn into junkies, and will have to battle their own addictions if they want to bring down Gaines once and for all.','/mYRGsAFhvPmH8umMhsO8EJmhLQX.jpg','1991-12-22',120,'Released','How far do they go before they\'ve gone too far?','Rush',20289,3.0751,6.661,'b0fN88K_hw0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11400,_binary '\0','/vAk1qSnupaCO0Q2tpJzYMygDQN3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102825',7.2,8216,'hi','साजन','Breaking conventional barriers, a poor, disabled orphan befriends the son of a wealthy businessman. However, their friendship is put to the test after both friends fall in love with the same woman.','/wg4WBjFhYZeLaaQhE3NeFyfTn2Y.jpg','1991-08-30',181,'Released',NULL,'Saajan',107745,1.511,6.488,'KKU31Cus9qY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11401,_binary '\0','/xRuuITvWJMtlMqC9o8KQ3QVfpMw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102835',5.2,1671,'hi','सनम बेवफ़ा','Salman falls in love with Ruksar but their fathers, despite being neighbours, are sworn enemies. The couple end up marrying but they are shocked when they finally discover the reason why their fathers allow the marriage to take place.','/mnou9y9BgH7JVmsozvuqGxVPULc.jpg','1991-01-11',161,'Released','Love was never so beautiful','Sanam Bewafa',161396,1.1937,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11402,_binary '\0','/5eMrJ5kEPm50C6Ue6nF29KNsoeI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102842',7.3,2643,'en','Sarah, Plain and Tall','Kansas, 1910. Widowed farmer Jacob Witting finds that taking care of both his farm and two children, Anna and Caleb, is too difficult to handle alone. John takes out an ad in a newspaper for a mail-order bride, to which the \"plain and tall\" Sarah Wheaton answers, soon traveling from Maine to Kansas to become John\'s wife. Despite the love that grows between Sarah and the family, Sarah finds herself homesick, and she must ultimately choose whether or not to stay.','/dNigktllrKYWrvxuBXBi58ZeWqO.jpg','1991-02-03',98,'Released','It took all of her courage to come and all of her love to stay','Sarah, Plain and Tall',15740,2.0959,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11403,_binary '\0','/tBSmIx0eQAvKxdD50VQtEvLzPT9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102844',6.7,1809,'hi','सौदागर','Two childhood friends have become bitter enemies. So much so, in fact, that they have divided their territories and sworn to kill anyone who crosses the boundary. Against this backdrop, their grandchildren fall in love and when their romance surfaces, the rivalry between is rekindled. The two young lovers are told never to see each other again, on pain of death ... when they get together, it\'s too late for their grand family ..','/hcTv8TCuVcwSzCwld8C06pSVCHd.jpg','1991-08-09',213,'Released',NULL,'Saudagar',166017,1.2622,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11404,_binary '\0','/emIKVqvFXZwCrTegVzclxxkJvFR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102848',5.3,4298,'en','Scanners II: The New Order','A breed of humans with dangerously powerful telepathic abilities -- the scanners -- are being recruited by a corrupt police commander, John Forrester, in his crusade to take over the city.','/8vHebWuKWnAW4iT7mKsufcCTY1j.jpg','1991-05-03',104,'Released','10 years later... A new generation of scanners, Born with powers so terrifying, it\'s beyond their control!','Scanners II: The New Order',24331,2.7104,5.272,'wHKOtcXkgyM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11405,_binary '\0','/UZkZvsXsMqHJty1HtreclUQSyj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102849',5.4,5509,'en','Scenes from a Mall','A comedy about a married couple -- he\'s a sports lawyer, she\'s a psychologist -- which takes place on their 16th wedding anniversary, when they make some startling confessions.','/roF5MQlNBFSV0K3s9ThBPIBglO5.jpg','1991-02-22',89,'Released','On their 16th wedding anniversary, Deborah and Nick decided to work out all their differences... in public.','Scenes from a Mall',47762,3.0672,5.2,'GLosc-SIgfM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11406,_binary '\0','/tQDeXcuogjNbqdqPeJxBPD7QUzS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102855',6.2,1664,'en','Cerro Torre: Schrei aus Stein','A meeting of two world famous climbers, one an experienced mountaineer the other a sport climber, and a journalist (Ivan) results in a bet on which of the two is the best climber. Roger (the mountaineering expert) states that Martin (the sport climber) wouldn\'t survive a day on a \'real\' climbing expedition, although he is considered to be the world\'s best sport climber (having just won an indoor \'world championship,\' an event depicted in the opening scene). They plan to climb \'Cerro Torre,\' in the Patagonia region of South America, near the Argentinian/Chilean border, one of the world\'s most difficult mountains, especially considering the extreme weather conditions common to the area.','/egROOqQo00anjXFYd6YDZoM4VA3.jpg','1991-10-03',105,'Released','In this battle, there can be no winners','Scream of Stone',88893,2.5915,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11407,_binary '\0','/tohBD7ybxuAUvLfvUnT2eKbDa9f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102860',5.1,3560,'en','Scissors','A woman trying to recover from a sexual attack is locked in a posh apartment with a corpse of the very man she\'s been dreaming would murder her. She tries to hang on to reality when objects around her seem to come to life.','/xADMLeSZjGCYddcDFyYrRGqyuog.jpg','1991-03-22',105,'Released','Angie is about to step over the edge. All she needs is a little help.','Scissors',41793,3.1661,4.992,'v3Y3hzI6vKo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11408,_binary '\0','/dQCOYbxG1HsHI9MwaophgEyqrbC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102898',5.6,6113,'en','Shakes the Clown','Shakes plods about his duties as party clown, and uses all of his free time getting seriously drunk. Binky, another clown, wins the spot on a local kiddie show, which depresses Shakes even more, and his boss threatens him with unemployment if he can\'t get his act under control.','/nfTWQ7GfH462FVmYEGQB1oHR6H4.jpg','1991-08-28',87,'Released','Loved by children. Desired by women. Adored by bartenders everywhere.','Shakes the Clown',26291,2.0908,5.4,'V7KOt3Hugd4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11409,_binary '\0','/jxSKhN2bLz8zjAaF3IqQjxgHkV9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102900',6.5,13039,'en','Shattered','Dan Merrick comes out from a shattering car accident with amnesia. He finds that he is married to Judith who is trying to help him start his life again. He keeps getting flashbacks about events and places that he can\'t remember. He meets pet shop owner and part time private detective Gus Klein who has supposedly done some work for him prior to the accident. Klein helps Merrick to find out more...','/k3UaQNJ8FAUaHgDhPyT3uEiod8h.jpg','1991-10-11',98,'Released','A love he can\'t forget. A murder he can\'t remember.','Shattered',2071,4.5629,6.161,'TTy-tsPBQK4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11410,_binary '\0','/fIlVgFKJ099KrDGeKcoHwIk4eG5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102910',4.9,1576,'en','Shock \'Em Dead','Martin is a total loser, who nobody cares for. When he fails to get a position as guitar player in Lindsay\'s band and loses his job on the way, he makes a deal with a Voodoo priestess. She promises him the fulfillment of all his dreams if he swears obedience to her. He becomes a rock star and has many women - but to stay alive, he has to kill other people.','/jtxvMkhC7sPwQltcjp5L90bKDbR.jpg','1991-01-31',93,'Released','For the girl of his dreams, he\'d make a deal with the devil.','Shock \'Em Dead',40208,1.3415,4.2,'oOg7mprld8Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11411,_binary '\0','/liUNcihiGtCOASdrK0sio882kQX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102913',5.3,2164,'en','Shout','A new music teacher in a 1955 West Texas home for wayward boys brings new vision and hope for many of the interned boys.','/fgHhbol55iYeFl8I1f3ubtBSdTu.jpg','1991-10-04',89,'Released','Rock & Romance Explode In A Texas Town.','Shout',25674,2.4545,5.8,'1x8HMYiT-S4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11412,_binary '\0','/ywwRHYRgcDKnStvXQxNXKG4M0tx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102915',6.1,22664,'en','Showdown in Little Tokyo','An American with a Japanese upbringing, Chris Kenner is a police officer assigned to the Little Tokyo section of Los Angeles. Kenner is partnered with Johnny Murata, a Japanese-American who isn\'t in touch with his roots. Despite their differences, both men excel at martial arts, and utilize their formidable skills when they go up against Yoshida, a vicious yakuza drug dealer with ties to Kenner\'s past.','/phwuQrs557cJkRhoS1TVWsslnJK.jpg','1991-08-23',79,'Released','One\'s a warrior. One\'s a wise guy. They\'re two L.A. cops going after a gang of drug lords. Feet first.','Showdown in Little Tokyo',13154,6.2604,6.4,'nCD4kbu-QlU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11413,_binary '\0','/aYcnDyLMnpKce1FOYUpZrXtgUye.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102926',8.6,1748933,'en','The Silence of the Lambs','Clarice Starling is a top student at the FBI\'s training academy. Jack Crawford wants Clarice to interview Dr. Hannibal Lecter, a brilliant psychiatrist who is also a violent psychopath, serving life behind bars for various acts of murder and cannibalism. Crawford believes that Lecter may have insight into a case and that Starling, as an attractive young woman, may be just the bait to draw him out.','/uS9m8OBk1A8eM9I042bx8XXpqAq.jpg','1991-02-14',119,'Released','To enter the mind of a killer she must challenge the mind of a madman.','The Silence of the Lambs',274,8.3485,8.345,'6iB21hsprAQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11414,_binary '\0','/dvdxLxcmxOi3enwAhisPHLDDwBM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102932',6.6,3468,'cn','倩女幽魂III：道道道','100 years after the events of the first film, Buddhist Bai Yun and his disciple Fong journey through a small town to transport a golden idol of Buddha. However, local thieves thwart their journey, forcing them to take shelter at the ghostly Orchid Temple.','/3WKqrzr0wpudTkN1nCjedl1BnCe.jpg','1991-07-18',109,'Released','The final battle between god and evil.','A Chinese Ghost Story III',9048,3.5632,6.5,'ZKEpU-Hs4D8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11415,_binary '\0','/jRvsE4wR82sGzz5yIIOCRsoJJhM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102940',4.9,5083,'en','Ski School','Rival groups in a skiing school do battle on and off the piste. One gang are rich and serious, the other group are party animals.','/gDlLWxvr6lMBRevo2RXb0eUF8RQ.jpg','1991-01-11',88,'Released','The hottest action ever to hit the slopes.','Ski School',21811,2.9488,5.1,'Mjzqs6bStXQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11416,_binary '\0','/1gjK6oZSQtvhFBbSgkBvn72dPLF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102943',7,25709,'en','Slacker','Austin, Texas, is an Eden for the young and unambitious, from the enthusiastically eccentric to the dangerously apathetic. Here, the nobly lazy can eschew responsibility in favor of nursing their esoteric obsessions. The locals include a backseat philosopher who passionately expounds on his dream theories to a seemingly comatose cabbie, a young woman who tries to hawk Madonna\'s Pap test to anyone who will listen and a kindly old anarchist looking for recruits.','/f7Iov2nd0XX9bp2laQEPYPEhisc.jpg','1990-07-27',97,'Released',NULL,'Slacker',14022,2.8144,6.7,'EAdgIV7jDgU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11417,_binary '\0','/apUbdi4nGrD5VGIaxErtpsn7ST8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102945',6.3,72578,'en','Sleeping with the Enemy','A young woman fakes her own death in an attempt to escape her nightmarish marriage, but discovers it is impossible to elude her controlling husband.','/zaUkndJP8IClB1gMsbw13PoVeLS.jpg','1991-01-13',99,'Released','She is a stranger in a small town. She changed her name. Her looks. Her life. All to escape the most dangerous man she\'s ever met. Her husband.','Sleeping with the Enemy',7442,7.3995,6.5,'FcQqsrf2gik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11418,_binary '\0','/x9oEk4xkcdt0WWfZJXqXnKWEVSF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102951',6.6,19057,'en','Soapdish','Celeste Talbert is the star of the long-running soap opera \"The Sun Also Sets.\" With the show\'s ratings down, Celeste\'s ruthlessly ambitious co-star, Montana Moorehead, and the show\'s arrogant producer, David Seton Barnes, plot to aggravate her into leaving the show by bringing back her old flame, Jeffrey Anderson, and hiring her beautiful young niece, Lori Craven.','/cDiXGOBa0SjY30rzl26DeSP16bk.jpg','1991-05-31',97,'Released','All that glitter... All that glamour... All that dirt.','Soapdish',25562,4.2857,6.29,'0PLnF8EZu7s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11419,_binary '\0','/eJaDc4tOyhKjsl0PL2Nl0FFF6gG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102958',6.8,4675,'es','Sólo con tu pareja','Tomás Tomás is a young yuppie playboy with a string of discarded girlfriends. But when Silvia, the victim of one of his adventures, tries to get revenge by typing \"positive\" on his AIDS test, Tomás experiences for the first time the realities of love and death.','/pprKQ637rH8ClRMS75VnRtUCiL9.jpg','1992-12-25',94,'Released',NULL,'Sólo con tu pareja',49971,2.2518,6.5,'ca2X2Ztj_MA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11420,_binary '\0','/bv3vfyXE8oBCdbLc4WO6hDU3s3a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102960',5.7,13770,'en','Sometimes They Come Back','Desperate for a job to help him support his family, Jim Norman takes a position teaching high school in the town where his brother was murdered in front of him by teenage bullies twenty-seven years before. The teens who committed the crime are long dead, but now the kids in Jim\'s new class keep dying and being replaced by new students who look like the deceased hoodlums.','/jOsCw4tKKyRcYU1Wygp2V6hhpNm.jpg','1991-05-07',98,'Released','With \"The Shining\" and \"Misery\" Stephen King scared you to death. Now, he\'s going to scare you back to life.','Sometimes They Come Back',27769,5.1329,5.9,'ON6OZy167TE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11421,_binary '\0','/gJlQgSmwiXEIp0RLAhCmTtmsBwm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102969',6.2,2576,'en','Spotswood','Wallace is an efficiency expert, managing the high-profile downsizing of a major auto parts factory. But when he is hired to evaluate a small moccasin factory which seems from another era, Wallace has to reconsider the rapid modernization he advocates, as he is confronted by the human faces such plans hurt.','/t7YiAgDrraufIDlwAFU3fKtm0Hz.jpg','1992-01-23',95,'Released','An everyday story about loyalty, betrayal, lust and footwear.','Spotswood',16982,2.1461,5.4,'REr6AYzOGaE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11422,_binary '\0','/nGJTamFPZ9V4JX5YpiOS0UDuwmx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102975',7.3,85896,'en','Star Trek VI: The Undiscovered Country','After years of war, the Federation and the Klingon empire find themselves on the brink of a peace summit when a Klingon ship is nearly destroyed by an apparent attack from the Enterprise. Both worlds brace for what may be their deadliest encounter.','/tvTOJD7Gz668GLy2nNdLRQvpPsv.jpg','1991-12-06',110,'Released','The battle for peace has begun.','Star Trek VI: The Undiscovered Country',174,7.312,7,'tUQtoL6LpMU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11423,_binary '\0','/6rB9UlHWLRWvJNlNIbK1RW7tUWd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102979',6.5,1389,'en','Stepping Out','A has-been Broadway performer gives tap lessons to a group of misfits who, through their dance classes, bond and realize what they can achieve.','/mxiqMSnRj6a58kb2AhdN6354rsc.jpg','1991-10-11',106,'Released','Your dreams are just a step away','Stepping Out',41795,2.117,5.9,'IFcAKT82yeQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11424,_binary '\0','/lm3kcXEV6Q71QTNDBIITamoTR1A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102984',6.1,11354,'en','Stone Cold','Joe Huff is a tough, loner cop with a flair for infiltrating dangerous biker gangs. The FBI blackmail Huff into an undercover operation that entails infiltrating The Brotherhood – a powerful Mississippi biker gang linked in the murder of government officials as well as dealing drugs with the mafia.','/4nW7wZKKjzZ5zriDfIjpJcZIyZS.jpg','1991-05-17',92,'Released','A cop who enforces his own brand of justice.','Stone Cold',21338,4.0469,6.217,'1bNfag1hosI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11425,_binary '\0','/h8ruAR69EEpXnMtGMEGGIPzaYsg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102993',7.6,1621,'en','The Company of Strangers','A busload of women become stranded in an isolated part of the Canadian countryside. As they await rescue, they reflect on their lives through a mostly ad-libbed script.','/hlXFhekstIC0hsVjbhLjjC5EWBy.jpg','1990-10-01',101,'Released','Sometimes the middle of nowhere can lead to the most beautiful of places.','The Company of Strangers',123778,1.6372,7.1,'hCXWBccmBUs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11426,_binary '\0','/sW3YsUWmOLgGFIoxKLAKt7Qn5ce.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0102996',5.5,2529,'en','Strictly Business','Waymon has a great job in real estate and a promising future, but he\'s also trapped in a loveless longterm relationship. He meets Natalie, a beautiful club-hopping hipster, and quickly falls in love. Realizing he\'s just not cool enough to attract her on his own, he seeks the help of his friend Bobby, a free-spirited smooth talker who works in the mail room at Waymon\'s firm and utilizes the predicament as leverage to advance in the company.','/aH8NjAzgxQckbt1oY4YBpCYLrDd.jpg','1991-11-08',84,'Released','A comedy about a kid who goes from the mailroom to the boardroom by improving relations between a mover & a shaker.','Strictly Business',45147,2.6967,5.4,'SRJ5_z6MpWo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11427,_binary '\0','/1Shfc1ceGtqQnnZzUoL8QZlZ13r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103003',4.7,12271,'en','Suburban Commando','Shep Ramsey is an interstellar hero, righting wrongs, etc. His ship is damaged after a fight with an interstellar nasty and he must hide out on Earth until it can recharge. He leaves his power suit at home, but still finds himself unable to allow wrongs to go unrighted and so mixes it up with bad drivers, offensive paperboys, muggers and the like.','/wE8WUFEfkZnNDLMpWNmyiJr8E7y.jpg','1991-10-04',88,'Released','The Wilcoxes were having some problems around the neighborhood... until the ultimate security system landed in their backyard.','Suburban Commando',11504,4.3183,4.7,'CwwXrgvzIc4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11428,_binary '\0','/byGDzYJou70f3kFFXIqucOA8L6e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103007',5.7,7143,'en','The Super','Louie Kritski is a heartless landlord who has been so negligent in keeping up his ghetto apartment that he is threatened with jail time. The judge gives him another option -- he must live in his rat-infested hell hole until he brings it up to liveable standards.','/grkfopMr14odyBGTZQFiBXZ6K5Z.jpg','1991-10-04',86,'Released','The judge sentenced slumlord Louie Kritski to six months in his own building. He would have been better off in jail.','The Super',53287,2.5028,5.907,'0uhm03zFQsg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11429,_binary '\0','/2BQbaVGtb2j6pSNZhtOLFPUvf8X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103010',7.2,1984,'en','Surviving Desire','Jude, a college professor, is obsessed with Sophie, his student. She, in turn, is intrigued by his scholarly charm. Flirtation turns to lust and the two become lovers.','/VfE2VZu75iGJG5w65uOjVQ4HoN.jpg','1992-01-22',53,'Released',NULL,'Surviving Desire',94666,1.8726,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11430,_binary '\0','/5cqfok6356y4VTK3ylZy1iymV8e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103016',5.8,11368,'en','Switch','Steve Brooks, a sexist womanizer, is killed by a group of his angry former lovers. In heaven, he makes a bargain with God for redemption and agrees to return to Earth. Once there, he must have a sincere relationship with a female and make her fall in love with him. If not, Steve\'s soul will become the property of the devil. But the devil hedges his bet, and Steve is reincarnated as a woman named Amanda Brooks.','/ddmOMoFWMpXJSU0YFddBU7d6kWT.jpg','1991-05-10',104,'Released','Steve and Walter used to have a preference for blondes. Then Steve was murdered... and came back as one. Will being a woman make him a better man?','Switch',10261,3.6379,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11431,_binary '\0','/cVydU2eqkZeQxGTn4KORxknecE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103030',7,19114,'es','Tacones lejanos','After being estranged for 15 years, flamboyant actress Becky del Paramo re-enters her daughter Rebeca\'s life when she comes to perform a concert. Rebeca, she finds, is now married to one of Becky\'s ex-lovers, Manuel. The mother and daughter begin making up for lost time, when suddenly, a murder occurs...','/xUpMr3ma8XMpdDhM27s4EuFxdyC.jpg','1991-10-23',114,'Released','A mother, a daughter, a lover. Relationships can be murder.','High Heels',8222,5.3325,7,'wxPxKefg0LE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11432,_binary '\0','/oUGE7v7gpkKdrgeGaWffZRvysKK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103035',6.4,10179,'en','Taking Care of Business','An uptight advertising exec has his entire life in a filofax organizer which mistakenly ends up in the hands of a friendly convict who poses as him.','/q3yEyOqJ5e3vAjK70qTnBMnmgYy.jpg','1990-08-16',108,'Released','You are who you pretend to be.','Taking Care of Business',6393,4.6374,6.316,'WPxDbbHw6lw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11433,_binary '\0','/u8NYsNR7cDiM4QYGCFcaOt5vXsu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103039',5.1,7209,'en','Talkin\' Dirty After Dark','Terry is an up and coming comedian, but believes politics will get him the big breaks and more time at the popular Dukie\'s Comedy Club. Just so happens that Terry is \'sleeping\' with Ruby Lynn Sinclair, the wife of club owner Dukie Sinclair. What follows is a night of comedy, romance, comedy, action, comedy, and Terry achieving his initial goal: getting $67 dollars to pay his phone bil','/bNTfwzDkpXQEFSr1vOxPpcWYDej.jpg','1991-08-16',89,'Released','It\'s sex, laughs and one night stands.','Talkin\' Dirty After Dark',83985,2.0027,5.2,'b_WshnkWys4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11434,_binary '\0','/fUm9IwC7aBOEiAqbOYZZipBH5kO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103044',6.7,1709,'cn','監獄風雲II逃犯','The rivalry between two Chinese prison factions heats up as a seasoned inmate forms an alliance that could cost him more than his freedom.','/ybMjmFC1oY51i2MZ3XD3o9HaOfg.jpg','1991-06-22',113,'Released',NULL,'Prison on Fire II',56251,2.6812,6.9,'8KpdS8O-a4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11435,_binary '\0','/duQb41tV3g3bSXudPYIMBVjEZFW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103045',7,5516,'cn','逃學威龍','Chow Sing Sing is about to be kicked out of the Royal Hong Kong Police\'s elite Special Duties Unit. But a senior officer decides to give him one last chance: Star must go undercover as a student at the Edinburgh High School in Hong Kong to recover the senior officer\'s missing revolver.','/8sC9PZVxrFNtHi3sYKxm6bFasg6.jpg','1991-07-18',100,'Released',NULL,'Fight Back to School',47647,3.0857,7.018,'_jQRq8LqSUE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11436,_binary '\0','/8VGaEXbTOGeWGW7IvzOf1j2rjet.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103060',6.1,65220,'en','Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles II: The Secret of the Ooze','The Turtles and the Shredder battle once again, this time for the last cannister of the ooze that created the Turtles, which Shredder wants to create an army of new mutants. Meanwhile Splinter is coming... to a decision.','/Hyvvz9Z3le1is8a0EeFJQm0aSC.jpg','1991-03-22',88,'Released','Back by bodacious demand.','Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles II: The Secret of the Ooze',1497,6.9374,6.2,'1ulJwDjpD30','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11437,_binary '\0','/izkMjmhauFx9DjoBQqM5sM5WAwE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103064',8.6,1300743,'en','Terminator 2: Judgment Day','Ten years after the events of the original, a reprogrammed T-800 is sent back in time to protect young John Connor from the shape-shifting T-1000. Together with his mother Sarah, he fights to stop Skynet from triggering a nuclear apocalypse.','/jFTVD4XoWQTcg7wdyJKa8PEds5q.jpg','1991-07-03',137,'Released','It\'s nothing personal.','Terminator 2: Judgment Day',280,35.7104,8.2,'2aCC9F8cGCc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11438,_binary '\0','/fDXAI0emsKNqJOLkdFdclNSJhSE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103069',6,3340,'en','Texasville','Summer, 1984: 30 years after Duane captained the high school football team and Jacy was homecoming queen, this Texas town near Wichita Falls prepares for its centennial. Oil prices are down, banks are failing, and Duane\'s $12 million in debt. His wife Karla drinks too much, his children are always in trouble, and he tom-cats around with the wives of friends. Jacy\'s back in town, after a mildly successful acting career, life in Italy, and the death of her son. Folks assume Duane and Jacy will resume their high school romance. And Sonny is \"tired in his mind,\" causing worries for his safety. Can these friends find equilibrium in middle age?','/7Tj55FkIsZWQbGxIkMuLFsMH7fj.jpg','1990-09-28',123,'Released','It\'s not a place... It\'s a state of mind.','Texasville',82545,1.5158,6.1,'xdmYkfKqUxA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11439,_binary '\0','/u49EZzHvGCNrHdQxkc3hhLmQEPP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103074',7.6,196735,'en','Thelma & Louise','Taking a break from their dreary lives, close friends Thelma and Louise embark on a short weekend trip that ends in unforeseen incriminating circumstances. As fugitives, both women rediscover the strength of their bond and their newfound resilience.','/7D2DqmIKpPlkCU0RLVdlKLKR7XZ.jpg','1991-05-24',130,'Released','Somebody said get a life...so they did.','Thelma & Louise',1541,10.1452,7.596,'2iBFmKlO4BY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11440,_binary '\0','/67xxuwAqftQfIBb8MSJVjVW8D3C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103077',5.6,3067,'en','There\'s Nothing Out There','Mike\'s obsession with horror movies means he can\'t help but expect to find a monster lurking around every corner. When he joins his friends for a weekend away at a remote lodge, Mike instantly senses that something isn\'t right. Can Mike use his movie knowledge to save his pals from a bloody end?','/1jq1ixT05QZfmf4pSpxG0pXybP3.jpg','1991-04-05',91,'Released','A horror film of comic proportions.','There\'s Nothing Out There',41775,2.3278,5.75,'KtCGIZaHxUM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11441,_binary '\0','/fBwp5YvMxbH84kN21DN33E7cyYg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103078',7.2,2133,'en','Miss Marple: They Do It with Mirrors','At the insistence of Ruth Van Rydock, an old schoolfriend who is convinced that there is something wrong, Miss Marple agrees to visit \'Stonygates\', the country house of Ruth\'s sister.','/dVsTv0I24Z3QHTCW6aXv9QzIyT0.jpg','1991-12-29',100,'Released',NULL,'Miss Marple: They Do It with Mirrors',416417,3.2354,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11442,_binary '\0','/8Tvq2tkvr8LslXJpwjWPEap4BNa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103099',7.1,2189,'en','Tongues Untied','Marlon Riggs, with assistance from other gay Black men, especially poet Essex Hemphill, celebrates Black men loving Black men as a revolutionary act. The film intercuts footage of Hemphill reciting his poetry, Riggs telling the story of his growing up, scenes of men in social intercourse and dance, and various comic riffs, including a visit to the \"Institute of Snap!thology,\" where men take lessons in how to snap their fingers: the sling snap, the point snap, the diva snap.','/wbrcRd695aB8D6pkWh0hSurKRbO.jpg','1990-03-16',55,'Released','Black Men Loving Black Men','Tongues Untied',97049,2.0053,6.7,'uut1FKNkvY4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11443,_binary '\0','/57UWmEFLl61qqVnLsnWVp9c9uzM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103103',6.2,2077,'fr','La Totale !','To his family, François Voisin is nothing more than a humdrum civil servant. In truth, for the past twenty years he has been working as a secret agent. All goes well until circumstances put his secret in danger.','/aZgW65lLYWvCgWMks3p9KsibROr.jpg','1991-12-18',102,'Released',NULL,'The Jackpot!',75944,1.4619,5.89,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11444,_binary '\0','/qeaXS1MTcCiSXm614msFqMpmYJQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103105',7.4,6726,'fr','Toto le héros','80-year-old Thomas recounts his childhood and middle age through a series of flashbacks and dream sequences. Thomas believes he’s been taken away from a better life at birth; following a hospital fire, he vividly recalls being swapped with another new-born, and subsequently grows up in a poorer neighbouring household.','/fxIzSyOMrOFxwCIWIW4bwtgMpds.jpg','1991-05-17',91,'Released',NULL,'Toto the Hero',56321,2.1263,7.1,'AcMaAwyTr1o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11445,_binary '\0','/8gWKkEWaUy1cSORno7Mva3Im3BE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103110',7.5,8541,'fr','Tous les matins du monde','Following the death of his wife, a renowned musician ostracises himself from the outer world and dedicates his life to music. However, his life changes when a young man approaches him to learn music.','/mTXJgweEbR3LVMQPqNLtycxsbOJ.jpg','1991-12-18',115,'Released',NULL,'All the Mornings of the World',41804,2.5317,7.1,'PMRHhtQiHnI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11446,_binary '\0','/5wHcVeMuUNlgQ2JvN0bVQ4sSDeM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103111',4.8,1681,'en','Hard to Die','While doing the inventory for a lingerie outlet in a high rise office building, five attractive women are terrorized by a series of bizarre killings. They suspect that the strange janitor, who witnessed another series of killings six months previously, is at the bottom of the whole thing. Little do they know the real horror that they face in the end.','/sQPdz28o3LmEaknwwnKB8zqqIYF.jpg','1990-10-09',84,'Released','SHE\'S A KILLER IN A G-STRING!','Hard to Die',28339,6.5354,6,'AwseLsrAFKs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11447,_binary '\0','/iLpBP4GSPzLUJt1wbhVRmY2QWS8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103112',6.6,26685,'en','Toy Soldiers','After federal agents arrest a drug czar and put him on trial, the cartel leader\'s vicious son storms a prep school and takes its students hostage. They rebel against the armed intruders and try to take back their academy by any means necessary.','/nL3ccvqU1Wq1j31feHWAydzpbr2.jpg','1991-04-24',112,'Released','They\'ve Always been REBELS - TODAY, They Become HEROES.','Toy Soldiers',10750,4.0858,6.528,'x1b7Q0gmR-Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11448,_binary '\0','/3ObLgqTlqeey6E8cfyy6xki2rCs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103125',6.3,5955,'en','True Colors','Two law school friends find themselves at odds when one becomes a Justice Department lawyer and the other goes into politics.','/iRchyRu07YagzHv9bQ7Jfz1CsAc.jpg','1991-03-15',111,'Released','All the shades of friendship. Including betrayal and revenge.','True Colors',13571,2.2273,6.2,'SOIESpioxUU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11449,_binary '\0','/A0CeKIsygdnshBas35bKZA28kJ7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103128',5.1,1384,'en','True Identity','In order to escape from the mob, an African-American man must disguise himself as a white man.','/4Sc2pdsyEQ85xMVBqLXnRrNLbXa.jpg','1991-08-23',93,'Released','Ever since the mob\'s been after him...Miles Pope hasn\'t been himself!','True Identity',56385,2.0257,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11450,_binary '\0','/GFi1vzXUncFnxfUITfxVBDv8N4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103129',7.2,9452,'en','Truly Madly Deeply','Nina is totally heartbroken at the death of her boyfriend Jamie, but is even more unprepared for his return as a ghost. At first it\'s almost as good as it used to be – hey, even the rats that infested her house have disappeared. But Jamie starts bringing ghostly friends home and behaving more and more oddly.','/jjLEXLTXfJPYtl31knRS8bjclf0.jpg','1991-05-03',106,'Released','BE CAREFUL WHAT YOU WISH FOR... IT JUST MIGHT COME TRUE.','Truly Madly Deeply',18317,2.2472,6.9,'OU1dRWJmBRs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11451,_binary '\0','/kclghqLepNi2ysevncFTUw0qglH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103130',7.3,11901,'en','Trust','After being thrown away from home, pregnant high school dropout Maria meets Matthew, a highly educated and extremely moody electronics repairman. The two begin an unusual romance built on their sense of mutual admiration and trust.','/9wE7LuIkvuPfr4Ye6fMqPXHqaiE.jpg','1990-09-09',106,'Released','A slightly twisted comedy.','Trust',37291,2.5359,6.8,'pIgv4Tvx3V0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11452,_binary '\0','/cty5cZL7kSacO5MjI85DVoa3PjC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103150',7.1,1352,'pl','Ucieczka z kina „Wolność”','The screening of a movie \"Daybreak\" at the \"Liberty\" Cinema is interrupted by an unusual event - actors come to life on the screen, start conversations among themselves, draw the audience into them. Crowds gather around the cinema, the relevant authorities and services wonder what to do in this complicated situation. Also arriving is the censor, a man reaching his fifties, a one-time literary critic and journalist. The line between fiction and reality begins to blur.','/uzZIr3zw3yWTgz5OjFCDwnw4oeP.jpg','1990-10-14',87,'Released',NULL,'Escape from the Liberty Cinema',176032,1.664,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11453,_binary '\0','/4CS1uQyTsBfz9IzgMv2WRoiA2wh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103157',4.8,1861,'en','The Unborn','Joy turns to horror when a pregnant mother discovers the nightmarish truth behind her doctor\'s unexpected success in helping her conceive.','/zilEvurrEostVxGSklgsJm7hJXx.jpg','1991-03-29',85,'Released','A new generation of terror.','The Unborn',87451,2.3099,5,'mHuhRR9mDRE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11454,_binary '\0','/9CeA3i4RUoZ2KI6hCQ9BzTb2IKR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103168',6.7,1522,'fr','Une époque formidable','Michel Berthier, a senior executive at a mattress manufacturing company, has just been fired. As he does not dare to tell the truth to Juliette, his partner, he goes into debt to maintain the family’s standard of living, showering them with gifts. But soon he can no longer lie, and he decides to leave the house. After losing his money, his car, and his shoes, he meets Toubib, Mimosa, and Crayon, three “homeless” people who wash themselves in the restrooms at the Gare de l’Est. They take him under their wing and lead him to break into his former company in order to get sleeping bags and beds.','/tTiuOpaDA3NPxc5bVYdnZIY4awR.jpg','1991-06-19',96,'Released',NULL,'Une époque formidable',50213,1.3007,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11455,_binary '\0','/a19BZX1HZoJYTxS0k0tUV0szc3H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103176',7.5,4086,'ru','Урга — территория любви','A farmer and his wife live in a rural part of Inner Mongolia with their three children. Chinese population control policies prevent them from having any more. The farmer sets out for the nearest town to obtain birth control. He comes upon a Russian truck driver who has ended up in a lake. The farmer takes the man back to his farm, and after initially being appalled, the Russian becomes enchanted with the peaceful life of the countryside and decides to stay. But his presence presages big changes for the peasants.','/zYenMsWvXEfjm95kkKmnBspylqc.jpg','1991-09-25',119,'Released',NULL,'Close to Eden',36346,1.7186,6.724,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11456,_binary '\0','/4REBsWHiKULBFVr8MBjue6T6xJg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103184',5,5823,'en','V.I. Warshawski','Victoria \"V.I\" Warshawski is a Chicago based private detective who agrees to babysit for her new boyfriend; then he is murdered. Being the detective type, she makes the murder her next case. In doing so she befriends the victim\'s daughter, Kat, and together they set out to crack the case.','/w0ykwLLDB8v1wT50wDpYaPnyac7.jpg','1991-07-26',89,'Released','Killer eyes. Killer legs. Killer instincts.','V.I. Warshawski',41805,4.2361,4.8,'Qh2OhB_DXXI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11457,_binary '\0','/p8BnLSfq9GCnGeSuAdIFdAj6Rz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103186',7.1,4095,'es','Vacas','An act of cowardice influences the lives of two Basque families over three generations.','/j9c3HPCwuPGfFNHzjt0taANaC78.jpg','1992-02-26',96,'Released',NULL,'Cows',2441,1.273,6.5,'On4Wxp_EaLo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11458,_binary '\0','/2ISaysmOQceYV44eLchDgzb1vXo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103190',7.1,3665,'fr','Van Gogh','After leaving the asylum, Vincent van Gogh settles in the home of Doctor Gachet, where he keeps painting amidst the torments of his failing mental health. He begins an affair with his host’s daughter, however, she soon realizes that he doesn’t love her and that his heart beats only for art.','/sbyckO3FYAtFt3hDCunQG7FbIiu.jpg','1991-10-30',158,'Released','The last 67 days of the great artist\'s life.','Van Gogh',4734,1.7793,6.7,'GmuoJTPE834','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11459,_binary '\0','/ye1hCefMAQIhIRrzDu7YNqVL94K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103203',7.2,1434,'it','Il viaggio di Capitan Fracassa','In the French countryside, circa the 17th-century, Serafina, Pulcinella and Isabella are three lusty, beautiful members of a travelling theatrical troupe, leaving in their wake a crop of broken hearts.','/8ooQ3Oyw0uQhZmmkPiXMu1MYxSy.jpg','1990-10-31',127,'Released',NULL,'The Voyage of Captain Fracassa',63057,1.9356,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11460,_binary '\0','/npnbvNO28udi5EfL0ompXf2KL8Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103239',5.9,10003,'en','Wedlock','A male prison escapee heads for his hidden loot, electronically attached to a female prisoner.','/jQNEJIKeCk9wNXRW7a2FiNCR3ie.jpg','1991-05-10',101,'Released','It\'ll blow your mind.','Wedlock',2125,2.8224,5.786,'UOlHprM7jQ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11461,_binary '\0','/2Ek1JtggvRquMfzie66ybbID9g0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103241',7,79845,'en','What About Bob?','Before going on vacation, self-involved psychiatrist Dr. Leo Marvin has the misfortune of taking on a new patient: Bob Wiley. An exemplar of neediness and a compendium of phobias, Bob follows Marvin to his family\'s country house. Dr. Marvin tries to get him to leave; the trouble is, everyone loves Bob. As his oblivious patient makes himself at home, Dr. Marvin loses his professional composure and, before long, may be ready for the loony bin himself.','/pFCrGGGhV5xeAdvEysv6aSv8T13.jpg','1991-05-17',100,'Released','Bob\'s a special kind of friend. The kind that drives you crazy.','What About Bob?',10276,4.7488,6.9,'ptmP1lziJw4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11462,_binary '\0','/rrCd6hNiUoUdjUvUSOEArVyMQtY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103243',6.3,2757,'en','Where Angels Fear to Tread','An English widow goes to Italy, falls in love with a dentist\'s son and marries him, against her straitlaced family\'s wishes.','/5SVoW24Fjj6tLSrImaQ2CnusVPF.jpg','1991-06-21',108,'Released','Only one thing could come between Lilia and her Italian lover… her in-laws.','Where Angels Fear to Tread',59704,2.3769,6.7,'bvu0kz3E18A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11463,_binary '\0','/1DcKVybwLpvnybtZ3Du8RTOu4MK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103247',6.7,24482,'en','White Fang','Jack London\'s classic adventure story about the friendship developed between a Yukon gold hunter and the mixed dog-wolf he rescues from the hands of a man who mistreats him.','/27wg0rVZW8hX7nWeHCwTf9DygGc.jpg','1991-01-18',107,'Released','Where civilization ends, their journey begins.','White Fang',12227,6.1529,6.746,'nACyMvM9AR4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11464,_binary '\0','/yme0UvacQuWaZK9QiywD6lvx0Oz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103251',6.5,9992,'en','White Palace','Max Baron is a Jewish advertising executive in his 20s who\'s still getting over the death of his wife. Nora Baker is a 40-something diner waitress who enjoys the wilder side of life. Mismatched or not, their attraction is instant and smoldering. With time, however, their class and age differences become an obstacle in their relationship, especially since Max can\'t keep Nora a secret from his Jewish friends and upper-crust associates forever.','/nUxEeMzDNIrxlUXTmg3ApKj4EhU.jpg','1990-10-19',103,'Released','The story of a younger man and a bolder woman.','White Palace',41003,4.5049,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11465,_binary '\0','/j5WX3FXThUna0K1ZQb55yIcrhKi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103253',5.6,4986,'en','Whore','This melodrama investigates the life of a sex worker, in a pseudo-documentary style.','/k2bDSZKq0eoplco3Yvj7fld8Gnu.jpg','1991-06-21',85,'Released','If You\'re Afraid to Say It... Just See It.','Whore',20712,3.861,5.3,'9QYVIver2yE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11466,_binary '\0','/wAneBIQKVFSXpBsXP8Z85tzNyUB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103262',7.2,6460,'en','Wild Hearts Can\'t Be Broken','A runaway orphan, young Sonora, persists in a menial job mucking stables in Doc Carver\'s travelling stunt show. Her great wish is to become a death-defying \"diving girl,\" but Doc refuses her pleas. Undaunted, Sonora\'s gutsy resolve finally convinces him to give her a break. On the brink of stardom, however, a cruel twist of fate threatens to destroy her dream.','/kY7KaiN3vh4g49Pn3ShM2ATnFVw.jpg','1991-05-24',88,'Released',NULL,'Wild Hearts Can\'t Be Broken',23438,3.2718,7.336,'ew3S69fcRq0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11467,_binary '\0','/bGDt9bYUx3f0Cr0qpJjDvC2wHZe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103266',7,1975,'en','Wildflower','One day Sammy and his younger sister Ellie happen upon a cabin where Alice, a young, partially deaf girl with epilepsy is being kept by her abusive stepfather. The three soon become friends and hope to get Alice an education and help her escape from the torture she undergoes daily. However, Alice\'s stepfather soon finds out about the friendship Alice has struck up and punishes her brutally. This story of friendship and youth shows that everyone is human and deserves to be treated so, no matter their disability or weakness.','/84foP2vS8PTHMhQSbTGGNdWbyI0.jpg','1991-12-03',91,'Released',NULL,'Wildflower',21546,2.046,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11468,_binary '\0','/shl0ELODK3VgHr7pu8VTz2a8olW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103285',7.2,21646,'cn','黃飛鴻','In late 19th-century Canton, legendary hero Wong Fei-Hung battles foreign forces\' (English, French and American) plundering of China. When Aunt Yee returns from America totally westernised, Wong assumes the role of protector. This proves difficult when his martial arts school and local militia become involved in fierce battles with foreign and local governments. As violence escalates, even Aunt Yee has to question her new western ideals, but is it possible to fight guns with Kung Fu?','/dkBQC0jmkmTOJJMgwsBdgkzZ6Ry.jpg','1991-08-15',133,'Released','Never was a Hero needed more...','Once Upon a Time in China',10617,5.5838,7.1,'x95gXieo3f0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11469,_binary '\0','/4hCNxfO3mFYxsrjXKeUgoSOMRtv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103295',7.1,5265,'cn','笑傲江湖II東方不敗','Ling Wu Chung decides to hide from the chaotic world. Before leaving, he visits his friends, a tribe of snake-wielding women warriors. However, he finds that the tribe have been attacked, and their leader Yam Ying Ying has been abducted.','/nHDvrm1tpaZIE3g5ZENIW7Kfe1E.jpg','1992-06-26',107,'Released',NULL,'The Legend of the Swordsman',18672,3.4686,6.6,'QO-d_0E8_rQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11470,_binary '\0','/tnFbCw7vmfEDUjPYgSUcaOesByW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103296',6.5,1472,'cn','新精武門1991','Lau Ching, a Mainlander with an incredibly powerful right arm, arrives in Hong Kong to find his cousin. He befriends with a drifter named Handsome, and a martial artist girl named Mandy. In order to woo her, Ching participates in a fighting competition in hopes of winning a $10 million prize, and must defeat his love rival, Wai, in the ring.','/yccQWmZwTS7kCQW80He5u2jpz5C.jpg','1991-03-23',96,'Released',NULL,'Fist of Fury 1991',73414,2.1892,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11471,_binary '\0','/iKGSlUc4b2Maqve01XyuHs6bohP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103303',5.6,3220,'en','Year of the Gun','American novelist David Raybourne accidentally becomes entangled in the Red Brigade\'s terrorist plan to kidnap Italian Premier Aldo Moro during a research trip to Rome. As the terrorists attempt to kill David, he and his photojournalist friend must struggle to stay alive.','/q7RxDFfKv3jF2KXLJE72dZ860Y.jpg','1991-09-10',111,'Released','In a city bathed in blood… who can you trust?','Year of the Gun',31922,3.0843,4.9,'q-ACF53MZ8A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11472,_binary '\0','/36qrYVzykVAQkNxfVONqmXUSExY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103305',7.2,1252,'en','Yes Virginia, There Is a Santa Claus','While newspaper writer Church struggles with the death of his wife, he receives a \"special\" assignment. He must answer a little girl\'s question about whether Santa Claus really exists.','/ruevJzjilBmoURqs8IS5IPWZoqV.jpg','1991-12-08',95,'Released',NULL,'Yes Virginia, There Is a Santa Claus',190879,2.4586,7.2,'nYpe2SutanE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11473,_binary '\0','/uePLLSyFR4bczdZYA6VCuugqFyX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103327',6.4,1220,'ja','ゼイラム','Teppei and Kamiya, two average joes working in the electronic services industry, stumble upon the intergalactic bounty-hunter Ilia, and her partner, the artificial intelligence named Bob. Both men are accidentally transported to the Zone, a virtual reality in which Bob has trapped Ilia\'s latest prey, a biological weapon named Zeiram. The Earth natives must both survive the experience and help Ilia capture Zeiram before the Zone disappears around them.','/pIXJIxy0OXgTgVIIks98UjRp59z.jpg','1991-12-21',97,'Released',NULL,'Zëiram',27302,1.5275,6.2,'SjtYWtumafc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11474,_binary '\0','/8Mv8YonHDO0J0mUoKeS46KMZvkw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103328',7,3438,'cn','整蠱專家','A trickster-for-hire, known as the Tricky Expert, is hired to ruin the lives of a father and son by making them think that he\'s a part of the family.','/4zehVfzyp4r4FXgYT7TPZhe1P3o.jpg','1991-02-02',110,'Released',NULL,'Tricky Brains',41364,3.1421,7.128,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11475,_binary '\0','/omK6WF36PZ4A2SdzaGeWb6C6tqd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103337',7.2,1243,'fi','Zombie ja Kummitusjuna','Antti \"Zombie\" Autiomaa does two things well: play the bass guitar and drink. After several months\' sleeping on the streets of Istanbul, he returns to Helsinki where he\'s called into the army but discharged on mental health grounds after adding turpentine to the officers\' soup. Zombie lives bleary-eyed in an apartment off his parents\' house where his lonely, unemployed father suffers from heart disease. His girl-friend Marjo has taken up with a hairdresser but comes back to Zombie. His friend Harri hires him as a roadie for his band \"Harry and the Mulefukkers\" then gives him a chance as a bass player. He has his girl and he has a gig, but can Zombie put the bottle down?','/5NUu1VycRGipz8dZxSUVeE2UFfD.jpg','1991-07-26',90,'Released',NULL,'Zombie and the Ghost Train',60409,1.3062,6.7,'ypUe2jxpuq0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11476,_binary '\0','/qIgplWrPzo2dpgDDqZKUYRQUOCP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103594',6.4,35564,'en','1492: Conquest of Paradise','1492: Conquest of Paradise depicts Christopher Columbus’ discovery of The New World and his effect on the indigenous people.','/3effmbI6BbGW9i0HzEDfVGuOsvz.jpg','1992-08-09',154,'Released','Centuries before the exploration of space, there was another voyage into the unknown.','1492: Conquest of Paradise',1492,6.1975,6.3,'bmnLrzG2zKw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11477,_binary '\0','/d6MIFNVaf3Z0rQHJfrlta6pb9fT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103595',7.3,1710,'en','1991: The Year Punk Broke','David Markey\'s documentary of life on the road with Sonic Youth and Nirvana during their tour of Europe in late 1991. Also featuring live performances by Dinosaur Jr, Babes in Toyland, The Ramones and Gumball.','/nDWYYzzfBUeWQhWowEAExqwGbyv.jpg','1992-11-19',98,'Released',NULL,'1991: The Year Punk Broke',28742,1.8623,6.8,'oapsnj4qmg4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11478,_binary '\0','/qoSIw7XPwpbo5p3WuQoc5AvKZ4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103596',5.4,25322,'en','3 Ninjas','Each year, three brothers Samuel, Jeffrey and Michael Douglas visits their Japanese grandfather, Mori Shintaro whom the boys affectionately refer to as Grandpa, for the summer. Mori is a highly skilled in the fields of Martial arts and Ninjutsu, and for years he has trained the boys in his techniques. After an organized crime ring proves to be too much for the FBI, it\'s time for the 3 brother NINJAS! To use their martial arts skills, they team up to battle the crime ring and outwit some very persistent kidnappers!','/fhGyCrKke6KImUQtprqsICYHnkX.jpg','1992-08-07',96,'Released','Tum Tum, Colt and Rocky Ready for a Ninja Summer!','3 Ninjas',16314,6.2323,5.8,'jF_9prQFtik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11479,_binary '\0','/dtiTi2BfJU4i7XwgjsTKTdCi17v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103601',6.9,2125,'fr','588 rue Paradis','A successful playwright reflects on his journey from his Armenian roots to adapting in France, forty years after his family\'s move to Marseilles. He now goes by a new name to fit in better with French society.','/n937nGKbYIepi8OjY8z8AuK9bfx.jpg','1992-01-14',135,'Released',NULL,'588 rue Paradis',151232,1.759,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11480,_binary '\0','/xZjIF1WXeucatqIzEmM4mTLmTlY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103617',3.8,3355,'en','Iron Eagle III','Chappy discovers a drug-smuggling scheme at his own air base. It turns out that the lives of some village people in Peru are at stake, and he decides to fly there with ancient airplanes and friends to free them.','/ylvfsnacoqsTdZuLty2XVRolnNH.jpg','1992-01-09',98,'Released','Four heroes from the past fight as one to protect the future.','Iron Eagle III',2038,2.7652,4.1,'f2DAry5gaY0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11481,_binary '\0','/psQrEXfUZjQKNsxIKpgUdcEvJGr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103621',4.8,1363,'en','Adventures in Dinosaur City','A scientist\'s kids are sucked into a TV screen and wind up in the Stone Age with cavemen and dinosaurs.','/cEKr5x2EBeJ1gHnMJGWxgTORBEf.jpg','1991-08-28',88,'Released','Long before there were turtles, the world was ruled by dinosaurs.','Adventures in Dinosaur City',49082,1.9238,4.5,'JdZybLee9yo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11482,_binary '\0','/2X4rN11T056eHyYNt44p6eHQ6C7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103634',6.9,3254,'en','Aileen Wuornos: The Selling of a Serial Killer','In this documentary, filmmaker Nick Broomfield follows the saga of Aileen Wuornos, a prostitute who has been accused of committing a brutal series of murders. Broomfield conducts interviews with Wuornos herself, and his crew films her trial as well as her interactions with religious fanatic Arlene Pralle, who gives Wuornos dubious advice and legally adopts her. The cameras also roll as the accused\'s attorney ignores the case at hand to negotiate a deal to sell his client\'s story.','/cRsTiPrgzWVFnSw14biZkrPEpY9.jpg','1992-11-01',87,'Released','The True Story of America\'s First Female Serial Killer','Aileen Wuornos: The Selling of a Serial Killer',97044,1.7088,6.8,'7vd1K65fawU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11483,_binary '\0','/nenJjvfe2Eq8uBMXFJnWj5mw4bi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103639',8,505702,'en','Aladdin','In the boorish city of Agrabah, kind-hearted street urchin Aladdin and Princess Jasmine fall in love, although she can only marry a prince. He and power-hungry Grand Vizier Jafar vie for a magic lamp that can fulfill their wishes.','/eLFfl7vS8dkeG1hKp5mwbm37V83.jpg','1992-11-25',91,'Released','Imagine if you had three wishes, three hopes, three dreams and they all could come true.','Aladdin',812,21.2537,7.657,'XBrfbWtmvWs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11484,_binary '\0','/lU0zVj8KcQVkPczdGGraYGiRC72.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103644',6.4,355728,'en','Alien³','After escaping with Newt and Hicks from the alien planet, Ripley crash lands on Fiorina 161, a prison planet and host to a correctional facility. Unfortunately, although Newt and Hicks do not survive the crash, a more unwelcome visitor does. The prison does not allow weapons of any kind, and with aid being a long time away, the prisoners must simply survive in any way they can.','/xh5wI0UoW7DfS1IyLy3d2CgrCEP.jpg','1992-05-22',114,'Released','3 times the suspense. 3 times the danger. 3 times the terror','Alien³',8077,13.3389,6.4,'TtOBa2SMSPs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11485,_binary '\0','/9dBkwDR3JfBAVdjXFcIOTBangwY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103670',6.7,3905,'en','American Heart','An ex-convict is tracked down by his estranged teenage son, and the pair try to build a relationship and life together in Seattle.','/h74XME6qwQB0mY9iMOUKXaNvmL2.jpg','1992-12-19',115,'Released',NULL,'American Heart',7015,1.8946,6.4,'KvN8n3xX3p0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11486,_binary '\0','/l7JoZghpEh7rfzc5eRKKUzlv3BY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103671',7.1,11705,'en','American Me','During his 18 years in Folsom Prison, street-gang leader Santana rules over all the drug-and-murder activities behind bars. Upon his release, Santana goes back to his old neighborhood, intending to lead a peaceful, crime-free life. But his old gang buddies force him back into his old habits.','/mrcdh66L6K1Nb5xPORuZufvE9aE.jpg','1992-03-13',125,'Released','In prison they are the law. On the streets they are the power.','American Me',13199,4.7436,7.469,'uS-kGp0Fjho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11487,_binary '\0','/2F5VRSmiPQgPA6MMLdn8tpXwHzG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103704',7.5,7557,'ja','あの夏、いちばん静かな海。','A deaf garbage collector happens upon a broken and discarded surfboard. The discovery plants in him dreams of becoming a surf champion. Encouraged by his also deaf girlfriend, he persists against all odds.','/uSwYQjd48iXVU8KHSSV9V6QYvBd.jpg','1991-10-19',101,'Released',NULL,'A Scene at the Sea',23606,5.5012,7.5,'6FKiIqunBHc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11488,_binary '\0','/60mel00T22aIaV3Gy7uP3jPGbXm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103743',6.8,5369,'cn','八仙飯店之人肉叉燒包','Macau cops begin to suspect a man running a pork buns restaurant of murder, after tracing the origin of a case full of chopped up human remains that washed ashore, which leads them to him.','/tQ7Ymo92AOXZFrMX5TBAfAdYECt.jpg','1993-05-13',95,'Released','Based, unfortunately, on real events…','The Untold Story',39857,5.1438,6.3,'UYNsNL_PxUc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11489,_binary '\0','/wK0dvEaqW7F85BaswQkgaYzFGFj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103747',5.9,10942,'en','The Babe','A chronicle of Babe Ruth\'s phenomenal story--from his hard knock beginnings at a Baltimore orphanage, to his meteoric rise to baseball superstardom and his poignant retirement from the game. His amazing career included seven American League pennants, four World Series championships, two tempestuous marriages and a wild lifestyle that earned him numerous suspensions.','/lso2f5jbglHtGke2A8NwRkcfxF6.jpg','1992-04-17',115,'Released','There Was Only One.','The Babe',61225,3.2293,5.7,'gJljHtBANRU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11490,_binary '\0','/1wtEDA8osImgHAduxr8qBPmqrgn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103759',7,53231,'en','Bad Lieutenant','While investigating a young nun\'s rape, a corrupt New York City police detective, with a serious drug and gambling addiction, tries to change his ways and find forgiveness.','/mVJ2mXykqq3t2v1nuouf1P10g0d.jpg','1992-11-20',96,'Released','Gambler. Thief. Junkie. Killer. Cop.','Bad Lieutenant',12143,6.6883,7,'Yhb2lT8Kktc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11491,_binary '\0','/c0QYwNyeURswT7fxmR2mlfpdk0l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103767',8.5,43489,'en','Baraka','A paralysingly beautiful documentary with a global vision—an odyssey through landscape and time—that attempts to capture the essence of life.','/ldEuJQ4z7zEvL7iXraESWBUfQcz.jpg','1992-09-15',97,'Released','A world beyond words.','Baraka',14002,3.8507,8.2,'LKGpHu9IONc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11492,_binary '\0','/7FRraud59N3s10bbf9bfYjvwx3v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103772',7.1,247087,'en','Basic Instinct','Catherine, a novelist with an insatiable sexual appetite, becomes a prime suspect when her boyfriend is brutally murdered -- a crime she had described in her latest story.','/76Ts0yoHk8kVQj9MMnoMixhRWoh.jpg','1992-03-20',128,'Released','A brutal murder. A brilliant killer. A cop who can\'t resist the danger.','Basic Instinct',402,22.8923,7,'Jh6JwQ8XPK0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11493,_binary '\0','/cPN5CkCxglf4JFeES1c2zEnhq58.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103773',4.9,4734,'en','Basket Case 3','Duane recovers from his delusional breakdown to find his freakish basket-bound brother Belial will soon become a father. But not everything is joyous as the once tight knit brothers no longer seem to trust each other.','/nSh40LxVLIvm4wyATNmS4gq5JMO.jpg','1992-02-21',90,'Released','It\'s time to build a bigger basket!','Basket Case 3',27816,2.0743,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11494,_binary '\0','/7x4SNxO5HWArighxxFeet5sn3il.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103776',7.1,352994,'en','Batman Returns','The monstrous Penguin, who dwells in the sewers beneath Gotham, joins up with corrupt mayoral candidate Max Shreck to topple the Batman once and for all. But when Shreck\'s timid assistant Selina Kyle finds out, and Shreck tries to kill her, she\'s transformed into the sexy Catwoman. She teams up with the Penguin and Shreck to destroy Batman, but sparks fly unexpectedly when she confronts the caped crusader.','/jKBjeXM7iBBV9UkUcOXx3m7FSHY.jpg','1992-06-19',126,'Released','The Bat. The Cat. The Penguin.','Batman Returns',364,20.1743,6.953,'TlbtLfWvFbo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11495,_binary '\0','/j8zu86NqJSr7QhatgJT8vJzxpnz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103783',5.9,5918,'en','Bebe\'s Kids','When Robin meets the lovely Jamika he thinks he\'s in heaven. But when he meets her friend Bebe\'s children, whom she is looking after, he knows he\'s in hell.','/uuUHtdsxLqr79QlCCnJNwPkOTTB.jpg','1992-07-31',73,'Released','It\'s animation... with an attitude.','Bebe\'s Kids',36616,2.7159,6.1,'OnwQeU_stCw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11496,_binary '\0','/dieTafH3G5IxNeyZbBdCOpugNzN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103786',5.8,82388,'en','Beethoven','The Newton family live in their comfortable home, but there seems to something missing. This \"hole\" is filled by a small puppy, who walks into their home and their lives. Beethoven, as he is named, grows into a giant of a dog... a St Bernard. Doctor Varnick, the local vet has a secret and horrible sideline, which requires lots of dogs for experiments. Beethoven is on the bad doctor\'s list.','/aSZYXOmQ9SW27gLdHU02PJQGBMH.jpg','1992-04-03',87,'Released','The head of the family is the one with the tail.','Beethoven',11806,6.9265,5.835,'ki8wHMR-yOI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11497,_binary '\0','/1HOO7m6NeK3wFw22xGBLdwvim51.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103791',7.1,12305,'es','Belle Époque','In 1931, a young soldier deserts from the army and falls into a country farm, where he is welcomed by the owner due to his political ideas. Manolo has four daughters, Fernando likes all of them and they like him, so he has to decide which one to love.','/2pb7i9pI6wMH5dlyjbVTXdfSKun.jpg','1992-12-04',109,'Released',NULL,'Belle Époque',2470,3.7583,6.7,'h_VuVKHPW8U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11498,_binary '\0','/uH7zKI0YsvZhEju7f9NpVNhtjHw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103793',7.1,21144,'de','Benny\'s Video','A 14-year-old video enthusiast obsessed with violent films decides to make one of his own and show it to his parents, with tragic results.','/gCjViGVeChg4TAJqPEbeVHrTpGB.jpg','1992-11-06',110,'Released',NULL,'Benny\'s Video',1987,3.1021,6.9,'18X_kyHW3G0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11499,_binary '\0','/6ddsCINrGR20sltMMEKeNsVfX3a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103800',6.8,1948,'fr','Betty','A drunken, self-destructive woman called Betty wanders into a Parisian bar where she meets middle-aged alcoholic Laure. Laure decides to take care of Betty. Recovering in a hotel room, Betty begins to recount to Laure the story of her bourgeois life and her unhappy and unfaithful marriage.','/393HreXn9rsqkCoin1GwqkEQkq7.jpg','1992-02-19',103,'Released',NULL,'Betty',31303,1.7178,6.4,'Lqr2PIDvMKo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11500,_binary '\0','/AtwCUHplhgV00C9xpFMqtv60bKO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000','tt0103805',6.4,9026,'en','Beyond the Law','Dan Saxon is an undercover cop who infiltrates a biker gang to nail the scum behind a drug-smuggling operation. In order to maintain the trust of the gang\'s leader, he must commit ever more dangerous and heinous crimes. Just how far \'beyond the law\' will Saxon go?','/vzlSfPrQDExlb8y8TAfjiYuk3hN.jpg','1993-04-22',108,'Released','Some men are meant to stand between good and evil.','Beyond the Law',18631,4.1013,6.3,'Yi3xsVIGxF0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:04.000000'),(11501,_binary '\0','/3s7nAEaN2yWPYHSB7pNkqYeT7it.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103812',4.5,1505,'en','The Bikini Carwash Company','Bikini-clad car wash attendants give a sudsy Los Angeles establishment a slippery edge on the competition.','/h79aakAG5Hn6aHbJH7ukCDgRN6Z.jpg','1992-06-17',81,'Released','The Slipperiest, Sultriest, Sexiest Carwash in Town!','The Bikini Carwash Company',56115,2.4262,5.3,'rlHGRgVS2jE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11502,_binary '\0','/ufzFOqk5xSim9vdlR5EIk48VeTQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103827',5.6,3044,'en','Blame It on the Bellboy','Mike Lawton, Maurice Horton, and Melvin Orton are three men who come to Venice. One of them is a hit man sent to take out a mobster. Another is a lech looking for a little action with a woman he never met, whom he was set up with. And one of them was sent by his employer to inspect a property his boss wants to buy. All three men stay at the same hotel. But when the bellboy gets their names mixed up and gives info meant for someone else. So one of them meets a Realtor who will whatever she has to, to close the sale. And another follows a woman looking for romance. And another goes to the home of the mobster who thinks he\'s sent there to kill him.','/aGyu2UhON2s0J0YdTWsTUvsFJ4g.jpg','1992-01-24',78,'Released','Mix-ups, Mishaps, Madness, and Mayhem... It\'s all part of the service.','Blame It on the Bellboy',34151,2.1314,5.4,'M3gwuyHa9yA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11503,_binary '\0','/2MCrGL87yVKRfjh41e6Js4szbMU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103838',7,2320,'en','The Inner Circle','Life changes for a Moscow worker when he\'s made Stalin\'s personal film projectionist but cannot tell his bride.','/qruy6W5qwn7nBLRXAawfphNuPbF.jpg','1992-02-28',137,'Released','Explosive. Unforgettable. True.','The Inner Circle',73376,1.4269,5.8,'hEIl_c_QSt0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11504,_binary '\0','/wtHZ3s5MIE2V25ZsgYXNDLqSciF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103843',5.1,5154,'en','Blown Away','After her mother is killed by a car bomb, a 17-year-old girl lives a reckless and decadent lifestyle. She begins having sex with a boy who works at a local ski resort. He falls in love, and she tells him of her suspicions that her strict father was responsible for her mother\'s death and wants him to help her out of her situation. He must decide whether she\'s telling the truth or using him to her own ends.','/zkdYTsyORrP7utUW1TDTHz5eyOB.jpg','1993-04-01',93,'Released','She\'ll charm you. Seduce you. She might even kill you.','Blown Away',20859,2.376,6.23,'eaxAgtvngD4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11505,_binary '\0','/4tl7kkOodSs1QMv0l7pNouNLngh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103848',5.2,1962,'en','Blue Ice','An ex-British spy (Michael Caine) helps a U.S. diplomat\'s wife (Sean Young) and blows the lid off a deadly government cover-up.','/biQ5YZZjlCQnwOeTAQgfNk6YxS4.jpg','1992-10-09',105,'Released','If Harry\'s past ever catches up with him, he won\'t live long enough to regret it.','Blue Ice',46270,2.411,5.3,'JUTB95NJRdk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11506,_binary '\0','/lyTh10IP4bNVYp3G7cWBac76OYb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103850',7,15038,'en','Bob Roberts','Millionaire conservative Bob Roberts launches an insurgent campaign against incumbent senator Brickley Paiste, firing up crowds at his rallies by singing \'60s-style acoustic folk songs with lyrics espousing far-right conservative social and economic views.','/j4PokuSIrmbN5oCR54D8kiI0U6a.jpg','1992-09-04',102,'Released','Vote first. Ask questions later.','Bob Roberts',10608,2.9334,6.6,'yRpWaJRyVQo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11507,_binary '\0','/bJyb7Bk9PLUslPggangniTBLzHO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103855',6.4,160245,'en','The Bodyguard','A former Secret Service agent grudgingly takes an assignment to protect a pop idol who\'s threatened by a crazed fan. At first, the safety-obsessed bodyguard and the self-indulgent diva totally clash. But before long, all that tension sparks fireworks of another sort, and the love-averse tough guy is torn between duty and romance.','/ihWF0uY1xnKqw9YK7ZHNLUZOhcO.jpg','1992-11-25',129,'Released','Never let her out of your sight. Never let your guard down. Never fall in love.','The Bodyguard',619,12.2241,6.706,'v4qauDAr_hA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11508,_binary '\0','/fS4qzWxxyyF2vow3G98NMHnsBKm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103859',5.7,32876,'en','Boomerang','Marcus is a successful advertising executive who woos and beds women almost at will. After a company merger he finds that his new boss, the ravishing Jacqueline, is treating him in exactly the same way. Completely traumatised by this, his work goes badly downhill.','/apwkBVaJqLuK6mxe6sOABCeNjRw.jpg','1992-06-28',117,'Released','A player who\'s about to be played.','Boomerang',11066,5.9069,5.7,'xCr5RlXidhg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11509,_binary '\0','/ekzXIjP2KAWZFQ8ZUcib2VHx00s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103872',6.9,5012,'en','Brain Donors','Three manic idiots—a lawyer, a cab driver and a handyman—team up to run a ballet company to fulfil the will of a millionaire. Stooge-like antics result as the trio try to outwit the rich widow and her scheming big-shot lawyer, who also wants to run the ballet.','/r928uiKrN1mvPrqyHy2djLUBlAe.jpg','1992-04-17',80,'Released','Three bozos. One ballet company. Tutu many laughs!','Brain Donors',32450,2.3007,6.085,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11510,_binary '\0','/z07GWpT24sV7PDaaRKm71W63yAC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103873',7.4,110697,'en','Braindead','When a Sumatran rat-monkey bites Lionel Cosgrove\'s mother, she\'s transformed into a zombie and begins killing (and transforming) the entire town while Lionel races to keep things under control.','/pa39D8TQs6aNw3hiUs4jLjHVUB0.jpg','1992-08-13',103,'Released','Some things won\'t stay down... even after they die.','Braindead',763,7.1492,7.4,'Ytg1JFrI2AA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11511,_binary '\0','/fGuhbAlDpvmNuC0vkz1vsIzYwsq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103874',7.4,270901,'en','Bram Stoker\'s Dracula','Count Dracula, a 15th-century prince, is condemned to live off the blood of the living for eternity. Young lawyer Jonathan Harker is sent to Dracula\'s castle to finalise a land deal, but when the Count sees a photo of Harker\'s fiancée, Mina, the spitting image of his dead wife, he imprisons him and sets off for London to track her down.','/jSxCIZXudp5q8wQO8VERGX8hRAl.jpg','1992-11-13',128,'Released','Love never dies.','Bram Stoker\'s Dracula',6114,18.0245,7.447,'xD6JMxOGBLQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11512,_binary '\0','/mC6cE2M2UtGPTE0WdmOV12dgPgP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103882',7.3,6270,'en','A Brief History of Time','Partly adapted from cosmologist Stephen Hawking\'s popular book about his theories of the universe, this in-depth documentary also presents Hawking\'s daily life as he deals with the ALS that renders him virtually immobile and unable to speak without the use of a computer. Hawking\'s friends, family, former classmates and peers are interviewed about not only his theories but the man himself.','/A3sVrDThz8Xthfq2EglWoypKEfU.jpg','1991-10-01',80,'Released',NULL,'A Brief History of Time',1358,2.1965,7.2,'5_y13Pbo4qs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11513,_binary '\0','/9iJc22eLmYhK1f2sMOLa0k8bmmb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103888',7.5,4431,'en','Brother\'s Keeper','This documentary by Joe Berlinger and Bruce Sinofsky details the murder trial of Delbert Ward. Delbert was a member of a family of four elderly brothers, working as semi-literate farmers and living together in isolation from the rest of society until William\'s death.','/kwhCkHrLIK7JRdCNFDlMty8gzmc.jpg','1992-09-09',104,'Released','A heartwarming tale of murder.','Brother\'s Keeper',26755,0.9,7.1,'shWoWvaaTm4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11514,_binary '\0','/qMf1MuY9u6BfBYTscEjWbIlWMrg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103893',5.7,53042,'en','Buffy the Vampire Slayer','Blonde, bouncy Buffy is your typical high school cheerleader. But all that changes when a strange man informs her she\'s been chosen by fate to kill vampires.','/tcF3S4UdFpuoZEWovMDq5AXazNF.jpg','1992-07-24',85,'Released','She knows a sucker when she sees one.','Buffy the Vampire Slayer',10206,5.9236,5.6,'pnZkV_aR_9w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11515,_binary '\0','/lFNqSPK1EZZBoCfDUl65BGunCoe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103898',5.2,1424,'de','The Burning Moon','A delinquent brother reads his kid sister two bedtime stories after injecting himself with heroin. These disturbingly morbid stories focus on a serial killing blind date and a murderous, psychotic priest.','/mYmV7xOdBzfbmMWyqssEDtETIyC.jpg','1992-02-26',98,'Released','When the moon is full, the blood tide rises.','The Burning Moon',40058,1.2076,5.8,'6lxF5KZIbLo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11516,_binary '\0','/7QLGk7qKm66dtjTtpVeAIRocoan.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103905',7.4,45367,'fr','C\'est arrivé près de chez vous','The activities of rampaging, indiscriminate serial killer Ben are recorded by a willingly complicit documentary team, who eventually become his accomplices and active participants. Ben provides casual commentary on the nature of his work and arbitrary musings on topics of interest to him, such as music or the conditions of low-income housing, and even goes so far as to introduce the documentary crew to his family. But their reckless indulgences soon get the better of them.','/uRVI98a6MxdLkpsXM8LqIM9W7XZ.jpg','1992-08-20',96,'Released','A killer comedy.','Man Bites Dog',10086,3.7083,7.2,'3HFuTY3HpV8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11517,_binary '\0','/l0JgqFNxeMb1OoHq1CzdYC3Y5J8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103919',6.8,110484,'en','Candyman','The Candyman, a murderous soul with a hook for a hand, is accidentally summoned to reality by a skeptic grad student researching the monster\'s myth.','/jQtgkgDZE7egMq532sOt83DnT83.jpg','1992-10-16',100,'Released','We dare you to say his name five times.','Candyman',9529,6.9588,6.7,'CeLZMhkFTuU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11518,_binary '\0','/a7nEljKws5sgtCndAkJtdpGz9pe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103923',3.3,16267,'en','Captain America','During World War II, a brave, patriotic American Soldier undergoes experiments to become a new supersoldier, \"Captain America\". Racing to Germany to sabotage the rockets of Nazi baddie \"Red Skull\", Captain America winds up frozen until the 1990s. He reawakens to find that the Red Skull has changed identities and is now planning to kidnap the President of the United States.','/vdHrLFfHcJX9nlvUfG3LK2a2hq4.jpg','1990-12-14',97,'Released','As the entire world teetered on the brink of global destruction, there arose a man unlike any other...a man who personified truth and justice and all the hopes of mankind. They called him Captain America.','Captain America',13995,5.3038,4.546,'cs8rFsmhNTc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11519,_binary '\0','/cUqa9ngoI72dFGVQKVLsTbzj65B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103924',5.9,24917,'en','Captain Ron','When mild-mannered Martin Harvey finds out that he has inherited a vintage yacht, he decides to take his family on a Caribbean vacation to retrieve the vessel. Upon arriving on a small island and realizing that the ship is in rough shape, Martin and his family end up with more than they bargained for as the roguish Captain Ron signs on to sail the boat to Miami. It doesn\'t take long before Ron\'s anything-goes antics get the Harveys into plenty of trouble.','/otnKFXvqFH2swlrNf2sNiXpnIsR.jpg','1992-09-18',100,'Released','Martin just wanted a nice, quiet family vacation. Instead, he got... Captain Ron','Captain Ron',14361,4.0532,5.6,'VaTCVWnjcK8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11520,_binary '\0','/zbnNk0dY8Pj3rlqrT2KDTh6ZQlr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103926',7,2061,'en','Careful','The mountain-village passions of a German widow and her sons unfold in the style of a 1920s expressionist movie.','/qolQ7M5hpbBwcvpMpfeSMyU64rs.jpg','1992-09-30',100,'Released',NULL,'Careful',55613,1.0085,6,'09guxj1weq8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11521,_binary '\0','/gjPra9czrNyqWTuNJPI6U4OOa6J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103927',3.5,2937,'en','Carry On Columbus','Christopher Columbus believes he can find an alternative route to the far East and persuades the King and Queen of Spain to finance his expedition...','/i2xYxXo2j8RCqxDQCs0c2xxqw8s.jpg','1992-10-02',91,'Released',NULL,'Carry On Columbus',19725,2.0526,3.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11522,_binary '\0','/zQgSvwgYdJOnywMJvAFWQxbAXz7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103935',7.5,6393,'zh','青少年哪吒','In Taipei, four youths face alienation, loneliness, and moments of existential crisis amidst a series of minor crimes.','/eVNOoFSpRnaCNSJwerAD0KkeibD.jpg','1994-08-04',106,'Released',NULL,'Rebels of the Neon God',57564,2.0264,7.3,'C6xEVquRjcg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11523,_binary '\0','/qjKUUw2AhUZnbEzQIOjAN3chjeE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103939',7.5,66134,'en','Chaplin','An aged Charlie Chaplin narrates his life to his autobiography\'s editor, including his rise to wealth and comedic fame from poverty, his turbulent personal life and his run-ins with the FBI.','/yEbD5ibsuZOZF522bb3RXtOYg35.jpg','1992-12-17',145,'Released','Everyone has a wild side. Even a legend.','Chaplin',10435,6.5812,7.4,'7tXo1S8c0hc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11524,_binary '\0','/kN8YtaE6i9SLI3aHSPD7UKL4dTS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103949',7,1333,'ru','Чекист','Srubov is a part of CHEKA, the secret police Lenin established after the Bolshevik Revolution. They arrest, interview for a minute, try in ten seconds, and execute intellectuals, aristocrats, Jews, clergy, and their families. In the building basement, five people at a time are shot as they stand naked facing wooden doors. No one to remember their last words; no martyrs, just anonymous bodies. Daily, the kangaroo court, the executions, the loading of bodies onto wagons. Srubov is cold, distant, sexually dysfunctional, and a deep thinker, hated by former friends and his family. As he tries to reason the nature of revolution and the purpose of CHEKA, he slowly goes mad.','/y9Xlinx4B9eEGAliCBdnU8RWF0s.jpg','1992-09-15',91,'Released','The face of death','Chekist',119320,2.2748,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11525,_binary '\0','/6IvACiFRqZ7hNbmwYUWNzqCouAp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103950',6.3,13969,'cn','城市獵人','A self-indulgent private investigator winds up on a cruise ship full of rich patrons, gorgeous women, murderous terrorists, and scarce food.','/r34w8z6H08lKMfCAXsYLr47ORD2.jpg','1993-01-14',99,'Released','He\'s out of town, out of time and out of his depth!','City Hunter',11198,5.8943,6.6,'Ef95EpDi5jc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11526,_binary '\0','/8kZT97Ml1ZyawrfHCajmP2b0wPC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103956',5.2,52201,'en','Child\'s Play 3','Eight years after seemingly destroying the killer doll, teen Andy Barclay is placed in a military school, and the spirit of Chucky returns to renew his quest and seek vengeance after being recreated from a mass of melted plastic.','/6toMk9OCuDYEEf733Bzlq3yiw3z.jpg','1991-08-30',90,'Released','There comes a time to put away childhood things. But some things won\'t stay put!','Child\'s Play 3',11187,11.2051,5.906,'3No1jTRSvg8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11527,_binary '\0','/bc9yu8sj4SAn1WvWoqtslmeAcH3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103957',4.7,1454,'en','Children of the Night','In the quiet little town of Allburg, friends Lucy and Cindy are on the verge of going away to college when they partake in a cleansing ritual by swimming in an abandoned church crypt. After Lucy accidentally drops her crucifix in the water, it drifts down and awakens the ancient vampire Czakyr, who becomes thirsty for Lucy\'s virgin blood.','/ikcykEAFNVNEirJBkBYfPJvgdB9.jpg','1991-09-06',92,'Released','Be home before nightfall... and pray for dawn!','Children of the Night',61054,1.9471,4.3,'6E1rkVqwxqk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11528,_binary '\0','/jvnrGpr0KlYzaZoJS96UizxVWw0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103959',4.1,2203,'en','Chopper Chicks in Zombietown','Riding around on their motorbikes, a gang of tough women bikers are the only thing that stands between a crowd of zombies, which have been accidentally let out of their secure cave, and those still alive in the town.','/2iViC9lCEmmrDHir1sBLcPV690U.jpg','1989-04-05',86,'Released','They\'re looking for a few good men.','Chopper Chicks in Zombietown',27070,1.8153,4.7,'7KpRrB4fgk0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11529,_binary '\0','/wnIeCk6ODy5pIfC61w4GtTTyxmU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103961',4.8,1733,'en','Christmas in Connecticut','Elizabeth is the star of a successful cooking show and author of several cookbooks. But when her manager, Alexander sees forest ranger Jefferson, who lost his cabin in a fire, comment on TV about wishing he could get a home-cooked Christmas dinner, he arranges for a special live show on Christmas, for Elizabeth to cook him Christmas Dinner. Only Elizabeth can\'t cook, and trying to keep Jefferson and the viewing public from finding out on a live show may be a little difficult.','/Alwn4aKfVwqHPNYcUMNuuvZSlE6.jpg','1992-12-22',93,'Released',NULL,'Christmas in Connecticut',55596,1.6984,4.697,'f2lRqz0Urvs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11530,_binary '\0','/9qlCxh3I50mfLc3oWoFr3I8pKH8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103962',4.5,3404,'en','Christopher Columbus: The Discovery','Genoan navigator Christopher Columbus has a dream to find an alternative route to sail to the Indies, by traveling west instead of east, across the unchartered Ocean sea. After failing to find backing from the Portugese, he goes to the Spanish court to ask Queen Isabella and King Ferdinand for help. After surviving a grilling from the Head of the Spanish Inquisition Tomas de Torquemada, he eventually gets the blessing from Queen Isabella and sets sail in three ships to travel into the unknown. Along the way he must deal with sabotage from Portugese spies and mutiny from a rebellious crew.','/2VUr81cOU0jsZtzBs2EoVHcDJDW.jpg','1992-08-20',120,'Released','Chosen by a queen. Driven by a dream. He dared to go to the edge, and kept going.','Christopher Columbus: The Discovery',41682,3.2434,4.8,'fr1_TMVrYv4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11531,_binary '\0','/6yv04w4HhItzCvLP70drYy0qtbl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103969',7.8,4339,'ro','Balanţa','A description of Romania before Ceausescu\'s downfall, through the story of Nela. Daughter of a former colonel of the Securitate, the romanian political police. She refused to become like her sister, an agent of this Securitate, and lives with her father. After he died, she leaves Bucharest, and ends up in a little town, where she meets Mitica, a surgeon, another herself, laughing at everything.','/7eNbNHfsm7SvyFb8LTzsCQ5WiMK.jpg','1992-09-16',105,'Released',NULL,'The Oak',41678,2.4316,6.7,'6PktLxhgkKQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11532,_binary '\0','/x5TzLtw9teazSVRvSiLjQM8RqIC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103973',7,1660,'en','Citizen Cohn','As lawyer and power broker Roy Cohn lies dying of AIDS in a private hospital room, ghosts from his past visit him as he reflects on his life and loves.','/2Eqgea16BiNen8nFzFV5IDQCq7o.jpg','1992-08-22',107,'Released','He was McCarthy\'s loyal partner. The Kennedys\' worst enemy. The F.B.I.\'s best friend. The country\'s greatest nightmare.','Citizen Cohn',75145,1.9259,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11533,_binary '\0','/tbZJMFiJSDMVTkYkkFRxWKlwNpe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103976',6.5,6047,'en','City of Joy','Max Lowe is a Houston surgeon who has grown weary of the bureaucracy of American medicine. When he loses a patient on the operating table, Max impulsively decides to leave America and travel to India in the hope of finding himself. Not long after he arrives in Calcutta, Max is attacked by a group of thugs and left without money or a passport.','/heq4BXSPGkhpLXEc20zkDlwQgUe.jpg','1992-04-15',132,'Released','He was a man who couldn\'t care less... until he met a man who couldn\'t care more.','City of Joy',47821,3.9055,6.6,'w9dshlVBrSg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11534,_binary '\0','/eKMy8K39xU3L4GrphhQ2UmQJa14.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103978',6.1,8770,'en','Class Act','Duncan is a genius straight A student, Blade is ajuvenile delinquent. But because of a mix up with their school records, everyone thinks each is the other one. Now, Duncan kind of likes the attention from being thought of as a real bad dude, if only the school bully would stop trying to rough him up. And Blade definitely likes being thought of as important instead of as trouble.','/bjXz1WkcaOMVZr70GIVqbQ2clWG.jpg','1992-06-05',98,'Released','A hair-raising comedy!','Class Act',30963,2.7877,6.262,'113aS4qO2Co','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11535,_binary '\0','/68XpGYC5D0dVVQwbspehCqlwY1W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103982',5.1,1242,'en','Cold Heaven','While on holiday in Mexico, unhappily married Marie Davenport summons the courage to tell her unknowing husband, Alex, that she is leaving him for her lover. But before she delivers the news, Alex is involved in a boating accident – and Marie is unsure whether he\'s dead or not. Faced with supernatural events, Marie turns back to Catholicism and seeks the help of Father Niles and Sister Martha.','/dnlNgqPlNNWuskm0AO5MnRNhwrn.jpg','1992-05-29',105,'Released','Somewhere between life and death.','Cold Heaven',107254,2.6517,4.3,'lCdxhwgmf38','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11536,_binary '\0','/oWXYQ20Wt4v7nwmKY6weqFFQRGJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103991',5.4,1230,'it','Le comiche 2','Paolo Villaggio and Renato Pozzetto are the protagonists of various misadventures, first as nurses of a crazy ambulance, then as night guards of a shopping center and later as a pilot and stewardess of an air taxi. Next, they enlist in the foreign legion and then work as a Santa Claus in a Department Store.','/fIhoGGxL8flbYQPTt7F1xeSxEKh.jpg','1991-12-20',87,'Released',NULL,'The Comics 2',43648,1.0156,5.688,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11537,_binary '\0','/fi7gBF2nfIGWF9MuOhuEr6rkgBQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0103994',7.1,20646,'es','Como agua para chocolate','Tita is passionately in love with Pedro, but her controlling mother forbids her from marrying him. When Pedro marries her sister, Tita throws herself into her cooking and discovers she can transfer her emotions through the food she prepares, infecting all who eat it with her intense heartbreak.','/itwUdMqLmPfhtGJ44hiDxkqZhiq.jpg','1992-04-16',105,'Released','In Tita\'s kitchen, ordinary spices become a recipe for passion.','Like Water for Chocolate',18183,4.2635,7.279,'EkvgSTJkKGI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11538,_binary '\0','/sCBEywMPvO8sS3dvubMNYt7onCD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104006',5.7,8953,'en','Consenting Adults','Richard and Priscilla Parker are an ordinary suburban couple whose lives are invaded and rocked by their hedonistic, secretive new neighbors, Eddy and Kay Otis.','/16H9mMevZFFZfnCgsE2fVe2HH51.jpg','1992-10-16',99,'Released','Thou shalt not covet thy neighbor\'s wife.','Consenting Adults',37753,3.2781,5.424,'BkVsrJUdzoc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11539,_binary '\0','/hfTKQGmXbaeOmiRmHdQ6A4vK95T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104008',7.2,7128,'fr','Conte d\'hiver','Felicie and Charles have a whirlwind holiday romance. Due to a mix-up on addresses they lose contact, and five years later at Christmas-time Felicie is living with her mother in a cold Paris with a daughter as a reminder of that long-ago summer. For male companionship she oscillates between hairdresser Maxence and the intellectual Loic, but seems unable to commit to either as the memory of Charles and what might have been hangs over everything.','/4YBjcrIyHNaRRc20SdQXKW0p9r8.jpg','1992-01-29',114,'Released',NULL,'A Tale of Winter',10241,2.0366,7,'lfhcwzO0VTk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11540,_binary '\0','/uRUAwzXOU75vmO0CD1RzY0CaZ8d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104009',4.9,27223,'en','Cool World','While incarcerated for murder, cartoonist Jack Deebs found escape by creating Cool World, a series featuring a voluptuous femme fatale named Holli Would. But the artist becomes a prisoner of his own fantasies when Holli transports Jack into Cool World with a scheme to seduce him and bring herself to life. Hard-boiled detective Frank Harris – the only other human in Cool World – cautions Jack with the law: Noids (humans) don\'t have sex with doodles (cartoons). However, flesh proves weaker than ink as Holli takes human form in Las Vegas, staring in a trans-universal chase that threatens the destruction of both worlds.','/mqzRUHNtFwmgJCmSnvq3JnX0xgZ.jpg','1992-07-10',102,'Released','Holli Would if she could ...and she will','Cool World',14239,6.7259,5.7,'J-RypXeH8Fo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11541,_binary '\0','/hpcrX3mqu5WGM9r5aDlukU86ucS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104014',5.2,7805,'it','Così fan tutte','After five years of marriage, Diana discovers the joys of adultery, claiming that she can save her failing relationship through betrayal.','/7MKmQ9TdHQdiYpVGyZFBu6aFTvE.jpg','1992-02-21',93,'Released','A New Erotic Masterpiece from Tinto Brass, the Director of Caligula.','All Ladies Do It',37265,9.134,5.068,'rOix7Lu1TSY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11542,_binary '\0','/eMjDaAP6a6146dWUctEDitvJpCN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104025',6.8,1857,'fr','La Crise','Victor is a legal advisor who finds himself abandoned by his wife and fired the same day. He tries to seek comfort from different friends and family members, but everyone he meets is concerned with their own problems. His morale begins to falter when he realizes that no one cares about him.','/dm1w31bd5uXu752cDrmu3q9UKke.jpg','1992-12-02',95,'Released',NULL,'The Crisis',56947,1.5453,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11543,_binary '\0','/l22ObdYSFwyWqCzvZlAZNaXwslb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104027',5.8,2450,'en','CrissCross','A 12-year-old boy comes of age in 1969 Key West against the backdrop of the Apollo moon landing, when he begins to sell cocaine so his mother can stop stripping.','/45XEweogsSzd4HqiEAIdd3Sj9gi.jpg','1992-05-08',96,'Released',NULL,'CrissCross',70423,2.2202,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11544,_binary '\0','/uXWGRcCtgaQja4QKOBEM7rGdh9L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104028',7.8,3932,'sr','Црни бомбардер','In a near-future Belgrade, a DJ stirs up trouble with his rocking anti-establishment broadcasts. After his station is shut down, he takes to the street and starts transmitting revolution with the police hot on his trail.','/8EX4KsWGN26k43jeH9sIBH1CrM0.jpg','1992-06-15',116,'Released',NULL,'The Black Bomber',109143,1.9754,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11545,_binary '\0','/nR16suoZalsNzJvtkN8nxsTVwrR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104029',6.7,36942,'es','Cronos','Faced with his own mortality, an ingenious alchemist tried to perfect an invention that would provide him with the key to eternal life. It was called the Cronos device. When he died more than 400 years later, he took the secrets of this remarkable device to the grave with him. Now, an elderly antiques dealer has found the hellish machine hidden in a statue and learns about its incredible powers. The more he uses the device, the younger he becomes...but nothing comes without a price. Life after death is just the beginning as this nerve-shattering thriller unfolds and the fountain of youth turns bloody.','/tQqIA8bDN7v1LmHjJg7Qh9BKCLa.jpg','1993-11-05',94,'Released','An ancient device. A modern discovery. A terrifying tale of the eternal.','Cronos',11655,4.8391,6.7,'j_9r7Trek5I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11546,_binary '\0','/k4ZrvqTWADP1nzgXNSKDNk4xOEB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104036',7.2,63893,'en','The Crying Game','Irish Republican Army member Fergus forms an unexpected bond with Jody, a kidnapped British soldier in his custody, despite the warnings of fellow IRA members Jude and Maguire. Jody makes Fergus promise he\'ll visit his girlfriend, Dil, in London, and when Fergus flees to the city, he seeks her out. Hounded by his former IRA colleagues, he finds himself increasingly drawn to the enigmatic, and surprising, Dil.','/9BXGoat9TYgdDqGk2WJmaX9dVoe.jpg','1992-09-02',112,'Released','...play it at your own risk.','The Crying Game',11386,5.6447,6.8,'FRxmK7Q3yF4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11547,_binary '\0','/pNGrPhlOt76pkC5VAPR76mQrgin.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104040',6.9,25616,'en','The Cutting Edge','Two former Olympians, one a figure skater and the other a hockey player, pin their hopes of one last shot at Olympic glory on one another. That is, of course, if they can keep from killing each other in the process...','/sx4qf2XoW0xaLITQLpajsYc4mcj.jpg','1992-03-27',102,'Released','The ultimate love/skate relationship.','The Cutting Edge',16562,3.4807,7.284,'0jvRfLOVfeY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11548,_binary '\0','/aDHXSz4U53LAVaQvgUdzKME0xob.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104046',7.5,4675,'nl','Daens','Father Daens returns to Aalst, where workers suffer from poverty, child labor, and exploitation in the textile industry. Driven by his sense of justice, he takes their side, even if it means confronting the church and the upper class. A detailed historical drama about the fight for justice.','/nUBD5dFMtnwn6mbQQrYTAzlcaLv.jpg','1992-10-01',138,'Released',NULL,'Daens',44103,1.282,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11549,_binary '\0','/78XMuCvwtCRLFUbZNd5qbM0oaO3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104053',5.8,8980,'it','Trauma','A young Romanian woman and a recovering drug addict launch an unlikely investigation after her parents are murdered by a vicious serial killer known as The Headhunter.','/A9lheNDXPb4HS0g2RQu2rUD98V5.jpg','1993-03-12',109,'Released','A dark secret. A twisted mind. An insane desire for revenge.','Trauma',44435,2.016,5.8,'WKURm_LsFjU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11550,_binary '\0','/l8ofJ0ErKaL5F3JKmYVn4aa4i1w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104057',6.7,3917,'en','Daughters of the Dust','In 1902, a Gullah family on the Sea Islands off South Carolina decide whether to migrate to the mainland, risking their unique cultural heritage.','/sk5qednzLeDZMIhto6Oa9QFKOon.jpg','1991-01-24',112,'Released',NULL,'Daughters of the Dust',68427,1.846,6.3,'FRpTae7jmi4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11551,_binary '\0','/vDFhaKEMKPIUePtQH2nOwSHfgPy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104070',6.7,151929,'en','Death Becomes Her','Madeline is married to Ernest, who was once her arch-rival Helen\'s fiancé. After recovering from a mental breakdown, Helen vows to kill Madeline and steal back Ernest. Unfortunately for everyone, the introduction of a magic potion causes things to be a great deal more complicated than a mere murder plot.','/kkWxyyyWFK5KNk9WVwQuGEC9H9H.jpg','1992-07-30',104,'Released','In one small bottle... The fountain of youth. The secret of eternal life. The power of an ancient potion. Sometimes it works... sometimes it doesn\'t.','Death Becomes Her',9374,12.8122,6.797,'0jPuZLUY4II','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11552,_binary '\0','/1igdOZ4SzSaomRaKkCKMlK45f05.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104073',7,16819,'en','Deep Cover','Black police officer Russell Stevens applies for a special anti-drug squad which targets the highest boss of cocaine delivery to LA—the Colombian foreign minister\'s nephew. Russell works his way up from the bottom undercover, until he reaches the boss.','/etr2mCm7gMufAJkSLuB23XocDtd.jpg','1992-04-15',108,'Released','There\'s a thin line between catching a criminal... and becoming one.','Deep Cover',20676,5.1413,6.817,'ZDyw5XK32Ws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11553,_binary '\0','/5neTqMtoLkXrZlYY8PkH5K7Plz1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104082',5.8,1352,'sv','Den demokratiske terroristen','The West German security police, Verfassungsschutz, need help to infiltrate a group connected to the Rote Arme Fraktion. The Swedish James Bond, Carl Hamilton, goes to Hamburg, pretending to be a Swedish officer, thrown out of the country after having been exposed as an East German spy. He gets in contact with the terrorists and joins them. Together they are planning to strike against the CIA headquarters in Stockholm.','/bicOkDfv1NwFz8qloWKiR1jEvm3.jpg','1992-08-21',96,'Released',NULL,'The Democratic Terrorist',48995,1.4267,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11554,_binary '\0','/hesIVXWlTMJHoEDLrbub8aMPlZj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104105',6.2,1343,'fr','Diên Biên Phu','Vietnam, 1954. An American reporter finds himself in the middle of the battle of Điện Biên Phủ, between the French army and the Vietminh.','/snqmAzSevLzf8hip90clpdIvVip.jpg','1992-03-04',125,'Released',NULL,'Dien Bien Phu',74714,2.3659,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11555,_binary '\0','/sVtITce3bIq0ykEtnQynNQb4PIa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104107',6.9,8953,'en','Diggstown','Gabriel Caine has just been released from prison when he sets up a bet with a business man who owns most of Diggstown, a boxing-mad town. The bet is that Gabe can find a boxer that will knock out 10 Diggstown men, in a boxing ring, within 24 hours. Roy \'Honey\' Palmer is that man that, at 48, many say he is too old.','/rJ0VsONJzyctlYX8W2rL8TQ4wD9.jpg','1992-08-14',98,'Released','Where the pros meet the cons.','Diggstown',19143,3.2233,6.333,'Vr007U4Pekk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11556,_binary '\0','/CC6S4ea706RSUy5lvzPqU8eRyT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104114',5.9,18067,'en','The Distinguished Gentleman','A Florida con man uses the recent death of the long time Congressman from his district, who he just happens to share a last name with, to get elected to his version of paradise, the U.S. Congress, where the money flows from lobbyists.','/ny722xPMhsY6JlRmQQjLZs7JP0S.jpg','1992-12-04',112,'Released','From con man to congressman.','The Distinguished Gentleman',10411,4.0905,6.01,'SfOSA34yjuI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11557,_binary '\0','/Ak4qIGjRY2CYrTTB1VsM9i9nF13.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104115',5.4,2770,'en','Doctor Mordrid','Bound by hate and a mystical amulet that holds the powers of life and death, two immortal wizards meet for the last time in an ancient struggle of good versus evil.','/zH9TkMZHSVRokg6vyyeLdu5SJxf.jpg','1992-11-02',74,'Released','Doctor Mordrid will have you believing in magic all over again!','Doctor Mordrid',1877,2.2378,5.1,'M-BjMiezgxs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11558,_binary '\0','/nB8tUVLUPAGKDdmuX3rMTqznJkq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104118',7,2614,'en','Doing Time on Maple Drive','Yale scholar Matt Carter introduces his wealthy fiancée, Allison, to his family, and initially everything goes smoothly. However, it isn\'t long before Allison learns that Matt has lied to her about his relatives to mask their failures and dysfunctions. His brother, Tim, flunked out of school and developed a drinking problem, and Matt struggles to keep his own troubling secret from his less than tolerant parents.','/3SuMq6qrDqVr3ltF94z9UjB8iPP.jpg','1992-03-16',92,'Released','Every family has its secrets.','Doing Time on Maple Drive',22795,2.1678,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11559,_binary '\0','/clYDUgc2sh3W83iIa1yF9tFFgGW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104119',4.8,3815,'en','Dolly Dearest','An American family moves to Mexico to fabricate dolls, but their toy factory happens to be next to a Sanzian grave and the toys come into possession of an old, malicious spirit.','/fp5o7DIp31R3T7SNzPGVKgyyTpu.jpg','1991-09-01',93,'Released','It\'s time to play...','Dolly Dearest',28859,2.8588,5.7,'N9Ni1kaIewg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11560,_binary '\0','/kyaUlqZMGAcxv7lmNCMYtJ5XcrV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104135',4.3,2482,'en','Double Trouble','Two beefed-up twins operating on opposing sides of the law, team up to stop a nefarious crook in this actioner. Peter Jade is a notoriously arrogant burglar who ends up with the key to an enormous underground cache of diamonds. David Jade is a cop who joins forces with Peter after greedy Philip Chamberlain, wanting the diamonds for himself, kills David\'s partner','/c9Q0zxjCPBS84y2akpowbnNcnOQ.jpg','1992-02-14',86,'Released','Twin brothers. Ones a good cop. The other is bad news.','Double Trouble',88107,2.5463,4.7,'SIecX6FHDcw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11561,_binary '\0','/lnv9JCsdMVdZJocPW52Zy70KNiK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104139',5.4,8691,'en','Dr. Giggles','In 1957, Evan Rendell flees after his father is lynched for killing multiple patients in his effort to find a replacement heart for his ailing wife. After 35 years, Evan escapes from a mental institution and returns to town for revenge, killing off residents one by one. When Jennifer and her friends break into the Rendell house out of morbid curiosity, Evan notices Jennifer has a heart condition similar to his mother and decides to make her his final victim.','/xd2gbzKxJSdKgNDMHYehfl4xt8j.jpg','1992-10-23',95,'Released','A new prescription for terror.','Dr. Giggles',37527,2.6738,5.5,'Esdz_gBnUc4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11562,_binary '\0','/ifnxZzX6oFkVdwDuQOYN5fE8a2c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104147',6.8,3144,'cn','賭聖','Sing, a dumb, lovable mainlander with supernatural powers comes to China to visit his uncle Tat. When it\'s revealed that Sing can see through objects, Tat employs him as \"The Saint of Gamblers,\" and proceeds to set him loose in the gambling world.','/nfSoqPX29IAZme5Ydl5P0CHh7EB.jpg','1990-08-18',101,'Released',NULL,'All for the Winner',40346,2.6103,6.8,'8YnWZiCAx0E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11563,_binary '\0','/5V0v8Gh2JEBycQ7TNgocEv3i0PN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104155',6.2,6641,'en','Dust Devil','A woman on the run from her abusive husband encounters a mysterious hitch-hiker.','/59pEswv24gaJk1BZ6s7o7NnceVf.jpg','1992-07-11',103,'Released','He\'s not a serial killer. He\'s much worse.','Dust Devil',5237,1.8863,6.26,'qis1w0MV1oU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11564,_binary '\0','/60OypzgF62FE8PWxXi5zSI1bLyS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104181',6.6,16687,'en','Wuthering Heights','Young orphan Heathcliff is adopted by the wealthy Earnshaw family and moves into their estate, Wuthering Heights. Soon, the new resident falls for his compassionate foster sister, Cathy. The two share a remarkable bond that seems unbreakable until Cathy, feeling the pressure of social convention, suppresses her feelings and marries Edgar Linton, a man of means who befits her stature. Heathcliff vows to win her back.','/lV8zMPqaK8Qg39zKLzfvnYkiBiC.jpg','1992-10-16',105,'Released','A passion. An obsession. A love that destroyed everyone it touched.','Wuthering Heights',25095,5.8157,6.645,'a6eTho1jxuM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11565,_binary '\0','/2C4b0mHxy420fBk5xvbBwEf03bY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104187',5.9,50199,'en','Encino Man','High school misfits Stoney and Dave discover a long-frozen primeval man buried in their backyard. But the thawed-out Link—as the boys have named him—quickly becomes a wild card in the teens\' already zany Southern California lives. After a shave and some new clothes, Link\'s presence at school makes the daily drudgery a lot more interesting.','/y8HtL6pyjfODdHOFgciFVFmt8Eq.jpg','1992-05-22',88,'Released','When the stone age meets the rock age.','Encino Man',10406,5.3912,5.814,'1xkTN1Z1rTQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11566,_binary '\0','/vffosXhKJ8bWIeqwLqRAjEsSVpx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104201',5.6,1438,'en','Equinox','Estranged twins Henry and Freddy navigate their drastically different lives— one a troubled bookworm, the other a hardened criminal. As a young writer uncovers their royal lineage and inheritance, the brothers’ fate intertwines in unexpected ways.','/lVmZkiDbTJ1GUYMxUDqdkrAQkFp.jpg','1992-09-18',110,'Released','The shocking story of identical twins... One too good to die. The other too evil to live.','Equinox',115565,1.5941,5.7,'DcOXVe5jlqU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11567,_binary '\0','/lGIe6Cpv9o3uKRutwFGyNkcx80o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104215',5.4,1770,'en','Excessive Force','Chicago policeman Terry McCain is determined to put away mobster Sal DiMarco, who always gets acquitted on technicalities. While monitoring a drug sale, a shootout ensues, and one of Terry\'s fellow officers gets away with $3 million of Sal\'s money. Suspecting Terry took the cash, the mobster sends his men to kill Terry\'s brother, Dylan, and partner, Frankie Hawkins. Furious, Terry sets out to take his revenge by any means necessary.','/4DzUkmxUAdlq993UpV0Cw5SiPH3.jpg','1993-05-14',87,'Released','You have the right to remain silent... permanently.','Excessive Force',24227,1.9473,4.9,'1tZyaCKwvew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11568,_binary '\0','/1Qf6lzJFhNiRVQrS2N05PQbInmY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104231',6.6,73393,'en','Far and Away','A young free-spirited Irish woman from an affluent Protestant family spontaneously befriends a street-smart commoner cheated by her family’s hostile land takeovers. They escape to America, ready to take advantage of the 19th century Oklahoma land rush.','/is80o8p0sCok3UqtnHEE2oyXyad.jpg','1992-05-22',140,'Released','What they needed was a country big enough for their dreams.','Far and Away',11259,11.6316,6.8,'kgpwDLMowBM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11569,_binary '\0','/jITuPW8zL9JmDnc7R24jpTtn2Qu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104237',6.7,22974,'en','Damage','The life of a respected British politician at the height of his career crumbles when he becomes obsessed with his son\'s lover.','/alf3JOPP7EYP0iO24gwe5YfRnqo.jpg','1992-12-02',111,'Released','Desire... Deceit... Destiny...','Damage',11012,7.4922,6.605,'QHoSvQwvrnw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11570,_binary '\0','/yEWh2uS2hYEMxfMKasrf0ysw874.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104254',6.6,38251,'en','FernGully: The Last Rainforest','When a sprite named Crysta shrinks a human boy, Zak, down to her size, he vows to help the magical fairy folk stop a greedy logging company from destroying their home: the pristine rainforest known as FernGully. Zak and his new friends fight to defend FernGully from lumberjacks — and the vengeful spirit they accidentally unleash after chopping down a magic tree.','/xkJxdeaibcrcsi1XHvT0IuOjdzB.jpg','1992-04-10',76,'Released','Just beyond your dreams lives a secret world. Where every tree is a home. Every sound is a song. And humans only exist in fairy tales. Until now...','FernGully: The Last Rainforest',13225,5.5774,6.4,'Dzqyc95zcxo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11571,_binary '\0','/H40nWdJngUc6gtytMAbElm9HOu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104257',7.8,321731,'en','A Few Good Men','When cocky military lawyer Lt. Daniel Kaffee and his co-counsel, Lt. Cmdr. JoAnne Galloway, are assigned to a murder case, they uncover a hazing ritual that could implicate high-ranking officials such as shady Col. Nathan Jessep.','/rLOk4z9zL1tTukIYV56P94aZXKk.jpg','1992-12-11',138,'Released','In the heart of the nation\'s capital, in a courthouse of the U.S. government, one man will stop at nothing to keep his honor, and one will stop at nothing to find the truth.','A Few Good Men',881,16.2014,7.56,'2T2pyqrr8UM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11572,_binary '\0','/1hMdzWs6s48ySNruPDW9gc33exw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104265',5.9,16409,'en','Final Analysis','A psychiatrist becomes romantically involved with the sister of one of his patients, but the influence of her controlling gangster husband threatens to destroy them both.','/bQZT83mRoNINRsCaKtKOpUQQdY.jpg','1992-02-07',124,'Released','Someone was seduced. Someone was set up. and before it was all over... someone was dead.','Final Analysis',4823,5.5192,5.762,'xWiUQhvxjG4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11573,_binary '\0','/gpbikFSRiA0uFCtGqmfQkpoyM9Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104279',5.7,5486,'nl','Flodder in Amerika!','The mayor of Sunny Dale see a chance to get rid of the Flodder family: They send the asocial bunch for an international exchange to New York. There they get confused with a Russian delegation of medical doctors while the street worker Werner who accompanies them becomes imprisoned.','/sgF2RyQTFl9lKyT0CJlZhzZfbNI.jpg','1992-06-03',95,'Released',NULL,'Flodder Does Manhattan!',10408,1.8315,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11574,_binary '\0','/xGqHBEji3b64z5daKLTZTRf4dLn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104283',5.7,3018,'en','Folks!','A slightly self absorbed yuppie takes in his parents including his senile father, after their home burns down. But his personal and professional life fall apart soon after.','/sCx6kmi8YMvpGJyayCpnGseoenZ.jpg','1992-05-01',107,'Released',NULL,'Folks!',18495,2.3581,5.5,'do5xs1T11A8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11575,_binary '\0','/iCGgBNzTeh8Q3bh0Y8PJalL7r5R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104291',6.4,53169,'en','Forever Young','A 1939 test pilot asks his best friend to use him as a guinea pig for a cryogenics experiment. Daniel McCormick wants to be frozen for a year so that he doesn\'t have to watch his love lying in a coma. The next thing Daniel knows is that he\'s been awoken in 1992.','/eKbD77BEhhBmFD7ZE9VTi9o8r2K.jpg','1992-12-16',102,'Released','Time waits for no man, but true love waits forever.','Forever Young',10326,6.2968,6.504,'HIEHuEFDgac','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11576,_binary '\0','/8FlHUvNOSANeo8Y8adBNJanEib.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104299',5.4,18967,'en','Freejack','Time-traveling bounty hunters find a doomed race-car driver in the past and bring him to 2009 New York, where his mind will be replaced with that of a terminally ill billionaire.','/lSN8lIX90Az0t1qvIXC4MlCvd9a.jpg','1992-01-17',110,'Released','Alex Furlong died today. Eighteen years from now he\'ll be running for his life.','Freejack',9278,4.2023,5.5,'CIU819AyIVM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11577,_binary '\0','/byckFRHkQnXZezIGjamsYTjCvlb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104321',6.6,4849,'en','Gas Food Lodging','Nora, a single mother raising two teenage daughters, Shade and Trudi, waits tables at a truck-stop diner in a small New Mexico town. The beautiful and rebellious Trudi drops out of school and gets a job alongside Nora, while the younger Shade whittles away her time at Spanish movie matinees. Their lives are turned upside down when Trudi becomes pregnant and the girls\' absent father returns.','/4klEYvGDHmv89NQRfAaDc8qHncs.jpg','1992-07-10',101,'Released','When Shade\'s good, she\'s very good. But when Trudi\'s bad, she\'s better.','Gas Food Lodging',47866,2.4617,6.2,'rmUS7oKpcc8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11578,_binary '\0','/rE3t6AnaTWzX1i02ntO3jwrWIts.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104346',6.6,11982,'en','Gladiator','Tommy Riley has moved with his dad to Chicago from a \'nice place\'. He keeps to himself, goes to school. However, after a street fight, he\'s noticed and quickly falls into the world of illegal underground boxing — where punches can kill.','/w0YjBWVfu689txEXZG3xa4Aev3i.jpg','1992-03-06',101,'Released','Nobody owns Tommy Riley. Nobody.','Gladiator',16219,7.5639,7.644,'hnh-7a8-TTI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11579,_binary '\0','/qukaw3P4MOFNdxjhNpClhT9unr8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104348',7.6,127314,'en','Glengarry Glen Ross','An examination of the machinations behind the scenes at a real estate office. Unscrupulous salesmen try to hawk dubious real estate to suckers.','/zcaEDx8KlVfh4vKfMNLhiSi5Oz4.jpg','1992-09-10',100,'Released','A story for everyone who works for a living.','Glengarry Glen Ross',9504,7.2472,7.327,'_VrekKSuFto','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11580,_binary '\0','/f9diUEYPfjgDnC4pzXoWFhunzzQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104350',7.7,3801,'sv','Den goda viljan','In this film about Ingmar Bergman\'s parents, Henrik Bergman is studying for the priesthood and trying to make ends meet when he encounters the lovely, affluent Anna. Despite their social differences, Henrik and Anna fall in love, wed and move to the country. They lead a quiet life as Henrik works as a priest, but it isn\'t long before the simple people and plain surroundings make Anna long for a more lavish lifestyle, which causes marital stress.','/kkwKpqYac8zUNNMkRTfAQfbMQWl.jpg','1992-05-24',182,'Released',NULL,'The Best Intentions',41764,2.4894,7,'PmLPUXqec2M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11581,_binary '\0','/nS0HmXoWdVMcTM4OUzgGmgOj9J8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104352',6.2,6429,'ja','ゴジラvsモスラ','Mothra\'s dark counterpart, Battra, emerges to eliminate humanity on behalf of the Earth. Two tiny fairies called the Cosmos offer their help by calling Mothra to battle the creature. Unfortunately a meteorite has awoken a hibernating Godzilla as a three way battle for the Earth begins.','/oqhO8Vg8DOTnuen1rmL4BdS2su2.jpg','1992-12-12',102,'Released','Earth S.O.S.! The battle over the future of the human race begins.','Godzilla vs. Mothra',39465,3.4161,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11582,_binary '\0','/d4we56oInXStdqPgcNzSsfWcKTP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104362',6.4,3675,'en','Timescape','Before they can complete renovations on their new country inn, a widowed father and his young daughter are visited by a strange group of tourists. He soon makes a chilling discovery: they are disaster junkies from the future who visit the past to witness history\'s greatest catastrophes—and his small town is their next stop.','/snhE8XNzw1Av7yhJa986cnesobB.jpg','1992-01-11',99,'Released',NULL,'Timescape',37420,3.4327,6.4,'wNzCQWEXgMI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11583,_binary '\0','/xOeat7qs3HUClEzn9PZ0IojO0Zq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104376',5.1,1936,'en','The Gun in Betty Lou\'s Handbag','A Southern librarian puts excitement in her life with a found murder weapon and a false confession.','/gouuqyfzqjErBjMaXQaix2VNlyR.jpg','1992-08-21',89,'Released','She was a nobody until someone found...','The Gun in Betty Lou\'s Handbag',47898,1.7801,5.1,'nzROVvskio4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11584,_binary '\0','/mEOX0uznv57FINZUOiNdNse4PvO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104377',5.5,2896,'en','Guncrazy','California teen Anita Minteer struggles in the face of an absentee mother, her mom\'s abusive boyfriend, Rooney, and a lack of respect from her classmates. This all changes when a pen-pal school project connects her with convict Howard. Anita secures Howard\'s parole and violently squares off against Rooney after he rapes her. Soon enough, the gun-crazy teen is on the run with Howard, with his parole officer in pursuit.','/tYY4Dfg3bJlu5woIz2i7LNMD1bX.jpg','1992-09-11',97,'Released','Love made them crazy. Guns made them outlaws.','Guncrazy',24065,1.7896,5.4,'X6Bc8E2sRJ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11585,_binary '\0','/l3qZ3wYF0iRCrWuYTSMsp70qiH9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104389',6.7,56905,'en','The Hand That Rocks the Cradle','A suburban family chooses seemingly sweet Peyton Flanders as their newborn\'s nanny. Only much later does the infant\'s mother, Claire Bartel, realize Peyton\'s true intentions -- to destroy Claire and replace her in the family. The nail-biting suspense builds quickly in this chilling psychological thriller about deception and bitter revenge.','/1fBnyO3SbNBplck45js6O4pQaLw.jpg','1992-01-10',110,'Released','Trust is her weapon. Innocence her opportunity. Revenge her only desire.','The Hand That Rocks the Cradle',11087,10.1172,6.9,'ms2v2C1batY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11586,_binary '\0','/mmIg2bXQDsUTl0T9chDybq51mx2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104391',4.3,1657,'en','Hard Hunted','A nuclear trigger has been smuggled to the Middle East by an evil mastermind named Kane, and the weapons could upset the delicate balance of power in the region if they fall into the wrong hands. It\'s up to three bombshell federal agents to avert disaster and restore the precarious balance.','/esVXyG6o2tD42XmPKgAhPCfdEUY.jpg','1992-09-11',97,'Released','The world\'s hottest undercover agents are back!','Hard Hunted',45030,2.4343,4.5,'nkmV7eOpYnU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11587,_binary '\0','/xjeoa7KjnUMQzJXGunHmgMjhHmP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104409',5.5,38637,'en','Hellraiser III: Hell on Earth','Pinhead is set loose on the sinful streets of New York City to create chaos with a fresh cadre of Cenobitic kin.','/qnXEJp6KP6aIGWhNrg1fOKza4kp.jpg','1992-09-11',93,'Released','What started in Hell will end on Earth.','Hellraiser III: Hell on Earth',11569,6.8301,5.7,'TDbbVx2YYEw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11588,_binary '\0','/2sZ3SYWN4ApotMkDyG79Y5YkAhP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104412',6.5,25377,'en','Hero','Bernie Laplante is having a rough time. He\'s divorced, his ex-wife hates him and has custody of their son, the cops are setting a trap for him, then to top it all, he loses a shoe whilst rescuing passengers of a crashed jet. Being a thief who is down on his luck, Bernie takes advantage of the crash, but then someone else claims credit for the rescue.','/wD7D0B9U9ooanxyhtgLKaqM7www.jpg','1992-10-02',117,'Released','We\'re all heroes if you catch us at the right moment. Even Bernie Laplante.','Hero',10699,4.8245,6.3,'uOA5UzlIwZM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11589,_binary '\0','/cIfa32tuybOwKZKGca1LJxfzTKZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104418',6,6328,'en','Highway to Hell','Charlie and Rachel run away from home to get married in Las Vegas. But they get attacked by a zombie who takes Rachel with him to hell, where she will become one of Satan\'s brides.','/672mGX0B3LIbaBQEdWKAJpCVHO5.jpg','1991-11-21',94,'Released','If there\'s one thing worse than dying and going to Hell, it\'s not dying - and going to Hell.','Highway to Hell',16191,3.3449,5.9,'e6AeScDSe68','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11590,_binary '\0','/dineJzDZLuEXNNy261vFcJgqhxr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104427',6.6,26368,'en','Hoffa','A portrait of union leader James R. Hoffa, as seen through the eyes of his friend, Bobby Ciaro. The film follows Hoffa through his countless battles with the RTA and President Roosevelt.','/aMGhaSkhkFwz33hKEsBrJ3ptx3g.jpg','1992-12-25',140,'Released','He Did What He Had to Do.','Hoffa',10410,5.0122,6.264,'tTlAAEaxckQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11591,_binary '\0','/8fnYJPoXxwAN4valDLgz2whMGTH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104431',6.9,462396,'en','Home Alone 2: Lost in New York','Instead of flying to Florida with his folks, Kevin ends up alone in New York, where he gets a hotel room with his dad\'s credit card—despite problems from a clerk and meddling bellboy. But when Kevin runs into his old nemeses, the Wet Bandits, he\'s determined to foil their plans to rob a toy store on Christmas Eve.','/uuitWHpJwxD1wruFl2nZHIb4UGN.jpg','1992-11-15',120,'Released','He\'s up past his bedtime in the city that never sleeps.','Home Alone 2: Lost in New York',772,23.4936,6.793,'k0kJieJ1k6k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11592,_binary '\0','/r4Vx7kne6dovybAJR4LsR4eQCxP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104437',4.9,49902,'en','Honey, I Blew Up the Kid','Wayne Szalinski is at it again. But instead of shrinking things, he tries to make a machine that can make things grow. As in the first one, his machine isn\'t quite accurate. But when he brings Nick & his toddler son Adam to see his invention, the machine unexpectedly starts working. And when Adam comes right up to the machine, he gets zapped along with his stuffed bunny.','/4EGqDo2pP2ZL0TCcYDGnwsU8liQ.jpg','1992-07-16',89,'Released','The BIG Laughs Start January 6th!','Honey, I Blew Up the Kid',11158,6.3576,5.289,'-agq5R3b43U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11593,_binary '\0','/okgLJmUGZr2CBgIgjTB1CXmlN33.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104438',5.9,20647,'en','Honeymoon in Vegas','On her deathbed, a mother makes her son promise never to get married, which scars him with psychological blocks to a commitment with his girlfriend. They finally decide to tie the knot in Vegas, but a wealthy gambler arranges for the man to lose $65K in a poker game and offers to clear the debt for a weekend with his fiancée.','/qZPay0VF5Bq2PiUvC09WwM5blmj.jpg','1992-08-28',96,'Released','A comedy about one bride, two grooms, and 34 flying Elvises.','Honeymoon in Vegas',12518,3.7085,5.7,'MbrZBvSUMkM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11594,_binary '\0','/yUUIrkbDObGN6f77QkeDBV9Fsb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104452',6.2,28991,'en','Housesitter','Con artist Gwen moves into Newton\'s empty home without his knowledge and begins setting up house, posing as his new wife.','/A9Ojij6kEwe8LSnMieiPyPCXShx.jpg','1992-06-12',102,'Released','She\'s turning his house into a home...hers!','Housesitter',10407,6.9051,6.152,'bNCG3EI_7N0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11595,_binary '\0','/novvibtQv0B4psRxuqvd8g2qS5M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104454',7.3,39058,'en','Howards End','A saga of class relations and changing times in an Edwardian England on the brink of modernity, the film centers on liberal Margaret Schlegel, who, along with her sister Helen, becomes involved with two couples: wealthy, conservative industrialist Henry Wilcox and his wife Ruth, and the downwardly mobile working-class Leonard Bast and his mistress Jackie.','/1009nhfj28VhhQnVadtjkOacduX.jpg','1992-03-13',142,'Released','Based on the Novel by E.M. Forster','Howards End',8293,5.0085,7.001,'dNJdbu4p1Fg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11596,_binary '\0','/aH6d2U61HIM3Rt3PXElFYjZpBbE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104466',7.5,33215,'en','Husbands and Wives','When their best friends announce that they\'re separating, a professor and his wife discover the faults in their own marriage.','/mb6Hmns0PP2Me9TYpLE9M3GHt7v.jpg','1992-09-18',108,'Released','A hilarious comedy about being married, being single, sex and life in New York.','Husbands and Wives',28384,4.5991,7,'WKg1Bq7BCHI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11597,_binary '\0','/y7iCuZZ8pD3u30lSpC5LkFTf8am.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104467',7.4,1597,'wo','Hyènes','A now-rich woman returns to her poor desert hometown to propose a deal to the populace: her fortune, in exchange for the death of the man who years earlier abandoned her and left her with his child.','/or2P5W4SHTOYS40F2LifY8wm1e4.jpg','1992-09-18',110,'Released',NULL,'Hyenas',124085,1.4574,7.2,'FqO9FFwIAGA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11598,_binary '\0','/xkM4h9DAu0omqPC4pkBg7WqaDIp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104503',7.1,5058,'en','In the Soup','An aspiring young filmmaker gets involved with an eccentric gangster for the financing of his first film.','/kj7j6q8g3kptgqnpjpZlr5det2I.jpg','1992-10-23',96,'Released','A comedy about getting in over your head.','In the Soup',52936,2.1608,6.7,'beHlaDVeVyA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11599,_binary '\0','/qGvTsuftetiCaGLHUqegiGG8p47.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104504',7.5,1379,'en','Incident at Oglala','On June 26, 1975, during a period of high tensions on the Pine Ridge reservation in South Dakota, two FBI agents were killed in a shootout with a group of Indians. Although several men were charged with killing the agents, only one, Leonard Peltier, was found guilty. This film describes the events surrounding the shootout and suggests that Peltier was unjustly convicted.','/lGqaFhjQmRmBzYLVYDcnS9VZkoU.jpg','1992-05-08',89,'Released','What are the facts - And what is the truth?','Incident at Oglala',26246,1.8608,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11600,_binary '\0','/sk5YqvIl4jd7xgw7lcoUMYOLjKt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104507',7,11850,'fr','Indochine','In colonial Vietnam, dashing French naval captain Jean-Baptiste, wealthy plantation owner Éliane Devries, and her adopted Vietnamese daughter Camillevare form the three points of a cross-cultural romantic triangle. As the struggle against European imperialism sweeps Indochina, Jean-Baptiste and Camille have to choose sides and Éliane faces the emotionally difficult challenge of raising the child of her daughter and ex-lover.','/sAemRfr6mOSwtQ76e4yUQVImo8B.jpg','1992-04-15',159,'Released','A great film from a mysterious world','Indochine',2731,5.2514,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11601,_binary '\0','/8MAiMQLDfyd6YktQFk1B1bhzzz3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104511',6.2,12305,'en','Innocent Blood','Marie is a vampire with a thirst for bad guys. When she fails to properly dispose of one of her victims, a violent mob boss, she bites off more than she can chew and faces a new, immortal danger.','/bloBdkHtAHSAJWa31Gls59z0xfb.jpg','1992-09-25',112,'Released','The movie that goes straight for the jugular.','Innocent Blood',27381,5.0115,6.178,'b3eJLnMW2-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11602,_binary '\0','/jRJnq8dyWs0zlCyJmihOilQSRir.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104522',7,3434,'en','Into the West','Accused of a crime they didn\'t commit, two city kids and a magical horse are about to become the coolest outlaws ever to ride Into The West.','/k9e63dUNxu5MtXCCB3trUXtXX58.jpg','1992-10-23',97,'Released','A magical Adventure begins...','Into the West',33221,2.1653,6.4,'MmkI1_KRy98','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11603,_binary '\0','/nmXzGIkLqChoPEAWauG9LdiNw37.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104545',6.4,17115,'es','Jamón, jamón','José Luis has a cushy corporate job at the lingerie factory his mom owns. After he falls in love and proposes to Silvia, a beautiful laborer on the underwear assembly line, his mom enlists Raul, a potential underwear model and would-be bullfighter, to seduce Silvia.','/bxYSRl1vXGwaAD98aXSwZQ5hmAe.jpg','1992-09-03',94,'Released','A film where women eat men and men eat ham','Jamon Jamon',4507,5.4288,6.2,'0QD3wb0QsoA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11604,_binary '\0','/dAWlWircXrlnMjsVZSyb7vgMlIo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104549',6.3,19862,'en','Jennifer Eight','John Berlin, a big-city cop from LA moves to a small-town police force and immediately finds himself investigating a murder. Using theories rejected by his colleagues, Berlin meets a young blind woman named Helena, whom he is attracted to. Meanwhile, a serial killer is on the loose—and only John knows it.','/pMlk8spEliRD6hr4ILs5ubHeBGT.jpg','1992-11-06',124,'Released','Is anyone there?','Jennifer Eight',10424,4.8905,6.072,'T02flRwnKog','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11605,_binary '\0','/wIk9HEB5VI3N4kc1ltchhOk8IPR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104550',6.1,1842,'en','Jersey Girl','A working girl from New Jersey looks for love with a fast-lane Manhattan salesman from Queens.','/5yQ3QSyZ4jDgqmn7Stb9A4GxUb9.jpg','1992-08-01',95,'Released','A Cinderella story with big hair.','Jersey Girl',54655,2.5678,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11606,_binary '\0','/f15Xz57oZ40Omjjs2fVFzoQasyG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104553',7.2,2956,'cn','家有囍事','Three brothers living with their father fib and play pranks to win parental approval for themselves and their romances.','/i7lMtQEzbSpM9OnDvmZAYPnZDIK.jpg','1992-01-25',100,'Released',NULL,'All\'s Well, Ends Well',60145,2.5405,7.1,'t4AgDTE_YcU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11607,_binary '\0','/rNfhWdqWcguzFLWJrFXV2az4qBE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104558',7,27130,'cn','警察故事 III：超級警察','A Hong Kong detective teams up with his female Red Chinese counterpart to stop a Chinese drug czar.','/mUJOyCd4g0pNsU8thYI7UGrIpkl.jpg','1992-07-04',95,'Released','There\'s never a cop around when you need one, but when this cop\'s around, all you need is one.','Police Story 3: Super Cop',11134,8.04,6.9,'73Fc5X8Hqt8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11608,_binary '\0','/t4udEv84RinojiR8tO93pssaJUX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104561',8.1,27815,'hi','जो जीता वही सिकन्दर','Sanjay, a carefree young man, experiences mental and physical transformation to compete in an inter-collegiate bicycle race after his elder brother is unable to participate due to an injury.','/4QoNFpLuO4tpzBpFhDDS0GJIbR8.jpg','1992-05-22',174,'Released',NULL,'Jo Jeeta Wohi Sikandar',33202,2.5264,7.2,'9MeWjDECi_8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11609,_binary '\0','/fK0NyLXUxDbQyhUuK11qsBwquMH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104567',5.7,4764,'en','Johnny Suede','Johnny Suede (Brad Pitt) longs to be a teen-age idol like Ricky Nelson. He has a pair of black suede shoes, an impressive pompadour, a guitar, and some pals who will play backup for him. Yet he doesn\'t have much talent or drive.','/x1ZvgHwDUFsgqWhYUEcJcyHmZQW.jpg','1991-08-18',97,'Released','He\'s a heartbreaker... lover... loner. keeping up an image can be a full time job.','Johnny Suede',45145,2.3717,5.2,'WpdJgVKE9s0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11610,_binary '\0','/54xcERdFHlRny2FJ9NC4koForkR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104573',7,33856,'en','Juice','Four Harlem friends -- Bishop, Q, Steel and Raheem -- dabble in petty crime, but they decide to go big by knocking off a convenience store. Bishop, the magnetic leader of the group, has the gun. But Q has different aspirations. He wants to be a DJ and happens to have a gig the night of the robbery. Unfortunately for him, Bishop isn\'t willing to take no for answer in a game where everything\'s for keeps.','/hfXFPMhNjLnCugBHMN0nrtKW7Ra.jpg','1992-01-17',96,'Released','In the Ghettos of Harlem you don\'t buy respect... you earn it.','Juice',16136,4.1432,7.2,'ECi021J_j18','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11611,_binary '\0','/ogw4HLfdmSqjpZx6k0C4u5l3sFE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104575',6.4,1588,'en','Just Another Girl on the I.R.T.','Chantel Mitchell, a hip, articulate, black high-school girl in Brooklyn, is determined not to become \"just another girl on the IRT\" (the IRT is one of NYC\'s subway lines). She dreams of medical school, a family, and an escape from the generational poverty and street-corner life her friends seem to have accepted as their lot. But personal and sexual challenges confront Chantel on her way to fulfilling these dreams.','/jjBthOisXwuyUqBd1BAmIzdSf4S.jpg','1993-03-19',92,'Released','If you think you know her, think again.','Just Another Girl on the I.R.T.',124088,1.5468,6.9,'GMoOcC0vlgg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11612,_binary '\0','/m01K2o9QxHFr33H23GIJEuvNY89.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104581',5.6,3426,'sv','Jönssonligan & den svarta diamanten','Sickan, the leader of the criminal Jönsson gang is incarcerated in a mental institution, attended by Dr M.A. Busé, who admire a handbook in crime that Sickan has been writing. Blackmailed by the nefarious banker Wall-Enberg, Dr Busé and Sickan\'s partners Vanheden and Dynamite-Harry execute Sickan\'s plan of stealing the valuable Black Diamond of the Romanovs from the National Museum.','/qD54LiOT4xywx3HUKjCAw58BRhR.jpg','1992-10-30',104,'Released',NULL,'Jönssonligan & den svarta diamanten',23654,1.2859,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11613,_binary '\0','/3wHt1mT6w6OLYh9rOEpxxKkInor.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104602',7.2,2807,'de','Kein Pardon','Since childhood Peter Schlönzke dreams of a career as a TV presenter. His great role model is Heinz Wäscher, who is always looking for talented young entertainers for his popular show. Peters mother announces her shy boy for an audition, which, although mercilessly goes wrong, but brings him a job as a cable helper. He meets the popular entertainer from the unlikely side: as a bus scrapper who despises his audience. When Peter stumbles into the limelight by chance, he has a unique chance - as successor to scrubber.','/sCNEO1m302XZTvLCMWcJ9TQOKGa.jpg','1993-02-25',97,'Released',NULL,'Kein Pardon',10807,1.1152,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11614,_binary '\0','/1FZhCCwy5hkHg9CfPrmHQfJCe2D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104605',7.1,9007,'hi','Khiladi','A group of friends, who love to make bets with one another, play a prank that goes horribly wrong when one of them is murdered.','/r6HFdTBnXbVn8gXgXayNg76dKrz.jpg','1992-06-04',159,'Released','A musical thriller.','Khiladi',161436,1.6491,6.221,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11615,_binary '\0','/5FzWfd6jhcsbwD0moOI8wLOvhaG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104607',6.6,2441,'hi','ख़ुदागवाह','Baadshah Khan falls in love with Benazir, a member of a rival clan who has defeated him in a game of buzkashi. Benazir will not marry him unless he brings back the head of her father\'s killer, Habibullah, from India. He is successful, but he must return to India. He is then tragically separated from Benazir through a series of incidents that are only resolved years later with the arrival of his daughter, Menhdi, and his release from prison.','/uUvUFpWfGXlgOzXgkIYwqpchh0f.jpg','1992-05-08',193,'Released',NULL,'Khuda Gawah',51725,1.3452,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11616,_binary '\0','/h0jlJEWoXEgMic7JNSaddGQRG6r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104609',4.3,3880,'en','Kickboxer 3: The Art of War','Kick-box champion David Sloan arrives in Rio de Janeiro for an exhibition fight. He and mentor Xian take pity on Brazilian rascal Marcos Coasta, an urchin who offers guide services but routinely steals from tourists for himself and his older sister Isabella. David is shocked when he sees how his Argentinian opponent Marcelo needlessly abuses a courteous local sparing partner. That\'s the doing of his evil US manager, Lane. He has nasty plans to force David to cheat and runs a white slavery racket.','/eGVPTY8ifyogwFZu3WJ4MLLJgdE.jpg','1992-06-11',92,'Released','In The World\'s Deadliest Contest, There Can Only Be One Winner... And Only One Survivor!','Kickboxer 3: The Art of War',39027,3.9316,5.051,'CQxEOxJvirE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11617,_binary '\0','/yB2rCIgYAblGr24um29IHI29eXg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104612',6.7,1339,'en','A Killer Among Friends','A teenage girl disappears and later turns up drowned, with a log across her back. Three years later, a former friend comes forward with some answers.','/prgjxNqjM9079DgIE4RWaY3tgYT.jpg','1992-12-08',96,'Released',NULL,'A Killer Among Friends',70104,2.5139,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11618,_binary '\0','/4QtzjI9HgClGT0EQwaD4whhvnuk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104627',6.1,9985,'en','Knight Moves','A chess grandmaster is in a big tournament, and when his lover is found painted up and the blood drained out of her body he becomes a chief suspect. After he gets a call from the killer urging him to try and figure out the game, he cooperates with police and a psychologist to try and catch the killer, but doubts linger about the grandmaster\'s innocence as the string of grisly murders continues.','/6TbMfJueFlfwdn8pURQdcugjUFC.jpg','1992-01-14',116,'Released','In a game of life and death... one wrong move could be his last...','Knight Moves',5765,3.3556,5.764,'ys1_XKoUydY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11619,_binary '\0','/jXySMFq48i4VXY4Jb7zjj78GfXz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104647',5.9,12264,'en','Kuffs','George Kuffs didn\'t finish high-school, just lost his job, and his college-age girlfriend is pregnant. To top it off, George\'s brother Brad is killed and George inherits Brad\'s \"patrol special\" privatized police district and all the problems that come with it.','/mF0eKbtnPxMVTPiLeKquUziMW06.jpg','1992-01-10',102,'Released','When you have attitude, who needs experience?','Kuffs',14603,2.3281,5.8,'ndT1r0Kw7Nw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11620,_binary '\0','/ec4m0EvVlEtVl5aySdw6ab9uG0b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104652',7.7,118707,'ja','紅の豚','In Italy in the 1930s, sky pirates in biplanes terrorize wealthy cruise ships as they sail the Adriatic Sea. The only pilot brave enough to stop the scourge is the mysterious Porco Rosso, a former World War I flying ace who was somehow turned into a pig during the war. As he prepares to battle the pirate crew\'s American ace, Porco Rosso enlists the help of spunky girl mechanic Fio Piccolo and his longtime friend Madame Gina.','/8mIvSvnVBApfORL9N6S38Q7wD6A.jpg','1992-07-18',93,'Released','Can a pig really fly?','Porco Rosso',11621,9.3497,7.794,'3LRyNwYg1f8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11621,_binary '\0','/gwEuuqPM6ocJCazGb2Tt1wTVe5E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104658',7.2,2359,'fr','L.627','In Paris, Lulu, a passionate policeman, works with the faith of a rookie, despite the sclerotic bureaucracy and the incompetence or negligence of some of his colleagues. In his new position as a narcotics inspector, he tries to keep his sanity as he witnesses the worst of the human condition.','/wZDV2rdnx9M2FfQAa4rX5SIHajs.jpg','1992-09-09',141,'Released',NULL,'L.627',39967,1.5943,7.1,'KMd6RpVKDAM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11622,_binary '\0','/sDvFQzJyuN0ff1I5jB8INflsbHK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104662',7.3,4399,'es','El lado oscuro del corazón','Oliveiro is a young poet living in Buenos Aires where sometimes he has to sell his ideas to an advertising agency to make a living or exchange his poems for a steak. In Montevideo, he meets a prostitute, Ana, with whom he falls in love. Back in Buenos Aires, he accepts a contract with a publicity agency to get the money for three days of love with her. Will he get what he\'s searching for when his ideal of love\'s pleasure is literally going in levitation while making love?','/7sGolviXy0GUJ5OzDuxcv61k2UX.jpg','1992-05-21',127,'Released',NULL,'The Dark Side of the Heart',74938,3.0178,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11623,_binary '\0','/vX69GeZwAQQhDg8tCFZkZTIBBeV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104663',7.6,3135,'it','Il ladro di bambini','Antonio, a policeman (carabiniere), has an order to take two children (Rosetta and her brother Luciano) from Milan to Sicily to an orphanage. Their mother has been arrested for forcing Rosetta (11 years old) to work as a prostitute. First the relation between Antonio and the children is tough, but it relaxes so they become temporary friends.','/fkFYNR4iCz5n1j5Drf0jejKmNVb.jpg','1992-04-10',116,'Released',NULL,'The Stolen Children',47714,2.0317,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11624,_binary '\0','/awY6dPWIrtR919DZCITOmvq3dSU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104670',5.6,11453,'en','Ladybugs','To climb the corporate ladder to success, a businessman agrees to coach his company\'s all-girl soccer team with the help of his secret weapon: his fiancee\'s son.','/gC0DmdJu7rHaqYjyXeo8GLLJ2Oa.jpg','1992-03-27',90,'Released','He\'s Coach...not first class.','Ladybugs',19087,3.1385,5.643,'eCAAWi_ZLZo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11625,_binary '\0','/bL3rgYFs0NTAoLBMpCBIJ7aX6hp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104684',7.7,60736,'cn','辣手神探','A cop who loses his partner in a shoot-out with gun smugglers goes on a mission to catch them. In order to get closer to the leaders of the ring he joins forces with an undercover cop who\'s working as a gangster hitman. They use all means of excessive force to find them.','/oMqr4CGGqVlfI8DdrSelK1e9aFM.jpg','1992-04-16',126,'Released','As a cop, he has brains, brawn, and an instinct to kill.','Hard Boiled',11782,7.915,7.517,'J_HPNU5oJMI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11626,_binary '\0','/mhpDSuNyHPMsccI7zISEaskTgOQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104691',7.6,209770,'en','The Last of the Mohicans','In war-torn colonial America, in the midst of a bloody battle between British, the French and Native American allies, the aristocratic daughter of a British Colonel and her party are captured by a group of Huron warriors. Fortunately, a group of three Mohican trappers comes to their rescue.','/qzJMPWRtZveBkxXOv3ucWhoJuyj.jpg','1992-08-26',112,'Released','An epic adventure and passionate romance unfold against the panorama of a frontier wilderness ravaged by war.','The Last of the Mohicans',9361,11.8881,7.384,'c9TED2yeoRo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11627,_binary '\0','/tRs8Kg3BhjFVMwdIX4zxN7r7Ydu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104692',5.5,42692,'en','The Lawnmower Man','A simple man is turned into a genius through the application of computer science.','/1VLqWcel87oYVmN383FgSH0mCTY.jpg','1992-03-05',108,'Released','God made him simple. Science made him a god.','The Lawnmower Man',10163,6.3015,5.6,'zzwPuJklv4w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11628,_binary '\0','/7I0CXY3hhwsix5esdwMNrhew62I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104693',6.6,1403,'en','Laws of Gravity','The lives of two incompetent young men from Brooklyn spin out of control after a friend returns from Florida with guns to sell.','/zFN3C7flx1xj3dxGEAsSK7Uz7bB.jpg','1992-08-26',100,'Released','Sooner or later, everything goes down.','Laws of Gravity',1482,1.791,6.9,'uaB0NGj5MDM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11629,_binary '\0','/kb2FuXGruaPA6ErjOpcifpCyPyY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104694',7.4,132501,'en','A League of Their Own','As America\'s stock of athletic young men is depleted during World War II, a professional all-female baseball league springs up in the Midwest, funded by publicity-hungry candy maker Walter Harvey. Competitive sisters Dottie Hinson and Kit Keller spar with each other, scout Ernie Capadino and grumpy has-been coach Jimmy Dugan on their way to fame.','/f9BtX6wYOwJUyfUr4vyeT3COz6m.jpg','1992-07-01',128,'Released','Once in a lifetime you get a chance to do something different.','A League of Their Own',11287,10.2833,7.211,'0A-O1MJAl9E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11630,_binary '\0','/dn0FKCIJB0J5TI0yvE62uGOd75z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104695',6.2,15905,'en','Leap of Faith','Jonas Nightengale is a fraudulent Christian faith healer who makes a living travelling around America holding revival meetings and conducting \'miracles\' with the help of his friend and manager, Jane, and their entourage.','/iqIKuwQYdvoKKGFjjEPdXlUKYvk.jpg','1992-12-18',108,'Released','Real miracles, sensibly priced.','Leap of Faith',12772,3.8157,5.8,'rP6VDQ2J3QM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11631,_binary '\0','/7rO1gTp9voTQIEBzqy8RrZAJjG6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104697',6.6,1720,'en','Leaving Normal','Darly, a waitress with a past that\'s weighing her down, decides to drive to Alaska to try and come to terms with her unfortunate history. Along the way, she meets Marianne, an impulsive young woman leaving an abusive relationship. The two hit the road together and keep driving north, bonding over the hardships that they have endured and meeting a number of eccentric characters as they get closer to their destination.','/zZWTFb1eT9CL8GePAilkRyB8Zut.jpg','1992-04-29',110,'Released','Sometimes the only way to find where you\'re going is to lose your way','Leaving Normal',54715,1.8335,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11632,_binary '\0','/4g5IcgWKESnkWfLJYyOYTjD3SsJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104706',7.9,8529,'de','Lektionen in Finsternis','Shortly after the Gulf War, oil fires were raging all through Kuwait. In the week before this sea of fire would be extinguished, Werner Herzog filmed this apocalyptic landscape with its murky skies, scorched earth and capricious flames.','/rSQaIbOQj6SUSOxr3BEiAmCoj1P.jpg','1992-02-21',54,'Released',NULL,'Lessons of Darkness',53200,1.8078,7.8,'EPwmsbbcG6Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11633,_binary '\0','/kmt9XmhmX36sJduuDVFlTgEWh9U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104714',6.7,190118,'en','Lethal Weapon 3','Riggs and Murtaugh pursue a former officer who uses his knowledge of police procedure and policies to steal and sell confiscated guns and ammunition to local street gangs.','/8FnOudDHPOY7MFJnvQMR1qpuyek.jpg','1992-05-15',118,'Released','The magic is back again!','Lethal Weapon 3',943,14.0195,6.728,'340a5ZjyEa8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11634,_binary '\0','/8hwjzxg1XgLTWK3LENj7RVyGBkb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104740',7.1,8964,'ja','NEMO/ニモ','A little boy whose dreams transcend reality is sucked into his own fantasy, which is everything he has dreamed of, until he unleashes an old secret that may not only destroy this perfect dream world but reality itself.','/uVyqRtRaIGrHJvfxImrHHFaQNxM.jpg','1989-07-15',95,'Released','Take off on a wonderful adventure with \"Little Nemo.\"','Little Nemo: Adventures in Slumberland',22611,5.111,6.9,'99VKtcydHUU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11635,_binary '\0','/5kFSjZNYSng3YrXgencT6iINItv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104743',5.6,4357,'en','Live Wire','Danny O\'Neill is a bomb disposal expert assigned to a case where terrorists have developed an \"invisible\" liquid explosive which is activated within the human body.','/xQbj9KgXqw9yjZfDO99jFyw1pzg.jpg','1992-09-03',85,'Released','Your body is 93% water... no one is safe.','Live Wire',12629,2.7886,5.242,'L0E-HlVskU8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11636,_binary '\0','/5x7oNRmIyYiTcmaXfHUBajZf2jy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104745',6.6,4772,'en','The Living End','Two HIV-positive young men — a semi-employed film critic and a hot hustler — tear off on a cross-country crime spree.','/4tqdQcKkZGn4qQy9bWWu1fEM6z2.jpg','1992-08-21',85,'Released','An irresponsible movie by Gregg Araki.','The Living End',33247,3.4411,6.7,'7mvDLTMUtQQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11637,_binary '\0','/vz5tQrBKspCuOQjbh2yi0ch2b0J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104753',7.3,4545,'en','The Long Day Closes','Bud is a lonely and quiet boy whose moments of solace occur when he sits in rapture at the local cinema, watching towering and iconic figures on the movie screen. The movies give Bud the strength to get through another day as he deals with his oppressive school environment and his burgeoning homosexuality.','/4cbgr67H4qV2RHqeFqlf4hMIl1Y.jpg','1992-05-22',85,'Released','A magical story about a boy’s love affair with the music and movies of the 50s.','The Long Day Closes',49956,2.3884,7.2,'6Gd9IVdLX3Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11638,_binary '\0','/gYapxyWZXFYcCHtf5dVB2Ub9RTy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104756',7.3,25684,'en','Lorenzo\'s Oil','Lorenzo Odone, a Virginia 5-year-old, develops a degenerative nerve disease so rare that nobody is working on a cure, so his parents decide to immerse themselves in research and tackle the problem themselves.','/suRf59zRu1h8Zq4Gxekn6UiLGaM.jpg','1992-12-30',135,'Released','Some people make their own miracles.','Lorenzo\'s Oil',2007,3.7602,7.1,'_HTvfNUmltA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11639,_binary '\0','/JrQJCQnE5DEowyK88AS6VdEKVd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104759',5.4,1492,'en','The Lost World','Unfazed by ridicule from fellow scientists, professor Challenger (John Rhys-Davies) leads an expedition to investigate rumored sightings of prehistoric life still thriving in the unexplored African jungle. He\'s joined by a thrill-seeking journalist, his archrival and a beautiful adventurer on a perilous trek through mysterious and uncharted territory, filled with danger and deception. David Warner, Eric McCormack and Tamara Gorski co-star.','/jJQovqiutwWadYa7r42iyMT3l9U.jpg','1992-01-01',99,'Released',NULL,'The Lost World',2983,1.4435,5.2,'rQkwdfChuq8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11640,_binary '\0','/nuqAjJveGqlLhlr1YrVbURxtlME.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104761',5.9,1791,'sv','Lotta på Bråkmakargatan','Lotta is a five old girl living in Sweden with her mother, father, brother and sister. She is living the very normal life of all children of her age...','/jbUYWbZllF7nWwX2fToAkVVMETb.jpg','1992-09-26',74,'Released',NULL,'Lotta on Rascal Street',27600,1.584,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11641,_binary '\0','/m2l2vf7F5wG2yQZkZA7050jj06G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104765',6.5,5034,'en','Love Field','Dallas housewife Lurene Hallett\'s life revolves around the doings of Jacqueline Kennedy. She is devastated when President Kennedy is shot a few hours after she sees him arrive in Dallas. Despite her husband Ray\'s prohibition, she decides to attend the funeral in Washington, D.C. Forced to travel by bus, she befriends Jonell, the young black daughter of Paul Couter. Sensing something wrong, her good intentioned interference leads the mixed race threesome on an increasingly difficult journey to Washington with both the police and Ray looking for them.','/u0qV3fFXWM6yGMlaqz3EWNSodB4.jpg','1992-12-11',102,'Released','Her life began when her world fell apart.','Love Field',66599,4.0588,6.1,'knp4x9ve0W8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11642,_binary '\0','/2g1H6L0LDWnQjkhhidwFLYVEwyO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104770',7.1,4700,'cn','鹿鼎記','The story of Wai Siu Bo, a pimp who after saving Chan Kan Nam, the leader of the Heaven and Earth society, a revolutionary group, is made a member. After a botched first assignment for the group, he is made a servant to the Prince, the very person the Heaven and Earth society want to overthrow. What follows is plenty of mayhem and laughter.','/tJeafyenaenHTiMVKRPBAISQ3qH.jpg','1992-07-30',106,'Released',NULL,'Royal Tramp',51730,2.9959,7.115,'Bi30jfHeLF8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11643,_binary '\0','/uiTFVCL19OLaPAgrbX9zTvYK5bb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104771',7,3420,'cn','鹿鼎記 II : 神龍敎','After discovering that the Empress is actually Lung Erh, a member of the St Dragon Sect, and that she imprisoned the real empress. Lung Erh, is bent on eliminating the person who disclosed her true identity, Wai Siu Bo. But more complications ensues when Lung Erh is assigned to protect the Prince, whose servant is none other than Wai Siu Bo.','/nc3I27aQucb5IGn8VXWKN5gygqc.jpg','1992-09-24',93,'Released',NULL,'Royal Tramp 2',51731,3.075,7.1,'XQk93O5tXtQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11644,_binary '\0','/zXKKvPstrabP07BXNAUgXKZGetB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104774',7.7,3072,'es','Un lugar en el mundo','Mario and Ana, in voluntary exile from Buenos Aires, live in a remote Argentine valley with their 12-year-old son Ernesto. Mario runs a school and a wool cooperative; Ana, a doctor, heads a clinic with Nelda, a progressive nun. Into this idealistic family comes Hans, a jaded Spanish geological engineer -- surveying the land for the local patron, to see if it can be dammed for hydro-electric power, which would drive the peasants from the land into the cities.','/fm7OklHHGq8wYHWSZsVwtfv8CLx.jpg','1992-04-09',121,'Released',NULL,'A Place in the World',32635,1.903,7.5,'DRLNojIUq04','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11645,_binary '\0','/9NwkPVcLBKMrPKU79XinX73HZNa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104779',7.2,46830,'en','Bitter Moon','A passenger on a cruise ship develops an irresistible infatuation with an eccentric paraplegic\'s wife.','/bW7E4cLWh0elRRbp2VCrtXrY1if.jpg','1992-09-02',139,'Released','A kinky voyage with a full head of steam.','Bitter Moon',10497,7.158,7.1,'R3EMSHqkbfI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11646,_binary '\0','/7v4l2FnrpreaV19gY4xYiuPDPL2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104782',7.3,7741,'fr','Léolo','The story of an imaginative boy who pretends he is the child of a sperm-laden Sicilian tomato upon which his mother accidentally fell.','/1HDTXmngKg6NHKGVnKADpxGPye5.jpg','1992-09-16',107,'Released','Growing Up Can Be Painfully Funny.','Léolo',11139,1.9402,7.187,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11647,_binary '\0','/yj9VAqzlA0kasae8rK1VG3NvDZk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104797',7.7,112500,'en','Malcolm X','A tribute to the controversial black activist and leader of the struggle for black liberation. He hit bottom during his imprisonment in the \'50s, he became a Black Muslim and then a leader in the Nation of Islam. His assassination in 1965 left a legacy of self-determination and racial pride.','/o2s9ow0uRRm1BcF3teznk5twd90.jpg','1992-11-18',202,'Released','Scholar, convict, leader, disciple, hipster, father, hustler, minister, black man, every man.','Malcolm X',1883,7.551,7.551,'0hMpERkER6s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11648,_binary '\0','/dP26FZ6cFpQwRpsKkd2m8uLNPql.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104798',6.8,1968,'it','Maledetto il giorno che t\'ho incontrato','Bernardo is dumped by his girlfriend, his career as a rock music critic is beginning to decline and stars to see a psychologist but in the meantime he meets the problematic and shy Camilla, who disrupts his life.','/l9AGWeX90hlxl7GykkGKjlmUCYw.jpg','1992-01-31',110,'Released',NULL,'Maledetto il giorno che t\'ho incontrato',56551,1.3017,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11649,_binary '\0','/fpnGP9d0LEpoVWO0rcgFjmcKLQz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104802',6.4,6401,'en','The Mambo Kings','The Mambo Kings tells the story of César and Nestor Castillo, brothers and aspiring musicians who flee from Cuba to America in search of the American Dream.','/yAMYoODA6FzHPwycrBwwrjKv1A4.jpg','1992-02-28',104,'Released','With a suitcase full of song, Hearts filled with passion, two brothers come to America in search of a dream.','The Mambo Kings',40082,2.7863,6.4,'IwR0bMQp3tA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11650,_binary '\0','/vntBEkhsJchhnhBYs5pOUlDUgoj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104804',4.7,3716,'en','Man Trouble','A sleazy but affable guard dog trainer is blackmailed to steal a manuscript for a tell-all book from one of his clients.','/3hpxleh58Ln1jLcF9hczRTWxtP9.jpg','1992-07-17',100,'Released','He Plans To Steal...More Than Her Heart.','Man Trouble',39472,3.1564,4.9,'t1ho3wmu8Hk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11651,_binary '\0','/1dakZzxCyzIh24uvQiQMOsz1orJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104808',5,5921,'en','Maniac Cop 3: Badge of Silence','A priest practicing the Voodoo arts resurrects Matt Cordell, who takes his badge and returns from the dead...again...to do his bidding.','/xgFbKENMAYShyUIRXqwnJ2X6yHP.jpg','1992-12-10',85,'Released','The wrong arm of the law is back!','Maniac Cop 3: Badge of Silence',50687,3.4861,5.3,'SPbIQqSAZRM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11652,_binary '\0','/gwflTQYqpUqogAel7rGfoICQCiw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104810',8.1,5050,'en','Manufacturing Consent: Noam Chomsky and the Media','A film about the noted American linguist/political dissident and his warning about corporate media\'s role in modern propaganda.','/2Izpz5pgB5ScVrXkIxK4TXDxZLn.jpg','1992-11-06',167,'Released','A Primer In Intellectual Self-Defense','Manufacturing Consent: Noam Chomsky and the Media',36947,1.9094,7.6,'7LVsiP0s33A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11653,_binary '\0','/AblWtgIpxWkw4eIFzN0A3Gdrl14.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104812',7,3599,'en','Map of the Human Heart','In an Arctic village in 1931, British mapmaker Walter Russell selects 12-year-old Eskimo Avik as his guide. When the boy contracts tuberculosis, Walter flies him to a Montreal hospital, where Avik meets Albertine and is infatuated. A decade later, a grown Avik encounters Albertine again in London, where he\'s serving as a British combat pilot. Despite her relationship with Walter, she and Avik begin an affair.','/ritKJM436bbvFhXlWKbwKzjs8SM.jpg','1993-04-22',109,'Released','Born in the magic of youth. Forged by the passions of war. Their love knew no boundaries.','Map of the Human Heart',36709,2.266,6.2,'ttoIFUJjo0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11654,_binary '\0','/zERY2aaCrLExpR6NQ1ceIs0WG8S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104815',6.8,75398,'es','El Mariachi','El Mariachi just wants to play his guitar and carry on the family tradition. Unfortunately, the town he tries to find work in has another visitor, a killer who carries his guns in a guitar case. The drug lord and his henchmen mistake el Mariachi for the killer, Azul, and chase him around town trying to kill him and get his guitar case.','/zRh7K4SV1xQ419m8gzGITak51vc.jpg','1993-02-22',81,'Released','With a guitar in his hand and a price on his head, he wasn\'t looking for trouble. But trouble came looking for him.','El Mariachi',9367,4.5015,6.7,'QtNJsvpHye0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11655,_binary '\0','/jsnzeDldCBScvH8ocuXG4ZK0Szn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104839',6,26425,'en','Medicine Man','An eccentric scientist in the Amazon jungle rejects his research assistant for being a woman, but as bulldozers threaten their work on a potential cancer cure, they learn to collaborate and begin to fall in love.','/lkHqtViTG4Zzh7i9rrtHJGTnEUg.jpg','1992-02-07',106,'Released','He turned his back on civilization. Only to discover he had the power to save it.','Medicine Man',9096,4.6134,6,'ZQs9NrHc7qo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11656,_binary '\0','/qY1YMdPcPOLVlxEdCdVzHmwMacl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104850',6,29866,'en','Memoirs of an Invisible Man','After a freak accident, an invisible yuppie runs for his life from a treacherous CIA official while trying to cope with his new life.','/zSy5SyhacsgqRfuJToU6jXFZ1DD.jpg','1992-02-28',99,'Released','Women want him for his wit. The C.I.A. wants him for his body. All Nick wants is his molecules back.','Memoirs of an Invisible Man',2687,5.1113,5.9,'U4qLE7gRmfI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11657,_binary '\0','/obiOpLG9lnBeie3l7DTaa7t0uBc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104860',8.3,10305,'sr','Ми нисмо анђели','Angel and the devil fight for the soul of a Belgrade playboy who made a young girl pregnant.','/ptm7a3VNssm99wKbcx3vuo8oKZf.jpg','1992-05-30',98,'Released',NULL,'We Are Not Angels',33604,1.8091,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11658,_binary '\0','/5Im6DRMxV9tnrPL5B9OCVP32AkO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104868',6.6,77603,'en','The Mighty Ducks','After reckless young lawyer Gordon Bombay gets arrested for drunk driving, he must coach a kids hockey team for his community service. Gordon has experience on the ice, but isn\'t eager to return to hockey, a point hit home by his tense dealings with his own former coach, Jack Reilly. The reluctant Gordon eventually grows to appreciate his team, which includes promising young Charlie Conway, and leads them to take on Reilly\'s tough players.','/zxaCHxKDFNi6frh1Q0dj19L216o.jpg','1992-10-02',101,'Released','They can\'t skate. They can\'t win. They can\'t be serious.','The Mighty Ducks',10414,5.7392,6.609,'Um_JU7HpSYQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11659,_binary '\0','/3i0Q0RUlDqbRNJx5HPOAGcFSkQp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104870',5.7,3867,'en','Mikey','Mikey just needs a good stable home. He\'s bounced from foster home to foster home his whole life. He finally lands himself with a new loving family, but their perfect little child is not what he appears to be. His previous caretakers all died of mysterious \"accidents\" that weren\'t really accidents at all. Mikey is a cold blooded killer, and it doesn\'t take long for him to aim his sights on his new adoptive family and anyone else who stands in his way.','/5LRKZKU6DcC4d82ndUonCUtsyrV.jpg','1992-11-12',90,'Released','Remember Jason and Freddy were kids once too.','Mikey',87321,3.3325,5.8,'oFig5VcPbzQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11660,_binary '\0','/tQmn9jxHZG0b6S6tdZ92vJHofuJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104874',7.4,1335,'ja','ミンボーの女','An upscale Japanese hotel hires Mahiru Inoue, a lawyer adept at dealing with the Yakuza, to help them rid their hotel of the local gangsters so they can get a contract for a meeting of important foreign officials.','/5EJURClk0HuKGHAGrt7VcIVZOVG.jpg','1992-05-16',124,'Released','The gangster comedy that shook up the Japanese mob.','Minbo, or The Gentle Art of Japanese Extortion',110283,1.7875,7,'jTDPCUIzca4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11661,_binary '\0','/uWPEUiNRxJozLUzcMmcQh3OtSAx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104879',5.5,2361,'en','Miracle Beach','Down on his luck, Scotty McKay becomes the master of a very lonely genie, who brings him wealth, power and true love. Miracles can happen!','/p1HFnge9U5Ucrv46McRI928gL3l.jpg','1992-09-15',88,'Released','It will really raise your spirits.','Miracle Beach',55694,2.0885,5.7,'TnOiOa8QEO4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11662,_binary '\0','/8GWdj2JTmUmHuuUXp30WyEmo5hJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104882',7.5,2336,'en','Miss Marple: The Mirror Crack\'d from Side to Side','A town busybody is poisoned at a busy reception in the home of famous film star Marina Gregg. The poisoned drink seemed intended for Marina, but Miss Marple is not so sure. She sets out to discover the true identity of the killer before he or she can strike again.','/jmxqf5dDkTEq0YtRsY5Ti55352h.jpg','1992-12-27',106,'Released',NULL,'Miss Marple: The Mirror Crack\'d from Side to Side',417161,2.8638,7.4,'7nl5KwSfJjM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11663,_binary '\0','/olzgaTu8HuNyMCaxGnL0RfNmMNe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104892',5.4,2584,'en','Mistress','A comedy about a screenwriter (Wuhl) whose old movie script is read by a producer (Landau) and the search for financial backers begins. But it seems that each money source (Aiello, DeNiro, Wallach) has his own mistress that he wants put into the film. Gradually, the screenwriter is forced to make changes to his script to accommodate these backers until he finally sees no semblance of his original ideas in the writing.','/kNo9Tj7EPOkRyEJZu98RjAbQPrb.jpg','1992-07-24',110,'Released','The Director Had A Vision. The Producers All Had Girlfriends.','Mistress',71825,2.37,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11664,_binary '\0','/5ra8ddenBkIGKfk2nB9IfvsVxvT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104897',5.6,8932,'en','Mo\' Money','Trying to get his act together, a con artist gets a job in a credit card company. He falls in love with a fellow employee, he steals a couple of cards, everything is going great. But soon, the chief of security drags him into the big leagues of criminals...','/tLbKMopp46m5i3hukmFkQdCzfDR.jpg','1992-07-24',97,'Released','Some of the best things in life are free. But if you want it all...just say mo\'.','Mo\' Money',12251,2.8419,5.6,'WNOOafALs_w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11665,_binary '\0','/lrnezFF62XoPw1UQRAm1Sfll1gB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104905',5.4,5666,'en','Mom and Dad Save the World','Emperor Spengo sees Marge Nelson and using a giant magnet, kidnaps her and her husband Dick, hoping to make Marge his before blowing up the Earth. The Emperor and other inhabitants of his planet are somewhat less than bright, and Dick begins reliving episodes of Flash Gordon and Buck Rogers in order to rescue Marge, save the Earth, and restore the rightful emperor to the throne.','/grRXYyHbkp5ckh1zyQztgXbRIJX.jpg','1992-07-24',88,'Released','Boldly going where no parents have gone before.','Mom and Dad Save the World',27295,2.4414,4.9,'c4DLVTazJRs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11666,_binary '\0','/5LYA0a6ZLXhR4HLXsvFEXrc3Eg4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104919',7.4,1403,'fa','مسافران','A wedding day becomes a ritual of mourning when the bride\'s family die in an auto accident. Refusing to accept her daughter\'s death, and in the midst of guests and mourners, including the drivers that caused the accident, the mother orders the wedding to move forward. But how can the bride marry in the midst of a wake and without the family\'s traditional mirror, which the sister was bringing to the service?','/dNQ0jZVIPajP6mnTMPCsiFZ8BQ1.jpg','1992-02-01',90,'Released',NULL,'Travelers',263207,0.8123,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11667,_binary '\0','/bpjXnHzkbXbb09XsRNpufEr3TVw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104922',6.3,2416,'en','Motorama','A ten year old boy gets tired of life with abusive parents and cashes in his piggy bank and steals a Mustang. He rides off into a surreal America playing \"Motorama,\" a game sponsored by Chimera Gas Company. He has various encounters with different people, and eventually reaches the Chimera Gas Company where he finds they are not playing by the rules of the game.','/158yiojjP5YxoCkTLcznXeccxUV.jpg','1991-09-10',90,'Released','There\'s only one way to win the girl of your dreams: floor it!','Motorama',49410,1.5267,6.6,'-RBBlbD4ze4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11668,_binary '\0','/tMdkN0b81Dob3JnIuEQa08tdmx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104926',6.1,12990,'en','Mr. Baseball','Jack Elliot, a one-time MVP for the New York Yankees is now on the down side of his baseball career. With a falling batting average, does he have one good year left and can the manager of the Chunichi Dragons, a Japanese Central baseball league find it in him?','/6J56wP2ZKJcyfQ1sa4Dm3jSbXzo.jpg','1992-10-01',108,'Released','He\'s the biggest thing to hit Japan since Godzilla!','Mr. Baseball',18722,3.0589,5.9,'jywTtvKbTO0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11669,_binary '\0','/9X7rxTdzk8NYeqDRZLRTB35ffDo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104928',5.9,5471,'en','Mr. Saturday Night','Buddy Young was the comic\'s comic, beloved by everyone. Now, playing to miniscule crowds in nursing homes, it seems like everybody but Buddy realizes that he should retire. As Buddy looks for work in show business, he realizes that the rest of the world has forgotten the golden days of Buddy Young, and that there just may not be room in the business for an old comic like himself.','/tDAJzffAZyhpEsRiRCH3J9abTbZ.jpg','1992-09-23',119,'Released','It\'s lonely at the middle.','Mr. Saturday Night',54087,2.6945,5.911,'0FeTjAyjAW4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11670,_binary '\0','/e1bszYUg2dJ9GVUc8xoHfSP7nKG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104938',3.5,1398,'en','Munchie','No friends. The new school sucks. And Mom is in love with a sleazy research doctor. Pretty bleak. That’s how life looks to ten-year-old Gage when suddenly, into his world pops the magical Munchie. Munchie is the ever-hungry and hilarious mysterious creature from another world who delivers flying pizzas and brings on the parties! With the help of Munchie and loony Professor Cruikshank, Gage evens the score on his school’s bullies as well as his mom’s boyfriend and has the greatest summer ever!','/5B0JIheq8jpXjuZfzirgqzhIb5T.jpg','1992-05-15',80,'Released','Magical. Mystical. Munchie!','Munchie',116158,1.5954,4.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11671,_binary '\0','/kLVWvnUdqQ07WjbAYGpmiD2ZFQa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104940',7.8,82730,'en','The Muppet Christmas Carol','A retelling of the classic Dickens tale of Ebenezer Scrooge, miser extraordinaire. He is held accountable for his dastardly ways during nighttime visitations by the Ghosts of Christmas Past, Present and Future.','/ssrV29QSVVJuemBHho0Qx7pFYak.jpg','1992-12-11',86,'Released',NULL,'The Muppet Christmas Carol',10437,5.5481,7.5,'JXaVI60BFJM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11672,_binary '\0','/uEoaOfvWibpvjBNxFoj4MxWn0OH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104952',7.6,161715,'en','My Cousin Vinny','Two carefree pals traveling through rural Alabama on their way back to college are mistakenly arrested and charged with murder. Fortunately, one of them has a cousin who\'s a lawyer - Vincent Gambini, a former auto mechanic from Brooklyn who has just passed his bar exam after his sixth try. When he arrives with his leather-clad girlfriend to try his first case, it\'s a real shock - for him and the Deep South!','/iwSURa8nS2ujwrU3s1lfxxX7voH.jpg','1992-03-13',119,'Released','There have been many courtroom dramas that have glorified the Great American Legal System. This is not one of them.','My Cousin Vinny',10377,8.8353,7.5,'hITJLnyH9Fc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11673,_binary '\0','/2Ck7nNq4ZtiMAsxe721vB2sY5HY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104962',6,2253,'ru','На Дерибасовской хорошая погода, или На Брайтон Бич опять идут дожди','When mysterious Russian bandit named Artist came in USA, brave Russian special agent Fyodor Sokolov runs to States for defeat evil master.','/jj490LF9fyLrOHMJELIIJArw2xj.jpg','1993-04-01',91,'Released',NULL,'There\'s Good Weather in Deribasovskaya, Or It\'s Raining Again in Brighton Beach',57776,1.0671,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11674,_binary '\0','/kIeVUQjXH8Q8uR8Rmiu7OkVCH3l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104974',7.3,1335,'fa','ناصرالدین شاه، آکتور سینما','The film follows a character known as The Cinematographer, who is looking for someone called Atieh (Future). As he calls out to her, he is magically transported back in time from the early twentieth century to the reign of Naser al-Din Shah in 19th century Iran. Captured by the Shah\'s guards, he shows films from the history of Iranian cinema to the Shah. The Shah is entranced and eagerly shows his family the apparently magical medium.','/k62Bhq1SBag8NTCUQ2tiub9OOl3.jpg','1992-02-01',92,'Released',NULL,'Once Upon a Time, Cinema',43977,0.8453,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11675,_binary '\0','/nnbmO6FKHZdFjxBWnMvjGWWFdFX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104981',5.3,1485,'en','Neon City','In a not-too-distant future, a group of people try to escape to a safe haven called Neon City after a solar disaster has decimated the Earth.','/uUw0HFlPStvtU8K6FtGDhj1vpCI.jpg','1991-12-16',99,'Released','Take a deep breath, it may be your last. Welcome to the year 2053.','Neon City',77195,1.8612,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11676,_binary '\0','/ze5ystmhOxvLKwjrc301UFgXIP4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104987',4.3,1505,'en','Netherworld','A young man arrives at his father\'s mansion in Louisiana to discover that a secretive cult is using winged creatures to raise the dead to do their bidding.','/hIGKGn5tA6yPZu5CR6nRXpljsUG.jpg','1992-02-06',87,'Released','There is a place between heaven and hell.','Netherworld',40115,2.1396,3.8,'II7HJXVMxIU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11677,_binary '\0','/eRR2a0tOaP6UITtQ8S3ofh8n7lX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0104990',6.9,24600,'en','Newsies','A week in the life of the exploited, child newspaper sellers in turn-of-the-century New York. When their publisher, Joseph Pulitzer, tries to squeeze a little more profit out of their labours, they organize a strike, only to be confronted with the Pulitzer\'s hard-ball tactics.','/8ykmCMHzkRSuJucPYeqGA2ampbp.jpg','1992-04-10',121,'Released','A Thousand Voices. A Single Dream.','Newsies',15300,4.337,6.7,'B6GQso7TAXY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11678,_binary '\0','/8xzT2QUSaAzSCXEgSVj44M4xwHZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105001',5.8,5566,'en','Night and the City','Looking to get rich quick, an unsuccessful lawyer uses dishonest means to try to become a boxing promoter.','/tyImRcDzTdwIhRReKla6CFpXnPX.jpg','1992-10-16',105,'Released','When you\'re down to your last dream, you either live it or lose it.','Night and the City',36288,3.6917,5.7,'d1NmpF0M4SM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11679,_binary '\0','/3TgABPPQ6YYdUCvr6AZZunucrxX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105017',7.4,13953,'en','Noises Off...','Hired to helm an Americanized take on a British play, director Lloyd Fellowes does his best to control an eccentric group of stage actors. With a star actress quickly passing her prime, a male lead with no confidence, and a bit actor that\'s rarely sober, chaos ensues in the lead up to a Broadway premiere.','/rrRNSwC0sfQUs0g9MVmDaJdP4Pg.jpg','1992-03-20',103,'Released','The comedy where everyone gets caught in the act.','Noises Off...',26670,3.6375,7.159,'gHQZPtseP8E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11680,_binary '\0','/iNbILJjog6ZsBkf9ZHrjAmpjrYE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105019',7.2,3640,'nl','De Noorderlingen','A black comedy set in the 1960s in a small Netherlands community, populated by a cast of eccentrics, all of whom hold a range of sexual obsessions and frustrated desires.','/urIKSwOoTez21y0kIkRRu0oSrgJ.jpg','1992-04-17',103,'Released',NULL,'The Northerners',5899,3.1258,6.856,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11681,_binary '\0','/skqgXTN4ioWCqykgVl2QnDkhtlh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105032',6.8,2608,'fr','Les Nuits fauves','Jean is young, gay, and promiscuous. Only after he meets one or two women, including Laura, does he come to realize his bisexuality. Jean has to overcome a personal crisis and a tough choice between Laura and his male lover Samy.','/wPzs0G2LV6shi0zpxdYOVZcuBDP.jpg','1992-10-21',126,'Released','1986. Passion, rage, liberty and love.','Savage Nights',41878,2.0417,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11682,_binary '\0','/5HVwz8cImMEwcV2z1SMFyJHY51q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105046',7.4,51832,'en','Of Mice and Men','Two drifters, one a gentle but slow giant, try to make money working the fields during the Depression so they can fulfill their dreams.','/qAHLUMZyoW3iwj2b01B2nKcePTA.jpg','1992-09-16',111,'Released','We have a dream. Someday, we\'ll have a little house and a couple of acres. A place to call home.','Of Mice and Men',9609,5.6676,7.2,'VY4HJLl0yl8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11683,_binary '\0','/ee7ZWPDUOki7wMapIhFnrexLCWt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105059',5.3,1843,'en','Only You','Dumped by his fiancée, Clifford Godfrey goes on vacation anyway where he ends up torn between a sober party girl and his travel agent.','/A8Jgus7xXrqg8THp785EFJ3F79W.jpg','1992-05-23',85,'Released','A comedy about having the right feelings for the wrong girl.','Only You',64039,1.9096,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11684,_binary '\0','/7KypUicRtK66yZmH93FGiFGFBIm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105073',5.1,2173,'de','Otto - Der Liebesfilm','Cupid, the God of love, gets the order to unite two people. On Earth, Otto fails as a street musician because his guitar breaks. While buying a new string, his hand gets stuck in the purse of Tina, who works at the Dr. Bayerle beauty farm. When she enters the subway, the purse is teared off and Otto is hit by Cupid\'s arrow. Now he wants to give back her purse at the doctor\'s conference.','/koO3NOmBxUl6zP06LnAoa2NUY5y.jpg','1992-07-30',87,'Released',NULL,'Otto - The Romance Film',9897,1.3591,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11685,_binary '\0','/cGKrZqFkPuzkmWq57ZOTtMopTws.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105078',5.3,2230,'en','Out on a Limb','While heading to the town where his sister, Marci, lives, big-city banker Bill Campbell is robbed by a woman who takes everything he has, including his clothes and a business document worth millions of dollars. Bill eventually reunites with Marci, who is in a tizzy because she thinks their stepfather has been killed. While trying to determine if his sister is right, Bill must also get back his valuable paperwork.','/y2El6Z9vlsLcOjtcawNESpAzDb3.jpg','1992-09-04',82,'Released','He\'s got 24 hours to find his missing wallet with a phone number worth a hundred million dollars. There\'s only one place he hasn\'t looked...','Out on a Limb',114726,3.2302,5.23,'T8Y4pYJk5VY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11686,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105089',7.5,1244,'en','The Panama Deception','This winner of the 1993 Academy Award for Best Documentary Feature details the case that the 1989 invasion of Panama by the US was motivated not by the need to protect American soldiers, restore democracy or even capture Noriega. It was to force Panama to submit the will of the United States after Noriega had exhausted his usefulness.','/6ZN3WG2X2Flv4iyx0y9Jva7m7O3.jpg','1992-07-31',91,'Released','Exposing The Cover Up!','The Panama Deception',41773,1.3426,7,'jFDeGTCHAJM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11687,_binary '\0','/5PDHWBBCwFplGFIb9VS57D5Hfku.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105097',7.3,3135,'it','Parenti serpenti','During the annual Christmas gathering at the family home, the parents surprise their children by announcing their decision to move in with one of them and pass on the house.','/tDksTwkXNSTx7aO7cqG3oAZSO9X.jpg','1992-03-26',105,'Released',NULL,'Dearest Relatives, Poisonous Relations',24182,1.0947,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11688,_binary '\0','/4HYBjoT3IJW9dREApR1wizj2DMT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105103',5.8,1601,'en','Passed Away','Thrown for a loop by the unexpected news that Dad has suddenly gone to his reward, the grieving eccentric Scanian clan are drawn together in a test of familial endurance that soon has them at each other\'s throats.','/kUBxt3YGBOg5Okpg6dUE7DBrRgR.jpg','1992-04-24',96,'Released','The hilariously grave comedy that proves eternity is spending three days with family!','Passed Away',62383,2.4545,5.4,'12AOtObDF6M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11689,_binary '\0','/f3ugXLa0w4x3cVVNodBPB6HDmSk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105104',5.9,54155,'en','Passenger 57','Airline security specialist John Cutter, finally returning to the job after his wife\'s death, finds himself stuck on a flight being hijacked by notorious terrorist Charles Rane. Unfortunately for the terrorists, they\'re also stuck with him.','/4VBN8pQxGHjeZWcNv1V1xSw0OKC.jpg','1992-11-06',84,'Released','He\'s an ex-cop with a bad mouth, a bad attitude, and a bad seat. For the terrorists on flight 163 . . . he\'s very bad news.','Passenger 57',10538,7.745,6.023,'cqftFJdAvtQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11690,_binary '\0','/AiKGSLRxaEp7IMCsLCcAEf3L7Gt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105107',7.3,6537,'en','Passion Fish','After an accident leaves her a paraplegic, a former soap opera star struggles to recover both emotionally and mentally, until she meets her newest nurse, who has struggles of her own.','/g60GELLr2oGnlJX5Yidkl9ufFYv.jpg','1992-12-11',135,'Released','Have you ever dreamed of escaping to a place where you can begin again?','Passion Fish',41768,2.9511,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11691,_binary '\0','/x7fPduF0EZsiL4Mv120YX8aUvsK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105108',5.6,1737,'en','Past Midnight','A man gets out of prison after 15 years for stabbing his wife to death, and his social worker becomes convinced he was innocent. As she researches his case, and interviews other people who were involved, she begins to fall in love with him, as her friends warn her that he\'s dangerous.','/8sMb6VIWs253IZ0X56vC6v7FjnB.jpg','1992-05-03',100,'Released','Past Passion. Past Terror. Past Murder.','Past Midnight',66566,1.7259,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11692,_binary '\0','/26Ftg4S0uORiachoSFR59biJC9c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105112',6.9,129556,'en','Patriot Games','When CIA Analyst Jack Ryan interferes with an IRA assassination, a renegade faction targets Jack and his family as revenge.','/9IT7gnszrRthduYxCLqaIkM55Un.jpg','1992-06-04',117,'Released','Not for honor. Not for country. For his wife and child.','Patriot Games',9869,11.0717,6.679,'lctC_4kQwtw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11693,_binary '\0','/hiN1KvtpFO1gdt19DoI7xGFw2E8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105114',7.1,1220,'es','El patrullero','A naïve rookie in the Mexican highway patrol must adapt in order to survive as he contends with widespread corruption, dangerous drug runners and the consequences of his often morally gray actions.','/dRnOQCMEjZWViZvGa5iZqQ5vPXS.jpg','1991-12-28',104,'Released',NULL,'Highway Patrolman',54837,1.6762,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11694,_binary '\0','/soSkfXpZBHU1pTQnW1ZyLtkMz9b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105120',6.8,1524,'it','Pensavo fosse amore... invece era un calesse','Tommaso goes incredible lengths to win back the love of his former girlfriend Cecilia, but sometimes things change in the most unexpected way.','/53z9iakCACkdqTtpSIpgKaXg5xS.jpg','1991-12-20',103,'Released',NULL,'I Thought It Was Love',56975,1.5733,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11695,_binary '\0','/lyGRyMxIYwvPObfOYWYDivMQUqh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105121',6.4,44179,'en','The People Under the Stairs','Trapped inside a fortified home owned by a mysterious couple, a young boy quickly learns the true nature of the homicidal inhabitants, and secret creatures hidden deep within the walls.','/8OWDBVmGdM7HwaDtbDsdn6Rlzqj.jpg','1991-11-01',102,'Released','In every neighborhood, there is one house that adults whisper about and children cross the street to avoid.','The People Under the Stairs',13122,5.1601,6.6,'Jp8FkfhSWK4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11696,_binary '\0','/yLGlSNfVVidVeanH6vY8ZntdPiy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105128',5,25600,'en','Pet Sematary II','The \"sematary\" is up to its old zombie-raising tricks again. This time, the protagonists are Jeff Matthews, whose mother died in a Hollywood stage accident, and Drew Gilbert, a boy coping with an abusive stepfather.','/9g6ngNlHOfMfQnaKkw9468p67d4.jpg','1992-08-28',100,'Released','Raise some hell.','Pet Sematary II',10906,7.6892,5.5,'hdn56hGq5O0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11697,_binary '\0','/hvvWpJlIAnUxvmqHO5crATLVNzP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105130',7,13222,'en','Peter\'s Friends','After inheriting a large country estate from his late father, Peter invites his friends from college: married couple Roger and Mary, the lonely Maggie, fashionable Sarah, and writer Andrew, who brings his American TV star wife, Carol. Sarah\'s new boyfriend, Brian, also attends. It has been 10 years since college, and they find their lives are very different.','/8ly4EB83JlOkjBD6wOTU0ReXMQN.jpg','1992-09-18',101,'Released','Love, friendship, and other natural disasters...','Peter\'s Friends',11790,2.7483,6.6,'BgVweY7P7rM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11698,_binary '\0','/qAITd8D9DAYutAbjvwamcQ161Am.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105137',7.7,2454,'tr','Piano Piano Bacaksız','In 1940s Turkey, the war is recently over, but the wounds are still fresh, and the WWII is going on next door. A different family lives in each room of a mansion. They all lead a scarce life but hold on to life with hope.','/dTUM9oExpkROFc4CHcMJnGyRjyx.jpg','1991-10-25',81,'Released',NULL,'Piano Piano Kid',85694,0.9209,7.483,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11699,_binary '\0','/gLKDWQk47mndcBusxiRwTrqJplo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105150',6.2,1399,'en','The Playboys','A young woman, Tara Maguire (Robin Wright) scandalizes her provincial Irish village in the 1950s by having a baby out of a wedlock, and refusing to name the father. She has a rare beauty and every man in town desires her, especially Sergeant Hegarty (Albert Finney). The arrival of a dramatic troupe stirs things up even more, especially when she falls in love with one f the \"Playboys\", Tom Casey (Aidan Quinn).','/n3Bk1DArX9vGt1jqLnDSx09Ig98.jpg','1992-04-22',117,'Released',NULL,'The Playboys',41774,1.5466,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11700,_binary '\0','/tKyxF6ZyxF65CcJKBKId1VavpGP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105151',7.5,73060,'en','The Player','A Hollywood studio executive is being sent death threats by a writer whose script he rejected - but which one?','/tZ3kDut2dhFVGkWNEn9xoCHCNAx.jpg','1992-05-08',124,'Released','Now More Than Ever!','The Player',10403,7.2181,7.2,'HpDDTS08wPs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11701,_binary '\0','/1EhnpDKRkxNKDpMBm8FFsYJl12j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105156',5.4,21777,'en','Poison Ivy','A seductive teen befriends an introverted high school student and schemes her way into the lives of her wealthy family.','/aBreWBGcu4ejlDo2U7ZPqilRGoQ.jpg','1992-05-08',92,'Released','Ivy thought her best friend had the perfect house, the perfect family, the perfect life. So she took them.','Poison Ivy',9264,4.7334,5.4,'-O3cU3dODjo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11702,_binary '\0','/zyJW3g5HjPKvAE8uvPxwfhjrQX9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105159',7.1,11526,'en','The Power of One','PK, an English orphan terrorized for his family\'s political beliefs in Africa, turns to his only friend, a kindly world-wise prisoner, Geel Piet. Geel teaches him how to box with the motto “fight with your fists and lead with your heart”. As he grows to manhood, PK uses these words to take on the system and the injustices he sees around him - and finds that one person really can make a difference.','/xOVPMNaQvMNHt68vijC1gvy81my.jpg','1992-03-27',127,'Released','An exhilarating epic of a triumph of the heart.','The Power of One',13823,5.1542,7.464,'B_2FNpN14PI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11703,_binary '\0','/mhCfjWwYulkEQYYsEUEKiOXmQJK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105162',4.4,1254,'en','Praying with Anger','An alienated, Americanized teenager of East Indian heritage is sent back to India where he discovers not only his roots but a lot about himself.','/8CrWxYHGQCtwFwA5CZShh30VvxN.jpg','1993-09-15',101,'Released','In a land torn apart by hate, he found the strength to love...','Praying with Anger',114284,1.4635,4.983,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11704,_binary '\0','/l7Qi8DAsPfiqejik3C71d8qLyl4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105165',5.6,8902,'en','Prelude to a Kiss','A couple fall in love despite the girl\'s pessimistic outlook. As they struggle to come to terms with their relationship, something supernatural happens that tests it.','/2jircyuuGwx7OtFcSMVVXW0fNvv.jpg','1992-07-10',105,'Released','If you can\'t believe your eyes, trust your heart.','Prelude to a Kiss',2613,4.0356,5.6,'4DmWLxGad8I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11705,_binary '\0','/6SM3LbbLtAZFrQ8iXvtAFXElJji.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105179',4.1,2413,'en','Prom Night IV: Deliver Us from Evil','Thirty years after slashing a Hamilton High couple on Prom Night 1957, psychotic priest Father Jonas gets loose from the chapel basement where the other church fathers had been secretly keeping him locked up and drugged.','/tjq1iWClSBCfi3SjpVJblOU6q4F.jpg','1992-02-14',93,'Released','They ditched the prom for a private party, now it\'s their last dance.','Prom Night IV: Deliver Us from Evil',41769,2.2667,4.8,'aebIiQ8qAl8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11706,_binary '\0','/sPSLFoxI747wwdxsX2d1rDBLI4z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105185',7.6,6179,'pl','Psy','In post-communist Poland, former secret police agent Franz Maurer works as a regular cop pursuing a major drug ring. As he and his old comrades lose their privileges and face public scorn in the new reality, Franz realizes that some of his former colleagues are now on the opposite side of the law.','/nxz6gkpf0Vgch9v3s2yFMjqcqnc.jpg','1992-11-20',104,'Released',NULL,'The Pigs',18575,1.9971,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11707,_binary '\0','/5SKW1cDYH0xHTdyAAnEvHbFXQmx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105187',6.5,4698,'en','The Public Eye','A crime photographer gets involved in a conspiracy.','/oiKWmtkGVOHR9Z49qZkkDkCeKyO.jpg','1992-10-16',99,'Released','Murder. Scandal. Crime. No matter what he was shooting, \"The Great Bernzini\" never took sides, he only took pictures... Except once.','The Public Eye',31692,3.126,6.2,'FIpQagY4Dqw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11708,_binary '\0','/oI2W1YhbmKz5QFIYBwvToA7RPTx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105188',6.6,1914,'it','Puerto Escondido','Targeted by a dirty cop after witnessing a murder, bank clerk Mario flees to Puerto Escondido, Mexico, where a couple of oddball Italian expats drags him into a journey of self-discovery and bad decisions.','/5u3IX4yee6o46SkYdYGHBOIO0EH.jpg','1992-12-17',110,'Released',NULL,'Puerto Escondido',46028,1.3026,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11709,_binary '\0','/x5SGeaiCylpjKxnMgWAgkQcVubb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105191',7.2,5975,'en','Pure Country','Dusty Chandler is a super star in the country music world, but his shows have the style of a \'70s rock concert. One day he takes a walk - out of his overdone concerts to find his real country roots. He\'s helped and hindered by friends and staff, but pushes on in his search for a real music style as well as a real romance.','/nVilYjaslgywSsDPqLeiW94Kc7R.jpg','1992-10-23',112,'Released','Bright lights. Hit songs. Country\'s biggest star. He\'d trade it all to find the kind of love he\'d only sung about.','Pure Country',22627,2.0126,6.9,'WhjJ3fZIoLU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11710,_binary '\0','/rtW6heeSJhFzudJXIj6JQap8hAC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105197',7.5,7229,'zh','秋菊打官司','When her husband is kicked in the groin by the village head, Qiu Ju, a peasant woman, despite her pregnancy, travels to a nearby town, and later a big city to deal with its bureaucrats and find justice.','/5yYnTVXuLBjFQ91k2FnSWcwNn3x.jpg','1992-08-31',100,'Released',NULL,'The Story of Qiu Ju',38143,2.3717,7.3,'nmbu07qTiMo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11711,_binary '\0','/qupyOOes39BBlCtgvH77vgGVpA1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105211',6.9,15365,'en','Radio Flyer','A father reminisces about his childhood when he and his younger brother moved to a new town with their mother, her new husband and their dog, Shane. When the younger brother is subjected to physical abuse at the hands of their brutal stepfather, Mike decides to convert their toy trolley, the \"Radio Flyer\", into a plane to fly him to safety.','/nQjCKrwWYH6ES0HrnkLkPXnOEp0.jpg','1992-02-21',114,'Released','Powered by imagination.','Radio Flyer',20763,4.6008,7.002,'Gxsfeyl5g7I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11712,_binary '\0','/49RkUuDWrsv5ba6525fAXG5g0Tg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105217',6.1,19336,'en','Raising Cain','Child psychologist Carter Nix is a loving and caring family man, but under this appearance lies a dark and troubled past. Grappling with the consequences of this past on his own psyche and the influence of his returning father and violent brother Cain, Carter becomes involved in a series of murders and kidnappings. Meanwhile, his wife Jenny rekindles an old love affair, placing herself in the crosshairs of her increasingly unstable husband.','/5vRn138vnZeUNFe32qTuPGKkVLR.jpg','1992-08-07',92,'Released','Demented. Deranged. Deceptive. De Palma.','Raising Cain',13937,3.8668,6.046,'XczemP7GJvc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11713,_binary '\0','/ECILueM2qNRK0eSNMr6OtldZcA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105219',6.3,11229,'en','Rapid Fire','College student Jake Lo is pursued by smugglers, mobsters and crooked federal agents after he witnesses a murder by a Mafia kingpin.','/sjZ3eS5Cvi7aS6nf4qwcTL2NS6P.jpg','1992-08-21',95,'Released','Unarmed and extremely dangerous.','Rapid Fire',13153,4.3389,6.438,'iTfrzTyGqdM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11714,_binary '\0','/3JbHPpUJ53I52w66jydAhIp8Ibe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105226',7,28716,'en','Red Rock West','When a promised job for Texan Michael fails to materialize in Wyoming, Mike is mistaken by Wayne to be the hitman he hired to kill his unfaithful wife, Suzanne. Mike takes full advantage of the situation, collects the money, and runs. During his getaway, things go wrong, and soon get worse when he runs into the real hitman, Lyle.','/ewofUEqU3Gpr7WSgSz3TEVPIfBg.jpg','1993-05-14',98,'Released','Where nothing is as it seems.','Red Rock West',10427,4.2638,6.8,'1kP0yuB0W-o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11715,_binary '\0','/6aWKx7vk90AhE74jAAqNStK065J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105227',5.3,1779,'en','Red Shoe Diaries','A man grieving the loss of his fiancée discovers a diary she kept that details a side of her he never knew. In an effort to understand, he reaches out in an unusual way by placing an ad asking for women’s diaries and hearing their stories.','/xQPjn6wf1wxwaHeSUXQdpQZcmin.jpg','1992-05-16',105,'Released','Trapped by a burning secret. Torn by a blazing desire.','Red Shoe Diaries',5234,1.9773,4.9,'QhU6hsKx7s8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11716,_binary '\0','/jwt159hXWA9Q5xpBo8hWb3zwLi7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105236',8.2,1181826,'en','Reservoir Dogs','A botched robbery indicates a police informant, and the pressure mounts in the aftermath at a warehouse. Crime begets violence as the survivors -- veteran Mr. White, newcomer Mr. Orange, psychopathic parolee Mr. Blonde, bickering weasel Mr. Pink and Nice Guy Eddie -- unravel.','/xi8Iu6qyTfyZVDVy60raIOYJJmk.jpg','1992-09-02',99,'Released','Every dog has his day.','Reservoir Dogs',500,24.5611,8.11,'2KLZ4fSXtgI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11717,_binary '\0','/yDmrli2yAPHa9ZLd7iM4T1EKLDL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105242',6.2,5776,'en','The Resurrected','Charles Dexter Ward, a wealthy scientist, uses an ancient diary and human remains to begin a terrifying and bloody pursuit for immortality.','/nhQwgcIDD5XcKWLMLyrgqY4bFZd.jpg','1991-10-19',105,'Released','Death used to be the end. Now it\'s only the beginning...','The Resurrected',30694,4.305,6.17,'9jC7BBrYlkI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11718,_binary '\0','/1fB1ml3q1vQcGL9q00OxDHXRftl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105251',3.9,5636,'en','Revenge of the Nerds III: The Next Generation','The nerds are now in control of the university, as a result of Lewis Skolnick and the rest\'s actions in the two previous movies. A new generation of sportsmen arrive, however, determined on winning the school back. The principle, himself an ex-nerd fighter, helps them, and the nerds return to suppression. Harold Skolnick needs help from his uncle Lewis, the hero of the first two movies. Lewis, however, are not too proud of his nerd past, and won\'t reveal any of it, much less help his nephew. However, his wife makes him change his mind, and with help from his friends from the first two movies, they start the fight to win the school back, using classic nerd tricks.','/ql88TgCS7cA6gxts2LOKIqeQ1Ug.jpg','1992-07-13',93,'Released',NULL,'Revenge of the Nerds III: The Next Generation',18543,2.9095,4.6,'w7Uvrt9eS04','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11719,_binary '\0','/85dLdBCBbuZYde0T6L1CKXd707u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105265',7.2,72085,'en','A River Runs Through It','The Maclean brothers, Paul and Norman, live a relatively idyllic life in rural Montana, spending much of their time fly fishing. The sons of a minister, the boys eventually part company when Norman moves east to attend college, leaving his rebellious brother to find trouble back home. When Norman finally returns, the siblings resume their fishing outings, and assess where they\'ve been and where they\'re going.','/aVP45oS2cBL4WtZ1kB7r8uarruB.jpg','1992-10-09',123,'Released','Nothing perfect lasts forever. Except in our memories.','A River Runs Through It',293,9.5323,7,'0dAe_2y6_c8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11720,_binary '\0','/6ky1yDq16DcvJlnDDbIGjuxyPs8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105267',6.3,1542,'en','Roadside Prophets','On a quest to fulfill a friend\'s last wish, Joe takes to the desert road on his 1957 Harley-Davidson. Joined by wannabe biker Sam, Joe journeys from Los Angeles to Nevada, meeting all sorts of characters along the way.','/8KkFF5voIohrkjUzLY7eNnW10hR.jpg','1992-03-27',96,'Released','They weren\'t born to be wild. It just turned out that way.','Roadside Prophets',40841,1.4309,5.6,'07dhxbfDeng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11721,_binary '\0','/pWgrBvyUwyMu4VaFVCvnZTO7aeD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105271',8.1,14909,'ta','ரோஜா','Roja, a simple girl from a village in Tamil Nadu, makes desperate efforts to find her husband, Rishi, after he is kidnapped by militants during a secret undercover mission in Kashmir.','/4vsfaW8actUgPRK79zgGlgpSSeB.jpg','1992-08-15',137,'Released',NULL,'Roja',21463,1.7008,7,'Y30vs1tzckg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11722,_binary '\0','/cfGKEah2uUli5HPG1Ry3QK3lwDh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105275',6.8,43851,'en','Romper Stomper','Nazi skinheads in Melbourne take out their anger on local Vietnamese, who are seen as threatening racial purity. Finally the Vietnamese have had enough and confront the skinheads in an all-out confrontation, sending the skinheads running. A woman who is prone to epileptic seizures joins the skins\' merry band, and helps them on their run from justice, but is her affliction also a sign of impurity?','/urE3Jzl3zuz2XUmAq2rXubYn3SD.jpg','1992-03-05',94,'Released','You\'ve never seen anything like it.','Romper Stomper',10412,3.1941,6.525,'Tu2JLPh4A40','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11723,_binary '\0','/onCcMjFXrO8InXVsaCMbiHuucqa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105287',5.5,3276,'cn','玉蒲團之偷情寶鑑','A recently married scholar goes on a quest for knowledge of other people\'s wives, based on his philosophical differences with the Sack Monk. He encounters the Flying Thief, who agrees to help him find women, but only if he attains a penis as big as a horse\'s. The scholar has a surgeon attach said unit, and he\'s off and running on his mission, only to find that there are obstacles to his new lifestyle, such as jealous husbands and treacherous females.','/10pN7gDszAyYdROJB6ok0CZ3TJf.jpg','1991-11-30',99,'Released','Banned for 400 years! The most notorious of China\'s three great erotic sagas – revealed on the screen for the first time.','Sex and Zen',45491,1.1643,6.2,'3fwcSB7RI-I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11724,_binary '\0','/gad4GTmKva9W5EV1G5twdpinV21.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105291',5.5,1762,'en','Ruby','Fact and fiction are combined in this story about Jack Ruby and a stripper, Candy Cane, and how they become involved in a conspiracy to kill J.F.K.','/wEPTCmzKLnP9GArjWvYfI6TJTv6.jpg','1992-03-27',110,'Released','If you don\'t know his story you don\'t know the whole story.','Ruby',70709,1.7729,5.5,'ZWcs485lBKM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11725,_binary '\0','/waSil3v5wY9NIbJRwkCrK0Y3Bq3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105306',6.1,1339,'en','Salt on Our Skin','A Scottish woman who attends school in Paris comes home for the summer and helps take in the straw, where she meets an attractive and simple man. They begin a torrid affair despite the differences in their lifestyles. He asks her to marry him but she refuses, and they continue their separate lives but also continue their affair through the years, loving each other despite their differences.','/84j1jVf7IbN4p0F5pRET9etFALW.jpg','1992-09-17',111,'Released',NULL,'Salt on Our Skin',117202,2.1922,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11726,_binary '\0','/lsKlPoqRy0nzquK3Iv8jOY0FnaO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105316',6.4,2472,'en','Sarafina!','A Soweto schoolgirl named Sarafina is galvanized to protest apartheid after her teacher is arrested for her activism, leading her to join the student resistance movement.','/jAbU0p1hQErFIErJPmUG3n91xgn.jpg','1992-09-18',117,'Released','She was their teacher. They were her hope.','Sarafina!',35936,7.0593,6.2,'3wVYjkFfpXM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11727,_binary '\0','/kxFEVOgv3RKP7CNgDwf3rdOoUkG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105321',6.1,3448,'en','Saved By the Bell: Hawaiian Style','Kelly\'s grandpa invites the whole gang to his little hotel \"The Hideaway\" in Hawaii for summer vacation. They expect a marvelous time at the beach - without Belding. Upon arriving, they quickly learn that not only is Belding there, but they also have to help Kelly\'s grandpa from losing his hotel. Meanwhile Zack meets (again) the love of his life, Jessie and Slater bet with Lisa that they won\'t fight, and Screech gets kidnapped by the Pupuku clan.','/jpUVeuVpeX2cNrA7GL0j2jxL9xC.jpg','1992-11-27',92,'Released',NULL,'Saved By the Bell: Hawaiian Style',37022,2.7236,6.3,'vRNy6OCDRJM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11728,_binary '\0','/gqEKfkukuB4m1oNKhVAm9JcvJg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105322',4.5,2936,'en','Scanners III: The Takeover','A young scanner with extraordinary telepathic powers transforms into a lethal killing machine after taking one of her father\'s experimental drugs.','/qrgsczCSUfbaeYJnvMSEmKcGV4X.jpg','1992-01-31',95,'Released','Scanners against scanners... The battle for total control has begun.','Scanners III: The Takeover',33305,1.9996,4.413,'PPak4CNlXfU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11729,_binary '\0','/fa03pD2qYmms4ZMgAv7PMqfFiGO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105323',8,376159,'en','Scent of a Woman','Charlie Simms is a student at a private preparatory school who comes from a poor family. To earn the money for his flight home to Gresham, Oregon for Christmas, Charlie takes a job over Thanksgiving looking after retired U.S. Army officer Lieutenant Colonel Frank Slade, a cantankerous middle-aged man who lives with his niece and her family.','/4adI7IaveWb7EidYXfLb3MK3CgO.jpg','1992-12-23',156,'Released','Frank Slade has a plan. It includes a weekend of fast cars, the tango, high living and a loaded forty five. And Charlie is coming along for the ride.','Scent of a Woman',9475,15.7095,7.791,'7xIYQgrd-Sg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11730,_binary '\0','/3WWQtVKOra73bde9ViwOwq1GnsN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105327',6.9,29795,'en','School Ties','When David Greene receives a football scholarship to a prestigious prep school in the 1950s, he feels pressure to hide the fact that he is Jewish from his classmates and teachers, fearing that they may be anti-Semitic. He quickly becomes the big man on campus thanks to his football skills, but when his Jewish background is discovered, his worst fears are realized and his friends turn on him with violent threats and public ridicule.','/h9u6VSyEPlF5L69QSzOh1eo4F5q.jpg','1992-09-18',106,'Released','Just because you’re accepted doesn’t mean you belong.','School Ties',14684,5.3029,6.517,'PWj_zc7RBFQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11731,_binary '\0','/idsUJU6UBR3DSDzUcW5f29gcIId.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105328',7.1,4505,'de','Schtonk!','Schtonk! is a farce of the actual events of 1983, when Germany\'s Stern magazine published, with great fanfare, 60 volumes of the alleged diaries of Adolf Hitler – which two weeks later turned out to be entirely fake. Fritz Knobel (based on real-life forger Konrad Kujau) supports himself by faking and selling Nazi memorabilia. When Knobel writes and sells a volume of Hitler\'s (nonexistent) diaries, he thinks it\'s just another job. When sleazy journalist Hermann Willié learns of the diaries, however, he quickly realizes their potential value... and Knobel is quickly in over his head. As the pressure builds and Knobel is forced to deliver more and more volumes of the fake diaries, he finds himself acting increasingly like the man whose life he is rewriting. The film is a romping and hilarious satire, poking fun not only at the events and characters involved in the hoax (who are only thinly disguised in the film), but at the discomfort Germany has with its difficult past.','/j1XmuLmbt8rj0rM5Ewg83sIPy2Z.jpg','1992-03-12',115,'Released','One of the first funny german look at its past.','Schtonk!',6547,1.5356,6.858,'Fwg3viGTAvU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11732,_binary '\0','/wbj8JACZCJQIb1JdfwN0nk0XF2o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105347',4.5,1667,'en','Seedpeople','The citizens of Comet Valley are being taken over by seeds from an alien plant that has taken root there. A sheriff investigates the strange goings-on.','/5Yc8mcedfd07l56193P533ayqNl.jpg','1992-05-28',87,'Released','The root of all evil!','Seedpeople',92779,2.1348,4.4,'evSJfl3D4pw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11733,_binary '\0','/8xnucZi1Y1MetGVRXJwW7VXRcrv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105355',7.8,1402,'en','A Sense of History','Jim Broadbent wrote and starred in this short film directed by none other than Mike Leigh. As a member of the landed gentry, the 23rd Earl of Leete has a duty to maintain and expand his lands. Shot in the style and manner of a BBC documentary, Broadbent tells his family history to the crew, who slowly come to realise - as do we - that things are not what they seem.','/clpYdBOWCTWYYOnndKIu6SbD7my.jpg','1992-09-12',26,'Released',NULL,'A Sense of History',61120,1.6531,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11734,_binary '\0','/mcSeT9VDT4OnSR3E2dxl6knE9YG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105378',6.7,19192,'en','Shadows and Fog','With a serial strangler on the loose, a bookkeeper wanders around town searching for the vigilante group intent on catching the killer.','/6Ybi2u1TSOTpAocZAGJl2WThq11.jpg','1991-12-05',85,'Released','A delicate comedy-mystery in true Allen fashion.','Shadows and Fog',19200,4.495,6.7,'gIOkamBic4A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11735,_binary '\0','/u9FmjB3VHOzG73ucfvUjAYIwGYS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105385',6.8,3505,'cn','審死官','An unscrupulous lawyer with an equally eccentric kung-fu sidekick wife tries to bring justice to the court.','/1GjRTLuy9C6HqiFhniugcAItYJ4.jpg','1992-07-02',95,'Released',NULL,'Justice, My Foot!',32517,2.7455,6.7,'BN3xg_vsfUk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11736,_binary '\0','/8rdRjdlQMYNdwDX38VkTH4BXorI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105391',6.4,11658,'en','Shining Through','Spirited New Yorker Linda Voss goes to work for international lawyer and secret Office of Strategic Services operative Ed Leland just before World War II. As they fall in love, the United States enters the fight against Hitler, and Linda volunteers to work for Ed spying undercover behind Nazi lines. Assigned to uncover information about a German bomb, Linda also has personal motives to fulfill: discovering the fate of her Jewish family members in Berlin.','/wAnvljbemUQluLjCcjgTZs0PXW1.jpg','1992-01-31',132,'Released','He needed to trust her with his secret. She had to trust him with her life.','Shining Through',31962,4.9716,6.479,'ChujSmX8KDU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11737,_binary '\0','/vhpbqIP1voyklgLy1mNaha7R8YO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105394',6.6,1426,'hi','Shola Aur Shabnam','The spoiled and arrogant brother, Bali, of notorious gangster, Kali Baba, enlists in the National Cadet Corps, and wants to have his way with his fellow-students and trainer, Inder Mohan Lahti, with comical results. When he meets Divya Thapa for the first time, he is smitten by her, and wants to marry her by hook or by crook. But Divya is in love with Karan, and both plan to marry each other. Circumstances act against them, and they flee together, with Kali Baba\'s men, and Divya\'s Police Commissioner dad, Yashpal Thapa, in hot pursuit, to an unknown destination, surrounded by a web of lies, deception, and no known resource to assist them.','/chuyRvvnvgs1oW1hLIYMwGJpO6n.jpg','1992-01-23',167,'Released',NULL,'Shola Aur Shabnam',103015,1.6438,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11738,_binary '\0','/xSPomtBv0oAedbetieoITr1auFt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105395',5.5,1684,'en','Shootfighter: Fight to the Death','Nick and Ruben are hoodwinked into a \"shootfighter\" (no-holds-barred, to the death) martial arts match by the evil Mr. Lee, who has a grudge against world shootfighter champ(and teacher of Nick and Ruben) Shingo.','/1WcxVQBsXG6EQlNJd8vcF4oFTg4.jpg','1993-05-05',100,'Released','It\'ll tear your heart out!','Shootfighter: Fight to the Death',62328,3.1882,6.5,'N3NngZGiMvg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11739,_binary '\0','/h3vctOuLlF0V3liuTfaWVC9utKG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105399',6.4,14164,'cn','双龙会','Identical twins are separated at birth, one becoming a streetwise mechanic, and the other an acclaimed classical concert conductor. Finally meeting in adulthood, they\'re mistaken for the other and entangled in each other\'s worlds.','/tm153lMrHy6HykEYwoP0EI3dQ8k.jpg','1992-01-15',104,'Released','Twice the action!','Twin Dragons',18764,5.6513,6.9,'2sNVVr4AfMU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11740,_binary '\0','/s0KZQlfhLlO7oT1q9XxCLdW06jO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105402',5.3,11074,'en','Sidekicks','Asthmatic teenager Barry Gabrewski is a daydreamer. Troubled by bullying, he escapes into a fantasy world where he is the sidekick to his martial arts hero, Chuck Norris, in a series of high-octane adventures taken right out of his movies. With help from his teacher\'s wise old uncle, Mr. Lee, Barry learns the finer points of martial arts and enters a karate championship.','/p4n2gLg7Iqko72GMJwfaHHCdVg4.jpg','1992-12-17',101,'Released','A dreamer and a champion. An unbeatable team.','Sidekicks',22590,3.6613,5.305,'v7jiQLjzaLE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11741,_binary '\0','/ajpBNu8J4TyKA0nu06wHWxIswvM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105411',7.1,5144,'en','Simple Men','Two diametrically opposite brothers set off on a journey to reunite with their estranged father but when their motorcycle breaks down while passing through a small town, they become entangled in local life.','/kB03zN890CYjNvp9iqe8f9HC3n.jpg','1992-10-14',105,'Released','They\'re good boys with bad attitude!','Simple Men',47802,2.3159,6.7,'i43BKdVbhak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11742,_binary '\0','/yZIfHR7LM1z97CmRXWf6xGTBME3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105414',6.4,47283,'en','Single White Female','Having recently split from her fiancé, Allison Jones welcomes new roommate Hedra Carlson. The young women quickly form a bond, but soon Allison begins to notice not all’s well with her new tenant.','/yPGK58CcAM8NAX8ycR1jdjo2wiE.jpg','1992-08-14',108,'Released','Living with a roommate can be murder.','Single White Female',9605,4.66,6.3,'ROg4MoaAXvY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11743,_binary '\0','/n6z8b0qN9Sk3lNElgeJY6qfDU2L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105415',6.8,35827,'en','Singles','A group of young adults in their twenties, who share an apartment in the city of Seattle, ponder on love and face all the challenges of adulthood.','/4T7OKBdkNBorRKWw7VSeuA225z1.jpg','1992-09-18',99,'Released','Love is a game. Easy to start. Hard to finish.','Singles',11068,9.2521,6.401,'3Hpx_b3gj64','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11744,_binary '\0','/bNiBuekwqwNKFGSqlJRDZIF4ADB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105417',6.6,119808,'en','Sister Act','When lively lounge singer Deloris sees her mobster beau commit murder, she is relocated for her protection. Set up in the guise of a nun in a California convent, she proceeds to upend the quiet lives of the resident sisters.','/xZvVSZ0RTxIjblLV87vs7ADM12m.jpg','1992-05-28',100,'Released','No booze. No sex. No drugs. No way.','Sister Act',2005,12.9151,6.836,'lCBjHkCK1Vw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11745,_binary '\0','/fNaW6q6hAepN5FXfie2iNWLpMWu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105420',5.2,1728,'en','Sketch Artist','A sketch artist for the police helps a witness recall who she saw leaving the scene of a murder, and discovers that the person is his wife. Not willing to believe she was responsible, he resketches the pictures so they don\'t look like her, and he begins his own investigation of the murder.','/cioo465M7jKMB56pcIzTTD2Aj9a.jpg','1992-09-25',88,'Released',NULL,'Sketch Artist',108134,2.0411,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11746,_binary '\0','/gAaqoA1tGCRjIH0vrjvn7Lbveun.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105424',7.6,1245,'da','De skrigende halse','Copenhagen 1984. Ronni is a young, mediocre punk-guitarist, eager to make it big in the death obsessed late-punk milieu. But his girlfriend has left him, the other members of his band are fed up with his incompetence and insecure attitude, he has a problem with his stomach, his doctor wants to abuse him sexually and the former manager of the band thinks Ronni owes him some money. It seems to reach an ultimate low, when Ronni collapses onstage during an all-important concert, but it turns out to be his ticket to glory as he claims to be mortally ill','/aeBqzqvJEityTCCkdwc9CvDuYQJ.jpg','1993-03-07',65,'Released',NULL,'The Screaming Throats',33070,1.2388,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11747,_binary '\0','/2GcMfxqQdB4xuyetOYPREdnu7ey.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105428',5.4,27880,'en','Sleepwalkers','Charles Brady and his mother, Mary, are the last of a dying breed whose needs are not of this world. They are Sleepwalkers - able to stay alive only by feeding on the life-force of the innocent, but destined to roam the earth, avoiding discovery while searching for their next victim. That search takes them to the sleepy little town of Travis, Indiana, where beautiful teenager Tanya Robertson is about to become an unwilling pawn in their nightmarish fight for survival.','/iiwplv5pET2HgMog6otunohIiSr.jpg','1992-04-10',89,'Released','The first Stephen King story written expressly for the scream.','Sleepwalkers',11428,5.0873,6.095,'Ge6_zTJPhUc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11748,_binary '\0','/smK3ud9IKSLVuRXdKauJ9p0DwNB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105435',7.1,68155,'en','Sneakers','When shadowy U.S. intelligence agents blackmail a reformed computer hacker and his eccentric team of security experts into stealing a code-breaking \'black box\' from a Soviet-funded genius, they uncover a bigger conspiracy. Now, he and his \'sneakers\' must save themselves and the world economy by retrieving the box from their blackmailers.','/l2pIGwCvpZEpBuMb55YBl6A04Jv.jpg','1992-09-09',125,'Released','We could tell you what it\'s about. But then, of course, we\'d have to kill you.','Sneakers',2322,11.5761,6.915,'VNy4zC-wy_M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11749,_binary '\0','/wGv3uv2a1z0Eqz6X0EOjzD0ZxQE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105438',7.6,2419,'es','El sol del membrillo','Filmmaker Victor Erice follows Spanish artist Antonio Lopez in his painstaking attempt to paint the image of a tree.','/wH3VuGHcf0jTzeRGLZlPfqTIHS1.jpg','1992-10-01',138,'Released','Fuller, fuller.','Dream of Light',94706,2.162,7.3,'N172cmoSsGc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11750,_binary '\0','/aU4X43pt0c640CO0vn1WZrQ3i4C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105450',6.8,7522,'en','South Central','During a 10-year sentence for murdering the leader of a rival South Central Los Angeles gang, Bobby Johnson finds religion and rehabilitation with the help of Muslim inmate Ali. Upon his release, Bobby returns home to find that his young son, Jimmie, has joined the Deuces, his old crew. Tensions rise as Bobby struggles to convince Jimmie to leave the gang that was his only family during the painful years his absent father spent behind bars.','/huOFp6gtLYVGZw585fWLabQrzrL.jpg','1992-09-18',99,'Released','A child\'s chance to escape anger and injustice begins with one man... His father.','South Central',23196,3.2806,6.715,'ZEPS0ZNGVkk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11751,_binary '\0','/oCjnXawymfIn4sBog5a9nEQGxfX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105459',6,18998,'en','Split Second','In a flooded future London, Detective Harley Stone hunts a serial killer who murdered his partner and has haunted him ever since — but he soon discovers what he is hunting might not be human.','/c111nTTNsArsUqJx662hPrFymyz.jpg','1992-05-01',90,'Released','He\'s seen the future. Now he has to kill it.','Split Second',13006,4.8305,6,'A-M8PbnAiTc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11752,_binary '\0','/nX149x4sMTo1J95MPZvyjk7gJX3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105462',7,3067,'en','Stalin','The life and career of the brutal Soviet dictator, Josef Stalin. Through the eyes and memories of Anna Aliluyeva, Stalin’s granddaughter, the film traces the rise of the Bolshevik tyrant from Lenin’s return from exile to his brutal struggle with Trotsky, the creation of his feared secret police and the merciless inner workings of his regime. As Anna recounts her grandfather’s life, viewers gain an intimate, personal perspective on the paranoia and purges that left even his closest circles living in constant fear.','/mxkirHGxqcRGN7b8fROEIx85D6E.jpg','1992-11-21',172,'Released',NULL,'Stalin',56448,2.3978,5.3,'IPeRD4P578U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11753,_binary '\0','/r2I5jR7xWSk3jqyODm5zsV45Tpg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105466',6.3,14313,'en','Stay Tuned','Salesman Roy Knable spends all his free time watching television, to the exasperation of his wife, Helen. One day, TV salesman Spike convinces Roy to buy a satellite dish offering 666 channels. The new addition to Roy\'s home entertainment system sucks him and Helen into Hellvision, a realm run by Spike, who is an emissary of Satan. For 24 hours, the couple must survive devilish parodies of TV programs if they want to return to reality alive.','/yd2MN9zA30eGjf89DaaNoUXbRNp.jpg','1992-08-14',87,'Released','Something weird\'s on the air.','Stay Tuned',23939,3.072,6.197,'ycVcurvRYqY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11754,_binary '\0','/kKbQXVYy5i87HcDtRc3BPyqysY5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105470',4.7,2492,'en','Stepfather 3','After escaping a Puget Sound institution, \"Stepfather\" Gene Clifford alters his appearance with plastic surgery and takes on another new identity: Keith Grant. Moving to Deer View, California, Keith falls for a divorced school principal, arousing the suspicions of her wheelchair-bound, computer-savvy son.','/an492xjfS59bRBVTnmFfGy71cNl.jpg','1992-06-04',110,'Released','Daddy\'s been working in the garden... again!','Stepfather 3',61964,3.3608,5.388,'L01r98f6H04','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11755,_binary '\0','/dICmmT2dIC5DSYhzS861jSl23ii.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105477',4.4,46595,'en','Stop! Or My Mom Will Shoot','A tough police sergeant\'s mother comes to visit him, and promptly starts trying to fix up his life, much to his embarrassment. For his birthday she buys him a machine gun out of the back of a van, and begins to further interfere with his job and love life, eventually helping him with a case he\'s on.','/yCw4U5FK7C9hVWF2qcLO4EVvkCc.jpg','1992-02-21',87,'Released','Detective Joe Bomowski\'s mom is in town for a visit. She did the laundry, washed the windows and scrubbed the floors. Now, she\'s gonna clean up the streets.','Stop! Or My Mom Will Shoot',9876,7.122,5.4,'2sGiAIq0xvM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11756,_binary '\0','/gXYQPEZA9CbRtvoBRnvrYcQXYpr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105480',5.7,1544,'en','Storyville','While investigating his own blackmailing, a young politician uncovers his family\'s deep secrets.','/Aag0midhVXwTVv5ZiidAFo6H5SY.jpg','1992-08-26',113,'Released','A candidate\'s private moment can all too quickly become public record.','Storyville',135890,1.7399,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11757,_binary '\0','/8DhJPQwYTErosyJkMGK7OpXsn4e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105481',5.9,4832,'en','Straight Talk','Honest and straightforward small-town Shirlee Kenyon chucks her boyfriend and heads for Chicago. Accidentally having to host a radio problem phone-in show, it is clear she is a natural and is hired on the spot. But the station insists she call herself Doctor, and as her popularity grows a local reporter starts digging for the truth. Problem is, the more he is around her the more he fancies her.','/fc9jSEvsnqdQ59Gt6mlIgb9rtto.jpg','1992-04-03',91,'Released','Dreams do come true...sometimes.','Straight Talk',37264,2.6032,6.1,'ZaiJ626aNvs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11758,_binary '\0','/zlnim8fvgMbYmAVpLgnogwgyy8X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105483',5.6,4629,'en','A Stranger Among Us','Detective Emily Eden is a tough New York City cop forced to go undercover to solve a puzzling murder. Her search for the truth takes her into a secret world of unwritten law and unspoken power, a world where the only way out is deeper in.','/t9V1cE3PzlK0syDD2HzrUiUpIRV.jpg','1992-07-17',110,'Released','In a dangerous world of mystery and intrigue, she\'s going undercover searching for the truth.','A Stranger Among Us',41670,3.065,5.486,'HimOwv3CfOM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11759,_binary '\0','/5gPUA8ABoBK4D1GUkL1NXTSS8Wq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105488',7.2,31302,'en','Strictly Ballroom','Brave new steps put Scott\'s career in jeopardy. With a new partner and determination, can he still succeed?','/f6vs4DQGuNpLuA5Z7k69uuKpbVG.jpg','1992-08-20',94,'Released','A life lived in fear... is a life half lived.','Strictly Ballroom',10409,2.7076,6.606,'PLwfNOrIqSs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11760,_binary '\0','/9mtxaXRqZ8SPrGTDbFXx0qZbG29.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105500',4.5,1410,'hi','सूर्यवंशी','An archaeologist unearths an underground palace at Sangramgarh. The locals are afraid of what will happen if they start digging and would like to leave the past alone. It turns out their fears we confounded.','/lL7EaJNdXeFR8LkgnBQgPAneq8U.jpg','1992-02-14',174,'Released',NULL,'Suryavanshi',161402,1.0692,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11761,_binary '\0','/dU6UiVJN6MQH48cKBJufY8xpQgL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105508',6.6,2093,'en','Swoon','Teenagers Nathan Leopold Jr. and Richard Loeb share a dangerous sexual bond and an amoral outlook on life. They spend afternoons breaking into storefronts and engaging in petty crimes, until the calculating Nathan ups the ante by kidnapping, and murdering, a young boy.','/aM9nXrWOJKh7JJ2I6GdxbDa3UC7.jpg','1992-09-11',93,'Released','Love gone mad. History gone bad.','Swoon',54934,1.2175,5.7,'Ebzul9IoH-c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11762,_binary '\0','/oZdXapNOqdu02vfldJDRLvAHprV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105526',5.2,1549,'en','The Taking of Beverly Hills','A chemical spill has caused the occupants of Beverly Hills to be forcibly evacuated. A retiring football player left behind, finds that the toxic gas emulating from the spill is a bogus front for a heist set up by fired police officers out to plunder the city of all its valuables. Finding himself siding with a corrupt cop who was once apart of the plan until he discovered the city\'s mayor had just been blown away, by one of the chief crooks in charge. Now both on the run with no help in sight...both must do whatever they can to stop these murderous looters.','/6odj5NeJmxn8n56ZCyMMrODVwtM.jpg','1991-10-10',96,'Released','The richest city in the world. Shut down. Ripped off. Blown up.','The Taking of Beverly Hills',32045,2.2327,5.2,'N3zmUh-8qLE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11763,_binary '\0','/4SyrSuXAfggnTDzGia3U9TUm7Ek.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105534',6.6,3463,'cn','逃學威龍２','Star Chow, an officer in the elite police unit, resigns when he is made a scapegoat for a botched investigation. He goes undercover at a school to complete the case and realizes a bumbling detective is also undercover as a student.','/vEszZw7fdL8Qch9TBrnEdDVtTNS.jpg','1992-04-09',106,'Released',NULL,'Fight Back to School 2',53165,3.2732,6.8,'3F7xqPII6-I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11764,_binary '\0','/bMYcQ5l9AxLSgXwP8ImqqqtYKkN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105569',6.4,5746,'ja','鉄男II BODY HAMMER','A Japanese salaryman finds his body transforming into a weapon through sheer rage after his son is kidnapped by a gang of violent thugs.','/w2We4S0SmRP72BKpvtOfyu9cF6H.jpg','1992-10-03',81,'Released','Tokio is seized with rage... The monstrous rage that brings TETSUO to life.','Tetsuo II: Body Hammer',17991,2.2099,6.3,'PowBNgdRAGQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11765,_binary '\0','/4nMRo92eqEn8XcIC8AjBHMFPcxT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105572',6.6,3553,'en','That Night','A coming-of-age story about an eleven-year-old girl who idolizes her troubled sixteen-year-old neighbor.','/tky1NpcXYsgtc1KtrePLYbQTBM5.jpg','1992-08-04',89,'Released','In everyone\'s life there\'s a friendship you never forget.','That Night',34334,2.4701,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11766,_binary '\0','/9TmUpJvbMZCDEjFZ1HJcVxrHOFB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105573',5.8,1374,'en','There Goes the Neighborhood','A dying prisoner whispers the location of his loot to the facility\'s psychologist, who heads to the New Jersey suburbs to find it. Two prisoners overhear the plan and escape to get the millions for themselves. Who will get the money?','/ryqGwpssiS4cd7DH1q5uHi3PTMf.jpg','1992-10-30',88,'Released','A Hot Comedy About Cold Cash.','There Goes the Neighborhood',163228,2.4958,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11767,_binary '\0','/gUJ3sZKLySRxUlvId3j0NKHh5G8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105575',8.6,9092,'ta','தேவர் மகன்','London-educated Saktivelu returns to India and wants to open a chain of restaurants in Chennai. His father, however, wishes that he would stay back and help the villagers.','/wL6DTw3fNDXFnWRdZyvJWpGQaeY.jpg','1992-10-25',160,'Released',NULL,'Thevar Magan',66362,1.6623,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11768,_binary '\0','/m6S6hyLWubiuLpJR7IjswLRcgJe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105577',6.1,1536,'en','This Is My Life','Single mom Dottie Ingels sells cosmetics in a department store while dreaming of becoming a comedian. After she inherits some money, she decides to move to New York with her children Erica and Opal in order to begin a stand-up career in small bars. Dottie soon rises to stardom, but while she travels all over the USA, her daughters stay home lonely.','/5cAUlDEAjHCx9Tr1VH8iUro4VXv.jpg','1992-02-21',95,'Released','It\'s 10pm. Do you know where your mother is?','This Is My Life',41776,2.3995,6,'GYP5htFBgyo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11769,_binary '\0','/ezqMGAZNg1y2b3TPU9jWKUL8rKM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105585',6.8,19588,'en','Thunderheart','A young mixed-blood FBI agent is assigned to work with a cynical veteran investigator on a murder on a poverty-stricken Sioux reservation.','/uGbVd9gzRHk70E8WQPZcjiv6ZLk.jpg','1992-04-03',119,'Released','Two men from different worlds. Two cops after the same killer. Together they must uncover the secrets. Together they must discover the truth.','Thunderheart',12395,5.0188,6.4,'dJp5pxFG6Sg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11770,_binary '\0','/gEkX6dB2KRBZuc6ZIu8hkcdeWG1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105592',5.5,1518,'en','Tiger Claws','A mysterious martial artist is killing martial arts masters with his unique style, Tiger Claw. Two police detectives, who are also martial arts experts, use unorthodox methods to track down the serial killer.','/A6xwAfDrNvUXRVXtuqiLMhnBTmq.jpg','1991-08-30',92,'Released','The city is being torn apart and only two cops can stop the frenzy','Tiger Claws',66006,1.7537,6,'_FGy-3fyD9k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11771,_binary '\0','/szApENCnw9EwTviN6FKX40pjnkp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105597',5.4,2426,'en','Timebomb','When someone tries to murder watchmaker Eddy Kay, the incident triggers a barrage of nightmares and flashbacks into a past that isn\'t his own. Fearing for his sanity, Eddy contacts psychiatrist Dr. Anna Nolmar for help. Anna thinks he\'s hallucinating until another attack proves the dangers are all too real. The two of them go on the run, trying to discover the truth about Eddie\'s past and true identity before it kills them.','/ztApTo1ZBqwuDR9ovLo5qrwhKKL.jpg','1991-05-25',96,'Released','Eddy Kay was trained to kill, ordered to destroy, programmed to forget. Now, the most dangerous man alive is about to explode.','Timebomb',44192,3.0624,5.2,'4pPSx62lZcM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11772,_binary '\0','/mQi6o11rJb3OZt3x14PzpIT8Ik2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105599',6.9,2437,'hi','तिरंगा','After having witnessed the gruesome murder of his father, Harish\'s plans for revenge go for a toss when he is framed by the same mafia boss who killed his father.','/zA8lbSRKUpmCcHmD4WE8SUloTKa.jpg','1993-01-29',168,'Released',NULL,'Tirangaa',272662,0.977,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11773,_binary '\0','/c09Fpu5GrPJwlhoc2KeTtigmqFM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105602',7.9,6551,'sr','Тито и ја','At his school, 10-year-old Zoran wins the competition for the best essay about Tito. His reward is participation in the march \"Revolutionary trails\" to Tito\'s hometown of Kumrovec.','/hLekdPVjTjqbkauVR8DXDgixrw4.jpg','1992-03-02',104,'Released',NULL,'Tito and Me',41777,1.4454,6.953,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11774,_binary '\0','/ncgrBBIZ4iOk6taPAutU9pqeyLj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105606',5.7,3213,'en','To Grandmother\'s House We Go','When precocious twins Sarah and Julie feel like Mom is tired of them, they take off on an exciting adventure to their grandmother\'s house and encounter a pair of villains along the way.','/muzQuNYEQfZEPIN7G5shtKKT3fP.jpg','1992-12-06',89,'Released',NULL,'To Grandmother\'s House We Go',50327,2.3435,6.5,'8Na0hOYk5hM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11775,_binary '\0','/uDdt2h4Q1jZikmYphHRerKtjMgF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105616',5.5,13426,'en','Tom and Jerry: The Movie','The popular cartoon cat and mouse are thrown into a feature film. The story has the twosome trying to help an orphan girl who is being berated and exploited by a greedy guardian.','/k68ZB5trRKcEJSQdPiY6jtxVq14.jpg','1992-10-01',83,'Released','The world\'s most famous cat and mouse in their first motion picture.','Tom and Jerry: The Movie',22582,7.454,6.3,'WBYdp2sOut0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11776,_binary '\0','/2eA6zc0rk4AiWuEFKRni4sW1OqO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105619',6.6,5395,'cn','東方三俠','While one tough woman with an invisible robe has stolen 18 babies for her powerful master, two other tough women and the cops try to stop her.','/ilYFTXzy04qP5rZoQtWfz5JYH9a.jpg','1993-02-12',88,'Released','Each holds a secret power... together they face the ultimate evil!','The Heroic Trio',43636,2.6677,6.7,'6u2lyRQIByY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11777,_binary '\0','/yetPav6Lpo30pl8RE5jaXFCgsIa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105622',5.9,4016,'ja','トパーズ','A submissive hooker goes about her trade, suffering abuse at the hands of Japanese salarymen and Yakuza types. She\'s unhappy about her work, and is apparently trying to find some sort of appeasement for the fact that her lover has married.','/ya3HsnwavmtQYMxnGS5T5RV6do0.jpg','1992-01-06',113,'Released','Erotic sex or dangerous fantasy?','Tokyo Decadence',15802,8.408,6,'UPqHQclvEns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11778,_binary '\0','/94lkfilyPNfvhqlELWV9CHdfvaH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105629',5.2,35630,'en','Toys','Leslie Zevo is a fun-loving inventor who must save his late father\'s toy factory from his evil uncle, Leland, a war-mongering general who rules the operation with an iron fist and builds weapons disguised as toys.','/l0YBVvOvOxoOkggTZ70tNGvGQo4.jpg','1992-12-18',122,'Released','Laughter is a state of mind.','Toys',11597,4.4648,5.3,'d_vxkIm9z8k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11779,_binary '\0','/oZWJAHTYzM5sRNptmZXyIffzK6h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105631',5.3,2100,'en','Traces of Red','Jack, a Palm Beach detective, becomes involved in a case of multiple murders. All the women can be linked to Jack in some way. Jack and his partner have no leads, but numerous suspects. The murders continue, along with anonymous letters from the killer.','/eeUiN0UtokcGjzEDkou4rhmQVFi.jpg','1992-11-13',105,'Released','No one is beyond suspicion.','Traces of Red',103299,1.7553,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11780,_binary '\0','/9eYY8elmuv69MOVTeZFPibeJELO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105636',6.3,13834,'en','Trespass','Two Arkansas firemen, Vince and Don, get hold of a map that leads to a cache of stolen gold in an abandoned factory in East St. Louis. What they don\'t know is that the factory is on the turf of a local gang, who come by to execute one of their enemies. Vince sees the shooting, the gang spots Vince, and extended mayhem ensues. As Vince and Don try to escape, gang leader King James argues with his subordinate Savon about how to get rid of the trespassers.','/GSeicpK571uoM2ZCRb1YyW2YMG.jpg','1992-12-25',101,'Released','They all came to the wrong place at the wrong time.','Trespass',22004,3.3021,6.3,'3KZbRGE7-4c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11781,_binary '\0','/iGSkacZfUs3eJyg78XxKjT99Hfw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105643',3,36680,'en','Troll 2','When young Joshua learns that he will be going on vacation with his family to a small town called Nilbog, he protests adamantly. He is warned by the spirit of his deceased grandfather that goblins populate the town. His parents, Michael and Diana, dismiss his apprehensions, but soon learn to appreciate their son\'s warnings. Guided by his grandfather\'s ghost, will Joshua and his family stand a chance in fighting off these evil beings?','/eFth6zw4PEInzr2Y64mYVN1zbBi.jpg','1990-10-12',95,'Released','The Original Boogeyman is Back.','Troll 2',26914,2.314,3.9,'2p1Fu5lvrc4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11782,_binary '\0','/2rRyAY9IbykdzkYZULoWCInw5j3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105652',7.2,5376,'zh','推手','Mr. Chu is an elderly widower who teaches tai chi chuan in Beijing. He moves to America to live with his son\'s family, but finds the cultural adjustment difficult. Since his daughter-in-law is a white woman who does not speak Chinese, Mr. Chu\'s son, Alex, must mediate.','/2z7QvDFDYnjd7nQhAfMW1zDihXd.jpg','1991-12-07',105,'Released',NULL,'Pushing Hands',25296,1.9877,7.3,'CLyFaipchmk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11783,_binary '\0','/ju8NwbN3O2JK0fcOOcGNaWAROaj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105654',6.9,1233,'en','The Tune','Del is a song writer for the obnoxious Mr. Mega, and in love with Didi, Mega\'s secretary. His quest to write a hit tune brings him to the wacky world of Flooby Nooby, where he just might learn to write songs from the heart.','/4pheWWXiVMQ4zK6O9mm4YnSwZ6S.jpg','1992-09-04',70,'Released','An Outrageous Animated Comedy Extravaganza','The Tune',41313,0.9828,6.6,'BAKWjBcVdxg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11784,_binary '\0','/be6RLSXCDx5psbhFPlqoS2lR2rM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105655',6.1,1871,'cn','東方不敗之風雲再起','A royal official accompanies a Portuguese warship to the Black Cliffs to see the site of the defeat of the evil Invincible Asia, who attained supernatural abilities by following the sacred scroll and castrating himself.','/4hWOc6GfQWTwdDrTmVOJNIu7YEe.jpg','1993-08-04',93,'Released',NULL,'Swordsman III: The East Is Red',18667,2.9762,6.1,'gP1Lq3529ZA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11785,_binary '\0','/amGU1FpELmenVvNmPShW58Orepy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105665',7.3,119963,'en','Twin Peaks: Fire Walk with Me','In the questionable town of Deer Meadow, Washington, FBI Agent Desmond inexplicably disappears while hunting for the man who murdered a teen girl. The killer is never apprehended, and, after experiencing dark visions and supernatural encounters, Agent Dale Cooper chillingly predicts that the culprit will claim another life. Meanwhile, in the more cozy town of Twin Peaks, hedonistic beauty Laura Palmer hangs with lowlifes and seems destined for a grisly fate.','/mxsGXqetGnirf99qapYd5MMY1VL.jpg','1992-06-03',135,'Released','In a town like Twin Peaks, no one is innocent.','Twin Peaks: Fire Walk with Me',1923,11.2624,7.4,'vCUxM9UZrd0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11786,_binary '\0','/rWkuu1S6oAE6OPA1KtwdXP61NFL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105682',7.5,11673,'fr','Un cœur en hiver','Beautiful violin virtuoso Camille has two obsessions: the music of Ravel, and a friend of her husband\'s who crafts violins. But his heart seems to be as cold as her playing is passionate.','/nwYKkV2SbrAfZEFOfafnPYZiFr1.jpg','1992-09-02',105,'Released',NULL,'A Heart in Winter',48150,3.3592,7.274,'FAf78uKN1Hs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11787,_binary '\0','/ihBDaN7OwT7D9DVri8SmxCnuRLB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105690',6.5,104006,'en','Under Siege','A disgruntled ex-CIA operative, his assistant and their assembled group of terrorists seize a battleship with nuclear blackmail in mind. They\'ve planned for every contingency but ignore the ship\'s cook, former Navy SEAL Casey Ryback—an error that could be fatal.','/7tzVzgGKhLsQoiyDh2tiGcPeTpH.jpg','1992-10-08',102,'Released','In 1992 a battleship\'s been sabotaged by nuclear pirates out to steal its warheads. Now, surrounded by terrorists, a lone man stands with a deadly plan of attack.','Under Siege',8845,11.3896,6.306,'PlESsppIcWc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11788,_binary '\0','/dgoFyczFZjnmUh3lmUHhkpauXa1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105691',6.4,5743,'en','Under Suspicion','In the late 1950s, British police officer Tony Aaron resigns from the force after sleeping with Hazel, wife of the man whose house he was supposed to guard. In his new job as a fake private investigator, he helps couples get divorces by photographing Hazel having \"affairs\" with the husband. When she is murdered during a job, Tony begins having an affair with the dead man\'s mistress, Angeline, while trying to prove his innocence.','/wnAcBVWvcQzHQEqS8SXXX3YyHbA.jpg','1991-09-27',99,'Released','How close can you get to a killer before you\'re too close?','Under Suspicion',26850,13.328,6,'xueKP_Pn9yU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11789,_binary '\0','/rvRGFevvZK48onX0PYI1eQLbuJd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105695',8.2,472802,'en','Unforgiven','William Munny is a retired, once-ruthless killer turned gentle widower and hog farmer. To help support his two motherless children, he accepts one last bounty-hunter mission to find the men who brutalized a prostitute. Joined by his former partner and a cocky greenhorn, he takes on a corrupt sheriff.','/54roTwbX9fltg85zjsmrooXAs12.jpg','1992-08-07',130,'Released','Some legends will never be forgotten. Some wrongs can never be forgiven.','Unforgiven',33,13.8283,7.915,'amE57OniG9Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11790,_binary '\0','/505LZxTJd2o7BqpispO427M9bPI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105698',6.1,102724,'en','Universal Soldier','An American soldier who had been killed during the Vietnam War is revived 25 years later by the military as a semi-android, UniSols, a high-tech soldier of the future. After the failure of the initiative to erase all the soldier\'s memories, he begins to experience flashbacks that are forcing him to recall his past.','/fp0mWrHl1SW9PhP8QcsgYPoVYFc.jpg','1992-07-10',103,'Released','Almost human. Almost perfect. Almost under control.','Universal Soldier',9349,11.3001,6.35,'EhXJHHzphdM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11791,_binary '\0','/osgn0gVcr2wU8N9x5VwERuX89qq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105699',6.4,22498,'en','Unlawful Entry','When Michael and Karen Carr’s home is robbed, the couple strike up a friendship with duty officer Pete Davis. But the disturbed cop develops an intense fixation on Karen, and his idea of friendship soon turns into a dangerous obsession, making him the Carrs’ worst nightmare.','/qt1pESASA3w4xOOPwZS3YRlcYhL.jpg','1992-06-26',112,'Released','A man obsessed will do anything for love... A cop obsessed can get away with it.','Unlawful Entry',17494,5.3599,6.3,'I0_Z4lh-Rus','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11792,_binary '\0','/mrumfehWdmPSslEO58yE2VEWIZj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105706',6.2,2210,'en','Used People','At her husband\'s funeral, Pearl, Jewish mother of two divorced and antagonistic daughters, meets an old Italian friend of her husband, whose advice years previously had stopped the husband leaving home. For 23 years he, now a widower, has secretly loved Pearl.','/8h5tBiUXTHQyBBB5bdRVzbOrDtE.jpg','1992-12-16',115,'Released','A story about love, family and other embarrassments.','Used People',41779,2.3282,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11793,_binary '\0','/5cfA1lIyHg8o7Js8l7ChHcWcu1W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105719',5.8,2481,'en','The Vagrant','A business man buys a house, but he has a hard time trying to get rid of its previous tenant, a dirty bum.','/8XTaMcU4WxafaIxT6HvfYHL8KTP.jpg','1992-05-15',91,'Released','He\'s not home alone.','The Vagrant',186869,2.2284,5.9,'GkLrWFyiETg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11794,_binary '\0','/F9yotopY4t5P9DBvY28iTIO6hl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105750',7.5,7343,'fr','La Vie de Bohème','Three penniless artists become friends in modern-day Paris: Rodolfo, an Albanian painter with no visa, Marcel, a playwright and magazine editor with no publisher, and Schaunard, a post-modernist composer of execrable noise.','/wBd8ZCQY3uW1dDLIzXwAmHsvB5B.jpg','1992-02-27',103,'Released',NULL,'La Vie de Bohème',28212,2.5978,7.535,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11795,_binary '\0','/8Jns5hMUpTtYcNLrwTSvVuVOHFg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105764',7.7,3448,'en','Visions of Light','Cameramen and women discuss the craft and art of cinematography and of the \"DP\" (the director of photography), illustrating their points with clips from 100 films, from Birth of a Nation to Do the Right Thing. Themes: the DP tells people where to look; changes in movies (the arrival of sound, color, and wide screens) required creative responses from DPs; and, these artisans constantly invent new equipment and try new things, with wonderful results. The narration takes us through the identifiable studio styles of the 30s, the emergence of noir, the New York look, and the impact of Europeans. Citizen Kane, The Conformist, and Gordon Willis get special attention.','/62ry0lNv4gQRuusC1EkUkOmTuUY.jpg','1992-09-17',92,'Released','The Art of Cinematography','Visions of Light',41778,1.3886,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11796,_binary '\0','/5WIQCtc5FqQ62ohB8rnSEG9Du7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105789',6.8,3113,'en','The Waterdance','Author Joel Garcia breaks his neck while hiking, and finds himself in a rehab center with Raymond, an exaggerating ladies man, and Bloss, a racist biker. Considerable tension builds as each character tries to deal with his new found handicap and the problems that go with it, especially Joel, whose lover Anna is having as difficult a time as he is.','/6fLc2xBZ3lK6AToG7iO1v1UAeqJ.jpg','1992-05-13',106,'Released','Sometimes, life happens by accident.','The Waterdance',61418,2.3397,6,'SZL7L26F66Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11797,_binary '\0','/4ReS6RokSL0vO3Oa55ZMttsxKk4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105790',6.6,2653,'en','Waterland','The story of a mentally anguished high school history teacher going through a complete reassessment of his life. His method for reassessing his life is to narrate it to his class and interweave in it three generations of his family\'s history.','/4zduHkpRTyFI2RrxLUAdk0SAsLr.jpg','1992-08-21',95,'Released',NULL,'Waterland',145066,2.5402,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11798,_binary '\0','/3K5f069NukXn209osdL9RdRnTL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105792',5.4,5467,'en','Waxwork II: Lost in Time','The survivors of the first Waxwork must use a portal through time to defeat the evil that has followed them and turned their lives upside down.','/dT2V9pZNVGOpzH17LJKg62wl3Pc.jpg','1992-05-11',104,'Released','A killer is waiting... in the past, present and future.','Waxwork II: Lost in Time',28762,2.4412,5,'y3D7kvdL6ds','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11799,_binary '\0','/lAvf5zzyOgTZmpRBRJFa7IVVqCK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105793',7,183739,'en','Wayne\'s World','The adventures of two amiably aimless metal-head friends, Wayne and Garth. From Wayne\'s basement, the pair broadcast a talk-show called \"Wayne\'s World\" on local public access television. The show comes to the attention of a sleazy network executive who wants to produce a big-budget version of \"Wayne\'s World\"—and he also wants Wayne\'s girlfriend, a rock singer named Cassandra. Wayne and Garth have to battle the executive not only to save their show, but also Cassandra.','/fHwZnFNWR7PaS9t5EBwTvGPeoYQ.jpg','1992-02-14',94,'Released','You\'ll laugh. You\'ll cry. You\'ll hurl.','Wayne\'s World',8872,8.1119,6.681,'eBzr2UDK4DM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11800,_binary '\0','/73E34ld2wYZ1BmznSLnIHwX3mf0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105807',4.8,1316,'en','When the Party\'s Over','Three women and a gay man in their 20s share a house in Los Angeles; try to find love and happiness - often at the expense of their well-being and friendships. Artist Amanda is trying to make it on the gallery scene, while aspiring actor Banks attempts to hit it big in Hollywood. Meanwhile, Frankie has an emotionally draining yet rewarding job as a social worker, but would be shattered to know that her roommate M.J. is sleeping with her boyfriend.','/xQf4udmAXaKklmnj6EkbeIkKdtu.jpg','1993-03-12',110,'Released',NULL,'When the Party\'s Over',102408,2.4254,4.9,'_RVJlGyx0Xs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11801,_binary '\0','/wsm8giuQPeri3zRgmeVJxFPSlAM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105810',6.5,4184,'en','Where the Day Takes You','King is a young man, but he\'s already a veteran of life on the streets of Los Angeles. The de facto leader of a group of teenage runaways, King acts as a mentor to troubled kids such as gay hustler Little J and junkie Greg. When Heather, a beautiful girl from Chicago, starts hanging out with King and his crew, it changes the dynamic of the gang. However, it seems as though nothing will alter their dangerous lifestyle.','/6W7pwB1o601kN8zySjHNz5X3QDK.jpg','1992-09-11',104,'Released','No parents. No rules.','Where the Day Takes You',17736,3.0182,6.1,'jUKs4kqiDQA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11802,_binary '\0','/x2PAgEyN2Yz32HbHsMP6LI4uZjk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105811',5.6,2610,'en','Whispers in the Dark','Psychiatrist Ann Hecker is ending one relationship and possibly starting an important new one, while finding that some of the sexual exploits her patients relate are weighing on her. Turning to a married friend from her research days for guidance, she finds his help increasingly important when a female patient is murdered and it turns out that her new boyfriend was also seeing the dead woman.','/c7n1fZuUMeEVspvzOrIUCz4XdCe.jpg','1992-08-06',103,'Released','Deception. Betrayal. Seduction. Murder. Her life depends on every word.','Whispers in the Dark',88174,2.2918,5,'6uiK4yxdR8g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11803,_binary '\0','/rqtJyKamFSYm1Z0pLdjgmHbwoi7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105812',6.8,104631,'en','White Men Can\'t Jump','Two street basketball hustlers try to con each other, then team up for a bigger score.','/jnI05Z2Cm9ACEJo8FGen7tdHKLl.jpg','1992-03-27',115,'Released','It ain\'t easy being this good.','White Men Can\'t Jump',10158,6.9506,6.7,'NHRvNAENaxk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11804,_binary '\0','/7qse864BI3rJmhg4I7UNOt14dJc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105813',6,9818,'en','White Sands','A small southwestern town sheriff finds a body in the desert with a suitcase and $500,000. He impersonates the man and stumbles into an FBI investigation.','/jeOkfby3MMawUbZqBj7el4UePno.jpg','1992-04-24',101,'Released','The most dangerous way to solve a murder... become the victim.','White Sands',19380,3.7402,5.88,'XNJH0-LHRuk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11805,_binary '\0','/vXQJ7tDgwVPN0rLMHBPr661Czpc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105819',4,2001,'en','Wild Orchid II: Two Shades of Blue','Blue is a teenage girl who lives with her Jazz playing father Ham. Ham gets very sick and dies, and now Blue must support herself somehow. Elle, the headmistress at a brothel, talks her into living and working at her establishment. She decides to leave the business and lead a normal life. Elle is hellbent to see that she never has one.','/d3r89A0iiRKhLW3SEGFIOnwExUE.jpg','1991-10-31',111,'Released','One love. Two lives. She could sell her body, but not her heart.','Wild Orchid II: Two Shades of Blue',5233,2.5665,5.3,'wC70WDIJi3c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11806,_binary '\0','/cSbcBpduXYQ6XfdoSQaTo23jF1u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105824',6.5,3352,'en','Wind','In 1983, yacht sailor Will Parker leads an American crew financed by millionaire Morgan Weld to defeat during the America\'s Cup race against an Australian crew. Determined to get the prize back, Will convinces Morgan to finance an experimental boat designed by his ex-girlfriend Kate\'s new beau, Joe Heisler. When the boat is completed, the Americans head to Australia to reclaim the cup.','/qj7RAiqrLVp3TCzDnhQlONm9In4.jpg','1992-09-11',126,'Released','The only thing better than winning the America\'s Cup is losing it... and winning it back.','Wind',28881,2.4851,6.2,'ZLgLcgvnKMQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11807,_binary '\0','/7RUybHnkpqlw30PmBow63VXx7nP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105833',7.1,1844,'en','A Woman Scorned: The Betty Broderick Story','After sixteen years of marriage and four children, Betty Broderick\'s high-powered attorney husband decides to leave her for a younger woman with whom he\'s been having an affair. Hurt by his betrayal and feeling helpless against his legal expertise, Betty begins a campaign of vandalism and verbal assault. Her rage consumes her and ultimately leads to a terrible and violent act.','/fbgeFS8gsZuEUrGJIaBzO9bCZHZ.jpg','1992-03-01',96,'Released',NULL,'A Woman Scorned: The Betty Broderick Story',176000,1.9501,5.9,'tLmFZO8jfKI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11808,_binary '\0','/zrSmI2wP2WIkWrgfP7IDSY1F9fW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105839',7.3,11527,'cn','黃飛鴻之二：男兒當自強','Wong Fei-Hung faces the White Lotus Society, a fanatical cult seeking to drive the Europeans out of China through violence, even attacking Chinese who follow Western ways. Wong must also defend revolutionary Dr. Sun Yat Sen from the military.','/jvrQXnpgSpKXQ3fkz5p6RV8jZJa.jpg','1992-04-16',113,'Released',NULL,'Once Upon a Time in China II',10618,4.8524,7.2,'uvSfl3NaLos','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11809,_binary '\0','/qJv0lg1Pyk5S1TkcRG5fZZV8dkd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105851',7.1,5444,'cn','俠盜高飛','In an effort to get his buddy out of a gambling debt, Jeff agrees to join forces with Judge in a weapons heist. The job goes bad and Judge betrays Jeff. Jeff plots the ultimate revenge on Judge and his followers and it is a question of whether he can follow through with his plan.','/qbSgjlhn9x2GVcNrYWhCsJjzvSV.jpg','1992-07-23',98,'Released','Betrayed. Double-Crossed. Left for Dead.','Full Contact',27073,3.1674,6.805,'1jTmkANCi7g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11810,_binary '\0','/kQBEHIcFrUPIudjIlsULhglRQzc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105859',7.2,5324,'cn','新龍門客棧','During the Ming Dynasty, power-crazed eunuch Tso Siu Yan rules his desert region of China as if he were Emperor, ruthlessly thwarts plots against him and sets a trap for one of his enemies at the Dragon Gate Inn.','/jCkdnfVu08gM87KcbEOURyymAtT.jpg','1992-08-22',104,'Released','In the desert, only the strong survive.','New Dragon Gate Inn',40213,3.3238,7.4,'KUKXPlZRusE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11811,_binary '\0','/hN7mhItA8QNyWYZPtF67tdQJqoP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105869',5.7,1298,'cn','妖獸都市','A peace treaty between the Earth and the Black World, a parallel universe of demons, is coming to an end. Two cops, Taki, a human male, and Maki, a female demon, are assigned to protect a diplomat who will help secure another treaty. A radical group of demons from the Black World are out to assassinate the diplomat and prevent the treaty; only the bond that forms between the two cops can save the Earth from destruction.','/560uq9mziscCktjYGYBc24q9z44.jpg','1992-11-20',91,'Released',NULL,'Wicked City',69011,3.1553,5.8,'m7Uo99wJ9gA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11812,_binary '\0','/nArrefj0yMMk9OlC1U8PIU9niHi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105871',5.9,1978,'en','Year of the Comet','An auctioneer\'s daughter and a rich buyer\'s emissary fall for each other while trying to keep a rare wine out of the hands of evil doers.','/qZSn3HyI5B2jQnoPQPYxCkAgbMm.jpg','1992-04-24',91,'Released','A comedy about romance and other perilous adventures.','Year of the Comet',44941,2.4157,5.7,'x-aVjim_g3I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11813,_binary '\0','/9wiThrCLnq8OQB9dLEHjmsQ1IFk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105884',6.8,1313,'nl','Het Zakmes','Accidentally still in possession of his best friend\'s pocket knife after they move all the way to a different city, a young boy sets out to return it.','/1RaFJ3DdIv3uJKMvOTq8PjnkusO.jpg','1992-10-15',90,'Released',NULL,'The Penknife',48449,1.2562,6.341,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11814,_binary '\0','/xoXioy0KWBbHAH8keeCVlGOe77d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105885',6.3,1562,'en','Zebrahead','A white, hip-hop loving teen falls in love with a black girl in Detroit.','/yM5faEnpRmYHGyMerTY1GZUErUy.jpg','1992-10-23',102,'Released',NULL,'Zebrahead',70489,1.3284,5.7,'7y3k6KjU4Sk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11815,_binary '\0','/1UpTTMg5l7KQPRdveydtP2EBv8D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105888',7.8,9399,'fa','زندگی و دیگر هیچ','After the earthquake of Guilan, a film director and his son travel to the devastated area to search for the actors from the movie the director made there a few years previously. In their search, they see how people who have lost everything in the earthquake still have hope and try to live life to the fullest.','/100CuZjqxtcbDvZ5qPsoi1VEU5n.jpg','1992-10-21',95,'Released','The Earth moved, we didn\'t!','Life, and Nothing More…',83761,2.6385,7.716,'66gdMLbiS8Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11816,_binary '\0','/vQRCSCSCKdFW3C6H4Sk75fkMpy5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0105916',6.4,5844,'sv','Änglagård','In a small village in Västergötland, everything is turned upside-down when the local loner dies and his cottage is inherited by his unknown relative Fanny. She rides into town on a big black motorcycle with her androgynous boyfriend Zack, wearing black leather and spikes. When they decide to stay, Flogfält\'s plans to buy the cottage are upset.','/zKHeZrgRuMso9MWvqBQlNYSHTka.jpg','1992-02-21',127,'Released',NULL,'House of Angels',34683,2.0508,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11817,_binary '\0','/rEqGOI5E54coPSgS2OX53vQEO6d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106185',5.6,1824,'en','The Innocent','A young engineer is sent to post-WWII Berlin to help the Americans in spying on the Russians. In a time and place where discretion is still a man’s best friend, he falls in love with a mysterious woman who will take him on the dark side of evil.','/inQUT1SxTrAMzjE3zqpVU3qdsoq.jpg','1993-09-16',119,'Released',NULL,'The Innocent',91390,2.6089,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11818,_binary '\0','/jZBJfWHHGw9kbRQs2hnY1n1bQpm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106188',6.7,5953,'en','12:01','Office employee Barry Thomas is caught in a \"time bounce\" caused by a glitch in the company\'s secret project. Now the same day occurs again and again - and Barry\'s the only one who can do anything about it, including saving the life of beautiful research assistant Lisa Fredericks.','/xK3d7mT6D7v2y8jp5Kv7c9FXzen.jpg','1993-12-16',92,'Released','Every day at a minute past midnight the sci-fi adventure begins... again.','12:01',17803,2.4765,6.3,'GXIyafi6qbw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11819,_binary '\0','/xLaGDBuiWgZ9grp69NbVISEDsXn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106204',6.8,2637,'hi','Aankhen','Two good-for-nothing brothers are embroiled in a conspiracy involving a political assassination and try their best to save the country.','/zuLd519jDNN4kXOd3m6IIMslXK3.jpg','1993-09-09',170,'Released',NULL,'Aankhen',96147,1.104,6.1,'du3mzofHEdA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11820,_binary '\0','/n7jIsZoAjY69DCs0BmZBEaEzg5R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106215',6.4,6369,'es','Acción mutante','Waging war against all things glamorous and beautiful, crippled terrorists Acción Mutante plot a series of attacks on society\'s elite, and attempt the kidnapping of a wealthy socialite at her elaborate wedding reception.','/dVbouY3L2iVr0qfOlbxuUQH7yA1.jpg','1993-02-03',93,'Released',NULL,'Mutant Action',25466,1.794,6.271,'jMZA9a_jx3Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11821,_binary '\0','/n19B6DyQ5LRUmdmFLkn6g9hlPqy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106218',6.7,1478,'nl','Ad fundum','Sammy Raes, a nice, naive law-freshman from a simple family, dies in a form of hazing known as the \'flying carpet\'. The father of the arrogant fraternity president Guy Bogaerts who ordered this reckless procedure abuses his connections to prevent a judicial homicide conviction, while the college authorities prefer to avoid a scandal in the press. However Sammy\'s freshmen friends Tom Smits and Denn','/hopnC2X7eF9PuozZUBaKLijOlra.jpg','1993-10-06',98,'Released','wanting to belong can cost your life','Ad Fundum',24524,1.4949,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11822,_binary '\0','/sZhTfYouKM1iV3rVbgIVEQFQogA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106220',6.9,124690,'en','Addams Family Values','Siblings Wednesday and Pugsley Addams will stop at nothing to get rid of Pubert, the new baby boy adored by parents Gomez and Morticia. Things go from bad to worse when the new \"black widow\" nanny, Debbie Jellinsky, launches her plan to add Fester to her collection of dead husbands.','/sdxT2VjVSx9DRicwnuECUdBHeE7.jpg','1993-11-19',94,'Released','The family just got a little stranger.','Addams Family Values',2758,11.3328,6.988,'BDmIba_BPT4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11823,_binary '\0','/19RoH2VH3IjgUFYc2oUZFJxLQ97.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106223',6.2,9969,'en','The Adventures of Huck Finn','Mischievous Huck Finn is unnerved when his father, reemerging after years away, kidnaps him in an attempt to take away a $600 inheritance from his late mother. Fearing for his life, Huck fakes his own death and escapes. He soon runs into his friend, Jim, a slave fleeing his master. Together, the pair embarks on a raft journey down the Mississippi River, staying ahead of pursuers who blame the slave for Huck\'s alleged murder.','/8VpQZ43hdaTUmkMoe2CnED1Y2fS.jpg','1993-04-02',108,'Released','For anyone who has ever dreamed of running away from it all','The Adventures of Huck Finn',34723,3.817,6.2,'cS9-HeIUa-M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11824,_binary '\0','/jha4hsGYlxPSsZC2AL35PJNW3o5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106226',7.2,75697,'en','The Age of Innocence','In 19th century New York high society, a young lawyer falls in love with a woman separated from her husband, while he is engaged to the woman\'s cousin.','/5Tuyt26v7qNR8Cl3m7ZRx36rduf.jpg','1993-09-10',138,'Released','In a world of tradition. In an age of innocence. They dared to break the rules.','The Age of Innocence',10436,7.8154,7,'I3Mx8OSlNYM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11825,_binary '\0','/byQFTtskbR9COpluK1p3oImdsBt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106233',6.3,8574,'en','Airborne','Good-natured teen surfer Mitchell Goosen finds himself staying with his aunt and uncle in Cincinnati, Ohio when his parents head to Australia for work. There he meets his cousin, Wiley, and together they try to navigate the perils of high school—avoid the bullies, get the girl, and win a little respect.','/4TPCzvOoQmmParPjgHCiqqiVYIJ.jpg','1993-09-17',91,'Released','Mitchell became the most popular guy on Earth...once he took to the sky!','Airborne',13064,2.9761,6.1,'4oThxQN6xso','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11826,_binary '\0','/qHXdyDBgetOyetVkWGzHYGp7L72.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106246',7.1,69291,'en','Alive','The amazing true story of a Uruguayan rugby team\'s plane that crashed in the middle of the Andes mountains, and their immense will to survive and pull through alive, forced to do anything and everything they could to stay alive on meager rations and through the freezing cold.','/uQACcCZqd7WCTRin9xRIW5gr1bd.jpg','1993-01-15',127,'Released','The triumph of the human spirit.','Alive',7305,6.723,6.893,'C2lFPEp7dbI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11827,_binary '\0','/qjZbqv1piaEyRtzWk2GyWfhD3Cj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106257',3.1,4620,'en','American Ninja 5','When a scientists daughter is kidnapped, American Ninja, attempts to find her, but this time he teams up with a youngster he has trained in the ways of the ninja.','/feLMfivbHHla844jWrVnqgzU0Zh.jpg','1993-04-02',102,'Released','The Magic Power of the Ninja Is About to Reveal Itself...','American Ninja 5',25684,2.3087,4.8,'8WPPpUaA9LA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11828,_binary '\0','/qKiLBPpxQ3aK6kAvn2kU1rlgdv9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106258',5,2363,'en','American Samurai','A martial artist working as a reporter tries to track down his family’s sword passed down by his adopted Japanese father. He soon finds himself fighting for his life in a brutal underground tournament.','/y36XqY64lMEWBJ65ZxrYD2aMMQ3.jpg','1992-12-22',87,'Released',NULL,'American Samurai',36796,1.8635,5.7,'GQmm0BRdlxk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11829,_binary '\0','/lcfI1iBnWTCe3wv56NbGUo8ZLKh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106260',5.3,2432,'tr','Amerikalı','Revenge story in Istanbul. After being sent to prison, Şeref manages to escape and flee to the United States. Over the next twenty years, he works tirelessly and becomes a billionaire. With his vast fortune, he returns to Turkey after twenty years, driven by his longing for his homeland and his former lover. However, time has passed differently in Turkey than it has in America... Will Şeref, who returns to his country and loved ones with curiosity, be able to adapt to this change?','/drj1SHRwaaxedpxJj7TeAZtjrkg.jpg','1993-10-08',87,'Released',NULL,'Amerikalı',54343,1.2036,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11830,_binary '\0','/MPkbcY7CXGXkyNGrqshcF0NYVp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106266',5.7,10477,'en','Amos & Andrew','When Andrew Sterling, a successful black urbanite writer, buys a vacation home on a resort in New England the police mistake him for a burglar. After surrounding his home with armed men, Chief Tolliver realizes his mistake and to avoid the bad publicity offers a thief in his jail, Amos Odell a deal.','/zD2fem9pVsODpUQUgWgoEfdNZyD.jpg','1993-03-05',96,'Released','Misunderstood. Misplaced. Mismatched.','Amos & Andrew',31000,3.7389,5.5,'vemvP58rEWs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11831,_binary '\0','/wwxQCCbvFp1SpBPPUjr6dvaMm4T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106267',5.4,1718,'en','The Amy Fisher Story','The true story of the Long Island teen who shoots and wounds the wife of a man she called her lover.','/v6GBfGEP2625aPq8eqBaUAk6OSa.jpg','1993-01-03',96,'Released',NULL,'The Amy Fisher Story',19754,2.3814,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11832,_binary '\0','/9EjHUb6xNrHUsjxMu16p8KmR7Cy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106273',7.8,11874,'en','And the Band Played On','The story of the discovery of the AIDS epidemic and the political infighting of the scientific community hampering the early fight with it.','/4fyZ6SZaZuerfZWaIp0niFW7Yar.jpg','1993-09-11',140,'Released','Strength. Friendship. Courage. Sometimes that’s all you have.','And the Band Played On',2887,4.1662,6.4,'PaHUzy-A05U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11833,_binary '\0','/eBA3K1Vdh1UuagOu6KMzPrxw7EU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106292',5.6,16352,'en','Another Stakeout','A pair of immature detectives are joined by a pesky assistant district attorney in staking out a lakeside home where an important Mafia trial witness is believed to be heading.','/hBItFUmCrRS1mel0TM69ymBD79k.jpg','1993-07-22',109,'Released','They\'re on the look out for thrills, action and adventure.','Another Stakeout',9409,4.8666,5.4,'DPcFwi6lLm8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11834,_binary '\0','/hIZpvw0bLlzhCJuW4Zi5D0wna4a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106301',6.9,1910,'fr','L\'Arbre, le Maire et la Médiathèque','The socialist mayor of a small village in France dreams of building an arts center but he runs up against some opposition.','/roGLahpgFtg6MYNtgdCXNgEE511.jpg','1993-02-10',110,'Released',NULL,'The Tree, the Mayor and the Mediatheque',134463,1.7821,6.7,'S5zQqQR69R4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11835,_binary '\0','/5y7AvZ7UJ6x5vSaqU4UdPPJNplg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106303',5.1,1224,'en','Arctic Blue','Eric Desmond, a committed environmentalist, is accidentally involved in the transfer of Ben Corbett, a ruthless killer, from an isolated Alaskan village, along a long route, to civilization; but the prisoner is determined to escape at any cost.','/xKOWWvS0aeYpshJoRgMj1SoraXj.jpg','1993-01-01',92,'Released','In Alaska, when the nights get longer… People get crazy.','Arctic Blue',58787,1.9248,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11836,_binary '\0','/vqZwNpJDABRWeN2cRQEh6rsdmcN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106305',7.1,5200,'es','La ardilla roja','Jota\'s suicide attempt is interrupted when a motorcyclist crashes off a bridge. After he rescues her, he decides to invent a life story for her — one of love and shared memories — creating a fragile web of deception that intertwines their fates.','/qKBXVmQeihhC5WYe4sIcYy8a2SL.jpg','1993-04-21',114,'Released','A comedy full of youth, suspense and lies!','The Red Squirrel',2444,1.3894,6.5,'shHYlsbVjsA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11837,_binary '\0','/iJ4XWlsGpZuZOQDTYenn9YqWfR0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106307',7.2,48103,'en','Arizona Dream','Rebellious young Axel Blackmar gets caught up into the family car business when his cousin, Paul, coaxes him to come to Arizona to attend the wedding of their Uncle Leo. As Axel makes the decision to try selling Cadillacs with his family, he meets an eccentric woman named Elaine and her equally quirky stepdaughter, Grace. Their lives become inextricably intertwined through romance, dreams – and death.','/jNhRjc1Q9l6tFo5aHdl8UZJPdKy.jpg','1993-01-06',142,'Released','A rebellious young man. With his own version of the future. And his own fantasy of love.','Arizona Dream',11044,5.3119,7.1,'5xgHBIHUqfc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11838,_binary '\0','/8WIufsaJgm7VWgAc5ALWdJ8v2kB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106308',7.4,212545,'en','Army of Darkness','Ash, a handsome, shotgun-toting, chainsaw-armed department store clerk, is time warped backwards into England\'s Dark Ages, where he romances a beauty and faces legions of the undead.','/xsgTuAtR2zSH8Umg3jWZcZjlDpe.jpg','1992-10-31',89,'Released','Trapped in time. Surrounded by evil. Low on gas.','Army of Darkness',766,14.6448,7.3,'UHZQEtG8xYo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11839,_binary '\0','/khX8E1X1zizbL3gvC5cfaVxCixL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106309',5.7,6858,'en','Joshua Tree','A Los Angeles police detective tracks a fugitive who heads for the desert with a deputy sheriff as hostage.','/kKYMrf2iwyyBYbGYnzPVWV8LXUQ.jpg','1993-04-08',106,'Released','When it comes to getting even, he\'s taking revenge into overdrive.','Joshua Tree',26127,5.3567,6.164,'3vhvUoLAcns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11840,_binary '\0','/emdEruzRaUoTJugJozTjAiQYw6E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106315',6.1,3443,'en','Aspen Extreme','T.J. and his friend Dexter quit their jobs in Detroit to become ski-instructors in Aspen. While T.J. advances to the most popular instructor of the school during the season, he has to take care for Dexter, who\'s future is less bright and who\'s eventually thinking about jobbing as drug courier - bringing their friendship to a test. Meanwhile the rich business woman Brice supports T.J. in his writing ambitions and invites him to live at her home. But in her absence he falls in love with the stunningly beautiful blond radio moderator Robin.','/kbXb9XvMZW6GmLJoFf7gkoLBvUR.jpg','1993-01-22',113,'Released','Skiing\'s the easy part.','Aspen Extreme',16370,1.5341,6,'aMZ0f1hywBg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11841,_binary '\0','/b1lJUrWUfjnR51GwX6GXbTNyOVn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106317',4,3541,'en','Attack of the 50 Ft. Woman','When an abused heiress grows to giant size because of her encounter with aliens, she decides to get revenge on her cheating husband and those who looked down on her.','/xklTXjnDMYKkmWJTe5HlyQ4Mc0T.jpg','1994-09-28',85,'Released','People always called Nancy the little woman... They\'ll never do that again!','Attack of the 50 Ft. Woman',74629,3.0769,4.7,'PCY3EU2zWI4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11842,_binary '\0','/2Ki9TmOG0VsjpryessJ5uOkOD6G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106323',5.1,1425,'en','Auntie Lee\'s Meat Pies','A devil-worshiping woman sends out her four beautiful nieces to lure men back to her place so they can be killed, ground up and sold as meat pies.','/lgpWqRSo8jFEUXHM3nNOhGFCR3x.jpg','1992-10-21',101,'Released','... a real slice of life.','Auntie Lee\'s Meat Pies',29806,2.1665,4.9,'mJ7XGBYhQAU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11843,_binary '\0','/sI4115nDjIL4MZbvqOmOiYu8qxc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106330',7.1,3155,'fa','از کرخه تا راین','Young veteran Saeed, who is suffering from visual problems due to injuries sustained during the Iran-Iraq War, is sent to Germany for treatment and recuperation. Once there, he is reunited with his sister Leyla, who is now married to a German citizen. The siblings struggle to reconnect in a foreign land, while Saeed prepares himself for surgery that could change his life. A tragic exploration of the horrific repercussions of war.','/6slhaA6gJaIXC9BXqnSVakT5RGM.jpg','1993-01-02',92,'Released',NULL,'From Karkhe to Rhein',328063,1.1478,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11844,_binary '\0','/bBiZN1epQTu3F8iFLBuMhc4TRzr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106332',8.1,37710,'zh','霸王别姬','In an epic tale of theater, gender, love and class, two Beijing opera actors navigate political turmoil as their friendship evolves over decades.','/f54hNIiHNINw3JiUJB2XaQl5wCN.jpg','1993-01-01',171,'Released','The passionate triangle of two lifelong friends and the woman who comes between them!','Farewell My Concubine',10997,12.3795,7.9,'FFiHfDBt9lE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11845,_binary '\0','/lPUrfzWb7icGC6X1z0AKnYRtHGu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106333',7.6,32236,'hi','बाज़ीगर','A young man with a vendetta against a business tycoon seduces and kills his eldest daughter and then proceeds to his younger daughter but she begins to suspect her new lover\'s ulterior motive.','/ndQQ2bTV0JLSRxUBchE4eD3qhDb.jpg','1993-11-12',181,'Released',NULL,'Baazigar',19657,2.3324,6.9,'Ip93KcX6H9w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11846,_binary '\0','/iHfVnZrb6w39x1KIcgTGNY7g0l1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106335',6.9,5485,'en','The Baby of Mâcon','In 17th-century Tuscany, a church play is performed for the benefit of young aristocrat Cosimo. In the play, a grotesque old woman gives birth to a beautiful baby boy. The child\'s older sister is quick to exploit the situation, selling blessings from the baby, and even claiming she\'s the true mother by virgin birth. However, when she attempts to seduce the bishop\'s son, the Church exacts a terrible revenge.','/lYB5uF36JE61GMLInD3Gp7yCCyL.jpg','1993-09-17',122,'Released','Exploring thoroughly modern taboos','The Baby of Mâcon',5051,3.1028,6.8,'0hgirnEHhqs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11847,_binary '\0','/qpQDSAOZMjT0RnPnF5I7tfktmO0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106339',6.7,7071,'en','Backbeat','Chronicles the early days of The Beatles in Hamburg, Germany. The film focuses primarily on the relationship between Stuart Sutcliffe, John Lennon, and Sutcliffe\'s girlfriend Astrid Kirchherr.','/1BuFx7P8veAUUZDXqdMNhtdCUSM.jpg','1994-04-01',100,'Released','5 guys. 4 legends. 3 lovers. 2 friends. 1 band.','Backbeat',12635,3.3196,6.1,'5hbfyo8alXg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11848,_binary '\0','/ad6tCgBgKieGjIde9RasliPlCfY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106341',7.3,16284,'en','Bad Boy Bubby','Bubby has spent thirty years trapped in the same small room, tricked by his mother. One day, he manages to escape and, deranged and naive in equal measures, his adventure into a modern and nihilistic life begins.','/fERbcofifizJmDt892lFcrIYhFh.jpg','1993-09-01',114,'Released','All he needs is love.','Bad Boy Bubby',14135,2.7092,6.9,'YXZ4u2ZVWOc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11849,_binary '\0','/kk04VPJIyhFxF7unTjAs13TUlWz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106342',6.8,4142,'cn','白髮魔女傳','The sensitive swordsman Cho Yi-Hang is tired of his life. He is the unwilling successor to the Wu-Tang clan throne and the unsure commander of the clan\'s forces in a war against foreign tribes and an evil cult. One day, he meets the beautiful Lien, a killer for the evil cult who is equally unsatisfied with her situation, but their love angers both the Wu-Tang clan and the evil cult.','/vccyLghE5DylFPqlOKUFuB4TxO6.jpg','1993-08-26',92,'Released',NULL,'The Bride with White Hair',18817,2.8854,6.509,'eHMi6fTOuic','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11850,_binary '\0','/6yBU9zX1d3o35JwSmibl7PUksZw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106343',5.8,1255,'cn','白髮魔女2','For ten years, Cho has been in the snow of Mount Shin Fung waiting for a rare flower to blossom that will cure his wife who, back in Chung Yuan, is slowly killing all of the members of the Eight Big Clans. Something Cho did to her early in their marriage has turned her hair white and driven her mad. Cho\'s nephew, Kit, marries Lyre; they are deeply in love. On their wedding night, Ni-Chang, the bride with white hair, kidnaps Lyre and takes her to her harem of fighting women to indoctrinate her against Kit. Kit tries to lead a rescue party, but they are up against formidable opponents. Can Cho come in time with the blossom to soften Ni-Chang\'s heart?','/pFfxAufiZtZBOiSCi0oRmbnDSpD.jpg','1993-12-22',80,'Released',NULL,'The Bride with White Hair 2',25384,1.9954,5.8,'hXpRVmwazxU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11851,_binary '\0','/pxqbPF4juX2t2V0wVa2seBETO2j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106350',6.7,1957,'en','The Ballad of Little Jo','After being thrown out of her home, a young woman decides to disguise herself as a man to survive the ruthless Wild West.','/cFGLQ3NigGdDmJy2Wjhcp9nmHe4.jpg','1993-08-20',121,'Released','In the Wild West, a woman had only two choices. She could be a wife or she could be a whore... Josephine Monaghan chose to be a man.','The Ballad of Little Jo',71940,2.305,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11852,_binary '\0','/nGnj5jPyulLzD7Nm9Gsw4ROiYFc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106356',7.2,3741,'en','Barbarians at the Gate','F. Ross Johnson decides to buyout his own tobacco firm RJR Nabisco after the plans of the launch of his new product, a smokeless cigarette Premier, fail on account of market rumours.','/v8StvvS5thbpsidFFPUth6vMziS.jpg','1993-03-20',107,'Released',NULL,'Barbarians at the Gate',27678,2.7069,6.9,'F3DWpuISBas','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11853,_binary '\0','/cMUuAgVsMWOCawXonZ4D1dSMd6h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106364',7.8,64946,'en','Batman: Mask of the Phantasm','Andrea Beaumont leaves her father to return to Gotham, rekindling an old romance with Bruce Wayne. At the same time, a mysterious figure begins to hunt down Gotham\'s criminals, wrongly implicating Batman in the murders. Now on the run from the law, Batman must find and stop the culprit, while also navigating his relationship with Andrea.','/hT4ehUteagUrhUOHAtmYiY7mp5l.jpg','1993-12-25',76,'Released','The Dark Knight fights to save Gotham city from its deadliest enemy.','Batman: Mask of the Phantasm',14919,9.4787,7.5,'4PK5CYZlHMA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11854,_binary '\0','/dMvUK3bfcOxdekknbYszEWYE6uY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106366',3.7,1444,'en','Beach Babes from Beyond','When smokeshow space teens Xena, Sola, and Luna steal Xena\'s dad\'s spaceship for an illicit joyride, they run out of gas and come crashing to Earth. There, they meet Dave and Jerry, two equally horny Earth dudes who are good to go. But when Dave\'s easygoing Uncle Bud is targeted for eviction from his ramshackle beach house, the hormonal honeys must put their libidos aside and enter a bikini contest, the prize money of which will save the day.','/v5TXbzoPvjsU1JAM8mS7E0gMJro.jpg','1993-12-16',75,'Released','They Boldly Go Where No Woman Has Dared Go Before!','Beach Babes from Beyond',29795,2.3611,4,'QgMmVRE3s-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11855,_binary '\0','/wN5EnpDUmrusp73qD0fZsOXtqVh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106375',5,31806,'en','Beethoven\'s 2nd','Beethoven is back -- and this time, he has a whole brood with him now that he\'s met his canine match, Missy, and fathered a family. The only problem is that Missy\'s owner, Regina, wants to sell the puppies and tear the clan apart. It\'s up to Beethoven and the Newton kids to save the day and keep everyone together.','/biH5hW1BRfEr13oCizuAzpdBf2l.jpg','1993-12-14',89,'Released','The Newton Family is going to the dogs...','Beethoven\'s 2nd',10438,6.2394,5.572,'gU85o4t0xwM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11856,_binary '\0','/sEG0GBeOfP4abiIT3CoL1LKo4gm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106379',5.3,4456,'en','Being Human','One man must learn the meaning of courage across four lifetimes centuries apart.','/1OJilNyyJPH3es0HZzebJjuPJua.jpg','1994-05-06',122,'Released','For Hector, history has a way of repeating itself.','Being Human',46924,2.3778,5.1,'7eaxL9j7cWQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11857,_binary '\0','/jLhPalsB7IqpLbiFMI3eRIg63Rx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106384',7.3,1260,'de','Glocken aus der Tiefe','A group of pilgrims lie down on the thin ice of the lake Svetloyar and begin to look for the city of Kitesh. According to the legend, God saved the city from the Mongolian prince Batyi\'s soldiers by letting it sink to the bottom of the lake. If you listen carefully you can hear the bells of the Kitesh cathedral toll deep down.','/yQiPcF0usfStfHSCnWOpXSQ5luZ.jpg','1993-09-07',60,'Released','Faith and superstition in Russia','Bells from the Deep',102691,1.3629,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11858,_binary '\0','/yTbwPaqmoxtQtTnJsqgAdnK7zp4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106387',7.1,65838,'en','Benny & Joon','A mentally ill young woman finds love with an eccentric man who models himself after Buster Keaton.','/iX4xSwwLk4ypTiwFnfx0TSctsJV.jpg','1993-04-16',98,'Released','A romance on the brink of reality.','Benny & Joon',4104,4.993,7.031,'oPjBb1qeiK4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11859,_binary '\0','/fgFFPXHeuUWEONzQ85hb34DWhJt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106389',5.5,1602,'tr','Berlin in Berlin','A young German engineer photographs a beautiful Turkish woman without her permission. Her husband finds out and starts a fight. In the midst of the argument the German engineer accidentally kills the husband.','/dokL3fOZTZlSlukt5J4tPYeaEK1.jpg','1993-01-02',99,'Released',NULL,'Berlin in Berlin',329166,0.905,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11860,_binary '\0','/z439MV4UMYubDX0MMo6yfdhadsK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106393',5.6,7045,'en','Best of the Best 2','In an underground fight club, blackbelt Travis Brickley is killed after losing to the evil martial arts master Brakus. Travis\' death is witnessed by Walter Grady, the son of his best friend Alex Grady. Alex and his partner, Tommy Lee, vow to avenge their friend\'s death by defeating Brakus and shutting down the fight club.','/vCVKYnyZKmd2nSwfQhPHSeNbwFF.jpg','1993-03-05',101,'Released','Get ready for the ultimate challenge!','Best of the Best 2',32049,4.2304,5.995,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11861,_binary '\0','/jogunsbDpMehAPdeLdt6puRJAwB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106400',5.1,21489,'en','The Beverly Hillbillies','Mild-mannered dirt-poor hill-dweller Jed Clampett strikes it rich when oil is discovered on his property. At cousin Pearl\'s insistence, he moves his family to Beverly Hills to better enjoy his newfound wealth.','/refYLEQvzkY63i2IHronCPQODex.jpg','1993-10-15',93,'Released','Upscale neighborhood, down-home heart.','The Beverly Hillbillies',11041,7.2302,6.3,'Sy0tjb-Gjqw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11862,_binary '\0','/9Nll0mqi0dOTyX7rRfFV5REaqL4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106408',6.4,1329,'en','Bhaji on the Beach','A group of South Asian women try but cannot escape their problems on a day trip to a British beach resort.','/jq27h7iCkqwBP3Dd9DQnWdgfGGV.jpg','1993-09-11',100,'Released','A day to set yourself free.','Bhaji on the Beach',14587,2.0677,5.3,'20KdLa-9d2c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11863,_binary '\0','/3c4BQzT0sS09IA5gRtJFIgyh95b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106417',7.6,3178,'ja','劇場版 美少女戦士セーラームーンR','While enjoying the flower gardens, Sailor Moon and friends encounter an old childhood friend of Mamoru\'s: an alien! He\'s come back to give Mamoru a special flower but doesn\'t like Usagi and the rest of the planet\'s inhabitants. Sailor Moon must defend the earth from the evil Kisenian Flower he\'s brought back... before the evil vines and blossoms overrun the planet!','/sOsEDVFv2dJ8sI77XzQ2SeqRObZ.jpg','1993-12-05',61,'Released','The Future Depends On Scout Power!','Sailor Moon R: The Movie - The Promise of the Rose',37100,3.5869,7.8,'OdTp0qVOmKo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11864,_binary '\0','/5SBZ9xzrgdNLv9a28Vkd5EFqGLC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106421',6.7,1260,'ja','ブラック・ジャック','Black Jack is a master surgeon who possesses impeccable skills, enabling him to perform operations that are impossible for even the finest surgeons. He now is faced with his most difficult task to date and must challenge the limits of medical science...before it\'s too late!','/6iceZCYdSExrLuUotkU9XJUWiU5.jpg','1996-11-29',93,'Released','A Surgeon with the Hands of God.','Black Jack: The Movie',27213,2.7047,6.4,'WZOLdrXMg0A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11865,_binary '\0','/6JqU0XuZSfHhWx47uUQzw2iXMbX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106426',5.5,1876,'en','Blind Side','A couple visits Mexico to scout a new location for their furniture manufacturing business, and hit a cop with their car on the way back stateside. Realizing that if they report it they could land in a Mexican jail (guilty until proven innocent), they clean up the car and return home. A few days later, an insistent man shows up wanting a job -- and insinuating that he saw something in Mexico that he would not want to report -- the couple must make a decision about how far they will allow themselves to be blackmailed.','/fx6Ex4wtLCzH18BzNP6QT7LSjVQ.jpg','1993-01-30',98,'Released','They had something he wanted... he had something they feared','Blind Side',60505,1.8742,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11866,_binary '\0','/nAUBENJ7KO7OBCY1LaPYpzJANJx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106438',7.2,3246,'en','Blue','Against a plain, unchanging blue screen, a densely interwoven soundtrack of voices, sound effects and music attempt to convey a portrait of Derek Jarman\'s experiences with AIDS, both literally and allegorically, together with an exploration of the meanings associated with the colour blue.','/6dcmkKOAcHGJJVKY04dNscAKpOM.jpg','1993-08-19',79,'Released',NULL,'Blue',94794,1.7902,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11867,_binary '\0','/wOkLuQnsdMZCAqc7mzcN2suVf7d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106447',5.7,2610,'en','Bodies, Rest & Motion','Rebelling against his dreary life in a small Arizona town, salesman Nick abandons his girlfriend, Beth, and strikes out onto the highway in search of... something else. Encouraged by her best friend, Carol, Beth reluctantly accepts the romantic attentions of Sid, a local housepainter.','/46HAxDyb5Xqljse9Ata9ftqOxbK.jpg','1993-04-09',95,'Released','Nick is leaving. Beth is staying. Carol is waiting. Sid is painting.','Bodies, Rest & Motion',47676,2.2955,5.7,'bWjpqCiH5Ss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11868,_binary '\0','/40a2z21BPfsNjDJbhZ0WshZFDF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106449',6.2,14705,'en','Body Bags','A horror anthology containing three stories: a female college student working a graveyard shift is terrorized by a serial killer; a hair transplant goes horribly wrong; and a baseball player loses an eye and gets a new one from a recently executed murderer.','/xRwna1sWDByZs9hsnlabt16INHl.jpg','1993-08-08',95,'Released','Zip yourself in tight!','Body Bags',31578,4.4508,6.169,'2kqSUsDpHvs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11869,_binary '\0','/jbunzjlC12ZNf84xD6v5HF3LlOo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106450',5.3,4488,'en','Body Melt','Residents of peaceful Pebbles Court, Homesville, are being used unknowingly as test experiments for a new \'Body Drug\' that causes rapid body decomposition (melting skin etc.) and painful death.','/3DhwXNsZ5X66aQi9VnJMPn1Xcsl.jpg','1994-10-28',81,'Released','The first phase is hallucinogenic... the second phase is glandular... and the third phase is... BODY MELT','Body Melt',22455,1.8709,5.1,'PA0riGc6cWw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11870,_binary '\0','/7UlPokDtGNbz7TTdDE1QYFlaMYm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106452',6,22341,'en','Body Snatchers','When Environmental Protection Agency inspector Steve Malone travels to a remote military base in order to check for toxic materials, he brings his family along for the ride. After arriving at the base, his teenage daughter Marti befriends Jean Platt, daughter of the base\'s commander, General Platt. When people at the base begin acting strangely, Marti becomes convinced that they are slowly being replaced by plant-like aliens.','/s8WdtuOBvfEsuPtbQVpNfEgd5aR.jpg','1993-06-09',87,'Released','Imagine... you\'re gone and someone else is living inside your body.','Body Snatchers',4722,5.3171,6.2,'0vBfhQXFTds','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11871,_binary '\0','/vbVe8HhnR1hJ6I5k49E6cqCajYX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106453',4.6,17911,'en','Body of Evidence','When an elderly millionaire is found dead with cocaine in his system, his will leaves $8 million to Rebecca Carlson, who was having an affair with him. District attorney Robert Garrett decides to prosecute Rebecca, arguing that she deliberately engaged in wild sex with the old man to overexcite him and lead to his premature death. Defense attorney Frank Dulaney defends Rebecca in court while getting sucked into a dangerous affair with her.','/rGDfwZHRMpY5R0ZkmaiHHvpYQKB.jpg','1993-01-15',101,'Released','An act of love, or an act of murder?','Body of Evidence',2149,6.5154,4.977,'51xEHzC-rjQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11872,_binary '\0','/4Jj5I8qmnNndscSCjHSXo19QUcf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106455',5,7194,'en','Boiling Point','Red is an aging scam-artist who\'s just been released from prison together with Ronnie, a young and not-so-bright hoodlum who is easily manipulated. Their new business is to organize fake-money sales and then kill the buyer to take his money; but when Ronnie kills an undercover secret service agent, his partner Jimmy Mercer vows revenge and is given one week to catch the killers before being transferred.','/rmCgFzCnqoPRtm1zXTxKzV8yUJV.jpg','1993-04-16',92,'Released','He\'s a cop who reached the Boiling Point.','Boiling Point',22213,3.5341,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11873,_binary '\0','/aOQIOD8YukmcK9x51usHi8pOmDK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106466',5.2,4471,'en','Born Yesterday','A rich millionaire hires a sophisticated journalist to bring his somewhat dim-witted girlfriend up to the level of his peers. He fears that the showgirl\'s lack of etiquette may damage his own social reputation and tries to change her — but fails to realise that her enhanced eloquence will empower her to voice her own strong opinions.','/dUANBUEbVprsyEzRPe1mQFACr3n.jpg','1993-03-26',100,'Released','Never underestimate the power of an underestimated woman.','Born Yesterday',44968,2.2074,5.302,'y9B8Ty2F6KE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11874,_binary '\0','/9xjUZjuYyehv2qnqMH0oR9nSTft.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106469',7.9,38293,'en','Bound by Honor','Based on the true life experiences of poet Jimmy Santiago Baca, the film focuses on half-brothers Paco and Cruz, and their bi-racial cousin Miklo. It opens in 1972, as the three are members of an East L.A. gang known as the \"Vatos Locos\", and the story focuses on how a violent crime and the influence of narcotics alter their lives. Miklo is incarcerated and sent to San Quentin, where he makes a \"home\" for himself. Cruz becomes an exceptional artist, but a heroin addiction overcomes him with tragic results. Paco becomes a cop and an enemy to his \"carnal\", Miklo.','/8t9ojZ7fyn5iTqKCVjGvJ6nMacN.jpg','1993-02-05',190,'Released','An epic story of three brothers. Bound by blood. Divided by fate. Driven by destiny.','Bound by Honor',9702,12.8908,8.2,'EgXh-jXG-Vk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11875,_binary '\0','/lUJQIpDsnhicKAN7jIt6fqgE0WZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106471',4.8,14107,'en','Boxing Helena','A top surgeon is besotted with a beautiful woman who once rebuffed him. Unable to come to terms with life without her, he tries to convince her that they need each other. She has other ideas, but a horrific accident leaves her at his mercy.','/vgs0h94IllpZRheIjBTonjR7Zf2.jpg','1993-03-22',107,'Released','Beyond love, beyond obsession, there hides something beyond reason.','Boxing Helena',18215,4.7686,5,'QgsUUFYLSoQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11876,_binary '\0','/iEqFtSq6MX8q82VdkAkMgKscZC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106473',7.5,2312,'en','The Boys of St. Vincent','The true story of boys being sexually abused at their orphanage, run by a religious community in Newfoundland.','/cam0cG0UWdUVtQRvFHJXmNtL1hY.jpg','1994-06-03',93,'Released','For more than fifteen years their story was shrouded in secrecy. Unveiled... it shocked the world.','The Boys of St. Vincent',32119,2.5161,7.1,'hynI6orlOOA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11877,_binary '\0','/oL5PP1gTMUa2BLcC6yQIS8NbSWf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106476',5.9,1571,'sv','Brandbilen som försvann','A routine mission ends up in a flaming inferno when a house suddenly explodes. It looks like a spectacular suicide attempt but the technical investigation reveals unexpected evidence. Beck and his men are soon on the tracks of a narcotic syndicate...','/dZDggSVoQiTtmKvaNmZCilLAFvN.jpg','1993-07-02',86,'Released',NULL,'The Fire Engine That Disappeared',44581,1.6234,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11878,_binary '\0','/ggzzn1Hf4zBz1VVywpQhGtDxKtA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106489',7.8,190080,'en','A Bronx Tale','Set in the Bronx during the tumultuous 1960s, an adolescent boy is torn between his honest, working-class father and a violent yet charismatic crime boss. Complicating matters is the youngster\'s growing attraction - forbidden in his neighborhood - for a beautiful black girl.','/7Obzc6svsHSR1za0LqzkpwFsEhw.jpg','1993-10-01',121,'Released','One man lives in the neighborhood, another man owns it. A devoted father battles the local crime boss for the life of his son.','A Bronx Tale',1607,17.2171,7.909,'q5nQyoo1LwY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11879,_binary '\0','/y120PeLE7dLyHwAZBiB25aZidZS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106500',6.3,11291,'en','CB4','A \"rockumentary\", covering the rise to fame of MC Gusto, Stab Master Arson, and Dead Mike: members of the rap group \"CB4\". We soon learn that these three are not what they seem and don\'t appear to know as much about rap music as they claim... but a lack of musical ability in an artist never hurts sales, does it? You\'ve just got to play the part of a rap star...','/7bP66TCKWPTsiER72xgyKUsjg82.jpg','1993-03-12',88,'Released','Sex, rap and family values?','CB4',15278,2.5547,6.1,'tL0wunQtbco','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11880,_binary '\0','/suOXt1cnN4UMSOBjfn563N4PbQr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106504',6.7,2562,'en','Calendar','A photographer and his wife travel across Armenia photographing churches for a calendar project. Travelling with them is a local man acting as their driver and guide. As the project nears completion, the distance between husband and wife grows.','/7ct08n4H8WcvdfiKDI9AQ3GOyH.jpg','1993-06-03',74,'Released',NULL,'Calendar',83599,1.6353,6.3,'5uOIf2noNZ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11881,_binary '\0','/55sNqPoGPyVCkNNA2W8KquRL9uD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106505',5.2,2656,'en','Calendar Girl','Three young men go on an end of the summer trip to Hollywood, California. Their quest: to fulfill the fantasy of meeting Marilyn Monroe.','/ljSqZTl5oophHsH1Qtyv7AF2BW6.jpg','1993-09-03',90,'Released','It started with a dream and a stolen convertible.','Calendar Girl',117553,2.4031,5.2,'Ci-QG4w1Tz0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11882,_binary '\0','/9s4ZDw0j6qByLgwJtUsRcepBXSw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106519',7.9,250869,'en','Carlito\'s Way','Free after years in prison, Carlito Brigante intends to give up his criminal ways, but it\'s not long before the ex-con is sucked back into the New York City underworld.','/g6D7mjQtndu768cusGmoEQY9fTB.jpg','1993-11-10',144,'Released','He\'s got a good future if he can live past next week.','Carlito\'s Way',6075,13.6921,7.8,'nYBHVf108J0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11883,_binary '\0','/dwX0AX1TGm127tK2lvUSVjwYYA0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106521',3.7,4769,'en','Carnosaur','After being driven to extinction, great bloodthirsty dinosaurs come back to life with the assistance of a demented genetic scientist. She plans to replace the human race with a super-race of dinosaurs who will not pollute the planet.','/ef4PP83qdOmdbHk82eRYd9L4BYe.jpg','1993-05-21',83,'Released','Driven to extinction. Back for revenge.','Carnosaur',39283,2.5309,4.2,'M0wP4rP6R70','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11884,_binary '\0','/kMKp0yZ084IurAF4GbL04P4yzq9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106534',8.4,2022,'ro','Cel mai iubit dintre pământeni','The life-story confession of a prisoner waiting for his trial. Victor Petrini, a promising intellectual in the 1950s and a lecturer in Philosophy is arrested by the repressive secret police, wrongly accused of espionage, and sentenced to prison and forced labor.','/yugtLLAX43uchzq4Ct5rRC0P4Hv.jpg','1993-03-20',110,'Released','The verdict constitutes a brutal end to all his projects and ideals.','The Earth\'s Most Beloved Son',178923,1.3408,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11885,_binary '\0','/WQdxfSioBfSK6fHZxkE8feciMl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106535',6.9,5917,'en','The Cement Garden','After the death of her husband, the mother of Julie, Jack, Sue and Tom begins to suffer from a mysterious illness. Aware that she is going to have to go into hospital she opens a bank account for the children, so that they can be financially self-sufficient and will be able to avoid being taken into care by the authorities. Unfortunately she also dies and Julie and Jack (the older, teenage children) decide to hide her body in the basement so that they can have free reign of their household. Soon Tom has taken to dressing as a girl whilst Sue has become increasingly reticent, confiding only to her diary, meanwhile Jack and Julie sense an attraction developing for each other. However Julie\'s new beau, Derek, threatens to unearth the many dark secrets within this family as he becomes increasingly suspicious of Jack.','/dnEoE3tHBStCXZx2i9qsUYkwucu.jpg','1993-02-20',101,'Released','Love knows no limits.','The Cement Garden',14832,3.074,6.766,'mBzAFD3kF3w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11886,_binary '\0','/kOXcJY4NwNpLGDVlygdwssGGcxV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106538',6.2,2530,'cn','濟公','The gods in heaven complain to the Jade Emperor about the malicious practical jokes played on them by Dragon Fighter Lohan.','/cYSA6dHkD0E4xYECMBiq619CSFJ.jpg','1993-07-29',89,'Released',NULL,'The Mad Monk',75197,2.5656,5.855,'RMHXGi7AUvk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11887,_binary '\0','/fOWUfeeWS4oOYitb67EdJajm0tb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106539',3.5,1569,'en','Chained Heat 2','An American tourist lands in a Slavic prison run by a twisted woman and the U.S. ambassador.','/xR1Gra1DDxakAKr2XPbqv7qrmZI.jpg','1993-08-25',99,'Released','In prison, no one cares if you scream!','Chained Heat 2',52315,2.0719,4.1,'H5QJhJQiPLg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11888,_binary '\0','/7YvvanAc23ArKgcgrjNTrsX9ybI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106544',6.1,4904,'cn','超級計劃','As a crime wave sweeps through Hong Kong, the police call Jessica Yang, a rising star in the ranks, to help stop a notorious gang of thieves! What Jessica doesn\'t realize is that her boyfriend – recently discharged from the force – is the leader of this ruthless crime ring!','/wYGXe2BRIyNX2z7Y6UdQoiw8yfk.jpg','1993-10-21',101,'Released','Only One Force Can Stop This Crime Wave....And She\'s One Tough Cop!','Supercop 2',38955,2.5313,5.722,'uN1T-L17B1A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11889,_binary '\0','/2gKx07SGTXbqef6HpubZqfF36Zq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106545',6,1807,'cn','超級學校霸王','In the year 2043, an evil crime lord is trying to take over the world. Only one government official stands in his way, and plans to send him to prison, so The General and his minions Kent, Thai King, and Toyota travel to the year 1993 to kill the official before he has a chance to get into office. During a battle with The General\'s minions, the Future Cops Lung, Broom Man, Ti Man, and Ah-Sing hear of their evil plan and devise a plan of their own to travel back in time to protect the official.','/mmx9lmosHgsdT1bvDHGMWhfjfdq.jpg','1993-07-15',95,'Released',NULL,'Future Cops',63721,2.9038,6.1,'8F3dpWYt144','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11890,_binary '\0','/ejSBZuLfTFzGftPhcOQRo576FcC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106557',4.4,10568,'en','Children of the Corn II: The Final Sacrifice','When a tabloid reporter and his son travel to a quiet Midwestern town to investigate a gruesome massacre, they fall victim to a possessed orphan named Micah.','/5UaH4zhfKT1taJGHUwPxm29ZENf.jpg','1992-01-29',92,'Released','These children are home alone too. But their parents are never coming back.','Children of the Corn II: The Final Sacrifice',25748,3.6327,4.8,'bsYaPp3UDCw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11891,_binary '\0','/sofHRGQgG6LvKYJWpaxQRFKe4or.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106559',7.2,4298,'cn','青蛇','Two snake spirits become human and learn about love and suffering. A monk discovers his own weaknesses and finds that morality is not as simple as he had thought.','/qU5lu66AJFopMd5XxELxCkKzRRP.jpg','1993-11-04',99,'Released','Demons have never looked this good!','Green Snake',39915,3.1012,7.3,'j_PuAy5KWdU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11892,_binary '\0','/sL364DOfbKPNwI3BHW0KDYgc2Ti.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106579',7,6627,'en','Clean, Shaven','Peter Winter is a young schizophrenic who is desperately trying to get his daughter back from her adoptive family. He attempts to function in a world that, for him, is filled with strange voices, electrical noise, disconcerting images, and jarringly sudden emotional shifts. During his quest, he runs afoul of the law and an ongoing murder investigation.','/kpMXYy0L2GHrIVyDF0HkEiDK1Wd.jpg','1995-04-14',79,'Released','Partition on a strange madness!','Clean, Shaven',1479,1.5128,6.5,'5EhBZGAk_GY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 1