wise sidekick, a hardboiled cop is forced to take his new partner seriously as they race the clock to bring the bad guys to justice.','/2z2AcI1VyPnRtHrvfpk1YDItdmB.jpg','1993-04-02',93,'Released','One kid\'s fantasy. One cop\'s nightmare.','Cop & ½',12574,2.762,4.6,'tKWIo3b_4T0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11897,_binary '\0','/oKQ3kSui8T5zYPu4FLOGsCsRa21.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106620',3,1838,'en','The Crawlers','People from a small town are attacked by evil radioactive tree roots growing in the forest.','/yI5V7KFXGhHZl8TEfgaDZ8CVhaQ.jpg','1991-10-18',95,'Released','They Hunt...They Feed...They Kill...You\'re Next!','The Crawlers',107438,1.2848,3.8,'yo6qHnlWju0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11898,_binary '\0','/h8RQ5X0SzCLtICqIEgw2Xqcb7oY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106627',5.9,23803,'en','The Crush','A precocious and obsessive teenager develops a crush on a naive writer with harrowing consequences.','/4B0eHFjUYYZlkE1fthC29KVC4CS.jpg','1993-04-02',89,'Released','He thought it was just a crush. He was dead wrong.','The Crush',33408,4.4588,6.7,'vlEwqBrbPPU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11899,_binary '\0','/byb2fcbUcEOmlZIv8heYibZcfle.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106632',7.1,2217,'fr','Cuisine et Dépendances','Jacques and Martine, an ordinary bourgeois couple, invite to dinner a friend whom they have not seen the last ten years. Since then he has become a media star and everything has to go just right at dinner.','/b5czH5faR0vKKKXBnddiZvtxtu5.jpg','1993-04-06',96,'Released',NULL,'Kitchen with Apartment',40627,1.1535,7,'xeskuBaTjDs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11900,_binary '\0','/qa6ovATp32PBmcYjM1O584pM6u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106655',7.8,4518,'hi','Damini','The theme revolves around the character Damini who represents truth and innocence. After her marriage in renowned wealthy family, Damini happens to see a cruel act done by her brother-in-law. She wants the victim to get justice, but the family including her husband oppose her, which leads her to leave the house. Soon she is helped by a drunkard, an ex-advocate, who helps her in all respect to reach to her aim and therefore justice','/qHLHZG9aVO2zg3q5k5BIjvaEAsZ.jpg','1993-04-30',175,'Released',NULL,'Damini',138934,1.2088,7.478,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11901,_binary '\0','/vXqBQUTEpbuT035JgRS6R72NKyb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106660',5.6,4745,'en','Dangerous Game','A New York film director, working on his latest movie in Los Angeles, begins to reflect the actions in his movie and real life, especially when he begins an affair with the lead actress.','/lHD4z6KAjtDWKIMeChezIFon5bX.jpg','1993-10-13',108,'Released','Turbulence. Redemption. Hollywood.','Dangerous Game',49299,2.5409,5.7,'aUgOLi4f2G4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11902,_binary '\0','/1aTT2UJEaN1KWJp8priMxsGsDnT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106661',5.7,1996,'en','A Dangerous Woman','Martha Horgan is a withdrawn, mentally disabled woman who lives with her aunt, Frances. One of Martha\'s unusual traits is that she doesn\'t lie, a quality that leads to her getting fired from a dry-cleaning shop thanks to the actions of the shifty Getso. Conflict seems to follow Martha, since she also becomes romantically involved with local fix-it man, Mackey, who is sleeping with Frances as well.','/wsRHmHgio3w5nR5W2brn5VQ2oe4.jpg','1993-09-10',102,'Released','The story of a woman no one noticed until it was too late.','A Dangerous Woman',108021,2.2976,5.5,'QBIfbY5GbNY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11903,_binary '\0','/uTlZjD5uZ8C71pt4G8gt5QhhqIJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106664',6,22473,'en','The Dark Half','Following the public\'s realization that Thad Beaumont and George Stark are one and the same, the former stages a mock funeral, only for a series of gruesome murders to begin occurring as in his books.','/uTzi0no438AjKELtJgTbipNxWGu.jpg','1993-04-23',122,'Released','There are very good reasons to be afraid of the dark.','The Dark Half',10349,5.222,5.977,'3aWs7YChHEo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11904,_binary '\0','/lpBqjU3OyG9DnIy5BHt0zNw8n0q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106673',6.9,60732,'en','Dave','A sweet-natured Temp Agency operator and amateur Presidential look-alike is recruited by the Secret Service to become a temporary stand-in for the President of the United States.','/n7wQlcexeER5bW7DvV8sji2vRRH.jpg','1993-05-07',110,'Released','In a country where anybody can become President, anybody just did.','Dave',11566,4.9712,6.6,'ynC1hITFIzQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11905,_binary '\0','/nTJ2V9DRigYpttmcJirp5icAcnp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106676',5,2107,'en','Daybreak','When a substantial portion of the nation\'s populace falls victim to a deadly plague, the tyrannical government quarantines them in camps, offering no alternative except death. But a gutsy rebel named Torch sets out to help the afflicted by leading an underground effort to spirit the victims to humane sanctuary.','/dAPUDM50vPIoAqekqeYvj4rE2uK.jpg','1993-05-08',91,'Released','The terror of the time has darkened their world. Now they\'ll have to fight for a new dawn.','Daybreak',47945,1.9669,5.2,'1akLjalzUWs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11906,_binary '\0','/iNNm00fWqHnlEI1O0KCTivzcPEw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106677',7.6,218939,'en','Dazed and Confused','The adventures of a group of Texas teens on their last day of school in 1976, centering on student Randall Floyd, who moves easily among stoners, jocks and geeks. Floyd is a star athlete, but he also likes smoking weed, which presents a conundrum when his football coach demands he sign a \"no drugs\" pledge.','/msG9awbLhVZwv1Eh9Ge7SofMexW.jpg','1993-09-24',102,'Released','It was the last day of school in 1976. A time they\'d never forget. (If only they could remember)','Dazed and Confused',9571,11.0909,7.3,'uzDPw5N8d_0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11907,_binary '\0','/rBlbtWJplSENxaB82apO5tolUQI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106684',4.1,4278,'en','Deadfall','After he accidentally kills his father Mike during a sting, Joe tries to carry out Mike\'s dying wish by recovering valuables that Mike\'s twin brother Lou stole from him years earlier. But Uncle Lou is also a confidence artist, and Joe is soon drawn into his increasingly dangerous schemes.','/8S1lqwp1RR9z0V05QAVWTSbvtwC.jpg','1993-10-08',98,'Released','...The ultimate con','Deadfall',33927,3.3083,4.076,'gqvrcT3A0co','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11908,_binary '\0','/2iEh1tA1EKCoiMrLodaVuUlTQyk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106689',5.2,4400,'en','Death Train','When a renegade Russian general sends a nuclear bomb hurtling toward the Middle East aboard a hijacked train, special agents are dispatched to disarm the deadly device. Ten tons of steel and one ounce of hot plutonium are now riding roughshod through Europe. With time running out, the agents launch a desperate, bullet-packed assault on a deadly moving target piloted by a cold-blooded mercenary.','/zC0MftjGSMUuHFFzZnHnaYWC4gf.jpg','1993-04-14',100,'Released','It\'s Die Hard at 90 miles an hour!','Death Train',20435,2.3744,5,'apcusKoSgoU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11909,_binary '\0','/8VJy3mBVPFhH3IAJLssWXAUv4az.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106693',7.6,2901,'cs','Dědictví aneb Kurvahošigutntag','Bohus is indolent and spends his days drinking brandy. One day he finds he has inherited a brickworks, several shops and a five-star hotel. Bohus sets out to tour his new empire, insulting everyone on the way.','/AZZnvDakfZoMO0cUdrZeaaU0kS.jpg','1992-12-14',120,'Released',NULL,'The Inheritance or Fuckoffguysgoodday',40573,1.5947,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11910,_binary '\0','/4pl165EUdvveHCr4J4YcHVA1MnD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106697',6.7,211273,'en','Demolition Man','In 1996, brash L.A. detective John Spartan and maniac killer Simon Phoenix are both sentenced to decades in a cryogenic prison as punishment for a rescue mission gone wrong. When Phoenix escapes 36 years later to wreak havoc on the future, Spartan is awakened to capture his nemesis the old-fashioned way.','/dq6AmlVFo92PRuoLCcIyFdoRuxf.jpg','1993-10-08',115,'Released','The future isn\'t big enough for the both of them.','Demolition Man',9739,14.5279,6.774,'JdXYTDqeXe4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11911,_binary '\0','/r0MDuymjP02XA3BtC2qp0sLXU1c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106701',5.7,69931,'en','Dennis the Menace','Mr. Wilson\'s ever-present annoyance comes in the form of one mischievous kid named Dennis. But he\'ll need Dennis\'s tricks to uncover a collection of gold coins that go missing when a shady drifter named Switchblade Sam comes to town.','/t642WwGifbQ2fEuKTJRgpPzsgtX.jpg','1993-06-09',96,'Released','He\'s armed... He\'s adorable... And he\'s out of school for the entire summer.','Dennis the Menace',12139,9.9282,5.9,'63XgkkkEPMo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11912,_binary '\0','/hyUblmYuBSBDKxXtXpRXEnKFJEy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106749',7.3,2708,'tr','Dönersen Islık Çal','A dwarf and a transvestite, both are excluded from the society and doomed to exist at night. Their lives overlap in a strange encounter and this becomes the start of their friendship.','/eeYJUbQGoZOS60xkuDqgfqJpppU.jpg','1993-02-12',99,'Released',NULL,'Whistle If You Come Back',378435,1.1445,6.435,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11913,_binary '\0','/iSaKc4Nu7hTQDAvJigUVmNwTkj6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106753',4.4,4579,'en','Doppelganger','After being implicated in a murder, a young woman flees New York City and moves to Los Angeles, where she rents a room from a writer. They begin an affair, but it seems she\'s been followed by a homicidal duplicate of herself.','/2JBlzmEzvclTkrn6tMB0Hg9N9RU.jpg','1993-03-01',104,'Released','In every good, there is evil. In Holly Gooding there is something worse. Much worse.','Doppelganger',18773,3.0234,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11914,_binary '\0','/gJXt3gMz4EF39mdyhvy5EsXdiPk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106761',4,15115,'en','Double Dragon','Two brothers have half of a powerful ancient Chinese talisman. An evil gang leader has the other half, and determines to get the brothers\' half and have a complete medallion so he can gain absolute power.','/9ZTYSD8ZesYMKqLRbmVfZUW1FiE.jpg','1994-11-04',96,'Released','Power. Justice. Darkness. Light.','Double Dragon',2436,4.1541,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11915,_binary '\0','/fv01ZeWs69JWEnjSaKCJCilzKDm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106763',5.9,4277,'en','Double, Double, Toil and Trouble','On Halloween night, two precocious little girls try to save their parents from their nasty old capitalist aunt\'s greedy clutches. Magic abounds and they meet mysterious new friends along the way.','/pJZF7RqItBs05TcnRh7ux3sTeAb.jpg','1993-10-30',96,'Released','A witch\'s brew of family fun!','Double, Double, Toil and Trouble',57789,3.2833,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11916,_binary '\0','/xbDyMo2ZRHc6FIZP4U9VrFt8NLT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106770',7,34115,'en','Dragon: The Bruce Lee Story','This film is a glimpse into the life, love and the unconquerable spirit of the legendary Bruce Lee. From a childhood of rigorous martial arts training, Lee realizes his dream of opening his own kung-fu school in America. Before long, he is discovered by a Hollywood producer and begins a meteoric rise to fame and an all too short reign as one the most charismatic action heroes in cinema history.','/lxhsdC8wuGgQf0gKCt8wyHHxGcQ.jpg','1993-05-07',119,'Released','The mystery. The life. The love. The legend.','Dragon: The Bruce Lee Story',10423,7.8417,6.909,'64Fi-X_74gQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11917,_binary '\0','/w9j5j0TQmdij8TBiyBOZJL6sb4B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106779',5.6,4016,'sv','Drömkåken','Göran buys a house in a suburb. It is in need of some repairs, but Göran believes himself capable of repairing it himself with the help of some cheap craftsmen. However, the house is much worse than he thought. At the same time, a gang of crooks is searching for the dynamite they hid in the basement some time ago. Göran has to rescue both his wallet from greedy craftsmen as well as his marriage with Tina.','/Ac0GmgAdDQbqYutASvApA1ycpGn.jpg','1993-10-28',97,'Released',NULL,'The Dream House',39749,1.4235,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11918,_binary '\0','/gph8WWp4efupQi7L76MlpPSiAhe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106792',6,2655,'en','Ed and His Dead Mother','A mourning son makes a deal to reanimate his one year dead mother, however things turn into an unexpected direction.','/AnF4FFmJPIJhZ3FoOhlTWClPHFR.jpg','1993-06-04',93,'Released','A family reunion with some minor complications.','Ed and His Dead Mother',44562,2.4236,5.5,'ypAO0-ES0fQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11919,_binary '\0','/pYgGGcA9HZfXLt6jSHQzFUdYOCT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106827',4.8,2697,'en','Ernest Rides Again','Buffoonish Ernest and his dimwitted pal Abner unearth a huge cannon reputed to contain the crown jewels of England.','/lv9xbTZSafdFAXLpcbfJ779nnOG.jpg','1993-11-12',99,'Released','He\'s back...and history will never be the same!','Ernest Rides Again',34300,2.061,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11920,_binary '\0','/6BnVhHr7FlAXpslomRaQIymajHY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106833',6.3,2408,'it','Ethan Frome','Married couple, Ethan and Zeena, are in need an extra hand around the house due to Zeena\'s debilitated body and constant illness. The young woman who joins them is a beautiful, spirited person. She and Ethan fall in love much to the dismay of Zeena.','/wsXL08E4gQHWW5pRX4qpIyyeBfs.jpg','1993-03-12',99,'Released','A classic tale of forbidden passion','Ethan Frome',61807,2.3409,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11921,_binary '\0','/bR54Rc8r3voUdxX5RkzBOpQGtFc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106834',4.3,8292,'en','Even Cowgirls Get the Blues','A girl born with enormous thumbs in the repressive era of the 1950s learns to turn her quirks into assets.','/20x8nm0nPXkYv04COAHFA2AHyAl.jpg','1994-05-13',96,'Released','There have been many great drivers but only one great passenger.','Even Cowgirls Get the Blues',34444,3.1473,4.3,'K_Q1VTuna-w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11922,_binary '\0','/3Z9874b3XnCZALXE7eTg4uopkXC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106850',5.6,1633,'en','Extreme Justice','Jeff Powers is the newest member of a very elite and very secret LAPD division. Their mission is to target important criminals and to get them to stop. Police brutality is not a known term for the division and they will stop at nothing to get the job done, even if it means murder.','/lAmQPtxrNvIuIjU4qmsrHN7JrqO.jpg','1993-06-26',96,'Released','They\'re an elite task force. They target high-profile criminals, learn how they work...and shut them down.','Extreme Justice',103201,1.8636,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11923,_binary '\0','/cS45swrlrTJijH1RblBLe8LlW2p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106856',7.5,229231,'en','Falling Down','An ordinary man frustrated with the various flaws he sees in society begins to psychotically and violently lash out against them.','/7ujqyF96Zg3rfrsh9M0cEF0Yzqj.jpg','1993-02-26',113,'Released','The adventures of an ordinary man at war with the everyday world.','Falling Down',37094,14.5417,7.4,'09XCNERMIwU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11924,_binary '\0','/3ye2TQIpVEMwsMiSeCWfuTMJTGq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106866',6.7,3277,'fr','Fanfan','After seeing the initial passion and romance fade into a series of routine and boring relationships, Alexandre (Vincent Perez) concludes that romance ends when sex enters into a relationship. Determined to prevent this from happening with his latest love-interest—a sexy young woman named Fanfan (Sophie Marceau)—he decides that platonic love is the solution. Despite the wonderful, romantic, and inventive ways Alexandre finds for them to spend time together, Fanfan is left disappointed by his refusal to make love to her. Their exciting relationship becomes jeopardized by Alexandre\'s unwillingness to change his new approach to love.','/dKX3qjZ4XI2iDLU33EBsxPjqLzs.jpg','1993-06-16',89,'Released',NULL,'Fanfan',38012,2.1968,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11925,_binary '\0','/8bOqmWt0OwkSCWbQJTb5YYvyH2C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106867',5.6,1810,'it','Fantozzi in paradiso','One by one, with a sweet but inexorable rate, Ugo\'s colleagues, go to a better life. When Ugo is attending at one of the innumerable funerals, he and the priest remain involved in an accident. The doctor says that Ugo as only one week left to live','/mcwJGvwToICufgjjXAGcVwmYVtd.jpg','1993-12-21',93,'Released',NULL,'Fantozzi in Heaven',41665,1.2425,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11926,_binary '\0','/2eVkfAVFezj31dsfKaJl7sHRRyb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106868',6.5,4046,'en','A Far Off Place','Thrown together under incredible circumstances, two strangers must discover courage and strength when they begin a journey across the treacherous African desert! Equipped only with their wits and the expertise of a native bushman who befriends them, they are determined to triumph over impossible odds and reach their destination. But along the way, the trio face a primitive desert wilderness.','/ro8gNxloA1kStuGUMn3Kj0dz9iw.jpg','1993-03-12',107,'Released','A far off land. A far off journey. A far off adventure.','A Far Off Place',24736,3.1689,6.2,'DDe-OvUWM-A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11927,_binary '\0','/mTJHunR5Fr62OsPcTrPrw3YWTAS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106873',5.8,8994,'en','Fatal Instinct','Ned Ravine is a police officer and lawyer who occasionally defends the delinquents he arrests. He crosses paths with seductive Lola Cain during an assignment and promptly begins an affair with her. Meanwhile, Ned\'s wife, Lana, is deep in an affair of her own. Lana and her lover are planning to murder Ned in an elaborate fashion so they can collect on his triple indemnity life insurance policy.','/syewFnehGbbya5BdxoHLzrcm5Ne.jpg','1993-10-29',90,'Released','Sex, murder and revenge were never this funny.','Fatal Instinct',26141,5.8445,5.5,'9ykW-780bHs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11928,_binary '\0','/8oIy0PJWifTDGGdfU34UDyYJtoM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106877',5,3729,'en','Father Hood','Deadbeat dad kidnaps his kids from the bus to an abusive foster home and they go on a run. The cops are after them, they bicker constantly and his idea of a way out is grim, yet this dangerous ride might just turn them into a family.','/xHndTwPS3CNjct7aE20dBa6764e.jpg','1993-08-27',95,'Released','He\'s America\'s Most Wanted...Dad!','Father Hood',65137,5.0277,5.8,'UkaKSRWdPJM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11929,_binary '\0','/5ezE1ThLm4zLUX9VbXFXlXFePwt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106880',7.2,4922,'en','Fear of a Black Hat','Chronicling the controversial career of bad boys N.W.H. (Niggaz With Hats), this uproarious \'mockumentary\' lampoons all of hardcore rap\'s hot-button issues. This underground laugh riot recounts the rise, fall and resurrection of a clueless bunch of would-be rappers, Ice Cold, Tone-Def & Tasty Taste performing as N.W.H.','/4goFB3XTrh4sKumpXkvbdlZZAo8.jpg','1994-06-03',88,'Released','The First Drive-By Comedy','Fear of a Black Hat',20239,2.0927,6.2,'usSS517OlSI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11930,_binary '\0','/auKXOVH7znRHb8rl7DAS3c98hp4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106881',7,26426,'en','Fearless','After surviving a plane crash that kills many others, Max Klein develops a sense of invulnerability, leading to radical, compulsive actions. Can a psychologist and a fellow guilt-ridden survivor bring him down to earth?','/sFhzvwgv04VUmedB7pOO4cMP9xq.jpg','1993-10-15',122,'Released','Some people are afraid of nothing.','Fearless',10443,3.4503,6.9,'nnsdUVp06Dc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11931,_binary '\0','/wr3geqKULwDih4HNPYU0zG2d5gz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106911',6.8,1256,'en','Fiorile','The Benedetti family\'s wealth comes from gold stolen from the French army during the 18th century. When Jean (Michael Vartan), the lieutenant guarding the coins -- and lover of Elisabette Benedetti (Galatea Ranzi) -- is executed for a crime he did not commit, Elisabette curses the family. Bad luck travels from generation to generation. As the latest Benedettis tell their children about their eccentric grandfather, the children worry that the family curse will be passed on.','/oC7oMifaSO9ZUb1wwTbvHFb6CAe.jpg','1993-06-06',118,'Released',NULL,'Fiorile',41648,1.8314,5.8,'Aqmx3apiM2A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11932,_binary '\0','/rG8rGUrK3Ur6N2DuTVvjrtpV44l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106912',6.5,32295,'en','Fire in the Sky','After clearing brush for the government, a group of men return to town claiming their friend was abducted. Despite no apparent motive or evidence of foul play, no-one believes their story and his disappearance is treated as murder.','/rTFrjAp1YV49DSTUGCyKSkaEHC8.jpg','1993-03-12',109,'Released','Alien abduction. November 5, 1975. White Mountains, Northeastern Arizona.','Fire in the Sky',15613,7.5006,6.715,'vkSGgVdJLwc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11933,_binary '\0','/p19YGO5l7W4kVNpd0RXvS5MOaH7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106913',3.6,3109,'en','Fire on the Amazon','When a well-known environmental researcher is murdered in the Amazon jungle, an arrogant photojournalist joins forces with a beautiful young activist to find out who is responsible. Along they way, they fall in love as they discover the men responsible for the killing would be more than willing to murder again if it will keep them quiet.','/9OUU14KPIhRTEjAFcUi4MN52nHV.jpg','1993-10-01',78,'Released','Fight fire with fire.','Fire on the Amazon',28983,2.7042,3.5,'0cFgnxW9EQE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11934,_binary '\0','/jlUTfePS1XRyMpgZvjFvDk7yEi0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106918',6.9,164375,'en','The Firm','Mitch McDeere is a young man with a promising future in Law. About to sit his Bar exam, he is approached by \'The Firm\' and made an offer he doesn\'t refuse. Seduced by the money and gifts showered on him, he is totally oblivious to the more sinister side of his company. Then, two Associates are murdered. The FBI contact him, asking him for information and suddenly his life is ruined. He has a choice - work with the FBI, or stay with the Firm. Either way he will lose his life as he knows it. Mitch figures the only way out is to follow his own plan...','/kFexXCzidkm4LwlgZqxsJsDQB5v.jpg','1993-06-30',154,'Released','Power can be murder to resist.','The Firm',37233,10.2961,6.7,'Auxb3l4Y8j0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11935,_binary '\0','/foyYGZj8nN1WjAwtzjRrGNwRPC0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106926',6.3,6609,'en','Flesh and Bone','Haunted by memories of his father murdering a family, Arlis Sweeney prefers to keep to himself, focusing his energy on his work. One day, the traumatic past that eats away at him returns when he meets Kay Davies, a woman connected to the bloody event. Against all odds, Arlis and Kay fall in love; however, when his father, Roy, reappears in his life -- with the coldhearted Ginnie in tow -- Arlis must deal with his past demons.','/gNaZSODlVRiQltGWjS8vQZEYJTq.jpg','1993-11-05',126,'Released','Evil is patient.','Flesh and Bone',18551,4.8896,6,'1SbacB2W1l8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11936,_binary '\0','/h4skbDqGjhj4p6hK8dPA3WKItvD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106936',7.1,8932,'cn','方世玉','The secret Red Lotus Flower Society is committed to the overthrow of the evil Manchu Emperor and his minions. One of his Governors is sent on a mission to retrieve a list of members of that secret society. Meanwhile, Canton kung fu practitioner Fong Sai-Yuk falls in love with the beautiful daughter of a rich merchant.','/hdAqW3qn0Y9jNMjDob5ae0NRa0F.jpg','1993-03-04',106,'Released',NULL,'The Legend',17653,4.1185,7,'g5Ej_RjrNM8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11937,_binary '\0','/deTIvZZb9OIZcyIRsPDhFAHzCGg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106937',6.9,5079,'cn','方世玉續集','The hero Fong Sai Yuk becomes involved in the secret brotherhood \"The Red Flower\", who are trying to overthrow the Manchurian emperor and re-establishing the Ming dynasty. The social upheaval is combined with Sai Yuk\'s personal moral conflict about how to conform to the rigid regime of the brotherhood and on top of that sort out his difficult love life, saddled with two presumptive wives.','/ioG9sQbDV1yqOvB7EDlF6jBMKCv.jpg','1993-07-30',95,'Released',NULL,'The Legend II',17811,4.0209,6.7,'y0EKAvkBs6I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11938,_binary '\0','/xEmQpw6wMVqwiuyWHguL8hHGxNK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106941',6.2,16924,'en','For Love or Money','New York concierge Doug Ireland wants to go into business for himself and refurbish a hotel on Roosevelt Island, N.Y., but he needs an investor. With a few weeks left before his option on the site runs out, Doug agrees to help wealthy Christian Hanover conceal his affair with salesgirl Andy Hart from his wife. Despite his own attraction to Andy, Doug tries to stay focused on getting Christian to invest $3 million in his project.','/cXkkdmC0EJxZ1JuN1RBHwqktxiT.jpg','1993-10-01',94,'Released','He thought there was nothing as seductive as money. He was wrong.','For Love or Money',9024,6.3027,6.2,'doB6Oa1Iyic','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11939,_binary '\0','/wVt48TGKt95xJvJsQbWXaYt1w7i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106949',7.4,2512,'da','Det forsømte forår','At their 25th high-school anniversary some bourgeois citizens remember their time in school as a happy one. In reality it was quite the contrary. The school was a madhouse in which the teachers, especially Blomme, tormented the students. As a result one of them became a murderer.','/fx9ScTlwfUsJXvGhIcGO50CzdbD.jpg','1993-01-29',90,'Released',NULL,'Stolen Spring',42613,0.9912,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11940,_binary '\0','/6SD8Z4aGvglKU7qIX0kwNT3n4be.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106950',5.9,32396,'en','Fortress','In the future, the inmates of a private underground prison are computer-controlled with cameras, dream readers, and devices that can cause pain or death. John and his illegally pregnant wife Karen are locked inside \"The Fortress\" but are determined to escape before the birth of their baby.','/evjpqWPUY4VpOdyLpeRfkGU8DiR.jpg','1992-12-18',95,'Released','In the year 2017, one corporation is building a fortress for the ultimate takeover... your mind.','Fortress',12088,6.9646,6.09,'_grwVpfklzs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11941,_binary '\0','/tktw4gp70ytTStOwK3nsMEGWPAL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106963',5.9,1262,'en','Frauds','The film is a story of the ways in which insurance investigator Roland Copping interferes in and manipulates the lives of others with outrageous games and gimmicks. Eventually he becomes involved in an escalating vendetta with a couple who make an unusual insurance claim.','/oSBsYeNWt1h5WbTnx2JCPZy6nHg.jpg','1993-06-04',90,'Released','He\'s No Ordinary Insurance Man -- You Can Bet Your Life On It!','Frauds',114556,1.1851,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11942,_binary '\0','/mXkUfzJfdWx9y4Zlm7wsvQ0uvYo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106965',6.1,90370,'en','Free Willy','When maladjusted orphan Jesse vandalizes a theme park, he is placed with foster parents and must work at the park to make amends. There he meets Willy, a young Orca whale who has been separated from his family. Sensing kinship, they form a bond and, with the help of kindly whale trainer Rae Lindley, develop a routine of tricks. However, greedy park owner Dial soon catches wind of the duo and makes plans to profit from them.','/9iBgd9gi9ztWiVcYSG6zl8wDFBN.jpg','1993-07-16',112,'Released','How far would you go for a friend?','Free Willy',1634,8.2117,6.216,'PQZES1EtZ2w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11943,_binary '\0','/kTlrvY35ldGN0yReCu59DfQdlcp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106966',7.4,6399,'es','Fresa y chocolate','In 1979 Cuba, flamboyant gay artist Diego attempts to seduce straitlaced David, an idealistic young communist, and fails dismally. But David conspires to be \"friends\" with Diego so he can monitor the artist\'s subversive life for the state. As Diego and David discuss politics, individuality and personal expression in Castro\'s Cuba, a genuine friendship develops between the two.','/8riS2hGneWg78MHuhP7NqvLERRy.jpg','1993-12-01',108,'Released','Savor the flavor.','Strawberry and Chocolate',12527,2.4723,7,'qWv7dKxWhz4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11944,_binary '\0','/kFXtr3TbiP0WMCD2U3DYqh7G0WD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106973',4.9,4100,'en','Frosty Returns','Mr. Twitchell, a greedy old businessman, has invented Summer Wheeze: a spray that instantly removes snow and slush! Now Holly has to keep Frosty from melting, and convince everybody that snow\'s actually a good thing.','/r4XMrwhhhic6W6LvxBTxzs8kXlt.jpg','1992-12-01',24,'Released',NULL,'Frosty Returns',28042,2.4836,5.681,'9MvMhf5G6vA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11945,_binary '\0','/7WVRxZ7KZmzoHnUkAjnEFT4o6Dw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106977',7.8,350438,'en','The Fugitive','Wrongfully convicted of murdering his wife and sentenced to death, Richard Kimble escapes from the law in an attempt to find the real killer and clear his name.','/b3rEtLKyOnF89mcK75GXDXdmOEf.jpg','1993-08-06',131,'Released','A murdered wife. A one-armed man. An obsessed detective. The chase begins.','The Fugitive',5503,16.8754,7.489,'OlYsVq6FpuU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11946,_binary '\0','/xWVexPM5EbZGa1YbB4iBwovGipC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0106980',5.5,2203,'en','Full Eclipse','The LA police department have a special team of officers with a talent for reducing big-time crime. The team leader has an excellent track record for crime reduction in other big cities, but his methods are unconventional, and so is he - he\'s a werewolf.','/lCtgDrPfhdeIhqRanyAYVG59Ew7.jpg','1993-11-27',97,'Released',NULL,'Full Eclipse',78239,2.0268,5.1,'WvVorV0v7sc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11947,_binary '\0','/goeGgDKGaTzpXp6jJAvDWKT7P80.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107002',7.1,6228,'fr','Germinal','It\'s mid 19th century, north of France. The story of a coal miner\'s town. They are exploited by the mine\'s owner. One day the decide to go on strike, and then the authorities repress them.','/cizv23RUxcpTrQt4kcOz7Sv6YJl.jpg','1993-09-29',160,'Released','Who needs God and Heaven? We can change this lousy world.','Germinal',51980,2.1637,6.7,'chCnbs7UMSk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11948,_binary '\0','/6YSj3paJAn3p6F6cyfSdgLncFTQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107004',6.6,15581,'en','Geronimo: An American Legend','The Apache Indians have reluctantly agreed to settle on a US Government approved reservation. Not all the Apaches are able to adapt to the life of corn farmers. One in particular, Geronimo, is restless. Pushed over the edge by broken promises and necessary actions by the government, Geronimo and thirty or so other warriors form an attack team which humiliates the government by evading capture, while reclaiming what is rightfully theirs.','/9FNuwnhHngkblD6eVRXnmJN8kQq.jpg','1993-12-10',115,'Released','A Warrior. A Leader. A Legend.','Geronimo: An American Legend',35588,5.1685,6.3,'v4alqybzcic','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11949,_binary '\0','/ikwP1BTRHlqula7bbPtT7Hk0Fkq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107007',7.6,32598,'en','Gettysburg','In the summer of 1863, General Robert E. Lee leads the Confederate Army of Northern Virginia into Gettysburg, Pennsylvania with the goal of marching through to Washington, D.C. The Union Army of the Potomac, under the command of General George G. Meade, forms a defensive position to confront the rebel forces in what will prove to be the decisive battle of the American Civil War.','/k0XKdT3QbycMB8f2H7CEZVx2t4m.jpg','1993-10-08',254,'Released','Same Land. Same God. Different Dreams.','Gettysburg',10655,4.0068,7,'9Vz5f9NOVuk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11950,_binary '\0','/9zr8ogXbcABPFQZf38hxjfVqhpr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107009',4.7,4465,'en','Ghost in the Machine','After a freak, fatal accident, the soul Karl—aka The Address Book Killer—ends up trapped in the electrical grid. He targets Terry and her son for his next victims, turning home technology against them as deadly weapons.','/lyUZFIQj4CekCtGeR3smYNUJWtk.jpg','1993-12-20',95,'Released','Plug in to your worst nightmare','Ghost in the Machine',41651,3.1963,4.7,'o2HPq-WDnFQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11951,_binary '\0','/vRIQmdWb4DEQvc08ttj0ZyT6LPz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107027',6.5,6862,'ja','ゴジラvsメカゴジラ','The U.N.G.C.C. (United Nations Godzilla Countermeasure Center) recovers the remains of Mecha-King Ghidorah and construct Mechagodzilla as a countermeasure against Godzilla. Meanwhile, a giant egg is discovered along with a new monster called Rodan. The egg is soon found to be none other than an infant Godzillasaurus.','/ezZnnAit1N1Nj9sewMFQ1xy33YQ.jpg','1993-12-11',108,'Released','The Birth of the End of the Century Tyrant.','Godzilla vs. Mechagodzilla II',6593,3.8467,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11952,_binary '\0','/bBE2NdAjrbeRbTrcATvdaf1NeXp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107034',6.4,49148,'en','The Good Son','A young boy stays with his aunt and uncle, and befriends his cousin who\'s the same age. But his cousin begins showing increasing signs of psychotic behavior.','/6jZ1eef6SCVSMb4o1pSHHq84Nyf.jpg','1993-09-24',87,'Released','Evil has many faces.','The Good Son',9272,7.4611,6.778,'_gHxeAadqOs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11953,_binary '\0','/4W6RYDNe4OByNryOCvJprrutm9h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107048',8,740901,'en','Groundhog Day','A cynical TV weatherman, along with his idealistic producer and his sardonic cameraman, is sent to report on Groundhog Day in the small town of Punxsutawney, where he finds himself repeating the same day over and over.','/gCgt1WARPZaXnq523ySQEUKinCs.jpg','1993-02-11',101,'Released','He’s having the worst day of his life… Over and over again.','Groundhog Day',137,20.4057,7.6,'_ADlbEQG_VA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11954,_binary '\0','/vKEtCExyFwVFo2KEBSb3dvGLFUH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107050',7,57954,'en','Grumpy Old Men','For decades, next-door neighbors and former friends John and Max have feuded, trading insults and wicked pranks. When an attractive widow moves in nearby, their bad blood erupts into a high-stakes rivalry full of naughty jokes and adolescent hijinks.','/iMY7yFn4gMvGaQYMGWnyX2QgvHZ.jpg','1993-12-25',103,'Released','The best of enemies until something came between them.','Grumpy Old Men',11520,6.0933,6.683,'64MH2i5gr_I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11955,_binary '\0','/m4nj31M92zxZJxtjjOyZIYenTzQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107057',5.7,6340,'en','Guilty as Sin','Before a criminal lawyer knows what has happened, she is forced to defend a wife killer she knows is guilty.','/a5b53cYM23bUA7OyoNyDtIJ38kc.jpg','1993-06-04',107,'Released','She\'s finally met her match. He\'s handsome, wealthy, seductive. A Real Lady Killer!','Guilty as Sin',4916,3.1294,5.7,'ookd-Dgs8PU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11956,_binary '\0','/1pvg5ELV8sIyv5hpI8FZFIAawD4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107065',7.2,2487,'en','Gypsy','Gypsy\'s mother Rose dreams of a life in show business for her daughters, but Louise becomes a huge burlesque star. Stage musical loosely based on the memoirs of Gypsy Rose Lee.','/2VTBGuUojvyVWeFEFVxBWkMS78l.jpg','1994-09-29',153,'Released','The Divine Miss M in Broadway\'s greatest Diva role!','Gypsy',17912,1.7959,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11957,_binary '\0','/4IRHnS9Ljvb4tGI2SGaSiQikcaE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107076',6.2,60655,'en','Hard Target','When a woman\'s father goes missing, she enlists a local to aid in her search. The pair soon discover that her father has died at the hands of a wealthy sportsman who hunts homeless men as a form of recreation.','/mXCM7pmUFUGp7QzSmare3RITe6n.jpg','1993-04-27',99,'Released','Don\'t hunt what you can\'t kill.','Hard Target',2019,14.3622,6.5,'-pzx4IeYYFg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11958,_binary '\0','/ueL2dupQ5Clyyd4Hsq5HSBDzNxz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107079',5.8,5330,'en','Sugar Hill','In the Harlem neighborhood of New York City, the Mafia steps in when a drug dealer quits his partner and brother to lead a straight life with his girlfriend.','/6bnYhhJS7vuDMRPVSplWaXdK49g.jpg','1994-02-25',123,'Released','He wanted power. He wanted revenge. Now he just wants out.','Sugar Hill',39349,3.1179,5.6,'D6oxEZ6yblA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11959,_binary '\0','/oXSuI7yNzQUp35qkL0mTroLPWU1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107086',7.2,3971,'en','Hated: GG Allin and The Murder Junkies','An overview of the life of the most shocking, vile, and notorious of punk rock legends.','/bPgH9xOvGqMkH9pzZIrr3PCxrtC.jpg','1993-08-13',50,'Released',NULL,'Hated: GG Allin and The Murder Junkies',46697,1.2078,6.6,'5RAF0jANsyM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11960,_binary '\0','/rWl6FWZmKzPwiQxJPaSEeUsfjPq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107090',5,1465,'en','Hear No Evil','Deaf Jillian Shanahan becomes the target of a ruthless and corrupt cop. The cop is looking for a stolen coin, which he plans to keep for himself. A journalist briefly acquires the coin and hides it in Jillian\'s apartment, then his car explodes, now the cop is after her.','/y3cWYMacQAcDeF2x3NZLKm2Xq2t.jpg','1993-03-26',97,'Released','What you can\'t hear could kill you.','Hear No Evil',71140,2.2292,4.6,'6w0RLrzfkz0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11961,_binary '\0','/orjpvbnfiDQvqRJIy9cLAb8WTgF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107091',7,20455,'en','Heart and Souls','A fateful night in 1959, four people die when the bus they are riding crashes. They continue as ghosts; their souls become eternally entwined to the life of a child born at the moment of their deaths as his guardians. Baby Thomas grows up to be a businessman who has memories of his playmates, but assumes they are products of his youthful imagination. When the ghosts realize they need Thomas\' help to move on to the afterlife, they decide to make an appearance once more.','/jnMBqMSUwa0Lzh9X1Fwo4f8AMl6.jpg','1993-08-13',104,'Released','The story of four souls who needed a body and one guy who needed some soul.','Heart and Souls',12187,5.1552,7,'8qEYlO-QMZs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11962,_binary '\0','/o0F4QDlH12j8GmGEV8GvSDGmyFT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107096',6.8,16281,'en','Heaven & Earth','In a small Vietnamese village torn apart by war, a young woman faces unimaginable horrors before deciding to escape to the city. There, she encounters a compassionate Marine who offers her hope and a chance at a new life, igniting the possibility of a future together.','/hvvR7Yf743pc2E2F1VJ2dfZl7OZ.jpg','1993-12-25',140,'Released','Lasting victories are won in the heart.','Heaven & Earth',31642,5.8511,6.62,'WpjxuJV6FfY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11963,_binary '\0','/gZncuH1zkwMJ4nQtAWbgMR3uKXZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107101',4.8,4349,'en','Hellbound','Two Chicago police officers are sent to investigate the brutal murder of a rabbi. As the investigation begins, Shatter and Jackson are summoned to Israel for questioning. Upon arrival they realize that they are, in fact, pursuing a supernatural being.','/wfrZ62b1h1e6Btxp7RO94Xl0e7u.jpg','1994-01-21',95,'Released','A Chicago cop is about to face his worst nightmare... Only this time it\'s real.','Hellbound',63777,1.7036,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11964,_binary '\0','/nGX1rMYJYcDkviavSXRar8bc71g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107103',7.1,1834,'en','Hercules Returns','When Brad gets fired from his job, he goes to reopen an old cinema, he enlists his frends to help him show the last film the cinema aired before it closed... Only they don\'t know, the film is in Italian. With everyone sitting ready they begin to dub the movie... on the fly!','/8DDByl1HBjdrDa5lDmOMWiP37e8.jpg','1993-09-16',82,'Released','Funnier than Gandhi... Sexier than The Little Mermaid... Shorter than Dances with Wolves','Hercules Returns',16327,1.2199,6.6,'KL0q5gjeLkU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11965,_binary '\0','/2M9p0GcQ5AkWMrZkRLnr2GH2BDY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107107',5.6,1933,'en','Hexed','Lowly hotel clerk Matthew Welch stumbles unto a chance to go on a date with supermodel Hexina by pretending he is someone else. But something goes wrong on the date, she tries to kill him! Soon she kills a couple more people, and unfortunately all the evidence points to Matthew. Gloria, who has been wishing Matthew would ask her on a date, thinks he is innocent and is willing to help, but hardnosed Detective Ferguson is hot on the clues, and closing in on Matthew.','/ijKY2vhrdBoWqXfE0twYMamwkQG.jpg','1993-01-22',93,'Released','An erotic thriller that casts a wicked spell','Hexed',75686,1.9881,4.8,'OByAzxrCNt4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11966,_binary '\0','/mo91VtUnf3n6aNNgsBd2E1RCjPP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107117',5.4,1272,'en','The Hit List','A hit man\'s boss refers him to a client, a dangerous woman who mixes business with pleasure.','/oivPqqQ5UpigKSRGePf2XkJdidO.jpg','1993-01-17',93,'Released','Assassin. Bodyguard. Lover. Is he next on... The Hit List','The Hit List',232422,1.7847,4.9,'JKWgOmOiWDE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11967,_binary '\0','/ncr6KR7bBF8cps6yZKiTAwClpn1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107120',6.9,174083,'en','Hocus Pocus','After 300 years of slumber, three sister witches are accidentally resurrected in Salem on Halloween night, and it is up to three kids and their newfound feline friend to put an end to the witches\' reign of terror once and for all.','/by4D4Q9NlUjFSEUA1yrxq6ksXmk.jpg','1993-07-16',96,'Released','It\'s just a bunch of Hocus Pocus.','Hocus Pocus',10439,16.3731,7.037,'OFm_2RyxXjQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11968,_binary '\0','/wAYvtTbyedjJlpRWEOjsPYIiAaH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107121',6.5,1338,'no','Hodet over vannet','Einar and Bjørn leaves Lene on the island for a fishing trip. Then her former lover, Gaute, drops by unexpectedly. Drunk, he sleeps in the double bed. Lene sleeps on the couch and wakes up when the men come back. She tries to wake Gaute, but then discovers that he\'s dead.','/birWMF4Axa3y958boSkg5l0mkv0.jpg','1993-08-08',97,'Released',NULL,'Head Above Water',40918,0.9712,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11969,_binary '\0','/hKBnHE5NTRyFsdF1ykk9wpPdLbd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107130',7.1,4738,'en','A Home of Our Own','In 1960s Los Angeles an energetic widow and her six children try to make a dream of theirs come true: to have a home of their own. They leave L.A. and head for the countryside, all the while facing numerous difficulties and obstacles during their journey.','/yN32TPLWWPo3dt1K9zydaFb3ItV.jpg','1993-11-05',104,'Released','They had nothing... and tried to find their dream.','A Home of Our Own',78133,3.6834,7.024,'U59QrykKCtw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11970,_binary '\0','/xDwDhLtQnA7jK4f7DVkdeSvZnAp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107131',7,56078,'en','Homeward Bound: The Incredible Journey','Before the Seavers leave for a family vacation to San Francisco, they drop off their pets -- Chance, an adventurous American bulldog; Shadow, a wise golden retriever; and Sassy, a cautious cat -- at a friend\'s ranch. But when the animals start to worry that they\'ve been left for good, the three embark together on a treacherous and thrilling journey to find their way back home through the California wilderness.','/el6dJEpK97OJRQiQhuiSGk2jkV5.jpg','1993-02-03',84,'Released','In the classic tradition of Walt Disney Pictures comes a story about courage, adventure and friendship.','Homeward Bound: The Incredible Journey',6878,8.3334,7,'GyONxFhfuuQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11971,_binary '\0','/lKoEEg7Nf1FUPSzRR0oMtPIqiyX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107144',6.6,104724,'en','Hot Shots! Part Deux','Topper Harley is found to be working as an odd-job-man in a monastery. The CIA want him to lead a rescue mission into Iraq, to rescue the last rescue team, who went in to rescue the last rescue team—who went in to rescue hostages left behind after Desert Storm.','/zh9EGK970GHo10ETclWBOjZVUOK.jpg','1993-05-21',88,'Released','Just deux it.','Hot Shots! Part Deux',9255,13.3659,6.5,'Rida8js49Uo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11972,_binary '\0','/jPcfz03Gs4hEa7257BiJRKKviSs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107146',6.6,2341,'en','The Hour of the Pig','In medieval France, young lawyer Richard Courtois leaves Paris for the simpler life in the country. However, he is soon drawn into amorous and political intrigues. At the same time, he is pushed to defend a pig, owned by the mysterious gypsy Samira. The pig has been arrested for the murder of a young boy.','/e6JNPDyNlbVMgLPT7Dbd5WRRHij.jpg','1993-09-25',112,'Released','The case is a dog. The defendant is a pig. And the law is an ass.','The Hour of the Pig',70912,2.977,6.2,'qmVXlt8Pmpk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11973,_binary '\0','/x78BjSaUWQx30PQvTNMopWePY6z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107148',6.1,3097,'en','House of Cards','When Ruth Matthews\'s husband is killed in a fall at an archaeological dig, her daughter Sally handles her father\'s death in a very odd manner. As Sally\'s condition worsens, Ruth takes her to see Jake, an expert in childhood autism. Jake attempts to bring Sally out of her mental disarray through traditional therapy methods, but Ruth takes a different route. She risks her own sanity by attempting to enter her daughter\'s mind and make sense of the seemingly bizarre things that Sally does, including building a wondrous house of cards','/cmZTyKkjlchMjhgzvnpfkxIglqJ.jpg','1993-06-25',109,'Released','A Journey That Will Open Your Mind... And Touch Your Heart.','House of Cards',47095,2.6258,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11974,_binary '\0','/im6mZxeUMq71cBqqQmzLGDVdIXd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107151',6.9,26768,'en','The House of the Spirits','A rancher, his clairvoyant wife and their family face turbulent years in South America.','/pS5xqILNBxcjRqLZROIkO4wszrU.jpg','1993-10-21',140,'Released',NULL,'The House of the Spirits',2259,7.2813,6.941,'XGjmJSPzEfw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11975,_binary '\0','/9C41BHwReEBBndjcKp7KhsYoWvs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107152',6.9,1337,'en','Household Saints','A chronicle of three generations of Italian-American women struggling to get by in post-World War II New York’s Little Italy.','/1C24iDt0aP88KnYxf7sdrwiRUOK.jpg','1993-09-15',124,'Released','The Santangelos asked for a miracle. God gave them something slightly more complicated. Their daughter Teresa.','Household Saints',119907,1.686,6.6,'PSIkYwTv8uE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11976,_binary '\0','/AiADW9ru9v1DLbFo4Ac76CtlXjK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107156',7.6,19149,'zh','囍宴','A Taiwanese-American man is happily settled in New York with his American boyfriend. He plans a marriage of convenience to a Chinese woman in order to keep his parents off his back and to get the woman a green card. Chaos follows when his parents arrive in New York for the wedding.','/arWCA8lg0rbdlwHUMvI46LNDhnL.jpg','1993-03-01',108,'Released','A little deception at the reception.','The Wedding Banquet',9261,3.7357,7.217,'5kVkRhXt3S4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11977,_binary '\0','/izWGOOsJJGS6ffd1oUFiQ4f1bN6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107157',7,2301,'zh','戲夢人生','Master puppeteer Li Tien-lu recalls his life in Japanese-occupied Taiwan during the first half of the 20th century.','/nb3jOZsFUDSjUXQgw951FMNE9O7.jpg','1993-12-08',143,'Released',NULL,'The Puppetmaster',96712,1.6137,6.6,'GL22Cp6-lio','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11978,_binary '\0','/aBz5Cfz4LCraHZ8kykkW2WT6Nio.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107162',5.9,1524,'cn','黃飛鴻之四：王者之風','Wong Fei Hung must win another Lion Dance contest in order to defeat the eight foreign concessions in Shanghai.','/sOQQwisk5fHG3y3yu9yiJ7doT4l.jpg','1993-06-10',101,'Released',NULL,'Once Upon a Time in China IV',52316,3.6209,5.8,'tQDp6IljjSw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11979,_binary '\0','/kvEhXJlreqdDI4sIlrX4xeMFyIr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107165',6.1,4322,'es','Huevos de oro','A libidinous construction worker uses his charm and bravado in an attempt to attain enough finances to build his dream project.','/2wxZTo2GZCiEmo6NIFxtqichly4.jpg','1993-09-24',95,'Released',NULL,'Golden Balls',47707,3.508,5.5,'ne5rHn_Lbp8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11980,_binary '\0','/f4YeXwFw7nTTIDg33RMvABccxM7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107166',7.3,6812,'hi','हम हैं राही प्यार के','Rahul has his hands full taking care of his late sister’s three children. He faces a new challenge when the kids sneak a runaway bride into the house.','/ocEQInlignEoa8ztW7CSVSnsty3.jpg','1993-07-05',163,'Released',NULL,'Hum Hain Rahi Pyar Ke',54814,1.9218,6.989,'3jXYgddLl08','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11981,_binary '\0','/xnAmTJ4BOCaO62CUMbYXnRO0V29.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107175',6.1,1748,'fr','Hélas pour moi','This complex allegorical tale tells the story of man’s quest for spiritual meaning. When God enters the body of 1980s filmmaker Simon Donnadieu, his wife Rachel realizes that something has gone awry, but chooses to remain faithful to her erratically-behaving husband.','/3u5DZuVEKLHFmTmVoZc78V5JCzc.jpg','1993-09-08',84,'Released',NULL,'Oh, Woe Is Me',52713,1.4251,6.3,'_h2LqozNgjg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11982,_binary '\0','/pcPlJf7hw2gaW7krTSlQnLh3wMu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107178',6.4,2543,'en','I Can Make You Love Me','A beautiful young computer technician starting off her career in Silicon Valley during the Eighties, is stalked and harassed by a nerdy, dangerous and mentally-unstable colleague with a twisted obsession.','/7AP8Zthv8QyKnEQ1tMpJwaojkna.jpg','1993-02-09',92,'Released','Even the most innocent relationship can become a fatal attraction.','I Can Make You Love Me',126816,2.4942,6.7,'w6tVHju8HXo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11983,_binary '\0','/zYM9IbF08gB1Ip3Qee19HPvNY8T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107206',7.2,124555,'en','In the Line of Fire','Veteran Secret Service agent Frank Horrigan is a man haunted by his failure to save President Kennedy while serving protection detail in Dallas. Thirty years later, a man calling himself \"Booth\" threatens the life of the current President, forcing Horrigan to come back to protection detail to confront the ghosts from his past.','/3NvOFpmyECI3DNExYMtFIRcGMsu.jpg','1993-07-08',128,'Released','An assassin on the loose. A president in danger. Only one man stands between them…','In the Line of Fire',9386,11.6271,6.975,'FuZdS9da4S4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11984,_binary '\0','/gUIVD0rFWVB8Okk8wU8dQxjOYnZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107207',8.1,204770,'en','In the Name of the Father','A small-time Belfast thief, Gerry Conlon, is wrongly convicted of an IRA bombing in London, along with his father and friends, and spends 15 years in prison fighting to prove his innocence.','/3NcIkKxaO2SmRVsG1v50XhtmL0f.jpg','1993-12-27',133,'Released','In the name of truth... In the name of justice... In the name of love.','In the Name of the Father',7984,8.2208,7.9,'H0ff5KjZ7vM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11985,_binary '\0','/pFMTaNCCIwfO20Z7M7AfO5fAWDp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107209',7.2,9896,'de','In weiter Ferne, so nah!','A group of angels look longingly upon the life of humans. Berlin now is a very different place: unified in name but overrun with crime, corruption, and—in what turns out to be a key theme here—Americans.','/5VaPw0NgM4DloukmQTggzgvD4rb.jpg','1993-09-01',147,'Released','Your favorite Angels are back!','Faraway, So Close!',10434,3.2448,6.9,'8-kAhp0pruM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11986,_binary '\0','/8g8WtAAEGRramjw9G4ivYQV8OaR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107211',6.1,88177,'en','Indecent Proposal','John Gage offers a down-on-his-luck yuppie husband $1 million for the opportunity to spend the night with the man\'s wife.','/a39WoiTJEG5kNLIrr3kOMwg3LFg.jpg','1993-04-07',117,'Released','A husband. A wife. A millionaire. A proposal.','Indecent Proposal',4478,11.9735,6.408,'Ad98qFf7PTE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11987,_binary '\0','/4ZRyBQI9clbKxb9rsCqJkXdRIut.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107212',6.6,6845,'en','Indian Summer','A group of childhood friends, now in their thirties, reunite at Camp Tamakwa. Only a few of the original campers show up, but they still have a good time reminiscing. The people share experiences and grow while at the camp. They are dismayed to discover that the camp\'s owner, Unca Lou, is going to close the camp down.','/A1gUvZbQ25wsnj7HD8bDwTxOSWy.jpg','1993-04-23',97,'Released','A Comedy About Eight Friends Who Return To The Best Summer Of Their Lives!','Indian Summer',33506,2.5398,6.3,'lqxylqQXsh4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11988,_binary '\0','/81ATdQABVtCJResodQBk6vY3krV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107214',7.9,3206,'de','Indien - der Film','Heinzi Boesel and Kurt Fellner are two Austrian health inspectors forced to work together, traveling through Austria. Over time a beautiful friendship evolves between the odd couple who couldn\'t stand each other initially; a friendship that even overcomes the boundaries of great tragedy.','/AslgHRni2MxFfCfrokqYGqfowfu.jpg','1993-10-07',90,'Released',NULL,'India',11122,1.118,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11989,_binary '\0','/8feVoYD8Ps0p9qI5pmRPKXmLu52.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107225',6.9,2440,'it','Io speriamo che me la cavo','A bureaucratic snafu sends Marco Tullio Sperelli, a portly, middle-aged northern Italian, to teach third grade in a poor town outside Naples','/b4wZkB4FNUi7SK46Tw9kxT5oW8M.jpg','1992-10-09',93,'Released',NULL,'Ciao, Professore!',23637,1.9191,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11990,_binary '\0','/AdtegdZ4VLanBAUOJq0Z9XlALhd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107227',7.8,4078,'ar','الإرهاب والكباب‎‎','Ahmed heads to Tahrir compound to extract papers to move his son to another school. There he clashes with the administrative obstacles. He suddenly finds himself involved in carrying a weapon and taking hostages at the government building and becomes a terrorist in the process.','/4bfkwrkHGfXGOCHHAeFKqFD6Snv.jpg','1992-06-11',115,'Released',NULL,'Terrorism and Kebab',63729,1.3116,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11991,_binary '\0','/eyasB4HS0arhjvvdiV6x3rySKO8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107247',6.5,4694,'en','Jack the Bear','Story of the relationships between two sons and their father, who moves the family to California and becomes a tv horror show host after the death of his wife.','/ujQp7d43MmENpjMG9qaZslMqD24.jpg','1993-04-02',99,'Released','Laugh. Cry. Hold on tight.','Jack the Bear',38749,2.3008,6.3,'vH6p2cgDbck','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11992,_binary '\0','/vdlhVjSarfs5FNbbaFweg3QdDph.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107249',4.6,1286,'hi','जागृति','Vishal is brutally killed in the presence of his younger brother, Jugnu. Jugnu is grown up now and he must avenge his brother\'s death, but he is alone, and has an uphill task.','/fxncbQIk8kIBsjQW2fFbVRGj9te.jpg','1992-07-03',149,'Released',NULL,'Jaagruti',161404,1.0827,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11993,_binary '\0','/wqRyyOZcMaUxTnKsxDexPp4IAZ5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107254',4.1,41667,'en','Jason Goes to Hell: The Final Friday','Jason Voorhees is tracked down and blown to bits by a special FBI task force, reborn with the bone-chilling ability to assume the identity of anyone he touches.','/Aacq05foqiWdXqetFv02HBvMoJy.jpg','1993-08-13',88,'Released','Evil has finally found a home.','Jason Goes to Hell: The Final Friday',10285,8.0811,4.6,'3lM2_KX2MYY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11994,_binary '\0','/eXHznh4SCFOAaU92Ix23rBnzKEG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107277',5.7,1800,'en','Josh & S.A.M.','Josh and Sam are two brothers facing change, their mother is about to marry a French accountant and the kids are sent to go live with their father in Florida. Meanwhile, Josh tells Sam that he is a \"S.A.M.\" that is going to be sent to Africa to fight in a war and that Canada is a safe haven for any S.A.M. unwilling to fight. Will Josh & S.A.M. make it to Canada or will they wish they should have never left home?','/dWggqpyiZzhvpIyef5ZPB4Lsscu.jpg','1993-11-24',96,'Released','Why run away from home when you can drive?','Josh & S.A.M.',48706,2.3736,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11995,_binary '\0','/Ad8aDCb0hi24PN7r8H1QsHI0pgZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107282',7.7,19860,'en','The Joy Luck Club','Through a series of flashbacks, four Chinese women born in America and their respective mothers born in feudal China explore their pasts.','/s1Sk0hhVARNs7i9wqRHqbCriu8n.jpg','1993-09-08',139,'Released','Between every mother and daughter there is a story that must be told.','The Joy Luck Club',19931,3.4965,7.2,'TNiWeqvrFz8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11996,_binary '\0','/lIuseocAIWrEq8zl4EBCBH96e4z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107286',6.6,21357,'en','Judgment Night','Four young friends, while taking a shortcut en route to a local boxing match, witness a brutal murder which leaves them running for their lives.','/3rvvpS9YPM5HB2f4HYiNiJVtdam.jpg','1993-10-15',110,'Released','Don\'t move. Don\'t whisper. Don\'t even breathe.','Judgment Night',6,4.3459,6.446,'3OGTl_bAORc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11997,_binary '\0','/8x66igfuRC8Znxc44xQvmwco3ao.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107289',6.2,2061,'da','Jungledyret','This film introduces us to Hugo, a one-of-a-kind animal who lives in a jungle. Youthful and carefree, Hugo is prone to playing practical jokes on his friends, Zig and Zag the monkeys. His idyllic lifestyle is interrupted when he is captured by CEO of a famed movie company, Conrad Cupmann, to be co-star in a Hollywood-style film. In order to return from Copenhagen to his jungle home, he must escape with the help of a newly found friend, Rita the fox.','/9QT6XZ9eDpAgMJZECSjGPfygp1K.jpg','1993-12-10',73,'Released',NULL,'Hugo, the Jungle Creature',36323,1.8608,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11998,_binary '\0','/4SyDTF02R5BepqSdQmOaNCHObzF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107290',8.2,1198881,'en','Jurassic Park','A wealthy entrepreneur secretly creates a theme park featuring living dinosaurs drawn from prehistoric DNA. Before opening day, he invites a team of experts and his two eager grandchildren to experience the park and help calm anxious investors. However, the park is anything but amusing as the security systems go off-line and the dinosaurs escape.','/d9mtMGQDLANKieb9PbD3yK7xxzo.jpg','1993-06-11',127,'Released','An adventure 65 million years in the making.','Jurassic Park',329,17.6083,7.976,'Rz_FvTXa_qY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(11999,_binary '\0','/mSYuqQE8MXwzz3CqtuEIR2cyUfm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107302',6.7,63402,'en','Kalifornia','A journalist duo go on a tour of serial killer murder sites with two companions, unaware that one of them is a serial killer himself.','/aXyA3UvVaXBoX2zq9zH7NcK5rKT.jpg','1993-06-24',118,'Released','Fear never travels alone.','Kalifornia',10909,5.9547,6.6,'2ut7heVeMnM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12000,_binary '\0','/1t7cw6mrDHGPxrIB3o5VsunOLsR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107311',7.1,4320,'hi','खलनायक','Inspector Ram succeeds in nabbing notorious criminal Ballu. When Ballu\'s escape taints Ram\'s name, his fiancee, Ganga, decides to trap Ballu. But, things get complicated however, when Ballu falls for her and she finds that she isn\'t entirely immune to his charms.','/4mKDbADQt7kN1TEwH3ZDGZ29m0i.jpg','1993-08-06',190,'Released','The Heroism of a Villain','Khal Nayak',32295,1.5482,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12001,_binary '\0','/l8dbS5uLR2IzRu3qwMOXCUBRLnh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107315',6.5,16152,'es','Kika','When American author Nicholas brings in a cosmetologist named Kika to prepare the corpse of his recently deceased son, she inadvertently revives the young man, then falls in love with him. Forces conspire against the couple, though, as Nicholas wants Kika for himself.','/jUEBKaMqcvrz0HHF8Cei8asjRWr.jpg','1993-10-29',117,'Released','A memorable, surreal and bizarre comedy in the best Almodóvar style!','Kika',8223,4.4834,6.4,'z5bmEnGrA4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12002,_binary '\0','/jvUr9d44lPhBOUuJKyMBHGEHF8Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107321',5.3,3423,'hi','किंग अंकल','Ashok Bansal has a traumatic childhood which teaches him that money matters most to people, even more than their kids. Ashok starts hating poor people & starts working hard to get out of poverty, at the expense of his own family. However, Ashok’s life changes forever when Munna enters his life.','/oJAg9UonrhG4yoJTSo70dF99Qp6.jpg','1993-02-05',171,'Released','An Emotional Story Of Stone Hearted Big Man','King Uncle',81551,1.2211,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12003,_binary '\0','/bnN6H3vng04ofPXa0Xe7PJHFd7J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107322',7.3,9461,'en','King of the Hill','Based on the Depression-era bildungsroman memoir of writer A. E. Hotchner, the film follows the story of a boy struggling to survive on his own in a hotel in St. Louis after his mother is committed to a sanatorium with tuberculosis. His father, a German immigrant and traveling salesman working for the Hamilton Watch Company, is off on long trips from which the boy cannot be certain he will return.','/s2sed4Wpa5NJobKhjiB7T0lmUVS.jpg','1993-08-20',103,'Released','When the world turns upside down, the trick is coming out on top.','King of the Hill',34024,3.7711,6.835,'fHamua2ORRY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12004,_binary '\0','/pFZHX2yBYH4Dc3UYSwQbABED6vs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107330',7.5,1622,'de','Kleine Haie','When dishwasher Ingo, whose girl-friend has just left him, returns a borrowed bar stool to the Folkwang Acting School in Essen, he stumbles into the audition for next year\'s new students. He lets Johannes, the broke and unsuccessful applicant, stay with him. Ingo decides to go to Munich with Johannes, where he wants to try his luck once again. Hitchhiking, they get rides with very different drivers on the autobahn. They meet up with the smooth-talking Ali in the wayside dinner \"Raststätte Spessart\". Arriving in Munich, the trio tries to find cheap sleeping accommodation. They enter Ingo into the audition at Munich acting school. Moreover, Johannes falls in love with street artist Herta from Berlin. Written by emkarpf','/oHfoWOpIkaUrnLs5pfpVyQ6SMCv.jpg','1992-09-03',87,'Released',NULL,'Little Sharks',9617,1.3552,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12005,_binary '\0','/AjqVmtOiwlYNY656bf8OpRRhNkw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107333',4.7,2300,'en','Knights','In the future, as a result of devastating wars, all suitable for cultivation of land turned into one big lifeless desert. In the search of fertile lands around the world were traveling group of nomadic farmers. But one of the distant city genesis in these lands came cyborgs. For the operation they need human resources, or more simply - blood. To combat this army of Vampire creator has been sent cyborg Gabriel (Kristofferson). In this he will help the girl Nea (Long), whose parents as a child killed the main villain - Job (Henriksen).','/mKcz7slE98nja8ksnjdugLrHW81.jpg','1993-04-19',95,'Released','He said it takes a cyborg to kill a cyborg. She\'s going to prove him dead wrong.','Knights',52627,1.5814,5.2,'cKlHgIPz1h0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12006,_binary '\0','/nBvrKWlF3YWZVLg8F7fwk8OaJPB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107349',6.5,2387,'sv','Kådisbellan','Stockholm in the 1920s. Young Roland lives with his socialist father, Jewish mother and a boxing brother. His mother sells condoms illegally, and from them, Roland makes slingshots which he sells. His rebellious ways has gotten him the special attention of his school teacher, who always makes sure that Roland is punished. Roland also tries to make extra money by repairing bicycles, a successful business that in the end lands him in hot water.','/hu8OM6AkfZeYlG10q5aQ9e07PqZ.jpg','1993-09-24',102,'Released','If growing up were easy, everybody would do it.','The Slingshot',41653,2.0917,6,'En4ua26ruec','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12007,_binary '\0','/gZAoacoaVfUFK2FU6EEQkzNDdlr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107357',4.7,1581,'en','Lake Consequence','A repressed housewife is plunged into erotic ecstasy by the arrival of a handsome groundskeeper. At a remote lake, she is encouraged by the groundskeeper and his lover to explore her deepest sexual desires.','/mU6CwKO7QwxRlutmUSIS4hjJJUa.jpg','1995-06-02',90,'Released','He took her to the edge of experience and then let her float free','Lake Consequence',37333,2.336,4.581,'7eNUq7004WI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12008,_binary '\0','/8J2JCoSB0faP0QWOpAmDHGJ7YSG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107358',7.5,3532,'zh','蓝风筝','A young man recalls his childhood growing up in a poor alley in Beijing during the 1950s and 1960s.','/r3VkKXNPOyxyGc6fSENL1ewLT0d.jpg','1994-02-02',141,'Released','A history untold, a memory unfolds.','The Blue Kite',44162,2.0396,7.2,'zwW0mr9K9L4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12009,_binary '\0','/bumIpNTKmLY380bruTgIDTrXfpZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107362',6.5,175098,'en','Last Action Hero','After his father\'s death, a young boy finds solace in action movies featuring an indestructible cop. Given a magic ticket by a theater manager, he is transported into the film and teams up with the cop to stop a villain who escapes into the real world.','/vkhEaWAv5j3qgrOGp3BgMeiYPKj.jpg','1993-06-18',131,'Released','This isn\'t the movies anymore.','Last Action Hero',9593,13.48,6.489,'OJw8o49CNZI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12010,_binary '\0','/zwvM1gGZN0MiCSJzF18KBoxsYAO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107376',8.1,2305,'fr','Latcho Drom','Latcho Drom is a vista of the music, culture, and journey of the Romani people—from their homeland of India, to Europe and Southwest Asia.','/tQHcUwjiC9xmu24UnRku6d65PWy.jpg','1993-06-06',103,'Released',NULL,'Safe Journey',47105,1.9576,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12011,_binary '\0','/uUVo2qgILxmxQ8Msd5lIfjzHa5n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107384',5.6,2100,'en','Leningrad Cowboys Meet Moses','After years of fame and misfortune in Mexico, the members of the Leningrad Cowboys decide to return to their native village. Their former manager Vladimir, who now calls himself Moses lead them on their way home.','/pjozVQnmZKH0gKbPz8A8OIkkzH.jpg','1994-02-17',94,'Released',NULL,'Leningrad Cowboys Meet Moses',30366,1.7133,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12012,_binary '\0','/odBmsTbv5bZPe0tBL4UTzQVn0RG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107387',4.8,34186,'en','Leprechaun','A demonic leprechaun terrorizes a group of young people whom he believes stole his gold.','/8SZgqIjiCSaRq03SxW1Z6yLfBHf.jpg','1993-01-08',93,'Released','Your luck just ran out.','Leprechaun',11811,4.8977,5.572,'P3IR80MrfgY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12013,_binary '\0','/ercmUfU1kpd6PJxRzv7yO0IXPcc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107413',5.7,7105,'en','Life with Mikey','Michael Chapman, a former child TV star, runs a struggling talent agency specilizing in child acts. When a young girl off the street puts on a real performance after he catches her picking his pocket, he may have just found the next big thing.','/dKsvF5t5xsm17HG3GJzQQGJpJzP.jpg','1993-06-04',91,'Released','He\'s a talent agent. She\'s a thief. Looks like they\'ve already got something in common.','Life with Mikey',42580,3.1403,5.7,'niJhC06sv1g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12014,_binary '\0','/yUj6jsSfxxkxj802w9EIRP0dzVf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107415',5.5,1325,'en','Lifepod','Lifepod cronicles the trip of eight passengers after the ship they were traveling on blew up on Christmas Eve. Immediately people start dying. The passengers begin to investigate why the ship blew up and how it relates to them','/pn2ppzJPwHbe7APDEQyCbqXIlrc.jpg','1993-06-28',89,'Released',NULL,'Lifepod',19553,1.4824,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12015,_binary '\0','/roWqJp8dXekp1DShC1RNpG9Yr3y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107426',6.2,19399,'en','Little Buddha','After the death of Lama Dorje, Tibetan Buddhist monks find three children — one American and two Nepalese — who may be the rebirth of their great teacher.','/xy70xtdoKZ3PxlKkakwdhL3UFDQ.jpg','1993-12-01',123,'Released','A magical journey to a place where the past and present meet','Little Buddha',1689,5.7632,6.273,'-J_cV7rRZ9c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12016,_binary '\0','/nGwlHqVQjPjRPPxEiJuaXYoOuIl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107438',4.4,32843,'en','Look Who\'s Talking Now!','When high-powered executive Samantha LeBon hatches a scheme to spend a romantic Christmas with her new employee – the unsuspecting, blithesome James – his wife, their kids and their two dogs, Rocks and Daphne, must rescue him before he makes a terrible mistake.','/73JahFiizkMVsrrslXInmNK54nC.jpg','1993-11-05',96,'Released','The world\'s favorite family is back.','Look Who\'s Talking Now!',11982,6.2918,5.377,'S-oJ1D5aZcM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12017,_binary '\0','/6GKi4QB60Vw9pDxoOKUosXh2LYk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107443',6.8,3945,'en','Lost in Yonkers','In the summer of 1942 two young boys are sent to stay with their stern grandmother Kurnitz and their childlike aunt Bella in Yonkers, New York.','/9COy4RAhPzOw1ICecKMYQCexTgm.jpg','1993-05-14',114,'Released','This summer there\'s no better place to find yourself.','Lost in Yonkers',27224,1.6203,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12018,_binary '\0','/wcgo1CZkwBlX9OqX8YzJPQc9e4M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107447',6.6,2984,'en','Love & Human Remains','In a Canadian metropolis, failed actor David shares a place with the bookish Candy, whom he dated before coming out as gay. While David, who now waits tables, pursues an aimless romance with a younger coworker, Candy dabbles in both same-sex and heterosexual affairs. As David and Candy\'s odd assortment of friends — including a telepathic sex worker and an ill-tempered yuppie — pass in and out of their beds, a serial murder stalks the city\'s women.','/9QVw6cPXfsjr4PncE1TeWudeLmh.jpg','1994-07-22',100,'Released','Welcome to love in the 90’s','Love & Human Remains',15730,2.4189,5.8,'_1cjHboN8Mw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12019,_binary '\0','/bTdibkwk0T0yRZXqXoG4wANzgZG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107451',5.2,1324,'en','Love, Cheat & Steal','Paul Harrington thinks he has the perfect wife... stunning, kind, and ambitious. Yet behind Lauren\'s pretty face lies a wicked person who sent her former boyfriend to jail by setting him up. Reno Adams has lost seven years of his life in Jail and wants revenge. After escaping, he tracks Lauren down and intends to make her and her husband\'s life a living hell.','/h6clL4lnwo8ddC7Lj6yrgDUd6I4.jpg','1993-12-05',96,'Released','He promised to love, honor and protect. She promised to love, cheat and steal.','Love, Cheat & Steal',90376,2.1788,4.52,'Bh4G37DNZxg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12020,_binary '\0','/7cqxSTOUe0olgvjXxRs8XedFjOr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107468',6.7,11875,'en','M. Butterfly','In 1960s China, French diplomat Rene Gallimard falls in love with opera singer Song Liling – but Song is not at all who Gallimard thinks.','/vfutnJ9sgpAtNuPemksd26gd5dC.jpg','1993-10-01',101,'Released','Passion. Power. Revenge. In All Their Majesty.','M. Butterfly',1413,3.6875,6.581,'fgANS15AN4I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12021,_binary '\0','/wFGZDBAmoAuHZMWg13K6bwZkYKd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107471',6.9,2374,'fr','Ma saison préférée','Elderly woman Berthe leaves her house to live with her daughter Emilie. Emilie and her brother Antoine had a falling out three years ago and have not seen each other since, but Emilie invites him for Christmas. Memories will resurface and impact both Berthe\'s destiny and the strange relationship between Emilie and Antoine.','/mWQhnhvNo8B2WRZhvv9XxrA7HgF.jpg','1993-05-14',127,'Released',NULL,'My Favorite Season',52873,1.908,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12022,_binary '\0','/aIDwNw6aGjwAkqNlUlUirCftaNx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107472',8,3174,'de','Die Macht der Bilder: Leni Riefenstahl','This documentary recounts the life and work of one of most famous, and yet reviled, German film directors in history, Leni Riefenstahl. The film recounts the rise of her career from a dancer, to a movie actor to the most important film director in Nazi Germany who directed such famous propaganda films as Triumph of the Will and Olympiad. The film also explores her later activities after Nazi Germany\'s defeat in 1945 and her disgrace for being so associated with it which includes her amazingly active life over the age of 90.','/pZnBH4ZJnHcVFgeuK81w2tcHvRD.jpg','1993-09-11',188,'Released',NULL,'The Wonderful Horrible Life of Leni Riefenstahl',41647,1.3072,7.2,'91607Aqn-mo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12023,_binary '\0','/xX5St4pQuLWK9JbKHYuDnLOQSon.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107473',6.3,24223,'en','Mad Dog and Glory','Wayne Dobie is a shy cop whose low-key demeanor has earned him the affectionate nickname \"Mad Dog.\" After Mad Dog saves the life of Frank Milo, a crime boss and aspiring stand-up comedian, he\'s offered the company of an attractive young waitress named Glory for a week. At first both are uneasy about the arrangement, but they eventually fall in love. However, the situation becomes complicated when Milo demands Glory back.','/wmgmTe9uQ5mtudN6e4IVEGvSqg1.jpg','1993-03-05',96,'Released','A cop who\'d rather be an artist. A mobster who\'d rather be a comic. And a woman who\'d rather be anywhere but between them.','Mad Dog and Glory',10433,5.1811,6.027,'FyMnAp0WWJA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12024,_binary '\0','/osYVAYoyJbL0BySa61cMyMkgUvN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107474',7.3,6833,'ja','まあだだよ','In postwar Tokyo, beloved writer-professor Hyakken Uchida retires and is buoyed through hardship by the fierce devotion of his former students, who honor him each year with a raucous “Not yet!” birthday toast. Told in warm, gently comic vignettes, Kurosawa’s farewell celebrates aging, friendship, and the sustaining ritual of teacher and pupils refusing to say goodbye.','/kaPbCMIvriKSHCM8ERnGGe3Ovgs.jpg','1993-04-17',134,'Released',NULL,'Madadayo',13889,2.8906,7.342,'drg_zJ98nEU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12025,_binary '\0','/lTrHk6DznYoAGr7biPkdIbb4WGo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107478',5.2,18871,'en','Made in America','A young black woman discovers that her father was a sperm donor, and if that wasn\'t bad enough, he\'s white.','/1NLhOZN4AcTSvEPMI3HCjTVSfvy.jpg','1993-01-06',111,'Released','At the sperm-bank she asked for a tall, intelligent, black man. One out of three ain\'t bad.','Made in America',12121,4.4117,5.5,'dPPN93A3RRs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12026,_binary '\0','/pD08wZYOMOqSVXHs64XCPNRNSPO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107479',6.9,1414,'es','La madre muerta','Ismael breaks into the house of a fine art restorer and shoots the homeowner dead, leaving her daughter orphaned and traumatized for life. Years later, Ismael is working in a bar where he sees the daughter again. Paranoid that she has recognised him and will report him, he kidnaps her and holds her hostage, demanding that her hospital pay a ransom for her release. As he spends more time with her, a strange bond develops that causes him to delay the ransom request or fulfil his threats of throwing her in front of a train. But he can’t delay forever…','/tAvzP7zWN46dI1GO1TP5pirh0Mc.jpg','1993-11-05',112,'Released','Killing is as easy as stealing candy from a baby.','The Dead Mother',115470,1.169,6.2,'OAHwhXNfnYg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12027,_binary '\0','/v9pxyF8VvM157VbvKfjIOd4G38P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107497',6.5,31608,'en','Malice','A tale about a happily married couple who would like to have children. Tracy teaches infants, Andy\'s a college professor. Things are never the same after she is taken to hospital and operated upon by Jed, a \"know all\" doctor.','/oQoe4eIzDjQSSqGvLgJFjXtEkNv.jpg','1993-09-29',107,'Released','Her doctor wasn\'t playing God. He thought he was God.','Malice',2246,5.2797,6.289,'44Key2Yloaw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12028,_binary '\0','/eq5mrlYcu142Z8io1bdVPwGxx34.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107501',6.7,33176,'en','The Man Without a Face','Justin McLeod is a former teacher who lives as a recluse on the edge of town after his face is disfigured from an automobile accident ten years earlier, in which a boy was incinerated--and for which he was convicted of involuntary manslaughter. Also suspected of being a paedophile, he is befriended by Chuck, causing the town\'s suspicions and hostility to be ignited.','/9dmH2jc6jwlZo90JQTFOx4XaBWt.jpg','1993-08-25',115,'Released','A fatherless boy had almost given up all his dreams... until one man believed in him enough to make them come true.','The Man Without a Face',10502,4.2561,6.6,'YWyo45AArP8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12029,_binary '\0','/fRQNUm33JDwWeUGQG0sVmesNlc1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107504',5.3,5290,'en','Man\'s Best Friend','A genetic research facility worker exposes animal abuses there to a local TV reporter, who frees and takes in a genetically altered dog from the lab, unaware that he has a violent streak.','/dRDOrszc2X9bWsE2LhJuJ6WbVEp.jpg','1993-11-19',97,'Released','Companion. Protector. Killer.','Man\'s Best Friend',41759,3.5186,5.9,'sFKIFyTDEhY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12030,_binary '\0','/px0d4Kzn9683SHLMS9K3e5OHk2H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107507',7.3,50183,'en','Manhattan Murder Mystery','A middle-aged couple suspects foul play when their neighbor\'s wife suddenly drops dead.','/zrzBIlMyAP7Ac9W5qAy5ssAUdK4.jpg','1993-05-02',104,'Released','Who killed who?','Manhattan Murder Mystery',10440,4.4558,7.3,'kOQuEcmYoZI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12031,_binary '\0','/ksSummZDfgYXEgbyQI9Kb6Wi2se.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107511',6.2,1562,'sv','Mannen på balkongen','A serial-killer attacks and murders young girls in the parks of Stockholm. The police have trouble finding any evidence to find the killer. But when a newsstand is robbed in one of the parks while the murderer strikes again, police inspector Martin Beck believes that the robber may be an important witness. Plot by Mattias Thuresson.','/wP2uq4gV5Vshv7sAD4avIF4g39f.jpg','1993-11-26',91,'Released',NULL,'The Man on the Balcony',46320,1.1621,6.1,'OoXyxPIoxJs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12032,_binary '\0','/nfTkAIHLQ0XGVAxJefC8zX5yYrr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107529',6.9,13909,'en','Matinee','A showman introduces a small coastal town to a unique movie experience and capitalizes on the Cuban Missile crisis hysteria with a kitschy horror extravaganza combining film effects, stage props and actors in rubber suits in this salute to the B-movie.','/2S6FEhl4dpr5E0mj3sth0XxJQAu.jpg','1993-01-29',99,'Released','Lawrence Woolsey presents the end of civilization as we know it. Make that... Proudly Presents!','Matinee',25389,3.2256,6.7,'0GmhD-MnoQM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12033,_binary '\0','/s5PP0ryxAo12jzvPntSEybahpCw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107554',7.5,71082,'en','Menace II Society','A young street hustler attempts to escape the rigors and temptations of the ghetto in a quest for a better life.','/guvPiEOeXwROpfCb2LkHkVEvOck.jpg','1993-05-26',97,'Released','This is the truth. This is what\'s real.','Menace II Society',9516,6.8471,7.5,'woJQ9XPpVVY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12034,_binary '\0','/xb6seczD1LyJbYMqwFQ0hPUFEKG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107561',5.1,1324,'en','Metamorphosis: The Alien Factor','A virus from outer space transforms a bio-researcher into a blood thirsty monster. But chief, Dr.Vialini doesn\'t like the cops and public to be involved in this secret experiment. But he becomes lunch very soon.','/cx8mDA9Pb6HmyZ0bHQ71JN8OAMO.jpg','1990-11-05',98,'Released','It came from another world...','Metamorphosis: The Alien Factor',92562,1.4326,6.1,'NkbGDpe3_lA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12035,_binary '\0','/qQ1xCJC5604FM8lP7hqMGycCAB7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107563',5.3,9540,'en','The Meteor Man','One night Jefferson Reed gets hit in the chest by a souped-up chunk of meteor. So he can fly, but he\'s scared of heights. He can master the information in any book ... for about thirty seconds. Now his friends and family want him to protect their community from the dreaded Golden Lords.','/d30mZVOrY8n5KCvwaPkiQEFv1tc.jpg','1993-08-06',100,'Released','Get meteorized. Take a stand.','The Meteor Man',11244,3.7433,5.8,'61iSBGGESxY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12036,_binary '\0','/vIGWegxzGfymD9sQBnw9HBINY3l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107566',6.5,2657,'en','Mi Vida Loca','Two Indigenous Latina bestfriends, Mousie and Sad Girl live in a contemporary Los Angeles poor Indigenous Hispanic American neighborhood. But when Sad Girl becomes pregnant by Mousie\'s boyfriend, a drug dealer named Ernesto, the two become bitter enemies. While their dispute escalates towards violence, the violence of the world around them soon also impacts their lives.','/gtKIaHUqkNqdgVnMFosyVJXvKMC.jpg','1994-06-08',92,'Released','Mothers. Warriors. Sisters. Survivors.','Mi Vida Loca',32325,2.678,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12037,_binary '\0','/cPNT4Y9HcLUE9AHN2WKx8qnB70W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107594',5.7,4754,'en','Money for Nothing','When unemployed dockworker Joey Coyle finds $1.2 million that fell off of an armored car, he decides to do the logical thing: take the money and run. After all, he says, finders keepers. He turns to his ex-girlfriend Monica, who works in an investment firm, for advice, before turning to the mob for help laundering the money. While Joey makes plans to leave the country, however, a detective is following his ever-warmer trail in order to recover the cash.','/xkof6yO3w4aaLmpD9EHjw8Uk22w.jpg','1993-09-10',100,'Released','What would you do if you found a million bucks?','Money for Nothing',55448,3.3973,5.6,'r6cnkaR3lI4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12038,_binary '\0','/59qneeis27Xgq45a9oaiixJdDic.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107606',5.4,3986,'en','Mother\'s Boys','Sexy but unstable wife and mother Jude walked out on her family three years ago. Now, just as suddenly, she is back. But her husband, Robert, has fallen in love with Callie, an assistant principal at his sons\' school. He asks Jude for a divorce. She responds by trying to turn her three boys against Callie, then by slashing herself and blaming her rival and finally by drawing her 12-year-old, Kes, into a murderous plot.','/itHFRyqt5lVnjIdaHi1DNvaiT77.jpg','1993-10-01',96,'Released','This divorce is going to be a nightmare.','Mother\'s Boys',41587,2.5484,5.4,'5GjXGdP2uI0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12039,_binary '\0','/cvtHD8gxuHyLtF6M8ZN2QPWxOYr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107611',5.9,8051,'en','Mr. Jones','The story about the relationship between a manic depressive man, Mr. Jones, and the female doctor who takes more than a professional interest in his treatment.','/rmAnfar51B0qSQ1Wkix0iKtUUnx.jpg','1993-10-08',114,'Released','Everything That Makes Him Dangerous Makes Her Love Him More','Mr. Jones',2625,4.2458,5.8,'oc7XozMbR9A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12040,_binary '\0','/nddtdxD1HSYD1LabTsiV8aHVr6p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107612',3.9,10854,'en','Mr. Nanny','A former pro-wrestler is hired to be the bodyguard/nanny for a couple of bratty kids whose inventor father is being stalked by a rival.','/gSRSvh9kSEgCOsPR7yrH0ueh4lC.jpg','1993-04-02',84,'Released','He\'s big, he\'s bad, and he\'s babysitting. He doesn\'t stand a chance.','Mr. Nanny',19371,3.1444,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12041,_binary '\0','/ryFVXPn95BESMqomIHElOyeyNzD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107613',5.9,3865,'en','Mr. Wonderful','Electrician Gus gets the chance to fulfil a childhood dream by buying an old bowling-alley with some of his friends, but first he must find his ex-wife a new husband so he can stop paying alimony.','/AtUjyMEXPR41JWZzGfHEzgmrrHq.jpg','1993-10-15',98,'Released','Sometimes love is a stranger. And sometimes it\'s someone you\'ve known all your life.','Mr. Wonderful',31911,1.9972,5.6,'dD1VJZSZcF8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12042,_binary '\0','/f9X91dUckoRzOZlw4XBUOfkN9FC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107614',7.1,320132,'en','Mrs. Doubtfire','Loving but irresponsible dad Daniel Hillard, estranged from his exasperated spouse, is crushed by a court order allowing only weekly visits with his kids. When Daniel learns his ex needs a housekeeper, he gets the job -- disguised as a British nanny. Soon he becomes not only his children\'s best pal but the kind of parent he should have been from the start.','/shHrSmXS5140o6sQzgzXxn3KqSm.jpg','1993-11-24',125,'Released','She makes dinner. She does windows. She reads bedtime stories. She\'s a blessing... in disguise.','Mrs. Doubtfire',788,18.0493,7.195,'3euGQ7-brs4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12043,_binary '\0','/dktr46Mbdr2DpHmqe5ruUmiu6qN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107616',7.3,56270,'en','Much Ado About Nothing','In this Shakespearean farce, Hero and her groom-to-be, Claudio, team up with Claudio\'s commanding officer, Don Pedro, the week before their wedding to hatch a matchmaking scheme. Their targets are sharp-witted duo Benedick and Beatrice -- a tough task indeed, considering their corresponding distaste for love and each other. Meanwhile, meddling Don John plots to ruin the wedding.','/tvltGP6vYOkHdURag0jPSjhPUAV.jpg','1993-05-07',111,'Released','Romance. Mischief. Seduction. Revenge. Remarkable.','Much Ado About Nothing',11971,6.1516,6.955,'rbSN4Lv_N4g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12044,_binary '\0','/7bKppGvuhdF9BCOZWDMUFccoQU1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107617',7.3,11175,'vi','Mùi đu đủ xanh','1950s Saigon through the eyes of Mui, a Vietnamese servant girl. At 10 years-old, Mui leaves her village to work for an affluent, troubled family. As she comes of age, Mui finds work in the household of a pianist she has admired since childhood, and finds their relationship growing in complexity.','/4Pqvx6cuzF2XQrHUrIPUBVXugc3.jpg','1993-06-08',104,'Released',NULL,'The Scent of Green Papaya',19552,5.16,7.018,'xe9DorMzpEw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12045,_binary '\0','/kG1MgvsiEniPFI1sXrbYNvGONIV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107623',7,2802,'en','The Music of Chance','Two men face the consequences of gambling after playing with men beyond their league.','/qHkIzEe3sYHWSQc3XOw2v5VqsaH.jpg','1993-06-23',98,'Released','Jack Pozzi is about to take the biggest gamble of his life …','The Music of Chance',39327,2.1258,6.532,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12046,_binary '\0','/ir9KO8xWfO2HoIFyy14pTpKoLDZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107625',7.8,2354,'de','Muttertag','48 hours in the life of the Neugebauer family. The May weekend with a small family celebration, which was planned as peaceful and contemplative, turns out to be a kind of Rocky Horror Picture Show in Vienna\'s municipal housing estate. Just like the other residents, the Neugebauers are preparing for the impending Mother\'s Day.','/zC84ZItwUT31A9PR2XCvwq2SQKr.jpg','1994-02-23',99,'Released',NULL,'Mother\'s Day',15458,0.8847,7.256,'C6D-sEV0u2k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12047,_binary '\0','/nMiep7lt2slsnl85wkxM4TCzwt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107626',5.5,5597,'en','My Boyfriend\'s Back','Missy McCloud is the most beautiful girl in school and Johnny Dingle has been in love with her for years. One night, as Johnny tries to stop an armed robbery and save Missy from danger, he\'s killed, but resurrected as a zombie not long after. Now, with the help of his mentor, self-proclaimed Zombie Expert Maggie, Johnny must control his flesh-eating urges while trying to win the heart of Missy.','/euXyMbBT2QaxiYZf1jJrsa5yGon.jpg','1993-08-06',85,'Released','A comedy that proves true love never dies.','My Boyfriend\'s Back',31503,2.9448,5.7,'UiYWlnCswrk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12048,_binary '\0','/5ccAivPcFEJazxwZZnr5QOGNcz6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107630',6.8,13082,'en','My Life','It seems that Bob Jones has everything a man could want, namely a fulfilling job and a beautiful, pregnant wife, Gail. But Bob\'s life is turned upside-down when he is diagnosed with cancer and given four months to live -- not even enough time to see his first child\'s birth. To cleanse himself of demons in his remaining days, Bob makes a video diary, hoping to pass along some wisdom to his future child. Along the way, he discovers a lot about himself.','/eF8wNMMqY3kukUTTAVXLLx94UhB.jpg','1993-11-12',114,'Released','Every moment counts.','My Life',41659,3.7198,6.7,'XGdlCrkscMA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12049,_binary '\0','/fjFsPT76Mxpe74hSErVamagHVWd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107642',6.1,1274,'fr','Métisse','Lola is pregnant, and she isn’t sure who the father is: Félix, a Jewish delivery boy, or Jamal, a black law student.','/ojNzabwK0IaAVIjQwcNhxBNYRmr.jpg','1993-08-18',95,'Released','A Tasty French Blend.','Métisse',47507,1.1414,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12050,_binary '\0','/uIh3mW3AuSM7ww7NYtvSWDQ1zc7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107653',7.6,49392,'en','Naked','An unemployed Brit vents his rage on unsuspecting strangers as he embarks on a nocturnal London odyssey.','/xMYP4uaNeyPmX4FQ2xxWk2eIN6K.jpg','1993-08-06',131,'Released','When unbalance leads to submission','Naked',21450,6.0054,7.285,'TdKPbyvS0qc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12051,_binary '\0','/vYq0sXktMc9zwSiAsRCYwRlayk3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107659',6.2,53717,'en','National Lampoon\'s Loaded Weapon 1','An LA detective is murdered because she has microfilm with the recipe to make cocaine cookies. Two cops partner to find and stop the fiends before they can dope the nation by distributing their wares via the \'Wilderness Girls\' cookie drive.','/moP0nyVWVisqSeH6nMewWyIPV6z.jpg','1993-02-04',84,'Released','Oh my God. They have guns!','National Lampoon\'s Loaded Weapon 1',9644,6.4833,6.068,'Xtz0Zw0eSkA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12052,_binary '\0','/1iBMzeqVOudzAQDEy0NuLg4NRTh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107664',5.9,7723,'en','Necronomicon','H.P. Lovecraft anthology is divided into four segments: \"The Library\" which is the wraparound segment involving Lovecraft\'s research into the Book of The Dead and his unwitting release of a monster and his writing of the following horror segments \"The Drowned\", \"The Cold\", and \"Whispers\".','/ryV8xeOHvRiPBVsSwb8jqwGZeuC.jpg','1993-11-01',96,'Released',NULL,'Necronomicon',32998,3.0191,5.9,'rGxIJF3qwIs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12053,_binary '\0','/cFm73y9i3ijvlQIgp5o1vzRVHQv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107665',6.3,30852,'en','Needful Things','A mysterious new shop opens in a small town which always seems to stock the deepest desires of each shopper, with a price far heavier than expected.','/9RxE6kd1ky4689WxqX6CHEpIWya.jpg','1993-08-27',121,'Released','Buy now. Pay later.','Needful Things',10657,6.71,6.3,'ZCDFTT1S67Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12054,_binary '\0','/dTyneeUtfK1h8t48lNX8M5geJxf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107668',5.5,7879,'en','Nemesis','In the future, chaos is rampant as \'information terrorists\' threaten to destroy order in society. Alex is a part-man, part-machine LAPD cop who is the best at what he does. When one of the terrorists calls him a machine, Alex questions his humanity and decides to leave the force. His final assignment is to apprehend an old colleague who has stolen some data. However, there is more than meets the eye and Alex must question his allegiance.','/znPIbermRgSXgjArNxhO8mb0Ba6.jpg','1992-12-26',96,'Released','In the future... it pays to be more than human.','Nemesis',24230,4.5885,5.414,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12055,_binary '\0','/gvlg0uh7KP7cgliqzBJvkWa9go2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107685',6,2889,'en','The Night We Never Met','Sam has a problem with his roommates: they are disgusting, and don\'t seem to share his views on responsibility, privacy, and basic hygine. Such is his discomfort with his living arrangements that he agrees to share the occupancy of another flat: he gets two nights a week, the owner (a sleazy frat-boy yuppie named Brian, soon to be married) and Ellen (a would-be painter seeking relief from her boring marriage) each get their seperate nights in the flat. Things go extremely well until Sam and Brian swap nights without telling Ellen, who attributes the \"nice\" things that happen around the place to the slob Brian, while berating the responsible Sam for his hedonistic lifestyle.','/hE76yhW9dOzweQJxSZEZRI6hWqw.jpg','1993-04-30',99,'Released','A comedy with room for romance.','The Night We Never Met',41661,2.1553,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12056,_binary '\0','/dSfrsjhqC6lYe7LYDYnzWeXZmEl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107688',7.9,415518,'en','The Nightmare Before Christmas','Tired of scaring humans every October 31 with the same old bag of tricks, Jack Skellington, the spindly king of Halloween Town, kidnaps Santa Claus and plans to deliver shrunken heads and other ghoulish gifts to children on Christmas morning. But as Christmas approaches, Jack\'s rag-doll girlfriend, Sally, tries to foil his misguided plans.','/oQffRNjK8e19rF7xVYEN8ew0j7b.jpg','1993-10-09',76,'Released',NULL,'The Nightmare Before Christmas',9479,27.766,7.842,'IoYahD_xNR0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12057,_binary '\0','/mOd8oNCNyKOXs58FzdD1pPygWD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107692',7.8,45295,'ja','獣兵衛忍風帖','Jubei is a masterless ninja who travels the land alone, lending his services to those with gold—or a worthy cause. His fearsome abilities have served him well, but a plot to overthrow the government threatens to end his wandering ways—and possibly his life.','/qzZEnaXwv4wss2QalEo4Uf9BAwh.jpg','1993-06-05',94,'Released','Feudal Japan—a time of danger, intrigue and deception . . .','Ninja Scroll',14282,5.4519,7.779,'CeYwh-Xz1KU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12058,_binary '\0','/5VF6N8dPSSPeyQdQoQ53mxDcUjw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107711',5.7,28321,'en','Nowhere to Run','Escaped convict Sam Gillen single-handedly takes on ruthless developers who are determined to evict a widow with two young children.','/a2FGbyzk2dTAlu37iGeQBbUjLLE.jpg','1993-01-15',94,'Released','When the law can\'t protect the innocent, the only hero left is an outlaw.','Nowhere to Run',10413,7.7435,6.6,'4E3jLN30b78','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12059,_binary '\0','/4kfbvA3KgGQshNGfmRqIAO28dyw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107715',1.8,1557,'en','Nukie','A space child, lost in the universe, is abducted by the U. S. Space Foundation. In a desperate intergalactic search for the frightened little alien, his brother Nukie® mistakenly lands in Africa where he is befriended by African twins. Together they journey through the laughter and adventure of talking lions, a greedy witch doctor, a charming chimpanzee, a feisty nun, a compassionate scientist and an outrageous romantic computer named E.D.D.I.','/oZOcdnjbFMg4XrMyGifqt5ankbP.jpg','1987-07-01',99,'Released','A Magical Space Adventure','Nukie',84626,1.2622,2.2,'qolVwFie4E4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12060,_binary '\0','/sKIGsGE6qyLCj72YlhtYIndyOB0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107719',6,2867,'en','The Nutcracker','On Christmas Eve, a little girl named Marie falls asleep and dreams herself into a fantastic world in which her toys become larger than life. She meets up with the Nutcracker Prince who takes her on a journey to his kingdom and defends her from the Mouse King.','/mKGGzL6o27cOurOO0gCUopDCxts.jpg','1993-11-24',92,'Released','The joy of the New York City Ballet in an exciting family holiday motion picture.','The Nutcracker',73191,1.6507,5.8,'7PZCAbeShow','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12061,_binary '\0','/iJtbO8WvdcZN69XPTQP2585lvvT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107736',7.6,1950,'ja','お引越し','Physically separated from her father and at odds with her distraught mother, a girl must negotiate her own passage to maturity.','/mrtukTgoK0n7KFyOZ2ThI6S9k1O.jpg','1993-03-20',124,'Released',NULL,'Moving',115784,2.2702,7.5,'zekp4_PGoU0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12062,_binary '\0','/cYtqxGTbUJzhtSp62eVA7fiuPZ6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107745',6.5,6551,'en','Once Upon a Forest','A young mouse, mole and hedgehog risk their lives to find a cure for their badger friend, who\'s been poisoned by men.','/aGmed955Bv1ok2YBjjhAA71b7OF.jpg','1993-06-18',71,'Released','An adventurous race against time!','Once Upon a Forest',33539,4.8082,6.5,'hLKuBn7_Clw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12063,_binary '\0','/k7wQcxa6KN5EmAdxj1tWgy7odBg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107750',6.6,7639,'en','Only the Strong','Former Green Beret Louis Stevens returns to his hometown of Miami after completing military service in Brazil, only to learn that his old high school has become a haven for gangs and drug dealers. After Stevens uses his capoeira skills to kick several drug dealers off of the school property, Kerrigan, one of Stevens\' old teachers, sees the impact that Stevens has on the students. Kerrigan gives him the task of teaching Capoeira to a handful of the worst at-risk students at the school.','/pPWV5rBhCgzlzhwkpdRG7a7UZqt.jpg','1993-08-27',99,'Released','The ultimate martial art.','Only the Strong',15797,4.8872,6.919,'tJRLI_O9Reo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12064,_binary '\0','/AoMYwa8yRvXcbRKdD5s8VwIN3NA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107756',7.1,21308,'en','Orlando','England, 1600. Queen Elizabeth I promises Orlando, a young nobleman obsessed with poetry, that she will grant him land and fortune if he agrees to satisfy a very particular request.','/seRawEs8eQ8rWfkBm6QC39EQEAU.jpg','1992-12-11',94,'Released',NULL,'Orlando',9300,4.3816,6.94,'MorOaD61KUI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12065,_binary '\0','/pxj9HLInMRdKieUnUKYJA75KRva.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107777',5.1,1338,'hi','Parampara','In a remote region in India there has been a tradition of settling differences by fighting a duel with pistols with only one bullet in each of them. Such was the duel fought by Shankar and Thakur Bhavani Singh, with the latter emerging as the victor. Years later, Bhavani\'s son, Prithvi, returns from London, meets Shankar\'s son, Gora and daughter, Tara, befriends them, and eventually both Tara and Prithvi fall in love with each other. When Bhavani finds this out, he wants Prithvi to marry Rajeshwari, who comes from a rich family, and will destroy Gora Shankar and his tribe of gypsies. Unable to make up his mind, Prithvi ends up marrying both women, leading to Tara giving birth to a son, Pratap. Bhavani is enraged when he this out, he has Tara and a lot of their people slain, and their homes torched. Gora himself is arrested by the police, and sentenced to several years in prison...','/fXmOtJpndCBMx9qRYmwMTHHP7Vk.jpg','1993-05-14',155,'Released',NULL,'Parampara',159655,1.1876,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12066,_binary '\0','/dMFVSGbgtVTedpewA4PHykQuEEK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107798',6.7,105438,'en','The Pelican Brief','A law student\'s theory about the recent deaths of two Supreme Court justices embroils her in a far-reaching web of murder, corruption, and greed.','/7B1HS0SqfJR1jbeHS6V0ZWdzLXP.jpg','1993-09-17',141,'Released','Two Supreme Court Justices have been assassinated. One lone law student has stumbled upon the truth. An investigative journalist wants her story. Everybody else wants her dead.','The Pelican Brief',9944,11.1584,6.594,'MgmItLPfdO4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12067,_binary '\0','/xTZvY5qVsOKinCuYgx9GZ9opXiM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107808',7.5,94759,'en','A Perfect World','A kidnapped boy strikes up a friendship with his captor: an escaped convict on the run from the law, headed by an honorable U.S. Marshal.','/kWX2CYM5TbWaZwll4ysh7OjVUmJ.jpg','1993-11-24',138,'Released','A convict. A cop. A hostage that will make one of them a hero.','A Perfect World',9559,9.0867,7.5,'_Qm-UhA3b4g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12068,_binary '\0','/nWO4sGqH950N2fij8X0Pwumqe9k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107818',7.7,276865,'en','Philadelphia','Two competing lawyers join forces to sue a prestigious law firm for AIDS discrimination. As their unlikely friendship develops, their courage overcomes the prejudice and corruption of their powerful adversaries.','/tFe5Yoo5zT495okA49bq1vPPkiV.jpg','1993-12-22',126,'Released','No one would take on his case... until one man was willing to take on the system.','Philadelphia',9800,8.5822,7.702,'qf49UApA88s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12069,_binary '\0','/uIiFTa0jkv9MN8eNfCNNJCqD88g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107819',4.5,2420,'en','Philadelphia Experiment II','It is several years after the events of the first movie, and David Herdeg (the survivor of the Philadelphia Experiment from the first film) and Allison (the woman from 1984 he fell in love with) have married and have a child. David awakes, in agony, to a changed world. Germany won World War II and the United States is now about to mark 50 years as a Nazi conquest.','/6zRtsii1KQuF2KvSda6IDYBEVJg.jpg','1993-11-12',97,'Released','They cut a hole through time','Philadelphia Experiment II',35610,1.8294,5.2,'9NA3R7as_Ts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12070,_binary '\0','/c2O99arhWcuLexMHiuRfSuDMpYm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107822',7.5,102526,'en','The Piano','When an arranged marriage brings Ada and her spirited pre-teen daughter Flora to the wilderness of 19th-century New Zealand, she finds herself locked in a battle of wills with both her controlling husband and a rugged frontiersman to whom she develops a forbidden attraction.','/rx8RKXn8OtuS6lqloYsjyrGOUp4.jpg','1993-05-18',120,'Released','Silence affects everyone in the end.','The Piano',713,8.8928,7.4,'61ooIf1QDZo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12071,_binary '\0','/lNvlerKoYwboltmK7hQfgxsYtNP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107840',6.2,18714,'en','Poetic Justice','Still grieving after the murder of her boyfriend, hairdresser Justice writes poetry to deal with the pain of her loss. Unable to get to Oakland to attend a convention because of her broken-down car, Justice gets a lift with her friend, Iesha, and Iesha\'s postal worker boyfriend, Chicago. Along for the ride is Chicago\'s co-worker, Lucky, to whom Justice grows close after some initial problems. But is she ready to open her heart again?','/6jE7Vzh3edBQtbbDcF4AC5gMX2g.jpg','1993-07-23',109,'Released','\'Cause nobody, but nobody can make it out here alone.','Poetic Justice',8291,4.9749,6.7,'XkI_0pJlLl0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12072,_binary '\0','/vmd31t5Jk3R0MNXnroPOuhxSTJN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107843',6.1,32364,'en','Point of No Return','Hardened criminal Maggie Hayward\'s consistent violence, even in police custody, ends in the execution chamber. However, top-secret US government agent \'Bob\' arranges a staged death, so Maggie can be elaborately trained as a phantom killer and subdued into obedience.','/m8hefEVK6WHiCbMUBeHU0yZbQLB.jpg','1993-03-19',108,'Released','The government gave her a choice. Death. Or life as an assassin. Now, there\'s no turning back.','Point of No Return',10498,6.5189,6.2,'GUXSN2ZOKw8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12073,_binary '\0','/xZGnbvAOE58LshePSNa9tXPmi9d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107846',5.9,1451,'sv','Polis polis potatismos','A famous industrialist is murdered at a restaurant in the city of Malmö. Police inspector Martin Beck from the city of Stockholm gets the case. The suspects lead to people involved in illegal arms deals. But who was the biggest criminal, the murderer or the industrialist?','/ahgMECYF4Knw5yIzYkLBTlovsld.jpg','1993-10-06',91,'Released',NULL,'Murder at the Savoy',34527,1.2749,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12074,_binary '\0','/zKBcDIzOEKe9INmRBnD19dbWd2Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107861',6.6,1544,'en','The Positively True Adventures of the Alleged Texas Cheerleader-Murdering Mom','A Texas housewife plots hire a hit man to kill the girl who beat out her daughter for a place on the cheerleading squad.','/yxzuKYuujQo0a8PNjKV4DRpqWR4.jpg','1993-04-10',99,'Released','She wanted to give her daughter the best shot at being a cheerleader... The things you do for your kids.','The Positively True Adventures of the Alleged Texas Cheerleader-Murdering Mom',67595,2.1287,6.4,'WB_ZlOgmS7c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12075,_binary '\0','/ayMTC0J0hDcucG7CywvbhrOFFXi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107863',5.6,5369,'en','Posse','A group of mostly black infantrymen return from the Spanish-American War with a cache of gold. They travel to the West where their leader searches for the men who lynched his father.','/rdlqu3eweNIa9CHpyysASyh5AtE.jpg','1993-05-14',111,'Released','The untold story of the wild west.','Posse',36233,3.4471,5.5,'3q70xYEopMI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12076,_binary '\0','/qmvT44mdN8gcTuZZYxoKSghvmyI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107870',4.7,2465,'en','Prehysteria!','A young boy and his family embark on a series of adventures when the boy finds some mysterious eggs which hatch to reveal a brood of baby dinosaurs.','/uZ70Mx9Psd0ciVJvTnuQxqNy4bZ.jpg','1993-06-30',84,'Released','The Family Movie You\'ve Been Waiting Ages For!','Prehysteria!',79500,1.9862,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12077,_binary '\0','/x1XWqlbmfSrOPiZ81An6MFjO3Aq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107875',6.7,3594,'en','The Princess and the Goblin','The story is about the Princess Irene and a young warrior boy named Curty. Irene must use her magic power to fight off goblins and save the kingdom.','/gWXeEzpOavcmv1Ca8sjqkorfuIO.jpg','1991-06-03',82,'Released','An enchanting princess, an outrageous goblin, a magical adventure for the entire family!','The Princess and the Goblin',42001,2.77,5.8,'8pkH11310rw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12078,_binary '\0','/xuUDm3AGTaCxN9I8x6GxKtBlYfO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107889',6.5,12377,'en','The Program','Several players from different backgrounds try to cope with the pressures of playing football at a major university. Each deals with the pressure differently, some turn to drinking, others to drugs, and some to studying.','/4pdbutHc9SLEPmdLKtlVffiLByP.jpg','1993-09-24',112,'Released','Pressure surrounds them. Competition divides them. Glory unites them.','The Program',18133,2.7693,6.5,'dBOwtSdtAYg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12079,_binary '\0','/icnXFrLWlwuWqXeMR863z6SxOyW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107920',7.3,5334,'en','Raining Stones','Proud, though poor, Bob wants his little girl to have a beautiful (and costly) brand-new dress for her First Communion. His stubbornness and determination get him into trouble as he turns to increasingly questionable measures, in his desperation to raise the needed money. This tragic flaw leads him to risk all that he loves and values, his beloved family, indeed even his immortal soul and salvation, in blind pursuit of that goal.','/6mn9rCxmslIThAVEqDc6IYY3tZb.jpg','1993-09-09',90,'Released','It would be funny if it didn\'t hurt so much.','Raining Stones',62463,1.745,6.9,'IYv5M6A_ERk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12080,_binary '\0','/fWuOFLP57Zapja5AqInxjDezdT2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107927',5.5,10481,'en','The Real McCoy','Karen McCoy is released from prison with nothing but the clothes on her back. Before being incarcerated, Karen was the bank robber of her time, but now she wishes for nothing more than to settle down and start a new life. Unfortunately, between a dirty parole officer, old business partners, and an idiot ex, she will have to do the unthinkable in order to save her son.','/qORwfGUYZNHAuYfLaff8YpO32Vd.jpg','1993-09-10',100,'Released','20 guards. 30 tons of steel. A security system second to none. They said there wasn\'t a man on Earth who could pull off a bank job like this. They were right.','The Real McCoy',2047,5.5507,5.709,'At15r1-YUYQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12081,_binary '\0','/qFI9KvwobyqsdEeRXBX2OffMLPZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107930',5.1,1934,'en','Reckless Kelly','A satirical take on a modern day Ned Kelly who is forced to Hollywood in order to make enough money to save his family\'s land. As it goes against his belief, he cannot simply rob banks for his own benefit (all money goes to the poor). Ned is forced to find another way to come up with the $1 million required to save his family island.','/ufTt0YqzlZvNjht4YVEqzXWtaXK.jpg','1993-04-08',103,'Released','The incredible untold story of the greatest outlaw of all time.','Reckless Kelly',44664,1.9526,4.6,'QIZ5xAXo-Y0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12082,_binary '\0','/vFhxd3Z1zaV3Yu5XLpvWzSxJCe8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107943',7.8,94179,'en','The Remains of the Day','A rule-bound head butler\'s world of manners and decorum in the household he maintains is tested by the arrival of a housekeeper who falls in love with him in post-WWI Britain. The possibility of romance and his master\'s cultivation of ties with the Nazi cause challenge his carefully maintained veneer of servitude.','/uDGDtqSvuch324WnM7Ukdp1bCAQ.jpg','1993-11-05',134,'Released','Diamond in the Rough.','The Remains of the Day',1245,7.8571,7.4,'jALmEb72beg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12083,_binary '\0','/gB6TPrzf8PwKFdkFuEQuKgG8Xyr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107953',5.9,18765,'en','Return of the Living Dead III','Having recently witnessed the horrific results of a top secret project to bring the dead back to life, a distraught teenager performs the operation on his girlfriend after she\'s killed in a motorcycle accident.','/lu4Eit7pR5I8hGHJmy3K9Re8FPo.jpg','1993-10-01',97,'Released','She\'s to die for.','Return of the Living Dead III',28260,6.1027,6.6,'PJypjaGuXKo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12084,_binary '\0','/dmaLmrP3PYfhb8P2SWMucZCZqjk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107969',6.3,50693,'en','Rising Sun','When a prostitute is found dead in a Los Angeles skyscraper occupied by a large Japanese corporation, detectives John Connor and Web Smith are called in to investigate. Although Connor has previous experience working in Japan, cultural differences make their progress difficult until a security disc showing the murder turns up. Close scrutiny proves the disc has been doctored, and the detectives realize they\'re dealing with a cover-up as well.','/jVWEeZ383peKxwE284AdyHqq6GH.jpg','1993-07-30',129,'Released','A collision of East and West. A conspiracy of seduction and murder. A battle between tradition and power. Business is war.','Rising Sun',7007,6.4419,6.2,'4gPr_qix-po','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12085,_binary '\0','/xFhpZ9UDUGXu52lCHdN39PIooRt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107977',6.7,147324,'en','Robin Hood: Men in Tights','Robin Hood comes home after fighting in the Crusades to learn that the noble King Richard is in exile and that the despotic King John now rules England, with the help of the Sheriff of Rottingham. Robin Hood assembles a band of fellow patriots to do battle with King John and the Sheriff.','/woexOLEkUlYsPLLuZRK6LjZaF38.jpg','1993-07-28',104,'Released','The legend had it coming...','Robin Hood: Men in Tights',8005,9.1621,6.6,'rL_aElj93ws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000');
INSERT INTO `movies` VALUES (12086,_binary '\0','/uxYlITKYX1x1lhMpYiH60Z8Udu8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107978',4.2,57850,'en','RoboCop 3','The mega corporation Omni Consumer Products is still bent on creating their pet project, Delta City, to replace the rotting city of Detroit. Unfortunately, the inhabitants of the area have no intention of abandoning their homes simply for desires of the company. To this end, OCP have decided to force them to leave by employing a ruthless mercenary army to attack and harass them. An underground resistance begins and in this fight, RoboCop must decide where his loyalties lie.','/ppLSSwCuC5ERRWbu9H3R8SPL9AM.jpg','1993-01-21',105,'Released','He\'s back. Back on line. Back on duty.','RoboCop 3',5550,6.9506,4.9,'VWBo9-YtSQs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12087,_binary '\0','/p6EDOwLkTwM5BOe2wBndOoFvTja.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107979',4,1898,'en','Robot Wars','In the year 2041, the rebel Centros are a plague to the survivors of the great toxic gas scare of 1993. A renegade Megarobot pilot and an archaeologist must team up (despite personal differences, a reluctant romance, and official pressure to cease and desist) to thwart the Centro\'s attempts to resurrect a hidden Megarobot, with which they can challenge the prevailing order.','/wFMbece9Zl1hMgFegROfruDIfGD.jpg','1993-04-28',67,'Released','First There Was ROBOT JOX...','Robot Wars',40487,1.6268,4.2,'3sDi4ktmY4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12088,_binary '\0','/bI6fptNOG0mS2pNNZgbZSxuVaPN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107983',6.5,17031,'en','Romeo Is Bleeding','A corrupt cop gets in over his head when he tries to assassinate a beautiful Russian hit-woman.','/ojXNRpHMXU99UFmF9MKKiJCymKr.jpg','1993-09-13',110,'Released','The story of a cop who wanted it bad and got it worse.','Romeo Is Bleeding',2088,5.9652,6.2,'SNlEZjsY8Y8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12089,_binary '\0','/AsiZIxTfcSSj2Ti9s88F17pzjrF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107985',6.1,34504,'en','Rookie of the Year','When the cast comes off his once broken arm, a 12-year-old boy can throw a 100-mile-an-hour fastball, and the Chicago Cubs want him as their new pitcher.','/9If8XnhBdEbQ2Q0ggAQC92CptjU.jpg','1993-07-07',103,'Released','The Chicago Cubs needed a miracle... They got Henry Rowengartner.','Rookie of the Year',21845,6.3512,6.2,'8XyXypaFO4c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12090,_binary '\0','/mQKk1iPQPBUBxqA5uYGCGECywbn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107989',6.2,1478,'sv','Roseanna','A young American girl is found dead in Gota Kanal, Swedens largest channel. Since there are hardly any clues or evidence at all it seems as if the murder cant be solved. Martin Beck and his men are assigned to the case. Soon they find a likely suspect and together with a police woman they begin a cat and mouse game to catch him. Plot by Mattias Pettersson.','/creoNMQxbSKvyjeulmRhXI4bfDu.jpg','1993-10-06',95,'Released',NULL,'Roseanna',34645,1.0224,6.1,'L_Lj5DGaPCg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12091,_binary '\0','/a2f8TYB0is0VU4VQve9wcwhzyic.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0107999',5,2762,'en','Ruby Cairo','Baseball cards and a food-aid worker help a woman follow her shady husband\'s money trail around the world.','/m04N3KefWQ1bQF9kHWMgItKJYdi.jpg','1992-12-12',91,'Released','Adults play the most dangerous games.','Ruby Cairo',69035,1.9466,5.012,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12092,_binary '\0','/zcPBI0vCuYkG9ml8E3loZPtI7Ye.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108000',6.9,3452,'en','Ruby in Paradise','Reeling from her mother\'s recent death, Ruby Lee Gissing relocates to Florida to start anew. After finding a job at a souvenir store, Ruby becomes friends with the shop\'s owner, Mildred Chambers, and slowly acclimates to her new surroundings. Before long, she\'s juggling the affections of Mildred\'s Lothario son, Ricky, and the good-natured Mike. As she wavers between Ricky and Mike, Ruby also tries to come to terms with her past.','/gk0vbIVYwpXxSf1wQbS2r9IsBoV.jpg','1993-10-08',114,'Released','A woman\'s search for herself.','Ruby in Paradise',47889,2.038,6,'4G5MY_T-CBY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12093,_binary '\0','/flzoI6jEw7J0X5x2rwOMZCwZ57I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108002',7.5,75614,'en','Rudy','Rudy grew up in a steel mill town where most people ended up working, but wanted to play football at Notre Dame instead. There were only a couple of problems. His grades were a little low, his athletic skills were poor, and he was only half the size of the other players. But he had the drive and the spirit of 5 people and has set his sights upon joining the team.','/fAbfTCRpjHe2rprXBly55KL1dL9.jpg','1993-09-17',114,'Released','It\'s not the size of the dog in the fight, It\'s the size of the fight in the dog.','Rudy',14534,5.6602,7.35,'7YKYFz-0a1E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12094,_binary '\0','/wVJIqHyWPY90pktbYMbdWiX902c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108026',7,3104,'en','The Saint of Fort Washington','Matthew, a young schizophrenic, finds himself out on the street when a slumlord tears down his apartment building. Soon, he finds himself in even more dire straits, when he is threatened by Little Leroy, a thug who is one of the tough denizens of the Fort Washington Shelter for Men. He reaches out to Jerry, a streetwise combat veteran, who takes Matthew under his wing as a son. The relationship between these two men grows as they attempt to conquer the numbing isolation of homelessness.','/e8ie1x22wFEo63LQBbpBDqIH4oY.jpg','1993-11-03',99,'Released',NULL,'The Saint of Fort Washington',56583,2.491,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12095,_binary '\0','/wjxyKpUAZu6OVbKx9krhgI9KMl2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108037',7.8,117639,'en','The Sandlot','During a summer of friendship and adventure, one boy becomes a part of the gang, nine boys become a team and their leader becomes a legend by confronting the terrifying mystery beyond the right field wall.','/7PYqz0viEuW8qTvuGinUMjDWMnj.jpg','1993-04-07',101,'Released','They\'re more than a team. They\'re the best buddies in the entire history of the world.','The Sandlot',11528,7.9719,7.564,'52yV9dSzV1E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12096,_binary '\0','/nYPswdKSM7NehFux74bLuWdCLIh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108045',4.2,1290,'en','Save Me','An accountant beleaguered by personal and professional problems gets involved with a femme fatale and her mysterious psychiatrist.','/1Df1aeTtxDH6jQsXLAFvwEBslpJ.jpg','1994-03-23',93,'Released',NULL,'Save Me',30361,2.7093,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12097,_binary '\0','/zb6fM1CX41D9rF9hdgclu0peUmy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108052',9,1603014,'en','Schindler\'s List','The true story of how businessman Oskar Schindler saved over a thousand Jewish lives from the Nazis while they worked as slaves in his factory during World War II.','/sF1U4EUQS8YHUYjNl3pMGNIQyr0.jpg','1993-12-15',195,'Released','Whoever saves one life, saves the world entire.','Schindler\'s List',424,31.1797,8.569,'kXYcYhckXD8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12098,_binary '\0','/8eeProseSvUSMPr1WNWPuRAp93S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108053',5.7,3861,'de','Schramm','Lothar Schramm is a simple man with complex problems, yet he seems like such a nice guy. He works as a taxi driver and lives by himself where he is happy to answer his door to strangers and kill them outright. As with many shy loner types he has a problem dealing with women so he drugs them and photographs their nude bodies for sexual stimulation. He then murders his helpless victims and so goes the life of a deranged serial killer.','/xMZlbJmohBzuWY4DNT7eUcFZqxD.jpg','1993-01-01',65,'Released','Into the Mind of a Serial Killer','Schramm',39883,1.4258,5.8,'i7vkJJWIB54','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12099,_binary '\0','/swXvzkH1oSVHh4flmcthXnusbwc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108065',7.3,45094,'en','Searching for Bobby Fischer','A seven-year-old chess prodigy refuses to harden himself in order to become a champion like the famous but unlikable Bobby Fischer.','/oAJpHkMpfXiFY9F3HocIz9fhHLc.jpg','1993-08-13',110,'Released','Every journey begins with a single move.','Searching for Bobby Fischer',14291,4.2567,7.1,'8khmNiamBxo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12100,_binary '\0','/yJ4PMGCOSIi69GqIYXa4Ll7X7DP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108069',7.2,1719,'en','The Secret Adventures of Tom Thumb','A boy born the size of a small doll is kidnapped by a genetic lab and must find a way back to his father in this inventive adventure filmed using stop motion animation techniques.','/98yogK8pBvjqpQ7mtohuaBMLUJv.jpg','1993-12-10',61,'Released','A nursery crime of epic proportions...','The Secret Adventures of Tom Thumb',18242,1.5648,6.5,'t8G_imDKpVA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12101,_binary '\0','/8s7FJ9dHXgeFZdvxfjPmrrJh6EC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108071',7.3,47790,'en','The Secret Garden','A young British girl born and reared in India loses her neglectful parents in an earthquake. She is returned to England to live at her uncle\'s castle. Her uncle is very distant due to the loss of his wife ten years before. Neglected once again, she begins exploring the estate and discovers a garden that has been locked and forgotten. Aided by one of the servants\' boys, she begins restoring the garden, and eventually discovers some other secrets of the manor.','/zf6h5dJ7wVG7LqMO9dhHGHVejzj.jpg','1993-08-13',101,'Released','The timeless tale of a special place where magic, hope and love grow.','The Secret Garden',11236,6.3938,7.4,'1zeqqhA5Z3A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12102,_binary '\0','/fSUsuiI6wYxMB4KgxgEIULc9Mx1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108074',6.9,3701,'cn','射鵰英雄傳之東成西就','A power struggle between the Queen\'s treasonous lover and a princess occurs amid musical numbers, slapstick battles, and martial arts acrobatics.','/lnlJkAlnw5AovZ0S5Zbp8m6YPjm.jpg','1993-02-05',103,'Released',NULL,'The Eagle Shooting Heroes',55157,3.3668,7.1,'cDkAutq7iKM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12103,_binary '\0','/nna1FWMle9WUd0lg3qJWog1NBbe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108101',7.3,21733,'en','Shadowlands','C.S. Lewis, a world-renowned writer and professor, leads a passionless life until he meets spirited poet Joy Gresham.','/5jTWY1M2O4Zhid4rLOpftzazRGn.jpg','1993-12-25',131,'Released','He distanced himself from love as he distanced himself from pain, until one woman got close enough to open his heart to the world.','Shadowlands',10445,3.3613,6.9,'-zfkmfRX4X4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12104,_binary '\0','/a0OjGWE9ru1OlKLBujbz3mAYYxU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108122',7.6,50332,'en','Short Cuts','Many loosely connected characters cross paths in this film, based on the stories of Raymond Carver. Waitress Doreen Piggot accidentally runs into a boy with her car. Soon after walking away, the child lapses into a coma. While at the hospital, the boy\'s grandfather tells his son, Howard, about his past affairs. Meanwhile, a baker starts harassing the family when they fail to pick up the boy\'s birthday cake.','/mbNTvbtWfV4soyErimDTdX67OAr.jpg','1993-10-01',188,'Released','From two American masters comes a movie like no other','Short Cuts',695,4.6984,7.2,'ePyhGz9_RCI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12105,_binary '\0','/gjfiRbLg0PV6aLpHOtscL9rL9mx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108135',5.2,1413,'en','Silent Tongue','Mad with grief after the death of his Kiowa wife, Roe awaits death under a tree with her body beside him. She begins to haunt him because he won\'t bury her. His father, who bought him the wife, thinks her sister might reason with Roe.','/9BqpMgVDdvfCK68cgcZGSpf7IzH.jpg','1994-02-01',102,'Released','Justice can never be silenced.','Silent Tongue',143547,1.9223,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12106,_binary '\0','/12JrrgaGeatoaCsHMwxLbBgzBIA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108137',5.8,1441,'en','The Silver Brumby','A mother tells her daughter a fable about the prince of the brumbies, brumby being a term for the feral horses of Australia, who must find its place among its kind, while one man makes it his mission to capture it and tame it. Australian adaptation of Elyne Mitchell\'s \"The silver Brumby\".','/uw5Cy8I0pbwg2dPFza1FAnXKyB3.jpg','1993-09-16',93,'Released','The magic of the mountain. The obsession of a man. The beauty of the Silver Brumby.','The Silver Brumby',43757,2.4385,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12107,_binary '\0','/vgVzQyOVU5QDSbEPkilPVg8IS41.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108147',5.8,64378,'en','Sister Act 2: Back in the Habit','Deloris Van Cartier is again asked to don the nun\'s habit to help a run-down Catholic school, presided over by Mother Superior. And if trying to reach out to a class full of uninterested students wasn\'t bad enough, the sisters discover that the school is due to be closed by the unscrupulous chief of a local authority.','/dlkBp5S6Ei5f54031rAhyb4IwML.jpg','1993-12-09',107,'Released','The holy terror is back!','Sister Act 2: Back in the Habit',6279,11.7821,6.371,'_QcgjGyRnuw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12108,_binary '\0','/YmNqLZwBs3KB81Wpk30fh8faxe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108148',7.5,18282,'cn','黃飛鴻之鐵馬騮','In this Hong Kong variation of Robin Hood, corrupt officials of a Chinese village are robbed by a masked bandit known as \"Iron Monkey\", named after a benevolent deity. When all else fails, the Governor forces a traveling physician into finding the bandit.','/qXYISomt08V5PUqCzYRLVSQZmWP.jpg','1993-09-03',90,'Released','Unmask the legend.','Iron Monkey',12780,3.4982,7.4,'B9-OQqbVkU8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12109,_binary '\0','/e9L5dpi41k3YkbavwgOGXnQGCe1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108149',6.7,24422,'en','Six Degrees of Separation','The story of a young, gay, black, con artist who, posing as the son of Sidney Poitier, cunningly maneuvers his way into the lives of a white, upper-class New York family.','/bROsFCnsHr0e09M7VA0aCcNF432.jpg','1993-12-08',112,'Released','For Paul, every person is a new door to a new world.','Six Degrees of Separation',23210,5.0259,6.39,'IBO1Sr14eQQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12110,_binary '\0','/zYX8Jz6cKf73KPJTqhMgHih9CdB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108159',7.2,1241,'en','Skylark','Jacob\'s farm is in trouble from a severe drought. Jacob and Sarah begin to wonder if Sarah can stay, and what will happen to Jacob if she and the children have to leave the farm.','/jVOPrMs9lK3nYFyL3Tj15vjOyhP.jpg','1993-02-07',95,'Released',NULL,'Skylark',15759,1.5322,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12111,_binary '\0','/yX9qKcfU6J1yRY53U4tTPCzu5Ue.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108160',6.8,209873,'en','Sleepless in Seattle','After the death of his mother, a young boy calls a radio station in an attempt to set his father up on a date. Across the country, an engaged woman becomes convinced that they belong together, despite their never having met. Will their paths collide despite the odds?','/jAXfku1u1uaLGh4cUmK0ESf1pPu.jpg','1993-06-24',105,'Released','What if someone you never met, someone you never saw, someone you never knew was the only someone for you?','Sleepless in Seattle',858,14.0638,6.7,'2bnxHgO59A4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12112,_binary '\0','/zu09Mwoo69qwHpcj3gNtKntgUB7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108162',5.1,38093,'en','Sliver','A woman moves into a Manhattan apartment, where she learns that the previous tenant\'s life ended under mysterious circumstances.','/g7PC2e2KqDkIfOoJx9iXJJez99d.jpg','1993-05-21',107,'Released','You like to watch... don\'t you?','Sliver',867,8.6195,5.6,'qvMMd47Yox0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12113,_binary '\0','/6CNeV4TA0pULJBWh1m3bnDnyeIf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108167',7.3,2070,'fr','Smoking / No Smoking','Two actors portray eighteen Yorkshire villagers, who offer several iterations of their lives depending on whether or not they lit a cigarette at a certain point in time.','/4Les5XLYn5FbQtevZmLkKSQBRU5.jpg','1993-12-15',280,'Released','Which one will you go see first?','Smoking / No Smoking',61560,1.2759,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12114,_binary '\0','/uehyCW6aDRDSqqojcKg226vgdnL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108169',3.9,2102,'en','Snapdragon','An erotic amnesiac lures a police psychologist into a world of lust and danger.','/6BRHL9vjzDpQWDRxaefkOJliLKn.jpg','1993-12-01',96,'Released','A Psycho-Sexual Thriller','Snapdragon',41128,2.5766,4.1,'Vhky_5rbQQk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12115,_binary '\0','/qQksZdRMIaZwttaT0pzbyJklWQz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108171',6.1,27134,'en','Sniper','Tough guy Thomas Beckett is a US Marine working in the Panamanian jungle. His job is to seek out rebels and remove them using his sniper skills. Beckett is notorious for losing his partners on such missions. This time he\'s accompanied by crack marksman Richard Miller.','/ayYsC7Jp2BxhCLWghOBWzZlO4FI.jpg','1993-01-29',98,'Released','One Shot. One Kill. No Exceptions.','Sniper',9545,5.064,6.2,'id4md3teqGo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12116,_binary '\0','/iVweNwFhEtlJlPxOkaDh8VboE9b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108174',6.5,46429,'en','So I Married an Axe Murderer','Just after a bad breakup, Charlie MacKenzie falls for lovely butcher Harriet Michaels and introduces her to his parents. But, as voracious consumers of sensational tabloids, his parents soon come to suspect that Harriet is actually a notorious serial killer -- \"Mrs. X\" -- wanted in connection with a string of bizarre honeymoon killings. Thinking his parents foolish, Charlie proposes to Harriet. But while on his honeymoon with her, he begins to fear they were right.','/yv2yakJ8zTT4ycKAsppcGQZmpMz.jpg','1993-07-30',93,'Released','The honeymoon was killer.','So I Married an Axe Murderer',10442,4.5001,6.109,'nGlyUmq9wE4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12117,_binary '\0','/1PDbUriaRQWwF714dCE3Bbw1nNr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108179',4.8,1251,'fr','La Soif de l\'or','Urbain Donnadieu\'s first love is money. It\'s also his second, third and fourth love. The only reason he married - a tax inspector named Fleurette - was to avoid a fine for tax evasion. For several years, he has been stealing money from his construction company and buying gold bars with his ill-gotten gains. His plan is to deposit all this wealth in a Swiss Bank, where neither his wife - whom he is about to divorce - nor the French State can get at it. Accompanied by his money-grabbing Granny Zézette, Urbain heads off for Switzerland, with his gold concealed in the walls of a model house on the back of a trailer. Unfortunately, his scheme is threatened by his wife and his embittered ex-chauffeur, who are determined to get his money at any cost...','/alKt5HtY5xwA6EnyYDePd0BxXEx.jpg','1993-08-31',81,'Released',NULL,'The Thirst for Gold',51195,1.7805,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12118,_binary '\0','/c9xlNKNk2P7Gw6I1fWJBI4w8KEa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108185',6.3,23809,'en','Sommersby','Set in the South just after the US Civil War, Laurel Sommersby is just managing to work the farm without her husband, believed killed in battle. By all accounts, Jack Sommersby was not a pleasant man, thus when he suddenly returns, Laurel has mixed emotions. It appears that Jack has changed a great deal, leading some people to believe that this is not actually Jack but an imposter. Laurel herself is unsure, but willing to take the man into her home, and perhaps later into her heart.','/tAgQKLv0GK97Tr0bvdI66oXlEVb.jpg','1993-02-05',109,'Released','She knew his face. His touch. His voice. She knew everything about him ... But the truth.','Sommersby',1049,4.9962,6.4,'obqtXIGpSiE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12119,_binary '\0','/pV1Kdxjk05NfTUtfXB3ZZyD95s0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108186',6,23913,'en','Son in Law','Country girl Rebecca has spent most of her life on a farm in South Dakota, and, when she goes away to college in Los Angeles, Rebecca immediately feels out of place in the daunting urban setting. She is befriended by a savvy party animal named Crawl, who convinces the ambivalent Rebecca to stay in the city. When Thanksgiving break rolls around, Rebecca, no longer an innocent farm girl, invites Crawl back to South Dakota, where he pretends to be her fiancé.','/gj4afHL9bMQ18opZzMp77tlPkAq.jpg','1993-07-02',95,'Released','He\'s a relative nightmare.','Son in Law',13203,4.3226,6.029,'8pnnGZUe14g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12120,_binary '\0','/y2L5kW4SGseKH1XDL4c11qB21Xe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108187',3.9,6588,'en','Son of the Pink Panther','The illegitimate son of Inspector Clouseau is on the case of the kidnapped Princess Yasmin.','/vSBzy0XtZvJQ4N9KLoWvblprZY2.jpg','1993-08-27',93,'Released','Inspector Clouseau\'s biggest mistake lives on!','Son of the Pink Panther',46828,4.1536,4.61,'lWmdU3_7lGE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12121,_binary '\0','/wVQbMLpczyxlPKJWo6Qk3A1v2rB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108188',7.4,24392,'ja','Sonatine','Murakawa, an aging Tokyo yakuza tiring of gangster life, is sent by his boss to Okinawa along with a few of his henchmen to help end a gang war, supposedly as mediators between two warring clans. He finds that the dispute between the clans is insignificant and whilst wondering why he was sent to Okinawa at all, his group is attacked in an ambush. The survivors flee and make a decision to lay low at the beach while they await further instructions.','/mX9E4fEuG17L2e7bZmhBc0XdRbw.jpg','1993-09-10',94,'Released','A ferocious man sleeps here.','Sonatine',7500,4.4716,7.516,'oLcZFTPZKfc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12122,_binary '\0','/5Xar1vpdb7meEo5qZRsZbbDpfOu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108192',7.5,1252,'ko','서편제','Despite its falling popularity, a father teaches his two children the Korean musical tradition of Pansori (one singer accompanied by one drummer).','/tCejyq7oz1WudC8hJqauHlBCAFN.jpg','1993-04-10',113,'Released',NULL,'Sopyonje',124315,1.6059,7.8,'fu6gmh4Wvys','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12123,_binary '\0','/4ssL7Q5VEROg6AGldQZZQobywa1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108194',7.6,2182,'hu','Sose halunk meg','In 1960s Hungary, an introverted teenager’s life is turned upside down by a few days in the company of his coat hanger salesman uncle: a roguish charmer with a zest for life and a weakness for horse racing and women.','/dHIcN3wahEbKh3UxDontGmOKvT9.jpg','1993-01-15',86,'Released',NULL,'We Never Die!',41075,0.9704,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12124,_binary '\0','/Z6XHKgEpLk9B6YazeAj9erQwyu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108207',5.5,4834,'en','Splitting Heirs','A member of the English upper class dies, leaving his estate and his business to an American, whom he thinks is his son who was lost as a baby and then found again. An Englishman who thinks he is an Indian comes to believe that he is actually the heir. He comes to hate the American who is his boss, his friend, and the man who has stolen the woman after whom he lusts.','/bOxCNid7ZLB9SoUkIGhWKfDqrZy.jpg','1993-04-02',87,'Released','A wickedly funny comedy of Royal proportions','Splitting Heirs',20339,3.0753,5.2,'bakWHKecYw0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12125,_binary '\0','/mo2O5ESdB7PWnY3OBS9jjvjeskB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108211',7.5,39654,'de','Stalingrad','A German Platoon is explored through the brutal fighting of the Battle of Stalingrad. After half of their number is wiped out and they\'re placed under the command of a sadistic captain, the platoon lieutenant leads his men to desert. The platoon members attempt escape from the city, now surrounded by the Soviet Army.','/hEHmXFMOBJv5c6Gd5m6mDiLAxsy.jpg','1993-01-20',134,'Released','Till the last man...','Stalingrad',11101,4.9271,7.337,'3usU25Z9ICE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12126,_binary '\0','/2rgs1cFWcw8HkribrlM5dLMuSZq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108230',6.4,1273,'en','Strapped','Ex-con attempting to go straight runs across serious problems. His girlfriend gets arrested for dealing crack to an undercover police officer. In a desperate attempt to get the charges dropped against his woman, he strikes a deal with a weapons cop to turn in local gun dealers. However, the D.A. is not satisfied with the results, resulting in some serious game playing and double crossing.','/txcj4qo5wJ1Vdv0jLCL8Bl1hzU7.jpg','1993-08-21',104,'Released',NULL,'Strapped',26479,1.5568,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12127,_binary '\0','/A1OL7rbcgFs5NbK4GeuEGGRqD9r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108238',5.9,53251,'en','Striking Distance','Demoted Pittsburgh cop Tom Hardy works river patrol while a serial killer targets women from his past, forcing him to conduct an unauthorized investigation to prove his innocence and expose a dirty cop.','/1bLazrQWJQhO6u58vJZXJZ3ZFDh.jpg','1993-09-17',102,'Released','They shouldn\'t have put him in the water, if they didn\'t want him to make waves.','Striking Distance',11074,8.8533,5.9,'5PbX4LXD6Es','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12128,_binary '\0','/mTgjcIK82DgTuXuwctlD1fwxEin.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108252',7,5672,'sv','Sunes sommar','It\'s summer and Sune Andersson\'s family is planning a holiday in Greece. Sune\'s father, Rudolf is sulking because then he won\'t be able to go on his beloved fishing trip. But after seeing how much the Greek trip is going to cost, he comes up with a great idea: Let\'s go on a camping trip instead. A lot is happens during this trip and after a while Rudolf discovers that the camping trip might not be as cheat as he thought.','/54gPbrAGeyLDKLkAu8fIdBU9geI.jpg','1993-12-25',83,'Released','The dreamer and girl lover Sune is back!','Sune\'s Summer',30149,1.7058,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12129,_binary '\0','/1GGfWFp9hp4RUHRHxd505z9rVFa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108255',4.2,68408,'en','Super Mario Bros.','Mario and Luigi, plumbers from Brooklyn, find themselves in an alternate universe where evolved dinosaurs live in hi-tech squalor. They\'re the only hope to save our universe from invasion by the dino dictator, Koopa.','/yt5bbMfKpg1nRr4k5edxs7tPK2m.jpg','1993-05-28',105,'Released','This ain\'t no game.','Super Mario Bros.',9607,7.762,4.496,'GE7zdN-Qzvw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12130,_binary '\0','/fUQXMXd6M54dPYjlBzvQ4v6fkcf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108258',5.1,9690,'en','Surf Ninjas','Two Asian-American \"surfer-dude\" brothers discover they are the long lost princes from a China Sea Island. Part of their inheritance includes magically-induced martial arts prowess and seeing the future. Using their new powers, they act to overthrow the island\'s current dictator, a despotic madman with a metal face!','/4Xn0CBDAGADHc62MEGmFYcbhU1E.jpg','1993-08-12',87,'Released','Surf\'s up! Time to save the world!','Surf Ninjas',23470,2.8943,5,'UlLWmFpEouI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12131,_binary '\0','/yZ0vdcZ5YG8IB8JNBj13P6mtDxG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108260',6.5,2277,'en','Suture','A man named Clay flies into Phoenix for a reunion with his long-lost half-brother Vincent.','/8lbOpuNaJBNT1gXbIDDyYnDIYut.jpg','1993-09-14',96,'Released','A thriller where nothing is black and white.','Suture',87078,1.3084,6.5,'IzZSguDxGsk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12132,_binary '\0','/1nJozcSOKcSqjN46hMU1xnWJRZ4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108265',6.8,18418,'en','Swing Kids','The story of a close-knit group of young kids in Nazi Germany who listen to banned swing music from the US. Soon dancing and fun leads to more difficult choices as the Nazis begin tightening the grip on Germany. Each member of the group is forced to face some tough choices about right, wrong, and survival.','/o85xTgX5ByDewuYo5yOLIsP02CX.jpg','1993-03-05',112,'Released','In a world on the brink of war. You either march to one tune or dance to another.','Swing Kids',10419,4.1281,6.7,'VX7AReML354','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12133,_binary '\0','/zlOZ2XHi8JcrZkr55wttuH6Cd56.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108275',4.7,2445,'sv','Sökarna','Jocke has grown up in one of Stockholm\'s rough suburbs. Nowadays he spends the daytime getting into trouble at school and going into Stockholm in the evenings and getting into even more trouble. After being sentenced to prison he meets Tony. After their release they begin a series of robberies.','/lWkOfWaV87QIkvi7vbiAiBu0NOB.jpg','1993-03-26',108,'Released','No child is bad from the beginning.','The Searchers',60911,0.8784,4.935,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12134,_binary '\0','/rY6itId5FvITgxQiIGCXgBHbrTG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108277',4.6,1884,'en','TC 2000','Somewhere in the future the environmental overkill had come. Many people had died. The rich were able to build the underworld, the poor had to stay on the surface building gangs to survive. Jason Storm, an underworld guard gets knowledge of a conspiracy to kill all people on the surface. He needs to flee to the surface, and wins Sumai, a respected martial arts master, as his ally to stop the dirty plot.','/iVULeqvSEykblA3lBBHNbDBDVrq.jpg','1993-08-18',95,'Released','The year is 2020. He\'s mostly human, and totally invincible...Until now','TC 2000',56172,2.2692,5.3,'FyliqCQlM_Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12135,_binary '\0','/cLRa56dXsd6MTydEJrx4fGLOYNS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108281',7.2,11831,'cn','太极张三丰','Falsely accused for cheating in a martial arts competition, two boyhood friends are banished from their Shaolin Temple and go their separate ways. As adults, they join opposing sides in a civil war. When one betrays the other, they settle their differences mano-a-mano.','/vzodCpQ3xBaVuFLUl0w0iYp4V7G.jpg','1993-11-18',96,'Released',NULL,'Tai-Chi Master',11143,3.2697,7.2,'v-JZKJck050','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12136,_binary '\0','/sYuSTFIKNnAGYItluwRNUmFDr7R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108289',7.6,7191,'zh','唐伯虎點秋香','A scholar in search of true love. Disguising himself as a houseboy, he indentures himself to a rich family in order to pursue the ravishing servant girl who has stolen his heart.','/sK5k5gyE18yEHCw9AqeTEfqYqtw.jpg','1993-07-01',102,'Released','Scholar. Madman. Lover.','Flirting Scholar',37703,3.8034,7.5,'dghEmuAjUPY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12137,_binary '\0','/1a81UWKrHQsU1B1ak4HYcVtIAUR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108290',6.2,1457,'fr','Tango','Vincent, a stunt pilot, is acquitted of murdering his wife and her lover. However, a few years later, L\'Elegant, the Judge in the case, comes to blackmail him. The Judge\'s nephew, Paul, is having trouble with his wife and they demand that Vincent kill her. The Judge, a confirmed bachelor, takes Paul and Vincent on the road to search for Paul\'s wife Marie. The three men get on well together, and spend their time discussing their relationship with women.','/zFrckeBscdJO0UiLzi0SfUHT14m.jpg','1993-02-03',88,'Released',NULL,'Tango',66447,1.738,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12138,_binary '\0','/2pov8bDTzf63CocoaABHMH92G1u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108291',6.7,1886,'es','Tango feroz: La leyenda de Tanguito','A biopic based on the life of one of the pioneer argentine rock stars \'Tanguito\'. The movie tells the story of his rise and fall from grace, encompassed in violent times of a military regime.','/zSwYYGs1iQjqKLbhxTBFksdg8xI.jpg','1993-06-03',125,'Released',NULL,'Wild Tango',73857,1.7253,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12139,_binary '\0','/jznP87h6Mo5E8s5wNqoCCgcT86i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108293',6.2,2438,'cn','逃學威龍III之龍過雞年','Chow Sing Sing returns, only this time he doesn’t go back to school. Instead, Chow goes undercover as the husband of a wealthy socialite, which doesn’t sit well with his fiancée, who tries to convince Chow to quit working as undercover.','/gwq4z0x4ISsXI9Ra9EJhBIzyUTN.jpg','1993-01-14',89,'Released',NULL,'Fight Back to School 3',66657,4.1359,6.5,'ZzYXCY3sKeo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12140,_binary '\0','/jIZ67qdDawus6s3Aua96e7nV7eM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108308',4.8,39113,'en','Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles III','The four turtles travel back in time to the days of the legendary and deadly samurai in ancient Japan, where they train to perfect the art of becoming one. The turtles also assist a small village in an uprising.','/fwX5RdPDBFsbEAXc46DrvRz5Bca.jpg','1993-03-17',95,'Released','The Turtles are back... in time.','Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles III',1499,7.7251,5.5,'QlnCSUe8o9U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12141,_binary '\0','/oq2W3CGPvhr2qPsUCmQCyN9vjAr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108311',5.3,3911,'en','The Temp','Peter Derns, an executive at Mrs. Appleby\'s Cooke Company, fears his future prospects are crumbling fast, until the arrival of Kris Bolin, a gorgeous, cooly efficient temp - and sultry temptress - who helps him develop a marketing campaign that slays the competition. But after two executives mysteriously die, Peter discovers his job security may vanish due to the one person he needs to trust: his temp.','/87h7OsuTWZURTZ1oSNfLl8bqfbO.jpg','1993-02-12',97,'Released','She\'ll eliminate the competition... permanently.','The Temp',17168,4.1939,4.8,'iWkZYNv59ZI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12142,_binary '\0','/qLqEHfma6JZ6CU7CZGeCdB68wpj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108317',6.6,2688,'de','Texas - Doc Snyder hält die Welt in Atem','The dreaded Doc Snyder returns home after 30 years. After his long ride through the prairies of the wild west, his laundry is extremely dirty, and who could wash it better than his unshaven mommy? But first she sends him to the prison, from which he is to free his brother Hank, because otherwise he will be hanged. When that\'s done, they both spontaneously decide to rob a bank, which goes completely wrong. Before Doc Snyder\'s eyes, his beloved brother is shot by his intimate enemy, the Nose Man. Snyder initially manages to escape, but the Nose Man takes up the pursuit, and from then on many innocent people have to die - including Snyder\'s mother...','/ybD59vpUjk5xjW0rRBRxcLwdjms.jpg','1993-11-11',86,'Released',NULL,'Texas - Doc Snyder hält die Welt in Atem',1659,1.7389,6,'orHfgnsJWd4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12143,_binary '\0','/2U9vlFEqglJJ25YMEqAmiN7bStu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108320',6.3,1228,'en','There Goes My Baby','It\'s the summer of 1965, and the members of the graduating class of upscale Westwood High are eager to reinvent themselves. Valedictorian Mary Beth wants to attend a liberal university. Surfer bum Stick plans to enlist to fight in Vietnam. Calvin lives in the poor Watts section of Los Angeles, which is slowly erupting in violence. As the summer nights grow long, they\'ll all be forced to make decisions that will affect the rest of their lives.','/3KM98skbDojKhXFvShERFsTxv3a.jpg','1994-09-02',99,'Released','It was a summer they would never forget.','There Goes My Baby',88641,2.7978,6.2,'6e5POdDGOL4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12144,_binary '\0','/5U9tWqwaLREc6cnXPOVSVIDzYpl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108327',6.4,9456,'en','The Thing Called Love','A group of newcomers to the country music business seek love and stardom.','/xsxkXRFDYeGGMGkdvotCIhMJFPl.jpg','1993-08-27',116,'Released','Stand by your dream.','The Thing Called Love',27804,3.4713,6.1,'8jQ9j5D_AhI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12145,_binary '\0','/6srvLtwWhy4IvkNjxM3IfPDcRJL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108328',7.3,4278,'en','Thirty Two Short Films About Glenn Gould','A collection of vignettes highlighting different aspects of the life, work, and character of the acclaimed Canadian classical pianist.','/3GTmkUpCb1uL7psLYqAHyIyld51.jpg','1993-11-26',93,'Released','The sound of genius.','Thirty Two Short Films About Glenn Gould',20967,2.1796,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12146,_binary '\0','/mckbk3xnCXr12b0KQ4BHcrtibWM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108329',7.1,1568,'ta','திருடா திருடா','An Inspector is assigned to track down a large sum of stolen money. His investigations lead him to a couple of small time crooks, a village belle, a murder, an absconding suspect, and an international drug dealer.','/9qnecMIRerHdKkuFTeCZXNNVU9z.jpg','1993-11-13',170,'Released',NULL,'Thiruda Thiruda',112306,1.2098,7.333,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12147,_binary '\0','/6N6VUUR1gzbCkiGpQzvRREv3Od1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108330',7.2,63032,'en','This Boy\'s Life','When a son and mother move to Seattle in hopes for a better life, the mother meets a seemingly polite man. Things go south when the man turns out to be abusive, endangering their lives. As the mother struggles to maintain hope in an impossible situation, the son has plans to escape.','/pRMSZfen1Cv1eqwDbtxCBpBqxnU.jpg','1993-04-09',115,'Released','He looked like the ideal husband. He seemed like the perfect father. That\'s just what they needed. But that\'s not what they got.','This Boy\'s Life',8092,10.8821,7.1,'P28qmkCrNSM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12148,_binary '\0','/1M7eNvLkrAbhQDbcoBnVfzanHcT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108333',6.4,65101,'en','The Three Musketeers','D\'Artagnan travels to Paris hoping to become a musketeer, one of the French king\'s elite bodyguards, only to discover that the corps has been disbanded by conniving Cardinal Richelieu, who secretly hopes to usurp the throne. Fortunately, Athos, Porthos and Aramis have refused to lay down their weapons and continue to protect their king. D\'Artagnan joins with the rogues to expose Richelieu\'s plot against the crown.','/mk8UH7JRmK8adcqJJpB1ygP7B1C.jpg','1993-11-11',105,'Released','All for one and one for all!','The Three Musketeers',10057,8.8733,6.386,'FMy1TFRF8Lk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12149,_binary '\0','/fRjb7Z9dYveyaxsGrgn1tjPmXv4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108334',5.5,2292,'en','Three of Hearts','A lesbian hires a male escort to break the heart of the bisexual woman who has just dumped her.','/tBzAb9odo7xszFTLfuYziP714kf.jpg','1993-04-30',110,'Released','Three wild hearts. One sexy romantic comedy.','Three of Hearts',5187,2.3095,4.9,'MUEe8AL5OSs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12150,_binary '\0','/asWJoeclSZ0HiNVMcr9uTzzRwwl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108339',5.5,6756,'en','Ticks','Teens camping in a northern California retreat are terrorized by mutant insects created by evil, polluting pot farmers.','/3tfMPBgpfwu2V403u9gST5ReWl9.jpg','1993-10-12',85,'Released','Something hungry is about to hatch.','Ticks',34098,2.7535,5.7,'b4uhzVlesk8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12151,_binary '\0','/pJ5hsNlil3iJez2DP9DIxCytELR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108342',4.1,1278,'en','Time Runner','During the alien invasion of 2022, one man flees through a wormhole to 1992, where attempt after attempt is made to catch and kill him.','/mWUmoHHJ5CJF8xI6UJQa5ZxTNOl.jpg','1993-03-17',90,'Released','A world under attack. A hero battling to change destiny.','Time Runner',48315,2.0748,4.3,'s_Xzu_Nfysc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12152,_binary '\0','/wfToTS0NHtVD7Xf136gCZHuaLje.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108350',3.6,1696,'en','Night Terrors','A woman visiting her father in Egypt becomes involved with the Marquis de Sade\'s descendant and his terrifying cult.','/zEsDvD9DD45tWz9a82K37LJqKJ2.jpg','1993-11-09',94,'Released','Beware the power of your own desires.','Night Terrors',78247,2.4017,4.2,'uyTuXP9o3LA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12153,_binary '\0','/v2CwkO8jHfpG4xTo87q0SH8BXqr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108355',6,1615,'es','Todos a la cárcel','A prison in Valencia hosts an event recognizing political prisoners jailed during Franco’s reign. The reunion proves more raucous than the organizers intended.','/bB9cIOMKVxCROACoofnysPpy9cG.jpg','1993-12-22',99,'Released',NULL,'Everyone Off to Jail',99902,1.7437,6.3,'Ix0S1_rCyfI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12154,_binary '\0','/djPXXv9pPyTLGl9kMPCTyiBmIA5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108358',7.8,195275,'en','Tombstone','Legendary marshal Wyatt Earp, now a weary gunfighter, joins his brothers Morgan and Virgil to pursue their collective fortune in the thriving mining town of Tombstone. But Earp is forced to don a badge again and get help from his notorious pal Doc Holliday when a gang of renegade brigands and rustlers begins terrorizing the town.','/wGFCvylul8iEQhJOKfwZGGvXMzA.jpg','1993-12-25',130,'Released','Every town has a story. Tombstone has a legend.','Tombstone',11969,12.5431,7.584,'XTWYKf5hXIg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12155,_binary '\0','/mNaZmb5bCZXdbKL0mh57J5v7pdt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108366',6.5,5590,'en','Totally F***ed Up','Gay, alienated Los Angeles teens have a hard time as their parents kick them out of their homes, they don’t have money, their lovers cheat, and they are harassed by gay-bashers.','/qZBtSTEhlXy0aNTZ40umWLpJr2T.jpg','1994-08-19',80,'Released','Another homo movie by Gregg Araki','Totally F***ed Up',33560,3.778,6.618,'2vBayHtjD_s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12156,_binary '\0','/h30NyZ2e2MobAoJXUt8ywn5BFTz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108388',6,2689,'en','The Trial','Joseph K. awakes one morning, to find two strange men in his room, telling him he has been arrested. Joseph is not told what he is charged with, and despite being \"arrested,\" is allowed to remain free and go to work. But despite the strange nature of his arrest, Joseph soon learns that his trial, however odd, is very real, and tries desperately to spare himself from the court\'s judgement.','/t3nlCW5pGQJSdLXlq5rwZFNaggb.jpg','1993-06-18',118,'Released','Arrested and Prosecuted. But for what, he does not know.','The Trial',69703,2.2177,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12157,_binary '\0','/pXvYw0QOPbHJVvwGbZfrSNY2vnB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108394',7.8,119337,'fr','Trois couleurs : Bleu','The wife of a famous composer survives a car accident that kills her husband and daughter. Now alone, she shakes off her old identity and explores her newfound freedom but finds that she is unbreakably bound to other humans, including her husband’s mistress, whose existence she never suspected.','/33wsWxzsNstI8N7dvuwzFmj1qBd.jpg','1993-09-08',98,'Released',NULL,'Three Colors: Blue',108,6.6325,7.614,'kQjJoRl3bLc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12158,_binary '\0','/tA7kbXNAoulH0OHGqwwvEQsTbtB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108395',5.4,7910,'en','A Troll in Central Park','A friendly troll with a magic green thumb grows one flower too many for the queen, whose laws require all trolls to be mean ugly and scare humans whenever possible. As a punishment, he is exiled to a world of concrete, where he should live a life of proper trolldom: Manhattan.','/5RH87MTTrQwfX3HgYD444naIWn7.jpg','1994-10-07',75,'Released','Believe in Yourself and You Can Do Anything!','A Troll in Central Park',35614,4.2395,5.1,'pUhrFgs5knU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12159,_binary '\0','/1Uh8yuXlFcMDpVHWZJidjanT06e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108399',7.9,263785,'en','True Romance','Clarence marries hooker Alabama, steals cocaine from her pimp, and tries to sell it in Hollywood, while the owners of the coke try to reclaim it.','/39lXk6ud6KiJgGbbWI2PUKS7y2.jpg','1993-09-09',119,'Released','Stealing. Cheating. Killing. Who says romance is dead?','True Romance',319,14.7223,7.537,'6uoPeUa7Gkc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12160,_binary '\0','/6X9XblP5yfF2YCoPm2DmZubxDdb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108410',6.3,4371,'en','Twenty Bucks','A story about the life of a twenty dollar bill as it weaves in and out of the various lives of several people.','/pAZxoG13a8nGTQ5jrs7xzz0t59b.jpg','1993-10-21',91,'Released','When you pass the buck, the last thing you expect is change.','Twenty Bucks',50536,2.9121,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12161,_binary '\0','/4IDUN8LuTmdH6LHJ8h5KPc8UvxU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108429',8.4,1774,'ka','უძინართა მზე','The director dedicated this lyrical, epic film-confession to the memory of his father who was a doctor. The film’s protagonist, an ambulance doctor, conducts dangerous experiments in search of a vitally important vaccine. His wife believes in his work, though his daughter would not understand him. His son, who is absolutely unlike his father in character, is trying to protect him. But self-denial in the name of science proves too high a price. Just when he is on the verge of discovery, the doctor loses everything he has gathered as a result of his twenty-year-long work. This loss brings him even closer to his son. The shooting of the film continued for seven years (1985-1992), making it a metaphorical culmination of the Soviet cinematography and the Soviet way of life as a whole.','/jfrnY8mD9xxTlewczcTXbQNbNNY.jpg','1992-03-01',123,'Released',NULL,'Sun of the Sleepless',150100,1.6028,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12162,_binary '\0','/6ryHAHtpcNTExUVekeaNe0xmDbb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108432',6.6,23940,'ja','海がきこえる','At Kichijōji Station, Tokyo, Taku Morisaki glimpses a familiar woman on the platform opposite boarding a train. Later, her photo falls from a shelf as he exits his apartment before flying to Kōchi Prefecture. Picking it up, he looks at it briefly before leaving. As the aeroplane takes off, he narrates the events that brought her into his life...','/fSR1LLMIJZ6WcQEkM82yKy4F9vQ.jpg','1993-10-09',72,'Released',NULL,'Ocean Waves',21057,5.975,6.4,'tfkHiHjrqa8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12163,_binary '\0','/2VFfjJMzmcMaC4yzovpbakpyXNu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108442',6.1,9457,'en','Undercover Blues','When fun-loving American agents Jeff and Jane Blue are called back from maternity leave for a special assignment in New Orleans, the spy parents decide to skip the sitter and give their bouncing baby girl the adventure of a lifetime.','/etF4xfCH4HlAajRVX9u73oy13PH.jpg','1993-09-10',90,'Released','Intelligence runs in the family.','Undercover Blues',12661,3.7088,5.994,'NDGLBJps0vA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12164,_binary '\0','/6BDMIVtoLblsnV686WTDVbDEojn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108447',5.1,1393,'en','The Unnamable II: The Statement of Randolph Carter','A creature of demonic nature, too hideous to have a name, once again terrorizes the college kids that summoned it.','/4hqRGLDf5HJwbDTxfsipgWtqRis.jpg','1992-10-21',104,'Released',NULL,'The Unnamable II: The Statement of Randolph Carter',29098,2.3286,4.7,'9ekx-NwEeoo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12165,_binary '\0','/dbu06T6Mm3JlSwzLpz2bBfJcqEa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108451',6.8,17239,'en','Untamed Heart','Caroline, a young waitress who seems to have bad taste in men, is on her way home one night when thugs attempt to rape her. Adam, the mysterious busboy who works at the same diner, helps fight off the assailants, and she begins a relationship with him -- but not all their fellow Minnesotans are happy for them. Meanwhile, the couple face their own difficulties when Caroline finds about Adam\'s past, including his unique health condition.','/2NTqe5MGx5YAXyQuMvwXSevNHeQ.jpg','1993-02-12',102,'Released','He doesn\'t make sense. She doesn\'t make sense. Together they make sense.','Untamed Heart',26333,4.422,6.8,'OrHKg87fUCc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12166,_binary '\0','/1C3Y8XqOxR9LLhKl4BxS5nTTr3C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108461',6.4,4221,'ja','超神伝説 うろつき童子','Legend has it that the human race is not the only dominant civilization living on Earth. Two other races exist in this world: the Makai (a demon race) and the Jujinkai (a half-man, half-beast race). Once every 3,000 years, a supreme being known as the Choujin (Overfiend) will emerge and bring balance to all three realms on Earth. In present-day Japan, after 300 years of endless searching, a Jujinkai named Amano Jyaku has discovered the presence of the Choujin inside high school slacker Tatsuo Nagumo. But now, Amano, along with his sister Megumi and their sidekick Kuroko, must protect Nagumo and his new girlfriend Akemi Ito from the Makai, who believe that Nagumo is not the Choujin, but an evil entity bent on destroying all living beings on Earth.','/5JzDyR3gEkOf1USGIeC8lSOlo3m.jpg','1989-03-18',105,'Released',NULL,'Urotsukidōji: Legend of the Overfiend',48624,5.8701,6,'HAGYVLKF3ds','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12167,_binary '\0','/hnV0mMWdki9d8jndoQJQWK1MPLd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108471',7.3,1777,'pt','Vale Abraão','Ema is a very attractive but innocent girl, so pretty that cars crash in her presence. In her youth she marries Dr. Carlos Paiva, her father\'s friend, to whom she is not attracted. They move to the valley of Abraham. Carlos loves her, but decides to sleep in a separate room to avoid waking Ema when he has to return late at night. As time goes by she begins to feel unhappy about her marriage, so she finds a new lover.','/zU5moFVXIVZbjd6pcwo6J47sBbY.jpg','1993-09-01',204,'Released',NULL,'Abraham\'s Valley',107693,1.3828,7.4,'kB6V19I0KbE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12168,_binary '\0','/ker1eyGYk5eIIPiveZYGHaW9aZ5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108473',6.3,30821,'en','The Vanishing','The boyfriend of an abducted woman never gives up the search as the abductor looks on.','/tlFUthtOMlRYDpRzYDBtyrNJJUU.jpg','1993-02-05',109,'Released','Obsession is the ultimate weapon.','The Vanishing',1644,5.1335,6.17,'GS_s9bYYM0k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12169,_binary '\0','/hnv93Trwxip51M3F6vp2l1BKJFy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108490',8.2,1778,'ml','വിധേയൻ','Thommy is the loyal servant of Bhaskara Pattelar, a ruthless tyrant. He struggles between obedience and morality.','/joWXgPgCi6y172IxcYaowO6zAIo.jpg','1994-01-27',112,'Released',NULL,'Vidheyan',256212,1.0273,7.6,'xKRI7TMroXs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12170,_binary '\0','/tH7GoWIooWdKwF4GTUuIVc3pnnN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108500',7,41550,'fr','Les Visiteurs','After a wizard\'s spell goes awry, 12th-century Gallic knight Godefroy de Papincourt, Count of Montmirail finds himself transported to 1993, along with his dimwitted servant, Jacquouille la Fripouille. Startled and perplexed by modern technology, the duo run amok, destroying cars and causing chaos until they meet Beatrice de Montmirail, an aristocratic descendant of the nobleman, who may be able to help them get back to 1123.','/hPCq0buG5PaXgKjzT2ktjrjlpbj.jpg','1993-01-27',107,'Released','They weren\'t born yesterday!','The Visitors',11687,7.708,7.122,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12171,_binary '\0','/flCCCDxtj7OlSPKCTknuoQp7AiD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108504',7.5,5325,'nl','Voor een verloren soldaat','In the occupied Netherlands near the end of WWII, a young teenager, Jeroen Boman (Maarten Smit) is sent to the Dutch countryside to avoid the war in Amsterdam. While living with his adopted family, Jeroen meets and becomes friends with a Canadian soldier named Walt Cook, who is stationed at the same town he is staying at. Joroen and Walt spend a lot of time playing around and eventually a romantic relationship develops between them. The boy’s sexual curiosity leads him to have a sexual experience with Walt, an encounter that is shown with some vague detail but without actually showing any nudity, even though sexual intimacy between the two of them is implied. Overall, the movie handles this difficult subject with an elegant style and feeling, without having the adult-child relationship overwhelm the viewer and thus allowing the movie to be seen as just a wartime relationship between two people that marks an important time in a young boy’s life.','/83qNwms7atRnkBcFAdowojG072C.jpg','1992-09-18',92,'Released',NULL,'For a Lost Soldier',27052,2.2848,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12172,_binary '\0','/xPaGpRcklIZaFuFjhIdjZeCl5om.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108515',7.3,4755,'en','The War Room','A behind-the-scenes documentary about the Clinton for President campaign, focusing on the adventures of spin doctors James Carville and George Stephanopoulos.','/prfxsyG4SnlnqqulavCJ4RksFUA.jpg','1993-11-03',96,'Released','They changed the way campaigns are won.','The War Room',26408,1.7621,6.8,'gOVn50rHV0g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12173,_binary '\0','/meOtdGhHZIOCmCdBqVe1AzTG7M2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108517',5.4,7625,'en','Warlock: The Armageddon','Every six hundred years, a great evil has the opportunity to escape and unleash Armageddon. A group of five stones has the power to either free the evil, or banish it for another six hundred years. An order of Druids battles with a Warlock determined to unleash his father upon the world.','/qpRtxbnLb0qFP93db5vwDDXvWz2.jpg','1993-05-01',98,'Released','When he comes... All hell breaks loose.','Warlock: The Armageddon',24126,2.6427,5.454,'njVDf8UoPq4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12174,_binary '\0','/lehbmczbRb97gpufaAy6NFRSaUP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108525',6.2,92779,'en','Wayne\'s World 2','A message from Jim Morrison in a dream prompts cable access TV stars Wayne and Garth to put on a rock concert, \"Waynestock,\" with Aerosmith as headliners. But amid the preparations, Wayne frets that a record producer is putting the moves on his girlfriend, Cassandra, while Garth handles the advances of mega-babe Honey Hornée.','/72TBNPN06oo1myHqihwcCQVDl48.jpg','1993-12-10',95,'Released','You\'ll laugh again! You\'ll cry again!! You\'ll hurl again!!!','Wayne\'s World 2',8873,6.2843,6.1,'Im4g7MOb-G0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12175,_binary '\0','/6pbIOpnWFAO42JgZhuNUdMEUxi8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108526',6.1,17408,'en','We\'re Back! A Dinosaur\'s Story','Captain New Eyes travels back in time and feeds dinosaurs his Brain Grain cereal, which makes them intelligent and non-violent. They agree to go to the \"Middle Future\" in order to grant the wishes of children in New York City. They are to meet Dr. Bleeb of the Museum of Natural History, but get sidetracked with their new children friends and run into the Captain\'s evil brother, Professor Screweyes.','/iyFmhYlioe3PDZjSKWtcIhu5R02.jpg','1993-11-24',71,'Released','Wish for a dinosaur and watch all your dreams come true.','We\'re Back! A Dinosaur\'s Story',18890,5.2686,6.1,'lfOWnR4iu24','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12176,_binary '\0','/t9kiAxPGXWziIEsj4X2w2xsYliW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108539',4.9,15361,'en','Weekend at Bernie\'s II','Everybody\'s favorite stiff is back! Working fools Larry Wilson and Richard Parker have uncovered a dirty, little secret: Their former boss, Bernie Lomax, embezzled $2 million and placed it in a safe deposit box in the Caribbean. Now, the boys are ready to go after the loot, but they can\'t do it alone -- they need poor Bernie\'s help. Can the buddies give their ex-boss new life?','/ylN3DZEPCnn60ecGq01y0AyWsTQ.jpg','1993-07-09',97,'Released','You don\'t have to stop partying just because you\'ve stopped breathing.','Weekend at Bernie\'s II',8494,4.2394,5.1,'ZlCADShkhjk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12177,_binary '\0','/m05zMH2I7aEOP4zc0JYOdqR4JUD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108550',7.7,271383,'en','What\'s Eating Gilbert Grape','Gilbert Grape is a small-town young man with a lot of responsibility. Chief among his concerns are his mother, who is so overweight that she can\'t leave the house, and his mentally impaired younger brother, Arnie, who has a knack for finding trouble. Settled into a job at a grocery store and an ongoing affair with local woman Betty Carver, Gilbert finally has his life shaken up by the free-spirited Becky.','/8FxWgsfDNosewo7H65oE4QkOb7g.jpg','1993-12-17',118,'Released','Life is a terrible thing to sleep through.','What\'s Eating Gilbert Grape',1587,9.8531,7.658,'wpSGFets1oM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12178,_binary '\0','/bNZsRKtsfQAc7LZ7k8RnTK6H5n6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108551',7.4,25942,'en','What\'s Love Got to Do with It','Singer Tina Turner rises to stardom while mustering the courage to break free from her abusive husband Ike.','/btC4819GhihmkCELqO3qgepNGos.jpg','1993-06-09',118,'Released','Who Needs A Heart When A Heart Can Be Broken?','What\'s Love Got to Do with It',15765,6.483,7.062,'4YMzT2Uelts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12179,_binary '\0','/2ai8Kv2gGGqsK0gf71f8EyBxWmg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108555',5.9,2300,'en','When the Bough Breaks','A police detective investigates the apparent serial killing of several children which is linked to an institutionalized, autistic child.','/amfAPDTqTnEBXQUnXd5muX1El9O.jpg','1994-05-07',105,'Released','Can a child\'s telepathic mind help find a serial killer?','When the Bough Breaks',124524,2.7981,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12180,_binary '\0','/4chp6jrqeB9CmyJk6Vh9LviPwnV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108556',6.2,4636,'en','When a Stranger Calls Back','Jill Johnson, now a crisis center counselor, reunites with retired detective John Clifford to hunt a killer stalking a coed.','/m2Aw6vFF9f1UpOOZbWvzAPo8p1P.jpg','1993-04-04',94,'Released','Terror Is Twice As Chilling The Second Time Around!','When a Stranger Calls Back',30554,2.7582,5.9,'aWWAWCA-Wcg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12181,_binary '\0','/466rctGWbwVdLg7wSyJRd5UE9ci.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108560',5.4,9029,'en','Who\'s the Man?','Ed Lover and Doctor Dre are two inept barbers. Deciding that maybe they ought to find another line of work, they join the police. A big mistake, as far as their duty sergeant, Sgt Cooper is concerned, who proceeds to harass them at every turn. Despite this, they discover a major crime, and proceed to solve it in their own unusual fashion.','/zgRLvO8cnPsKKPIzNwlbuoeoY0d.jpg','1993-04-23',90,'Released','The First Hip-Hop Whodunnit!','Who\'s the Man?',25925,2.5013,5.5,'cOj8E86TsD4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12182,_binary '\0','/gwg4npn6ATLu0coDvnKessBIqFK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108565',5.6,2351,'en','Wide Sargasso Sea','In the wake of Jamaican emancipation, French colonist Annette Cosway falls into poverty and marries racist Englishman Paul Mason. But when Annette\'s young son dies in a fire started by former slaves, Mason flees to England, leaving his grief-stricken wife and her Creole daughter Antoinette behind. Soon Antoinette learns she must marry to claim her inheritance and sets her sights on Rochester, an Englishman eerily similar to Mason.','/bXd4BilBzaFumBbsdc7FguIO6Or.jpg','1993-04-16',98,'Released','The sensual film based on the acclaimed novel by Jean Rhys.','Wide Sargasso Sea',41667,1.7283,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12183,_binary '\0','/1jPvMFRNRRAKjmbRcmpcYuDrRVt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108569',5.5,1923,'en','Wilder Napalm','Wilder and Wallace are brothers and pyrokinetics. Ever since childhood they\'ve been able to start fires with their minds but following a tragedy in which they accidentally killed a man, the brothers have grown up very differently. Wilder has become a regular 9-5 workaday joe but Wallace performs his feats with a traveling circus. When the circus comes to Wilder\'s home town Wallace starts coming on strong to Wilder\'s wife, Vida who, ironically, is a slight pyromaniac.','/o7OuyebED05jOxAQfLv7kR1hxM9.jpg','1993-08-20',109,'Released','Never Start a Romance You Can\'t Put Out.','Wilder Napalm',55950,1.8611,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12184,_binary '\0','/hihGYFKBZvu5TxBIPUegHAQQ4N5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108574',7.3,1386,'de','Wir können auch anders ...','The brothers Kipp and Most set off to inherit their grandmother\'s estate. Along the way, they meet Viktor, a deserted Russian soldier who kidnaps them, and Nadine, who joins them voluntarily. On their way to their inheritance, the protagonists get into some seemingly hopeless situations.','/yR3XAi4V1KZyJxiYfeII6a6DpWX.jpg','1993-04-01',92,'Released',NULL,'No More Mr. Nice Guy',6553,1.7586,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12185,_binary '\0','/e4zfrQ3Jw1xSi3k9HcBl2tOKWkl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108577',5.1,2311,'en','Witchboard 2','A young woman starts receiving messages through a Ouija board, claiming to be from the former occupant of her apartment.','/apQdrG3dYseOFsLTatijYHQtZQS.jpg','1993-07-28',98,'Released','Everyone\'s dying to play.','Witchboard 2',40251,2.6336,4.9,'4dDt-xNuM0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12186,_binary '\0','/gpKRNRDXcWhABESC4rv9AEnOCoq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108583',6.9,3251,'en','Wittgenstein','A dramatization, in modern theatrical style, of the life and thought of the Viennese-born, Cambridge-educated philosopher Ludwig Wittgenstein, whose principal interest was the nature and limits of language. A series of sketches depict the unfolding of his life from boyhood, through the era of the first World War, to his eventual Cambridge professorship and association with Bertrand Russell and John Maynard Keynes. The emphasis in these sketches is on the exposition of the ideas of Wittgenstein, a homosexual, and an intuitive, moody, proud, and perfectionistic thinker generally regarded as a genius.','/mdUtfHPGTRjPiKMw39NUZ6z5Mn2.jpg','1993-03-26',72,'Released','If people never did silly things nothing intelligent would ever get done.','Wittgenstein',58937,2.0334,6.4,'afnExeNmyMA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12187,_binary '\0','/8W9dXK2Q0lajJnE5jZSTwAduTu2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108592',6.7,8335,'cn','黃飛鴻之三：獅王爭霸','Master Wong and his disciples enroll in the \'Dancing Lion Competition\' to stop an assassination plot and to battle an arrogant, deceitful opponent.','/8TmkTiHOTAyAjmbtDVi5f78a5ow.jpg','1993-01-14',112,'Released','A Hero Beyond All Others.','Once Upon a Time in China III',10619,4.4818,6.444,'gH0LaV8BYcQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12188,_binary '\0','/y8WpgFmaYFwTJIr89zoyfw5hFLK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108593',6.6,3813,'cn','黃飛鴻之鐵雞鬥蜈蚣','Jet Li stars in this comic spectacle as a Chinese \"Robin Hood\" who stumbles upon a kidnapping scheme after unwittingly opening a martial arts school next to a brothel!','/v8uCNayRX5mCgvRwhUVE24qtpnN.jpg','1993-04-01',111,'Released',NULL,'Last Hero in China',18731,3.8962,6.3,'7Vl8a8a9i1w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12189,_binary '\0','/mmJLL4PyHhTuiUdjKowHuni2aEb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108596',7,3564,'en','Wrestling Ernest Hemingway','Frank, a retired Irish seaman, and Walter, a retired Cuban barber, are two lonely old men trapped in the emptiness of their own lives. When they meet in a park Frank is able to start a conversation after several attempts. They begin to spend time together and become friends. But because of their different characters they often quarrel with each other and finally seperate after Frank misbehaves to Walter\'s friend Elaine.','/aMWkpitaM33HgDv25RzeMy9ZNFQ.jpg','1993-12-17',123,'Released','...and other lies your friends let you get away with.','Wrestling Ernest Hemingway',40509,2.3277,6.3,'o-z2hHBixP4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12190,_binary '\0','/vLbcIeTacmczPLCGrHygJiunrW3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108606',5.8,1904,'cn','現代豪俠傳','In a post-nuclear world, three superpowered women fight an evil genius controlling the government and the water supply.','/iJZntaDcv7C2V4VTV5Ch4idjq7L.jpg','1993-09-30',97,'Released','The Heroic Trio is back in…','Heroic Trio 2: Executioners',58311,2.6357,5.9,'vFRrzZKwWEo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12191,_binary '\0','/c2e6HyXFi6HpDlsJjt9j1oTuKcJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108614',6,1378,'cn','新流星蝴蝶劍','A loyalist attempts to keep the King\'s empire from being overthrown by a revolutionary group.','/i1s86wKq0FTWJ5xQtYW8b7n7g79.jpg','1993-01-16',88,'Released',NULL,'Butterfly and Sword',40166,1.8917,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12192,_binary '\0','/ce6VKMxmAAUOKmhQr4bkNzRW2ki.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108624',6.4,4532,'cn','倚天屠龍記之魔教教主','A wild and rollicking martial arts fantasy extravaganza that features prized swords and swordsmen, a crazy monk attached to a rolling boulder, serious clan and cult rivalries, and lots of magic and flying.','/n4diDPsEzHDojys2gLgyRVZAMKc.jpg','1993-12-18',103,'Released',NULL,'Kung Fu Cult Master',10852,4.5232,6.7,'Hg9Z0gJHDXw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12193,_binary '\0','/aCpoWtD58N2GmKamLZLNlqvAAyH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108633',5.7,2951,'en','The Young Americans','Experienced New York Police Detective John Harris is sent to London to help a local task force investigate a series of gangster killings organized by a new player in town, an American. With the help of a young teen wronged by gangsters, Harris navigates London\'s seedy, drug-fuelled underworld in order to take down its new criminal empire.','/9mCCxKnVew8tZJ9uDSc8TjbsOSp.jpg','1993-10-08',103,'Released','No Honor. No Respect. No Remorse.','The Young Americans',24909,2.7093,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12194,_binary '\0','/rwT2ux8tUYPwsIAo1ogehaubEae.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108656',6.7,8514,'cn','重案組','A special agent is assigned to protect a wealthy business magnate. However, when the businessman is kidnapped in a daring ambush, he teams up with a seasoned detective to crack the case. But soon he discovers the case isn\'t that simple.','/1LzBLlptRC7ogT8OPi8cb0NrDQb.jpg','1993-06-24',107,'Released','The world\'s toughest city needs more than an army to stop the mob… They need one man!','Crime Story',18857,4.2816,6.771,'IkS1wWkMXjU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12195,_binary '\0','/imzETwoWdxCVcPJSB2QqEDqZWmD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0108677',7.8,1272,'ro','È pericoloso sporgersi','It is late in the Ceausescu era in Romania, and Cristina is having a difficult time with her boyfriend. He wants her to have sex with him before he goes off to do his obligatory stint in the army. She wants him to marry her first. She also gets involved with a slightly rebellious actor, a would-be ladies\' man. He has some vague plans to defect - could those be the reason he is receiving mysterious phone calls? Or are they the work of his anonymous admirer?','/AvxIwusPhAm9kGTdjSrRIeKAgqs.jpg','1993-05-26',104,'Released',NULL,'Sundays on Leave',196928,0.9635,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12196,_binary '\0','/7P0YiRs39xQQqYMw1EGIHE4fprs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109000',6.9,2781,'de','00 Schneider - Jagd auf Nihil Baxter','The funny clown Bratislav Metulskie is found dead in circus \"Apollo\". The retired commissioner 00 Schneider is asked to assume control of the case. Schneider and his aged sidekick Körschgen investigate to find the murderer.','/yPmbdbFTXgxhQARyYo1w2avXk77.jpg','1994-12-21',92,'Released',NULL,'00 Schneider - Jagd auf Nihil Baxter',1652,1.8744,6.4,'xU-JHUI5xok','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12197,_binary '\0','/kf5drE0HFOp1tCUxlmKuO3lHqBW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109010',7.2,3921,'hi','१९४२: ए लव स्टोरी','The son of a politician loyal to the British rule falls in love with the daughter of a freedom fighter.','/nWJj37l6rIrpegYGoobLtdHOqV6.jpg','1994-04-15',157,'Released',NULL,'1942: A Love Story',33124,1.523,6,'aDXubcMwqJo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12198,_binary '\0','/2m8gk7KmYk5POA5b4Xr7URBsK4P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109015',4.7,10794,'en','3 Ninjas Kick Back','During a championship baseball match, the three brothers hear that their grandfather in Japan is in trouble, and head out to help him, conceding the match. When they arrive in Japan, they must use all their powers to defend him against his ancient enemy, who has returned to exact revenge.','/kXuh3c0DyvqSGo0DBatoemBwEtz.jpg','1994-02-25',93,'Released','Colt, Rocky and Tum Tum are back for bigger kicks in an all new adventure','3 Ninjas Kick Back',18885,4.6554,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12199,_binary '\0','/9fGRcNndP0IsVcbU3B7rZqiqhdk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109020',7.1,9751,'de','71 Fragmente einer Chronologie des Zufalls','71 scenes revolving around multiple Viennese residents who are by chance involved with a senseless gun slaughter on Christmas Eve.','/bcITctg9JiW32EnNz9vYmDlvaKx.jpg','1995-03-10',100,'Released',NULL,'71 Fragments of a Chronology of Chance',32764,3.0915,7,'qjqyWOMXwrg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12200,_binary '\0','/fO2ulA6piUHhKDSiQvC1ulYwZgR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109021',6.7,6490,'en','8 Seconds','This film chronicles the life of Lane Frost, 1987 PRCA Bull Riding World Champion, his marriage and his friendships with Tuff Hedeman (three-time World Champion) and Cody Lambert.','/wqKVkOveZrK6zwfrptGLVPmnMpR.jpg','1994-02-25',105,'Released','The sport made him a legend. His heart made him a hero.','8 Seconds',18069,3.7058,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12201,_binary '\0','/qGJxeY9lL7LEHXb85o5xABXJ4Hu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109028',7,1991,'en','Á köldum klaka','A Japanese businessman travels to Iceland and has a series of misadventures while venturing to a remote area to perform a traditional burial ritual where his parents died several years back.','/hFqI4uEViGZWPzebAm0gFs63Ewp.jpg','1995-02-10',85,'Released',NULL,'Cold Fever',68445,1.1799,6.4,'a5l6MbXu6AQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12202,_binary '\0','/kC004yrq5VIjCVKkDL6bo5oAvjr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109034',6.8,2319,'en','Above Suspicion','Dempsey Cain is an honored cop, a loving husband and father, and mentor to his handsome younger brother. Then a drug dealer\'s bullet paralyzes him for life and Dempsey\'s world is shattered. Suddenly, his wife and brother seem to care less about him than for each other, and a million-dollar insurance.','/8nLc5gGXs9UrGRuttNtwN118164.jpg','1995-05-21',95,'Released','They thought they could get away with murder. They thought they were... Above Suspicion.','Above Suspicion',24711,2.2753,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12203,_binary '\0','/puh0Yn0NP1U6WbBgxrfqT8DybL7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109035',6.6,18450,'en','Above the Rim','Story of a promising high school basketball star and his relationships with two brothers, one a drug dealer and the other a former basketball star fallen on hard times and now employed as a security guard.','/u23m3ILOMFRj0J7fKbmkioZPSqt.jpg','1994-03-23',96,'Released','Some games you play. Some games play you.','Above the Rim',19092,3.7505,7.063,'sEsCXWD7-Cc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12204,_binary '\0','/nbvREKIjX16mwNZtFqAoQTTHPnQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109040',6.9,358171,'en','Ace Ventura: Pet Detective','He\'s Ace Ventura: Pet Detective. The Ace is on the case to find the Miami Dolphins\' missing mascot and quarterback Dan Marino. He goes eyeball to eyeball with a man-eating shark, stakes out the Miami Dolphins and woos and wows the ladies. Whether he\'s undercover, under fire or underwater, he always gets his man… or beast!','/pqiRuETmuSybfnVZ7qyeoXhQyN1.jpg','1994-02-04',86,'Released','He\'s the best there is! (Actually, he\'s the only one there is.)','Ace Ventura: Pet Detective',3049,12.6319,6.584,'Lc0bgXhpmAE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12205,_binary '\0','/q1PuySDtRiKSgxAZjpIbFvvLOus.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109045',7.5,62578,'en','The Adventures of Priscilla, Queen of the Desert','Two drag performers and a transgender woman travel across the desert to perform their unique style of cabaret.','/rSkhcbHkk23fR3qhYJestqtamWK.jpg','1994-08-10',103,'Released','Finally, a comedy that will change the way you think, the way you feel, and most importantly... the way you dress.','The Adventures of Priscilla, Queen of the Desert',2759,5.2296,7.3,'VFmwVI-5lfU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12206,_binary '\0','/5OhBmG0wmA3uR2be9ntbjaJRheY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109053',6.6,3528,'en','Against the Wall','In 1971, a warden at Attica Penitentiary is caught up in a hostage crisis when inmates take over the prison to demand better living conditions.','/vTPZiHQDl7d67V9u7BSjiH3jwRL.jpg','1994-03-26',111,'Released','39 men died. The story never will.','Against the Wall',31619,3.2707,6.2,'ln4qTZXVh5w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12207,_binary '\0','/zcY5MpaNI7pSnxf4IcOMQ2xKICT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109066',7.4,5608,'zh','愛情萬歲','Three lonely young denizens of Taipei unknowingly share an apartment: May, a real estate agent who uses it for her sexual affairs; Ah-jung, her current lover; and Hsiao-kang, who\'s stolen the key and uses the apartment as a retreat.','/i60TuLXoZQaU9dJlClWf5kNdoKE.jpg','1994-09-02',118,'Released',NULL,'Vive L\'Amour',11985,3.3429,7.2,'Z6L1R0g5Bm8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12208,_binary '\0','/z25QroFHstdSqVuQfeGqpLu49DK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109067',5.6,9932,'en','The Air Up There','Jimmy Dolan is a college basketball coach who wants a big promotion. To get it, he needs to make a dramatic find. He ends up deep in Africa, hoping to recruit Saleh, a huge basketball prodigy Jimmy glimpsed in a home movie. But Saleh is the chief\'s son and has responsibilities at home, since the tribe\'s land is threatened by a mining company with its own hotshot basketball team.','/lY1yhtg0DRaMTzclYCXo0sP1kAV.jpg','1994-01-07',107,'Released','Jimmy Dolan went to recruit a new player. What he found was a whole new ballgame.','The Air Up There',46094,3.0073,6.173,'0bc_EmUZJ84','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12209,_binary '\0','/tkMVZc8JbOtRhzOsxph9jDVquq9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109068',6.2,60254,'en','Airheads','The Lone Rangers have heavy-metal dreams and a single demo tape they can\'t get anyone to play. The solution: Hijack an FM rock radio station and hold the deejays hostage until they agree to broadcast the band\'s tape.','/4xPG8pPMyeoec48gKWbbC85EC8j.jpg','1994-08-05',92,'Released','The amps are on but nobody\'s home.','Airheads',13595,4.6472,6.221,'y6rFEdy4hrk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12210,_binary '\0','/a02ttwhR98gxi4XEPZaJrUt0qZl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109071',6.9,1737,'cs','Akumulátor 1','In this movie, TV sets are full of life. If a person is in TV (e.g. because it was filmed on the street) it has a double that\'s right in the TV set. This double needs energy from the true character to survive. Each time, the real human watches TV, his Double will pull life energy from him. So there\'s a mysterious Death-serial. Many persons die in front of their TV set and nobody knows why. Olda, the main character, is one of the persons, that get more and more weak. He is near death, till Fisarek, the natural healer appears. He teaches Olda how he can resist this magic force and how he can fight it.','/aE5BBbf8zVSG6oBEgkTyLnNjYGf.jpg','1994-03-24',102,'Released',NULL,'Accumulator 1',16977,1.2185,6.966,'KW80enBn95s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12211,_binary '\0','/aJBp5VXZIXUkE3o8cU2gIrkrxsY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109078',6.5,1626,'en','Alien Nation: Dark Horizon','Followup movie to the TV series about 250,000 aliens, or \"newcomers\" as they are known, who have by now settled alongside the humans in California. Most of the newcomers were slaves, and the slave masters are now looking for them. They send Aponso to earth to locate the slaves ready for the aliens to pick them up.','/fDBN0S2l5QiuoVTPd8K4DTbcKPX.jpg','1994-10-25',90,'Released',NULL,'Alien Nation: Dark Horizon',24047,1.9332,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12212,_binary '\0','/lF1vgyD1kNa2xfwWyOsS6LYPfmv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109093',6.7,7512,'en','Amateur','A man wakes up in an alley, bleeding and with no memory of who he is. He stumbles into a coffee shop and is befriended by a charitable ex-nun who is failing in her attempts to write marketable pornography.','/n0lFhpnoctfsPo5GXvuvQSgv9Fj.jpg','1994-08-05',105,'Released','Accountancy, Murder, Amnesia, Torture, Ecstasy, Understanding, Redemption','Amateur',30157,3.0806,6.2,'RvwXIhOqTvQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12213,_binary '\0','/zPti1gv6K6WqkpHldYlK0clkQ7m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109098',4.4,1796,'en','American Cyborg: Steel Warrior','After the nuclear war people are sterile and ruled by the artifical intelligences they created in this violent world. The only woman who was able to give life to a child has to take the child through the dangerous city to the ship to save it. She is followed by an immortal killer robot through all the dangers, and only one guy tries to help her survive and protect her from the killing machine.','/spGgKY5H55HGFCjHKf7WNbk6Zzi.jpg','1993-06-05',94,'Released',NULL,'American Cyborg: Steel Warrior',50767,2.3977,5.2,'Luvqzik1Gls','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12214,_binary '\0','/umITBqiVlSyDwkBH2htNTDp4vTX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109099',5.6,3415,'en','American Yakuza','When Nick Davis leaves prison after one year in solitairy, he is hired to operate a forklift in a warehouse in the harbor owned by the Japanese Yakuza patriarch Isshin Tendo. The place is assaulted by the Italian Mafia lead by Dino Campanela and Nick rescues and saves the life of Shuji Sawamoto, who is the representative of Yakuza interests in America. Shuji hires Nick to work for Yakuza and becomes his godfather in the family after his oath to join Yakuza. However, Nick is a lonely FBI undercover agent assigned to penetrate the criminal organization. When the FBI discovers that Campanela is organizing a massive attack to destroy the Yakuza, Nick\'s boss Littman calls off the operation to leave the dirty work to the Italian Mafia. But the connection of Nick with Shuji and his goddaughter Yuko forces him to help his Japanese family.','/LDMQeNTasGcQKRahLMJEtB8E3V.jpg','1993-12-22',96,'Released','The mob has a new enemy.','American Yakuza',36909,2.4656,5.8,'Ty8TW1lmyXY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12215,_binary '\0','/8YboYnoujBeWv4Galqnb7I0h9jf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109117',8,58308,'hi','अंदाज़ अपना अपना','Two slackers competing for the affections of an heiress inadvertently become her protectors from an evil criminal.','/a0GV2V3yif2DbsMCSBrivvSHUWQ.jpg','1994-04-11',160,'Released',NULL,'Andaz Apna Apna',58128,2.173,6.793,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12216,_binary '\0','/jvTfDcBfhq5aSTp1jG9abW62cVD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109120',5.7,7793,'en','Andre','The true story of how a marine seal named Andre befriended a little girl and her family, circa 1962.','/bV2SjLBMTAgS9R64ejP8J3e4SSr.jpg','1994-08-17',94,'Released','The greatest adventure is finding your way home.','Andre',21352,2.5719,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12217,_binary '\0','/yrMfznQbmMtz9YgivpPLxShS4RD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109127',6.3,38268,'en','Angels in the Outfield','Roger is a foster child whose irresponsible father promises to get his act together when Roger\'s favourite baseball team, the California Angels, wins the pennant. The problem is that the Angels are in last place, so Roger prays for help to turn the team around. Sure enough, his prayers are answered in the form of angel Al.','/7WRt6l7tiXVPG9zLco1rwy5Ffw9.jpg','1994-07-15',103,'Released','Ya Gotta Believe!','Angels in the Outfield',24795,5.379,6,'wok7pG9_vX8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12218,_binary '\0','/tjffzrF3CZiqyK5NSBEdZnDiEUR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109129',5.5,2482,'en','Angie','Angie lives in Bensonhurst, Brooklyn, and dreams of a better life. When she finds out she\'s pregnant by her boyfriend, Vinnie, she decides she\'ll have the baby; but not Vinnie as a husband. This turns the entire close-knit neighborhood upside-down and starts Angie on a journey of self-discovery.','/A7B8snyynp1iOBYiGx76V3TOdKq.jpg','1994-03-04',108,'Released','An extraordinary story of the choices we make, the lives we tough, and the miracles we create.','Angie',83714,1.9723,5.8,'RZnQUeyz4Tc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12219,_binary '\0','/uBxcxhj1sF8NWcKsuKe7My0zDi5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109134',6.6,8005,'hi','अंजाम','After mistaking a flight attendant\'s attention for love, a wealthy, spoiled man becomes obsessed with her and soon tears her life apart.','/srzXcZCnGx5oMFUzHgyZOLARdFu.jpg','1994-04-22',146,'Released',NULL,'Anjaam',114436,2.1204,6.919,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12220,_binary '\0','/qMEcknq6zjo59rqjMf0v49Ba230.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109144',4.4,1300,'en','A.P.E.X.','A time-travel experiment in which a robot probe is sent from the year 2073 to the year 1973 goes terribly wrong thrusting one of the project scientists,into a plague ravaged alternate time-line whose war weary inhabitants are locked in a constant battle with killer robots from the future.','/2suttaVnNI3dhxBZ1jI9bHMf12m.jpg','1994-02-01',98,'Released','Trapped in a future they didn\'t create. Fighting an enemy they cannot stop.','A.P.E.X.',21947,1.9592,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12221,_binary '\0','/XBY0iPOFVghrFPT5I3heiToGca.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109162',5.9,9210,'de','Asterix in Amerika','When marauding Romans capture - and catapult - their pal Getafix into lands unknown, the shrewd and cunning Asterix and his able sidekick Obelix spring into action! But their journey leads them to a strange and dangerous new world, where they must face a tribe of Indians, a stampeding herd of buffalo and a medicine man with designs on their magic potion!','/lKSunt7dnbITSopaEeeR7KfeSHb.jpg','1994-09-29',85,'Released','«Danger lurks on foreign shores!»','Asterix Conquers America',9369,3.4554,6.2,'GgFlDipuvzw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12222,_binary '\0','/7bDfeFS4utVf2LNN5lr2pnVgRTb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109190',6.3,61393,'en','Baby\'s Day Out','Baby Bink couldn\'t ask for more: he has adoring (if somewhat sickly-sweet) parents, lives in a huge mansion, and he\'s just about to appear in the social pages of the paper. Unfortunately, not everyone in the world is as nice as Baby Bink\'s parents—especially the three enterprising kidnappers who pretend to be photographers from the newspaper. Successfully kidnapping Baby Bink, they have a harder time keeping hold of the rascal, who not only keeps one step ahead of them, but seems to be more than a little bit smarter than the three bumbling criminals.','/21U2jwl36hoTHsXB3fDuIQkcchu.jpg','1994-07-01',99,'Released','No bib. No crib. No problem.','Baby\'s Day Out',11212,10.3146,6.419,'CopsAJVGSBs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12223,_binary '\0','/lliLm5qfg8lbTCMHSuZ2Dup5HCM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109198',5.3,14415,'en','Bad Girls','Four former harlots try to leave the wild west (Colorado, to be exact) and head north to make a better life for themselves. Unfortunately someone from Cody\'s past won\'t let it happen that easily.','/cXY79luLXt2dzUP2Tx601zpZFzK.jpg','1994-04-22',99,'Released','It was a dangerous time to be a woman. And a good time to have friends.','Bad Girls',11853,6.1529,5.3,'CvSpONjcX2o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12224,_binary '\0','/54HjaN1wfl8O7F2xuBoDrduEzKJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109206',7.5,5933,'hi','बैंडिट क्वीन','Born a lower-caste girl in rural India\'s patriarchal society, \"married\" at 11, repeatedly raped and brutalized, Phoolan Devi finds freedom only as an avenging warrior, the eponymous Bandit Queen. Devi becomes a kind a bloody Robin Hood; this extraordinary biographical film offers both a vivid portrait of a driven woman and a savage critique of the society that made her.','/aYJgxlxo0NZvA075d4BelEjsbJA.jpg','1994-01-26',119,'Released','Revenge was her reply.','Bandit Queen',14785,1.9096,6.567,'Vb8cRenDMOg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12225,_binary '\0','/gyP4rLbexXLpXIBigzxGPJfZ3G9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109219',7,7099,'en','Barcelona','During the 1980s, uptight Ted Boynton is a salesman working in the Barcelona office of a Chicago-based company. He receives an unexpected visit from his cousin Fred, a naval officer who has come to Spain on a public relations mission for a U.S. fleet. Not exactly friends in the past, Ted and Fred strike up relationships with women in the Spanish city and experience conflicts -- Ted with his employer, and Fred with the Barcelona community.','/7dgX3naR9EsFMvQhwHY8My6r5FR.jpg','1994-07-29',100,'Released','Americans. Anti Americans. In love.','Barcelona',16771,1.8269,6.3,'qJGU08RaoNU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12226,_binary '\0','/yrzJZwLW41fEnEgav4vyhUpGb4k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109254',5.5,101316,'en','Beverly Hills Cop III','When his boss is killed, Detroit cop Axel Foley finds evidence that the murderer had ties to a California amusement park called Wonder World. Returning to sunny Beverly Hills once more, Foley reunites with Detective Billy Rosewood to solve the case. Along with Billy\'s new partner, Detective Jon Flint, they discover that Wonder World is being used as a front for a massive counterfeiting ring.','/7vIpCkgGEfk5LZwm78nMxswLJRH.jpg','1994-05-24',105,'Released','In for the ride of his life.','Beverly Hills Cop III',306,10.573,5.9,'kUjD5uKWxcg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12227,_binary '\0','/cLOyix71NJwkfwt77bnmmy9ibJO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109255',6.5,6710,'de','Der bewegte Mann','The heterosexual man Axel is thrown out of his girlfriends home for cheating and ends up moving in with a gay man. Axel learns the advantages of living with gay men even though they are attracted to him and when his girlfriend wants him back he must make a tough decision.','/2TcZBHcseRXLxNq2RXnKIsbKZwi.jpg','1994-10-05',94,'Released','A movie that will make you blush.','Maybe... Maybe Not',159,2.2316,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12228,_binary '\0','/e1guKT9UTvyQZufDf1bOcKPzYWQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109275',3.4,2132,'en','The Birds II: Land\'s End','Ted and his family have just moved to the sleepy coastal town of Gull Island so that he can complete work on his thesis. Everything couldn’t seem more picturesque about their new, seaside home… that is, except for the increasing number of aggressively behaving birds.','/3hJ1WWMmR5IyhpSmZjcFz5PwdED.jpg','1994-03-19',86,'Released','History Has a Nasty Way of Repeating Itself.','The Birds II: Land\'s End',4337,2.2916,4,'ES7wwIYXPPw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12229,_binary '\0','/Z4FW54wpXHcYKpCOY0OGhYwQ1I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109277',7.6,2501,'ja','劇場版 美少女戦士セーラームーンS 〜かぐや姫の恋人〜','As Usagi and her friends enjoy Christmas vacation, an unusual and fierce snowstorm hits town... The evil Snow Queen Kaguya has returned to claim Earth as her own. Crucial to Queen Kaguya\'s plan is a magical crystal from outer space, approaching Earth disguised as a comet. Once she gets hold of the crystal, she will have the power to suck away all life energy and cover the Earth in ice. Will Sailor Moon find the crystal before Queen Kaguya? Will her powers be enough to save the Earth from permanent winter? All hope lies with the Legendary Ultimate Scout Power!','/8HLrjXHz5LhmIMiahoC3S55bSim.jpg','1994-12-04',59,'Released','Sailor Moon vs Snow Queen! The Legendary Sailor Scouts\' Power Appears!','Sailor Moon S the Movie: Hearts in Ice',30575,5.633,7.6,'wbq_ybcuofc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12230,_binary '\0','/o9AEP2Z8Ez1DlbYIrxJl2URj4L8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109279',6.6,11437,'en','Black Beauty','The fates of horses, and the people who own and command them, are revealed as Black Beauty narrates the circle of his life.','/5uH60FBDPQoyAnc4uvU0fIB8JXv.jpg','1994-07-29',88,'Released','A story for all ages. A friendship for all time. Share the adventure.','Black Beauty',14522,5.5184,6.7,'2SADctToBnE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12231,_binary '\0','/ddpmx0dH1bXOp3jQt18GHaLwbAX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109287',5.3,24275,'en','Blank Check','Bullied by his siblings and nagged by his parents, 11-year-old Preston Waters is fed up with his family — especially their frugality. But he gets his chance to teach them a lesson when a money-laundering criminal nearly bulldozes Preston with his car and compensates the boy with a blank check. Preston makes the check out for $1 million and goes on a spending spree he\'ll never forget.','/qhsH1BGqeCDHoogt5ebxOgERJGb.jpg','1994-02-11',93,'Released','Quick thinking landed him a million bucks... now everybody\'s after it!','Blank Check',13962,6.4557,6,'mf-7OvD6oFQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12232,_binary '\0','/59cmxJwHdTofw5tDBMNm3sej0Nj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109288',5.2,11235,'en','Blankman','Darryl is a childlike man with a genius for inventing various gadgets out of junk. When he stumbles on a method to make his clothes bulletproof, he decides to use his skills to be the lowest budgeted superhero of all.','/9b1zje1Yp3kaJOn8pJqaQ1WLmoj.jpg','1994-08-19',96,'Released','Coming to save your butt!','Blankman',20678,4.2512,5.389,'r4sNVsTp500','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12233,_binary '\0','/1Gj5fEY9UuNKm9551wnhmKqy047.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109297',6.2,9860,'en','Blink','Emma is an attractive girl in her 20s who has been blind for 20 years. A new type of eye operation partially restores her sight, but she is having problems: sometimes she doesn\'t \"remember\" what she\'s seen until later. One night she is awakened by a commotion upstairs. Peering out of her door, she sees a shadowy figure descending the stairs. Convinced that her neighbour has been murdered she approaches the police, only to find that she is unsure if it was just her new eyes playing tricks on her.','/wP6dfv85SQLogoNguUd6jO1A4be.jpg','1993-10-01',106,'Released','What you can\'t see, can kill you.','Blink',26203,2.3136,6.1,'azibdrz8l3c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12234,_binary '\0','/8d6kHxFAIE2P54WpxAssgpm5W0Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109303',6.3,37215,'en','Blown Away','Blown Away tells the story of Jimmy Dove, who works for the Boston bomb squad. Shortly after Dove leaves the force, his partner is killed by a bomb that Dove thinks might have been made by someone he knows.','/fD23iryzdjfRU05nQAQriD0A3AR.jpg','1994-07-01',121,'Released','5. 4. 3. 2. 1......Time\'s Up.','Blown Away',178,6.0373,6.214,'f3N-e9BLZFo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12235,_binary '\0','/y9EqhIvXtvKOFLZMSZL3jHybXvZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109305',6.3,16561,'en','Blue Chips','Pete Bell, a college basketball coach is under a lot of pressure. His team isn\'t winning and he cannot attract new players. The stars of the future are secretly being paid by boosters. This practice is forbidden in the college game, but Pete is desperate and has pressures from all around.','/tO71i4Ob64tchCRBB5MoqonPKAF.jpg','1994-02-18',108,'Released','Victory doesn\'t come cheap.','Blue Chips',19819,3.7938,6.108,'3FC5zdcct9s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12236,_binary '\0','/mcFAhNqy9N2EkHAHcPOUfEEvomJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109306',6.4,9104,'en','Blue Sky','Hank Marshall is a tough, square-jawed, straitlaced Army engineer and nuclear science expert, assigned to help conduct weapons testing in 1950s America. Hank has become a thorn in the side of the Army, though, for a couple of very different reasons. He is an outspoken opponent of atmospheric testing, though his superiors hold contrary views and want to squelch his concerns...and his reports. The other problem is his wife, Carly. She is voluptuous and volatile, wreaking havoc in his personal life and stirring up intrigue at each new Army base.','/zG40OnO4Y98lo1iDHyFo5TaZyP1.jpg','1994-09-16',101,'Released','In a world of secrets, love is the most powerful weapon.','Blue Sky',57834,2.4687,6.08,'G33WnfZ9YCU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12237,_binary '\0','/yfAOozKlOuq5PtTQ0S6uhjjWsPP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109321',6,5136,'it','Botte di Natale','Two brothers who hate themselves are going to spend Christmas with their mother. She tries to get them together.','/kZYAN78ARDZZLDPig4yBnNsNUW2.jpg','1994-11-25',107,'Released','How The West was almost lost','Troublemakers',9287,3.6234,6.161,'OWUv6SLX0ow','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12238,_binary '\0','/uu2AafsWp6sovE8OHYqXpudGRwU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109327',6,14411,'en','Brainscan','A lonely teenage horror fan and video gamer plays a new immersive and hypnotic computer game where he becomes a psychopathic killer, but when he emerges, he finds that the murder has actually happened.','/5JqamPZC7W5rzRNweMGhqltcsIV.jpg','1994-04-22',96,'Released','Wanna play? I dare you.','Brainscan',14237,2.9704,6.1,'CJwuX3m1Bcs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12239,_binary '\0','/8GKe3okbcxaTMDkLumJJuv3wOGC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109340',7.2,3840,'en','The Browning Version','Andrew Crocker-Harris is an embittered and disliked teacher of Greek and Latin at a British prep school. After nearly 20 years of service, he is being forced to retire for \'health reasons\', and perhaps may not even be given a pension. The boys regard him as a Hitler, with some justification. His unfaithful wife Laura tries to hurt him in any way she can. Andrew must come to terms with his failed life and at least regain his own self-esteem.','/8My9Wnzu1zasVVzGdDj5y2dItuM.jpg','1994-06-08',97,'Released','The greatest lessons in the life and the ones learned by heart.','The Browning Version',49805,2.15,6.4,'yhKQH-ZLtrM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12240,_binary '\0','/6zfPDvqeZUleXjNaU5iWQwHUtCN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109348',7.4,43499,'en','Bullets Over Broadway','After young playwright, David Shayne obtains funding for his play from gangster Nick Valenti, Nick\'s girlfriend Olive miraculously lands the role of a psychiatrist—but not only is she a bimbo who could never pass for a psychiatrist—she\'s a dreadful actress. David puts up with the leading man who is a compulsive eater, the grand dame who wants her part jazzed up, and Olive\'s interfering hitman/bodyguard—but, eventually he must decide whether art or life is more important.','/mY9D1oCLeDKNMdUO8EV7MoCZ3up.jpg','1994-10-14',98,'Released','A killer comedy!','Bullets Over Broadway',11382,3.9184,7.1,'DSPx3Bcvau0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12241,_binary '\0','/edCqcKd0gjhAW2cEAve4iY4ndor.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109357',6,4153,'tr','C Blok','Tulay, a restless woman whose marriage is slowly disintegrating sets out to come to terms with various traumas while continually being watched by Halit, a resident in her apartment complex.','/skDhD6o56cb3fwshypaghxTs1Do.jpg','1994-08-26',92,'Released',NULL,'Block C',52187,1.3292,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12242,_binary '\0','/fTvDZ46fRW9zcz5myEBuE5Dp6SS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109361',5.4,9740,'en','Cabin Boy','A foul-mouthed finishing school graduate mistakenly winds up on an ill-fated fishing boat, and faces the wrath of a crew that considers him bad luck.','/xy2BzE3siqU67VQCQ2k4xideNNM.jpg','1994-01-07',80,'Released','He\'s Setting Sail On The High Seas... Without A Rudder, A Compass, Or A Clue!','Cabin Boy',26391,2.2085,5.241,'cmBq41nVrXs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12243,_binary '\0','/hUqpbtSns4usIVA1vhclCYj0lDu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109369',6.1,11742,'en','Camp Nowhere','Morris \"Mud\" Himmel has a problem. His parents desperately want to send him away to summer camp. He hates going to summer camp, and would do anything to get out of it. Talking to his friends, he realizes that they are all facing the same sentence: a boring summer camp. Together with his friends, he hatches a plan to trick all the parents into sending them to a camp of their own design.','/5DmempuEgWyHCu5lMVyICTRgZUp.jpg','1994-08-26',96,'Released','No parents. No counselors. No rules!','Camp Nowhere',17745,4.373,5.9,'A7eyOFMqrEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12244,_binary '\0','/c4vkEcwWiRAg5TAb4sbuIElSR4T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109370',5.9,19740,'en','Canadian Bacon','The U.S. President, low in the opinion polls, gets talked into raising his popularity by trying to start a cold war with Canada.','/bzK2aQ8xUB67kwCR5LHTSY99HtT.jpg','1995-06-08',91,'Released','It\'s lonely at the top when there\'s no butt left to kick.','Canadian Bacon',1775,4.4335,5.7,'kI5SEOdN7Fc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12245,_binary '\0','/lKQRcvbhRFMew82Vj0CtLBS9UWw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109374',6.2,2676,'en','Captives','A beautiful young dentist working in a tough British prison starts to become attracted to a violent inmate after the break-up of her marriage, and embarks upon an illicit affair with him, with terrible consequences for all.','/7rOOxUNrTLZMT6KAdBd8WMnElsd.jpg','1994-05-03',100,'Released','How far will you go for love?','Captives',37667,2.138,5.8,'Z2LIMGsmuqU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12246,_binary '\0','/1itzckOrvl0jeWZf96xSQMX10ew.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109376',2.6,4608,'en','Car 54, Where Are You?','Brash NYC policeman Officer Gunther Toody is partnered with stiff, by-the-book Officer Francis Muldoon to protect an important mafia witness prior to testifying against orgainzed crime in Brooklyn, all the while dealing with their personal lives, overbearing spouses, common criminals, arms dealers, and their officious boss Captain Anderson.','/1wD1ez4d3wSd79eTdFbH5nvc5p5.jpg','1994-01-28',89,'Released','An arresting comedy.','Car 54, Where Are You?',31395,2.7976,3.581,'qm4Gfy-u_So','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12247,_binary '\0','/qG1gKmoLOgaA2x3IOkoJb0eoWMI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109380',6.7,1583,'pt','Carlota Joaquina, Princesa do Brazil','The Spanish Infanta Carlota Joaquina is promised to D. João VI at the age of 10. Forced to leave for Portugal, Carlota suffers a great disappointment when she meets her promised prince. With the death of D. José, Carlota Joaquina and D. João VI inherit the Portuguese crown. However, frightened by the French Revolution and the approach of Napoleon\'s army, they decide to flee to their colony: Brazil.','/hOU1KgIGdD7fOWSru7eHTMWFus9.jpg','1995-01-06',100,'Released',NULL,'Carlota Joaquina, Princess of Brazil',126045,1.5568,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12248,_binary '\0','/dsMqUvdYGeXSky9cQO26JJOhFZa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109382',7.2,10227,'it','Caro diario','Nanni Moretti recounts in his diary three slice-of-life stories marked by a dry, ironic gaze: in the first, he rides his Vespa through a deserted, sun-drenched summertime Rome; in the second, he visits a reclusive friend on an island, who ropes him into an impromptu journey between islets in search of quiet; and in the last, he finds himself grappling with an unknown illness.','/fpuOq1YN7LHjctGFniOK8OPnwgs.jpg','1993-11-12',101,'Released',NULL,'Caro diario',25403,2.2976,7.328,'Qujgo5C09rM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12249,_binary '\0','/4mopIaKwC0RBK0kGVjgSnkLYn1m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109402',5.9,20808,'en','The Chase','Jack Hammond is sentenced to life in prison, but manages to escape. To get away from the police he takes a girl as hostage and drives off in her car. The girl happens to be the only daughter of one of the richest men in the state. In a while the car chase is being broadcast live on every TV-channel.','/lEmGW4Fc9wMRLIKq6NRojZnTbdp.jpg','1994-03-04',89,'Released','Getting there is twice the fun.','The Chase',10694,4.7331,5.786,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12250,_binary '\0','/g6jT5XdfDN72THwXI01WtCSTA35.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109403',5.2,7642,'en','Chasers','Military men Rock Reilly and Eddie Devane are tasked with taking a prisoner, blonde bombshell Toni Johnson, on what becomes an unforgettable road trip. Toni, an enlistee who\'s in trouble for deserting her unit, soon proves that she\'s craftier than most inmates.','/mEG6fTyTjsA1vzTTqCXsiJzjdQ5.jpg','1994-04-22',102,'Released','It was supposed to be a routine prisoner transfer. But this was no ordinary prisoner.','Chasers',24405,2.9198,5.407,'ubV1jwg9Ce0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12251,_binary '\0','/44nIaOvDWJ04EGFEMGrU1gO3im7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109412',5.9,2949,'cn','赤裸羔羊','A young woman is trained by a professional assassin to become her partner in crime.','/d9V3lIqF0fyQfMe4CUl86N0nQfJ.jpg','1992-12-03',93,'Released','They\'re beautiful. They\'re perfect. They\'re to DIE for!','Naked Killer',26877,6.2475,6,'LlPP65j02B4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12252,_binary '\0','/c2JSNywZp3ifP9Ea8NSvLkfv57h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109415',4.4,9309,'en','Children of the Corn III: Urban Harvest','After a couple adopts a pair of orphaned brothers, it becomes alarmingly clear the boys are much more than they seem.','/xTNGI3MGTlOTiYU9ucfWd79kV2k.jpg','1995-09-12',90,'Released','In the heart of a city, an adult nightmare is about to be reborn...','Children of the Corn III: Urban Harvest',25749,4.0623,4.8,'pWlPSl7HjuM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12253,_binary '\0','/sWyflLpu1qWLTirUadWmL2X3eln.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109417',6.3,9473,'en','China Moon','Detective Kyle Bodine falls for Rachel Munro who is trapped in a violent marriage. After she shoots her husband, Kyle relucantly agrees to help hide the body, but his partner is showing an unusual flair for finding clues.','/v2o5uqHety8727LukhGfyAfA8EE.jpg','1994-03-04',99,'Released','He thought it was passion. It was deceit. He thought it was love. It was murder.','China Moon',26337,4.0225,6.1,'nc4jNN-afbQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12254,_binary '\0','/8e6avmXiqurj5LHkmdHBq6rc5jm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109424',7.9,113896,'cn','重慶森林','Two melancholic Hong Kong policemen fall in love: one with a mysterious underworld figure, the other with a beautiful and ethereal server at a late-night restaurant.','/43I9DcNoCzpyzK8JCkJYpHqHqGG.jpg','1994-07-14',103,'Released','If my memory of her has an expiration date, let it be 10,000 years...','Chungking Express',11104,13.1201,8,'OPCug9jyG9k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12255,_binary '\0','/kuq99XpsY2wyI0yMMNjK5pTLafY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109439',5.6,21902,'en','City Slickers II: The Legend of Curly\'s Gold','Mitch Robbins\' 40th birthday begins quite well until he returns home and finds his brother Glen, the black sheep of the family, in his sofa. Nevertheless he is about to have a wonderful birthday-night with his wife when he discovers a treasure map of Curly by chance. Together with Phil and unfortunately Glen he tries to find the hidden gold of Curly\'s father in the desert of Arizona.','/gh0lsyJARglhpbKmnY8i8M7V5bI.jpg','1994-06-10',116,'Released','They\'re back in the saddle!','City Slickers II: The Legend of Curly\'s Gold',11310,4.6582,5.348,'qgg9I4zOTnk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12256,_binary '\0','/8j70OIZzpxuAB8dsjxhsqLmTuhW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109440',7.5,11721,'fr','La Cité de la peur','A second-class horror movie has to be shown at Cannes Film Festival, but, before each screening, the projectionist is killed by a mysterious fellow, with hammer and sickle, just as it happens in the film to be shown.','/7RFbGblTn679rjPo88MPSbtbJx9.jpg','1994-03-09',100,'Released',NULL,'Fear City: A Family-Style Comedy',15097,3.9315,7.458,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12257,_binary '\0','/qt3upsZUFpDGLZRyDTXR4xkLNbs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109443',5.7,4389,'en','Clean Slate','Pogue is a private eye with a problem: every morning when he wakes up, he has total amnesia, waking up with a \'blank slate\'. Since he is in the middle of a hot investigation and has a developing romance, this is less than convenient.','/kAYsvQvBVshLHGTIDGHcj9jTJq0.jpg','1994-05-06',107,'Released','It\'s a day he\'ll never forget. Until tomorrow.','Clean Slate',18658,3.6101,5.7,'tBOd_AiVa-8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12258,_binary '\0','/hEMxuwywh3FmWjhkIrfo57k3M2n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109444',6.9,117874,'en','Clear and Present Danger','Agent Jack Ryan becomes acting Deputy Director of Intelligence for the CIA when Admiral Greer is diagnosed with cancer. When an American businessman, and friend of the president, is murdered on his yacht, Ryan starts discovering links between the man and drug dealers. As former CIA agent John Clark is sent to Colombia to kill drug cartel kingpins in retaliation, Ryan must fight through multiple cover-ups to figure out what happened and who\'s responsible.','/6xTM8FPxrLRYwz6I3fqtwh7xybs.jpg','1994-08-03',141,'Released','Truth needs a soldier.','Clear and Present Danger',9331,10.349,6.6,'3sG1tGbpT7c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12259,_binary '\0','/sjfbZVKRGh84lNxhqvuhdvovh18.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109445',7.7,241785,'en','Clerks','Convenience and video store clerks Dante and Randal are sharp-witted, potty-mouthed and bored out of their minds. So in between needling customers, the counter jockeys play hockey on the roof, visit a funeral home and deal with their love lives.','/9IiSgiq4h4siTIS9H3o4nZ3h5L9.jpg','1994-10-19',92,'Released','Just because they serve you doesn\'t mean they like you.','Clerks',2292,6.5802,7.4,'f8yqQkABBjY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12260,_binary '\0','/ncU6X4hosU9srxqC0hGxajZvAyD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109446',6.7,87728,'en','The Client','A street-wise kid, Mark Sway, sees the suicide of Jerome Clifford, a prominent Louisiana lawyer, whose current client is Barry \'The Blade\' Muldano, a Mafia hit-man. Before Jerome shoots himself, he tells Mark where the body of a Senator is buried. Clifford shoots himself and Mark is found at the scene, and both the FBI and the Mafia quickly realize that Mark probably knows more than he says.','/oLdkJ4ZjxPtFSUChdjDQvHM9l75.jpg','1994-07-20',119,'Released','A district attorney out for a conviction. A new lawyer out of her league. A young boy who knew too much.','The Client',10731,10.7157,6.692,'EZY7_dCQRgk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12261,_binary '\0','/5vOca8MbJGUGvZSu229qpJUoyaK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109447',5.6,9587,'en','Clifford','When his brother asks him to look after his young son, Clifford, Martin Daniels agrees, taking the boy into his home and introducing him to his future wife, Sarah. Clifford is fixated on the idea of visiting a famed theme park, and Martin, an engineer who helped build the park, makes plans to take him. But, when Clifford reveals himself to be a first-rate brat, his uncle goes bonkers, and a loony inter-generational standoff ensues.','/ym5iYreD35Qa4Kjq9FOmtMqCtMF.jpg','1994-04-01',89,'Released','What\'s the difference between Clifford and a pit bull? One will tear your heart out, scare your friends and wreck your house. The other one is a dog.','Clifford',2778,2.143,5.1,'hNF-yVRGnsI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12262,_binary '\0','/1ZpyiQWRS95hixy6ajtJk4WVduZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109450',6.4,8587,'en','Cobb','Al Stump is a famous sports-writer chosen by Ty Cobb to co-write his official, authorized \'autobiography\' before his death. Cobb, widely feared and despised, feels misunderstood and wants to set the record straight about \'the greatest ball-player ever,\' in his words.','/clOqh9is8vWZvX6AUjF4HtLdQMj.jpg','1994-12-02',128,'Released','Everyone hated this baseball legend. And he loved it.','Cobb',29973,2.6938,5.7,'zZFiH0SQpiY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12263,_binary '\0','/lF3stznsrRzgiWBVG4x1lYOXQiA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109454',6.9,2274,'fr','Le Colonel Chabert','When Colonel Chabert returns from the war, he discovers that he has lost everything.','/Usaduh828gtYe6jw9DosnPJ7I9.jpg','1994-09-21',110,'Released',NULL,'Colonel Chabert',41580,1.6879,6.7,'O8kU6FhOBBY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12264,_binary '\0','/3yFGxAMXvfsVWIEmzRbntELcdkw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109456',5.2,27774,'en','Color of Night','A color-blind psychiatrist is stalked by an unknown killer after taking over his murdered friend\'s therapy group and becomes embroiled in an intense affair with a mysterious woman who may be connected to the crime.','/w1OBPkf3BxeC7543YzFwiKIwBFJ.jpg','1994-08-19',121,'Released','In the heat of desire, love can turn to deception. Nothing is what it seems when day turns into night.','Color of Night',2124,7.033,5.762,'09rrVrDZJYU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12265,_binary '\0','/jm1aj0nfly0A1S18dRq6ngqw1Rs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109478',4.7,1418,'en','The Cool Surface','A writer returns to Hollywood after finishing his novel in the wilderness. Still smarting from his girlfriend\'s suicide and his publisher\'s criticisms of his novel, he becomes intrigued by the neighbor couple\'s abusive relationship.','/tLNFrAsJiDDJrktYssqp9y5oHHK.jpg','1994-04-05',88,'Released','One touch is all it takes.','The Cool Surface',62611,1.9837,4,'0QpwuYxWG4Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12266,_binary '\0','/or1yV4hqs8X2sDsFhGXSR8Vc8YM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109480',5.3,8033,'en','Cops & Robbersons','When the police discover that a mob hitman has moved in next door to the Robbersons, they set up a stakeout in the Robbersons\' home. Hard-nosed, tough-as-nails Jake Stone and his young partner Tony Moore are assigned to the stakeout, but now it is a question of whether Jake can last long enough to capture the bad guys. The Robbersons want to help, and by doing so, drive Jake crazy.','/wnkWgFU5UcLwbExCp1YtCg5Ox4E.jpg','1994-04-15',93,'Released','One\'s the toughest cop on the force. The other just wants to get some action. Together, they\'re in a disaster!','Cops & Robbersons',26261,2.4198,5.2,'WtEYTu8vxoA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12267,_binary '\0','/rxRf5Te8PX4Ko5iFUN13llcsLI1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109484',6.6,15501,'en','Corrina, Corrina','When Manny Singer\'s wife dies, his young daughter Molly becomes mute and withdrawn. To help cope with looking after Molly, he hires sassy housekeeper Corrina Washington, who coaxes Molly out of her shell and shows father and daughter a whole new way of life. Manny and Corrina\'s friendship delights Molly and enrages the other townspeople.','/atPbnSNt21aSysWOk4QCvRT5XxE.jpg','1994-08-12',115,'Released','They needed a family. What they got was magic.','Corrina, Corrina',10464,4.8115,6.7,'SvbCmpo-luk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12268,_binary '\0','/iI8vFLKngsJ2iJhNYmRdpOAyLiB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109493',6,9935,'en','The Cowboy Way','Two championship rodeo partners travel to New York to find their missing friend, Nacho Salazar who went missing there.','/5oBVSzbWD85zRCKIWm0KvhypUZU.jpg','1994-06-03',107,'Released','How the East was won.','The Cowboy Way',19176,4.1368,5.7,'McAPp0LAfOw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12269,_binary '\0','/mIKuvEhBvDf9LGxE9x6m0hDR9Au.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109504',7.1,12482,'en','Crooklyn','From Spike Lee comes this vibrant semi-autobiographical portrait of a school-teacher, her stubborn jazz-musician husband and their five kids living in \'70s Brooklyn.','/iFqe07F78SO0SIBzWcK4I5MwNvP.jpg','1994-05-13',114,'Released','A new look at the old neighborhood.','Crooklyn',34152,3.1319,6.8,'KnYl1TfWD-U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12270,_binary '\0','/2VN9umruwVZsT1Pr1NMCV71HpUu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109506',7.5,233560,'en','The Crow','Exactly one year after young rock guitarist Eric Draven and his fiancée are brutally killed by a ruthless gang of criminals, Draven, watched over by a hypnotic crow, returns from the grave to exact revenge.','/rMMB3v6jYHjsvXRNJYESacoTD7j.jpg','1994-05-11',102,'Released','Believe in angels.','The Crow',9495,10.503,7.5,'Ltzov6nhud0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12271,_binary '\0','/1mlfORlfu2PtZnlEB3gMKqJy7Qp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109508',8,23225,'en','Crumb','This movie chronicles the life and times of R. Crumb. Robert Crumb is the cartoonist/artist who drew Keep On Truckin\', Fritz the Cat, and played a major pioneering role in the genesis of underground comix. Through interviews with his mother, two brothers, wife, ex-wife and ex-girlfriends, as well as selections from his vast quantity of graphic art, we are treated to a darkly comic ride through one man\'s subconscious mind.','/9ocTHdBCJdwJ65Tubg3lYlfMxEY.jpg','1995-04-28',121,'Released','Weird sex · Obsession · Comic books','Crumb',26564,2.706,7.539,'67uWAtFmjYI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12272,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109514',5.6,2544,'en','Curse of the Starving Class','Curse of the Starving Class is a play by Sam Shepard, considered the first of a series on family tragedies. Drama about a dirt-poor 1950\'s-era farm family. Dad\'s a foul talking drunk and Mom is desperately trying to save what\'s left of their family life.','/dqWagNZENRquoRmXIQS3ASnozLl.jpg','1994-09-13',102,'Released',NULL,'Curse of the Starving Class',169339,1.9404,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12273,_binary '\0','/j4wM9nywFEgjhYD8Ylu4UVKwN8v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109515',3.8,1698,'en','CyberTracker','Eric is a secret agent currently working as security guard for senator Dilly. The senator is the main advocate for a new kind of police officer: the Tracker, a perfect and nearly invulnerable android. When Eric realizes that senator Dilly is playing dirty games, he does not only have Dilly\'s security chief Ross after him, but also those nearly undefeatable Trackers.','/nFRhXWT46YGY8OLO31sJEHClcOg.jpg','1994-08-22',91,'Released','A Machine with An Attitude','CyberTracker',78375,1.5527,4.1,'XxpLeVWPlc0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12274,_binary '\0','/tJT4K4nhSuKsNmbwb40C8UVZbTR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109517',4.3,1512,'en','Cyborg Cop','Ex-DEA agent Jack receives an emergency message from his brother Phillip, whose team was ambushed on the Caribbean island of St. Keith. Jack goes to St. Keith to find his brother, who has been turned into a cyborg by the drug runner he was after.','/imTBB3Q2dr5tZsKkbmlkYaoDBrP.jpg','1993-10-05',95,'Released','Programmed to kill... He is unstoppable.','Cyborg Cop',73587,1.6318,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12275,_binary '\0','/qdJL2ckIXn4Hrwre80ZA0hJVLt9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109520',6.1,46279,'en','D2: The Mighty Ducks','After Gordon Bombay\'s hockey comeback is cut short he is named coach of Team USA Hockey for the Junior Goodwill Games. Bombay reunites the Mighty Ducks and introduces a few new players, however, he finds himself distracted by his newfound fame and must regather if the Ducks are to defeat tournament favourites Iceland.','/veGW1N6QUglP4osDdOUI6CZCcBI.jpg','1994-03-25',106,'Released','The puck stops here!','D2: The Mighty Ducks',11164,5.8361,6.232,'OI9PFPLwEcE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12276,_binary '\0','/eEPhfLscpUahaBTdxy7jBLk3OaZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109529',7.1,1532,'en','Dance Me Outside','Explores the sensitive, and tense, relationship between life on an First Nations reservation and life in the outside world. When Native Canadian Silas Crow is forced to write a personal essay in order to get a much-desired job, he tells the story of the rape and murder of an Indian girl by a drunken thug. When the killer received a lenient two-year sentence for manslaughter, the First Nations community felt shock and anger—and tried desperately to deal with the after-effects of this lack of justice.','/exqsixP7i48pMsV2ejfBaSyWhno.jpg','1995-03-10',84,'Released','After the party\'s over, real life kicks into gear.','Dance Me Outside',96461,1.3764,6.6,'eQz7K-4QsLw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12277,_binary '\0','/lEZVWSVMobZsncEDp3Tbd7rmhlK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109550',5.9,3662,'en','Dark Waters','After the death of her father, a young woman travels to a remote convent on an island in the Black Sea to find out why her father funded it for years.','/wDcyo7b0XniwJlgGESKiqZ7xNFe.jpg','1993-12-29',94,'Released','A New Wave of Horror','Dark Waters',65899,1.7993,5.7,'AZDirq-BiuQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12278,_binary '\0','/spmyXKG2BZnEQuFPQ3R2Q539EnI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109575',5.6,5521,'en','Death Machine','Chaank Armaments is experimenting with the ultimate fighting machine which is part human - part machine. So far, the Hardman project has been unreliable and has killed a number of innocent people. The genius behind this project is Jack who lives in a world of models, toys and magazines. When he is fired by Cale for killing a few corporate officers, he unleashes the ultimate killing machine called the \'Warbeast\' against Cale and those who would help her.','/vmDaabHFO4NvrEc6kT8aRMv9Rve.jpg','1995-05-02',122,'Released','It feeds on your fear.','Death Machine',1702,3.8397,5.848,'6bDi0C-7XCs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12279,_binary '\0','/tZGsjeXFg0hRv0Uip2cQJ8fxX3Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109578',4.9,9989,'en','Death Wish V: The Face of Death','Paul Kersey is back at working vigilante justice when his fiancée, Olivia, has her business threatened by mobsters.','/5gcpHxQh93M6CKTIMpngErxxq0D.jpg','1994-01-14',95,'Released','No judge. No jury. No appeals. No deals.','Death Wish V: The Face of Death',34746,4.7113,5.6,'_QlN7kuSjT0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12280,_binary '\0','/buQbUKiV7fn0vX1mwH6D0Uvvv2t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109579',7.2,29265,'en','Death and the Maiden','A political activist is convinced that her guest is a man who once tortured her for the government.','/yrGpwavZwfprhjVRHMHc165q22u.jpg','1994-05-04',103,'Released','Prepare yourself for the moment of truth.','Death and the Maiden',10531,4.2989,7.1,'MxR1pHaMpcY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12281,_binary '\0','/fHPTQ18tuwtJ3JvrCeZMZs4X58Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109592',7,26545,'it','DellaMorte DellAmore','Francesco Dellamorte is the groundskeeper at a cemetery where the dead just won’t stay dead—and it’s up to him to deal with those who come back to life with a hunger for human flesh. But Dellamorte’s job soon becomes much more complicated when he falls for an enigmatic young woman whose husband has recently died.','/cI5AV3jCuxmoQp0N7Z16SI2b7Xk.jpg','1994-03-25',104,'Released','Zombies, guns and sex, OH MY!!!','Cemetery Man',21588,3.2431,6.9,'I6o0TJNC77I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12282,_binary '\0','/opCNBkNTkGKBVjxRxd06UqnZKGZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109593',4.7,2563,'en','Delta of Venus','A struggling American writer and a fellow American expatriate begin a sordid affair among the chaos and discord of 1940 Paris, France on the brink of World War II.','/j43W5XkXR7u7uVAvfniEXiQ3Bpv.jpg','1995-06-09',99,'Released','In 1939, Elena went to Paris searching for her voice as a writer. What she found was her voice as a woman.','Delta of Venus',38867,2.5831,4.4,'Gg9c-WnK6sM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12283,_binary '\0','/h3TbBGDAm87wLJTeK8w1Wm0Jqsp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109627',4,2054,'en','Dinosaur Island','Welcome to lush Dinosaur Island, where a tribe of gorgeous cavedwelling warrior women satisfy the exotic fantasies of five downed military airmen. Fearsome battles with the island\'s ferocious maneating dinosaurs are the only disruption of their seductive pleasures on this island paradise. Narrowly surviving with their lives, the rugged men fall under the seductive spell of their lovely captors and soon find their every dream fulfilled.','/4vCWyCtc1m7qWUogiE6HpEMkoAT.jpg','1994-03-23',85,'Released','It\'s Just Like Paradise, Only Better Looking.','Dinosaur Island',28138,2.7749,4.4,'ncnJ2C6k9s4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12284,_binary '\0','/gMXzyxFvLi2hJpGua9UE4kaI9cE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109635',6.2,58907,'en','Disclosure','A computer specialist is sued for sexual harassment by a former lover turned boss who initiated the act forcefully, which threatens both his career and his personal life.','/9e8cp3ho2aZrHMFgitysCoJxXwP.jpg','1994-12-09',128,'Released','Sex Is Power.','Disclosure',8984,7.4507,6.244,'_UtApAxpjJ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12285,_binary '\0','/puWAyIPaujRp1Nvp4Ikzc5nEIb0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109642',7.4,53980,'en','Dolores Claiborne','Dolores Claiborne was accused of killing her abusive husband twenty years ago, but the court\'s findings were inconclusive and she was allowed to walk free. Now she has been accused of killing her employer, Vera Donovan, and this time there is a witness who can place her at the scene of the crime. Things look bad for Dolores when her daughter Selena, a successful Manhattan magazine writer, returns to cover the story.','/yqY5h9kI456xXRWv6u9t0Axn9CS.jpg','1995-03-24',132,'Released','Sometimes, an accident can be an unhappy woman\'s best friend.','Dolores Claiborne',11929,5.3649,7.258,'AqPvXzess2I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12286,_binary '\0','/pHLdEWww3NbViVrumyG0D7dBbRZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109644',6.2,4135,'en','Don\'t Drink the Water','Somewhere behind the early 1960s cold-war iron curtain, the Hollander family cause an international spying incident when Walter photographs a sunset in a sensitive region. In order to stay out of jail, the Hollanders take refuge in the American Embassy, which is temporarily being run by the absent Ambassador\'s diplomatically incompetent son, Axel.','/wUHtBgKoHGfn0I4aPnlcwNBUUEl.jpg','1994-12-18',91,'Released','They Couldn\'t Wait To Get In. Now It\'s Hilarious Trying To Get Out!','Don\'t Drink the Water',10462,2.4202,5.6,'s1ms38yNXfM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12287,_binary '\0','/cFJYraODuEkH5TM4LV0PH5UEu1X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109650',6.2,1272,'en','Doomsday Gun','Dr Gerald Bull was a genius at designing and building superguns (very large long range guns capable of shooting at ranges more than 100 miles). When an operational plan by the CIA to export sanctioned arms to apartheid-South Africa through him was exposed, the CIA denied all knowledge and he went to jail. He was later released, and moved to Belgium to start a subsidiary, of which a major project was to help Saddam Hussein build a new supergun capable of firing over 500 miles.','/6CNIpuzCBwmmSB1J681j5hTTQSI.jpg','1994-07-23',120,'Released','An explosive true story.','Doomsday Gun',38641,2.0259,5.789,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12288,_binary '\0','/o48Dkq4ImR7Infhp8KWmX8kEVH4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109655',7,1391,'en','Double Happiness','Jade Li is a feisty, 20-something Chinese Canadian, trying to achieve that happy medium between giving in to her parent\'s wishes and fulfilling her own needs and desires – double happiness. Naturally, something\'s got to give and when love beckons in the shape of Mark, a white university student, the façade of the perfect Chinese daughter begins to slip.','/5sbnCdiFoZLe4G27ERS7wtj1lCY.jpg','1994-09-07',87,'Released','You\'ve got one life to live. What\'s it gonna be?','Double Happiness',60855,1.3146,6.5,'oNTA_A3llwg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12289,_binary '\0','/83hLixhpxMw2WpG72IzFYE28b3v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109665',6.2,7795,'en','Dream Lover','Not long after they cross paths at an art gallery, architect Ray Reardon and hypnotically sensual Lena are married with children. But as strange incidents occur, Ray begins to realize he may not really know the woman he married.','/epl5pprGt04gAJI8lzbKy83XkbE.jpg','1994-05-06',103,'Released','If you think you know your lover. Think again. Especially if she\'s your wife.','Dream Lover',18190,5.1583,6.856,'5qjVam4n3N0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12290,_binary '\0','/hZh1kD7Dp8aMTc3OP41KGREH52V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109676',5.6,23238,'en','Drop Zone','A daring prison break from an airliner at 30,000 feet leaves U.S. Marshal Pete Nessip mourning a brother and gunning for revenge. After being ordered to turn in his badge, he seeks out Jessie Crossman, a noted skydiver, and offers to sponsor her crew for the annual Independence Day parachuting show in Washington, D.C., if she trains him. Meanwhile, the mastermind behind the mid-air jailbreak is planning a daring computer theft on Independence Day.','/2AnguJel4FIm1AUjHLrhi4ztsYU.jpg','1994-12-08',101,'Released','Taking crime to new heights.','Drop Zone',4954,5.487,5.7,'FrR6QwWMxr8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12291,_binary '\0','/kjOWUE1ZHafSM34KNETaUGcKiMu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109683',6.7,3150,'cn','賭神2','Ko Chun, the God of Gamblers, vows to keep his identity hidden while looking for the gangsters who murdered his pregnant wife.','/fy7K4G0lwLZRbPdaeVJ1FQEMgVr.jpg','1994-12-15',124,'Released',NULL,'God of Gamblers\' Return',19503,2.7662,6.6,'hsewi_njM80','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12292,_binary '\0','/pOYRt2gmUGvKHImegnDx3hv7aer.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109685',7.5,2257,'zh','獨立時代','Over the course of a few days, the paths of a group of young friends, lovers, and acquaintances in Taipei intersect, prompting them to arrive at realizations about their lives.','/sDEPrUoBf52AISJd5liP47ofKzp.jpg','1994-10-13',129,'Released','Don\'t you break my heart?','A Confucian Confusion',54233,2.1548,7.5,'o_bYP1Pzskc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12293,_binary '\0','/8uBTDGRcNHhYChcoazP5rleRME7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109686',7.3,447786,'en','Dumb and Dumber','Lloyd and Harry are two men whose stupidity is really indescribable. When Mary, a beautiful woman, loses an important suitcase with money before she leaves for Aspen, the two friends (who have found the suitcase) decide to return it to her. After some \"adventures\" they finally get to Aspen where, using the lost money they live it up and fight for Mary\'s heart.','/4LdpBXiCyGKkR8FGHgjKlphrfUc.jpg','1994-12-16',107,'Released','For Harry and Lloyd, every day is a no-brainer.','Dumb and Dumber',8467,23.2179,6.666,'OyJhN2Es7Cw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12294,_binary '\0','/smtzZRpE8hQkQNnhQg2TIRfcWcj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109688',7,18460,'cn','東邪西毒','Ouyang Feng is a heartbroken and cynical man who spends his days in the desert, connecting expert swordsmen with those seeking revenge and willing to pay for it. Throughout five seasons in exile, Ouyang spins tales of his clients\' unrequited loves and unusual acts of bravery.','/ciyEwAbvoMHPP3281cgSnfslu43.jpg','1994-09-17',98,'Released','Fear of rejection leads to a life of exile.','Ashes of Time',40751,5.7771,7.1,'j8zg_25-SYA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12295,_binary '\0','/zo9eHYG2du31erAP3bQZT0V0Pdu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109699',6.5,2498,'es','Días contados','Days before committing an attack, Antonio, a gunman of the terrorist gang ETA who has dedicated his life to a cause he no longer believes in, meets Charo, a young drug addict who, despite the sordid environment in which she lives, still retains her innocence.','/3QFSC7bTMaYuYgKZ2j10QL6Ykso.jpg','1994-10-06',93,'Released',NULL,'Running Out of Time',114218,1.8381,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12296,_binary '\0','/wXzqtoBaQONFDgsHkeSZ2TuELoi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109702',6.9,2529,'fr','L\'Eau froide','An outer suburb of Paris, 1972. Gilles and Christine, both sixteen, are classmates and lovers who have become frustrated with the aloofness of their families and the general monotony of their lives. When the pair are caught shoplifting, Christine\'s father ships her off to a home for emotionally disturbed children, temporarily putting space between her and Gilles. Luckily for them, though, she escapes and the couple contemplate running away together.','/7UmbO8A7EVWmv1kpssBzzz9iPrY.jpg','1994-07-06',95,'Released',NULL,'Cold Water',64901,1.2796,6.4,'bauqwKeEEmM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12297,_binary '\0','/3jrwJiMCe7VZP0DNcywHYOKg0Zu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109707',7.8,191039,'en','Ed Wood','The mostly true story of the legendary \"worst director of all time\", who, with the help of his strange friends, filmed countless B-movies without ever becoming famous or successful.','/n8SrO3WbyuY2b6KazogqbQF348C.jpg','1994-09-28',127,'Released','Movies were his passion. Women were his inspiration. Angora sweaters were his weakness.','Ed Wood',522,5.7291,7.478,'xPyqcdjBf_U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12298,_binary '\0','/gMztD9hnKvgMzTT9EmOiWqRSBr6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109723',4.4,7582,'en','Embrace of the Vampire','An 18-year-old college freshman is seduced by a handsome vampire lover who introduces her to a dark world of carnal desires.','/3amk8h3a4xVdt3f5LG8Mo7TrAn0.jpg','1995-05-30',92,'Released','Between innocence and evil lies the seduction.','Embrace of the Vampire',18392,3.8769,4.854,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12299,_binary '\0','/tnETQoBKEf638Jgg5kRZgw1Q7Jb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109729',7.6,2175,'en','The Endless Summer II','Bruce Brown, king of surfing documentaries, returns after nearly thirty years to trace the steps of two young surfers to top surfing spots around the world. Along the way we see many of the people and locales Bruce visited during the filming of Endless Summer (1966).','/89y5faI7wXFghUcsMtwfcVS6JBZ.jpg','1994-06-03',109,'Released','The journey continues...','The Endless Summer II',24257,1.1227,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12300,_binary '\0','/qQAMH8bKGstol94KvJhagoobt4q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109730',5.7,2088,'en','The Enemy Within','A officer with the Joint Chiefs of Staff uncovers a planned military coup of the U.S. government and has only one week to prevent the takeover.','/2qEjb22Lg6xYRumlKc3crq6e3qp.jpg','1994-08-24',86,'Released','You never know who your enemies really are...','The Enemy Within',59121,2.812,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12301,_binary '\0','/2rYgtckajPftIqpJxzVy7nfnlY0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109731',7,7429,'fr','L\'Enfer','Working extremely hard to keep his hotel afloat, Paul begins hearing voices in his head. Convinced that his wife has been unfaithful, he begins to see every male guest as a potential threat. What follows is Paul\'s downward spiral into the madness of deranged jealousy where he finally discovers that hell is not a state of mind – hell is himself.','/cW9BUIVQacmt58hcI6RrSLl2QGT.jpg','1994-02-16',102,'Released',NULL,'Torment',17961,3.0477,6.872,'wH9guGtDJ7A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12302,_binary '\0','/5zrvx6RLpFNJUoXJJT3cOvMTGKr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109733',6.8,1735,'ja','エンジェル・ダスト','Every Monday, a young woman is murdered in the subway, leading psychiatrist Setsuko Suma to investigate Dr. Rei Aku\'s deprogramming of former sect members.','/oCCjvRIJJygkavmSg6DbtPOimWR.jpg','1994-09-23',117,'Released',NULL,'Angel Dust',34048,1.6786,6.6,'tNLyhnZZwOo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12303,_binary '\0','/5Kb9FhREL9UijQGuYReO4Cf0rQa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109739',4.7,3300,'en','Ernest Goes to School','Jim Varney\'s recurring dim-bulb character Ernest P. Worrell returns in this film as a school janitor seeking to obtain a high school diploma.','/k2S6bIKKGK6kHSCWLsoQFpUeawN.jpg','1994-06-10',89,'Released','America\'s favorite class clown finally makes the grade!','Ernest Goes to School',20551,2.5484,4.1,'gklMbtVh0Js','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12304,_binary '\0','/5u78RNOkaOgqVwbcF96uz66lego.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109747',7.7,3181,'es','La estrategia del caracol','A group of tenants facing eviction due to a city renovation unite to fight back, but as they clash with the landlord and his ruthless attorney, they each transform into the opposite of who they once were.','/aSZ0HB5UxQrCn2NyiXIQkKgs89R.jpg','1993-12-25',116,'Released','No one can take away what we carry inside.','The Strategy of the Snail',10000,1.6908,7.6,'uuI2mr9xmb8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12305,_binary '\0','/iZ9ssYStIgQ9NQQJCEX0XLt38mo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109758',4.3,7740,'en','Exit to Eden','Photographer Elliot Slater has inadvertently snapped the only existing photos of elusive jewel thief Omar. When Elliot leaves for a private vacation on an S&M island, he is followed by Omar, Omar\'s partner, Nina, and undercover police officers Fred and Sheila. Unaware of the number of people chasing him, Elliot enjoys his stay at the resort, and finds himself falling in love with head dominatrix Lisa.','/dUtpplO9K03uYCA71Vqj9ZRkVyA.jpg','1994-10-14',114,'Released','To crack this case, these two cops will have to flash more than their badges.','Exit to Eden',18395,2.9516,4.2,'Yxa7yLhYDg8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12306,_binary '\0','/sdgWn2YmR2h0HWFUGXmvbCerQCR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109759',7,22753,'en','Exotica','In the upscale Toronto strip club Exotica, dancer Christina is visited nightly by the obsessive Francis, a depressed tax auditor. Her ex-boyfriend, the club\'s MC, Eric, still jealously pines for her even as he introduces her onstage, but Eric is having his own relationship problems with the club\'s female owner. Thomas, a mysterious pet-shop owner, is about to become unexpectedly involved in their lives.','/pWcJdcIHjL3P6NaEJKeV6ONfAMV.jpg','1994-09-29',103,'Released','In a world of temptation, obsession is the deadliest desire.','Exotica',20156,4.3113,6.6,'GqrHGP6a0Vo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12307,_binary '\0','/2uBGbCx6eOo9EMtQt3DnhMSKzB8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109770',3.8,8916,'en','The Fantastic Four','When dosed with cosmic rays, four intrepid astronauts are given incredible powers. They decide to form a superhero group called the Fantastic Four to fight their arch-enemy, Dr. Doom.','/avJpIDOjyfdoOLINYficKvW9dEa.jpg','1994-01-19',90,'Released','Part muscle. Part elastic. Part fire. Part invisible. Together, it\'s clobberin\' time!','The Fantastic Four',22059,4.3361,4.371,'TgeFPKECZKE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12308,_binary '\0','/mYWxd7i6qsFK6TyDjMquSGwjo69.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109771',6.8,7948,'fr','Farinelli','The life and career of Italian opera singer Farinelli, considered one of the greatest castrato singers of all time.','/i5h0ZjYobco5HRPaAU6QTlrMYw0.jpg','1994-12-01',111,'Released','Where does the power of his voice end?','Farinelli',10954,2.2136,6.555,'nbX2diR9b4U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12309,_binary '\0','/znWxInJXM4GZ3SzMYbfRZMjlEtQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109779',6.4,6734,'en','Fatherland','Fictional account of what might have happened if Hitler had won the war. It is now the 1960s and Germany\'s war crimes have so far been kept a secret. Hitler wants to talk peace with the US president. An American journalist and a German homicide cop stumble into a plot to destroy all evidence of the genocide.','/8HbeLtS7FRaQ6Ys8Qf62HW1VBSn.jpg','1994-11-26',106,'Released',NULL,'Fatherland',11248,4.3171,6.272,'xcj_nOE3H1o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12310,_binary '\0','/qiGF1b2vH38WRWQooLp3q9LS7m2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109781',7.3,4812,'cs','Lekce Faust','A very free adaptation of Marlowe\'s \"Doctor Faustus\", Goethe\'s \"Faust\" and various other treatments of the old legend of the man who sold his soul to the devil. A nondescript man is lured by a strange map into a sinister puppet theatre, where he finds himself immersed in an indescribably weird version of the play, blending live actors, clay animation and giant puppets.','/mdCj8IANhA3zOnsaW4yLeYYsmDG.jpg','1994-09-10',97,'Released',NULL,'Faust',18919,2.656,7.4,'UyW46Pbsp9k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12311,_binary '\0','/g4Z3XvXRLxL4qQfx2LwEJ2bBCjB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109783',5.2,3566,'en','The Favor','On the eve of her high school reunion, bored housewife Kathy convinces her single best friend Emily to seduce her old flame Tom, so she can get all the juicy details. But when Emily falls for Tom, it\'s like high school all over again!','/uFooKexRxruACuxnkQVmwf3nNcU.jpg','1994-04-29',97,'Released','Two Women. Three Men. One Secret.','The Favor',50463,2.5478,4.897,'Anbw_q9a1SM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12312,_binary '\0','/vq5EcmEK3Bqsqq9cPINELCtnAUc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109791',7,6000,'de','Felidae','A domestic house cat named Francis investigates the grisly feline murders taking place in his new neighborhood.','/bI9fGbmtQhtHRTNaZXnFjDzoxtI.jpg','1994-11-03',82,'Released','Francis is the world’s greatest cat detective. And all his nine lives are in danger.','Felidae',8983,2.3794,6.669,'uVaW2j9sGXE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12313,_binary '\0','/zG9yflBwN7P6r7rjuCAJKD6mX70.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109798',5.8,3795,'fr','La Fille de d\'Artagnan','It is 1654, in the South of France. When horsemen follow a runaway slave into the convent where he\'s taken sanctuary and kill both the fugitive and the Mother Superior, they little realise that one of the novices is the spirited daughter of retired musketeer D\'Artagnan.','/hxrzEpWLmNjkogpGXKR3BMlf3AV.jpg','1994-08-24',125,'Released',NULL,'D\'Artagnan\'s Daughter',10732,2.9923,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12314,_binary '\0','/gUZLXXhCLsTLM8JwxwzB7Ex14c0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109809',4.9,2272,'en','FleshEater: Revenge of the Living Dead','A group of college students take a Halloween hayride in the countryside and convince the driver to take them to a secluded area for a night of debauchery. However, the fun turns to terror when a local farmhand unearths a mysterious wooden box that contains an ancient zombie.','/1l8jtsjjgxMCTaqaKgyqh58FXQx.jpg','1988-08-17',89,'Released','He lived, he died, he\'s back, and he\'s hungry!','FleshEater: Revenge of the Living Dead',36837,1.5963,4.8,'6vqL8X5mDvs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12315,_binary '\0','/4byUSbNrjqCSjqVYrJU6AxqyZYr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109813',5.1,93320,'en','The Flintstones','Modern Stone Age family the Flintstones hit the big screen in this live-action version of the classic cartoon. Fred helps Barney adopt a child. Barney sees an opportunity to repay him when Slate Mining tests its employees to find a new executive. But no good deed goes unpunished.','/qbojLbbpSaNSerWa2moIrt0C8hy.jpg','1994-05-27',91,'Released','Yabba-Dabba-Doo!','The Flintstones',888,11.8187,5.4,'a-uN0rHF7Ig','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12316,_binary '\0','/dymsqRll89InKJV3h7fN6Gjn0QG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109816',5.8,1449,'en','Floundering','John Boyz lives close to where they film \"Baywatch\", but you\'d never know it. His life is full of bizarre friends, sweaty sex, pistol wielding gangsters, bungling bureaucrats, police fanatics, revolutionaries, and weirdos. All John wants is a little peace of mind and a little piece of the action, but in \"Floundering\" it wont come easy.','/sTW4JE8SOn5x50bhzYd47SOhWtQ.jpg','1994-11-04',96,'Released','A post-riot comedy','Floundering',41578,1.2999,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12317,_binary '\0','/66Kn4XWhkuPkJxOJyPEx4U2CUfN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109830',8.8,2534503,'en','Forrest Gump','A man with a low IQ has accomplished great things in his life and been present during significant historic events—in each case, far exceeding what anyone imagined he could do. But despite all he has achieved, his one true love eludes him.','/Cw4hIUIAmSYfK9QfaUW5igp9La.jpg','1994-06-23',142,'Released','The world will never be the same once you\'ve seen it through the eyes of Forrest Gump.','Forrest Gump',13,38.7929,8.461,'Mj9IA9tTfio','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12318,_binary '\0','/ejFaHWnDP29z7ePw2cJVOsWvOvH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109831',7.1,184488,'en','Four Weddings and a Funeral','Over the course of five social occasions, a committed bachelor must consider the notion that he may have discovered love.','/qa72G2VS0bpxms6yo0tI9vsHm2e.jpg','1994-03-09',117,'Released','Five good reasons to stay single.','Four Weddings and a Funeral',712,10.3606,6.8,'tvdlnbfaJ3E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12319,_binary '\0','/2Z5HYNraDHVFPLo5hHWdZlt9r8H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109835',5.8,1847,'en','Frank & Jesse','At the end of the Civil War, Frank and Jesse James and other former guerillas who rode with Quantrill and Bill Anderson take the oath of allegiance to the Union. Feeling oppressed by Chicago railroad investors, the James and Younger brothers, Bob and Charlie Ford, Clell Miller and Arch Clements take to robbing banks, trains and coaches, with Pinkerton sworn to bringing them to justice.','/h54QflwgAKx0sy2bE4qm7SGg1Tw.jpg','1994-10-21',105,'Released','The civil war made them outlaws. The people made them heroes','Frank & Jesse',42706,2.6213,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12320,_binary '\0','/qhZgRQB6ExVcbFXXGL3ISvshfJm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109836',6.3,64360,'en','Mary Shelley\'s Frankenstein','Victor Frankenstein is a promising young doctor who, devastated by the death of his mother during childbirth, becomes obsessed with bringing the dead back to life. His experiments lead to the creation of a monster, which Frankenstein has put together with the remains of corpses. It\'s not long before Frankenstein regrets his actions.','/bOwCAQsZlEKrwhPi1ejY6BS8jpL.jpg','1994-11-04',123,'Released','Be warned.','Mary Shelley\'s Frankenstein',3036,7.2265,6.4,'ZkZAPkKDd9I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12321,_binary '\0','/dhjcwoymr9oLO1EJPrhHZweT6x5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109838',6.4,9601,'en','Freaked','A vain actor, his best friend, and an activist end up at a mutant freak farm run by a weirdo scientist.','/enQ9FBLo4bd7AHX78geP6qRSl9U.jpg','1993-10-01',80,'Released','Butt ugly. But funny.','Freaked',17796,3.9683,6.188,'DHkfRo5Mq2o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12322,_binary '\0','/rg0E4KETgFagjmoaucTnYDeWNVk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109842',7.5,16454,'en','Fresh','Death and violence anger twelve year old drug courier Fresh, who sets his rival employers against each other.','/uXRIIUzjDZZdWR2cUzPJ9eAqaHv.jpg','1994-06-15',114,'Released','In a world where criminals make the rules, an innocent boy is out to beat them at their own game.','Fresh',13815,6.7685,7.2,'R1wenNfrjI8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12323,_binary '\0','/4KqKD7RXROYgk2cqObaD13sIQus.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109847',6.1,3038,'en','A Friend to Die For','Who could have stabbed popular, beautiful cheerleader Stacy to death? It could have been antisocial Goth girl Monica; it could\'ve been angst-ridden Jill -- or maybe it was the plain girl nobody suspected.','/woA94oecsKPu3fOmfoS1rNuLAHL.jpg','1994-09-24',92,'Released','She would do anything to be popular... Even kill!','A Friend to Die For',60666,2.6438,6.3,'D0d2cStVOFI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12324,_binary '\0','/ckhW4ZAnxKY4nEhoPo9lOsyR6be.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109855',6.8,1396,'en','Fun','Hillary and Bonnie meet one morning by the side of the road. They become fast friends, share their secrets, and, on a rising wave of frenzy, later that afternoon, murder an old woman. They did it, they say later, for fun.','/aUjxc8vFItbrBLPgYh0NPNOfCfv.jpg','1994-10-12',105,'Released','Friendship. Love. Murder.','Fun',33135,1.2175,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12325,_binary '\0','/iQhtbLW27Hi6QWyquB9XJTJC94x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109858',4.4,1563,'en','Funny Man','When Max Taylor wins the ancestral home of Callum Chance in a game of Poker, little does he realize that the game is far from over. One by one, Max\'s family are murdered by the Funny Man, a demonic jester with a varied and imaginative repertoire of homicidal techniques and an irreverent sense of humor. Meanwhile, Max\'s brother is on his way to the mansion with a bunch of hitchhikers who will be lucky to survive the night.','/11g73aKXNFMLMtZ9VgyQPPUNt0T.jpg','1994-06-10',90,'Released','He\'s cheeky & he\'s cruel!','Funny Man',104205,1.4101,4.8,'hOIdgipHuH0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12326,_binary '\0','/i5De1yRYk2F8BwrqEaVZamNKc26.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109872',6.4,1474,'ja','餓狼伝説 THE MOTION PICTURE','The Armor of Mars -- a suit of armor consisting of six pieces. If anyone from the bloodline of the ancient warrior Godimus were to find all six pieces for himself, he would receive power equal to the level of a god. The Curse of Godimus, however, also dictates that this same person would lose all sense of himself and become an insane killing machine.','/9s3eqjjRyAK8E9jyPTm14BiZfae.jpg','1994-07-16',95,'Released','Based on the Bestselling Video Game!','Fatal Fury: The Motion Picture',28697,3.6707,7.3,'rsvrjHe9LaE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12327,_binary '\0','/zwr45axiNqYhTs6IO4wjNOMp054.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109890',5.9,21662,'en','The Getaway','An ex-con and his devoted wife must flee from danger when a heist doesn\'t go as planned.','/ftbdJTJi6mR5iZV5ESJWv8f8pWN.jpg','1994-02-11',116,'Released','A dangerous deal. A double cross. And the ultimate set up is yet to come.','The Getaway',2087,11.2521,5.8,'5ILKbeW4Fd8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12328,_binary '\0','/570uxNdyVeeeEQ8Hi8R0tFJPomJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109891',4.9,9457,'en','Getting Even with Dad','Con man Ray is going after one last heist – a stash of rare coins – when his estranged son Timmy unexpectedly shows up. Ray is too preoccupied with his robbery to spend time with his son, so Timmy blackmails him into acting like a father, hiding the coins and promises to return them only after Ray takes him to amusement parks and baseball games.','/txsmdQqbgSz5Zu3rgd9fglMqKA4.jpg','1994-06-17',109,'Released','Timmy\'s not getting mad he\'s...','Getting Even with Dad',41579,6.1213,5.332,'idx2k39SU5M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12329,_binary '\0','/jd7UaFVw75WM0qNWmAC0ExpbpJb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109900',7.2,1222,'fr','Giorgino','October 1918: After returning to the civil life, the young Doctor Giorgino Volli searches for a group of children, which he had been the care-taker of before the first world war began. However, soon the searching becomes a part of hide-and-seek with death. Giorgino finds a village bordered with a treacherous marsh and rumours of wolves. There he also meets the mysterious Catherine....','/j87ucqJHsg8W8QMa38oAQzi3hKH.jpg','1994-10-05',177,'Released',NULL,'Giorgino',77728,2.2109,6.4,'RZS2M1nJy_g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12330,_binary '\0','/owgUoV6Hc1tgJcUgUuabbiPI5E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109906',6.1,3796,'en','The Glass Shield','J.J. is a rookie in the Sheriff\'s Department and the first black officer at that station. Racial tensions run high in the department as some of J.J.\'s fellow officers resent his presence. His only real friend is the other new trooper, the first female officer to work there, who also suffers similar discrimination in the otherwise all-white male work environment. When J.J. becomes increasingly aware of police corruption during the murder trial of Teddy Woods, whom he helped to arrest, he faces difficult decisions and puts himself into grave personal danger in the service of justice.','/cgvBosSBpjF8ynBi7A1KmMwYoxl.jpg','1994-09-16',110,'Released','In a world filled with violence... his only weapon is the truth!','The Glass Shield',72031,2.9759,5.2,'Cu1RIxNf0M8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12331,_binary '\0','/4QfEycN0OKIxVhGa1W70fMr5qt3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109912',4.5,1599,'en','A Gnome Named Gnorm','A young Los Angeles police officer and a mysterious gnome become unlikely partners as they track a killer. When a sting operation goes awry, officer Casey is blamed for the murder of his colleague and Gnorm the gnome is the only witness.','/vc9t3j1VHMsSGBhiYRF1fe56DIs.jpg','1991-05-18',84,'Released',NULL,'A Gnome Named Gnorm',21357,2.8816,4.681,'Fr0mb2NFk4c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12332,_binary '\0','/yu3boJ3VvHGStgCMBxYqzyOaBgA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109913',5.8,2644,'en','Go Fish','Max is a trendy, pretty, young lesbian, who is having trouble finding love. A friend sets her up with Ely, whom Max likes, but Ely is frumpy, homely, and older. Nor do they have much in common. Can Max learn to look past the packaging?','/wWSqWcTQpedYn0ZMJ06PqSmJUxb.jpg','1994-06-10',83,'Released','The girl is out there','Go Fish',18620,1.4726,5.2,'qnWt4aMBE6E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12333,_binary '\0','/kLtyj68xLGIDgD39oDn8pJACD48.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109916',5.8,6610,'ja','ゴジラvsスペースゴジラ','A mysterious extraterrestrial being resembling Godzilla rapidly approaches Earth. The monster, dubbed SpaceGodzilla, lands to challenge the King of the Monsters.','/9qL56FqqVmavTBWZNw6cetJyevP.jpg','1994-12-10',108,'Released','The descent of the God of Destruction','Godzilla vs. SpaceGodzilla',39466,3.451,6.7,'u0LTRmEoTjM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12334,_binary '\0','/5U7rLNr15sgUnIM9DPWOtvlMpet.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109920',5.1,2816,'en','A Good Man in Africa','Morgan Leafy is a secretary to the British High Commissioner to an Africa nation. Leafy is a man that makes himself useful to his boss, the snobbish Arthur Fanshawe, who has no clue about what\'s going on around him, but who wants to use his secretary to carry on his dirty work, which involves getting one of the most powerful men in the country to do business with his country.The young secretary has an eye for beautiful women around him, especially Hazel, a native beauty, with whom he is having an affair. Things get complicated because Sam Adekunle, a man running for president of the country, wants a favor from Leafy in return after he has accepted the invitation to visit London. The proposition involves swaying a prominent doctor\'s opposition to a plan that will make Adenkule filthy rich.','/4BBZLZVEANsnCVqIF9fgf0bshQD.jpg','1994-07-14',94,'Released',NULL,'A Good Man in Africa',41006,3.0907,4.9,'m2godocX2A0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12335,_binary '\0','/8CBIP7avPE8gMOfuxjygY6Wy92Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109936',6.3,15679,'en','Greedy','Meet the McTeagues. They\'ve come to stake a claim in their wealthy uncle\'s will… only he\'s not dead yet!','/5OpvMU6CTXe4pRAQUVWcVJeZCSS.jpg','1994-03-04',113,'Released','Where there’s a will, there’s a relative.','Greedy',12778,4.9334,6.152,'LjAGMVR_4ck','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12336,_binary '\0','/4DgcfG8h13gGZQyUW7I4rWiU32I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109942',6.4,2320,'fr','Grosse Fatigue','Stressed and overworked, famous French movie star Michel Blanc is beginning to wear down, physically and mentally, from the pressure and demands of fame. Already in a fragile state of mind, strange events start to transpire all around him, and he gradually loses his grip. Taking the advice of a psychiatrist, Blanc retreats to the countryside with his friend Carole Bouquet, but Blanc still has not managed to escape all of his problems.','/tD8zVuSpIfUSjmEZ0UXBeOU9Va8.jpg','1994-05-18',82,'Released',NULL,'Dead Tired',64567,2.6396,6,'aOePV4B8I10','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12337,_binary '\0','/dpzpRNDD5A1HMn3KNUDlVUUKHad.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109949',6.9,1661,'es','Guantanamera','During the \'Special Period\', the members of a funeral procession cross paths with truckdrivers who have to take the same route, and begin to talk about God and the world. They discover that life for both groups has many similarities, as well as a lot of differences.','/eOdVQUCn9gWwTr6LSnDQJ3kimU.jpg','1995-09-03',105,'Released',NULL,'Guantanamera',43775,0.9488,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12338,_binary '\0','/6hJyoLi3dZDdN4VRkRE8NTgn2X9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109951',6.2,21019,'en','Guarding Tess','Doug is a Secret Service Agent who has just completed his stint in charge protecting Tess Carlisle—the widow of a former U.S. President, and a close personal friend of the current President. He finds that she has requested that he not be rotated but instead return to be her permanent detail. Doug is crushed, and—after returning—wants off her detail as she is very difficult to guard and makes her detail crazy with her whims and demands.','/4QXsuHFw1teyR48mnXz8jk9P3Gq.jpg','1994-03-11',96,'Released','A comedy beyond the call of duty.','Guarding Tess',6472,5.8191,6,'mdE9FXCUIbc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12339,_binary '\0','/uMb8xUhYa5z3oHa2xO5g7dvlYaw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109958',7.3,1422,'cn','金枝玉葉','Wing is a devoted fan of popular singer Rose who is involved in a topsy-turvy relationship with her charismatic producer Sam. Willing to go to any length to meet Rose, the willowy Wing disguises herself as a man, and with a twist of fate is chosen to be the next budding star for the record company.','/vTIuaah4Sb8ma3jjblW1D3rE5hC.jpg','1994-07-23',107,'Released',NULL,'He\'s a Woman, She\'s a Man',115156,1.9763,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12340,_binary '\0','/g9LldXzWIGTcHqb0Zxz6ZQqKzOd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109959',5.3,4040,'en','Gunmen','A New York DEA agent springs an outlaw from jail to lead him to stolen money in South America.','/9beKwCwSZk8FhRISl9eLILvi3Qo.jpg','1993-05-21',94,'Released','In a South American country, there\'s only one way to take down a druglord: point blank.','Gunmen',24231,2.4447,4.96,'OOQSPW0WFvM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12341,_binary '\0','/jcLFejDiZwbUyMDWNVjPvxPpcoP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109962',7.1,9224,'cn','國產凌凌漆','A Chinese secret agent travels to Hong Kong to reclaim a dinosaur fossil but experiences hilarious incidents because of his incompetence.','/xUAVVRNxbbI3XcwKdFTRAryQAk8.jpg','1994-10-13',84,'Released','The most hilarious 007, ever!','From Beijing with Love',41387,4.8566,7.014,'gaXC8X--FJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12342,_binary '\0','/caoUIsFdwNYRQzPtJnoiWYSyUA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109965',5.8,4201,'en','Guyver: Dark Hero','Sean Barker became the unwilling host to an alien bio-armor known as the Guyver. A year ago he destroyed the Kronos Corporation, an organization of mutants who want the Guyver. Now he is trying to find why the Guyver unit forces him to fight and kill evil.','/2vbtLS0rdMty6SA1MOCUIqhfWbm.jpg','1994-04-20',124,'Released','Sci-fi\'s most powerful alien-human hybrid returns!','Guyver: Dark Hero',11795,2.3532,5.8,'owYuLPFMF2Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12343,_binary '\0','/prXvVwk5w5ezhzBiQHI9AAJopXk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0109969',3.2,1458,'en','Hail Caesar','Caesar is having a hard time dividing his time between his band and his rich girlfriend, Buffer. Buffer\'s dad doesn\'t like Ceasar, so he makes Caesar a bet. If Caesar can make a hundred thousand dollars within six months, he can stay with Buffer... but if he fails, their relationship is over forever. How can Ceasar win the bet if he only knows how jam with his band?','/4zBmCJcGJKGWiCRunAjOC4rqcS6.jpg','1994-05-11',100,'Released','It\'s hard to rock \'n roll when you\'re knee deep in rubber erasers!','Hail Caesar',173299,1.76,3.4,'-PqKAzfau94','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12344,_binary '\0','/jd78sfeqg6Qy71FENgiXQBPiFe2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110002',5.7,2240,'en','Heart of Darkness','A trading company manager travels up an African river to find a missing outpost head and discovers the depth of evil in humanity\'s soul.','/sg2zS4fyoc0N214rjjFtY7Y7rb2.jpg','1994-03-13',100,'Released','The jungle offers incredible riches, but its price can be deadly.','Heart of Darkness',4782,2.4022,5.8,'qzWFhTv5uC4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12345,_binary '\0','/jHjOY9vgE7maH2HRk2fd9lOPg8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110005',7.2,70296,'en','Heavenly Creatures','Precocious teenager Juliet moves to New Zealand with her family and soon befriends the quiet, brooding Pauline through their shared love of fantasy and literature. This friendship gradually develops into an intense and obsessive bond.','/uvb86wVCIqD3Rlbr0GTNgWDF7Zo.jpg','1994-09-12',109,'Released','Not all angels are innocent.','Heavenly Creatures',1024,4.6415,7,'_bIUDcnHDlg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12346,_binary '\0','/hBUgtysIiuvJite0NX0C0FHJ90m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110006',6.6,33715,'en','Heavyweights','Camp Hope is a summer retreat for overweight boys run by a kindly couple who make the campers feel comfortable with their extra pounds. But when tyrannical fitness guru Tony buys the camp, he puts the kids on a cruel regimen that goes too far. Sick of the endless weeks of \"all work and no play,\" the kids stage a coup and reclaim their summer of fun.','/uN65XQzyPknLZs2R6koZ2Cu6eGC.jpg','1995-02-17',97,'Released','They don\'t run the fastest. They don\'t jump the highest. But they sure are getting the last laugh.','Heavyweights',14819,3.7647,6.2,'SLtdSDzpLyE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12347,_binary '\0','/2uv0VEoyWxb3KgsiF5FInWP18wQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110008',7.2,39499,'ja','平成狸合戦ぽんぽこ','The Raccoons of the Tama Hills are being forced from their homes by the rapid development of houses and shopping malls. As it becomes harder to find food and shelter, they decide to band together and fight back. The Raccoons practice and perfect the ancient art of transformation until they are even able to appear as humans in hilarious circumstances.','/gyoJmFf24MOUc4TTu97sd0cHIQF.jpg','1994-07-16',119,'Released','A fantastic tale of survival.','Pom Poko',15283,7.7038,7.175,'63xrlIw4Y88','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12348,_binary '\0','/kiq6xYbLaGzxAmYhci0ftXJO1tO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110015',6.3,3899,'en','Hercules and the Amazon Women','Hercules and Iolaus take time out from Iolaus\' wedding preparations, to help a distant village under attack from \"monsters\". When they reach their destination, they find the monsters are in fact Amazonian women who are controlled by Hera. \"Hercules and the Amazon Women\" is the first movie-length pilot episode of the television series \"Hercules: The Legendary Journeys\".','/aTcAL4khfIAZjmbOeKIMqOtv1kd.jpg','1994-04-24',91,'Released','Treat them nice or they will become amazon women.','Hercules and the Amazon Women',37404,2.5217,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12349,_binary '\0','/9lQ4yO9aO3ex0gLXmmjhtsTllRg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110016',6.4,2970,'en','Hercules and the Circle of Fire','When all the earth\'s fire begins to go out, Hercules and Deianeira must go in search for fire to stop the world from cold. \"Hercules and the Circle of Fire\" is the third movie-length pilot episode of the television series \"Hercules: The Legendary Journeys\".','/bH04FIbgsAlDkxF5QGCFQHhEPAg.jpg','1994-11-05',90,'Released',NULL,'Hercules and the Circle of Fire',75822,2.9749,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12350,_binary '\0','/rkKLnIdjcg63ztGEkZfSC5VaHXZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110017',6.4,3108,'en','Hercules and the Lost Kingdom','Hercules comes to the aid of a young woman who is seeking the lost city of Troy. Eventually, Hercules leads her to a camp of refugees from the city, which has been taken over by Hera\'s Blue Priests. Hercules helps the refugees take back the city. \"Hercules and the Lost Kingdom\" is the second movie-length pilot episode of the television series \"Hercules: The Legendary Journeys\".','/1ZeDv8ffdIqLxTV1glIKCTC1xLX.jpg','1994-05-02',90,'Released',NULL,'Hercules and the Lost Kingdom',75826,2.8916,6.025,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12351,_binary '\0','/qWCFpJn66gno6pVmBXVOdNVRYCu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110018',6,2684,'en','Hercules in the Maze of the Minotaur','Hercules has settled down with his wife and children, but misses the good old days traveling around having exciting adventures. Then one day he is persuaded out of his farming \"retirement\" to help a distant village which is being attacked by an unseen monster. \"Hercules in the Maze of the Minotaur\" is the fifth out of five made for TV movies that spawned the series \"Hercules: The Legendary Journeys\".','/m2JoUnBae0GYYuTEKWRYvddtVnx.jpg','1994-11-19',90,'Released',NULL,'Hercules in the Maze of the Minotaur',70811,3.0462,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12352,_binary '\0','/ynhkGOZr8dBfXQHAvHcJ9ttdhSJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110019',6.4,2529,'en','Hercules in the Underworld','When villagers begin disappearing it is discovered that they had fallen through a crack in the earth which goes straight to Hades. Hercules once again comes to the rescue and faces one of his most difficult challenges, and must prove himself as a man as well as a god. \"Hercules in the Underworld\" is the fourth made for TV movie in the series Hercules: The Legendary Journeys.','/bskH8CKf3f926IrZC6tvUmyt57O.jpg','1994-11-07',91,'Released',NULL,'Hercules in the Underworld',75834,2.687,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12353,_binary '\0','/igQB0f0SEkmhBAhBjj3NYrTAFnJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110022',3.2,1689,'en','The Hidden II','The alien criminal from the first movie is dead, but he left a few eggs which are hatching now. The good alien, who still inhabits Tom Beck\'s body, has been waiting just in case this happened. Unfortunately, his presence in the body has taken a terrible toll on it, draining it of life energy. Additionally relations with Beck\'s daughter Juliet (now a cop) have deteriorated. But when the killing starts again, they will need to work together to stop the new generation of aliens.','/k2KSy0ZSnHneOfrLBk9RfpUf1mC.jpg','1993-09-06',91,'Released','They live for lust. They live for power. They live forever.','The Hidden II',68163,2.0871,3.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12354,_binary '\0','/1ulygMNAaR6KINjI6Fqcx1N82ag.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110027',4.5,23476,'en','Highlander III: The Sorcerer','Deceived that he had won the Prize, Connor MacLeod wanders through the world; however, he is awakened from his peaceful life when an entombed immortal magician, Kane, escapes and comes seeking the Highlander.','/o4GKLReSGRR0rulOBS9SrfFAXOz.jpg','1994-11-29',99,'Released','Centuries ago one man was chosen to protect all that is good. But an enemy from the past has traveled through time to challenge him in the present.','Highlander III: The Sorcerer',8011,6.502,4.752,'C-nCNKutCno','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12355,_binary '\0','/sFd0pFbBvJmGSuleWWSvsXswaS8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110036',6.1,1693,'es','Historias del Kronen','Carlos is a young student, just 21. Nice or annoying as he likes, enjoys provoking and transgreding. In the night he goes out to meet his friends in the Kronen, a bar. Every situation can be taken a little farther. There are no limits, no accepted barriers. And more each time, each adventure is chained to the next, as if it were a continuous night. A long description of people: grandfather, parents, sister, girlfriend, friends. And, among that, the obscure will of living every minute as if it were the last one. But something which happens puts Carlos and his friend against a reality they have been trying to ignore.','/vulTVwoMoy1IE1IRJhihHYQ6H2H.jpg','1995-04-29',95,'Released',NULL,'Stories from the Kronen',98600,1.102,6.1,'KTAjGpGPrKE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12356,_binary '\0','/5gLBAZeKzNhenTBMvvbjPfRy2Lh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110044',5.1,1792,'en','Holy Matrimony','A young Hutterite boy must marry his late brother\'s wife who comes from outside the community.','/guuXfnxgXWPFrvgPbqySnujnjqb.jpg','1994-04-08',93,'Released','\'Til death do them part. Or until she finds the money.','Holy Matrimony',2348,3.0631,5.3,'xN40B23SORM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12357,_binary '\0','/xFndvLBuhcO2Jc6q1tX7OHzwgOX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110052',4.6,1266,'en','Hong Kong 97','Hong Kong 97 takes place in Hong Kong right before the transfer of power from Britain to China. Reginald Cameron, an assassin affiliated with a large corporation with interests in the colony, guns down key members of the Chinese envoy which will take charge of Hong Kong the next day. Suddenly, he becomes a target for every two-bit mercenary in the city. With the help of his company mentor, a clueless friend, and his ex-girlfriend, Cameron must unravel the motives behind his sudden target status and escape Hong Kong alive.','/gcVkSUbjpIM10jxSJYHc8RyaP3h.jpg','1994-11-09',91,'Released','99 years of British rule is coming to an end... Hong Kong will never be the same.','Hong Kong 97',182886,1.7381,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12358,_binary '\0','/962UtsFIsA4gok0aVOZcfhzjILg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110054',6.3,6524,'cn','洪熙官之少林五祖','A young father and his infant son are beset by forces of evil and corruption. They wander China, upholding their sense of honor and protecting the weak. When they are forced into combat, spectacular and hilarious fast-motion kung fu sequences follow. In the end, they must call on all of their abilities in a battle royale, to attempt to vanquish a supernatural man-monster or die trying.','/57kngzlMiKkn6yg5lDfcxNmcYF4.jpg','1994-02-05',95,'Released',NULL,'Legend of the Red Dragon',18670,5.353,7.107,'sxJbhZ8mA3s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12359,_binary '\0','/pYeiEm55NySzK9ksKlQGlFQNapz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110057',8.3,29816,'en','Hoop Dreams','Every school day, African-American teenagers William Gates and Arthur Agee travel 90 minutes each way from inner-city Chicago to St. Joseph High School in Westchester, Illinois, a predominately white suburban school well-known for the excellence of its basketball program. Gates and Agee dream of NBA stardom, and with the support of their close-knit families, they battle the social and physical obstacles that stand in their way. This acclaimed documentary was shot over the course of five years.','/gLzHl2XBtVwycl8DxdOXRHPm8G3.jpg','1994-09-12',174,'Released','An Extraordinary True Story.','Hoop Dreams',14275,1.8695,7.6,'AglLHi4_0MM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12360,_binary '\0','/5UjsS8YeJEe6EXXlUc1uHCmTkZy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110064',4.7,5849,'en','House Party 3','Hip Hop duo Kid & Play return in the second follow-up to their 1990 screen debut House Party. Kid (Christopher \"Kid\" Reid) is taking the plunge and marrying his girlfriend Veda (Angela Means), while his friend Play (Christopher Martin) is dipping his toes into the music business, managing a roughneck female rap act called Sex as a Weapon. Play books the ladies for a concert with heavy-hitting pr','/jLUgvHO3vVLkzKs3OcYksGPbLnA.jpg','1994-01-11',94,'Released','This bachelor party\'s gonna\' bring down the house!','House Party 3',16097,2.9396,5.3,'Rh7eZVsqNqk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12361,_binary '\0','/ibrbpEEgncx1gOIIpkBHOmWATOQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110066',6,8028,'en','Houseguest','In hot water with the mob over an unpaid debt, a con man poses as a family friend in an affluent Pennsylvania suburb.','/cdiHlZho11EEqD3aPanYe1rEYRB.jpg','1995-01-06',109,'Released','He came. He ate. He stayed.','Houseguest',17207,3.2161,5.5,'ImjGBHRDW7c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12362,_binary '\0','/qWr5MbYqgqGFscwszjmtihQSEJ2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110068',4.9,2216,'en','How the West Was Fun','Twin sisters help a woman save her dude ranch from developers who would like to turn the property into a theme park.','/x7Kkp6ZXMSeKMYqTgh81eBTuMKS.jpg','1994-11-19',96,'Released',NULL,'How the West Was Fun',50326,2.1898,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12363,_binary '\0','/3Q5b50R7EJUNej8DHjNqnmQap7v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110073',5.9,1350,'zh','黃飛鴻之五龍城殲霸','After the authorities flee China with public funds, Wong Fei-Hung battles pirates and corrupt officials to help the government restore peace.','/uTgzQvzlKN87CLsjdfTqbuNgjAm.jpg','1994-06-18',101,'Released',NULL,'Once Upon a Time in China V',42287,3.9455,5.7,'KDC5Euu2BcQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12364,_binary '\0','/gXo423uIRgBOsfQrrqJfVVcySif.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110074',7.2,90953,'en','The Hudsucker Proxy','A naive business graduate is installed as president of a manufacturing company as part of a stock scam.','/xBQBr6Q1OTivouBK66oFgy86n03.jpg','1994-03-11',111,'Released','They took him for a fall guy... but he threw them for a hoop.','The Hudsucker Proxy',11934,6.9619,7.1,'2o5yi6hFg4Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12365,_binary '\0','/hZB1ke21feNJ7yJRGiyVlnanvin.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110076',7.5,24563,'hi','हम आपके हैं कौन...!','Prem and Nisha meet and fall in love at the wedding of their elder siblings, but their plans to be together are put in jeopardy when Nisha\'s sister dies, leaving behind a baby.','/bQtT9GsMtPjjfkFPXUSN9pt7uts.jpg','1994-08-05',207,'Released',NULL,'Hum Aapke Hain Koun..!',46387,2.3306,6.6,'N59F2MMuWnc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12366,_binary '\0','/s7xVB5OPWw6GO40VBeEJcX9EwNt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110081',8.3,22690,'zh','活着','Married couple Fugui and Jiazhen endure tumultuous events in mid-20th century mainland China as their personal fortunes move from wealthy landownership to peasantry.','/bv0qREWTw8TPAtgt22ELp1UlKVl.jpg','1994-05-18',133,'Released',NULL,'To Live',31439,5.3822,8.1,'GAZUbjttUPc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12367,_binary '\0','/vay1nnmwRbS6HUPjCEhWHzUkq8x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110091',6.8,2075,'en','I Like It Like That','After her husband is arrested for looting, Lisette struggles for independence while dealing with her transgender sibling, her critical mother-in-law and assorted neighborhood eccentrics.','/aCxh21UPLHi7Pxm9ykH1GNx39OW.jpg','1994-10-14',104,'Released','For Lisette, everyday has become independence day.','I Like It Like That',48992,2.0422,6.3,'k_znxl0qA5I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12368,_binary '\0','/lnO0pcgCyzirR2QRt1XNPBTgjNB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110093',5.4,13355,'en','I Love Trouble','Rival Chicago reporters Sabrina Peterson and Peter Brackett join forces to uncover a train wreck conspiracy.','/2uyytK3XFRPFXoTchFDtsWiSujn.jpg','1994-06-29',123,'Released','Romance Was Never More Dangerous!','I Love Trouble',10879,4.7763,5.5,'j8RuhldReRo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12369,_binary '\0','/4OA6xrToD64FaeUcEdKeoysz6Mw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110097',5.5,3029,'en','I\'ll Do Anything','Matt Hobbs is a talented but unsuccessful actor. When estranged (and strange) ex-wife Beth dumps their daughter Jeannie on Matt, father and daughter have a lot of adjusting to do. His budding relationship with attractive production assistant Cathy Breslow is made complicated, while the precocious child is overly accustomed to getting her own way. Matt eventually faces the choice of family vs career in a particularly difficult way.','/oroT4oMzldeKglEAnMT94o3KN66.jpg','1994-02-04',115,'Released','She\'s the most maddening female he\'s ever met. And she\'s only six years old.','I\'ll Do Anything',106143,3.4391,5.6,'YT8cUWSQL_E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12370,_binary '\0','/b3fo2hryygeN2FQFu2GLL2Pm1mh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110099',6.2,27952,'en','I.Q.','Albert Einstein helps a young man who\'s in love with Einstein\'s niece to catch her attention by pretending temporarily to be a great physicist.','/5we3ZV6yiw13b8zGk4LuacuV8n7.jpg','1994-12-24',100,'Released','With Einstein as Cupid, what could possibly go wrong?','I.Q.',11777,3.3356,6,'1lF2BkLl0yQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12371,_binary '\0','/os0tKi3sYSQ8yd08VQ04yNdl9by.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110115',6.4,1854,'en','Imaginary Crimes','A recently widowed, small-time hustler struggles to raise his two daughters on his own and still make a dishonest living in 1960s Portland, Oregon.','/hRmlR78pLtquyFc7swwsvjqigkc.jpg','1994-10-14',105,'Released','When a father doesn\'t live up to his dreams... a daughter has to stand up for hers.','Imaginary Crimes',75490,1.762,6.4,'4jRV-PZJVw4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12372,_binary '\0','/4wrdhfmmv9fQkmiPRl3d8NACjh9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110116',7.4,27776,'en','Immortal Beloved','A chronicle of the life of infamous classical composer Ludwig van Beethoven and his painful struggle with hearing loss. Following Beethoven\'s death in 1827, his assistant, Schindler, searches for an elusive woman referred to in the composer\'s love letters as \"immortal beloved.\" As Schindler solves the mystery, a series of flashbacks reveal Beethoven\'s transformation from passionate young man to troubled musical genius.','/lkqz2R5pjXeDaiIjR3Z6JTGjtg6.jpg','1994-12-16',121,'Released',NULL,'Immortal Beloved',13701,5.3031,7.107,'e2ql5wODeMY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12373,_binary '\0','/94udTcVXzo8nsN1yrgs3CbKAvC0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110123',5,15760,'en','In the Army Now','Bones Conway and Jack Kaufman, two misguided youths, join the reserves to make some easy money for their entrepreneurial dreams. Unfortunately, no sooner than they finish basic training they find themselves at war as part of the water purification team.','/cNIIDaJM9nsDP9tTmAN6sjKpeiN.jpg','1994-08-12',91,'Released','Sleep tight, America! The safety of the free world rests in his hands!','In the Army Now',12475,4.2505,5.1,'D8WQ8sgWaVU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12374,_binary '\0','/3neYS5s3FcF8efaaycRSVkjJ4af.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110137',6.4,1745,'en','The Inkwell','The Inkwell is about a 16-year-old boy coming of age on Martha\'s Vineyard in the summer of 1976.','/b5qUq9l6ci9KzzAqYhpdxzjY7qi.jpg','1994-04-22',110,'Released','Summer\'s never been so much fun!','The Inkwell',59930,1.48,5.7,'A0QhbZ7k9jI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12375,_binary '\0','/x2vTCtMdjCTGffHKSZ6r78UQWsC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110146',5.4,9671,'en','Intersection','During a car accident, Vincent Eastman watches his whole life flash before his eyes, and he doesn\'t like what he sees. While maintaining the semblance of a marriage with his wife, Sally, Vincent has been carrying on with a mistress, Olivia. She\'s everything Sally isn\'t -- warm, passionate, carefree. So why can\'t he choose between the two, especially when his indecision is taking its toll on his daughter?','/xRMbpD2WRxpVcU6Vvws32GkMxin.jpg','1994-01-21',98,'Released','Make every move as if it were your last.','Intersection',46717,3.501,5.1,'jo9EJwkaPTQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12376,_binary '\0','/3fChciF2G1wXHsyTfJD9y7uN6Il.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110148',7.5,380878,'en','Interview with the Vampire','A vampire relates his epic life story of love, betrayal, loneliness, and dark hunger to an over-curious reporter.','/t7NU8IcmcNBrlunCxiycX9JV7Rp.jpg','1994-11-11',123,'Released','Drink from me and live forever.','Interview with the Vampire',628,16.0149,7.4,'qmFYu8x46VY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12377,_binary '\0','/djxccumL5DaOR9umOz9KcjBFIT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110155',6.4,2040,'ar','الإرهابي','Ali Abd-El-Zaher is a member of an Islamic radical group which has been launching attacks against the government and the society under the orders of the spiritual leader Brother Saif. Ali manages to assasinate an officer, but as he escapes from the authorities he gets hit by a car driven by Sewsan, the daughter of a respected Muslim family living in the Maadi district. Sewsan\'s father who is a surgeon and his family take care of the injured terrorist who then tries to conceal the truth about his personality, such as his dislike of music, unveiled women and Western life styles.','/amyrjFVIu9tE9hmk0t0odsqPTP9.jpg','1994-03-13',142,'Released',NULL,'The Terrorist',86839,1.2329,6.278,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12378,_binary '\0','/iF9qJ9EyiKip01DsmmKYI2wcD48.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110157',6.6,10274,'en','Iron Will','When Will Stoneman\'s father dies, he is left alone to take care of his mother and their land. Needing money to maintain it, he decides to join a cross country dogsled race. This race will require days of racing for long hours, through harsh weather and terrain. This young man will need a lot of courage and a strong will to complete this race.','/vYsSu7DdgU4yqbekTvAevrv6dSP.jpg','1994-01-14',108,'Released','It\'s not a question of age. Or strength. Or ability. It\'s a matter of will.','Iron Will',24767,3.4524,6.7,'giLeHfkJeXU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12379,_binary '\0','/rHqIKBrvmRTExmi7XN31OjRSPKT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110167',6.4,49728,'en','It Could Happen to You','Charlie Lang is a simple, kindhearted New York City cop. When he realizes he has no money to tip waitress Yvonne Biasi, Lang offers her half the winnings of his lottery ticket. Amazingly, the ticket happens to be a winner, in the sum of $4 million. True to his word, Lang proceeds to share the prize money with Biasi, which infuriates his greedy wife, Muriel. Not content with the arrangement, Muriel begins scheming to take all the money.','/6UOaeLDOdwwTMQtbl5YL6EGjqy0.jpg','1994-07-16',101,'Released','A cop. A waitress. A lottery ticket.','It Could Happen to You',10660,7.626,6.7,'cEvsrvQ2RD8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12380,_binary '\0','/mjhm00FOGvzyTjYZdMhlegj28fI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110168',5.6,1979,'en','It Runs in the Family','It is now summer in the Parker family; and the usual amount of numerous events are happening in their separate lives. Ralphie is searching for the perfect top to use to beat the school bully with, the Old Man is in battle with their hillbilly neighbors, the Bumpus, while eagerly awaiting the discovery of the perfect fishing spot, and the Mother is attempting to collect all of the pieces of a glass china set at a local movie theater.','/u0uPPOs7nkoDgMfFhEvPz5OUMZL.jpg','1994-09-23',85,'Released','In \'A Christmas Story\' Ralphie raised the roof. This Summer, the whole family is bringing down the house.','It Runs in the Family',81828,1.9163,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12381,_binary '\0','/eT781UbJpqF5cQRAo52RGHKZ4pw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110169',2.8,10796,'en','It\'s Pat: The Movie','Pat Riley, an obnoxious busybody of indeterminable sex, meets and falls in love with Chris, a sensitive, caring person also of indeterminable sex. Their relationship suffers because Pat\'s a lout, and cannot decide on a direction for their life. Meanwhile, Pat\'s neighbor Kyle falls further and further into obsession with Pat, fascinated by their indeterminate sexuality.','/tydslMVgc6DpEvwYT0MWW9byL1a.jpg','1994-08-26',77,'Released','The sex symbol of the 90\'s.','It\'s Pat: The Movie',33783,3.2857,3.1,'eiIXNNfpgLY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12382,_binary '\0','/12IZamU6o4QNLcz0XhJuUK4DF1r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110171',6.8,1504,'fr','J\'ai pas sommeil','Ninon is a spirited hotel-manager who teaches self-defense classes to her terrified eldery neighbors. Daiga, an aspiring Lithuanian actress newly arrived to Paris, becomes fascinated with the life of a mysteriously beautiful drag performer.','/dHLDH7njBr6ylunu344Dy1dwzOC.jpg','1994-05-18',108,'Released','Evil exists where least expected.','I Can\'t Sleep',64900,1.9113,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12383,_binary '\0','/rUIRJsgOFhWMcHIfjAmYSsfZUzk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110175',6.6,1808,'en','Jacob','Isaac\'s son Jacob deprives his brother Esau of his birthright and has to flee for his life. He finds shelter with his uncle Laban, but is himself deceived. Finally, Jacob has to face both his uncle and brother.','/bmwFf3fMgBKqtiST5sQ7wapeLFB.jpg','1994-12-04',94,'Released',NULL,'Jacob',2712,2.5142,6.7,'8maf2lAsMwY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12384,_binary '\0','/8yUVptQ82wWax8h3X9lURadGZ0d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110186',6.6,5179,'en','Jason\'s Lyric','The story of a young man who must confront his own fears about love as well as his relationships with family and friends.','/2dXA5dNh3kqDQwRt08TxxgldTOW.jpg','1994-05-22',119,'Released','Love is courage.','Jason\'s Lyric',22067,2.3104,6.8,'xzeTvIWxhek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12385,_binary '\0','/e43TSVrHVAQfaBSQiTbwui2Fh9i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110189',4.8,3065,'en','The Jerky Boys','When two unemployed telephone pranksters decide to use their vocal \"talents\" to impersonate a Chicago mob boss and curry favor with organized crime in New York, the trouble begins. It isn\'t long before Johnny and Kamal (the \"Jerky Boys\" of crank call fame) are wanted by the local mafia, the police, and their neighbor.','/yUbdqyZaeaoNKBQmnmtim1IIAf1.jpg','1995-02-03',82,'Released','They were just a couple of losers from Queens...until they dialed a wrong number and got the mob!','The Jerky Boys',18713,1.6996,4.4,'Jl7b3E4kbeY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12386,_binary '\0','/qVQmGToej01BjzZ1FUPGKNSiK7n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110197',5.3,3842,'en','Jimmy Hollywood','Jimmy Alto is an actor wannabe who stumbles into the role of a lifetime. He becomes a vigilante crime-fighter, aided by his sidekick William, who has suffered a head wound and has problems with short-term memory. Jimmy\'s vigilante alter ego soon becomes a media wonder--but Jimmy remains a total unknown and his long-suffering girl friend Lorraine is getting fed up with the whole situation.','/o066KgKkw32T4ShvgYO7qHDzZt0.jpg','1994-03-30',112,'Released','One thing stands between Jimmy and stardom. Reality.','Jimmy Hollywood',31643,2.1385,5.2,'zLckjRbfUlE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12387,_binary '\0','/2XMjBxdICJWVmBMlbge2JySz7X9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110200',7.5,27044,'zh','精武英雄','Chen returns to his school when he finds out that his martial arts teacher has died. When he learns that his school students are harassed by some hooligans, he gears himself up to save them.','/Aqa1Yuog2OFrduwSffxZc2w4Tnk.jpg','1994-12-22',103,'Released','To avenge his master\'s death, He\'ll fight like never before!','Fist of Legend',17809,5.9817,7.47,'zfZXiw-lgMs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12388,_binary '\0','/x8zprGIgH2pExKCyNdwfANcbnlG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110201',7.5,5475,'zh','九品芝麻官','Pao Lung Sing, a descendant of the legendary Judge Pao Ching Tin, is a 9th degree corrupt judge who changes his tune when he tries to champion a woman Chi Siu-Lin, who was framed for killing her husband. As a result, Pao is forced to flee and through a series of events becomes a 1st degree judge and comes back to wreak havoc and justice on the guilty.','/29yDD4IMpk6xR6GgcbhvQ9pkOtc.jpg','1994-03-31',106,'Released','Lowest rank, loudest justice.','Hail the Judge',55156,3.9058,7.468,'cwARkgqIZYc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12389,_binary '\0','/rvNbTjSYLEJf18tNHoSKiBpP1Xu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110202',7.2,1216,'cs','Jízda','Two guys buy a car and travel through the country until they meet a lonely girl on the road. They begin travelling together, having fun, enjoying life. But then there is another guy who has a better car and who is looking for this girl because he is her lover, her first one. What is going on inside the mind of this girl? Nobody knows, until the very end.','/lZOVjHhojWBuZdbC50Wl95UWXHj.jpg','1994-10-13',90,'Released','Summer playtime which became a legend','The Ride',81400,1.1831,6.9,'ojHKN4Ya1pM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12390,_binary '\0','/k2QQrOoyShcnXqIlMZLDVg8si4M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110213',6.1,20253,'en','The Jungle Book','Raised by wild animals since childhood, Mowgli is drawn away from the jungle by the beautiful Kitty. But Mowgli must eventually face corrupt Capt. Boone, who wants both Kitty\'s hand and the treasures of Monkey City – a place only Mowgli can find.','/lFMxUrByUG2LcRAIsqrGti1zGIu.jpg','1994-12-23',111,'Released','The legend will never be the same.','The Jungle Book',10714,7.0827,6,'L8LC-wPUdqE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12391,_binary '\0','/sK1IMe4yNH5Je1PBmcgw7aFA8HB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110216',4.8,78595,'en','Junior','A research scientist becomes the world\'s first pregnant man in order to test a drug he and a colleague have designed for expectant women. To carry out the trial, he has an embryo implant, believing that he will only carry the baby for three months – hardly expecting to face the prospect of giving birth.','/swxxtzYc60qqnFhfWMFdmx9QXvY.jpg','1994-11-22',110,'Released','Nothing is inconceivable.','Junior',6280,5.4952,5.198,'aNfsJuv0bJU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12392,_binary '\0','/q8ZR4yCKRH9YCtmb3mwgTyytvYM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110222',7.6,20522,'hi','कभी हाँ कभी ना','A man belongs to a middle-class family and is intent on pursuing his career with a music group, despite his dad\'s disapproval. He is also in love with the lead singer, but she sees him mainly as a friend.','/6FtBaFCz3UFFhXyE4JHxQDn43gM.jpg','1994-02-25',158,'Released',NULL,'Kabhi Haan Kabhi Naa',15419,1.6984,6.7,'XvsJd6tEyBE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12393,_binary '\0','/5E8NLdIgZo8PqsletlZvL0bXS0N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110236',6.7,2365,'sv','Kan du vissla Johanna?','Young Berra has a friend, Ulf. Ulf has a grandfather which he likes very much, he gives Ulf presents and takes him on fishing trips. Berra doesn\'t have a grandfather, but he wants one that\'s nice to him and who can teach him to whistle. Ulf knows where to find a grandfather - at a home for senior citizens. They go searching together and Berra finds a great pretend grandfather, Nils.','/h6wLjg39h2EAxqaI9CHJWwdHzvy.jpg','1994-12-24',55,'Released',NULL,'Kan du vissla Johanna?',76594,1.1033,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12394,_binary '\0','/63BX5ZE1SgT2EIzu2WWiva1jQtH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110251',7.1,1299,'de','Keiner liebt mich','On the brink of her 30th birthday, Fanny feels the door to marital happiness closing on her. She is obsessed with death and even visits evening classes on dying, so it seems fitting that she encounters a skeleton in the malfunctioning elevator of her apartment building. The skeleton is her neighbour Orfeo, a Black, gay, self-declared psychic, who convinces her that she is about to meet \"him\". But is it really Lothar, the new yuppie apartment manager ...?','/vBDJPkoTOKT9F1zx0y9tT7G62vF.jpg','1994-11-07',104,'Released',NULL,'Nobody Loves Me',11907,1.572,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12395,_binary '\0','/hrJCxVyDPkitAugITlaq7HdQHk7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110255',4.1,4102,'en','Kickboxer 4: The Aggressor','David Sloan must travel to Mexico to save his wife from a savage international terrorist.','/9hA6SzsDkLTKxKOcfYVmRrq4Z0U.jpg','1994-05-14',90,'Released',NULL,'Kickboxer 4: The Aggressor',50346,3.2715,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12396,_binary '\0','/lA2EYuuyvWDDSL9rqONIByoQRDy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110265',6.4,22519,'en','Killing Zoe','Zed is an American vault-cracker who travels to Paris to meet up with his old friend Eric. Eric and his gang have planned to raid the only bank in the city which is open on Bastille day. After offering his services, Zed soon finds himself trapped in a situation beyond his control when heroin abuse, poor planning and a call-girl named Zoe all conspire to turn the robbery into a very bloody siege.','/k3UEKMVnkljOlsO5sLmz87YGlaG.jpg','1993-10-01',96,'Released','We go in. We get what we want. We come out.','Killing Zoe',507,3.5892,6.2,'u_4mhnd-098','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12397,_binary '\0','/qp9f05lAf96VtuxPe3O0WDjsBbT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110280',7.4,2714,'hi','Krantiveer','Lack-lustred and alcoholic Pratap Narayan Tilak is given a rude awakening when he meets with journalist Megha Dixit, and decides to instill some sense of justice and fair play within his community, and get them to assertively defend their rights and freedom. He is met with strong resistance, both from within his very own community, the police, and some very powerful and influential politicians. Unable to bear the injustice, and frustrated at his community to act proactively, Pratap decides to take the law into his own hands, resulting in chaos, violence, and uncertainty for everyone, and a path to his own grave.','/lfVjv2SqiqgCfo0EWwLYjpgTlVu.jpg','1994-07-22',159,'Released',NULL,'Krantiveer',143980,1.1298,8.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12398,_binary '\0','/cNftai0xQHlb3wiqWlFioAWNWwF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110296',7.4,4158,'en','Ladybird Ladybird','Maggie has had four children, by four different fathers, removed by social services because of a previous violent relationship. When she meets Jorge, a gentle Latin American refugee, she gradually sees her chance for happiness, but her past still haunts her.','/14sAtrim0RpkI1eZSZ3m5etp5Wz.jpg','1994-02-18',101,'Released',NULL,'Ladybird Ladybird',49980,2.2692,7.2,'REPoYxk2W7w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12399,_binary '\0','/1udmBSCUyP6FDrnUNQ9CjSlp0iz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110299',7.4,2527,'it','Lamerica','Fiore, an Italian conman, arrives in post Communist Albania with Gino, his young apprentice, to set up a shoe factory that will never open. The con requires a native Albanian, so they designate Spiro, an impoverished and confused former political prisoner as chairman of the board. When Fiore returns to Italy to get government funds for the project, Spiro unexpectedly disappears and Gino sets out on a journey to find him. The search leads him to discover Spiro\'s tragic personal history and witness Albanian poverty firsthand.','/nnLpA4mqb3gvhNJQZ00cOyBmeq3.jpg','1994-09-09',112,'Released',NULL,'Lamerica',49133,1.7583,7.2,'3Fd6ZlgOFqs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12400,_binary '\0','/xX2vIe7mGE4wo1NSWFlxTQLV6cK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110305',5.9,6710,'en','Lassie','On their way to start a new life at a sheep farm in rural Virginia, the Turner family are halted by a wreck on the highway that has claimed the life of a truck driver. Spotting the trucker\'s now-abandoned collie on the side of the road, they take pity on the dog and adopt her. As the city family copes with the change to rural life, including a feud with a neighboring farm family who resent the city interlopers, the ever-loyal Lassie helps them adjust to their new surroundings.','/mz8nOwwuOntjoBuIxNXePLzjZ32.jpg','1994-07-22',94,'Released','Best friends are forever.','Lassie',29918,3.6895,6.107,'VkwPGVUHg9E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12401,_binary '\0','/vDgXzSbSwTPvDuxrDkSQkjYcA4I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110307',6.1,3715,'en','The Last Outlaw','The story follows a band of former Confederate soldiers who were part of a cavalry unit. Their commander, Graff, had once been a heroic and staunch supporter of the Southern cause, but after losing his family, he became coldhearted and ruthless. His second-in-command is Eustis, whom Graff has trained on the strategies of leadership and combat command.','/pnLWFKZSvH1fNtjSCdgGP2WOqRu.jpg','1993-10-30',93,'Released',NULL,'The Last Outlaw',20333,3.1606,5.454,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12402,_binary '\0','/8KbWuuthHkS7U1wntWCrgo36igG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110308',7,29161,'en','The Last Seduction','A devious femme fatale steals her husband’s drug money and hides out in a small town where she meets the perfect dupe for her next scheme.','/kK8IiJDkz2Tv6DwaK60vJVHKH85.jpg','1994-05-26',110,'Released','Most People Have a Dark Side. She Had Nothing Else.','The Last Seduction',25284,4.2424,6.7,'wBAZQ029TBQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12403,_binary '\0','/eVIuBKpeLB8rkozkj8bVmxDuAsp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110322',7.5,202124,'en','Legends of the Fall','In early 20th-century Montana, Col. William Ludlow lives on a ranch in the wilderness with his sons, Alfred, Tristan, and Samuel. Eventually, the unconventional but close-knit family are bound by loyalty, tested by war, and torn apart by love, as told over the course of several decades in this epic saga.','/89DRDb6mmNkIekqSeAzz13faQDt.jpg','1994-12-23',133,'Released','After the Fall from Innocence the Legend begins.','Legends of the Fall',4476,14.6837,7.392,'w5320WqSVPQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12404,_binary '\0','/yvtMS504Fvqxs613lD7hAGI51Dd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110329',4.7,13511,'en','Leprechaun 2','A thousand years ago, the Leprechaun left a bloody trail when he ripped through the countryside in search of his stolen gold. Now he\'s back in the big city using all of his deadly tricks to snare the girl of his nightmares. His bloody quest becomes more deadly when her boyfriend steals one of the Leprechaun\'s gold coins. The town soon discovers two dead bodies and a trail of gold dust leads them to the Leprechaun\'s lair.','/fnCLZ3rpy3enYSHrzcBxnx3fozK.jpg','1994-04-08',85,'Released','This time... luck has nothing to do with it.','Leprechaun 2',18009,3.8469,5.445,'fPTC15gu_gk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12405,_binary '\0','/pVRzlfalhzWmz87LH16Q2LmTXyu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110353',5.5,7649,'en','Lightning Jack','Lightning Jack Kane is an Australian outlaw in the wild west. During a bungled bank robbery he picks up mute Ben Doyle as a hostage. The two become good friends, with Jack teaching Ben how to rob banks, while they plan Jack\'s last heist.','/4YoRERjKWO2442ezcvgEjAZuxWP.jpg','1994-03-11',98,'Released',NULL,'Lightning Jack',22317,2.6745,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12406,_binary '\0','/bqFxtuGNsz30HTk5mzgGs8m9Po.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110357',8.5,1277529,'en','The Lion King','Young lion prince Simba, eager to one day become king of the Pride Lands, grows up under the watchful eye of his father Mufasa; all the while his villainous uncle Scar conspires to take the throne for himself. Amid betrayal and tragedy, Simba must confront his past and find his rightful place in the Circle of Life.','/sKCr78MXSLixwmZ8DyJLrpMsd15.jpg','1994-06-15',89,'Released','The greatest adventure of all is finding our place in the Circle of Life.','The Lion King',8587,40.7423,8.251,'_YZ9qZSIjo0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12407,_binary '\0','/hEPUs4yRZE0gFckKPf83OH8sQMp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110361',7.1,6002,'en','Lisbon Story','Wim Wenders\' homage to Lisbon and films. A sound engineer obtains a mysterious postcard from a friend who at the moment is filming a film in Lisbon. He sets out across Europe to find him and help him.','/iqxvLET9q43BxxNXmit9nNiEPPM.jpg','1994-12-16',100,'Released',NULL,'Lisbon Story',390,2.3556,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12408,_binary '\0','/lLk9msIWEHRJR7Die5Q2Jgyep7f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110363',6.2,12565,'en','Little Big League','When the owner of the Minnesota Twins passes away, he bequeaths the team to his preteen grandson. The newly minted head honcho quickly appoints himself manager, causing unrest in an organization that struggles to take orders from a 12-year-old.','/ps0GapKs4vuV38XX6VUbTZm8QS6.jpg','1994-06-29',119,'Released','The Minnesota Twins Have A New Owner','Little Big League',31504,2.5543,5.9,'6NOZXwAvFFY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12409,_binary '\0','/gl58xoX8NK95vIgtIMCsKsd2its.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110364',6.5,33470,'en','Little Giants','When Danny O\'Shea\'s daughter is cut from the Peewee football team just for being a girl, he decides to form his own team, composed of other ragtag players who were also cut. Can his team really learn enough to beat the elite team, coached by his brother, a former pro player?','/AkfXNOeKgJSOD08StGd0599auiZ.jpg','1994-10-14',107,'Released','For everyone who\'s waited to be chosen, and wasn\'t... your day has come.','Little Giants',20726,4.6086,6.5,'Oo3k1wVPARc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12410,_binary '\0','/eixQk0rpDH3vYamqWw4Bvu3Y635.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110365',6.7,10201,'en','Little Odessa','Long separated from his family, hitman Joshua returns to Brighton Beach for a contract killing for the Russian Mafia. His abusive father, Arkady, banned him from returning after Joshua committed his first murder. He takes up residence in a hotel, and soon everyone knows he has returned. He goes home to visit his dying mother, Irina, and prepares for the assassination, getting drawn back into the criminal community he left behind.','/80zDn3oanRMWDSDX1cPKZVIi8OO.jpg','1994-10-28',98,'Released','Brothers in blood. Partners in crime.','Little Odessa',47504,2.8857,6.469,'LkGY1-IvSmU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12411,_binary '\0','/GGtBQDAl7CtZtTFTCUUoYHVHyJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110366',6.4,62359,'en','The Little Rascals','When nine-year-old Alfalfa falls for Darla, his \"He-Man-Woman-Hating\" friends attempt to sabotage their relationship.','/qI7PKX2JSw4yD2iQm3pyHvKir28.jpg','1994-08-05',82,'Released','Mischief loves company.','The Little Rascals',10897,19.3302,6.8,'FgyCE8VsGKM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12412,_binary '\0','/cIxRNZqafLWrS9WfkB7e7v6aJ0g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110367',7.3,69868,'en','Little Women','Four sisters come of age in America in the aftermath of the Civil War.','/1ZzH1XMcKAe5NdrKL5MfcqZHHsZ.jpg','1994-12-21',115,'Released','The story that has lived in our hearts for generations, now comes to the screen for the holidays.','Little Women',9587,9.8141,7.268,'sET83nlk1NU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12413,_binary '\0','/aqun4YtcepdCBOHkhO16gIwtZxb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110391',6,5422,'en','Love Affair','Ex-football star Mike Gambril meets Terry McKay on a flight to Sydney, which is forced to land on a small atoll. They become romantic on board a ship sent to take them to a larger island. They agree to meet in New York three months later to see if the attraction is real. One shows up but the other doesn\'t. However, a chance meeting brings them together again.','/uPEh48HZN9qqewkF2Hsi9BD6oz7.jpg','1994-10-21',108,'Released',NULL,'Love Affair',43742,3.3186,5.5,'-NoM6EQIaF0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12414,_binary '\0','/5edOoD7mdBrHm2LWeZQIQHiFOrF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110395',6,5184,'en','Love and a .45','Small-time criminal Watty Watts attempts to rob a convenience store with his drug-addict buddy, Billy Mack Black. The robbery, however, leads to murder, and soon Watty leaves Billy behind and goes on the run with his beloved girlfriend, Starlene. Heading toward Mexico, the fugitive couple gets plenty of media coverage, until there are even more people on their trail. Can Watty and Starlene make it south of the border without getting caught?','/xz7rXuL1lkc6tkt1rS0N05rxtRX.jpg','1994-11-23',101,'Released','This is one jagged twisting ride you\'ll never forget.','Love and a .45',15477,2.4275,5.7,'B3AqG25J_Vo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12415,_binary '\0','/sXjws2JQcuv2yrL5TVgrWSvEtyY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110399',5.9,8495,'en','A Low Down Dirty Shame','A black detective becomes embroiled in a web of danger while searching for a fortune in missing drug money. During the course of his investigation, he encounters various old connections, ultimately confronting the criminal responsible for Shame\'s expulsion from the force. He must also deal with two women, Angela, a beautiful old flame, and Peaches, his energetic but annoying sidekick.','/v5XUfLrdoGfatObGXhqckYTNqFT.jpg','1994-11-23',100,'Released','He\'s armed and dangerously funny.','A Low Down Dirty Shame',26352,3.3028,5.667,'-kRfPEO_5aY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12416,_binary '\0','/fj0hwDJEOOHllRim2BMt5L7tbjf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110413',8.5,1365535,'fr','Léon','Léon, the top hit man in New York, has earned a rep as an effective \"cleaner\". But when his next-door neighbors are wiped out by a loose-cannon DEA agent, he becomes the unwilling custodian of 12-year-old Mathilda. Before long, Mathilda\'s thoughts turn to revenge, and she considers following in Léon\'s footsteps.','/bxB2q91nKYp8JNzqE7t7TWBVupB.jpg','1994-09-14',111,'Released','If you want the job done right, hire a professional.','Léon: The Professional',101,26.0245,8.29,'DD-6bmOY__g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12417,_binary '\0','/fjrLJZ18NfSPkByHeiGUqKw1TP1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110419',6.3,2344,'en','MacGyver: Lost Treasure of Atlantis','Hunting artifacts attributed to Zenon (an ancient scientist from Atlantis), MacGyver and his old professor end up searching for the lost city.','/hcmocdC6Rp0w6C8M4i1yvewmgNL.jpg','1994-05-14',93,'Released',NULL,'MacGyver: Lost Treasure of Atlantis',81895,2.4808,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12418,_binary '\0','/nJXoFnSK6E2GOetBMdp5nqKvrCP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110420',6.1,1727,'en','MacGyver: Trail to Doomsday','A close friend of MacGyver is murdered. In searching for a reason for this assassination MacGyver discovers a secret nuclear weapons plant right in the center of Britain.','/goM1nyiXVHIyRwFyM7uXMzmrr0v.jpg','1994-11-24',93,'Released',NULL,'MacGyver: Trail to Doomsday',13632,2.2351,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12419,_binary '\0','/2Rf6jQMHGDZpzoeoNdBLbCyRCK7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110428',7.2,20360,'en','The Madness of King George','Aging King George III of England is exhibiting signs of madness, a problem little understood in 1788. As the monarch alternates between bouts of confusion and near-violent outbursts of temper, his hapless doctors attempt the ineffectual cures of the day. Meanwhile, Queen Charlotte and Prime Minister William Pitt the Younger attempt to prevent the king\'s political enemies, led by the Prince of Wales, from usurping the throne.','/1dTSY023ZyBbgVSKDRuA6JLGSnZ.jpg','1994-12-28',107,'Released','His Majesty was all powerful and all knowing. But he wasn\'t quite all there.','The Madness of King George',11318,4.9588,6.8,'0pdNMKZXJ28','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12420,_binary '\0','/20xLKFRodYKx0KV6ZCtykvMEAJ0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110438',6.5,7043,'hi','मैं खिलाड़ी तू अनाड़ी','A Bombay police officer seeks revenge when his brother is killed by a powerful underworld figure. Things get complicated when a matinee movie idol begins to tag along the policeman so he can research a movie role.','/tFJFdzaI3huSWkElcgnMsr18lTZ.jpg','1994-09-23',175,'Released',NULL,'Main Khiladi Tu Anari',46403,1.1841,6.041,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12421,_binary '\0','/y4nGjTJ4d0x5tQ7EFLhuDO81QaV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110442',5.7,30052,'en','Major League II','After losing in the ALCS the year before, the Cleveland Indians are determined to make it into the World Series this time! However, they first have to contend with Rachel Phelps again when she buys back the team.','/2QAb0gZusyMsZ1W5ce85plVciDp.jpg','1994-03-30',105,'Released','The dream team is back!','Major League II',11067,5.0494,5.706,'QGnW5gh4WZE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12422,_binary '\0','/4lNbhZcnrjG079TUkG1mIi2wen0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110443',6.3,44124,'en','Major Payne','Major Benson Winifred Payne is being discharged from the Marines. Payne is a killin\' machine, but the wars of the world are no longer fought on the battlefield. A career Marine, he has no idea what to do as a civilian, so his commander finds him a job - commanding officer of a local school\'s JROTC program, a bunch of ragtag losers with no hope.','/kWHx5eq7PELkF3If7LrrhuBskRG.jpg','1995-03-24',95,'Released','He\'s looking for a few good men... or a few guys old enough to shave.','Major Payne',11008,6.092,6.5,'bv4fMbrfrWM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12423,_binary '\0','/xfK1dvRMcxkUx6UtAqywsUqSIOQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110455',6.7,1325,'en','A Man of No Importance','Alfie Byrne is a middle-aged bus conductor in Dublin in 1963. He would appear to live a life of quiet desperation: he\'s gay, but firmly closeted, and his sister is always trying to find him \"the right girl\". His passion is Oscar Wilde, his hobby is putting on amateur theatre productions in the local church hall. We follow him as he struggles with temptation, friendship, disapproval, and the conservative yet oddly lyrical world of Ireland in the early 1960s.','/zKHmxia0cdXMmNu5LUEwiJQJQoa.jpg','1994-12-24',99,'Released','An extraordinary tale of an ordinary hero','A Man of No Importance',52038,1.7635,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12424,_binary '\0','/bI3Pig6LyzxndsRNNfptQDv100I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110463',5.7,2263,'cn','冒險王','A serial adventure writer with problems in his personal life lives out the adventures of his literary hero, King of Adventurers.','/qsOgkQ41npgioxnSv0Li7rWtWg3.jpg','1996-02-10',90,'Released','There\'s a New Action Hero in Town!','Dr. Wai in the Scripture with No Words',31027,2.9364,5.8,'vT4t2thnw2c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12425,_binary '\0','/bQlw59HncOXX9alFlOYKHAvSnm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110475',7,477230,'en','The Mask','Timid bank clerk Stanley Ipkiss discovers a magical mask infused with the spirit of the Norse god Loki. Donning it transforms him into an unrestrained, green-faced, cartoon-like wild man. While the mask grants him the confidence to woo a local singer, it also makes him the target of a ruthless mobster.','/jPC2eYub74zwf2tPGVtzSlBW6Oy.jpg','1994-07-29',101,'Released','From zero to hero.','The Mask',854,21.1496,6.996,'hOqVRwGVUkA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12426,_binary '\0','/ctzKCslTsMRsOJNvAm1Mw8ytiHY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110478',7,126045,'en','Maverick','Bret Maverick is a gambler who would rather con someone than fight them, and needs an additional $3k in order to enter a winner-takes-all poker game beginning in a few days. He joins forces with a woman with a marvelous Southern accent, and the two try and enter the game.','/mTVbGGi5PIexmxVzeyFd2RYKwfM.jpg','1994-05-20',127,'Released','In their hands, a deck of cards was the only thing more dangerous than a gun.','Maverick',9359,7.0471,6.903,'mQ69CVbCiow','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12427,_binary '\0','/xjgPzyORwBwHnkiLZHNCUQfA64S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110490',5.6,5054,'en','Men of War','Nick Gunar is a burnt-out, jaded and hard-up former mercenary who is having a difficult time adjusting to civilian life. At the end of his rope, he is hired by the Nitro Mine Corporation to strong-arm the natives of a South China Sea island into giving up their rights to its valuable mineral resources. Nick loathes the thought of another mission, but this seemingly easy job will earn him enough money to get back with his estranged family. He recruits some of his former mercenary buddies to help him with the job. The island people refuse to give up their land and Nick decides to help them fight the greedy corporation that hired him. As greed and treachery begin to unravel, Nick\'s band of mercenaries choose sides.','/rrwG9foUMulWBI2Nk7s6Bcgwfim.jpg','1994-09-03',103,'Released','Killers for hire are paid for what they can do, not for what they believe... until today.','Men of War',38940,2.7801,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12428,_binary '\0','/1rHgdXka6ovVnXotYdt92S8YUa2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110496',5.8,1242,'en','Mesmer','A biography of the eighteenth century Viennese physician, Franz Anton Mesmer, who used unorthodox healing practices based on his theory of \"animal magnetism.\"','/3dHeKIBTREvsVdiLSLAXXXOH3DK.jpg','1994-08-25',107,'Released','Charlatan, Fraud... or Genius','Mesmer',77624,1.4495,6,'vOesv5sdzwk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12429,_binary '\0','/A0rgmDhySzeYibyjUzC6NjtML7f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110516',5.7,14113,'en','Milk Money','Three young boys pool their money and pay V, a kindhearted prostitute, to strip for them. Afterward, she drives them home to the suburbs -- but then her car breaks down. It\'s just as well, though, because a mobster named Waltzer is after her, and V realizes the suburbs are the perfect place to hide. But things get a lot more complicated when V falls in love with Tom, a single father who is unaware of her real profession.','/od8SCOMLDq4iRYaHNqihQVn1SNE.jpg','1994-08-31',108,'Released','You can\'t get enough of a good thing... But first you have to find it.','Milk Money',8986,4.5804,6.5,'mQJDvN59u6o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12430,_binary '\0','/XBGXzsgIqA0DP5BDtH6cBpL9JD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110524',6.1,3566,'ja','みんな〜やってるか!','While pursuing his dream of having car sex, a goofy middle-aged man makes all the wrong moves and ends up enrolling in a number of crazy escapades.','/owvDqHOzdeN7nMiUBZfHtpgEWW.jpg','1995-02-11',108,'Released','What wouldn\'t you do for sex?','Getting Any?',39767,2.2822,5.764,'Q7nCJdwf0ww','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12431,_binary '\0','/oU0lGpUukjNOgZeuIqueNM3QiBE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110527',6.7,51390,'en','Miracle on 34th Street','Six-year-old Susan Walker has doubts about childhood\'s most enduring miracle—Santa Claus. Her mother told her the secret about Santa a long time ago, but, after meeting a special department store Santa who\'s convinced he\'s the real thing, Susan is given the most precious gift of all—something to believe in.','/iUTPKkljdEjPlcPPYgbUz7APnHu.jpg','1994-11-18',114,'Released','If you really believe, anything can happen.','Miracle on 34th Street',10510,7.2956,6.8,'yiypbCFV7Ao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12432,_binary '\0','/8Ba82CvjOKcmb9ghBIXN5rFW88B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110538',5.4,14866,'en','Mixed Nuts','The events of a crisis hotline business on one crazy night during the Christmas holidays.','/xPdQMqxWnFwCKOIto8dBEorTtGR.jpg','1994-12-21',97,'Released','A comedy on the edge.','Mixed Nuts',24070,5.0599,5.4,'dwBG2CXDXcc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12433,_binary '\0','/q1UnSrn1zECgC3rzpi4bSjBEyis.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110545',6.5,1242,'ar','المهاجر','The biblical tale of Joseph is told from an Egyptian perspective in this interesting character study. In this film, Joseph is called Ram. Ram, tired of his family\'s backward superstitious life, and tired of being picked on by his brothers, wants to go to Egypt to study agriculture. His brothers travel with him across Sinai, but then suddenly sell him to Ozir, an Egyptian who works for a Theban military leader, Amihar. Amihar is impressed by Ram\'s drive and personal charm and so grants Ram some desolate land outside the capital. Ram soon finds himself a pawn in the political and sexual games between Amihar and his wife Simihit, a high priestess of the Cult of Amun.','/rKndICPaIJpPUpwJXFZ6ly6xAt5.jpg','1994-09-26',130,'Released',NULL,'The Emigrant',96428,1.2039,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12434,_binary '\0','/jNqTXO3JIhORYBCi6OAFzFzVxhE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110546',7,9329,'hi','Mohra','Journalist Roma Singh is the daughter of a jailer. While taking a tour of the jail, she is molested by some of the inmates, and an inmate, Vishal Agnihotri comes to her assistance. She finds out that Vishal is in for four homicides, and decides to investigate further. She finds out, with the help of the owner of her publications, Jindal that Vishal was compelled to take the law in his own hands when the courts failed to punish the assailants of his sister and sweetheart. Soon, Vishal is released from prison, and begins to work for Jindal. It is then that he realizes that he has just walked from a walled prison, to an open prison, as the truth behind his release slowly but surely starts to dawn on him.','/r6Eafb6fYhNrBNGDxwdJxfN9del.jpg','1994-07-01',177,'Released',NULL,'Mohra',109028,1.4932,6.207,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12435,_binary '\0','/fuf0kMwAWVoQmtO1QeRppqg4AKL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110557',5.4,7825,'en','Monkey Trouble','Dodger, a criminal monkey, belongs to a crooked street performer but escapes his life of crime only to end up in the arms of Eva, an innocent little girl whose mother has no idea that her daughter is harboring a fugitive.','/XnEXrR8SKWQmmvjtjRoAXROEj.jpg','1994-03-18',96,'Released','Eva\'s new friend has big eyes, hairy feet, and very sticky fingers.','Monkey Trouble',41582,3.1054,5.7,'7z9ERLpWD2w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12436,_binary '\0','/izUQSU7tCcx0k4xU3VARcKqy3pn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110570',7.3,12627,'it','Il mostro','A vicious serial sex killer is on the loose, and landscape gardener and shop-window outfitter Loris is the prime suspect, thanks to his unfortunate habit of getting caught in compromising situations (for which there is always a totally innocent explanation that the police fail to spot). Undercover policewoman Jessica is assigned by eccentric police psychologist Taccone to follow Loris.','/6h6ahipPd84QcyFbnsEikLt7w3Z.jpg','1994-10-22',112,'Released',NULL,'The Monster',22826,3.1483,6.944,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12437,_binary '\0','/9FQhHLE4oFLjSB6PpJ4PBu0IJNv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110588',6.4,5108,'en','Mrs. Parker and the Vicious Circle','Dorothy Parker remembers the heyday of the Algonquin Round Table, a circle of friends whose barbed wit, like hers, was fueled by alcohol and flirted with despair.','/avTHiIim0Jm0rs4ehFLck8u3NFW.jpg','1994-09-07',125,'Released','New York in the 1920\'s. The only place to be was the Algonquin, and the only person to know was Dorothy Parker.','Mrs. Parker and the Vicious Circle',23333,2.7494,5.9,'LYuj2PAP-jA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12438,_binary '\0','/x4sqnmV2nAKIG6cmt9WAF9xRA2M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110598',7.3,46114,'en','Muriel\'s Wedding','Socially awkward Muriel Heslop wants nothing more than to get married. Unfortunately, due to her oppressive politician father, Muriel has never even been on a date. Ostracized by her more socially adept friends, Muriel runs into fellow outcast Rhonda Epinstalk, and the two move from their small Australian town to the big city of Sydney, where Muriel changes her name and begins the arduous task of redesigning her life to match her fantasies.','/zJyTr8Fo412a2OIfJGXTRAm4IwX.jpg','1994-09-29',106,'Released','Success is the best revenge.','Muriel\'s Wedding',236,5.1072,6.8,'JJVWXHRDqec','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12439,_binary '\0','/1QZBkYj1XbjfpYmMbCiXH6xqGXx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110604',6.7,8508,'en','Mute Witness','When a mute makeup/special effects artist working on a low-budget slasher film gets locked in a dilapidated Moscow movie studio late one night, she thinks she witnesses the making of a snuff film. Thus begins a night of terror.','/kfCIZNpb2bWspnQNkIQftQlksCU.jpg','1995-09-15',95,'Released','She won\'t be silenced.','Mute Witness',48787,3.2556,6.462,'2Xqca_EJ1eA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12440,_binary '\0','/sHfxJXELZHyFIt6H8sfCnJkdFMu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110612',5.5,12337,'en','My Father the Hero','A teenage girl on vacation in the Bahamas with her divorced father tries to impress a potential boyfriend by saying that her father is actually her lover.','/qOP80oUZRTT7EsV7EZA9aBa95dQ.jpg','1994-02-04',90,'Released','Fathers have just one problem with raising their daughters. They grow up!','My Father the Hero',10486,4.3148,5.4,'7Ft-edEK3BE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12441,_binary '\0','/gWxwSSrujqNgVJ6tGBd89Bgw2YU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110613',5.3,22375,'en','My Girl 2','Vada Sultenfuss has a holiday coming up, and an assignment: to do an essay on someone she admires and has never met. She decides she wants to do an assignment on her mother, but quickly realises she knows very little about her. She manages to get her father to agree to let her go to LA to stay with her Uncle Phil and do some research on her mother.','/hEZ6L72eBORRnoUxf4pip5U76pq.jpg','1994-02-11',99,'Released','There\'s being a kid. There\'s being a adult. And then there\'s that year in between.','My Girl 2',11317,4.5156,6.1,'w3gVq6WXMpg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12442,_binary '\0','/oS9pCcAOq5Jn9myvjM8KaJuBHz6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110620',6,3949,'en','Nadja','In a contemporary New York City, members of a dysfunctional family of vampires are trying to come to terms with each other, in the wake of their father\'s death. Meanwhile, they are being hunted by Dr. Van Helsing and his hapless nephew. As in all good vampire movies, forces of love are pitted against forces of destruction.','/uwo3iDfPNdZoSNGAgQDXEM7xMu8.jpg','1995-09-01',93,'Released','Unseen. Unforgiving. Undead.','Nadja',34574,1.9997,5.7,'RR3RjPOCPFo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12443,_binary '\0','/rZBc0S32bVNYOGJ5sKYsHhOwIT5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110622',6.5,129801,'en','Naked Gun 33⅓: The Final Insult','Frank Drebin is persuaded out of retirement to go undercover in a state prison. There he has to find out what top terrorist, Rocco, has planned for when he escapes. Adding to his problems, Frank\'s wife, Jane, is desperate for a baby.','/p0AYsdgkudR9P5fNV5AjzbwQt8W.jpg','1994-03-18',83,'Released','Mostly all new jokes.','Naked Gun 33⅓: The Final Insult',36593,10.9922,6.5,'WQ3p19A1mbw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12444,_binary '\0','/fjYSfQVLW9vvyhZKvJS1UadMtoZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110623',5.6,1851,'en','Naked in New York','Naked in New York begins in the car of grown up Jake, he is talking to us about his girlfriend, Joanne, and to whom you can turn to for help while facing life. From there it flashes back to his memories of his parents, college, house across from a squirrel infested peanut factory, best friend, writing career and Joanne.','/gAufFGm2Qly8TYrhy4me9X35B7m.jpg','1993-11-10',95,'Released','Love. Work. Life. Even when you have all the pieces… some assembly is required','Naked in New York',11800,2.6275,4.8,'KeFUNWc0oeE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12445,_binary '\0','/2FAGeHcOOxviG3iNTFh4paFoJYM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110631',7.1,20771,'da','Nattevagten','Martin, a law student, takes up a job as a nightwatchman at a mortuary to fund his studies. But the mortuary harbours a dark secret, and he has to find the truth before he is implicated in a serial murder case.','/wThSC3JdyeXOWM11RWBxWfUQg74.jpg','1994-02-25',107,'Released','They are looking for a night watchman. Martin is not afraid of the dark but he just has one problem... he got the job!','Nightwatch',6498,3.8427,6.9,'gVwN6YlZ7fw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12446,_binary '\0','/k3TOt50cHvTLXWYPnXP0szhiXB8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110632',7.2,270138,'en','Natural Born Killers','Two victims of traumatized childhoods become lovers and serial murderers irresponsibly glorified by the mass media.','/fEKZwT91gxvkAoyPgpNXo8W5fu0.jpg','1994-08-26',119,'Released','The media made them superstars.','Natural Born Killers',241,12.62,7,'PgxH1-yeWNI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12447,_binary '\0','/jpYjJd0cNKqxQXufHQdMkcIHM3g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110638',6.5,32689,'en','Nell','In a remote woodland cabin, a small town doctor discovers Nell — a beautiful young hermit woman with many secrets.','/aIDp3x2YfijtdherR28pIH6yenn.jpg','1994-12-23',112,'Released','Her heart. Her soul. Her language are a mystery... A mystery called Nell','Nell',1945,3.3766,6.532,'n1Zay9SOYxA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12448,_binary '\0','/12Tr8MQ3z4M2Kpsz7bQQhghNJ5X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110647',3.2,13294,'de','Die unendliche Geschichte III - Rettung aus Phantásien','A young boy must restore order when a group of bullies steal the magical book that acts as a portal between Earth and the imaginary world of Fantasia.','/o75HHfr23sgeqIeUPwjKY0V9Ppi.jpg','1994-10-26',95,'Released','It\'s a brand new beginning in the adventure that never ends.','The NeverEnding Story III',27793,4.8853,4.5,'XiiyFFZjq0Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12449,_binary '\0','/x4EU6KgzU68twF7vakAaNmuA9ii.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110649',5.6,1384,'en','The New Age','Peter and Katherine Witner are Southern California super-yuppies with great jobs but no center to their lives. When they both lose their jobs and begin marital infidelities, their solution is to start their own business together. In order to find meaning to their empty lives, they follow various New Age gurus and other such groups. Eventually, they hit rock bottom and have to make some hard decisions.','/k0qZgxIlGRPsgamNjIUDKhLmZGH.jpg','1994-09-16',112,'Released','A shopping spree for the morally bankrupt.','The New Age',41588,1.7942,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12450,_binary '\0','/kgqgbPB2snzVlkMkQjYAvmF1hkc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110657',4.6,38625,'en','The Next Karate Kid','Mr. Miyagi decides to take Julie, a troubled teenager, under his wing after he learns that she blames herself for her parents\' demise and struggles to adjust with her grandmother and fellow pupils.','/wI3gCi9w1cuUJCiwhviAy46we9Q.jpg','1994-07-18',107,'Released','It\'s ancient wisdom against teenage spunk. 1,000 years of karate tradition is about to get a kick in the pants.','The Next Karate Kid',11231,8.9336,5.4,'eDchGHJdRVs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12451,_binary '\0','/hwjR19fQAJkiNKopY6KUJV0r23l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110659',7.5,1314,'sr','Ni na nebu ni na zemlji','The exploits of a depressed architect in Belgrade as he wanders about searching for the future in a land where the future no longer exists. Handsome Nikola is in his mid-thirties. He earned the nickname Champ because he used to race speedboats. He makes a decent living as a free-lance architect and his apartment is spacious and comfortable. Ana is attracted by the Champ\'s good looks and apparent prosperity. He is always pensive though; even when he is out drinking at the local clubs with his companions he cannot help but brood about the state of Belgrade. Though the city appears fairly normal on the outside, the presence of the war is signalled when a reluctant conscript in the army is dragged away.','/gCIqXqqIj3f6mGSUxF0Xq0To459.jpg','1994-07-02',100,'Released',NULL,'In the Middle of Nowhere',283415,1.2644,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12452,_binary '\0','/xj0Cas0bnBtUvjZA6Tye4utUvxD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110667',5.9,7319,'en','Night of the Demons 2','Angela, the hostess from hell, summons her army of teen demons when teenagers from St. Rita\'s High School decide to party at the haunted Hull House on Halloween.','/c0JZ23O4hKJana9mzC0AxKbS7Ko.jpg','1994-05-31',96,'Released','Angela\'s throwing another party. Trick or treat, sucker','Night of the Demons 2',24925,2.8197,6.2,'GN7E3ex13Vc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12453,_binary '\0','/sNZqPZL3p4Xcm6aRUubH0DZtkxB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110668',5.9,2423,'en','Night of the Running Man','A Las Vegas cab driver finds a million dollars of stolen money in his cab after his fare is murdered. Soon after, a ruthless hitman is in pursuit; he will stop at nothing to recover the money and dispose of all witnesses.','/q4lAGqpDySxw8iIWZFREofbtb6F.jpg','1995-01-19',93,'Released',NULL,'Night of the Running Man',51911,2.3956,5.8,'Akeloeclg90','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12454,_binary '\0','/jVgQzfKgJ7kCvviscQXpSPD208X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110678',6.1,24652,'en','No Escape','In the year 2022, a ruthless prison warden has created the ultimate solution for his most troublesome and violent inmates: Absolom, a secret jungle island where prisoners are abandoned and left to die. But Marine Captain John Robbins, convicted of murdering a commanding officer, is determined to escape the island in order to reveal the truth behind his murderous actions and clear his name.','/jRwMdEb5bxwVARU2VmOADTflLfZ.jpg','1994-04-29',118,'Released','No guards. No walls.','No Escape',10447,5.0404,6.2,'J_1OWBKKSbw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12455,_binary '\0','/sY5U9A21r93qT7hbEDLFWMEM4b0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110684',7.3,24963,'en','Nobody\'s Fool','A rascally man nearing retirement juggles a workers\' compensation suit while secretly working for his nemesis and flirting with his nemesis\' young wife. As his estranged son returns, he faces new family responsibilities, while a banker plots to evict him from his home.','/xyAXFy6mOfgZcVWbceCeuTYadeq.jpg','1994-12-23',110,'Released','In a town where nothing ever happens... everything is about to happen to Sully.','Nobody\'s Fool',11593,4.2872,6.9,'Zh4nKGloiHk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12456,_binary '\0','/ddtoVAha6yUyuMdHUWMzn5o5njX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110687',4.6,15798,'en','North','Eleven-year-old North has had it with his parents. They are always busy with their careers and don\'t give North the attention he needs, so he files a lawsuit against them. The judge rules that North should either find new parents or return to his own parents within two months. Thus North starts off on a journey around the world to find parents that really care about him.','/e4JEG7dstmurXMUPOW9Jy6UDR9F.jpg','1994-07-22',87,'Released','Ever wonder what your life would be like with different parents? A boy named North did.','North',31586,5.093,5.1,'zInygRFVbxA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12457,_binary '\0','/pTlT8oJnNiJUlgwxijhJMdACC7i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110689',5.8,3352,'en','Nostradamus','A dramatic retelling of the life of Michel de Nostredame, from his early work as a plague doctor to his time at the court of Catherine de Medici, after he became famed for his prophetic almanacs. Stars Rutger Hauer and Julia Ormond.','/kbjPR7FoKUUv4uR4dwzO7ce4aTx.jpg','1994-08-18',119,'Released','His story is still unfinished five centuries later.','Nostradamus',48485,1.5643,5.8,'YPYY5u45VB8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12458,_binary '\0','/mJl9NAhghkzEOkN4HRP0cI7jEns.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110706',4.8,1913,'en','Oblivion','On another planet which resembles the Old West, a die-hard pacifist is forced to re-examine his ways after an evil alien bandit and his gang murder his estranged sheriff father, take over his home town, and threaten his friends.','/yh1I8pMrXMnjb98gGECfykwu8xX.jpg','1994-04-01',94,'Released','It\'s High Noon at the End of the Universe.','Oblivion',49050,1.6879,4.896,'5buqVnYiswA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12459,_binary '\0','/uibu04sFSZ2FCbEZRTVV8qYPIwY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110712',4.9,2664,'en','Of Love and Shadows','Irene is a magazine editor living under the shadow of the Pinochet dictatorship in Chile. Francisco is a handsome photographer and he comes to Irene for a job. As a sympathizer with the underground resistance movement, Francisco opens her eyes and her heart to the atrocities being committed by the state.','/aJuOamSPeB3GBJXhLnwPCcietyG.jpg','1994-05-10',103,'Released','Surrounded by danger, they\'ll risk everything for freedom!','Of Love and Shadows',90148,3.8518,5.4,'0uijz9WWE3Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12460,_binary '\0','/4pfl8PtnNDisipYagVT13hQ1VDt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110719',7.3,1804,'ru','Окно в Париж','Nikolai (played by Sergei Dontsov) has been fired from his job as a music teacher and has to live in the gym until he finds a place to stay. Finally, he gets a communal room in the apartment of Gorokhov (Victor Mikhalkov). The room\'s previous inhabitant, an old lady, has died a year ago, and yet her cat, Maxi, is still in the locked room, healthy and fat. Soon, Nikolai and his neighbours discover the mystery: there is a window to Paris in the room. That\'s when the comedy begins - will the Russians be able to cope with the temptation to profit from the discovery?','/o8WmmNqcX3MLGdXYsBBs0QxBmxo.jpg','1993-10-01',112,'Released',NULL,'Window to Paris',41043,0.9478,6.329,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12461,_binary '\0','/6bXAJ2pMeFaIs6YuajYlAgBf8m8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110722',6.5,3867,'en','Oleanna','Carol, a college student, comes to John\'s office, her professor, to discuss the grade she has received for one of her papers.','/8WqNryGHUxtVqvQK7JZYy2jnpxA.jpg','1994-11-04',87,'Released','Whatever side you take, you\'re wrong.','Oleanna',33633,1.4784,6.2,'rmzD1a8AVoU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12462,_binary '\0','/ttCHDsVpepLV1PoRYSePPcXrtYH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110725',4.6,27180,'en','On Deadly Ground','Forrest Taft is an environmental agent who works for the Aegis Oil Company in Alaska. Aegis Oil\'s corrupt CEO is the kind of person who doesn\'t care whether or not oil spills into the ocean or onto the land—just as long as it\'s making money for him.','/8jnO8EByAsfupWj9RjQxYAO4AUH.jpg','1994-02-18',101,'Released','His battle to save the Alaskan wilderness and protect its people can only be won On Deadly Ground.','On Deadly Ground',9624,4.7597,5.193,'E4DJz_lvSvI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12463,_binary '\0','/ninIdXC6iCDKuQRKFJw7nY4uRY2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110729',7.9,39718,'en','Once Were Warriors','In a violent relationship, it takes a mother’s strength to save herself and her children from the man she loved. Once Were Warriors is a violent love story set against a contemporary urban backdrop.','/kRNANrGG50AaU2TwN0kg7tkYqlQ.jpg','1994-09-02',99,'Released','Their People Once Were Warriors. But Once... Was a Long Time Ago','Once Were Warriors',527,3.9576,7.4,'N0-Q3ChKcfE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12464,_binary '\0','/8uAwA3xnpMyP6etx3JIjFouA4Cl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110737',6.5,30374,'en','Only You','Two childhood paranormal incidents have convinced schoolteacher Faith Corvatch that her true love is a guy named \'Damon Bradley\', but she has yet to meet him. Preparing to marry podiatrist Dwayne in ten days, Faith receives a phone call from Dwayne\'s old classmate Damon Bradley, who is on his way to Venice. She impulsively decides to fly to Italy with the hope of finally encountering the man of her dreams. Accompanying her on the trip is her sister-in-law and best friend Kate, who has just left her husband, Faith\'s brother Larry.','/7mLLANXgUg3bibTiUitDlB0NZcU.jpg','1994-03-04',109,'Released','A love story written in the stars.','Only You',9058,5.6553,6.7,'zLrqyfkXt_A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12465,_binary '\0','/4CxQXuitlZFNndvis2uv2YUzAQ7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110759',6.6,15537,'en','PCU','Nervous high school senior Tom Lawrence visits Port Chester University, where he gets a taste of politically correct college life when he\'s guided by fraternity wild man Droz and his housemates at The Pit. But Droz and his pals have rivals in nasty preppy Rand McPherson and the school\'s steely president. With their house threatened with expulsion, Droz and company decide to throw a raging party where the various factions will collide.','/xTToUzy9Im9nu2W8fz7TPWoDWN5.jpg','1994-04-29',81,'Released','Flunk \'em if they can\'t take a joke.','PCU',14425,2.839,6.1,'aIpuS8vTBts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12466,_binary '\0','/60XduQspYjRnvKQszuBtQwhzCDc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110763',6.2,28251,'en','The Pagemaster','Rich knows a lot about accidents. So much so, he is scared to do anything that might endanger him, like riding his bike, or climbing into his treehouse. While in an old library, he is mystically transported into the unknown world of books, and he has to try and get home again.','/iIWUuCjN8VND7BDugvf45LveA6p.jpg','1994-11-23',75,'Released','All the adventure your imagination can hold.','The Pagemaster',15139,7.3142,6.403,'ZFDV5lsFOpk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12467,_binary '\0','/r306ZI0LYIc7ilX1aRNZ08uDg8M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110770',5.2,1602,'en','The Paperboy','A homicidal twelve-year-old paperboy becomes obsessed with a woman and her daughter next-door, and he\'ll do anything to make his fantasy of the \"perfect family\" come alive.','/xklwDWqhvcBTNy1gg6g1kN6WFOV.jpg','1994-11-16',94,'Released','Something terrifying just arrived at your doorstep...','The Paperboy',63725,1.8639,4.633,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12468,_binary '\0','/nV6quaSNz9fY1AeIlvd631zG7vl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110771',6.7,17554,'en','The Paper','Henry Hackett, a workaholic tabloid editor, has to juggle personal issues, difficult coworkers, a tempting job offer, a looming deadline and a race to land an exclusive on a recent high-profile murder case, all during one hectic workday.','/pGPrFbucRLwVtCKCeinwAklAl0l.jpg','1994-03-18',112,'Released','A behind-the-lines look at work, marriage and other forms of combat.','The Paper',12280,5.4954,6.6,'8kXXBY_qtcI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12469,_binary '\0','/7lVCox6KxHTH0eDewQKQTWQjnoR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110776',6.3,1291,'fr','Le Parfum d\'Yvonne','It is the summer of 1958 in wealthy Lake Geneva, where an enigmatic young Frenchman begins an affair with a beautiful starlet under the watchful eye of her flamboyant elderly mentor. But in a season full of secrets, is truth the most elusive passion of all?','/pfqsYEAi0W84DwevkGBDgK5gBgT.jpg','1994-03-24',86,'Released','A romance set in the summer of 1958.','The Perfume of Yvonne',64724,1.9145,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12470,_binary '\0','/5xnuiKsFpK8rzAr986xe7Luvym.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110785',5.3,1318,'es','La pasión turca','A young woman’s passion forms the basis of this erotic Spanish drama adapted from a popular novel by Antonio Gala. The night before Desideria’s marriage, her girl friends give her some valuable advice on sex. The marriage takes place, and while it is generally happy, her husband Ramiro suffers from sexual dysfunction and Desideria is frustrated. The two end up on holiday in Istanbul with two friends. Desideria falls madly in love with the sensual ambiance of the ancient, teeming city. She begins a passionate affair with a handsome Turkish guide, Yaman. Upon her return home, she learns that she is pregnant. Ramiro agrees to support the child, but unfortunately it dies in infancy and the grieving Desideria flees for Istanbul to find her lover. She finds him and they renew their torrid affair. Later she learns some distressing things about Yaman, but this does not stop her from becoming his sexual slave and a call girl for wealthy carpet sellers.','/fLMjCgzkS4GejHopJNpYpbOwNSw.jpg','1994-11-18',112,'Released',NULL,'Turkish Passion',60985,1.8258,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12471,_binary '\0','/4KnxgZR4tEsW8043aoGLQ9Xw8Kf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110796',7.2,1759,'fr','Les Patriotes','Ariel, a young French Jew, decides to leave his family to go to Israel and secretly become an agent of Mossad, the Israeli secret service. After years of training, his first mission is in Paris to steal secrets from Remy Prieur, a French atomic scientist.','/yf7SAbaJQ1zA4MDRKQEgzRSbm86.jpg','1994-05-18',142,'Released','Manipulation is our business','The Patriots',16242,1.746,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12472,_binary '\0','/edY7dfMuQwxtTZnSdpeEGfdZS6r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110805',4.4,2172,'en','Pentathlon','When East German Eric Brogar wins a gold medal in the pentathlon, he escapes to freedom in the west with the help of a beautiful American athlete. But his demanding coach, Heinrich Mueller vows revenge and Eric\'s best friend and his father pay the ultimate price for his freedom when they are killed by the Secret Police. In Los Angeles, Eric starts to train for the gold again. But when Mueller comes to America, Eric must win the most deadly game of all… the fight for his life.','/kD5SvLTd1MSvuwPrshoIaGIDlgC.jpg','1994-06-04',101,'Released','Play to win. If you lose... you die.','Pentathlon',30526,1.7936,4.4,'GgGbwrZgOSM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12473,_binary '\0','/uLZ3NgKf2qLjSPyqNIEYYMABboB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110823',6,11731,'en','Phantasm III: Lord of the Dead','The Tall Man, that imposing menace from Morningside Mortuary, is back and once again haunting the thoughts of the now-adult Mike and his friend, ex-Ice Cream vendor Reggie. The two continue their hunt for the mysterious figure and in his path of destruction encounter a variety of dangerous situations, friends and enemies.','/uFv3H39YgyL568PTse5jGB6Ll8a.jpg','1994-05-06',91,'Released','If You Don\'t Get It This Time, He\'ll Have To Drill It Into Your Head!','Phantasm III: Lord of the Dead',16139,2.9106,5.795,'Th50t0STvIE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12474,_binary '\0','/9NBOuI2Zh2pv4M3NFWhmPIp7Gg3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110832',7.1,4417,'fi','Pidä huivista kiinni, Tatjana','Two Finnish men agree to drive an Estonian woman and a Russian woman to a harbor.','/AdYTwhIAx4SK14euoQxvcRRsjGw.jpg','1994-01-14',62,'Released',NULL,'Take Care of Your Scarf, Tatjana',58416,1.5257,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12475,_binary '\0','/9TbU5QntB0JCierykScSz0MWdG0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110852',6.9,4386,'cn','破壞之王','Ho Kam-An is a lovestruck dim sum delivery boy who falls for a beautiful judo student. After being humiliated by her boyfriend, Ho Kam-An seeks the services of an aging master who teaches him a half-assed style of kung fu, \"Karate Kid\"-style.','/9OVkDveP5OrgAoV4fwWy7zoMLr5.jpg','1994-02-04',97,'Released',NULL,'Love on Delivery',53163,3.2574,7,'BjA_YJe_2MQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12476,_binary '\0','/rF060JFEDVmBUe2BRvUKQXe2O02.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110857',3.5,38449,'en','Police Academy: Mission to Moscow','The Russians seek help in dealing with the Mafia from the veterans of the Police Academy. They head off to Moscow, in order to find evidence against Konstantin Konali, who marketed a computer game that everyone in the world is playing.','/3517XQ9LpoEykyYq2TuDNS45MPP.jpg','1994-06-09',83,'Released','Just when we thought the Cold War was over, leave it to these guys to heat it up again.','Police Academy: Mission to Moscow',11546,7.2505,4.593,'DPjBOnC7z1s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12477,_binary '\0','/rkq1Za40eZM4oM9kkpadrYaOnLl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110860',5.8,1273,'sv','Polismördaren','A woman is found murdered in a closed amusement park. A young couple who happen to be there at the same time become, without their knowledge, suspects for the murder. They are chased by a large number of police but only Martin Beck believes them to be innocent.','/f36XJmEy1h2Q3BgI2Ft1FSOZiuJ.jpg','1994-01-01',97,'Released',NULL,'Cop Killer',34644,2.1234,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12478,_binary '\0','/32pvxFiXNo2TdNpBiuHN8k2Mr4K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110877',7.8,41944,'it','Il postino','Simple Italian postman learns to love poetry while delivering mail to a famous poet; he uses this to woo local beauty Beatrice.','/cUaCpjVDefYShKyLmkcDsiPaBHn.jpg','1994-09-22',114,'Released','Dreams do come true.','The Postman',11010,5.4011,7.9,'0or7hSz-7gc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12479,_binary '\0','/gUNK128qFaejz31jaQzkRmlcox9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110882',7.8,16821,'mk','Пред дождот','The circularity of violence seen in a story that circles on itself. In Macedonia, during the war in Bosnia, Christians hunt an ethnic Albanian girl who may have murdered one of their own. A young monk who\'s taken a vow of silence offers her protection. In London, a photographic editor who\'s pregnant needs to talk it out with her estranged husband and chooses a toney restaurant.','/e8DEVsL3tm0llRESDJfkRRktino.jpg','1994-06-09',113,'Released','Time Never Dies, the Circle is Not Round.','Before the Rain',19155,2.843,7.4,'wHBQ4VsQaic','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12480,_binary '\0','/7kxUMxyE3uTVRUEOmnxsmyEQp64.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110889',7.1,11856,'en','Priest','The deeply held religious convictions of an idealistic young priest are challenged when he must face extraordinary events within his own congregation.','/yCZ2eGJb78HzaYthNwVF8R0G6BG.jpg','1995-03-17',98,'Released','In a world of rituals, in a place of secrets, a man must choose between keeping the faith and exposing the truth.','Priest',40156,2.9108,6.3,'mxlZ8hB5Q40','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12481,_binary '\0','/5zmdjwzuhE0aredp8KwNV6xFDWp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110891',5.4,2715,'en','Prince of Jutland','A Danish prince seeks revenge upon the villain who killed the king and his son to usurp the throne.','/qG90bxBkwfiqqSdmsWZWEjAvS2F.jpg','1994-02-23',107,'Released','His quest for vengeance... may cost him everything.','Prince of Jutland',48791,2.182,5.4,'LPOzoFKyR-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12482,_binary '\0','/4YfMzsgqWIGVQoVKPzqAReWVEqz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110892',6,3254,'en','Princess Caraboo','Bristol, England, early 19th century. A beautiful young stranger who speaks a weird language is tried for the crime of begging. But when a man claims that he can translate her dialect, it is understood that the woman is a princess from a far away land. She is then welcomed by a family of haughty aristocrats that only wants to heighten their prestige. However, the local reporter is not at all convinced she is what she claims to be and investigates. Is Caraboo really a princess?','/a3Fw33tSGdO2eV8SULQigOITzH4.jpg','1994-09-16',97,'Released','She was everything they dreamed of... And nothing they expected.','Princess Caraboo',37345,3.3582,5.5,'iXBGg5sDRyQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12483,_binary '\0','/1hCwhL4zmMDJI8YAe9XYrN2kDAJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110907',5.2,16787,'en','Prêt-à-Porter','During Paris Fashion Week, models, designers and industry hot shots gather to work, mingle, argue and try to seduce one another.','/bb8pq3ap09S4KHsOvflXqoNJdWZ.jpg','1994-12-23',133,'Released','Sex. Greed. Murder. Some things never go out of style.','Prêt-à-Porter',3586,5.222,5.2,'ENrpGFroUbw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12484,_binary '\0','/jFCVrUkoLyaDQYUKV5cnObQP78p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110908',6.7,2938,'pl','Psy 2. Ostatnia krew','Franz Maurer, a compromised cop, former officer of the criminal department of the Warsaw\'s police, is released from prison where he was doing time for his brutality and murders. He is awaited by Nowy, a former police colleague. Franz tries to go straight starting hard work in a steel mill. Nevertheless, he must leave the factory as a criminal with an uncertain past when he doesn\'t join the strike organized by the workers\' union. At the same time, a merciless war continues in former Yugoslavia. Wolf and William, two high rank officers, come to Poland in order to organize a network selling and smuggling arms to Yugoslavia by way of Albania.','/ezphEFk3mcuvHd8vgvifLQh7OKC.jpg','1994-04-05',100,'Released',NULL,'Pigs 2: The Last Blood',24769,1.4726,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12485,_binary '\0','/suaEOtk1N1sgg2MTM7oZd2cfVp3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110912',8.8,2467101,'en','Pulp Fiction','A burger-loving hit man, his philosophical partner, a drug-addled gangster\'s moll and a washed-up boxer converge in this sprawling, comedic crime caper. Their adventures unfurl in three stories that ingeniously trip back and forth in time.','/vQWk5YBFWF4bZaofAbv0tShwBvQ.jpg','1994-09-10',154,'Released','You won’t know the facts until you’ve seen the fiction.','Pulp Fiction',680,49.8321,8.48,'tGpTpVyI_OQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12486,_binary '\0','/cond2jUrMNHN35JOVk7NBJZs0Do.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110913',4.7,6140,'en','Pumpkinhead II: Blood Wings','When five teenagers unwittingly resurrect Pumpkinhead, nobody is safe! But this monster is different – inside its demonic form dwells the soul of a boy murdered years ago. Can the evil creature be killed without destroying the child trapped within?','/fZIoluMNFq1KfMc4gJH0LLXxueq.jpg','1995-10-20',88,'Released','They couldn\'t leave dead enough alone.','Pumpkinhead II: Blood Wings',35977,3.1366,5.595,'n5J3N-S3ux8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12487,_binary '\0','/88FnsK3iF9rWdR36N3anp1oYVYJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110917',7.5,13767,'it','Una pura formalità','Famous writer Onoff is now a recluse. The Inspector is suspicious when Onoff is brought into the station one night, disoriented and suffering a kind of amnesia. In an isolated, rural police station, the Inspector tries to establish the events surrounding a killing, to reach a startling resolution.','/bAd56dYln4cgoJBa1r60cb9S5xR.jpg','1994-05-15',111,'Released',NULL,'A Pure Formality',19223,2.5773,7.415,'pB4GTan0y64','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12488,_binary '\0','/A50sHt5LYb0Ygw7Tm8njPph0ct1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110922',7.2,3570,'fr','Le Péril jeune','Ten years after their Upper Sixth, Bruno, Momo, Leon and Alain meet together in the waiting room of a maternity hospital. The father of the awaited baby is Tomasi, their best friend at that time, who died one month before due to an overdose. They remember their teenage, their laughs, their dreams, their stupid pranks... a description of the French youth in the middle of the seventies.','/encyBuX8ZdO2qijlROGAJPqsT0S.jpg','1995-01-11',101,'Released',NULL,'Good Old Daze',33095,1.4197,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12489,_binary '\0','/R5yzaNz6IE2107lcmnzBSerCBP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110932',7.5,78427,'en','Quiz Show','Herbert Stempel\'s transformation into an unexpected television personality unfolds as he secures victory on the cherished American game show, \'Twenty-One.\' However, when the show introduces the highly skilled contestant Charles Van Doren to replace Stempel, it compels Stempel to let out his frustrations and call out the show as rigged. Lawyer Richard Goodwin steps in and attempts to uncover the orchestrated deception behind the scenes.','/yoGJo1h3Hl2exXPVcG9UXWDENtX.jpg','1994-08-25',133,'Released','Fifty million people watched, but no one saw a thing.','Quiz Show',11450,6.8846,7.2,'bj-m3Ddmn0E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12490,_binary '\0','/6TqfA0WFh9t5lhxPg9rwAswM9Yv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110939',6.2,4170,'en','Radioland Murders','A series of mysterious crimes threatens the existence of a new radio network.','/l9pvl3AH4UsUvLn4yUP0RR4pltx.jpg','1994-10-21',108,'Released','At station WBN, the hits just keep on coming.','Radioland Murders',22588,2.9021,5.8,'ftyAK30wfBk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12491,_binary '\0','/efao3Gy42NL38LhUkZ7cFKz56WE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110942',6.4,3664,'hi','Raja Babu','Raja Babu is a rich, spoiled, country bumpkin who lives a carefree, luxury lifestyle until the girl he loves rejects him and his parents reveal that he was adopted.','/56dEONvFlidzOxZy9c8pOOWDPmQ.jpg','1994-01-10',161,'Released',NULL,'Raja Babu',211819,1.3092,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12492,_binary '\0','/dxP6c1ZaCGlIsoKyN66gJdN2bCc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110944',6.4,5775,'en','Rapa Nui','Inter-tribal rivalry leads to a competition to erect a huge Maoi statue in record time before Make can take part in the race to retrieve the egg of a Sooty Tern. The reward for winning this race is to rule the island for one year.','/7SGV2gjYWKQezXOLGdbzPuaYxo2.jpg','1994-06-03',107,'Released',NULL,'Rapa Nui',10448,2.3213,6.4,'4d_oapAqo6k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12493,_binary '\0','/pxEIEtpWUbinLs4pfsoRfTtHa15.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110948',4.2,1663,'en','Raw Justice','The mayor of a small town hires a bounty hunter to find his daughter\'s killer, but it turns out to be a very dangerous job.','/tijFjcSlOMuvb07NKEgnYi7JOL9.jpg','1994-08-17',95,'Released','Kill... or be killed.','Raw Justice',34750,2.2814,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12494,_binary '\0','/wPW1cMe2XyeLnm2DNDudoDXVSwt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110950',6.6,58172,'en','Reality Bites','A small circle of friends suffering from post-collegiate blues must confront the hard truth about life, love and the pursuit of gainful employment. As they struggle to map out survival guides for the future, the Gen-X quartet soon begins to realize that reality isn\'t all it\'s cracked up to be.','/qGDhodtpkpxkrFqokenGNJlzt6w.jpg','1994-02-18',98,'Released','A comedy about love in the \'90s','Reality Bites',2788,5.8652,6.5,'xDYGo0UgIVM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12495,_binary '\0','/jRFC2W21pWAwKUqbEmvG5mVbcle.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110955',6.9,28828,'en','The Ref','A cat burglar is forced to take a bickering, dysfunctional family hostage on Christmas Eve.','/ym7Kx3iDmalK8kXKvVQwnFYABEV.jpg','1994-03-09',97,'Released','They might be his hostages but what they\'re doing to this guy is criminal.','The Ref',10872,4.4519,6.6,'_26ROmuSyTQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12496,_binary '\0','/bvlYk1rxwkZopZAYdlqOhiKXAPu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110958',6.5,1492,'fr','Regarde les hommes tomber','A middle-aged sales rep drops everything to track down the killers of his cop friend. Two years earlier, an older gambler forms an intense bond with a naive young man, who changes his name to please him.','/s4kAQLqnHxPmS5GrKRxIsEUfDaf.jpg','1994-08-31',90,'Released',NULL,'See How They Fall',64347,1.9901,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12497,_binary '\0','/h0lGYUOxXKCM1W7cgvHN1UW1TC4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110963',7.4,20542,'fr','La Reine Margot','Paris, Kingdom of France, August 18, 1572. To avoid the outbreak of a religious war, the Catholic princess Marguerite de Valois, sister of the feeble King Charles IX, marries the Huguenot King Henry III of Navarre.','/8uGkhBLiJMIkwohGPo3iB9AuwDg.jpg','1994-05-13',138,'Released','She was the wife of a king… and the lover of a soldier.','Queen Margot',10452,5.3571,7.2,'HIBfX5D1Um4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12498,_binary '\0','/bNZ4G2h9EABULTThr7lEx9ODzoj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110971',6.2,20511,'en','Renaissance Man','An advertising man is slowly sliding downhill. When he is fired from his job in Detroit, he signs up for unemployment. One day they find him a job: teaching thinking skills to Army recruits. He arrives on base to find that there is no structure set up for the class.','/iPRtaSfN8gNWFclgrcg5oD3V41i.jpg','1994-06-03',128,'Released','One man\'s mission to teach the few, the proud... The impossible!','Renaissance Man',11858,5.5691,6.125,'HU7DpT-s2VA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12499,_binary '\0','/eZvVoJc3XrAE81bmNhtyTUDti8b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110978',3.4,29174,'en','The Return of the Texas Chainsaw Massacre','A group of teenagers get into a car crash in the Texas woods on prom night, and then wander into an old farmhouse that is home to Leatherface and his insane family of cannibalistic psychopaths.','/e1ikqofvLBddrZJ73IjmJWhUYus.jpg','1995-09-22',95,'Released','If looks could kill, he wouldn\'t need a chainsaw.','The Return of the Texas Chainsaw Massacre',16780,6.7221,4.572,'jmyDMs3ec5w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12500,_binary '\0','/rTVfhtlWJ90YkJ84nCgYa6Qpe1z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110982',3.8,4093,'en','Revenge of the Nerds IV: Nerds in Love','Lewis and his nerdy friends attend Booger\'s wedding to the daughter of a rich politician, but nerd-haters in the family do everything possible to prevent the wedding going ahead. Meanwhile, Lewis awaits with eagerness the birth of his unborn foetal child...','/9JLkd95T4E7lNWsrQt8a3YZYgPi.jpg','1994-05-09',92,'Released','Birds do it. Bees do it. Tonight see what happens when Nerds do it...','Revenge of the Nerds IV: Nerds in Love',21029,3.339,4.6,'j2GdoQeFQC8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12501,_binary '\0','/e3TJpdAJnuJkywVRvf4IevhSzM3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110989',5.5,80120,'en','Ri¢hie Ri¢h','Billionaire heir Richie Rich has it all, including Reggie Jackson as a batting coach and Claudia Schiffer as a personal trainer -- but no playmates. What\'s more, scoundrel Laurence Van Dough is scheming to take over the family empire. Uh-oh! Enter faithful butler Cadbury to save the day.','/qgGh5d0IHAZRlHIdFS3XWVygumR.jpg','1994-12-19',94,'Released','Five buddies, one butler, and a dog on an adventure so big... even the world\'s richest kid can\'t afford to miss it.','Ri¢hie Ri¢h',11011,9.2645,5.954,'Yddr5thpDTE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12502,_binary '\0','/8KcvxZCwkahVDphIzRENl7rZECy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110997',6.5,54190,'en','The River Wild','Gail and Tom Hartman are struggling to stay together and decide to take a white-water rafting holiday adventure in Montana for their son Roarke\'s 10th birthday, only to meet up with a pair of mysterious men whose desperation grows, turning their vacation into a nightmare.','/wVgQ2T63ThjIsY4R0qoHXjyllql.jpg','1994-09-30',111,'Released','The vacation is over.','The River Wild',8987,6.5436,6.461,'WbGD81wUgC0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12503,_binary '\0','/tErSuaPqo3XU5CWPSmORKwxRtwY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110998',6.5,3176,'en','River of Grass','Cozy, a dissatisfied housewife, meets Lee at a bar. A drink turns into a home break-in, and a gunshot sends them on the run together, thinking they\'ve committed murder.','/i2s1L8AavAfKIcKf3ONhF3no405.jpg','1995-08-04',76,'Released','A girl, a gun, and nowhere to go.','River of Grass',98514,1.3071,6.2,'K9QrvLd2pbY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12504,_binary '\0','/72OAIhqf1sFd5t83a4pRYr0y0nn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0110999',5.1,1881,'en','The Road Killers','After a young boy is almost runover by a maniac on a highway, a re-encounter and confrontation by the boy\'s father with the driver sets off conflicts with a car full of maniacs.','/yiAzM6NSQEOmsrI1kVXkaIqWgkz.jpg','1994-05-07',89,'Released','The highway to hell','The Road Killers',106968,2.8772,5.6,'vBb8Sn6toC0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12505,_binary '\0','/ykiw5tftmlCsAXa8dMFA3rDbMKR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111001',5.9,14138,'en','The Road to Wellville','An unhappy young couple visit the infamous Kellogg spa in Battle Creek, Michigan while a young hustler tries get into the breakfast-cereal business and compete against John Kellogg\'s corn flakes.','/zh7OVdFMpqpZ027z9RgVIwzxYjZ.jpg','1994-10-28',118,'Released','A comedy of the heart and other organs.','The Road to Wellville',10467,4.4344,5.6,'DX5eHMZuuro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12506,_binary '\0','/pEpm3o5GM1YU48VrczRP8pdWNAG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111003',5.9,10553,'en','The Puppet Masters','The Midwest USA is invaded by stingray-shaped alien slugs that ride on people\'s backs and control their minds in order to spread their dominion. Government agency reps Sam Givens, Andrew Nivens, and Mary Sefton must stop the aliens.','/8xJGom6fUqmVhJ7EWprZEHygUis.jpg','1994-10-21',109,'Released','Trust No One','The Puppet Masters',25557,3.6312,5.769,'rU6ghNfsQSI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12507,_binary '\0','/9MbN03RE7vEn1trsdFaBdisFXPo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111019',7.2,7345,'fr','Les Roseaux sauvages','As the Algerian War draws to a close, a teenager with a girlfriend starts feeling homosexual urges for two of his classmates: a country boy, and a French-Algerian intellectual.','/yTBEcAsD8OoIs8thYXl7FZuUXN3.jpg','1994-06-01',115,'Released',NULL,'Wild Reeds',26933,2.1967,7,'L3On9Zj0Xnw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12508,_binary '\0','/fT4eXXGflcGhqCm4ie62DXtj0rF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111021',6.3,2931,'en','Roswell','Based on the book \"UFO Crash at Roswell\" by Kevin Randle and Donald Schmitt, Roswell follows the attempts of Major Jesse Marcel to discover the truth about strange debris found on a local rancher\'s field in July of 1947. Told by his superiors that what he has found is nothing more than a downed weather balloon, Marcel maintains his military duty until the weight of the truth, however out of this world it may be, forces him to piece together what really occurred.','/kU1WrVsRYG8d6qyMhEsRk5dvT5z.jpg','1994-07-31',91,'Released','The Pentagon denied it was a UFO. But one man knew better, because he was there.','Roswell',43275,2.3532,6.1,'emVT47BnPMk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12509,_binary '\0','/92zgF1BYoNUvrup4uoC4JkRjFr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111048',5.8,5682,'en','S.F.W.','An alienated and misanthropic teenager gains sudden and unwanted celebrity status after he\'s taken hostage by terrorists where his indifference to their threats to kill him makes news headlines.','/3bq91jWCReRrqlPn81alSoxeXoP.jpg','1995-01-20',96,'Released','Fate made them hostages. The media made them stars.','S.F.W.',29444,1.9008,5.9,'CLQ_dlkA6sU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12510,_binary '\0','/nMfMIsthmlTXIfAZ2osKafMRWJF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111049',3.7,1826,'it','S.P.Q.R. 2000 e 1/2 anni fa','In 71 BC in Rome, utter disorder reigns in the form of political corruption and bribery involving the senator Cynic (Leslie Nielsen). The situation is claimed to be similar to the “Tangentopoli” situation in Italy in the 1990s: one of the politicians involved was Bettino Craxi.','/tzRo3DbGDtCMEmi5ZOzlCSZThoL.jpg','1994-12-15',95,'Released',NULL,'S.P.Q.R.: 2,000 and a Half Years Ago',11334,1.7046,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12511,_binary '\0','/7cqj9BaaaZ3C7WGq7rzeKct2RKc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111054',6.3,1432,'en','Safe Passage','Recently estranged from her husband, and mother of seven sons, Mag Singer stands poised to pursue a whole new way of life. But when one of her children is involved in an explosion while on duty in the Middle East, Mag must rexamine everything she cherishes.','/b0pcExU3UvqUoaRiYwrVEAYC2iL.jpg','1994-12-01',98,'Released','Life\'s best journeys take you home.','Safe Passage',49803,1.6499,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12512,_binary '\0','/bTMp3YqzCV88EQBYdW6QwjYvumk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111055',7.3,1253,'ar','صمت القصور','The death of a prince brings a young woman back to the palace where she was born into servitude. The lingering legacy is brought into light from behind frosted windows and velvet curtains.','/c8QQRaI3k3LNUqYKmlKldhLpgYK.jpg','1994-09-30',124,'Released',NULL,'The Silences of the Palace',44284,1.021,6.8,'2Vmtb6B6nTs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12513,_binary '\0','/wgOginYyu6YVx09HAPJbOtxFAut.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111068',6.7,6192,'hi','संघर्ष','A rookie CBI officer must enlist the help of an incarcerated criminal in order to catch a serial child killer, who has recently escaped police custody.','/qGip4Xr3j9wHhIj1HFFgvVNULpC.jpg','1999-09-03',127,'Released',NULL,'Sangharsh',166012,1.4567,5.067,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12514,_binary '\0','/p89QeYRc2u0rX0eKKU4TLJStwHO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111070',6.6,148579,'en','The Santa Clause','On Christmas Eve, divorced dad Scott Calvin and his son discover Santa Claus has fallen off their roof. When Scott takes the reins of the magical sleigh, he finds he is now the new Santa, and must convince a world of disbelievers, including himself.','/hvV2rI60qOYELT7tHHLpxtafnBZ.jpg','1994-11-11',97,'Released','This Christmas, the snow hits the fan.','The Santa Clause',11395,9.4498,6.529,'Bx8FX7etF_8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12515,_binary '\0','/6no5Sp7AkzKhaxBS4bycvGgMGdn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111081',6.3,3794,'en','Saved By the Bell: Wedding in Las Vegas','In this conclusion of the long running series it finally happens: Kelly and Zack will marry. Zack\'s parents are against the early commitment and Kelly\'s parents can\'t afford it, so only the gang travels to Las Vegas for the wedding. However, before the wedding can happen, they have to live through many adventures, including Zack losing his hard earned money, Kelly becoming jealous and Slater being chased by mobsters.','/i7u6rh2HcfdtHp6QopXk8cDPPMQ.jpg','1994-10-07',90,'Released',NULL,'Saved By the Bell: Wedding in Las Vegas',37020,2.1541,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12516,_binary '\0','/3Q2blD8pBoZeK0kB6Ea9cAzNNXJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111093',5.2,2695,'en','Scorned','A vengeful widow worms her way into the home of the man she holds responsible for her husband\'s suicide.','/latrrZjz5kwVz3Am3ajLaCrJ1LW.jpg','1993-07-14',100,'Released','Hell Hath No Fury Like A Woman...','Scorned',64084,9.5119,5.3,'QA7ZlnQn3qM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12517,_binary '\0','/vfign3pdE9qeQoFChMA3rOKHO7r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111094',5.5,7469,'en','The Scout','When his star recruit botches a Major League Baseball debut, humiliated talent scout Al Percolo gets banished to rural Mexico, where he finds a potential gold mine in the arm of young phenom Steve Nebraska. Soon, the New York Yankees put a $55 million contract on the table—provided a psychiatrist can affirm Nebraska\'s mental stability.','/a5b1k4wmZShLu1Fo19SzcOJKRlD.jpg','1994-09-30',101,'Released','He was praying for a miracle. What he got was Steve Nebraska.','The Scout',35233,2.7699,5.238,'rX9q4A65jHg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12518,_binary '\0','/piMXOXK28gdrxoI2Mzul7eu6wcG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111102',6.8,2134,'en','Second Best','The difficult relationship between a british postal officer and his adoptive son.','/aKnqvAIYLUXm1Lnih0Oc024HbYV.jpg','1994-09-30',105,'Released','A man who dreams of being a father. A boy disillusioned with life. Together they share a compelling story of friendship, trust, and hope.','Second Best',103413,2.4517,6.7,'tI3PqOgC0Q4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12519,_binary '\0','/4kdjUgayHYUgsQlr2TsMzDHC2At.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111112',7.4,9536,'en','The Secret of Roan Inish','Ten-year-old Fiona is sent to live with her grandparents in a small fishing village in Donegal, Ireland. She soon learns the local legend that an ancestor of hers married a Selkie – a seal who can turn into a human. Years earlier, her baby brother was washed out to sea and never seen again, so when Fiona spies a naked little boy on the abandoned Isle of Roan Inish, she is compelled to investigate.','/2FFcEEMMrnXh3CFz3aON92sLkXP.jpg','1994-05-14',103,'Released','Between land and sea there is a place where myths are real.','The Secret of Roan Inish',14334,2.7547,6.7,'fWoyGukz1ag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12520,_binary '\0','/yaHSrHQ82mCeJRvXX4H08cLsXYz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111127',6.9,38519,'en','Serial Mom','Beverly is the perfect happy homemaker, along with her doting husband and two children, but this nuclear family just might explode when her fascination with serial killers collides with her ever-so-proper code of ethics.','/3Qlycp68b6TQkC1fMMahpf04Oq8.jpg','1994-04-13',94,'Released','Every mom wants to be wanted, but not for murder!','Serial Mom',11592,5.3232,6.7,'Ut9GvlhB9f4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12521,_binary '\0','/j3CMtQbRS4bBAuRuoTBpnPAaHSj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111143',6.1,29465,'en','The Shadow','Based on the 1930s comic strip, The Shadow is put up against his archenemy Shiwan Khan, who plans to take over the world by holding a city to ransom using an atom bomb. Using his powers of invisibility and \"the power to cloud men\'s minds\", The Shadow comes blazing to the rescue with explosive results.','/xAbFJH3vQYZvUyzzGAtG4OLy492.jpg','1994-07-01',108,'Released','Who knows what evil lurks in the hearts of men?','The Shadow',8850,5.6533,6.072,'l0lbmUaooSw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12522,_binary '\0','/qPm2JWGq3LnoTmfbi8flzJRImbc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111149',7.2,71558,'en','Shallow Grave','When David, Juliet, and Alex find their new roommate dead with a large sum of money, they agree to hide the body and keep the cash. However, this newfound fortune gradually corrodes their friendship.','/gqvSKLbfIg1mja1ulVkVcLhdwWF.jpg','1994-12-22',93,'Released','What\'s a little murder among friends?','Shallow Grave',9905,7.1883,7,'xKrfUAho5as','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12523,_binary '\0','/pNjh59JSxChQktamG3LMp9ZoQzp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111161',9.3,3237918,'en','The Shawshank Redemption','Imprisoned in the 1940s for the double murder of his wife and her lover, upstanding banker Andy Dufresne begins a new life at the Shawshank prison, where he puts his accounting skills to work for an amoral warden. During his long stretch in prison, Dufresne comes to be admired by the other inmates -- including an older prisoner named Red -- for his integrity and unquenchable sense of hope.','/9cqNxx0GxF0bflZmeSMuL5tnGzr.jpg','1994-09-23',142,'Released','Fear can hold you prisoner. Hope can set you free.','The Shawshank Redemption',278,67.511,8.731,'PLl99DlL6b4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12524,_binary '\0','/zW3guydPMAnqEcia0PJGZnDuWJm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111173',5.5,3301,'en','Shopping','A dark, hip, urban story of a barren and anonymous city where the underclass\' sport of choice is ram-raiding. An exciting game in which stolen cars are driven through shop windows to aid large-scale looting before the police arrive. For Tommy, it\'s a business, but for Billy and Jo, it\'s a labour of love. As the competition between Tommy and Billy grows more fierce, the stakes become higher and the \"shopping\" trips increasingly risky.','/jiIQO8UWyvVkdJEujb6VWKUBzaz.jpg','1994-12-06',105,'Released','No one leaves without paying...','Shopping',45549,2.2227,5.4,'hjYtwGdK_48','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12525,_binary '\0','/nIm9SnoTVmhhnr79BtjIyaVtpgj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111174',5.3,1453,'en','Showdown','Ken has just moved from Kansas with his mother. He talks to a girl named Julie, not knowing that her boyfriend Tom is very possessive of her. Tom is learning karate from Lee, a sensei whose brother was killed by a rookie cop named Billy. Billy has since then become the janitor of the school that Ken, Julie and Tom go to. When Ken gets beaten up by Tom for talking to Julie again, Billy helps Ken by teaching him how to defend himself, which eventually leads to a battle between student vs. student, and sensei vs. sensei.','/xB7olw4jv804V1OjFJ8S0PwuqzF.jpg','1993-09-16',100,'Released','There is no other way.','Showdown',104751,2.0653,6.2,'Wgrd16X9Row','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12526,_binary '\0','/lfKPBQh9rL3dBOvWvE0OP7es1ti.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111175',5.1,1874,'en','Shrunken Heads','Three teens killed by a local crime boss return for revenge after a witch doctor revives them through voodoo magic.','/nlBcNDa71lDlkoDCWF8XZyYaTJQ.jpg','1994-05-01',86,'Released','They\'re superheroes from the heads... to their necks.','Shrunken Heads',79975,2.1561,4.671,'2ucILiZBHpo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12527,_binary '\0','/4XpTvJGz804zAcmiWpfovnEfYdF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111187',5.9,5295,'en','Silent Fall','Having seen the double murder of his parents, autistic youth Tim Warden is sent to therapy with controversial therapist Dr. Jake Rainer. Jake tries to probe the silent child about what he saw, but he gets more details about the Wardens\' household dynamics from Tim\'s teenage sister, Sylvie. As he spends more time with the siblings, Jake learns that the Wardens\' marriage was not as perfect as it seemed, and he uncovers other new details that might help solve the crime.','/nek7oeAURO3dr3AdKe4Yi3zPNTF.jpg','1994-10-28',101,'Released','A Savage Crime. A Silent Witness.','Silent Fall',39473,2.1396,5.3,'wZay5lGzWZg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12528,_binary '\0','/qjW4nssdUBPCoIxGHofSG3g3nfT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111190',4.7,6466,'it','Il silenzio dei prosciutti','Rookie FBI agent Jo Dee Foster has been assigned to work on the case of the Psycho Killer, a psycho killer who has psycho-killed over 120 people. But to learn more about his target, he\'s forced to meet Dr. Animal Cannibal Pizza, a famous doctor turned cannibal who ate pizzas with human body parts. Meanwhile, Jo\'s girlfriend, Jane Wine, has just stolen $400,000 in cash from her money-hungry boss, Mr. Laurel, so she and Jo can be happy, but gets lost in a horrible storm and stops at the Cemetery Motel, where the owner, Antonio Motel, is dominated by his insane mother.','/s4mxntM3FM7joVGz1LECSGfvYtm.jpg','1994-03-11',81,'Released','Stark, raving comedy.','The Silence of the Hams',10450,3.6876,4.84,'lErnYQKfzp0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12529,_binary '\0','/wE6Vw8eInRuscQE1MPCU2qnfmeE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111194',6.3,6699,'en','A Simple Twist of Fate','When Michael McCann is thrown over by the woman he loves, he becomes something of a misanthrope and a miser, spending all of his spare money on collectible gold coins. Living in the same town is an affluent family with two sons: John and Tanny. Tanny\'s a wild boy, whom John cannot control, and one night he breaks into McCann\'s house, and steals the gold and disappears, which nearly confirms McCann\'s distrust of mankind. But then, a mysterious young woman dies in the snow outside McCann\'s house, and her small daughter makes her way to McCann\'s house and into McCann\'s life and heart.','/2Jorj80Y4EVEAPDRVVdDXKSVUTw.jpg','1994-09-02',106,'Released','A twist of fate brought them something wonderful... Each other!','A Simple Twist of Fate',43535,3.4203,6.169,'e7bD5BNqfwY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12530,_binary '\0','/A0YCPfLrxv2xX0Hno9eFBEemYPL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111201',5.9,12415,'en','Sirens','In 1930s Australia, Anglican clergyman Anthony Campion and his prim wife, Estella, are asked to visit noted painter Norman Lindsay, whose planned contribution to an international art exhibit is considered blasphemous. While Campion and Lindsay debate, Estella finds herself drawn to the three beautiful models sitting for the painter\'s current work, freethinking Sheela, sensual Pru and virginal Giddy.','/bOUDHgOlxANs1KsYZEsLSjZBTkd.jpg','1994-03-04',98,'Released','Love, Lust, Art and Religion','Sirens',12519,4.637,5.608,'JTzat7vRdCQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12531,_binary '\0','/izRtKLwWGFElvpy5r3l6bsP10WD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111205',6.5,4069,'en','Sister My Sister','A true story of shocking violence catapults a picturesque little town into history. The close sibling relationship between the two maids takes on a new dimension as their overbearing employer discovers a sexual fever between the two sisters.','/g1SwimqDPN3pP3LOcKuBi14bKIH.jpg','1994-12-15',104,'Released',NULL,'Sister My Sister',44925,3.1507,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12532,_binary '\0','/4s3MuDSkXxnfYW5owEm7t0rv2Bz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111216',5.1,1246,'en','Slaughter of the Innocents','A seasoned FBI Agent\'s child-genius son assists him on catching a child-killer, a schizophrenic mohab nut who believes he\'s been chosen by god to be a new Noah.','/pUyIUwRsGaku48LpPWVNyylp9bh.jpg','1993-09-17',103,'Released','A brutal slaying. An elusive killer. The chase is on.','Slaughter of the Innocents',112969,2.322,5.5,'lrJLuFRFzEg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12533,_binary '\0','/izT4BtdpA4WhaHJ4po4Bn9250Ri.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111218',5.7,2985,'en','Sleep with Me','Six different writers wrote a scene each of this romantic comedy featuring the marriage and turbulent relationship of Joseph and Sarah, with Joseph\'s best friend Frank trying hard to cope with letting the love of his life marry his best friend.','/gDmoa5nCDpOnwyePTHTAND3GmFW.jpg','1994-09-23',86,'Released','An Unconventional Romance','Sleep with Me',19361,2.5088,5.7,'5MuX6XZ8r74','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12534,_binary '\0','/e3IPovVj7wiLoBVftaHz4oafWxQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111244',4.2,1454,'en','Sorceress','Two friends, who both work for the same high-priced, high-powered law firm, are both married to modern day witches. Erica, the wife of Larry, believes that he is being led astray by Carol, an old flame, who also works for the same law firm. Erica decides to act and one night after a torrid sex session Larry drifts off to sleep and begins to dream. Soon the dream turns into a nightmare of sex, violence, murder and death involving himself, his friends and colleagues from the law firm which appears to be frighteningly realistic...','/4yTPpffXf0WA33rgweZ1Y7PUe0L.jpg','1995-01-04',93,'Released','She gets what she wants. She keeps what she gets. She never lets go.','Sorceress',28529,2.3923,5.1,'DRg9DpCCaZo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12535,_binary '\0','/9b3NzHY4HccEkXcIUVBQ1yIaxex.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111252',6.3,7112,'en','Spanking the Monkey','Bright young student Raymond Aibelli is forced to sidetrack an important medical internship because his mother, Susan, is recovering from a broken leg. When he isn\'t tasked with the most mundane aspects of Susan\'s recuperation, Raymond finds distraction in a neighborhood girl, Toni Peck. But, as Susan begins relying on her son for both physical and emotional needs, Raymond starts developing disturbing and unwanted new yearnings.','/fuID31Ft8nWLcFRSQ7qZRlu49o7.jpg','1994-01-15',106,'Released','A gripping comedy about letting go.','Spanking the Monkey',17600,4.9935,5.7,'zCxlFPnsEU4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12536,_binary '\0','/fvBshQMwOnYZdUXySGMdT6LiqsI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111255',5.6,74248,'en','The Specialist','May Munro is a woman obsessed with getting revenge on the people who murdered her parents when she was still a girl. She hires Ray Quick, a retired explosives expert, to kill her parents\' killers. When Ned Trent, embittered ex-partner of Quick\'s, is assigned to protect one of Quick\'s potential victims, a deadly game of cat and mouse ensues.','/9CVAjtkSaFs9FyddGfThj11ZuQq.jpg','1994-10-07',110,'Released','The government taught him to kill. Now he\'s using his skills to help a woman seek revenge against the Miami underworld.','The Specialist',2636,8.956,6,'SS75LoRrmMg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12537,_binary '\0','/grmMkJ0ey2rQ1qPL1Cq57mHM0x3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111256',5.8,5671,'en','Speechless','In the midst of election season in New Mexico, political speechwriters Julia Mann and Kevin Vallick begin a romance, unaware they are working for candidates on opposite sides.','/bremBHwg2cAvFIGIRwlRtPMkgfL.jpg','1994-12-16',99,'Released','There are two sides to every love story. Don\'t believe either one of them.','Speechless',15128,2.8992,6,'TzDlsj1XzsY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12538,_binary '\0','/lywmuPU5Hr1Mnpb9UGeDbILmkTx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111257',7.3,427693,'en','Speed','Tensions run high when a crazed bomber rigs a Los Angeles bus with a device that will kill everyone on board if the vehicle\'s speed dips below fifty miles per hour.','/82PkCE4R95KhHICUDF7G4Ly2z3l.jpg','1994-06-09',116,'Released','Get ready for rush hour.','Speed',1637,17.3854,7.159,'3q_4xiR3VJQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12539,_binary '\0','/gEFftogowsMEZfPJ4N0QsnPgfWM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111271',6.1,1592,'en','Squanto: A Warrior\'s Tale','It\'s the 17th century, and Native American Squanto roams free in the New World until he\'s captured by visiting sailors who take him back to England. Monk Brother Daniel teaches him social customs, but other Englishmen aren\'t as kind. Squanto becomes the unwilling star of performances that highlight his fighting skills, but he eventually engineers a return trip to America. He finds that his home has changed forever, and he must chart a new path for his people.','/1OQAT40mMFrIBe9ExBqG93DX13Z.jpg','1994-10-28',102,'Released','In the quest for peace, he became a legend.','Squanto: A Warrior\'s Tale',65158,3.3229,6.8,'5SQ0RiVNQx8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12540,_binary '\0','/mNdsbVuRdsyo8eitW2IBW2BWRkU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111280',6.6,92102,'en','Star Trek: Generations','Captain Jean-Luc Picard and the crew of the Enterprise-D find themselves at odds with the renegade scientist Soran who is destroying entire star systems. Only one man can help Picard stop Soran\'s scheme...and he\'s been dead for seventy-eight years.','/gh0ZZRwSmlzEZTIZee3ZCN9Jssx.jpg','1994-11-18',118,'Released','Two captains. One destiny.','Star Trek: Generations',193,6.605,6.524,'MUieGh1fHSI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12541,_binary '\0','/s2bqHApZlliCuwgyHod0qucrYqZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111282',7,221542,'en','Stargate','An interstellar teleportation device, found in Egypt, leads to a planet with humans resembling ancient Egyptians who worship the god Ra.','/4T6Po0XnZlevmhfPh3ZfEs5butR.jpg','1994-10-28',121,'Released','It will take you a million light years from home. But will it bring you back?','Stargate',2164,13.8199,7.034,'c3sgzrgpn8s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12542,_binary '\0','/KOVhlUkmnfmKmwGENj0cHTYxi3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111292',5.5,1484,'sv','Stockholm Marathon','A gardener decides to exact revenge on the men he believes to be responsible for the death of his mentally disturbed wife.','/aIia6whM2IsyI7pnXKBTaixZOpJ.jpg','1994-07-01',87,'Released',NULL,'Stockholm Marathon',33121,1.0075,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12543,_binary '\0','/bggXK8BospsGCNqTCw3L0HpmcnA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111293',6.2,5902,'en','The Stöned Age','Determined to avoid another night of driving aimlessly around Torrance in the Blue Torpedo, Joe and Hubbs set out on a quest for fine chicks. Their paths soon cross with Tack, from whom they learn about a pair of foreign radical chicks hanging out near the Frankie Avalon place. Over Joe\'s objections, Hubbs worms Tack out of the deal, and the pair take a slow ride toward their destiny.','/d9Edl0tqX7eigcEEoFqKfnpBJHA.jpg','1994-12-05',90,'Released',NULL,'The Stöned Age',20860,3.0891,6.1,'lhIE1wXoxrU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12544,_binary '\0','/vmXRiIs6alZFDtlHlUT3Tx5rHww.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111301',4.2,80195,'en','Street Fighter','Colonel Guile and various other martial arts heroes fight against the tyranny of dictator M. Bison and his cohorts.','/6yh95dD2Y6uWAlPfWCZZygBM1ec.jpg','1994-12-23',102,'Released','The fight to save the world is on!','Street Fighter',11667,11.2885,4.681,'HsTKoGcFS78','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12545,_binary '\0','/tQuwXgAc9C2a5kt0Knfl9Kv4un3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111308',5.8,2233,'hi','Suhaag','Collegian Ajay Sharma was born on 2nd April 1968 and lives in Bombay with his widowed mom, Asha. He is friendly with fellow-collegian, the wealthy Raj Sinha, and both often end up getting beat-up by goons and Madhu (Raj\'s girlfriend) respectively. After they graduate from college, Raj\'s maternal uncle asks Ajay to bring his birth certificate so that he could make his passport and find work for him in a department store in Canada. Ajay goes home to look for his birth certificate, but is unable to locate. His mother makes a show of helping him, but instead tears a document and tosses it outside. Ajay puts the document together and finds out that his real name is Ajay Malhotra, his father, Dr. Ravi Malhotra, is still alive, serving a life sentence in prison for killing and stealing a patient\'s organs. Ajay questions his mother and finds out that his dad was framed by the hospital owner, Rai Bahadur. He and Asha meet Ravi in prison and swear to avenge his humiliation.','/y47kzea1h3LkzBHTwMEftbiY8eX.jpg','1994-10-20',160,'Released',NULL,'Suhaag',143881,1.1258,5.588,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12546,_binary '\0','/nlcD0fZBXPy6wYINygD4PHZeH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111309',7.3,6263,'en','The Sum of Us','A widowed father has to deal with two complex issues: while he is searching for \"Miss Right,\" his son, who is in his 20s and gay, is searching for \"Mr. Right.\"','/4rBI4KISTuMCsWGb0kurWxKjqPQ.jpg','1994-07-28',100,'Released','We\'re all just... The Sum of Us.','The Sum of Us',36614,2.1176,6.8,'JW7E011rHfg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12547,_binary '\0','/fZIOrSUxZ6f1tODktqdICN3Ky1o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111323',6.2,14583,'en','Surviving the Game','A homeless man is hired as a survival guide for a group of wealthy businessmen on a hunting trip in the mountains, unaware that they are killers who hunt humans for sport, and that he is their new prey.','/wRtpJFGney5gqHmMb3JjT5WN3FH.jpg','1994-04-15',96,'Released','The Rules are Simple: Kill or Be Killed.','Surviving the Game',17585,3.8442,6.175,'SzsAue_mm0g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12548,_binary '\0','/gxZnVE7hKqT0VB06hOiLKl583X4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111333',6.5,29763,'en','The Swan Princess','The beautiful princess Odette is transformed into a swan by an evil sorcerer\'s spell. Held captive at an enchanted lake, she befriends Jean-Bob the frog, Speed the turtle and Puffin the bird. Despite their struggle to keep the princess safe, these good-natured creatures can do nothing about the sorcerer\'s spell, which can only be broken by a vow of everlasting love.','/f5YvIPrkJ9HCsNbgzWJJyxXVNhj.jpg','1994-11-18',89,'Released','An enchanting classic destined to capture your heart and free your spirit.','The Swan Princess',22586,6.807,6.6,'5wfMVdyDa_g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12549,_binary '\0','/5a4Gmk2HNeefI4Rmwdmbyoy79oy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111341',8.2,14586,'hu','Sátántangó','Inhabitants of a small village in Hungary deal with the effects of the fall of Communism. The town\'s source of revenue, a factory, has closed, and the locals, who include a doctor and three couples, await a cash payment offered in the wake of the shuttering. Irimias, a villager thought to be dead, returns and, unbeknownst to the locals, is a police informant. In a scheme, he persuades the villagers to form a commune with him.','/y38z0v4HJ12MHiKddLEoFlvPiBt.jpg','1994-04-28',432,'Released',NULL,'Satantango',31414,7.3717,8.034,'UuyznqAILAM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12550,_binary '\0','/b6UiIu8YiFC2CXjMj7BCDVhKts0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111359',5.9,4752,'en','Tall Tale: The Unbelievable Adventure','A young boy draws on the inspiration of legendary western characters to find the strength to fight an evil land baron in the old west who wants to steal his family\'s farm and destroy their idyllic community. When Daniel Hackett sees his father Jonas gravely wounded by the villainous Stiles, his first urge is for his family to flee the danger, and give up their life on a farm which Daniel has come to despise anyway. Going alone to a lake to try to decide what to do, he falls asleep on a boat and wakes to find himself in the wild west, in the company of such \"tall tale\" legends as Pecos Bill, Paul Bunyan, John Henry and Calamity Jane. Together, they battle the same villains Daniel is facing in his \"real\" world, ending with a heroic confrontation in which the boy stands up to Stiles and his henchmen, and rallies his neighbors to fight back against land grabbers who want to destroy their town.','/di43EvahPBbdTgZrBxx8yZjvFu8.jpg','1995-03-24',98,'Released','A journey into a world where legends come to life. Dreams come true. And every boy is a hero.','Tall Tale: The Unbelievable Adventure',41841,3.5861,6.209,'_SEKFI00-g0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12551,_binary '\0','/rK8XY6IHadMBEZWqwCfU2sXFBeC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111361',5.4,6843,'en','Tammy and the T-Rex','An evil scientist implants the brain of a murdered high school student into an animatronic Tyrannosaurus, who later wreaks vengeance on the bullies who killed him, and is reunited with his sweetheart.','/uT3W8PIO0NUZqaSxsgNVKoDij1e.jpg','1994-12-28',91,'Released','No pain. No gain.','Tammy and the T-Rex',55563,3.9981,5.082,'NlW0EAhXJbE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12552,_binary '\0','/q0Q4X4JfxnAu9Qf6NTIX3wXOXHd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111400',5.6,15657,'en','Terminal Velocity','A maverick skydiver and a former KGB agent team up to stop the Russian mafia from stealing gold.','/acqkCrNcwgBcICUymdJwOMQlf9n.jpg','1994-09-23',102,'Released','It\'s not the fall that kills you...','Terminal Velocity',9057,4.4294,5.4,'2R0Zbnj9snQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12553,_binary '\0','/aMMYfyQT5bYjP9l7Ap09oaMhwWf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111403',6.3,3773,'es','La teta y la luna','A child does not stand the idea of having a new brother and dreams about drinking milk from the breasts of his mother again. The child asks the moon to bring him a tit only for him.','/rUYqLL2DXnWuyXoH468AlumoJIE.jpg','1994-03-29',86,'Released',NULL,'The Tit and the Moon',13375,5.4395,6.2,'TPD1yqEW-ss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12554,_binary '\0','/kBzZR5wIY7ThPAVIZU0oISHc1v7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111408',7.5,1893,'en','That\'s Entertainment! III','Some of MGM\'s musical stars review the studio\'s history of musicals. From The Hollywood Revue of 1929 to Brigadoon, from the first musical talkies to Gene Kelly in Singin\' in the Rain.','/g6urKxs7CnXe3TNcKGkS8VVFlxh.jpg','1994-07-01',113,'Released',NULL,'That\'s Entertainment! III',77448,2.369,7.1,'tDcvstelTmk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12555,_binary '\0','/xs7v0o0p4VWQ7BMa1XWYZ3coAor.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111418',6.3,14361,'en','Threesome','At a sizable public college, high-minded student Eddy is forced to room with the slovenly Stuart, but the pair strike up a surprising friendship. When attractive co-ed Alex is assigned to live with the two male students because of her gender-neutral name, a roundabout love triangle ensues. Eddy secretly yearns for Stuart, who wants Alex, but she prefers Eddy. The complex situation leads to sexual experimentation and strained relationships.','/vR6qwjChOV4Z9940VA9chucNpne.jpg','1994-04-08',93,'Released','One girl. Two guys. Three possibilities.','Threesome',10635,4.233,6.4,'u1KIeJaW3kI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12556,_binary '\0','/jhxmxSNBNCAKtHeJnJhWpkOOI7d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111419',6.3,20463,'en','Thumbelina','Born of a flower and growing to only a couple of inches tall, poor Thumbelina is worried she\'ll never meet someone her own size, until she happens to catch the eye of Prince Cornelius of the Fairies. Just as soon as she finds love, however, it\'s torn away when she\'s kidnapped by Ms. Toad. Now Thumbelina has to escape Ms. Toad\'s grasp and search for Prince Cornelius. Luckily, there\'s a whole city of animals willing to help.','/eBvSSfwAKgcjF4eyaeNSzTCpfaF.jpg','1994-03-30',87,'Released','Follow your heart and nothing is impossible.','Thumbelina',28032,9.4754,6.5,'EzVA8BmskjA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12557,_binary '\0','/iNfDwioDBzqodomLbMfV8ZXj0yL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111438',6,70673,'en','Timecop','In 2004, an officer for a security agency that regulates time travel must fend for his life against a shady politician who has a tie to his past.','/bgxP6ws8ErBiarnb4S93vv0lkf4.jpg','1994-09-15',98,'Released','They killed his wife ten years ago. There\'s still time to save her.','Timecop',8831,6.7625,6.034,'7OPLHgw54h4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12558,_binary '\0','/cJL4i2NrR85l8UyJ1BB2UDDC9y6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111454',6.2,2015,'en','Tom & Viv','The story of the marriage of the poet T. S. Eliot to socialite Vivienne Haigh-Wood, which had to cope with her gynaecological and emotional problems and his growing fame.','/iw4ofGbX2AbJ4p17CixwnMjuoJ0.jpg','1994-04-15',115,'Released','For better, for worse, forever.','Tom & Viv',46797,1.5083,6.1,'8O2PybIWgIE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12559,_binary '\0','/ml5hjkggO4GTcmkrogfqss7eusV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111470',5.5,2409,'en','Trading Mom','The Martin kids learn of a magic spell that will take them to the \'mommy market\' so they can get a more user friendly model. After giving a few other moms a try, they want their own back. But that is not so easy.','/coR9bSS5xHts2fBLEou1X7XTkXi.jpg','1994-03-04',82,'Released','No More Vegtables, No More HomeWork, No More Cleaning up your room...','Trading Mom',41589,1.8775,5.9,'5cFdF5MIJl0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12560,_binary '\0','/jNIqlHr5cYvYbtf5k5PlbsCG0mo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111477',5.9,16663,'en','Trapped in Paradise','Residents of a friendly Pennsylvania town foil three brothers\' plan to rob a bank on Christmas Eve.','/dK4yUlzV2pG1p8oBZP6CuIUO6yg.jpg','1994-12-02',111,'Released','The Firpo Brothers can get away with anything. They just can\'t get away!','Trapped in Paradise',23719,4.5825,5.6,'PGHRkervPL4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12561,_binary '\0','/A9oxp0W1fpI4beE3LECEmzlNnq4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111488',5.5,2197,'en','Trial by Jury','Valerie is a juror in the trial of a mob boss. When her young son\'s life is threatened, she has no option other than to see that justice isn\'t done.','/uYVGv35bMH7MybbfvWHEC9xQDMY.jpg','1994-09-09',107,'Released','For one juror, the question of guilt or innocence is a matter of life or death... her own.','Trial by Jury',41590,2.4372,5.4,'RBF5FGjDnBw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12562,_binary '\0','/xkk7cqXFzY4aCCG5AYWZCFQFbIX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111495',8,116936,'fr','Trois couleurs : Rouge','Part-time model Valentine unexpectedly befriends a retired judge after she runs over his dog. At first, the grumpy man shows no concern about the dog, and Valentine decides to keep it. But the two form a bond when she returns to his house and catches him listening to his neighbors’ phone calls.','/JHmsBiX1tjCKqAul1lzC20WcAW.jpg','1994-05-12',100,'Released','The invisible thread of destinies.','Three Colors: Red',110,7.1848,7.885,'1fQQBbcfL5E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12563,_binary '\0','/jRZ3joUcg8YDCQYl4Tog5xhY6wk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111503',7.3,303488,'en','True Lies','A fearless, globe-trotting, terrorist-battling secret agent has his life turned upside down when he discovers his wife might be having an affair with a used car salesman while terrorists smuggle nuclear war heads into the United States.','/pqdvCBDThAOjlA0XBzbNm7GvwpU.jpg','1994-07-15',141,'Released','When he said I do, he never said what he did.','True Lies',36955,13.8634,7.103,'3B7HG8_xbDw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12564,_binary '\0','/b1CVjSYinzm6tx1TGA7c75W8X9k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111507',7.6,85527,'fr','Trois couleurs : Blanc','Polish immigrant Karol Karol finds himself out of a marriage, a job and a country when his French wife, Dominique, divorces him after six months due to his impotence. Forced to leave France after losing the business they jointly owned, Karol enlists fellow Polish expatriate Mikołaj to smuggle him back to their homeland.','/6r09mQLfJmQes0uFD4yTa8NAKPj.jpg','1994-01-26',92,'Released',NULL,'Three Colors: White',109,7.0542,7.4,'mfw46ZiSScw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12565,_binary '\0','/zo14UuFDTVy91cBNWHplHCqHCPt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111512',7.5,52194,'cn','醉拳二','Returning home with his father after a shopping expedition, Wong Fei-Hong is unwittingly caught up in the battle between foreigners who wish to export ancient Chinese artifacts and loyalists who don\'t want the pieces to leave the country. Fei-Hong must fight against the foreigners using his Drunken Boxing style, and overcome his father\'s antagonism as well.','/xqUBrSBtPYLvCtfqHF5sapU6Div.jpg','1994-02-03',102,'Released','He\'s got a secret weapon with a lot of kick.','The Legend of Drunken Master',12207,9.1768,7.5,'7P7tWqwKqE4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12566,_binary '\0','/5pg53sST9txHC2kc5dmYWgURlTI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111520',6.3,1446,'en','The Twilight Zone: Rod Serling\'s Lost Classics','James Earl Jones hosts this film based on two stories by the late Rod Serling, who wrote the stories of the original \'The Twilight Zone\' (1959) series. In \"The Theatre,\" a young woman attends a movie only to find that her life story is being revealed on the screen. In \"Where the Dead Are,\" a Boston surgeon in 1868 searches for a scientist who may have the answer to a medical mystery.','/kP63L0E7Ftesqq8npKDQV4v078L.jpg','1994-05-19',89,'Released',NULL,'The Twilight Zone: Rod Serling\'s Lost Classics',29803,2.6216,6.8,'ym0HvJSajW4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12567,_binary '\0','/fxSRvXYp0iPKUaKQ3gsj8xmgdHI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111543',5.7,5155,'fr','Un Indien dans la ville','Stephen, an international trader, tracks down his ex-wife Patricia in some Amazonian backwater. He needs her consent to a divorce so that he can marry Charlotte. Unfortunately, he discovers a son he didn’t know he had – Mimi-Siku. The young jungle boy yearns to see Paris so Stephen reluctantly agrees to take him back home with him for a few days. How will Mimi-Siku react to life in the great metropolis?','/nUFHWv42GRJcjLTQa5IYBEuVzmK.jpg','1994-12-14',90,'Released','The city is a jungle. Some are just better prepared for it, than others.','Little Indian, Big City',11479,2.9419,6,'uysLQhTKiI8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12568,_binary '\0','/yjOskYh5JJe8mWVnk0lM6eT5Sux.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111549',5.7,3096,'en','Uncovered','While restoring a fifteenth-century painting Julia reveals a hidden Latin phrase. A series of murders begin to rock her small world of art experts, patrons and restorers, and she finds that the mystery of the painting is interwoven with the mystery of the deaths around her.','/9Iwv6PEAifrzUtWTv1aC4I0rttg.jpg','1995-01-04',112,'Released','To some murder is an art.','Uncovered',18591,2.229,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12569,_binary '\0','/orFys420SI0TT9l5Xepau4oz6rd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111552',4.5,2913,'en','Undefeatable','The film follows Kristi Jones who, along with her gang, take part in Mafia-run street fights to earn money for her sister\'s college education. Kristi\'s sister hopes to become a doctor and pay for Kristi\'s education.','/zGueu0lvOJGgJBUj2G8RKeNeLZi.jpg','1993-03-05',90,'Released','Out of the ring, into the fire... in a fight to the finish','Undefeatable',24527,2.7418,5.3,'qr68LKnC9Tk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12570,_binary '\0','/erNihgtybk36SLdUtXUR0pGU3nF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111573',5.5,4523,'it','L\'uomo che guarda','At a college in Rome, a professor, nicknamed \"Dodo\" is in a deep depression. His stunningly beautiful wife has just left him for another man. Dodo wants her back very badly and has erotic daydreams about her. A beautiful young student in his class asks him for a ride home and seduces the lucky man, but still he wonders about his wife and her lover.','/831BBTawd6E6WJ3Zu0KKwmbpDp2.jpg','1994-01-27',98,'Released',NULL,'The Voyeur',27066,12.5611,6.4,'iR-G_3GVDeg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12571,_binary '\0','/dR6oO0xtzUhRy9pGe5aL0yLARCu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111579',7.8,17439,'ru','Утомлённые солнцем','Russia, 1936: revolutionary hero Colonel Kotov is spending an idyllic summer in his dacha with his young wife and six-year-old daughter Nadia and other assorted family and friends. Things change dramatically with the unheralded arrival of Cousin Dmitri from Moscow, who charms the women and little Nadia with his games and pianistic bravura. But Kotov isn\'t fooled: this is the time of Stalin\'s repression, with telephone calls in the middle of the night spelling doom - and he knows that Dmitri isn\'t paying a social call...','/jcpvnPSuRrynrgY7menuyZe7X4r.jpg','1994-05-01',135,'Released','A moving and poignant story set against the corrupt politics of the Stalinist era.','Burnt by the Sun',50797,2.1196,6.9,'1gPzpr08hFk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12572,_binary '\0','/llXsPTScDIdQjgsescQyKaIZA6l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111590',7.3,5705,'en','Vanya on 42nd Street','An uninterrupted rehearsal of Chekhov\'s \'Uncle Vanya\' plays out by a company of actors. The setting: their run-down theater with an unusable stage and crumbling ceiling. The play is shown act by act with the briefest of breaks to move props or for refreshments. The lack of costumes, real props and scenery is soon forgotten.','/sYkkHsqXyUcFoLbXt4WNwnRRpT1.jpg','1994-10-19',120,'Released',NULL,'Vanya on 42nd Street',32636,3.2468,6.7,'hJxvpLrp4yA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12573,_binary '\0','/nOdNvUvxkyLkVxu9f0NwcKmhIGS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111640',5.4,3819,'de','Voll Normaaal','Tommie is the absolute loser in his home district of Cologne-Kalk: no money, no apartment of his own, no girlfriend. In the exhaust workshop where he toils, the foreman is constantly angry with him. But Tommie is in a great mood: The video freak dreams enthusiastically through the fantasy world of film art, preferably with the bust sex star Gianna S. in the leading role. Tommie collects exhaust pipes. When he steals a particularly capital specimen from Jupp\'s swank Mercedes, he gets into real trouble. He has no choice but to return the exhaust to Jupp, but his deadly ultimatum of procuring a case of the rare beer brand \"Ramsdorfer Kölsch\" by seven o\'clock in the evening proves to be insanely difficult. Because at the very same time, \"Gianna S.\" is expected in town...','/4rz8OqfbvvScPpv9uKM7ieUcXbh.jpg','1994-11-10',91,'Released',NULL,'Just Desserts',9673,1.6041,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12574,_binary '\0','/5uf31DQxAFPtveULkEC8a70iPQA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111653',4.9,7022,'en','Wagons East!','After the 1860s Wild West, a group of misfit settlers - including ex-doctor Phil Taylor, prostitute Belle, and homosexual bookseller Julian - decide they cannot live in their current situation in the west. They hire a grizzled alcoholic wagon master by the name of James Harlow to take them on a journey back to their hometowns in the East.','/xRYheMiWnjdvUFuXmb1IzjbO9kz.jpg','1994-08-16',107,'Released','They came. They saw. They changed their minds.','Wagons East!',30114,3.218,4.9,'PfabKcoGFmE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12575,_binary '\0','/lRMUqLDihl9AEsGDMLoAToqeOGl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111666',7.3,5012,'en','War of the Buttons','War between two Irish youth gangs consists of removing and retrieving buttons from each other\'s clothing.','/uqsNLBj1MKzq2uqvegAgoE0gG1M.jpg','1994-08-05',94,'Released','Most wars last years. This one has to be over by dinner.','War of the Buttons',38348,2.5916,7,'qiNtHShWnco','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12576,_binary '\0','/flsBbMFOiD7kXFs5Jmm7qR47cd4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111667',6.8,14495,'en','The War','The son of a Vietnam War Veteran must deal with neighborhood bullies as well as his dad\'s post-traumatic stress disorder while growing up in the deep south in the 1970\'s.','/eMJYqr5zs7rz54oZhiX4ez1BI5E.jpg','1994-11-04',126,'Released',NULL,'The War',19855,4.6852,6.667,'BzB_Qkl2Gec','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12577,_binary '\0','/qKF9GwtJbi2rob8kZBmGcQGAaMo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111686',6.4,70394,'en','Wes Craven\'s New Nightmare','A demonic force has chosen Freddy Krueger as its portal to the real world. Can Heather Langenkamp play the part of Nancy one last time and trap the evil trying to enter our world?','/glM7dFY5Pvd9y6y7Avd6Nfu1CFt.jpg','1994-10-13',112,'Released','This time the terror doesn\'t stop at the screen.','Wes Craven\'s New Nightmare',11596,9.4874,6.456,'9dLQYxBYGTQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12578,_binary '\0','/8EqsebNbijFWEdiW9poMZ9eXjWf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111689',7.3,2930,'en','What Happened Was...','Jackie and Michael are coworkers at a large law firm. They decide to meet at Jackie\'s for dinner one night.','/mke5aNX5cT6JIWk2ER4ng9dGNNL.jpg','1994-09-09',91,'Released','Comedy. Romance. Terror. The perfect first date.','What Happened Was...',83718,2.0382,7.2,'QgxLAcCO55k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12579,_binary '\0','/eS4ky6DOiDLr9mHMNJnFPRWo4D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111693',6.6,25217,'en','When a Man Loves a Woman','An airline pilot and his wife are forced to face the consequences of her alcoholism when her addictions threaten her life and their daughter\'s safety. While the woman enters detox, her husband must face the truth of his enabling behavior.','/cA1uMNX3sdWAWfMZbsgm1VIJYSY.jpg','1994-04-29',126,'Released','Through the good times. Through the bad times. When a Man Loves a Woman it\'s for all times.','When a Man Loves a Woman',10449,5.1175,6.634,'3vQK49vzmBI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12580,_binary '\0','/syo8e0MKOFJjjOnYyxO6oRb0hyl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111701',5.5,2743,'en','White Fang 2: Myth of the White Wolf','A boy and his dog, White Fang, must try to save the noble Haida tribe from evil white men in turn-of-the-century Alaska.','/30KfICHg6aPUiAYy4sy7zA9TFA.jpg','1994-04-15',106,'Released','An Ancient Myth. A Land of Mystery. An Extraordinary Adventure.','White Fang 2: Myth of the White Wolf',43643,3.8674,6.9,'44BNr7fNI2g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12581,_binary '\0','/a1FpItDtzTDBGBEy2MWYRyc8DDk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111712',6.6,2102,'en','Widows\' Peak','Scandal and mystery reign following the arrival of Edwina in a small Irish town populated entirely by widows. Edwina quickly falls out with the locals while also falling in with the son of the community\'s leader','/xXyVUwvJesJJChzpvn7xj5cAOfm.jpg','1994-04-15',101,'Released',NULL,'Widows\' Peak',25440,2.7523,6.4,'BAsNqcro3EE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12582,_binary '\0','/ez1RyjAyFpd7SHfdL0gxZNLhZqQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111730',5.5,2102,'en','Witch Hunt','Magic and murder connect an actress, a private eye, a senator and a witch in 1950s Hollywood.','/dmOXxbrAN013vKE2BJXIyl46hLL.jpg','1994-12-10',100,'Released','It’s a new kind of evil, as old as time.','Witch Hunt',41595,2.298,5.1,'wVcYIJ0StHk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12583,_binary '\0','/m0m0ikotUirpFBRuqjfXA738CMc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111732',6.8,18457,'en','With Honors','Convinced he\'ll graduate with honors because of his thesis paper, a stuffy Harvard student finds his paper being held hostage by a homeless man, who might be the guy to school the young man in life.','/eWJ2Y7CRvlv1KVfAJGRcH95i1pY.jpg','1994-04-29',103,'Released','If you want a degree go to Harvard. If you want an education go to Simon Wilder.','With Honors',16297,4.0652,6.7,'DZ7Fm26YJjs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12584,_binary '\0','/yE9ygTGxEwYXYPPYZfqRoIC5vdX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111735',6.9,1881,'en','Without Warning','A television program is interupted by a news network announcing that three meteors have hit the United States, France and China. At first it seems natural but after interviews by scientists and eyewitness seems to suggest that it is not. Three more meteors are coming and the various Earth governments combine forces to stop them.','/1oG3MqY623Bl0AnR1CwumVC6gBA.jpg','1994-10-30',91,'Released','The most frightening cosmic event of the century.','Without Warning',44117,1.5525,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12585,_binary '\0','/dAFKnTzyOBbZyRCAb33F632ctva.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111742',6.3,65035,'en','Wolf','An aging publisher becomes a demon wolf and, with this newfound youthful vigor, fights to keep his job.','/5TprU55U2zjAMCwr2jQra3zj1zu.jpg','1994-06-17',125,'Released','The animal is out.','Wolf',10395,6.2522,6.133,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12586,_binary '\0','/8Nhn88ZaR8txXSLptWMBgWm3QnJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111756',6.7,60069,'en','Wyatt Earp','From Wichita to Dodge City, to the O.K. Corral in Tombstone, Wyatt Earp is taught that nothing matters more than family and the law. Joined by his brothers and Doc Holliday, Earp wages war on the dreaded Clanton and McLaury gangs.','/51LItgyecu2KMAtIchYogEykCIu.jpg','1994-06-24',191,'Released','The epic story of love and adventure in a lawless land.','Wyatt Earp',12160,6.4205,6.8,'3deAQVbaqlY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12587,_binary '\0','/9YhcK0LSe9xWvIV6zgNZGDA7ZIb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111786',8,6395,'zh','阳光灿烂的日子','Beijing, 1970s. The Cultural Revolution has driven most adults to the provinces leaving 14-year-old Monkey and his pals with free rein over the city. They hang around, get up to no good, and discover that unsolvable mystery known as \"girls.\"','/ky7JiHPlwb0vKNSwWgXHQnQs6d7.jpg','1994-09-01',141,'Released','A Revolutionary Childhood.','In the Heat of the Sun',161285,3.0901,7.8,'SeWN-SWLLbE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12588,_binary '\0','/jWf1nDgW8UjXG9K9WUWhlTXLXpV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111787',6.4,2174,'en','Yankee Zulu','Two South African boys, one white, Rhino, and one black, Zulu, go their separate ways after an incident. Many years later, they meet up again as adults, when one, after living for years in the United States, is now a wanted criminal. The two end up being a part of a madcap chase involving a check for a large amount of lottery money, pursued by Gen. Diehard and Rhino\'s ex-wife Rowena, who was the cause of the rift between the two protagonists.','/gOPkzkmi5XkGDUkurhpBK9gNHpI.jpg','1993-12-03',100,'Released','If the gods were crazy... now they\'re berserk.','Yankee Zulu',16417,2.7162,6.2,'gUYyFdfBMnw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12589,_binary '\0','/8c5ZuZXUXBDhm1gSt9P7DJ2xvAe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111793',5.9,4979,'hi','Yeh Dillagi','Sapna, the daughter of a rich family\'s chauffeur, fantasizes about wealth and romance. When the family\'s younger playboy son falls for her, his parents and his responsible, workaholic older brother Vijay vow to break the couple up. However, things quickly become complicated when Vijay finds himself developing feelings for Sapna as well.','/7DelNAcFTGzYVqNRk28psaCytqj.jpg','1994-05-05',155,'Released',NULL,'Yeh Dillagi',161447,2.2914,6.2,'R8Ukl1P8D-4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12590,_binary '\0','/tllmUjmEQKF0OaH7FgqZYnLBsYB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111797',7.8,25517,'zh','飲食男女','Retired and widowed Chinese master chef Chu lives in modern day Taipei, with his three attractive daughters, all of whom are unattached. Soon, each daughter encounters a new man in their lives. When these new relationships blossom, stereotypes are broken and the living situation within the family changes.','/olhIWtIBFg6VWK59DEd4lAvgVgz.jpg','1994-08-03',123,'Released','A comedy to arouse your appetite.','Eat Drink Man Woman',10451,4.8,7.6,'l7pKpO8NErU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12591,_binary '\0','/8vOlmG5DqQraxjYmhyJ690cDjA7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111800',6.9,3787,'cn','詠春','Martial arts expert Wing Chun battles bandits in this magical film that provides as many laughs as it does wallops. Besides horse thieves, Wing Chun must deal with the men around her who simply can\'t handle a strong, independent woman. Ultimately, she must dish out \"lessons\" again and again and again until the respect for her remarkable skills is finally won.','/zL8fYCzy3qPTvbp1Vf9bbvw0Yx6.jpg','1994-03-24',93,'Released',NULL,'Wing Chun',25645,3.4546,6.9,'fxHMOIMKmE4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12592,_binary '\0','/2K6xJVf5DUiNlhSanYB3AlffOjz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111807',6.8,4541,'sv','Yrrol - en kolossalt genomtänkt film','Sketch comedy. Look forward to an evening of satire, smut, and contemporary issues in an unholy mix. What more could you want? In these gloomy times? How many times has it been said about a film: \"You\'ve never seen anything like it\"? This time, it\'s actually true. This film features, among other things, a bartender with a naked lower body, a double coffin with a built-in pie, a violent flight attendant, five screaming Salvation Army soldiers, a blind TV salesman, a dirty tennis ball and, of course, Uncle Bosse – dirtier than ever.','/6ZAmfe5jQnmKDeGQtyw63oRfKVW.jpg','1994-10-28',88,'Released','A film like any other.','Yrrol: An Enormously Well Thought Out Movie',22471,1.3937,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12593,_binary '\0','/tR6bYGdCSm6t9JE4UESRw96EoPy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111835',6.4,6262,'cn','中南海保鑣','A corrupt businessman commits a murder and the only witness is the girlfriend of another businessman with close connections to the Chinese government, so a bodyguard from Beijing is dispatched to help two Hong Kong cops protect the witness.','/xd4X6YIssIJWYXnPiZHTgy0EzWa.jpg','1994-07-28',92,'Released',NULL,'The Bodyguard from Beijing',18674,5.1152,6.8,'_C7Z02rSgWI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12594,_binary '\0','/4BIIX7qiKYYJSm4cWTB2dHfCwZE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111845',7.7,12192,'fa','زیر درختان زیتون','When the actor in a scene for his film Life And Nothing More… has to quit, a film director casts another man for the part. However, complications arise since the man and the woman who was cast for the scene know each other.','/6YTFB34QqK06OBm5GDOsnROsNUo.jpg','1994-12-02',104,'Released',NULL,'Through the Olive Trees',47104,3.6387,7.4,'T4Ue-t2XKnU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12595,_binary '\0','/74BdRjSMe4rF67EOIUizDQ5hfYS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0111862',5.5,2541,'sv','Änglagård - andra sommaren','Fanny and Zack is back, after she inherited Änglagård last year. Everytone looks forward to their new stay. Axel has told Fanny he is her father, but who else? Ivar also thinks he is her father. Be ready for expectations and confusions.','/7w4pcBKfrWvyAyWF57mIf3NvV4a.jpg','1994-12-25',130,'Released',NULL,'House of Angels: The Second Summer',44965,1.4999,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12596,_binary '\0','/e5YsSxWpCILbfDTQ0B4LyKUFHMc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112031',6.1,1418,'en','Catherine the Great','Trapped in a loveless arranged marriage to the immature future Czar, a young German Princess proves a skillful political infighter and rises to become Catherine the Great.','/gnkdVJyZDaPjazFnQXIKxBeuqif.jpg','1996-04-28',180,'Released','Through Treachery, Passion and Courage, She Built an Empire','Catherine the Great',69931,2.0963,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12597,_binary '\0','/fU8X7GbEkUvhn6rSH58mR8VHcUO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112255',4.4,6895,'en','3 Ninjas Knuckle Up','Rocky, Colt and TumTum must battle an evil wealthy toxic waste dumper in order to save a local Indian tribe and their friend Joe. The 3 Ninjas must help find Joe\'s father and find a secret disk that contains evidence that could stop the toxic landfill that is destroying the Indian community. However the town is owned by the rich man and he controls the police and even the mayor. They must fight a motorcycle gang and renegade cowboys in this non-stop ninja adventure.','/A2664BFz1Xmxyprh9DoxXIEldhb.jpg','1995-04-07',85,'Released','Tum Tum, Colt and Rocky are back for all new non-stop Ninja action!','3 Ninjas Knuckle Up',40508,3.879,5.2,'MggyCCD1HFg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12598,_binary '\0','/8ZNGbL8dLdyXmmEdIwwMzy2eOqS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112257',6.4,1291,'ko','삼공일 삼공이','Two obsessive-compulsives, a chef and an anorexic writer, are neighbors in an apartment building. The chef (301) tries to entice her neighbor to eat with fabulous meals. The writer (302) refuses to eat, and this refusal begins a turbulent relationship that forces both women to delve into their pasts of torment.','/7gMh5BcWebJ5qy4M1529FjmK94H.jpg','1995-04-22',100,'Released','Two apartments. Two women. One shocking mystery.','301/302',54285,1.5128,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12599,_binary '\0','/h5Y9T4OoFpMrONhVBZvN2X2DfAB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112281',6.4,251578,'en','Ace Ventura: When Nature Calls','Summoned from an ashram in Tibet, Ace finds himself on a perilous journey into the jungles of Africa to find Shikaka, the missing sacred animal of the friendly Wachati tribe. He must accomplish this before the wedding of the Wachati\'s Princess to the prince of the warrior Wachootoos. If Ace fails, the result will be a vicious tribal war.','/wcinCf1ov2D6M3P7BBZkzQFOiIb.jpg','1995-11-10',90,'Released','New animals. New adventures. Same hair.','Ace Ventura: When Nature Calls',9273,12.2655,6.346,'DfqPjRMsRP0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12600,_binary '\0','/1ndAmeEZWX3xTAZVEphdKC3uLTc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112288',6.5,13199,'en','The Addiction','A vampiric doctoral student tries to follow the philosophy of a nocturnal comrade and control her thirst for blood.','/1Yy8H2tKQ16mffLFRfxcBHKBdyF.jpg','1995-10-06',82,'Released','The dark is their sunlight. What makes them different is what keeps them alive.','The Addiction',34996,4.022,6.5,'7nyyYwqpwQQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12601,_binary '\0','/jP8lHNHD89xaRPfAdyz5KEVYcSb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112302',5.5,12621,'en','Tom and Huck','A mischievous young boy, Tom Sawyer, witnesses a murder by the deadly Injun Joe. Tom becomes friends with Huckleberry Finn, a boy with no future and no family. Tom has to choose between honoring a friendship or honoring an oath because the town alcoholic is accused of the murder. Tom and Huck go through several adventures trying to retrieve evidence.','/bMY31ikEOIPOHqQwhPhII8UVBln.jpg','1995-12-22',97,'Released','A lot of kids get into trouble. These two invented it.','Tom and Huck',45325,3.1455,5.308,'-C-xXZyX2zU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12602,_binary '\0','/3YWSWnRUGlt3DDb37mQ81TfFJbQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112313',6.9,5958,'hi','अकेले हम अकेले तुम','Rohit and wealthy Kiran Dayal meet each other and fall in love. They intend to marry, but Kiran\'s parents will not permit her to marry beneath her class. Kiran is adamant, and the marriage goes through without the blessings of the Dayals. They live in harmony for months, even after Kiran gives birth to Sunil. Then they start to have differences, which are minor at present, and then snowball...','/xpCbEiAstlOOIhjbQhQrTHF4ZEg.jpg','1995-11-30',160,'Released',NULL,'Akele Hum Akele Tum',16894,1.5426,6.522,'yYbYw0XLEgc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12603,_binary '\0','/1fZlLZxYI2kmsymlrOrGXHyWkXS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112342',5.7,4680,'en','The Amazing Panda Adventure','Far from home in the lush bamboo forests of China, ten-year-old Ryan Tyler, with the help of a young girl, goes on a wonderful journey to rescue a baby panda taken by poachers.','/tIK40vCE9i8g4VhyJ3LLr5y1ROJ.jpg','1995-08-25',84,'Released','In the sweeping highlands of China, a boy begins a magical journey to save the life of a natural wonder.','The Amazing Panda Adventure',30765,2.4408,5.7,'Uwnm9QAwhzE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12604,_binary '\0','/hMc2fw8J56H6u4VRWHwLfeXnUCU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112346',6.9,65964,'en','The American President','Widowed U.S. president Andrew Shepherd, one of the world\'s most powerful men, can have anything he wants -- and what he covets most is Sydney Ellen Wade, a Washington lobbyist. But Shepherd\'s attempts at courting her spark wild rumors and decimate his approval ratings.','/hudVVQa0jCspRPYGLJwUVsteKsk.jpg','1995-11-17',113,'Released','Why can\'t the most powerful man in the world have the one thing he wants most?','The American President',9087,5.8317,6.527,'5E3VG3LL1Mo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12605,_binary '\0','/yVfUZF0bLbCPRcEgtQ7DRrjf8zU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112362',6.9,1679,'en','Angel Baby','Two schizophrenics meet during therapy and fall in love. Unfortunately they are on a road to nowhere...','/1IU0pJskxWoP1ZD9XHxyJleJYHg.jpg','1995-10-26',105,'Released','In a world that says they can\'t, Harry and Kate will risk everything, to prove they can.','Angel Baby',2892,1.2554,6.8,'rx9wZfaxIfQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12606,_binary '\0','/u49LQw75oynfoiN1HyWGuh78hs5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112364',6.3,1219,'en','Angela','A ten year old girl named Angela leads her six year old sister, Ellie, through various regimens of \'purification\' in an attempt to rid themselves of their evil, which she believes to be the cause of their mother\'s mental illness. Precocious, to say the least, Angela has visions of Lucifer coming to take her and her sister away, and one of her remedies for this is for them to remain within a circle of their dolls and toys until they see a vision of the virgin Mary come to them. But such thinking can only lead to an ending befitting of her own mental state.','/fhxU3jFzC2tlBgqFhB7NqO4qAFe.jpg','1996-01-26',102,'Released',NULL,'Angela',32622,2.1537,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12607,_binary '\0','/h5PrPi1fnGACJiYoIJxBpAkqhGU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112365',6.8,5126,'en','Angels and Insects','In Victorian England, wealthy patriarch Sir Harald Alabaster invites an impoverished biologist, William Adamson, into his home. There, William tries to continue his work, but is distracted by Alabaster\'s seductive daughter, Eugenia. William and Eugenia begin a torrid romance, but as the couple become closer, the young scientist begins to realize that dark, disturbing things are happening behind the closed doors of the Alabaster manor.','/w1i5JdddoLuzSmnKo5ORDoKdMm2.jpg','1995-09-10',118,'Released','An elegant seduction. An erotic deception. A stunning revelation.','Angels and Insects',8447,2.2412,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12608,_binary '\0','/6bpXP2BV50miAj80ntZ9Q2HjEZM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112366',5.9,3867,'fr','Les Anges gardiens','A sleazy Paris nightclub owner and ex-detective flies to Hong Kong to rescue the young son of a friend murdered by the Chinese mob.','/rrOC47OcekS7yJeunU308iY0tdH.jpg','1995-10-11',110,'Released',NULL,'Guardian Angels',51191,2.7167,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12609,_binary '\0','/qGW0LutVJfqEkBGooJj3w9ngLV8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112368',6.7,7567,'en','Angus','Angus is a large, pathetic 14-year-old whose thoughts are most often filled with the image of only one girl, Melissa Lefevre. Angus is shy and thinks that he has no chance of ever \'getting\' her. Being especially uncool, he is incredibly surprised (along with the rest of the school) that he is chosen to dance with her at the Winter Ball. The only one not surprised is the cool kid who set him up to fail, but Angus\' best friend is going to help him win the heart of Melissa by developing a new look for him','/x1Py4TB8Y0Wx9IZ62derpSDqwjd.jpg','1995-09-15',90,'Released','For everyone on the outside looking in... your moment has arrived!','Angus',25969,1.7326,6.6,'3f_aU8iTr4A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12610,_binary '\0','/yeE0TxjBrOM7j2mSYPSwizsM9bR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112373',8.1,1483,'en','Anne Frank Remembered','Using previously unreleased archival material in addition to contemporary interviews, this Academy Award-winning documentary tells the story of the Frank family and presents the first fully-rounded portrait of their brash and free-spirited daughter Anne, perhaps the world\'s most famous victim of the Holocaust.','/6nyhzrSGimCbdxiY8DEO7kI7xx4.jpg','1995-06-08',117,'Released','She is perhaps Hitler\'s best known victim, but what was Anne Frank really like?','Anne Frank Remembered',51352,1.5337,7.6,'HFMnh-n7U7w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12611,_binary '\0','/sOkUBkwq21ZEThCX7wboY2Xl3m5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112379',7.4,10123,'nl','Antonia','After World War II, Antonia and her daughter, Danielle, go back to their Dutch hometown, where Antonia\'s late mother has bestowed a small farm upon her. There, Antonia settles down and joins a tightly-knit but unusual community. Those around her include quirky friend Crooked Finger, would-be suitor Bas and, eventually for Antonia, a granddaughter and great-granddaughter who help create a strong family of empowered women.','/nUCVi6bBIL7LGC61nYaCqikAhIA.jpg','1995-09-21',102,'Released','A motion picture that celebrates everything you love about life.','Antonia\'s Line',880,2.2141,6.916,'3n1O-sKecdA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12612,_binary '\0','/n0FDJI9c0uWiZwm8wgXVjaMBn96.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112384',7.7,342802,'en','Apollo 13','The true story of technical troubles that scuttle the Apollo 13 lunar mission in 1970, risking the lives of astronaut Jim Lovell and his crew, with the failed journey turning into a thrilling saga of heroism. Drifting more than 200,000 miles from Earth, the astronauts work furiously with the ground crew to avert tragedy.','/tVeKscCm2fY1xDXZk8PgnZ87h9S.jpg','1995-06-30',140,'Released','\"Houston, we have a problem.\"','Apollo 13',568,13.8926,7.463,'B1KJ9XeZuxA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12613,_binary '\0','/eI0Ffq6GpobBN4mdhnHka7KJFev.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112386',6.9,1275,'fr','Les Apprentis','Antoine is a failed and depressed writer. Fred doesn\'t do much in his life and seems to be happy about it. The two of them share an apartment and live in a shambles. The adventures and mostly the misadventures of these two buddies/losers, makes them realise that despite everything that happens their friendship is the most important thing in their lives.','/hnUhtrw1zsBdQ3tFl8xmO3KFayc.jpg','1995-12-20',95,'Released',NULL,'The Apprentices',62013,1.3028,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12614,_binary '\0','/AeKMvKZ2W7LfqZDrbf1Dk6HFhNj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112387',6.7,2574,'fr','L\'Appât','With the ambition to start a boutique overseas but without the means to do so, Nathalie finds herself in a desperate situation, where she would do anything to acquire what she needs. Along with her boyfriend, Eric, and his friend Bruno, she concocts a plan where she seduces clueless men and accompanies them to their places, then allows Eric and Bruno to break in. But the three soon encounter trouble after one of their schemes ends in murder.','/86hFBxrciPyuhCcZis5gBndKWJB.jpg','1995-03-08',117,'Released','Young. Beautiful. Deadly.','Fresh Bait',38414,1.4658,6.435,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12615,_binary '\0','/sYpmWBe1IO7Fxthtw3UmlzQEylK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112401',6.3,93112,'en','Assassins','Assassin Robert Rath arrives at a funeral to kill a prominent mobster, only to witness a rival hired gun complete the job for him -- with grisly results. Horrified by the murder of innocent bystanders, Rath decides to take one last job and then return to civilian life. But finding his way out of the world of contract killing grows ever more dangerous as Rath falls for his female target and becomes a marked man himself.','/wPmZYnaQpxwoHmwNwVhZ2IY0UbF.jpg','1995-10-06',132,'Released','In the shadows of life. In the business of death. One man found a reason to live.','Assassins',9691,6.8849,6.495,'XCuD8Q_Y10Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12616,_binary '\0','/6TEwh5BlOkaW9wgXatGlwQr9Lfg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112427',5.8,3242,'en','An Awfully Big Adventure','Liverpool. 1947. Right after World War II, a star struck naive teenage girl joins a shabby theatre troupe in Liverpool. During a winter production of Peter Pan, the play quickly turns into a dark metaphor for youth as she becomes drawn into a web of sexual politics and intrigue and learns about the grown-up world of the theater.','/tfXBuRBMbyu9IF9KCFz3kXeWQDT.jpg','1995-05-11',113,'Released','In love, as in life, destiny is always waiting in the wings','An Awfully Big Adventure',22279,3.4548,6.5,'HPBkA3GuvcY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12617,_binary '\0','/agkZziO4ZPAsVfKUrJD68lys08P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112431',6.9,143927,'en','Babe','Babe is a little pig who doesn\'t quite know his place in the world. With a bunch of odd friends, like Ferdinand the duck who thinks he is a rooster and Fly the dog he calls mum, Babe realises that he has the makings to become the greatest sheep pig of all time, and Farmer Hoggett knows it. With the help of the sheep dogs, Babe learns that a pig can be anything that he wants to be.','/zKuQMtnbVTz9DsOnOJmlW71v4qH.jpg','1995-07-18',92,'Released','A little pig goes a long way.','Babe',9598,9.5053,6.296,'tVxeoUtVF0o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12618,_binary '\0','/lO7kLQ9EVcpSTlEFDBElDVl5fJL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112435',5.8,7125,'en','The Baby-Sitters Club','Seven junior-high-school girls organize a daycare camp for children while at the same time experiencing classic adolescent growing pains.','/cdICP1AzQPgBWsEHwKTZH9ziNyE.jpg','1995-08-18',94,'Released','Friends Forever','The Baby-Sitters Club',48287,3.2477,5.5,'FGG_TKydPsM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12619,_binary '\0','/kdx9N1Wn097GE3pVqn5lbqlL52U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112437',5.5,2230,'en','The Babysitter\'s Seduction','The mother of the family for which Michelle baby-sits dies unexpectedly. Michelle is asked to take over looking after the children and is gradually \"seduced\" by the father.','/jvyqO99xPHuKwqCfCXf0p2KBj7g.jpg','1996-01-22',86,'Released','She was hired to watch over the kids. But who was going to watch over her?','The Babysitter\'s Seduction',69945,3.5833,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12620,_binary '\0','/A4tG725okDhIG7fWwU4olFstMVK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112438',4.3,6776,'en','The Babysitter','Jennifer is a lovely teen who has been hired to baby-sit the kids of Harry Tucker and his wife, Dolly. The Tuckers go to a party and proceed to get inebriated, with Mr. Tucker fantasizing about his beautiful baby sitter. Meanwhile, Jack, her boyfriend, and Mark, another guy interested in her, decide to spy on Jennifer at the Tucker house, with each young man also fixated on her.','/wOv6HKiKTcDiyZRXPOsjm2JhVZV.jpg','1995-10-17',90,'Released','Something about her captures the imagination.','The Babysitter',37141,3.9046,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12621,_binary '\0','/wOLTJxfv98miIQcn0oNXq9fIgXM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112442',6.8,318979,'en','Bad Boys','Marcus Burnett is a henpecked family man. Mike Lowrey is a footloose and fancy free ladies\' man. Both Miami policemen, they have 72 hours to reclaim a consignment of drugs stolen from under their station\'s nose. To complicate matters, in order to get the assistance of the sole witness to a murder, they have to pretend to be each other.','/x1ygBecKHfXX4M2kRhmFKWfWbJc.jpg','1995-04-07',119,'Released','Whatcha gonna do?','Bad Boys',9737,19.9945,6.831,'OLYENHi4IIc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12622,_binary '\0','/nJx6Wkfz6zVNxBok9UYl4hddr8W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112443',5.4,3586,'en','Bad Company','CIA operative Nelson Crowe is tasked with a deadly assignment: infiltrate a highly secret industrial espionage firm. Once inside, he teams with Margaret Wells, a master spy and seductive manipulator, in a plot to overthrow the organization\'s sinister president, which leads them into a darkly mysterious web of intrigue -- and shocking murder!','/5q5r3cpaTDByz4qko9ZWHlK3gMF.jpg','1995-01-20',108,'Released','Bribery. Blackmail. Murder. Specialities of the house.','Bad Company',40480,2.418,5,'tf6dFhAfTuE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12623,_binary '\0','/3emn7fR8QWUtIvT1qo3pUwTrDly.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112444',5.5,2256,'en','My Teacher\'s Wife','Todd Boomer is a college student aspiring to get into University. His chances are looking poor when his maths teacher, fails him in every maths test. Help arrives in the guise of the gorgeous Vicki, a mathematical genius who decides to tutor Todd. As the relationship develops,Todd finds himself in an affair with Vicki unknowing of her marriage to his math teacher.','/4esN7mSfMoDUF9Y3fWP0TeUvZW4.jpg','1999-11-10',89,'Released','Todd Boomer is embracing his homework like never before!','My Teacher\'s Wife',39001,3.5724,5.1,'dUu9tCTBiLw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12624,_binary '\0','/jRLhcuyTPgcaCzrTKVTVrFDWrYo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112445',7.6,9575,'fa','بادکنک سفید','Several people try to take advantage of a little girl\'s innocence to hustle money her mom gave to her to buy a goldfish with.','/bamJR4MwtQDMdWkjVAPojfwOjY4.jpg','1995-01-02',85,'Released',NULL,'The White Balloon',46785,1.4994,7.488,'bltXpgXuUp8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12625,_binary '\0','/pkFlSypkCFKaFdiA9omyplXaIE6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112446',6.2,3334,'cn','百變星君','A rich playboy gets blown up by a gangster when he flirts with the gangster\'s wife. Through a series of circumstances, his professor makes him a synthetic body that allows him to change into anything he wants.','/xhTTKU7SfZQ3pg3gmelSGJQqZdF.jpg','1995-08-19',92,'Released','He\'s a Sixty Million Dollar Man But He Has Only a Mouth, a Head, and a Penis!','Sixty Million Dollar Man',52324,2.8038,6.6,'om2mSgknmhI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12626,_binary '\0','/hljMglukfpnfaNmUgMuORmL4OVW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112453',7.1,52479,'en','Balto','An outcast half-wolf risks his life to prevent a deadly epidemic from ravaging Nome, Alaska.','/dCVcdb5oxDizqFLz0F7TE60NoC9.jpg','1995-12-22',78,'Released','His story became a legend. His adventure is one you\'ll never forget.','Balto',21032,6.5767,7.3,'GKH3bVyBDsg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12627,_binary '\0','/uudv3gXakt7O8qLy7QMMahKXFGm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112459',5.6,1599,'hi','Barsaat','A village boy named Badal, is attracted towards his classmate Tina, who belongs to a rich family. However, her father disapproves of their relationship and gets him arrested under false charges.','/qsN7GlJnTewDZwtKcyPZDCd6JlF.jpg','1995-09-29',165,'Released',NULL,'Barsaat',46375,1.2025,5.2,'TnudLtApsZo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12628,_binary '\0','/oDdRrwTCgaDzAshScrFO09qWqPB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112461',7.3,134464,'en','The Basketball Diaries','A high school basketball player’s life turns upside down after free-falling into the harrowing world of drug addiction.','/AhvO1GGDPIgN0hOqZEgaFCbswMK.jpg','1995-04-21',102,'Released','The true story of the death of innocence and the birth of an artist.','The Basketball Diaries',10474,7.115,7.4,'Jg78DNeKM1o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12629,_binary '\0','/snlu32RmjldF9b068UURJg8sQtn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112462',5.5,284993,'en','Batman Forever','Batman faces off against two foes: the schizophrenic, horribly scarred former District Attorney Harvey Dent, aka Two-Face, and the Riddler, a disgruntled ex-Wayne Enterprises inventor seeking revenge against his former employer by unleashing his brain-sucking weapon on Gotham City\'s residents. As the caped crusader also copes with tortured memories of his parents\' murder, he has a new romance, with psychologist Chase Meridian.','/i0fJS8M5UKoETjjJ0zwUiKaR8tr.jpg','1995-06-16',121,'Released','Courage now, truth always, Batman forever!','Batman Forever',414,14.5858,5.464,'iKKEK8qb8nk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12630,_binary '\0','/1SE8rswLgoqvW1savbevMWNdCBr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112469',4,1679,'en','Beastmaster III: The Eye of Braxus','Before he died, Dar\'s father gave a mysterious amulet to Tal, Dar\'s younger brother who is now king. Dar, while wandering with his animal companions, chances to meet and rescue a family who seek the help of King Tal against Lord Agon, a sorcerer who has conquered their land. Dar obtains an audience for them with Tal, who rallies his troops to march against Agon in the morning. Alas, the young king is captured by Agon\'s crimson warriors during the night.','/8nC2YMR0lHnPNUv7LGdt9DuXiam.jpg','1996-05-24',92,'Released','A legendary hero. A battle beyond imagination.','Beastmaster III: The Eye of Braxus',36291,2.1643,4.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12631,_binary '\0','/qA2TyqPldTtoTVY3LKrNIG5g6bH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112471',8.1,384090,'en','Before Sunrise','An unexpected meeting on a train leads two travelers to spend an evening wandering through Vienna. As the night unfolds, they share stories and conversations about life and love, exploring new ideas while a quiet intimacy grows between them, knowing it may be their only night together.','/kf1Jb1c2JAOqjuzA3H4oDM263uB.jpg','1995-01-27',101,'Released','Can the greatest romance of your life last only one night?','Before Sunrise',76,15.0954,7.968,'jGvcbSabADM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12632,_binary '\0','/uGRGIj8Cx8B4xNOcoMWFWL7YdE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112480',5.9,2312,'sv','Bert - den siste oskulden','The film is based on a series of immensely popular Swedish children\'s books, about the boy Bert, who is just hitting puberty and having the usual problems with it. But that\'s where the usual ends abruptly.','/t1erh5XRQpHcHa7AXTIbEnGsadq.jpg','1995-12-25',100,'Released','This is the movie about my 3 favorite things: Girls, Women, and Ladies','Bert: The Last Virgin',36674,1.7972,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12633,_binary '\0','/vVCzDbzkrM69JBU2ZH799grylmH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112483',4.9,2783,'en','Best of the Best 3: No Turning Back','A martial arts instructor comes to the defense of a schoolteacher who has taken a stand against a local white supremacist organization.','/kUZ2Hbj2Gjpou5uQVzgqh2ELZiK.jpg','1995-05-17',90,'Released',NULL,'Best of the Best 3: No Turning Back',36555,3.2508,5.624,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12634,_binary '\0','/hNtzhMa7E4URgr9CPqR4hFqKXzQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112492',4.3,1652,'en','Beware: Children at Play','Parents are in a panic as their children mysteriously disappear. Little do they know that the only thing worse than their children disappearing would be them coming back. After the youngsters of Ellenburg fall under the ruthless control of a cult leader, they turn on their parents with gruesome results.','/eUTs5eIhzqpi2Esepxui9HVu6dx.jpg','1989-11-24',94,'Released','These Aren\'t Children...They Are Demons!','Beware: Children at Play',67309,1.2254,4,'V1eHFk87bp0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12635,_binary '\0','/dcGsNJtwBXnXmSqze0289IjScTR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112495',6.5,5738,'en','Beyond Rangoon','Dr. Laura Bowman is a young widow who\'s unwittingly drawn into political turmoil while vacationing in Burma in the late 1980s. Bowman initially left San Francisco with her sister in an attempt to escape painful memories of her husband and son\'s violent deaths. But her fight to escape to Thailand could prove just as harrowing.','/xTiy5kSP3Hetig7xB4E8INq5ron.jpg','1995-08-25',100,'Released','Truth has a witness','Beyond Rangoon',1873,2.6171,6.5,'Ow_yBFgyUvQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12636,_binary '\0','/bSE6JsSOvY350NhaT2nhUhl5hUE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112499',5.6,12155,'en','The Big Green','In a depressed Texas town, British foreign exchange teacher Anna attempts to inject some life into her hopeless kids by introducing them to soccer. They\'re terrible at first, but Anna and her football-hero assistant whip them into shape. As they work overtime, the pair help kids build their self-esteem and also get involved in solving family squabbles.','/nVHqIuBTcTLmAIrML7T704UwfNI.jpg','1995-09-29',100,'Released','The biggest kick of the year!','The Big Green',26441,3.9589,5.6,'K4MltltKq4k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12637,_binary '\0','/xtgQkD280doGaFOL3c2LVokz3tt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112508',6.4,169250,'en','Billy Madison','Billy Madison is the 27 year-old son of Bryan Madison, a very rich man who has made his living in the hotel industry. Billy stands to inherit his father\'s empire, but only if he can make it through all 12 grades, 2 weeks per grade, to prove that he has what it takes to run the family business.','/sOdgtJdFalL9kRKaeJItARLTAEq.jpg','1995-02-10',90,'Released','To inherit his family\'s fortune, Billy is going back to school... Way back.','Billy Madison',11017,7.4439,6.18,'WMNX2dP6RNY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12638,_binary '\0','/xbEmI681B0aeYkIXQ2Nlfj42GCF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112513',7.4,2028,'ja','劇場版 美少女戦士セーラームーンSuperS セーラー9戦士集結！ブラック・ドリーム・ホールの奇跡','The wicked Badiyanu has come to capture all Earth\'s children to gain enough power to absorb the planet in her Black Dream Hole. The Black Dream Hole is in Badiyanu\'s castle and absorbs the dream energy from children. The more children Badiyanu kidnaps, the larger the dream hole gets. The Sailor Team must save Earth\'s children and prevent the Black Dream Hole from enveloping the entire planet!','/11GoqlOv0AqNZ4V9w3oUhBMg86r.jpg','1995-12-23',60,'Released','The Magical Dream Vortex! Sailor Soldiers please save the children\'s dreams!','Sailor Moon SuperS: The Movie - Black Dream Hole',28460,4.177,7.9,'uMGMTPfxVAU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12639,_binary '\0','/fG2rz1ffmV5iGIHlo4qSqJ6fyRS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112519',4.6,1465,'en','Black Scorpion','Darcy is a cop who is also a supehero named Black Scorpion at night who kicks and beats evildoers to a pulp. She soon catches wind of an asthmatic mad scientist who plans on tainting the city\'s air supply with a toxin. Only Darcy in her superhero garb can stop him with the assistance of a petty thief named Argyle.','/69Pznt0OTEAw5XWQa6LvuuflITg.jpg','1995-08-22',92,'Released','Justice has a nasty sting.','Black Scorpion',27010,3.6076,5.5,'6qSzRRlarBI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12640,_binary '\0','/pheHY9ChIKEyBT8MHQ3dN2XRhDu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112527',5.9,1519,'en','Blood & Donuts','In 1994, in Toronto, the vampire Boya awakens from his twenty-five years of sleep in a basement hit by a golf ball. He takes a cab to the local cemetery, retrieves his belongings from a grave and lodges in a low budget hotel nearby an all-night donut shop. Boya does not drink human blood anymore but rats and pigeons blood instead. While in the donut shop, Boya befriends and protects the taxi driver Earl, who is having trouble with two criminals, and falls in love for the waitress Molly. Meanwhile, his former passion of 1969, Rita, who misses her lost youth, is trying to locate him.','/vxwWv2jgAL1rFGn1gllUTlFA2NL.jpg','1995-09-09',90,'Released','There is a place between the living and the dead... and it\'s open 24 hours','Blood & Donuts',57221,1.1374,5.4,'e1CwjrAAfxc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12641,_binary '\0','/fOVWjkc3sdHNQe6ymgCEheXVpct.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112536',4.9,4497,'en','Bloodsport II','After thief Alex Cardo gets caught while stealing an ancient katana in East Asia, he soon finds himself imprisoned and beaten up by the crowd there. One of the guards, Demon, feels upset by Alex appearance and tortures him as often as he gets the opportunity. Alex finds a friend and mentor in the jailhouse, Master Sun, who teaches him a superior fighting style called Iron Hand. When a \'best of the best kumite\' is to take place, Demon gets an invitation. Now Master Sun and Alex need to find a way to let Alex take part in the kumite too.','/4yHbsdHLHapmWaOcOcRShqWbr4s.jpg','1996-03-01',90,'Released','Caught between honor and revenge, how far will one man go...','Bloodsport II',25087,3.0875,5.377,'RV42hof83ws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12642,_binary '\0','/aJPhyf6gGakSe0XBjFsay6Mxef5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112537',5.1,3181,'en','Blue Juice','JC is the hero of the Cornish surfing community. Staring thirty hard in the face, he fears that the wave that has carried him through a prolonged adolescence is heading for the rocks as his girlfriend pressures him for commitment and his friends contemplate growing up.','/ohed7RGWkbkiUbVXsAc1SOj6wpi.jpg','1995-09-15',90,'Released','The ride is wild!','Blue Juice',18762,2.7051,4.1,'e5MWplVDWu8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12643,_binary '\0','/qszPxuer6ibhX8IAFVrGPeAGlAF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112541',6.6,10653,'en','Blue in the Face','A wacky group of locals visit the neighborhood cigar shop, looking for good times and finding plenty of hilarious fun. But when the greedy owner threatens to close the shop for good and turn it into a trendy vegetarian restaurant, the neighborhood proves they\'ll do just about anything to save their favorite hangout.','/u0iwm9SDjlfFZDrSdSbcebX7VUG.jpg','1995-09-15',83,'Released','Welcome to the planet Brooklyn.','Blue in the Face',5894,3.7244,6.5,'72ue1Jqy01E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12644,_binary '\0','/r0vO7Tlu3kUNZxzGGXzqfp9pX3R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112546',6.4,1873,'es','Boca a Boca','For financial reasons, an aspiring actor begins working for a phone-sex enterprise. Through his new line of work, he develops relationships with two regular clients: Bill, an elderly homosexual, and Amanda, a mysterious femme fatale.','/j0ovimfy5YFwWMOBO8jtkvOmtdf.jpg','1995-11-10',106,'Released','Let your fingers do the talking.','Mouth to Mouth',62364,1.5236,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12645,_binary '\0','/mxpBKB25cWU8YahkWyn1i5OJ04y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112553',8.1,15328,'ta','பம்பாய்','A Hindu man and a Muslim woman fall in love in a small village and move to Mumbai, where they have two children. However, growing religious tensions and erupting riots threaten to tear the family apart.','/g1FXpdQogl84eztCsLI3h8Kmp69.jpg','1995-03-10',141,'Released',NULL,'Bombay',26247,2.4599,7.253,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12646,_binary '\0','/8XFrlAj1k83k0TaEb92qA5RRz6K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112556',7,3208,'fr','Le bonheur est dans le pré','Francis, the boss of a small plumbing supply company, is harassed by tax collectors, striking employees, and an impossible wife and daughter. His only joy is sharing lunch with his friend Gerard. Then a TV show called \"where are you?\" shows a woman from Gers who is searching for her husband who disappeared 28 years ago. The lost husband looks like an identical twin of Francis...','/tjHn19RpFMBmzQx58SBO40nLvhu.jpg','1995-12-06',106,'Released',NULL,'Happiness Is in the Field',43612,1.5051,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12647,_binary '\0','/xOZPqUEL6MeuCUD2gmKjaYOqKx6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112562',6.6,1826,'fa','بوی پیرهن یوسف','َA father, Daei Ghafur, does not accept his son\'s death during 1980-1988 conflict between Iran and Iraq, and believes he is alive despite all evidence indicating otherwise. One day he meets a young lady, Shirin, at the airport who has travelled from Europe to Iran looking for his brother, Khosrow, a missing soldier at war. Both start searching their loved ones...','/6JUkVo2Wdw91QHIGluhfr7IrTlb.jpg','1995-01-01',100,'Released',NULL,'The Scent of Joseph\'s Shirt',430734,1.1559,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12648,_binary '\0','/gja1HJCm1byNL6AsM8BSv6LveNk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112571',6.5,16441,'en','Boys on the Side','After breaking up with her girlfriend, a nightclub singer, Jane, answers a personal ad from Robin, a real estate agent with AIDS, seeking a cross-country travel partner. On their journey from New York City to Los Angeles, the two stop by Pittsburgh to pick up Jane\'s friend Holly, who is trying to escape an abusive relationship. With three distinct personalities, the women must overcome their differences to help one another.','/2dhZnfBjiza5TupvOupRU4hFAcJ.jpg','1995-02-03',115,'Released','A motion picture that celebrates the art of survival, the gift of laughter and the miracle of friendship.','Boys on the Side',9382,7.989,6.403,'zr7YfmdIDjU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12649,_binary '\0','/aKKJttuN9RD8yTU8NHL9UkdJwip.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112572',6.3,26539,'en','The Brady Bunch Movie','The original \'70s TV family is now placed in the 1990s, where they\'re even more square and out of place than ever.','/kbJfBJh5vEf5356Jlm6P37H48hD.jpg','1995-02-16',89,'Released','They\'re back to save America from the \'90s.','The Brady Bunch Movie',9066,5.2344,6.1,'zMicH5Mt7_s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12650,_binary '\0','/1m1c5gIWWkb1FEC9lzsoXHhhs7b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112573',8.3,1172304,'en','Braveheart','Enraged at the slaughter of Murron, his new bride and childhood love, Scottish warrior William Wallace slays a platoon of the local English lord\'s soldiers. This leads the village to revolt and, eventually, the entire country to rise up against English rule.','/or1gBugydmjToAEq7OZY0owwFk.jpg','1995-05-24',178,'Released','Every man dies, not every man really lives.','Braveheart',197,24.1311,7.944,'nMft5QDOHek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12651,_binary '\0','/4TnGcUsyd6ixuLWHaaEG5BGkAIp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112579',7.6,98025,'en','The Bridges of Madison County','Photographer Robert Kincaid wanders into the life of housewife Francesca Johnson for four days in the 1960s.','/aCBrhOQjhG397GLkEZ49zReQEKX.jpg','1995-06-02',135,'Released','A love like this happens to some of us sooner or later. For Robert and Francesca, it was later.','The Bridges of Madison County',688,9.901,7.7,'ZoJJkAQV0Bg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12652,_binary '\0','/FMzWki3kw14V8SzQjFaAmR4AWR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112585',6.6,9222,'en','The Brothers McMullen','Deals with the lives of the three Irish Catholic McMullen brothers from Long Island, New York, over three months, as they grapple with basic ideas and values — love, sex, marriage, religion and family — in the 1990s.','/6oWsOJP0ed5gs8n2UywcailoxFN.jpg','1995-08-11',98,'Released','Sometimes the Best Friends Are the Ones You\'ve Known Your Whole Life.','The Brothers McMullen',16388,1.6745,6.1,'WPsbUcvKzxQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12653,_binary '\0','/fyy4NAy6D9AdGomxGdtdg7vrQex.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112602',5.7,7436,'en','Bushwhacked','A inept courier realises he has been used by criminals to deliver money. On the run from both the criminals and police, he poses as a Scout leader and leads a scout group on a hike through the mountains.','/j3H0POtvl0Tt4Meesvp7HX6JxAv.jpg','1995-08-04',90,'Released','They wanted a great adventure. What they got was \"Mad Max\" Grabelski.','Bushwhacked',26258,2.7706,5.397,'ZkzvOmPOpYI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12654,_binary '\0','/pdv8Br6JWG3OWnWZE36CTpHBWZd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112604',6.3,2265,'en','Butterfly Kiss','Deeply mentally unbalanced drifter Eunice roams grim northern Britain committing psychosexual serial murders of both men and women while ostensibly searching for an unknown woman named Judith. She spares the life of lonely but kind-hearted gas station cashier Miriam, who abandons her dismal life to follow her damaged new lover. While attempting to hide the evidence of her multiple crimes, Miriam tries to understand Eunice\'s bizarre quest.','/dmQ2rKLSsofdXok2y9Xp5gfUqaB.jpg','1995-07-06',88,'Released','A story of love and redemption.','Butterfly Kiss',48260,2.2778,6.4,'xC7p1cO4JCQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12655,_binary '\0','/ugDa1khwE3yDFBQ7KXnvCnO93Ot.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112606',6.2,5571,'en','Bye Bye Love','With varying degrees of success, recently divorced friends Dave, Vic and Donny are trying to move on with their lives. Vic feels vilified by his ex-wife\'s parents, while Donny has a shaky bond with his teen daughter, Emma. Dave, meanwhile, has an enviable problem -- he has more dates than he can handle. As they confront their post-marital challenges, the men take solace in one another\'s plights.','/qMAvEXDLLhIKJzCSiMUgn1ypsO4.jpg','1995-03-16',106,'Released','Donny, Dave and Vic are best friends. They have everything in common ... ex-wives, new girlfriends, and the kids for the weekend.','Bye Bye Love',30528,2.1518,6,'cKXyXSO9t74','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12656,_binary '\0','/q7C3pXklXXKuSpIQShgRzlN4Wqp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112609',7.1,2088,'es','Caballos salvajes','Jose is an elderly rebel who, after being refused a withdrawal at a bank, returns with a gun and threatens to shoot himself if he doesn\'t get his cash. Pedro, a young teller, is disillusioned with his life and sees Jose\'s stunt as a way out when he pretends to be taken hostage, leaving the bank with the old man and a hefty amount of money. The unlikely duo become friends, picking up tough-girl Ana along the way, while avoiding the police.','/6kqnuivr2qnqqIaUJKqDQ9fd8ST.jpg','1995-08-10',122,'Released','Every man risks every time he chooses... and that makes him free','Wild Horses',32208,1.0983,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12657,_binary '\0','/aUymGblKsS1JHdpXFR2yTO2y7gh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112619',7.3,3677,'es','El callejón de los milagros','Heated tempers, frustrated desires and dashed hopes plague a diverse group of individuals whose lives cross paths in Mexico City. There is the bar-owner\'s son, Chava, who yearns to emigrate to America. A poor barber, Abel, is madly in love with the gorgeous Alma, who eventually becomes a high-class prostitute. Finally, there is Susanita, the desperate spinster who pursues many love affairs in hopes of finding a husband.','/nqBmwrAWuhfEiPwVdYYmC1VzNeN.jpg','1995-05-05',140,'Released','The most awarded film in Mexican history.','Midaq Alley',18205,2.5916,7.307,'H6cosTYH8E0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12658,_binary '\0','/tMZ2iT1bu4zWNVzeQ8SZ040VQfG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112625',5.3,15890,'en','Candyman: Farewell to the Flesh','Annie, a young schoolteacher struggling to solve the brutal murder of her father, unwittingly summons the \"Candyman\" to New Orleans, where she learns the secret of his power, and discovers the link that connects them.','/2scgM9dFaHEppWb3tS99gCAh8KX.jpg','1995-03-17',95,'Released','Evil comes when you call his name.','Candyman: Farewell to the Flesh',10824,4.7038,5.5,'jpInUUDkZwo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12659,_binary '\0','/1a1QU6pD3MzrjrPXhBctuPm3oCl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112637',6.8,6221,'en','Carrington','Painter Dora Carrington develops an intimate but extremely complex bond with writer Lytton Strachey. Though Lytton is a homosexual, he is enchanted by the mysterious Dora and they begin a lifelong friendship that has strangely romantic undertones. Eventually, Lytton and Dora decide to live together, despite the fact that the latter has fallen in love with military man Ralph Partridge, whom she plans to marry.','/8NmeBTkC4UQa8XT2GGsBN2R8Bqo.jpg','1995-05-25',121,'Released','A love story so unusual it has to be true.','Carrington',47018,1.8789,6.2,'w60AMje46pA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12660,_binary '\0','/iZGiMD0p1M2AOmzKknFo5bkuz94.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112641',8.2,628065,'en','Casino','In Las Vegas, two best friends--a casino executive and a Mafia enforcer--compete for a gambling empire and a fast-living, fast-loving socialite.','/gziIkUSnYuj9ChCi8qOu2ZunpSC.jpg','1995-11-22',179,'Released','No one stays at the top forever.','Casino',524,13.8158,7.998,'zFUKn_75m1o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12661,_binary '\0','/sQPckU0TfSeYIlUneHfIXwzQC2f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112642',6.2,161274,'en','Casper','Casper is a kind young ghost who peacefully haunts a mansion in Maine. When specialist James Harvey arrives to communicate with Casper and his fellow spirits, he brings along his teenage daughter, Kat. Casper quickly falls in love with Kat, but their budding relationship is complicated not only by his transparent state, but also by his troublemaking apparition uncles and their mischievous antics.','/2ah8fNJFZVU3vcXhU5xfAYi2eym.jpg','1995-05-26',100,'Released','Seeing is believing.','Casper',8839,10.4341,6.347,'kRX7PPqbKaQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12662,_binary '\0','/a6Ha2K2VGQVDEPL76oN8qLVnqAH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112651',7.8,8131,'en','The Celluloid Closet','Exuberant, eye-opening movie that serves up a dazzling hundred-year history of the role of gay men and lesbians have had on the silver screen. Film contains fabulous footage from 120 films showing the changing face of cinema sexuality, from cruel stereotypes to covert love to the activist triumphs of the 1990s.','/x0DSh3uMeQk6EG1DHjGJUywN7C0.jpg','1996-03-15',102,'Released',NULL,'The Celluloid Closet',32562,1.9538,7.3,'JL_vrb4-6_0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12663,_binary '\0','/oP6Eik48JT6YeGeEmVgyumP6ZVd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112654',6.5,2215,'fr','Les Cent et Une Nuits de Simon Cinéma','Monsieur Cinema, a hundred years old, lives alone in a large villa. His memories fade away, so he engages a young woman to tell him stories about all the movies ever made.','/cHyi6Ro293kZlYctdPXnzPVndRt.jpg','1995-01-25',105,'Released',NULL,'One Hundred and One Nights',94771,2.8311,6.1,'ulqWFu33oEQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12664,_binary '\0','/f0EJHNWtscxlZeREO7o1D7JcQ5v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112667',7,1408,'en','The Christmas Box','A ski-shop owner reluctantly moves himself, his wife, and his daughter in to an estate as live-in help for an elderly widow. While struggling to balance his career and family life, he has recurring dreams about an angel.','/ezbT2hvOHJJlhSg6JifhPf5ODBV.jpg','1995-12-17',100,'Released',NULL,'The Christmas Box',57857,1.0455,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12665,_binary '\0','/8SHUNL0AlfzYC4TZIQzseU63BSp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112679',6.7,9849,'en','Circle of Friends','Three girlhood friends now at college share first loves, first kisses and first betrayals. At the center of it all is the best-looking boy on campus. Can a self-conscious dreamer hook the biggest fish in the pond?','/2QLTcXxrdSBrEgQZjPjpCf5QS4f.jpg','1995-04-07',103,'Released','For everyone who ever thought the person they loved was out of their reach','Circle of Friends',22625,3.3946,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12666,_binary '\0','/kCmVAb2J81guVgk14lX7wLfFjMO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112681',7.4,27066,'en','Citizen X','Based on the true story of a Russian serial killer who, over many years, claimed victim to over 50 people. His victims were mostly under the age of 17. In what was then a communists state, the police investigations were hampered by bureaucracy, incompetence and those in power. The story is told from the viewpoint of the detective in charge of the case.','/mr3lIjSRhXGVP2o9HY3P9PX2KsH.jpg','1995-02-25',105,'Released','You don\'t want to know what he does... You just want to know when he\'s caught.','Citizen X',12554,3.8194,7.2,'20KiHIT6wu0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12667,_binary '\0','/yDjsUoEANHggKFabkAyTu3Y9j4N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112682',7.4,75331,'fr','La Cité des enfants perdus','A scientist in a surrealist society kidnaps children to steal their dreams, hoping that they slow his aging process.','/zwTqStZ0wCDoi5hD1wZjJjUKtFq.jpg','1995-05-17',112,'Released','Where happily ever after is just a dream.','The City of Lost Children',902,6.1423,7.2,'F-F3Fz6DadE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12668,_binary '\0','/YDIYCzQrBkFRkzNsEvV6eiQ2ML.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112685',4.1,1481,'en','Class of Nuke \'Em High 3: The Good, the Bad and the Subhumanoid','It\'s the final chapter in the cult classic Class of Nuke\'Em High Trilogy, and this time the fate of Tromaville hangs in the balance! Following the destruction of the Nukamama Power Plant by the lovable and horribly mutated toxic squirrel Tromie. Roger Smith (Brick Bronsky) and his half-subhumanoid son Adlai (also played by Brick Bronsky) are working to rebuild Tromaville into a place where human and subhumanoid can live together in peace. Unbeknownst to them, Adlai\'s twin brother Dick (again played by Brick Bronsky!), kidnapped at birth and raised by the evil Power Clite, has plans to regain contol of the Subhumanoids and turn Tromaville into a nuclear waste dump. In a showdown for the ages, \"The Good, the Bad and the Subhumanoid\" face off in an explosive sci-fi battle of epic proportions!','/izrRDVQfXQ1Ko9X2OZWLI43LOvK.jpg','1994-10-20',102,'Released',NULL,'Class of Nuke \'Em High 3: The Good, the Bad and the Subhumanoid',36217,1.4781,4.1,'X1n3Kam8qPQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12669,_binary '\0','/xhYs4yaBnDNM3utncVzLmFVpAmK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112688',6.9,25158,'en','Clockers','Strike is a young city drug pusher under the tutelage of drug lord Rodney Little. When a night manager at a fast-food restaurant is found with four bullets in his body, Strike’s older brother turns himself in as the killer. Detective Rocco Klein doesn’t buy the story, however, setting out to find the truth, and it seems that all the fingers point toward Strike & Rodney.','/c79uqLJleho2a7OQayfrW5Ypphf.jpg','1995-09-15',128,'Released','When there’s murder on the streets, everyone is a suspect.','Clockers',20649,3.7044,6.7,'YsFUoioGePc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12670,_binary '\0','/65d0MccsiRSPTVicregKQL8owoo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112697',6.9,282343,'en','Clueless','Shallow, rich and socially successful Cher is at the top of her Beverly Hills high school\'s pecking scale. Seeing herself as a matchmaker, Cher first coaxes two teachers into dating each other. Emboldened by her success, she decides to give hopelessly klutzy new student Tai a makeover. When Tai becomes more popular than she is, Cher realizes that her disapproving ex-stepbrother was right about how misguided she was -- and falls for him.','/8AwVTcgpTnmeOs4TdTWqcFDXEsA.jpg','1995-07-19',97,'Released','Sex. Clothes. Popularity. Is there a problem here?','Clueless',9603,12.4996,7.242,'KeGqX4GVBZE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12671,_binary '\0','/h5D0kYyT6oyzxOU3LRNeSgAABCZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112701',7.2,8140,'en','Cold Comfort Farm','In this adaptation of the satirical British novel, Flora Poste, a plucky London society girl orphaned at age 19, finds a new home with some rough relatives, the Starkadders of Cold Comfort Farm. With a take-charge attitude and some encouragement from her mischievous friend, Mary, Flora changes the Starkadders\' lives forever when she settles into their rustic estate, bringing the backward clan up to date and finding inspiration for her novel in the process.','/fkPm7MQhn3YqcRDM9qFDKNHiw7D.jpg','1995-04-25',95,'Released','She discovered a new branch of her family tree... the one with all the nuts.','Cold Comfort Farm',32513,2.4811,6.8,'6P_1oFBbKZ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12672,_binary '\0','/j10hT6IF87L48zBlVMeJJcc6QAC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112702',6.7,4330,'en','Coldblooded','Cosmo, an affectless mob bookie who lives in the basement of a retirement home, is promoted to hitman. He learns his new trade from Steve, a seasoned killer. He falls in love with a yoga teacher, Jasmine, and must figure out a way to leave the mob so they can be together.','/zfU3QJVqnY3wW1La9ptrOYGFdbP.jpg','1995-09-15',92,'Released',NULL,'Coldblooded',32502,2.0252,6.229,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12673,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112705',7.1,2138,'en','Strange Bedfellows','A man murders his compulsive gambling brother, frames a mob bookie for the crime, and then murders the bookie and claims self-defense. He finds himself being investigated by Lt. Columbo, and in trouble with the bookie\'s mob boss.',NULL,NULL,89,'Released','columbo','Strange Bedfellows',1409269,0.4821,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12674,_binary '\0','/v6AxhNXz5P2Yx7akvnDjXnt8aaW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112710',7.2,1607,'pt','A Comédia de Deus','An ice-cream seller lusts after the female employees in his shop.','/5Y4VOCIpLvHFf62UyOuWNtrkc7K.jpg','1996-01-20',162,'Released',NULL,'God\'s Comedy',49974,1.9076,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12675,_binary '\0','/9qD8MFDvlZD0IPU42BmtFEiPyDr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112714',7.4,1668,'fr','Le Confessionnal','Pierre Lamontagne has returned to Quebec to attend his father\'s funeral. He meets up with his adopted brother, Marc, who has begun questioning his identity and has embarked on a quest for his roots that would lead them to the Quebec of the 1950s. Past and present converge in a complex web of intrigue where the answer to the mystery lies.','/9ApR0PwQdlnvc76NmlbUWkeAK9i.jpg','1995-09-29',100,'Released','Two brother united by the past and torn by the sacred vow of confession.','The Confessional',99040,1.3773,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12676,_binary '\0','/dT8Fhrh3eVazbuSSIarFPXniQh4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112715',5.4,53541,'en','Congo','Eight people embark on an expedition into the Congo, a mysterious expanse of unexplored Africa, where human greed and the laws of nature have gone berserk.','/hPNSToNIIpRO6y5Rh973leqQqNr.jpg','1995-06-09',108,'Released','Where you are the endangered species.','Congo',10329,6.4096,5.617,'QpdbdpOqLuY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12677,_binary '\0','/f0wTYitK1lELuGygXslG7SQpY0E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112722',6.6,87884,'en','Copycat','An agoraphobic psychologist and a female detective must work together to take down a serial killer who copies serial killers from the past.','/oMgwJb016znNZcpDR20eXxZoW8A.jpg','1995-10-27',124,'Released','One man is copying the most notorious killers in history one at a time. Together, two women must stop him from killing again. Or they’re next.','Copycat',1710,6.7611,6.484,'7RaBcFSABEM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12678,_binary '\0','/mjlRoaURNhcW5YmXev8Z4UrV7x6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112740',7.4,138232,'en','Crimson Tide','After the Cold War, a breakaway Russian republic with nuclear warheads becomes a possible worldwide threat. U.S. submarine Capt. Frank Ramsey signs on a relatively green but highly recommended Lt. Cmdr. Ron Hunter to the USS Alabama, which may be the only ship able to stop a possible Armageddon. When Ramsey insists that the Alabama must act aggressively, Hunter, fearing they will start rather than stop a disaster, leads a potential mutiny to stop him.','/21nqRJ6ofEgVvEl68J4O9V26Xzy.jpg','1995-05-12',116,'Released','Danger runs deep.','Crimson Tide',8963,13.8008,7.188,'cc0Az3IJFOU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12679,_binary '\0','/oi9RFxqb5Tncm7VvDnVT6sZUWyH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112744',6.3,15649,'en','The Crossing Guard','Unable to move on from the loss of his daughter, Freddy, now a shell of the person he was before, swears to kill the man responsible for her death.','/kogaCIIylHmWQo2gJrrdq8Br8b8.jpg','1995-01-26',111,'Released','...some lives cross, others collide.','The Crossing Guard',27526,4.2469,6,'kDdwRURSEzI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12680,_binary '\0','/i1b7potegowFC5g11Bs4kdqOVDE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112749',6.8,2189,'en','Cry, the Beloved Country','A South-African preacher goes to search for his wayward son who has committed a crime in the big city.','/96TZr6o4kuiIEryC5jkzaQoP6m5.jpg','1995-12-15',106,'Released',NULL,'Cry, the Beloved Country',34615,2.3062,6.8,'1nejmbo5c9A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12681,_binary '\0','/aNPC0up2DinxoW23lF6R6yGLTAQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112750',6.4,14551,'en','Crying Freeman','A lethal assassin for a secret Chinese organisation, who sheds tears of regret each time he kills, is seen swiftly and mercilessly executing three Yakuza gangsters by a beautiful artist. She is captivated by the grace of his kill and later falls in love with him. An intense power struggle for the leadership of the Yakuza Clans ensues as they seek vengeance for the death of their leader.','/8vkvIlExu2a8ZJRdbw5rywmeaQX.jpg','1995-04-23',102,'Released','Once in a lifetime comes the perfect killer','Crying Freeman',9501,7.4373,6.4,'Paj-b9VJtm4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12682,_binary '\0','/cXliQvK1xSi9lSqP7qaBUyED1Az.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112757',7.7,12230,'en','The Cure','Erik, a loner, finds a friend in Dexter, an eleven-year-old boy with AIDS. They vow to find a cure for AIDS together and save Dexter\'s life in an eventful summer.','/3WN1H5NzLOjhY9AP848v8WPc9uu.jpg','1995-04-21',97,'Released','The best cure for a disease is friendship.','The Cure',6715,4.5342,7.9,'AKq57Gr_i9E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12683,_binary '\0','/hHoIQVAmTg4RM7PPNhNvMlJk3mg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112760',5.7,33556,'en','Cutthroat Island','Morgan Adams and her slave, William Shaw, are on a quest to recover the three portions of a treasure map. Unfortunately, the final portion is held by her murderous uncle, Dawg. Her crew is skeptical of her leadership abilities, so she must complete her quest before they mutiny against her. This is made yet more difficult by the efforts of the British crown to end her pirate raids.','/hYdeBZ4BFXivdouxLfQGWNE6zRx.jpg','1995-12-22',124,'Released','Be bold. Be brave. Be prepared.','Cutthroat Island',1408,7.5572,5.802,'WFn7VVN3Wvk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12684,_binary '\0','/bcSj4j8CfPRCHetc3pHhE1cHXU8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112767',7.1,5992,'vi','Xích lô','Follows a young cyclo driver on his poverty-driven descent into criminality in modern-day Ho Chi Minh City. The boy\'s struggles to scratch out a living for his two sisters and grandfather in the mean streets of the city lead to petty crime on behalf of a mysterious Madame from whom he rents his cyclo.','/mdOsnSVTLwHMEH1juOLMiwXcO5o.jpg','1995-09-27',123,'Released',NULL,'Cyclo',36266,3.008,6.944,'xqPxeyfzOd4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12685,_binary '\0','/gOXtwZxGnUxgpwPN9rEKKLYBTaQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112769',7.5,15479,'fr','La Cérémonie','Sophie, a quiet and shy maid working for an upper-class French family, finds a friend in the energetic and uncompromising postmaster Jeanne, who encourages her to stand up against her bourgeois employers.','/vq2x8JfEoVrdQZqo0fppjw7ZI3d.jpg','1995-08-30',112,'Released','France\'s Alfred Hitchcock Returns...','La Cérémonie',1802,7.6734,7.3,'2yTdbrL6MvM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12686,_binary '\0','/cvpq5L0LSrTvLBokQ0tsFdEysJ6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112778',7.5,9645,'cn','西遊記第壹佰零壹回之月光寶盒','When the Goddess of Happiness tosses the Longevity Monk and his disciples out of heaven (because the Monkey King tried to attain immortality), the Monkey King is reincarnated as the Joker. He now spends his time chasing two jealous women. When one of them is dying, the Joker goes back in time in an attempt to save her.','/wIDDJ3FXPmVnNpxVoZOvjjcKVqj.jpg','1995-01-21',88,'Released',NULL,'A Chinese Odyssey Part One: Pandora\'s Box',13345,4.4903,7.547,'ZPri1X1RVeo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12687,_binary '\0','/yK5vziICSiW6uHLltNqkZ1TXhNx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112792',6.5,61837,'en','Dangerous Minds','Former Marine Louanne Johnson lands a gig teaching in a pilot program for bright but underachieving teens at a notorious inner-city high school. After having a terrible first day, she decides she must throw decorum to the wind. When Johnson returns to the classroom, she does so armed with a no-nonsense attitude informed by her military training and a fearless determination to better the lives of her students -- no matter what the cost.','/yWHWC8fJRp2kLgiFrEa8o3krOH9.jpg','1995-08-11',99,'Released','She broke the rules... and changed their lives.','Dangerous Minds',9909,9.6807,7.02,'gA-5nLQCmW8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12688,_binary '\0','/mrmjRPR7Iy0g90rpRLtIUNqPDAo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112800',6.9,4164,'cn','刀','Adopted by a renowned swordsmith, a young man discovers that his biological father was killed by a powerful bandit called Lung. Leaving to seek revenge, he runs afoul of vicious desert scum, losing his right arm in the process. After being nursed back to health, he learns to compensate for his loss and returns to confront Lung.','/jLH5MxiYXtGiS96rl13Rz8TIPaG.jpg','1995-12-21',105,'Released',NULL,'The Blade',42845,2.9978,7.117,'fs-mGcLe7lk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12689,_binary '\0','/a7DtgKB187dUm9n81IlvNzVXsK1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112817',7.5,109889,'en','Dead Man','On the run after committing murder, an accountant encounters a strange Native American man who prepares him for his journey into the spiritual world.','/jX3wGBVoYoAY3IixBpwYk1fjT4z.jpg','1995-12-23',122,'Released','It is preferable not to travel with a dead man.','Dead Man',922,6.2628,7.3,'FEHMWguT--U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12690,_binary '\0','/gwRWQeHfPuA8mg73kydQsM8rdXq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112818',7.5,109504,'en','Dead Man Walking','A death row inmate turns for spiritual guidance to a local nun in the days leading up to his scheduled execution for the murders of a young couple.','/eShxyjhWoFl3BwsuEmVsr4nLaMZ.jpg','1995-12-29',122,'Released',NULL,'Dead Man Walking',687,7.3083,7.31,'CB89rktO_Ws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12691,_binary '\0','/c8H6Xi9im1tT6HP9PA9HpFE3sOy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112819',6.9,27081,'en','Dead Presidents','On the streets they call cash dead presidents. And that\'s just what a Vietnam veteran is after when he returns home from the war only to find himself drawn into a life of crime. With the aid of his fellow vets he plans the ultimate heist -- a daring robbery of an armored car filled with unmarked U.S. currency!','/eGfsSXizR11tTHVo0kuOOFPAxZt.jpg','1995-09-29',119,'Released','The only color that counts is green.','Dead Presidents',11443,4.6745,6.7,'NEFBEBSEzzE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12692,_binary '\0','/3DPb10hyznACc0KxPlgjgEbVMxw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112843',4.3,1472,'en','The Demolitionist','A murdered police officer is brought back to life by a cold-hearted scientist to serve as \"The Demolitionist\", the ultimate crime-fighting weapon in a city overrun by criminals and internal corruption','/iQTMxblJ58S0PnFK1tAUlYZLVQ4.jpg','1995-03-09',100,'Released','This time, the law takes off their cuffs','The Demolitionist',89904,2.008,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12693,_binary '\0','/r8WcJH9jVkzdYVA94UWzxHQp7JM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112844',6.6,1439,'en','Denise Calls Up','A group of friends in New York, working away at their PCs and laptops, keep in touch exclusively by phone and fax. They are all too busy to meet face to face. Gale plays matchmaker, by phone, to Jerry and Barbara who, in turn, hit it off beautifully – via phone and fax. Martin gets a telephone call from someone he\'s never met. It\'s Denise, with some extraordinary news. Tapping away at his computer all the while, he develops a sort of friendship with Denise – via phone. And so it goes as the friends, tap, tap, tapping away, share news, hopes, and dreams – via phone and fax. Finally Gale has an unfortunate encounter with a phone, Denise has some more news for Martin, and Frank plans a gala New Year\'s Eve party, but will he answer the door?','/ab8iYcRfEAFwzcrkYP8tJBISX1E.jpg','1995-05-17',80,'Released','A hilarious heart-ringing fable about life, love and hangups.','Denise Calls Up',47449,1.8318,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12694,_binary '\0','/pBje8Zw42aEy7E2IxrCIw9jM4qC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112851',7.1,210692,'en','Desperado','El Mariachi plunges headfirst into the dark border underworld when he follows a trail of blood to the last of the infamous Mexican drug lords, Bucho, for an action-packed, bullet-riddled showdown. With the help of his friend and a beautiful bookstore owner, El Mariachi tracks Bucho, takes on his army of desperados, and leaves his own trail of blood.','/e3gwpBeXpvGZsxUya9zNym5QXrw.jpg','1995-08-25',104,'Released','He came back to settle the score with someone. Anyone. EVERYONE.','Desperado',8068,10.6248,6.9,'nJb0yXRHdi4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12695,_binary '\0','/sC60syDjr6LfdwNDWWoRpmT7w8d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112854',4.6,2676,'en','Destiny Turns on the Radio','Johnny Destiny burns into Las Vegas in his hot Plymouth RoadRunner, stopping only to pick up a stranger stranded in the desert. But then, things aren\'t always as they seem. Anything can happen in that town of many possibilities...especially since there\'s been some weird electrical disturbances. As the stranger, fresh out of prison, tries to put his life back together--to recover his money from an old bank heist and the girl he lost in doing the job--something keeps interfering with his plans. Is it fate...or just Destiny?','/kd04IvuW1wvgGoB2HxSuFVIU9rU.jpg','1995-04-28',103,'Released','Fate visits in ways you never expect','Destiny Turns on the Radio',62488,2.1151,5,'4wNfb1lh7oE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12696,_binary '\0','/n6SFCz0OsyZ800ZSlaD5WpNmqCj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112857',6.8,27968,'en','Devil in a Blue Dress','In late 1940s Los Angeles, Easy Rawlins is an unemployed black World War II veteran with few job prospects. At a bar, Easy meets DeWitt Albright, a mysterious white man looking for someone to investigate the disappearance of a missing white woman named Daphne Monet, who he suspects is hiding out in one of the city\'s black jazz clubs. Strapped for money and facing house payments, Easy takes the job, but soon finds himself in over his head.','/yZ9vNEKOkd0GWWozsopW3SqflYQ.jpg','1995-09-29',102,'Released','Private detective Easy Rawlins has been caught on the wrong side of the most dangerous secret in town.','Devil in a Blue Dress',8512,5.431,6.5,'7bWekMNDfT8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12697,_binary '\0','/fBvSfLetWlAMevQVHa0nBDV1Fon.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112864',7.6,433373,'en','Die Hard: With a Vengeance','New York detective John McClane is back and kicking bad-guy butt in the third installment of this action-packed series, which finds him teaming with civilian Zeus Carver to prevent the loss of innocent lives. McClane thought he\'d seen it all, until a genius named Simon engages McClane, his new \"partner\" -- and his beloved city -- in a deadly game that demands their concentration.','/buqmCdFQEWwEpL3agGgg2GVjN2d.jpg','1995-05-19',128,'Released','Think fast. Look alive. Die hard.','Die Hard: With a Vengeance',1572,14.8284,7.284,'aRQetHOPpKA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12698,_binary '\0','/84beTJf26mfhoasUlKSOiNSutyS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112870',8,86824,'hi','दिलवाले दुल्हनिया ले जायेंगे','Raj is a rich, carefree, happy-go-lucky second generation NRI. Simran is the daughter of Chaudhary Baldev Singh, who in spite of being an NRI is very strict about adherence to Indian values. Simran has left for India to be married to her childhood fiancé. Raj leaves for India with a mission at his hands, to claim his lady love under the noses of her whole family. Thus begins a saga.','/lfRkUr7DYdHldAqi3PwdQGBRBPM.jpg','1995-10-20',190,'Released','Come… fall In love, all over again…','Dilwale Dulhania Le Jayenge',19404,13.6059,8.504,'_ZaPIKNg_EQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12699,_binary '\0','/aemN3zZKGptjYzGrzI1OxPou5V6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112873',1.6,3160,'no','Dis: En Historie om Kjærlighet','Two young people stand on a street corner in a run-down part of New York, kissing. Despite the lawlessness of the district they are left unmolested. A short distance away walk Maria and Andreas. They are on their first date. In an episodic style the film tells of encounters and love among young people. The stories are set in Cairo, Paris, on the coast of Normandy and in New York.','/dysWKZKjV79Lj8yzKRdCJ9TJ1Rj.jpg','1995-02-17',70,'Released','A story about love','Dis: A Story About Love',31133,0.8139,3.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12700,_binary '\0','/nnrITCU29fAVFDngn3eEwBsECPX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112883',6.7,55611,'en','Don Juan DeMarco','John Arnold DeMarco is a man who believes he is Don Juan, the greatest lover in the world. Clad in a cape and mask, DeMarco undergoes psychiatric treatment with Dr. Jack Mickler to cure him of his apparent delusion. But the psychiatric sessions have an unexpected effect on the psychiatric staff and, most profoundly, Dr Mickler, who rekindles the romance in his complacent marriage.','/fe0TuYz9jCKUba2Omj48K8bWJ8z.jpg','1994-10-12',97,'Released','The story of the man who thought he was the greatest lover in the world... and the people who tried to cure him of it!','Don Juan DeMarco',1909,5.2258,6.8,'AteQZ7q6rtA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12701,_binary '\0','/9mHvO0PzmEgxDtmRq3VeTVELYqb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112887',6.2,19122,'en','The Doom Generation','Jordan White and Amy Blue, two troubled teens, pick up an adolescent drifter, Xavier Red. Together, the threesome embarks on a sex- and violence-filled journey through a United States of psychos and quickie marts.','/tLfp9fHjydH6wzxukch5PWclga.jpg','1995-10-20',84,'Released','Sex. Violence. Whatever.','The Doom Generation',13552,4.7024,6.5,'PZM-vG8DcRc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12702,_binary '\0','/831cuXWhhB1yILRvHoevIB20dWi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112895',4.6,3186,'en','Dr. Jekyll and Ms. Hyde','A scientist creating perfumes inherits his great grandfather Dr. Jekyll\'s formula and decides to use modern technology to improve it. He ends up as an ambitious, ruthless woman. She tries to prevent returning into the spineless man.','/jSfC0KyRdP2BypWydrEcXOskfvH.jpg','1995-08-25',90,'Released','Helen Hyde wants the Doctor\'s body... She just doesn\'t want him in it at the same time.','Dr. Jekyll and Ms. Hyde',37019,3.0164,4.7,'jAB77OAJriI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12703,_binary '\0','/uyqK9lqHmP4aYtu7DaK9HhIcfea.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112896',5.9,49395,'en','Dracula: Dead and Loving It','When a lawyer shows up at the vampire\'s doorstep, he falls prey to his charms and joins him in his search for fresh blood. Enter Professor Van Helsing, who may be the only one able to vanquish the Count.','/5QmMhHdKpJ2eQp5i8NqopzGbw9r.jpg','1995-12-22',88,'Released','You\'ll laugh until you die...then you\'ll rise from the dead and laugh again!','Dracula: Dead and Loving It',12110,7.7435,6.1,'HGCKrgSeXcE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12704,_binary '\0','/q90O3NbVXwiaFElkPmr3FYjpBV3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112907',6.4,1322,'en','Drunks','At the beginning of a nightly Alcoholics Anonymous meeting, Jim seems particularly troubled. His sponsor encourages him to talk that night, the first time in seven months, so he does - and leaves the meeting right after. As Jim wanders the night, searching for some solace in his old stomping grounds, bars and parks where he bought drugs, the meeting goes on, and we hear the stories of survivors and addicts - some, like Louis, who claim to have wandered in looking for choir practice, who don\'t call themselves alcoholic, and others, like Joseph, whose drinking almost caused the death of his child - as they talk about their lives at the meeting','/lY5E0rjsgzlxUyMtUZRlzwHqLTA.jpg','1997-03-14',90,'Released','All they want is another shot...','Drunks',116844,1.5707,3.2,'_IguspdTqfQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12705,_binary '\0','/lInQVVbPjKFGX7GDcxNMXALy2Y4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112913',7.5,61165,'cn','墮落天使','An indifferent hitman, his infatuated business partner and an ex-convict search for love and meaning as their lives cross paths in Hong Kong.','/yyM9BPdwttK5LKZSLvHae7QPKo1.jpg','1995-09-06',98,'Released','The night\'s full of weirdos.','Fallen Angels',11220,8.9941,7.7,'uxaT19BlH0M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12706,_binary '\0','/ijBx6WyNU94rKKmt1iTkD9N1ujn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112922',7.3,25107,'es','El día de la bestia','When a rogue priest discovers the exact date the Antichrist will be born, he enlists a Death Metal record store clerk and a cheesy TV psychic for an urban spree of gore, sacrilege and twisted humor to prevent the Apocalypse.','/yEXhgACPIV4PmTgHT2HS3Ko2oS3.jpg','1995-10-20',104,'Released','A devilishly dark comedy.','The Day of the Beast',10722,4.2146,7.3,'hLdHqtURuzA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12707,_binary '\0','/ct80LPqrOXbMtxvKqxixfXuIOkP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112945',6.5,2334,'fr','Élisa','Marie has had a tough childhood ever since her mother Elisa committed suicide. She has spent most of her life in an orphanage and now makes a living as a small time criminal in Paris. Now she wants to unravel her past and find her father whom she blames for her mother\'s death.','/q5LWron7LvX1XeKtTNEs47oY6Sf.jpg','1995-02-01',115,'Released',NULL,'Élisa',58058,2.2283,6.4,'-FmJjY9Ig2E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12708,_binary '\0','/8ohWBqEn3Zh9ro0JulFKPfk0XDE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112950',6.7,71989,'en','Empire Records','The employees of an independent music store learn about each other as they try to stop the store from being absorbed by a large chain.','/qKP7hVdjAAvRvbF3GBCbzi5LzMf.jpg','1995-09-22',90,'Released','They\'re selling music but not selling out.','Empire Records',13531,5.7897,6.635,'c2-LdSfXo14','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12709,_binary '\0','/wY1Rn2DnmDt7QKnGSH5be3JM7u7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112966',6.6,19820,'en','The Englishman Who Went Up a Hill But Came Down a Mountain','When an English cartographer arrives in Wales to tell the residents of the Welsh village of Ffynnon Garw that their \'mountain\' is only a hill, the offended community sets out to remedy the situation.','/s96XNz6eBsYDK3A9nVyEuHdv7BG.jpg','1995-05-12',91,'Released','A romantic comedy about a town that wouldn\'t give up. A man who couldn\'t get out. And the mountain that brought them together.','The Englishman Who Went Up a Hill But Came Down a Mountain',10612,6.2155,6.346,'1UWT0dMrYOM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12710,_binary '\0','/zKZuUxLc2xxGwiZRyTeqBcU3hUO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112985',6.2,1902,'en','Escape to Witch Mountain','The tale of two orphan twins with special powers who go looking for their origins. The two are hindered by an avaricious tycoon who only wants to exploit their abilities.','/pe1VE1Sxhwar4lS5mtkA2Y7ygRN.jpg','1995-04-29',87,'Released',NULL,'Escape to Witch Mountain',239033,2.1899,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12711,_binary '\0','/wvbAwJbCgVVORfkI3gGAoDQmnXT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0112993',5.5,1582,'en','Evolver','A teenage boy gets a robotic opponent after winning a laser tag contest; however the robot is not what it seems!','/a0cNbTMqJF4hZqF8FjV5aVSatsY.jpg','1995-02-10',90,'Released','It was supposed to be a game.','Evolver',48038,1.7941,5.2,'UujcND6GaAE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12712,_binary '\0','/nlaHNTeoV7PRTFxBwoPQfCKupPa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113008',6.6,1772,'en','The Face on the Milk Carton','Based on the book by Caroline B. Cooney, a girl happens to look down at a milk carton one day and she sees herself on the back! Could her parents really have kidnapped her?','/oUa8n2GyjxE8K6R4DeWGlrIHop3.jpg','1995-05-24',87,'Released',NULL,'The Face on the Milk Carton',108227,2.0244,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12713,_binary '\0','/iFfbBL8vtiuTkqb9Os7lO8y3KnY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113010',4.4,14828,'en','Fair Game','Max Kirkpatrick is a cop who protects Kate McQuean, a civil law attorney, from a renegade KGB team out to terminate her','/qcxsWOzBaF7MZNNThtRQWQ9Wrdk.jpg','1995-11-03',91,'Released','He\'s a cop on the edge. She\'s a woman with a dangerous secret. They\'ve been targeted by the Russian mob, and now they\'re both Fair Game.','Fair Game',11859,5.1426,5.189,'Y5zrZnV-4dk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12714,_binary '\0','/9D2SaKXE5tnYMASY8XhS4Y3z6Vl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113014',5.4,2189,'en','Fall Time','Three young men decide to plan a mock kidnapping, but everything goes wrong because a real bank robbery was already planned by two other guys.','/rYFexSIWUXNhuIdTIVcvZSEGe5G.jpg','1995-05-13',88,'Released','Wrong People, Wrong Place, Wrong Time.','Fall Time',28732,1.9005,4.8,'Bh_d3EN9LyE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12715,_binary '\0','/ccu7qyf5Pw3prXVXxqnHTnplUen.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113018',6,1225,'en','Freefall: Flight 174','True story of a brand-new Canadian airliner running out of fuel in-flight and forced to glide to the nearest airfield.','/ppRwjaBU8LYxQRc0AKOc7CL8B24.jpg','1995-10-10',93,'Released','A true story of a hero in the making','Freefall: Flight 174',76036,2.2001,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12716,_binary '\0','/yAkyU8KhujyGjbFzbmJnndeMBIf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113024',5.4,1251,'en','Family of Cops','Paul Fein is a veteran police detective whose son Eddie is also a cop. Paul is assigned to investigate the murder of a prominent businessman, and he soon learns that the field of suspects has been narrowed down to two—the victim\'s sexually freewheeling wife Anna, and Paul\'s wild-child daughter Jackie. Neither Paul nor Eddie believe that Jackie could have committed the murder, and soon Paul is using himself as a decoy in a bid to find out more about what Anna does and doesn\'t know about her husband\'s death.','/2egbVICXRMfyX9ebrKmPVEYFdiG.jpg','1995-11-26',87,'Released','A one man cop shop in a two-timing town','Family of Cops',76392,1.729,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12717,_binary '\0','/rJHqxsUOU5NJ4DlsIlHYBuYMLS7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113026',5.7,1307,'en','The Fantasticks','Widowers Amos and Ben plot to romantically unite Amos\' daughter Luisa and Ben\'s son Matt by pretending to feud and forbidding the teens to associate, knowing they will resist their fathers\' interference. As the youngsters fall in love, the fathers plot to end the \'feud\' by hiring a travelling showman to fake an abduction and allow Matt to \'rescue\' Luisa.','/hfO64mXz3DgUxkBVU7no2UWRP7x.jpg','2000-09-22',86,'Released','Try to remember the first time magic happened','The Fantasticks',62127,1.5033,5.5,'K9Da-XCJvYM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12718,_binary '\0','/bDuosrdJBpHvNMD9pzWQcD4ldBv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113028',6.3,3589,'en','Far from Home: The Adventures of Yellow Dog','Teenager Angus adopts a stray dog and names him Yellow. Several days later, while travelling along the coast of British Columbia with Angus\'s father, John, the boy and dog become stranded when turbulent waters capsize their boat. Angus\'s parents relentlessly badger rescue teams. Angus, schooled by his father in wilderness survival skills, and assisted by the intelligent Yellow Dog, tries to attract rescuers.','/bHtNHOiSmfX1KlJwc9Jvc8sYcjB.jpg','1995-01-13',81,'Released','Partners in survival. Friends for life.','Far from Home: The Adventures of Yellow Dog',27985,2.8271,6.248,'fHbI2fohgeI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12719,_binary '\0','/lEsjVrGU21BeJjF5AF9EWsihDpw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113041',6.1,45944,'en','Father of the Bride Part II','Just when George Banks has recovered from his daughter\'s wedding, he receives the news that she\'s pregnant ... and that George\'s wife is expecting too. He was planning on selling their home, but that\'s a plan that—like George—will have to change with the arrival of both a grandchild and a kid of his own.','/rj4LBtwQ0uGrpBnCELr716Qo3mw.jpg','1995-12-08',106,'Released','Just when his world is back to normal... he\'s in for the surprise of his life!','Father of the Bride Part II',11862,7.0062,6.3,'yCg8WNQwe0A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12720,_binary '\0','/1tm1yizlkVTpAUxsk2ICkmLWxJt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113043',3.9,1760,'en','The Fear','Richard, a college student who has decided to focus his attention on the study of fear, invites a group of friends up to his family\'s secluded mountain cabin for the weekend. Soon, a lifelike, wooden carving of a man begins stalking and killing them.','/c5euWkCK5LTzHogAHxFoSXSwKPM.jpg','1995-01-20',102,'Released','He\'s whatever scares you the most.','The Fear',75555,1.9015,4,'9LjcJdtfVUw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12721,_binary '\0','/gi15b6N5cI0NqdWO6KpxqFasw02.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113049',5.2,2270,'it','Fermo posta Tinto Brass','A successful erotic film producer from Rome regularly receives letters from female fans seeking his advice on how to spice up their sex lives. Thanks to his years of experience in both the film business and the sex industry, he has all sorts of tips at the ready and, in an emergency, is happy to make a house call himself to demonstrate his qualities in person.','/oGC1ByDVsAjPo8W3G078EYpvBWi.jpg','1995-08-30',81,'Released','A sensational collection of real-life sexual fantasies from the Master of Erotica.','P.O. Box Tinto Brass',55580,3.0235,5.989,'S7P7grGWUEA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12722,_binary '\0','/gN7EMCouAT0p3BT0Kk5eUMWw07E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113057',6.6,2119,'fr','La fille seule','A young Parisian must make major decisions about pregnancy, a job, and her boyfriend.','/8dFs6OW8T8Y1R56U2YdlDDBkUPj.jpg','1995-11-29',90,'Released',NULL,'A Single Girl',102461,2.3414,5.9,'gOU5irEzdVM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12723,_binary '\0','/hx8vvyZi687eQ8kVtTwAJid5w7c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113059',5.5,1377,'nl','Filmpje!','Bob and Annie separate. After the court case Annie gives Bob two airline tickets for a tropical island to save their relationship. However, Bob takes someone else with him on holiday: Carmen, the daughter of Mafioso Don Gorgonzola. Annie lags behind in Holland, where she falls in love again with other men.','/9ajYLWglNAfdORxRoHRbK1ZtAQM.jpg','1995-05-06',100,'Released',NULL,'Filmpje!',49323,0.8466,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12724,_binary '\0','/AqGx54sfSYtejIYual5RlLr2VhN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113063',5.5,1387,'en','The Final Cut','A former bomb squad leader comes out of retirement to investigate a series of bombings plaguing Seattle.','/2QH3IzMNnuPnGSgezNRETuxN7TZ.jpg','1995-11-05',96,'Released','3 seconds. 2 wires. 1 cut. No mistakes.','The Final Cut',2442,2.1383,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12725,_binary '\0','/tsgEdYjwWVhdGHv01djx7KdXDJm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113071',6,83256,'en','First Knight','The timeless tale of King Arthur and the legend of Camelot are retold in this passionate period drama. Arthur is reluctant to hand the crown to Lancelot, and Guinevere is torn between her loyalty to her husband and her growing love for his rival. But Lancelot must balance his loyalty to the throne with the rewards of true love.','/dJH5bwtu3UxbwRsSlhlhmMrV8ZH.jpg','1995-07-07',134,'Released','Their greatest battle would be for her love.','First Knight',6520,9.3486,6.088,'zO1_r6slUlk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12726,_binary '\0','/gWSgyx0rW25TGoTpmiGo1pYXBXk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113074',3.9,3817,'en','Fist of the North Star','From the immensely popular FIST OF THE NORTH STAR comic book series, comes a new hero. The fate of mankind rests with superhuman warrior Kenshiro who roams the wastelands of the future waging a battle against overwhelming evil. With the spiritual guidance of his dead father, Kenshiro fights to free his stolen love from the brutal tyrant Lord Shin. Through his struggle he must confront his destiny.','/mkZINehDU8GTiNT0XfssMCeU57T.jpg','1995-04-22',103,'Released','A Legendary Warrior Battles Against The Forces Of Evil.','Fist of the North Star',26300,3.5703,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12727,_binary '\0','/6xK19gQx5H1QjcLZZ197SRJKC3Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113080',6.3,2397,'en','Flirt','The same situation is played out in different cities (New York, Berlin and Tokyo). A lover has to choose whether to commit to a partner who is returning home. In each case there are other people involved, an ex-partner and someone else in a \"permanent\" relationship, what do they choose to do?','/6DGq5lReLwfrfaeidNeHpYtAZ9Q.jpg','1996-08-07',85,'Released',NULL,'Flirt',46986,2.0401,6.2,'uyT1qvtxj5Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12728,_binary '\0','/bqnM8i8hxf9ZdC7OyAelTpG133b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113081',5.5,4083,'nl','Flodder 3','Back from their trip abroad, the family must meet the people of the neighborhood while preparing for the 25th anniversary of Zonnedael. Ma falls in love with a bum that is not exactly what he seems to be.','/lygAXQ3vw8Le0jUslzGt91LluHY.jpg','1995-06-29',90,'Released',NULL,'Flodder 3',11084,1.5699,5.796,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12729,_binary '\0','/kbY2KsmwyFiRYtO0f9Xwd3cV9tZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113083',7,13869,'es','La flor de mi secreto','Middle-aged romance author Leo writes under a pseudonym, since she despises her own work. At home, her husband, who works overseas, is distant both physically and emotionally. As she reevaluates her life and writing, Leo is led to an unexpected relationship with Ángel, a sensitive newspaper editor.','/t4ctWrXgjE1U8l0BKmebEfcLT5Z.jpg','1995-09-22',106,'Released','Every woman has a secret...','The Flower of My Secret',4307,4.2161,6.8,'Zg7qqTOgT1M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12730,_binary '\0','/lwnM9P0rtXdNdV2uZ9r84ALQTyt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113089',6.6,8281,'en','Fluke','Workaholic Thomas Johnson dies in an auto accident and reincarnates as a dog. Remembering some of his previous being, he returns to his wife and son to protect them from the man who caused his accident. But, as time goes by, his memories return, and Thomas realizes he wasn\'t such a good husband and father.','/9cdyiQQK4JwghWVWWB6hEqx4okB.jpg','1995-06-02',96,'Released','Unleash your imagination... and come along on a magical journey. Follow him home.','Fluke',21183,4.0588,7,'ozYFLnuBVFU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12731,_binary '\0','/9fxljwrE3gYiFaSNNXnubMa1fvb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113097',6.5,13965,'en','Forget Paris','Mickey Gordon is a basketball referee who travels to France to bury his father. Ellen Andrews is an American living in Paris who works for the airline he flies on. They meet and fall in love, but their relationship goes through many difficult patches.','/c2RwGHqWwvh7nmRKpdIyYUWMEvP.jpg','1995-05-19',101,'Released','A comedy about love...after marriage.','Forget Paris',10525,2.5431,6.319,'98Z2-q8rlZk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12732,_binary '\0','/c1BaOxC8bo5ACFYkYYxL0bBWRaq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113101',6.7,117596,'en','Four Rooms','It\'s Ted the Bellhop\'s first night on the job...and the hotel\'s very unusual guests are about to place him in some outrageous predicaments. It seems that this evening\'s room service is serving up one unbelievable happening after another.','/75aHn1NOYXh4M7L5shoeQ6NGykP.jpg','1995-12-09',98,'Released','Twelve outrageous guests. Four scandalous requests. And one lone bellhop, in his first day on the job, who\'s in for the wildest New year\'s Eve of his life.','Four Rooms',5,7.7655,5.9,'S_Pd2pGkq54','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12733,_binary '\0','/9HmK9hH5stSvdXMaXuRTNhROzzA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113112',5.8,1552,'en','Freaky Friday','Fun-loving Annabelle Andrews and her uptight mother, Ellen, have a hard time getting along with each other. One Friday the 13th, they both wear magical necklaces that make them switch bodies for the day.','/fxl5cADKj1I7Ri0JOkqmNVO8VYK.jpg','1995-05-06',86,'Released','Be careful... What you wish for.','Freaky Friday',196257,1.6924,5.649,'1laVy33TqS8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12734,_binary '\0','/jiVuIZPan76T1l7oi1EfzqWvJ1Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113114',5.1,20913,'en','Free Willy 2: The Adventure Home','Jesse becomes reunited with Willy three years after the whale\'s jump to freedom as the teenager tries to rescue the killer whale and other orcas from an oil spill.','/3wpug3W5rYBdqeAnhc1UeXLE5ZF.jpg','1995-07-19',95,'Released','The adventure is back. The fun is back. Willy\'s back. And this time he\'s brought his whole family to meet an old friend ... and take on a new challenge.','Free Willy 2: The Adventure Home',9073,6.4298,5.932,'SFnK1abzS9E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12735,_binary '\0','/nZbIezWkPHVR2WLkdGqiR5Cy5do.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113117',6.6,57096,'en','French Kiss','After her fiancee admits to infidelity while on a business trip in France, a woman attempts to get her lover back and marry him by traveling to Paris despite her crippling fear of flying. On the way she unwittingly smuggles something of value that has a charming crook chasing her across France as she chases after her future husband.','/q5hXdMfxSwhuOmWmkTJmm5qVijc.jpg','1995-05-05',111,'Released','Kate\'s stuck in a place where anything can happen with a guy who\'ll make sure that it does.','French Kiss',397,5.4661,6.5,'ZOY63ebD1b0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12736,_binary '\0','/y3E6gIZkRILqNmp7nCLkHPg0WXF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113118',7.2,138961,'en','Friday','Craig and Smokey are two guys in Los Angeles hanging out on their porch on a Friday afternoon, smoking and drinking, looking for something to do.','/3Ya1RurP2NqaYoiok4DmfO41rCC.jpg','1995-04-26',91,'Released','A lot can go down between Thursday and Saturday...','Friday',10634,8.235,7.16,'umvFBoLOOgo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12737,_binary '\0','/9BwBblFveNkslsjpfn6qAK1oenU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113119',4.5,1263,'en','Friend of the Family','A free-spirited natural beauty teaches an entire family to reconnect with their own sexuality. Elke is invited to stay with the Stillman family in their luxurious home in Malibu. The outward appearances of a happy and successful family soon dissolve as Elke finds each to have emotional and sexual problems that only she can help them overcome.','/szHN7vOc6GOjZaV2wTtkOmsX6KJ.jpg','1995-06-01',103,'Released','... something for everyone','Friend of the Family',59306,3.1358,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12738,_binary '\0','/sBetFyUcmX1E1gavYQhhDlih8j9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113131',5.5,1999,'en','Full Body Massage','Nina, an art dealer, has her weekly massage appointment and is surprised to find out her usual masseur, Douglas, has sent a replacement named Fitch. The pair develop an easy rapport during the session, with talk about past relationships. As Nina lies topless on the massage table, Fitch also takes time to explain various massage techniques, including those used by Hopi medicine men.','/dyWG6GC2aktRXma00sdg7fmw18r.jpg','1999-07-10',93,'Released','Feelings and desire that go beyond the physical.','Full Body Massage',35044,4.3419,5.3,'-Zxej3tiMNc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12739,_binary '\0','/7C6ePxdUIxLH1awBQuWh1bYVOyt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113133',6.7,3930,'en','Funny Bones','Tommy Fawkes wants to be a successful comedian. After his Las Vegas debut is a failure, he returns to Blackpool where his father—also a comedian—started, and where he spent the summers of his childhood.','/yGY053q9WlgaZzji50ZHK3p8VIy.jpg','1995-09-20',128,'Released','Comedy. It\'s in the timing. It\'s in the material. But mostly, it\'s in the bones.','Funny Bones',35292,2.4707,6.6,'EE1wCo3N6As','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12740,_binary '\0','/wQJAdKKnmqVUhcAxIEuctJ1k7WI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113140',3.7,1271,'en','Galaxis','Legend says that the sacred crystal is the source for all life and was created at the beginning of time. Kyla has sought the crystal to use its powers for himself and he takes the crystal after smashing the defenders on the Planet Sintaria. But there is another identical crystal on Earth and Ladera heads there to get it before the evil Kyla. She finds that Jed has taken the crystal from is hiding place, but Victor and his inexhaustible hit men want it for money they gave to Jed. Ladera easily handles the weak earthlings and saves Jed, but Kyla is also after the crystal. Jed and Ladera must find the crystal before Kyla, the clueless cops or the dimwitted villains.','/lKBnXiYVgWJVXmGHF6tjJMeSnBM.jpg','1995-06-27',91,'Released',NULL,'Galaxis',45296,1.5346,4.4,'Tbd6bN7pKsg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12741,_binary '\0','/1Un7cFDgA04xhBChOKEY5yROov8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113142',6.7,4693,'ja','ガメラ 大怪獣空中決戦','A ship runs aground on a mysterious atoll leading to an investigation by insurance representative Kusanagi, who discovers an ancient bead that he gives to his daughter Asagi. Meanwhile, ornithologist Nagamine investigates reports of a new species of large bird named Gyaos. As the Gyaos begin to attack, an ancient guardian with a bond to Asagi emerges.','/iZ8yFxavjqsZXfZhkfPqrc4NauY.jpg','1995-03-11',96,'Released','A great duel of supersonic speed.','Gamera: The Guardian of the Universe',54433,2.895,7.4,'0uP70EbjFnA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12742,_binary '\0','/eAexMnPNZG0Q9QNHNWWfr9iHLMf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113149',6.4,5673,'fr','Gazon maudit','After learning of her husband\'s infidelities, a housewife invites an itinerant lesbian to move in with them. None of their lives will ever be the same again.','/xlLnHizshGBwMiNrnop2kg2nYzE.jpg','1995-01-18',95,'Released','A scorned wife. An outrageous affair. The perfect revenge.','French Twist',4482,2.6166,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12743,_binary '\0','/gwhd2zpsk8Zy7V6pNavRyq9Izsh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113153',6.5,5889,'cn','給爸爸的信','An undercover cop struggling to provide for his son and ailing wife, must infiltrate a ruthless gang. But things turn sour when another cop blows his cover and he quickly finds himself battling for his life and the lives of his family.','/dVySxFxeaUvT6COQ4Rx7znwh9C4.jpg','1995-02-08',104,'Released',NULL,'The Enforcer',18725,5.543,6.7,'bJbjW45rhRQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12744,_binary '\0','/mHi1zNvKnfLqV85RDDGmuQoPMP8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113158',6.5,3485,'en','Georgia','Sadie looks up to her older sister Georgia, a successful folk singer. Unfortunately it is this very obsession — coupled with her self-destructive tendencies and rampant drug abuse — that keeps her spiraling down the drain.','/uXjfK404xo7SiVlFcAoRyaFqXR4.jpg','1995-05-19',115,'Released','The toughest act to follow was their dreams.','Georgia',97406,1.6116,5.7,'LfM1kP34Dz8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12745,_binary '\0','/wiZT8DVmAZNwmqd8G3QjWZ1mpLB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113161',6.9,97076,'en','Get Shorty','Chili Palmer is a Miami mobster who gets sent to L.A. to collect a bad debt from Harry Zimm, a Hollywood producer who specializes in cheesy horror films. When Chili meets Harry\'s leading lady, the romantic sparks fly. After pitching his own life story as a movie idea, Chili learns that being a mobster and being a Hollywood producer really aren\'t all that different.','/r82SdPhg4fnIcLt0ogIjQxqjdcO.jpg','1995-10-20',105,'Released','Attitude plays a part.','Get Shorty',8012,7.8568,6.502,'fvBx0x9IJnk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12746,_binary '\0','/8vJUL4RjKpNq1m4gFneECkksDCJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113184',7.1,1344,'en','Go Now','Nick, is a young Scottish soccer player living in the big city. He meets Karen, and the two fall in love and move in together. Soon after, Nick exhibits signs of serious illness. As his body slowly succumbs to multiple sclerosis, he experiences a wide sweep of jagged emotions, and in the process gives himself and those who love him the strength to carry on.','/51d63BwusSczQjWAVelCDT1xLaD.jpg','1995-09-16',81,'Released',NULL,'Go Now',49474,1.3577,6.6,'SPQ82pGD34Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12747,_binary '\0','/npCBOlRFrTT31L9gsWKAEIiH0IS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113187',6.9,8791,'ja','ゴジラvsデストロイア','A burning Godzilla, on the verge of meltdown, emerges to lay siege to Hong Kong. At the same time horrifying new organisms are discovered in Japan. These crustacean-like beings are seemingly born of the Oxygen Destroyer, the weapon that killed the original Godzilla.','/csebMf1IWokaWOughl5s3uX8p44.jpg','1995-12-09',103,'Released','Godzilla dies','Godzilla vs. Destoroyah',12561,5.2171,7.76,'NCNyFPRzI8c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12748,_binary '\0','/gQCnA0hibRyhXMPlzfkKMH4bSet.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113188',6.1,5416,'en','Gold Diggers: The Secret of Bear Mountain','Two teen girls, one from the city, one from the country, try to find the hidden gold of Bear Mountain learning about friendship, loyalty and courage on the way.','/rbiCeXOKdTJXhuWTrIzcfrFNKHT.jpg','1995-11-03',94,'Released','Some friendships are worth a fortune','Gold Diggers: The Secret of Bear Mountain',35645,3.1979,6.2,'ZF42bsaRAac','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12749,_binary '\0','/fIWsCpYR9iGDMSbMTSAzy8L7Kg5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113189',7.2,288791,'en','GoldenEye','When a powerful secret defense system is stolen, James Bond is assigned to stop a Russian crime syndicate from using it.','/z0ljRnNxIO7CRBhLEO0DvLgAFPR.jpg','1995-11-16',130,'Released','No limits. No fears. No substitutes.','GoldenEye',710,12.0584,6.904,'8Zw8ylP4buA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12750,_binary '\0','/A9V6FyKORlcaKefGZdC0TiRk96f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113194',6.7,2911,'ja','Gonin','Five men plot to steal a large sum of money from the local yakuza, but everything does not go as planned and the men find themselves hunted down by contract killers.','/wgecD8RqekDEmj1EaRrvti3TPsy.jpg','1995-09-23',121,'Released','Five men... two killers... one massacre...','Gonin',26830,2.241,6.615,'HPPEz28KdmE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12751,_binary '\0','/aLMP6CYWyGadDXRFQILgmUgFW7d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113198',7,70827,'en','A Goofy Movie','Goofy’s teenage son Max is desperate to impress his crush and fit in at school. After well-meaning but ignorant Goofy suddenly whisks him away on a cross-country road trip—messing up Max’s first date plans in the process—Goofy’s old-school parenting and Max’s desire for independence lead to a vacation of hilarious mishaps, as they both learn to see eye to eye and listen to each other.','/bycmMhO3iIoEDzP768sUjq2RV4T.jpg','1995-04-05',78,'Released','It\'s hard to be cool when your Dad is Goofy.','A Goofy Movie',15789,13.962,7,'_IY7_iCuINo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12752,_binary '\0','/9vzENEEun6X2do2qWbNkPOSRaKL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113199',3.9,2203,'en','Gordy','A talking pig named Gordy becomes involved in a quest to save his family from the slaughterhouse.','/4sLmghaiAIYXh320qCvZWY4avVT.jpg','1995-05-12',90,'Released','The talking pig who made it big!','Gordy',47867,1.3207,5.4,'RSTZl1bENrc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12753,_binary '\0','/xAFX96GvkxmF6GisSRFEFs3nz7A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113211',6.6,20024,'en','The Grass Harp','Based on the novel by Truman Capote, this often-witty coming-of-age drama looks at a young man growing up with an unusual family in the Deep South in the 1940s. Becoming an orphan in 1935, Collin moves to his dad\'s cousins Verena and Dolly. Verena is a rich, bossy businesswoman. Dolly, Collin and the maid revolt, moving to a tree house.','/10K5IjIy3XbMJJaEdNILWwIXGSN.jpg','1996-10-11',107,'Released','Love is a chain of love... as nature is a chain of life.','The Grass Harp',46732,3.1161,5.886,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12754,_binary '\0','/fkBVvO21p7puGxMxOzFJ1ACq4Jg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113221',2.4,1266,'en','Grim','A team of spelunkers, when investigating a system of caves beneath a small town, come across a hideous creature that can move through walls.','/v1Tn3Thj6SciSH90T1e9swhnZg9.jpg','1996-02-13',88,'Released','This is no fairy tale...','Grim',69272,1.7655,3.8,'EMF-UadFxZI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12755,_binary '\0','/1o4vuCHpmd4DXofMYDUwpnhKiuy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113228',6.7,31967,'en','Grumpier Old Men','A family wedding reignites the ancient feud between next-door neighbors and fishing buddies John and Max. Meanwhile, a sultry Italian divorcée opens a restaurant at the local bait shop, alarming the locals who worry she\'ll scare the fish away. But she\'s less interested in seafood than she is in cooking up a hot time with Max.','/1FSXpj5e8l4KH6nVFO5SPUeraOt.jpg','1995-12-22',101,'Released','Still Yelling. Still Fighting. Still Ready for Love.','Grumpier Old Men',15602,5.4638,6.5,'rEnOoWs3FuA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12756,_binary '\0','/ddfw57zy58BIJBJkx5lnINwC7Er.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113241',6.4,2604,'en','Habit','It\'s autumn in New York. Sam has broken up with his girlfriend and his father has recently died. World-weary and sloppy drunk, he finds temporary solace in the arms of Anna, a mysterious vampire who draws him away from his friends and into a web of addiction and madness.','/9jUDhHiDtzhQviodUvWBv1MuytA.jpg','1997-11-14',113,'Released','It can catch up to you','Habit',28671,1.2903,5.6,'QNRIFSQMXMc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12757,_binary '\0','/8fyeM5YyqSY7ZlyVr2Zyfsrmiib.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113243',6.2,82982,'en','Hackers','Along with his new friends, a teenager who was arrested by the US Secret Service and banned from using a computer for writing a computer virus discovers a plot by a nefarious hacker, but they must use their computer skills to find the evidence while being pursued by the Secret Service and the evil computer genius behind the virus.','/qfx2EENW1sOpKNVKLzr7VOhlxkt.jpg','1995-09-14',105,'Released','Their crime is curiosity.','Hackers',10428,11.7295,6.4,'vsjK7AVmsL8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12758,_binary '\0','/viGCwLxupyoaLsa6hrnu1gYrB0B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113247',8.1,231610,'fr','La Haine','After a chaotic night of rioting in a marginal suburb of Paris, three young friends, Vinz, Hubert and Saïd, wander around unoccupied waiting for news about the state of health of a mutual friend who has been seriously injured when confronting the police.','/hY4exng4s29RzDbtQInjx9MA3PZ.jpg','1995-05-31',98,'Released','How far you fall doesn\'t matter, it\'s how you land…','La Haine',406,11.5457,8.086,'FKwcXt3JIaU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12759,_binary '\0','/1KbqRBlZB9Z6OWv8ZWOocDeX4De.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113249',4.5,1233,'en','Innocent Lies','In September 1938 a British detective comes to a small French coastal town in order to investigate the death of a colleague. Prime suspects are the members of English aristocratic family with plenty of skeletons in the closet. This is a loose adaptation of the Agatha Christie novel Towards Zero.','/3zCmSYYlf4uPqaYIn1JR9UnNA74.jpg','1995-06-30',88,'Released','The truth is deadly','Innocent Lies',71134,2.9437,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12760,_binary '\0','/jHtuoRdP5nGyulwYoV8izEU6p8M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113253',4.7,47255,'en','Halloween: The Curse of Michael Myers','Six years after being presumed dead in a fire, and just as the town prepares to finally celebrate Halloween again, Michael Myers returns to Haddonfield to continue his reign of terror.','/noCnM8nEI2bEDSdKHh0RKbwBwbC.jpg','1995-09-29',88,'Released','Terror never rests in peace.','Halloween: The Curse of Michael Myers',10987,8.3672,5.153,'YZbc4LCDPsk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12761,_binary '\0','/rvbNUvGvINOHiVJhVdn24GwXio8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113256',7.1,1348,'zh','好男好女','An actress preparing to play in a historical epic is terrorized by someone faxing her pages from her stolen diary; has colorful flashbacks of her affair with a now-deceased man; and imagines black-and-white film-within-a-film scenes of the movie she is about to appear in.','/yMmjIymprpdHrSoentdTaUNqgMG.jpg','1995-05-13',108,'Released','She has the role of another lifetime.','Good Men, Good Women',99600,1.2922,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12762,_binary '\0','/d4xyXTf95sMB6B1Crzrr6CbSWe3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113264',7.2,2900,'en','Harrison Bergeron','\"All men are not created equal. It is the purpose of the Government to make them so.\" This is the premise of the Showtime film adaption of Kurt Vonnegut\'s futuristic short story Harrison Bergeron. The film centers around a young man (Harrison) who is smarter than his peers, and is not affected by the usual \"Handicapping\" which is used to train all Americans so everyone is of equal intelligence.','/jc2mINVs86QrreRZw0tlPJp1FlC.jpg','1995-08-13',99,'Released','Welcome to the future. It\'s a no-brainer.','Harrison Bergeron',24732,3.3863,6.771,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12763,_binary '\0','/7MyaGCabKNgJvg5Cpe5NInND7h9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113269',6.2,8173,'en','Haunted','Professor David Ash exposes false spiritulists and mediums. He is invited to Edbrook to resolve the fears and torments within its secretive family. Soon after arriving Ash begins to doubt his own senses, and watching the strange behaviour of its residents does not make his task any easier. In time, he finds there\'s more to Edbrook than even he can debunk.','/5sJyBJafGtBuvHv6zkXsTFtA3vu.jpg','1995-10-27',108,'Released','A Supernatural Tale of Love and Mystery','Haunted',18801,3.401,6.1,'KB_aYW3ig-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12764,_binary '\0','/uI22JkEMediWyiRqhllNqeeGtW0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113277',8.3,818461,'en','Heat','Obsessive master thief Neil McCauley leads a top-notch crew on various daring heists throughout Los Angeles while determined detective Vincent Hanna pursues him without rest. Each man recognizes and respects the ability and the dedication of the other even though they are aware their cat-and-mouse game may end in violence.','/umSVjVdbVwtx5ryCA2QXL44Durm.jpg','1995-12-15',170,'Released','A Los Angeles crime saga.','Heat',949,25.5017,7.945,'14oNcFxiVaQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12765,_binary '\0','/f8xSrxnGtwaKvBWb26yS02ezrY6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113278',4.2,1421,'en','Heatseeker','A kickboxing champion is forced to fight cyborgs in a tournament when the company kidnaps his fiancee.','/9nEpgNNbTY67vnvyJs9VxyrAiPe.jpg','1995-06-27',91,'Released','Meet the Ultimate Warrior in Cyber-Technology','Heatseeker',146926,1.1922,4.8,'ZhpViS43K-A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12766,_binary '\0','/kqaIZ94OVxAdjsxh2i1GmTFliJd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113280',6.7,6365,'en','Heavy','Victor is a cook who works in a greasy roadside restaurant owned by his mother, Dolly. It\'s just the two of them, a waitress named Delores, and a heavy drinking regular, Leo. But things change when Callie, a beautiful college dropout, shows up as a new waitress and steals Victor\'s heart. But Victor is too shy to do anything about it, and too self-consciously overweight to dream of winning Callie away.','/xo2KsY7hOHDqpgYlDStL56zmgaq.jpg','1995-12-29',105,'Released','He\'s a man so shy, he doesn\'t even think he deserves love…','Heavy',22621,1.5626,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12767,_binary '\0','/sBFr5OLNRjMWC6F1tKwFmfW34Gn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113292',6.1,1435,'cn','和平飯店','After his wife\'s murder, Ping sets up a Peace Hotel to act as a sanctuary for anyone who needs protecting. One day, a mysterious woman shows up who seeks shelter from a gang hunting her. Vowing to never turn anyone away, Ping must decide whether to help the women or risk confronting the gang.','/yAo95rbWXpALy6coB8bfU92s2rU.jpg','1995-04-12',90,'Released','Solitude is not Peace. Killer is the Protector.','Peace Hotel',50840,2.5923,5.9,'L7WnXy59hPo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12768,_binary '\0','/wDjVua7LmH2yR3fhV2d2oNtrb9G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113303',5.3,8082,'en','Hideaway','Hatch Harrison, his wife, Lindsey, and their daughter, Regina, are enjoying a pleasant drive when a car crash leaves wife and daughter unharmed but kills Hatch. However, an ingenious doctor, Jonas Nyebern, manages to revive Hatch after two lifeless hours. But Hatch does not come back unchanged. He begins to suffer horrible visions of murder -- only to find out the visions are the sights of a serial killer.','/cYWjgxgIJrak0BTemkij3gOCbMa.jpg','1995-03-03',103,'Released','Hatch Harrison was pronounced dead on arrival. After two hours, the doctors brought him back. But he didn\'t come back alone.','Hideaway',27303,2.7243,5.2,'1jmKLl95NZ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12769,_binary '\0','/hV0LwQlPrjSjKXi4vteNEdgxm4d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113305',6.5,23593,'en','Higher Learning','African-American student Malik is on a track scholarship; academics are not his strong suit, and he goes in thinking that his athletic abilities will earn him a free ride through college. Fudge, a \"professional student\" who has been at Columbus for six years so far, becomes friendly with Malik and challenges his views about race and politics in America.','/tuud1Blsdwo1KQRdz5UVwjlLAWQ.jpg','1995-01-11',128,'Released','Question the knowledge.','Higher Learning',16295,4.7781,6.3,'R9CZErJ9idU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12770,_binary '\0','/oEaHA6CjiWEDoqxpkd7yhCFE1rI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113313',5.7,2184,'en','Hollow Point','Livingston is trying to merge the Russians, Chinese and Italian gangsters into one group with huge amounts of money and power. FBI agent Susan and DEA agent Max are trying to stop them.','/1fb03z1y3Ruz6HLgh7OS35A5CCw.jpg','1996-10-21',102,'Released',NULL,'Hollow Point',58028,1.7755,5.3,'JaBWkHNlQPQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12771,_binary '\0','/lCugQmmEoUc5Z3U7IlBXNYjrtJi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113321',6.6,16328,'en','Home for the Holidays','After losing her job, making out with her soon-to-be former boss, and finding out that her daughter plans to spend Thanksgiving with her boyfriend, Claudia Larson faces spending the holiday with her unhinged family.','/3zqlKdOttWyExzopVxglz50Vjxq.jpg','1995-11-02',103,'Released','On the fourth Thursday in November, 84 million American families will gather together... And wonder why.','Home for the Holidays',9089,4.0297,6.255,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12772,_binary '\0','/5ftRls3IbR1kXnasqJEJL63LVsc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113326',6.8,50323,'cn','紅番區','Keong comes from Hong Kong to visit New York for his uncle\'s wedding. His uncle runs a market in the Bronx and Keong offers to help out while Uncle is on his honeymoon. During his stay in the Bronx, Keong befriends a neighbor kid and beats up some neighborhood thugs who cause problems at the market. One of those petty thugs in the local gang stumbles into a criminal situation way over his head.','/1nAfchiXHQB3iyhK8fCJJEnNs5A.jpg','1995-01-21',106,'Released','No Fear. No Stuntman. No Equal.','Rumble in the Bronx',33542,7.1117,6.855,'8PT49TzAV7I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12773,_binary '\0','/nOPCU3zmLTp1A6KpPtHTuAyzkf5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113347',6.3,13227,'en','How to Make an American Quilt','Soon-to-be-wed graduate student Finn Dodd develops cold feet when she suspects her fiancé is cheating on her. In order to clear her head, Finn visits her grandmother, Hy, and great aunt, Glady Joe Cleary, in Grasse, Calif. There, Finn learns that Hy and Glady Joe are members of a group of passionate quilters, and over the course of her visit she is regaled with tales of love and life by women who have collected rich experiences and much wisdom.','/pI9UAemlWgdrnjRgYJsbTk8BSJc.jpg','1995-10-06',116,'Released','There\'s beauty in the patterns of life.','How to Make an American Quilt',11861,5.7552,6.4,'8KmWa408RVQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12774,_binary '\0','/xEBeV6SBncFvVyn3bLiYyi2TwKT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113356',6.8,3226,'cn','回魂夜','After being haunted by evil spirits inside a residential building, a security guard seeks help from a mysterious exorcist, who turns out to be an escaped mental patient.','/jQs824sDWcYD0Q9ZecrrUi2kDxB.jpg','1995-07-06',82,'Released',NULL,'Out of the Dark',45452,2.9131,6.9,'B50bLzmChh0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12775,_binary '\0','/hys4aPB77G2pboLRUCWNkl9djbl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113360',5.9,6346,'en','The Hunted','Paul Racine, a high-powered American business executive in Japan, is catapulted into a maze of danger and intrigue after he and his sexy companion are the targets of assassins hired by the ruthless Kinjo. To survive, Racine must join forces with a powerful samurai and together they will fight the force of evil in an awesome battle rooted in centuries of brutal conflict.','/luCVuKiRBcQjr9MuY9mRCTehjpY.jpg','1995-02-24',110,'Released','He\'s trapped in a world where killing is an art and revenge is an obsession.','The Hunted',32631,4.516,5.715,'ZaQMk2id9fw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12776,_binary '\0','/5aXOJ5cpzodpZoTDe4NVL0kSkRl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113362',7,6709,'fr','Le Hussard sur le toit','In a time of war and disease, a young officer gallantly tries to help a young woman find her husband.','/tsmwnxi8hGXQTNVqBRCAVsfeGON.jpg','1995-09-20',135,'Released',NULL,'The Horseman on the Roof',11876,3.2675,6.546,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12777,_binary '\0','/3jlYVxDpPZg7s8Vn61OfKzlBS8r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113375',7.3,8059,'en','I.D.','Four policemen go undercover and infiltrate a gang of football hooligans hoping to route out their leaders. For one of the four, the line between \'job\' and \'yob\' becomes more unclear as time passes . . .','/hcDZx4VTA9QzquHvWOdoOSeSB2t.jpg','1995-05-05',107,'Released','When you go undercover, remember one thing: who you are.','I.D.',15322,1.7901,6.616,'5Y26VMm4L7o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12778,_binary '\0','/dxY5PYsKSu99JkxKOv6iACui7Mw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113394',5.5,1628,'en','The Immortals','An elaborate heist unites 8 strangers in a simultaneous assault on targets all over the city- and explodes in a hailstorm of gunfire and high-speed chases in this powerful action-thriller. Recruited by a Mafia nightclub owner (Eric Roberts), 4 teams launch a brutal cross-town attack to retrieve suitcases full of cash. But as the violence escalates, the team members discover just who their real target has been all along - and the shocking truth they have in common.','/rShuJsXmzT4pzUm6aBO5NIpq1uw.jpg','1995-10-05',98,'Released','It was a chance of a lifetime. If they lived that long.','The Immortals',29231,1.6575,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12779,_binary '\0','/5uDDUQnWZyvJZl0lsS4ov6Z214L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113399',7,2028,'en','In Pursuit of Honor','To save a group of horses slated to be destroyed by the US Cavalry, a group of officers rebel and begin a journey towards Canada to save themselves and the mounts.','/wQfP0juGwqU6ZiXvC0MsnSwnQld.jpg','1995-03-18',111,'Released','As soldiers they were taught to fight for honor. As men they were willing to die for it.','In Pursuit of Honor',139826,3.1658,5.8,'zacZfCTZ_AA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12780,_binary '\0','/iAxwce4twFKiBrW10rxnoTPfnuB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113403',7.2,2909,'en','In the Bleak Midwinter','Out of work actor Joe volunteers to help try and save his sister\'s local church for the community by putting on a Christmas production of Hamlet, somewhat against the advice of his agent Margaretta. As the cast he assembles are still available even at Christmas and are prepared to do it on a \'profit sharing\' basis (that is, they may not get paid anything) he cannot expect - and does not get - the cream of the cream. But although they all bring their own problems and foibles along, something bigger starts to emerge in the perhaps aptly named village of Hope.','/eUrv3E65orbuPnFikjpjso4TVBN.jpg','1995-09-29',99,'Released','The drama. The passion. The intrigue... And the rehearsals haven\'t even started.','In the Bleak Midwinter',40154,2.1502,7.1,'E1b5iSgd43I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12781,_binary '\0','/uofxTi1d3IIAdRdyzKl5se5PGf1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113409',7.1,91646,'en','In the Mouth of Madness','An insurance investigator visits a small town while looking into the strange disappearance of a popular horror novelist. He soon finds that the impact of the author’s books is far more than inspirational.','/msh4tEUzbnEqlHcFOUH4O0Zti8r.jpg','1995-02-03',95,'Released','Lived any good books lately?','In the Mouth of Madness',2654,7.5032,7.2,'AlugldzO9zY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12782,_binary '\0','/1QKNlJsClzzPkiuh3XwN0N9Iwm0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113416',6.7,5817,'en','The Incredibly True Adventure of Two Girls in Love','An adventurous love story between two young women of different social and economic backgrounds who find themselves going through all the typical struggles of a new romance.','/dPbYJaH1j7sgj1NuA4VRyb7O4Mt.jpg','1995-06-16',94,'Released','There\'s a first time for everything.','The Incredibly True Adventure of Two Girls in Love',29371,3.1133,6.3,'CVyg1xk1HdM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12783,_binary '\0','/fKzQzmqsUDVbrH4dux9FcXtXLbQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113419',6,33456,'en','The Indian in the Cupboard','A nine-year-old boy gets a plastic Indian and a cupboard for his birthday and finds himself involved in adventure when the Indian comes to life and befriends him.','/ozQAmW85tTJu2dhRe3evzyY03Nb.jpg','1995-07-14',96,'Released','Adventure comes to life.','The Indian in the Cupboard',11359,5.7502,6.5,'kQVketPgcuE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12784,_binary '\0','/7tfMqjzSqWkWbqIZAXSSPbgMebK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113421',7.5,5120,'en','Indictment: The McMartin Trial','The McMartin family\'s lives are turned upside down when they are accused of serious child molestation. The family run a school for infants. An unqualified child cruelty \"expert\" videotapes the children describing outrageous stories of abuse. One of the most expensive and long running trials in US legal history, exposes the lack of evidence and unprofessional attitudes of the finger pointers which kept one of the accused in jail for over 5 years without bail.','/m9yQXiRZhn2iS5rvUgXoXIwLtqo.jpg','1995-05-20',135,'Released',NULL,'Indictment: The McMartin Trial',46725,3.3042,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12785,_binary '\0','/cKQbtVObw0klPpjG5pT8SLs30he.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113429',7,2209,'en','Institute Benjamenta, or This Dream People Call Human Life','Jakob arrives at the Institute Benjamenta (run by brother and sister Johannes and Lisa Benjamenta) to learn to become a servant. With seven other men, he studies under Lisa: absurd lessons of movement, drawing circles, and servility. He asks for a better room. No other students arrive and none leave for employment. Johannes is unhappy, imperious, and detached from the school\'s operation. Lisa is beautiful, at first tightly controlled, then on the verge of breakdown. There\'s a whiff of incest. Jakob is drawn to Lisa, and perhaps she to him. As winter sets in, she becomes catatonic. Things get worse; Johannes notes that all this has happened since Jakob came. Is there any cause and effect?','/sbAYYXZNY6iofJa1EfylnR9MrkC.jpg','1995-08-01',105,'Released',NULL,'Institute Benjamenta, or This Dream People Call Human Life',40651,1.9465,7.6,'82U10Ndol7E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12786,_binary '\0','/lrtSbfSJNJJw1fN8tIwJsf16hvG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113438',3.4,1595,'en','Iron Eagle IV','While Chappy Sinclair is saddled with a bunch of misfits and delinquents for his flight school, he turns to his protégé Doug Masters to assist him in rounding them into shape for an important competition. During their training, they stumble upon a group of subversive air force officers who are dealing in toxic waste as a sideline.','/11a0w12nHY7rVjYSbnAeABOsKF.jpg','1995-12-01',96,'Released',NULL,'Iron Eagle on the Attack',28737,2.1424,3.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12787,_binary '\0','/yS3E5LOcFsk3eWGh3oWGnsfV1M8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113442',6.1,29111,'en','It Takes Two','Identical 9-year-olds from very different backgrounds: orphaned Amanda and wealthy Alyssa meet at summer camp and decide to switch places -- and play matchmaker between Alyssa\'s dad, Roger, and the kind social worker who cares for Amanda.','/4CptjFLiIJXtjc3dykS7vkEHMbw.jpg','1995-11-17',101,'Released','Two identical strangers. Two different worlds. One perfect match.','It Takes Two',33689,7.5437,6.5,'yh1OH4NnLWQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12788,_binary '\0','/81Rf7XnNEP4ttNbAl2zQRWOt9eY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113443',7.1,3420,'en','It\'s My Party','Nick, a gay, HIV-positive architect, begins to display severe symptoms of AIDS and makes preparations to kill himself before he is unable to function normally. He arranges a party to reconnect and say goodbye to his closest friends and his confused parents. But when his ex-partner, Brandon, a television director who left Nick when he was diagnosed with HIV, shows up, what was supposed to be a celebratory event becomes much more difficult for everyone.','/ltrjg99gc3bA3P5E6WaIbGMxWHS.jpg','1996-03-22',110,'Released','A gathering of friends. A gift of love. A celebration of life.','It\'s My Party',33245,3.0279,6.3,'R1OitcQJi5I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12789,_binary '\0','/2LDY0auGo25vERpruG5PV9I1OMJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113448',6.7,5834,'en','Jack & Sarah','Jack always lands on his feet. He lands on his feet when he marries the beautiful Sarah. He lands on his feet when he buys a luxurious new home. However, when Sarah goes into labour, he takes a tumble down the stairs and lands on his head. When he comes around he discovers he is the proud father of a baby girl, but deficient in the spouse department to the tune of 1.','/yWMj1KMfnixB35qa2IZKniHF4sn.jpg','1995-06-02',110,'Released','She\'s not proper, she\'s not fitting, she\'s not British, but to Jack she\'s a breath of fresh air.','Jack & Sarah',2021,2.2807,6.8,'_fQLwQ0Yhj8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12790,_binary '\0','/gF7K3TpsTEQvNY3I2tgbWOwUdCv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113449',3.5,2219,'en','Jack-O','A long long time ago a wizard was put to death, but he swore vengeance on the townsfolk that did him in, particularly Arthur Kelly\'s family. Arthur had done the final graces on him when he came back to life as Mr. Jack the Pumpkin Man. The Kellys proliferated through the years, and when some devil-may-care teens accidentally unleash Jack-O, young Sean Kelly must stop him somehow as his suburban world is accosted and the attrition rate climbs','/As60LTJeTZ05JCnaZPMljUA11h3.jpg','1995-10-10',88,'Released','He\'s Baaack!','Jack-O',27498,2.4649,3.53,'mrHWsg8693E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12791,_binary '\0','/k19u7EVyMqhfQrH9KMlyCNbnvBZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113451',5.4,15739,'en','Jade','When a prominent art dealer is found murdered, the man\'s death leads to an intriguing investigation steeped in sex, corruption and crime. District Attorney David Corelli gets assigned to the case and discovers that a key suspect is his ex-lover Katrina Gavin, a beautiful psychologist who has settled down with his old friend and peer. As Corelli gets deeper into the case, he uncovers dark secrets with far-reaching implications.','/8KWiZKDYpAgh8n27lanvTuDquyX.jpg','1995-10-11',95,'Released','Some fantasies go too far.','Jade',11863,3.9356,5.5,'9yQ1L97C9FU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12792,_binary '\0','/Au2xkTRPU6xd4l4mcfCWfOMePuh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113463',5.7,3320,'en','Jefferson in Paris','His wife having recently died, Thomas Jefferson accepts the post of United States ambassador to pre-revolutionary France, though he finds it difficult to adjust to life in a country where the aristocracy subjugates an increasingly restless peasantry. In Paris, he becomes smitten with cultured artist Maria Cosway, but, when his daughter visits from Virginia accompanied by her attractive slave, Sally Hemings, Jefferson\'s attentions are diverted.','/vcZCvsm920LoNDb7pMibJkxIE4n.jpg','1995-03-31',139,'Released','A powerful man torn between his love for one woman and his secret desire for another.','Jefferson in Paris',87729,2.3529,5.1,'oTpFci6HNgA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12793,_binary '\0','/8dCgk9uer8DvMHKdC7wcyzPTwiA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113464',6.8,7214,'en','Jeffrey','Jeffrey, a gay man living in New York City with an overwhelming fear of contracting AIDS, concludes that being celibate is the only option to protect himself. As fate would have it, shortly after his declaration of a sex-free existence, he meets the handsome Steve Howard, his dream man -- except for his HIV-positive status. Facing this dilemma, Jeffrey turns to his best friend and an outrageous priest for guidance.','/cacIqtIkUaD5xYqUUN1J7qJjciQ.jpg','1995-08-18',92,'Released','Love is an adventure when one of you is sure... and the other is positive.','Jeffrey',17447,2.1916,6.2,'xGQRgOJ2bV0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12794,_binary '\0','/sDEeZGAE7N44XPJa1fi4yYLTaHb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113475',6.7,1666,'cn','金玉滿堂','Within a few years, petty crook Chiu rises to gang leader. But his professional ambitions are actually quite different: he wants to leave illegality behind and make a career for himself and his lover in Canada... as a chef. However, this craft must first be learned and Chiu\'s talent in the field of cooking leaves much to be desired.','/hbal71oj7AlzQSlvUeAMXHFM1rz.jpg','1995-01-28',100,'Released',NULL,'The Chinese Feast',93465,2.7346,6.6,'c1pkS3dt0ok','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12795,_binary '\0','/7FRYVIF2hnh1IbPtqMgF5iygdjz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113481',5.6,82213,'en','Johnny Mnemonic','In a dystopian 2021, Johnny is a data trafficker who has an implant that allows him to securely store data too sensitive for regular computer networks. On one delivery run, he accepts a package that not only exceeds the implant\'s safety limits—and will kill him if the data is not removed in time—but also contains information far more important and valuable than he had ever imagined. On a race against time, he must avoid the assassins sent to kill him and remove the data before it, too, ends his life.','/iH8Jgi8qvb7pnBfI8fVGaUbyRna.jpg','1995-05-26',97,'Released','The future\'s most wanted fugitive.','Johnny Mnemonic',9886,8.1404,5.8,'PDzjBr1c4qs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12796,_binary '\0','/baJHUXBcoaHnMf2sjwegbuhIjEV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113492',5.6,133189,'en','Judge Dredd','In a dystopian future where Judges maintain law and order by acting as judge, jury, and executioner, Dredd fights to prove his innocence after being falsely accused of murder.','/cfSnKn8NDU3m8UxihjVcYprA0Aq.jpg','1995-06-30',96,'Released','In the future, one man is the law.','Judge Dredd',9482,11.9309,5.852,'43-BefmjMFg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12797,_binary '\0','/qSxeCfWUUyht9hZgaaYmtPtTkw2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113497',7.1,419522,'en','Jumanji','When siblings Judy and Peter discover an enchanted board game that opens the door to a magical world, they unwittingly invite Alan -- an adult who\'s been trapped inside the game for 26 years -- into their living room. Alan\'s only hope for freedom is to finish the game, which proves risky as all three find themselves running from giant rhinoceroses, evil monkeys and other terrifying creatures.','/bdHG5Mo83VPobeZZdlSz0Y7HQHB.jpg','1995-12-15',104,'Released','It\'s a jungle in here.','Jumanji',8844,4.7739,7.249,'bFPN23BktYA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12798,_binary '\0','/8zO4AoxU7pzH8PRjDl1phWwLuVm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113500',4.4,9364,'en','Jury Duty','When jobless Tommy Collins discovers that sequestered jurors earn free room and board as well as $5-a-day, he gets himself assigned to a jury in a murder trial. Once there, he does everything he can to prolong the trial and deliberations and make the sequestration more comfortable for himself.','/DbKQDPqBE4kCaePj4CHu6r3ZAb.jpg','1995-04-12',88,'Released','For truth. For justice. For five bucks a day.','Jury Duty',19326,2.9606,4.4,'bdKOtQlUS6s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12799,_binary '\0','/i9opFwOh2DvFyjy8uQXC17UEUzL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113501',6.4,33219,'en','Just Cause','A Harvard professor is lured back into the courtroom after twenty-five years to take the case of a young black man condemned to death for the horrific murder of a child.','/hbkS4UpgHcGhLlGy9YCX4WIJ4lu.jpg','1995-02-17',102,'Released','Buried deep in the Florida Everglades is a secret that can save an innocent man or let a killer kill again.','Just Cause',9061,5.142,6.255,'tZlr2PbTiow','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12800,_binary '\0','/iTpYxTMuk2ZyvjcHEIOyjUzadz6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113510',5,2632,'sv','Jönssonligans största kupp','When Vanheden and Dynamit-Harry tries to break doctor Busé out of jail, they get Herman Melvin instead. He has been working at the Swedish Mint and the doctor, who has started to think like Sickan, has written a plan for making a burglary there, on Melvin\'s back. However, something goes wrong. They don\'t get a lot of Deutsch-marks as they planned but instead, they end up on a ship going to Poland, together with bunches and bunches of Polish Zlotys (the Polish currency). In Poland, they discover that the mafia are very interested in that money and Wall-Enberg is working with the mafia.','/pmJT07tBpHsFOfXCXHoSNkYDyLF.jpg','1995-02-03',99,'Released',NULL,'The Jönsson Gang\'s Greatest Robbery',37731,1.7357,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12801,_binary '\0','/c8JIJqFggXhluAru8J9lPelVTeo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113526',6.8,17882,'hi','कारन अर्जुन','Karan and Arjun reincarnate in the different parts of the country. But the faith of their previous mother brings them together in order to avenge their death.','/uYhjsC9gCKhxiG2enkCJgdLOXjB.jpg','1995-01-13',175,'Released','...and they returned to take revenge!','Karan Arjun',93519,2.0471,6.7,'WbWtNny5x4c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12802,_binary '\0','/9mq2wFxGAGR1ZokFdPXToRuVmd7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113533',5.2,1831,'en','Born to Be Wild','Rick Heller is a juvenile delinquent who keeps getting himself into trouble. To keep him out of trouble his mother puts him to work cleaning the cage of a gorilla named Katie which she is teaching to communicate through the use of sign language. When the owner of the gorilla takes her back to become a flea market freak Rick takes it upon himself to break Katie out and take her on an adventurous journey to get her out of the country.','/n5SyB9589EQrkyPxdQJhN1pl6xn.jpg','1995-03-31',100,'Released','What do you do when your best friend\'s a 400-pound gorilla? Anything she likes.','Born to Be Wild',68927,3.3492,5.3,'x3ECV7v5Qcc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12803,_binary '\0','/hyG7Y6r0aQnE5ssoTyq8xSQmS25.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113537',6.6,16152,'en','Kicking and Screaming','After college graduation, Grover\'s girlfriend Jane tells him she\'s moving to Prague to study writing. Grover declines to accompany her, deciding instead to move in with several friends, all of whom can\'t quite work up the inertia to escape their university\'s pull. Nobody wants to make any big decisions that would radically alter his life, yet none of them wants to end up like Chet, the professional student who tends bar and is in his tenth year of university studies.','/ynAtSpTou7snNOq32djzILw9VCA.jpg','1995-10-06',96,'Released','Anxiety loves company.','Kicking and Screaming',28387,3.0103,6.193,'g9ul_89gqI4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12804,_binary '\0','/nqDQFwSpzqPNeu7gL0BWnwjWFkL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113538',4.8,7464,'en','A Kid in King Arthur\'s Court','A Southern California kid named Calvin Fuller is magically transported to the medieval kingdom of Camelot through a crack in the ground caused by an earthquake. Once there, he learns he was summoned by the wizard Merlin, who needs Calvin to save Camelot. Using dazzling modern inventions, can Calvin help King Arthur retain his crown and thwart the evil Lord Belasco?','/q7A67rr8f3hESsr4MYb4CEOzF7v.jpg','1995-08-11',89,'Released','Calvin Fuller is about to break curfew...by 1500 years.','A Kid in King Arthur\'s Court',37108,3.5751,5,'yLtmLy1Vzkc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12805,_binary '\0','/3gmreIMvzQgd1q4hsiUN5ADV88W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113540',7,92694,'en','Kids','A group of bored, disaffected New York City teenagers spend a day skating, smoking, drinking, partying, deflowering virgins, and getting into fights.','/8qV8hUVCUnFIQKewzlhaFWhdszK.jpg','1995-07-21',91,'Released','Shocking. Depraved. Sickening. And they\'re only Kids.','Kids',9344,6.6429,6.878,'U9a5tZSKDOU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12806,_binary '\0','/1C4y0daUxufkdpox7iZcL2ssy7E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113542',6.3,2506,'en','Killer: A Journal of Murder','Carl Panzram is sent to Leavenworth Prison for burglary. While there, he is brutally beaten by a guard. Neophyte guard Henry Lesser feels sympathy for Panzram, befriends him, and gets him to write his life story. Lesser learns that Panzram\'s past is much more violent than he thought, but also that he\'s capable of being a much better person than the rest of the prison staff believes - or so Lesser thinks.','/bGhq64TzH7i1jSmK0tYHbDmgzVQ.jpg','1996-09-06',91,'Released','Liar. Thief. Murderer. He hated all of humanity, himself most of all.','Killer: A Journal of Murder',59569,2.455,5.9,'q5OQLgzGLAA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12807,_binary '\0','/p9PdDRIiQfjGtg21xHOPVD7jZyy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113552',6,20215,'en','Kiss of Death','Jimmy Kilmartin\'s an ex-con who\'s trying to go straight. But he can\'t say no to a quick driving job because his so-called friend\'s life is threatened. The job is for Little Junior Brown, a violent and powerful villain. When things go wrong, Jimmy is left to do the time, and his whole life is turned upside-down, but if that wasn\'t enough, the cops won\'t leave Jimmy alone when he gets out... They want Little Junior Brown.','/2cCxEqeIy6Q8HgVjfT7obOnF5Zi.jpg','1995-04-21',101,'Released','Little Junior Brown. He rules the streets. He owns the game. But he doesn\'t own all of the players.','Kiss of Death',6071,7.6052,5.693,'EeOtkhiScMI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12808,_binary '\0','/3OldHa5lfPTOgQVt23HDGoCZRwM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113557',7.2,2357,'no','Kjærlighetens kjøtere','Larsen, an aspiring poet in \'20s Oslo, leaves his girlfriend to spend a year as a trapper in East Greenland. There he is teamed with a seemingly rough old sailor/trapper, Randbæk, and a scientist, Holm. Trapped in a tiny hut together as the Arctic winter sets in, a complex and intense love/hate relationship develops between Randbæk and Larsen, who are more similar than either would like to admit. A powerful psychological and physical drama set against stunningly bleak Arctic scenery.','/ddvaQzv1w53kTfRzzZbfnisUMJq.jpg','1995-09-29',118,'Released',NULL,'Zero Kelvin',85589,1.2977,6.5,'icwDnDtR-U8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12809,_binary '\0','/jIpagj2Dud9g3ZVJFvaWikEWsYz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113568',7.9,176839,'ja','GHOST IN THE SHELL / 攻殻機動隊','In the year 2029, the barriers of our world have been broken down by the net and by cybernetics, but this brings new vulnerability to humans in the form of brain-hacking. When a highly-wanted hacker known as \'The Puppetmaster\' begins involving them in politics, Section 9, a group of cybernetically enhanced cops, are called in to investigate and stop the Puppetmaster.','/9gC88zYUBARRSThcG93MvW14sqx.jpg','1995-11-18',83,'Released','It found a voice... now it needs a body.','Ghost in the Shell',9323,21.796,7.93,'8RF09G8Ymqg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12810,_binary '\0','/ju6T45slOeGulTVO0TDjOYVadok.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113580',7,2659,'fi','Kummeli Stories','The war between Luxembourg and Finland sets the outline to a set of comedic stories about a rally team, gay couple\'s fishing trip, two hoodlums\' last school days in the spring and a haunted hotel among others.','/yWgxqxHTVoIjQLeQmsNV7wucJtR.jpg','1995-10-20',90,'Released',NULL,'Kummeli Stories',62719,2.0866,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12811,_binary '\0','/yGp9gp5HuRG60F9eH5AicRZgcv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113598',7.3,1406,'nl','Lang Leve de Koningin','A fairytale about a young girl who learns to play chess and at the same time finds her father.','/pvW71qoY6xVN72q38LBCTJIwmyL.jpg','1995-11-15',118,'Released','A fairytale about chess','Long Live the Queen',85115,1.2505,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12812,_binary '\0','/3yLMuH0Xp5gp7Wls3LfcVn6lVU9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113613',6.7,16507,'en','The Last Supper','A group of idealistic but frustrated liberals succumb to the temptation of murdering right-wing pundits for their political beliefs.','/oIgPiiM0qD1mCo1SYG3Sd0vmKTa.jpg','1995-09-08',92,'Released','Love... Sex... Life... Death. In this house it\'s all on the table.','The Last Supper',12520,3.6118,6.5,'jNPSHydODoI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12813,_binary '\0','/eSjyfYgT9GOoeTEj20ByCgj84Ms.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113617',7,6639,'en','Last of the Dogmen','A Montana bounty hunter is sent into the wilderness to track three escaped prisoners. Instead he sees something that puzzles him. Later with a female Native Indian history professor, he returns to find some answers.','/7GkP9w87TAFSXLzJdqxTt0ymbJE.jpg','1995-09-08',118,'Released','A journey of the heart. The adventure of their lives.','Last of the Dogmen',30718,3.1672,6.8,'3k7KWvQQaTk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12814,_binary '\0','/xsMCdgk9nXkm2juUlyxUzn16Xwc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113623',6.4,1669,'it','I laureati','Four thirtysomething college students share a flat in Florence: Leonardo pursues beautiful Letizia, Rocco moonlights as a night watchman, Bruno needs to graduate to inherit his father-in-law\'s business, and Pino dreams of becoming a stand-up comedian.','/6S17LRh2RY2SCFak7KE9aIHxMc8.jpg','1995-12-22',88,'Released',NULL,'The Graduates',56374,1.2849,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12815,_binary '\0','/ckTh7Ej33m9O4eiKDQ1u91Opd9N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113627',7.5,146958,'en','Leaving Las Vegas','Ben Sanderson, an alcoholic Hollywood screenwriter who lost everything because of his drinking, arrives in Las Vegas to drink himself to death. There, he meets and forms an uneasy friendship and non-interference pact with prostitute Sera.','/wIfP6uLXD9Ptu68SyRx8WuSNNSK.jpg','1995-10-27',111,'Released','I love you... The way you are.','Leaving Las Vegas',451,8.9574,7.249,'O4HrGa2-RLc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12816,_binary '\0','/w9twLTtxSJHe5qQA7fc2NeBZ1wE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113633',5.4,2197,'en','Bullet to Beijing','When long-time British agent Harry Palmer loses his job because the Cold War is over, he\'s promptly approached by a Russian bossman, Alex. In St. Petersburg Alex tells Harry of his plan for Russia\'s future, which is threatened because a deadly biochemical weapon called the Red Death has been stolen from him. He\'ll pay Harry handsomely to retrieve it. An ex-spy friend tips Harry off that it\'s being sent to Beijing by train, aboard which we begin to learn whose side everyone\'s really on.','/gVVXIWcxcSNlv5cNOOayHzmR2Q3.jpg','1995-12-20',101,'Released','The Ipcress File\'s Harry Palmer is back.... and the Cold War is heating up again!','Bullet to Beijing',37237,2.5034,5.2,'E1gz__yDI1o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12817,_binary '\0','/ecDJQZDK5O4IGaZsTIRfI70kfXM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113634',4.9,1634,'en','Midnight in Saint Petersburg','Harry Palmer heads a private investigation business based in Moscow. His associates are Nikolai \"Nick\" Petrov, ex-CIA agent Craig, and ex-KGB Colonel Gradsky. They take on the job of finding 1000 grams of weapons-grade plutonium stolen from the Russian government, though they do not know the identity of their client.','/wCW51ACVUu0rofvs6DL2P5EnvEI.jpg','1996-10-17',86,'Released','No One Can Be Trusted. Nothing Is As It Seems. One Wrong Move Could Cost Everything.','Midnight in Saint Petersburg',23608,2.4497,5.2,'mRwd2WPsS5A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12818,_binary '\0','/1Jo5VQqlHd2fxR6LOnusoKumXuU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113649',6.9,2380,'es','Libertarias','At the outbreak of the Spanish Civil War, the nun Maria is forced to flee her convent. She takes refuge in a brothel, until it is liberated by a woman\'s anarchist group. Maria joins the group and eventually goes to the front. The women\'s group faces the problems of fighting not only the nationalists, but also factions on the left seeking to impose a more traditional military structure.','/k9HiiZRNS6N0PnUM7Wyeo5cspEn.jpg','1996-04-19',125,'Released',NULL,'Freedomfighters',58097,1.2491,6.5,'1NLfEnfKBmw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12819,_binary '\0','/tcMVpjdEpsXrbPtVrSmh4uDBSiy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113670',7.6,39514,'en','A Little Princess','When her father enlists to fight for the British in WWI, young Sara Crewe goes to New York to attend the same boarding school her late mother attended. She soon clashes with the severe headmistress, Miss Minchin, who attempts to stifle Sara\'s creativity and sense of self-worth.','/9V4bAVEskSNbEqjVI0YmeuB0n8I.jpg','1995-05-10',97,'Released','No miracle is ever too small.','A Little Princess',19101,5.4745,7.6,'Q3WJrWZ_npg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12820,_binary '\0','/tflrcWltHuZ15pxrhHFZovPLGQs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113674',5.2,2135,'en','Live Nude Girls','A group of old friends at a Hens Night discuss their issues, uncertainties, fears and fantasies.','/vg9piYFtCTHep2V5EmLjwsYMzn2.jpg','1995-12-08',95,'Released','Sex, Lies and Fantasies... Unrated!','Live Nude Girls',26271,3.1183,4.69,'5T8bssaRGHQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12821,_binary '\0','/6CwIvZzTtsHX9LQAySH03Vby5UV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113677',7.5,21940,'en','Living in Oblivion','Low-budget independent filmmaker Nick Reve tries to keep everything together as his production is plagued with an insecure actress, a megalomaniac star, a pretentious beret-wearing director of photography, and lousy catering.','/b54xDk98oWtEtAso9sj1wjaZDDH.jpg','1995-07-21',90,'Released','Nick is about to discover the first rule of filmmaking: if at first you don\'t succeed... PANIC!','Living in Oblivion',9071,3.5784,7.2,'QjoJjWvKiUY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12822,_binary '\0','/2FRGE0hIaEOAIB3pq2rEq3Vx9NQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113682',5.6,5459,'en','Loch Ness','Dr. Dempsey, an American scientist, is sent to Scotland to disprove the existence of the Loch Ness Monster. He is shocked when Laura, an inn-keeper, introduces him to a small family of Nessie-dinosaurs.','/fMXL9o1N150SK0z6Sk6aXnC4oEB.jpg','1996-08-23',101,'Released','for 1500 years one legend remains undiscovered undisturbed until now LOCH NESS.','Loch Ness',51043,2.9419,5.7,'L90001PVzec','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12823,_binary '\0','/xeoSaPhZ3SCizkCQaofVB9w6iZE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113690',6.1,20228,'en','Lord of Illusions','During a routine case in L.A., NY private investigator Harry D\'Amour stumbles over members of a fanatic cult who are preparing for the resurrection of their leader Nix, a powerful magician who was killed 13 years earlier.','/8MZu8s01psozeTuD6OzstP4vSvM.jpg','1995-08-25',109,'Released','Prepare for the coming.','Lord of Illusions',8973,3.4002,5.908,'U_czotvi8FQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12824,_binary '\0','/xt4tkFRKwT1uiOpMpszIqFwOoji.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113691',6.4,6830,'en','Losing Isaiah','Khaila Richards, a crack-addicted single mother, accidentally leaves her baby in a dumpster while high and returns the next day in a panic to find he is missing. In reality, the baby has been adopted by a warm-hearted social worker, Margaret Lewin, and her husband, Charles. Years later, Khaila has gone through rehab and holds a steady job. After learning that her child is still alive, she challenges Margaret for the custody.','/oHALKuPewtqIn2BcluZsGvcEG1P.jpg','1995-03-17',106,'Released','Who decides what makes a mother?','Losing Isaiah',28313,3.9123,6.5,'-ZXnvEun0sc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12825,_binary '\0','/j0H799tVVLesjskDbL5FKcV5Nfr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113703',7.9,13699,'ja','Love Letter','Hiroko attends the memorial service of her fiancé, Itsuki Fujii, who died in a mountain-climbing incident. Although Itsuki\'s mother says that their old house is gone, Hiroko records the address listed under his name in his yearbook and sends him a letter. Surprisingly, she receives a reply, and discovers it came from his old classmate, a girl who also happens to be called Itsuki Fujii.','/ux1pNQKM3MP2mdOENEXf41UU08b.jpg','1995-03-25',117,'Released','Lost love lives on.','Love Letter',47002,5.667,7.8,'P6JAtpSC0EA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12826,_binary '\0','/uonotYnbDrHXcMFA1AbembrrQ8N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113718',6.8,3529,'fr','Lumière et Compagnie','40 international directors were asked to make a short film using the original Cinematographe invented by the Lumière Brothers, working under conditions similar to those of 1895. There were three rules: (1) The film could be no longer than 52 seconds, (2) no synchronized sound was permitted, and (3) no more than three takes.','/bSQ394UJb2xjMfwucHiHxg8XR5f.jpg','1995-12-20',88,'Released','Fourty intriguing films from the world\'s leading directors','Lumière & Company',48336,2.2075,6.4,'M0aqmD90pE0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12827,_binary '\0','/wTipCPwvGfm3IJXBRojmuj97GIN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113720',6.8,8882,'sv','Lust och fägring stor','In 1943 Malmö, 15-year-old Stig is attracted to his teacher Viola, 22 years his senior, who, drawn to his youth and innocence, believes the lad is a God-sent relief from her miserable marriage to a drunken, unfaithful lout.','/y1oFNynXrIzlPUe4CXKMR2dpNep.jpg','1995-03-08',125,'Released','He was a student. She was his teacher. Their love was forbidden.','All Things Fair',27098,9.4576,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12828,_binary '\0','/bk8RQN88Hh5jusTKydxCJfDlDNg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113725',7.5,8750,'ja','幻の光','A tragedy strikes a young woman\'s life without warning or reason. She continues living while searching for meaning in a lonely world.','/ri9sequtTo9K8I6AQoRbbBzU8F2.jpg','1995-10-01',110,'Released',NULL,'Maborosi',18872,2.5484,7.5,'n0mDpUpIZ6Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12829,_binary '\0','/8njBiJUriBw4wrT6FoVpYA57wdG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113729',5.4,7456,'en','Mad Love','Matt falls for Casey, the new girl in school. She\'s fun-loving and eccentric, but there\'s a darkness to her whimsy that Matt can\'t begin to comprehend. When Casey attempts to commit suicide, her parents place her in a mental institution. Matt springs her out, and together the young lovers head on a road trip. They believe their love can \"cure\" Casey\'s problems. Matt starts to wonder, though, if are they inspired or misguided.','/glhctWoYw1jg8z0FUSwFD4UTNi4.jpg','1995-05-26',95,'Released','A wild and sexy adventure!','Mad Love',47608,3.1278,5.2,'OS4XqN-LaO4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12830,_binary '\0','/sG5V7eXUmaylQlDkVsEdpErPGEE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113737',5.4,2247,'en','Magic in the Water','Radio psychologist Jack Black takes his children Joshua and Ashley on a \'vacation\' to a lake in British Columbia. While he grinds away at work the children discover that the famous local lake monster \"Orky\" may not be just a gimmick to attract tourists after all. In fact, Orky may enable them to get closer to their workaholic dad, and help stop local polluters who are dumping toxic waste.','/54BiiZRiIUFDNboO8RZ81AKqk3d.jpg','1995-08-30',98,'Released','In a small town, on a peaceful lake, a mythical creature is about to surface.','Magic in the Water',24962,2.9545,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12831,_binary '\0','/uROWnhZkGUJDIkEA94eCCg1y39y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113748',5.1,1793,'en','Malicious','A mystery woman turns vengeful after a college athlete dumps her following a one-night stand.','/eGvIuVn858L3UnawNyHDRLFGx57.jpg','1995-11-06',92,'Released','Ignore her, and she\'ll never go away.','Malicious',71376,1.6915,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12832,_binary '\0','/h8fMLx6zJ5qfp8uT2DXzbHCFoJC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113749',7,135219,'en','Mallrats','Both dumped by their girlfriends, two best friends seek refuge in the local mall. Eventually, they decide to try and win back their significant others and take care of their respective nemeses.','/2ip0sGIMPN0XEN6q3lQIoaNI6tP.jpg','1995-10-20',95,'Released','They\'re not there to shop. They\'re not there to work. They\'re just there.','Mallrats',2293,5.2209,6.8,'XpshU8YDYjw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12833,_binary '\0','/45XjLWOACuD9UcFZ5iFGtQPVlAW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113755',5.3,11353,'en','Man of the House','Ben Archer is not happy. His mother, Sandy, has just met a man, and it looks like things are pretty serious. Driven by a fear of abandonment, Ben tries anything and everything to ruin the \"love bubble\" which surrounds his mom. However, after Ben and Jack\'s experiences in the Indian Guides, the two become much closer.','/6bnOhhrrrq6RZhMgz4aGyqbJ9Wf.jpg','1995-03-03',96,'Released','Jack wants to marry Ben\'s mother. But there are strings attached.','Man of the House',40490,3.7072,5.4,'JcW2p8nyrng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12834,_binary '\0','/c6wTuTMEl0ffnZyzozNiw08Ocnl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113757',5.9,1719,'cn','滿清十大酷刑','A corrupt magistrate subjects an innocent young bride to inconceivable physical punishments after convicting her of killing her husband.','/wbMoB0gCTA9oKz75YuE8szcCjfJ.jpg','1994-05-19',93,'Released',NULL,'A Chinese Torture Chamber Story',32629,5.7612,5.7,'AZ7bkjVuDB4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12835,_binary '\0','/fg62HvBsidzoZLzhjEyfXITwKdQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113762',4.5,10923,'en','The Mangler','A laundry-folding machine has been possessed by a demon, causing it to develop homicidal tendencies.','/vwRZOUzIX17luLM69sCC9meM9od.jpg','1995-03-03',106,'Released','It has a CRUSH on you!','The Mangler',13559,4.3344,4.9,'BhTgzfMwpiQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12836,_binary '\0','/gTT4K142pCJ1bZtbMybOSRLtv0m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113774',7.2,1451,'en','Margaret\'s Museum','In a town where half the men die down the coalpit, Margaret MacNeil is quite happy being single in her small Cape Breton island town. Until she meets Neil Currie, a charming and sincere bagpipe-playing, Gaelic-speaking dishwasher. But no matter what you do, you can\'t avoid the spectre of the pit forever.','/ulhih7Th6S9zuhR5kOiVdCm8Il4.jpg','1995-09-13',114,'Released','She found a way to preserve her memories forever.','Margaret\'s Museum',71754,1.462,6.5,'S82xxKIURF4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12837,_binary '\0','/hNf6J498veQVdq5FhHmL08ardwf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113799',7.5,26566,'ja','MEMORIES','Three back-to-back anime films by three different directors make up this sci-fi trilogy three years in the making.','/e0HIBRiKS5dWmXkxWvEh6JQZcc2.jpg','1995-12-23',113,'Released','Three unforgettable tales from the masters of anime.','Memories',42994,5.022,7.5,'NTyRMfdDfc8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12838,_binary '\0','/7WdT5QF2HPPPeiNHcm6o4DfCsgI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113808',5.4,3725,'en','Miami Rhapsody','Even though Gwyn Marcus is engaged to her boyfriend, Matt, she is still afraid of commitment. While she admires her parents\' loving relationship, she discovers that her family has not always been faithful in marriage, making it harder than ever to settle down. As her mother pressures her to get married, and plenty of attractive men appear in her life, Gwyn learns that she must balance her career, relationships and marriage to be truly happy.','/joturqaJfAJ8XHPadT8kibgSpS4.jpg','1995-01-27',95,'Released','Love is great. Marriage is a completely different affair.','Miami Rhapsody',17402,3.5269,5.3,'H-FofBXlWKA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12839,_binary '\0','/hSY4PYJSFW5JWeQqOs2LAzG0W8a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113819',7,45289,'en','Mighty Aphrodite','When Lenny and his wife, Amanda, adopt a baby, Lenny realizes that his son is a genius and becomes obsessed with finding the boy\'s biological mother in hopes that she will be brilliant too. But when he learns that Max\'s mother is Linda Ash, a kindhearted prostitute and porn star, Lenny is determined to reform her immoral lifestyle. A Greek chorus chimes in to relate the plot to Greek mythology in this quirky comedy.','/ice135yQZp4iX2SgCmd90nKgS5j.jpg','1995-09-13',95,'Released','Of all human weaknesses, obsession is the most dangerous, and the silliest!','Mighty Aphrodite',11448,4.8771,6.7,'6hsIc9reo7k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12840,_binary '\0','/7n6RzJfPGnSGsHidO2gUWYgs1TT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113820',5.3,32278,'en','Mighty Morphin Power Rangers: The Movie','Six incredible teens out-maneuver and defeat evil everywhere as the Mighty Morphin Power Rangers, but this time the Power Rangers may have met their match when they face off with Ivan Ooze, the most sinister monster the galaxy has ever seen.','/pcLbHqs80dchv0byHivhdwHKEup.jpg','1995-06-30',96,'Released','Each has a power. Each has a purpose. And together, they will face their fiercest enemy.','Mighty Morphin Power Rangers: The Movie',9070,4.9674,5.892,'Gb5MGWPAiGg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12841,_binary '\0','/rphor0XQcYO4CQoQ6auaQm3UPap.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113824',7.8,84799,'ja','耳をすませば','Shizuku lives a simple life, dominated by her love for stories and writing. One day she notices that all the library books she has have been previously checked out by the same person: \"Seiji Amasawa.\"','/5FROLD8zpWFs9ja7aYho1uOMJHg.jpg','1995-07-15',111,'Released','I found someone I like.','Whisper of the Heart',37797,14.0517,7.943,'0pVkiod6V0U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12842,_binary '\0','/9uQMik14eqfgc3pjeQEHOZiE0t1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113828',7.4,4451,'fr','Les Misérables','In WWII France, poor and illiterate Henri Fortin is introduced to Victor Hugo\'s classic novel Les Misérables and begins to see parallels between the book and his own life.','/toQ6BJCiKVSnklpsma2GnJ6KKah.jpg','1995-03-22',175,'Released','In a time of chaos, in a world of change, he was moved by a book he could not read to become a hero he never imagined.','Les Miserables',48750,1.9709,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12843,_binary '\0','/gyaBJn7eR8Ol205wmT2Xpi6IuhA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113845',5.7,45700,'en','Money Train','When a vengeful New York transit cop decides to steal a trainload of subway fares, his foster brother—a fellow cop—tries to protect him.','/jWBDz6Mf9aQVBiUS76JQsEhvoJl.jpg','1995-11-21',110,'Released','Get on, or GET OUT THE WAY!','Money Train',11517,8.5306,5.874,'5Odo80-WFgM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12844,_binary '\0','/8KPKBnQV6fjLlH3BoMceoUNBvUb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113849',6.1,2790,'en','A Month by the Lake','For 16 years Miss Bentley has been spending April at an elegant hillside villa on Lake Como. This year, 1937, her London society artist father has recently died and the only other English-speaking guests are brash Americans. Then Major Wilshaw arrives. He suggests they meet for cocktails and Miss Bentley stands him up -- not even thinking about it -- as she helps the new nanny of an Italian family settle in. Miss Beaumont, a tall, young American who has dropped out of finishing school in Switzerland, is bored and finds some amusement in flirting with the major, whose libido is awakened for the first time since before the great war. And Miss Bentley now finds more about the major to admire than his ears.','/cgoiGvNffe4tZC33x6RIQQiKIp9.jpg','1995-09-11',92,'Released',NULL,'A Month by the Lake',41007,2.0607,5.7,'YX6mtTLHlkg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12845,_binary '\0','/rTVEE5TcZbqVFOSVKLu5CXYpkpS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113851',5.7,4471,'en','Moonlight and Valentino','A young widow still grieving over the death of her husband finds herself being comforted by a local housepainter.','/rKJ1DwaH8pM3qDNxKFxvsQEg6wE.jpg','1995-09-29',100,'Released','Virginity, sex, the big cry, and other salty topics.','Moonlight and Valentino',68274,2.4026,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12846,_binary '\0','/dfU9xyEEyLxvZ5unTn05Whm9Lce.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113855',5.9,136457,'en','Mortal Kombat','For nine generations an evil sorcerer has been victorious in hand-to-hand battle against his mortal enemies. If he wins a tenth Mortal Kombat tournament, desolation and evil will reign over the multiverse forever. To save Earth, three warriors must overcome seemingly insurmountable odds, their own inner demons, and superhuman foes.','/9YhpvhhvLrtL1wlwEfpVL16GI9d.jpg','1995-08-18',101,'Released','Nothing in this world has prepared you for this.','Mortal Kombat',9312,10.4447,5.915,'a1P1j6MP920','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12847,_binary '\0','/j8wsuXDWoP9z6ugemrW98WbpHwb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113858',4.9,3420,'en','Mosquito','An alien starship crashes in a swamp in a U.S. National Park. Some mosquitos begin to feed from the alien\'s corpses, causing them to grow to the size of a vulture. These mutant insects became very agressive, killing every human being they find. Will the few survivors fight successfully against this nightmare...?','/3YhIr9p5oeeNuD8ZHgQSKGavc44.jpg','1994-11-21',92,'Released','Millions Of Years Of Evolution Have Just Become Mankind\'s Worst Nightmare.','Mosquito',41574,1.9447,4.9,'dEjvwCYzeyc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12848,_binary '\0','/oUptKQLatCgywVDx0ETVhq7knHt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113862',7.4,44545,'en','Mr. Holland\'s Opus','In 1965, passionate musician Glenn Holland takes a day job as a high school music teacher, convinced it\'s just a small obstacle on the road to his true calling: writing a historic opus. As the decades roll by with the composition unwritten but generations of students inspired through his teaching, Holland must redefine his life\'s purpose.','/kBmwWeSN3ajnYHZ3dSybEobxEPI.jpg','1995-12-29',143,'Released','Of all the lives he changed, the one that changed the most was his own.','Mr. Holland\'s Opus',2054,5.8969,6.956,'1nsHT-9kFtE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12849,_binary '\0','/8uw6OCa4ofQ6A9xz5ldtgnEVPDr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113870',7.3,33236,'en','Murder in the First','A young, inexperienced public defender is assigned to defend an inmate accused of committing murder while behind bars.','/1S3xY4HKAXLNvvKXRECMrbVnGQR.jpg','1995-01-20',122,'Released','The trial that brought down Alcatraz.','Murder in the First',8438,7.0552,7.1,'8X9HG1W-23Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12850,_binary '\0','/7aobDzV4NBSTVvaltT74EbpkDwO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113896',7.3,4852,'en','My Family','Traces over three generations an immigrant family\'s trials, tribulations, tragedies, and triumphs. Maria and Jose, the first generation, come to Los Angeles, meet, marry, face deportation all in the 1930s. They establish their family in East L.A., and their children Chucho, Paco, Memo, Irene, Toni, and Jimmy deal with youth culture and the L.A. police in the \'50s. As the second generation become adults in the \'60s, the focus shifts to Jimmy, his marriage to Isabel (a Salvadorian refugee), their son, and Jimmy\'s journey to becoming a responsible parent.','/i6t6QF5QyUd3UAQ8JM8eVU1169D.jpg','1995-05-03',128,'Released','Three generations of dreams.','My Family',38722,3.3152,7.444,'V2mQUID4Wx8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12851,_binary '\0','/6serW02awztrQ9CCUvZZrSwSJCA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113918',6.8,2364,'es','Nadie hablará de nosotras cuando hayamos muerto','Alcoholic prostitute Gloria is in the middle of a business deal with gangsters when a fatal confrontation occurs. She flees Mexico City, returning to her native Madrid, where she\'s reunited with her comatose husband and his mother, while hitman Eduardo is pursuing her to retrieve information.','/Ahj3sJHmX4Fof72kubtaKlowoRY.jpg','1995-10-05',104,'Released',NULL,'Nobody Will Speak of Us When We\'re Dead',74840,1.6642,7,'A3vgrk_hfP8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12852,_binary '\0','/aXwXCV9tfdrxiISlVxqhP1p8UpL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113922',7.3,1680,'ja','渚のシンドバッド','A coming-of-age story. Shuji, a Japanese teen, is falling in love with his friend Hiroyuki, however, Hiroyuki is attracted to Kasane, the new girl in their class.','/h2ofrgLOB0eXaLlqnL6nIG4gxzr.jpg','1995-12-16',129,'Released',NULL,'Like Grains of Sand',26896,1.6502,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12853,_binary '\0','/o2QOGwQqpKC82l52bkjRzJyb0Ve.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113932',6.1,2228,'en','Napoleon','The adventures of Golden Retriever pup Napoleon and his friend, the parrot Birdo Lucci.','/c3wcjhGgC9usb8MhrKNeVjIr1Lz.jpg','1995-06-30',81,'Released','He\'s boldly going where no house pet has ever gone before.','Napoleon',44381,3.0887,6.345,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12854,_binary '\0','/4ZBhKQ4ar6sIOG2greomg2e3dv2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113936',5.7,6760,'en','National Lampoon\'s Senior Trip','While on detention, a group of misfits and slackers have to write a letter to the President explaining what is wrong with the education system. There is only one problem, the President loves it! Hence, the group must travel to Washington to meet the Main Man.','/3QpB4KpMKRnZnsJOsemOZHDoQKw.jpg','1995-09-08',91,'Released','Four score and seven beers ago... They came. They saw. They passed out.','National Lampoon\'s Senior Trip',27993,2.8821,5.5,'0xa74mYgSnI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12855,_binary '\0','/yfsOmGOMwuZxgjAlyiOwuen4a6u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113939',6.2,3109,'en','Nature of the Beast','Two men, both hiding a deadly secret, are on a murderous rampage through the desert.','/l633GuQGaHJFfNhQg2cEBZHoVjI.jpg','1995-10-23',91,'Released','All men are created evil.','Nature of the Beast',85564,2.5294,5.944,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12856,_binary '\0','/evGlZtheDf2sDZZA5Vg8RzgES02.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113947',7.2,5486,'fr','Nelly et Mr. Arnaud','Nelly leaves her lazy, unemployed husband to work for retired judge Mr Arnaud, forty years her senior, after he offers to clear her bills for her. While she types his memoirs the two develop a close friendship, but Arnaud becomes jealous when Nelly begins dating his good-looking young publisher.','/87kKTPi9r7YIVrlo9Z42NwTXBVi.jpg','1995-10-18',106,'Released',NULL,'Nelly and Monsieur Arnaud',12652,2.863,7.02,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12857,_binary '\0','/dDE6EIaFsPFJPLXHG1ghuPQc7ST.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113957',6,80726,'en','The Net','Angela Bennett is a freelance computer systems analyst who tracks down software viruses. At night, she hooks up to the internet and chats to others \'surfing the net\'. While de-bugging a new high-tech game for a cyber friend, she comes across a top secret program and becomes the target of a mysterious organization, who will stop at nothing to erase her identity and her existence in order to protect the project.','/dtupntUFMD5iXBo8HLfALt2ET4R.jpg','1995-07-28',114,'Released','Her driver\'s license. Her credit cards. Her bank accounts. Her identity. DELETED.','The Net',1642,6.3907,6.06,'46qKHq7REI4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12858,_binary '\0','/cdfXRJaLXjL6hGYAOYVmhAJu62f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113965',5.3,7942,'en','Never Talk to Strangers','Sarah Taylor, a police psychologist, meets a mysterious and seductive young man, Tony Ramirez, and falls in love with him. As a cause of this relationship, she changes her personality when she begins to receive anonymous telephone calls.','/naZWa06duMvKr4dLrPGgl9yrPZ1.jpg','1995-10-20',86,'Released','In A World Where Love Isn\'t Always Safe, Trust Can Be Deadly.','Never Talk to Strangers',48781,3.9756,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12859,_binary '\0','/ds835eZ1BQa6MP0GuaGuu8Bb9RD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113967',6.6,3751,'en','New Jersey Drive','Jason and Midget are two young, black teenagers living in Newark, New Jersey, the unofficial car theft capital of the world. Their favourite pastime is that of everybody in their neighbourhood: stealing cars and joyriding. The trouble starts when they steal a police car and the cops launch a violent offensive that involves beating and even shooting suspects.','/lXJWJT6lfAg2NEqEueJcI4ESWSG.jpg','1995-04-19',98,'Released','The Only Thing That Matters Is The Ride','New Jersey Drive',39310,2.368,6.2,'6wEM9KYgMx4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12860,_binary '\0','/lqYC3KzAx4luSaB6kQzuItAGFsS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113971',7.3,4274,'pl','Nic śmiesznego','One day, hospital orderlies, watching corpse in the morgue, recognize film director. Man, even though he died, he begins to remember his life. He made a career making movies, had numerous mistresses, but never realized their dreams. His life was interspersed with many setbacks that enfeebled him from the inside. Although he made a career in film, he was not happy with his life.','/safG3ShLh8BtAGyw77qXHz5wXu2.jpg','1996-02-02',95,'Released',NULL,'Nothing Funny',24768,1.2412,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12861,_binary '\0','/u1JzntSiNw9vUCqYIOcNDajWwdZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113972',6.3,47946,'en','Nick of Time','An ordinary man is suddenly forced into a plot to kill a politician in exchange for his kidnapped daughter\'s freedom.','/A1FJwUVg84sQSjHVz5jVMXQvifJ.jpg','1995-11-22',89,'Released','Ninety minutes. Six bullets. No choice.','Nick of Time',2086,4.8415,6.237,'PVT1iXco8bc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12862,_binary '\0','/ov0vKHlWG8WrvTXQXBh8erhowJp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113982',5.4,1733,'en','Night of the Scarecrow','A group of drunk teenagers accidently set free the spirit of a warlock, which possesses a scarecrow. The scarecrow goes on a bloody rampage killing the descendents of the men who had killed the warlock a century before. A newcomer and the daughter of the mayor try to stop it before it is too late and the warlock can reincarnate...','/i6crY4HAR2MZQMmWVzLP8Yel37I.jpg','1995-08-08',85,'Released','Terror has come home to harvest','Night of the Scarecrow',55537,2.514,4.958,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12863,_binary '\0','/8r51eVEjtqAQvpHfbFHXcedRB8r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113984',5.1,1915,'en','Night Watch','UN agents Mike Graham and Sabrina Carver are sent by their director Nick Caldwell to investigate the theft of Rembrandt\'s painting, \"The Night Watch\". The trail takes them from Amsterdam to Hong Kong and involves them in not only art theft and forgery, but the high-tech schemes of Martin Schraeder and his Korean cohort Mao Yixin','/6B3RWyjuiMcug49aw65h0F6wjDQ.jpg','1995-10-04',94,'Released','Action and espionage share a common bond.','Night Watch',38651,1.9542,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12864,_binary '\0','/4snl08qYXCUti8JBD2qeCV5kktX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113986',5.5,40446,'en','Nine Months','When he finds out his longtime girlfriend is pregnant, a commitment-phobe realizes he might have to change his lifestyle for better or much, much worse.','/y3VwPenHpiuIGb0fhgyt7PXZKLB.jpg','1995-07-12',103,'Released','Ready or Not.','Nine Months',11472,6.9476,5.721,'dVmOU8HPf_E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12865,_binary '\0','/zAaFQHZV23SJgSwRBvW5PeD219H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113987',7,34852,'en','Nixon','A look at President Richard M. Nixon—a man carrying the fate of the world on his shoulders while battling the self-destructive demands from within—spanning his troubled boyhood in California to the shocking Watergate scandal that would end his Presidency.','/cz2MTGr2wpDZLirgV2rGHBdA2t3.jpg','1995-12-22',192,'Released','Triumphant in Victory, Bitter in Defeat. He Changed the World, But Lost a Nation.','Nixon',10858,5.0579,6.813,'dO2LWKpeyI8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12866,_binary '\0','/gadua0G6Ba8YrpFLLn55ZBupgCP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0113999',5.4,1463,'en','One Tough Bastard','When a man\'s wife and family are murdered, he plots revenge only to find out that the killer is under Federal protection and he must exact his own form of justice.','/nwTewKNeOhXz3womN75WFBgJMGM.jpg','1996-07-26',100,'Released','Revenge is everything.','One Tough Bastard',97618,2.8074,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12867,_binary '\0','/ic529Vlnxmp2ArVSYr5vBLoNFEK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114011',6.8,35296,'en','Now and Then','Waxing nostalgic about the bittersweet passage from childhood to puberty, four childhood girlfriends — Teeny, Chrissy, Samantha and Roberta — recall the magical summer of 1970. During their walk down memory lane, they reconcile experiences with boys, secrets, bullies and more.','/q31Ks8oAmM4Nq2CcGjyYYpdBAmh.jpg','1995-10-20',102,'Released','In every woman there is the girl she left behind.','Now and Then',9263,6.3233,6.879,'RQLVzTtt2Ws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12868,_binary '\0','/8CVUo9plS6ZVliu8rbC8mJd3oqI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114031',4,2160,'hi','ओह डार्लिंग यह है इंडिया!','Miss India and an aspiring actor spend a night together roaming the streets of Mumbai and unwittingly clash paths with a megalomaniacal gangster planning to take over India.','/i09cnJD9MW5a44GAC0GSSD5QwNX.jpg','1995-08-11',153,'Released',NULL,'Oh Darling! Yeh Hai India!',160243,1.2572,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12869,_binary '\0','/zPpB979cGcFKNIzW5ohiG6WEf7s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114048',5.3,10319,'en','Operation Dumbo Drop','Five Green Berets stationed in Vietnam in 1968 grudgingly undertake the mission of a lifetime -- to secretly transport an 8,000-pound elephant through 200 miles of rough jungle terrain. High jinks prevail when Capt. Sam Cahill promises the Montagnard villagers of Dak Nhe that he\'ll replace their prized elephant in time for an important ritual. But for Capt. T.C. Doyle, the mission becomes a jumbo-sized headache!','/qIJlpbMCKg9O1C7gaiyDFaUWf9b.jpg','1995-07-28',107,'Released','A top-secret mission of gigantic proportions!','Operation Dumbo Drop',27281,2.9304,5.2,'mHd7O6YeHIU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12870,_binary '\0','/87WAS6PKMxenH6oYfeiPNLB8IKI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114055',7.4,5301,'ru','Особенности национальной охоты','A Finn preparing a work on the Russian hunting traditions and customs, comes to Russia to collect materials and is invited to take part in a hunting party. His flamboyant companions include an Army general, with more than a passing resemblance to Aleksander Lebed, a police detective, local forest ranger (a devotee of Zen Buddhism) and some big-city types from St. Petersburg. Inevitably, their good intentions soon give way to endless drinking, visits to local farm girls and much else besides.','/knfyxxvcXAlDX9K6gqDKMA1v81o.jpg','1995-06-15',93,'Released',NULL,'Peculiarities of the National Hunt',451928,1.4751,6.835,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12871,_binary '\0','/7SqIfSVW3xKTk07FbUm4LrhOOeL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114057',6.8,10686,'en','Othello','The evil Iago pretends to be friend of Othello in order to manipulate him to serve his own end in the film version of this Shakespeare classic.','/kyevuYzW36wKadiE8lftLac5VwQ.jpg','1995-12-15',123,'Released','Envy, greed, jealousy and love.','Othello',16420,2.084,6.4,'WIIjya_5Oro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12872,_binary '\0','/jwwltwI2uLpxhIUReucyLBkL8dg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114069',6.6,147119,'en','Outbreak','A deadly airborne virus finds its way into the USA and starts killing off people at an epidemic rate. Col. Sam Daniels\' job is to stop the virus spreading from a small town, which must be quarantined, and to prevent an over reaction by the White House.','/4KymNvlWR0XF0sqX2BWRd9Z3yXR.jpg','1995-03-10',129,'Released','Try to remain calm.','Outbreak',6950,9.0867,6.6,'AgZ5goJibn0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12873,_binary '\0','/wLNDiDL0o4Ht2UsLd1jGu4tCM5N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114084',6.4,2873,'en','Panther','In this sprawling, fictionalized history of the Black Panthers, 1960s Oakland becomes a war zone as the Panthers battle for the right to exist.','/gxGOkt6WBhSIdZiQqyVEccRURVv.jpg','1995-05-03',124,'Released','The People Called Them Heroes. The F.B.I. Called Them Public Enemy Number One.','Panther',41478,3.0504,6.3,'6_K3LUtw0sY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12874,_binary '\0','/zzycVYDPY4qtx2m99UkusI13nG8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114086',6.4,6544,'fr','Al di là delle nuvole','Four tales, each centered on a woman, journey inward to explore the enigmatic reality of their lives, connecting through a single narrative thread.','/dFvjnu8NxaGlJUuNHTsaw4Ng5ee.jpg','1995-10-27',110,'Released',NULL,'Beyond the Clouds',33517,3.605,6.178,'uJBN0awboIE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12875,_binary '\0','/sMiMYF7sf8h6s8R0a3r1bO1Y3Wk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114095',6.5,9193,'en','Party Girl','Although Mary has little income, she still finds ways to spend her nights at clubs. After being arrested for throwing an illegal rave, she asks her aunt Judy for bail money. Judy then finds Mary a job at her library so that Mary can repay her. Initially, Mary finds the job as a clerk boring and stifling, and prefers to get to know a street food vendor whom she likes. However, Mary must refocus her life once she loses her job and apartment.','/cfGEUftQVjvJHTTc3OKbzfsBamT.jpg','1995-06-09',94,'Released','There\'s a new librarian in town!','Party Girl',36196,3.2285,6.6,'9y-TvmzQ8qA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12876,_binary '\0','/eA4zo1RWNuzGbxMSLGYrkuEIZCw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114099',5.8,4585,'en','The Passion of Darkly Noon','Desire torments a former cultist taking refuge at the home of a scantily clad woman whose husband is away.','/nx459fssgbvYTBcL5CC0lH1gbwq.jpg','1995-01-02',99,'Released','No Faith Without Blood','The Passion of Darkly Noon',37062,2.5079,5.621,'CHFhUt60xxo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12877,_binary '\0','/9AJNEWmprXEIRhMdWFirYn1egbZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114108',5.6,6145,'en','The Pebble and the Penguin','A bashful bachelor penguin named Hubie, who\'s partial to a pretty female named Marina. Ancient penguin ritual dictates that males present a pebble to their intended, then mate for life. Hubie finds a spiffy stone, but before he can bestow it on Marina, dastardly rival Drake tosses him into the churning sea, and Hubie gets swept away.','/aWi36nNbyMw51yGN0tTSOrOLu6L.jpg','1995-04-12',74,'Released','The adventure of a lifetime begins with one small pebble.','The Pebble and the Penguin',54648,3.2465,5.2,'OPGRkDfw2mk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12878,_binary '\0','/34O2EvrVTUup7a0JllQWtXURQw1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114113',6,2628,'en','The Perez Family','In the midst of the Mariel boat lift -- a hurried exodus of refugees from Cuba going to America -- an immigration clerk accidentally presumes that dissident Juan Raul Perez and Dorita Evita Perez are married. United by their last name and a mutual resolve to emigrate, Dorita and Juan agree to play along. But it gets complicated when the two begin falling for each other just as Juan reunites with his wife, Carmela, whom he hasn\'t seen in decades.','/jxi3UDHf86kDk5hqJxnpEMzVch2.jpg','1995-05-12',113,'Released','On the way to finding a family, she found love.','The Perez Family',63020,2.3206,6.1,'irBhYcQ50Tc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12879,_binary '\0','/evCHYeumw4Y4hikG4AG9o5yZXUW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114117',7.6,12890,'en','Persuasion','In early 19th-century England, dire financial straits reacquaint the aristocratic Anne Elliot with her wealthy ex-fiance Frederick Wentworth. The two must choose between either putting the past behind them or listening to their hearts.','/10hycdhFLq3M3y0ONxIMSiY8Mrs.jpg','1995-05-01',107,'Released','A love lost, but never forgotten','Persuasion',17015,4.3576,7.212,'u4T5dl1isp8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12880,_binary '\0','/4B5L3OQsta7N7qr08yRS44ESIKK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114126',6.3,11044,'cn','霹靂火','In order to release his kidnapped sister, sports car mechanic, Chan Foh To, has to defeat a super-criminal street racer.','/81D5xBlnTAdJs19dbkfw8eK0oWA.jpg','1995-08-05',110,'Released','The stakes don\'t come much higher.','Thunderbolt',10348,6.5357,6.5,'0PTTRQIFO7U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12881,_binary '\0','/27isI5pxtk6b04G3nfCVzLfgEyG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114129',6.6,1229,'en','Picture Bride','Riyo, an orphaned 17-year old, sails from Yokohama to Hawaii in 1918 to marry Matsuji, a man she has never met. Hoping to escape a troubled past and start anew, Riyo is bitterly disappointed upon her arrival: her husband is twice her age. The miserable girl finds solace with her new friend Kana, a young mother who helps Riyo accept her new life.','/s1lUr4NWgOi4ftXLrUWGI49IvKK.jpg','1995-05-05',94,'Released',NULL,'Picture Bride',30304,1.3742,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12882,_binary '\0','/23x8GGvzDuUCZy3YbNLNiQUtx02.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114134',6.5,14339,'en','The Pillow Book','Nagito has a fetish for calligraphy on the human body and meets her ideal soulmate Jerome, an English translator sent to Japan. However, once Nagiko\'s father\'s gay publisher rejoins the scene, the story is overtaken by treachery and bloodlust.','/haJOy4dOmy0nih5RH25FBuwVNH4.jpg','1995-09-01',126,'Released',NULL,'The Pillow Book',26422,4.1712,6.353,'z4I75Rvb0zo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12883,_binary '\0','/iIJ7H6dhkIuIwJ3qBJ5AEfQUOMc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114137',4.1,2992,'en','Piranha','Doctor Baines has been conducting genetic experiments on piranhas and has made them virtually unstoppable. Unfortunately, his assistants, Maggie and Paul, accidentally release the hybrids into the Lost River Lake threatening to destroy everyone in their path. Can they prevent the flesh-eating piranhas from escaping into the ocean and spawning?','/sUzAJwxeGiODOVmsIGrgXcy9aj1.jpg','1995-10-01',89,'Released','Lost River Lake was a thriving resort, Until they discovered...','Piranha',48374,2.3345,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12884,_binary '\0','/fDZ2DCKW2D7J0ABNr9EICdD2H1s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114148',6.7,220092,'en','Pocahontas','Pocahontas, daughter of a Native American tribe chief, falls in love with an English soldier as colonists invade 17th century Virginia.','/kZ1ft0QZ4e3zDUPMBftEkwI9ftd.jpg','1995-06-16',81,'Released','An American legend comes to life.','Pocahontas',10530,12.7993,6.913,'DDKjqUzDPRY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12885,_binary '\0','/gAeFtnwgF4asNVbmrudWMHOilWj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114168',6.6,35420,'en','Powder','Harassed by classmates who won\'t accept his shocking appearance, a shy young man known as \"Powder\" struggles to fit in. But the cruel taunts stop when Powder displays a mysterious power that allows him to do incredible things. This phenomenon changes the lives of all those around him in ways they never could have imagined.','/zwVmkbrRdbNceK4drB0imFszGxl.jpg','1995-10-27',112,'Released','An extraordinary encounter with another human being.','Powder',12665,5.694,7.061,'lGp4WXcVEno','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12886,_binary '\0','/oRHGvCbijALcsiJQk62Ty3m6XHi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114188',3.4,4306,'en','Problem Child 3','Now a pre-teen, Junior has fallen head over heels for a classmate who doesn\'t even notice him, but does notice three other boys – a child star, a hockey player and a Boy Scout – who are rivals to Junior. This means war!','/adCNPBJPaBjp9ikJAJYGAkqz6CE.jpg','1995-05-13',87,'Released','Junior in Love!','Problem Child 3',28601,3.5713,4.8,'YXGlxRfAVoo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12887,_binary '\0','/gC9153vwf9LIOIzdDvHuP7geVet.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114193',4.5,1452,'en','Project: Metalbeast','With the medical breakthrough of a metal-based synthetic skin called \"bio-ferron\" the prospect for pioneering surgeries for burn victims and cancer patients seems set to occur but for the warped head scientist in charge...it\'s a opportunist chance to reactivate a long forgotten classified project...that has been left frozen in a set of cryogenic chambers deep beneath the bowels of government laboratory. Convincing the other in the research team to start work on putting this living \'metal\' skin on corpses, he now has the perfect test patients waiting on ice for them to work on. But there was a reason three of these stiffs in particular where left to chill. Due to an experiment gone bad these three only look human on the outside and none of them are as dead as everyone believes they are.','/m2Sy5Hb3xBIWjHLsPZaEqEv8MRl.jpg','1995-01-03',92,'Released','DNA Overload','Project: Metalbeast',92698,1.7298,4.4,'MUjr6XHyWTQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12888,_binary '\0','/kZbLOAlCB3htkhyZzTkUv21i0gv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114194',6.4,36016,'en','The Prophecy','The angel Gabriel comes to Earth to collect a soul which will end the stalemated war in Heaven. However, it is hidden inside of a Native American girl and only a former priest and a schoolteacher can stop him.','/4ZWFhQipzBHJze2llzCzhrSIZsn.jpg','1995-08-05',98,'Released','Marked by fate, doomed by prophecy.','The Prophecy',11980,5.3945,6.5,'okN79Z_uw9Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12889,_binary '\0','/fN7uHMRtkKekReuJ2rl1rOPtN6O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114196',4.1,1378,'en','Proteus','Group of heroin smugglers finds shelter on abandoned oil rig after their ship had exploded. Soon they find that the oil rig was just cover for biological experiment. One of the results is Charlie - shape-shifting monster with ability to absorb the memory of its victims. However, even such creatures have their own bad habits.','/svuWussng8tQtMq3AtpO1CBTnty.jpg','1995-11-04',97,'Released','In the middle of the ocean, a new form of horror is taking shape.','Proteus',116194,1.5271,4.7,'kLoURCQuIzM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12890,_binary '\0','/iABYnpNMzbSu9Cu17rukNQOOFDb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114212',6.8,1833,'pt','O Quatrilho','The story of two immigrant couples: Teresa and Angelo; Pierina and Massimo. While fighting for survival in the new world, the unexpected love of Massimo and Teresa appears. They react against family and cultural traditions and leave to a new destiny, leaving their partners. Quatrilho is the name of a card game in wich the player have to betray his partner in order to become the champion.','/jCulmudehw1pGcwIJbH2KBWTCk4.jpg','1995-10-20',110,'Released','A game of fascination and seduction','The Quartet',67617,1.0831,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12891,_binary '\0','/wwdzmWC1Ra9SqPBrtCyRNJ4oYUO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114214',6.5,114896,'en','The Quick and the Dead','A mysterious woman comes to compete in a quick-draw elimination tournament, in a town taken over by a notorious gunman.','/jhEmrXJpP6F3cqwyLjvgBgxxxFA.jpg','1995-02-09',107,'Released','Think you\'re quick enough?','The Quick and the Dead',12106,10.698,6.562,'Lo9cGqmHXhg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12892,_binary '\0','/1FeG9ZnebSuKslZMVPUdFB0AyJy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114230',5.2,1221,'hi','राजा','Rana Mahednra Pratap Garewal (Mukesh Khanna) is a wealthy businessman along with his brother Vishwa (Dalip Tahil). They are both good friends with Brijnath (Paresh Rawal) who is not as wealthy. Rana\'s younger sister Madhu (Madhuri Dixit) is a good friend of Brijnath\'s younger brother Raja (Sanjay Kapoor). Seeing this Rana and Birju both arrange for Raja and Madhu to marry when they are older but Rana quickly backs out and insults Birju because of his social status.','/1UDwr2CnaVRKKJ6UZh4jRbTVV2f.jpg','1995-06-02',168,'Released',NULL,'Raja',205075,1.3125,5.286,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12893,_binary '\0','/fsD5yYICjnXwG8TKesuJHzkjMAh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114231',5.4,4830,'hi','राम जाने','A street hustler, who has spent several years in and out of prison, decides to reform his life, as he teaches street kids to stay away from crime, but has trouble maintaining these ideals in his own life.','/3xBLu6PZK6XeyUdRGlHOkONALlr.jpg','1995-11-29',172,'Released',NULL,'Ram Jaane',160242,1.7846,5.216,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12894,_binary '\0','/na4Wmp6FBtA0ZM55daq2c7RzILp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114234',7.4,11220,'hi','रंगीला','A poor young woman, who dreams of Bollywood fame, is caught in a love triangle between her childhood friend and a famous actor.','/tUGVpmgWhsg9rZCDNSUW7MJWSKf.jpg','1995-09-08',175,'Released',NULL,'Rangeela',21570,1.8817,6.889,'AduvgkbVnqw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12895,_binary '\0','/ioAjcXAZ6qzY7OY3HsK0A7XecmA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114266',7.2,2779,'fr','Les Rendez-vous de Paris','Three stories of love and coincidence around the theme of dates in Paris.','/rCdlWdkwA4MMVNdEQFXQKgxqkzw.jpg','1995-03-22',98,'Released',NULL,'Rendezvous in Paris',77056,1.5103,6.6,'uNundAo7nTo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12896,_binary '\0','/3ejBdBUpqHFnGNZgvP2gicCerw0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114268',5.5,2373,'en','Rent-a-Kid','Harry Habert, owner of a rental company, has an original idea—to rent baby\'s from a nearby orphanage to local families. He rents the Ward siblings, 2 boys and a girl, to his first customers.','/hnL5TxGumlBy68D4HovSlndEIkz.jpg','1995-01-01',85,'Released',NULL,'Rent-a-Kid',36357,2.2592,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12897,_binary '\0','/5uLnlBxEiy1rSK6Bqexa3gxzfYu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114272',6.6,10476,'en','Restoration','An aspiring young physician, Robert Merivel found himself in the service of King Charles II and saves the life of someone close to the King. Merivel joins the King\'s court and lives the high life provided to someone of his position. Merivel is ordered to marry his King\'s mistress in order to divert the queens suspicions. He is given one order by the king and that is not to fall in love. The situation worsens when Merivel finds himself in love with his new wife. Eventually, the King finds out and relieves Merivel of his position and wealth. His fall from grace leaves Merivel where he first started. And through his travels and reunions with an old friend, he rediscovers his love for true medicine and what it really means to be a physician.','/glOCWK6AMl6FVHxLikl5OD8xw2B.jpg','1995-12-29',117,'Released','An ordinary man, an irresistible offer. In a world of seduction and power, temptation has its price.','Restoration',35196,3.2927,6.121,'CvsAuHYBgEQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12898,_binary '\0','/l8gbqIvow8rXFblM5IzYI5AKN8Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114279',7.3,16475,'en','Richard III','Having helped his brother King Edward IV take the throne of England, the jealous hunchback Richard, Duke of Gloucester, plots to seize power for himself. Masterfully deceiving and plotting against nearly everyone in the royal court, including his eventual wife, Lady Anne, and his brother George, Duke of Clarence, Richard orchestrates a bloody rise to power before finding all his gains jeopardized by those he betrayed.','/cBg1AMH1ucPsDlNMfcHlrreQXQX.jpg','1995-12-29',104,'Released','I can smile, and murder while I smile','Richard III',31174,4.514,6.8,'BjftFyJE-NM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12899,_binary '\0','/yOwrZDFWdK2hjb4iOg8UEfNvNpJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114287',6.9,49934,'en','Rob Roy','In the highlands of Scotland in the 1700s, Rob Roy tries to lead his small town to a better future, by borrowing money from the local nobility to buy cattle to herd to market. When the money is stolen, Rob is forced into a Robin Hood lifestyle to defend his family and honour.','/kWI2rF6RAnRtEjfBlZgsXumgOm5.jpg','1995-04-13',139,'Released','Honor made him a man. Courage made him a hero. History made him a legend.','Rob Roy',11780,4.7695,6.7,'p76fH8_a32Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12900,_binary '\0','/wK9YSkkosLx7cOePoNzeucg9jdB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114296',6.4,2170,'en','Roommates','An elderly, yet young-at-heart man, moves in with his grandson, and both their lives turn upside-down.','/8MWrjbzAUTCrsbIlVuOq4AroqSG.jpg','1995-03-03',108,'Released','Some people talk. Some people listen. When you\'re 107 and going strong, you do whatever you want.','Roommates',161495,1.9949,5.7,'eEvt88iMQME','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12901,_binary '\0','/2dCdE0xlmyDOFSor6Cy99jAwRtO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114303',5.4,2291,'en','Rough Magic','In the 1950s, a pretty magician\'s apprentice travels to Mexico to escape her boyfriend, a wealthy politician, and to find a Mayan shaman who will teach her the ancient principles of magic.','/1ihrS8fbHnIvkcruSWBJSGiayh7.jpg','1995-09-07',100,'Released','In the world of magic, the hand is quicker than the eye and love is the wild card.','Rough Magic',45671,2.4333,5.7,'4WuEkA0ns-w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12902,_binary '\0','/zq0rQXY009Pd60TxGN2YnUjU7Tm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114306',4.7,3111,'en','Rumpelstiltskin','In the 1400s, Rumpelstiltskin is imprisoned inside a small jade figurine. In modern-day Los Angeles, the recently widowed wife of a police officer, with baby in tow, finds her way into a witch\'s shop and purchases a certain figurine, resulting in the cackling beast being freed and demanding possession of the baby.','/4BMmj4WHCzUJFxmyr4GNw3aTG6.jpg','1995-11-24',87,'Released','When the fairy tale ends, the nightmare begins.','Rumpelstiltskin',28229,2.9223,5.2,'ychzH70V--o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12903,_binary '\0','/4V8hilzgzbzTR5Gfdb18cUrGdM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114317',5.9,4880,'hi','Sabse Bada Khiladi','For 20 years, intrepid police detective Vijay has believed the malicious Amar Singh murdered Vijay\'s twin brother, Lallu. Vijay eventually dredges up enough evidence to put the crafty Amar in the slammer, but he walks on a technicality. Events take a surprising turn, however, when Lallu suddenly shows up again.','/ipqId5OPEMrZYsPxB6tloW9n1Cp.jpg','1995-06-09',162,'Released',NULL,'Sabse Bada Khiladi',309593,1.3765,5.684,'2BUzDfIVPMo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12904,_binary '\0','/oMGV48EGhsNavC1PL8HMeWs5Udq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114319',6.4,47941,'en','Sabrina','After her return from school in Paris, a playboy finally takes notice of his family\'s chauffeur\'s daughter Sabrina, who\'s long had a crush on him, but he questions his more serious brother\'s motives when he warns against getting involved with her.','/i8PbLJDPU7vCwwscWD625oHbJy.jpg','1995-12-15',127,'Released','You are cordially invited to the most surprising merger of the year.','Sabrina',11860,6.0101,6.2,'twTksx_lWB4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12905,_binary '\0','/p8O3WhMWumLrLp21BRW80kBND4d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114323',7.1,19678,'en','Safe','Carol White, a Los Angeles housewife in the late 1980s, comes down with a debilitating illness with no clear diagnosis.','/2O71QsBkbqdLqQdx2yuNpJ4pFPq.jpg','1995-06-23',119,'Released','In the 21st century nobody will be… Safe.','Safe',32646,4.231,7,'Qe_UmLAFuHE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12906,_binary '\0','/ovPlqmYbB3JsZOMorwL6vREgFij.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114324',6.7,3978,'en','Sahara','After the fall of Tobruk in June 1942, U.S. Army sergeant Joe Gunn leads his tank into the Sahara desert, in order to evade advancing Rommel\'s forces and reach Allied lines. Along the way he picks up few Allied soldiers, but soon they are running out of water. They find water at the ancient well, but the well is a goal of an entire German battalion. Despite the impossible odds, Sergeant Gunn decides to defend the well.','/be1SfIkSJ3jeSD7OhsDX3eNCNcE.jpg','1995-04-25',106,'Released',NULL,'Sahara',44136,3.309,6.665,'9cR1wj-g__A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12907,_binary '\0','/s6kv8ULRwnLMINd0srRPu2eefwx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114329',7.6,2401,'fa','سلام سینما','Makhmalbaf puts an advertisement in the papers calling for an open casting for his next movie. However when hundreds of people show up, he decides to make a movie about the casting and the screen tests of the would-be actors.','/sMomuldengOiGtSJonjqcRmzrTF.jpg','1995-04-14',75,'Released',NULL,'Salaam Cinema',43981,1.1735,6.8,'TWYjtnwowcU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12908,_binary '\0','/tZJIL1n3eGZd3mZyto3Ux2xNEBW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114345',5.4,17545,'en','The Scarlet Letter','Set in puritanical Boston in the mid 1600s, the story of seamstress Hester Prynne, who is outcast after she becomes pregnant by a respected reverend. She refuses to divulge the name of the father, is \"convicted\" of adultery and forced to wear a scarlet \"A\" until an Indian attack unites the Puritans and leads to a reevaluation of their laws and morals.','/8gIU7O3oV6NyWUjlL6ppbpnIZLW.jpg','1995-10-13',135,'Released','When intimacy is forbidden and passion is a sin, love is the most defiant crime of all.','The Scarlet Letter',10533,6.2243,6.1,'wzoFrXEdC74','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12909,_binary '\0','/ioOJOynKH49uTRXYhKDgGJkHDud.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114354',7,1753,'de','Schlafes Bruder','In the beginning of the 19th century, Johannes Elias Alder is born in a small village in the Austrian mountains. While growing up he is considered strange by the other villagers and discovers his love of music, especially rebuilding and playing the organ at the village church. After experiencing an \"acoustic wonder\", his eye color changes and he can hear even the most subtle sounds.','/wjvaafRCIGKLTJYm45oWgB494gJ.jpg','1995-09-08',132,'Released',NULL,'Brother of Sleep',890,2.3669,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12910,_binary '\0','/7LMy4tZggDRa31ycv5ccnPtLspV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114367',6.3,32063,'en','Screamers','SIRIUS 6B, Year 2078. On a distant mining planet ravaged by a decade of war, scientists have created the perfect weapon: a blade-wielding, self-replicating race of killing devices known as Screamers designed for one purpose only -- to hunt down and destroy all enemy life forms.','/eqgBf791rMZG7ywHfObpXeMpiRf.jpg','1995-09-08',108,'Released','The last scream you hear will be your own.','Screamers',9102,4.3332,6.245,'qrgAvr0TIr4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12911,_binary '\0','/i5H7zusQGsysGQ8i6P361Vnr0n2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114369',8.6,2058739,'en','Se7en','Two homicide detectives are on a desperate hunt for a serial killer whose crimes are based on the \"seven deadly sins\" in this dark and haunting film that takes viewers from the tortured remains of one victim to the next. The seasoned Det. Somerset researches each sin in an effort to get inside the killer\'s mind, while his novice partner, Mills, scoffs at his efforts to unravel the case.','/191nKfP0ehp3uIvWqgPbFmI4lv9.jpg','1995-09-22',127,'Released','Gluttony. Greed. Sloth. Envy. Wrath. Pride. Lust.','Se7en',807,34.5612,8.382,'KPOuJGkpblk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12912,_binary '\0','/ej6hlnFhzdxn9pZJ19AuGW8zLiV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114371',5.3,1476,'en','Search and Destroy','A self-help guru\'s televised teachings inspire a down-and-out businessman to pursue his dream of making a movie.','/fE6Bu947OQR0fFjbZmWQ7iupMzW.jpg','1995-04-23',90,'Released','A screwball tragedy!','Search and Destroy',54022,1.5852,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12913,_binary '\0','/cFnyfWHL6HjOOVal6lp8e5gqibK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114388',7.7,137953,'en','Sense and Sensibility','The Dashwood sisters, sensible Elinor and passionate Marianne, learn that their prospects of marriage seem doomed by their family\'s sudden loss of fortune. After Henry Dashwood dies unexpectedly, his estate must pass on by law to his son. These circumstances leave Mr. Dashwood\'s wife and daughters without a home and with barely enough money to live on. As Elinor and Marianne struggle to find romantic fulfillment in a society obsessed with financial and social status, they must learn to mix sense with sensibility in their dealings with both money and men.','/9YdQ73YmvInxpXZVNjEKePw9tRO.jpg','1995-12-13',136,'Released','Lose your heart and come to your senses.','Sense and Sensibility',4584,15.0746,7.413,'2WGq2Rbs1Qg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12914,_binary '\0','/mxk38SNmzoqgZdznql5cPMeHe9F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114395',7,1291,'en','Serving in Silence - The Margarethe Cammermeyer Story','After serving in the military for more than twenty years, including a tour of duty in Vietnam, Colonel Margarethe Cammermeyer (Glenn Close) had seen her share of battles. But nothing could prepare her for the fight ahead: an intensely personal struggle against the U.S. Army when she becomes the highest ranking officer ever to be discharged for being a lesbian. With the support of her partner Diane (Judy Davis), Cammermeyer undertakes an against-all-odds battle against the Army\'s policy. But to do so, she must risk everything – her career, her privacy and even the love of her family.','/mHkVybbJ77ZNzEvsISQZypBSmE4.jpg','1995-01-23',91,'Released','Ask. Tell.','Serving in Silence - The Margarethe Cammermeyer Story',49809,2.0796,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12915,_binary '\0','/pOCNSEsJ52hCkv8INQE9gzj9yfc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114419',6.5,1761,'en','She Fought Alone','All, including school administration and a friend, turn their backs on a girl who accused a classmate of rape.','/a9bqJEQrE1Z8ryA4zWqaOAXmGlo.jpg','1995-11-06',91,'Released','She cried rape. But no one would listen.','She Fought Alone',151506,1.6736,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12916,_binary '\0','/8I931Yn7331fFeS0sB52xJDmwA1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114429',7.1,2926,'ru','Ширли-мырли','A Russian criminal steals a giant diamond from the Mafia, hides it, and suddenly runs into his unknown brothers; unexpected, absurd events with participation of the mob, doctors, musicians, Americans, militia, and gypsies ensue.','/aboB73RjkfM3oqxTad0lF9JRLGw.jpg','1995-03-30',143,'Released',NULL,'What a Mess!',97666,2.4584,6.66,'4XhUd5oLKyg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12917,_binary '\0','/dhgde57Iy8oaxnBIV16KapyQEXy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114432',5.1,2584,'en','The Shooter','A CIA agent gets caught up in political intrigue after he gets brought in to solve the murder of a Cuban ambassador.','/59lcXwBxDiLlDT8H2lmseqbkRwc.jpg','1995-12-15',104,'Released','Seduction is a deadly weapon.','The Shooter',55261,3.3591,4.8,'7L8oMncfNcY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12918,_binary '\0','/jL3G2f8uNCFejJRlIqCzRp8Y7eV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114436',5.2,83248,'en','Showgirls','Fresh to Las Vegas with no connections, Nomi Malone takes a job as an exotic dancer. Her talents are quickly noticed by Cristal, a headlining dancer who senses an opportunity to bolster her own act. But Nomi won’t play second fiddle and soon begins her venomous path to the top, ruthlessly backstabbing anyone who gets in her way.','/o4HT3Ap5c99W4FYpdXUtTvxGgPc.jpg','1995-09-22',131,'Released','Leave your inhibitions at the door... the show is about to begin.','Showgirls',10802,11.4645,5.559,'kDJdLxpdU40','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12919,_binary '\0','/xSD006l1pSsU0mNOGHGUilT4Rn7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114437',6.1,4944,'cn','鼠膽龍威','After failing to save his wife from \'The Doctor\', Kit Li is working as a bodyguard and secret stunt double for the cowardly martial arts film star Frankie Lane. Frankie attends an exhibition of the crown jewels of Russia at a Hong Kong hotel, and when the Doctor\'s gang take over the building in attempt to steal them, Kit is the only thing standing in their way. Will Frankie regain his courage? Will romance blossom between Kit and the nosy reporter? Who has the best Kung-Fu?','/vF3xN5umwPQEZ7mcbaRcv55cg1y.jpg','1995-07-01',101,'Released','He Redefines Revenge.','High Risk',18665,4.1227,6.682,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12920,_binary '\0','/AcnDMTc0GAyMR4A2xhizjvIF9vQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114443',5.7,1394,'da','Sidste time','Some students gets locked up in their school and is stalked by a killer. But as time goes by, it turns out that there is more to this than it seems.','/ulDM2HUIZBx6unguMMhJsPoYvLL.jpg','1995-06-26',83,'Released','Were they the victims sacrifice ... - Or the killers of the victim?','Final Hour',33438,1.7708,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12921,_binary '\0','/dEiTwmcFOU5sMrfyd2mJc7IvCL9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114465',4.1,1577,'en','Ski School 2','Dave has been enjoying life until he receives an ex-girlfriend\'s wedding invitation. Even though Beth dumped him years ago, Dave knows it\'s their destiny to be together. So Dave embarks on a quest: to save Beth from certain death-by-boredom, return balance to the universe, and maybe get in a little awesome skiing. Dave convinces his buddies to join him in his quest to make things right.','/lMGtv7QlDkyraMkYHW8JTL4Ln8W.jpg','1994-02-17',92,'Released',NULL,'Ski School 2',32888,1.7092,3.9,'M3Na5TNWHns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12922,_binary '\0','/q9sL0tuPZSe5atZEPjYtHde8WGZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114466',5.2,1638,'en','Skinner','A man rents a room in a couple\'s house and roams the streets at night looking for victims to skin, while constantly being followed by a junkie he mutilated who is now looking for revenge.','/s9aIb6oM8KMp3G21D88weab99Lf.jpg','1993-10-01',90,'Released','Madness is Only Skin Deep','Skinner',76450,2.5495,4.5,'2kz1vm0hNcs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12923,_binary '\0','/hRGwqDgtPi9dhjfyABUWKztXeQ3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114474',6.8,1755,'en','Small Faces','Three teenage brothers, gang-member Bobby, troubled mama\'s boy Alan and self-assured prankster Lex, reside in a downtrodden section of Glasgow, Scotland, circa 1968. But while Bobby and Alan are beginning to experience the power of raging hormones, the story focuses on Lex, who begins a downward spiral after he accidentally shoots the leader of Bobby\'s gang. Lex\'s cockiness and immaturity unfortunately prevent him from understanding the effect his subsequent crimes will have on both himself, and on those around him.','/pYFtU8vFj86TY435w99aK5fNjzl.jpg','1996-04-05',108,'Released','You are now entering Tongland','Small Faces',42758,1.4889,6.5,'BFwYPhGzNQ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12924,_binary '\0','/dkg2DcGg6cjDia20yLWDaNLBRIb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114478',7.4,39000,'en','Smoke','Writer Paul Benjamin is nearly hit by a bus when he leaves Auggie Wren\'s smoke shop. Stranger Rashid Cole saves his life, and soon middle-aged Paul tells homeless Rashid that he wouldn\'t mind a short-term housemate. Still grieving over his wife\'s murder, Paul is moved by both Rashid\'s quest to reconnect with his father and Auggie\'s discovery that a woman who might be his daughter is about to give birth.','/1WMUaTQaj2dQrhsPI3Px0OR9eTF.jpg','1995-06-09',112,'Released','The most precious things are lighter than air.','Smoke',10149,3.827,7.2,'3v8r-ec4V2M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12925,_binary '\0','/7T26ESbSiuMsEDYSi68JVgJJiPr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114489',4.4,1485,'en','Soldier Boyz','A group of prisoners are going to Vietnam to rescue the daughter of a V-I.P. The Ones who survive get their freedom back...but hell awaits them.','/8FhrAIxW1uqab1Km7GnWNq5MY91.jpg','1995-11-23',90,'Released','A dirty half dozen–but twice as deadly.','Soldier Boyz',112938,1.7349,4.8,'6HauLBqBtrQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12926,_binary '\0','/cnUl10UxyT6yluGckYHwr7vycx7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114496',5.8,15366,'en','Something to Talk About','Grace King Bichon, who is managing her father\'s riding-stable, discovers that her husband Eddie is deceiving her with another woman. After confronting him in the middle of the night on the streets of their small home town, she decides to stay at her sister Emma Rae\'s house for a while to make up her mind. Breaking out of her everyday life, she starts to question the authority of everyone.','/a52KpsmvLNdTdmDzw1fUrJONpfH.jpg','1995-08-04',106,'Released','A story about husbands, wives, parents, children and other natural disasters.','Something to Talk About',18402,4.0438,5.6,'x1wNnEaYfYM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12927,_binary '\0','/tEHmWaIzM0nuFi1CKQL8mJdJZsT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114508',5.9,91630,'en','Species','In 1993, the Search for Extra Terrestrial Intelligence Project receives a transmission detailing an alien DNA structure, along with instructions on how to splice it with human DNA. The result is Sil, a sensual but deadly creature who can change from a beautiful woman to an armour-plated killing machine in the blink of an eye.','/cT5wdyo8kT7dycqjrolJ2sHWkFx.jpg','1995-07-07',108,'Released','For three million years, the human race has been at the top of the evolutionary ladder. Nothing lasts forever.','Species',9348,8.3983,6,'ECe9Yqltw_w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12928,_binary '\0','/8513UQR6ZYUUT3fKJgaoFQu4EEU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114550',7.1,1883,'en','Stonewall','A group of gay friends try to live with dignity and self-respect while events build to the opening battle in the major gay rights movement.','/5MkwQ3CCabrDZlD1nHceDTLCPiv.jpg','1995-12-26',99,'Released','The fight for the right to love','Stonewall',28628,1.4526,5.8,'Qt9ifpe8bpQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12929,_binary '\0','/zSFuvi6fIPT8CHpH1KMG25T2Iub.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114558',7.2,86651,'en','Strange Days','In the last days of 1999, ex-cop turned street hustler Lenny Nero receives a disc which contains the memories of the murder of a prostitute. With the help of bodyguard Mace, he starts to investigate and is pulled deeper and deeper in a whirl of murder, blackmail and intrigue.','/rY5BrDRcYAKE0BYmmT66YG6Uy5Q.jpg','1995-10-13',145,'Released','You know you want it.','Strange Days',281,8.0565,7,'t3vX5XRpV9c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12930,_binary '\0','/ckjqoqCGbPyf8HknxXu4hXS9N4M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114563',7.1,11372,'ja','ストリートファイター II MOVIE','Bison, the ruthless leader of the international terrorist organization Shadowlaw, has been desperately searching for the greatest fighter on the planet for years. He finds it in Ryu, a young wanderer who never stays in one place long enough for Bison to find him. He does, however, get a fix on Ken Masters, an American martial arts champion who studied with Ryu as a child under the same master. Meanwhile, Major Guile of the United States Army is forced to team up with Chun Li from China in hopes of apprehending Bison and putting a stop his international ring of crime.','/dZ1rqmE4eIhPbUCr7sn2Pw2wwGW.jpg','1994-08-06',102,'Released','The wear lose and the strong win! Will the World Wariors triumph or die?','Street Fighter II: The Animated Movie',12613,3.6058,7.136,'8adq6g4BhSY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12931,_binary '\0','/iHsTlNhbRc2DnmqUi7CPRwZQ1UM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114565',6.6,1408,'en','A Streetcar Named Desire','A fading Southern Belle moves in with her sister in New Orleans where her ferocious brother-in-law takes stabs at her sanity.','/xB0dg5ALgUEEs7WdDsIm0IqYBKj.jpg','1995-10-24',156,'Released',NULL,'A Streetcar Named Desire',133021,2.6932,6.914,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12932,_binary '\0','/hNWte9XlfxBeNuLW7CxwnZHuY1J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114571',5.3,3146,'en','Stuart Saves His Family','A self-help advocate struggles to put his dysfunctional family in its place.','/80YaWpUokDoPynsJi0ittpts3J0.jpg','1995-04-12',95,'Released','You\'ll laugh because it\'s not your family. You\'ll cry because it is.','Stuart Saves His Family',28033,2.2392,5.2,'P2bCdymB7do','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12933,_binary '\0','/wPSHboBNEInknw4VnCWOD2D8qc2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114576',5.9,40059,'en','Sudden Death','When a man\'s daughter is suddenly taken during a championship hockey game – with the captors demanding a billion dollars by game\'s end – he frantically sets a plan in motion to rescue her and abort an impending explosion before the final buzzer.','/4Snihptli0we9I4W5QfufOdHSeV.jpg','1995-10-27',111,'Released','Terror goes into overtime.','Sudden Death',9091,8.8752,6.041,'tEL21KB9rT4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12934,_binary '\0','/kVQrqY4giMJtVHvUXw1tzK5do2U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114580',5.9,1447,'en','The Sunshine Boys','Two aging comedians, who acrimoniously dissolved their act eight years earlier, must overcome their differences when they have the chance for a lucrative movie comeback.','/4XjKfvjQx2vv4JKeLoPR335UnOw.jpg','1996-08-08',90,'Released','The world was created in seven days. Getting these two guys together won\'t be as easy.','The Sunshine Boys',119694,1.7829,5,'JXoFDiEroy0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12935,_binary '\0','/nVTPAbTaExg00eoTHJnDJPkZKZT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114594',7,24823,'en','Swimming with Sharks','Guy is a young film executive who\'s willing to do whatever it takes to make it in Hollywood. He begins working for famed producer Buddy Ackerman, a domineering, manipulative, coldhearted boss. When Guy also finds out that his cynical girlfriend, Dawn, has been using sex as a career move, he reaches his limit. Guy decides to exact revenge on Buddy by kidnapping him and subjecting him to cruel and unusual punishment.','/eMRiIJIEyMLjWjktIqjNfzs9jGX.jpg','1994-09-10',93,'Released','In Hollywood his dreams could come true. But first he has to make coffee.','Swimming with Sharks',20306,2.9717,6.6,'UH9OLQh46FY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12936,_binary '\0','/47WfbtmsreEhNy2OzEDBxk9ZlzG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114608',6.7,28963,'en','Tales from the Crypt: Demon Knight','Ex-soldier Frank Brayker is the guardian of an ancient key that can unlock tremendous evil; the sinister Collector is a demon who wants the key so he can initiate the apocalypse. On the run from wicked mercenaries for almost 90 years, Brayker finally stops in at a boarding house in New Mexico where — with the help of its residents — he plans to face off against the Collector and his band of ghouls, preventing them from ever seizing the key.','/5sTFaW66D2l3fhP6qYLJ6gURACz.jpg','1995-01-13',93,'Released','Ready for your deadtime story?','Tales from the Crypt: Demon Knight',9059,6.7974,6.9,'2cT5Cg8H7ec','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12937,_binary '\0','/bfoOP1RN7N6FzF0MQYx3v5yi3WU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114609',6.6,11358,'en','Tales from the Hood','A strange mortician tells four horrific tales to three drug dealers that he traps in a local funeral parlor.','/glPNCcI7V8zTTI3BG0iIUJJcwXN.jpg','1995-05-24',98,'Released','Your most terrifying nightmare and your most frightening reality are about to meet on the streets.','Tales from the Hood',25066,3.1375,6.258,'dOO-A59c4C0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12938,_binary '\0','/rmG0rboJMA9sE6vttQCM2eXXJ2Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114614',5.4,38183,'en','Tank Girl','After a comet disrupts the rain cycle of Earth, the planet has become a desolate, barren desert by the year 2033. With resources scarce, Kesslee, head of the powerful and evil Water & Power Corporation, the de facto government, has taken control of the water supply. Unwilling to cower under Kesslee\'s tyrannical rule, a pair of outlaws known as Tank Girl and Jet Girl rise up, joining the mysterious rebel Rippers to destroy the corrupt system.','/dpX63vJd6k5fMTudLaEOw9ffX8h.jpg','1995-03-31',104,'Released','In the future, the odds of survival are 1000 to 1. That\'s just the way she likes it.','Tank Girl',9067,5.3662,5.511,'PDJK306eH_o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12939,_binary '\0','/vlVU8j57wGsYX9uMNd4e8aps9Rk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114622',4.9,1447,'en','North Star','Set during the Alaskan gold rush of the late 1800s. In his efforts to gain control of a small mining town, Sean McLennon is buying up every claim that becomes available, usually after the deaths of the previous owners at the hands of McLennon\'s \'assistants\'. One of the miners targeted by McLennon, a half-Indian hunter named Hudson Saanteek, manages to escape his hired thugs and comes back into town looking to re-establish his claim and get revenge. McLennon and his men have the advantage of numbers and weapons, but Saanteek has his survival skills and knowledge of the Alaskan wilderness.','/iuai9NBKZX0RmGDwTuGvpyPV8mx.jpg','1996-01-03',90,'Released','Where land is power and revenge is obsession.','North Star',200383,1.7002,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12940,_binary '\0','/lzzC9DJHti43iX8khM8ZFyqbfcL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114623',6.1,1388,'nl','De tasjesdief','Alex is very close to his elderly grandmother partly because his busy parents seem to have little or no time for him. One day he surprises two boys from his school leaving her house and is shocked to find her tied up inside – they have robbed her! Alex is sworn to secrecy as his gran is worried that her daughter will think her incompetent. This secret leads Alex into trouble as the two boys accost him in the street and bully him into becoming a pickpocket (\"tasjesdief\") for them, mugging old ladies. Alex learns how to deal with this situation in the end.','/qVDSHn9YaQKgJuS4BF8qiQ7oO3X.jpg','1995-04-06',96,'Released',NULL,'The Purse Snatcher',259387,1.5274,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12941,_binary '\0','/2JDnDRLGlOofRutV4YbrVuE2zme.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114626',7.1,1774,'pl','Tato','Tato is the story of a divorced father fighting for the right to raise his 7-year-old daughter. When his marriage falls apart, he decides to kidnap his daughter rather than let the court award custody to his mentally ill wife, whom he deems unfit to raise their child. But as he quickly finds out, it’s easier to be a real man than it is to be a real father.','/9WeFCx64FiPaEaP2srs0r8TvkRP.jpg','1995-12-14',110,'Released',NULL,'Tato',135938,0.796,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12942,_binary '\0','/i9dJI44Zy9rB5I1NjntfRN5932d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114651',7.4,2786,'pt','Terra Estrangeira','During a time of political upheaval in Brazil, two strangers meet by coincidence in a foreign land and end up caught in the middle of a gem smuggling ring.','/6DhzYI5pbVMuFGbBJEC2YiXV4xH.jpg','1996-09-04',110,'Released','The best place to lose someone or your own self','Foreign Land',57811,1.5402,7.262,'mTsyH6Eki8M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12943,_binary '\0','/71BTsB16aNZrbidjrV6eLwWGdh2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114658',2.4,5143,'en','Theodore Rex','In an alternate futuristic society, a tough female police detective is paired with a talking dinosaur to find the killer of dinosaurs and other prehistoric animals leading them to a mad scientist bent on creating a new Armageddon.','/fUUbOE91SK4GCpiyftEY5USjCh1.jpg','1995-12-14',92,'Released','The world\'s toughest cop is getting a brand new partner. And he\'s a real blast from the past!','Theodore Rex',36259,4.2971,3.634,'dY7gsUL9Xkk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12944,_binary '\0','/J4l8AvrK8ByAjnoKposMLh3ubL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114660',6.7,32255,'en','Things to Do in Denver When You\'re Dead','Five different criminals face imminent death after botching a job quite badly.','/3LxYzYybOVpnw0juCSlNL5cj8NK.jpg','1995-12-01',116,'Released','Protect. Love. Honor. Avenge.','Things to Do in Denver When You\'re Dead',400,6.2545,6.4,'i1o_PO3ridY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12945,_binary '\0','/BuOA7HsDQmWLuvoTh7gCazSgCo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114663',6.1,3570,'en','Three Wishes','While Jane Holman is driving with her two sons, she accidentally runs into a drifter, Jack McCloud, who breaks his leg. Being responsible, Jane invites Jack, and his dog, to stay at her home until his leg has healed. Jack struggles to adapt their lifestyle, and finds himself loved by the family.','/8uzNbDH1b90DTsy38NPLqVIVpAH.jpg','1995-10-27',115,'Released','If you really believe, magic will find you','Three Wishes',47939,2.8886,6.2,'hQR4_rT0qB4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12946,_binary '\0','/tnWk1Kued91e3OFgVoxE0bz34Oj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114666',5,1349,'en','The Tie That Binds','A young couple adopts a traumatized child, unaware that her parents are fugitives and murderers who will do anything to get her back.','/xwrY46PITbSoCiKm9gTnDWP47Kh.jpg','1995-09-08',99,'Released','Janie\'s been adopted by the perfect couple. With their help she can find a new life. If her real parents don\'t find her first.','The Tie That Binds',79593,2.6482,4.9,'3VZwHAMcVvA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12947,_binary '\0','/nKGVLehRRJt2UK2Hn9JvNAzd4C6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114671',7.5,12983,'en','Land and Freedom','Summer 1936: young unemployed communist David Carr leaves Liverpool to join the fight against fascism in Spain. He joins an international group of Militia-men and women, the POUM (Partido Obrero de Unificación Marxista). After being wounded, he goes to Barcelona, where he joins another group of fighters.','/u5QRqW0vFYMHFzeQJ4oFgJtu5Xp.jpg','1995-04-07',109,'Released',NULL,'Land and Freedom',38884,3.0449,7.3,'ZbZnyGT4P7o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12948,_binary '\0','/7LNkP4ofj5pPgPeyEXC5z3U4y8a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114681',6.8,61072,'en','To Die For','Suzanne Stone wants to be a world-famous news anchor and she is willing to do anything to get what she wants. What she lacks in intelligence, she makes up for in cold determination and diabolical wiles. As she pursues her goal with relentless focus, she is forced to destroy anything and anyone that may stand in her way, regardless of the ultimate cost or means necessary.','/ji0F2HvO58iIrNfbo41lrnYybed.jpg','1995-09-22',106,'Released','All she wanted was a little attention.','To Die For',577,7.294,6.589,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12949,_binary '\0','/xga9dXEIJHAjNLGMjw4VDPH7LJB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114682',6.9,42672,'en','To Wong Foo, Thanks for Everything! Julie Newmar','Manhattan drag queens Vida Boheme and Noxeema Jackson impress regional judges in competition, securing berths in the Nationals in Los Angeles. When the two meet pathetic drag novice Chi-Chi Rodriguez — one of the losers that evening — the charmed Vida and Noxeema agree to take the hopeless youngster under their joined wing. Soon the three set off on a madcap road trip across America and struggle to make it to Los Angeles in time.','/8bkJiI6N8wDxAtQ49bLUt0qCBII.jpg','1995-09-08',108,'Released','Attitude is everything.','To Wong Foo, Thanks for Everything! Julie Newmar',9090,7.194,7.477,'sH0zihZWIK0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12950,_binary '\0','/bwc76uzu0jo9N9YSfV2RHfdMVEP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114683',3.3,1603,'en','To the Limit','Colette is an attractive ex-CIA agent seeking revenge against a ruthless villain and his organization of trained assassins for the murder of her husband while the man is also after mobster Frank Di Vinci for his own personal reasons. It isn\'t long before the paths of both Colette and Frank meet whom they share the same vendetta against the same man and they reluctantly try to co-operate with each other to bring him down.','/m2SqFqeMkJR9A9Y8bh4NLxZtu1K.jpg','1995-09-19',98,'Released','This agent bares all in the line of duty!','To the Limit',52027,2.4226,3.5,'o2sEK45Zzns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12951,_binary '\0','/2lVqVJkP2xvGnnIXUFLVEjcJnPL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114690',7,4774,'ja','東京フィスト','A businessman, Tsuda, runs into a childhood friend, Kojima, on the subway. Kojima is working as a semiprofessional boxer. Tsuda soon begins to suspect that Kojima might be having an affair with his fiancée Hizuru. After an altercation, Tsuda begins training rigorously himself, leading to an extremely bloody, violent confrontation.','/uHlZjow4nLoS37zzZ1PKUmQuhDK.jpg','1995-10-21',87,'Released',NULL,'Tokyo Fist',41577,3.0366,6.804,'TZ1aiK-MivQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12952,_binary '\0','/chJF1c4coUtVkQdv5u1YUn6H1Wm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114694',7.1,105796,'en','Tommy Boy','To save the family business, two ne’er-do-well traveling salesmen hit the road with disastrously funny consequences.','/jeEM8v1OA9u6F5NC2lzXD04Ls1U.jpg','1995-03-31',98,'Released','If at first you don\'t succeed, lower your standards.','Tommy Boy',11381,7.0144,6.8,'A2Albcpyaiw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12953,_binary '\0','/kfFCe3TFBTMK91LEnDmaBbMIOhJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114697',4.3,4339,'en','Top Dog','With his cop companion shot and killed by terrorists, Reno The Dog pairs up with tough cop Jake in thwarting the criminal organization.','/vjPtpVxbXj8QJD2mJHXHxuVDzf.jpg','1995-04-28',86,'Released','One\'s tough ... One\'s smart... Together they unleash explosive action!','Top Dog',36278,2.1506,4.3,'fzPErq8puf8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12954,_binary '\0','/3FYltaTkmrFeVquPOXbAXgYVuqZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114702',6.4,16704,'en','Total Eclipse','Young, wild poet Arthur Rimbaud and his mentor Paul Verlaine engage in a fierce, forbidden romance while feeling the effects of a hellish artistic lifestyle.','/9ihmgsX9aDXZmwjvgrzJgH8FxNa.jpg','1995-11-03',111,'Released','Touched by Genius. Cursed by Madness. Blinded by Love.','Total Eclipse',36834,5.1696,6.4,'8eZpsPixVuU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12955,_binary '\0','/1yXwq0rz6nP1eom3NEZGGhMkMOx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114704',7.5,2539,'de','Der Totmacher','Fritz Haarmann, who has killed at least 27 boys, is questioned by a psychology professor in order to find out whether he is sane and can be held responsible for his crimes. During this interrogation Haarmann reveals his motives and his killing methods.','/1BaHXGZB7UTNWylELBz0DkjIs31.jpg','1995-11-23',110,'Released',NULL,'The Deathmaker',1484,1.6038,6.9,'ArV2X9pFLMs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12956,_binary '\0','/3Rfvhy1Nl6sSGJwyjb0QiZzZYlB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114709',8.3,1198835,'en','Toy Story','Led by Woody, Andy\'s toys live happily in his room until Andy\'s birthday brings Buzz Lightyear onto the scene. Afraid of losing his place in Andy\'s heart, Woody plots against Buzz. But when circumstances separate Buzz and Woody from their owner, the duo eventually learns to put aside their differences.','/uXDfjJbdP4ijW5hWSBrPrlKpxab.jpg','1995-11-22',81,'Released','Hang on for the comedy that goes to infinity and beyond!','Toy Story',862,41.417,7.989,'CxwTLktovTU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12957,_binary '\0','/oVokrBcA5bL9hLYXD6zK9C1EpiN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114726',4.9,3312,'hi','त्रिमूर्ति','Entrapped by notorious gangster Khokha Singh, honest police inspector Satyadevi Singh gets a life sentence in jail. She hopes to get her three sons Shakti, Anand and Romi to avenge this carnage.','/o6Pmeu0tcw3YKNHLdYw7IrNNdNq.jpg','1995-12-22',187,'Released',NULL,'Trimurti',102358,1.2707,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12958,_binary '\0','/jOncZUo1ce3cOgBWPvnmpilzFUu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114732',7.2,8291,'fr','Les Trois Frères','Three half-brothers are reunited at their mother\'s funeral. After being told of their inheritance they quickly spend the money, only to find out that they will not receive it after all. The men grow closer while deciding how to proceed.','/nPrUw2hLIt9uWrGwfKjr0AbGWgd.jpg','1995-12-13',105,'Released',NULL,'The Three Brothers',37653,1.6376,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12959,_binary '\0','/fYneevxH3vBdcKHHhqYoboMRJcx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114733',6,7507,'en','Tromeo & Juliet','All the body-piercing, kinky sex, and car crashes that Shakespeare wanted but never had! Join Tromeo and Juliet as they travel through Manhattan\'s underground in search of climactic love, violence and the American Way.','/wqLSSp1PEzOeCQsLxzlySQUPZrK.jpg','1996-08-30',107,'Released','Body Piercing, Kinky Sex, Dismemberment. The Things That Made Shakespeare Great','Tromeo & Juliet',16233,2.7778,6,'VFvFUD-P-4M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12960,_binary '\0','/xZRuns3IlPxnzpHhbscAOLyiwNr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114738',7.1,2642,'en','Truman','Biographical account of America\'s President for the latter part of WWII. Shows Truman\'s rise from small-town nobody to leader of the USA, his decision to use the Atomic Bomb against Japan, and subsequent election as the US\' post-war President.','/4SW6da4XjxLGlRVS079O1ORpjqk.jpg','1995-09-09',135,'Released',NULL,'Truman',16901,1.6225,7.4,'fpW_uth2sCE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12961,_binary '\0','/2nTYrk82ALzqMfPfq4lUe3yXn4m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114745',7.1,7912,'en','The Tuskegee Airmen','During the Second World War, a special project is begun by the US Army Air Corps to integrate African American pilots into the Fighter Pilot Program. Known as the \"Tuskegee Airman\" for the name of the airbase at which they were trained, these men were forced to constantly endure harassement, prejudice, and much behind the scenes politics until at last they were able to prove themselves in combat.','/jcLTwnisDFnH6VT57NEHVq959PN.jpg','1995-08-25',106,'Released','The right spirit. The right attitude. The wrong color.','The Tuskegee Airmen',31894,3.085,7.086,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12962,_binary '\0','/mKIkGoyuR71qz6FdiEiOjxvBQcS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114746',8,684407,'en','Twelve Monkeys','In the year 2035, convict James Cole reluctantly volunteers to be sent back in time to discover the origin of a deadly virus that wiped out nearly all of the earth\'s population and forced the survivors into underground communities. But when Cole is mistakenly sent to 1990 instead of 1996, he\'s arrested and locked up in a mental hospital. There he meets psychiatrist Dr. Kathryn Railly and the son of a famous virus expert who may hold the key to the Army of the 12 Monkeys; thought to be responsible for unleashing the killer disease.','/gt3iyguaCIw8DpQZI1LIN5TohM2.jpg','1995-12-29',129,'Released','The future is history.','Twelve Monkeys',63,18.969,7.614,'Xwh1xBzsc1Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12963,_binary '\0','/6iIw7Dw3wsaW5EIcfeBpavvEnGu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114753',6.1,3862,'en','Two Bits','It\'s a hot summer day in 1933 in South Philly, where 12-year old Gennaro lives with his widowed mom and his ailing grandpa, who sits outside holding tight to his last quarter, which he\'s promised to Gennaro and which Gennaro would like to have to buy a ticket to the plush new movie theater. But grandpa\'s not ready to pass on the quarter or pass on to his final reward: he has some unfinished business with a woman from his past, and he enlists Gennaro to act as his emissary.','/ianK4zwR5Vv4JSDm3sNDh3kH86I.jpg','1995-10-22',85,'Released','You\'re never too old to believe in a dream. Or too young to make one come true!','Two Bits',40628,2.3044,5.7,'z7oSfRVevzU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12964,_binary '\0','/iySvMFCjA4pAKpJkMNfTu4Wyysh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114759',6.2,2831,'en','Tyson','The story of Mike Tyson. From his early days as a 12 year old amateur with a powerful punch, to the undisputed title of \"Heavyweight Champion of the World\", and ultimately to his conviction for rape. The story of his turbulent life moves quickly, never focusing for long on anything in particular.','/cE0V6JaKVK1T8wTfVkzPkGfISyK.jpg','1995-04-29',110,'Released',NULL,'Tyson',50114,2.4019,6.018,'Cot_zox2HR8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12965,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114774',6.6,1542,'fr','Un bruit qui rend fou','The Blue Villa is a seedy bordello on a Mediterranean island where the villages are frightened by the ghost-like return of a young man, who mysteriously disappeared after the killing of a young Eurasian woman.','/eUEuwgNGgXd9iWBAAqkYYwLfuFC.jpg','1995-11-01',100,'Released',NULL,'The Blue Villa',124607,1.2741,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12966,_binary '\0','/yY2zwlxoqaFjcLXKSxmDIJSDmSd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114781',5.6,53841,'en','Under Siege 2: Dark Territory','A passenger train has been hijacked by an electronics expert and turned into an untraceable command center for a weapons satellite. He has planned to blow up Washington DC and only one man can stop him, former Navy SEAL Casey Ryback.','/gElwFCQTbSK5hdK0PVyia547nst.jpg','1995-07-13',99,'Released','Last time he rocked the boat. This time the sky\'s the limit.','Under Siege 2: Dark Territory',3512,8.7252,5.9,'LorQZ4TfbTQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12967,_binary '\0','/2nerKhF40OzjnGGOyzHcsAw8T53.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114787',8,64562,'sr','Подземље','Black marketeers Marko and Blacky manufacture and sell weapons to the Communist resistance in WWII Belgrade, living the good life along the way. Marko\'s surreal duplicity propels him up the ranks of the Communist Party, and he eventually abandons Blacky and steals his girlfriend. After a lengthy stay in a below-ground shelter, the couple reemerges during the Yugoslav Civil War of the 1990s as Marko sees the opportunity to exploit the situation.','/h8N6y13t4VusrDdH5PzTkwvBvgN.jpg','1995-10-25',170,'Released','ONCE UPON A TIME THERE WAS A COUNTRY','Underground',11902,3.729,7.7,'rYTvmLvLchs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12968,_binary '\0','/hCg0cpmiIMGwGMYwPeY8YO9WpMy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114788',6.1,4147,'en','The Underneath','A recovering gambling addict attempts to reconcile with his family and friends but finds trouble and temptation when caught between feelings for his ex-wife and her dangerous hoodlum boyfriend.','/a8jn5ML3vRT4nnMMBmFGXRaRhqO.jpg','1995-04-28',99,'Released','For passion, betrayal and murder... there\'s still no place like home.','The Underneath',36141,3.0573,5.7,'8IGoUeVzBbk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12969,_binary '\0','/yax779wlHwcQWeoZkLdD6ztccPR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114790',6.2,1476,'fr','Une Femme française','Wed just as war breaks out, Jeanne hardly gets to know her military husband, Louis, before the debacle of 1940. While waiting for his return from a POW camp, Jeanne journeys through countless affairs with Louis\' comrades- in-arms. Hoping to forget these wartime betrayls, Louis takes his wife and the infant twins he didn\'t father to Berlin, where she falls for Matthais, a sensitive German industrialist. When the Indochinese war sends Louis to Vietnam, Matthais follows Jeanne back to France. A subsequent move to Damascus where Louis is posted as military attache, fails to break their bond.','/r6o9XB6ttit5KO6Ib3CKBDkrmfR.jpg','1995-03-14',100,'Released',NULL,'A French Woman',183244,1.3931,5.527,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12970,_binary '\0','/2gY7KFsEWAqj6oDajd51lZxGueY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114798',6.7,3414,'en','Unstrung Heroes','Steven Lidz, unhappy with his home life since his mother became sick, moves in with his two eccentric uncles. As Steven grows closer to his uncles, he learns how to cope with his emotions and to value his own uniqueness.','/twnqc80AL55WYnCVz4nMGEGcL7.jpg','1995-09-15',93,'Released','Sometimes you find your heroes in the most unlikely places','Unstrung Heroes',52856,1.6814,6.1,'sth8EmI2y6g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12971,_binary '\0','/qVmsH6us23qZPn3SXBJXKvMbXk5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114805',6.5,1253,'en','Unzipped','Isaac Mizrahi, one of the most successful designers in high fashion, plans his fall 1994 collection.','/dnIzv4rXr9FXkqW880E3rStYQA7.jpg','1995-08-11',73,'Released',NULL,'Unzipped',77350,2.2538,5.4,'irIUyh38WFw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12972,_binary '\0','/ePyZVtn6j8upnk44HnDARDDOuPD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114808',7.3,5848,'it','L\'uomo delle stelle','In 1950s Sicily, con artist Joe Moretti does screen tests for the big studios, accepting money or favours for his efforts. A young illiterate novitiate named Beata desperately wants to change her life and falls for him; belatedly, he realizes his feelings for her. However, their love affair is doomed when he\'s arrested.','/xa3IfslUY5hjIWFb3Z2Ofq37KHF.jpg','1995-09-21',113,'Released','In the golden age of cinema, everyone dreams of becoming a star. One man promises to make all their dreams come true...','The Star Maker',37975,2.7343,7.028,'hNCT7tsPoZw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12973,_binary '\0','/hy0Hx9fMPk2fmw26Li60z1S2giU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114814',8.5,1253666,'en','The Usual Suspects','Held in an L.A. interrogation room, Verbal Kint attempts to convince the feds that a mythic crime lord, Keyser Soze, not only exists, but was also responsible for drawing him and his four partners into a multi-million dollar heist that ended with an explosion in San Pedro harbor – leaving few survivors. Verbal lures his interrogators with an incredible story of the crime lord\'s almost supernatural prowess.','/99X2SgyFunJFXGAYnDv3sb9pnUD.jpg','1995-07-19',106,'Released','Five criminals. One line up. No coincidence.','The Usual Suspects',629,21.7798,8.163,'byMcINu1G5M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12974,_binary '\0','/uQWHuHi4sdNS3U0dON14eY6Tsja.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114825',4.7,27115,'en','Vampire in Brooklyn','Detective Rita Veder is assigned to a baffling serial murder case. After examining the crime scene — a corpse-filled ship found adrift at sea — she meets Maximilian, a smooth-talking Caribbean playboy determined to romance her.','/fodPA5x3REtOwColG17CucreZqM.jpg','1995-10-26',102,'Released','A comic tale of horror and seduction.','Vampire in Brooklyn',12158,4.2414,5.1,'2qzFuLGeVGI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12975,_binary '\0','/sx8kiWYjqlV0GADTD71Y8iH0joK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114844',6.6,3042,'it','Viaggi di nozze','The vicissitudes of three couples of newlyweds from the celebration of weddings to their respective honeymoons.','/9nAS1pf731RaCrYlH2CccMH7mVR.jpg','1995-12-15',105,'Released',NULL,'Honeymoon Trips',56804,1.4604,6.815,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12976,_binary '\0','/udqpyMs0zvaP9MjETzhWg04zVKe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114852',5.7,37280,'en','Village of the Damned','An American village is visited by some unknown life form which leaves the women of the village pregnant. Nine months later, the babies are born, and they all look normal, but it doesn\'t take the \"parents\" long to realize that the kids are not human or humane.','/hDNZHzYy62mOAsby0PTadKQh7so.jpg','1995-04-28',98,'Released','Beware the children.','Village of the Damned',12122,5.5891,6.1,'oDabkjic1mM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12977,_binary '\0','/wH3rho5l3w0hV8XWQzl14DWduRU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114857',5.5,35153,'en','Virtuosity','The Law Enforcement Technology Advancement Centre (LETAC) has developed SID version 6.7: a Sadistic, Intelligent, and Dangerous virtual reality entity which is synthesized from the personalities of more than 150 serial killers, and only one man can stop him.','/5emgnXYrXjqyiup2JsvtuENseiV.jpg','1995-08-04',106,'Released','Justice needs a new program.','Virtuosity',9271,5.0471,5.499,'45riYi75C8w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12978,_binary '\0','/2CqkiCDXftfhTGMy3odCgTFkHP5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114863',7.6,8192,'el','Το βλέμμα του Οδυσσέα','An exiled filmmaker finally returns to his home country where former mysteries and afflictions of his early life come back to haunt him once more.','/AmRdjyd5nVBd06FzJT8xoTS43ct.jpg','1995-10-12',169,'Released',NULL,'Ulysses\' Gaze',22549,5.9158,7.5,'4sLpusSzOx8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12979,_binary '\0','/jZjoEKXMTDoZAGdkjhAdJaKtXSN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114885',6.1,14178,'en','Waiting to Exhale','Cheated on, mistreated and stepped on, the women are holding their breath, waiting for the elusive \"good man\" to break a string of less-than-stellar lovers. Friends and confidants Vannah, Bernie, Glo and Robin talk it all out, determined to find a better way to breathe.','/4wjGMwPsdlvi025ZqR4rXnFDvBz.jpg','1995-12-22',127,'Released','Friends are the people who let you be yourself... and never let you forget it.','Waiting to Exhale',31357,5.3666,6.199,'j9xml1CxgXI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12980,_binary '\0','/mcI5QGUNncahaDqsIJKmoPuGywY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114887',6.7,39477,'en','A Walk in the Clouds','World War II vet Paul Sutton falls for a pregnant and unwed woman who persuades him -- during their first encounter -- to pose as her husband so she can face her family.','/xencQzZnUWDRAOUydjf9PWet8Ae.jpg','1995-05-27',103,'Released','A man in search. A woman in need. A story of fate.','A Walk in the Clouds',9560,8.2712,7.4,'CCJLFg1nOao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12981,_binary '\0','/yaIu82UiD9QZEkKCGrAd8VAmc0V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114898',6.3,226880,'en','Waterworld','In a futuristic world where the polar ice caps have melted and made Earth a liquid planet, a beautiful barmaid rescues a mutant seafarer from a floating island prison. They escape, along with her young charge, Enola, and sail off aboard his ship. But the trio soon becomes the target of a menacing pirate who covets the map to \'Dryland\'—which is tattooed on Enola\'s back.','/X4UyUO5jgzs3c5YafnmYKLKKYw.jpg','1995-07-28',135,'Released','Beyond the horizon lies the secret to a new beginning.','Waterworld',9804,11.8843,6.24,'r4LLyBCz9tw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12982,_binary '\0','/cmD7smdQnflmpthFDjSArI2jKZF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114906',7.3,40953,'en','Welcome to the Dollhouse','An unattractive 7th grader struggles to cope with suburban life as the middle child with inattentive parents and bullies at school.','/fsMMOVto87pvUQyozOF9CaT9aMR.jpg','1996-03-22',88,'Released','Not all girls want to play with dolls.','Welcome to the Dollhouse',11446,4.4998,7.1,'5U0QG3L6XsE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12983,_binary '\0','/5CCPKLWg0YWajQEXWYeY2w5c8qS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114916',6.5,7988,'en','When Night Is Falling','Camille is a professor at a Protestant college and is in a long-term relationship with Martin, a respected minister and fellow professor. When Camille meets Petra, a bold and flamboyant performer in a circus troupe, she is inexplicably drawn. Pursuing Petra, Camille throws her whole conservative life into disarray.','/6Ac5GLwJ01uli5mCXqXwquR36Y1.jpg','1995-02-01',96,'Released','A visual treat on lust.','When Night Is Falling',8391,2.3663,6.3,'D55Evh2HII0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12984,_binary '\0','/wvPrzevsfbOsLPprAHiDznoYcih.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114917',6.1,2718,'en','When Saturday Comes','Jimmy Muir comes from a typical gritty, northern town where there are only two options: working down the pit or in a factory. But Jimmy has other ideas — he dreams of becoming a professional footballer. Confronted by a bitter and unsupportive father, hard-drinking friends and a lifetime of bad habits...has Jimmy the will to achieve his ultimate goal?','/pZtRON0IqXoXmSA0M2s2qwxgqbm.jpg','1996-03-01',95,'Released','To Jimmy Life Was Just A Game...Until The Game Became His Life!','When Saturday Comes',1608,1.9629,5.8,'PIpoLVVfl7s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12985,_binary '\0','/r4ZkyhfwcpnHNGdn2QULEBTClZG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114924',6.8,128604,'en','While You Were Sleeping','A transit worker pulls commuter Peter off railway tracks after he\'s mugged, but—while he\'s in a coma—his family mistakenly thinks she\'s Peter\'s fiancée, and she doesn\'t correct them. Things get more complicated when she falls for his brother, who\'s not quite sure that she\'s who she claims to be.','/qNGO3ETcNwlWqK2kNRpbJSJRlos.jpg','1995-04-21',103,'Released','A story about love at second sight.','While You Were Sleeping',2064,10.8887,7.035,'nsJxyUvkB_E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12986,_binary '\0','/uvkfydMPlao4cpZ6bBappfkt1Zz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114928',5.3,5392,'en','White Man\'s Burden','The story takes place in alternative America where the blacks are members of social elite, and whites are inhabitants of inner city ghettos. Louis Pinnock is a white worker in a chocolate factory, loving husband and father of two children. While delivering a package for black CEO Thaddeus Thomas, he is mistaken for a voyeur and, as a result, loses his job, gets beaten by black cops and his family gets evicted from their home. Desperate Pinnock takes a gun and kidnaps Thomas, demanding justice.','/5MPatVYJXPYEGrd9RQiwldBBQvJ.jpg','1995-12-01',89,'Released','Reality Just Switched Sides','White Man\'s Burden',31611,3.4488,5.057,'1ezPwSoXdX0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12987,_binary '\0','/yo8EUyqcVsrJbhUkvc3FCu3R8tl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114938',5.8,8925,'en','Wild Bill','Biopic about famous gunslinger Wild Bill Hickock. The early career of legendary lawman is telescoped and culminates in his relocation in Deadwood and a reunion with Calamity Jane.','/g5sQTDwc4BcvRCBAhnujhBPIEO1.jpg','1995-12-01',98,'Released','The Name Is Legendary. The Man Is Real.','Wild Bill',65796,3.4664,5.7,'vsLUneCKuO8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12988,_binary '\0','/oHBk9ac0j2wEVtUn9hUDY4uHKro.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114941',5.6,2626,'en','Wild Side','A bank accountant who moonlights as a high-priced call girl becomes embroiled in the lives of a money launderer, his seductive wife, and his bodyguard.','/pFRrKn9wqPECjN1QOrDdS3BVdL5.jpg','1996-06-22',96,'Released','It\'s Not About Sex, It\'s About Power.','Wild Side',26674,2.5534,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12989,_binary '\0','/hbZT53Kng9UXWAq2oHaPPbp4B83.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0114996',7.8,9690,'cn','西遊記大結局之仙履奇緣','This sequel to \"Pandora\'s Box\" continues director Jeffrey Lau\'s adaptation of the Buddhism saga \"Journey to the West\". Stranded five centuries in the past, Joker Monkey King must battle a variety of monsters, seductive women and super-powered villains to save the dying Pak Jing-Jing.','/ksloRonL1kOq4yErf9LOJ5qDhem.jpg','1995-02-04',99,'Released','10,000-year promise, lifetime of regret.','A Chinese Odyssey Part Two: Cinderella',21835,5.4685,7.745,'iK93BzuGG-U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12990,_binary '\0','/6XCGLN8Nb7Oa0AF41UtS0nUFN7l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115005',7.5,3900,'en','Xiu Xiu: The Sent-Down Girl','Young teen girl Xiu Xiu is sent away to a remote corner of the Sichuan steppes for manual labor in 1975 (sending young people to there was a part of Cultural Revolution in China). A year later, she agrees to go to even more remote spot with a Tibetan saddle tramp Lao Jin to learn horse herding.','/f60ZzxvcNjQG1aXomXuKWEzS2pP.jpg','1998-02-19',99,'Released',NULL,'Xiu Xiu: The Sent-Down Girl',33194,5.9576,7.2,'xx03ReiY82s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12991,_binary '\0','/eChLr5Z5wAiK9OTUiTteuCwNgkU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115006',3.7,1636,'en','Xtro 3: Watch the Skies','Marines on a deserted island are ordered to defuse bombs, but then an alien creature terrorizes them.','/mvJYVmHya0WuCOUb04JTKlWbZLx.jpg','1995-11-14',97,'Released','From beyond imagination... from beyond the earth itself... Xtro waits.','Xtro 3: Watch the Skies',57597,2.0604,4.385,'XBtB-2it4q4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12992,_binary '\0','/gHG1OogmvDJldyi1tjqncjoblKV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115012',7.1,6456,'zh','摇啊摇，摇到外婆桥','Shanghai, China, 1930. When young Shuisheng arrives from the countryside, his uncle Liushu puts him at the service of Bijou, the mistress of Laoda, supreme boss of the Tang Triad, constantly threatened by his enemies, both those he knows and those lurking in the shadows.','/tzG1UxUSfPACREjgBrsPDRUvneH.jpg','1995-09-14',108,'Released','In 1930, Shanghai violence was not the problem. It was the solution.','Shanghai Triad',37557,2.5158,6.8,'xgIHRczRE1Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12993,_binary '\0','/gcl6TH5JMO8ZT0simZnQhFvdV3Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115019',5.1,1478,'hi','मझधार','Although Krishna and Radha are in love, their class differences prevent them from getting married; Radha eventually marries a man named Gopal, but leaves him soon after giving birth to her daughter without giving notice.','/g8yKMXsnmCPs3CWSE4vBYYmLIbn.jpg','1996-03-29',140,'Released',NULL,'Majhdhaar',161416,0.9067,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12994,_binary '\0','/ogEZl7DzCOS6gmrby2N7MSqe2JS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115033',7,3996,'en','The Young Poisoner\'s Handbook','Graham Young is a teenage misfit living in suburban London in the 1960s. He hates his stepmother but loves chemistry, and the two impulses unite in a wicked plot to slowly poison her. After she dies, he\'s found guilty and sent to a psychiatric hospital, where an idealistic doctor thinks he can be cured.','/d3Lakfy0K1eRHUbay9kMeWdt7y6.jpg','1995-01-20',99,'Released','Meet Graham. He\'s not your ordinary teenager.','The Young Poisoner\'s Handbook',16934,2.0007,6.7,'Xw6F07ChJzQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12995,_binary '\0','/3XXGGrULW7WJQ16B3EBSgGKb88T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115040',7.6,2374,'sk','Záhrada','Jakub\'s life arrived at a dead-end. He leaves his job, and gets into conflict with his father. The trouble just grows by his relation with a married woman. Breaking out, Jakub realizes the pleasures of the countryside in the old garden of his grandfather. He finds true love with an angel, and encounters various exciting moments of his new free life. Strange visitors arrive, and he wont get back to town anymore.','/u9rrUaFUUePbPdem4ZnsyE7rbtF.jpg','1995-06-09',99,'Released',NULL,'The Garden',19008,1.4391,7.314,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12996,_binary '\0','/gN0G4HGXOrjR3DuV3wdcUgZJTly.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115042',4.7,2376,'hi','ज़माना दीवाना','A police commissioner enlists the aid of an eccentric inspector to end a gang war between bitter enemies.','/iYAfxnzVM604D4kuqziemoGtHnq.jpg','1995-07-28',180,'Released',NULL,'Zamaana Deewana',160247,1.2968,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12997,_binary '\0','/8gCXK1zfphG7Hu07IS3ikSmYNr9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115067',6.8,2775,'nl','Zusje','After several years without contact, Martijn visits his sister Daantje, who just started to live on her own in Amsterdam. He tells her he is going to make a documentary from her life, and enters her home life with a video camera.','/nfieSjmRZOfmwihLrTjHBgZlBDq.jpg','1995-12-01',91,'Released',NULL,'Little Sister',42746,1.6327,6.2,'j0s9mwtbQgE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12998,_binary '\0','/yqh3mb9jd3GTTs09ZlnW4mxS95z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115433',5.8,124618,'en','101 Dalmatians','An evil, high-fashion designer plots to steal Dalmatian puppies in order to make an extravagant fur coat, but instead creates an extravagant mess.','/8o2ADoAyG796UwTjwBFjPyBz0yG.jpg','1996-11-27',103,'Released','So many dogs. So little time.','101 Dalmatians',11674,13.6692,5.946,'mom8X7zk7PE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(12999,_binary '\0','/7JmTlybgcuEH6uuOIOk96Bupj4Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115438',6.5,23090,'en','2 Days in the Valley','In a sleepy bedroom community of LA\'s San Fernando Valley, the murder of a professional athlete by two hit men sets into motion a chain of events that puts the mundane lives of a dozen residents on a collision course. This clever tale tells the story of two hit men, a mistress, a nurse, a vindictive ex-wife, a wealthy art dealer and his lovelorn assistant, a suicidal writer and his dog, and a bitter cop and his partner.','/dKmOINYPpg2W8SMRicnFdusqk1x.jpg','1996-09-11',104,'Released','You have one minute to decide the rest of your life.','2 Days in the Valley',9401,6.3383,6.2,'umjwm08s104','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13000,_binary '\0','/7eGGOnJNuoubKj2atB0yPhS7fF4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115471',3.9,4013,'en','Adrenalin: Fear the Rush','In a not-too-distant future, a lethal virus sweeps across Europe, prompting the creation of quarantine refugee camps in the United States. Police officers Delon and Lemieux learn of a grisly murder in the Boston camp and team up to investigate. Suspecting the ruthless killer is infected with the virus, the pair have just hours to stop him before he becomes contagious and infects the entire population.','/azeZdo0MfO3ZcDa0GzgAC7zVP5m.jpg','1996-11-29',77,'Released','Four cops, two hours, one psychopath with a deadly virus. If he\'s not dead by dawn...we are.','Adrenalin: Fear the Rush',55687,2.6218,4.5,'-Bwr1Tj9dWQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13001,_binary '\0','/2qbHYBLD2mTjyySVWXuRJzwBfN6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115472',5.3,6714,'en','The Adventures of Pinocchio','One of puppet-maker Geppetto\'s creations comes magically to life. This puppet, Pinocchio, has one major desire and that is to become a real boy someday. In order to accomplish this goal he has to learn to act responsibly. This film shows you the adventures on which he learns valuable lessons.','/rGPFPkUmPam6arT22ey8jWpKzL2.jpg','1996-07-26',95,'Released','A new angle on the classic tale... And that\'s no lie!','The Adventures of Pinocchio',18975,3.2534,5.3,'DdSZWvO7DU4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13002,_binary '\0','/vosxmjlUPE2YgmsQSJGma1dnvlA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115479',7.1,1587,'it','Sostiene Pereira','Lisbon, 1938. Mr. Pereira is the editor of the culture section of an evening paper. Although fascism is on the rise in Europe, like in nearby civil war Spain or even inside Portugal itself in the form of Salazar\'s regime, Pereira only concerns himself with writing bios and translating French novels. Things change after he hires a young writer as his assistant, getting to know also his girlfriend – both opponents to the regime – and reluctantly helps them when they begin to get in trouble for subversive activities. Eventually, he\'s forced to take a stand...','/hcC09OL0ajVDYRFl38psXBfLx4x.jpg','1995-04-06',104,'Released',NULL,'Pereira Declares',47367,1.3997,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13003,_binary '\0','/uI7Wxl9RMthNtSPOCfTNvPW6oWs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115487',6.7,5447,'es','Airbag','A man gets involved in a series of mishaps while frantically searching for his lost wedding ring.','/sjvz7mxHsygeO4K09GoSgWR4dfy.jpg','1997-06-20',132,'Released',NULL,'Airbag',21700,1.4644,6.586,'AOwf4BKPbbc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13004,_binary '\0','/gTodo59kxoc1siYPVmSOhVTEYsi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115493',5.8,6163,'en','Alaska','Jake Barnes and his two kids, Sean and Jessie, have moved to Alaska after his wife died. He is a former airline pilot now delivering toilet paper across the mountains. During an emergency delivery in a storm his plane goes down somewhere in the mountains. Annoyed that the authorities aren\'t doing enough, Jessie and Sean set out on an adventure to find their father with the help of a polar bear which they have saved from a ferocious poacher. Conflict ensues.','/qInhNnU2siIX4vJudzm0fwzS99O.jpg','1996-08-14',109,'Released','A missing father. A desperate search. An unforgettable adventure.','Alaska',36344,2.5449,5.8,'iKpgVlwF5vY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13005,_binary '\0','/vcafO6dnQT9bCXRwwZijkYHW9Q0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115495',6.1,9032,'en','Albino Alligator','While escaping from a foiled robbery attempt, three thieves find themselves surrounded by police at a New Orleans bar--only they\'re not the people the police are searching for.','/jOyV5Rb1MaMUl6XrWWossVTm7BA.jpg','1997-01-17',97,'Released','They planned the perfect crime... Until it all went perfectly wrong!','Albino Alligator',8744,2.6678,5.7,'eB76XiTiMBA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13006,_binary '\0','/3DuDEqDDHG7OhbDpVEIMCTLHSic.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115509',5.5,7347,'en','All Dogs Go to Heaven 2','Charlie and Itchy return to Earth to find Gabriel\'s Horn, but along the way meet up with a young boy named David, who ran away from home.','/kNmIJILOW9qF2F1Z0qOXkadaS50.jpg','1996-03-29',82,'Released','Heaven help us! Look who\'s back in the adventure of 2 lifetimes.','All Dogs Go to Heaven 2',19042,5.5143,6.1,'yPkqreV3siY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13007,_binary '\0','/nkVsFtaCZTIgGwCTTkjqzMPGeAk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115530',5.8,4238,'en','American Buffalo','Three inner-city losers plan a robbery of a valuable coin in a seedy second-hand junk shop.','/tkIMquxwzMzZUrnAv43e3w0eX0F.jpg','1996-09-13',88,'Released','They had a plan. It wasn\'t worth a nickel.','American Buffalo',31546,2.3394,5.4,'ZsWPpq_AqDA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13008,_binary '\0','/gYF5RQCdLiG7fSwID6ZG46F5Pe2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115536',6.5,1878,'es','El amor perjudica seriamente la salud','Madrid, 1965. When The Beatles arrive in the city, Diana goes to great lengths to meet them.','/ytw0cAAowy6JxHfzKrKmqPTfTeK.jpg','1997-07-01',118,'Released',NULL,'Love Can Seriously Damage Your Health',74192,2.2834,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13009,_binary '\0','/3Q7gL6aLgxdIZY4gCLxtT53XfUS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115561',7.3,17243,'fr','L\'Appartement','Max is a former playboy who has decided to settle down by marrying his current love, Muriel. However, when Max catches a glimpse of the great lost love of his life, he becomes obsessed with rekindling their relationship.','/8EWKKGnAQPdTXhr2aRde1aLwPQn.jpg','1996-07-27',116,'Released','A place where passion and destiny meet.','The Apartment',12531,5.0698,6.8,'GwapQhrZ-D0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13010,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115568',4.4,2114,'hi','आर्मी','Arjun, an army man, who is newly-wed, is brutally killed by a gangster, Nagraj. His wife, who is determined to avenge her husband, raises an army of dedicated young men to kill the gangster.','/wujllj1QzLAxV7tbcTGWZT72blL.jpg','1996-06-28',169,'Released','For love she wages a war','Army',160261,1.4425,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13011,_binary '\0','/fqGjwh4vmWUD4luen26Wtaf6xdd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115571',6.2,42405,'en','The Arrival','Zane Ziminski is an astrophysicist who receives a message that seems to have extraterrestrial origins. Eerily soon after his discovery, Zane is fired. He then embarks on a search to determine the origins of the transmission that leads him into a Hitchcockian labyrinth of paranoia and intrigue.','/4H3VwvIQC1dsMFb2DEGZpbS0JiI.jpg','1996-05-31',115,'Released','The greatest danger facing our world has been the planet\'s best kept secret... until now.','The Arrival',10547,8.1942,6.046,'zPKQidRkQ4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13012,_binary '\0','/7oiQbSjF95pXVenW17534Q8AeEo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115577',7.9,2060,'ro','Asfalt Tango','A desperate husband chases a bus full of beautiful women headed for Paris, France.','/6KYoB9dDfAZVMFxW6Piyd6FbJz3.jpg','1996-11-13',100,'Released',NULL,'Asphalt Tango',8380,1.3427,7.111,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13013,_binary '\0','/pzSXjRmejFNQUrqXqDyVlQhLVBo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115580',6.2,9744,'en','The Associate','Laurel Ayres is a businesswoman trying to make it but unfortunately she works at a investment firm where she does all the work but all the senior investors like Frank Peterson grab all the credit. She then leaves and starts her own firm. While trying to find clients Laurel pretends that she has a male partner named Robert Cutty. And when she starts to do well all of her clients wants to meet Cutty which is difficult since he doesn\'t exist.','/uGyGDcH1tcxMZQQbcqwvxwMPFff.jpg','1996-10-25',114,'Released','Behind every great man is a woman... Wishing he\'d get the hell out of her way.','The Associate',11112,3.7419,6.239,'BBAkNCO7R78','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13014,_binary '\0','/5Qr1sU7l1BU7qVnu8iTu3iND89U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115610',5.8,10132,'en','Bad Moon','During an expedition in Nepal, a photo-journalist becomes infected by a werewolf. Returning to the U.S., he holes up in an isolated location in the woods, but when he invites his sister and nephew for a visit, their dog, Thor, knows something is amiss.','/1RobAQaPIYV2PBmkb4XISbsQZPe.jpg','1996-11-01',80,'Released','Half man. Half wolf. Total terror.','Bad Moon',49763,4.0329,6.702,'R8mK-_EPxdk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13015,_binary '\0','/o7bxmFoHfEP5JiBzVYY5QgLiSfU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115624',3.6,32302,'en','Barb Wire','A sexy nightclub owner, Barb Wire moonlights as a mercenary in Steel Harbor, one of the last free zones in the now fascist United States. When scientist Cora Devonshire wanders into Barb\'s establishment, she gets roped into a top-secret government plot involving biological weapons. Soon Barb is reunited with her old flame Axel Hood, who is now Cora\'s husband and a guerrilla fighter, resulting in plenty of tense action.','/eACq1joafhQTD12gGXNS13J06B.jpg','1996-05-02',98,'Released','Don\'t call me babe!','Barb Wire',11867,5.6165,4.117,'8bNMwKRVbWA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13016,_binary '\0','/h7vBO0meGzjW3yu0Gejx5hI09I9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115632',6.9,24096,'en','Basquiat','The brief life of Jean Michel Basquiat, a world renowned New York street artist struggling with fame, drugs and his identity.','/gFfVhN8BbgHhMb3ZNQRAH5xc7kq.jpg','1996-08-09',107,'Released','In 1981, a nineteen-year-old unknown graffiti writer took the New York art world by storm. The rest is art history.','Basquiat',549,3.56,6.612,'8zIsTrrYeQU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13017,_binary '\0','/qL5Njffzz9kzq17nx2UHIPhauFk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115633',7.3,5174,'en','Bastard Out of Carolina','A poor, struggling South Carolinian mother and daughter face painful choices with their resolve and pride. Bone, the eldest daughter, and Anney her tired mother, grow both closer and farther apart: Anney sees Glen as her last chance.','/jYFwFOkHwWxaStR21UIgdb96Gzh.jpg','1996-12-15',97,'Released',NULL,'Bastard Out of Carolina',41240,4.3103,7.121,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13018,_binary '\0','/h5qJobJ81R4uUAq3FOWByfODV9q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115638',6.7,1566,'fr','Beaumarchais, l\'insolent','Beaumarchais the Scoundrel is a biopic film based on the life of the French playwright, financier and spy Pierre Beaumarchais depicting his activities during the American War of Independence and his authorship of the Figaro trilogy of plays.','/hPfb9v4I24eQvFBOMvvrbcQV2Hp.jpg','1996-03-20',100,'Released',NULL,'Beaumarchais the Scoundrel',68023,1.3528,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13019,_binary '\0','/5VfgNZJvJ6FcwF3PPQbpUIzILkQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115639',7.1,36540,'en','Beautiful Girls','During a snowy winter in the small fictional town of Knight\'s Ridge, Massachusetts, a group of lifelong buddies hang out, drink and struggle to connect with the women who affect their decisions, dreams and desires.','/sHcx1fBmrtZYvFmUywU0d5cvIFd.jpg','1996-02-09',112,'Released','Good times never seemed so good.','Beautiful Girls',9283,5.8348,6.7,'0AvkCamSj5o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13020,_binary '\0','/2qGHNcU8YBIbvNc8HR1YczBeejA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115640',7.6,27638,'en','Beautiful Thing','During a long, hot summer on the Thamesmead Estate in Southeast London, three teenagers edge towards adulthood.','/34fPI0phWQ189lc5O7aNf12jWPm.jpg','1996-06-21',92,'Released','An urban fairytale.','Beautiful Thing',10938,2.9709,7.3,'YeGBkXoOe6Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13021,_binary '\0','/wJapgoCWs31JbhHINFYCpdac1pT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115641',6.8,63320,'en','Beavis and Butt-Head Do America','Slacker duo Beavis and Butt-Head wake to discover their TV has been stolen. Their search for a new one takes them on a clueless adventure across America, during which they manage to accidentally become America\'s most wanted.','/vqdgQiRCSzgpFXLlbxbybfkleBM.jpg','1996-12-20',81,'Released','Coming to a screen bigger than your TV.','Beavis and Butt-Head Do America',3179,5.9569,6.649,'RzYWKWtRmzQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13022,_binary '\0','/p4JS5EvUKzCkqgHZdW7zdvm7sl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115644',6.1,9262,'en','Bed of Roses','The seeds of love are planted when Lisa, a high-powered investment banker, receives flowers from a secret admirer. But when his fairy-tale fantasies clash with her workaholic ways, they soon find out that sometimes, it\'s harder than it seems for love to conquer all.','/zCXvHCEm8334d0d646ldDkXnKws.jpg','1996-01-26',87,'Released','He gave her flowers. She gave him a chance.','Bed of Roses',20927,3.353,5.9,'GJ6-ymSjShg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13023,_binary '\0','/vmw1GLjWlCQJZVSaRthQYbf7Ypf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115645',6.1,11568,'en','Before and After','Two parents deal with the effects when their son is accused of murdering his girlfriend.','/oK8UKDrjFS14OFoihaQPfmmMOyI.jpg','1996-02-23',108,'Released','A murder. A suspect. A shadow of a doubt.','Before and After',43566,4.7727,5.9,'SAmbXIWzRYo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13024,_binary '\0','/a1ng6McskX9Qg8SJNE98zywG4ki.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115650',7.1,6332,'fr','La Belle Verte','As part of an intergalactic coalition, a well-meaning space alien volunteers to bring a message of self-actualization and harmony with nature to the one planet rejected by all her peers as incorrigible: Earth.','/8KE4MGBu9BNr2dawI17n1We64nF.jpg','1996-09-18',99,'Released',NULL,'La Belle Verte',25518,4.5453,7.205,'xB1HHt-gfa8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13025,_binary '\0','/vDlHGqV1FKzXarAoxLaorBB9cPd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115658',7.1,4325,'fr','Bernie','Bernie, a 30 years old orphan, decides to leave his orphanage and find his parents. After an investigation, he meets Marion, a young heroin addict and falls in love with her. He believes that his family was victim of a plot and this is why they deserted him.','/c5jNOFSbUttQZl4CesnpAe1LrPR.jpg','1996-11-27',87,'Released',NULL,'Bernie',19963,1.6918,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13026,_binary '\0','/mhr4BkRfJENbfyYeZiW8NBgTznt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115665',6.7,1311,'cn','攝氏32度','A mysterious and highly successful hitwoman in Hong Kong is paid to assassinate top-level crime bosses. After beginning a relationship with a noodle vendor, she decides to travel to South Korea to complete one last job. Unfortunately, the dead man\'s bodyguard is out for revenge.','/uEQaqbGG7ucQqMuYkIGq7J7jE95.jpg','1996-09-20',90,'Released','Killing is all she knows.','Beyond Hypothermia',45509,1.5512,6.2,'2OgPeMvY2L4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13027,_binary '\0','/CGlwHevhR9vIg4A7ayjYlmpIO7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115669',7.7,3597,'zh','变脸','Wang Bianlian is an aging street performer known as the King of Mask for his mastery of Sichuan Change Art in a true story. His wife left him with and infant son over 30 years ago. The son died from illness at age 10. This left Wang a melancholy loner aching for a male descendent to learn his rare and dying art.','/w3fOMjcR74WdZlYOyug6Q7H1XmU.jpg','1995-06-09',102,'Released',NULL,'The King of Masks',25471,1.5585,7.4,'EDwo1XKW0Fs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13028,_binary '\0','/tYGxW8kkZD8sCOIDi5je9Vk2Wjx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115676',4.8,5918,'en','Big Bully','A writer returns to his hometown where he faces the childhood nemesis whose life he ultimately ruined, only the bully wants to relive their painful past by torturing him once again.','/dws3JR4Yi325Tz33XnuXEB6XjGr.jpg','1996-01-26',90,'Released','A comedy for the kid in all of us.','Big Bully',36929,3.3065,4.657,'WnnQd7lItOg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13029,_binary '\0','/79EyItsEl7pnIO0jFi5HDMhsiON.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115678',7.3,25304,'en','Big Night','Primo and Secondo, two immigrant brothers, pin their hopes on a banquet honoring Louis Prima to save their struggling restaurant.','/8AJGSDyrj3Dz2B57n1ZB4qNPbmJ.jpg','1996-09-20',109,'Released','In love and life, one big night can change everything.','Big Night',18203,4.4102,6.986,'lQQhoYLsoHI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13030,_binary '\0','/4pXKbwEFGxvBMFq4QjOjljtVzdq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115683',4.5,31979,'en','Bio-Dome','Moronic best friends get themselves locked inside the Bio-Dome, a science experiment, along with a group of environmental scientists for one year.','/pjSkGZAvksrbO6tGain8PJ3rfC7.jpg','1996-01-12',95,'Released','Bud and Doyle are here to save the world. But who\'s gonna save the world from Bud and Doyle?','Bio-Dome',9536,4.7022,4.6,'4xD1ujNkZXs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13031,_binary '\0','/yNOtXSNep1BLnfZ0yhLejm1TULi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115685',7.3,118629,'en','The Birdcage','A gay cabaret owner and his drag queen partner agree to put up a false heterosexual front so that their son can introduce them to his fiancée\'s conservative parents.','/4IpC35BoA5aRO0Q1DpFGJ8iKKYq.jpg','1996-03-03',119,'Released','Come as you are.','The Birdcage',11000,8.628,7.047,'P7FcPlt8hHc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13032,_binary '\0','/bHeNjLRJGuQjDXD5CzJzFm6aQF2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115693',6,13075,'cn','黑俠','Super-soldier recruit Tsui Chik is forced to escape with his comrades after the project is canceled. Months later, he\'s trying to have a quiet life as a librarian with his best friend, Inspector Shek Wai-Ho. However, a string of vicious gangland murders begins that has all the markings of Tsui\'s former compatriots who seem to have turned to crime. Realizing that the police are helpless, he decides to take them on himself. With a disguise, Tsui becomes the mysterious superhero known only as Black Mask.','/eEmG43S9o5C6XeFschoFQU4Bcub.jpg','1996-11-07',99,'Released',NULL,'Black Mask',9460,3.6496,6.2,'Vc-QANPIE10','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13033,_binary '\0','/rJbDh4nIjxQFlFjK6k2SktTTT01.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115697',6.2,46419,'en','Black Sheep','When dignified Albert Donnelly runs for Governor, his team moves to keep his slow-witted and klutzy younger brother, Mike, out of the eye of the media. To baby-sit Mike, the campaign assigns sarcastic Steve, who gets the experience of a lifetime when he tries to take Mike out of town during the election.','/bqIW5oE4WeHAvk1nh2Y6rfOLGrF.jpg','1996-02-02',86,'Released','There\'s one in every family.','Black Sheep',13997,5.2463,6.1,'BRgCb1QjOv4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13034,_binary '\0','/7TNqLr09aHfBxr67Dm7hLSQvLKq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115701',4.3,1881,'en','Blast','A deadly team of terrorists mounts a precision attack on a swimming complex, which holds the world\'s finest women\'s swimming team hostage, and unknowingly traps a janitor inside.','/tSIHQJWX6AfPkS84js1j0A2GoAp.jpg','1997-03-13',99,'Released','Terror Has No Limits','Blast',243856,2.715,4.4,'e7k9zjnnzek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13035,_binary '\0','/6ofPPtaNiNaZ34LhofdMNyvwM6P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115710',6,11570,'en','Blood and Wine','A man who has failed as a father and husband commits a heist to make money for his fledging business, but things become complicated when his wife interferes.','/diFSUAvHZE6rkKqfP3J3qf19Z2X.jpg','1996-10-03',101,'Released','There is no honour amongst thieves.','Blood and Wine',31640,3.3304,5.705,'4EYz-SCVgpQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13036,_binary '\0','/kstY6KGkOzqfgf7VMuQPDgIOhVW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115725',5.4,7378,'en','Bogus','Recently orphaned, a young boy is taken in by his godmother who is shocked to realize that she can see the boy\'s imaginary friend: a flamboyant, French magician named Bogus.','/unp3wg7uzIV3HikMexGQJpO0OHc.jpg','1996-09-06',110,'Released','A comedy about losing your heart, finding your inner child and meeting the one friend you\'ve always tried to avoid.','Bogus',3587,2.7536,5.8,'UtTdKGJMLxA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13037,_binary '\0','/yTDwyUEYHZTK35z7Iyp4QHxvVj9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115734',6.9,89083,'en','Bottle Rocket','Upon his release from a mental hospital following a nervous breakdown, the directionless Anthony joins his friend Dignan, who seems far less sane than the former. Dignan has hatched a harebrained scheme for an as-yet-unspecified crime spree that somehow involves his former boss, the (supposedly) legendary Mr. Henry.','/6E7mJ5wpzTFbYFbJvTzzZ8Til9C.jpg','1996-02-21',91,'Released','They\'re not really criminals, but everyone\'s got to have a dream.','Bottle Rocket',13685,5.1903,6.7,'JJPQ-NnjZR0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13038,_binary '\0','/pMvTpyls1l3OEGKBvgRwKMT8a6O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115736',7.3,68332,'en','Bound','Corky, a tough female ex-convict working on an apartment renovation in a Chicago building, meets a couple living next door, Caesar, a paranoid mobster, and Violet, his seductive girlfriend, who is immediately attracted to her.','/9qAy6UWVw44dGrsyKrdEMt5qIUM.jpg','1996-09-13',105,'Released','For money. For murder. For each other.','Bound',9303,7.5934,7.237,'ToCMwdOaWh4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13039,_binary '\0','/ypaWcRK1K4gvBaOIFmxfwY31tzZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115738',7.1,6454,'en','Box of Moonlight','Al Fountain, a middle-aged electrical engineer, is on the verge of a mid-life crisis, when he decides to take his time coming home from a business trip, rents a car, and heads out looking for a lake he remembers from his childhood. But his wandering takes him into the life of Kid, a free-spirited young man who helps Al escape from the routine of everyday life and find freedom to enjoy himself.','/ibDb9U1JsPXJYycSgq6ssSOz1W4.jpg','1996-08-29',112,'Released','Some people have a hard time unwinding.','Box of Moonlight',31146,2.3047,6.8,'_s47WYL9FrI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13040,_binary '\0','/r6vCcqYU9ijZqFxBSaBTWzHYk8i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115742',4.9,3971,'en','Boys','Fed up with boarding school and frustrated with the way others have planned his life, John Baker Jr. wants a change -- anything to shake up his staid routine. The moment arrives when he stumbles upon a woman, Patty Vare, unconscious in a field. Deciding to risk it, John takes her to his dorm to look after her, much to the disapproval of his friends. John\'s decision proves fateful as he and Patty grow close to one another. However, she may be keeping secrets from him.','/kxpLUlvqptToQbLZJbQ7YO4MUAe.jpg','1996-05-10',86,'Released','No one stays innocent forever.','Boys',43634,3.0212,5.4,'7zkoiOq2Urw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13041,_binary '\0','/c8Ooqu8owDRo2iK7LYCvdZuUaV9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115744',7.2,22575,'en','Brassed Off','A Yorkshire coal mine is threatened with closure and the only hope is for the men to enter their Grimley Colliery Brass Band into a national competition. They believe they have no hope until Gloria appears carrying her Flugelhorn. At first mocked for being a woman, she soon becomes the only chance for the band to win.','/qS2cZYWn2jlQs4Ej5O42LVIANQB.jpg','1996-11-01',107,'Released','Fed up with the system. Ticked off at the establishment. And mad about... each other.','Brassed Off',9450,3.6875,6.995,'CTTS1V2XWO8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13042,_binary '\0','/nY2faCdUVHzuH6FmDI6QsAURE68.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115751',7.8,76662,'da','Breaking the Waves','In a small, conservative Scottish village, an oilman is paralyzed in an accident. His wife, who prayed for his return, feels guilty; even more, when he urges her to have sex with another.','/dQWMcdHXUOSHtr7ypOCa5T79JMS.jpg','1996-07-05',159,'Released','Love is a mighty power.','Breaking the Waves',145,5.7975,7.477,'1zKf2tATyoc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13043,_binary '\0','/446lXnrT0vSIkeClW8bCN8KrnxN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115759',6.1,111393,'en','Broken Arrow','When rogue stealth-fighter pilot Vic Deakins deliberately drops off the radar while on maneuvers, the Air Force ends up with two stolen nuclear warheads -- and Deakins\'s co-pilot, Riley Hale, is the military\'s only hope for getting them back. Traversing the deserted canyons of Utah, Hale teams with park ranger Terry Carmichael to put Deakins back in his box.','/iBPMwYYJFvdCBkXrwV75peo5Lz2.jpg','1996-02-09',108,'Released','Prepare to go ballistic.','Broken Arrow',9208,12.0688,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13044,_binary '\0','/w3CQNq8On5Vg39WVoCDwNsNDoGo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115781',6.4,9568,'en','Bullet','A tough, Jewish ex-con just released from prison crosses a powerful drug dealer and former prison rival in his return to a life of crime.','/plsSRQwRfF2FIvoLmVsjo1ELqbl.jpg','1996-03-01',100,'Released','You only get one shot at revenge.','Bullet',14469,2.1337,6.2,'8F76-l3w-YI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13045,_binary '\0','/nHLi2cLJcDF0PK14baJ0HZyEEPm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115783',5.8,41624,'en','Bulletproof','An undercover police officer named Rock Keats befriends a drug dealer and car thief named Archie Moses in a bid to catch the villainous drug lord Frank Coltan. But the only problem is that Keats is a cop, his real name is Jack Carter, and he is working undercover with the LAPD to bust Moses and Colton at a sting operation the LAPD has set up.','/iI7G9YXxodrqkQPKis1y3EKP8wJ.jpg','1996-09-06',84,'Released','Tough cop. Hostile witness.','Bulletproof',10723,6.7849,5.8,'yfzAGAQvsz8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13046,_binary '\0','/a6d2Tjhu0DMdiOcpGVniKsPNDuS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115794',4.5,1731,'it','Bámbola','Her name is Mina, but she is called Bambola (doll). Upon the death of her mother, she and her homosexual brother, Flavio, open a pizzeria. A man named Ugo loans Bambola the money, but is then killed in a fight with another one of her boyfriends, Settimio. While visiting Settimio in jail, she meets a sadistic man named Furio, and they begin a relationship.','/8o2xRDWl9DTmSTpdLCN0GHl9zqJ.jpg','1996-09-01',95,'Released',NULL,'Bambola',54065,4.901,4.508,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13047,_binary '\0','/nj0rIFyjZ0GUOQYnGM8YyGR3CmS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115798',6.2,191423,'en','The Cable Guy','When recently single Steven moves into his new apartment, cable guy Chip comes to hook him up—and doesn\'t let go. Initially, Chip is just overzealous in his desire to be Steven\'s pal, but when Steven tries to end the \'friendship\', Chip shows his dark side. He begins stalking Steven, who\'s left to fend for himself because no one else can believe Chip\'s capable of such behaviour.','/YJt9l3RdrRohI95btQKPXwpdii.jpg','1996-06-10',96,'Released','There\'s no such thing as free cable.','The Cable Guy',9894,9.9749,6,'rhhI_qYOacw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13048,_binary '\0','/2qbAyRbJLf0L44sT6VEnKzss0Tl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115813',5.8,6533,'en','Campfire Tales','Anthology of famous, scary urban legends done with a modern twist.','/wcYwgCJioHteh7g0RaZ9Y8sEhvY.jpg','1997-02-28',88,'Released','Deep in the woods, no one can hear you scream.','Campfire Tales',16315,2.4993,5.896,'EgDSetDxR8A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13049,_binary '\0','/t6I4ddXBBfjIT8XCrTz7R9RlSKm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115819',6.9,13940,'en','Cannibal! The Musical','Heading through Colorado Territory in search of gold and women, Alferd Packer and his group of bemused companions find themselves lost, starving and musically inspired by the obstacles they confront along the way, including a die-hard Confederate cyclops, a trio of surly trappers, a tribe of Japanese-speaking \"Indians,\" and ultimately, each other.','/mX5UM9Fhp9tfQ6VXXO9cUWKPCRK.jpg','1996-08-30',97,'Released','All Singing! All Dancing! All Flesh Eating!','Cannibal! The Musical',13063,1.8327,6.4,'ChS9ojfBiws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13050,_binary '\0','/ccsLztuF4cKlfnriitwdxs0coBa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115820',6.2,3343,'en','The Canterville Ghost','When a teenaged girl moves to England, with her brothers and parents into the ancient Canterville Hall, she\'s not at all happy. Especially as there\'s a ghost and a mysterious re-appearing bloodstain on the hearth. She campaigns to go back home, and her dad, believing the ghost\'s pranks are Ginny\'s, is ready to send her back. But then Ginny actually meets the elusive 17th-century Sir Simon de Canterville (not to mention the cute teenaged duke next door), and she sets her hand to the task of freeing Sir Simon from his curse.','/daQl68yTtTnFIwKJoI3rrYsyvTO.jpg','1996-01-27',92,'Released',NULL,'The Canterville Ghost',48358,2.4264,6.333,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13051,_binary '\0','/8ohEXPkeEvP19l0k1ecPAkzgewb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115822',7.2,2674,'fr','Capitaine Conan','The last days of World War I, Eastern front. Captain Conan, a lone wolf, a true warrior, leads a band of ruthless French fighters who love hand-to-hand combat; they are not fit for peacetime, they only feel really alive in the chaos of the battlefield.','/5prF2brzZEFSqBC5v8d7AemMIQE.jpg','1996-10-16',133,'Released',NULL,'Captain Conan',46334,1.7334,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13052,_binary '\0','/mBc5ehhLAEoOgbUSSsp6gQFDrnO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115832',6.8,3727,'en','Carla\'s Song','1987, love in time of war: bus driver George meets Carla, a Nicaraguan exile living a precarious, profoundly-sad life in Glasgow. Her back is scarred, her boyfriend missing, her family dispersed; she\'s suicidal. George takes her to Nicaragua to find out what\'s happened to them and help her face her past.','/jQtbHH07alTI1knOmt8ZabU6p3c.jpg','1996-10-30',125,'Released','A dream called freedom. A nightmare called Nicaragua.','Carla\'s Song',2143,1.7669,6.791,'iZLReZOORZI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13053,_binary '\0','/8LtMkl1d8gu4JJrtiOUSDSnGdG7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115836',5.1,5715,'en','Carpool','A man with an important business meeting finds himself having to take care of the carpool for the neighborhood school children when his wife gets sick. Stopping to get donuts for the kids, things go even more awry when he finds himself a victim of a robbery. However, the situation only gets worse as a desperate man who had been contemplating a bank robbery robs the robbers and takes the man and the kids hostage in their van as his truck is blocked by an armored car. The thing then proceeds into a comedic chase movie. The father finds his kids don\'t really respect him and they react better to the robber. The end result is everyone gets a lifestyle change, including the original store owner.','/rYoZR4EtrfziT5WXhZzcNbH5GuE.jpg','1996-08-23',89,'Released','A dad in a hurry. A man on the run. And five kids with an attitude.','Carpool',23945,2.5024,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13054,_binary '\0','/mwZJ3W1V2UAS8JhxrDqtltyNOIJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115837',6.3,1843,'en','Carried Away','Based on Jim Harrison\'s book, \"Farmer\". 47-year-old Joseph Svenden lives on the family farm with his dying mother and teaches at a two room schoolhouse with Rosealee, his lover and his best friend\'s widow. Joseph, who lacks a college degree, learns that he will lose his teaching job at the end of the year when the school district expands into his town. Meanwhile, he is seduced by 17-year-old Catherine, a new student in his class. His affair with Catherine and losing his teaching job forces Joseph to take a look at his previously dull life and to decide how he wants to live the rest of it.','/58pT6TIvkQNJYefpeKFa3nBwcSr.jpg','1996-01-26',109,'Released','A story of first loves and last chances.','Carried Away',36447,2.5076,5.8,'RPHqAI3AxDk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13055,_binary '\0','/1pZJXiLnfg5rjhCErUCAXBCkhC1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115847',6.5,1603,'en','Caught','A middle-aged couple has a drifter enter their lives. The fish-store owners find that the mysterious young man awakens the couple in ways they didn\'t expect. Things get tense when the drifter begins an affair with the woman of the house.','/33sUPXPUqIe9YnZ80d8xzkiL2gb.jpg','1996-01-24',110,'Released',NULL,'Caught',47260,27.3031,5.7,'i0Ja-Ttm_5E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13056,_binary '\0','/90VhKNMbZpv3VvcFWsYywM1pVlk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115851',5.3,11243,'en','Celtic Pride','Two over-loyal Celtic fans kidnap their opponent\'s star player in order to guarantee their team the championship.','/5P3p9I2ADnTbBdIAl4ZUeUXGuIi.jpg','1996-04-19',91,'Released','If you can\'t beat \'em... steal him!','Celtic Pride',23449,3.1202,5.306,'SnQFSfapPl8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13057,_binary '\0','/zQPEo9JVbfbKagRyr92Vfk9xqXT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115856',6.9,3739,'fr','Chacun cherche son chat','When Chloe, a young Parisian, decides to take a long-overdue vacation, she has to find someone to look after Gris-Gris, her beloved cat. Everyone, including her gay male roommate, refuses to help her, but she finally makes an arrangement with the elderly Madame Renée, who often watches over other peoples\' cats and dogs. However, when Chloe comes back, Madame Renée tells her that unfortunately the cat has been lost, and the unlucky owner goes on a search for her dear animal friend. While looking for the cat, she meets many colorful characters who populate the neighborhood.','/vZjHfDpE74EmbknicrTg4n5YOLr.jpg','1996-04-03',91,'Released','No man. No job. No cat.','When the Cat\'s Away',11956,2.2166,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13058,_binary '\0','/8coSVxxbsV69T81nMILkiPdUKrP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115857',5.7,59156,'en','Chain Reaction','At the University of Chicago, a research team that includes brilliant student machinist Eddie Kasalivich experiences a breakthrough: a stable form of fusion that may lead to a waste-free energy source. However, a private company wants to exploit the technology, so Kasalivich and physicist Dr. Lily Sinclair are framed for murder, and the fusion device is stolen. On the run from the FBI, they must recover the technology and exonerate themselves.','/4ahjVHwXXsq5zK57ds8FwWY73MS.jpg','1996-08-02',107,'Released',NULL,'Chain Reaction',12123,11.7183,5.8,'bV5HVS-pdvY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13059,_binary '\0','/iqFL6M9fBplNucrruYjHjIea41P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115862',6,15979,'en','The Chamber','Idealistic young attorney Adam Hall takes on the death row clemency case of his racist grandfather, Sam Cayhall, a former Ku Klux Klan member he has never met.','/dHwB9Fn2uBEkxkMZZxWpxMGrhL3.jpg','1996-10-11',113,'Released','Time is running out.','The Chamber',6346,4.5409,5.9,'9Qu4LuSdbTo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13060,_binary '\0','/iwGEdDFaqpbg5e2wMFmhuIcoJVC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115875',6,1985,'en','The Cherokee Kid','Isaih Turner didn’t want to be a hero-all he wanted was revenge. Orphaned when both his parents were cruelly murdered by the wealthy and powerful Cyrus Bloomington, the young Isaiah grew up with one air in mind: to find the man who killed his folks and take him down.','/dGjtGuCvB0qMSG37OUey1npx82l.jpg','1996-12-14',91,'Released','In the old west, you had to be real hard, real tough or real crazy... He was all three.','The Cherokee Kid',56281,2.8657,5.5,'D3b8cIPW-Ps','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13061,_binary '\0','/oBdIe2fRj0wRFogc3X1CHfHhkgm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115886',6.3,2457,'en','Children of the Revolution','A man (Richard Roxburgh) the Australian government blames for 1990s political woes blames his mother (Judy Davis), a communist Stalin seduced in 1951.','/jfL0X3Ym9R9QDkUQZufwzVq12F0.jpg','1996-12-26',101,'Released','A red comedy about the ultimate party animals.','Children of the Revolution',9977,1.996,5.6,'VYtklkIQOqQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13062,_binary '\0','/zRKH1oLM4kWAkQHoGQH3eNtZcl3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115891',6.2,1242,'en','Christmas Every Day','Billy Jackson is not having a good Christmas. He got a basketball for Christmas and just cannot make a jump shot. His Uncle David is coming to town to open a ValueMall, which will put his Dad\'s store out of business. When he tells his little sister Sarah that there is no Santa, she makes a wish that it would be Christmas every day. Billy now has to relive Christmas Day over and over again.','/r5GgnXk32vmI98ho7WB9GPMzohg.jpg','1996-11-30',87,'Released','Sometimes Christmas wishes really do come true!','Christmas Every Day',61550,1.7799,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13063,_binary '\0','/gQ5ldmixFQ6vHy5jH6CkH5Y8urv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115899',6.8,6748,'it','Il ciclone','The everyday life of accountant Levante, his family and the other people of a small town in the Tuscan countryside is taken by storm by the serendipitous arrival of five gorgeous Spanish flamenco dancers.','/uyIO4UfPiJgnugMtg754dL3izcy.jpg','1996-12-20',95,'Released',NULL,'The Cyclone',38366,1.4894,6.938,'XpJ-JYA4reM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13064,_binary '\0','/1PW1QmsdOH7kO95wdoI2YQmTxcC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115906',7,9843,'en','Citizen Ruth','\"Citizen Ruth\" is the story of Ruth Stoops, a woman who nobody even noticed -- until she got pregnant. Now, everyone wants a piece of her. The film is a comedy about one woman caught in the ultimate tug-of-war: a clash of wild, noisy, ridiculous people that rapidly dissolves into a media circus.','/ncDIFOY7Mcan2gunAivLjIx3Kj1.jpg','1996-11-21',104,'Released','Life, liberty, money and the pursuit of happiness. She\'s gotta have it.','Citizen Ruth',13891,2.4631,6.6,'oIb4KbnMQ38','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13065,_binary '\0','/9z9SwlbhlV1oaai2gPhyRE8xpIG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115907',6.2,24530,'en','City Hall','The accidental shooting of a boy in New York City leads to an investigation by the Deputy Mayor, and unexpectedly far-reaching consequences.','/w7EkAl4Oi8Lc6VQKaqRHrOV3CxR.jpg','1996-02-16',111,'Released','It started with a shootout on a rainswept street and ended in a scandal that shattered New York.','City Hall',11062,4.7905,5.964,'OlCO01s1upA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13066,_binary '\0','/3jabc26AUH8bKEGbglAbJXFowcV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115927',5.5,1758,'en','Commandments','Seth Warner has reached the end of his rope. Ever since his wife died two years earlier, his world has been in turmoil. He is despondent, his career has fallen apart, even his house has been destroyed. There seems to be nothing left for him to live for. Confused and angry after two years of suffering, he finally directs his wrath at God from the rooftop of his apartment building in New York City. In the midst of a wild thunderstorm he demands to know why he has been betrayed by the god he has believed in and honored his whole life. God\'s answer is to strike down Seth\'s dog in a bolt of lightning. Pushed beyond his limits, Seth decides to respond to his years of torment by breaking each of the biblical Ten Commandments.','/bob97FFDOHzGoD62MamZc82jZy.jpg','1997-05-02',88,'Released','He\'s getting even...by breaking all the rules.','Commandments',16399,1.3084,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13067,_binary '\0','/cRgONBm7ozB26wuRHtUCifDPmyI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115928',6.7,1839,'fr','Comment je me suis disputé… (ma vie sexuelle)','Paul Dedalus is at a crossroads in his life. He has to make several decisions; should he complete his doctorate, does he want to become a full professor, does he really love his long-standing girlfriend, or should he re-start with one of his other lovers?','/sWGTIBFAVoYki1wCnlLqTPc6xZX.jpg','1996-05-01',181,'Released',NULL,'My Sex Life... or How I Got Into an Argument',83994,1.8378,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13068,_binary '\0','/h7jewTP4Q0fPAiufeFTGZF04P39.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115940',7.6,12308,'fr','Conte d\'été','Awaiting his girlfriend Léna’s arrival at the Breton seaside resort of Dinard, Gaspard befriends — and flirts heavily with — two other women, the companionable ethnology student Margot and the sensual townie Solène, making for a rather complicated situation when Léna finally arrives.','/l3syqgYqqfqPVheINI5jOBN5hXL.jpg','1996-06-05',114,'Released',NULL,'A Summer\'s Tale',37563,2.6472,7.337,'rsBodd_UqJE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13069,_binary '\0','/uOlHBIjgUw70pCNY5RNDI6otoFK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115950',6.7,1724,'en','Cosas que nunca te dije','Don is a real estate salesman who volunteers at a \"hotline for hope\". Ann, who works in a photo store, has been told by her boyfriend that he doesn\'t love her anymore and wants to break up. To try to win him back, she records a videotape where she tells him things she never told him. When Don and Ann cross paths, their lives change fundamentally.','/6NjS3gRyeJZT9mnHgQ1FTwkvSlW.jpg','1996-04-24',93,'Released','Some things are difficult to explain.','Things I Never Told You',110909,3.0107,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13070,_binary '\0','/9fay2wNCKqEuewn9XFq45PavmI3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115951',6.6,2433,'en','Cosi','Lewis, a young amateur theater director, is offered a job with a governmental program for the rehabilitation of mentally ill patients in a Sydney institution. His project is overrun by one of the patients, who wants to stage the opera Cosi Fan Tutte by Mozart, despite the fact that none of the patients can sing or speak Italian. A comedy of errors ensues, but one which unifies the patients and their director in unexpected ways.','/g4b3tEgmPSq7mZ7db1r9i5jHEHV.jpg','1996-03-04',102,'Released','When chasing your dreams... it helps to be a little crazy!','Cosi',90214,1.8569,6.2,'4TvtNFAYBmQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13071,_binary '\0','/sWaKmnieGBGSrstaPLopH4m1A3K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115956',6.6,64232,'en','Courage Under Fire','A US Army officer, who made a \"friendly fire\" mistake that was covered up, has been reassigned to a desk job. He is tasked to investigate a female chopper commander\'s worthiness to be awarded the Medal of Honor. At first all seems in order. But then he begins to notice inconsistencies between the testimonies of the witnesses...','/vDJurMJkrx049AiXa3DJx5Zx7a4.jpg','1996-07-04',116,'Released','A medal for honor. A search for justice. A battle for truth.','Courage Under Fire',10684,6.8408,6.556,'F3n76pChEcs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13072,_binary '\0','/yAaAsbossCADVFdiqm8qAhd2gL0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115963',6.5,120930,'en','The Craft','A Catholic school newcomer falls in with a clique of teen witches who wield their powers against all who dare to cross them -- be they teachers, rivals or meddlesome parents.','/8bW2RdRkloYtEPhbQZN4wcdmJP4.jpg','1996-05-03',101,'Released','Welcome to the witching hour.','The Craft',9100,13.3739,6.781,'SxEqB--5ToI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13073,_binary '\0','/vQNknPEVSAui6IL6eUlDBPfUzcW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115964',6.4,72882,'en','Crash','A car crash victim inexplicably finds himself aroused by car accidents and becomes involved with an underground subculture of like-minded souls.','/gpai5oUFyFGLHOCsYTvVMqlbY7A.jpg','1996-07-17',100,'Released','Exploring the ultimate thrill where body and metal become one.','Crash',884,9.0497,6.5,'9dIC-lDgpZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13074,_binary '\0','/jtgge9V7Z71cDRkQKTIGcdwd2By.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115985',5.3,3380,'en','Crossworlds','College good guy Joe is drawn into a battle to save the world from arch-enemy Ferris. Joe\'s heirloom pendant just happens to be the key to the staff that opens doors to the Crossworlds. When Laura shows up to check on the key and Ferris\' goons begin their assaults, they run to semi-retired adventurer A.T. for help and guidance.','/A2aqbMX7EoYg23NfD6lCusZrZyR.jpg','1996-02-14',90,'Released','Imagine a place where all dimensions of the universe collide...','Crossworlds',17821,1.5456,5.2,'qm3YWiHUip8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13075,_binary '\0','/c0OnUa4nmLdbM63CZZtyehjCaQ2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115986',4.6,23585,'en','The Crow: City of Angels','A murder victim is brought back to life by a mysterious crow. With the help of a beautiful woman, he exacts revenge on his killers – only to realize his enemy has discovered the one weakness that can destroy him forever.','/ppOoLiO2JY0BJQdixs08xrQuAA6.jpg','1996-08-29',84,'Released','Believe in the power of another.','The Crow: City of Angels',10546,5.4971,5.5,'ptt-3fC3bcU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13076,_binary '\0','/iGjePiIOMhy8FZyVZaXkbw5lc2d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115988',6.8,43092,'en','The Crucible','A Salem resident attempts to frame her ex-lover\'s wife for being a witch in the middle of the 1692 witchcraft trials.','/zv69Rev43me5gQ68x7fk1mQzhHn.jpg','1996-11-27',123,'Released','Arthur Miller\'s timeless tale of truth on trial.','The Crucible',20539,6.2646,6.6,'4OBffF0s3Hc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13077,_binary '\0','/2R7wWGQI5dwLFtE9MYk43Dza9Ss.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0115994',5.9,5832,'en','Curdled','A death-obsessed cleaning woman uncovers a clue identifying a Florida bartender for a series of socialite murders.','/quXWXtOp6umg1qzPdWD6bB3x9EW.jpg','1996-09-06',88,'Released','After the killer kills, after the living are dead, somebody has to clean up the mess… and you thought your job sucked.','Curdled',12241,2.5625,5.772,'IgNXkUUZ6vU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13078,_binary '\0','/7vSYjecvEFW0wSUxyBAD5ou5BGj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116000',5.5,30683,'en','D3: The Mighty Ducks','The Ducks are offered scholarships at Eden Hall Academy but struggle with their new coach\'s methods and come under pressure from the board to retain their scholarships before their big game against the Varsity team.','/wltMr1loUKSCaEV4EDgh21eCRI3.jpg','1996-10-04',104,'Released','No Fear. No Limits. No Brakes. Just Ducks.','D3: The Mighty Ducks',10680,4.7873,5.97,'CFSmoKm6c5A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13079,_binary '\0','/zaWCHa0EXs9uMPZxmjFZ6D1dXp7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116005',6.6,1393,'ko','돼지가 우물에 빠진 날','The lives of 4 interconnected South Koreans – a married couple, a novelist the wife is having an affair with, and a second woman the novelist is simultaneously involved with.','/1DJ1veoay9Ugb7ve2NUZvQbdRUC.jpg','1996-05-04',117,'Released',NULL,'The Day a Pig Fell Into the Well',86267,3.214,6.349,'eOSo9vCLIM4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13080,_binary '\0','/8Ly3AUHwkadZFfLPvLsNA657heA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116014',6.9,5245,'cn','大內密探零零發','An imperial agent gets ridiculed for his various inventions, until his supportive wife encourages him to attend a conference, which\'s actually a trap to kill all the doctors serving the emperor, where his crazy inventions come in handy.','/bywu9M03JAowpRqWYB43lINsfo5.jpg','1996-02-16',89,'Released','He is the law! what law?','Forbidden City Cop',37702,3.6852,7,'QJAxV9UUfPM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13081,_binary '\0','/c8YEFNd9c3posszHtCLVsNtTAPf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116036',6.4,2266,'en','Dating the Enemy','Television show host Brett and his laid-back science journalist girlfriend Tash despair that they will ever truly understand each other. On their first anniversary, under a full moon, a frustrated Tash declares her wish that they could swap lives. The next morning, Brett and Tash awaken to find Tash\'s wish has come true. Forced to confront the unfamiliar sensations of their \"new\" bodies, both must navigate strange new experiences with friends and co-workers.','/4MFCad31c4neuZhcVi8dUkvy0w0.jpg','1996-09-19',104,'Released','A cheeky romantic comedy.','Dating the Enemy',16197,2.1703,6.3,'OHH7mYpG_D8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13082,_binary '\0','/uK4mks9XqF0LGinouk7BQvqZiR1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116040',6,81179,'en','Daylight','A group of armed robbers fleeing the police head for the New Jersey Tunnel and run right into trucks transporting toxic waste. The spectacular explosion that follows results in both ends of the tunnel collapsing and the handful of people who survived the explosion are now in peril. Kit Latura is the only man with the skill and knowledge to lead the band of survivors out of the tunnel before the structure collapses.','/bRWNxtm3q0QvIIM52uQqRIEvpl2.jpg','1996-12-06',115,'Released','No air. No escape. No time.','Daylight',11228,8.3182,6.145,'tRWIfCpxNK4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13083,_binary '\0','/jcybjAhhzJYgacSx3DOrtAXOwzR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116041',7.1,9165,'en','The Daytrippers','Eliza D\'Amico thinks her marriage to Louis is going great until she finds a mysterious love note to her husband. Concerned, she goes to her mother for advice. Eliza, her parents, her sister Jo, and Jo\'s boyfriend all pile into the station wagon and go to the city to confront Louis with the letter. On the way, the five explore their relations with each other and meet many interesting people.','/bDmconT9Fj0dnXdV5LaGAxXrVFN.jpg','1997-03-05',87,'Released','It\'s a family affair.','The Daytrippers',49806,3.1876,6.6,'HBZ3iVspjd8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13084,_binary '\0','/a7eFsqP9BDvn0JWtNuCrPTb1pyn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116059',5.5,4410,'en','Dear God','A judge gives con-man Tom Turner a choice—a jail sentence, or a year of honest work. But when he gets a job in the U.S. Post Office\'s dead letter office, he starts a Good Samaritan con by answering letters written to God. His seemingly virtuous work inspires his co-workers to do the same, but their good deeds are frowned upon by the postmaster general—and the cops.','/mHc6hY6Rv7S7kS50vW2vVdHWG79.jpg','1996-11-01',112,'Released','Many people write to God. Somebody is answering.','Dear God',38554,2.3509,5.4,'n-p13le_NhE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13085,_binary '\0','/jSXkVoiUxUtrUSEQRp8tzEN4Q9Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116070',5.5,1306,'en','The Delta','In Memphis, a middle-class white teenager and a black Vietnamese immigrant meet in a gay cruising spot and discover what they don\'t have in common.','/a6qkTkU5B14VDuEnTHp9h71EZ6y.jpg','1997-08-15',85,'Released','The distance between two men is...','The Delta',107199,1.8551,5.2,'Y65tTy6vs98','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13086,_binary '\0','/25pNPKtYHtZFLsJ71SC5skiXJAe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116075',5.4,11654,'en','The Dentist','Dr. Alan Feinstone has everything: a beautiful wife and a successful career in dentistry. However, when he discovers his wife\'s affair, he realizes that behind every clean, white surface lies the stench of decay.','/4jKZXQy0OJW3B0tt8AdQ8epI9sU.jpg','1996-06-07',92,'Released','It\'s been six months. Time for your check-up!','The Dentist',9568,5.9061,5.5,'LkDykd9ZmXM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13087,_binary '\0','/5QJyi6fG7YxxLao5HIdrOvwRHaj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116095',5.5,16616,'en','Diabolique','The wife and mistress of a cruel school master collaborate in a carefully planned and executed scheme to murder him. The plan goes well until the body, which has been strategically dumped, disappears. The psychological strain starts to weigh on the two women when a retired police investigator begins looking into the man\'s disappearance on a whim.','/zSW4A35r7Vpz0ainYJGb2QVwCh0.jpg','1996-03-22',107,'Released','Two women. One man. The combination can be murder.','Diabolique',10988,4.0132,5.5,'c9jTjZ89HVc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13088,_binary '\0','/5u6TzelrBYCrdob3jBJAwMKsq80.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116102',7,2129,'en','Different for Girls','Paul and Kim meet when their vehicles collide. Paul is fascinated with the attractive Kim. It turns out that the two were childhood friends in Catholic boys\' school, but back then, before the operation, Kim was named Karl.','/aWO2iXpqQY3S4WhXRvf0B18QVR8.jpg','1996-10-01',97,'Released','Expect the unexpected','Different for Girls',106837,2.3337,7.1,'IMUtd_pchHY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13089,_binary '\0','/26MVKVGQf1J0yrzJx97Ww4DLslV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116118',6.3,11435,'en','Doctor Who','The Seventh Doctor becomes the Eighth. And on the streets of San Francisco – alongside new ally Grace Holloway - he battles the Master.','/cwae2p7JcRNtz1CvNCzpX5ad96V.jpg','1996-05-12',86,'Released','He\'s Back... And It\'s About Time!','Doctor Who',15691,3.769,6.2,'tbktviLW51s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13090,_binary '\0','/dfkE2LppPbJ1qUzi3tdND5iuMFp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116126',6.6,68111,'en','Don\'t Be a Menace to South Central While Drinking Your Juice in the Hood','When Ashtray moves to South Central L.A. to live with his father (who appears to be the same age he is) and grandmother (who likes to talk tough and smoke reefer), he falls in with his gang-banging cousin Loc Dog, who along with the requisite pistols and Uzi carries a thermo-nuclear warhead for self-defense. Will Ashtray be able to keep living the straight life?','/9gqMAFr81RCHzjUDUuDT2CllbTD.jpg','1996-01-12',89,'Released','Finally, the movie that proves that Justice isn\'t always Poetic, Jungle Fever isn\'t always pretty, and Higher Learning can be a waste of time.','Don\'t Be a Menace to South Central While Drinking Your Juice in the Hood',10607,10.1349,7.1,'JAAhQwcJ20U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13091,_binary '\0','/waytOOLxw9IDbo0hNKZLk1z4lzI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116130',6.2,29148,'en','Down Periscope','Maverick Navy Lieutenant Commander Tom Dodge will never be a textbook officer, but he\'s a brilliant seaman who\'s always wanted to command a nuclear submarine — he\'s been given one last chance to clean up his record. Unfortunately, Admiral Graham, his nemesis, would rather sink the fleet than give Dodge his own boat. So, Graham stacks the deck against him and assigns Dodge to the Stingray, a diesel-powered WW2 submarine that can barely keep afloat. To make matters worse, Dodge\'s crew is a collection of maladjusted, mistake-prone misfits. Then, he\'s tagged the \"enemy\" in a crucial war game, and ordered to take on the U.S. Navy\'s best.','/brleKcHsirTw7lFqcgUMOfgL2nl.jpg','1996-03-01',92,'Released','A rusty sub. A rebel commander. A renegade crew. When destiny called, they should have hung up.','Down Periscope',9101,8.348,6.4,'lTyxmVou27w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13092,_binary '\0','/xbqluNfftDJtxDsqcpx9kKme4LF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116136',6.4,105455,'en','DragonHeart','In an ancient time when majestic fire-breathers soared through the skies, a knight named Bowen comes face to face and heart to heart with the last dragon on Earth, Draco. Taking up arms to suppress a tyrant king, Bowen soon realizes his task will be harder than he\'d imagined: If he kills the king, Draco will die as well.','/1J2FvxEoEKMFT9TjUdfhm0MJhZD.jpg','1996-05-31',103,'Released','You will believe.','DragonHeart',8840,8.5895,6.6,'7MSLlD8lQ5k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13093,_binary '\0','/gynNsoCNHHgSD7NznXIdhwfaHD9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116138',5.2,1552,'en','Drawing Flies','Donner and his roomates are out of money and about to get evicted from their home. So as a diversion from their situation, he invites them to his father\'s cabin in the Canadian wilderness. They all go along, but soon learn that there\'s no cabin - he\'s really trying to find Sasquatch.','/uPxM0whm2mRykOeWL2edfsCxcTD.jpg','1996-06-12',76,'Released','A Good Monster is a Terrible Thing to Waste.','Drawing Flies',24063,1.3247,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13094,_binary '\0','/1C9Jj6Bw7QxkM7qEauWHgZ5ErEf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116141',5.9,3132,'en','Dream for an Insomniac','A girl with insomnia who works in a coffee house has impossibly high standards for her love and fears she will never meet a worthy man. Then in walks a new employee and they click - until she discovers he has a girlfriend. Undaunted, she moves to L.A. with a friend sure that he will dump the girlfriend and follow her. She puts all her faith in fate and hopes for the best.','/1hGRcEPnpmgAmfLObym3olCk6tM.jpg','1996-04-18',87,'Released','A dreamer who couldn\'t sleep. An author who couldn\'t write. A friend who couldn\'t help but help.','Dream for an Insomniac',32284,2.318,5.1,'SidZYXhVgJQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13095,_binary '\0','/1gKDAWgzHTbBM5OcWzhVBw4H3wt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116147',6.6,7652,'en','Drive','A prototype enhanced human, on the run from Chinese-hired hit men, hooks up with a dread-locked bystander, and the two of them elude their pursuers narrowly each time.','/bJiau5UDnDIjemil7z3d7kUbUHm.jpg','1997-08-06',100,'Released','There ain\'t no cruise control.','Drive',25571,3.257,6.164,'8YywD_T4gjk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13096,_binary '\0','/ArNNCDc3Ndg9d0PkkOYHsZeLsbo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116151',5.4,14309,'en','Dunston Checks In','Hotel manager Robert Grant is forced by his boss to postpone his family vacation when a hotel critic checks in. Trouble is, the critic is really a villainous jewel thief with an orangutan assistant named Dunston. When Dunston gets loose and tries to escape a life of crime -- aided by Robert\'s sons -- havoc, hijinks and lots of laughs abound!','/xR2cWC04kWNr7TBeXNOf4uOqn00.jpg','1996-01-12',88,'Released','He\'s about to turn a Five Star Hotel into a three ring circus.','Dunston Checks In',17414,4.4813,5.411,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13097,_binary '\0','/pBeDtizLhNwmOLJiLiozcRYkZyU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116163',6.5,5624,'cn','伊波拉病毒','A violent fugitive on the run from the law makes his way from Hong Kong to South Africa, where he discovers that he\'s immune to the Ebola virus, and later returns home to spread the deadly disease.','/3537kQNixMuzl9hS6WDY7J7v3nd.jpg','1996-06-15',100,'Released',NULL,'Ebola Syndrome',24922,5.3664,6.432,'BGMJhnwXJ9c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13098,_binary '\0','/zfRUlq0ZXMcxnGfOmxkyWYXEPTa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116164',6.8,1556,'de','Echte Kerle','Christoph, cop and self-confident macho, has trouble with his fiance. After a long night he wakes up in the arms of Edgar, a good-looking, gay auto-mechanic. His live gets more and more troublesome after his girl friend throws him out of their apartment and as last resort he moves to Edgars place. Working together with a new, good-looking, very self-confident, female collegue, but living with a good-looking gay guy makes him pretty uncertain about his sexuality and his role as a cop. Written by Konstantin Articus','/yh8IiyblpNt8QSK2r7FMStuI85q.jpg','1996-05-30',100,'Released','Macho cop finds himself in a relationship with a gay man and questions his life. German.','Regular Guys',9098,1.1943,5.9,'92YpB53r8Fs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13099,_binary '\0','/2z5DyXsGhJhngSuE8IwQ4zEhhEM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116165',2.8,9154,'en','Ed','Jack Cooper could be a world-class baseball pitcher if he didn\'t keep buckling under the pressure. He tries to keep his spirits up after he\'s traded to a minor league team but loses all hope when he discovers that Ed, one of his teammates, is a chimp. Ed used to be the team mascot, but was promoted to third base when the owners realized he had a talent for baseball. As Jack struggles to get used to his new surroundings, Ed helps him regain his confidence on and off the field.','/oSNX3zyTpRMN0ExtOobt7eaJfPD.jpg','1996-03-15',94,'Released','Minor league. Major friendship.','Ed',32308,2.2227,4.129,'InqDF8ImCgU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13100,_binary '\0','/hpP2NfkfXN9K6WGOWKt8zRq87Xx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116168',5.2,10666,'en','Eddie','Eddie is a New York limo driver and a fanatical follower of the New York Knicks professional basketball team. The team is struggling with a mediocre record when, in mid-season, \"Wild Bill\" Burgess, the new owner, as a public relations gimmick, stages an \'honorary coach\' contest, which Eddie wins. The fans love it, so \"Wild Bill\" fires the coach and hires her. She takes the bunch of overpaid prima','/qIJ4PU6WifgRs8RpiN3LkNYjzlS.jpg','1996-05-31',100,'Released','The newest coach in the NBA has got the Knicks right where she wants them.','Eddie',11107,2.9875,5.497,'_iuDUSj5jaI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13101,_binary '\0','/eBQc24VRzNXz3gFMrvdSvwd6Ire.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116191',6.6,44416,'en','Emma','Emma Woodhouse is a congenial young lady who delights in meddling in other people’s affairs. She is perpetually trying to unite men and women who are utterly wrong for each other. Despite her interest in romance, Emma is clueless about her own feelings, and her relationship with gentle Mr. Knightley.','/fM5goQ6c3uq3hzNJj3ZAFfTFkX9.jpg','1996-08-02',121,'Released','Cupid is armed and dangerous!','Emma',3573,4.64,6.6,'Qqt3MYX2i0I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13102,_binary '\0','/em5kAUF8QbwThG5BCqVgFomxNT5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116209',7.4,215350,'en','The English Patient','In the 1930s, Count Almásy is a Hungarian map maker employed by the Royal Geographical Society to chart the vast expanses of the Sahara Desert along with several other prominent explorers. As World War II unfolds, Almásy enters into a world of love, betrayal, and politics.','/8eHHqMg8qEYtVw8LQLygsHXSR2q.jpg','1996-11-14',162,'Released','In love, there are no boundaries.','The English Patient',409,10.7049,7.1,'N1OopmufwUo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13103,_binary '\0','/8n6ZCFJWwK7UiX7NYuIEvHLRPYG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116213',6.2,125311,'en','Eraser','Eraser, an elite federal marshal who \"erases\" the pasts of jeopardized informers and relocates them into safe anonymity, must protect a moving target who stands to uncover a conspiracy that could shift the balance of power in the world forever.','/1FUV5ZmEkbxvqwQW0az4tFFOSmo.jpg','1996-06-21',115,'Released','He will erase your past to protect your future.','Eraser',9268,9.3198,6.1,'P3nrgwO3R-w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13104,_binary '\0','/wzC2p07FfCsOTLo2aUeGBUQhsHX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116225',5.7,86901,'en','Escape from L.A.','Into the 9.6-quaked Los Angeles of 2013 comes Snake Plissken. His job: wade through L.A.\'s ruined landmarks to retrieve a doomsday device.','/3L9lL2eUsmLNNfENPwNOc82Hzpw.jpg','1996-08-09',101,'Released','Snake is back.','Escape from L.A.',10061,9.1939,5.864,'EMvoxhtPXXA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13105,_binary '\0','/oojHJ1BRCeHBkdIEshjP85gDDfY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116231',8.1,75911,'tr','Eşkıya','The film tells the story of a group of bandits captured in the Cudi Mountains 35 years ago. All of them have died, either from illness or vendettas; only Baran (Şener Şen) survives. After serving his 35-year sentence, Baran is released from Viranşehir Prison and learns that his birthplace is now submerged under the waters of a dam. Ceren Ana (Zübeyde Erden) tells him about the past. Baran is imprisoned because of the betrayal of his old friend Berfo (Kamran Usluer). Berfo stole the bandits gold, bought his childhood love Keje (Sermin Hürmeriç) from her father, and fled to Istanbul. While Baran is searching for Keje, he encounters a young man named Cumali (Uğur Yücel). These two men find solace in each other to avoid being swept away by the storms of the big city. And in this world where violence, betrayal, passion, boundless love and hatred intertwine, they try to survive.','/44KTRoayojxpzti2okBZGKmjEGM.jpg','1996-11-29',128,'Released',NULL,'The Bandit',26900,1.9033,7.293,'OPJwwRUCQd4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13106,_binary '\0','/9qu0OF45gslLPWsLsti7I4e5p0G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116240',5.9,5327,'en','The Evening Star','Continuing the story of Aurora Greenway in her latter years. After the death of her daughter, Aurora struggled to keep her family together, but has one grandson in jail, a rebellious granddaughter, and another grandson living just above the poverty line.','/bX4FCb2nooHnJh68Ig06lyLfyM0.jpg','1996-12-25',129,'Released','The continuing story of \'Terms of Endearment\'.','The Evening Star',30285,2.7475,5.9,'491s6_6f_DA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13107,_binary '\0','/2G6nVbZPPMvrJCNHm3lbiWJp59v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116242',6.7,41511,'en','Everyone Says I Love You','A New York girl sets her father up with a beautiful woman in a shaky marriage while her half sister gets engaged.','/cFOZ4bNbWtnIIboc43M86yhwPBX.jpg','1996-12-06',101,'Released',NULL,'Everyone Says I Love You',9716,5.2729,6.4,'w0PN_ZvESJ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13108,_binary '\0','/r9UT8rRCAy2WG2Qg5jQz2H1jQ4c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116247',5.5,4433,'en','Evil Ed','Edward is a friendly, harmless film editor in the splatter and gore department of a horror film company. Ed is assigned to work on the new Loose Limbs series of horror films after the previous editor killed himself with a hand grenade. Later his reality begins to twist and distort into a horrifying world where nothing is as it seems. Soon enough this turns Ed into Evil Ed!','/aMcXrjmSOTSuUbo7t3E5IzBdK9d.jpg','1995-11-01',93,'Released','When His Mind Blows ... Anything Goes!','Evil Ed',25234,2.1705,5.4,'Y2niQM44EHU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13109,_binary '\0','/aZtinn0RhlDMYQU0jlotEzJ3tJc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116250',6.3,39798,'en','Evita','The hit musical based on the life of Evita Duarte, an Argentinian actress who eventually became the wife of Argentinian president Juan Perón, and the most beloved and hated woman in Argentina.','/mVdQatilUGMtB6sV4FXA7O473UD.jpg','1996-12-14',135,'Released','Unforgotten, forever loved and adored.','Evita',8818,3.8252,6.1,'jXzJXj2x0Rk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13110,_binary '\0','/ct9dN0QUh5SMAexvyQ9IaA7HpOP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116253',6.5,66028,'en','Executive Decision','Terrorists hijack a 747 inbound to Washington D.C., demanding the release of their imprisoned leader. Intelligence expert David Grant suspects another reason and he is soon the reluctant member of a special assault team that is assigned to intercept the plane and hijackers.','/hLjXkFr9fHlWzRVwu1T31QSVHRq.jpg','1996-03-15',132,'Released','Five miles above the earth, an elite team of six men must make an air to air transfer, in order to save 400 lives on board a 747...and 40 million below.','Executive Decision',2320,9.5801,6.3,'3pdPOqN06ec','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13111,_binary '\0','/pkZyudy6PLofZUQhNhoPH49Qxah.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116259',6.2,21108,'en','Extreme Measures','Guy Luthan, a British doctor working at a hospital in New York, starts making unwelcome enquiries when the body of a man who died in his emergency room disappears. After the trail leads Luthan to the door of an eminent surgeon at the hospital, Luthan soon finds himself in extreme danger from people who want the hospital\'s secret to remain undiscovered.','/uowP2Nw2mLpQni1vtbUb1LUSiP0.jpg','1996-09-27',118,'Released','Not all surgery is intended to cure.','Extreme Measures',11306,5.5524,6,'dUppiay4Fs0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13112,_binary '\0','/lOiIE1MS7q756PYHYiAw6glruxZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116260',6.2,22233,'en','Eye for an Eye','It\'s fire and brimstone time as grieving mother Karen McCann takes justice into her own hands when a kangaroo court in Los Angeles fails to convict Robert Doob, the monster who raped and murdered her 17-year-old daughter.','/y2lZSdJ1o0VvLegTw3ad6KFtxra.jpg','1996-01-12',101,'Released','What do you do when justice fails?','Eye for an Eye',17182,7.5971,6.277,'jY56N6irNCk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13113,_binary '\0','/mtimhZ7tY2zhgePqsKzDTLlocJP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116261',7.3,1520,'en','Eye of God','A small Oklahoma town is stripped of its innocence when one of its boys turns up mute and bloodied by the lakeside. Unable to tell his story, the local sheriff embarks on a quest to uncover the roots of a gruesome crime. He\'s led to Ainsley DuPree and her new husband, Jack, a man whose interest in family may very well outweigh his morals.','/zMxJNqwDH9bm69z0DnPFyMrVv0b.jpg','1997-10-17',83,'Released','A small, peaceful, God-fearing town. But tonight, it\'s not God they have to fear.','Eye of God',62184,1.584,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13114,_binary '\0','/uLe08DokjJDRxhZJmQsAk4vtDjE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116269',5.7,2420,'en','Faithful','A depressed housewife whose husband is having an affair contemplates suicide, but changes her mind when she faces death by a killer hired to do her in.','/nbDb2ESmcDT2tDpwdgOPPReRSl6.jpg','1996-04-03',91,'Released','A comedy about a wife, her husband and his hit man.','Faithful',47502,2.028,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13115,_binary '\0','/bxEwMGxFgpWJWQWlbEg706XtnMe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116274',7.2,1661,'es','Familia','Santiago wakes up like any other morning. He goes down to the kitchen and his whole family is waiting for him: it\'s his birthday. They all sing \"Happy Birthday to You\" and give him presents. But when he opens the present of his youngest son, he gets angry and says he doesn\'t like it. The boy starts crying and saying that he loves him, but Santiago answers that he doesn\'t believe him and he tells the boy that he is fired and that he wants another son, who is thinner, who doesn\'t need glasses and who resembles him more. Written by Pablo Montoya','/4x1jiEfaKN0HCJAE3hDSKtL7fW.jpg','1996-10-01',98,'Released',NULL,'Family',107667,1.1217,7.4,'G51d1fV65fw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13116,_binary '\0','/ypjHHnZuPn7A1Euqi1onU32Ejgs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116275',7.1,5052,'en','A Family Thing','Earl Pilcher Jr. runs an equipment rental outfit in Arkansas, lives with his wife and kids and parents, and rarely takes off his gimme cap. His mother dies, leaving a letter explaining he\'s not her natural son, but the son of a Black woman who died in childbirth; plus, he has a half brother Ray, in Chicago, she wants him to visit. Earl makes the trip, initially receiving a cold welcome from Ray and Ray\'s son, Virgil. His birth mother\'s sister, Aunt T., an aged and blind matriarch, takes Earl in tow and insists that the family open up to him.','/1IHxwmguaeytGo6m0wZaS0s3fP.jpg','1996-03-29',109,'Released','With family, everything is relative.','A Family Thing',41852,2.5133,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13117,_binary '\0','/dISWllRkiQ1l5Nbn5JMZbz6RHoh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116277',5.9,55639,'en','The Fan','When the San Francisco Giants pay center-fielder, Bobby Rayburn $40 million to lead their team to the World Series, no one is happier or more supportive than #1 fan, Gil Renard. When Rayburn becomes mired in the worst slump of his career, the obsessed Renard decides to stop at nothing to help his idol regain his former glory—not even murder.','/lu7CjP8YES5dJMCFg5O9o9jCkjl.jpg','1996-08-15',116,'Released','All fans have a favorite player. This one has a favorite target.','The Fan',9566,5.4213,5.987,'OJhwzOqqdqU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13118,_binary '\0','/k4WfbmcyIJEW7U5ELt0wgVNr6g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116279',5.3,1460,'it','Fantozzi - Il ritorno','Ugo Fantozzi has been ejected from Heaven and is sent back to Earth for a short period of time until the staff in Heaven can get Fantozzi a place there. Fantozzi goes through a variety of unfortunate experiences, such as rescuing his retro punk granddaughter Uga, and having to pay a vast telephone bill due to frequent chat line conversations. He ends up getting arrested instead of his ex-boss, who was originally charged with corruption. Just as he is about to enjoy the World Cup Final with Italy, he is called back into Heaven. Can he find peace once again?','/sL0Ay3GQZRup2xOPkL63qujgzgh.jpg','1996-12-20',97,'Released',NULL,'Fantozzi The Return',41668,1.3696,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13119,_binary '\0','/747dgDfL5d8esobk7h4odaOFhUq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116282',8.1,796977,'en','Fargo','Jerry, a small-town Minnesota car salesman is bursting at the seams with debt... but he\'s got a plan. He\'s going to hire two thugs to kidnap his wife in a scheme to collect a hefty ransom from his wealthy father-in-law. It\'s going to be a snap and nobody\'s going to get hurt... until people start dying. Enter Police Chief Marge, a coffee-drinking, parka-wearing - and extremely pregnant - investigator who\'ll stop at nothing to get her man. And if you think her small-time investigative skills will give the crooks a run for their ransom... you betcha!','/rt7cpEr1uP6RTZykBFhBTcRaKvG.jpg','1996-03-08',98,'Released','A lot can happen in the middle of nowhere.','Fargo',275,15.1435,7.849,'Pg_CqV3VlPg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13120,_binary '\0','/vqycIvfLRFtdiCAvOmGX9iP7mAE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116287',6.3,64244,'en','Fear','Nicole Walker always dreamed of being swept away by someone special — someone strong, sexy and sensitive who would care for her more than anything else in the world. David is all that and more: a modern-day knight who charms and seduces her, body and soul. But her perfect boyfriend is not all he seems to be. His sweet facade masks a savage, dark side that will soon transform Nicole\'s dream into a nightmare.','/ut8snuINzOibbKnvpTnsGWQr4Nl.jpg','1996-04-12',97,'Released','Together forever. Or else.','Fear',10543,10.2651,6.7,'p2AlffKozbg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13121,_binary '\0','/pWQccERGRrNRJTEK9cOLV8M4Efx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116289',5.4,12115,'en','Feeling Minnesota','Sam Clayton\'s marriage to ex-stripper Freddie comes about when she\'s strong-armed into the match by Red, a club proprietor who once did her a favor. But Freddie falls in love with Jjaks, Sam\'s brother, and the pair tries to escape the situation together. It isn\'t long before both Sam and Red catch up with them, resulting in threats against the two of them -- although tension also starts to build between Sam and Red.','/fCJ5eUZw6mGS53spQxGUu7rzFm1.jpg','1996-09-13',99,'Released','Just when she met the man of her dreams, her husband showed up to ruin everything.','Feeling Minnesota',12656,3.1954,5.441,'LoVRGgufV2w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13122,_binary '\0','/rARL8L9J1m114szR9nhn50tD4Yx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116293',5.4,3159,'en','Female Perversions','An ambitious female attorney wallows in excess and meaningless sex with both male and female partners, while dealing with her personal life problems including helping her kleptomaniac sister.','/gyw58PEJE51aMgwHRCsQBhVymJU.jpg','1996-11-21',117,'Released','Dare to let yourself go where you\'ve never been before.','Female Perversions',41801,4.2277,5.1,'ZDQGMdoR5yg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13123,_binary '\0','/ugXZzSoelpO5lPQy4TXXMgBrRHJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116295',6.6,2172,'zh','風月','Set in the decadent 1920s, Temptress Moon tells the very complicated story of a wealthy family living on the outskirts of Shanghai. Their youngest daughter, Ruyi, is brought up as a servant to her opium-addicted father and brother. Meanwhile, her brother-in-law Zhongliang has a successful, if illegal, career seducing and blackmailing married women in the city. When he comes to Ruyi\'s home the two fall in love, and trouble ensues.','/48KhZT4wwioPjAYz2LwX8nXt4UN.jpg','1996-05-09',130,'Released','What the heart hides, the moon reveals.','Temptress Moon',47694,2.7039,6.7,'zJV9dRGG05k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13124,_binary '\0','/3571mDtNc2GaaVH4CDOl72pntW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116296',6.7,1319,'it','Ferie d\'agosto','Like every August, journalist Sandro, his family and acquaintances vacation on the island of Ventotene. This time, however, they find out the house next door has been rented to a lower middle class family, whose crass nature and values soon clash with their own intellectual and progressive background.','/6tOhTuwoK46tQPtzW9tHSQT944b.jpg','1996-04-05',106,'Released',NULL,'August Vacation',56399,1.1592,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13125,_binary '\0','/qH5y3iE9nBIKhHEfOgH7bV0Itu9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116308',7.1,6823,'en','फायर','In a barren, arranged marriage to an amateur swami who seeks enlightenment through celibacy, Radha\'s life takes an irresistible turn when her beautiful young sister-in-law seeks to free herself from the confines of her own loveless marriage.','/jDUCcZ7bBkqhbZ8R0vml3YUd4GG.jpg','1997-08-22',108,'Released','Beneath the surface lies a burning secret.','Fire',513,1.9766,6.778,'SnshN0wqiCo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13126,_binary '\0','/rysvKeLogXYSGlx4XuH04ldr8mh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116311',5.3,12381,'en','First Kid','Some say that to be the leader of a country is one of the loneliest jobs in the world. But being the child of a world leader can be doubly so. Constantly surrounded by security officers, restricted in movements and having almost every waking moment carefully monitored makes normalcy an impossibility. No one knows this better than young Luke Davenport, the son of U.S. President Davenport. He vents his loneliness, frustration and feelings of isolation from family and friends by being a brat to his private Secret Service agent. When the agent snaps from the strain in front of the First Lady, a new agent is assigned to Luke. He turns out to be the enormous Sam Simms, a bit of a rogue who managed to rise through the ranks by sheer determination rather than strict adherence to Secret-Service protocol. At first, Luke tries all his old tricks upon Sam. But instead of getting angry, Sam seems to actually understand.','/t7yTkuXQpnougXmRIqgfT32axZi.jpg','1996-08-30',101,'Released','He\'s young. He\'s wild. He\'s fun. And he\'s the one protecting the president\'s son.','First Kid',12559,3.3294,5.8,'_t7ubr0jBII','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13127,_binary '\0','/gtLbJuGgAEvxG4DaPHRARURlD2H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116313',6.5,60891,'en','The First Wives Club','After years of helping their hubbies climb the ladder of success, three mid-life Manhattanites have been dumped for a newer, curvier model. But the trio is determined to turn their pain into gain. They come up with a cleverly devious plan to hit their exes where it really hurts - in the wallet!','/2ApifgYnfdJUSmCKzTBrWOYYWsn.jpg','1996-09-20',102,'Released','Don\'t get mad. Get everything.','The First Wives Club',2925,7.0005,6.7,'u4ITvGX5Atc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13128,_binary '\0','/v8pmJbQIcrsQKDN6dlXHkCfY7gO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116320',5.5,10695,'en','Fled','During a routine prison work detail, convict Piper is chained to Dodge, a cyberhacker, when gunfire breaks out. Apparently, the attack is related to stolen money that the Mafia is after, and some computer files that somebody wants desperately to bury. The pair, who don\'t exactly enjoy each other\'s company, escape and must work together if they are to reach Atlanta alive. Luckily, they meet a woman who may be willing to help them.','/5oGdTgWXCOKerrfdBxJrOlFyifL.jpg','1996-07-19',98,'Released','See how they run.','Fled',18550,3.5033,5.723,'unkjtd50Nmk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13129,_binary '\0','/750Uayj0Bww4QfqMUJCymW3EJkC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116322',5.4,12762,'en','Flipper','Sandy Ricks is sent by his mom to Coral Key, a rustic island in the Florida keys, to spend the summer with his uncle Porter Ricks. Sandy dislikes everything about his new environment until a new friend comes into his life, a dolphin named Flipper, that brings uncle and nephew together and leads Sandy on the summer adventure of a lifetime.','/c3KEzecZ5oE6CpSrWX6wCLrBJbf.jpg','1996-05-17',95,'Released','This summer it\'s finally safe to go back in the water.','Flipper',36355,3.1483,5.562,'YQRbTNN-jNE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13130,_binary '\0','/gzlGNZczKeBsNskj8MLGlh0fIc1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116324',6.7,21171,'en','Flirting with Disaster','Adopted as a child, new father Mel Colpin decides he cannot name his son until he knows his birth parents, and determines to make a cross-country quest to find them. Accompanied by his wife, Nancy, and an inept yet gorgeous adoption agent, Tina, he departs on an epic road trip that quickly devolves into a farce of mistaken identities, wrong turns, and overzealous and love-struck ATF agents.','/uIcgXQYm2eqguUaYdbolQ4LWpMy.jpg','1996-03-22',93,'Released','A comedy about sex, love, family and other accidents waiting to happen.','Flirting with Disaster',2074,4.1506,6.2,'Pc6p72O4p44','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13131,_binary '\0','/gJeF1Pn9nsSsexqaQpS0G840nI2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116329',6.9,29122,'en','Fly Away Home','Amy is only 13 years old when her mother is killed. She goes to Canada to live with her father, an eccentric inventor whom she barely knows. Amy is miserable in her new life... until she discovers a nest of goose eggs that were abandoned when a local forest was torn down. The eggs hatch and Amy becomes \"Mama Goose\". When winter comes, Amy and her dad must find a way to lead the birds South.','/obcQJkZB2OsRxd5GWIcQ5Qjv4YW.jpg','1996-09-13',107,'Released','To achieve the incredible, you have to attempt the impossible.','Fly Away Home',11076,5.5408,7,'2mpxfPxPM6A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13132,_binary '\0','/3MyhpiRSeabVbSvaXLyZdX7ckMe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116334',6.2,1267,'fr','For Ever Mozart','Episodic film that follows a theater troupe from France attempting to put on a play in Sarajevo. Along their journey they are captured and held in a POW camp, and they call for help from their friends and relations in France.','/5TCe8LHpl8aZ9OvGvFkakAYyYlL.jpg','1996-11-27',85,'Released',NULL,'For Ever Mozart',111367,1.3469,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13133,_binary '\0','/dqHixRXYzuPZolsKNEDSoB2zBmt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116336',6.1,1280,'en','For My Daughter\'s Honor','Fourteen-year-old high school student, Amy Dustin, becomes an object of romantic affection to the school\'s biology teacher and football coach, Pete Nash. They take a sudden interest in each other, sending each other notes and talking on the telephone. Although Pete has a family, the two begin a secret relationship. People then begin to suspect that Pete and Amy are having an affair.','/1FkHMDXQ7cqK8GO5qYC5GjZrecy.jpg','1996-11-20',88,'Released','She was young, lovely and innocent... until she met him.','For My Daughter\'s Honor',105437,2.2546,5.3,'gSncpcW9QjY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13134,_binary '\0','/oOQ2zxEWmI60fnRMj6XgJVfPLZZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116341',3.8,3205,'en','Forest Warrior','McKenna, the spirit of Tanglewood Forest, can transform into a bear, a wolf or an eagle. When a gang of evil lumberjacks led by Travis Thorne arrive in Tanglewood to chop the forest down, McKenna cannot let this happen. With his new friends, the Lords of Tanglewood, a band of children who love to play in the forest, he battles Thorne and his gang.','/lU9ECdGWnhWl2pJKlovMSWQKmLB.jpg','1996-11-05',97,'Released','It\'s going to take more than a miracle to save their mountain','Forest Warrior',63988,3.2463,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13135,_binary '\0','/fJClZLeghpEyHXDAErBwNF2E1tN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116344',7.4,6576,'en','Forgotten Silver','The life story of Colin McKenzie, a forgotten pioneer of international cinema who was born in rural New Zealand in 1888.','/gSLluaJR2fxmsGOtmfSKQJ9RCly.jpg','1997-09-11',53,'Released',NULL,'Forgotten Silver',32458,1.7871,7.2,'tULVFTt3Fkg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13136,_binary '\0','/i2WrfAiK3o5NjqdM7XZKTrwil6m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116353',6.2,10455,'en','Foxfire','The story of five teenage girls who form an unlikely bond after beating up a teacher who has sexually harassed them. They build a solid friendship but their wild ways begin to get out of control.','/ywrSScJT43HerqWPlMu8nigLFzg.jpg','1996-08-23',102,'Released','It took them 17 years to learn the rules. And one week to break them all.','Foxfire',18555,3.0552,6,'SQ-CopNrehU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13137,_binary '\0','/q86f264W90GIUeg1Ovf4T1PIBA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116361',6.8,34637,'en','Freeway','Following the arrest of her mother, Ramona, young Vanessa Lutz decides to go in search of her estranged grandmother. On the way, she is given a ride by school counselor Bob Wolverton. During the journey, Lutz begins to realize that Bob is the notorious I-5 Killer and manages to escape by shooting him several times. Wounded but still very much alive, Bob pursues Lutz across the state in this modern retelling of Little Red Riding Hood.','/m0pAARUq3foDWFsrUmlYDHtNPE9.jpg','1996-08-23',104,'Released','Her life is no fairy tale.','Freeway',11229,4.1585,6.5,'6LHrvpL6OgM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13138,_binary '\0','/krR08gys45BTnY3qXIfBJVDKrvK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116365',7.1,103394,'en','The Frighteners','Once an architect, Frank Bannister now passes himself off as an exorcist of evil spirits. To bolster his facade, he claims his \"special\" gift is the result of a car accident that killed his wife. But what he does not count on is more people dying in the small town where he lives. As he tries to piece together the supernatural mystery of these killings, he falls in love with the wife of one of the victims and deals with a crazy FBI agent.','/zcJbCMwFLJdn5OLjhYwMVaSB32R.jpg','1996-07-19',110,'Released','No rest for the wicked.','The Frighteners',10779,8.6096,7,'9FBZxkNSmTs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13139,_binary '\0','/phiRQhfwZZeMMn3osvQUmGYmJbp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116367',7.2,374294,'en','From Dusk Till Dawn','After kidnapping a father and his two kids, the Gecko brothers head south to a seedy Mexican bar to hide out in safety, unaware of its notorious clientele.','/sV3kIAmvJ9tPz4Lq5fuf9LLMxte.jpg','1996-01-19',108,'Released','One night is all that stands between them and freedom. But it\'s going to be one hell of a night.','From Dusk Till Dawn',755,20.4882,7.051,'jNuIn4T-CLk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13140,_binary '\0','/3ON157Dt5FfwOl9LF3tCxVEdKSJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116378',6.6,10103,'en','The Funeral','After the funeral of one of their own, a criminal family decides to embark on an emotionally unnerving journey in an attempt to exact bloody revenge.','/sHbJbr6BvVwRJhliiX1PKPERejO.jpg','1996-01-26',99,'Released','One family, one murder, too many lies.','The Funeral',21612,3.0644,6.769,'uRgBedsCOWk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13141,_binary '\0','/uv0annzJaX9iGrzQOTTmHD63qPJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116384',6.9,4058,'fa','گبه','An elderly couple go about their routine of cleaning their gabbeh, while bickering gently with each other. Magically, a young woman appears, helping the two clean the rug. This young woman belongs to the clan whose history is depicted in the design of the gabbeh, and the rug recounts the story of the courtship of the young woman by a stranger from the clan.','/oa1ap3SlARqFUMJs0467g9f4OUS.jpg','1996-06-26',72,'Released','Life is Colour. Love is Colour.','Gabbeh',43771,1.7608,6.7,'mFFkf0hNgVw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13142,_binary '\0','/1ve1TMFBha5Pbp1T81Ro01DmYXh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116390',7,3609,'ja','ガメラ2 レギオン襲来','A strange meteor lands in Japan and unleashes hundreds of insect-like \"Legion\" creatures bent on colonizing the Earth. When the military fails to control the situation, Gamera shows up to deal with the ever-evolving space adversary. However the battle may result in Gamera losing his bond with both Asagi and humanity.','/xPBtoCLUN0raEKywuiSId6SSRAc.jpg','1996-07-12',99,'Released','Who will be extinct, Japan, or Legion?','Gamera 2: Advent of Legion',59480,2.3294,7.4,'ET65ASPPNOw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13143,_binary '\0','/tbZO6k6JXMAhCv9NLXS1lGYxxiy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116401',4.4,2320,'en','Generation X','A group of young mutants--humans with a genetic variation that gives them superpowers and makes them feared by the population at large--begin training at a school for heroes. Their studies are interrupted when they must rescue one of their number from a mad scientist who can enter others\' dreams.','/9LeTRxm04eW6Ls4429DTT4MU9b7.jpg','1996-02-20',87,'Released','Welcome to the future','Generation X',26623,2.5705,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13144,_binary '\0','/nITF6wXK8Icm3FitDNw54bGNaHv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116404',6.9,6447,'en','Get on the Bus','Fifteen Black men gather in South Central LA to take a cross-country bus trip to attend the Million Man March in Washington, DC in October 1995. Among the attendees are an eclectic set of characters, including a laid-off aircraft worker, a man whose at-risk son is handcuffed to him, a Black Republican, a former gangsta, a Hollywood actor, a cop of mixed racial background, and a white bus driver. All make the trek discussing issues surrounding the March, including manhood, religion, politics, sexuality, and race.','/7p8FvHMSr11LQw9Xv6dPJdrBeU2.jpg','1996-10-16',121,'Released','On October 16, 1996, the one year anniversary of the Million Man March, Spike Lee invites you to lift your head, raise your voice, and...get on the bus.','Get on the Bus',49471,3.2753,6.4,'A104gXyW1Ts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13145,_binary '\0','/mJvMMgPupfGpmWuINVClcC3EDXI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116405',4.7,1479,'en','Getting Away with Murder','When the very moralistic college ethics instructor Jack Lambert finds himself living next door to an accused German death camp commander, he takes it upon himself to rid the world of this man.','/zL9RbLQrhTyi60ZeXjc8hEIaTxf.jpg','1996-04-12',88,'Released','One bad apple can spoil the whole line-up.','Getting Away with Murder',25697,2.2451,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13146,_binary '\0','/fpO8UUlzNFPs3kltvraDhwoolma.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116407',7.6,4994,'hi','Ghatak','Katya, a ruthless mobster, rules over the town with an iron fist. When newcomer Kashi dares to challenge his reign of terror, he faces brutal consequences.','/4lqlyxjMNMuQtu4VlXV0LrRx3tt.jpg','1996-11-08',158,'Released',NULL,'Ghatak',118632,3.1436,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13147,_binary '\0','/kM2RkLCt3ElQ2NfHgw1CzZXRGfZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116409',6.8,71345,'en','The Ghost and the Darkness','Sir Robert Beaumont is behind schedule on a railroad in Africa. Enlisting noted engineer John Henry Patterson to right the ship, Beaumont expects results. Everything seems great until the crew discovers the mutilated corpse of the project\'s foreman, seemingly killed by a lion. After several more attacks, Patterson calls in famed hunter Charles Remington, who has finally met his match in the bloodthirsty lions.','/oU7zYtqtKejO1BxCmRGIaVQMGTP.jpg','1996-10-11',109,'Released','Prey For The Hunters','The Ghost and the Darkness',10586,7.4756,6.9,'jGsiY-2CkPU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13148,_binary '\0','/wpcClVxsbVGTmCvDOU0tvuPTvOg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116410',6.7,13804,'en','Ghosts of Mississippi','A Mississippi district attorney and the widow of Medgar Evers struggle to bring a white supremacist to justice for the 1963 murder of the civil rights leader.','/gu81MbuLTPbw95xWuDuM7ddcCir.jpg','1996-12-20',130,'Released','A forgotten crime. An impossible case. A final chance... for justice.','Ghosts of Mississippi',31908,3.6621,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13149,_binary '\0','/wZIFAgcy7Hihvo8d0svFKCDlBQR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116414',5.4,6977,'en','Girl 6','A struggling actress in New York City takes a job as a phone sex operator.','/1SSYCOTrHucd9aBCyTfbLWcJ2zD.jpg','1996-03-22',108,'Released','She\'s the only thing better than being there.','Girl 6',61752,2.3537,5.1,'yGxWoppTujU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13150,_binary '\0','/oFs99SgcuVOwGhtew77rBKniNmi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116421',5.4,22611,'en','The Glimmer Man','A former government operative renowned for his stealth, Jack Cole is now a Los Angeles police detective. When a series of horrible murders occurs in the metro area, Cole is assigned to the case, along with tough-talking fellow cop Jim Campbell. Although the two men clash, they gradually become effective partners as they uncover a conspiracy linked to the killings, which also involves terrorism and organized crime.','/fMXc2nf3iZFsVbNNmJ5MCtjcwlk.jpg','1996-10-04',92,'Released','Two good cops. One bad situation.','The Glimmer Man',9625,4.6212,5.427,'zJQNS57EpVo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13151,_binary '\0','/mPSqoeQObPuoT616wz3v5EtifhC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116422',5.6,3928,'en','Glory Daze','Jack, a soon-to-be graduate, finds he\'s having a difficult time letting go of the college life -- and decides maybe he doesn\'t have to. Also questioning whether there\'s life after college are Jack\'s roommates: Rob, who fears domestication; comic-strip artist Mickey, who\'s shy around girls; intellectual party animal Slosh; and perpetual student Dennis.','/mosH3RnC5wjcThd0DZq4ZqWkTPQ.jpg','1995-10-01',100,'Released','True or False.','Glory Daze',26626,3.3958,5.2,'r2fPHLVu7Z8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13152,_binary '\0','/zqDAbBZkAgQEKvBLih1GFitDWC8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116426',7.2,10931,'cn','食神','The most renowned and feared chef in the world loses his title of God of Cookery because of his pompous attitude. Humbled, he sets out to reclaim his title.','/9BbEsmLl1kVPcsojW5W8kMm5Ws5.jpg','1996-12-21',95,'Released',NULL,'The God of Cookery',41343,4.7102,7.2,'b-bsPK7mlEE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13153,_binary '\0','/qeTBrEHmaWdiBq7fFx0f65rccuW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116441',7.2,10149,'en','Gotti','John Gotti, the head of a small New York mafia crew breaks a few of the old family rules. He rises to become the head of the Gambino family and the most well-known mafia boss in America. Life is good, but suspicion creeps in, and greed, rule-breaking and his high public profile all threaten to topple him.','/4ZeKN0jnXHlyloMFba1Xe4C1ell.jpg','1996-08-17',117,'Released','The Rise and Fall of a Real Life Mafia Don','Gotti',14786,2.907,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13154,_binary '\0','/vyGXpBeq0PLMSVw5UOiiJ3U2IUW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116442',6.8,4246,'en','Grace of My Heart','Philadelphia teenager Edna Buxton wins a talent contest during the early rock \'n\' roll era, changes her name to Denise Waverly and moves to New York City to make it big. Though she flops as a recording artist, fast-talking record producer Joel Millner recognizes her songwriting talent and teams her with struggling songsmith Howard Caszatt.','/fkgVjmbN9VdBxguNi6tz6lb3sDu.jpg','1996-09-13',116,'Released','For years her songs brought fame to other people. Then she found her own voice.','Grace of My Heart',58985,2.7567,6,'nOhOiFpZJ78','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13155,_binary '\0','/oA5k91Lu0IojIoRcbXtdAgNFAiP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116446',5.7,1580,'en','The Grave','Two prisoners escape with the help of their jailer to search for a treasure that is supposedly buried with a dead millionaire.','/zXX7uWgtrEujgDs6PAhDw7BRrzC.jpg','1996-01-18',90,'Released','Some secrets are better left buried.','The Grave',36299,1.6734,5.3,'OXZ2w_3QJIg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13156,_binary '\0','/sqqlEz8T2dUvHcRMA2CxoBkRYom.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116447',6.8,2674,'en','Gray\'s Anatomy','The film documents, in an often dramatic and humorous fashion, Gray\'s investigations into alternative medicine for an eye condition (Macular pucker) he had developed.','/w9oYXUfwezTBqcLE8qTWSZ3p8KL.jpg','1996-09-11',80,'Released','Thrill to the minimal cystoid macula edema on the basis of capillary incompetence!','Gray\'s Anatomy',32686,1.6817,6.5,'UDzGh6Z2WxA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13157,_binary '\0','/sCo0Y61v00gqNMTJjPTkxLXwMLv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116448',5.5,9884,'en','The Great White Hype','When the champ\'s promoter, Rev. Sultan, decides something new is needed to boost the marketability of the boxing matches, he searches and finds the only man to ever beat the champ. The problem is that he isn\'t a boxer anymore and he\'s white. However, once Rev. Sultan convinces him to fight, he goes into heavy training while the confident champ takes it easy and falls out of shape.','/yEPiu0mC4NqMHOoFLsC6CxQW34d.jpg','1996-05-03',91,'Released','If you can\'t find the perfect contender....make one.','The Great White Hype',20759,3.4906,5.248,'WnyftZZ880s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13158,_binary '\0','/gKJ6ynHx8zkfSWMjj1YQFq9zSA7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116455',6.6,1421,'cn','古惑仔之隻手遮天','This time taking on the rival Tung Sing triad, who is attempting to usurp Hung Hing influence in Hong Kong by having Tung Sing member Crow frame Ho Nam for the murder of Hung Hing Chairman Chiang Tin Sang. On the plus side, Chicken finds a new love interest in Wasabi, the daughter of the comedic priest, Father Lethal Weapon Lam.','/nx4COZ81XFPWAZ7H8h0GyZNCnHn.jpg','1996-06-29',98,'Released',NULL,'Young and Dangerous 3',48940,3.3723,6.5,'VZAo2ZXsyb4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13159,_binary '\0','/bqnUI5n6f3edUquqLgfVOUVheEN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116456',7,2324,'cn','古惑仔之人在江湖','Five young hoodlums sing karaoke, murder, joke around, get beaten up, win and lose women, and learn the value of blind loyalty.','/jLfEVzChm3akXJNhyQGWGrmEjd4.jpg','1996-01-25',99,'Released',NULL,'Young and Dangerous',39828,3.0545,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13160,_binary '\0','/9kkzRKwGKTVWNFBMruCT3RKUrzx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116477',7.7,42212,'en','Hamlet','Hamlet, Prince of Denmark, returns home to find his father murdered and his mother now marrying the murderer... his uncle. Meanwhile, war is brewing.','/ilurgUOp6SCl4cuhfjctj1qxlfZ.jpg','1996-12-25',242,'Released','Something is rotten in the state of Denmark.','Hamlet',10549,4.2421,7.309,'05zTajDCXLc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13161,_binary '\0','/5aPWPG924fSUnrW22v4a11enT7p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116480',7.2,1837,'sv','Hamsun','Knut Hamsun is Norway\'s most famous and admired author. Ever since he was young he has hated the English for the starvation they caused Norway during WWI. When the Germans occupy Norway 9 April 1940 he welcomes them and the protection they can give from Great Britain. He supports the national socialist ideals, but opposes the way these ideals are turned into action - that Norwegians are jailed and executed. His wife Marie travels in Germany during the war as a sign of support from Knut and herself.','/k2BVh5iAzvDD52b2k2KlYfzvL5z.jpg','1996-04-19',159,'Released','They were worshipped as national saints. Hated as traitors. Their marriage spanned from the worst kind of betrayal to the greatest love...','Hamsun',79118,1.2581,6.8,'JEMBTo0r5dE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13162,_binary '\0','/t4HWzRhhcmPCARtVh0Hr8o9OSK8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116481',7.6,2719,'en','Hands on a Hardbody: The Documentary','Filmmaker S.R. Bindler profiles Texas contestants trying to win a truck by keeping one hand on it longer than everyone else.','/snyLQ21YGNWHNcDSNUIouzBFObh.jpg','1997-06-01',98,'Released',NULL,'Hands on a Hardbody: The Documentary',18603,1.3861,7.5,'TgA3DvoBVb8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13163,_binary '\0','/As7NuiDRM4EO7LlJn2u8JWWsABp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116483',7,312383,'en','Happy Gilmore','Failed hockey player-turned-golf whiz Happy Gilmore — whose unconventional approach and antics on the green courts the ire of rival Shooter McGavin — is determined to win a PGA tournament so he can save his granny\'s house with the prize money. Meanwhile, an attractive tour publicist tries to soften Happy\'s image.','/4RnCeRzvI1xk5tuNWjpDKzSnJDk.jpg','1996-02-16',92,'Released','He doesn\'t play golf... he destroys it.','Happy Gilmore',9614,12.5113,6.674,'VJFdK0Owxlc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13164,_binary '\0','/4EcUnkCoGcD0SOeyUeKt3hKMj3I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116488',7.2,2971,'en','Hard Core Logo','Bruce Macdonald follows punk bank Hard Core Logo on a harrowing last-gasp reunion tour throughout Western Canada. As magnetic lead-singer Joe Dick holds the whole magilla together through sheer force of will, all the tensions and pitfalls of life on the road come bubbling to the surface.','/xE6BqwOxHjjFniKXsW1Zg4F04RC.jpg','1996-10-11',92,'Released','4 Guys. 5 Nights. 3000 Miles. 764 Gallons of Gas. 987 Bottles of Beer. 3457 Cigarettes. 1 Last Shot.','Hard Core Logo',21589,2.0839,6.6,'CAw_HZ4GsFc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13165,_binary '\0','/cTDoeA4zEJMP0it4VYe0ACFaJ4N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116493',6,12335,'en','Harriet the Spy','Harriet may only be in the sixth grade, but she\'s already found her calling: to be a spy. In a private journal she takes everywhere, Harriet records suspicious activity and keeps a running list of observations on virtually everyone she knows. It seems harmless enough until, one day, someone finds the journal and exposes Harriet\'s critical thoughts about her classmates. Suddenly, even her best friends are against her, and Harriet resolves to take revenge.','/spTUUMgIVm4gOdWL35IoYWEuZQl.jpg','1996-07-10',101,'Released','On your case!','Harriet the Spy',38223,3.7845,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13166,_binary '\0','/xAbmXGRLMtrzO5lYbEoPCED6KGj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116502',6,8731,'en','Head Above Water','Judge George brings his young wife, Nathalie, to a remote island for a vacation. But while George accompanies their only neighbor -- Nathalie\'s childhood friend Lance -- on a fishing trip, Nathalie spends time with her ex, Kent. When Kent ends up dead the next morning, Nathalie tries to hide the evidence before her husband gets home. After the body is found, the events of the previous night unravel, with unexpected revelations.','/snbpUmX63bbjko0j0NyugJPHd9b.jpg','1996-11-07',92,'Released','Murder just became a water sport.','Head Above Water',11103,4.3565,6,'eMNKYXlSjeE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13167,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116506',5.9,3306,'en','Hearts & Minds','In the final days of the pro-apartheid government, bigoted policeman and assassin Andries Fourie is assigned an undercover job. His task is to pose as a political progressive to infiltrate the African National Congress and assassinate one of the party’s leaders.','/74CK1qibFcIR45SAwLZ32cQjAZ6.jpg','1995-08-29',113,'Released',NULL,'Hearts & Minds',55146,0.952,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13168,_binary '\0','/o8RG4fTO60r0btIiICIkRJ0t7jS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116508',5.8,6204,'en','Heaven\'s Prisoners','A hardened New Orleans cop, Dave Robicheaux, finally tosses in the badge and settles into life on the bayou with his wife. But a bizarre plane crash draws him back into the fray when his family is viciously threatened.','/yUWVNHA3dVc1CmxNIcXZWqbqWc8.jpg','1996-05-17',132,'Released','For an ex-cop obsessed with an unsolved murder, trusting the wrong woman could be a deadly choice.','Heaven\'s Prisoners',36915,2.5607,5.4,'hwuRDxzitek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13169,_binary '\0','/8HFwBR7roggdQoFNbcVzR7tMfOY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116514',5.1,27277,'en','Hellraiser: Bloodline','Three generations of the same family deal with the consequences of unleashing the forces of hell.','/tCQsVackQil2fl5TzOYrCAI6All.jpg','1996-03-08',86,'Released','The past, the present and the future will all meet at the crossroads of hell!','Hellraiser: Bloodline',8766,5.2509,5.3,'NoU_IizY9GM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13170,_binary '\0','/d5eaDVIOBvpAjO4WOpDyUydXRT0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116516',5,1487,'en','Henry: Portrait of a Serial Killer, Part 2','Henry has wandered into a small town looking for work and a place to stay. He gets a job delivering and cleaning porto-potties and moves in with a co-worker until he gets his feet off of the ground. Henry and his new friend soon start to kill.','/hWI6R5iyZZNpwvvlT6q9j8QUPez.jpg','1996-10-27',87,'Released','Guess who\'s back in the neighborhood?','Henry: Portrait of a Serial Killer, Part 2',39930,2.0136,4.8,'NLpjCOMbwl0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13171,_binary '\0','/aXMQIcZ7RFYnE2PC50952msVq2E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116531',5.6,15052,'en','High School High','Richard Clark has just left the well-known Wellington Academy to teach at Marion Barry High School. Now, he will try to inspire the D-average students into making good grades and try to woo a fellow teacher.','/rVaKt2stFzTfae2VEuTz3hlF3yC.jpg','1996-10-25',86,'Released','A Dangerous Mind is a terrible thing to waste.','High School High',9308,3.5067,5.5,'R4ZUi1mEbG0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13172,_binary '\0','/5AEw3bdctSzCwweRKniKsJebaZl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116550',7.6,1269,'en','Homecoming','When their mother disappears, a group of siblings are forced to fend for themselves, and make their way on their own. They eventually meet their grandmother, a loner who is reluctant to take them in.','/nP2yQ98bzQUhL7AL1dggXDbu4zC.jpg','1996-04-14',105,'Released','She thought her life was over until they gave her a new beginning','Homecoming',113850,1.5229,7.1,'kEnuI4qzsaA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13173,_binary '\0','/sMukEdOweNU9UveS1FPTnzVpB9p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116552',5.9,17499,'en','Homeward Bound II: Lost in San Francisco','When the pets accidentally get separated from their vacationing owners, Chance, Shadow, and Sassy navigate the mean streets of San Francisco, trying to find their home across the Golden Gate Bridge. But the road is blocked by a series of hazards, both man and beast.','/kfYawa9SF9MQ3ae0TXAfhDLFGv7.jpg','1996-03-08',89,'Released','Your favorite talking animals are back!','Homeward Bound II: Lost in San Francisco',25059,8.8051,6.6,'sSfkkYgv_3o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13174,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116557',2.6,1225,'hu','Honfoglalás','Filmed in commemoration of Hungary\'s 1100th anniversary and on the sites of the actual events, a cast of thousands authentically recreates the 896 AD arrival of the Magyar chief Arpad (Nero) and his seven tribes into the Carpathian basin from the steppes.','/trBsXoZNssWpxSxeXNYdrBGfn8f.jpg','1996-12-12',109,'Released',NULL,'The Conquest',80205,2.0206,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13175,_binary '\0','/4wxCj0BIr7hGpqD7g4VkZbE5dFb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116571',5.8,9905,'en','House Arrest','High-schooler Grover Beindorf and his younger sister Stacy decide that their parents, Janet and Ned, are acting childishly when they decide to divorce after 18 years of marriage, so they lock them up in the basement until they\'ll sort out their problems.','/mpQg8IgbmrMY0skgpTXBA9EhiWy.jpg','1996-08-14',109,'Released','There\'s More Than One Way To Keep A Marriage Together...','House Arrest',18862,3.267,5.365,'RQYNVWQe9no','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13176,_binary '\0','/rQ0XmwWp9dwhnXNPlm6wN17mxoi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116581',7.4,10671,'fr','Le Huitième Jour','An unusual and wonderful friendship develops between a busy but unhappy salesman and a resident of a mental asylum.','/cgpJTvFcd0NJyJRTKYaBoLMuqdW.jpg','1996-05-22',118,'Released','What a difference a day makes…','The Eighth Day',36998,2.3928,7.322,'Q0qrryCHlZo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13177,_binary '\0','/k4HIk81b03lLeNo7I0dHxD3VPKD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116583',7,186653,'en','The Hunchback of Notre Dame','Isolated in the bell tower of Notre Dame, Quasimodo longs to experience the world beyond the cathedral walls, despite the wishes of his stern guardian, the Judge of Paris Claude Frollo. His first venture into the city leads him to Esmeralda, a fearless Romani woman whose defiance of Frollo\'s tyranny draws her—and Quasimodo—into his dangerous obsession.','/dmMBtXuFzZzLYgeQXkOkg98w2Ak.jpg','1996-06-21',91,'Released','He dared to dream, he dared to love. This is the tale of a man… and a monster.','The Hunchback of Notre Dame',10545,17.9072,7.136,'HUGraD-rxjk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13178,_binary '\0','/SC1rW5DLMX6tzKL2JyBe03fSa6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116587',5.8,1629,'en','Hustler White','Reminiscent of Sunset Boulevard, the action is transposed from the silver screen\'s old backlots to contemporary male prostitution and the pornographic industry.','/7Z6BFaSz9TBvn4EPgU2RoSTHzTp.jpg','1996-10-30',80,'Released','See it with someone you\'ve paid for','Hustler White',44497,1.8645,5.5,'_ZsZTZh981Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13179,_binary '\0','/8Z862TpwD0c9S0jWMG1Z69x3Y7F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116589',7.5,3371,'en','Hype!','This documentary examines the Seattle scene as it became the focus of a merging of punk rock, heavy metal, and innovation. Building from the grass roots, self-promoted and self-recorded until break-out success of bands like Nirvana brought the record industry to the Pacific Northwest, a phenomenon was born.','/vfR9veCwZMZXfpCF5QlnaLFoSr1.jpg','1996-11-08',84,'Released',NULL,'Hype!',30180,1.4464,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13180,_binary '\0','/rJDEAyYkKKSIrGETkbRUTNqvV0L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116592',5.3,3007,'en','I Love You, I Love You Not','A school student and her European-born grandmother share sad stories of their lives.','/aesZ94JtQFiVdvNFNbO5CSeWms2.jpg','1996-08-28',88,'Released',NULL,'I Love You, I Love You Not',45565,2.2063,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13181,_binary '\0','/5no2GArlFLbtgOkJ5qGUe59cqhE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116594',6.6,7518,'en','I Shot Andy Warhol','The story of Valerie Solanas, a \'60s radical who preached misandry in her \"SCUM\" manifesto. She wrote a screenplay for a film that she wanted Andy Warhol to produce, but he repeatedly ignored her. So she shot him.','/8BLETXcQDxooKo8NubmmJ1psIhb.jpg','1996-05-01',103,'Released','You only get one shot at fame.','I Shot Andy Warhol',26890,2.8955,6.2,'-eOQckkennE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13182,_binary '\0','/gtErXYPyXgKAFt3bTELWRJGQbOr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116601',6.5,1970,'en','I\'m Not Rappaport','Old Nat Moyer is a talker, a philosopher, and a troublemaker with a fanciful imagination. His companion is Midge Carter, who is half-blind, but still the super of an apartment house. When he is threatened with retirement, Nat battles on his behalf. Nat also takes on his daughter, a drug dealer, and a mugger in this appealing version of a really \'odd couple\'.','/1gatAVNrBnDnbbwj4FNIwlMBpUd.jpg','1996-12-24',135,'Released',NULL,'I\'m Not Rappaport',61536,2.2174,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13183,_binary '\0','/9OM746UZPI8PJxafovfNgR7IlVK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116606',4.9,4352,'en','If Lucy Fell','Joe and Lucy are roommates and best friends. Lucy, whose love life is embarrassingly dull, convinces Joe, who is infatuated with a neighbor he\'s never met, that if they don\'t have stable romances within a month, they must jump off the Brooklyn Bridge.','/l3Bwmjdon6JBDzJUA3ZSdMZZ7lI.jpg','1996-03-08',92,'Released','A comedy for the romantically challenged.','If Lucy Fell',10324,2.1939,5.4,'mok43U9zy4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13184,_binary '\0','/2VkyRkNuGIoQtqAQoSEbFWeGFlo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116607',7,5671,'en','If These Walls Could Talk','A powerful, intimate portrait of three women living in the same house during different eras who all face unplanned pregnancies. The vignettes follow a recently widowed nurse struggling to take control of her life in the early 50s, a mother of four balancing raising a family and maintaining a career in the 70s, and a student making a difficult decision with the help of one woman that will change the course of both their lives in the 90s.','/5foda9jN8pAM9zvKP5iFdITepWj.jpg','1996-09-11',97,'Released','Changing times, intimate decisions, and the four walls that hold their secrets.','If These Walls Could Talk',35203,3.7579,6.8,'ed6O609Kz_E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13185,_binary '\0','/hTofqSo4o05UOlpU79WfBAoCM9U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116621',6,9534,'en','In Love and War','After teenage ambulance driver Ernest Hemingway takes shrapnel in the leg during World War I, he falls in love with Agnes von Kurowsky, a beautiful older nurse at the hospital where he\'s sent to recover. Their affair slowly blossoms, until Hemingway boldly asks Agnes to be his wife and journey to America with him.','/rjRu7HOjXNVflUrR40eMKhvmQps.jpg','1996-12-18',113,'Released','In war they found each other...In each other they found love...','In Love and War',26949,4.5199,5.9,'S757V8461_4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13186,_binary '\0','/kFI1oF6KVnLEbUT7yLIbKXeyvu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116629',7,654833,'en','Independence Day','Strange phenomena surface around the globe. The skies ignite. Terror races through the world\'s major cities. As these extraordinary events unfold, it becomes increasingly clear that a force of incredible magnitude has arrived. Its mission: total annihilation over the Fourth of July weekend. The last hope to stop the destruction is an unlikely group of people united by fate and unimaginable circumstances.','/p0BPQGSPoSa8Ml0DAf2mB2kCU0R.jpg','1996-07-02',145,'Released','The question of whether or not we are alone in the universe has been answered.','Independence Day',602,20.0654,6.918,'B1E7h3SeMDk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13187,_binary '\0','/gLokHZ39okWFb9QL3xe8fvNAFDm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116630',8.1,16244,'ta','இந்தியன்','Senapathy, an ex-freedom fighter, is angry. He is angry against the rampant corruption at every level of the bureaucracy. He will clean it up at any cost.','/zhGayNbH2ZHWaJkhSv3qEhs5fy6.jpg','1996-05-09',185,'Released',NULL,'Indian',31521,1.5542,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13188,_binary '\0','/AGT1GHGfNFgtpELarEk8Xpy0zC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116635',6.2,2120,'en','Infinity','Story of the early life of genius and Nobel Prize-winning physicist Richard Feynman.','/45cU6BNyRGKhDQZKzVSll4eTgwh.jpg','1996-10-04',119,'Released','He was no ordinary genius. Theirs was no ordinary love.','Infinity',2033,2.6276,6.6,'_FHMeXqC1po','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13189,_binary '\0','/iK3JJvaWg67dQQyob3SqDsnQpHo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116650',7,10859,'fr','Irma Vep','A has-been French filmmaker wants a Hong Kong actress to be the heroine in a rendering of Les Vampires.','/9Z84G7mn8eS7WxiHr5CrXRrneaF.jpg','1996-10-01',99,'Released','A Latex Comedy','Irma Vep',25355,3.335,6.7,'QyhEUvjDr9A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13190,_binary '\0','/5kAeJB8wR1Be0EFG7QjKdwFfHx7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116654',4.6,38357,'en','The Island of Dr. Moreau','After surviving a plane crash caused by a magnetic storm, United Nations attorney Edward Douglas stumbles upon a mysterious island and is shocked to discover that a brilliant scientist and his lab assistant have found a way to combine human and animal DNA—with horrific results.','/hOJeQXve8W9rNRhdgC1WV3GQJyA.jpg','1996-08-23',96,'Released','Through DNA experimentation, Dr. Moreau has upset the balance of nature.','The Island of Dr. Moreau',9306,5.6934,4.9,'lJP3cb2RcII','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13191,_binary '\0','/eRxlxSj0yXe4mmRk3q1zleuLzkF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116661',6.1,1828,'en','It\'s in the Water','When hordes of gays and lesbians come out \"of the closet\" in the fictional town of Azalea Springs, Texas, intolerant residents go into a panic about the water supply.','/ti2pf9W0TeCJ4dpOcUOXGO1urHp.jpg','1997-01-30',100,'Released','An Outrageous Comedy With A Queer Little Twist','It\'s in the Water',21060,1.6382,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13192,_binary '\0','/v9wC8Rf3RHYQ6yKO4yQAlQLHSA6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116669',5.8,66509,'en','Jack','Born with a rare condition that makes him age four times faster than normal, ten-year-old Jack Powell looks like a forty-year-old man. After years of homeschooling, he enters public school for the first time, eager to make friends and live like any other kid—only to discover that growing up too fast means learning some of life’s hardest lessons early.','/9ZklgGqTljzg9VxzumbVOC1UKAs.jpg','1996-08-09',113,'Released','He\'s a healthy ten year old who\'s growing four times faster than normal. Now he\'s about to take off on the biggest adventure of his life... 5th grade.','Jack',7095,5.1009,6.283,'R2tCAybRzpY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13193,_binary '\0','/zrT2bgL7V0mzMuIUnIHrtcRibNc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116676',6,5297,'fr','Le Jaguar','A shaman from the South American rain forest visits France for a public relations campaign. In a hotel\'s elevator in Paris he meets a French good-for-nothing named Perrin he\'s fascinated with. He follows Perrin to his flat and although Perrin is not very enthusiastic about so much interest in his person, he lets the shaman spend the night in his flat. After an official meeting on the next day being part of the PR campaign the shaman suffers from a heart attack. Hardly being able to speak and laying in a hospital bed he demands to see Perrin. The latter is not very interested in meeting the shaman again. However it looks like it is to late for animosities as the shaman and Perrin seem to be tied mentally somehow since they\'ve met in the elevator.','/41j80U3fw3h7Eb8PzOVvdoLiXi6.jpg','1996-10-09',100,'Released',NULL,'Jaguar',54471,2.2809,5.707,'Ku_NhQdAPEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13194,_binary '\0','/oln1PXYVaih5uvWUCWS0p6LDa79.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116681',5.6,1222,'no','Jakten på Nyresteinen','Once 8 year old Simon gets shrunk down to a microscopic level by a talking teddy bear, he ventures into the body of his ailing grandfather in search of the source of his illness.','/wzye7VXUaBejIsOzGJfw0wCYF1P.jpg','1996-10-04',91,'Released',NULL,'Chasing the Kidneystone',56726,1.1922,6,'Nt60VFib6M4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13195,_binary '\0','/6kTLm7zfwKAgAcGnaVU0uT4QYug.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116683',6.7,79333,'en','James and the Giant Peach','When the young orphan boy James spills a magic bag of crocodile tongues, he finds himself in possession of a giant peach that flies him away to strange lands.','/vNEGobe23vW43mSPYVaVaBLP6qV.jpg','1996-04-12',79,'Released','Adventures this big don\'t grow on trees.','James and the Giant Peach',10539,7.7082,6.604,'7OKQVzOO-DM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13196,_binary '\0','/s4WgUHG8RieewPBL44i8hYrBy2m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116684',6.8,10851,'en','Jane Eyre','After a bleak childhood, Jane Eyre goes out into the world to become a governess. As she lives happily in her new position at Thornfield Hall, she meets the dark, cold, and abrupt master of the house, Edward Rochester. Jane and her employer grow close in friendship and she soon finds herself falling in love with him. Happiness seems to have found Jane at last, but could Rochester\'s terrible secret be about to destroy it forever?','/2vyt97wy8dEJYILoDoiPwTzLnzK.jpg','1996-01-20',113,'Released','The passionate tale of forbidden secrets!','Jane Eyre',47333,3.7937,6.918,'jKvO2TYPuTw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13197,_binary '\0','/5GTon2hxub294b2IeUfPRqI4rHz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116690',5.9,3005,'hi','जीत','The story of a hitman who kills for the mob, but on one job he falls madly in love with a girl, who happens to be the beautiful daughter of an associate.','/rc16sRaw8S4EnXZFcwywdks97LG.jpg','1996-08-23',170,'Released','Victory of Love','Jeet',141613,1.3226,6.417,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13198,_binary '\0','/zxHSp0F0DKdHx3OPIh1rN4zApJq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116692',7.4,4780,'de','Jenseits der Stille','Beyond Silence is about a family and a young girl’s coming of age story. This German film looks into the lives of the deaf and at a story about the love for music. A girl who has always had to translate speech into sign language for her deaf parents yet when her love for playing music grows strong she must decide to continue doing something she cannot share with her parents.','/bfNOcXDcwzKOlJoTtQM4lsEVxS1.jpg','1996-12-18',109,'Released','About life, love and the sound of snow.','Beyond Silence',312,1.7426,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13199,_binary '\0','/a66PKC32YVZISoqZtRQyz8c9Vx6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116695',7.3,316136,'en','Jerry Maguire','Jerry Maguire used to be a typical sports agent: willing to do just about anything he could to get the biggest possible contracts for his clients, plus a nice commission for himself. Then, one day, he suddenly has second thoughts about what he\'s really doing. When he voices these doubts, he ends up losing his job and all of his clients, save Rod Tidwell, an egomaniacal football player.','/lABvGN7fDk5ifnwZoxij6G96t2w.jpg','1996-12-13',139,'Released','Everybody loved him... Everybody disappeared. The journey is everything.','Jerry Maguire',9390,12.7471,7.002,'KUd3gwaf0KQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13200,_binary '\0','/rKgcBnpoHrmxCZ7edEsGhw1IEhT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116696',6.9,1615,'sv','Jerusalem','Members of a devout Christian congregation try to start a new life in Palestine.','/x0GX5ie4BGJaTin5Te4Q0HWZQ1l.jpg','1996-09-06',168,'Released',NULL,'Jerusalem',226594,1.4193,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13201,_binary '\0','/pvJhP6L8h1LHhosbt7YJBAe4W3f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116704',6.6,24491,'cn','警察故事4之簡單任務','Hong Kong cop Chan Ka-Kui returns, working with Interpol to track down and arrest an illegal weapons dealer. Chan later realizes that things are not as simple as they appear and soon finds himself to be a pawn of an organization posing as Russian intelligence.','/dOZJQTn8Ys57pH5trpG5y9DaUBq.jpg','1996-02-10',107,'Released','They thought they possessed the ultimate weapon. They hadn\'t counted on Jackie Chan.','Police Story 4: First Strike',9404,7.7832,6.505,'8DqtXHuS-rw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13202,_binary '\0','/rnn6sGMGPpM8VfVmCMFxsjKvz7q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116705',5.8,131143,'en','Jingle All the Way','Howard Langston, a salesman for a mattress company, is constantly kept busy at his job, disappointing his son. After he misses his son\'s karate exposition, Howard vows to make it up to him by buying an action figure of his son\'s favorite television hero for Christmas. Unfortunately for Howard, it is Christmas Eve, and every store is sold out of Turbo Man. Now, Howard must travel all over town and compete with everybody else to find a Turbo Man action figure.','/lHLOUt0ZIQLC5asHdIQBoTUvaEp.jpg','1996-11-21',89,'Released','Two dads, one toy, no prisoners.','Jingle All the Way',9279,12.8441,6.1,'04CWFXHYMGk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13203,_binary '\0','/ieZHOhXPnkHSaN3UNrmqZ6zjNR1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116707',5.6,15625,'en','Joe\'s Apartment','A nice guy has just moved to New York and discovers that he must share his run-down apartment with a couple thousand singing, dancing cockroaches.','/a06jrMRurcq7sYdhFK2LNs8bRt8.jpg','1996-07-26',81,'Released','Sex, Bugs, and Rock \'n Roll.','Joe\'s Apartment',11962,4.7907,5.8,'oTPMCFJW1gQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13204,_binary '\0','/tMIfgn1CeolINBBPeWSdmFrb2i3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116712',5.2,1907,'en','Once a Thief','Set in Hong Kong and Vancouver, the story follows Mac Ramsey and Li Ann Tsei, lovers and professional thieves who are separated while fleeing the powerful Hong Kong underworld crime lord who raised and trained them. After being imprisoned in Hong Kong, Mac is forcefully recruited into a clandestine international crime-fighting unit by a hard-nosed, menacing Director. He is teamed in Vancouver with Li Ann, who thought Mac was dead, and her new fiancé Victor Mansfield, an ex-cop who is attracted to the unorthodox methods of the agency. Conflict flares between Mac and Victor as the trio take on their assignment. They soon learn that their principal target is their foster brother Michael Tang, who had been given Li Ann as his future wife and who has vowed to hunt down the pair for their disloyalty to the \"family\".','/uyGoCcfK69r7Cedz36GmRx9LGO4.jpg','1996-09-29',96,'Released',NULL,'Once a Thief',39084,1.8888,4.92,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13205,_binary '\0','/mir57K4jzuIzBXSne6Wo8lLwrZg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116714',6.3,1872,'en','Johns','It\'s the day before Christmas, the day before John\'s 21st birthday. He\'s a prostitute on Santa Monica Blvd in L.A., and he wants to spend that night and the next day at the posh Park Plaza Hotel. Meanwhile, Donner, a lad new to the streets, wants John to leave the city with him. John spends the day trying to figure out how to deal with Donner\'s friendship.','/dIiAsjLNB0ud1MiwXxv1GEuuuXS.jpg','1996-12-10',96,'Released','This ain\'t no 90210','Johns',56830,4.5259,5.3,'TPSqGXFqqCI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13206,_binary '\0','/dWqE64mFDsOxkzn8Sx6pu3NEVva.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116722',6.9,11795,'en','Jude','In late 19th-century England, Jude aspires to be an academic, but is hobbled by his blue-collar background. Instead, he works as a stonemason and is trapped in an unloving marriage to a farmer\'s daughter named Arabella. But when his wife leaves him, Jude sees an opportunity to improve himself. He moves to the city and begins an affair with his married cousin, Sue, courting tragedy every step of the way.','/pK7hcjrvgRisQC7i1XwiA1B97sJ.jpg','1996-02-06',123,'Released','A time without pity. A society without mercy. A love without equal.','Jude',25147,2.8647,6.3,'tVpgRZURgsA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13207,_binary '\0','/tQy94y8ryHjoBsOo93cKZ61nlTu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116729',6.9,2216,'nl','De jurk','The story of a summer dress and those who have to do with it, especially the train conductor (played by van Warmerdam, the director). The dress functions as catalyst for the whimsical events, which turns out to be either tragic or hilarious.','/jmAQ4eXd5GCvYFrmoI0fKLr1zuD.jpg','1996-03-21',103,'Released',NULL,'The Dress',5900,1.1826,6.21,'_5jjWH7QNok','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13208,_binary '\0','/g0CGOIl3H1FDsqHpPzlfkhXAtv8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116731',5.7,22919,'en','The Juror','Struggling single mother Annie Laird impulsively agrees to serve on a jury, hoping for a little excitement in her humdrum life. But she gets far more than she bargained for when she\'s forced to sacrifice the truth to save her son from the mob\'s seductive, psychotic enforcer.','/31mRYhJvaknQx8PQnR2UV7YCkLT.jpg','1996-02-02',118,'Released','There is no defense.','The Juror',9623,6.3719,5.7,'Awng-jZnkoY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13209,_binary '\0','/wYXJEz1dIwrFdzbv8o4DgBh4c0H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116736',7,10311,'sv','Jägarna','A policeman from Stockholm come to Norrbotten in Sweden, to join his brother, now when their father is dead. While there he starts to work on a long-running case where reindeers have been poached and soon discovers that his brother is involved...','/5Ez8MDtedHPGWtkHFOKOXAJ8ns5.jpg','1996-02-02',113,'Released',NULL,'The Hunters',16003,1.5652,6.5,'YaAh-bkWmi4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13210,_binary '\0','/1bxtkatgT0zx0rQwmghJ3yOiiAA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116739',7.8,3121,'hr','Kako je počeo rat na mom otoku','On a small island in the Adriatic, tensions rise between the local population and the forces of the Yugoslav People\'s Army. The locals try to fight the enemy with song, dance, music and motivational speeches, but, major Aleksa, the head of the batallion situated on the island, threatens to blow their barracks up with everyone inside them if the civilians don\'t retreat.','/alWqkJk397BIutEhkMmw0dRIf5b.jpg','1996-11-07',97,'Released',NULL,'How the War Started on My Island',40890,1.2743,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13211,_binary '\0','/cl5PQpxudjd0xWtbCmvG2HjvPMW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116743',6,12079,'en','Kama Sutra: A Tale of Love','Tara and Maya are inseparable, with the same tastes, habits, and hobbies. Years later, the two have matured but have maintained their friendship. Tara marries local prince Raj Singh, who succeeds the throne as the sole heir. After the marriage, Raj seeks another female to satisfy his sexual desires, with his sights settling on Maya, putting a perhaps unforgivable strain on a longtime friendship.','/kUaWgLrI7HqpPqPxgR54wSGokCV.jpg','1997-02-28',113,'Released','Passion, pleasure, power','Kama Sutra: A Tale of Love',28005,3.2453,5.7,'y_52xXLw0jc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13212,_binary '\0','/caeaH63bqRSwz2BvDbZLf2srdNP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116745',6.3,5971,'en','Kansas City','A pair of kidnappings expose the complex power dynamics within the corrupt and unpredictable workings of 1930s Kansas City.','/deD8SAbQYGvzcpRr50HUb9uj8xJ.jpg','1996-08-16',116,'Released','Kansas City, 1934. Anything could happen here. One night it did.','Kansas City',22479,1.9553,6.1,'H9PFVthayBE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13213,_binary '\0','/dqcXtv7k8WbM0R9Z6Pm1wUcCQiN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116752',7.6,10806,'fi','Kauas pilvet karkaavat','The ever-poker-faced Ilona loses her job as a restaurant hostess, as her tram driver husband, Lauri, also finds himself out of work. Together they must hit the streets of Helsinki, facing up to hardship and humiliation in their quest for survival, guided through the gloom by a ray of hope.','/xxzuKTo3RNyyUGXghfVkeiSbVDt.jpg','1996-01-26',97,'Released',NULL,'Drifting Clouds',8214,2.4401,7.577,'hsRRJ2ZE03U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13214,_binary '\0','/9HguisYwGUiEE9ajopMEBmjvDwN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116754',7.4,4990,'ru','Кавказский пленник','Two Russian soldiers, one battle-seasoned and the other barely into his boots and uniform, are taken prisoner by an anxious Islamic father from a remote village hoping to trade them for his captured son.','/82WdNsibYEwZI3u3XB0ndfKKKLe.jpg','1996-03-15',99,'Released','An extraordinary story of hope, courage and humanity.','Prisoner of the Mountains',55936,1.5347,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13215,_binary '\0','/mQzeocOItlHOf26UQeYEFgAvNaJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116756',3.2,26791,'en','Kazaam','When Max fools a gang of local toughs, he finds himself in big trouble. Fleeing from the thugs, Max runs into an old warehouse and bumps into a boom box. By doing that, he manages to release Kazaam, a genie who has been held captive for thousands of years.','/k6kXq27UVxf7zGCWSvygYYIp9eP.jpg','1996-07-17',94,'Released','The world\'s most powerful genie has just met his match.','Kazaam',11511,3.5288,4.2,'fFVaxa1UKNg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13216,_binary '\0','/AXGq5mxfNFSFANjZsqwPUnb6TO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116762',5.2,1954,'en','Keys to Tulsa','Richter Boudreau is on a bad streak: Languishing in the shadow of his celebrity mother, he loses his job as a film critic for the town paper, and now he\'s been approached with a dangerous proposition that ultimately leads to blackmail. Richter\'s friend Ronnie ropes him into a scheme to steal the inheritance of his wife, Vicky.','/g3Y1t6AXTVyRrz2DOIGsBeeA3YB.jpg','1997-04-11',113,'Released','Murder. Blackmail. Deceit. ...There\'s no place like home.','Keys to Tulsa',118991,2.3364,4.7,'9MI7HF_jCqk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13217,_binary '\0','/qNFDbwgiH0Nh4hKmDX9VHnLIMUp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116763',7.4,5018,'hi','Khamoshi: The Musical','The daughter of deaf-mute parents seeks their understanding when she discovers a love for music.','/lhOkmrXgbk3U8vZkd5bkynmvdyT.jpg','1996-08-09',159,'Released',NULL,'Khamoshi: The Musical',97449,1.3371,6.783,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13218,_binary '\0','/gWl6f91JRlzZx35swdrHAR7n3b8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116767',7.4,7437,'ja','キッズ・リターン','Shinji and Masaru spend most of their school days harassing fellow classmates and playing pranks. They drop out and Shinji becomes a small-time boxer, while Masaru joins up with a local yakuza gang. However, the world is a tough place.','/pyyf9Q9eV9ug8ADxkQOZvvyWkgX.jpg','1996-07-27',107,'Released','We haven\'t even started.','Kids Return',27233,4.8031,6.9,'2KKHObkkZFk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13219,_binary '\0','/bkVq7isKuvikraOzNVjWa3q1tDK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116768',6.9,9823,'en','Kids in the Hall: Brain Candy','A pharmaceutical scientist creates a pill that makes people remember their happiest memory, and although it\'s successful, it has unfortunate side effects.','/j7LYkIa2KC98ZqZmFIjEmtvlv87.jpg','1996-04-02',88,'Released','Shove this up your mind','Kids in the Hall: Brain Candy',18414,2.8366,6.3,'FIXQBdYjAWI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13220,_binary '\0','/aZj6E0lLyfaSMEt3ZUfid6eWCN4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116770',4.5,1599,'es','La lengua asesina','A bank robber seeks refuge in a desert gas station run by nuns, awaiting her boyfriend\'s release. An alien meteorite transforms her into a flesh-craving monster with a monstrous tongue, while her poodles become drag queens.','/wSyQwNcMPNC4S9ITMSh8mRt2nwE.jpg','1996-11-15',98,'Released','The movie with outrageous taste.','Killer Tongue',36271,2.397,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13221,_binary '\0','/t8HtbS9tWWUbqI5J7hIYCspgkGI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116778',6.9,97486,'en','Kingpin','After bowler Roy Munson swindles the wrong crowd and is left with a hook for a hand, he settles into impoverished obscurity. That is, until he uncovers the next big thing: an Amish kid named Ishmael. So, the corrupt and the hopelessly naive hit the circuit intent on settling an old score with Big Ern.','/lVpejjxzBujSjLpxQ7hGe1s0wP2.jpg','1996-07-04',114,'Released','You wouldn\'t want to meet these pinheads in an alley.','Kingpin',11543,5.3478,6.5,'1DsveTPI4aM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13222,_binary '\0','/AtzbBUZ8vvXGrWOrnNvowl9Y24h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116783',6.4,4216,'en','Kissed','As a child, Sandra Larson was fixated on death. As a mortician, she discovers that her fixation goes beyond not just preparations and embalming, but into necrophilia. Medical student Matt has feelings for Sandra, but her taste in men is the barrier for their relationship.','/sLHamI4Qrtg1YyUVsMbh1diCAyg.jpg','1996-09-07',78,'Released','Love can leave you cold.','Kissed',21626,1.5898,6.4,'AakbRH_71gE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13223,_binary '\0','/q9GAThBRXMeXFLArzxt1tpbjK7E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116790',7.7,17102,'cs','Kolja','After a fictitious marriage with a Russian emigrant, Cellisten Louka, a Czech man, must suddenly take responsibility for her son. However, it’s not long before the communication barrier is broken between the two new family members.','/fB0cGiEOngfsfyDHXIpFOmEwFgi.jpg','1996-05-15',105,'Released',NULL,'Kolya',784,3.1898,7.39,'TJ7XTi9S_Ag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13224,_binary '\0','/ihH2rEO2yljzHDzSLUfVtHoqbmA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116791',5.4,3716,'de','Kondom des Grauens','In New York City, detective Luigi Mackeroni investigates a string of mysterious penile mutilations at the Hotel Quickie. After Mackeroni attempts to have a tryst with a gigolo he meets in the lobby, a carniverous condom bites off his right testicle and flees, which sets the detective off on a quest to stop the predatory prophylactic once and for all.','/miOAaZHAxPFyO79BSwndQ38iPyl.jpg','1996-08-29',120,'Released','The rubber that rubs you out!','The Killer Condom',10542,2.7586,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13225,_binary '\0','/pjno1d3ZftUY4Cym29iN2cHTHfu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116823',5.7,8343,'en','Larger Than Life','Motivational Speaker Jack Corcoran is determined to get his career off the ground, but the biggest gigs he can get are the ones nobody wants. One day, he receives a telegram that his circus clown father has passed away and left a \"huge\" inheritance: an elephant that was his father\'s pride and joy. His main intention to sell the pachyderm off, Jack must choose between loud and rude zookeeper Mo or attractive animal show owner Terry. As the two trek through the country Jack and the elephant develop a bond, and it changes his approach to life for the better.','/jdpEVxE5IUQv1qEBxWcQM49qDF9.jpg','1996-07-26',93,'Released','He\'s got 5 days to go coast-to-coast. (There\'s just one BIG problem.)','Larger Than Life',34170,4.3859,5.5,'BjM_ln1NBu8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13226,_binary '\0','/fTt5XqCMc4o8v25Xc3YuWhuPZqM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116827',5.7,4940,'en','Last Dance','Upon taking a new job, young lawyer Rick Hayes is assigned to the clemency case of Cindy Liggett, a woman convicted of first degree murder and sentenced to death. As Hayes investigates the background for her case, the two begin to form a deep friendship, while the date for her execution draws nearer.','/hsMe9TYfPs1VfpZs9xVLZBVGcES.jpg','1996-05-02',103,'Released','Sometimes justice is a crime','Last Dance',46063,3.0936,5.7,'_aLZr3oBk9E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13227,_binary '\0','/cclSlAt9MX8ztxbuTe2JxZ2oELt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116828',5.4,2094,'en','The Last Days of Frankie the Fly','Dreaming of ascending the underworld ladder and gaining revenge on his sadistic boss, Sal, a Mafia flunky, Frankie, tries to take a step in the right direction by \"saving\" an exploited, drug-addicted porn actress, Margaret.','/4TpztUZFGGy7UTdAqhZYvcBQzhn.jpg','1996-10-24',96,'Released',NULL,'The Last Days of Frankie the Fly',21119,1.9116,6.1,'5LkOTUkJK1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13228,_binary '\0','/2wpoSvwPkCMJeVTrjkMUAF5B1sW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116830',6.4,62836,'en','Last Man Standing','John Smith is a mysterious stranger who is drawn into a vicious war between two Prohibition-era gangs. In a dangerous game, he switches allegiances from one to another, offering his services to the highest bidder. As the death toll mounts, Smith takes the law into his own hands in a deadly race to stay alive.','/2cWqlkXaKKdl32Waep4FwCQnyH0.jpg','1996-09-20',101,'Released','In a town with no justice, there is only one law... Every man for himself.','Last Man Standing',9333,7.9629,6.4,'Rz4pQWEtEhg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13229,_binary '\0','/hc6YEXvbeJjWeO8AhM2ToYUfVDb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116833',6.1,2061,'en','The Last of the High Kings','It is 1977, Dublin rocks to the music of Thin Lizzy and the world is stunned by the death of Elvis Presley. Frankie, caught between acne and adulthood, has just completed his final exams in school. Convinced he will fail, he survives the summer organising a beach party, having lustful thoughts about two girls he believes are unobtainable and fending off the advances from a visiting American family friend, all whilst coping with his oddball family.','/pSdzsYKg1wpmYpflD1ZEq5Cf9rd.jpg','1996-12-06',102,'Released','When school ends... and life begins.','The Last of the High Kings',63564,2.0475,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13230,_binary '\0','/lcj8bkyEw1jqoKfxLAwPIuYmAuJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116835',6.7,4066,'en','The Late Shift','David Letterman vies with Jay Leno and his manager to succeed Johnny Carson, retiring from \"The Tonight Show.\"','/8qDU1GxN5jOkA0s4rwgaMu9hfNs.jpg','1996-02-24',95,'Released','Two heads fighting for the late night crown - One head\'s gotta roll.','The Late Shift',30330,2.4333,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13231,_binary '\0','/rCZfdhDuJJTwdUMpuaRiCm9jS0k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116839',2.6,10808,'en','Lawnmower Man 2: Beyond Cyberspace','Now a shattered mind lurking in cyberspace, Jobe plots a return by hijacking a global VR network and rebuilding himself as something far beyond human. As reality starts to glitch, a small group races to stop a digital god who no longer needs a body.','/aP8eGsCyZVCHgSMxhDa4KiC7H9B.jpg','1996-01-12',92,'Released','God made him simple. Science made him a god. Now, he wants revenge.','Lawnmower Man 2: Beyond Cyberspace',11525,4.1368,3.303,'0U1vomY6kUg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13232,_binary '\0','/y8HO4SHVyIXF7Uav0WrBkNvfO00.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116845',5.6,1714,'en','The Leading Man','A successful playwright\'s plan to leave his wife for his mistress – who is also one of the stars of his new play – is complicated by the arrival of a charismatic Hollywood star.','/whzyul1AbkQMTYfbsHeQDzzmqiS.jpg','1996-12-12',100,'Released','Indecent. Immoral. Irresistible. It\'s the role he was born to play.','The Leading Man',46338,2.0229,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13233,_binary '\0','/5xpONIe98F5zmtlyJmZRhmyrSm4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116851',7.4,4521,'fa','لیلا','This film tells the story of a semi modern Iranian couple, who are trying to fight the old beliefs and old generation. This is a failing battle because the man is not strong enough.','/xWD44o01amfOAQ2mAouIYogtS0E.jpg','1999-05-14',125,'Released',NULL,'Leila',45899,1.2766,7.5,'YHzie_ezb-E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13234,_binary '\0','/fFOjup0LziJp2QrmSmEgU2vIphT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116852',7.5,5434,'fa','لیلی با من است','During the Iran-Iraq war, a television cinematographer, having financial problems, needs to get a loan from the TV to complete his half-built flat so one of his colleagues suggests him going to the war zone under the pretext of making a documentary about the Iraqi captives for the sake of accompanying another man who is so influential in TV\'s treasury, so that he can take his loan more easily. However he doesn\'t want to get to the line of fire, his sanctimonious demeanor leads him to something more precious than what he started his journey for.','/c1X6NpO2w79uVdG0bCZiwb1xb6B.jpg','1996-02-01',90,'Released',NULL,'Leily is with Me',384295,1.0736,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13235,_binary '\0','/as1jEfdaBV8fuRrL4AFSqW1UkVD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116860',8.6,19196,'sr','Лепа села лепо горе','In the opening stages of the Bosnian War, a small group of Serbian soldiers are trapped in a tunnel by a Muslim force.','/1qiCayfLJa4VugmyqNfm1hw67RO.jpg','1996-05-11',130,'Released',NULL,'Pretty Village, Pretty Flame',29927,2.8468,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13236,_binary '\0','/heRwumGHa2WWe6Q6NRjEmQkeyec.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116882',7.3,3186,'en','Lilies','1952: Bishop Bilodeau visits a prison to hear the confession of Simon, a boyhood friend jailed for murder 40 years ago. However, once there, Bilodeau finds himself forced to watch a play put on by Simon and the other inmates depicting the two men\'s youths. As the play progresses, the tragic truth of Simon\'s crime comes to light.','/bgE2GVACHAuJNZ8WKKUm7PeMTmj.jpg','1997-01-29',96,'Released','Great Passion and Tragic Betrayal','Lilies',47643,2.0145,8.1,'XoOE7_jkf0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13237,_binary '\0','/hkkysoAJj2OzKGxueNScy8MVFdm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116883',4.9,1883,'sv','Lilla Jönssonligan och cornflakeskuppen','The young Jönsson gang\'s plan to steal \"millions of filmisar\" faces problem after problem before uncovering something much greater.','/xAqlfXN8LmSbox7DnWmZeqb9kVy.jpg','1996-11-29',90,'Released',NULL,'Young Jönsson Gang: The Cornflakes Robbery',54257,1.4807,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13238,_binary '\0','/vsxo1dkhRHd9YT9Um5IaxvnF8Yt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116905',7.4,36266,'en','Lone Star','When the skeleton of his murdered predecessor is found, Sheriff Sam Deeds unearths many other long-buried secrets in his Texas border town.','/lBxY8znsRoqa9Dy2NCe8I6GPsRm.jpg','1996-06-21',135,'Released','John Sayles invites you to return to the scene of the crime.','Lone Star',26748,3.8222,7,'plMNsde4_-M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13239,_binary '\0','/s4s38yygyyeVacxQimu0jbuPjYk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116908',6.8,93860,'en','The Long Kiss Goodnight','Samantha Caine is a small-town schoolteacher and mom with no memory of her life before washing up on a beach eight years ago. After a car accident and a violent home invasion trigger flashes of her past, she discovers she used to be a deadly CIA assassin. Teaming up with a wisecracking private investigator, Samantha must return to her old ways to take down the people who tried to erase her.','/yREdXX5lMFUKhTvb0ofI7mzUHlR.jpg','1996-10-11',121,'Released','What\'s forgotten is not always gone.','The Long Kiss Goodnight',11412,8.2495,6.6,'dYpVQraaTZ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13240,_binary '\0','/qTofO8swHYG9Dw0wE2UwbaJpuNl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116913',7.3,8896,'en','Looking for Richard','Al Pacino\'s deeply-felt rumination on Shakespeare\'s significance and relevance to the modern world through interviews and an in-depth analysis of \"Richard III.\"','/2iEgEoMP1S2YWKkYkwm8cgg2bBN.jpg','1996-10-11',112,'Released','A four hundred year old work-in-progress.','Looking for Richard',42314,2.9951,6.8,'nVgdtcNwIGQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13241,_binary '\0','/hGnJhGSeyWlerHcLNnD06sbX5wU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116922',7.6,173320,'en','Lost Highway','A tormented jazz musician finds himself lost in an enigmatic story involving murder, surveillance, gangsters, doppelgängers, and an impossible transformation inside a prison cell.','/5POhfNeFPIi4VUNwCTaK85sh98r.jpg','1997-01-15',134,'Released','A lost road on the edge of strange...','Lost Highway',638,12.2378,7.552,'TJGd5CUfar8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13242,_binary '\0','/gWLEQEFElvjpQX0IXJRmAOa4xha.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116928',5.1,1563,'en','Love Is All There Is','The Malacicis, a hard-working Italian family recently immigrated from Florence, open a fancy restaurant in the Bronx, N.Y., drawing the ire of another clan. Mike and Sadie Capomezzo, equally hard-working Sicilian caterers from the area, find they cannot stand Piero and Maria Malacici. But things get complicated when the Malacicis\' daughter, Gina, and the Capomezzos\' son, Rosario, fall in love.','/tXaewq2LMjTJmZLTuKEM6LJhBo2.jpg','1996-05-10',105,'Released','Love is all there is… until your parents find out.','Love Is All There Is',55058,2.3107,5.2,'yZXapOBN--0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13243,_binary '\0','/Aatd7pPsI3u7qlDTVxuOlkGCcFU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116930',6.7,1781,'en','Love Serenade','Two sisters in an Australian country town develop a fierce and competitive crush on their new neighbour, a brooding and self-centred radio personality.','/fXBWYmK9MybKhqvmyj57KyFEcq3.jpg','1996-10-10',101,'Released','Two sisters will do anything to hook the right man.','Love Serenade',65046,1.1199,6.1,'U-QL4Gi1Ey0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13244,_binary '\0','/uB6Eunt5h0uMcje1Pfr4MRzMRyW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116931',6.4,2219,'en','Love and Other Catastrophes','Over the course of one frantic day, five university students try to keep their heads above water.','/sO91zO8XY5o10R48RKAE6UDvJd7.jpg','1996-08-01',78,'Released','The trouble with love is, you never know where it\'s going to strike next.','Love and Other Catastrophes',76996,1.6399,5.4,'I8YVXMfc0ug','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13245,_binary '\0','/u4oRzOZ7tW23xJLRAfsZ3eCEGRg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116950',7.7,2623,'hi','माचिस','A realistic, hard-hitting portrayal of terrorism and youth in the Punjab after the 1984 riots.','/1gDubagNmgdSY98PMzU7PbAGUrJ.jpg','1996-10-25',160,'Released',NULL,'Maachis',21460,0.9823,7.5,'HVa0owi2ZP4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13246,_binary '\0','/uuPB4j1O4lz44SPpM9un8QygZym.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116953',5.4,3910,'en','Mad Dog Time','With his boss in the madhouse, a mobster is temporary boss of the criminal empire just as vicious rivals threaten the control of the empire.','/z5WQce58yyNCdKFLFWmxfmL6gtA.jpg','1996-11-08',93,'Released','No laws. No meaning. No exit.','Mad Dog Time',66034,2.9252,5.226,'5OR01NFAf0U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13247,_binary '\0','/t75JyYfgLoK6tqmGDiVP60EdNMA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116962',7.3,2456,'zh','麻將','Amid a rapidly changing cityscape, the lives of a disparate group of swindlers, hustlers, gangsters, and expats collide, with a naive French teenager and a sensitive young local who tries to protect her caught dangerously in the middle.','/mMDogr2D9FTIsA7xleOG3Lps93K.jpg','1996-12-07',121,'Released',NULL,'Mahjong',54421,1.9498,7.6,'ju3IaK3oNJI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13248,_binary '\0','/tvIZRw8AF4m1krMJWpmJDYgBad2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116985',6.6,2420,'en','Manny & Lo','A pregnant teen and her younger sister run away from foster homes and kidnap a woman whom they believe can help with the pregnancy.','/1aaykv8QSg5iXOVXcaIy1mm0qd4.jpg','1996-07-26',88,'Released',NULL,'Manny & Lo',88224,1.6354,6.3,'-lucc4SIhaY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13249,_binary '\0','/ELsTifJ2lu4vsMhoHeZ5EnncHw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116996',6.4,261190,'en','Mars Attacks!','A fleet of Martian spacecraft surrounds the world\'s major cities and all of humanity waits to see if the extraterrestrial visitors have, as they claim, \"come in peace.\" U.S. President James Dale receives assurance from science professor Donald Kessler that the Martians\' mission is a friendly one. But when a peaceful exchange ends in the total annihilation of the U.S. Congress, military men call for a full-scale nuclear retaliation.','/hll4O5vSAfnZDb6JbnP06GPtz7b.jpg','1996-12-13',106,'Released','Nice planet. We\'ll take it!','Mars Attacks!',75,13.357,6.4,'HK6moeA-w5w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13250,_binary '\0','/aoDnGTYni7wZhQJu1vHtLeVoyeU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0116999',6.7,32244,'en','Marvin\'s Room','A leukemia patient attempts to end a 20-year feud with her sister to get her bone marrow.','/lTHq1K5Y6EDRjxTBvReXHY6AKQ3.jpg','1996-12-18',98,'Released','A story about the years that keep us apart... And the moments that bring us together.','Marvin\'s Room',9819,6.1457,6.7,'XjnTcV6aJvA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13251,_binary '\0','/mErnrp6gxgSw7eYVnuos3k8EkWf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117002',5.8,16695,'en','Mary Reilly','A housemaid falls in love with Dr. Jekyll and his darkly mysterious counterpart, Mr. Hyde.','/cW5wTiv5fdtBOd22utmAIZBCMS3.jpg','1996-02-23',108,'Released','The untold story of Jekyll and Hyde','Mary Reilly',9095,4.1954,5.8,'qgHHBYzgL-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13252,_binary '\0','/t3HVA7XdVnQneMjI5hYjEhXmHY3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117008',7,198994,'en','Matilda','Matilda Wormwood is an brilliant and intelligent little girl. Unfortunately, her parents, Harry and Zinnia, fail to see that fact. As time passes, she finally starts school and has a kind teacher, loyal friends, and a terrifying, sadistic headmistress. As she becomes fed up with the constant cruelty, she discovers she has a special gift that she just might be able to use to outwit the unruly adults around her.','/wYoDpWInsBEVSmWStnRH06ddoyk.jpg','1996-08-02',98,'Released','Somewhere inside all of us is the power to change the world.','Matilda',10830,15.6906,7.19,'c2DK0o-uEnU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13253,_binary '\0','/ksFqZgH0bt9VQxRgAJ66dzYxdD9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117011',5.6,26119,'en','Maximum Risk','Alain Moreau\'s investigation into the death of his identical twin brother leads him from the beauty of the south of France to the mean streets of New York City and into the arms of his brother\'s beautiful girlfriend. Pursued by ruthless Russian mobsters and renegade FBI agents, the duo race against time to solve his brother\'s murder and expose an international conspiracy.','/18HVWwyLihWJPzGpSVl3omRRMyL.jpg','1996-09-13',100,'Released','The other side of safe.','Maximum Risk',10861,7.6735,5.8,'ssvDmR3K7UA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13254,_binary '\0','/f50cssF1I4Mxr6s1Z6HO4wPOrmY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117038',5.7,47347,'en','Michael','Tabloid reporters are sent by their editor to investigate after the paper recieves a letter from a woman claiming an angel is living with her.','/3XdsHncNxOSMOITeQBC8ML9ADky.jpg','1996-12-25',105,'Released','He\'s an angel... Not a saint.','Michael',2928,3.9158,5.7,'Tw1jwFTDrSU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13255,_binary '\0','/A4Ikk4bR7R16rMFrDUsbUrurEHM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117039',7.1,36485,'en','Michael Collins','Michael Collins plays a crucial role in the establishment of the Irish Free State in the 1920s, but becomes vilified by those hoping to create a completely independent Irish republic.','/brIBbU6t9glEGAKRTJ4PMj9OiDC.jpg','1996-10-25',132,'Released','Ireland, 1916. His Dreams Inspired Hope. His Words Ignited Passion. His Courage Forged A Nation\'s Destiny.','Michael Collins',1770,4.2364,6.9,'nvFV6xOWK9I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13256,_binary '\0','/87NFGpptRN7xnI3VfERAZEwbh7C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117040',7.9,12178,'fr','Microcosmos : Le peuple de l\'herbe','A documentary of insect life in meadows and ponds, using incredible close-ups, slow motion, and time-lapse photography. It includes bees collecting nectar, ladybugs eating mites, snails mating, spiders wrapping their catch, a scarab beetle relentlessly pushing its ball of dung uphill, endless lines of caterpillars, an underwater spider creating an air bubble to live in, and a mosquito hatching.','/OPoiGrzNr5FWoczXH5Gs1cReec.jpg','1996-09-06',80,'Released','15 years of research. 2 years of equipment design. 3 years of shooting. One great movie to restore your sense of wonder.','Microcosmos',9305,3.5889,7.6,'76R2EKEnoJQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13257,_binary '\0','/f1sqx5GudHmZv22PO78NInpbyei.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117056',7.5,3840,'fa','آینه','When a young girl\'s mother doesn\'t meet her after school, she tries to navigate the streets of Tehran by herself.','/hCCQE0qd4kKw5hElo7Mi0UTbN8c.jpg','1997-04-01',94,'Released',NULL,'The Mirror',40882,1.2485,7.3,'V7o5r37V2R0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13258,_binary '\0','/29f4MK68pkBwDzWWTmarrmzdrcn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117057',6.7,25893,'en','The Mirror Has Two Faces','Rose Morgan, who still lives with her mother, is a professor of Romantic Literature who desperately longs for passion in her life. Gregory Larkin, a mathematics professor, has been burned by passionate relationships and longs for a sexless union based on friendship and respect.','/ekk8MKMp3tlJjcMuhOgKsMCRrvR.jpg','1996-11-15',126,'Released','A story about just how wrong two people can be before they can be right.','The Mirror Has Two Faces',25189,5.0978,6.7,'FOslHESIipg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13259,_binary '\0','/sra8XnL96OyLHENcglmZJg6HA8z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117060',7.2,523461,'en','Mission: Impossible','When Ethan Hunt, the leader of a crack espionage team whose perilous operation has gone awry with no explanation, discovers that a mole has penetrated the CIA, he\'s surprised to learn that he\'s the prime suspect. To clear his name, Hunt now must ferret out the real double agent and, in the process, even the score.','/l5uxY5m5OInWpcExIpKG6AR3rgL.jpg','1996-05-22',111,'Released','Expect the impossible.','Mission: Impossible',954,24.1724,7.03,'L8Pbjh4EZRk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13260,_binary '\0','/iaJgxU9iyHpctkjAE4kVN9mIYKu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117061',5.6,1261,'en','Mistrial','When a cop-killer goes free, a detective\'s search for personal justice veers dangerously out of control. Declaring a mistrial, he takes the accused, the judge and the jury hostage...and begins a trial of his own.','/mu0R7Dx6SePsGu4Jp3c2el80kUY.jpg','1996-11-02',89,'Released','One man has taken control of the courtroom - and it isn\'t the judge.','Mistrial',291613,2.5892,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13261,_binary '\0','/hLUiE8JXZa48skCji07vG6VWfeW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117069',6.7,2458,'es','Moebius','Deep within Buenos Aires\'s labyrinthine subway system, a train mysteriously disappears along with it\'s 30 passengers. The subway officials are greatly troubled and call in topographer Daniel Pratt to help them find it. Unfortunately, the tunnels are so vast and complex, that Pratt needs his mentor Hugo Mistein to help him. Unfortunately, he too has vanished.','/snGS7VrI36KREmbfQ1xrkcq2ldS.jpg','1996-10-17',88,'Released','A disquieting metaphor of recent stories, fears, and oblivions…','Moebius',39335,1.1224,6.235,'Ed0iFVcJ81w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13262,_binary '\0','/p98VRomVosbv0xc5UIpM7HNvrQx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117070',5.2,2871,'en','Mojave Moon','Al McCord is hanging out at his favourite restaurant when he meets an attractive young woman (Ellie) who is looking for a ride from the city out into the Mojave Desert, where her mother lives. Little does he know that while Ellie is falling in love with him, he is falling for her mother (Julie), despite the nearby presence of Julie\'s boyfriend who seems likely to go berzerk at any moment. Even more strange, hilarious events follow and it\'s up to Al to find some explanation. His life may never again be the same.','/mUGMYmA11ZFnPqOJ4GdnZa2q6FU.jpg','1996-11-15',95,'Released',NULL,'Mojave Moon',24275,2.4822,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13263,_binary '\0','/m6Si2vwNCorETZape82t6iuxTj3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117071',6.4,4761,'en','Moll Flanders','The daughter of a thief, young Moll is placed in the care of a nunnery after the execution of her mother. However, the actions of an abusive priest lead Moll to rebel as a teenager, escaping to the dangerous streets of London. Further misfortunes drive her to accept a job as a prostitute from the conniving Mrs. Allworthy. It is there that Moll first meets Hibble, who is working as Allworthy\'s servant but takes a special interest in the young woman\'s well-being. With his help, she retains hope for the future, ultimately falling in love with an unconventional artist who promises the possibility of romantic happiness.','/lHVpzsvjLU7qSCB8UWFqIAavSRu.jpg','1996-06-14',123,'Released','The remarkable story of one woman\'s unbreakable spirit.','Moll Flanders',18989,3.3787,6.1,'Ac1GR0lO3hg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13264,_binary '\0','/8mk1w1friPH3yEWrIPivk1XMIf9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117073',6.2,1921,'fr','Mon homme','In Lyon, where many are unemployed, Marie is a prostitute who loves her work: she\'s thoughtful and exuberant toward clients old and young, slim or flabby. One night, a homeless man sleeps in the foyer of her apartment house; she gives him a hot meal, then a place on the floor to sleep by her radiator, then she offers herself. She falls in love, giving him new life, clothes, a place to live. When he grouses that he must bar hop while she uses the flat for her work, she finds them a larger flat. He grows restless, seducing a manicurist and pressing her to prostitution. He\'s arrested for procuring, so Marie must decide what to do; he, too, must face the consequences of his choices.','/A2vNKPMD1JnsgOV0Adimhd9vIPA.jpg','1996-01-31',99,'Released',NULL,'My Man',48709,1.9321,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13265,_binary '\0','/eCWmP3C3I4pg5kywdNCJz9khYh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117089',5.8,1782,'ja','モスラ','A new Mothra takes to the air and battles against Desghidorah to save all of humanity.','/7GYJ433TAUZbvcZDUxY71zFNAbQ.jpg','1996-12-14',104,'Released','Fight, in order to protect!','Rebirth of Mothra',36214,1.8893,6.2,'uX7xjVMsexk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13266,_binary '\0','/aViC67Gyp0BzAQjBcGJsRv2HlB0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117091',6.9,7423,'en','Mother','A neurotic, twice-divorced sci-fi writer moves back in with his mother to solve his personal problems.','/mxJJ0IEOOdvMo5yO7rcJBqyZ11n.jpg','1996-12-25',104,'Released','No one misunderstands you better.','Mother',27265,2.3492,6.8,'n3ZObZ52yxw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13267,_binary '\0','/h3j37jPImzP4HTuGJHTUDa6wxyK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117092',5,1231,'en','Mother, May I Sleep with Danger?','Laurel has the boyfriend of her dreams, Kevin. He can and will do anything for her. He is totally devoted to her but the downside is that he won\'t leave her alone. When she tries to get some distance he responds with aggressiveness. It finally dawns on Laurel that he is not good for her. Laurel\'s mother Jessica has already started to suspect that something is wrong with his background.','/pX0dedYfB66zUAFmS4zJ4VW35Np.jpg','1996-09-30',93,'Released','Alone. In love. Afraid. She gave him her heart. Now he wants her life.','Mother, May I Sleep with Danger?',133494,1.8892,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13268,_binary '\0','/xyL8QHwMdWPdFYqe7Edu8N0F4Vx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117093',7.1,5920,'en','Mother Night','An American spy behind the lines during WWII serves as a Nazi propagandist, a role he cannot escape in his future life as he can never reveal his real role in the war.','/cJtOHLb96rcLjgLS4FM9fqEKcd6.jpg','1996-11-01',114,'Released','The truth is more shocking than the uniform he wears... HE WAS AN AMERICAN SPY.','Mother Night',20318,2.3744,6.6,'KYbXUWw61ug','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13269,_binary '\0','/sNMFqW8HCorpOQYpAOGXb7ADQSV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117102',3.9,5554,'en','Mr. Wrong','A single and lonely woman finds the seemingly perfect man to date, but soon regrets it when his deranged and possessive other personality emerges and worst still, she cannot convince anyone else of his Jekyll/Hyde true nature.','/csSkKS6rcGjG8jjpwKZPVCD7Kiq.jpg','1996-02-16',96,'Released','He loved her from afar. It wasn\'t far enough.','Mr. Wrong',47475,2.5686,4.1,'CAECDKr2g5M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13270,_binary '\0','/orQzG8L1nnah4nMkVHK7SVhnrLi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117103',6.6,1525,'en','Mrs. Santa Claus','Neglected by her husband during the pre-Christmas rush, Mrs. Claus takes the reindeer and sleigh out for a drive, only to end up stranded in the neighborhood of Manhattan\'s Lower East Side.','/pEEHeB51XrPufbyUoa0W208zT2c.jpg','1996-12-08',91,'Released','Mrs. Santa Claus is doing it for herself!','Mrs. Santa Claus',110433,1.9045,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13271,_binary '\0','/2peKSpj2WqR5QxHqS1xzrwkRfNd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117104',6.3,9404,'en','Mrs. Winterbourne','Connie Doyle is eighteen, pregnant and alone. She accidentally ends up on a train where she meets Hugh Winterbourne and his wife pregnant Patricia. The train wrecks and she wakes up in the hospital to find out that it\'s been assumed that she\'s Patricia. Hugh\'s mother takes her in and she falls in love with Hugh\'s brother Bill. Just when she thinks everything is going her way, her ex-boyfriend shows up.','/egeehOmWVnXj6ohtpqUOB7Eqxe5.jpg','1996-04-19',105,'Released','The story of a girl who is going from filthy to rich','Mrs. Winterbourne',40001,3.8501,7.2,'WPLODs_yJGE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13272,_binary '\0','/3RbfSjGLDKHSvoUEVxPZHODJMXS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117107',6.3,21425,'en','Mulholland Falls','In 1950s Los Angeles, a special crime squad of the LAPD investigates the murder of a young woman.','/tT5rYDXloX5ZxISr8HdlRC9TBcP.jpg','1996-04-26',107,'Released','The power of love vs. the love of power.','Mulholland Falls',10990,5.6669,6,'4KQ4kqppxSs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13273,_binary '\0','/sihsl8L0G0RDIaKpQhNYQvIXJap.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117108',6.2,37467,'en','Multiplicity','Construction worker Doug Kinney finds that the pressures of his working life, combined with his duties to his wife Laura and daughter Jennifer leaves him with little time for himself. However, he is approached by geneticist Dr. Owen Leeds, who offers Doug a rather unusual solution to his problems: cloning.','/rlG2vi85uSEwWigVTtqDecVFTxR.jpg','1996-07-19',117,'Released','Sometimes to get more out of life, you have to make more of yourself.','Multiplicity',9304,4.2461,5.8,'SH2XDPI5664','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13274,_binary '\0','/seOhwRXVDGJilTipevwsMNGbXTh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117110',7,30418,'en','Muppet Treasure Island','Young Jim Hawkins and his two best friends, Gonzo and Rizzo, embark on a voyage across the high seas in search of buried treasure, but soon find that not everyone onboard can be trusted.','/k4KW2CUkzDKaCy4H4cS02cO8gvV.jpg','1996-02-16',100,'Released','Set sail for Muppet mayhem!','Muppet Treasure Island',10874,5.2636,6.724,'-37gsH0ideE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13275,_binary '\0','/hrqORPlqj28fg2DIff9BG17dsCh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117119',6.5,16710,'en','My Fellow Americans','They used to run the country. Now they\'re running for their lives! Two on-the-lam former Presidents of the United States. Framed in a scandal by the current President and pursued by armed agents, the two squabbling political foes plunge into a desperately frantic search for the evidence that will establish their innocence.','/AkZUWdXXuOSat3J9HaHXm7HPtqA.jpg','1996-12-20',101,'Released','A comedy about life, liberty and the pursuit of two ex-presidents.','My Fellow Americans',17795,3.456,6.069,'B8NNXi4-yxQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13276,_binary '\0','/hXD4z5xykt9G7SLXstUB96RFflh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117128',7.1,19357,'en','Mystery Science Theater 3000: The Movie','In the not-too-distant future, the evil Dr. Forrester forces a temp named Mike into a series of experiments, where he\'s forced to watch cheesy movies so the mad scientist can monitor his mind. However, as Mike can\'t control where the movies begin or end, he\'ll try to keep his sanity with the help of his robot friends.','/tlakU3uwNiUgd7aOlb2RoAsGTnY.jpg','1996-04-19',73,'Released','Every year Hollywood makes hundreds of movies. This is one of them!','Mystery Science Theater 3000: The Movie',3065,2.7379,6.6,'aJJ8RLi73xI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13277,_binary '\0','/AsiaTrhF7CXVL6WifPg45oKpl4I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117135',5.9,1737,'de','Männerpension','A support program brings the two convicts Gerd and Steinbock into the care of women. There they are supposed to prove that they are capable of integrating into society. Now Gerd stupidly kills a bar owner. This puts an end to their excursion into freedom for the time being.','/65wbEhyP1oqFQVAm3YLnN78hlMm.jpg','1996-01-31',96,'Released',NULL,'Männerpension',9269,1.2277,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13278,_binary '\0','/4GMoUtK5AX86xTvQmBFUIeELErd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117143',7,1644,'de','Nach Fünf im Urwald','Anna, 17 years old, is happy to throw her first big birthday party without her parents, but some of her guests are so stoned that they leave a big chaos and, even worse, destroy the favorite record of Anna\'s father. After the return of her shocked and angry parents, Anna runs away to Munich with her admirer Simon. They discover the nightlife jungle and get to know some typical urban guys. Meanwhile, Anna\'s parents get in touch with Simon\'s and try to find their children. On the way across Munich, they remember their own wild and restless youth…','/8ZxgQlwKItuICjzdCckuap43WqV.jpg','1996-04-18',99,'Released',NULL,'It\'s a Jungle Out There',4285,1.7023,6.788,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13279,_binary '\0','/lE2DD3iEfKuQpKDG0xtLbMhlEpf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117151',7.2,2163,'zh','南國再見，南國','In this portrait of small-time hoods rendered in rhythm-of-life anecdotal detail, Gao is the leader of a circle of layabouts including his sidekick, Flathead, and their girlfriends, Pretzel and Ling. He is also the originator of petty crime schemes, which promise to get the gang nowhere fast.','/vvBJHFW8kkMM3nQ2ny6DMMin6nD.jpg','1998-01-15',116,'Released','Fast times, easy money, big trouble.','Goodbye South, Goodbye',88811,1.5808,7,'5AGPKfx4jvg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13280,_binary '\0','/aNqkhakQaoqExxXDIXjTIkRSK1e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117179',5.7,2725,'en','Night of the Twisters','A teenager boy bonds with his stepfather while battling a series of killer twisters.','/ht5Xjl6tz0ocJW9RRPN8JljN4cp.jpg','1996-02-18',92,'Released',NULL,'Night of the Twisters',34138,2.2741,6.3,'TPXe3mzWqvA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13281,_binary '\0','/wrVBnOukdFzhqXc6abyiUTJtGPB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117191',6.6,3593,'en','No One Would Tell','Shy sixteen-year-old Stacy Collins can\'t believe that the most popular guy in school, an attractive athlete named Bobby Tennison, is interested in her. At first she is flattered by his constant attention, but then he becomes possessive and jealous-telling her who she can speak to and what she can wear. Threats escalate into violence when Bobby thinks Stacy has stepped out of line. Soon she is walking on egg shells and living in fear. Having seen the tell-tale bruises, Stacy\'s best friend convinces her to break things off with Bobby-but in a moment of weakness, Stacy goes to meet him. It will be the last time she is seen alive.','/4Iv7BLGEAVaU4KvAMD1hc1G6D6M.jpg','1996-05-06',88,'Released','Jealousy is Dangerous. Obsession is Deadly.','No One Would Tell',72116,2.6895,6.97,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13282,_binary '\0','/teoJwthThy12cy2Rel4MCwMRFjm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117193',5.1,3079,'en','No Way Back','When FBI Agent Zack Grant\'s partner is killed during a blown-up operation, he attempts to find the person responsible. Mafioso Frank Serlano believes Zack is responsible for his only son\'s death in the same operation and kidnaps Zack\'s son to hold as bait. The action gets wild when airline stewardess Mary is taken hostage to add what seems an another insurmountable problem for Zack. There appears to be no way out.','/hrMnjNApBeCCsifs6mztF2YnFm4.jpg','1995-05-12',91,'Released',NULL,'No Way Back',37431,2.9399,4.8,'k5_0IvsJOmc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13283,_binary '\0','/9eVTF4sZccPMHdi7b1ccqPcUGz2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117194',6.7,2060,'en','No Way Home','An ex-con\'s future is threatened by his brother\'s involvement with drugs.','/eq4VgCeSs5gMP5QeyxpIYlUaVR4.jpg','1997-01-23',102,'Released','Blood ties can be murder.','No Way Home',100167,2.1403,6.2,'DZP0a8gT3GI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13284,_binary '\0','/p01cByRs1xJsBhNgnQtX7BzlkJY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117201',6,2984,'en','Norma Jean & Marilyn','This film follows Norma Jean from her simple, ambitious youth to her sex star pinnacle and back down. She moves from lover to lover in order to further her career. She finds fame but never happiness, only knowing seduction but not love.','/uQ1ZrGxA0N6cgeTTl1vZhrdp30C.jpg','1996-05-18',139,'Released','Marilyn Monroe was our fantasy. Norma Jean was her reality.','Norma Jean & Marilyn',41127,1.7966,6.1,'10XPTMTtY6U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13285,_binary '\0','/qyUNaqLMVUfST6CSVN39g0yHyj5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117202',6.3,2705,'en','Normal Life','Chris Anderson and his wife Pam live a fairly normal life until Chris loses his job on the police force and secretly turns to robbing banks to make his wife\'s dreams come true. Upon discovering his secret, she joins his deadly crime wave and together they terrorize an unsuspecting suburban town.','/keQ3yXWkPN1tmKt45bFBtGVokSG.jpg','1996-01-26',101,'Released','Love was their addiction, crime was the drug.','Normal Life',23223,2.1097,5.959,'eZB90dRD79w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13286,_binary '\0','/8w8DjWOz3RFyw1cneE8YvzA56kz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117214',7.7,5303,'fa','نون و گلدون','A semi-autobiographical account of an incident in Makhmalbaf\'s life when, as a 17-year-old, he stabbed a policeman at a protest rally. Two decades later, he tracks down the policeman he injured in an attempt to make amends.','/jBgImBSOFUJg8voD7xbLqS1s1tf.jpg','1997-04-09',78,'Released',NULL,'A Moment of Innocence',43976,2.0468,7.558,'p5HJPyLz8rA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13287,_binary '\0','/gHFuLHxruielBcMEZx1WowxbRWS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117218',5.7,132527,'en','The Nutty Professor','When beautiful Carla Purty joins the university faculty, genetic professor Dr. Sherman Klump grows desperate to whittle his 400-pound frame down to size and win her heart. So, with one swig of his experimental fat-reducing serum, Sherman becomes \'Buddy Love\', a fast-talking, pumped-up, plumped down Don Juan.','/fMtb5aZoLRNbMnCkatFsTmPRfl5.jpg','1996-06-28',95,'Released','Inside Sherman Klump, a party animal is about to break out.','The Nutty Professor',9327,9.7639,5.649,'FFVbS0qm0TI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13288,_binary '\0','/mcphcFaLjbhTaQdzWmNe1vLaLsU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117221',6.9,2000,'fr','Nénette et Boni','Teenage siblings Nenette and Boni were raised apart as a result of their parents\' divorce. Their mother, who doted on her son Boni, has died. He works for an interesting couple as a pizza baker, and is surprised and enraged when his younger sister, having run away from boarding school, suddenly turns up. There\'s a problem that they must confront.','/4tiYchxwSkLI80TaAgmHLUEBx0B.jpg','1997-01-29',99,'Released',NULL,'Nenette and Boni',99002,1.8888,6.5,'tQK6omIiKTg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13289,_binary '\0','/rDRBp8SrUfndHAnP7siwGGARu0N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117238',4,3476,'en','Omega Doom','After earth is taken over by an army of robots, the small number of humans left are forced into hiding. In the nuclear winter, only droids walk the face of the earth, in fear of the rumored human resurgence, and in search of a hidden cache of weapons. One robot, his evil circuits destroyed, enters a small town where a robot civil war is taking place.','/yLXlIJIGmlDZMPbGaQ1l55vhCap.jpg','1996-10-21',84,'Released','Robots rule the Earth. Only one man can stop them.','Omega Doom',17135,1.4924,4.5,'aVrw1tFY4QQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13290,_binary '\0','/5GVVMB1YGU8mNfNK6f3ob1Yt8uR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117247',6.5,51044,'en','One Fine Day','Melanie Parker, an architect and mother of Sammy, and Jack Taylor, a newspaper columnist and father of Maggie, are both divorced. They meet one morning when overwhelmed Jack is left unexpectedly with Maggie and forgets that Melanie was to take her to school. As a result, both children miss their school field trip and are stuck with the parents. The two adults project their negative stereotypes of ex-spouses on each other, but end up needing to rely on each other to watch the children as each must save his job. Humor is added by Sammy\'s propensity for lodging objects in his nose and Maggie\'s tendency to wander.','/5NiRRR7JDNHOr21JNoGRxPWh9vb.jpg','1996-12-20',108,'Released','She was having a perfectly bad day... Then he came along and spoiled it.','One Fine Day',7300,5.579,6.5,'BJjj_v33mTs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13291,_binary '\0','/yowGMmlfVvqwPZWiZJrG1fBaa6V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117260',5.7,2246,'es','Original Gangstas','The Rebels rule the streets of Gary, Indiana. They shoot storekeeper Marvin Bookman for giving the police information about a drive-by shooting they committed. Marvin’s son, former NFL star and Rebel founder John returns to be with his father and, with a little help from some friends, to destroy the gang his way.','/uirrsTZmoPmscHZdyWz4tiXVqHE.jpg','1996-05-10',99,'Released','The original bad boys are stepping up in \'96!','Original Gangstas',40507,2.0987,5.6,'FLqNi-Um33c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13292,_binary '\0','/vrMDCQoaBlidRk42DciUD9DgIbZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117273',8,1285,'sl','Outsider','A teenager, son of an army officer moves with his family to Ljubljana in the fall of 1979. In the new surroundings, he\'ll fall in love, make friends and discover the world of punk rock. The latter will put him into the troubles with his strict father.','/pUMqhD140eFb2k3QcNDtvV9qel3.jpg','1997-02-13',100,'Released',NULL,'Outsider',152861,0.7677,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13293,_binary '\0','/srCUjSUPXaMad9X3Zz3XlMBlS6A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117283',5,11466,'en','The Pallbearer','Aspiring architect Tom Thompson is told by mysterious Ruth Abernathy that his best friend, \"Bill,\" has taken his own life. Except that Tom has never met Bill and neither have his incredulous friends. So when Tom foolishly agrees to give the eulogy at Bill\'s funeral, it sets him on a collision course with Ruth -- who is revealed to be Bill\'s oversexed mother -- and Julie DeMarco, the longtime crush Tom hasn\'t seen since they were teens.','/zwHI9B3kcj3WqZoE2LaLDi6ZeAO.jpg','1996-05-03',97,'Released','Something magical is about to unfold in the most unexpected place.','The Pallbearer',23570,3.2561,5,'2Qq2LmclTw8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13294,_binary '\0','/fvD78gniQUBZ4RvRjW35hQZRQMD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117284',6.5,2658,'en','Palookaville','Jerry and his two pals, Russ and Syd, are just looking for some easy money to help them break out of their nowhere lives in their nowhere town. Despite a bungled jewelry store heist which exposes their incompetence as criminals, a fateful event (and an old black-and-white film) convinces them that they can pull off an armored-truck robbery. While they are busy plotting their caper, their dysfunctional families spin out of control, all around them.','/vmlO5CbUKmqvn5BVtEprxAmNOkp.jpg','1996-10-25',92,'Released','One foot in the door. The other one in the gutter.','Palookaville',37616,1.9613,5.9,'70mmikY8rd0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13295,_binary '\0','/9M6NsVPnxVtlY5JqSJ1TL2ev3QI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117287',6.8,2498,'en','The Paper Brigade','A 14 year old boy named Gunther moves to a small town with his parents and little brother. He meets up with a group of overly charitable paper boys who want him to sub for their friend while he\'s out of town. Gunther agrees so he can get enough money for concert tickets to take his blonde and beautiful crush too, all the while dealing with Chad, her wannabe boyfriend and his bully friends. All in all, Gunther learns to respect himself and other people and to have fun during it all.','/qV8wZhGUAm6WJ0V5XeIJgScAIYW.jpg','1996-09-25',90,'Released','The line is drawn, the sides are packed, the soldiers are in place. The war has begun!','The Paper Brigade',64265,1.9526,6.9,'DItquit7A7Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13296,_binary '\0','/sOFwEeWmlQufAQwLH7OXnw2oLlj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117293',8.2,19835,'en','Paradise Lost: The Child Murders at Robin Hood Hills','A horrific triple child murder leads to an indictment and trial of three nonconformist boys based on questionable evidence.','/h65fwEQTv9zRNyEuExE1wAk5CQ2.jpg','1996-12-03',150,'Released','Witchcraft or witch hunt?','Paradise Lost: The Child Murders at Robin Hood Hills',17204,2.099,7.6,'Tfj_bVIwyeA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13297,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117315',7.4,1819,'fa','پدر','Mehrollah is a 14-year-old boy who is forced to find a job to support his family after his father dies. He travels to the southern parts of Iran, looking for work. Upon his return to his hometown, he notices certain changes in his family.','/fQ0QpeJOO6EdBWp3dx24QJpdDtE.jpg','1999-02-10',91,'Released',NULL,'The Father',47100,0.8154,7.15,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13298,_binary '\0','/9oxTuL6on1LBalFyzP6cIp6eUwu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117318',7.3,106828,'en','The People vs. Larry Flynt','Larry Flynt is the hedonistically obnoxious, but indomitable, publisher of Hustler magazine. The film recounts his struggle to make an honest living publishing his girlie magazine and how it changes into a battle to protect the freedom of speech for all people.','/sAgHn7ys6TiVXBDTZ0UBEjinIUk.jpg','1996-12-25',130,'Released','You may not like what he does, but are you prepared to give up his right to do it?','The People vs. Larry Flynt',1630,8.0395,7,'OPqDVSUM5gs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13299,_binary '\0','/jeVion38tN3JVaAB44EhiBSbXC1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117331',5.1,37998,'en','The Phantom','The 21st successor to the role of Bengalla\'s resident superhero must travel to New York to prevent a rich madman from obtaining three magic skulls that would give him the secret to ultimate power.','/8k8RSMkmGR9Lp6FbKtithM3KIQb.jpg','1996-06-06',100,'Released','Slam evil!','The Phantom',9826,6.0902,5.325,'cN5wUTSPxZ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13300,_binary '\0','/15JUzyooElSbMXXYl2gnHX62A7X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117333',6.5,90705,'en','Phenomenon','An ordinary man sees a bright light descend from the sky, and discovers he now has super-intelligence and telekinesis.','/5eK1HNf0Kl2vDPOeqf1kX4SKxrw.jpg','1996-07-05',123,'Released','Some things in life just can\'t be explained.','Phenomenon',9294,8.1687,6.5,'apduYg2VqTI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13301,_binary '\0','/w50UAuXUBtnGsHY0HREAs2nkEfv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117338',7,3013,'ja','PiCNiC','Believing that the world will end that very day, three mental patients Coco, Tsumuji, and Satoru set out upon a journey. Walking upon the tops of the walls of the city, they seek to find a picnic spot with the best vantage point to view the final event.','/pyQ75I3hrsuAgOd4Ny12v1W8MzJ.jpg','1996-06-15',72,'Released','I know when the world will end.','Picnic',40886,2.5232,6.8,'3VqMin8ChFM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13302,_binary '\0','/5zG8ysekUjEgf4Xf4c4YdOjJQ0e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117342',4.2,2744,'en','Pinocchio\'s Revenge','Defense attorney Jennifer Garrick acquires a Pinocchio puppet from a condemned serial killer. Her pre-teen daughter, Zoe, mistakes the puppet as a birthday present and grows attached to her new friend. Suddenly, accidents begin to happen to those who cross Zoe. Zoe claims it\'s her Pinocchio doll but her therapist thinks otherwise. Pinocchio promises he\'ll behave if Zoe will cut his strings...','/cdR1GDOzcnKGPrZSL5Lx73vh07l.jpg','1996-10-07',95,'Released','Evil comes with strings attached.','Pinocchio\'s Revenge',30926,2.9166,4.5,'homg6Vqy6bo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13303,_binary '\0','/khRkXzvfzgE9vdcitDdUnmeFg6n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117350',2.7,4165,'en','Plump Fiction','Four stories intersect in this violent film parody. Exterminators dress as hit men and try to protect the wife of their boss, Montello. Meanwhile, the strippers at Montello\'s strip club, dressed as nuns, attempt to rob him. Tag-team wrestlers steal Montello\'s briefcase, thinking its contents are valuable. Finally, Bumpkin, running to deliver a script, loses a lot of the pages.','/hVpAdZmLjgLI6onq2UDdLvg4lrs.jpg','1997-05-01',82,'Released','From the producers who saw Pulp Fiction, Reservoir Dogs & Braveheart.','Plump Fiction',39411,2.3196,3.733,'R2KZZ4TFEWs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13304,_binary '\0','/A1mjezoHH1SwKGNDYfRhSO3snQF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117351',5.8,1340,'fr','Le Plus Beau Métier du monde','To be closer to his children following his divorce, Laurent Monier, a history and geography teacher in a peaceful provincial high school, accepts a position in a sensitive college in the Paris suburbs. He is assigned the hardest class, the fourth techno, and he finds an apartment in the Cité des Muriers, a particularly difficult district.','/wiO6LZ6FyHkqTBklR011vlkEZyK.jpg','1996-12-11',105,'Released',NULL,'The Best Job in the World',40089,2.222,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13305,_binary '\0','/jH0AM4Z928cDooUTtIXjXUveGAe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117359',7.5,5117,'fr','Ponette','After losing her mother in a car accident that leaves her with a broken arm, 4-year-old Ponette struggles with anguish and fear. Left by her father with a caring aunt and her children, Ponette grieves, secretly hoping her mother will somehow come back. Confused by the religious explanations provided by adults, and challenged by the cruel taunts of a few children at school, little Ponette must make her way through her emotional turmoil.','/p6ZlnYATJvYZtcQr6RDmzplq3hX.jpg','1996-09-25',97,'Released',NULL,'Ponette',38523,1.9911,7.398,'sgXbG12kJXI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13306,_binary '\0','/8Dc6WVeJjJcl9muNJmuuoOgkiB7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117364',6.2,13594,'en','The Portrait of a Lady','Ms. Isabel Archer isn\'t afraid to challenge societal norms. Impressed by her free spirit, her kindhearted cousin writes her into his fatally ill father\'s will. Suddenly rich and independent, Isabelle ventures into the world, along the way befriending a cynical intellectual and romancing an art enthusiast. However, the advantage of her affluence is called into question when she realizes the extent to which her money colors her relationships.','/yoUuMtWTQXzfARYE0nF7Nn7gRuS.jpg','1996-10-17',144,'Released',NULL,'The Portrait of a Lady',36758,5.0633,5.9,'kAkTcfZus8s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13307,_binary '\0','/nFt2ZMXzo9WiNCZ8cfGxaeBVEII.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117372',5.8,15240,'en','The Preacher\'s Wife','Good-natured Reverend Henry Biggs finds that his marriage to choir mistress Julia is flagging, due to his constant absence caring for the deprived neighborhood they live in. On top of all this, his church is coming under threat from property developer Joe Hamilton. In desperation, Biggs prays to God for help – which arrives in the form of an angel named Dudley.','/z1mU4g9poAgoDQRNLcfNdj3iiMs.jpg','1996-12-13',123,'Released','They needed help. What they got was a miracle.','The Preacher\'s Wife',21539,5.2902,5.8,'kYIFhk4lutY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13308,_binary '\0','/dZM71rHXh3Oo3WZlw8YpMMsoVB5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117381',7.7,296921,'en','Primal Fear','Defense attorney Martin Vail takes on jobs for money and prestige rather than any sense of the greater good. His latest case involves an altar boy, accused of brutally murdering the archbishop of Chicago. Vail finds himself up against his ex-pupil and ex-lover, but as the case progresses and the Church\'s dark secrets are revealed, Vail finds that what appeared a simple case takes on a darker, more dangerous aspect.','/qJf2TzE8nRTFbFMPJNW6c8mI0KU.jpg','1996-04-03',130,'Released','Sooner or later, a man who wears two faces forgets which one is real.','Primal Fear',1592,17.6171,7.66,'dUzCu3LntU8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13309,_binary '\0','/yt89UgjbVUK021vK5prZDNO1ZZG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117394',7.1,2519,'es','Profundo carmesí','Driven by desire and desperate for self-love, Coral and Nicolás will abandon their past lives in a journey surrounded by murder.','/wxfwz8uObOEUyd5ECMAGl9aFYUj.jpg','1996-10-04',111,'Released',NULL,'Deep Crimson',47007,2.0875,6.8,'h9-SqFDT010','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13310,_binary '\0','/4Tw3kivygpKVgps0CDClOAkLSWy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117397',5.4,3535,'en','Project: ALF','Six years ago, the lovable intergalactic fugitive Gordon Shumway, best known as ALF, was on his way back to his new home when the Alien Task Force finally caught up with him. Now, he is being studied at a top-secret military base where he finds allies who feel that ALF\'s existence should be announced to the world to ensure his safety... especially when they learn that the abrasive Colonel Milfoil wants ALF, and all Alien Life-Forms, destroyed.','/bkvLzCLdVme61llHl5yWgC09NUT.jpg','1996-02-17',95,'Released','Call the government! Alert the media! Hide the cat! ALF\'s back!','Project: ALF',10960,4.316,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13311,_binary '\0','/1B5aXOwtCGicwd2gEiH45flqtrW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117398',7.7,9064,'fr','La Promesse','Igor, aged 15, and his father Roger deal in housing and peddling illicit labor in the outlying districts of Liege, Belgium. Scams, lies and swindling rule their lives. When one of his father’s illegal workers gets injured on the job and asks Igor to promise to take care of his wife and baby, Igor finds himself at a crossroad. He wants to keep the promise, but the price would be to betray his father.','/pmGx73cJ3gVCCli1JAVQOaLbdnY.jpg','1996-08-07',94,'Released',NULL,'La Promesse',24183,1.4849,7.2,'OsOi17HJZ5k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13312,_binary '\0','/1ZJlf0fxLRRrAn39guNvJi4e7Im.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117407',7.3,52995,'da','Pusher','A drug pusher grows increasingly desperate after a botched deal leaves him with a large debt to a ruthless drug lord.','/9Myfvq4e2BySE5aosX8UzV9cUME.jpg','1996-08-30',110,'Released','You don\'t have a chance. Seize it!','Pusher',2061,5.0803,7,'AEIwMsqee-A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13313,_binary '\0','/zJ20Fq7n7jSxZKVQzDPgUtzXPYc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117412',5.8,2067,'fr','Pédale douce','A closeted gay man\'s attempt to \"act straight\" for the sake of his job has unexpected consequences.','/eTsacNYD4grU2dAnINLUcttxzY2.jpg','1996-03-27',100,'Released',NULL,'What a Drag',31789,1.458,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13314,_binary '\0','/vY89P28kXOJCJDfbgjibKqFCydL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117420',5.6,30376,'en','The Quest','Ghang-gheng, the ancient winner-take-all competition in which the deadliest fighters from around the world employ the most spectacular feats of martial arts skills ever displayed in order to win the prized Golden Dragon. But fighting prowess alone will not be enough for Chris to triumph over such daunting foes.','/xMDo0ewl6XMZei44UNGMfho6eBq.jpg','1996-04-19',95,'Released','A lost city. A man of destiny. A test of honor.','The Quest',9103,5.5171,6.217,'EaCbSlAsQoE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13315,_binary '\0','/6vfsrnXNROHFBlNNGYURfiS5Qtl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117427',5.4,3618,'en','Race the Sun','A bunch of high school misfits in Hawaii, introduced by their new teacher, attend a science fair in which they draw up inspiration to build their own solar car and win a trip to compete in the 1990 World Solar Challenge in Australia.','/jQA7TXgmEi35Zab6fHQ8VZ7Zhfn.jpg','1996-03-22',100,'Released','A dream can make all the difference under the sun.','Race the Sun',55731,2.1936,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13316,_binary '\0','/20iAq3KbalEdV7ODys9YnE7RnBV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117437',6.1,9391,'hi','Raja Hindustani','Raja, a taxi driver, falls in love with Aarti, a rich girl, and marries her against her parents\' wishes. Later, her stepmother tries to create a rift betweenthe couple.','/m4Uy3dHYmnYgvZ0U2xK5alazBFR.jpg','1996-11-15',177,'Released',NULL,'Raja Hindustani',21566,1.8412,6.411,'UysNzAH4xHc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13317,_binary '\0','/AtHEEiHtD31xazyEvYdmk4Pj6o2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117438',6.7,145370,'en','Ransom','When a rich man\'s son is kidnapped, he cooperates with the police at first but then tries a unique tactic against the criminals.','/4nmOA5ZOY2VlHzwSlKY03sF2JUz.jpg','1996-11-08',121,'Released','Someone is going to pay.','Ransom',3595,6.9852,6.697,'fIo43xs25DQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13318,_binary '\0','/6EUUTvqO8FGmbzgMkbWHplivg8n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117442',6.9,4274,'en','Rasputin','Into an era seething with war and revolution, a man comes with an incredible power to heal a nation...or destroy it. Based on the true story of one of the most powerful and mysterious figures in Russian history.','/16UlqPiJA5WTGzrLjth05xSHcfd.jpg','1996-03-23',100,'Released','He Was A Magician. A Madman. A Savior And Seducer....','Rasputin',46827,2.1325,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13319,_binary '\0','/gEFcbU6SayYOcQjd5YPP44Y1pqf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117450',7.6,3327,'en','Rebound: The Legend of Earl \'The Goat\' Manigault','A dramatization of the life of Earl \'The Goat\' Manigault (Don Cheadle), with a lot of factual based occurrences. A reformed junkie returns from prison to clean up his act and devote the rest of his life to the young kids of Harlem. 1996 was the 25th anniversary of the first tournament named after him.','/x37YaL5yrmNMX8LvJAKNIjIpIxQ.jpg','1996-11-23',120,'Released',NULL,'Rebound: The Legend of Earl \'The Goat\' Manigault',29804,2.5078,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13320,_binary '\0','/64Vc3NnoUrcSWvdEZ3H41JIQT1y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117468',6.2,7300,'en','Retroactive','A psychiatrist makes multiple trips through time to save a woman that was murdered by her brutal husband.','/7kOHEXDUTyyQQmI1VES1JofgPbj.jpg','1997-02-21',91,'Released','On a lonely Texas road, time, space and murder are about to collide.','Retroactive',26689,2.4013,6.156,'Hnb65cgl2xI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13321,_binary '\0','/xScMrgLKcS3Uk0Sm21E38s6XuYF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117473',5.3,3704,'en','The Rich Man\'s Wife','A rich man\'s wife finds she has a bad prenuptial agreement with an even worse husband. Over drinks with a stranger, she fantasizes about doing her husband in to void the prenup — but much to her surprise, the stranger decides to turn her imagination into reality.','/uE7BXhR6QkSGCIK6gTPGfFRAggY.jpg','1996-09-13',94,'Released','Someone Is Playing A Very Deadly Game...','The Rich Man\'s Wife',44465,2.7723,5.4,'NGCcCuY00OE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13322,_binary '\0','/azaAwIh1G7MrqhflrmXmSdD03mT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117477',7.3,8593,'fr','Ridicule','To get royal backing on a needed drainage project, a poor French lord must learn to play the delicate games of wit at court at Versailles.','/j78rRskAapKtILalcxAmdskGtzb.jpg','1996-05-09',102,'Released','Wit is the ultimate weapon.','Ridicule',12709,2.3981,6.945,'IICdZuA97hY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13323,_binary '\0','/ynpag8C3nhpPrHIghrKH6kKXOSO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117496',6,14736,'en','Robinson Crusoe','Robinson Crusoe flees Britain on a ship after killing his friend over the love of Mary. A fierce ocean storm wrecks his ship and leaves him stranded by himself on an uncharted island. Left to fend for himself, Crusoe seeks out a tentative survival on the island, until he meets Friday, a tribesman whom he saves from being sacrificed. Initially, Crusoe is thrilled to finally have a friend, but he has to defend himself against the tribe who uses the island to sacrifice tribesman to their gods. During time their relationship changes from master-slave to a mutual respected friendship despite their difference in culture and religion.','/93uRPzVpf4ZVjDfswmpsrAmBS4w.jpg','1997-06-11',92,'Released','One survivor. One island. One warrior. Two men, against all odds.','Robinson Crusoe',11210,5.2089,6,'3nXblCMnetI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13324,_binary '\0','/qDVdTL1KqGmGLGsy7UPA3vksku7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117500',7.4,384602,'en','The Rock','When vengeful General Francis X. Hummel seizes control of Alcatraz Island and threatens to launch missiles loaded with deadly chemical weapons into San Francisco, only a young FBI chemical weapons expert and notorious Federal prisoner have the skills to penetrate the impregnable island fortress and take him down.','/eBcoxveWzzXQrCrwWMGAROcqgpP.jpg','1996-06-07',137,'Released','Alcatraz. Only one man has ever broken out. Now five million lives depend on two men breaking in.','The Rock',9802,15.5592,7.2,'a3qcNyjj9ZQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13325,_binary '\0','/hoQBa4EK6KFS31sPBND9zMjARfb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117509',6.7,263543,'en','Romeo + Juliet','In this contemporary take on William Shakespeare\'s classic tragedy, the Montagues and Capulets have moved their ongoing feud to the sweltering suburb of Verona Beach, where Romeo and Juliet fall in love and secretly wed. Though the film is visually modern, the bard\'s dialogue remains.','/dJCDUkXhfRdc4q8e4VCKEBbqzBT.jpg','1996-11-01',120,'Released','My only love sprung from my only hate.','Romeo + Juliet',454,12.4215,6.776,'oO4jqwpt25k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13326,_binary '\0','/7Ml26p2bpOCvEEfdEoKkx6dWwAK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117533',5.8,2085,'en','Sabotage','Former special services agent plays an intricate game of chess involving several federal agencies. Queen takes pawn.','/TuYneVBXjBO3j970nXAA7Xt1LO.jpg','1996-03-07',96,'Released','The Dark Heart Of The Black Ops Beats To A Secret Agenda.','Sabotage',81778,2.3431,5.642,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13327,_binary '\0','/3nJD6oMaLNRwa6QjHTqGZaxBu8X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117534',6.1,8538,'en','Sabrina the Teenage Witch','A girl, sent by her parents to live with her two eccentric aunts, finds out on her sixteenth birthday that she is a witch.','/esmArJK1cb9xsWphfPWNREN6Gg6.jpg','1996-04-07',91,'Released','Do homework, buy prom dress, learn how to fly.','Sabrina the Teenage Witch',15674,3.2454,6.7,'JpwtZ4o44zg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13328,_binary '\0','/36rsCCD7mDABWe3ESiaUYyotGWX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117550',2.7,9956,'en','Santa with Muscles','A heartless millionaire believes he is Santa Claus after an accident renders him amnesiac.','/ldxrT4FkyJWENpqy0ZucCu1HgAj.jpg','1996-11-08',98,'Released','He\'s arrived in the St. Nick of time!','Santa with Muscles',31388,2.7783,3.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13329,_binary '\0','/2RzGLyhkW5FfAy0cMHSR1f65Kh3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117555',8.1,2611,'bs','Savršeni krug','An alcoholic Bosnian poet sends his wife and daughter away from Sarajevo so they can avoid the troubles there. However, he is soon descended upon by a pair of orphaned brothers. The brothers have escaped a massacre in their own village and have come to the Bosnian capital in search of a long lost Aunt. The poet befriends the boys and together they try to survive the horror of the siege of Sarajevo.','/nz817P2e8wS7JPIiY5QyKv5myCz.jpg','1997-09-10',110,'Released',NULL,'The Perfect Circle',49807,1.2704,6.952,'0GFyJlptAWY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13330,_binary '\0','/6nYzuMifSK2vOYost6j3TB97YEf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117561',6.7,6410,'en','Schizopolis','A man works for the unpleasant guru of a Scientology-like movement.','/9ASmg9EvWkt90dwW9YKO3NXQk8d.jpg','1997-04-02',99,'Released','Come early! Come often!','Schizopolis',16375,1.7535,6.3,'f2E7ArARdaE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13331,_binary '\0','/4w6nQYAY0eb7B0VVRDXilXcgAUV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117571',7.4,453242,'en','Scream','A year after the murder of her mother, a teenage girl is terrorized by a masked killer who targets her and her friends by using scary movies as part of a deadly game.','/lr9ZIrmuwVmZhpZuTCW8D9g0ZJe.jpg','1996-12-20',112,'Released','Someone has taken their love of scary movies one step too far. Solving this mystery is going to be murder.','Scream',4232,20.1177,7.436,'U0LETmDvuXc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13332,_binary '\0','/kJQcCV8jr5JQGjy04rTRKuPJDt7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117577',6,2105,'en','The Search for One-eye Jimmy','While working on a documentary on his old neighborhood, a young film school graduate shifts the focus of his production onto the disappearance of a local resident and the strange characters who are conducting the search to find him.','/da9r0FJxecJvLK6X5iqirRLMxks.jpg','1994-11-09',85,'Released',NULL,'The Search for One-eye Jimmy',67365,1.3173,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13333,_binary '\0','/kTnmYqmAi9GrN0fMy29QU3vtBF0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117581',3.5,1571,'en','The Secret Agent Club','A secret agent masquerades as a toy-seller, successfully concealing his alter ego even from his young son until, on a daring mission, he is captured by an evil arms dealer, then it falls to his inexperienced offspring to save the day.','/4sSzmMHoEccf5ZWuokhPCmNsT63.jpg','1996-08-16',90,'Released','It\'s tough being a kid...especially when you discover your Dad\'s a secret agent.','The Secret Agent Club',80546,2.8456,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13334,_binary '\0','/aTfKI7TZUR1uhYsdYyEax09hDz5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117582',5.6,2778,'en','The Secret Agent','In 1880s London, pornographic bookseller Verloc is a double agent for the Russian government, providing information to Chief Inspector Heat about a lazy anarchist organization. In order for the anarchists to be arrested, an act of terrorism must occur. So Verloc decides to set up bombs – which leads to tragedy – not only for himself but also for his family, including wife Winnie and brother-in-law, Stevie.','/tPHoV5WGQROGQmbSw4h8NGWB22c.jpg','1996-11-08',95,'Released','In Victorian London, a city of spies, one woman is about to be caught in a web of conspiracy and only one man has the power to protect her.','The Secret Agent',47199,2.8295,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13335,_binary '\0','/oLh3r9BhrymkMjKtI2geTGkKMif.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117589',8,50906,'en','Secrets & Lies','After her adoptive mother dies, Hortense, a successful black optometrist, seeks out her birth mother. She\'s shocked when her research leads her to Cynthia, a working class white woman.','/zQBuRQ3hrLhkEsXcxteUxuxLrvs.jpg','1996-05-24',142,'Released','Roxanne drives her mother crazy. Maurice never speaks to his niece. Cynthia has a shock for her family. Monica can\'t talk to her husband. Hortense has never met her mother.','Secrets & Lies',11159,5.3375,7.6,'V1e9ovKQViw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13336,_binary '\0','/8ebAtpx6YVfRGrxPrs4nTTWSbT9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117603',6.9,20743,'en','Set It Off','Four inner-city Black women, determined to end their constant struggle, decide to live by one rule — get what you want or die trying. So the four women take back their lives and take out some banks in the process.','/wpiARyUqTfabzakAXHMIUY6Tl1A.jpg','1996-11-06',123,'Released','It\'s about crime. It\'s about payback. It\'s about survival.','Set It Off',9400,5.258,7.2,'bKB2KclDMTY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13337,_binary '\0','/kv6tpMykekRKAiktXJKffAIpdH8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117608',5.9,25302,'en','Sgt. Bilko','The US army is known for churning out lean mean fighting machines intent on protecting our great nation. Sergeant Ernie Bilko is the leader of a ragtag group of the sorriest soldiers ever to enlist in the armed forces.','/q4zmVdQq35ZBj8uyxsU2RCPOQxo.jpg','1996-03-29',90,'Released','All he ever wanted was an honest week\'s pay for an honest day\'s work.','Sgt. Bilko',9099,4.4356,5.883,'3mHbLYzdqVE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13338,_binary '\0','/dvoWawkOsykirEysaY10Rz2FG6J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117609',5.7,3775,'en','Sgt. Kabukiman N.Y.P.D.','A streetwise New York police officer transforms into the world\'s most unusual superhuman hero.','/tN2TjrVP9evNNNw7bGcowNuNIkl.jpg','1991-01-01',105,'Released','Fatal Sushi ... Lethal Chopsticks .. And As American As Apple Pie!','Sgt. Kabukiman N.Y.P.D.',27994,2.0062,5.6,'ckkPwLYuQo8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13339,_binary '\0','/srILItoYT4PSXvTGocHNHfMXEHB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117611',4.8,2003,'en','Shadow Builder','A demon is summoned to take the soul of a young boy who has the potential to become a saint. By doing this he will open a doorway to hell and destroy the world.','/isR6U53W9jCU85xlVAdKRW3QLeR.jpg','1998-11-01',101,'Released','When God created light, the first shadow was born.','Shadow Builder',48921,1.9392,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13340,_binary '\0','/utumW9rZtRymRQuFJXG3uZlowPG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117615',7.7,12625,'ja','Shall we ダンス?','A bored accountant spots a beautiful woman in the window of a ballroom dance studio. He secretly starts taking dancing lessons to be near her, and then over time discovers how much he loves dancing. His wife, meanwhile, has hired a private detective to find out why he has started coming home late smelling of perfume.','/v9sHUTn1v1O6imErEwSJRwozXEv.jpg','1996-01-27',136,'Released','She\'s got the moves… but he\'s got two left feet!','Shall We Dance?',11239,3.3089,7.492,'46HQAq2te-M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13341,_binary '\0','/brxvV8kGF2zVSXohZOqKDU7PVje.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117626',6.1,1618,'en','She Cried No','A college freshman is date-raped and tries to press charges.','/3h8cXDNkLinutfQMAVPNUqQYAJD.jpg','1996-09-23',98,'Released','Once innocence is lost, it can never be found.','She Cried No',117401,1.659,5.7,'GRW0giu6H7A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13342,_binary '\0','/4zXhWqspo9EqAMxIkMWrENfIDQe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117628',6,20161,'en','She\'s the One','Mickey, a free-spirited New York cabbie, and Francis, a materialistic Wall Street stockbroker, are extremely competitive and confused about women as a result of their father\'s influence. They disagree on everything, but they have one thing in common: Mickey\'s ex-fiance Heather is Francis\'s secret love. Although both brothers are already married, Heather triggers their longtime sibling rivalry.','/wNd6qM8Qa8tLFOiUOiEivh0qBkH.jpg','1996-08-26',96,'Released','A romantic comedy about two brothers... and the one thing that came between them.','She\'s the One',11363,5.2904,5.5,'mIvoJ2_8X5I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13343,_binary '\0','/2NU8w8djgX6SzLrg7rN6yMXWAzC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117631',7.6,59344,'en','Shine','Pianist David Helfgott, driven by his father and teachers, has a breakdown. Years later he returns to the piano, to popular if not critical acclaim.','/cbmThowj2XAW7lKlMAXmnhZvjGI.jpg','1996-08-15',105,'Released','A true story of the mystery of music and the miracle of love','Shine',7863,4.0679,7.4,'NaF9JIhPgdU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13344,_binary '\0','/2BpitM8sHyvcEXckBSwxQkQ5peZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117653',5.4,4867,'en','Silent Trigger','Waxman is a former Special Forces soldier who is now working as a heavily armed assassin for a top secret government agency. When a covert mission goes terribly wrong, Waxman and fellow assassin Clegg become that agency\'s prime targets.','/9ij2MMLgfEahM4H0gnYDBQ8B5Gs.jpg','1996-06-26',93,'Released','The Terms are Clear. Kill or be Killed.','Silent Trigger',24206,3.1408,5.224,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13345,_binary '\0','/zLL0a8UrC9BVSpML7Me9SmKcRrT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117658',6,10066,'it','La sindrome di Stendhal','A young policewoman slowly goes insane while tracking down an elusive serial rapist/killer through Italy when she herself becomes a victim of the brutal man\'s obsession.','/ttgMlgv76nbh3vwRl91P4JkgroA.jpg','1996-01-26',120,'Released','Murder is an art — and she’s the canvas!','The Stendhal Syndrome',39434,3.0229,5.5,'S6b0y0FP8UA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13346,_binary '\0','/sDhABATFQX8nfTHShTfH8HeqKY1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117665',7.5,257954,'en','Sleepers','Two gangsters seek revenge on the state jail worker who during their stay at a youth prison sexually abused them. A sensational court hearing takes place to charge him for the crimes.','/yUpiEk2EojS9ZEXb3nIQonQCYYF.jpg','1996-10-18',147,'Released','Four friends have made a mistake that will change their lives forever.','Sleepers',819,13.8385,7.6,'rNaMAgf4ErE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13347,_binary '\0','/crj92SZi5iOs0TJC6LScJw2iFMI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117666',8,104807,'en','Sling Blade','Karl Childers, a mentally disabled man, has been in the custody of the state mental hospital since the age of 12 for killing his mother and her lover. Although thoroughly institutionalized, he is deemed fit to be released into the outside world.','/rioWUWXPFNSjwm9NO2aau9x0wlP.jpg','1996-08-30',135,'Released','A simple man. A difficult choice.','Sling Blade',12498,6.2452,7.5,'DfnPrMypS8U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13348,_binary '\0','/vuYYs28DH51wM9UAdJNcnvy14LS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117688',4.1,4736,'en','Solo','An android fighting-machine is charged with destroying a small brigade of rebels in a Latin American war who are fighting to maintain their freedom and protect their village. Contrary to his programming, Peebles decides to stay and assist the rebels in their plight. Having gained this information, his \"creators\" develop a more powerful android to try and defeat him.','/9qqdpyYVnU5zY5KsTKCIp5gpZoV.jpg','1996-08-23',94,'Released','Part man. Part machine. Total weapon.','Solo',29621,2.8245,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13349,_binary '\0','/QY6225iRF9U2DD16dGne6Q5bhP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117690',7.2,3197,'en','Some Mother\'s Son','Based on the true story of the 1981 hunger strike in a British prison, in which IRA prisoner Bobby Sands led a protest against the treatment of IRA prisoners as criminals rather than as prisoners of war. The film focuses on the mothers of two of the strikers, and their struggle to save the lives of their sons.','/ngy7zafrXEDCUOPfolcbFofMDmI.jpg','1996-09-13',112,'Released','Between love and loyalty... Between life and death... Lies a choice no mother should have to make.','Some Mother\'s Son',58102,3.023,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13350,_binary '\0','/vY77qwyyFDeES95vqGcQp3VPVDh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117695',6.2,1603,'it','Sono pazzo di Iris Blond','Romeo, a lovelorn Roman musician in his 40s with 20 years since his only hit, consults a fortuneteller who predicts he\'ll find love and money with a foreign singer named for a flower. In Brussels he meets Marguerite, an older chanteuse who interprets Jacques Brel and loves her yappy dog.','/kUVDylhtLVtJXBtqujdDgbsTwnN.jpg','1996-12-13',109,'Released','There\'s Something Wild About Iris Blond','Iris Blond',58081,1.5683,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13351,_binary '\0','/lWybXICZZpxnSvWSOW53XxTERUg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117705',6.5,231818,'en','Space Jam','With their freedom on the line, the Looney Tunes seek the help of NBA superstar Michael Jordan to win a basketball game against a team of moronic aliens.','/4RN5El3Pj2W4gpwgiAGLVfSJv2g.jpg','1996-11-15',87,'Released','Get ready to jam.','Space Jam',2300,12.1353,6.808,'17pOeKY17vc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13352,_binary '\0','/yqzWtzbaq6MRkRKYCJqf05phlAr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117715',7.3,3969,'cs','Spiklenci slasti','Six Prague residents pursue bizarre rituals. Mr. Peony builds a chicken costume to wear while enacting homicidal fantasies toward neighbor Mrs. Loubalova, who does the same dressed as a dominatrix. Their mail carrier, Mrs. Malkova, inhales tiny balls of bread. Newsstand operator Mr. Kula obsessively watches the broadcasts of news anchor Mrs. Beltinska, whose husband regularly scrubs his body.','/rqZLPEVEcF703OeAkJNT624f7Zw.jpg','1996-10-17',83,'Released',NULL,'Conspirators of Pleasure',59892,2.045,6.717,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13353,_binary '\0','/bMNFWeyxAlrwLdJ1N1rhSDdX87a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117718',7,6214,'en','The Spitfire Grill','Percy, upon being released from prison, goes to the small town of Gillead, to find a place where she can start over again. She is taken in by Hannah, to help out at her place, the Spitfire Grill. Percy brings change to the small town, stirring resentment and fear in some, and growth in others.','/dXxsqE22C6X72O1g8abO3kSIkpy.jpg','1996-08-23',117,'Released','To a town with no future, comes a girl with a past.','The Spitfire Grill',47907,2.8648,6.5,'SKKdkqnAX4o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13354,_binary '\0','/yAzC0pV1e1BzXA5NyWsGsRggOM5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117723',5.3,43311,'en','Spy Hard','The evil Gen. Rancor has his sights set on world domination, and only one man can stop him: Dick Steele, also known as Agent WD-40. Rancor needs to obtain a computer circuit for the missile that he is planning to fire, so Steele teams up with Veronique Ukrinsky, a KGB agent whose father designed the chip. Together they try to locate the evil mastermind\'s headquarters, where Veronique\'s father and several other hostages are being held.','/yoegp9XEG4YCbJJKR0wvm0BGYpG.jpg','1996-05-24',81,'Released','All the action. All the women. Half the intelligence.','Spy Hard',10535,9.4744,5.4,'q7eXHlWfulI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13355,_binary '\0','/wygUDDRNpeKUnkekRGeLCZM93tA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117731',7.6,138948,'en','Star Trek: First Contact','The Borg, a relentless race of cyborgs, are on a direct course for Earth. Violating orders to stay away from the battle, Captain Picard and the crew of the newly-commissioned USS Enterprise E pursue the Borg back in time to prevent the invaders from changing Federation history and assimilating the galaxy.','/iqhHe893Vcf07jNkNQ31tu85dKG.jpg','1996-11-22',111,'Released','Resistance is futile.','Star Trek: First Contact',199,10.3106,7.309,'YQ1eiEvefKI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13356,_binary '\0','/bJFapHYlJIhXpfqH8uaNLtUxHwD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117737',6.5,32714,'en','Stealing Beauty','Lucy Harmon, an American teenager is arriving in the lush Tuscan countryside to be sculpted by a family friend who lives in a beautiful villa. Lucy visited there four years earlier and exchanged a kiss with an Italian boy with whom she hopes to become reacquainted.','/5ugxnyVmBK952bwOcE4M0szNimx.jpg','1996-03-29',116,'Released','The most beautiful place to be is in love.','Stealing Beauty',14553,7.608,6.675,'SStzlZz6lxc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13357,_binary '\0','/2T6zTAacQMCQo3T4AsuZmB1htlM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117765',4.6,52114,'en','Striptease','Bounced from her job, Erin Grant needs money if she\'s to have any chance of winning back custody of her child. But, eventually, she must confront the naked truth: to take on the system, she\'ll have to take it all off. Erin strips to conquer, but she faces unintended circumstances when a hound dog of a Congressman zeroes in on her and sharpens the shady tools at his fingertips, including blackmail and murder.','/4zMy6R7acotCmGoDk4sjzRtDwKn.jpg','1996-06-28',115,'Released','Some people get into trouble no matter what they wear.','Striptease',9879,8.1788,5.6,'ujvOdC3-JGw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13358,_binary '\0','/rNxqquM6jUrm9rIBGtHc2NevC7y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117768',4.4,7665,'en','The Stupids','An incredibly dull-witted family unknowingly stumble upon an illegal weapons deal while on the trail of their \"stolen\" garbage.','/uR0EPkE66y2DU21NOZAu6xtfpQL.jpg','1996-08-08',94,'Released','As American as apple pie and twice as smart.','The Stupids',16299,2.9969,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13359,_binary '\0','/ps7ACSyVUb9tvrksge7Wc21lYKQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117771',6.6,1396,'da','De største helte','The two medicated low-lifes Carsten and Peter are long time partners, an old flame of Peter\'s turns up to tell him that he has a twelve year old daughter, whom he should present himself to. Her adoptive father is a mean bastard, and incestive undertones lies in the relationship between the two. The daughter escapes from her adoptive father, turns up at Peter\'s place, and Carsten, Peter, and the daughter escapes to Sweden.','/k0AObd9g2FIi4hlSuU6l89elESB.jpg','1996-11-08',90,'Released',NULL,'The Biggest Heroes',49302,1.3538,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13360,_binary '\0','/uFdLjtlgCbEtkQfBiZQPLfVryr5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117774',6.1,18631,'en','The Substitute','When an inner-city Miami schoolteacher gets her knee broken after standing up to the school\'s gang leader, her mercenary combat specialist boyfriend goes undercover as a substitute teacher to take down the punk. Soon he discovers a conspiracy of criminals at work, and must reassemble his team from his last jungle raid to stop them.','/7vfzvhPMNauUXrVxVOPEfpOsful.jpg','1996-04-19',114,'Released','The most dangerous thing about school used to be the students.','The Substitute',20762,7.2661,7.024,'IpUI3NRsjk8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13361,_binary '\0','/sLQUCTUjnDVut0741VQVJ1VbWhh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117781',6.1,5492,'en','The Sunchaser','A young half-Navajo convict dying of cancer forces a yuppie doctor to drive him to a magic healing lake.','/9Y0snZwCLvG8eoJewP4G3RT8Z4v.jpg','1996-05-29',122,'Released','I drop you. I could care less.','The Sunchaser',38191,2.9968,6.3,'BFG7Cd9iClc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13362,_binary '\0','/lL3QBgmDoZ6yYd1J1bWuoFCr2KD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117784',6,2034,'en','Sunset Park','A white teacher takes over a talented, but undisciplined Black high school basketball team and turns them into winners.','/rkt8cYfOV6vcqlDbut7jak9qaPh.jpg','1996-04-26',99,'Released','You gotta represent.','Sunset Park',29649,2.1844,6.5,'MjsvTIlTdvg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13363,_binary '\0','/ntcAJpibO5hkp74BKBlzzh5MGjY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117786',6.3,31365,'cn','一個好人','A Chinese chef accidentally gets involved with a news reporter who filmed a drug bust that went awry and is now being chased by gangs who are trying to get the video tape.','/wAAt2gvbkbeefzjd06GPfkdfUho.jpg','1997-01-31',95,'Released','Fight first. Apologize later.','Mr. Nice Guy',10622,5.7877,6.6,'PznkKtrh6qo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13364,_binary '\0','/zabeClnzpQldGd3TaUpqiufMBwT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117791',6.3,8229,'en','Surviving Picasso','The passionate Merchant-Ivory drama tells the story of Francoise Gilot, the only lover of Pablo Picasso who was strong enough to withstand his ferocious cruelty and move on with her life.','/olcQOdg54uBYDUkZbgw2FFTBaZI.jpg','1996-09-04',125,'Released','Only his passion for women could rival his passion for painting.','Surviving Picasso',41843,3.5292,5.8,'55m72TA8Soo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13365,_binary '\0','/mLj1mB7yYJxt4knNQu0VUwqf2lY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117794',7.2,3655,'en','Susie Q','The ghost of a girl who died in 1955 appears to a troubled teen living in her old house.','/vqn0vSAK30DNZxCvQ6H0IPmoicH.jpg','1996-09-30',83,'Released','Death is just the beginning.','Susie Q',46227,1.2893,5.7,'PIQO4PgCr70','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13366,_binary '\0','/1u0ivjKCXZULqQTUZiVjZOjkEiO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117797',7.5,4958,'ja','スワロウテイル','The struggles of a group of outcasts living in \"Yentown\", in an alternate-future Japan.','/wiCisHRzUjho1l90JC5KJ050H9A.jpg','1996-09-14',148,'Released','This is the story of Yentowns in Yentown.','Swallowtail Butterfly',8426,3.3233,7.5,'NLGhrgFot8I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13367,_binary '\0','/urQRrvRzsBztqjOt7yuxX9gpqw1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117802',7.2,91830,'en','Swingers','After 6 years together, Mike\'s girlfriend leaves him, so he travels to LA to be a star. Six months on, he\'s still not doing very well— so a few of his friends try to reconnect him to the social scene and hopefully help him forget his failed relationship.','/rRjWk68kU3a2so4lgr3TKB7Y5vA.jpg','1996-10-18',96,'Released','Cocktails first. Questions later.','Swingers',10218,4.2959,6.849,'SoNOlh_zCf8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13368,_binary '\0','/tW1azZ2j0ObJj4d0QMay30AFNTL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117808',5.8,1937,'pl','Szamanka','Anthropology professor Michal develops two overwhelming obsessions. The first one is a mummified, 3,000 year-old, perfectly preserved body of a shaman he and his colleagues have recently dragged out of a swamp. The second is an enigmatic student he meets by chance at a railway station.','/feVJnyUX5f1tvQzn64zeaGWMghm.jpg','1996-05-10',117,'Released','She\'s a machine.','Szamanka',81217,2.2312,6.042,'49L3Y3cP8io','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13369,_binary '\0','/wuAUnxLWQhFn3geUANlQcxDOo7G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117817',6.9,1356,'no','Søndagsengler','The Other Side of Sunday, also known in Norwegian as \"Søndagsengler\", is a movie that criticizes the small, and often tight, church community. We follow the Preacher\'s Daughter, Maria, on her journey to liberate herself from the stiff church community and her father.','/8nJlw1xMfimLc1CoRw0SfocwWaI.jpg','1996-02-09',103,'Released',NULL,'The Other Side of Sunday',46754,2.0394,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13370,_binary '\0','/4pdn51JC1pliaFjf5tNDi8sMRqs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117826',5.4,17145,'en','Bordello of Blood','A seedy private eye gets more than he ever bargained for when a missing persons case leads him to a brothel overseen by the mother of vampires and her lusty army of the undead.','/aKkUQ0Zd9TFlqfcMMHFKQBB15wZ.jpg','1996-08-16',87,'Released','Evil bites!','Bordello of Blood',9431,6.7731,6,'WGe7kfi0lZA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13371,_binary '\0','/1fwJnJkscVItxwqoXrD9r1XLRQF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117876',7.1,1549,'ja','天地無用! in LOVE','The demonic space criminal Kain has escaped from prison and destroyed the Galaxy Police headquarters. To ensure that the Jurai will not stop him, Kain travels back to 1970 to eliminate Tenchi\'s mother before he is even born. Now, Tenchi and the gang must travel to the past to stop him before he ceases to exist.','/YR0MeIbbinhc0qLr2vg3Zmqbw6.jpg','1996-04-20',95,'Released',NULL,'Tenchi Muyo! In Love',34935,3.1957,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13372,_binary '\0','/vqSnB2T6qgU3in8scPkAYqV7kBR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117883',7.4,47257,'es','Tesis','While working on a thesis about audiovisual violence, film student Ángela finds a snuff video where a girl is tortured until death. Soon she discovers that she was a former student in her university, and that the authors of the video are not very far either.','/lzD8bdIptcgsAUaTgAdvD1e9NDu.jpg','1996-04-11',125,'Released','My name is Ángela. They\'re going to kill me.','Thesis',9299,5.4486,7.5,'DIrrXbhIuzI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13373,_binary '\0','/vxhnRV7jGncAZmf0FFHMs6rFHWn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117887',7,79158,'en','That Thing You Do!','A Pennsylvania band scores a hit in 1964 and rides the star-making machinery as long as it can, with lots of help from its manager. But behind the scenes, the group’s sudden fame tests their strength, their maturity and responsibility, and their ability to resist the temptations that money and notoriety always make possible.','/9RmZu33qHdyZFGLfhEOmkTjdNEu.jpg','1996-10-04',108,'Released','The Fab Four without the Mop Tops','That Thing You Do!',9591,9.369,6.886,'fBSrLcksj8c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13374,_binary '\0','/1Y7ZE94BTwXhYDDzzS7MY8sXBr1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117891',5.7,6105,'en','A Thin Line Between Love and Hate','Nightclub manager Darnell Wright is a perpetual playboy who is almost as devoted to his job as he is to the pursuit of beautiful women. After he sets his sights on the ultra-classy Brandi Web, he launches an all-out assault to win her heart. Ultimately, charm, lust and passion prevail, but Darnell learns the hard way that when you play, you pay. Brandi is much harder to get rid of than she was to get--especially when she realizes that she has a rival vying for Darnell\'s affection. When he finally decides to call it quits, Brandi becomes an obsessed femme fatale stalking the new 