ch other.','Comrades, Almost a Love Story',37185,3.7442,7.8,'x1g7VSYwJ44','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13378,_binary '\0','/y4pVhEtlQ3CuHs7jfaceKm56qzS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117909',7.2,4169,'es','Tierra','A mysterious exterminator falls in love with two women who live in a distinctive wine-producing region in Spain.','/AeswDyMS7DS8c66vrnLZxXXbLT1.jpg','1996-05-20',123,'Released',NULL,'Earth',2460,2.5907,6.9,'s2sdwTCdC00','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13379,_binary '\0','/bwLQCW6LqmrJ6aJsevypcg93JCU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117913',7.5,212129,'en','A Time to Kill','A young lawyer defends a black man accused of murdering two white men who raped his 10-year-old daughter, sparking a rebirth of the KKK.','/w8UCke112E9jrhjKcwG32kyhTx5.jpg','1996-07-24',149,'Released','Experience a time you\'ll never forget.','A Time to Kill',1645,13.3235,7.4,'701GQjY6PaI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13380,_binary '\0','/amO7B3fSXhnIP51NDXBXPVcZRe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117918',6.4,56643,'en','Tin Cup','A washed up golf pro working at a driving range tries to qualify for the US Open in order to win the heart of his succesful rival\'s girlfriend.','/rB7OvMmjcBFoogleORaUqrRgp8g.jpg','1996-08-16',135,'Released','Golf Pro. Love Amateur.','Tin Cup',10478,4.2193,6.068,'cG-XrSUg1fw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13381,_binary '\0','/sJ2w867Y55MNbhxiEOjnPGPGsiD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117924',5.8,5301,'en','To Gillian on Her 37th Birthday','David loves his wife, Gillian. Unfortunately, she died two years ago. David deals with his grief by continuing his romance with Gillian during walks with her \"ghost\" on the beach at night. While David lives in the past, other family problems crop up in the present in the real world....','/7HGWS6WlsPzBsB7NG5JM4P8NrIv.jpg','1996-10-25',93,'Released','Some love lasts a lifetime. Real love lasts forever.','To Gillian on Her 37th Birthday',30500,2.7008,5.5,'XxeSLgMObIM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13382,_binary '\0','/igzhMRd2eMT0k2GEYEcQl7jc4ku.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117927',6.4,1667,'en','To Sir, with Love II','After thirty years teaching in London, Mark Thackeray retires and returns to Chicago. There, however, the challenge of teaching kids in an inner city school proves to be too much to resist.','/94gHDqRoScMy6JIydYWsE3QBwea.jpg','1996-04-07',92,'Released',NULL,'To Sir, with Love II',86040,2.885,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13383,_binary '\0','/pArPMLvKOKfF2waNpkhOPncxPo1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117942',4.7,1233,'en','Tornado!','An accountant sent to produce an evaluation of a tornado research project, and the scientist running the project pursue tornadoes and each other.','/kzQNHyfqdbUdpJqHyqtZSQYxq5F.jpg','1996-05-06',87,'Released','Hell has no fury like a twister.','Tornado!',36983,1.586,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13384,_binary '\0','/dkfBKDUIWP1peEszdqK10MkMZCP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117951',8.1,774735,'en','Trainspotting','Heroin addict Mark Renton stumbles through bad ideas and sobriety attempts with his unreliable friends --Sick Boy, Begbie, Spud and Tommy. He also has an underage girlfriend, Diane, along for the ride. After cleaning up and moving from Edinburgh to London, Mark finds he can\'t escape the life he left behind as Begbie and Sick Boy come knocking.','/1jUC02qsqS2NxBMFarbIhcQtazV.jpg','1996-02-23',94,'Released','Choose life.','Trainspotting',627,14.1389,7.959,'KhGT6itWByA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13385,_binary '\0','/4aXe78YsL7TWtoVZXO5DTnn9AAR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117958',7.1,17791,'en','Trees Lounge','Tommy has lost his job, his love and his life. He lives in a small apartment above the Trees Lounge, a bar which he frequents along with a few other regulars without lives. He gets a job driving an ice cream truck and ends up getting involved with the seventeen-year-old niece of his ex-girlfriend. This gets him into serious trouble with her father.','/swOo6PSYDVgwSce9faxPBS9V4ss.jpg','1996-05-11',95,'Released','A story about one man\'s search... for who knows what','Trees Lounge',27845,4.3848,6.9,'xZutAd7RQKU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13386,_binary '\0','/92Oqn01ncWZU5pvYY9wLST5joUM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117959',6.6,1980,'it','La tregua','After the liberation of Auschwitz, an Italian prisoner of War begins a torturous voyage home to Turin, through a Europe caught between war and peace.','/k4GWXtFvRQ8zKuf6ICOpjcyNjYE.jpg','1997-02-14',112,'Released','At the end of the war, a group of Italian prisoners got lost on their way home. Their journey back transformed everyone they met along the way.','The Truce',30529,1.9498,6.1,'IQY0rDjRW1g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13387,_binary '\0','/4adK7YqTWWVICmjel4GJRL0vrzz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117965',5.7,7248,'en','The Trigger Effect','A blackout leaves those affected to consider what is necessary, what is legal, and what is questionable, in order to survive in a predatory environment.','/rVhaxpd12ZoXB1RE9r9CUjylxro.jpg','1996-08-30',94,'Released','When nothing works, anything goes.','The Trigger Effect',58770,3.1052,5.8,'4kvM9ITybqE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13388,_binary '\0','/4bvAkBUO2JKgvzdRMOqhA7UTAnf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117966',5.7,2041,'en','Trilogy of Terror II','Three tales of terror: in \"The Graveyard Rats\" lovers murder the woman\'s older husband and encounter horror when they attempt to rob his grave; \"Bobby\" is the story of a woman who summons her son back from the dead; and in \"He Who Kills\" an African doll goes on a murderous rampage.','/5QFPqKCyYMIKvujRIJzFJ5LlwNs.jpg','1996-10-30',90,'Released','The first one kept you on the edge of your seat. This one will keep you under it.','Trilogy of Terror II',45875,2.4936,5.2,'TlCNLYGCElA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13389,_binary '\0','/49PxbsbF5QoAlqQPUNsu8IMqbUN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117968',6.8,1721,'fr','Trois vies et une seule mort','Four intertwining stories of bizarre occurrences in Paris featuring a man who was stolen away by fairies, a professor who becomes a tramp, the lovers who inherit a chateau – and the last tale that connects all that has gone before.','/v5zPLrTdFWox2AO7aTytgVhmdoU.jpg','1996-05-15',123,'Released',NULL,'Three Lives and Only One Death',55049,2.2406,6.479,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13390,_binary '\0','/2ZWD2t48CbjxcxzaZ8tqqDiY85f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117979',6.3,29100,'en','The Truth About Cats & Dogs','A successful veterinarian and radio show host with low self-esteem asks her model friend to impersonate her when a handsome man wants to see her.','/4T2edRWgD8QlW62Ja6w5uSFteRH.jpg','1996-04-26',93,'Released','Brian\'s about to discover the woman he loves isn\'t the woman he loves.','The Truth About Cats & Dogs',8866,3.5143,6.1,'6nFJcAt-ktU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13391,_binary '\0','/4bY839VFMXTOrn76y2P1LrF9VJP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117983',5.1,1656,'hi','Tu Chor Main Sipahi','Thakur Gajendra Singh runs a criminal empire from a small town. The Thakur rules this town, including the police, who only cater to his interests. His town has been known to be the grave-yard of police officers who have dared to oppose him. Inspector Amar Varma accepts the assignment to serve in this town, not knowing that he is not only putting his own life, but the lives of his loved ones also, in the hands of the merciless Thakur.','/cmRoqW06eqgjSLiAuxgD3sVscJK.jpg','1996-05-10',153,'Released',NULL,'Tu Chor Main Sipahi',333583,1.5774,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13392,_binary '\0','/5jlN3G7ymVDNxDeA4SjElIslZv7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117991',7.1,6784,'en','Twelfth Night','Shakespeare\'s comedy of gender confusion, in which a girl disguises herself as a man to be near the count she adores, only to be pursued by the woman he loves.','/uMvHIh50LqWJxUK26eYWV10epdq.jpg','1996-10-25',134,'Released','Never send a boy to do a man\'s job, especially if he\'s a girl.','Twelfth Night',44705,2.7914,7,'DGEoGFdjXi8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13393,_binary '\0','/5oCAo7LFj2x0yByfi5JYirGnK8I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0117998',6.6,253797,'en','Twister','An unprecedented series of violent tornadoes is sweeping across Oklahoma. Tornado chasers, headed by Dr. Jo Harding, attempt to release a groundbreaking device that will allow them to track them and create a more advanced warning system. They are joined by Jo\'s soon to be ex-husband Bill, a former tornado chaser himself, and his girlfriend Melissa.','/d4ie3f6QTvNw40V770Uzo87SDZn.jpg','1996-05-10',113,'Released','The dark side of nature.','Twister',664,12.9066,6.576,'FB7haistlIE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13394,_binary '\0','/sUv3nQ9Z2I2drYOnIlFWpYnJR0E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118001',5.4,6401,'en','Two Much','A struggling Miami art gallerist incurs the wrath of a mobster when he becomes accidentally engaged to his flighty ex-wife, but he falls in love with the woman\'s sister, so he invents a twin brother and plays both parts to satisfy the women.','/65WB70Jhi3G2c5C41PyL5pl9L9p.jpg','1995-12-01',118,'Released','A comedy about two sisters who thought they had nothing in common.','Two Much',46029,3.2768,5.5,'ajGpyRSKgKw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13395,_binary '\0','/9YTwzhG4HcZICyWcwSGO3O9JBgw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118002',5.3,6911,'en','Two If by Sea','Frank O\'Brien, a petty thief, and his 7-year-long girlfriend Roz want to put an end to their unsteady lifestyle and just do that last job, which involves stealing a valuable painting. Frank takes Roz to an island on the coast of New England, where he wants to sell the painting and also hopes that their sagging relationship will get a positive push back up. Not everything goes as planned.','/xSfqAMYqrTtDeAjPtYo0S8nc5Zz.jpg','1996-01-12',96,'Released','A new comedy about love, laughter, and larceny','Two If by Sea',19760,4.1627,5,'Psql1jhaIiA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13396,_binary '\0','/1vKNE7XGF3eM9aZMIExV0kHhlC0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118011',8.1,2440,'sr','Убиство с предумишљајем','Men, women, and war. Jelena Panic is a young woman in Belgrade in the early 1990s, during Serbia\'s war with Croatia; she\'s making a book of her grandmother\'s diaries from the end of World War II. She takes up with Bogdan, a young soldier recovering from war wounds. He helps her with her grandmother\'s story, a tragic triangle involving her effete and well-educated husband and an uneducated major, a Chekist who has, perhaps, the power to save a political prisoner who is the grandmother\'s friend. As Jelena wonders which man was her grandfather (the Chekist or the husband), Bogdan recovers from his wounds and must decide whether to return to the front. Jelena pleads; duty calls.','/xMcZHTuvElOAaFzOHmLzuzJV4ao.jpg','1995-11-15',94,'Released',NULL,'Premeditated Murder',284154,2.5593,8.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13397,_binary '\0','/mE7C0GZXXAbw6wUaOGkWnW3S9U0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118015',7.4,5897,'fr','Un air de famille','An upper middle-class French family celebrates a birthday in a restaurant. In one evening and during one meal, family history, tensions, collective and separate grudges, delights, and memories both clash and coalesce.','/eKGcispYwnZdC4FPctDAtFXLkyu.jpg','1996-09-07',110,'Released',NULL,'Family Resemblances',14646,2.1534,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13398,_binary '\0','/xoxOLdS3J0j1LGD1270MDjvGnU9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118018',5.9,2548,'fr','Un divan à New York','A burnt-out New York psychoanalyst exchanges apartments with a Parisian woman. When his patients arrive, they talk to her and then pay. He returns early and becomes a patient as well.','/8txMP2kp0A9ZGlVFtg9eUe3ZhWC.jpg','1996-02-21',104,'Released','A Man... A Woman... A Dog... The perfect combination for romance...','A Couch in New York',47434,2.6127,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13399,_binary '\0','/2sxUrCRimUdYMtgGubx9lLMWMtz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118020',7.1,3586,'fr','Un héros très discret','Set in France at the end of World War II Albert Dehousse finds out his father wasn\'t a war hero and his mother is a collaborator.','/gXB4G4UTwJCBKLdFLNKA8fWYdeQ.jpg','1996-05-15',107,'Released',NULL,'A Self-Made Hero',48580,1.9755,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13400,_binary '\0','/qiHv4wmDEZsz1aMihaAMWhguhio.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118040',6,6493,'en','Unforgettable','Seattle medical examiner David Krane is obsessed with solving his wife\'s murder. A possible solution presents itself in an experimental \"memory\" serum designed by a neurobiology professor, which has the ability to transfer memories from one person to another, but with potentially fatal consequences.','/500Ne3EDn3HHpuCQWwGKR74r0cB.jpg','1996-02-23',116,'Released','He loved her. He lost her. He won\'t let her memory die... until it tells him who killed her.','Unforgettable',2045,2.6757,5.6,'5RLDDt6Jpes','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13401,_binary '\0','/rIfaCpgE59tkjZbAOIZnuXvhCBv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118043',6.8,2802,'de','Der Unhold','Frenchman Abel Tiffauges is a naive man who lives a simple life working as a mechanic. Falsely accused of being a child abuser, he is recruited as a soldier when World War II begins, but is captured soon and taken to the heart of Nazi Germany.','/ybLzxBiB9qiiqyANLj8RGs2Dkp3.jpg','1996-09-12',113,'Released',NULL,'The Ogre',48213,2.1115,6.4,'cLYZnniXAhk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13402,_binary '\0','/srmVuvqEDS1LNobNqGgEZCY9gyI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118044',6.5,2536,'en','Unhook the Stars','Widowed mother Mildred must suddenly redefine herself and find an outlet for her nurturing side when her adult daughter moves out of the family home. Though Mildred thinks she\'s found her purpose when her neighbor, overworked single mother Monica, asks her to look after her little boy, she has great difficulty learning to strike a healthy balance between giving selflessly to others and remembering to take care of herself.','/xDa7qRS8iOY5XDvt0DRpwlAJO6H.jpg','1996-09-04',103,'Released','When prim & proper meets wild & crazy get ready to...','Unhook the Stars',48862,2.7703,5.9,'9daIbBlaEIA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13403,_binary '\0','/wI1yvoJNIeFgorLUIG6NObQvAwe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118048',6.4,1583,'en','Unlikely Angel','A country singer dies prematurely, but cannot enter heaven until she performs a good deed back on earth.','/4OpnhBEf1t8sAD5km2sN60VrlJe.jpg','1996-12-17',95,'Released','No wings. No halo. All heart.','Unlikely Angel',103409,1.8063,6.1,'x1kH8JeHfAc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13404,_binary '\0','/wqD5zMFFITtzySK7fuYX42AtbJE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118055',6.1,16510,'en','Up Close & Personal','Tally Atwater has a dream: to be a prime-time network newscaster. She pursues this dream with nothing but ambition, raw talent and a homemade demo tape. Warren Justice is a brilliant, hard edged, veteran newsman. He sees Tally has talent and becomes her mentor. Tally’s career takes a meteoric rise and she and Warren fall in love. The romance that results is as intense and revealing as television news itself. Yet, each breaking story, every videotaped crisis that brings them together, also threatens to drive them apart...','/zF67qcf7skMHLpXnifodinUqCFr.jpg','1996-03-01',119,'Released','Passion Brought Them Together... Only Success Could Tear Them Apart!','Up Close & Personal',9302,4.651,6.275,'6Y28HLt-fEg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13405,_binary '\0','/1uf6ybrvTzx1hs64Phr5HOw4T2N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118064',6.7,5148,'en','The Van','In a working-class quarter of Dublin, \'Bimbo\' Reeves gets laid off from his job and, with his redundancy payout, buys a van and sells fish and chips with his buddy, Larry. Due to Ireland\'s surprising success at the 1990 FIFA World Cup, their business starts off well, but the relationship between the two friends soon becomes strained as Bimbo behaves more like a typical boss.','/2TdHo37gBCZFT613VcLMbP5eM65.jpg','1996-11-29',100,'Released','A comedy about friends, family and fish.','The Van',11844,1.6942,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13406,_binary '\0','/6PktHOB9WiszclMWMNE8mbh4ww2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118073',5.9,12742,'en','A Very Brady Sequel','A man claiming to be Carol Brady\'s long-lost first husband, Roy Martin, shows up at the suburban Brady residence one evening. An impostor, the man is actually determined to steal the Bradys\' familiar horse statue, a $20-million ancient Asian artifact.','/7xqOkzAQvXCLkDtmlWU6HZnOhru.jpg','1996-08-23',90,'Released','The more everything changes the more they stay the same.','A Very Brady Sequel',12606,4.1062,5.841,'BKkq5Iqujuw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13407,_binary '\0','/vCkgZjVomaDn57njVjVGo4dwoPJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118083',5,2158,'sv','Vinterviken','John-John is young and black, growing up with his mother and stepfather in a boring suburb south of Stockholm. On one of the last days of the summer vacation, they rescue 10-year old Patricia from drowning at a public bath in Vinterviken in Lake Mälaren. Her father shows his gratitude by taking them home to the wealthy neighborhood, Bromma, where he and his family lives. John-John meets his daughter Elisabeth, and instantly fall in love with her. But it\'s a long way to go before he wins her love and her father\'s consent.','/iTwr3rGDNmQIqsAqx16vXi7YQ82.jpg','1996-01-26',98,'Released',NULL,'Winter Bay',39502,1.0877,3.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13408,_binary '\0','/qiGO31RIzndpoJbVfwUoDGFUGre.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118100',6.7,2421,'fr','Les Voleurs','In the middle of the night, someone brings Ivan\'s body home to his wife and his young son. Flashbacks reveal the relationships among Ivan and his brother Alex, a cop with a cleanliness fetish; siblings Juliette and Jimmy, Ivan\'s partners in a seedy nightclub; the love triangle of Alex, Juliette, and Marie, a professor of philosophy; and of Alex and his nephew, Ivan\'s dour, stoic son. Ivan\'s death changes every relationship.','/meeBmnlkMP8UhrPvZKv83jjhd2E.jpg','1996-08-21',117,'Released',NULL,'Thieves',49935,2.7605,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13409,_binary '\0','/7nNAyGnKvTXKFwRk1EivuPKW6xF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118111',7.4,34093,'en','Waiting for Guffman','Aspiring director Corky St. Clair and the marginally talented amateur cast of his hokey small-town musical production go overboard when they learn that Broadway theater agent Mort Guffman will be in attendance.','/zuArI6EBpV6mExrvfnyidoOtzdf.jpg','1997-01-31',84,'Released','There\'s a good reason some talent remains undiscovered.','Waiting for Guffman',16448,2.8907,7,'DE_KdBT-xVU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13410,_binary '\0','/qyUcA9yqly33P0shcexLmVwhBPS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118113',6.7,4326,'en','Walking and Talking','Just as Amelia thinks she\'s over her anxiety and insecurity, her best friend announces her engagement, bringing her anxiety and insecurity right back.','/m8JMJQUfGwGt7gse8aoduAcTYE.jpg','1996-07-17',86,'Released','A movie for everyone who wants to get married and stay single at the same time.','Walking and Talking',49963,1.7209,6.1,'ohAd27SbH6E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13411,_binary '\0','/6Cj6qDa6juHag6Xf9PR0HnGmIZU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118117',6.9,2745,'en','The War at Home','Jeremy Collier is a Vietnam veteran who has returned home and is struggling to cope with the war experiences that haunt him. He is also at odds with his family, who cannot begin to understand what he has been through. Jeremy\'s battles with his family finally spiral out of control on Thanksgiving Day, when a bitter secret is revealed','/la11ac7YYCDBsizOkKxqwn71VKQ.jpg','1996-11-20',119,'Released','There Is A Secret About To Explode.','The War at Home',59232,2.4407,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13412,_binary '\0','/l0YhkeRNks3mPdjxd2VgAFtKplB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118125',7.1,5259,'en','The Watermelon Woman','A young black lesbian filmmaker probes into the life of The Watermelon Woman, a 1930s black actress who played \'mammy\' archetypes.','/mBBqKfkvzSk6Rk7bfRXU9kR916N.jpg','1997-03-05',85,'Released','Sometimes you have to create your own history.','The Watermelon Woman',44479,2.2772,7,'mtU6Wo29VXI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13413,_binary '\0','/5hTrlgPRIYDOFactczf0dCHVnOA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118138',5.6,3696,'de','Werner - Das muss kesseln!!!','Because of a bet, Werner and his friend have to construct the fastest vehicle to win a race, because life depends on it.','/xAlhCsCl3XzEroBjIR4oyGPkB5x.jpg','1996-06-27',85,'Released',NULL,'Werner: Eat My Dust!!!',9514,1.8926,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13414,_binary '\0','/3n3Wo9hPpipFqUXCNiftVyXSw13.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118147',7.9,19246,'en','When We Were Kings','It\'s 1974. Muhammad Ali is 32 and thought by many to be past his prime. George Foreman is ten years younger and the heavyweight champion of the world. Promoter Don King wants to make a name for himself and offers both fighters five million dollars apiece to fight one another, and when they accept, King has only to come up with the money. He finds a willing backer in Mobutu Sese Suko, the dictator of Zaire, and the \"Rumble in the Jungle\" is set, including a musical festival featuring some of America\'s top black performers, like James Brown and B.B. King.','/yBkZK1JZOOJ3q5Jj1H9UP9T8YuV.jpg','1996-10-25',89,'Released','The untold story of the Rumble in the Jungle.','When We Were Kings',10548,4.3835,7.6,'uBauogNmRqY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13415,_binary '\0','/kpVQHZrBLUsB35S1pTbP8apgT5W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118158',6.6,26307,'en','White Squall','In 1960, a hardy group of prep school students boards an old-fashioned sailing ship. With Capt. Christopher Sheldon at the helm, the oceangoing voyage is intended to teach the boys fortitude and discipline. But the youthful crew are about to get some unexpected instruction in survival when they get caught in the clutches of a white squall storm.','/5xF4qy44Lvv68glS7eHWH7laTqt.jpg','1996-02-02',129,'Released','The strongest will in nature is the will to survive.','White Squall',10534,6.1475,6.3,'bQiKlj2qI5c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13416,_binary '\0','/l8g9VAYVZ0LcvbNk0nZ3iLRnVXz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118163',7,4434,'en','The Whole Wide World','In 1930s Texas, pulp fiction master Robert E. Howard is introduced to Novalyne Price, a teacher with aspirations of becoming an author herself, and they begin a unique relationship filled with conversation and imagination. Although the possibility exists for romance, Howard\'s obsession with his work and dedication to his sick mother leads Price to look elsewhere for love, leaving Howard feeling betrayed and alone.','/ajMk4ueXcOCbxwJjJecltiGhYrn.jpg','1996-09-08',106,'Released','Based on a true story.','The Whole Wide World',18451,2.5289,6.654,'bHvOeMRgPuw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13417,_binary '\0','/rzjexcxnYvATkfeyRE7ujpiA7Al.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118172',6.3,3677,'en','The Wind in the Willows','Jailed for his reckless driving, rambunctious Mr. Toad has to escape from prison when his beloved Toad Hall comes under threat from the wily weasels, who plan to build a dog food factory on the very meadow sold to them by Toad himself.','/nsOM52BsDeHzc0yI27bah2OWems.jpg','1996-10-16',88,'Released','Go wild in the country!','The Wind in the Willows',47168,2.8859,5.8,'v75ncrfTK2Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13418,_binary '\0','/nlm4SzWY7bZNpfqP0RhLhSeIggm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118178',6.6,9247,'en','Wish Upon a Star','A younger sister wishes to switch places with her popular older sister and the two bickering siblings awaken to find the wish has come true.','/5vgfcw4y4UVE2BUA4RTauUX62jQ.jpg','1996-11-12',89,'Released','I wish I may, I wish I might, become my sister for a night!','Wish Upon a Star',27681,3.413,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13419,_binary '\0','/nMfRuH0WOdl4UVn4t3BK4GlcJ1m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118200',6.1,2999,'ja','X -エックス-','It\'s the year of destiny, and 15 year old Kamui Shiro, a powerful psychic, has returned to Toyko after a 6 year absence, having left when he was very young. He wants to be with his childhood friends, Fuma (his best friend) and Kotori, Fuma\'s little sister (and Kamui\'s possible girlfriend). He wants to protect them from all dangers, but destiny and fate are haunting Kamui and pulling in himself and his beloved childhood friends. It is his destiny and his sole decision to decide the fate of the world, no matter if he wants the role or not. Now it is a matter of if he will join the side of the Seven Seals and become the Dragon of Heaven to save mankind or join the Seven Angels and become the Dragon of Earth to destroy all civilization so the earth can heal itself from man\'s destruction.','/irv0rrd34VGdxHRjI3AiJiXnAdo.jpg','1996-08-02',97,'Released','Their Destiny Was Foreordained 1999','X',44587,3.8293,6.2,'RdWnqfvrA1c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13420,_binary '\0','/vkRuuNbeEdWTVar2eGqpvjmvaKg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118247',5.1,1232,'en','20,000 Leagues Under the Sea','In the 19th century, an expert marine biologist is hired by the government to determine what\'s sinking ships all over the ocean. His daughter follows him. They are intercepted by a mysterious captain Nemo and his incredible submarine.','/8kVSztb6A7gA0K4eFJIxjzgdiH0.jpg','1997-03-23',95,'Released','Terror Lurks in the Depths...','20,000 Leagues Under the Sea',2965,1.9882,5.9,'fkAH5xXM1aw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13421,_binary '\0','/n4tvIJRlSBO0LyaBMhcTju54Aji.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118261',4.7,2219,'en','Asteroid','With the discovery of an incoming asteroid, the government of America formulate a plan to destroy it. When the plan fails, all the world can do is wait. The main impact zone is revealed to be Dallas, Texas. Generally, the plot follows the lives and reactions of several characters: an astronomer, her father, her son, two firefighters from Kansas, two young doctors in Dallas and the heads of the government agency in charge of the situation.','/5J99UfKU8xv66OF3uqi8sqlEAVO.jpg','1997-02-16',120,'Released','The End Of The World Is Just Beginning.','Asteroid',36609,2.2542,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13422,_binary '\0','/sZfK9Gy0mHbGjPte0lgXTprmIsI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118301',6,15833,'en','Dead Man on Campus','Two college roommates venture out to identify a fellow student, who is most likely to commit suicide as it will help them pass the semester.','/mTr7ARy7lj8ggvg6snLWDo3CnEu.jpg','1998-08-21',96,'Released','Roommate Wanted... For a Limited Time Only.','Dead Man on Campus',14557,4.0827,5.5,'PZbXDnXEpfk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13423,_binary '\0','/skTeEE3kZZG0w7sdMt51ZMW1ZaH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118308',7,6834,'en','Emma','Emma Woodhouse is a congenial young lady who delights in meddling in other people’s affairs. She is perpetually trying to unite men and women who are utterly wrong for each other. Despite her interest in romance, Emma is clueless about her own feelings, and her relationship with gentle Mr. Knightley.','/oBs9SdyQZXe4E9D1Na8iAA7qvLD.jpg','1996-10-02',107,'Released',NULL,'Emma',12254,4.2404,6.608,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13424,_binary '\0','/wtz8F6GmlajJWuYJRuhD2nH6SUy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118350',7.1,2346,'en','Intensity','Chyna Shepherd is a twenty-six-year-old psychology student who survived an extremely troubled past. While visiting Laura Templeton\'s house, a farm in the Napa Valley. A serial killer named Edgler Foreman Vess breaks into the house, killing Laura and her parents. Chyna survives, but she learns of Vess\'s captive: a girl, just as innocent as Chyna, trapped in Vess\'s home far from the Napa Valley.','/aMumOEvsvYXFJkCa6gu0TCaeHX9.jpg','1997-08-05',186,'Released',NULL,'Intensity',35608,1.2512,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13425,_binary '\0','/hFuklEFl76JkQrrOcMVsyhud5AC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118365',3,1458,'en','Justice League of America','The evil Weather Man is intent on destroying New Metro City with a series of malevolent meteorological mishaps. Can the super-powered (and semi-employed) Justice League of America save the day? Or will New Metro be drowned in a humongous tidal wave?','/6Bd04JTvYC5UPrgvEkeThst3jG6.jpg','1997-12-28',86,'Released',NULL,'Justice League of America',69336,2.1024,3.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13426,_binary '\0','/4qEnQSSv1WyeSN4TQSs89ic3ZQs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118523',4.8,3084,'en','\'Til There Was You','Two strangers, whose paths are always crossing, finally meet when fate steps in. It took them twenty years to fall in love at first sight.','/ndbW89bKquf5gMXgncY2fCkrIa.jpg','1997-05-30',113,'Released','It took them twenty years to fall in love at first sight.','\'Til There Was You',32872,2.9138,4.1,'haQ3SOYIoi8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13427,_binary '\0','/1TIHPWCFMmdpLSFBeghYdoD2FgP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118526',6.7,2250,'en','...First Do No Harm','When Lori Reimuller learns that her young son Robbie has epilepsy, she first trusts the judgment of the hospital staff in how best to bring it under control. As Robbie\'s health slides radically downhill, however, she becomes frustrated and desperate, and so does her own research into the existing literature on treatments. When she decides to try an alternative treatment called the Ketogenic Diet, devised long ago by a doctor from Johns Hopkins, she is met with narrow-minded resistance from Robbie\'s doctor, who is prepared to take legal action to prevent Lori from removing him from the hospital.','/iHR3DgBK7rVI1cQZX1DEck33qPC.jpg','1997-02-16',90,'Released','She went looking for help... and found a miracle','...First Do No Harm',26716,2.893,6.8,'sWkDP633kd8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13428,_binary '\0','/rTf1rucbSn8IaW4AU11lvBk3JmX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118528',7.8,21428,'en','12 Angry Men','During the trial of a man accused of his father\'s murder, a lone juror takes a stand against the guilty verdict handed down by the others as a result of their preconceptions and prejudices.','/whDdYx3lh1LHTN0VlPFt51fX29g.jpg','1997-08-17',117,'Released',NULL,'12 Angry Men',12219,7.1244,7.7,'s07eOhWSqQc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13429,_binary '\0','/U4NA0YZinyEQ8lJSVW8QPcffTN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118531',6.6,27279,'en','One Eight Seven','When a Brooklyn high school student writes the police code for homicide, 187, inside a textbook owned by teacher Trevor Garfield, Garfield feels threatened. The principal dismisses the incident, but the same student stabs Trevor soon after. Fifteen months later, a physically and emotionally scarred Trevor relocates to California and takes up substitute teaching. To his dismay, his new school is as full of dangerously undisciplined students as his old one—including four Latin Americans and a European American claiming membership in tagging gang K.O.S. (Kappin\' Off Suckers)—driving him over the edge.','/rPmmyspi1MZBItSvfx40qwep8ow.jpg','1997-07-29',119,'Released','When schools become war zones and both sides start taking casualties, what then?','One Eight Seven',6072,5.8299,6.682,'c5Su5PMMN7w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13430,_binary '\0','/q7soebyjssEwNulE3SsWX96UfSb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118539',3.1,13056,'en','3 Ninjas: High Noon at Mega Mountain','Three young boys, Rocky, Colt and Tum Tum together with their neighbor girl, computer whiz Amanda are visiting Mega Mountain amusement park when it is invaded by an army of ninjas led by evil Medusa, who wants to take over the park and hold the owners for ransom. Kids and retired TV star Dave Dragon, who made his farewell appearance at the park at the time the ninjas appeared, have to break Medusa\'s vicious plans.','/7jKefCfhcXLd1qVnmc1zBhSgPjh.jpg','1998-03-26',93,'Released','Saving the day the ninja way!','3 Ninjas: High Noon at Mega Mountain',32302,3.4121,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13431,_binary '\0','/73yBuG9gH1GWCooeXaFxUoNXziL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118540',7.8,3911,'en','4 Little Girls','On September 15, 1963, a bomb destroyed a black church in Birmingham, Alabama, killing four young girls who were there for Sunday school. It was a crime that shocked the nation--and a defining moment in the history of the civil-rights movement. Spike Lee re-examines the full story of the bombing, including a revealing interview with former Alabama Governor George Wallace.','/7kbV3fDjuy9dQmcuZuT9NKNAEix.jpg','1997-07-09',102,'Released','On that Birmingham Sunday the blood ran like wine','4 Little Girls',26580,2.0882,7.1,'qVw5RgZjBKs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13432,_binary '\0','/vPIrxnLMIpSQBPN0g0hWBUsxWyL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118541',5.4,11825,'en','8 Heads in a Duffel Bag','Mafia hitman Tommy Spinelli is flying to San Diego with a bag that holds eight severed heads, which he\'s bringing to his superiors to prove that some troublesome rival mobsters are permanently out of the picture. When his bag gets accidentally switched at the airport, Tommy must track down his duffel bag and the 8 heads it contains.','/dbjS5UH7JvsQwSLMYMY5GQOSwv1.jpg','1997-04-18',95,'Released','A mindless comedy.','8 Heads in a Duffel Bag',13982,3.4484,5.022,'nDDpEBmlCew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13433,_binary '\0','/cLftTzGw40BlLw8IggKSWDjKOQo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118548',6.7,65598,'en','Absolute Power','A master thief coincidentally is robbing a house where a murder—in which the President of the United States is involved—occurs in front of his eyes. He is forced to run, while holding evidence that could convict the President.','/jiwy7YaPHLN8s1SuXWGgQLKKNKE.jpg','1997-02-14',121,'Released','Corrupts absolutely.','Absolute Power',66,9.323,6.7,'QlwU9HXN8ds','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13434,_binary '\0','/u8qSrWBTvsFHPEy3Qy4ry4zFRua.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118554',6.1,3572,'sv','Adam & Eva','Adam and Eva have been married for four years. But the romance has disappeared from their relationship and has been replaced by boredom and old routine. When Adam meets his brother\'s baby-sitter, Jackie, he is immediately attracted to her. They have an affair, but Adam tell himself that they are only friends. However, when Eva finds out that he has a mistress, she leaves him. Adam tries to convince himself that he is free again, but soon realizes that he is still in love with Eva, and must win her back...','/QWPOG7KhWiPVlRkKVDDiKwp7u.jpg','1997-02-14',97,'Released',NULL,'Adam & Eva',54044,1.1522,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13435,_binary '\0','/35b11n97MKmmkjJoJcx8tqHIVJ2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118556',6.1,26879,'en','Addicted to Love','Good-natured astronomer Sam is devastated when the love of his life leaves him for a suave Frenchman. He therefore does what every other normal dumpee would do — go to New York and set up home in the abandoned building opposite his ex-girlfriend\'s apartment, wait until she decides to leave her current lover, and then win her back.','/sRfuSc6E9GvVaOHdPv4vG3ywfMw.jpg','1997-05-23',100,'Released','A Comedy About Lost Loves And Last Laughs','Addicted to Love',2058,4.6751,6.2,'-O6rOQvo_HM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13436,_binary '\0','/hNNlrvbqYqAPGRf4cCsrF3kBsM1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118564',6.9,21925,'en','Affliction','A small town policeman must investigate a suspicious hunting accident. The investigation and other events result in him slowly disintegrating mentally.','/hNu8ePwoRyXDQxhLY4iurCVXAQs.jpg','1998-02-12',114,'Released','Like father like son...?','Affliction',31662,3.7233,6.326,'yBvzSs2qo1c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13437,_binary '\0','/vaFeNRUmn8pvx4wYXnZn4XhtFWC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118566',6,4116,'en','Afterglow','Lucky Mann is a builder equally handy at repairs and seduction. The latest housewife to succumb to his charms is Marianne, unhappily married to corporate exec Jeffrey. When Jeffrey becomes enraptured by Lucky’s wife Phyllis, the four get caught in a love quadrangle that reignites their marriages.','/c13Luo9O09ah6nMPrsr3zqlLyF9.jpg','1997-12-26',114,'Released','A comedy of tears…','Afterglow',26941,2.7188,5.93,'TzXKj2X1TKI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13438,_binary '\0','/tTUOXTIKnBLOaoNbelpWomPKdho.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118570',5.4,21725,'en','Air Bud','A lonely boy befriends a stray dog who has a natural talent for basketball and together they experience the highs and lows of life as their friendship remains solid through a series of escapades.','/kDfzh6QdX2tseTwwyB7lp2RP7iE.jpg','1997-08-01',98,'Released','He Sits. He Stays. He Shoots. He Scores.','Air Bud',20737,5.8604,5.6,'0cOrwS3Xihw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13439,_binary '\0','/8IFCWQ0fQEukqNY7LAljl7DuFZf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118571',6.6,226035,'en','Air Force One','When Russian neo-nationalists hijack Air Force One, the world\'s most secure and extraordinary aircraft, the President is faced with a nearly impossible decision to give in to terrorist demands or sacrifice not only the country\'s dignity, but the lives of his wife and daughter.','/evO1iENjLpUnbwjnt5XK85jRYob.jpg','1997-07-25',124,'Released','The fate of the nation rests on the courage of one man.','Air Force One',9772,11.4688,6.467,'FItgZOuaPVY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13440,_binary '\0','/qGqD5YhRGeQzYkD9exKGhSX04KK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118577',3.5,3890,'en','An Alan Smithee Film: Burn, Hollywood, Burn','Filmmaker Alan Smithee finds himself the unwilling puppet of a potentially bad big budget action film, for which he proceeds to steal the reels, and leaves the cast and crew in a frenzy.','/KSGv5uV6SJS7mUMlttvLfWA6Lv.jpg','1998-02-27',86,'Released','The Movie Hollywood Doesn\'t Want You to See.','An Alan Smithee Film: Burn, Hollywood, Burn',78149,2.8199,3.9,'vDxeCkOymdA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13441,_binary '\0','/ikr0UILfvRerzMNoBTtJtyuWAEV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118583',6.2,294551,'en','Alien Resurrection','Two hundred years after Lt. Ripley died, a group of scientists clone her, hoping to breed the ultimate weapon. But the new Ripley is full of surprises … as are the new aliens. Ripley must team with a band of smugglers to keep the creatures from reaching Earth.','/9aRDMlU5Zwpysilm0WCWzU2PCFv.jpg','1997-11-12',109,'Released','It\'s already too late.','Alien Resurrection',8078,18.5143,6.2,'vu1tVYGsJ1Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13442,_binary '\0','/eC961epmTvph71l3f8Lxxr9TzCO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118586',6.5,3603,'en','All Over Me','Claude and Ellen are best friends who live in a not-so-nice area of New York. They\'re involved in the subculture of 90s youth, complete with drugs, live music, and homophobia. All is changed one night when a violent and meaningless death rocks their lives.','/31bWsFSSxhy1BrW3PgjQLD74GEp.jpg','1997-04-25',93,'Released','In a world that expects you to fit in, sometimes you have to stand out.','All Over Me',12793,1.6079,5.9,'d4AgoXREJSE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13443,_binary '\0','/57kRJI1QHTlOZoPEa0XSNwShpqY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118588',7.1,3176,'nl','All Stars','Seven young men who played soccer together since their early youth grow apart and are forced to think about the nature of their friendship. In a comic way and a very Dutch setting, All Stars is about pregnant girlfriends and homosexuality, career plans and the power of parents.','/7iF6qvTRIVafyqxlcZCIZEfRxxn.jpg','1997-05-01',115,'Released','A film about off-side, penetrating deeply and missed chances','All Stars',2764,1.0056,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13444,_binary '\0','/qSukSg6JBR3A4iEkRGIfHPC0W5H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118589',2.5,23473,'en','Glitter','A young woman is catapulted into pop stardom, with her already-famous DJ boyfriend calling the shots.','/388ru0R7fnBFPaVuJe4caRGGh54.jpg','2001-09-21',104,'Released','In music she found her dream, her love, herself.','Glitter',10696,3.7545,4.3,'QaKxGrajnzY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13445,_binary '\0','/3EGB5wRA3IdocXFCaqm98PLOvlB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118591',6.2,1342,'cn','97家有囍事','Old Mr. Lo has three sons and the youngest one Lo Kung is his favorite. However, Kung does nothing but fool around all day long. Old Mr. Lo is very annoyed about this. The relationship between father and son is thus affected. So on Kung\'s birthday, his two brothers decide to play a joke on him. They trick him into believing he has won the lottery. Kung is so happy that he spends a tremendous amount of money. When he realizes he is in huge debt, he pretends to go insane and the whole family believes him.','/w1gA67JnlAhkw1DR6RPERTrh2ov.jpg','1997-02-06',90,'Released',NULL,'All\'s Well, End\'s Well \'97',64083,2.2038,6.4,'xZ6ShE-zkcE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13446,_binary '\0','/i8pbee3D83gC51jMnHK8XzyX29n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118603',5.9,1631,'en','American Perfekt','Criminal psychiatrist, Jake Nyman is taking a much needed vacation from responsibility. An experimental road trip during which ever decision will be made on a flip of a coin. Meanwhile, Sandra Thomas, disenchanted professional, is en route to pick up her flunked out sister, Alice, at a cheap motel before continuing on to visit their ailing mother. After being forced off the road by a mysterious assailant, however, Sandra is picked up by Jake, who\'s coin flipping amoral attitude quickly excites her own desire to break a few rules. Or worse. Jake and Sandra\'s romance is soon driven by chance acts of crime and kindness, all governed by the flip of a coin - at least until Sandra mysteriously disappears and Jake unwittingly picks up her suspicious sister, Alice ...','/hjD0Vi9VPukK2KBrhZudyCcaO4X.jpg','1997-06-11',100,'Released','The Road to Hell is Paved with Good Intentions','American Perfekt',55902,1.8523,6.5,'R1XAIq_oipU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13447,_binary '\0','/3umSuaSibCcNGAnsWYUyauLTZwE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118604',5.1,29285,'en','An American Werewolf in Paris','An American man unwittingly gets involved with werewolves who have developed a serum allowing them to transform at will.','/1NUOprbP7LLfKPArLJY7wziUiHT.jpg','1997-05-29',98,'Released','Things are about to get a little hairy.','An American Werewolf in Paris',9406,6.8796,5.9,'T6d3_4bFXIU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13448,_binary '\0','/AmTrqk910ot3aYLBGyIG78Xfa18.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118607',7.3,88718,'en','Amistad','In 1839, the slave ship Amistad set sail from Cuba to America. During the long trip, Cinque leads the slaves in an unprecedented uprising. They are then held prisoner in Connecticut, and their release becomes the subject of heated debate. Freed slave Theodore Joadson wants Cinque and the others exonerated and recruits property lawyer Roger Baldwin to help his case. Eventually, John Quincy Adams also becomes an ally.','/6QqNyIHKow0jngiQgTNBOBrLILM.jpg','1997-12-10',155,'Released','Freedom is not given. It is our right at birth. But there are moments when it must be taken.','Amistad',11831,1.5592,7.013,'BJFDOvGMD0U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13449,_binary '\0','/e2oO1FPwMiDEi119rJJspYI6TiG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118615',5,127262,'en','Anaconda','A \'National Geographic\' film crew is taken hostage by an insane hunter, who takes them along on his quest to capture the world\'s largest — and deadliest — snake.','/33NysOnLpLZY0ewHTcfpalzAsRG.jpg','1997-04-11',90,'Released','When you can\'t breathe, you can\'t scream.','Anaconda',9360,11.1695,5.3,'ZkjWyIdIBJo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13450,_binary '\0','/h6VshReCGaGQoaGZwT2wqiqrcZW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118617',7.2,148565,'en','Anastasia','Ten years after she was separated from her family, an eighteen-year-old orphan with vague memories of the past sets out to Paris in hopes of reuniting with her grandmother. She is accompanied by two con men, who intend to pass her off as the Grand Duchess Anastasia to the Dowager Empress for a reward.','/bppGWGA8zq1sRvTdDJnUzVW9GcH.jpg','1997-11-20',94,'Released','Discover the adventure behind the greatest mystery of our time.','Anastasia',9444,10.1391,7.601,'1vC1Ju__0R8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13451,_binary '\0','/54vvW1BSmFS7I23F4XEgV2B2QM1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118618',4.7,1219,'en','Angels in the Endzone','The football team Jesse is on is terrible, and after the death of his father Jesse quits the team. Then angels come to help the team get better and nobody can see them but Jesse\'s little brother.','/8CGoV5Lmw7Ex2jfizZTPPEZpHHo.jpg','1997-11-09',87,'Released',NULL,'Angels in the Endzone',36986,1.7722,5.6,'ONGoQhLbFe0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13452,_binary '\0','/teVi7XIrQDKMsIMCcZeM42vTKvc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118623',6.3,6474,'en','Anna Karenina','In Imperial Russia, Anna, wife of the officer Karenin, goes to Moscow to visit her brother. On the way, she meets charming cavalry officer Vronsky, to whom she\'s immediately attracted. But in St. Petersburg’s high society, a relationship like this could destroy a woman’s reputation.','/6YWh035E2jhiWs57A2LMg1c9mv4.jpg','1997-04-04',108,'Released','In a world of power and privilege, one woman dared to obey her heart.','Anna Karenina',50512,4.5223,6.1,'my7icJ-mfmc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13453,_binary '\0','/iDNA5Bbl9NgcYbyn8dDrpnf2MUt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118632',7.2,16114,'en','The Apostle','After his happy life spins out of control, a preacher from Texas changes his name, goes to Louisiana and starts preaching on the radio.','/9KqCzLhWbFMBPjqRpZ69izRiYgG.jpg','1997-12-19',134,'Released','The hardest soul to save was his own.','The Apostle',2895,3.6141,6.3,'nkL2wYSydN4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13454,_binary '\0','/5Y6PE1gTFGNf3RmsIDfmBZ1ILUp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118635',6.9,3907,'it','Aprile','Nanni Moretti once again muses on the ebb and flow of life in April 1996, as he is about to become a father for the first time and finds himself unable to focus on his documentary about the upcoming general elections, where the left is heading into a rematch against Berlusconi.','/uiAzaXYtEwoc91V6cFuImqkke4y.jpg','1998-03-27',78,'Released',NULL,'Aprile',32117,1.3129,7.3,'BrtdZKYVNhA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13455,_binary '\0','/xQpsxWPaAZW77G1L2Nzi2EAhizZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118636',6.7,44661,'en','Apt Pupil','One day in 1984, Todd Bowden, a brilliant high school boy fascinated by the history of Nazism, stumbles across an old man whose appearance resembles that of Kurt Dussander, a wanted Nazi war criminal. A month later, Todd decides to knock on his door.','/pU3fvfSvrs5pZFdODPCzoLk95Ws.jpg','1998-10-23',107,'Released','If you don\'t believe in the existence of evil, you\'ve got a lot to learn','Apt Pupil',9445,4.5699,6.5,'Nqe-VWnwACY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13456,_binary '\0','/qaBFoqsOsDJueaHKM86AxAbB13V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118644',6.4,2368,'fr','Assassin(s)','Old professional killer Wagner seeks someone to teach what he knows as long as he is already dying, and he chooses Max, young and passionless thief to be his successor.','/cq6qzZTrBtMfGaoco5SMgOd4IlI.jpg','1997-04-30',133,'Released',NULL,'Assassin(s)',34068,1.8466,6.3,'etUywUc2_Yg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13457,_binary '\0','/utFqtzVFwwpjYDMr5XSI8vhHxXW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118645',4.1,1316,'en','Assault on Devil\'s Island','When one of Mike McBride\'s men goes rogue and takes a group of gymnasts hostage to Devil\'s Island in exchange for the return of drug lord Carlos Gallindo, the SEALS face their most perilous assignment yet.','/dWewLlQQR51ckBgHYtY6NUuZ0wI.jpg','1997-10-28',94,'Released','Pray They\'re on Your Side','Assault on Devil\'s Island',92011,2.1327,4.2,'OgwhJTuzxFE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13458,_binary '\0','/c70FgVZ2e34xyJqN4rEGuiAAre2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118647',6.8,10690,'en','The Assignment','Jack Shaw has experienced the terror first-hand. He\'s a top CIA agent who\'s tracked international killer-for-hire Carlos \"The Jackal\" Sanchez for over twenty years and barely survived Carlos\' devastating bombing of a Parisian cafe. Now, he finally gets a break when he discovers Carlos\' dead ringer: American naval officer and dedicated family man Annibal Ramirez.','/lhuV5cvxFhUrB6F4smVZGmdSwbT.jpg','1997-09-28',119,'Released',NULL,'The Assignment',18355,4.0235,6.32,'rD0MQC41xk0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13459,_binary '\0','/mWxJEFRMvkG4UItYJkRDMgWQ08Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118652',4.9,2024,'en','The Attic Expeditions','Trevor Blackburn is accused of murdering his girlfriend, Faith, in a brutal ritual. He\'s sentenced to live in an experimental rehabilitation community and falls into a coma. When he wakes up, he meets the mysterious Dr. Ek, who tortures Trevor in an attempt to learn the whereabouts of a powerful occult book. As other patients start to disappear, Trevor begins to wonder who and where he really is.','/b0p8CjMLWc7B1nnIfFQ2uY3HLe0.jpg','2001-04-05',100,'Released','His search for peace of mind... will leave his mind in pieces.','The Attic Expeditions',17140,2.0972,5.1,'AuIKCKlDz1E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13460,_binary '\0','/wSm5McaHSAyOx4gGRYdlDHzj00y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118655',7,276125,'en','Austin Powers: International Man of Mystery','As a swinging fashion photographer by day and a groovy British superagent by night, Austin Powers is the \'60s\' most shagadelic spy. But can he stop megalomaniac Dr. Evil after the bald villain freezes himself and unthaws in the \'90s? With the help of sexy sidekick Vanessa Kensington, he just might.','/5uD4dxNX8JKFjWKYMHyOsqhi5pN.jpg','1997-05-02',89,'Released','Debonair. Defiant. Defrosted.','Austin Powers: International Man of Mystery',816,11.3977,6.602,'9HGy-c4_xFg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13461,_binary '\0','/sCJb30Oo9natGgVZbLZEDRqZlAz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118660',4.6,1321,'hi','औज़ार','Suraj, who is a police officer, discovers that Yash, his friend\'s father, runs an illegal business. He must now convince Yash to make his father mend his ways or face criticism from his superiors for not confronting him.','/6lchKwXaCNNzOr0sWorkww3yIZq.jpg','1997-02-28',133,'Released','The Weapon','Auzaar',161237,1.1709,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13462,_binary '\0','/ftr9GcaD97CRSKRftx4FtTHfhfa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118661',3.8,46003,'en','The Avengers','British Ministry agent John Steed, under direction from \"Mother\", investigates a diabolical plot by arch-villain Sir August de Wynter to rule the world with his weather control machine. Steed investigates the beautiful Doctor Mrs. Emma Peel, the only suspect, but simultaneously falls for her and joins forces with her to combat Sir August.','/1p5thyQ4pCy876HpdvFARqJ62N9.jpg','1998-08-13',89,'Released','She\'s Peel. He\'s Steed. Their world is a dangerous place. And they love it.','The Avengers',9320,6.2196,4.443,'-NfKTtTozWg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13463,_binary '\0','/HDPq5KVV9Yw2H0fhvMug3Oi9Xv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118663',4.9,6407,'en','B.A.P.S','Two wannabe Black American princesses aim to marry rich men, who will pay for their world\'s first combination hair salon and soul food restaurant.','/yi40NrDfdv8vX0aoWvis3CnCVWj.jpg','1997-03-28',90,'Released','These Pretty Women... Are Clueless!','B.A.P.S',18423,2.9722,5.4,'cHPpnwYVV8s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13464,_binary '\0','/ywSzDrauG6R52H2zg0HkrPRgvYE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118665',2.6,28534,'en','Baby Geniuses','BabyCo is the world\'s leading manufacturer in baby products. However, what the public doesn\'t know, is that Drs Kinder and Heep, two of its most brilliant scientists, are tirelessly working in complete secrecy to crack the indecipherable code to \'baby talk\': a highly sophisticated language, and the key to the secrets of the universe. Before long, problems arise when mischievous Sly, the smartest of the toddlers, escapes confinement, bent on uniting all babies to free those trapped in the laboratory. Now, Kinder and Heep must find Sly before it is too late.','/7zvPhjHkz5YEMUMPyvANCR96RJA.jpg','1999-03-12',95,'Released','Think innocent. Think helpless. Think again. Naps are history.','Baby Geniuses',22345,5.3738,4.1,'-gDV8LSw4NY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13465,_binary '\0','/v9joeyWOSoo0kMbudwRcesalaXc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118670',5.3,2175,'en','Bad Day on the Block','When decorated firefighter Lyle Wilder is restrained from seeing his wife and child after abuse allegations, he turns his attention to his neighbours. During a heatwave, what starts as a neighbourly feud turns into outright assault.','/bXBxNAsu1lPp3ijj55qYDxOayYR.jpg','1997-08-22',88,'Released','Everyone has a breaking point','Under Pressure',71456,2.8805,5.5,'QZGcpLFedKw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13466,_binary '\0','/1p7DagTWpPauCbXQ3vmgQLlqbid.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118673',5.9,4033,'hi','Bade Miyan Chote Miyan','Arjun and Pyare are two police officers witha friendly rivalry, who get framed for various crimes being committed by their doppelgangers.','/1iiBcRXR8OFDyfXitR5W72z7rrU.jpg','1998-10-06',142,'Released',NULL,'Bade Miyan Chote Miyan',46373,1.8428,5.762,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13467,_binary '\0','/aEN29N9PX6oD5imdLTK06D3XJdO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118678',5.1,3725,'de','Ballermann 6','Tommie and Mario travel to Mallorca in search of a vacation fueled by alcohol and the desire for women and parties.','/e2Bzix31c1MG4DAYEeyHHanlSvD.jpg','1997-10-16',95,'Released','The movie the nation waits for!','Ballermann 6',9527,1.4648,5,'fVR8yJjnhjI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13468,_binary '\0','/zVApBM3g8aq5Dco40kOx5NEaIvb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118682',6.4,3442,'de','Bandits','Four female cons who have formed a band in prison get a chance to play at a police ball outside the walls. They take the chance to escape. Being on the run from the law they even make it to sell their music and become famous outlaws.','/ozF6lrPxtHncA4MNqPbGrqm0lEH.jpg','1997-07-03',110,'Released','They always wanted to be famous – they never knew they’d be wanted','Bandits',11526,1.9051,6.017,'yRisDSqRXfs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13469,_binary '\0','/rgaWBcsjj85v3jxuRpHHrHK0zuM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118686',5.8,2285,'en','Basil','A lonely young aristocrat in turn-of the century England struggles to meet the approval of his over-bearing, class-conscious father while trying to please the selfish woman he loves.','/dwEVoYhQE3MUykPb345UotKZOOY.jpg','1998-07-22',113,'Released',NULL,'Basil',37613,1.5351,5.5,'h0uTLyF-qHw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13470,_binary '\0','/kEuQWHte2erRpAICrYqkAZaZAAY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118688',3.8,285026,'en','Batman & Robin','Batman and his sidekick Robin attempt to the foil the sinister schemes of a deranged set of new villains, most notably the melancholy Mr. Freeze, who wants to make Gotham City into an arctic region, and the sultry Poison Ivy, a botanical femme fatale. As the Dynamic Duo contend with these bad guys, a third hero, Batgirl, joins the ranks of the city\'s crime-fighters.','/i7hEUpDuMN2LOrCEifFyGSHZQSY.jpg','1997-06-20',125,'Released','Strength now. Courage always. Family, above all. Batman and Robin!','Batman & Robin',415,16.5547,4.393,'Zc7sjDHW2KY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13471,_binary '\0','/xvBvwR3NWn1K8YcByJJhB7pYoKu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118689',6.5,117405,'en','Bean','Childlike Englishman, Mr. Bean, is an incompetent watchman at the Royal National Gallery. After the museum\'s board of directors\' attempt to have him fired is blocked by the chairman, who has taken a liking to Bean, they send him to Los Angeles to act as their ambassador for the unveiling of a historic painting to humiliate him. Fooled, Mr. Bean must now successfully unveil the painting or risk his and a hapless Los Angeles curator\'s termination.','/IwrDPrB4d2DMcpnGkvan46yINL.jpg','1997-07-03',89,'Released','One man. One masterpiece. One very big mistake.','Bean',1281,7.9303,6.48,'-jCq13TtzRY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13472,_binary '\0','/9OIONHl9OBmQLbUHaPcnNtEDvF0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118691',5.5,10702,'en','The Beautician and the Beast','A New York City beautician is mistakenly hired as the school teacher for the children of the president of a small Eastern European country.','/s2RaTrqoPvD4eYEaZCyF0zFbbpV.jpg','1997-02-07',105,'Released','Once upon a time...','The Beautician and the Beast',17894,5.119,6.718,'mI6p6BHQHL4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13473,_binary '\0','/ffQFnAUm2Uu4RU0nijpjPRf9TBT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118694',8,191531,'cn','花樣年華','In 1960s Hong Kong, two neighbors form an intimate bond after making a discovery about their spouses in this visually stunning tale of unrequited love.','/8BgGbbWiLNhPtkMkN0gGTnbtvBv.jpg','2000-09-29',99,'Released','Feel the heat, keep the feeling burning, let the sensation explode.','In the Mood for Love',843,16.7651,8.1,'m8GuedsQnWQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13474,_binary '\0','/o0qPyAxebCBroqm4BpDyO3dfISI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118696',4.9,1365,'en','Below Utopia','Daniel returns to his family\'s mansion for the holidays along with his girlfriend Susanne. His family\'s seemingly-utopian existence is overshadowed by not only the death of Daniel\'s brother, but also by Daniel\'s failure to live up to his brother\'s potential. However, this quickly becomes inconsequential, as blood-thirsty killers soon show up..','/n9cIhPd5WtAx1Id1CshEYv5Fji9.jpg','1997-09-26',88,'Released','He was a hired professional. But this was personal.','Below Utopia',50835,1.7888,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13475,_binary '\0','/zrc9EoqrKOGy3QBDr6keuqH32wd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118698',7.1,9432,'en','Bent','Max is a handsome young man who, after a fateful tryst with a German soldier, is forced to run for his life. Eventually Max is placed in a concentration camp where he pretends to be Jewish because in the eyes of the Nazis, gays are the lowest form of human being. But it takes a relationship with an openly gay prisoner to teach Max that without the love of another, life is not worth living.','/mTRIVPmRK01rgLlE6XJPGbbRdXb.jpg','1997-11-26',105,'Released','In a time of war, they found themselves in the most dangerous place of all. In love.','Bent',19601,2.6663,6.9,'GA0CCzh3x_g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13476,_binary '\0','/5VwdwYzid9LHYL1yMtvkENfM9NQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118702',5.5,3186,'en','Best Men','Four tuxedo clad men show up at a penitentiary to meet a friend who has just been released after three years in prison and is going straight from the jail to marry his girlfriend. En route to the wedding, one of the men asks to stop by a bank to pick up some cash. As it turns out, he is a wanted bank robber who uses Shakespeare passages during his robberies and thus has become known as \"Hamlet\". Soon all five men are caught up in the bank and involved in the robbery as they end up in a hostage situation. The hostage negotiator shows up who turns out to be Hamlet\'s father.','/dDutboDhQeIGZ0VOMI8RkM7MWm3.jpg','1997-10-17',90,'Released','A comedy thriller about four men, a wedding and everybody\'s funeral.','Best Men',19952,1.8292,5.3,'Iz3LHk12Gx4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13477,_binary '\0','/8eX3x7BXwrkLw0hhiHuZ8E0TLmn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118708',5.6,47437,'en','Beverly Hills Ninja','Haru, an orphaned American who washes ashore in Japan and is mistaken for the great White Ninja of legend. Raised among the finest Ninjas, Haru grows strong and big - very big. With the grace of all Three Stooges rolled into one body, Haru is an embarrassment to his clan. But when a beautiful blonde pleads for his help, Haru is given one dangerous, disastrously funny chance to prove himself.','/wAD7nnWh4e6wweffwmkLbf35uf0.jpg','1997-01-17',88,'Released','He puts the Mortal back in Kombat.','Beverly Hills Ninja',9622,6.0667,5.7,'XSwpv54VgK8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13478,_binary '\0','/77ElMccPnTMPouRxSdbJ4nEjf69.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118715',8.1,924563,'en','The Big Lebowski','Jeffrey \'The Dude\' Lebowski, a Los Angeles slacker who only wants to bowl and drink White Russians, is mistaken for another Jeffrey Lebowski, a wheelchair-bound millionaire, and finds himself dragged into a strange series of events involving nihilists, adult film producers, ferrets, errant toes, and large sums of money.','/3bv6WAp6BSxxYvB5ozKFUYuRA8C.jpg','1998-03-06',117,'Released','Times like these call for a Big Lebowski.','The Big Lebowski',115,19.3932,7.835,'3QY0ckqBgDw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13479,_binary '\0','/vyT3N9WnldkCfojnCnZzcfVl6ma.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118734',5.4,3175,'en','The Blackout','A debauched Hollywood movie actor tries to piece together one wild night in Miami years earlier which remains a drug-induced blur, and soon finds out that some questions about his past are best left unanswered.','/rvwaJUDsy4Zx9VRb0xiOCpmQZF9.jpg','1997-06-11',98,'Released','The darkest secrets are the ones we hide from ourselves','The Blackout',25690,1.9797,5.8,'S2PqjYSirus','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13480,_binary '\0','/131bBqq4EJFqywvwaWagsip4ISr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118735',6,1246,'en','Blackrock','In New South Wales, Jared surfs with his mates and has a first girl. He hosts a beach party for his older pal, Ricko, and witnesses four of his mates gang-rape a 15 year old. He does nothing, and the next day, she\'s found murdered. At school, the boys and the girls react: the girls with anger at the perpetrators, the boys with jeering at the dead girl\'s morality. The students\' parents have their own responses. Jared retreats into angry silence, disgusted that he did nothing to help the dead girl. Meanwhile, his mother wants to talk to him about her impending cancer surgery, the police want to know what he saw, and his friend Ricko wants an alibi. Jared\'s cracking under the pressure.','/36EyDOPw8tvGhvVqi3msNPDYSoY.jpg','1997-05-01',90,'Released','When all you can hear is your own silence.','Blackrock',81530,1.1452,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13481,_binary '\0','/bMPIc12GOP0PlOKNVwLmigEi3Dz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118736',6.4,8580,'en','Six-String Samurai','In a post-apocalyptic world where the Russians have taken over a nuked USA and Elvis is king of Lost Vegas, Buddy is a \'50s rocker and wandering warrior rolled into one, too-cool package. Armed with his six-string in one hand and his sword in the other, Buddy is on his way to Vegas to succeed Elvis as King. Along the way, he saves an orphan who decides to tag along.','/4Lo0pT1gnDAL4hTVMYLwpVWcqR1.jpg','1998-09-18',91,'Released','Vegas Needs a New King.','Six-String Samurai',24746,1.8793,6.2,'uYHtoRJjOb4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13482,_binary '\0','/dQoqaOal5WLkvY2moxUmX2f4xsM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118742',6,3179,'en','Bliss','On his wedding day, Joseph nervously admits that his wife is not quite like other women. But his beautiful bride is more than just the \"impulsive, compulsive, obsessive\" woman he thinks he knows. And when Joseph discovers she is hiding troubling secrets, it sends them both on a sexual odyssey that will either destroy or redeem their relationship.','/zGdGINvf9oSysprbWnu85dIM7rc.jpg','1997-04-14',103,'Released','A daring love story that breaks all the rules.','Bliss',63945,2.6601,6.435,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13483,_binary '\0','/rMCZoAVjXmZq26ujyq84khtRG4P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118744',5.5,14914,'en','Hush','Jackson and Helen are in love and about to have their first child when they move in with Jackson\'s mother, Martha, in order to take care of the family estate. But all is not well in this household. Martha is jealous of her son\'s affection for Helen, and, despite her Southern smile, she\'s starting to act strangely. As Helen tries to create a happy home life, Martha attempts to divide the family so that Jackson will become hers alone.','/muUx7SqlYE9kb1W4xzK7AaJueeN.jpg','1998-03-06',95,'Released','Don\'t breathe a word.','Hush',17941,3.6636,5.7,'BmtVg6zxADw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13484,_binary '\0','/71DtMxDy6W936jBkNVWAGvxYFCo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118747',4.9,36417,'en','Blues Brothers 2000','Finally released from prison, Elwood Blues is once again enlisted by Sister Mary Stigmata in her latest crusade to raise funds for a children\'s hospital. Hitting the road to re-unite the band and win the big prize at the New Orleans Battle of the Bands, Elwood is pursued cross-country by the cops.','/m8UyxXAaD3aorRKAZxed0LUvTd2.jpg','1998-02-06',123,'Released','The Blues are back.','Blues Brothers 2000',11568,5.8288,5.3,'jtOdLDXCfyM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13485,_binary '\0','/ArpTzQZHWh4UVsgUvV6S7WjTq1n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118749',7.9,309691,'en','Boogie Nights','In 1977, an idealistic porn producer and his promising protege try to catch up with the end of an era before their never-ending party collides with cold, hard reality.','/2hVSN9yOfoI8EUTqcVW6zCIyQ1G.jpg','1997-10-07',156,'Released','The life of a dreamer, the days of a business and the nights in between.','Boogie Nights',4995,12.7153,7.635,'6__jTfyCMsc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13486,_binary '\0','/yDN1cTJk0JVMlbJ0dwOntEdOpvM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118750',5.5,10213,'en','Booty Call','Rushon is sexually pent-up and ready to take thing things to the next level with his girlfriend, Nikki. But when he calls for a date, she asks to make it a double — bringing along her brash friend, Lysterine, whom Rushon sets up with his lewd buddy, Bunz. Things go better than expected. As the evening transitions from the restaurant to the bedroom, the two men go on a madcap search for what will surely make the night complete: condoms.','/1pQpHVm3AXIwbBUnwGEQ0q95E0L.jpg','1997-02-26',79,'Released','Some guys will do anything for a little somethin\', somethin\'.','Booty Call',21915,3.8793,5.3,'wdaNdRAOlJU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13487,_binary '\0','/zawV2nF32ajisU7GG0M0mINTXpY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118751',8,20628,'hi','सीमा','Amidst the 1971 Indo-Pak war, a company of 120 Indian soldiers stationed at the border region of Longewala in Rajasthan must defend their post through the night against two thousand Pakistani troops armed with tanks. Based on the true events of the Battle of Longewala.','/qBfe7zVYWxeBm1SaOa2rPsQSi9A.jpg','1997-06-13',176,'Released',NULL,'Border',33125,2.3796,6.5,'e8XHBK7OdFk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13488,_binary '\0','/ndLim5pNt2EclFPMt3FzltlVM05.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118755',5.9,24021,'en','The Borrowers','The four-inch-tall Clock family secretly share a house with the normal-sized Lender family, \"borrowing\" such items as thread, safety pins, batteries and scraps of food. However, their peaceful co-existence is disturbed when evil lawyer Ocious P. Potter steals the will granting title to the house, which he plans to demolish in order to build apartments. The Lenders are forced to move, and the Clocks face the risk of being exposed to the normal-sized world.','/kgaocWyuxihDe5aNqok6fORIHnY.jpg','1997-12-05',87,'Released','Little People. Big Trouble. Lots of fun.','The Borrowers',9449,6.8426,6.1,'lgZQ8gyUlwI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13489,_binary '\0','/vQdHQip4YTxiOldOf2bhvNCMUJu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118756',6.9,4118,'fr','Le Bossu','France, 17th century, during the reign of Louis XIII. When a dear friend, the Duke of Nevers, is treacherously assassinated by a powerful relative, a skilled swordsman, the noble Henri de Lagardère, seeks his rightful vengeance as he tries to protect the innocent life of the duke\'s last heir.','/3tNL0uM1SNSfN2d1mKSBB5Ih6FH.jpg','1997-12-03',128,'Released','Some things are worth dying for','On Guard',40815,1.9174,6.674,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13490,_binary '\0','/37iU8su1kQgylRqpbhzGb2KtrWF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118760',7,23962,'en','The Boxer','Nineteen-year-old Danny Flynn is imprisoned for his involvement with the I.R.A. in Belfast. He leaves behind his family and his sixteen-year-old girlfriend, Maggie Hamill. Fourteen years later, Danny is released from prison and returns to his old working class neighborhood to resume his life as a boxer.','/wsbNQWMQV4HwwqXtvQUoBfiBzK8.jpg','1997-12-31',114,'Released','Love is always worth fighting for.','The Boxer',16992,3.7296,6.7,'UlcM-1Rm9Eo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13491,_binary '\0','/6XhosgxUt4kQQfxNCC5xSTdc6Q2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118763',6.3,1446,'en','The Boys Club','Three teenage boys in small-town Southern Ontario are thrilled when Luke Cooper, a mysterious American fugitive with a gunshot wound in his leg, decides to crash their secret hideout. Luke tells them that he\'s a cop on the run from corrupt colleagues, and swears them to silence. As he recuperates, he becomes their buddy and confidante. By the time the boys realize Luke is not who he pretends to be, they\'re in way over their heads','/axn4MXeCdFCOG7i8i6DvbolzZeG.jpg','1996-09-19',91,'Released','A crime to get in, murder to get out.','The Boys Club',73339,1.3975,5.7,'VwnRKpxEvME','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13492,_binary '\0','/c3Tq6V9qHG89szM5F10HOiUQh4A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118764',6.7,2383,'fr','Les Boys','Every Monday evening, at the arena, eleven men get together to lovingly put on the jersey of the Boys, the hockey team of a \"garage\" league to which they belong. As Stan, their revered trainer, would affectionately say, they have the \"puck\" tattooed on their hearts. It doesn\'t matter if they are lawyers, policemen, mechanics or unemployed, as soon as they enter the locker room, everyone forgets their age, their work and their problems.','/bOlQ91qtobEIt96YB7yNBRGqjQk.jpg','1997-12-12',107,'Released','Nothing in the world would make them miss their weekly game...','The Boys',42832,1.3021,6.2,'dQHhinKxC_0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13493,_binary '\0','/yJcWW0FfGu63cFCGN6G2BoMKiis.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118766',5.4,1242,'en','Southie','South Boston Irish bad boy Danny Quinn returns back home from New York and gets stuck between his pals, who are supported by one Irish mafia clan, and his family, which are members of another.','/a67OFrGDa7KYkqPJNyqFgWmUKqI.jpg','1998-06-10',95,'Released','The toughest thing about South Boston is coming back.','Southie',55989,1.3634,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13494,_binary '\0','/g5821JEdxqj8bUBDV1FDhHbZkRa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118767',7.8,29424,'ru','Брат','Danila goes to his successful brother, Victor, in Petersburg to start a new life. Unknown to Danila, Victor is a contract killer, but is in hiding after asking for too much money to assassinate a Chechen mob boss. To avoid exposure, Victor convinces Danila to kill the boss instead.','/dxeVQdd227B367xQxvabkYTfz0b.jpg','1997-12-12',96,'Released',NULL,'Brother',20992,2.6555,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13495,_binary '\0','/eDqf1F85rU7cxUeBBArL6k2QVtv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118768',6.1,11376,'en','The Brave','A down-on-his-luck American Indian recently released from jail is offered the chance to \"star\" as the victim of a snuff film, the resulting pay of which could greatly help his poverty stricken family.','/Img3pLjIsZQbOzAqei0v5920Vi.jpg','1997-07-30',123,'Released',NULL,'The Brave',9956,2.5189,6,'ireAmF8RXrs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13496,_binary '\0','/e86x1nXqfXRlqATuy60MmzFUFQr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118771',7,71854,'en','Breakdown','On their cross-country drive, a married couple, Jeff and Amy Taylor, experience car trouble after their SUV breaks down. Stranded in the New Mexico desert, the two catch a break when a passing truck driver offers Amy a ride to a nearby café to call for help. Meanwhile, Jeff is able to fix the car and make his way to the café, but Amy isn\'t there. He tracks down the trucker ― who tells the police he\'s never seen Jeff or his wife before. Jeff then begins a desperate, frenzied search for Amy.','/m3VB59ppr1RlpxNUYRUfZTgjgU.jpg','1997-05-02',93,'Released','It could happen to you.','Breakdown',2163,6.8708,6.946,'ECIc4pX8zKA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13497,_binary '\0','/3jFTUy2OFbH6KPeA89eBPEthjBt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118772',4.8,3311,'en','Breaking Up','An aloof, struggling food photographer thinks he has found true love with a fiery grade-school teacher. At first, the relationship is all wine and roses, but as they realize they have little in common besides great sex, the romance wanes, and they struggle through a succession of break-ups and reunions as they try to work things out.','/tWOQOOAvwDA3KbDCSQH3NoBgimc.jpg','1997-10-17',90,'Released',NULL,'Breaking Up',26393,2.5127,4.644,'z5WmsvW-Uro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13498,_binary '\0','/da7AbXHPpBL8hjphP7Up83KU4Pg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118785',6.7,2150,'no','Budbringeren','Dimwitted, somewhat misanthropic Oslo mail carrier Roy\'s quiet life changes dramatically on the day he steals a set of keys and lets himself into the apartment of a deaf woman who seems to be in trouble with a psychotic criminal. Though he doesn\'t know it at the time, his and her fate are about to intertwine and this is not going to be to his benefit.','/adQQdVMN2wC5HJ94BiAMeyP7pZb.jpg','1997-02-21',83,'Released','Sometimes adventure comes in the least likely package','Junk Mail',34582,0.833,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13499,_binary '\0','/cr4cjSzRe904PmxwV1FhETlgwiW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118787',4.8,2986,'en','Buddy','An eccentric socialite raises a gorilla as her son.','/jdKwul2ePJ7vjdlzgxB1mme5S8B.jpg','1997-06-06',84,'Released','Welcome to a family that will make yours seem tame','Buddy',15170,2.8,5,'WMvW_-N9FUM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13500,_binary '\0','/ojf5ZwmVz5DaHS9x53falPtvfSu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118788',7,2899,'es','La buena estrella','Rafael, a lonely 40-something butcher, saves a pregnant Marina from an assault by her boyfriend Daniel. Rafael agrees to take Marina in and they happily raise the child together. Years later, Daniel re-enters their lives and turns them upside down.','/tX90wXNHJYvlHYjK67CnftdzkWJ.jpg','1997-05-30',95,'Released',NULL,'Lucky Star',97295,1.2993,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13501,_binary '\0','/oCcRRoalUWy83x3gqhCIl6pPUAi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118789',7.4,67573,'en','Buffalo \'66','Billy is released after five years in prison. In the next moment, he kidnaps teenage student Layla and visits his parents with her, pretending she is his girlfriend and they will soon marry.','/fxzXFzbSGNA52NHQCMqQiwzMIQw.jpg','1998-01-20',110,'Released','Billy Brown just got out of jail. Now he’s going to serve some real time. He’s going home.','Buffalo \'66',9464,6.3153,7.13,'r7JXNyiPBIQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13502,_binary '\0','/zoflkUluMA01vxvifWqhmr4sA2q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118798',6.8,28376,'en','Bulworth','A suicidally disillusioned liberal politician puts a contract out on himself and takes the opportunity to be bluntly honest with his voters by affecting the rhythms and speech of hip-hop music and culture.','/gR9jZ7W2d28aSa2Yimz797VNXRh.jpg','1998-05-15',108,'Released','Brace yourself. This politician is about to tell the truth!','Bulworth',9452,3.9799,6.303,'PWca7MI-RBs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13503,_binary '\0','/6aNKD81RHR1DqUUa8kOZ1TBY1Lp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118799',8.6,822728,'it','La vita è bella','A touching story of an Italian book seller of Jewish ancestry who lives in his own little fairy tale. His creative and happy life would come to an abrupt halt when his entire family is deported to a concentration camp during World War II. While locked up he tries to convince his son that the whole thing is just a game.','/74hLDKjD5aGYOotO6esUVaeISa2.jpg','1997-12-20',116,'Released','An unforgettable fable that proves love, family and imagination conquer all.','Life Is Beautiful',637,23.8078,8.436,'pAYEQP8gx3w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13504,_binary '\0','/bjuH03KlisJ78ssHUzXhruoVulp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118804',7.1,10818,'en','The Butcher Boy','Francie and Joe live the usual playful, fantasy filled childhoods of normal boys. However, with a violent, alcoholic father and a manic depressive, suicidal mother the pressure on Francie to grow up are immense. When Francie\'s world turns to madness, he tries to counter it with further insanity, with dire consequences.','/9KrClE5Ax6wzCAwgaGRhQI2Eolk.jpg','1998-02-20',110,'Released','This little piggy laughed all the way home!','The Butcher Boy',22797,2.8437,6.802,'mdvtR8Hup4E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13505,_binary '\0','/qznvmpYU0OXP8HbWCWa4U92NNpS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118818',7.1,6790,'en','Career Girls','A young college student in London moves into a flat and becomes best friends with a flatmate; the former moves into her own flat 4 years later but 6 years after their parting, the former returns to London to pay the latter a visit.','/lm8e0VH9XxP7eiaqA1bQNK9PNvM.jpg','1997-06-01',87,'Released','All Hannah wanted was a roommate... instead she got a best friend.','Career Girls',49462,2.9536,6.6,'xxil12x9uuU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13506,_binary '\0','/gDekB0OnIYbKhqzzdArfSQpcAvH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118819',7.3,35883,'es','Carne trémula','When Victor attempts to seduce Elena, all he gets for his trouble is a one-way, six-year ticket to prison, where he concentrates on strengthening his mind, his body... and his desire for vengeance on the man who put him there. After his release and still madly in love with her, Victor will stop at nothing to win her over even if means revenge, for Elena has married David, the cop who sent him to prison!','/7YPGYeamF6AuyxhKqbd5oNKKCCy.jpg','1997-10-10',103,'Released','Life, love, desire... and everything in between.','Live Flesh',267,4.6722,7,'R2cXd-gB0B0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13507,_binary '\0','/fimwiQFQTA8KOkKVuiyxvSy5GmZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118826',7.7,19112,'en','The Castle','The quirky Kerrigan family lives together in a makeshift home they built themselves – with great pride and a bizarre attention to detail – a few yards from the edge of Melbourne, Australia\'s busy Tullamarine Airport. When a building inspector condemns the building and reveals that the government plans to use their land for an airport expansion, Darryl Kerrigan and his brood recruit hack attorney Dennis Denuto and prepare themselves for the fight of their lives.','/3QKTPz9gpIIt9Po091LfG0CASfk.jpg','1997-04-10',85,'Released','Ordinary Family. Extraordinary Story.','The Castle',13852,2.7315,7.1,'ki-Aw9PZFIQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13508,_binary '\0','/lKdpaG0G9kXU1wXcZm21FLiyTTQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118829',6.9,9370,'en','Cats Don\'t Dance','An ambitious singing and dancing cat in 1939 Hollywood overcomes several obstacles to fulfill his dream of becoming a movie star.','/6CrgfB0dNUsanaMWHTv0Y6AFeNd.jpg','1997-03-26',75,'Released','For a bunch of funny friends trying to break into show business... it\'s a jungle out there!','Cats Don\'t Dance',24662,5.417,7.2,'d5Hd4dfFB-Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13509,_binary '\0','/wZ3kOwYNYC89WFxKsxweoAl6BxF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118834',6.2,2100,'fr','Ceux qui m\'aiment prendront le train','A group of mourners travels by train to bury a recently deceased artist in Limoges. As they journey, secrets and desires unfold, with relationships shifting, past loves resurfacing, and personal connections revealed. At the funeral and afterward, tensions rise among the group, leading to further emotional complexities at the artist’s family home.','/iwATSa886QDamfkTG3nHXkCoXPe.jpg','1998-05-15',122,'Released',NULL,'Those Who Love Me Can Take the Train',31353,2.1371,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13510,_binary '\0','/czvKQcMyzFYBJUIPcwiPx6a2yIV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118836',2.4,6733,'en','Chairman of the Board','Surfer Edison isn\'t able to make ends meet with his inventions or his lifestyle. But then he meets billionaire Armand McMillian, who takes a shine to the young bum — so much so that he leaves his invention company to him upon his death. Unfortunately, Armand\'s nephew, Bradford, only gets a surfboard. While Edison manages to run the company successfully, with the help of pretty Natalie, Bradford conspires to take him down.','/1eGB1EjaUjGbiuPBAqndlO3khyn.jpg','1998-03-13',95,'Released','Work sucks!','Chairman of the Board',31535,2.2158,3.6,'rsGr2_8jez0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13511,_binary '\0','/c21e9gru5KLk6rHZGADz2AlqR8M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118840',5.5,3511,'en','The Manson Family','A dramatization of the horrific and notorious Manson Family Murders, in the form of super 8 home movies.','/eyvCvpFkA9bROmbgEmrTsckfpW0.jpg','1997-10-22',95,'Released','You\'ve seen the story through the eyes of the law... Now see it through the eyes of The Manson Family.','The Manson Family',34867,1.4514,5.4,'gEj7m1PdiaU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13512,_binary '\0','/9dsOweKYJ6XAJteBIKEGOI0T2bf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118842',7.2,149152,'en','Chasing Amy','Holden and Banky are comic book artists. Everything is going good for them until they meet Alyssa, also a comic book artist. Holden falls for her, but his hopes are crushed when he finds out she\'s a lesbian.','/tqydORBcNlQxy3ijgSpPurgDHM2.jpg','1997-04-04',114,'Released','It\'s not who you love. It\'s how.','Chasing Amy',2255,6.7474,6.7,'2PwIAmcrr3E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13513,_binary '\0','/vx5Mla7OfNzibnVat2HQuqGrUkc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118843',8,59244,'sr','Crna mačka, beli mačor','A small-time hustler makes a deal with a notorious gangster to whom he owes money: marry his teenage son to the latter\'s daughter. However, the young lovers are not as agreeable.','/xxQ9jgYf3xhbUTW98VtCjA1wMLv.jpg','1998-06-01',127,'Released',NULL,'Black Cat, White Cat',1075,5.7014,7.6,'Lxw0ea_UiZ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13514,_binary '\0','/2Xkd3WeAx11cHxb4Lr3wnSNDWcd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118845',7.6,38902,'cn','春光乍洩','A couple travels from Hong Kong to Argentina to revive their relationship but experience turbulence when both men\'s lives drift in separate directions.','/kO4KjUkQOfWSBw06Bdl7m6AlEP7.jpg','1997-05-30',96,'Released','Lonely people are all the same.','Happy Together',18329,6.2027,7.597,'5VPvFaAWX9U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13515,_binary '\0','/9W250lyDDC3P9AgW5ZKGRj7R2Pv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118849',8.2,91347,'fa','بچه‌های آسمان','Zohre\'s shoes are gone; her older brother Ali lost them. They are poor, there are no shoes for Zohre until they come up with an idea: they will share one pair of shoes. School awaits.','/jWqh1CJWAEcxckMRrf6ARhIEh0R.jpg','1997-08-01',88,'Released','A Little Secret... Their Biggest Adventure!','Children of Heaven',21334,4.284,7.9,'dqxvZeQsVzY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13516,_binary '\0','/1edXu0NNfUnVPcj8WT9vXKaN3qr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118851',6.2,3781,'en','Chinese Box','The story of Hong Kong, from New Year\'s Day to June 30th, 1997, when the British left their colony and turned it over to the People\'s Republic of China.','/e7qXWE5Qbhr55BrjOBi7JG5rI4B.jpg','1997-11-14',99,'Released',NULL,'Chinese Box',30265,3.2208,5.8,'t8NYCGnEP3g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13517,_binary '\0','/vceiGZ3uavAEHlTA7v0GjQsGVKe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118852',7,5100,'en','Chinese Coffee','When Harry Levine, an aging, unsuccessful Greenwich Village writer, is fired from his job as restaurant doorman, he calls on friend and mentor Jake, ostensibly to collect a long-standing debt.','/nZGWnSuf1FIuzyEuMRZHHZWViAp.jpg','2000-09-02',99,'Released','There\'s a fine line between friendship and betrayal.','Chinese Coffee',49511,1.6623,6.8,'bMzJENlJiy8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13518,_binary '\0','/slTy1EziUzZJAhTIFzgvE8XkzDu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118859',6.1,7301,'en','City of Industry','A retired thief swears revenge on the lunatic who murdered his brother and partner, while going on the run with the loot they stole.','/8sLhOGSCTVeaihjXIy0OjL520F2.jpg','1997-03-14',97,'Released','Wanting a man dead can be reason enough to live.','City of Industry',18420,3.1171,5.5,'7_7qp8qUcRM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13519,_binary '\0','/brB272BzxcuTG5NdTRcjNEqAb3A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118863',6.6,12666,'en','Clay Pigeons','Clay is a young man in a small town who witnesses his friend, Earl, kill himself because of the ongoing affair that Clay was having with the man\'s wife, Amanda. Feeling guilty, Clay now resists the widow when she presses him to continue with the affair. Clay unknowingly befriends a serial killer named Lester Long who murders the widow in an attempt to \"help\" his \"fishing buddy.\"','/6cxoftMuiwcQ9xzXfvGWAQfWUmK.jpg','1998-09-25',104,'Released','Lester Long never forgets a friend.','Clay Pigeons',26618,3.5194,6.175,'VChKGXLiLYI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13520,_binary '\0','/av8XV8HgvcAGzeXzgFZGm1qgxPM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118864',4.7,2453,'en','Operation Delta Force 3: Clear Target','The anti-terrorist team Delta Force destroys a billion dollar cocaine stash, to the extreme displeasure of drug cartel leader Umberto Salvatore. To retaliate, he hijacks a stealth submarine and threatens to unleash a biological weapon with the power to kill everyone in New York City.','/d3BOmNSoXHX1HbzTrQhTvm139bv.jpg','1998-11-23',92,'Released','A Combat Unit of Indomitable Strength...They are America\'s Deadliest Weapon','Operation Delta Force 3: Clear Target',101180,2.2449,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13521,_binary '\0','/rwfbbTIZakqQxtEGTQdmDNXuPxj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118866',6.6,7876,'en','Clockwatchers','Four female temps working for a credit company find their friendship threatened by the arrival of a new hire, who lands a permanent position one of the women was vying for.','/s6Gm06rGhopHumkAiYkJ4DsdaK8.jpg','1997-06-12',96,'Released','Waiting for your life to change... can be a full time job.','Clockwatchers',55561,2.3241,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13522,_binary '\0','/fTrO4xtJ9g8bQg0QzfCtd1YNAXq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118874',7.6,2167,'en','A Trace of Murder','While investigating a murder of a millionaire\'s business rival, Columbo becomes suspicious when a police forensics expert and the millionaire\'s wife let slip an in-depth knowledge of the case - and each other.','/xZhT64lrORlsZWk24ZJmzqPXCWv.jpg',NULL,92,'Released','Three Eyes are Better Than One!','A Trace of Murder',1712184,1.4118,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13523,_binary '\0','/vsmlShNNHrYlERZaqMOsZ3YctoO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118880',6.9,342816,'en','Con Air','Newly-paroled former US Army ranger Cameron Poe is headed back to his wife, but must fly home aboard a prison transport flight dubbed \"Jailbird\" taking the “worst of the worst” prisoners, a group described as “pure predators”, to a new super-prison. Poe faces impossible odds when the transport plane is skyjacked mid-flight by the most vicious criminals in the country led by the mastermind — genius serial killer Cyrus \"The Virus\" Grissom, and backed by black militant Diamond Dog and psychopath Billy Bedlam.','/kOKjgrEzGOP92rVQ6srA9jtp60l.jpg','1997-06-05',116,'Released','They were deadly on the ground. Now they have wings.','Con Air',1701,15.7522,6.785,'Sm3AAG6JyL4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13524,_binary '\0','/70tmPOoCJCciWaM1vDvXAi4w3Bc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118883',6.7,115400,'en','Conspiracy Theory','A man obsessed with conspiracy theories becomes a target after one of his theories turns out to be true. Unfortunately, in order to save himself, he has to figure out which theory it is.','/sTyTKZVikQU6g50HE8HR1tBSRxj.jpg','1997-08-08',135,'Released','What if your most paranoid nightmares had just come true?','Conspiracy Theory',8834,9.306,6.623,'gOoEZT_C7gA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13525,_binary '\0','/yFkUPqBuUnbhYbQL8VFpTrAT9za.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118884',7.5,317220,'en','Contact','A radio astronomer receives the first extraterrestrial radio signal ever picked up on Earth. As the world powers scramble to decipher the message and decide upon a course of action, she must make some difficult decisions between her beliefs, the truth, and reality.','/bCpMIywuNZeWt3i5UMLEIc0VSwM.jpg','1997-07-11',150,'Released','Take a journey to the heart of the universe.','Contact',686,14.6422,7.449,'s3hcz8OCd-Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13526,_binary '\0','/cnD5ygO97xFY8wQPwLP5v9saus7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118887',7,117168,'en','Cop Land','Freddy Heflin is the sheriff of a place everyone calls “Cop Land” — a small and seemingly peaceful town populated by the big city police officers he’s long admired. Yet something ugly is taking place behind the town’s peaceful facade. And when Freddy uncovers a massive, deadly conspiracy among these local residents, he is forced to take action and make a dangerous choice between protecting his idols and upholding the law.','/qzR7m6kUhsbdid3xRK2jTXjyNmG.jpg','1997-08-15',104,'Released','No One Is Above The Law.','Cop Land',2142,7.5395,6.8,'DWLFW9iAr-E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13527,_binary '\0','/nT6udCjGaYih9VUZQU7xnwX99RK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118892',7.1,20941,'en','Dangerous Beauty','Veronica is brilliant, gifted and beautiful, but the handsome aristocrat she loves, Marco Venier, cannot marry her because she is penniless and of questionable family. So Veronica\'s mother, Paola, teaches her to become a courtesan, one of the exotic companions favored by the richest and most powerful Venetian men. Veronica courageously uses her charms to change destiny -- and to give herself a chance at true love.','/7uHX8qIr8VYPwdpVv4TCjXcVxDo.jpg','1998-02-20',111,'Released','Born without privilege. Bound by tradition. She found the courage to follow her heart.','Dangerous Beauty',8583,6.1915,7.008,'n_g4qspx3es','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13528,_binary '\0','/cDOfaTXGhGiIDauSnvRntAFcRn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118894',6.2,3007,'en','Cousin Bette','In 19th century Paris, Bette Fischer, a poor and homely spinster, forms an alliance with the seductive courtesan Valerie Marneffe to orchestrate revenge on her handsome and wealthy relatives.','/4TEMm2pyZ6mYBmP2AwoierJHQf9.jpg','1998-06-12',108,'Released','Lust. Greed. Murder. Some things never go out of style.','Cousin Bette',50043,4.0042,5.5,'wAA-HvYbAsI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13529,_binary '\0','/gOXSTrLUItkw1ke8ZRZY9cQN1p3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118895',6.6,1239,'fr','Le Cousin','Nounours is the nickname of a \"cousin\" an informer with a special arrangement with the police: he gets 10% of the drugs seized thanks to his help. When his personal contact, inspector Maurin, commits suicide, inspector Gérard Delvaux takes over. Meanwhile, judge Lambert is uncovering the illegal practices of the policemen. Her persistent investigations, which had cornered Maurin, are leading to Gérard, and also to Nounours as the source of heroin that led to recent cases of deadly overdoses. Nounours promises Gérard increasingly bigger catches which he is intent on realising before he is forced to reveal who Nounours is to judge Lambert.','/yzqzpOelUkcpChoo3g4tDlet1PF.jpg','1997-12-10',112,'Released',NULL,'The Cousin',84644,0.9379,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13530,_binary '\0','/xCvbe2cTLc27EB1AtQhVrzqoZoY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118900',6.4,11228,'en','Gang Related','After murdering an undercover DEA agent, two corrupt cops scramble to cover up what they\'ve done.','/zvl4RYK5OHo2d9V1aUkHkxhh9Zv.jpg','1997-10-08',111,'Released','The best place to hide is behind a badge.','Gang Related',14398,5.0851,6.4,'MbwxXXfzJTQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13531,_binary '\0','/jPuyVi5SdFAQdzhIBiObWvNWxFP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118901',5.9,2487,'en','Critical Care','Werner Ernst is a young hospital resident who becomes embroiled in a legal battle between two half-sisters who are fighting over the care of their comatose father. But are they really fighting over their father\'s care, or over his $10 million estate? Meanwhile, Werner must contend with his nutty supervisor, who insists that he only care for patients with full insurance. Can Werner sidestep the hospital\'s legal team and do what\'s best for the patient?','/p4UPT3vvdKHsv6PbhvvtFm8w5Zx.jpg','1997-10-31',107,'Released','At Memorial Hospital no one ever dies... Until their insurance runs out.','Critical Care',61337,2.6917,6.234,'NnqNzGt9BiQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13532,_binary '\0','/u2UPTfjQuBnFkPiIM2uxFHIDqXK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118906',7.4,2501,'hu','Csinibaba','The movie is set in the actual \"Ki Mit Tud?\" talent contest in 1962. In reality the contest in dance music category was won by an army brass band. \"Omega\" which later became one of the most successful Hungarian rock bands came out in the second place.','/nBUrMl3Sp9Gd6dTkvhYIeOKQxtY.jpg','1997-02-20',100,'Released',NULL,'Dollybirds',41012,1.3449,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13533,_binary '\0','/efJn6vxdSOQu5nbTcVLfVDOxE92.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118925',6.6,2729,'en','Dancer, Texas Pop. 81','Four guys, best friends, have grown up together in DANCER, TEXAS POP. 81, a tiny town in West Texas. Years ago, they made a solemn vow to leave town together as soon as they graduate. Now, it\'s that weekend and the time has come to \"put up or shut up.\" The clock is ticking and as all 81 people in the town watch, comment, offer advice and place bets, these four very different boys with unique backgrounds struggle with the biggest decision of their lives... whether to stay or leave home.','/khV9zPcvgOjrqwlk3dI1lGojZib.jpg','1998-05-01',97,'Released','in the middle of nowhere they had everything','Dancer, Texas Pop. 81',78373,2.2501,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13534,_binary '\0','/qR3Dk3ctnrrxkAI6I472RhamIbu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118926',6.9,7264,'en','The Dancer Upstairs','A police detective in a South American country is dedicated to hunting down a revolutionary guerilla leader.','/jG662jKzEf63fhcbbN3WiLlz5MX.jpg','2002-09-20',132,'Released','An honest man caught in a world of intrigue, power and passion.','The Dancer Upstairs',20689,2.5306,6.09,'hyHE9O60cQE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13535,_binary '\0','/prcMFvfxdoylA5JNomd5ie9kEpA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118927',4.5,2093,'en','Dangerous Ground','Vusi Madlazi returns to the South African village he left as a young boy to bury his father. He meets up with his brother Ernest, who tells him their other brother Stephen couldn\'t be contacted. Vusi goes to Johannesburg to find him, but at first can only find his neighbor/girlfriend, Karin, a stripper. Vusi proceeds to learn how conditions have changed since the end of apartheid, not always for the better for black men.','/3oFap1KH6zTTP1w0iQ6uQZrzKU4.jpg','1997-02-12',95,'Released','What he wants is revenge. What he gets is the fight of his life.','Dangerous Ground',52855,1.5784,4.3,'D313rsokyXg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13536,_binary '\0','/dMa5IBCZylgIKvpRA13a06RSSvn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118928',6.1,109612,'en','Dante\'s Peak','Volcanologist Harry Dalton comes to the sleepy town of Dante\'s Peak to investigate the recent rumblings of the dormant volcano the burg is named for. Before long, his worst fears are realized when a massive eruption hits, and immediately, Harry, the mayor and the townspeople find themselves fighting for their lives amid a catastrophic nightmare.','/8PRVIfZzDgw8EV3sDWJ6NA1ZMAn.jpg','1997-02-07',108,'Released','The pressure is building...','Dante\'s Peak',9619,12.023,6.256,'Qq06-T0hnLM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13537,_binary '\0','/sWi4SSeVPii4NU365Df9vzX1yOX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118929',7.5,228588,'en','Dark City','A man struggles with memories of his past, including a wife he cannot remember, in a nightmarish world with no sun and run by beings with telekinetic powers who seek the souls of humans.','/tNPEGju4DpTdbhBphNmZoEi9Bd3.jpg','1998-02-27',101,'Released','They built the city to see what makes us tick. Last night, one of us went off.','Dark City',2666,12.1806,7.332,'30mmoegSQCs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13538,_binary '\0','/gCu63rvC4hirW4VmZVPYCVDmVgz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118930',5.4,3960,'en','The Dark Side of the Sun','Traveling in search of a cure for a rare skin disease, a man finds freedom and love along the way.','/yxSwmSeoEIJL5BhDEUmURGx38qQ.jpg','1988-12-21',101,'Released','They needed a miracle for their love to survive','The Dark Side of the Sun',26642,2.4021,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13539,_binary '\0','/1l7m4EvSWBGTLDsE81PUaFdfDvd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118931',5.9,1352,'hi','दौड़','A notorious gangster asks a career thief by the name of Nandu to steal a package worth over one crore rupees for a fee.','/1ssiQGO414xFBmelUoNWX6lTZl0.jpg','1997-08-22',180,'Released','Fun On The Run','Daud',54969,1.0678,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13540,_binary '\0','/AbJgUFiaCPGeFd7lZqFgIKApcRG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118942',6.1,1725,'en','Dead Silence','Three escaped convicts take a group of deaf students hostage.','/ky3OepQzmrbwBU8ikWVU134cwEK.jpg','1997-09-22',105,'Released',NULL,'Dead Silence',223389,1.8311,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13541,_binary '\0','/2Xi4of70I7xZOtlJq2EDnylUvhf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0118949',5.7,1921,'en','Into Thin Air: Death on Everest','An adaptation of Jon Krakauer\'s best selling book, \"Into Thin Air: A Personal Account of the Mt. Everest Disaster\". This movie attempts to re-create the disastrous events that took place during the Mount Everest climb on May 10, 1996. It also follows Jon Krakauer throug