collecting the souls of 18 beautiful children.','/p7t4aLbYvnw6ktvC50W6On5Iw9K.jpg','1997-01-01',88,'Released','The Crow Flies, The Clock Strikes And the Devil is Due.','The Eighteenth Angel',33695,1.7535,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13565,_binary '\0','/nOrvnTf7MmwVe25YqYmwBIg08P5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119062',5.6,5566,'en','The End of Violence','In Hollywood, the lives of a successful film producer, his wife, a police detective and a surveillance agent intersect after a botched abduction.','/2ejIzekqpeC2XnSdOrpCw9KYXxF.jpg','1997-09-12',121,'Released','Nothing Lasts Forever.','The End of Violence',46625,3.5837,5.4,'h-T1ripGc-I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13566,_binary '\0','/ss5ndQBFUsSFIIPdkVfp2nXXxx4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119072',2,1472,'de','Das erste Semester','A young student stands to inherent a fortune provided he can pass his first semester of college and find a steady girlfriend. His scheming stepfather has other plans for the money, however.','/iIK65YPz8Z4WOmhJjoaPFPHmyb8.jpg','1997-04-17',95,'Released',NULL,'The First Semester',12256,1.2361,3.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13567,_binary '\0','/vCqwlvpnK3UMLMLguz2shQr8VcA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119079',6.7,9021,'en','Onegin','A virtuous and passionate girl falls in love with a cynical but a dashing aristocrat.','/nG5c0Jwy8vxFXZcDMMcrbSCEsrp.jpg','1999-12-22',104,'Released','A magical era. A passionate longing. A love that spans time.','Onegin',30237,2.3592,6.1,'oCpBYN7eR7I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13568,_binary '\0','/dzoLlCiMhraAfCjQuudyVLcl8Le.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119080',7.2,13174,'en','Eve\'s Bayou','Summer heats up in rural Louisiana beside Eve’s Bayou, 1962, as the Batiste family tries to survive the secrets they’ve kept and the betrayals they’ve endured.','/33yTPcGSv7eo3FVlb7XKACHl1M8.jpg','1997-11-07',108,'Released','The secrets that hold us together can also tear us apart.','Eve\'s Bayou',45153,3.8523,6.5,'6mXU9qVFRpM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13569,_binary '\0','/nByMcYBhChTs2TF9fEFcTSsjme5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119081',6.6,217619,'en','Event Horizon','In 2047, a group of astronauts are sent to investigate and salvage the starship Event Horizon which disappeared mysteriously seven years before on its maiden voyage. However, it soon becomes evident that something sinister resides in its corridors.','/qfluaDXv0cIdLwgQWzNB2piHL2q.jpg','1997-08-15',96,'Released','Infinite space. Infinite terror.','Event Horizon',8413,14.0402,6.6,'Ix9CHnOo94k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13570,_binary '\0','/mfAyTW6lEMWulqocDbiPyfDcMRD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119086',5.4,15237,'en','Excess Baggage','A rich brat fakes her own kidnapping, but in the process ends up locked in the trunk of a car that gets stolen.','/dfKaCA32iSkEQiu37drvIAZWZFz.jpg','1997-08-29',101,'Released','A crash course in kidnappings, car thefts and other rituals of dating.','Excess Baggage',26180,4.8248,6.103,'GhX7-V-ShiQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13571,_binary '\0','/dLUqPz4HbkWVs4MbfBg1Ir4g68i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119088',4.7,1243,'en','Executive Target','His wife held hostage, a stunt driver is forced to drive a getaway car in a plot to kidnap the President from a motorcade.','/ct6PWs5NimnyFVvdQzkfYOLuK0h.jpg','1997-07-11',100,'Released','Kidnapping a U.S. President is worth a hell of a lot of money.','Executive Target',134458,1.7437,4.8,'9jPCSK-8c7Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13572,_binary '\0','/qOe7JSx1ucYs1pRvddzDbsSc05g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119092',6.6,5163,'en','Face','Ray is an aging ex-socialist who has become a bankrobber after seeing the demise of socialism in 1980s Britain. Teaming up with a gang of other has-beenish crims, he commits one bank job too many. The gang dissolves in a murderous flurry of recriminations.','/egPYnvwTRTzoEAQ7zC6mRzOfFcW.jpg','1997-09-26',105,'Released','The blag to kill for. Only one of them meant it for real.','Face',26124,1.9932,6.3,'VG8_N8vzmF4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13573,_binary '\0','/tsSWHgaFlzzkp3o976juBZbmcs2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119094',7.3,431331,'en','Face/Off','In order to foil a terrorist plot, an FBI agent undergoes facial transplant surgery and assumes the identity of a criminal mastermind. The plan turns sour when the criminal wakes up prematurely and seeks revenge.','/69Xzn8UdPbVnmqSChKz2RTpoNfB.jpg','1997-06-27',139,'Released','In order to trap him, he must become him.','Face/Off',754,16.1137,7.061,'3zebJ_NoduE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13574,_binary '\0','/qUWr7fJRsiccFcOAKvIJV30gZsP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119095',6.5,6699,'en','FairyTale: A True Story','In 1917, two children take a photograph, which is soon believed by some to be the first scientific evidence of the existence of fairies. Based on the true story of the Cottingley Fairies.','/5H86i0qE8zCAbg0vTBKG7S7I2Vi.jpg','1997-10-24',99,'Released','Believe.','FairyTale: A True Story',29911,3.1193,6.4,'Pu6qgclh_KE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13575,_binary '\0','/mOj9BKbrZiGts8E44emOoIdZUeB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119097',7.2,2901,'en','Fakin\' Da Funk','Chinese kid Julian, who was adopted by the black family of Joe and Annabelle Lee -- and Asian exchange student May-Ling, who is housed with a black family -- are trying to adapt to their mostly black neighborhood of South Central.','/yR2XzSGH4I2bTshziMqdDx5ak7x.jpg','1997-07-20',89,'Released','Finding your roots in the hood ain\'t easy.','Fakin\' Da Funk',64254,1.7851,6,'kj3l25ijpPw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13576,_binary '\0','/mjEc4llir1d3SGqaxVjTMXrbvKB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119098',5.7,2110,'en','Fall','For Michael Shiver, life as an easy-going cab driver in New York suddenly changes when he picks up supermodel Sarah Easton and falls head over heels in love. But Sarah has more than just passion on her mind; she also has a husband and a glamorous lifestyle that she can\'t seem to leave behind. Torn between her feelings for Michael and the security of her marriage, Sarah is forced to make a realistic decision about the sacrifices that must be made to be truly and totally in love.','/4nRzyiVckWoqE9Vpm35yZTrfkJM.jpg','1997-06-20',93,'Released','He\'s a cab driver, she\'s a supermodel. What the hell?','Fall',37567,1.8959,6.2,'xElVlr2sRak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13577,_binary '\0','/oooPzQZU7Y2GZU3qZFgewqGUEbe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119099',7,105859,'en','Fallen','Homicide detective John Hobbes witnesses the execution of serial killer Edgar Reese. Soon after the execution the killings start again, and they are very similar to Reese\'s style.','/sWGqNkWVr6JWL4grHFFGV3datuQ.jpg','1998-01-16',124,'Released','Detective John Hobbes is searching for a criminal he\'s already met... already caught... and already killed.','Fallen',9411,10.0473,6.8,'eSCMzZoKkyg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13578,_binary '\0','/bEqyMigf4TFsd6G0WS6MISQPmWM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119107',7.1,4112,'en','Fast, Cheap & Out of Control','Errol Morris interweaves the stories of four men, each driven to create eccentric worlds from their unique obsessions, all of which involve animals: a lion tamer shares his theories on the mental processes of wild animals; a topiary gardener devotes a lifetime to shaping bears and giraffes out of hedges and trees; a man fascinated with hairless mole rats; and an MIT scientist who has designed complex, autonomous robots that can crawl like bugs.','/8uXV6w3ZQUtefqjCgxXswCwPSjk.jpg','1997-10-03',83,'Released',NULL,'Fast, Cheap & Out of Control',25099,1.8464,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13579,_binary '\0','/r6OIUKbFs92aDjaMa25EPaX1RaA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119109',5.3,17499,'en','Fathers\' Day','A woman cons two old boyfriends into searching for her runaway son by convincing both that they are the boy\'s father.','/834wRxQRbbctFupf8AES7CCeTSM.jpg','1997-05-09',99,'Released','All she said was \"My son is yours.\" Unfortunately, she said it to both of them.','Fathers\' Day',12499,4.2023,5.5,'fBwwYHSogdE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13580,_binary '\0','/yAJkaaxujWGz39AGeP4e8aBSLEW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119114',6.7,12681,'en','Fever Pitch','A romantic comedy about a man, a woman and a football team. Based on Nick Hornby\'s best selling autobiographical novel, Fever Pitch. English teacher Paul Ashworth believes his long standing obsession with Arsenal serves him well. But then he meets Sarah. Their relationship develops in tandem with Arsenal\'s roller coaster fortunes in the football league, both leading to a nail biting climax.','/xTpZGWVo5DDk1oQUrUJcRjqGzGg.jpg','1997-04-04',102,'Released','Life Gets Complicated When You Love One Woman And Worship Eleven Men','Fever Pitch',1610,3.058,6.4,'gGv8S1nqzdk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13581,_binary '\0','/pS0XZuNd7ciH5oDR1xfmAUDnTev.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119115',6.4,26748,'en','Fierce Creatures','Ex-policeman Rollo Lee is sent to run Marwood Zoo, the newly acquired business of a New Zealand tycoon. In order to meet high profit targets and keep the zoo open, Rollo enforces a new \'fierce creatures\' policy, whereby only the most impressive and dangerous animals are allowed to remain in the zoo. However, the keepers are less enthusiastic about complying with these demands.','/1Wl0zSEngmsTXjQMVE0GD5s85cM.jpg','1997-01-23',93,'Released','Don\'t pet them.','Fierce Creatures',12145,3.8875,6.2,'fU9zV8gdEUw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13582,_binary '\0','/jW21PoKwqs79wk6bfiYezox63mK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119116',7.6,551740,'fr','Le Cinquième Élément','In 2257, a taxi driver is unintentionally given the task of saving a young girl who is part of the key that will ensure the survival of humanity.','/fPtlCO1yQtnoLHOwKtWz7db6RGU.jpg','1997-05-02',126,'Released','There is no future without it.','The Fifth Element',18,30.1858,7.591,'5Sg2RkdkSvk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13583,_binary '\0','/iWoQUcMpEZlq5yAALb08LtACr9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119123',5.2,20447,'en','Fire Down Below','When an EPA representative is murdered in a small Appalachian community, EPA undercover agent Jack Taggart is sent in—posing as a handyman working with a Christian relief agency—to determine what happened.','/pt0aBevxZvM89Pioly6WDyW4fzr.jpg','1997-09-05',104,'Released','Beneath a land of wealth and beauty hides a secret that could kill millions. Undercover has never run so deep.','Fire Down Below',14289,6.8236,5.7,'67aF_v-At-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13584,_binary '\0','/tQuem05XAAX4bGNvpn7xGYIN6bq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119125',7.2,5292,'en','Firelight','In 1838, lovely governess Elisabeth Laurier agrees to bear a child of an anonymous English landowner, and he will in return pay her father\'s debt. At birth, she, as agreed, gives up the child. Seven years later, she is hired as governess to a girl on a remote Sussex estate. The girl\'s father, Charles Godwin, turns out to be that anonymous landowner. So Elisabeth has to be her own daughter\'s governess, and she can\'t reveal the secret of her tie with little Louisa.','/hkgSUgPdOehzyGjczoytG3bzNaW.jpg','1998-05-27',103,'Released','Passion has no limits.','Firelight',38621,3.1336,6.7,'4qvtoymwZwE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13585,_binary '\0','/xHK1N3Zf98CeleVswvdRneC7mRA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119127',6.8,1502,'en','First Time Felon','Inspired by the true story of Greg Yance. In the film, Yance (Epps) is a hood who goes to jail for possession of drugs. He is given a choice: 5 years in jail or a couple of months in boot camp. He chooses boot camp and finds out it is tougher than he thought it would be. He braves it through and comes home a better man. He then has to deal with the real world, and never gives up no matter what the odds.','/9FFUIycnveVyGrUWuK3HzPzKF4M.jpg','1997-09-06',110,'Released','There\'s his way or the hard way. One guard. One inmate. One chance for redemption.','First Time Felon',50296,2.0572,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13586,_binary '\0','/iaAWeeZaWU7c1UHfxMOhqxLXAUp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119137',5.3,101274,'en','Flubber','Professor Phillip Brainard, an absent minded professor, works with his assistant Weebo, trying to create a substance that\'s a new source of energy and that will save Medfield College where his sweetheart Sara is the president. He has missed his wedding twice, and on the afternoon of his third wedding, Professor Brainard creates flubber, which allows objects to fly through the air.','/bnKvk04icAyCO1KjqhsaEXBO9aJ.jpg','1997-11-26',93,'Released','Catch it if you can!','Flubber',9574,7.3972,5.672,'dl4r6JK6vgY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13587,_binary '\0','/9f5wCpkbbEtqEUQU9UJGV3zQEyz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119141',6.2,42234,'en','Fools Rush In','After a one night stand with Alex, Isabel realizes that she is pregnant and they decide to get married. However, along with the marriage comes compromise of one\'s own cultural traditions.','/tcRaMjWoF8K7h1LqOH7FOOLRQ3e.jpg','1997-02-14',109,'Released','What if finding the love of your life meant changing the life that you loved?','Fools Rush In',1968,6.8714,6.494,'hLKa24D1KUk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13588,_binary '\0','/19pPgJa9c3zxDGIcyoTH0IvWU2n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119142',5.9,13181,'en','For Richer or Poorer','Brad Sexton and his wife, Caroline, are wealthy New Yorkers with both marital and financial problems. The latter issue becomes a pressing matter when they discover that their accountant has embezzled millions and pinned the blame on them. Forced to go on the lam, Brad and Caroline end up in an Amish area of Pennsylvania and decide to pose as members of the religious group to evade the IRS. As the two adapt to the simple Amish lifestyle, they begin to reconnect.','/tPjqY9Qp5WOIBFKnyEpMBVwGr01.jpg','1997-12-11',115,'Released',NULL,'For Richer or Poorer',10371,4.9608,6,'J9kBohmnmWM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13589,_binary '\0','/651HXaynmumQkpVfHCAIOdOXa34.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119152',4.8,11401,'en','Free Willy 3: The Rescue','Willy the whale is back, this time threatened by illegal whalers making money off sushi. Jesse, now 16, has taken a job on an orca-researching ship, along with old friend Randolph and a sarcastic scientist, Drew. On the whaler\'s ship is captain John Wesley and his son, Max, who isn\'t really pleased about his father\'s job, but doesn\'t have the gut to say so. Along the way, Willy reunites with Jesse.','/xzca4bxgP2aEMlPTyq5vqhsunFB.jpg','1997-08-06',86,'Released','A new friend. A new threat. A new adventure that will capture your heart.','Free Willy 3: The Rescue',18519,4.5138,6.1,'cMYTTn4Pzmk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13590,_binary '\0','/r8SwFiCeaADf0jIotMMtfNBzLEI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119164',7.2,120874,'en','The Full Monty','Sheffield, England. Gaz, a jobless steelworker in need of quick cash persuades his mates to bare it all in a one-night-only strip show.','/fjg4EvzoLZVcZli4BwJIytJ6yjn.jpg','1997-08-13',91,'Released','The year\'s most revealing comedy.','The Full Monty',9427,5.5898,7,'d6bjW9OwSQc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13591,_binary '\0','/lUaWr7XwW9ohgNltPlMrTbMPLDp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119165',6.6,2958,'en','Full Tilt Boogie','A documentary about the production of From Dusk Till Dawn (1996) and the people who made it.','/88AiFDwQHuGjE6ZfunMQNNjIEDw.jpg','1998-07-31',97,'Released','Unzipped. Unwrapped. Unleashed!','Full Tilt Boogie',36606,1.7677,6.4,'uurbvR3U1H8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13592,_binary '\0','/79SBe1bU30Dy6QPwJ2KQ3LTr1lr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119167',7.5,99463,'de','Funny Games','Two psychotic young men take a mother, father, and son hostage in their vacation cabin and force them to play sadistic \"games\" with one another for their own amusement.','/48uCNgdyYIoN4ayWjTpLaqSDcWI.jpg','1997-09-11',109,'Released',NULL,'Funny Games',10234,6.7165,7.3,'bH2HS6uWIhQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13593,_binary '\0','/gHxgAuHsavtzPUCkluw1KHldAtc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119169',6,1521,'it','Fuochi d\'artificio','Ottone, a professional dog sitter who\'s uncertain about most things in life, asks an analyst if he made the right decision love-wise while recounting the significant relationships he had with four women.','/nTvTnDL87Foftz4z1VFftgp2kkE.jpg','1997-10-10',100,'Released',NULL,'Fireworks',60047,1.3008,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13594,_binary '\0','/bs65jUGHevSDmfKF5LgVyWtPK4o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119173',6.1,92777,'en','G.I. Jane','In response to political pressure from Senator Lillian DeHaven, the U.S. Navy begins a program that would allow for the eventual integration of women into its combat services. The program begins with a single trial candidate, Lieutenant Jordan O\'Neil, who is chosen specifically for her femininity. O\'Neil enters the grueling Navy SEAL training program under the command of Master Chief John James Urgayle, who unfairly pushes O\'Neil until her determination wins his respect.','/6yBgZJYqaR4XkxwjsB9tS4GK1ZN.jpg','1997-08-19',125,'Released','Failure is not an option.','G.I. Jane',4421,6.8706,6.5,'FDrXl6WOPZA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13595,_binary '\0','/k7GM13qRYSour3lk90Dq1EwdpoW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119174',7.7,477450,'en','The Game','In honor of his birthday, San Francisco banker Nicholas Van Orton, a financial genius and a cold-hearted loner, receives an unusual present from his younger brother, Conrad: a gift certificate to play a unique kind of game. In nary a nanosecond, Nicholas finds himself consumed by a dangerous set of ever-changing rules, unable to distinguish where the charade ends and reality begins.','/4UOa079915QjiTA2u5hT2yKVgUu.jpg','1997-09-12',129,'Released','What do you get for the man who has everything...?','The Game',2649,14.9994,7.6,'DnhDqMJcKZ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13596,_binary '\0','/hPsCR1ny6GnctJkWqeJwihTDD7T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119177',7.7,350852,'en','Gattaca','Vincent is an all-too-human man who dares to defy a system obsessed with genetic perfection. He is an \"In-Valid\" who assumes the identity of a member of the genetic elite to pursue his goal of traveling into space with the Gattaca Aerospace Corporation.','/eSKr5Fl1MEC7zpAXaLWBWSBjgJq.jpg','1997-07-09',107,'Released','There is no gene for the human spirit.','Gattaca',782,11.0375,7.567,'NIIZ2P-fiyI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13597,_binary '\0','/gR9ztrutzPPqgK2V2djS0fg2twW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119190',5.6,91389,'en','George of the Jungle','Deep in the African jungle, a baby named George, the sole survivor of a plane crash, is raised by gorillas. George grows up to be a buff and lovable klutz who has a rainforest full of animal friends: Tookie, his big-beaked toucan messenger; Ape, a witty talking gorilla; and Shep, a peanut-loving pooch of an elephant. But when poachers mess with George\'s pals, the King of Swing swings into action.','/lWp8hUqE4oLPxsYgilXoYoVThfU.jpg','1997-07-15',92,'Released','Watch out!','George of the Jungle',10603,10.5195,5.674,'PP9VGoP8xnI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13598,_binary '\0','/dYx5TEXOBpz5nTf2yKJi03fqOEP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119196',5.7,12267,'en','The Gingerbread Man','A successful Savannah defense attorney gets romantically involved with a sexy, mysterious waitress troubled by psychopaths and dark family secrets.','/9914ih3TvooyVU0GA9BqtaJ4TbE.jpg','1998-01-23',114,'Released','Based on an original story by John Grisham.','The Gingerbread Man',12488,3.367,5.6,'xSMT-ysb_EU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13599,_binary '\0','/mAjn2ddIjHCNNJmaZZeh0eGoQVf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119204',6.2,1557,'sv','Glasblåsarns barn','Based on the novel by Maria Gripe, this is the story of two children, Klas and Klara, growing up in the poor Swedish countryside of the mid-19th century. Their father Albert is a glass-blower, famous for his beautiful vases, but still unable to earn enough money for his wife Sofia and the children. At a spring fair a distinguished gentleman arrives and buys all of Albert\'s glassware. After this nothing will be the same again. Klas and Klara are kidnapped and taken to a strange castle...','/ihJuuIxDYlxIjo9iu8Ms90yLZBn.jpg','1998-02-27',110,'Released',NULL,'The Glass-Blower\'s Children',83678,1.3177,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13600,_binary '\0','/lOi3quqDsAnfyvadtpfyox7m66Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119209',5.7,2377,'en','Going All the Way','Korean War--era veterans and ex-classmates \"Gunner\" Casselman and \"Sonny\" Burns reunite upon their return home. Gunner, who spent the war years abroad, is trying to convince his mother that his gal Marty is good enough for him, while Sonny, who was stationed stateside, is torn between loyal Buddy and tempting Gale Ann. As they commiserate, the men realize that they\'re outgrowing the lives they lived before the war.','/sWNjMpcmlsCJ7Sp1WzojIvh3Zpv.jpg','1997-09-19',110,'Released','In love and life there\'s only one way to go.','Going All the Way',118075,2.5587,4.8,'HLf9XVCyMnQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13601,_binary '\0','/yWhwrzGTsGo98fT1xC3GFI5u7WQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119210',6.5,16330,'en','Switchback','After FBI agent Frank Lacrosse believes his son was kidnapped by a notorious serial killer, he travels to Amarillo, Texas, where he believes the murderer is in hiding. Although officially taken off the case because of its personal significance to him, Frank continues to pursue the killer, causing concern for local sheriff Buck Olmstead. When another victim pops up at a nearby car garage, Frank knows that he is as close as he\'ll ever be to tracking down the elusive killer.','/3v4nX475G97Vd8XCapTKQ7NTqMs.jpg','1997-10-31',118,'Released','The hunter becomes the hunted.','Switchback',10871,5.4229,6.013,'8mfhtbEDDoU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13602,_binary '\0','/3J0N0ZdNucjJHVKhyUxII7GAuyw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119214',4.9,11192,'en','Gone Fishin\'','Two fishing fanatics get in trouble when their fishing boat gets stolen while on a trip.','/lGRHE7s2iGgJ0JNO9gxm8BJKelt.jpg','1997-05-30',94,'Released','Even the fish are laughing!','Gone Fishin\'',9054,3.963,4.935,'Fiw6M7hmJ6A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13603,_binary '\0','/989PPDhaKhbtnyiWCEHYO8mUElo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119215',5.8,36640,'en','Good Burger','Two L.A. teens with summer jobs at Good Burger try to save their small restaurant when a corporate giant burger franchise moves in across the street.','/imFLUF2TYkm13GpFYTKYF7T27sP.jpg','1997-07-25',95,'Released','A comedy with everything on it.','Good Burger',14817,7.5639,6.2,'mzoMkdsYHHQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13604,_binary '\0','/xj1Sv1xm4Y0ydBueGuf10Y9qM0O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119217',8.4,1241970,'en','Good Will Hunting','Will Hunting is a headstrong, working-class genius who is failing the lessons of life. After one too many run-ins with the law, Will\'s last chance is a psychology professor, who might be the only man who can reach him.','/z2FnLKpFi1HPO7BEJxdkv6hpJSU.jpg','1997-12-05',127,'Released','Some people can never believe in themselves, until someone believes in them.','Good Will Hunting',489,26.4033,8.166,'ReIJ1lbL-Q8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13605,_binary '\0','/k9HMLdcc9oQxHnjAGY9zoytQ2mI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119219',5.6,4629,'en','Goodbye Lover','Police investigate when a man having an affair with his brother\'s wife disappears suddenly.','/fE4wFIX2GUrhTkK0VuQ88Kd6ew6.jpg','1999-04-16',102,'Released','No one\'s ever been so good at being so bad.','Goodbye Lover',49981,2.3944,5.6,'uTSG2qdbCzI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13606,_binary '\0','/laXkVCU5DE8Dib0QVHUUUsE7FM6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119223',6.8,60913,'en','Great Expectations','Loosely based on the Charles Dickens\' classic novel, \"Great Expectations\" is a sensual tale of a young man\'s unforgettable passage into manhood, and the three individuals who will undeniably change his life forever. Through the surprising interactions of these vivid characters, \"Great Expectations\" takes a unique and contemporary look at life\'s great coincidences.','/djLsfl3lm7BZKWsKfVZ2wM1ZMrP.jpg','1998-01-30',111,'Released','Let desire be your destiny.','Great Expectations',9410,7.2464,6.7,'Sy0hc1_4yiI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13607,_binary '\0','/jFT7mu2A1rM64JeFg2126zaIwO0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119225',6.9,17637,'en','Gridlock\'d','After a friend overdoses, Spoon and Stretch decide to kick their drug habits and attempt to enroll in a government detox program. Their efforts are hampered by seemingly endless red tape, as they are shuffled from one office to another while being chased by drug dealers and the police.','/jlOL8fLsG0tGBtkj9qzHgqcHPVV.jpg','1997-01-29',91,'Released','Life is a traffic jam.','Gridlock\'d',12489,3.1141,6.6,'Blp_G4F8gdY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13608,_binary '\0','/jrm5WPcYN09Xv9u31XwATd0R7Rv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119227',6.1,12339,'en','Snow White: A Tale of Terror','When young Lili\'s mother dies in childbirth, her father remarries Lady Claudia, a woman ruled by an evil mirror with the power to make her queen of all living things. After escaping an attempt on her life, Lili finds herself lost in a dark forest, where living happily ever after seems unlikely.','/3Zythq86Hyov8J100r3XNbEXtUh.jpg','1997-07-18',100,'Released','The fairy tale is over.','Snow White: A Tale of Terror',9092,4.9289,6.1,'Z0qbe5_Cqt0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13609,_binary '\0','/paSilBRK7Qw3iIbf3xIYVDKnVF9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119229',7.3,105869,'en','Grosse Pointe Blank','Hitman Martin Blank becomes a moving target after he rebuffs a fellow assassin\'s invitation to form a union. On the advice of his quirky assistant and neurotic psychiatrist, Martin begrudgingly heads out to Grosse Pointe, Michigan for his ten-year high school reunion, where he soon comes across the woman he jilted on prom night.','/7lQ0MSNQqBTYpXTTZL82u1n95Z3.jpg','1997-04-11',107,'Released','Even a hit man deserves a second shot.','Grosse Pointe Blank',9434,5.029,6.96,'RL1oWnFyyZ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13610,_binary '\0','/mLdMnoIE4SjMkTkgxayaHH9DS4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119237',6.6,42406,'en','Gummo','Teenagers Solomon and Tummler kill time in Xenia, Ohio, a small town that has never recovered from the tornado that ravaged the community in the 1970s.','/tMdoCRx0XIPR5uYBwxbxR7WCNBb.jpg','1997-10-17',89,'Released','Prepare to visit a town you\'d never want to call home.','Gummo',18415,3.5437,6.6,'40NyJSBvCC0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13611,_binary '\0','/7CutQU7NVKT93rfdqq3EljuR1GV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119239',7.3,6315,'hi','Gupt: The Hidden Truth','When Governor Jaisingh Sinha is murdered, the needle of suspicion points towards his estranged step-son, Sahil. Now Sahil must prove his innocence and find out who the real killer is.','/tMEDfqBRQTbRHMcnH7pMkQaSbPI.jpg','1997-07-04',155,'Released','The Hidden Truth','Gupt: The Hidden Truth',21906,2.4484,6.397,'Tsl2U855nH0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13612,_binary '\0','/ejD6Za0cSVmw6mMGBaGuiGOgRx7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119247',5.8,3235,'fr','Une chance sur deux','Alice Tomaso gets out of jail, and goes looking for Léo and Julien, one of whom, it appears, is her father. On the way, she steals the wrong car - one belonging to the Russian mafia, and arrives at her destination with a gang of thugs out looking for her and the car.','/qXtIuvGLGJTdc4UJEYjUqtlPyIf.jpg','1998-03-25',110,'Released',NULL,'Half a Chance',49938,2.5899,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13613,_binary '\0','/gwhaNUYihVap6YV1Ucnk2T9y6qr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119248',6.8,7944,'it','Hamam','Francesco and Marta run a husband-and-wife design company in Rome. When Francesco\'s aunt dies in Istanbul he travels there to sort out the hamam Turkish steam bath that she left him. He finds a love and warmth in his relatives\' Istanbul home that is missing from his life in Italy.','/a1c3p8qvTXf3Eue9QNzq1kVG5MM.jpg','1997-05-09',94,'Released','What he inherited was a sexual awakening...','Steam: The Turkish Bath',27104,2.7776,6.6,'IsolrGofG6U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13614,_binary '\0','/5RzKxNU6NB4Nfw6B6v6LgIqxavw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119249',5.8,4545,'sv','Hamilton','A government agent leads his team\'s effort to stop Russian rebels from smuggling a stolen missile through Sweden.','/4fMWOuqom2z7h73LKaGAqdwa3Lg.jpg','1998-01-30',122,'Released',NULL,'Hamilton',17629,1.7637,5.8,'tMcJYEGHkXo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13615,_binary '\0','/mdQ6oH7GLM9VerAb8JhsEAyJnHs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119250',7.7,35976,'ja','HANA-BI','Beleaguered police detective Nishi takes desperate measures to try and set things right in a world gone wrong. With his wife suffering from leukemia and his business partner paralyzed from a brutal gangster attack, Nishi borrows from a yakuza loan shark and then robs a bank to clear his debt.','/bWIo1nDJnSyGJvVt8bRw8PHBqo4.jpg','1997-10-30',103,'Released','Thank you - thank you for everything.','Fireworks',5910,5.6531,7.7,'PwTWtAE3ylY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13616,_binary '\0','/4rt35cuyJ3CwpZgeIdXm5fmCinx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119256',7.1,60492,'en','Hard Eight','A stranger mentors a young Reno gambler who weds a hooker and befriends a vulgar casino regular.','/1l5UaoP25Ak8PWCKIULQz70yF03.jpg','1997-02-28',102,'Released','If you stay in the game long enough, you\'ll see everything, win everything, and lose everything.','Hard Eight',8052,4.2719,6.8,'AwLWHNuJ-2M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13617,_binary '\0','/A9FC1AqBgMuX15hzW2nFlxinXwi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119263',7.2,3658,'zh','河流','A young man develops severe neck pain after swimming in a polluted river for a movie shoot, but nobody can provide him any relief.','/8Z4jHXRPf86hIsnvHXnTp2dt5pj.jpg','1997-08-07',116,'Released',NULL,'The River',54291,1.716,6.8,'_VWnPCwd9ko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13618,_binary '\0','/boWOE5lDkTvQKWgMcq1NkadFjcT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119272',5.7,2445,'en','Heaven\'s Burning','In Sydney, the newly married Midori is honeymooning with her husband, Yukio. She does not love him and fakes her own kidnapping to escape the marriage. Her lover is supposed to meet her, but fails to appear. She goes to a bank to get some cash, only to become a hostage in an unfolding robbery, until the getaway driver, Colin, saves her from his fellow robbers. They hit the road together, with the cops, her husband and the robbers in pursuit.','/j7l2BgeJCNhiFwRrK5p5FhjliG5.jpg','1997-11-06',96,'Released','Vengeance takes no prisoners.','Heaven\'s Burning',70581,2.6409,5.7,'PZ2s2WR8VrM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13619,_binary '\0','/f5C03doOWiauu37bToKXtpgP5bS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119273',5.4,10357,'en','Heavy Metal 2000','Upon discovery of a shard of what could be the Loc-Nar, a miner named Tyler becomes possessed with an insatiable hunger for power and a thirst for immortality. On his way to the planet of youth, Tyler wipes out most of a space colony and kidnaps a beautiful young woman. His only mistake is that he doesn\'t kill her sister, Julie, who then sets out on a mission of rescue and revenge.','/dCggUkmi3Fyc1HrSnyaSxKPrG4n.jpg','2000-04-19',88,'Released','Flakked, stacked and action-packed!','Heavy Metal 2000',16225,3.8918,6.028,'HLXlHwwDN_4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13620,_binary '\0','/2FjwxHU5XTYFPDHkaFJaI5seflq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119278',6.4,2171,'en','Chicago Cab','A day in the life of a Chicago cab driver is examined as he picks up fares from the good and bad parts of the city and emotionally connects to many of his passengers.','/aab0vn8vnywjgCH95E39BFpVlXG.jpg','1998-09-18',96,'Released','Do you dare pay the fare?','Chicago Cab',116008,2.2626,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13621,_binary '\0','/wtcbvl1s3pEDNxKqaXuEmdR7RmL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119279',4.3,3222,'en','Bleeders','A man with an unknown disease travels to an island with his girlfriend where his relatives once lived, hoping to find a cure to his illness. Although his relatives were all thought to be dead, he finds them living underground.','/xhMTDjI5Q9v9YvS2D1Mtsg5us1B.jpg','1997-07-31',89,'Released','It\'s in the blood','Bleeders',58789,2.3819,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13622,_binary '\0','/fxjiafn34SRjU4olPBRBbGLPwd6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119280',7.2,16491,'en','Mrs Brown','When Queen Victoria\'s husband Prince Albert dies, she finds solace in her trusted servant, Mr. John Brown. But their relationship also brings scandal and turmoil to the monarchy.','/hVdBkTe6Fbd9rcsQoBTqrDw5I1z.jpg','1997-07-18',105,'Released','Loyalty without question. Friendship without equal.','Mrs Brown',17589,3.7223,6.8,'DsnOyuU2o6A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13623,_binary '\0','/oG9dcGSSu13fjFp1Uly15ZXjRKV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119282',7.3,283925,'en','Hercules','Bestowed with superhuman strength, a young mortal named Hercules sets out to prove himself a hero in the eyes of his father, the great god Zeus. Along with his friends Pegasus, a flying horse, and Phil, a personal trainer, Hercules is tricked by the hilarious, hotheaded villain Hades, who\'s plotting to take over Mount Olympus!','/dK9rNoC97tgX3xXg5zdxFisdfcp.jpg','1997-06-13',93,'Released','The man. The myth. The movie.','Hercules',11970,19.0199,7.499,'67gHAchsUW8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13624,_binary '\0','/ciuacABTErf6XEzxHAOWEvFvaYm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119285',6.3,3952,'hi','Hero No. 1','Rajesh and Meena fall in love and want to get married. But Meena\'s grandfather rejects Rajesh without seeing him because of a terrible encounter with Rajesh\'s father. Rajesh pretends to be a servant and finds employment in Meena\'s house to try and win her family over.','/ruKS1nf9EfMuAIEQZqj2N2aCySW.jpg','1997-02-21',134,'Released','A modern retelling of Bawarchi','Hero No. 1',30613,1.192,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13625,_binary '\0','/bPLaTihTldVrmXfwOgK0e3MkFB5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119288',4.8,1584,'en','Hideous!','Dr. Lorca, an eccentric collector of biological oddities - has just \"acquired\" his greatest specimen: a horrible mutant born of toxic sewage, but the creature\'s rightful owner wants it back. The collector\'s clash is cut short though, as the sickening specimen comes to life, re-animating an angry, oozing little army of ferocious freaks','/bVmg3Nx7SfZjMXOiLzhGt7kHwo.jpg','1997-08-26',82,'Released','Deformed. Depraved. Deadly.','Hideous!',53246,1.4697,5.3,'el2mFloNSbI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13626,_binary '\0','/oHsiqHajO9v8YTuonvcMCkxtpSq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119303',4.6,139610,'en','Home Alone 3','9-year-old Alex Pruitt is home alone with the chicken pox. Turns out, due to a mix-up among nefarious spies, Alex was given a toy car concealing a top-secret microchip. Now Alex must fend off the spies as they try to break into his house to get it back.','/6uOadrCfle0n2LOOxHbgWEdnrm2.jpg','1997-12-12',102,'Released','There\'s a new kid on the block.','Home Alone 3',9714,14.0335,5.3,'PP--dDh4axI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13627,_binary '\0','/rpwWJbqI8br33aktuKTz1ml6uee.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119304',5.2,9629,'en','Home Fries','Dorian and Angus chase down their womanizing stepfather with a helicopter, frightening him to death. In his effort to cover their tracks, Dorian begins investigating his stepfather\'s mistress, Sally. She works at a fast-food drive-through, she\'s pregnant and Dorian quickly falls in love with her. Unfortunately, his scheming mother wants Sally dead. And Sally isn\'t sure she wants Dorian to be her child\'s father and also his brother.','/rXEpaJIPlBqKq7QepB8uowmeAT2.jpg','1998-11-25',93,'Released','A long shot romance in a short order world.','Home Fries',12257,4.1181,5.1,'TgaV1oNx_i4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13628,_binary '\0','/i72JysXqxwdDX7vgZDQwsAbI3QK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119305',5.7,5352,'en','Homegrown','Three laborers on a Northern California marijuana plantation become increasingly paranoid when they learn that their boss has been murdered. They know enough to run, taking with them enough of the crop to pay them for services rendered. Hooking up with go-between Lucy in the next town, they plot their next move.','/feQeYHriKLCjzkUEjg4D81ggyYs.jpg','1998-04-17',102,'Released',NULL,'Homegrown',17133,2.1381,5.5,'00MGwq1eNNQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13629,_binary '\0','/4kr8dUmxSxCHQnaI6hYtEz49OvR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119311',6.3,14303,'en','Hoodlum','In 1934, the second most lucrative business in New York City was running \'the numbers\'. When Madam Queen—the powerful woman who runs the scam in Harlem—is arrested, Ellsworth \'Bumpy\' Johnson takes over the business and must resist an invasion from a merciless mobster.','/hZrwqVXLyxxsNJHVc6bJKSUDkXA.jpg','1997-08-27',130,'Released','Power is measured in enemies.','Hoodlum',22073,5.3948,6.492,'cP76l_U3l9M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13630,_binary '\0','/9zgnuwIK6JAc6giVsscq9H82li1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119313',6.1,33270,'en','Hope Floats','Birdee Pruitt has been humiliated on live television by her best friend, Connie, who\'s been sleeping with Birdee\'s husband, Bill. Birdee tries starting over with her daughter, Bernice, by returning to her small Texas hometown, but she\'s faced with petty old acquaintances who are thrilled to see Birdee unhappy -- except for her friend Justin. As he helps Birdee get back on her feet, love begins to blossom.','/6PRFM09xjGSWpXObW87CT5JELGJ.jpg','1998-05-29',114,'Released','When life fell apart, love fell into place.','Hope Floats',9715,6.6962,6.5,'nNVbi6tGhrg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13631,_binary '\0','/ww9pokP6M6gp2Iu0o3sT5B7eN66.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119314',6.7,47019,'en','The Horse Whisperer','The mother of a severely traumatized daughter enlists the aid of a unique horse trainer to help the girl\'s equally injured horse.','/ptkDeHY2mRJVyNRyxb9TgyAjTYs.jpg','1998-02-01',169,'Released',NULL,'The Horse Whisperer',547,9.674,6.9,'W_1dKoCQlxY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13632,_binary '\0','/6XhB0Gs1FB0MXxcAZ8fVnnBsnBX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119324',6.6,9408,'en','The House of Yes','Jackie-O is anxiously awaiting the visit of her brother home for Thanksgiving, but isn\'t expecting him to bring a friend — and she\'s even more shocked to learn that this friend is his fiance. It soon becomes clear that her obsession with Jackie Kennedy is nothing compared to her obsession with her brother, and she isn\'t the only member of the family with problems.','/vgXLG6BRBKPwkoJOwjaLDMLK9cQ.jpg','1997-10-10',85,'Released','Enter at your own risk.','The House of Yes',33344,2.8827,6.2,'48-M7MfrYMc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13633,_binary '\0','/xWtXjQn6YfqI4Oaz30UajrO1t2X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119326',5.4,9682,'en','How to Be a Player','Dray is a young playboy whose only objective in life seems to be to have sex with as many girls as he can without getting caught by his girlfriend Lisa. Dray\'s sister Jenny and her friend Katrina plan to show him that the way he lives is wrong and organize a party in Malibu, inviting all of his girlfriends.','/1BFKMh1ogtWzGOjKTzxCD2tG0K3.jpg','1997-08-06',93,'Released','So many women. So little time.','How to Be a Player',28353,1.9863,5.68,'V4nDMM5Jjws','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13634,_binary '\0','/8xMW9xmQFEyn76EfmrSUhHoZL47.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119327',5,2201,'en','Hugo Pool','Hugo Pool is a quirky tale of a Los Angeles pool cleaner who falls in love with a young man dying of Lou Gerhig\'s Disease.','/sVVdjinglTAShsEYlYkPNQ0SQGv.jpg','1997-12-12',92,'Released','A comedy with serious relief','Hugo Pool',32332,2.4143,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13635,_binary '\0','/nnqnpTipkMSahf8CJ9vyTZAknKq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119329',6.1,2044,'en','The Hunchback','Based on Victor Hugo\'s famed novel, the story of Quasimodo, the deformed bell ringer of Notre Dame, and his unrequited love for the gypsy girl, Esmeralda.','/xch2lgon3mGYT9jT0SMFpBPdSPv.jpg','1997-03-16',98,'Released',NULL,'The Hunchback',148636,3.5487,5.9,'GUB4e0Xe7sI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13636,_binary '\0','/f587vJ79gzfrpInN3uao8IzRzqQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119336',5.7,10774,'en','Hurlyburly','A group of actors and their casting agents try to find a direction in their lives whilst coming to terms with their personal problems and relationship conflicts.','/wg7GBXBALHQ0tjmyMiwu5gcDss9.jpg','1998-12-25',122,'Released','Hollywood highs and L.A. lows','Hurlyburly',24525,2.0271,5.5,'DiBVIk7wW4Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13637,_binary '\0','/xGVLZDHDx6KTn7DEAnKqGhR6i7H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119338',6.4,1388,'en','Hurricane Streets','Marcus is a New York City street kid torn between his friends\' criminal activities and a girl trying to keep him out of trouble.','/kI8WAtPfjiPygfdKcwYJUkMZyh4.jpg','1997-01-21',86,'Released','Know life. No limits.','Hurricane Streets',125052,1.3962,5.2,'XumaKYDG9dM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13638,_binary '\0','/6wpIPoE1H7N5yCuFsfcYoGBhFlP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119345',5.9,183031,'en','I Know What You Did Last Summer','After an accident on a winding road, four teens make the fatal mistake of dumping their victim\'s body into the sea. Exactly one year later, the deadly secret resurfaces as they\'re stalked by a hook-handed figure.','/dQyaJx0SptDqvQcAewAr8FAtLB2.jpg','1997-10-17',102,'Released','If you\'re going to bury the truth, make sure it stays buried.','I Know What You Did Last Summer',3597,11.5904,6,'rEnCEM48QaY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13639,_binary '\0','/xUfyg80LvnfHjQ3xE65GXigeqiS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119346',6.9,2458,'en','I Married a Strange Person!','On their wedding night, Grant begins experiencing strange, supernatural powers and his bride Keri can\'t cope. Whenever Grant thinks of something, it becomes reality, yet he doesn\'t know where this magic came from. Things become more complicated when a megalomaniac CEO sends the military to capture Grant in order to weaponize his abilities.','/dyP1Zlj1lbhBHeO5veF5L7uqdsb.jpg','1998-08-28',72,'Released','The honeymoon is definitely over!','I Married a Strange Person!',51942,1.7874,7.2,'b505zxlfJHA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13640,_binary '\0','/idelRXDUl8XM2lQnQHfloYWUg9l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119347',6,3394,'en','I Want You','A young boy and his sister are drawn into one man\'s obsessive pursuit of his former lover.','/iMnAh6K4jLnwDrtxjaCshX9k425.jpg','1998-02-15',87,'Released','What she wants, she gets.','I Want You',35113,3.1451,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13641,_binary '\0','/r700X6U2hVX0haLRItATSVn5Rj4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119349',7.3,64132,'en','The Ice Storm','In the weekend after thanksgiving 1973 the Hood family is skidding out of control. Then an ice storm hits, the worst in a century.','/3a6uLta7K8Dzojps4RoJAPHD0km.jpg','1997-09-27',113,'Released','It was 1973, and the climate was changing.','The Ice Storm',68924,8.8688,6.9,'GALtpiBSG3I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13642,_binary '\0','/AlgiBrqgx9R21fJVORCDdrti7Z8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119360',6.4,46931,'en','In & Out','A midwestern teacher questions his sexuality after a former student makes a comment about him at the Academy Awards.','/jUTQp6cPgfOX4St2WfaeUvxZCts.jpg','1997-09-10',90,'Released','An out-and-out comedy.','In & Out',10806,5.2861,6.454,'fxD7Ty5ZhQE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13643,_binary '\0','/ns8yY2OpwwhPMPvEaIGoWmMdQdN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119361',7.1,14901,'en','In the Company of Men','Two business executives--one an avowed misogynist, the other recently emotionally wounded by his love interest--set out to exact revenge on the female gender by seeking out the most innocent, uncorrupted girl they can find and ruining her life.','/1gPJ4H4TbGAiuEA6pFalFtqA0eL.jpg','1997-03-28',97,'Released','Are all men bastards...or just misunderstood?','In the Company of Men',14585,3.0234,6.728,'5kvfCm-rVpQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13644,_binary '\0','/AqnjJtRblGjIiq6oJ8DzyIFjza1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119362',7,1820,'en','In the Gloaming','Danny, dying of AIDS, returns home for his last months. Always close to his mother, they share moments of openness that tend to shut out Danny\'s father and his sister.','/iV3oY3N0Mb16ohciAiFToPl67fe.jpg','1997-04-20',61,'Released',NULL,'In the Gloaming',63148,2.296,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13645,_binary '\0','/kiHFYMj7dsXle66TQGolgOaT6NC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119365',6.4,4308,'en','Incognito','Harry Donovan is an art forger who paints fake Rembrandt picture for $500,000. The girl he meets and gets into bed with in Paris, Marieke, turns out to be an arts expert Harry\'s clients are using to check the counterfeit picture he painted.','/45idl65SLCipP1G1RMRVfkF4ldw.jpg','1997-11-14',108,'Released','Harry Donovan is a master in the art of deception... trapped in a lie so perfect even the truth can\'t save him.','Incognito',45928,2.1429,5.8,'xReR33oKcDw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13646,_binary '\0','/hCs57B6a5BVmfaud6q0MaaalgQ1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119369',7,1869,'en','The Inheritance','A beautiful orphan of mysterious parentage is asked by her adoptive family to help find a husband for their niece, but when two suitors both fall for the orphan girl, the niece instigates a scheme to discredit her in the eyes of her guardians. Based on the novel by Louisa May Alcott.','/kQIUZCJrePvref6WC4jV5HzKaz6.jpg','1997-04-06',94,'Released',NULL,'The Inheritance',46200,2.961,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13647,_binary '\0','/r2t5TjazNr6Kx9eQbcy50izuPw0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119375',7.2,17742,'no','Insomnia','Detectives Jonas and Erik are called to the midnight sun country of northern Norway to investigate a recent homicide, but their plan to arrest the killer goes awry, and Jonas mistakenly shoots Erik. The suspect escapes, and a frightened Jonas pins Erik\'s death on the fugitive. Jonas continues to pursue the killer as he seeks to protect himself; however, his mounting guilt and the omnipresent sun plague him with an insomnia that affects his sanity.','/bMq1l0RUf7xr45yMRUKzkU5cDOQ.jpg','1997-03-14',96,'Released','No peace for the wicked','Insomnia',26610,3.0029,7,'cbItn9Laz3c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13648,_binary '\0','/tL8c4Oz3fXqRP3oquUpHWqpEC6B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119381',6.4,15446,'en','Inventing the Abbotts','In the 1950s, brothers Jacey and Doug Holt, who come from the poorer side of their sleepy Midwestern town, vie for the affections of the wealthy, lovely Abbott sisters. Lady-killer Jacey alternates between Eleanor and Alice, wanting simply to break the hearts of rich young women. But sensitive Doug has a real romance with Pamela, which Jacey and the Abbott patriarch, Lloyd, both frown upon.','/ysfD96fF56BEzpktyDWChC8Epgs.jpg','1997-04-04',110,'Released','When you want it all but can\'t have it, there\'s only one way to handle life... invent it.','Inventing the Abbotts',12723,4.9207,6.315,'0ThSqKNO-zQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13649,_binary '\0','/mGZY68Ab7QeVedY4jWZ6H2xeYaD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119385',8.4,9058,'ta','இருவர்','A fictionalized account of the lives of 1980s Tamil Nadu political icons M. G. Ramachandran and M. Karunanidhi, continuing the tryst between Tamil cinema and Dravidian politics.','/meBNe0IHOhYNjNna2YlxXQ3iwvL.jpg','1997-01-14',140,'Released','Power....Authority....Position....','Iruvar',49032,2.0643,7.527,'6ZH2x42v-xY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13650,_binary '\0','/8k2cDumng4l0QUjfA7C66762ucX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119389',7.1,2346,'en','The Island on Bird Street','Alex is an 11-year old boy who, during WWII, hides in the Jewish ghetto from Nazis after all his relatives have been sent to the concentration camp. The movie portrays the ghetto through his eyes.','/q8IXiMGnid3jSk5GAJAyjvDHL4E.jpg','1997-04-11',107,'Released',NULL,'The Island on Bird Street',45614,2.5115,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13651,_binary '\0','/ctu2jbJ4NpQX2SKXdIMCYfwDCsO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119395',6.4,132101,'en','The Jackal','Hired by a powerful member of the Russian mafia to avenge an FBI sting that left his brother dead, a psychopathic hitman known only as The Jackal proves an elusive target for the people charged with the task of bringing him down: a deputy FBI director, a Russian MVK Major, and a jailed IRA terrorist who can recognize him.','/oXF26QmDEaRaH9Fbhs3NXtcnryx.jpg','1997-11-14',124,'Released','How do you stop an assassin who has no identity?','The Jackal',4824,12.3229,6.4,'_3UCCtpFET8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13652,_binary '\0','/gvaeY5kz3wHrMU6xLdnybziwYXw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119396',7.5,408338,'en','Jackie Brown','Jackie Brown is a flight attendant who gets caught in the middle of smuggling cash into the country for her gunrunner boss. When the cops try to use Jackie to get to her boss, she hatches a plan — with help from a bail bondsman — to keep the money for herself.','/rOUx7qg4KmEh1juEDwqzbDSL1Nr.jpg','1997-12-25',154,'Released','This Christmas, Santa\'s got a brand new bag.','Jackie Brown',184,12.6858,7.359,'Mr5aO3Ltrdg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13653,_binary '\0','/hsBu64kDdca8ghEStr8FJB1d2g3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119404',7,3695,'en','Jane Eyre','After a bleak childhood, Jane Eyre goes out into the world to become a governess. As she lives happily in her new position at Thornfield Hall, she meets the dark, cold, and abrupt master of the house, Edward Rochester. Jane and her employer grow close in friendship and she soon finds herself falling in love with him. Happiness seems to have found Jane at last, but could Rochester\'s terrible secret be about to destroy it forever?','/1j3MacXlWOJg0nrzmBfmlqPoWZp.jpg','1997-03-09',108,'Released',NULL,'Jane Eyre',46203,2.4061,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13654,_binary '\0','/wOmMJqsUhPDaxtgP5vBIVxvZSui.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119416',5.5,1220,'en','Johnny Skidmarks','Johnny Scardino is working for blackmailers, photographing wealthy guys in seedy motels. One such assignment turns the wrong way and blackmailers die one by one. Is Johnny the next on the list?','/f7q1Cpc6cyjgGFhhPehAWY25VgD.jpg','1998-01-18',96,'Released','A crash course in crime.','Johnny Skidmarks',68744,1.7283,5.4,'JwiQW2m2a7E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13655,_binary '\0','/scFhhNVkoupdgbaxV0xGlx43cas.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119418',1.9,1227,'fr','Le Jour et la Nuit','Ten years ago, distinguished French author Alexandre (Alain Delon) exchanged his stressful, hectic life in Paris for a more peaceful existence upon a Mexican hacienda with his wife Ariane (Marianne Denicourt). Lucien (Jean-Pierre Kalfon) also accompanies them. There, Alexandre meets the strange lady-oracle Sonia (Lauren Bacall). As the film opens, the melancholy Alexandre is visited by the sensuous actress Laure (Arielle Dombasle) and her producer Raoul Fillipi (Karl Zero) who is going to make a movie of one of Alexandre\'s best-loved books. Laure is determined to play the part of the heroine and is willing to resort to seduction to get it. At the same time, Ariane is involved in a passionate affair with French-Mexican seismologist Carlo (Xavier Beauvois). While all of these characters wrangle and tangle with their different agendas, the local residents prepare for a violent revolution. ~ Sandra Brennan, Rovi','/zChEZS28CAnWclUddXil575dlOA.jpg','1997-02-12',108,'Released',NULL,'Day and Night',160989,1.6162,2.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13656,_binary '\0','/3Z7DzPvGJhibK3mCGQuyeZUcMsj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119426',5,1972,'en','Joyride','A bored motel clerk and his buddies go for a little joy ride in a woman\'s car. They don\'t realize until it is too late that she is a paid assassin and that her latest victim is in the trunk. Thus begins the clerk\'s descent into a shadowy world of lies and murder.','/myQoJilmXPzVi7mcrHqgNjAvmBU.jpg','1997-11-18',93,'Released','Would you kill for the ride of your life?','Joyride',48319,2.0489,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13657,_binary '\0','/bl0aRfeNSl3zw03rWEVYqstBUKL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119427',6.1,3270,'hi','जुदाई','In order to attain wealth and a luxurious life, a greedy wife sells her husband to a rich woman. However she realizes that with a luxurious life, she has to pay a heavy price for this decision.','/74DpCTKpItTBcgJyISO3wLEmAMo.jpg','1997-02-28',167,'Released',NULL,'Judaai',108368,1.3109,5.7,'_8vMeuXeWDI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13658,_binary '\0','/hoSX32ZUxAUBDfCJemYE7e8MyjA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119428',6.2,7838,'hi','जुड़वा','Identical twins Raja and Prem are separated at birth and raised in drastically different backgrounds. While Prem becomes a singer in the USA, Raja\'s life leads him to become a tough-talking thug in India. When Prem comes to India, who\'s who confusion brews and leads to hilarious consequences.','/hC1prtsvTKSUh6FzRun7zD0XXUB.jpg','1997-02-07',148,'Released',NULL,'Judwaa',161238,1.8594,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13659,_binary '\0','/9cNryJmufuwcXKI6hhcQj15MeWm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119429',5.9,1693,'en','Julian Po','Christian Slater is a stranger who comes to a small town. The local citizens think he\'s up to no good. After bothering him for a while, he blurts out in frustration, that he is there to kill himself.','/2kdCZztkyS0sgtoWaLp3zebp1uE.jpg','1997-09-05',84,'Released',NULL,'Julian Po',100196,1.5882,6.5,'i-qjY8CJSEU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13660,_binary '\0','/1yZPEWvKLVMImVECTgZLKvdYyMa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119432',5.3,27957,'en','Jungle 2 Jungle','Uptight New York City executive, Michael Cromwell, pursues his soon-to-be ex-wife to South America and returns home with the son he never knew he had—a boy raised in a tribal village in Brazil. Armed with only his blowgun, the 13-year-old Mimi-Siku discovers that the world outside his jungle home is indeed a strange place.','/xRKfvheWRfkirm0kzdBAydUjiK5.jpg','1997-03-04',105,'Released','The big city is about to get a little savage.','Jungle 2 Jungle',9446,4.2475,5.4,'-geSKK8NZ8I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13661,_binary '\0','/7rxKreyDYVaHCOm93cZ1GaK5ZeO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119448',7.6,12053,'nl','Karakter','In pre-WWII Holland, the penniless, illegitimate son of a powerful bailiff sets out to become a lawyer as he spends a lifetime struggling to prove his worth to his relentlessly spiteful father.','/v7TWGTZ6fNkY72IyoiVIcnlwniU.jpg','1997-04-17',122,'Released',NULL,'Character',17139,1.7691,7.307,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13662,_binary '\0','/8edMloIwppGDsJ4tqqhDfH9IOSN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119453',6.3,1668,'en','Keep the Aspidistra Flying','Gordon Comstock is a copywriter at an ad agency, and his girlfriend Rosemary is a designer. Gordon believes he is a genius, a marvelous poet and quits the ad agency, trying to live on his poems, but poverty soon comes to him.','/kOqZpuN5Q3F1GU6SFJjWnYd2uBo.jpg','1997-11-20',101,'Released',NULL,'Keep the Aspidistra Flying',54795,2.2417,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13663,_binary '\0','/gyu82kX4H1HoYYelCJNAW3rKZYq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119465',6,2194,'en','Kiss Me, Guido','When he discovers his girlfriend having sex with his brother, Frankie decides to head to Manhattan, leaving his Bronx pizza shop forever for the fame and fortune of show business. But before stardom, he needs a place to stay. Looking in the personals, he notices GWM. And thinking it \"Guy with Money,\" he heads to the Village and the apartment of gay actor Warren, who\'s in desperate need of this month\'s rent.','/3aFhsB4ez8ViUofXMaSI9k7bT1m.jpg','1997-07-18',86,'Released',NULL,'Kiss Me, Guido',32519,1.7075,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13664,_binary '\0','/jRTbtpVdcCgBylYvEVZvqHW6DyM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119467',6.3,1518,'en','Kiss or Kill','Two lovers, Nikki and Al, have a scam in which Nikki allows herself to be picked up by older men, drugs them, and, with Al\'s help, robs them. After accidentally killing one of her victims with an overdose, Nikki and Al are on the run.','/vV0tah9ztJbj0kWSzAMtvQm2L9L.jpg','1997-07-01',96,'Released','Lovers on the RUN . . .','Kiss or Kill',37517,1.716,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13665,_binary '\0','/y319VH0gIFie6KEO5L4nHhxxQUw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119468',6.6,101501,'en','Kiss the Girls','Forensic psychologist and detective Alex Cross travels to North Carolina and teams with escaped kidnap victim Kate McTiernan to hunt down \"Casanova,\" a serial killer who abducts strong-willed women and forces them to submit to his demands. The trail leads to Los Angeles, where the duo discovers that the psychopath may not be working alone.','/a4P8PD9kvN0IZnDzsyurVs2WaJX.jpg','1997-09-29',115,'Released','Smart girls. Pretty girls. Missing girls.','Kiss the Girls',9437,13.1295,6.546,'JiHGk64-eNE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13666,_binary '\0','/ziUPHQ0WEyG4dzmqLsUaWrUwaIZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119471',5.8,4197,'de','Kleines Arschloch - Der Film','Want to know what a successful day in the life of the little asshole looks like? Yes? Well, after you have successfully disturbed your parents\' lovemaking, you concentrate on your own libido. This, slightly disturbed, forces you to strain the weak heart of pensioner Mrs. Koschmidder with unambiguous offers.','/b5OxVpDzm7eVXgm1TUyDM4Lrqeg.jpg','1997-03-06',82,'Released',NULL,'Kleines Arschloch - Der Film',9497,1.9398,5.58,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13667,_binary '\0','/yXnlw2SB0QhYUC4QDyuRZh3CQlU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119472',7.8,37430,'de','Knockin\' on Heaven\'s Door','Two young men, Martin and Rudi, both suffering from terminal cancer, get to know each other in a hospital room. They drown their desperation in tequila and decide to take one last trip to the sea. Drunk and still in pajamas they steal the first fancy car they find, a 60\'s Mercedes convertible. The car happens to belong to a bunch of gangsters, which immediately start to chase it, since it contains more than the pistol Martin finds in the glove box.','/oiaGyQtjI5rnFDI7BVngXyfmVhc.jpg','1997-02-20',89,'Released',NULL,'Knockin\' on Heaven\'s Door',158,5.0415,7.682,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13668,_binary '\0','/YlAjS4vKnymLPexNPhx1ChsqFr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119484',4.9,9302,'en','Kull the Conqueror','A barbarian named Kull becomes ruler after defeating the old king in battle. In an effort to regain the throne, the former king\'s heirs resurrect Akivasha, a witch queen. However, Akivasha has plans of her own for the throne, and only Kull stands in the way.','/cgKK2eCdb5LLaQBDQZbmR312q1O.jpg','1997-08-29',95,'Released','Courage conquers all.','Kull the Conqueror',17832,3.2569,5,'Qlondt_U4w4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13669,_binary '\0','/hDUGoS4BKEAn5ZwJsFEGPU2fJtS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119485',7,32500,'en','Kundun','From childhood to adulthood, Tibet\'s fourteenth Dalai Lama deals with Chinese oppression and other problems.','/yvdFRDoQIQ5PBk4u8x8gJT8NJAw.jpg','1997-12-25',134,'Released','The destiny of a people lies in the heart of a boy.','Kundun',9746,3.5035,6.8,'TW2USm6wTSA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13670,_binary '\0','/hUn13Hom8OWMYpR1ay0diwswwdP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119488',8.2,663802,'en','L.A. Confidential','Three detectives in the corrupt and brutal L.A. police force of the 1950s use differing methods to uncover a conspiracy behind the shotgun slayings of the patrons at an all-night diner.','/lWCgf5sD5FpMljjpkRhcC8pXcch.jpg','1997-09-19',138,'Released','Everything is suspect... Everyone is for sale... And nothing is what it seems.','L.A. Confidential',2118,14.8583,7.808,'QeIoelqDzsA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13671,_binary '\0','/1a1AZaWccuaFsoJ1fS3JOUUnw5f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119494',6.2,2325,'en','The Land Girls','During World War II, the organisation \"The Women\'s Land Army\" recruited women to work on British farms while the men were off to war. Three such \"land girls\" of different social backgrounds - quiet Stella, young hairdresser Prue, and Cambridge graduate Ag - become best friends in spite of their different backgrounds.','/tfdj6Wx8vCDNZbzmIRR2hDn5mAr.jpg','1998-06-12',111,'Released','The story of three young women and the events that would change their lives... The friendships that would stay with them forever... and the loves that would change their hearts.','The Land Girls',17044,1.7609,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13672,_binary '\0','/BFadsVKryVfrOf0nzRxBsvzcCm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119501',6.8,2578,'en','Last Stand at Saber River','As America recovers from the Civil War, one man tries to put the pieces of his life back together but finds himself fighting a new battle on the frontier. Cable is an embittered Confederate soldier who returns from the war to reclaim his Arizona homestead from rebel pioneers who sympathize with the Union war effort.','/wWKbhAzELISfMVTFgFVx7kDyLA4.jpg','1997-01-19',96,'Released',NULL,'Last Stand at Saber River',55576,2.8337,6.5,'JPeinD_Ohzc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13673,_binary '\0','/Hx5VuyfXN9AVHnzeKmhMFaPINq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119502',5.4,2610,'en','The Last Time I Committed Suicide','Neal Cassady is living the beat life during the 1940s, working at The Tire Yard and philandering around town. However, he has visions of a happy life with kids and a white picket fence. When his girlfried, Joan, tries to kill herself he gets scared and runs away. But when Joan reappears will he take the chance at that happiness, or will he turn his back on it?','/5AM1oDIlsWBBLYecetUAHOWv9dW.jpg','1997-06-20',94,'Released','Life is what happens when you\'re busy making plans.','The Last Time I Committed Suicide',34941,2.4961,5.2,'9HViIBZsBfk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13674,_binary '\0','/k21lrYDmrcROWUI4PVzPtKK1x1S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119505',5.7,1411,'en','Curtain Call','A bachelor afraid of marriage angers his long-time girlfriend by buying a splendid townhouse just for himself, only to find it haunted by the ghosts of a famous theatrical couple, who teach him about love and commitment.','/bZmI4sd3KHxjujVAjzSu9huWHCJ.jpg','1998-12-05',94,'Released',NULL,'Curtain Call',48689,2.4296,5.1,'6C4Bgehc4Z4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13675,_binary '\0','/rKOzBCXwtRtkLpDQOyCcNvDS0qo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119506',7.4,9359,'en','Lawn Dogs','In the affluent, gated community of Camelot Gardens, bored wives indiscriminately sleep around while their unwitting husbands try desperately to climb the social ladder. Trent, a 21-year-old outsider who mows the neighborhood lawns, quietly observes the infidelities and hypocrisies of this overly privileged society. When Devon, a 10-year-old daughter from one family, forges a friendship with Trent, things suddenly get very complicated.','/hNi2M5Z7GUEaSCPjt66yavLlsqV.jpg','1997-11-21',101,'Released','Innocence is a dangerous friend.','Lawn Dogs',35796,2.2951,7.132,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13676,_binary '\0','/tFOjZK25suEIaj7FICwrbiPrINV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119509',5.2,4849,'en','Leave It to Beaver','The Cleavers are an all-American family living in Ohio – wise father Ward, loving mother June, teenage son Wally, and 8-year-old Theodore, better known as \'Beaver\'. Beaver hopes to get a bike as a gift from his father and to please him tries out for his school football team and he makes it, only to be embarrassed. The bike he gets is quickly stolen. Meanwhile, Wally is trying to help his friend Eddie Haskell to get the heart of pretty classmate Karen, but Karen seems to like Wally more, and that leads to tensions between the friends.','/zBe7rCrImp9XxSGWTWAmYlPEXeN.jpg','1997-08-22',84,'Released','The Beav is back!','Leave It to Beaver',37244,2.6042,5.4,'38tlgTpTrQM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13677,_binary '\0','/zm5qhhfQkyV9Z2l8oHBaGRaEBLd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119510',7.2,2153,'de','Das Leben ist eine Baustelle.','After he loses his job, his father, and his girlfriend, Jan\'s life is a shambles. Then suddenly he meets freakish street musician Vera, and a bittersweet romance unfolds...','/skb7jy7QHcIp09UCFTZ7iH1ZeZ7.jpg','1997-03-20',115,'Released',NULL,'Life Is All You Get',10018,1.9702,6.674,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13678,_binary '\0','/xS3h1T32kVQnblp0s5IYUNPQZEC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119512',7.3,3101,'en','Left Luggage','While escaping from Nazis during the WWII, a Jewish man dug suitcases full of things dear to his heart in the ground two. The war deprived him of his family, and afterwards he endlessly turns over the soil of Antwerp to find the suitcases, which makes him look obsessed. He keeps checking old maps and keeps digging, trying to find, in fact, those he lost. His daughter Chaya is a beautiful modern girl looking for a part-time job. She finds a place as a nanny in the strictly observant Chassidic family with many children, although her secular manners clearly fly in the face of many commandments. One of the reasons she is accepted is that mother of the family is absolutely overburdened by the household, so she stays despite the resistance of the father, normally - an indisputable authority in the family. She develops a special bond with the youngest of the boys, four-year old Simcha, so far incapable of speaking.','/rcG3g4yblcJC2OlPqYX7Mi54C3b.jpg','1998-03-30',100,'Released',NULL,'Left Luggage',53119,1.8927,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13679,_binary '\0','/7SmKYAxrBgAt4MW34lg9LDL876c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119517',6.3,8654,'en','Your Friends & Neighbors','Restless and unhappy, two couples get caught up in infidelity and deception. Barry is a sullen businessman married to Mary, a writer who is unsatisfied with their relationship. Mary begins an affair with Jerry, a smug theater professor and husband of her friend, Terri, who is also a writer. Adding to the adulterous mix are Cary, a callous doctor, and Cheri, an art-gallery assistant.','/g8u6Hx7F7V2gFr5ddyLQPzQ8f3t.jpg','1998-08-19',107,'Released','A modern immorality tale.','Your Friends & Neighbors',77469,3.1627,5.824,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13680,_binary '\0','/siLb5ADPz9zgr4RR2HHaxuJhfrZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119522',5.4,2637,'en','Letters from a Killer','A man is falsely convicted of the murder of his wife. During his time in jail, he finds comfort from four women with whom he corresponds. After his second court appearance, he is finally freed from prison only to be framed for yet 2 more murders which he did not commit. With the help of his former prison guard, he once again sets out to clear his name','/imNNoKEUWflaoMJlweRJk0gNlgw.jpg','1998-08-21',100,'Released','Don\'t open the mail.','Letters from a Killer',38017,2.3831,5.4,'mqdaIkOgUV0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13681,_binary '\0','/ojJKxkrw0QI5vxj8b2p689s5Wtw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119527',6.4,7715,'en','Deceiver','The gruesome death of a prostitute brings suspicion on one of her clients, James Wayland, a brilliant, self-destructive and epileptic heir to a textile fortune. So detectives Braxton and Kennesaw take Wayland in for questioning, thinking they can break the man. But despite his troubles, Wayland is a master of manipulation, and during the interrogation, he begins to turn the tables on the investigators, forcing them to reveal their own sinister sides.','/1bxBZV0KsUolu7MddTXZ0Prac3Q.jpg','1997-08-31',106,'Released','There are two sides to every lie.','Deceiver',14583,2.7598,5.969,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13682,_binary '\0','/nuDMG0uTaiWFVD6XfHPruum5JOL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119528',6.9,366743,'en','Liar Liar','Forced by his son\'s birthday wish, fast-talking attorney and habitual liar Fletcher Reede must tell the truth for the next 24 hours.','/p1habYSdC7oD3WygQ5lynU5G5rV.jpg','1997-03-21',86,'Released','Trust me.','Liar Liar',1624,14.7992,6.72,'odPUipiGYek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13683,_binary '\0','/78fqm4OGHe4a1Sl1WhX12pV8Ocr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119535',6.3,38612,'en','A Life Less Ordinary','Upon being fired, a desperate guy kidnaps a daughter of his former boss. Two angels are sent to Earth to check if love is possible in this case.','/tk7WNEwLZepFU2yPIIkRuQOO0Q9.jpg','1997-10-24',103,'Released','Kidnapping. Blackmail. Extortion. Karaoke. What some people will do for love.','A Life Less Ordinary',8067,5.1254,6.2,'0AU-Mz0vK9E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13684,_binary '\0','/n7I6AElkIYOBnIKml0t5i0jtX2x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119539',4.4,1392,'sv','Lilla Jönssonligan på styva linan','When their circus tickets get swiped, the Jönsson League boys hatch a plan to steal them back, but end up suspects in an even bigger crime!','/zyA8ITfknEPmc2ypcMbiQ5VQagM.jpg','1997-11-28',104,'Released','They are back!','Young Jönsson Gang Showing Off',57548,1.5197,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13685,_binary '\0','/boDQbQ4NSJdrJy2pbNFSBjVGXwx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119547',6.2,2377,'en','Little Boy Blue','Living in rural Texas is a dysfunctional family: an abusive dad, a Vietnam vet with a war wound that\'s left him impotent; a compliant wife and a son of about 20, two small sons who look a lot like their brother. The dad harbors a secret, and he goes to murderous lengths to keep it hidden. The young man, Jimmy, who has suspicions, but little comes out until a Yankee woman comes to town.','/8A9DICuchF1woO13mvUb9dmUIj8.jpg','1998-05-29',105,'Released',NULL,'Little Boy Blue',20064,2.5888,6,'5Wlm-Rz8dqQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13686,_binary '\0','/oFEfrMKko2tlkYT2rNdcU4TF2ev.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119550',6,2100,'en','Little Ghost','While on location in a spooky Italian villa with his Hollywood big-shot mom and her dorky boyfriend, twelve-year-old Kevin befriends a Renaissance-era girl ghost who helps him cause unrest on the set.','/vAYEBiLx8UilGEBUcqanMyERfll.jpg','1997-12-30',90,'Released','It\'s always an adventure when your best friend is a ghost','Little Ghost',64313,1.2931,5.9,'883WUaKwqjM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13687,_binary '\0','/ppZtadyxjgRZAZneKzUmNY2bVgg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119557',6.1,2241,'en','The Locusts','Delilah Potts has always had her choice of men to work her ranch and fill her bed. But from the moment Clay Hewitt, a handsome drifter with a mysterious past, arrives at her door, Delilah knows that her life will never be the same. And when he spurns her affections, she unleashes a torrent of forbidden passions and deadly secrets that will prove to Clay that the only thing darker and more dangerous than the past he\'s escaping... is the one he\'s about to discover.','/l9vNY9tJUENOvXRCUg5FFACtrtL.jpg','1997-10-03',124,'Released','Every betrayal begins with trust.','The Locusts',75250,1.6209,5.7,'wi_zqr6GACQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13688,_binary '\0','/b9diKSmofRcgjbUxDrSPms82yAN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119558',6.8,75747,'en','Lolita','Humbert Humbert is a middle-aged British novelist who is both appalled by and attracted to the vulgarity of American culture. When he comes to stay at the boarding house run by Charlotte Haze, he soon becomes obsessed with Lolita, the woman\'s teenaged daughter.','/9INcC14WZjCMKGE360VXmklCLdZ.jpg','1997-09-27',137,'Released','A forbidden love. An unthinkable attraction. The ultimate price.','Lolita',9769,20.7466,7.1,'ro4ty8zWcko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13689,_binary '\0','/4ev5rqOZiixs5wc34TyRcZJFKAf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119560',5.9,2290,'en','No Looking Back','Charlie returns to his old town where he meets his ex-girlfriend again and tries to get her back.','/nrhlaUJn8y9rRKhvVRraOhbNSIz.jpg','1998-03-27',96,'Released','How can you not fit in...in your own hometown?','No Looking Back',93350,2.1296,5.5,'ca6_mOp1_XM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13690,_binary '\0','/1VL9ZrYnY88gj5T4GLwzikUP2SD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119565',6,2853,'en','L.A. Without a Map','An aspiring Hollywood actress, on a visit to a charming North England town, has a brief fling with the town undertaker, who also writes obituaries for the local paper. Returning home, where she works as a waitress at a Japanese restaurant, she tells everyone about the handsome \"writer\" she met on her trip. Unfortunately, he decides to follow her back to Hollywood, setting up the expected light romantic comedy with asides as the newcomer gains experience about the goings on in Hollywood.','/2olQqpq5qUVZzEkCm8BORl0G4S2.jpg','1999-02-26',107,'Released','It\'s bright, exiting, romantic and just a little scary.','L.A. Without a Map',61675,3.14,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13691,_binary '\0','/A4rYaPdzgocCjQ0n9LUSYUxyvpS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119567',6.6,483303,'en','The Lost World: Jurassic Park','Four years after Jurassic Park\'s genetically bred dinosaurs ran amok, multimillionaire John Hammond shocks chaos theorist Ian Malcolm by revealing that he has been breeding more beasties at a secret location. Malcolm, his paleontologist ladylove and a wildlife videographer join an expedition to document the lethal lizards\' natural behavior in this action-packed thriller.','/s4RkAQWI9hgzctXgNFos8sJUnXJ.jpg','1997-05-23',129,'Released','Something has survived.','The Lost World: Jurassic Park',330,1.0004,6.564,'vtfwgaHD5_w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13692,_binary '\0','/zEi4O9gszwYpTjcIMYYg5FBDwOh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119571',5.4,1756,'en','The Love Bug','The inimitable VW Beetle is losing all his races and destined for the scrap heap until mechanic Hank takes him over and gives him a new lease of life. Soon, Herbie is winning again, to the fury of his previous owner, who builds a menacing black bug to challenge Herbie to the ultimate race.','/2V6aoZvvcjZcvT9050zuLa38jxW.jpg','1997-11-29',88,'Released','Herbie\'s Back In A Brand-New Movie!','The Love Bug',32643,3.3353,5.7,'W6iTSq0lqKk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13693,_binary '\0','/jWiFvzwhZButMGSUICOXUQppAmE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119572',7.4,6507,'en','Love Jones','Darius Lovehall is a young black poet in Chicago who starts dating Nina Moseley, a beautiful and talented photographer. While trying to figure out if they\'ve got a \"love thing\" or are just \"kicking it,\" they hang out with their friends, talking about love and sex. Then Nina tests the strength of Darius\' feelings and sets a chain of romantic complications into motion.','/iuwimPkDm7kfptKm5zlK0pIzqXM.jpg','1997-03-14',109,'Released','Get Together. Fall Apart. Start Over.','Love Jones',27322,2.9317,7.4,'xNMoQ_Cqt4E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13694,_binary '\0','/h0hl22aEoTduH5dpC8BtSR40Ex.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119574',6.9,4339,'en','Love and Death on Long Island','Curmudgeonly author Giles De\'Ath, a widower with a marked distaste for modern popular culture, attempts to buy a ticket for a film adaptation of an E.M. Forster novel, but instead finds himself watching a tacky teen sex comedy. Yet when the beautiful Ronnie Bostock appears on the movie screen, Giles finds himself caught in a whirlwind of unanswered questions about both his own sexuality and his place in late 20th-century society.','/2jCmP9j43QXy48oQFpzM4oaYRc7.jpg','1998-03-06',93,'Released',NULL,'Love and Death on Long Island',47452,2.4002,6.3,'UJaAMIojNL0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13695,_binary '\0','/t9HN9ScASWf9RSLEoAukRbeDMKq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119576',3,5016,'en','Another 9 1/2 Weeks','Despondent at losing his lover, a man wanders the streets of Paris and has an affair with her kinky friend.','/lbQjiB1KTCX1Tmrby7CV7tP5Yq5.jpg','1997-06-12',105,'Released','On the trail of an old love, he found a dangerous new obsession.','Another 9 1/2 Weeks',18167,3.7912,4.5,'v0kEWhgd9f0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13696,_binary '\0','/2OIb7XZKkgeqS1qX64EkxKXMjC8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119577',6.5,4413,'en','Love Is the Devil: Study for a Portrait of Francis Bacon','In the 1960s, British painter Francis Bacon surprises a burglar and invites him to share his bed. The burglar, a working class man named George Dyer, accepts. After the unique beginning to their love affair, the well-connected and volatile artist assimilates Dyer into his circle of eccentric friends, as Dyer\'s struggle with addiction strains their bond.','/5zPTMTbYPhXXzAo5UQkeSpcmSMl.jpg','1998-09-16',92,'Released','There\'s no beauty without the wound','Love Is the Devil: Study for a Portrait of Francis Bacon',4975,2.3639,6.1,'Q2fjwPFPjhg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13697,_binary '\0','/4K2mgmVneXYuCmfjJb6k8iHGr46.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119578',7,3811,'en','Love! Valour! Compassion!','A group of gay friends spend summer weekends together at a lakeside house in upstate New York. As the season progresses and secrets begin to surface, the complex relationships within the group are sometimes strained and sometimes strengthened.','/1IcLQpZZUPgevqj05xFbg40jTle.jpg','1997-05-16',108,'Released','Eight men. One summer. Figure it out.','Love! Valour! Compassion!',64802,1.9526,6.3,'IdoegW8LI5Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13698,_binary '\0','/gpEzT7uwD6nOXVnbuyJtRE9fz2p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119586',6.6,1592,'fr','Lucie Aubrac','A love story or a tale of the resistance, this poignant movie tells both the haunting story of a French resistance cell in Lyon but also the love of Lucie Aubrac for her husband...','/jpgsYQRoNHnTX6jYtCCyjhzTuLR.jpg','1997-02-26',115,'Released',NULL,'Lucie Aubrac',52366,1.6496,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13699,_binary '\0','/6DDaDZMrkbMvRL7CgFYfnyF8L6z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119588',5.8,2874,'it','M.D.C. - Maschera di cera','Paris, 1900: a couple are horribly murdered by a masked man with a metal claw who rips their hearts out. The sole survivor and witness to the massacre is a young girl. Twelve years later in Rome a new wax museum is opened, whose main attractions are lifelike recreations of gruesome murder scenes. A young man bets that he will spend the night in the museum but is found dead the morning after. Soon, people start disappearing from the streets of Rome and the wax museum halls begin filling with new figures...','/zBaPj7OLO3nFL5z5lDcsxP2hGWw.jpg','1997-04-04',98,'Released',NULL,'The Wax Mask',28494,2.1538,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13700,_binary '\0','/nfj0CWrBw6lRjPb1yUSqxGjgudt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119590',7.5,9293,'fr','Ma vie en rose','Ludovic is waiting for a miracle. With six-year-old certainty, she believes she was meant to be a little girl -- and that the mistake will soon be corrected. But where she expects the miraculous, Ludo finds only rejection, isolation, and guilt -- as the intense reactions of family, friends, and neighbors strip away every innocent lace and bauble.','/4SwZaSDy1DR80QXKdvp6iSTawK2.jpg','1997-05-28',88,'Released','Sometimes you just have to be yourself.','My Life in Pink',27103,2.2612,6.9,'gyRURX2h7G4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13701,_binary '\0','/76STV6QPsVnYKX2HSEoTclAHIeQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119592',6.3,22013,'en','Mad City','A misguided museum guard who loses his job and then tries to get it back at gunpoint is thrown into the fierce world of ratings-driven TV gone mad.','/wXb9KGqxyrAHNygRRI1HW1BhcU.jpg','1997-10-10',114,'Released','One man will make a mistake. The other will make it a spectacle.','Mad City',9770,3.5817,6.255,'UB6XsDKKz1s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13702,_binary '\0','/xDVSIYTtAEauO85vZ6GPdJZOnwD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119594',6.2,14179,'en','Twilight','A retired detective accepts a simple task, unaware that it will tear open old, forgotten, but deadly wounds.','/jepRBZNXgsINrbtSiSEdtCYbRMM.jpg','1998-03-06',94,'Released','Some people can buy their way out of anything. Except the past.','Twilight',26269,3.8078,6.1,'yPt0jp1o9jU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13703,_binary '\0','/1nmYUfJCM2tUFqtDufcGBrq4pzU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119608',6.6,1437,'cs','Mandragora','Marek is a 15-year-old from a provincial village who runs away to Prague when he begins to fail at school. He is mugged shortly after arriving in the city and is rescued by Honza with the promise of work. Marek is taken to an apartment, drugged, and becomes a male prostitute. He is a bit smarter than his colleagues and teams up with a friend, David, in order to go after bigger scores – to cash in and get out. They manage to stash away a bit of money, but when it comes time to return home, Marek loses his nerve and is soon back in the city.','/hLOO5qg4l1Xlh2J61X3azzBRJSZ.jpg','1997-10-22',126,'Released','He was 15 – an innocent from a small village, soon to be trapped in the erotic underworld of Prague.','Mandragora',41914,2.4132,6,'h5z1eIGyOqQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13704,_binary '\0','/pWC1VAEu1ujQdKW8kTzrwxV7abl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119620',6.9,1867,'fr','Marius et Jeannette','Jeannette is a single mother living in a working-class community in Marseilles; she tries to support herself and her two kids on her salary as a check-out girl at a supermarket and lives in an apartment complex where everyone is thrown into close proximity with everyone else. Marius is working as a security guard at a cement factory that has gone out of business; he\'s also squatting in the building, since the plant is soon to be demolished and he\'ll be needing his money later on. One day, Jeannette happens by the factory, and spotting several cans of paint, tries to take two of them home with her. Marius spots her and tries to chase her away, while she rails at him with curses against the capitalist system. The next day, an apologetic Marius appears at her doorstep, cans of paint in hand; the two soon become friendly, and a romance begins to bloom, though it quickly becomes obvious that Jeannette\'s romance novel fantasies are a bit off the mark from what Marius has in mind.','/6avoR3mDjg2UN5BGVrkpe5M94RF.jpg','1997-11-19',105,'Released',NULL,'Marius and Jeannette',64968,1.815,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13705,_binary '\0','/zgW0dbMOqVfpsefYYIRh0AO5Z7D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119623',5.9,1687,'fr','Marquise','Marquise is a drama about the rise and fall of a beauteous actress. As cheerfully portrayed by Sophie Marceau, the eponymous heroine is an engagingly ribald, but perhaps rather too modern, character. She rises from an impoverished background to become a favourite of the Sun King, Louis XIV, and the mistress of the celebrated Racine, who wrote roles especially for her; but her fate, in the end, is a tragic one.','/4FlAhORNIfOwL5XPEtXUbSAKnTK.jpg','1997-08-20',111,'Released','The rise and fall of a beauteous actress','Marquise',5144,1.6647,5.5,'ORObl4u0Hsc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13706,_binary '\0','/oLMzuBnWrooxDIRBKTG7OPDlrXS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119626',7.6,5187,'es','Martín (Hache)','After having a nearly fatal drug overdose, 19-year-old Argentine Martin is sent to Madrid, where his film director father lives with his new, younger lover, Alicia, and his bisexual actor friend, Dante.','/pe7dC06Eb0hNKzWSsHtA2oTUDK9.jpg','1997-03-31',134,'Released','He doesn’t work. He doesn’t want to study. He’s not a bum. He wants to be free.','Martin (Hache)',43429,1.3174,7.5,'cUQIHRV3Vlc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13707,_binary '\0','/cBw8PERRo7wq2zf3WobS1ynDrg3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119629',7.1,3484,'ar','المصير','In the 12th century\'s Andalusia lives Ibn Rushd a prominent Islamic philosopher with his wife Zeinab and daughter Salma. The principality is ruled by Khalifa ElMansour who has two sons, ElNasser, an intellectual that likes Ibn Rush and is in love with his daughter Salma. The younger son Abdallah is more into dancing and poetry, spending most of his times with the gypsy family and getting the daughter pregnant. The Khalifa is depending on the extremists to build his army granting them more power which they use to combat artists and philosophers. The extremists succeed in recruiting Abd Allah and train him to kill his father. Events go on where Marawan, the gypsy singer, is killed and Ibn Rushd\'s books are burnt. Adapted from the real life of Ibn Rushd AlMasir is Chahine\'s statement against extremism.','/pjA38G2fCKTgWsz1HbOcGJalbi1.jpg','1997-08-18',129,'Released',NULL,'Destiny',37673,1.4865,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13708,_binary '\0','/cN4qq4B8JR4ekuKAIKGVa4bBssl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119630',5.3,3931,'en','Masterminds','A rebellious computer engineering prodigy uses his talent for pranks to outwit the security consultant who has taken the students at his prestigious private school hostage.','/ejI1ANa8nu2hYN7iVBWJfpaaJoe.jpg','1997-08-22',105,'Released','He\'s a teenage one-man army... and he doesn\'t have a hall pass!','Masterminds',25224,2.0101,5.3,'RYxF6KgUQZ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13709,_binary '\0','/wrz94zJpGWZgq2DKbxqLiy97Lbd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119632',6.6,6232,'en','The Matchmaker','Marcy, a worker in the reelection campaign of bumbling Senator John McGlory, is sent to Ireland on a quest to find the Irish ancestry of Sen. McGlory, to help him win the Irish vote. But when Marcy arrives in the small village of Ballinagra, she finds herself in the middle of a matchmaking festival, and the local matchmaker is determined to pair her off with one of the local bachelors.','/3TlW75w0Lo4uT6l8WRf3pdxbHHs.jpg','1997-10-03',97,'Released','A comedy for the incurably unromantic.','The Matchmaker',20457,1.9012,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13710,_binary '\0','/uTp1WgfD43U6g4iP44VcoKQcm1H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119640',4.6,7474,'en','McHale\'s Navy','Retired Lieutenant Commander Quinton McHale spends his days puttering around the Caribbean in the old PT-73 selling homebrew, ice cream, and swimsuit calendars. He\'s brought out of retirement when Major Vladikov, his old nemesis turned the second top terrorist in the world, takes over the island of San Moreno and starts building a nuclear launch silo. With help from his old crew and hindrances from Captain Wallace B. Binghampton, who sank a cruise liner a while back, McHale aims to put Vladikov out of business.','/tg9qzqF349j526pNZnjPB4p2UED.jpg','1997-04-18',108,'Released','He\'s Under Siege and Out-of-Control.','McHale\'s Navy',14908,2.1058,4.5,'K_MLWXe3PCc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13711,_binary '\0','/yLNUdGv4tLdNc4J9DhTPhMX6UcF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119642',5.3,5242,'en','Mean Guns','One hundred mid- and low-level gangsters who are on their boss\' bad side are locked inside a newly-built high-security prison, and given plenty of guns, ammo, and baseball bats, then told that the last survivor will get a suitcase with 10 million dollars.','/yjFf4TG5XYivQX7K59vDM2JtkHO.jpg','1997-11-21',110,'Released',NULL,'Mean Guns',26103,2.7617,5.5,'ZJ1ci5Z12EU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13712,_binary '\0','/uMBByiSDpgFwWVegAtwwnuzvogJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119643',7.2,303491,'en','Meet Joe Black','Bill Parrish has it all - success, wealth and power. Days before his 65th birthday, he receives a visit from a mysterious stranger, Joe Black, who soon reveals himself as Death. In exchange for extra time, Bill agrees to serve as Joe\'s earthly guide. But will he regret his choice when Joe unexpectedly falls in love with Bill\'s beautiful daughter Susan?','/fDPAjvfPMomkKF7cMRmL5Anak61.jpg','1998-11-12',178,'Released','Sooner or later everyone does.','Meet Joe Black',297,18.9785,7.37,'_zIOjl93WrU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13713,_binary '\0','/4S0VpCc4LNUxB7PmkHQt4n5MLlE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119644',5.3,4011,'en','Meet Wally Sparks','Wally Sparks is a tabloid TV show reporter who\'s trying to boost ratings on his show. He goes to the governor\'s mansion to uncover a sex scandal.','/mD30gucf7NkKNFyqEMEag7l63VO.jpg','1997-01-31',105,'Released','He\'s a menace to high society.','Meet Wally Sparks',40506,2.7099,4.7,'Z8MBl2oi7dg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13714,_binary '\0','/aJMhYOP80cVBtq5ku3uyqASF3Ol.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119654',7.3,671944,'en','Men in Black','After a police chase with an otherworldly being, a New York City cop is recruited as an agent in a top-secret organization established to monitor and police alien activity on Earth: the Men in Black. Agent K and new recruit Agent J find themselves in the middle of a deadly plot by an intergalactic terrorist who has arrived on Earth to assassinate two ambassadors from opposing galaxies.','/uLOmOF5IzWoyrgIF5MfUnh5pa1X.jpg','1997-07-02',98,'Released','Protecting the Earth from the scum of the universe.','Men in Black',607,21.5061,7.23,'HYUd7AOw_lk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13715,_binary '\0','/tSS4RTrD9sOsgYMUXZG6K0pV36E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119657',7.6,2984,'en','Men with Guns','Dr. Fuentes is a medical professor approaching his retirement and journeys to find old students, with sometimes disturbing results.','/xdjOvVfG6lhRi1U1qBLW1s6CdFj.jpg','1998-03-27',127,'Released','A New Film From The Director of \"Lone Star\"','Men with Guns',44641,1.9069,6.3,'qXtx2213Baw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13716,_binary '\0','/i21CwiP4K1lEdactj7UyDBNkoVZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119664',5.6,30840,'en','Metro','Roper, a hostage negotiator catches a murderous bank robber after a blown heist. The bank robber escapes and immediately goes after the man who put him behind bars.','/nvfyHYv1EDpYai5pCGqBeRf3tax.jpg','1997-01-16',117,'Released','LIFE IS A NEGOTIATION.','Metro',8860,4.4854,5.7,'6bumn8hGuOQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13717,_binary '\0','/hAFIXRVST0f8XJztLn8vntv9zkq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119665',6.3,3852,'en','Metroland','In late-1970s suburban London, Chris and Marion have settled into a comfortable yet all-too-predictable middle-class existence. Chris receives an unexpected visit from his free-spirited friend Toni, a reunion that reminds him of a more carefree time in 1960s Paris. Now, with lingering doubts about his marriage bubbling up, Chris must make the choice between revisiting his youthful abandon with Toni or facing the here and now with Marion.','/qUFYBfOY3Ec2S6PR6apgFwfR6je.jpg','1998-08-21',105,'Released','It\'s not a place, it\'s a state of mind.','Metroland',30950,1.6962,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13718,_binary '\0','/zDtIIaPdcRvZnvpD1qnI8v4nHOR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119668',6.6,44094,'en','Midnight in the Garden of Good and Evil','A visiting city reporter\'s assignment suddenly revolves around the murder trial of a local millionaire, whom he befriends.','/4SYIV9cPixTWfjlDd44mGl6F05f.jpg','1997-11-21',155,'Released','Welcome to Savannah, Georgia. A city of hot nights and cold blooded murder.','Midnight in the Garden of Good and Evil',8197,5.2786,6.35,'bUvm4Yd4ebA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13719,_binary '\0','/wq41s88t8TUNDWWhpZQ65P4OhP8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119670',7.2,15020,'en','The Mighty','Kevin, an intelligent guy helps out Maxwell to improve his reading skills. In return, Kevin wants Maxwell to take him out places since he is not authorized to go out. Being the social outcasts of the town, Kevin and Maxwell come to realize that they are similar to each other and accept that they are \"freaks\" and nothing will stop them.','/eHcuTZwmY4VAJm7kfbZn7qDAjYs.jpg','1998-06-01',100,'Released','The quest for friendship is the noblest cause of all','The Mighty',9821,4.0912,7.239,'55NnLGNeZ-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13720,_binary '\0','/coGcEVPsB7BPutqK0qjfAK22PUC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119675',6,60712,'en','Mimic','A disease carried by common cockroaches is killing Manhattan children. In an effort to stop the epidemic an entomologist, Susan Tyler, creates a mutant breed of insect that secretes a fluid to kill the roaches. This mutant breed was engineered to die after one generation, but three years later Susan finds out that the species has survived and evolved into a large, gruesome monster that can mimic human form.','/ieRRo78f8JzEKxfiCKqJyFg6l8o.jpg','1997-08-22',105,'Released','For thousands of years, man has been evolution\'s greatest creation... until now.','Mimic',4961,6.6442,6.1,'LL-GB11uyTI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13721,_binary '\0','/cTuuVAzOGg7JQwJwytAQIBi3GdD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119677',6.7,2883,'hu','A miniszter félrelép','A Minister and the Secretary of the Opposition party go to a 5 star hotel to conduct a secret affair. Their plans are ruined when they discover a corpse lodged in the window of their room.','/xjqUeuSYTqNZC8nU2OqC0PoptB6.jpg','1997-12-11',105,'Released',NULL,'Out of Order',50827,1.107,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13722,_binary '\0','/jzvtc39zBL03YOJUatCg4dQjxbU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119679',7.1,1593,'en','Miss Evers\' Boys','The true story of the US Government\'s 1932 Tuskeegee Syphilis Experiments, in which a group of black test subjects were allowed to die, despite a cure having been developed.','/fnC7xMbXGDEO7ETVOsTOOPYXTCM.jpg','1997-02-22',118,'Released','A Government Lie. A Woman\'s Secret. A Story That Must Be Told.','Miss Evers\' Boys',133958,2.1098,6.6,'C6B_dCLcfks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13723,_binary '\0','/g1J3SBqxbeHLTatlzHp8bGhaAwO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119683',7.4,44763,'en','Les Misérables','In 19th century France, Jean Valjean, a man imprisoned for stealing bread, must flee a relentless policeman named Javert. The pursuit consumes both men\'s lives, and soon Valjean finds himself in the midst of the student revolutions in France.','/3TOgmlIY8X3WjIjvU7Z0jqeNkyU.jpg','1998-05-01',134,'Released','The legend comes to life.','Les Misérables',4415,5.4686,7.2,'JhhsylxYafE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13724,_binary '\0','/cWBWCVWcetCA70pce1leRLQWeFj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119687',7.3,1654,'ja','萌の朱雀','Depicts the life of a family in a remote Japanese timber village. Family head Tahara Kozo lives with his mother Sachiko, wife Yasuyo, nephew Eisuke and young daughter Michiru. Economic recession and failed development plans cause tragedy in the family.','/fdHiWTfFWt5v1gYlOTqaqhs4lZM.jpg','1997-11-01',95,'Released',NULL,'Suzaku',36895,1.5709,7.3,'j_5RNlUmIe8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13725,_binary '\0','/mPId0j7owQmeOQHyOl2kEbzQpXd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119695',6.2,33892,'en','Money Talks','Sought by police and criminals, a small-time huckster makes a deal with a TV newsman for protection.','/bN57Rl003E9pYred5kw9Rp8h9Np.jpg','1997-08-22',97,'Released','This ain\'t no buddy movie.','Money Talks',9416,5.7194,6,'FQjAVpz4k-U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13726,_binary '\0','/gl0jzn4BupSbL2qMVeqrjKkF9Js.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119698',8.3,490927,'ja','もののけ姫','Ashitaka, a prince of the disappearing Emishi people, is cursed by a demonized boar god and must journey to the west to find a cure. Along the way, he encounters San, a young human woman fighting to protect the forest, and Lady Eboshi, who is trying to destroy it. Ashitaka must find a way to bring balance to this conflict.','/cMYCDADoLKLbB83g4WnJegaZimC.jpg','1997-07-12',134,'Released','The fate of the world rests on the courage of one warrior.','Princess Mononoke',128,22.0994,8.321,'4OiMOHRDs14','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13727,_binary '\0','/9iRvrYsIxr3UlS16XSrBypFMJHo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119699',6.1,2112,'en','Montana','A seasoned enforcer is given the seemingly routine task of finding the Boss\'s runaway mistress, Kitty. However Kitty is involved in plans to overthrow the Boss and this routine task gets very complicated.','/zFs5UNnduge6BvIXORENbEdfK8h.jpg','1998-01-16',96,'Released','Never underestimate the power of a woman.','Montana',30814,2.0611,5.6,'PuBPaX_Y6fE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13728,_binary '\0','/19EpgKZDkLIwY1TI1pjBJtQ5qdr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119707',3.6,62718,'en','Mortal Kombat: Annihilation','A group of heroic warriors has only six days to save the planet in \"Mortal Kombat Annihilation.\" To succeed they must survive the most spectacular series of challenges any human, or god, has ever encountered as they battle an evil warlord bent on taking control of Earth.','/ttryglcY2osWZE3sRYBf3ewTZsW.jpg','1997-11-11',95,'Released','Destroy all expectations.','Mortal Kombat: Annihilation',9823,7.1319,4.566,'dimVCTUBJEA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13729,_binary '\0','/gy3SSsbVonbAHCzsmMuTe91I2Kh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119709',5.6,6725,'en','Most Wanted','A Marine on death row is recruited by a shadowy U.S. military officer as part of a top-secret ops team, then gets framed for murder when the team and its officer set him up as the fall guy for the assassination of the First Lady.','/8vKh2AnzJaRM1eALkBKEU97NK1B.jpg','1997-10-10',99,'Released','Sometimes the most patriotic thing a Marine can do...is disobey orders. From most honored to Most Wanted.','Most Wanted',34309,4.4377,5.4,'Wh9ttAFn3rg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13730,_binary '\0','/rgqAb8TR2ZdzowHnsY1sBn8T6Or.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119711',7.2,4526,'ru','Мать и сын','A man goes for a walk through the countryside with his dying mother.','/tCvDqekqALCQ5rTC9c2IYLARhL8.jpg','1997-02-20',73,'Released',NULL,'Mother and Son',44361,1.5494,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13731,_binary '\0','/3YV8gxpLA3WYkLaQcejI4uti1hf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119715',6.5,64262,'en','MouseHunt','Down-on-their luck brothers, Lars and Ernie Smuntz, aren\'t happy with the crumbling old mansion they inherit... until they discover the estate is worth millions. Before they can cash in, they have to rid the house of its single, stubborn occupant—a tiny and tenacious mouse.','/aqBPrWOzXEO3rWEk3DYTHBjXNZb.jpg','1997-12-19',98,'Released','Who\'s hunting who?','MouseHunt',6283,8.2902,6.551,'xvFeWRpeU1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13732,_binary '\0','/ePplQTFby7PCg0A7VBVM6DEYWq2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119717',6.3,2812,'en','Mr. Jealousy','After his first date at age 15 ended with the girl making out with another man at a party, aspiring writer Lester Grimm has treated all his girlfriends with jealousy and suspicion. While dating Ramona Ray, paranoia gets the best of him when he discovers that her most recent ex is successful novelist Dashiell Frank. Lester begins attending the same group therapy sessions as Dashiell to learn about Ramona\'s past with him.','/eHKAQTwZOIzUvqz4pZ3Tj6JX3K1.jpg','1998-06-05',105,'Released',NULL,'Mr. Jealousy',53765,3.2507,5.9,'SOmd9JbQ9lo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13733,_binary '\0','/ynSNDPkOPNWStSzVsj3CZ6NT6F5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119718',4.1,17011,'en','Mr. Magoo','Mr. Magoo, a man with terrible eyesight, gets caught up in a museum robbery.','/po5CfSBmmATuCNIt7M1G7xOPuUK.jpg','1997-12-25',87,'Released','You won\'t believe your eyes.','Mr. Magoo',9438,3.7584,4.483,'h4CChNuUxYA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13734,_binary '\0','/a7dvEl0hRPbGmplEFEJMJwTuGzK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119723',6.5,4625,'en','Mrs. Dalloway','Clarissa Dalloway looks back on her youth as she readies for a gathering at her house. The wife of a legislator and a doyenne of London\'s upper-crust party scene, Clarissa finds that the plight of ailing war veteran Septimus Warren Smith reminds her of a past romance with Peter Walsh. In flashbacks, young Clarissa explores her possibilities with Peter.','/kJURxFCyfqjTss7vTVMuUobHcye.jpg','1997-09-01',97,'Released','A woman’s past unlocks the truth buried within her soul.','Mrs. Dalloway',38904,2.2144,5.7,'p6Iv7r-aRWs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13735,_binary '\0','/pV3851nZ1OZ18j2BWDJSQ4de0Dn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119731',6.1,34931,'en','Murder at 1600','A secretary is found dead in a White House bathroom during an international crisis, and Detective Harlan Regis is in charge of the investigation. Despite resistance from the Secret Service, Regis partners with agent Nina Chance. As political tensions rise, they learn that the crime could be part of an elaborate cover-up. Framed as traitors, the pair, plus Regis\' partner, break into the White House in order to expose the true culprit.','/4WPR0m8zuzFAcRJAHcGs1AxkkpB.jpg','1997-04-18',107,'Released','This address changes all the rules.','Murder at 1600',9415,6.054,6.102,'VKa2-Uy6-L4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13736,_binary '\0','/tDFCGTkLT40Q6ySAzXPxjCwpgyX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119734',6.2,5758,'en','Music from Another Room','Music From Another Room is a romantic comedy that follows the exploits of Danny, a young man who grew up believing he was destined to marry the girl he helped deliver as a five year old boy when his neighbor went into emergency labor. Twenty-five years later, Danny returns to his hometown and finds the irresistible Anna Swann but she finds it easy to resist him since she is already engaged to dreamboat Eric, a very practical match. In pursuit of Anna, Danny finds himself entangled with each of the eccentric Swanns including blind, sheltered Nina, cynical sister Karen, big brother Bill and dramatic mother Grace as he fights to prove that fate should never be messed with and passion should never be practical.','/zamhRB4bKVeRUW568lVSFeEbqVg.jpg','1998-04-24',104,'Released','Their romance began the day she was born.','Music from Another Room',39424,3.4256,5.6,'ZP12lveblKo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13737,_binary '\0','/naA6aqGYh8D8x2pODBAvFiqwuJh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119738',6.4,168744,'en','My Best Friend\'s Wedding','When she receives word that her longtime platonic pal Michael O\'Neal is getting married to debutante Kimberly Wallace, food critic Julianne Potter realizes her true feelings for Michael -- and sets out to sabotage the wedding.','/b5g4bp8gS5ovMyR5439AII6zQ3n.jpg','1997-06-19',105,'Released','Julianne fell in love with her best friend the day he decided to marry someone else.','My Best Friend\'s Wedding',8874,7.2824,6.6,'7gRQFgdtAXs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13738,_binary '\0','/caRJ9pL232P22zxAOvD06xK9lwf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119743',6.8,1712,'en','My Son the Fanatic','Pakistani taxi-driver Parvez and prostitute Bettina find themselves trapped in the middle when Islamic fundamentalists decide to clean up their local town.','/34rfjIEVqmzjN7HMZhrrPgPaHuE.jpg','1997-10-21',88,'Released',NULL,'My Son the Fanatic',55955,2.1735,5,'o0xAGZSLYNA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13739,_binary '\0','/Spi2VFiSw63yQfyNSXSJWh1HxY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119746',6,2780,'en','The Myth of Fingerprints','When a New England dysfunctional family gathers for Thanksgiving, past demons reveal themselves as one son returns for the first time in three years.','/4aHnhKkmQlSBbOKhYNImUI254KF.jpg','1997-09-17',93,'Released',NULL,'The Myth of Fingerprints',98502,1.9376,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13740,_binary '\0','/hatBDnsTHk5GwBBHgfveX3MWK1C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119763',4.8,1697,'sv','Nattbuss 807','Kalle, an 18-year-old boy, has ended up on the wrong path in life. He hangs out mostly with a bunch of racist young punks. Carlos is a 16-year-old boy, he has lived in Sweden most of his life with his mother and her older brother. His father remains in his native Bolivia. Carlos and his brother are part of a small gang consisting mostly of immigrants. The film is about the conflict between Kalle and Carlos, as well as their respective gangs, a conflict with tragic consequences.','/k3MzuJneYnICIGUIsvuCJz1Djg5.jpg','1997-02-28',106,'Released',NULL,'Night Bus 807',46134,1.4582,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13741,_binary '\0','/q0KhhLSbxoJTlV2o79NtXZgYW8c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119772',6.5,1524,'en','The Nephew','Twenty years ago, Tony Egan\'s sister went to America. Nobody ever heard of her again. But now, the message of her death arrives in her town of birth. Only days later, her only son Chad arrives, too. Obviously, his mother took a black husband. Soon, Chad falls for Aislin, who has a bit of a crush on him too. But there is an old conflict going on between her father and Chad\'s uncle. This conflict resurfaces and begins to draw circles, wider and wider.','/iN3hezUBdYs2RL2nnePtrSWBYNt.jpg','1998-08-28',105,'Released','They\'re worlds apart, but closer than anyone could believe.','The Nephew',78784,1.4941,5.6,'0vnwhBNgKw0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13742,_binary '\0','/vz6MMig076jEHtTBU1BOCDcfWXr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119773',6.7,1270,'fr','Nettoyage à sec','A bored couple takes in a young man who turns their lives inside out.','/q2W2lPtTcjv5AAv2885T2JLMKlU.jpg','1997-09-24',97,'Released',NULL,'Dry Cleaning',6187,1.5028,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13743,_binary '\0','/bpCfNntqaHCYIGOahipfyGE8ovP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119778',6.5,5384,'en','Next Stop Wonderland','Dumped by her loser boyfriend, Erin\'s love life hits rock bottom when her overbearing mother places an embarrassing ad in the \"personals\" section of a local newspaper on her behalf. Erin\'s disgust turns to curiosity as she searches for the right guy in a hilarious series of disastrous dates. Meanwhile, a lonely ex-plumber named Alan clumsily searches for his dream job while narrowly missing one chance meeting with Erin after another.','/cygwoUJ1LqXkYT451E7W3dHtfHZ.jpg','1998-08-21',96,'Released','Love is the destination.','Next Stop Wonderland',41469,1.3133,6,'Q8meZ1qJ3Lk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13744,_binary '\0','/8O8eyuHKZL8ui5QlQbXK4wFovdd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119780',6.8,1825,'en','Niagara, Niagara','An outsider and a young woman plagued by Tourette\'s syndrome meet and together journey to Canada.','/mT46iyYXAgCJIt73qk1T3f13Sgv.jpg','1998-03-20',93,'Released','Love can\'t be controlled.','Niagara, Niagara',53092,1.2881,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13745,_binary '\0','/7HuwR4a3C9HRIgAAYPtFzcW7Ey6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119781',3.8,3636,'en','Nick Fury: Agent of S.H.I.E.L.D.','Marvel\'s hard-boiled hero is brought back to fight the menace of Hydra after exiling himself in the Yukon since the end of the Cold War. The children of the former Hydra head, Baron Von Stucker, have taken charge of the terrorist organization. Under the lead of his vicious daughter, Viper, Hydra has seized a deadly virus and threatens the destruction of America.','/4T0YjvnBaMASZkkRKxMIe6IoWO0.jpg','1998-05-26',91,'Released','The last superhero!','Nick Fury: Agent of S.H.I.E.L.D.',27460,3.3922,4.606,'JNBRum247m0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13746,_binary '\0','/mBMlGgX74cd6g6OE2mM7CqrHyxE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119783',6.7,9609,'en','Night Falls on Manhattan','A newly elected District attorney finds himself in the middle of a police corruption investigation that may involve his father and his partner.','/sjvySDgeAOqrMmm965gdkqR5AML.jpg','1997-03-21',113,'Released','In a city of nine million people is there room for one honest man?','Night Falls on Manhattan',46027,3.2321,6.4,'AxrHdoT0fho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13747,_binary '\0','/ffq9emGt0d2xrxDG0v0V1rcPWoU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119784',6,13568,'en','The Night Flier','For cynical tabloid journo Richard Dees, facts are always stranger than fiction. Every headline is a dead-line. Serial killers, UFO abductions, tales of molestation, mayhem and murder. To some the tales are mere sleazy fantasy – but his faithful readers believe. And now there\'s a new story: The Night Flier. What is it that travels by night in a dark-winged Cessna, lands at secluded airfields and murders local residents? Dees begins to track the unknown killer in a Cessna of his own, uncovering clues that reveal a pilot more terrifying than he could have ever imagined.','/3bMb6CzdKfpw0pZWVW2RbQRneIC.jpg','1997-04-30',93,'Released','Evil has a flight plan.','The Night Flier',12238,3.4002,6,'0eRH4obQa3A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13748,_binary '\0','/zn5hHgu7J3YzB6Wjab2o0veuAZI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119791',6.2,22983,'en','Nightwatch','A law student takes a job as a night watchman at a morgue and begins to discover clues that implicate him as the suspect in a series of murders.','/va6AEeuzB98q9jmzoOpEcBPAYq0.jpg','1997-01-31',102,'Released',NULL,'Nightwatch',2212,4.5215,6.085,'-08FkMkgM4w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13749,_binary '\0','/gJHbC2PZHfX4YZ8MzLCv5rDCP8Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119792',7.3,11200,'en','Nil by Mouth','The family of Raymond, his wife Val and her brother Billy live in working-class London district. Also in their family is Val and Billy\'s mother Janet and grandmother Kath. Billy is a drug addict and Raymond kicks him out of the house, making him live on his own. Raymond is generally a rough and even violent person, and that leads to problems in the life of the family.','/xRW2hoYmXgloWehdBQxAdbKu4Jn.jpg','1997-10-10',128,'Released',NULL,'Nil by Mouth',21252,2.5628,6.9,'ygsnOgh3wIs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13750,_binary '\0','/6MIcir1IlXCCLGfyg1VZwwYeUpG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119794',6.1,7577,'it','Nirvana','Jimi, a computer game designer, finds that his latest product has been infected by a virus which has given consciousness to the main character of the game, Solo. Tormented by the memory of his fled girlfriend Lisa and begged by Solo to end its useless \"life\", Jimi begins a search for people who can help him both to discover what happened to Lisa and to delete his game before it is released.','/1UXk8P1qY3PadOdSj5qk1qBXWMy.jpg','1997-01-24',113,'Released','This game is so advanced... it\'s deadly.','Nirvana',8765,2.5614,6.514,'jRs2HfWinjQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13751,_binary '\0','/i9nSIg4V8LFj3G7vAabnSZexnK7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119802',6.6,2002,'en','Monument Ave.','Bobby O\'Grady is a low level member of a Boston Irish gang run by Jackie O\'Hara. Jackie demands absolute, total loyalty to him. When Jackie kills one of Bobby\'s buddies, Teddy, Bobby and others have to keep it an absolute secret, even from their and Teddy\'s relatives.','/2IpSjfTzEWlHGTHAWNMToqznYn1.jpg','1998-09-25',93,'Released',NULL,'Monument Ave.',21132,1.7773,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13752,_binary '\0','/y7fsDAazaQudZHMrTTegPjWdFT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119807',6.7,52944,'en','Nothing to Lose','Advertising executive Nick Beame learns that his wife is sleeping with his employer. In a state of despair, he encounters a bumbling thief whose attempted carjacking goes awry when Nick takes him on an involuntary joyride. Soon the betrayed businessman and the incompetent crook strike up a partnership and develop a robbery-revenge scheme. But it turns out that some other criminals in the area don\'t appreciate the competition.','/umbzQyRMeB1oHTKiymTlH591xNB.jpg','1997-07-18',97,'Released','When the odds are against you, sometimes the only bet is yourself.','Nothing to Lose',11676,7.0519,6.6,'D81vrzAu9Ck','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13753,_binary '\0','/sx1Lyt6f1NL9uVJiizanUfVNfIx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119809',6.6,12676,'en','Nowhere','In Los Angeles, a colorful assortment of bohemians try to make sense of their intersecting lives. The moody Dark Smith, his bisexual girlfriend, her lesbian lover and their shy gay friend plan on attending the wildest party of the year. But they\'ll only make it if they can survive the drug trips, suicides, trysts, mutilations and alien abductions that occur as one surreal day unfolds.','/c1TZKfzvATep5x5DthqWjjWtU2l.jpg','1997-05-09',83,'Released','Let the love feast begin.','Nowhere',1811,4.2699,6.74,'Yp3ZYlFShk0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13754,_binary '\0','/mqFaz5jlBNHwCNRxNzLPXLS2vgR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119815',7.4,6479,'pt','O Que é Isso, Companheiro?','Fernando, a journalist, and his friend César join terrorist group MR8 in order to fight Brazilian dictatorial regime during the late sixties. César, however, is wounded and captured during a bank hold up. Fernando then decides to kidnap the American ambassador in Brazil and ask for the release of fifteen political prisoners in exchange for his life.','/lwrkDaM1sbxV83tjRT59LyCHcbI.jpg','1997-10-01',110,'Released','Their goal: freedom. Their only hope: an international incident. Their target: the American ambassador.','Four Days in September',21253,2.4469,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13755,_binary '\0','/7a0bohmu6nLKDOyl69UWTQrFfYz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119819',5.2,2612,'en','Office Killer','When Dorine Douglas\' job as proofreader for Constant Consumer magazine is turned into an at-home position during a downsizing, she doesn\'t know how to cope. But after accidentally killing one of her co-workers, she discovers that murder can quench the loneliness of her home life, as a macabre office place forms in her basement, populated by dead co-workers.','/ytPjWp5LMW5jV9IVrcv6yTsxDTH.jpg','1997-12-03',82,'Released','Working here can be murder.','Office Killer',49728,2.4766,5.1,'0uNVPg8njGQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13756,_binary '\0','/wJ0GEncNlH2kGIVIKsUkGMCU5Qb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119820',5.8,1581,'sv','Ogifta par ...en film som skiljer sig','Marie and David are always arguing while their friends Sara and Samuel always seem to be happy together. Or are they? This year they decide to spend Christmas in the mountains together.','/hlJlp7MZBTnIJzc3ZuHoxLAnGeP.jpg','1997-10-29',90,'Released',NULL,'Unmarried Couples: A Comedy That Will Break You Up',53106,1.3448,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13757,_binary '\0','/x7y8ezKtU1vRInk0dmbvDoKgJ8u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119822',7.7,340316,'en','As Good as It Gets','A misanthropic author, a single mother and waitress, and a gay artist form an unlikely friendship after the artist is assaulted in a robbery.','/xXxuJPNUDZ0vjsAXca0O5p3leVB.jpg','1997-12-19',139,'Released','A comedy from the heart that goes for the throat.','As Good as It Gets',2898,12.1727,7.4,'t2d89afgtqg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13758,_binary '\0','/lULtHGIa0d0mzlmpYmoZIdOC9dO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119825',6.2,2007,'en','Oliver Twist','An orphan endures a harsh life in a workhouse before fleeing to London, where he falls in with a gang of juvenile pickpockets led by the criminal Fagin, and eventually finds a better life, exposing the cruelties of poverty and child labor in Victorian England.','/zAYTgtQlQzFK8xGu6mREuOZTkJX.jpg','1997-05-15',91,'Released',NULL,'Oliver Twist',49146,1.8596,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13759,_binary '\0','/AujW8ilemIkF9r6yEcDZv34MwBZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119828',7.3,4664,'fr','On connaît la chanson','Business executive Odile seeks a new, larger apartment. Her younger sister Camille, having completed her doctoral thesis in history, is a Paris tour guide. Simon is a regular on Camille\'s tours as he\'s attracted to her. However, Camille has fallen for Marc, and they begin an affair. Nicolas is also looking for an apartment, since he hopes to eventually have his family join him in Paris.','/rhBcUjyHVssuCke2eZsypcUIMt2.jpg','1997-11-12',120,'Released',NULL,'Same Old Song',2817,1.7824,7,'h2MhkajNVmo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13760,_binary '\0','/7zrjfBsYSOfWXBWpAlc7BLwHd2R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119832',5.9,7476,'en','One Night Stand','In Los Angeles, Max Carlyle makes a good living directing commercials and has a happy home life with his wife, Mimi, and two children. When Carlyle travels to New York City to visit his friend Charlie, who has been diagnosed with AIDS, he has repeat run-ins with a beautiful woman, Karen, and eventually sleeps with her. Though he goes home the next day and doesn\'t return until a year later, Carlyle\'s infidelity still lingers.','/h6aDoPEyK4rgp4MiuRvQjepoyZx.jpg','1997-10-10',102,'Released','Sometimes an entire life can change in just one night.','One Night Stand',12616,3.7917,5.6,'EjCSBgN2vRY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13761,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119838',7,1434,'en','Don King: Only in America','A cinematic portrait of the famous fight promoter and boxing manager.','/eJmNeaGivcXKd8Gzzbi3YRIqHtF.jpg','1997-11-15',121,'Released',NULL,'Don King: Only in America',31907,2.2895,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13762,_binary '\0','/fRtRDCtJZ7bbYBjo1e3IX9L8iwO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119842',7,1939,'en','Orphans','A group of four siblings reunite in Glasgow on the eve of their mother\'s funeral, and the children mourn their mother\'s passing in a variety of ways—sometimes heartfelt, sometimes bizarre. As a potential thunderstorm threatens to damage the city, the situation compounds itself.','/xJqQmrCktJVoCoNU8HSMcTBUbdT.jpg','1998-09-03',101,'Released','Are YOUR parents a burden?','Orphans',57745,1.0244,6.6,'oSYBDZEHB6s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000');
INSERT INTO `movies` VALUES (13763,_binary '\0','/fhvByI4cAMm2gSKgNm2GcTG2c01.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119843',6.5,7462,'en','Oscar and Lucinda','After a childhood of abuse by his evangelistic father, misfit Oscar Hopkins becomes an Anglican minister and develops a divine obsession with gambling. Lucinda Leplastrier is a rich Australian heiress shopping in London for materials for her newly acquired glass factory back home. Deciding to travel to Australia as a missionary, Oscar meets Lucinda aboard ship, and a mutual obsession blossoms. They make a wager that will alter each of their destinies.','/9naDX3u4hsRM8jZ0Y7k5e2HAKmY.jpg','1997-12-31',132,'Released','They dared to play the game of love, faith, and chance.','Oscar and Lucinda',39780,2.9606,6.4,'Q9KRbrmc-A0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13764,_binary '\0','/iXq6SRu8YK0Bo5jFpfQ8TYCNaet.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119844',6.8,1951,'pt','Ossos','After a suicidal teenage girl gives birth, she misguidedly entrusts her baby’s safety to the troubled, deadbeat father, whose violent actions take the viewer on a tour of the foreboding, crumbling shantytown in which they live.','/8g4lW86bbqxNW2kAjEn8mpX1QNB.jpg','1997-11-14',97,'Released',NULL,'Ossos',55700,0.8454,6.8,'5R-hMxlEcs4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13765,_binary '\0','/dTPGduoNN2h9kQdetddVOo8tfKt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119848',6.1,10346,'en','Out to Sea','Care-free Charlie cons his widower brother-in-law Herb into an expenses-paid luxury cruise in search of rich, lonely ladies. The catch is that they are required to be dance hosts! With a tyrannical cruise director, and the luscious Liz and lovely Vivian, our heroes have lots of mis-adventures before they finally return to port.','/de3GHQy3TJAVhgF6ys1aWpe5jWK.jpg','1997-07-02',106,'Released','Get ready to Rumba!','Out to Sea',18080,2.9558,5.8,'Gnf--nARR5E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13766,_binary '\0','/dlUBOryv6pTSqseV4PpGwqyRDX7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119859',6.8,6302,'en','Paradise Road','A group of English, American, Dutch and Australian women creates a vocal orchestra while being imprisoned in a Japanese POW camp on Sumatra during World War II.','/cwRSdBwWeL5FJL8DZsURHY4bEq7.jpg','1997-02-11',122,'Released','Courage echoes forever.','Paradise Road',77223,2.9257,6.3,'d_m6IhkTwxM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13767,_binary '\0','/ynYT4ohuJnbkYdb1OYmvD5AiG3A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119860',5.7,1413,'ja','パラサイト・イヴ','A scientist realizes his dead wife is an organization of mitochondria bent on making a new species that will wipe out humanity.','/tEQqMOfiHWtCb2dDu4X5dOBF2AH.jpg','1997-02-01',120,'Released','It\'s not a virus... it\'s evolution.','Parasite Eve',33045,1.5035,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13768,_binary '\0','/4gmPddjaeA5I5nERgud5xQne2DT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119861',6.9,17341,'hi','परदेस','Kishorilal wants an Indian bride for his westernised son. He gets him engaged to Ganga, his friend\'s daughter, and brings her to USA. But she shares a deeper bond with Arjun, Kishorilal\'s foster son.','/cUiM7V2hK540SN9Wd6UXZPGcDBH.jpg','1997-08-08',191,'Released','American dreams, Indian soul.','Pardes',25519,1.6839,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13769,_binary '\0','/4I6XXENK6FYhRhbA1FjTtG913BB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119863',6.3,4899,'fr','Le Pari','Two rival \"brothers-in-law\" make a bet that they can stop smoking for 2 weeks. But, it\'s just not that easy...','/guTwU8fAQVQ2cLUDLeBph5iQGIB.jpg','1997-10-15',100,'Released','They said they\'d do it.Unfortunately, they did!','The Bet',44706,2.2058,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13770,_binary '\0','/6nWMHiADqlmxiF88XLc5yMXo7KJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119872',5,3092,'en','The Peacekeeper','When a terrorist group steals the US President\'s personal communications computer for launching the US arsenal in case of war, only a heroic Major has the key to prevent a Presidential assassination or a nuclear holocaust.','/6QBjzPscdNshlskkzw2fDXfLC1q.jpg','1997-08-22',98,'Released','Mass destruction just met its match.','The Peacekeeper',27719,1.5695,4.8,'NB1PxpFkTNk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13771,_binary '\0','/lwEuFWTUsXbQWF6wU3Ui7mcAoId.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119874',6,66840,'en','The Peacemaker','When a train carrying atomic warheads mysteriously crashes in the former Soviet Union, a nuclear specialist discovers the accident is really part of a plot to cover up the theft of the weapons. Assigned to help her recover the missing bombs is a crack Special Forces Colonel.','/hc3p6pvIrfO4AmrVLb6qTviOwW2.jpg','1997-09-26',124,'Released','In the fall of 1997, every nuclear device in the world will be accounted for...except one.','The Peacemaker',6623,10.115,6.1,'QG8O3Cr9kEs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13772,_binary '\0','/kznmEv5dOczfbEw8ZC3KTpY4T5c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119879',6.3,11059,'es','Perdita Durango','She\'s sexy, shameless and loves taking people to their limit. She\'s a dangerous young woman who dreams about a jaguar that licks her naked body and sleeps by her side. Her past is bathed in blood and weird passions. Now she\'s met the man of her wildest dreams. He\'s dark, tough and mysterious. He likes robbing banks, trafficking in corpses and spicing it all with voodoo rituals. Together, the duo sets off toward Mexico destined to become the most feared outlaws in the continent.','/37oOHBE3bQUzKScnx9s9QhVLFXz.jpg','1997-10-31',130,'Released','Get on the road.','Dance with the Devil',9845,3.2865,6.496,'q3atkz_fGpI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13773,_binary '\0','/vFsULlGGG0IsV4Vm44igWkGqfWc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119881',6.2,1389,'en','Perfect Body','Obsessed with perfection, young gymnast Andie Bradley nearly starves herself to realize her dream of making the Olympic gymnastics team.','/wK7H98hX3BJsarYbg89WRDX2TLG.jpg','1997-09-08',100,'Released',NULL,'Perfect Body',86186,1.7397,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13774,_binary '\0','/66Gmi5MengnR9Thu9CGkC8Imndb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119887',4.8,9939,'en','The Pest','Fast-talking Latino con artist Pestario \"Pest\" Vargas is the target of Scottish mobsters to whom he owes a considerable debt. Willing to do anything to raise money and avoid severe injury or death, Vargas agrees to a very unusual job -- he will be transported to a remote island and hunted by Gustav Shank, a racist German executive. If he can survive a full day and night, Vargas gets $50,000 and will be set free. Is he wily enough to elude Shank?','/rmxgXwRgWJ3Ds9VQX7SDRIGJYvk.jpg','1997-02-07',82,'Released','What kind of freakazoid would let someone hunt him just to collect $50,000?...Next question.','The Pest',17949,2.3228,4.719,'cYUHNjL0RnM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13775,_binary '\0','/iw7WWV96g2mTQWPSRq5DuAdMlZK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119889',4.3,6288,'it','Il fantasma dell\'Opera','A series of terrifying accidents and brutal murders leave a bloody trail into the subterranean caverns of an Opera house. Below the theatre stalks a man raised by creatures of the underworld.','/uHKKGS3jrPo6wTMhIuBDpWMi7VT.jpg','1998-11-20',104,'Released',NULL,'The Phantom of the Opera',10593,3.0346,4.7,'zNnAWKmLvfM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13776,_binary '\0','/sfZsUTH7MYxX2FsHOcWcx0YgkYa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119891',5.5,24793,'en','Phantoms','In the peaceful Colorado town of Snowfield, something evil has wiped out the community. And now, it\'s up to a group of people to stop it, or at least get out of Snowfield alive.','/FM8MOTW8BbyoTLa2V8PnI6UPib.jpg','1998-01-23',96,'Released','For centuries they told us the terror would come from above. We\'ve been looking the wrong way.','Phantoms',9827,3.5632,5.6,'HynK3ZkjtcE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13777,_binary '\0','/h0pxtAQCGWcArbPxqudW5NbmUNc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119892',6.3,4765,'en','Phoenix','Gambling fever -- along with a brutal bookie -- leads three crooked cops into a double-dealing scheme that lands them in hot water way over their heads.','/tkppRmx4iBvAeKlopfNTO8hnKxK.jpg','1998-09-04',107,'Released','In this town, the heat can kill you.','Phoenix',28047,2.9879,5.519,'jQTmDc2OXDI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13778,_binary '\0','/343tndCLTH1BaBLyRsH9ipTHmOR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119893',6.7,3046,'en','Photographing Fairies','Photographer Charles Castle is numbed with grief following the death of his beautiful bride. He goes off to war, working in the trenches as a photographer. Following the war and still in grief Charles is given some photographs purporting to be of fairies. His search for the truth leads him to Burkinwell, a seemingly peaceful village seething with secrets','/95rYK0G003rj8WDavXslmTO4pRE.jpg','1997-09-19',106,'Released','Another world… as close as the beat of your heart','Photographing Fairies',26644,1.5866,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13779,_binary '\0','/ecZVDPB3ju7jxJy1kEsn2rnsVx6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119896',5.6,22540,'en','Picture Perfect','A young advertising executive\'s life becomes increasingly complicated when, in order to impress her boss, she pretends to be engaged to a man she has just met.','/xYnvr4o7GEaA2uyt4Q1ASUI5Obv.jpg','1997-08-01',105,'Released','She was prepared for anything until love stormed in.','Picture Perfect',9413,5.0581,5.9,'yAzzi9CJOZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13780,_binary '\0','/8LEZ1KqLRcktagPnSr6wC5FzuQr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119899',5.3,1883,'en','Pippi Longstocking','Pippi Longstocking is an extraordinary little girl who lives alone in her house, while her father sails the seven seas. Pippi\'s irrepressibly fun nature makes her easy to befriend, as neighbors Tommy and Annika find, but can also earn ire, especially from social worker Mrs. Prysselius.','/nndjAapR3epDSxuNSpgRdfP7L6v.jpg','1997-08-22',76,'Released','Her name is about all you can handle!','Pippi Longstocking',12630,3.0257,5.8,'Xww39W1SzuA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13781,_binary '\0','/7imcURNICADnzQyRuYoCUoJSygW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119901',6.2,2904,'fr','Place Vendôme','The story of a woman that remained distracted for a long time from her life, from the passions that made her feel alive. The importance of true love is compared with the material value of diamonds. Only one truly lasts forever. She\'s got to find the thing that values most for her, the thing that gives psychical stability and real happiness again to her life.','/8zSk1gOonLdJCESLMVzVww0aSlH.jpg','1998-10-07',117,'Released',NULL,'Place Vendôme',33799,2.2855,6.2,'8Lf-BZy74RI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13782,_binary '\0','/5fGHM9HUhAnZSJf9pC22VDNvTfc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119905',5.9,8586,'en','The Players Club','Single mother Diana struggles to provide for her child and pay for her college education. When she meets two dancers from a nearby gentlemen\'s club, Diana\'s convinced there\'s fast money to be made stripping.','/8Y0ipbrZ6oiXffZkI1D9eahVsZ1.jpg','1998-04-08',104,'Released','Sometimes you\'re the player. Sometimes you\'re played.','The Players Club',19848,2.9103,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13783,_binary '\0','/gHqEy16wIeGEfoCdROYaTpCcPUb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119906',5.6,8273,'en','Playing God','Stripped of his medical license after performing an operation while high on amphetamines, famed LA surgeon Dr Eugene Sands abandons his former life only to find himself crossing paths with Raymond Blossom, an infamous counterfeiter. Employed as a \"gun-shot doctor\" when Raymond\'s associates cannot risk visiting a hospital, Eugene is lured deep into the criminal world and becomes entangled with his boss\'s girlfriend.','/faYRZjtBMNygM7spt72yrs72hC8.jpg','1997-10-17',94,'Released','Joining this deadly underworld was easy. But getting out... deadly!','Playing God',12628,3.4643,5.6,'k0GfYWswQ3Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13784,_binary '\0','/jw3090ZOcyegQCeHWdFkDsPIaRh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119910',5.5,3482,'en','Polish Wedding','The film centers on a big Polish family. Jadzia is the mother and the ruler of the Pzoniak family (she has five children). Though she\'s happily married to Bolek, she is also having a long-time affair with Roman. Her young daughter Hala is having an affair with neighbour cop Russell and becomes pregnant by him. Russell is pressed hard to marry Hala.','/36De1BxBBzXyJ1eYVQlIoTUIwQm.jpg','1998-01-16',105,'Released','Sometimes the further you stray, the closer you are to home.','Polish Wedding',38509,1.8697,5.1,'sq4hc2KkBXI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13785,_binary '\0','/5mwd1quVNkdwImOF2RGm90hKZ5P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119925',6.1,84065,'en','The Postman','In 2013, there are no highways, no I-ways, no dreams of a better tomorrow, only scattered survivors across what was once the United States. Into this apocalyptic wasteland comes an enigmatic drifter with a mule, a knack for Shakespeare, and something yet undiscovered: the power to inspire hope.','/piVzOuKFLHNGLxnjwNtibC26lTy.jpg','1997-12-25',178,'Released','The year is 2013. One man walked in off the horizon and hope came with him.','The Postman',9922,8.1423,6.3,'BC8FxxvXYTY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13786,_binary '\0','/d6uOeJA9RwAEMbI4tmykkRVObwq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119926',7.4,2227,'ja','ポストマン・ブルース','Sawaki is a postman who\'s not quite thrilled about his boring way of life. But his life is about to change when he delivers mail to his old schoolmate Noguchi, who\'s now a member of the Yakuza, the Japanese Mafia, and just finished cutting his little finger off.','/1Cx5vhNDL2EojrqpwO129ycaiMu.jpg','1997-08-16',110,'Released',NULL,'Postman Blues',36221,1.8798,7.366,'5rETRsQSR6w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13787,_binary '\0','/jWboV1HQ0rPeeRg2yeMI3dkmyqI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119932',6.8,2073,'de','Praxis Dr. Hasenbein','Before WWII: Dr. Hasenbein lives with his son Peter in a small town. Aunt Uschi\'s orphanage houses many children and a hamster. When the hamster falls ill, Dr. Hasenbein is given something to do. The tailor, Mr. Voss, is also treated by Dr. Hasenbein: for tendinitis. During the war, Dr. Hasenbein has to go away. When he comes back after 30 years, everything has changed...','/r0kJskT769jdLBcYwwY1elfzSK8.jpg','1997-01-30',97,'Released',NULL,'Praxis Dr. Hasenbein',1655,0.8431,6.5,'KaJN_YbvT5s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13788,_binary '\0','/i1E2K8gPSkrWAf2ZwO3dvSlseNG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119934',7.2,8067,'en','Without Limits','The life of renowned runner Steve Prefontaine and his relationship with legendary coach Bill Bowerman.','/2HoKVqCzVOez7DEwHApc73bKobg.jpg','1998-09-11',117,'Released','PRE. The way he competed. The way he lived his life.','Without Limits',22256,2.6245,6.7,'e2MpP3M9oCk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13789,_binary '\0','/z95KUOYEGF8EsB6C1c0xc8bDOQW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119935',5.8,1494,'en','Preaching to the Perverted','A computer wizard infiltrates a London sex club to get evidence for a shutdown, but falls for the proprietress.','/44jLHbqSLDRsgdLrCaeCUQIEyEv.jpg','1997-07-04',100,'Released','He wants to save her. She wants to pervert him. Who will win?','Preaching to the Perverted',20684,2.0554,6.1,'Z_d9OCYea0I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13790,_binary '\0','/3c06ySbMeU6XiCWBgVNuqofTj1M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119937',6.8,7985,'en','Prefontaine','It\'s the true-life story of legendary track star Steve Prefontaine, the exciting and sometimes controversial \"James Dean of Track,\" whose spirit captured the heart of the nation! Cocky, charismatic, and tough, \"Pre\" was a running rebel who defied rules, pushed limits ... and smashed records ...','/3jtG9mgfiZRTRQf19BiUAY6QPN3.jpg','1997-01-24',106,'Released','He beat the odds... And became a legend!','Prefontaine',26306,2.4356,6.6,'FmtqzdHOECc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13791,_binary '\0','/8S0fdn8FumgyqEN2yQDeVfBFOk1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119942',6.7,31690,'en','Primary Colors','In this adaptation of the best-selling roman à clef about Bill Clinton\'s 1992 run for the White House, the young and gifted Henry Burton is tapped to oversee the presidential campaign of Governor Jack Stanton. Burton is pulled into the politician\'s colorful world and looks on as Stanton -- who has a wandering eye that could be his downfall -- contends with his ambitious wife, Susan, and an outspoken adviser, Richard Jemmons.','/RXEgVSEBkMnV8LkEGkBpuz3mkD.jpg','1998-03-20',143,'Released','What went down on the way to the top.','Primary Colors',9440,5.0622,6.2,'WCtnouR_r4Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13792,_binary '\0','/jpu6mTZEAQ1UGTxf0G30qVQPE87.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119947',5.1,2684,'en','Prince Valiant','An Arthurian legend of young Prince Valiant, son of the King of Scandia. After the King is exiled by an evil leader, the Prince travels to Camelot to secure the aid of King Arthur in helping restore his family to power and prevent a plot by the Black Knight.','/pTg3XnghiI8Z8sp7Pxknnl2A3rn.jpg','1997-07-24',91,'Released','He who holds the sword, rules the world.','Prince Valiant',6264,3.097,5.2,'JMRCtZJg0sU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13793,_binary '\0','/liPn0q65pOXosCpkr0BTbTHjbRT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119951',6.9,40716,'en','Private Parts','The life and career of shock-jock superstar Howard Stern is recounted from his humble beginnings to his view from the top. Possessing a desire to be an on-air personality since childhood, Stern meanders through the radio world, always with his supportive wife, Alison, by his side. Landing a gig in Washington, D.C., Stern meets Robin Quivers, who will become his long-time partner in crime. When the two move to New York, they face the wrath of NBC executives.','/8nCc9fhXCVvetlqpxkrCTc9NwOz.jpg','1997-03-07',109,'Released','Never before has a man done so much with so little.','Private Parts',9403,4.1888,6.5,'RQFfqUUaNqs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13794,_binary '\0','/opFNKq4RLKZwmwy2qPmPa7Jo6fd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119975',4.9,3122,'en','Quicksilver Highway','Aaron Quicksilver is a mysterious storyteller whose listeners invariably end up as the subjects of his gruesome, grisly tales. He tells a new bride stranded on a desert highway a horrifying account of a set of carnivorous toy teeth, then entrains a pickpocket with the spine chilling story of an army of murderous, disembodied hands.','/ktKeyB6yNo81wD60NxZvb7f1nZz.jpg','1997-05-13',90,'Released',NULL,'Quicksilver Highway',26215,2.4578,5,'UOoEzPS4INE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13795,_binary '\0','/v0IeACcCsKLKqT4eCJsZ60nySQL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119978',7.2,93371,'en','The Rainmaker','Fresh out of law school and desperate for work, idealistic rookie Rudy Baylor takes on a powerful insurance company accused of denying a dying boy’s claim. Teaming up with a scrappy, unlicensed paralegal, he finds himself in a David-versus-Goliath courtroom battle that tests his ethics, courage, and belief in justice.','/twLGHXPjQtS8UyVGp5GXmhJiTM7.jpg','1997-11-18',135,'Released','They were totally unqualified to try the case of a lifetime... but every underdog has his day.','The Rainmaker',11975,7.7884,7,'Odb3LrbvS_0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13796,_binary '\0','/2KU8ZSzj1Y9eYfZv4RYO2yCiO4v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119981',5.9,2230,'fr','Les Randonneurs','A quartet of Parisians embark upon a guided hike in Corsica and end up working through the sometimes comical chaos of their individual lives.','/jsp15ZnGZhXUmckz1QffsHEwCHg.jpg','1997-03-12',95,'Released','Smile, it may not last!','Hikers',40413,1.3942,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13797,_binary '\0','/pv1XbQ7z6azYOK0Bj304UaWcHDE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119987',6,4549,'en','The Real Blonde','An aspiring actor and his girlfriend handle life\'s frustrations, while his friend seeks fulfillment with a blonde.','/kJucBNGwwTT4n4pSHU1b44nyju4.jpg','1998-02-27',105,'Released','What you see isn\'t always what you get.','The Real Blonde',29825,2.9693,5.3,'fEq5SOQpGsc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13798,_binary '\0','/tT3mJ7jJB92oB4gtmHGptdA7HcT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119989',5.3,2184,'en','Shadow of Doubt','An attorney uncovers a political conspiracy in the brutal killing of a wealthy young woman.','/sz9bB5aPNTgJJb7A15Bc3eewCR3.jpg','1998-04-09',103,'Released','In a world of lies, nothing is more dangerous than the Truth.','Shadow of Doubt',126780,2.9467,4.8,'CwFz02yCBPA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13799,_binary '\0','/lCczq2kw7PzHgwpwGfuXAK946lm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0119994',6.3,19939,'en','Red Corner','An American attorney on business in China, ends up wrongfully on trial for murder and his only key to innocence is a female defense lawyer from the country.','/xsIbKOO1CacqTagyJmEGGf4kOnn.jpg','1997-10-30',122,'Released','Severity for those who resist.','Red Corner',9407,7.0767,6.3,'0nlfKbMIh4g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13800,_binary '\0','/kMVOGxOzn0ukgcOg8GLwpDpIOC6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120001',7,2616,'en','Regeneration','Wilfred Owen and Siegfried Sassoon, two of England\'s most important World War I poets are sent, along with other traumatized combatants, to a rest home in order to treat their emotional troubles, caused by the psychological fatigue that suffer the soldiers fighting in the no man\'s land.','/jWNif4E8ZRhqRBItr0FWVMz1ooO.jpg','1997-08-27',114,'Released','Between duty and destiny, loyalty and love, lies the road to...','Regeneration',49798,1.7333,5.5,'30fpaqNsEoM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13801,_binary '\0','/A21CdNF0nsnTPPreSkTsjmGmHQU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120004',5.8,32908,'en','The Relic','A homicide detective teams up with an evolutionary biologist to hunt a giant creature that is killing people in a Chicago museum.','/fAG4nKPUWEIwGBpP38H64GGV8kl.jpg','1997-01-10',110,'Released','They did the unthinkable. They brought it back.','The Relic',11015,6.7477,6.2,'bFbvUDpRBuo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13802,_binary '\0','/yYY0eWwfbvb1OTUx5cMNvHogDvs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120008',6.1,32163,'en','The Replacement Killers','Hired assassin John Lee is asked by Chinatown crime boss Terence Wei to murder the young son of policeman Stan Zedkov. Lee has the boy in his sights, but his conscience gets the better of him, and he spares the child\'s life. Afraid that Wei will take revenge on his family in China, Lee seeks out expert forger Meg Coburn to obtain the passport he needs to get out of the country, but a band of replacement killers is soon on his trail.','/6q96xjyGTQllKAKgmwyBsk5JSe5.jpg','1998-02-06',87,'Released','Kill or be replaced.','The Replacement Killers',11702,5.5202,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13803,_binary '\0','/748u1vXG5f9XZgqIbrhDyqnoQ9R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120013',6.1,1956,'en','The Revengers\' Comedies','After saving each other from jumping off a bridge, Henry Bell and Karen Knightly plot to avenge the people who drove them to suicide. Henry will ruin the life of the woman who married Karen\'s boyfriend, while Karen will work as a secretary for the man who took Henry\'s job. Whether revenge will be sweet – or bittersweet – is anyone\'s guess.','/cF66jVvsRbT187EGrEC4fXOOBLH.jpg','1998-06-09',86,'Released','Getting Even... Just Got Even Funnier!','The Revengers\' Comedies',2166,1.7498,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13804,_binary '\0','/yTDtWwtIo1ivBRjcf6uVmCaOaHE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120018',6.5,3410,'fr','Rien ne va plus','Betty and Victor, a rather ill-matched couple, tour unobtrusively around France in their motor-home, earning their living as petty con artists, until one day they find themselves involved in an international money scam which takes them on a globe-trotting adventure.','/ySOZSH5gIr6G1Aphe27jqJrhPnk.jpg','1997-10-15',105,'Released',NULL,'The Swindle',64559,2.2293,6.545,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13805,_binary '\0','/u23fEhanCB9tzrGmnhzhFfRqCxb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120026',6.4,2345,'en','Finding Graceland','An eccentric drifter claiming to be Elvis Presley hitches a ride with a young man and they find themselves on an adventurous road trip to Memphis.','/1ENZ1rKGFbGU8lhnwmJo57sNx18.jpg','1998-09-18',97,'Released','Life isn\'t about believing in dreams... it\'s about living them.','Finding Graceland',38555,1.9517,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13806,_binary '\0','/u0lUCPGPX6AtWNolcxAUL7qTBsK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120029',5.9,11290,'en','RocketMan','An accident-prone and obnoxious geek joins a NASA space mission to Mars. During the flight, he manages to put himself and the entire crew in jeopardy, but is in danger of emerging as a hero when his new colleagues need him to save them from the unforgiving surface of the red planet.','/6ejazTl7f8lWY3quZhenIOyOfED.jpg','1997-10-10',95,'Released','He\'s just taking up space!','RocketMan',36797,4.034,5.2,'CJWolzZRQx4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13807,_binary '\0','/piPxbzkBkxtxkNek4YgTayx6aGQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120032',6.4,58786,'en','Romy and Michele\'s High School Reunion','Two not-too-bright party girls reinvent themselves for their high school reunion. Armed with a borrowed Jaguar, new clothes and the story of their success as the inventors of Post-It notes, Romy and Michele descend on their alma mater, but their façade crumbles quickly.','/yLxgglhaP2QfWVZTdrv7mZgvuHL.jpg','1997-04-25',92,'Released','The blonde leading the blonde.','Romy and Michele\'s High School Reunion',9611,5.7924,6.247,'SBsOzaI0NSM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13808,_binary '\0','/p9EVI5kudyCxfrrubaARLQCyPp0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120034',7.1,3611,'en','Roseanna\'s Grave','Roseanna is dying of a heart condition, and all she wants is to be buried next to her daughter, in a cemetery that is getting full fast. The cemetery can\'t expand because Capestro, the man who owns the land next to the cemetery, won\'t sell. While Marcello is doing good deeds to make sure no one dies, Roseanna thinks of Marcello\'s future.','/6xIGYIjTUt9Ew2sBJS57W1NKSP2.jpg','1997-03-06',98,'Released','A romantic comedy about the things we do for love.','Roseanna\'s Grave',65889,2.3798,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13809,_binary '\0','/mvBQh4Qy9YRf9ckAGPmNkOQAyUq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120036',7.2,9479,'en','Rosewood','Spurred by a white woman\'s lie, vigilantes destroy a black Florida town and slay inhabitants in 1923.','/5EeTYDXdrpD9mZSSwsrFbqgok9U.jpg','1997-02-21',142,'Released','In 1923, a black town in Florida was burned to the ground, its people murdered because of a lie. Some escaped and survived because of the courage and compassion of a few extraordinary people. This film is for them.','Rosewood',25624,2.1039,6.5,'veXzhAxlvxw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13810,_binary '\0','/t9xHPcekGuPl7BvflYMtLLGb4b6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120037',6.4,2508,'de','Rossini, oder die mörderische Frage, wer mit wem schlief','Zigeuner is on the hunt for the woman of his dreams, a woman who should also play the main role in the film. Meanwhile, ruthless producer Oskar Reiter wants to buy the film rights at all costs - and he is struggling for the love of the beautiful Valerie.','/xTWkqGS5i9bPTwHCgHsNiiurn25.jpg','1997-01-23',118,'Released',NULL,'Rossini',9643,2.2259,6.1,'iY8f7upbsBc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13811,_binary '\0','/mcKY6yPbcHo9ZoX9LWhdLKymxYR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120041',5.2,1297,'ru','Runaway Car','A nurse apprentice, who had a bad day at work, meets a computer programmer at a car garage. The man is urged to go somewhere, but his car is not ready yet, so the nurse offers him a ride. Before leaving the man, they pick up the nurse\'s baby nephew. Once on the street, they almost run over a young man. Not knowing if he is hurt, they pick up the man too. But the worst luck begins when the car brakes break down','/vqpYFnuwYII3G2Garqy0hAd6ofc.jpg','1997-01-27',90,'Released',NULL,'Runaway Car',99036,1.4353,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13812,_binary '\0','/lbq606b9dQiqrLObLcsemgwFX4X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120042',6.8,1932,'en','Running Time','Carl, a career criminal, receives an early release from prison and immediately begins preparations for his next big heist.','/f8mduE3FgPFWKWPsfM6rbE6paHO.jpg','1997-12-18',70,'Released','Time is Running Out!','Running Time',81048,2.2944,5.7,'DypxONkt530','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13813,_binary '\0','/x6f4Axjvr5Ybi2mfdpVSWvASdxX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120051',6.8,2789,'en','Safe House','A psychological thriller; Mace Sowell, an ex-intelligence operative and whose past government activities catches up with him, faces his own mortality, in the shape of the onset of Alzheimer\'s disease. Holding the electronic key to secret information which implicates a Presidential front-runner, Mace struggles for his life while battling the debilitating effects of the disease.','/8xkkY7FkpjPEB2gQ3MAlmVdq3h4.jpg','1998-07-01',112,'Released','The less you know, the safer you are.','Safe House',28123,1.8703,5.927,'ykJ_RP3SVfY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13814,_binary '\0','/ceLkDb2KgZukpeEfAQjXY8bAbe7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120053',6.2,78872,'en','The Saint','Simon Templar (The Saint), is a thief for hire, whose latest job to steal the secret process for cold fusion puts him at odds with a traitor bent on toppling the Russian government, as well as the woman who holds its secret.','/k43wPAVeepqzGwP52dKcknQjquj.jpg','1997-04-03',116,'Released','Never reveal your name. Never turn your back. Never surrender your heart.','The Saint',10003,8.7912,6.108,'F4JOxijD1ts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13815,_binary '\0','/4SCbmWLGtThJzLVHcZz6efoTjsC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120066',6.5,3104,'pl','Sara','Sixteen-year-old Sara\'s father is a wealthy gangster and has a lot of enemies. Her father makes clear that whoever touches Sara will die and he looks for the right bodyguard to protect her.','/oABucjPbq4UVlGngrNziKqial1V.jpg','1997-05-23',110,'Released',NULL,'Sara',61999,2.1135,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13816,_binary '\0','/iLyQVeo4Jm9UmLM8YEWStdgTuV4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120070',7.2,12252,'en','Savior','A hardened mercenary in the Foreign Legion begins to find his own humanity when confronted with atrocities during the fighting in Bosnia.','/7qMfDjUTEvLg5640CUAddk2BNpG.jpg','1998-06-01',103,'Released','He\'s fighting a war he doesn\'t believe in, hoping to find something he does.','Savior',2042,3.3998,7.1,'NF18FCr3vuM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13817,_binary '\0','/rcmipcf9nRiL7609YZwF9haPRPL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120075',6.5,3864,'de','Das Schloß','When land surveyor K arrives at a small village that houses a castle, local authorities refuse to allow him to enter. As he tries to convince the officials that they sent for him, they clamp down with increasingly complicated bureaucratic obstacles.','/qPxKjmRvjrbe6WegvWawv5gqUTn.jpg','1997-09-06',123,'Released',NULL,'The Castle',26891,1.5413,6.1,'ESspziFbPpE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13818,_binary '\0','/lVmcX3hlJqsUGkEOEZkRFiOQdLv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120082',6.4,240288,'en','Scream 2','Two years after the Woodsboro murders, Sidney Prescott acclimates to college life while someone donning the Ghostface costume begins a new string of killings.','/dORlVasiaDkJXTqt9bdH7nFNs6C.jpg','1997-12-12',120,'Released','Someone has taken their love of sequels one step too far.','Scream 2',4233,13.8731,6.524,'C-j2TLBmTBY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13819,_binary '\0','/k5lYNUW5vTcLxkn6BHygFOxucp4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120086',6.6,2578,'en','The Second Civil War','When a planeload of Pakistani orphans are shipped to his state for permanent relocation, the governor of Idaho defies the president and closes the state\'s border. News Net Television, a cable news program that makes hay by reporting on political scandals, quickly spins the racist act into an overnight media sensation, creating a divide in national opinion over the issue.','/aVdrnRbP38f2R0u9OxqRUC8Wr09.jpg','1997-12-04',97,'Released','A very uncivil comedy','The Second Civil War',45046,2.3626,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13820,_binary '\0','/86ijckQVCjhKFwRMS7ZhBN8NmEQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120087',4.5,1273,'en','The Second Jungle Book: Mowgli & Baloo','In this exciting live-action adventure, young Mowgli, an orphan raised by wolves, is spotted by a scout for a giant circus. Accompanied by a cruel hunter and a snake charmer, the scout sets out to trap Mowgli. But with the help of Baloo the bear and Bagheera the panther, little Mowgli leads the adults into his biggest and wildest adventure yet! A fun-filled movie every member of the family will enjoy.','/kLzE0IluHeY920jshiTsLz92ZEe.jpg','1997-05-16',88,'Released',NULL,'The Second Jungle Book: Mowgli & Baloo',50850,2.349,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13821,_binary '\0','/5PYuy6PWovZHDLA4FuREKkDFzeA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120088',5.3,3713,'en','Wicked','A cul-de-sac in an oppressive suburb becomes a literal dead end for wife and mother Karen Christianson when she is brutally murdered in her own home. In the wake of the event, Karen\'s teenage daughter Ellie begins to exhibit bizarre behaviors as she slowly acquires her mother\'s demeanor and mannerisms. Meanwhile, Karen\'s husband Ben nurtures a less-than-innocent interest in the family\'s sultry live-in nanny, Lena.','/13ix5ryXWE9l8UhtEKuJrkjmsTr.jpg','1998-01-17',88,'Released','Evil never looked so good.','Wicked',44046,3.2649,5.125,'sy9-Ghod4tU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13822,_binary '\0','/84dkpmDHeqFXNTLNrknlpnCoTis.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120089',6.2,1244,'en','The Killing Secret','A pregnant teen is murdered and a popular high-school senior is suspected. But will his girlfriend stick by him to prove his innocence despite the fact she has bonded with the victim\'s mother?','/i0wJwqO7y4evwOfAkxual25QO0d.jpg','1997-01-06',86,'Released','Some secrets should not be kept.','The Killing Secret',47691,1.5907,5.6,'k2TN6Oho4lo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13823,_binary '\0','/q6Ezq5Hi3Ox7Du7gPqyB8MXyYKN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120090',7,2195,'es','Secretos del corazón','Javi and his friend Carlos visit an old house on the outskirts of a small Spanish village. According to his brother Juan this is a haunted house and one can hear the voices of the dead. Later he is intrigued with a room which is always closed (the room where his father was found dead). He is so interested in these mysteries that he starts to investigate all the secrets of these dead people and their stories.','/f4h71CyoiXoc1Kf2MipSlTd6XTF.jpg','1997-03-19',105,'Released',NULL,'Secrets of the Heart',92603,1.6656,6.5,'_mylEgZ3tNw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13824,_binary '\0','/kcBlY5FasH8ti150aYExULw53ui.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120094',6.9,34165,'en','Selena','In this biographical drama, Selena Quintanilla is born into a musical Mexican-American family in Texas. Her father, Abraham, realizes that his young daughter is talented and begins performing with her at small venues. She finds success and falls for her guitarist, Chris Perez, who draws the ire of her father. Seeking mainstream stardom, Selena begins recording an English-language album which, tragically, she would never complete.','/j8xX3yBAFOayfSaImgLZPnAcdWz.jpg','1997-03-21',127,'Released','Discover the true story of one of America\'s brightest stars... that faded too soon.','Selena',16052,4.1612,7.718,'RzePZay7fbQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13825,_binary '\0','/e2FerujeIHpgGRNKKs2tdPhUNRZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120100',5.6,1898,'en','The Serpent\'s Kiss','A man sends a young architect to build an extravagant garden to bankrupt the husband of the woman he once loved.','/lMDCOUsDPzPTEI3lf9w6nD40Lq7.jpg','1997-05-14',104,'Released','Revenge has never been so sweet.','The Serpent\'s Kiss',47604,2.3731,5.4,'GdmN8GwXNb8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13826,_binary '\0','/athnSvS41TEHOSK2Ax0LAM0ulDp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120102',7.1,170106,'en','Seven Years in Tibet','Austrian mountaineer Heinrich Harrer journeys to the Himalayas without his family to head an expedition in 1939. But when World War II breaks out, the arrogant Harrer falls into Allied forces\' hands as a prisoner of war. He escapes with a fellow detainee and makes his way to Lhasa, Tibet, where he meets the 14-year-old Dalai Lama, whose friendship ultimately transforms his outlook on life.','/qm87HHUew8ICtUCM4asO3gFYvby.jpg','1997-09-12',136,'Released','At the end of the world his real journey began.','Seven Years in Tibet',978,12.5122,7.164,'m9a_7WFcPlI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13827,_binary '\0','/xAiQwgOSIhNs9ZwIPeDTwpAyP78.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120107',5,5618,'en','Shadow Conspiracy','Bobby Bishop is a special assistant to the President of the United States. Accidentally, he meets his friend professor Pochenko on the street. Pochenko has time to tell Bishop about some conspiracy in the White House but then immediately gets killed by an assassin. Now bad guys are after Bobby as the only man who knows about a plot. Bishop must now not only survive, but to stop the conspirators from achieving their goal. And he doesn\'t know whom to trust.','/m8dgxxCrpLhKjkjH2DPxkz0inoJ.jpg','1997-01-25',103,'Released',NULL,'Shadow Conspiracy',38153,4.31,4.9,'U2CNeff1Q5M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13828,_binary '\0','/gWfI95LXNdEff7xqnvoFOjDgMmC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120108',6.2,2515,'en','The Proposition','Father Michael McKinnon goes from the UK to Boston circa 1935. For unknown reasons, he avoids at all costs the most prominent parishioners, Arthur and Eleanor Barret. Meanwhile Eleanor and Arthur desperately want to have a child, but Arthur is sterile, so they hire Harvard law student Roger Martin to impregnate Eleanor, but unfortunately Roger falls in love with her.','/zIPmvZyWLHOTZgpPXgnKgO2pvM0.jpg','1998-03-26',110,'Released','One man gave up everything he owned. The other, everything he believed in.','The Proposition',32144,2.8424,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13829,_binary '\0','/xJQwAoMhBBUrcIz00XDRHyaMVaE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120112',5.9,9121,'en','She\'s So Lovely','After being released from a psychiatric institution, a man tries to redeem himself in the eyes of his now-ex wife from the events that led up to his incarceration.','/oZISQ7Cnmezs5NgBaL6uHUkDMFZ.jpg','1997-08-20',100,'Released','The story of one outrageous woman. Caught between two men. Both of them certain of one thing...','She\'s So Lovely',38295,3.8376,5.9,'fDRO_SlFnZ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13830,_binary '\0','/yirnApV45FdzauIUIODXRz45uSX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120118',6.3,4103,'en','Shiloh','An abused beagle runs away from his owner. On the road, he meets young Marty Preston and follows him home. The boy immediately forms a bond with the dog and names him Shiloh. His stern father won\'t let him keep the dog because it belongs to Judd Travers, a local hunter. After Shiloh is mistreated again, he runs away and returns to Marty. Knowing his father will once again make him bring Shiloh back to Judd, he makes a home for the dog in an old shed up the hill from the Prestons\' house and hides him from his family. His secret is soon discovered when a stray attacks the dog one night and he must turn to his father for help.','/wRB0cTPBIWHEq4FmWuX6voagePf.jpg','1996-11-30',93,'Released','The story of a boy who risks everything to save his best friend.','Shiloh',33660,2.4913,6,'Y7fGNsgCcHc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13831,_binary '\0','/ldjjEZl2Ez6m32HAZJtfaF2aKGF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120122',6.5,8042,'en','Shooting Fish','Two con artists hire an unwitting medical-school student as a secretary for their latest scam.','/sBA1vTqjhKmtogB6PKQ3tOn2HNX.jpg','1997-08-22',109,'Released','Fat cats are too easy. Go for the big fish.','Shooting Fish',25719,2.5212,6.3,'vi4FsOzFZEs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13832,_binary '\0','/pKZ9kLAxcXgv9JkE6zf3mNl2a1d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120125',7.6,13462,'ru','Сибирский цирюльник','Douglas is a foreign entrepreneur, who ventures to Russia in 1885 with dreams of selling a new, experimental steam-driven timber harvester in the wilds of Siberia. Jane is his assistant. On her travels, she meets two men who would change her life forever: a handsome young cadet Andrej Tolstoy with whom she shares a fondness for opera, and the powerful General Radlov who is entranced by her beauty and wants to marry her.','/6sAm5HWkhjWo7xI0nZjeJTru6mP.jpg','1998-11-11',180,'Released','He\'s Russian. That explains a lot.','The Barber of Siberia',51300,3.4236,7.1,'GzeuxbthFg8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13833,_binary '\0','/88i20YQRV1N47sPsSWWZMEuaLvW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120126',7.5,1819,'en','Sick: The Life and Death of Bob Flanagan, Supermasochist','The story of Robert Flanagan, a man who was born with cystic fibrosis and told he wouldn\'t live past 20, who through a unique odyssey of masochism, art and love found a way to live decades past his expiration date.','/fNyc2Ay883m6FFN1BV6s8ROfYHN.jpg','1997-01-24',90,'Released',NULL,'Sick: The Life and Death of Bob Flanagan, Supermasochist',35638,1.38,7.1,'Gu0wmiIngAw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13834,_binary '\0','/aU2gK5ehx5MOwnigEAK54cQjLpS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120133',5.4,6256,'en','A Simple Wish','Murray is a male fairy godmother, and he is trying to help 8-year-old Anabel to fulfil her \"simple wish\" - that her father Oliver, who is a cab driver, would win the leading role in a Broadway musical. Unfortunately, Murray\'s magic wand is broken and the fairies convention is threatened by evil witches Claudia and Boots.','/cfyJ7yIvNTlz2ooH8iU6r0pxAMj.jpg','1997-07-11',89,'Released','Anabel made a wish. Murray made a mess.','A Simple Wish',17834,4.4597,5.5,'cVYQN5Al1ck','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13835,_binary '\0','/rxt49p7a9vejB8ak70YIW19Nx72.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120135',5.4,1651,'en','Since You\'ve Been Gone','The story of a 10th anniversary High School reunion, told through the eyes of a doctor who was humiliated on graduation day by being badly beaten up by a fellow graduate.','/7sZZnTairxpqYzctasIpPoiskBE.jpg','1998-06-06',96,'Released',NULL,'Since You\'ve Been Gone',61168,2.273,4.7,'k7OuGTzaeOw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13836,_binary '\0','/jACcAsj1fAZQsDBvnU6xjBUDe9y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120142',5.7,6893,'en','The 6th Man','A college athlete returns from the dead to help his brother\'s basketball team win the NCAA title.','/c08PAB0kWE38zrOGl376D9qqdEc.jpg','1997-03-28',108,'Released','They\'re lifting the game to a higher level','The 6th Man',36807,3.0921,6.1,'ymluKbAk_RU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13837,_binary '\0','/1dApwEEMrk7QnUb1EpyYWrG6nRh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120148',6.7,76701,'en','Sliding Doors','Helen, a London ad executive, is fired from her job and rushes out to catch a train, but, as she runs down, her life suddenly splits off. In one version she catches the train; in the second, she misses it. Her whole life changes in that one second, and the rest of the film depicts what happens in each scenario.','/s8VOVTywXZIIHqdEjkCZziH0ebq.jpg','1998-04-23',99,'Released','What if one split second sent your life in two completely different directions?','Sliding Doors',10215,5.5332,6.5,'Da-Mizk86AE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13838,_binary '\0','/5K3PLsbumQ99e9mAnnDnYtFOgl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120151',4.8,1600,'en','A Smile Like Yours','Danny and Jennifer Robertson are happily married, except for one major issue – he\'s doubtful about having children, and she desperately wants a baby. Soon, both are tempted to stray from their marriage as their baby conception woes mount.','/sm7eMB5PDR4pwJBX8uu1E0y6q60.jpg','1997-08-27',98,'Released','The shortest distance between two people is a certain smile.','A Smile Like Yours',33657,2.0768,4,'iKuEaScoqmo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13839,_binary '\0','/4TQgxCYdaizZr9bfjQYVsZPZVGE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120152',6.3,16089,'en','Smilla\'s Sense of Snow','Smilla Jaspersen attempts to understand the death of a small boy who falls from the roof of her apartment building. Suspecting wrongdoing, Smilla uncovers a trail of clues leading towards a secretive corporation that has made several mysterious expeditions to Greenland.','/2BwL0fKCaNRXfqMsu2uvFFS7dZX.jpg','1997-02-28',121,'Released','Some Tracks Should Never Be Uncovered.','Smilla\'s Sense of Snow',9311,4.3006,6.4,'sr7svnup0Dk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13840,_binary '\0','/eYrjffVvcc0MEgy9RcquvWyBGtQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120157',6.1,62297,'en','Soldier','Sergeant Todd is a veteran soldier for an elite group of the armed forces. After being defeated by a new breed of genetically engineered soldiers, he is dumped on a waste planet and left for dead. He soon interacts with a group of crash survivors who lead out a peaceful existence. The peace is broken as the new soldiers land on the planet to eliminate the colony, which Sergeant Todd must defend.','/g62RTtfhgzJo1GV2jjwdzpNuiUB.jpg','1998-10-23',99,'Released','The best soldier they ever created just became their worst nightmare.','Soldier',9425,6.8226,6.395,'N8BkBh24HdY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13841,_binary '\0','/tKC9LCc8mMu7VTJEgoQzlq7PfGL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120164',6.9,1279,'cn','宋家皇朝','Ai-ling married a wealthy and powerful businessman. Ching-ling married Sun Yat-sen, the revolutionary founder of modern China. Mei-ling married Chiang Kai-shek, China\'s leader during World War II. The sisters captured the world\'s fascination for their brilliant marriages and their strong influence on their nation.','/kJHuHIpwxNmSf49sWGGggTk0k2J.jpg','1997-05-01',145,'Released','One loved money. One loved power. And one loved China.','The Soong Sisters',29346,2.3308,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13842,_binary '\0','/d8JdOTvPHrT5pi4oGcwZ3YAqjP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120169',7,9897,'en','Soul Food','Traditional Sunday dinners at Mama Joe\'s turn sour when sisters Teri, Bird and Maxine start bringing their problems to the dinner table in this ensemble comedy. When tragedy strikes, it\'s up to grandson Ahmad to pull the family together and put the soul back into the family\'s weekly gatherings.','/97t6YjxjTpwQ439MJcPiPDrMAg0.jpg','1997-09-26',114,'Released','Every family needs some.','Soul Food',29461,2.4377,6.3,'nsxjqvBhBWk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13843,_binary '\0','/cFTzUosDnHsG0QUDP2OuiAxFoTL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120176',7.1,26517,'en','The Spanish Prisoner','An inventor of a secret process suddenly finds himself alone as both his friends and the corporation he works for turn against him.','/cwkWlWfFrvH6WW6ovX5gfGHo7ks.jpg','1997-12-03',110,'Released','It\'s the oldest con in the book.','The Spanish Prisoner',29193,2.9701,6.814,'DPF-5KNmqq4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13844,_binary '\0','/cSR1BXlqaKXhexFQQU4NJdI3KDy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120177',5.2,77339,'en','Spawn','After being murdered by corrupt colleagues in a covert government agency, Al Simmons makes a pact with the devil to be resurrected to see his beloved wife Wanda. In exchange for his return to Earth, Simmons agrees to lead Hell\'s Army in the destruction of mankind.','/3svvunKXkhRvEKByGDua1Qu0otq.jpg','1997-07-31',96,'Released','Born in darkness. Sworn to justice.','Spawn',10336,7.8411,5.5,'UoeMuhP6Mp8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13845,_binary '\0','/wmwEjQpqNXEIadsQoqWUS1pVVBi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120179',4,89876,'en','Speed 2: Cruise Control','A disgruntled former employee hijacks the Seabourn Legend cruise liner. Set on a fixed course, without any means of communication and at the mercy of the hijacker, it\'s up to the one cop on vacation and his soon to be fiancé (hopefully) Annie to regain control of it before it kills the passengers and causes an environmental disaster. Insurmountable and daunting tasks await them on their perilous journey throughout the ship trying to fend off the hijacker and save the passengers.','/gnK1ocpwUTj24zAktzomOJsD2bu.jpg','1997-06-13',125,'Released','Rush hour hits the water.','Speed 2: Cruise Control',1639,8.3176,4.597,'3279Ry6bN4k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13846,_binary '\0','/rSoWawQFVINi3yMyeMfq4aCny0U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120184',6.1,118287,'en','Sphere','A spacecraft is discovered at the bottom of the Pacific Ocean, presumed to be at least 300 years old and of alien origin. A crack team of scientists and experts is assembled and taken to the ocean floor to investigate. However, the ship is not as it seems and when a giant perfect sphere is discovered in the cargo bay, things begin to fall apart.','/reR7C7EYe3DiHm5OYpA0ACUMDld.jpg','1998-02-13',134,'Released','Terror can fill any space.','Sphere',10153,9.5405,6.135,'REFrh4OJ8a0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13847,_binary '\0','/zZEJu3db4Ld4urK5klPvQxkWzaX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120185',3.8,38622,'en','Spice World','World-famous pop group the Spice Girls zip around London in their luxurious double-decker tour bus having various adventures and performing for their fans.','/yWK6Wz8kHPlBcWW9BzZm2Dm0cOl.jpg','1997-12-18',92,'Released','You say you want a revolution?','Spice World',6116,4.297,4.9,'XbG8d7CM0IQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13848,_binary '\0','/iG868T25Wb0cvbWrb4wAQ0IYtFr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120186',5.4,2156,'en','Body Count','A group of thieves attempt to rob an art gallery, but when plans backfire and one of the men winds up dead, the group head down south, running afoul of the law. Along the way, they meet up with a seductive con artist with ideas of her own.','/b6TuM0hWFD1la74txZrXYEASJSO.jpg','1998-04-28',85,'Released','It was a simple $15 million art heist... until she walked into the picture.','Body Count',31015,2.6886,5.5,'I41YVkPJPdQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13849,_binary '\0','/gysZn2XnFlDDQROXdBPiku4Aujg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120188',7.1,187362,'en','Three Kings','A group of American soldiers stationed in Iraq at the end of the Gulf War find a map they believe will take them to a huge cache of stolen Kuwaiti gold hidden near their base, and they embark on a secret mission that\'s destined to change everything.','/fClJQW8xn8wHOFqoA4jUn0PZh1f.jpg','1999-09-27',114,'Released','It\'s good to be king.','Three Kings',6415,9.4468,6.6,'Bdal5c1TfmE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13850,_binary '\0','/bK1E7poEPMdWbUANyIqBs3QsaV5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120190',5.1,1384,'en','Sprung','Two pairs of best friends - Montel &amp; Clyde and Brandy &amp; Adina meet at the party, where Clyde makes Adina think he is very rich and gets her into bed the same evening. When Adina finds out that she\'s been fooled, she becomes Clyde\'s worst enemy. Meanwhile Montel and Brandy fall in love and plan to marry, and Adina and Clyde try to do everything to stop them.','/quoo72l1VzxHDsE5yPw4RhHp4y7.jpg','1997-05-14',105,'Released','Way Past Whipped!','Sprung',60082,1.6014,5.5,'0g-CKrZ3fWQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13851,_binary '\0','/ArrbOtK8WcXueDNlz7HbkbAMHNb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120199',5.4,9888,'en','Space Truckers','John Canyon is one of the last independent space transport entrepreneurs. Rough times force him to carry suspicious cargo to Earth without questions being asked. During the flight the cargo turns out to be a multitude of unstoppable killer robots.','/f0NNTJxBzAwC0wvqmBgD9pPiHnG.jpg','1996-10-04',95,'Released','Earth\'s Only Hope','Space Truckers',10690,3.7637,5.4,'VQOqLOErhZA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13852,_binary '\0','/7iEfnj3rfyunky6BzvnlwqfoEF0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120201',7.3,350018,'en','Starship Troopers','Set in the future, the story follows a young soldier named Johnny Rico and his exploits in the Mobile Infantry. Rico\'s military career progresses from recruit to non-commissioned officer and finally to officer against the backdrop of an interstellar war between mankind and an arachnoid species known as \"the Bugs.\"','/cxCmv23O7p3hyHwqoktHYkZcGsY.jpg','1997-11-07',129,'Released','A new kind of enemy. A new kind of war.','Starship Troopers',563,15.9316,7.116,'zPYuV_jGk7M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13853,_binary '\0','/tuerGhZ1lA8wpBjUCEUpeTWDT5B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120202',6.7,23668,'en','State and Main','The residents of a small Vermont town don\'t know what hit them when a beleaguered Hollywood film crew brings a chaotic shoot to their quaint village.','/348hvpWeSGdAQlCrGvKbpC0FpQN.jpg','2000-08-26',106,'Released','Lock your windows. Hide your daughters. Say your prayers.','State and Main',21991,3.8491,6.283,'oRhVOeyguLY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13854,_binary '\0','/61Wj1C1hrOyu6mAHARS8J5ShOzq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120207',3,16000,'en','Steel','When a renegade military reject puts new superweapons in dangerous hands, John Henry Irons becomes Steel. Wearing body armor, wielding a fearsome electrohammer and riding a gadget-packed motorcycle, he\'s ready to wage war... if he can fix the untimely glitches in his untested gear.','/ufA7d5LT2rGj58KaZErPhcMkJ4U.jpg','1997-08-15',97,'Released','Heroes don\'t come any bigger.','Steel',8854,4.13,4.248,'-bAWWmLfkWo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13855,_binary '\0','/fe1MtZSdbJ6iper1QjpjHOujvRp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120211',6.4,3772,'en','Still Breathing','Two lost souls: she a con-artist in L.A.; he a puppeteer in San Antonio have the same dream linking each with the other. He travels to L.A. to find this woman he has become obsessed with. She resists, afraid of his kooky ideas until she travels with him to San Antonio and meets his wise grandmother. Story of two disparate people linked by \"fate\" gets increasingly interesting as it rolls along.','/xzddUnxNOs1DTyygqojRRYkPG6C.jpg','1997-09-01',109,'Released','True love, midnight visions and stacking rocks. OR The love of a lifetime can begin with a dream','Still Breathing',39467,2.4171,6.5,'XBPQdY50MOE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13856,_binary '\0','/sfBHEZAxIiaIQ6QOd85R3IPrg59.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120213',5.1,1557,'en','Slappy and the Stinkers','Five 2nd-grade kids who don\'t follow strict rules by their school principal Brinway are dubbed \"Stinkers\" by him. On the class visit to an aquarium the Stinkers decide that a sea lion called Slappy doesn\'t feel too good there, \"free\" him, and plant him into Brinway\'s hot-tub.','/g6PsNLXH5bS8ZuPmhXujcM0JTHx.jpg','1998-01-23',78,'Released','Five Kids. One Sea Lion. No Rules.','Slappy and the Stinkers',81367,2.3369,5.4,'AaI55fKKZoU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13857,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120214',1.6,2608,'da','Stjerner uden hjerner','Two comedians set out to make their own exploitation video.','/k51KgSL2NUCvfeU13xo2KMikPcR.jpg','1997-01-01',79,'Released',NULL,'Danes Without a Clue',31256,0.8174,2.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13858,_binary '\0','/zlaHc8w9ob0ZRASmIUdPiEQB0ce.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120216',7.3,1232,'en','Stolen Women, Captured Hearts','Kansas, 1868. A wagon train is attacked by a band of Lakota Sioux led by the young and athletic warrior Tokalah. The attractive, red haired Anna Brewster-Morgan and her friend Sarah White are on this wagon train too. When Tokalah noticed a terrified Anna with a Bible, he thinks this is an omen. Despite killing the other passengers of the wagon train, only Anna and Sarah may continue their voyage. The next day Anna and Sarah are kidnapped by Tokalah. At first terrified of her captors, the unhappily married Anna eventually falls in love with the noble, honorable Tokalah. After a year\'s captivity, Sarah is returned to her own people. Anna now must choose between her new life with Tokalah and her previous existence as the wife of farmer Daniel Morgan.','/qBn3ijt3xL0Tk2AbduQVuNjzfcd.jpg','1997-01-16',87,'Released','She was a beautiful woman abducted by a Sioux warrior. Now she must choose between the world she lost and the love she found.','Stolen Women, Captured Hearts',68167,2.6282,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13859,_binary '\0','/m3lFal27s4wY96nrP3t2k0rbRzY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120238',6.7,11976,'en','SubUrbia','A group of suburban teenagers try to support each other through the difficult task of becoming adults.','/7PdRbG09K9JHYyOwwCSn3OdJb0N.jpg','1997-02-07',121,'Released','Sixpacks, sex and supermarkets.','SubUrbia',28059,2.4818,6.2,'sHxxbcI8g6A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13860,_binary '\0','/mhZr6UcJi3Sqsrwq7FD181DQ6dh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120240',6.5,1456,'en','Subway Stories','An anthology of 10 stories depicting real-life incidents of subway riders in New York City, which range from compassion and love to violence and loss.','/pzy2cwGh3fssoxqaIJFWOnMax5x.jpg','1997-07-24',81,'Released','Every ride is as unpredictable as the city itself.','Subway Stories',209802,2.1665,5.6,'l8TZtviEZ-M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13861,_binary '\0','/3lFX0OVEllA09J8HRZ4w1C0Wsoe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120241',6.9,30780,'en','Suicide Kings','Carlo, a former mobster, is abducted by five privileged young men desperate to raise a $2 million ransom to save the sister of a friend. As Carlo plays mind games, however, his captors splinter -- each wondering whether one of their own had a hand in the crime.','/rQ2Sidqubi7XiHDScFe1faIz3Uv.jpg','1997-09-06',106,'Released','A crime is a terrible thing to waste.','Suicide Kings',10668,3.3149,6.59,'i7Wy8AW0tb4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13862,_binary '\0','/uQVwMQJaZXOwMLV8QvJ25csFh23.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120253',5.4,1697,'sv','Svensson Svensson - filmen','Lena Svensson has been offered a new and exiting job in Stockholm that she can\'t say no to. But her husband, Gustav, has no plan of what so ever to move from his quiet little town of Vivalla, and especially his job as a very proud postman. After Lena started to commute between Stockholm and Vivalla, he decides to sell the house and give Stockholm a chance. He starts of with a job as a postman in one of Stockholm\'s worst districts, but after a mistake on a conference, Gustav seems to do quite a success at his new job, while Lena is struggling with annoying colleagues and a demanding boss.','/3XZ0olrUrk9aONt91k0Qm6KO6W0.jpg','1997-12-19',81,'Released',NULL,'Svensson, Svensson - The Movie',17964,0.941,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13863,_binary '\0','/7zRAZFZ4xVMyoLEvCb4Au41uvny.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120255',7.4,37172,'en','The Sweet Hereafter','A small mountain community in Canada is devastated when a school bus accident leaves more than a dozen of its children dead. A big-city lawyer arrives to help the survivors\' and victims\' families prepare a class-action suit, but his efforts only seem to push the townspeople further apart. At the same time, one teenage survivor of the accident has to reckon with the loss of innocence brought about by a different kind of damage.','/gJy7LMq4b5qO5fsSUSoBgm24BHf.jpg','1997-09-25',112,'Released','There is no such thing as the simple truth.','The Sweet Hereafter',10217,3.372,6.884,'F7w-dPZI_LY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13864,_binary '\0','/2xEzike2hCWfkAlj4HTRPvkeVo8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120257',6.7,3852,'en','Swept from the Sea','The film tells the story of Russian emigree and the only survivor from ship crash Yanko Goorall and servant Amy Foster in the end of 19th century. When Yanko enters a farm sick and hungry after the shipwreck, everyone is afraid of him, except for Amy, who is very kind and helps him. Soon he becomes like a son for Dr. James Kennedy and romance between Yanko and Amy follows.','/w5Or62J6mF099MQcn0Cq8ycIfqB.jpg','1998-01-23',113,'Released','In the heart of an outcast, he found his destiny. In the passion of an outsider, she found her home.','Swept from the Sea',1959,3.2587,6.4,'9BSstWVjFis','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13865,_binary '\0','/tEwzaE6wMbsoTYKbA2CRjFY1HK6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120263',7.5,21727,'sv','Sånger från andra våningen','A monumental traffic jam serves as the backdrop for the lives of the inhabitants of a Swedish city.','/xMZieoxiQ1hb5zraZlhzcvU7MGN.jpg','2000-10-06',99,'Released',NULL,'Songs from the Second Floor',34070,2.4831,7,'X05M_G5mR_M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13866,_binary '\0','/44SNTCSZTdbF5bzgUy4IfPV3DUq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120265',7.7,45144,'fa','طعم گيلاس','A middle-aged Tehranian man, Mr. Badii is intent on killing himself and seeks someone to bury him after his demise. Driving around the city, the seemingly well-to-do Badii meets with numerous people, including a Muslim student, asking them to take on the job, but initially he has little luck. Eventually, Badii finds a man who is up for the task because he needs the money, but his new associate soon tries to talk him out of committing suicide.','/vgPwjgbSdbYWrS1ty8TIZtmi6Tn.jpg','1997-09-28',99,'Released',NULL,'Taste of Cherry',30020,4.8913,7.7,'XDSQLTtGZE0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13867,_binary '\0','/uiEcc0rRtbYGFpwvm35MeBFQjCa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120274',6.9,3283,'es','Tango, no me dejes nunca','A dangerous love affair inspires a director to create the most spectacular and boldly seductive dance film ever made.','/87Ze0JLbWYuYbWc1qf6aGxHipnI.jpg','1998-08-06',115,'Released','Tango: do not ever leave me','Tango',65749,2.1569,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13868,_binary '\0','/8UepZvv8uGXa5x6v5hrNTlkTBPJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120275',6.7,2600,'en','The Tango Lesson','On a trip to Paris Sally meets Pablo, a tango dancer. He starts teaching her to dance then she returns to London to work on some \"projects\". She visits Buenos Aires and learns more from Pablo\'s friends. Sally and Pablo meet again but this time their relationship changes, she realises they want different things from each other. On a trip to Buenos Aires they cement their friendship.','/dFrkFLIGUiHTu74WGE3633XXi4C.jpg','1997-11-28',100,'Released',NULL,'The Tango Lesson',34838,1.5086,6.25,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13869,_binary '\0','/wgtPEiQPIreKRZYYDv4H0KTQwsM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120303',6.2,2607,'en','Telling Lies in America','A 17-year-old boy becomes friends with Billy Magic, the radio DJ he idolizes, and eventually slips into the payola and corruption of the entertainment world.','/yNKGhbqUgFp7gDG4btnJdLIUzSM.jpg','1997-08-02',101,'Released','Just don\'t get caught.','Telling Lies in America',63437,2.3842,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13870,_binary '\0','/4nPn6EY2ZhwmwTQWkA8DoLSODMm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120317',4.7,5260,'en','That Darn Cat','While making his nightly rounds in the neighborhood, Patti\'s pet cat D.C. finds himself the carrier of a call for help from a kidnap victim. Patti enlists skeptical law enforcement help to find the victim before it\'s too late.','/bH2EWFR9FOKp9fAjNgYf9eanivk.jpg','1997-02-14',89,'Released','This FBI agent is purring his life on the line. Fortunately, he\'s got nine.','That Darn Cat',20735,3.804,5,'mAroIlS6CD4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13871,_binary '\0','/kwqj7mRe6svkavr0ID9kjF6X8Rs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120318',6.1,4276,'en','That Old Feeling','A bride\'s divorced parents find their old feelings for each other during the wedding reception and over the course of the next few days upsetting the newlywed\'s honeymoon.','/seeCorvsPL07f3Ga4RKqzzg8BBk.jpg','1997-04-04',105,'Released','It was the perfect wedding except for two things... the bride\'s parents.','That Old Feeling',25796,2.9708,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13872,_binary '\0','/5MvH0D3aGYRM9KeQL3Xtl853UyB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120321',7.2,12282,'en','Smoke Signals','Young Native American man Thomas is a nerd in his reservation, wearing oversize glasses and telling everyone stories no-one wants to hear. His parents died in a fire in 1976, and Thomas was saved by Arnold. Arnold soon left his family, and Victor hasn\'t seen his father for 10 years. When Victor hears Arnold has died, Thomas offers him funding for the trip to get Arnold\'s remains.','/dZ6smtO2cEm3nxVhWscYfKS0mYX.jpg','1998-06-26',89,'Released','A new film from the heart of Native America.','Smoke Signals',20862,2.1918,6.8,'vQhviwp8j38','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13873,_binary '\0','/opYMZxuPnwxjuObBqlFYS7bvFzF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120323',6.1,6115,'en','A Thousand Acres','The lives of an Iowa farmer\'s three daughters are shattered when he suddenly decides to bequeath them the family\'s fertile farm.','/p7tsW4oUi7hHbpNtFZdMQEBj42g.jpg','1997-09-19',105,'Released','Best friends. Bitter rivals. Sisters.','A Thousand Acres',66588,3.6375,5.7,'eGH5iZZxFBg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13874,_binary '\0','/gtdCmYpubVkkvTQ8rdR9tkixDSj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120324',7.5,85042,'en','A Simple Plan','Captivated by the lure of sudden wealth, the quiet rural lives of two brothers erupt into conflicts of greed, paranoia and distrust when over $4 million in cash is discovered at the remote site of a downed small airplane. Their simple plan to retain the money while avoiding detection opens a Pandora\'s box when the fear of getting caught triggers panicked behavior and leads to virulent consequences.','/wO2gH7DMqpMeHlj5QmDhW4IkgAr.jpg','1998-12-11',121,'Released','Sometimes good people do evil things.','A Simple Plan',10223,5.758,7.2,'Li8aZUd6O9A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13875,_binary '\0','/51LLFjAPQY4crfennmr8XrnzV5j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120329',6.7,1613,'sv','Tic Tac','During one single day a number of life destinies cross one another. It becomes a night for the involved they will never forget, a night when the coincidences are going to change their lives forever.','/AjcFsrF2p1FDlIE7qRazPraSzGV.jpg','1997-10-31',96,'Released',NULL,'Tic Tac',76864,1.0647,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13876,_binary '\0','/xXCuto8YVp5RFqBJ7yKmVmLOWpF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120338',8,1412856,'en','Titanic','101-year-old Rose DeWitt Bukater tells the story of her life aboard the Titanic, 84 years later. A young Rose boards the ship with her mother and fiancé. Meanwhile, Jack Dawson and Fabrizio De Rossi win third-class tickets aboard the ship. Rose tells the whole story from Titanic\'s departure through to its death—on its first and last voyage—on April 15, 1912.','/9xjZS2rlVxm8SFx8kPC3aIGCOYQ.jpg','1997-12-18',194,'Released','Nothing on earth could come between them.','Titanic',597,41.9983,7.9,'CHekzSiZjrY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13877,_binary '\0','/fesAgiKA0pc04vScDTAQe1f9nd4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120347',6.5,217727,'en','Tomorrow Never Dies','A deranged media mogul is staging international incidents to pit the world\'s superpowers against each other. Now James Bond must take on this evil mastermind in an adrenaline-charged battle to end his reign of terror and prevent global pandemonium.','/gZm002w7q9yLOkltxT76TWGfdZX.jpg','1997-12-11',119,'Released','Yesterday is a memory. Today is history. Tomorrow is in the hands of one man.','Tomorrow Never Dies',714,13.6635,6.391,'QP1FMpIo-uQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13878,_binary '\0','/z6yxBxJ9atnsXnATy7cgWcgqMXR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120357',5.6,3129,'en','Touch','At the discovery of his ability to work miracles, Juvenal becomes a media sensation, but now he\'s prone to those who want to exploit him.','/4KEkCiId2lhKgSM6sAGSuG9BjdH.jpg','1997-02-14',96,'Released','Everyone wants a piece of the action.','Touch',61563,2.0097,5.571,'-MT3V4eY42s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13879,_binary '\0','/nsfVr4QbbunUrHINN9N7JdVAMTf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120363',7.9,684240,'en','Toy Story 2','Andy heads off to Cowboy Camp, leaving his toys to their own devices. Things shift into high gear when an obsessive toy collector named Al McWhiggen, owner of Al\'s Toy Barn kidnaps Woody. Andy\'s toys mount a daring rescue mission, Buzz Lightyear meets his match and Woody has to decide where he and his heart truly belong.','/4rbcp3ng8n1MKHjpeqW0L7Fnpzz.jpg','1999-10-30',92,'Released','The toys are back!','Toy Story 2',863,54.5404,7.623,'xNWSGRD5CzU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13880,_binary '\0','/9hbzM2xI6y4qhvtnC3YLxsoayBb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120366',6.1,2543,'en','Traveller','A young man, Pat, visits the clan of gypsy-like grifters (Irish Travellers) in rural North Carolina from whom he is descended. He is at first rejected, but cousin Bokky takes him on as an apprentice. Pat learns the game while Bokky falls in love and desires a different life.','/sgRravjx1m3guWa9otsizIbEJXx.jpg','1997-04-18',101,'Released','Swindlers. Scammers. Con-men. As American as apple-pie.','Traveller',31465,1.9669,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13881,_binary '\0','/7ueORrKG1Mf4ZpDFVsR83YslKR9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120370',6.9,5140,'en','Trekkies','Denise Crosby takes a first look at the huge fans of \"Star Trek\" from around America and how the series has affected and shaped their lives.','/o6MYZAcI2A7VfJkcIvCDbFPISLP.jpg','1997-10-18',86,'Released','A hilarious look at the universe\'s most fervent fans.','Trekkies',15800,2.0196,6.3,'T3STZ1aLRO0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13882,_binary '\0','/hqn2GTCYk1qbUKM0oVtkdPRsSlF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120373',5.8,6866,'en','Trial and Error','When lawyer Charlie is sent to a small Nevada town to file a continuance request for a client, his actor friend Richard turns up to throw a surprise bachelor party celebrating his upcoming marriage to the boss\'s daughter. When Charlie is too hung-over to make it to court for the hearing, Richard fills in, inadvertently committing felony fraud, and Charlie is left with no choice but to coach the clueless Richard through the whole trial.','/menUTMx04eYe8EYKhJnGYA4gK6Q.jpg','1997-05-30',98,'Released','The 2nd most outrageous trial of the century','Trial and Error',17770,2.3773,5.4,'4DMkNYxCyKA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13883,_binary '\0','/zjk0NUc2Ri7YT75cJxnmbphHT1a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120376',5.7,7066,'en','Trojan War','Brad is about to hook up with the girl of his dreams, but runs into a problem, no condom. So Brad sets out into the night to find one, running into many obstacles along the way, while not knowing his best friend, Leah is in love with him.','/oSvcgwbuWZXRPjqU8lYFtyuj8s6.jpg','1997-09-26',85,'Released','She has 24 hours to convince the guy of her dreams that she\'s the girl of his.','Trojan War',14330,3.9005,6,'MXsQ8kxlET0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13884,_binary '\0','/5cjJSK0zBu8tqRmV6qE8cu2TuUi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120380',3.9,4239,'en','Trucks','A group of seemingly humanistic trucks takeover a truck stop and starts killing everything in sight. The remaining townsfolk must band together and come up with a way to murder the inanimate objects, a seemingly difficult task considering the abnormal circumstances.','/aJN2BNCUSfrOftshzSginQNILPk.jpg','1997-10-29',99,'Released','U-TURN, U-DIE!','Trucks',17100,3.2511,4.6,'Trq3ILMgMy8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13885,_binary '\0','/k4Tx1EaJApVtyloW3Rqa8Yq1wy4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120381',5.2,1296,'en','True Heart','A brother and sister are plane-wrecked in Canada, where they must rely on the help of a native and his bear.','/rnOPcBc3ZHXPUDcrNP3jrtAAM7k.jpg','1999-02-17',92,'Released',NULL,'True Heart',41831,2.0127,5.088,'WS-opRVQ5r0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13886,_binary '\0','/rmiG2uwcNoGFmBKMoa1pIcf514L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120382',8.2,1405893,'en','The Truman Show','In a picture-perfect seaside town, an insurance salesman begins to realize that his entire existence may be staged and observed by a vast unseen audience as part of a long-running real-time reality TV show.','/vuza0WqY239yBXOadKlGwJsZJFE.jpg','1998-06-04',103,'Released','On the air. Unaware.','The Truman Show',37165,32.0486,8.159,'N1VlDVRiFrk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13887,_binary '\0','/od58TVod2KVZ50Nb1AOb6BfKQSw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120383',6.3,5553,'en','Truth or Consequences, N.M.','Raymond Lembecke is a con just out of prison after serving time for selling drugs for his mob boss Tony Vago. (Lembecke was innocent and took the rap for Vago.) Lembecke thinks Vago owes him big time so, when his former boss gets him a measly job in a warehouse, he decides on revenge and plans to steal a million dollars worth of drugs from him.','/5SqRSTVbvBrM6s2rPa5U34Hcryu.jpg','1997-05-02',106,'Released','Life\'s harsh. Why behave?','Truth or Consequences, N.M.',31017,2.7772,6.1,'2gxjyajlMKU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13888,_binary '\0','/zTeRNwkRxEbZ6qrwnbbyJHiPdcG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120389',3.8,10546,'en','Turbo: A Power Rangers Movie','The legendary Power Rangers must stop the evil space pirate Divatox from releasing the powerful Maligore from his volcanic imprisonment on the island of Muranthias, where only the kindly wizard Lerigot has the key to release him. The hope of victory lies in the Ranger\'s incredible new Turbo powers and powerful Turbo Zords.','/4mau5EXQoKUTiS5wx3Wocwrh5hG.jpg','1997-03-27',99,'Released','The Power Is Back!','Turbo: A Power Rangers Movie',6499,5.622,5.8,'NA8LYE7afBM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13889,_binary '\0','/pkL5Irj4WYU27jziUSgwl1d7d0D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120390',5.1,13612,'en','Turbulence','On a flight transporting dangerous convicts, murderer Ryan Weaver manages to break free and cause complete chaos throughout the plane. As various people on board fall victim to Weaver, it is ultimately down to flight attendant Teri Halloran to keep the aircraft from crashing, with on-ground support from an air traffic controller. While Halloran struggles to pilot the plane, Weaver continues to terrorize the surviving members of the crew.','/8N63NGWIErS7jUvR5NeVWDZEeZJ.jpg','1997-01-09',100,'Released','If you weren\'t afraid of flying before, you will be now.','Turbulence',34314,4.4964,5.368,'arr-4RGgJvU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13890,_binary '\0','/sHgs1XWYsCjRgQ6d5jlMA3d636w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120391',7,2905,'en','TwentyFourSeven','In a typical English working-class town, the juveniles have nothing more to do than hang around in gangs. One day, Alan Darcy, a highly motivated man with the same kind of youth experience, starts trying to get the young people off the street and into doing something they can believe in: Boxing. Darcy opens a boxing club, aiming to bring the rival gangs together.','/g5rd7ljbR0VVcK7m2ogrMa4E0fE.jpg','1998-04-03',96,'Released','Everybody wants to be somebody.','TwentyFourSeven',22913,2.141,6.2,'EnafD79cF0E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13891,_binary '\0','/t8CPqOkau7SeozptcnmoSnkOrLO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120392',6.4,1239,'en','The Twilight of the Golds','A woman discovers her unborn baby has a genetic predisposition to homosexuality, unwittingly exposing deep-seated prejudices within her family.','/5p0c5yZxFzWaClp7wrv38vtAm8Q.jpg','1996-10-10',92,'Released','Ten fingers, ten toes... and gay. Do you still want him?','The Twilight of the Golds',72483,2.2029,5.6,'IUIGuOZJ89w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13892,_binary '\0','/8IVxmM6ZXdYjJnxJEM2f3KOjQc4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120394',6.8,6781,'en','Twin Town','Jeremy and Julian Lewis, the \"Lewis Twins\", are two unruly brothers who terrorise the city of Swansea from the caravan park where they live with their family. When their father, Fatty, is injured while working on a roof for local kingpin Bryn Cartwright, they try in vain to claim compensation. Thus begins a campaign of terror, which local policemen Terry and Grayo are ill-equipped to prevent, involved as they are in a drugs deal with Cartwright.','/b9rf32Mq0bQ0pJ3EZ5ghY52J4tS.jpg','1997-04-11',99,'Released','Pretty shitty city.','Twin Town',15321,1.7628,6.2,'Pplx0p01EJA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13893,_binary '\0','/rq6duKhgffOtMs9LqgyhrJ9Y8EX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120399',6.7,58052,'en','U Turn','When a desperate man’s car breaks down in a bizarre desert town while evading vengeful bookies, he becomes entangled in a dangerous love triangle. Caught between a married couple, he’s faced with deadly contracts to kill them both.','/nBPTj1ApIDWo04M14rXFwLPdtr2.jpg','1997-10-03',125,'Released','Sex. Murder. Betrayal. Everything that makes life worth living.','U Turn',10155,4.6486,6.6,'uidcyKDkFWU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13894,_binary '\0','/1ReyL0Xm8u5xYokl6EQef2HKhjY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120401',6,3273,'en','The Ugly','A female psychologist wants to understand the minds of a confessed serial killer who spent the last five years in a mental hospital because of his state.','/vtwQ8oICMxscIpoL3bKcoKklcV2.jpg','1997-08-26',93,'Released','Murder is in the eye of the beholder.','The Ugly',40961,1.2552,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13895,_binary '\0','/ps3Jl9zQSw8UJlgwlGmLvO3tl2N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120402',7,8046,'en','Ulee\'s Gold','Third-generation Florida beekeeper Ulee Jackson may have gotten out of Vietnam alive, but he left a part of himself behind. Now he methodically tends his bees, carefully provides for his two grandchildren and keeps his emotions at bay. But when a long-buried secret threatens Ulee\'s business and family, he is forced to break through his emotional walls and confront the terror of his wounded spirit.','/wMpZ7U7A0QHJptR9L573V3Y7SI0.jpg','1997-06-13',112,'Released',NULL,'Ulee\'s Gold',55306,1.8909,6.449,'ORI2PFOePYM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13896,_binary '\0','/tu1Yzp1pw52EvM8Gn97M7voULjk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120404',5.1,1673,'fr','Un amour de sorcière','Michael Firch is very skilled in computers and he goes to Paris to meet very important persons to discuss a contract. Michael was born on a special astral date. On arriving in Paris, he meets Morgane and her son. Morgane is a witch, she is beautiful, she is good and she needs Michael to save her son from evil powers. Molok is a sorcerer and he opposes Morgana\'s plan.','/azNil7xE2srTzvKYY6wnAf6o9M6.jpg','1997-03-19',102,'Released',NULL,'A Witch\'s Way of Love',64340,2.3318,5.2,'APYEqVP2wtA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13897,_binary '\0','/2yYrBdhPzsrHQlNqswFa90y6bZu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120408',7.3,7114,'ja','うなぎ','A businessman kills his adulterous wife and is sent to prison. After his release, he opens a barbershop and meets new people, talking to almost no one except for an eel he befriended while in prison.','/3TEzcwdF3DPeO8uSPmCfBBUhgNp.jpg','1997-05-12',117,'Released',NULL,'The Eel',20506,5.1857,6.9,'jNXkSuhJPqk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13898,_binary '\0','/9bVNNFdxgE0N5gCvMkFf4BbUcPf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120430',5.7,3288,'en','Vanishing Point','When his wife goes into a troubled labor while he is on the road over 1200 miles away James Kowalski, an ex race car driver and a former Army Ranger, attempts to elude police while trying to get home. After numerous chases he turns into a Native American reservation and reflects on his life, and his wife. He heads off to break through a police roadblock.','/yiKDpr72gmML8mnKclllpEg4sZc.jpg','1997-01-07',91,'Released',NULL,'Vanishing Point',27312,2.1283,5.6,'SVo3Z2dAZ20','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13899,_binary '\0','/9HcZsZQZcgxr99iYYOoYMcfjmHB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120434',6,56820,'en','Vegas Vacation','The Griswold family hits the road again for a typically ill-fated vacation, this time to the glitzy mecca of slots and showgirls—Las Vegas.','/jUOreo2AWDnPuRJsUp6T1i66tUe.jpg','1997-02-13',93,'Released','This time the Griswolds are on a roll.','Vegas Vacation',11419,7.5712,5.983,'U5jQU0gsuaE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13900,_binary '\0','/8nzazBKjnS4VlV74MKbPsnpbKaX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120448',6.9,3789,'fr','La Vie de Jésus','Twenty-something Freddy is becalmed in a podunk French village where the only sign of life is the local amateur brass band and youth aimlessly roaming around the countryside on scooters. He has an intense sexual connection with his girlfriend but has no joy or passion to give her. When she falls for a handsome Arab youth a tragedy unfolds.','/mY7yWPN61wqpCIGVtNjInGidyJk.jpg','1997-06-04',96,'Released',NULL,'The Life of Jesus',27067,1.8144,6.6,'Nqlsv-xCFI0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13901,_binary '\0','/96cxNn6Mpi91iauvJSGiN1UATXc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120449',7.4,8061,'fr','La Vie rêvée des anges','Isa and Marie bond while working in a French sweatshop and soon begin sharing an apartment that Marie is watching for a hospitalized mother and daughter. Marie, hoping to avoid a life of struggle and poverty, takes up with Chriss, a nightclub owner whose most attractive asset is his money. Isa recognizes the ultimate futility of the relationship and tries to keep Marie away from him, but her interference puts their friendship at risk.','/1yxr5KJHJk5aPCbapJaBS8Znx8V.jpg','1998-10-16',113,'Released',NULL,'The Dreamlife of Angels',9840,1.8483,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13902,_binary '\0','/gYqIjjMezPW2Jtv0kA0pyR1BbPb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120456',7.4,3251,'hi','Virasat','After completing his studies in London, England, Shakti Thakur returns home to India in a small town where his family resides.','/hfbE6xLSmFhCRZbHm12VjLbMXGA.jpg','1997-05-30',168,'Released',NULL,'Virasat',166259,1.3379,7.342,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13903,_binary '\0','/j3Nvs9rZDjsOU3jwtxUwyEum1pn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120458',5.1,32412,'en','Virus','When the crew of an American tugboat boards an abandoned Russian research vessel, the alien life form aboard regards them as a virus which must be destroyed.','/5Np88iigCfnXvMlMKmCcbPVIbYQ.jpg','1999-01-14',100,'Released','Life on earth is in for a shock.','Virus',9423,4.2503,5.4,'ipYSWeV599s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13904,_binary '\0','/lYpScP0hkba0X3HY1VrKZ7LOMxS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120461',5.6,87926,'en','Volcano','An earthquake shatters a peaceful Los Angeles morning and opens a fissure deep into the earth, causing lava to start bubbling up. As a volcano begins forming in the La Brea Tar Pits, the director of the city\'s emergency management service, working with a geologist, must then use every resource in the city to try and stop the volcano from consuming LA.','/5xIjktjXuro7anZ6AR58t5ZYWjQ.jpg','1997-04-25',104,'Released','It\'s hotter than hell.','Volcano',10357,8.1552,5.983,'67oe0_s9EIw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13905,_binary '\0','/133PkTc8SCcl6q9PaKtsoE1sYOK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120467',5.2,4422,'en','Vulgar','Vulgar is about a man who is a children\'s clown but has not been getting much luck lately. He lives in a cheap apartment which he can\'t even afford. Bums are constantly sleeping in his run down car and crashing on his lawn. He has a nagging mother who lives in a nursing home, and his best friend is a moocher. One day he comes up with the idea to become a bachelor clown.','/aLdezroGbHDP0w0jOLwxXjgrgma.jpg','2002-04-26',87,'Released','Everyone loves a clown... some more than others.','Vulgar',19085,1.626,5.3,'YLjXcYWKnJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13906,_binary '\0','/mUaaSvKSOdUtC7tvZ6q2Iddls3u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120471',6.4,5387,'fr','La Vérité si je mens !','Jobless loner Eddie Vuibert gets a lucky break when a rich Jewish entrepreneur mistakes him for a Jew and gives him a sweet job in the Parisian fashion district.','/z1JRKYnac2SvvQsCbHaVM2E5x0v.jpg','1997-04-01',100,'Released',NULL,'Would I Lie to You?',39385,2.1368,6.273,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13907,_binary '\0','/p8UhV6DkFrFyZm59rivTou7q5cp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120472',7.8,3880,'en','Waco: The Rules of Engagement','In one of the most tragic face-offs in the history of law enforcement, the deadly debacle at Waco pitted the Branch Davidian sect against the FBI in an all-out war. This documentary makes the most of footage and recordings to examine how the events that led to the tragedy of April 19, 1993, unfolded, and how the FBI\'s unrelenting approach made what was already a bad situation much worse.','/wJkMYVedNcwK7tzWL7k7Jp6tUPr.jpg','1997-09-19',136,'Released','The shocking truth revealed!','Waco: The Rules of Engagement',34044,1.6938,7.6,'gCX9rUAqpyo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13908,_binary '\0','/okPwhy7bkNBAzisjLEEtFKMWTM6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120478',5.3,3421,'en','Star Kid','Shy seventh-grader Spencer Griffith\'s life changes when the meteor falls into local junkyard and he finds a Cybersuit - the wise and strong robot from another galaxy. Spencer puts Cybersuit on and becomes a different kind of guy','/srnvpaAg83sfYr82meDe6k1nDd.jpg','1997-11-13',101,'Released','You know what they say, if the cyborsuit fits, go kick some alien butt!','Star Kid',54007,2.3086,6.553,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13909,_binary '\0','/fmlKLVNNL62XJ28fhU2SjlozJl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120479',4.8,3948,'en','Warriors of Virtue','A young boy is whisked away to the mythical land of Tao where he becomes the center of a conflict between an evil lord and a group of animal warriors.','/3wR9rxqZsVe5YGXYCsVAn1fl9RY.jpg','1997-05-02',103,'Released','In a world beyond your imagination a battle for the universe has begun.','Warriors of Virtue',49478,3.2596,4.718,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13910,_binary '\0','/iW2wbSu2ZmzaE7dv8VrjrfcR1mG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120481',6.7,3966,'en','Washington Square','In 1870s New York, spinster heiress Catherine Sloper is courted by the much younger, penniless Morris Townsend, much to the chagrin of her overprotective father. Catherine must decide whether to spend the rest of her life alone, or marry a man interested in her solely for her inheritence.','/3LIn7bskDwsmyxMWTNWRIPSCm2X.jpg','1997-10-10',115,'Released','She must choose between her father\'s fortune... Or the man she loves.','Washington Square',45019,2.9527,6.2,'K3i253Glu20','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13911,_binary '\0','/k0NVarTkjVJBDS4XDpkhNbrh8vS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120483',6.6,37550,'en','The Man Who Knew Too Little','An American gets a ticket for an audience participation game in London, then gets involved in a case of mistaken identity. As an international plot unravels around him, he thinks it\'s all part of the act.','/yVlIZa0u6CTN5LudxGX77Fk46iz.jpg','1997-11-14',94,'Released','He’s on a mission so secret, even he doesn’t know about it.','The Man Who Knew Too Little',9414,4.4017,6.3,'-YAhpfcdx0U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13912,_binary '\0','/bWfmsPRKJ9Skkh7pUOdoThR9zqO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120484',6.2,194206,'en','The Waterboy','Bobby Boucher is a water boy for a struggling college football team. The coach discovers Boucher\'s hidden rage makes him a tackling machine whose bone-crushing power might vault his team into the playoffs.','/miT42qWYC4D0n2mXNzJ9VfhheWW.jpg','1998-11-06',90,'Released','You can mess with him. But don\'t mess with his water.','The Waterboy',10663,8.2751,6.063,'YeCM7UTyr7M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13913,_binary '\0','/9NjCvqLUAQYfX3ksAImHdtdc1Bx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120490',6.7,8184,'en','Welcome to Sarajevo','Follow a group of international journalists into the heart of the once cosmopolitan city of Sarajevo—now a danger zone of sniper and mortar attacks where residents still live. While reporting on an American aid worker who’s trying to get children out of the country, a British correspondent decides to take an orphaned girl home to London.','/bGdDqsFCF0v9M5mB77fAF8vJMsy.jpg','1997-05-09',103,'Released','To get the story, they’ll risk everything.','Welcome to Sarajevo',14905,2.8594,6.5,'IOmm1OD2ArQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13914,_binary '\0','/c0NSn1uypIXpP0ybdGQ2QwUVTR5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120491',5.7,2309,'en','Welcome to Woop Woop','A con artist escapes a deal gone wrong in New York and winds up in the Aussie outback in a strange town whose inhabitants are an oddball collection of misfits.','/2ek9pyqNFQbtwtXptRZxsIGkOuN.jpg','1998-08-13',106,'Released','The hills are alive...','Welcome to Woop Woop',6970,2.3727,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13915,_binary '\0','/9ZoBERwgdy96gFKqhamqqfDCrXx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120494',6.7,1220,'fr','Western','Catalonian Paco is a traveling rep for a shoe manufacturer. When he stops to pick up Russian emigree hitchhiker Nino, Paco soon finds himself on the side of the road with everything stolen out from under him. Local gift shop owner Marinette gives the Spaniard a lift. Their mutual attraction manifests itself quickly, and Paco, who was fired over the stolen-car episode, hangs around. When he happens to spot Nino in the same town, he beats up the scrawny Russian, who lands in the hospital. Oddly enough, this marks the beginning of a beautiful friendship. Paco and Nino soon take the trip down the road together','/u7P3htHY9FDaEFgtRdp5B830L4O.jpg','1997-05-09',124,'Released',NULL,'Western',39968,0.9393,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13916,_binary '\0','/k3YUfzlOkZYEI1hkwUEb2dpS2Tr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120498',7.1,1455,'en','What the Deaf Man Heard','In 1945, a young boy arrives in a small Georgia town on a bus from which his mother was abducted and murdered. Alone he sits quietly and everyone becomes convinced that he is deaf and mute. Deciding that silence offers some power and protection, the boy decides to remain mute and just listens to all that is being said around him by people who think that he cannot hear.','/mEhTcoBQ7cbmX6OkZJ8kIIYojWo.jpg','1997-11-23',99,'Released','For twenty years, he lived in silence. Now his heart needs to speak the truth.','What the Deaf Man Heard',57479,2.556,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13917,_binary '\0','/xGOwf36SjVWgYL953tOSHYRHaPW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120510',5.8,4860,'en','Wide Awake','The tale of a ten-year-old boy in a Catholic school who, following the death of his beloved grandfather, embarks on a quest to discover the meaning of life.','/xnqLUL2l71KVSaqiz9fbFpXtEFe.jpg','1998-03-20',88,'Released','Meeting your best friend. Finding your favorite teacher. Having your first crush. Remember what it felt like to be...','Wide Awake',32911,2.92,5.5,'Mf0cPAJ27hs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13918,_binary '\0','/pQqDcWx07WDzDS0mRCfQ3XgffP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120512',6.4,8810,'en','Wild America','Three brothers - Marshall, Marty and Mark dream of becoming naturalists and portraying animal life of America. One summer their dream comes true, they travel through America, filming alligators, bears and moose.','/m9VIy9qtq49EDwgYFg07ganUYg.jpg','1997-07-02',106,'Released','Take a ride on the wild side.','Wild America',38225,2.7833,6.1,'0lj0nw7X9y8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13919,_binary '\0','/8WquHvFVBq9jtfRUUOzMVJBzNW4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120514',6.9,17837,'en','Wilde','Oscar Wilde is a married playwright who has occasionally indulged his weakness for male suitors. After much toil, Wilde debuts \'The Importance of Being Earnest\' in London, and a chat at the theatre with Lord Alfred \'Bosie\' Douglas leads to a full-fledged romance. However, this affair leads to a legal dispute with Lord Alfred\'s oppressive father, the Marquess of Queensberry, and, given the local anti-gay laws, Wilde is jailed. Wilde\'s vast intellect helps him survive until he regains his freedom.','/66ieZHIIOkeQAjAi4ekFpcCLozA.jpg','1997-09-01',118,'Released','Loved for being unique. Hated for being different.','Wilde',11365,4.4005,6.6,'_Y7NGglgjCU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13920,_binary '\0','/sO2R3spdsK7GcAa8qyUnOGw7Ns4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120520',7.1,12404,'en','The Wings of the Dove','Kate is secretly betrothed to a struggling journalist, Merton Densher. But she knows her Aunt Maude will never approve of the match, since Kate\'s deceased mother has lost all her money in a marriage to a degenerate opium addict. When Kate meets a terminally ill American heiress named Millie traveling through Europe, she comes up with a conniving plan to have both love and wealth.','/eb1ZnIEC8LMmMgwD2fIAmQOkcd.jpg','1997-09-04',102,'Released','A couple with everything but money. An heiress with everything but love. A temptation no one could resist.','The Wings of the Dove',45609,3.6072,6.592,'a03XaApFiz4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13921,_binary '\0','/cjL96NuObyl8zE7kPMynns8tw56.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120521',6.8,3978,'en','The Winter Guest','It\'s winter in a small Scottish village near the sea, and multiple lives intersect in a day. Frances has just lost her husband to an early death, so her mother, Elspeth, travels to Frances\' house to reconnect with her daughter and grandson, Alex. Meanwhile, old women Chloe and Lily go to a funeral, youngsters Sam and Tom cut class, and Alex gets a crush on tomboy Nita.','/9t0hyTI7HTB6JSIecUNODrtBvwa.jpg','1997-12-27',108,'Released','Come In From The Cold','The Winter Guest',25994,2.7501,6.5,'jt3AT-8rKGk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13922,_binary '\0','/7KB5MLHBkkZrjKIZm5PRhImOSdt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120522',7.1,4863,'de','Winterschläfer','Young blonde translator Rebecca lives with her boyfriend ski instructor Marco in a mountain villa owned by her friend, nurse Laura. Rene, local cinema projectionist, steals Marco\'s car and gets into a car crash with local Theo, whose daughter, after being in coma for a time, dies. Rene suffers from partial short term memory loss and starts a relationship with Laura. Meanwhile Marco is looking for the man who stole his car and Theo - for the man who killed his daughter...','/9eSSVuhQ197uSzhgkuW8rKGQ1bo.jpg','1997-10-30',120,'Released',NULL,'Winter Sleepers',781,1.1261,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13923,_binary '\0','/m8xEJ663MQZPmf8RQdiMyBb4Xon.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120523',5,1476,'en','Wishful Thinking','Elizabeth, a vet assistant, falls for Max, who brings in an abused dog. His jealousy burdens their relationship as does talk of marriage. Lena wants Max and she schemes.','/nA3eMtLYyo0fjwvC3moqJzZZHRj.jpg','1999-07-09',91,'Released','TRUE LOVE...Is Just A Wish Away!','Wishful Thinking',86913,1.3745,5,'emmrDzTNtKY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13924,_binary '\0','/y5uIU4LMXPpINIpTDT6ry1lu9P4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120524',5.9,29298,'en','Wishmaster','The Djinn, having been released from his ancient prison, seeks to capture the soul of the woman who discovered him, thereby opening a portal and freeing his fellow Djinn to take over the earth.','/4BwP7ruojwdGr73iD9UWKSA7M19.jpg','1997-09-19',90,'Released','Be careful what you wish for.','Wishmaster',10351,6.057,6.132,'dbbUSeXxc_A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13925,_binary '\0','/AmzrZsqKxBYrJnEmGVt1PdgQK97.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120530',6.3,4701,'cn','黃飛鴻之西域雄獅','So goes to the U.S. to open a martial arts school. Around this time, many Chinese people were sold off to U.S. railroad companies, and were brutally treated by the Americans under the harsh working conditions. Thus, the American workers\' hatred towards the Chinese immigrants is high. As a result, So gets into trouble with the Americans and the mob, and calls Master Wong for help.','/6hSNNOwJIYkNXYjn6yhJPCd9oio.jpg','1997-02-01',102,'Released',NULL,'Once Upon a Time in China and America',10620,3.9995,5.901,'_N5MZkQuI08','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13926,_binary '\0','/c8qHUbcyVGw300QHsIXnodwsCpf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120531',4.3,2407,'en','Woo','Woo is a woman in control of her world. She is smart, self-confident, sophisticated and snarky. And she doesn\'t have any trouble attracting members of the opposite sex. But for some reason no one ever sticks around. Woo meets Tim, a paralegal who is her complete opposite. They shouldn\'t click. However, Woo and Tim begin to bond when a series of weird and stressful calamities hits them while they are on their first date.','/8K1IfJXWPW1N5J6ar8ZOLU47c98.jpg','1998-05-08',84,'Released','It\'s Woo\'s world.. we\'re just living in it.','Woo',58680,2.0596,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13927,_binary '\0','/cBmezUU59QHQPVjBlEKTIGaExih.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120533',6.3,28874,'en','Celebrity','The career and personal life of writer Lee are at a standstill, so he divorces his bashful wife, Robin, and dives into a new job as an entertainment journalist. His assignments take him to the swankiest corners of Manhattan, but as he jumps from one lavish party to another and engages in numerous empty romances, he starts to doubt the worth of his work. Meanwhile, top TV producer Tony falls for Robin and introduces her to the world of celebrity.','/q4UJHtH14nO8tbMfGtJ3Z3Tw5RW.jpg','1998-09-25',113,'Released','A funny look at people who will do anything to get famous... or stay famous.','Celebrity',9466,4.6173,6,'CK6x-SSEfzg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13928,_binary '\0','/xN7NnkNvgL41OI3NDhQy0cFrtBH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120536',6.7,4605,'en','The Wrong Guy','Nelson Hibbert expects to become the new president of Nagel Industries, but Mr. Nagel gives the promotion to another employee. When Nelson barges into Nagel\'s office to confront him, he finds Nagel\'s been murdered. Fearing that he will be implicated, Nelson decides to run from the law...despite the fact that the police already know the killer\'s identity.','/9X22sqQI5UAwajmSNH293avRtFr.jpg','1997-08-01',92,'Released','A fugitive in his own mind.','The Wrong Guy',15313,2.8422,6.8,'Rtkh3iQ7X2c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13929,_binary '\0','/4tODjTeNOvM1XUqGtSzFrG2rHKo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120539',6.6,2060,'en','Year of the Horse','A document of Neil Young and Crazy Horse\'s 1996 concert tour. Director Jarmusch conducts interviews about the band\'s long history, interspersed with backstage footage from the 1970s and 1980s.','/kLO7UAx8OalCeW2JqTAispzNBJr.jpg','1997-10-08',106,'Released',NULL,'Year of the Horse',62422,2.1806,6.4,'CoJicHPkPa8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13930,_binary '\0','/4AWQOipcjMRHmhKWXzmvISjnjsv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120540',6.7,15283,'hi','हां बॉस','Rahul Joshi wants to be a successful businessman so he works hard for his boss Siddharth. One day Rahul meets Seema, an up and coming model, and he feels like he\'s finally met his match. Will Seema fall for Rahul?','/ayp76lRwyp5izlZVnxcZscgHofH.jpg','1997-07-18',165,'Released',NULL,'Yes Boss',79982,1.5973,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13931,_binary '\0','/cjGr4luNLyMi7ADqlE3xzWzlZJv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120543',7.2,2533,'zh','有话好好说','A spurned lover seeks a rich man for revenge. A random onlooker — who witnessed the public assault committed by the rich man against the lover — seeks for monetary compensation for his smashed computer.','/WAdaLx9FKPEqZNnLjguGQB0mr.jpg','1997-09-02',93,'Released','Who will pay for the computer?','Keep Cool',37909,1.8737,7.5,'C-AaDGtg9Wk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13932,_binary '\0','/9Xx3K21mnd1NTrmKrBKJvqgWoXI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120547',7.3,1220,'ja','ユメノ銀河','Tomiko falls in love with Niitaka, even though she also suspects him of being the Tokyo bus driver serial killer, who killed his female conductors after tiring of them.','/49h5yFfzIn1m1ZU0buaCFdDMNcn.jpg','1997-02-15',90,'Released',NULL,'Labyrinth of Dreams',76760,1.6539,7,'v3xanFYBcOA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13933,_binary '\0','/67rDbJBnh5BxrjNvgx51jIEJgpo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120550',5.4,3400,'en','Zeus & Roxanne','Mary Beth is a marine biologist that gets annoyed when a dog called Zeus stows aboard her research boat. Nevertheless she is intrigued when the intrusive canine makes best-friends with her captive dolphin, Roxanne. She falls in love with Zeus\'s owner, Terry, a musician who rides a bike.','/igyTJ9cFwjcuzMM5oa0lknRyvYv.jpg','1997-01-24',98,'Released','A friendship no one ever thought possible. An adventure no one ever will forget.','Zeus & Roxanne',42424,3.0831,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13934,_binary '\0','/g6ls0ftIOS9qqPHn8K1nysq7yMB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120551',6,2047,'hi','ज़िद्दी','Omnipresent Bollywood acting dynamo Sunny Deol stars as Deva, the son of an honest lawyer (Anupam Kher) who lives with his brother, Aakash (Sachin Khedekar), and his beloved sister, Guddi (Richa Behl). Imprisoned after a man touches Guddi and sets off his violent, jealous rage, Deva falls into a life of crime, quickly rising to the top of the city\'s criminal underworld--much to the chagrin of the other crime bosses, who plot his murder. Their attempt to frame him for the murder of an important Minister doesn\'t go as planned, and Deva suddenly finds himself on the run, with the minister as a hostage, and his brother and sister murdered.','/p8OaWdlGVfpOzTbZo4F0xRzOMOR.jpg','1997-04-11',170,'Released',NULL,'Ziddi',143976,1.2647,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13935,_binary '\0','/fxVo7k5TaV63Qxi4BygxfnAWVkN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120576',6,7239,'en','Dance with Me','Young Cuban Rafael just buried his mother, and comes to Houston to meet his father John for the first time. The difficult part is that John doesn\'t know he is Rafael\'s father. John runs a dance studio, and everyone prepares for the World Open Dance championship in Las Vegas. It soon becomes clear Rafael is a very good dancer, and Ruby is the biggest hope for the studio at the championship.','/mJ1LDb5MOIAwH8LQ019Vg36Yh3O.jpg','1998-08-21',126,'Released','In the dance of life, love can happen in a heartbeat.','Dance with Me',17915,4.3607,6.9,'s9-9uvi1iQ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13936,_binary '\0','/rGaXfUvsnIK32RikoCnYKoYsQNc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120577',5.9,36175,'en','54','When the mastermind behind New York\'s infamous Studio 54 disco plucks young Shane from the sea of faces clamoring to get inside his club, he not only gets his foot in the door, but lands a coveted job behind the bar — and a front-row ticket to the most legendary party on the planet!','/gLjt54vow8CEOHdgRkQCyXwbq52.jpg','1998-08-28',93,'Released','It\'s Saturday night fever every night.','54',3682,6.4936,5.9,'oYv2hyJXMeU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13937,_binary '\0','/qJctmzmNllpc8erVHhFIWGmLbY3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120584',6.7,3400,'en','All the Little Animals','An emotionally challenged young man named Bobby runs away from home in order to escape his abusive stepfather who has killed his pets. He meets an old man, Mr. Summers, who spends his time traveling and giving burials to animals that have been killed by cars. Bobby, also having an affinity for animals, becomes friends with the old man and aids him in his task.','/8FTYas78VeQbnP94Sl4ePAGmZwk.jpg','1999-07-09',112,'Released','On this earth, in this land, we are all here for a reason.','All the Little Animals',48464,2.3061,6,'6Zpzsfy5ZkU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13938,_binary '\0','/6qHI1IYj7QlLSCwHRzkL62X175s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120586',8.5,1286563,'en','American History X','Derek Vineyard is paroled after serving 3 years in prison for killing two African-American men. Through his brother, Danny Vineyard\'s narration, we learn that before going to prison, Derek was a skinhead and the leader of a violent white supremacist gang that committed acts of racial crime throughout L.A. and his actions greatly influenced Danny. Reformed and fresh out of prison, Derek severs contact with the gang and becomes determined to keep Danny from going down the same violent path as he did.','/x2drgoXYZ8484lqyDj7L1CEVR4T.jpg','1998-07-01',119,'Released','Some legacies must end.','American History X',73,19.9755,8.323,'el6JxnW2Tyg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13939,_binary '\0','/i4NvcHeYeAdLEFiLxEVvUA3BT0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120587',6.5,172351,'en','Antz','A neurotic worker ant in love with a rebellious princess rises to unlikely stardom when he switches places with a soldier. Signing up to march in a parade, he ends up under the command of a bloodthirsty general. But he\'s actually been enlisted to fight against a termite army.','/lWPjxbUMpAHFkJpZHHNWhQaRsax.jpg','1998-10-02',83,'Released','See the world from a whole new perspective.','Antz',8916,10.0689,6.191,'g4SiWDIoFhE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13940,_binary '\0','/1cO6OQJxz7YhTZ4V1OlkYfebeJa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120591',6.7,483955,'en','Armageddon','When an asteroid threatens to collide with Earth, NASA honcho Dan Truman determines the only way to stop it is to drill into its surface and detonate a nuclear bomb. This leads him to renowned driller Harry Stamper, who agrees to helm the dangerous space mission provided he can bring along his own hotshot crew. Among them is the cocksure A.J. who Harry thinks isn\'t good enough for his daughter, until the mission proves otherwise.','/eTM3qtGhDU8cvjpoa6KEt5E2auU.jpg','1998-07-01',151,'Released','For love. For honor. For mankind.','Armageddon',95,14.3947,6.833,'SsjVBE5bE60','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13941,_binary '\0','/ll1BtZ7R84UZfZppK3l7rCi0TBu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120594',5.9,3673,'en','B. Monkey','When wistful introvert Alan Furnace meets quick-witted bombshell Beatrice, he has no idea of her secret life as \"B. Monkey\" -- the top thief-for-hire in London\'s criminal underworld. Charmed by Furnace\'s innocent and chivalrous ways, Beatrice resolves to reform. But to cash in on her first chance at real love, she must escape her former partner in crime, the ruthless Paul Neville -- and a dark past that seems to haunt her every step.','/80bQjfpH14P5p2TDnfWUukEkM55.jpg','1999-07-15',94,'Released','Trouble never looked so good.','B. Monkey',2923,2.6637,5.813,'SLfl0RiOvEM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13942,_binary '\0','/73Zd7StP4Ln0hSCwmqhCaZomYWB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120595',5.9,37887,'en','Babe: Pig in the City','Babe, fresh from his victory in the sheepherding contest, returns to Farmer Hoggett\'s farm, but after Farmer Hoggett is injured and unable to work, Babe has to go to the big city to save the farm.','/glO6LcTWUZcbxWT2SB4eRDnFSsP.jpg','1998-11-25',96,'Released','In the heart of the city, a pig with heart.','Babe: Pig in the City',9447,9.5895,5.7,'mARmXtTkVvY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13943,_binary '\0','/1tRrXYZ5pMJOW57SFTHetL6f5Ay.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120596',5.1,18276,'en','The Bachelor','Jimmie is seeing his single friends get married one by one. He isn\'t too worried until his girlfriend Anne catches the bouquet at his friend Marco\'s wedding. Suddenly, his wild mustang days are numbered. He finally decides to propose to her, but he sticks his foot in his mouth and botches the proposal. Being insulted by the defeatist proposal, Anne leaves town on an assignment. After she\'s gone, he finds out that his recently-deceased grandfather\'s will stipulates that he gets nothing of a multi-million dollar fortune unless he\'s married by 6:05pm on his 30th birthday: tomorrow! Not being able to find Anne, Jimmie begins backtracking through his past girlfriends to find a wife.','/zAF7cDx3SNqx6vjqgH2FLFM9pcm.jpg','1999-11-05',101,'Released','One thousand brides. One hundred million dollars. Jimmie Shannon is about to discover the true value of love.','The Bachelor',2020,6.0872,5.145,'J-qVET5KSpk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13944,_binary '\0','/vxoZ4jHd9B5f8OiSWhlZyOlfdnN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120598',3.3,3837,'en','Barney\'s Great Adventure','Mom and dad dump son Cody, daughter Abby, her best friend Marcella and a baby on the farm with Grandpa and Grandma. Purple dinosaur Barney soon appears to entertain the kids, and when a large colorful egg deposited on a farm by a shooting star is accidentally carted off, Barney and the kids start their chase for it.','/tSadXiI88soRyS4mcSr7PsKWaqN.jpg','1998-04-03',76,'Released','An Adventure as Big as your Imagination.','Barney\'s Great Adventure',17644,2.4042,5,'NEr3oXxXIz8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13945,_binary '\0','/1Nyjb7aeRKynWgmOl8he5ZcvWLm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120601',7.7,371368,'en','Being John Malkovich','One day at work, unsuccessful puppeteer Craig finds a portal into the head of actor John Malkovich. The portal soon becomes a passion for anybody who enters its mad and controlling world of overtaking another human body.','/31FGQu3OnwdmS4COquENe0vMZc0.jpg','1999-10-29',113,'Released','Ever wanted to be someone else? Now you can.','Being John Malkovich',492,11.2218,7.422,'LEtlqumjXLw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13946,_binary '\0','/c0GGzLetI6MDMAgbRmzIAek7Y99.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120602',6.8,2567,'en','Bella Mafia','Following the brutal murder of her husband and male kin, Sophia unites with her mother-in-law and sisters-in-law, in a fierce quest for vengeance against their enemies.','/4xHvnDHzcRKP9aaDaj823WSiD3Y.jpg','1997-11-16',165,'Released','Hell hath no fury like the women of...','Bella Mafia',82077,2.6145,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13947,_binary '\0','/5v7vW8fRA70Y02FMB0W8ubCQebc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120603',6.1,8845,'en','Beloved','After Paul D. finds his old slave friend Sethe in Ohio and moves in with her and her daughter Denver, a strange girl comes along by the name of \"Beloved\". Sethe and Denver take her in and then strange things start to happen...','/jIoT0J2fNXXCYZst6OkKStQIPw9.jpg','1998-10-16',172,'Released','The past has a life of its own.','Beloved',39437,3.3432,5.8,'WNz7mV8ob2Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13948,_binary '\0','/9bdTdaqxT2ZEVGZwXsMvG7410cT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120604',4.1,13373,'en','Beowulf','Beowulf is a wanderer who learns about a man-eating creature called Grendel, which comes in the night to devour warriors trapped at the Outpost. The Outpost is ruled by Hrothgar. He has a daughter, whose husband may have been murdered by the Outpost\'s master of arms.','/ktX5naCHfERaoDVaCUOITPIFrFd.jpg','1999-03-31',93,'Released','A fortress at the edge of darkness. An enemy within that only one man can conquer!','Beowulf',5470,3.2268,4.4,'63YvJnFtFhU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13949,_binary '\0','/r7DqnFeud4kV2VUUFxsmW4T09sw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120609',6.1,33473,'en','The Big Hit','Affable hit man Melvin Smiley is constantly being scammed by his cutthroat colleagues in the life-ending business. So, when he and his fellow assassins kidnap the daughter of an electronics mogul, it\'s naturally Melvin who takes the fall when their prime score turns sour. That\'s because the girl is the goddaughter of the gang\'s ruthless crime boss. But, even while dodging bullets, Melvin has to keep his real job secret from his unsuspecting fiancée, Pam.','/7b1JP2WE0UrVAy34U7X4UngWtBi.jpg','1998-04-24',91,'Released','Nothing\'s more dangerous than some nice guys... with a little time to kill.','The Big Hit',9448,5.8338,5.99,'ge4RlzTujq8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13950,_binary '\0','/g3OIqGPv36wGfe86NPjzWpAmQ7Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120610',5.5,10854,'en','Black Dog','An ex-con takes a job driving a truck cross country. What he doesn\'t know is that the truck is filled with illegal weapons and now he must fight to survive and save his family.','/8hvt4L3EXWq3ANutok32ODQIGwV.jpg','1998-05-01',88,'Released','The rules of the road are simple. Don\'t turn back.','Black Dog',18316,3.6331,6.406,'C5FHxF0KqdA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13951,_binary '\0','/7NKfxJrQn053UJeLftlx4m4NTzo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120611',7.1,335834,'en','Blade','The Daywalker known as \"Blade\" - a half-vampire, half-mortal man - becomes the protector of humanity against an underground army of vampires.','/oWT70TvbsmQaqyphCZpsnQR7R32.jpg','1998-08-21',121,'Released','Against an army of Immortals, one warrior must draw first blood.','Blade',36647,16.3223,6.856,'O2Y3FFFIvRI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13952,_binary '\0','/x7vXdeO3S3pTfwlkhyAOKNQLij5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120613',6.6,9898,'en','A Walk on the Moon','The world of a young housewife is turned upside down when she has an affair with a free-spirited blouse salesman.','/6aNMyAP82sDoVFmopFzGDWeVVne.jpg','1999-01-29',107,'Released','It was the summer of Woodstock... when she became the woman she always wanted to be.','A Walk on the Moon',28029,4.027,6.1,'wlb2pESsygo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13953,_binary '\0','/8zLS8p1tRyWFLRFfmgQq0j5WE6z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120616',7.1,508664,'en','The Mummy','Dashing legionnaire Rick O\'Connell stumbles upon the hidden ruins of Hamunaptra while in the midst of a battle to claim the area in 1920s Egypt. It has been over three thousand years since former High Priest Imhotep suffered a fate worse than death as a punishment for a forbidden love—along with a curse that guarantees eternal doom upon the world if he is ever awoken.','/yhIsVvcUm7QxzLfT6HW2wLf5ajY.jpg','1999-04-16',124,'Released','The sands will rise. The heavens will part. The power will be unleashed.','The Mummy',564,29.2354,6.996,'OGOBz4t7OXs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13954,_binary '\0','/54mzszGjQWMxByAF0nbYH3dBqZV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120617',6.7,4590,'en','Bravo Two Zero','When an elite eight-man British SAS team is dropped behind enemy lines, their mission is clear: take out Saddam Hussein\'s SCUD missile systems. But when communications are cut and the team finds themselves surrounded by Saddam\'s army, their only hope is to risk capture and torture in a desperate 185-kilometer run to the Syrian border. Based on the true story of a British Special Forces unit behind enemy lines during the Gulf War, Bravo Two Zero explores the tragedies and triumphs of men taken to the edge of survival in the Persian Gulf War.','/qYQnIBew0Tv2BPT0kpNSekxmAyr.jpg','1999-10-07',115,'Released',NULL,'Bravo Two Zero',116333,2.0102,5.896,'QA8Be3oyje0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13955,_binary '\0','/tJfAybe1M78AZ8e7059NRSeNkzr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120618',4.6,8819,'en','Breakfast of Champions','A millionaire car salesman who runs the biggest dealership in Midland City, Dwayne Hoover is a celebrity, loved and trusted by everyone. Then one day, he wakes up and realizes that his life is a total mess! But between the headaches posed by his pill-popping wife, a mistress who won\'t leave him alone, and a cross-dressing sales manager, Dwayne has picked a bad week for a midlife crisis.','/5uNVeZNt7qxDWLJAZ0PER03WtKE.jpg','1999-02-18',110,'Released','In a world gone mad, you can trust Dwayne Hoover.','Breakfast of Champions',12479,3.329,5,'ZUQzm3PxPGE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13956,_binary '\0','/c2FC0HuVkRIHqw5vHKuPVqsNcVj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120619',5,2234,'en','Break Up','Housewife Jimmy Dade stays with her violent husband, Frankie, even after his abuse leads to the loss of her hearing. When his car is found with an unidentifiable dead body inside, police officers John Box and Andrew Ramsey suspect Jimmy has killed him. But, after discovering her bank account has been emptied, Jimmy fears that Frankie is still alive, and she goes on the run -- with the police in pursuit.','/10VG3K8B0pJvtmpjQQIPgNVOAYK.jpg','1998-08-20',100,'Released','Silent Betrayal. Deadly Passion. Sweet Revenge.','Break Up',67849,1.5149,5.1,'yoPrceYzulg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13957,_binary '\0','/iwcvWOyT04GHLSevuFROL3SGSb6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120620',6.4,25318,'en','Brokedown Palace','Best friends Alice and Darlene take a trip to Thailand after graduating high school. In Thailand, they meet a captivating Australian man, who calls himself Nick Parks. Darlene is particularly smitten with Nick and convinces Alice to take Nick up on his offer to treat the two of them to what amounts to a day trip to Hong Kong. In the airport, the girls are seized by the police and shocked to discover that one of their bags contains heroin.','/pWxoggA0KCS5oMPDOjIDYZYzryE.jpg','1999-08-13',100,'Released','Their graduation present was a trip to paradise, but they never thought they would land in hell.','Brokedown Palace',17707,4.7714,6.4,'nAlQ9KhOQ-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13958,_binary '\0','/hwwFyowfcbLRVmRBOkvnABBNIOs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120623',7.2,341495,'en','A Bug\'s Life','On behalf of \"oppressed bugs everywhere,\" an inventive ant named Flik hires a troupe of warrior bugs to defend his bustling colony from a horde of freeloading grasshoppers led by the evil-minded Hopper.','/Ah3J9OJVc2CNCuH2zMydXy9fmIC.jpg','1998-11-25',95,'Released','An epic of miniature proportions.','A Bug\'s Life',9487,23.8266,6.983,'mE35XQFxbeo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13959,_binary '\0','/vloRX9TveaDPTLAoIw5cs90OhVO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120626',7.1,3662,'pt','Capitães de Abril','Story of the 1974 coup that overthrew the right-wing Portuguese dictatorship--which continued the fascist policies of long-time dictator Antonio Salazar--and of two young army captains who were involved in it.','/wNA8cPdwJRqr1O0iDNfMB6wmrHx.jpg','2000-04-21',123,'Released',NULL,'April Captains',54380,1.5542,6.6,'O2MJxj06kho','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13960,_binary '\0','/tOBqX2PMvlHel3MEwSMFo8BkZAA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120627',3.2,2605,'en','Carnival of Souls','A young woman is pursued in reality and in her subconscious by the sadistic carnival clown who raped and murdered her mother.','/k5gPDGcSOQh0W5W2Gfum3D9msCV.jpg','1998-08-21',87,'Released','Enter at your own risk!','Carnival of Souls',40341,1.7204,3.8,'oLk-C5NlhxQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13961,_binary '\0','/3eYkMSjWbvTaZso7ow5ub9ikNNq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120630',7.1,226929,'en','Chicken Run','The creators of Wallace & Gromit bring you an exciting and original story about a group of chickens determined to fly the coop–even if they can’t fly! It’s hardly poultry in motion when Rocky attempts to teach Ginger and her feathered friends to fly…but, with teamwork, determination and a little bit o’ cluck, the fearless flock plots one last attempt in a spectacular bid for freedom.','/8XgmIsbpVamdhwcNVsYzohFZTtT.jpg','2000-06-23',84,'Released','There\'s nothing more determined than poultry with a plan.','Chicken Run',7443,16.9756,6.852,'rUSoF2nwPw8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13962,_binary '\0','/lhpokM60CnLWcNETQqKMz2q9ryL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120631',7.1,87037,'en','EverAfter','Danielle, a vibrant young woman, was forced into servitude after the death of her father when she was a young girl. Danielle\'s stepmother, Rodmilla, is a heartless woman who forces Danielle to do the cooking and cleaning, while she tries to marry off the eldest of her two daughters to the prince. But Danielle\'s life takes a wonderful turn when, under the guise of a visiting royal, she meets the charming Prince Henry.','/9TspO5dThMBioF0DFrvy6YqrngH.jpg','1998-07-31',121,'Released','Desire. Defy. Escape.','EverAfter',9454,7.7543,7.5,'-AAyf5RSrmU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13963,_binary '\0','/pYl4YpepgRbr504D7ep58C5gMyF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120632',6.7,136029,'en','City of Angels','When a guardian angel – who invisibly watches over the citizens of Los Angeles – becomes captivated by a strong-willed heart surgeon, he ponders trading in his pure, otherworldly existence for a mortal life with his beloved. The couple embarks on a tender but forbidden romance spanning heaven and Earth.','/iuzxpUjHsbQJXV3kB9ZAdCimM60.jpg','1998-04-10',114,'Released','She didn\'t believe in angels until she fell in love with one.','City of Angels',795,11.4786,6.8,'ESy_QZFah2o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13964,_binary '\0','/vcI8kweLIpGv7jb9NWVunOyZ2O7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120633',6.6,32967,'en','A Civil Action','Jan Schlickmann is a cynical lawyer who goes out to \'get rid of\' a case, only to find out it is potentially worth millions. The case becomes his obsession, to the extent that he is willing to give up everything—including his career and his clients\' goals—in order to continue the case against all odds.','/2AVF1cjRGOfaB4oteSzxvHiQ3hR.jpg','1998-12-25',115,'Released','Justice has its price.','A Civil Action',9422,5.2355,6.5,'Y4WOo8IJzVg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13965,_binary '\0','/ozveofGraUFz6CHeYA5s6MLFYD0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120642',6.2,3282,'en','A Cool, Dry Place','Russell, a single father, balances his work as a lawyer with the care of his five-year-old son after his wife abandoned them. When she reappears creating turmoil, he must deal with his new love interest and the job opportunity of a lifetime.','/c1pyoTbc3xkLTIhPnj153CVUsRn.jpg','1998-04-03',97,'Released','love, sex and starting over...','A Cool, Dry Place',37272,3.1094,5.9,'u4CMadHVDKs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13966,_binary '\0','/570taJwYEkUnq6VnlayRewl5eKu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120643',6.3,4470,'en','Dancing at Lughnasa','Five unmarried sisters make the most of their simple existence in rural Ireland in the 1930s.','/6Rtf82SgyvN6QxtgHL3cmgIo1Lo.jpg','1998-09-04',96,'Released','Five sisters embrace the spirit of a people.','Dancing at Lughnasa',5332,2.744,6,'wuCWRknHxrE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13967,_binary '\0','/6CMGdj5mAnfPm7PPV2KF8rXJgmY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120645',4.2,3372,'en','Meet the Deedles','Two surfers end up as Yellowstone park rangers and have to stop a former ranger who is out for revenge.','/7hSCyqtYZ2ICMiV2rI5ZtZQTUnF.jpg','1998-03-27',93,'Released','To protect and surf.','Meet the Deedles',40688,2.8164,4.5,'-0BhquO1wk4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13968,_binary '\0','/idDE0lXV9ZuadIu3dQaqJoiZMFs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120646',6.3,23637,'en','The Deep End of the Ocean','A three-year-old boy disappears during his mother\'s high school reunion. Nine years later, by chance, he turns up in the town in which the family has just relocated.','/4Q8g9CfW7EiwxRCpLSDpOmcaEZb.jpg','1999-03-12',106,'Released','The search for her son was over. The search for her family was just beginning.','The Deep End of the Ocean',30943,5.7381,6.563,'mWa7nDm9Wdg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13969,_binary '\0','/pWmJBkdb0EMb3PSd2f9wjza0krb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120647',6.3,207652,'en','Deep Impact','A seven-mile-wide space rock is hurtling toward Earth, threatening to obliterate the planet. Now, it\'s up to the president of the United States to save the world. He appoints a tough-as-nails veteran astronaut to lead a joint American-Russian crew into space to destroy the comet before impact. Meanwhile, an enterprising reporter uses her smarts to uncover the scoop of the century.','/a3vQS7JKqlOb3MdVJHuTCP9s7Mg.jpg','1998-05-08',122,'Released','Oceans rise. Cities fall. Hope survives.','Deep Impact',8656,15.0915,6.3,'XfcoWexWCzc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13970,_binary '\0','/kFS9s5jBpGkEBIMXEvLkkmhpts5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120654',6.4,33369,'en','Dirty Work','Unemployed and recently dumped, Mitch and his buddy Sam start a revenge-for-hire business to raise the $50,000 that Sam\'s father needs to get a heart transplant.','/r6OcS6TQCHal2wHooJhHWSlFzfd.jpg','1998-06-12',82,'Released','Revenge is sweet. (And surprisingly affordable.)','Dirty Work',14577,5.4555,6.227,'UGO59S2mabY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13971,_binary '\0','/nljRWpjfmqh5qYxcblFoazU5eYY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120655',7.3,242787,'en','Dogma','An abortion clinic worker with a special heritage is called upon to save the existence of humanity from being negated by two renegade angels trying to exploit a loophole and re-enter Heaven.','/oxhHl2YokTqcP44QK5tiTgjgLgk.jpg','1999-10-04',130,'Released','Get \"touched\" by an angel.','Dogma',1832,8.1968,6.9,'rwSRribTgdA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13972,_binary '\0','/sjZIN2oDzOLGYuz21QwWw1tJ8ly.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120657',6.6,140465,'en','The 13th Warrior','A Muslim ambassador exiled from his homeland joins a group of Vikings, initially offended by their behavior but growing to respect them. As they travel together, they learn of a legendary evil closing in and must unite to confront this formidable force.','/pj1IQQ7ajwaOrjjTCxyM1L4mSnX.jpg','1999-08-13',103,'Released','Prey for the living.','The 13th Warrior',1911,12.1659,6.714,'RikXt796p2o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13973,_binary '\0','/lPLTLCBn39Wiy1RPQLB9xOKyF2v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120660',7.3,277017,'en','Enemy of the State','When the videotape of the murder of a congressman unknowingly ends up in the hands of labor lawyer and dedicated family man Robert Clayton Dean, he is framed for the murder. With the help of the mysterious Brill, Dean attempts to throw the NSA off his trail and prove his innocence.','/x9pXrMKLsBGGOFyyZ0Gwt9YpVub.jpg','1998-11-20',132,'Released','It\'s not paranoia if they\'re really after you.','Enemy of the State',9798,13.7006,7.08,'a3mrRv-1khI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13974,_binary '\0','/em3VJhxB2YOKtWyRT3g54tyo8D9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120662',5,16696,'en','Eye of the Beholder','A reclusive surveillance expert is hired to spy on a mysterious blackmailer, who just may be a serial killer.','/4eB1Gw5r3Etbe4su6PhOo6OAN9E.jpg','1999-11-24',109,'Released','Obsession is in the eye of the beholder.','Eye of the Beholder',18681,4.2868,4.9,'5E--MQm-AdE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13975,_binary '\0','/aC6wW62V6b0csr5iUnbOjYAqfhg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120663',7.5,438583,'en','Eyes Wide Shut','After Dr. Bill Harford\'s wife, Alice, admits to having sexual fantasies about a man she met, Bill becomes obsessed with having a sexual encounter. He discovers an underground sexual group and attends one of their meetings -- and quickly discovers that he is in over his head.','/knEIz1eNGl5MQDbrEAVWA7iRqF9.jpg','1999-07-16',159,'Released','No dream is ever just a dream.','Eyes Wide Shut',345,26.8452,7.5,'VSS47StLOhk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13976,_binary '\0','/qq9ELjoyllBUMkGisZvcj0fCd43.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120667',5.7,379073,'en','Fantastic Four','During a space voyage, four scientists are altered by cosmic rays: Reed Richards gains the ability to stretch his body; Sue Storm can become invisible; Johnny Storm controls fire; and Ben Grimm is turned into a super-strong … thing. Together, these \"Fantastic Four\" must now thwart the evil plans of Dr. Doom and save the world from certain destruction.','/4YMcYEFS8sFuW3soP1HVmgR3cSm.jpg','2005-06-29',106,'Released','4 times the action. 4 times the adventure. 4 times the fantastic.','Fantastic Four',9738,18.9805,5.811,'QIx2jkXYu34','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13977,_binary '\0','/qJaR9AZx2Qq2oJ3krnSO0Z5ne5I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120669',7.4,321728,'en','Fear and Loathing in Las Vegas','Raoul Duke and his attorney Dr. Gonzo drive a red convertible across the Mojave desert to Las Vegas with a suitcase full of drugs to cover a motorcycle race. As their consumption of drugs increases at an alarming rate, the stoned duo trash their hotel room and fear legal repercussions. Duke begins to drive back to L.A., but after an odd run-in with a cop, he returns to Sin City and continues his wild drug binge.','/tisNLcMkxryU2zxhi0PiyDFqhm0.jpg','1998-05-22',118,'Released','Buy the ticket, take the ride.','Fear and Loathing in Las Vegas',1878,12.312,7.2,'Rx-EsbhLZLQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13978,_binary '\0','/gqySr87GFNjNX3sPwRAiPzt1O05.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120670',4.9,4595,'en','Firestorm','Firefighter Jesse Graves has to save ornithologist Jennifer and other people caught in a forest fire, which was set up by the lawyer of convicted killer Earl Shaye, who escaped from the prison with several of his inmates posing as firefighters to recover $37,000,000 in stashed loot.','/joAzHTg4xoz56zQ7AntfTYENuAD.jpg','1998-01-08',89,'Released','Fight fire with fire.','Firestorm',41417,2.157,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13979,_binary '\0','/fheyOmaLi8m5Iv3C83A5HQMqwUv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120678',5,3365,'en','Free Money','A deranged prison warden with a nasty habit of killing escapees forces the boyfriends of his teenage twin daughters into a shotgun wedding, after they claim to be pregnant. All hope seems lost, until the husbands hatch a madcap plan to rob a money train to freedom.','/rthoTWBsSiaSdtQGwgvr1HcAweT.jpg','1998-12-03',93,'Released','Right scheme, wrong guys!','Free Money',30712,3.187,5.409,'obsNbp3D4og','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13980,_binary '\0','/gcGaSXzmodu53ABb0wOWrVWjKeg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120679',7.3,102070,'en','Frida','A biography of artist Frida Kahlo, who channeled the pain of a crippling injury and her tempestuous marriage into her work.','/a4hgR6aKoohB6MHni171jbi9BkU.jpg','2002-08-29',123,'Released','Prepare to be seduced.','Frida',1360,5.3871,7.4,'-CTM7FcY1LE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13981,_binary '\0','/bHKj3m3eLlU2wJQBlAs7wv6ZMBv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120681',6.7,173056,'en','From Hell','Frederick Abberline is an opium-huffing inspector from Scotland Yard who falls for one of Jack the Ripper\'s prostitute targets in this Hughes brothers adaption of a graphic novel that posits the Ripper\'s true identity.','/t2WpWM8nBO4sULXr2bDfNEt4qgr.jpg','2001-02-08',122,'Released','More than the legend will survive.','From Hell',768,7.5613,6.7,'7gJQRKQjvrU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13982,_binary '\0','/6rlOgCIxCuJj1cmlPcaBekgQuRb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120683',5.2,6679,'en','Gloria','After serving a prison term for her boyfriend, a streetwise, middle-aged moll named Gloria stands up against the mobs, which is complicated by a six-year-old urchin with a will of his own, whom she reluctantly takes under her wing after his family has been gunned down.','/1AKAfnT3nm7asU9qyNT6gtS1vbe.jpg','1999-01-22',108,'Released','Gloria. Big mouth. Big attitude. But who knew she had a big heart.','Gloria',45712,2.6187,5.921,'hld5iJyUJ4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13983,_binary '\0','/v1HOjtXoGwQz26fT4elHeNT0JnW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120684',7.3,34494,'en','Gods and Monsters','It\'s 1957, and James Whale\'s heyday as the director of \"Frankenstein,\" \"Bride of Frankenstein\" and \"The Invisible Man\" is long behind him. Retired and a semi-recluse, he lives his days accompanied only by images from his past. When his dour housekeeper, Hannah, hires a handsome young gardener, the flamboyant director and simple yard man develop an unlikely friendship, which will change them forever.','/awvJH3NtXoStsjAtXKr99hfuVaG.jpg','1998-09-12',105,'Released','A portrait of an outrageous friendship.','Gods and Monsters',3033,4.6332,6.9,'Nn2G6YrvibM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13984,_binary '\0','/p2wRmV9WbzPLdgd1HoeqdZeuBXi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120685',5.5,214830,'en','Godzilla','French nuclear tests irradiate an iguana into a giant monster that viciously attacks freighter ships in the Pacific Ocean. A team of experts, including Niko Tatopoulos, conclude that the oversized reptile is the culprit. Before long, the giant lizard is loose in Manhattan as the US military races to destroy the monster before it reproduces and it\'s spawn takes over the world.','/xJVl1I95StraYAwaNbBkVoWE2qA.jpg','1998-05-20',138,'Released','Size does matter.','Godzilla',929,14.3543,5.7,'3FEDcXsL5o8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13985,_binary '\0','/iteE4cNHQm8PWmWDuKcCCnMLhS3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120686',6.8,81155,'en','Stepmom','Jackie is a divorced mother of two. Isabel is the career minded girlfriend of Jackie’s ex-husband Luke, forced into the role of unwelcome stepmother to their children. But when Jackie discovers she is ill, both women realise they must put aside their differences to find a common ground and celebrate life to the fullest, while they have the chance.','/wMPv2Yz6QDzv6YhSbaqM48Medl1.jpg','1998-12-25',125,'Released','Be there for the joy. Be there for the tears. Be there for each other.','Stepmom',9441,9.6025,7.156,'QNUu1d7i26g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13986,_binary '\0','/3EHrfyZ8GZqJLviBlSCvmXryh4z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120687',6.2,3329,'en','The Governess','When the father of privileged Rosina da Silva violently dies, she decides to pass herself off as a gentile and finds employment with a family in faraway Scotland. Soon she and the family father, Charles, start a passionate secret affair.','/xi1nfYolXIJI6bV8YGq1Zv7XwTz.jpg','1998-07-31',115,'Released',NULL,'The Governess',96196,1.6061,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13987,_binary '\0','/amZavErrjrdgDwhsIdpWxHNenIx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120689',8.6,1584775,'en','The Green Mile','A supernatural tale set on death row in a Southern prison, where gentle giant John Coffey possesses the mysterious power to heal people\'s ailments. When the cell block\'s head guard, Paul Edgecomb, recognizes Coffey\'s miraculous gift, he tries desperately to help stave off the condemned man\'s execution.','/8VG8fDNiy50H4FedGwdSVUPoaJe.jpg','1999-12-10',189,'Released','Paul Edgecomb didn\'t believe in miracles. Until the day he met one.','The Green Mile',497,41.0759,8.506,'Bg7epsq0OIQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13988,_binary '\0','/7ICPss8rtKmjda2kL9V5aVIjd9g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120692',6.7,8191,'en','Strike!','In 1963 New England, a group of friends at an all-girls academy learn that they\'re going to be combined with a nearby all-boys institution. They concoct a plan to save their school while dealing with everyday problems along the way.','/cCr8mLqIVkbjBNs1uaZPvkXYnWA.jpg','1998-08-21',97,'Released','Get ready for a radical education.','Strike!',19381,2.7802,6.372,'gWZ-NsM5okY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13989,_binary '\0','/yl7M1buWaxXXhZv0bSbi4MPYVKm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120693',6.6,71573,'en','Half Baked','Three lovable party buds try to bail their friend out of jail. But just when the guys have mastered a plan, everything comes dangerously close to going up in smoke.','/14TmEac4bquNaEld9t0uIliYoKE.jpg','1998-01-16',82,'Released','They\'ll do anything to save their best bud.','Half Baked',9490,5.0948,6.311,'0v3Azrz5bJs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13990,_binary '\0','/A1LU0zDxrEhtMYpqDHbXkBJT6aP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120694',5.8,89465,'en','Halloween H20: 20 Years Later','Two decades after surviving a massacre on October 31, 1978, former baby sitter Laurie Strode finds herself hunted by persistent knife-wielder Michael Myers. Laurie now lives in Northern California under an assumed name, where she works as the headmistress of a private school. But it\'s not far enough to escape Myers, who soon discovers her whereabouts. As Halloween descends upon Laurie\'s peaceful community, a feeling of dread weighs upon her -- with good reason.','/lqLXUm3oK59sGJKRH2Zjj2m3iMg.jpg','1998-08-05',86,'Released','This summer, terror won\'t be taking a vacation.','Halloween H20: 20 Years Later',11675,8.0649,6.049,'xMpeZ1BXEO4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13991,_binary '\0','/tdo5GwYAsdRkYTTMpXM9aZu8DlH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120696',5.9,38764,'en','Hard Rain','An armored car driver tries to elude a gang of thieves while a flood ravages the countryside.','/ggMcOVSax4lBXjYqqQUJLCtrar3.jpg','1998-01-16',97,'Released','A simple plan. An instant fortune. Just add water.','Hard Rain',11258,7.314,5.874,'FOPWoK-tpYU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13992,_binary '\0','/ufl4p5BmfhvJhUOC0iP92h54IRx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120699',6.1,4878,'en','The Hi-Lo Country','An intimate story of the enduring bond of friendship between two hard-living men, set against a sweeping backdrop: the American West, post-World War II, in its twilight. Pete and Big Boy are masters of the prairie, but ultimately face trickier terrain: the human heart.','/1bC63XzaUEWJArFUQFKwUy77lZS.jpg','1998-12-30',114,'Released','A woman like Mona can drive men to extremes.','The Hi-Lo Country',1363,3.5926,6,'-rNp9JqQ7NY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13993,_binary '\0','/bab3M73GxIf0UfxPeXG1GsGjnXu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120701',5,21968,'en','Holy Man','In a world governed by commerce, Ricky and Kate, dedicated employees, find their lives forever changed when they encounter the enigmatic stranger G. As they navigate the realm of commerce, their paths intertwine in a surreal dance of love, loss, and redemption. G\'s presence, amplified through the pervasive influence of globalized television, casts a spell that reverberates beyond Ricky and Kate, impacting the lives of those who bear witness to their intertwined destinies.','/sfJBsOdSbgLLarO6GIS0dWzFcCv.jpg','1998-10-08',114,'Released','God\'s gift to home shopping.','Holy Man',9713,3.2481,5.2,'7e3YGlFWtDs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13994,_binary '\0','/sW9lF5r5riUk6X1Dgy6xsnVaMSP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120703',5.8,9040,'en','How Stella Got Her Groove Back','Through good times and bad, Stella and Delilah have always had each other. Now, Stella\'s so busy building a life that she\'s forgotten how to really live. But Delilah is about to change all that. What starts as a quick trip to Jamaica, ends as an exhilarating voyage of self discovery as Stella learns to open her heart and find love – even if it\'s with a man 20 years her junior.','/ygmuaJDLYxWJo8eNhq0A63hagrQ.jpg','1998-08-14',124,'Released','Sometimes you have to break the rules to free your heart.','How Stella Got Her Groove Back',33644,3.5355,5.8,'0eF0BYJM1FY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13995,_binary '\0','/2jY2PNtMalZbyZjQpGVzL7wP1AR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120706',7.2,9864,'en','The General','The real-life story of Dublin folk hero and criminal Martin Cahill, who pulled off two daring robberies in Ireland with his team, but attracted unwanted attention from the police, the I.R.A., the U.V.F., and members of his own team.','/3UUR2Evm2JtC2odd2UMYgs9Yi1x.jpg','1998-05-01',124,'Released','The extraordinary true story of the rise and fall of the gangster, Martin Cahill.','The General',16885,2.0532,6.694,'PR6P6KMDUD0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13996,_binary '\0','/i5PZiTBdvt4lDmpwAnMso0bAiWs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120709',6,1815,'en','Illuminata','It\'s the start of the 20th century, and Tuccio, resident playwright of a theatre repertory company offers the owners of the company his new play, \"Illuminata\". They reject it, saying it\'s not finished, and intrigue starts that involves influential critic Bevalaqua, theatre star Celimene, young lead actors and other theatre residents','/vovb7pbU3CkKjfcmOxwz7AMbpCX.jpg','1998-05-21',119,'Released','The Story of Imperfect Love…','Illuminata',91076,1.286,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13997,_binary '\0','/opESjJxA10pGES8hod8YK2Gi4ug.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120710',5.5,14234,'en','In Dreams','A suburban housewife learns that she has psychic connections to a serial killer, and can predict this person\'s motives through her dreams.','/q3Q00fCgeZGjAYaiwbfTMuIrUb0.jpg','1999-01-15',100,'Released','You don\'t have to sleep to dream','In Dreams',28902,3.4987,5.5,'DHHPY9u6RQM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13998,_binary '\0','/3iKILr9RSZbDVJDKjLBgosl8o0s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120711',7.7,8753,'en','Babylon 5: In the Beginning','Londo Mollari, the Centauri Emperor, recounts the initial contact between the Humans and Minbari, which resulted in a major incident and subsequent war, for an eager pair of youngsters wanting a story about love and conflict.','/iFum9eQ5DztNMGE1c1CFm01SnJt.jpg','1998-01-04',94,'Released',NULL,'Babylon 5: In the Beginning',10940,3.1976,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(13999,_binary '\0','/1uoPMtx4VHqdfFS33Mxo14W9Xny.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120714',7,9332,'en','The Interview','A duel between a suspected murderer and a detective pressed by people who want results. But whose skin is really wanted?','/yW462Tqs3pGcYFaNAAYlsfeDpcG.jpg','1998-03-03',104,'Released','Two minds... one truth.','The Interview',19846,1.6025,6.8,'FB7VFNQXsdI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14000,_binary '\0','/pRYrWzkFqtPUwfEXQcnyvSVRK81.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120716',6.5,17544,'en','Jakob the Liar','In 1944 Poland, a Jewish shop keeper named Jakob is summoned to ghetto headquarters after being caught out after curfew. While waiting for the German Kommondant, Jakob overhears a German radio broadcast about Russian troop movements. Returned to the ghetto, the shopkeeper shares his information with a friend and then rumors fly that there is a secret radio within the ghetto.','/vvwsvPyQFuQbKKfzNgoRhAcL5ml.jpg','1999-09-16',120,'Released','When all hope was lost, he invented it.','Jakob the Liar',2290,4.3256,6.7,'4L2n2DyXL4M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14001,_binary '\0','/V75E91kcObuMD83BcQXUE5IKei.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120722',6.5,5220,'en','Living Out Loud','Judith Moore is suddenly single after discovering her husband of fifteen years, a successful doctor, has been having an affair with a younger woman. Judith stews, plans, plots and fantasizes, but she can\'t decide what to do with her life until she goes out to a night club to see singer Liz Bailey, who is full of advice on life and love. While out on the town, Judith is suddenly kissed by a total stranger, which opens her eyes to new possibilities... which is when she notices Pat, the elevator operator in her building.','/uegG68vP7leUDQbG8fP4ihgTo0i.jpg','1998-10-30',100,'Released',NULL,'Living Out Loud',46889,2.8153,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14002,_binary '\0','/waNupov4rdxPP0oLcf2EC75DMRL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120723',5.6,5320,'en','Kissing a Fool','An egotistical television personality enlists the assistance of his best friend in putting the fidelity of his fiancé to the test in this amiable comedy of the sexes. Told in flashback, the film takes a familiar love-triangle scenario and gives it a bitter twist. With a bride who seems too good for either suitor, the film is sustained by one question - who will she choose?','/aOHkDefwdH9YxGqeZDEbo9CcGzq.jpg','1998-02-27',93,'Released','May the best man win.','Kissing a Fool',15513,2.3768,5.5,'N9NDFMpxZW4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14003,_binary '\0','/cQrq7h8Giz6pDg1jH6kCAjLqI7m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120724',4.9,17658,'en','Knock Off','A fashion designer and his CIA agent business partner must join forces to stop a group of terrorists from smuggling explosives in counterfeit jeans during the handover of Hong Kong.','/hK7hKDA51FCbtFCuXZNiQ6gPq3S.jpg','1998-09-04',91,'Released','There is no substitute.','Knock Off',37498,4.3978,5.37,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14004,_binary '\0','/eBd8v9XCymp6z6hUwLyLVJAPB4d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120725',5.1,6643,'en','Krippendorf\'s Tribe','After squandering his grant money, despondent and recently widowed anthropologist James Krippendorf must produce hard evidence of the existence of a heretofore undiscovered New Guinea tribe. Grass skirts, makeup, and staged rituals transform his three troubled children into the Shelmikedmu, a primitive culture whose habits enthrall scholars. But when a spiteful rival threatens to blow the whistle on Krippendorf\'s ruse, he gets into the act as well.','/i8OUyPxAQsfylzAgSmAASSaKSeM.jpg','1998-02-27',94,'Released','He\'s discovered the wildest tribe in his own backyard!','Krippendorf\'s Tribe',31220,3.2564,4.6,'ZBqnBoQlD54','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14005,_binary '\0','/fUsBSXkii0e4sEyEkXiPWXIpnuT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120728',6.7,15328,'en','The Last Days of Disco','Two young women and their friends spend spare time at an exclusive nightclub in 1980s New York.','/lReaAZCsA0GXvJrxzSMsFxwgh6F.jpg','1998-05-29',113,'Released','History is made at night.','The Last Days of Disco',16980,4.6182,6.3,'QouayPT1DDY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14006,_binary '\0','/muSeX7fnNw0pv4zHK7RSwZln6Hk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120731',8,74277,'it','La leggenda del pianista sull\'oceano','Musician Max Tooney goes to sell his prized Conn trumpet to a music shop, where he plays the instrument one last time. The shopkeeper recognises the song as one on a record matrix he found and asks who the piece is by. Tooney tells the story of an infant found abandoned in the first class dining room of the four-stacker ocean-liner SS Virginian on 1 January 1900. Danny Boodman, a coal-man from the boiler room, names the boy Danny Boodman T. D. Lemon 1900, after himself, the fruit crate the boy was found in, and the year, and raises him as his own.','/iOcbJ5pxokOPDRgieVDbsFMrCc6.jpg','1998-10-28',170,'Released','An epic story of a man who could do anything... except be ordinary','The Legend of 1900',10376,8.2806,8.233,'jqhbOiF9-8g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14007,_binary '\0','/cXQH2u7wUIX1eoIdEj51kHXoWhX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120735',8.1,654245,'en','Lock, Stock and Two Smoking Barrels','A card shark and his unwillingly-enlisted friends need to make a lot of cash quick after losing a sketchy poker match. To do this they decide to pull a heist on a small-time gang who happen to be operating out of the flat next door.','/6pJB2t3MbQUy9m5pFIBHXLqnqNd.jpg','1998-08-28',105,'Released','A Disgrace to Criminals Everywhere.','Lock, Stock and Two Smoking Barrels',100,8.469,8.1,'HY7mRdQuUSw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14008,_binary '\0','/oiwc338EoBgS4sEI2ixAny4KQKg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120737',8.9,2236516,'en','The Lord of the Rings: The Fellowship of the Ring','Young hobbit Frodo Baggins, after inheriting a mysterious ring from his uncle Bilbo, must leave his home in order to keep it from falling into the hands of its evil creator. Along the way, a fellowship is formed to protect the ringbearer and make sure that the ring arrives at its final destination: Mt. Doom, the only place where it can be destroyed.','/6oom5QYQ2yQTMJIbnvbkBL9cHo6.jpg','2001-12-18',179,'Released','One ring to rule them all.','The Lord of the Rings: The Fellowship of the Ring',120,53.546,8.445,'_nZdmwHrcnw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14009,_binary '\0','/qu0HXKZBsugBiHJm4QZdFiSrvPi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120738',5.3,78149,'en','Lost in Space','The prospects for continuing life on Earth in the year 2058 are grim. So the Robinsons are launched into space to colonize Alpha Prime, the only other inhabitable planet in the galaxy. But when a stowaway sabotages the mission, the Robinsons find themselves hurtling through uncharted space.','/fCocPDUFuKswY2GxDdfYsT9BXMd.jpg','1998-04-03',130,'Released','Danger, Will Robinson!','Lost in Space',2157,8.7527,5.4,'R7qXvZz-Ymo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14010,_binary '\0','/fyhxTKsJ3x47z9rgMvkqL1haT6S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120741',5.6,16798,'en','Jane Austen\'s Mafia!','After growing up poor in Salmonella, Vincenzo Cortino installs himself as the preeminent, if bumbling, Mafia don of the New World. But now he must pass on power to one of his two sons: either level-headed veteran Anthony or vituperative loose cannon Joey.','/gGgirOcInrfjWgemKMjvZc3fGtU.jpg','1998-07-24',84,'Released','See it early. Avoid the mob.','Jane Austen\'s Mafia!',9835,4.1747,5.5,'afiNZtmIKNE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14011,_binary '\0','/16r4Dz5graaCCnpDAxRoSfmzpCx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120742',4.7,8750,'en','Major League: Back to the Minors','At the behest of Roger Dorn -- the Minnesota Twins\' silver-tongued new owner -- washed-up minor league hurler Gus Cantrell steps up to the plate to take over as skipper of the club\'s hapless farm team. But little does he know that Dorn has an ulterior motive to generate publicity with a grudge match between the big leaguers and their ragtag Triple A affiliate.','/bxaSidfXSEVw5zM5378m6tm7H51.jpg','1998-04-17',100,'Released','They\'re just nine players short of a dream team.','Major League: Back to the Minors',9771,2.8752,5,'o6-wczHGRHk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14012,_binary '\0','/uhhtglfXNaTavkKtjer38qHLfVi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120744',6.5,192428,'en','The Man in the Iron Mask','Years have passed since the Three Musketeers, Aramis, Athos and Porthos, have fought together with their friend, D\'Artagnan. But with the tyrannical King Louis using his power to wreak havoc in the kingdom while his twin brother, Philippe, remains imprisoned, the Musketeers reunite to abduct Louis and replace him with Philippe.','/zHE9yRURvA7DyhYtQxkGTfE1Ywi.jpg','1998-03-12',132,'Released','For the honor of a king. And the destiny of a country. All for one.','The Man in the Iron Mask',9313,11.7578,6.7,'gnNt7l2nA_o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14013,_binary '\0','/hthzCwZ1inzSCSjf3SUn9S6C26d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120746',6.8,212176,'en','The Mask of Zorro','It has been twenty years since Don Diego de la Vega fought Spanish oppression in Alta California as the legendary romantic hero, Zorro. Having escaped from prison he transforms troubled bandit Alejandro into his successor, in order to foil the plans of the tyrannical Don Rafael Montero who robbed him of his freedom, his wife and his precious daughter.','/bdMufwGDDzqu4kTSQwrKc5WR4bu.jpg','1998-07-16',138,'Released','No one has seen his face... but everyone... knows this mark.','The Mask of Zorro',9342,16.0748,6.581,'abwtRFZx8Rs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14014,_binary '\0','/jeglAYl7Z8vlQycRDhEqdAomlvM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120747',6.4,4850,'en','Martha – Meet Frank, Daniel and Laurence','Laurence recounts to his neighbour how his life long friendship with Frank and Daniel has been overturned in just three days by their each independently meeting, and falling for, Martha, who has no idea of their connection. Slowly the tale unfolds, the narrative moving backwards and forwards gradually filling in the gaps until we see the whole picture','/5BdJ9K9NGpbCSmjIZpuZJgMf4ie.jpg','1998-05-08',88,'Released','Two\'s Company. Three\'s a Crowd. Four\'s a Disaster.','The Very Thought of You',6373,2.2595,5.7,'ALGEs4RTgio','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14015,_binary '\0','/5EkowLSlfQT50KbeHzhvbdyaIoI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120749',6.1,81919,'en','Mercury Rising','Renegade FBI agent Art Jeffries protects a nine-year-old autistic boy who has cracked the government\'s new \"unbreakable\" code.','/60AAso6I2TzQCy2SjqtzPni8csA.jpg','1998-04-03',111,'Released','Someone knows too much.','Mercury Rising',8838,10.2826,6.3,'jkAGQJZFEmg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14016,_binary '\0','/dkNjhkEk2tw7hoxx7Ik1YQsdenZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120751',5.7,32892,'en','Mighty Joe Young','As a child living in Africa, Jill Young saw her mother killed while protecting wild gorillas from poachers led by Andrei Strasser. Now an adult, Jill cares for an orphaned gorilla named Joe -- who, due to a genetic anomaly, is 15 feet tall. When Gregg O\'Hara arrives from California and sees the animal, he convinces Jill that Joe would be safest at his wildlife refuge. But Strasser follows them to the U.S., intent on capturing Joe for himself.','/jM39MOyLOxCD6Njz4vfQkGaKkY1.jpg','1998-12-25',114,'Released','Survival is an instinct.','Mighty Joe Young',9822,7.9846,6.3,'3tPWHp2KZoY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14017,_binary '\0','/2gUFXKuuJwCYMFAJ1xxy34kI3SM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120753',5.7,23352,'en','The Million Dollar Hotel','A federal agent searches for a potential killer among the bizarre residents of a dilapidated Los Angeles hotel.','/iGRyPsZF0lfIL3IadmBdoAsYzyn.jpg','2000-02-09',122,'Released','Everyone has something to hide.','The Million Dollar Hotel',318,4.3589,5.9,'S4Ft6C8LTKU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14018,_binary '\0','/24DZfupDlhXeTchmcOkoGRhP5Vg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120755',6.1,418348,'en','Mission: Impossible II','With computer genius Luther Stickell at his side and a beautiful thief on his mind, agent Ethan Hunt races across Australia and Spain to stop a former IMF agent from unleashing a genetically engineered biological weapon called Chimera. This mission, should Hunt choose to accept it, plunges him into the center of an international crisis of terrifying magnitude.','/hfnrual76gPeNFduhD4xzHWpfTw.jpg','2000-05-24',123,'Released','Expect the impossible again.','Mission: Impossible II',955,17.7855,6.139,'hSPtsCQq52k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14019,_binary '\0','/cT2sUrROSnypjozsxInp3swZzsH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120757',4.4,9915,'en','The Mod Squad','Three youthful delinquents escape conviction for their crimes by teaming with the LAPD.','/7c20VEblNKkDiBuA6bE6kbeHqHa.jpg','1999-03-26',92,'Released','First they broke the law. Now they are the law.','The Mod Squad',16379,2.8108,4.4,'PacWyC2OyCM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14020,_binary '\0','/mUYV0ZdsDEliGaQahcQH1F3grsP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120762',7.7,351073,'en','Mulan','When Imperial China calls one man from every family to defend the empire from invading Huns, a young woman disguises herself as a soldier to take her ailing father’s place. Facing ruthless invaders, brutal training, and the risk of execution if discovered, she must decide who she truly is— and what she’s willing to fight for.','/jAbexAtB0aSfP5Ay4TpWHARyVnG.jpg','1998-06-18',88,'Released','The flower that blooms in adversity is the most rare and beautiful of all.','Mulan',10674,23.8905,7.902,'2z2KsFZs-8I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14021,_binary '\0','/1viDPGEPpEZBVwuIotnaXBQNyGQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120764',5.1,15255,'en','My Favorite Martian','Ambitious television reporter Tim O\'Hara stumbles upon a martian whose spaceship has accidentally crashed on Earth. Thinking this is his ticket to a Pulitzer Prize, Tim makes plans to expose the martian, who, posing as Tim\'s Uncle Martin, takes human form and has plans of his own. In fact, all of Tim\'s efforts to divulge the truth are systematically thwarted by the resourceful alien, who ultimately recruits Tim to help him repair his ship for a return to Mars.','/pOp4xriDEFUy2uN0BfnHJcjzqWt.jpg','1999-02-11',94,'Released','The martian has landed. There goes the neighborhood.','My Favorite Martian',9849,5.7838,5.7,'VXZ-b-ZB7Rw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14022,_binary '\0','/kzEjJ6kKQFtvhWkBafLKvcsRhTU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120765',5,7506,'en','My Giant','Sammy, an agitated agent lost in the forest of the modern world, happens upon a gentle giant with a tall talent for friendship named Max.','/49ylsG7JJFjNRlKTOdMQTgcI7om.jpg','1998-04-10',103,'Released','A comedy of incredible proportions.','My Giant',47881,2.2203,5.4,'h5Jb1kYRewk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14023,_binary '\0','/y4TbQOC9DCzZop9HwKuX73rKbYO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120768',7.3,170921,'en','The Negotiator','The police try to arrest expert hostage negotiator Danny Roman, who insists he\'s being framed for his partner\'s murder in what he believes is an elaborate conspiracy. Thinking there\'s evidence in the Internal Affairs offices that might clear him, he takes everyone in the office hostage and demands that another well-known negotiator be brought in to handle the situation and secretly investigate the conspiracy.','/dUMHEymATOGbs2K3E4dmNSVBgFQ.jpg','1998-07-29',140,'Released','He frees hostages for a living. Now he\'s taking hostages to survive.','The Negotiator',9631,14.042,7.115,'LJ1pS1W0XXg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14024,_binary '\0','/nw0xlXxry89BlsErsuOMSIuxloq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120769',6.1,13292,'en','The Newton Boys','The story of the Newton gang, the most successful bank robbers in history, owing to their good planning and minimal violence.','/v3VuDClmFZNjfI6YLTkeinae9HK.jpg','1998-03-26',122,'Released','History is about to catch up with America\'s most successful bank robbers.','The Newton Boys',42807,3.5285,6.1,'MSiIVMi1A08','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14025,_binary '\0','/ygc5qt7mxtsPljY2W9LAbZWFDGb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120770',6.2,69654,'en','A Night at the Roxbury','Despite being well into adulthood, brothers Doug and Steve Butabi still live at home and work in the flower shop owned by their dad. They exist only to hit on women at discos, though they\'re routinely unsuccessful until a chance run-in with Richard Grieco gets them inside the swank Roxbury club. Mistaken for high rollers, they meet their dream women, Vivica and Cambi, and resolve to open a club of their own.','/7oZ5xE4AL4D5EbeQUaoRxahgzJX.jpg','1998-10-01',82,'Released','Score!','A Night at the Roxbury',9429,6.6168,6.556,'Xvl3qJe9L9g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14026,_binary '\0','/9ItSJKC4O77Uk2yULvSYdV6F171.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120772',6,22785,'en','The Object of My Affection','A pregnant New York social worker begins to develop romantic feelings for her gay best friend, and decides she\'d rather raise her child with him, much to the dismay of her overbearing boyfriend.','/2mA6QEdzhsftNIFV11SGsQLJvJR.jpg','1998-04-17',111,'Released','A love story that could only happen between best friends.','The Object of My Affection',17127,5.3641,5.825,'gPKp-jE93VU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14027,_binary '\0','/hJQ8SRUp8DgNaqgszlwh9RUUXJB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120773',6.5,11526,'en','The Odd Couple II','Brucey, the son of Oscar, calls his father to invite him to his wedding to Felix\'s daughter next Sunday in California. Oscar and Felix meet again at Los Angeles International Airport and rent a car in order to go to San Malina for the wedding.','/aTajf9LOrL1pok7KnzoHKFJJyWD.jpg','1998-04-09',97,'Released','Some arguments stand the test of time.','The Odd Couple II',27472,3.7063,6.296,'BSsjfuxlTu0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14028,_binary '\0','/mxA7pexWSgMbtLDn15zijxckuus.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120775',6,1440,'en','One Man\'s Hero','One Man\'s Hero tells the little-known story of the \"St. Patrick\'s Battalion\" or \"San Patricios,\" a group of mostly Irish and other immigrants of the Catholic faith who deserted to Mexico after encountering religious and ethnic prejudice in the U.S. Army during the Mexican-American War. The plot centers around the personal story of John Riley, an Irishman who had been a sergeant in the American Army who is commissioned as a captain in the Mexican army and commands the battalion, as he leads his men in battle and struggles with authorities on both sides of the border','/6QbunsUllQT0aQWWgMBnSlqwrfF.jpg','1999-08-02',121,'Released','One man\'s hero is another man\'s traitor.','One Man\'s Hero',69848,2.8832,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14029,_binary '\0','/4IrOhjmbvDcl4czUTB15CLfKtL0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120776',6.9,13463,'en','One True Thing','A career woman reassesses her parents\' lives after she is forced to care for her cancer-stricken mother.','/hOYQIMtrqVeHUBe999V1KIqO7Gf.jpg','1998-09-18',127,'Released','Love What You Have.','One True Thing',53113,3.7262,6.5,'lXJv1BQr1iI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14030,_binary '\0','/fw4mgfiq01d0SQduEqKjnh3xzbs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120777',6.4,22337,'en','The Opposite of Sex','A 16-year-old girl visits her gay half-brother and ends up seducing his boyfriend, thus wreaking havoc on all of their lives.','/e0rNtvIlcd8c0WChSsVC0W8Bvlf.jpg','1998-05-22',106,'Released','You\'ll laugh, you\'ll cry, you\'ll be offended','The Opposite of Sex',9844,4.9463,6.2,'R4ZzqLPvagc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14031,_binary '\0','/rOvXN8m3l4qNKCdNscLUjxK6I9I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120780',7,106478,'en','Out of Sight','Meet Jack Foley, a smooth criminal who bends the law and is determined to make one last heist. Karen Sisco is a federal marshal who chooses all the right moves … and all the wrong guys. Now they\'re willing to risk it all to find out if there\'s more between them than just the law.','/v49q7AMR3pB4M762woWB1NYMCLF.jpg','1998-06-26',123,'Released','Opposites attract.','Out of Sight',1389,7.3366,6.7,'WE49DjCAZCc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14032,_binary '\0','/gSsiZrjjgN1MDVpeBUjDzFlZzPu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120782',6.1,9044,'en','Palmetto','After being released from prison on a bum charge, Harry Barber is out for payback to regain his lost two years. He\'s hired by Mrs. Malroux to fake the kidnapping of her stepdaughter (the daughter of a dying millionaire). He discovers that he is being set up on multiple levels and will soon face a longer sentence if he doesn\'t prove the truth.','/3R8At5ll1ZyCJT7FWbLmCjVqFlp.jpg','1998-02-20',114,'Released','In a town this bad, it\'s no use being good.','Palmetto',30949,2.4969,6,'kBZJ2F88Ywc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14033,_binary '\0','/y3zUOMWRoI2vC4ck2GBJyFWhzyA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120783',6.7,176717,'en','The Parent Trap','Hallie Parker and Annie James are identical twins who were separated at a young age due to their parents\' divorce. Unbeknownst to their parents, the girls are sent to the same summer camp, where they meet, discover the truth about their relationship, and come up with a plan to switch places in an effort to reunite their mother and father.','/p4dGmi8u9W0HHyVXcgWPoiFfKTF.jpg','1998-07-28',128,'Released','Twice the Fun, Double the Trouble.','The Parent Trap',9820,25.2566,7.2,'PMAhVpgzmRU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14034,_binary '\0','/fP9QYH8T9LBnsvnQvcqetB4nuwX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120784',7,154947,'en','Payback','With friends like these, who needs enemies? That\'s the question bad guy Porter is left asking after his wife and partner steal his heist money and leave him for dead -- or so they think. Five months and an endless reservoir of bitterness later, Porter\'s partners and the crooked cops on his tail learn how bad payback can be.','/8Bqlv2kbOyZFqfiPNgzdBscqYPn.jpg','1999-02-05',100,'Released','Get ready to root for the bad guy.','Payback',2112,9.2398,6.836,'n_aXrHNqQro','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14035,_binary '\0','/jgnfSyrtonk5U2UMP7MLtgX2eYt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120786',4.2,14085,'en','The Patriot','A deadly virus threatens to wipe out an entire Rocky Mountain town, leaving the town doctor to find some way to escape the soldiers who enforce the town\'s quarantine and devise an antidote. Matters take a more deadly turn after the physician is captured by a dangerously unstable band of militia extremists.','/5lmW1yBXAHkOc533wRDEqp3jlCV.jpg','1998-07-10',90,'Released','Every second counts.','The Patriot',6058,3.9727,5.6,'2bA86VQAGYw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14036,_binary '\0','/dNW7ftcqEAvKmDkuRPaLC4gnhwJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120787',6.6,99537,'en','A Perfect Murder','Millionaire industrialist Steven Taylor is a man who has everything but what he craves most: the love and fidelity of his wife. A hugely successful player in the New York financial world, he considers her to be his most treasured acquisition. But she needs more than simply the role of dazzling accessory.','/wC0ax12N9GQ8vMXPEs4nES5AAiB.jpg','1998-06-05',107,'Released','A powerful husband. An unfaithful wife. A jealous lover. All of them have a motive. Each of them has a plan.','A Perfect Murder',1965,11.0783,6.6,'aaQ8YI-rX2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14037,_binary '\0','/oxoeM1vnM6lPliYeJpUa99PvMll.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120788',6.2,8495,'en','Permanent Midnight','Juggling increasing career success and a growing heroin habit, a television comedy writer attempts to go down a path of improvement.','/wkoy7DQ1viN0EOtzw6v8W9y6UAr.jpg','1998-09-16',88,'Released','He had a great job, beautiful wife and a habit the size of Utah.','Permanent Midnight',22318,3.1228,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14038,_binary '\0','/yPmLNEl9tC9RBO5c95L2R67uxGR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120789',7.5,145793,'en','Pleasantville','Geeky teenager David and his popular twin sister, Jennifer, get sucked into the black-and-white world of a 1950s TV sitcom called \"Pleasantville,\" and find a world where everything is peachy keen all the time. But when Jennifer\'s modern attitude disrupts Pleasantville\'s peaceful but boring routine, she literally brings color into its life.','/sjnRihb0OdmtD5GBe5lfdfBjSxo.jpg','1998-09-17',124,'Released','Nothing is as simple as black and white.','Pleasantville',2657,5.9711,7.3,'Q-4pnXcqyt0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14039,_binary '\0','/yDraZAT061irt1KtqWnbEPt5yK5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120790',7,1363,'pt','Jaime','A woman takes her young son, leaves her husband and moves in with her lover. The boy, desperate to get his parents back together, becomes convinced that if only he can get his father\'s stolen motorcycle back everything will be fine again, so he sets out to get enough money to buy his father a new one.','/jDpnyAD1p3r6reGRgtSBnzlyKKB.jpg','1999-03-14',111,'Released',NULL,'Jaime',109192,1.3515,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14040,_binary '\0','/4kbkq887XNT85d6nJonCnmXDWor.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120791',6.4,117474,'en','Practical Magic','Sally and Gillian Owens, born into a magical family, have mostly avoided witchcraft themselves. But when Gillian\'s vicious boyfriend, Jimmy Angelov, dies unexpectedly, the Owens sisters give themselves a crash course in hard magic. With policeman Gary Hallet growing suspicious, the girls struggle to resurrect Angelov -- and unwittingly inject his corpse with an evil spirit that threatens to end their family line.','/AwmToSgf2IL3aHv0QRVsR5KvChv.jpg','1998-10-16',104,'Released','For two sisters from a family of witches, falling in love is the trickiest spell of all.','Practical Magic',6435,43.6316,6.813,'R7uixLkpjPs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14041,_binary '\0','/oGC9zshEYxCaSPRb94DCBepDHHp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120793',6.5,3090,'en','A Price Above Rubies','About a young woman who is married to a devout Jew and the problems that trouble their marriage because of the woman wanting something more out of her life.','/xR8U72BbHOc0o5q6UjApLRXRIRc.jpg','1998-03-26',117,'Released',NULL,'A Price Above Rubies',44308,2.2362,5.4,'xbahXLHtULk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14042,_binary '\0','/565DYYXgdRYMiETLi2EDx4p7s92.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120794',7.3,164559,'en','The Prince of Egypt','The strong bond between two Royal Egyptian brothers is challenged when their chosen responsibilities set them at odds, with extraordinary consequences.','/2xUjYwL6Ol7TLJPPKs7sYW5PWLX.jpg','1998-12-16',99,'Released','The power is real. The story is forever. The time is now.','The Prince of Egypt',9837,20.7417,7.325,'zmBDY-fSlIs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14043,_binary '\0','/9nFpMbSWebfdGlAxFyPHn9eyIvY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120797',6,32010,'en','Pushing Tin','Two air traffic controllers who thrive on living dangerously compete to outdo each other on several levels.','/61FWajJNKeS27DO4KgvS5LUgcHh.jpg','1999-04-23',124,'Released','A comedy about losing control','Pushing Tin',12596,4.5126,5.874,'XnBH9oQU8QU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14044,_binary '\0','/m58yUAi6CuHJ61eYGtSOaV996qn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120800',6.3,19866,'en','Quest for Camelot','During the times of King Arthur, Kayley is a brave girl who dreams of following her late father as a Knight of the Round Table. The evil Ruber wants to invade Camelot and take the throne of King Arthur, and Kayley has to stop him.','/pLfFEQ9HTw0HRvBkW3nI9RUze03.jpg','1998-05-15',86,'Released','Share the adventure, laughter and song in a land where magic was born and where wizards, knights and dragons still live.','Quest for Camelot',18937,6.7178,6.841,'PWEbAKGnX_4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14045,_binary '\0','/rzOCr1VCQa0BUU9x34JbwzM5mRo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120801',7,6775,'en','RKO 281','In 1939, boy-wonder Orson Welles leaves New York, where he has succeeded in radio and theater, and, hired by RKO Pictures, moves to Hollywood with the purpose of making his first film.','/v8Z4ENMOAT5OpiMeS1PBNPui3X0.jpg','1999-11-20',84,'Released','What went on the screen was nothing compared to what went on behind the scenes.','RKO 281',50008,2.0428,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14046,_binary '\0','/kOpaLjBnfpRqgo4vE9ViIZINt5J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120802',7.6,35935,'fr','Le violon rouge','300 years of a remarkable musical instrument. Crafted by the Italian master Bussotti (Cecchi) in 1681, the red violin has traveled through Austria, England, China, and Canada, leaving both beauty and tragedy in its wake. In Montreal, Samuel L Jackson plays an appraiser going over its complex history.','/uPjq8PaNDhFQTzOu4Ce91f6BFgZ.jpg','1998-11-13',130,'Released',NULL,'The Red Violin',14283,4.4327,7.3,'DhqgV4flGdE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14047,_binary '\0','/l5KvxFVOru3Qyf3dl2asNw5g1MD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120804',6.6,314824,'en','Resident Evil','When a virus leaks from a top-secret facility, turning all resident researchers into ravenous zombies and their lab animals into mutated hounds from hell, the government sends in an elite military task force to contain the outbreak.','/1UKNef590A0ZaMnxsscIcWuK1Em.jpg','2002-03-15',100,'Released','A secret experiment. A deadly virus. A fatal mistake.','Resident Evil',1576,23.6567,6.674,'HhBAIDHvRTc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14048,_binary '\0','/55jv6lnJf4SrjqGHczvFq8jAV4a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120805',4.6,2434,'en','Modern Vampires','A vampire hunter in southern California discovers that his son has been murdered by a gang of the undead and thus goes on a quest for revenge.','/fXqIlTNkODfkJzVK4Ws26pxaUP3.jpg','1998-10-19',91,'Released','Taste the evil. Taste the fun.','Modern Vampires',31003,3.123,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14049,_binary '\0','/9FrpAtF87VKblKkDEiIZzYgO40K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120812',7.1,335237,'en','Rush Hour','When Hong Kong Inspector Lee is summoned to Los Angeles to investigate a kidnapping, the FBI doesn\'t want any outside help and assigns cocky LAPD Detective James Carter to distract Lee from the case. Not content to watch the action from the sidelines, Lee and Carter form an unlikely partnership and investigate the case themselves.','/nwPhAsfnb7f46bZkWLG7IRP5HXr.jpg','1998-09-18',97,'Released','The fastest hands in the East meet the biggest mouth in the West.','Rush Hour',2109,17.2165,7.085,'hgrQLDbs1qU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14050,_binary '\0','/n6IHtlXxwxqI9CWpASDXil6HdDg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120813',5.8,3785,'en','Safe Men','Two untalented singers are mistaken for a pair of major league safe crackers in Providence, Rhode Island. The two are pressed into service by the local hoodlums and quickly find themselves in conflict with their professional colleagues. Romantic interest is added by the daughter of the underworld leader who won\'t date the men she knows are gangsters.','/857L7x6uFNr4c2oHD5KJw5pkbxn.jpg','1998-08-07',88,'Released','Welcome to the world of disorganised crime.','Safe Men',16155,2.3271,5.5,'thq7p9VrWnI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14051,_binary '\0','/bdD39MpSVhKjxarTxLSfX6baoMP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120815',8.6,1661786,'en','Saving Private Ryan','As U.S. troops storm the beaches of Normandy, three brothers lie dead on the battlefield, with a fourth trapped behind enemy lines. Ranger captain John Miller and seven men are tasked with penetrating German-held territory and bringing the boy home.','/uqx37cS8cpHg8U35f9U5IBlrCV3.jpg','1998-07-24',169,'Released','The mission is a man.','Saving Private Ryan',857,31.4455,8.233,'RYExstiQlLc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14052,_binary '\0','/vZHao0jyNzTY29sr4TLR2tSDTUV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120820',6,17971,'en','Senseless','A student gets his senses enhanced by an experimental drug. But abuse is not an option.','/rqy7OFHWy1NMjmgjyI8XYcl0VU5.jpg','1998-02-20',93,'Released','A secret experiment gave him super senses. Then came the side-effects.','Senseless',12538,3.9643,6.212,'A6pM-4m7xQ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14053,_binary '\0','/njN4u6NBo4AWohPcp4nArz9uUr0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120823',6.5,5618,'en','The Impostors','Wrongly accused of physically abusing a fellow actor, starving thespians Arthur and Maurice find themselves pursued by the law aboard a cruise ship.','/pnL8MvYje9DOZTuTnF04k8RUkSL.jpg','1998-10-02',101,'Released','Why be yourself when you can be somebody else?','The Impostors',28134,2.4698,6,'o6NjLhtvW3o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14054,_binary '\0','/9gzaEGkgadqCRHbBhZie4qtOthQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120824',6.7,34987,'en','The Shipping News','An emotionally-beaten man with his young daughter moves to his ancestral home in Newfoundland to reclaim his life.','/3IdEZw4YN4NfvjLRyZVWpI0z2IH.jpg','2001-12-18',111,'Released','Dive beneath the surface.','The Shipping News',6440,3.7325,6.4,'8x1z8IK-L0U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14055,_binary '\0','/9rzH8WD96rJTM31bHjxsLrQDV2G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120828',5.9,88648,'en','Six Days Seven Nights','In the South Pacific, in Polynesia, on the island of Makatea, Quinn Harris, a taciturn pilot, leads a quiet life, content to earn a living by transporting goods in his De Havilland Beaver. His life is exactly as he wants it to be—until he meets Robin Monroe, a sophisticated and determined woman, the assistant editor of a New York magazine, on vacation for a week with her boyfriend, Frank Martin. An urgent work assignment in Tahiti, the neighboring island, forces Robin to reluctantly hire Quinn to fly her there. But a violent storm forces them to make an emergency landing on a deserted island. This unlikely pair avoids each other at first, until they are forced to team up to escape the island... and evade the pirates who are after them. Danger and temptation are never far away...','/fzWrrCzRa16v51TXAUuT6Wendw7.jpg','1998-06-12',102,'Released','After this week in paradise, they\'ll need a vacation!','Six Days Seven Nights',6068,9.4391,6.1,'P_cWHAPogMo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14056,_binary '\0','/u5To9HnmkbVym4cE8LzAORP8hEm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120831',6.7,16012,'en','Slums of Beverly Hills','In 1976, a teenage girl struggles to cope while living with her neurotic lower-middle-class family of nomads on the outskirts of Beverly Hills.','/bTY6I0Mju4vTRHGoTZrNtxtAlAO.jpg','1998-08-14',91,'Released','Growing up is hard to do.','Slums of Beverly Hills',14662,3.9849,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14057,_binary '\0','/2MvYDk1CzVOffa6IoFjVrTR3Ow4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120832',6.2,94263,'en','Snake Eyes','All bets are off when shady homicide cop Rick Santoro witnesses a murder during a boxing match. Determined to solve the crime, he quickly learns that his search for answers will only uncover yet more questions in an ever-widening web of conspiracy, intrigue, and danger.','/gsh9mQKRrr4M90XC9Rr0wxefc9u.jpg','1998-08-07',98,'Released','Believe everything except your eyes.','Snake Eyes',8688,6.6093,6.208,'LwNgUdp2otk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14058,_binary '\0','/aAIobmR0vHtbmUgVeEBLXrGcipm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120834',6.7,15022,'en','Snow Falling on Cedars','In the 1950s, a Japanese-American fisherman is suspected of killing his neighbour at sea. For Ishmael, a local reporter, the trial strikes a deep emotional chord when he finds his ex-lover is linked to the case. As he investigates the killing, he uncovers some startling clues that lead him to a shocking discovery.','/h1CujbeKvwkR6LMr4jVuMM0C94X.jpg','1999-12-22',127,'Released','First loves last forever.','Snow Falling on Cedars',10219,4.6884,6.089,'SY6mC4I4SWk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14059,_binary '\0','/ygE6FbYAE4RE61Bdrhg6xDr2mZQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120835',6.8,2548,'en','A Soldier\'s Daughter Never Cries','This fictionalized story, based on the family life of writer James Jones, is an emotional slice-of-life story. Jones is portrayed here as Bill Willis, a former war hero turned author who combats alcoholism and is starting to experience health problems. Living in France with his wife, daughter, and an adopted son, the family travels an unconventional road which casts them as outsiders to others. Preaching a sexual freedom, his daughter\'s sexual discovery begins at an early age and betrays her when the family moves to Hanover in America. Her overt sexuality clashes with the values of her teenage American peers and gives her a problematic reputation. Meanwhile, her brooding brother copes with his own interior pain regarding his past, only comfortable communicating within the domestic space.','/k3DmaY20ynkRTE17Oe1dR8pZWaR.jpg','1998-09-18',127,'Released','The city of lights. A famous American author and the decade that changed a generation...forever.','A Soldier\'s Daughter Never Cries',72987,1.8635,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14060,_binary '\0','/rOldSefEDKQWDRhvcDfIalOVl4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120836',5.1,7250,'en','Lost & Found','In order to impress his beautiful French neighbor, Dylan Ramsey dognaps her pet pooch so he can return him and become a hero.','/jaylLo7TsJrJriNVGf72Asen1Fr.jpg','1999-04-23',95,'Released','A comedy about a guy who would do anything to get the girl of his dreams - and did!','Lost & Found',39964,3.3393,5.073,'HUNgL4jTPeQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14061,_binary '\0','/nU077DKYGmnQRdmNdj6M8KwidWH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120838',5.8,3172,'en','Sour Grapes','The bond between cousins is tested when one wins a fortune with the other\'s money at Atlantic City.','/u7WrCfoiMarjpARPtgkfEFslCsK.jpg','1998-04-17',91,'Released','They\'re cousins and best pals...til debt do them part.','Sour Grapes',24560,2.3185,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14062,_binary '\0','/q5q8kXiPH0oOBfMXwXIC0koe3uV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120841',4.6,34130,'en','Species II','Having just returned from a mission to Mars, Commander Ross isn\'t exactly himself. He\'s slowly becoming a terrifying alien entity with one goal -- to procreate with human women! When countless women suffer gruesome deaths after bearing half-alien offspring, scientist Laura Baker and hired assassin Press Lennox use Eve, a more tempered alien clone, to find Ross and his brood. Before long Eve escapes to mate with Ross.','/8LSBi0bHACZtIiVErUBQ2UXNYLA.jpg','1998-04-10',93,'Released','Mating season begins...','Species II',10216,7.4288,5.2,'zJXdwcKdGf0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14063,_binary '\0','/vsjuHP9RQZJgYUvvSlO3mjJpXkq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120844',6.4,83806,'en','Star Trek: Insurrection','When an alien race and factions within Starfleet attempt to take over a planet that has \"regenerative\" properties, it falls upon Captain Picard and the crew of the Enterprise to defend the planet\'s people as well as the very ideals upon which the Federation itself was founded.','/xQCMAHeg5M9HpDIqanYbWdr4brB.jpg','1998-12-11',103,'Released','The battle for paradise has begun.','Star Trek: Insurrection',200,7.4211,6.459,'gm2M8oUrEyg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14064,_binary '\0','/gWvTNBTRk4My2hZFW61Ljb6SCyT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120847',5.2,4148,'en','The Substitute 2: School\'s Out','When teacher Randall Thomasson is killed during a carjacking, an unexpected visitor shows up at his funeral - his estranged brother, Karl Thomasson. An ex-Green Beret turned mercenary, Karl signs on as a new substitute teacher in order to investigate Randall\'s murder.','/vk95MEsk43QMUsyxC3yd6Bz2Ett.jpg','1998-08-01',89,'Released',NULL,'The Substitute 2: School\'s Out',29812,5.8541,6.5,'1E6vB_Df4Xk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14065,_binary '\0','/sEUfDr2jWxMWc9g07g2OxVFyR2Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120851',4.4,2067,'en','Sweepers','Dolph Lundgren is Christian Erickson, a leading demolition expert trained to disarm mine fields in a humanitarian minesweeping operation in Angola. His son is killed and he discovers that mines are being planted during the war to kill people in the area.','/8M31PAMj8XhrbfXfILLJHRX8UPy.jpg','1998-12-02',96,'Released','One step between life and death.','Sweepers',44808,2.8897,4.4,'_JvR3s5eg3A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14066,_binary '\0','/a0E1mbejev56Ii51hCnYUDj4tZS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120855',7.3,272198,'en','Tarzan','Tarzan was a small orphan who was raised by an ape named Kala since he was a child. He believed that this was his family, but on an expedition Jane Porter is rescued by Tarzan. He then finds out that he\'s human. Now Tarzan must make the decision as to which family he should belong to...','/bTvHlcqiOjGa3lFtbrTLTM3zasY.jpg','1999-06-17',88,'Released','An immortal legend as you\'ve only imagined.','Tarzan',37135,18.4523,7.406,'FV9GYz1g4GY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14067,_binary '\0','/seBLWU1Zf6hr1Y7THEiunUYU5Ab.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120856',4,2483,'en','Tarzan and the Lost City','Tarzan returns to his homeland of Africa to save his home from destruction.','/kp4gfmC7O10lAuBCDn1cbnPdudU.jpg','1998-04-24',83,'Released',NULL,'Tarzan and the Lost City',38618,2.7718,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14068,_binary '\0','/w5AkUNcQP5FtEhEBeU3yioZOczN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120857',6.9,13946,'en','Tea with Mussolini','In 1930s fascist Italy, adolescent Luca just lost his mother. His father, a callous businessman, sends him to be taken care of by British expatriate Mary Wallace. Mary and her cultured friends - including artist Arabella, young widow Elsa, and archaeologist Georgie - keep a watchful eye over the boy. But the women\'s cultivated lives take a dramatic turn when Allied forces declare war on Mussolini.','/i3rAPxhhDjqsL1rZJM57pyR7xFW.jpg','1999-03-25',117,'Released','A story of civilized disobedience','Tea with Mussolini',10368,2.9341,6.438,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14069,_binary '\0','/r7Ym4rSWfm7HHom9kE3MIODyfhh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120861',6.5,2794,'en','The Theory of Flight','Richard is assigned public service after crashing his homemade aircraft, leading him to meet Jane, a young woman dying of motor neuron disease. After they strike up a friendship, Jane asks Richard to help fulfill her deepest wish: to lose her virginity before her death.','/wnvKxQ2PwqLf1QOtblr8ICrxXTi.jpg','1999-01-22',101,'Released',NULL,'The Theory of Flight',76857,2.0728,6.3,'nJIdiOq9TkY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14070,_binary '\0','/hsDyfAk2ml82IrpPC4AHvxvuTsn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120863',7.6,213878,'en','The Thin Red Line','The story of a group of men, an Army Rifle company called C-for-Charlie, who change, suffer, and ultimately make essential discoveries about themselves during the fierce World War II battle of Guadalcanal. It follows their journey, from the surprise of an unopposed landing, through the bloody and exhausting battles that follow, to the ultimate departure of those who survived.','/seMydAaoxQP6F0xbE1jOcTmn5Jr.jpg','1998-12-23',171,'Released','Every man fights his own war.','The Thin Red Line',8741,14.774,7.4,'ejm0XvT3rB8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14071,_binary '\0','/dEqga9uQjXEBaizh44XEAd9JQAq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120865',6.9,1914,'en','This Is My Father','When schoolteacher Kieran Johnson discovers that his father was not a French sailor (as he had been led to believe) but rather an Irish farmer, he looks to his mother for answers. When she refuses to provide any, Kieran travels to Ireland.','/xKOdv0qSUFLcMpHftpk19M0G5DA.jpg','1999-05-07',119,'Released','A Journey of the Heart.','This Is My Father',25232,2.3187,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14072,_binary '\0','/xwlShstQ7tODGkJJQ2ddM2JoNMu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120866',7,22376,'en','Titus','Titus Andronicus returns from the wars and sees his sons and daughters taken from him, one by one. Shakespeare\'s goriest and earliest tragedy.','/82mCeQoeT2C7h7vR6Ot9MQotE1R.jpg','1999-12-25',162,'Released','The fate of an empire. The descent of man.','Titus',12524,4.2109,6.4,'xAFhn_0mHEE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14073,_binary '\0','/z3QOFJJjfg7oX0GR2JJNfq7fAaV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120867',6.5,2203,'en','Jerry and Tom','Tom and Jerry are two hit men, they work by day at a third-rate second-hand car dealership. Tom is a veteran and Jerry is a novice in their business, and their attitude toward their profession differs a lot. It shows when Tom is required to kill his old friend Karl.','/7vb4RjMgdzPflqSpdUwwUjdwjTu.jpg','1998-12-04',107,'Released',NULL,'Jerry and Tom',76891,1.9419,6.2,'15mSCHdOGX8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14074,_binary '\0','/cKLsNFf88VQrJDT4NJu7HN8Bsi8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120868',6.8,15492,'es','Torrente, el brazo tonto de la ley','A former policeman enlists his nerdy friend to help bust drug traffickers moving heroin through a Chinese restaurant.','/tGlaXKGmpo7YH1ULTQYFCz8241k.jpg','1998-03-13',97,'Released',NULL,'Torrente: The Dumb Arm of the Law',1283,3.7638,6.5,'ulJSg4GYbBE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14075,_binary '\0','/1gjmfxUd4JPhfoVZszyS9mLA5Uv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120873',6.6,121331,'en','U.S. Marshals','U.S. Marshal Sam Gerard is accompanying a plane load of convicts from Chicago to New York. The plane crashes spectacularly, and Mark Sheridan escapes. But when Diplomatic Security Agent John Royce is assigned to help Gerard recapture Sheridan, it becomes clear that Sheridan is more than just another murderer.','/5ST0BydDSXtW5AtfDDhTVS13pTt.jpg','1998-03-06',131,'Released','The cop who won\'t stop is back. But this time he\'s chasing down a lot more than a fugitive.','U.S. Marshals',11808,9.3912,6.554,'VdF4SCmj-lI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14076,_binary '\0','/uzlGbsQkpK6C3ZiqRqKw9CwK0Do.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120877',6.1,69111,'en','Vampires','The church enlists a team of vampire-hunters to hunt down and destroy a group of vampires searching for an ancient relic that will allow them to exist in sunlight.','/4JhaFBPwyC5IM1rKaRR07Gzutse.jpg','1998-10-30',108,'Released','Prepare for the dawn.','Vampires',9945,6.0056,6.3,'hSfGOdPSvPQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14077,_binary '\0','/vKKhkLajUTCoRIL2pHbxZmnvHPw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120878',4.7,1926,'en','The Velocity of Gary','When bisexual porn star Valentino meets new-in-town hustler Gary, there is an immediate attraction between the two. Valentino helps get Gary a job at a phone-sex company, and they become fast friends and lovers, but tension threatens their relationship when Gary and Valentino\'s friend Mary becomes involved. When Valentino finds out he is dying and Mary is going to have his child, the three must work through hard times together.','/8wQlK0QukCXXmvmDARAx65wnX4j.jpg','1999-07-16',100,'Released','One Sexy Girl. Two Hot Guys. A Million Possibilities.','The Velocity of Gary',133575,1.9378,4.4,'TdWU5O5tgpc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14078,_binary '\0','/zUs2GW4rPSIsfzBp0GtXaQR2mqk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120879',6.9,40728,'en','Velvet Goldmine','Almost a decade since larger-than-life glam-rock enigma Brian Slade disappeared from public eye, an investigative journalist is on assignment to uncover the truth behind his former idol.','/4EJkObEJFvXCuoVqOP7XBXGqdQ1.jpg','1998-08-28',123,'Released','Leave your expectations at the door','Velvet Goldmine',1808,4.5711,6.9,'mNx-hJ54L70','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14079,_binary '\0','/ep9dgyiqnonyerQG5HsCToYzQHY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120882',6.1,14695,'fr','Les Couloirs du temps : Les Visiteurs II','The sequel to The Visitors reunites us with those lovable ruffians from the French Medieval ages who - through magic - are transported into the present, with often drastic consequences. Godefroy de Montmirail travels to today to recover the missing family jewels and a sacred relic, guarantor of his wife-to-be\'s fertility. The confrontation between Godefroy\'s repellent servant Jack the Crack and his descendent, the effete Jacquart, present-day owner of the chateau, further complicates the matter.','/c1xMb4GfTuyKSRUoeewBF27dtKa.jpg','1998-02-11',118,'Released','They come back!','The Visitors II: The Corridors of Time',10353,4.4637,6,'sdEbOkbO0s8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14080,_binary '\0','/vQuxf8meojQ3XV4hHl5BmOPYuFH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120885',7.1,94186,'en','Wag the Dog','During the final weeks of a presidential race, the President is accused of sexual misconduct. To distract the public until the election, the President\'s adviser hires a Hollywood producer to help him stage a fake war.','/kAwOj7t8ZeaniTFtLWVSKO79JxX.jpg','1997-12-25',97,'Released','A comedy about truth, justice and other special effects.','Wag the Dog',586,5.4527,6.9,'steA_PZPkc8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14081,_binary '\0','/7Kfuj85Bbi6EJqfhg2wKUh2fEkN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120888',6.9,175093,'en','The Wedding Singer','Robbie, a local rock star turned wedding singer, is dumped on the day of his wedding. Meanwhile, waitress Julia finally sets a wedding date with her fiancée Glenn. When Julia and Robbie meet and hit it off, they find that things are more complicated than anybody thought.','/zVvyTrcZQb7kC2DPDzyo25WcxXp.jpg','1998-02-13',97,'Released','He\'s gonna party like it\'s 1985!','The Wedding Singer',11003,5.8888,6.774,'8yjOXMTa6vA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14082,_binary '\0','/586n41CjDveXtwmQgP41YtyHKUV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120889',7,121789,'en','What Dreams May Come','After Chris Nielsen dies in a car accident, he is guided through the afterlife by his spirit guide, Albert. His new world is beautiful and can be whatever Chris imagines. Even his children are there. But, when his wife, Annie, commits suicide and is sent to hell, Chris ignores Albert\'s warnings and journeys there to save her. Upon arrival, Chris finds that rescuing Annie will be more difficult than he\'d imagined.','/78wCdphUzeb528wLZw2W0fn7yGB.jpg','1998-10-02',113,'Released','After life there is more. The end is just the beginning.','What Dreams May Come',12159,9.1238,7.253,'RmZ-FuBThuQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14083,_binary '\0','/qVKhr3WcbSQKJmVJhKq9ov3iwcT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120890',6.6,142106,'en','Wild Things','When teen-socialite Kelly Van Ryan and troubled bad girl Suzie Toller accuse guidance counselor Sam Lombardo of rape, he\'s suspended by the school, rejected by the town, and fighting to get his life back. One cop suspects conspiracy, but nothing is what it seems...','/wrcTDD9T7Ga5c9MW7kaOo2qwIvW.jpg','1998-03-20',108,'Released','They\'re dying to play with you.','Wild Things',617,11.493,6.4,'RbnGi43LqI4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14084,_binary '\0','/tbzWgnaqhFwN5mCIiwbgN5oiw0V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120891',5,174699,'en','Wild Wild West','Legless Southern inventor Dr. Arliss Loveless plans to rekindle the Civil War by assassinating President Ulysses S. Grant. Only two men can stop him: gunfighter James West and master-of-disguise and inventor Artemus Gordon. The two must team up to thwart Loveless\' plans.','/mCdo7nykEVCa25bjnkwgyX35fjm.jpg','1999-06-30',106,'Released','It\'s a whole new west.','Wild Wild West',8487,8.7818,5.3,'wSRtRrPBTT8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14085,_binary '\0','/t3yTlQShxPu883luyFXsfBttXCX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120894',6.2,6448,'en','The Wisdom of Crocodiles','A vampire in London is searching for the ideal woman to \'redeem\' him.','/rMxdX8QXWjIZDsZthsN8axFR4ws.jpg','1998-11-27',98,'Released','He seduces for blood.','Immortality',1448,2.7374,5.7,'9gKDRTyuH3Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14086,_binary '\0','/hVQtxvDBppLGmBFgNDOEnDIzrhI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120899',6.5,3228,'en','My Life So Far','A memoir of the lives of a family growing up on a post World War I British estate headed up by a strong disciplinarian, her daughter, her inventor husband, their ten year old son and his older sister. Through the household comes a number of suitors hoping to impress the young woman, including an aviator. When the elder woman\'s son shows up at the estate with his French fiancé, everything gets thrown into turmoil. The young boy takes a sudden interest in her sexual allure and his father is disturbed by his own non-Victorian feelings.','/6lXglg96vfFuHCDdmNof1bdyd0F.jpg','1999-08-25',98,'Released','Imagine a summer in paradise with nothing to do except everything your heart desires.','My Life So Far',48958,2.9767,5.4,'sP3KI7_pbkc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14087,_binary '\0','/KOXNduDONfkv4zk3ZwNWbZuCOe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120901',6.1,32450,'en','Wrongfully Accused','Ryan Harrison, a violin god, superstar and sex symbol does not want to cheat on sexy Lauren Goodhue\'s husband with her. Mr. Goodhue is found murdered and Ryan suddenly finds himself being the main suspect. After being sentenced to death he manages to flee while being transferred to his execution site. Now, all the world is after him as he stumbles from one unfortunate incident to the next in order to prove himself innocent - by finding a mysterious one-eyed, one-armed, one-legged man...','/6FG3aldS4eVD4baKwmAi9P8kdRS.jpg','1998-07-23',87,'Released','Somewhere in the naked city lurks a one-armed, one-legged, one-eyed man responsible for the murder for which Ryan Harrison has been wrongfully accused. To find him, all Ryan needs is a clue.','Wrongfully Accused',9417,5.4908,6,'IvEKtk0TCtI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14088,_binary '\0','/2YIzEKCMfexbLIoeVUkR8MPayB2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120902',7,115799,'en','The X-Files','Mulder and Scully, now taken off the FBI\'s X Files cases, must find a way to fight the shadowy elements of the government to find out the truth about a conspiracy that might mean the alien colonization of Earth.','/yLIw6shz2WC3W3iI0jROsF4B2ha.jpg','1998-06-19',121,'Released','Fight the future.','The X-Files',846,10.8951,6.9,'NmVHEEogDII','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14089,_binary '\0','/3QUVzbcNyfGe3ocWkYAT8emK8Co.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120903',7.3,704637,'en','X-Men','Two mutants, Rogue and Wolverine, come to a private academy for their kind whose resident superhero team, the X-Men, must oppose a terrorist organization with similar powers.','/bRDAc4GogyS9ci3ow7UnInOcriN.jpg','2000-07-13',104,'Released','Trust a few. Fear the rest.','X-Men',36657,1.2108,7.023,'s4Wqw8tqgdM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14090,_binary '\0','/bHOn3rW9jUwWysmrFzeW8Ukrauk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120906',6.8,16184,'en','Zero Effect','Daryl Zero is a private investigator and—along with his assistant, Steve Arlo—he solves impossible crimes and puzzles. Although Daryl\'s a master investigator, he doesn\'t know what to do with himself when he\'s not working; he has no social skills, writes bad music and drives Steve crazy.','/yFALvZFwqnh5ESarNoVd5KtizCo.jpg','1998-01-30',116,'Released','The world\'s most private detective.','Zero Effect',16148,3.5759,6.3,'eSH8Y3h5j-g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14091,_binary '\0','/vgPBS3To8IuQ1sY1l9G97dqcsq2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120907',6.8,114717,'en','eXistenZ','A game designer on the run from assassins must play her latest virtual reality creation with a marketing trainee to determine if the game has been damaged.','/kETKF0JhdTPn1knci8CAdYL0d79.jpg','1999-04-14',97,'Released','Everybody\'s Playing It.','eXistenZ',1946,5.9166,6.792,'DZZJrQc-wtw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14092,_binary '\0','/wBQ2tSdXgAOAdH14VgXtN9qD0Ol.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120910',7.1,44378,'en','Fantasia 2000','Blending lively music and brilliant animation, this sequel to the original \'Fantasia\' restores \'The Sorcerer\'s Apprentice\' and adds seven new shorts.','/5rwAtUaKEK48CPUijVfVU0IPKPZ.jpg','2000-01-01',74,'Released',NULL,'Fantasia 2000',49948,7.5554,6.972,'4M3KeyELE1Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14093,_binary '\0','/o1l6OCqA3pYDZHIc5L1s7CEzCMv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120912',6.2,436287,'en','Men in Black II','Kay and Jay reunite to provide our best, last and only line of defense against a sinister seductress who levels the toughest challenge yet to the MIB\'s untarnished mission statement – protecting Earth from the scum of the universe. It\'s been four years since the alien-seeking agents averted an intergalactic disaster of epic proportions. Now it\'s a race against the clock as Jay must convince Kay – who not only has absolutely no memory of his time spent with the MIB, but is also the only living person left with the expertise to save the galaxy – to reunite with the MIB before the earth submits to ultimate destruction.','/enA22EPyzc2WQ1VVyY7zxresQQr.jpg','2002-07-03',88,'Released','Same planet. New scum.','Men in Black II',608,24.0331,6.392,'DMHlNR6x2Sw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14094,_binary '\0','/t0VWB5Kc5o38w5YYgzReArrGiZ8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120913',6.6,67223,'en','Titan A.E.','A young man finds out that he holds the key to restoring hope and ensuring survival for the human race, while an alien species called the Drej are bent on mankind\'s destruction.','/el2iHk3LTJWfEnwrvcRkvWY501G.jpg','2000-06-16',95,'Released','Get ready for the human race.','Titan A.E.',7450,7.8439,6.627,'mK7huyUD3i8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14095,_binary '\0','/3TeGmKJfkik1D1rIoqGb1aR4k9c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120915',6.5,938925,'en','Star Wars: Episode I - The Phantom Menace','Anakin Skywalker, a young slave strong with the Force, is discovered on Tatooine. Meanwhile, the evil Sith have returned, enacting their plot for revenge against the Jedi.','/6wkfovpn7Eq8dYNKaG5PY3q2oq6.jpg','1999-05-19',136,'Released','Every saga has a beginning.','Star Wars: Episode I - The Phantom Menace',1893,19.4263,6.583,'J3kyYFHdRsM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14096,_binary '\0','/mZj8EUr6F1x2PWZjKPxaeYd5WRw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0120917',7.4,252846,'en','The Emperor\'s New Groove','When the self‑absorbed Emperor Kuzco is accidentally transformed into a llama, he must rely on a humble villager to survive the jungle and reclaim his throne.','/wwbgkXQBEKtnyIJapk6gUgWkVw8.jpg','2000-12-15',78,'Released','It\'s all about... ME!','The Emperor\'s New Groove',11688,23.7349,7.6,'Hjvy8vc39kw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14097,_binary '\0','/v23fWgJUEt8EMmvn19btIacxP8E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0121164',7.4,332272,'en','Corpse Bride','In a 19th-century European village, a young man about to be married is whisked away to the underworld and wed to a mysterious corpse bride, while his real bride waits bereft in the land of the living.','/3RAoVTxUk1OzZClscAsynuu670p.jpg','2005-09-12',77,'Released','There\'s been a grave misunderstanding.','Corpse Bride',3933,34.0205,7.59,'BgwJEpmPKk8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14098,_binary '\0','/fuS7N26zf6GTQwvC5Xf1DnfgOlR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0121261',3.2,1820,'en','Faces of Death III','Gory real-life footage of blood and guts on the German Autobahn, drug smugglers getting blown away, a parachutist landing in a crocodile pit, torture and murder in El Salvador, a PCP addict getting stoned, a videotaped rape/murder, a car thief getting ripped apart by two junkyard dogs, and much more.','/xsESeofFGmzpOdE74mBoN2kUxYK.jpg','1985-03-10',86,'Released',NULL,'Faces of Death III',15901,2.1499,3.8,'evWN764PnkI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14099,_binary '\0','/zWQADNWqbMJUG0RL3hcuUvhIEHg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0121262',3.5,1483,'en','Faces of Death IV','Contains more than 50 separate scenes of blood-chilling horror, none of which have ever been seen by the public, depicting a cremation, an electrocution, a terrorist destroyed by his own bomb, the massacre of a Columbian wedding party, the drawing and quartering of a Russian peasant and a man-eating tiger turning on its trainer.','/2cDKmzKP5mz0UTJflTpVwuTiX6R.jpg','1990-11-28',90,'Released',NULL,'Faces of Death IV',15902,1.5891,4,'YB4G59u8ynY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14100,_binary '\0','/57cCXtmKTR9FnC3Eyqxkdg6vkW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0121403',8.2,5719,'hu','Indul a bakterház','The story of Bendegúz, the teenage boy who never succeeds in anything and about whom everybody\'s first though is \"I wish you had been hanged when you were born!\" drops out of school and becomes a cowboy. He works for the Stationmaster whose cows he has to graze by the railway. Despite his goodwill and kindheartedness he always manages to spoil everything he touches. No matter his wit, he gets into humiliating situations and regularly fights with the Ugly Witch (the Stationmaster\'s mother-in-law). However his good spirit and cheerfulness never leave him.','/fgAd27qMb8fKcxbTLOAHL9LIZWp.jpg','1980-11-12',66,'Released',NULL,'The Stationmaster Meets His Match',63625,2.0416,7.7,'77pzqm0RgmM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14101,_binary '\0','/accAuHmemGmxWFi8FoQQwQUyXMv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0121431',7.5,1554,'hu','János Vitéz','A traditional Hungarian poetic fairytale that describes the epic adventures of a young shepherd through love, war, magic and death.','/pcmz6fSbu1w05JwzLuHuqVW8wn5.jpg','1973-05-01',78,'Released',NULL,'Johnny Corncob',41078,2.5009,7.9,'3iseWnZ5Vc8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14102,_binary '\0','/uSPNOnthJJ2pHt1p6wuV0gA0N0X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0121442',6.3,2504,'nl','Koko Flanel','Placide\'s dad tells him on his deathbed he\'ll haunt Placide if he doesn\'t find a wife soon. Placide cautiously agrees, but he only wants to settle for a very beautiful woman. That might be easier said than done, since he is a vagabond. When he accidentally enters a photo shoot, Placide meets Sarah. He falls in love, but she is way out of his reach.','/7Uabrib0sNCQno7p3owSg1dU9dy.jpg','1990-02-23',95,'Released','Fashion isn\'t everything','Koko Flanel',35016,1.0381,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14103,_binary '\0','/uSEVuLrFBAWqawLlyRavAEbb7Ks.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0121694',3.4,1674,'en','Robo Vampire','Narcotics agent Tom Wilde is given a second chance at life after being shot and killed. In a futuristic experiment, agent Wilde is returned to life as an Android Robot. He is sent on a very dangerous mission into the depths of the golden Triangle to rescue Sophie, a beautiful undercover agent who has been captured by the evil drug warlord Mr. Young and his inhuman creation the Vampire Beast.','/aOCqnXdg2J32pphIZZlSOnlVoV0.jpg','1988-10-22',90,'Released','Past And Present Meets In This Land Of Turmoil!','Robo Vampire',88377,1.4182,4.6,'GbuMUbhvPTw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14104,_binary '\0','/cxvr2IOTwHcQa3EqMoQ8RHCkqBG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0121765',6.6,831500,'en','Star Wars: Episode II - Attack of the Clones','Following an assassination attempt on Senator Padmé Amidala, Jedi Knights Anakin Skywalker and Obi-Wan Kenobi investigate a mysterious plot into the heart of the Separatist movement and the beginning of the Clone Wars.','/oZNPzxqM2s5DyVWab09NTQScDQt.jpg','2002-05-15',142,'Released','A Jedi shall not know anger. Nor hatred. Nor love.','Star Wars: Episode II - Attack of the Clones',1894,13.7864,6.6,'gYbW1F_c9eM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14105,_binary '\0','/5vDuLrjJXFS9PTF7Q1xzobmYKR9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0121766',7.7,934110,'en','Star Wars: Episode III - Revenge of the Sith','When the sinister Sith unveil a thousand-year-old plot to rule the galaxy, the Republic crumbles and from its ashes rises the evil Galactic Empire. Jedi hero Anakin Skywalker must choose a side.','/xfSAoBEm9MNBjmlNcDYLvLSMlnq.jpg','2005-05-17',140,'Released','Every story has a hero. Every hero has a destiny. Every saga has an end.','Star Wars: Episode III - Revenge of the Sith',1895,16.6183,7.475,'5UnjrG_N8hU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14106,_binary '\0','/nRc6pwhW51n2f1AAg3b5590MBpz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0121804',6.8,6081,'en','Babylon 5: Thirdspace','Susan Ivanova discovers a derelict spaceship in hyperspace. They tow it back to Babylon 5, then strange things start happening. People are being telepathically taken over by aliens from another (third)space.','/lGRkbsA4cqFBjvshNAnCnUg0uyV.jpg','1998-07-17',94,'Released','One mistake. One mistake out of so many. So many others.','Babylon 5: Thirdspace',10941,2.423,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14107,_binary '\0','/8lPF73Zb7D5FWaT8wj7rynJqBpe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0121989',6.4,2811,'hi','Baazi','A tough and honest police officer wages a one-man war against terrorists and a corrupt politician who have planned to assassinate the chief minister of the state.','/ovZzl24CtM4UevTLHMyJO9svRXB.jpg','1995-04-05',183,'Released',NULL,'Baazi',159657,1.1655,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14108,_binary '\0','/4G6vYZAqxGuo8IpI7hIQ7vh0H8R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0122037',5.3,3303,'en','The Dead Pit','The arrival of an amnesiac patient in a psychiatric hospital somehow frees a mad doctor, who was shot and entombed with his fiendish experiments in an abandoned wing of the asylum 20 years before.','/m1QVgIr9MzPxNcGYk7PPNywmzHA.jpg','1989-10-01',102,'Released','They\'re out.','The Dead Pit',40448,1.819,5.2,'QX6V-tZn9VA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14109,_binary '\0','/gFFQBqsQ976WI6jMtANYoCRBuh3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0122050',4.4,1584,'zh','新七龍珠 神龍的傳說','An unauthorized live-action adaptation of the Dragon Ball manga, it follows a band of misfit adventurers trying to stop King Horn and his goal to collect all seven Dragon Balls, and his wish of ultimate power.','/2OfxuVeFsClcEMt71MDw8BhbaZh.jpg','1991-11-30',90,'Released',NULL,'Dragon Ball: The Magic Begins',68810,2.0147,4.2,'VkpJul4Di8M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14110,_binary '\0','/lpcIogzzMVNxhlWF2P05Q8w0PJZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0122070',3.9,1844,'en','The Forest','A cannibal hermit living in the woods preys on campers and hikers for his food supply.','/QNvOiW54Ls8RMHxLOpfUsX5xKb.jpg','1982-06-11',85,'Released','Daddy\'s Gone A Hunting','The Forest',85196,1.4773,3.9,'55ShrbPAkX0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14111,_binary '\0','/wAyQqVWyOpJV6lh9KF1Tvc7pEFM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0122082',7.6,9046,'fr','Gadjo Dilo','A man is looking for a singer he had heard on cassette. He finds much more.','/3V1ZXttNb7MJz66HvZnIwf8Tc9y.jpg','1998-04-08',102,'Released',NULL,'The Crazy Stranger',5071,2.0879,7.413,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14112,_binary '\0','/5dOiPl5dq3MPowArvSVly1PJmca.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0122111',6.9,3405,'cs','Ikarie XB 1','The year is 2163. Starship Ikaria XB-1 embarks on a mission deep into space in search of alien life. During their perilous journey the crew confront the effects of a malignant dark star, the destructive legacy of the 20th century and, ultimately, the limits of their own sanity.','/svpzTXId4kH1pwn71e3ZOFUxd7L.jpg','1963-07-26',88,'Released','Dare you take the first?','Ikarie XB 1',19757,1.8764,6.8,'K13DNaQWKBs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14113,_binary '\0','/oLui5hnc8HnkVDXruisqu3LZb6H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0122136',7.7,10066,'ja','藪の中の黒猫','In the Sengoku period, a woman and her daughter are raped and murdered by soldiers during a time of civil war. Afterwards, a series of samurai returning from the war through that area are found mysteriously dead with their throats torn out. The governor calls in a wild and fierce young hero to quell what is evidently an Onryō ghost.','/43LZYSBRMZoi9QdYntkGXhLSMeI.jpg','1968-02-24',100,'Released','Beware what lurks in the bamboo forest craving the blood of samurai!','Kuroneko',40149,2.5493,7.384,'3jRRK-cOdkI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14114,_binary '\0','/8ex3KmRxQSPG3ap2FVjfU6zQQdQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0122143',5.2,6876,'en','The Last Broadcast','In December 1995, a four-man team from the public-access program, \"Fact or Fiction\", braved the New Jersey\'s desolate Pine Barrens determined to deliver a live broadcast of the legendary Jersey Devil. Only one came out alive. It took the jury ninety minutes to sentence the lone survivor to life in prison. One year later, a filmmaker decides to mount his own investigation...','/wexVSBnfx4fggSmLxzn1kc51Q5.jpg','1998-10-23',87,'Released','What actually happened that night in the woods?','The Last Broadcast',34288,1.0726,5,'HoyBZ87F94U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14115,_binary '\0','/u4d4vymNPo1UuJ6ihtyy9OQgco2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0122151',6.6,181899,'en','Lethal Weapon 4','With personal crises and age weighing in on them, LAPD officers Riggs and Murtaugh must contend with a deadly Chinese crime lord trying to get his brother out of prison.','/pTLliHRoG0Qwp6qycmrMB4bD3mr.jpg','1998-07-10',127,'Released','The gang\'s all here.','Lethal Weapon 4',944,12.7788,6.61,'pi2cGmz9Q2A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14116,_binary '\0','/45Q5C4x2NQzckjqrZ0X2L42mNDg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0122186',7.4,1464,'fa','ناخدا خورشید','Captain Khorshid is a sailor who although only having one hand, manages to sail his little boat. In his village, due to its hot climate and hard living conditions, dangerous criminals are sent into exile. They want to escape from the area, so they ask a middleman to strike a deal with Khorshid. Khorshid is asked to illegally take them out of the country with his boat. At first he is reluctant, but because of the hardships of living he accepts the job.','/fEuKqsZMPLmU8IcBrRdkaIJfXs3.jpg','1987-03-02',117,'Released',NULL,'Captain Khorshid',257687,0.9641,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14117,_binary '\0','/eogP9xLzrtFwT69G6hjFnOVtmo4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0122227',8.1,5345,'ru','Остров сокровищ','Young Jim Hawkins finds himself serving with pirate captain Long John Silver in search of a buccaneer\'s treasure in this Soviet Ukrainian animated adaptation of Robert Louis Stevenson\'s classic tale.','/sEiC7v8WWiHO2Yr0cfsFtoRcbPq.jpg','1988-03-24',107,'Released',NULL,'Treasure Island',49418,2.357,7.728,'OVh58xKhT2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14118,_binary '\0','/erWQG6yXhLRHBp82Aprn8IhayAR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0122234',8.2,3897,'sh','Сабирни центар','During the excavation of ancient Roman ruins, an old archaeology professor accidentally opens the gate between our world and the world of the dead.','/1pmdW99kRRzyolp7MqFwPIBA8EF.jpg','1989-02-26',98,'Released',NULL,'Meeting Place',196892,1.1253,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14119,_binary '\0','/3AB1oujBAoA0WgChhEr57lLG5wF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0122427',6.8,2068,'hi','Chaalbaaz','Twin girls Anju and Manju are separated in infancy and brought up differently. One weak, one strong. One day, they end up at each other\'s houses. Their lives will never be the same.','/jq1f7uVoQBfKVwKQqsXDV998ftJ.jpg','1989-12-08',155,'Released',NULL,'Chaalbaaz',168430,1.1973,6,'pIv4ofBci1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14120,_binary '\0','/oNOJoW2XoH3shkQxHtOyacJRBCQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0122459',7,25442,'en','Return to Me','Dragged out on a blind date a year after his wife\'s tragic death, grieving architect Bob Rueland finds an unexpected spark not with his date, but with Grace, the sharp-witted waitress at a lively Irish-Italian restaurant. Unbeknownst to Bob, Grace is the recipient of his late wife\'s donated heart. As they grow closer, their romance offers the promise of healing and the weight of a secret that could tear them apart.','/mtYZyZh7hSiTq3gAU0C8FlcMC5.jpg','2000-04-07',116,'Released','A comedy straight from the heart.','Return to Me',2621,4.5288,6.68,'ZQNifpPNmTk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14121,_binary '\0','/lh57j971CIzI3FruTbFeWpYHjej.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0122515',6.2,8412,'en','The Acid House','A surreal triptych adapted by \"Trainspotting\" author Irvine Welsh from his acclaimed collection of short stories. Combining a vicious sense of humor with hard-talking drama, the film reaches into the hearts and minds of the chemical generation, casting a dark and unholy light into the hidden corners of the human psyche.','/o0KvKCgxMFccx3SzDI3p2218921.jpg','1998-12-31',107,'Released',NULL,'The Acid House',12229,2.4216,6.238,'Z52YjcjCrXI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14122,_binary '\0','/bP1ry1gWi9BOIVpbgvkqgOYppTA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0122529',7.1,8264,'en','Henry Fool','An egocentric bum transforms the lives of a shy New Jersey garbageman and his sister.','/1Uun13GJi5U0gs303e7BnER6SpG.jpg','1998-06-19',137,'Released','An honest man is always in trouble...','Henry Fool',37410,2.2255,6.6,'tmF9RIJVmsw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14123,_binary '\0','/ttAOV3BdJoPwYPExHw4dW4TN72P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0122541',6.8,17819,'en','An Ideal Husband','Sir Robert Chiltern is a successful government minister, well-off and with a loving wife. All this is threatened when Mrs Cheveley appears in London with damning evidence of a past misdeed. Sir Robert turns for help to his friend Lord Goring, an apparently idle philanderer and the despair of his father. Goring knows the lady of old, and, for him, takes the whole thing pretty seriously.','/Aac3Kw7qAszSotkTNle4bvu3uuH.jpg','1999-01-14',97,'Released','He just doesn\'t know it yet.','An Ideal Husband',24137,4.2582,6.469,'SJS6B8NHegg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14124,_binary '\0','/ufDS364YnnJ0dGlXVFMxB50yJeE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0122565',8.6,3523,'el','Η Κάλπικη Λίρα','Four stories, humorous, romantic or dramatic, are linked by a counterfeit gold sovereign. It is made by the honest engraver in the first story, seduced by the charms of a young widow, and it subsequently passes into the hands of a beggar and a prostitute, a wealthy miser and a newly married couple where the husband is a poor artist.','/5yEk0HpclVv2PBnHqLVv9hLdbya.jpg','1955-12-28',118,'Released',NULL,'The Counterfeit Coin',47713,1.2564,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14125,_binary '\0','/83amBpMutM9kApj3O9rg2mEMd9E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0122573',6.2,1479,'sv','Sista kontraktet','Young police officer Roger is on the trail of the international master assassin, while the assassin follows his plan to murder Swedish Prime Minister Olof Palme.','/9yMK11qu9W1NbNg12pVbYDVL6A9.jpg','1998-03-06',115,'Released',NULL,'The Last Contract',80782,1.1985,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14126,_binary '\0','/hj8mXGTrEGX9Kyc1zw8gKw0TMp8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0122603',3,2374,'en','Legion of Fire: Killer Ants','When a hive of deadly killer ants attack a town in Alaska, a small group races to survive and to find a way to stop the ruthless ants.','/cNpK3zhp0z3ZKL6znVMPxbz7jME.jpg','1998-06-24',95,'Released',NULL,'Legion of Fire: Killer Ants',98084,2.4759,4.139,'9jHGTrOfq9o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14127,_binary '\0','/zLLyLkM7ogDjwLvGv7VozUCthIv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0122642',5.2,1544,'en','One Tough Cop','A detective tries to remain loyal to his partner, and his best friend - a mobster.','/qXKVKFApORbPIOM9gyUEBpTRjmT.jpg','1998-10-09',90,'Released',NULL,'One Tough Cop',134368,1.5517,4.583,'apfqRGIPuKM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14128,_binary '\0','/fQh5iXY9YySfH1KqCoxwi8JncyN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0122648',7.3,4468,'it','Ovosodo','From childhood to fatherhood, Piero learns things the hard way while growing up in a working-class neighborhood of Livorno.','/lV5uNrculiODLGqzWsP7uV3EUPm.jpg','1997-09-12',100,'Released','Life... what a sweet, cruel, silly thing.','Ovosodo',48254,1.5904,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14129,_binary '\0','/1R70fkpPTuu8PrXLdybFbECsjHp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0122670',8.2,1400,'el','Πολυτεχνίτης κι Ερημοσπίτης','Thanasis Vengos plays a poor young man that comes to Athens looking for a job. We watch as he tries many different jobs; druggist, photographer, even wrestling referee. The result is always hilarious and explosive!','/iEybMeZTCUbES5LD0KWLOCN4uaM.jpg','1963-09-30',80,'Released',NULL,'Jack of All Trades, Master of None',296344,1.0707,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14130,_binary '\0','/uRtwAXx1m0Bk6JTXkGTig3MAJ6v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0122689',7.6,2540,'en','The Rolling Stones Rock and Roll Circus','A 1968 event put together by The Rolling Stones. The film is comprised of two concerts on a circus stage and included such acts as The Who, Taj Mahal, Marianne Faithfull, and Jethro Tull. John Lennon and his fiancee Yoko Ono performed as part of a supergroup called The Dirty Mac, along with Eric Clapton, Mitch Mitchell, and Keith Richards.','/4vm06pTpw2yfjaMV1j2weXkTJYL.jpg','1996-10-12',65,'Released','For a brief moment, it seemed Rock & Roll would INHERIT THE EARTH.','The Rolling Stones Rock and Roll Circus',18944,2.0424,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14131,_binary '\0','/frqahc6v8wt0p2Zo3XKBu2dg73z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0122690',7.2,210260,'en','Ronin','A briefcase with undisclosed contents – sought by Irish terrorists and the Russian mob – makes its way into criminals\' hands. An Irish liaison assembles a squad of mercenaries, or \'ronin\', and gives them the thorny task of recovering the case.','/AirrhRJjHwytOV0pdLu7YZ4DEyr.jpg','1998-09-25',122,'Released','Anyone is an enemy for a price.','Ronin',8195,6.7918,7,'FHrhOuz_QEk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14132,_binary '\0','/gdQk5g4TC95957Xs4xGbcOBnG56.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0122718',6.3,111448,'en','Small Soldiers','When missile technology is used to enhance toy action figures, the toys soon begin to take their battle programming too seriously.','/2nuUjSzHsoYlRvTPmLo7m7gCQry.jpg','1998-07-10',110,'Released','Big movie.','Small Soldiers',11551,11.2037,6.6,'YwIt5wagRsg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14133,_binary '\0','/nh9IaBoDGFZvnRdd6ghplEQLVv1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0122735',7.2,2178,'it','La gabbianella e il gatto','A seagull is caught by the black tide of a sinking petrol ship. She manages to fly inland and falls down in a garden by a cat. Moribund, she asks the cat to fulfill three promises: that when she lays her egg he must not eat it; that he must take care of it until it hatches; that he would teach the newborn how to fly.','/9tuNSBnodER4Dxot2b2fmbCvIEM.jpg','1998-12-22',76,'Released','Together they learn the true meaning of friendship.','Lucky and Zorba',49992,2.3084,7.644,'vl60ggCL1KA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14134,_binary '\0','/cNMIi0SIIBml1PjnQd1ns6IgdhN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0122768',6,5088,'en','Twin Sitters','An evil business executive is releasing dangerous toxins and the Barbarian Brothers set out to stop his evil work.','/nFnpQ0WaXYJszWR1P40ZF5sw0Tl.jpg','1994-10-01',93,'Released','You\'re never home alone when you\'re a twin!','Twin Sitters',48232,2.731,6.4,'K2Nd-Qo3TeY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14135,_binary '\0','/nZwGNDhoOIgwCcJN0WtTw9y5nNI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0122770',7.7,2184,'cs','Údolí včel','Cast out by his father, young Ondrej joins the Order of the Teutonic Knights, where he is raised by strict monk Armin. After years of hardship, Ondrej escapes from the Order when he is wrongly punished, and sets out for his former home. Arriving to discover his father to be dead, Ondrej now not only assumes control of his father\'s properties, but seeks to marry his former stepmother.','/xhLW4pc1x2nZjLeGIwCdXbcJ9ZE.jpg','1968-05-17',101,'Released',NULL,'The Valley of the Bees',25908,1.3954,7,'2igPZeMxRpI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14136,_binary '\0','/gQJkHlkzhzyBBS1waNgSV9SIhUq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0122883',8.1,1538,'el','Αλλοίμονο στους Νέους','Two rich old friends, Andreas and Agisilaos are in love with young Rita. Andreas believes that is youth and not money that drive the world. He sells his soul to the devil, becomes young and flirts Rita. However, Andreas understands that youth alone is not enough and decides to give a dowry to lovely Rita so that she can marry the one she loves.','/rVtDRVKAZGP8sohUH4h9LybMxoU.jpg','1961-10-30',87,'Released',NULL,'Woe to the Young',409870,0.8352,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14137,_binary '\0','/oas0DvvhhaMncvn805LjepxeoZh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0122933',6.7,170562,'en','Analyze This','Countless wiseguy films are spoofed in this film that centers on the neuroses and angst of a powerful Mafia racketeer who suffers from panic attacks. When Paul Vitti needs help dealing with his role in the \"family,\" unlucky shrink Dr. Ben Sobel is given just days to resolve Vitti\'s emotional crisis and turn him into a happy, well-adjusted gangster.','/gN8o7Ke1lUF2K8tzcLRb5bfEKbD.jpg','1999-03-05',103,'Released','New York\'s most powerful gangster is about to get in touch with his feelings.','Analyze This',9535,8.7598,6.5,'ZJyv0AYmy4c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14138,_binary '\0','/2vJe8fmPu5rxlH9lJlcHrj7bs2u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0123003',6,1690,'en','Bruno','The story of a unique young boy genius, Bruno, whose expression of his own individuality leads his family and community along an emotional journey.','/6gj9iMwlKZh3C4Q21q1qNu8idVE.jpg','2000-04-16',108,'Released','The comedy that is long on originality and short on pants.','Bruno',95136,1.5391,6.5,'9UTHePWzVH0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14139,_binary '\0','/krThHPMyhnE2SyLtLRjGOJzI9km.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0123034',5.8,5702,'en','The Curve','Two roommates plan to kill a third to take advantage of college policy giving a 4.0 grade to a suicide\'s roommates.','/a4Ql4swnnosHQoOSObHiHToPKOm.jpg','1998-01-24',91,'Released','Someone is about to go over the edge.','The Curve',44625,2.3488,5.5,'XoiPokum5is','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14140,_binary '\0','/fbfwd9neUezzsMSmWYICtf7fSXd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0123046',6.3,1373,'fa','دزد عروسکها','Leila and Bahram\'s mother is supposed to rescue her children from the troubles of their homeowners, home-grown, by buying a home loan and buying a home. But the hangman who lives outside the city does not want to see them calmly..','/hHVRdHKjMVpjmW8hWRNv4y3hcjV.jpg','1990-02-03',90,'Released',NULL,'Thief of Dolls',506974,0.9711,6.5,'IYrwJ-RUqpE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14141,_binary '\0','/scMU7yDvzZdqpqb24WcuQB0i4fb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0123092',7,4247,'ja','極道戦国志 不動','In order to settle a business dispute, a mob leader murders one of his own teenage sons. The surviving son vows to avenge his brother\'s death, and organizes his own gang of teenage killers to destroy his father\'s organization.','/kRlmTuDdZEGPbbXavNmiafUYYka.jpg','1996-10-12',99,'Released',NULL,'Fudoh: The New Generation',36282,1.8821,6.654,'cHd5icLCosg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14142,_binary '\0','/aPMeZd7EMrSC8qLT8yNPKofwCtV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0123111',6.9,3262,'sv','Här kommer Pippi Långstrump','Pippi Longstocking lives alone in Villekulla because her mother is an angel in heaven and her father is a pirate king in the Southern Seas. She befriends her next door neighbors, siblings Tommy and Annika, who are swept into Pippi\'s wild adventures.','/p0P2jdOykhoNhq4did5lHTWqlSs.jpg','1969-10-31',83,'Released','Pippi Longstocking\'s third great adventure!','Pippi Goes on Board',40696,2.7029,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14143,_binary '\0','/fZmoZ8MHLpHXWQgx3wA8Vp8O3d4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0123179',7.6,3700,'en','Mister Magoo\'s Christmas Carol','In this animated musical version of Charles Dickens\' \"A Christmas Carol\", Ebenezer Scrooge - via Mr. Magoo\'s starring performance in a stage production of the classic - doesn\'t have a ghost of a chance unless he learns the true meaning of Christmas from the three spirits who haunt him one Christmas Eve.','/v373WxuWPaUlincYeu6AIzcZUV8.jpg','1962-12-18',52,'Released',NULL,'Mister Magoo\'s Christmas Carol',49742,2.1091,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14144,_binary '\0','/mEEP7KyxdoRmuCQIsF5zADeUiyF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0123186',7.8,1499,'ka','Не горюй!','Benjamin, the local doctor is a soul of a local society, the educated, friendly, democratic person who often treats the poor for free. It makes him very popular with the locals but most certainly does not help with his bank account. He is in love with a beautiful Manette who is also crazy about him but is being watched closely by her father who called his daughter \"his small capital\" and is determined to protect her virginity until the moment the marriage contract has been signed...','/2IPcSewQCAZqrMoHPZX0NAaJGnK.jpg','1968-12-22',90,'Released',NULL,'Don\'t Grieve!',27922,0.9619,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14145,_binary '\0','/7aI6KiuTkvliEs3jVKWPV7Np4oC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0123209',6.5,13895,'en','The Other Sister','A mentally challenged girl proves herself to be every bit as capable as her \"perfect\" sister when she moves into an apartment and begins going to college.','/4rBrYRkB7btGex5Bs0yOpqBZgsR.jpg','1999-02-26',130,'Released','A love story for the romantically challenged.','The Other Sister',18417,4.6836,6.4,'2WtkWZyPehM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14146,_binary '\0','/sNwm4Z21aoahOGklFyCR3oHsgU2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0123221',5.6,2091,'en','Just the Ticket','Gary Starke is one of the best ticket scalpers in New York City. His girlfriend, Linda, doesn\'t approve of his criminal lifestyle, though, and dumps him when she gets the opportunity to study cooking in Paris. Gary realizes that he has to give up scalping if he has any chance of winning her back. But before he does, he wants to cash out on one last big score. He gets his chance when the pope announces he\'ll be performing Easter Mass at Yankee Stadium.','/5vsjad22y8jbjWwENUhF5T3O1RB.jpg','1998-02-01',115,'Released','Irresponsible, unreliable, unpredictable and totally irresistible.','Just the Ticket',26425,2.1895,5.5,'_u2G6qKLlPY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14147,_binary '\0','/sLdDuDx5pOFsaL5JCmK2lz5MWhj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0123313',8.2,1578,'el','Βοήθεια! Ο Βέγγος Φανερός Πράκτωρ \"000\"','Vengos studies in a secret agents\' academy, dreaming of becoming a great spy like 007. Unfortunately, he can\'t do anything right, so he wreaks havoc during his final exams.','/rbTWLuCowsMB2ysauN9VesXKIg3.jpg','1967-01-30',89,'Released',NULL,'Help! Vengos Visible Agent \'000\'',47799,1.064,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14148,_binary '\0','/aFt9A4TK8n869uBsOBJj5cfZRDi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0123324',6.4,4860,'en','Why Do Fools Fall In Love','In the mid-80s, three women (each with an attorney) arrive at the office of New York entertainment manager, Morris Levy. One is an L.A. singer, formerly of the Platters; one is a petty thief from Philly; one teaches school in a small Georgia town. Each claims to be the widow of long-dead doo-wop singer-songwriter Frankie Lyman, and each wants years of royalties due to his estate, money Levy has never shared. During an ensuing civil trial, flashbacks tell the story of each one\'s life with Lyman, a boyish, high-pitched, dynamic performer, lost to heroin. Slowly, the three wives establish their own bond.','/tSj2g6VdJ2UXeWk9wRa19SsxRFg.jpg','1998-08-28',116,'Released','The story of three very different women.....with one husband in common.','Why Do Fools Fall In Love',46702,2.5978,6.4,'lIlWN0Dxvfw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14149,_binary '\0','/mXpB1O5M5dZBGKyCXL5F82dwZ58.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0123328',7.5,3566,'cn','香港製造','After his father abandons the family, Autumn Moon drops out of high school and becomes a debt collector for the Triads. On his rounds, he meets and falls in love with Ping, a daughter of one of the Triads\' clients. She is suffering from a fatal kidney disease, and to pay for her medical expenses, Autumn Moon takes an assassination contract, but as he slips deeper into the criminal underworld, he\'s haunted by a figure from his past.','/gWuB0NcEyZu2oz1ppdIwNGUpZJe.jpg','1997-10-09',109,'Released',NULL,'Made in Hong Kong',26005,2.0887,7.6,'Op4HBWPiDyU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14150,_binary '\0','/qOsqRRo9jDjzypa1bMy8ldg9XhG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0123334',7.4,2095,'ja','座頭市血笑旅','Blind swordsman/masseuse Zatoichi befriends a young woman returning home with her baby. When gangsters mistake her for Zatoichi and kill her, Zatoichi determines to escort the baby to its father. He gains the reluctant help of a young pick pocket and together they travel to find the baby\'s father. But they do not reckon on the father\'s reaction to their arrival, nor on their own growing feelings for the child.','/8BecqM4fFbHrz994VYgwqUtD5xm.jpg','1964-11-17',88,'Released',NULL,'Fight, Zatoichi, Fight',54266,1.6298,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14151,_binary '\0','/cFIZb3b1wl0Gil3foG9m5RMp8fc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0123335',7.3,1693,'ja','座頭市二段斬り','Itinerant masseur and master swordsman, the blind Zatoichi, is near the village of his teacher, Hikonoichi, so he decides to visit. He learns of Hikonoichi\'s recent robbery and murder and the imprisonment of his virginal daughter, Osayo, in a brothel. Through friendship with Denroku, a local dice thrower and devoted father, Ichi uncovers an unholy alliance between the governor and the area strongman: among their scams is falsifying tax records to put farmers in debt, then forcing their daughters into prostitution at the boss\'s brothel. With help from Denroku\'s daughter, Otsuru, Ichi comforts Osayo until he can provoke showdowns with the villains and their henchmen.','/evoqWToyvUYw6kohcV485dJuIbu.jpg','1965-04-03',84,'Released',NULL,'Zatoichi\'s Revenge',54273,1.5151,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14152,_binary '\0','/AnY6qCODxXB81Sn56QvxS6EwwZA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0123385',6.7,2354,'fr','Artemisia','The story of Artemisia Gentileschi (1593-1653), one of the first well-known female painters, including her youth, when she was guided and protected by her father, the painter Orazio Gentileschi.','/5mMzt0Cw99wNk0xTT7YOdRxaqZp.jpg','1997-09-10',98,'Released','Her passion for her art changed the face of history.','Artemisia',39177,1.5169,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14153,_binary '\0','/poDiq5bSxAHAnnRomHFTm0MO8cW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0123390',8.6,2142,'ro','Brigada Diverse în alertă','The adventures of three Romanian inept petty criminals during the 1970s.','/3JthQ09Sf1B2BG2hhGPxWNUJl0Y.jpg','1971-07-26',95,'Released',NULL,'Brigade Miscellaneous on Alert',159237,1.3888,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14154,_binary '\0','/t6IaTWICf5ahVx3x1ZCpMXPFWDt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0123391',8.5,2094,'ro','Brigada Diverse intră în acțiune','Brigade Miscellaneous fights crime in a funny and serious way.','/pUexBV8BOgg7md7dSPnhjssWf5P.jpg','1970-06-06',100,'Released',NULL,'Brigade Miscellaneous Steps In',152835,1.411,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14155,_binary '\0','/bLpoz4Lz0DIdDW2HNNMA9h4lwoC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0123392',8.6,2222,'ro','Brigada Diverse la munte și la mare','Misc. Brigade must solve a drug traffic case, in their own way','/AbN4uUjVpGLbMJ3bqsX6yD4GRPS.jpg','1971-01-01',96,'Released',NULL,'Brigade Miscellaneous in the Mountains and at the Sea',94097,1.4718,7.7,'-Rvz4171W0k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14156,_binary '\0','/3TimUBrXMVblpnTsyg4HssGVbBv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0123755',7.1,263808,'en','Cube','A group of strangers find themselves trapped in a maze-like prison. It soon becomes clear that each of them possesses the peculiar skills necessary to escape, if they don\'t wind up dead first.','/x4BTjxdrOKC27FcSkBh8KPEgnum.jpg','1998-07-11',90,'Released','Don\'t look for a reason... Look for a way out.','Cube',431,7.9102,6.8,'nRZ1M4oMGJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14157,_binary '\0','/gQ4afNQyFgVhJcfQM2KBlUEDI2S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0123832',4.9,1302,'en','Family Plan','A bumbling guy takes a group of orphans to summer camp.','/3zA26F6S83D8sVy24rCuoAvpmsm.jpg','1997-01-01',95,'Released',NULL,'Family Plan',11505,2.0501,5.3,'ydl2P-UcAg4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14158,_binary '\0','/4ppGUPBhWrMdYlIiJFmkplRQ9KJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0123865',6.9,55491,'en','Gia','Gia Carangi meteorically rises to modeling fame in the late 1970s but becomes overconsumed by persistent loneliness and drug addiction.','/oFi5OIvBf59W1KFaN0cuiMEEbs1.jpg','1998-09-22',120,'Released','Too beautiful to die. Too wild to live.','Gia',14533,6.2888,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14159,_binary '\0','/xxIRKSd9LmHojUD5grvMuGypwVC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0123948',7.5,41057,'ja','キュア','A frustrated detective deals with the case of several gruesome murders committed by people who have no recollection of what they\'ve done.','/xNVJr9q6AtSbjosS6Ed9YirOkSo.jpg','1997-12-27',111,'Released','Madness. Terror. Murder.','Cure',36095,7.9813,7.585,'b4ax7CNt4ag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14160,_binary '\0','/GjoNCBnOdmKz7ZVG0IICfg1GKa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0123964',6.8,61794,'en','Life','Two men in 1930s Mississippi become friends after being sentenced to life in prison together for a crime they did not commit.','/saWYpX3ADdmdByQZVrSYUNbQ9GC.jpg','1999-04-16',108,'Released','Share it with someone you love.','Life',6522,6.2544,6.7,'7R_vTEEyxoo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14161,_binary '\0','/jLXF28lzhCA3C5BdK1pSn2mF3mR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0123976',7.7,4041,'el','Λούφα και Παραλλαγή','A group of Greek soldiers are assigned to run the Cinematographic Unit of the army in the midst of political unrest.','/kNDZ9jirhexRUWzd8YpJ50s9s2V.jpg','1984-10-01',99,'Released','Our national... tragedy now a comedy.','Loafing and Camouflage',58865,2.0081,7.436,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14162,_binary '\0','/jQzmXfjv9p2YVz5NqTTEQdDIwnl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0123987',6,8677,'en','Madeline','Horrified at the prospect of her beloved school being sold, a young French girl named Madeline uses her wit and craftiness to attempt to save it, making an unlikely new friend in the process.','/nAGRLwJC0jv7QlfJR6y32xRZqcF.jpg','1998-07-10',89,'Released','In an old house in Paris, that was covered with vines...','Madeline',35680,2.8914,6.2,'dYqx5vFA6is','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14163,_binary '\0','/3sB8Vg4BZmb7vir5L3F4aYowkwN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0124012',7.1,2031,'cs','Morgiana','Jealous of her vapidly \"good\" sister\'s popularity, poisonous Viktoria doses pretty Klara\'s tea with a slow-acting fatal substance. As the latter grows hysterically weak, the former finds success increasingly compromised by guilt, blackmail, and the pesky need to kill others lest she be exposed.','/bX8ZGlqREc3qwsO7blOPWX52HyG.jpg','1972-09-15',106,'Released',NULL,'Morgiana',53186,2.1246,7.2,'xsM8AHQmNDU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14164,_binary '\0','/ap6Mni6kKx0hMxkoPdGLObOEqjR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0124014',5.2,7030,'en','The Mutilator','As a child, Ed was cleaning his father’s hunting rifles - a surprise birthday treat for the old man - when one of them went off, hitting and killing his mother. On seeing the bloodshed, his father flew into a murderous rage - Ed just barely escaped with his life. Now in his teens, he returns home; he doesn’t expect to find his father, still there, waiting for a chance to settle the score . . .','/WdTypYAKttmUPWMQ4uLzRS6Hye.jpg','1985-01-04',86,'Released','By pick, by axe, by sword, bye bye!','The Mutilator',40451,1.6005,5,'Da3utTUGq8I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14165,_binary '\0','/7F59vpblBh2q62rdhdrObP7mJ6q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0124102',5.1,8506,'en','Strangeland','A pierced and tattooed sadist, Captain Howdy, trolls the Internet for naive teens, luring them to his home to torture and defile them. When Howdy kidnaps and tortures the daughter of police Detective Mike Gage, he is caught. Deemed insane, he is sent to an asylum but is released soon after, seemingly better. However, Gage knows it is only a matter of time before Howdy strikes again, and he\'s ready to unleash his own form of retribution when the time comes.','/AhQh5rtPymR1J8daZc0FNXiSkU.jpg','1998-10-02',86,'Released','Wanna come to a party?','Strangeland',27791,2.2456,5.044,'8KYGdpYnHAY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14166,_binary '\0','/lauOVXEeFSCvCMTwSbR0ybAjElN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0124179',5.5,7674,'en','Two Girls and a Guy','Two women confront their boyfriend, a two-timing actor who professed eternal love to each.','/9Hj90OgXLBReJCAGqOOzzxjZfCh.jpg','1998-04-24',84,'Released','Thanks to his two girlfriends, Blake is about to learn a new sexual position. Honesty.','Two Girls and a Guy',32456,2.8793,5.2,'TOEUpyMZl94','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14167,_binary '\0','/1saY8VCrhrRRbsDqgkjkSo6nqpm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0124185',6.4,1729,'en','Under the Skin','Although married and pregnant Rose has always been mother\'s favorite, it is younger sister Iris whose life is shaken up by mother\'s death. Suffocating, Iris spirals out of control and copes by losing herself in sexual oblivion.','/zE2EAofyZq33fWViMB6bwwHQDHw.jpg','1997-11-28',82,'Released','Your body betrays your soul.','Under the Skin',77955,1.4901,6.125,'0w8sScb8pu4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14168,_binary '\0','/2hrgzOj35M3Fa3YFWiaAD2Ty6Hu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0124198',6.3,51225,'en','Very Bad Things','Kyle Fisher has one last night to celebrate life as a single man before marrying Laura, so he sets out to Vegas with four of his best buddies. But a drug and alcohol filled night on the town with a stripper who goes all the way, turns into a cold night in the desert with shovels when the stripper goes all the way into a body bag after dying in their bathroom. And that\'s just the first of the bodies to pile up before Kyle can walk down the aisle...','/rYmyRxF5e9fBdgcQScKu0CUtMy5.jpg','1998-09-11',100,'Released','They\'ve been bad. Very bad.','Very Bad Things',10029,4.7601,6.3,'WUIO3LKZcdI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14169,_binary '\0','/wfWsbl3NGEul8Xff5h1GoSE0hLM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0124207',7.6,6021,'ru','Вор','Katya and her 6-year-old son Sanya, who, in 1952, meet a veteran Soviet officer named Tolyan. Katya falls in love with Tolyan, who turns out to be a small time criminal, but who also becomes a father figure to Sanya ...','/rnHqDzKmnrm47dzhQvLJtZKRVK8.jpg','1997-10-13',96,'Released','He\'ll steal your heart!','The Thief',46187,2.0668,7,'Fs7FGGvRQYU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14170,_binary '\0','/82QlrfE3Cdctd1cvfWOz8Y04n8b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0124272',6,1888,'nl','Abeltje','Pupil Abel is the victim of Laura\'s nasty prank, yet gets accidentally blamed and overreacts. His ma withdraws him from school and gets him a job as lift-boy. But its\' a special lift: when he pushes the forbidden green button, it takes him, Laura, Jozias Tump and Maria Klaterhoen to Manhattan. There he\'s mistaken by a rich woman who looks like his mother for her long missing son Johnny. When a police helicopter comes to tow the lift cabin, the Dutchmen get back in. It takes them to a Latin American country, Perugona. The new revolutionary leader realizes presidents live about one year, so he gives the job to Mr. Tump, who saved his life. The news coverage attracts Abel\'s and Johnny\'s family, in time for an even weirder finale.','/zEse3rAT4qUq1H7lfEcZ1Syld1x.jpg','1998-11-26',110,'Released',NULL,'The Flying Liftboy',21872,0.7929,5.857,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14171,_binary '\0','/jpauygSFjJA4NCWQptFlybfoph7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0124295',7.1,8129,'en','The Big One','The Big One is an investigative documentary from director Michael Moore who goes around the country asking why big American corporations produce their product abroad where labor is cheaper while so many Americans are unemployed, losing their jobs, and would happily be hired by such companies as Nike.','/jodI8ifzMO2IvuE0oBnqLZ2LCgF.jpg','1997-09-06',91,'Released','Protecting the Earth from the scum of corporate America.','The Big One',1774,1.4153,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14172,_binary '\0','/qr3yKVRrPmPCpxqtEeFkdisGE4n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0124298',6.7,78430,'en','Blast from the Past','Following a bomb scare in the 1960s that locked the Webbers into their bomb shelter for 35 years, Adam now ventures forth into Los Angeles to obtain food and supplies for his family, and a non-mutant wife for himself.','/qVN4bbVX2tzaNbAdEJT5eOPq26c.jpg','1999-02-12',112,'Released','She\'d never met anyone like him. He\'s never met anyone... Period.','Blast from the Past',11622,10.8838,6.8,'hDNR4CxYtls','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14173,_binary '\0','/zAioXoqvQa8zWPa1XeHJWi1Tggr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0124312',7.4,1889,'es','Cenizas del paraíso','A judge falls from the roof of the Federal Courthouse. A woman is murdered. Between them and the three sons of the judge there is a connection that will be investigated by a woman judge who is determined to discover the truth.','/d0r5mYcglrJ0GM4Gsb4liCZ3Fwr.jpg','1997-08-07',121,'Released','Three siblings, one woman, one destiny','Cenizas del paraíso',90171,1.3856,6.897,'owCOpUqtvJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14174,_binary '\0','/dlZzE2HyO9USfTyZvzsLK5ge2hL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0124315',7.4,110219,'en','The Cider House Rules','Homer is an orphan who was never adopted, becoming the favorite of orphanage director Dr. Larch. Dr. Larch imparts his full medical knowledge on Homer, who becomes a skilled, albeit unlicensed, physician. But Homer yearns for a self-chosen life outside the orphanage. What will Homer learn about life and love in the cider house? What of the destiny that Dr. Larch has planned for him?','/qAECAgqjSFRVZzEEGbFAZqZNiDh.jpg','1999-12-17',126,'Released','A story about how far we must travel to find the place where we belong.','The Cider House Rules',1715,10.1678,7.087,'pGdZBESUSfk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14175,_binary '\0','/pFznyhH87VcFhhO3kOBHhB1r7Rs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0124349',4.7,1553,'en','Deathline','A prostitute helps a U.S. smuggler evade assassins and seek revenge upon his traitorous partner in Moscow.','/krIxi3YQCAfvxXbjSnSkz4Iwphb.jpg','1997-09-26',93,'Released','In The Future, Death Is Only The Beginning.','Deathline',64218,2.2274,5.1,'ZoHJesBnpDo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14176,_binary '\0','/yFYMSV63x0qgywC5pQZIrJJbDu3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0124437',7.9,2609,'el','Ο Δράκος','On New Year’s Eve, a timid bank clerk is mistaken for a notorious criminal mastermind who rules the streets of Athens. Embracing his mistaken identity comes with a price though, as his unwitting white lie begins to unravel.','/vtmSjaBQAEaQMkJwf2CQCPrwa0E.jpg','1956-03-05',104,'Released','The most biting, the most daring social satire','The Ogre of Athens',47717,1.1256,7.1,'6C1filSWrKA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14177,_binary '\0','/oyozrAwuzpXIhxvsCA688SFcIEw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0124595',6.9,16179,'en','Return to Paradise','Lewis, Sheriff and Tony are three friends vacationing in Malaysia. Sheriff and Tony eventually leave to pursue careers in New York, but Lewis stays behind to work with orangutans. Two years later, Sheriff and Tony learn that, because of their past actions, Lewis has been arrested for drug possession. With Lewis facing a death sentence, the friends are left with a difficult decision: return to Malaysia and split Lewis\' sentence, or let him die.','/t4lmZtx1zLUijwO2oHHEbUQ7j41.jpg','1998-08-10',109,'Released','Give up three years of their lives or give up the life of their friend. They have eight days to decide.','Return to Paradise',10278,4.2704,6.47,'t58hRl6dLyY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14178,_binary '\0','/tShcOCcKLxaBJw43OH35SzLkwT8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0124621',6.7,1888,'it','Femina Ridens','Beautiful PR woman, Maria finds herself trapped in the home of the sinister and troubled Dr. Sayer, where she is subjected to a series of increasingly bizarre, terrifying, and degrading sex games. Sayer admits that he has murdered several women after the same ordeal, always killing them at the point of orgasm. But all is not what it seems, and through a series of twists and turns, the whole situation is slowly turned on its head.','/iVnuImueARSbd6DsMRi6PgGwRJ0.jpg','1969-08-24',86,'Released','Dominance. Submission.','The Laughing Woman',100812,2.5353,6.7,'Nx2ggAFQNJ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14179,_binary '\0','/eW9vrzXW0r8glKx6p27i1iQblsr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0124718',6.9,55282,'en','He Got Game','A basketball player\'s father must try to convince him to go to a college so he can get a shorter prison sentence.','/kd8hRaysUQOz7AvSorZDJHuihcJ.jpg','1998-05-01',136,'Released','The father, the son and the holy game.','He Got Game',9469,5.1074,6.8,'LnN4t7xJd_s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14180,_binary '\0','/AkyvSlL1XASeZolYjJRvzWjaTOF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0124770',7.5,5211,'ja','機動警察パトレイバー 2 the Movie','A Japanese police unit who use giant anthropomorphic robots (called Labors) is caught up in a political struggle between the civilian authorities and the military when a terrorist act is blamed on an Air Force jet. With the aid of a government agent, the team gets close to a terrorist leader to stop things from going out of control when after the military is impelled to impose martial law.','/aB7HCqsA3d2TkAoTkiy7sioJZJ9.jpg','1993-08-14',113,'Released',NULL,'Patlabor 2: The Movie',14572,3.5492,7.412,'bRYWHzTVkow','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14181,_binary '\0','/bFCJcJ8Grp12Fkeh0X4oUcoV5uR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0124819',6.1,39479,'en','Orgazmo','A devout Mormon living in L.A. becomes a pornographic actor after his martial arts moves impress a big-time director.','/hu1DbDbrutEuiK9qSR4LExLYQby.jpg','1998-07-02',94,'Released','Fighting crime never felt so good!','Orgazmo',8675,3.9025,6.096,'v5QitQpqpSU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14182,_binary '\0','/zFMkDYxE9RIdcRRyvsV8amQdLDs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0124836',3.6,1703,'cn','女警察','Incriminating evidence against a gang is left in a cab when a gang member dies in it. The gang chases the innocent cab driver, who receives help from the dead gangster\'s sister - a tough police woman.','/1LfkWHskx9ESxdt5NbxzLeEfWBJ.jpg','1973-04-26',84,'Released','Young Tiger','The Heroine',38034,2.8761,4.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14183,_binary '\0','/woldnmHWqYpUYoGzTQkiXtaLQxT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0124879',6.8,23147,'en','Simon Birch','Simon Birch and Joe Wenteworth are boys who have a reputation for being oddballs. Joe never knew his father, and his mother, Rebecca, is keeping her lips sealed no matter how much he protests. Simon, meanwhile, is an 11-year-old dwarf whose outsize personality belies his small stature. Indeed, he often assails the local reverend with thorny theological questions and joins Joe on his quest to find his biological father.','/rwUmbLDSfFyDeXrO3HxXNNN254D.jpg','1998-09-11',114,'Released','Destiny has big plans for little Simon Birch.','Simon Birch',22796,3.7596,6.867,'AGU8cOHxSxo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14184,_binary '\0','/kz8uFk8AYDu4an8PhkdGLbVJXMi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0124901',7.1,22345,'en','Thursday','A former Los Angeles drug dealer moves far away to Texas, making a new life for himself as a married architect in the suburbs. His old crime partner unexpectedly shows up with heroin and gangster business, attracting a slew of violent unsavory characters.','/pbfBCMSzmKlAHZUDwsrtmG7GZP3.jpg','1998-09-25',87,'Released','They say the past always catches up with you. This could be the day.','Thursday',9812,4.4386,6.908,'LJ0lN6yLrrg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14185,_binary '\0','/ayRhG0eoQwJ6il7bmXGrZx8rUta.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0125022',6.3,62694,'en','Heartbreakers','Max and Page are a brilliant mother/daughter con team who have their grift down to a fine science. Max targets wealthy, willing men and marries them. Page then seduces them, and Max catches her husband in the act. Then it\'s off to palimony city and the next easy mark.','/bwvec0gRMSpLakcPuxe0RWScNv3.jpg','2001-03-23',123,'Released','Meet the mother and daughter who\'ll love you for richer...and leave you for poorer.','Heartbreakers',10833,6.2493,6.145,'xplT0169ACQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14186,_binary '\0','/u5ThCZj4V2rtkpoUhXz59yUsDWf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0125128',6.8,3163,'en','The Hanging Garden','William, a once obese and troubled teen, goes back to his family\'s home after being gone, without word, for ten years and finds it (and his family) haunted with his past. He had moved to the city and become a fit, well-adjusted gay man, but during his visit home, he becomes unhinged as the newly remembered reasons for his miserable adolescence come to life in each of their presents.','/kXhjuFB4U8xkEd6SY84S42w3Q8R.jpg','1997-09-05',91,'Released','It\'s hard to go home... ten years after your death.','The Hanging Garden',35161,1.3695,6.3,'xKVZ0NOXGtY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14187,_binary '\0','/FrQeVJiPgqVIN4ISIxk4oh43lr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0125209',6.6,1838,'en','I Think I Do','The marriage of mutual friends reunites former college roommates Bob and Brendan, who tried to ignore the sexual tension that always flowed between them. Brendan finally comes out to Bob at the reception, but is it a case of too little, too late?','/59LvJlLf2wIhi9mWOpCGhqVLopc.jpg','1997-06-20',90,'Released','3 Days. 2 Couples. 1 Wedding. No Funerals.','I Think I Do',19797,2.1468,6.2,'RuCjCDcQ7sk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14188,_binary '\0','/bi4fsFHOeXlapR0g8SSvSVCXacT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0125301',7.2,1302,'cs','Kdo chce zabít Jessii?','In this zany Czechoslovakian comedy, a scientist invents a machine that projects a sleeping person\'s dream on a screen; disaster soon follows when the machine malfunctions and the cartoon-like dream characters become very real!','/vTyGH9bn948xMGaLjInhZp9tqyJ.jpg','1966-08-26',81,'Released','A comedy about a prohibited beauty.','Who Wants to Kill Jessie?',65904,1.4969,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14189,_binary '\0','/enTZhfxAdgOCdFdbj52MR3F10yC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0125439',7.2,390346,'en','Notting Hill','London bookstore owner William Thacker\'s quiet life turns upside down when a chance encounter with famous actress Anna Scott sparks an unlikely romance challenged by their vastly different worlds.','/hHRIf2XHeQMbyRb3HUx19SF5Ujw.jpg','1999-05-21',124,'Released','Can the most famous film star in the world fall for the man on the street?','Notting Hill',509,13.0501,7.262,'bMrOp79dM74','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14190,_binary '\0','/gG8U4kRbDDQ28I0UJnsCBZ0imUv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0125454',6.6,17651,'en','Paulie','Paulie, a talking parrot, recounts his travels looking for his original owner to a Russian janitor who helps him to the end of his journey.','/aiW8TWjIuFveTcA5BCU7KMjPaaW.jpg','1998-04-17',91,'Released','The bird is the word','Paulie',36568,5.9456,7,'AGV8nB_EEAU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14191,_binary '\0','/pqnBZ5vdLkGo0Yt641bArAIvzDs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0125507',5.8,2006,'no','Sofies verden','One day fourteen-year-old Sophie Amundsen comes home from school to find in her mailbox two notes, with one question on each: \"Who are you? and \"Where does the world come from?','/vRLqdK9JW9tbcyDLgGchrMkxVAS.jpg','1999-08-06',113,'Released',NULL,'Sophie\'s World',41992,1.6243,6.3,'2tyWveV-Gg0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14192,_binary '\0','/x2Aj04sAnLydBeRakOhpT7orIK9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0125510',4.1,2276,'en','Splatter University','A sociology instructor finds her new teaching duties at a private college interrupted by the presence of a killer.','/cJqS0Qyk9QZDvIojWKye9VhuwtO.jpg','1984-07-13',77,'Released','Earn a higher degree in terror!','Splatter University',30996,1.1556,4.1,'W9ec8g53Yyg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14193,_binary '\0','/kTcL3qdlW6hBwz3EcvxuHdyADK5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0125522',7.1,1576,'en','Sue','An unemployed ex-office worker searching for work floats a fragile line of sanity as she struggles to find friendship and companionship. Her tenuous grasp on reality further fluctuates when a man whom she met in a restaurant and started an affair with is called to go to India for an assignment. The final straw occurs when she is evicted and moves into a sleazy hotel. She then starts seeking casual sex in unorthodox locations just to have human contact.','/8qruld52pQloOmSXp6PxAMheMI6.jpg','1998-09-10',91,'Released','A Woman in New York','Sue',49813,1.8626,6.808,'GbFqTte33U0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14194,_binary '\0','/k6xQZq2jkA7xRpvyy2kLWprFwIN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0125659',7.7,76454,'es','Abre los ojos','Handsome 25-year-old Cesar had it all -- a successful career, expensive cars, a swank bachelor\'s pad, and an endless string of beautiful and willing women -- until he is thrown into a strange psychological mystery after a car accident scars his face and lands him in prison.','/1NkQNM5bw3U7n3RCba8JKnb61Ds.jpg','1997-12-19',117,'Released',NULL,'Open Your Eyes',1902,6.2935,7.5,'1zX8gwWvke8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14195,_binary '\0','/c6jFpztvihsXraV51up2nxXfm5t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0125664',7.4,144257,'en','Man on the Moon','The story of the life and career of eccentric avant-garde comedian, Andy Kaufman.','/msOZS07xRIFnapwp3fprGbKEAfT.jpg','1999-12-22',118,'Released','Hello, my name is Andy and this is my movie.','Man on the Moon',1850,8.4581,7.217,'cvaHj0np8GM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14196,_binary '\0','/yvq8yls4IwRb3Re9DPwTtCAFl4E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0125678',5.1,4563,'en','Bongwater','David is an artist and a pothead. He\'s fallen in love with the beautiful and sexy Serena, and things are going simply splendidly until poor David\'s house burns down. Serena doesn\'t need the bad vibes, so she splits the scene and runs off to New York with rocker and junkie Tommy. Lonely David finally turns to the sweet, sweet comfort of marijuana and his strange menagerie of friends to forget about his lost home and love','/3gW8VZHOvvS1KnyH3u0svl7yCU8.jpg','1998-04-18',97,'Released','When everything in life goes to pot.','Bongwater',14887,1.808,4.8,'bri1GOu48dA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14197,_binary '\0','/51O2KgqWW9KzniZFcwVxCoNspsn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0125718',7.4,1254,'fa','دل‌شدگان','A group of Iranian classical musicians in the Ghajar era try to release their first record, which takes them on a journey to France.','/4MnFCm2DD4uqMWlDn5UxTpW7MNN.jpg','1992-04-01',91,'Released',NULL,'Love-Stricken',389882,0.7537,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14198,_binary '\0','/skmIpaxOAg6vf7FPPKZ6Drw6vD9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0125879',6.2,4466,'en','Lulu on the Bridge','A famous jazz saxophonist\'s life is forever changed after he is accidentally shot. After discovering a mysterious package, he meets and falls in love with a beautiful aspiring actress, but their happiness is cut short by a series of strange, dreamlike events.','/9wcqbfKtZtbpRPO2ymldubnUnSH.jpg','1998-09-06',103,'Released','Is she real? ..or did he make her up?','Lulu on the Bridge',42848,2.7267,5.9,'rDXidnYUmO0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14199,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0125968',8.5,1582,'ro','Operatiunea Monstrul','A group of five work colleagues leave for an expedition in the Danube Delta, without letting their wives know anything about it. Going fishing and hunting, the characters end up in the funniest and ridiculous situations.','/xGPuAmLSXybW7e7AkRB6DI0dx0C.jpg','1976-01-01',102,'Released',NULL,'Operation \'The Monster\'',38779,1.2993,8.3,'K1JA9kqAJp8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14200,_binary '\0','/fEr2cdMiY1OPmGRUGnH12F0VYRN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0125971',6.4,9884,'en','Outside Providence','In this coming-of-age comedy, Tim Dunphy is leading a go-nowhere existence, spending his days smoking pot and hanging out with his best friend, Drugs Delaney. But Tim\'s lazy days of getting high are jettisoned after a brush with the law convinces his blue-collar dad to send him to a Connecticut prep school. The one saving grace of the new school is Jane, a fellow student Tim falls for immediately.','/xSqewkFWR0zs7OkXLOd10VnxFPN.jpg','1999-09-01',96,'Released','Tim\'s getting a future... whether he likes it or not!','Outside Providence',14578,3.3334,5.9,'oCVN60P9gsY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14201,_binary '\0','/5HPtthcaZFwnN7Y7skEiDCJsXMe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0126004',6,2720,'fr','La Rose de fer','A young couple out for a walk decide to take a stroll through a large cemetery. As darkness begins to fall they realize they can\'t find their way out, and soon their fears begin to overtake them.','/wEch3pkYG4w5Zuc296LxjGB1g4T.jpg','1973-04-12',80,'Released','The strangest of love stories','The Iron Rose',84473,1.8513,6.2,'IeCXKCpyHIM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14202,_binary '\0','/w0eKUOEog2ImtktCHAMUZws8qif.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0126029',7.9,821581,'en','Shrek','It ain\'t easy bein\' green -- especially if you\'re a likable (albeit smelly) ogre named Shrek. On a mission to retrieve a gorgeous princess from the clutches of a fire-breathing dragon, Shrek teams up with an unlikely compatriot -- a wisecracking donkey.','/iB64vpL3dIObOtMZgX3RqdVdQDc.jpg','2001-05-18',90,'Released','The greatest fairy tale never told.','Shrek',808,35.5466,7.779,'HobeWN9DnsY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14203,_binary '\0','/ry3fJWl57KNiTO2wJN18es2maib.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0126100',7.6,2240,'en','Tess of the D\'Urbervilles','Thomas Hardy\'s classic epic remains one of the most popular novels, this TV adaptation vividly depicts the powerful tale of a peasant girl whose life is torn apart by the love and jealousy of two men. Justine Waddell stars as the hapless Child of Nature who is tossed around by the dark forces of fate. Jason Flemyng is the dark and sinister Alec D\'Urberville whose relentless pursuit of Tess triggers the heroine\'s downfall. Oliver Milburn plays the handsome young Angel Clare, the caring rebel who falls deeply in love with Tess.','/ecNHSAhWkZnHJ3dOXwmq1llWkhi.jpg','1998-03-08',180,'Released',NULL,'Tess of the D\'Urbervilles',128714,2.174,8.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14204,_binary '\0','/3TQglwPIrFCCqA3T92UWYqv1GID.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0126220',6.4,1637,'en','A Bright Shining Lie','Something in his past keeps career Army man John Paul Vann from advancing past colonel. He views being sent to Vietnam as part of the US military advisory force a stepping stone to promotion. However, he disagrees vocally (and on the record) with the way the war is being run and is forced to leave the military. Returning to Vietnam as a civilian working with the Army, he comes to despise some South Vietnamese officers while he takes charge of some of the U.S. forces and continues his liaisons with Vietnamese women.','/M23xbNgYsUEOYMgH48K72rXsi4.jpg','1998-05-30',118,'Released','In war as in life, the difference between truth and deception is what a man allows himself to believe.','A Bright Shining Lie',13923,2.1737,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14205,_binary '\0','/AuHqRWvDYvw082NAaJ82KSCzuxU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0126234',6.5,7886,'hi','चमत्कार','When Sunder loses everything, he seeks refuge in a graveyard, where he befriends a ghost.','/tJlGNBkE0DNQ9iLkHMY2gsCOza3.jpg','1992-07-08',171,'Released',NULL,'Chamatkar',45002,2.0831,6.467,'qz2NLAVnSvk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14206,_binary '\0','/ehy7y1EgoeDjVcXjBB6i4FACabV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0126237',6,1651,'ru','Через тернии к звёздам','In the 23rd century, a reconnaissance craft discovers an unknown destroyed spaceship in deep recesses of space. The crew discovers the sole survivor - the mysterious Niya, an artificial being who appears to be the last of her kind, who possesses unique and unimaginable powers. Taken in by a family of scientists to unlock her memories and harness her abilities, a journey to discover Niya’s origins begins - taking us through the stars from Earth, to a dying planet light years away in need of help…','/fYbKCKWKXuGcV8ckeCSUA0M65JV.jpg','1981-04-01',148,'Released',NULL,'To the Stars by Hard Ways',26873,0.9734,5.6,'54g_CBeGqOM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14207,_binary '\0','/oRJDlTmdYToqJotGsehhdfejVy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0126250',6.8,14399,'en','Cookie\'s Fortune','Conflict arises in the small town of Holly Springs when an old woman\'s death causes a variety of reactions among family and friends.','/3ZCLVOfEyGowLWsgOF4vn6vjRsJ.jpg','1999-03-24',118,'Released','Welcome to Holly Springs... home of murder, mayhem and catfish enchiladas.','Cookie\'s Fortune',9465,2.9334,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14208,_binary '\0','/p647Ybydodyr4Qli20LV8olPX2z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0126261',6.1,2713,'en','Desert Blue','An academic obsessed with roadside attractions and his tv-star daughter stop at a small desert town to see the world\'s largest ice cream cone, where, because of an accident that spilled an unknown substance all over the highway, they are forced to spend a few days with the towns eccentric residents.','/m81tA5hmjJ4Xzp3Yxs0dcnl8B1q.jpg','1999-06-04',90,'Released','Once You Get There, You\'ll Never Want To Leave','Desert Blue',41730,2.1348,5.7,'J3HNzMiNpbY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14209,_binary '\0','/aruMeacEyebJuzCc7dvfO9GETo3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0126344',6.7,2518,'en','I Went Down','Fresh out of prison, Git rescues a former best friend (now living with Git\'s girlfriend) from a beating at the hands of loan sharks. He\'s now in trouble with the mob boss, Tom French, who sends Git to Cork with another debtor, Bunny Kelly, to find a guy named Frank Grogan, and take him to a man with a friendly face at a shack across a bog. It\'s a tougher assignment than it seems: Git\'s a novice, Bunny\'s prone to rash acts, Frank doesn\'t want to be found (and once he\'s found, he has no money), and maybe Tom\'s planning to murder Frank, which puts Git in a moral dilemma. Then, there\'s the long-ago disappearance of Sonny Mulligan. What\'s a decent and stand-up lad to do?','/2rApWxlYkiwNZBSC3KJ7WFWWq1T.jpg','1997-10-03',107,'Released','One doesn\'t count, the other can\'t. Dis-organised crime.','I Went Down',12655,1.5894,6,'vvjMed6Wlug','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14210,_binary '\0','/lHmI3sEY99Sduaupnx3BUXwcD7u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0126388',5.5,27671,'en','Legionnaire','Alain Lefevre is a boxer paid by a Marseille mobster to take a dive. When he wins the fight he attempts to flee to America with the mobster\'s girlfriend Katrina. This plan fails and he seeks escape by joining the foreign legion. As part of the legion he tangles with abusive lieutenant Steinkampf and bonds with legionnaires Luther, Mackintosh and Rosetti.','/sBeI7TeJzVw103iacL03v7Y5mCX.jpg','1998-12-03',98,'Released','A fugitive from a killer. A remote outpost. A fight to the death.','Legionnaire',3513,4.1023,5.851,'_SG7kiDdjMg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14211,_binary '\0','/vOxIhxV5D578Cmm7JEptJsyeBxB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0126604',6.4,15808,'en','Pecker','A Baltimore teenager who picks up a second-hand camera starts snapping his way to stardom, soon turning into a nationwide sensation, with a fateful choice between his life and his art.','/ox6Myr2r36zr7aqnisQGZp2EW33.jpg','1998-09-25',86,'Released','He never realized how far 35 millimeters would take him.','Pecker',11855,3.5311,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14212,_binary '\0','/pF6kmtP2T8bOXhW2Z4VGsXEFkJy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0126618',5.5,1446,'it','I pompieri','In the barracks of the \"Settecamini\" fire brigade in Rome, the shabby Squadra 17 tackles missions with resounding failures, waiting in vain for a chance for redemption.','/4o2pxQsGIgMw8lV3ElUCNFkpyaj.jpg','1985-10-25',97,'Released',NULL,'Firefighters',38310,1.0792,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14213,_binary '\0','/zbDTA5mGW6tpEI5GjR3xGplLVrZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0126765',7.1,7876,'de','23','The movie\'s plot is based on the true story of a group of young computer hackers from Hannover, Germany. In the late 1980s the orphaned Karl Koch invests his heritage in a flat and a home computer. At first he dials up to bulletin boards to discuss conspiracy theories inspired by his favorite novel, R.A. Wilson\'s \"Illuminatus\", but soon he and his friend David start breaking into government and military computers. Pepe, one of Karl\'s rather criminal acquaintances senses that there is money in computer cracking - he travels to east Berlin and tries to contact the KGB.','/rkIxy5BCPUV0EzXalywT5m6mOIn.jpg','1998-07-02',99,'Released',NULL,'23',1557,1.6927,6.835,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14214,_binary '\0','/5rr7ii7N6Ym2zy0Q1pn7XPT6ZZK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0126810',6.6,3626,'en','Bedrooms and Hallways','At the suggestion of a straight friend, gay man Leo joins a men’s group, where he causes some upsets by declaring his attraction to one of its members.','/tH02iMSE2qSmkl6i0x4sbhfS58M.jpg','1998-08-01',96,'Released','Re-model Your Love Life.','Bedrooms and Hallways',40694,2.1124,6,'i11ToqLd0_E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14215,_binary '\0','/hLr3ybylDMnC33mnK9IRPQXFntl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0126816',4.8,4921,'en','Blackjack','After saving Casey, a daughter of his friend, from hired assassins, Jack Devlin is hit with a strange phobia - fear of white color. But when his other friend, who works as a bodyguard for a supermodel, is wounded, Jack decides to step in for him. Now he must confront his fear and the assassin, who seems to be well aware of Jack\'s problem.','/xinJIob2IVjXaupIkSj2TGiJYJf.jpg','1998-06-11',112,'Released','He\'s just been dealt... a deadly hand.','Blackjack',39083,2.1143,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14216,_binary '\0','/5iwtSyrrus3V1MfkiXdKQjdhx9s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0126838',7,2758,'ko','초록물고기','Returning home and finding his town drastically changed, a former soldier falls in with gangsters.','/td3XJKc0fpvdkDQIGgXJEPsEj8r.jpg','1997-02-07',111,'Released',NULL,'Green Fish',95482,2.7987,6.9,'ZdscPvb2siA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14217,_binary '\0','/abrtCipUf8JrcCdcfF1wA4bxEXm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0126848',2.1,1620,'en','Cry Wilderness','A Bigfoot-type creature befriends Paul, a young student. His father is a park ranger trying to capture an escaped tiger. Everyone in town is on edge and wants the tiger killed. David tries to keep Bigfoot a secret.','/r69TNogRUIyLbOMeExo50n4HXk1.jpg','1987-02-01',93,'Released','\"Legends do live\" if you truly believe','Cry Wilderness',216163,1.0995,2.5,'WdqcazJPOb8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14218,_binary '\0','/94PblztgYHJFeZsaEOr7iR3TCBo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0126859',5.3,3462,'en','The Loss of Sexual Innocence','The story of the sexual development of a filmmaker through three stages of his life.','/eVg5oHFnzEE51cZ8Tq1qe8iWMZk.jpg','1999-04-29',106,'Released',NULL,'The Loss of Sexual Innocence',15059,2.3704,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14219,_binary '\0','/dtISA4Cv96mlmhnaVLnvU7ALDPw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0126861',5.3,1337,'en','Denial','Couples split up after a comment at an LA dinner party sets up arguments about how truthful partners are in their relationships.','/nFtKGYOqabGaUEgN5UVXV4LYSPW.jpg','1998-05-21',93,'Released',NULL,'Denial',45427,1.5037,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14220,_binary '\0','/8OFoHybzT7DbXkP1RmcuCjIHDZa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0126871',6.7,8168,'hi','दीवाना','A singer marries his biggest fan, but his uncle plans to kill him in order to gain his money.','/8liOcHgcghI3aQFxq8QCGKKqQKX.jpg','1992-06-25',163,'Released',NULL,'Deewana',45001,2.2953,6.755,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14221,_binary '\0','/lNPPNnYM3j0cb8IZ9CsJiDt0BK9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0126886',7.2,112262,'en','Election','A high school teacher meets his match in an over-achieving student politician.','/fbo0IYzBc32dD5SjFzKIgfp4O4F.jpg','1999-04-23',103,'Released','Reading. Writing. Revenge.','Election',9451,4.6289,6.9,'XaQvqhtCYW0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14222,_binary '\0','/jYg7oXQUB3yW6WHYVXn5ltXfcpa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0126916',6.6,40665,'en','For Love of the Game','A baseball legend almost finished with his distinguished career at the age of forty has one last chance to prove who he is, what he is capable of, and win the heart of the woman he has loved for the past four years.','/vkeKxoSXE1qMArcFNTNBBH8TjKZ.jpg','1999-09-17',138,'Released','Billy Chapel must choose between the woman he loves and the game he lives for.','For Love of the Game',10390,6.2866,6.4,'qSz1KqZZvpc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14223,_binary '\0','/wgCUuIFoR1EFgt7DmkoYuHXSzXZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0126938',6.3,1250,'en','Hav Plenty','Lee Plenty is an almost broke would-be novelist and Havilland Savage is a rich and very beautiful woman and his friend. When she invites him to her home for New Year\'s Eve, they start to build up a romance.','/vJutTuVdm5XxL3ixMFqw2o0AS8C.jpg','1997-09-11',92,'Released',NULL,'Hav Plenty',51955,1.4283,5.8,'Bp7av9COM2k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14224,_binary '\0','/ocuFOTnAzBruxOR87JMX43a8tX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0127045',5,3401,'en','Neon Maniacs','A group of teenagers in San Francisco discover a nest of homicidal monsters living in a tower of the Golden Gate Bridge, but when they try to tell authorities, no one believes them.','/2OOORWY2makxH498NqmhGEYWKKC.jpg','1986-11-14',91,'Released','There are twelve good reasons to be afraid of the dark. And every one of them is a killer.','Neon Maniacs',26676,2.0554,5.128,'dVVR0GZWFqA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14225,_binary '\0','/8cHafSnxWj4uuR0F6mrfkhblez2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0127276',4.6,1388,'en','The Shadow Men','An innocent family outing becomes an exercise in terror when a blinding light from the sky descends on the Wilsons - Bob, Dez, and their son Andy, rendering them unconscious. They awake the following morning with no memory of the incident, yet they are all plagued by images of extraterrestrials and inexplicable anxiety.','/hBaR548OuaCAtglXZWbHu31dVIz.jpg','1998-09-25',94,'Released','They know that you know','The Shadow Men',60009,1.9406,4.614,'wSs-Uz7nMog','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14226,_binary '\0','/9VWz4tKEs9EHPCTfemreeXVIv08.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0127288',6.1,1843,'en','Six Ways to Sunday','Harry Odum is a henpecked 18-year-old momma\'s boy with a violent temper in Youngstown, Ohio. After impressing a local boss of the Jewish Mafia, he begins working as a hit man alongside crack addict Arnie Finklestein.','/5Y2MYk6966UCtxY1tm9d41H2LyT.jpg','1999-03-05',97,'Released','There are worse crimes than killing someone.','Six Ways to Sunday',47501,1.8505,6.1,'IlmBKkd_Yxo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14227,_binary '\0','/8LYF5QQjN4lPyBNy4wNrncQV0o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0127296',6.1,3952,'en','Splendor','Veronica is a white-bread beauty searching for a good man in Los Angeles. While slam dancing at a Halloween rave, she meets Abel, a sensitive poet. Then she meets Zed, a supersexy tattooed drummer with incredible biceps. Who will she choose? Does she go for true love or cheap sex? She can\'t decide so she chooses both. But after managing to nurture a picture-perfect threesome, along comes Ernest, a rich movie director with deep baby blues that sweep Veronica off her feet. What\'s a girl to do now?','/spYxqTm5k8h0vCm3c3JZUlZgMoF.jpg','1999-09-17',93,'Released','Explore the possibilities...','Splendor',35122,2.6935,6.2,'E2WCzPLioJE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14228,_binary '\0','/yxNmTvmBLgyk1f4G3qS5skRIEuo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0127310',7.3,1218,'ja','スーパーの女','A struggling Japanese neighborhood supermarket manager chances upon an old classmate, who has plenty of ideas for revitalizing his business.','/8Ak3RCQm0pdUh6o8DjPlwnPA8ye.jpg','1996-06-15',127,'Released','This is the laughter-filled super comedy for all housewives nationwide!','Supermarket Woman',81296,2.1107,6.7,'wZxO_c8Ol0o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14229,_binary '\0','/3deAGN09WpwQXxtxUYHvbNAAowA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0127311',7.6,12271,'tr','Tabutta Rövaşata','Mahsun Supertitiz is an unemployed homeless man who steals cars at night so that he can sleep in a heated place during the winter. Mahsun lives in Rumelihisar, an old section of Istanbul, and makes ends meet by getting the local fishermen to help him. Mahsun loves the cars he robs, cleans and polishes them, and drives them through the streets of Rumelihisar during the daytime.','/wZFHPRHKyN8nXEsZJ6tqTUbACuZ.jpg','1996-04-01',76,'Released',NULL,'Somersault in a Coffin',83567,2.2922,7.347,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14230,_binary '\0','/26s8wR2X8A5kewlm20zPY2hrboQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0127322',5.9,2588,'en','Toothless','A female dentist is cast into limbo after her death in an accident and is given the assignment to act as the Tooth Fairy as her action to be admitted into heaven.','/9hIEmHraSssH6NOYzWPXGklVmc0.jpg','1997-10-05',92,'Released','A fun and fractured fairytale','Toothless',82549,2.5884,5.5,'lDlW_h_xGDc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14231,_binary '\0','/wW2binZ7EVPGy5gEsIoMKICckcQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0127349',6.4,7989,'en','Waking the Dead','A congressional candidate questions his sanity after seeing the love of his life, presumed dead, suddenly emerge.','/wC4MSw7MYYDIhkcgw1lZui0kzur.jpg','2000-03-24',105,'Released','Sometimes love has a life of it\'s own.','Waking the Dead',37722,2.9568,6.005,'w82ymNsitw8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14232,_binary '\0','/sqb6J9GohKpqoeTLsG0pgP7AXg7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0127354',5.3,3443,'en','Wavelength','In a Lower Manhattan industrial loft, a camera very slowly zooms into a photograph on a wall while various people occasionally enter and exit.','/EJrUlzZ7kTrCP3czxqtb5dfS5i.jpg','1967-12-29',45,'Released',NULL,'Wavelength',88421,1.6762,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14233,_binary '\0','/8jjd2Ui4VgtKaWGvwP8pkT91ilQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0127357',6.8,46148,'cn','我是誰','A group of covert CIA operatives trailing a potential new energy source are double-crossed by corrupt agent Morgan, who causes a helicopter crash in remote South Africa. The sole survivor, suffering severe amnesia, is nursed to recovery by a kindly native tribe who call him \"Whoami\" after the question he keeps asking. With the help of a mysterious reporter Christine, Whoami pieces together his past and tracks the turncoat agent and his criminal cohorts.','/9YDKLbBmWGpxG5bO3TBawtNNOAr.jpg','1998-01-17',120,'Released','Fight now. Ask questions later.','Who Am I?',8697,8.0589,7.2,'iLo5g4HHyBE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14234,_binary '\0','/6KACvOW0HpwpiDqY4BwDjbzPx3o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0127454',3.1,1340,'tr','Bay E','A television news anchorman, İsmet Berkan goes on a journey with his wife. Along the journey, out of the blue they start fighting. When he confesses that he cheated on her, she gets mad. Enraged, Leyla gets out of the car, enters a gas station and takes off with a man in a red sports car. Trying to track down his wife, the anchorman finds himself trapped in a bizarre world in the midst of murderers, cops and beautiful women.','/n7UawKFmnwkqkM2ZBoMAWI15p4m.jpg','1995-03-09',101,'Released',NULL,'Mr E.',177283,2.2164,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14235,_binary '\0','/mE5CaaHl9zN3FgTFEfPb180Upht.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0127516',6.7,2270,'en','Divorcing Jack','He\'s Irish, he\'s ageing, he drinks, is a touch cynical and when he has time writes a newspaper column. On the eve of the country\'s first election as an independent state, Dan Starkey\'s life is about to change after he finds the young woman he has just made love to dead and his only ally is a nun','/dPbxBc3DWR5vz2ucO5v8MO8NA47.jpg','1998-10-01',110,'Released',NULL,'Divorcing Jack',43997,2.1709,6.007,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14236,_binary '\0','/LTjGvAf92YLudl5zqJP9tHLuSo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0127536',7.4,110990,'en','Elizabeth','The story of the ascension to the throne and the early reign of Queen Elizabeth the First, the endless attempts by her council to marry her off, the Catholic hatred of her and her romance with Lord Robert Dudley.','/qEk48VLOdibXFVIEzE9ETZUBcCs.jpg','1998-09-13',123,'Released','Declared illegitimate aged 3. Tried for treason aged 21. Crowned Queen aged 25.','Elizabeth',4518,6.2488,7.2,'DyGBwrtIamw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14237,_binary '\0','/vmGWKadwri2y67t4truG1nPVd6v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0127626',7.5,8824,'pl','Kiler','An innocent cab driver is mistaken for a contract killer and imprisoned. Soon, he is sprung by a mob boss who needs a \"killer\" for a few more jobs.','/ho08qS2vBVFywB4I180PhaTtxg4.jpg','1997-11-17',104,'Released','A film that kills... with laughter','Killer',31132,1.4696,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14238,_binary '\0','/hs03shmubfXKTeOl5g6MKGqyaRg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0127722',6.5,9772,'en','Another Day in Paradise','In the hope of a big score, two junkie couples team up to commit various drug robberies which go disastrously wrong, leading to dissent, violence, and murder.','/nDhm7xSYk1Touf977107SEGIjur.jpg','1998-12-30',101,'Released','We live at the abyss.','Another Day in Paradise',36136,2.7574,6.235,'dDUWUYvr8i8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14239,_binary '\0','/yPVhkvOiI4UZC0jOpjO1HntlxHv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0127723',6.5,57900,'en','Can\'t Hardly Wait','It\'s graduation day at Huntington Hills High, and you know what that means - time to party. And not just any party, either. This one will be a night to remember, as the nerds become studs, the jocks are humiliated, and freshman crushes blossom into grown-up romance.','/r3a5gGWfS0SDS9nriNrJzSSrErf.jpg','1998-06-12',100,'Released','Yesterday\'s history. Tomorrow\'s the future. Tonight\'s the party.','Can\'t Hardly Wait',15037,6.7011,6.247,'qukvN6ieeMY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14240,_binary '\0','/q4lZYutzXhkFqHqWrXPXouBP1zf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0127834',7,1494,'en','Seven Years Bad Luck','After breaking a mirror in his home, superstitious Max tries to avoid situations which could bring bad luck, but in doing so causes himself the worst luck imaginable.','/A2wzhYV3Kk36hkxxAJekNk1uz97.jpg','1921-02-06',62,'Released',NULL,'Seven Years Bad Luck',97995,1.1353,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14241,_binary '\0','/em4nfgXczAUXuuyT6kJc4llwONw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0127919',4.1,3790,'en','Tale of the Mummy','Centuries ago, under the sands of ancient Egypt, a Prince was buried and his tomb eternally cursed so that no man would ever again suffer from his evil ways. But hundreds of years later on a greedy search for treasure, a group of archaeologists break the cursed seal of the tomb. Every man vanishes without a trace, leaving behind only a log book, and a deadly warning of the legend of the bloodthirsty Talos.','/tauZsCSZ9a5IvzBZmsX1sl1vDrQ.jpg','1998-08-03',88,'Released','The curse is legend. The terror is real.','Russell Mulcahy’s Tale of the Mummy',66892,3.3245,4.7,'3ZAHujT9Tng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14242,_binary '\0','/c6IhEmdp2SYmUJDNIyJpQOtqeWK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0128133',7.2,3745,'de','Comedian Harmonists','Comedian Harmonists tells the story of a famous, German male sextet, five vocals and piano, the \"Comedian Harmonists\", from the day they meet first in 1927 to the day in 1934, when they become banned by the upcoming Nazis, because three of them are Jewish.','/9jUWDGEOZ6MFy9gSfYZ69KLjPLY.jpg','1997-12-25',126,'Released',NULL,'The Harmonists',9524,2.2746,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14243,_binary '\0','/hwAPuGAH3Du3A9WuaaJXZandBYX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0128137',6,2984,'en','The Confession','After his young son dies from the negligence at a hospital, Harry Fertig takes matters into his own hands and kills the doctor, nurse and clerk responsible. Slick lawyer Roy Bleakie, looking only to win a case and not caring of the matters involved, is asked by Fertig\'s boss to defend him. Shocked to hear that his client wants to plead guilty, the case causes Bleakie to question his own morals by defending an honorable man.','/xRGb8CyMYRmjHhQhqSdFdJvk1nW.jpg','1999-03-26',114,'Released','Trust no one.','The Confession',30998,2.9227,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14244,_binary '\0','/akbJi9TNHuZ5XAue4ZH0S6Oy5S3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0128221',5.8,1478,'it','Fracchia contro Dracula','Fracchia is desperate: he has to sell a house with at least five bathrooms within three days or his boss will fire him. Incredibly, he and his pal Filini manage to find the perfect house, a castle in Transylvania owned by some count Vlad... things get even worse when they meet the Count and his sister, who has a crush on Fracchia and decides to marry him!','/929UzpnRMgolTdyvhr11BpSXTeX.jpg','1985-12-20',88,'Released',NULL,'Who\'s Afraid of Dracula?',30459,1.3224,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14245,_binary '\0','/hxC4Qg4ZmEgFA6wcD14IKGg46A2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0128232',5,1601,'en','Ghostkeeper','A group of three friends on a snowmobiling trip find themselves stranded at an abandoned lodge isolated in the mountains. They discover that an old woman resides in the hotel, along with an evil entity that she is keeping in the basement.','/mtp1L82bCKQZt8rLuErco11ByVP.jpg','1981-12-01',87,'Released','Who Next Becomes The Keeper Of The Beast That Lives On Human Flesh?','Ghostkeeper',85189,1.3134,5.2,'W5rCFZ9Gu9U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14246,_binary '\0','/vyxQ6wrpRjqwdIhZJJPQca0UuQX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0128239',6,4276,'en','Grey Owl','Archie Grey Owl is a trapper in Canada in the early 1930s when a young Iroquois woman from town asks him to teach her Indian ways. They live in the woods, where she is appalled at how trapped animals die. She adopts two orphaned beaver kits and helps Archie see his way to stop trapping. Instead, he works as a guide, a naturalist writer, and then the Canadian government hires him to save the beaver in a conserve by Lake Ajawaan in Prince Albert National Park. He writes a biography, which brings him attention in Canada and invitations to lecture in England. Before he leaves, he and Anahareo (Pony) marry. In England, his secret is revealed. Will Anahareo continue to love him?','/zreBHtHVAkH8Z2EdAAje1pFuF2p.jpg','1999-10-01',117,'Released','A dream to save the wilderness. A secret that shocked the world.','Grey Owl',41807,2.9613,5.7,'O1-LzEBZSJM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14247,_binary '\0','/uqa2PKpMzNMm5nkW2Xwio7TVIli.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0128278',6.6,35695,'en','Instinct','In a prison for the criminally insane, deranged anthropologist Ethan Powell is set to be examined by a bright young psychiatrist, Theo Caulder. Driven by ambition and a hunger for the truth, Caulder will eventually risk everything—even put his very life on the line—in a harrowing attempt to understand the bizarre actions of this madman.','/8EKmzia6awjsqFxgBk5a82aTmb6.jpg','1999-06-04',124,'Released','Nothing is more savage than civilization.','Instinct',12117,4.7322,6.5,'zdSZaTBWQqw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14248,_binary '\0','/94tirOgRaEoBfMOIm3aXvl3RCCx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0128292',7.3,1888,'cs','Knoflíkáři','It is a film consisting of six short stories, which mostly tell in a black humorous, ironic, often bitterly bitter form about an ancient curse, human infidelity, strange deviations, an unexpected miracle and hypocritical forgiveness. They have their own pointed structure, specific atmosphere and way of processing, and yet they pass on motives to each other that communicate with each other and observe the same things from different angles.','/1JrmqCxVu16OONXKsEj6Vxiyvwe.jpg','1997-11-20',102,'Released',NULL,'Buttoners',65896,1.5507,7.033,'sLGUVoUqwzo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14249,_binary '\0','/rB6LXlbFUJIHKi55n2Srh0LZNVE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0128332',8,23272,'tr','Masumiyet','Yusuf is released from prison after serving a ten year sentence. Because of unexpected problems at his sister’s house, he finds himself in a cheap hotel where he meets a man, a woman, and a child who will change his life in unexpected ways…','/blJ0RGs0dnFppzUxyCFeE8PlozW.jpg','1997-10-24',110,'Released',NULL,'Innocence',31413,1.7751,7.619,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14250,_binary '\0','/8TLeH2lDJaTIBfBe6I7MEW9NhFG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0128364',7.6,1544,'ja','無常','Near a remote Buddhist monastery, a young man falls in love with his sister and gets her pregnant. After a monk finds out, the young man becomes an assistant to a master sculptor, only to proceed to complicate matters with his affairs.','/r9UJitBSy1DE9zZfOjWJuqn8Abg.jpg','1970-08-08',143,'Released',NULL,'This Transient Life',104452,2.082,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14251,_binary '\0','/7GPLVxu5FcGVmyC1kBht8Nd8DUA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0128378',7,6073,'pl','Ogniem i mieczem','In the mid-17th century, Poland was the largest, most democratic, and most tolerant country in Europe. However, a tragic civil war brought about the gradual decline of the once glorious republic... An epic story about the Cossack rebellion against the Polish-Lithuanian Commonwealth.','/qyBPfr9ue5EhdaVne14XA3Zxacs.jpg','1999-02-08',175,'Released',NULL,'With Fire and Sword',31273,2.1247,6.938,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14252,_binary '\0','/tgRQsrjBKdic7llxhI7pqLJb8kS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0128442',7.3,173531,'en','Rounders','Poker addict Mike McDermott knows the game inside out, but loses his money one night in a game to Russian-American gangster Teddy KGB. Promising his partner Jo he\'ll give up, he meets up with best friend Lester \'Worm\' Murphy, just out of prison and owing lots of money to the wrong kind of people. McDermott becomes his co-guarantor and now there\'s only one way to raise the money, the pair have to get back into the game.','/mqbMwYGwIChnaCO55h7v8DG8Wwy.jpg','1998-09-11',121,'Released','Trust everyone... But always cut the cards.','Rounders',10220,7.0209,7,'cjUgHE3hxyg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14253,_binary '\0','/asC4h9U7pD72bkYcqzgTB7VJYLy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0128445',7.6,209738,'en','Rushmore','When a beautiful first-grade teacher arrives at a prep school, she soon attracts the attention of an ambitious teenager named Max, who quickly falls in love with her. Max turns to the father of two of his schoolmates for advice on how to woo the teacher. However, the situation soon gets complicated when Max\'s new friend becomes involved with her, setting the two pals against one another in a war for her attention.','/hSJ6swahAuZ8wM96lHDTwQPXUvZ.jpg','1998-12-11',93,'Released','Love. Expulsion. Revolution.','Rushmore',11545,6.3323,7.4,'846UzdeHI1g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14254,_binary '\0','/4Nu1JW7a17Z57RbnX6s9O7lGbyQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0128801',6.5,3892,'en','Under Wraps','A comedy-adventure in which three twelve-year-olds have a close encounter with a 3,000-year-old mummy. Marshall, Gilbert and Amy accidentally set the mummy free, but if they don\'t get him back to his resting place by midnight on Halloween, he\'ll turn into dust and lose his only chance of being reunited with his long-lost love.','/wgq6xA57hLo6c7vCDClUKs8kpQk.jpg','1997-10-25',91,'Released',NULL,'Under Wraps',76212,2.4331,5.5,'scjJDHqz7yc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14255,_binary '\0','/9lYpkcO7WuruOXB2mn8ppC6Ecaq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0128853',6.7,248471,'en','You\'ve Got Mail','Book superstore magnate Joe Fox and independent book shop owner Kathleen Kelly fall in love in the anonymity of the Internet—both blissfully unaware that he\'s trying to put her out of business.','/rJLUSpmdxSMqqEsyzeCni3vy1ca.jpg','1998-12-18',119,'Released','Someone you pass on the street may already be the love of your life.','You\'ve Got Mail',9489,30.3541,6.71,'AKlhYZ-HqKs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14256,_binary '\0','/jykk4FQURwovaOfzzn89fBn5c0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0128960',7.7,1621,'ru','Белорусский вокзал','Four former soldiers reunite 25 years after the war. Last time they saw each other on the Byelorussian railway station in the summer of 1945. Now they\'ve come together to mourn the death of a friend.','/36O2YFv179ynFFgZ161odbLDgwk.jpg','1971-04-30',101,'Released',NULL,'Byelorussian Station',107705,1.0383,6.714,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14257,_binary '\0','/c5UlEYHM2xuSrfxESg1gZSpVAEB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0128977',6.2,1847,'en','The Bumblebee Flies Anyway','An amnesiac youth tries to piece together his past, but what he discovers may jeopardize his future.','/4k1fezf5fVMv7rqecGFeXhtQdNl.jpg','2000-01-01',95,'Released','They Took His Past. She Gave Him His Future','The Bumblebee Flies Anyway',96716,2.5608,6.3,'YtlrJlJY4Hw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14258,_binary '\0','/sKT0bFEpm9fVNz8Ah3Ocu1tHki2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0128985',7.9,2087,'hi','Chalti Ka Naam Gaadi','Three woman-hating brothers face changes in their respective lifestyles when two of them fall in love.','/eQ0OSwVY46YoPaY3dBYijufZTmB.jpg','1958-02-28',173,'Released','Babu Samjho Ishaare','Chalti Ka Naam Gaadi',64743,1.0324,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14259,_binary '\0','/y9OZCg6OUqtDMtedW9Pr6mSL09y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0128996',6.8,11038,'en','Cinderella','Cinderella chafes under the cruelty of her wicked stepmother and her evil stepsisters, until her Fairy Godmother steps in to change her life for one unforgettable night. At the ball, she falls for handsome Prince Christopher, whose parents, King Maximillian and Queen Constantina, are anxious for him to find a suitable paramour.','/54awQrtekrsI11bKg2NwQrBHLIe.jpg','1997-11-02',88,'Released','Updated version of the classic Rodgers and Hammerstein musical of the classic fairy-tale, with an all-star, multi-racial cast.','Cinderella',42884,3.0564,6.574,'py03Zy3dEwc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14260,_binary '\0','/jzmDQsmmAtlOMRl1EmxLtUqzNoY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0129023',5.9,3144,'en','Dark Harbor','A bickering couple drive fast through a downpour to catch the last ferry to their island retreat. In a flash, they recognize a crumpled body laying at the side of the road and after much argument they stop, only to find a young man battered and bruised. An offer of summoning the police firmly rejected, the two help the man as best they can although it certainly means missing the ferry... and so starts this thriller: a tale of twisted sexual attraction and ulterior motives.','/rlOlAcK7dQIA3SE7S1p5jLwCUH6.jpg','1999-12-31',84,'Released',NULL,'Dark Harbor',105980,2.0715,5,'B5abPgafiR0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14261,_binary '\0','/7ZuaRIspIwqks8POVkbtMYqawr4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0129136',4.6,2996,'en','Hell\'s Kitchen','Newly released from jail, an ex-gang member asks a former contender to teach him to box.','/4O5qyaUbVBJGe4Gt95RpKS2yyrl.jpg','1998-09-11',95,'Released','The road to redemption is covered in blood.','Hell\'s Kitchen',37900,2.0293,5.1,'0qj1HLguDyI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14262,_binary '\0','/ni5cXCrrGzoiIEoIwOzGiIwMZlH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0129167',8.1,265543,'en','The Iron Giant','In the small town of Rockwell, Maine in October 1957, a giant metal machine befriends a nine-year-old boy and ultimately finds its humanity by unselfishly saving people from their own fears and prejudices.','/k1Cv5CHJvqGWK1xJDUJz8DojFEy.jpg','1999-08-06',86,'Released','It came from outer space!','The Iron Giant',10386,18.5597,7.965,'2izFEWmzPdk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14263,_binary '\0','/eYMhYS5QrQ1wKZCtCrE1aOniP4Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0129222',6.7,1231,'nl','De man die zijn haar kort liet knippen','Govert Miereveld is a lawyer from a small Flemish town who also teaches in a school for girls. He harbors a secret love for one of his young students, Fran, whom he loses touch with after her graduation. Some time later, Miereveld has to attend an autopsy, and the shock of the experience deeply affects his mental balance. He finds out - or he believes so - that Fran has become a popular singer. He arranges to meet her to finally reveal his feelings. An ambiguous but perhaps tragic denouement follows which might be a figment of the protagonist\'s disturbed mind.','/4qMYOTz9aKfC0EQgSMKN963MSf2.jpg','1966-09-05',95,'Released',NULL,'The Man Who Had His Hair Cut Short',86482,1.3363,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14264,_binary '\0','/lRb0rSw7gJzn0PAZYhLJ4jYpXg4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0129273',7,2077,'no','Olsen-banden','Egon Olsen is the leader of the Olsen Gang. While he was in the slammer, he planned how he would steal the fantastic golden figure Keizeroppzatsen.','/1gfj46MFTdn6hi02NQXF6iuU1oV.jpg','1969-08-11',82,'Released',NULL,'The Olsen Gang',24667,2.1363,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14265,_binary '\0','/umY2wpVWJLY77ydBFlwlGVR3hFg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0129280',5.5,16095,'en','The Out-of-Towners','The adventures of married couple Henry and Nancy Clark, vexed by misfortune while in New York City for Henry\'s job interview.','/wOmLJYh7oOfATE236XpoDfcXhOh.jpg','1999-04-02',90,'Released','They fell in love 24 years ago... and in the next 24 hours, they\'ll remember why.','The Out-of-Towners',8970,6.6578,5.8,'erByzW27zEM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14266,_binary '\0','/sPGgJ0w1oCVPBOW41dN0hpMouhI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0129290',6.9,131465,'en','Patch Adams','The true story of Dr. Hunter \"Patch\" Adams, who in the 1970s found that humor is the best medicine, and was willing to do just anything to make his patients laugh—even if it meant risking his own career.','/xN1aKur5ddWQSXTqvzDPJD2TCxe.jpg','1998-12-25',115,'Released','Laughter is contagious.','Patch Adams',10312,8.2958,7.314,'lZqGA1ldvYE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14267,_binary '\0','/mBw7GMmRycQHFXRUjn70KrzCJCq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0129332',6.9,47059,'en','Ravenous','After arriving at his new, remote Army outpost, Capt. John Boyd and his regiment aid a wounded frontiersman who recounts a horrifying tale of a wagon train murdered by its supposed guide – a vicious U.S. Army colonel gone rogue. Fearing the worst, the regiment heads out into the wilderness to verify the gruesome claims.','/5f7pY4Uzyt4ZNWhHyd1dJhIF4Gc.jpg','1999-03-16',101,'Released','You are who you eat.','Ravenous',10212,5.8441,6.8,'l7BDiNktrLU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14268,_binary '\0','/egJQ3nIon5fT8wyXcKRHzvmtZpD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0129387',7.1,351215,'en','There\'s Something About Mary','For Ted, prom night went about as bad as it’s possible for any night to go. Thirteen years later, he finally gets another chance with his old prom date, only to run up against other suitors including the sleazy detective he hired to find her.','/slJD1Dvnsf15LoeqhERsyzisAdn.jpg','1998-07-15',120,'Released','Love is in the hair.','There\'s Something About Mary',544,13.2751,6.638,'503D8hOfE_8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14269,_binary '\0','/dxOqPoaMNi8oqmFDYmSfIGmPUCW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0129659',7.3,1280,'de','Zugvögel - einmal nach Inari','Hannes is a beer truck driver in Dortmund. His biggest dream is to win the first prize at the International Timetable Contest in Inari (Finland). When his new boss cancels his extra holidays to go there, Hans goes mad… On his journey to Finland by train, followed by the police, he meets lot of folks and the love of his life.','/muDWaAemVZzl4F4fpvwdKGDafus.jpg','1998-07-09',87,'Released',NULL,'Train Birds',743,1.6664,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14270,_binary '\0','/op9Y3fXznsfEWsE52xRhgLssIyR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0129672',7.5,1348,'en','Cinderella','Julie Andrews was nominated for an Emmy for portraying the titular scullery maid who finds true love with a prince in this legendary adaptation of one of the most famous fairy tales of all time. A musical, made-for-television, with music by Richard Rodgers and book and lyrics by Oscar Hammerstein II, it is the only of the legendary composing team\'s musicals created specifically for that medium. It was originally broadcast live on CBS on March 31, 1957, and was a phenomenal success, viewed by more than 107 million people. Though it originally aired in full color, only a black & white kinescope of the production has survived.','/qx6Ttai1fzsmxj947MM2TKNbU88.jpg','1957-03-31',77,'Released','The classic fairy tale with a Rodgers and Hammerstein score and performed live on TV.','Cinderella',44459,1.9423,6.7,'vP-SRSwSuOE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14271,_binary '\0','/yb1Fnpt51RR8gaNK9Hk7jXHGyrx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0129686',8.1,6646,'en','Hornblower: The Even Chance','Portsmouth, 1794. Under thundery skies and in lashing rain, 17-year-old midshipman Horatio Hornblower takes the first tentative steps of his naval career, but a feud with a shipmate causes complications.','/gEBjQzBRJMTil8XE2VoZrOg5IYs.jpg','1998-10-07',100,'Released',NULL,'Hornblower: The Even Chance',19493,2.5249,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14272,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0129694',8.5,1633,'en','Lewis & Clark: The Journey of the Corps of Discovery','The story of the most important American exploration expedition in American history and the participants in it.','/hjiMdLSUgv6U97hCVKyKX4HxCut.jpg','1997-11-04',240,'Released',NULL,'Lewis & Clark: The Journey of the Corps of Discovery',775012,0.44,10,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14273,_binary '\0','/s2fiUm5aoLZD3e0sU5laFdL22u2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0129794',7.8,3575,'it','Un borghese piccolo piccolo','A middle-aged government accountant is determined to secure a stable job for his son before retiring, willing to go to great lengths to achieve his goal.','/kXaY6crK5zFh0W77FuQNeTBgJsU.jpg','1977-03-17',122,'Released',NULL,'An Average Little Man',54561,2.3182,7.938,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14274,_binary '\0','/zwgje2ruELJGHEZcSwq287o5Qo3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0129871',5.3,12475,'en','Desperation','When a sheriff arrests a writer, a family, a couple, and a hitchiker and throws them in a jail cell in the deserted town of Desperation, they must fight for their lives.','/sVVTUA9SBaGlkZcj3XIJq077dQB.jpg','2006-05-23',131,'Released','In this town, there are no accidents.','Desperation',10004,3.7284,5.5,'sWYeA9Ycxug','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14275,_binary '\0','/kJQFvR2Gww0KB34Tt8w0KYA4fwG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0129884',5.2,2326,'en','Dog Park','A young man, whose girlfriend has just left him and taken their dog, falls for another woman who is also on the rebound, but who prefers the company of her dog to the company of men.','/9B5ZKG8Ht1xacz61x3sRovY6glG.jpg','1998-09-14',91,'Released','Down Boy','Dog Park',62994,1.6594,5.5,'3av4Z2Y6t8Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14276,_binary '\0','/djFWCethTNYz5WPqIso6IVXTtFU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0129923',6.6,1549,'fr','La femme de chambre du Titanic','Horty, a French foundry worker, wins a contest and is sent to see the sailing of the Titanic. In England, Marie, saying she is a chambermaid on the Titanic and cannot get a room, asks to share his room. They do, chastely; when he awakens, she is gone, but he sees her at the sailing and gets a photo of her. When he returns home, he suspects that his wife Zoe has been sleeping with Simeon, the foundry owner. Horty goes to the bar, where his friends get him drunk and he starts telling an erotic fantasy of what happened with him and Marie, drawing a larger audience each night.','/p4frEECepz84DjgB7clmwBOXldE.jpg','1997-10-10',100,'Released',NULL,'The Chambermaid on the Titanic',115872,1.491,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14277,_binary '\0','/gF1BbDac7ONryE5jezRzXVe31Ud.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0130018',4.8,89290,'en','I Still Know What You Did Last Summer','Ever since killing the Fisherman one year ago, Julie James is still haunted by images of him after her. When her best friend Karla wins free tickets to the Bahamas, Julie finds this a perfect opportunity to finally relax. But someone is waiting for her. Someone who she thought was dead. Someone who is out again for revenge.','/eg3d6hvTaOmW3lNErFfutBmWmAR.jpg','1998-11-13',100,'Released','Someone is dying for a second chance.','I Still Know What You Did Last Summer',3600,10.9886,5.363,'xx_j5SL93Xs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14278,_binary '\0','/7BUkUyHAijyZ8UpMxnn3TM5vHwg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0130121',5.9,39773,'en','Mickey Blue Eyes','An English auctioneer proposes to the daughter of a mafia kingpin, only to realize that certain \"favors\" would be asked of him.','/gEnKsStQ27P0KCCIGtkYwvFQ0RX.jpg','1999-08-16',102,'Released','A romantic comedy you can\'t refuse','Mickey Blue Eyes',10154,4.8531,5.7,'AOh-F4PKwjU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14279,_binary '\0','/r6lToY3URLXAgVBUnOzZHK18kki.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0130156',5.2,1791,'da','Olsen-bandens sidste stik','Egon escapes from the psychiatric ward, where he has been incarcerated since the gang\'s last coup. Keld and Benny pick him up, and when Egon, as always, is planning the big heist, the Olsen Gang is once again on the move.','/tkOidJCoRpqVTUlaQlAtG6Ejm9c.jpg','1998-12-18',105,'Released','They are back!','The Olsen Gang\'s Last Trick',12549,1.4501,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14280,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0130172',4.8,1594,'en','P.U.N.K.S','Drew Utley, Miles Kitchen, Lanny Nygren and Jonny P. comprise a club called \'P.U.N.K.S.\'. Their mission is to protect and serve peace.','/ikX7XvF7PuaEZSEeF4pTzYhu0tm.jpg','1999-01-05',98,'Released',NULL,'P.U.N.K.S',62410,1.6895,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14281,_binary '\0','/gUu1973lUo4nJ0dKGpfuSHtGhD0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0130192',5,2239,'en','Postmortem','The only thing James wants is to remain away from Scotland. One day, however, he receives a fax, a printout of an unknown person\'s obituary. The next day, he is charged and arrested for the murder of this person.','/ktNGzAEsn37RHfdklJ7Vydz5vao.jpg','1998-06-20',105,'Released','The only way to trap a serial killer is to know what he feels, what he thinks, and when he\'ll strike...again.','Postmortem',43913,1.632,5.5,'VBgqoNUdumU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14282,_binary '\0','/vO7BTXDLOOI8jyRPAr2g7WbU3g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0130216',5.1,1296,'en','The Redeemer: Son of Satan!','Six people are trapped within the confines of their old high school during their 10th high school reunion with a psychotic, masked preacher who kills them off for their sinful lives they have made for themselves.','/kyJrdg83ATfyzTDQ3Pf35RYhvz.jpg','1978-04-07',84,'Released','If You Have a Craving for Terror… Come to the Class Reunion','The Redeemer: Son of Satan!',86332,1.1655,4.4,'KLeBc3RUAq4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14283,_binary '\0','/ohbofvm0XGYItnr2maHgmAYiwlY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0130350',6.5,1773,'hi','विश्वात्मा','Two brave and smart young men: namely Police inspector Prabhat Singh (Sunny Deol) and a reformed criminal Akash Bhardwaj (Chunkey Pandey) is sent to the African country of Kenya in order to apprehend the underworld criminal Azghar Jhorat (Amrish Puri). He is a criminal in India but his whereabouts is known in Kenya. While in Kenya they reaches up with a stern Kenyan police officer who is of Indian origin Surya Pratap Singh (Naseeruddin Shah), it is his duty to make Prabhat and Akash abide by the Kenyan laws but to capture Azghar both is forced to break the laws and gets into confrontation with Surya where a misunderstood is created. Will Akash and Prabhat be able to fulfilled there duties towards there country or will they leave there mission half way and run like cowards?','/nb4FKjLfuHwQeGkANULU4saRCWC.jpg','1992-01-24',173,'Released',NULL,'Vishwatma',357131,1.2293,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14284,_binary '\0','/gSTZOMGc9QbtX3tiQenAjSv5rfN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0130377',7.3,2036,'ja','座頭市千両首','Ichi travels to the village of Itakura to pay his respects at the grave of Kichizo, a man he killed two years ago. When some tax money is stolen while in transit to the governor he is accused and sets out to find the money and clear his name.','/7AJD46hbaU47ScV5Oe8hX5OmEw7.jpg','1964-03-14',83,'Released',NULL,'Zatoichi and the Chest of Gold',40897,1.4741,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14285,_binary '\0','/uFiIYzTg752yDR5qErCaZyxbWV6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0130444',7.2,7344,'de','Aimée & Jaguar','In 1943, while the Allies are bombing Berlin and the Gestapo is purging the capital of Jews, a dangerous love affair blossoms between two women – one a Jewish member of the underground, the other an exemplar of Nazi motherhood.','/vd6c4PliEGXgtWTzq1iFxnXIE5H.jpg','1999-02-11',125,'Released','Bound By Desire. Torn Apart By War.','Aimée & Jaguar',2211,2.1766,6.8,'KGwcU31U_Lg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14286,_binary '\0','/en6btt9y8VdsAYXpGKgrjLslLcT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0130529',7.6,1530,'en','Cane Toads: An Unnatural History','A documentary detailing the spread of Hawaiian sugar-cane toads through Australia in a botched effort to introduce them as counter pests.','/9mae0ZYiHNvUtHZiJ7u2brWYG3Z.jpg','1988-06-09',47,'Released','The story of a bizarre biological blunder, warts and all!!','Cane Toads: An Unnatural History',82284,1.0509,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14287,_binary '\0','/laeEtakR2pLKu3CeRwB2lU5Y53X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0130623',6.4,73727,'en','Dinosaur','An orphaned dinosaur raised by lemurs joins an arduous trek to a sancturary after a meteorite shower destroys his family home.','/rSje3FS7ycJSglowlngjsvDt7vO.jpg','2000-05-19',82,'Released','Discover a world you\'ve only imagined.','Dinosaur',10567,11.7911,6.591,'sCqYuBIFE5I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14288,_binary '\0','/wRcm3iwi4BeMN59U4fjO7u3dOVI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0130827',7.6,218308,'de','Lola rennt','Lola receives a phone call from her boyfriend Manni. He lost 100,000 DM in a subway train that belongs to a very bad guy. She has 20 minutes to raise this amount and meet Manni. Otherwise, he will rob a store to get the money. Three different alternatives may happen depending on some minor event along Lola\'s run.','/v0giIi4bTILVhNhJajet3WWY3FA.jpg','1998-08-20',80,'Released','Every second of every day you\'re faced with a decision that can change your life.','Run Lola Run',104,8.5647,7.3,'ZCYnsUdO6H0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14289,_binary '\0','/cOE0JUuhHyRFT6XYkyeO44lMTyw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0130885',7.3,1324,'en','Murder, She Wrote: South by Southwest','Jessica Fletcher searches for a woman who witnessed the murder of a man trying to expose a serious flaw in a top-secret government satellite code.','/6Ot5ZLXh6ZZ4k7ImxDJxvSog5ss.jpg','1997-11-02',100,'Released','It began as a cross country train trip. It became a Federal case-- of murder!','Murder, She Wrote: South by Southwest',238098,3.0326,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14290,_binary '\0','/dBBkcFFY03yw5OILyaLfYpctODg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0131097',7.2,1752,'it','Il vedovo','Alberto Nardi is a Roman businessman who fancies himself a man of great capabilities, but whose factory teeters perennially on the brink of catastrophe. Alberto is married to a rich and successful businesswoman from Milan, Elvira Almiraghi who has a no-nonsense attitude and barely tolerates the attempts of her husband to keep his factory afloat with her money.','/nRdFWaScUo1Zmz8C3m9gY54Cv7H.jpg','1959-11-20',87,'Released',NULL,'The Widower',56340,1.8272,7.4,'6BSyoasFgzo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14291,_binary '\0','/ujGQ7SUN5ImxGeEjh7YuGvc4xaZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0131207',7.4,2373,'ru','Три плюс два','Three best friend are going to spend a vacation on a sea shore. But when they arrive to their usual place they suddenly find that the spot is already occupied - by two beautiful girls.','/v5XyONUyeOC4PfTblrYokbgRoRU.jpg','1963-07-03',100,'Released',NULL,'Three Plus Two',73267,1.7862,7.429,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14292,_binary '\0','/vLfksvG182LklmmiHek0Al4FdRN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0131325',6.5,78299,'en','Bowfinger','On the verge of bankruptcy and desperate for his big break, aspiring filmmaker Bobby Bowfinger concocts a crazy plan to make his ultimate dream movie. Rallying a ragtag team that includes a starry-eyed ingenue, a has-been diva and a film studio gofer, he sets out to shoot a blockbuster featuring the biggest star in Hollywood, Kit Ramsey -- only without letting Ramsey know he\'s in the picture.','/iGuiFYEYwFkaRPl3FgLJYEm6dWq.jpg','1999-08-12',97,'Released','The con is on.','Bowfinger',11353,4.0971,6.188,'vQArw5Lu418','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14293,_binary '\0','/xVlQ3apBJ86JZCWq1ILjXGcumvc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0131335',7.8,2239,'es','Canoa: memoria de un hecho vergonzoso','A group of students arrives in a small town during a hiking expedition. Once there, the local priest accuses them of being communist agitators on the run from an army crack-down against student demonstrations in nearby Mexico City and rallies the townsfolk to lynch them. Based on a true story.','/ag35bvtquwiDPsY4itNH895NguW.jpg','1975-12-11',116,'Released','A town. Vested interests. 1968: a decisive year in the history of Mexico.','Canoa: A Shameful Memory',116982,2.0047,7.83,'-2RPx_RDOhw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14294,_binary '\0','/ut0D7P0UGHAmEje50QuFeCIyN3b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0131369',6.1,46986,'en','EDtv','Video store clerk Ed agrees to have his life filmed by a camera crew for a tv network.','/xnnjoMONNamGU6ZX6acbcxyOKv1.jpg','1999-03-26',123,'Released','The story of a nobody everybody is watching.','EDtv',11374,3.836,5.955,'V5ZJtWn8zBY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14295,_binary '\0','/8b7ct0DNWCLaVSw2YGCLm5JR53C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0131436',4.2,2540,'en','I Got the Hook-Up','Two broke buddies feel lucky when they come upon a truckload of cellular phones and begin selling them out of the back of their van. Trouble arises though, when the phones develop faults. The two friends then not only have to deal with unsatisfied customers but also the FBI.','/u8kdtt80gFiqGKLTdQqdGWy9FfZ.jpg','1998-05-27',93,'Released','A truckload of cell phones... turns into a boatload of cash!','I Got the Hook-Up',40505,2.4404,5.3,'SiIv0skjraY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14296,_binary '\0','/fUHuBNqTFGCohCuHDEqHs1pDPj7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0131479',7.4,4846,'ja','名探偵コナン 時計じかけの摩天楼','Once brilliant teenage detective Shinichi Kudo was given a poison that reverted him to a 4-year-old. He\'s adopted the pseudonym Conan Edogawa so no one (save for an eccentric inventor) will know. Now he\'s got to solve a series of bombings before his loved ones become victims. Who is this madman and why is he doing this? Only the young genius can save the day but will even he be up to the task?','/h6xyd2XwrriAhkYpXpbfffWq09N.jpg','1997-04-19',94,'Released',NULL,'Detective Conan: The Time Bombed Skyscraper',21422,5.8371,7.4,'N4CP6BMyn2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14297,_binary '\0','/yqwxYu9UoPMYYNJFs9l12ID9qze.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0131502',4.7,1773,'en','No Code of Conduct','A cop, his partner, and his father uncover a plot by city elders to smuggle drugs from Mexico into Phoenix, Arizona.','/9Ml1UUzLvoB5BjDvwFyMVvdstiH.jpg','1999-03-19',93,'Released',NULL,'No Code of Conduct',1711,3.9486,5.4,'m3zccmjHrOU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14298,_binary '\0','/vsdk7K9GVm6I3eieVVvYfk0BzUN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0131566',6.4,11455,'en','Rogue Trader','Rogue Trader tells the true story of Nick Leeson, an employee of Barings Bank who--after a successful trading run--ends up accumulating $1.4 billion in losses hidden in account #88888.','/t10DvWj5Yeog5jsJZuBoFDJJbhP.jpg','1999-06-25',101,'Released','He\'ll risk