u0y7P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0131704',4.3,22081,'en','The Adventures of Rocky & Bullwinkle','Rocky and Bullwinkle have been living off the finances made from the reruns of their cartoon show. Boris and Natasha somehow manage to crossover into reality and team up with Fearless Leader, an evil criminal turned media mogul with some evil plans up his sleeve. Rocky and Bullwinkle must stop the three of them before they wreak havoc.','/xCFSsftt2rglC81I6QLWcZSTCBM.jpg','2000-06-30',92,'Released','This summer it\'s not the same old bull.','The Adventures of Rocky & Bullwinkle',17711,5.6923,4.3,'zRADwNEWW6c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14303,_binary '\0','/uU4gKojSRMgr7kqpamSh2lFmSIZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0131857',6.5,69483,'en','BASEketball','Two losers from Milwaukee, Coop and Remer, invent a new game combining basketball with the rules of baseball. When the game becomes a huge success, they, along with a billionaire\'s help, form the Professional Baseketball League where everyone gets the same pay and no team can change cities. When a rival owner wants to institute major rule changes, Coop and Remer\'s team is the only one standing in the way.','/oKZdAUV9XSLp091f0GmtQEu0UZy.jpg','1998-07-28',103,'Released','Two guys invented a game... and turned the sports world upside down!','BASEketball',14013,4.7366,6.141,'UtxFvx3GE7c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14304,_binary '\0','/rODTjAT8q1u4ZXIVTCwsBbZo3EE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0132245',4.6,45500,'en','Driven','Talented rookie race-car driver Jimmy Bly has started losing his focus and begins to slip in the race rankings. It\'s no wonder, with the immense pressure being shoveled on him by his overly ambitious promoter brother as well as Bly\'s romance with his arch rival\'s girlfriend Sophia. With much riding on Bly, car owner Carl Henry brings former racing star Joe Tanto on board to help Bly. To drive Bly back to the top of the rankings, Tanto must first deal with the emotional scars left over from a tragic racing accident which nearly took his life.','/8tJ4Ya8yEyxCMihDumEyvwvUuLB.jpg','2001-04-27',116,'Released','Get ready for the race of your life.','Driven',10477,6.5415,5.174,'O2QrywxknaM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14305,_binary '\0','/nrLnodkGvswfPiuKfbdPZN8P5eI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0132347',6.1,74480,'en','Mystery Men','When Champion City\'s hero Captain Amazing is kidnapped by the recently paroled supervillain Casanova Frankenstein, a trio of average, everyday superheroes -- Mr. Furious, the Shoveler and the Blue Raja -- assemble a new super team to save him.','/ciVSbFmDecOIwlxl9F6GhHVgCVJ.jpg','1999-08-06',121,'Released','Not your classic superheroes...they\'re the other guys.','Mystery Men',9824,5.8015,5.9,'pPkXTEZupEo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14306,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0132378',6.8,1252,'no','Olsenbanden tar gull','Egon returns from prison with the key to a big heist, a hidden Nazi-treasure. The Olsen Gang finds the location of the treasure, but problems arise when the international criminals Carina and Ricco shows up.','/4cllHlH2r7me2Mj8mjdKs1wlc09.jpg','1972-08-09',94,'Released',NULL,'The Olsen Gang Takes the Gold',24668,1.1735,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14307,_binary '\0','/c6uIPrMgvDzhEGSKuZc8aw6NfC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0132477',7.8,113120,'en','October Sky','The true story of Homer Hickam, a coal miner\'s son who was inspired by the first Sputnik launch to take up rocketry against his father\'s wishes.','/umWrXCIWdcYPf764ruvMRCpG3cA.jpg','1999-02-19',107,'Released','Sometimes one dream is enough to light up the whole sky.','October Sky',13466,7.2902,7.683,'4cmMukCFyd8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14308,_binary '\0','/4guSmJ5dCX6Y8OFifFVk6Dp9dA6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0132512',6,15436,'en','At First Sight','A blind man has an operation to regain his sight at the urging of his girlfriend and must deal with the changes to his life.','/9nylrKj8zWxTor9BCy3umv6WHZe.jpg','1999-01-15',128,'Released','Science gave him sight. She gave him vision.','At First Sight',15556,4.0377,6,'yojRQveAnpE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14309,_binary '\0','/jztr3qsmmHzGM1FsdwP6ppJoAeI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0132888',3.6,1992,'en','Blood Freak','A biker comes upon a girl with a flat tire and offers her a ride home. He winds up at a drug party with the girl\'s sister, then follows her to a turkey farm owned by her father, a mad scientist. The father turns the biker into a giant turkey monster who goes after drug dealers.','/yxEtPupFdVMLPPgt8NMpRE7mwmQ.jpg','1972-10-12',86,'Released','A Dracula On Drugs!','Blood Freak',83413,1.5478,3.5,'B4RMDQxJSAE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14310,_binary '\0','/ophZilymhZohZkPEcuOynI7hoJy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0132893',6.8,2713,'en','Borrowed Hearts','Single mom Kathleen Russell (Roma Downey) and her daughter Zoey pretend to be Kathleen\'s boss\'s \"family\" so he can close a major business deal with the mysterious Mexican financier Javier Del Campo.','/4zVDQ8F0QVS3BP5fTmguR3RQJxK.jpg','1997-11-30',91,'Released',NULL,'Borrowed Hearts',70417,2.3032,6.5,'z036iqU7YQE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14311,_binary '\0','/eK8E8U17AdQVGNB9s3PItwZlWwD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0132905',6.5,1358,'es','El coronel no tiene quien le escriba','Every Friday, the Colonel puts on his only suit and goes to the dock to await a letter announcing the arrival of his pension. But the townsfolk all know that this pension will never come. His wife also knows it, and even he knows it. But he is still waiting, living with the pain of the death of his son.','/1KxUgvZEB4tJLL4rVursK5WKCRe.jpg','1999-06-02',118,'Released',NULL,'No One Writes to the Colonel',120129,2.1755,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14312,_binary '\0','/s6cgAveWCam2hYgdPhD3WbrjSBt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0132910',4.9,13857,'en','The Crow: Salvation','Alex Corvis, a man wrongly executed for the murder of his girlfriend, returns from the dead and sets out to find the real killer.','/5JkLJ0HS1hGxZHok9pjBcLCpLuX.jpg','2000-01-23',101,'Released','For vengeance. For justice. For love.','The Crow: Salvation',9456,5.0595,5.5,'XrVu11KNNB8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14313,_binary '\0','/AasQNH3iHoRysoLKF83XOZSvFYk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0132938',4.7,1327,'en','Emmanuelle: First Contact','Emmanuelle makes first contact...when a group of intergalactic travelers arrives, seeking to understand human love and sexuality. Who better to teach them than Emmanuelle, the most sensual woman in the world...and beyond.','/hj7y7GUlj8LZ4ZbtzrsUp5bm2Ft.jpg','1994-06-20',94,'Released','The most sensual woman in the world...and beyond.','Emmanuelle: First Contact',97802,3.0414,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14314,_binary '\0','/yu73EhsOvLHTDpsZ005QERw7EPp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0133024',6.8,13069,'hi','Ishq','The children of two wealthy businessman fall in love with someone from a poor background, much to their parents\' disapprovals.','/38xVYSuVXIJS1iyEaRm8wtjotZB.jpg','1997-11-28',161,'Released',NULL,'Ishq',29988,1.7405,6.403,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14315,_binary '\0','/i64i2v5EvY0qmpUkyKs5cSOwdGG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0133046',5.4,22765,'en','Teaching Mrs. Tingle','A bright high-school senior has her impending status as valedictorian jeopardized when her bitter history teacher, Mrs. Tingle, gives her a poor grade on a project. When an attempt to get ahead in Mrs. Tingle\'s class goes awry, mayhem ensues and friendships, loyalties and trust are tested by the teacher\'s intricate mind-games.','/cGv0tkWZZSmoaPYiOsDcGmMhKq7.jpg','1999-08-11',96,'Released','Before school lets out, Mrs. Tingle\'s class is going to need a substitute teacher.','Teaching Mrs. Tingle',10342,4.9834,5.5,'ZbVa-QJXI5M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14316,_binary '\0','/cHhLPbN8yOui9SfysizvopgMYbk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0133059',6.2,1919,'cn','算死草','Stephen Chow plays a selfish yet in some places kind hearted barrister who tricks his servant in doing things for his own benefit. Eric Kot playing the servant is misguided by what he thinks is love and leaves Chow vowing that he will never need Chow\'s help again in life. Shortly afterwards Kot gets into some big trouble (due to be executed) with the British and calls on Chow for help. Chow tries to help his client, but is fish out of water when he has to fight this court room case according to western rules.','/mc4mjHkvvOwJ4g5eMD7t1lxitvB.jpg','1997-07-31',85,'Released',NULL,'Lawyer Lawyer',45487,2.2595,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14317,_binary '\0','/tlm8UkiQsitc8rSuIAscQDCnP8d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0133093',8.7,2277849,'en','The Matrix','Set in the 22nd century, The Matrix tells the story of a computer hacker who joins a group of underground insurgents fighting the vast and powerful computers who now rule the earth.','/dXNAPwY7VrqMAo51EKhhCJfaGb5.jpg','1999-03-31',136,'Released','Believe the unbelievable.','The Matrix',603,50.9712,8.259,'FVI84Dfx2-I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14318,_binary '\0','/njEV665uPL7ptlhod0UCMb1P4PV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0133104',5.1,1421,'ja','モスラ2 海底の大決戦','The fairies from Infant Island discover a lost city, as well as a giant monster that is attracted to environmental calamities.','/1tXKK2HZCzxWmuE7MeJ0o38aUKn.jpg','1997-12-13',97,'Released','A transforming miracle!','Rebirth of Mothra II',36212,1.4701,5.7,'EJAoqPYrW8Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14319,_binary '\0','/9GXU40cPceT5L4AgQs4cl0yjA8l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0133122',5.2,7285,'en','New Rose Hotel','A corporate raider and his henchman use a chanteuse to lure a scientific genius away from his employer and family.','/pMk6iJSmbt5uovZ1LEhhBZdR5cz.jpg','1999-03-19',93,'Released','No possession is sacred. No secret is safe.','New Rose Hotel',21430,2.7852,5.29,'HDd4vIMOVXk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14320,_binary '\0','/1N0MYYFvYwpM5fi3mjw4150ReoR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0133152',5.7,243222,'en','Planet of the Apes','After a spectacular crash-landing on an uncharted planet, brash astronaut Leo Davidson finds himself trapped in a savage world where talking apes dominate the human race. Desperate to find a way home, Leo must evade the invincible gorilla army led by Ruthless General Thade.','/3ZWsuP5rExMSji7erxnb1P5SK6F.jpg','2001-07-26',120,'Released',NULL,'Planet of the Apes',869,15.6452,5.777,'E-a4eIA8KWM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14321,_binary '\0','/8jVr1iEuNY4MS7CI3JY39gXg1jR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0133170',7.7,2354,'ja','ラヂオの時間','A love story written by an ordinary housewife is going to be broadcast as a radio drama and almost everyone among the crew insists on changing various parts of the play to their liking.','/y1bFYM4d9YFVye1Jc8vgxJUfyOR.jpg','1997-11-08',103,'Released',NULL,'Welcome Back, Mr. McDonald',102227,2.7364,7.6,'2Z15vb6MILY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14322,_binary '\0','/iYFh15WLRXHPfAkcaqgIfVLoopC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0133189',7.3,36344,'en','SLC Punk','Two former geeks become 1980s punks, then party and go to concerts while deciding what to do with their lives.','/7u3IZPuIOPjICi55K7cJgzV3e3B.jpg','1998-09-24',97,'Released','God bless America... they\'re going to need it.','SLC Punk',6396,3.3365,7.137,'MsZziQvRWCg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14323,_binary '\0','/f2opsSUSiMdEp6AiY2sbC8QPd8S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0133240',7.2,150598,'en','Treasure Planet','When space galleon cabin boy Jim Hawkins discovers a map to an intergalactic \"loot of a thousand worlds,\" a cyborg cook named John Silver teaches him to battle supernovas and space storms on their journey to find treasure.','/kNhZkR3UNbXfvESQo7mJpOi4tGd.jpg','2002-11-26',96,'Released','Find your place in the universe.','Treasure Planet',9016,20.047,7.579,'ajhZRL1j7a0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14324,_binary '\0','/yGcfhstNqWEv31kRvwSVFw2JsBX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0133363',7.6,20978,'es','Los amantes del Círculo Polar','As young children, Otto and Ana become best friends, leading to the marriage of Ana\'s mother to Otto\'s father. When Otto and Ana become teenagers, they begin a sexual relationship, which they hide from their parents. The two fall deeply in love and seem destined to spend the rest of their lives together. However, their relationship is tested when Otto\'s mother dies and the two are separated.','/1hUFwXtUIJQdayIkaTR835QyaKT.jpg','1998-09-04',112,'Released','Destiny cannot be denied.','Lovers of the Arctic Circle',1414,2.9114,7.3,'kkbBoTitGpc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14325,_binary '\0','/1FxwuCdaMmCEsl3hSlafKRHR8Th.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0133385',6,48908,'fr','Astérix & Obélix contre César','Set in 50 B.C., Asterix and Obelix are living in a small but well-protected village in Gaul, where a magic potion concocted by Druids turns the townsfolk into mighty soldiers. When Roman troops carve a path through Gaul to reach the English Channel, Caesar and his aide de camp Detritus discover the secret elixir and capture the Druid leader who knows its formula, and Asterix and Obelix are sent off to rescue them.','/sJ4zNakOuWcsW6ssH1qk80JehQ2.jpg','1999-02-03',109,'Released','The Gauls are revolting!','Asterix and Obelix Take On Caesar',9564,8.3083,6,'CdNgs_fl3rI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14326,_binary '\0','/7x5z33H3Drr9btqpBemymwc5U86.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0133412',6.1,8577,'en','Best Laid Plans','Rich, successful Bryce meets beautiful Lissa at a bar one night and invites her back to his house, not suspecting for a moment that Lissa isn\'t really who she seems. What unfolds next is a dangerous, tangled web of double-crosses and seduction.','/yvsfeDsJrTV4stJhYY00zL5e8WW.jpg','1999-04-09',92,'Released','Keeping a relationship alive can be murder','Best Laid Plans',18621,3.2959,5.746,'PfMEoflpTQE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14327,_binary '\0','/qb00FqfMPidYzyW1f8Vs0gtPnWE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0133643',5.8,4983,'en','Breast Men','We follow the two Texas doctors who invented the modern breast implant and its surgical procedure. However, when success and money come their way, they split up and follow different paths. One becomes the surgeon of the everyday woman while the other\'s career freefalls and has to settle with strippers and actresses. The film covers their history and their inventions, from the sixties until today.','/gWLkO7Xp6tZPwevNAyBrV9X6W0U.jpg','1997-12-13',95,'Released','Two young doctors with a dream of making it big... Really big!','Breast Men',19850,4.7362,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14328,_binary '\0','/oJRlYxfG10h4sxk2A7fpeOZnaFi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0133751',6.6,149564,'en','The Faculty','When creepy things start happening at Herrington High, the students begin to suspect that their faculty is being controlled by body-snatching aliens.','/5XetJwmAiDC0EtH23NIXaqFn3Wl.jpg','1998-12-25',104,'Released','These six students are about to discover their teachers really are from another planet.','The Faculty',9276,11.2218,6.6,'praQkvivkUE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14329,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0133826',8.5,3951,'ml','ഗുരു','A few political goons, disguised as Muslims, cause trouble at the temple and kill Raghuraman\'s family. Later, Raghuraman joins an extremist group and decides to avenge his family\'s death.','/4TUWBUul1BWqnadSOrknNWs9wUd.jpg','1997-09-12',150,'Released',NULL,'Guru',280254,1.4484,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14330,_binary '\0','/soQhZpbZKFm5BoDhWgm3WrVRl7h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0133906',7.2,4139,'fi','Kummeli Kultakuume','Psychiatric patient Elmeri knows about the existence of a gold treasure in Finnish Lapland, hidden there by his late father who somehow managed to capture it from withdrawing German troops on the last days of WW2. His openly gay nurse helps him escape from the mental institution, and the two men slowly find their way up north to reach the gold. On their way, the odd couple meets a cavalcade of even odder characters.','/3p1Bi3SUbWHNcJlwBRlte6W2DfY.jpg','1997-12-05',96,'Released',NULL,'Kummeli Kultakuume',38205,1.6938,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14331,_binary '\0','/c2B8gl2ZLbelWxS0ZODPKGJxdWX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0133952',6.4,83785,'en','The Siege','The secret US abduction of a suspected terrorist from his Middle East homeland leads to a wave of terrorist attacks in New York. An FBI senior agent and his team attempt to locate and decommission the enemy cells, but must also deal with an Army General gone rogue and a female CIA agent of uncertain loyalties.','/gbeeWu8rYaIYMyq9ayN1AepjNxP.jpg','1998-11-06',116,'Released','An enemy they can\'t see. A nation under siege. A crisis they can\'t control.','The Siege',9882,7.7585,6.295,'87Rai0X97Fc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14332,_binary '\0','/6QSkFvaEA5L5Q6GmX5qCfowwHoO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0133985',6.3,9910,'en','A Murder of Crows','In the wake of a career-ending scandal, disgraced lawyer Lawson Russell moves to Key West, where he befriends aging novelist Christopher Marlowe. After letting Russell borrow his latest manuscript, Marlowe dies of a heart attack. When Russell publishes the dead man\'s manuscript under his own name, he makes the best-seller list—and unwittingly becomes the prime suspect in the investigation of a grisly multiple homicide.','/fi88I3TTCY6JVwhEqlJCU2YeDNi.jpg','1999-07-06',102,'Released','A work of deadly fiction.','A Murder of Crows',17263,3.4226,6.124,'YNkSiO8ojX0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14333,_binary '\0','/tKQH4kTV9PHtDTghmlPTiLVMuWE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0134033',6.3,10853,'en','Plunkett & Macleane','Will Plunkett and Captain James Macleane, two men from different ends of the social spectrum in 18th-century England, enter a gentlemen\'s agreement: They decide to rid the aristocrats of their belongings. With Plunkett\'s criminal know-how and Macleane\'s social connections, they team up to be soon known as \"The Gentlemen Highwaymen\". But when one day these gentlemen hold up Lord Chief Justice Gibson\'s coach, Macleane instantly falls in love with his beautiful and cunning niece, Lady Rebecca Gibson. Unfortunately, Thief Taker General Chance, who also is quite fond of Rebecca, is getting closer and closer to getting both.','/9LASEwSyW2h7Zql0t1ksURC70MG.jpg','1999-01-22',93,'Released','They Robbed The Rich...And That\'s It','Plunkett & Macleane',10381,3.9198,6.2,'MH_QY6vFCDE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14334,_binary '\0','/xGhwfRxTsP9VhDSNsfHqBcRvWKY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0134057',5.2,1841,'it','La Riffa','Struggling with a financial crisis, a good-looking widow decides to put herself up for grabs. However, going through with it becomes almost impossible with a new love and the legal system thrown into the mix.','/2Jc60w8ZemDMYqyJUStcQKy6syi.jpg','1991-11-15',93,'Released','Francesca is alone with a daughter and without a dime. But she\'s beautiful','The Raffle',59053,4.7507,6.9,'o4Kxx63iBJM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14335,_binary '\0','/cC9oBBqGcOdBheKre24YfthsptI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0134067',6,22154,'en','The Rugrats Movie','The Pickles family welcome a new arrival, Dil, whose constant crying and need for attention quickly exhaust the other toddlers. Seeking to return the \"broken\" baby to the hospital, the gang embarks on a journey in a Reptar Wagon that inadvertently veers off course, leaving them stranded in a vast, dangerous forest. While facing off against escaped circus monkeys and a predatory wolf, Tommy must overcome his own resentment to protect his brother and make it back home.','/uZejGKCSd6nwfMx8U0Td37U2fTc.jpg','1998-11-20',80,'Released','An adventure for anyone who\'s ever worn diapers.','The Rugrats Movie',14444,6.1895,6.3,'Uw7HDQ5Dnjo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14336,_binary '\0','/AbFWty0o5nKGo4iLJaGRgqFtC8W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0134084',5.7,188344,'en','Scream 3','As bodies begin dropping around the Hollywood set of STAB 3, the third film based on the gruesome Woodsboro killings, Sidney and other survivors are once again terrorized by another Ghostface killer.','/qpH8ToZVlFD1bakL04LkEKodyDI.jpg','2000-02-04',116,'Released','The most terrifying scream is always the last.','Scream 3',4234,10.4949,6.007,'Gx24Z9O0MuY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14337,_binary '\0','/51UDa3IuGyiKGe2MgMcLGvJE2Fm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0134119',7.4,275905,'en','The Talented Mr. Ripley','Tom Ripley is a calculating young man who believes it\'s better to be a fake somebody than a real nobody. Opportunity knocks in the form of a wealthy U.S. shipbuilder who hires Tom to travel to Italy to bring back his playboy son, Dickie. Ripley worms his way into the idyllic lives of Dickie and his girlfriend, plunging into a daring scheme of duplicity, lies and murder.','/6ojHgqtIR41O2qLKa7LFUVj0cZa.jpg','1999-12-25',140,'Released','How far would you go to become someone else.','The Talented Mr. Ripley',1213,11.5093,7.2,'Ylc5ToQoLg0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14338,_binary '\0','/yBkZyxzIl46PVgFEDsTCtoGd5F4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0134154',6.7,15347,'en','Ride with the Devil','Friends Jake and Jack Bull join up with Civil War guerrilla fighters, yet after the realities of war set in, they must decide what honor truly means.','/pH3J5IUzho4ZVaRuTuErzqHHovb.jpg','1999-11-24',138,'Released','In a No-man\'s Land between North and South, You didn\'t fight for the Blue or the Grey... You fought for your friends and family.','Ride with the Devil',22267,6.0512,6.336,'F8Vwm6dBQI8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14339,_binary '\0','/mn36UOPQm6cHFdxM37601WF5nLt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0134230',6.4,2041,'hu','Zimmer Feri','The 50 years old Ferenc rents an apartment on the Balaton beach, but it has a lot of debt on it. His plan is to make it profitable.','/Apaat3IVaaQJ1z5HRSe47zt0hgh.jpg','1998-01-27',88,'Released',NULL,'Zimmer Feri',159582,0.8712,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14340,_binary '\0','/eEP8pyCmldfbnml0SFMvPK7kE4x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0134273',6.6,152730,'en','8MM','A small, seemingly innocuous plastic reel of film leads surveillance specialist Tom Welles down an increasingly dark and frightening path. With the help of the streetwise Max, he relentlessly follows a bizarre trail of evidence to determine the fate of a complete stranger. As his work turns into obsession, he drifts farther and farther away from his wife, family and simple life as a small-town PI.','/mhr9xRpjOBqlBjgDwtiOx6FsLvV.jpg','1999-02-26',123,'Released','You can\'t prepare for where the truth will take you.','8MM',8224,7.6355,6.508,'mjIGbTTw3i8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14341,_binary '\0','/f8zh7tSRsp4h3tGaD6ZRRWANXSX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0134402',8.3,2239,'pt','Cabra Marcado Para Morrer','Eduardo Coutinho was filming a movie with the same name in the Northeast of Brazil, in 1964, when there came the military coup. He had to interrupt the project, and came back to it in 1981, looking for the same places and people, showing what had ocurred since then, and trying to gather a family whose patriarch, a political leader fighting for rights of country people, had been murdered.','/gqLIvOGAUQOIQh6PEbkL6yz00Ch.jpg','1984-12-03',119,'Released',NULL,'Twenty Years Later',86320,1.4976,8.4,'qfPHHaN--6w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14342,_binary '\0','/8bgqAgtG2IW8q04lDVfkNTzP5dL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0134614',7.8,5281,'ru','Девчата','A graduate of the culinary technical school of the cook, Tosya Kislitsyna, a naive and eccentric girl, came to the village lost in the northern forests. She sticks her nose in all affairs, seeks to help everyone. She met Ilya on the day of arrival: the \"first guy in the village\" fell upon her indignantly, and in the evening, to brighten up an unpleasant meeting, she decided to \"make happy\" with an invitation to a dance and was refused. Not accustomed to refusals, Ilya argues with Filya that during the week he will fall in love with Tosya...','/zAmv4i2sARwa17npj8rJD4OA4md.jpg','1962-03-07',96,'Released',NULL,'The Girls',20975,2.4452,7.533,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14343,_binary '\0','/swwCQk5sDGeuVWub4GLyS2YETrT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0134618',6.7,29853,'en','Mystery, Alaska','In Mystery, Alaska, life revolves around the legendary Saturday hockey game at the local pond. But everything changes when the hometown team unexpectedly gets booked in an exhibition match against the New York Rangers. When quirky small-towners, slick promoters and millionaire athletes come together.','/bmg4sjOQswcrP5mPL9YzNom9cXx.jpg','1999-10-01',119,'Released','A Small Town on the Outskirts of Greatness.','Mystery, Alaska',15198,3.7651,6.304,'a80x06Wn91U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14344,_binary '\0','/9bMAhzkuvwSXdxUIoFrYuAvkxDU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0134619',5.7,28053,'en','Disturbing Behavior','Steve Clark is a newcomer in the town of Cradle Bay, and he quickly realizes that there\'s something odd about his high school classmates. The clique known as the \"Blue Ribbons\" are the eerie embodiment of academic excellence and clean living. But, like the rest of the town, they\'re a little too perfect. When Steve\'s rebellious friend Gavin mysteriously joins their ranks, Steve searches for the truth with fellow misfit Rachel.','/uAhvaueOUUQ6ORCRdsJr1WXz1w0.jpg','1998-07-24',84,'Released','In Cradle Bay it doesn’t matter if you’re not perfect. You will be.','Disturbing Behavior',9424,3.7398,5.829,'ipcvwwIoEHo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14345,_binary '\0','/dDJuLVV5K1XYim69Ab8wy9luXu4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0134630',6.2,10561,'en','Duets','Duets is a road-trip comedy which revolves around the little known world of karaoke and the whimsical characters who inhabit it. All roads lead to Omaha, site of a national karaoke competition where this motley group of singers and stars come together for a blow-out sing-off.','/isxHRG54S1bz1A1CAlPaAAoh65k.jpg','2000-09-09',112,'Released','Six littles souls in search of a little harmony.','Duets',18074,3.5846,5.72,'rdVzQatZEs4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14346,_binary '\0','/s2lO59YNCmrXuCh2O1QiHR7fsMN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0134633',7.3,2850,'ru','Экипаж','Story of the lives of three Soviet pilots who are united by disaster in a small town in the mountains.','/uT4SIGnCjEX1GFiRpJzY5C1z6c.jpg','1980-01-14',144,'Released',NULL,'Air Crew',72892,1.5626,6.754,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14347,_binary '\0','/eFL6glfGf0GPGRQ712f1rPNniDV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0134661',6.8,4054,'en','Frosty\'s Winter Wonderland','Years have passed since Frosty left for the North Pole, but his promise is kept when he hears news of the first snowfall of the season, and decides to return.','/o915rkZ0wwQjrk0UAEQkEkmt1E1.jpg','1976-12-02',25,'Released',NULL,'Frosty\'s Winter Wonderland',26539,2.115,6.566,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14348,_binary '\0','/hKHep3PE2PVS7Lv13lYT9WnAGwL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0134664',6.8,1541,'cn','高度戒備','A police inspector becomes obsessed with apprehending a criminal planning a major heist at the Hong Kong Jockey Club in the weeks leading up to Hong Kong\'s return to China.','/54EorHKcOokVBFWgJX6clsPoEcN.jpg','1997-07-18',99,'Released',NULL,'Full Alert',42842,2.5695,6.8,'CxVSTz48Xu8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14349,_binary '\0','/4Pq6OxOyvV12OBsPSMpWPc3F6iF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0134771',7.2,1388,'ja','黒い河','A love triangle develops between a benevolent student, his innocent girlfriend, and a cruel petty criminal, all as a point of diagnosis of a social disease that had Japan slowly succumbing to lawlessness during the post-War era.','/ngqkpjfP2fU3bAXElKSbfSXlTVv.jpg','1957-10-23',114,'Released',NULL,'Black River',101929,1.3986,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14350,_binary '\0','/9IO3Ha7lptcCg31dFyWnXcBlEeh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0134786',8,2643,'ro','Liceenii','The love story of two students in the tenth grade. Mihai is a provincial who reached in a Bucharest high school where his passion for philosophy and mathematics will be eclipsed by love and Dana is a chess enthusiast. Their romance is full of naturalness, but will go through many trials.','/7YqG0u4Qqi9FyvTtqIm1o9iZMx6.jpg','1986-05-01',96,'Released',NULL,'The High Schoolers',141331,1.6702,8.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14351,_binary '\0','/bMJdVmo6QqoUHpUsjWyei6MN02x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0134847',7,266147,'en','Pitch Black','When their ship crash-lands on a remote planet, the marooned passengers soon learn that escaped convict Riddick isn\'t the only thing they have to fear. Deadly creatures lurk in the shadows, waiting to attack in the dark, and the planet is rapidly plunging into the utter blackness of a total eclipse. With the body count rising, the doomed survivors are forced to turn to Riddick with his eerie eyes to guide them through the darkness to safety. With time running out, there\'s only one rule: Stay in the light.','/3AnlxZ5CZnhKKzjgFyY6EHxmOyl.jpg','2000-02-18',108,'Released','Don\'t be afraid of the dark. Be afraid of what\'s in the dark.','Pitch Black',2787,6.4654,6.874,'mEJ8e8S4hOw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14352,_binary '\0','/lKcnwEruAPjwVUxUqx1r3nCHh1p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0134928',5.2,4720,'ja','らせん','A young pathologist seeks answers to the mysterious death of a friend and soon comes into contact with the same cursed videotape that caused the death of the friend\'s wife and son, which is haunted by the curse of Sadako, a relentless spirit.','/nSJUlIejc5yL1qAInQBtIgGysaK.jpg','1998-01-31',97,'Released',NULL,'The Spiral',9706,2.9699,5.4,'iLgnhZ4RUqQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14353,_binary '\0','/gGnB5HYaPysK8MUjnE96hrDCs5o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0134969',3.2,1807,'en','Soccer Dog: The Movie','A heart-warming comedy about the friendship between the new kid in town and a soccer-playing dog on the lam from the dog-catcher. It\'s up to these two underdogs to win the PeeWee Soccer League championship game.','/uVHDvqpJn09XaiHUN78MgUh3WP6.jpg','1999-01-01',99,'Released',NULL,'Soccer Dog: The Movie',32139,1.8806,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14354,_binary '\0','/przsU4aiGsdlDkCp5uV8kq8gbLe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0134983',4.9,21215,'en','Supernova','Set in the 22nd century, when a battered salvage ship sends out a distress signal, the seasoned crew of the rescue hospital ship Nova-17 responds. What they find is a black hole--that threatens to destroy both ships--and a mysterious survivor whose body quickly mutates into a monstrous and deadly form.','/AmHGUjhgXnOYRYrF2ZYMtzfwxPe.jpg','2000-01-14',91,'Released','All hell is about to break loose.','Supernova',10384,5.1222,5,'tLmjjtpb4H4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14355,_binary '\0','/43RcFOMa3NGsTw0VUOjkNRmYGbN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0135007',7.7,13602,'it','Tre uomini e una gamba','Friends Aldo, Giovanni, and Giacomo cross Italy from north to south for Giacomo\'s wedding: the father of the bride, a despotic magnate who is both their boss and father-in-law—since Aldo and Giovanni have also married into the family not for love but for money, a fate now awaiting Giacomo—has entrusted them with a priceless piece of modern art, one that looks just like a rather unremarkable wooden leg.','/yhgfM1WTHu4Uiwa47FAGmBk4V7x.jpg','1997-12-27',98,'Released','WANTED: A Leg, Dead or Alive','Three Men and a Leg',38286,2.6592,8,'x8L6dcZCxnA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14356,_binary '\0','/fEfFaByobTu2RR2KMMohmCNLReg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0135024',5.3,4875,'fr','Une vraie jeune fille','Reluctantly, a sulky adolescent returns to her parents\' house for yet another boring summer vacation, dabbling in desire and the art of desirability, eventually mixing reality with vision, caged fantasies with the fierce female sexuality.','/kuSYd4AGcfydRtkcVLqas0zLtql.jpg','1976-06-01',94,'Released','A surreal voyage into adolescent sexuality.','A Real Young Girl',1631,13.0051,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14357,_binary '\0','/pgrRRmjuX6cMqqwgqSpGl93jD4s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0135033',7.2,3425,'es','Veneno para las hadas','In 1965 Mexico City, Flavia, a wealthy yet lonely schoolgirl, befriends Veronica, a young orphan girl who has a fascination with witchcraft. Veronica convinces Flavia that she is a real witch and forces her to be her assistant. The children\'s games gradually become more serious and Veronica demands more from Flavia.','/wnuqTxv4G9mj4Q27ayoZowu4IwU.jpg','1986-10-02',90,'Released',NULL,'Poison for the Fairies',28968,2.6096,7.8,'IAWOBQ9wt9E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14358,_binary '\0','/2CLYqi6FCVYU4weO4ggH9abyjhy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0135037',6.6,2335,'ja','ヴイナス戦記','The new frontier of Venus has degenerated into a dystopia ravaged by the civil war between Ishtar and Aphrodia. Bubbly reporter Susan Sommers arrives in the capitol of Aphrodia just before it\'s captured by Ishtar. She falls in with a bunch of teen-agers who live for a sort of motorcycle version of Roller Derby. Daredevil rider Hiro and his friends reluctantly join the struggle to free Aphrodia from the invaders. Not surprisingly, Hiro proves an ace at piloting the mono-cycles that are the Aphrodians\' secret weapon in the key battle.','/vqebq2MY0NvBwpgyPwhiBah3c5J.jpg','1989-03-11',102,'Released',NULL,'Venus Wars',31769,4.312,6.7,'I7Rlnb5mwSk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14359,_binary '\0','/ntIfZV9mi4r9Qwlp7WZ7nTjYsfg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0135165',4,1242,'en','Bug Buster','After the mayor uses a potentially dangerous substance to protect the local plantation, the lakeside town of Mountview, in California, is attacked by a lethal species of large cockroach. After some of the town\'s inhabitants are killed, the mayor enlists the help of eccentric pest exterminator General George S. Merlin in order to prevent further harm to the local dwellers.','/7bTOOlKQT2jySiiPiPuQYSIPyf7.jpg','1998-01-18',93,'Released','Dial 1-500-KICK-ASS for the Pest Eliminator near you.','Bug Buster',57196,2.4662,3.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14360,_binary '\0','/5c8wc8MRr4lB0K3spkjWmphf2XJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0135509',6,1619,'el','Η Κόρη Μου Η Σοσιαλίστρια','Liza falls in love with one of her father\'s employees. Her socialistic ideas about employment drive her to collide with her father and the sociopolitical status of the time.','/3Wyr5LSh68VKGwpsIjlA9QVKhzn.jpg','1966-10-24',94,'Released',NULL,'My Daughter, the Socialist',266549,1.1125,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14361,_binary '\0','/ngUVOmpqWavlzj9f2YEyvKEl7z0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0135519',7.5,1249,'el','Λατέρνα, Φτώχεια Και Φιλότιμο','Two poor portable barrel piano players ramble through Greek countryside and play in fairs. They meet by chance with a rich runaway girl whose father offers a large reward to her finders.They have to choose between getting the reward or helping the girl with her renegade love affair.','/3aVO1aW7mEhZEFoprxW82FAOnSM.jpg','1955-12-12',91,'Released',NULL,'The Hurdy-Gurdy',301491,0.6595,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14362,_binary '\0','/sKT1XISC4hi74H238exoxMkCxOA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0135625',7.7,1346,'ru','Республика ШКИД','The film is based on the eponymous book, written by two former street gangsters - Grigori Belykh and Leonid Panteleyev. Film is set in the 1920s St. Petersburg, Russia. Streets of the city are full of the homeless boys. They are caught to be raised and educated at the correction school named after Dostoevsky. The boys are street smart and difficult. But the faculty stands up to the challenge. The teaches are being devoted and caring, and gradually win the respect of the most difficult kids. The school director Vicknixor is a refined intellectual, who becomes a role model for the boys.','/mvohjlYq5P3AApvyDYSUkgCp4A9.jpg','1966-12-29',103,'Released',NULL,'The Republic of ShKID',20885,0.8668,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14363,_binary '\0','/nYuQ0wlW6Bq4hwtBM87lTUyNiQ6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0135636',8,3239,'sv','Sagan om Karl-Bertil Jonssons julafton','\"Christopher\'s Christmas Mission\"- A tale about a boy who steals Christmas gifts from the wealthy to give to the poor people of Stockholm, while working in a post office on Christmas Eve.','/bK3Wv9vN29pTPtC65qvkIaEOsN5.jpg','1975-12-24',23,'Released','Take from the rich give to the poor','Christopher\'s Christmas Mission',74354,1.2395,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14364,_binary '\0','/yUtrtho67X2HQHkJ0myHwWtPlzZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0135641',5.2,1390,'hi','सपूत','Singhania big hearten Don who does not like to trade in drugs and other illegal business which does not go well with his rivals Dhaneshwar and Tejeshwar.Singhania\'s older son Raj is taking care of his business,While is younger son Prem is a Casanova.Dhaneshwar is killed by Singhania when he attacks on Raj.Kantiilal and Samsher trusted aide of Singhania\'s betray him and he gets killed by them and Tejeshwar.','/8ray62qezaV4G5sdMrGBR93l5i1.jpg','1996-11-08',158,'Released',NULL,'Sapoot',305899,1.1826,4.929,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14365,_binary '\0','/324EG6EiXnpEnk2ODpnYyWF9J4K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0135673',7.7,1966,'el','Η Θεία Απ\' Το Σικάγο','Charilaos (Orestis Makris), a retired officer with very strict and conservative principles, raises his four daughters with... military discipline, taking care of their culture, their appearance and their good behavior. Despite all his desire to marry them, he does not leave them anywhere alone, as a result of which no man approaches them. His wife, Efterpi (Eleni Zafiriou), as well as his friend and neighbor Xenophon (Pantelis Zervos), make remarkable efforts to convince him to change his tactics, but he insists on his very conservative behavior. But when the conversation reaches the well-to-do sister of Kalliopis (Georgia Vassiliadou) who has been living in Chicago, USA for years, everything turns upside down. She returns to Athens and undertakes to modernize the general\'s house, as well as help the four girls (and her nieces) to be rehabilitated.','/xOkb0ymIYnDpFp0OdgBoexPtV7G.jpg','1957-12-16',72,'Released',NULL,'The Auntie from Chicago',288526,1.2206,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14366,_binary '\0','/tqzpeMDGkC5z2n28U13kRZR4Lti.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0135706',7,9425,'en','When Trumpets Fade','In WWII Western Germany, Private David Manning reluctantly leaves behind a mortally wounded fellow soldier and searches for survivors from his platoon, only to learn from commanding officer Captain Pritchett that they have all been killed in action. Despite requesting a discharge on the grounds of mental disability, Manning is promoted to sergeant and assigned to lead a new platoon of young inductees.','/koPwFJ9qe4HCS4T8I1dumdMSjGU.jpg','1998-06-27',95,'Released','Heroes are born when bullets fly,when earth explodes,when cannons roar...When trumpets fade','When Trumpets Fade',13935,3.8003,6.6,'_qkWQvOZ3Oo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14367,_binary '\0','/y57A6U4lbmSTXHejwFQjD8KDhHk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0135790',7.5,11530,'de','Bang Boom Bang - Ein todsicheres Ding','Bank robber Kalle Grabowski escapes from prison while his unemployed smalltime crook buddy is sitting around doing nothing after he just lost all their money. A fast paced comedy from German director Peter Thorwarth.','/c1bkOK9z6s3ZSkFEejUw76eeuwZ.jpg','1999-08-26',110,'Released',NULL,'Bang, Boom, Bang',344,2.4642,7.5,'hicVVzmESUg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14368,_binary '\0','/nb26S2qGTPTYXFcFZ77CblkNB33.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0136153',4.6,2968,'hi','इंग्लिश बाबु देसी मेम','Vikram Mayur is looking after his late brother\'s eight-year-old son and is torn between choosing to take Nandu back to England to learn his family\'s business, or risk throwing it all way.','/m1JCCMIv7E2bt0JHkI75sKknYlp.jpg','1996-01-26',172,'Released',NULL,'English Babu Desi Mem',160255,1.8002,5.386,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14369,_binary '\0','/k6KrLaa1QogrCBQB47wcRu2iVPC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0136244',6,7293,'en','Hideous Kinky','In 1972, disenchanted about the dreary conventions of English life, 25-year-old Julia heads for Morocco with her daughters, six-year-old Lucy and precocious eight-year-old Bea.','/c1uprmmhS6LFt5GDcUuugcTBqDw.jpg','1999-02-04',98,'Released','A journey to love.','Hideous Kinky',10209,2.669,5.9,'Xmp6Z7nICoU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14370,_binary '\0','/vPBdScexsK9F2DerVBGuxnjHHSf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0136352',6.2,10855,'hi','कोयला','A village girl agrees to a marriage to a king she has never met after he sends her a photograph of himself. But the man in the photograph is not the king but his most loyal slave, the handsome but mute Shankar.','/rP12AzvscPo6WfKdrkw1Nfv2KrK.jpg','1997-04-18',170,'Released',NULL,'Koyla',160265,2.3314,6.514,'ayWGCfkx_fw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14371,_binary '\0','/ztaRsWWfIUX4pSLG7YWpEHR8CAt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0136551',6.8,1302,'el','Ο Στρίγγλος Που Έγινε Αρνάκι','Leonidas Petrohilos (Lambros Konstantaras), a widower with three master unruly children, Kimon (Paul Liaros), Andreas (Thanassis Papadopoulos) and dad (Vangelis Ioannidis), still loves his first wife and refuses to remarry. His friend Xenophon (Stavros Xenidis) recommends Mary\'s (Maro Kondou) atychisasa a lady who needs to work. Leonidas hires Mary as housekeeper and serenity comes home. But until Leonidas understand that it is intended for rigged plot has good bite on the plate ...','/g6nwGv9w0AUBNkjY8TBMW8cxI8Z.jpg','1968-01-22',80,'Released',NULL,'The Strongman Who Became a Lamb',181196,0.8465,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14372,_binary '\0','/4H2hbSkXi6nVYHTIukAQ9Zs4gQA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0136694',6.7,2601,'fa','آدم برفی','A Iranian man (Akbar Abdi) stuck in Turkey, desperately wants to get a VISA to go to America. He starts dressing up as a woman in hopes of marrying an American man to get American citizenship, but he starts having doubts and...','/pthH1kxc1RDWPFBdINbxF7VCLJc.jpg','1995-01-02',97,'Released',NULL,'Snowman',327566,0.8498,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14373,_binary '\0','/grqR4eJ7Zcrqbc8rY2fX2JDqaAy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0136755',6.8,1622,'en','The Christmas List','Perfume saleslady Melody Parris feels like her life is in neutral. Her stick-in-the mud boyfriend won\'t commit and she gets passed over for a promotion at the store where she works. She decides to make a Christmas list. After it\'s deposited in Santa\'s mailbox at the store, she starts getting everything she wanted, but it doesn\'t always turn out as she expected.','/2pvPGlQORmNBROfkYDolJrDVjH5.jpg','1997-12-01',86,'Released',NULL,'The Christmas List',82375,1.5332,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14374,_binary '\0','/qqGBIb9N5b7mXFAxwbF1vKLk2OH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0137079',6.8,1442,'de','Lola und Bilidikid','Lola is part of “The Migrant Workers”, a Turkish drag queen troupe who perform to great acclaim. Lola’s gay little brother Murat, on the other hand, is just beginning his search for an identity. An intense family drama set in “Anatolian” Berlin-Kreuzberg.','/7PaPoErUcs2JdLZKtl84OqXyXsU.jpg','1999-02-21',93,'Released',NULL,'Lola and Billy the Kid',162234,1.7356,6.4,'LHhfc5n4xFU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14375,_binary '\0','/qMD6mRBJoew8aNSbB58ySJQ6duH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0137100',5.4,2595,'hi','माया मेमसाब','A frustrated housewife whose marriage to an average man does not meet her expectations enters into an affair with a younger man. Of course, there are no easy escapes from reality.','/lIRLy3RGceFWQ9SMKN26ZudxvLw.jpg','1993-07-02',126,'Released',NULL,'Maya Memsaab',170991,1.7363,5.673,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14376,_binary '\0','/up2T2KP54vxu89IbVKZUB28fWdj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0137201',5.9,3598,'en','Rudolph the Red-Nosed Reindeer: The Movie','Young Rudolph suffers a childhood accident that sees his nose turn from the publicly accepted norm of black to a glowing red colour. His parents worry about him getting teased, and indeed he does in the end. When he is beaten in the reindeer games by his rival for a doe he fancies, Rudolph runs away and moves into a cave with Slyly the Fox. However can he overcome his fear and reach his true potential?','/pNwHtfMVcqmWat1MfMJ9XSVBBXR.jpg','1998-10-16',83,'Released',NULL,'Rudolph the Red-Nosed Reindeer: The Movie',33719,3.5951,6.1,'67TPwx6c2_M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14377,_binary '\0','/dKINnrOlsKRnCpoR0mfw1tDLMKm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0137226',7.8,2373,'hu','Szaffi','Szaffi is a full-length animated feature based on Mór Jókai’s short books The Gypsy Baron (A cigánybáró) and Szaffi. It has adventure, and treasure, and love, and a little black cat, and a war, and picturesque villains - a governor with a pressure release valve in his skull and a fat pig-loving baron, and of course, the good gypsies.','/fzNpexbkf5tw5bw9LcSndwekyqg.jpg','1985-04-11',76,'Released',NULL,'The Treasure of Swamp Castle',40993,1.0833,7.7,'3rPNnBNzfIk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14378,_binary '\0','/9mmTUthdFrFfVnE8D9YLY2tvceE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0137338',6,17307,'en','200 Cigarettes','In 1981 New York City, a collection of twentysomethings try to cope with relationships, loneliness, desire and their individual neuroses on New Years Eve.','/ssbx2Mk5ZCJWpXALuP2AdG0GFIT.jpg','1999-02-26',101,'Released','It\'s 11:59 on New Years Eve... do you know where your date is?','200 Cigarettes',15256,4.5222,5.803,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14379,_binary '\0','/fejBH0x6Tn5UE7phdOMz2drp3jB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0137363',7.2,100375,'en','Arlington Road','Bedraggled college professor Michael Faraday has been vexed — and increasingly paranoid — since his wife\'s accidental death in a botched FBI operation. When a seemingly all-American couple set up house next door, Michael begins to suspect there’s more to them than meets the eye.','/4yYHyZuyTTQaEZuHKS7561jXjtR.jpg','1999-03-19',117,'Released','Fear Thy Neighbor.','Arlington Road',1073,7.4808,7.039,'tzzT_Iaw0t8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14380,_binary '\0','/6gedxusAaVYNARRneJfpGGhQlT6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0137386',6.6,4055,'en','Billy\'s Hollywood Screen Kiss','Billy Collier is a photographer working on a series of pictures featuring recreations of movie kisses, with drag queens playing the female roles. For his male model, he hires Gabriel, a young waiter on whom he has developed a serious crush. While Billy is openly gay, Gabriel says that he is straight and even claims to have a girlfriend. However, as they spend more time together and grow closer, Billy becomes increasingly unsure that this is true.','/dUj3KciCFdOPnyavPzhYbbpIHv5.jpg','1998-07-24',92,'Released','Lights!... Camera!... Attraction!','Billy\'s Hollywood Screen Kiss',17539,1.5456,5.9,'3Btaw8DnuLw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14381,_binary '\0','/qbiREyYmjFDqcAjT2MjGhpvdxZD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0137401',6.2,1637,'fr','Les Boys II','Our Boys are back a year after their last adventures. This time around, the players of Quebec\'s most popular garage league travel to Chamonix, France, to take part in an international amateur hockey tournament.','/9VsVwcKv0XQEgSTxHqHToJBUVe9.jpg','1998-12-11',120,'Released',NULL,'The Boys II',42841,1.0399,6.5,'Ieroah-1qVw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14382,_binary '\0','/jrbW0IOu7x24qFBSsAakgWOd9c9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0137439',7.4,7058,'fr','Conte d\'automne','Magali, forty-something, is a winemaker and a widow: she loves her work but feels lonely. Her friends Rosine and Isabelle both want secretly to find a husband for Magali.','/1DQYFB5DENLWKUYdz5ttaVbDYnk.jpg','1998-09-07',112,'Released',NULL,'An Autumn Tale',10239,2.2768,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14383,_binary '\0','/rsV4f4dzHyJIZ3WGNykh7K2WMHZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0137494',6.3,130697,'en','Entrapment','Two thieves, who travel in elegant circles, try to outsmart each other and, in the process, end up falling in love.','/psrm7DToacaxQvgViBAcrYiLKzH.jpg','1999-04-29',112,'Released','The trap is set.','Entrapment',1844,10.1255,6.2,'LFSpRNtxd8I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14384,_binary '\0','/c6OLXfKAk5BKeR6broC8pYiCquX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0137523',8.8,2661016,'en','Fight Club','A ticking-time-bomb insomniac and a slippery soap salesman channel primal male aggression into a shocking new form of therapy. Their concept catches on, with underground \"fight clubs\" forming in every town, until an eccentric gets in the way and ignites an out-of-control spiral toward oblivion.','/jSziioSwPVrOy9Yow3XhWIBDjq1.jpg','1999-10-15',139,'Released','Mischief. Mayhem. Soap.','Fight Club',550,46.8587,8.437,'BdJKm16Co6M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14385,_binary '\0','/6gbL6HZJybbSdGgcBIG5pciu258.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0137799',5.7,2944,'en','Ground Control','An air-traffic controller quits after a plane crash but, years later, goes to help an airport that is in the path of a terrible storm.','/kub1fmuz61ZjXzS0Wui7beNP3pU.jpg','1998-08-26',98,'Released','No radar. No contact. No control.','Ground Control',54940,2.0972,5.6,'v4-2Xt1KRyA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14386,_binary '\0','/A14ICjXcZO7gwjDg4iGFISEDzlM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0138068',7.1,1372,'en','Ruby Bridges','When six-year-old Ruby Bridges is chosen to be the first African-American to integrate her local elementary school, she is subjected to the true ugliness of racism for the first time.','/kMZzzR05SvMLLxzYN0kzKNUW30h.jpg','1998-01-18',96,'Released','She went to school... and taught the nation a lesson.','Ruby Bridges',96715,1.6039,6.8,'akYXhyN0cLY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14387,_binary '\0','/nDdtx8siYsOHEfCPx8rRVDY3MIM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0138074',1.4,1804,'en','Santa and the Ice Cream Bunny','Santa Claus finds his sleigh stuck in the sand on a Florida beach only days before Christmas Eve.','/nyxCEzLSnMfA3zgaeCZPbf10Wmh.jpg','1972-11-18',70,'Released','The amazing story of Santa in big trouble... And his exciting rescue by the daring ice cream bunny ... It\'s breath-taking, fun for all.','Santa and the Ice Cream Bunny',79720,1.3926,2.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14388,_binary '\0','/hLnWSg8zodS2R0TPudzJ1wgZang.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0138078',4.8,1301,'en','Scary Movie','On Halloween night, big-time nerd Warren attends a spookhouse in a small Texas town. But is the haunted house as harmless as it seems, or has a psychotic mental patient found a new stomping ground?','/per9VRL7WmEOgutgykgo2yWqV4A.jpg','1991-10-18',82,'Released','Fear is a state of mind','Scary Movie',4242,1.8162,5.2,'mzMYKUOfLqk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14389,_binary '\0','/i16MjvM9YsQ85ejdB63gtGXDu4W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0138097',7.1,244365,'en','Shakespeare in Love','Young William Shakespeare is forced to stage his latest comedy, \'Romeo and Ethel, the Pirate\'s Daughter\', before it\'s even written. When lovely noblewoman Viola de Lesseps auditions for a role, they fall into forbidden love — and Shakespeare\'s play finds a new life (and title). As their relationship intensifies, the comedy soon transforms into tragedy.','/zdW7jdzPi4J9KZR3TyY2jn3Xh5e.jpg','1998-12-11',124,'Released','Love is the only inspiration.','Shakespeare in Love',1934,8.2432,6.823,'_CxNF4eA6yw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14390,_binary '\0','/6WLXXpntALn42Is3hwxKeUzUujQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0138304',5.4,59371,'en','The Astronaut\'s Wife','When astronaut Spencer Armacost returns to Earth after a mission that nearly cost him his life, he decides to take a desk job in order to see his beautiful wife, Jillian, more often. Gradually, Jillian notices that Spencer\'s personality seems to have changed, but her concerns fade when she discovers that she\'s pregnant. As Jillian grows closer to becoming a mother, her suspicions about Spencer return. Why does it seem as if he\'s a different person?','/54RGJ6INW9ERG8IaalmMKbbDgwH.jpg','1999-08-27',109,'Released','How well do you know the one you love?','The Astronaut\'s Wife',2900,6.0284,5.6,'pu_TmXgGEG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14391,_binary '\0','/uFjlM9ePr9Hgb9kAml7pEjlSnWJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0138393',7.2,2013,'en','The Decline of Western Civilization Part III','A musical study of Los Angeles in the late 90s, where homeless teens roam the streets and profess to live a punk lifestyle of music, drugs, and flouting authority.','/4ZFYFv4YOFZGzbAHUVJFBFI2AUa.jpg','1998-11-13',86,'Released',NULL,'The Decline of Western Civilization Part III',44848,2.2098,6.91,'LNtQ0OWKHCs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14392,_binary '\0','/vZUrJTE4ufo0AGr5CFKPxpgNPKD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0138414',6.8,7421,'en','Edge of Seventeen','1984, Sandusky, Ohio. A naive 17-year-old navigates heartbreak and self-expression as he explores his sexuality.','/qsyG50KDdfxPZxVSLrNmlwWBgWm.jpg','1999-06-11',104,'Released',NULL,'Edge of Seventeen',4927,2.8661,6.5,'P2SSmdVvOg4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14393,_binary '\0','/tNxB5fYyDx4jEZWx6sW9ZcoyoL8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0138444',5.6,2906,'en','Fifteen and Pregnant','Based on a true story, 15 year old Tina Spangler discovers she is pregnant. Her choices are abortion, adoption, or a lonely, exhausting life as a single parent. Abandoned by her boyfriend, she turns to her mother. Tina discovers although it has torn her world apart, her pregnancy could re-unite her shattered family and help her find her true purpose in life.','/ehA1FTLR87THjN6QwdI7M4uhe9I.jpg','1998-01-19',96,'Released','Tina Spangler is about to discover just how little she knows about life...','Fifteen and Pregnant',60662,2.0085,6.3,'_aD5lWydh_0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14394,_binary '\0','/uritiGXsqQe4Dcfs0HbHDU7alk5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0138467',5.7,3290,'en','Girl','A sheltered, straight-A high school senior, Andrea Marr, becomes infatuated with a local rock singer, Todd Sparrow, and dives into the underground music scene, neglecting her friends and academic life in the process.','/mQF41OUH4gNtnUwM7YaZJDUKpzo.jpg','1998-11-05',99,'Released','She’s all that and more','Girl',58467,1.8487,5.045,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14395,_binary '\0','/bNC3u8M91LDvlgqZu83w47Xhez6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0138487',6.5,4790,'en','Head On','Nineteen-year-old Ari confronts both his sexuality and his Greek family. Ari despises his once-beloved parents, former radical activists, for having entombed themselves in insular tradition. Ari is obsessed with gay sex, although he does make an unenthusiastic attempt to satisfy the sister of one of his best friends. While all of this is going on, he\'s facing problems with his traditional Greek parents, who have no clue about his sexual activities.','/7kOpfb9oCiDP7LUWbthZhzjnh1J.jpg','1998-08-13',104,'Released','Full on. All night. Come on.','Head On',13817,1.7596,6.2,'0GoEW-1L8q0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14396,_binary '\0','/aPdLqBzNo5rBfnZxy15VTc65lO2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0138510',6.3,50798,'en','Idle Hands','Anton is a cheerful but exceedingly non-ambitious 17-year-old stoner who lives to stay buzzed, watch TV, and moon over Molly, the beautiful girl who lives next door. However, it turns out that the old cliché about idle hands being the devil\'s playground has a kernel of truth after all.','/mCO4gU1lkViGXTkoRBEYrvjDIJu.jpg','1999-04-30',92,'Released','The touching story of a boy and his right hand.','Idle Hands',6552,7.7612,6.2,'HcVrp--9UUc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14397,_binary '\0','/x1BTLDDijvms3Yi9NZoxxniTDGA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0138524',6.3,106480,'en','Intolerable Cruelty','A revenge-seeking gold digger marries a womanizing Beverly Hills lawyer with the intention of making a killing in the divorce.','/7K8hDwOWsZv0MluyrB8nWlhJOgB.jpg','2003-10-10',100,'Released','Engage the enemy.','Intolerable Cruelty',11775,6.3375,5.962,'aeuAiVTB3fc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14398,_binary '\0','/dBVthigPLMXnk7HBb2UhDt8skLh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0138537',7,1288,'en','Man of the Century','The sidewalks of New York will never be the same, thanks to Johnny Twennies, an ace reporter who bangs out his column on an old manual typewriter and is blissfully aware that he sticks out like a sore thubm. His girlfriend is fed up because he hasn\'t even kissed her and the local mob wants to bump him off because he\'s hot on their trail. Can Johnny blow the lid off an important crime scoop, get the girl, and keep from getting himself killed?','/hBQNTz2MJLuK4u6pgzjxpXMqI5e.jpg','1999-10-29',77,'Released','Meet yesterday\'s answer to the world of today.','Man of the Century',98480,2.0282,6,'E3CAxPBFX6c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14399,_binary '\0','/uGhqlElLECQgYbJPDdqpJF6agks.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0138541',6.1,4432,'en','Judas Kiss','The shooting of a U.S. senator\'s wife raises the stakes for kidnappers seeking a hefty ransom for a computer magnate.','/aBwSiD2kjlarWe7zXYFvfGdlUon.jpg','1998-09-16',97,'Released','Four million dollars the hard way in the Big Easy.','Judas Kiss',37516,2.9931,5.7,'sTVcCunyoUg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14400,_binary '\0','/1RDAbIOaQ2MskpTS2PRnoAVbmxv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0138545',6.8,3037,'is','The Juniper Tree','Margit and her older sister Katla flee for safety after their mother is burned to death for witchcraft. Finding shelter with Johan and his resentful young son, Jonas, the sisters help form an impromptu family unit that’s soon strained by Katla’s burgeoning sorcery.','/xcKxbhJ41JZM3QqauFG6YgL9gpz.jpg','1990-04-10',79,'Released','A dark tale of witchcraft and mysticism','The Juniper Tree',29460,1.9503,6.9,'POwG00JWrRo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14401,_binary '\0','/eAyVDKMf8Gg2DWLqpzrVxgrrQ0s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0138563',6.1,7494,'en','Kurt & Courtney','After rocker Kurt Cobain\'s death, ruled a suicide, a film crew arrives in Seattle to make a documentary. Director Nick Broomfield talks to lots of people. Portraits emerge: a shy, slight Kurt, weary of touring, embarrassed by fame, hooked on heroin; an out-going Courtney, dramatic, controlling, moving from groupie to star.','/m60KpD60vXOXjJXRjb4veX88Y8q.jpg','1998-02-27',95,'Released',NULL,'Kurt & Courtney',13907,1.1809,6,'gL_qQunAwNM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14402,_binary '\0','/ncau6uhCOYM65XaVoIP7bj56ITm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0138587',6.1,1412,'cn','行運一條龍','Lucky Coffee Shop is well-known for its egg tarts and tea. Waiter Sui, named as Prince Egg Tart, attracts lots of girls but only loves Candy. He and his friends, Nam, and Fok, all have love problems. At the same time, the coffee shop may collapse since the landlord is increasing the rent tremendously. Let\'s see how the lucky guys of the shop can revert this situation.','/e4KkehV6oTZWgClsHeeTwTEl0V7.jpg','1998-01-16',99,'Released',NULL,'The Lucky Guy',132183,2.7971,6.6,'iDm89uvNhtA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14403,_binary '\0','/nZJxMHITTGjB3LX1d7Do8PYPmLW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0138590',6.1,2944,'en','The Man with Rain in His Shoes','Victor Bukowski is an out-of-work actor with problems. He\'s got a lousy agent, he has a habit of falling out with directors and he\'s still in love with his ex-girlfriend. However, Victor is about to embark on an unexpected emotional journey which will make him confront his future and his past mistakes.','/fVuJserJVW7bWJ0Ni95nowncIWA.jpg','1998-11-27',91,'Released','For anyone who needs a second chance at once upon a time.','The Man with Rain in His Shoes',55912,2.686,4.988,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14404,_binary '\0','/13dZPwTQAXpQHmxG1ETIZ9vf4xM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0138681',5.7,1394,'en','The Opportunists','Vic is a struggling auto mechanic with a safe-cracking past and a lot of debt. His girlfriend runs a bar and offers to loan him the money she\'s saved for remodeling, but Vic is reluctant to take it. When a long-lost cousin from Ireland shows up on his doorstep, the two team up for one last heist.','/o3ahlEqcwxxlVWPnEHTIzYMdwhQ.jpg','2000-05-17',90,'Released','When crime is all you know, you\'ve got to take what you can.','The Opportunists',45905,1.7577,5.7,'DpP4_1jWw34','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14405,_binary '\0','/fPXLDESssAsBrjza3ofSB52ve1D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0138703',5.5,9264,'en','Phantasm IV: Oblivion','Taking off immediately where the last one ended, Mike travels across dimensions and time, fleeing from the Tall Man while trying to find the origins of his enemy and what really happened the night that his brother died. Meanwhile, Reggie battles spheres and the undead in a quest to find Mike before the Tall Man can complete his transformation.','/412lNlGrB8eHBOKlNhOgxI9bCtL.jpg','1998-07-31',90,'Released','You Can\'t Go Forward Until You\'ve Gone Back.','Phantasm IV: Oblivion',16146,2.6106,5.2,'9lg7nrOz1es','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14406,_binary '\0','/pVmCanXNPYqE74cJoL0U6C9ONf5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0138704',7.3,193776,'en','Pi','A mathematical genius discovers a link between numbers and reality, and thus believes he can predict the future.','/fJA22FjlAW8rzrOw9Mwanl6oTc9.jpg','1998-07-10',84,'Released','Faith in chaos.','Pi',473,6.34,7.1,'yRjkQT9xLZs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14407,_binary '\0','/ciM5RFsBoWEj0tbwJy42Hr76iRd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0138749',6.9,120828,'en','The Road to El Dorado','Stowing away after a failed con, a pair of swindlers end up on El Dorado, the fabled \"city of gold\", where they quickly get in over their heads when they are mistaken as gods by the inhabitants.','/tQuqhUBACMcGqCvliHxpJreBfXC.jpg','2000-03-31',90,'Released','They came for the gold. They stayed for the adventure.','The Road to El Dorado',10501,13.2435,7.3,'JcOfJwN0bdY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14408,_binary '\0','/hbvg9M2S3ufj6uWsCPQdmqinPPf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0138874',7.2,3471,'vi','Ba Mùa','The residents of Ho Chi Minh City face modernization amid widespread poverty. A retired American Marine arrives on a search for his daughter, whom he abandoned at the end of the Vietnam War. Elsewhere, a cyclo driver falls for a troubled prostitute and schemes to raise money so he can spend time with her. Additionally, a young women begins harvesting lotuses for a writer suffering from leprosy, and a child trinket seller loses his traveling case.','/9BRzgNVCrb40TsEUKZt2ODXgWMQ.jpg','1999-04-30',105,'Released','A haunting tale of changes, choices and second chances.','Three Seasons',4154,1.9653,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14409,_binary '\0','/y8cbKwg2VYtG7IdZUu8TE0AajsO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0138946',6.4,25152,'en','The Yards','In the rail yards of Queens, contractors repair and rebuild the city\'s subway cars. These contracts are lucrative, so graft and corruption are rife. When Leo Handler gets out of prison, he finds his aunt married to Frank Olchin, one of the big contractors; he\'s battling with a minority-owned firm for contracts.','/AtwXtU8CDWvVADgOwRkOSRZFPWI.jpg','2000-04-27',115,'Released','He\'s the target of the most merciless family in New York. His own.','The Yards',19457,6.2334,6.3,'0Q-Kecw6iV4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14410,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0138987',5.6,1780,'en','20 Dates','Myles is divorced in L.A. He wants a love life and a film career. So he decides to go on 20 dates and find true love in front of a camera, making his first feature. His patient agent, Richard, finds a $60,000 investor, the shadowy Elie. Myles starts his search, sometimes telling his date she\'s being filmed, sometimes not. Elie wants sex and titillation, Myles wants it \"real.\" Myles regularly talks with his old film teacher, Robert McKee, who wonders if love is possible in modern life. Half-way through the 20 dates, Myles meets Elisabeth; she\'s everything he desires and she likes him. Can he finish the 20 dates, satisfy Elie, and complete his film without losing Elisabeth?','/79TTGQZrOAzwuWxcOy8y6k6Ldm0.jpg','1998-01-01',87,'Released','A comedy so real you\'ll think it\'s fiction.','20 Dates',111794,1.4945,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14411,_binary '\0','/8b2V7MC5RPVnJfaE1eQgZA7M7Ps.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0139076',5.3,1604,'en','Bone Daddy','Doctor Palmer, a former pathologist, wrote a fictional book based on his real cases. In the book, the madman gets caught, but in reality he is still uncaught. After the book is released, Palmer\'s editor is kidnapped. Palmer soon is sent a present containing a page of his book, and a bone from his editor. Together with the police, Palmer tries to find his editor, who might still be alive. In addition, his own son becomes one of the main suspects. Written by Julian Reischl','/pAtj1hZsbDvhkCrpR2KT1LUfMuF.jpg','1998-07-19',90,'Released','Dying is the easy way out.','Bone Daddy',60504,1.7637,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14412,_binary '\0','/m2QvGozzKz5ux74gKocn4kFTGz1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0139134',6.8,222610,'en','Cruel Intentions','Slaking a thirst for dangerous games, Kathryn challenges her stepbrother, Sebastian, to deflower their headmaster\'s daughter before the summer ends. If he succeeds, the prize is the chance to bed Kathryn. But if he loses, Kathryn will claim his most prized possession.','/76cCsRtQ5MJBAqoigojXsLXLJwh.jpg','1999-03-05',97,'Released','In the game of seduction, there is only one rule: Never fall in love.','Cruel Intentions',796,11.7433,6.8,'UzlKsS-IhEo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14413,_binary '\0','/vRx6kzCItpqwnYCcj2z8qf70gv3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0139151',5.2,11764,'en','Inferno','Eddie Lomax is a drifter who has been in a suicidal funk since the death of his close friend Johnny. Riding his motorcycle into a small desert town where Johnny once lived, Lomax is confronted by a gang of toughs, who beat him and steal his bike. However, Lomax is not a man to take an injustice lying down, and soon he begins exacting a violent revenge on the men who stole his motorcycle, with local handyman Jubal Early lending a hand and several area ladies offering aid and comfort.','/n5C3PSYfjpUqBhyVWEWJQmM3Sr9.jpg','1999-09-25',95,'Released','Left for dead. Burning for revenge','Inferno',10908,5.0225,6.209,'mIeJ3ogJAlQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14414,_binary '\0','/6kY0imilYIH7yuxFEQJA7mTlq1H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0139239',7.2,80775,'en','Go','A supermarket clerk decides to step in for an absent drug dealer, setting off an explosive, comedic chain of events.','/7UzD5Dmu3jqb2ls4Lnb4SYQqbYm.jpg','1999-04-09',102,'Released','Life begins at 3am.','Go',9430,6.6035,6.97,'vt9tm1tdv9A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14415,_binary '\0','/z6Cxs29a2vX2Oq79sLCZ5BOZMJ7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0139362',6.6,11823,'en','High Art','When Syd, a young editor at an influential art magazine, becomes involved with her neighbor, a drug-addicted lesbian photographer, both seek to exploit each other for their respective careers while slowly falling in love with each other.','/lMXSGQIKTaM4bDkshmEHXHtfa7l.jpg','1998-06-12',101,'Released','a story of ambition, sacrifice, seduction and other career moves.','High Art',37636,5.6745,6.2,'GOpsWJN_SHM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14416,_binary '\0','/bqqhrL3UOuQ6bh8qQ5gMtbMvkBV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0139388',5.7,3051,'en','It Had to Be You','Sparks fly when Anna Penn and Charlie Hudson meet. Unfortunately, they\'re both engaged to other people. In fact, they\'re staying at the same New York City hotel in order to work on wrapping up the last details of their nuptials. Over days and evenings of joint wedding planning, the two grow closer -- and start to wonder if they\'re getting married to the right people after all.','/3V96hEwWBywA0RNY6nvsl2tWcry.jpg','2000-02-11',97,'Released','Love is what happens when you\'re busy making other plans.','It Had to Be You',44388,3.7148,6.1,'HbrEW6V5R98','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14417,_binary '\0','/pbASW9fGXms2u3Y6LyYUQPqaSlU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0139414',5.8,70260,'en','Lake Placid','When a man is eaten alive by an unknown creature, the local Game Warden teams up with a paleontologist from New York to find the beast. Add to the mix an eccentric philanthropist with a penchant for \"Crocs\", and here we go! This quiet, remote lake is suddenly the focus of an intense search for a crocodile with a taste for live animals...and people!','/pEszakCP8j9E9S0UPLfEa3Cad3O.jpg','1999-07-15',82,'Released','You\'ll never know what bit you.','Lake Placid',9825,7.0872,6,'xNP_FyUjysk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14418,_binary '\0','/r8Ph1fnZyZOCCffVPiIoa6nIJPB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0139426',4.8,1461,'en','Lighthouse','A prison ship on its way to a remote island prison runs aground on rocks and sinks. Mixed survivors of cons and prison guards struggle ashore, only to discover to their horror that another survivor got there first - the murderous & psychotic Leo Rook. Stranded, with no means of escape or call for help, the survivors must face a night of terror as they struggle to survive.','/66vc6Jicxi6S1eONK0VV6NOMHoU.jpg','2000-02-04',95,'Released','The brightest light. Your darkest fears.','Lighthouse',27336,1.2173,4.5,'AMzCs8_hKEE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14419,_binary '\0','/bHTAGzPTQ0aBm7gmfkSnqaHiajM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0139462',6.3,42776,'en','Message in a Bottle','A woman finds a romantic letter in a bottle washed ashore and tracks down the author, a widowed shipbuilder whose wife died tragically early. As a deep and mutual attraction blossoms, the man struggles to make peace with his past so that he can move on and find happiness.','/ulUjszY6YJFsDUd0E3WolJg6sOp.jpg','1999-02-22',131,'Released','A story of love lost and found.','Message in a Bottle',10207,6.7804,6.252,'Wpb616fwYMk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14420,_binary '\0','/gHYSkkgfO7DlkjzOgpytkrL1Jg9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0139465',3.9,2345,'en','The Minion','New York, Christmas Eve, 1999 - at the dawn of the new millennium - a subway construction crew unearths an eight hundred year old Celtic skeleton and a mysterious key. Archeologist Karen Goodleaf is called in to determine the meaning of the discovery. News of the discovery reaches a Middle East monastery where the warrior monks knowns as the Knights Templar - an ancient sect entrusted with protecting holy relics - choose their best pupil, Lukas to face the diabolical threat. As Lukas races to New York, an evil Minion seizes Karen and uses her body like a parasite and host!','/h3O4P5i1T0qScKRI0qOzIksDuzR.jpg','1998-09-26',95,'Released','When the Millenium ends... Armageddon begins!','The Minion',51831,3.252,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14421,_binary '\0','/a56yntKq9u00uzin9EuNyQ1ym5A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0139500',7,1927,'pt','No Quarto da Vanda','An unflinching, fragmentary look at a handful of self-destructive, marginalized people, but taking as main focus the heroin-addicted Vanda Duarte.','/wi70RuDNiYqIyruZtXPeBOHTtj2.jpg','2001-03-02',171,'Released',NULL,'In Vanda\'s Room',87063,1.7625,6.7,'OMtsdwWSjyk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14422,_binary '\0','/dolTehtRFO6B6yVu21yU7TBShot.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0139564',6.7,2512,'fr','Regarde la mer','Sasha, a young British woman, is living with her baby daughter at Ile d\'Yeu, a peaceful beach community. A stranger appears. Her name is Tatiana, she\'s passing through, and pitches her tent in Sasha\'s yard. The two women build an odd rapport, and tension builds as events unfold.','/l8gnjkOv5GKg0fyW8hf7tA2dix4.jpg','1997-12-03',52,'Released','When stranger knocks...','See the Sea',46748,1.1406,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14423,_binary '\0','/xeN6uxr1ao3wBjvjn86mThQJ5ku.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0139615',7,2595,'en','Slam','Raymond Joshua, a young black performance poet, is arrested and imprisoned for a petty marijuana charge in a Washington, D.C. jail. Although the confining prison walls do little to shield him from danger, it is within those walls that Raymond establishes his identity, strength, and voice and meets a prison gang leader and a prison writing teacher, Lauren Bell. Bell inspires Raymond to use the power of creative expression to free himself from the struggles and demise of the Black male as another victim of the judicial system.','/qU0QR2ax1hyjfACni4Clgsc5YyX.jpg','1998-10-07',104,'Released','Words make sense of a world that won\'t.','Slam',37532,1.5284,6.9,'SzBHE1ISsUA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14424,_binary '\0','/nuO8o9ltxhI7AZQxePavEZ4TyHa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0139654',7.8,525527,'en','Training Day','On his first day on the job as a narcotics officer, a rookie cop works with a rogue detective who isn\'t what he appears.','/bUeiwBQdupBLQthMCHKV7zv56uv.jpg','2001-10-05',122,'Released','The only thing more dangerous than the line being crossed, is the cop who will cross it.','Training Day',2034,16.8799,7.531,'1-wOKy45o9o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14425,_binary '\0','/891kxjT04dJNMhbsyMOlycO5wAN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0139668',6.6,40349,'en','True Crime','Boozer, skirt chaser, careless father. You could create your own list of reporter Steve Everett\'s faults but there\'s no time. A San Quentin Death Row prisoner is slated to die at midnight – a man Everett has suddenly realized is innocent.','/ozrV1xtwU3Y5XOFuVn9T00ZYoiV.jpg','1999-03-19',127,'Released','An innocent man has only 12 hours to live...','True Crime',10354,6.4899,6.5,'0sJ7Yt5oRUs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14426,_binary '\0','/rTlMsaE2MQ8NG2cs0bEkwVhMOrV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0139699',6.6,53963,'en','Varsity Blues','In small-town Texas, high school football is a religion, 17-year-old schoolboys carry the hopes of an entire community onto the gridiron every Friday night. When star quarterback Lance Harbor suffers an injury, the Coyotes are forced to regroup under the questionable leadership of John Moxon, a second-string quarterback with a slightly irreverent approach to the game.','/g2jX2Xmx7drbc6J9MLJEBghR7Mg.jpg','1999-01-15',106,'Released','Make your own rules.','Varsity Blues',14709,4.2144,6.166,'eSnkWiacUW4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14427,_binary '\0','/nJ0jz1J3zNja31UEMeklhgFeMw5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0139809',7,83966,'en','The Thirteenth Floor','In Los Angeles, a wealthy man, known as Mr. Fuller, discovers a shocking secret about the world he lives in. Fearing for his life, he leaves a desperate message for a friend of his in the most unexpected place.','/7oaie3ZBc9UuWZLF24crro1pone.jpg','1999-04-16',100,'Released','Question reality.','The Thirteenth Floor',1090,7.1885,7.1,'UQcOLSaDd1w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14428,_binary '\0','/oQ2476SCWCxCbMS6CYqOUadfCEh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0139820',7.7,2274,'ja','赤い天使','In 1939, Sakura Nishi is a young army nurse who is sent to the field hospitals in China during the Sino-Japanese war. She has to assist the surgeon Dr. Okabe with an incredible number of amputations. In the crowded wards, she gives sympathy to some of the soldiers, including sexually servicing one who has lost both arms and has no hope of returning home. She falls in love with Dr. Okabe, and follows him to the front, even though he is impotent from his morphine addiction.','/qWngp0H82FoT92iyGdEV7VzBzgO.jpg','1966-10-01',95,'Released',NULL,'Red Angel',90560,1.9195,7.6,'r0JUfcbBBGA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14429,_binary '\0','/r6IqWqTZiGzOyaa8ebXVf08qEn0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0139859',7.7,2833,'ta','அண்ணாமலை','A class-divided friendship goes through highs and lows through several decades.','/e96hSrmolvJ2SiaxlDNs3Ye2WEo.jpg','1992-06-27',180,'Released','The rise of the new King','Annamalai',48757,1.1569,7.333,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14430,_binary '\0','/z2WjRzdsP5pChOjFADIXXfd5XpZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0139861',7.5,3009,'ta','அருணாச்சலம்','Arunachalam, the son of a prominent village elder, discovers the truth about his past.','/vplqDhbUk5GMPUosMuQy91NePxv.jpg','1997-04-10',165,'Released',NULL,'Arunachalam',66245,1.5805,7.25,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14431,_binary '\0','/tpQqaLigNHWrEgEBcarRL4M6sOg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0139872',7.9,3349,'ta','அவ்வை சண்முகி','A divorced husband desperately misses his daughter. In order to be with her, he takes up a job in his father-in-law\'s house. The only catch is that the job is that of a female governess.','/bBSyJ3UM6pvqswgn6LwkxtIb2PI.jpg','1996-11-10',161,'Released',NULL,'Avvai Shanmugi',69575,1.4165,7.031,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14432,_binary '\0','/hh2bBmgqzJEY1J7enMKqTsziVRO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0139876',8.3,13777,'ta','பாட்ஷா','Auto rickshaw driver Manickam avoids violence at all costs. When some thugs begin to intimidate Manickam\'s family, it triggers the revival of Manickam\'s old self.','/xPSw9PLzYFKTVphw9ErZcBPKUsd.jpg','1995-01-12',145,'Released',NULL,'Baasha',49074,1.4319,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14433,_binary '\0','/dIi3u1qnCMvRJRxLAa230UXgOfX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0139898',6.9,1935,'en','The Boys','Brett, out of prison on parole, returns to his family home to catch up with his mother and brothers. The day takes a bad turn when the brothers start drinking and doing drugs, embarking on a night that they will have difficulty living down.','/jLyfVrwm5028RPhx5oXmJv01uSr.jpg','1998-05-07',86,'Released','Little we know or imagine can prepare us for the fierce and punishing impact of The Boys.','The Boys',13821,1.2176,6.7,'ZfWAr3Jg_UY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14434,_binary '\0','/xsH1NrcG0lDLaHuPFGib6LAoFzU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0140090',8.2,3555,'ta','குணா','Gunaa, a mentally-disturbed man, imagines a fictitious character of a woman to be his future wife. One day, he sees a girl in a temple and assumes that she is his imaginary love and kidnaps her.','/ifSabca6z8WY2MnGJ7S4vec6cWt.jpg','1991-11-05',167,'Released',NULL,'Gunaa',66359,1.5271,7.182,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14435,_binary '\0','/mO6sfsasjsAQblTaGFGUaPRfiih.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0140282',5.5,1303,'en','In God\'s Hands','Three pro surfers - gifted Shane, once-great Mickey and rising young star Keoni travel to Madagascar, Bali and Hawaii in search for the ultimate wave.','/5ifY8XwrWv4gAgFiJyMcqdYNJ0m.jpg','1998-04-24',96,'Released','To surf 40-foot waves is to put yourself...','In God\'s Hands',36943,1.7355,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14436,_binary '\0','/moCVgDhJdE57JBlOep4IWVO0KLK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0140340',7.2,2740,'en','The Love Letter','20th century computer games designer Scott, Civil War buff, buys an antique desk from that era and, while polishing it, he discovers a secret compartment in which sits an unmailed letter--a letter written by a young poet named Lizzie over a century earlier. Touched by her yearning for passion, he writes her back, egged on by his mystically inclined mother. Magically, his letter reaches Lizzie and they begin a correspondence that threatens Scott\'s impending marriage but promises to bring fulfilment to Lizzie. Spanning the Civil War to the present, the perils of Lizzie\'s war-torn situation threaten her safe passage into the future. Will their love endure the test of time?','/q7DKV2pIP6u5WvXIdUl2VA5hz3l.jpg','1998-02-01',98,'Released','A letter from the past would change their future forever.','The Love Letter',57943,2.7111,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14437,_binary '\0','/5DG7DNebo8lTSGa8BBTNy8Q3j2J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0140348',8.6,5194,'ta','மகாநதி','Krishnaswamy, an honest man, is conned into a chit fund business and imprisoned. While he faces unspeakable hardships in prison, his family disintegrates.','/2tfkpsl73EpKlBQygbKiYqtfpg5.jpg','1994-01-14',162,'Released','The Great River','Mahanadhi',66353,1.3046,7.462,'4vYGSSDVn0U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14438,_binary '\0','/2GIr0LArTvO33HQVPEdp49FLdNV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0140352',7.8,193351,'en','The Insider','A research chemist comes under personal and professional attack when he decides to appear in a 60 Minutes exposé on Big Tobacco.','/3BYhikNhkWALAbpAdoL0rcBrl5A.jpg','1999-10-28',158,'Released','Two men driven to tell the truth … whatever the cost.','The Insider',9008,8.9726,7.467,'MGOb29aePyc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14439,_binary '\0','/9BWHLtZmHP5IyaR3JkLCLdxI8mV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0140377',8.5,8036,'ta','மைகேல் மதன காம ராஜன்','A wicked man separates a set of quadruplets after their birth and one of them ends up with their biological father, while the other three find new homes. Things take a turn after they meet each other.','/3TzfpFmdTuwRczVmJzB3P9xsHGD.jpg','1990-03-01',167,'Released',NULL,'Michael Madana Kama Rajan',14445,1.7738,7.243,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14440,_binary '\0','/y8F8UE7U0rELJKmWzeucpevxVBN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0140379',6.4,28644,'en','A Midsummer Night\'s Dream','Mistaken identity, unrequited love, and the supernatural are combined in Shakespeare\'s classic set in the woods of Greece on a moonlit night.','/5KTYh2gXmsHUzsRsrstBGy0QfXf.jpg','1999-05-20',116,'Released','Love makes fools of us all.','A Midsummer Night\'s Dream',10210,5.3765,6.4,'0ygOgq_XmmU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14441,_binary '\0','/eL7DQB1gZZwefgcOfMHPyYAPwUO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0140384',7,4493,'ja','盲獣','A blind sculptor kidnaps an artists\' model and imprisons her in his warehouse studio – a shadowland of perverse monuments to the female form. Here a deranged passion play of sensual and sexual obsession is acted out in world where sight is replaced by touch.','/klTJKS9iWeEi7XMP6tYvDNIU2yA.jpg','1969-01-25',84,'Released',NULL,'Blind Beast',27425,1.86,6.5,'QD3q-0Pli9c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14442,_binary '\0','/twcTqKRiAlK6g8CVKHQGOnmxkti.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0140397',6.8,9831,'en','Mumford','When a would-be psychologist, curiously named Dr. Mumford, comes to the idyllic town of the same name and offers his talent for listening and a disarming frankness, the town\'s quirkiest citizens scramble for a seat on his couch. As he lightens hearts darkened by old secrets no one realizes he\'s hiding a whopper of his own, or that he\'s fallen head over heels for one of his patients!','/a2uqenG3BZICDrcrr49IZwoHA8Y.jpg','1999-09-24',112,'Released','Some towns have all the fun.','Mumford',24071,1.9795,6.557,'aSRaO1sRnLU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14443,_binary '\0','/z7GDWAyLbPVJnY9a4wxsqAfYQR9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0140399',7.5,4134,'ta','முத்து','The story concerns Muthu, a charismatic, well-respected and loyal servant and charioteer of Raja Malayasimman, a wealthy zamindar. While Muthu and Raja\'s exploits lead them to fall in love with the same woman, an actress and dancer named Ranganayaki, Raja\'s materal uncle Ambalathar is keen on assuming control of the family\'s property.','/fespJv8tkg9sWnG0DlB2zjnOpFQ.jpg','1995-10-23',165,'Released',NULL,'Muthu',66247,1.9884,6.85,'-EUPpNsu1UE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14444,_binary '\0','/fp3JFLf2vb9yQ8EytusLTVF1zzB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0140428',6.9,1497,'it','L\'odore della notte','A former policeman turns full-time robber and goes on a downward spiral of crime in 1970s Rome.','/k5k0KPAYO7C1J8apX74ezWc7Ztb.jpg','1998-09-11',100,'Released',NULL,'The Scent of the Night',63276,1.6561,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14445,_binary '\0','/5rjFYrnjBb0p8355ErsxucaJKc1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0140447',5.9,1706,'en','The Passion of Ayn Rand','Author Ayn Rand becomes involved with a much younger and married man, to the dismay of those close to her.','/bSudsCHq4z5jVl08nEq1OhMAzeC.jpg','1999-01-27',104,'Released',NULL,'The Passion of Ayn Rand',49622,2.1484,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14446,_binary '\0','/eGvjorY2D0TEi2U7v6uSEFWPYdI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0140448',8,1425,'ta','பதினாறு வயதினிலே','Sixteen-year-old Mayil is secretly loved by her handicapped cousin, Chappani, and the village rowdy, Parattai. But, she falls for a city doctor who takes advantage of her and deserts her. Gradually she realises how much Chappani loves her meanwhile, Parattai also eyeing for Mayil.','/kwDvZcHkVwGEcPWwdHGWSUiwL4k.jpg','1977-09-15',139,'Released',NULL,'16 Vayathinile',66332,1.0042,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14447,_binary '\0','/1UGkeYQsW2kml28YURNGdkNCosq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0140534',8.1,1787,'ta','சதி லீலாவதி','Arun, a married man, has an affair with Priya as he dislikes his wife Leelavathi, who is plain-looking and overweight. When she discovers Arun\'s affair, she plots with Dr. Sakthivel to win Arun back.','/gJjxDw7uogiHuDtvkxk3GKD9UGu.jpg','1995-01-15',144,'Released',NULL,'Sathi Leelavathi',66352,1.3846,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14448,_binary '\0','/euVs3ocBAMRxZ5XZRP0ioUk6uIq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0140581',4.7,1796,'en','The Suckling','A woman goes to a back alley abortion clinic, only to have her aborted fetus attack her, her boyfriend, and everyone else at the clinic.','/qAkU68rqKWZT5v6sFCxx85SrLr0.jpg','1990-09-24',89,'Released','He\'ll always be mommy\'s little mutant.','The Suckling',83292,1.4032,4.7,'VPqfakhy5_c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14449,_binary '\0','/s3cuXtBxw7os9iE0uXoazJWf9Lh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0140594',5.2,1326,'en','The Taking of Pelham One Two Three','In New York, armed men hijack a subway car and demand a ransom for the passengers. Even if it\'s paid, how could they get away?','/akBizBjWNtflwja701E8eZqqFdi.jpg','1998-02-01',100,'Released',NULL,'The Taking of Pelham One Two Three',314370,1.8688,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14450,_binary '\0','/vVkP3mswepKStmOxxSbQpox0yhY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0140603',6.9,1480,'it','La cena','An evening at an Italian restaurant hosted by tolerant and relaxed Flora, various middle-class parties enter – large and small, young and old, regulars and tourists, married and single – to dine, converse, argue, celebrate, make confessions; to eavesdrop, to interrupt, to sing, listen to music, and enjoy life.','/4L5sGM2bJUvKrtkpfTKUTjGQGnF.jpg','1998-09-03',126,'Released',NULL,'The Dinner',65485,1.4898,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14451,_binary '\0','/2uxPfvSXD4ditHJUbhdwIeXTlIt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0140653',6.1,1364,'it','L\'ultimo capodanno','New year\'s eve at \"The Islands\" condos. An aging countess\'s party is crashed by the soccer team from her gigolo\'s town. While dressing for a dinner party, the wealthy Guilia discovers her husband\'s affair with her best friend and vows revenge. Next door, a family prepares their vintage Dodge for a drive through the streets. A call girl ties up a lawyer while, unbeknownst to him, three men await the right moment to break into his office. Across the hall, a woman downs pills in a lonely suicide attempt. Two young men hide out in a bedroom smoking dope; one of them has some dynamite. As midnight approaches, each group draws closer to grotesque tragedy.','/tjo0JnzSSpMJUtHbPnTe303rmSm.jpg','1998-03-06',98,'Released',NULL,'The Last New Year\'s Eve',52676,2.6504,5.8,'DhudrX61Zuo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14452,_binary '\0','/m2TPv8knmkinjLhU1Bl62C4zUQR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0140796',4.6,6706,'en','Air Bud: Golden Receiver','Josh and Buddy move from basketball to football in this first of several sequels to the original Air Bud.','/y3ohh9NyWx2oj2op1dfrkwJMeFE.jpg','1998-08-14',90,'Released','The Timberwolves are about to unleash their secret weapon.','Air Bud: Golden Receiver',21661,2.8737,5.1,'rsl8lFegX1g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14453,_binary '\0','/m6MQ8lGEbU4NScc7NRSnABAmPB0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0140825',7.5,4273,'ko','8월의 크리스마스','It\'s a sweltering summer, but Jung-won, a terminally ill, thirty-something photographer, is already in the winter of his life when he begins a tentative romance with a young traffic cop who doesn\'t know about his condition. Is their relationship doomed before it even begins?','/lJlGScysOQg6kFRkxOqAidw2GRP.jpg','1998-01-24',97,'Released','Is love eternal?','Christmas in August',26935,2.1812,7.655,'m4TlXBDIay4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14454,_binary '\0','/lrLIy9OFRQg4VkhrCyolfNXJEUH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0140888',8,51609,'pt','Central do Brasil','An emotional journey of a former school teacher, who writes letters for illiterate people, and a young boy, whose mother has just died, as they search for the father he never knew.','/zJvp7XjQ2LhPbDVYhFXyucs40vR.jpg','1998-04-03',111,'Released','Between hope and solitude, two lives cross and reinvent themselves','Central Station',666,5.7499,8.121,'qCoqppCsEa8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14455,_binary '\0','/lZYsPT5WzDMgHe4tZzO9GHVN9ei.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0141098',5.5,37747,'en','Forces of Nature','Ben Holmes, a professional book-jacket blurbologist, is trying to get to Savannah for his wedding. He just barely catches the last plane, but a seagull flies into the engine as the plane is taking off. All later flights are cancelled because of an approaching hurricane, so he is forced to hitch a ride in a Geo Metro with an attractive but eccentric woman named Sara.','/etmjiee84g6G9WALmLkJ1DhenAu.jpg','1999-03-12',105,'Released','He went from the eye of the storm, into the arms of a hurricane.','Forces of Nature',1641,6.4432,5.5,'gRb5JFHpzew','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14456,_binary '\0','/sGbTfUgN5NIxK0RrkyrUwgLfB6q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0141105',6.7,3464,'en','Free Enterprise','Young filmmakers trying to hawk a movie titled \"Bradykillers\" about a serial killer who goes after victims Marcia, Jan, and Cindy meet their screen idol, William Shatner. The two young men, who idolize him and in their fantasies have seen him as a shadowy fairy godfather figure, are alarmed at the reality of the middle-aged non-Captain Kirk man that they meet.','/tBkKj6pUgxIW8DvNJEjsbnWgifP.jpg','1998-06-04',113,'Released','Love long and party','Free Enterprise',13533,1.565,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14457,_binary '\0','/kVM45FdWgirD08xJAwnRRWMC3QL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0141109',5.5,44915,'en','Jack Frost','A father who can\'t keep his promises dies in a car accident. One year later, he returns as a snowman, who has one final chance to put things right with his son before he is gone forever.','/tdSyQJe7vEDcH9kEVqzVcr0O9lS.jpg','1998-11-15',101,'Released','He\'s the world\'s coolest dad and he\'s gonna prove it.','Jack Frost',9745,6.2491,6.029,'orPZ0BMUI7k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14458,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0141121',6.5,1332,'en','Gideon','Gideon Dobbs is young, simple-minded man who has never stopped dreaming. He checks into a retirement home where he finds the residents have lost their lust for life. Through his innocence he changes their lives and teaches them that each day is a precious gift. They get back their self-esteem and their lust for life.','/bl4STfhVoNBP9MWWaDlEEi03vL0.jpg','1998-10-26',102,'Released','An angel in our lives.','Gideon',219575,1.3722,6.4,'9WG2erBVU9o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14459,_binary '\0','/7OsGo8yVkTgD1ZJMBi9M8GP5aes.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0141369',4.2,54349,'en','Inspector Gadget','John Brown is a bumbling but well-intentioned security guard who is badly injured in an explosion planned by an evil mastermind. He is taken to a laboratory, where Brenda, a leading robotics surgeon, replaces his damaged limbs with state-of-the-art gadgets and tools. Named \"Inspector Gadget\" by the press, John -- along with his niece, Penny, and her trusty dog, Brain -- uses his new powers to discover who was behind the explosion.','/dDcsv1Lql5aM6H4JYfDHjBAXKgT.jpg','1999-07-23',78,'Released','The greatest hero ever assembled.','Inspector Gadget',332,7.1582,4.535,'-60JCARFnIY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14460,_binary '\0','/b4iO8gVM0Y9PdV2V5nFUMOL73Vq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0141399',5.4,2650,'en','Isn\'t She Great','An unsuccessful over-the-top actress becomes a successful over-the-top authoress in this biography of Jacqueline Susann.','/ikmulTGVfW6jYYNz4iO5yoN7dla.jpg','2000-01-28',95,'Released','Talent isn\'t everything...','Isn\'t She Great',75531,2.6316,4.9,'QXr2BTy8nwQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14461,_binary '\0','/5K28IWXIDzQ6CIqKTfNZsXylUn9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0141716',7.1,1864,'en','Party Monster: The Shockumentary','Tells the story of the rise and fall of Michael Alig, a kid from Middle America who aspired to take the place of Andy Warhol. Michael quickly rose to become the biggest party promoter in New York and King of the so-called Club Kids. But after spiraling into drug addiction, Michael brutally murdered his roommate Angel Melendez.','/thyUsE0hr2me9HC0qQlZ8fzhWqq.jpg','1998-06-11',57,'Released','The real story that inspired the major motion picture.','Party Monster: The Shockumentary',34424,1.327,6.3,'89bjDkxGyZg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14462,_binary '\0','/5NT6ngOQRRJ5OtIUcvK9bqyQgaf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0141830',7.7,1262,'ru','Сказка странствий','In this fantasy with dragons and flying machines, 10-year-old Marta is determined to find her brother who was kidnapped at Christmastime by a fake Saint Nick because the little boy is blessed with the ability to locate gold. A kindly, wise philosopher-type by the name of Orlando joins Marta in her search, and together they survive a gigantic sleeping dragon and imprisonment in a tower with no clear means of escape. They overcome that hurdle, but later on, Orlando succumbs to the evils of The Plague (an all-consuming woman!) and Marta continues on her search alone. Eventually, she does find her brother -- but that only introduces problems she had never considered.','/qbtWz2qjxThJGPMyld0uqTkSY4M.jpg','1983-11-01',99,'Released',NULL,'The Story of the Voyages',167858,1.3232,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14463,_binary '\0','/6fTBtsF1bUhlOhhMyYMB2e5uSBv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0141861',6.4,1495,'ja','スウィートホーム','Working on a documentary about infamous painter Mamiya Ichiro, a TV crew filming at his old home come under attack from the ghost of the painter\'s wife.','/oLfO5ppONfQzOcKL6maPI3CVY03.jpg','1989-01-21',103,'Released',NULL,'Sweet Home',72834,1.8622,6.4,'_j0GiqEMyCE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14464,_binary '\0','/r7GIn3wUwDIt2co63wAz1kkEwDY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0141897',5.2,1819,'en','Terror','The descendants of a witch-hunting family and their close friends are stalked and killed by a mysterious entity.','/iFuSsrIKEzd2HZ0vfC6S64xa9wE.jpg','1979-10-26',84,'Released','It Buried For A Hundred Years... But Never Laid To Rest!','Terror',38826,1.3658,5.4,'wFeYliP8JpM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14465,_binary '\0','/hmKS6mItxewMUUgYMFl3M1fWJfB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0141907',4.5,5475,'en','Town & Country','Porter Stoddard is a well-known New York architect who is at a crossroads... a nexus where twists and turns lead to myriad missteps, some with his wife Ellie, others with longtime friends Mona and her husband Griffin. Deciding which direction to take often leads to unexpected encounters with hilarious consequences.','/4ckfJA1zqdXG7ttBqGZ2A91YHQs.jpg','2001-04-27',104,'Released','There\'s no such thing as a small affair.','Town & Country',24113,2.7463,4.5,'TddNSETGZ0Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14466,_binary '\0','/2W1AA5qZXJrR7MJXUgqj49JsLYy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0141926',6.6,92891,'en','U-571','In the midst of World War II, the battle under the sea rages and the Nazis have the upper hand as the Allies are unable to crack their war codes. However, after a wrecked U-boat sends out an SOS signal, the Allies realise this is their chance to seize the \'enigma coding machine\'.','/7lc7jXmjQmITnfUBX7nN4kxKKbI.jpg','2000-04-20',116,'Released','Heroes are ordinary men who do extraordinary things in extraordinary times.','U-571',3536,6.3312,6.6,'2imOf6-H3tI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14467,_binary '\0','/pdau8JG1KZfYM7PhK5otnwQR6dI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0141966',7.4,1481,'ro','Vlad Tepes','Vlad Țepeş, otherwise known as Vlad the Impaler and Dracula, fights the Ottoman Turks on the battlefield and the Hungarian Boyars in his court.','/yseuxcrMyT523a00mnv3mdioSTM.jpg','1979-01-08',134,'Released',NULL,'Vlad the Impaler: The True Life of Dracula',92096,1.0342,7.522,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14468,_binary '\0','/zPUeLfcy2LdMoGYhJ8rWv9YFPZJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0141974',7.2,12173,'en','The War Zone','An alienated teenager, saddened that he has moved away from London, must find a way to deal with a dark family secret.','/ziw5h70xBbr1eyNaMX0ONT2GBl6.jpg','1999-06-11',98,'Released','When the worst of men hides in a family with no history.','The War Zone',42739,4.4714,6.8,'vsMRoJ5ZpkM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14469,_binary '\0','/6StYWJiLD9lzdRUUtkFl8PDp7hK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0141986',6.9,2337,'en','Wild Man Blues','Wild Man Blues is a 1998 documentary film directed by Barbara Kopple, about the musical avocation of actor/director/comic Woody Allen. The film takes its name from a jazz composition sometimes attributed to Jelly Roll Morton and sometimes to Louis Armstrong and recorded by both (among others). Allen\'s love of early 20th century New Orleans music is depicted through his 1996 tour of Europe with his New Orleans Jazz Band. Allen has played clarinet with this band for over 25 years. Although Allen\'s European tour is the film\'s primary focus, it was also notable as the first major public showcase for Allen\'s relationship with Soon-Yi Previn.','/9CaJQIscbAiHOr7RMbdXA8UqL7Z.jpg','1997-01-16',105,'Released',NULL,'Wild Man Blues',76330,1.2864,6.7,'MXld5YUBb1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14470,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0141998',8,1230,'en','The Last Spring','A group of high school friends deal with the break-up of their softball team.',NULL,'1994-05-28',90,'Released','A comedy with cleats.','The Last Spring',1024742,0.9298,9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14471,_binary '\0','/gHsz9q4OXw4dBfh3aDvnCkKzsRb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0142074',6.2,4182,'en','Alien Abduction: Incident in Lake County','After a mysterious blackout, a son goes out to investigate and captures footage of actual aliens. When the aliens follow he and his brothers back to their home all hell breaks lose.','/ix6kUUS6UkbzzTb3gVzHk9QcNxY.jpg','1998-01-20',93,'Released','We are not alone','Alien Abduction: Incident in Lake County',20182,2.5687,7.438,'5OouuR7Dw20','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14472,_binary '\0','/scfBpNaw7LZIV6NtDlC01HCjEpT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0142181',7.4,5104,'ja','中国の鳥人','Wada, a salary man, is enlisted to venture off to China to investigate a potential Jade mine. After his arrival, Wada encounters a violent, yet sentimental, yakuza, who takes the liberty of joining his adventure through China. Led on their long and disastrous journey to the mine by Shen, the three men come across something even more magical and enticing.','/civu1OxSYyxywfEOeMyCZoAOt7H.jpg','1998-06-10',118,'Released','The children of the sky.','The Bird People in China',28638,2.419,7.2,'st1MwQD8V8Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14473,_binary '\0','/n9SyYytuvTXXZY6yx9Yu4iPobN2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0142192',6.1,20228,'en','The Corruptor','Danny is a young cop partnered with Nick, a seasoned but ethically tainted veteran. As the two try to stop a gang war in Chinatown, Danny relies on Nick but grows increasingly uncomfortable with the way Nick gets things done.','/1Eg34AuZG1jtAvdM8xGHW5jiwCF.jpg','1999-03-12',110,'Released','You can\'t play by the rules if there aren\'t any.','The Corruptor',9455,6.173,6.1,'g-D9unnCJhY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14474,_binary '\0','/n5kP33efxqphJhhBbxuGhGFb0Vc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0142201',6.3,7795,'en','Crazy in Alabama','An abused wife heads to California to become a movie star while her nephew back in Alabama has to deal with a racially-motivated murder involving a corrupt sheriff.','/bAlevqRg9KG9y725tt4YkNajLrk.jpg','1999-10-22',112,'Released','Sometimes you have to lose your mind to find your freedom.','Crazy in Alabama',31306,3.3513,6,'N087EJuQudM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14475,_binary '\0','/4hS2FAz65RKwNYmzyAq4uc994CG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0142231',6.9,2019,'en','Down in the Delta','A single mother plagued by alcohol and drug addictions is sent with her children from Chicago to her ancestral home in the Mississippi Delta, to live with her uncle and aunt for the summer.','/2ygShFSdj1hug8xj2q28OMktAU4.jpg','1998-12-25',112,'Released','Sometimes, the last place you expected to be is the one place you\'ve always belonged...','Down in the Delta',125582,1.4109,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14476,_binary '\0','/9mZGGJJP04RBmrzh9XVSfqRXl0d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0142233',6.7,9811,'ja','ドラゴンボールZ 地球まるごと超決戦','Goku and friends must stop a band of space pirates from consuming fruit from the Tree of Might before it\'s destructive powers drain Earth\'s energy.','/fDX4Dp8IKvjBAaEb5MOJrGkxWX0.jpg','1990-06-07',61,'Released','From the seeds of destruction, a new threat has arisen.','Dragon Ball Z: The Tree of Might',39101,7.7472,6.5,'6nkQu1l5Grs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14477,_binary '\0','/fZL8BvRSgDrdpBHiEnJ8ROB0rgN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0142234',5.8,6929,'ja','ドラゴンボールＺ 超戦士撃破!!勝のはオレだ','Jaga Bada, Mr. Satan\'s old sparring partner, has invited Satan to his personal island to hold a grudge match. Trunks and Goten decide to come for the adventure and Android #18 is following Satan for the money he owes her. Little do they know that Jaga Bada\'s scientist have found a way to resurrect Broly, the legendary Super Saiyan.','/A0VKJ6eRIubW6wH4eAwcpQfjoRD.jpg','1994-07-09',50,'Released','Broly is back! And this time a case of mistaken identity might be the end of the planet!','Dragon Ball Z: Bio-Broly',39106,5.0986,5.8,'QQS1n9VZuOg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14478,_binary '\0','/t9z8Wm8c0HnxfPN9YvXgmueG6De.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0142236',7.6,13884,'ja','ドラゴンボールZ 復活のフュージョン!! 悟空とベジータ','Not paying attention to his job, a young demon allows the evil cleansing machine to overflow and explode, turning the young demon into the infamous monster Janemba. Goku and Vegeta make solo attempts to defeat the monster, but realize their only option is fusion.','/rCU5ddP3FVSDJy81UldUsBuf3ag.jpg','1995-03-04',55,'Released','Hell’s gates have opened.','Dragon Ball Z: Fusion Reborn',39107,6.4515,7.569,'rE95a4iC1dk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14479,_binary '\0','/cZD27c2H9wLAsIOeouzqiL4OaBr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0142237',6.9,9618,'ja','ドラゴンボールZ 激突!!100億パワーの戦士たち','Cooler has resurrected himself as a robot and is enslaving the people of New Namek. Goku and the gang must help.','/ipfeRIqcBj5NfCLkTtg39enfJV2.jpg','1992-03-07',46,'Released','The odds are 10 billion to 2.','Dragon Ball Z: The Return of Cooler',39103,6.2229,6.5,'sGqAtYAkwDo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14480,_binary '\0','/h5Rvh7TUOLqmY2AOebwSEnHolwB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0142238',7.1,8326,'ja','ドラゴンボールZ 銀河ギリギリ!! ぶっちぎりの凄い奴','Mr. Money is holding another World Martial Arts Tournament and Mr. Satan invites everyone in the world to join in. Little does he know that Bojack, an ancient villain who has escaped his prison, is competing. Since Goku is currently dead, it is up to Gohan, Vegeta, and Trunks to defeat Bojack and his henchman.','/iihTK9Af8G1ZzBjkIIAV4qQMkzF.jpg','1993-07-10',51,'Released','A new threat emerges. A champion prepares.','Dragon Ball Z: Bojack Unbound',39105,7.9846,7.2,'DJZ3vjBqYFU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14481,_binary '\0','/2WTjYoswcKZTQrokeUOhY3Xb3mZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0142239',6.5,7506,'ja','ドラゴンボールＺ 危険なふたり！超戦士はねむれない','A Saiyan Space pod crash-lands on Earth out of which a wounded Saiyan crawls: Broly, the Legendary Super Saiyan. The wounded Broly shouts out in frustration and turns into normal form. The place soon freezes, trapping him in it and he falls into a coma.','/Apnw8FWoPOIsu14d5dvaNZzFSJE.jpg','1994-03-12',48,'Released',NULL,'Dragon Ball Z: Broly - Second Coming',44251,5.479,6.8,'ioU887K1Obk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14482,_binary '\0','/pLuoFuzygOdWBRJhLQWSbKeoZ0s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0142240',6.6,8370,'ja','ドラゴンボールZ この世で一番強いヤツ','The evil Dr. Kochin uses the dragon balls to resurrect his mentor, Dr. Wheelo, in an effort to take over the world. Dr. Wheelo, his body having been destroyed by the avalanche that killed him fifty years before, desires the body of the strongest fighter in the world as his new vessel. Believing Roshi to be the world\'s strongest warrior, Dr. Kochin abducts Bulma and forces Roshi to surrender himself to save her. When Goku hears of their abduction, he goes to their rescue.','/5elbm3iLgGQ6nA5vqUmi9vIojbF.jpg','1990-03-10',60,'Released','Deep in the ice is earth\'s greatest threat that can only be stopped by one man.','Dragon Ball Z: The World\'s Strongest',39100,6.3984,6.623,'RuViG2-w_To','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14483,_binary '\0','/1u3yIvWFZaNDSSXmWYCYaNpCBBu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0142241',6.9,9035,'ja','ドラゴンボールＺ 極限バトル！三大超サイヤ人','Dr. Gero\'s Androids #13, #14, and #15 are awakened by the laboratory computers and immediately head to the mall where Goku is shopping. After Goku, Trunks, and Vegeta defeat #14 and #15, #13 absorbs their inner computers and becomes a super being greater than the original three separately were. Now it is up to Goku to stop him.','/uVJqC187rKxQ1sJsWlKjNfAzeTk.jpg','1992-07-11',46,'Released','Three Androids. Three Saiyans. One Ultimate Battle.','Dragon Ball Z: Super Android 13!',39104,5.2058,7,'Ph2tugLEjpc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14484,_binary '\0','/xrg1pYVPK1yN0UREAzd1ywoVM6m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0142242',7.3,13580,'ja','ドラゴンボールＺ 燃え尽きろ!!熱戦・烈戦・超激戦','While the Saiyan Paragus persuades Vegeta to rule a new planet, King Kai alerts Goku of the South Galaxy\'s destruction by an unknown Super Saiyan.','/6iO8TJCyLI4BiPYOvdwzPV2bhoV.jpg','1993-03-06',70,'Released','As the legend foretold.','Dragon Ball Z: Broly - The Legendary Super Saiyan',34433,7.4665,7.3,'mDlTYHVoUGA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14485,_binary '\0','/b6u42A4TkZzv3TNhZfmfu5bjuFK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0142243',7.4,11092,'ja','ドラゴンボールZ 龍拳爆発!!悟空がやらねば誰がやる','The Z Warriors discover an unopenable music box and are told to open it with the Dragon Balls. The contents turn out to be a warrior named Tapion who had sealed himself inside along with a monster called Hildegarn. Goku must now perfect a new technique to defeat the evil monster.','/7uRu9EA3nie0n2mlVDDLlTI3IzC.jpg','1995-07-15',51,'Released','If he doesn\'t do it, who will?','Dragon Ball Z: Wrath of the Dragon',39108,8.5175,7.3,'52VKPAbEWug','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14486,_binary '\0','/jznY4TwOaVWZJoXA3D5FkvX3cUc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0142244',6.5,7744,'ja','ドラゴンボールゼット 超スーパーサイヤ人じんだ孫そん悟ご空くう','A Super Namekian named Slug comes to invade Earth. But the Z Warriors do their best to stop Slug and his gang.','/1lmwZTsqwTtvd3m60pyQfhGM2Ut.jpg','1991-03-19',52,'Released',NULL,'Dragon Ball Z: Lord Slug',39102,5.1153,6.535,'qd017xX0Y2E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14487,_binary '\0','/mhwqI7dKEjVwhTbILHM3tZyarTD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0142248',6.8,3347,'ja','ドラゴンボール 魔訶不思議大冒険','Master Roshi has succeeded at the one mission he valued most: to train Goku and Krillin to become ultimate fighters. So, he arranges for them to test their mettle at a competition hosted by Emperor Chiaotzu. Not everyone\'s playing by the rules, however, as a member of the ruler\'s household schemes to use the Dragonballs to extort money and power from the royal.','/4uPs9rjKkGWOmc5QO4VV08YdLpV.jpg','1988-07-09',48,'Released',NULL,'Dragon Ball: Mystical Adventure',116776,4.3824,6.679,'DIjku6BtYW4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14488,_binary '\0','/a7yu3kFNsKuDdXlpcElBvBvaoIk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0142249',6.5,3576,'ja','ドラゴンボール 魔神城のねむり姫','Goku and Kuririn are given an assignment by Kame-Sen\'nin: \"Retrieve the sleeping princess from Lucifer and I will take you as my students.\" But the mission proves to be more perilous than originally thought.','/9BMFoAqU4DadJajmL3BX0CgJXfe.jpg','1987-07-18',45,'Released',NULL,'Dragon Ball: Sleeping Princess in Devil\'s Castle',39145,4.2665,6.703,'nE8WLaCQKCU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14489,_binary '\0','/cJ2CNxc1AQh5raZgxeQreGKxale.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0142250',7.1,3480,'ja','ドラゴンボール 最強への道','A retelling of Dragon Ball\'s origin with a different take on the meeting of Goku, Bulma, and Kame-Sen\'nin. It also retells the Red Ribbon Army story; but this time they find Goku rather than Goku finding them.','/wPkoqtFhDoIbzt61oOYwmLOZdAg.jpg','1996-03-04',80,'Released',NULL,'Dragon Ball: The Path to Power',39148,4.6138,7.405,'JyN86BcP3WY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14490,_binary '\0','/trUoQPnQy3cAXDx5TknzuBTFiWX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0142251',6.6,4447,'ja','ドラゴンボール 神龍の伝説','The great King Gurumes is searching for the Dragon Balls in order to put a stop to his endless hunger. A young girl named Pansy who lives in the nearby village has had enough of the treachery and decides to seek Muten Rōshi for assistance. Can our heroes save the village and put a stop to the Gurumes Army?','/dZCWRFJnwyxYOhzAhf7Xyru4moB.jpg','1986-12-20',50,'Released',NULL,'Dragon Ball: Curse of the Blood Rubies',39144,9.1055,6.885,'0PNzQ_D8fjY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14491,_binary '\0','/4Nnh0j5yj8J5sdhXWqWu8052gjl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0142257',6.4,2276,'ja','江戸川乱歩全集 恐怖奇形人間','After escaping from an insane asylum, a medical student assumes the identity of a mysterious dead man, who appears to be his doppelganger, and gets lured to a sinister island ruled by a mad scientist and his malformed men.','/q1cgApkVjMPXSXVbJrfu1aPfbJZ.jpg','1969-10-31',99,'Released','Banned for decades! The most notorious Japanese horror film ever made!','Horrors of Malformed Men',39986,1.8294,5.7,'nArLPDsEZZI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14492,_binary '\0','/hvsfKEFga6L0ew3Mx7bGx99Ru2s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0142316',7,3130,'ja','極道黒社会','A Japanese assassin stranded in Taiwan must take work from a local crime boss to make ends meet when suddenly a woman from his past delivers a son to him.','/zQVopy34WweVuBdMXWWlzJ5G1V1.jpg','1997-06-28',95,'Released',NULL,'Rainy Dog',36244,1.5184,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14493,_binary '\0','/fl3no3IMXGjZAUa2iU9aBzlid5m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0142342',6.5,254219,'en','Big Daddy','A lazy law school grad adopts a kid to impress his girlfriend, but everything doesn\'t go as planned. Now he\'s forced to grow up while navigating the challenges of fatherhood.','/lEYg1X8RjqNB5NWEtodcbK7vm1G.jpg','1999-06-25',93,'Released','Nature called. Look who answered.','Big Daddy',9032,12.4406,6.488,'J_l5fMb1oxg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14494,_binary '\0','/4LN2mts3ble1y54H1DZw38AvCR6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0142371',7.1,8030,'ja','北斗の拳','After a nuclear holocaust tears the world apart, mankind is forced to the harshness of not only the oppression of others who are much more powerful, but the dead earth which seems to be getting worse with every passing moment. But a savior has risen from the ashes, a man who will defeat those who would torment the weak and make the world a livable place once more. A man named Kenshiro...','/2YCNdrSstrYovSYyKMCDxkkDUsC.jpg','1986-03-08',112,'Released','An epic assault on the senses!','Fist of the North Star',19877,3.4038,6.7,'QBLm3WYcFSw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14495,_binary '\0','/zybudGZitZg5X4xs8xQZrrQeoPo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0142632',8.2,2488,'hu','Lúdas Matyi','A young peasant boy stands up to tyranny, aided by his trusting friend - a goose.','/AlmnfwBhlknPMW79iHonFfEXekJ.jpg','1977-04-07',70,'Released',NULL,'Mattie the Goose-Boy',41061,1.3933,7.2,'6VXaP_kwo2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14496,_binary '\0','/qVyN9czTgRJ2SAA2BLXESzQEVgz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0142688',6.7,212012,'en','The Ninth Gate','A rare book dealer finds himself at the heart of a string of paranormal events when he is hired to find the last two copies of a text, The Nine Gates of the Kingdom of Shadows, capable of summoning the Devil.','/rxw9l9YNL14ODdmAavUwHLBjiDo.jpg','1999-08-25',133,'Released','Every book has a life of its own.','The Ninth Gate',622,12.0883,6.499,'zTEWeZyV7zQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14497,_binary '\0','/p7DJBCMQPRKp31ER3mx2PJIqnJP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0142772',7.1,1473,'nl','De Poolse bruid','Drama on the dawning love between a Polish woman and a farmer. Anna is forced to work in a brothel, but manages to escape. She\'s found, exhausted and scared, by Henk (the farmer) who offers her a place to stay, but her past chases her.','/1YGxhpsZDRMSTR1Mzebn6iKwn93.jpg','1998-05-26',89,'Released',NULL,'The Polish Bride',28527,1.164,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14498,_binary '\0','/deqB89VLPy9WJzGrb51tU1DyuhN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0142804',6.1,12207,'en','Resurrection','A jaded homicide detective has been put on the case of a ruthless killer in the city of Chicago, who leaves a trail of horribly mutilated and dismembered corpses along with perversely ironic biblical quotes.','/2j6cMHN1Mx1u8S897VVhO7wSrce.jpg','1999-06-05',108,'Released','He\'s coming.','Resurrection',10359,3.18,6.1,'X-F4dQTWbf4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14499,_binary '\0','/oZDNsC5ucmzoDlCyBS4fjbZTXhK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0143012',7.2,1460,'ja','座頭市の歌が聞える','Zatoichi comes upon a dying man who asks him to give a bag of money to \"Taichi\". Zatoichi has no idea who this is but when he comes upon a small town harassed by gangsters, he finds that \"Taichi\" was the man\'s young son. Along his travels he also met a blind monk who makes Zatoichi question his murderous lifestyle. In trying to help the town, Zatoichi kills some gangsters and becomes a hero to the boy. He must make a choice of whether to use non-violence and set a good example, or violence and set the boy on the wrong path in life.','/9OkByHoDn8dqGUXfQlgEMSaEJaA.jpg','1966-05-03',83,'Released',NULL,'Zatoichi\'s Vengeance',21410,1.5667,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14500,_binary '\0','/jxFMrLsgfZNaYbl7GsI9MtICNNi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0143088',6.9,1437,'fr','Adieu Philippine','Michel is a young technician in the fledgling TV industry and is due for military service in two months at the time of the Algerian War. Juliette and Liliane are inseparable best friends, and aspiring actresses, who hang around outside the TV studio. Michel invites them in to watch, flirts with them both, and dates them separately and together. When Michel goes on a holiday to Corsica, just before he is drafted, the girls follow.','/zMsWl13cKCgCV6SAALtQTZEt5Ou.jpg','1962-09-25',111,'Released',NULL,'Adieu Philippine',63880,3.2318,6.8,'sP_tcOdMaZ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14501,_binary '\0','/n2jVDMcBEWsLFooO7W1ZkcMUtWS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0143145',6.4,222244,'en','The World Is Not Enough','Greed, revenge, world dominance and high-tech terrorism – it\'s all in a day\'s work for Bond, who\'s on a mission to protect a beautiful oil heiress from a notorious terrorist. In a race against time that culminates in a dramatic submarine showdown, Bond works to defuse the international power struggle that has the world\'s oil supply hanging in the balance.','/wCb2msgoZPK01WIqry24M4xsM73.jpg','1999-11-17',128,'Released','As the countdown begins for the new millennium there is still one number you can always count on.','The World Is Not Enough',36643,14.4128,6.3,'Mc-ZkzZrfIQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14502,_binary '\0','/fweODJ36nd7GQeFVrk1cGwXavUR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0143261',4.4,1687,'en','Friends & Lovers','Friends for ten years, a group of twenty-somethings head for the ski slopes as guests of Ian\'s father. (Ian and dad are estranged because dad worked too many hours when Ian was a lad.) Dad has something to say, but Ian won\'t listen. Meanwhile, David is gay and virginal; Ian\'s business partner, Keaton, is unhappy that his sister Jane is pregnant with no plans to tell the father; Lisa is everybody\'s pal and no one\'s lover; John, stuck in adolescence, is always on the make. He brings German-born stunner, Carla, and promptly loses her affection to Hans, a fast-talking ski instructor. David meets Manny: they have chess in common. Soon, surprises abound as relationships take new turns.','/5zh1PQPN7dl8BX2zdaEYyiNRNXp.jpg','1999-04-16',103,'Released','... can you tell the difference?','Friends & Lovers',114719,2.593,4.9,'RbPKyuqQON8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14503,_binary '\0','/v1hi6Jefi6jdiA0aDo8GQR085Fm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0143296',5.3,1532,'en','I\'ve Been Waiting for You','When a New England high schooler is mysteriously murdered, the town blames Sarah, the new girl who recently moved into a purportedly haunted house and who they believe to be the reincarnation of a witch who was burned at the stake 300 years ago.','/vtb5CtWqRZWmRG8g07dhMW9MeUT.jpg','1998-03-22',90,'Released','Someone’s idea of a high school prank is about to turn very deadly!','I\'ve Been Waiting for You',117904,1.8065,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14504,_binary '\0','/f0hZnbxYGOrgTqd2Pv60Pz4A1OU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0143334',6.9,7327,'tr','Kasaba','A story in four parts is told from the perspective of two children, showing life in school, in nature, with family and at home. All of this unfolding along with the seasons. The Small Town depicts life in the village, while also portraying the relationships between members of a small-town family, in a long centerpiece scene around a campfire with family members talking about the past, life and its disappointments. Both brother and sister witness the complexities and darkness of the adult world, as well as the mysteries of nature and wildlife.','/3l8X5JRmdZckhaHbIml0UY0mbP5.jpg','1997-11-28',85,'Released',NULL,'The Small Town',52111,2.3391,6.566,'X0FLZTDYANo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14505,_binary '\0','/bydFWRsa2M7K2vj8JbtFxwtBg59.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0143338',4.7,1950,'en','Killer Crocodile','A group of environmentalists arrives at a faraway tropical delta where toxic waste is being dumped. However the water also hides a giant crocodile. The corrupt local officials don\'t help much either.','/kK1JKRiR3j6JCpFGEwvCI0jrVJU.jpg','1989-07-30',92,'Released','You are invited to dinner in the tropics. But you\'re the dinner!','Killer Crocodile',78402,1.8908,5.5,'559dVJXPnI8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14506,_binary '\0','/x9mXe97tn5F9dxmjpVL9YqN1xJL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0143348',7.5,5526,'ja','子連れ狼 親の心子の心','Ogami Itto is hired to kill a tattooed female assassin and battles Retsudo, head of the Yagyu clan, and his son Gunbei.','/80dPE18baHbnB8mrl6wWtGXEyCP.jpg','1972-12-30',81,'Released',NULL,'Lone Wolf and Cub: Baby Cart in Peril',41477,2.3324,7.3,'GUq0iu6fESg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14507,_binary '\0','/7zwL9zZHngaUEs7dowYUerNwpqp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0143422',3.6,1662,'en','American Virgin','When your father is a pornographer, what can you do to shock him? If you\'re Katrina Bartalotti, you announce that you\'re going to lose your virginity -- live on the Internet, for the whole world to see.','/y6IlQu0eVHAI7pCefUWZoqxRLhk.jpg','2000-06-02',88,'Released','There is a first time for everything!','American Virgin',60005,2.0517,3.4,'_JJ-2FIWVV8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14508,_binary '\0','/yqiBjLP6ZQgBpXYrmAmSbT7Lvf0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0143428',7.5,5131,'ja','子連れ狼 冥府魔道','Ogami Itto is challenged by a quintet of warriors, each armed with one fifth of Ogami\'s assassin fee and one fifth of the information he needs to complete his assignment.','/9GVtFK1lVfQLHL1uPl2Sqy3Hz3c.jpg','1973-08-11',89,'Released',NULL,'Lone Wolf and Cub: Baby Cart in the Land of Demons',41482,1.9234,7.2,'UcwsSMvN3Fg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14509,_binary '\0','/bUm9rdfH5SyvSAKsnpz4QPUlE1L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0143746',5.7,3355,'en','Molly','Molly McKay is a profoundly autistic twenty-something woman who has lived in an institution from a young age following her parents\' death in a car accident. When the institution must close due to budget cuts, Molly is left in the care of her neurotypical, older brother, Buck McKay, an advertising executive and perennial bachelor. Buck forces her to undergo an experimental medical treatment, with unexpectedly drastic results.','/bKyRoZ8uutxdCMMmrVoivZJ0Mc7.jpg','1999-10-22',102,'Released','Innocence is bliss. See the world through her eyes.','Molly',44857,2.2574,4.2,'9VFywCWZzSw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14510,_binary '\0','/2fTB1wwSFbUlACeIwXNJqi8EdJa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0143861',7.8,3004,'en','Scratch','A feature-length documentary film about hip-hop DJing, otherwise known as turntablism. From the South Bronx in the 1970s to San Francisco now, the world\'s best scratchers, beat-diggers, party-rockers, and producers wax poetic on beats, breaks, battles, and the infinite possibilities of vinyl.','/vXVou6iXTfxS8gbmQj8xNPcKefV.jpg','2001-11-07',92,'Released',NULL,'Scratch',18984,1.0627,7.8,'G_u7s8NDz9o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14511,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0143907',7.4,1713,'ru','Страна глухих','Strana Glukhikh is about an unusual relationship between two women, one of them a deaf-mute dancer and the other on the run from the mafia. Yaya, the deaf girl, offers to hide Rita whose boyfriend, Alyosha owes gambling debts to the mafia, but in return she wants her to leave the young man and run off with her to an imaginary paradise where material values do not exist.','/eW6KVc3d2KnKPL9I0cZZqkTuRob.jpg','1998-04-06',105,'Released',NULL,'Country of the Deaf',54514,0.9628,6.703,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14512,_binary '\0','/92wIfI4yh0Sh7YVx82Iy0ogeD6E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0144020',7.4,3911,'zh','小武','A small town pickpocket whose friends have moved on to higher trades finds himself bitter and unable to adapt.','/cAhJeNYIARl0T6mHISxfiWThvIT.jpg','1997-08-01',113,'Released',NULL,'Pickpocket',52103,2.2114,7.223,'k4kLUNJTfl8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14513,_binary '\0','/5oaMV2q0qzxkIW2ukU3lldLu5q2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0144084',7.6,856439,'en','American Psycho','A wealthy New York investment banking executive hides his alternate psychopathic ego from his co-workers and friends as he escalates deeper into his illogical, gratuitous fantasies.','/9uGHEgsiUXjCNq8wdq4r49YL8A1.jpg','2000-04-13',102,'Released','Killer looks.','American Psycho',1359,22.8062,7.401,'5YnGhW4UEhc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14514,_binary '\0','/MKlMOV0rajV4ztnpn9oINa81no.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0144106',6.4,1321,'de','Bin ich schön?','Between Munich and Seville, the destinies of sixteen characters intertwine and intersect, missing each other or colliding head-on. They are all, without knowing it, at a pivotal moment in their lives...','/pTbiGNjH15ogIBeHICPr1gWRH4s.jpg','1998-09-17',117,'Released',NULL,'Am I Beautiful?',8556,1.8176,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14515,_binary '\0','/9DNDELpVxuLJWMoomgULhhZFoHR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0144117',7.6,264115,'en','The Boondock Saints','Tired of the crime overrunning the streets of Boston, Irish Catholic twin brothers Conner and Murphy are inspired by their faith to cleanse their hometown of evil with their own brand of zealous vigilante justice. As they hunt down and kill one notorious gangster after another, they become controversial folk heroes in the community. But Paul Smecker, an eccentric FBI agent, is fast closing in on their blood-soaked trail.','/wtLUmkWg41xFLpvmUWAN1mm65f6.jpg','1999-01-22',108,'Released','Thy kingdom come. Thy will be done.','The Boondock Saints',8374,9.6981,7.241,'IMs4ESRJuCU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14516,_binary '\0','/fLTd0VxpijUt6Hm1QM2ehLpWPeu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0144120',5.7,71289,'en','Bride of Chucky','For ten years, the tortured soul of serial killer Charles Lee Ray has been imprisoned inside a child\'s doll. Chucky is reborn when his old flame, Tiffany, rescues his battered doll parts from a police impound. But Chucky wants his new playmate cut down to size, so he transforms his blushing bride into a stunning little terror. Chucky and Tiffany can\'t wait to start their own homicidal honeymoon. When this demonic duo hits the road and hooks up with a pair of unsuspecting newlyweds, they leave a trail of murder and mayhem behind them. Chucky\'s back!','/yaIPNOcC7ZRuwH3maNwP9qzIo5G.jpg','1998-10-15',89,'Released','Chucky gets lucky.','Bride of Chucky',11932,14.7828,6.14,'VNpqr8GfNRg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14517,_binary '\0','/awVyzo630F3p0M7WnW3nJt5sQIo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0144142',5.1,4180,'en','Committed','After her husband, Carl, suddenly leaves, Joline travels from New York to Texas to track him down. Although Joline tries to remain upbeat, she is discouraged when she discovers that Carl already has a new girlfriend, the lovely Carmen. Familiarizing herself with Carl\'s new home and friends, Joline gets company in the form of her brother, Jay. Will Joline win Carl back, or are there other romantic possibilities on her horizon?','/10vXic9IMUTW5FrB1ivmieM2ydY.jpg','2000-04-28',98,'Released','She\'ll get what she wants... no matter what it takes!','Committed',40562,2.7273,4.9,'An9oI16FPkY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14518,_binary '\0','/5WLdmRWfTpohU3aSbBgvF4zljfM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0144168',6.2,22902,'en','Dick','Two high school girls wander off during a class trip to the White House and meet President Richard Nixon. They become the official dog walkers for Nixon\'s dog Checkers, and become his secret advisors during the Watergate scandal.','/aBG4XoK5xkujl4crloPs6bStl4m.jpg','1999-08-04',94,'Released','He was tricky. They were better.','Dick',16406,3.7246,6,'K8eZ-QgITAA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14519,_binary '\0','/jlxwZ7XHK17U4sZUxmDP8iHThC8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0144201',7.4,14970,'fr','La Fille sur le pont','It\'s night on a Paris bridge. A girl leans over Seine River with tears in her eyes and a violent yearning to drown her sorrows. Out of nowhere someone takes an interest in her. He is Gabor, a knife thrower who needs a human target for his show. The girl, Adele, has never been lucky and nowhere else to go. So she follows him. They travel along the northern bank of the Mediterranean to perform.','/t5hKllCsmpWWA7XpxBXPjx0Gfct.jpg','1999-03-31',90,'Released',NULL,'The Girl on the Bridge',10401,2.9276,7.027,'5Tsg_dVhNi4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14520,_binary '\0','/ppXYWZdv0qkr9aIRMLjtJPXDDon.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0144214',6.4,69171,'en','The General\'s Daughter','When the body of Army Capt. Elisabeth Campbell is found on a Georgia military base, two investigators, Warrant Officers Paul Brenner and Sara Sunhill, are ordered to solve her murder. What they uncover is anything but clear-cut. Unseemly details emerge about Campbell\'s life, leading to allegations of a possible military coverup of her death and the involvement of her father, Lt. Gen. Joseph Campbell.','/w8CMN81n7SON7ALPMlxZtOzBZB.jpg','1999-06-18',116,'Released','Go behind the lies.','The General\'s Daughter',2275,7.3449,6.4,'k1MQqkCA484','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14521,_binary '\0','/bPggCFClLVQPJO64NKBveyGZfiC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0144286',6.5,2233,'en','The Lost Son','Xavier Lombard is a world-weary private eye in London, in exile from his native Paris; his best friend is Nathalie, a high-class call girl. He gets a call from an old friend from the Paris police department, now a businessman whose brother-in-law is missing. The missing man\'s parents hire Xavier over their daughter\'s objections, and quickly he finds himself in the realm of children\'s sexual slavery.','/3Et7EXmtQ4Ds2xc5hBPxuUwmSqX.jpg','1999-06-25',102,'Released',NULL,'The Lost Son',30964,1.58,6,'VsPH3Mbh58Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14522,_binary '\0','/i3oT0v1KVDZEq8oOZdAAqy78Vub.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0144528',4.5,56139,'en','Nutty Professor II: The Klumps','The hilarity begins when professor Sherman Klump finds romance with fellow DNA specialist, Denise Gaines, and discovers a brilliant formula that reverses aging. But Sherman\'s thin and obnoxious alter ego, Buddy Love, wants out...and a big piece of the action. And when Buddy gets loose, things get seriously nutty.','/v8gI95Eio7kAjixyqYHxNKmJTmm.jpg','2000-07-27',107,'Released','The Klumps are back!','Nutty Professor II: The Klumps',12107,6.378,5.027,'X5BnhugnRR8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14523,_binary '\0','/5uMgPq5IVsTrZZGT2yIRVITwfp3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0144550',7.1,6198,'en','The Pentagon Wars','From the director of “Made In America” and “The Money Pit” comes a hilarious look at one of the most expensive blunders in military history. Over 17 years and almost as many billion dollars have gone into devising the BFV (Bradley Fighting Vehicle). There\'s only one problem. . . it doesn\'t work. (Spoiler alert: 25 years later ... it does work.)','/qPe6EtkyONh6JuekhPZ56jRWyVV.jpg','1998-02-28',104,'Released','They aimed to build the ultimate fighting machine... they missed.','The Pentagon Wars',14439,3.9577,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14524,_binary '\0','/kN2I71yfFRuE8UX7JOelo8jmHX4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0144555',5.5,1984,'de','Premutos - Der gefallene Engel','Premutos is the first of the fallen Angels, even before Lucifer. His Goal is to rule the world, the living and the dead. His son should pave the way for him and appears arbitrary throughout human history and is then recognized as some kind of monster. In the present time, a young man living in Germany begins to suffer from visionary flashbacks - of the lives he lived in the past as Premutos\' son! He remembers how he appeared in the middle age, when mankind suffered from pestilence and during WWII in Russia. On his (earthly) father\'s birthday, a case containing some strange old book and a yellow potion is found in their garden, which was hidden by some peasant in 1943, who experimented with witchery in order to re-animate his deceased wife. Whe the young man gets in touch with the book and some of the yellow potion, he mutates into a monster and awakens an army of zombies, ready to bring back the fallen Angel Premutos and to disturb the little birthday party','/1KzZKWIGKS30GvtX88BpCPzcWAJ.jpg','1997-03-24',106,'Released',NULL,'Premutos: The Fallen Angel',10370,1.6267,5.1,'dA0LfpVNU7o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14525,_binary '\0','/eLNsAwSHuZ92Riem3m2tJQERGnp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0144557',5.5,2847,'en','Puddle Cruiser','A student falls in love with a fellow student who is defending his buddies in university court. He \"proves his love\" (more like his masculinity) to her by playing rugby against her ex-boyfriend.','/6EyVqjP2d6cWANdlA4TUoVIt7tf.jpg','1996-10-18',102,'Released',NULL,'Puddle Cruiser',13563,1.5122,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14526,_binary '\0','/A3MTxPOcJIwHjvdKNIPohPDgrvo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0144604',6.4,1449,'en','Shadrach','In 1935, 99-year-old former slave Shadrach asks to be buried on the soil where he was born to slavery, and that land is owned by the large Dabney family, consisting of Vernon, Trixie and their seven children, and to bury a black man on that land is a violation of strict Virginia law.','/zXqzSRvIUBBJRVaHXXQSEkGMmdY.jpg','1998-09-23',88,'Released',NULL,'Shadrach',73351,1.1299,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14527,_binary '\0','/7v4WhTSr3tG0eVFZaMkN3W09Vbz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0144640',6.1,20967,'en','Three to Tango','Oscar and Peter land a career-making opportunity when a Chicago tycoon chooses them to compete for the design of a cultural center. The tycoon mistakenly believes that Oscar is gay and has him spy on his mistress Amy. Oscar goes along with it and ends up falling in love with Amy.','/z2EhRgWvzNa2NgoX0uModV6mEb2.jpg','1999-10-22',98,'Released','All\'s fair in the war of love.','Three to Tango',10563,3.5146,5.7,'l8Rma8xaCb8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14528,_binary '\0','/2BzfOwehPOdnAm4puhTU52EIICr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0144715',5.9,16493,'en','Holy Smoke','While on a journey of discovery in exotic India, beautiful young Ruth Barron falls under the influence of a charismatic religious guru. Her desperate parents then hire PJ Waters, a macho cult de-programmer who confronts Ruth in a remote desert hideaway. But PJ quickly learns that he\'s met his match in the sexy, intelligent and iron-willed Ruth.','/xcovgjKOnNsJTz8uADbCVF98wS1.jpg','1999-09-04',115,'Released','He had only one thing on his mind... but so did she!','Holy Smoke',13787,3.6171,5.7,'YvVi4-vlYxQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14529,_binary '\0','/ozEmN5Ni428TvIxuGZfIUrneYLP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0144782',7.2,2091,'pt','O Bandido da Luz Vermelha','Born and raised in the misery of Brazilian slums, Jorge becomes a luxury house burglar in São Paulo and gets nicknamed \"The Red Light Bandit\" by the sensationalist press. In addition to wearing a red flashlight, he talks to his hostages in an irreverent tone and makes bold breakthroughs to later spend the money extravagantly. His world is the decadent neighbourhood of Boca do Lixo.','/49CQCiWXs3mnFSJmAxVTTYOMQjh.jpg','1968-12-02',92,'Released','A third world western','The Red Light Bandit',186738,1.9666,7.7,'5d1C2sMbYNo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14530,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0144801',7,1421,'en','The Brandon Teena Story','Documentary about Brandon Teena, a transgender man who was murdered along with two others in 1993 in rural Nebraska.','/2VUVDdbInXCTn4X2ViCkIYE33r5.jpg','1998-09-23',89,'Released','All Brandon wanted was to be one of the guys, unfortunately he was a girl.','The Brandon Teena Story',113096,0.7827,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14531,_binary '\0','/tloUICX4JQH0nm4lJLp0zgFCLGM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0144814',4.8,19637,'en','The Rage: Carrie 2','A horrible massacre strikes up after an outcast teenage girl is taunted by a group of high school jocks, all of them unaware of her cutthroat telekinetic powers.','/jJmIf22gwwQPAFJfZ6Tr1MwSpRg.jpg','1999-03-12',105,'Released','Looks can kill.','The Rage: Carrie 2',7341,5.9545,5.7,'0dhGX76FhLE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14532,_binary '\0','/mvbBw9pxhxznSNxrvIWT8GsTTb3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0144964',4.6,22597,'en','Highlander: Endgame','Immortals Connor and Duncan Macleod join forces against a man from Connor\'s distant past in the highlands of Scotland, Kell, an immensely powerful immortal who leads an army of equally powerful and deadly immortal swordsmen and assassins. No immortal alive has been able to defeat Kell yet, and neither Connor nor Duncan are skilled enough themselves to take him on and live. The two of them eventually come to one inevitable conclusion; one of them must die so that the combined power of both the Highlanders can bring down Kell for good. There can be only one... the question is, who will it be?','/u7kIXMyagqcek2SaS9svfPTTGVT.jpg','2000-09-01',87,'Released','It will take two immortals to defeat the ultimate evil. But in the end, there can be only one.','Highlander: Endgame',12211,5.9169,4.805,'M7mqpGNx8FI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14533,_binary '\0','/36CQmRQ7rLhC9dMz66R8tTdXFFE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0145006',7.4,1515,'el','Τζένη Τζένη','Jenny Skoutari, a student and the daughter of a party local commander Kosmas Skoutaris, gets use to visit the private library of - her father\'s political rival - the shipowner Miltos Kassandris. Kassandris prepares his nephew - and a childhood friend of Jenny - Nikos Mantas, as a candidate for the next election. Mantas\' rival has a lead, and is backed by Skoutaris, who is facing financial problems. So Kassandris decides to force Jenny to marry his nephew with a fake marriage, while at the same time financially breaks down her father in order to secure the election of his nephew. This marriage, however, will lead to unexpected situations between the couple..','/wu4TNbacOFBq7YlITZ6YuYXcnOv.jpg','1966-02-21',103,'Released',NULL,'Jenny Jenny',183383,1.3618,7.095,'Rn33t3Zmxgw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14534,_binary '\0','/b17zzeUVfAXav3izCTAWYvki0Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0145033',7.2,1703,'ru','Королевство кривых зеркал','Alice-type Soviet girl, named Olya meets her counterpart Yalo, while looking into the mirror. Yalo is an absolute antipode to Olya: where Olya is precise and neat, Yalo is absent-minded, careless, etc. The explicit plot relates to Olya learning to see herself differently, but this occurs through an experience in the Kingdom of Crooked Mirrors which serves as a mechanism for commenting on the ability of a society to manufacture a false reality.','/pMgXSlo6zXWN5S9JO12w7iBbUC5.jpg','1963-12-28',80,'Released',NULL,'Kingdom of Crooked Mirrors',20891,1.2633,6.88,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14535,_binary '\0','/o3cMdKm2NN2TtF9Gx7epPODNUBy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0145046',8,7559,'en','Little Dieter Needs to Fly','Three decades after German-American pilot Dieter Dengler was shot down over Laos, he returns to the places where he was held prisoner during the early years of the Vietnam War. Accompanied by director Werner Herzog, Dengler describes in unusually candid detail his captivity, the friendships he made, and his daring escape. Not willing to stop there, Herzog even persuades his subject to re-enact certain tortures, with the help of some willing local villagers.','/2sLpyYytu0Dbymzs3skxOCRHKkl.jpg','1997-12-01',77,'Released','In 1966, Dieter Dengler was shot down over Laos, captured, and, down to 85 pounds, escaped.','Little Dieter Needs to Fly',57976,1.7783,7.471,'edxvznzklCA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14536,_binary '\0','/iiSC8rVjkHJw0UmpEMq70xPVQ8H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0145393',7,3293,'es','Pizza, birra, faso','A couple of friends work for a taxi driver to rob his passengers, but they feel like they\'re getting ripped off. They decide to plan their own robberies, but they are amateurs and things don\'t go too well. One of the youths, Cordoba, whose girlfriend Sandra is pregnant, just wants to get enough cash so they can leave Argentina and get to Uruguay to start a new life. He and his friends plan one last robbery, but things don\'t go as planned.','/gJEpEp0oE7osryIExZgCtyiUtJb.jpg','1998-01-15',92,'Released','Four friends. One city. One way out.','Pizza, Beer, and Cigarettes',127471,1.4048,6.955,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14537,_binary '\0','/zQ8AxTPiCiS5nnwXpwTBPBHSaa5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0145487',7.4,997313,'en','Spider-Man','After being bitten by a genetically altered spider at Oscorp, nerdy but endearing high school student Peter Parker is endowed with amazing powers to become the superhero known as Spider-Man.','/or6XJBVpcEbIkma0V9zshnbEtx4.jpg','2002-05-01',121,'Released','Go for the ultimate spin.','Spider-Man',557,43.9845,7.356,'nwyO5Ue6JUQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14538,_binary '\0','/vlG25qaVew5s3uqSvaNCANd7qBS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0145503',7.4,15330,'en','Sunshine','The fate of a Hungarian Jewish family throughout the 20th century.','/qcHDFrjClW35u0dSuLjsQEi8gDk.jpg','1999-09-13',181,'Released','In a time of revolution, in a family torn by tradition, one man was consumed by love.','Sunshine',17771,3.3994,6.4,'fdJXlNgnQTk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14539,_binary '\0','/dkDMCd9ma7PssUWH9HsrmmTMCiI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0145505',5.2,1980,'en','Susan\'s Plan','Susan wants her reprehensible ex-husband dead and, in several bungled attempts by henchmen, tries to accomplish the deed.','/kSzJiqJBQ771Vr2RJOBdYyLPa5H.jpg','1998-10-29',89,'Released','Divorce can be murder.','Susan\'s Plan',83489,2.1311,4.758,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14540,_binary '\0','/apqjnaR3vuh3admgf0lbARj42GR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0145529',2.5,3657,'en','Time Chasers','Inventor Nick Miller dreams of traveling through time, of stopping war and curing humanity\'s problems. He invents the Transport, a time machine, to better the world. When he sells his invention to a defense contractor, the time machine is used by its evil CEO as a sinister weapon. Nick soon discovers that the future has been changed into a desolate wasteland controlled by gangs. Robertson has sold use of the Transport to anyone who wants to take advantage of knowing the normal course of history. The only way Nick can stop the destruction of the future is to erase his past. If somehow he can prevent his past-self from creating the Transport, the threat will be averted. In this pulse-pounding race through time that takes you from the future of 2041 to the Revolutionary War, Nick must risk everything to try and save the future!','/PDxAAvSnsjEIY128Au2Glvo5oM.jpg','1994-03-17',89,'Released','Saving the future before time runs out…','Time Chasers',31380,1.5576,2.8,'FYWO70LsQX0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14541,_binary '\0','/i9tMK3nzmZJ8MBG92iIxGXHWDq4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0145531',6.2,78047,'en','Stigmata','A young woman with no strong religious beliefs, Frankie Paige begins having strange and violent experiences, showing signs of the wounds that Jesus received when crucified. When the Vatican gets word of Frankie\'s situation, a high-ranking cardinal requests that the Rev. Andrew Kiernan investigate her case. Soon Kiernan realizes that very sinister forces are at work, and tries to rescue Frankie from the entity that is plaguing her.','/sKS1Vuqj7OQpOumfs6ArC0TICTN.jpg','1999-09-02',103,'Released','The messenger must be silenced.','Stigmata',10307,5.3886,6.318,'y3PKfVK2LDo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14542,_binary '\0','/9Jd2YrhSsnRyeJDqRJQK2fqPMMt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0145547',7.1,13521,'en','Two Hands','19-year-old Jimmy is just scraping by in the red-light district of Sydney. When local crime lord Pando offers him a shot at working for his syndicate, Jimmy jumps at the chance to deliver a costly package. But, when Jimmy gets jacked by a couple of kids, he\'s indebted to the dangerous gangster for $10,000. Running out of time, he schemes to rob a bank to save himself and a beautiful girl he desires from a gruesome demise.','/k5jokQZjJ8hT8FSaStbfgY7dUnC.jpg','1999-07-29',103,'Released','It was only one mistake, but it was a big one.','Two Hands',13428,3.7639,6.6,'PaPrvXPxm30','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14543,_binary '\0','/inRUNgkrVdri9C12lgvqfds1qTn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0145600',5.2,2253,'en','Brave New World','In a futuristic totalitarian utopian society, babies are created through genetic engineering, everyone has a predestined place in society and their minds are conditioned to follow the rules. A tragic outsider jeopardizes the status quo.','/6fQP7c3TPOvi84onjU5XMbOcbeP.jpg','1998-04-19',87,'Released','In a world where emotion is forbidden, two people find their lives transformed by an outsider.','Brave New World',27260,2.8655,5.5,'xmpiTKFHhJ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14544,_binary '\0','/oKNe6Ids29lqvG6PFc4qxlB3j1R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0145653',7.3,24631,'en','Angela\'s Ashes','An Irish Catholic family returns to 1930s Limerick after a child\'s death in America. The unemployed I.R.A. veteran father struggles with poverty, prejudice, and alcoholism as the family endures harsh slum conditions.','/3Zzcys11nAPP14sKW9l97fIHhkK.jpg','1999-12-25',145,'Released','The hopes of a mother. The dreams of a father. The fate of a child.','Angela\'s Ashes',10397,4.7037,7.3,'Y2xFUdq-qMg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14545,_binary '\0','/xI1tAzzUk2v9nON6DLAHzcOLK42.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0145660',6.7,264783,'en','Austin Powers: The Spy Who Shagged Me','When diabolical genius Dr. Evil travels back in time to steal superspy Austin Powers\'s ‘mojo,’ Austin must return to the swingin\' \'60s himself - with the help of American agent, Felicity Shagwell - to stop the dastardly plan. Once there, Austin faces off against Dr. Evil\'s army of minions to try to save the world in his own unbelievably groovy way.','/jiF7UShERJFn5RtgfBK2lIJrOTc.jpg','1999-06-08',95,'Released','First he fought for the Crown. Now he\'s fighting for the Family Jewels.','Austin Powers: The Spy Who Shagged Me',817,13.71,6.323,'a9HSJwG4DXo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14546,_binary '\0','/oOoy2MqPeuDqeedQyouFfitncei.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0145681',6.7,202649,'en','The Bone Collector','Lincoln Rhyme was the department\'s top homicide detective and leading expert in criminal forensics until an injury left him paralyzed, depressed, and incapable of working. But when a gruesome murder in Manhattan leaves detectives baffled, they call on Rhyme to help solve the mystery. Amelia Donaghy, a rookie cop whose quick thinking preserved a gruesome murder scene, is enlisted by Rhyme to be his on-the-scene forensics expert. With Amelia reluctantly acting as Rhyme\'s able-bodied go-between, the pair piece together cryptic clues the killer leaves behind at the scene of the crime, hoping to catch the grisly serial killer.','/7atMCqRaDpAOnGsteTRm17zmvN3.jpg','1999-11-04',118,'Released','Right now, this serial killer could be looking at his next victim.','The Bone Collector',9481,12.013,6.8,'krU7HZgCxsI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14547,_binary '\0','/31hKau6i2AqCUHubvl82f111jgo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0145734',6.9,21125,'en','Playing by Heart','In a vibrant tapestry of love and longing, nine interconnected souls navigate romance and heartbreak in L.A., where passions collide and truths unfold, revealing that the heart\'s desires often lead us where we least expect.','/3neHR1oPnC0OpcYhLn0TEdSHoEp.jpg','1998-12-30',121,'Released','If romance is a mystery, there\'s only one way to figure it out.','Playing by Heart',825,4.5873,6.646,'DppPtpEbFag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14548,_binary '\0','/sBhNHGKJspWnvxOIBZ6d6D2by4X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0145891',6.9,2327,'fr','Daisy Town','When the members of a caravan of pioneers find a daisy growing in the middle of the desert they decide to stop there and to build their town on this very spot. Houses soon spring up like mushrooms, immediately followed by a bank, a saloon, a prison, etc. Daisy Town is born. Unfortunately a city does not go without its bad boys and the peaceful place is soon turned into a lawless place. To restore law and order, a lawman is needed. Lucky Luke, the cowboy who shoots faster than his shadow, will be this man: all the villains had better watch out!','/hKu2GtcbT95cH1O8BHbJOuIQgOu.jpg','1971-11-01',71,'Released',NULL,'Daisy Town',52761,3.8265,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14549,_binary '\0','/qIDYvZBLYLuWtKnSgq1okHU3Nt8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0145893',5.3,15875,'en','Simply Irresistible','After her mother\'s death, mediocre chef Amanda Shelton is having trouble attracting customers to her family\'s restaurant. While shopping for ingredients, she is given a magical crab by mysterious Gene O\'Reilly. Afterward, Amanda\'s dishes suddenly become excellent, inducing strong emotional reactions in everyone who eats them. Tom Bartlett, who is preparing to open his own eatery, tries her cooking and falls in love.','/zFsqqPQUz69wPaLBqQeiGbGiW7J.jpg','1999-02-05',95,'Released','Magic opened up their hearts... Love did the rest.','Simply Irresistible',16172,4.7069,5.5,'HrnSqohMAqI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14550,_binary '\0','/qhQCEwJNHlLqb7p7UHA2q0iWBMd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0145937',6.4,6566,'en','Naqoyqatsi','A visual montage portrait of our contemporary world dominated by globalized technology and violence.','/buDo6FcSlOVEQJomKB0IviNV0Do.jpg','2002-09-02',89,'Released','Life as war','Naqoyqatsi',21925,2.1427,6.2,'4xe2a3eWuZ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14551,_binary '\0','/klIi6wJBc6WzbYgLp5XnkvJlb3n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0146165',6.7,3414,'en','The Rat Pack','After a brief flash-forward to Frank Sinatra as an old man, saying \"I miss my guys,\" the movie\'s main narrative begins during high points in the solo careers of the Rat Pack: Dean Martin has become a big success despite the breakup of his partnership with Jerry Lewis; Sinatra\'s career is at its peak; Sammy Davis, Jr., is making a comeback after a near fatal car crash, and standup comic Joey Bishop is gaining exposure as an opening act for the other three. The Pack becomes complete when Sinatra reconciles with actor Peter Lawford, who has been ostracized since being seen out publicly with Sinatra\'s ex-wife, Ava Gardner.','/q720CdZKDSvYy4dux6lbfMOX1MA.jpg','1998-08-22',120,'Released','They never let the rules get in the way of having fun.','The Rat Pack',25163,2.8448,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14552,_binary '\0','/b13USE8fClOMI5JhRhIlxwV34by.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0146247',6.5,5266,'en','Babylon 5: The River of Souls','A group of Soul Hunters come to Babylon 5 demanding the return of something that was stolen from them.','/bG8H9cnusrothe1HixryGGvSo9S.jpg','1998-12-20',94,'Released',NULL,'Babylon 5: The River of Souls',10921,2.3125,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14553,_binary '\0','/yFJRDGZ2We3MbwJ4ihtSKArP6Ei.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0146271',7.1,4984,'ja','四月物語','In spring, a girl leaves the island of Hokkaido to attend university in Tokyo. Once there, she is asked to reveal why she wanted to go there in the first place.','/5fwJNsGi0nolXIXTaaccUPqX84y.jpg','1998-03-14',67,'Released',NULL,'April Story',72933,3.1465,7.134,'gA_dyZ5tLRE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14554,_binary '\0','/wCPxfj8dyqz5dqFXlOHEN0lahTR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0146289',6.3,1328,'it','La stanza del vescovo','Mario, a rich and eccentric war hero befriends Marco, a loner with a sailboat, and takes him home to meet his estranged wife Cleofe and sexually repressed sister in law Matilde. Mario confesses his love for Matilde and so ensues a love triangle.','/olxTQ1JJ9yUEFFw4m4aDUloUgeJ.jpg','1977-03-18',110,'Released',NULL,'The Bishop\'s Bedroom',63071,2.4433,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14555,_binary '\0','/pR3v192B20nFtsHY1jZQS4AkN0a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0146309',7.3,65883,'en','Thirteen Days','The story of the Cuban Missile Crisis in 1962—the nuclear standoff with the USSR sparked by the discovery by the Americans of missile bases established on the Soviet-allied island of Cuba.','/aLx9UXH9fK2v6NDMvMyW4X88K3u.jpg','2000-12-25',145,'Released','You\'ll never believe how close we came.','Thirteen Days',11973,6.6144,7,'PqM102xIbIs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14556,_binary '\0','/bL41GVWvp4YJDJ50PDcxaN4cds9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0146316',5.8,231945,'en','Lara Croft: Tomb Raider','Orphaned heiress, English aristocrat and intrepid archaeologist, Lara Croft, embarks on a dangerous quest to retrieve the two halves of an ancient artifact which controls time before it falls into the wrong hands. As an extremely rare planetary alignment is about to occur for the first time in 5,000 years, the fearless tomb raider will have to team up with rival adventurers and sworn enemies to collect the pieces, while time is running out. But, in the end, who can harness the archaic talisman\'s unlimited power?','/sJpl1EfHGZhbKtZ3fWTlwrpM1tH.jpg','2001-06-15',100,'Released','Born into Wealth. Groomed by the Elite. Trained for Combat.','Lara Croft: Tomb Raider',1995,11.9975,5.915,'VlCylyAKpGA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14557,_binary '\0','/sWYtXkNr4iGDd2khTqBxtoAM555.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0146336',5.6,79291,'en','Urban Legend','A college campus is plagued by a vicious serial killer murdering students in ways that correspond to various urban legends.','/dUvZDNU9G0njhM628NA5phASntq.jpg','1998-09-25',100,'Released','What you don\'t believe can kill you.','Urban Legend',9877,7.1392,5.7,'R4d1_D90BwU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14558,_binary '\0','/hz95xUI0MhXTpRGjfnT0HkDijtV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0146402',3.9,5770,'en','Addams Family Reunion','The Addams Family goes on a search for their relatives. Gomez and Morticia are horrified to discover that Grandpa and Grandma Addams have a disease that is slowly turning them \"normal\". The only chance they have of a cure is to find a family member hoping that they know a home remedy.','/XtfNBKnLDpg1waJhDF5FAd5OEX.jpg','1998-12-23',86,'Released','Some families have all the fun.','Addams Family Reunion',11508,4.3973,4.8,'syBERPwOCZk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14559,_binary '\0','/lFkJ3ClNeNpgQrsrHOapQiSDCcC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0146425',7.1,2293,'en','Always Outnumbered','An ex-con moves to L.A. to find work and creates a disturbance by fighting for a position. More importantly he touches the lives of many of his neighbors including an older man dying of cancer, a young married couple whose husband is too proud to accept a lesser position which causes strife with his wife, and a young boy on the verge of getting in trouble with street gangs.','/p4NjziVAOO7a7tu3YTfZ3xqD2uk.jpg','1998-03-21',104,'Released','In every man\'s soul hides a hero.','Always Outnumbered',26622,1.8003,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14560,_binary '\0','/hbIb6jNrcV406uR3LbBRmVlYZ7w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0146455',7.1,6173,'en','Babylon 5: A Call to Arms','Allies of the Shadows seek revenge against humanity. This movie sets up the series, \"Crusade,\" the sequel to \"Babylon 5.\"','/dWn0TBxBOBt45cbyefRSQ6Azu9R.jpg','1999-05-12',94,'Released',NULL,'Babylon 5: A Call to Arms',10916,2.3689,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14561,_binary '\0','/l1xnDBtuJYS4qxnBCzcpsYa6fbM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0146468',7.1,3472,'es','Barrio','Bored 15-year-old school chums Rai Manu and Javi dream of sexual adventures and exotic resorts while the well-off population of Madrid flock to the beaches on a summer holiday. The youths hang around the concrete wasteland killing time by reading the sex classifieds and pushing their luck. They masturbate, thieve, fight with their families and get involved in a drug bust. Finally Rai, the most daring and restless of the trio - gets shot while trying to steal stereo gear from a car. Each adolescent faces a dreary home life but when they get together they enjoy each other\'s company to the full. The film is an engaging mixture of comedy drama and the pathos of life in a Madrid neighborhood.','/yqSE4ESOETx1OTXw9F74bPtzTl2.jpg','1998-10-02',94,'Released',NULL,'Barrio',32118,1.2918,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14562,_binary '\0','/1Uls6MYdCBBTMtUNsylFGvfyGUU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0146645',8.5,2053,'hi','दोस्ती','Mr. Gupta passes away after an accident while on duty, leaving behind his ailing wife and school-going son, Ramnath. Both await for some compensation, and when they are informed that the company does not accept liability for Gupta\'s death, his wife falls down the stairs. and passes out. When Ramnath goes to fetch a doctor, he is knocked down and run over by a speeding car, losing the use of his left leg. When he returns from hospital, he finds that his mom has passed away, and his landlord has evicted him. Penniless and hungry, he roams the streets of Bombay and befriends a blind young man, Mohan, and both use their talents - playing and harmonica and singing respectively to earn some money. Mohan is on the look-out for his sister, Meena, who works as a Nurse in one of the hospitals and hopes to be reunited with her. Both friends befriend a ailing young girl, Manjula, and hope to get some money from her so that Ramnath can attend school.','/dvpr8i6gA6elX2kWztWMZ3hZwiP.jpg','1964-03-02',163,'Released',NULL,'Dosti',172658,0.8678,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14563,_binary '\0','/oVp4NyyOqVPKrv5PBA7Sjwoh09S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0146675',5.8,123702,'en','End of Days','Cynical bodyguard Jericho is hired by a man possessed by Satan, who is in search of his bride. When Jericho realizes what is happening, he must do everything he can to save the woman and the world.','/pY8FbKKl3VD0jRI1iDFrwN6alLa.jpg','1999-11-24',122,'Released','Prepare for the end.','End of Days',9946,12.9281,6.1,'3qO3R8OlwYs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14564,_binary '\0','/o7mKLOc5NIvWLoPOAP2pVZ0NzQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0146838',6.9,132254,'en','Any Given Sunday','A star quarterback gets knocked out of the game and an unknown third stringer is called in to replace him. The unknown gives a stunning performance and forces the aging coach to reevaluate his game plans and life. A new co-owner/president adds to the pressure of winning. The new owner must prove herself in a male dominated world.','/bysZeUvSPZPJnku4qkHF34CdgMG.jpg','1999-12-22',163,'Released','Life is a contact sport.','Any Given Sunday',9563,6.6949,6.824,'cC2rkQThgX0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14565,_binary '\0','/tmP4COlAaowO0FniW30aatOcmMq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0146882',7.4,201074,'en','High Fidelity','After his long-time girlfriend dumps him, a thirty-year-old record store owner seeks to understand why he is unlucky in love while recounting his \"top five breakups of all time\".','/e2LZGB62GMhv3Fo8tDZjY87I81a.jpg','2000-03-17',113,'Released','A comedy about fear of commitment, hating your job, falling in love and other pop favorites.','High Fidelity',243,7.5931,7.13,'6P4dXJ_Tvns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14566,_binary '\0','/bwS2YrIMJp7yAb8RhuLkNVMLeyY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0146984',6.7,62822,'en','The Legend of Bagger Vance','World War I has left golfer Rannulph Junuh a poker-playing alcoholic, his perfect swing gone. Now, however, he needs to get it back to play in a tournament to save the financially ravaged golf course of a long-ago sweetheart. Help arrives in the form of mysterious caddy Bagger Vance.','/7jKjh9PZvHJYYtCycQmTbBoZVV4.jpg','2000-11-02',126,'Released','It Was Just A Moment Ago.','The Legend of Bagger Vance',4958,5.6989,6.606,'lpsF4MfeGlQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14567,_binary '\0','/2NZI1lo3xIcIW6TWgCCmSs8cxJB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0146990',6.3,1865,'en','Like It Is','A young, bare-knuckle boxer Craig moves from Blackpool to London, where he falls for a twenty-something music producer, Matt. Trouble ensues when shy, awkward Craig tries squeezing into Matt\'s glib lifestyle and Matt\'s scheming boss tries to break up the couple.','/20dQoDekwtFekePrnUkV8aHNgAD.jpg','1998-04-17',90,'Released',NULL,'Like It Is',21001,1.3272,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14568,_binary '\0','/lwluU3TYXBL4AllSxhgqRlhGEIY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0147004',7,17896,'en','Little Voice','After the death of her father, Little Voice or LV becomes a virtual recluse, never going out and hardly ever saying a word. She just sits in her bedroom listening to her father\'s collection of old records of Shirley Bassey, Marilyn Monroe and various other famous female singers. But at night time, LV sings, imitating these great singers with surprising accuracy. One night she is overheard by one of her mother\'s boyfriends, who happens to be a talent agent. He manages to convince her that her talent is special and arranges for her to perform at the local night club, but several problems arise.','/7VxdMxSa3BEAvGl5nLvsgpBwrZH.jpg','1998-11-05',97,'Released','Finding your own voice can be magic.','Little Voice',8545,2.5734,6.446,'AqTaIbDTNnE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14569,_binary '\0','/je8w3wpKtKcrRVhTkPOn0Jfmb9i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0147556',7.2,1999,'sr','Стршљен','A love story between a Serbian girl and young Albanian set against the background of current Balkanic conflict.','/zeNefuvvEua7Igc0dIpjvtUP9M9.jpg','1998-04-06',107,'Released',NULL,'The Hornet',142453,1.4875,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14570,_binary '\0','/71FY8TrpfqHEA2chmSiD5ZWrN2R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0147599',5.8,3106,'en','Thick as Thieves','Two master thieves go at odds with one another as one sets the other up for a crime. The first, a suave pro who does his job and then hides in his own privacy, listening to old jazz records and caring for his ailing dog, Wally. The other is a local gangster with a taste for the finer life, who decides to eliminate the competition. This ignites a war between the two men and their aides. An angry mob boss and a female police officer try to sort the mess before things get too out of hand.','/x9Qi1B8cMUiRg5ouFV3lqX67eRJ.jpg','1999-04-09',93,'Released','It\'s all about payback.','Thick as Thieves',67899,2.3072,6,'pVaFiOWd0Z4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14571,_binary '\0','/3AE92av4pGYx9NKKss7x5zEgEOS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0147612',7.7,80791,'en','Happiness','The lives of several individuals intertwine as they go about their lives in their own unique ways, engaging in acts which society as a whole might find disturbing in a desperate search for human connection.','/rYfUcEV88Z3gENrfYTE6i8yBkDr.jpg','1998-10-11',140,'Released','You want. He wants. She wants. But nobody wants what I want.','Happiness',10683,3.9189,7.436,'1eOzYczx-Xk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14572,_binary '\0','/yvPbncYhMu9FfTjDhq0N5lgnVkO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0147800',7.4,461373,'en','10 Things I Hate About You','On the first day at his new school, Cameron instantly falls for Bianca, the gorgeous girl of his dreams. The only problem is that Bianca is forbidden to date until her ill-tempered, completely un-dateable older sister Kat goes out, too. In an attempt to solve his problem, Cameron singles out the only guy who could possibly be a match for Kat: a mysterious bad boy with a nasty reputation of his own.','/ujERk3aKABXU3NDXOAxEQYTHe9A.jpg','1999-03-30',97,'Released','How do I loathe thee? Let me count the ways.','10 Things I Hate About You',4951,19.4787,7.598,'Ax8qnxP2TWY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14573,_binary '\0','/f0WVpizXWAkkHnn28DFqtD975QZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0147822',7.3,1413,'tr','Adı Vasfiye','The story of a provincial woman named Vasfiye, whose life passed changing hands and drifting between men in Aegean towns, is told by different narrators. The story changes every time the narrator changes. However, it is not known which story is the truth.','/y1q4XQtStEF4lV9bxD4hqcM7j9a.jpg','1985-11-03',90,'Released',NULL,'Vasfiye Is Her Name',141216,1.1542,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14574,_binary '\0','/wZKxHPuBERsKeMUQXDmNJt6NgBK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0149151',7,9388,'en','Still Crazy','In the 1970s, Strange Fruit were it. They lived the rock lifestyle to the max, groupies, drugs, internal tension and an ex front man dead from an overdose. Even their demise was glamorous; when lightning struck the stage during an outdoor festival. Twenty years on, these former rock gods they have now sunk deep into obscurity when the idea of a reunion tour is lodged in the head of Tony, former keyboard player of the Fruits. Tony sets out to find his former bandmates with the help of former manager Karen to see if they can recapture the magic and give themselves a second chance.','/o1k991eZm7iF8JUNiVdUZU44x5c.jpg','1998-10-30',95,'Released','They were \"Strange Fruit\". Some called them the greatest rock band of the \'70s. They haven\'t played together for 20 years. No wonder they\'re worried about their performance.','Still Crazy',1618,2.7892,6.9,'FADiGMfYuBI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14575,_binary '\0','/xDhqTT2CHzvyLPBb4S6WUHe4Vsw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0149171',5.5,1907,'en','Strays','Rick is frustrated by the repetitious grind of one-night stands and aimless hustling. Whilst looking for more to his life he meets Heather, a neighbour. Rick takes the opportunity to escape his boring life style with her, but soon finds that his volatile behaviour threatens to finish their relationship before it even really begins.','/ppTv3pRVoYeDBl7i2POJz26AwJA.jpg','1997-01-18',105,'Released','Life is a matador.','Strays',19083,2.4073,5.2,'-sVZ_i9jTSc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14576,_binary '\0','/bdDTda15ZPbNumwkKa9eH9RplIe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0149261',6,153167,'en','Deep Blue Sea','Researchers on the undersea lab Aquatica have genetically altered the brains of captive sharks to develop a cure for Alzheimer\'s disease. But there\'s an unexpected side effect: the sharks got smarter, faster, and more dangerous. After a big storm damages their remote research facility, they must fight for their lives.','/fyn0zyCI4kIlbDoHH0Hzv09hDC5.jpg','1999-07-28',105,'Released','Bigger. Smarter. Faster. Meaner.','Deep Blue Sea',8914,11.892,6.002,'NPVFybrhHnc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14577,_binary '\0','/pXmdznbuyQRURgL3T8MypyBgQqY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0149291',7.6,4446,'sr','Tri palme za dve bitange i ribicu','The story takes place in 1993 Serbia, torn by hyperinflation and economic disaster. Milan, an avid fan of FC Partizan, lives with his friend, a painter, and makes money by selling his paintings to the \"new elite\". He meets a nice girl who works a phone sex hot line and the two eventually fall in love. An another friend so his is a treasury guard in a bank governed by a shady lady known as \"Serbian mother\", notorious for cheating the thousands of creditors. The couple is planning to rob the bank and run away to a remote sunny island with palms.','/4sCpXrc2PDLYZ0lijdxhuyAdHq3.jpg','1998-04-02',103,'Released',NULL,'Three Palms for Two Punks and a Babe',109576,1.1396,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14578,_binary '\0','/9KEMuH2H3eqSvr8bjZikYOUePpt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0149367',6.3,6847,'en','Where the Money Is','Henry Manning has come up with a new way to break out of prison: fake a stroke and get transferred to a nursing home. It\'s a perfect plan, except for one thing: the woman assigned to take care of him at the nursing home, Carol Ann McKay, has a plan of her own.','/s6FODEWgJ9XDwKunGLWEmexguUs.jpg','2000-04-14',89,'Released','Another con. Another sting. Another day.','Where the Money Is',31776,3.2362,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14579,_binary '\0','/qmG0Oz0QAubKIivX99nFmdA9SK6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0149568',5.4,2177,'hi','आ अब लौट चलें','An ambitious, unemployed youth goes to the US to find a job and gets caught in a love triangle between Pooja and Loveleen. However, he soon realises that he loves Pooja and reconciles with her.','/w87ziVrS9aWGW3WvDU6VJb2jXDQ.jpg','1999-01-22',178,'Released','with love..Rishi Kapoor','Aa ab Laut Chalen',75253,1.125,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14580,_binary '\0','/97s3czqmBGIyDvOH023oVLfYr4M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0149573',6.3,2342,'hi','आशिकी','Rahul and Anu Verghese meet on the same day, while both are held by the police on charges of creating a disturbance, and running away respectively. They meet again, and love happens. Rahul helps Anu to be independent, and seek a job. Then Anu is discovered by a talent agent to be a model, which she accepts. Rahul wants to marry Anu, but first must establish himself.','/4we2et0iMkYGYCV3xS6bhTHI55.jpg','1990-07-23',152,'Released',NULL,'Aashiqui',34369,1.3593,5.569,'aMZq0Z-3FMI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14581,_binary '\0','/c6XO2PBkt2jQcZIOj43iFMe1Se3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0149601',7.6,12908,'tr','Ağır Roman','Salih is a mechanic and the son of a respected barber named Ali. A woman named Tina arrives at Cholera Street, where she takes up residence and works as a prostitute.','/gi4a0N7liZflqYj2fQCe3Mgn30g.jpg','1997-11-28',114,'Released',NULL,'Cholera Street',34529,2.7699,6.811,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14582,_binary '\0','/7U6WJ0qri2sACtcGa0wEpM9eAM1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0149624',5.8,15277,'en','All the Pretty Horses','The year is 1949. A young Texan named John Grady finds himself without a home after his mother sells the ranch where he has spent his entire life. Lured south of the border by the romance of cowboy life and the promise of a fresh start, Cole and his pal embark on an adventure that will test their resilience, define their maturity, and change their lives forever.','/6E4E7wYXw1DE2321F2hVNryLSk7.jpg','2000-12-11',117,'Released','Some passions can never be tamed.','All the Pretty Horses',21355,5.2621,5.7,'yygkQ8SjjQk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14583,_binary '\0','/n03FL1Ia88Jq2nV7fz4AJE9utw0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0149691',6.2,19609,'en','Anywhere but Here','Single mother Adele August is bad with money, and even worse when it comes to making decisions. Her straight-laced daughter, Ann, is a successful high school student with Ivy League aspirations. When Adele decides to pack up and move the two of them from the Midwest to Beverly Hills, Calif., to pursue her dreams of Hollywood success, Ann grows frustrated with her mother\'s irresponsible and impulsive ways.','/2DNtxmXkotuaJexU57geTLIPnQf.jpg','1999-11-12',114,'Released','A story of a mother who knows best... and a daughter who knows better.','Anywhere but Here',21349,5.397,6.081,'lv0i_9eoUoI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14584,_binary '\0','/r9843pYwbf2NtyeJfqnlra19cTt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0149723',6.8,5447,'it','L\'assedio','While in exile in Italy, an African woman finds herself trying to get back home and free her imprisoned husband. But the only man that can help her do so is in love with her.','/ZV18CMRVkUT119mmkGCz6mj6AD.jpg','1998-02-05',93,'Released','Touched by Genius. Cursed by Madness. Blinded by Love.','Besieged',44297,1.8816,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14585,_binary '\0','/vXDp0vnHSP9tZO9gZta7VD1OZ2J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0149898',5.2,1321,'en','Black & White','Chris O\'Brien, devote Catholic and rookie cop with LAPD, is assigned to partner with the hard-edged, street-smart Nora Hugosian. A serial killer is loose, and all the victims are low-life guys whom Nora has dealt with. So, when the tire tracks of a police car are found at a murder scene, she\'s the prime suspect of internal affairs investigator Simon Hertzel...','/nyfIYhT8NUDdZtW8Qq2un4K7Ze0.jpg','1999-11-29',97,'Released','If you can\'t trust your partner, who can you trust?','Black & White',66166,1.6209,5.4,'PmzjymtCMQc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14586,_binary '\0','/7ctMokt9Mhvcwo2CQMUZYsCvJCy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0150021',4.6,2472,'en','Camouflage','Marty Mackenzie is an unsuccessful stage actor who takes an interest in private investigating. He takes a job working with Jack Potter, a crusty private eye. They both take a case in Beaver Ridge, a seedy small town where a murder is being planned against a rich gravel pit owner. Marty realizes that private investigating is not as it seemed to be.','/ngubWu6cemohJlPKKEvBRtsRzed.jpg','2001-01-09',96,'Released',NULL,'Camouflage',56085,2.4248,4.4,'3Kx4DeujRmQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14587,_binary '\0','/yEqJQSFCuUqQhFbpLIybegL4UZ9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0150143',6.7,1498,'en','Claire Dolan','A high-priced call girl, shocked by her mother\'s death, decides to get out of the business and have a baby.','/3tTruxVJkXSgm0SdZhu7fTJZFZo.jpg','1998-11-18',95,'Released',NULL,'Claire Dolan',47186,2.357,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14588,_binary '\0','/hbz8S3w8npB5jBpy6i63nUnGJMx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0150176',4.4,2039,'en','Coming Soon','Privileged teenage friends Jenny, Nell and Stream spend their senior year on a quest to rid Stream of her virginity. However, Stream wants more than just her first sexual experience. She wants to have an orgasm -- but achieving this proves problematic, as the boys she meets are hardly sensitive enough to provide her the release she seeks. When it becomes clear that Nell and Jenny have never experienced an orgasm either, all three set out to get one.','/nd3sDcYh7pn7FNaOPvearItL2Yr.jpg','1999-06-08',95,'Released','It\'s All About Feeling Good.','Coming Soon',25896,2.678,5.6,'YemgKXmymxM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14589,_binary '\0','/9cKpfklF4CgMiNMOk53yDzfzF3q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0150216',6.7,9865,'en','Cradle Will Rock','A true story of politics and art in the 1930s USA, centered around a leftist musical drama and attempts to stop its production.','/d8LJWY8kaAIlfMiQLOGglL8VqVT.jpg','1999-12-10',132,'Released','Art is never dangerous... unless it tells the truth.','Cradle Will Rock',32274,3.5178,6.539,'89dGJ_hx8-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14590,_binary '\0','/368xRO16FSMiiHBviiQ7wTPHxxu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0150230',7.5,2098,'en','The Cruise','Affectionate portrait of Timothy \"Speed\" Levitch, a tour guide for Manhattan\'s Gray Line double-decker buses.','/aTPN6ttUQqkqV6ZT762Ihc8hwKi.jpg','1998-10-23',76,'Released',NULL,'The Cruise',32326,0.8582,7,'8HWaHBaqajk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14591,_binary '\0','/hVv9yoyYCPt3f6D1U3GbJqqP9iN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0150338',7.7,1262,'en','Divine Trash','The life and times of Baltimore film maker and midnight movie pioneer, John Waters.','/uaPcuUP9QxyKRtdGtE6IlG4JLqp.jpg','2000-03-31',97,'Released',NULL,'Divine Trash',53380,1.4411,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14592,_binary '\0','/fk4NXhazfRKtQaVEV9IPeM7OIVH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0150377',6.6,106935,'en','Double Jeopardy','Libby Parsons, wrongly convicted of her husband Nick\'s murder, thinks he is still alive. She survives the long years in prison with two burning desires sustaining her -- finding her son and solving the mystery that destroyed her once-happy life. Standing between her and her quest, however, is her parole officer, Travis Lehman. Libby poses a challenge to the cynical officer, one that forces him to face up to his own failings while pitting him against his superior and law enforcement colleagues, as she plunges into a desperate fight for justice, survival, and revenge.','/dPd9QvEeMQpgHO6iLB1LqALTZl.jpg','1999-09-24',105,'Released','Murder isn\'t always a crime.','Double Jeopardy',10398,11.325,6.6,'u22fy9OTaxo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14593,_binary '\0','/ygTBp6GDxpXNtur57iOmTFQXMe8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0150433',7.6,8456,'hi','1947: Earth','In 1947, the borderlines between India and Pakistan are being drawn. A young girl bears witnesses to tragedy as her ayah is caught between the love of two men and the rising tide of political and religious violence.','/hQtvQYlxfEHl45TR41lNSywrq4K.jpg','1998-09-16',101,'Released',NULL,'Earth',7504,1.4398,6.568,'ELwZ2N2dIoA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14594,_binary '\0','/7TjeFeYpwMqI9Q2o69IcZrQoUK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0150662',7.5,58319,'sv','Fucking Åmål','Two teenage girls in small-town Sweden. Elin is beautiful, popular, and bored with life. Agnes is friendless, sad, and secretly in love with Elin.','/ek5fMfwGVTyQ0N0VXBT1VWqan3U.jpg','1998-10-23',89,'Released','I\'d rather be happy now than in 25 years.','Show Me Love',11634,3.2943,7.072,'J54QQl0U_e0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14595,_binary '\0','/qsd6A8m6VgjqlnHrTIYpPrpLh2J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0150912',7,1296,'ro','Liceenii: Rock \'n\' Roll','The adventures of high schoolers, including strict maths teachers, rock \'n\' roll music, and first love experiences.','/oaKjUYhlAw8ogzFB9rAf8IvHl5i.jpg','1991-04-08',98,'Released',NULL,'High Schoolers: Rock \'n\' Roll',442957,1.2659,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14596,_binary '\0','/4t9HIVEY6gknmNTAM23rzL1yEyv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0150915',7.3,11348,'en','Hilary and Jackie','The tragic story of world-renowned cellist Jacqueline du Pré, as told from the point of view of her sister, flautist Hilary du Pré-Finzi.','/aE2NJH2sllQTmbpN6laKuM7NXYy.jpg','1998-12-30',121,'Released','The true story of two sisters who shared a passion, a madness, and a man.','Hilary and Jackie',46992,3.2988,6.6,'VoPV-8ZBF-8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14597,_binary '\0','/zJCH92pdBjUJ5x2ZpeZQHzYAHEn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0150918',6.9,1449,'de','Hinterholz 8','Herbert Krcal (Roland Düringer) and his wife Margit (Nina Proll) dream of owning a home. They prefer to do this in the \"Blue Lagoon\", a prefabricated house park in the south of Vienna, where they regularly go on pilgrimage with their son Philipp. Just as regularly, they have to recognize the bitter truth that they cannot actually afford the dream house they have visited.','/2mXXl6PLpDHKsTrp59V0eQpz8GQ.jpg','1998-09-18',105,'Released',NULL,'Hinterholz 8',38005,1.003,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14598,_binary '\0','/5NfLEeakUxT0JcU9Q830niu2w8e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0150980',7.2,6785,'ko','하녀','A piano composer\'s family moves into a new house; when his pregnant wife collapses from working to support the family, he hires a housemaid to help with housework.','/fFRG3soeb7ceKjWoXu4EFDc8grO.jpg','1960-11-03',112,'Released','Do you have mine too?','The Housemaid',42506,2.4064,7.106,'WsShIXZrJvA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14599,_binary '\0','/wEOnz2zzrc8XP3mXs6Ud64EuTWu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0150992',7.4,21212,'hi','हम दिल दे चुके सनम','A newly-wed man discovers that his wife is in love with another man and decides to unite them. Ignoring the ridicule he might have to face for this, he takes his wife to Italy in search of her love.','/fqCtf7bkOLJ9mrHWcNH4CWWbJFp.jpg','1999-06-18',178,'Released','Straight from the heart...','Hum Dil De Chuke Sanam',5319,2.1924,6.4,'UIYW8IZ89rQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14600,_binary '\0','/3e7gmIqphokqp0lagkKEpDybSFX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0151035',7.6,1485,'ka','იყო შაშვი მგალობელი','Gia is a carefree young percussionist who works at a theater in Tbilisi, capital of Georgia. He lives in a small apartment with his mother. Gia spends his days flitting from friend to friend, lover to lover, avoiding any responsibility, and never staying still for five minutes. However, he always manages to arrive at the theater just in time to play the drums at the end of the ballet.','/vw5f9rlJCoFWQPQ4ooKYSTJl4zw.jpg','1970-12-06',78,'Released',NULL,'There Once Was a Singing Blackbird',83235,1.4456,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14601,_binary '\0','/fQZXSRTvK2vd8WMOhP6VrjWPPdD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0151121',6.5,4416,'ta','ஜீன்ஸ்','The father of twin brothers wants to get them married to only twin sisters. But one of the brothers falls in love with a woman does not have a twin sister.','/uICyDD1FuQIjAm0M0gL6wq5RgPZ.jpg','1998-04-24',175,'Released','100% Love, 0% Cotton!','Jeans',30086,1.672,6.28,'DZOfzU6pYmM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14602,_binary '\0','/iW2ZLRkKJvFuI6ZkSchk5f8kCPc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0151137',6.4,73676,'en','Joan of Arc','In 1429, a French teenager stood before her King with a message she claimed came from God; that she would defeat the world\'s greatest army and liberate her country from its political and religious turmoil. As she reclaims God\'s diminished kingdom, this courageous young woman has various amazing victories until her violent and untimely death.','/lFzOGA2LPdOfQyhEiY74uDf2WKa.jpg','1999-10-27',158,'Released',NULL,'The Messenger: The Story of Joan of Arc',10047,9.145,6.424,'aCbMOQIs45s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14603,_binary '\0','/moKRFO2pjDfMjEYDiS2QBqItWEL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0151150',6.1,11929,'hi','जोश','Two gangs fight for control of the streets: the Scorpions, led by Prakash and the Eagles, fronted by Max. When Prakash\'s brother Rahul comes to visit, he meets and quickly falls in love with Shirley, not realizing she\'s the sister of his brother\'s rival, Max. Though Rahul tries to keep their relationship secret, it\'s only a matter of time before it brings the gang rivalry to a head.','/epulB8WC1mGIEFJPZr50LVCKt6k.jpg','2000-06-09',157,'Released','Full of life','Josh',131940,1.8309,6.012,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14604,_binary '\0','/38t18T9uLSnJkPTR3u91uXLd0bK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0151206',6.6,1393,'hi','खून भरी माँग','Aarti, a homely but wealthy widow, is the unwitting target of a scheme to divest her of her family, fortune and life. Her father is killed by one of his workers. The worker\'s nephew Sanjay woos her and weds her, then tosses her into a crocodile-filled lake with the goal of inheriting his dead wife\'s riches. Aarti lives, has plastic surgery that transforms her into a beauty and plots her revenge.','/qI1lglqzP0y1lSG9z9Ly9smpD8u.jpg','1988-09-08',146,'Released',NULL,'Khoon Bhari Maang',124595,1.2419,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14605,_binary '\0','/zEJkztwsYHMoZFkCOzORGDovGcn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0151239',5.1,2883,'en','Kolobos','Five young individuals agree to live in an isolated lodge together and have their daily activities filmed. But soon the house is locked down and they each run into the murderous clutches of a faceless serial killer who may not be working alone.','/vz71EgLOHD7j2SgMdGVrz9d3bfM.jpg','1999-09-28',84,'Released','Scream... You\'re On TV','Kolobos',40129,2.1465,5,'QPXml_BIr40','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14606,_binary '\0','/taOj7lSsCsaUjicddcV8nDUPAYz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0151479',7.7,2636,'ro','Terminus paradis','Mitu and Elena get to know each other in the course of a vodka drinking contest and discover that they are both dissatisfied with the status quo. Mitu is about to begin military service and Elena is to be married to a man she does not love. They decide they are meant for each other and plan on a different future, one that is on a collision course with the authorities, and start a mad affair.','/rGafgpADv9enlhEenp3r48Ya7Jp.jpg','1998-09-01',99,'Released',NULL,'Next Stop Paradise',123707,1.0772,6.7,'77MJcAi0dn0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14607,_binary '\0','/vuB822fEemGIv5CXhd05OVFiroI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0151568',7.3,14353,'en','Topsy-Turvy','For nearly a decade, Gilbert and Sullivan’s collaborations have delighted the English people. But in 1884, as a London heat wave cuts into the theater trade, their latest work, \"Princess Ida\", receives lukewarm press. In an effort to reconcile their creative differences and drawing inspiration from Japanese culture, they went on to create the hit opera \"The Mikado\", one of the duo\'s greatest successes.','/nxHjVAVOFgWbD2RptBBCLVO6SIR.jpg','1999-12-15',160,'Released','Gilbert & Sullivan & So Much More','Topsy-Turvy',46435,3.3927,6.6,'BWFcMRYjJtA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14608,_binary '\0','/hNyPB1vdp3FKRzdIIs6qJUJg9Ht.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0151572',7.1,4605,'es','El milagro de P. Tinto','Wafer factory-owner P. Tinto and his wife Olivia want a child of their own more than anything else in the world. Years of trying, however, have left them with nothing but a pair of extraterrestrial midgets living in the spare bedroom. When they decide to try adoption, a series of misroutings and chance encounters results in an escaped adult mental patient arriving at their door with adoption papers in hand. P. Tinto and Olivia accept this without question and welcome him in as their son. Can this family arrangement work?','/rcADIJ08E0m95gI1BZGN7ZjJqxg.jpg','1998-12-18',102,'Released',NULL,'The Miracle of P. Tinto',30145,1.6837,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14609,_binary '\0','/3rVtoCyClDZh6vt7tRUBWVoIOnR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0151582',6,7886,'en','The Minus Man','When the quiet and amiable Vann Siegert drifts into town, no one suspects the evil that lies beneath the surface. Despite his easy charm, Vann is merely a reflection of what those he encounters want him to be. Soon, as locals start to disappear, it becomes clear that an eerie subtraction is at work in the sleepy hamlet.','/xrui0mDUWY3poirLrjHtoOU1rGA.jpg','1999-09-24',111,'Released','Keep your eyes open for anything too ordinary.','The Minus Man',21719,2.943,5.5,'YxDE_I6V3So','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14610,_binary '\0','/1Fi9ltooVTygW8x9Uo7gmmOa5C1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0151683',6.3,4968,'en','My Date with the President\'s Daughter','Duncan is just an ordinary high school student. Hallie dreams of an ordinary life, but is actually the daughter of the president of the United States, living with a high profile and a rigid schedule. The unlikely pair happen to meet at the local mall, and Duncan nervously asks Hallie out, unaware of her family situation. When their eventual date is ruined by the intrusive Secret Service, the young lovebirds cut loose for a night of mischief.','/9at6NYvT5Z6jZRS27ZrCGPCM54c.jpg','1998-04-19',93,'Released','She\'s five minutes late, alert the National Guard.','My Date with the President\'s Daughter',32195,2.3899,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14611,_binary '\0','/7HS8YSbD37UvS3XABBjOnKKsbc5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0151691',7.4,9402,'en','My Name Is Joe','Two thirtysomethings, unemployed former alcoholic Joe and community health worker Sarah, start a romantic relationship in one of the toughest Glasgow neighbourhoods.','/3qUWbQjtNQFX26QOENPIkck9KOJ.jpg','1998-05-15',105,'Released',NULL,'My Name Is Joe',8129,2.2408,7.252,'Vog33PwornI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14612,_binary '\0','/1wwvDbEHnM9RR8lM2e0dslWkb8N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0151734',6.6,1645,'en','Excellent Cadavers','Palermo, Sicily, 1984. Examining magistrate Giovanni Falcone allies with Tomasso Buscetta, a former mobster, to defeat the clan of Corleone, the ruthless Mafia faction that rules Cosa Nostra with an iron hand, cruelly eliminating all those who dare to oppose its immense power: other criminals, policemen, judges, even innocent civilians. One of them wants revenge, the other wants justice. But only one can survive such an unequal fight.','/4PGKekbYuushvovzHCEl4X51sfl.jpg','1999-10-16',102,'Released','Sicily. A land blessed by God, and cursed by man.','Excellent Cadavers',19189,2.3184,6.286,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14613,_binary '\0','/vNdulTZXaL11xFs7FWCnxEE7wqR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0151738',6,103898,'en','Never Been Kissed','Josie Geller, a baby-faced junior copywriter at the Chicago Sun-Times, must pose as a student at her former high school to research contemporary teenage culture. With the help of her brother, Rob, Josie infiltrates the inner circle of the most popular clique on campus. But she hits a major snag in her investigation -- not to mention her own failed love life -- when she falls for her dreamy English teacher, Sam Coulson.','/6BngDhDNfbBjhVFWDT2yMve32vi.jpg','1999-04-09',107,'Released','Some things are worth waiting for.','Never Been Kissed',11355,8.2837,6.164,'xPyMf4ROt3Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14614,_binary '\0','/g7o5O6xRWkMiwHXiYMPC690YEL4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0151804',7.6,311769,'en','Office Space','A depressed white-collar worker tries hypnotherapy, only to find himself in a perpetual state of devil-may-care bliss that prompts him to start living by his own rules, and hatch a hapless attempt to embezzle money from his soul-killing employers.','/iEmTwOkUaLziMQCUZii5wPQBIAO.jpg','1999-02-19',90,'Released','Work sucks.','Office Space',1542,9.3465,7.387,'3_fG_zLbBeU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14615,_binary '\0','/1GLqS5pRl3xpgrPjrIkFpQZH1IZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0152015',5.7,5751,'fr','Pola X','A writer leaves his upper-class life and journeys with a woman claiming to be his sister, and her two friends.','/gTmZlEoH03sNtaNeYbboB7vgn5j.jpg','1999-05-12',134,'Released','An erotically charged descent into madness.','Pola X',35717,2.9034,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14616,_binary '\0','/58urVpxmJWN5Af3dTQ5DcrwZjK2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0152073',7.2,1257,'cs','Princezna se zlatou hvězdou','A Czech fairy tale about a princess named Lada who runs away from home in a mouse fur disguise in order to escape an unwanted and forced marriage.','/v2KS2n4uqgBMUhfVl4SozRgerWN.jpg','1959-12-18',80,'Released',NULL,'The Princess with the Golden Star',51959,1.8763,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14617,_binary '\0','/5NKhecZAU5hda6WVeQgu5J9Lulr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0152139',6.5,1313,'hi','Ram Teri Ganga Maili','Ganga Singh lives near Gangotri with her brother, Karam. One day she comes to the assistance of a young man, Narendra Sahay, who has come with a group of Calcutta-based college students to study the source of the holy river Ganga, and to get some holy water for his wheelchair-bound paternal grandma. Both are attracted to each other, and on the next Puran Mashi get married, and spend the night in close intimacy. Narendra leaves, but promises Ganga that he will be back soon. Months go by, but he does not return. She gives birth to a son, and as soon she is able to, she starts her journey to Alipor, Calcutta, to confront Narendra and ensure a better future for their son.','/gTE72sR6uP0IX3dB9q0aT4FnotL.jpg','1985-08-16',178,'Released',NULL,'Ram Teri Ganga Maili',173735,1.7036,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14618,_binary '\0','/5gUlDj9hGXbdUiWc6H3aeRLlUIK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0152438',6.9,2131,'fa','سکوت','Khorshid, a blind child growing up in Tajikistan, is constantly distracted by music and sounds. This frequently causes him to be late to his job as an instrument tuner even though he runs the risk of being fired at a time when his family is in danger of being evicted from their house.','/eBnuAC7m553JfQUQS5Z03y1dMaB.jpg','1998-12-04',76,'Released',NULL,'The Silence',43974,1.5272,6.4,'JaqYSgjUXAg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14619,_binary '\0','/amHXl0gpzMyYdUxpvHXEhKyOW3m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0152836',6.7,6559,'hi','ताल','Businessman Manav falls for aspiring singer, Mansi, but their romance faces an uphill climb when Manav must depart and Mansi\'s suave manager moves in.','/n2VsCd4wPIEMTWQBxBJVKVAOeTk.jpg','1999-08-13',177,'Released','Don\'t fall .. rise in love.','Taal',20929,1.5622,6.609,'evt-UsQGJCE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14620,_binary '\0','/nmGgqRzbb0OHJloknzlorUzUVQo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0152930',7,96337,'fr','Taxi','In Marseilles a skilled pizza delivery boy Daniel who drives a scooter finally has his dreams come true. He gets a taxi license. Caught by the police for a huge speed infraction, he will help Emilien, a loser inspector who can\'t drive, on the track of German bank robbers, so he doesn\'t lose his license and his dream job.','/egBxj3ude84theXc3cLbBHrWOkQ.jpg','1998-04-08',86,'Released',NULL,'Taxi',2330,9.0338,6.7,'qYBNjVnbtFg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14621,_binary '\0','/uiHNhtfNBjwDAoz5UdMbGTzseCm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0153032',6.3,1757,'en','This Year\'s Love','The big-screen debut from Scottish stage director David Kane, This Year\'s Love is a comedy about the romantic misadventures of six young people in Camden, North London. The marriage of tattoo artist Danny (Douglas Hanshall) and dressmaker Hannah (Catherine McCormack) gets off to a less-than-inspiring start when Danny finds out Hannah has already been fooling around with a friend\'s husband, so Danny takes a walk and Hannah splits with a friend to get drunk. At the airport, where the newly-weds were supposed to leave for a honeymoon, Danny meets a cleaning woman named Mary (Kathy Burke) and is immediately infatuated, while Hannah is picked up by a scruffy artist named Cameron (Dougray Scott). Elsewhere, Liam (Ian Hart), a geeky comic-art enthusiast who shares an apartment with Cameron, finds romance with Sophie (Jennifer Ehle), a single mother and full-time neurotic.','/atEvEcTytE2mnlhjPvxVHmIz77I.jpg','1999-02-19',108,'Released','Your pad or mine?','This Year\'s Love',38647,2.2395,5.4,'hE4AY_7TR3g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14622,_binary '\0','/kOLz2b2s6K73twG2AlrPRV2ynNj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0153464',6,2989,'en','Up at the Villa','Superficial people are revealed and drastically changed by circumstance or luck in this a tale of death, seduction, blackmail and theft among British and Americans in Florence in the turbulent days just before World War II.','/hkjBOhbNVCk6zbnC8Xo1cNYMmuA.jpg','2000-04-14',115,'Released',NULL,'Up at the Villa',47724,2.4251,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14623,_binary '\0','/Zr6SIvP7yAgOBC5nsgRD8qAlnR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0153489',7.8,2301,'ru','Вам и не снилось','Two high school kids meet in class and fall madly in love with each other. Unfortunately, His father and her mother had a history of their own between them which creates uneasiness in both of them. Also because of that, the boy\'s mother is very jealous and tries to separate them. The only person that tries to help them is their teacher who has relationship problems of her own.','/hjR7d5I73L01xHaIIUISEAREAST.jpg','1981-03-23',90,'Released',NULL,'Could One Imagine?',64765,1.6141,7.121,'IivpyjnD-Dw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14624,_binary '\0','/7Sski7g80nDYcd1tpVHA3CknyS1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0153882',6.7,1824,'en','Witness to the Mob','Sammy \'The Bull\' Gravano was mafiosi. He started out as a soldier, but his talent for murder, including the slayings of his best friends, his wife\'s brother and his own boss, Paul Castellano, saw him rise to under-boss in the Gambino crime family. However, betrayals within the family saw him break the code of silence and became the highest ranking member of the mob to turn into a rat - \'a rat in a suit,- assisting the government to finally put away the Teflon Don, John Gotti.','/niX9b5Sew9GxXML09Wl5o6gLcT7.jpg','1998-05-10',124,'Released','The story of the man who betrayed John Gotti and became a...Witness to the Mob','Witness to the Mob',64920,2.3374,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14625,_binary '\0','/nKJlu3R8oTEotQSUH8yJcGvfSxF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0154129',5.8,1500,'en','Cartoon All-Stars to the Rescue','The plot chronicles the exploits of Michael, a teenager who is using marijuana and stealing his father\'s beer. His younger sister, Corey, is worried about him because he started acting differently. When her piggy bank goes missing, her cartoon tie-in toys come to life to help her find it. After discovering it in Michael\'s room along with his stash of drugs, the various cartoon characters proceed to work together and take him on a fantasy journey to teach him the risks and consequences a life of drug-use can bring and save the world.','/9fF73VGKlJ8OY0pAIIPf8EKymi7.jpg','1990-04-21',26,'Released','Drugs don\'t stand a chance against these guys!','Cartoon All-Stars to the Rescue',32638,2.3992,6.2,'WSv-olhnbh0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14626,_binary '\0','/vMyxt6MsLYiGeKfZnD4iDyrU6rm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0154183',4.5,1292,'hi','Awwal Number','India has lost two of the three one day internationals against Australia, and have lost all hope of winning the three-test series, mostly due to the dismal performance of the arrogant Cricket Captain, Ranvir Singh alias Ronny, who is also the brother of the Chair of the Cricket Selection Committee. This Committee decides to have a new-comer named Sunny in place of Ronny, which leaves an embittered Ronny, swearing to kill Sunny at any cost. The third match is being planned in the Wankhede Stadium in Bombay, and a group of terrorists announces that they will blow the stadium up with the estimated 50,000 spectators, unless and until the Indian army withdraws it\'s peace-keeping force in the region. The Chair of the Selection Committee takes control as the Director General of Police; launches an investigation; and does arrest the culprits, who have been employed with the Stadium for many years...','/mh5SmoFFu7hnFKEXJLWxWR5CkkY.jpg','1990-05-11',138,'Released',NULL,'Awwal Number',159645,1.0278,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14627,_binary '\0','/yCtgdv7TfgZLHj6R9IQKD5TjljP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0154420',8,100806,'da','Festen','The family of a wealthy businessman gather to celebrate his 60th birthday. During the course of the party, his eldest son presents a speech that reveals a devastating secret that turns the night into a battle of truth and denial.','/2LRzNq41yrY8EjCnD1S8sCCPvKk.jpg','1998-06-19',101,'Released','Every family has a secret.','The Celebration',309,4.6128,7.7,'XCqc_JTiNxg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14628,_binary '\0','/7yJvYCJzPWuqBDR0Eplh3NbnR9h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0154421',6.7,36374,'da','Idioterne','A group of perfectly intelligent young people decide to react to society\'s cult of aimless, non-creative and non-responsible form intellect by living together in a community of \'idiots\'. Their primary activity becomes going out into the world of \'normal\' people and pretending to be mentally incompetent. They take advantage of this situation to create anarchy, and, by every possible means, to make those around them miserable.','/dZUgHe2XH8egBFerMC6yLoqUqii.jpg','1998-05-20',110,'Released','Take a long ride on the short bus.','The Idiots',452,4.6904,6.467,'QbF80Gu80-4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14629,_binary '\0','/yz5DUdhiMr0gpFj97PRFEzwI2Nv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0154443',5.6,4398,'en','8 ½ Women','After his wife dies, middle-aged businessman Philip Emmenthal, at the prompting of his playboy son Storey, populates his Geneva villa with eight-and-a-half concubines. Three are from Kyoto, where Storey manages Pachinco palaces. Each has a distinctive personality: a nun, a child bearer, a gambler, a student of Kabuki, a horsewoman with a pet pig, a maid. As a year passes, the women begin asserting their own power.','/t7G0SA8cqrsu7XzzTL0ge54aw7L.jpg','1999-05-22',121,'Released','If every man thinks of sex once every nine minutes, what does he think of the other eight?','8 ½ Women',11332,3.032,5.5,'X9GCQE-SZbA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14630,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0154467',6.6,1788,'en','Evidence of Blood','When a brilliant crime writer investigates a 40-year-old murder, he confronts a small town\'s worst fears.','/u9bsNTCzSfQuUfkHbL4ojIaAlJB.jpg','1998-04-13',109,'Released','Between the past and present lies a terrifying secret','Evidence of Blood',278822,1.7615,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14631,_binary '\0','/yf5I5VHllK4h5VdbxHfQ40RBTe8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0154506',7.4,114424,'en','Following','Bill, an idle, unemployed aspiring writer, walks the crowded streets of London following randomly chosen strangers, a seemingly innocent entertainment that becomes dangerous when he crosses paths with a mysterious character.','/3bX6VVSMf0dvzk5pMT4ALG5A92d.jpg','1999-04-02',69,'Released','You\'re never alone.','Following',11660,5.164,7.1,'62TTN6gD2So','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14632,_binary '\0','/vWW5SV6ubEO4Od8F2qC8G6yl9cy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0154587',6.5,1424,'en','Hey There, It\'s Yogi Bear!','Following a misunderstanding about Yogi Bear’s whereabouts, Cindy Bear ends up in captivity at a Missouri circus. It’s now up to Yogi and his friend, Boo-Boo, to save her.','/x8ZBi9rdjl0zTgC4O4aWdPNK05s.jpg','1964-06-03',89,'Released','HEY THERE! Here\'s a whole NEW world of wonderful entertainment just for YOU...and YOU...and YOU!','Hey There, It\'s Yogi Bear!',33037,2.4213,6.5,'nPHElcXVgA8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14633,_binary '\0','/4ZVAAGCGDYncbZhjEgnfU1v2iQD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0154683',6.7,5113,'ja','地獄','A group of sinners involved in interconnected tales of murder, revenge, deceit and adultery all meet at the Gates of Hell.','/ehiMOuKE7i9WHgvs7dSIZelsHwA.jpg','1960-07-30',99,'Released',NULL,'Jigoku',50173,1.8306,6.3,'vQ13Z-cXfuI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14634,_binary '\0','/j0HQARVcGbtZj0Emx1pw9ehAUgs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0155124',8.6,2203,'te','రుద్రవీణ','Suryam is the son of a great musician who wishes to change society through his music but his conservative father does not like his ways causing Suryam to leave home and fight his battle alone.','/eJrcSDsXmHrazUeQfCluZLqd0uT.jpg','1988-03-04',170,'Released',NULL,'Rudraveena',66342,0.9645,7.333,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14635,_binary '\0','/eolWmaxbTyIfmRxHYCJaklF9DCi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0155157',6.7,1593,'fr','Serial Lover','Claire Doste is about to reach the age of 35 and has everything one dreams of, such as having four boyfriends and a creative job in a publishing house specialising in crime novels. One day, she invites all of her boyfriends to her birthday dinner so that she can pick out her would-be fiancé. But an accident happens when Claire is getting the dinner ready.','/xUkaotxtg3xRt3JoS0O49qepXPd.jpg','1998-04-22',83,'Released',NULL,'Serial Lover',4282,2.3854,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14636,_binary '\0','/uycElQXtwMo5dRpiy8Ji9wIbZuJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0155197',6,1979,'en','Speedway Junky','A naive drifter runs away from his army father in hopes of making it on the car racing circuit. In Las Vegas, he meets a young scam artist, who develops a crush on him. He is then introduced to a whole gang led by a young hustler. The racer-to-be then gets a lesson in the wild side, getting involved in one situation after another.','/tk5Y7CIC9B4a2mXx8pOB1wJJwHN.jpg','1999-02-11',104,'Released','There\'s no place for dreams on the streets of Vegas','Speedway Junky',46727,1.8719,5.4,'TgfYbwYoFU4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14637,_binary '\0','/3wkLwmPhBkzlDb958Ir3CzNnvtP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0155265',8.5,4130,'ta','தில்லு முல்லு','Chandran lies to his boss that his mother is unwell to get a leave but gets caught. In order to save his job, he is forced to pretend to his boss that he has a good-for-nothing twin brother.','/9ECMeSTG2Qdi2PpjgGcvlgLpP8T.jpg','1981-05-01',145,'Released',NULL,'Thillu Mullu',66402,1.0493,7.026,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14638,_binary '\0','/iDGfPcu2CV66BCRk31uOcfB3IvU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0155267',6.9,110922,'en','The Thomas Crown Affair','Bored billionaire executive Thomas Crown decides to plan a robbery and assigns a professional agent with the right information to the job. However, Crown is soon betrayed yet cannot blow his cover as he’s fallen in love.','/5yqs1MVlqdIg1DY5adC5jFx3d7j.jpg','1999-08-06',113,'Released','How do you get the man who has everything?','The Thomas Crown Affair',913,9.5969,6.757,'XSGTgwGsP1U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14639,_binary '\0','/cmVocTAP4MK1kk2uGSffheEH96s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0155278',7,2267,'ja','東海道四谷怪談','This horror tale adapts the Japanese legend about a man who faces the consequences of betraying his wife in order to acquire wealth and power.','/zq6QafbuTLkW6tSxkKbIF90F7Dr.jpg','1959-07-11',77,'Released',NULL,'Ghost Story of Yotsuya',84508,1.9549,6.5,'Jk6VGVytrYE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14640,_binary '\0','/lGU30X5XYSbtG7kTYC2cU6tQq9f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0155329',8.2,1288,'ta','வறுமையின் நிறம் சிவப்பு','Three educated but unemployed youth who have come to live in a bustling, harsh metropolis struggle to earn a living.','/vuKtNy3xApXNbT7wIFru5PTEsFU.jpg','1980-11-06',144,'Released',NULL,'Varumayin Niram Sivappu',66406,1.3047,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14641,_binary '\0','/aSvcjbrk7hryhsSUzJv5O9I3d9I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0155388',7.3,8557,'en','The Winslow Boy','In pre-WWI England, a youngster is expelled from a naval academy over a petty theft, but his parents raise a political furor by demanding a trial.','/qKUUT3QKsShXloZiF88IdT5g64N.jpg','1999-03-18',104,'Released',NULL,'The Winslow Boy',28519,1.7872,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14642,_binary '\0','/khE3sMQBy4bfh4f70Wk81iI0Flw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0155487',8.3,3500,'ml','അമരം','Achootty, an uneducated fisherman, wants his daughter Radha to be educated and also want her to become a doctor. His dreams get shattered when Radha falls in love with her childhood friend.','/1Lszw3GArY4v1NaPnwqOYM4KXRa.jpg','1991-02-01',136,'Released',NULL,'Amaram',237725,1.4261,7.167,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14643,_binary '\0','/xyr80oscg6z6C1eVyNSYrsZXxBg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0155711',6.4,21287,'en','Flawless','An ultraconservative police officer suffers a debilitating stroke and is assigned to a rehabilitative program that includes singing lessons - with the drag queen next door.','/fkwkkUnaTmhaWt2OGBRepYr7yB5.jpg','1999-11-26',112,'Released','Nobody\'s perfect. Everybody\'s flawless.','Flawless',31582,4.5564,6.1,'xy0NQbn2C8g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14644,_binary '\0','/7AkasKcoVAvK7WCW3kDiOY4Z3KY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0155722',7.8,9008,'de','Ein Lied von Liebe und Tod - Gloomy Sunday','Budapest in the 1930s. Restaurant owner Laszlo hires pianist András to play in his restaurant. Both men fall in love with the beautiful waitress Ilona who inspires András to his only composition. His song of Gloomy Sunday is, at first, loved and then feared, for its melancholic melody sets off a chain of suicides. The fragile balance of the erotic ménage à trois is sent off kilter when the German Hans falls in love with Ilona as well.','/7cjNxmJUmz3gaaN6LYRJuEYtaKe.jpg','1999-10-21',112,'Released',NULL,'Gloomy Sunday',1277,3.1526,7.743,'g2CHe2BIrm4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14645,_binary '\0','/2fP8yZHl3FxJUouMCTBqTnSUrno.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0155753',5.6,13425,'en','I\'ll Be Home for Christmas','Estranged from his father, college student Jake is lured home to New York for Christmas with the promise of receiving a classic Porsche as a gift. When the bullying football team dumps him in the desert in a Santa suit, Jake is left without identification or money to help him make the journey. Meanwhile, his girlfriend, Allie, does not know where he is, and accepts a cross-country ride from Jake\'s rival, Eddie.','/9hTYFvEDnajUIbpdfc3fO6bZq2Y.jpg','1998-11-13',86,'Released','Somewhere between L.A. and N.Y. Jake found the meaning of Christmas.','I\'ll Be Home for Christmas',17037,5.3343,6,'_78cM5PZtYE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14646,_binary '\0','/kRsJiPpSgkU50dJOmXlF6daiJE8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0155776',5.8,32701,'en','Jawbreaker','When an exclusive clique of teenage socialites accidentally murder their best friend on the morning of her birthday, the three girls responsible conspire to hide the truth.','/7YrxXoG25hVCK4nYDHQv9YIk3Ye.jpg','1999-01-30',87,'Released','Death totally bites.','Jawbreaker',18892,6.0052,6.437,'ascDz9SZ-uI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14647,_binary '\0','/fjNM6qTGr9DMP6dkMjfls29NSXZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0155796',7.2,1699,'ja','カンゾー先生','At the end of WWII, Japanese doctor Akagi searches for the cure for hepatitis in the prisoner-of-war camp.','/n8toBnAPgHEY2371YH45LQXkPw7.jpg','1998-05-17',128,'Released',NULL,'Dr. Akagi',68528,1.818,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14648,_binary '\0','/8mxJjrPymsCg4rJxmVNjXByQ2ee.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0155975',4.6,53155,'en','Psycho','A young female embezzler arrives at the Bates Motel, which has terrible secrets of its own.','/6pQpZu6JjPsbHzjhG545OsjU2TG.jpg','1998-12-04',104,'Released','Check in. Relax. Take a shower.','Psycho',11252,5.6796,5.1,'p0QkvHCfg7w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14649,_binary '\0','/bKz6Ux0GgaQhVWLA0VBseWpCg0Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0156038',6.6,1780,'tr','Salkım Hanım\'ın Taneleri','During the period of the Wealth Tax, where many non-Muslims in Turkey were forced to pay higher taxes, often in an arbitrary and unrealistic way. Nimet and Durmuş migrate from Niğde to Istanbul and take shelter with Durmuş\'s friend Bekir, who finds Durmuş a job at the inn. However, making a living by serving as a porter is not in line with Durmuş\'s ambitions. He wants everything Halit Bey has, the inn owner. Halit Bey begins to dispose of his property in order to pay the tax stipulated to his beloved wife Nora, who was treated in a nursing home. Wealth Tax has begun to affect everyone\'s destiny.','/weMVwqegSgDHPmkmMfl9qmpZ7Dr.jpg','1999-11-19',133,'Released',NULL,'Mrs. Salkim\'s Diamonds',154513,1.5967,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14650,_binary '\0','/wvKxwezB7c0swrHmaJVFqqXBTiJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0156078',6.2,2053,'de','Der Sieg des Glaubens','Follows the Fifth Nazi Party Rally (Nuremberg, 30 August–3 September 1933) and shows the then close relationship between Adolf Hitler and Ernest Rõhm.','/qOuJJfgHwjaqHOnDxzTdjvZs9JJ.jpg','1933-12-01',67,'Released',NULL,'The Victory of Faith',99999,1.56,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14651,_binary '\0','/zwvhzXMnORZMtefgLaoyESRJ3bb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0156079',7.8,2241,'ta','சிகப்பு ரோஜாக்கள்','Dileep is an industrialist who runs a company named Minerva Exports & Imports. Despite his humble exterior, he has a dark side.','/lIV9vlniRUJvN9F0CwhKCreREuW.jpg','1978-10-28',121,'Released',NULL,'Sigappu Rojakkal',66413,1.0707,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14652,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0156096',7.5,1525,'en','Spring Forward','Trying to put himself back together after serving prison time for robbery, Paul takes a job as a parks employee in a small Connecticut town. His co-worker, Murph, a generation older than Paul, is dealing with his own issues, chiefly the the impending death of his very ill gay son. After the men have a run-in with local snob Frederickson, Murph\'s age and experience starts to temper Paul\'s fiery nature, as the younger man begins to embrace his new life.','/id2pAgtG5dNS7lguTpXbhCq9l3g.jpg','2000-12-10',110,'Released','Nothing in common. Everything to gain.','Spring Forward',51145,1.3693,6.5,'j_JTYeLHfcw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14653,_binary '\0','/2bN6fETbG97PtqI5c5XnAxFQeLA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0156248',6.4,4020,'fr','Un 32 août sur terre','After escaping unscathed from a car accident, photo model Simone decides that having a baby is the only way to give her vacant life some meaning. She asks her best friend Philippe to get her pregnant, and he reluctantly agrees, on the condition that they conceive somewhere in a desert, so they leave Montréal on a 24-hour round-trip to Salt Lake City to find a suitable spot.','/iE0XpMkBOGgqYZ2UsS6bqtjvfLG.jpg','1999-02-11',88,'Released',NULL,'August 32nd on Earth',59482,2.0663,6.5,'t4_s82xvQ80','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14654,_binary '\0','/6o8y8fNo6eIgmS2jRux150LQwwj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0156323',5.7,10051,'en','Screwed','A chauffeur kidnaps his rich boss\'s dog to hold it for ransom, but when she accidentally gets the dog back, she thinks that it\'s the chauffeur who\'s been kidnapped.','/m6FfMbH1ga1Kp5QI9Nm0ETOIG64.jpg','2000-05-12',81,'Released','Everyone gets it in the end.','Screwed',19419,2.1555,5.5,'KZlfi_qlTnw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14655,_binary '\0','/97kJ7wDotERnbEpa8c3wVDRXdFI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0156408',6.7,1762,'fr','La Classe de neige','A schoolboy Nicholas always worries about something. When he goes on a school skiing trip, all his visions and nightmares take him over.','/jEoZ0T50qntBYGZC9cQPZtclnKk.jpg','1998-09-23',96,'Released',NULL,'Class Trip',46817,1.8013,5.7,'VCw8jlx60bw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14656,_binary '\0','/csHtlULs2nhvCGRFTpu4CrLZLV8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0156413',4.4,2531,'en','The Clown at Midnight','Upon the reopening of the opera house where her mother was murdered, a teen and her friends become the targets of a deranged killer dressed in a clown costume.','/ng8VJLgquIl5PNnHzslK5C7VZk5.jpg','1999-02-09',91,'Released','So Many Victims, So Little Time','The Clown at Midnight',85230,2.0115,4.5,'qVEvoAd8cXk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14657,_binary '\0','/xjYM3CPfnFZdtN8xou748XExYM7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0156460',6.5,1879,'en','Defying Gravity','Popular frat guy Griff, the ultimate boy next boy, has a great big secret... Pete. Given an ultimatum by Pete, Griff goes the straight route until things get rough. Ultimately, defying reality is harder than he had ever imagined.','/7CgDSsJkpoR91OIHRimycO4B1W6.jpg','1997-07-09',92,'Released','Some pledges are for keeps.','Defying Gravity',31978,1.1835,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14658,_binary '\0','/jJ8etjN0422rX17nWNWqeXFwzZr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0156515',6.2,2238,'en','Entropy','Entropy is a semi-autobiographical film which tells the story of a young director struggling to make a film for a despotic studio while his life falls apart around him. Along the way, he goes on tour with U2 to help them make a music video, gets married in Vegas, and has a conversation with his cat.','/2GcOcBCi96GMAptOtPsYU7rZ7t4.jpg','1999-11-27',104,'Released','The hardest thing to do in life is direct your own.','Entropy',30382,1.5236,5.9,'rzlqgxQmZCY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14659,_binary '\0','/vAxmASACS5qwPIoSR1R9eBBMZbi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0156524',4.5,4145,'de','Der ewige Jude','A Nazi propaganda film made to promote anti-Semitism among the German people. Newly-shot footage of Jewish neighborhoods in recently-conquered Poland is combined with preexisting film clips and stills to defame the religion and advance Hitler\'s slurs that its adherents were plotting to undermine European civilization.','/6EMlshXsRmE9LJJd84V6Rh2Rhz.jpg','1940-11-28',62,'Released',NULL,'The Eternal Jew',38668,1.8842,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14660,_binary '\0','/7VT6EA7VQ21yCGkvf1oBu7rpbV8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0156554',3,1259,'en','Gargantua','Marine biologist Jack Ellway and his son Brandon are drawn to the Polynesian island of Malau to study the effects of recent seismic activity on the area\'s marine life. Along with the local doctor Alyson Hart, they soon become caught up in the investigation of a series of recent drownings with unexpected results. As Jack explores the surrounding ocean for a mysterious marine creature, Brandon discovers and befriends a three-foot-long baby creature that is able to leave the ocean and walk on land. As more dangerous and giant creatures come onto the island, and the military begins to take offensive action, Jack must risk everything to save the creatures, the island and his son.','/mzx3KU6QNzquBdTmjhuytQ8kXlM.jpg','1998-05-19',90,'Released','Terror has a new name','Gargantua',180243,1.8658,3.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14661,_binary '\0','/Anxhh4DeakufTyCdjpuVGF08Gpq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0156587',7.3,4696,'zh','海上花','At the end of the 19th century, Shanghai is divided into several foreign concessions. In the British concession, a number of luxurious “flower houses” are reserved for the male elite of the city. Since Chinese dignitaries are not allowed to frequent brothels, these establishments are the only ones that these men can visit. They form a self-contained world, with its own rites, traditions and even its own language. The men don’t only visit the houses to frequent the courtesans but also to dine, smoke opium, play mahjong and relax. The women working there are known as the “flowers of Shanghai”.','/9N3TdNbr5pyT69M5cHODmfc4zTs.jpg','1998-10-01',113,'Released',NULL,'Flowers of Shanghai',45935,3.0498,6.92,'E8LkUCujLX4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14662,_binary '\0','/sb174oPl1eQqgiCFSDvINxd3fb7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0156610',7.4,4865,'zh','洞','In the final days of the year 1999, almost everyone in Taiwan has died from a strange plague that ravished the island. As rain pours down relentlessly, a single man is stuck with an unfinished plumbing job and a hole in his floor. This results in a very odd relationship with the woman who lives below him.','/lsuvfxyCxlnkzc49hGMUmPDibCk.jpg','1998-09-14',95,'Released','A search for intimacy in a world of disaster.','The Hole',47060,1.624,7,'EcJxOcTUUZ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14663,_binary '\0','/iLGS7I7tXgKfIOetvgwO8figNhh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0156639',6.2,2749,'en','The Big Tease','Thinking he\'s competing in Los Angeles\' hot Platinum Scissors contest, Scottish hairstylist Crawford leaves Glasgow with a film crew to capture the event. When he learns he\'s a mere audience member, Crawford must find a way to become the mane event.','/i7HjSujyV4PpIcTzhlNxNGvMiRJ.jpg','1999-11-26',87,'Released','He saw. He combed. He conquered.','The Big Tease',20468,1.7833,5.9,'bJO4loGZbTg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14664,_binary '\0','/3gDtI9VCISLoNzcXiB62Dsm2Q4K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0156701',7.2,2613,'ru','Хрусталёв, машину!','Military doctor General Klenski is arrested in Stalin\'s Russia in 1953 during an anti-Semitic political campaign accused of being a participant in so-called \"doctors\' plot\".','/uMAEIn0fjxHNyweV0GfbTmMnD5D.jpg','1999-01-13',147,'Released',NULL,'Khrustalyov, My Car!',100784,1.3391,6,'h3qOf5dJqao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14665,_binary '\0','/vypveK2NHcpzQOON33xKtYeOnbX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0156706',3.6,2150,'it','Killing Birds','A group of students goes into the woods to study birds, and soon the dead begin to rise to devour the living.','/khdLWItOdgfrvCCpNq2hA7ziXca.jpg','1988-08-19',93,'Released',NULL,'Killing Birds',65588,1.7389,3.7,'95_f8MLAML4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14666,_binary '\0','/violLWJwy4I1LPRWssUmu5UVTQK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0156729',7.1,10597,'en','Last Night','Various citizens of Toronto anxiously await the end of the world, which is occurring at the stroke of midnight on New Year\'s Day.','/hlPBctls7n03GOj3qDjFWWzCiFt.jpg','1998-10-23',94,'Released','It\'s not the end of the world... there\'s still six hours left.','Last Night',16129,2.3565,6.7,'3h9q5yKz2J8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14667,_binary '\0','/rdnaChiHzsConxjsGssYBrQGbZb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0156757',5.9,2231,'en','Mad About Mambo','High school student tries to improve soccer skills by practicing dance and falls for his dance partner.','/aU57igWyBGP4wUvch4GuckoDvAl.jpg','2000-04-04',92,'Released','Fall in love... With the beat','Mad About Mambo',43079,1.717,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14668,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0156789',2.8,1340,'en','Men in White','National Lampoon\'s Men in White is a straight-to-television satirical parody of contemporary science fiction movies, mainly spoofing Men in Black and Independence Day. It debuted in 1998 on the Fox Family Channel.','/6PNDDiex1rnV8QU50wVlUtOvVww.jpg','1998-08-16',83,'Released','No Gravity, No Oxygen, No Brains... No Problem.','Men in White',154140,1.7767,3.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14669,_binary '\0','/hwo8xALeQiQsW31ZErCJvxpRdsV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0156794',7.8,16513,'el','Μια αιωνιότητα και μια μέρα','Famous writer Alexander contracts a terminal illness. He receives a letter from his wife describing a summer day 30 years ago, and leaves his seaside home to remember his past. This journey will allow him to wander between the past and the present, and encounter unexpected people, allowing him to collect unforgettable memories in the final moments of his life.','/wH8sfLJCqNjsIw8zkXpvxdSzj60.jpg','1998-10-23',133,'Released','How long will tomorrow last?','Eternity and a Day',24858,55.0868,7.8,'dPtApSuqCJw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14670,_binary '\0','/weeA1C6llNmQn4k8X6DqVV97JEK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0156807',4.5,1301,'en','Mr. Accident','A very clumsy man and his UFO-obsessed girlfriend discover a plan made by his boss to market eggs laced with nicotine.','/74p6UpzvlXVkS2hrJB4s2W3nhA7.jpg','2000-03-24',89,'Released','It\'s a trip.','Mr. Accident',37716,1.3683,4.5,'DhcoXd1OeIE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14671,_binary '\0','/mrhdbBV44O87ikOObJpIMuHoMNL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0156812',7,22187,'en','My Dog Skip','A shy boy is unable to make friends in Yazoo City, Mississippi in 1942, until his parents give him a terrier puppy for his ninth birthday. The dog, which he names Skip, becomes well known and loved throughout the community and enriches the life of the boy, Willie, as he grows into manhood.','/nnPv7RuSn6UaPjZussIFljZdWS8.jpg','2000-01-12',95,'Released','Every family needs an optimist.','My Dog Skip',17908,5.7157,6.7,'NtS1kDW8PEo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14672,_binary '\0','/gA319UUESvNt5jCsQ9YqSidJ2CE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0156841',4.7,12147,'en','The Next Best Thing','A comedy-drama about best friends - one a straight woman, Abbie, the other a gay man, Robert - who decide to have a child together. Five years later, Abbie falls in love with a straight man and wants to move away with her and Robert\'s little boy Sam, and a nasty custody battle ensues.','/iYK1ZUtY4etcn91glUmrGuZRH6M.jpg','2000-03-03',108,'Released','Best friends make the best mistakes','The Next Best Thing',1831,5.0104,5.244,'xve77tiSI64','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14673,_binary '\0','/1hB7MUSvGy1FMGlcthHmg0ut08C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0156843',3.6,2838,'en','Revenge of the Dead','Reports of strange activities out by the Old Willow\'s place signal new adventures for Kelton the Cop & Co. An apparent mystic, Dr. Acula is engaging in rituals designed to raise the dead. But he may get more than he bargained for...','/ad5YqkwPM1GiKEaBYlAUwCQt34N.jpg','1959-05-03',69,'Released','The Dead of Night is Alive with the Dead!','Revenge of the Dead',32623,1.3858,4.4,'VISP8aYe-o0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14674,_binary '\0','/1oOQv7Yf5fIwVgQI5nqhyg2xsxr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0156849',6.9,4997,'ru','Про уродов и людей','St. Petersburg, early 20th century. The handsome and secretive Johann specializes in shooting erotic pictures depicting the floggings of bare-bottomed women. With the help of his assistants, the photographic creations gradually penetrate the peaceful households of two upper-class Russian families.','/747Pva2PZtWUPGiQFsILoXLRPHt.jpg','1998-05-20',93,'Released',NULL,'Of Freaks and Men',84002,1.4535,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14675,_binary '\0','/mHG7dpLb0ZScSY3LpP443IHRmjy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0156887',8,126995,'ja','PERFECT BLUE','Rising pop star Mima Kirigoe quits singing to pursue a career as an actress. After she takes up a role on a popular detective show, her handlers and collaborators begin turning up murdered. Harboring feelings of guilt and haunted by visions of her former self, Mima\'s reality and fantasy meld into a frenzied paranoia.','/6WTiOCfDPP8XV4jqfloiVWf7KHq.jpg','1998-02-28',81,'Released','\"excuse me... who are you?\"','Perfect Blue',10494,19.5571,8.305,'Olsdzqe2y9Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14676,_binary '\0','/fyE9O3NCj4i3GyzVP65FusSFP34.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0156901',7.2,2939,'fa','سیب','After twelve years of imprisonment by their own parents, two Iranian sisters are finally released by social workers to face the outside world for the first time.','/5QC5xzyWIkGK2NcnpZUXThZYK66.jpg','1998-05-27',82,'Released',NULL,'The Apple',43978,1.1386,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14677,_binary '\0','/onOF95lPTacI4lKHGG9REPw3fHJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0156934',5.4,25525,'en','Random Hearts','After losing their spouses in a plane crash, an internal affairs cop and a congresswoman find each other\'s keys in each other\'s loved ones\' possessions and discover that the two were having an affair.','/k7LoKDWDesvYD7DXDh9Ewlxtcx8.jpg','1999-10-08',133,'Released','In a perfect world, they never would have met.','Random Hearts',12618,6.2715,5.6,'aLHMJZ5eKjs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14678,_binary '\0','/zZvsUYJDHVUzeoB23ikYQGFVwQp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0156985',6.4,3143,'hi','सड़क','A taxi driver with a tragic past sees an opportunity for redemption when he encounters a woman sold into prostitution. Wanting to help her escape, he has to deal with the wrath of the brothel madam.','/fFESWq8YQHRrwSJ9K8ThAxlDCx.jpg','1991-12-06',127,'Released',NULL,'Sadak',230435,1.3506,5.667,'Gsi4AuOXx1E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14679,_binary '\0','/AjE0eLKSJ8SmHg9aiTaSuX5Od6R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0157016',7.2,27954,'fr','Seul contre tous','After completing jail time for beating up a man who tried to seduce his mentally-handicapped teenage daughter, the Butcher wants to start life anew. He institutionalizes his daughter and moves to the Lille suburbs with his mistress, who promises him a new butcher shop. Learning that she lied, the Butcher returns to Paris to find his daughter.','/4kMB2AAcDQ5diRuh7NTxuS90bx7.jpg','1999-02-17',89,'Released','In the bowels of France.','I Stand Alone',1567,3.6246,7.4,'X22CYBExkZQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14680,_binary '\0','/20eu7LBcBnQg6hmQLfp6jXd22go.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0157044',6.6,5886,'fr','Sitcom','The adventures of an upper-class suburban family abruptly confronted with the younger brother\'s discovery of his homosexuality, the elder sister\'s suicide attempt and sadomasochist tendencies, and the intrusion of a very free-spirited maid and her husband. And it all started with the arrival in the family of an innocent looking rat.','/2rbWkcmHertfXMWUmn54px5DSjI.jpg','1998-05-27',80,'Released','Family is fun. But there are limits...','Sitcom',46761,1.478,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14681,_binary '\0','/teMF3vIQl6NxzMqmlnqpnaG5ucX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0157075',4.3,2604,'en','The Suburbans','The Suburbans, a one-hit-wonder new wave band from the \'80s, reunite at their bassist\'s wedding, where a promising young record executive sees the ensemble perform. When she encourages them to launch a revival, the group must weigh their dreams of fame and fortune against the reality of their relatively quiet domestic lives.','/meQUL49dy2A5f89hnDG22Pra2An.jpg','1999-10-29',81,'Released','Never before has a girl done so much with so little.','The Suburbans',46286,2.4022,4,'zyjSfUtDnU4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14682,_binary '\0','/icGxnJJrVZVIBEo73xsXRnLmCDd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0157117',6.6,1452,'ja','Tokyo Eyes','The police are tracking a man who shoots at people. But the young sister of a detective finds that he\'s not the mad vigilante portrayed in newspapers.','/5VR0pPwqu7yliYJbtbouXkjAF0J.jpg','1998-09-09',90,'Released','Where teen love and bullets meet.','Tokyo Eyes',49918,1.6376,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14683,_binary '\0','/haTYiJ6APNaUtVtekPRFmlPJ9KT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0157122',7.4,3944,'sv','Trolösa','Scripted by Ingmar Bergman, this very personal film is about a destructive affair which wrecks the marriage of an actress (Marianne) and musician (Markus). Wanting to continue the affair, Marianne moves in with her lover. But she is tormented by Markus\' decision not to let her have custody of their daughter. Finally Markus announces he may have a solution to the stalemate, but this leads to deception, lies and ultimately, tragedy.','/5fshpCYhGUBPrPsBgFY4mlLqnEN.jpg','2000-09-15',154,'Released','One Moment Can Change A Lifetime','Faithless',47595,2.3998,6.6,'0Ua-2YDWv4o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14684,_binary '\0','/7M4HDajGdVAMvG4GprGcFu3Xn1H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0157154',7.4,2493,'es','La vendedora de rosas','Monica is 13 years old and has already created her own world, on the street, where she fights courageously to defend what little she has: her friends, her boyfriend, who sells drugs, and her dignity and pride that makes no concessions to anyone. On Christmas night, like every night, she sells roses to make a living. But life brings her a new appointment with loneliness, poverty, drugs and death.','/w2tizTBmh8mATLFjo617wrNWjXy.jpg','1998-05-13',115,'Released',NULL,'The Rose Seller',97038,2.0458,7.889,'CuDrHVrPIYk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14685,_binary '\0','/q2jMv5sHl7f4yp3rUKdgOd1wjZA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0157183',7.6,5340,'ar','West Beyrouth','In 1975, the long slog of civil war has recently begun in Beirut. Two friends, Tarek and Omar, suffer during the Lebanese civil war. Conflicts arise when they decide to cross from West to East, crossing the Muslim-Christian line that divides Beirut.','/djx4ceoh6o5kdLKRuPsMULNWvDl.jpg','1998-10-30',105,'Released','Growing up is only half the battle.','West Beirut',49184,1.3532,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14686,_binary '\0','/fawdSMG9xBZQVsgMiU4MbSIl4es.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0157191',5.3,1750,'en','One Last Dance','In the wake of tragedy, a renowed New York dance company is on the brink of collapse. After leaving the dance world for good, Travis, Chrissa, and Max are pulled in to resurrect the dance that shattered their careers. They have one last chance to save the company, re-connect with the passion and magic, and prove that miracles really can happen.','/5CeVJT5apj5LdMuVtol6q84XNtu.jpg','2003-04-04',100,'Released',NULL,'One Last Dance',25665,2.6078,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14687,_binary '\0','/nubP8teClmRZ1qxexS68IsFhwvi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0157208',6.5,1641,'fr','L\'École de la chair','Fashion executive Dominique\'s obsession for Quentin, a young bisexual hustler, fills her desire for physical love but leaves her taxed emotionally. Twists and turns in the relationship, along with the man\'s violent and abusive nature, force Dominique to reconcile the conflicts created by her passion. In this quest, Dominique is aided, and sometimes hindered, by friends, clients, and Quentin\'s former and current acquaintances.','/esyIrOG6cjRYIAfjI3Sj9ijA8LQ.jpg','1998-11-18',110,'Released','Lessons in love, sex and betrayal.','The School of Flesh',77936,2.2135,5.4,'0IIMTO9vXtE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14688,_binary '\0','/1RsbtQ0hhEORWszanaWom6pK51D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0157262',3.5,14226,'en','2001: A Space Travesty','When odd reports are received through official channels stating that the President of the United States is being held captive on a secret international moon base called Vegan and that he has been replaced on Earth by a clone, the US Marshall Service immediately sends their \'best\' man, Dix, on the mission.','/jNCvJuLbHjvXPvyOubbaa54ArvH.jpg','2000-10-31',99,'Released','The most outer spaced-out comedy ever!','2001: A Space Travesty',7290,4.1839,4.3,'12iTQ7k265o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14689,_binary '\0','/fnV3RP67glYT7y6Etf8i14l2lOL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0157339',7.4,1468,'hi','Baton Baton Mein','Rosie Perreira is an overly anxious widow, living with her guitar-obsessed son, Sabhi, and a lovely daughter, Nancy, who she would like to get married to a wealthy young man. Her helpful neighbor, Tom, introduces a young eligible Tony Braganza to Nancy in the 9:10 AM Western Railway local train from Bandra to Churchgate. Tom also asks Nancy to introduce Tony to Rosie, which she does. Rosie is initially apprehensive about him as he only drawing a mere Rs.300/ compared to Nancy\'s Rs.700/-, but soon changes her mind when she finds out that after his probationary period he will draw a monthly pay of Rs.1000/-. Nancy and Tom are permitted to meet and both eventually fall in love. While Nancy wants to follow her mother\'s directions and get married, Tony is hesitant, and this is what costs him Nancy\'s love, as she starts to feel that he will not come through with the marriage. And soon Rosie starts looking elsewhere for a son-in-law, while Tony is still reluctant to make any commitments.','/1B265Q95QVfn2NZOLjYyWVxgcFU.jpg','1979-04-13',113,'Released',NULL,'Baton Baton Mein',44059,1.1291,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14690,_binary '\0','/eJ31kSaOTijPqz61MMBFKOFuao9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0157366',6.8,1302,'cn','野獸刑警','Tung is a street cop in Hong Kong who\'s friends with a Triad named Fai. Fai hires a hit man to murder a business rival; the hit goes wrong and Fai, implicated in the incident, goes on the run.','/gDUCOWJM4zUAnuw6zwqJxIWtU7j.jpg','1998-04-09',110,'Released','In the black and white world of cops and gangsters, One man is caught in the gray area.','Beast Cops',44267,1.7995,6.5,'SvI8PyDKjxc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14691,_binary '\0','/ygys5z5itmGGbSp2G003A6crCyO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0157472',5.2,15826,'en','Clockstoppers','Until now, Zak Gibbs\' greatest challenge has been to find a way to buy a car. But when he discovers an odd wristwatch amidst his father\'s various inventions and slips it on -- something very strange happens. The world around him seems to come to a stop, everything and everybody frozen in time. Zak quickly learns how to manipulate the device and he and his quick-witted and beautiful new friend, Francesca, start to have some real fun.','/6XZJ58gStdLZV8uJyTRcA5bGNyi.jpg','2002-03-29',94,'Released','What if you had the power to stop time?','Clockstoppers',15028,4.2953,5.331,'WuDCVKAoslY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14692,_binary '\0','/xXSDhhyC853VgF7OCDKpXKeA5Md.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0157503',6.7,45672,'en','Drop Dead Gorgeous','In a small Minnesota town, the annual beauty pageant is being covered by a TV crew. Former winner Gladys Leeman wants to make sure her daughter follows in her footsteps; explosions, falling lights, and trailer fires prove that. As the Leemans are the richest family in town, the police are pretty relaxed about it all. Despite everything, main rival (but sweet) Amber Atkins won\'t give up without a fight.','/iMMvFvHhURa4cWv6CxhpwIDjme2.jpg','1999-07-16',98,'Released','The battle between the good and the bad is about to get ugly.','Drop Dead Gorgeous',10490,5.817,6.5,'M26Llut3FEM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14693,_binary '\0','/6EUKagQGH2vZLsbOYdD1CvmIJOm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0157571',8.2,2293,'hi','एक रुका हुआ फैसला','Twelve jurors gather in a closed room to deliberate on a murder charge against a young man accused of killing his elderly father. Eleven are convinced of his guilt, while one remains unconvinced. As the others attempt to persuade him to join their unanimous verdict, doubts begin to emerge. A Hindi adaptation of 12 Angry Men.','/p6c6AzKBN1VX7ZwP94IpXGpI73x.jpg','1986-07-23',127,'Released',NULL,'Ek Ruka Hua Faisla',55658,0.9127,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14694,_binary '\0','/pE334YKo9NNgee3VEGl6VR6gGSZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0157583',6.4,22862,'en','Enigma','The story of the WWII project to crack the code behind the Enigma machine, used by the Germans to encrypt messages sent to their submarines.','/7gBFkDYBqvSzrPOWlpGTXRp97NQ.jpg','2001-01-22',119,'Released','Unlock the secret.','Enigma',10491,3.4784,6.28,'4bIBaf2MF18','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14695,_binary '\0','/fAUqTcFUhP1QC7HxEfKhsxewswp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0157713',6.9,1271,'ru','Господин оформитель','A famous artist strives to find the secret of eternal life through the beautiful mannequins he creates.','/yo2OvbzDgiTftEIr6PS5BKQ4kQN.jpg','1988-12-01',103,'Released',NULL,'Mister Designer',274991,1.4753,6,'wcoe37NUsRE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14696,_binary '\0','/24gDeda1KTUwEWfwVlYLm0jvMoH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0157894',7.5,2869,'en','The Killing of America','A documentary of the decline of America, composed of archival material and exclusive footage, carnage, madness, and mayhem with an unapologetic sincerity on the factual depiction of violence in the industrialized nation of the United States. Featuring a juxtaposition of detailed accounts of terrible acts, brutal behavior, and interviews from experts and convicted killers alike.','/kVc7VKfZqxrJhNvIvXxX6DuT6lU.jpg','1981-09-05',95,'Released','The film the American authorities didn\'t want you to see!','The Killing of America',95006,2.0614,7.2,'XjwOnQktNC8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14697,_binary '\0','/inDHdHRclQ6MWxAUeJ9TtXDh1xW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0158011',4.5,1731,'en','The Eternal','An alcoholic American couple travel to Ireland with their son so he can meet his grandmother but they walk in on their crazed uncle who is in the midst of reviving a centuries-old Druid witch.','/r6wLlv6gS39T2jVniHJ7ORsBegt.jpg','1998-09-18',95,'Released','Evil sleeps, but never dies.','The Eternal',55066,4.459,4.8,'aCvPCuweP3E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14698,_binary '\0','/bvZde5jspfH4XjhwkoA7zkhwdV1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0158030',6.7,4778,'es','La niña de tus ojos','During the Spanish Civil War, a troupe of Spanish filmmakers is invited to shoot a film at UFA studios in Nazi Germany.','/lKu9RSzI8yjs8o18f2SwelPsifW.jpg','1998-11-13',121,'Released','A romantic comedy about war, filmmaking and impossible love.','The Girl of Your Dreams',67297,2.6074,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14699,_binary '\0','/mondD9nN4pPdtklX7SAySoCuKp8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0158033',5.9,1968,'en','Nora','In 1904, in Dublin, James Joyce chats up Nora Barnacle, a hotel maid recently come from Galway. She enchants him with her frank, direct and uninhibited manner, and before long, he\'s convinced her to come with him to Trieste, where he has a job with Berlitz. Over time, Nora pulls him through phobias, tolerates his drinking, takes in his brother Stan, and bests Joyce at \'the writin\' game\' to bring him back to Italy from Dublin where he\'s gone to open a cinema. But his sexual jealousy threatens the relationship and sends her back to Galway with the children. Is there any way to tame Jim\'s green-eyed monster? And, will the lad ever get his stories published?','/3G1dPq5hf9g7m98uKrksBIu1kbL.jpg','2000-04-05',106,'Released','She gave a voice to his words and fire to his passion.','Nora',41165,1.7537,5.2,'JT367gsMEvo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14700,_binary '\0','/tHVbcgxUyZ5Zb6EDRbltBNGT48y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0158131',6.8,4685,'en','Purgatory','An outlaw band flees a posse and rides into Refuge, a small town where no one carries a gun, drinks, or swears. The town is actually Purgatory, and the peaceful inhabitants are all famous dead outlaws and criminals such as Doc Holiday and Wild Bill Hickok who must redeem themselves before gaining admittance to Heaven... or screw up and go to Hell.','/lNbVYDqrsMsPJSBYONcao8CkDZG.jpg','1999-01-10',94,'Released',NULL,'Purgatory',23356,3.0001,7.2,'c8lCp8BSJh4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14701,_binary '\0','/zeOhbKAmvxZzimQv8tl5NU5MkYg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0158302',6.8,3290,'sv','Under solen','Olof lives alone on his family\'s farm after the death of his mother. Unable to read and write, he is dependent on his younger friend, Erik, who helps him in the afternoons. Once a sailor, Erik brags of having known hundreds of women. Out of the blue, Olof advertises in the local paper for a young lady housekeeper, and Ellen, a middle-class city woman, arrives to take over the house and, as the summer goes on, Olof\'s heart and Erik\'s desire as well.','/qlYP62dQzItQnbxM46Kn8LesuPX.jpg','1998-12-25',130,'Released',NULL,'Under the Sun',52673,1.8915,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14702,_binary '\0','/8D4in0vUmyzjMQHcIdQ8wyEmUca.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0158371',7.1,37209,'en','Sweet and Lowdown','In the 1930s, jazz guitarist Emmet Ray idolizes Django Reinhardt, faces gangsters and falls in love with a mute woman.','/23S5qa8j3ajYnERcYCqMLfSeOvw.jpg','1999-12-03',95,'Released',NULL,'Sweet and Lowdown',9684,4.1744,6.8,'7w3fokY0kP0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14703,_binary '\0','/3QV1Xesxj0lmo3m2jJ1mlOjyQUK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0158409',4.1,3291,'en','Futuresport','In the not too distant future, a new deadly sport is the only way to stop a war that will kill millions. Fix is the creator of the sport, but the spotlight has always been on Ramzey. Now this hothead must use the game to stop the Revolution.','/SPJXju2Wq1VmjsVYU2aUSP4eFX.jpg','1999-09-30',91,'Released','In 2025, Futuresport is the organized sport of the planet. But someone else is getting organized and their game is war.','Futuresport',16365,2.0445,4.331,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14704,_binary '\0','/g2yEOy5naHvTm0bggpxWzBXGsiy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0158423',5,1447,'en','NetForce','Set in the year 2005, a division of the FBI, called \"NetForce\" has been initiated to investigate Internet crime. A Bill Gates-type character finds a loophole in his new web browser which enables him to gain control of the Internet. Net-Force, headed by Kristofferson and Bakula\'s characters set out to stop him.','/7j9wbttMSFC1ZvHzcSmzko6CGqE.jpg','1999-02-01',154,'Released','The One Who Controls The Internet Controls The World.','NetForce',54373,2.1121,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14705,_binary '\0','/kpLjleAdMLKOgb2LVT89F4AQzq4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0158493',6.2,14162,'en','Belly','Tommy Bundy and Sincere are best friends as well as infamous and ruthless criminals and shot-callers in the hood. Respected by many but feared by all. As the police are closing in on them and new players are looking for a come up, will their reign last?','/i4QhjdZXxdOpKOhc9kh4qqWjRWr.jpg','1998-11-04',96,'Released','Money, power, respect... but who\'s got your back?','Belly',12888,3.8577,6.345,'4kBUQv51_ko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14706,_binary '\0','/hirileHWHzCPwGhrgNQXGOCafbt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0158534',7,2042,'hi','दी बर्निंग ट्रेन','An engineer\'s dream of making the perfect train for Indian Railways is given hope when the company commissions his prototype. After years dedicating himself to his dream, his family has suffered, but now he hopes to make it all up to them with the train\'s triumphant inaugural journey. However, an embittered fellow employee has other ideas.','/vjxvY0pbfTE9QM4qxr1JpzdFK0o.jpg','1980-03-20',152,'Released',NULL,'The Burning Train',168498,1.2952,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14707,_binary '\0','/9aZp91tVz3G5AByiTqJGr4vPNYD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0158560',8.2,1774,'en','The Concert for Bangladesh','A film about the first benefit rock concert when major musicians performed to raise relief funds for the poor of Bangladesh. The Concert for Bangladesh was a pair of benefit concerts organised by former Beatles guitarist George Harrison and Indian sitar player Ravi Shankar. The shows were held at 2:30 and 8:00 pm on Sunday, 1 August 1971, at Madison Square Garden in New York City, to raise international awareness of, and fund relief for refugees from East Pakistan, following the Bangladesh Liberation War-related genocide.','/jSJBmsAwYJXqKPuWoGHGJVZhyLJ.jpg','1972-03-23',103,'Released',NULL,'The Concert for Bangladesh',59414,1.9161,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14708,_binary '\0','/sfTzAvW3SDYnugNDAGLySGEE4UZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0158583',6.4,2914,'en','Deterrence','The President of the United States must deal with an international military crisis while confined to a Colorado diner during a freak snowstorm.','/qAkbSZ3RY7E6jVYi5FNvc27o019.jpg','2000-03-10',101,'Released','Every President has a defining moment. Walter Emerson is about to have his.','Deterrence',25212,2.8575,6.1,'l2iLx4foJ0E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14709,_binary '\0','/fZp7CoIjWrIjEOqjIdFhFgeLUDr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0158610',8,3809,'sh','Како је пропао рокенрол','Omnibus film, consisting of three independent parts: in the first story, Koma, a failed rocker, wants to prove to his producer father that newly composed music could be better than his. He becomes a mysterious masked folk singer-known as Ninja. In the second, Dracula is killed... again. This time he does not dies oby way of a wooden stake, a silver bullet, or a cross. A blonde woman manages to deprive him of eternal life without the help of sunrise. The last story is about Eve and Djuro. She is creator, he is a musician. They live in a harmonious relationship, but a love letter brings division among them.','/7YOyKgDR5OTC6W8hY3IEn0CYffo.jpg','1989-05-07',106,'Released',NULL,'The Fall of Rock and Roll',33587,0.9145,6.3,'-t03Amfi9g0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14710,_binary '\0','/5TgtoN4NjBsRD8PksQSDdWVjuWC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0158622',3.8,27206,'en','The Flintstones in Viva Rock Vegas','The Flintstones are at it again. The Flintstones and the Rubbles head for Rock Vegas with Fred hoping to court the lovely Wilma. Nothing will stand in the way of love, except for the conniving Chip Rockefeller who is the playboy born in Baysville but who has made it in the cutthroat town of Rock Vegas. Will Fred win Wilma\'s love?','/o4pijWLImp7TQ64Yg2nuUYzdiDy.jpg','2000-04-28',91,'Released','Get ready to rock!','The Flintstones in Viva Rock Vegas',889,7.1873,4.839,'Eu3zeVVu3ME','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14711,_binary '\0','/Myd8G3Rhdor0Kt7bIteHhNaeLc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0158692',6.8,3440,'fi','Juha','A farmer\'s wife is seduced into running away from her stolid older husband by a city slicker, who enslaves her in a brothel.','/idh0ybgYH0ttildtRjxaRrYWWto.jpg','1999-02-26',78,'Released',NULL,'Juha',55257,1.3128,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14712,_binary '\0','/sNEO4KDId8ZHpZgKwiFDcuNuaNF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0158714',7.6,19425,'ja','修羅雪姫','A strikingly beautiful young woman is trained from birth to be a deadly instrument of revenge against the swindlers who destroyed her family.','/wkcbaqCoYEXDUnSQ6NTnB2C7H05.jpg','1973-12-01',97,'Released',NULL,'Lady Snowblood',2487,3.0439,7.518,'bIiuywU9ZJ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14713,_binary '\0','/4n10DEpEsNOJj5Is1NjpGqrN7Lv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0158811',6.3,22119,'en','Muppets from Space','When Gonzo\'s breakfast cereal tells him that he\'s the descendant of aliens from another planet, his attempts at extraterrestrial communication get him kidnapped by a secret government agency, prompting the Muppets to spring into action to rescue their friend.','/Aww9cF4uMsbald9ddhCYFoP4gBi.jpg','1999-07-14',88,'Released','Space. It\'s not as deep as you think.','Muppets from Space',10208,4.9726,6.1,'R94eV8nxvrA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14714,_binary '\0','/2q3B90h2hZ6xJTvna9CIFDNaIr4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0158983',7.7,224532,'en','South Park: Bigger, Longer & Uncut','In this feature film based on the hit animated series, the third graders of South Park sneak into an R-rated film by ultra-vulgar Canadian television personalities Terrance and Phillip, and emerge with expanded vocabularies that leave their parents and teachers scandalized. When outraged Americans try to censor the film, the controversy spirals into a call to wage war on Canada and Terrance and Phillip end up on death row, with the kids their only hope of rescue.','/tS0PedvA2mFO9VCHYwQpaU1K36U.jpg','1999-06-24',81,'Released','Uh-oh.','South Park: Bigger, Longer & Uncut',9473,8.3427,7.3,'K6EiSoRlobg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14715,_binary '\0','/6b6UpsOXmjO8mJKYsGTG9HW49CN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0159097',7.2,188539,'en','The Virgin Suicides','A group of male friends become obsessed with five mysterious sisters who are sheltered by their strict, religious parents.','/1NCQtXPQnaHRjOZVmktA9BSM35F.jpg','2000-04-21',97,'Released','Beautiful, mysterious, haunting, invariably fatal. Just like life.','The Virgin Suicides',1443,8.6698,7.1,'8kDcCGlaBwY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14716,_binary '\0','/zH2W8xecCmGkN1BKCtMv4jniZ6n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0159272',6.7,2602,'en','Beautiful People','In London, during October 1993, England is playing Holland in the preliminaries of the World Cup. The Bosnian War is at its height, and refugees from the ex-Yugoslavia are arriving. Football rivals, and political adversaries from the Balkans all precipitate conflict and amusing situations. Meanwhile, the lives of four English families are affected in different ways by encounter with the refugees.','/t5s6oSCyA2tGf7J5ZJHii4eb2J2.jpg','1999-09-16',107,'Released','A comic collision of chaos and coincidence','Beautiful People',61416,1.3962,6.2,'4i4eu5Q7M0U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14717,_binary '\0','/lEdy2A62qCwJPffMLVyByRxUpfd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0159273',6.4,120145,'en','Behind Enemy Lines','While flying a routine reconnaissance mission over Bosnia, fighter pilot Lt. Chris Burnett photographs something he wasn\'t supposed to see and gets shot down behind enemy lines, where he must outrun an army led by a ruthless Serbian general. With time running out and a deadly tracker on his trail, Burnett\'s commanding officer, Admiral Reigart, decides to risk his career and launch a renegade rescue mission to save his life.','/fZReMWU3zszvaktDUqOoWCzHssZ.jpg','2001-11-30',106,'Released','His only weapon is his will to survive.','Behind Enemy Lines',8007,8.2103,6.5,'PUeWBp_kmuo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14718,_binary '\0','/xjJz025MAPrSeNj18LPjcyu4xFM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0159365',7.2,165283,'en','Cold Mountain','In this classic story of love and devotion set against the backdrop of the American Civil War, a wounded Confederate soldier named W.P. Inman deserts his unit and travels across the South, aiming to return to his young wife, Ada, who he left behind to tend their farm. As Inman makes his perilous journey home, Ada struggles to keep their home intact with the assistance of Ruby, a mysterious drifter sent to help her by a kindly neighbor.','/j0AJeeR5CQPDFh0otyWyCWREHO8.jpg','2003-12-24',154,'Released','Find your way home.','Cold Mountain',2289,9.5415,6.935,'Rq7ecfLUtZI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14719,_binary '\0','/maKFO957CHUHZ9K34Hqtg1oMojH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0159382',7,25009,'en','Croupier','Jack Manfred is an aspiring writer who to make ends meet, takes a job as a croupier. Jack remains an observer, knowing that everything in life is a gamble and that gamblers are born to lose. Inevitably, he gets sucked into the world of the casino which takes its toll on his relationships and the novel he is writing.','/bLLa74hdq9qsJpcVqLSwm3fKzJn.jpg','1998-06-25',94,'Released','Life\'s a gamble...','Croupier',12706,3.8546,6.7,'LDWzeq5QGiA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14720,_binary '\0','/1yV9o2iCpwEcBbLUppXzHBlUnCD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0159401',6.6,1290,'en','The Debt Collector','Mean, gritty, dirty and low, and that\'s just the policeman Gary Keltie, out for retribution for the horrendous crimes against the helpless people of Edinburgh during the 1970s, by notorious, torturous, and killer, debt collector Nickie Dryden.','/mcnXFQQCqRTnz5CyRTxbpnRAeJW.jpg','1999-06-25',105,'Released','Some debts can never be paid.','The Debt Collector',34713,1.2969,6.4,'7ymrxDK_Z28','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14721,_binary '\0','/veU2KXRIWEXWLifUdbJH77YqTUO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0159421',5.9,4047,'en','The Adventures of Elmo in Grouchland','Elmo loves his fuzzy, well-worn blue blanket more than anything in the whole world. However, when Elmo\'s blanket gets sucked through a colorful, swirling tunnel into Grouchland, the yuckiest place on earth, Elmo goes on an adventure to Grouchland to retrieve his prized possession.','/u9i4frT1XPaTqJxRYLJ8j2r8LYO.jpg','1999-10-01',73,'Released','The Good, The Bad and The Stinky.','The Adventures of Elmo in Grouchland',16112,4.6797,6.2,'w83W4ug5HTw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14722,_binary '\0','/oPxGNTQpx5ydWTI8aaQDEz7SbhQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0159432',7,1305,'cn','非常突然','Bumbling mainland crooks mess up a jewelry heist. Two cops serious Ken and jokey Sam investigate but mix up these amateurs with dangerous mainland robbers in the neighborhood.','/lQveKpyNQQXJtaKNS5N9g3E99kZ.jpg','1998-05-28',90,'Released',NULL,'Expect the Unexpected',72897,1.4856,6.4,'W73keCzmSdU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14723,_binary '\0','/qKpougHofM4Gagv1Qp8DAW3Sz4z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0159485',7.1,5922,'fi','Häjyt','The Tough Ones tells a story of two friends who have a hard time finding their place in the society. Antti and Jussi are released from jail. While they were doing time for bank robbery, the third man involved in the robbery, the one who was not convicted, has become a policeman. He tries to help his friends to settle into the small town in Pohjanmaa, but the boys start a black market liquor business instead. The road seems to lead back to the jail.','/gIyzNrM8BnyuB6guykvlXhsbkX1.jpg','1999-01-15',105,'Released','Three young men rob a bank. Only two of them are caught. What will happen when they return to their home town?','The Tough Ones',38821,2.095,6.2,'hv-LxCMW6Yc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14724,_binary '\0','/8t6l0IW0weM02S4NMCNcnLkzCM6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0159509',7,2884,'ja','機動戦士ガンダム','In the year Universal Century 0079, humans have colonized the area of space lying in between the Earth and the moon. However, the ambitious Zabi family, rulers of the Duchy of Zeon, the grouping of colonies furthest from the earth, has sparked a war.','/kzyMAqagPK6wuvDzA5FeJU6n71Y.jpg','1981-03-14',139,'Released','Thrust into the thick of battle, a young boy and a secret weapon are earth\'s last hope!','Mobile Suit Gundam I',39228,2.8598,6.745,'QeNKubtJB1A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14725,_binary '\0','/oWa4zximcnYE1Ofnl7t47UEqFas.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0159510',7.1,2047,'ja','機動戦士ガンダムII 哀・戦士編','After surviving attacks by Zeon\'s Char Aznable and Garma Zabi, the crew of Federation warship White Base and its mobile suits must battle Zeon forces through Asia, Europe, and the Atlantic Ocean if they are to reach Earth Federation\'s headquarters alive. During that process, many of its crewmembers must overcome their fears, losses, immaturities, and insecurities in order to persevere.','/i1J5u0bhbcCghFWnwmvsTi5RzQf.jpg','1981-07-11',135,'Released','I pray, pray, pray to bring near the New Day.','Mobile Suit Gundam II: Soldiers of Sorrow',39229,2.7334,7.184,'O86MFn2jduI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14726,_binary '\0','/wTsYCRokwwr84nIhDP13rZFhvpI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0159511',7.5,1968,'ja','機動戦士ガンダム III めぐりあい宇宙編','Amuro Ray and the rest of the White Base crew, now denominated the 13th Autonomous Corps, return to outer space to support the rest of the Earth Federation forces for the decisive battle against the Principality of Zeon\'s forces.','/lXeLWEuUV5dVIhHmQt5z5RyawT4.jpg','1982-03-13',140,'Released','Space reverberates, and two souls meet by chance....','Mobile Suit Gundam III: Encounters in Space',39230,3.0037,7.471,'CUEnfUIrEt8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14727,_binary '\0','/3m6rRRxJl7nzcLiNbA3TfQE7UZX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0159568',6.4,1243,'ja','機動戦士ガンダムF91','U.C. 0123. After a generation of peace, the Earth Federation has begun to build new space colonies to house humanity\'s growing population. But a new force, the aristocratic Crossbone Vanguard, plans to seize the colonies of the newly constructed Frontier Side for itself. As their home becomes a battlefield, a handful of young civilians struggle to escape the conflict. To save his friends and family, the reluctant warrior Seabook Arno becomes the pilot of a new Gundam which bears the code name F91.','/pD1VbnZQtMNjSNr3Nopw8ATHL95.jpg','1991-03-16',115,'Released',NULL,'Mobile Suit Gundam F91',16308,3.696,6.5,'Z6Dtq9FOvNk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14728,_binary '\0','/hmizqGOcCIppb6y2FuXd924yO7r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0159693',4.6,1768,'en','Razor Blade Smile','A 19th century woman, who has become one of the undead, acts as a hired killer in modern times. When she starts knocking off part of the elite businessmen, \"The Illuminati\", who secretly are taking over business and the government, she becomes the target of a hired Scotland Yard detective. Of course, the head of \"The Illuminati\" is the vampire who first gave her immortality.','/sMVuGc7VU9Sp4SLz544QhjtWtjK.jpg','1998-10-16',102,'Released','Part Seductress. Part Assassin. All Vampire.','Razor Blade Smile',28766,1.4461,4.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14729,_binary '\0','/lIYMmZTRtsfJHrkTugvcvFVBDQ2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0159696',6.7,1667,'en','Relax... It\'s Just Sex','A tight-knit group of thirty-somethings -- gay, lesbian and straight -- struggle to live, love and stay friends in modern-day Los Angeles as circumstances conspire to tear them apart.','/7IfXHRstu6TRyZorQ8Xy4yWDfdV.jpg','1998-06-28',110,'Released','With friends like these, who needs family?','Relax... It\'s Just Sex',84586,1.9139,5.9,'J-VYnoNKWAc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14730,_binary '\0','/ztM695T5nCr2DlGeZ1Akij8XqN6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0159730',5.1,3109,'en','The Sex Monster','A neurotic L.A. building contractor pushes his reluctant wife into having a threesome. Unfortunately for him, his wife gets more out of it than he does and begins seducing every female she meets, including the contractor\'s secretary.','/u3otrY7hETbYjId7gzJnuGEyzSU.jpg','1999-05-15',97,'Released',NULL,'The Sex Monster',14383,3.6685,5.086,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14731,_binary '\0','/lfyq9S7ih7liOJgR2unaCJnQ54l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0159784',6.2,7438,'en','Takedown','Kevin Mitnick is quite possibly the best hacker in the world. Hunting for more and more information, seeking more and more cyber-trophies every day, he constantly looks for bigger challenges. When he breaks into the computer of a security expert and an ex-hacker, he finds one - and much more than that...','/axBeZMzdFUEMu4j59JLUSV3Cf2A.jpg','2000-03-15',92,'Released','The world has a right to know.','Takedown',10429,3.1503,6.1,'2Kdpiaqx7KI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14732,_binary '\0','/4h3sspcWhhdiJvOEfxv5FlndiCc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0159995',6.2,1524,'en','Angel\'s Dance','A young hitman is asked to prove himself by killing an innocent woman.','/rIUsUsc1ONmwKEzkXcZhE34jGxN.jpg','1999-02-25',99,'Released','Don\'t mess with an angel and expect to be saved.','Angel\'s Dance',94894,1.8054,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14733,_binary '\0','/dE6xTBdthy3d9GYIIbbndFr4AOD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0160009',5.7,32608,'en','The Art of War','Neil Shaw is both agent and weapon - a critical line of defense for the Secretary General of the United Nations. He does not even officially exist. As an international security expert, he must uncover an international plot in which ruthless terrorists threatened to bring down the United Nations on the eve of an historic summit with China. A mysterious chain of events leads to the murder of the Chinese U.N. Ambassador, and the terrorists frame Neil Shaw, the one man they believe can stop them. Accused of the crime, Shaw goes underground — in effect, vanishing from his own life — as he tries to stop what could become World War III.','/9fbStI2ht3gMgsVRusqoBDWeK9c.jpg','2000-08-25',117,'Released','Do you know who your enemy is?','The Art of War',11398,7.2576,5.686,'rKFmSpB-uGQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14734,_binary '\0','/oq3IOr7QvEmei0eXsXacqaMPqlV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0160127',5.7,208255,'en','Charlie\'s Angels','The captivating crime-fighting trio who are masters of disguise, espionage and martial arts are back! When a devious mastermind embroils them in a plot to destroy individual privacy, the Angels, aided by their loyal sidekick Bosley, set out to bring down the bad guys. But when a terrible secret is revealed, it makes the Angels targets for assassination.','/paDTaHGLxhacythNZCT86VPanm6.jpg','2000-11-02',98,'Released','Get some action.','Charlie\'s Angels',4327,17.9332,5.852,'GtB603KpU9g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14735,_binary '\0','/1xoA2eSkHxboQwfeaf0wdjsu2Q2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0160184',5.4,31295,'en','D-Tox','A disgraced FBI agent with a drinking problem joins nine other troubled law enforcement officers at an isolated detox clinic in the wilds of Wyoming. But the therapeutic sanctuary becomes a nightmarish hellhole when a major snowstorm cuts off the clinic from the outside world and enables a killer on the inside to get busy.','/hfWsyD0h9vhvB5LhHygQjMdBtWa.jpg','2002-01-04',96,'Released','Survival is a Killer.','D-Tox',10375,4.3211,5.6,'L3x9RpAmjRc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14736,_binary '\0','/4vzGCb8ohvCImk0tke1cusgXFIQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0160236',4,11954,'en','Dudley Do-Right','Royal Canadian Mountie Dudley Do-right is busy keeping the peace in his small mountain town when his old rival, Snidely Whiplash, comes up with a plot to buy all the property in town, then start a phony gold rush by seeding the river with gold nuggets.','/4LP5BieqdFNlCFjxsvaA3d6hGGd.jpg','1999-08-27',77,'Released','He\'s dedicated. He\'s honest. He\'s a Mountie who always gets his man...well, almost always.','Dudley Do-Right',17709,3.1778,4.155,'limQX9SHaVc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14737,_binary '\0','/msQroAI9XORkT5YH7JCSGBxgp70.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0160289',5.5,1411,'en','Four Dogs Playing Poker','With the help of their mentor Felix, a group of the best friends and first-time thieves steal a valuable statuette for a ruthless black market art dealer. After the amateurs botch the delivery of the objet d\'art, the dealer kills Felix and forces the remaining four to \"find\" $1 million within a week\'s time or face certain death.','/6v4Cx2uf3S1UvBvAhKv2kAMz4hq.jpg','2000-06-06',98,'Released',NULL,'Four Dogs Playing Poker',20445,2.1767,4.241,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14738,_binary '\0','/imDJN3JFrjbrgSweymA9nHVz5tt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0160298',5.3,1501,'en','Trippin\'','Greg is near the end of his senior year in high school, wanting to go to the prom, eyeing Cinny (the school\'s beauty with brains) from afar, and regularly trippin\', daydreaming about being a big success as a poet, a student, a lover. His mom wants him to apply to colleges, but Greg hasn\'t a clue. One of his teachers, Mr. Shapic, tries to inspire him, too. He finally figures out he can get close to Cinny if he asks her for help with college applications. But friendship isn\'t enough, he wants romance and a prom date. So, he tells a few lies and, for awhile, it seems to be working. Then, things fall apart and Greg has to figure out how to put the trippin aside and get real.','/gKdbdPg6Ye8TOpGGDFQ0NeVVSSI.jpg','1999-05-12',94,'Released','He\'s a legend. In his own mind.','Trippin\'',53862,1.7698,5.333,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14739,_binary '\0','/4PqIL1UJfvowW67hANZqgdA9uC3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0160338',5.9,2841,'en','Guinevere','A young girl from an affluent family rebels and becomes involved with a much older photographer.','/1isgjzl3mwVoxlRd7sqJ7COzwZw.jpg','1999-09-12',104,'Released','He was her first love... she was his last.','Guinevere',60994,1.8191,5.7,'oZcQUc_S-SY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14740,_binary '\0','/1tPQi7zEefICSjPf83S1ynvv5bj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0160393',4.9,1365,'en','Ice','After the whole North of the Equator freezes below zero, a group of people in Los Angeles risk their lives while trying to \"escape\" from the city\'s hostile conditions, in order to take a ship to a hotter place on Earth.','/tilZyozOjIZVEPZvz7nCXLTjv09.jpg','1998-07-21',93,'Released','The ultimate disaster... The world is covered in ice','Ice',36979,2.3765,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14741,_binary '\0','/dv4tLF2gISz3w1e9YK3rK1jxpLj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0160399',6.2,25557,'en','Impostor','A top-secret government weapons designer is arrested by a clandestine government organization on suspicion of being a clone created by the hostile alien race wanting to take over Earth.','/7Uy4JbalP0mEyKnFW2IorQDmbBa.jpg','2001-12-03',102,'Released','In the Future, not everyone is who they seem to be.','Impostor',4965,5.7133,6.1,'Vh6xFG7l8ss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14742,_binary '\0','/um2OI4jCk5edWnyGtoMc43gJJuc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0160401',6.2,7626,'en','In Too Deep','Drug lord Dwayne Gittens rules Cincinnati with an iron fist. No wonder he\'s known as \"God\" on the streets. Determined to break Gittens\' stranglehold on the city is undercover cop Jeffrey Cole. But as Cole takes on an assumed identity to penetrate Gittens\' criminal empire, he makes a disturbing discovery -- he kind of likes being a gangster.','/mYteXffai9mmShyGCa4nPhfGCLQ.jpg','1999-08-25',95,'Released','He didn\'t know how far he\'d have to go.','In Too Deep',22314,4.0127,6.4,'RQMpbyFjsbc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14743,_binary '\0','/1JlxSn7pVoSkWQfOoyMZeXYehdy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0160403',5.9,1280,'en','The Independent','A notorious B-movie director tries for a comeback by seeking out the film rights to the life story of a serial killer who wants his biography film to be a musical.','/wx3xTqcp9fzPa3Dv1SiF8D3O3hY.jpg','2000-11-10',95,'Released','Morty Fineman. Artist. Visionary. Madman.','The Independent',81442,1.8093,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14744,_binary '\0','/dkwT2Ac0jkBRpQLEdD0e0vaONRS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0160429',4.4,4542,'en','The King and I','Widowed Welsh mother Anna Loenowens becomes a governess and English tutor to the wives and many children of the stubborn King Mongkut of Siam. Anna and the King have a clash of personalities as she works to teach the royal family about the English language, customs and etiquette, and rushes to prepare a party for a group of European diplomats who must change their opinions about the King.','/kbEA2LEFh1MX9EraNQSiq9ajs24.jpg','1999-03-19',87,'Released','The All New Animated Family Spectacular Adapted From The Musical By Rodgers And Hammerstein','The King and I',47288,3.2688,5.429,'BD7-hz-qmBM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14745,_binary '\0','/zz7InT2UIrk4barylhP0gmHVBpW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0160440',7.2,2505,'ja','狂った果実','Two brothers compete for the amorous favors of a young woman during a seaside summer of gambling, boating, and drinking.','/tQIuAQe0E09L8WfVa5hqjMQ7nIU.jpg','1956-07-12',86,'Released',NULL,'Crazed Fruit',86664,2.106,6.9,'aDLre9jun6k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14746,_binary '\0','/gGTzXQsIeVTLoqihn7fcJk9GFnI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0160484',4.8,11801,'en','Lost Souls','A young woman becomes aware of a conspiracy to enable the Devil to walk the Earth in human form. To defeat the prophesy, she must convince a respected New York crime journalist, who is devoid of faith, that he is in fact the target of the conspiracy.','/9DOq3KqGrNbqa3z5M8iDJ2wuaxJ.jpg','2000-10-13',97,'Released','They\'ve had their 2000 years... now it\'s our turn.','Lost Souls',10383,4.3956,5.069,'2pBypER8kgY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14747,_binary '\0','/ylWm0EQNIrcIbjpeUhHKTfD1Ugw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0160509',6.5,2275,'en','Agnes Browne','Set in Dublin in 1967, the story of feisty woman, who along with her seven children, learns to cope with adversity after the unexpected death of her husband.','/bgZ0lDvN0W8OLjPki1Me1JhtBrH.jpg','1999-11-08',92,'Released','When Agnes Browne\'s husband died, she discovered something amazing... Herself.','Agnes Browne',15506,2.0337,6.2,'_AzQ1BYgiYU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14748,_binary '\0','/lAIvDYjzKSqC0zbydqCk1sx6s96.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0160513',6.5,4965,'en','A Map of the World','School nurse Alice Goodwin lives with her husband and two daughters on a dairy farm in a small Wisconsin community. After an accident on her property involving a friend\'s child, the town turns against her and Alice finds herself fighting charges of child abuse.','/yhoXmw3zbds7gjDPJfA7CiNNssI.jpg','1999-09-13',125,'Released','A woman\'s life falls apart after she\'s blamed for an accident on her property.','A Map of the World',54933,3.0181,6.047,'ON9ZtvKd_qw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14749,_binary '\0','/sHnvSBVKjbkqTXFRgDbaBfGKIOL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0160611',6.3,14813,'en','Ordinary Decent Criminal','Michael Lynch is a notorious criminal with two wives and a flair for showmanship. He\'s also a huge embarrassment to the local police, who are determined to bring him down once and for all.','/jZiORaxALVDGoMUBau85E4CWB0d.jpg','2000-01-07',93,'Released','Stealing Is The Best Revenge','Ordinary Decent Criminal',12490,3.4835,6.156,'-AfXL5PZt10','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14750,_binary '\0','/ckZjtGdYQAJYarmNxsIS0VSvqBE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0160620',6,5079,'en','Oxygen','When housewife Frances Hannon is abducted and buried alive, detective Madeline Foster is brought in. With only 24 hours before Frances\' oxygen runs out, Madeline pursues the trail laid by a killer calling himself Harry Houdini. After capturing him, Madeline brings Harry back to the police station, but is unable to get him to confess where Frances is buried. As time runs down, Harry gets inside the head of unstable, alcoholic Madeline.','/9qejeCJ2lUevfwRdwdGADuoFX0X.jpg','1999-11-12',92,'Released','A killer. A cop. Someone\'s... buried alive.','Oxygen',18561,2.8596,6.066,'Yt0qyZ6ZeEI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14751,_binary '\0','/ojcY1gtiSk0HHCbmCJ8YOrx9rcF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0160644',5.5,3782,'en','Passion of Mind','A psychological romantic thriller where fantasy and reality become indistinguishable for a woman leading a double life in her dreams.','/A7lzVd2YHz85pgOugGJCJ983bQB.jpg','2000-01-07',105,'Released','What if you had two lives at once. What if you knew that one life took place only in your dreams. What if you didn\'t know which life was real.','Passion of Mind',19214,2.6491,5.8,'5HbYGhOndJY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14752,_binary '\0','/eQYgghhQdxlW8hKAab40MhNeOnq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0160672',6.7,3191,'en','Joe the King','A destitute 14-year-old struggles to keep his life together despite harsh abuse at his mother\'s hands, harsher abuse at his father\'s, and a growing separation from his slightly older brother.','/pJy18dUA9J9XDuKiboTjEtj6YWL.jpg','1999-01-22',96,'Released','The road to disaster is paved with many small mistakes.','Joe the King',53151,2.7678,5.8,'P-S80SdlVH0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14753,_binary '\0','/euVuflyoWzpaLGOBHZhxwGgldNX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0160797',6.4,53130,'en','Rules of Engagement','A Marine Colonel is brought to court-martial after ordering his men to fire on demonstrators surrounding the American embassy in Yemen.','/38iMM0sHOqNz315ApF9bEjT4rFA.jpg','2000-04-07',127,'Released','A hero should never have to stand alone.','Rules of Engagement',10479,5.6939,6.2,'usKVcBTxkfk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14754,_binary '\0','/oSY7vsYlScliVKomRNviGuWXykC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0160862',6,114806,'en','She\'s All That','High school hotshot Zach Siler is the envy of his peers. But his popularity declines sharply when his cheerleader girlfriend, Taylor, leaves him for sleazy reality-television star Brock Hudson. Desperate to revive his fading reputation, Siler agrees to a seemingly impossible challenge. He has six weeks to gain the trust of nerdy outcast Laney Boggs -- and help her to become the school\'s next prom queen.','/a0pepZNFCjggc7Na9gEwbTI1f46.jpg','1999-01-29',95,'Released','These two opposites attract... but EVERYONE\'S trying to keep them apart!','She\'s All That',10314,8.7991,6.343,'kI9fYsgduGE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14755,_binary '\0','/mh30m4DuwBtvI9zwfZF6KfkkRbP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0160916',6,25264,'en','The Story of Us','After 15 years of marriage, Katie and her husband, Ben, have grown apart. While they keep up the facade of having a contented marriage, mostly to not worry their children, they aren\'t happy together and argue frequently. While the kids are away at camp, Katie and Ben decide to separate and try to reassess their relationship to see if they should stay together or split up for good.','/8rm0CZpHW1D7pIv8OguJNHF93LV.jpg','1999-10-14',96,'Released','Can a marriage survive 15 years of marriage?','The Story of Us',12220,5.8294,6.1,'5Ja1AKJeko4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14756,_binary '\0','/eAjt5jswKjomWLLpJqAm3D45Wam.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0161010',5.9,4879,'en','The Trench','The Trench tells the story of a group of young British soldiers on the eve of the Battle of the Somme in the summer of 1916, the worst defeat in British military history. Against this ill-fated backdrop, the movie depicts the soldiers\' experience as a mixture of boredom, fear, panic, and restlessness, confined to a trench on the front lines.','/tEK7lwfMz7Hy3LhuunPH0cjQDXl.jpg','1999-09-17',98,'Released',NULL,'The Trench',27123,3.3152,5.3,'IXzxnROBlgc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14757,_binary '\0','/3lJvJAuPq4nSXRZwGvqaZX1eM2P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0161023',6.7,3801,'en','Tumbleweeds','Whenever trouble strikes in one of her relationships, single mother Mary Jo Walker and her daughter, Ava, pack up and move to another city, a routine Ava is tiring of. This time, they are helped on their move to San Diego by trucker Jack Ranson. While Ava settles in, getting a leading part in the school play, Jack starts dating Mary Jo but soon reveals himself to be controlling and aggressive. Mary Jo prepares to flee again, angering Ava.','/2SdW45O7bPDTe0zLzNHhEcacNAk.jpg','1999-11-24',102,'Released','They ran away from everything but each other.','Tumbleweeds',55123,1.6574,6.4,'WhV3uzr6sZ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14758,_binary '\0','/dN0Y9PpPjW8pX4ZcdxarzswI2K6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0161081',6.6,146896,'en','What Lies Beneath','Norman and Claire Spencer are a seemingly happily married couple who uncover a terrible secret… a secret so disturbing it threatens to destroy them.','/2L3Cn0CizbSy2E9KJt1SiOSyb6p.jpg','2000-07-21',130,'Released','He was the perfect husband until his one mistake followed them home.','What Lies Beneath',2655,12.121,6.437,'s6nTJMdrGVU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14759,_binary '\0','/tONZXxOfDjYYSeVaGSmLpHpqO5B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0161083',5.5,18287,'en','What\'s the Worst That Could Happen?','Thief Kevin Caffery attempts to rob from the home of rich businessman Max Fairbanks. But Fairbanks catches him and steals his cherished ring that his girlfriend gave him. Caffery is then bent on revenge and getting his ring back with the help of his partners.','/dF9vz1LB6078ULfweT2vxdWZzos.jpg','2001-05-31',94,'Released','It takes a thief to nail a crook.','What\'s the Worst That Could Happen?',14034,6.0485,5.5,'_V-98mcrejg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14760,_binary '\0','/645iJzNG9A8FqKQ3BhPblKWI2Nm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0161100',7,11310,'en','The Wood','In the panicky, uncertain hours before his wedding, a groom with prenuptial jitters and his two best friends reminisce about growing up together in the middle-class African-American neighborhood of Inglewood, California. Flashing back to the twenty-something trio\'s childhood exploits, the memories capture the mood and nostalgia of the \'80s era.','/yEWMSJHkzMLgsTgsvR5TxuP3lBt.jpg','1999-07-16',106,'Released','From boyhood to manhood, you can always count on your best friends.','The Wood',16158,2.4865,6.7,'koP2IdQhA_I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14761,_binary '\0','/xHk51fVV0Tt6RHZvzsqmkoKq6bQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0161216',6.3,2484,'en','Steal This Movie','Five years after Yippie founder Abbie Hoffman goes underground to avoid a drug-related prison sentence, he contacts a reporter to get out the story of the FBI\'s covert spying, harassment and inciting of violence they then blame on the Left.','/wEylWTGRZoOR51wo422rhYXkV6Y.jpg','2000-08-18',107,'Released',NULL,'Steal This Movie',18153,1.9189,5.7,'IxulvgFgTQo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14762,_binary '\0','/usFLaJeqJgIBA65msnNgCXiVjUx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0161292',6.8,11599,'da','Bleeder','Two stories for the price of one: a video store clerk tries to get acquainted with a waitress; a man beats his pregnant wife, unaware that her brother is a violent racist.','/lNF10v7Db2zq53kBcwKGlVcd8Er.jpg','1999-08-06',98,'Released',NULL,'Bleeder',17985,2.5665,6.7,'Y9HVMv78_RY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14763,_binary '\0','/vBAYPI8flVeTo7jiuSHteXB2Gk6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0161492',4.8,4789,'en','The Dentist 2','Dr. Feinstone escapes from the mental hospital where he has been held ever since his wife\'s adultery sent him on a deranged killing spree. Hoping to resume a normal life, he makes his way to a quiet Midwestern town and establishes himself in a new practice under an assumed name. Things are starting to look up for Dr. \'Caine\' – that is, until the day he catches his new love in the arms of someone else. As before, the impact of romantic betrayal sends him over the edge into madness and murder, with his unfortunate patients once again bearing the brunt of his hostility.','/7Ibri70TTY34ucoXsh3DqWM5jqM.jpg','1998-12-11',98,'Released','Brace yourself!','The Dentist 2',37526,4.6494,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14764,_binary '\0','/7WcWTWOmCNLFnazUmIY64eSvMMz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0161860',7.5,14888,'de','Nirgendwo in Afrika','A Jewish woman named Jettel Redlich flees Nazi Germany with her daughter Regina, to join her husband, Walter, on a farm in Kenya. At first, Jettel refuses to adjust to her new circumstances, bringing with her a set of china dishes and an evening gown. While Regina adapts readily to this new world, forming a strong bond with her father\'s cook, an African named Owuor.','/2ED1GaTKhHielGYa1giBsxfoacp.jpg','2001-12-11',140,'Released','One family\'s tale of a homeland lost... and a homeland found.','Nowhere in Africa',1591,2.4188,7,'Hep5_o--OEE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14765,_binary '\0','/fHODRgXkCPUKFtxfGc107D2qwvF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0161970',3.4,3476,'en','Shark Attack','When an accidental death verdict is given on discovery of the remains of a top scientist, within the stomach of a hammerhead shark his closest friend Marine Biologist Steven McRay is not happy with the explanation and travels to investigate further, where he discovers that his friend\'s death was not an isolated incident, and that the local population have been terrorised by a rash of shark attacks.Developments in scientific technology had allowed experts to predict the pattern and likelihood of Shark Attacks, but now it seems that they may also be able to actually control these factors, rendering at their disposal the ultimate Killing machine.Enjoy the water... you may never want to go in the sea again!','/g3xlaPOkt1vFkJqxA32LnudEqrG.jpg','1999-11-09',95,'Released','The worlds deadliest predator just got angry...','Shark Attack',42185,1.8253,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14766,_binary '\0','/hnCm2e0mRKbbxluzy7YQHLAoU7v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0162023',7.3,2895,'de','Tuvalu','Set in a dilapidated indoor swimming pool (the Central Baths in Sofia), the film details the efforts of Anton, a clueless dreamer who yearns to sail the world, and Martha, the button obsessed cashier, to maintain the illusion for Anton\'s blind father that business is thriving. Working to sabotage their efforts is Gregor - Anton\'s brother - an amoral developer who is determined to raze the entire town and construct a sprawling condominium complex. Gregor engineers an accident that seems certain to doom the business and in the process steals away Eva, the beautiful woman of Anton\'s dreams. Will Gregor\'s dastardly plan succeed?','/lnxJMNExjZmAdvfWOQ3L79QLb7l.jpg','1999-11-19',92,'Released',NULL,'Tuvalu',8076,1.1501,6.2,'mQCD3hGHhyg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14767,_binary '\0','/xkhj9A89EeP6qQ1Ca62u7vbmkzS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0162162',7.9,1314,'el','Απόντες','The relationships, changes, and conflicts among six childhood friends from Salamina unfold over a period spanning from the triumphant 1987 EuroBasket victory to the 1994 FIFA World Cup and the Greek national team\'s disappointing performance.','/wpvSaB3x4eb64yyHZqnlHjh5TUe.jpg','1996-12-06',115,'Released',NULL,'Truants',326338,0.7413,6.5,'fAi7Xlwxd4o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14768,_binary '\0','/4gpcNmMgF0leqkntewyi6lZJupS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0162212',7,7722,'en','Brink!','Andy \"Brink\" Brinker and his in-line skating crew--Peter, Jordy, and Gabriella--who call themselves \"Soul-Skaters\" (which means they skate for the fun of it, and not for the money), clash with a group of sponsored skaters, Team X-Bladz--led by Val--with whom they attend high school in southern California. When Brink discovers his family is in financial trouble, he goes against the wishes of his parents and his friends and joins Team X-Bladz. Brink tries to lead a double life but will be able to pull it off?','/hul7jmZJsBOjqKNZIEzxJPyemca.jpg','1998-08-28',91,'Released','It Takes A Champ To Stay In Line.','Brink!',15043,2.5471,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14769,_binary '\0','/oCFVYPXI4IfhtF3GapU2jkDicDI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0162222',7.8,696629,'en','Cast Away','Chuck Noland, a top international manager for FedEx, and Kelly, a Ph.D. student, are in love and heading towards marriage. Then Chuck\'s plane to Malaysia crashes at sea during a terrible storm. He\'s the only survivor, and finds himself marooned on a desolate island. With no way to escape, Chuck must find ways to survive in his new home.','/7lLJgKnAicAcR5UEuo8xhSMj18w.jpg','2000-12-22',143,'Released','At the edge of the world, his journey begins.','Cast Away',8358,19.0409,7.7,'4olwbrY2kwE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14770,_binary '\0','/bAF6YL1zvaP07DRNs4A1NZgNoeR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0162236',6.6,1657,'en','Just Looking','It\'s 1955. Lenny is a 14-year old boy who is totally fascinated by sex. He is too scared to \"do it,\" so he dedicates his summer to seeing two other people do it. Easier said than done. Caught in the act of spying, his mother and stepfather ship him off to spend the summer with his aunt and uncle in \"the country\" -- Queens. His plan looks like a bust and his summer seems destined for boredom, until he meets a whole new group of friends -- young teens who have a \"sex club.\"','/mNCDnjP2pMCH1PLKE3l6eXyDVUK.jpg','1999-10-21',97,'Released','A voyeuristic coming-of-age comedy.','Just Looking',100975,2.986,5.9,'9hQBnuf74MY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14771,_binary '\0','/6zIOO1NrTehQkDaNfvga4luSRQc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0162346',7.3,131828,'en','Ghost World','Two quirky, cynical, teenaged girls try to figure out what to do with their lives following high school graduation. After they play a prank on an eccentric, middle-aged record collector, one of them befriends him, which causes a rift in the girls’ friendship.','/uwKqnUPE4dSM0kKuMW0vXpURh2T.jpg','2001-07-20',111,'Released','Accentuate the negative.','Ghost World',1548,4.0233,7.1,'PXD5GtKF2Dc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14772,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0162348',7.4,2671,'en','Smiling Fish & Goat On Fire','Two brothers share a house in LA\'s Fairfax district: Tony\'s a feckless actor, Chris is an accountant. Both are in relationships on rocky ground. As these emotions swirl, Tony meets his US Postal Service letter carrier, a single mom named Kathy who\'s come to LA from Wyoming with her daughter, a budding actress. Chris meets Anna, an Italian beauty working in the States for a few months wrangling animals on movie sets. Chris also befriends Clive, an aging and crusty man whose longing for his recently-deceased wife is a portrait of true love. Can Clive\'s example help Chris sort out his love life, and can Tony grow up enough to see the possibilities with Kathy and her daughter?','/cGCNG3Md9t0Zvhksr27aqXa1AI9.jpg','1999-09-16',90,'Released','two brothers, four women and the search for Magnetic Perfection','Smiling Fish & Goat On Fire',125537,1.561,5.2,'0yTRCA27HWg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14773,_binary '\0','/mZEsbQGrxuGbIsnGteaFVni5lQU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0162360',6.3,10704,'en','Happy, Texas','Two escaped convicts roll into the village of Happy, Texas, where they\'re mistaken for a gay couple who work as beauty pageant consultants. They go along with it to duck the police, but the local sheriff has a secret of his own.','/5bUoL781c0YdWmqtcNWjbPATyAb.jpg','1999-12-03',98,'Released','Escaped convicts disguised as beauty pageant experts? This could get ugly.','Happy, Texas',24066,2.4528,5.7,'WKmiiF1aOrs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14774,_binary '\0','/qOzN3bxxUgIMgkBNEhLKPqRcIWV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0162426',7.1,6145,'de','Kurz und schmerzlos','Gabriel, Bobby and Costa are old friends from Altona, a multicultural hood in Hamburg. Just out of prison, Gabriel wants to turn his back on crime, but the others continue to operate as petty criminals. Friendships are tested as the trio navigate a dark world of mafia bosses and deals gone wrong.','/cVyYb5REN5cX5CWAr7wcdu7cT4Y.jpg','1998-10-15',100,'Released',NULL,'Short Sharp Shock',407,1.4896,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14775,_binary '\0','/oZDE1soPkYi9mhGr0AtucE76sbs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0162480',6.3,7209,'hi','Mr. & Mrs. Khiladi','A slacker falls in love with a rich girl. Now he must impress her father to marry her.','/hyD1LX15vx5hGSNIgzt2Swz9Pau.jpg','1997-10-09',133,'Released',NULL,'Mr. & Mrs. Khiladi',170838,1.3193,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14776,_binary '\0','/k7oBefddAsdndcHdoU7sIfd3K3g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0162503',4.3,1491,'it','Nuda per Satana','Italian Gothic horror that tells the tale of a man who stops at a remote castle hoping to get medical help for an injured woman, only to find the inhabitants mirror the darker sides of the woman and himself.','/fpzVjRkf5tnUxUDiHY3xuYk6O1b.jpg','1974-10-30',82,'Released',NULL,'Nude for Satan',35718,1.4927,4.3,'RMIyh7Gzoo8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14777,_binary '\0','/6x4d95RgN3jbZMN3t9CoWyuhiQz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0162625',6.7,4677,'fi','Rukajärven tie','It is the summer of 1941 and the Finnish army has been mobilized along the border with Russia. A platoon led by Lt. Eero Perkola is waiting for orders to go on the offensive. The platoon receives orders for a recon mission through the wilderness around the Lieksa lake to search for possible Russian defensive positions.','/4fVl9Sw94BIv5MMr0Rn5nqh9cCN.jpg','1999-01-22',123,'Released','Whatever happens to you in this war, I will wait for you...','Ambush',49320,2.1291,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14778,_binary '\0','/sblTwYXpm6Nrl4qewg3526lBdlK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0162650',6,86098,'en','Shaft','New York police detective John Shaft arrests Walter Wade Jr. for a racially motivated slaying. But the only eyewitness disappears, and Wade jumps bail for Switzerland. Two years later Wade returns to face trial, confident his money and influence will get him acquitted -- especially since he\'s paid a drug kingpin to kill the witness.','/pn7AE658mAHDS5xOinIeIOF7zBE.jpg','2000-06-15',99,'Released','Still the man, any questions?','Shaft',479,6.761,6.026,'DcLG3AfyVDI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14779,_binary '\0','/m8t7K3LcAY7bpyQ7iQ5kGsrcjnh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0162661',7.3,416242,'en','Sleepy Hollow','Skeptical young detective Ichabod Crane gets transferred to the hamlet of Sleepy Hollow, New York, where he is tasked with investigating the decapitations of three people – murders the townsfolk attribute to a legendary specter, The Headless Horseman.','/1GuK965FLJxqUw9fd1pmvjbFAlv.jpg','1999-11-19',105,'Released','Heads will roll.','Sleepy Hollow',2668,16.9461,7.195,'XB-y10r77V8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14780,_binary '\0','/maMyyb4zswshTkcBv5OGCsG8RG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0162662',6.1,1239,'en','A Slipping Down Life','A young woman becomes obsessed with a small-time North Carolina rock singer.','/xxWjd3dbWSMwTeSHaSukFHY84p6.jpg','1999-01-22',109,'Released',NULL,'A Slipping Down Life',67962,2.0217,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14781,_binary '\0','/pXXhErx4sn30BuOnhNeGJX8mQ7r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0162677',6.7,44530,'en','Summer of Sam','Spike Lee\'s take on the \"Son of Sam\" murders in New York City during the summer of 1977 centering on the residents of an Italian-American Northeast Bronx neighborhood who live in fear and distrust of one another.','/yvGGA2CbT6xyFVTZUA9f2ok0q5V.jpg','1999-06-28',142,'Released','No one is safe from Son of Sam.','Summer of Sam',10279,4.849,6.5,'sPM5TzVBCfo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14782,_binary '\0','/fPFFpFx2uYsCeffgv3quYvw62pi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0162710',7.2,10034,'en','Trick','Gabriel is a young, aspiring musical composer whose life seems stuck in the First Act. When his new musical number gets a critical reception, a theatre colleague, Perry, tells Gabriel that he needs to get a life before he can write about one – so he heads straight for his local gay bar.','/3uphUbyfQkiKPt29WIO1vrX0Zyx.jpg','1999-07-23',89,'Released','A story about two guys trying to make it in the big city.','Trick',1812,2.3661,6.9,'RgDyBdZpJjI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14783,_binary '\0','/z0zdlob3WACzF8I4grXI4IfZOo9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0162711',4.9,1706,'en','Trixie','Passed over at work and numbed after she witnesses a colleague\'s murder, security guard Trixie Zurbo takes a relatively easy job at a lakefront casino, working undercover keeping an eye out for pickpockets. Trixie meets an assortment of colorful regulars: Kirk Stans, the casino\'s lounge act who drinks too much and is a dead-on mimic; Ruby Pearli , a glamorous, young and knowledgeable barfly; and Dex Lang, a raffish ladies\' man who pays attention to Trixie in a way that\'s hard for her to ignore.','/fWNoZeG9GYj1uCBWIAlE5BRL7ad.jpg','2000-06-28',116,'Released','The best private detective in the biz','Trixie',31610,2.2919,4.8,'xXaNjvZ9Va4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14784,_binary '\0','/d9ltRq4tB8XIEhiXbW23FzlJF4U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0162735',6.1,1441,'en','Vendetta','Based on a true story, Vendetta tells the shocking and tragic story of a group of Sicilian immigrants working on the New Orleans docks in the 1890\'s. After the Chief of Police was brutally murdered, much of the city\'s Sicilian population was rounded up and brought in for questioning. Eventually, thirteen were formally tried for murder and nine went to trial, and while they were acquitted, a series of brutal lynchings showed they had as much to fear from the city\'s general populace as they did from the corrupt police force.','/9ndP7ySPPYFvETowqA5HbG22hZm.jpg','1999-09-12',117,'Released','Threats. Intimidation. Murder. His way is the only way.','Vendetta',105462,1.7387,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14785,_binary '\0','/kKYWjOuBLdyPi0vOoBMAu0mP3wf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0162766',4.8,1394,'en','The White River Kid','Two con men are traveling through the American South when they are held hostage by a serial killer who is running from the authorities.','/qdULc09j1WCnQDLcHcd4jIHH9TW.jpg','1999-01-01',99,'Released',NULL,'The White River Kid',47701,3.0162,5.1,'iy-qkWDrxcA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14786,_binary '\0','/hSMl003cRUPyZLttYe1PxyNHxcZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0162830',7.1,4116,'en','Twin Falls Idaho','Francis and Blake Falls are Siamese twins who live in a neat little room in a rundown hotel. While sharing some organs, Blake is always fit and Francis is very sickly. Into their world comes a young lady, who turns their world upside down. She gets involved with Blake, and convinces the two to attend a Halloween party, where they can pass themselves off as wearing a costume. Eventually Francis becomes really ill, and they have to be separated. They then face the physical and mental strains that come from their proposed separation.','/boBbVY67YhGC4PWuqyQFysP3mN4.jpg','1999-07-30',111,'Released','A different kind of love story.','Twin Falls Idaho',33430,1.7786,6.9,'Z-RUwT26eNE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14787,_binary '\0','/s8J0aq227wyA1VTojCy3zihlsyh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0162866',7.2,6731,'zh','荆轲刺秦王','In pre-unified China, the King of Qin sends his concubine to a rival kingdom to produce an assassin for a political plot, but as the king\'s cruelty mounts she finds her loyalty faltering.','/hroNcPp2cn6mMWcYpkEud2GY78f.jpg','1998-10-08',162,'Released',NULL,'The Emperor and the Assassin',10387,2.6576,6.9,'fTaU6ziWKD8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14788,_binary '\0','/2ejyFXksKlzl1Mit04bUXJFdzVQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0162897',6.7,1377,'en','The Hunley','CSS Hunley tells the incredible true story of the crew of the manually propelled submarine CSS Hunley, during the siege of Charleston of 1864. It is a story of heroism in the face of adversity, the Hunley being the first submersible to sink an enemy boat in time of war. It also relates the human side of the story relating the uncommon and extaordinary temperament of the 9 men who led the Hunley into history and died valiantly accomplishing this feat.','/dPmwzVG7AGHGoFyR8PpiswGiQ8T.jpg','1999-07-11',94,'Released',NULL,'The Hunley',65431,1.6968,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14789,_binary '\0','/vKpDBXEwRzuIWj4b5y9CoEmletQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0162930',1.8,3466,'en','Die Hard Dracula','We find Steven, a good-looking American hero devastated by the death of his girlfriend, wandering through Europe and looking for happiness. A car accident leads him to a small town sitting literally in the shadow of Dracula\'s castle. The frightened villagers have been preyed upon for generations. Steven is stunned to discover Carla, the innkeeper\'s daughter looks identical to his dead girlfriend. When she begs for his assistance against the vampire, he agrees to help them. Together with Dr. Van Helsing, he attacks Dracula using a variety of ingenious weapons against the supernatural. Dracula shows unusual powers that defeat them at every turn, including fireballs and lightning from his fingertips. He is constantly on a search for blood to satisfy his centuries-old bickering brides. When Dracula kidnaps Carla right out of her bed, Steven and Van Helsing desperately try to kill him before it is too late.','/2Qvc0z01kA60aZ8xkMwMvSIdyz3.jpg','1998-01-01',88,'Released','To kill the unkillable, one step at a time.','Die Hard Dracula',31260,0.7216,2.9,'BL0tqOZ5tZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14790,_binary '\0','/xlrwGUVkIWwJqoLGkgeLV5tUsbm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0162958',5.9,2183,'en','Final Cut','A group of friends gather for a wake, and are shown a video shot by Jude and starring them before he dies. Things go rapidly downhill.','/ckeyOoyGjcnsEoCXdMPOFW5Rzd7.jpg','1998-11-13',93,'Released','The camera never lies... it\'s a pity about friends','Final Cut',47072,2.2174,5.5,'p9lPrngt9v0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14791,_binary '\0','/zQ4sKBzuX3tgGpl6eiGYT0ur9Nk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0162973',7.5,14034,'en','Get Real','Sensitive rural town model student Steven Carter hides his gay feelings, except with his neighbor and best friend Linda. Suddenly his desperate search for partners leads to a blind date with golden boy John Dixon, bound for an Oxbridge career.','/k7KCBnt1VXFhPjoTSt4MePr1MpI.jpg','1998-08-16',111,'Released','Boy meets boy. Boy likes boy. Boy, oh, boy.','Get Real',24584,2.1077,7,'dsqlriNlXr4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14792,_binary '\0','/9I9VYNau1KU77OQAcF6WnfOtGcU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0162983',4.9,13860,'en','Hanging Up','Three sisters - Georgia, Eve, and Maddy - do what they do best with life, love, and lunacy on the telephone lines that bind - when their curmudgeonly father, Lou, is admitted to a Los Angeles Hospital. After years of wild living, intermittent affection, and constant phoning, he is finally threatening to die.','/lnnFFGhIXi6ZDU3r29eKHKTHdq0.jpg','2000-02-16',94,'Released','Every family has a few hang-ups.','Hanging Up',10385,4.6438,5.3,'w-5Cbu7QLDI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14793,_binary '\0','/8v8x4vVbRgrsdU3M4drnD7HQbfe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0163025',6,376046,'en','Jurassic Park III','In need of funds for research, Dr. Alan Grant accepts a large sum of money to accompany Paul and Amanda Kirby on an aerial tour of the infamous Isla Sorna. It isn\'t long before all hell breaks loose and the stranded wayfarers must fight for survival as a host of new -- and even more deadly -- dinosaurs try to make snacks of them.','/oQXj4NUfS3r3gHXtDOzcJgj1lLc.jpg','2001-07-18',92,'Released','This time, it\'s not just a walk in the park!','Jurassic Park III',331,0.9424,6.177,'FBRWNdXpG1g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14794,_binary '\0','/zHYaZA52Wo2I0dGBtOg9hmXJeAB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0163114',5.3,1325,'en','Murder à la Mod','Naive young Karen wants to help her struggling amateur filmmaker boyfriend Christopher raise enough money so he can divorce his wife. Meanwhile, jolly psycho-prankster Otto stalks the building where Christopher is shooting a low-grade adult movie in order to keep himself afloat.','/rywNtpPmIlS5uIL85gk2gOAuEuU.jpg','1968-05-01',80,'Released','A Lost Horror Film from Brian De Palma!','Murder à la Mod',64936,1.7809,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14795,_binary '\0','/kvZxYVwy75O35YqvkHztYijFVRE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0163187',5.6,111831,'en','Runaway Bride','Having already left three grooms at the altar, Maggie Carpenter is branded \"the runaway bride\" by jaded New York journalist Ike Graham. But, after his facts are called into question, Ike races to Maggie\'s hometown to save his reputation and report on her upcoming fourth trip down the aisle – during which he\'s convinced she\'ll run again. Though he\'s there on a muckraking mission, Ike can\'t help but fall for this breathtaking heartbreaker.','/wzivR0yWJStVdhcl0A5rQvVdTQ7.jpg','1999-07-30',116,'Released','Catch her if you can.','Runaway Bride',4806,9.2547,6.095,'Ay8QC6tL7k0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14796,_binary '\0','/syAk28k87qt1GEWtQcRsib5Bt1A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0163375',4.4,2151,'en','Vicious Lips','Sometime in the distant future, a fledgling band gets an opportunity for a breakthrough, if they can make it in time to a faraway planet to perform in a very popular club.','/o1FXCkhdYn4OwD0TvIhtAeRuWj9.jpg','1987-02-01',84,'Released','They\'re Lost and Loose in Outer Space.','Vicious Lips',38134,1.5621,4.9,'UPWrd7CDh-I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14797,_binary '\0','/bKLUmQJKl8tERC0oZMphMVJ0MAk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0163494',7.1,2765,'ja','SPACE ADVENTURE コブラ','Cobra, a notorious space pirate, is enlisted by bounty hunter Jane to rescue her sister from the strange being known as Crystal Bowie, but then finds himself drawn into a complex struggle over the fate of a mysterious wandering planet.','/4qjxYE7kM01YwTlFjx0vMh8Jc5N.jpg','1982-07-03',99,'Released','The most wanted man in the entire universe','Space Adventure Cobra',81850,3.4333,6.7,'Sos77QtKfHg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14798,_binary '\0','/snkw8maFYKOf42H8pFu9Wt1x0aN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0163563',6.9,3655,'ja','バレット・バレエ','After his girlfriend commits suicide, a man becomes embroiled in gang warfare attempting to obtain a gun in hopes to kill himself.','/v3bQVcIvajOJLamwejJOUTZHK7Z.jpg','1998-12-01',87,'Released',NULL,'Bullet Ballet',25951,1.9384,7.1,'t0TI8YAkz60','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14799,_binary '\0','/s5kqyWWjuWNNjWEIkPSyqADyjdF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0163579',5.3,10415,'en','Chill Factor','A store clerk and an ice cream truck driver are thrown together when a dying scientist entrusts them with a deadly chemical kept in ice. This chemical will kill every living thing once it melts. They have to take the chemical codenamed \'Elvis\' to the next nearest military base while being chased by terrorists who want it to hold the country for ransom.','/fgPC0xS3o6J5eWFwetssfSD2SEK.jpg','1999-09-01',101,'Released','Keeping cool is a matter of life and death.','Chill Factor',2162,3.049,4.9,'baygP3plKHg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14800,_binary '\0','/cvH1gNIMRITdLzoWv1HNAbRyH3n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0163651',7,473080,'en','American Pie','At a high-school party, four friends find that losing their collective virginity isn\'t as easy as they had thought. But they still believe that they need to do so before college. To motivate themselves, they enter a pact to all \"score\" by their senior prom.','/5P68by2Thn8wHAziyWGEw2O7hco.jpg','1999-07-09',95,'Released','There\'s nothing like your first piece.','American Pie',2105,20.9398,6.618,'Sithad108Og','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14801,_binary '\0','/jBeGCBNfkVsKrFajGETIoscJRvK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0163676',4.7,5055,'en','The In Crowd','A mentally disturbed young woman takes a job at a posh country club and falls in with a clique of wealthy college kids where she\'s taken under the wing of the clique\'s twisted leader, who harbors some dark secrets too terrifying to tell.','/j77l405846qiLb8RGb1egu7ON3r.jpg','2000-07-19',105,'Released','What would you do to get in?','The In Crowd',36047,1.912,4.7,'NPPIooM8c7s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14802,_binary '\0','/bycLClGKY8fWkHKggzzNLNczoXn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0163818',6.1,5946,'cn','殺手之王','Financially troubled, a newbie hitman reluctantly takes the job of finding the plotted killer of a Japanese tycoon.','/oLOFr2PGrtNmQ9rLshIKr6T41UK.jpg','1998-04-03',103,'Released','An army of one... for hire.','Contract Killer',10616,5.4986,7.111,'-G4T9-zY4bM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14803,_binary '\0','/sRskwJS0u9jg9KLcKN9YTsB4PZK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0163887',6,2963,'en','The Audrey Hepburn Story','The film spans from Hepburn\'s early childhood to the 1950s which details her life as a Dutch ballerina, coming to grips with her parents\' divorce, and enduring life in the Nazi-occupied Netherlands during World War II. She then settles in the U.S. where she succeeds in making it big as a movie actress, in such movies as Breakfast at Tiffany\'s.','/w42uOb4BrYPS7aDEYy2hBYh5pVa.jpg','2000-03-27',133,'Released','Experience the loves, tragedies and triumphs of a beloved screen legend.','The Audrey Hepburn Story',60587,2.6828,6.137,'Y_83ZdiRJQc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14804,_binary '\0','/f7sQHmdZdPHaRVt3428XmdoZ8Hs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0163978',6.6,271370,'en','The Beach','Twenty-something Richard travels to Thailand and finds himself in possession of a strange map. Rumours state that it leads to a solitary beach paradise, a tropical bliss - excited and intrigued, he sets out to find it.','/4y7LxD8TSi6AtsM2xSYqUm1gu7u.jpg','2000-02-03',119,'Released','Somewhere on this planet it must exist.','The Beach',1907,9.0843,6.486,'t99_nC_tYVM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14805,_binary '\0','/oJUk1lRbpGF55f5N4ZUPDAp0F72.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0163983',5.1,16037,'en','Bless the Child','When Maggie\'s sister Jenna saddles her with an autistic newborn named Cody she touches Maggie\'s heart and becomes the daughter she has always longed for. But six years later Jenna suddenly re-enters her life and, with her mysterious new husband, Eric Stark, abducts Cody. Despite the fact that Maggie has no legal rights to Cody, FBI agent John Travis takes up her cause when he realizes that Cody shares the same birth date as several other recently murdered children.','/s1RGEF8xIA6ecF8W4do8CaWI0yE.jpg','2000-08-11',107,'Released','Mankind\'s last hope just turned six.','Bless the Child',10391,5.2978,5.4,'ce4Hlm2IOfQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14806,_binary '\0','/6UgzxKBBIdfTLrDQdDdFf1gpBBa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0163988',6.8,82015,'en','Bringing Out the Dead','Once called \"Father Frank\" for his efforts to rescue lives, Frank Pierce sees the ghosts of those he failed to save around every turn. He has tried everything he can to get fired, calling in sick, delaying taking calls where he might have to face one more victim he couldn\'t help, yet cannot quit the job on his own.','/gE2Q8mL0m0EA6HakRyc92uzSPJn.jpg','1999-10-22',121,'Released','Any call can be murder, any stop can be suicide, any night can be the last.','Bringing Out the Dead',8649,7.3886,6.6,'sfUwvmRmMtw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14807,_binary '\0','/kS7B1EXg9HT4dzD71MDMfNBhEIH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0164003',5.9,6170,'en','City of Ghosts','A con man who is on the run from law enforcement in the U.S. travels to Cambodia to collect his share in an insurance scam but discovers more than he bargained for.','/1nZbFdgEjJELfbZeXWLjXx5evHa.jpg','2002-09-10',116,'Released','Where you go when you can\'t turn back.','City of Ghosts',31932,2.7317,5.9,'vWjZwW8jjPY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14808,_binary '\0','/tdmfu9MpDJTossDcDXakBvqzSkv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0164023',6.5,1283,'en','Exiled','NYPD Detective Mike Logan, who was reassigned to Staten Island after punching a corrupt politician, takes on a grisly murder case. When the investigation leads him back to the 27th Precinct, Logan sees a chance to resurrect his flailing career and be reinstated as a homicide detective.','/hz4I3oHkz9wOhCgp3mLKa9Fb1hz.jpg','1998-11-08',87,'Released','A Law & Order movie.','Exiled',87901,1.5258,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14809,_binary '\0','/g6UIASElC5M6jwtV4TZlz1sok3h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0164052',5.9,149430,'en','Hollow Man','Cocky researcher Sebastian Caine is working on a project to make living creatures invisible. Determined to achieve the ultimate breakthrough, Caine pushes his team to move to the next phase — using himself as the subject. The test is a success, but when the process can\'t be reversed and Caine seems doomed to future without flesh, he starts to turn increasingly dangerous.','/sd3qUIv5uoP2oTbqv66CzXSPjKG.jpg','2000-08-04',112,'Released','Think you’re alone? Think again.','Hollow Man',9383,13.1503,6,'PksGHTBW1uE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14810,_binary '\0','/tQ2j2umXauIVV8qXmo6BnE4CyAn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0164063',7.9,2945,'el','Όλα Είναι Δρόμος','Three separate stories about lonely men from Northern Greece facing turning points in their lives. In \"A Silver Coin on the Lips\", a bereaved archaeologist works in the ruins of ancient Philippi and embarks on a journey to heal from a major loss; in \"The Last of the Lesser Whites\", a dedicated game warden helps ornithologists track an endangered lesser white-fronted goose along the Evros River Delta; and in \"Vietnam\", a dejected furniture wholesaler from Kilkis deals with a painful breakup by drinking in a loud, remote club, leading to an emotional collapse.','/w1O7wnL3DaKA0JLMY5B8m4XlOIo.jpg','1998-02-18',118,'Released',NULL,'It\'s a Long Road',167021,0.992,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14811,_binary '\0','/vKzYoegE3Zr4a3PVx8GVyPKavPb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0164085',6.9,6715,'en','Limbo','Traumatized by a fishing boat accident many years before, Joe Gastineau has given up his hopes for a life beyond the odd jobs he takes to support himself. That quickly changes when nomadic club singer Donna de Angelo and her troubled teen-age daughter enter Joe’s life. Both mother and daughter fall for Joe, increasing the friction between them. The tension continues to build when Joe invites them on a pleasure cruise up the Alaskan coast, discovering too late that the trip may cost them their lives.','/1ytI3G3dT6j888ySOwYhpJHz8ED.jpg','1999-06-04',126,'Released','The only thing more dangerous than death...is survival.','Limbo',62676,2.3124,6.6,'HSjiCN--ZKs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14812,_binary '\0','/iq1l8KXcRSwDbmRbaNo7XELmJ3k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0164094',8.1,1368,'el','Μάθε Παιδί μου Γράμματα','The most important political, post-military junta satire about the nation, the religion, the education, the family.','/3fF1nPCqlUOtU59aYARzFn5hiZO.jpg','1981-10-09',96,'Released',NULL,'Educate Yourself My Son',163018,1.0563,7.568,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14813,_binary '\0','/vJd0ZCeGeuG5lzolUNlhoaoPaCK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0164108',5.8,11853,'en','The Muse','With his career on the skids, a Hollywood screenwriter enlists the aid of a modern-day muse, who proves to test his patience.','/hmtvDW52V3EuFmbhTOLjaGMYCDx.jpg','1999-08-27',97,'Released','In Goddess we trust.','The Muse',37718,3.195,5.2,'YKC3g1SCo50','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14814,_binary '\0','/yV08G6ztiu95yHF8jyw42sqL1v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0164114',5.8,23299,'en','Drive Me Crazy','Nicole and Chase live next door to each other but are worlds apart. However, they plot a scheme to date each other in order to attract the interest and jealousy of their respective romantic prey. But in the mist of planning a gala centennial celebration, Nicole and Chase find that the one they always wanted was closer than they ever thought.','/qq2jbAOw5yWTaSPJIRHxvTf0bND.jpg','1999-10-01',91,'Released','The last guy she wants is the only one she needs.','Drive Me Crazy',14429,4.7786,6.6,'kD7CDwoRPkE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14815,_binary '\0','/puVlXLW2gVWQFKJsd9fjYWpdTgZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0164181',6.9,93693,'en','Stir of Echoes','After being hypnotized by his sister-in-law, Tom Witzky begins seeing haunting visions of a girl\'s ghost and a mystery begins to unfold around her.','/9CyJ5aYF27cITX1WSUTENeP4wBE.jpg','1999-09-10',99,'Released','In every mind there is a door that should never be opened.','Stir of Echoes',11601,8.8611,6.707,'Daa5VOnUWsA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14816,_binary '\0','/455z1puGQRuMKumAaDttSEEzqg1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0164184',6.5,135413,'en','The Sum of All Fears','When the president of Russia suddenly dies, a man whose politics are virtually unknown succeeds him. The change in political leaders sparks paranoia among American CIA officials, so CIA director Bill Cabot recruits a young analyst to supply insight and advice on the situation. Then the unthinkable happens: a nuclear bomb explodes in a U.S. city, and America is quick to blame the Russians.','/3E4LW4bjRhEMDeeXeIsmkJ94v8K.jpg','2002-05-31',124,'Released','27,000 nuclear weapons. One is missing.','The Sum of All Fears',4614,14.3381,6.375,'p4Y-0Pun2Eg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14817,_binary '\0','/yedYIJC9lg5V3eGXQJlDNGJxTB5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0164212',6.4,30625,'en','Under Suspicion','A lawyer is asked to come to the police station to clear up a few loose ends in his witness report of a foul murder. \"This will only take ten minutes\", they say, but it turns out to be one loose end after another, and the ten minutes he is away from his speech become longer and longer.','/2snkCKKthT5S8Ua0aMZkeaXkmBi.jpg','2000-08-24',110,'Released','In a world of secrets, the truth is never what it seems.','Under Suspicion',10562,5.1631,6.1,'gyPkbZ_kmEg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14818,_binary '\0','/dOtiEsq9o8kjYqzSBAkXeMX4qv9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0164221',5.1,3136,'en','Virtual Sexuality','A frustrated teenage girl creates her perfect man in a virtual reality machine and in a freak accident, gives him life.','/lMx1firCTM9gs7kVxyRKjHx56Lm.jpg','1999-07-02',92,'Released','If you can\'t find the perfect guy, make one!','Virtual Sexuality',5248,2.6133,5.3,'k6-J1yuamNY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14819,_binary '\0','/k5KUDSvYbxKzcE9zdkixvQ0qLkb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0164312',8.1,2983,'en','42 Up','Director Michael Apted revisits the same group of British-born adults after a 7 year wait. The subjects are interviewed as to the changes that have occurred in their lives during the last seven years.','/hJAYtr8CvnYBBZJlpdYvUMRWNCl.jpg','1999-11-17',133,'Released','In 1964, director Michael Apted interviewed a group of seven year old children for the documentary \"Seven Up\". He\'s been back to film them every seven years. Now they are 42.','42 Up',20565,2.1161,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14820,_binary '\0','/5C6njaciKvyZlKWUrQX7mjdl4D1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0164334',6.4,104989,'en','Along Came a Spider','After the harrowing death of his partner, forensic psychologist and best-selling author Alex Cross cannot forgive himself and has retreated to the peace of retirement. But when a brilliant criminal kidnaps a senator\'s young daughter, he is lured back into action as the kidnapper wants to deal with Alex personally. Teamed with Jezzie Flanigan, the Secret Service agent assigned to protect the missing girl, Alex follows a serpentine trail of clues that leads him to a stunning discovery - the kidnapper wants more than just ransom.','/vipRsbIpwUNf1gjfOcVNizQ1o3c.jpg','2001-04-06',104,'Released','The game is far from over.','Along Came a Spider',2043,11.2478,6.35,'kswRbwYqn3k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14821,_binary '\0','/tbdkGwUuctietvOd2FlIHgmkfWp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0164368',6.6,2686,'fr','Au cœur du mensonge','In a small Breton town, a 10-year-old girl is found murdered. René, her art teacher, a professional painter, is the last person to have seen her alive. The inspector in charge of the investigation immediately questions him. In this small provincial town where people all know each other and regularly meet at the Bar des Amis, René is increasingly unsettled by the other inhabitants\' suspicions and by the inspector\'s investigation. Children stop coming to him for lessons. His wife, Viviane, a district nurse, protects him and supports him with her love. However, a self-centred media-star writer adds to René\'s confusion...','/rqwy4AUMEHCdeJRz4GCMT4c3Pea.jpg','1999-01-13',113,'Released',NULL,'The Color of Lies',45515,2.0811,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14822,_binary '\0','/jgM3wB7ansOorZzkt7lOvWJ6q6q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0164393',4.4,1395,'en','Berserker','Six young adults in the woods run afoul of a berserker, a viking warrior who dons the fur and snout of a bear, and are slain in turn by him.','/sgCzukVYbMepwJTRFyxBAROqR4H.jpg','1987-07-04',85,'Released','It\'s too late to run. There\'s no time to scream... Just close your eyes and pray to die.','Berserker',40463,1.356,4.6,'qjCWK0kxFQ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14823,_binary '\0','/tehFBPaGYefRFfKn6f4Cz5GOxR7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0164519',6.4,1243,'it','Da grande','Marco, a nine year old boy, is in love with his elementary teacher, and feels neglected by his workaholic parents. When they forget about his birthday he wishes he could grow up at once. This really happens and Marco begins a new life as an adult. He rents a room in his teacher\'s flat and she falls in love with him. He even fakes a kidnapping when he runs out of money but he is mistaken for the kidnapper.','/e9YszGfap4GhfNYEtoiU9VEWhah.jpg','1987-12-23',87,'Released',NULL,'Big',57918,0.995,6.034,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14824,_binary '\0','/8v8Uc4PfiZk6g87qdq2L87sCDvE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0164538',7.5,33763,'hi','दिल से..','Journalist Amar falls for a mysterious woman on an assignment, but she does not reciprocate his feelings. However, when Amar is about to get married, the woman shows up at his doorstep asking for help.','/rdnkOPYlHf8WaPRllTz3dsuzpp8.jpg','1998-08-22',163,'Released','Moments of Pain.. Moments of Love.','Dil Se..',21210,3.4642,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14825,_binary '\0','/619PncDFvqD46w6RkoW2nRhZxc7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0164550',5.6,9440,'hi','डुप्लीकेट','Manu, a criminal, finds his doppelganger in a budding chef, Bablu, and uses this fact to his advantage. Later, Manu tries to kill the chef so that he can take over his life and escape the law.','/ylBsNn4xkMlZPk1beZuuwFqrWUK.jpg','1998-05-08',165,'Released','Double Dhamaka','Duplicate',159090,2.3544,6.108,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14826,_binary '\0','/unXW69sfvau9m5uaqadKhLRJ1m1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0164711',6.1,3056,'da','Kærlighed ved første hik','Anja is a beautiful and very well proportioned high school senior... and still a virgin. She insists that she wants her first time to be with a guy, who knows what it\'s about. Her rich (and arrogant, pretentious and obnoxious) boyfriend Peter serves the purpose, and he\'s more than willing. In fact, he\'s pushing forward as much as he can, but Victor, a freshman who has a serious crush on Anja, has other plans. Her first time should definitely not be with this buffoon, and he\'s ready to take it VERY far!','/1OCRb2AxrCXmrtNCXftvMyb68B9.jpg','1999-10-15',85,'Released',NULL,'Love at First Hiccough',23289,1.6465,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14827,_binary '\0','/hzR0YPFfNBM5yJcnsAIOKJtv6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0164756',7.1,8358,'da','Mifunes sidste sang','Kresten, newly wed, is on the threshold of a great career success in his father-in-law’s company. But when the death of his own father takes him back to his poverty-stricken childhood home, far out in the country, his career plans fall apart. For one thing he has to deal with his loveable, backward brother, who is now all alone; for another, he meets a stunning woman who comes to the farm as a housekeeper, in disguise of her real profession as a call-girl.','/qEg7dmFcPqjF5kBYD0Bkz2CVyYB.jpg','1999-03-12',98,'Released',NULL,'Mifune',139,3.0243,7,'d4vbOOPnW6M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14828,_binary '\0','/5R22ALClltFkQD5supuGSThX5kW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0164877',6.5,3269,'es','Sexo, pudor y lágrimas','A comedic drama featuring two couples and two old friends in Mexico City. Tomas visits Carlos and Ana, while Miguel and Andrea are joined by Maria. The presence of guests triggers lust, rejection, infidelities, reconciliation and other consequences.','/1j3TiCXSguHi3IGumXKpQymvUKH.jpg','1999-06-18',110,'Released',NULL,'Sex, Shame & Tears',22512,4.5165,6.6,'VZYQ1qiMJ_o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14829,_binary '\0','/dECKGAenue36W50HYhd3Jh1OJs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0164912',6,162242,'en','Stuart Little','When the Littles adopt Stuart, the mouse, George is initially unwelcoming to his new brother, and the family cat, Snowbell, is even less enthusiastic. Stuart resolves to face these difficulties with as much pluck and courage as he can muster.','/362lcwTJlNyAhitTlp2UraECISR.jpg','1999-12-17',84,'Released','The Little family just got bigger.','Stuart Little',10137,10.504,6.086,'Wlo-sYrADlw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14830,_binary '\0','/gTecjgfB8UEQwDKyEA56IhnLM9X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0164917',6.5,4587,'ja','スプリガン','An elite superhuman agent must stop a foreign military unit from seizing control of an ancient artifact that holds the key to ultimate power.','/glGbrKRq0cqhqUcM9s2LE1Fxfq6.jpg','1998-09-05',90,'Released','It\'s the END of our world.. and the BEGINNING of the next!','Spriggan',16767,2.516,6.1,'VKx5woiP6-4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14831,_binary '\0','/hDwRKONTSGJGd9PlZ9Es4UpeYuj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0164961',6.4,24111,'fr','Vidocq','Paris, 1830. In the heart of the town, Vidocq, a famous detective, disappears as he fights the Alchemist, an assassin that he has been pursuing for a few months. His young biographer, Etienne Boisset, decides to avenge Vidocq\'s death and takes the investigation on...','/3wkhE9fgX1rZbk4oQuzSd5Hoizz.jpg','2001-09-18',98,'Released','To look into his mask was to lose your soul.','Vidocq',9597,3.254,5.963,'mRrhvC8OchI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14832,_binary '\0','/yXKGjr4COubBVnhndbuRhbuNzsY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0164982',7.3,1773,'ja','座頭市あばれ火祭り','The blind masseuse is targeted by the leader of a powerful yakuza group while also fending off a jealous husband bent on revenge. Zatoichi tours Edo\'s underground via a rousing onsen fight scene, gambling houses and the gender-bending character of Umeji, before a final, flame-filled conflagration.','/pJ8LQ4AwC64M5KljSVxR7qwHYSE.jpg','1970-08-12',96,'Released',NULL,'Zatoichi Goes to the Fire Festival',54283,1.4412,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14833,_binary '\0','/4J5c5M1tiStgETZ2wuN514ep025.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0164983',7.2,1472,'ja','座頭市喧嘩太鼓','Zatoichi is forced to kill a young man who owes a debt to a yakuza boss. Moments later, his sister Osode arrives with the money she earned (prostituting herself) to pay his debts. The bosses true motives are revealed and he attempts to steal Osode even though the debt is paid. Zatoichi realizes his grievous error and protects the girl from the gang. Osode and Zatoichi are caught in a dilemma as she must rely on her brother\'s killer for protection and Zatoichi wrestles with the injustice he has caused.','/sNYpnU1uuNfOew0mN0y2xx4rgAZ.jpg','1968-12-28',84,'Released',NULL,'Samaritan Zatoichi',54281,1.3742,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14834,_binary '\0','/amQVLtXyHHTplNx4rF4IX08luzQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0164984',7.1,1696,'ja','座頭市関所破り','Blind swordsman/masseuse Zatoichi befriends a young woman looking for her father, a village leader who has disappeared. As he helps her investigate the disappearance, Zatoichi also becomes involved with another young woman who is trying to help her brother, who has murdered someone at about the same time and place as the missing man was last seen.','/vfDkiTxG3X8FKM6i5SSMMoae2GZ.jpg','1964-12-30',86,'Released',NULL,'Adventures of Zatoichi',54272,1.2485,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14835,_binary '\0','/mbFHUlhWU53VG8VLE5jAcQQVIUR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0164993',6.3,9649,'en','Alice in Wonderland','Alice follows a white rabbit down a rabbit-hole into a whimsical Wonderland, where she meets characters like the delightful Cheshire Cat, the clumsy White Knight, a rude caterpillar, and the hot-tempered Queen of Hearts and can grow ten feet tall or shrink to three inches. But will she ever be able to return home?','/kpXmXjqeyuSYCtNuGMytWQLdKX.jpg','1999-02-28',133,'Released','A Masterpiece of Imagination...','Alice in Wonderland',30923,5.5903,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14836,_binary '\0','/pXOsdvH4xuprxGmZMiCJsRAowi7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0165078',7.6,16000,'ja','ワンダフルライフ','On a cold Monday morning, a group of counselors clock in at an old-fashioned social services office. Their task is to interview the recently deceased, record their personal details, then, over the course of the week, assist them in choosing a single memory to keep for eternity.','/bs2M1hqAQl5LeAOPPRV4drwouZS.jpg','1999-04-17',118,'Released','What is the one memory you would take with you?','After Life',17962,3.3559,7.2,'DN9sr5wVkik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14837,_binary '\0','/kez3aP2trsIQnBpbtlKsJcigH3G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0165196',6.9,1598,'en','Molokai: The Story of Father Damien','The true story of the 19th century Belgian priest, Father Damien, who volunteered to go to the island of Molokai, to console and care for the lepers.','/fIjamNr5wMYZRjGmhAJ4ftOGJ1W.jpg','1999-03-17',109,'Released',NULL,'Molokai: The Story of Father Damien',21644,1.7098,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14838,_binary '\0','/5EiLLM24ZD9QsaLz8DouJIqfvE8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0165303',3.4,1666,'en','The Godson','After the death of his older brother, Guiseppe \"the guppy\" Calzone becomes head of the Calzone Mob family. His aging father knows his son is not cut out for the job, so he sends him to \"Mafia University\". The head of a rival Mafia Family sees this as an opportunity to strike and bring the Calzone Family to its knees. Surrounded by danger, double-crossing and pasta.','/sHbSKVxRRHf18mtp9yinaYlAjK9.jpg','1998-10-06',100,'Released','Some wise guys aren\'t so smart!','The Godson',45758,1.6765,3.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14839,_binary '\0','/guRwzxnn0sHFkrNgvSsLyPq4AEp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0165325',5.4,1246,'it','Immagini di un convento','Locked behind the walls of a convent are an order of beautiful nuns whose vows force them to forget the pleasures of sexual contact. Crazed with lust and desire many of the nuns pleasure themselves and each other in fear of the Mother Superior. One night a wounded man is found on the grounds of the convent and is brought inside to be healed. He becomes the focus of the young nuns\' desires as each one tries to visit this young man. But along with him has come the evil force of Satan. A local priest proceeds to exorcise the demon from within the holy building driving the nuns into a delirium of sexual madness.','/gd2LKbIJrAs86S8YraRTqnE1u7l.jpg','1979-08-07',102,'Released','The Most Explicit Nunsploitation Film Ever Made','Images in a Convent',30493,0,5.1,'o9NvzArwytM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14840,_binary '\0','/8cwxKDaTK0i4XC3UAm3h284bsIT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0165361',6.1,7255,'en','Highway','Jack is caught with the wife of his employer, a Vegas thug. The thug sends goons after Jack, who convinces his best friend, Pilot, to flee with him. Pilot insists that they head for Seattle, but doesn\'t tell Jack why. The goons learn from Pilot\'s drug source where the youths are headed, and they follow, hell bent on breaking Jack\'s feet. On the road, Jack and Pilot give a ride to Cassie, a distressed young woman. She and Jack hit it off. They pick up an aging stoner headed to Seattle for Kurt Cobain\'s memorial, and they help a circus sideshow family. Why is Pilot so set on Seattle, will the goons catch Jack, and is there any way the friends\' competing needs can be resolved?','/jttL1E4eCQn7tHBbYlUkMz865Q4.jpg','2002-03-26',97,'Released','It started as a desperate escape and became the wildest ride of their lives','Highway',18808,2.5794,5.5,'-pg3293JS2U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14841,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0165384',6.2,1453,'en','The Match','Romantic comedy set against the story of a grudge football match between two pubs. The prize for the winner of the centenary match is the the closure of their opponent\'s bar. The Match was mainly filmed around Straiton in Ayrshire.','/h7sS80bAgJrPm31eKHNV5JqzdEL.jpg','1999-08-13',95,'Released','It\'s a game of two pubs!','The Match',41160,1.9039,6,'5NdX5Mn0V7U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14842,_binary '\0','/qBHYPg8WCUVPaLH6E3PKPcf0jqb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0165396',4.2,1690,'en','My Brother the Pig','When a spell turns an 8-year-old boy into a swine, his sister and best friend race to find the cure.','/v21boSM424AT1J5dC5ugWr7zwqq.jpg','1999-09-10',92,'Released','If you act like an animal, you just may become one!','My Brother the Pig',73257,2.8195,5.8,'s50cjn99zhM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14843,_binary '\0','/w1Zsqd7CmeoTMYgZWO8lkfRGkLK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0165454',5.5,1328,'en','The Runner','A compulsive gambler finds his new family\'s safety seriously threatened by a ruthless gambling boss.','/mzNyDHOm6Ingz8tSVDOKq8f1mgI.jpg','1999-09-09',94,'Released',NULL,'The Runner',214412,1.7934,5.4,'yCBCKq-xI2Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14844,_binary '\0','/6j4KSnQnjvkQ0pEV5rMMcvHAXlp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0165456',5.5,2309,'en','Sabrina Goes to Rome','Sabrina goes to Rome, with Salem stowaway-ed in her backpack, to free her 16th-century aunt Sophia who was banished for divulging her powers to a non-witch.','/zzJPgh0ntXQw5XEC6XFKTIU7LBl.jpg','1998-10-04',84,'Released',NULL,'Sabrina Goes to Rome',33271,2.3342,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14845,_binary '\0','/aJrwBXzk09zDXNpAPZHYZJkiw6A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0165473',7.9,3580,'ja','修羅','Gengobe Satsuma, an exiled samurai cast out as an Asano clan retainer, is given a second chance to join his brothers in arms to become the 48th Ronin against the Shogunate. His faithful servant gathers the 100 ryo required for his acceptance. Gengobe is also in love with a greedy geisha named Koman. About to be sold to another man, Gengobe learns that in order to keep her, her debt is exactly 100 ryo.','/kUsODPIBhUdWz5N6jeXqrLIWOJu.jpg','1971-02-13',134,'Released','This world is a sea of blood.','Demons',104548,2.0436,7.703,'R21YtKJ6iJc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14846,_binary '\0','/1Cq1WKfp748tFSofbA8sSKFueHT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0165494',3.4,5549,'en','Ringmaster','Jerry Springer stars as more or less himself, the host of a raunchy, controversial and popular Los Angeles talk show which features everyday people with problems and who frequently vent their problems on the air.','/9QNqeKB4XodrvEiYewOTG9WEka5.jpg','1998-11-25',90,'Released',NULL,'Ringmaster',37536,1.7126,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14847,_binary '\0','/cWpjusDpWCpzRvXA3QRp7gGBP54.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0165499',6.4,4364,'zh','風雲雄霸天下','Heeding a prophecy, a warlord trains two orphans after killing their parents. But the skills he teaches could lead to his downfall.','/9vLOmW27iY3oHLPknNwMGxfa0IT.jpg','1998-07-18',128,'Released','When The Wind and Cloud combine, the Fish with the golden scales becomes a dragon.','The Storm Riders',2137,4.5185,6.5,'aYhIcaTSpB0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14848,_binary '\0','/nKLy3Kc2Tzxo1qJI5fzOXzTbUyn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0165543',7.2,1945,'en','One Special Night','Builder Robert is visiting his ailing wife in a nursing home and is having problems getting a taxi home due to an intense snow storm. One of the doctors, Katherine offers him a lift home however their car gets stuck and they have to spend the night in an empty cabin nearby. They talk and bond, but afterwards seem to have difficulty beginning a relationship.','/uf3RuZlGZ5YxbvPZnuXycr8PXv8.jpg','1999-11-28',92,'Released',NULL,'One Special Night',50616,1.9978,6.8,'8fkx-ZgZaKk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14849,_binary '\0','/iaQvRr8YBGdTlMJcMQglTIy6aV7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0165546',8,12653,'sr','Ране','This film follows two Belgrade youths on their rise to gangster legends in a decaying society.','/w2BCsgIdGbSGegwWHLlLD24ZiB4.jpg','1998-05-27',103,'Released','The Years Have Passed Only Wounds Have Remained','The Wounds',51022,1.8295,7.199,'MwXmiJPi7VI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14850,_binary '\0','/jn5LRTCl8zR0jsV2Pf04WyhMcHZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0165623',7.1,16934,'de','Angst','A killer is released from prison and breaks into a remote home to kill a woman, her handicapped son and her pretty daughter.','/nSYdWrPPwvcs5t5hG67XqDbwncG.jpg','1983-01-01',75,'Released','Based on a true story.','Angst',18912,3.7252,7.1,'IWwPIjN1wPg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14851,_binary '\0','/n7ylI2IACVkXqKUEiHnTZlZBaYe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0165643',5,6207,'en','Black and White','Rich Bower is an up-and-coming star in the hip-hop world. Everyone wants to be around him, including Raven and her fellow upper-class white high school friends. The growing appeal of black culture among white teens fascinates documentary filmmaker Sam Donager, who sets out to chronicle it with her husband, Terry. But before Bower was a rapper, he was a gangster, and his criminal past comes back to haunt him and all those around him.','/uzFgLnuvC7IngemxqpplSx1Zq8R.jpg','1999-09-04',98,'Released','What happens when you mix it up?','Black and White',38809,3.452,4.6,'OIPZJ-xv5N4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14852,_binary '\0','/NH15yF3nLKyYpog18sy5ynnGBf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0165710',6.8,41986,'en','Detroit Rock City','In 1978, a Kiss concert was an epoch-making event. For the four teen fans in Detroit Rock City getting tickets to the sold-out show becomes the focal point of their existence. They\'ll do anything for tickets -- compete in a strip club\'s amateur-night contest, take on religious protesters, even rob a convenience store!','/jedOctnsD20K4IvOeh5jG811B8L.jpg','1999-08-13',95,'Released','Kiss the rules goodbye.','Detroit Rock City',9781,4.1761,6.8,'RT391AQQHA4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14853,_binary '\0','/vUfm9rRJdLRFCJnJd7TDeOU3Ihz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0165773',7,8818,'en','Felicia\'s Journey','Seventeen and pregnant, Felicia travels to England in search of her lover and is found instead by Joseph Ambrose Hilditch, a helpful catering manager whose kindness masks an unsettling secret.','/itqEwiINuYvaqvFKw5YWitnqAUc.jpg','1999-10-08',116,'Released','Monsters Aren’t Born.','Felicia\'s Journey',47692,1.6194,6.3,'z2yPGlwHk_I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14854,_binary '\0','/9oRbHgbJf1Zr2fct8jBIKadpKya.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0165798',7.5,103758,'en','Ghost Dog: The Way of the Samurai','A Black hitman who models after the samurai of old finds himself targeted for death by the mob.','/gjcl07r9zgQ9tVo9alyHmysPFfX.jpg','1999-10-06',117,'Released','Live by the code. Die by the code.','Ghost Dog: The Way of the Samurai',4816,7.252,7.3,'ZhR6jWWpUj0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14855,_binary '\0','/4kz1eNVrKOrEeXzEhOilSdtthx3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0165831',5.2,4477,'en','Held Up','What should have been a romantic getaway turns into one hilarious debacle after another when Michael\'s woman dumps him in the desert where he gets carjacked by a teenager and he is taken hostage in a stickup at the local Sip and Zip.','/95AseMukZsjgDXC9NtgVQESAVgY.jpg','1999-10-08',89,'Released',NULL,'Held Up',19489,1.788,5.9,'wf5ovF63uvA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14856,_binary '\0','/ppdgXQ7rE9Whf3rCzaawQzmLVnx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0165832',7.5,41577,'en','Interstate 60','An aspiring painter meets various characters and learns valuable lessons while traveling across America.','/zZQt29qBWLoVVOo8HEFzFYRAgYQ.jpg','2002-04-13',116,'Released','It began as a wish, became an adventure, and ended as the ultimate road trip.','Interstate 60',20312,5.5325,7.396,'fLSBfpI6cig','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14857,_binary '\0','/mKm56aTBr34ciZTpTWX6WoPubUY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0165854',6.9,38561,'en','The Limey','The Limey follows Wilson, a tough English ex-con who travels to Los Angeles to avenge his daughter\'s death. Upon arrival, Wilson goes to task battling Valentine and an army of L.A.\'s toughest criminals, hoping to find clues and piece together what happened. After surviving a near-death beating, getting thrown from a building and being chased down a dangerous mountain road, the Englishman decides to dole out some bodily harm of his own.','/efAnFInZYrenNvBlLIXN2oLYyNc.jpg','1999-10-08',89,'Released','Tell him I\'m coming.','The Limey',10388,6.0715,6.535,'l-Ks8nV8Adg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14858,_binary '\0','/2oOBBTJpkbzW3zOh9JIAWI5vawY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0165859',7,7364,'en','Liberty Heights','This semi-autobiographical film by Barry Levinson follows various members of the Kurtzman clan, a Jewish family living in suburban Baltimore during the 1950s. As teenaged Ben completes high school, he falls for Sylvia, a black classmate, creating inevitable tensions. Meanwhile, Ben\'s brother, Van, attends college and becomes smitten with a mysterious woman while their father tries to maintain his burlesque business.','/pFcUURqmwvvyq0eFzvDun8daPMX.jpg','1999-11-17',127,'Released','You\'re only young once, but you remember forever.','Liberty Heights',27141,2.1293,6.7,'5HHBBSRr2KY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14859,_binary '\0','/q8b1qmCCbmpDsN9FGyL0QTNpnOR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0165870',2.8,1302,'en','Maniac Nurses','In a remote fortress, a sinister sorority of surgically skilled sisters lie in wait of their next victim. They control a bevy of caged women who have been brain washed and sponge-batherto become the worlds most anatomically awesome surgeons. This is the git-wrenching story of one innocent girl, Sabrina, who finds herself trapped in a living nightmare. Captive to a slavery ring that is training an','/dLVhecsbVOXDlisZ0i7kEDyOJSA.jpg','1992-01-01',74,'Released',NULL,'Maniac Nurses',19351,1.0821,2.9,'zGDsynVyl40','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14860,_binary '\0','/uxInHuYdymUHjsyboB2ivauppvC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0165874',6.3,6699,'en','The Mating Habits of the Earthbound Human','David Hyde Pierce, playing an alien (credited as infinity-cubed in the opening credits), narrates a courtship in a late-20th century American city as an extraterrestrial nature documentary. The relationship \"footage\" is played straight, while the voice-over (with its most often wildly inaccurate theories) and elaborate visual metaphors add comedy.','/6HKeiRaPRstC5Uc7y6MmolV5dbi.jpg','1999-09-03',90,'Released','A How-To-Do-It Guide.','The Mating Habits of the Earthbound Human',17198,2.9084,6,'fvqdBZxJezk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14861,_binary '\0','/hq5bbmRj65ald90E3PlWyzOtl7D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0165929',6.1,77671,'en','Romeo Must Die','Two warring gang families (one African-American, the other Chinese) maneuver for bragging rights to the Oakland, California docks. Hang Sing and Trish O\'Day uncover a trail of deceit that leaves most of the warring factions dead... or worse!','/zKrnaTWW63y4Q1XLrdZQyQmcRWd.jpg','2000-03-22',115,'Released','In a world of vicious rivalries and violent betrayals, only one thing is sure...','Romeo Must Die',2085,9.1379,6.3,'gU_xJ4EDAas','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14862,_binary '\0','/j8isWEPL3PmmVh8ap3jm75qVF4p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0165982',6.8,65065,'en','Sinbad: Legend of the Seven Seas','The sailor of legend is framed by the goddess Eris for the theft of the Book of Peace, and must travel to her realm at the end of the world to retrieve it and save the life of his childhood friend Prince Proteus.','/yiW2L1fDiBT7AeWXrykhTNtPrr8.jpg','2003-07-02',86,'Released','The fantastic tale of his greatest adventure.','Sinbad: Legend of the Seven Seas',14411,12.7454,7.1,'46CuCaYIp3o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14863,_binary '\0','/w6al75OEaE1WmrrRqFrkRWQ99Vl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0166110',4.5,8673,'en','Bones','Over 20 years after his death, local legend and benefactor Jimmy Bones returns as a ghost to get revenge on those who killed him and restore his neighborhood.','/2Fsm30AcKiBbQPfYV8mm6Q7Axdh.jpg','2001-10-24',97,'Released','This Dogg\'s got a bone to pick.','Bones',11380,2.7232,5,'8Z8Srxaoi48','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14864,_binary '\0','/z85hVCLK4z3YxVdfpzT4Kh1GXkm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0166158',5.7,2724,'en','Daddy and Them','Ruby and her husband Claude are a working-class couple who live in suburban Arkansas. As crazy as they are for each other, their relationship is far from harmonious. (The lack of money doesn\'t help matters, either.) In fact, their whole family is fraught with unresolved conflicts. Then Claude\'s uncle is arrested on a felony charge, and everyone rallies round. Ruby\'s mother Jewel and flirtatious sister Rose (Claude\'s ex-girlfriend) even fly in from Tennessee; but, far from being a source of support, Jewel seems only to want to break up Ruby and Claude.','/7MfP7nCRhSYePUec86i31DDPNMd.jpg','2001-10-26',101,'Released','It\'s hard to stand by your man... when your sister\'s sitting in his lap.','Daddy and Them',33557,1.9643,5.3,'LR6JtnlgV-o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14865,_binary '\0','/dxsMt5JspjPdMk59nap00Z8p4nx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0166175',6.9,19775,'en','East Is East','In 1971 Salford fish-and-chip shop owner George Khan expects his family to follow his strict Pakistani Muslim ways. But his children, with an English mother and having been born and brought up in Britain, increasingly see themselves as British and start to reject their father\'s rules on dress, food, religion, and living in general.','/tDchJ4mB23vGgwdQCmq9FCQ4W23.jpg','1999-05-14',97,'Released','A comedy of families, a chip shop... and a very randy dog.','East Is East',10557,2.205,6.541,'yfoqUY0KwfQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14866,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0166195',4.9,7452,'en','Foolish','\'Foolish\' Waise is a talented comedian with a hard-edge trying to make it in the comedy clubs in LA while his brother is a hard-nosed gangster trying to make it on the streets. With all the competition they face in their chosen \"professions,\" their biggest battle is with each other over the love of a pretty girl.','/bCBsJyLnZbnlfwooB5733LLXF24.jpg','1999-04-09',84,'Released','This big mouth is ready for the big time','Foolish',27455,1.5116,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14867,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0166233',7.6,1258,'hr','Kad mrtvi zapjevaju','Homesick and desperate to provide proper financial care for his wife, Croatian migrant worker Cinco, decides to fake his death, and asks his best friend Marinko to steal the hearse he\'ll be transported in and drive it from Germany to Croatia. However, not everyone is fully aware of the true ramifications of Cinco\'s plan and the two are targeted by the German mafia, Serbian spies and, upon their return to their homeland, violent separatist paramilitary groups and superstitious locals.','/m5zTvBr1nqVzNSo8QeS6h5o1wDL.jpg','1998-07-29',99,'Released',NULL,'When the Dead Start Singing',260490,0.6005,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14868,_binary '\0','/oYEp07KhxUuPYJHrLqq7S4FHcaA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0166252',5.5,4843,'en','The Love Letter','In the sleepy New England town of Loblolly By The Sea, a letter has arrived that is going to wake things up. It is a love letter - ardent, sensual... and unsigned. As the letter falls into different hands, residents of the small town to eye one another with renewed interest - wondering who it\'s for and who it\'s from. Determined to find the letter\'s author, Helen MacFarquhar begins a quest that will open her life to a new chapter involving two decidedly different men: George, an old friend from her past, and Johnny, a young man very much in her present. Unexpectedly, one mysterious love note has the power to unlock some startling secrets, leaving a trail of wonderful surprises as it turns an entire town upside down.','/7w8QCvKDFn1cJ3sW3RGWcwlitgX.jpg','1999-05-21',88,'Released','Comedy that pushes the envelope','The Love Letter',31342,2.6228,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14869,_binary '\0','/ntVB3LgyvKIaw6Dk29ZuDsV3TSR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0166276',4.9,20453,'en','Monkeybone','After a car crash sends repressed cartoonist Stu into a coma, he and the mischievous Monkeybone, his hilarious alter-ego, wake up in a wacked-out waystation for lost souls. When Monkeybone takes over Stu\'s body and escapes to wreak havoc on the real world, Stu has to find a way to stop him before his sister pulls the plug on reality forever!','/lgH7Wej9922C1MQv0wciAfesKH8.jpg','2001-02-23',93,'Released','Get boned!','Monkeybone',23685,5.3245,5.3,'KsUdm-GatOY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14870,_binary '\0','/aAa9Cr0YkdisVbHi0O7Z5SIOwYp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0166287',6.8,1798,'es','No se lo digas a nadie','Based on the alleged autobiography of gay peruvian talk show host Jaime Bailey. Joaquin, a young man from the high class of Lima, deals with problems concerning his sexual identity as a child, then as a teenager pressured by his macho snobbish father, then as an independent lazy pot-smoking college student, and later as a cocaine addict in Lima and Miami.','/93fjWBuwimIffPpDQH8cbA38Gy3.jpg','1998-07-16',103,'Released','Lima\'s most scandalous story','Don\'t Tell Anyone',53117,1.6219,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14871,_binary '\0','/2Ybd1D20MBztggy6NXsF66qyF65.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0166314',6.5,1321,'ja','ポルノスター','A young man decides one day to start killing yakuza. After he kills his first two he gets roped into helping a wannabe gangster and his bumbling underlings to perform a hit. While things work out in the beginning, this young psychopath quickly becomes more trouble than the gang expected. Will they be able to rid themselves of him, or will they be his next victims?','/hi2N4u74b6OxI09ewygeIJuNUxY.jpg','1998-10-10',98,'Released',NULL,'Pornostar',33170,1.7762,6.5,'dFFGctRl6zg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14872,_binary '\0','/kpTMKCQ5qwQUio63eM6AIpjfffc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0166322',5.6,4974,'en','Rear Window','Jason Kemp, a recently paralyzed architect, lives in a high-tech apartment filled with assistive technology. As a quadriplegic confined to his home, he passes the long hours by spying on his neighbors from his apartment window. His innocent pastime takes a deadly turn when he believes he witnesses a murder. Determined to uncover the truth, Jason continues to dig deeper - eventually finding himself locked in a deadly game of cat and mouse.','/zmbPjkZhlnt0JEOU9xMYtbjNXuL.jpg','1998-11-22',89,'Released','Who\'s watching who?','Rear Window',11603,2.9318,5.4,'DZlx2jNMhA8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14873,_binary '\0','/d2g96sPT305JJccjvc0a8Nudd2G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0166370',4.8,2263,'en','Subconscious Cruelty','A surrealistic anthology of horror films; four segments structured as an intense fever dream...','/uxi61UmS8djkoJ7yHop40ogf7RU.jpg','2001-04-13',92,'Released',NULL,'Subconscious Cruelty',36224,2.3485,4.8,'Q_K2FDHYYXE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14874,_binary '\0','/et3pBXfI1Q1fb7kLwZIoW7CYQgh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0166396',7.3,30045,'en','Waking Ned','When a lottery winner dies of shock, his fellow townsfolk attempt to claim the money.','/bsxiOOKC40HlhdIJYCUE2BkpJv0.jpg','1998-11-20',91,'Released','Finally, a comedy that will make you feel like a million bucks.','Waking Ned',10162,2.975,7,'vO8mTY3ZIZc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14875,_binary '\0','/866aJcimh30DVYRo3IMTqaKK3JR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0166476',7.2,1589,'it','Amore tossico','The alienating and repetitive life of a group of heroin junkies in 1980s Rome.','/hQwo0Nwek1kH9QE4ZOO0TN7XAgU.jpg','1983-09-01',89,'Released',NULL,'Toxic Love',59037,1.8363,7.3,'zZK5UVVVEyE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14876,_binary '\0','/jW1HUCofeIYSpLLbVqVSsm7nMdN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0166485',6.7,40586,'en','Anna and the King','The story of the romance between the King of Siam (now Thailand) and the widowed British school teacher Anna Leonowens during the 1860s. Anna teaches the children and becomes romanced by the King. She convinces him that a man can be loved by just one woman.','/PIlOkljucv7HnvATbn4JwrAvSn.jpg','1999-12-16',148,'Released',NULL,'Anna and the King',1439,6.4588,6.8,'xHPoKOi1XcM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14877,_binary '\0','/WH9AZVrIXX3FiDyLb5S4Gv6YES.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0166556',7,6246,'it','Così è la vita','While on the run from the police, an unlikely companionship blossoms between a funny con man who just broke out of jail, the bumbling cop whose car he seized at gunpoint, and a nitpicking civilian he unwittingly took hostage.','/zcZxzcl79S3gaWWDGGHcFkjT9m2.jpg','1998-12-18',108,'Released',NULL,'That\'s Life',38396,1.7282,7.464,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14878,_binary '\0','/980A1bZukkWosakdPLyNNMQhN2i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0166604',6.5,2657,'fr','F. est un salaud','15-year-old Beni falls in love with Fögi, a singer in a Rock band. As Fögi seduces him, he is only willing to follow him where ever Fögi wants to. But Fögi is a drug addict and pulls Beni deeper and deeper into the hell of drug addiction.','/jKUX5f7Za3nNq3VVrXZ6XsjMera.jpg','1998-09-11',91,'Released',NULL,'Fögi Is a Bastard',29457,1.8521,5.5,'yNhaQOJbl88','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14879,_binary '\0','/h9wr9N6qysPJQesw2kejo2p4oSs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0166653',4.4,4089,'sv','Hälsoresan - En smal film av stor vikt','The film is about the health resort Granhedsgården in Dalarna, Sweden, and they have a problem. They don\'t have many guests at all and something must be done. At the same time, Stig-Helmer is a little depressed after his girlfriend has left him, and so he lives on junk food. His best friend Ole invites him to come along to the health resort Granhedsgården. Now, the craziness begins.','/nSUK8HNVfvEbJP6oWhCpxltEBjv.jpg','1999-12-25',105,'Released','A slim movie of great weight.','The Health Journey',24647,1.8654,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14880,_binary '\0','/4STEylBCabNW3Zx689YrqAj6Hwa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0166808',5.9,2105,'fr','Sombre','A serial killer stalks a woman he befriended after her car broke down.','/AfzVdGL7Gv3fExrpQLfHMzLcm7E.jpg','1998-08-06',112,'Released',NULL,'Sombre',56653,2.0866,6.3,'ncqQPs_FasI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14881,_binary '\0','/b8hPBW0NJmiIVzvQjT3CwIpAdzl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0166813',7.2,95484,'en','Spirit: Stallion of the Cimarron','A captured mustang remains determined to return to his herd no matter what.','/jTS4o0Yj1RoA2OGzl8USZyAJqYK.jpg','2002-05-24',83,'Released','Some legends can never be tamed.','Spirit: Stallion of the Cimarron',9023,14.408,7.709,'RPJ4EQ2Eh9I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14882,_binary '\0','/1S81PpyGwS8eVx4W75uSKzMw4B0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0166896',8,109813,'en','The Straight Story','Retired farmer and widower Alvin Straight learns one day that his estranged brother Lyle has suffered a severe stroke. Alvin is determined to make things right with Lyle while he still can, but his brother lives in Wisconsin, while Alvin is stuck in Iowa with no car and no driver\'s license. He then has the idea of making the trip on his old lawnmower, thus beginning a picturesque and at times deeply spiritual odyssey.','/tT9cMiVDdtlcdZxOoFy3VRmEoKk.jpg','1999-10-15',112,'Released','A true story that proves a little determination goes a very, very long way.','The Straight Story',404,8.9938,7.737,'BauhJIjn9Uk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14883,_binary '\0','/g9ClaS5EqU0Hk8WIbMNhld0Bk6f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0166924',7.9,434285,'en','Mulholland Drive','Blonde Betty Elms has only just arrived in Hollywood to become a movie star when she meets an enigmatic brunette with amnesia. Meanwhile, as the two set off to solve the second woman\'s identity, filmmaker Adam Kesher runs into ominous trouble while casting his latest project.','/x7A59t6ySylr1L7aubOQEA480vM.jpg','2001-06-06',147,'Released','An actress longing to be a star. A woman searching for herself. Both worlds will collide... on Mulholland Drive.','Mulholland Drive',1018,21.1287,7.8,'3oa64ktrwKY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14884,_binary '\0','/1RQj9GlPMU1iHoGVDal3G5NOQRF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0166943',6.7,13988,'en','Music of the Heart','After Roberta Guaspari separates from her husband, she receives encouragement from her mother to take up a job of a music teacher at the Central Park East School in East Harlem.','/knbONQ6d24XtWpRv9Q9D2DyHogo.jpg','1999-10-29',124,'Released','She gave them a gift they could never imagine. They gave the system a fight it would never forget.','Music of the Heart',26149,4.1054,6.7,'-p50UW7zhM4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14885,_binary '\0','/m7qP7WtKv9ZvsKtF1cGyRoqVbup.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0166973',5.6,2341,'en','An American Tail: The Treasure of Manhattan Island','Fievel and his friend Tony Toponi find a map that they believe points to a treasure buried somewhere beneath Old New York, and the plucky rodent is determined to find it. However, what he discovers under the city is a tribe of Native American mice who were driven underground by prejudiced European immigrants.','/3tHRV61S9NWgme1pOHeXeDRBYvh.jpg','1998-02-15',78,'Released','Meet Fievel. In his search to find his family, he discovered America.','An American Tail: The Treasure of Manhattan Island',31473,3.2794,6.3,'t0lYUrTFz6U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14886,_binary '\0','/r7dK0bukw0BOe4QMwRTIBii90RV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0167059',6.5,2206,'en','The Book of Life','New Year\'s Eve takes on new meaning when the Devil, Jesus Christ, and Christ\'s assistant Magdalena discuss and debate the End of the World.','/802XKT8qeUP4QLQgrbixgF9qLai.jpg','1998-08-22',63,'Released','2000 seen by... Hal Hartley.','The Book of Life',23522,2.2943,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14887,_binary '\0','/1R5fVcVM0DwlFcjMDWj8PqRAnKv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0167116',6,3640,'en','Desert Saints','Banks is a hit man, the best, usually working for Latin American drug cartels. He picks up solitary women, uses them briefly for a job, then kills them. He\'s in the Southwest, headed toward Mexico, when he picks up Bennie, a woman leaving an abusive marriage, going to Paradise, Arizona. The film follows three tracks: Banks\'s slow recruitment of Bennie, the set-up for the hit at a swank resort in Mexico, and the FBI\'s close pursuit of Banks, whom they want alive in hopes he\'ll rat out his bosses. Bennie may not be who she seems, and there may be a chink in Banks\'s tough-guy armor. Guns, money, and a chance at Paradise.','/2as5ytuOjrT01xr4wmqJBhfUNlV.jpg','2002-03-10',88,'Released',NULL,'Desert Saints',2095,2.4544,5.8,'74bJWd6O8NI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14888,_binary '\0','/mTvt7XcSUWrfLhvvkqcaAoeFghy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0167132',6.5,3053,'de','Der Eisbär','Four characters become involved in one dramatic story: Nico has a mission to drive a car containing a live bomb to a specified destination, park the car and escape as quickly as she can. Leo has become his client\'s target, having carried out a \"contract\" that unfortunately had already been cancelled. Fabian and Reza want to enjoy themselves without any money, bringing themselves into contact sooner or later with the police. Sooner or later all four will meet up in dramatic circumstances....','/9F1selwsaWrzScQIsNupbYuvdIv.jpg','1998-11-12',90,'Released',NULL,'The Polar Bear',9321,1.4311,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14889,_binary '\0','/nmu3blraqJUVG31nmwPaxunOdQ3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0167137',6.9,5675,'da','Den eneste ene','When kitchen fitter Niller comes to install Sus\'s new suite, their immediate attraction to one another proves a sweet escape from both of their problematic relationships.','/cutsTlDTJWJwYfaLnInKUirKp9s.jpg','1999-04-01',106,'Released',NULL,'The One and Only',18908,1.5344,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14890,_binary '\0','/53It4cHZY3sr9T1RCdpLIHhrQiO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0167147',6.2,4564,'ja','死霊の罠','A talk show hostess takes a camera crew out to an abandoned factory to investigate a purported snuff film that was made there. As she gets closer to the truth, she and her friends are subjected to a brutal nightmare.','/qQeJk5RJtoKNaxxAZy8noc1OxwW.jpg','1988-05-14',100,'Released','Pure terror!','Evil Dead Trap',40037,1.9284,6,'hnA6ISw_8BE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14891,_binary '\0','/5sdNwufhvWfKYwrmByrw6QnGkAY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0167187',7.2,2001,'en','Great Expectations','Orphan Pip discovers through lawyer Mr. Jaggers that a mysterious benefactor wishes to ensure that he becomes a gentleman. Reunited with his childhood patron, Miss Havisham, and his first love, the beautiful but emotionally cold Estella, he discovers that the elderly spinster has gone mad from having been left at the altar as a young woman, and has made her charge into a warped, unfeeling heartbreaker.','/59LU8PjGuW1oiSD9ZqmKCpEwUB0.jpg','1999-04-12',168,'Released',NULL,'Great Expectations',16075,2.1372,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14892,_binary '\0','/avwEj8wiywFH6FZ6h2wzvyJpiH7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0167190',6.9,373159,'en','Hellboy','In the final days of World War II, the Nazis attempt to use black magic to aid their dying cause. The Allies raid the camp where the ceremony is taking place, but not before they summon a baby demon who is rescued by Allied forces and dubbed \"Hellboy\". Sixty years later, Hellboy serves the cause of good rather than evil as an agent in the Bureau of Paranormal Research & Defense, along with Abe Sapien - a merman with psychic powers, and Liz Sherman - a woman with pyrokinesis, protecting America against dark forces.','/lbaTEneOofwvAyg77R8HbFML2zT.jpg','2004-04-02',122,'Released','From the dark side to our side.','Hellboy',1487,10.4517,6.678,'qc4-3QmiFak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14893,_binary '\0','/iLByx9FInCiEptsOqqePG32w2UT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0167203',5.6,5139,'en','I Dreamed of Africa','Inspired by the true story of indomitable Kuki Gallmann, the film tells of a beautiful and inquisitive woman who had the courage to escape from her comfortable yet monotonous life in Italy to start anew in the African wilderness with her son, Emanuele, and her new husband, Paolo. Gallmann faces great danger there but eventually becomes a celebrated conservationist.','/kuDIrcsUI0duLSTUgKKLKEiEdrK.jpg','2000-05-05',114,'Released','Sometimes the adventure of a lifetime becomes life itself.','I Dreamed of Africa',21311,3.6683,5.4,'Gnya5boyEv8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14894,_binary '\0','/ctiw6FZK4N36LmkjSklWEbuvlq9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0167260',9,2192745,'en','The Lord of the Rings: The Return of the King','As armies mass for a final battle that will decide the fate of the world--and powerful, ancient forces of Light and Dark compete to determine the outcome--one member of the Fellowship of the Ring is revealed as the noble heir to the throne of the Kings of Men. Yet, the sole hope for triumph over evil lies with a brave hobbit, Frodo, who, accompanied by his loyal friend Sam and the hideous, wretched Gollum, ventures deep into the very dark heart of Mordor on his seemingly impossible quest to destroy the Ring of Power.​','/rCzpDGLbOoPwLjy3OAm5NUPOTrC.jpg','2003-12-17',201,'Released','There can be no triumph without loss. No victory without suffering. No freedom without sacrifice.','The Lord of the Rings: The Return of the King',122,49.6711,8.505,'KOQSQaGgJxs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14895,_binary '\0','/6G73mNyooWAEQTpckPSnFxFoNmc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0167261',8.8,1983495,'en','The Lord of the Rings: The Two Towers','Frodo Baggins and the other members of the Fellowship continue on their sacred quest to destroy the One Ring--but on separate paths. Their destinies lie at two towers--Orthanc Tower in Isengard, where the corrupt wizard Saruman awaits, and Sauron\'s fortress at Barad-dur, deep within the dark lands of Mordor.','/5VTN0pR8gcqV3EPUHHfMGnJYN9L.jpg','2002-12-18',179,'Released','The journey continues.','The Lord of the Rings: The Two Towers',121,42.4314,8.429,'Y4neBR0h39c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14896,_binary '\0','/qEJWjt8IwjMLVVXs1iY4iUfuUYA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0167331',8.1,7083,'cs','Pelíšky','Two families, Sebkovi and Krausovi, are celebrating Christmas, but not everyone is in a good mood. The teenage kids think that their fathers are totally stupid, and the fathers are sure that their children are nothing more than rebels, hating anything they say.','/2lJFNWjhSMLsiekLzr21LeuzL0S.jpg','1999-04-08',121,'Released',NULL,'Cosy Dens',15387,2.2786,8,'CwQOncE8O6k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14897,_binary '\0','/4Rh7JkF0pQGJJg0uFankuVrDM3A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0167341',5.6,1319,'fi','Poika ja ilves','Twelve-year-old Tommy reluctantly moves with his father from the big city to a small Lapp village - the childhood home of his mother, who has recently died. The village is close to the northernmost wildlife reserve in the world, where Tommy\'s father will be working on a project to release a captive lynx into the wild. The boy gradually falls under the spell of his new surroundings, and discovers that his mother was involved in protecting the local lynx, and, when his father\'s project fails, and the lynx is about to be sold, he decides to set it free himself. A dramatic series of events ensues, and Tommy, through his brave actions, regains the trust and respect of his family and the village.','/kzhimUBz7LSHZrLklInctBS5U9k.jpg','1998-12-18',102,'Released','Wild animal as a friend, wilderness as hide-out, a great adventure awaits!','Tommy and the Wildcat',234850,1.3289,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14898,_binary '\0','/wv2WFbDqduNQdwaUa0etefZ0UVq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0167350',4.9,1829,'en','Progeny','An unsuspecting woman is impregnated by aliens who are experimenting on the human population.','/2sWXXCvcrWDXd6g57N0uGPkhFDH.jpg','1998-03-30',98,'Released','There Are Some Things In The Universe That We Can\'t Understand','Progeny',105588,1.9518,4.9,'9VRdc4ciq74','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14899,_binary '\0','/16LiiwdGpejcUv4u8DhvPSIgfSB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0167400',7.8,8935,'tr','Sevmek Zamanı','On the Princes’ Islands to the south of Istanbul, the days are rainy and full of longing. Poor but proud painter Halil gets a job in one of the island’s villas, where he encounters the photograph of a beautiful woman and falls in love with her image.','/9j4p13FyX0HDkpCfCk7XBmWsRuB.jpg','1965-10-09',89,'Released','Just like a fairy tale.','Time to Love',124611,2.0949,7.5,'bycSjWBi7CI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14900,_binary '\0','/6TjllWT3cGrPFyqDXurVZ3L8bBi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0167404',8.2,1162717,'en','The Sixth Sense','Following an unexpected tragedy, child psychologist Malcolm Crowe meets a nine year old boy named Cole Sear, who is hiding a dark secret.','/vOyfUXNFSnaTk7Vk5AjpsKTUWsu.jpg','1999-08-06',107,'Released','Not every gift is a blessing.','The Sixth Sense',745,25.2756,7.955,'3-ZP95NF_Wk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14901,_binary '\0','/gYmemySNlveFDPImjP4skD0QcPY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0167423',5.4,1857,'en','Diamonds','Mystery about an ex-prizefighter who embarks on a journey to find 13 missing diamonds','/AjZvoJIGOOu8d1XIJ5QEFcGbTOy.jpg','1999-12-10',91,'Released','Hunting for buried treasure was never this much fun.','Diamonds',35118,1.4159,5.1,'56Lf_8LJ_e0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14902,_binary '\0','/iTjl4y7ZOP79GBMAiNtqz6mpAxq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0167427',5.3,21730,'en','Superstar','Orphan Mary Katherine Gallagher, an ugly duckling at St. Monica High School, has a dream: to be kissed soulfully. She decides she can realize this dream if she becomes a superstar, so her prayers, her fantasies and her conversations with her only friend focus on achieving super-stardom.','/vfBUCPe6wgt3SwNP7dKlqh8xeyO.jpg','1999-10-08',82,'Released','Dare to dream.','Superstar',13824,3.3387,5.3,'lW85KbKYwYs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14903,_binary '\0','/jyzuK6OgWzibgAblJzxANUHSZ2x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0167456',4.4,15208,'en','Thunderbirds','Dangerous missions are the bread and butter of the Thunderbirds, a high-tech secret force employed by the government. Led by Jeff Tracy (Bill Paxton), the Thunderbirds are at the top of their game, but their nemesis, The Hood (Ben Kingsley), has landed on their island and is attempting a coup by using the team\'s rescue vehicles. He\'ll soon discover that the Thunderbirds won\'t go down.','/1jH0vADEIvuRlkvJzLUW5nVO96d.jpg','2004-07-23',95,'Released','Climb into the driver\'s seat of the most advanced rescue vehicles on the planet.','Thunderbirds',14623,4.0196,5.1,'lGOwT8goZZY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14904,_binary '\0','/l3PKdvzXXwbCzEIX5w6ffwv4C3Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0167479',7,1544,'it','Vieni avanti cretino','Pasquale Baudaffi, on amnesty, comes out of prison and starts looking for a job with the help of his cousin Gaetano. But first he goes to what was once a brothel, but, unbeknownst to our hapless hero, has been taken over and rented as a dental office. Pasquale finds himself at the center of endless misunderstandings. He tries to be a gamekeeper but that\'s not okay, he tries to be a waiter in a bar: he immediately gets his orders wrong and he is fired. His performance as a garage keeper was negative. The very latest experience is in an electronics company but its insertion into the futuristic mechanism triggers the craziest complications. The encounter with a lost dog allows him to get to know his mistress and thus discover the woman of his life.','/g406DEMSh0uCk7tcwqBpQQd5xf3.jpg','1982-04-07',98,'Released',NULL,'Vieni avanti cretino',37501,1.5436,6.9,'a0VvTlKYcIY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14905,_binary '\0','/xMzaiMy6Y1z13k5NSFkdrUZ2TuS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0167752',5.8,6053,'en','The 4th Floor','A woman inherits a rent-controlled apartment and is terrorized by a neighbor.','/4oYkJDmcSkXOuxmaBB0YPLHAOEc.jpg','1999-07-31',90,'Released','People are dying to live in this building.','The 4th Floor',49745,3.3,5.724,'XDw_tNZbN44','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14906,_binary '\0','/gPK9EGvgcvG77suuIemYZRHlD48.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0167758',5.3,1805,'en','Alice Through the Looking Glass','A modern adaptation of the classic children\'s story \'Alice through the Looking Glass\', which continued on from the popular \'Alice in Wonderland\' story. This time Alice is played by the mother, who falls asleep while reading the the bedtime story to her daughter. Walking through the Looking Glass, Alice finds herself in Chessland, a magical and fun world. There she meets the Red and White Queens, as well as many other amusing friends on her journey across the chessboard countryside onto become a crowned queen.','/cpFhYi64PE3vKJVvN3ZxqZFcfBl.jpg','1998-12-26',83,'Released','Lewis Carroll\'s Classic Fantasy Tale.','Alice Through the Looking Glass',15162,2.4949,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14907,_binary '\0','/sSxpIXxcfxdRNy5lWfwrodOeK8V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0167825',2.6,1485,'en','Chicken Park','Vladimiro travels to the Dominican Republic with his fighting-chicken when it gets stolen. While searching for his lost chicken he discovers Chicken Park, a zoo full of giant chickens.','/r2I4FtgvGePSxinvezLz42PDydw.jpg','1996-04-05',97,'Released','A comedy 65 million feathers in the making.','Chicken Park',65758,1.401,3.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14908,_binary '\0','/2RzqKJ22hs3p1IgSYzrQYHbYNLz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0167886',7.2,1725,'it','Il demonio','Purif is distraught when her lover is betrothed to another. When she summons the old ways to curse him, her erratic behavior is interpreted as demonic possession, and the villagers turn against her with physical and sexual violence.','/wo0RUtWIw1KmWHpwBCUiN4Hz853.jpg','1964-01-31',100,'Released','A night she wakes up bound to the bed and with the bleeding body. The revenge of the devil will not delay!','The Demon',138765,2.3178,7.2,'5M3EtXC6EoA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14909,_binary '\0','/iM1yVDHn22U1DZ45SVjhKPLrCBW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0167925',6.8,2094,'fr','Fin août, début septembre','A book editor juggles relationships with two women while coping with his best friend\'s terminal illness.','/pBIcJIwqKl9DpStlg5rL33yYTQe.jpg','1999-02-10',112,'Released',NULL,'Late August, Early September',78568,2.0673,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14910,_binary '\0','/69RMqVigjzzvUJAbFgRjKqYFo17.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0167926',7.4,3327,'fr','Les Enfants du marais','The film is set in Marais, a quiet region along the banks of Loire river in 1918. Riton is afflicted with a bad-tempered wife and three unruly children. Garris lives alone with his recollections of World War I trenches. Their daily life consists of seasonal work and visits from their two pals: Tane, the local train conductor and Amédée, a dreamer and voracious reader of classics.','/9tEvO0H3Eg43MJQm4t1ChukCu8d.jpg','1999-03-03',115,'Released',NULL,'The Children of the Marshland',36719,2.151,7.126,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14911,_binary '\0','/vAalYWPS1zln2pLE0GK32Nne1VD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0167947',5.6,1371,'it','Gallo cedrone','The life and times of Armando Feroci, a fortyish year old, who\'s been everything, a divorced husband, a careless father, an unreliable brother. The story is told in flashback by his friends while Armando has been mysteriously kidnapped in an Arab country by an integralist group and condemned to death.','/d9KRUi4OxpOER0ANBXNpN7hfwmF.jpg','1998-10-16',94,'Released',NULL,'Gallo cedrone',42674,1.0361,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14912,_binary '\0','/x7GdT6eFPpAYutYKcxoV1WVdGG5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0168043',7.2,2746,'cn','暗花','A corrupt cop named Sam handles negotiations between two Triad leaders who plan to join forces. However, he meets a suspicious bald man named Tony, who keeps following him around and disrupting his personal business.','/fGceZ7I1IibzaWHngbrsuOf75g5.jpg','1998-01-01',84,'Released',NULL,'The Longest Nite',41158,2.5912,6.9,'ihArXbyouqk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14913,_binary '\0','/2xRN76LW0DFOWMF0kdvI6f6vZu2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0168080',6.5,3949,'es','Muertos de risa','Nino and Bruno are two comedians who reach the heights of success with their duo act, turning them into huge TV celebrities. However, the hate between them grows fast, as much as their fame.','/9pTnAwFOUt5NSOcKkeuNW46cwws.jpg','1999-03-11',113,'Released','The people adored them. They hated each other. This is their story.','Dying of Laughter',57544,1.4724,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14914,_binary '\0','/vKgsqmYHdNjtyhQIUjXW88IPeI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0168122',7.2,26324,'en','Pirates of Silicon Valley','The story about the men who made the world of technology what it is today, their struggles during college, the founding of their companies, and the ingenious actions they took to build up the global corporate empires of Apple Computer Inc. and Microsoft Corporation.','/rdAMdi7iFN7EP0zuaPp3mESBOH8.jpg','1999-06-20',97,'Released','The true story of how Bill Gates and Steve Jobs changed the world.','Pirates of Silicon Valley',3293,5.0996,7,'ZNQk-s6BMH8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14915,_binary '\0','/v76fEFpeE4p2KdrvASRzNMJhdMA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0168123',7,2916,'fi','Pitkä kuuma kesä','The story of a rock band \"Kalle Päätalo\" in the 1980s.','/o4pcBSny2ZnTQYUzurOeroYvILR.jpg','1999-03-26',100,'Released','They were young. They were beautiful. They were born to win.','A Long Hot Summer',62825,0.7525,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14916,_binary '\0','/gFDmoSH4tpe911zZD9iU5ke1ZZi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0168172',2.7,7294,'en','Simon Sez','A tattooed Interpol agent helps an old classmate find the kidnapped daughter of a computer software tycoon.','/uJG7oSRQxacXC2GvzPF2nDoWXIW.jpg','1999-09-24',85,'Released','It Ain\'t Over \'Til...','Simon Sez',32305,2.5401,2.851,'0mysvIJPCAk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14917,_binary '\0','/zM0bkuDgERSRkbbnVC8HLnM9vRV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0168269',7.5,1507,'ru','Золушка','In the fairy kingdom live stepmother, her evil daughters — Anna and Maryana, a limp husband-forester and his daughter from his first marriage — Cinderella. The stepmother exploits the poor girl as a housekeeper. With the help of her godmother-fairy, Cinderella gets to the royal ball, where a beautiful and very kind prince falls in love with her. At midnight, the magic ends, and poor Cinderella has to return to her former life. But on the crystal shoe that Cinderella lost while fleeing the palace to the battle of the palace chimes, the prince searches for the bride.','/ygRrn9QEgH0XlhjGaSUUuH0l8lN.jpg','1947-05-16',82,'Released',NULL,'Cinderella',42651,1.3674,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14918,_binary '\0','/9HiPNg8Y1equeEjbqT9aFok0C3N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0168331',6.6,1886,'en','Esther','Esther, the beautiful queen of Persia, intervenes to save the Jewish people from a bloody massacre.','/6RaDUkZan01ixkpsM7hew4UQybw.jpg','1999-03-29',87,'Released',NULL,'Esther',2700,2.4711,6.8,'XZ0cTN84Tnw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14919,_binary '\0','/177bT09OBoPZ0ZN1yqtQfbrqgq9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0168446',7.1,3730,'en','Aberdeen','Kaisa is a Scot, a successful London lawyer, who snorts coke and has one-night stands with strangers. Her mother calls from Aberdeen with some story begging her to fly to Norway and collect her alcoholic dad whom she hasn\'t seen in years.','/yjDBeAxrXXd4kt4DpTbjHsmtukk.jpg','2000-09-08',113,'Released',NULL,'Aberdeen',26665,1.5887,6.5,'f82q3VWEUz8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14920,_binary '\0','/4FYTuTJajPuCyGYFV2O7C2DPbSP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0168449',6.6,2027,'en','The Adventures of Sebastian Cole','Hank marries the divorced Joan, who\'s the mother of teens Sebastian and Jessica. After living with his new family for years, Hank announces that he\'s getting a sex change operation. The family deserts Hank, with Jessica going her own way and Sebastian staying with his mom. But Joan becomes an alcoholic, so Sebastian moves back in with Hank — now Henrietta — who turns out to be far more supportive than anyone else.','/isgUjJ9dlDyUJqEWtFrNeQe1wMg.jpg','1998-09-11',99,'Released','A movie about sex, rebellion and a stepfather named Henrietta.','The Adventures of Sebastian Cole',67323,1.6772,5.3,'PU95IFnj4RA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14921,_binary '\0','/rptszjb9Cgx7hUXTxTmlh4ScD7m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0168501',6.8,12914,'en','The Best Man','After writing a soon-to-be bestselling novel, writer and committed bachelor Harper attempts to hide the fact that his saucy new book is loosely based on the lives and loves of his tight-knit group of friends. Harper is set to be best man at his friend Lance\'s wedding, and all his friends will be in attendance. When an advance copy of the book makes its way into the hands of his ex-flame, Jordan, Harper attempts to keep it under wraps.','/ub2Njdn4kq49ndyg7QglnE8PUqT.jpg','1999-10-22',120,'Released','The flower arrangements have been ordered. The sleeping arrangements are still being worked out.','The Best Man',16162,3.7941,6.6,'kUwBXEjIVKM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14922,_binary '\0','/vdntIumsNp6yx5S4VdnwUvm4OFa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0168504',5.6,1861,'en','A Better Way to Die','Boomer is a rookie cop based in the urban hellhole that is downtown Chicago. After his involvement in a drug bust operation which results in the death of Carlos, his mentor and father figure, Boomer becomes disillusioned with the brutal and inhumane nature of his job. Consequently, he decides to hand in his resignation to the Chicago Police Department and return to his home town of Joliet, where his fiancé, Kelly, awaits. While en route back to Joliet, however, Boomer makes a grievous error in judgment when he stops for, and assists, an unfortunate motorist whose vehicle appears to have broken down; the naive ex-cop is swiftly attacked and rendered unconscious. Boomer awakes to find that his car and wallet have been stolen, and that he has become involved in a dangerous game of mistaken identity.','/jHqAEpjlj7msZ24zArfWgYrGTuz.jpg','2001-09-26',96,'Released',NULL,'A Better Way to Die',23705,1.6384,5.6,'b8wvwMPKm44','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14923,_binary '\0','/vxvzf0cGtFY2Vpw5ULWumCIW6Ri.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0168629',7.9,125198,'en','Dancer in the Dark','Selma, a Czech immigrant on the verge of blindness, struggles to make ends meet for herself and her young son, who has inherited the same genetic disorder and will suffer the same fate without an expensive operation. When life becomes increasingly difficult, Selma learns to cope through her love of musicals, dreaming up little numbers to the rhythmic beats of her surroundings.','/pWzOfTJRZHPNO1VNrMnNFqRcJwg.jpg','2000-09-01',140,'Released','In a world of shadows, she found the light of life.','Dancer in the Dark',16,9.168,7.834,'ddcCwLqtT8w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14924,_binary '\0','/qD3iptcv51gqYQiW4qPdwhyXN8A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0168740',6,2470,'fr','L\'ennui','A philosophy teacher restless with the need to do something with his life meets a young woman suspected of driving an artist to his death. He finds the very simple Cecilia irritating but develops a sexual rapport with her. Obsessed with the need to own and tormented by her inability to respond to him, he becomes increasingly violent in a quest he can\'t name - a quest that slowly begins to undermine his certainties.','/xvu2D0pW6Js10ONu1We64DBfBFp.jpg','1998-11-14',122,'Released','An Obsession Out of Control','L\'ennui',55107,2.2321,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14925,_binary '\0','/83xzg9g16CulQbYISZRF64EoeSY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0168786',7.3,41013,'en','Antwone Fisher','A sailor prone to violent outbursts is sent to a naval psychiatrist for help. Refusing at first to open up, the young man eventually breaks down and reveals a horrific childhood. Through the guidance of his doctor, he confronts his painful past and begins a quest to find the family he never knew.','/j9lCK1aFXqMO3hzhGiqCNU8coIX.jpg','2002-12-19',120,'Released','Antwone Fisher is at war... with himself.','Antwone Fisher',13435,3.4238,6.946,'RcwE7ArDf-U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14926,_binary '\0','/3juSu7fpbxQSme1nE5ziKwpLHoI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0168794',6.7,3188,'en','The Five Senses','Interconnected stories examine situations involving the five senses. Touch is represented by a massage therapist who is treating a woman, while her daughter accidentally loses the woman\'s pre-school daughter in the park. The older daughter meets a voyeur (vision), a professional house-cleaner has an acute sense of smell, a cake maker has lost her sense of taste, and an older man is losing his hearing.','/y4UjdQJYxQEhenI7DFIM301Df7d.jpg','1999-05-18',106,'Released','Nothing can cure the soul but the senses. — Oscar Wilde','The Five Senses',47585,1.9254,5.7,'ACSZnim2ij4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14927,_binary '\0','/jBQJ1J45pqRLtABbK9LBgKL0YmE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0168856',6.1,8317,'da','Hjælp, jeg er en fisk','Three children are accidentally transformed into fish after consuming a potion made by an eccentric scientist. The kids end up in the sea, with one problem: they must find and drink the antidote within 48 hours, or forever remain as fish.','/s9yFQD19xJqXEnAnUAZFUan25DJ.jpg','2000-10-06',80,'Released','A potion put them in the ocean','Help! I\'m a Fish',12609,6.7048,6.7,'eodWgXqQZxE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14928,_binary '\0','/raco63dENglejZ70P8shG3hNYkW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0168972',7.4,2604,'ja','ラブ&ポップ','Tokyo schoolgirl Hiromi and her friends engage in a practice known as enjo kosai, or \"compensated dating\", where older men pay young girls for dates. Hiromi plunges deeper into this world to raise money for an expensive ring.','/t5TMd9ldthwyMAd6HDcrJcZIIDx.jpg','1998-01-10',112,'Released','Schoolgirls by day... Call girls by night...','Love & Pop',70846,3.2732,7.7,'v0rvoOZt5sI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14929,_binary '\0','/ipG5qDUEiDZexgvgOMwbT4g0gon.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0168987',6.1,9102,'en','Better Than Chocolate','Not long after moving into her own place, Maggie finds herself with two unsolicited roommates: her recently divorced mother, Lila, and her young brother. The timing is especially bad, considering Maggie has fallen hard for an attractive woman, Kim, only hours before they move in. What could be a nonissue becomes increasingly complicated -- since Maggie\'s family is unaware of her sexual orientation, and Maggie is not open to sharing that information.','/7FC2UK7MyEwlmbJGCIIFg4U7VPU.jpg','1999-07-08',101,'Released','A delicious romantic comedy.','Better Than Chocolate',18212,2.0476,6,'MxS3znIIzfQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14930,_binary '\0','/76VwduxQMkVXOUktps85dE0lLeP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0169102',8.1,130563,'hi','लगान','The year is 1893 and India is under British occupation. In a small village, the tyrannical Captain Russell has imposed an unprecedented land tax on its citizens. Outraged, Bhuvan, a rebellious farmer, rallies the villagers to publicly oppose the tax. Russell offers a novel way to settle the dispute: he challenges Bhuvan and his men to a game of cricket, a sport completely foreign to India. If Bhuvan and his men can defeat Russell\'s team, the tax will be repealed.','/yNX9lFRAFeNLNRIXdqZK9gYrYKa.jpg','2001-06-15',233,'Released','Once upon a time in India','Lagaan: Once Upon a Time in India',19666,3.1768,7.3,'rZPbpymefuE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14931,_binary '\0','/7eeaXQXUvLAMNkfbd2py6UZwbHw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0169145',7.7,6089,'sr','Буре барута','20 peoples paths crisscross one night in violent mid-\'90s Belgrade.','/9YZY9mEje6dsdoGgBybdI8ftlmX.jpg','1998-08-01',102,'Released',NULL,'Cabaret Balkan',47144,1.9208,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14932,_binary '\0','/9l87pFIHkFmAz1TuXVHW3VdnCLs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0169164',7,2667,'it','Radiofreccia','April 24, 1993: it\'s the last broadcast of Radiofreccia, an independent radio station closing after 18 years, barely one minute before coming of age. Bruno, one of its founders, begins to tell its story, the story of a group of friends—especially troubled Freccia\'s—and a period of their youth in their small hometown.','/w2AO7FzSsWholgjwTx2MUTV8M9v.jpg','1998-10-16',112,'Released',NULL,'Radiofreccia',56020,1.2258,7.053,'hLAcflxsBbQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14933,_binary '\0','/59q7OtxjOSDgTenkoyahWEbjFTM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0169183',4.1,1283,'en','GetEven','The Corruption of The System is given a swift lopsided kick by Vigilante Justice as a Disgraced Former Cop emerges from exile, automatic weapons blazing and mediocre martial arts akimbo, to bring down a murderous satanic cult headed by his former partner. His only allies? A boatload of swagger and one leggy blonde.','/zPDbXnkUHaM9kQ6XdonVlOQjz4V.jpg','1993-09-24',89,'Released','Will Justice Win Out Over Evil? Will Courage Overcome Corruption?','GetEven',99373,1.3592,4.2,'PiQ5yCYAvJA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14934,_binary '\0','/zaydFrMVU5mn3ajBc3VwbNasYAG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0169222',6.7,2469,'ja','鮫肌男と桃尻女','In dreamlike mountain scenery, Toshiko makes a daring escape from her sexually warped Uncle Sonezaki. Fortunately, she met Samehada as she runs for her life, which is also escaping from some slayers. What follows is a wild chase that leads the audience into a comically violent world.','/31rPJUTmffhsKmCT996kKIBflkL.jpg','1999-02-06',108,'Released','They\'ve got the money… They\'ve got each other… Now They\'ve got to survive!','Shark Skin Man and Peach Hip Girl',36867,2.3288,6.862,'9tNW8H4jUtA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14935,_binary '\0','/prwrraTcCLQ4H8At2pweuGDw9ei.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0169299',6.1,6017,'en','Terror Firmer','A low-budget film crew working in New York City find themselves being preyed upon by a sexually conflicted serial killer.','/gnASuHPWrVwpQdKeyaMspgGCePC.jpg','1999-10-29',114,'Released','Let\'s Make Some Art!','Terror Firmer',14005,1.8316,6.035,'L5NvH1J_MpE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14936,_binary '\0','/okwee9zGe2l1PZAyV721f385niQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0169302',7,2082,'ta','தீவிரவாதி','A young female terrorist goes on a suicide assassination mission, but her resolve to complete it is put to the test.','/5h3Kuoi5dBdh99aSGr7D1tktXeY.jpg','1998-09-12',95,'Released','Her death will not be ordinary.','The Terrorist',48233,0.9453,6.9,'yEzY02REUOM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14937,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0169514',5.5,2414,'en','Witchblade','New York detective Sara Pezzini’s search for justice leads her to the Witchblade, an arcane weapon that grants her the power to battle Earth\'s darkest evil forces.','/zeYnBrsunBHdeMkYIXzcXgypLI4.jpg','2000-08-27',94,'Released','A new force of justice has arrived on the streets of New York.','Witchblade',174797,1.0691,5.8,'gRJa9hqJHeY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14938,_binary '\0','/2ndw55F40IkALzWyjCCza3M6nqM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0169547',8.3,1288350,'en','American Beauty','Lester Burnham, a depressed suburban father in a mid-life crisis, decides to turn his hectic life around after developing an infatuation with his daughter\'s attractive friend.','/wby9315QzVKdW9BonAefg8jGTTb.jpg','1999-09-15',122,'Released','... look closer','American Beauty',14,19.356,7.997,'3ycmmJ6rxA8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14939,_binary '\0','/gAmPO9zCtXZjXmO5vMiphIb9Y3L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0169590',7.7,10839,'en','The Batman/Superman Movie: World\'s Finest','As the Joker visits Metropolis with a plan to kill Superman for Lex Luthor, Batman pursues the clown to Superman\'s turf.','/dQxwNGQ6pQLCUE5vaI9PwIZK6UC.jpg','1997-10-04',64,'Released','Cleaning up the planet one villain at a time.','The Batman/Superman Movie: World\'s Finest',17074,3.9862,7.412,'47aEME-QFg0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14940,_binary '\0','/8Qa88kwPvRKdyz7pHkz8xTMxzUu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0169620',4.8,1496,'en','The Black Gestapo','General Ahmed has started an inner-city People\'s Army to try and relieve the misery of the citizens of Watts. When the locals are put under increasing pressure by Mafia thugs, Ahmed\'s second-in-command Colonel Kojah asks for permission to start a protection squad to take more direct action. Ahmed fears this protection squad will just turn into a vigilante mob, and his prediction soon proves correct. Will Ahmed be able to wrest control back from the power-mad Kojah, or will he be the mob\'s next victim?','/3JRlArCBikzla0Fjgrg9xr6SSu3.jpg','1975-03-01',88,'Released','The New Master Race!','The Black Gestapo',83295,1.0891,4.3,'5t_GIRJ1_2k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14941,_binary '\0','/nkmBsmJBs2PYiTyAa0to76uPRyN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0169828',8.3,4937,'ka','ჯარისკაცის მამა','When peasant Georgy Makharashvili hears that his soldier son is lying wounded in a hospital, he sets out to visit him. However, unknown to him, his son has been sent back to the front. Reluctant to return home and in a vain attempt to locate his boy, Georgy joins the Red Army in it\'s unrelenting push to the west.','/jI99Q0qChLfl4zyjPcGuqRB04Ym.jpg','1965-05-11',83,'Released','A soldier by duty, a father by love.','Father of a Soldier',127668,2.1024,7.1,'6CWPG1_v2yY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14942,_binary '\0','/AfyuI3glMCBDFmNPj9PY6DwbgGp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0169858',8.1,79052,'ja','新世紀エヴァンゲリオン劇場版 Air／まごころを、君に','SEELE orders an all-out attack on NERV, aiming to destroy the Evas before Gendo can advance his own plans for the Human Instrumentality Project. Shinji is pushed to the limits of his sanity as he is forced to decide the fate of humanity.','/j6G24dqI4WgUtChhWjfnI4lnmiK.jpg','1997-07-19',87,'Released','The fate of destruction is also the joy of rebirth.','Neon Genesis Evangelion: The End of Evangelion',18491,14.8288,8.261,'J8t48KMGCo4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14943,_binary '\0','/74wyAwiWTGLpJGQIPMKjYjvSyl4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0169880',7.2,17252,'ja','新世紀エヴァンゲリオン劇場版 シト新生','Originally a collection of clips from the Neon Genesis Evangelion TV series, Death was created as a precursor to the re-worked ending of the series. Rebirth was intended as that re-worked ending, but after production overruns Rebirth became only the first half of the first part of The End of Evangelion, with some minor differences.','/lXBjqzo6c4NyLuJtqOiH39kswji.jpg','1997-03-15',101,'Released','Welcome to the apocalypse.','Neon Genesis Evangelion: Death and Rebirth',21832,5.6852,7.4,'sZwPBcnOk5c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14944,_binary '\0','/sy0vo1cmpKqwPRiMUiJ45jyLsX7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0170016',6.4,336190,'en','How the Grinch Stole Christmas','The Grinch decides to rob Whoville of Christmas - but a dash of kindness from little Cindy Lou Who and her family may be enough to melt his heart...','/1WZbbPApEivA421gCOluuzMMKCk.jpg','2000-11-17',105,'Released','You better watch out!','How the Grinch Stole Christmas',8871,17.3905,6.779,'UnyPPS1Z-Vs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14945,_binary '\0','/uFBRsDsk3byX98lb6TveaGVqGuM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0170259',7.2,3404,'ru','Лунный папа','The unborn child of Mamlakat is telling her story. She is 17, beautiful and vivacious, and dreaming secretly of becoming an actress. She lives with her father and brother in a small village in Central Asia. One night she is seduced by an actor from a travelling troupe, who poses as a friend of Tom Cruise, and gets her pregnant. She tries to abort, but her father and brother become determined to find the seducer, setting in motion a cascade of comic adventures.','/6yzM7xSapMZfQEK9PDQ0lNc9IP6.jpg','1999-09-08',103,'Released',NULL,'Luna Papa',10573,1.7148,6.256,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14946,_binary '\0','/y8c2N0JT9Q7OvD6GMxhhDIaZWx3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0170266',7.5,2628,'en','Miss Marple: The Murder at the Vicarage','Faced with two false confessions and numerous suspects after a despised civil magistrate is found shot in the local vicarage, Detective Inspector Slack reluctantly accepts help from Miss Marple.','/wkJZURN8E8w7wBj4IzeGUUtsaC7.jpg','1986-12-25',102,'Released',NULL,'Miss Marple: The Murder at the Vicarage',293879,3.2138,6.708,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14947,_binary '\0','/df5iAHuH2brY9zXMeeRuL2AAE6O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0170351',6.1,3975,'pl','Pan Tadeusz','Romance brings two warring families together in this historical drama. As citizens fight for independence in 1810s Lithuania, Tadeusz, the son of a murderer, and Zosia, a young woman, come together for a wedding against a backdrop of changing politics, ancient traditions, and the uncertain future of a country.','/kWomf1J9CNZmD0P9IntFEGlAe12.jpg','1999-10-22',147,'Released',NULL,'The Last Days',4966,2.0432,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14948,_binary '\0','/yARLSUYlJm7CKE1jHc0aCQvJNN9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0170544',7.2,2853,'ja','SF サムライ・フィクション','A warrior-in-training and his bumbling friends go in pursuit of a stolen sword.','/yWKRqv2fEZ10nM7245CjZm4ttEO.jpg','1998-10-27',111,'Released',NULL,'Samurai Fiction',10686,1.4562,6.7,'ljRVlCRjHJE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14949,_binary '\0','/rn2EB8kitYpAhCrZR2rXePyZJ7j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0170691',6.9,44419,'en','Tigerland','A group of recruits go through Advanced Infantry Training at Fort Polk, Louisiana\'s infamous Tigerland, last stop before Vietnam for tens of thousands of young men in 1971.','/pnFdCvxxL44sPLkKEIJCUaIZa7M.jpg','2000-10-06',101,'Released','The system wanted them to become soldiers. One soldier just wanted to be human.','Tigerland',10687,3.632,6.6,'LABt1rwmIgg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14950,_binary '\0','/7QDnuj2T6CCY5wOSnKfYH7cIb6M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0170705',7.6,9977,'fr','Train de vie','In 1941, the inhabitants of a small Jewish village in Central Europe organize a fake deportation train so that they can escape the Nazis and flee to Palestine.','/uFyKJfels7BJ31D4rGfAYowzdjd.jpg','1998-09-16',103,'Released',NULL,'Train of Life',8056,2.2138,7.3,'t4esViss83M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14951,_binary '\0','/sa12mkBBtxJZlzxZ2SBKSTwjftu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0170783',8.9,3731,'bg','Вчера','The 1960s was the time of Beatles and Rolling Stones, the time of sexual revolution. These events have their echo in Bulgarian English-learning school. The school order provokes a protest of the students due to the narrow-minded teachers.','/mFGJwHaxBV8pVP4SFBY373N5vbo.jpg','1988-01-25',80,'Released',NULL,'Yesterday',265910,0.9572,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14952,_binary '\0','/3LgHakoDxHzOsakI77200tznEn6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0171049',3.7,1470,'en','Airspeed','When wealthy executive Raymond Stone sends out his private plane to pick up his spoiled teenage daughter, Nicole, and a pair of his top-ranking employees, disaster strikes. While the jet flies through an electrical storm, the pilot and other passengers are incapacitated, and Nicole is left on her own to keep the plane in the air, guided by an air traffic controller. Can the irresponsible and panic-stricken teen find a way to land the jet?','/xYYXK19BmmqXDIshAmZU5XCthrB.jpg','1998-08-18',98,'Released',NULL,'Airspeed',19568,1.9962,4.3,'SIURXH5ijCY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14953,_binary '\0','/vND3csfm8A7ThMbJZS0CkWYHoO6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0171227',4,1602,'en','Diplomatic Siege','When Steve Mitchell is clandestinely sent to the US embassy in Bucharest, Romania to disarm a nuclear bomb that has secretly remained in the building since the end of the Cold War, little does he know that other problems will soon erupt. He must join Erica Long, a diplomatic attaché who is not all that she appears, to work together on setting the correct computer code that will disable the weapon and accomplish the mission. But while watching video monitors from inside a long-forgotten surveillance room, Steve witnesses a surprising deadly takeover of the building by the Serbian Liberation Front.','/iAahz2oxMjdDRsXWdebzNKlBdyq.jpg','1999-12-17',90,'Released',NULL,'Diplomatic Siege',27058,1.6085,4.3,'6zEKXh6SMmM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14954,_binary '\0','/u1AqcrgBZxibhceCsdYoxgOnlIa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0171259',6.1,1564,'en','Earthly Possessions','A bored homemaker planning to run away from her minister husband is taken hostage in a bank robbery. However, she sees the thrill in being involved in the chase and becomes an accomplice to the young robber.','/sIDL4BmIgcukU7uVR34uQlUiMAX.jpg','1999-12-29',98,'Released','You can\'t always choose your traveling companion.','Earthly Possessions',97964,1.4722,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14955,_binary '\0','/4bAq4bkYgLrg2b36uDucxbFf8cl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0171356',5.6,8352,'en','Gun Shy','Legendary undercover DEA agent Charlie Mayough has suddenly lost his nerves of steel. On the verge of a career-induced mental breakdown, and in complete fear of trigger-happy Mafia leader Fulvio Nesstra, Charlie seeks psychiatric help and finds himself relying on the support of an unstable therapy group and nurse Judy just to get through his work.','/iMCuGjQu5LsS6hyr5KmRDNqcomy.jpg','2000-02-04',101,'Released','The Agency\'s best has a bad case of nerves.','Gun Shy',29076,3.876,5.2,'edAjY73zXbg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14956,_binary '\0','/sbsJjObPuZt4y5pHUN3zM1BIIiT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0171357',7.1,1693,'ja','はだしのゲン２','Three years after the Hiroshima bombing, a teenager helps a group of orphans to survive and find their new life.','/kho0D6jPrVIBfyuNoBzO5roWwL0.jpg','1986-06-14',85,'Released',NULL,'Barefoot Gen 2',14088,1.9019,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14957,_binary '\0','/u8Wix09R2qIsT3nPcmJPS1y89j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0171359',5.9,10398,'en','Hamlet','Modern day adaptation of Shakespeare\'s immortal story about Hamlet\'s plight to avenge his father\'s murder in New York City.','/yL1rYMHlqZtZVESxEWLsaneXq86.jpg','2000-05-12',112,'Released','Passion, Betrayal, Revenge, A hostile takeover is underway.','Hamlet',10688,2.052,5.8,'F39CYBE6-Kg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14958,_binary '\0','/acloCJG7yIvM8M8lh6GuuohlGJR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0171363',5.1,85305,'en','The Haunting','Dr. David Marrow invites three distinct individuals to the eerie and isolated Hill House to be subjects for a sleep disorder study. The unfortunate guests discover that Marrow is far more interested in the sinister mansion itself — and they soon see the true nature of its horror.','/xwLldS5JnB4441iS50ha9ZrkaA8.jpg','1999-07-23',113,'Released','Some houses are born bad.','The Haunting',11618,8.0049,5.516,'ht1M5GlEgW4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14959,_binary '\0','/ivnknwHWZdYsMIPVj4uWHTtvKzu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0171408',7.5,1428,'ru','Июльский дождь','Lena, a woman in her late twenties, loves her boyfriend, but in time comes to see that their relationship serves no useful function. What\'s more, she sees that her friends are for the most part empty-headed lackeys, causing her to wonder just what is the point of her life.','/497CGtHQXdoZXnifLu5CGtWgqbG.jpg','1967-08-07',109,'Released',NULL,'July Rain',104810,1.0511,6.8,'YfqRHRZlXfA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14960,_binary '\0','/yn1XpVtDpENvJ2qWD7E2istIgjM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0171410',6.8,5981,'en','The Jack Bull','When the law fails to punish a fellow rancher that has abused his horses, a Wyoming horse trader sacrifices it all in a quest for justice.','/yPbvb9cHQxcg9GzXG8DCb0yMSJI.jpg','1999-04-17',116,'Released','All men want justice. Few are willing to pay the price.','The Jack Bull',16331,3.3668,6.4,'NSQeVcQloQc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14961,_binary '\0','/3xJFFU3YF9WcpK2WXDF15zVcSQZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0171433',6.4,54512,'en','Keeping the Faith','Best friends since they were kids, Rabbi Jacob Schram and Father Brian Finn are dynamic and popular young men living and working on New York\'s Upper West Side. When Anna Reilly, once their childhood friend and now grown into a beautiful corporate executive, suddenly returns to the city, she reenters Jake and Brian\'s lives and hearts with a vengeance. Sparks fly and an unusual and complicated love triangle ensues.','/9NF199FTvHr9ggqdBTVbPhF1MGk.jpg','2000-04-14',127,'Released','If you have to believe in something, you may as well believe in love.','Keeping the Faith',4967,4.0851,6.11,'wORkOt7MOHM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14962,_binary '\0','/8ZquU1oL90wNowQeXaXx7xPk7vZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0171580',6.3,35973,'en','Nurse Betty','What happens when a person decides that life is merely a state of mind? If you\'re Betty, a small-town waitress and soap opera fan from Fair Oaks, Kansas, you refuse to believe that you can\'t be with the love of your life just because he doesn\'t really exist. After all, life is no excuse for not living. Traumatized by a savage event, Betty enters into a fugue state that allows -- even encourages -- her to keep functioning... in a kind of alternate reality.','/1OCHR9z9k7go669AsShOkTj4CFb.jpg','2000-08-30',108,'Released','She\'s chasing a dream... they\'re chasing her.','Nurse Betty',10480,6.282,6.1,'hAmf7VKFM-Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14963,_binary '\0','/A5j7Q6ltJRYPZ3Wz2azcGZtwPem.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0171685',7.5,13527,'en','Ratcatcher','James Gillespie is 12 years old. The world he knew is changing. Haunted by a secret, he has become a stranger in his own family. He is drawn to the canal where he creates a world of his own. He finds an awkward tenderness with Margaret Anne, a vulnerable 14 year old expressing a need for love in all the wrong ways, and befriends Kenny, who possesses an unusual innocence in spite of the harsh surroundings.','/dvrN33jql75Bd0I0i75oSJ9pXzX.jpg','1999-11-12',94,'Released',NULL,'Ratcatcher',29698,2.2202,7.1,'CHZ_MS2-iM0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14964,_binary '\0','/ti48nxF5gKgmFgxpnPvUlvqqyCy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0171698',5.9,1421,'en','Rites of Passage','A father and his two sons go on holiday together hoping to reconcile some of their differences, but when the arrival of two escaped convicts interrupts their vacation, the three men must cooperate in order to survive.','/sPNnFaZaNSB5NlzLBr491F65x8r.jpg','1999-10-27',95,'Released','The secrets some men keep can be killers.','Rites of Passage',49221,1.5665,5.6,'fYJ-fWSopJ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14965,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0171741',7.1,1304,'en','Shot Through the Heart','The horrors of war are examined from the view points of lifelong friends (Linus Roache, Vincent Perez), who end up on opposing sides in the civil war in Sarajevo. One is an expert marksman, who trains the snipers used to terrify the city and the other becomes a freedom fighter, who rejects his friend\'s offer to gain an escape from the city. As might be expected, the two eventually have to face-off against one another.','/8SaCrqSYJJZjvS78OW2dvvWS394.jpg','1998-10-04',112,'Released','Two Friends. Two Marksmen. Two Targets. Each Other.','Shot Through the Heart',23217,1.5156,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14966,_binary '\0','/yV1s91RyHJIMIJ7KeyHsWJ0ayUv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0171804',7.5,108271,'en','Boys Don\'t Cry','A young transgender man explores his gender identity and searches for love in rural Nebraska.','/eB505ycEhFVfMwGglIzXNUyKAIs.jpg','1999-09-02',118,'Released','A true story about finding the courage to be yourself.','Boys Don\'t Cry',226,8.1094,7.4,'uxWt9rxNzjg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14967,_binary '\0','/s3LLgxox2P0TafCrazYke3f4E07.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0171851',6,3000,'sv','Tsatsiki, morsan och polisen','Little Tsatsiki, son of a single mother in Sweden, has never met his father, a Greek fisherman. Tsatsiki befriends a nice but straight-laced motorcycle policeman renting one of their rooms and decices he is the right guy for his mother, an amateur rock singer in love with her band\'s bass player.','/yXdmoHwGp5BGRFrqh1nr7PaT7C6.jpg','1999-10-01',91,'Released',NULL,'Tsatsiki',27119,1.6552,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14968,_binary '\0','/jWiVBctu6FXlGGLvYetaYf4Njks.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0171865',7.1,4384,'en','Wonderland','Living in working-class London, Bill, Eileen, and their three grown daughters navigate quiet lives of loneliness: cafe waitress Nadia searches for love through personal ads, hairdresser and single mother Debbie balances casual romance with co-parenting alongside her volatile ex, and expectant mother Molly copes with a partner overwhelmed by impending fatherhood.','/xNhql30OzIPJc190czt7qLmpuBd.jpg','1999-05-13',108,'Released','Everybody\'s looking for something.','Wonderland',32640,2.3786,6.6,'OuXCatJa9ys','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14969,_binary '\0','/5iR6aqgRaNojA75YTQxE4Ln3DSv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0171922',7.9,2210,'ar','زوجة رجل مهم','When Mona marries the seemingly decent police officer Hisham, she finds out there is more into him than what he shows to the people.','/wFXu4PfnqEHmYADdpNaf0tZISvl.jpg','1988-01-11',109,'Released',NULL,'The Wife of an Important Man',193414,0.8045,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14970,_binary '\0','/wDxM8yfKZnSNppPxTeSr3c6my2H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0171928',6.6,1324,'pt','O Xangô de Baker Street','Rio de Janeiro, 1886. A precious Stradivarius violin presented to Emperor Dom Pedro II is stolen. Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson are called to solve the case.','/t6lA48IIzY0xNdPOiK85A4e4DsA.jpg','2001-09-27',124,'Released',NULL,'The Xango from Baker Street',63712,1.9155,6.295,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14971,_binary '\0','/gxSVZCUlDd8upT1G2wdrUdz2hxG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0172156',6.6,290885,'en','Bad Boys II','Detectives Marcus Burnett and Mike Lowrey of the Miami Narcotics Task Force are tasked with stopping the flow of the drug Ecstasy into Miami. They track the drugs to the whacked-out Cuban drug lord Johnny Tapia, who is also involved in a bloody war with Russian and Haitian mobsters. If that isn\'t bad enough, there\'s tension between the two detectives when Marcus discovers that playboy Mike is secretly romancing Marcus’ sister, Syd.','/yCvB5fG5aEPqa1St7ihY6KEAsHD.jpg','2003-07-18',146,'Released','If you can\'t stand the heat, get out of Miami.','Bad Boys II',8961,16.9783,6.658,'MsGSpfK6H4A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14972,_binary '\0','/sCbq6bJlIcWgXPSacSVziGihAss.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0172184',2.8,1527,'en','Bloodsport: The Dark Kumite','Agent John Keller goes undercover into the tough prison known as Fuego Penal to find out about the corpses of prisoners disappearing without a trace. There he gets involved in a dangerous tournament arranged by a man named Justin Caesar, where the prisoners are forced fight to death.','/w0txwbqZKLF6Am4gl5Zp660B09H.jpg','1999-03-30',100,'Released','Undercover on death row...the final contest is about to begin.','Bloodsport: The Dark Kumite',36693,2.0181,4.8,'4WBjZPH0FDA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14973,_binary '\0','/9O4Dfj968SHlkMyxpgaj1cfvBz2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0172234',5.5,3615,'hi','चाहत','Roop and his father come to the city for medical treatment where Reshma falls in love with Roop. However, Roop loves Pooja but when Reshma threatens to kill herself, Roop agrees to marry her.','/cn3gL1s7ZshDUTjcZ0W4JCyBBc6.jpg','1996-06-06',155,'Released','Moments of love, moments of pain.','Chaahat',102353,2.0105,6.692,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14974,_binary '\0','/gSLSN5EoTPmS9c6FOPOWQYFF8PD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0172345',4.7,1219,'en','Don\'t Look Down','After a terrible accident, Carla develops a debilitating fear of heights. She joins a counseling group headed by Dr Paul Sadowski, an unconventional therapist who presses people to confront their fears. However, his methods come into question when his patients begin to suffer mysterious accidents.','/p76rclRc1XLDM0kTelHVfpR9Ruu.jpg','1998-10-28',90,'Released',NULL,'Don\'t Look Down',58752,2.3412,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14975,_binary '\0','/y3JsYtUoN8flTnnWVnoizaioHEP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0172348',7,4183,'en','Introducing Dorothy Dandridge','An acclaimed stage performer, Dorothy still struggled with the challenge of her color, in a time that wouldn\'t let some stars in by the front door. Yet against the odds she beat out many more famous rivals for the role of \"Carmen Jones\", becoming the first black woman ever nominated for a Best Actress Academy Award. Marriages and affairs would break her heart, but her heart was strong. Seductive and easily seduced, she was born to be a star - with all the glory and all the pain of being loved, abused, cheated, glorified, undermined and undefeated. Here was a woman who wouldn\'t wait in the wings. Halle Berry stars as Dorothy Dandrige.','/4y5HWByhvOrxzPZpxvwahpeAGZA.jpg','1999-08-21',115,'Released','Right woman. Right place. Wrong time.','Introducing Dorothy Dandridge',54982,2.2988,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14976,_binary '\0','/hO1UwCPxI5tpz21hzITij3DPwFY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0172396',7,25753,'en','The End of the Affair','On a rainy London night in 1946, novelist Maurice Bendrix has a chance meeting with Henry Miles, husband of his ex-mistress Sarah, who abruptly ended their affair two years before. Bendrix\'s obsession with Sarah is rekindled; he succumbs to his own jealousy and arranges to have her followed.','/xTp5cyp6qG0YTdI4AEz4ytjODOQ.jpg','1999-12-03',102,'Released','The end was just the beginning.','The End of the Affair',20024,5.0171,6.572,'-i_A6Dlrk5g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14977,_binary '\0','/jDePFWhpfkY4GJm41qiRffJ0NGq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0172493',7.3,236885,'en','Girl, Interrupted','Set in the changing world of the late 1960s, Susanna Kaysen\'s prescribed \"short rest\" from a psychiatrist she had met only once becomes a strange, unknown journey into Alice\'s Wonderland, where she struggles with the thin line between normal and crazy. Susanna soon realizes how hard it is to get out once she has been committed, and she ultimately has to choose between the world of people who belong inside or the difficult world of reality outside.','/dOBdatHIVppvmRFw2z7bf9VKJr9.jpg','1999-12-21',127,'Released','Sometimes the only way to stay sane is to go a little crazy.','Girl, Interrupted',3558,9.774,7.555,'vL7c0Aqn_Pw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14978,_binary '\0','/Ar7QuJ7sJEiC0oP3I8fKBKIQD9u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0172495',8.5,1881510,'en','Gladiator','After the death of Emperor Marcus Aurelius, his devious son takes power and demotes Maximus, one of Rome\'s most capable generals who Marcus preferred. Eventually, Maximus is forced to become a gladiator and battle to the death against other men for the amusement of paying audiences.','/wN2xWp1eIwCKOD0BHTcErTBv1Uq.jpg','2000-05-04',155,'Released','What we do in life echoes in eternity.','Gladiator',98,39.0221,8.2,'P5ieIbInFpg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14979,_binary '\0','/3N3EeP9wT7nuOluQqMBnnrLw31.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0172519',4.1,2767,'hi','गुड्डू','When Guddu and Salina end up in a car accident, Salina loses her sight. Guddu soon finds out that he has a brain tumour, and decides to donate his eyes to Salina.','/9oKsXKeBV1xmZ8QF68JuKhpcOmt.jpg','1995-08-11',160,'Released',NULL,'Guddu',160251,1.3111,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14980,_binary '\0','/6YyQkBsVOs0Ju5ojfHwwDWSXZC0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0172543',7,4336,'en','He Died with a Felafel in His Hand','A search for love, meaning and bathroom solitude. Danny goes through a series of shared housing experiences in a succession of cities on the east coast of Australia. Together these vignettes form a narrative that is surprisingly reflective.','/ceB5SP5dmoeaQUq2RM1uANAwu0L.jpg','2001-08-30',107,'Released','Some people will do anything to get out of paying the rent...','He Died with a Felafel in His Hand',13777,2.1978,7,'bylNWJ84xlM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14981,_binary '\0','/pCQcd7Sfuq1HjQutNE17DqaEWK0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0172577',7.1,1506,'pl','Hydrozagadka','Warsaw is mysteriously running out of water during the summer heat wave. This mystery can only be solved by a Polish superhero known as As.','/7GI9e4JXjuhUt0dnTFPW70u1odW.jpg','1971-04-30',70,'Released',NULL,'Hydro-Puzzle',31856,0.8766,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14982,_binary '\0','/3wuouE2sw2ezhiuqF7SpAyLZB3s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0172627',4.9,5798,'en','Body Shots','The Los Angeles club scene is a place of booze-fueled decadence and debauchery. In a night full of possibilities, eight 20-somethings take to the clubs seeking good times, companionship and maybe a little sex. But in the harsh light of the morning after, their worlds are thrown into a spin of confusion when hungover Sara accuses hard-partying Mike of date rape. Loyalties are tested as each among them is forced to take sides.','/1YihuAszdbPMPxK7k46UYLdP1mz.jpg','1999-10-07',106,'Released','Tonight it\'s for sex. Tomorrow it\'s for real.','Body Shots',14484,2.8946,4.965,'sxsvpt2DRjg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14983,_binary '\0','/1VYE83DZuMrkmc5w364oeYDzYwK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0172632',6.5,1688,'en','Joe Gould\'s Secret','Around 1940, New Yorker staff writer Joe Mitchell meets Joe Gould, a Greenwich Village character who cadges meals, drinks, and contributions to the Joe Gould Fund and who is writing a voluminous Oral History of the World, a record of 20,000 conversations he\'s overheard. Mitchell is fascinated with this Harvard grad and writes a 1942 piece about him, \"Professor Seagull,\" bringing Gould some celebrity and an invitation to join the Greenwich Village Ravens, a poetry club he\'s often crashed. Gould\'s touchy, querulous personality and his frequent dropping in on Mitchell for hours of chat lead to a breakup, but the two Joes stay in touch until Gould\'s death and Mitchell\'s unveiling of the secret.','/n7X4jmmRIRtqNQWXJt8LxZcS1Ja.jpg','2000-01-21',104,'Released',NULL,'Joe Gould\'s Secret',125709,1.7432,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14984,_binary '\0','/cwEjYdBqneZGIiHnv4qSF4dfgZU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0172669',4.2,4001,'en','Komodo','During the 70\'s, some Komodo Dragon eggs were dumped on an North Carolina island. Somehow, the baby Komodos survived, and twenty years later they have grown up and taken over the island for themselves. Young Patrick has lost his parents and his dog to the lizards, but didn\'t see them himself, which has left him traumatized. Now, with his therapist Victoria, they return to confront his fears.','/c4kNtYHFB1SbM8OrN206VlXVe2n.jpg','1999-07-04',89,'Released','Welcome to the bottom of the food chain.','Komodo',25172,2.0704,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14985,_binary '\0','/iQJZMLr5cdn7Al2Av4V1VEzPDoQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0172684',7.5,63456,'hi','कुछ कुछ होता है','Per her mother\'s last wish, an 8 year old girl sets out to reunite her father with his college best friend who was in love with him.','/5FmtHHDGPofW5Zjns1EM1D8503c.jpg','1998-10-16',185,'Released','Love is Friendship.','Kuch Kuch Hota Hai',11854,3.3577,7.5,'IR5ReWgs-iQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14986,_binary '\0','/c9ZDn1mJUfs8L0IyGZXS6oXtXfX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0172726',6,4045,'en','Light It Up','On a winter day in a southside Queens high school, events collide and six students are suddenly in an armed standoff with the NYPD. At the school, classrooms freeze, teachers come and go, resources are scant.','/sHbII8OHz2uoyOpPAVYe0LIJcdN.jpg','1999-11-04',99,'Released',NULL,'Light It Up',19052,2.7298,6.6,'z7f6bMCq3fs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14987,_binary '\0','/xI3mhX0z0mUsgNRPk20c2bmDn7o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0172761',5.3,2473,'hi','मेज़र साब','Virendra is a spoiled young man newly enrolled in the Indian army. Major Jasbir Singh Rana, a tough disciplinarian, is in charge of transforming him into a brave soldier and a noble man.','/6mS6zYGLA8ObDDRtP5HuI91QWc9.jpg','1998-06-26',165,'Released',NULL,'Major Saab',84321,1.1748,5.605,'WOBnRlhRjIU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14988,_binary '\0','/4sNlQ5wAsjntwtVYM58eApUouZ8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0172776',8.4,2172,'sh','Марш на Дрину','A Serbian artillery battery of the Combined Division makes a forced march to the Cer Mountain in western Serbia to meet Austro-Hungarian troops, who have invaded the country by crossing over the Drina River. A chronicle of the Battle of Cer; a landmark battle of World War I and the first Allied victory over the Central Powers.','/cw1qDV1XCpPpXBpmJ5LXtBvIZWh.jpg','1964-07-17',107,'Released',NULL,'March on the River Drina',230648,1.1948,7.2,'-EXvlWDAdd0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14989,_binary '\0','/gTCyXiB6YPzZdrePj7xf7dpdmNM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0172812',7.3,1419,'ru','Мой ласковый и нежный зверь','An aristocrat falls for a young woman who brings him ruin. Based on Chekhov\'s story. AKA A Hunting Accident, The Shooting Party.','/tJAtWyIEV3aFUUKy0nYXJQwS2OZ.jpg','1978-05-16',105,'Released',NULL,'My Tender and Affectionate Beast',61266,1.6836,6.125,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14990,_binary '\0','/lpQk54TiMJPF6uXlsLVKIDjAB36.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0173024',7.2,1784,'ru','Посетитель музея','It is the future, the world is in ruins and a large portion of the population consists of deformed mutants living in reservations. In this world a man decides to spend his vacation visiting the ruins of a museum that is now buried under the sea.','/3lilHSgFYCZ8kvULFJvwsuBHOjJ.jpg','1989-12-19',128,'Released',NULL,'A Visitor to a Museum',73922,1.3507,6.864,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14991,_binary '\0','/tUGgVcWvSJOG9xXnUkijhbpSNwS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0173080',6.6,6720,'hi','प्यार किया तो डरना क्या','A wealthy collegian falls in love with an heir apparent, but her domineering cousin orders her to end the affair.','/wWJPE15xbl1RkM9y4EgnwbtEiBC.jpg','1998-03-27',162,'Released','Why be afraid of Love?','Pyaar Kiya To Darna Kya',45533,1.2231,6.227,'Q0rWij78_4A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14992,_binary '\0','/hk6wswC5CCH4h7l84TMYouSb7Kr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0173081',6.6,3911,'hi','प्यार तो होना ही था','Sanjana is desperate to revive her hopeless relationship with Rahul. However, when the brooding and mysterious Shekhar comes along, her heart starts gravitating towards a new possibility.','/7AxLqNWoZIzvqdNAyb62JwDHr4W.jpg','1998-07-15',156,'Released',NULL,'Pyaar To Hona Hi Tha',60397,1.8926,6.558,'VhG_xZTNYI4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14993,_binary '\0','/rWfjVkZoVBTJNM9EYenkGhZIT7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0173102',6.7,8945,'hi','राजू बन गया जेंटलमैन','A young engineer, from a small town, moves to Mumbai, with big dreams. As he hugely advances in his career, he gets caught up in the rich and glamorous lifestyle and starts getting changed. After becoming a victim of a conspiracy, he realizes his mistake and tries to redeem himself.','/fKwlg9RaftVirIhuLya2fmJv8b2.jpg','1992-11-13',161,'Released',NULL,'Raju Ban Gaya Gentleman',45003,1.4532,7.103,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14994,_binary '\0','/fgwgSnb1ejBCTBVtVT9NU9gUmnI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0173283',6.7,2040,'hi','Swarg','Living in a posh mansion named Swarg, this is the story of Sahabji, his wife sister Jyoti, two brothers, and a sister-in-law. Sahabji has a clash of wits with Dhanraj, who successfully schemes with Sahabji\'s two brothers, and takes over the prestigious mansion and vast business empire, leaving Sahabji virtually penniless, and devastated with the passing away of his wife. His brothers have now taken over the money, and his business. It is now up to a servant of the mansion, Krishna to set things right for Sahabji\'s household. How can a poor servant succeed against rich and powerful individuals?','/6YkqqialCuhMcaaRyW98kJ4Lm0M.jpg','1990-05-02',151,'Released',NULL,'Swarg',241180,1.4116,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14995,_binary '\0','/cC8Pdc2DMkU7RoHxmGYCQIS8Bm7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0173716',6.3,16894,'en','Cecil B. Demented','A young lunatic director and his devoted cult of cinema terrorists kidnap a Hollywood movie goddess and force her to star in their radical underground movie.','/gCXUA9BUOSDmOFVfkVBF4v15Td6.jpg','2000-08-02',88,'Released','Demented forever!','Cecil B. Demented',14195,3.6475,6.4,'LMmKfKCZoTk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14996,_binary '\0','/aOEsoi4PLECCsoNH0XQajlwupf6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0173772',8.1,3711,'it','Il mio viaggio in Italia','World-renowned director Martin Scorsese narrates this journey through his favorites in Italian cinema.','/hygBynLFPb4YWStH6ha3vbU7pAM.jpg','1999-09-11',246,'Released',NULL,'My Voyage to Italy',53198,1.9439,7.6,'CK5PRxvXiCw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14997,_binary '\0','/qyOO0dgss0oeUYFPWbbdALDgOSm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0173840',6.4,86738,'en','Final Fantasy: The Spirits Within','Led by a strange dream, scientist Aki Ross struggles to collect the eight spirits in the hope of creating a force powerful enough to protect the planet. With the aid of the Deep Eyes Squadron and her mentor, Dr. Sid, Aki must save the Earth from its darkest hate and unleash the spirits within.','/47b1EwFqqSWxYna7NtUM7iML4oT.jpg','2001-07-02',106,'Released','Unleash a new reality','Final Fantasy: The Spirits Within',2114,8.252,6.2,'qUXVOfdGE4o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14998,_binary '\0','/dOaF7zNAHYsSaAp8PXrUt4qfm8k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0173886',6.5,25078,'en','Halloweentown','On her 13th birthday, Marnie learns she\'s a witch, discovers a secret portal, and is transported to Halloweentown — a magical place where ghosts and ghouls, witches and werewolves live apart from the human world. But she soon finds herself battling wicked warlocks, evil curses, and endless surprises.','/y9RJCxJMbWqhXjkBgC0VXETmHj6.jpg','1998-11-10',84,'Released',NULL,'Halloweentown',27850,4.0717,6.8,'YgUY4oBrdak','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(14999,_binary '\0','/bakOPWwFRnAqi5Iq5nUdDyBnJOt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0173906',7.2,1845,'fr','L\'Homme que j\'aime','This is a combination coming out and first love story. The swimmer and diver Lucard is interested in attractive Martin. The film follows the characters\' coming out with all its difficulties, the bitter-sweet pleasures of first love and the dreadful moment when one comes down to reality and realizes that one\'s beloved friend has a hard way to go yet. The positive message the film tries to transmit is the somewhat common motto \"Live each day of your life as if it were your last.\"','/eDAA2Lbn3M0Tnj74iwBd0wBe1kF.jpg','1997-12-05',87,'Released',NULL,'The Man I Love',19654,2.021,6.3,'JWNcg7iADEM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15000,_binary '\0','/8dmRzIlIWIkA7uTceyeJUffoGo7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0173974',5.5,2245,'en','Lansky','Organized crime boss Meyer Lansky remembers his life as he is moving about the world looking for some country that will take him in since the USA have put out an extradition order for him.','/vHdgO6qsUCRy7f7VDfucSdI0Qri.jpg','1999-02-27',116,'Released','The mind that organised crime.','Lansky',76739,3.015,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15001,_binary '\0','/5NXiyBCMBcgVLv62UepfgGBjBhC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0174105',4.1,1285,'it','Paparazzi','A montley group of free-lance photographers are desperate to grab a good shot of a celebrity.','/in8v1bGSrF8K3UUw00wb0h2dYiZ.jpg','1998-12-18',100,'Released',NULL,'Paparazzi',43554,2.3297,5.142,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15002,_binary '\0','/lAH6sXpb9pnyhOQHk5Z1TWwwNIx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0174204',4.7,3837,'en','Simpatico','As youths in Azusa, Vinnie, Carter, and Rosie pull off a racing scam, substituting winners for plodders and winning big bucks on long odds. When an official uncovers the scam, they set him up for blackmail. Jump ahead twenty years, Carter and Rosie are married, successful racers in Kentucky about to sell their prize stallion, Simpatico. Vinnie is a drunk in Pomona. Vinnie decides to make a play for Rosie, lures Carter to California, steals his wallet and heads for Kentucky with the original blackmail material. Carter begs Vinnie\'s friend, a grocery clerk named Cecilia, to follow Vinnie and get the stuff back that he has in a box. Will she succeed?','/p6JglpvM6ERbZAYEW31gwvNprVZ.jpg','1999-09-15',106,'Released',NULL,'Simpatico',50116,2.0254,4.9,'P9gPcMyT1i8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15003,_binary '\0','/evVyt6xNSih4mZRZVViMypR4CZr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0174268',6.5,3788,'en','The Third Miracle','The Vatican sends a priest to verify some miracles, performed by a woman who has been nominated for sainthood...','/lkxqF5lQSVoLk9ikALSByJgBPoN.jpg','1999-11-18',119,'Released',NULL,'The Third Miracle',36773,2.691,5.9,'khDVs664t80','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15004,_binary '\0','/5bM4eG1c3hSsyb7aBpmeKzF9htS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0174330',6.3,4659,'fr','Vénus beauté (institut)','Aging beautician Angèle, already wounded by a long-ago romance, gets awkwardly dumped at a train station. Witnessing how she turns around a humiliating situation, younger sculptor Antoine becomes so smitten that he breaks up with his fiancée and sets out to win Angèle\'s heart. Meanwhile, Angèle attempts to quash the budding romance of her young co-worker, Marie, and a much older widowed client, despite their obvious rapport.','/nQIv4yTGmjk3ZLnK9CWUiIu66R1.jpg','1999-02-03',105,'Released','Welcome to the Venus Beauty Institute where love, innocence and sex are a sight to behold','Venus Beauty Institute',33491,1.754,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15005,_binary '\0','/pFc5f6OFxOg10y01Q0eJlphgIaB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0174336',4.5,4549,'en','Whipped','Three to one may sound like fairly good odds, but it depends on the game. When the \"one\" is one very irresistible woman and the \"three\" are three hopelessly smitten guys, the deck is pretty stacked. In the battle of the sexes, the first rule is to never underestimate the power of a woman.','/jIVMqADXH1fEAlf8K19FoDZYh0U.jpg','2000-09-01',82,'Released','Never underestimate the power of a woman.','Whipped',23531,1.7584,3.9,'FweMyFsq-FM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15006,_binary '\0','/9t8zSBYMSV8fc51FV4xCdmK7oyP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0174480',5.6,30760,'en','Autumn in New York','Will Keane, a Manhattan restaurateur, is content with his playboy lifestyle until he meets Charlotte Fielding, a free-spirited young woman. Together the pair pursue a passionate affair that forces them both to reevaluate what they want out of life, even as fate threatens to steal away their future.','/avtPZ5vGvFugnY0NK8d3Przx6P7.jpg','2000-08-11',103,'Released','He fell in love for the first time. She fell in love forever.','Autumn in New York',10641,6.0583,6.125,'Hn8xwIrAF8U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15007,_binary '\0','/mVFz8hqMmrX8JeXcAcowjW1EJtv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0174685',2.3,4013,'en','Girl in Gold Boots','A young woman with dreams of being a dancer moves to Hollywood with her draft-dodging boyfriend. While the man is forced to take a job as a janitor, his girlfriend enters the glamour of go-go dancing and the criminal world of drug trafficking.','/taI9BcHPaWlMescy31doA6bqmMo.jpg','1968-04-25',94,'Released','The glitz and glamor of being a big time Hollywood Go-Go dancer looked good from a distance, but up-close it was another story...this story','Girl in Gold Boots',31253,1.3294,3,'KbdA9X5iqV0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15008,_binary '\0','/qXUCnoVPb8Oge4kIs0Z8cuoNIli.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0174707',6.9,1470,'ja','御用牙 かみそり半蔵地獄責め','Against the backdrop of the Edo treasury devaluing currency and driving many into poverty, Hanzo Itami enforces the law without regard to status. He shows inadequate respect to the treasurer, who wants him dead.','/yvlWwZLgR2Ut1fUVSgoRJJyoOZ2.jpg','1973-08-11',89,'Released',NULL,'Hanzo the Razor: The Snare',17128,1.2334,6.2,'y3G44cdF-qE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15009,_binary '\0','/sNURrrvo1ovc2DLzc2TS3X9GmDu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0174741',4.3,3109,'en','Hitman\'s Run','A former mob hitman, now in witness protection, is forced to come out of retirement when his family is threatened by his cohorts. He teams up with a skateboarding kid, who has a computer disk that the mob wants to get their hands on that has a list of new names for individuals in the FBI witness protection program. The list includes his dad, who separated from his mother years before and hadn\'t been seen since.','/AiwlXo7CEPWavyuXKCWdSFgxy3c.jpg','1999-01-01',93,'Released','Hiding From The FBI And The Mob Can Be Deadly','Hitman\'s Run',127756,1.4049,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15010,_binary '\0','/q8Cv8NcUDoa4H3JTsmZPei4oz9I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0174792',6.9,1842,'en','Jeremiah','The young Jeremiah grows up in a priest\'s family in the village of Anathoth, near Jerusalem. God appears to Jeremiah in different human guises on several occasions, and makes it clear that he has been selected to announce God\'s message to the people of Jerusalem.','/3QeItnMubKWCs7geoxbqQConXXM.jpg','1998-12-14',91,'Released',NULL,'Jeremiah',33201,2.3087,6.9,'xMeyaSy81iw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15011,_binary '\0','/cY3sSQRZZc7olOMYHVqeYAEGRvd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0174834',7.8,2645,'cs','Krysař','A darkly brilliant stop-motion adaptation of The Pied Piper of Hamelin about a plague of rats that punish townsfolk corrupt with greed. One of the most ambitious Czech animation projects of the 1980s, notable for its unusual dark art direction, innovative animation techniques and use of a fictitious language.','/tYDRQvqgTUorU37ZzEFULNMvMHf.jpg','1986-07-29',53,'Released',NULL,'The Pied Piper',82094,2.0676,7.5,'e5RjH1Mp5To','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15012,_binary '\0','/bSvegZGcIA2ipKgPfKu2YQp0EtK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0174852',7.9,6622,'en','The Last Days','This Oscar-winning documentary recounts the harrowing stories of five Hungarian Jews who endured the horrors of the Holocaust and Hitler\'s reign.','/kWr6QDDcO2HHKqvJvgsJ1hQz4Gs.jpg','1998-10-23',87,'Released','Everything you\'re about to see is true.','The Last Days',20595,1.7721,7.425,'Ih74YeYRtHc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15013,_binary '\0','/ffAL7ZiUnCay51SeHFTrTEUpUkO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0174856',7.6,109097,'en','The Hurricane','The story of Rubin \"Hurricane\" Carter, a boxer wrongly imprisoned for murder, and the people who aided in his fight to prove his innocence.','/zhnxjsNnnpsBMF5V1H7Pzkec45Y.jpg','1999-09-17',146,'Released','His greatest fight was for justice.','The Hurricane',10400,8.2399,7.4,'GxtcUmaTHMY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15014,_binary '\0','/ilwS3zaTa79L6Zz9N885TanHbzl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0174931',5.1,5346,'it','Monella','In 1950s northern Italy, a woman tests her fiancé\'s love and passion by trying to break his commitment to premarital chastity.','/n691GdFEMP3bBZ3SvLxFD2paAOz.jpg','1998-06-01',105,'Released','A determined young virgin is on the loose...','Frivolous Lola',50124,3.727,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15015,_binary '\0','/klY4l1qMKyQRY3hdQpNghSZOOQi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0175047',4.3,2163,'en','Point Blank','Convicted corporate criminal Howard engineers a prison break as he and a number of fellow inmates are being transferred to a new facility. The escapees storm a shopping mall and take a group of shoppers hostage (after killing many more of them) before making their demands. Only Rudy, a former mercenary and brother of one of the fugitives, can take out the criminals before more of the hostages die.','/4ewYXrICSHI2PEZC972WPADIykL.jpg','1998-05-12',90,'Released','It\'s Not Just Another Day at the Mall','Point Blank',56125,2.7151,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15016,_binary '\0','/yoLvMXBfQS766ldL2JfxwRxYS2v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0175075',8.3,1892,'uk','Пропала грамота','Folk comedy that tells the adventures of Ukrainian cossacks Vasyl and Andriy as they set out on a long journey to deliver a letter from their leader to the Russian empress in St. Petersburg.','/bLvza7BwMYMqB41tT078cs6kk9n.jpg','1972-12-25',79,'Released',NULL,'The Lost Letter',124007,1.0152,7.768,'OAo6pTFB4go','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15017,_binary '\0','/m5dA4JZsj78EBTa2D6imWOAebwB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0175142',6.3,334892,'en','Scary Movie','A familiar-looking group of teenagers find themselves being stalked by a more-than-vaguely recognizable masked killer! As the victims begin to pile up and the laughs pile on, none of your favorite scary movies escape the razor-sharp satire of this outrageously funny parody!','/fVQFPRuw3yWXojYDJvA5EoFjUOY.jpg','2000-07-07',88,'Released','No mercy. No shame. No sequel.','Scary Movie',4247,20.3903,6.43,'HTLPULt0eJ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15018,_binary '\0','/zfxaFKvKihZYxyDJzd84gJR7HJK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0175157',8.5,1562,'ka','შერეკილები','Ertaoz travels to the city with the intent to sell a chicken and pay off his father\'s debts. Upon arrival, he falls for the beautiful Margalita and decides to help her dispose of her ex-lover\'s body. However, at the cemetery, the lover–a policeman–unexpectedly regains consciousness and arrests Ertaoz and the chicken. Ertaoz is sentenced to ten years, while the bird receives seven. In prison, they meet an inventor who has built a flying machine that runs not on fuel but the power of love.','/gNiv4du6cKwbff2j0ftP5k5MSZj.jpg','1974-01-20',79,'Released',NULL,'The Eccentrics',371486,1.367,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15019,_binary '\0','/xFw5Pw4EOsu6dtyDqtDXEjBhyWV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0175317',7.2,1390,'en','Walking Across Egypt','An elderly widow befriends an orphaned juvenile delinquent.','/vW7tJUxCgCWAQW31feb4syzEXtE.jpg','1999-12-17',100,'Released','For a tough kid who\'s lived a life of crime, the struggle back is as hard as...','Walking Across Egypt',32090,1.6106,4.9,'a2uI3_c_Qk0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15020,_binary '\0','/b8KbYr4ssvlT2k1dLvJxcL55WOu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0175526',5.3,16261,'en','Cherry Falls','When students in the small town of Cherry Falls learn a serial killer is targeting virgins, they realize their only chance of survival is to throw a “Pop Your Cherry” party.','/s4oBLopQ0nh70RXyxIWbNjx7Zw6.jpg','2000-08-25',92,'Released','Lose your innocence... or lose your life.','Cherry Falls',12619,3.8603,5.376,'PGdlArQiXFo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15021,_binary '\0','/qZO6NSn7XVjJZvqj6LyXEHusESy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0175536',5.4,3854,'en','Freeway II: Confessions of a Trickbaby','A twisted teenage prostitute and an equally deranged vicious killer manage to escape from the pen and embark on a non-stop orgy of violence and debauchery, all while hoping to make it across the border into Mexico in order to seek refuge with the mysterious Sister Gomez.','/5GDjVq3WhQRc7OlKb6QDQzxKdk7.jpg','2000-05-13',98,'Released','When you live in the fast lane, there\'s no looking back!','Freeway II: Confessions of a Trickbaby',39927,2.7442,5.6,'1ImBo3Fi0eM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15022,_binary '\0','/8eohkYjvxMzxYpzWIZ2GC8Sl7yo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0175680',7.8,5791,'en','Goodnight, Mister Tom','A shy and quiet World War II evacuee is housed by a disgruntled old man, and they soon develop a close bond.','/qxlqWxL5dgZuSS2XicVt1WNRq8r.jpg','1998-10-25',108,'Released',NULL,'Goodnight, Mister Tom',20546,1.8442,7,'Om5SzTn-Fa0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15023,_binary '\0','/AlY7tXZjY0Xuk44eleDgeXxx4Fa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0175877',5.9,1937,'en','Made Men','A man and a woman are on the run from gangsters whom he has stolen $12.5 million. When the gangsters show up, he takes them supposedly to where the money is hidden but instead leads them into a trap at a backwoods crystal-meth factory. The gangsters and the drug dealers start a shoot-out for unknown reasons and both go gunning for Belushi. Meanwhile an unscrupulous cop is secretly having an affair with the girl friend and planning to make off with the money.','/bGCv1t8McPOFnHdUgDIiFv9c5GW.jpg','1999-06-11',91,'Released','Think bad. Get bad.','Made Men',33671,1.919,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15024,_binary '\0','/mFfyE5DPFDqoes4HIcElHc2a15y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0175880',8,353313,'en','Magnolia','On one random day in the San Fernando Valley, a dying father, a young wife, a male caretaker, a famous lost son, a police officer in love, a boy genius, an ex-boy genius, a game show host and an estranged daughter will each become part of a dazzling multiplicity of plots, but one story.','/tpfC325Jk6S38VTe5dDWjWtoyxr.jpg','1999-12-17',189,'Released','Things fall down. People look up. And when it rains, it pours.','Magnolia',334,10.249,7.7,'cxcegktcxSM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15025,_binary '\0','/lDKwVAsbqzEHryJOCcw5V7bmB2S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0175996',6.6,1248,'es','La otra conquista','The film is a drama about the aftermath of the 1520s Spanish Conquest of Mexico told from the perspective of the indigenous Aztec people. It explores the social, religious, and psychological changes brought about by a historical process of colonization that both defined the American continent and is also highly reminiscent of today’s neocolonialism.','/reunIt1kgpX8D29oXYkbSgvcDuS.jpg','1999-04-01',105,'Released','The spirit of a people can never be conquered.','The Other Conquest',89540,1.8099,6.6,'HaTdPhOZ9UA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15026,_binary '\0','/fMReDZO1Mukdn6Lqfgm4KEBR4Uj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0176227',7.2,2325,'it','Tempo di viaggio','Andrei Tarkovsky and screenwriter Tonino Guerra journey across Italy in preparation for \"Nostalghia.\" Their location scouting unfolds into a wide-ranging conversation about filmmaking, artistic simplicity, and cultural identity, with Tarkovsky articulating his creative philosophy while confronting the emotional weight of working far from his homeland.','/8SKuLuaM7CO4wvvU4vm6dQFmjYK.jpg','1990-03-27',62,'Released',NULL,'Voyage in Time',47011,1.1627,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15027,_binary '\0','/4S32YIJauLUILOgCYDuvdHOkwPj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0176250',6.1,1520,'en','Tube Tales','Nine short stories based on the true experiences of London Underground passengers: \"Mr. Cool\" (Amy Jenkins, dir.); \"Horny\" (Stephen Hopkins); \"Grasshopper\" (Menhaj Huda); \"My Father the Liar\" (Bob Hoskins); \"Bone\" (Ewan McGregor); \"Mouth\" (Armando Iannucci); \"A Bird in the Hand\" (Jude Law); \"Rosebud\" (Gaby Dellal); \"Steal Away\" (Charles McDougall)','/bK3zlukpnr3MGeOvBZ5vIiJ2EWE.jpg','1999-11-19',84,'Released',NULL,'Tube Tales',45739,2.157,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15028,_binary '\0','/7mTsm6R2LAOxOsQ1BooJ27WwzAl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0176269',4.2,32282,'en','Universal Soldier: The Return','Luc Deveraux, the heroic former Universal Soldier, is about to be thrown into action once again. When SETH, the supercomputer-controlled ultra-warrior, decides to take revenge and destroy its creators, only Luc can stop it. All hell breaks loose as Luc battles SETH and a deadly team of perfect soldiers in a struggle that pits man against machine and good against evil.','/qlcPJK0Me8aUtDPwk3TqN2RdKH4.jpg','1999-08-05',82,'Released','Prepare to become obsolete.','Universal Soldier: The Return',10366,7.3872,5.9,'DmokVosyZbE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15029,_binary '\0','/bBPsblWmfNDAW8eC5f6zyQB5wa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0176326',4,1316,'en','Without Evidence','It is based on the true story of Michael Francke, who was the Head of Corrections for the state of Oregon before being murdered. Just before his murder, Francke visits his brother and informs him of a drug ring involving his prison colleagues. When Michael is killed, his brother begins his own investigation into the murder, leading him to more lies and deceit.','/ngwlWUKxPSY3Y68mL3FShFAoa3r.jpg','1995-10-12',92,'Released',NULL,'Without Evidence',23476,2.0354,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15030,_binary '\0','/21ZJvlxIv49YO6tz0gnVvQiar06.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0176415',7.3,2210,'es','El abuelo','After his son dies, an elderly man comes back to Spain from the US and hopes to find out which of his granddaughters is true, and which one is bastard.','/63OYLpAPcHWMIHr96VDmqQUdJ5s.jpg','1998-10-16',151,'Released','Love or honor? How can one choose?','The Grandfather',69851,1.1864,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15031,_binary '\0','/vI2TzKkJqZ0xD8Wpqj7eMrAjr90.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0176422',6.2,1986,'fr','Alice et Martin','Martin, the illegitimate son of an industrialist and a hairdresser, was sent to live with his wealthy father in the countryside as a young boy. Alice is a musician living with Martin\'s half-brother in Paris. When Martin shows up at Alice\'s door after fleeing his father\'s home under troubled circumstances, their lives become intertwined.','/9IwtR0iolypfZbDrPk3xB7A9fKh.jpg','1998-10-23',124,'Released',NULL,'Alice and Martin',102489,1.6499,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15032,_binary '\0','/magHC0PE5d1jS0lTcFPhWs3Th4B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0176426',5.5,1950,'en','It\'s the Rage','A rich cross-section of urban USA find their lives changed when their fates collide at gunpoint. At the centre of it all are Helen and Warren Harding, an up-scale couple on the brink of divorce, whose awakening in the night by a burglar sets off a catastrophic series of events.','/ug180c08YBK7kaRi5HGrqmCWNLf.jpg','2000-07-07',99,'Released',NULL,'It\'s the Rage',30946,2.4421,5.5,'npxeAOGwOGI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15033,_binary '\0','/43VrmHOChLcAOG9S5tIFdsxr3u8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0176694',7.9,1516,'hu','Az ember tragédiája','Jankovics\'s adaptation of the eponymous play is divided into multiple parts, and depicts the creation and fall of Man throughout history.','/mAVOj2Lr7BwuGPVrqRxAJI558EJ.jpg','2011-11-27',166,'Released',NULL,'The Tragedy of Man',116369,1.7536,7.5,'0eSdOPcHum8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15034,_binary '\0','/aJCHbwgrrizPSyZTzywSSeLqYQv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0176783',5.9,17240,'en','Gossip','For a class project, three college students decide to invent an unfounded rumor about the most popular girl on campus. But as the rumor spreads, it begins to spiral out of control.','/1fyQiQyBFlqjeqgT6sAEh5vo4Fe.jpg','2000-04-21',90,'Released','Some people are dying to hear it.','Gossip',18041,3.2517,5.8,'BVeBO-ahVGU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15035,_binary '\0','/qnL8fXGSAx5KfqNLMZtUPxsPENu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0176809',7,1580,'cn','真心英雄','Jack and Martin are gunmen who work for two rival kingpins. Jack and Martin have been fighting on their bosses behalf for close to a year. When a truce is made both Jack and Martin are cut loose. The two men then decide to join forces and take on the gangsters who used them.','/AuoQm14zQPL89WxpiTKb5VAoOxP.jpg','1998-09-30',98,'Released',NULL,'A Hero Never Dies',58776,2.1237,6.9,'ETIbfylSCG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15036,_binary '\0','/aZpLaHFgHkvJihJx5pXmGytJKbr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0176892',4.8,2287,'en','A Knight in Camelot','Yet another variation on Mark Twain\'s \"A Connecticut Yankee At King Arthur\'s Court.\" Here, a computer malfunction causes a science researcher to be sent back in time with her laptop, which she uses to amaze the court.','/rCJICpvo6Av27x9Lfu65iwlNfED.jpg','1998-11-08',90,'Released','King Arthur\'s Round Table will never be the same!','A Knight in Camelot',24793,2.1878,5.5,'nMHZEmCulKA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15037,_binary '\0','/dHKK8ALYAFvjNLwkqV3aOMDCa2H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0176943',5.2,1980,'en','Logan\'s War: Bound by Honor','Chuck Norris stars as martial arts extraordinaire Jake Fallon, who, after the death of his brother and sister-in-law, adopts (and trains) his orphaned nephew. Logan (Eddie Cibrian, TV\'s Invasion). After fifteen years of careful instruction, Logan is determined to avenge his parents Death... And, he\'ll need Uncle Jake\'s help to do it.','/6d0bSSHFi4tBpX1abJ0SDxklopU.jpg','1998-11-01',90,'Released','Long memory... Short fuse...','Logan\'s War: Bound by Honor',38202,2.9734,5.3,'lyuDDdU2mKs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15038,_binary '\0','/dM5EsMThLa7KB7bpl7ZcVuwdvlE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0177215',5.7,1357,'en','Seven Girlfriends','Jesse is charming, romantic, and he knows how to pop the question; he just can\'t face marriage. So, when he and Hannah split up during the same week that a former fiancée dies, he decides to figure things out. He visits each woman about whom he\'s been serious to ask what went wrong. His teen flame, an independent woman who sometimes sleeps with him, and a group of lesbians give him advice, as does Anabeth, dead but lively in his dreams. One ex remains furious, but with the help of her inventive colleague, the level-headed insomniac Laura, Jesse even gets to talk to her. It\'s on to Anabeth\'s funeral, where he\'ll see Hannah, and maybe grasp what has been eluding him.','/96yBDHZr5WbdgiAYLHqT7hIH01b.jpg','2000-04-21',99,'Released','Jesse Campbell is breaking up... Only his ex-girlfriends can pick up the pieces','Seven Girlfriends',38274,1.9243,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15039,_binary '\0','/8HV5836TP0AmLgNU4nkEs9FnIEo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0177226',4.3,1384,'en','Sisters of Death','During an all-girl secret society initiation, one of the new members is killed playing Russian Roulette. Many years later the survivors are invited for a reunion to a lavish estate, which turns out to be owned by the crazed father of the girl who died.','/juVkFdUYpGMITvnzrKeHdMQDV8d.jpg','1976-04-18',87,'Released','There\'s nobody to hear your scream...except your killer','Sisters of Death',49304,1.9157,4.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15040,_binary '\0','/qg6s5pLyOdCalXBavcbIXzqwd0n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0177242',6.8,7606,'de','Sonnenallee','A group of kids grow up on the short, wrong (east) side of the Sonnenallee in Berlin, right next to one of the few border crossings between East and West reserved for German citizens. The antics of these kids, their families, of the \"West German\" friends and relatives who come to visit, and of the East German border guards, all serve to illustrate the absurdity of everyday life on the Sonnenallee, and therefore throughout the former East Germany.','/lkoK4EVQiIx60a65BoR2HGpiw8g.jpg','1999-10-07',101,'Released',NULL,'Sonnenallee',2241,2.5038,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15041,_binary '\0','/o7gPznINZLwFIDBuibZ8rDRKBvc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0177262',8,3640,'en','Style Wars','Tony Silver and Henry Chalfant\'s PBS documentary tracks the rise and fall of subway graffiti in New York in the late 1970s and early 1980s.','/vgW7eMrK8Y8u91vG9R9iff4tsIP.jpg','1984-01-23',70,'Released',NULL,'Style Wars',29587,1.8236,7.6,'K5DBB1PNew0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15042,_binary '\0','/dOjWpQ7evwJXfFzxQjUv3sWIHB6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0177267',7.6,3477,'en','Superman: The Last Son of Krypton','Clark Kent, the last survivor of the dead planet Krypton, uses his amazing powers to defend people of his adopted world, Earth, and become Superman.','/2g5o7gVeSn0HTtmZapL2pY1u1xR.jpg','1996-09-10',64,'Released','Who is he? What is he?','Superman: The Last Son of Krypton',49076,2.9927,7.1,'wW86XbgYDwA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15043,_binary '\0','/37iNQlXOAc9hCbheJjHbdV9iGgd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0177293',7,2149,'el','Το Ξύλο Βγήκε Απ\' τον Παράδεισο','Young teacher Floras arrives to teach a class at a girls’ high school in Athens. His students, daughters of rich Athenian families, are very spoilt making his and the other teachers work difficult. When he starts implementing discipline in his class, the girls use every means to get rid of him. But the most undisciplined, Lisa Papastavrou, falls in love with him.','/wGEZAYoSKlLG7ekJ7ZqgGmIjFeU.jpg','1959-11-16',98,'Released',NULL,'Maiden\'s Cheek',297560,1.515,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15044,_binary '\0','/4kNcp0Ha3II1yaYZmNNtByTyMil.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0177347',6.4,2481,'sv','Vägen ut','The enthusiastic Reine is forced to take a job as a social worker at Kumla prison.','/fAkO326MnSo8844f7rZmwJY092o.jpg','1999-02-19',105,'Released',NULL,'Breaking Out',49940,1.2225,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15045,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0177484',8,1303,'te','జగదేకవీరుడు అతిలోకసుందరి','A man finds a ring that gives the bearer great power, but the goddess to whom the ring belongs wants it back to return to her world.','/q1B0XgJmzlSP6sujx95ny2tSwrK.jpg','1990-05-09',150,'Released',NULL,'Jagadeka Veerudu Athiloka Sundari',77031,1.2001,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15046,_binary '\0','/zsNSRF5acERdJMwdSkzgKz9Ac3I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0177507',7.6,5215,'de','Absolute Giganten','The Hamburg friends Walter, Ricco and Floyd take each day as it comes between the estates of tower blocks and fast food restaurants. All three are in their early twenties and are dreaming of another life when Floyd suddenly takes a job on a freighter going to Singapore.','/bfIyk9Tlc4u5NdpWvtSD2jQEqOE.jpg','1999-09-30',80,'Released',NULL,'Gigantic',1661,2.1331,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15047,_binary '\0','/vRr0gyJJyD5O12Ozt6jM4bAz1H0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0177511',7.7,7687,'fa','آژانس شیشه‌ای','An armed veteran of the Iran-Iraq War takes hostages at a travel agency after failing to raise enough money for his injured comrade to travel abroad for medical treatment.','/wyT1BT6W0zvPrJe8cIOx9XyF1PB.jpg','1998-01-02',108,'Released',NULL,'The Glass Agency',328069,1.0899,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15048,_binary '\0','/q100wrlBjRAWXaIqLo548htjvia.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0177650',5.2,2251,'en','Company Man','In the 1960\'s, a school teacher pretends to be a CIA spy to get his nagging wife off his back. He helps a Russian ballet dancer defect and is then sent to Cuba to locate \"Agent X\" for the CIA.','/qtHajQHigcU44j5DEgOdLbQev8u.jpg','2000-03-09',86,'Released','International intelligence just got dumber.','Company Man',44412,1.9972,5.1,'BgOIYGutIx8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15049,_binary '\0','/3HyORQdGbULikpcV6z05VvELuBj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0177698',7.7,1721,'el','Δεσποινίς Διευθυντής','The strict and formal director Lila Vassiliou has under her orders all the staff of the technical office of which she takes over the management, but at the same time, she is looking to find ways of charm to conquer the lively sub-engineer Alekos Samiotakis.','/9gCFgblC9q4N78FZjjBlCHqy3eU.jpg','1964-12-18',96,'Released',NULL,'Miss Manager',57305,1.531,7.438,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15050,_binary '\0','/pPslvQiEDuK4cScAoyMmgBxmmEi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0177746',6.4,2111,'fr','Les Enfants du Siècle','True tale of the tumultuous love affair between two French literary icons of the 19th Century, novelist George Sand and poet Alfred de Musset. But their affair falls apart during an excursion to Venice, Italy where Musset is distracted by drugs and Sand by a handsome doctor.','/x5qDyTNNXBEw8SMrnyt1607tJs0.jpg','1999-09-12',135,'Released',NULL,'The Children of the Century',46466,2.1471,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15051,_binary '\0','/2sRjubxawPd2dLFcTkQBhCdk2Na.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0177747',6.1,3270,'es','Entre las piernas','A radio-show assistant meets a budding screenwriter during a group-therapy session for sex addicts.','/3RwzIMMaZEmvGWzvOrZZfWctdvx.jpg','1999-01-14',115,'Released','Sex can be murder.','Between Your Legs',53116,2.4882,5.4,'75-Z8jw3PPM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15052,_binary '\0','/j13gcHwSsW7j4ulY6q5aUOSRvvs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0177749',7.2,1413,'de','Erleuchtung garantiert','Two middle aged German brothers - one New Age and recently divorced, the other uptight and sceptical - travel to a Zen monastery in Japan in search of enlightenment, or perhaps just in search of themselves.','/zSNtcIPwhdulMYjTYrEkD3APw6Y.jpg','2000-01-20',109,'Released','Two Strangers in a Strange Land.','Enlightenment Guaranteed',29507,1.5667,6.9,'6fXi4lOJe1I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15053,_binary '\0','/yzQ0mkz1OUJKtUK1NWp53jiGcaJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0177789',7.4,193373,'en','Galaxy Quest','For four years, the courageous crew of the NSEA Protector — Commander Peter Quincy Taggart, Lieutenant Tawny Madison, and Doctor Lazarus — set off on a thrilling and often dangerous mission in space... until their series was cancelled! Now, twenty years later, aliens under attack have mistaken the Galaxy Quest television transmissions for \"historical documents\" and beam up the crew of has-been actors to save the universe. With no script, no director, and no clue, the actors must turn in the performances of their lives.','/fZXSwgZknp81vmciTb86rw0MejV.jpg','1999-12-25',102,'Released','A comedy of galactic proportions.','Galaxy Quest',926,10.2482,7.101,'B34jbC43XzA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15054,_binary '\0','/15yhlMfdCeorg8QGkoQuBYeUNBC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0177845',6.1,1647,'en','Hotel Splendide','A chef seeks reconciliation with her brother by helping him run a decaying resort and health spa.','/td1G4qqhCnOQ4ZliPU3BnWVbRrG.jpg','2000-09-21',98,'Released','… The Last Resort','Hotel Splendide',67252,1.3158,5.7,'ECURiv-NCCg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15055,_binary '\0','/rLbsOTimvSBqaf7Utlmh8GqqZBA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0177858',7.6,23634,'de','Im Juli','Daniel’s drab existence as a physics teacher takes an adventurous turn when he falls in love with a Turkish girl named Melek. He spontaneously decides to follow her to Instanbul by car. On the road across Europe, he picks up his free-spirited friend Juli, who is secretly in love with him.','/4OHEgTFNy6G0rkPEOKD2tM6VBwY.jpg','2000-08-23',96,'Released','A Summer Night\'s Dream.','In July',3716,1.8395,7.2,'Mr7WImqnKBM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15056,_binary '\0','/s2XyJwZ2nmtbCT8ZE3oPlm0yq1j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0177882',6.6,5323,'de','Kebab Connection','In Hamburg, Ibrahim \"Ibo\" Secmez, of Turkish descent, wants to direct the first German kung-fu movie. For now, he makes commercials for his uncle\'s kebab restaurant. Titzie, an aspiring actress and Ibo\'s German girlfriend, finds she\'s pregnant. Ibo is uncertain about fatherhood - compounded by his father\'s disowning him for getting a German girl pregnant - so Titzie sends him packing. He makes attempts at getting it right, but as the birth approaches, he\'s still not ready. In the background are three thugs in search of good tripe soup and a Capulet-Montegue feud between the kebab joint and a Greek taverna across the street. Can Ibo be the glove upon that hand?','/jNHsAVtJEzAGQJnv3AGagBSAFLu.jpg','2004-04-21',96,'Released',NULL,'Kebab Connection',2004,1.3189,6.6,'M0Eyvh4SUG0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15057,_binary '\0','/hAlU3J8T66bEquSPWm9Bh7zNxET.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0177886',2.9,1402,'en','The Killer Eye','A mad scientist\'s experiment goes awry, turning a homeless drifter\'s eyeball into a giant killing machine with an insatiable appetite for young women.','/v6TD8iJMU6f8OXm0YFJ24FHAYPx.jpg','1999-01-18',72,'Released','Terror Vision','The Killer Eye',64921,1.5927,2.7,'bdfAmQwq4EM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15058,_binary '\0','/tO1wEUOSmZLyttwkhOMzUxTiR7k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0177971',6.5,190211,'en','The Perfect Storm','In October 1991, a confluence of weather conditions combined to form a killer storm in the North Atlantic. Caught in the storm was the sword-fishing boat Andrea Gail.','/vJPoxqgpfFNbGi0HyoNsjFeLCio.jpg','2000-06-29',130,'Released','Feel its fury.','The Perfect Storm',2133,12.2927,6.49,'g2gtajq4K_Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15059,_binary '\0','/tHNrEK51E7UVTJbaXpvGY3p7IaY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0178022',6.4,1382,'en','Siam Sunset','A British design executive, who seemingly has everything going for him has his life totally changed when a refrigerator falls from an aircraft and lands on his wife...','/iGFjTOA5DoU3uqzzjhYXsDHEHQS.jpg','1999-09-09',91,'Released',NULL,'Siam Sunset',50285,1.341,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15060,_binary '\0','/a16Zv4zf3FjQIGV666B9bapOdQU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0178033',6.2,1320,'el','Η Σωφερίνα','Mary and Nikos are a happily married couple whose life turns upside down when Mary’s friend, Lilly, borrows their new car. When Lilly crashes the car, she asks Mary to cover for her so that her husband doesn’t find about her new affair. The case of the car crash is brought to court, and Mary is accused. Things get so complicated that not even Lilly’s confession can solve the misunderstanding.','/79vuE49jVGrxEdP12uqoV6VhbtR.jpg','1964-11-07',98,'Released',NULL,'The Woman Driver',301490,0.9908,5.765,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15061,_binary '\0','/tOnKQ7VLfyfnB5LGB1Lp4JPPFHD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0178043',6.1,1443,'en','Stranger Than Fiction','Nothing is as it seems when four friends agree to cover up a killing. When they begin to doubt who among them is telling the truth, they find that life can be stranger than fiction.','/3d54NNXZnpIq7H9UyITVbM8yEiw.jpg','2000-03-16',96,'Released','One murder leads to another.','Stranger Than Fiction',9892,1.6517,5.9,'WNOqt8Noj4I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15062,_binary '\0','/qYEWzElzsewiWFdjBBmqAkpjm9t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0178050',5.6,1833,'en','Sunset Strip','A day in Hollywood, 1972, with young people looking for the 24 hours that will change their lives. Zach will open that night for a British rocker at Whisky a Go-Go; he lives in a canyon and plays impromptu duets with a mysterious guitarist he doesn\'t see. Tammy is a costume designer, open to quick sex with the various rockers she works with and loved from afar by Michael, a photographer recovering from a case of the clap. His good friend is Felix, a morose, alcoholic songwriter. On hand for comic relief is Marty Shapiro, a fast-talking record producer. Getting ready for the gig at the club, Zach\'s performance, and the early-morning aftermath comprise the film.','/j9awEAeVvMolWIAmmqTYeRyXagM.jpg','2000-08-18',90,'Released','The ultimate address for a dream','Sunset Strip',117262,1.7393,4.8,'CbgUeve9ym4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15063,_binary '\0','/unuq3xeXq6DiB8i1MObdD5nJNx7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0178186',7.9,1758,'hi','Aandhi','J.K. is a hotel Manager in a scenic location in India. One day he gallantly comes to the rescue of a drunk daughter, Aarti, of a politician, and chooses to be discrete about it. When she recovers, she and he fall in love; get married in a small marriage ceremony, have a daughter, and thereafter differences arise to such an extent that they decide to separate. Years pass J.K. and Aarti meet again when she is an established politician, both are still attracted to each other, but she does not want her name to be tarnished and stigmatized as a \"separated\" woman.','/6v5sL4BcMwwx17Vb0oitvsBi40o.jpg','1975-02-13',133,'Released',NULL,'Aandhi',59277,1.097,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15064,_binary '\0','/iT4Og4CRGXV7gbIpIalMVuSUfFH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0178642',5.5,3276,'en','The Invisible Circus','After learning that her sister, Faith, has committed suicide in Portugal, Phoebe, an 18-year-old hippie, decides to uproot from her San Francisco home to travel to Europe. Phoebe hopes to discover and experience the life that led to her sister\'s death by retracing her footsteps, which eventually leads to Wolf -- Faith\'s boyfriend. However, as Phoebe\'s journey continues, a series of visions of Faith pushes her mind to the brink.','/fJD7zRuGJ9HbgbmKSTRkKysWhu7.jpg','2001-02-23',93,'Released','A story of friendship, freedom and fate that could only happen in the Sixties.','The Invisible Circus',18856,1.6356,5.2,'gGOUZ66EGyU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15065,_binary '\0','/5MXugxOxwvuzdFECssjdlAp56lf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0178683',6.4,1611,'el','Χτυποκάρδια στο Θρανίο','Lisa is a student, pretending the sick not to go to school. Her parents are worried about her health and call the doctor to examine her. He realizes her lies but he covers her. Soon, they fall in love and eventually get married. However, after the honeymoon she begins to yearn school and her classmates and she returns to it without saying anything to her husband. Soon, her husband begins to suspect her because of her frequent absences from home and her secret meetings with the professor seem to confirm his suspicions.','/hMwt4YJkGB1fi9wIdnieIeHRTI5.jpg','1963-11-11',114,'Released',NULL,'Throbs at the Desk',379508,0.9347,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15066,_binary '\0','/w3jB1liVZioKssQ9V18mEZaTG9V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0178737',7,28196,'en','Mansfield Park','Fanny Price is sent to live with her wealthy relatives, the Bertrams, where she is treated poorly by most except her cousin Edmund. Her life is complicated by the arrival of the worldly Mary and Henry Crawford.','/4l6KP9BSU1QgSgj9cjpeS3Bfhsr.jpg','1999-11-12',112,'Released','For everyone who loved \"Emma\" and \"Sense & Sensibility\" comes the comedy Jane Austen loved best.','Mansfield Park',10399,3.1904,6.7,'7t15rm0iwSQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15067,_binary '\0','/sGhbO6muh1Fnpa7nkxYCfvmgWCo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0178868',7.2,87239,'ja','リング','A mysterious video has been linked to a number of deaths, and when an inquisitive journalist finds the tape and views it herself, she sets in motion a chain of events that puts her own life in danger.','/1YINof6kN5yRdePEbcU5360ejoq.jpg','1998-01-31',96,'Released','One curse, one cure, one week to find it.','Ring',2671,9.0853,7.1,'m4iODTbUn1A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15068,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0178988',5.4,2116,'en','Whiteboyz','In a virtually all-white Iowa town, Flip daydreams of being a hip-hop star, hanging with Snoop Doggy Dogg and Dr. Dre. He practices in front of a mirror and with his two pals, James and Trevor. He talks Black slang, he dresses Black. He\'s also a wannabe pusher, selling flour as cocaine. And while he talks about \"keeping it real,\" he hardly notices real life around him: his father\'s been laid off, his mother uses Food Stamps, his girlfriend is pregnant, James may be psychotic, one of his friends (one of the town\'s few Black kids) is preparing for college, and, on a trip to Chicago to try to buy drugs, the cops shoot real bullets. What will it take for Flip to get real?','/k5hHP3JaD6wak6ovkuZL7Ggqzyz.jpg','1999-09-10',92,'Released','They dreamed of the ghetto...But they woke up in Iowa.','Whiteboyz',40879,1.2488,5.4,'pOVPcS2ZKHE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15069,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0179074',6.6,2422,'en','American Pimp','Street pimps, all of them African-American, discuss their lives and work: getting started, being flamboyant, pimping in various U.S. cities, bringing a woman into their group, taking a woman from another pimp, and the rules and regulations of pimping. The men are clear: it\'s about money.','/2vEP0mubKIp5Xexfj23SvN86aDD.jpg','2000-06-09',87,'Released',NULL,'American Pimp',24587,1.1524,6,'JtUaq2nouLU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15070,_binary '\0','/53f29bdN46K7UT17OCYQ0sBZBdm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0179098',6.6,15275,'en','Moonlight Mile','As he copes with the death of his fiancee along with her parents, a young man must figure out what he wants out of life.','/jKDnCPUkL4QsgeqKCtyNMPL2XUU.jpg','2002-09-09',117,'Released','In life and love, expect the unexpected.','Moonlight Mile',31005,4.2811,6.3,'5mr0AnQ2jwU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15071,_binary '\0','/f4ZgIaMpOWd6rewhCfoIIMqWquh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0179116',6.9,53368,'en','But I\'m a Cheerleader','Megan is an all-American girl. A cheerleader. She has a boyfriend. But Megan doesn\'t like kissing her boyfriend very much. And she\'s pretty touchy with her cheerleader friends. Her conservative parents worry that she must be a lesbian and send her off to \"sexual redirection\" school, where she must, with other lesbians and gays learn how to be straight.','/8huDg3Q0EmcWuN9HgYsO8ylAp9f.jpg','2000-07-07',85,'Released','A comedy of sexual disorientation.','But I\'m a Cheerleader',20770,6.6443,7.087,'0x4vA-IXhq0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15072,_binary '\0','/3VHkoXEPDEyrvQaL9Oti8U5FlmD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0179148',6.3,4940,'en','The Devil\'s Arithmetic','An American-born Jewish adolescent, Hannah Stern, is uninterested in the culture, faith and customs of her relatives. However, she begins to revaluate her heritage when she has a supernatural experience that transports her back to a Nazi death camp in 1941. There she meets a young girl named Rivkah, a fellow captive in the camp. As Rivkah and Hannah struggle to survive in the face of daily atrocities, they form an unbreakable bond.','/2QBXokkFDYOKLPAKk6FQO9gd6YS.jpg','1999-03-28',95,'Released','She saw the truth with her own eyes.','The Devil\'s Arithmetic',22509,2.5373,6.8,'kl11PqoaRtU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15073,_binary '\0','/e4zGKgmT2SThRAVsbbZ2jIK1fuU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0179182',5.3,2946,'en','Forever Mine','A hotel cabana boy falls for the wife of a powerful politico. But when she confesses to the affair, her husband determines to end it forever.','/87ypWc4siloySz32xiTORN9oH46.jpg','1999-09-12',117,'Released','Some desires are too dangerous to resist.','Forever Mine',18553,2.6333,5.3,'JVZonN3nfLM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15074,_binary '\0','/bgCfvq9ReQbCA4O2CEqKDu6zmbQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0179183',4.5,7711,'en','Fortress 2','John Brennick once again finds himself imprisoned, but this time in a new, more sophisticated fortress prison in outer space. But Brennick\'s not a man to give in easily, and with a 10-year-old son waiting for him back on earth, he\'s going to pack some serious assault on the evil corporation.','/dVNFoj8NqfnNJN4Syq8aXbAS10B.jpg','2000-03-02',92,'Released','Locked in a prison orbiting 26,000 miles above earth. Escape was never thought possible... until now.','Fortress 2',11119,3.2962,5.059,'8kt_GEVZGCY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15075,_binary '\0','/mEEpAUGeYkLuaaW3A7EgqduchLW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0179218',8,4682,'en','Hitman Hart: Wrestling with Shadows','This documentary follows superstar Bret Hart during his last year in the WWF. The film documents the tensions that resulted in The Montreal Screwjob, one of the most controversial events in the history of professional wrestling, in which Vince McMahon, Shawn Micheals, and others, legitimately conspired behind the scenes to go against the script and remove Bret Hart as champion.','/t1OcFAGsBWMUgtifSXblxiCHrZl.jpg','1998-12-20',93,'Released','The story of a man who believes in heroes, in a world where the anti-hero is king.','Hitman Hart: Wrestling with Shadows',34303,2.2275,7.5,'jUTfI6MSV6k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15076,_binary '\0','/79ewxXRWT4hbgK6qzJ8atdOOgjO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0179473',4.3,1821,'en','South of Heaven, West of Hell','Valentine Casey is a Marshal in the desolate Tucson territory of the early 1900s. On Christmas Eve, his outlaw family pays him a disturbing visit. He must confront the sins of his past. He and his partner, U.S. Christmas, journey through the desert to a small town that the ruthless Henry Clan has hit in order to save Casey\'s love, Adelyne.','/3XG2NwrO1YCWxHJ1tOyvGwRECvk.jpg','2000-01-28',131,'Released','It\'s A Little Strange Out There...','South of Heaven, West of Hell',24470,2.5051,4.6,'ZTf1VAxtbpA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15077,_binary '\0','/1dVT8zOJkFEyMyke5wsYWATGWtm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0179477',4.2,1788,'en','Storm Catcher','A renegade general plots to bomb Washington using a new top secret jet called the Storm Catcher. The only trouble is only one man is capable of flying it. So they seek to put him on the run in a conspiracy that makes him appear to have murdered several men and stolen the plane. Then try to murder his wife and take his daughter prisoner. Threatening to kill his daughter if he doesn\'t help, he appears trapped. However, his best friend who is the plane\'s computer specialist has a few tricks up his sleeve.','/nl7TMlYPSDGhWga4j6ru8RvKF7U.jpg','1999-09-10',95,'Released','Convicted of treason. Sentenced to death. One chance to set the record straight.','Storm Catcher',26129,2.5529,3.7,'wli1iud9v3E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15078,_binary '\0','/dGm3XpCrvwU7DmMz7UFViJtKAYg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0179626',6.1,53975,'en','15 Minutes','When Eastern European criminals Oleg and Emil come to New York City to pick up their share of a heist score, Oleg steals a video camera and starts filming their activities, both legal and illegal. When they learn how the American media circus can make a remorseless killer look like the victim and make them rich, they target media-savvy NYPD Homicide Detective Eddie Flemming and media-naive FDNY Fire Marshal Jordy Warsaw, the cops investigating their murder and torching of their former criminal partner, filming everything to sell to the local tabloid TV show \"Top Story.\"','/1qGyTDp4K4J2RjGtT5hR81ilX9r.jpg','2001-03-01',120,'Released','America likes to watch.','15 Minutes',2749,5.888,5.921,'nWdh_-ZItS4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15079,_binary '\0','/5HBAC4N3qg510xT7sBuvTWkJJ3b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0179634',6.4,2180,'el','Η Αλίκη στο Ναυτικό','Aliki is in love with someone who serves his duty in the greek navy. Wanting to see him, she disguises as a navy soldier and gets aboard her lover\'s ship. Things get more complicated when she comes accross the ship\'s captain; her father!','/A5eJhSpvoVYZH7SEUrV9HECGdB6.jpg','1961-02-20',87,'Released',NULL,'Alice in the Navy',64674,2.1323,6.455,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15080,_binary '\0','/zUfHgNOD3E6ZsCBk30cijW86n06.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0179841',6.1,3412,'tr','Harem Suare','On the eve of the fall of the Ottoman Empire: in the harem of Sultan Abdulhamit II, the odalisque of Italian origin Safiyè dreams of becoming the sultan\'s first mistress. To achieve her goal, the girl, aided by the eunuch Nadir, is even willing to kill. But when her dream is finally about to come true, her entire world suddenly collapses: the sultan is exiled, the harem is closed, and the odalisques and eunuchs are abandoned to their fate.','/7vDDKNnt5mp9eVYRh7nCcj3pV7S.jpg','1999-11-24',125,'Released',NULL,'Last Harem',47953,2.4028,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15081,_binary '\0','/dNsKS5aAVXF2I9cdDaYBau8pFcU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0179861',3.6,1439,'en','Icebreaker','At the the Killington ski resort something has gone awry. Evil terrorists led by the sinister Greig have taken the resort hostage with a stolen nuclear device. It\'s up to Ski Patrol bum Matt Foster to save the day... and his fiancé.','/ebNiYaq0daBYk32blRWztNHigW0.jpg','2000-05-01',90,'Released','Twenty terrorists, five hundred vacationing skiers, one ski patrol officer...','Icebreaker',15090,1.7492,3.5,'vS70dfwUX2k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15082,_binary '\0','/kXPet5lpTsLPBhmjsbP8dSkJHJ8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0179890',5.7,1236,'el','Υπολοχαγός Νατάσσα','The year is 1965. Natasa Arseni visits Dachau, the place where she was found by the Americans at the end of the World War II. She returns to Greece, and during the train ride she recalls those past events. Before the beginning of the Greek-Italian war, she met Orestis . With the German invasion, Orestis, who was an officer in the Greek army, left for the Middle East. She followed him and accompanied him back to occupied Greece on a mission. She was arrested, interrogated and tortured and was finally sentenced to execution.','/2ETXm8eABCD2xKfHucNSFkyuqzg.jpg','1970-12-12',136,'Released',NULL,'Lieutenant Natassa',276609,1.4326,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15083,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0179918',8,1315,'sh','Kamiondžije 2','New adventures of truck drivers Jare and Paja, long-time fellow associates and close friends. Jare is forced to pay off his debt for the loans he was raising to build a house for his numerous family. He must find heaps of money as soon as possible, or let tax gatherers to take everything. Paja tries to help him in this impossible task, but on their way they face bunch of obstacles, losses and misfortunes, encountering all sorts of people, only to end up in serious problems.','/oRHUMAXuVFofLLHKQvFuN5UVgWY.jpg','1984-04-05',88,'Released',NULL,'Truckers Ride Again',263964,2.0599,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15084,_binary '\0','/hvIKsPloN4QxfHiJSBOSwh09FDQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0179955',8.3,11741,'hu','Macskafogó','In the year 80 AMM (After Mickey Mouse) on the anthropomorphic animal-controlled Planet X, a party of mafioso cats plot to enact a genocide against the mouse population of the world. Mouse scientist Professor Fushimishi seems to have found the weapon against the threat to his people\'s lives and calls Intermouse, who then call its best (albeit retired) agent, Nick Grabowsky, to get the plans, and as a distraction, they send a second agent - Sergeant Lazy Dick - for the mission.','/8cPcKE7HEieNJVTft11xRKXFpAv.jpg','1986-10-02',96,'Released',NULL,'Cat City',60800,2.355,7.6,'bs8K0mtaq_E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15085,_binary '\0','/urMpw7FsQSzeAcnXIHzcsycXZiK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0180037',6.4,2723,'en','Paperback Hero','Australian truck driver Jack has written a successful romance novel under the name of his best friend\'s girlfriend - Ruby Vale. When a publisher arrives to sign up \'Ruby\', complications arise.','/ycPH8DZp6qZ5TJuf95pDGoYDFWo.jpg','1999-03-25',96,'Released','He\'s hard, tough...and doesn\'t give a XXXX for anything...except romantic novels','Paperback Hero',68044,1.2701,6.1,'FWAiGU0_mNI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15086,_binary '\0','/lEGw5YRSN4WVY51Hadytked78nG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0180052',3.9,28487,'en','The Adventures of Pluto Nash','The year is 2087, the setting is the moon. Pluto Nash, the high-flying successful owner of the hottest nightclub in the universe, finds himself in trouble when he refuses to sell his club to lunar gangster Mogan, who just happens to be helping the mysterious Rex Crater mastermind a plan to take over the entire moon.','/96vvhLWWDosS1zRrfQ6XEGAzByL.jpg','2002-08-16',95,'Released','The MAN on the Moon.','The Adventures of Pluto Nash',11692,5.1845,4.371,'B7KYlzex1ZQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15087,_binary '\0','/o4p4joAAFETuUFCHJe2XYJcnCdi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0180073',7.2,59392,'en','Quills','In early 19th-century France, the Marquis de Sade is confined to an asylum where his forbidden writings continue to circulate beyond its walls. As the authorities tighten control, a clash unfolds between the Marquis’ unyielding imagination, the reformist ideals of the Abbé in charge, and the repressive measures of a doctor sent to silence him. Desire, power, and censorship collide in a battle over freedom of expression.','/AvGdw3BpvJV2wHmK2qY0N7XHqET.jpg','2000-11-22',124,'Released','Meet the Marquis de Sade. The pleasure is all his.','Quills',10876,5.6222,7.153,'u--PYnIYewE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15088,_binary '\0','/fAGYRJCujRBMw7TCuTp893eSG8e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0180093',8.3,984945,'en','Requiem for a Dream','The drug-induced utopias of four Coney Island residents are shattered when their addictions run deep.','/9BTwsLaMVHOGFlmsSlx5QYCaXb.jpg','2000-10-06',102,'Released',NULL,'Requiem for a Dream',641,10.8064,8.005,'NEKjZSTo0Uk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15089,_binary '\0','/1MoeX0mJOLzu2Fcs47RYaBbcH4y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0180274',4.9,2235,'en','Unhinged','College students Terry, Nancy, and Gloria, on their way to a rock concert, crash their car in a torrential rainstorm, badly injuring one of them. Rescued from the car, they are provided with recuperation in a house occupied by a man-hating mother and her daughter…but all is not what it seems.','/61msrGNVrE2TbIfI8Xl0I9sk9yX.jpg','1982-10-14',80,'Released','The Nightmare Begins When You Wake Up!','Unhinged',54116,1.7453,4.8,'usZfT8oNe5c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15090,_binary '\0','/qMYvxKZ4ocJbU32bZvFVft7ZjJz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0180396',6.4,2135,'it','Addio zio Tom','Two documentary filmmakers go back in time to the pre-Civil War American South, to film the slave trade.','/nLw410E9rnJw13kufNgOtjiGvGk.jpg','1971-09-23',123,'Released','300 years of hate explode today!','Goodbye Uncle Tom',48691,2.4504,6.6,'BZoE3pn7VQs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15091,_binary '\0','/ffR5kTg4PCdbdE8C8LEwLWqTM2Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0180633',7.8,1764,'sh','Дечко који обећава','A normal boy receives a blow to the head which sets him off to perform rebellious acts.','/bhVnqJQWL8zU8AL40a81P67tIbu.jpg','1981-01-01',106,'Released',NULL,'The Promising Boy',33243,1.0719,6.3,'i1WbOVBO5x0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15092,_binary '\0','/hDTHPStEOUkj5zTXk015E7z3g7D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0180659',7.5,2234,'sh','Druga Žikina dinastija','Unlike in the previous sequel of \"Foolish Years\"/\"Zika\'s Dynasty\" film series, Zika\'s and Milan\'s grandson became crazy for girls, having sex with them simultaneously in his apartment. Granddads are now worried for different reason, so they visit the doctor who gives them an advice to send their grandson to the country in order to use his strength appropriately.','/3atMCWmr2wY7bFKM1RWIaRpmScE.jpg','1986-09-01',89,'Released',NULL,'Second Žika\'s Dynasty',55120,1.1293,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15093,_binary '\0','/wP6P3IxnreLQhrxKaYhB5PtEKD9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0180679',6.3,2199,'en','Escanaba in da Moonlight','On the eve of deer-hunting season in Michigan, a family of hunters contends with the shame of their eldest son never having shot his own buck.','/i7Lnquo1pTcX8p0w3if7xajiQuj.jpg','2001-01-26',91,'Released','A great-american hunting miss-adventure.','Escanaba in da Moonlight',39497,1.5954,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15094,_binary '\0','/oONWvm6kBDVXakj8aELlTohpkUT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0180734',6.4,36545,'en','Hardball','An aimless young man who is scalping tickets, gambling and drinking, agrees to coach a Little League team from the Cabrini Green housing project in Chicago as a condition of getting a loan from a friend.','/9RMcwwnK8a9WCt8dVlwmtNsFCg3.jpg','2001-09-14',106,'Released','The most important thing in life is showing up','Hardball',20857,4.2859,6.5,'63OFSv2LGlU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15095,_binary '\0','/vpzApkn0pIkDD7KwThdtJo013DS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0180735',7.4,1573,'el','Η χαρτοπαίχτρα','About Aleka who is obsessed with playing cards and the efforts of her husband to make her quit this bad \"habit\".','/hHwTtIhzxNCo4e8WdyVwevZzPL7.jpg','1964-12-28',94,'Released',NULL,'The Gambler Lady',297336,1.056,6.722,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15096,_binary '\0','/bZt4CwuaZWadSh9OEcNQCZbPFR1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0180748',7.3,24758,'da','I Kina spiser de hunde','Arvid is an ordinary bank clerk who lives a rather unassuming life with his dear girlfriend. But his life is turned completely upside down when he bravely manages to avert a robbery against the bank where he works.','/v78NxEyzsElWnwSvGWpvf2DCzP9.jpg','1999-09-10',91,'Released',NULL,'In China They Eat Dogs',250,3.8465,7.3,'QKVuCfX1A9c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15097,_binary '\0','/b67LyW9kpRx2Iw1dpfifnfRJRSN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0180749',7.9,2268,'el','Η Δε Γυνή Να Φοβήται Τον Άνδρα','When a man decides to marry the woman he\'s been living with, she stops being the silent patient person she was and claims to be the boss in the house. Her behaviour changes so much after the marriage that the husband gets so irritated as to ask for a divorce even a few hours later..','/oD5Q5ZbshCtw9rgFMUmEhw4LHS.jpg','1965-06-28',105,'Released','An unmarried couple in the strict Greek society of the 60s.','And the Woman Shall Fear Her Husband',163791,1.7752,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15098,_binary '\0','/fBwrL5eNK961FrqACR7ua8Oj5ta.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0180782',7.8,1613,'el','Τα κίτρινα γάντια','When it comes to his wife, Orestis is suspicious of everything, be it a moustachioed chauffeur or a lost pair of bumblebee-yellow gloves. But, are his fears justified or is this case of the lost fashion accessories a big misunderstanding?','/wnpfgfD2jCeT4QtxKbRaqy8B4Sa.jpg','1960-12-12',84,'Released',NULL,'The yellow gloves',296993,1.3675,6.897,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15099,_binary '\0','/35YGZy5QPqwOazBwfbrFa1KvUqA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0180802',7.3,1217,'sh','Ljubavni život Budimira Trajkovića','Trajković family are bridge builders. Being forced to move every once in a while, the bridges are everything but pleasant thing for 17 year old Budimir, who is unable to make any permanent love relationship. In their last attempt to settle down in capital, a boy will experience love in its full meaning.','/gFPXoB9UiqTedQEFFcx5K6Je3uH.jpg','1977-06-03',100,'Released',NULL,'The Love Life of Budimir Trajković',33603,1.6097,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15100,_binary '\0','/185G4RghYjGXdWTA6BUCymD8TeG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0180837',6.3,1924,'en','Bossa Nova','After a chance encounter on the elevator, the lives of Mary Ann, a widowed English teacher, and Pedro, a recently divorced man, intersect against the hot backdrop of Rio de Janeiro.','/zNOEUXsb3LMdBLDafaWYziLCQbO.jpg','2000-02-18',95,'Released','The difference between \"amor\" and \"love\".','Bossa Nova',19600,1.1122,5.5,'70xdfkjxC7Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15101,_binary '\0','/qOi6SN4jsuhNl2WpYhiBkz3bzcw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0180924',7.8,1978,'sh','Poslednji krug u Monci','The story of an outsider who spent seven years in prison for robbery. Eternal rebel, unsatisfied with the system and people around him.','/fWt8MCAVEx0GqYkJI6IB8IalfN.jpg','1989-12-19',102,'Released',NULL,'The Last Lap at Monza',144974,1.0437,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15102,_binary '\0','/PgzH7nFLTrlkUoImYJfbFUoyze.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181012',6,3084,'en','Sole Survivor','After inexplicably surviving a plane crash, TV station worker Denise tries to get on with her life. She soon learns that she was actually supposed to die in the crash. Death refuses to be cheated and starts sending its minions, people that have recently died, to collect her.','/4XU7MrjYrynL6IzFFXRjfLdyIMc.jpg','1984-03-16',85,'Released','It wants her...It\'s waiting...It won\'t be long now.','Sole Survivor',29611,1.74,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15103,_binary '\0','/zjwkjfyAfxp3qVtYdS62Pu2REjq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181034',6,1425,'sh','Sulude godine','After the road accident, Zika and Milan end up in an overcrowded hospital, run by doctor Nedeljkovic and his sexually obsessed nurse. Accompanied by a crazy bandmaster and a peasant with farting problems, they will try to get away from the ongoing chaos.','/6xmRX54xQ8UXyD6EZoLeTymFfA.jpg','1988-10-03',84,'Released',NULL,'Weird Years',55121,0.8385,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15104,_binary '\0','/5YqiXXlxZ20bvqbZImb5tYLzHFn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181049',7.7,2244,'sh','Tesna koža 2','After car crash with some Turk, Pantic gets the idea to build a motel for all Turks who traveling through Yugoslavia. Sojic wants to thwart the plan, and tells the Turk in confidence that Pantic is gay. However, the Turk is also gay.','/5Ha40UAa6yYMrqLWeYXsx831R9N.jpg','1987-11-02',87,'Released',NULL,'Tight Skin 2',55131,1.0536,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15105,_binary '\0','/51xAvIkVgYsQPtN8pgUZhJDwNq5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181050',7.7,2147,'sh','Tesna koža 3','Dimitrije Pantic loses his suitcase with business projects in an overcrowded bus, only to find a similar one - yet full of foreign currencies. This money turns his life upside down, but it also influences other people\'s ambitions.','/jLgHPgMb8zbSObhWARUH33RUl9I.jpg','1988-08-08',95,'Released',NULL,'Tight Skin 3',55132,0.8975,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15106,_binary '\0','/kGD2uMCXLk9lbF3xCFvLLUxn33.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181051',7.5,1906,'sh','Tesna koža 4','On the 35th anniversary of his company, Dimitrije Pantic gets a plaque and watch as a present instead of well-deserved promotion he was hoping for. Meanwhile, his highly corrupt boss Srecko Sojic plans to ruin the company with his business partners and sell it on auction, which would provide him with money. For being a \"troubled element\", Pantic loses his job at the company and finds a new one as a private detective, accidentally discovering Sojic\'s intentions on the first day of work.','/1wY3ecMb9eJB14qkujdDXKkyYEi.jpg','1991-11-28',90,'Released',NULL,'Tight Skin 4',55133,0.717,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15107,_binary '\0','/mxIZsS9Mj6bmX7II1TqbTYYXnqr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181080',7.8,2517,'sr','Три карте за Холивуд','The story of three boys who, fascinated with seventh art magic, decide to escape from their remote village straight to Hollywood. In the same time, a local policeman frantically organizes a reception for the president of the state. His \"strictly controlled\" citizens, under the influence of events in Cuba, in 1962. start dividing in two parties, resolved to succeed where Khruschev and J.F.K. have failed.','/q8Iicvqq1sqeyQU8jlU9rfQ3yRI.jpg','1993-04-09',118,'Released',NULL,'Three Tickets to Hollywood',17913,1.31,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15108,_binary '\0','/kaH2D6SnJQHeOeNwnkjOac6Gt9j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181151',5.7,10163,'en','What Planet Are You From?','A human-looking alien from a highly advanced but emotionless all-male society is sent to Earth to impregnate a woman and bring the child back to their planet. The alien ends up falling in love while a suspicious FAA agent tails him.','/2VtgMZPj3uDLz0zOQqZ74SUZGK4.jpg','2000-03-03',105,'Released','To save his planet, an alien must find a woman on Earth to have his baby. There\'s just one problem.','What Planet Are You From?',10416,3.3232,5.42,'vzK6h_OIyEk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15109,_binary '\0','/y90hRRJoKrZC3ZUfrBfeWvH56ea.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181182',7.6,3214,'sh','Жикина династија','Misa is already a teenager but with little interest in girls and much for his violin. Two granddads, Zika and Milan, are worried for their grandson who may \'deviate\' like Steven from \"Dynasty\", the show they like to watch. That\'s why they decide to introduce him better to their attractive housekeeper.','/CmiigUa34ci3eKURyj9BRoiRkp.jpg','1985-10-31',86,'Released',NULL,'Zika\'s Dynasty',55119,1.1456,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15110,_binary '\0','/ozhQNWIlgCbtJxETvhOXFsDoBvX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181212',6.1,1867,'en','Don Quixote','Adapted from the work of Miguel de Cervantes, this is the story of a hidalgo, fanatic for chivalry novels, who loses his sanity and believing to be a knight named Don Quixote de La Mancha, decides to go on imaginary adventures along with his friend, the simple farmer Sancho Panza, who becomes his squire. On their journeys, they rescue dames in distress in honorable acts and fight giants among other perils, with Don longing to be with the love of his life, lady Dulcinea, and Sancho waiting to be rewarded with an island where he\'s about to become a governor.','/fAAYFnAR7bIX3iaVBWg0OfmcQz0.jpg','2000-04-09',139,'Released','The classic tale of a man\'s dream, his epic journey, and one true love.','Don Quixote',207937,2.2423,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15111,_binary '\0','/bdSZ5SutGPvFPpRKZNcF1au6owe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181288',7.8,21301,'en','American Movie','American Movie documents the story of filmmaker Mark Borchardt, his mission, and his dream. Spanning over two years of intense struggle with his film, his family, financial decline, and spiritual crisis, American Movie is a portrayal of ambition, obsession, excess, and one man\'s quest for the American Dream.','/y8dJgWr1HeW0RRxwANDWvgIXdsF.jpg','1999-11-05',104,'Released',NULL,'American Movie',14242,3.1376,7.5,'zMFZOu8rDUQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15112,_binary '\0','/xDKuTzBVpJPqFc39H4hctrle87T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181316',6.4,93970,'en','Blue Streak','Miles Logan is a jewel thief who just hit the big time by stealing a huge diamond. However, after two years in jail, he comes to find out that he hid the diamond in a police building that was being built at the time of the robbery. In an attempt to regain his diamond, he poses as an LAPD detective.','/jek2osBtFhzU6Hjj7yp1egOtbqO.jpg','1999-09-17',93,'Released','He\'s a cop that\'s not. Believe that!','Blue Streak',11001,11.702,6.533,'zxfFGW00EB0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15113,_binary '\0','/izFiwja7S6IS4t4o7rKzfvzMZ0u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181322',6.1,1519,'en','The Breaks','Derrick, a racially-confused Irishman raised in the hood by a black family is having the worst day ever. Determined to prove to his fed-up mother and would-be girlfriend that he\'s not a screw-up, he sets out to do one thing right (get some milk) and even that proves to be a challenge! Hilarious encounters with racist red-neck cops, local gangsters and \'flamboyant\' pawn shop owners ensue, and along the way Derek shows that he can actually do things for others and maybe even get his own life together.','/teNV6wHnhFQApC7F2HjixWfdffx.jpg','1999-02-26',86,'Released','He\'s a brother who pales by comparison.','The Breaks',15031,1.8007,6.5,'BvnUjMjOqIY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15114,_binary '\0','/uzwPXaierYhjYaYfcXDSF9RrFvm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181328',7.1,1396,'sr','Булевар револуције','A love story between a teenager girl and a small time mob set in Belgrade during the times of great political turmoil.','/agtx6w5N1JUrH4SYj9aJyeksEPL.jpg','1992-06-19',99,'Released',NULL,'Boulevard of the Revolution',110358,0.8434,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15115,_binary '\0','/5ShzEv7Q7lq2Z1x60NUw86TICXV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181365',7.7,1729,'en','The Secret Path','14-year-old Jo Ann Foley lives in squalor in a rural Southern community during World War II. Abused by her bootlegging grandfather Hank, Jo Ann has, like her mother Marie, been forced into a life of prostitution. Periodically escaping her miserable existence, Jo Ann finds comfort, security, and genuine love with a poor but proud African American couple: Honey and Too Tall.','/syrovXmCyrxSgzDgAVqZa4eac4V.jpg','1999-04-02',98,'Released',NULL,'The Secret Path',50804,2.9935,7.5,'Csh8n-WKaQg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15116,_binary '\0','/3oWkSvadQqJ7pdDmOoPhBOyNfev.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181396',6.3,1731,'it','Come te nessuno mai','Teenage problems intertwine during the occupation of a high school in Rome. Silvio—much like his peers desperate to lose his virginity—wants to make his move on the girl he likes, despite her being already his friend\'s girlfriend and not knowing that her best friend harbors feelings for him—while clashing also with his parents, onetime Sixties radicals who look down on the kids\' aimless political commitment.','/zCGBSSTNxGzZtYfUMbjDR27Tcfk.jpg','1999-10-01',88,'Released','In a time of revolution, some things remain eternal','But Forever in My Mind',53915,1.8546,5.9,'qh6NUQuiTa0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15117,_binary '\0','/hBexByVqQYAkgihzsKSVBTtDlwO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181530',7.4,5393,'fr','Est-Ouest','June 1946: Stalin invites Russian emigres to return to the motherland. It\'s a trap: when a ship-load from France arrives in Odessa, only a physician and his family are spared execution or prison. He and his French wife (her passport ripped up) are sent to Kiev. She wants to return to France immediately; he knows that they are captives and must watch every step.','/c1Uf4HC5WEcssVoOm48Bfzn7Wmk.jpg','1999-09-01',121,'Released','An unforgettable story of love, betrayal and survival.','East/West',28463,1.7755,6.4,'nq_SAormBEs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15118,_binary '\0','/eQnIwnhDuHQiSks3dy0zwrJydWU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181536',7.3,95708,'en','Finding Forrester','Gus Van Sant tells the story of a young African American man named Jamal who confronts his talents while living on the streets of the Bronx. He accidentally runs into an old writer named Forrester who discovers his passion for writing. With help from his new mentor Jamal receives a scholarship to a private school.','/chd9bCGNYtzDoJqGw5wUHlhrkOb.jpg','2000-12-21',136,'Released','In an ordinary place, he found the one person to make his life extraordinary.','Finding Forrester',711,7.3232,7.1,'8QGCBH_2Dck','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15119,_binary '\0','/3rMYbEJ6GHI3rQC4QqGSiX7BLJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181547',6.4,1559,'el','Από Την Άκρη Της Πόλης','Minority-group Greeks from an outer suburb of Athens struggle with their life on society\'s fringe and exploitation of one another.','/n6Mpg0OttUe3yIKl6px5Z0d4I1S.jpg','1998-11-20',94,'Released',NULL,'From the Edge of the City',40940,1.3104,5.8,'EKTWf-9RXGU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15120,_binary '\0','/bxSW79AIc4LldSTthxYnC0or6Yn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181592',8,2037,'el','Ο Ηλίας Του 16ου','Ilias dresses himself in a police uniform as part of a complex burglary plot. Unfortunately for him, the impostor officer is called to assist in the investigation of a real crime. The other officers involved in this case treat him as a colleague, and he is forced to play along in hopes that his cover is not blown.','/eFz7K8l9mcTMxArnO41nzYzZGEF.jpg','1959-05-30',84,'Released',NULL,'The Policeman of the 16th Precinct',167487,1.2965,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15121,_binary '\0','/8gLOykatXN9eubmTUz7pK3CGaxR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181600',8.2,1652,'el','Υπάρχει Και Φιλότιμο','Minister Andreas Mavrogialouros (Labros Konstadaras) visits the village of his electoral district, Platanias for the inauguration of a maternity hospital. After an accident, he finds his voters\' dissatisfaction and the scams of his partners. He, therefore, decides to step down from the government and bring order to his life, starting from his wife and his daughter.','/oebFhbWg2bh66n3TPYSiOTuADA4.jpg','1965-12-06',89,'Released',NULL,'A Matter of Earnestness',297342,1.0065,7.095,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15122,_binary '\0','/oAIHUFNsNCVs7Rz9LNTINPFIa4j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181627',7.5,12375,'fr','Kirikou et la Sorcière','Drawn from elements of West African folk tales, it depicts how a newborn boy, Kirikou, saves his village from the evil witch Karaba.','/9RNrozaagFmpm6m0CP7q4XDcIXj.jpg','1998-12-09',71,'Released','Can Kirikou save his village from a terrible curse?','Kirikou and the Sorceress',21348,3.9528,7.4,'-6jw9S5Ym10','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15123,_binary '\0','/PrMb3oeEluauy0q9ZO5xL33A6C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181689',7.6,627259,'en','Minority Report','John Anderton is a top \'Precrime\' cop in the late-21st century, when technology can predict crimes before they\'re committed. But Anderton becomes the quarry when another investigator targets him for a murder charge.','/ccqpHq5tk5W4ymbSbuoy4uYOxFI.jpg','2002-06-20',145,'Released','Everybody runs.','Minority Report',180,16.8244,7.354,'3JNsNp2DVSE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15124,_binary '\0','/b4bOy4QfEN9DfWrH2iTVi2W9eOp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181739',6.3,41874,'en','Osmosis Jones','A white blood cell policeman, with the help of a cold pill, must stop a deadly virus from destroying the human they live in, Frank.','/foZpSG88IQUCEBJE3unc5QzO6bQ.jpg','2001-08-10',95,'Released','Every body needs a hero.','Osmosis Jones',12610,6.8445,6.5,'iI6nzmvDBfE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15125,_binary '','/3AcGPicOAZPvpZRt6IkfOWCTVwz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181810',5.6,1441,'en','Sex: The Annabel Chong Story','The documentary follows Annabel Chong, former record holder for the world\'s largest gang bang, which she set in 1995 by having sex with 70 men. It focuses on her reasons for working in porn, and her relationship with friends and family.','/plopvhJyYFkWZOTh9I0Mfa7Kcp8.jpg','1999-02-11',86,'Released',NULL,'Sex: The Annabel Chong Story',51182,3.1375,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15126,_binary '\0','/du8vCvkBBLDJtN8qdU5npmvMxP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181830',6.8,1581,'cy','Solomon and Gaenor','A young Jew in 1911 Wales tries to make his living by selling fabrics door to door, but to do so he must hide his nationality. On one of his sales he meets and falls in love with a demure young woman with a strong-willed father and a Jew-hating brother. The two fall in love and she becomes pregnant, but only then does she learn of his ethnic background. When anti-Jewish riots break out, the two are forced to flee and become separated.','/r6gpjGinYKoJxZyMqXiOGRmDxLZ.jpg','1999-04-30',105,'Released','Their tragedy was to fall in love.','Solomon & Gaenor',81517,1.4505,5.9,'czDjR-UERIw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15127,_binary '\0','/ifXKFWQWKO7B3Mz3L0Qn3kEVcF2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181836',5.7,2684,'en','The Specials','America\'s seventh best superhero team, the Specials, are a group of geeks and oddballs. Lifelong fan Nightbird joins the group just in time for the group to get a new line of action figures. But the members\' extreme personalities and personal issues threaten to rip the group apart.','/kCoifvSC6tUa7Ia4YClf4npqjQp.jpg','2000-09-22',82,'Released','They\'re not incredible, they\'re just special.','The Specials',29015,2.0627,5.3,'1wMvv924Gks','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15128,_binary '\0','/1U1nFKWz59eZW7WbIQwXsrJd15c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181845',7.1,1510,'sh','Свето место','Strange love story between Toma, a reluctant theology student and Katarina, the beautiful daughter of a powerful feudal lord. After Katarina\'s mysterious death, Toma is, according to her wishes, forced to read the prayers over her body for three nights in a row.','/odBzLki7cSNldRRhEY8K2fnCyp5.jpg','1990-09-29',90,'Released',NULL,'A Holy Place',144825,0.9836,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15129,_binary '\0','/voVkSwgFYv9GOpRNfUAwj6qYRTL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181852',6.3,440629,'en','Terminator 3: Rise of the Machines','It\'s been 10 years since John Connor saved Earth from Judgment Day, and he\'s now living under the radar, steering clear of using anything Skynet can trace. That is, until he encounters T-X, a robotic assassin ordered to finish what T-1000 started. Good thing Connor\'s former nemesis, the Terminator, is back to aid the now-adult Connor … just like he promised.','/vvevzdYIrk2636maNW4qeWmlPFG.jpg','2003-07-02',109,'Released','The machines will rise.','Terminator 3: Rise of the Machines',296,18.4098,6.206,'ysQizA7Una8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15130,_binary '\0','/nkMgY1XFLWr91najzfvwie8LyYF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181865',7.5,232071,'en','Traffic','An exploration of the United States of America\'s war on drugs from multiple perspectives. For the new head of the Office of National Drug Control Policy, the war becomes personal when he discovers his well-educated daughter is abusing cocaine within their comfortable suburban home. In Mexico, a flawed, but noble policeman agrees to testify against a powerful general in league with a cartel, and in San Diego, a drug kingpin\'s sheltered trophy wife must learn her husband\'s ruthless business after he is arrested, endangering her luxurious lifestyle.','/jbccmnqE4oAPI67bApgt2JiRPz8.jpg','2000-12-27',147,'Released','No one gets away clean','Traffic',1900,12.2348,7.088,'sZnOWu68Vw4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15131,_binary '\0','/AqLtFRKVX2G0ghMnMnQoSGan4pY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181875',7.9,317697,'en','Almost Famous','In 1973, a precocious 15-year-old aspiring rock journalist lands a dream assignment from Rolling Stone to tour with a rising rock band, embarking on a coming-of-age journey as he discovers the exhilarating and heartbreaking realities behind rock stardom.','/3rrkyLYbgLj84AYvjhdcJot4JPx.jpg','2000-09-15',124,'Released','Experience it. Enjoy it. Just don\'t fall for it.','Almost Famous',786,13.9906,7.503,'4U07rtBNa2g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15132,_binary '\0','/e8qnYlw9PB1GYQa8zxetPejwZJH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181912',6.3,3190,'fr','Éloge de l\'amour','Someone we hear talking - but whom we do not see - speaks of a project which describes the four key moments of love: meeting, physical passion, arguments/separation and making up. This project is to be told through three couples: young, adult and old. We do not know if the project is for a play, a film, a novel or an opera. The author of the project is always accompanied by a kind of servant. Meanwhile, two years earlier, an American civil servant meets with an elderly French couple who had fought in the Resistance during World War II, brokering a deal with a Hollywood director to buy the rights to tell their story. The members of the old couple\'s family discuss heatedly questions of nation, memory and history.','/iOeAn1yxiBypmOVHBFimjnIeqx.jpg','2001-05-16',99,'Released',NULL,'In Praise of Love',52717,2.0071,6.5,'nqUORQ_VlsA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15133,_binary '\0','/riig6n6nLefJpB1g50IPimILNw2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181960',7.6,4845,'ja','雨あがる','A group of travelers is stranded in a small country inn when the river floods during heavy rains. As the bad weather continues, tensions rise amongst the trapped travelers.','/5m7uLaFRcW6c4hqNC4bryNnfQGC.jpg','2000-01-22',91,'Released',NULL,'After the Rain',15319,3.5871,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15134,_binary '\0','/A96CVXbTNfhqw3jkUlyfFnGe8i3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0181984',7,60883,'en','Boiler Room','A college dropout gets a job as a broker for a suburban investment firm and is on the fast track to success—but the job might not be as legitimate as it sounds.','/jFB5uvCZ3HXF00liAEAuOruCPs6.jpg','2000-02-18',119,'Released','Welcome to the new American dream.','Boiler Room',14181,7.1574,6.709,'kgCLG4gCAvI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15135,_binary '\0','/hEbXPZSxbcMZtUxoArrnc96vgHL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0182000',5.8,7079,'en','The Caveman\'s Valentine','Romulus, a misunderstood musician turned recluse hiding from personal demons in a New York City cave, finds the frozen body of a young drifter in a tree. The authorities, including his police officer daughter, claim the death is accidental. Romulus is convinced the man was murdered by a prominent art photographer but how can he prove he\'s right when everyone thinks he\'s insane?','/xWjoiGvFZPXuBi93reGblvDHIax.jpg','2001-01-19',105,'Released','Romulus Ledbetter lives on the edge. The view is incredible.','The Caveman\'s Valentine',25208,4.773,5.9,'gRBWQYmsUFE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15136,_binary '\0','/vys9PaP6EtjAXEKwGtpVXmeklps.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0182060',4.3,8459,'tr','Dünyayı Kurtaran Adam','Two space cadets crash-land on a desert planet, where an evil wizard seeks the ultimate power to take over the world. Although the movie borrows some background footage from Star Wars, the plot is mostly unrelated.','/osC4REvPVBBGca3sleO7pANbSVC.jpg','1982-11-04',97,'Released',NULL,'The Man Who Saved the World',20787,2.0278,4.8,'1Wlj9eXf3CU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15137,_binary '\0','/gvx2ZigcKqwqSkCDrBjQ1ehLDPh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0182251',5.9,3410,'hi','जब प्यार किसीसे होता है','Sooraj Dhanrajgir, a playboy, falls in love with Komal, who rejects him because of his vices and gives him time to change. Things go awry when a little boy shows up claiming to be his son.','/5Rje4CxHvs7yDXuRrlWttDXUmmy.jpg','1998-05-22',164,'Released',NULL,'Jab Pyaar Kisise Hota Hai',161236,1.4241,5.565,'rX-N8SYRmmQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15138,_binary '\0','/abMkYf4kcuIb8q6lD2GhkwfKQ4F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0182295',5.9,5124,'en','Love\'s Labour\'s Lost','A scholarly king and his three companions swear off the society of women for three years, only to have a diplomatic visit from a French princess and her three ladies-in-waiting thwart their intentions.','/7rJr9b0Mc8wEAqzuDUkz0zg1BX7.jpg','2000-03-31',93,'Released','A new spin on the old song and dance.','Love\'s Labour\'s Lost',51333,3.4231,5.6,'iOXzJL1roS8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15139,_binary '\0','/8s2zX5oOC9XaAlSGwKezKSjCS6Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0182503',7.2,3902,'tr','Turist Ömer Uzay Yolunda','The spaceship Enterprise under the command of Captain Kirk has embarked on a new mission. They need to receive the reports from Professor Krater, who lives alone with his wife on the planet Orin 7. Mister Spak lands on the planet with a team. However, one of the crew dies unexpectedly. The doctor had difficulty determining the cause of death. The killer is the professor\'s wife Nancy. The professor decides to lure a creature from ancient times to the planet with a time machine to save him. Omar, a tourist, is about to be married to a woman he didn\'t know at the time. During the wedding ceremony, the machine pulls Omar to Orin 7. The tourist thinks that Omar survived. But the adventure is just beginning.','/c7ZmfoxZRbtnoAUFEzIpSbPadUq.jpg','1973-01-01',72,'Released','The Enterprise picks up a Turkish hobo.','Omer the Tourist in Star Trek',161334,1.0896,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15140,_binary '\0','/5vtH95kPCpZ2bkSWRrdGvfE7HqE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0182508',6.8,3263,'en','Urbania','A series of urban legends take place around the life of a troubled man who is searching New York City for a mysterious stranger.','/bl2RsU7kzOm1AjZhCBepCxuFToY.jpg','2000-01-24',103,'Released','Heard any good stories lately?','Urbania',77332,1.3363,5.5,'HBK20gyd7LM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15141,_binary '\0','/lzjoIf4aQRAtGXxC91VKqNIvL6G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0182730',5.6,1423,'el','Η Αρχόντισσα κι ο Αλήτης','Rena’s father insists on marrying her off to the son of a shipowner. Rena, however, doesn’t even want to hear about it, so she runs away and disguises herself as a boy named Pipis. As such, she meets a poor fisherman, Lefteris, and helps him on his way to Ioannina.','/jGDkBD2ucutmUnubpdA7Uvdg7Oi.jpg','1968-12-30',109,'Released',NULL,'The Lady and the Tramp',301494,0.9607,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15142,_binary '\0','/anc2mt3RyN1S87HH0VtJX7D1xub.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0182764',6,1843,'tr','Battal Gazi\'nin Oğlu','When Battal Gazi is killed by Byzantine Prince, his son swears to take revenge.','/9eWUocLjpKj73Bx0MRPGdLJRL2n.jpg','1974-10-01',70,'Released',NULL,'Battal Gazi\'nin Oğlu',184980,1.2416,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15143,_binary '\0','/zxbKlIys9LoGU8IJkbFD5NO6pSr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0182765',6.4,2012,'tr','Battal Gazi Destanı','Depiction of the life of the legendary Muslim Serdar of Malatya, Battal Gazi.','/bIjBh43oMC00ePT3SCN02sfxIKE.jpg','1971-12-01',97,'Released',NULL,'The Legend of Battal Gazi',405821,0.8594,6.3,'vSRyYGyS5_Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15144,_binary '\0','/aIVL5crQCBMPxKMoExiIsUDFPeR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0182789',6.9,135903,'en','Bicentennial Man','Richard Martin buys a gift, a new NDR-114 robot. The product is named Andrew by the youngest of the family\'s children. \"Bicentennial Man\" follows the life and times of Andrew, a robot purchased as a household appliance programmed to perform menial tasks. As Andrew begins to experience emotions and creative thought, the Martin family soon discovers they don\'t have an ordinary robot.','/wrs23eO0VEWwOQpXoOasMnlW9Y4.jpg','1999-12-17',131,'Released','One robot\'s 200 year journey to become an ordinary man.','Bicentennial Man',2277,11.4365,7.272,'CbG3JoXU7yc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15145,_binary '\0','/3hLdOCJ9be3pSHrk5s8LTQjTeyC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0182916',6.8,4424,'tr','Gol Kralı','Sait, who is in love with Sevim, a football enthusiast, starts playing football to catch her attention. When Sevim mocks him, Sait gets angry and decides to become a football player.','/4Ah7LGD1tGmAD14eWQ4Zatb1VfE.jpg','1980-11-01',81,'Released',NULL,'The Top Scorer',436063,0.8427,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15146,_binary '\0','/dDpPBrdZNuMVmjnTDJntQUsKRCi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0182996',3.7,4025,'en','Don\'t Go in the Woods','Four friends take a weekend camping trip in the mountains of Utah, where a homicidal woodsman begins murdering tourists.','/9klmBM1TypVd0DrJ4D7kh5vl3lD.jpg','1981-09-05',82,'Released','Everyone has nightmares about the ugliest way to die.','Don\'t Go in the Woods',44936,1.5147,4.1,'7cPsewoSRA8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15147,_binary '\0','/rYQkXduVSBubBgMQS20OoPGdFfs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0183056',6.7,1255,'en','Esther Kahn','A Jewish girl in 19th century London dreams of becoming a stage actress.','/ikotkI3DKEnDENBS1ZxSLEPwVdF.jpg','2000-10-04',142,'Released','The stage is her world.','Esther Kahn',61578,1.5648,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15148,_binary '\0','/7WNcaaN3zDR5whliqWxCGuP468Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0183288',6.3,1845,'en','Halloween Is Grinch Night','When the sour-sweet wind starts blowing again, the Whos retreat to their homes because they know the Grinch will soon be a\'prowlin. Young Eukariah Who has to make a trip to the Euphemism (outhouse), when the wind blows him away to a confrontation with the gruesome Grinch. Eukariah decides that the Grinch must be stopped, so he faces his fears and confronts the Grinch and his spooks.','/8NMJWTNIChzRHWftVprjAc5RCl2.jpg','1977-10-29',26,'Released','Grinches Are Scary, Or So Everyone Hears, But One Little Boy Overcomes His Worst Fears!','Halloween Is Grinch Night',52207,2.3089,6,'S4N27DYOpzE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15149,_binary '\0','/vnQhzxHqAeZK5mkevV0yl9QYxiZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0183306',7.7,3377,'ur','Jinnah','Biography of Mohammed Ali Jinnah, the founder of modern Pakistan is told through flashbacks as his soul tries to find eternal rest. The flashbacks start in 1947 as Jinnah pleads for a separate nation for the Muslim minority, infuriating Lord Mountbatten. Mountbatten then tries to enlist Gandhi & Nehru to persuade Jinnah to stop his efforts. Gandhi sides with Jinnah, which upsets Nehru. However, Jinnah turns down the offer to become prime minister and the film takes another slide back to 1916, which reveals all of the political implications that have occurred.','/6gNDyfZhQEOkeVWbsfTMOuvXx8V.jpg','1998-11-07',110,'Released','He fought for justice, and made Pakistan.','Jinnah',41614,1.6955,6.9,'YoDjscRb5WM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15150,_binary '\0','/vQgYYUZlrUlaeABYEj78Wvbt1qq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0183338',6.1,1503,'tr','Kara Murat: Fatih\'in Fermanı','Sultan Khan of Ottoman Empire has fallen in love with Princess Iren of Byzantium. When he asks her father Niktol for her hand he refuses and tries to kill Khan. The Sultan\'s armies then attack and overtake Constantinople (now renamed Istanbul). Niktol kills Princess Iren and flees with his army to the island of Lesbos. From Lesbos, Niktol launches a series of ruthless attacks on Turkish villages resulting in the death of one of the Sultan\'s guard\'s mother. The guard, Murat, is sent by the Sultan on a mission to avenge his mother\'s death and bring back the head of the man who killed Iren. Murat goes undercover in Lesbos posing as Royal Guard Kostas, seeking the killers.','/wHz8eOdqbs8yzkjJiuAYF5Bpw8h.jpg','1973-11-01',75,'Released',NULL,'Karamurat: The Sultan\'s Warrior',425847,1.0908,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15151,_binary '\0','/p9FR2wJydmeC1Dk6wVVmj0p9ZB6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0183368',7,1229,'tr','Köroğlu','The epic tells about the life and heroic deeds of Koroghlu (literally \"son of the blind man\") as a hero of the people who struggled against unjust rulers, defending his clan or tribe.','/9vUF28u9S5sr9dscJuOuGCAQSAQ.jpg','1968-01-01',90,'Released',NULL,'Köroğlu',272600,1.785,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15152,_binary '\0','/o4efOzU1yrCTQ1F9KTl3Q1c7m4j.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0183459',7.5,1867,'tr','Maden','When work accidents in a coal mine start to result in death, İlyas warns his colleagues working in the mine. It starts to collect signatures for the necessary measures to be taken, but the necessary solidarity among the workers cannot be established. A tent theater that comes to the region further complicates things.','/9SYeLxsAZHfo5sMM8ksIjCbQL6h.jpg','1978-11-26',90,'Released',NULL,'The Mine',449662,1.532,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15153,_binary '\0','/ewhGRo6tnAM2ymIHEQLr6fCDztS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0183503',6.6,2714,'en','Me Myself I','Pamela Drury is unhappy, and alone. On her birthday she stumbles across a photo of Robert Dickson, and wonders what would\'ve happened had she said yes to his proposal. A freak accident causes Pamela to live out the life she could\'ve had, but is the grass on the other side always greener?','/sI8AjPZMeRKn5mQ7LD4uYTStTMc.jpg','1999-10-06',104,'Released','I deserve the best and I accept the best.','Me Myself I',49721,1.4713,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15154,_binary '\0','/8qLen3NLCVSu1I9aqGWbTUIoBLQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0183505',6.6,265862,'en','Me, Myself & Irene','Rhode Island State Trooper Charlie Baileygates has a multiple personality disorder. One personality is crazy and aggressive, while the other is more friendly and laid back. Both of these personalities fall in love with the same woman named Irene after Charlie loses his medication.','/rvRrcbLbpn7UJGRH1JupgHOeJFq.jpg','2000-06-22',117,'Released','From gentle to mental.','Me, Myself & Irene',2123,16.1247,6.631,'UBPHrX4x3Ns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15155,_binary '\0','/qurwfjYAzSgSsQl99IY6ttZ0S7P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0183523',5.7,80196,'en','Mission to Mars','When the first manned mission to Mars meets with a catastrophic and mysterious disaster after reporting an unidentified structure, a rescue mission is launched to investigate the tragedy and bring back any survivors.','/cTKWoBpN5Gvi0vpMb9mLtYlwXqT.jpg','2000-03-10',114,'Released','For centuries we\'ve been looking for the origin of life on earth. We\'ve been looking on the wrong planet.','Mission to Mars',2067,7.2958,6,'njIN5HU4UMQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15156,_binary '\0','/kOrpnX2KSMDRb4dUXNW4s0HvbLy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0183570',6.1,1531,'el','Η Νεράιδα και το Παληκάρι','Fourtounakis’ daughter, Katerinio, is forced to get engaged with a brutal Cretan, Skandalakis. But the return of Manousos Vrontakis from Athens and his flirtation with the girl leads to a great romance, without them knowing that they belong to families who are longstanding enemies.','/Mkc0RXMMTZxtWMvMMy8BayCW5m.jpg','1969-12-22',102,'Released',NULL,'I Neraida Kai to Palikari',234961,1.1584,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15157,_binary '\0','/iYOEONglnxIsykyOGfzyc01fyg4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0183649',7.1,304044,'en','Phone Booth','A slick New York publicist who picks up a ringing receiver in a phone booth is told that if he hangs up, he\'ll be killed... and the little red light from a laser rifle sight is proof that the caller isn\'t kidding.','/r6lIwPKVDa6Q76qH2TbIBqPhXL3.jpg','2003-01-06',81,'Released','No options. No lies. No fear. No deals. Just keep talking.','Phone Booth',1817,9.6305,6.879,'PEDTSk69HcA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15158,_binary '\0','/diLUnClHswIfhpJSjpblvSjWL9U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0183659',7,31163,'en','Pollock','In August of 1949, Life Magazine ran a banner headline that begged the question: \"Jackson Pollock: Is he the greatest living painter in the United States?\" The film is a look back into the life of an extraordinary man, a man who has fittingly been called \"an artist dedicated to concealment, a celebrity who nobody knew.\" As he struggled with self-doubt, engaging in a lonely tug-of-war between needing to express himself and wanting to shut the world out, Pollock began a downward spiral.','/azsBSw2zw2uNHiCjTnbe9TJVEDB.jpg','2000-09-06',132,'Released','A true portrait of life and art.','Pollock',12509,2.4832,6.7,'-EvqaHos7Oo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15159,_binary '\0','/gkT737kgnmI6jZyXbUBJRwVbGkW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0183790',7,222864,'en','A Knight\'s Tale','William Thatcher, a knight\'s peasant apprentice, gets a chance at glory when the knight dies suddenly mid-tournament. Posing as a knight himself, William won\'t stop until he\'s crowned tournament champion—assuming matters of the heart don\'t get in the way.','/srb1XnrlDZHcdpjBKqUu4qAzxKU.jpg','2001-05-11',133,'Released','He will rock you.','A Knight\'s Tale',9476,15.5495,6.9,'PVKVgkm-nkA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15160,_binary '\0','/xSnKDHTk79wu2UJqI0RDm4tiBvj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0183869',6.5,62457,'fr','Taxi 2','A cabdriver and a cop race to Paris to rescue a love interest and the Japanese minister of defense from kidnappers.','/z0js1eYtKxfw4RBxiTukO7q66Rf.jpg','2000-03-25',82,'Released','France\'s answer to the Italian job','Taxi 2',2332,6.3004,6.279,'XvGjrOLjG-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15161,_binary '\0','/5JLlQgplhNuYzOcGBpFeTtvoOnZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0183992',6.2,3452,'sv','Vuxna människor','Frank leads a respectable yuppie life working at a noted Stockholm law firm. He has also been married for eight years to his beautiful wife Nenne, who runs an upscale boutique. Yet Frank is deeply bored with his life and is supremely randy. He even fantasizes about the marriage counselor that he and Nenne visit weekly. Eventually, Frank shacks up with a young fetching art student named Sofia, though the experience wracks Frank with guilt. Meanwhile, Nenne\'s friend and co-worker Rosie suspects that Frank is having an affair, though she does not have the nerve to tell her. Little does Rosie suspect, however, that her friend is sleeping with her lover Georg, an uptight journalist with an ego the size of Finland. Soon wires get crossed, and all hell breaks loose.','/ltVU6kHBLWvDdgJ6iEJuNQw1AXg.jpg','1999-09-24',91,'Released',NULL,'Adult Behaviour… It\'s All in the Mind',13619,0.898,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15162,_binary '\0','/y175UUyKcEe1zLE2xC4qkfTDxNV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0184005',5.4,3059,'de','Werner - Volles Rooäää!!!','A wicked investor wants Werner\'s residential area razed to the ground in order to build a shopping center. However, building tycoon Günzelsen has not reckoned with Werner. Together with his master Röhrich he\'s planning to blow away the plumbings with a gigantic obstruction...','/7JcuWbkqCfKuG3D7Ja6u5snEyqe.jpg','1999-09-16',77,'Released',NULL,'Werner - Volles Rooäää!!!',9496,1.5846,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15163,_binary '\0','/xJXoFAwKgsxXYXr9Psb2qUw0JLO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0184316',8,1449,'cs','Byl jednou jeden král...','A selfish self-centered widowed ruler, barely tolerated by his subjects and called appropriately enough, \'King Myself, First\' asks his three daughters to name the measure of their love for him. When one of them says, \"more than salt\", he banishes her from the kingdom. Not understanding what she meant the King assumes love can only be measured by precious metals or one\'s own talent, the \'correct\' answers from his other two daughters. The arrogance of the King leads him to gather all the salt in the kingdom and destroy it. Of course, this backfires as he slowly learns the universal value of the substance, and of course, the essence of his daughter\'s reply. With the help of the wise and magical old \'herb woman\', the King also learns what it means to be a true and wise ruler.','/zFwdYowSp357ta9PhDXQ2tcPiMa.jpg','1955-02-11',107,'Released',NULL,'Once Upon a Time, There Was a King...',49587,1.5619,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15164,_binary '\0','/7Ul9qKUBpRww25lHdcP1Y9qJ7CF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0184503',7.1,3738,'ja','ガメラ3 邪神＜イリス＞覚醒','With the Gyaos re-emerging, Gamera\'s ties to humanity have been severed with his bond to Asagi broken. Nagamine and Asagi investigate while an orphaned girl named Ayana discovers a new creature she names Iris. Nagamine and Asagi must reach Ayana before she takes her revenge on Gamera, who she blames for the death of her family.','/yeUzjv04YdWS3Er5m1gPJJS1D10.jpg','1999-03-06',108,'Released','I\'ll never forgive Gamera.','Gamera 3: Revenge of Iris',60159,3.0462,7.4,'s5McI41Mon4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15165,_binary '\0','/3OAB1xYywss9szLG34YzHkC00Wk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0184526',6,13431,'cn','玻璃樽','When Ah Bu, a girl from a small fishing town in Taiwan, finds a glass bottle with a romantic message, she travels to Hong Kong to find her prince charming. As it turns out, her prince charming, Albert, happens to be gay. But all is not lost when Ah Bu meets the dashing Chi Wu. Meanwhile, Ah Bu\'s boyfriend from Taiwan comes looking for her, as the action and romance follow Ah Bu back to Taiwan.','/oZzsnCPFfGg9uoRLRwQLZxju4d.jpg','1999-02-12',121,'Released','She wanted adventure. In Hong Kong she found her match.','Gorgeous',10951,6.9664,6.5,'IZk9jCGbn_I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15166,_binary '\0','/3BRh96rnlW8LTq7PvbL5pHx6jvP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0184543',7.4,1333,'tr','Gurbet Kuşları','Tahir Agha sells all his assets when his business in Maraş deteriorates. He immigrates to Istanbul with his wife Hatice, sons Selim, Murat, Kemal and daughter Fatoş, where he sets his mind to open a repair shop. But in the metropolis, things don\'t go as planned.','/zxcZeK6n9WFsJd43cvOBizKaQyQ.jpg','1964-04-12',103,'Released',NULL,'Birds of Exile',271790,0.8156,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15167,_binary '\0','/87pDymBz5E5FzgNxD8EPx9jqaQv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0184756',8.4,13015,'tr','Muhsin Bey','An ingenuous countryman Ali Nazik migrates to Istanbul and meets producer Mr. Muhsin to have his first album.','/zfeEW8nxszmmiiZbPv7ZrPJXlJI.jpg','1987-05-01',119,'Released',NULL,'Mr. Muhsin',31415,0.8482,7.957,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15168,_binary '\0','/kPOizQXpSS5uK0M4BcUHzK93nmg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0184791',6.1,21473,'en','O','Even though he\'s the only black student at the elite Palmetto Grove Academy, star basketball player Odin James has the adoration of all, including the team\'s coach and the Dean\'s beautiful daughter Desi. Odin\'s troubled friend Hugo, the coach\'s son, deeply resentful of his father\'s preference of Odin on and off the court, plots a diabolical scheme to sow the seed of mistrust between O and Desi, setting in motion a disturbing chain of events which erupts into a firestorm of breathtaking intensity.','/6zcnbgNm4Es96sfsgoUavqbAed9.jpg','2001-08-31',95,'Released','Trust. Seduction. Betrayal.','O',11065,3.0652,5.9,'sxp0Z5W0Vxw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15169,_binary '\0','/n5pEhP9GUZywJ0Q1c8QVR6ryb7H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0184858',5.8,45029,'en','Reindeer Games','After assuming his dead cellmate\'s identity to get with his girlfriend, an ex-con finds himself the reluctant participant in a casino heist.','/8y1PedfYWllJVoBbkt9KWLY155v.jpg','2000-02-25',104,'Released','The trap is set. The game is on.','Reindeer Games',2155,6.9549,5.699,'0856Uv4QmtI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15170,_binary '\0','/fEM3Zym1MKPZ0sW31l3iBdBj4fc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0184872',7.3,3091,'ja','るろうに剣心 -明治剣客浪漫譚- 維新志士への鎮魂歌','The war against the Tokugawa Shogunate ended years ago. But there are some who are not happy with the outcome. Shigure Takimi watched his friends and family get slashed down in the name of freedom and prosperity. Now he and a band of desparate rebels have sworn to settle one final score. Only one man stands in their way: Rurouni Kenshin. Will the former assassin take up his sword to fight again? When Shigure discovers Kenshin\'s true identity and his fight becomes a personal vendetta, the young hero will have no choice.','/8wk4qIT0KtwHll3Vlg6tlzJFLeG.jpg','1997-12-20',91,'Released','For a Decade, he\'s tried to bury his past...Now his past returns to bury him!','Samurai X: The Motion Picture',39977,3.4992,7.257,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15171,_binary '\0','/xuwPmDMHslcx71T7zHc9YqF2Ny3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0184894',6.6,143331,'en','Shanghai Noon','Chon Wang, a clumsy imperial guard, trails Princess Pei Pei when she\'s kidnapped from the Forbidden City and transported to America. Wang follows her captors to Nevada, where he teams up with an unlikely partner, outcast outlaw Roy O\'Bannon, and tries to spring the princess from her imprisonment.','/b0WwWRcDiDahkah5vZ0KjB4N9ZZ.jpg','2000-05-26',110,'Released','The old west meets the far east.','Shanghai Noon',8584,11.1196,6.4,'FqHg5fc_0_U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15172,_binary '\0','/mnHPVOgNfzyfsXFClVi1NCeQvCy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0184907',5.2,14799,'en','Snow Day','When an entire town in upstate New York is closed down by an unexpected snowfall, a \"snow day\" begins when a group of elementary school kids, led by Natalie Brandston, try to ensure that the schools stay closed by stopping a mechanical snowplow driver by trying to hijack his plow truck. Meanwhile, Natalie\'s big brother Hal is using this day to try to win the affections of Claire Bonner, the most popular girl in his high school, while Hal and Natalie\'s father Tom, a TV meteorologist, faces off against a rival meteorologist for weather coverage of the day\'s events.','/myTnHKy178rrd1oUG3GkEvc641G.jpg','2000-02-11',89,'Released','Roads closed. Schools shut. Rules were made to be frozen!','Snow Day',15489,3.7051,5.1,'qgJgWJmF3jY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15173,_binary '\0','/c7IHHGG7eUiGZYkcFvudmt5mX8G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0184950',7.9,1282,'el','Θου-Βου Φαλακρός Πράκτωρ, Επιχείρησις: Γης Μαδιάμ','Thou-Vou and his new partner, MAP31, accept three imaginary tasks from a cunning director who is only interested in filming the unsuspecting duo for his upcoming movie feature. Will the agents manage to squeeze success out of failure?','/q0Q0nzrD9ioTSogwfS01KMcWzXw.jpg','1969-04-11',92,'Released',NULL,'Thou-Vou Bald Agent, Operation: Havoc',185111,1.2249,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15174,_binary '\0','/f6axPiSzkPa2ErTtTxBUGfCLFPd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0185014',7.2,69417,'en','Wonder Boys','Grady is a 50-ish English professor who hasn\'t had a thing published in years—not since he wrote his award winning \'Great American Novel\' 7 years ago. This weekend proves even worse than he could imagine as he finds himself reeling from one misadventure to another in the company of a new wonder boy author.','/5yvQe06HPNII2eZCJWTeMwqLWvR.jpg','2000-02-22',107,'Released','Undependable. Unpredictable. Unforgettable.','Wonder Boys',11004,4.8753,6.8,'VZd2zeiFYl8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15175,_binary '\0','/nJdJqNZib638SRA7a1iFEwpvuXJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0185101',6.2,1828,'en','Pups','When troubled teen boy Stevie (Cameron Van Hoy) and his girlfriend, Rocky (Mischa Barton), attempt to rob a bank without any forethought, the situation rapidly deteriorates. Soon the young couple is holding bank customers and employees hostage, while law enforcement gathers outside. Daniel Bender (Burt Reynolds), a veteran negotiator for the FBI, is charged with assessing the crime scene and ending the standoff as quickly as possible, but Stevie\'s short fuse considerably complicates matters.','/wJFRrXEQmkZGcIzkvAsKrywAoht.jpg','1999-04-18',99,'Released','What happens when a kid finds a gun or a gun finds a kid?','Pups',54003,1.261,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15176,_binary '\0','/tilClWjFZeUTGJu0pxgF72fvUmN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0185125',7.8,110683,'es','Todo sobre mi madre','Following the tragic death of her teenage son, Manuela travels from Madrid to Barcelona in an attempt to contact the long-estranged father the boy never knew. She reunites with an old friend, an outspoken transgender sex worker, and befriends a troubled actress and a pregnant, HIV-positive nun.','/hjQhzhkGYXPNM96k0mOgob6HMmn.jpg','1999-04-16',101,'Released','Part of every woman is a mother/actress/saint/sinner. And part of every man is a woman.','All About My Mother',99,8.4323,7.6,'0Ki8qXRBIFI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15177,_binary '\0','/sKTTPiNq6tgBpecmoHAvmqG4I4K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0185183',2.5,85205,'en','Battlefield Earth','In the year 3000, man is no match for the Psychlos, a greedy, manipulative race of aliens on a quest for ultimate profit. Led by the powerful Terl, the Psychlos are stripping Earth clean of its natural resources, using the broken remnants of humanity as slaves. What is left of the human race has descended into a near primitive state. After being captured, it is up to Tyler to save mankind.','/wXCRuBHdJ5aTFQdsuGJFXNdo79T.jpg','2000-05-12',117,'Released','Take back the planet.','Battlefield Earth',5491,5.8514,3.342,'7VbfuehRjpw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15178,_binary '\0','/vQEUaUR67RJMZH0gw07upwaMLwN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0185284',5,2793,'en','Do Not Disturb','Combining a family vacation with business, Walter Richmond takes his wife and their 10-year-old, mute daughter, Melissa , to the Netherlands -- where Melissa inadvertently witnesses a murder. Unable to tell anyone what she\'s seen, the frightened girl vanishes in an attempt to elude the killers. Meanwhile, her parents try desperately to piece together the puzzle leading to Melissa\'s disappearance.','/q6awQsOv4H3ARmABir08Hmkk9iI.jpg','1999-11-04',94,'Released','When you can\'t scream you can only run...','Do Not Disturb',15719,2.1636,4.976,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15179,_binary '\0','/lLWwbnLWm7MBvhDFUDuyzd42mB3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0185335',6.7,1474,'hi','Ghulam-E-Musthafa','The film revolves around a gangster named Mustafa (Patekar) who is a contract killer and can go any limit to please his superiors and offers 5 times Namaz. He was adopted by a powerful don Shanta Prasad (Rawal) when he was a child. He calls Shanta as Abba (an Urdu term for father). Abba taught him the crime tactics and made Mustafa his weapon for his illicit crimes. Mustafa\'s only aide is Sudama, his childhood best friend. Abba shares enmity with the Verma brothers Mahesh, Rohan and Bipin (Pradhan, Joshi and Bahl) which the trio wants to kill Abba. Meanwhile, a dancer Kavita (Tandon) who works in Verma\'s dance club.','/hXKl08qjZc8KHP72vGppgvMgQ3n.jpg','1997-01-01',162,'Released',NULL,'Ghulam-E-Musthafa',111978,1.1529,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15180,_binary '\0','/gxZ478weUdq3tiDG348lqlpSE5F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0185371',5.6,64486,'en','House on Haunted Hill','An amusement park mogul offers a random group of diverse people $1 million to spend the night in a decrepit former mental institution.','/weiGTsZqBglKxkIn5xj1nEjxn81.jpg','1999-10-29',93,'Released','Evil loves to party.','House on Haunted Hill',11377,6.1318,5.627,'nfhy9nWG6Gw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15181,_binary '\0','/fYKfPWArkWeMcril9JxhVRP9bYk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0185431',5.3,120545,'en','Little Nicky','After the lord of darkness decides he will not cede his throne to any of his three sons, the two most powerful of them escape to Earth to create a kingdom for themselves. This action closes the portal filtering sinful souls to Hell and causes Satan to wither away. He must send his most weak but beloved son, Little Nicky, to Earth to return his brothers to Hell.','/AudA8gnTWSBWXBHSBHnr3HHUXXM.jpg','2000-11-10',90,'Released','If your father was the Devil and your mother was an angel, you\'d be messed up too.','Little Nicky',9678,7.122,5.8,'_e3FajuSgs0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15182,_binary '\0','/bOlXLkgFb01lPkdwYWUqWKrfXLH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0185481',7,5048,'ja','迷宮物語','A trilogy of separate stories. In \"Labyrinth labyrinthos\", a girl and her cat enter a strange world. In \"Running Man\", a racer takes on the ultimate opponent. In \"Construction Cancellation Order\", a man must shut down worker robots.','/3tQqkfhE2v03OXK4ocxKQ4rnkaC.jpg','1989-04-15',50,'Released','It\'s not just a city... It\'s a state of mind.','Neo Tokyo',37433,3.4082,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15183,_binary '\0','/36rRIIltrEDPEe6eWELQvrKcVmg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0185584',7.2,4448,'ru','Особенности национальной рыбалки','General Ivolgin, forester Kuzmich, and good-natured Lyova lose their way on a fishing trip and wind up in a neighboring country, where they decide to have a good time anyway but end up leaving their vodka and fishing equipment behind.','/7zHuIitFhPOLh24pTfGfwxAetli.jpg','1998-11-01',95,'Released',NULL,'Peculiarities of the National Fishing',20882,1.3861,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15184,_binary '\0','/rCpCdEF3NZ5BLJ90y8TAkDfUGln.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0185853',6.7,2518,'tr','Ali Baba ve Kırk Haramiler','The Classical story of Ali Baba and the Forty Thieves, starring Sadri Alışık as Ali Baba.','/wKLVct1W6dzvUC0zOssLAb4zFOm.jpg','1972-01-12',84,'Released',NULL,'Ali Baba and the Forty Thieves',157573,1.4543,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15185,_binary '\0','/bWwDhFusTMlVprl4cNZ8NEY76QM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0185895',6,2260,'en','Au Pair','A young MBA mistakenly interviews for the wrong job... and ends up as an Au Pair for a pair of snotty rich kids.','/bqT9BBO5F0nxFBXAwfWhNR7tNL1.jpg','1999-08-22',92,'Released',NULL,'Au Pair',49928,1.3229,5.7,'I3tRJ0Rm8SY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15186,_binary '\0','/ghPJw3XfhELokIf6V5QL0VpsXtK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0185937',6.5,322554,'en','The Blair Witch Project','In October of 1994 three student filmmakers disappeared in the woods near Burkittsville, Maryland, while shooting a documentary. A year later their footage was found.','/9050VGrYjYrEjpOvDZVAngLbg1f.jpg','1999-07-14',81,'Released','Everything you\'ve heard is true.','The Blair Witch Project',2667,11.606,6.371,'AcTh2YItSaM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15187,_binary '\0','/a7dYlan85gcc8fyMGpPQugsTFXd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0186045',5.8,16746,'en','Drowning Mona','A Sheriff investigating the murder of an upstate New York woman learns that her extremely hateful ways gave the whole town a motive to be rid of her.','/iuN2SXCGPIlC7pAPCOzqAdeaDji.jpg','2000-03-03',96,'Released','The death of Mona Dearly wasn\'t so much a whodunnit, as a who didn\'t.','Drowning Mona',25166,3.9042,5.5,'WUapG9Ma3uw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15188,_binary '\0','/pBS51YVR78U2E6s2YXdIh8hPGSn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0186151',7.4,125052,'en','Frequency','When a rare phenomenon gives police officer John Sullivan the chance to speak to his father, 30 years in the past, he takes the opportunity to prevent his dad\'s tragic death. After his actions inadvertently give rise to a series of brutal murders he and his father must find a way to fix the consequences of altering time.','/aFuw2yow5Og0e2M7uEHQtpS5GPz.jpg','2000-04-28',118,'Released','The future is listening.','Frequency',10559,8.9736,7.3,'jdACpDDpIUs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15189,_binary '\0','/96ukaxh1ICysARG21SNNMg4jspH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0186183',6.1,4243,'en','The Guilty','Callum Crane, a lawyer and would-be federal judge, jeopardizes his chances at a judgeship by forcing himself on his secretary. He then worsens the situation by trying to have the woman murdered. Further complicating matters, he assigns the task to a young man who, unbeknownst to Crane, is actually his son, Nathan. Nathan refuses to do the deed, but not before informing several people, one of whom tries to take on the job.','/fXhL95BYYfy9uSld68RHsmRfcqU.jpg','2000-06-01',108,'Released','The evil that men do','The Guilty',55101,3.7757,5.7,'7GBflBsi_68','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15190,_binary '\0','/doYCHWCvXbst9vukstxxl3klBW7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0186253',6.9,7822,'en','Jesus\' Son','A young man turns from drug addiction and petty crime to a life redeemed by a discovery of compassion.','/A2lVDbF1oTuCMlh69vLnqugWEAM.jpg','2000-06-16',107,'Released',NULL,'Jesus\' Son',25636,2.3293,6.2,'4C7KjAd5PT4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15191,_binary '\0','/vYDLOpjyx3wxe2XkXAMgoxF8VUA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0186408',8,3801,'ru','Обыкновенное чудо','A wizard invents characters who all come to life and start to arrive at his house: a King, his servants, a princes, a bear trapped in a man\'s body - the usual lot. The Plot mainly rotates around the bear, who the wizard had turned into a man. The Bear, who wishes to be a bear once again, can turn into his old self if he were to kiss a princess. It gets complicated when he falls in love with that princess, that arrived at the wizard\'s house. For how can they be together, if a single kiss will destroy their love?','/htvbPwc21Ey2yk4RDv69JM7ivRw.jpg','1978-10-02',137,'Released',NULL,'Ordinary Miracle',27935,0.9603,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15192,_binary '\0','/y5Y12Pds6Z4ipLg482Azhp4xb9x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0186508',7.6,21132,'en','Buena Vista Social Club','In this fascinating Oscar-nominated documentary, American guitarist Ry Cooder brings together a group of legendary Cuban folk musicians (some in their 90s) to record a Grammy-winning CD in their native city of Havana. The result is a spectacular compilation of concert footage from the group\'s gigs in Amsterdam and New York City\'s famed Carnegie Hall, with director Wim Wenders capturing not only the music -- but also the musicians\' life stories.','/b8psTDXSelHiab1I7L8rFdYs0IC.jpg','1999-06-04',105,'Released','In Havana, music isn\'t a pastime, it\'s a way of life.','Buena Vista Social Club',11779,4.033,7.481,'hB_1lw0iVRo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15193,_binary '\0','/sUye6BrOjlpoAKRMjcP0YwiUvHW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0186566',6.5,90638,'en','Space Cowboys','Frank Corvin, ‘Hawk’ Hawkins, Jerry O\'Neill and ‘Tank’ Sullivan were hotdog members of Project Daedalus, the US Air Force\'s test program for space travel, but their hopes were dashed in 1958 with the formation of NASA and the use of trained chimps. They blackmail their way into orbit when Russia\'s mysterious ‘Ikon’ communications satellite\'s orbit begins to degrade and threatens to crash to Earth.','/hPzt1bbA1sUDQOl6Vujmyz2hjLN.jpg','2000-08-04',130,'Released','Space will never be the same.','Space Cowboys',5551,7.2953,6.39,'7PAZBAV43Zw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15194,_binary '\0','/r61qpgtIUEuRHGh3VdQpgcxN8zN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0186589',5.8,16521,'en','Sugar & Spice','When Jack and Diane find themselves in an unexpected adult situation, the A-Squad comes to their rescue. In order to help their friend Diane, the A-Squad goes where no cheerleader has gone before: taking on a little after-school project known as bank robbery. But the A-Squad does things their way -- with sugar and spice -- forever changing their friendship, their future and the nation\'s notion of teen spirit.','/fN3xeuVsPaiEKYm65uHSO9JVmeb.jpg','2001-01-24',81,'Released','Why would the most popular girl in school wear a mask?','Sugar & Spice',16723,4.5472,6.434,'wP60n7sCKUk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15195,_binary '\0','/eVxyOuyVDFdodWQXyLl62zxJ1Xf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0186654',2.9,2231,'en','Universal Soldier II: Brothers in Arms','With the UniSol program budget cut by the government, a gang of mercenaries takes control of the new line of Universal Soldiers for their own nefarious ends. In doing so, they clash with Luc Deveraux, survivor of the first incident with the UniSols, alongside his long-lost and newly-resurrected brother Eric and reporter Veronica Roberts.','/tOI7BWFf16QXViDOXnT2h5BCBW5.jpg','1998-09-27',92,'Released','No memory. No emotion. No mercy... Until one of them decides to become human again.','Universal Soldier II: Brothers in Arms',10704,3.6522,4.3,'ccT1UOAc8Uk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15196,_binary '\0','/5tOzlyJg7ipRC3XAAQS2S2VcPIo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0186655',3,1578,'en','Universal Soldier III: Unfinished Business','When reporter Veronica Roberts unwillingly gets involved in a hostage situation and is forced to escape, she and Luc Devereaux go into hiding. Meanwhile, Dr. Walker and Mentor get set with a powerful new Universal Soldier and a lethal plan.','/rAmN4ROrFlOipyccNdiltUAz0f2.jpg','1998-10-28',95,'Released','Back in action and deadlier than ever!','Universal Soldier III: Unfinished Business',27847,2.6941,4.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15197,_binary '\0','/sSTUKQ8XbBNhDnFoR7JbdWvsMdb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0186725',7.4,1553,'ja','座頭市鉄火旅','Zatoichi comes upon the town of Tonda, overrun by gangsters. Using one of his favorite techniques, Zatoichi proceeds to win 8 ryo in a rigged gambling game. Of course, the local gangsters attempt to kill him, and the adventure begins. It turns out a blacksmith named Senzo examines Zatoichi\'s cane sword, and discovers it to be forged by his old mentor. Senzo discovers the sword is at the end of its usefulness and will break when it is used next.','/2UUr2KXLuC7UcLCwMN5QX6izVhb.jpg','1967-01-03',93,'Released',NULL,'Zatoichi\'s Cane Sword',54277,1.8611,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15198,_binary '\0','/zoSPdY6CbtwtQ9MIDKwVGMVGJrm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0186726',6.4,9284,'en','Zenon: Girl of the 21st Century','Zenon Kar, a 13-year-old girl who lives on a space station in the year 2049, gets into some trouble and is banished to Earth. With help from some Earth friends she must find her way back.','/ehahU4rOE2V02PKpgx8Fui3AZNQ.jpg','1999-01-23',97,'Released','She\'s one galactic girl who saves the day in a stellar way!','Zenon: Girl of the 21st Century',34766,2.6483,6.1,'qAklH_3E4Hs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15199,_binary '\0','/81PS9G3hN96rn3M07S24B4O3byG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0186730',7.4,3126,'fr','Ça commence aujourd\'hui','In a mining town which has been blighted by economic downturns, an elementary school headmaster struggles to obtain social services on behalf of his students.','/gq61g2yRffztbKf6yDWv48Dw3l9.jpg','1999-03-12',117,'Released',NULL,'It All Starts Today',32273,1.8388,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15200,_binary '\0','/hZARFbBT4I3svc6TAnaHrhTyKbc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0186894',5.8,22813,'en','Bounce','Buddy Amaral, a successful and self-absorbed Los Angeles advertising executive, switches airline tickets with a stranger just before boarding a long-delayed flight so that he might enjoy an overnight fling with a pretty Dallas businesswoman. When the plane goes down, killing all aboard, Buddy\'s guilt soon turns into an alcohol problem. As part of his 12-step program, Buddy seeks atonement and decides to seek out the woman he thinks he\'s left a widow.','/w7X4M14WV7KrkkvXd64lcLh79sR.jpg','2000-11-15',107,'Released','Two strangers fell in love. One knew it wasn\'t by chance.','Bounce',10862,3.7369,5.8,'U_lR9dqgx7s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15201,_binary '\0','/sUjQme7fDIz3rQ1h6OOHgWQ9Mkq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0186895',5.7,1251,'fr','Les Boys III','Three years have passed. The Boys are still a great hockey team in a garage league. Their coach Stan, in France for three years, returns from his trip to the delight of his troops. However, a wealthy businessman appears in the background and the players feel drawn to the lure of profit until the point where the Boys will face... the Boys.','/qR4WNSt7l2ftsTaDyp9Q6FXahJ2.jpg','2001-11-30',124,'Released',NULL,'The Boys III',42843,1.0253,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15202,_binary '\0','/h9tOfwccsf1hYZi6izEbT1NX86Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0186910',4.8,1454,'en','Can of Worms','A teen is visited by aliens after he broadcasts a message into space.','/cyQfx4kHTbuFdm6OEQTDrMV22Ko.jpg','1999-04-10',84,'Released','Who\'s Got Time to Be a Teenager When You Have to Save the World?','Can of Worms',82401,2.73,4.8,'023DndT2z4c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15203,_binary '\0','/kqcbwRrUmkcUe6TcFWHMnobVDon.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0186975',5,16573,'en','Down to You','College coeds in New York City, Al, the son of a celebrity chef, and Imogen, a talented artist, become smitten the second they lay eyes on one another at a bar. However, the road to happiness is not a smooth one. Outside forces, including a predatory porn star who wants to lure Al into her bed, threaten to pull apart the young lovers before their romance has a chance to really flourish.','/pqEEtX4S8j2XqZ9JAD97fz2DPkV.jpg','2000-01-21',91,'Released','A new comedy about giving first love a second chance.','Down to You',10472,5.7708,5.2,'tdnZYsDOxfI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15204,_binary '\0','/qJk6OzlZovXnWLeZysweuAKuk7t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0187044',6.6,1280,'fr','Les Galettes de Pont-Aven','Henri Serin (Jean-Pierre Marielle), an umbrella salesman, leads a quiet life between his work, his family and his passion for painting. During his many business trips, Henri indulges in a few amorous escapades, which provide a welcome change from the tiresome daily routine his bigoted wife locks him into. One fine day, Henri decides to drop everything and live on love and fresh water. He ends up in Pont-Aven, where he meets Émile, a local painter imitating Gauguin, with whom he shares his drinking and other feminine attractions.','/5ZYbGdFa9wVqctQ6uSdFWK3apJ2.jpg','1975-08-20',105,'Released',NULL,'Cookies',35549,1.8036,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15205,_binary '\0','/bAi93pqJpkGLEr5HieCZhMoE0VG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0187078',6.5,312682,'en','Gone in Sixty Seconds','Ex-car thief Randall Raines is forced out of retirement to save his brother Kip after a boost gone wrong. With the help of allies old and new, they race to meet the demands of notorious crime boss Raymond Calitri as the police are in hot pursuit.','/fToQDmkBtiXYGh9xfgAh3gpo6GZ.jpg','2000-06-09',118,'Released','Ice cold, hot wired.','Gone in Sixty Seconds',9679,13.4895,6.475,'cxCE9gDm1vo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15206,_binary '\0','/lcmfVMnKKp6FGQxupOoVGS6afMM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0187115',8.1,2193,'te','క్షణ క్షణం','Chandu is a petty thief who comes across Satya, an innocent girl who unwittingly comes across a way to a huge amount of money stolen from a bank. While the gang that robbed the bank go after her for the clue, one member dies in her apartment and she believes she\'s the one that killed him. Every one including the original gang that robbed the bank, the police and now Chandu and Satya go after the money.','/9qQyvepQkpPeeNFk04tea2vLTuY.jpg','1991-10-09',152,'Released',NULL,'Kshana Kshanam',81072,1.2559,5.909,'oJqEujLBYuU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15207,_binary '\0','/hWatGQXYRcuaUTllnOqpSQ0oCpF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0187227',5.9,1643,'hi','Laadla','Laadla is the story of the kind-hearted Raju, who lives with his disabled mom. One day Raju, on his way to a job interview, saves the life of a rich textile mill owner who offers him a job in his factory. The mill is run by his ambitious daughter Sheetal, whose competitive attitude and open insults have made her many enemies. Raju and Sheetal clash often, until Sheetal tries to get the upper hand by forcing Raju to marry her, even though he has already fallen in love with Kaajal.','/19gxqTBRBYoWxypSihK0qKMphKd.jpg','1994-03-17',169,'Released',NULL,'Laadla',197483,1.0455,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15208,_binary '\0','/ekFH659jcoSclsp8RGS8XHqzQ8D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0187231',8.6,9136,'sr','Lajanje na zvezde','Comedy about teachers and students at a high school in a small provincial town. Mihailo tries to win the heart of a girl his brother is also chasing.','/vbVH6qUzk0LbPVA37dqhASIvUPJ.jpg','1998-06-01',95,'Released',NULL,'Barking at the Stars',55138,0.8962,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15209,_binary '\0','/9xV4KpZ5OqK4pj6mgCnroewvD0E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0187251',4.3,1733,'en','Lovers Lane','A man with a hook for a hand escapes from a mental institution to go after the children of his previous victims.','/bZxjY9lPtKeNxBeFkBTTaSQbtoA.jpg','2000-02-05',90,'Released','Don\'t get hooked.','Lovers Lane',113957,3.2616,4,'bBZgmirfawc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15210,_binary '\0','/80fT4pJ7yCZF2XrDYIoQbBJSSRh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0187318',8.6,3726,'ta','மூன்றாம் பிறை','A young woman suffers a major head injury in a car accident after which she begins behaving like a child. Trapped at a brothel, she finds hope in a lonely school teacher who decides to rescue her.','/kDimtjGArqeW93Aa5tjS6kPrupB.jpg','1982-02-19',143,'Released','The Third Crescent','Moondram Pirai',66389,1.5954,6.725,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15211,_binary '\0','/8J10PcjUuJlk3BG3BMHlUOiIUpM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0187393',7.2,316567,'en','The Patriot','After proving himself on the field of battle in the French and Indian War, Benjamin Martin wants nothing more to do with such things, preferring the simple life of a farmer. But when his son Gabriel enlists in the army to defend their new nation, America, against the British, Benjamin reluctantly returns to his old life to protect his son.','/fWZd815QxUCUcrWQZwUkAp9ljG.jpg','2000-06-28',165,'Released','Before they were soldiers, they were family. Before they were legends, they were heroes. Before there was a nation, there was a fight for freedom.','The Patriot',2024,15.845,7.2,'OpKR4qTOVgI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15212,_binary '\0','/s2PoR5AU9KlLZcSBnl1xoQIE6Cu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0187512',5.1,5970,'en','Slap Her... She\'s French','Welcome to Splendona High School, Texas, where football players, cheerleaders and beauty queens rule the hallways. And Starla Grady, the most popular girl in school, is on top of it all. That is, at least until Genevieve LePlouff, a French foreign exchange student arrives and turns her life upside down.','/eztcBfiB8wbKkU4BmwjKC5oRBIU.jpg','2002-02-07',89,'Released','Bonjour, y\'all','Slap Her... She\'s French',23967,2.6716,4.7,'3Qa0_fHctpE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15213,_binary '\0','/abS5UZWLusamGYP00vr2V6Ti0p0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0187601',6.2,1369,'fr','Mauvaise passe','Fleeing from his wife in France to London, 45-year-old Pierre is barely able to support himself. He meets friendly Tom, who offers to help him make ends meet by working as a male escort.','/os14mHUzmxbXk1uVr9eh3hzo2iQ.jpg','1999-11-17',100,'Released','He\'ll be your friend, he\'ll be your lover, but it\'s strictly by the hour.','The Escort',71632,2.0145,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15214,_binary '\0','/6OzOuU2JE0lm11p0UEUm3dCiH3L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0187696',6,14703,'de','Anatomie','Medical student Paula wins a place at an exclusive Heidelberg medical school. When the body of a young man she met on the train turns up on her dissection table, she begins to investigate the mysterious circumstances surrounding his death.','/hZgnRhrOkmjjod5u3umbw4y08kX.jpg','2000-02-03',103,'Released','Some study. Some are studied.','Anatomy',1698,3.6169,6.1,'0nXtQ5QIF6o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15215,_binary '\0','/86b0NGY1i0bt3ckhkcHxiCSMxk1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0187738',6.7,255425,'en','Blade II','Blade forms an uneasy alliance with the vampire council in order to combat the Reapers, who are feeding on vampires.','/wAn6VYamKbnOtfyTZ6arVtkMzDv.jpg','2002-03-22',117,'Released','Faster. Sharper. Deadlier.','Blade II',36586,13.9843,6.573,'fcCQ7xk8zzM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15216,_binary '\0','/hkqag2HuaOZI887DpVoAqfWCQjt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0187809',7.4,1973,'fa','درخت گلابی','Mahmoud is suffering from writer\'s block and he is unable to continue the book he is currently working upon. He decides to take a break from his routine life and plans to visit his family\'s rural estate that is situated at north of Tehran. He also intends to complete his book in this visit. While at the estate, Mahmoud\'s attention is brought to the old Pear Tree that is situated behind the estate by the old gardener of the estate. Seeing the Pear Tree, Mahmoud thinks about his past - his infatuation towards his 14-year-old female cousin known only as M, his adolescent dreams, how that changed over the years. The rest of the film chronicles thoughts of Mahmoud and his past.','/AiSxasAeSsrk1j8XblohOFl5u6w.jpg','1998-10-18',95,'Released',NULL,'The Pear Tree',165911,1.1157,6.881,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15217,_binary '\0','/6SRECmsTgh9IbJZULGMJMCuWby4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0187819',4.9,3823,'en','Doug\'s 1st Movie','Doug and his pal Skeeter set\'s out to find the monster of Lucky Duck Lake. Though things get really out of hand when some one blurts out that the monster is real.','/hZduJdSSWCkmvnBpNyRaIszubVm.jpg','1999-03-26',76,'Released','You\'ll Dig Doug!','Doug\'s 1st Movie',16508,3.3795,5.6,'b23YuMtrNE4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15218,_binary '\0','/vAmKOLEo2AHwy47NsuKMOcJ5Qeh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0187859',7.7,1496,'en','Genghis Blues','Blind blues musician Paul Pena is perhaps best known for his song \"Jet Airliner\". In 1993, Pena heard Tuvan throat singing over his shortwave radio and subsequently taught himself how to reproduce these extraordinary sounds. This documentary follows him to Tuva, where he takes part in a throat singing competition. Languages featured in the film include English, Russian and Tuvan.','/tEwdvxK2ntu6LGBPqCNFkXnwO1B.jpg','1999-07-19',87,'Released','The story of a blind blues musician\'s triumphant journey to the lost land of Tuva.','Genghis Blues',28030,1.4272,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15219,_binary '\0','/aFvLUBVkOsrooUnikodoHEiQfco.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0188030',7.6,10766,'es','La lengua de las mariposas','The film centres on Moncho and his coming-of-age experience in Galicia in 1936. Moncho develops a close relationship with his teacher Don Gregorio who introduces the boy to different things in the world. While the story centres on Moncho\'s ordinary coming-of-age experiences, tensions related to the looming Spanish Civil War periodically interrupt Moncho\'s personal growth and daily life.','/iSyRibFKtZL0tvjh6tCxTb6o74s.jpg','1999-09-24',96,'Released','Stop and taste the world.','Butterfly',31023,2.6814,7.337,'IEzOxMriGTE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15220,_binary '\0','/lTzZT8YZHQ9sn04KHEyy4BFHJjZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0188055',5.3,2637,'en','Mercy','Detective Catherine Palmer is on the trail of an elusive serial killer. During her investigation she meets Vickie Kittrie, who belongs to an exclusive club of women who engage in secret sessions of bondage and S&M. Matters become even more complicated when Palmer finds herself attracted to Kittrie, leading to a brief lesbian encounter. Palmer soon learns that each victim belonged to this club of prominent, sexually experimental women. In order to catch the killer, Catherine must trust Vickie to guide her through the dangerous and illicit underground.','/rTgEO5EpxztlMfdiXqghh7G2UxW.jpg','2000-02-11',117,'Released',NULL,'Mercy',5247,2.7564,5.269,'DljrEsl1Lp8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15221,_binary '\0','/8JsQ35vi7IpaFRHVOnpsWfm2bnG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0188128',6.6,1388,'en','Very Annie Mary','Set in the fictional village of \"Ogw\" in the valleys of south-east Wales. After her father Jack suffers a stroke Annie Mary Pugh is forced to take care of him but uses the circumstances to emancipate herself and find the courage to sing once again.','/g5YBT8oxc5zttmYArfiVtloQ6tz.jpg','2001-05-25',104,'Released','One can dream, can\'t one?','Very Annie Mary',62956,1.6021,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15222,_binary '\0','/gUnCdNS2L0cn3HQ3yWFjDQDig8q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0188350',7.3,1696,'sv','Det nya landet','A 15-year-old Somalian boy meets a 40-year-old Iranian man in a refugee camp in Skåne, in the south of Sweden. With the threat of deportation hanging over them, they decide to take their faiths in their own hands and together they go on a journey in the Swedish summer.','/psl0W09e1bOcBxsH2JduD4lilz3.jpg','2000-11-24',128,'Released',NULL,'The New Country',24955,1.304,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15223,_binary '\0','/gyBM5bka3l2qClAzbbre6cs0RJA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0188404',7.4,1769,'nl','Als Je Begrijpt Wat Ik Bedoel','Oliver B. Bumble finds an egg that, it turns out, has a cute little dragon in it. However, this dragon grows huge each time it gets excited or upset. As this causes a lot of problems, Bumble has to face a difficult dilemma.','/fauu3Ve7BeBk614Jrshi9AneBMf.jpg','1983-02-03',84,'Released',NULL,'The Dragon That Wasn\'t (Or Was He?)',21375,1.3333,7.1,'oTYda3yxdk0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15224,_binary '\0','/kq7a3jjof465gLwsIDhjtpyNURD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0188453',6,27277,'en','Birthday Girl','John is a mild-mannered banker who has never been lucky in love. Fed up with waiting for the right girl to come along, John takes a chance on a Russian mail-order bride arranged via the Internet, where he is introduced to Nadia. John\'s fondness for Nadia grows... until the sudden arrival of Nadia\'s gregarious cousins makes John realize that he\'s in over his head.','/jrwCiqQjEm3WqxHXxvAoW4gOsUd.jpg','2001-09-06',93,'Released','Be careful what you wish for.','Birthday Girl',2084,5.0725,5.9,'QZsi-SQmljI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15225,_binary '\0','/tbI4gCfoCtNlZe5hQBwUWcxbPOE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0188503',6.9,6893,'ko','조용한 가족','A family decides to buy a lodge in a remote hiking area. Their first customer commits suicide and the distraught family buries his body to avoid the bad publicity. But their luck gets worse, the bodies start piling up, and the family becomes frantic to rectify the situation.','/6sCTGLgqcqHyXGgX9KFUKASIj8q.jpg','1998-04-25',101,'Released','The ruthless comedy.','The Quiet Family',74336,2.3118,7.014,'nSyJAuvzGcU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15226,_binary '\0','/mEJTIt7fGYeBZw60OSPgureF5Gb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0188527',5.1,4304,'el','Τα Παιδιά Του Διαβόλου','A British couple on a break on a small Greek Island spreads terror beyond anything the Islanders could ever have imagined, only stopping every once in a while to shag anything that moves, be it man, woman or animal. But will they go unpunished, or will the inspector from London be able to put an end to their killing spree?','/vWfz11ffaHL2kMja0iwz8skFsIP.jpg','1976-04-26',106,'Released','The lucky ones got their brains blown out!!','Island of Death',40043,2.5219,4.8,'oMLHKSYFjEk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15227,_binary '\0','/vPaeGgUxnZRBXCAeENxuitmNgDw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0188568',7,2426,'sr','Do koske','Overcome by an irrational rage, a 17 year-old hatchet man kidnaps his boss who had managed to cover up his true identity and become part of the establishment. The Kid takes this one time hero of his to a hideout in a huge, deserted steel mill where the two experience a kind of enlightenment after some twenty hours of infernal games and agony.','/l6mUS2O5AppbVdwnmmfxoPjA62W.jpg','1997-03-06',97,'Released',NULL,'Rage',109035,1.2303,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15228,_binary '\0','/nv60CvL3fjosoJytnBcdJcF5l0L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0188640',6,10463,'ja','ゴジラ2000 ミレニアム','An independent group of researchers called the Godzilla Prediction Network (GPN) actively track Godzilla as he makes landfall in Nemuro. Matters are further complicated when a giant meteor is discovered in the Ibaragi Prefecture. The mysterious rock begins to levitate as it\'s true intentions for the world and Godzilla are revealed.','/7BrjFxV0j5VzZRfVYeYbFXMUweB.jpg','1999-12-11',107,'Released','Witness! A new era of Godzilla!','Godzilla 2000: Millennium',10643,4.9822,6.9,'ykM1erwrtiA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15229,_binary '\0','/caRq5BlQ5BKcN245TCsRGAdi9Cv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0188653',6.9,1957,'tr','Güneşe Yolculuk','Mehmet, a young Turkish man newly migrated from Tire, takes a job searching for water leaks below the surface of the streets of Istanbul. Due to a strange set of events, he is mistaken for a Kurd, imprisoned, and brutally beaten. Upon his release, he becomes an outcast marked as a Kurd.','/3ilI1iWve88t1fhwYMZpwIZYBab.jpg','1999-02-16',109,'Released',NULL,'Journey to the Sun',47215,1.1831,5.8,'Xk5yOopcZ0c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15230,_binary '\0','/kRC0aqvYYDIrgeq83yUdq7qFTn4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0188674',7.1,29869,'en','Human Traffic','For Jip, Lulu, Koop, Nina, and Moff, the dead-end jobs they endure during the week just kill the time until Friday night. That\'s when they cut very loose and get on the rollercoaster ride that takes them right through to Monday morning.','/cHwnYGZh1fVuVWqT28GpCN0usYF.jpg','1999-06-04',100,'Released','The weekend has landed.','Human Traffic',11129,2.815,6.815,'GjoWJB9SGf0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15231,_binary '\0','/n0bleUycxAsw4tg5fBTijnFrRN2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0188766',7.2,8904,'cn','喜劇之王','Wan Tin-Sau is an actor who cannot seem to catch a break, since his only professional jobs are limited to being a movie extra. As well as being an actor, he is also the head of his village\'s community center.','/dmJWvKNgeCrIwJH6AapdSMiZHop.jpg','1999-02-08',89,'Released',NULL,'King of Comedy',53168,4.0561,7.369,'8fsA0w2TxVA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15232,_binary '\0','/8tPB90KpiogRD0fqGXkXxmw07ER.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0188863',5.7,5804,'en','Love Stinks','Seth Winnick has it all: a successful career in television, good friends, and a passionate relationship with beautiful Chelsea. However, when he fails to make a timely marriage proposal, Chelsea tries to make his life hell.','/srHcbkCyQFfdmqt5rPQMshxp1Yt.jpg','1999-09-10',94,'Released',NULL,'Love Stinks',15122,2.2475,6.5,'e-WBWtNm_i0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15233,_binary '\0','/5p9HiIQdUBOXjfz8ujFqaQRST8K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0189070',6.9,6007,'en','Scooby-Doo! Meets the Boo Brothers','After the death of Shaggy\'s Uncle Beaureguard, he, Scooby and Scrappy arrive at the late uncle\'s Southern plantation to collect the inheritance. But as soon as they arrive, they find it is haunted by the ghost of a Confederate soldier. With this spook on their tails while they solve riddles in search of the inheritance, they seek help from the Boo Brothers, a trio of ghost-exterminators to help catch this nasty ghoul.','/2jKmHNGED3cUyXd6oge5uuHYh3f.jpg','1987-10-18',93,'Released','It\'s the start of a boo-tiful friendship!','Scooby-Doo! Meets the Boo Brothers',24787,3.7057,7.4,'Fwhd79i0h7c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15234,_binary '\0','/ofM2bez3pE2SJBZAUyoQDdVPkJS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0189071',6.8,7124,'en','Scooby-Doo and the Ghoul School','Scooby, Shaggy and Scrappy are on their way to Miss Grimwood\'s Finishing School for Girls, where they\'ve been hired as gym teachers. Once there, however, they find that not only is it actually an all-girl school of famous monsters\' daughters but there\'s a villainess out to enslave the girls.','/duMdoHLQvnzRDZm2CD66DT4PvS5.jpg','1988-10-16',93,'Released','Hey there, it\'s the ghoul school!','Scooby-Doo and the Ghoul School',13350,4.3837,7.391,'HaEXAFs8Prg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15235,_binary '\0','/qFeuSLq1InfpK9PgjFHmdY3UZNq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0189072',6.6,6033,'en','Scooby-Doo! and the Reluctant Werewolf','Shaggy is turned into a werewolf, and it\'s up to Scooby, Scrappy and Shaggy\'s girlfriend to help him win a race against other monsters, and become human again.','/cXUQuHnNBxFSZAmYfogMfrcvMk7.jpg','1988-11-13',92,'Released','The New Scooby-Doo Movie You\'ll Howl For!','Scooby-Doo! and the Reluctant Werewolf',37211,4.4032,7.3,'yDwF5IIJZq4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15236,_binary '\0','/7rOFCemUdldeNMdf3qURElant2K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0189142',6.7,3009,'fr','Le Temps retrouvé','In early 1920s France, an author, lying on his deathbed, looks at various photographs and is flooded with memories of the people and events that have shaped his life.','/1ZbBR18GU7XpVfooWV9NsrV4RGV.jpg','1999-05-19',163,'Released',NULL,'Time Regained',47439,2.6294,6.3,'b7SDy6Jxm2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15237,_binary '\0','/pKSKphqZmvr3DTmqFj38D8D9FWz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0189153',7.5,3038,'sr','Точкови','Nemanja leads a normal life with a steady job and a fiancée, until he is waylaid by a sudden downpour in a seedy hotel called The Wheel. The hotel is populated by seemingly upstanding citizens, until Nemanya is accused of being the notorious Laughing Monster, a serial killer who has been terrorizing the neighborhood.','/ttZBf7C72xVD8F7sTKHJeC8jjYh.jpg','1998-10-01',92,'Released',NULL,'Wheels',23237,1.0655,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15238,_binary '\0','/2T8VGLAuy8CFDQrCcsrW4SG48n2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0189154',8.4,1293,'bg','Топло','A tenement house needs to have steam heating installed. The residents find the necessary workers to do it, sign the contract and pay them in advance. The workers show up and start their job, but disappear immediately. Panic-stricken, the residents set up to search for them, only to find the workers in jail. Totally desperate, their only chance is to come up with an ingenious plan how to bring the work to the end.','/yyhvQWk599cJsXie2GGhUVQdBLh.jpg','1978-11-20',91,'Released',NULL,'The Central Warmth',266952,1.4415,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15239,_binary '\0','/iRYEGEbpjbPQrxAXcIg9wlaO2xm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0189192',5.7,21373,'en','Just Visiting','A knight and his valet are plagued by a witch, and to repair the damage they make use of the services of a wizard. However, something goes wrong and they are transported from the 12th century to the year 2000. There the knight meets some of his family and slowly learns what this new century is like. However, he still needs to get back to the 12th century to deal with the witch, so he starts looking for a wizard. Remake of 1993 French film Les Visiteurs (The Visitors).','/7KqzbefXjADSUE8j2ZsrudvAArY.jpg','2001-04-06',88,'Released','They\'re not just from another time, they\'re from France.','Just Visiting',56715,6.8952,4.765,'SNrj8-avYvU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15240,_binary '\0','/cr5fnofjFTKoUwgbyHzeZdkYMz4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0189219',7.3,3756,'zh','小城之春','A married couple living in a desolate small town in post-WWII China are paid a surprise visit by an old friend of the husband\'s.','/kRiHwa1p7FDkPBxjjFNMY8pjc1f.jpg','1948-02-01',94,'Released',NULL,'Spring in a Small Town',21058,11.4768,7.2,'LiFkrKUbBd0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15241,_binary '\0','/6AhjL10T0kOtpYEzxN7DPAxBuhJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0189456',4.4,4086,'en','Cut','A group of film students set out to finish filming a movie that was never completed after its director was murdered. After they begin filming, they realize they\'re in for a bit of trouble, not unlike the late director...','/64Dn0qJdC0E744uIWYtN5xQL9om.jpg','2000-02-23',82,'Released','They just have to finish the movie… before it finishes them!','Cut',10205,2.4108,4.6,'38RWV0V-U-4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15242,_binary '\0','/8BVJJjXoq7IbacR6YnUe9rGrUq7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0189492',6.8,2458,'hi','दुश्मन','According to police records, a daredevil, Gokul Pandit is on the loose. He would attempts to rape and kill young and beautiful girls who are alone.','/bUgHLNNz5jz8M9otUA2msVVn10J.jpg','1998-07-13',145,'Released',NULL,'Dushman',165068,1.2598,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15243,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0189541',4.8,1551,'en','Gabriela','Mike is romantic, persistent, and a social worker at a psychiatric clinic. He falls for a new intern, Gabriela, who is passionate and engaged.','/7CXc1TBLlDaL4Xc9lwePPIMnj3a.jpg','2001-02-14',93,'Released',NULL,'Gabriela',291675,1.9358,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15244,_binary '\0','/90sruxPLYoCzYnaFEVzxfpkGjG5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0189584',6.5,15513,'en','The Big Kahuna','Three salesmen working for a firm that makes industrial lubricants are waiting in the company\'s \"hospitality suite\" at a manufacturers\' convention for a \"big kahuna\" named Dick Fuller to show up, in hopes they can persuade him to place an order that could salvage the company\'s flagging sales.','/sMhWWdW6V3HXFanELFA1oHdvboS.jpg','1999-11-17',90,'Released',NULL,'The Big Kahuna',15723,2.54,6.8,'_MZXKWNvtK4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15245,_binary '\0','/pCLC8KTruIod4TwkA4NQc5rvmEm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0189592',5.5,1975,'hi','हम आपके दिल में रहते हैं','Vishwanath is a multi-millionaire industrialist, who lives in a palatial house, with his only chid, a son named Vijay. Vijay has been literally born with a silver spoon in his mouth, and indulges in life\'s temptations and weaknesses to the extreme. Vishwanath would like his son to get married and be responsible. Vijay agrees to get married on condition that his future bride sign an agreement that the marriage is on a trial basis for one year, and thereafter is Vijay does not fall in love with her, the marriage gets annulled. Vishwanath asks his personal assistant, Megha, to quit her job and marry Vijay, but Megha refuses. Megha comes from a poor family, consisting of her mom, two other sisters, and one brother. Written by Shrikant','/imN87wvGiqaXJ8ia5pi8Iqil4cJ.jpg','1999-01-22',168,'Released',NULL,'Hum Aapke Dil Mein Rehte Hain',52860,1.3059,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15246,_binary '\0','/waEKuyRge5fdmqUgqa2xcGTbzXZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0189630',6.8,2050,'he','קדוש‎','The year 2000 approaches in Jerusalem\'s Orthodox Mea Shearim quarter, where the women work, keep house, and have children so the men can study the Torah and the Talmud. Rivka is happily and passionately married to Meir, but they remain childless. The yeshiva\'s rabbi, who is Meir\'s father, wants Meir to divorce Rivka: \"a barren woman is no woman.\" Rivka\'s sister, Malka, is in love with Yakov, a Jew shunned by the yeshiva as too secular. The rabbi arranges Malka\'s marriage to Yossef, whose agitation when fulfilling religious duties approaches the grotesque. Can the sisters sort out their hearts\' desires within this patriarchal world? If not, have they any other options?','/mQML6VNcmW80YlyS0Cfp7hnnrdP.jpg','1999-06-10',110,'Released','In a world of ancient traditions…','Kadosh',40476,1.0088,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15247,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0189633',6.6,1359,'hi','करीब','A friend helps a smitten young man arrange to marry a pretty woman who lacks a dowry.','/fYqmdzDH0tLZZx6HEIWCP9acKPN.jpg','1998-07-17',155,'Released',NULL,'Kareeb',97442,1.1947,6.091,'13syb5DUwpQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15248,_binary '\0','/sxH8NEYsNQluOQjjzAjwkTIXrBk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0189744',6.1,1693,'en','Miss Julie','A footman seduces a count\'s daughter. Adaptation of August Strindberg\'s famous play.','/7eBM9T0CKZpy59dIsvAg4GArTg8.jpg','1999-12-10',103,'Released','Worlds apart... bound by desire.','Miss Julie',125520,2.1404,5.8,'bj2Mwwy9B0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15249,_binary '\0','/tSxd9g80Av9ZbFsFXJK6oUAmCOR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0189764',5.7,1288,'ja','モスラ 3 キングギドラ来襲','To save the world, Mothra goes back in time in an attempt to defeat a younger King Ghidorah.','/gjPOYcixy3ESaCYnucjFkluSEW5.jpg','1998-12-12',99,'Released','The strongest enemy, the final transformation.','Rebirth of Mothra III',36247,1.488,6.3,'339mmgIG8Ik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15250,_binary '\0','/a8jKGQfOeAzgcMwLfaydkefGMQc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0189916',5.8,1788,'fr','Peut-être','Arthur is invited to a New Year\'s Eve party to celebrate the year 2000. His girlfriend Lucie would like a baby from him but he refuses. Through the ceiling of the toilets, he discovers a passage leading to this futurist Paris. There, he meets an old man Ako who affirms he is his son and that he wants to exist. Otherwise he will vanish into the air. Arthur is still hesitant because his life is an unfulfilled one: a has a little lucrative job, is uncertain about his future and things are getting out of hand when Ako discovers the passage and interferes in the party.','/crHfjsE7ZE8yMa7bilCLbOsaHZY.jpg','1999-11-10',109,'Released',NULL,'Peut-être',11957,1.4681,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15251,_binary '\0','/fZxedOOa9HOkbeszY2czuBuzNC4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0189981',6.3,1250,'en','Scarfies','This dark comedy is set in Dunedin, New Zealand. A university student finds an old \"abandoned\" house and proceeds to invite other students to share. It even has running electricity. But what is the catch?','/rpA3BziC2xPK9eLFaKTEDrYmVKg.jpg','1999-08-05',101,'Released','A captive in your basement. What would you do?','Scarfies',13892,1.9309,5.6,'f8xO4KnwqTw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15252,_binary '\0','/cKKhk85c1TZSYy6ZF94QpUH8bRw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0189998',6.9,48225,'en','Shadow of the Vampire','Director F.W. Murnau makes a Faustian pact with a vampire to get him to star in his 1922 film \"Nosferatu.\"','/nWm7DWi8X4D87XkM5qr9BhTJHq6.jpg','2000-08-30',95,'Released','An unspeakable horror. A creative genius. Captured for eternity.','Shadow of the Vampire',10873,5.9943,6.7,'_B15iesNMa8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15253,_binary '\0','/pqVFdQDe0wbZRKg6GDyx3ghYXag.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0190138',6.7,136581,'en','The Whole Nine Yards','After a mobster agrees to cooperate with an FBI investigation in order to stay out of prison, he\'s relocated by the authorities to a life of suburban anonymity as part of a witness protection program. It\'s not long before a couple of his new neighbours figure out his true identity and come knocking to see if he\'d be up for one more hit—suburban style.','/rDV7ntPLY0ZDBT722Odsi80nFrn.jpg','2000-02-18',98,'Released','In the heart of suburbia, a hit man with heart has just moved in.','The Whole Nine Yards',2069,9.8418,6.5,'671bZc4jX7g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15254,_binary '\0','/VKd9ixTgbSJNdQ8TLRvSwPLl13.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0190268',7,2208,'ko','파란대문','Jin-a, a young prostitute, moves into a seaside motel called the Birdcage Inn, run by a dysfunctional family. Struggling with her circumstances and the family\'s treatment, she forms an unlikely bond with the daughter, Hye-mi. As they navigate love, betrayal, and personal growth, their friendship ultimately leads to a deeper understanding and a chance for redemption.','/AudXaWqKI4Bb9xIsyjTeQCTxJId.jpg','1998-10-31',101,'Released','Same age, same space and different life…','Birdcage Inn',2777,2.2143,6.4,'0u8pepOqA5U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15255,_binary '\0','/KlYRORotYilG7XL2kPsHImDeBO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0190281',5.1,1742,'en','Britannic','It was the sister ship of the infamous Titanic... and its final destiny was the same. Experience the true untold story of Britannic, a tumultuous, epic voyage of human passion, courage and betrayal aboard an ill-fated ocean liner bound for a shattering demise. With the world at war, an undercover British agent (Amanda Ryan), embarks the Britannic in search of a German spy believed to be on board to sabotage the ship. Posing as a governess, the undercover agent finds herself falling in love with the ship\'s chaplain (Edward Atterton). In a stunning discovery, the lovers suddenly find themselves enemies of war. And when a massive explosion deals a deathblow to the ship, their battle becomes one for their own survival. With a dynamic, international cast and a story line that hosts a chilling tale of espionage, politics and romance, Britannic brings one of history\'s most devastating events to riveting, new life.','/dzjEdjrRNAe6gIYcQFm0lKAby6Q.jpg','2000-01-10',93,'Released','They Never Thought It Would Happen Again','Britannic',59709,2.5027,6.805,'BVGefCB7VCY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15256,_binary '\0','/nSm9cij9VRrGDoZoS16CPnX0FqK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0190332',7.8,297341,'zh','卧虎藏龍','Two warriors in pursuit of a stolen sword and a notorious fugitive are led to an impetuous, physically-skilled, teenage nobleman\'s daughter, who is at a crossroads in her life.','/iNDVBFNz4XyYzM9Lwip6atSTFqf.jpg','2000-07-06',120,'Released','A timeless story of strength, secrets and two warriors who would never surrender.','Crouching Tiger, Hidden Dragon',146,13.3196,7.437,'q-HrIQLdaNE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15257,_binary '\0','/wsPLN1iFifrgxbbX76FUEVfR7WG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0190374',3.7,38198,'en','Dungeons & Dragons','The Empire of Izmer is a divided land: elite magicians called “mages” rule while lowly commoners are powerless. When Empress Savina vows to bring equality and prosperity to her land, the evil mage Profion plots to depose her.','/tLCsyHLHhTbzKzsL3IcBNyDKlZm.jpg','2000-12-08',107,'Released','This is no game.','Dungeons & Dragons',11849,5.0249,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15258,_binary '\0','/eJD6RzWXN4iHeVLOfIPphczQiw9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0190419',7.2,12802,'hi','ग़ुलाम','Sidharth (Aamir Khan), is a Mumbai \'Tapori\' and a boxing champion. His elder brother, Jai (Rajat Kapoor) works with Raunak Singh (Sharad Saxena), who now rules their \"Basti\" through terrorising its people and collecting \'Hafta\' from local merchants. Sidharth idolized his father, a freedom fighter, whom he saw falling to his death as a child. This effects Sidharth through his adult life. Sidharth meets a young girl, Alisha (Ranee Mukherjee), who rides with a motorcycle gang and Charlie (Deepak Tijori), the gang leader. Sidharth also meets Hari, whose idealism reminds him of his father. Hari\'s social work in the community possess a threat to Raunak Singh\'s evil empire. What happens to Hari changes Sidharth\'s life forever. How Sidharth breaks Raunak Singh\'s chains of \'Ghulami\' around the community forms the crux of the story. Featuring the superhit song \"Aati Kya Khandala\" sung by Aamir Khan.','/b1Nq1gKCp7JhwkCzmb5x9XGkmLu.jpg','1998-06-19',162,'Released',NULL,'Ghulam',51216,1.8274,6.254,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15259,_binary '\0','/7xhhGceFmuJh4nmmCakbhOcMTGQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0190506',6.7,5183,'pl','Kiler-ów 2-óch','Jurek Kiler has become a VIP - sponsoring the Polish government, playing tennis with the President, meeting world leaders. He must oversee a transfer of a substantial amount of gold. However, in his past activities, he has made enemies. Mighty ones. And thus Jurek Kiler\'s next adventure begins as he has to face attempts at kidnapping, assassinations and problems in his love life...','/y1bF4yRRLpc9M2EVrzwwyDdsjct.jpg','1999-01-08',113,'Released','Two times the fun','Killer 2',38872,1.7098,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15260,_binary '\0','/rzADbsNfcvTrmgfSKjO8Tv6vgsC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0190524',4.4,11189,'en','Left Behind','After learning that millions have completely vanished, an airline pilot, a journalist, and others work together to unravel the mystery of those left behind.','/5kT3kifA8Xwkjm1YmSubTw1GwK0.jpg','2000-10-30',100,'Released','The Future Is Clear.','Left Behind',37302,3.3322,4.2,'7h2LtAG3Mkw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15261,_binary '\0','/rbsm633lnt3hKHEpk7FOt3dy82a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0190590',7.7,355659,'en','O Brother, Where Art Thou?','In the deep south during the 1930s, three escaped convicts search for hidden treasure while a relentless lawman pursues them.','/2YztYilviFCYcEtDAnrOstUWGie.jpg','2000-08-30',107,'Released','They have a plan, but not a clue.','O Brother, Where Art Thou?',134,12.4408,7.327,'JvJ_5a6GHnE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15262,_binary '\0','/wK2Jd32UuLSvWIoV8uLmxu6lmcC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0190611',7.1,2819,'es','Pantaleón y las visitadoras','The Peruvian army captain Pantaleon Pantoja, a very serious and efficient officer, is chosen by his superiors to set up a special service of \'visitors\' to satisfy the sexual needs of the soldiers posted on remote jungle outposts.','/at0Pg8I1RSfg18K99cPEnEu6Bt5.jpg','1999-10-01',137,'Released',NULL,'Captain Pantoja and the Special Services',19822,1.9431,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15263,_binary '\0','/eA0qc5ihjSKG05tdJO4QPgYPAwY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0190641',6.4,50833,'ja','劇場版ポケットモンスター ミュウツーの逆襲','Determined to prove its superiority, a bio-engineered Pokémon called Mewtwo lures Ash, Pikachu and others into a Pokémon match like none before.','/6YPzBcMH0aPNTvdXNCDLY0zdE1g.jpg','1998-07-18',96,'Released','Who is the strongest Pokémon?','Pokémon: The First Movie',10228,6.1158,6.979,'hX-NHafvY5I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15264,_binary '\0','/hzV7oyPLy4JlESd7IWvD9AkgxlF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0190798',7.5,4018,'es','Solas','Maria has just moved into a decaying flat in a poor neighbourhood. She left her family in the countryside because she could no longer stand her father\'s authority. Pregnant by a man who refuses to see her, Maria gets by as a cleaning-woman. When her father is brought to the city for an operation, her mother moves into her flat.','/1ovtyHHDjyCXtf46w2Yv3yPeUDY.jpg','1999-03-05',101,'Released','Go deep, fear nothing, look for escape and be brave.','Alone',80713,0.9606,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15265,_binary '\0','/jjogwfWVmwc4l0iNEmxXdz9fXKU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0190861',6.6,8619,'en','Vatel','Vatel is the cook of Prince Condé. When the prince invites Louis XIV to hunt, he has to give lavish banquets in order to fall in his favour. But when Vatel falls in love with the king\'s mistress, love and duty conflict.','/qxtzOlO5FqFgSOGnNr0kFzo2Ho7.jpg','2000-05-01',103,'Released','Some men are too noble to live among aristocracy.','Vatel',7093,3.1704,6.125,'_AuOPnOboCE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15266,_binary '\0','/gPMYhwogEWMeUWqL0JJkSuwcafk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0190865',6,71291,'en','Vertical Limit','Trapped near the summit of K2, the world\'s second-highest mountain, Annie Garrett radios to base camp for help. Brother Peter hears Annie\'s message and assembles a team to save her and her group before they succumb to K2\'s unforgiving elements. But, as Annie lays injured in an icy cavern, the rescuers face several terrifying events that could end the rescue attempt -- and their lives.','/kpqQUEi8eAyYHMDFACf6YlnPIu7.jpg','2000-12-08',124,'Released','Hold your breath.','Vertical Limit',11678,11.0016,6,'pRdFuZSW4-Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15267,_binary '\0','/rn2McEtaY76wtVqUnhud5KPChGi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0191037',5.5,2431,'en','Circus','Bruno, a sadistic criminal, wants clever con man Leo out of the way. Leo and his equally clever wife, Lily, are up to something. So too is Julius: he hires Leo to kill Gloria, Julius\'s wife. Leo does it, but then Julius shows up with the murder on tape, saying Gloria isn\'t his wife - it\'s blackmail. Leo\'s bookie, Troy, is also closing in, wanting to be paid. Bruno and Lily as well as Bruno and Julius have their own scams running, and Leo is their target. Maybe Leo can get Troy off his back, avoid Moose (Bruno\'s huge enforcer), send Gloria\'s corpse out of England, turn the tables on Bruno\'s murderous brother Caspar, and outfox Lily. Or is Lily his fox? It\'s a three-ring circus.','/ttXgT8IspCtnJhRsqS6wtJBBRGM.jpg','2000-05-05',95,'Released','Don\'t trust any of these clowns','Circus',51179,1.9774,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15268,_binary '\0','/q4YO6abeyYNiAaBsbtJRLgNRqoo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0191043',8.1,19577,'fa','رنگ خدا','Mohammad joyfully returns to his tiny village on summer vacation from the Institute for the Blind, unaware of his widowed father\'s intentions to disown him in order to win the hand—and dowry—of a local woman. With the wedding swiftly approaching, Mohammad\'s future hangs precariously in the balance as his father struggles against his destiny, unable to see the wonder of life and love that\'s so clear to his son.','/rQ1t23NAGJDv9oNfHEAsxhuiAOG.jpg','1999-02-08',88,'Released','Story of a little boy, who sees the world by his heart and hands not by eyes...','The Color of Paradise',17078,2.6285,7.6,'3_RvGYkUhEk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15269,_binary '\0','/2BIo9ISDEW4leWVxJKbx59mxgOe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0191074',5.3,3621,'en','New Best Friend','Alicia is a poor girl starting college. Hadley, Julianne and Sydney are three well-off girls in a row house. Classes begin and Alicia is paired with Hadley to work on a sociology class project. At first rejected, Alicia is finally accepted into Hadley\'s clique where she is introduced to a world of privilege and dangerous thrills. But her attempts to become one of them ultimately land her in the hospital.','/jfLukUjlYMvKSlYysdJeNKI8EVN.jpg','2002-04-12',91,'Released','How far would you go to fit in?','New Best Friend',44373,2.2137,5.1,'K8DoG5vXXu0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15270,_binary '\0','/n1FpfsKJsOzupFmAtXfJAkiJANF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0191133',5.6,8062,'en','The Fighting Temptations','Darrin Hill, a slick-talking but down-on- his-luck NYC advertising exec, returns to his hometown in Georgia to claim the inheritance his aunt left him. But before Darrin can collect the money, he must fulfill his aunt\'s final wish -- to create a local choir.','/1Dd8TBA6G0n1x2N8KpJvIefy2sB.jpg','2003-09-19',122,'Released','Don\'t fight the feeling.','The Fighting Temptations',22309,3.1717,5.8,'h6rTCW5JzIw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15271,_binary '\0','/bbDbM6ucn7TSpARZhWGvmMr1lto.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0191173',7.7,2790,'en','The Halloween Tree','Four children learn the origins of Halloween customs while trying to save the life of their friend.','/phcM1B7neu6g7ysw9CmIo35Qida.jpg','1993-10-02',69,'Released',NULL,'The Halloween Tree',45974,2.3649,6.7,'nSiUWYqSKB8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15272,_binary '\0','/ztDkizmVkL2nOQIduKRoqLUYqSc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0191182',7.5,3340,'de','Hitler - Eine Karriere','A keen chronicle of the unlikely rise to power of Adolf Hitler (1889-1945) and a dissection of the Third Reich (1933-1945), but also an analysis of mass psychology and how the desperate crowd can be deceived and shepherded to the slaughterhouse.','/jtaLqChWbcpdXvBO3VUwfL3IatE.jpg','1977-07-08',150,'Released','A career unparalleled in history','Hitler: A Career',60378,3.2491,7.426,'rfxi5os43M0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15273,_binary '\0','/wH4M4wvSR2kQqomE3N9dTStJre8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0191397',6.7,75181,'en','The Replacements','Maverick old-guard coach Jimmy McGinty is hired in the wake of a players\' strike to help the Washington Sentinels advance to the playoffs. But that impossible dream hinges on whether his replacements can hunker down and do the job. So, McGinty dusts off his secret dossier of ex-players who never got a chance (or screwed up the one they were given) and knits together a bad-dream team of guys who just may give the Sentinels their title shot.','/6qerI41HqkdRlio1sG0d5HLZcFN.jpg','2000-08-11',118,'Released','Throw the ball. Catch the girl. Keep it simple.','The Replacements',10393,8.6063,6.729,'YkOI1iX0BOI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15274,_binary '\0','/bZ7UfV85En1sbMpw6dZMzX74Z6w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0191423',5.7,1949,'en','Scooby Goes Hollywood','Shaggy and Scooby-Doo quit their Saturday morning TV series in pursuit of Hollywood stardom.','/t0DDWZVOyRjrpotc2qOvcFsRryp.jpg','1979-12-23',49,'Released',NULL,'Scooby Goes Hollywood',36972,2.5853,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15275,_binary '\0','/g64G14PlOmA5ov3SQNnqXQz6DPZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0191625',7.2,1220,'ru','Варвара-краса, длинная коса','One day, King Yeremei decides to go on a long hike in order to consider all his areas and compile their register. A well appears on his way home, but as soon as the sovereign bent over him, he was seized by the underwater king Chudo-Yudo and demanded an unusual ransom for his release — that which is in the state of Yeremei, but which he does not know about. The tsar is forced to agree to these conditions, because he thinks that each blade of grass was taken into account in the inventory — he still does not suspect that in his absence the Queen gave birth to him an heir.','/dswHqQYOeJgnaHTXJowFAAiVF4O.jpg','1970-12-30',81,'Released',NULL,'Barbara the Fair with the Silken Hair',20934,1.151,6.618,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15276,_binary '\0','/32SGFXLRJLaPzz2Sec0M7CXMGd8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0191636',7.1,5889,'fr','La Veuve de Saint-Pierre','In 1850, on the isolated French island of Saint-Pierre, a murder shocks the natives. Two fishermen are arrested. One of them, Louis Ollivier, dies in custody. The other, Neel Auguste, is sentenced to death by the guillotine. The island is so small that it has neither a guillotine nor an executioner. While those are sent for Auguste is placed under the supervision of an army Captain.','/dFQ2kQA9JlAIO0uL2KkrsmI4o2O.jpg','2000-04-19',112,'Released',NULL,'The Widow of Saint-Pierre',48217,2.543,6.623,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15277,_binary '\0','/eWCphjK0sdqeCyCPqnWpzkfqUIb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0191655',6.2,2445,'en','Witness Protection','Would you be willing to walk away from everyone and everything you\'ve ever known in exchange for your safety? This is the question facing career criminal Bobby \"Bats\" Batton (Tom Sizemore); on the outs with the mob and facing prosecution for a number of serious crimes, Batton is offered a deal by the FBI in which he will be given immunity in exchange for testifying against his former partners. However, Batton will have to join the Federal Witness Protection Program, which means that he, his wife, and his children will never again see their friends and family.','/xEHelrqC5AFnHSjPFR8XoIF0b7z.jpg','1999-12-11',105,'Released','When the mob wants you dead there\'s only one place to hide...','Witness Protection',98431,3.4719,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15278,_binary '\0','/9pYGjxsirMxpPkqjk1aM4gm2JF8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0191664',7.2,1878,'ja','座頭市あばれ凧','Blind masseur Zatoichi is nursed back to health by a young woman after he is shot by a gang member. Zatoichi, who had come to the village to repay a debt, now feels further indebted. He commits himself to use his amazing sword skills to help the young woman\'s father, whose river-crossing service is under attack by the same gang responsible for Zatoichi\'s wounds.','/q7M70mfiADpTBVz1JuKWR4NCXMK.jpg','1964-07-11',82,'Released',NULL,'Zatoichi\'s Flashing Sword',54265,1.797,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15279,_binary '\0','/gXahs8xwiF2VMZJK7JgtSZSgTDt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0191754',6.1,58315,'en','28 Days','After getting into a car accident while drunk on the day of her sister\'s wedding, Gwen Cummings is given a choice between prison or a rehab center. She chooses rehab, but is extremely resistant to taking part in any of the treatment programs they have to offer, refusing to admit that she has an alcohol addiction.','/tlgz7Shx0UavR5pyITeJ2mUHKFI.jpg','2000-04-06',103,'Released','The Life of the Party... before she got a life.','28 Days',10468,4.8477,6.2,'-dwp9ea0sSY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15280,_binary '\0','/iKKqWrk7ql0HaeJvX7hhNKzLfBi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0191996',6.1,4539,'en','Essex Boys','Billy has just scored an entry-level position with the local crime cartel. His first job is to mind Jason, a newly released thug with a vicious temper. Jason thinks it\'s his job to teach Billy about crime, drugs and women. Little does he know that Billy has his eyes on Jason\'s own wife, Lisa. When an ecstasy deal goes bad, Jason vows revenge on the boss, while Billy looks to take out Jason. Before long, bodies start turning up','/lW8lzJF4P0U8NjHvMftkNkDnaHR.jpg','2000-07-14',102,'Released','Some lines should never be crossed.','Essex Boys',18394,2.4237,5.7,'QsU0G4lZiwM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15281,_binary '\0','/yPCbDXSNBvAKasViTebGGXQJkk5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0192023',6.2,3718,'en','Finder\'s Fee','Friends Tepper, Quigley, Fishman, and Bolan get together for a weekly poker night with two simple rules: Everyone contributes a lottery ticket to the pot, and no one checks the numbers until the game ends. But this particular, stormy night is different: Tepper plans to propose to his girlfriend, and just before the weekly game, he finds a wallet outside his apartment with a winning lottery ticket worth $6 million. Tepper calls the wallet\'s owner, Avery, to come collect what\'s his, but keeps the winning ticket for himself...only for Avery to show up and ask to play a hand.','/czm0PdRjPCNpVkG7WMO9GhHCqKg.jpg','2001-06-19',100,'Released','The numbers don\'t lie...but the players just might.','Finder\'s Fee',5521,3.325,6.2,'bC8CNPLKvt8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15282,_binary '\0','/saQxwnIr4ftRmFpJeV9DQI1lsWd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0192071',5.7,21099,'en','Get Over It','When Berke Landers, a popular high school basketball star, gets dumped by his life-long girlfriend, Allison, he soon begins to lose it. But with the help of his best friend Felix\'s sister Kelly, he follows his ex into the school\'s spring musical. Thus ensues a love triangle loosely based upon Shakespeare\'s \"A Midsummer Night\'s Dream\", where Berke is only to find himself getting over Allison and beginning to fall for Kelly.','/A5cTiukvEqNuTpNFRgVTTf1aZOI.jpg','2001-03-08',87,'Released','Young, Free And Single. Again.','Get Over It',10050,4.0799,5.6,'bhbGq3fxm4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15283,_binary '\0','/wOEcgGdwvjtv2V12pqnStg0Y0dU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0192111',5.5,16231,'en','Head Over Heels','Ordinary single girl Amanda Pierce unexpectedly finds herself sharing an awesome Manhattan apartment with four sexy supermodels. Determined to bring Amanda into their world, the models give her the ultimate makeover. The plan works fabulously as Amanda connects with next door charmer Jim Winston. That is, until one night while spying on him, Amanda thinks she sees the man of her dreams committing a cold blooded crime.','/n5Ln7UmgKThD3QhPC6JS6WZgCXJ.jpg','2001-02-02',87,'Released','Unleash your inner model.','Head Over Heels',24940,4.0391,5.8,'UH4MB9v4kaE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15284,_binary '\0','/rL1vr8OwHAwKbLzVUfyAqCDAYXV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0192175',6.5,3396,'en','The Jetsons Meet the Flintstones','Elroy Jetson invents a time machine that takes him back to prehistoric times, where he meets the Flintstone family.','/9NJTAlOapW5jNVkt0ZZrTelfuiB.jpg','1987-11-15',92,'Released',NULL,'The Jetsons Meet the Flintstones',36868,3.0504,6.6,'wQcPlqt6dm8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15285,_binary '\0','/v3JIMHgB6QlLrT1LCQ3eaiXAQc6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0192194',6.7,8319,'en','Julien Donkey-Boy','Undiagnosed, untreated and generally untethered schizophrenic Julien lives with his pregnant younger sister, anorexic aspiring wrestler brother, sympathetic grandmother, and severely depressed and abusive German father.','/mK8pJA05Sdp3Hc4KWHMqhaMEbVW.jpg','1999-10-15',100,'Released','A fascinating journey into the mind of an adolescent schizophrenic.','Julien Donkey-Boy',42881,2.5166,6.9,'q3erNNfe6UQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15286,_binary '\0','/nAZtxTr5Rkfvj8Gj64WlRfWiJKo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0192213',7.3,1778,'zh','空山靈雨','In Ming Dynasty China, the retiring abbot of a Buddhist monastery invites two dignitaries to help him choose a successor, not suspecting that both of them have hired help to steal a priceless parchment kept in the temple.','/5tJdUYNXZIMgTyRneBkmKqqy3eN.jpg','1979-07-11',121,'Released',NULL,'Raining in the Mountain',76294,1.9926,7.3,'Gsq6wKpfUjY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15287,_binary '\0','/xiVZGT0kKT5wCy7VaYuf5rr6Fnu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0192255',5.8,12648,'en','The Little Vampire','Based on the popular books, the story tells of Tony who wants a friend to add some adventure to his life. What he gets is Rudolph, a vampire kid with a good appetite. The two end up inseparable, but their fun is cut short when all the hopes of the vampire race could be gone forever in single night. With Tony\'s access to the daytime world, he helps them to find what they\'ve always wanted.','/zBGfZGKX3KJnljxsX6r24lzRe0i.jpg','2000-10-13',95,'Released','They\'re not just best friends, they\'re blood brothers.','The Little Vampire',24100,4.7913,6.962,'XQhvp1fpYOA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15288,_binary '\0','/gYeqZJOnBN89uwA7bDdawey8tES.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0192335',7.5,6001,'en','Mr. Death: The Rise and Fall of Fred A. Leuchter, Jr.','Documentary filmmaker Errol Morris investigates the case of a man who became an authority on capital punishment, but was discredited when he got involved on the wrong side of a court case. Leuchter, a meek man whose appearance belies his grim expertise, develops what he says is a more effective electric chair. Before long, he\'s in demand from officials who want his opinions on other execution methods. But when called to aid the case of an accused Holocaust denier, Leuchter\'s problems begin.','/buoMN4p95mvB2JgyglMb5gKxurV.jpg','1999-12-29',91,'Released',NULL,'Mr. Death: The Rise and Fall of Fred A. Leuchter, Jr.',28216,1.886,7,'niBw8JakaFg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15289,_binary '\0','/iDXC10NwvaRMsfjdlDP3kwjOlZT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0192377',8.5,4085,'sr','Нож','In attempt to find out who he is and where his roots lie, Alija Osmanović discovers something far deeper and more important. He slowly discovers an evil that follows him as his destiny regardless of what his ancestors were called. Trying to find the reasons for this evil, he finds himself in a vicious circle. Running away from an irrational fear within him, he eventually finds the road to his faith.','/m0Cdbn7asKIFp0ajFxQvYN3Bi5V.jpg','1999-03-19',130,'Released',NULL,'The Knife',51128,0.793,6.4,'XO4WIUoCrsg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15290,_binary '\0','/sQgfkikdJ8huwB7RIOVJc9cFy8o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0192407',4.3,1861,'de','Otto - Der Katastrofenfilm','A man from Ostfriesland travels to Hamburg and sets course for America on a steamship to conquer this New World as well. What he leaves behind is a swath of devastation, a breach of confusion, a Milky Way full of music, a dead end full of mad jokes and perhaps a touch too much wordplay at the expense of others. But what is worst of all: he has also made a film about it!','/kIiaNNye4iFslWcohJtiqkLyWth.jpg','2000-03-22',87,'Released',NULL,'Otto - The Disaster Movie',9883,1.4497,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15291,_binary '\0','/9NFbh8Ii2AoPP67BuoYvLWReLfy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0192455',4.7,4048,'en','Picking Up the Pieces','A small New Mexican village discovers a severed hand that is considered a miracle of God, when it actually belongs to a murdered spouse with a husband in search of it.','/q5z7UhWHKTsoIR0x5dh0z8EMJd8.jpg','2000-05-26',95,'Released','A comedy that is not afraid to point the finger.','Picking Up the Pieces',31774,3.1617,4.3,'xeD4T6gKyuU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15292,_binary '\0','/1C6B8sGhhRWBmajZ4tQBSFbvmQy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0192578',5.3,2518,'en','Scooby-Doo! in Arabian Nights','Scooby-Doo and Shaggy travel to Arabia to become the Caliph\'s Royal Food Tasters. But they bite off more than they can chew and are forced to run for their lives! It\'s a wild magic carpet ride as Scooby-Doo, Shaggy and their genie (Yogi Bear) and a jolly sailor named Sinbad (Magilla Gorilla) take you on an adventure of mistaken identities, exotic locations and fun-filled action and surprises!','/lCQ4e2iogfvLqWsfYLQedcOUgeh.jpg','1994-09-03',69,'Released','Scooby-Doo meets the Yogi Bear!','Scooby-Doo! in Arabian Nights',13351,3.3213,7.3,'UOlkbbuOg08','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15293,_binary '\0','/4kWVUyJAF9AUrcBlNBOxs4ikcQf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0192614',5.6,35643,'en','The Skulls','A senior at an Ivy League college, who depends on scholarships and working on the side, gets accepted into the secret society The Skulls. He hopes it betters chances at Harvard but The Skulls is not what he thought and comes at a price.','/pYuggibfzm8LWgjnUKMMtii2430.jpg','2000-03-31',106,'Released','Getting in is easy. Getting out is a killer.','The Skulls',11478,5.7314,5.8,'B03lvL3pVp8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15294,_binary '\0','/4CXEDuM5LA8VlodhLAoylf0IEl6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0192618',6.2,9330,'en','Smart House','Ben Cooper and his family are struggling to get a grip on household chores, school and work. So when Ben sees that a Smart House is being given away, he enters the competition as often as he can, until they eventually win the house (named Pat). After moving in, Pat\'s personality radically begins to change, turning the Coopers against her.','/t9QsaGkvHCt5A2IEv8jN1TkPPfo.jpg','1999-06-26',82,'Released','Where the computer at home has opinions of her own.','Smart House',35215,2.9569,5.9,'SCDmXh7Yam4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15295,_binary '\0','/7uvkSxYBRuFyZgO5usCctNaXXx8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0192657',6.5,8973,'ko','쉬리','North Korea\'s 8th Special Forces hijack a shipment of CTX, a potent new liquid explosive, and threatens South Korea as part of a plot to re-unify the two countries. Ryu and Lee, special agents of O.P., South Korea\'s secret intelligence service, attempt to track down the terrorists and find the CTX. Meanwhile Hee, the 8th\'s ultra-bad female sniper, resurfaces to wreak havoc and haunt Ryu.','/7rmye0ThMHMT2VhZj7zdyCcHQVe.jpg','1999-02-13',125,'Released','No clues. No leads. No time.','Shiri',10355,2.6884,6.389,'iVGp7gBHz-4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15296,_binary '\0','/wApH0pzzDIiw5mKv8vnfVOlt0iR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0192718',7.8,5853,'fr','Un homme qui dort','A young student decides to have no more interaction with the world than is needed to minimally sustain life. His increasingly automaton-like behavior is coupled with a strange clarity of insight about the world around him.','/bEX0pQzpmsBM6pRo3meindwNTzE.jpg','1974-04-24',78,'Released','Just to wait until there is nothing left to wait for.','The Man Who Sleeps',104086,2.4742,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15297,_binary '\0','/sOn1tOLzvhRaEtOdRP4dxmweNBN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0192731',4.5,20451,'en','Urban Legends: Final Cut','The making of a horror movie takes on a terrifying reality for students at the most prestigious film school in the country. At Alpine University, someone is determined to win the best film award at any cost - even if it means eliminating the competition. No one is safe and everyone is a suspect.','/9kjGrnhMz37RYEd5BFcrU1qkPkl.jpg','2000-09-22',98,'Released','Legends never die.','Urban Legends: Final Cut',12212,5.6817,4.9,'ZZigtR5VBAw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15298,_binary '\0','/oY7pWz17RHaLPHycG8eVcKH1fA7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0192788',6.4,1533,'en','Where the Red Fern Grows','Set in the Ozark Mountains during the Great Depression, Billy Coleman works hard and saves his earnings for 2 years to achieve his dream of buying two coonhound pups. He develops a new trust in God as he faces overwhelming challenges in adventure and tragedy roaming the river bottoms of Cherokee country with \"Old Dan\" and \"Little Ann.\"','/zUDxfnWLq73rQaa8YSHBDGx96ZS.jpg','2003-05-03',86,'Released',NULL,'Where the Red Fern Grows',30071,2.6967,6.6,'C8JOVLR_1VI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15299,_binary '\0','/ebLDUPt6hQPgAqvINEASBFe7B9k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0192802',7.4,1405,'en','The Wind in the Willows','Jailed for his reckless driving, rambunctious Mr. Toad has to escape from prison when his beloved Toad Hall comes under threat from the wily weasels, who plan to build a dog food factory on the very meadow sold to them by Toad himself.','/oDXSed3TihGrQsNUbns5oIE8Urj.jpg','1995-12-24',74,'Released',NULL,'The Wind in the Willows',59178,2.2487,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15300,_binary '\0','/1FLwhmg40rMM1Z9iFXwk3KyKoIT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0192949',5.7,1863,'en','Stardom','A young girl is plucked from small-town obscurity and thrust into the spotlight of the glamorous world of super-models.','/tmvVAym5DE15R9ZdRMe49GOVps.jpg','2000-10-13',100,'Released','Sudden, Outrageous, Global Celebrity has a price tag.','Stardom',47302,1.9623,5.4,'n4s0zL1at2E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15301,_binary '\0','/9g5lQwq6VN4TGPBXEW2nvWLK4b4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0193164',6.8,1876,'en','A Flintstones Christmas Carol','Fred is cast as Ebenezer Scrooge in a stage adaption of the classic Christmas story, but is acting a bit stingy in real life.','/e0KbZdRvxuki9nrXqRtpkgcj3Vt.jpg','1994-11-24',70,'Released',NULL,'A Flintstones Christmas Carol',48874,2.3546,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15302,_binary '\0','/vykyyZPmJX8Pi08a3xV8zQGEpRN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0193187',6,2384,'en','Genius','Charlie Boyle finds that even his high IQ can\'t solve all of his problems when he takes on a double life in order to make friends his own age.','/ectbHu5dtNFNIgnTAhmyqxG55yo.jpg','1999-08-29',82,'Released','To fit in, genius Charlie Boyle added another side to himself','Genius',73527,1.9257,6.4,'-eVwG35RbpQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15303,_binary '\0','/6HtIoLN8VQ5IQQo9VU9HmM4jSFc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0193253',7.3,21409,'ja','人狼 JIN-ROH','A member of an elite paramilitary counter-terrorism unit becomes traumatized after witnessing the suicide bombing of a young girl and is forced to undergo retraining. However, unbeknownst to him, he becomes a key player in a dispute between rival police divisions, as he finds himself increasingly involved with the sister of the girl he saw die.','/63EMBxmcafkc4cWuUWQh2Ttd2jh.jpg','1999-11-17',102,'Released','A story of a man burdened with the destiny of a beast and a woman who dreamed of love.','Jin-Roh: The Wolf Brigade',823,6.1128,7.4,'leTBtP_pUm0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15304,_binary '\0','/8EtYE07RXkRqy4Mb5oz7G12v2h8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0193355',7.3,2502,'es','La Noche de los Lápices','The Night of the Pencils was a series of kidnappings and forced disappearances, followed by the torture, rape, and murder of a number of young students during the last Argentine dictatorship (known as the National Reorganization Process). The kidnappings took place over the course of several days beginning on September 16, 1976.','/8GjSq46q9YC3Vv2vFH6EBOYdXwT.jpg','1986-09-04',105,'Released','They were young students. They were raped, tortured, and shot.','Night of the Pencils',55269,1.5497,7,'Y41L4oZfWrg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15305,_binary '\0','/xUHUfugurdPJCIO33g6TFSEeK3c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0193364',4.7,10243,'en','The Order','When Rudy, an artifacts smuggler, goes to Jerusalem to rescue his kidnapped archeologist father, he faces deportation by a scheming police chief. Now, to find his dad and recover a sacred scroll, he\'ll have to outwit officials and a ruthless sect. With the help of a beautiful Israeli cop, Rudy battles a faction of religious zealots determined to see a holy war at all costs.','/xcs2taqwgKu2tDrcXd2k7XbtmLq.jpg','2001-05-05',89,'Released','Unleash the power.','The Order',37632,5.3087,5.114,'8ImEUX53wZk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15306,_binary '\0','/sPD0PDHStJo619mJzCrBuuYrN1o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0193524',2.2,18697,'en','The Star Wars Holiday Special','Luke Skywalker and Han Solo battle evil Imperial forces to help Chewbacca reach his imperiled family on the Wookiee planet - in time for Life Day, their most important day of the year!','/lGJDx7RCgyMMa3owtp150umMnnJ.jpg','1978-11-17',97,'Released','A galactic odyssey against oppression.','The Star Wars Holiday Special',74849,4.6332,3.396,'F3-Df7ROAxA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15307,_binary '\0','/h2CWPTirO4BGjG5KQ5Gubt2T6jX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0193560',5.3,6839,'en','Texas Rangers','Ten years after the Civil War has ended, the Governor of Texas asks Leander McNelly to form a company of Rangers to help uphold the law along the Mexican border. With a few veterans of the war, most of the recruits are young men who have little or no experience with guns or policing crime.','/69tMHlxiCYlYKGZm1aPH1u7hY88.jpg','2001-11-30',90,'Released','Count your bullets.','Texas Rangers',13503,2.6571,5.9,'BTwLLnBbot0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15308,_binary '\0','/qX3aU8iO3NeGJGOCU2vHvoXmcPx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0193741',5.9,1455,'fi','Badding','The life of Rauli \"Badding\" Somerjoki, a Finnish singer.','/z3S0NiEpi5dHLbvdECaXPk6SOXa.jpg','2000-08-18',103,'Released',NULL,'Badding',35735,1.8581,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15309,_binary '\0','/r0x2H8lsnLBrgyfBZQdePyiB2I7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0193854',6.3,2720,'en','A Shot at Glory','The irascible manager of a lower-division Scottish football side must contend with problems off and on the field when his team\'s impatient American owner demands they win the Scottish Cup or else be relocated to Ireland, while also dealing with the forced arrival of a new star striker - who happens to be his estranged son-in-law, whom he blames for the breakdown of his relationship with his daughter.','/ixYNeNqUAEGMth666MnvjqTG1Vo.jpg','2000-05-03',114,'Released','A small town. A small team. A big dream.','A Shot at Glory',72087,2.4741,5.7,'97ax8T7RPMs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15310,_binary '\0','/9J5uTNQqpLLlb1REGqTlxYMeIdQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0193879',4.8,1745,'es','Dimensiones ocultas','On his 17th birthday, a boy named Michael has a surprise party thrown by his friends, where a session with a Ouija board accidentally unleashes a demon named Virgil, who possesses one of them to go on a killing spree. Michael, now plagued by violent nightmares and premonitions, sets out to try and stop the killings.','/bMC8GpjVKBusffUE8hrSOTdIRcp.jpg','1989-03-02',90,'Released','Possessed by Horror.','Don\'t Panic',84387,1.6077,5.8,'t3YlOGSUhv8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15311,_binary '\0','/5eyfRHuHEAv66TciacfFD7HOs28.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0194104',7,3034,'nl','Lek','Based on a book about an infamous real scandal in the Dutch crime scene, the film aims at exposing the horrors caused by corruption on both sides of the law. A rookie policeman is coerced into obtaining secret information from a childhood friend turned gangster. The childhood friend turns informant. But his revelations are hardly the most important \"leaks\" in the story. In fact, the new relationship between old friends goes all wrong, and the young policeman becomes increasingly involved in a deadly web of lies, crimes, treason, and revenge, all seemingly out of control.','/3iDdIqMhbJpOypH3MfSkoVYiQCs.jpg','2000-07-15',105,'Released',NULL,'Leak',49325,1.2202,6.18,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15312,_binary '\0','/lcZPwn4zCLQWLsFPAk9MrpRskku.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0194218',6.6,9701,'en','Panic','Alex is going through a midlife crisis and it has become a very difficult time for him. His marriage is struggling, he\'s worried about his son, and his job of killing people for his family has become the most stressful part of his life. He seeks the help of a therapist and meets a woman in the waiting room that he connects with.','/gCaWBW6qQ0otWliRi0Gs4bAzgDX.jpg','2000-12-01',88,'Released','A story of family, lust, murder... and other midlife crises.','Panic',20637,2.8432,6.2,'h6qvVd-jg4Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15313,_binary '\0','/pi2J4AtHvigbCTYm1sEyQfrifPs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0194314',5.2,13479,'fr','Romance','Frustrated by the lack of intimacy in her relationship, a young schoolteacher goes through a series of intimidating and often violent sexual partners.','/xR2b19JyLr8ssLzIvaXBOkGkghm.jpg','1999-04-14',99,'Released','Love is desolate. Romance is temporary. Sex is forever.','Romance',26338,2.6397,5.5,'aq84LLLnHng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15314,_binary '\0','/nxeEkRZOOjVMHA7OmB7QVZz4sNN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0194368',6,4617,'en','Chain of Fools','An avid detective is assigned to investigate the heist of a batch of precious coins that end up in the hands of a suicidal barber.','/rUwl3cfSf60aP1uvfb4QIEVMHuq.jpg','2001-03-03',96,'Released','Why should smart people get all the money?','Chain of Fools',20682,2.1548,5.8,'1Q-5sQ8G38k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15315,_binary '\0','/4NoosADizDFdr3KLOQ6C5cgSaNr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0194378',6.8,2205,'es','Silvia Prieto','After her 27th birthday, Silvia Prieto decides to take charge of her life and make some changes. At the same time, she suddenly finds herself intertwined in the life of another woman who is also named Silvia Prieto.','/cmnAjgJ6z495FTcPg9iOzAH1wKD.jpg','1999-02-24',93,'Released','A reflection on what it means - or does not mean - to be yourself.','Silvia Prieto',49984,1.0813,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15316,_binary '\0','/ofMraBd4ClPBRK5oT7mgvNipeDb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0194422',6.2,3496,'en','Seventeen Again','Cat and Gene have been divorced for several years. They are both visiting their son and their grandchildren, Sydney and Willie. Willie\'s a genius who develops a formula that makes who uses it young again, it inadvertently spills into some soap that Willie places in his grandparents room. When each of them uses it they finds themselves 17 again. Willie had to find a way to reverse the process but will his grandparents want to be old again?','/ypMJVLjfhtx1B6TLGAqFTvy4AKl.jpg','2000-11-12',97,'Released','It\'s a Major Mix Up!','Seventeen Again',52051,1.6261,7,'CtcJ2DrtZYA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15317,_binary '\0','/gGXpY7kZx34Ulo9Rnand43mqt1D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0194426',7.5,1689,'ja','太陽を盗んだ男','A high school science teacher is the butt of all his students\' jokes, until their bus is hijacked on a school trip. But something more sinister lurks beneath the surface: he\'s building an atomic bomb in his apartment.','/mCzqMbajf0p9aGe7Z4HU5FHl5AA.jpg','1979-10-06',147,'Released',NULL,'The Man Who Stole the Sun',59352,2.2025,7.381,'5j_XDeTO2Yg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15318,_binary '\0','/loKUZVDpVV0XSoasOmA2JcMRoKE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0194530',6.4,1304,'en','Whatever Happened to Harold Smith?','It\'s 1976, and Vinny is a confused teenager who can\'t decide whether he is a disco king or a proto punk rocker.','/iXYzdpQEdPnj1rzucvZyUOqFwzL.jpg','2000-03-10',95,'Released','In 1977, disco wasn\'t the only magic in town.','Whatever Happened to Harold Smith?',49922,1.969,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15319,_binary '\0','/psUtgZRTrlz8tfYKeDpPcfb3eFq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0194722',4.7,3140,'en','Bridge of Dragons','The tough and cold mercenary Warchild, is working for the man who took care of his war training and upbringing, the greedy General Ruechang. Ruechang is planning to take over the country by marrying Princess Halo. But Halo discovers that Ruechang killed her father to gain more power than he had working for the King, so she decides to run away. Warchild is the one who has to bring her back to Ruechang, but the one thing no one counted on happens... Warchild and Halo falls in love, and together they take on the forces of Ruechang... Written by Zorteper -','/e5jzAQ1pyoUnytzCC8X9S4nayBN.jpg','1999-06-30',92,'Released','No Reasons! No Rules! No Submission! No Mercy!','Bridge of Dragons',36293,2.2779,5.6,'ctEtxrAfFhw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15320,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0194773',2.5,1263,'en','Corrupt','After decades of terror, two deadly street gangs reach a delicate truce and young MJ (Silkk the Shocker) sees a way out of the hood once and for all. Only Corrupt (Ice-T) stands in MJ\'s way, resulting into a violent and brutal roller coaster ride of action!','/bV3WtFCe3blZr5z2uZJyRAJchEZ.jpg','1999-12-28',66,'Released','Cross the line...pay the price.','Corrupt',49380,1.4215,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15321,_binary '\0','/cPsQFyia91dgMrHEw07ckhrQdPh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0194946',7.8,4528,'en','Hornblower: The Duchess and the Devil','Acting Lieutenant Hornblower and his crew are captured by the enemy while escorting a Duchess who has secrets of her own.','/h1lj9Ppc54dmv3KpjH9915DQa1N.jpg','1999-02-24',93,'Released',NULL,'Hornblower: The Duchess and the Devil',37065,1.7132,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15322,_binary '\0','/8Chey6igDxv7WF6goflYGy3tTJb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0194947',8,4957,'en','Hornblower: The Examination for Lieutenant','Acting Lieutenant Hornblower attempts to study for his promotion examination, but becomes distracted by the serious supply problems that face his crew.','/rTr2RvAopTve6QTsxz4f8V1cCgC.jpg','1998-11-18',93,'Released',NULL,'Hornblower: The Examination for Lieutenant',35494,2.0816,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15323,_binary '\0','/srUf1xoByWfirQf7cJfe8r0U1k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0194948',7.9,4624,'en','Hornblower: The Frogs and the Lobsters','Lieutenant Hornblower and his shipmates are sent to accompany a doomed royalist invasion of revolutionary France.','/ujgdXCaBoUtsz5WzQcVcsviiEgU.jpg','1999-04-02',100,'Released',NULL,'Hornblower: The Frogs and the Lobsters',37067,2.3227,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15324,_binary '\0','/czs1srOcEsRDEKMCfpihDQ8V81i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0195002',7.8,6352,'hi','कौन','While alone in the house, a woman hears news of serial killer on the loose. And then a stranger rings the doorbell...','/tNiBlJVAscbSHiWllhpksmnDFgC.jpg','1999-02-26',90,'Released','Do not open the Door......','Kaun?',142412,1.4107,6.718,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15325,_binary '\0','/t1EnlBK2AbrkyAqfUltgbWpeU46.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0195165',5.3,1869,'en','Possessed','An 11 year old boy starts throwing temper tantrums, vomiting on and attacking people, and swearing uncontrollably. Furniture begins to move on its own when he is around, and he doesn\'t remember any of it. After giving up on the protestants, the boy\'s parents turn to the catholic church for help. Father Bowden is a WWII veteran who is experiencing nightmares, flashbacks and other personal problems, including alcoholism. He is recruited by the archbishop to perform a series of exorcisms. This is the apparent true account of the last exorcism known to have been done by the catholic church.','/y69KzSWrryMLJJZ7aVOy1qjnFg4.jpg','2000-10-22',110,'Released',NULL,'Possessed',68572,2.1402,5.4,'M4WswLUJSDY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15326,_binary '\0','/oVx0FhUDayBBSVbuTbWxoLOVFAk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0195231',8.2,18765,'hi','सत्या','A young man named Satya comes to Mumbai from South India in search of a job. Jailed for something he did not do, the once-honest young man meets an underworld boss, Bhiku Mhatre in jail and joins his gang.','/wwgpEEGU5RVu5hM7AZa6oiivcln.jpg','1998-07-03',170,'Released','The Other Side of Truth','Satya',21502,1.6845,7.2,'V0ZHTqJj9yQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15327,_binary '\0','/7GQH1qYmqu0llcYque6flDmSR55.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0195234',6.9,20301,'en','Saving Grace','Unexpectedly widowed, prim and proper housewife Grace Trevethyn finds herself in dire financial straits when she inherits massive debts her late husband had been accruing for years. Faced with losing her house, she decides to use her talent for horticulture and hatches a plan to grow potent marijuana which can be sold at an astronomical price, thus solving her financial crisis.','/ml8XwUomPfisNsKmluP8TIZOR89.jpg','2000-01-24',93,'Released',NULL,'Saving Grace',2360,3.579,6.5,'-n8rHwtoEwo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15328,_binary '\0','/iwMEFGEVf29WQCWhiT88CANAgv7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0195256',7.7,2866,'zh','神女','A young prostitute, who is trying to give her infant son a good start in life, must contend with a coercive pimp and the prejudices of others.','/mhKVL4m9anBX0S8N6SWqsXx6W2S.jpg','1934-12-07',79,'Released','A story of a mother’s love.','The Goddess',112698,1.2469,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15329,_binary '\0','/m8igxLkPDJuNTTibnpnhnYXS85q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0195274',7,1783,'cs','Slunce, seno, jahody','A Czech agricultural student, Šimon Plánička, arrives at the small South Bohemian town of Hoštice, and joins the local JZD (agricultural co-op) with the intention of trying out his experiment regarding the \"Milk yield of cows in regards to a cultured environment\". He runs into difficulty with the directorship of the JZD, but he finds them eager to help once they hear he\'s the son of the local agricultural commissioner, as his last name is also Plánička. Blažena Škopková is given the task of finding out how things are looking. However everything is complicated by the jealousy of Blažena\'s boyfriend Venca.','/xmQvdloN2a7RmG2hAhPDYFYuvk0.jpg','1984-09-01',83,'Released','Crazy Comedy from Zdenek Troška','Sun, Hay, Strawberries',36994,1.211,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15330,_binary '\0','/7LLXBR8WUUDDi0lO75M4XXZQU5S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0195324',8.1,1495,'pt','São Paulo, Sociedade Anônima','Carlos is a young man from the São Paulo middle class who works for a big company during a time when foreign automobile industries were settling in Brazil. Shortly after, he accepts a job at a factory that makes automobile parts, where he becomes manager. To a certain extent, he is a family man who works hard, earns well and lives unsatisfied. Without any prospects in his life to change the condition he rejects, his last resort is escaping.','/9iSg7G6prnf3Y9nd3FIqO5IvMHa.jpg','1965-01-01',109,'Released','Anguish and emotion in the big city','São Paulo, Incorporated',74360,1.7937,8.108,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15331,_binary '\0','/3HmLKhahTxX2ALTWlagr92pZrU7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0195685',7.5,249791,'en','Erin Brockovich','A twice-divorced mother of three who sees an injustice, takes on the bad guy and wins -- with a little help from her push-up bra. Erin goes to work for an attorney and comes across medical records describing illnesses clustered in one nearby town. She starts investigating and soon exposes a monumental cover-up.','/eMs20iUQyZVs05Ck7Q0LNnRsstr.jpg','2000-03-17',131,'Released','She brought a small town to its feet and a huge company to its knees.','Erin Brockovich',462,10.7822,7.427,'jjqUUxIy_yk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15332,_binary '\0','/7isarjYDEKZ5t1CgcvbuqEUby8P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0195714',6.7,340923,'en','Final Destination','After a teenager has a terrifying vision of him and his friends dying in a plane crash, he prevents the accident only to have Death hunt them down, one by one.','/1mXhlQMnlfvJ2frxTjZSQNnA9Vp.jpg','2000-03-17',98,'Released','No accidents. No coincidences. No escapes. You can\'t cheat death.','Final Destination',9532,18.4877,6.641,'9hvUxRGeBhA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15333,_binary '\0','/qUkkAGbccOW5e0bWIjY85kK7Cud.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0195778',5.2,9323,'en','Here on Earth','Three lives of three young people intersect over the course of one summer. A rich student and a young working-class man accidentally destroy a diner when their impromptu road race takes a disastrous turn. Ordered by a judge to spend the summer repairing the building, they find themselves becoming rivals for the affections of the owner\'s daughter.','/shvubL3pIrCyEK22ZHrx00oNtCY.jpg','2000-03-24',96,'Released','One summer totally changed their lives.','Here on Earth',13539,2.5194,5.8,'3Pqyut8w8qw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15334,_binary '\0','/imZGOBuruwVJtXWdDHaTCorlrrs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0195855',7.3,1348,'fi','Katsastus','Viltteri, a balding guy in his thirties living in rural northern Finland, is hopelessly clueless about his new role as a married man and the father of a newborn son. A perfect escape from family responsibilities is having to get his old Hillman Minx repaired and inspected for road-worthiness, with a little help from an eccentric bunch of friends who never seem to have grown up either.','/tBaPV5VQiTn2afZIipopyw6Zb3D.jpg','1988-09-01',56,'Released',NULL,'The Wedding Waltz',38203,1.343,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15335,_binary '\0','/aOAuDRx1xeztkhFB3yl37IrRD92.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0195909',7.5,3417,'en','Meeting People Is Easy','Meeting People Is Easy takes place during the promotion of Radiohead\'s 1997 release OK Computer, containing a collage of video clips, sound bites, and dialogue going behind the scenes with the band on their world tour, showing the eventual burn-out of the group as the world tour progresses. The inaugural show of the OK Computer tour began on 22 May 1997 in Barcelona, Spain.','/3WtnnmgQNAZ2il10aW86haQI8g1.jpg','1998-03-20',95,'Released','A film by Grant Gee about Radiohead.','Meeting People Is Easy',19362,1.2829,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15336,_binary '\0','/xi4Uy11TdACds3SXglrbbmaVd90.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0195945',6.2,48115,'en','Next Friday','A streetwise man flees South Central Los Angeles heading to the suburbs and his lottery-winner uncle and cousin to avoid a neighborhood thug with a grudge who has just escaped from prison. But trouble soon follows and the suburbs will never be the same.','/dP4fYCGQZzg17ta7FvLwJVCwwt9.jpg','2000-01-12',98,'Released','The suburbs make the hood look good.','Next Friday',10471,4.9929,6.532,'mKepqz19Qb0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15337,_binary '\0','/2JbJDI5FV5IP0GiFKtAIaILg270.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0196069',7.7,8529,'bo','འཁོར་བ།','A love story situated in the Himalayas. A Buddhist monk can\'t choose between life and the way of the Buddha.','/j97jPOtKRpPjNSoaupokZHWGQaj.jpg','2002-04-30',138,'Released',NULL,'Samsara',8341,2.1227,7.467,'B76ulnQf2bk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15338,_binary '\0','/r4vnelohQBrUKhl181s4PjdRMTz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0196106',4.3,2995,'en','MVP: Most Valuable Primate','Jack is a three-year-old chimpanzee who has been the subject of a long-term experiment by Dr. Kendall, a researcher who been teaching Jack to communicate through sign language. Jack scrambles onto the ice in the midst of practice for Steven\'s junior league hockey team, and he and his teammates discover the monkey has a natural talent for the game.','/pRCciMvFOABm41eat8EKYa0BYIL.jpg','2000-08-11',93,'Released','Jack skates a little faster... Shoots a little harder... And is driving everyone bananas.','MVP: Most Valuable Primate',32834,2.4476,4.755,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15339,_binary '\0','/zIaoDdptaMCjjEwG3jO08WfkQfJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0196158',3.5,7755,'en','Ticker','Ray Nettles, a detective of San Francisco, and his partner Fuzzy must take up to one of the most dangerous terrorist gangs of the city. When one of the terrorists, the beautiful scientist Claire Manning is arrested, Swan, the leader of the terrorists, claims he will detonate bombs throughout the city if she is not released. Because of the possible bloodshed, Nettles calls for the help of explosive expert Frank Glass...','/qHuAAGikw2bTaam7K5B8btwUECM.jpg','2001-06-23',92,'Released','When the countdown hits zero, you\'re dead','Ticker',31002,2.5815,3.7,'FbJlg1HdYZg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15340,_binary '\0','/lcODO1ft7w32LEFB1h3vdfDuIdV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0196176',5.8,1252,'it','Tutti gli uomini del deficiente','Nearing death, videogame genius Leone Stella holds a contest to find an heir: several people named like him will compete in a live-streamed reenactment of his most famous exploits, and the winner will inherit his billion-dollar fortune.','/9eYrJp5Rcsl3dtJehOpNYLuMTQJ.jpg','1999-12-17',109,'Released',NULL,'Tutti gli uomini del deficiente',73649,1.5589,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15341,_binary '\0','/frZxX6UnkiBAWYwTR7AW7uaRJpI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0196216',6.7,43000,'en','Small Time Crooks','A loser of a crook and his wife strike it rich when a botched bank job\'s cover business becomes a spectacular success.','/eIJRFZFDmh0xXPlKt3WwN5fiSLe.jpg','2000-05-19',94,'Released','They took a bite out of crime.','Small Time Crooks',10569,4.8538,6.464,'MAWsmINQqJk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15342,_binary '\0','/jIxBog1AFd9tGaG1HMCbSice3h6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0196219',2.2,1264,'en','The Wrecking Crew','A high-level government hit squad is sent into the streets in order to complete a deadly mission.','/65lnZrtjriAB4rC7rf7OPsqmcIp.jpg','2000-03-21',80,'Released','Time to clean house.','The Wrecking Crew',90289,1.087,3.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15343,_binary '\0','/yBte8X4gPAqypZg0dsGzzVeRtPJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0196223',5.4,1540,'en','The Right Temptation','A detective falls for the man she\'s supposed to be investigating; dire complications follow.','/3UCwEsLUywrV58DjW8u1nr9ZJse.jpg','2000-08-19',95,'Released','She\'s A Private Investigator Who\'s Found The Wrong Man But...','The Right Temptation',55921,1.6862,5.9,'hVT7KW2lC6s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15344,_binary '\0','/lIyyiBOuyokL82rPEDcZaMKleA3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0196229',6.5,320698,'en','Zoolander','Clear the runway for Derek Zoolander, VH1\'s three-time male model of the year. His face falls when hippie-chic Hansel scooters in to steal this year\'s award. The evil fashion guru Mugatu seizes the opportunity to turn Derek into a killing machine. It\'s a well-designed conspiracy and only with the help of Hansel and a few well-chosen accessories like Matilda can Derek make the world safe for male models everywhere.','/qdrbSneHZjJG2Dj0hhBxzzAo4HB.jpg','2001-09-28',89,'Released','3% body fat. 1% brain activity.','Zoolander',9398,9.4174,6.234,'YtQq0T3ExLs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15345,_binary '\0','/rhj7SiBtWzP2ZkVuJvpcKDr5Byn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0196267',4.4,17266,'en','Cruel Intentions 2','After his precocious behavior has gotten him bounced out of one more in a string of exclusive private schools, 16-year old Sebastian Valmont has arrived in New York City to live with his father and stepmother. The cunning and handsome Sebastian may have met his match, however, in his equally manipulative and beautiful stepsister Kathryn Merteuil.','/soO0nrnh9lEdTgGFBT0IIvejwcK.jpg','2000-11-09',87,'Released','Seduce and destroy.','Cruel Intentions 2',5458,5.7383,5.083,'QW0Rm8_HyNE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15346,_binary '\0','/4MZwxXhz4iGPsm5t3gcMrBVQYWS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0196530',3.7,1553,'en','Empire','Filmed by Jonas Mekas from the 44th floor of the Time-Life Building, “Empire” explores the passage of time without the use of characters or a traditional narrative. The film, that consists of one stationary shot of the Empire State Building, was made from standard 1,200-foot rolls of 16mm film with a more than eight-hour runtime.','/qPV0RWUAZFMsNNSJtqA8pXU5xfW.jpg','1965-03-06',479,'Released',NULL,'Empire',108419,1.677,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15347,_binary '\0','/nRrt3KNzjQNr70GyS0oteFNost5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0196632',7.2,2403,'en','Inherit the Wind','Two great lawyers argue the case for and against a science teacher accused of the crime of teaching evolution.','/rgH4hyR25OE2AvuW55URkp8bmA.jpg','1999-05-29',113,'Released','The Landmark Trial That Forever Changed A Nation.','Inherit the Wind',103648,2.6839,6.3,'PeriPGQ8VcY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15348,_binary '\0','/Ak1UA1x9VzhbSYNMKq10U0hdcSf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0196635',4.8,2582,'hi','International Khiladi','News reporter, Payal, is assigned the task of interviewing a high ranking criminal, Devraj. However, they both fall in love with each other and, in the process, anger Devraj\'s guardian.','/j7xOLc1NmpxtfaK3el5wcC7loab.jpg','1999-03-26',160,'Released',NULL,'International Khiladi',117335,1.133,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15349,_binary '\0','/2tUCOsH8PW14ShjJdz8zU4EBJsq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0196708',6.2,2858,'en','Lockdown','Avery (Jones) returns to college as a competitive swimmer after getting his life back on track. But his life takes another unexpected turn when he and his two friends (Bonds, Casseus) are wrongly accused of murder and end up in prison.','/5nWDXa8zOK0Jf2dVjBtUgmsw8fs.jpg','2000-09-15',105,'Released',NULL,'Lockdown',50380,2.4441,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15350,_binary '\0','/8aXfrieoiTOWZ4gvLMfNsuC3MJS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0196723',5.6,1597,'en','Forever Lulu','A schizophrenic romantic tracks down her college sweetheart to help her find their son she gave up for adoption sixteen years ago to the dismay of his new wife.','/7MvNnjU6l5x2KQJ0qYH6rxlBfcj.jpg','2000-07-07',95,'Released',NULL,'Forever Lulu',17806,2.8102,5.4,'G6MVwrR5RoU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15351,_binary '\0','/vELKA00w4Zg2S3DVEbISLfiFLO4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0196750',7.6,1567,'el','Μια Τρελλή, Τρελλή Οικογένεια','Mika is a young woman living in a crazy ... family. Her mother, Pasta Flora, is alienated, her little sister is uncontrollable, and her father is a good, but cowardly, man. She\'s engaged to Mikis but the day before their wedding she goes to Venice and marries Andreas, who, after meeting her family, he undertakes to make sense of them.','/1TR7L5HS2WlOQVp7hGLJfTKtciv.jpg','1965-10-25',101,'Released',NULL,'A Crazy, Crazy Family',183388,0.7975,7.824,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15352,_binary '\0','/cvi87c0MElnvslK5asTyLCmx4jL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0196811',6.5,4057,'pt','Olga','Based upon the true story of Olga Benário, the German-born wife of Brazilian communist leader Luís Carlos Prestes. During the dictatorship of Getúlio Vargas (1930-1945) she was arrested and sent to Nazi Germany, where she was put to death in a concentration camp. After World War II began, Vargas decided to uphold the Allies.','/zym9l0b5eu6fDeBXJzbDuVYMOVJ.jpg','2004-08-20',141,'Released','Lots of passions in just one life','Olga',34671,1.5734,7.147,'Qf2rOV755kg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15353,_binary '\0','/dgRVFKHRf1frNXtX2aDesBBES9t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0196857',5.5,12785,'en','Play It to the Bone','Two aging fighters in LA, friends, get a call from a Vegas promoter because his undercard fighters for a Mike Tyson bout that night are suddenly unavailable. He wants them to box each other. They agree as long as the winner gets a shot at the middleweight title. They enlist Grace, Cesar\'s current and Vinnie\'s ex girlfriend, to drive them to Vegas.','/qSJl8pD17doJsAkou5mPvDogBQT.jpg','1999-12-25',124,'Released',NULL,'Play It to the Bone',20761,4.8702,5.464,'ovju_D3QB5Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15354,_binary '\0','/vG2GwWeF6wPDN1zIqM7dCooVdTe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0197042',8.8,2756,'el','Της Κακομοίρας','This classic Greek comedy revolves around the constant fights between Zikos who works as a clerk at a small grocer\'s shop and the shop\'s owner. Zikos just can\'t keep his mouth shut every time his boss behaves as being an aristocrat. Things go even worse when Zikos finds out that his boss, by taking advantage of his wealth and with the help of the local match-maker, is planning to marry a young poor girl living in the same neighborhood.','/gaQ4zzEpZkmEWPvoLFFW1W5POlJ.jpg','1963-06-18',96,'Released',NULL,'World Gone Mad',81365,1.3973,8.216,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15355,_binary '\0','/bhPYt1T4FFYE8cA25Djp2wsQAWP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0197094',6.3,3956,'en','What Becomes of the Broken Hearted?','Five years have passed and Jake has turned his back on his family. He\'s still up to his usual tricks in McClutchy\'s Bar, unaware, as he downs his latest opponent, that his eldest son, Nig, has died in a gang fight. The uncomfortable family reunion at Nig\'s funeral sparks a confrontation with second son, Sonny, and sets Jake and Sonny on a downward spiral.','/hdjZtu4hpapjPLekFZXLOijuLzX.jpg','1999-05-27',108,'Released','Once they were warriors. Men of Honour. Now five years on one man\'s battle has only just begun.','What Becomes of the Broken Hearted?',13893,1.5379,6.6,'P6iazDonV9U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15356,_binary '\0','/f7BKz0EkxYudtUeyb0uyJ1BkaKW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0197096',6.8,3170,'en','What\'s Cooking?','Four families of different ethnicities prepare for a potentially explosive Thanksgiving dinner.','/1kK3fktULJ4FpXoeruTY7n34Hq0.jpg','2000-01-20',110,'Released','Thanksgiving. A celebration of food, tradition and relative insanity.','What\'s Cooking?',77434,2.0474,5.5,'BZFl7kQbznI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15357,_binary '\0','/jy18bZ82yg8db16uRfIbPX44szv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0197230',5.7,1627,'en','An American Tail: The Mystery of the Night Monster','Follow the clues to fun and excitement as the beloved little mouse takes on a big monster in this charming, full-length adventure. When a ferocious, mouse-nabbing creature puts fear into the hearts of New York City\'s rodents, Fievel and his friends team up with a reporter to chase after the scoop of the century and -- just maybe -- get a close-up look at the bad guy himself!','/oTV5TwZ4i6wDcWxoNpczk4CQBbM.jpg','1999-10-06',78,'Released',NULL,'An American Tail: The Mystery of the Night Monster',27653,3.664,6.3,'PH28N8aokKU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15358,_binary '\0','/cbyltS3y1OUmzTr4vKo1y2X57EY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0197384',5.8,3484,'en','Crime + Punishment in Suburbia','Roseanne looks forward to her high school graduation and leaving her dysfunctional home life behind -- until a brutal act brings doom to all involved.','/gA6FiAOm8De8v0RFOrdUPn9mgXX.jpg','2000-08-25',100,'Released','No one stays innocent forever','Crime + Punishment in Suburbia',46119,3.6176,5.7,'08zTXSc4frk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15359,_binary '\0','/zaCHdD62UdUJQTYuCXrsr4ma2lk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0197402',6.6,1475,'no','Detektor','Daniel Jor is a 28-year-old psychiatrist, still living with his mom. He and his friend Ronny have one thing in common, they like searching for metallic objects in the ground. One day they find a jewel with the name \"Janne\" imprinted. This is the beginning of something big for Daniel. His life will never be the same. He\'s about to discover a lot of hidden secrets, about himself and others.','/dp3dSBGBpNWSFzIBKiEVK0wXnZv.jpg','2000-08-25',104,'Released',NULL,'Detector',64114,0.8997,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15360,_binary '\0','/cVE52iLZDjCkF9I59qfUQkgmOf3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0197521',6.3,9653,'en','Godzilla, King of the Monsters!','During an assignment, foreign correspondent Steve Martin spends a layover in Tokyo and is caught amid the rampage of an unstoppable prehistoric monster the Japanese call \'Godzilla\'. The only hope for both Japan and the world lies on a secret weapon, which may prove more destructive than the monster itself.','/19RDmhX6LtzMxv0KXXAU1IBIvvA.jpg','1956-04-27',81,'Released','Incredible, unstoppable titan of terror!','Godzilla, King of the Monsters!',18983,4.0462,6.5,'2h1YmMbQxow','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15361,_binary '\0','/x2n7x2ZfMocYkzEY75g4UxvQYSC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0197569',6.8,5425,'fr','L\'humanité','In a quiet little French town, two detectives are tasked with investigating the brutal rape and murder of a preteen girl.','/fEEVsOpI21ZDY64tKMh4T3FZzCp.jpg','1999-09-10',149,'Released',NULL,'Humanité',65296,1.351,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15362,_binary '\0','/8BqUhFYjJZMpPRTnfAnmEYaQuNA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0197750',4,2481,'en','Paranoid','Chloe Keane is an stressed American fashion model living in London who is about to have the worst weekend of her life. She and her boyfriend are invited to attend a party at the house of a former rock-star named Stan and his weird family who live in the countryside. Chloe awakes the next morning only to find her boyfriend has abandoned her at Stan\'s house and she has been drugged and handcuffed to the bed.','/7ERnpPPhr6mbzKIAqdKsMi6ycQq.jpg','2000-10-26',93,'Released','Forbidden Passions Can Be Deadly.','Paranoid',33347,2.0268,3.9,'6L48OhX8vh4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15363,_binary '\0','/h170P8UJVqgGfo00vmA2vRnT7zj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0197924',4.8,2259,'en','The Substitute 3: Winner Takes All','At a college visit to a war buddy\'s professor daughter, mercenary Treat Williams finds her brutally beaten. He then poses as a teacher to teach a lesson to the football jocks responsible.','/zQ7rVfLbl72ZGoj3MGszLtMmNL7.jpg','1999-08-14',89,'Released',NULL,'The Substitute 3: Winner Takes All',50820,2.9065,5.3,'Hji3WPIHpns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15364,_binary '\0','/ahGSlXunI3Aa0MV4IXlpjYVSVWI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0198021',6.7,38628,'en','Where the Heart Is','Novalee Nation is a 17-year-old Tennessee transient who has to grow up in a hurry when she\'s left pregnant and abandoned by her boyfriend on a roadside, and takes refuge in the friendly aisles of Wal-Mart. Eventually, some eccentric but kindly strangers \'adopt\' Novalee and her infant daughter, helping them buck the odds and build a new life.','/rFzsuA5i1Cysth1gJQb3SBd4KMU.jpg','2000-04-27',120,'Released','Laughter is harder... Friendship is stronger... Trust is deeper... When it comes from the heart.','Where the Heart Is',10564,6.0849,7.1,'HbzcodGsaRs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15365,_binary '\0','/9Cf8ZsWLbBu4d8872SRl3GtgswP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0198386',5.6,5679,'en','The Crew','Four retired mobsters plan one last crime to save their retirement home.','/kdQOz5enVVz113zZQcuoqh3oACy.jpg','2000-08-21',88,'Released','It may be artificial, but it\'s still their turf.','The Crew',19150,3.0442,5.5,'RalfvRfCIp8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15366,_binary '\0','/qlyrBbdml2l1nXOnVnWotsAHt2n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0198545',7.3,2301,'en','Horton Hears a Who!','In this story, Horton discovers there is a microscopic community of intelligent beings called the Who\'s living on a plant that only he can hear. Recognising the dangers they face, he resolves to keep them safe. However, the other animals around him think Horton has gone crazy thinking that there are such beings.','/iYYMhLU7Q702XydshudAcyViJ9V.jpg','1970-03-18',26,'Released',NULL,'Horton Hears a Who!',29233,2.5902,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15367,_binary '\0','/sDTnMOJ3H5wI38OxObmCtK7wfd5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0198781',8.1,1091512,'en','Monsters, Inc.','Lovable Sulley and his wisecracking sidekick Mike Wazowski are the top scare team at Monsters, Inc., the scream-processing factory in Monstropolis. When a little girl named Boo wanders into their world, it\'s the monsters who are scared silly, and it\'s up to Sulley and Mike to keep her out of sight and get her back home.','/wFSpyMsp7H0ttERbxY7Trlv8xry.jpg','2001-11-01',92,'Released','It\'s nothing personal. It\'s just their job.','Monsters, Inc.',585,36.8905,7.857,'6tCxnHCqqxg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15368,_binary '\0','/wI55Yf5dw2md2we0ieBZsb4oFVD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0198837',6.5,4595,'sv','Noll tolerans','Johan is a two-fisted Gothenburg cop who finds himself in a shoot-out with jewel robbers. After the smoke has cleared, one robber, shot by his accomplice, and an innocent bystander, are dead. Three witnesses, including Helen, identify thug extraordinaire Leo Gaut as being the dead crook\'s trigger-happy colleague. Gaut soon threatens the three witnesses, and only Johan, the badge-wearing hero, can save them.','/O8wijji4u1dUaNAdmBOyrcP2ZR.jpg','1999-10-29',108,'Released',NULL,'Zero Tolerance',21072,1.6602,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15369,_binary '\0','/1HfbADHPPG1KKqBQn7ZdiFVNXLe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0199161',7.1,1217,'en','Yogi\'s First Christmas','Businesswoman Sophie Throckmorton plans to sell the Jellystone Lodge, devastating the regular guests – including Huckleberry Hound, Augie Doggie and Doggie Daddy, and Snagglepuss – and it\'s up to Ranger Smith, manager Mr. Dingwell, and the newly awake Yogi, Boo Boo and Cindy keep the Christmas spirit alive amidst the mischievous attempts of two villains to ruin the fun.','/drUigP4dcVx4I3ZZpo2zzSO6CJn.jpg','1980-11-21',99,'Released','Comin’ up Christmas time!','Yogi\'s First Christmas',45851,2.1388,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15370,_binary '\0','/h7paUmJnLHYeSMRhT1JYlviI8IS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0199290',4.8,3931,'en','3 Strikes','Brian Hooks plays a character who is just released from jail. And the state adopts a \"3 strikes\" rule for felons that involves serious penalties. Hooks has 2 strikes, and wants to change his life for the better. When a friend picks him up, they are pulled over, and his friend shoots at police officers, and Hooks escapes. Now Hooks, a wanted man, must clear his name of having nothing to do with the shooting.','/ca7xVIgh7UYsFOCBLP8ERmBktC5.jpg','2000-03-01',82,'Released','the few, the proud, the paroled.','3 Strikes',47816,2.8311,5.6,'GDFqdXToYxE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15371,_binary '\0','/q5U2yQsx9lRgrKoEEpSb7XyI1tu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0199314',5.8,7016,'en','About Adam','A waitress falls for a handsome customer who seduces her, her two sisters, her brother, and her brother\'s girlfriend.','/e4EkKwF0MTcG6lfysals7Nxeq0z.jpg','2001-01-19',105,'Released','He came. He saw. He conquered. One sister at a time.','About Adam',18168,2.2825,5.285,'U2oVKYID93E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15372,_binary '\0','/5LXSry3VSeqJcKVCIGaTwtLAmu5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0199354',7.2,1438,'zh','不见不散','The story of two Chinese immigrants\' struggles in America. Yuan Liu has lived in LA for years. He has no stable job, no family and lives in a wagon. He seems content with his life until the day he meets Qing Li, a woman with the big \"American dream\".','/wb0l1Zfz7fb7csInp53JmZnKBE6.jpg','1998-12-25',103,'Released',NULL,'Be There or Be Square',126545,1.4346,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15373,_binary '\0','/pLfPw6E4iUSX8eQemx19zIMS1jg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0199389',5.6,2637,'en','Cabin by the Lake','A screenwriter does research for his new script by actually kidnapping and drowning young girls. He then places them in his \"garden\" of other dead girls coming back daily to check on them. One girl narrowly escapes and the other bodies are found leading to an ingenious plot to try and capture the killer.','/dttOEOJ76BHhUR4858e2RBcYdNy.jpg','2000-02-01',91,'Released',NULL,'Cabin by the Lake',30780,1.9379,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15374,_binary '\0','/vZWNHk9Bn3FFKWQAEA0Bmpv6Grh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0199481',2.8,5537,'fr','Vercingétorix : La Légende du druide roi','In the year 60 B.C. a group of Druids, including the arch-druid Guttuart (Max von Sydow), witness the passing of a comet and interpret it as the sign of the coming of a king for their country Gaul, which has not had a king for a long time. Guttuart goes to Gergovia, the capital of the Arvenes tribe, to attend a meeting of Gallic tribal chieftains. The young boy Vercingetorix, along with his friend the young girl Eponia, sneak into a large cavern where Celtill, Vercingetorix\'s father and chieftain of the Arvenes, hosts the meeting of chieftains with the intention of proclaiming himself king of all Gauls. When Celtill shows off the crown once worn by the old kings of Gaul, an arrow from two Roman spies (dressed as Gauls) hits Celtill in the back.','/5j9rc0SKxTMrywFJYgmvza5moTA.jpg','2001-01-24',124,'Released','You know his name. Discover his legend.','Druids',12911,2.1644,3.1,'6WeHTWQVVtA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15375,_binary '\0','/e1hIGr5HTAPPiHNs7fMlW2JMSPl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0199626',5.4,28043,'en','In the Cut','A New York City writing professor, Frannie Avery, has an affair with a police detective who is investigating the murder of a beautiful young woman in her neighborhood.','/c8Xg0yc8UQwDXooffBNLLs2BvQH.jpg','2003-10-22',119,'Released','Everything you know about desire is dead wrong.','In the Cut',10944,5.5652,5.12,'vGbAd8vlzfk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15376,_binary '\0','/b7bQc3XDokQ5a1ZDna2i0sI2xTf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0199650',3.9,1367,'en','Jill Rips','A tough guy goes undercover on a personal mission of vengeance into the hardcore world of S&amp;M, to find out who\'s responsible for the death of his brother.','/cfuc1GSUQaN56gc8y5nvkXwRkLF.jpg','2000-01-28',94,'Released','She\'s America\'s Most Wanted Serial Killer','Jill Rips',122163,2.5836,3.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15377,_binary '\0','/maxp4hu52uhfNuJmumD5NpZyrRo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0199683',7.7,23871,'ja','菊次郎の夏','Brash, loudmouthed and opportunistic, Kikujiro is the unlikely companion for Masao who is determined to see the mother he has never met. The two begin a series of adventures which soon turns out to be a whimsical journey of laughter and tears with a wide array of surprises and unique characters along the way.','/zTelT1xAO4Owxk1jHJM4puoei5N.jpg','1999-06-05',121,'Released',NULL,'Kikujiro',4291,5.2311,7.5,'EhUsQvoAeAY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15378,_binary '\0','/jF71CkY9bHyWvZTNQUThyzecXYb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0199725',7.2,27028,'en','Love & Basketball','Monica Wright and Quincy McCall grew up in the same neighborhood and have known each other since childhood. As they grow into adulthood, they fall in love, but they also share another all-consuming passion: basketball. As Quincy and Monica struggle to make their relationship work, they follow separate career paths though high school and college basketball and, they hope, into stardom in big-league professional ball.','/zNZWNX19FZ5QyedprVM0ldsXFiP.jpg','2000-04-21',125,'Released','All\'s fair in love and basketball.','Love & Basketball',14736,3.5906,7.4,'vhl4TV-S3bg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15379,_binary '\0','/vDeOTyvAnOSjeqmjm9X5Z0tMlP5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0199727',6.4,6117,'en','Love, Honour and Obey','Jonny dreams of leaving his dead-end job as a courier. Through his childhood best friend, nephew of the notorious crime lord Ray Kreed, he wins his way into the toughest gang in North London. Hungry for action, Jonny sparks a feud between Ray\'s gang and a rival firm in South London headed by drug kingpin Sean and his lieutenant Matthew.','/xVJ3ZLCHfWUMkV1sIhnJXDGbJUW.jpg','2000-04-07',103,'Released','Till Death Do Us Part','Love, Honour and Obey',18002,1.9877,6,'oybfiOGc_PY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15380,_binary '\0','/6E03p2tiT1pOw6O1eYcNQM5aDqL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0199753',5.7,62816,'en','Red Planet','Astronauts search for solutions to save a dying Earth by searching on Mars, only to have the mission go terribly awry.','/6svTVlVEJDoOOEz1G09HLeb7vtF.jpg','2000-11-10',106,'Released','Not a sound. Not a warning. Not a chance. Not alone.','Red Planet',8870,8.3641,5.736,'GROpZD40mk0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15381,_binary '\0','/hmCXrvv3fcRFEPQUDjoX9fVmsIY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0199776',6.5,1389,'de','Models','A revealing and devastating portrait of a trio of aspiring real-life Viennese models. Vivian will stop at nothing to be a magazine cover girl. Lisa fills her time with routine plastic surgery and cocaine binges, while innocent Tanja focuses on the mystical through tarot cards, yoga, and raw animal energy.','/2UQbrSTIBzRQZNeygcYY0jLqCzG.jpg','1999-02-26',118,'Released',NULL,'Models',56358,0.7522,6,'78kFD7fB1ps','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15382,_binary '\0','/5dvZd4eU7ktWdG4k9M0xevijchf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0199777',6.7,2753,'ru','Молох','In 1942 Bavaria, Eva is alone, when Adolf arrives with Josef, his wife Magda, and Martin to spend a couple of days without politics.','/jCXFOLTtOwErAvZdLG4X7MhDQnJ.jpg','1999-02-01',108,'Released',NULL,'Moloch',55971,1.9038,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15383,_binary '\0','/unGb5K0ytCP0lSogvqeHg2eF68X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0199849',4.5,1733,'en','Ninja Terminator','The hunt is on to gain the fabulous super-strength of ninja sorcery, after three top students of the Ninja Empire each steals one of the sections of the Golden Ninja Warrior statuette. On the case is interpol agent, Jaguar Wong, who must make sure that whoever re-unites the pieces uses the power for doing good not evil. A Hong Kong cut and paste edit of the 1984 Korean Film \"스타페리의 不請客\" (Uninvited Guest of The Star Ferry) with new ninja scenes.','/5YkYpKxTQVq4gna3qTztwwwo8YF.jpg','1986-07-15',92,'Released',NULL,'Ninja Terminator',40027,1.7668,6,'WdEk6ryQjE8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15384,_binary '\0','/qmV3UOdCokossgy8tUGInM7n7FP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0199905',7.2,1379,'ja','座頭市海を渡る','Zatoichi\'s trek through 88 temples to atone for his violent past is interrupted as he stumbles into a village terrorized by a violent yakuza boss.','/8mPhPVAIuV0FlgkZMwGSXNyJPrd.jpg','1966-08-12',82,'Released',NULL,'Zatoichi\'s Pilgrimage',54276,1.7021,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15385,_binary '\0','/trx50Ay4BjMW9TGSILqunfR39Zb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0199974',4.9,1288,'en','The Prophet\'s Game','Moving from city to city, The Prophet lures unsuspecting contestants into solving the riddles it supplies. If the contestants are wrong, somebody dies and somebody is famous.','/xXH6YzGbvSoLDUx5NaOL0hKPbza.jpg','2000-06-06',106,'Released','A serial killer is playing a deadly game...','The Prophet\'s Game',71115,2.2839,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15386,_binary '\0','/wXax3nRWlZDfRqgrmBIKfE2OnaJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200027',6.5,32151,'en','Riding in Cars with Boys','In 1965, a young woman with dreams of becoming a writer has a son at the age of 15 and struggles to make things work with the drug-addicted father.','/1xzvRrpA9V1TxXP7kIf8d0AgJ1R.jpg','2001-10-19',131,'Released','She did everything wrong, but got everything right.','Riding in Cars with Boys',11091,5.2713,6.8,'iCxojElPnbg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15387,_binary '\0','/1ZBPashbl6CQ3IhfbM38A67tNnj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200071',7.4,17367,'fr','Rosetta','Young, impulsive Rosetta lives a hard and stressful life as she struggles to support herself and her alcoholic mother. Refusing all charity, she is desperate to maintain a dignified job.','/buwLjQPPA9FaATvKzeAppLXiGMB.jpg','1999-09-29',95,'Released',NULL,'Rosetta',11489,2.4746,7.2,'woN2P4r65oA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15388,_binary '\0','/zQwmXzP0isT4qAKVu47X4HrSecA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200087',8.1,29014,'hi','सरफरोश','When terrorists kill a cop\'s brother and disable his father, he fights back against the smuggling of guns and drugs which plagues his country.','/uO8QoA7LS1Q2nr6iK7PSz7xR1um.jpg','1999-04-30',174,'Released','A Reason To Live','Sarfarosh',31524,1.6827,6.8,'QlULorEPMig','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15389,_binary '\0','/lJlt6z65AFZuE34wL7gDgYig3fF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200095',7.6,3015,'en','Scum','Carlin is a new reform school inmate with a reputation as a hard case. The authorities encourage gang leader Pongo to humble Carlin, but Carlin overtakes Pongo as Daddy of the ward. The guards institute a reign of terror and neglect, with Carlin emerging as an unlikely leader.','/3cDsOsGomlrFFG1VUT3def7koMm.jpg','1977-11-08',78,'Released',NULL,'Scum',90098,1.8238,7.236,'Sq6oDIRC1N4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15390,_binary '\0','/rac2rurGSht4QRkykCpOpeZ6xBC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200135',6.7,1411,'it','Sicilia!','A man returns to visit his native Sicily after living in New York for a long time. He learns about the Sicilian way of life from stylized conversations with an orange picker, his fellow train passengers, his mother, and a knife-sharpener.','/hyB17QfiGKt12LmJYMpHoY9XooD.jpg','1999-05-19',66,'Released',NULL,'Sicily!',104871,0.9726,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15391,_binary '\0','/8Ztgyr023FdFjMW4sCmRJ0W6AyO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200138',7.4,2015,'en','The Simple Life of Noah Dearborn','In the small Southern community of Twin Pines, GA, lives Noah Dearborn, a master craftsman and farmer who cherishes his solitude almost as much as the local townspeople cherish him — especially restaurant owner Sarah McClellan. But when greedy real estate developers set their sights on Noah\'s land and he rejects their six-figure offer, this taciturn man is forced to summon all his strength in order to defend not only his property and way of life, but his sanity.','/5pLvBGqQFQpB2oZK4lFJzbInMH7.jpg','1999-05-09',85,'Released','An Extraordinary Tale About An Ordinary Man.','The Simple Life of Noah Dearborn',57680,1.7811,6.2,'NBj25UZMFQI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15392,_binary '\0','/xBkPM0VvYeDedbeJUDxsNJ8wS1l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200192',5.4,7603,'it','Tra(sgre)dire','While scouting out apartments in London for her Venetian boyfriend, Carla rents an apartment overlooking the Thames. There, she meets a real estate agent by the name of Moira.','/7gqcEgJfTltbLo76nZTl8umgM1Y.jpg','2000-01-28',90,'Released',NULL,'Cheeky',22705,9.5516,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15393,_binary '\0','/tzijMBkZtUX5ubkgbcTC7WITE7i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200208',5.9,6829,'en','The Thirteenth Year','A teen learns that his birth mother is a mermaid after he begins to grow fins and slimy scales on his thirteenth birthday.','/fABYANPrfqti24Kb2vz5B2Vklml.jpg','1999-05-15',95,'Released','Cody\'s not just growing up... he\'s growing fins!','The Thirteenth Year',83965,3.4835,6.638,'Cb74tVTW_2I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15394,_binary '\0','/lo2Dp8t6ElOQ2u8pnTqWhiRJqya.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200215',5.1,1395,'it','Tifosi','Four different stories about italian football team’s supporter.','/jKXjLxy7aZ7bpn55TDJeVoQon2o.jpg','1999-10-01',119,'Released',NULL,'Tifosi',42441,1.5067,5.579,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15395,_binary '\0','/ad0n8V9w28K7ZZNcbDjT6PCet3F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200245',4.5,1399,'it','Vacanze di Natale 2000','Superenalotto winner Pasquale Esposito with his family, two penniless students from Emilia and the Colombo and Covelli families, who accidentally rent the same chalet, will spend the Christmas holidays in Cortina d\'Ampezzo.','/kmbJ3894zEHEYKVygDLKMZj35gK.jpg','1999-12-17',110,'Released',NULL,'Christmas Vacation 2000',42446,1.5515,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15396,_binary '\0','/5vG7WZq1iZagZDRxLiDQxpwyuKO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200267',7.4,5983,'ru','Ворошиловский стрелок','A very typical post-Soviet era storyline. A bunch of vagabonds lured an innocent teenage girl to their apartment, offered her a drink, intimidated, then gang raped her. Local cops are incapable to undertake an adequate actions against the scoundrels - prevented by the superior chief of the local police, who is the dad of one of the scumbags. The case is closed. The girl\'s granddad tired of an endless circumlocution decides to take revenge in his own hands.','/mDUPockuLcjeh6Sn4wNRt4ZYDRe.jpg','1999-04-19',95,'Released',NULL,'The Rifleman of the Voroshilov Regiment',71186,2.2357,7.077,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15397,_binary '\0','/3WwlCoSdxE9LTCPNcMULvNatsBd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200299',6,1583,'fi','Bad Luck Love','A shocking crime forces a man to re-evaluate his life, only to find that going straight is more complicated than he imagined. Ali is a low-level criminal who spends much of his spare time working out at a gym with his brother Pulu. Ali spends most of his day stoned on marijuana, while Pulu is known to drink cleaning products when he\'s run out of booze. Ali has fallen in love with Inka, a bright woman with a mind of her own, and her independent nature occasionally throws him into a fit of jealousy.','/26KyqgpiWYdDPpm7VgLSpis5bE6.jpg','2000-09-29',94,'Released',NULL,'Bad Luck Love',63938,1.3225,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15398,_binary '\0','/y2Fq7SI8U7UsOAQyVFrCxALYaV9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200309',7.2,3097,'ja','続・座頭市物語','Returning to the village where a year before he had killed Hirate, a much-admired opponent, Zatoichi encounters another swordsman and former rival in love.','/wsKbxbughfNsvcK0JVzajyIrFqN.jpg','1962-10-12',72,'Released',NULL,'The Tale of Zatoichi Continues',16693,1.6689,7.053,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15399,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200427',6.9,1868,'en','Diamond Men','After 30 years on the road, a veteran jewellery salesman is forced to show his young replacement the tricks of the trade. But when the kid introduces him to the ladies of the \"Altoona Riding Club,\" the old dog is introduced to a whole new set of \"tricks.\"','/v1BlkCqb2wtA5dJrae4pzpRfoHQ.jpg','2000-10-11',100,'Released',NULL,'Diamond Men',34714,1.1803,5.9,'VzsOnhrJUMA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15400,_binary '\0','/ynnarxTMs8jWKV9GK0SpUhGNCgH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200465',7.2,198353,'en','The Bank Job','Terry is a small-time car dealer trying to leave his shady past behind and start a family. Martine is a beautiful model from Terry\'s old neighbourhood who knows that Terry is no angel. When Martine proposes a foolproof plan to rob a bank, Terry recognises the danger but realises this may be the opportunity of a lifetime.','/bfXjFTytfFTdo9WeO7lYqzkHG7g.jpg','2008-02-28',112,'Released','The true story of a heist gone wrong... in all the right ways.','The Bank Job',8848,15.4722,6.854,'P-yikylK5gI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15401,_binary '\0','/z7oaOABTOvKK01XqA1BlE9VybYc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200469',4.1,12228,'en','Bats','Genetically mutated bats escape and it\'s up to a bat expert and the local sheriff to stop them.','/pZRcf2BwcxWg594X6XT2jkR2qdb.jpg','1999-10-22',91,'Released','Where do you hide when the dark is alive?','Bats',10496,3.3049,4.6,'nlgeu8SxoQI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15402,_binary '\0','/vkrX1B9zGfXBTtfYieaPfqVLAj7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200472',5.6,2489,'en','Beautiful Joe','A bad girl becomes a con artist, gets into trouble with the mob and taps a nice-guy florist for help.','/112w8czibDADH2Pnqg7Ez1aR4Kf.jpg','2000-06-09',98,'Released',NULL,'Beautiful Joe',32067,2.2469,5.4,'faeg3TVgbPo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15403,_binary '\0','/3wXJqoCgFTzWM3rcUmkWbzjwvFK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200528',7.6,2197,'en','Chip \'n\' Dale\'s Rescue Rangers to the Rescue','Chip and Dale, Disney\'s favorite chipmunk team, form their own protection agency for their fellow animals, where they seek to help the helpless and protect those in peril from those who would exploit them.','/mG7WobVyjbZy33rnhIeiaFmAqQt.jpg','1989-09-30',85,'Released',NULL,'Chip \'n\' Dale\'s Rescue Rangers to the Rescue',398284,1.5469,7.579,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15404,_binary '\0','/njRm7HrrVnLenW16SGpcVznQE0f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200530',6.6,6211,'en','Chuck & Buck','Chuck and Buck are childhood best friends whose lives have taken very different paths. While Chuck moved away and now has a real life, Buck stayed behind and developed a dangerous fixation—on Chuck\'s life.','/k0GY9haWiwZtBOf2T7winwNcsep.jpg','2000-07-14',96,'Released','When does a close friend become too close?','Chuck & Buck',44490,1.8364,6,'C6rVS-ouvpY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15405,_binary '\0','/f2MzXz3vjuNtSPn17ugFa6oTUmc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200550',5.8,128790,'en','Coyote Ugly','Graced with a velvet voice, 21-year-old Violet Sanford heads to New York to pursue her dream of becoming a songwriter only to find her aspirations sidelined by the accolades and notoriety she receives at her \"day\" job as a barmaid at Coyote Ugly. The \"Coyotes\" as they are affectionately called tantalize customers and the media alike with their outrageous antics, making Coyote Ugly the watering hole for guys on the prowl.','/xYM0laKrEqjiRSQNvqRrXPXN3iL.jpg','2000-07-30',100,'Released','Tonight, they\'re calling the shots.','Coyote Ugly',6282,9.8753,6.3,'2lqWOOHOwlE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15406,_binary '\0','/wrNvnsofuZuGKAunRMCEysUWIlD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200637',7.8,4170,'tr','Sarı Mercedes','The film is based on \'Fikrimin Ince Gulu\', a novel by Adalet Agaoglu, which depicts a first generation gurbetci/guest-worker returning home. It covers his land journey in short bursts from Germany to the Turkey\'s west border - and extensively from thereon to his village close to Ankara - capital of Turkey. He begins his journey purchasing a second hand yellow Mercedes - possibly his first car - using his meager savings working as a laborer. Offering deep insight into the mind of a manual laborer Bayram (Ilyas Salman) making his first trip back home, resorting to flashbacks in highlighting Bayram\'s motivation and experiences from his childhood right up to the events leading to his first departure from Turkey to Germany.','/8bq0HI8RyqdqrVX31SDEmVD2vDw.jpg','1993-03-01',90,'Released',NULL,'The Yellow Mercedes',300953,1.6533,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15407,_binary '\0','/6CBdZOpmyQm826pPFGTcRo7VH1s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200642',5.6,1383,'tl','For Y\'ur Height Only','Mr. Giant has kidnapped the brilliant Dr. Van Kohler and is planning to use the Doctor\'s invention, the N-bomb, to hold the world hostage. The only one who can foil Mr. Giant\'s evil scheme is Agent 00, a 3-foot-tall filipino martial arts master, expert marksman, top-class romancer and all-around superspy. Can Agent 00 rescue Dr. Kohler before it\'s too late?','/fGl22BMQ9WjyrhO5COeRx8ufrky.jpg','1981-07-01',88,'Released','He\'s tough. He\'s tender. He\'s three feet tall.','For Y\'ur Height Only',40471,1.356,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15408,_binary '\0','/jleMgDeeVaaC35ei7VUTEaF4OVu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200654',7.9,17438,'tr','Gemide','Sailors want to remain in their small world, which is warm and cozy and full of lies, but their routine life turns upside down when one of them gets mugged and badly beaten.','/vnQE1WvcP9CvQSbYAyXIQU9Sc1S.jpg','1998-12-04',102,'Released','A ship is like a country.','On Board',46629,1.0618,7.248,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15409,_binary '\0','/iMedTQJ3sbRu3EmfTO15zJrdlEe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200659',7.3,8939,'en','Ghostwatch','For Halloween 1992, the BBC decides to broadcast an investigation into the supernatural, hosted by TV chat-show legend Michael Parkinson. Parky (assisted by Mike Smith, Sarah Greene & Craig Charles) and a camera crew attempt to discover the truth behind the most haunted house in Britain. This ground-breaking live television experiment does not go as planned, however.','/h5nOIZbO3J7STIOZumW00BxU6DC.jpg','1992-10-31',91,'Released','\"We don\'t want to give anyone sleepless nights.\"','Ghostwatch',46633,2.1002,7,'8eO5vFykH-I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15410,_binary '\0','/1kLyl3IyjBOO74g4YRUC63Hx5qE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200669',5.9,4727,'en','The Golden Bowl','Wealthy American widower Adam Verver and his daughter Maggie live a refined life in Europe, surrounded by art. Maggie marries impoverished Italian Prince Amerigo, while Adam marries Maggie\'s friend Charlotte Stant. The Prince and Charlotte are having an affair, which Maggie discovers and navigates through a silent, psychological battle of wills, ultimately using her cunning to preserve her marriage and protect her father.','/xgUcUWu7lirlZbMPz21qo8RhK57.jpg','2000-05-14',130,'Released','From the novel by Henry James','The Golden Bowl',29946,2.283,6,'4-if2bcIdLA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15411,_binary '\0','/o3Ao7DNwz9IXxdXEGz384doWPec.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200710',7.4,1391,'ja','人斬り','A ronin desperately seeks a way out of financial straits; he allies with the Tosa clan under the ruthless leader Takechi, who quickly takes advantage.','/b4Wk9GV8m1eva53THh6Qpk2coH1.jpg','1969-08-09',140,'Released',NULL,'Tenchu!',37053,2.179,7,'zHPvh6vDNpk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15412,_binary '\0','/u85zf9uh1W92aGP8u8TwafiHGed.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200720',7,8744,'en','The House of Mirth','In early 20th century New York City, an impoverished socialite desperately seeks a suitable husband as she gradually finds herself betrayed by her friends and exiled from high society.','/gCEboOrNXFmqE5pKUn42fTHZx8R.jpg','2000-10-13',140,'Released','When a woman has the beauty men admire and women envy... it is wise to tread carefully.','The House of Mirth',25520,3.0186,6.2,'szwAoiYTflk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15413,_binary '\0','/rvtuFiaHQNqlQ16EjaT7DIEJyT3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200740',7.1,1691,'ja','刺青','Otsuya, the daughter of a rich merchant, elopes with her lover Shinsuke, an employee of her father\'s. During their flight, Otsuya\'s beauty attracts the gaze of Seikichi, a mysterious master tattooist who sees her pristine white skin as the perfect canvas for his art. The image of the large demonic spider that he emblazons across Otsuya\'s back marks her as the property of another man, radically altering her relationships with all around her as her personality seems to transform under its influence.','/888ZaiBbvcf4Uxvta8zx8P6DIqv.jpg','1966-01-15',86,'Released',NULL,'Irezumi',35018,2.4814,6.8,'gb9DKq21rDA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15414,_binary '\0','/qZcAcVDgxPECynQ8NyeqxqRtRpg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200768',7.5,3427,'ja','獣の剣','Legendary swordplay filmmaker Hideo Gosha\'s Sword of the Beast chronicles the flight of the low-level swordsman Gennosuke, who kills one of his ministers as part of a reform plot. His former comrades then turn on him, and this betrayal so shakes his sense of honor that he decides to live in the wild, like an animal. There he joins up with a motley group who are illegally mining the shogun’s gold, and, with the aid of another swordsman, gets a chance not just at survival but to recover his name and honor.','/8CoqruUTwDldSP8iNSKvmhq2sOC.jpg','1965-09-18',85,'Released',NULL,'Sword of the Beast',46917,1.8142,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15415,_binary '\0','/pN5CtXpQJMG6FDHguoBXTYktNyn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200800',6.8,3556,'sh','Лептирица','A young man wants to marry the beautiful daughter of a landowner who refuses to allow the marriage. To prove his worth, the young man becomes a miller in a vampire-infested local mill.','/tGFLOYPTUlGkaYRdyhqg0aPGguG.jpg','1973-04-15',65,'Released','If fear has its name, then it is LEPTIRICA!','Leptirica',220638,1.8797,6.5,'PIhMMJBhhIQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15416,_binary '\0','/3zjR5hQnke7o3JVEKNOK9Zip81B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200809',5.6,11016,'en','Life-Size','Sad and lonely after the death of her mother, Casey would do anything to see her again. But when a series of mystic mishaps mistakenly brings her fashion doll “Eve” to life instead, it changes Casey’s world forever!','/kS91p5rwK0A0VGmBISVWK6O3So5.jpg','2000-03-05',88,'Released','She was a perfect doll. Now she\'s the real thing.','Life-Size',36968,4.1532,6.6,'2VXWOmyYr-4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15417,_binary '\0','/rsNlLP0LKa20YG3NGS0KmMNOyGP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0200849',7.8,13323,'de','Mein liebster Feind','A film that describes the love-hate relationship between Werner Herzog and Klaus Kinski, the deep trust between the director and the actor, and their independently and simultaneously hatched plans to murder one another.','/osoW8CtE9zuCK7Bre0cnVsoXQjY.jpg','1999-05-17',99,'Released',NULL,'My Best Fiend',8672,3.0062,7.356,'Lae8FewbnuU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15418,_binary '\0','/uYKOI0OuwlyOHEMOpBLr3wfdUKf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0201265',6.9,9863,'sv','Tomten är far till alla barnen','Sara invites her ex-husbands and their new families to celebrate Christmas with her and her husband Janne. Sara has always wanted to have a baby with Janne, and at the dinner table she reveals the news: she\'s pregnant. The only problem is that Janne had a vasectomy two years ago, without Sara knowing it. The secret starts to spread among the guests, and in no time everyone knows but Sara. The party heads for a complete disaster. Who\'s the real father?','/20xZjYZqeZXw3qEghOtWQ8Ckjkf.jpg','1999-11-26',95,'Released',NULL,'In Bed with Santa',29822,1.8224,6.4,'fdF1M7hJbVA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15419,_binary '\0','/n1XuthS8P6I7XnHSY31SWttE6w3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0201290',2,2781,'en','The Underground Comedy Movie','A series of comedic short films guaranteed to offend.','/bFSlgGQyKXc0KsKDg2Xui0kMVcz.jpg','1999-05-14',92,'Released','WARNING: Guaranteed to offend','The Underground Comedy Movie',32306,2.4461,2.5,'dWz_wGJKTJw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15420,_binary '\0','/dYxbhzBvhviKRz9kzTK83xZvAnF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0201368',8.6,17906,'tr','Züğürt Ağa','The landowner (Agha) of the Haraptar village marries off his old father with the young and beautiful Kiraz. But on the nuptial night, his father dies and everything starts to go bad for the Agha. Due to the long drought and provocations of Kekec Salman (big brother of Kiraz), the peasants steal the crops and run away to Istanbul. Without the peasants and crops, Agha is also forced to sell the village and move to Istanbul. But he cannot keep up with the big city life and consumes all his money and belongings. Agha\'s wife and relatives leave him during this downfall.','/k91XbIdnDvzvg4RpwPh7mUz3VC7.jpg','1985-04-07',101,'Released',NULL,'The Broken Landlord',31401,2.1099,8.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15421,_binary '\0','/2jZesr0orlx2BXKwRfafnonqGh2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0201394',5.1,1667,'en','The Shrink Is In','A young woman impersonates a shrink to win over her Prince Charming.','/4nj4LaBxDuizYJmQ9KZy4unJGjh.jpg','2001-08-01',87,'Released','Just when you\'re getting close to true love... your hour is up!','The Shrink Is In',66668,2.4978,4.8,'6BmwGaGzOys','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15422,_binary '\0','/wytfOgPzYnYUqEbXUyM38HIcYXP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0201485',5.4,8709,'en','The Body','An ancient skeleton has been discovered in Jerusalem in a rich man\'s tomb. Colouration of the wrist and leg bones indicates the cause of death was crucifiction. other signs, include a gold coin bearing the marks of Pontius Pilate and faint markings around the skull, lead authorities to suspect that these could be the bones of Jesus Christ. Politicians, clerics, religious extremists and those using terror as a means to an end, find their beliefs and identities tested while risking their lives to unearth the truth.....','/lCTA1B2oFev0bcXVZZuh93qDjix.jpg','2001-04-13',109,'Released','It would change history and destroy the belief of millions,,,','The Body',28308,3.2277,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15423,_binary '\0','/7T52ievh2ngiI1FPtVMm1l0ANdv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0201517',6.8,2628,'ja','カリスマ','A seasoned detective is called in to rescue a politician held hostage by a lunatic. In a brief moment of uncertainty, he misses the chance for action. Leaving his job and family without explanation, he makes his way to a mountain forest, encountering a peculiar tree called Charisma.','/vILXJXcTjBUZFsXViw2vmpxO0uv.jpg','1999-11-10',104,'Released',NULL,'Charisma',72490,1.9324,6.9,'CfbP_mw64r4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15424,_binary '\0','/72dsn2rXdoIDguF4FTNi6ctciX5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0201538',6.8,1375,'fr','Les convoyeurs attendent','Roger Closset is a man who obviously loves his family, though that doesn\'t always make them feel better. Dad is an obsessive type with a short fuse and a long list of curious ideas, and his wife and children must often bear the brunt of his eccentricities. Roger works as a reporter, a job he doesn\'t like which doesn\'t pay especially well, either. One day, Roger learns an area business association is sponsoring a contest for a family that can break a world record, with the grand prize being a new car. Suddenly, Roger gets a brainstorm -- if his son can open and shut a door 40,000 times in 24 hours, the car will be theirs. 15-year-old Michel, however, is not at all happy to have been drafted into this new responsibility, especially when dad builds a practice door in the backyard and finds a trainer to teach Michel how to open and close it with greatest efficiency.','/1IjpBJXORA8ekNudBjs5j4qpgyp.jpg','1999-05-19',94,'Released',NULL,'The Carriers Are Waiting',31336,0.9119,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15425,_binary '\0','/eDgznD35ujsh35AiUcOybxJSSuU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0201631',7.3,3073,'es','Garage Olimpo','María is eighteen years old, she lives with her mother in an old house in Buenos Aires in 1978, subletting rooms and giving classes to poor illiterate adults. Suddenly she is abducted by a military squad and finds herself accused of subversion and submitted to torture in the hideous underground of the Garage Olimpo, while her mother desperately tries to find her.','/nm0GuXuM5zpsW9Hwv7kR1cXgXD6.jpg','1999-09-02',98,'Released',NULL,'Garage Olimpo',41115,2.7488,6.9,'IOx-1euY05w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15426,_binary '\0','/qgFMKBhnBKaYkm0n7Tv2VDguPaU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0201776',5.8,3986,'en','Rated X','Based on the true story of Jim and Artie Mitchell, two brothers who entered the porn industry in the early 60\'s. After creating such legendary porn films as \"Behind the Green Door\" and \"Inside Marily Chambers\", they later became addicted to drugs and began a downward spiral leading to bankruptcy and murder.','/fpe15WtOff8oRBoX4C7l80cTVVa.jpg','2000-01-25',115,'Released','The true story of the Mitchell Brothers: America\'s original porn kings.','Rated X',27859,1.7966,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15427,_binary '\0','/4AN0soSKwkQGff4sa2JcsrKLbb3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0201840',6.9,3504,'bo','ཕོར་པ།','While the World Cup is being played in France, two young Tibetan refugees arrive at a monastery in India. The atmosphere of serene contemplation is soon disrupted by soccer fever, as the two students desperately seek a TV to watch the final.','/8yh2Pj4o92sF4ceTvzB5qP9szUy.jpg','1999-10-28',93,'Released','Buddhism is their philosophy. Soccer is their religion.','The Cup',14521,1.1225,6.6,'o6qDpRbIM7o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15428,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0201899',6.8,1824,'en','A Rumor of Angels','An old woman helps a young boy resolve his feelings over the death of his mother.','/deCJCn5Z1bj1Fow23g7twY3CqlL.jpg','2000-09-08',106,'Released',NULL,'A Rumor of Angels',50225,2.0854,6.7,'-qXHEc2h8vM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15429,_binary '\0','/fOpz5wfgFQ61iREeDMzHSfqrkJz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0201922',6.8,1316,'ja','新座頭市物語・折れた杖','After accidentally causing the death of an old lady, Zatoichi tries to do right by buying the lady’s daughter’s freedom from a brothel - but this causes more problems than solves them.','/51GZ78cpBfsJ9jQ3utDkWVgTM5p.jpg','1972-09-02',92,'Released',NULL,'Zatoichi in Desperation',54306,1.4875,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15430,_binary '\0','/fbdgaXlMGmKc1ROdpm1b9WFjySs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0202055',8.1,2152,'ml','വാനപ്രസ്ഥം','Kunhikuttan, a famous Kathakali dancer, meets Subhadra, a woman from an upper caste family, who falls in love with his character rather than himself.','/mj9PWZDB3fhyRfeckdAatYwnQ7P.jpg','1999-05-13',119,'Released',NULL,'Vanaprastham',207649,1.2171,7.8,'wO_2-cgea44','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15431,_binary '\0','/2JZ13EBbXujjwHKxJL0K4dyu5sr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0202114',6.3,1312,'ja','ウルフガイ 燃えろ狼男','Akira Inugami is the only survivor of a clan of ancient werewolves who relies on his supernatural powers to solve mysterious crimes. After a series of bloody killings perpetrated by an unseen force, Inugami uncovers a conspiracy involving a murdered cabaret singer, corrupt politicians, and a plot by the J-CIA to harvest his blood in order to steal his lycanthropic powers.','/oNQvi7sxrDUwf3ezgXmmmpl543r.jpg','1975-04-04',86,'Released','In the depths of his glaring eyes lies the strange fate of this man!','Wolf Guy',165282,1.543,5.75,'xlJ0j-c8QR8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15432,_binary '\0','/hoT93rhjOxRy8y4obE4ugxXZBMD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0202152',7,2099,'ja','座頭市','Older, wiser but still a wandering loner, the blind, peace-loving masseur Ichi seeks a peaceful life in a rural village. When he\'s caught in the middle of a power struggle between two rival Yakuza clans, his reputation as a deadly defender of the innocent is put to the ultimate test in a series of sword-slashing showdowns.','/uLpWIKg5DdLNan1o2u6gvQ6KIVe.jpg','1989-02-04',116,'Released',NULL,'Zatoichi: Darkness Is His Ally',40644,2.5327,6.4,'U8ME2Gy17NE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15433,_binary '\0','/3dTN3JlHz27vu1vxyDorWZL5QvT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0202153',6.8,1260,'ja','座頭市御用旅','Blind masseur and master swordsman Zatoichi finds a robbed and fatally wounded pregnant woman, whose baby he delivers before she dies. He takes the baby in search of its father and finds the child\'s aunt, who is about to be forced into prostitution for want of a payment the dead mother was bringing. Zatoichi determines to save the woman from her cruel fate.','/lYcRZLdV3oeIZkeihbagW1pdi8W.jpg','1972-01-15',88,'Released',NULL,'Zatoichi at Large',54284,1.8778,6.577,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15434,_binary '\0','/9ObCmnzl819pFqxMdPPPF3xhrGR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0202154',6.8,1527,'ja','座頭市逆手斬り','Blind swordsman Zatoichi, jailed briefly, is implored by another prisoner to aid him in proving his innocence of a crime for which he is sentenced to death. Zatoichi is reluctant to get involved, because he knows how often such involvement has led to trouble in the past. But events conspire to thrust him repeatedly into involvement, and gradually he comes to believe in the man\'s innocence and determines to free him.','/7LNLv8ZICzdtpOrOko3sXhWicl3.jpg','1965-09-18',77,'Released',NULL,'Zatoichi and the Doomed Man',54274,1.2084,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15435,_binary '\0','/dYso244yCYb6VkNjqUedAzJsgA7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0202381',6.2,11237,'en','Guest House Paradiso','Richie and Eddie are in charge of the worst hotel in the UK, Guest House Paradiso, neighbouring a nuclear power plant. The illegal immigrant chef has fled and all the guests have gone. But when a famous Italian filmstar, Gina Carbonara, who is in hiding from a fiance she doesn\'t want to marry, arrives at the hotel, things get very interesting!','/8kHQZ0O28QD6GPLDcDzM1WMgRBg.jpg','1999-12-03',90,'Released','Pay to check in... pray to check out!','Guest House Paradiso',10482,2.6258,6.1,'c9vQ7GsV37c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15436,_binary '\0','/hworhPYqwu3z4T7HbuugQk8WVCK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0202402',5.5,13347,'en','Whatever It Takes','A nerdy teen, Ryan Woodman is smitten with the popular and gorgeous Ashley Grant, who apparently has no interest in him. Meanwhile, dim star athlete Chris Campbell has his eye on Ryan\'s brainy and beautiful friend, Maggie Carter. The two agree to help each other in their romantic quests, but, as they come closer to their goals, both Ryan and Chris suspect that they might be pursuing the wrong girls.','/u9UtZNMj2m7dtOP6RcMAeRfqmnF.jpg','2000-03-31',94,'Released','How low will they go to get the girls of their dreams?','Whatever It Takes',16222,7.0222,5.8,'cVqwwYy3_rA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15437,_binary '\0','/oImvpyBfpXQgFevXWrh1adswdOn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0202470',6.3,47431,'en','Rock Star','A wannabe rock star who fronts a Pennsylvania-based tribute band is devastated when his bandmates kick him out of the group he founded. Things begin to look up for Izzy when he is asked to join Steel Dragon, the heavy metal rockers he had been imitating for so long. This film is loosely based on the true story of the band Judas Priest.','/8pRMweo9WA1MvYOLsD2hWyFpZ1V.jpg','2001-09-04',105,'Released','The story of a wanna be who got to be.','Rock Star',12508,5.1768,6.7,'ZpSUqTJ7X6g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15438,_binary '\0','/je9wFiDIPg6pp9TWmoyHJNyoRRJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0202493',6.4,3764,'en','Curse of the Blair Witch','A mockumentary exploring the legend of the Blair Witch and the case of the three missing student filmmakers.','/e7AvQaI3k60HGGEso1t3KNjTuDW.jpg','1999-07-11',44,'Released',NULL,'Curse of the Blair Witch',128748,2.3786,6.167,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15439,_binary '\0','/uztdTUkWckVTrjQLWPE5YOttbxY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0202559',7.5,6514,'en','A Room for Romeo Brass','Two twelve-year-old boys, Romeo and Gavin, undergo an extraordinary test of character and friendship when Morell, a naive but eccentric and dangerous stranger, comes between them. Morell befriends with the two boys and later asks them to help him pursue Romeo\'s beautiful elder sister. He gradually becomes more violent after she rejects him.','/gLpv2UUf5We4sXDKdo11aFfnKgw.jpg','2000-10-20',90,'Released',NULL,'A Room for Romeo Brass',22908,2.1031,7,'QhuD5cF9bBs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15440,_binary '\0','/sxYDAjrAcwk1w6Yshj9CpBTcKv3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0202604',7.3,1826,'ja','砂の器','Two detectives are tasked to investigate the murder of an old man, found bludgeoned to death in a Tokyo rail yard.','/r4FGm8Mei8rkEMinjZgLSJ9GUDR.jpg','1974-10-19',143,'Released',NULL,'The Castle of Sand',29268,3.8639,7.336,'5b9UsxjRQK4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15441,_binary '\0','/fMMdGBMNFt1KFydmHY3MjXkqH0x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0202623',5.5,5140,'en','The Third Wheel','The clumsy and shy Stanley is a nice fellow, beloved by his colleagues in the office. He has a crush on the gorgeous new-hire Diana, but he has difficulties to get close to her. When Stanley finally invites Diana for a date, he hits the homeless Phil with his Taurus, and his planned night turns upside down.','/tP2wOztb1FW3JlyHMDzlyeZRjBS.jpg','2002-05-31',87,'Released','The only thing Stanley & Michael didn\'t plan on for the perfect date was... Phil.','The Third Wheel',37270,3.4629,5.3,'Eqf1qesE_Bw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15442,_binary '\0','/Atj3YhSZDnmtaFP4GnsZwDCeBep.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0202641',7.2,1814,'en','Two Family House','Buddy Visalo (Michael Rispoli) is a factory worker, a frustrated crooner who once had a shot at the big time. Buddy\'s dreams of greatness have been reduced to an endless series of failed moneymaking schemes. His latest is buying a two-family house for him and his wife, Estelle (Katherine Narducci) and converting the ground floor into a neighborhood bar where he can perform. The wrench in the works is that he also inherits the upstairs tenants, Mary,a pregnant Irish girl fresh off the boat (Kelly Macdonald) and her abusive, alcoholic husband, Jim (Kevin Conway). As Buddy\'s gang of Italians tries to handle the situation, the girl goes into labor, and a baby is born, forcing them all to confront the limits of their tolerance and compassion.','/g4U84VFQDvJeTwiQDhpI6bHWtGT.jpg','2000-01-21',104,'Released','The only way to find out what you love is to risk everything you have.','Two Family House',63956,1.8967,6.3,'qthfxaN4EFo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15443,_binary '\0','/iVpjSpgPlWMU1dSi5pOIg2BTlX1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0202677',6.6,37488,'en','The Way of the Gun','Two criminal drifters without sympathy get more than they bargained for after kidnapping and holding for ransom the surrogate mother of a powerful and shady man.','/wrjMMdgn1a4ChlaBmlzKnb78nr6.jpg','2000-09-08',119,'Released','Choose your side carefully, because the only way out is the way of the gun.','The Way of the Gun',1619,5.2702,6.369,'LFtd-9bvydI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15444,_binary '\0','/vvcLSgiviCIU0J0UcwLqWdU8Iup.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0203009',7.5,316950,'en','Moulin Rouge!','A celebration of love and creative inspiration takes place in the infamous, gaudy and glamorous Parisian nightclub, at the cusp of the 20th century. A young poet, who is plunged into the heady world of Moulin Rouge, begins a passionate affair with the club\'s most notorious and beautiful star.','/2kjM5CUZRIU5yOANUowrbJcRL9L.jpg','2001-05-18',128,'Released','The greatest thing you\'ll ever learn is just to love.... and be loved in return.','Moulin Rouge!',824,8.707,7.518,'2PpgPxjzbkA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15445,_binary '\0','/laNHiehbOHYM3y9FVFfqmLuX8X5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0203019',7.2,131615,'en','Men of Honor','Against formidable odds -- and an old-school diving instructor embittered by the U.S. Navy\'s new, less prejudicial policies -- Carl Brashear sets his sights on becoming the Navy\'s first African-American master diver in this uplifting true story. Their relationship starts out on the rocks, but fate ultimately conspires to bring the men together into a setting of mutual respect, triumph and honor.','/wNUAnXV1mzOOfvnVBIYsalkk078.jpg','2000-09-13',129,'Released','History is made by those who break the rules.','Men of Honor',11978,10.2923,7.501,'iC3pHZwdmGg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15446,_binary '\0','/rVuwmu32AuhpswqskRjrZocrxJq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0203088',4.2,1498,'en','Satan\'s School for Girls','A young woman enrolls at an all-girls college in New England to investigate her sister\'s suicide and is slowly lured into a witchcraft cult by a quartet of students wanting to make her their fifth member of their evil circle.','/AayZ4ecGhFLAniC6iKE0zgPmiX1.jpg','2000-03-13',87,'Released','A bad girl is a terrible thing to waste','Satan\'s School for Girls',221506,2.2902,4.9,'j4hU5ZFNUMg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15447,_binary '\0','/yYUGy4MDM6jbJoamlfo3HT6Guhy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0203119',7.3,76948,'en','Sexy Beast','Ex-safecracker Gal Dove has served his time behind bars and is blissfully retired to a Spanish villa paradise with a wife he adores. The idyll is shattered by the arrival of his nemesis Don Logan, intent on persuading Gal to return to London for one last big job.','/xTfCZTzhgHNAR1pf5D49WH4buI5.jpg','2001-01-12',89,'Released','Yes or yes?','Sexy Beast',11826,6.9672,7,'osexRaPM_Gc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15448,_binary '\0','/e5EMDeiWX6aiomuvMfaneZPmybk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0203139',4.3,1281,'en','Silent Predators','In 1979, a delivery truck makes its way up a lonely southern California highway in a storm, bound for the San Diego Zoo with a deadly tropical rattlesnake as cargo. When the truck suffers a blowout, the driver loses control and hits a tree, shattering the snake\'s aquarium in the back and the window separating the snake from the driver. The snake slithers into the front of the truck, kills the driver with its bite and then moves off into the forest. Flash forward to 1999. The small southern California town of San Vicente has grown from 6,000 to 30,000, and the rattler, which escaped nearby years ago, has bred. There are now 25,000 of these hybrid rattlesnakes, and they are slowly making their way downhill into the town, attracted by the movement of the blasting as the town paves its way toward progress. Progress, in this case, brings terror, in this tale originally penned by John Carpenter.','/h1rYsziZnMRzBLBv8LCU6YNzf4X.jpg','1999-06-13',91,'Released','The hunt is on. You\'re the Prey.','Silent Predators',109174,1.8121,5.3,'6kcu8Nu1KVg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15449,_binary '\0','/hPW7ZWQ0gYCi3tixBWPlw6eB5Mv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0203166',7.4,24366,'sv','Tillsammans','Elisabeth leaves her abusive and drunken husband Rolf, and goes to live with her brother, Göran. The year is 1975 and Göran lives in a commune called Together. Living in this leftist commune Elisabeth learns that the world can be viewed from different perspectives.','/fIY5xko6dJOcn0hckudIhPXobve.jpg','2000-08-25',106,'Released','One revolutionary, two open straight marriages, three gay people (maybe four), three children, two carnivores and eight vegetarians. There’s only one way they’re going to make it…','Together',742,2.3759,7,'_Jab2Cjst-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000');
INSERT INTO `movies` VALUES (15450,_binary '\0','/hardcwpNmv4soWzTZWWD6OhzsSX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0203230',7.5,33792,'en','You Can Count on Me','A single mother\'s life is thrown into turmoil after her struggling, rarely-seen younger brother returns to town.','/7mGFmij1FZD5eUnNwvUjmpqrDl6.jpg','2000-03-03',111,'Released','Family first. Love always.','You Can Count on Me',14295,4.3915,6.868,'55MVAFsS7iM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15451,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0203289',6.6,1699,'hi','American Desi','College freshman Krishna Reddy, who has never cared for his Indian-American cultural heritage, looks forward to a new life on campus but is surprised to find that he has been assigned Indian roommates.','/hklG9Ehe1Rt2dlgBplTIyov62qi.jpg','2001-01-01',100,'Released',NULL,'American Desi',32222,1.6387,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15452,_binary '\0','/wxA5jOKYwJWWFCXkOF5JNfXy3u1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0203408',3.6,5640,'en','The Omega Code','An ancient prophecy is about to be fulfilled as a secret code brings the world to the edge of apocalypse.','/vU73cxp7kxi5142nYZVzRibF5QP.jpg','1999-10-15',100,'Released',NULL,'The Omega Code',29064,2.2207,4.5,'PmgKK3uzqlc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15453,_binary '\0','/rW77MhZv4QhZJDRLNRMOshDsnnl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0203540',6.8,7023,'en','Greenfingers','Prison inmate Colin Briggs is introduced to gardening, and when his thriving prison garden attracts the attention of flamboyant gardening expert Georgina Woodhouse, she offers to sponsor the inmates in an upcoming flower show. At the Hampton Court Flower Show, Colin meets Georgina\'s daughter and romance is in bloom.','/qk1KSFLOzY6VAt5SRCHUAoqBA5h.jpg','2001-07-27',91,'Released','A Blooming Comedy...Based on a True Story','Greenfingers',33379,2.4267,6.3,'lzvwH5EhNTI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15454,_binary '\0','/tCxrbABrw3lHGUQjFK3sjyBF0QK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0203612',7.5,4736,'ja','おとし穴','A man wanders into a seemingly deserted town with his young son in search of work. But after a bit of bad luck, he joins the town\'s population of lost souls.','/KIRFXDuELVg86zDqDH0ESd9QoV.jpg','1962-07-01',97,'Released',NULL,'Pitfall',54146,1.6766,7.348,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15455,_binary '\0','/x8xpHyvXgDcz2tJXlR1dpnYCdbK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0203632',7.4,15280,'de','Der Krieger und die Kaiserin','Young nurse Sissi lives a secluded life entirely devoted to her patients at Birkenhof asylum. Her first encounter with ex-soldier and drifter Bodo has a lasting impact. He causes an accident in which he provides first aid, Sissi wonders if he may be the man of her dreams. But when she finds him weeks later she is rejected, as Bodo is stuck somewhere between a traumatic past and a criminal future.','/z0dMG2C4GvIObHAcOjW9r61WIJF.jpg','2000-10-12',135,'Released','Somewhere Out There You Can Find Love','The Princess and the Warrior',9301,2.6147,7,'IIZwzGpe10s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15456,_binary '\0','/yPb8ndRvDEoQfOo8sTXkgO3nSvr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0203672',5.8,2169,'cn','中華英雄','After Hero Hua marries Jade and leaves her in China, he goes to America to work as a servant and rebels against cruel labour conditions. Jade soon joins him in New York, where they build a family.','/zYeRnmIpuJwatUIKz1XzNPJUqL8.jpg','1999-07-17',116,'Released','Living up to his name…','A Man Called Hero',44554,2.6746,6,'dykAD_Ow2c0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15457,_binary '\0','/wLNMNO87pYqUAgbJE5xZGNUK46S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0203755',6.2,30771,'en','One Night at McCool\'s','On an ordinary night, in an ordinary part of town, a beautiful young woman walks into a bar. Her name is Jewel, and before long she is chatting to bartender Randy. The pair leave together, but he ends up getting into a tussle with her criminal boyfriend, who she then shoots dead, later persuading Randy to take the rap for her. But this isn\'t the end of it, as both Randy\'s cousin Carl and the detective assigned to the murder case also fall for Jewel\'s charms and find themselves caught up in the ensuing events. It seems that any man who meets Jewel falls instantly in love with her, and she\'s going to use this fully to her own advantage, leaving a trail of havoc in her wake. It also seems that she is going to get away with it - that is, until Randy decides to hire a hitman...','/aIJAjhdMqraB1tkSii9BWuUXd8q.jpg','2001-04-19',93,'Released','She\'s three men over the legal limit.','One Night at McCool\'s',2144,4.5293,5.858,'BsIeU6lQHt8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15458,_binary '\0','/gSWMfu7Sre7tnOtEdwZTXG1YHJD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0203940',4,3474,'en','Spiders','A DNA experiment on a rare breed of spider is taking place on a NASA space shuttle, when a freak meteor shower engulfs the shuttle, causing everything to go horribly wrong. One survivor is found on the ship and watched over in a secret location deep in the California desert. The problem continues, as the survivor isn\'t alone, as another deadly spiders climbs out of him and goes on a rampage around the ship. Curious reporter Marci Eyre must now survive, escape and warn everyone before the spider reaches outside the desert.','/k7KU0Lo5eWGApnophGEzEMQm7z8.jpg','2000-06-14',94,'Released','Something Very Hungry is About to Hatch!','Spiders',40039,2.0971,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15459,_binary '\0','/1UjMZlf2qxqk6XPenTiaUztefkS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0203975',4.7,3859,'en','Tart','A student will do anything to become part of the \"in-crowd\" at the exclusive school she attends in New York.','/wEGOIvjeh1FyCelpnywg4ziVWCh.jpg','2001-04-23',94,'Released','Sex, Drugs and Study Hall.','Tart',30331,2.536,4.3,'kMsdXxe6yfc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15460,_binary '\0','/m5NJnXhZjzWY6fpXUn6hwiouLrn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0204137',6.5,16285,'en','Animal Factory','Suburbanite Ron is spoiled, young and not overly worried about the marijuana charges leveled against him. But, after being made out to be a drug dealer, he faces a five-year jail sentence in San Quentin State Prison. Physically frail and unaccustomed to his rough surroundings, Ron is primed to fall victim to sexual predators and bullying guards – that is, until he\'s befriended by Earl, a veteran inmate who finds meaning in protecting the vulnerable new kid.','/2OUOg9Pf5dZZr5RufM5liA4IUVK.jpg','2000-10-13',94,'Released','On the inside the rules are brutal and the stakes are high.','Animal Factory',9791,3.7584,6.3,'dG1Lrf4k8Ds','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15461,_binary '\0','/drGRSAuWsB6iOR9USZPTTCAibJQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0204175',5.4,18531,'en','Boys and Girls','Ryan and Jennifer are opposites who definitely do not attract. At least that\'s what they always believed. When they met as twelve-year-olds, they disliked one another. When they met again as teenagers, they loathed each other. But when they meet in college, the uptight Ryan and the free-spirited Jennifer find that their differences bind them together and a rare friendship develops.','/gdVnV2wSESbgrXX4uRD3J0D8dBo.jpg','2000-06-16',94,'Released','Warning: Sex Changes Everything','Boys and Girls',10571,4.4031,6,'FBIYE656wr0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15462,_binary '\0','/A2kXYkGGdeLU20YHPM9qs6GX9nN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0204313',5.1,41709,'en','Exorcist: The Beginning','Years before Father Merrin helped save Regan MacNeil’s soul, he first encounters the demon Pazuzu in East Africa.','/4b7Mhc4HZN7XzMMLukaQ9C0x1Dx.jpg','2004-08-20',114,'Released','Go back to where the horror began.','Exorcist: The Beginning',11026,4.4046,5.4,'eHJEMIYNFFY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15463,_binary '\0','/sFrjFfsdmIaY3eRkJtmoZzz3b61.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0204350',4.9,1522,'en','Poor White Trash','Mike and Lenny are two buddies who dream of getting out of the trailer park. Out of desperation they resort to burglary as a means of financing Mike\'s college education. Their dream is jeopardized one summer day when their ploy to shoplift Near Beer begins a crime spree and a series of mishaps during which they are threatened with jail.','/pzq14kxX1Y0E4KYJB1iQMjKytSw.jpg','2000-12-01',86,'Released','Crime pays... just not enough','Poor White Trash',44895,2.1671,4.6,'ngaW0w2VPZs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15464,_binary '\0','/9KEAFYTnVlEbiNtrbQN2tKD87PR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0204526',6.6,2106,'et','Hukkunud Alpinisti hotell','The police get a call-out to a lonely hotel in the Alps. When an officer gets to the hotel everything seems to be alright. Suddenly, an avalanche cuts them off from the rest of the world and strange things start happening.','/6zD8cZ7gTvNLJdjEcnllYyJjkMY.jpg','1979-08-27',84,'Released',NULL,'Dead Mountaineer\'s Hotel',46908,1.8508,6.3,'FlQCVh_HSzM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15465,_binary '\0','/dtFS7DS64umOHK6PcfabXtDaf2w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0204626',5.3,29782,'en','The Watcher','FBI agent Joel Campbell, burnt-out and shell-shocked after years spent chasing serial killers, flees L.A. to begin a new life for himself in Chicago. But five months later, Joel\'s best laid plans are abruptly cut short when his new hometown becomes the setting for some particularly gruesome murders--murders that could only have been committed by one man: David Allen Griffin. One of Joel\'s most elusive and cunning nemeses, Griffin has followed his former pursuer to Chicago in order to play a sadistic game of cat and mouse. Taunting Joel with photographs of his intended victims and leaving his crime scenes meticulously free of clues in order to keep the police at bay, Griffin derives as much pleasure out of watching Joel react to every movement as watching his victims die. But when Griffin moves into Joel\'s inner circle, Joel must quickly find some way to stop him before someone close to him becomes the next one to die.','/hsMvndtd3KPAvJ3q7zKZuNSB1R3.jpg','2000-09-08',96,'Released','Don\'t go home alone.','The Watcher',10685,5.4453,5.2,'4P6gwL3sV2U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15466,_binary '\0','/nPf3hjHZYtUl57UxiMH8bKP5h6X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0204640',6.7,3957,'en','Sordid Lives','As three generations of a family in a small Texas town gather for a funeral, we learn the hilarious, sad, trashy truth of their sordid lives.','/r8c41jhIxEL4pNr0lOgzlOXHJZE.jpg','2000-05-25',111,'Released','A black comedy about white trash.','Sordid Lives',19094,1.6658,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15467,_binary '\0','/v0IPWrDOb8soKlbkToWrnYgSW0n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0204686',5.8,3028,'en','The Time Shifters','Tom Merrick gets caught up in a time-traveling conspiracy and must set the timeline right before it is irrevocably altered.','/rDuUjfilSUOPlwQH6MYJ2mpTn3k.jpg','1999-10-17',88,'Released','If you could change the past would you?','The Time Shifters',7837,2.4469,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15468,_binary '\0','/urnjWgyzMA6vz7irUqzfNqgqdMU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0204700',5.9,11130,'fr','Trouble Every Day','Newlyweds Shane and June arrive in Paris for their honeymoon. In the process of trying to find a cure for his strange, bloodthirsty disease, Shane stumbles upon the story of a doctor and his flesh eating wife.','/jn4799m6uB5P6ZUarlnxvZEZDFp.jpg','2001-07-11',101,'Released','I love you so much. I could eat you.','Trouble Every Day',40723,3.1466,5.8,'-cyR7rLsms8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15469,_binary '\0','/sHX7rZQu2QJ6CzDzQ32IFqN6CJZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0204709',6.9,5963,'fr','Une liaison pornographique','A man and a woman meet to fulfill her sexual fantasy.','/kTI6I2knV8uejV7O8VFDD8cTMOg.jpg','1999-09-04',80,'Released',NULL,'An Affair of Love',46991,2.4821,6.333,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15470,_binary '\0','/jMVhdTQx8TRajDWLB3XoAeQF4PP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0204744',6.4,1330,'en','Wuthering Heights','Gypsy boy Heathcliffe is adopted by God-fearing landowner Earnshaw in 19th-century northern England and grows up as the soulmate of the daughter, Cathy. However, their romance suffers various tragedies.','/bhdKWUgPGiZ8iGrage7twnp3Puu.jpg','1998-09-11',112,'Released','Two hearts that beat as one','Wuthering Heights',74170,1.5507,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15471,_binary '\0','/v1zYiJJYeRoacgQWcJNVjmwauVC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0204761',5.6,2180,'fr','La Fidélité','A talented photographer who lands a lucrative job in Paris with a scandal-mongering tabloid and becomes romantically involved with an eccentric children\'s book publisher while resisting the sexual advances of another photographer.','/3nMKtqNHs69URTAgO85KxELfyn2.jpg','2000-04-05',166,'Released','Sometimes... There is a desire for another man.','Fidelity',49979,2.7868,5.9,'pLVjLokwLkk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15472,_binary '\0','/hh35rkki4XHbAYXPqsSumyQ9Ns7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0204824',6,7041,'en','Animal Farm','Animals on a farm lead a revolution against the farmers to put their destiny in their own hands. However this revolution eats their own children and they cannot avoid corruption.','/vFQo4DdhgHBr0Jy06VpzCYaZaPI.jpg','1999-10-03',91,'Released','Four legs good. Two legs bad.','Animal Farm',815,3.0667,5.7,'LAeKX5n-5IE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15473,_binary '\0','/jVLod1v7bSit4dibflztKN6999v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0204932',7.3,4968,'sv','Den bästa sommaren','The summer of \'58, the year Sweden almost won the world championship in soccer over Brazil, Yngve Johansson accepts two children to live with him during the summer, as told through the eyes of a young boy. His name is Mårten, and the other child\'s name is Annika. She is a rough girl, with many problems. The three of them do not get along, and Yngve is a true dictator to the children\'s eyes. However, when the children discover that their new guardian has a crush on their teacher (Cecilia Nilsson), they do what they can to bring the two together. Soon enough, the three will discover that they have a lot more in common than they previously imagined, and together they can make their lives worth living again. This is a sweet story about life in Sweden in the mid 1900\'s. It is about family, love, hate, innocent friendship that we all can relate to, and much, much more...','/rROZUiGbgIuEMiQ9WzyOIVTWdU8.jpg','2000-03-08',92,'Released',NULL,'A Summer Tale',26436,1.3435,7.1,'ni7f7VPzV0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15474,_binary '\0','/3XpxR3cSQJou79KBQpPCcpZzmhj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0204946',6.2,115947,'en','Bring It On','The Toro cheerleading squad from Rancho Carne High School in San Diego has got spirit, spunk, sass and a killer routine that\'s sure to land them the national championship trophy for the sixth year in a row. But for newly-elected team captain Torrance, the Toros\' road to total cheer glory takes a shady turn when she discovers that their perfectly-choreographed routines were in fact stolen.','/bnVby0qI0dS7YunbShP7mw68HY3.jpg','2000-08-25',99,'Released','May the best moves win.','Bring It On',1588,7.4052,6.3,'4Fza-ZDQE6c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15475,_binary '\0','/per5h5iqTtwQ27nrk6YF2Hwe39T.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0205000',5.7,85875,'en','Deuce Bigalow: Male Gigolo','Deuce Bigalow is a less than attractive, down on his luck aquarium cleaner. One day he wrecks the house of a gigolo and needs quick money to repair it. The only way he can make it is to become a gigolo himself, taking on an unusual mix of female clients. He encounters a couple of problems, though. He falls in love with one of his unusual clients, and a sleazy police officer is hot on his trail.','/w0UKAcY4fAPuQW2GhAoIMwutIA5.jpg','1999-12-10',88,'Released','He charges $10 but he’s willing to negotiate.','Deuce Bigalow: Male Gigolo',10402,8.9519,6,'vcfyZr5buDA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15476,_binary '\0','/vgMkLRHFHpdZMLuBsdORgfXjOns.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0205177',5.8,15466,'en','Kevin & Perry Go Large','When stubborn, spotty Kevin and his equally hopeless best friend Perry go on holiday to the party island Ibiza, they see it as their big chance to become superstar club DJs and, more importantly, to lose their virginities. But they aren\'t prepared for the interference of top DJ Eyeball Paul, not to mention the embarrassment factor of Kevin\'s long-suffering parents.','/zwWoCdn8s3qCnJKOOsmK1XxV1yE.jpg','2000-04-20',83,'Released','All they want to do is... Do it!!!','Kevin & Perry Go Large',10597,3.8745,5,'nENwy9GRyF0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15477,_binary '\0','/pZ1cvlwMTm6gPyDo4AKFyvCqDvo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0205190',6.5,2858,'nl','Kruimeltje','The film is based on the popular Dutch childrens book by Chris van Abkoude. In a Dutch port in 1921 lives a 10-year-old orphan boy known to everyone simply as Little Crumb. His poverty-stricken mother Lize van Dien filled with shame was forced to turn him over to Mrs. Koster soon after he was born. Foster mother Mrs. Koster, who has cared for him since he was a baby, is very poor too, unable to support him by herself and proves to be a cruel taskmaster who insists Crumb bring her money before shell feed him. Somehow he must earn his keep out on the streets and can only go home after he has earned enough money. Crumb becomes an urchin stealing from the streets barrows and the shops to stay alive, sleeping in churches or huddled in doorways. Sometimes he has to run off from the police and he has earned the enmity of the most grownups around him.','/eQAlAVpgYIi0fhnd1wJIy1ej5Zv.jpg','1999-12-22',119,'Released',NULL,'Little Crumb',39772,1.1263,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15478,_binary '\0','/zf2eFbIgNvg4qRa8bUsHkw2JkSE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0205271',4.7,19848,'en','Dr. T & the Women','A successful Texas gynecologist finds himself amid a bevy of women and their problems – his wife’s breakdown, his daughter\'s fake marriage, his other daughter’s conspiracy theories, and his secretary’s crush. Craving time for himself, he finds solace in a kind outsider.','/3O898HkbDfbqAoSz7HVR0fVbBXm.jpg','2000-09-13',122,'Released','He is overwhelmed by the woman in his life','Dr. T & the Women',10763,4.583,4.9,'024wr51PRuM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15479,_binary '\0','/lhCIqxSO4tGkMgL0yMT5krlwm0m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0205306',8.7,2471,'bg','Оркестър без име','Velko, Filip, Pavel and Gosho have different professions but are connected by the love they have for music. They rehearse all year to make it big on the sea resorts in the summer. The head of the cultural center where they play is willing to give them the musical equipment if they replace their singer Maria (Filip\'s girlfriend) with the attractive but untalented Reni. This is the first, but not the last compromise they have to make on the way to the dream.','/dET1DAeEIOy74C7YsuUQOV96vUa.jpg','1982-01-04',112,'Released',NULL,'A Nameless Band',110978,1.3285,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15480,_binary '\0','/je0pgUFMNcIMGyjd8G5j2qjo35R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0205418',3,2906,'en','The Smokers','Three rebellious teenage girls decide to even the score in the battle of the sexes.','/fDbBabdTlhZLjNU15rS9uphoaTR.jpg','2000-03-05',89,'Released','They started something they couldn\'t end.','The Smokers',32309,1.5159,3.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15481,_binary '\0','/QpDVV6g1nyQ54o5oYX3HF8mWri.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0205461',4.3,5267,'en','Thomas and the Magic Railroad','Mr. Conductor\'s supply of magic gold dust, which allows him to travel between Shining Time and Thomas\'s island, is critically low. Unfortunately, he doesn\'t know how to get more. Meanwhile, Thomas is fending off attacks by the nasty diesel engines. Getting more gold dust will require help from Mr. C\'s slacker cousin, his new friend Lily and her morose grandfather, plus the secret engine.','/aPEJ36e8a7gLu28KVfsGDQdmruk.jpg','2000-07-14',86,'Released','Little Engines CAN Do Big Things...','Thomas and the Magic Railroad',16110,3.8234,5.332,'LTizNBmz90M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15482,_binary '\0','/odiJW3FWhnPZpffe4tP7mkYEuN4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0205493',6.1,1870,'it','Vacanze di Natale','Christmas holidays on the snow of Cortina D\'Ampezzo. Mario, a guy from Rome who has not much money, falls in love with the American Samantha, the girlfriend of hypochondriac Roberto. Billo, a singer and a playboy, meets Ivana: she\'s married with a rich man, Donatone, but in the past she had a flirt with Billo, who wants to reignite the flame.','/gk7NPFDuWt3aiXBqu7CdAibSHxX.jpg','1983-12-22',97,'Released',NULL,'Christmas Holidays',42442,1.3872,6.159,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15483,_binary '\0','/g6lZsTmzpQtM3Z7nGBhllsWwJT0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0205735',6.4,4819,'fr','Les amants criminels','After a perverted impulse drives them to kill, Alice and her boyfriend, Luc, drag the body into the woods, only to find themselves hopelessly lost – much like the fairy-tale plight of Hansel and Gretel. Starving and with no hope of being found, they chance upon a dilapidated cottage where a hulking man takes them prisoner and proceeds to feed Luc\'s sexual appetite.','/pFqPlZh9S1wP1MR3RiiyWiyc50i.jpg','1999-09-03',96,'Released','Their idea of foreplay was murder.','Criminal Lovers',33828,1.9315,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15484,_binary '\0','/ly1jZqH7A1zWWnXFqpk8cXHOHyW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0205782',6.4,1617,'en','Boss of Bosses','The story of the rise and fall of the powerful New York City organized crime boss, Paul Castellano.','/wbnh5en1EdQxKTGI2U16LQTRRIm.jpg','2001-06-03',93,'Released',NULL,'Boss of Bosses',61899,2.4108,5.9,'bnyT3i3enIc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15485,_binary '\0','/rY1FcmerUUU32VcDJ4ylZrTkH6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0205873',7.2,18198,'en','The Dish','A group of maverick scientists on a remote Australian sheep farm are the globe\'s only hope for obtaining the epic images of man\'s first steps on the moon.','/zG83o1wpU3p7QTd382K4HtctLq0.jpg','2000-10-19',101,'Released','Man\'s first step on the moon nearly stumbled on earth.','The Dish',5257,2.5468,6.8,'8dyGpXcQl-g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15486,_binary '\0','/oVXWmGJgDTp0BCUer3oLgGgJSGt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0205924',4.5,1302,'it','Fantozzi 2000 - La clonazione','Ugo Fantozzi was resurrected from the company where he worked because of a crisis, how it will end?Tenth and final chapter of the film series of Fantozzi character.','/4L3RIGmtmucY2cYRHu2ThsIlIiv.jpg','1999-12-23',94,'Released',NULL,'Fantozzi 2000 - The Cloning',41669,1.9995,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15487,_binary '\0','/9pIRnrvWOCG62HmDWELopE1Ip3k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0206013',7.1,18002,'ja','ホーホケキョ となりの山田くん','The Yamadas are a typical middle class Japanese family in urban Tokyo and this film shows us a variety of episodes of their lives. With tales that range from the humorous to the heartbreaking, we see this family cope with life\'s little conflicts, problems, and joys in their own way.','/nj0ijnOozQtu52r0ncut769G1FX.jpg','1999-07-17',104,'Released','The ups and downs of life.','My Neighbors the Yamadas',16198,4.4513,7,'oJD0k7hWc6M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15488,_binary '\0','/AuzHbhkKF9p8fQbuzW2pIkScboP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0206036',7,7780,'en','If These Walls Could Talk 2','The stories of three lesbian couples -- who live in the same house at different periods of time -- who are at a crossroads in their lives. In 1961, Edith loses her lover, Abby, to a stroke. Linda and Amy struggle with feminist issues in 1972. And, in 2000, Kal and Fran try to have a baby with the help of sperm donor.','/1bwmJfLJVoxmj96qKVuE9oSmEUS.jpg','2000-03-05',96,'Released','Women love women.','If These Walls Could Talk 2',28031,3.1979,6.6,'mp_h_ZqHhF0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15489,_binary '\0','/nNlpfmdvwYXuxP52ll7dFTkhr2E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0206064',6.3,6860,'en','Johnny Tsunami','A Hawaiian teenage surfer shows off his skills when he takes to the snow slopes in Vermont.','/d2jnJHWVJc8D5ms1xhJ2yRkyV3U.jpg','1999-07-24',88,'Released','The Temperature Is Down But The Surf Is Up!','Johnny Tsunami',24020,2.2792,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15490,_binary '\0','/4ifeatUQJ1v6Q4bNPeIWdTgGJRC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0206067',6,1869,'hi','कच्चे धागे','Dhananjay and Aaftab are half brothers who have never met. When they first do they instantly loathe each other, having nothing in common. One night, Aaftab blows up a loaded truck while trying to steal from it and attracts a mass of unwanted enforcers. Soon, Aaftab is forced to send Dhananjay into a trap but ends up with them both being handcuffed and escaping from the Border Security Force, the Central Bureau of Investigation, and the border mafia who are attempting to incriminate the brothers for anti-national activities and murder. Fate has it such that they are forced to escape on foot, on motorbikes, cars, stolen trucks, and even handcuffed to each other on a moving goods train.','/dldo2zZgGVlhvKG6DvqJd5nnjAt.jpg','1999-07-31',142,'Released',NULL,'Kachche Dhaage',211275,1.3295,5.711,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15491,_binary '\0','/3QtYFBpjTWySlw2U3EEfoCi93qI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0206113',6.3,1767,'en','Madison','In 1971, air-conditioner repairman and boat enthusiast Jim McCormick entertains his desire to \'go down\' as a legend in the record books when the Gold Cup hydroplane boat race improbably comes to his small town of Madison, Indiana. Immediately, Jim seizes his opportunity to enter the contest. With a motley crew of fellow mechanics and friends at his side, Jim fixes up his old boat and brings hope to the blighted industrial city. Written by Sujit R. Varma','/hlZUHqnwcOv5yPXW7BmguKedNP.jpg','2005-04-22',99,'Released','A town\'s future is riding with one man.','Madison',38717,1.2966,5.8,'2H-cemvrnZQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15492,_binary '\0','/lzZ4irPngEyitq3DEJ4rcogGx2A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0206117',6.2,1463,'es','Manolito Gafotas','The usually absent father of a chubby kid shows up to take him on a road trip.','/13vPWBJa085mAeVK8uyMAkBk30c.jpg','1999-06-23',89,'Released',NULL,'Manolito Four Eyes',72900,1.0506,6.2,'pH7NocxK324','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15493,_binary '\0','/au0ItfQAffyMzXTVWwVs7ul0fVC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0206216',7.1,1551,'ja','鉄道員','A railway stationmaster at a dying end-of-the-line village in Hokkaido is haunted by memories of his dead wife and daughter. When the railroad line is scheduled to be closed, he is offered a job at a hotel, but he is emotionally unable to part with his career as a railroader. His life takes a turn when he meets a young woman with an interest in trains who resembles his daughter.','/nJJA9ZuTzEItugZ5wfT7Nh8xI5Q.jpg','1999-06-05',112,'Released',NULL,'Railroad Man',68837,2.4453,7.043,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15494,_binary '\0','/gz0OkZ2f6h0yXG2tZgD8kamv9Se.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0206226',6.1,7623,'en','Psycho Beach Party','Chicklet is a sixteen-year old tomboy who\'s desperate to be part of the in-crowd of Malibu beach surfers. She\'s the typical American girl - except for one little problem: her personality is split into more slices than a pepperoni pizza.','/28mzKFDyVzMVx9nhDrJQ3G2H7It.jpg','2000-08-06',97,'Released','Party till you drop. Dead.','Psycho Beach Party',27723,2.7318,5.743,'SdyF7NTwFek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15495,_binary '\0','/gy3ZWhNom6hZ1NsUDwfOKS7YDrx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0206275',6.2,69561,'en','Save the Last Dance','After the death of her mother, Sara moves to the South Side of Chicago to live with her father and gets transferred to a majority-black school. Her life takes a turn for the better when befriends Chenille and her brother Derek, who helps her with her dancing skills.','/sV8GIxT3BjHIiwgKUNwk1S8VSLa.jpg','2001-01-12',113,'Released','The only person you need to be is yourself.','Save the Last Dance',9816,6.0407,6.557,'gV7MWxwxa1I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15496,_binary '\0','/ltSGhDJ9vcSFULZXYoTxtJ9qHlU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0206305',6.9,1419,'en','A Slight Case of Murder','In the midst of a spat, film critic Terry Thorpe accidentally kills his lover. Though Thorpe covers his tracks, he raises the suspicions of a private investigator, who then tries to blackmail him. Thorpe also falls under the watchful eye of Detective Fred Stapelli, a cop who is intent on becoming a screenwriter. Before long, Thorpe\'s girlfriend, Kit, and Stapelli\'s wife, Patricia, are roped into the case.','/8lzixEbonNLJHhKSEWiMKJUVxMs.jpg','1999-09-19',94,'Released','Homicide. Seduction. Betrayal. The classics never go out of style.','A Slight Case of Murder',37444,1.6239,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15497,_binary '\0','/5uiaW1yJPhGPdCXqGIkC5zeRfDg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0206314',6.6,84924,'en','Joy Ride','Three young people on a road trip from Colorado to New Jersey talk to a trucker on their CB radio, then must escape when he turns out to be a psychotic killer.','/1LVGjf1QWgkNNPQssZtuT1GYKoP.jpg','2001-10-05',98,'Released','It started as a joke. Now the joke is on them.','Joy Ride',10866,7.8691,6.5,'udKUOQ2czWg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15498,_binary '\0','/z7Jvhjl5GZf0EGs1yzU3lbgaoSH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0206334',5.9,2534,'cn','特警新人類','Four young officers of the Hong Kong Police are joined together to fight against organised crime using all possible means, even if this would lead them to break the law… Their first assignment is to eliminate a gang of criminals who have stolen a shipload of explosives.','/2URAvYZ67Wwo7iceIfTHl050luM.jpg','1999-06-18',114,'Released',NULL,'Gen-X Cops',13099,2.1186,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15499,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0206341',6.6,3019,'en','Thumb Wars: The Phantom Cuticle','The hilarious story of a restless young farm-thumb, Loke Groundrunner, and his tasty companion, Princess Bunhead, who go on an quest to combat Black Helmet Man and the Evil Thumbpire. This is the first film of the hilarious \'Thumbs!\' franchise.','/yI2W1hFCMqiv8Zv0r9619wk2QKk.jpg','1999-11-02',29,'Released','Every Hand Has A Thumb...','Thumb Wars: The Phantom Cuticle',14962,1.7627,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15500,_binary '\0','/8YAEyzviBTURPYRDkPeZGqyMG0z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000','tt0206367',5,1389,'en','The Trumpet of the Swan','The adventures of a young Trumpeter swan who cannot speak. With the help of a human boy and the love of his family and friends, Louie discovers his own unique talents which help him find his place in the world.','/pPEfPGKy7mOdyf25ta2BT2u6wIm.jpg','2001-05-11',75,'Released','Sometimes being different helps you to find your voice!','The Trumpet of the Swan',54491,3.1017,5.6,'pm-YcQ5-I_A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:05.000000'),(15501,_binary '\0','/fKcnrb49Pp6BJarmF0965ysBIsw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0206420',5.3,11263,'en','Woman on Top','Set to the intoxicating rhythms of Brazil, \"Woman on Top\" is a spicy, sexy comedy about the magic of food, love and music. Meet Isabella, a sultry enchantress born with the special gift of melting the palates and hearts of men everywhere. When she decides to break free from her rocky marriage and the stifling kitchen of her husband\'s restaurant in Brazil, she spirits off to San Francisco in pursuit of her dreams of a real culinary career.','/eYHvcMeVjWPwATYI0VCdecMy2n3.jpg','2000-09-22',92,'Released','A sexy comedy that turns happily ever after upside down.','Woman on Top',14629,5.0154,6.068,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15502,_binary '\0','/www52jvhbB0ppe9s0zxbf9EYox.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0206634',7.9,571834,'en','Children of Men','In 2027, in a chaotic world in which humans can no longer procreate, a former activist agrees to help transport a miraculously pregnant woman to a sanctuary at sea, where her child\'s birth may help scientists save the future of humankind.','/k9IAS4TehZFcKi4HVByxZNPfqex.jpg','2006-09-22',109,'Released','The year 2027: the last days of the human race. No child has been born for 18 years. He must protect our only hope.','Children of Men',9693,15.491,7.615,'2VT2apoX90o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15503,_binary '\0','/lHokS510cxw0p9L4VwPJrlP7XfX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0206742',6.4,2192,'en','Fast Food Fast Women','How important is the truth when falling in love? Bella is a Manhattan café waitress, about to turn 35, stuck in a long-term affair going nowhere. Paul is a widower, facing old age alone. Bella\'s mother sets her up with Bruno, a novelist/cabbie who likes to bed-hop and whose ex-wife expects their two children to stay with him for awhile. While Bruno learns some maturity from his young daughter, Paul answers a personals ad placed by a \"widow, 60.\" The two couples - along with one of Paul\'s older pals and a Jungian stripper - sort out how to initiate a relationship these days, what to do when someone you like disappoints you, and when to tell the truth.','/bJuz51a3Whsh8mTRxXnaSzuXrRQ.jpg','2000-07-27',95,'Released',NULL,'Fast Food Fast Women',49453,1.9469,6.2,'EYZC3DsJ5rc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15504,_binary '\0','/v5JMGnh4G2o4zTX9XJN8IuKvmYt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0206762',6.3,1577,'en','Friends and Family','Gay New York couple Stephen Torcelli and Danny Russo have something to hide from Stephen\'s parents -- their jobs as Mafia enforcers. When the Torcelli family plans to visit, Stephen and Danny panic because Stephen\'s father works for the FBI. Despite efforts to keep family and Mafia separate, a birthday party gets mixed up with a mobster\'s daughter\'s engagement party. Trouble arises when the mobsters concoct a political scheme at the party.','/kYzGsZZjIwni13eve3AvAXBXFb.jpg','2001-06-17',87,'Released','Meet the Real Gay Mafia!','Friends and Family',23423,1.3217,5.9,'gMTo3eoJnuk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15505,_binary '\0','/h3TPeRdS4EPTaq1CkqgaCQYKJuK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0206917',6.1,17233,'en','The Man Who Cried','A young refugee travels from Russia to America in search of her lost father and falls in love with a gypsy horseman.','/CDX8xSVzufb32GGWdVH2H5eUGW.jpg','2000-08-29',96,'Released',NULL,'The Man Who Cried',29572,3.9291,6.1,'PGeh7gH7Ol0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15506,_binary '\0','/2CCGpU4C9noCoHRd0fZbhayN0sA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0206921',6.2,6409,'hi','मन','A young woman falls in love with a handsome playboy, while aboard a Singapore to India cruise. They make plans to meet again, but fate may have other plans...','/nbn9Hxj7GEBxrZ8biAfIjhYSs1Y.jpg','1999-07-09',174,'Released',NULL,'Mann',159664,1.699,5.977,'oWATWGigIWM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15507,_binary '\0','/hRrnomZzVuWlV9PxgKpevRYRccr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0206926',5.6,6299,'en','Maybe Baby','Sam and Lucie Bell are a married couple who seem to have it all: good looks, successful careers, matching motorbikes, and an enthusiastic love life. The only thing they lack is the one thing they want more—a baby.','/4PLm3BZiOXhDIbbqH8ipVyPVA1M.jpg','2000-06-02',104,'Released','It\'s a matter of life and sex.','Maybe Baby',13966,2.2258,5.5,'fZbBbHXbYdQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15508,_binary '\0','/fumJEepP6acUkDD5VJksG9VpvAB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0206938',6.9,1228,'el','Μια Ελληνίδα στο Χαρέμι','Poor Rena tries to find money to pay her lottery partner because she destroyed the wining lottery-ticket.She and her brothers who try to help her end up in harem.','/iWDUWGZLnFOzOYUcod9t121zVrx.jpg','1971-01-04',105,'Released',NULL,'A Greek woman in a Harem',329204,1.2422,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15509,_binary '\0','/705d13uxddi59nqHbndanqkAbNQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0206963',7.1,6158,'en','My First Mister','Leelee Sobieski is brash, abrasive and vulnerable as a teenage child of divorce who hides her pain behind a mask of hard-edged gothic rebellion. Albert Brooks plays a man who is her total opposite, a precise and well-ordered menswear store owner of forty-nine who manages limited expectations and protects lonely secrets with pleasant ritual and quiet, ironic reserve. These two total opposites collide in conflict then come together in a surprising alliance, changing each other\'s lives forever.','/xP2JKtdq77aWWZ1LCGsR68co5Jw.jpg','2001-10-12',109,'Released','Mismatched. Misguided. Unmistakably friends.','My First Mister',25641,2.1682,6.6,'E24SGpVrs-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15510,_binary '\0','/bmUtH0jVbXA9otJ9QlGRvLuutNn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0207093',5.6,1252,'en','Shallow Grave','When four young college girls stumble upon a murder, they find themselves targeted by a killer who will stop at nothing to silence them.','/7IdrAxax97Yrlnm8gJjHtWL73LY.jpg','1987-09-25',89,'Released','Welcome to Medley, Georgia','Shallow Grave',85159,1.3385,5.1,'nly-DhdzVi8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15511,_binary '\0','/fB3bBfi4n1FQ6Ssb0UbJHeBI1T9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0207156',5.8,1515,'en','These Old Broads','Network television executive Gavin hopes to reunite celebrated Hollywood stars Piper Grayson, Kate Westbourne, and Addie Holden in a TV special after their 1960s movie musical Boy Crazy is re-released. Though the three women share the same agent, Gavin\'s seemingly insurmountable obstacle is that they all cannot stand each other.','/3X9nm1Zmiwtebi0gBWGPYCkSPyv.jpg','2001-02-12',89,'Released','They swore they\'d never work together again - their shocking reunion - still throwing tantrums, still stealing headlines, still making producers cry!','These Old Broads',59973,2.383,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15512,_binary '\0','/jU8l7a5iRDhm0ZBPvD2PVAzOLp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0207161',5.7,1521,'en','Time Share','Two single parents, one man and one woman, along with their kids, have to involuntarily share a house for their holidays.','/vMPtJVRonWXOWYN9cNmlje6YcN6.jpg','2000-06-18',87,'Released',NULL,'Time Share',20310,1.8833,5.8,'Oy4r7-4dmRM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15513,_binary '\0','/whKiywHUvnuzJkGQDG0KlKE8mad.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0207198',6.8,3813,'de','Was tun, wenn\'s brennt?','The humorous and touching story of six former creative anarchists who lived as house squatters in Berlin during its heyday in the 80s when Berlin was still an island in the middle of the former East Germany. At the end of the 80s, they went their separate ways with the exception of Tim and Hotte, who have remained true to their ideals and continue to fight the issues they did as a group. In 2000, with Berlin as Germany\'s new capital, an event happens forcing the group out of existential reason to reunite and, ultimately, come to terms with the reason they separated 12 years ago.','/z6PHgCsUpcK2n7m577fSJdoIy7k.jpg','2001-11-01',101,'Released','Their friendship was over, and that\'s just the beginning.','What to Do in Case of Fire?',5261,2.1913,6.3,'NEvLJ2y90vw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15514,_binary '\0','/xXHtSqFx8mLjzNGX9oCKQEx2yTa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0207201',6.5,240851,'en','What Women Want','Advertising executive Nick Marshall is as cocky as they come, but what happens to a chauvinistic guy when he can suddenly hear what women are thinking? Nick gets passed over for a promotion, but after an accident enables him to hear women\'s thoughts, he puts his newfound talent to work against Darcy, his new boss, who seems to be infatuated with him.','/eqkBEMDk1316Yx5wVoabWY07JAi.jpg','2000-12-15',127,'Released','He has the power to hear everything women are thinking. Finally... a man is listening.','What Women Want',3981,14.2049,6.451,'VFwHs7fEUNs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15515,_binary '\0','/wB2xUAzjuGK9pVTiGJmv55wrPSF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0207332',7.4,1936,'en','Behind the Planet of the Apes','Roddy McDowall takes you, film by film, from production meetings to make-up sessions, then right onto the movie set to see the actual filming of the science fiction masterpiece. The most comprehensive history of Planet of the Apes ever created, this fascinating 127-minute documentary explores one of the most imaginative and influential series in movie history.','/5Ku4Sn0piPBSm24CC2B5CI3VMuN.jpg','1998-09-05',127,'Released','Journey back to the Planet of the Apes','Behind the Planet of the Apes',17244,2.9103,7.1,'5KBO8R5lQmo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15516,_binary '\0','/jY9fTpIRIOi8DXs9sDHQpllWx3r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0207341',5.7,7107,'hi','बीवी नं 1','Two adorable kids, a quirky mother-in-law and a happy-go-lucky friend help a heartbroken wife bring a straying husband back from the other woman\'s tangled embrace.','/4c787y8j6XCuJHDv13Yuwu0FHmw.jpg','1999-05-28',140,'Released',NULL,'Biwi No.1',161226,1.2451,5.836,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15517,_binary '\0','/wmBht7UNgVJvDgdMn54svzhQ78I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0207524',6.8,3741,'en','How to Kill Your Neighbor\'s Dog','The story of Peter McGowan, a chain-smoking, impotent, insomniac playwright who lives in Los Angeles. Once very successful, he is now in the tenth year of a decade-long string of production failures. He finds himself bonding with a new neighbor\'s lonely young daughter who has mild cerebral palsy; and during one of his middle-of-the-night strolls, he encounters his oddball doppelgänger.','/6SnhJrYar2gedIdyIqlLwagBmCr.jpg','2002-02-22',107,'Released',NULL,'How to Kill Your Neighbor\'s Dog',13791,2.3712,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15518,_binary '\0','/nb6jf5vGmng5MXD5JWZVI2JP98I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0207805',7.4,5216,'en','Tuesdays with Morrie','A journalist finds himself questioning his own life when his best friend, a dying man, offers him some very powerful wisdom and advice for coping in relationships, careers and society.','/agRmUjQBHVA1b0QmZDWyS5o2f4d.jpg','1999-12-05',89,'Released','When you know how to die, you know how to live.','Tuesdays with Morrie',26133,1.9922,7.4,'V1N4W7_Qhao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15519,_binary '\0','/xXbEXEYJrEcMJ4RKbTeLtrlCMl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0207972',6.7,6473,'en','Annie','Things seem pretty bad for a young girl living a \"hard-knock life\" in an orphanage. Fed up with the dastardly Miss Hannigan, Annie escapes the run-down orphanage determined to find her mom and dad. It\'s an adventure that takes her from the cold, mean streets of New York to the warm, comforting arms of bighearted billionaire Oliver Warbucks - with plenty of mischief and music in between.','/y0XWZC1A7PbWf1gwmvbvhY9uWM2.jpg','1999-11-07',90,'Released','Disney makes the classical musical more magical than ever!','Annie',26177,2.9837,6.5,'sbXzg1KyIZ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15520,_binary '\0','/wAmg1DdrJgHYE4I3K2IVv1S5orO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0208003',5.3,96949,'en','Big Momma\'s House','When a street-smart FBI agent is sent to Georgia to protect a beautiful single mother and her son from an escaped convict, he is forced to impersonate a crass Southern granny known as Big Momma in order to remain incognito.','/5YoSFqpTz5qIxsX61CPMGKONQIY.jpg','2000-05-31',98,'Released','This FBI agent is going undercover... and he\'s concealing more than a weapon.','Big Momma\'s House',9600,11.0463,5.818,'QPEzzJYsPbY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15521,_binary '\0','/v8UmWYn6HytXoVII3SArg5SscOA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0208026',5.7,1349,'it','C\'era un cinese in coma','A talent agent with a truly talentless client roster, Ercole Preziosi finds himself in trouble when a car crash injures his star comedian, so he turns to his young plucky driver to do stand-up duty.','/hzFFl7CPRIpOhj8mxgG9KCvKD98.jpg','2000-03-03',108,'Released',NULL,'C\'era un cinese in coma',44933,1.295,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15522,_binary '\0','/kHOawTYL4tRc8uo0EHN375XmcRX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0208032',7,1336,'en','Canone Inverso','Costanza is drinking a beer in a Prague pub, a summer night in 1968, while a violinist enters and starts playing a \"canone inverso\" for her. It is not a case, that music and that violin have a story behind that could concern her. It is the love story between Jeno Varga and the music, between Jeno and Sophie.','/2l8wiy3rFNwMQbV4Lf55FrxnkJl.jpg','2000-02-11',107,'Released',NULL,'Making Love',29866,1.5055,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15523,_binary '\0','/gTghF8ardwJ48XLHkiapWk3ZmSo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0208092',8.2,985753,'en','Snatch','Unscrupulous boxing promoters, violent bookies, a Russian gangster, incompetent amateur robbers, and supposedly Jewish jewellers fight to track down a priceless stolen diamond.','/kJZoAHq1SLDdWjeNGtlHAnGpmFV.jpg','2000-09-01',103,'Released','Stealin\' stones and breakin\' bones.','Snatch',107,19.2839,7.83,'ni4tEtuTccc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15524,_binary '\0','/fLyZasxfwz7X9yZQe7dQ2P1c4ms.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0208101',6.6,4326,'en','Don\'t Look Under the Bed','A girl calls on her brother\'s imaginary friend to banish a mischievous boogeyman who has framed her for his pranks.','/hsa9gmUnaWPnsD7EBcsxqo1Rlze.jpg','1999-10-09',93,'Released','This Halloween, whatever you do...','Don\'t Look Under the Bed',70772,3.6991,6.5,'sj7W_loSNiU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15525,_binary '\0','/pGGswtb4058kSBTRrdXmCMXTZFI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0208181',6.6,1292,'es','Todo el poder','When a Mexican film director becomes fed up with the crime and corruption in his homeland, he decides to single-handedly take on a powerful band of criminals.','/uFPuSRWBYEHybthKHAiyXZMv3jf.jpg','2000-01-21',102,'Released','He films what nobody else sees.','Gimme Power',62353,1.2277,6.7,'SOgQvqJVFgo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15526,_binary '\0','/yUZWgQIC3SHNyGHOciH1yPlTikc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0208196',7.1,10656,'en','Happy Accidents','A comedy that pays tribute to the science fiction genre -- specifically, the sub-genre of time travel. But here the alternate reality is contemporary New York City where past and future experiences of trust, commitment and denial are cleverly put to the test. Just as Ruby is beginning to relish her first-ever healthy relationship, Sam begins muttering about being a time traveler from the year 2470.','/ihDJpDbKpVjxx9bzo9i6MdhS5dm.jpg','2000-01-25',110,'Released','Sometimes the future is better than it used to be.','Happy Accidents',22230,2.3508,6.807,'Ew0ALiiBmlg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15527,_binary '\0','/guTKlQh7Na7bec8SoAzSfYQWaUK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0208298',7.1,2038,'en','The Miracle Maker','A mother and father in search of help for their sick daughter cross paths with an extraordinary carpenter named Jesus, who has devoted his life to spreading God\'s word. An amazing miracle brings to light the true meaning of Christ, and the sacrifices he endured for the deliverance of mankind. A compelling story of faith, trust, and devotion.','/kdloDloT8L5UehG5kMpoSTjfmZl.jpg','2000-03-31',87,'Released','A visually stunning animation of the greatest story ever told.','The Miracle Maker',30628,3.1156,6.2,'32Ie1hH9g4g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15528,_binary '\0','/7KkagcMkv4H4pGVM3a5udrNLhxn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0208606',7.3,5246,'tr','Üçüncü Sayfa','Isa is blamed for a robbery. He is badly beaten and given twenty four hours to return the money. Instead of finding the money, Isa finds a gun.','/2oQbtc0FXEDpyyLc4Yv7TEpQNTE.jpg','1999-10-29',92,'Released',NULL,'The Third Page',79085,1.8354,7.029,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15529,_binary '\0','/qkMUH7xH6q8wIlfvefl1MArI9h5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0208654',7.3,4359,'en','\'Twas the Night Before Christmas','When a town learns that Santa Claus has struck it off his delivery schedule due to an insulting letter, a way must be found to change his mind.','/i5qPfBSeKjNbFPl1CseOUSNqKGe.jpg','1974-12-08',25,'Released',NULL,'\'Twas the Night Before Christmas',26547,2.1899,6.675,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15530,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0208675',7,1377,'es','Sexo por compasión','Dolores is a mature and kind woman whose husband abandons her because he can\'t stand her uncanny generosity. Desperate to get her husband back, she devotes her life to works of charity, which is to go to bed with the other men of the town. Dolores, now \"Lolita\", becomes so famous that all men seek out her help now. It is through her compassionate sex that she brings back the colour and the happiness to a town that was immersed in sadness. Written by HoMordomo.','/rHYhEHAsCpJKCDmWbqvBbuY5LyS.jpg','2000-06-30',109,'Released',NULL,'Compassionate Sex',96892,1.5633,5.75,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15531,_binary '\0','/9Ozm2xSLu292GTo06JJrlkGGDfq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0208874',6.9,26200,'en','The Contender','The vice president is dead, and as the president makes his choice for a replacement, a secret contest of wills is being waged by a formidable rival. When Senator Laine Hanson is nominated as the first woman in history to hold the office, hidden agendas explode into a battle for power.','/duRe0F2GYHIDvqe2bqIAMP4gWeP.jpg','2000-10-13',126,'Released','Sometimes you can assassinate a leader without firing a shot.','The Contender',6521,4.2449,6.7,'c9bC0mg_nJY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15532,_binary '\0','/5mzPqkesqAtL6o0yTPORJ02SrBn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0208903',6.4,1974,'hi','डिस्को डांसर','Street singer Anil is humiliated and—with his mother—driven out of Bombay. He soon becomes an acclaimed performer but the enemies from his past plot to destroy his hard-earned career.','/3vc1MMLflENJ8sHwbHjzedT07Hv.jpg','1982-12-10',134,'Released','Come, sing, and conquer.','Disco Dancer',19887,2.2123,6.1,'hg4ON3-cD9I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15533,_binary '\0','/Fh1C6xUiOYCE4MTvo5B2t7dSzb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0208911',6.3,2061,'en','The King Is Alive','Stranded in the heat of a barren African desert, eleven bus-passengers shelter in the remnants of an abandoned town. As rescue grows more remote by the day and anxiety deepens, an idea emerges: why not stage a play. However the choice of King Lear only manages to plunge this disparate group of travelers into turmoil as they struggle to overcome both nature\'s wrath and their own morality.','/ktnT4AsCy2tG3lld3DDdiLPzT3w.jpg','2000-05-11',110,'Released','As the sand shifts... madness nears.','The King Is Alive',10613,2.0793,5.5,'y1y2Ue5Vd98','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15534,_binary '\0','/iJ5vebaRUwcLSuKXfpXT8GzChGr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0208988',5.2,39489,'en','Get Carter','Jack Carter, a mob enforcer living in Las Vegas, travels back to his hometown of Seattle for his brother\'s funeral. During this visit, Carter realizes that the death of his brother was not accidental, but a murder. With this knowledge, Carter sets out to kill all those responsible.','/xGANaRWD6638ch1qQmqgRp395R6.jpg','2000-10-06',102,'Released','The Truth Hurts','Get Carter',10461,5.0696,5.2,'wAUlHeqkn7w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15535,_binary '\0','/fA7ptJVPbph8cZLVc1yaZIsTULk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0208990',7.3,21488,'it','La stanza del figlio','A psychoanalyst and his family go through profound emotional trauma when their son dies in a scuba diving accident.','/e9s1Hvw9TcVZspbkq2V8Bmvhky1.jpg','2001-03-09',99,'Released',NULL,'The Son\'s Room',11447,3.5116,7.087,'9WZQ5641lFs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15536,_binary '\0','/l6LAf2uXdLAjiKr98uNHK8CDDL9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0208993',6.9,1803,'en','Downtown \'81','The film is a day in the life of a young artist, Jean-Michel Basquiat, who needs to raise money to reclaim the apartment from which he has been evicted. He wanders the downtown streets carrying a painting he hopes to sell, encountering friends, whose lives (and performances) we peek into.','/lAWr0YaC1PaflYT08GBLToqYhW9.jpg','2001-07-13',72,'Released',NULL,'Downtown \'81',26571,1.3904,6.7,'pZ6qzDnQzGI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15537,_binary '\0','/rojr0vsJSxcxaDmnPja4Adm5e4P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0208995',5.5,1778,'ko','거짓말','A Korean high school student and a married sculptor embark on a sexual odyssey soaked in sadomasochism and love.','/tq7ow02nirK4UgBy84KPEA7P4DC.jpg','2000-01-08',112,'Released','Tell me… lies.','Lies',45043,2.2718,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15538,_binary '\0','/t6tLfIFUEWRaqi1lR5ETeNXFf7c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0209037',6.9,3382,'nl','Iedereen beroemd!','Jean is a family man and factory worker who dreams of becoming a songwriter. Pinning his hopes on his teenage daughter, Marva, he takes her to singing contests in which the awkward and overweight girl struggles to belt out a tune. When Jean is suddenly fired because of cut backs, he is ashamed and even more desperate to have his daughter succeed. In a chance meeting Jean kidnaps the most famous pop star in the country and holds her hostage demanding to be heard by the music industry. Catching the attention of the media and the eyes of the nation, Jean and Marva realize that the show must go on until everyone is famous.','/iPVRGoOQ6N9sMYYJW8OLT2CqDnO.jpg','2000-04-12',97,'Released',NULL,'Everybody\'s Famous!',58886,1.1191,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15539,_binary '\0','/uw5uCdiF0HSCyXml0GsUe95ejuw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0209077',5.8,32304,'en','Ken Park','Teen skater Ken Park (nicknamed Krap Nek; his name spelled and pronounced backward) kills himself at a Visalia skate park; his death bookends the lives of four other young people who knew him: Shawn, the most conventional; Tate brims with psychotic rage; Claude is habitually harassed by his brutish father and coddled, rather uncomfortably, by his enormously pregnant mother; and Peaches looks after her devoutly religious father, but yearns for freedom. They\'re all rather tight, or so they claim.','/p6ElNTWEbibYlobVeiIDHBvL1kF.jpg','2003-01-30',97,'Released',NULL,'Ken Park',7090,7.9843,6,'fG2XpMIPPCo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15540,_binary '\0','/7Wev9JMo6R5XAfz2KDvXb7oPMmy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0209144',8.4,1459037,'en','Memento','Leonard Shelby is tracking down the man who raped and murdered his wife. The difficulty of locating his wife\'s killer, however, is compounded by the fact that he suffers from a rare, untreatable form of short-term memory loss. Although he can recall details of life before his accident, Leonard cannot remember what happened fifteen minutes ago, where he\'s going, or why.','/nzlv62aC0octS5AklAiWpXLX9Z0.jpg','2000-10-11',113,'Released','Some memories are best forgotten.','Memento',77,19.1663,8.173,'-Dt_pjGQFbU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15541,_binary '\0','/7s7WkAFPBsMTprYMbqbgKoppQsR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0209163',6.4,371181,'en','The Mummy Returns','Rick and Evelyn O’Connell, along with their 8-year-old son Alex, discover the key to the legendary Scorpion King’s might: the fabled Bracelet of Anubis. Unfortunately, a newly resurrected Imhotep has designs on the bracelet as well, and isn’t above kidnapping its new bearer, Alex, to gain control of Anubis’s otherworldly army.','/kdJsW7hcy1lrj7tdMPycTAQPAiR.jpg','2001-05-04',130,'Released','Adventure is reborn.','The Mummy Returns',1734,18.9888,6.415,'ptmLrNpmcBo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15542,_binary '\0','/4B0aETcNjXngyxWcFNfbGIHSaUu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0209174',5.9,2674,'es','Nadie conoce a nadie','Simón is an aspiring novelist who makes a living designing crossword puzzles for a newspaper. One day he receives a threatening message instructing him to include the word \"adversary\" in a puzzle as Seville gets hit by a series of violent attacks.','/nEKnYQnKrOHaY5VG8uF7C9O0YjL.jpg','1999-11-26',105,'Released',NULL,'Nobody Knows Anybody',38091,1.8847,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15543,_binary '\0','/mAOw4PFjZDQMJTj4fXqUG2Vyqef.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0209180',8.2,5729,'sr','Небеска удица','Belgrade during the height of the war Yugoslavia in 1999. Kaja struggles with daily destruction and the constant threat of being drafted, but also with his impending divorce from his wife Tijana, who wants to emigrate with their son.','/mwBdKiwlxGiYT38SzO4Zp4kGGZw.jpg','2000-02-10',95,'Released',NULL,'Sky Hook',110366,1.7322,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15544,_binary '\0','/3YtzK8eWLjJ23xxXqkqxtaSnKYE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0209189',7.7,9890,'zh','一个都不能少','Set in the People\'s Republic of China during the 1990s, the film centers on a 13-year-old substitute teacher, Wei Minzhi, in the Chinese countryside. Called in to substitute for a village teacher for one month, Wei is told not to lose any students.','/eERKaWCIRh3a8rPjUu1z34OYZD8.jpg','1999-10-30',106,'Released','In her village, she was the teacher. In the city, she discovered how much she had to learn.','Not One Less',36210,2.4561,7.522,'r2nZwReoubM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15545,_binary '\0','/jJbUhrfncDTCJenKQBrC6ka1LVH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0209264',3.7,4267,'en','Python','After a military plane crashes outside of a small American town, its cargo — a genetically engineered, sixty-foot-long python — begins stalking and killing the locals.','/lDbTpRHTRFWBK4j0FAWpE4M5WT2.jpg','2000-08-09',99,'Released','Sixty feet of pure terror!','Python',41275,2.9042,5.2,'n5KSLda6boc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15546,_binary '\0','/4COmOn4lUd6pHyuHt2ehx1kLmHR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0209322',6.2,3936,'en','Skipped Parts','A woman and her son must leave a small South Carolina town because of her wild behavior.','/fnlTjsdjQysQ46IE3OMWeJtvP6e.jpg','2000-06-06',100,'Released','There\'s nothing like knowing what you\'ve been missing.','Skipped Parts',41282,3.0626,6.1,'ZVJrAA0CgTQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15547,_binary '\0','/b9UPNXGV7mEUmLejR8caJIJijow.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0209463',7.4,14349,'fa','باد ما را خواهد برد','Irreverent city engineer Behzad comes to a rural Kurdish village in Iran to keep vigil for a dying relative. In the meanwhile the film follows his efforts to fit in with the local community and how he changes his own attitudes as a result.','/tzrqZungDYA3Djp61NWUm7DtxNI.jpg','1999-09-23',118,'Released',NULL,'The Wind Will Carry Us',43423,5.3181,7.141,'xq1gXC3119A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15548,_binary '\0','/h6D695KwxdjFWteDwZ6LHOfICr6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0209475',5.4,94153,'en','The Wedding Planner','San Francisco\'s premiere wedding planner, Mary Fiore is rescued from an accident by the man of her dreams, pediatrician Steve Edison, only to find he is the fiancé of her latest client. As Mary continues making their wedding arrangements, she and Steve are put into a string of uncomfortable situations that force them to face their mutual attraction.','/meq4bLUPcBlOG3Z5YdiWuBMlpO.jpg','2001-01-26',103,'Released','A romantic comedy about love, destiny and other events you just can\'t plan for.','The Wedding Planner',2018,7.2516,5.928,'KAuxlHrDZJ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15549,_binary '\0','/1C84Yg3F2CgGJlOilvXBP8OZCMB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0209933',7.3,18725,'fr','Beau Travail','Foreign Legion officer Galoup recalls his once glorious life, training troops in the Gulf of Djibouti. His existence there was happy, strict and regimented, until the arrival of a promising young recruit, Sentain, plants the seeds of jealousy in Galoup\'s mind.','/5ySa1aQaT7kMcAbKwlS1HXxp2hM.jpg','2000-05-03',93,'Released','Maybe freedom begins with remorse.','Beau Travail',14626,4.1152,7.1,'Hh4HzACZOOQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15550,_binary '\0','/iFJ7GEIjIysbEJ36TohH28x6Nyu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0209958',6.4,116003,'en','The Cell','A psychotherapist journeys inside a comatose serial killer in the hopes of saving his latest victim.','/1LX8AOUGDSrBDzgC4KLtRvyJFgY.jpg','2000-08-18',107,'Released','Enter the mind of a killer.','The Cell',8843,9.6495,6.286,'44jpefZclO4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15551,_binary '\0','/brTqP0WG8G6x7QDgxdzCJ8jUaCV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0210044',6.6,2275,'en','Flowers for Algernon','Charlie Gordon is mentally handicapped and all he wants in life is to be a genius. When he gets picked for experimental surgery it looks like his dream may finally come true. But the surgery has side effects that could could kill Charlie. Can Charlie survive being just plain old \"Charlie Gordon\" and will his newfound romance survive this test of character?','/20dVWa6Ujpsx6nQxaSp0cEhX3Tu.jpg','2000-02-20',91,'Released','Last month, Charlie Gordon couldn\'t read. Now he\'s quoting Shakespeare. Can the medical miracle that changed his life help him understand the meaning of love?','Flowers for Algernon',29136,1.4432,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15552,_binary '\0','/ku7mvHEMZlVejvgkfc8dbIjmYy8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0210056',6,1354,'pl','Fuks','Two broken, police, destruction of property by arson with an explosive charge, stealing a car. Not bad for one night! Such is the balance of Alex\'s eighteenth birthday - the main hero of the film.','/z6VGEoa8IAU6yV0GunR2OAxo4zL.jpg','1999-08-20',86,'Released',NULL,'Fluke',36387,1.0406,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15553,_binary '\0','/8zmWwgtiPCWBzxCiRHdmBZoPvXc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0210065',6.7,15968,'en','Gangster No. 1','An old gangster is advised that Freddie Mays would leave jail after thirty years in prison. His mood changes and he recalls when he was a young punk and who joined Freddie\'s gang—a man he both envied and ultimately betrayed.','/t8eUSsD2reaIR9qmklU7O2GCVn4.jpg','2000-06-09',103,'Released','There can only be ONE!','Gangster No. 1',10394,3.2812,6.4,'NEXQkWlG8b8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15554,_binary '\0','/7GAgYVK29A4NADWhPbqC9c44X7P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0210070',6.8,58314,'en','Ginger Snaps','The story of two outcast sisters, Ginger and Brigitte, in the mindless suburban town of Bailey Downs. On the night of Ginger\'s first period, she is savagely attacked by a wild creature. Ginger\'s wounds miraculously heal but something is not quite right. Now Brigitte must save her sister and save herself.','/ozohDiJd7Oi65NEf8B0ya7lR9Fr.jpg','2000-12-11',108,'Released','They don\'t call it the curse for nothing.','Ginger Snaps',9871,6.4784,6.9,'011YdVip2KM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15555,_binary '\0','/5T59V9V2X0I1eK3GRBrJmXdQRmv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0210075',6.7,10758,'en','Girlfight','Diana Guzman, a troubled Brooklyn teenager, decides to channel her aggression by training to become a boxer, all while keeping it a secret from her father.','/ydHUoYtpZdkwxdroK1rWyEpJrLZ.jpg','2000-09-29',110,'Released','Prove them wrong.','Girlfight',19348,2.4768,6.5,'d2OXRBDRRg4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15556,_binary '\0','/ptneUQh83QXVAzTetYZJPJrracq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0210094',5.4,2891,'en','Happy Campers','Chaos and rampant hormones reign when teenage counselors are left in charge during their summer-camp director\'s absence.','/xUB8brmv36Yk7rSiVdGuYIGSghf.jpg','2001-01-21',94,'Released','The excitement is In-tents!','Happy Campers',24273,1.8454,5.4,'u4Mf6_gjYko','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15557,_binary '\0','/bS93S5uEVZng4qmDhmDMXTSEuay.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0210234',6.1,26350,'ja','劇場版ポケットモンスター 幻のポケモン ルギア爆誕','When Lawrence III\'s scheme to capture the Legendary Pokémon Lugia upsets the balance of nature, it is up to Ash Ketchum and his friends to save the world.','/6u65C8aG4krAVyHsTjAMF7ucTDH.jpg','1999-07-17',84,'Released','One person can make all the difference.','Pokémon the Movie 2000',12599,7.1768,6.747,'3uwx7tnwdCw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15558,_binary '\0','/1ExirZYN7X0Vowg57XW71JQHtxo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0210299',7.3,3875,'en','Songcatcher','After being denied a promotion at the university where she teaches, Doctor Lily Penleric, a brilliant musicologist, impulsively visits her sister, who runs a struggling rural school in Appalachia. There she stumbles upon the discovery of her life - a treasure trove of ancient Scots-Irish ballads, songs that have been handed down from generation to generation, preserved intact by the seclusion of the mountains. With the goal of securing her promotion, Lily ventures into the most isolated areas of the mountains to collect the songs and finds herself increasingly enchanted.','/qpUSLY5BPi42rqO097tNF8e53Qm.jpg','2001-03-01',109,'Released','Fall under its spell..','Songcatcher',62677,1.3286,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15559,_binary '\0','/bDh2Jk5MxeYaSf9ERWY5meMM6Hj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0210302',6.7,3226,'ja','双生児 -GEMINI-','When his mother\'s untimely death quickly follows his father\'s, a doctor begins to believe a killer may be targeting him and his amnesiac wife.','/aZGZfip534xdCN0EgjHTzWYHNAL.jpg','1999-09-15',84,'Released',NULL,'Gemini',27276,2.3808,6.5,'Uib42ItprBA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15560,_binary '\0','/luJNpYRsOH0Ee1qzAL7MsQVdm0X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0210358',6.4,7740,'en','Things You Can Tell Just by Looking at Her','In California, a group of women struggle with personal problems as their paths intertwine in unexpected ways. Dr. Elaine Keener, the sole caretaker for her aging mother, turns to tarot card reader Christine for spiritual aid. Christine grapples with her own angst due to her lover\'s debilitating illness. Meanwhile, a bank manager deals with an unwanted pregnancy, two sisters pursue romantic interests and a housewife gets back into the dating game.','/vTeEzAj0Uv8ySwdh894tEGvSh4s.jpg','2000-05-27',109,'Released','Men have their will. Women have their way.','Things You Can Tell Just by Looking at Her',20067,2.54,5.8,'LngW9j0y4fM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15561,_binary '\0','/7V4vwJrieINgLYwDAAHEZmlvCIB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0210382',5.8,10550,'en','The Weight of Water','A newspaper photographer researches an 1873 double homicide and finds her own life paralleling that of a witness who survived the tragic ordeal.','/zkFW3Vgz6rAds4cvHBke8fryeZ4.jpg','2001-03-30',113,'Released','Hell hath no fury...','The Weight of Water',13526,3.361,5.436,'nelE1UbylSE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15562,_binary '\0','/aAFGSvMO2wcw5IPx30JeKg6diWj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0210389',6.7,1708,'en','Wisconsin Death Trip','Inspired by the book of the same name, film-maker James Marsh relays a tale of tragedy, murder and mayhem that erupted behind the respectable facade of Black River Falls, Wisconsin in the 19th century.','/atngFVxShIsk2KDQdHnehtRtSZA.jpg','1999-09-05',76,'Released',NULL,'Wisconsin Death Trip',37044,1.1972,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15563,_binary '\0','/e0rLPw4rPgXjvMjH3NwcoTWYvnl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0210567',5.7,4523,'en','Beautiful','Headstrong Mona Hubbard is fiercely driven to capture the coveted Miss American Miss beauty award, but an unusual circumstance teams her with a soccer-playing, deep-dimpled little girl named Vanessa.','/aTjJFrADfQhyp9gDgY71YSxf2Ks.jpg','2000-09-29',112,'Released','Sometimes you have to give up the life of your dreams to discover the dream of your life.','Beautiful',34299,1.6411,5.8,'m1IpRlg6DuM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15564,_binary '\0','/zYbsfhGi7G5AzLizqzurvuj6z6n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0210584',6.2,2539,'en','Bootmen','Sean Odkin loves to dance—much to his fathers distain. When the woman he loves cannot return his love, he goes in search of the only thing that can make him whole again—dancing.','/zeRwE01YkmGxuE6LI2XpcWg4Ywl.jpg','2000-10-05',89,'Released','When you don\'t know your next step...improvise.','Bootmen',21370,1.931,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15565,_binary '\0','/kyZ3gfWFRYo1h0OLXRe9eQof0OD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0210609',6.6,2066,'hi','China Gate','After witnessing the brutal slaying of her Forest Officer father, Sunder Rajan, at the hands of dreaded dacoit Jageera, Sandhya goes to Colonel Krishnakant Puri and asks for his assistance in bringing an end to Jageera\'s rule in the Devdurg region. Krishnakant agrees to assist her, and summons about a dozen of his fellow officers and subordinates to assist him. They all assemble at Devdurg with all the necessary ammunitions and arms to combat Jageera, not realizing that Jageera has influence over the local police detachment, who will prevent Puri and his men to possess any guns and weapons. This does not deter Puri and his men, and they continue to stay on in Devdurg and gain the confidence of the villagers. What the villagers do not know that Krishnakant and his men had all been dishonorably discharged from the army for cowardice and retreating when attacked by the enemy. Will Puri and his men abandon Devdurg and let history repeat itself?','/83Z4Vx01zIwftnpeoELknrGz8Lu.jpg','1998-11-27',179,'Released',NULL,'China Gate',103048,1.4634,6.711,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15566,_binary '\0','/f3cTz9cEPgrWWECMAGIYO9gRSLs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0210616',6.7,22918,'en','Center Stage','A group of 12 teenagers from various backgrounds enroll at the American Ballet Academy in New York to make it as ballet dancers and each one deals with the problems and stress of training and getting ahead in the world of dance.','/95Et0t08Nv6S8FD593HpXyvcRt8.jpg','2000-05-12',115,'Released','Life doesn\'t hold tryouts.','Center Stage',10560,3.7145,6.9,'tf7vVdDExuM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15567,_binary '\0','/sV5bKNU246dhWWI8zVFVarxGKe5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0210628',7.1,2443,'en','The Crossing','A made-for-TV dramatization of George Washington\'s perilous gamble of crossing the Delaware River and attacking the British forces at Trenton.','/9LuskivFVMBaUf1RFfqUwE8KNwG.jpg','2000-01-10',89,'Released',NULL,'The Crossing',40878,2.1046,6.4,'WgTLmaTYdz8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15568,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0210659',6.8,3820,'hi','दूल्हे राजा','Poor Raja opens a fast foot restaurant right opposite a five star hotel run by its owner Singhania, earning his wrath. The wealthy hotel owner uses all his influence to remove Raja, but in vain. Things get worse for the wealthy man, when his daughter Kiran wants to marry the poor hotelier. The wealthy man refuses, leading to a confrontation and a condition - which Raja fulfills, he becomes rich virtually overnight, and proposes for the hand of Kiran. The wealthy hotelier reluctantly accepts him as his son-in-law, only to have Kiran elope with a man named Rahul.','/2sr6IDYP0ex53UEmLXA4garBt0o.jpg','1998-07-10',155,'Released',NULL,'Dulhe Raja',54971,1.0689,6.268,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15569,_binary '\0','/kI3EFRfElQZITZAHKn1pzqxx2AD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0210701',1.5,1371,'de','German Fried Movie','A series of comedic sketches.','/cEdpAzouR072JkAXnN2D84P3BxX.jpg','1992-04-09',88,'Released',NULL,'German Fried Movie',264340,1.1295,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15570,_binary '\0','/sH5OViBgXC4pROdtPjGsQgXznsL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0210717',6.6,2399,'es','Goya en Burdeos','Francisco Goya (1746-1828), deaf and ill, lives the last years of his life in voluntary exile in Bordeaux, a Liberal protesting the oppressive rule of Ferdinand VII. He\'s living with his much younger wife Leocadia and their daughter Rosario. He continues to paint at night, and in flashbacks stirred by conversations with his daughter, by awful headaches, and by the befuddlement of age, he relives key times in his life.','/yCn4Sz3uYy6a1aObs80hzMHp7hM.jpg','1999-09-04',100,'Released',NULL,'Goya in Bordeaux',170767,1.4863,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15571,_binary '\0','/a0YYt75e6Tn39231oXDypqlHEzX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0210719',5.7,2191,'en','The Great Gatsby','Stock broker Nick Carraway consents to play Cupid for his rich married cousin Daisy Buchanan and her former love, nouveau riche Jay Gatsby.','/k7pqsA76PCuyYAZWIvJ09U15mpT.jpg','2000-03-29',90,'Released','He risked it all to give first love a second chance.','The Great Gatsby',34027,2.18,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15572,_binary '\0','/lJEQru8ODRJlWwqWxVXhU5Babrt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0210727',7.4,6051,'fr','Himalaya - L\'Enfance d\'un chef','As the denizens of a Tibetan village prepare for their arduous annual trek to exchange salt for grain, the community\'s allegiances are split between aging chieftain Tinle and rebellious young Karma. Tinle tries to maintain his clout and preserve obedience to ancient customs when Karma challenges the old man\'s power.','/zppCfYBl0kRTpD9T0KTlZG5ZpWw.jpg','1999-09-13',108,'Released',NULL,'Himalaya',26813,2.8943,7.4,'1q8c6hzEyr0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15573,_binary '\0','/yroH7saHnyQZLaLXIBq3yhFRvul.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0210843',7.3,3855,'es','El mismo amor, la misma lluvia','Jorge is a writer for a left-leaning Buenos Aires magazine that\'s at odds with the country\'s military dictatorship. He meets lovely and intelligent actress Laura and begins an on-and-off romance that will continue for the next two decades. Fearful of commitment, Jorge initially moves on from her and his fortunes suffer, but the situation changes when he and Laura renew their acquaintance. Meanwhile, the country undergoes a political transformation.','/qSeUv634CRFlHsmdXcUCQkcxqAt.jpg','1999-09-16',100,'Released',NULL,'Same Love, Same Rain',44516,1.6069,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15574,_binary '\0','/nvKjpzAGiSjiqCUmckwXDU1k30u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0210916',7.8,2075,'zh','那山那人那狗','An old postman has spent his whole life delivering mail to the mountain of Hunan and is about to retire, his only son due to take over his duties.','/hnsgCd6YtM0R3tpbsVLy5J1oKZd.jpg','1999-10-22',93,'Released',NULL,'Postmen in the Mountains',108954,5.6758,7.68,'WTKOYvKtAAs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15575,_binary '\0','/yrdp38bUpwcSNuu6FAjl76Uy49e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0210943',6.4,2776,'en','Relative Values','A comedy of discriminating taste and dirty little secrets. In 1952 England, Nigel, the Earl of Marshwood, woos Hollywood star Miranda, upsetting both Nigel\'s mother, Countess Felicity, and Miranda\'s former love fellow Hollywood star Don. Right before the engagement party at Marshwood, Moxie, the Countess\'s personal maid and best friend, reveals that Miranda is her estranged sister. Crestwell, the Countess\'s butler, devises a plan - but an inebriated Don\'s arrival at Marshwood to talk to Miranda causes all chaos to break loose.','/jhTusqXqn2lTB9In49Y3UmWliz3.jpg','2000-06-23',87,'Released',NULL,'Relative Values',55302,2.3509,6.152,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15576,_binary '\0','/7lwo8VLHD8Va49DKuszabpm41V9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0210945',7.8,253770,'en','Remember the Titans','After leading his football team to 15 winning seasons, coach Bill Yoast is demoted and replaced by Herman Boone – tough, opinionated and as different from the beloved Yoast as he could be. The two men learn to overcome their differences and turn a group of hostile young men into champions.','/825ohvC4wZ3gCuncCaqkWeQnK8h.jpg','2000-09-29',113,'Released','History is written by the winners.','Remember the Titans',10637,10.7643,7.7,'nPhu9XsRl4M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15577,_binary '\0','/l9lmAJ2JzasKUnd6GJmCsIkWqJz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0211126',7.8,3830,'hi','Zakhm','Amidst religious riots, a son deals with his mother\'s life-threatening injuries, and her last request.','/qXJWHVj3vcQviTKpKGHjYMypitj.jpg','1998-12-14',125,'Released',NULL,'Zakhm',155308,1.2759,7.474,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15578,_binary '\0','/1GKHwfn66E6kWMJkBD158Y8VyKT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0211174',5.5,2483,'en','Up, Up, and Away','A boy is the only member of his family without superpowers, yet the world depends on him saving his family from computerized brainwashers. Will he realize that it doesn\'t take superpowers to be a hero in time to help them defeat the villains?','/kKBOr6r4EcCNFC2seWYbFn9mZWj.jpg','2000-01-22',77,'Released','In a family of superheroes, the greatest power is just being yourself.','Up, Up, and Away',124134,2.3954,5.5,'oE__hjHkedU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15579,_binary '\0','/eqZ5t82asfprFcNS56eVruNT5G5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0211181',4.9,42306,'en','102 Dalmatians','Get ready for a howling good time as an all new assortment of irresistible animal heroes are unleashed in this great family tail! In an unlikely alliance, the outrageous Waddlesworth - a parrot who thinks he\'s a Rottweiler - teams up with Oddball - an un-marked Dalmatian puppy eager to earn her spots! Together they embark on a laugh-packed quest to outwit the ever-scheming Cruella De Vil.','/ueE6u2GTECzGBtas6PFx7wwi9y0.jpg','2000-10-07',100,'Released','Meet Two Unlikely Heroes With A Bone To Pick.','102 Dalmatians',10481,9.6584,5.5,'VytB0HxR2eQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15580,_binary '\0','/kyiXkhIuLVnIckofSqXbV0jlDA6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0211286',6.3,1949,'fr','La Bûche','Christmas, family, and infidelity. Yvette\'s husband has died, and her grown daughters join her at the grave: Sonia, wealthy, bourgeois, and generous; Louba, living with their dad Stanislas, singing at a Russian restaurant, penniless, the mistress for the past 12 years of a man who will never leave his wife; Milla, the youngest, acerbic, lonesome. Christmas was when they learned their parents were divorcing 25 years ago. Over the next few days, yuletide depression, Louba\'s pregnancy, Sonia\'s crumbling marriage, Stanislas\'s overtures to Yvette, and Milla\'s attraction to the man who\'s her father\'s rent-free lodger lead each one to re-examine self, family, and hopes. Is renewal possible?','/fvw98onaQNC31voFO3s7oPFYuu1.jpg','1999-11-24',106,'Released','\'Tis the Season to be Jolly!','Season\'s Beatings',48216,1.1917,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15581,_binary '\0','/iJ5cCaMEdmsqHETDB1Hm5OP9RNe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0211387',6.7,7348,'fr','Gouttes d\'eau sur pierres brûlantes','In 1970s Germany, Léopold, a 50-year-old businessman, picks up and seduces 20-year-old Franz, who swiftly moves into his apartment. The dynamic between them intensifies with the sudden arrival of their ex-girlfriends.','/4hw1WwUyMTV5DmqTvAiC0w3PRjA.jpg','2000-03-15',86,'Released','Based on the first full-length play by R.W. Fassbender.','Water Drops on Burning Rocks',12480,3.321,6.383,'gqt8llBnj0k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15582,_binary '\0','/fR5Hkf4OH6aLExl2qP2ucMV2Xdt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0211443',4.5,67633,'en','Jason X','In the year 2455, Old Earth is now a contaminated planet abandoned for centuries -- a brown world of violent storms, toxic landmasses and poisonous seas. Yet humans have returned to the deadly place that they once fled, not to live, but to research the ancient, rusting artifacts of the long-gone civilizations. But it\'s not the harmful environment that could prove fatal to the intrepid, young explorers who have just landed on Old Earth. For them, it\'s Friday the 13th, and Jason lives!','/ggOND0hfoE0f3K857joSzEeIchb.jpg','2001-11-09',91,'Released','Evil gets an upgrade.','Jason X',11470,8.1849,4.866,'RDwYC3W-Fmc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15583,_binary '\0','/eZTEtIU8AORfmVa7YcRBlAfbgA1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0211465',6.1,25931,'en','Knockaround Guys','Four sons of well-known New York mobsters must retrieve a bag of cash from a small Montana town ruled by a corrupt sheriff.','/oYqsIxxIfJMRHiNEMLzgG81brkY.jpg','2001-11-30',92,'Released','If they don\'t finish the job, their fathers will finish them.','Knockaround Guys',7501,5.1395,6.1,'Am3rYXFhvV8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15584,_binary '\0','/aTQQZCBNbJofoOu4TT26BUTUt1M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0211492',6.8,5067,'en','The Luzhin Defence','Based upon the novel by Vladimir Nabokov, a chess grandmaster travels to Italy in the 1920s to play in a tournament and falls in love.','/tVV3PhTO58R0CAsvWhsUkYDzIEZ.jpg','2000-08-21',109,'Released','Two worlds collide when an eccentric genius falls in love with a strong-willed society beauty.','The Luzhin Defence',52654,2.5304,6.38,'yIDgfR653aI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15585,_binary '\0','/ev9RSoKn4BqOOMMY8GyEnZuUfoV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0211634',6.3,3832,'hi','फोजी','The story follows a young man (Bobby Deol) who flees India and arrives in Australia seeking vengence for something that started in India. In Australia he meets and falls in love with the daughter of a rich and powerful man(Suresh Oberoi). The story keeps the covers on Bobby Deols plan until the end when everything is revealed as to why he is a SOLDIER.','/awlSDbrGNuyk9PBrWm8owf2BLYe.jpg','1998-10-12',156,'Released','He who kills for his country is called...Soldier','Soldier',54959,1.284,5.8,'jaZy6tOkG88','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15586,_binary '\0','/opAFSoknD1LfgBieBGK8Jk6TP96.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0211653',7.8,4424,'ru','Тайна третьей планеты','At the end of the 22nd century Alisa Seleznyova, her father Professor Seleznyov and pilot Zelyony go on a space expedition to find rare animals for Moscow Zoo. On the way they seem to encounter a mysterious conspiracy led by Doctor Verhovtsev against legendary Two Captains Kim and Buran. The only clue is a talking bird Сhatterer [Govorun] that our heroes accidentally took possession of.','/c34bVzr6akMEJ7j2yrzRfgPJlVO.jpg','1981-07-31',50,'Released',NULL,'The Secret of the Third Planet',49802,2.2442,7.419,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15587,_binary '\0','/ufInwr1TStPD0MaLhDESTK2eQeW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0211661',6,2076,'en','Terror Tract','A real estate agent terrifies a couple with the grim fates of the previous owners of a house they\'re looking at.','/L3EUS8zLQ7tLiB7KtXN1le0WQc.jpg','2000-10-18',96,'Released','Horror has a new home.','Terror Tract',87867,2.5924,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15588,_binary '\0','/8azkNy5pgWBWc39liQzEREssM3o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0211718',7.3,3150,'fr','Vengo','Caco is a proud, handsome man, head of a family, and very powerful in the local community. Yet he has been torn to pieces by the death of his beloved daughter. He constantly visits her grave, weeps silently at her photo and has transferred all his wildly protective love and attention onto his mentally challenged nephew, Diego. It seems that Diego\'s father, Caco\'s brother, is in hiding after having killed a man from the Caravaca family, who are equally powerful in the community. They are looking for vengeance and have come to Caco for justice. When he refuses to betray his brother, the Caravacas grow impatient. When they realize they are getting nowhere, they threaten to kill Diego. Despite his fierce pride, Caco eventually realizes that the cycle of killing and revenge must be broken. But how can he achieve this and protect everyone he loves?','/wgWcaqcqZc1ZPNwjgdpbCKoFfNd.jpg','2000-10-04',90,'Released',NULL,'I Come',47108,1.8566,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15589,_binary '\0','/myxHQFGTxEELEwFCsahRE56GigC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0211792',5.2,1863,'en','Cutaway','The successful undercover agent Victor Cooper is assigned for his ninth mission: to find how the loadings of drug is being brought to Miami. He suspects that the drug is coming through the air and joins a team of sky diving, under the leadership of Red Line, a fanatic and considered the athlete number one in this sport in the world. Due to his profile of winner, Vic gets involved with the group and he \"disconnects\" from his position of infiltrated agent, \"connecting\" with the team.','/kiCZFNL6JoSNh0vdKc4GrxPhY5B.jpg','2000-08-26',104,'Released',NULL,'Cutaway',2089,1.9912,5,'XZsH-0DGeO0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15590,_binary '\0','/ed979IzcjcXZTlDaoixnrjTt8FY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0211900',5.9,1453,'fr','Les Acteurs','A self-conscious and self-referential adventure into the (pretend) lives of legendary actors in Paris.','/faSoQARDo0MOrDpiBOYzXbZGNjg.jpg','2000-04-05',103,'Released',NULL,'Actors',48328,2.7316,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15591,_binary '\0','/6n53UI4mX9QMfe2S0Pgt8mGebY1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0211915',8.2,847158,'fr','Le Fabuleux Destin d\'Amélie Poulain','At a tiny Parisian café, the adorable yet painfully shy Amélie accidentally discovers a gift for helping others. Soon Amelie is spending her days as a matchmaker, guardian angel, and all-around do-gooder. But when she bumps into a handsome stranger, will she find the courage to become the star of her very own love story?','/nSxDa3M9aMvGVLoItzWTepQ5h5d.jpg','2001-04-25',122,'Released','She’ll change your life.','Amélie',194,22.6048,7.92,'2UT5xaAfxWU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15592,_binary '\0','/c5TiPhbggc1LWckfd93p8ZFu16X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0211933',6.5,88932,'en','Awake','While undergoing heart surgery, a man experiences a phenomenon called ‘anesthetic awareness’, which leaves him awake but paralyzed throughout the operation. As various obstacles present themselves, his wife must make life-altering decisions while wrestling with her own personal drama.','/xqooV6lR1Kdx4Q52Sim0aGbDTYP.jpg','2007-11-28',84,'Released','Every year, one in 700 people wake up during surgery.','Awake',13483,6.5449,6.596,'RzR2J7_QBHg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15593,_binary '\0','/d5e8wSbYMbJ32mNStPe5pnISdsn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0211934',6.9,22253,'hi','बादशाह','A small time detective is mistaken as a CBI agent and gets embroiled in a deadly mission to save the Chief Minister from an assassination attempt.','/7r1nKEVxIlVQFSsijr3fndD1TDn.jpg','1999-08-27',175,'Released','World\'s most favorite detective.','Baadshah',41902,2.007,6.555,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15594,_binary '\0','/4gd9LCL1l8j88psOKbXtuAbTRlq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0211938',5.7,12537,'en','Bait','Landing in jail for a petty theft crime, Alvin finds himself sharing a cell with John Jaster, the incarcerated half of the pair of high-tech thieves responsible for the missing gold. His partner, Bristol, is still at large. Alvin wants only to get out of prison and start fresh with his girlfriend, Lisa, and when the Feds, led by U.S. Treasury investigator Clenteen, set him loose on a sketchy deal, he thinks his luck has changed. Alvin has his freedom and the Feds have found their bait.','/jon5ux36iUn6GnntxkZaNtB6AZT.jpg','2000-09-15',119,'Released','Alvin Sanders is going to help the Feds catch a killer. He just doesn\'t know it yet.','Bait',14805,4.1182,5.742,'Oc9xF_DvzSw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15595,_binary '\0','/uDl31WSjYoRRLyajhLuo6nelaT8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0211941',5.4,1734,'en','Beat','The true story of two murders that shaped the lives of several college students who went on to become some of the most influential writers of the \"Beat Generation.\"','/dXR7W5Vf7HV1qGiwtIDJPgFxBSM.jpg','2000-01-29',93,'Released','Sex and Drugs before Rock and Roll','Beat',3178,2.8057,5.2,'YkX_CTIY2jw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15596,_binary '\0','/8ZoW4hwuTWxKWDezkoUGBVvyxj5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0211946',7.2,16184,'de','Berlin Calling','A man tours clubs around the globe with his manager and girlfriend. On the eve of their largest album release he is admitted to a psychiatric clinic after overdosing at a gig.','/oxEZwuBATJbAdS2JVrALQDnP0Cu.jpg','2008-10-01',105,'Released',NULL,'Berlin Calling',30508,2.8677,6.8,'drdf8OeBUUM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15597,_binary '\0','/9M1ip5oyn0IRHg9IxNkX3NVZVbp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0212132',7.3,3541,'en','The Tracker','Somewhere in Australia in the early 20th century outback, an Aboriginal man is accused of murdering a white woman. Three white men are on a mission to capture him with the help of an experienced Indigenous man.','/zNDbpSbjpV0bLVA0mUY1TH2YohT.jpg','2002-08-08',90,'Released','All men choose the path they walk.','The Tracker',13439,1.3387,6.8,'2IV3LvS_M6M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15598,_binary '\0','/qcVrlyPFlPgCsmzorvELvpJN9Be.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0212338',7,382017,'en','Meet the Parents','Greg Focker is ready to marry his girlfriend, Pam, but before he pops the question, he must win over her formidable father, humorless former CIA agent Jack Byrnes, at the wedding of Pam\'s sister. As Greg bends over backward to make a good impression, his visit to the Byrnes home turns into a hilarious series of disasters, and everything that can go wrong does, all under Jack\'s critical, hawklike gaze.','/5tXJ9ctuyEOMUFLaeqRisbXowWs.jpg','2000-10-06',108,'Released','First comes love. Then comes the interrogation.','Meet the Parents',1597,12.5042,6.699,'I18TOdCvvdM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15599,_binary '\0','/bTpjn4OEeoLEJYjRvEvkPfPQZdb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0212346',6.4,252054,'en','Miss Congeniality','When the local FBI office receives a letter from a terrorist known only as \'The Citizen\', it\'s quickly determined that he\'s planning his next act at the Miss America beauty pageant. Because tough-as-nails Gracie Hart is the only female agent at the office, she\'s chosen to go undercover as the contestant from New Jersey.','/pat3vKaRlB70he4ghwTMydR4TvP.jpg','2000-12-22',110,'Released','Unpolished. Unkempt. Unleashed. Undercover.','Miss Congeniality',1493,16.6706,6.537,'MSXZJDuNwJE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15600,_binary '\0','/t3zwpukBDm3URvXXiPg0wfMkrtV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0212380',6.2,9650,'en','Blow Dry','The annual British Hairdressing Championship comes to Keighley, a town where Phil and son Brian run a barbershop and Phil\'s ex-wife Shelly and her lover Sandra run a beauty salon.','/iLGjyrjuOxILTx9FFNm2ktqzaxt.jpg','2001-03-01',91,'Released','An outrageous new comedy for anyone who\'s ever had hair.','Blow Dry',17203,2.7939,5.9,'q6yObNphIPE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15601,_binary '\0','/dQPQdTuKRiQcUiWtxWADy3vLQd9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0212408',7.3,2487,'tr','Otobüs','A group of illegal immigrants are brought to Stockholm in a bus by a smuggler who takes all their money and passports, and then runs away.','/uEmCbsqcnrmBR57zRHwyCLJ7v6K.jpg','1974-01-10',74,'Released',NULL,'The Bus',287011,2.0699,6.579,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15602,_binary '\0','/nWBCa2TqZHmegEjoArc7VGJz1dB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0212573',6.7,1801,'fa','دو زن','A sensation when released in 1999 in Iran, Two Women charts the lives of two promising architecture students over the course of the first turbulent years of the Islamic Republic. Tahimine Milani creates this scathing portrait of those traditions - aided by official indifference - which conspire to trap women and stop them from realizing their full potential; the inclusion of frank depictions of domestic violence was hailed by many as a breakthrough in dealing with a long taboo subject.','/odofuhiIv1uwEnYYKuywTxqBjPQ.jpg','1999-06-23',99,'Released',NULL,'Two Women',125550,1.0273,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15603,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0212604',7.3,2053,'en','Tully','Tully Jr. and Earl live on their father\'s Nebraska ranch, proud and independent to a fault. While the shy, reclusive Earl spends his free time watching movies, the cockier Tully works his way through a succession of short-term affairs and an off-again, on-again relationship with April, a stripper in town. When their childhood friend Ella returns to town to start a veterinary practice, however, Tully falls for her — although the townsfolk have their doubts that he could ever commit to one woman.','/vn91Vcugfmi0CBzSm32eMBiaS02.jpg','2002-11-01',106,'Released',NULL,'Tully',20861,1.2715,6.3,'NyUWgvnkLZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15604,_binary '\0','/h3JAMIeywbzobkhu2rt3mQAwRR1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0212712',7.4,64995,'zh','2046','Women enter and exit a science fiction author\'s life over the course of a few years after the author loses the woman he considers his one true love.','/jIN65qw0Giplo4CshzMrxz204Wn.jpg','2004-09-29',128,'Released','Are you still in the mood for love?','2046',844,6.1693,7.245,'xjmvuBY3560','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15605,_binary '\0','/n7p6UTAZtkeoHkwCO42BEQaMFJY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0212720',7.2,343009,'en','A.I. Artificial Intelligence','David, a robotic boy—the first of his kind programmed to love—is adopted as a test case by a Cybertronics employee and his wife. Though he gradually becomes their child, a series of unexpected circumstances make this life impossible for David.','/wnUAcUrMRGPPZUDroLeZhSjLkuu.jpg','2001-06-29',146,'Released','David is 11 years old. He weighs 60 pounds. He is 4 feet, 6 inches tall. He has brown hair. His love is real. But he is not.','A.I. Artificial Intelligence',644,15.5721,7.07,'vzviK8IibAY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15606,_binary '\0','/4bK0E2wsTuiwGHLFUR0dnDJoqjv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0212742',5.3,1846,'en','After Alice','A washed-up detective discovers his own psychic ability when assigned to investigate a serial murder case. The killer has a deranged obsession with the novel \"Alice in Wonderland.\" As the psychopath\'s bloody reign of terror continues, the cop spirals deeper and deeper into the case where the horrors of the past and present come together.','/oLniSc9a9mhowAZ3L8lwCqSJaNo.jpg','2000-01-01',100,'Released','There\'s murder on his mind.','After Alice',41738,1.4946,5.6,'FMiUMDveP10','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15607,_binary '\0','/nFTu2wKCs2AEuDUL4GuFxuCNBU0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0212815',7.3,5486,'en','Big Eden','Henry Hart is a young gay artist living in New York City. When his grandfather has a stroke, Henry puts his career on hold and returns home to the small town of Big Eden, Montana, to care for him. While there, Henry hopes to strike up a romance with Dean Stewart, his high-school best friend for whom he still has feelings. But he\'s surprised when he finds that Pike, a quiet Native American who owns the local general store, may have a crush on him.','/hAIqu69z1tZjfdq2jThAifAp0tQ.jpg','2000-04-18',119,'Released','A small miracle.','Big Eden',21056,2.292,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15608,_binary '\0','/qcgd7d97vnEOZr9dmNJDtjc7HMb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0212826',7,6428,'en','Bread and Roses','In Los Angeles, undocumented Mexican immigrant Maya finds work as a janitor through her sister, Rosa. However, as both work non-union, conditions are grim. After enduring abuse from her superiors, Maya is open to the pro-union rhetoric offered by organiser Sam Shapiro. Rosa, meanwhile, is far less interested in clashing with management, given the needs of her family, and a rift forms between the sisters.','/aNk0yx0xRcs66OdByiy2pJaFhI6.jpg','2000-09-14',110,'Released','The Balance of Power Is About to Change','Bread and Roses',37691,2.2496,6.299,'IrDpd4sCswY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15609,_binary '\0','/l7TLxnV6lB9QySMOVcuaOhN4aHC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0212830',5.3,7023,'en','Bruiser','After years of being browbeaten and walked on, a man wakes one day wearing an expressionless mask, fitted with a personality that enables him to take revenge.','/giOkOy6mqUU5OMhvWPgZFJexZ8S.jpg','2000-02-13',99,'Released','Meet the new face of terror.','Bruiser',29512,2.7553,5.5,'6zg3FCQLRWE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15610,_binary '\0','/7LpfwFFGystvSQpE70cBfs7ocPn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0212864',5.9,1909,'cn','千王之王2000','Undercover cop Leung Foon is having trouble taking down the illegal trading operation headed by crime boss Ferrari. So to accomplish his mission, he asks for help from the renowned Master Wong, an expert in gambling tricks.','/mFF1AtJdfVgY1E4I7lNfE3cA4Mt.jpg','1999-08-05',93,'Released',NULL,'The Tricky Master',53281,2.0882,5.9,'qNmJ19lJaHk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15611,_binary '\0','/rydjFBcArIdctIRD9kgRcoIyH6U.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0212879',5.8,7007,'en','Citizen Toxie: The Toxic Avenger IV','A horrific explosion creates a dimensional portal between Tromaville and its dimensional mirror image, Amortville. While the Toxie is trapped in the mirror dimension, Tromaville comes under the control of his evil doppelganger, the Noxious Offender.','/wR4VvqrRd2r9M4GYXPnoV02aUNG.jpg','2001-11-01',109,'Released','A tale of two Toxies!!!','Citizen Toxie: The Toxic Avenger IV',27601,4.6052,6.1,'IlFHVmIzui8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15612,_binary '\0','/uNsoUWOWpEqpcP3QqqUGbjKRVmH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0212887',7.9,2417,'en','Doctor Who: The Curse of Fatal Death','Before the Doctor can settle down to married life, he must face one last confrontation with his deadly enemy of certain death - the Master.','/jV3HsAwKmc6jW2V5eXl7Oh2SyID.jpg','1999-03-26',23,'Released',NULL,'Doctor Who: The Curse of Fatal Death',255466,2.038,7.475,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15613,_binary '\0','/ziwF07XA13aQ5FWqUInHBd8j7jS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0212910',5.8,1452,'en','Delivering Milo','A guardian angel has 24 hours to convince a soul that life on Earth is worth the effort.','/t0XvS2GVf522bcOV5kFG2JC2DVL.jpg','2001-01-04',94,'Released',NULL,'Delivering Milo',24811,2.8607,5.4,'BWThOuql9rU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15614,_binary '\0','/dN46Fj4ytfrvnd7kj62Lc4i1Rw6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0212974',6.6,4786,'en','Groove','An inside look into one night in the San Francisco underground rave scene.','/tVbs0q2duVWLwAR8wDuaemLuqj1.jpg','2000-06-08',86,'Released','Are you feeling it?','Groove',23655,2.5495,6.2,'gGRPxq72Kfs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15615,_binary '\0','/3Nb9AQaq3elLNCUBxG8VprmqfhZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0212985',6.8,316770,'en','Hannibal','After having successfully eluded the authorities for years, Hannibal peacefully lives in Italy in disguise as an art scholar. Trouble strikes again when he\'s discovered leaving a deserving few dead in the process. He returns to America to make contact with now disgraced Agent Clarice Starling, who is suffering the wrath of a malicious FBI rival as well as the media.','/v5wAZwRqpGWmyAaaJ8BBHYuNXnj.jpg','2001-02-08',131,'Released','His genius undeniable. His evil unspeakable. His name...Hannibal.','Hannibal',9740,2.9951,6.779,'20rd9VQ1Wx0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15616,_binary '\0','/mG01EhobVbHfdr4LEQA0jaOjt5c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0213065',7.8,3806,'en','The Lorax','The Once-ler, a ruined industrialist, tells the tale of his rise to wealth and subsequent fall, as he disregarded the warnings of a wise old forest creature called the Lorax about the environmental destruction caused by his greed.','/1f2T6PDGXcsCfkeizkwS4O1dyQD.jpg','1972-02-14',25,'Released','The Adorable Lorax Speaks For The Trees In This Music-Filled Tale That’s Certain To Please!','The Lorax',38060,2.3418,7.2,'RVNdVMV4QII','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15617,_binary '\0','/nP45UsgpHcSogMFUUUf4kHyYyJE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0213121',6.9,1916,'en','New Waterford Girl','A gifted teenager, dreaming of life beyond her small town, becomes inspired when a 15-year-old girl from New York moves in next door.','/1YMPN6GNY9jnzZpONPpmFiF1TSl.jpg','1999-09-12',97,'Released',NULL,'New Waterford Girl',35612,1.5319,6.7,'AVYqHrnJIyc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15618,_binary '\0','/zv1xOEQzebKyku349qDZ085FZlO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0213149',6.3,372850,'en','Pearl Harbor','The lifelong friendship between Rafe McCawley and Danny Walker is put to the ultimate test when the two ace fighter pilots become entangled in a love triangle with beautiful Naval nurse Evelyn Johnson. But the rivalry between the friends-turned-foes is immediately put on hold when they find themselves at the center of Japan\'s devastating attack on Pearl Harbor on Dec. 7, 1941.','/y8A0Cvp8WQmZ3bjbnsL53lY0dsC.jpg','2001-05-21',183,'Released','It takes a moment to change history. It takes love to change lives.','Pearl Harbor',676,15.6103,6.9,'oGYcxjywx0o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15619,_binary '\0','/4JbPQv5OiEhDypNFlF6jCvhdzWq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0213203',6.2,14732,'en','Rugrats in Paris: The Movie','A group of rambunctious toddlers travel a trip to Paris. As they journey from the Eiffel Tower to Notre Dame, they learn new lessons about trust, loyalty and love.','/grIL8mvfLznaWsv7EEEPhCpkH81.jpg','2000-11-17',79,'Released','France never had a chance!','Rugrats in Paris: The Movie',16340,7.6991,6.7,'hQkbeurqfQo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15620,_binary '\0','/fG1aFgZuHGFA7rSUVrFrxOpDYBJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0213314',7.1,1245,'cn','星願','A young man, blind and dumb, works as an audio tape typist in a hospital and fostering a tender and sincere relationship with a beautiful but introverted nurse. When hit by a car, he is the sixty billionth human being to die on earth, and is on transit to Polaris, en route to a yet more sophisticated form of existence in Vega. Given a reprieve of five days and a chance to be reunited with his love on earth, he cannot reveal his true identity behind the temporary facade he must present to her. Both boy and girl eventually learn, through a tangle of difficult and miraculous events, how love and good things always find ways of creeping into people\'s lives when people are not greedy and least expect these blessings.','/evDmIhRb51pm4g0GidHDSWYnnD2.jpg','1999-08-21',96,'Released',NULL,'Fly Me to Polaris',45464,1.9996,6.9,'rNs1EoT1i-c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15621,_binary '\0','/qvZfQ3oRFU8xmNXoeX0og7GCVvF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0213322',7.1,1700,'cs','Zítra vstanu a opařím se čajem','Former Nazi Klaus Abard survives to the 1990s by taking anti-ageing pills. He plans to use a time travel trip to return to Germany in 1944 and present Hitler with a hydrogen bomb, so that he can win the war. Unfortunately the pilot, woman-chasing Karel Bures, dies on the morning of the trip and his earnest twin brother Jan impersonates him, without knowing about the plot.','/cPjYaAtyj60gZyXlkOYFuaTnTAc.jpg','1977-08-12',93,'Released',NULL,'Tomorrow I\'ll Wake Up and Scald Myself with Tea',51424,1.7092,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15622,_binary '\0','/tYAXK3uVDlhJlEccH4edoaSBwby.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0213565',7.2,4832,'en','The Color of Friendship','Mahree Bok lives on a farm in South Africa. Her father is a policeman who cannot hide his joy when activist Steve Biko is caught by the South African authorities. Piper Dellums is the daughter of a US congressman from California and who lives in a nice home in Washington DC. When Mahree is chosen to spend a semester at the Dellums\' house, she doesn\'t expect that her host family would be black. Nor do her hosts suspect that she is not a black South African.','/3ELrXrBXvMiURWVkYKaZBnxgMTF.jpg','2000-02-05',83,'Released',NULL,'The Color of Friendship',92620,5.2242,6.7,'YNUZ5qVgwv0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15623,_binary '\0','/48z4fEXAVwYXUnp8SVuQ94ohsRl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0213682',6.8,8503,'ja','御法度','Set during Japan\'s Shogun era, this film looks at life in a samurai compound where young warriors are trained in swordfighting. A number of interpersonal conflicts are brewing in the training room, all centering on a handsome young samurai named Sozaburo Kano. The school\'s stern master can choose to intervene, or to let Kano decide his own path.','/jJxYFrbWhgK2FCjUDWZAkqlXX8.jpg','1999-12-18',100,'Released','How am I insane?','Taboo',20617,5.9009,6.6,'LCQvBZ3xptA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15624,_binary '\0','/lzWnfs5cR7JYjP7zrvNdD4hxrCz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0213790',5.2,14565,'en','The Ladies Man','Because of his salacious language, late-night radio advice-show host Leon Phelps, along with his sweet and loyal producer Julie, is fired from his Chicago gig. Leon gets a letter from a former lover promising a life of wealth, but he doesn\'t know who she is. Can Leon find his secret sugar-mama? What about Julie?','/kKMhGSwydCVjrOWwggDlSvcgzCl.jpg','2000-10-13',84,'Released','He\'s cool. He\'s clean. He\'s a love machine.','The Ladies Man',16888,2.5509,5.4,'dYzAFvkOyDg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15625,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0213802',3.3,2015,'en','Legion of the Dead','Two guys, handsome William and his side kick Luke have just started their trip through the beautiful California desert when they\'re kidnapped by the notorious Psycho Mike, The Kern River Killer. Securing their escape through hilarious means and the aid of an old friend they soon stumble into a small desert town where unbeknownst to them a mysterious tall Blond Man and his sadistic henchmen are killing people to create a Legion of the dead. Here\'s where it gets tricky. William falls in love with Geena, the beautiful waitress at the local restaurant and Luke spins out of control hormonally. The restaurant is suddenly attacked by the LEGION and the tall Blond Man gives an ultimatum to hand over Geena within two hours or he will personally come in to get her. What is the mysterious secret that Geena and the Blond Man share? The clock ticks as the ultimatum draws near. The fight against evil has just begun...','/7altpm0i6xJYN6nT6oN7Thh2TAw.jpg','2001-08-09',89,'Released',NULL,'Legion of the Dead',11629,2.2458,4.8,'GjqNnwTfcac','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15626,_binary '\0','/vadUKKQixxOKWkcuZ1SUEoBQeVG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0213847',7.4,126308,'it','Malèna','12-year-old Renato experiences three significant events on the same day: the beginning of the Second World War, getting a bike, and witnessing the arrival of the gorgeous Malèna. Through his eyes, we see the curse of beauty and loneliness of Malena, whose husband is presumed dead, and, through his soul, we see his love for her.','/3OyQTl0IGkbnjDxd3MhztfPE34g.jpg','2000-10-27',108,'Released','Too young to be a widow, too beautiful to be alone.','Malena',10867,16.8798,7.6,'73FrJrCgJCI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15627,_binary '\0','/s3IfP462ibiQkfU767D4YcMbKTt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0213890',7.1,37901,'hi','मोहब्बतें','At a prestigious all-male university, three friends seek love outside of the school grounds; at the same time, a newly-hired music teacher seeks to befriend and loosen up the militantly strict headmaster.','/dDsYaBazrYKg9bv8qgsEohZQMat.jpg','2000-10-27',216,'Released','Some Love Stories... Live Forever.','Mohabbatein',11518,3.7142,7.1,'OjlZFIY7VHU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15628,_binary '\0','/hoAUWqdkXffHa13H0ZKBdVPovGx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0213905',7,1340,'es','Mundo grúa','The portrait of a man and his attempts to make things up with life after losing his job.','/eAyHxFZDtnzx1d8yH12w92HItF1.jpg','1999-06-17',90,'Released',NULL,'Crane World',101338,0.9894,6.1,'3hH5yb8BsnA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15629,_binary '\0','/c4GW20T51X7xxBlCuJPSzxXuLTp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0213969',8.3,10032,'ta','படையப்பா','Padayappa, a mechanical engineer whose father gives up his property to his foster brother, and then dies of shock soon after. Neelambari initially loves Padayappa, but plans to humiliate him after his family humiliates her father. The rest of the plot deals with Padayappa overcoming all the obstacles placed by Neelambari.','/8PSYF0AtpLbSlTDneCUo7zP4qL1.jpg','1999-04-10',172,'Released',NULL,'Padayappa',47940,2.1883,7.394,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15630,_binary '\0','/d9WT4FCjvB3Z6Sx2cYckdPi9rMI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0213985',6.9,2737,'en','Partition','Determined to leave the ravages of war behind, 38 year old Gian Singh resigns from the British Indian Army to a quiet life. His world is soon thrown in turmoil, when he suddenly finds himself responsible for the life of a 17 year old girl, traumatized by the events that separated her from her family.','/qCq3QZbrf2ENAEyPJVaCGbWOQ1N.jpg','2007-02-02',116,'Released',NULL,'Partition',14608,1.9721,6.3,'bawkwiZGSTc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15631,_binary '\0','/v85ECqXDREz71x9tE8NUQmmPz7a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0214178',6.4,4840,'hi','Sooryavansham','Thakur Bhanupratap, a well-respected village head, deems his youngest son Heera, a failure and treats him poorly. However, despite his father\'s disappointment, Heera tries his best to make him proud.','/fI9cqF4scd7OfIJB5zmfeMxD2bg.jpg','1999-05-21',182,'Released',NULL,'Sooryavansham',194136,1.5451,6.105,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15632,_binary '\0','/eTlDL4TD8k5KKSx0yT4gnX6hx84.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0214289',6.3,4011,'fr','La Vérité si je mens ! 2','Eddie, Dov, and Yvan are back, still working in Paris\' Sentier textile district, This time they\'re confronting the high-stakes world of large distribution after striking a deal with Eurodiscount, a European hypermarket chain.','/oWth1wr5DvErZKh0S5CAFUZDm10.jpg','2001-02-07',105,'Released',NULL,'Would I Lie to You? 2',31359,1.5976,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15633,_binary '\0','/auO1IdZSpZf8nvGGvRnEdHNdp4r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0214388',5.8,23356,'en','100 Girls','Matthew, a college freshman, meets his dream girl in a dorm elevator during a blackout. He never sees her face, but instantly falls in love. In the morning, the power is restored, but the \"dream girl\" has vanished. All Matthew knows is that she lives in an all-girls dorm. He sets out on a semester-long journey to find his mystery girl among a hundred female suspects. Could it be Wendy? Dora? Arlene? Patty? Cynthia? Or the 95 other girls, any of whom could have been in that elevator with Matthew.','/sspDghFACtzitHyNV4sMBQcQKsg.jpg','2000-09-01',95,'Released','He met the girl of his dreams. If only he can meet her again.','100 Girls',10035,5.9809,5.754,'ihI3Y21aqOk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15634,_binary '\0','/cJEGLh6N2OpLE8Gv6ZmeEk1g0kv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0214529',4.5,5488,'fr','Belphégor, le fantôme du Louvre','A collection of artifacts from an archeological dig in Egypt are brought to the famous Louvre museum in Paris, and while experts are using a laser scanning device to determine the age of a sarcophagus, a ghostly spirit escapes and makes its way into the museum\'s electrical system.','/pOuxeQhR2Acjjr6dgOH4GJz3Wcf.jpg','2001-04-03',97,'Released',NULL,'Belphegor, Phantom of the Louvre',35831,3.1093,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15635,_binary '\0','/1L7OBxA3OJsVVCtp44giSvuafjP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0214585',8.7,6942,'ml','ചിത്രം','A young woman is dumped by her boyfriend just before the wedding as she will not be inheriting any wealth from her father. When the girl\'s father pays her a visit, she hires a man to act like her husband.','/4Ajkl9RZLXR8dYqUTeOKptdUgOE.jpg','1988-12-22',159,'Released',NULL,'Chithram',191335,1.4809,7.868,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15636,_binary '\0','/ysbIygWrORwIKO7umXWTmqLKeUB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0214698',6.9,2277,'en','The Three Stooges','A biography of the Three Stooges, in which their careers and rise to fame is shown throughout the eyes of their leader, Moe.','/nGxXtFLJ4MptoEuAcJssTimJvAD.jpg','2000-04-24',88,'Released','Their comedy made us laugh out loud, but their lives were pure drama.','The Three Stooges',85411,2.4496,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15637,_binary '\0','/bSGR2q1OlXp5j7lqDBeMe8BQ5Le.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0214730',7.2,3660,'en','Grass','Marijuana is the most controversial drug of the 20th century. Smoked by generations to little discernible ill effect, it continues to be reviled by many governments on Earth. In this Genie Award-winning documentary, veteran Canadian director Ron Mann and narrator Woody Harrelson mix humour and historical footage together to recount how the United States has demonized a relatively harmless drug.','/hkWa0nrel8a1I5xDNHOX8S5q4zu.jpg','1999-09-15',80,'Released',NULL,'Grass',22010,2.1886,6.6,'CEsBeO8rclE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15638,_binary '\0','/kevz644AEhhVmJvAj77ewxDe2EW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0214841',7.4,2646,'hi','कर्ज़','Ravi Verma is killed by his wife Kamini in a plot to steal his family\'s wealth and property. He is reborn as Monty, a popular singer exploited by a crude businessman. When Monty hears Ravi\'s favorite tune, memories of his previous life and violent death resurface. With the help of his fiancee Tina, Monty seeks revenge against his murderer and restoration of the Verma family.','/hetcyXaRfZPXAInkltGtlNHAJof.jpg','1980-06-11',159,'Released','People in love don\'t ask for a certificate of trust.','Karz',23715,1.2441,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15639,_binary '\0','/nkUi2GCQkIFPCkPUqFAyJuF1qZv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0214871',3.6,1766,'en','The Last Patrol','After a massive earthquake destroys Los Angeles, a new order is formed. But disagreement among the ranks leads to more war and disruption, and The Last Patrol must bring order if there\'s to be any hope for the future.','/1FuDl1n7okqzQX3OvXnk1iGknQQ.jpg','2000-04-01',95,'Released','After the final earthquake... welcome to the island of California.','The Last Patrol',60489,2.6037,3.9,'rVXZDdDA7to','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15640,_binary '\0','/dgmF11HX6rVosnsTyzHpAQPIv4C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0214874',5.1,1381,'en','The Legend of Sleepy Hollow','Ichabod Crane, a Yankee wanderer, arrives in Sleepy Hollow and becomes the new schoolmaster. He meets Katrina Van Tassel, and blissfully fantasizes about how can marry her, ultimately, inherit her father\'s rich estate. Her suitor Brom Bones, the blacksmith, wants to scare him away and dresses up as the legendary Headless Horseman. During the prank, the real ghost appears and drives Ichabod off','/2Ac7FIoV5pVkMm6EZBqgzh1iUDR.jpg','1999-10-23',105,'Released','The headless horseman rides again.','The Legend of Sleepy Hollow',9608,2.0653,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15641,_binary '\0','/jkGzq2vSXyEITsZNSjx3rrNBsGa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0214878',6.2,1939,'fr','Le Libertin','French philosopher Denis Diderot produces the first encyclopedia while indulging in 18th-century decadence.','/zBiNLDtDy1CLRzoZJgVsTsKsfH7.jpg','2000-03-15',100,'Released',NULL,'The Libertine',77519,1.4583,5.6,'jF4Ud09BF14','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15642,_binary '\0','/gmUgUCpSWxLwyxoTFsPovSHonoZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0214915',8.7,14656,'ml','മണിച്ചിത്രത്താഴ്','A young couple, Ganga and Nakulan, arrives at the ancestral home called Madampalli of the latter. Hailing from a family that follows tradition and superstitions, Nakulan\'s uncle Thampi objects to the couple\'s idea of moving into the allegedly haunted mansion, which Nakulan ignores. The couple moves in anyway following which seemingly supernatural events begin to happen.','/5YccrqvJFTfAVyEZp08I3fLx15y.jpg','1993-12-25',169,'Released','THE ORNATE LOCK','Manichitrathazhu',84368,1.8874,7.6,'5peTNRAj8ZA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15643,_binary '\0','/nkSpU6fxnPmQCDl70PM3ccEPoHD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0214930',5.5,1511,'en','Mary, Mother of Jesus','Mary, Mother of Jesus is a 1999 made-for-television Biblical film that retells the story of Jesus through the eyes of Mary, his mother.','/fqzIkjVMkTK3wJpGEZJHd0yhl41.jpg','1999-11-14',88,'Released','See Him Through Different Eyes','Mary, Mother of Jesus',139751,2.2953,4.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15644,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0215031',7.7,1400,'ml','പപ്പയുടെ സ്വന്തം അപ്പൂസ്','Balachandran had resorted to his work after he is unable to cope up with the death of his wife, Bhama. During the process, he neglects his only son, Appu. When Appu returns home for his school vacation, Balachandran promises to take him on a lot of trips, but is unable to do any as he is caught up with work. Pappayude Swantham Appoos movie is all about the bonds between the father and his son.','/ik0OJeGrUvJOshJkWQYYelTWF1l.jpg','1992-09-04',142,'Released',NULL,'Pappayude Swantham Appoos',181470,1.0994,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15645,_binary '\0','/cV0JkbhWNSgfRmENuVMkkDvNgdG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0215129',6.5,190392,'en','Road Trip','After a student at the University of Ithaca films his one-night stand with a beautiful sorority girl, he discovers one of his friends has accidentally mailed the homemade sex tape to his girlfriend in Austin. In a frenzy, he must borrow a car and hit the road in a desperate bid to intercept the tape.','/jee4eY5tZprI0V18S6PXUloBzSk.jpg','2000-05-19',93,'Released','The greatest college tradition of all.','Road Trip',9285,7.7034,6.251,'NU9NYU9O0Hw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15646,_binary '\0','/ipGtZEwR99uFyJPykTrjYLxPAik.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0215369',7.5,4348,'zh','洗澡','An aged father and his younger, mentally challenged son have been working hard every day to keep the bathhouse running for a motley group of regular customers. When his elder son, who left years ago to seek his fortune in the southern city of Shenzhen, abruptly returns one day, it once again puts under stress the long-broken father-son ties. Presented as a light-hearted comedy, Shower explores the value of family, friendship, and tradition.','/wAEmh0m4RSDQrby64REzZJLCSH5.jpg','1999-09-13',92,'Released',NULL,'Shower',1050,1.7268,6.9,'qcwZfUMDB0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15647,_binary '\0','/sGQ1tYqWo0GVwe8IPnPPRexnoWR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0215516',6.3,1862,'en','Nobody\'s Baby','Two not so bright small time crooks end up with a baby girl by \"accident\" and find a change in their lives. Billy (Ulrich) becomes the guy to take care of the child and look after it. Buford (Oldman) wants to get rid of it, but the others they knit with are for doing the best they can. They conspire to rob a pawn shop to get the necessary money, only to end up heroes for stopping a heist already in play.','/zzqp3TKdTZ10WcOzXvBoBZfzv7V.jpg','2001-01-21',110,'Released',NULL,'Nobody\'s Baby',48345,1.6225,5.2,'3HoMAIHUlik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15648,_binary '\0','/ztJF7L4n0F146U9agRbW13Eebkg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0215517',8.3,6362,'hi','अंगूर','Two pairs of identical twins are separated following an unfortunate incident. However, years later, their lives intertwine, leading to confusion and misunderstandings. Based on William Shakespeare\'s \'A Comedy Of Errors\'.','/wijF2sW1MDq9c1u5m9ezealO9KC.jpg','1982-03-05',136,'Released','A Comedy Of Errors','Angoor',21984,1.0997,7.361,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15649,_binary '\0','/p7e7OZwPxDQTYE4l4EFuYkCloLU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0215545',6.7,13204,'en','Bamboozled','Frustrated when network brass reject his sitcom idea, producer Pierre Delacroix pitches the worst idea he can think of in an attempt to get fired: a 21st century minstrel show. The network not only airs it, but it becomes a smash hit.','/oAg1mUUxdWJNLa6t1gctbQhXHVN.jpg','2000-10-06',136,'Released','A Spectacular Film by Mr. Spike Lee','Bamboozled',24664,3.2734,6.3,'EMZ6zp-3oGY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15650,_binary '\0','/iPuTxrco0yBOCCtC2ihGw2BN8nJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0215681',6.6,4659,'de','Crazy','Benjamin, a 16-year-old with lousy grades, switches to a boarding school in order to eventually reach grammar school. Adjusting to his new environment is difficult as he has to struggle with being a teen... specially when he falls in love to the school\'s dream girl, Malen.','/9tZ36iWvmrzupMOvleGh57nb94Y.jpg','2000-06-08',90,'Released',NULL,'Crazy',9375,1.2234,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15651,_binary '\0','/pnEMDuaZeDXUQPPhhGTo9QMfMeA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0215750',7.5,295870,'en','Enemy at the Gates','A Russian and a German sniper play a game of cat-and-mouse during the Battle of Stalingrad in WWII.','/cHRAbVdsCWFaQrswRsBP7Bn255W.jpg','2001-02-28',131,'Released','A single bullet can change history.','Enemy at the Gates',853,15.9166,7.427,'xqwlIaOyBSA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15652,_binary '\0','/1srM4tW8Scf9uZGHjELZb4oSxz5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0215911',8.4,1904,'hi','कोशिश','A romantic drama which tells the story of a 20 year relationship between Hari and Aarti - a deaf-mute couple who try to live their lives to the fullest despite their handicaps.','/hESoeO4lRRZR1XefZjkCKBbxwDo.jpg','1972-04-01',125,'Released',NULL,'Koshish',287901,0.8953,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15653,_binary '\0','/nC1KO0N62WTuwoPXGm5ABYuyAgj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0216048',7.7,2564,'en','Oklahoma!','A dark-themed and redesigned West End production of Rodgers & Hammerstein\'s seminal Broadway musical tells the story of farm girl Laurey and her courtship by two rival suitors, cowboy Curly and the sinister and frightening farmhand Jud.','/dHRP7Z3g16HV8LKL1zpqQ1Yjb8O.jpg','1999-09-26',177,'Released','London stage reproduction of the classic Broadway musical.','Oklahoma!',27074,1.4555,6.7,'UjEZyjQolTQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15654,_binary '\0','/a0jFMDNLmkIooaOvlWHnkrUJMeF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0216165',7.3,7061,'cn','暗戰','Police inspector and excellent hostage negotiator Ho Sheung-Sang finds himself in over his head when he is pulled into a 72 hour game by a cancer suffering criminal out for vengeance on Hong Kong\'s organized crime syndicates.','/9ccrrOMnpeQm9SI0PL2E1d4stn6.jpg','1999-09-23',93,'Released','Let the games begin.','Running Out of Time',2463,3.7091,7.3,'HFAwYLqCZB0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15655,_binary '\0','/pf5xJlqKLPSCXnyn3KlbAuxcklZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0216216',6,134940,'en','The 6th Day','A world of the very near future in which cattle, fish, and even the family pet can be cloned. But cloning humans is illegal - that is until family man Adam Gibson comes home from work one day to find a clone has replaced him. Taken from his family and plunged into a sinister world he doesn\'t understand, Gibson must not only save himself from the assassins who must destroy him to protect their secret, but uncover who and what is behind the horrible things happening to him.','/nlbB47qp1oxEtts9Ik3UYAwKWHM.jpg','2000-11-17',123,'Released','Are you who you think you are?','The 6th Day',8452,9.1831,6,'0VP44dGIi9c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15656,_binary '\0','/9KVToOdmf1hyi2hV4B2FAIoRgs3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0216417',5.8,2430,'en','The Wog Boy','Steve liked Celia from the moment they met. But following a clash with her boss, Raelene Beagle-Thorpe, Minister for Employment, he finds himself on national television branded as Australia\'s biggest dole bludger. Now Steve has to prove to Celia, to himself, and to the whole country, that there\'s more to him than meets the eye. With a little help from his friends, he might just do it.','/jUAyxboNsMmw7crA5XHa3rWUXQ3.jpg','2000-02-24',92,'Released','Every wog has his day.','The Wog Boy',16874,1.1103,5.8,'n_QsSOMYI9Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15657,_binary '\0','/68dyqMEQNyYLGi9vMZWj0VXf7xF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0216487',3.3,1631,'en','Invincible','The Shadow Men are immortal beings of darkness and destruction. One such Shadow Man, Os (Zane), is confronted by the White Warrior, a being of light, and given the chance to change his ways or die. After the White Warrior bests Os in combat, she opens his heart to the power of love, and charges him to find the warriors who are the representation of the five elements and will save the world.','/tVyc2qLdLBM67BLVah2VPm2tHsS.jpg','2001-11-18',90,'Released','To survive the ultimate battle, they must become the ultimate warriors.','Invincible',35216,1.6357,4.7,'KchgbimCXEM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15658,_binary '\0','/6JXoB4UFeotc8Yi8Vbi5snIT05N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0216578',6.8,1391,'fr','Les blessures assassines','Based on the true story of two chambermaids of 1930s France who murdered their employer and her daughter.','/8ZHVyEF1e5KTBiVwY04XVcypN0n.jpg','2000-11-22',94,'Released','It wasn\'t just a crime. It was a crime of passion.','Murderous Maids',62124,1.1006,6.2,'OWqj4q7h5tE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15659,_binary '\0','/8oKdae18qSgGufTlvDw23tuP9GL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0216584',5.6,4487,'en','Bob the Butler','Bob, an incompetent man, is searching for an available job by alphabetical order. He had just failed all of the A\'s, and discovers an ad in the Yellow Pages for a butler school. He is the only one in the butler school course to pass, because all of the other people quit due to the embarrassment and pressure of the teacher.','/gbVHXnDlx9UPCYH9bIAP5Dr8PC3.jpg','2005-03-10',90,'Released','The family will never be the same.','Bob the Butler',22747,2.1469,5.6,'vn9qM_DijOg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15660,_binary '\0','/5bAnFKlLcjRd6SK3it3tCvfwc2C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0216605',6,2450,'fr','La Captive','Ariane lives with Simon in his large Paris flat. Simon is obsessed with her: he wants to know everything about her, secretly follows her when she goes out, asks questions all the time, even in the most intimate moments. Ariane seems to take it all in stride, but Simon realises that she\'s hiding something.','/h7M7jy1tzLR5Il0jZptEYw0ECnt.jpg','2000-09-27',119,'Released',NULL,'The Captive',47244,2.2718,5.729,'A32wjB41wW8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15661,_binary '\0','/39eaG5OSykVCsbtZa72vCqBwLFC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0216620',4.4,2589,'en','Christina\'s House','A teenage girl is plagued by bizarre occurrences and deaths related to her new home.','/avPfOqBpx2cMQSS8xal2Ed2KHlh.jpg','2000-04-06',90,'Released','Stay Awake. Breathe. Your Life Depends On It.','Christina\'s House',38503,1.685,4.7,'V-TdqY3AASw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15662,_binary '\0','/g5CMQPz5cqUHro9pNLBRW7cT8cY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0216621',7.4,12314,'en','A Christmas Carol','Miser Ebenezer Scrooge is awakened on Christmas Eve by spirits who reveal to him his own miserable existence, what opportunities he wasted in his youth, his current cruelties, and the dire fate that awaits him if he does not change his ways. Scrooge is faced with his own story of growing bitterness and meanness, and must decide what his own future will hold: death or redemption.','/oi1NcVDXlFEsdpLp37BJmFbVlg9.jpg','1999-12-05',97,'Released','In just one night, he has seen his past, his present, and his future... and they\'ve all come back to haunt him.','A Christmas Carol',16716,4.0478,7,'upAYkFugbco','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15663,_binary '\0','/bTUBuFR25xvTiFel7q6pq0ejacY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0216625',7.1,16606,'fr','Code inconnu','A series of events unfold like a chain reaction, all stemming from a minor event that brings the film\'s five characters together. Set in Paris, France, Anne is an actress whose boyfriend Georges photographs the war in Kosovo. Georges\' brother, Jean, is looking for the entry code to Georges\' apartment. These characters\' lives interconnect with a Romanian immigrant and a deaf teacher.','/kJJx2FNmiaep8WT21uMPY9qPzxL.jpg','2000-11-15',118,'Released','Love has a language all its own.','Code Unknown',30970,4.121,6.7,'3C5_Ta4j9Sw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15664,_binary '\0','/lwkwVTNdNeG0a1FT06wr1Ylm1OV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0216651',7.7,42416,'ja','バンパイアハンターD','Legendary dhampir D competes with a motley family of bounty hunters to track down Charlotte Elbourne, a young woman seemingly abducted by undead nobleman Meier Link.','/9ipbQRgOq6Ilxpwagfa98ikgR9v.jpg','2001-04-21',103,'Released','When the sun sets, the hunt begins.','Vampire Hunter D: Bloodlust',15999,7.5137,7.7,'44xT9LSrgJ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15665,_binary '\0','/rz1TKlEBiJwAiXFdT4BJDSlElP7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0216689',6.7,1445,'fr','Les Destinées sentimentales','In late nineteenth century Charante, Protestant minister Jean Barnery causes local disquiet when he arranges a separation from his obsessive wife. He and his lover keep their love strong as the world changes around them.','/lJfjL4it2LhVQNI66lfKeaLnrri.jpg','2000-07-12',180,'Released','Love is the most rewarding sacrifice','Sentimental Destinies',64310,1.6231,5.5,'AmY9MKMNOf0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15666,_binary '\0','/nrRgNkbIRWergIWvI8eGBIxCpd9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0216707',5.1,1424,'hi','Dil Kya Kare','Anand Kishore, his wife, Kavita and only child, a daughter, Neha , live a happy and serene life in Delhi, India. Their lives are turned upside down when Kavita finds out that Neha is being stalked by a woman named Nandita Rai','/61k3JXpqxfjcltYEgzdotOWaUo.jpg','1999-09-24',158,'Released',NULL,'Dil Kya Kare',165066,1.2224,5.786,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15667,_binary '\0','/yrYVszUhLUJped3d7OAZ1qblDIZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0216741',4.9,2458,'de','Erkan & Stefan','Editor Eckernförde has come into the possession of an audiocassette that contains a recording of the last minutes of deceased politician Uwe Barschel. The circumstances of his untimely death have never been completely resolved - until now. Unfortunately, the editor\'s daughter Nina accidentally takes the tape with her to Munich, where she is about to visit her paralyzed Mom in a sanatorium. When this information reaches the CIA and the BND, both organizations compete to get hold of the tape. Meanwhile Erkan & Stefan, two loveable wannabe supercheckers from Munich, are assigned as bodyguards for Nina - of course, they are expected to mess up their job, so that the tape can be retrieved. But the two friends prove to be a bit more streetwise than CIA or BND ever expected.','/r8Vjf8vlHhivc9aY9nN8JHlgvIj.jpg','2000-04-20',83,'Released',NULL,'Erkan and Stefan',9601,1.1991,4.6,'e3lWm4bO_48','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15668,_binary '\0','/ya5ibHwMchzLLLujHTdjYAX6KsF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0216746',3.7,2023,'en','Bad Girls from Valley High','Soon after the arrival of a mysterious exchange student, who they\'re convinced has something to do with a murder they committed one year earlier, three ruthless high school queen bees begin to prematurely age.','/mECjS3CKireNp8rzsq3cqcEFwFq.jpg','2005-07-17',84,'Released','High School can be hell, but popularity can be murder!','Bad Girls from Valley High',47541,2.3063,4,'1gpJXIxPXUo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15669,_binary '\0','/iJlwlhM37rx00gXEBIu9ssoC7kZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0216755',7.9,2983,'ru','Формула любви','A young aristocrat, Aleksei Fedyashev, is languishing in his family\'s country estate, spending his days reading poetry and confessing his love... to a statue. Upon hearing that famous Count Cagliostro is touring Russia and has created quite a buzz in high society with his \"magic\", he decides to ask the Count to bring the statue to life...','/yAgBjMZMKG9rn0aKZBZ6Prx83T5.jpg','1984-12-30',90,'Released',NULL,'Formula of Love',27940,1.1953,7.432,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15670,_binary '\0','/9h90ga8OYzcHAVHCuwRuFYQQNm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0216772',4.2,1579,'en','Turn It Up','Trying to bootstrap his way out of Brooklyn\'s mean streets is Diamond, a rap musician. With his long-time pal Gage acting as his manager, he\'s trying to lay down a demo tape with cut-rate studio time. To pay the bills, he and Gage run drugs for \"Mr. B.\" Inside a week, Diamond\'s beloved mother dies suddenly, his father appears after an absence of 12 years and wants a relationship, and his girlfriend Kia tells him she\'s pregnant, asking him if he\'s ready to be a father. Gage steals $100,000 in a multiple-felony robbery so that Diamond can record a full album, not knowing it\'s Mr. B\'s money he\'s taken. B wants his money, Diamond wants his music, Tia wants an answer.','/1LqMTyQJnI7IfeDjjGRcDh1vv0r.jpg','2000-09-06',86,'Released','How you gonna win?','Turn It Up',9995,1.6713,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15671,_binary '\0','/tcsHNAMeZubqcAEbCQHd41WvEOA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0216787',7.2,11282,'fr','Le Goût des autres','Unpolished and ultra-pragmatic industrialist Jean-Jacques Castella reluctantly attends Racine\'s tragedy \"Berenice\" in order to see his niece play a bit part. He is taken with the play\'s strangely familiar-looking leading lady Clara Devaux. During the course of the show, Castella soon remembers that he once hired and then promptly fired the actress as an English language tutor. He immediately goes out and signs up for language lessons. Thinking that he is nothing but an ill-tempered philistine with bad taste, Clara rejects him until Castella charms her off her feet.','/k9R6Omadvp57EoQ4x9nNneig1Nv.jpg','2000-03-01',112,'Released',NULL,'The Taste of Others',10697,2.8711,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15672,_binary '\0','/tknIuEAueIh4yKnRdTF1O4p3uFE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0216799',7,7136,'en','Harrison\'s Flowers','1991. Harrison Lloyd, a renowned photojournalist covering the war in Yugoslavia, is reported missing. Sarah, his wife, convinced that he is not dead, decides to go to Bosnia to find him.','/3L560a4NGBelJyRyutk41lzChCx.jpg','2000-09-23',130,'Released',NULL,'Harrison\'s Flowers',25014,2.4361,6.5,'jX6driW3KdU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15673,_binary '\0','/mgNMFGVUezUAgOPJ57N2toQ7d6z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0216800',7.1,11283,'fr','Harry, un ami qui vous veut du bien','While fixing up their summer cottage, Michel and his family run into a man who claims to have gone to high school with Michel.','/tQ6Ut3kPOpo3lRhPrW5QfkBDwGk.jpg','2000-08-15',117,'Released','Who needs enemies?','With a Friend Like Harry...',47943,2.2807,6.791,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15674,_binary '\0','/91f8iV55g4k9GzE1DRmBfJ1deYY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0216817',6.4,11234,'hi','हम साथ - साथ हैं','A wealthy businessman\'s traditional family celebrate their togetherness when his three sons get married, but slowly find themselves growing apart after a misunderstanding.','/lEAEzpAfSyBZc5sw1NBnWr5TeZU.jpg','1999-11-05',177,'Released',NULL,'Hum Saath Saath Hain',62883,2.2526,6.085,'_UXCsK3eqWk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15675,_binary '\0','/f6T0JQe7W1B1NwpjJuD0DNvLLxR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0216930',4.8,2021,'en','My 5 Wives','A three times divorced real estate tycoon who thought he was through with love gets more then he bargained for when he invests in some property for a ski resort in Utah.','/tzlW7N2Nxf6H04RObi2IYIlRxiV.jpg','2000-09-08',100,'Released','Never has one man had to do so much with so little.','My 5 Wives',38132,1.6673,4.833,'nYI6XnvjUqE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15676,_binary '\0','/lJoI3pLLskdAJFtG69qwh9NY0Bh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0216986',7.1,10767,'tr','Propaganda','Based on a true story set in 1948, customs officer Mehti is faced with the duty of formally setting up the border between Turkey and Syria, dividing his hometown. He is unaware of the pain that will eminently unfold, as families, languages, cultures and lovers are both ripped apart and clash head on in a village once united.','/pMe9wka3jO0nJ0pvOIOy0sNKNl.jpg','1999-03-05',120,'Released',NULL,'Propaganda',53934,1.6766,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15677,_binary '\0','/8iD2S2Y5HBRscKVffIR7sdTYf6k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0217019',6,1956,'fr','Sade','A man prepares himself to be transferred to a detention center and rest home where he will relive one more time the highlights of his youth.','/mcr6I5KtSUrR1peEZ2EFotW6Hhx.jpg','2000-08-23',100,'Released','He was a man ahead of his time. His ideas on love and sex shocked his generation.','Sade',72356,2.4071,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15678,_binary '\0','/yhNi12Jc0GPt09VHpVGXtdW9rkA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0217074',5,3414,'en','Switching Goals','Twin sisters Emma and Sam come up with a scheme to switch places so each can play in the soccer team they prefer.','/ostcLXSpg25JHbaUkoXIHblCmsV.jpg','1999-12-12',85,'Released',NULL,'Switching Goals',36251,3.0634,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15679,_binary '\0','/8taRUGstMLSm32g6XnbxnwXENZY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0217086',4.7,1711,'en','Teacher\'s Pet','Psychopath Debbie Strand escapes from a mental institution for the criminally insane and takes the identity of a co-ed she meets and sets herself up on a college campus where she once again begins killing students who get in the way of her obsession with her former high school teacher Sam Deckner now teaching at the college.','/6tP0SNBPUWEFd4dz77p4JH2S574.jpg','2000-09-08',92,'Released','She gets whatever she wants...','Teacher\'s Pet',45511,1.6427,4.8,'zLym1CRkyxs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15680,_binary '\0','/6hNQzJvdu4bhTE0MxH2yWl3SdUx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0217119',6.9,1741,'fr','Une affaire de goût','Nicolas, a handsome, young waiter, is befriended by Frédéric Delamont, a wealthy middle-aged businessman. Delamont, a man of power, influence and strictly refined tastes, is immediately smitten by Nicolas\' charm. Lonely and phobic, Delamont offers Nicolas a lucrative job as his personal food taster. In spite of their differences, a close friendship begins to emerge between the two men. However, their bond of trust and admiration soon spirals downward into a dangerous game of deceit and obsession for which neither is prepared.','/3OKEpJKer0QfzYH2gShboxaJlQA.jpg','2000-04-26',90,'Released',NULL,'A Matter of Taste',74578,1.4653,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15681,_binary '\0','/dwAkkV62d714O0ftNrelS1hrw5x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0217331',5.2,3567,'en','The Convent','A group of college students break into an abandoned convent and become possessed by demonic spirits.','/ehDQuLqA0Lj03k4uM5MKzphbi0Y.jpg','2000-01-21',80,'Released','Prayer will get you nowhere.','The Convent',12724,2.3451,5.6,'1DLkItGalNc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15682,_binary '\0','/5QupiAgyE6WDxdRFYBS22kCZP8k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0217355',5.7,4433,'en','Dancing at the Blue Iguana','At the Blue Iguana, L.A.\'s most notorious strip club, the lives of five exotic dancers converge, clash and ultimately bond over the course of one week.','/mqnHHF6pductvQGIXfdB37GWNkd.jpg','2001-10-10',123,'Released','They expose all. They show nothing.','Dancing at the Blue Iguana',23941,4.3858,5.4,'3Aby9p-cWhs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15683,_binary '\0','/p8yXQse3IDZiwEjWRHda3EzDQjA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0217505',7.5,510650,'en','Gangs of New York','In early 1860s New York, Irish immigrant Amsterdam Vallon is released from prison and returns to the Five Points, seeking revenge against his father\'s killer, William Cutting, a powerful anti-immigrant gang leader. He knows that revenge can only be attained by infiltrating Cutting\'s inner circle. Vallon\'s journey becomes a fight for personal survival and to find a place for the Irish people.','/lemqKtcCuAano5aqrzxYiKC8kkn.jpg','2002-12-14',168,'Released','America was born in the streets.','Gangs of New York',3131,13.5444,7.315,'1bjh979vVG0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15684,_binary '\0','/x7EEtZ3rm7IN9XPWdYcJJEEiThv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0217590',7.6,2759,'ru','Маугли','Adventures of Mowgli is an animated feature-length story originally released as five animated shorts of about 20 minutes each between 1967 and 1971 in the Soviet Union.','/umKOlYg5Ramxhu74XSn0Zg0FsLM.jpg','1973-01-01',96,'Released',NULL,'The Adventures of Mowgli',59803,1.4005,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15685,_binary '\0','/3u4XlIPhrwpYzTMwv7f2FxHFKSi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0217629',7,3878,'en','Looking for Alibrandi','Josie Alibrandi is 17 and doesn\'t know where she belongs. This year, however, everything is going to change. Josie will face her fears, uncover secrets, and even discover the true identity of her father.','/gmqYmAAoO97ytzmKBozoJYzuNbc.jpg','2000-05-04',103,'Released','Sometimes what you\'re looking for is closer than you think...','Looking for Alibrandi',25069,1.4834,6.6,'krogZxNGHm8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15686,_binary '\0','/r80VehB1GzdOReLSgr0N4iWo5id.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0217630',5.4,31077,'en','Loser','On a university scholarship, a good natured student from the midwest gets a crash course in city life while dealing with three evil roommates. He befriends a virtually homeless college student whom he falls for, but she\'s dating a nasty professor.','/nOqWmYfgvpUA6gZjvdB0Cg24kA4.jpg','2000-07-21',95,'Released','Dare to be different.','Loser',10642,4.2048,5.419,'vWoXkC7udK0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15687,_binary '\0','/s1PvYipppwcbge4n69rThiMSLg0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0217679',6.1,2520,'ja','女虐 悪魔の悦び','A scientist taints his mother\'s scientific experiment with his own drug that transforms pain into a pleasurable experience. Unfortunately for the three women involved in the experiment, the drug works a little bit too well.','/ypOTvrvrvHmOyngAWZqWI8U90qD.jpg','1996-02-20',76,'Released',NULL,'Splatter: Naked Blood',36075,3.2044,5.8,'W096oMsVQNU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15688,_binary '\0','/exj2zZjiTYuR7PybCCsBvOVYZQx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0217680',6.5,2089,'th','นางนาก','In a rural village in Thailand, Mak is sent to fight in a war and leaves his pregnant wife, Nak. Mak is injured and barely survives. He returns home to his doting wife and child, or so he thinks.','/gEPxY5GEgo6vUWuJhTpvruhovRD.jpg','1999-07-23',101,'Released','Death never do us part.','Nang Nak',44108,1.5109,6.5,'tREjNCHsk18','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15689,_binary '\0','/18BilRDZs1bi6AOo0CGiFtNV1sa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0217756',5.4,16332,'en','Ready to Rumble','Two slacker wrestling fans are devastated by the ousting of their favorite character by an unscrupulous promoter.','/fRJNUXbeTte3MmpCqCRs53W7HIR.jpg','2000-04-07',107,'Released','They\'re headed to the big time...face first.','Ready to Rumble',20697,4.6919,5.2,'AfTvmbizNyQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15690,_binary '\0','/otJWuHDFbM1qauDGhkaGgdgHK3p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0217824',6.3,1926,'en','Goodbye Charlie Bright','Following Charlie Bright and his friends over one hot summer on the South London housing estate where they live. With Tommy about to join the army and Francis having fallen in love, friendships and loyalties are tested as the friends drift in their own directions.','/1cmoafqRswLzZrP821oTidnX6xQ.jpg','2001-05-11',87,'Released',NULL,'Goodbye Charlie Bright',24997,1.4182,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15691,_binary '\0','/A7CYNTa3fWyU0t207XiecgriQv5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0217869',7.3,471500,'en','Unbreakable','An ordinary man makes an extraordinary discovery when a train accident leaves his fellow passengers dead — and him unscathed. The answer to this mystery could lie with the mysterious Elijah Price, a man who suffers from a disease that renders his bones as fragile as glass.','/mLuehrGLiK5zFCyRmDDOH6gbfPf.jpg','2000-11-22',106,'Released','Are you ready for the truth?','Unbreakable',9741,12.9046,7.146,'faVXsGSC1AY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15692,_binary '\0','/AgA7fRQ1OtIU9kczLVKpJGWME4R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0217978',5.7,1786,'en','\'R Xmas','A New York drug dealer is kidnapped, and his wife must try to come up with the money and drugs to free him from his abductors before Christmas.','/DzoSalOppsZ5by1X2ISevQH2U4.jpg','2001-12-14',85,'Released','Dual identities, dueling dealers, and an overdose of greed.','\'R Xmas',49110,2.0072,6.2,'_kkr0IB2_E8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15693,_binary '\0','/55d4fqHRb5eXpzeFqdgEM8PlJJ8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0217990',6,2946,'en','Alley Cats Strike','A group of hip retro teenage outsiders become involved in an interschool bowling rivalry.','/kIJ6MwKUKA26O0Ww02ocZEBCCbm.jpg','2000-03-18',87,'Released','The Only Way To Settle The Score Is To Take It To The Alley!','Alley Cats Strike',72753,4.7892,6,'XND4-ASrvuo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15694,_binary '\0','/voj8J1nwD61FxQZuPxB2Uvtj5q7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0218043',7.6,9800,'en','Beyond the Mat','A heartfelt documentary focusing on the day-to-day lives of professional wrestlers, some on the rise, some on the wane, and others fighting for their lives.','/48AfKc79mpRcavpA5Hc7UW9Qqq6.jpg','1999-10-22',102,'Released','The Movie Vince McMahon Doesn\'t Want You to See.','Beyond the Mat',14271,2.237,7.294,'YfBnF484Qc0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15695,_binary '\0','/pwmQbGwZBl3qr9qQYr8ILBqexIU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0218067',4.4,2194,'en','The Calling','On her wedding night, a young woman conceives a child during an hallucinatory encounter. Several years later, as her friends and family begin to behave strangely, she pieces together clues that lead to one conclusion...her son is the Antichrist','/83aIfGKzE7TE4MqYC5ht14jAPz0.jpg','2000-12-21',89,'Released','They Kill to Serve Satan\'s Child.','The Calling',47191,1.9512,4.9,'CrRgVIhjQ6E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15696,_binary '\0','/edciLCTPW62hedNt0f2VIo6TnzA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0218080',3.5,1438,'en','Agent Red','Matt Hendricks is the US Navy\'s top Marine Special Operations Commander and is facing his toughest challenge yet - escorting the deadliest viral weapon on the planet back to a secure storage facility.','/5n9rh4C2qE9UJZI3jKxs6XE9Wvj.jpg','2000-09-13',95,'Released',NULL,'Agent Red',51422,1.7869,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15697,_binary '\0','/dtKlBit5ZZjh67sSYS8YqRVVcXA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0218088',5.4,1647,'es','Cementerio del terror','On Halloween night, a group of bored teens decide to steal a corpse from the local morgue and take it to a nearby cemetery where they perform a Satanic ritual, unwittingly reviving a bloodthirsty serial killer.','/gGwgyQ1hoDQpp6Yw2YCgWhMPWNG.jpg','1985-12-12',91,'Released','Digging Your Own Grave','Cemetery of Terror',85002,1.9228,6.34,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15698,_binary '\0','/7s7gL6ZCoGb4tzd7U4CJViu2tJJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0218094',6.7,3941,'en','Cheaters','In the fall of 1994, a teacher at Chicago\'s run-down Steinmetz High conspires with the school\'s academic decathlon team to cheat on an academic competition.','/bk7685BYE1GZmChtcvg1jAZpa0G.jpg','2000-05-20',106,'Released','Putting The System To The Test','Cheaters',15869,2.7203,6.3,'2-_Me2tfZKA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15699,_binary '\0','/7k0TQ1UF31u4MckrnPFDwptMPwz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0218107',5.6,1229,'en','Circuit','The hunky John is a closeted small-town cop who moves to L.A., where he is quickly seduced into the gay life of workouts and dusk-to-dawn parties. With actual circuit party footage and mounds of glistening and chiseled flesh, the pulsating Circuit is bound to get your juices flowing.','/c4dRn9y8b1FgqYvv60IVLZiti7y.jpg','2001-10-13',130,'Released','Party hard!','Circuit',5760,1.6105,5.8,'I7AhiPABaiY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15700,_binary '\0','/uulJ0YS8fYR1qyetKLOUfueq5Bd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0218112',6.2,1605,'en','The Closer You Get','Irish lads send an ad to the Miami Herald inviting fit and enticing women, between the ages of 20 and 21, to live in their isolated Donegal village. The whole town knows about the ad, and it sharpens everyone\'s sense of the opportunities for happiness already at hand. Kate, a publican with a young daughter, is separating from her husband and catches the eye of a bachelor sheep farmer. Kieran the butcher realizes that his assistant Siobhan is comely, and then he discovers she\'s fiery as well. Ollie sends off for Dutch skin magazines that the village postmistress won\'t release to him. The men, and women, find counsel in their movie-loving priest. Will anyone answer the ad?','/xeENuqgJtRcum0hJCrmUJ8HA4k8.jpg','2000-12-27',93,'Released','For five desperate Irishmen, the perfect girl is abroad.','The Closer You Get',73642,1.9765,5.7,'svnrSLDewY8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15701,_binary '\0','/fFvSC52N6oyJ8Ti3WrtRt6nvYyW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0218121',6,3044,'en','Model Behavior','An ordinary high school girl and a top teen model decide to switch places after meeting and discovering they bear an uncanny resemblance.','/shCXg98qT4jtDwod0T8YCv1g0Zt.jpg','2000-03-12',89,'Released','Looks like love is out of sync.','Model Behavior',71884,2.3506,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15702,_binary '\0','/pKXKxZedtaSQj3YBY7omnYalunJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0218127',7.1,4221,'en','Crossfire Trail','Rafe Covington is as good as his word, and he\'s determined to keep his promise to a dying man that he\'ll look after the man\'s widow and Wyoming ranch. But the widow doubts the integrity of drifter Covington. And an unscrupulous land grabber and his gunmen are sizing up the ranch the way a spider eyes a fly.','/nWFOBdMabfDUF5Qk8wEPNy9hpAR.jpg','2001-01-21',95,'Released','A hero is measured by the enemies he makes.','Crossfire Trail',35381,3.4699,6.4,'5EyU7-CZ7Zs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15703,_binary '\0','/wWjVP9vJTcukFWebybMlBPZkaha.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0218141',5.9,1862,'en','Deeply','On Ironbound Island, native Fiona McKay arrives from Europe with her teenage daughter Clair, hoping that the peace of the island will help the girl get over the death of her boyfriend. The girl finds comfort in the company of a visiting American girl and more so in the stories of Celia, a crazy old local who weaves enchanting tales which cleverly combine her own experiences on the island with mystifying legends.','/2zOT6T6Gqm3IcTLkblw06cABCu6.jpg','2000-09-11',101,'Released','All of life is salt water ... tears, sweat and the sea.','Deeply',41185,1.6798,6.188,'6ZslJboOK8s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15704,_binary '\0','/9cWUpScrsnDxCBjnBoSePGI2XY5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0218181',5.6,1332,'fr','Eugénie','Eugenie, a beautiful but shy young girl, lives with her stepfather, a famous writer specializing in stories of erotica. One day she happens to read one of his \"erotic\" books and its power so affects her that begins to find herself sexually attracted to her stepfather. He notices this, and eventually brings her into his dark world of sexual perversion and murder.','/tLiQYtiZQOlQBxEVC3CJUsdQbyK.jpg','1973-04-05',91,'Released',NULL,'Eugenie de Sade',28298,2.7126,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15705,_binary '\0','/A1ogoYrA3erbkO6AIBiynQQwyaC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0218182',6.2,1831,'en','An Everlasting Piece','Colin is a Catholic and George is a poetry-loving Protestant. In Belfast in the 1980s, they could have been enemies, but instead they became business partners. After persuading a mad wig salesman, known as the Scalper, to sell them his leads, the two embark on a series of house calls','/b4DApzfh4GxpDCWuS5JIyFMhXeD.jpg','2000-12-22',103,'Released','Piece on Earth.','An Everlasting Piece',29122,1.4844,5.9,'IJEhiF2cXRQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15706,_binary '\0','/aWvmJrHlKL34bue1OJzC2lm9arW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0218378',6.3,7169,'en','The Claim','A prospector sells his wife and daughter to another gold miner for the rights to a gold mine. Twenty years later, the prospector is a wealthy man who owns much of the old west town named Kingdom Come. But changes are brewing and his past is coming back to haunt him. A surveyor and his crew scouts the town as a location for a new railroad line and a young woman suddenly appears in the town and is evidently the man\'s daughter.','/drpLBTmnMOzDUVAd3jqeLjdolcf.jpg','2000-12-29',120,'Released','Everything has a price.','The Claim',44853,2.9098,6,'lnNYl5mSWO4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15707,_binary '\0','/b7BCGWuXsc68kU7jEkjfhgajm2O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0218379',6.3,2075,'he','כיפור','The film takes place in 1973 during the Yom Kippur War in which Egypt and Syria launched attacks in Sinai and the Golan Heights. The story is told from the perspective of Israeli soldiers. We are led by Weinraub and his friend Ruso on a day that begins with quiet city streets, but ends with death, destruction and devastation of both body and mind. Various scenes are awash in the surreal, as Weinraub\'s head hangs out over a rescue helicopter\'s open door, watching with tranquil desperation as the earth passes beneath, the overpowering whir of the blades creating a hypnotic state. It is not a traditional blood, guts and glory film. There are no men in battle, only the rescue crew trying to pick up the broken pieces.','/i7oZ01TVX0srYXemw35UM04QWGQ.jpg','2000-09-07',117,'Released',NULL,'Kippur',49709,1.5947,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15708,_binary '\0','/jG8qyfFdfbxmvmYEYFUx64toKIp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0218388',8.1,6750,'en','Larry David: Curb Your Enthusiasm','Mock documentary about Seinfeld writer Larry David featuring contributions from his friends and colleagues. Larry makes a return to stand-up comedy and prepares to film a television special for HBO. This is the original special that gave birth to the long-running award-winning HBO series.','/oAPbSMOWJCXXJbRYNBfzojE8Lql.jpg','1999-10-17',59,'Released',NULL,'Larry David: Curb Your Enthusiasm',261414,2.53,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15709,_binary '\0','/spJkq5xHrg2o02eAmC3MDLJ4KFZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0218440',5.9,2506,'en','Miracle in Lane 2','Young tween Justin Yoder, who\'s known for his outgoing demeanor and wit despite being confined to a wheelchair, dreams to be like his athletic older brother and propels himself into the world of soapbox derby racing. It\'s a field he\'s sure he has a chance in. Unfortunately, he finds that because of his condition, not everyone is eager to see him compete.','/2zLIdeSXvMp9gdWMpYmE7j1K1QD.jpg','2000-05-13',89,'Released',NULL,'Miracle in Lane 2',77921,3.0703,6.2,'fgGwtkJkj9k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15710,_binary '\0','/v4pufdPDfe2RV2iWVBI2ETKlEt4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0218505',7.3,4847,'en','Path to War','A powerful drama of soaring ambition and shattered dreams that takes a provocative insider\'s look at the way the USA goes to war—as seen from inside the LBJ White House leading up to and during the Vietnam War.','/wuxIMnWSUmw3QPjWZ67Hbcc5HWl.jpg','2003-10-28',165,'Released','He promised peace, but chose war.','Path to War',31018,3.2352,6.7,'DMCQOS1VCQY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15711,_binary '\0','/vlZrenRAefRLjukTerw1rXbwcjm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0218533',6.7,2850,'hi','पुकार','Major Jaidev saves a politician from the clutches of a dreaded terrorist. However, the terrorist joins hands with his childhood friend Anjali to ruin his life.','/6CYvGwb1hmIQcBWjfpec599v7X4.jpg','2000-02-04',165,'Released',NULL,'Pukar',41381,1.6272,6.395,'sBpzhu0JQ2M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15712,_binary '\0','/oTp23mDGYlgOVp2uxEuAGHFhZic.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0218553',5.8,16194,'ja','リング 2','While investigating the horrifying death of her boyfriend, Mai Takano learns about a videotape haunted by the spirit of a disturbing girl named Sadako, which kills anyone who watches it exactly one week later. When her boyfriend’s son, Yoichi, starts to develop the same psychic abilities as Sadako, Takano must find a way to keep the boy and herself from becoming the next victims.','/HREqYQWkGnH2viRQEXupCSX7ID.jpg','1999-01-23',95,'Released',NULL,'Ring 2',9669,4.5979,5.8,'uNXO-5ucOCc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15713,_binary '\0','/hsOqtX5G0y27hfsD22D5jgUWhgX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0218581',5,2987,'it','Scarlet Diva','A young Italian actress embarks on a self-destructive spree of sex, drugs and other excess while doing some soul searching to find the path for redemption.','/zo2uucPQ9FaGCwRG2tRV4V2KBVj.jpg','2000-05-26',91,'Released',NULL,'Scarlet Diva',23990,2.6667,4.753,'6ELT8kWGiNg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15714,_binary '\0','/oK0EwQzU3SqG3PfZwTnkQC4bAjO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0218616',6.6,1620,'en','Some Voices','Schizophrenic Ray tries to adjust to the outside world after being released from an institution.','/yOZNSgqnRmslKjr19WcLZ1BDvEr.jpg','2000-08-25',95,'Released','Love is not the only drug','Some Voices',83581,1.7189,6.1,'V6uaD28L66I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15715,_binary '\0','/x5IFsaNFSC8i9OTqTYNZHsBZAud.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0218619',4,10318,'en','Soul Survivors','A college freshman involved in a fatal car crash discovers she may not have survived after all when she becomes caught between the worlds of the living and the dead.','/uWmHhtuEgX7oI0FuWR2oD08HRHD.jpg','2001-09-06',84,'Released','The world of the dead and the world of the living... are about to collide','Soul Survivors',14033,2.9392,4.6,'6y5IRWxSc-k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15716,_binary '\0','/lJx5iXoPK97QfiDuuQIOuLC90UI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0218625',3.9,1880,'en','The St. Francisville Experiment','Four non-actors, with no script, lock themselves in a haunted Louisiana plantation home overnight to film what takes places. The Lalaurie plantation, site of grisly murders, comes alive before their camera lens and they experience a night more terrifying and incredible than they imagined.','/erXOuvL0nyREuvASXr24Lf3N2F4.jpg','2000-04-15',79,'Released','Everything you\'ve heard is true.','The St. Francisville Experiment',34794,1.9399,4,'pLal3auqEQI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15717,_binary '\0','/3R0vFuDfEAXm9j68L222Zb4RcAp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0218798',7.4,1707,'ru','Двенадцать месяцев','A poor girl was given an impossible task by her stepmother: to gather snowdrops in a winter forest. Suddenly she stumbled across twelve brothers who happened to be the twelve months.','/uK4C2aGBg4789JXG61Ehn8x7AmW.jpg','1956-12-31',55,'Released',NULL,'The Twelve Months',42647,2.2642,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15718,_binary '\0','/4zW1naRVReZqa9lfyLTmXnqchiI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0218817',6.1,31624,'en','Antitrust','A computer programmer\'s dream job at a hot Portland-based firm turns nightmarish when he discovers his boss has a secret and ruthless means of dispatching anti-trust problems.','/9PXyfcJe53A9qFkcj5dkTJwIWoS.jpg','2001-01-11',108,'Released','Truth can be dangerous...Trust can be deadly.','Antitrust',9989,4.1697,6.048,'uIdtkSMwnkQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15719,_binary '\0','/itVxHnmzMJbfHhX3rbzCuyI9mfB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0218839',7.5,76492,'en','Best in Show','The tension is palpable, the excitement is mounting and the heady scent of competition is in the air as hundreds of eager contestants from across America prepare to take part in what is undoubtedly one of the greatest events of their lives -- the Mayflower Dog Show. The canine contestants and their owners are as wondrously diverse as the great country that has bred them.','/qkYBCMN26SxkQww4gLxUXQm5vr4.jpg','2000-09-29',91,'Released','Some pets deserve a little more respect than others.','Best in Show',13785,5.3941,6.9,'w7H9fsREWdg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15720,_binary '\0','/hTLGvJ8drSQxjQCYVJ5ALvOaBS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0218864',5.8,7863,'en','Buying the Cow','A commitment-averse man frantically hits the dating scene after his girlfriend starts pressuring him to pop the question.','/ovpV10dDSJJofemJtxrqJwcRtwH.jpg','2002-06-08',88,'Released','Why buy the cow, when you can get the milk for free?','Buying the Cow',13163,2.5208,5.1,'5BC9g9dbdlA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15721,_binary '\0','/lFDeRoh5gowXWf0O3ayEAUxePcw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0218922',6,63994,'en','Original Sin','A young man is plunged into a life of subterfuge, deceit and mistaken identity in pursuit of a femme fatale whose heart is never quite within his grasp.','/xvTtsdvvVr1NYlVJxWZibzhaEt5.jpg','2001-05-08',116,'Released','Lead us into temptation.','Original Sin',2057,11.3636,6.1,'HF0eg5YAFIs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15722,_binary '\0','/gnosJeDIDQXy9uDewXphEpDWNYT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0218967',6.9,131912,'en','The Family Man','Jack\'s lavish, fast-paced lifestyle changes one Christmas night when he stumbles into a grocery store holdup and disarms the gunman. The next morning he wakes up in bed lying next to Kate, his college sweetheart he left in order to pursue his career, and to the horrifying discovery that his former life no longer exists. As he stumbles through this alternate suburban universe, Jack finds himself at a crossroad where he must choose between his high-power career and the woman he loves.','/9wToOVsKuf0XeKhlauzCa3D8Gui.jpg','2000-12-12',125,'Released','What if you made different choices? What if you said yes, instead of no? What if you got a second chance?','The Family Man',5994,10.3233,6.8,'Hzw-p2PfBeU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15723,_binary '\0','/zhI09I6ivSQDyUqOBgqhFQErdak.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0219086',7.2,1432,'en','Robbie the Reindeer: Hooves of Fire','Robbie the Reindeer arrives at the North Pole, ready to take his place as navigator on Santa\'s Christmas sleigh team. However, Robbie is soon plagued by doubt regarding his ability, and sets out to regain his self-respect and the admiration of his team-mates.','/r0xVWX3pNNscD9YMn0qXBMl11wl.jpg','1999-12-25',30,'Released','He\'s running the race of his life... If he can turn up in time!','Robbie the Reindeer: Hooves of Fire',13399,2.3926,6.121,'LiSWXVcCaMg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15724,_binary '\0','/sqY862wdzbCeiAQylq0EARfFwuq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0219171',5.9,3098,'en','Ripley Under Ground','Now living a quiet, luxurious life at his French estate—funded by past crimes and his marriage to an heiress—Tom Ripley finds that an art scam he supports—selling forged paintings by a supposedly living artist named Derwatt—beginning to collapse. An inquisitive American collector suspects his Derwatt painting is fake and demands answers. As the situation escalates, Ripley turns to murder and elaborate identity deception to protect his reputation.','/alNFel4KW4wQepQsFpGHfyW9O7n.jpg','2007-10-31',96,'Released',NULL,'Ripley Under Ground',39127,2.316,5.604,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15725,_binary '\0','/ttUwYbMtKEjWfXoPrNAXjqB8JRd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0219224',6.9,4633,'en','On the Beach','The world has finally managed to blow itself up and only Australia has been spared from nuclear destruction and a gigantic wave of radiation is floating in on the breezes. One American sub located in the Pacific has survived and is met with disdain by the Australians. The calculations of Australia\'s most renowned scientist says the country is doomed. However, one of his rivals says that he is wrong. He believes that 1000 people can be relocated to the northern hemisphere, where his assumptions indicate the radiation levels may be lower. The American Captain is asked to take a mission to the north to determine which scientist is right.','/1DekOcoIk9sXok8a9mcin3OSrXK.jpg','2000-05-28',197,'Released',NULL,'On the Beach',30944,3.0228,6.2,'daNjN659jxw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15726,_binary '\0','/9WHr8r2KLaOcv9i37p5nBdzJyjd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0219288',7.5,3469,'cs','Samotáři','Robert works for a travel agency and helps to arrange scenes from the everyday lives of \"ordinary\" Czech families as an attraction for Japanese tourists. He also works as a kind of matchmaker and occasionally helps to put together some of his friends. He helps to separate his friend Hanka from Peter, an announcer for an independent radio station who tries to capture \"real\" life by recording the moments from \"reality\" and playing them over the air. Vesna, came to Prague from Macedonia because it is according to her the best place for UFOs to land, but her real reason for coming is somewhat different... Hanka is followed by the crazy Ondrej, until then a respected brain surgeon, and married with two kids. Through him she meets Jacob, who uses copious amounts of weed in order to be constructive in this gloomy world. On the other hand, this destroys his short-term memory - and he forgets that he already has a girlfriend...','/A8nCilQSJ3Nnexus9CvJJEfRUvd.jpg','2000-04-13',103,'Released','Come to laugh at yourself.','Loners',31321,1.0235,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15727,_binary '\0','/om1qt1rgeyw4qsU9uc3tZwBueWV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0219374',6.7,4046,'en','Unconditional Love','After her husband leaves her, a woman travels to London for the funeral of the pop star, Victor Fox, she\'s adored all her life. There, she meets the lover of the dead pop star, and convinces him to come back to Chicago with her to figure out who killed the singer.','/hhSnhxf4OjYeyyvxFPPPpeae7LU.jpg','2002-08-23',124,'Released','If love takes no prisoners, somebody forgot to tell them.','Unconditional Love',37922,2.91,5.988,'vEJO0u5GR54','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15728,_binary '\0','/8Be8hMBJuBujQmYjwLxaaPEgne4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0219400',5.5,6665,'en','Waking Up in Reno','Candy and Lonnie Earl are just crazy about each other. The problem: she\'s married to Roy and he\'s married to Darlene. So far it\'s been a secret affair. But that\'s about to change, because this foursome is driving cross-country and headed for some big surprises.','/wXLmDc7KoaXqglHsqgJ2Zh2YFRx.jpg','2002-12-13',91,'Released','This foursome is sharing lots more than room service!','Waking Up in Reno',21118,4.0578,5,'1X1b6RQtai0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15729,_binary '\0','/feNJqEhBWj1C4Td2UVEYqucHjT1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0219405',6.7,1944,'en','Waydowntown','Four young office workers have a bet going to see who can last the longest without going outside. In the maze that is the downtown core of a large city, glass skywalks connect apartment buildings, office towers and shopping malls. Its day 28 of the bet and over the lunch hour, as the office prepares for the company founder\'s retirement party, things start to seriously unravel.','/k2gFxNSAYZEqXXzT2chV7ezrl0Z.jpg','2002-01-25',84,'Released','Welcome to life at the bottom of the food chain.','Waydowntown',13915,0.9238,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15730,_binary '\0','/kR3lYqpNoWX8AJQkY4CSLoW1OZo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0219519',6.3,1841,'en','Auggie Rose','An insurance salesman\'s humdrum existence takes a turn when a stranger, ex-con Auggie Rose, unexpectedly dies in his arms. Assuming the identity of the dead man, the salesman embarks on a double life, keeping it secret from his live-in girlfriend.','/lNTPMDT6tts9zLPTRjjiH5goIcC.jpg','2000-05-14',109,'Released',NULL,'Auggie Rose',113213,1.9267,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15731,_binary '\0','/bYaSV1JD9f1FBPrCDTQvFl0wcgb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0219653',4.9,39112,'en','Dracula 2000','When a team of techno-savvy thieves break into a high-security vault, they don\'t discover priceless works of art... they find a crypt unopened for 100 years.','/jnAfl6GSZbBMigL98RJGbOSk4V1.jpg','2000-12-22',99,'Released','The Most Seductive Evil of All Time Has Now Been Unleashed in Ours.','Dracula 2000',10577,5.8476,5.2,'py_sPdBmstA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15732,_binary '\0','/gwa2mecvILtKsAoKsBIiTG0vUCg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0219699',6.7,82395,'en','The Gift','Annie Wilson, young widow and mother of three, makes her living foretelling others\' futures⁠—though her own has become cloudier than even she can see. Threatened by a client\'s violent husband and plagued by visions of a missing local woman, Annie finds herself pulled into a thicket of lies and deception in which her extraordinary gift may ultimately get her killed.','/nQdBE1P0r4ZrgGqy5EX8sL2kXG6.jpg','2000-12-22',112,'Released','The only witness to the crime was not even there.','The Gift',2046,7.1077,6.489,'K1ee3-G-Spw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15733,_binary '\0','/XY0XlTy5DLXraXENg86db5IAmW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0219813',6.2,2350,'en','Horse Sense','After treating his rancher cousin shoddily in L.A. Michael Woods is sentenced by his parents to spending a month on the ranch with his cousin and aunt.','/ckdA057F1hpDIHedKG334vlRd.jpg','1999-11-20',92,'Released','Can this city guy and his cowboy cousin saddle up to save the ranch?','Horse Sense',6980,2.4466,6.8,'hR1BNYW3bNw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15734,_binary '\0','/cpvq7ODdoNvvIUidZljILpLUVK1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0219822',6.4,19628,'en','Human Nature','Obsessive scientist Nathan and his lover, the naturalist Lila, discover Puff: a man born and raised in the wild. As Nathan trains the wild man in the civilized ways of the world, Lila fights to preserve the man’s natural state. In the power struggle that ensues, an unusual love triangle emerges.','/eyEgsPIwsr9bUV9n9INH46L5KuM.jpg','2001-09-12',96,'Released','In the Interest of Civilization… Conform.','Human Nature',441,4.0322,5.982,'WM7cm69eZNE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15735,_binary '\0','/jEMYEoQw7jF0aoKRgaa1TbHojUT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0219854',6.1,46700,'en','The Kid','An unhappy, disliked image consultant gets a second shot at life when he is mysteriously confronted by an eight-year-old version of himself.','/kMRZhiF08nDiO5aRb81Np5a4d6p.jpg','2000-07-07',104,'Released','Nobody ever grows up quite like they imagined.','The Kid',4244,7.257,6.8,'d86Qg-y9eAA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15736,_binary '\0','/aZmSjtNzSqgSE9ZDW1fe3EPvS6e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0219952',5.1,11355,'en','Lucky Numbers','Russ Richards is a TV weatherman and local celebrity on the verge of losing his shirt. Desperate to escape financial ruin, he schemes with Crystal the TV station\'s lotto ball girl to rig the state lottery drawing. The numbers come up right, but everything else goes wrong as the plan starts to unravel and the game turns rough.','/glmBnEtrmtMypPyg8DiwPZja3Vj.jpg','2000-10-27',105,'Released','When they put their heads together... it\'s a no brainer.','Lucky Numbers',10783,3.5078,5.2,'dFFdGYuHATI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15737,_binary '\0','/97uVTcMUaml18166fwM2ds0kgp8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0219965',6.5,74927,'en','Bandits','After escaping from prison, Joe and Terry go on a crime spree, robbing banks through Oregon and California in order to finance their scheme for a new life south of the border. Unfortunately, things get more complicated when they meet Kate, who runs into them with her car. She joins the bandits on their cross-country spree, and eventually she steals something, too: their hearts.','/67AUAkiT4rbgqN7SNlIJn0zWZqU.jpg','2001-10-12',123,'Released','Two\'s company, three\'s a crime.','Bandits',3172,5.9391,6.3,'JuyNQxwWI7Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15738,_binary '\0','/iUdMBZcfYPU2ajJ9O8Z7inxyeBD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0220016',6.6,4052,'el','Safe Sex','A satire of life in modern Greece, presented through a series of different stories about sex. There are several couples and their relation with sex in parallel stories that come together in a hilarious way.','/iTxgwrDFT0vPae5TlNiYMd9oWZu.jpg','1999-10-22',100,'Released',NULL,'Safe Sex',17914,3.0915,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15739,_binary '\0','/60JMvMGuLHSlVjoUpi86UiB5Lmq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0220099',6.4,22041,'en','The Tigger Movie','Winnie the Pooh, Piglet, Owl, Kanga, Roo, and Rabbit are preparing a suitable winter home for Eeyore, the perennially dejected donkey, but Tigger\'s continual bouncing interrupts their efforts. Rabbit suggests that Tigger go find others of his kind to bounce with, but Tigger thinks \"the most wonderful thing about tiggers is\" he\'s \"the only one!\" Just in case though, the joyously jouncy feline sets out to see if he can find relatives.','/9OdZKUdGfaBAUwRLbtWpFWKbILO.jpg','2000-02-11',77,'Released',NULL,'The Tigger Movie',15655,8.2697,6.688,'9IHmPu3P9Fw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15740,_binary '\0','/hrsyCCYyqCFgV4jtPYHYalIXXNj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0220100',6,7390,'en','Timecode','A production company begins casting for its next feature, and an up-and-coming actress named Rose tries to manipulate her filmmaker boyfriend, Alex, into giving her a screen test. Alex\'s wife, Emma, knows about the affair and is considering divorce, while Rose\'s girlfriend secretly spies on her and attempts to sabotage the relationship. The four storylines in the film were each shot in one take and are shown simultaneously, each taking up a quarter of the screen.','/xQWlEjYAJTC8aBHjUzPmFLjZPSp.jpg','2000-04-28',97,'Released','Four cameras. One take. No edits. Real time.','Timecode',36234,1.9993,5.6,'icUyG8ZdX04','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15741,_binary '\0','/xx366LK78SBqXiuiexJZs0BoMF7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0220157',6.5,1368,'en','When Brendan Met Trudy','Brendan is an earnest, introverted schoolteacher who, aside from his participation in the local choir, has only one passion in his life -- the movies. That is until he meets Trudy, a woman who is gregarious and adventurous beyond his imagination. His entire persona changes as he becomes enveloped in her carefree and sometimes dangerous world.','/tI2yl0z0nZpeMEl0bGn5z98eilk.jpg','2000-12-14',95,'Released',NULL,'When Brendan Met Trudy',49929,2.0422,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15742,_binary '\0','/aixcoIaYC69hgktfAaBgkSaFovR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0220159',7.3,1934,'en','Winnie the Pooh & Christmas Too','Pooh is so busy gathering up his friends\' wish lists for Santa that he forgets to include his own. After retrieving the list and adding his own desires, he realizes he\'s late getting it where it needs to go. Off he goes to the North Pole on Christmas Eve, with pals Eeyore, Tigger, Piglet, Rabbit, and Christopher Robin missing him','/43viCWUdwNvfsTFcfHRaXQNeA35.jpg','1991-12-14',26,'Released',NULL,'Winnie the Pooh & Christmas Too',80357,2.2569,6.9,'jl0O9E0Woqs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15743,_binary '\0','/2oLZKqaiDtuB1FK7DybZ7Hq7zk4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0220307',2.3,1470,'de','Amoklauf','A nameless waiter spends his days sitting around the house watching Faces of Death, slaughterhouse videos, pornography and the German equivalent of The Price Is Right. Deluded, deranged and believing mankind will endure the most horrible experiences, and will resort to any actions in order to sustain their own life, he snaps.','/8WGMVEBZiOxSRYUbeRVMJKBHQys.jpg','1994-02-13',65,'Released',NULL,'Amoklauf',31538,1.8417,3.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15744,_binary '\0','/YpxBYi0eplB1cbekGh6BDjEwOA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0220343',5.4,1410,'en','Plain Dirty','Inez Macbeth is a pretty young woman married to Edgar, a moody and unstable felon. When Inez becomes interested in the sensitive and wealthy lawyer Druden Hunt, Edgar derails their budding romance by keeping her captive in their home. With his scruffy buddy, Flowers, on hand to watch Inez, Edgar continues to hold her prisoner, but eventually she devises a way to escape that tests the loyalty of Flowers and leads to murder.','/u1hur45oYcNO7wiPSR8AcaDrkIT.jpg','2003-01-20',103,'Released','Love. Marriage. Murder. Sometimes they\'re all... Plain Dirty','Plain Dirty',80218,1.511,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15745,_binary '\0','/8noDXtTJI6sB4GSbjPox8WUvius.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0220363',7,1233,'fa','روبان قرمز','A man and a woman fight over the rights to a property.','/pI0TXPh66J5uXbRp4CpQAD6eXAv.jpg','1999-04-01',95,'Released',NULL,'The Red Ribbon',403576,1.0686,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15746,_binary '\0','/jnSB3v76tGte9lzHS1XLGu75oaT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0220506',3.9,54553,'en','Halloween: Resurrection','Reality programmers at DangerTainment select a group of thrill-seeking teenagers to spend one night in the childhood home of serial killer Michael Myers. Their planned live broadcast turns deadly when Michael decides to crash the party.','/1mlKwbNzJCGzqe4i0ZEJtUUL290.jpg','2002-07-01',89,'Released','Evil finds its way home.','Halloween: Resurrection',11442,6.3015,4.604,'FyvbHlMcuyA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15747,_binary '\0','/em8MBMqzJo5uEFLksqAj9LXxZXE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0220507',6.6,2575,'ko','해피 엔드','When a wife becomes the breadwinner of her family after her husband loses his job, adultery becomes part of her life.','/oHqmSc7J9w4ZhoXyoSrpYWoxSTr.jpg','1999-12-11',100,'Released','She had another man.','Happy End',27154,5.6129,6.6,'02T7l0stH5M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15748,_binary '\0','/orCqFI2ROrtr1ajUTIolzMmQiqP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0220580',6.8,14276,'es','Intacto','An enigmatic tale of four people whose lives are intertwined by destiny are subject to the laws of fate. They discover that luck is something they cannot afford to be without as they gamble with the highest stakes possible in a deadly game from which only one of them will emerge intact.','/gAe6KmVojjHLmdhPZhYDMTmaiM1.jpg','2001-11-06',108,'Released','Some are born with luck. Others gamble for it.','Intacto',10856,2.8446,6.6,'0x2H2a7tP5w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15749,_binary '\0','/wHaffL9KEi8R9oXLcskztn1t0LX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0220608',7.2,1776,'en','The Last of the Blonde Bombshells','After Elizabeth\'s husband dies, she begins to play her tenor saxophone again, and remembers when she was 15 and a member of the Blonde Bombshells, an all-girl (with one exception) swing band. Accompanied by the exception and urged on by her grand-daughter, Elizabeth hunts up all the old members of the band and urges them to perform, and in doing so, learns more than she knew about the band, its members, the roses on the drum set, and herself--the last of the Blonde Bombshells.','/4BnxvAe18aNSPPuBmXcDZ41Z0FS.jpg','2000-08-26',84,'Released','It\'s never too late for an encore.','The Last of the Blonde Bombshells',40632,2.1168,6.857,'HTFgoiufqIk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15750,_binary '\0','/9jvFnE0BXEoefe80djgyNTtZbCa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0220623',6.3,5065,'sv','Livvakterna','After causing a commotion with his last assignment, Falk has been given a desk job, which hardly agrees with his personality, and he ends up accepting an offer from an old friend to buy into a private investigation agency. Another friend of Falk\'s, Sven, purchased a business in Estonia, and when local gangsters attempted to pressure him into paying protection money, Sven retained the services of Nikolaus Lehmann, a burly private eye, to throw them off his trail. However, Lehmann does his job all too well, murdering the racketeers, and then threatening Sven and his family. With no where else to turn, Sven asks Falk to help him deal with the crazed Lehmann; Falk agrees, but soon realizes he\'s dealing with a more dangerous man than he imagined when Lehmann kidnaps Falk\'s wife Jeanette, and then releases her with a time bomb locked around her neck, demanding that Falk hand over ownership of his detective agency to Lehmann.','/qnLVCqgSg9tEpB3QSmtpyMiwOVC.jpg','2001-08-17',112,'Released',NULL,'Executive Protection',21040,1.3846,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15751,_binary '\0','/rxaga3bJXuwgHidnTcdwVHifLpH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0220627',6.7,8162,'fr','Maelström','A young woman\'s life spirals into chaos after she is involved in a hit-and-run accident. Then she encounters a mysterious man named Evian who offers her an opportunity for redemption. Narrated by a fish.','/knhWhSDOEPcWed5ljKcJVnXbH7.jpg','2000-09-15',87,'Released',NULL,'Maelström',35650,2.7528,6.243,'xX153pGDQYw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15752,_binary '\0','/tfxZ8efiyreNDCszGosj9GOfMRF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0220631',6.9,1644,'ca','El mar','Childhood friends reunite later in life in Spanish tuberculosis sanitorium. Pressures of death all around combine with dark secrets of their past.','/2wsNLhToOjGfsBIdLJywmSHZI9P.jpg','2000-04-14',108,'Released',NULL,'The Sea',41425,1.8649,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15753,_binary '\0','/jNxw6CREDD6dYK443LWrjCNQyI7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0220644',7.5,6813,'cn','鎗火','Triad boss Lung, who has just escaped being killed in an assassination attempt hires the killers Curtis, James, Mike, Roy and Shin for his protection.','/oDhY2UjbT64vqfO1NDiPH0AxQIx.jpg','1999-11-19',84,'Released','Five men. They appreciate each other\'s guts and wisdom, and they are always perfect partners in missions. But now, they\'ll have to hold their pistols at each other...','The Mission',45871,3.4602,7.5,'EwHckUJu2Xs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15754,_binary '\0','/cbKHL1Jv9JPWivRkzRsUmFYINmQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0220656',8.4,9499,'ta','முதல்வன்','A man accepts a challenge to act as the Chief Minister for one day only, and makes such a success of it that soon he is embroiled in political intrigue.','/k69lNVmDJcLLJb4LBCk3L2yv4Vw.jpg','1999-11-07',169,'Released',NULL,'Mudhalvan',66526,1.5684,7.033,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15755,_binary '\0','/5ESdv9mEz3phLgU1RBrCMdwuF1c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0220726',7.2,2976,'fr','Ressources humaines','\"Good son\" Franck returns to his hometown to do a trainee managerial internship in the Human Resources department of the factory where his anxious, taciturn father has worked for 23 years.','/i2BdbtsCeRCHhczCDEV3mFt4uF0.jpg','1999-11-20',100,'Released',NULL,'Human Resources',46831,1.849,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15756,_binary '\0','/2lrq4E05BPZD2OcDgBUb74D0EKN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0220757',7.7,4465,'hi','शूल','Police Inspector Samar Pratap Singh is transferred to Motihari, in the Indian state of Bihar, along with his wife, Manjari and a daughter. He is honest and diligent and these attributes sets him up against his superior - the District Superintendent of Police, as well as his subordinates and fellow officers.','/hrH5MNv0C0pBsAXLr1TNW8etsXF.jpg','1999-11-04',142,'Released',NULL,'Shool',170998,1.1016,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15757,_binary '\0','/v2lrrGksxcc0hDD2LP8RxKz712b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0220806',6.4,3264,'ko','텔 미 썸딩','Detective Cho, a cop on the edge, is mourning his mother\'s recent death while under investigation for graft; on top of that he is suddenly put in charge of a seemingly-impenetrable mystery.','/jRyGUU4WiK8EOQqeIUvhutITFlr.jpg','1999-11-13',118,'Released','Crimes This Horrible... Are Better Left Unsolved.','Tell Me Something',16371,2.0923,6.2,'4XmtC7zIosY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15758,_binary '\0','/iyK4EdrFMSXp6NRmTB64fVgw92n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0220827',6.2,8242,'it','Non ho sonno','An elderly and retired police detective and a young amateur sleuth team up to find a serial killer whom has resumed a killing spree in Turin, Italy after a 17-year hiatus.','/ihD09Yz6sIhwGHDq0Bo1IZaIeAC.jpg','2001-01-05',117,'Released','Creepier than Jack the Ripper.','Sleepless',39436,2.4414,6.1,'oUZzD1SQUIc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15759,_binary '\0','/kijEHuVFvYHlUqOgbxziGHitxju.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0220832',8,16223,'hi','Vaastav','Raghu, a simpleton, and his best friend decide to run a food stall to get rid of their unemployment. However, Raghu\'s life takes a drastic turn after he accidentally kills one of their customers and he is pushed into a life of crime.','/fsB57eZ0EJ9nXLxgfjQG9iYiswH.jpg','1999-10-07',150,'Released','The Reality','Vaastav',146270,1.3274,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15760,_binary '\0','/b5GNqEW951qS1sJKmWUQD1uI7UU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0221027',7.5,289135,'en','Blow','The story of how George Jung, together with the Medellín Cartel led by Pablo Escobar, established the billion-dollar cocaine empire in the United States in the 1970s.','/yYZFVfk8aeMP4GxBSU9MTvqs9mJ.jpg','2001-04-04',124,'Released','based on a true story','Blow',4133,8.2216,7.353,'DRS5B3QsjiU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15761,_binary '\0','/bET2U7hMozQlSolyRcB508X5Erl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0221069',6.2,3760,'en','Chasing Sleep','A college professor wakes up to find his wife has not returned home, then struggles to understand her disappearance.','/5pC2f3ewFmDV9KA6XbZLPx6tPb8.jpg','2001-05-16',104,'Released','The nightmare begins when you open your eyes...','Chasing Sleep',32166,2.7182,6,'coSaMe5LWp0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15762,_binary '\0','/t2voKheYY22L3IM18oavWN164Da.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0221073',7.1,44990,'en','Chopper','The true and infamous story of Australia\'s notorious criminal Mark \'Chopper\' Read and his years of crime, interest in violence, drugs and prostitutes.','/8Ua4voSMwqzlL8DzYi6dOOe1Dxw.jpg','2000-06-21',94,'Released','Never let the truth get in the way of a good yarn.','Chopper',9519,3.0363,6.792,'VSELr4Dk3eo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15763,_binary '\0','/cA9Zr9lox5HBNJ5Ko0eyxQkTh3H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0221111',6.7,8997,'ja','DEAD OR ALIVE 犯罪者','Ryūichi and his small gang of Triad vie for control of the Japanese underworld in a crime-ridden Shinjuku quarter while Detective Jojima tries to bring it down.','/A8rgAigkv5RHi1abcQJ0oNNnwgJ.jpg','1999-11-27',105,'Released','A daring exercise in ultra-violent extremes.','Dead or Alive',11315,3.2553,6.4,'9RksoyvOxwE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15764,_binary '\0','/r0ZAhYrmidOZuPgZZ2vDfNC2ddd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0221218',5.8,43638,'en','The Glass House','When Ruby and Rhett\'s parents are killed in a car accident, their carefree teenage lives are suddenly shattered. Moving to an incredible house in Malibu with the Glasses\', old friends of the family, seems to be the beginning of a new life for them.','/16obDcmphjfq17zwWKJlur53fCh.jpg','2001-09-14',107,'Released','The glass is about to be shattered...','The Glass House',2176,6.537,5.976,'6wknrgJlv_Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15765,_binary '\0','/jVdPh0yUYnZZuNiwqP6BcZhDYZT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0221344',7.7,8004,'es','La ley de Herodes','In the 1940s, a small Mexican town has seen its last three mayors assassinated in rapid succession. A naive janitor is recruited to become the new mayor, and he believes he will modernize the little town and usher in a reign of peace. But the system corrupts him very quickly, and he takes to abusing his power while associating with an unscrupulous assortment of opportunists, hypocrites and criminals.','/653dXbr6dXffXG0oN8OfZGShFRP.jpg','1999-11-09',123,'Released','Why don\'t they want you to see it?','Herod\'s Law',14430,2.7871,8,'Qx7Ylt-Bwwc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15766,_binary '\0','/oDaiIfLL1ro5gFYYSpZg1MNbMIi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0221559',6.9,5275,'en','On the Edge','A suicidal young man is committed to a Dublin psychiatric hospital where he meets new friends who greatly influence his life.','/p7UivdoGp8Zkohy8wVzQEWR3gUx.jpg','2001-09-21',85,'Released','A joyride through sex, love, and other activities.','On the Edge',80070,2.0847,6.7,'R_jhl4ITQ8s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15767,_binary '\0','/kWLhQ6q9SHy8ukln7a5MZXvIkju.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0221563',5.9,1368,'en','Sorted','A young lawyer gets more than he bargains for while investigating his brother\'s mysterious death.','/pDX435FpvTW9rBqkmGUnY4P7kQl.jpg','2000-10-06',102,'Released',NULL,'Sorted',34056,2.1854,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15768,_binary '\0','/zcAXUO2mz2H7GbxWXaJjlC3BNM6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0221633',5.2,2630,'en','They Nest','After freezing up under pressure in the emergency room, Dr. Cahill decides to spend a few months unwinding on a little Maine island where he immediately gets off on the wrong foot with the locals. Meanwhile, a body has washed up on shore infested with a strange type of carnivorous cockroach. But when Dr. Cahill tries to warn the townsfolk of the danger, they are naturally skeptical. Will they realize the truth before it\'s too late?','/dCSSGMXLPKcPHZF3QlwkRxQtlis.jpg','2000-07-25',92,'Released','It\'s feeding time...','They Nest',40249,2.5003,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15769,_binary '\0','/1ztxggsHZcIxatvGOvqYhvZ8yKM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0221789',7,1692,'en','2gether','After being fired as a manager, a music mogul decides to start a boyband of his own in this spoof of popular boybands like *NSYNC and Backstreet Boys.','/jN23niTiMgfWbKjoEPmFvbdC722.jpg','2000-02-21',82,'Released','Are you SURE you want to go behind the music?','2gether',51824,1.3671,6.2,'GQdftbMlHyk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15770,_binary '\0','/3DHBsuI6KkEDc8kz7vdkkYQYTkH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0221799',6.7,4672,'en','An American Rhapsody','A Hungarian family forced to flee the Communist country for the United States must leave a young daughter behind. Six years later, the family arranges to bring the absent daughter to the United States where she has trouble adjusting. The daughter then decides to travel to Budapest to discover her identity.','/ixiDtKZ30uZmXiQg7G9mL2uDT60.jpg','2001-06-22',106,'Released','Sometimes you have to lose your way to find your home.','An American Rhapsody',37920,2.9152,6.4,'zSjL3pJP4Wg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15771,_binary '\0','/677kz71I1J0uHXVBZpsH9XuEVT1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0221838',6.8,2719,'en','Borstal Boy','Brendan Behan, a sixteen year-old IRA foot soldier, is going on a bombing mission from Ireland to Liverpool during the second world war. His mission is thwarted when he is apprehended, charged and imprisoned in Borstal, a reform institution for young offenders in East Anglia, England.','/1wtBSqyuRqiab8Bfdp38FngbIje.jpg','2001-03-22',91,'Released','As a prisoner of war it is my duty to escape.','Borstal Boy',24309,1.7839,6.2,'AV6b0XSAiUY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15772,_binary '\0','/smctEI9OQ5mdBOBkLjpIoJG5S5l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0221885',4.9,1218,'en','Contaminated Man','David Whitman is a chemist who lost his wife and child in a freak accident and is trying to rebuild his life on his own. While doing research, Whitman discovers a series of mysterious deaths that seem to follow in the path of Joseph Mueller, a seemingly ordinary man who works as a security guard. Unknown to Mueller, his body carries a strange contaminant that\'s deadly to many people, and Whitman is desperate to find Mueller and stop him before he can cause more deaths.','/c48V2n84yY9bDW4IgUIZjqp9o72.jpg','2000-12-17',100,'Released',NULL,'Contaminated Man',48123,1.8206,4.3,'e3mUH1iOsPE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15773,_binary '\0','/PncTIHqTcartOXIvm3TopbL0d7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0221889',5.8,4129,'en','Beautiful Creatures','When Petula and Dorothy cover up the accidental murder of one jerk boyfriend, they hatch a hilarious scheme to collect a huge ransom.','/v9mWi816aq6OZaIc9ICAWQcxQC1.jpg','2000-08-23',85,'Released','Dorothy and Petula have a body to die for. Disposing of it could get them killed.','Beautiful Creatures',15940,1.6059,5.6,'JpmsgXcSwOw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15774,_binary '\0','/kkgYfLabemM98GDTkoyXP8J8TyL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0221928',5.1,2158,'en','7 Days to Live','A grieving woman suffers terrifying visions of her own demise after she and her husband move into a country mansion.','/lalEkaTYF87Srr1KHXVUaHCTBkw.jpg','2000-06-25',96,'Released','Don\'t trust your eyes. Don\'t trust your heart. Just trust your fear.','7 Days to Live',10558,2.2375,5.6,'VV7XJ2u8ZQk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15775,_binary '\0','/j7JOVdjwSTCCtaMmgIlYHehBTPr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0222012',8,15320,'ta','ஹே ராம்','Saketh Ram\'s wife is raped and killed during direct action day riots in Calcutta. He is convinced that Mahatma Gandhi is responsible for all the problems happening in the country. He sets out to kill him.','/v7MM2hogZ6XwPaoHFC66g8g26Mo.jpg','2000-02-18',199,'Released','An Experiment With Truth','Hey Ram',60579,1.9583,7,'GKLvKk_uXzA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15776,_binary '\0','/56QegZ4GyF61IKfe4TRTBIDVApI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0222024',5.4,8538,'hi','हम तुम्हारे हैं सनम','Radha and Suraj have been friends since childhood. Gopal has been in love with Radha ever since they spent a few years together as kids. Years later, Gopal\'s guardian proposes to Radha a marriage with Gopal, and she accepts.','/46IXH3NtlWv2i7IeFigT5yb5T5.jpg','2002-05-24',174,'Released',NULL,'Hum Tumhare Hain Sanam',90634,1.8889,5.563,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15777,_binary '\0','/hWGz8dJqiVqpzU8vQEcZXmAO0b7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0222150',7,1314,'es','Lista de espera','At a rundown bus station in rural Cuba, the line of passengers waiting just keeps getting longer. The problem is that every bus that passes by is already full. Their only hope is to wait for the station\'s bus to be fixed. As the disparate group settles in, relationships start forming between the passengers: Emilio, a young engineer, becomes smitten with a beautiful young woman who is en route to meet her Spanish fiancé, a blind man gets support from the others to go to the head of the line. Frustration and disorder reign when the one bus brakes down and no one can leave. Resigned to working together, the group magically transforms the station into a beautiful place where no one wants to leave.','/fqv31DmokBLuIAm2iUcz5qBhRzM.jpg','2000-06-02',105,'Released',NULL,'The Waiting List',43776,1.5258,6.6,'sPOztEsyv2M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15778,_binary '\0','/dagl8l1HHAIiN8dXeZ21HUuxrMt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0222270',6.2,9558,'hi','फिर भी दिल है हिंदुस्तानी','Two rival reporters team up to help prove the innocence of a man set to be hanged for the murder of a politician.','/7VvNZVMbUcxwfdLZlUSZnKFYu0p.jpg','2000-01-21',160,'Released','Love, laughter, and freedom.','Phir Bhi Dil Hai Hindustani',97351,1.9416,6.559,'BCY-NGum5ts','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15779,_binary '\0','/9KgLQ8C4dGLaQmq5u9ORLewlnQx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0222293',6.6,2259,'en','Possible Worlds','The same man lives out several parallel lives in different \"worlds\" and in different relationships at the same time.','/jfjNjtKZq5jwkiutnb7JzpqcLmk.jpg','2000-09-04',93,'Released',NULL,'Possible Worlds',38987,1.5208,6.3,'p9msmseEMWY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15780,_binary '\0','/oN1wyH6qlyLdOdARnz5gxcwy1fB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0222368',5.8,8089,'es','Los sin nombre','The mutilated body of a six year old girl is found in a water hole. The girl is identified as the missing daughter of Claudia. However, only two peices of evidence could be used to identify her; a bracelet with her name on it near the crime scene, and the fact that her right leg was three inches longer than her left. All other methods of identification were removed from her body. Five years later Claudia, now addicted to tranquilizers, receives a phone call from someone claiming to be her daughter, asking for her mother to come find her before \'they\' kill her. Other mysterious clues show up, further indicating that Claudia\'s daughter is indeed still alive, and very much in danger. Claudia, a run-down ex-cop, and a parapsychology reporter put together the clues to discover Angela\'s whereabouts','/eZRtWQU6EnqBtPc9xKgQ9SM6ICg.jpg','1999-10-08',100,'Released','Trying to reach the limits of evil... But evil has no limits.','The Nameless',9439,1.7157,5.7,'anKksNCrt1w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15781,_binary '\0','/1eJt8dcoraOUKGH2DOFiBCvEK3f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0222812',5.7,14110,'en','Beyond Re-Animator','Once again tampering with mother nature to disastrous results, Dr. Herbert West continues his research while serving time in a maximum security prison for his previous exploits. West\'s limited prison-cell experiments are suddenly interrupted by the arrival of a new prison doctor and the brother of the girl who suffered from West\'s experiments 13 years earlier.','/iS4oB4nQEdO86Fvszqf6P2ejK44.jpg','2003-04-04',95,'Released','They thought prison would be the death of him. But for Dr. West, death is only the beginning.','Beyond Re-Animator',11429,3.0519,5.9,'fWZT-faP7Oc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15782,_binary '\0','/83lD2Uj4akWy6kMDz6bv7Ybpzxv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0222817',4.3,1427,'ja','処女のはらわた','Returning from a shoot, an adult film crew gets lost in the fog of a mountain location. Luckily, they find a deserted resort, but unfortunately, something is stirring in the woods, and it’s not too happy with their visit.','/3luqUP9feJwYO0YDKMbcX0GIkrR.jpg','1986-05-31',72,'Released','It will tear your insides out!','Entrails of a Virgin',46078,2.3539,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15783,_binary '\0','/bu8Ixqtg7vx1L0UlnV5sekYXizU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0222850',6.9,8646,'en','The Broken Hearts Club: A Romantic Comedy','A close-knit group of gay friends share the emotional roller coster of life, relationships, the death of friends, new beginnings, jealousy, fatherhood and professional success. At various stages of life\'s disarray, these young men share humorous and tragic relationships and always have each other to rely on.','/g9bqbopRZYy5Z2137zFoFQRXVEW.jpg','2000-02-01',96,'Released','The shortest distance between friends isn\'t always a straight line.','The Broken Hearts Club: A Romantic Comedy',22597,3.0792,6.2,'QRaWJy3NmFg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15784,_binary '\0','/cL1VX6WllejQQhGTUGGWHW25yor.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0222851',7.1,26107,'ja','Brother','A Japanese Yakuza gangster\'s deadly existence in his homeland gets him exiled to Los Angeles, where he is taken in by his little brother and his brother\'s gang.','/rSRJozSafFFuiFT9XnwsE1ricHT.jpg','2000-12-13',113,'Released','Are You Japanese?','Brother',327,4.9893,7.1,'NIGH6d5VVi8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15785,_binary '\0','/plp70Zqq1HQMJiN743F8IKmFdXU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0223268',4.5,4958,'en','Faust: Love of the Damned','An artist sells his soul to the mysterious M in order to get revenge on the people who killed his girlfriend. Soon, he realises everything has a price, and he is transformed into a horned demon with a passion for killing.','/qewddAmFcD2XoGc4w1YwNdw8YXy.jpg','2000-11-01',98,'Released','Evil rises from the depths of hell.','Faust: Love of the Damned',64883,2.8682,4.8,'R20724MykwI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15786,_binary '\0','/9AsJZuEwSWDCyBaRWaWx9DcohGs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0223530',6.4,2402,'ko','인정사정 볼 것 없다','Detective Woo is on the trail of the mysterious gangster Sungmin, a master of disguise who always manages to elude his pursuers. Eventually, the cop tracks down and confronts the master-criminal in the suburbs of a coal-mining town.','/f4liFY9Xoj6TOfJj57uvQFHjJwc.jpg','1999-07-31',108,'Released','They will find you.','Nowhere to Hide',25660,1.5222,6.7,'eWfv5p3HWrA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15787,_binary '\0','/9OAw8aom0GiNr86cTyHa2jXqzVo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0223777',6.7,1848,'es','Más negro que la noche','When four women move into an old house left by one woman\'s aunt, strange things begin to happen. Bizarre voices, visions of ghosts, and mysterious noises lead them to discover the darkest powers of evil and a horror and agony beyond terror.','/awiRINySbTVIsK78htbPWEOUVEQ.jpg','1975-12-25',102,'Released','Scary! Four beautiful women live between terror and agony.','Blacker Than the Night',68636,1.5108,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15788,_binary '\0','/h21tHAWrk9Nut3zncrMoUkW3INm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0223832',6.5,1402,'en','The Old Man Who Read Love Stories','In El Idilio, a village on the banks of a river in the Amazon rainforest, Antonio Bolívar, known to everyone as \"The Old Man,\" lives a recluse. One day, Antonio begins reading the romance novels that the traveling dentist Rubicondo Loachamin brings him to pass the time. He shares this occupation with a beautiful local girl, a waitress and prostitute, named Josefina, with whom he ends up falling in love. But all does not go smoothly when Antonio is forced to go on a hunting trip.','/nzmEJsEIedbGpj3L3yui0kCo9aB.jpg','2001-03-07',115,'Released',NULL,'The Old Man Who Read Love Stories',68052,1.8329,6.4,'20oILdd5v-c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15789,_binary '\0','/xoFolYFMGVzIOjYhEhyBiYbBpqK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0223897',7.2,128427,'en','Pay It Forward','Like some other kids, 12-year-old Trevor McKinney believed in the goodness of human nature. Like many other kids, he was determined to change the world for the better. Unlike most other kids, he succeeded.','/62OIokwaxFwBFWM147ijLJsaVJD.jpg','2000-10-20',122,'Released','When someone does you a big favor, don\'t pay it back...','Pay It Forward',10647,8.7272,7.39,'_pCtXRP1edo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15790,_binary '\0','/uhOlGqbz8u0aMsboYizV8RmoWFg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0223954',6,2329,'en','The Prime Gig','Pendelton \"Penny\" Wise is a smooth-talking con-artist who scams people with phoney travel comp vacations over the phone when, desperate for more fast cash, he\'s called to work for a shady, veteran con businessman Kelly Grant. The situation takes a turn for the worst when Penny begins a relationship with Grant\'s mistress, Caitlin.','/gJTeDkT6zYfUlSQFlSiBKfpibwA.jpg','2001-04-24',98,'Released','Too much is never enough.','The Prime Gig',44015,1.8121,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15791,_binary '\0','/o66nkW4OM2yoVTXtKoc2Nsu7TS9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0224077',6.6,1930,'ja','聖獣学園','18 years after the mysterious death of her mother, Maya takes religious vows to find out what terrible things happened to her mother inside the Sacred Heart Convent. As soon as the door closes to the nunnery, the nuns start torturing her. She also has to deal with a lecherous archbishops and a lesbian mother superior.','/v4Aae3oDI7XkHnUlzlsCUIIGI17.jpg','1974-02-16',91,'Released',NULL,'The Transgressor',39885,2.7159,6.388,'3NktNQ-givc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15792,_binary '\0','/cIlvOmtoHSAuvY4oBKGxBvnDuoe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0224578',7.2,4241,'vi','Mùa hè chiều thẳng đứng','Hanoi comes across almost picture-perfect in director Tran Anh Hung\'s beautiful, elegiac tale about the lives and loves of three Vietnamese sisters. A mood characteristic of Hung\'s films is set early on with the vivid sounds of birds, insects and water and the way the lighting enhances the subtle use of color. They all combine to gem-like effect here.','/mZCgbOi383Cohv0sIlH5XDEfQTa.jpg','2000-05-24',112,'Released',NULL,'The Vertical Ray of the Sun',34899,2.2212,6.6,'4ma2Bt8c1Kc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15793,_binary '\0','/afDTi2MQuqwvx0UQlNtS3EhgrNP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0225009',5.6,3588,'ja','ピノキオ√964','A memory-wiped and defective cyborg sex slave is tossed onto the streets and taken in by a homeless woman while his corporate creators hunt him down.','/99iOoaDyFElUA5ihgBYKmGRhPJs.jpg','1991-09-14',97,'Released','Vengeful Outcast, Emetic Spirit.','964 Pinocchio',50162,2.8246,5.976,'RJI_szKnDbo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15794,_binary '\0','/ytGqPRcmlX86Ve2yO3TlGtdfLaO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0225029',4.6,1586,'hi','Aflatoon','Mistakenly appointed as a college professor, happy-go-lucky Raja finds the rich girl of his dreams - but must confront a look-alike con man named Rocky to win her father\'s approval. The plot thickens when Raja pretends to be Rocky, and Rocky pretends to be Raja. But both does not know that this mistake will engulf them for years to come','/33ibzMirUrCoG859TSz3gVhQVEO.jpg','1997-12-19',153,'Released',NULL,'Aflatoon',165016,1.7777,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15795,_binary '\0','/6r38uhBZTZl0KGfEcfi3HNP2N0z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0225071',5.7,27254,'en','Angel Eyes','A story about a seemingly unlikely couple who cross paths under life-threatening circumstances as though they are destined not only to meet but to save each other\'s lives. Not once, but twice.','/6ZeMoynnz4pRweKKZ9c2G1absMJ.jpg','2001-05-18',102,'Released','The deeper you look, the more you will find.','Angel Eyes',5852,4.4534,6.1,'UoFcx-jO_UM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15796,_binary '\0','/kT7OblOHljem7puglvwWfDRQdMN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0225458',5.9,1218,'ja','堕靡泥の星 美少女狩り','The life of Tatsuya, a young man of proper yet mysterious descent, whose outward respectability hides his urges for rape and torture.','/3n029M1rCF51hG24sq18D3lMtTw.jpg','1979-10-27',100,'Released','A masterpiece of immoral Eros, a movie of Masaaki Sato\'s dramatic manga made by Norifumi Suzuki of \'Torakku yarō\'!','Star of David: Beauty Hunting',39863,6.7372,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15797,_binary '\0','/eX3ZYSbsNBVw0pC0ZWbnlv0X69E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0225515',5.3,1404,'hi','Dillagi','Two brothers -- Ranvir and Rajvir along with their parents move to Mumbai. They endure numerous hardships, but their will to survive prevails and they succeed. Soon, their parents pass away, leaving young Rajvir in the care of Ranvir. Now wealthy beyond any means, Ranvir runs the business and Rajvir lives recklessly. When Rajvir falls in love, Ranvir arranges his marriage, but to his dismay finds out that he has arranged his brother to marry the girl he loves.','/ezesgmVml1VvKoZlPHXzbdSzngY.jpg','1999-11-08',188,'Released',NULL,'Dillagi',457714,0.9401,5.533,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15798,_binary '\0','/AngxTcs3rr1edH3XwDJtTxZ72v9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0225535',7.8,4169,'pl','Dług','Based on true events, the movie tells the story of two men who want to start a scooter business but don\'t have the required collateral for a bank loan. Then one of them runs into a former flat neighbour who offers to lend them the money. The guy turns out to be a thug and starts to extort them. Their life goes downhill from there.','/57VzJyaO1HQxKaSAnBhfOaeqzl2.jpg','1999-11-19',106,'Released','Mixing friends and business is a deadly combination','The Debt',52666,1.1603,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15799,_binary '\0','/3gtr17V2XtZMlZi22GoWuFlwXXs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0226018',7.3,1439,'ja','仁義なき戦い 完結篇','While Hirono is in prison, his rival Takeda turns his own crime organization into a political party, whose two executives stir up new tensions in their thirst for power.','/8NlodXb8Vdl594bBBQYWsj6MB1L.jpg','1974-06-29',100,'Released',NULL,'Battles Without Honor and Humanity: Final Episode',64912,1.6207,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15800,_binary '\0','/9OVsevJ5OxHjwUBwuoHtQhS9oai.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0226418',7.6,2306,'en','A Season for Miracles','A miracle occurs for a homeless family consisting of two wayward children and their protective aunt with the help of an angel. When a young woman\'s niece and nephew are threatened with foster care after her sister is hospitalized following yet another overdose, she flees with them until they land in the sleepy town of Bethlehem just before Christmas and a series of kindnesses and coincidences gives the trio a chance at happiness.','/yDtDxE6tHTJ51he0aeCLTUMHWM8.jpg','1999-12-12',100,'Released',NULL,'A Season for Miracles',146405,2.546,7,'rkMc2oSnfDk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15801,_binary '\0','/eSkB9K0MJD4rbnfZaHsNmf8izAj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0226771',7.7,2504,'en','Homicide: The Movie','Retired police lieutenant Al Giardello is running for mayor when he is suddenly shot at a press conference. All of the detectives, past and present, clamor for an opportunity to help find the shooter.','/4L8vCP1Bp6U25JVa1jUm6VzHgBa.jpg','2000-02-13',89,'Released','The One Case So Important, Every Detective is Back','Homicide: The Movie',31006,2.2888,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15802,_binary '\0','/sCT0WyE8WNkWLPxsUlJeTsa4C0W.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0226847',4.8,2197,'hi','जानम समझा करो','Chandni, a nightclub singer and dancer, is requested to pretend to be a wealthy womaniser\'s wife in front of his grandfather. However, things get interesting when the two, gradually, fall in love.','/uAE2tf9EVtBeBSl6M941Lu0QKL5.jpg','1999-04-02',156,'Released',NULL,'Jaanam Samjha Karo',161227,1.1459,4.444,'tu3pHHWTfoI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15803,_binary '\0','/ajs3hya6o4ELDMHEcEgySm41AAF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0226872',7.2,5763,'ja','女囚701号さそり','After being cruelly set up and deceived by Sugimi, a detective in cahoots with the mob with whom she was whole-heartedly in love, Matsushima’s desire for revenge knows no bounds.','/Q3A9Mow4kSC7xpoiaBTuCOaIRl.jpg','1972-08-25',87,'Released','A woman betrayed and imprisoned. A mission of vengeance.','Female Prisoner #701: Scorpion',71138,3.301,7.1,'5ceGRIWDRoA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15804,_binary '\0','/1LZt5xWSxh5NvSQMI8XJ3Fk1Ahq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0226873',6.3,1945,'ja','女囚さそり 701号怨み節','Nami is once again on the run from the law but is saved by an old classmate who works at a strip club. Through a subsequent conversation they discover they both have a score to settle with a particular crooked cop. However, Nami has doubts about ever trusting a man.','/6tc4iSFAUkiDEZ4itqUZoPCOJTX.jpg','1973-12-29',89,'Released',NULL,'Female Prisoner Scorpion: #701\'s Grudge Song',55379,2.7236,6.2,'xRZ8KAbKPIc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15805,_binary '\0','/gpttyaLQTVfHDYxAuJjzJdFLbbT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0226874',7.1,3874,'ja','女囚さそり 第41雑居房','After being used and betrayed by the detective she had fallen in love with, young Matsu is sent to a female prison full of sadistic guards and disobedient prisoners.','/q2PYJshLAXKxd2tsXqgifhbkfAp.jpg','1972-12-30',90,'Released','Slicing up the patriarchy since 1972.','Female Prisoner Scorpion: Jailhouse 41',39872,2.0037,7.1,'kDJSPIfxN3c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15806,_binary '\0','/3QHESiate2Gou0kcZQAUeLrptmW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0226875',6.9,2529,'ja','女囚さそり けもの部屋','Following her successful prison break, Scorpion begins this third episode in the series hiding out in a brothel. Her prostitute friend tries to keep her identity secret, but the brothel\'s madam discovers that Scorpion is the ex-girlfriend of the vice officer who killed her lover.','/zHRhQ3v1pXCIB3LnOFdfTZso4nO.jpg','1973-07-29',87,'Released','The scorpion is dead... But! To dispel such rumors, the Vengeful Woman\'s Killing Fang has sent another one to Hell','Female Prisoner Scorpion: Beast Stable',35282,1.8737,6.8,'DI0qoRCk-j4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15807,_binary '\0','/iUKGfbEHvS4sid66UXb0BDw9WTX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0226935',4.8,2288,'en','Chelsea Walls','This movie tells five stories set in a single day at the famed Chelsea Hotel in New York City, involving an ensemble cast of some 30-35 characters.','/qgM01zWdfb3uVWM2CYMDB4zXz0a.jpg','2001-09-21',109,'Released',NULL,'Chelsea Walls',35694,1.7804,4.3,'sUkHBxP7fcE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15808,_binary '\0','/bfrkFpsNYRkzVTf1arVn6w2Kphe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0227005',6.3,20538,'en','Made','Two aspiring boxers and lifelong friends get involved in a money-laundering scheme through a low-level organized crime group.','/4HC6ieptXO2gjqbSEsfkOwsGubN.jpg','2001-07-13',95,'Released','The easy part is surviving the mob. The hard part is surviving the friendship.','Made',15745,3.1006,5.8,'b5WMY-nVAg0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15809,_binary '\0','/6hBxO59oSRkxJAJn5xHZckqFH6Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0227034',7.2,2154,'hr','Maršal','Stipan is a policeman who comes to small Adriatic island off the Croatian coast in order to investigate the reports of strange phenomena that had frightened the local population. At first, nobody wants to co-operate with him, until he finds out that the island is allegedly haunted by the ghost of Josip Broz Tito, the communist leader of the former Yugoslavia. For Luka, the mayor, this is an opportunity to turn the entire island into a Tito-themed amusement park. Tito\'s WW2 veterans, on the other hand, don\'t believe in ghosts. For them, the apparition is actually Tito himself, who had returned in order to lead them into a new revolution which would restore communism.','/mF1YFmGRUQbEklAmVsGq7WZU2XD.jpg','1999-01-05',97,'Released',NULL,'Marshal Tito\'s Spirit',194941,1.5457,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15810,_binary '\0','/ozxGFzo3iMgVaU2FR5gHB6slfsX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0227194',5.5,6252,'hi','वन २ का ४','After his partner, Javed, is killed, Arun takes care of the four orphaned children with the help of Geeta. He discovers Javed\'s death was a homicide, and as he investigates, he learns that Geeta is leading a double life.','/4sX2hNAeTBrg6CykOHKvbMURGfJ.jpg','2001-03-30',178,'Released',NULL,'One 2 Ka 4',132744,2.0546,5.576,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15811,_binary '\0','/fOaxKVXLM2cHgMHprwwVsBP0kp8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0227277',7,7239,'es','Plata quemada','Set in Argentina in 1965, the story follows the tumultuous relationship between two men who became lovers and ultimately ruthless bank robbers in a notoriously famous footnote in the annals of crime history. After a large-scale hold-up that turns bloody, the two men must flee. It is not long before the police are surrounding the building they are in and they must confront their demons to survive.','/LzjfTXKSdSwyqWzp2X5TjkvJ64.jpg','2000-05-11',125,'Released','Based on a true story that for 35 years was kept secret...','Burnt Money',27092,2.1312,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15812,_binary '\0','/4POvX5h1jDY95SXhPRzdvjppCSw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0227408',6.4,1289,'ja','ラバーズ・ラバー','After the explosive demise of their last subject, scientists must look for a replacement on whom to continue their bizarre experiments with brain-altering drugs.','/e3gnezLmqQUfAsNIJZcPRmbPTlE.jpg','1996-09-28',91,'Released','Psychic power is realized when mental anguish exceeds physical pain.','Rubber\'s Lover',48191,1.597,6.4,'XM-ZeGLrsps','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15813,_binary '\0','/tCBcuOw60wjzLvg9oJdZKlBn1nG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0227445',6.8,145557,'en','The Score','An aging thief hopes to retire and live off his ill-gotten wealth when a young kid convinces him into doing one last heist.','/fsb4m9XW59mei8GKznvI3lLzcfp.jpg','2001-07-13',124,'Released','There are no partners in crime.','The Score',11371,7.2164,6.7,'8W1D_D7ZG8o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15814,_binary '\0','/wfStsmeSW7MtvYhD9Ac6ETXdbmx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0227538',5.7,137510,'en','Spy Kids','Carmen and Juni think their parents are boring. Little do they know that in their day, Gregorio and Ingrid Cortez were the top secret agents from their respective countries. They gave up that life to raise their children. Now, the disappearances of several of their old colleagues forces the Cortez\' return from retirement. What they didn\'t count on was Carmen and Juni joining the \"family business.\"','/j3rUkHIAAoKr6jU30q3Db4fcIF9.jpg','2001-03-18',88,'Released','Real spies... only smaller.','Spy Kids',10054,11.5908,5.822,'GE5aHKJp6HI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15815,_binary '\0','/lTn6AUlpKn70quBaANug12n07xj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0227984',6.3,52985,'en','The 51st State','An American master chemist plans to score big on a once in a lifetime drug deal. All does not go as planned and he is soon entangled in a web of deceit.','/aYlrGirWrRCTU1PF6Svghn1EMAc.jpg','2001-12-07',93,'Released','Nice wheels. Dirty deals. And one mean mother in a kilt.','The 51st State',1613,4.8252,6.085,'CaGy5JkZiis','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15816,_binary '\0','/7N48JBsxqaMt1j7P1obXWgky5UU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0228242',6.9,1939,'fr','Drôle de Félix','A charming comedy about going on a rather long walk. Félix is a laid-back guy living in the bleak northern coastal town of Dieppe. He lives happily with his lover Daniel and is a soap opera enthusiast and HIV-positive. After losing his job, Félix decides to find the father he never knew in Marseilles. Agreeing to meet Daniel in the southern port city in a week\'s time, Félix throws on his backpack and starts hiking. On his way, he discovers that family need not always be connected by blood.','/62DDLzTOsqRYX5vWi9v2KflNykS.jpg','2000-04-19',92,'Released','Sometimes a little trip can change everything','Adventures of Félix',21488,1.4622,6,'aZJXMGL3Sjs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15817,_binary '\0','/1loG5dSesKgwakjOET0Ll27jKgI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0228333',4.9,62477,'en','Ghosts of Mars','In 2176, a Martian police unit is sent to pick up a highly dangerous criminal at a remote mining post. Upon arrival, the cops find the post deserted and something far more dangerous than any criminal — the original inhabitants of Mars, hellbent on getting their planet back.','/i2zztssCIbahGES1fdfWFmDXian.jpg','2001-08-14',98,'Released','Terror is the same on any planet.','Ghosts of Mars',10016,7.1179,5.2,'XbmFwk8n0f0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15818,_binary '\0','/2T8MljYJWFfb9ZLxpDy3sIx6EtB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0228488',6.2,2175,'en','Kiss Kiss (Bang Bang)','A hit man who wants out of the business is targeted by old colleagues.','/lSV5VXaUmHqy1BL3d9SUEuLD6TN.jpg','2001-11-07',101,'Released','Don\'t turn your back to the underworld.','Kiss Kiss (Bang Bang)',22615,2.3251,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15819,_binary '\0','/4iThHj4wK5A5Rfbe66y3KpyhD3Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0228687',7.3,7459,'cs','Otesánek','When a childless couple learn that they cannot have children, it causes great distress. To ease his wife\'s pain, the man finds a piece of root in the backyard and chops it and varnishes it into the shape of a child. However the woman takes the root as her baby and starts to pretend that it is real.','/86uoXmcgXKZQa35V1AsKVXY3NvX.jpg','2001-01-25',131,'Released','From the creator of \"Alice\" and \"Faust\" comes a most unusual baby…','Little Otik',18939,2.2921,7,'aF8SSyQi-2c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15820,_binary '\0','/iakEcGh4varespo3U8Cx0UtcNox.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0228750',6.3,61257,'en','Proof of Life','When Peter Bowman, an American engineer working in a South American country, is captured by anti-government forces, the rebels learn his identity and demand $5 million for his safe return. However, his US employer is on the verge of insolvency and will not provide the ransom. Peter\'s wife Alice is forced to deal with the matter on her own and she retains the services of freelance professional hostage negotiator Terry Thorne.','/yw8x2i3vaHZZzpvqvF75E8q2N6M.jpg','2000-12-08',135,'Released','For her, it\'s personal. For him, it\'s a contract.','Proof of Life',11983,5.4114,6.2,'BLH0JjhBe8g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15821,_binary '\0','/1Kzrk49o1oX15yqjWVuGPAEnjgd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0228786',6.9,70481,'fr','Les Rivières pourpres','Two French policemen, one investigating a grisly murder at a remote mountain college, the other working on the desecration of a young girl\'s grave by skinheads, are brought together by the clues from their respective cases. Soon after they start working together, more murders are committed, and the pair begin to discover just what dark secrets are behind the killings.','/npvDhiKkpQBuTaQ8cbWRT2iEfkE.jpg','2000-09-27',106,'Released','Evil rises to new heights.','The Crimson Rivers',60670,6.1617,6.92,'dzSrbX8u9q0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15822,_binary '\0','/ekKFhwWCeCaypq6IJXtxM9vX1AM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0228853',7.5,2624,'ja','書を捨てよ町へ出よう','An experimental, psychedelic odyssey through Japanese subculture experienced via the eyes of a disillusioned young man, who must contend with intense familial dysfunction, psychosexual alienation, and existentialist malaise.','/2TW1nVMOKzly6q1eoAldfZ3HsP2.jpg','1971-04-24',137,'Released',NULL,'Throw Away Your Books, Rally in the Streets',104549,2.2112,7.4,'yaOz3ec7vs8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15823,_binary '\0','/yKulAMi0l05dv6CQC9lxOt2Mnyf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0228871',5.8,1375,'sv','Sleepwalker','Ulrik Hansson is 45 years old and lives a secure life in a Swedish residential district together with his wife Monika and their two children. He\'s got a well-paid job as an architect and builds a new detached house which the family will move to. Everything is just great. He thinks. One morning he wakes up and shockingly discovers that they\'re gone. The whole family...','/odbnNGlaiCT7KerGG3jQ1XLsZ0T.jpg','2000-08-04',95,'Released',NULL,'Sleepwalker',22470,1.7943,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15824,_binary '\0','/bJO0QAFZbhuOuu7Ck20cDihUYWj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0228979',7,1256,'en','Two of Us','In this purely fictional story, Paul McCartney drops by The Dakota to visit John Lennon in 1976. Paul is still on top of the music world, reaching #1 with his new band, Wings. John, however, has retired from public life, choosing to raise his son, Sean. Rumors are rampant that The Beatles are going to reunite to play a concert. Paul, the consummate entertainer, is intrigued by the possibilities. But John, still fighting his inner demons, is content keeping Beatlemania a thing of the past. But even though the two men are still at odds over the band, they rediscover that they still have bonds from the past that will never go away.','/qjFyaTXHG4xDgy7p4mwJKAbwfH6.jpg','2000-02-01',90,'Released','The bitter break-up. The unexpected encounter. The legend lives on.','Two of Us',93184,1.5748,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15825,_binary '\0','/bp5Z6Lhx2El03YDtBtxAd28TKcB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0229002',6.1,1311,'en','Green Dragon','A tale about Vietnamese refugees sent to an orientation camp on the Camp Pendleton Marine Base in California, \'Green Dragon\' focuses on a young boy and his sister. Set in 1975, the film chronicles the stories told to the two children by other refugees in the camp and of Tai Tran, who dares to introduce himself to Sergeant Jim Lance. In developing a relationship with Lance, Tran is able to improve','/eCLKd6aR05mKMJf9st8LCdJGNgB.jpg','2001-05-17',115,'Released',NULL,'Green Dragon',35868,1.7536,6.2,'oQV-MjxWRUg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15826,_binary '\0','/unVjWj6KsRXk67pEkBfxflpbyRV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0229260',4.1,42383,'en','Book of Shadows: Blair Witch 2','A group of college students decide to take part in a witch hunt tour inspired by a horror movie. As the adventure goes awry, the students realise that an evil being has followed them home.','/l1jF93S9FYbzp3Byh5VUA1KApSJ.jpg','2000-10-27',90,'Released','Evil doesn\'t die.','Book of Shadows: Blair Witch 2',11531,4.9338,4.4,'rxANWqgmsFc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15827,_binary '\0','/W3WJlXspYPRXfXwWuSuCg3reUd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0229340',7.2,6748,'en','Dinner Rush','One unlucky evening, Louis Cropa, a part-time bookmaker, discovers that his restaurant has become a hotbed of conflicting characters. In addition to having to please a whiny food critic, Louis must fend off a hostile takeover from a pair of gangsters, to whom his sous-chef is in debt. Further, Louis has an argument with his son, the star chef, whose culinary creativity has brought success to the business.','/6qhSssp1RT3IU53OkomdpJsyJ0D.jpg','2000-09-01',99,'Released','New York\'s hottest eatery is going to have a killer night.','Dinner Rush',22617,2.893,7,'_oE-HFYGduU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15828,_binary '\0','/yKG2GDowR6U9WfGPW2YwWBOWDOe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0229371',7.3,1270,'en','An Evening of Edgar Allan Poe','Renowned horror actor Vincent Price narrates four tales of terror by renowned horror author Edgar Allen Poe: The Tell-Tale Heart, The Sphinx, The Cask of Amontillado, and The Pit and the Pendulum.','/dKwXIwOYQo3edxUJV1VhqW289Qe.jpg','1970-01-01',54,'Released','A diabolical quartet of HORRIFYING Evil!','An Evening of Edgar Allan Poe',52949,1.72,7.4,'4wIk1c5o348','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15829,_binary '\0','/6W2jH4hcqbNto9uTyda8ccNj1oJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0229664',7.6,2738,'fr','Princes et Princesses','In this episodic animated fantasy from France, an art teacher interprets a series of six fairy tales (each involving a prince or princess) with the help of two precocious students. Princes and Princesses was created using a special style of cutout animation, with black silhouetted characters performing the action against backlit backdrops in striking colors.','/gP1PDJmbsF5J2teuond2OtRiEaC.jpg','2000-01-26',70,'Released',NULL,'Princes and Princesses',65592,2.2073,7.662,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15830,_binary '\0','/4eTiLRTYwAVQyQAjuFuf3BXAony.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0230011',6.9,150247,'en','Atlantis: The Lost Empire','A young linguist named Milo Thatch joins an intrepid group of explorers to find the mysterious lost continent of Atlantis.','/oK8yR6xSQreWf1ouP1VpXKwoop5.jpg','2001-06-02',95,'Released','Atlantis is waiting...','Atlantis: The Lost Empire',10865,13.5874,7,'--3UI9-1PD4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15831,_binary '\0','/yNTgGcJFZeSFPNvCE61KRXQNX1i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0230025',6.4,2390,'en','Bartleby','An adaptation of Herman Melville\'s short story \"Bartleby, the Scrivener\" told in the setting of a modern office.','/swYfLGplXAle5CenmWVYpRSomCp.jpg','2001-03-10',85,'Released','I would prefer not to.','Bartleby',53048,1.8744,5.8,'RwiA8nC9C0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15832,_binary '\0','/uaTVgIzIn02wd1SBTDXouGTpiIG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0230030',6.1,120285,'en','Bedazzled','Elliot Richards, a socially awkward IT worker, is given seven wishes to get the girl of his dreams when he meets a very seductive Satan. The catch: his soul. Some of his wishes include being a 7 foot basketball star, a wealthy, powerful man, and a sensitive caring guy. But, as could be expected, the Devil puts her own little twist on each of his fantasies.','/sBV28EVvWsJRosMsEFCbVmpAZEl.jpg','2000-10-19',93,'Released','Meet the Devil. She\'s giving Elliott seven wishes. But not a chance in Hell.','Bedazzled',1636,8.601,6.119,'tDEfT9q07Ig','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15833,_binary '\0','/39fcknANf8uI2eQUd9bACoVMasm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0230169',5.5,6131,'en','Ed Gein','The true story of Edward Gein, the farmer whose horrific crimes inspired Psycho, The Texas Chainsaw Massacre and The Silence of the Lambs. This is the first film to Gein\'s tormented upbringing, his adored but domineering mother, and the 1957 arrest uncovered the most bizarre series of murders America has ever seen','/kmgR0RmsFei4Ev3a6GiRojuZwHx.jpg','2000-11-17',89,'Released','Before DAHMER, Before GACY, There was ED.','Ed Gein',55888,2.0767,5.4,'Woz9BIKgMc4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15834,_binary '\0','/5qu3Q3FcfiI59ZBo4Fddk8nchds.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0230347',5.9,3298,'hi','Jaanwar','Sultan (Shakti Kapoor) adopted an orphan and named him Badshah (Akshay Kumar). Badshah grows up to be a criminal and his life was made difficult by Inspector Pradhan (Ashish Vidyarthi). Badshah\'s sidekick is Abdul (Ashutosh Rana). The only hope in Badshah\'s life is Sapna (Karisma Kapoor), whom he incidentally met. But circumstances lead Badshah to commit murder in public. During this experience, a child clangs to him and he took the child to Sapna. Before he could explain anything, Pradhan gets there and Badshah had to escape. He changed his name to Babu Lohar and becomes a blacksmith and loving father, to give the child a good future. However, after 7 years, he sees Abdul and Sultan again. Pradhan is still after him. When the child\'s parents find out about him, they ask Babu to return their child. Will he let the child go? Will the child go with his parents?','/hAdnoPTsd1uWXKtKNzHzhijg6j.jpg','1999-12-24',120,'Released','PowerTo Kill. Power To Heal','Jaanwar',353429,1.4105,6.35,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15835,_binary '\0','/nF3At92CEaTHhPactTHgPRpMpnh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0230512',7,1697,'en','Mayor of the Sunset Strip','A look at the history of fame in the world through the eyes of pop star impresario, Rodney Bingenheimer','/1vRVeVhozMozvQSubTlcmQlHKK0.jpg','2003-06-17',94,'Released','One unlikely man made America listen','Mayor of the Sunset Strip',61487,2.3739,6.813,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15836,_binary '\0','/mG1H7dWzvgXVgNwhid6gJFIggmf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0230591',7.8,6760,'en','One Day in September','The full story of the 1972 Munich Olympics Massacre and the Israeli revenge operation \'Wrath of God.\' The 1972 Munich Olympics were interrupted by Palestinian terrorists taking Israeli athletes hostage. Besides footage taken at the time, we see interviews with the surviving terrorist, Jamal Al Gashey, and various officials detailing exactly how the police, lacking an anti-terrorist squad and turning down help from the Israelis, botched the operation.','/vsxtkcidi7flgxWERBSnwtyH1JJ.jpg','1999-10-22',94,'Released','1972. The Munich Olympic Games. 121 Nations. 7,123 Competitors. Over a billion viewers ... and 8 Palestinian Terrorists. For the first time in 25 years, the truth is revealed.','One Day in September',34045,1.7078,7.3,'WUax6vEEdac','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15837,_binary '\0','/4xaZvC6vgor1tm2zJ73C0abgIFW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0230597',8.7,6758,'ml','ഒരു വടക്കൻ വീരഗാഥ','Chanthu, a poor orphan and Aromal are cousins and belong to the Chekavar clan, a warrior clan who hire themselves out as duellers to settle disputes among the rich and powerful. Aromal, jealous of the much more talented Chanthu, makes life miserable for him and Chanthu decides to leave and live with Aringodar, a rival chekavan, as his pupil. When the two sons of a local landlord have a property dispute and decide to hire Aromal and Aringodar to duel it out, Chanthu has to decide where his loyalty lies - with the family of the uncle who brought him up or with Aringodar who provided him with sanctuary.','/zAHyfIpg9dLCfxCtZYTUyUjoCLb.jpg','1989-04-14',168,'Released',NULL,'Oru Vadakkan Veeragatha',151662,1.4333,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15838,_binary '\0','/rbBe9WQ1OqCxzgwskOTnaY6JdUA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0230600',7.6,432157,'en','The Others','Grace is a woman who lives in an old house kept dark because her two children, Anne and Nicholas, have a rare sensitivity to light. When the family begins to suspect the house is haunted, Grace fights to protect her children at any cost in the face of strange events and disturbing visions.','/p8g1vlTvpM6nr2hMMiZ1fUlKF0D.jpg','2001-08-02',101,'Released','Sooner or later they’ll find you.','The Others',1933,15.1003,7.618,'GekkoBitLvM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15839,_binary '\0','/6KfQTuw4X3LQN11sDA18eYy9HJY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0230838',6.7,99683,'en','Sweet November','Nelson is a man devoted to his advertising career in San Francisco. One day, while taking a driving test at the DMV, he meets Sara. She is very different from the other women in his life. Nelson causes her to miss out on taking the test and later that day she tracks him down. One thing leads to another and Nelson ends up living with her through a November that will change his life forever.','/3biEHZSBSYqSkawU2sQyNbLcjgE.jpg','2001-02-16',119,'Released','She Just Needed A Month To Change His Life Forever.','Sweet November',1921,8.3447,6.871,'A7hkvdyG8x4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15840,_binary '\0','/44agxyGL39VAjG3SXYpUUY34PsX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0230938',7,1302,'el','Βασικά... Καλησπέρα Σας','Stathis is a teenager who owns a pirate radio station that broadcasts at the same frequency used by another pirate radio station, owned by Stamatis and his friends. This leads to many conflicts between them, and as if this wasn\'t enough, Stathis is also desperately in love with Koula and has to face her huge boyfriend Kyriakos...','/pDH6QuzSeytYjzzYoLktgWRzm13.jpg','1982-10-04',90,'Released',NULL,'Good Evening to You',185105,0.9535,6.778,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15841,_binary '\0','/2wHCH7EayQuKTfatJUgzueVsne6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0231001',6.8,4439,'en','The Zookeeper','Jonah Ludovic is a custodian at a small municipal zoo. After a night of heavy shelling Ludovic arrives at his job to find the staff abandoning the zoo. He joins a skeleton crew that includes an elderly guard and a veterinarian. Their purpose: to keep the animals alive until help arrives from an international zoological mission.','/CL06HCdWB9ewda8aiiDsS0PFEx.jpg','2001-11-22',108,'Released','One man had the courage to do what was right...','The Zookeeper',209096,2.0694,6.6,'z75b19HbpL8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15842,_binary '\0','/ci4EHMEm52kzYbFNwozKV5aSbc9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0231237',7.7,7136,'en','Batman Beyond: The Movie','Fuelled by remorse and vengeance, a high schooler named Terry McGinnis becomes the new Batman as he fights crime in the futuristic Neo-Gotham City.','/8YgqCWC9Vf9732oa4uUcQRR38GC.jpg','1999-01-10',41,'Released','A new hero, for a new era.','Batman Beyond: The Movie',64202,3.9535,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15843,_binary '\0','/nkAqmS6JgZG0ERm6tPo1MsmaFVy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0231402',4.9,27701,'en','Crocodile Dundee in Los Angeles','After settling in the tiny Australian town of Walkabout Creek with his significant other and his young son, Mick \"Crocodile\" Dundee is thrown for a loop when a prestigious Los Angeles newspaper offers his honey a job. The family migrates back to the United States, and Croc and son soon find themselves learning some lessons about American life -- many of them inadvertent','/hwt6iJjPuXRDKJON5s9G9pdfPbu.jpg','2001-04-12',95,'Released','He heard there was wildlife in L.A. He didn\'t know how wild.','Crocodile Dundee in Los Angeles',9290,5.4065,5.198,'4hlqCTxr1mE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15844,_binary '\0','/3eyqLJpl6vDsXLTZnECXlR52pZQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0231448',5.6,8247,'en','Deuces Wild','In 1950s New York City, a bad and bloody gang war is about to erupt on the dysfunctional streets of Brooklyn between the Deuces and the vicious Vipers.','/nyr9WT4mLYZHFRINuyWCQExV9ku.jpg','2002-05-03',96,'Released','Before gangs had guns...they fought with guts.','Deuces Wild',13201,4.4623,5.5,'EcL4cGORh7U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15845,_binary '\0','/kybqBGkRT5AQlbbUlbPihLdFnaY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0231477',8.1,2225,'ar','دعاء الكروان‎','This compelling tale of love and betrayal, set in the upper Egyptian countryside, follows the story of Amna as she plots her revenge on the engineer who destroyed her family\'s honor.','/9Q8BYbJ9GQc9QLQhMIuaeMQkLPc.jpg','1959-10-07',123,'Released',NULL,'The Nightingale\'s Prayer',193388,0.8624,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15846,_binary '\0','/5fCjc8FlHwaK5soz0PBwN73CRxh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0231775',5.4,24645,'en','Down to Earth','Struggling comic Lance Barton knows what it\'s like to die on stage. But when his life takes an unexpected turn - straight to heaven - Lance is sure there\'s been a mistake. Miraculously, he\'s right! An angel tells Lance he was taken prematurely but assures him he can be returned to Earth - in the aged body of a ruthless white billionaire. In this improbable reincarnation, Lance begins a hilarious quest to realize his showbiz dream...and, along the way, discovers the person he never imagined he could be.','/w2XM4YCfBOOWEL4a0abQji7QxwI.jpg','2001-02-16',87,'Released','A story of premature reincarnation.','Down to Earth',16300,5.26,5.6,'awcN8kofaDY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15847,_binary '\0','/toX1ygocp4gEmhV0E9LVA9gosZz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0231844',7.7,6376,'fr','Juste une question d\'amour','After his gay cousin dies from hepatitis, young Laurent, who lives with his best friend Carole, falls in love with Cedric, a plant scientist. He\'s afraid to inform his conservative parents that he is gay.','/loqvaHycm5PjP5qZos2Zj7g9HKo.jpg','2000-01-26',88,'Released','It\'s not a question of gay or straight…','Just a Question of Love',4369,2.3263,7.3,'YPT91sowIVE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15848,_binary '\0','/75Ac8nN3qZmxMJGWk7EQsM47Hqw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0231971',5.6,4159,'fi','Levottomat','Ari, a paramedic, is a chronic womanizer; he makes it a point of pride to never sleep with the same woman twice, and his nights are a long series of brazen one-night stands. But when Ari meets Tiina, something unexpected happens – he falls in love.','/sbGUg6FDqPHTLOTqhmuvzM5SCuX.jpg','2000-01-28',111,'Released',NULL,'Restless',20160,1.9325,5.1,'bFcfwMJnYdk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15849,_binary '\0','/5XGSGQQK3sp3DionQXesbuPcUTq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0232079',3.8,5529,'hi','Mela','Best mates Kishen and Shankar decide to help village belle Roopa avenge her family\'s death, but their friendship is tested in the process.','/rPF46QLaBni9PXvbjmA8zSeaiJ5.jpg','2000-01-07',156,'Released',NULL,'Mela',159666,2.0641,4.553,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15850,_binary '\0','/8LAGMRpcRIZ0saHp0gYUd0wKV8x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0232083',6.7,6391,'fr','Merci pour le chocolat','Mika, heiress to a Swiss chocolate company, is married to celebrated pianist André and stepmother to his son, Guillaume, whose mother died in a car wreck on his tenth birthday. Their lives are interrupted by the unexpected arrival of Jeanne, a young woman who has learned she was almost switched with Guillaume at birth.','/76tPsLIYj9OYoZNFTXWridt7psC.jpg','2000-10-25',101,'Released',NULL,'Nightcap',10305,2.0525,6.3,'7wks01N6tx4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15851,_binary '\0','/wFBSErPblBHFGe0F6H8dspkqCvA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0232114',7.1,1347,'it','La moglie più bella','A 16-year-old Sicilian becomes the target of a mafia hit man after refusing to go through with her prearranged marriage.','/kbZHtvRh2YJcRXjrFmyzUUTIZaK.jpg','1970-03-12',108,'Released','What\'s your idea of justice... have you ever thought about it?','The Most Beautiful Wife',152846,2.1645,6.952,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15852,_binary '\0','/rfpg3QZYmAj1EPUCchTHp3NXyFv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0232152',9,1267,'kn','ನಾಗರಹಾವು','Although Ramachari falls madly in love with Alamelu, her parents forbid their marriage and force her to marry another man. But Ramachari can\'t stand idly by when he discovers his sweetheart\'s husband has become her pimp. Quietly aiding Ramachari on his quest to save Alamelu is Chamayya, a childless woman who loves him as much as if he were her own son.','/eVZvHAqPdUflP3WS91yQH146ShR.jpg','1972-12-29',169,'Released','Based on novel by T. R. Subba Rao','Naagarahaavu',326801,1.2074,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15853,_binary '\0','/jY9ef5nqY4xIIMu3yzW3qamUCoi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0232500',6.8,466659,'en','The Fast and the Furious','Dominic Toretto is a Los Angeles street racer suspected of masterminding a series of big-rig hijackings. When undercover cop Brian O\'Conner infiltrates Toretto\'s iconoclastic crew, he falls for Toretto\'s sister and must choose a side: the gang or the LAPD.','/gqY0ITBgT7A82poL9jv851qdnIb.jpg','2001-06-22',106,'Released','If you have what it takes, you can have it all.','The Fast and the Furious',9799,2.2732,7.016,'ZsJz2TJAPjw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15854,_binary '\0','/qiVp1pNFhLbXU10GXLhO9NUQOeR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0232611',6.3,1881,'es','Segunda piel','When Elena finds a hotel bill in her husband’s pocket, she begins to suspect that he’s having an affair — but not that it’s with a man.','/1EUWx8ZeAuly2mUd12KoOtqCF6m.jpg','1999-12-13',110,'Released','A different triangle','Second Skin',171229,1.7519,5.7,'mF0_nKQdpR0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15855,_binary '\0','/qQRY1Ctil9QTMWhKjnN2MzlKSQJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0232632',5.9,2256,'en','Shiner','The past catches up with a ruthlessly ambitious boxing promoter.','/8Ccd7MeyNM7Lp580GCkQ1gVoCA0.jpg','2000-09-22',99,'Released',NULL,'Shiner',28943,1.3401,5.4,'naKq2i84SLw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15856,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0232960',7.5,1475,'hi','Woh Kaun Thi','One stormy night, a doctor offers a ride to a ghostly woman he meets on the side of the road. Later, he discovers his intended bride is identical in appearance to the ghost. Who was she and why does she haunt him?','/eCPmSi4J4WJLBogo8IDV0gCq59y.jpg','1964-02-07',140,'Released',NULL,'Woh Kaun Thi',171195,1.0323,7.6,'u574BjGyrOY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15857,_binary '\0','/aSRfU8CIRXVhd7fPeuG0DbpAViI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0233142',6,51459,'en','3000 Miles to Graceland','It was an ingenious enough plan: rob the Riviera Casino\'s count room during an Elvis impersonator convention. But Thomas Murphy decided to keep all the money for himself and shot all his partners, including recently-freed ex-con Michael Zane. With $3.2 million at stake, the Marshals Service closing in, Michael must track down Murphy.','/nJgr5sGoXnsgZ0EVt80i6X9dQiA.jpg','2001-02-23',125,'Released','Crime Is King','3000 Miles to Graceland',12138,5.9149,5.889,'C86-XGyVGns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15858,_binary '\0','/4kGdCveGZS9LSV2nHvoMaU7hCmn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0233234',8.2,2338,'ar','أرض الخوف','A police officer is chosen in the late 1960s for a unique and lifelong mission: to infiltrate Egypt’s criminal underworld. Stripped of his name and reputation, he adopts a new identity, living among smugglers, dealers, and nightclub owners. Over the years, he rises within this hidden world, all the while trying to balance his secret duty with the temptations of wealth, power, and desire. Against the backdrop of Egypt’s shifting political eras, his life becomes a meditation on morality, loyalty, and the fragile boundaries of identity and biblical-level metaphors.','/kfooXMltEwVyM3aWirVH2YXT2Po.jpg','2000-03-15',134,'Released',NULL,'Land of Fear',103448,1.156,7.2,'v9cy2zpCHxI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15859,_binary '\0','/6YNpoNdKpCgJDQS53r597Ojvm1S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0233289',3.4,1228,'en','The Bare Wench Project','Four sorority girls -- Nikki, Chloe, Lori, and Toni -- head out to the mountains to find out the truth about the local legend of the Bare Wench. It isn\'t long before the gals get lost, run out of food, and begin succumbing to the fear that they\'re doomed.','/nFPTHiGd0q9OR609OIvHXIfTJvM.jpg','2000-05-16',76,'Released','No map, no food, no clothes.','The Bare Wench Project',27540,1.6979,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15860,_binary '\0','/AvEccS0Ek3WQTroyvOQvI6Bl31N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0233418',6.9,1289,'fr','Cavale','Après quinze ans passés derrière les barreaux, Bruno, qui prône la révolution prolétarienne, s\'évade. Ce dernier veut continuer la lutte, faire sortir ses camarades de prison, libérer les masses du joug capitaliste. Tous ses anciens alliés n\'y croient plus, même Jeanne qui s\'est mariée et a maintenant des enfants.','/hWqnmx3mvmjjUOypn8NdsXsZJ6G.jpg','2003-01-08',117,'Released',NULL,'On the Run',24259,1.2719,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15861,_binary '\0','/6LdtSbUL0vZ6Ydhzjzy6vq0piCp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0233422',7.4,14188,'hi','चाची ४२०','In order to see his little girl more often, a divorcee disguises himself as an old lady and gets a job as his own daughter\'s caretaker. A Hindi remake of the 1996 Tamil film \"Avvai Shanmugi,\" which is itself a remake of the Hollywood film \"Mrs. Doubtfire.\"','/45i934IvoLvuCvhus13n8MxGBV4.jpg','1997-12-19',165,'Released',NULL,'Chachi 420',134446,1.5056,6.97,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15862,_binary '\0','/tmLZMOhiqYL76PfzTYexXwTnouJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0233469',5.5,81613,'en','Collateral Damage','Firefighter Gordon Brewer is plunged into the complex and dangerous world of international terrorism after he loses his wife and child in a bombing credited to Claudio \'The Wolf\' Perrini.','/rALb2pU8QQGIlYdHezB2F5kwecI.jpg','2002-02-06',108,'Released','Nothing is more dangerous than a man with nothing to lose.','Collateral Damage',9884,10.0178,5.768,'YywOMlbqLPo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15863,_binary '\0','/fo7rpdHMn91shmoUWtkPQuLMZLO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0233600',5.8,2727,'cn','東京攻略','When a private eye, a jilted bride and a mysterious stranger join forces to track down an elusive mobster, there\'s more than trouble in the air.','/68qChq7E6qGV6eLlUnhlhGHDk7E.jpg','2000-01-28',118,'Released',NULL,'Tokyo Raiders',45438,3.4402,5.6,'wvrodm7zIZQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15864,_binary '\0','/vP5hmJoc0zbbBElSFKw5PsgqTNV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0233651',7.5,3157,'is','Englar alheimsins','The story of an Icelandic man and his slow descent into madness. Along his journey he meets Dagný, the initial cause of his breakdown. Other people he meets in the asylum have been committed for various reasons, such as signing cheques for Adolf Hitler and, believing themselves to be writing songs for the Beatles and telepathically transmitting to the band.','/8RViMuKJVmRamRLaO1wl3a5a3EL.jpg','2000-01-01',100,'Released',NULL,'Angels of the Universe',20152,1.1492,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15865,_binary '\0','/awyufitQnVBfQtYCrPMrWkGXZLf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0233656',3.6,1554,'en','Epicenter','Epicenter concerns brassy, beautiful Amanda Foster, a down-on-her-luck Los Angeles detective who\'s been assigned to protect a mobster-turned-State\'s-Witness, Nick Constantine, from the mob. On the night of the assignment, the city is rocked by a devastating earthquake, forcing Amanda and Nick to fight their way through the ravaged city streets while being pursued by ruthless assassins and corrupt cops.','/f38T1yGR5G240THLbczpJd1ZEaI.jpg','2000-03-21',102,'Released',NULL,'Epicenter',50477,2.0952,3.9,'NKLghJOH3ww','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15866,_binary '\0','/1VcWPfKpM3XZ59bJMK7DCisrs6o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0233657',4.9,2802,'en','Epoch','Disaster strikes as a specialised team of investigators struggle to find out the truth about a strange monolith which sends out an intercontinental signal.','/4ewzwE8BcS6yrwa7bGT4i7S6pRN.jpg','2001-11-24',96,'Released','Evolution. Is this the beginning or the end?','Epoch',20004,3.0355,4.8,'f138Yo7G3Pw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15867,_binary '\0','/xzCoEGF3wPRsz2tuCLb9pGLTRDp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0233687',7.2,2311,'en','The Eyes of Tammy Faye','A documentary look, mostly through the eyes of Tammy Faye Bakker Messner, at her rise and fall as a popular televangelist with husband Jim Bakker.','/r84Qve8mVeDXBKnSnBSQIS2OaD.jpg','2000-01-25',79,'Released',NULL,'The Eyes of Tammy Faye',15665,1.7759,6.3,'3o0eL4ymO04','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15868,_binary '\0','/aUYNgSfDbDALyYHMmsyIBbtLsLU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0233841',7.7,9608,'fa','باران','On a building site in present-day Tehran, Lateef, a 17-year-old Turkish worker is irresistibly drawn to Rahmat, a young Afghan worker. The revelation of Rahmat\'s secret changes both their lives.','/mcsAug8npYWQ21W0Adv5ghpJuSk.jpg','2001-01-31',90,'Released','A journey of sacrificing own \"identity\" for love...','Baran',43774,2.1236,7.4,'T5UGItdsqUI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15869,_binary '\0','/8ereTTWeyH1JH4IZOUS8qJ4M5W6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0233856',4.7,5255,'hi','Hello Brother','A ghost seeking revenge for his death haunts the man who received his heart in a transplant.','/edwYmD9YUs6gMPEkNOA78f28pwM.jpg','1999-08-26',131,'Released',NULL,'Hello Brother',39347,2.1398,5.555,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15870,_binary '\0','/wAGZuwqS8NVMVaW6fz3PB5TJjv2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0233926',7.9,1538,'en','In Which Annie Gives It Those Ones','Annie struggles to to clear his bachelor\'s degree with one final hurdle - The Thesis. It\'s his final attempt to clear it. Can he?','/74Qf7TOJR2w0ekWWp0hja3tF7Dc.jpg','1989-01-22',112,'Released',NULL,'In Which Annie Gives It Those Ones',364875,1.5281,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15871,_binary '\0','/aIMnZczeInqc56TatDczCWkBBkb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0233979',7.7,1458,'mr','झपाटलेला','After being shot in a toy store, a gangster transfers his soul into a doll. Lakshya, a puppetry master receives this doll as a gift, which unleashes terror upon the city.','/b1SCilgz5SWVlUCH0DhzZLiept0.jpg','1993-04-16',150,'Released','Om Phat Swaha','Zapatlela',192573,1.0363,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15872,_binary '\0','/cdhSX4PHnE3WEQsqlOt7qciaApV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0234000',6.9,18861,'hi','कहो ना प्यार है','Sonia and Rohit love each other but Rohit is mysteriously killed. When Sonia moves to New Zealand, she meets Raj, Rohit\'s lookalike who helps her trace Rohit\'s killer.','/alALytPcaZyQkzOjnRgHMSRv8fq.jpg','2000-01-14',172,'Released','Believe In Love','Kaho Naa... Pyaar Hai',16987,2.4344,6.7,'SfpoBnPEcqc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15873,_binary '\0','/A0oQibuUK79dgTFH8OXE8UaTKQJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0234041',6.6,1315,'fr','Roberto Succo','\'Kurt\' claims to be a sales rep. He also claims to be English in spite of his heavy Italian accent. Kurt is an habitual liar and a dangerous driver, at the very least. In the south of France he meets Léa, age 16. Between his increasingly strange dates with Léa, Kurt engages in a number of armed robberies, some successful, some not... The police are perplexed by a series of crimes including disappearances and a murder. They conclude that they are dealing with a madman... After he proposes, Léa breaks up with Kurt. The attempt to find a new girlfriend leads to a shooting by Kurt, now calling himself André. Léa\'s information identifies Kurt/André as Roberto Succo, psychiatric patient and parental murderer. The police hunt for Roberto covers three countries.','/2NIZzWvJJv97bmRFFpxEyFfFBVf.jpg','2001-05-14',124,'Released',NULL,'Roberto Succo',82550,0.9322,6,'jvXQGBRL9UM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15874,_binary '\0','/582nrZRzTUkslhPXVr5Mi8yXqht.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0234054',7.2,1251,'hi','Kranti','The film takes place in 19th Century British India and is the story of the fight for independence from the British in the years spanning from 1825 to 1875. It tells the story of two men who led the war against British Rule, Sanga and Bharat both of whom call themselves Kranti.','/fbXgeQtZMj5EtVRyqM8kZZbF1pK.jpg','1981-02-03',187,'Released',NULL,'Kranti',82578,0.934,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15875,_binary '\0','/jN7CC157HPiKm130DlkJ3IITjSm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0234137',6.1,5976,'en','Love & Sex','When her rather explicit copy is rejected, magazine journalist Kate is asked by her editor to come up with an article on loving relationships instead, and to do so by the end of the day. This gets Kate thinking back over her own various experiences, and to wondering if she is in much of a position to write on the subject.','/x4pnZxarc6VbkSv19Rfoio4yNmW.jpg','2000-02-23',82,'Released','Get a love life!','Love & Sex',25128,4.2766,6.2,'YuTmh1qxaG8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15876,_binary '\0','/ihOJcrorpDQtHTzIOrobbOhpJsj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0234215',7.2,676766,'en','The Matrix Reloaded','The Resistance builds in numbers as humans are freed from the Matrix and brought to the city of Zion. Neo discovers his superpowers, including the ability to see the code inside the Matrix. With machine sentinels digging to Zion in 72 hours, Neo, Morpheus and Trinity must find the Keymaker to ultimately reach the Source.','/8xEVAe84zlL9rkfYT6dZXero4KK.jpg','2003-05-15',138,'Released','Free your mind.','The Matrix Reloaded',604,27.6749,7.085,'zmYE3tg26Qc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15877,_binary '\0','/dpXNpZ0qqmU6NApl8j4XtwmjBM4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0234217',7.3,7535,'tr','Mayıs Sıkıntısı','An aspiring filmmaker visits his parents and begins to devise a movie. Amidst creating and casting for the film, he encounters with family & friends who struggle with their own problems, dreams and life.','/vWuqYkYSRzhlMc9Vfr2EIpR7OpC.jpg','1999-12-10',130,'Released',NULL,'Clouds of May',52072,2.0398,6.951,'k9ysLQfoQd0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15878,_binary '\0','/4tIqGGCrzpot7qCAHnw7sd9F806.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0234288',7.6,5583,'cs','Musíme si pomáhat','In 1943, a childless couple, the Čížeks, decide to hide a Jewish refugee, David Wiener, the son of Čížek\'s former employer, in the secret pantry of their apartment. Čížek is aware of the danger into which he has brought his household and his neighbours, but he takes helping his fellow man in need for granted. But at the same time, as a largely unheroic hero, he is dying of fear. His personal situation is greatly complicated by the approaching end of the war, when he faces danger from both the Germans and his \"honest\" fellow Czechs...','/6mKiT1zyUHHSCUm1hfZVe4RUhjV.jpg','2000-03-15',120,'Released',NULL,'Divided We Fall',29937,1.7272,7.197,'XAYjBHUIS7A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15879,_binary '\0','/5MY2YaCyd2Yqt2gNMby7ptdQbrO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0234354',5.8,12508,'en','Novocaine','A dentist finds himself a murder suspect after a sexy patient seduces him into prescribing her drugs.','/6ZVFepWKzYho4DLhyFVuRk7klZ1.jpg','2001-11-23',95,'Released','Getting to the root of the problem is like pulling teeth.','Novocaine',20794,2.3514,6.1,'R3nyKA7N6to','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15880,_binary '\0','/jQyiYfcw8YrStGwjQyUbU3MfAX7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0234516',4.8,2766,'en','The President\'s Man','To many, Joshua McCord is a charismatic Asian studies professor. To the President of the United States, he\'s America\'s greatest secret weapon; a covert operative charged with only the most sensitive and dangerous missions.','/jh9Zu6MwJDg6U3cixoZigcQQneh.jpg','2000-04-02',90,'Released',NULL,'The President\'s Man',31443,2.8673,4.7,'TlmeBW5tVHM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15881,_binary '\0','/qNYvUwmpjBozKWYcfHQn5yuINsT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0234748',5.3,1538,'en','Slime City','A student moves into a run-down building in New York City. His bizarre neighbors make a concoction in their apartment they call wine, but when he takes some of it, he turns into a deformed, murderous monster.','/cjqGqhMdH2wdwVWbxo1WKdo7Ydd.jpg','1988-05-13',81,'Released','A Horror Film With Guts!','Slime City',27548,1.3366,4.922,'JjvepsgpB4o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15882,_binary '\0','/t8Lw3JKCufuH5bHowfgENHgGiWb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0234805',6.9,2563,'de','Die Stille nach dem Schuss','Radical West German terrorist Rita Vogt abandons the revolution and settles in East Germany with a new identity provided by the secret service. She lives in constant fear of having her cover blown.','/ktTH7ljXgDcczHY514X68HcCmbw.jpg','2000-09-14',102,'Released',NULL,'The Legend of Rita',10499,2.0786,6,'Z1i131o-c7I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15883,_binary '\0','/5HgxyieEFHyke2aVpwKfQXTHmcB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0234829',5.1,17440,'en','Summer Catch','Local boy Ryan Dunne, now a pitcher for Boston College, meets Tenley Parrish, the daughter of a wealthy couple who summer on the Cape. Ryan and Tenley fall in love, much to the chagrin of their families, while Ryan clings to one last hope of being discovered and signed to a pro baseball contract.','/hMp5Iev56BUu3xJGpAeCCPC1ZwY.jpg','2001-08-22',104,'Released','Are you game?','Summer Catch',26602,5.508,5.415,'xRP55WJQ4CI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15884,_binary '\0','/vZKQAdBg4AqTxoqRIH4R2AEw59F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0234837',7.4,8742,'zh','苏州河','After getting out of prison, small-time crook Mardar stumbles upon a woman who looks exactly like his long-lost lover, who he attempted to kidnap 3 years ago.','/npmg7vTFvmFmxZsiThHFwWE86hA.jpg','2000-04-04',83,'Released','If you love me, search for me until you die. For me, who became a mermaid.','Suzhou River',11599,2.9276,7.3,'U3ARByfefvs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15885,_binary '\0','/Ogf7ovonWJCY1MBXew2YGm7Z2Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0234853',6.7,7978,'en','The Tao of Steve','In college, Dex was the big man on campus. Ten years later, now an overweight kindergarten teacher, Dex is immune to the shocked stares of the women who were once his conquests. While trying to pick up the bartender, he is struck by the gorgeous Syd. Through a series of circumstances, Syd and Dex are thrown together and he soon finds himself questioning his belief in all things Steve.','/u9z4Qg0KGomhBUerbUzQXeO1ODs.jpg','2000-08-04',87,'Released','Why do women find this man irresistible?','The Tao of Steve',20438,1.703,6.1,'3xQ2lPYTnmQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15886,_binary '\0','/5m2HJSI5mmb1I3miHhf8h9Xiq2r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0234988',7.2,1401,'fr','La ville est tranquille','A dark tale of working-class life in Marseilles, a city in crisis. Interesting characters include a hard-bitten but compassionate fish market worker with a drug addicted daughter and a moody bartender with a shocking secret life.','/8d2NBr4in07pEQgO1PwENJH0IO1.jpg','2000-08-30',133,'Released',NULL,'The Town Is Quiet',67385,1.6038,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15887,_binary '\0','/nxzh2GFY0Wb36FKNSaeTer6KzQV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0235060',7.7,14583,'zh','The Road Home','Prompted by the death of his father and the grief of his mother, a man recalls the story of how they met in flashback.','/AbUmBTtVZDpchPA4Yfq4OpIs46X.jpg','1999-10-16',89,'Released','An unforgettable journey into the realm of the heart.','The Road Home',12276,4.1906,7.4,'aYP0bfJl944','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15888,_binary '\0','/r6XM1ZFytc7kBxRWzx63r37kwo4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0235154',7.2,2524,'th','เรื่องตลก 69','A woman, fired from a financial corporation during the Asia crisis, returns home with no money. However, she finds a box with a fortune in front of her door, and decides to keep it. However, the people that left it there soon want it back.','/q9hHVuHQX3yTDDUtuIezDz3YC34.jpg','1999-10-20',118,'Released','How far would you go to protect a secret?','6ixtynin9',33253,1.0711,6.8,'a-WLwEyg2tA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15889,_binary '\0','/xmtmZc5aylqDMRKYlU8pmsgG0HF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0235198',7.1,100500,'ja','オーディション','Seven years after the death of his wife, widower Shigeharu seeks advice on how to find a new wife from a colleague. Taking advantage of their position as a film company, they stage an audition. Interviewing a series of women, Shigeharu is enchanted by the quiet Asami. But soon things take a twisted turn as Asami isn’t what she seems to be.','/zwGaUMm0wAqi0wkO7LJDlwoA5LP.jpg','2000-03-03',115,'Released','She always gets a part.','Audition',11075,5.9379,7.1,'2wr_om5LsuI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15890,_binary '\0','/dJD6TROixLm4V7OUNQeLWt4BD57.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0235327',7.7,7551,'en','Dark Days','A cinematic portrait of the homeless population who live permanently in the underground tunnels of New York City.','/vBUU6cphXFQqGq9fgk1VZ4dfnZX.jpg','2000-08-30',82,'Released',NULL,'Dark Days',14273,1.1429,7.3,'MjjQJipwSxQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15891,_binary '\0','/hf5STxQfmXIXu18U6iZVvJlqGYE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0235376',7.4,6876,'en','Fail Safe','Cold War tensions climb to a fever pitch when a U.S. bomber is accidentally ordered to drop a nuclear warhead on Moscow.','/hg2R1TllSeXGeHYJjIqWuIJ6SKF.jpg','2000-04-09',86,'Released',NULL,'Fail Safe',31067,2.9681,6.9,'p-6xcIUwPto','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15892,_binary '\0','/mOCKahJfONPmhEpRJ3FTnVdYtII.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0235412',5.9,1254,'en','Gaudi Afternoon','Barcelona hasn’t turned out to be the romantic dreamland fledgling translator Cassandra thought it would be. But just when she’s about to return to America, the mysterious Frankie offers her a large sum of money to track down her missing lover.','/wg0ip26O6LR51o1kmLoKLTZkvp5.jpg','2001-05-01',97,'Released','Alone in a foreign city, Cassandra must solve a family\'s darkest, deepest secrets before she can confront her own past.','Gaudi Afternoon',170400,1.3457,4.9,'7mTi9O6i56U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15893,_binary '\0','/mGLtSJSvaYdSVdMx2PMFDcvpl4w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0235452',7.2,1218,'ko','내 마음의 풍금','Hong-yun is a high school girl in little mountain village when she falls head-over-heels for a handsome new school teacher, Mr. Kang. What with taking care of her youngest baby brother for her widowed mother and the impossible age difference, it is a roller-coaster ride for her as she tries to become someone special for Mr. Kang while he seems interested in the other new teacher at the school, Miss Yang.','/vWVuht8stXzNF38bfxTHgK80SOW.jpg','1999-03-27',116,'Released','You never forget your first love!','The Harmonium in My Memory',142499,1.6878,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15894,_binary '\0','/edtLo4FO4z9JnPJQsFr4wIWFFPD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0235553',5,1583,'en','Love and a Bullet','Malik Bishop is the best killer in the business, but when his crimelord employer wants his girlfriend, who may be unfaithful, eliminated, Bishop doesn\'t count on falling in love with the woman. Now he must choose between his heart and, perhaps, his life.','/67fIrwMiSQ26Q2uUo1jz6B6kxID.jpg','2002-08-30',85,'Released',NULL,'Love and a Bullet',57351,2.3718,4.7,'Da_7eHNcYEA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15895,_binary '\0','/Ab7dkRxHAYX0dA42X2X1jzpbMak.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0235606',4.9,1560,'fr','Les Morsures de l\'aube','Antoine is a social wannabe who drops an elusive aristocrat\'s name to get into an exclusive party. The name - Jordan - gets him whisked by two burly bodyguards into the office of the host, von Bulow, who won\'t accept Antoine\'s admission of lying, gives him $100,000, and promises $900,000 more when led to Jordan. Enticed by the money, Antoine, with the help of his friend Étienne, begins his search. He follows trails through Paris\'s night scene, gets beaten up and bitten, and meets Jordan\'s sister, Violaine. After a surreal night, he\'s hooked on her charms but leery of continuing his pursuit of Jordan. Von Bulow insists. Can he find Jordan, get his reward, and attract Violaine?','/sMpv1xRfetTLsIsjUpDLSxfKqf6.jpg','2001-03-21',93,'Released','Paris, the night, the evils that burn from within...','Love Bites',56229,1.8316,4.8,'u2-wlLCiWeg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15896,_binary '\0','/xfmjSIRIvpnWqgWVUZhp1t4CiJU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0235608',4.7,1380,'es','La mujer murciélago','When a mad scientist begins kidnapping wrestlers and extracting their spinal fluid to create a race of Gill Men, two cops call in Batwoman to investigate. But when her mission leaves the scientist horrifically scarred, he seeks revenge.','/dtmB85uT9wuxgvA92KMho9VoNL3.jpg','1968-03-28',80,'Released','Noble! Bold! Enchanting! Daring! Invincible! Audacious!','The Bat Woman',106904,1.8159,5.5,'CXqZIctQBFY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15897,_binary '\0','/dYNY6tKcU50zpIT0zFMgUJroODj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0235618',6.8,1272,'en','The Nine Lives of Tomas Katz','The last day of creation. A stranger arrives in London. No one knows who he is or where he has come from. By the time he leaves, the entire universe will have been erased.','/gTzWCN5g1eSS7pLH6lgVzLdr25J.jpg','2000-03-01',87,'Released','The world will end in half an hour...','The Nine Lives of Tomas Katz',16171,1.9411,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15898,_binary '\0','/dLGQo5Xq6H18vPx00Czot8VHi3K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0235679',5.9,16992,'ja','劇場版ポケットモンスター 結晶塔の帝王 ENTEI','When the sadness of her father\'s disappearance gets to Molly Hale, she unknowingly uses the Unown to create her own dream world along with Entei, who she believes to be her father. When Entei kidnaps Ash\'s mother, Ash — alongside Misty and Brock — invade the mansion looking for his mom and trying to stop the mysteries of Molly\'s Dream World and Entei!','/hrBWiMWnD7mheMx846ycUWA3ohs.jpg','2000-07-08',73,'Released','This spring the Unown spells adventure.','Pokémon 3: The Movie',10991,6.436,6.6,'SEqstQn0sag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15899,_binary '','/hWt9jopj3avIGviSSMH2dkwGdlO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0235686',3.5,1548,'it','Porno Holocaust','A group of castaways wash ashore on a deserted island, unaware that a sex-crazed radioactive monster is also lurking.','/4FDf5zH4cxJn9TreQd8YJJbvKUY.jpg','1981-02-09',113,'Released','An island exposed to a nuclear fallout! A horny, mutant cannibalistic zombie!','Porno Holocaust',40162,0,4.1,'jxSyMmoZUZI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15900,_binary '\0','/noRX8VyyAFK1tt0DQSq5qy1tE10.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0235712',5.9,10869,'ja','リング０ バースデイ','Taking place thirty years before the events of Ringu, Ringu 0 provides the shocking background story of how the girl on the video became a deadly, vengeful spirit.','/nuhEWlaoMD00rTDCiYxdEc7d1tD.jpg','2000-01-22',99,'Released','Discover the secret...','Ring 0',9674,3.6441,6.1,'hV1JeyjofRk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15901,_binary '\0','/mGhz7vE2EvWm6MfFqPJXDidNgAY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0235737',7,33556,'en','The Salton Sea','After the murder of his beloved wife, a man in search of redemption is set adrift in a world where nothing is as it seems. On his journey, he befriends slacker Jimmy \"The Finn\", becomes involved in rescuing his neighbor Colette from her own demons, and gets entangled in a web of deceit full of unexpected twists and turns.','/i3InMSlLUNBEdQTKazMdyVP1ryX.jpg','2002-02-12',103,'Released','If you\'re looking for the truth, you\'ve come to the wrong place.','The Salton Sea',11468,5.9255,6.6,'hvkGhYkF2nw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15902,_binary '\0','/bSuzJ5MbTnwWlRVqottrEcWriXt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0236019',6.3,2325,'en','Better Than Sex','After a one-night stand a couple is faced with the terrifying possibility of what they really want.','/zUD6Dc88R7gieprJ1oz8bNyi0uf.jpg','2000-11-09',84,'Released','3 days in the life of a 1 night stand.','Better Than Sex',27444,1.6665,5.9,'0xLxgJ5uErI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15903,_binary '\0','/oW8tmQwXbg45AwqLqKCRhbgV89P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0236027',7.5,27247,'da','Blinkende lygter','Four small gangsters from Copenhagen trick a gangster boss: they take over 4,000,000 kroner which they were supposed to bring him. Trying to escape to Barcelona they are forced to stop in the countryside, in an old, wrecked house, hiding there for several weeks. Slowly, one after another, they realize, that they would like to stay there, start a new life.','/20ApKJUi1XYri37RAH3SDIp2Ykh.jpg','2000-11-03',109,'Released',NULL,'Flickering Lights',10180,2.6659,7.2,'-riyRypVqu8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15904,_binary '\0','/qdTKPu9SPaWPZbsfPv1TxNYMJXX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0236034',6.4,1709,'en','Born Romantic','In modern-day London, three men (Craig Ferguson, Jimi Mistry and David Morrissey) and three women (Olivia Williams, Jane Horrocks and Catherine McCormack) fall in and out of love and back again, to the Greek-chorus accompaniment of two cab drivers, who engage in an ongoing conversation about sex. A winning romantic comedy, Born Romantic is the second feature by British writer-director David Kane of This Year\'s Love fame.','/okQsBtYgfKfbjtHZMdiEGWF40TY.jpg','2000-09-14',96,'Released','Romance isn\'t dead...it\'s just not very well.','Born Romantic',35066,1.3579,6,'mWd944ogqUU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15905,_binary '\0','/2xnCNfAI53k1JQL4a42AVb7McXQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0236157',6.5,5755,'en','Disco Pigs','Pig and Runt born on the same day, in the same hospital, moments apart. Twins, all but by bloodline. Inseparable from birth, they are almost telepathic. They are one, needing no one else, inhabiting a delicate, insular and dangerous world where they make their own rules and have their own language. But days before their 17th birthday the balance of their world begins to shift. Pig\'s sexual awakening and jealousy begins to threaten their private universe.','/cvc0ufpTy8jdazickHhtbrcx3rS.jpg','2001-10-12',93,'Released','90 minutes you\'ll never forget.','Disco Pigs',26126,1.7156,5.8,'wlpXEwl_pKQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15906,_binary '\0','/8qVZboJe6Il7Ey2I1DqcEjLrjnZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0236216',7.6,6405,'en','The Filth and the Fury','Julien Temple\'s second documentary profiling punk rock pioneers the Sex Pistols is an enlightening, entertaining trip back to a time when the punk movement was just discovering itself. Featuring archival footage, never-before-seen performances, rehearsals, and recording sessions as well as interviews with group members who lived to tell the tale--including the one and only John Lydon (aka Johnny Rotten).','/kdNkiqmMeJfaD8ybjiV6bVOrcQ8.jpg','2000-03-29',108,'Released','A Sex Pistols film - uncut, unseen, unbelievable.','The Filth and the Fury',27745,2.5383,6.9,'rKdPOIcIBxs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15907,_binary '\0','/tciDcCjEKyqriwfma1AGQ09ekdZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0236283',4.8,1460,'en','Happy Hell Night','25 years ago at Winfield College, psycho-priest Zachary Malius murdered seven frat boys and was put away in the local asylum. Now, however, the same fraternity stages a prank from which Malius is inadvertently set free and returns to the house to repeat his crime...','/9KBH7erBJrqzaydlszf6lncea4h.jpg','1991-10-01',87,'Released','They\'ll Be Screaming Their Heads Off!','Happy Hell Night',30519,1.6032,4.9,'JulOTCmfzAQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15908,_binary '\0','/ft1BFY3aXekcsD6bgU0mEo34dJy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0236285',7.1,1325,'en','For Love or Country: The Arturo Sandoval Story','In the early 1970s, Cuban trumpeter Arturo Sandoval (Andy Garcia) is torn between his own musical dreams and the dreams of his wife, Marianela (Mía Maestro), a fervent supporter of the ideals of the Castro revolution. Also starring Charles S. Dutton as Dizzy Gillespie and José Zúñiga as Paquito D\'Rivera, this gripping jazz biopic is at once a detailed portrait of a musician and a stinging critique','/f2x9VlBE819oz0uGgQZyCOJqsVT.jpg','2000-11-18',120,'Released',NULL,'For Love or Country: The Arturo Sandoval Story',33355,1.9688,6.2,'uDVebY_nFQ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15909,_binary '\0','/wkQAYth62cJXsvqkYbDH8b1cqES.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0236348',5.7,27247,'en','Josie and the Pussycats','Josie, Melody and Val are three small-town girl musicians determined to take their rock band out of their garage and straight to the top, while remaining true to their look, style and sound. They get a record deal which brings fame and fortune but soon realize they are pawns of two people who want to control the youth of America. They must clear their names, even if it means losing fame and fortune.','/mHOix87RdBO3YQuyvFFZAZxpt5P.jpg','2001-04-06',98,'Released','Here kitty, kitty, kitty...','Josie and the Pussycats',19366,4.5869,5.817,'XvVhTHJWFr0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15910,_binary '\0','/7t7f7fHytr0JbjYCkMthpjBRZTv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0236388',6.9,6416,'en','The Original Kings of Comedy','The house is rockin\' and the laughs are rollin\' as comedians Steve Harvey (The Steve Harvey Show), D.L. Hughley (The Hughleys), Cedric The Entertainer (The Steve Harvey Show) and Bernie Mac (Life) meet in this riotously comedy summit directed by Spike Lee.','/vjbEcW9OqWoXKr9e2KySG1WZlNS.jpg','2000-08-18',115,'Released','We Got Jokes.','The Original Kings of Comedy',23618,2.2088,6.403,'JAa2gANm4KM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15911,_binary '\0','/nfG7okcUaUknI8HsDg25eQpQu3L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0236493',6.2,122239,'en','The Mexican','Jerry Welbach, a reluctant bagman, has been given two ultimatums: The first is from his mob boss to travel to Mexico and retrieve a priceless antique pistol, known as \"the Mexican\"... or suffer the consequences. The second is from his girlfriend Samantha to end his association with the mob. Jerry figures alive and in trouble with Samantha is better than the more permanent alternative, so he heads south of the border.','/5GqF6rVjUW6CVTuj7w1A2JE49AF.jpg','2001-03-01',123,'Released','Love with the safety off.','The Mexican',6073,6.5637,5.957,'LyujCIHTiHc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15912,_binary '\0','/earCm5oykrdb8fiQmndaeiOp37o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0236576',7.7,2313,'de','Paragraph 175','During the Nazi regime, there was widespread persecution of homosexual men, which started in 1871 with the Paragraph 175 of the German Penal Code. Thousands were murdered in concentration camps. This powerful and disturbing documentary, narrated by Rupert Everett, presents for the first time the largely untold testimonies of some of those who survived.','/jpWAael8IHvFJe50WZ1dTOY1kip.jpg','2000-01-22',74,'Released',NULL,'Paragraph 175',49671,2.2453,6.7,'i4SfaW708xY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15913,_binary '\0','/sVhxomEzB9qvLagwXXNiAn2w50I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0236638',4.1,2977,'fr','Promenons-nous dans les bois','A group of artists, composed of the young actors Wilfried and Matthieu and the actresses Sophie, Mathilde and the dumb Jeanne, is hired by a millionaire, Axel de Fersen, to present a performance of Little Red Riding Hood in his isolated castle to celebrate the birthday of his grandson. Meanwhile, the police advises that a serial killer is raping and killing young women in the woods around that area. During the night, the group feels trapped and threatened in the castle, guessing who is and where might be the killer.','/iF03JebY67u0RPz8J5zMXUboew5.jpg','2000-06-13',90,'Released',NULL,'Deep in the Woods',11303,1.9561,4,'KimGtDhsiE4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15914,_binary '\0','/j06D4plPJNP1s0h3FKB8qwGRGpW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0236640',6.2,20442,'en','Prozac Nation','When talented young writer Elizabeth Wurtzel earns a scholarship to Harvard, she sees it as her chance to escape the pressures of her working-class background and concentrate on her true talent. But what starts out so promising leads to self-destructive behavior and paralyzing depression that reflects an entire generation\'s struggle to navigate the effects of divorce, drugs, sex, and high expectations.','/4QB1h6mxlmQVM8BtYMybTwL2foc.jpg','2003-06-13',95,'Released','Where do you go when you\'ve gone too far?','Prozac Nation',16229,2.5827,6.4,'0QWM_Kni6l0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15915,_binary '\0','/zKctuZIWdni1QxTEt4SsNyysdxW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0236784',6.1,33772,'en','The Tailor of Panama','A British spy is banished to Panama after having an affair with an ambassador\'s mistress. Once there he makes connection with a local tailor with a nefarious past and connections to all of the top political and gangster figures in Panama. The tailor also has a wife, who works for the Panamanian president and a huge debt. The mission is to learn what the President intends to do with the Canal.','/na80ysnoCvoxwGTMWCWYvnmaDlz.jpg','2001-02-11',109,'Released','In a place this treacherous, what a good spy needs is a spy of his own.','The Tailor of Panama',2575,8.4681,6.002,'if887QzvTiw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15916,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0237038',8.4,3497,'ml','ഭരതം','Raman and Gopi are brothers who have a musical heritage. Raman\'s addiction towards alcohol becomes a threat to his career and Gopi is forced to take up his role.','/auG1KiHiIrRjAdmVM03cq5e7c1k.jpg','1991-03-29',147,'Released',NULL,'Bharatham',249633,1.3511,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15917,_binary '\0','/56YQoGnXtRL28hTotemdHZgVNG8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0237138',8.5,2731,'ml','ദശരഥം','Rajiv, a chronic bachelor and a business tycoon, decides to have a child. Annie, who has financial needs, agrees to help him and give birth to Rajiv\'s child through artificial insemination.','/1n6WNghYiTCMl8RPflPSohui4QP.jpg','1989-10-08',154,'Released',NULL,'Dasharatham',249210,1.2246,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15918,_binary '\0','/8eWcitSMXUqfdePD0jBFcOPKTQB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0237309',7.9,1585,'ml','ഹിസ് ഹൈനസ്സ് അബ്ദുള്ള','The story follows Abdullah (Mohanlal) who is hired by the members of a wealthy royal family to assassinate the family head Maharaja Udayavarma (Nedumudi Venu). Abdullah comes into the royal palace under the disguise Ananthan Namboothiri, a classical singer, and tries to use this mask to softly kill the Maharaja.','/tpLfoYFKW6qkCXARGh5G4qREFKF.jpg','1990-03-29',150,'Released',NULL,'His Highness Abdullah',251218,1.3548,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15919,_binary '\0','/i5iCILIdUrbujjuCosVmAabVUna.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0237376',8.9,9929,'ml','കിരീടം','Sethu aspires to become a police officer to fulfil his father\'s dream. However, his life turns upside down when he intervenes in a scuffle with a criminal to save his father\'s life.','/9mKxljfSzQ9UXpgEPLvGTwXvZUv.jpg','1989-07-07',127,'Released','Sethumadhavan is a man who lost everything...','Kireedam',191017,2.0142,7.87,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15920,_binary '\0','/wxijmbo9Oy5L9M9e4K1QhXVBRgm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0237534',7,77633,'fr','Le Pacte des loups','In 18th century France, the Chevalier de Fronsac and his Native American friend Mani are sent by the King to the Gevaudan province to investigate the killings of hundreds by a mysterious beast.','/w8CUoGAnP95txmIK2fl7leVmrmN.jpg','2001-01-31',151,'Released','The year is 1766... The hunt for a killer has begun.','Brotherhood of the Wolf',6312,8.7117,6.7,'RAGfNjIzldM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15921,_binary '\0','/xeeUw4uVkVYuRSWuQewQKI8wnlc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0237539',7.3,12587,'it','Pane e tulipani','An endearing light comedy about a woman who spontaneously becomes a resident of Venice after her family left her behind. While enjoying the wonderful people she meets she achieves a new life and the first time independent of her family.','/ijCBLF08KQsam3cOBAnit05iiV3.jpg','2000-03-03',114,'Released','Imagine your life. Now go live it.','Bread and Tulips',552,2.5338,7.149,'JVWLl6TBS1Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15922,_binary '\0','/o62VYsoyEUYgYMn21Thd9GHTuUE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0237572',6.7,78177,'en','The Pledge','A police chief, about to retire, pledges to help a woman find her daughter\'s killer.','/9QOzFL3FPMAUNNPrNiKC3mEDxco.jpg','2001-01-19',124,'Released','Detective Jerry Black has made a promise he can\'t break, to catch a killer he can\'t find.','The Pledge',5955,6.5788,6.6,'F0mHXlLnDzw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15923,_binary '\0','/ojfPLfGJYgSQyxMQuTeK7rZVPxW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0237682',8.5,1278,'ml','സദയം','Sathyanathan is condemned to death for brutally murdering four persons – two adults and two young girls – and is awaiting his final call. He shows no remorse and is just as cheerful as a man who knows he has done no wrong. In a series of flashbacks, Sathyanathan\'s story is revealed.','/oK2UuuJRwr9OK3L7IyoPBLLIdML.jpg','1992-07-04',148,'Released',NULL,'Sadayam',280277,1.2918,7.429,'YwsTkMrwV_k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15924,_binary '\0','/gQcrBqJGKgBKqGgg71l5pnxz617.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0237820',8.9,3724,'ml','തനിയാവര്‍ത്തനം','Balan, a teacher, has a mentally unstable uncle. There is a belief that the family is cursed to have a lunatic at all times. When the uncle passes away, people believe that Balan will be the next.','/5G7EUfeCWMIR0z1eZEx2lrqhMlA.jpg','1987-08-14',119,'Released',NULL,'Thaniyavarthanam',307252,1.1216,7.781,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15925,_binary '\0','/8frHHdHniGX5tQrlXAOZDIHhD1z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0237993',6.7,10255,'is','101 Reykjavík','A 30-year-old slacker who lives with his mother finds his life turned upside down when his mother\'s flamenco-dancing friend moves in.','/4zKQ9Wz68tLQ4WGirHDNXR1NdLf.jpg','2000-05-31',88,'Released',NULL,'101 Reykjavik',10989,1.6093,6.174,'k6T0snTFmsg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15926,_binary '\0','/bEyYqv75jnBfnrkMk2kZB64CFlA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0238112',5.9,37634,'en','Captain Corelli\'s Mandolin','When a fisherman leaves to fight with the Greek army during World War II, his fiancée falls in love with the local Italian commander.','/9YahF8HFypIKFTvOTiYzObA0hom.jpg','2001-04-18',131,'Released',NULL,'Captain Corelli\'s Mandolin',1722,5.4077,5.9,'M3lLNzTSRPo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15927,_binary '\0','/7yJKWJy1GJoOFFCdQugzRa6OCvu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0238119',7.6,8200,'pl','Chłopaki nie płaczą','A young aspiring violinist unwittingly becomes involved with a criminal gang.','/klzMlakszrViStdLUwE6vb44PiA.jpg','2000-02-25',100,'Released',NULL,'Boys Don\'t Cry',36380,1.8043,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15928,_binary '\0','/hm8LKMSSco60b1SPc3iMoGImFez.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0238137',5.5,2713,'en','Tangled','A young man is found bruised, beaten and stumbling down a secluded road. As the police try to piece together what happened, the convoluted relationship between a young woman and her two suitors gradually emerges.','/A2b2Vm0UZGTSZh0pNr3AS10DsMv.jpg','2001-11-02',100,'Released','The best of friends make the worst of enemies.','Tangled',51986,2.491,5.509,'wmbkL81QxEw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15929,_binary '\0','/smMJcqjhHEJUaBBfyg8Xc3Du7nd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0238321',6.5,1610,'en','ivans xtc.','Ivan Beckman, Hollywood\'s most sought-after talent agent, the darling and crown prince of La La Land, is dead. How and why did it happen? Was it drugs, murder, or perhaps something altogether more mundane? We begin with an ending and then catapult back a number of days to the apex of Ivan\'s brilliant career as he bags international megastar Don West onto his company\'s books. We then follow Ivan through the highs, lows, and extreme excesses of his final days.','/hbcQVKO8RhZcwjh8hq28s1fNxL8.jpg','2000-09-12',94,'Released','There\'s a fine line between success and excess','ivans xtc.',33994,2.5565,5.629,'f-8IuOduS58','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15930,_binary '\0','/dQutbCXdvcoRORJTcnakrICCkDb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0238380',7.3,365146,'en','Equilibrium','In a dystopian future, a totalitarian regime maintains peace by subduing the populace with a drug, and displays of emotion are punishable by death. A man in charge of enforcing the law rises to overthrow the system.','/yQuovle5Ov6q69XSdTNdH52eANc.jpg','2002-12-06',107,'Released','In a future where freedom is outlawed, outlaws will become heroes.','Equilibrium',7299,10.9205,7.057,'raleKODYeg0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15931,_binary '\0','/dHkKPuiPSw9BbfAt1zdEZCuAzTX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0238546',5.3,64962,'en','Queen of the Damned','Vampire Lestat awakens from his slumber and becomes a rock star. But chaos strikes when his music awakens Akasha, the vampire queen, who may not rest until she makes Lestat her new king.','/4MMpvQYgOz8K6lzlIVMXWjLzUPC.jpg','2002-02-10',101,'Released','The mother of all vampires.','Queen of the Damned',11979,7.7834,6.117,'2Gu9HtN05sc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15932,_binary '\0','/hmLfKkw8adwLvS89SOTYY88ZpN9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0238552',5.4,16745,'en','Replicant','Scientists create a genetic clone of a serial killer in order to help catch the killer, teaming up with two cops.','/q41zGgRXfhvnObJnn1kGIyoAhSu.jpg','2001-05-11',100,'Released','A ruthless killer... to destroy him, they had to create him.','Replicant',10596,4.9815,5.9,'8NfA0vFhggI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15933,_binary '\0','/mp45oLvaMWxhggGdHg6cueWY7Pz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0238660',6.6,4462,'en','There\'s Only One Jimmy Grimble','Jimmy Grimble is a shy Manchester school boy. At school he is constantly being bullied by the other kids, and at home he has to face his mother\'s new boyfriend. However, through football, and some special boots, he manages to gain the confidence to succeed and leads his school football team towards the final of the local schools cup.','/9v4RxdSMUkhkH9cceSVU4jH4BfV.jpg','2000-08-25',106,'Released',NULL,'There\'s Only One Jimmy Grimble',1609,2.3732,6.8,'mhyMBoQ93IY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15934,_binary '\0','/7LrFUq57MauhsBXDhA333KtAnQf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0238768',7,1251,'en','David Copperfield','A young man journeys from a difficult childhood to maturity, exploring social injustice, personal development, and the complexities of human relationships.','/1zOfg17Les0Bbz5wP7mLLWbhbt3.jpg','2001-12-25',180,'Released','An orphan with a rough childhood becomes a barrister.','David Copperfield',141640,1.5588,6.3,'vmLB-DrmVCI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15935,_binary '\0','/a8bPE7ufmXsfj2BLOrB8KuNMxN5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0238883',7.6,20794,'ru','Брат 2','Arriving in Moscow, Chechen War veteran Danila meets Konstantin, an old friend who tells him that his twin brother has been forced into signing a crooked contract with a US ice hockey team. Soon after this meeting, Danila discovers Konstantin dead and he sets out to avenge his death; a journey that leads him to Chicago and a whole new experience.','/r5pffTC8XZsrGUYSU8e23dGmGNK.jpg','2000-05-11',122,'Released','Danila returns!','Brother 2',20993,2.0979,7.1,'PeWGNfQhfPY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15936,_binary '\0','/lkdP7XOj3OnbeyVP79Rbxckkz5R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0238891',7.5,7254,'it','I cento passi','Peppino Impastato is a quick-witted lad growing up in 1970s Sicily. Despite hailing from a family with Mafia ties and living just one hundred steps from the house of local boss Tano Badalamenti, Peppino decides to expose the Mafia by using a pirate radio station to broadcast his political pronouncements in the form of ironic humour.','/dpQpjLslfQlpDv7eCVRDPQAKgqs.jpg','2000-09-01',114,'Released',NULL,'One Hundred Steps',29458,2.0418,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15937,_binary '\0','/kukeEqfKiybvnyppV1RilJrbSI9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0238924',6.9,14739,'en','The Dangerous Lives of Altar Boys','A group of Catholic school friends, after being caught drawing an obscene comic book, plan a heist that will outdo their previous prank and make them local legends.','/4uTWXZ2Rvizl3ycMHtODfRjks4W.jpg','2002-06-14',104,'Released','Forgive me father, for I am 14.','The Dangerous Lives of Altar Boys',16857,4.1396,6.682,'kWtJpUCxU4Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15938,_binary '\0','/aqIOQ5UrEGgRTq35BNbwgy7MIU2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0238936',7.6,52858,'hi','देवदास','In 1900s India, Calcuttan zamindar Devdas Mukherjee — unable to marry his lover — takes up alcohol and the company of a courtesan to alleviate the pain.','/4IJObbE9c3rO0bZxMwMtt5n9g2n.jpg','2002-07-11',185,'Released','A grand saga of timeless love.','Devdas',15917,2.8516,7.5,'8tuHQWGMQwY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15939,_binary '\0','/e93Upxk1sCLdscVKD7pQNLiaqVI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0238948',5.4,9069,'en','Double Take','A man on the run takes another man\'s passport, only to find himself stuck with the identity of a street hustler.','/gNyudcF4Z8LVJn4IxauOptG6dcb.jpg','2001-01-12',88,'Released','One big shot. One big mouth. The switch is on.','Double Take',18828,2.7206,5.7,'3n8cJ6Kl8vc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15940,_binary '\0','/ip7EzCJ48LIE126GHaA7AkppsB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0239060',5.9,1777,'nl','Ik ook van jou','While camping in France, Eric and Eddy fall in with two women. Eric talks to Silke, a Ugandan studying medicine in Holland. She tells him about her life and asks about the book he\'s writing: it\'s the story of his love affair with Reza. He tells her the story and we see it in flashbacks: Reza explodes into his boring life, she\'s unpredictable and their relationship becomes intense.','/fYbUra04wiMKHI6eUPNSiNWsKIc.jpg','2001-02-15',99,'Released',NULL,'I Love You Too',15514,1.3332,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15941,_binary '\0','/wIE436lMvXpLByb2lz01gnVJGfi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0239096',7.4,1369,'ru','Конёк-Горбунок','Remake of the 1947 Soviet film directed by Ivan Ivanov-Vano and produced by the Soyuzmultfilm studio in Moscow.','/5QRDGh7qVn6L3NiHpeGzfOmhZk8.jpg','1975-10-24',67,'Released',NULL,'The Humpbacked Horse',73924,3.0403,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15942,_binary '\0','/pRMpzgsYqNdxQdvUF6jA0Dq57S6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0239102',7,1612,'cs','Kytice','Seven seemingly unconnected fairy tales - glued together only by folklore, mood, color and light - make up this Czech collection of visual poetry. The original piece of literature, written by Karel Jaromír Erben in 1853, contained twelve tales.','/oGA4nUbaCOtVzhwPO6GqOtR8DUN.jpg','2000-12-06',81,'Released',NULL,'Wild Flowers',45952,1.2648,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15943,_binary '\0','/A9O9Hi45tlIefkwN4MWs4BexQNi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0239234',6.8,2984,'fr','L\'Anglaise et le Duc','Grace Dalrymple Elliot is a British aristocrat trapped in Paris during the French Revolution. Determined to maintain her stiff upper lip and pampered life despite the upheaval, Grace continues her friendship with the Duke of Orléans while risking her life and liberty to protect a fugitive.','/wKKrgVngsgJPVVKuh3GjWugQPbK.jpg','2001-09-07',129,'Released',NULL,'The Lady and the Duke',2894,1.7022,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15944,_binary '\0','/iL0EyyqCqKpZgsA431Bcj1YHTIK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0239381',5.7,4414,'pt','O Fantasma','Sergio is a brooding, alienated man who works as a trash collector in Lisbon by day and roams the city streets by night seeking rough, anonymous sex with men. One night he meets a man who seems to be the embodiment of his tormented fantasies, and he becomes obsessed with the stranger until loneliness and unfulfilled desire propel him finally into a dark and dangerous animalistic state.','/ffQsLmwrwrjIv90HpL7iwu0hZtA.jpg','2000-10-20',87,'Released','No one can live without love.','O Fantasma',27181,2.4318,6.2,'qlVcdP3LoRY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15945,_binary '\0','/3ipuPBeBfsxcsry7Gh5m9J1rwJ1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0239395',5.2,66254,'en','Cats & Dogs','When a professor develops a vaccine that eliminates human allergies to dogs, he unwittingly upsets the fragile balance of power between cats and dogs and touches off an epic battle for pet supremacy. The fur flies as the feline faction, led by Mr. Tinkles, squares off against wide-eyed puppy Lou and his canine cohorts.','/wUWoat7L4vvQburQ8pVEJhRG9L5.jpg','2001-07-04',87,'Released','Things Are Gonna Get Hairy!','Cats & Dogs',10992,8.2274,5.413,'PQ5RCk1iCY8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15946,_binary '\0','/sorRhDsR5FIfVKeG1h3P6XFBRf5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0239450',5.1,4833,'de','Harte Jungs','Flo is not quite a normal teenager: While all his friends only think about sex he can\'t even pronounce the word \"S - E - X\". But everything changes completely when one morning Flo wakes up from a strange call. His penis, excited for the first time, begins to talk to him. He claims that Flo severely neglected him for 15 years and it\'s time to release him.','/tp2ldyLlAxEp1dsGbNe0AON9bOP.jpg','2000-03-29',95,'Released','Come on, go ahead!','Ants in the Pants',9478,2.2311,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15947,_binary '\0','/5D0rchpoqdigb2EFZbYYlu9QnUV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0239655',7.3,2551,'ja','マンデイ','A simple funeral turns a man\'s world Topsy turvy. He wakes up in a posh hotel room, totally clueless about how he got there. Slowly, he recalls what happened a day before.','/x2JrwnEKRCdccBcIVr5RJ0JRJ6Y.jpg','2000-04-29',100,'Released',NULL,'Monday',36246,1.9591,7,'dR3TDPgrfHA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15948,_binary '\0','/h4Z5zO8OzbZJHbA2Hcnmykw9xdL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0239894',7.5,10451,'en','Paradise Lost 2: Revelations','Revisiting the 1994 Arkansas murder of three 8-year-old boys and the three teenagers convicted of the crime. A follow up to Paradise Lost, Revelations features new interviews with the convicted men, as well as with the original judge and police investigators.','/18ixOKgqZGmfALD5080MdZN4dxi.jpg','2000-07-28',130,'Released',NULL,'Paradise Lost 2: Revelations',17208,1.3621,7.2,'LZHx8I1Lg-4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15949,_binary '\0','/nBP8M28ig41ErPcQAHlkHoL6td3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0239948',5.9,46638,'en','Saving Silverman','A pair of buddies conspire to save their best friend from marrying the wrong woman, a cold-hearted beauty who snatches him from them and breaks up their Neil Diamond cover band.','/5mq8J11266ZL7HCOwDGXoaU6eIO.jpg','2001-02-09',90,'Released','They swore nothing would come between them. Then she came along.','Saving Silverman',10878,6.2144,5.821,'pcUE7DtW7hw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15950,_binary '\0','/fNb6NSwfv76je5MQp58rvJxvoMU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0239949',5,14292,'en','Say It Isn\'t So','Boy meets girl; boy falls in love (and had wild, non-stop sex) with girl; boy loses girl... when they discover they are brother and sister! But when he learns that he\'s the victim of the ultimate case of mistaken identity, the lovesick young man -- whom everyone still thinks is after some taboo thrills -- must race across the country to stop her from marrying another man.','/gHEI41EWj9dEscfEiKgw6a2uUez.jpg','2001-03-10',95,'Released','They share a love. They share a passion. And they might share DNA.','Say It Isn\'t So',20309,4.5869,4.8,'MUNSzbk8Duw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15951,_binary '\0','/hkRqomcT1A39BtmVU9wjbk8PIq8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0239986',6.4,7101,'en','Sidewalks of New York','The film follows the marital and dating lives of three men and three women who unknowingly form a tangled web of relationships. Interspersing \"man on the street\" interviews with scenes from the six characters\' lives, the film weaves a humorous and biting commentary on the game of love -- easy to start, hard to finish.','/oJuZGjMUKsYJXSkLXdOZ9CePJhg.jpg','2001-11-23',107,'Released','In a city of 8 million people, what are the odds the perfect two will meet?','Sidewalks of New York',31016,2.8115,6.1,'FHVpgT0UuDg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15952,_binary '\0','/5czirKDtUhNaLf6CPEg0faJeVMF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0240084',7.9,3907,'te','తమ్ముడు','Subrahmanyam (Pawan Kalyan), the youngest son of the family wastes away his life. His father always scolds him but his brother Chakri (Achyuth) who is a boxer, and friend Jaanu (Preeti Jhangiani) dote him. Meanwhile he falls in love with Lovely (Aditi) and for this he keeps on telling lies to her that he is very rich. Jaanu in the middle truly loves Subrahmanyam and gives him everything he asks her for thinking that he is doing these for her but he does it for lovely. Will Subrahmanyam realize what true love is?','/xNW91EcYqlhgHccmbEIjmaPL7h1.jpg','1999-07-15',160,'Released',NULL,'Thammudu',199808,1.1043,7.583,'SN1FnqAMv7M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15953,_binary '\0','/sSxuuzANk6Zo1fOWf9qWmWa7T57.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0240119',5.3,2444,'ja','富江','Following some trauma in her past that has since been repressed, a young woman is trying to recover her memories with the help of a psychiatrist. During her hypnosis sessions, she repeats the name \"Tomie\" but is unable to recall where she knows it from. Meanwhile, a police detective is investigating a string of brutal murders, where he also runs across the name \"Tomie.\" How are the two connected?','/zfHdSceORPkzKUs7sjUQPK8dcov.jpg','1998-10-06',95,'Released','Tomie Will Not Die.','Tomie',37726,2.2257,5.39,'6Ry_GZw5e-M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15954,_binary '\0','/fd5pMzskKtWWxAHL5CscgEuvzn4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0240149',6.6,2584,'fr','Une hirondelle a fait le printemps','A woman in her thirties gets tired of life in Paris and decides to leave and become a farmer.','/muykQb9inG47Wi0Cs9FsV91PgT7.jpg','2001-09-05',103,'Released',NULL,'The Girl from Paris',33302,1.9749,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15955,_binary '\0','/fensSW5qw8nSYg6qmO6Dm6xEIr7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0240200',7.7,15863,'en','Water','In 1938, Mahatma Gandhi\'s groundbreaking philosophies sweep across India, but 8-year-old Chuyia, newly widowed, must go reside with other outcast widows on an ashram. Her presence transforms the ashram as she befriends two of her compatriots.','/tdg6JKcqjS7szenmabGAbe5RGdN.jpg','2005-11-04',115,'Released',NULL,'Water',7509,2.2879,6.789,'2R0pRl18js8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15956,_binary '\0','/pSha2CdgzmhUpMWrlksAjoYqGde.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0240402',5.8,5533,'en','The Center of the World','A couple checks into a suite in Las Vegas. In flashbacks we see that he\'s a computer whiz on the verge of becoming a dot.com millionaire, she\'s a lap dancer at a club. He\'s depressed, withdrawing from work, missing meetings with investors. He wants a connection, so he offers her $10,000 to spend three nights with him in Vegas, and she accepts with conditions. Is mutual attraction stirring?','/lmcabkCsSQ08yll4dIVclWc2RSX.jpg','2001-04-19',88,'Released',NULL,'The Center of the World',32590,2.3711,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15957,_binary '\0','/7IpUXbKHWA1Xt4jCwnP3A2YFPC3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0240419',7,9733,'es','La Ciénaga','Amid the sweltering summer heat in northern Argentina, two middle-class families retreat to a crumbling country estate and a modest townhouse, where strained relationships, simmering tensions, and the presence of children and servants quietly expose the fractures of family life. Between idle days, gossip, and unspoken desires, the boundaries of class, tradition, and faith are reflected in their everyday interactions.','/fcgRKfCRudyWggyHIT9LOPgU3qW.jpg','2001-04-12',101,'Released',NULL,'La Ciénaga',58429,2.54,6.824,'iHikpCDL2_I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15958,_binary '\0','/WxgHV8OobHqXp91EPEeNirCab4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0240425',7.6,2608,'ja','楽しいムーミン一家 ムーミン谷の彗星','Moomintroll, Sniff and Little My set out to stop a comet approaching the Moominvalley. Along the way they meet Snufkin, the beautiful Snorkmaiden, Snork and Hemulen, who join them in their quest.','/b4O25Joz13gZqXusA5tyqO4Y4OV.jpg','1992-08-08',72,'Released',NULL,'Comet in Moominland',70089,3.3958,7.4,'rnz3c2gf91A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15959,_binary '\0','/VtFa6Ph0xCO6QJ86ihCrpsDBIO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0240462',4.8,49091,'en','Dr. Dolittle 2','A group of beavers ask Dr. Dolittle to save their habitat from loggers. The only hope is to get the forest preserved because it\'s the home of a protected bear, but there\'s a problem: the bear\'s the only bear in the forest, so she can\'t reproduce. Undaunted, Dolittle persuades a circus bear to help out, but he has to teach him not just the ways of the wild, but the wiles of lady bears too.','/asYjHXBoD44B6mLOcZtMfMV3hm1.jpg','2001-06-22',87,'Released','The doctor is in again.','Dr. Dolittle 2',10808,7.4283,5.327,'EXpnizX4kMA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15960,_binary '\0','/zvIhFx35lXEIO2OsVnrpReEH747.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0240468',6.2,51269,'en','Kung Pow: Enter the Fist','A movie within a movie, created to spoof the martial arts genre. Writer/director Steve Oedekerk uses contemporary characters and splices them into a 1970s kung-fu film, weaving the new and old together. As the main character, The Chosen One, Oedekerk sets off to avenge the deaths of his parents at the hands of kung-fu legend Master Pain. Along the way he encounters some strange characters.','/gVsZ1hsJ9g11oCCav4N8ccp9bRw.jpg','2002-01-25',81,'Released','If you\'ve got an ass...he\'ll kick it!','Kung Pow: Enter the Fist',11891,5.9895,6.5,'GXrAYdSeWY8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15961,_binary '\0','/2IojDzEWedVbre8KZhZPMoP5az4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0240510',6.5,36754,'en','The Four Feathers','A young British officer resigns his post when he learns of his regiment\'s plan to ship out to the Sudan for the conflict with the Mahdi. His friends and fiancée send him four white feathers as symbols of what they view as his cowardice. To redeem his honor, he disguises himself as an Arab and secretly saves their lives.','/bfmpeRr9LTXzBC2dpC89FE5uavK.jpg','2002-09-08',132,'Released','Freedom. Country. Honor. Passion. To save his best friend, one man must risk everything he loves.','The Four Feathers',9093,4.9331,6.644,'tQ_MrNPOzG4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15962,_binary '\0','/uhHYfrbc4BWZbmsAvl951pfvoEu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0240515',4.7,54609,'en','Freddy Got Fingered','Unemployed cartoonist Gord Brody moves back in with his parents Jim and Julie and younger brother Freddy. When his parents demand he leave, he retaliates by spreading rumors that Jim is sexually abusing Freddy.','/gVmSZgxiT7ynyRLsEgg8Xs8ZVWX.jpg','2001-04-20',87,'Released','This time you can\'t change the channel.','Freddy Got Fingered',13166,4.9184,4.8,'-b2j_JJ0Umk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15963,_binary '\0','/iBsvTINEs3trKH73p4Ogbwm9xQ5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0240628',7.1,6010,'en','James Dean','The man behind the legend and a knowing look at 1950s Hollywood are revealed in this dynamic biopic of the meteoric star whose troubled life echoed his gut-grabbing performances in East of Eden, Rebel Without a Cause and Giant.','/6dZt1YCJoEUjFRZUUhjEZclkDSZ.jpg','2001-08-04',96,'Released','The stars that burn brightest burn quickest','James Dean',2141,3.464,6.782,'ZPKq9q2Cq8E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15964,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0240641',7,1962,'en','Just, Melvin: Just Evil','A documentary about a man who molested generations of his children and stepchildren.','/hdKOfq2jZJ0Liz8ivbkACVCz1bF.jpg','2000-01-20',75,'Released',NULL,'Just, Melvin: Just Evil',113097,1.2585,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15965,_binary '\0','/ncoqdHs1poUaBqyKic9YI8ai7MP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0240772',7.7,683461,'en','Ocean\'s Eleven','Less than 24 hours into his parole, charismatic thief Danny Ocean is already rolling out his next plan: In one night, Danny\'s hand-picked crew of specialists will attempt to steal more than $150 million from three Las Vegas casinos. But to score the cash, Danny risks his chances of reconciling with ex-wife, Tess.','/hQQCdZrsHtZyR6NbKH2YyCqd2fR.jpg','2001-12-07',116,'Released','Are you in or out?','Ocean\'s Eleven',161,45.7552,7.465,'n3epi9hPbqQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15966,_binary '\0','/zAQwmMvh5cOtkVPk6UUtlGrXWkP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0240793',6,2878,'en','Dark Prince: The True Story of Dracula','Meet the man behind the legend in this true story of Vlad the Impaler, whose vicious and cruel reputation as a bloodthirsty warlord became the basis for the myth of Dracula.','/gtPSncmiwK3lR9WCGKWD8PgdrNV.jpg','2000-10-31',92,'Released',NULL,'Dark Prince: The True Story of Dracula',26245,2.4655,6.1,'v6OsDXLhYjs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15967,_binary '\0','/sBecqcXgrLRiwufYr6apGnYA70k.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0240890',6.8,132925,'en','Serendipity','Although already in relationships, two strangers realize they have genuine chemistry after a chance encounter – but part company soon after. Years later, they each yearn to reunite, despite being destined for the altar. But to give true love a chance, they have to find one another again.','/4jS66Qmq2Ru5S2YzHVknGd4xJyT.jpg','2001-10-05',90,'Released','Can once in a lifetime happen twice?','Serendipity',9778,8.82,6.982,'xgwn8UqU2aY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15968,_binary '\0','/xnv3YEL8KIH0n3NJnObHUbhlFsI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0240894',6.3,1479,'en','Sharing the Secret','A teenage girl, who feels she must always seem happy for her parents and friends, secretly binges and purges.','/vKO3CPkP0ZrDpWMUdbD2i5bzmMZ.jpg','2000-05-10',90,'Released',NULL,'Sharing the Secret',299024,2.4054,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15969,_binary '\0','/pmwIaqu40catjSDQTlYSCAHBhzP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0240900',5.3,15871,'en','Slackers','Dave, Sam and Jeff are about to graduate from Holden University with honors in lying, cheating and scheming. The three roommates have proudly scammed their way through the last four years of college and now, during final exams, these big-men-on-campus are about to be busted by the most unlikely dude in school. Self-dubbed Cool Ethan, an ambitious nerd with a bad crush, enters their lives one day and everything begins to unravel.','/g3xn7tRnGxVwwKc2tge7nPssywQ.jpg','2002-02-01',86,'Released','When all else fails... cheat.','Slackers',20009,3.8379,5.224,'XK65w7gpE6A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15970,_binary '\0','/bYvY5oAb56MKeYV91bL5uzKh1bP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0240913',7,10800,'fr','Sous le Sable','When her husband goes missing at the beach, a female professor begins to mentally disintegrate as her denial of his disappearance becomes delusional.','/phJFN5d5qtphQoz3QzP7Z7GLAMM.jpg','2001-02-07',96,'Released','Can love vanish without a trace?','Under the Sand',4973,3.1416,6.7,'c3kxXChV8oE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15971,_binary '\0','/yLBoS1Gtmz7acpW12we7GfyrfZQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0240980',6.3,2527,'en','Till Human Voices Wake Us','Sam and Silvy are best friends. One night, as they are watching a falling star while floating on their backs in a lake, Sylvy disappears from his side. Despite his best efforts, he cannot find her under water. Many years later, Sam, now a psychologist, returns to bury his father. Back in his hometown, he meets a woman called Ruby who reminds him in so many ways of his lost love.','/hVUYqZ2sGjEOYXA0tumra96ZxJI.jpg','2002-09-12',101,'Released','There will be time to wonder \"do I dare\"','Till Human Voices Wake Us',41820,1.8408,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15972,_binary '\0','/eW3GgBzpLcbohMy6I07rSyPROuM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0241025',6.2,24348,'en','Vanity Fair','In early 19th century England, orphaned Becky Sharp defies her poverty-stricken background and ascends the social ladder alongside her best friend.','/6GCjrrd1XIl8VSwjKo8c94LTwtd.jpg','2004-09-01',141,'Released','All\'s fair in love & war.','Vanity Fair',11632,6.2631,5.8,'BW9WVhTGT6Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15973,_binary '\0','/tq5Ru9mYiOufkvvK7AUrDesnLiA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0241073',5.9,3711,'ko','여고괴담','The ghost of a student who died at a Korean school comes back to seek vengeance and protect her friends.','/hWTcz8olkZrhL943Bn4xljOxVom.jpg','1998-05-30',105,'Released','Inside this school down these corridors, within the whispers lies the secrets and the sins.','Whispering Corridors',40254,1.6519,6.1,'_rTgKlX1tvk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15974,_binary '\0','/niW6lzCVnyQtJpZ9Xh7hzntvpeC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0241223',6.5,3150,'en','The Bank','The Bank, a world ripe with avarice and corruption, where O\'Reilly and his ilk can thrive and honest Aussie battlers lose everything. Enter Jim Doyle a maverick mathematician who has devised a formula to predict the fluctuations of the stock market. When he joins O\'Reilly\'s fold, he must first prove his loyalty to the \"greed is good\" ethos. Which way will he go? What does he have to hide?','/xiCMypGhw4vmTXOoPIF2IboiYEZ.jpg','2001-09-06',104,'Released','Power. Corruption. Revenge.','The Bank',15486,1.4581,5.7,'rHlPGyQWiOA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15975,_binary '\0','/ci7lHSttckIgO6TlaT4X1zy8CDi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0241303',7.2,211610,'en','Chocolat','In the winter of 1959, a single mother and her young daughter arrive in a rural French town, where they open an unusual chocolate shop that disrupts the moral fiber of the strictly Catholic townsfolk and mayor.','/lnwPvyj8UR7MetG2pQ92453IIoR.jpg','2000-12-22',121,'Released','One taste is all it takes.','Chocolat',392,7.3578,7,'692hOJq1KJE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15976,_binary '\0','/lvOLivVeX3DVVcwfVkxKf0R22D8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0241527',7.7,966724,'en','Harry Potter and the Philosopher\'s Stone','Harry Potter has lived under the stairs at his aunt and uncle\'s house his whole life. But on his 11th birthday, he learns he\'s a powerful wizard—with a place waiting for him at the Hogwarts School of Witchcraft and Wizardry. As he learns to harness his newfound powers with the help of the school\'s kindly headmaster, Harry uncovers the truth about his parents\' deaths—and about the villain who\'s to blame.','/wuMc08IPKEatf9rnMNXvIDxqP4W.jpg','2001-11-16',152,'Released','Let the magic begin.','Harry Potter and the Philosopher\'s Stone',671,56.0778,7.903,'PbdM1db3JbY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15977,_binary '\0','/wo4PrAv907tC2vIpft5XidTSEYS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0241588',7,1522,'ja','蛇の道','With the help of a mysterious acquaintance, a former low-level yakuza tracks down and kidnaps the man he believes kidnapped and murdered his daughter, but others are soon implicated in the death.','/kHUsXCAtjwQCcyCE8uLpksRt40M.jpg','1998-02-21',85,'Released','Violence escalates as a man seeks revenge for the murder of his daughter.','Serpent\'s Path',103794,1.6839,6.9,'RgkoNmmMApQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15978,_binary '\0','/BhLomNgO8x8CP5aAmXocmFFDfv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0241663',7.5,2258,'pt','Lavoura Arcaica','In 1940s São Paulo, Pedro’s tasked to retrieve his estranged brother André. André’s departure stems from a domineering father, an overly affectionate mother, and Pedro’s jealousy over the father’s favoritism. Further complicating matters is André’s unconventional relationship with their sister, Ana.','/u6Bz2BnPnuCgT6koT4LeiCUNJQi.jpg','2001-10-29',171,'Released',NULL,'To the Left of the Father',60141,2.0396,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15979,_binary '\0','/5gWpLr0QiujfFBhnaUrl9hUKgtj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0241743',7.2,1242,'en','Murder, She Wrote: A Story to Die For','Jessica Fletcher, lecturing at a writers\' conference, finds herself called on to solve the killing of a guest speaker, an arrogant Russian author who\'d written a nonfiction, tell-all book about his tenure as head of the KGB.','/tV5tKDXtVYzRakUjqOZRMcq0R0q.jpg','2000-05-18',95,'Released','Jessica\'s back to write a few wrongs.','Murder, She Wrote: A Story to Die For',238292,3.1137,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15980,_binary '\0','/bF8cXquHdctJgTGfHkjdUwGqwZx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0241760',5.8,40077,'en','The New Guy','Nerdy high school senior Dizzy Harrison has finally gotten lucky -- after purposely getting expelled, he takes lessons in \'badass cool\' from a convict and enrolls at a new school. But can he keep up the ruse?','/aekXSzkn3zry6aummMl7AU4rSa8.jpg','2002-05-10',88,'Released','A zero will rise.','The New Guy',10985,11.8855,6,'TcAX0e5s2d0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15981,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0241998',2.1,1409,'en','Sweetie Pie','A harrowing, modern day morality tale about kids who have had too much, too soon.','/hwtP2X8lijxwmjgbZfyDGFQUIst.jpg','2002-01-14',85,'Released',NULL,'Sweetie Pie',688607,2.4057,10,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15982,_binary '\0','/zUrAweFlUjGSoC75Trz2weoaBGI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0242024',6.1,1380,'nl','Team Spirit','The story centers around a group of friends (and girlfriends) who have been playing football together for over 10 years, and who are now getting everything ready for their 500th match.','/5b9djSvqozkKvVJxrJHHTBJ8BQX.jpg','2000-03-16',90,'Released',NULL,'Team Spirit',59271,0.8449,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15983,_binary '\0','/vYpsJcW9bFSVd9U8ITfIOimWLgr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0242150',5.5,2815,'en','Xchange','In the near future, a company called Xchange owns a mind transference technology that enables instantaneous travel by swapping bodies with someone at the destination. A member of the privileged corporate class (\"Corpie\") Xchanging for the first time unwittingly switches bodies with a terrorist. Forced to hide in a limited life span cloned body with just 2 days remaining, he races against time to stop the terrorist and regain his body.','/awEsQWTKi0yTfzFjrNPH4BDzn7X.jpg','2001-01-19',105,'Released','Out of time. Out of Bodies.','Xchange',26446,1.6548,5.2,'WFrgDp8xzhs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15984,_binary '\0','/vy13Ak7IQDzfwz4aMsjiTGfVUYb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0242193',6.9,42486,'en','Bully','A group of teenagers in South Florida enact a murder plot against their mutual bully, Bobby, who has emotionally, physically, and sexually abused them for years.','/vMJ2WHBbK4Jr3eDuF1e7O6lbC8m.jpg','2001-06-15',113,'Released','It\'s 4 a.m... do you know where your kids are?','Bully',9517,4.1174,6.684,'4hxbVQlrsLU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15985,_binary '\0','/woxo93Jbp2B5wfd4zfS6B2phJNW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0242252',6,5813,'en','The Affair of the Necklace','In pre-Revolutionary France, a young aristocratic woman left penniless by the political unrest in the country, must avenge her family\'s fall from grace by scheming to steal a priceless necklace.','/uPgXAA5PzMCCWXYA3PsihgNkwht.jpg','2001-11-30',118,'Released','Her birthright was stolen. Her dignity taken. Her rights denied. Deception was the only option.','The Affair of the Necklace',19076,2.6992,5.6,'g45P9vNp5Mc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15986,_binary '\0','/waEYmE1VqRqcy1OhbjGLBrNCGrh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0242256',8.3,9096,'ta','அலைபாயுதே','Karthik and Shakthi marry against the wishes of their families and start their new life. However, they soon realize that marriage is not the bed of roses they had imagined it would be.','/rnN492zNPK5zvXvDQILm0KRLwD4.jpg','2000-04-14',156,'Released',NULL,'Alaipayuthey',49035,1.8501,7.38,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15987,_binary '\0','/4GV1PNVIGmbwqnNvpwp7t7vLFct.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0242423',5.5,153928,'en','Dude, Where\'s My Car?','Two stoners wake up after a night of partying and cannot remember where they parked their car.','/A5FBQplPsSVVvdYn4NHgtWYF8un.jpg','2000-12-15',83,'Released','After a night they can\'t remember, comes a day they\'ll never forget.','Dude, Where\'s My Car?',8859,10.0815,5.544,'d1wuijgeaaY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15988,_binary '\0','/4oYN6hr7AjMhmgaZ0tWjVOkfX75.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0242445',5.6,37651,'en','Exit Wounds','Maverick cop Orin Boyd always brings down the domestic terrorists he tracks, but he ruffles feathers with his unorthodox techniques -- and soon finds himself reassigned to the toughest district in Detroit. When he discovers a group of detectives secretly operating a drug ring, Boyd joins forces with an unlikely ally -- gangster Latrell Walker -- to bring down the rotten cops.','/tGIJhBejmredgUZRNdteZyiahag.jpg','2001-03-16',101,'Released','This is gonna hurt','Exit Wounds',10877,8.8696,5.9,'ZYvSK-xBAMU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15989,_binary '\0','/yap1xGljc2mED8Upk4NYy3f1r7F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0242508',4.8,4729,'en','Harvard Man','College has always been a time for experimentation, sexual, cultural and otherwise. \"Harvard Man\" plays out against a background of love, sex, basketball, crime and experimentation. Action and philosophy in young people\'s quest to discover their true identity.','/vxZG1UXh8gA3nYmrPNUWCHGGBFn.jpg','2001-08-01',99,'Released','Passion, Seduction, Deception.','Harvard Man',27451,2.659,4.7,'CidMaD84sjc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15990,_binary '\0','/AkfqKaD1KqfIqytxLvWlyKJRlEi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0242519',8.2,81996,'hi','Hera Pheri','Two tenants and a landlord, in desperate need of money, chance upon a ransom call via a cross connection. They hatch a plan to claim the ransom for themselves.','/23MKGUPT5laTStim4TaGhfgSltu.jpg','2000-03-31',156,'Released',NULL,'Hera Pheri',21614,2.7114,7.129,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15991,_binary '\0','/o3PJPcTY40mUkj96P6wwhTIN9Rf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0242527',6.2,50289,'en','The Hole','Four teenagers at a British private school secretly uncover and explore the depths of a sealed underground hole created decades ago as a possible bomb shelter.','/n5aMoI6AZLJzUoNbjMj0P60EYMJ.jpg','2001-04-20',102,'Released','Once you get in, you can\'t get out.','The Hole',467,4.1962,6.2,'_N50XofqZkY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15992,_binary '\0','/scdsMR9iYakMGtydouJBT76iRpa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0242572',7.7,4336,'ta','கண்டுகொண்டேன் கண்டுகொண்டேன்','Two young women with differing views on love find themselves with three suitors in this modern take on Jane Austen\'s \'Sense and Sensibility\' set in Tamil Nadu.','/fA4oMpZpLc487DrtZGBeNnGGtoi.jpg','2000-05-05',157,'Released',NULL,'Kandukondain Kandukondain',69426,1.9771,7.077,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15993,_binary '\0','/zmKvbUUnTQMMUdKfd8FA4J6DSgK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0242587',7.1,11276,'en','L.I.E.','With his mother dead and his father busy at work, Howie feels adrift in his New York suburb. He and his friend Gary spend their time burglarizing their neighbors\' homes — until they make the mistake of robbing the house of Big John, a macho former Marine who is also an unrepentant pedophile. He propositions Howie, who declines, but the two eventually develop an unlikely and dangerous friendship.','/ck5Tkq17M6khEN7JQlQznoYl37L.jpg','2001-09-07',97,'Released',NULL,'L.I.E.',18734,2.6357,6.8,'XeiQT_7x4YQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15994,_binary '\0','/c9QSAjnkMX9KocxexKJp3njQ4qc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0242601',7.2,1491,'es','El libro de piedra','Julia, a governess, comes to work for a bourgeois family that lives in a forested property they have recently bought. Julia is to take care of a little girl named Silvia, whose unusual demeanor may find its roots in the family garden.','/jfx0gPzmECyZg1z39wl6MR74Ke1.jpg','1969-07-18',100,'Released','A legend from 7 centuries ago...','The Book of Stone',68632,1.3251,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15995,_binary '\0','/533xAMhhVyjTy8hwMUFEt5TuDfR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0242653',6.8,580240,'en','The Matrix Revolutions','The human city of Zion defends itself against the massive invasion of the machines as Neo fights to end the war at another front while also opposing the rogue Agent Smith.','/qEWiBXJGXK28jGBAm8oFKKTB0WD.jpg','2003-11-05',129,'Released','Everything that has a beginning has an end.','The Matrix Revolutions',605,20.0011,6.758,'hMbexEPAOQI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15996,_binary '\0','/Ae1NxtazIheNso8MC0va80pbjnK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0242795',6.7,5676,'fr','Presque rien','Story of two gorgeous, young French boys who begin a passionate relationship that boils over and threatens to destroy both their lives. Shy 18-year-old Mathieu is on summer vacation in the south of France. He spends his days lazily sunning himself at the beach, until he spies the handsome Cédric and falls in love.','/x04Oo0CKJNA0TlilWR0o5gY9sr1.jpg','2000-06-07',94,'Released',NULL,'Come Undone',27099,2.7584,6.4,'XLf15WZFEDE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15997,_binary '\0','/351R85FxY6gHefB6tK5CWorjwpC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0242888',6.5,9993,'en','The Sleeping Dictionary','In the 1930s, British officer John Truscott journeys to a remote village in colonial Malaysia to educate and Westernize the local Iban population. There, he\'s introduced to the lovely Selima. In keeping with tradition, Selima is assigned to sleep with Truscott and teach him the native language and customs. But when they fall in love, both colonists and natives object to their plans to marry.','/bszp3HdnaBE6ptfio37vB3JckuL.jpg','2003-01-31',109,'Released','He\'s an unexpected education.','The Sleeping Dictionary',25988,4.1133,6.6,'h5qBDWmFj7Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15998,_binary '\0','/xQv1lUPeqFEaQHmsAlys6YXbsWk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0242994',6.9,2665,'fr','Va savoir','After finding love and success in Italy, French actress Camille returns to Paris, the city she fled three years ago. She secretly dreads confronting her ex-boyfriend Pierre. Her new lover Ugo also has a secret, as he’s meeting with the intriguing Dominique while on his quest for an unpublished manuscript.','/8ZW85CU32SYme7MZjoD2d7KUgHO.jpg','2001-09-28',154,'Released',NULL,'Va Savoir (Who Knows?)',55372,1.9629,6.2,'R7TSR6KEqc0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(15999,_binary '\0','/ntsJFh4DMY3u2YUqanr5pYiJvFN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0242998',5,32394,'en','Valentine','Four friends start to receive morbid Valentine cards and realise they are being stalked by someone they had spurned 13 years ago. A masked killer is on the loose and Valentine\'s day is soon approaching.','/jMtWV4FixMGTgUjbr9NFVEANGYQ.jpg','2001-02-02',96,'Released','Remember that kid everyone ignored on Valentine’s Day? He remembers you.','Valentine',10984,5.7043,5.6,'9KYtyaXIXZQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16000,_binary '\0','/56MLZww2dMVAaTt5LDKCBu1do2X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0243017',7.6,69915,'en','Waking Life','Waking Life is about a young man in a persistent lucid dream-like state. The film follows its protagonist as he initially observes and later participates in philosophical discussions that weave together issues like reality, free will, our relationships with others, and the meaning of life.','/2MRM4PL6H7yraAkwyUEe2EqoQH3.jpg','2001-10-19',101,'Released','Dreams. What are they? An escape from reality or reality itself?','Waking Life',9081,4.1877,7.5,'edrGozs6W_I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16001,_binary '\0','/xwjVHxKKk2hb6CJX46U4Cv0Zq0a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0243133',7.5,121266,'en','The Man Who Wasn\'t There','A tale of murder, crime and punishment set in the summer of 1949. Ed Crane, a barber in a small California town, is dissatisfied with his life, but his wife Doris\' infidelity and a mysterious opportunity presents him with a chance to change it.','/lrCgt8NNMyFsfmXyXiSSCRXNH4u.jpg','2001-10-26',116,'Released',NULL,'The Man Who Wasn\'t There',10778,6.5659,7.5,'vjO8u_9CqXI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16002,_binary '\0','/1feGa8JR4WUQSCHRLCpn9UAwigr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0243135',6.7,4039,'fr','Le Battement d\'ailes du papillon','How, thanks to what\'s known as the \"Butterfly theory\" (a random series of unlinked events), can a young woman and a young man meet?','/kS0D6cQ30kt1lz3YuRrBJnfwxzF.jpg','2000-06-12',90,'Released',NULL,'Happenstance',24908,1.8349,6.476,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16003,_binary '\0','/9rSpxsMhG1FnFtUDdvSAXdtLtb3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0243155',6.8,289282,'en','Bridget Jones\'s Diary','Bridget Jones is an average woman struggling against expectations. As a New Year\'s resolution, Bridget decides to take control of her life, starting by keeping a diary in which she will always tell the complete truth. Her charming boss takes an interest in her, and she cannot stop running into a rather disagreeable acquaintance whom Bridget cannot help finding quietly attractive.','/olMTi7uCaec9Yr3Ar07D2SIja1G.jpg','2001-04-13',97,'Released','All women keep score... Only the great ones put it in writing.','Bridget Jones\'s Diary',634,13.3167,6.738,'EH9CWWqb-6E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16004,_binary '\0','/lFlxgP7lyXS4I0GEpTxGqFg6Se9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0243220',6.3,2119,'en','Disappearing Acts','A struggling construction worker and an aspiring musician find themselves falling in love.','/Anj9dYz1GazIpxEiBAnaRdBkdln.jpg','2000-12-09',115,'Released','Real love. Real life.','Disappearing Acts',45602,2.8271,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16005,_binary '\0','/lba63vslUgCsRCumTNy5XYKTyVP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0243232',6.3,2539,'en','Dust','Two parallel tales of redemption, a century apart. In the New York storyline, Edge hunts for Angela\'s gold to pay back a debt, and gradually grows closer to her. In the Macedonian story, the brothers end up fighting for opposite sides of a revolution, with the religious Elijah taking up sides with the Ottoman sultan and gunslinger Luke joining \"the Teacher\" , a Macedonian rebel.','/qhNlFTwlrte13wX3ntMQJSO7azG.jpg','2001-08-29',127,'Released',NULL,'Dust',16405,3.4486,5.5,'XHbTdBd0u-8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16006,_binary '\0','/gk7k11v0G9QiSEpDR5fhr6Ihkwa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0243255',6.4,14255,'fr','À ma sœur !','Anaïs is twelve and bears the weight of the world on her shoulders. She watches her older sister, Elena, whom she both loves and hates. Elena is fifteen and devilishly beautiful. Neither more futile, nor more stupid than her younger sister, she cannot understand that she is merely an object of desire. And, as such, she can only be taken. Or had. Indeed, this is the subject: a girl\'s loss of virginity. And, that summer, it opens a door to tragedy.','/afzbY1h7huuxlITigPfcyQSkqLs.jpg','2001-03-07',86,'Released',NULL,'Fat Girl',570,4.2619,6.2,'S7K2ZRuwBgg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16007,_binary '\0','/qGeUsoEt2KQoP0LtB1igK2OjX5P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0243465',5.5,1390,'sv','Det okända.','Five young field-biologists are sent to northern Sweden to investigate effects of a large forest fire. However, what was thought to be some weeks of camping and easy work soon turns into a nightmare as they find the remains of a mysterious creature and take it in for examination...','/sTuaZUUTY6X3sTlHikr50mPr4f9.jpg','2000-10-06',90,'Released','You are no longer who you think you are.','The Unknown',34754,1.7259,5.1,'mRbe6iD9z6k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16008,_binary '\0','/mrqrAmf19tgHGopeM6rLbsqJcZP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0243493',7,19206,'fr','Le Placard','A man spreads the rumor of his fake homosexuality with the aid of his neighbor, to prevent his imminent firing at his work.','/kNm5Jxr3iulG8tfYHqDD0ahODCw.jpg','2001-01-17',84,'Released','Sometimes to save your skin, you have to come out of the closet... or go in!','The Closet',11444,3.894,6.4,'ou9YG0fUztA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16009,_binary '\0','/3xdlUsjYLn22GkBj2t9McO5Cp1z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0243554',6.3,3358,'en','When Strangers Appear','A man enters a roadside diner run by a young woman and claims he is being chased by murderers.','/waL1neAqYQ6GsXUmEoUUdmguFFl.jpg','2001-02-01',98,'Released','Don\'t serve coffee to strangers.','When Strangers Appear',73952,1.8298,6.2,'LCHa5XZ1ixs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16010,_binary '\0','/8VRmHiIGbQxIJH8p30niFl78qSC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0243558',7.2,2133,'ja','少女革命ウテナ アドゥレセンス黙示録','In a loose retelling of the Revolutionary Girl Utena TV series, Utena Tenjou arrives at Ohtori Academy, only to be immediately swept up in a series of duels for the hand of her classmate Anthy Himemiya and the power she supposedly holds. At the same time, Utena reunites with Touga Kiryuu, a friend from her childhood who seems to know the secrets behind the duels. Utena must discover those secrets for herself, before the power that rules Ohtori claims her and her friends, new and old.','/lx68azELlJyBx7KqRe0Hy9wj9AU.jpg','1999-08-14',86,'Released','Alone, we have the power to revolutionize the world.','Revolutionary Girl Utena: The Movie',19738,3.4614,7.375,'PZlqkPaKYP8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16011,_binary '\0','/wkc4D723P2ZbMwwsD0lHcQuGTIO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0243575',5.6,2829,'en','Speaking of Sex','A counselor, an expert on depression, and two attorneys try to help a couple who have marital problems.','/oV6fwiOJKhf8vs5MnCSPeMc2U5i.jpg','2001-10-18',97,'Released','Because life has its ups and downs.','Speaking of Sex',16435,3.7086,5.6,'QXArd-galaI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16012,_binary '\0','/iEvlXeDvLW5IjmWa5jwO0Tieu1g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0243585',5.5,62511,'en','Stuart Little 2','Stuart, an adorable white mouse, still lives happily with his adoptive family, the Littles, on the east side of Manhattan\'s Central Park. More crazy mouse adventures are in store as Stuart, his human brother, George, and their mischievous cat, Snowbell, set out to rescue a friend.','/1vdPKC35IOjEAJEr9Y2rjEeyCcW.jpg','2002-07-19',78,'Released','A Little goes a long way.','Stuart Little 2',10996,8.4979,5.8,'k--OdtbKyqE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16013,_binary '\0','/8L2TLCbDYOrwXxkpAbEcB9gIVBV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0243595',6.1,2543,'en','Kill Me Later','Her goldfish dead, her lover exposed as a rat, Shawn Holloway leaves her bank post and goes to the roof intent on suicide. Before she can leap, she\'s taken hostage by Charlie Anders, a fleeing bank robber. He and his partners have stolen a million in cash and plan to escape to Venezuela. Shawn agrees to cooperate if Charlie promises to kill her once he\'s in the clear. Parts of the plan go awry, so Charlie has time to try to pierce her bleak manner and self pity, and she has time for reflection. As night falls, their interlude ends: they\'re each alone, Charlie facing prison as the police close in, and Shawn staring down at a river from atop a high bridge.','/2HaAtSaml6QLc6fs9H1BBM5nDMF.jpg','2001-09-14',89,'Released','Not every hostage wants to be saved!','Kill Me Later',35176,1.6318,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16014,_binary '\0','/7ew2soLD1RY0PbHwhReqNUv08Wa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0243609',6.9,12381,'en','To End All Wars','Based on a real-life story, this drama focuses on a small group of Allied soldiers in Burma who are held captive by the Japanese. Capt. Ernest Gordon, Lt. Jim Reardon and Maj. Ian Campbell are among the military officers kept imprisoned and routinely beaten and deprived of food. While Campbell wants to rebel and attempt an escape, Gordon tries to take a more stoic approach, an attitude that proves to be surprisingly resonant.','/4fXRE02M2EckpGPZNbuZIo05dmL.jpg','2001-09-02',108,'Released',NULL,'To End All Wars',1783,3.667,6.417,'uK_RihZLeu0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16015,_binary '\0','/boct1C0KWZ533T6o5qjFVfaUpSt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0243655',6.5,64945,'en','Wet Hot American Summer','It\'s the last day of Camp Firewood\'s season, but there\'s still time for the big talent show, a little romance… and for everyone to be wiped out by the piece of NASA\'s Skylab that\'s hurtling toward Earth.','/AaqZVlzoVOoT65QgikMVw0CqNlf.jpg','2001-07-27',97,'Released','High times. Hard bodies. Soft rock.','Wet Hot American Summer',2171,5.4246,6.244,'L82EQPT9sf4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16016,_binary '\0','/X2dwfq4hrACxwI0h85x3N5pa9Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0243664',7.9,10972,'en','Wit','A renowned professor is forced to reassess her life when she is diagnosed with terminal ovarian cancer.','/1ONOsIo5gby9hABPdknL7OAYBLm.jpg','2001-02-09',99,'Released','It appears to be a matter of life and death.','Wit',26976,2.7885,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16017,_binary '\0','/cNKwwzI0KkeBgeDmGELkO14ovle.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0243736',5.6,78802,'en','40 Days and 40 Nights','Matt Sullivan\'s last big relationship ended in disaster and ever since his heart\'s been aching and his commitment\'s been lacking. Then came Lent, that time of year when everybody gives something up. That\'s when Matt decides to go where no man\'s gone before and make a vow: No sex. Whatsoever. For 40 straight days. At first he has everything under control. That is until the woman of his dreams, Erica, walks into his life.','/pQTZX4gOEEkkMVFIRWtIrCpozeu.jpg','2002-03-01',94,'Released','Easier said than done.','40 Days and 40 Nights',2752,5.4526,5.47,'Asl625hZzoM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16018,_binary '\0','/bUa4SvSt35pwvJJquRWUvIPS1UQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0243759',6.9,3356,'en','The American Astronaut','Samual Curtis\'s first mission in this bizarre science fiction musical comedy requires him to take a cat to a saloon on an asteroid. There, he meets his former dance partner (the Blueberry Pirate) and collects his payment: a device capable of producing a Real Live Girl.','/qeh8Rzyr7VJaZWep7Vi5MP1e5hG.jpg','2001-09-21',92,'Released','Space is a lonely town','The American Astronaut',21538,1.4188,6.9,'5D1o69RFsfc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16019,_binary '\0','/7mWd9OJVmQqJRAwSXPpE6kKkusP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0243794',7.3,7624,'es','El Bola','El Bola is a 12-year-old boy raised in a violent and sordid environment. Embarrassed by his family life, he avoids becoming close to classmates. The arrival of a new boy at school changes his attitude towards his classmates and friendship.','/i51PMyfiomYL9dw9zcHc3Z7BpjZ.jpg','2000-10-20',88,'Released',NULL,'El Bola',33504,1.8449,7.1,'E2nBfLozAAk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16020,_binary '\0','/iiFzTxQZ647q0zc9F0w90lwn0PE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0243862',7,14514,'da','Italiensk for begyndere','Several lonely hearts in a semi-provincial suburb of a town in Denmark use a beginner\'s course in Italian as the platform to meet the romance of their lives. The film, which unspools the connections and family drama shared between the students, complies with several aesthetic principles of Dogme 95 movement.','/yviUKuVb9BXYPqkWvp8JZFj2wVb.jpg','2000-12-07',118,'Released','Attendance optional. Passion required.','Italian for Beginners',112,2.5163,6.4,'S0I4l3J9ljA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16021,_binary '\0','/bDipr16QRQ6Wn3bwiJ4w1czXN4a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0243876',5.8,1835,'cn','決戰紫禁之顚','The sword saint requests a duel with god of sword at the apex of the forbidden city to determine the worlds best. As the date of the duel nears troubles befall the imperial town until everything is revealed at the climactic fight.','/ySAg2M0RbPvvuJldAviQuhp7GaE.jpg','2000-02-03',106,'Released',NULL,'The Duel',35117,2.4701,5.8,'TiRkJY3w-w4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16022,_binary '\0','/bc8st5DZuqAXB3qaDvIBF4hP7Wk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0243889',7.7,4802,'ja','ユリイカ','In rural Japan, the survivors of a tragedy converge and attempt to overcome their damaged selves, all while a serial killer is on the loose.','/dsJ1D1GRAdBRsTKzbZAC6fqTZLR.jpg','2001-01-20',218,'Released','Do you think one can live only for others?','Eureka',38047,2.3574,7.8,'_o0CONMqKOc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16023,_binary '\0','/7Q6Zy7LJKqrHXFfmCNHm9qOj3aP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0243931',6.2,8462,'en','Good Advice','An investment banker loses everything and must discover what\'s really important in life.','/5RDn658gFZiz9iVD3QonTufuZh4.jpg','2001-11-15',93,'Released',NULL,'Good Advice',26014,4.495,5.9,'Ku5Bb0hEcEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16024,_binary '\0','/ciP4zvsQNZ5F0QZL2XqQQ3mza0A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0243991',4.6,2012,'en','Intimate Affairs','Edgar is an artist living in Paris during the 1920s who believes that sex is a subject of vital importance, but almost no one discusses it with the gravity it deserves. With this in mind, Edgar gathers together a panel of fellow creative types at the home of the wealthy tycoon Faldo and his oddly accented spouse Sasha for an evening in which they will discuss their erotic lives without self-serving wit or exaggeration.','/qcfHgzkclcbbw1cLKOyAk9fNSjh.jpg','2002-04-18',108,'Released','He uncovered their secrets.','Intimate Affairs',47237,2.7191,4.7,'BxPcVXCP05M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16025,_binary '\0','/6TkIKjHz4UYu2Z1I7tF57Frcz7i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0244000',5.9,17389,'en','American Outlaws','When a Midwest town learns that a corrupt railroad baron has captured the deeds to their homesteads without their knowledge, a group of young ranchers join forces to take back what is rightfully theirs. They will become the object of the biggest manhunt in the history of the Old West and, as their fame grows, so will the legend of their leader, a young outlaw by the name of Jesse James.','/ov9PIn56yrwvrwOfvVTKplmV0S6.jpg','2001-08-17',94,'Released','Sometimes the wrong side of the law is the right place to be.','American Outlaws',13496,4.6522,5.9,'RYhaFlWeJ1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16026,_binary '\0','/5AswKpdRKAtWWJRGiogtv985jyo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0244092',6.8,1608,'cn','孤男寡女','Wah and Kinki both work at a computer company. Despite not getting on too well initially, their friendship develops into romance when they get to know each other after a while.','/enjH5yOV0GDFemPwqMpNDAd7Q0b.jpg','2000-06-22',101,'Released',NULL,'Needing You...',45418,2.0587,6.3,'LleynJXJJE0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16027,_binary '\0','/hkzHUpwSJfXpPPq1pcHLxAZ0WYQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0244173',6.9,2556,'fr','Le roi danse','Louis XIV, the French sun-king has two passions, establishing absolute rule over the realm -after decades of religious/civil wars- by divine right and artistic brilliancy as a dancer','/iGsB3KkqSezLo66alEC16FSWn3Z.jpg','2000-12-06',115,'Released',NULL,'The King Is Dancing',44947,1.8928,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16028,_binary '\0','/eSxvC0Qw0A9AfI355MF9dSItrfR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0244244',6.5,204610,'en','Swordfish','Rogue agent Gabriel Shear is determined to get his mitts on $9 billion stashed in a secret Drug Enforcement Administration account. He wants the cash to fight terrorism, but lacks the computer skills necessary to hack into the government mainframe. Enter Stanley Jobson, a n\'er-do-well encryption expert who can log into anything.','/mM6h4jMqC4q5IaFgBIGKQDLnRU.jpg','2001-06-08',99,'Released','Log on. Hack in. Go anywhere. Steal everything.','Swordfish',9705,10.2692,6.268,'MTWGd-63sIM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16029,_binary '\0','/SlB5Oo5nBKMgnA29CdXFlOGt4l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0244297',6.8,1643,'en','The War Bride','During World War II, a Cockney woman marries a Canadian soldier and adjusts to life in Alberta.','/mTZmsV2wdshcXhq2juHN3kLCsfd.jpg','2001-03-21',103,'Released',NULL,'The War Bride',41839,1.3097,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16030,_binary '\0','/x903dx8Km6XNLFEmvbXc98vePSV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0244316',8.1,35035,'zh','一一','Each member of a family in Taipei asks hard questions about life\'s meaning as they live through everyday quandaries. NJ is morose: his brother owes him money, his mother is in a coma, his wife suffers a spiritual crisis when she finds her life a blank and his business partners make bad decisions.','/mR8dSQZI8X6Z1NClJhFrtJp636z.jpg','2000-09-20',174,'Released','We never live the same day twice.','Yi Yi',25538,8.9418,7.951,'PxgrzNFwyqY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16031,_binary '\0','/8DvbkZsU1hjnLz6QUMn6dQHCTV1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0244479',7.1,6398,'cs','Tmavomodrý svět','Lt. Franta Slama is a top pilot in the Czech Air Force who is assigned to train a promising young flier, Karel Vojtisek, and they soon become friends. When Nazi Germany invades Czechoslovakia in 1939, they both reject the authority of their new leaders and escape to England where they join other Czech exiles in the RAF. While flying a mission over England, Karel crash lands and happens upon the farmhouse of Susan, a young woman whose husband is in the Navy. Karel soon falls head over heels for Susan but, while they enjoy a brief fling, in time Susan decides she prefers the company of the older and more worldly Franta. As Franta and Karel struggle to maintain their friendship despite their romantic rivalry.','/9vu152xTO89l9UWDcqmE9zVD5xK.jpg','2001-05-17',112,'Released',NULL,'Dark Blue World',15813,2.1709,6.9,'AJTz9VozSYI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16032,_binary '\0','/v1mAmK4OM8uM2nYTnfKfGiUaj5B.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0244504',7,2017,'pt','Eu Tu Eles','A true story that comically depicts the relationship between an ordinary woman and her three husbands, who live in the same house in a poor and arid small village of the Brazilian northeast.','/bRpjzOjse06s4SOpH7ipAsqK0gb.jpg','2000-08-17',106,'Released','It is impossible to find all virtues on a unique man.','Me, You, Them',82103,1.31,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16033,_binary '\0','/4W53mm2nvOtiOuPNW2oiBm9pmUZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0244521',5.2,3493,'en','Funny Money','Henry Perkins, a mild-mannered accountant, accidentally trades briefcases with another man, to find out that there\'s a million dollars inside. Henry tells his unsuspecting wife of their new-found fortune, but she doesn\'t embrace it as well as he does. Soon they\'re joined by their best friends, a cop on the take, a cop on the hunt, and the dreaded Mr. Big, who has come to claim his money.','/oG3jWUZiDqqrdk3oKwPEkuwoN89.jpg','2006-03-09',98,'Released','Henry Perkins accidentally trades briefcases with another man, to find out that there\'s five million dollars inside...','Funny Money',9925,1.972,5.2,'NdRfKLzxNg4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16034,_binary '\0','/n9E7hN33zcvIPwEjNdlthM52veW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0244528',5.4,2378,'hi','Hadh कर दी आपने','Raj, a detective, goes on a Europe trip to investigate his friend\'s case. There, he falls in love with Anjali, who is impersonating her best friend.','/vf3YOjnTTBrAp7mKqbzkX8nC0bK.jpg','2000-04-14',134,'Released','A fun film.','Hadh Kar Di Aapne',46385,1.231,5.065,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16035,_binary '\0','/h9q6IW3ayeTnwz0QDs6lHt9HBdY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0244585',7.6,2096,'hi','खूबसूरत','Nirmala Gupta rules her household with an iron fist. While most of her family resents it, they do comply and try to appease to her. When her daughter-in-law\'s free-spirited sister comes over to stay for a few days, things in the Gupta family start to change, agitating Nirmala.','/cnW2iSpsI7VqoRfb9bKQ8tdc9Bu.jpg','1980-02-26',126,'Released',NULL,'Khubsoorat',60730,1.0548,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16036,_binary '\0','/jWwvUGRRTtcs3z7gj99jX0plNfH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0244764',5.9,1699,'en','Rip Girls','A teen-age girl and her father come to an island on Hawaii, they find a closer relationship to each other and think about changing the island. During her adventures, Sydney finds friends, a new hobby with her fantastic photography, and the truth about her mother.','/f4xSVmC6O8UjlfVtupCIGlIMV1S.jpg','2000-04-22',87,'Released',NULL,'Rip Girls',64269,4.7917,6.3,'69mMjp0wKeo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16037,_binary '\0','/v5n8DrD1nVxXaWCpBGu9K9ZaNlC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0244794',6.3,1981,'hi','सिर्फ़ तुम','Deepak, an ordinary young man with a big heart, and Aarthi, an attractive, middle class girl.','/c9w9QOJCVyBBApsD1E16kxG6YBo.jpg','1999-06-11',170,'Released',NULL,'Sirf Tum',166013,1.9566,5.969,'LHy-FKaDNCI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16038,_binary '\0','/ju66IP5AkqoHthl0T7efb7qosnS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0244870',6.1,10103,'ja','うずまき','The inhabitants of a small Japanese town become increasingly obsessed with and tormented by spirals.','/dS5ZG1qgjCIZWO1OvJOhbG46PaL.jpg','2000-02-11',90,'Released','Out of this world.','Uzumaki',11366,2.4461,5.946,'KMjpBR-uOZg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16039,_binary '\0','/fRNNl8iLc4mpWy1C2JDIJdJxHQZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0244970',6.1,27919,'en','Someone Like You...','Jane Goodale has everything going for her. She\'s a producer on a popular daytime talk show, and is in a hot romance with the show\'s dashing executive producer Ray. But when the relationship goes terribly awry, Jane begins an extensive study of the male animal, including her womanizing roommate Eddie. Jane puts her studies and romantic misadventure to use as a pseudonymous sex columnist -- and becomes a sensation.','/9cMkJSl2TI4xe8lKNFduinafKpe.jpg','2001-03-30',97,'Released','The story about the one that got away and the one she never saw coming.','Someone Like You...',12658,6.3151,5.968,'3qFynd7Pa6A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16040,_binary '\0','/t8lJnvKbdszl7fwfNK9u8wkTfwB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0245027',7.5,4773,'da','Bænken','Kaj is a stubborn man with a great deal of pride. The former chef lives in a council flat. He has wasted his life and is now on a council job training scheme for the long-term unemployed, where he refuses to let the foreman of the activation project boss him about. When Kaj\'s daughter, with whom he has not been in touch for nineteen years, moves into the same council estate on the run from her violent husband, a change comes over Kaj. His initial instinct is to avoid her, but by chance he ends up helping to look after Jonas, her six-year-old son. For the first time for years Kaj need not survive on his own devices. Now he has responsibilities and a family of his own.','/5bOteNFp8WsXaK44GHWGCugsotv.jpg','2000-08-26',89,'Released','He has a life, he isn\'t proud of, and a past that he doesn\'t want to remember.','The Bench',15830,2.1619,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16041,_binary '\0','/9jo4LVTFj1zKk9nCzulUiGWSnB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0245046',6.4,12508,'en','Charlotte Gray','This is a drama set in Nazi-occupied France at the height of World War II. Charlotte Gray tells the compelling story of a young Scottish woman working with the French Resistance in the hope of rescuing her lover, a missing RAF pilot. Based on the best-selling novel by Sebastian Faulks.','/6RnRclsipl3cZKnDfsu0MrqWCwI.jpg','2001-12-28',121,'Released','The story of an ordinary woman in an extraordinary time.','Charlotte Gray',12660,2.9479,6.1,'dGrZhlkfA2w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16042,_binary '\0','/j724iaQRnQTaxZ5dNIsvYaE4RQo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0245090',6.7,3836,'en','Edges of the Lord','A 12-year-old Jewish boy hides with a family of Catholic peasant farmers to escape the Nazis.','/toHIsXqxaLuqyTBIfzsqoPKibZO.jpg','2001-10-12',95,'Released','In war there are no children','Edges of the Lord',48130,2.6952,6.361,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16043,_binary '\0','/pNUVUFyf5UTAaaoh9k7UK6FXmez.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0245115',5.7,3095,'en','The Fluffer','Self-effacing, boyish Sean moves to LA to pursue a career in movies but finds it tougher than he imagined. He stumbles onto porn star Johnny Rebel - a handsome, muscled dream of men and women alike - who awakens Sean’s deep obsession.','/jYKeDJ0PgVBoSUVq4aXkXrapsjA.jpg','2001-02-11',95,'Released','Watch what you wish for.','The Fluffer',17731,3.1351,5.8,'9wGsFceP2FA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16044,_binary '\0','/cruaZPSaMcAbdihRbyCLYd8rDsW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0245120',5.3,9750,'en','The Forsaken','A young man is in a race against time as he searches for a cure after becoming infected with a virus that will eventually turn him into a blood-sucking vampire.','/4RN5EKSHawgUMoPzjzyyXCXckYk.jpg','2001-04-27',91,'Released','The night... has an appetite.','The Forsaken',12484,4.4084,5.4,'gkASS94NyT0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16045,_binary '\0','/3aKs5sru2flpoRANNDKyZcvDEUd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0245157',6.1,1740,'nl','Zus & zo','Three wacky sisters try to save their inheritance from their supposedly gay brother, who suddenly appears with a fiancé in tow. If he gets married, their father\'s will stipulates that he gets the family hotel in Portugal. So the sisters put aside their personal differences and set out to stop the wedding at all costs.','/pmStxhCvk7iN3HUK73JZKByRhEB.jpg','2002-05-08',106,'Released',NULL,'Zus & Zo',16539,1.8823,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16046,_binary '\0','/hMQfIJVM8s6O044a8OK08uLv9w9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0245171',6.4,4767,'en','Invincible','A Jewish strongman performs in Berlin as the blond Aryan hero Siegfried.','/vvNDQO2izNk6ytDxFtTr1BP5CxL.jpg','2001-12-02',133,'Released',NULL,'Invincible',68569,2.6228,6.2,'QGPOFJg-t1Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16047,_binary '\0','/xEWeqgytfnJawfpAbywxEFpXX8H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0245192',5.9,8149,'tr','Kahpe Bizans','Kahpe Bizans tells us the story of Yetis Bey (Cem Davran) and his struggle with Byzantian Emperor (Illetyus) in a humorous way.','/7NSA0ne79VCoNH1IGzWIPMaKclI.jpg','2000-01-21',97,'Released',NULL,'Perfidious Byzantine',33901,1.0505,5.3,'u6EclBcidiE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16048,_binary '\0','/j1FMMJhWWK3im0XtnBAYm9IaEXD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0245238',6.8,23565,'en','Lost and Delirious','After starting at an upmarket boarding school, a teenage girl forms close friendships with her two older roommates. However, when she discovers that her new friends are lovers she finds herself caught in a complicated situation.','/3Cu95A09arsfTsOJfygVwhJe5qc.jpg','2001-01-21',103,'Released','Friends. Roommates. Lovers.','Lost and Delirious',17612,3.6302,6.8,'c-My_lTpAgM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16049,_binary '\0','/gPNRf8gYlWQQIHlQl929IYCEELa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0245276',6.9,2108,'it','Il mestiere delle armi','In autumn of 1526, the Emperor, Charles V, sends his German landsknechts led by Georg von Frundsberg to march towards Rome. The inferior papal armies, commanded by Giovanni de\'Medici, try to chase them in the midst of a harsh winter. Nevertheless, the Imperial armies manage to cross the rivers along their march and get cannons thanks to the maneuvers of its Lords. In a skirmish, Giovanni de\'Medici is wounded in the leg by a falconet shot. The attempts to cure him fail and he dies. The Imperial armies assault Rome. The film is beautifully but unassumingly set, and shows the hard conditions in which war is waged and its lack of glory. It ends straightforwardly with the declaration made after the death of Giovanni de\'Medici by the commanders of the armies in Europe of not using again fire weapons because of their cruelty.','/goBhrMcbfiAHkLyoqNMqKyB1OjF.jpg','2001-05-11',105,'Released',NULL,'The Profession of Arms',56798,1.5362,6.7,'BOVlSzMVYkM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16050,_binary '\0','/9GKrozBVZvSgMJq1XZsmzsatRLb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0245280',7.4,2405,'en','Michael Jordan to the Max','This documentary showcases basketball player Michael Jordan\'s awe-inspiring moves, providing behind-the-scenes and on-the-court action, including footage of Jordan and the Chicago Bulls going head-to-head against the Utah Jazz in the 1997 NBA Finals. Phil Jackson and Bob Costas are interviewed (among others), and the awesome soundtrack includes songs by Earth, Wind and Fire, Fatboy Slim and Freddie King.','/z20ChkIl7zq7yOAIIJkDuUBV3x0.jpg','2000-05-05',46,'Released','Up close some heroes get even bigger.','Michael Jordan to the Max',24977,2.1591,7.5,'TaAFmO3XA-Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16051,_binary '\0','/mfSTOKAKV09DstCBCouAtmBlzhR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0245380',5.5,3082,'en','Quints','A teenager goes to desperate lengths to get attention when her mother gives birth to quints.','/u2DoMJ4Ecz7s3gOXa67cTHd5Cw1.jpg','2000-08-18',83,'Released','As if life at 14 isn\'t twisted enough.','Quints',101514,1.6951,5.6,'JtT3m_ZqwQs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16052,_binary '\0','/29ZtEwIbEjzFkH2PcjEpxbNBaY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0245407',5.8,4039,'en','Crush','Three 40-something women in a small English town meet weekly for a ritual of gin, cigarettes, and sweets -- and swapped stories arguing which of them has the most pathetic love life. Kate is headmistress at the local school; her best friends are the town\'s police chief and a cynical, thrice-divorced doctor.','/1ZEWDLOhlOymdcitI31kwulUJ6G.jpg','2002-06-07',112,'Released','Here\'s to men... of all shapes and sizes.','Crush',18435,2.1661,5.7,'rKcMHPbHbTE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16053,_binary '\0','/6oaL4DP75yABrd5EbC4H2zq5ghc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0245429',8.6,984718,'ja','千と千尋の神隠し','A young girl, Chihiro, becomes trapped in a strange new world of spirits. When her parents undergo a mysterious transformation, she must call upon the courage she never knew she had to free her family.','/39wmItIWsg5sZMyRUHLkWBcuVCM.jpg','2001-07-20',125,'Released','Beyond the tunnel was a mysterious town.','Spirited Away',129,40.0203,8.535,'ByXuk9QqQkk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16054,_binary '\0','/iRSf9PuFBrD0nRTiyhwj4NUcSW6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0245479',4.9,1647,'en','Just a Kiss','A group of thirtysomethings having problems with fidelity gets an opportunity to turn back the clock.','/6dH5EELSkd3neQldQGcLRImsPyF.jpg','2002-06-15',91,'Released','Every kiss has a story.','Just a Kiss',44635,2.0358,4.4,'vLdXtfRpG2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16055,_binary '\0','/f4jkzl52iQ3hW2jdaR03JQsmhkB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0245501',7,1580,'en','Things Behind the Sun','A young music journalist\'s dark memories are awakened when he goes to interview a female rock singer, and both are forced to confront troubling secrets from their pasts.','/7x1OE6QsxlLQfCz5D1q4olCkb5g.jpg','2001-10-12',120,'Released','Sex, drugs and a lost soul.','Things Behind the Sun',102933,2.0496,6,'1oRTFqfy-gc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16056,_binary '\0','/uK9SEHK2Xd28UiJOPHwasNamPpR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0245530',6.5,2236,'fr','Un crime au Paradis','In the 1980 French countryside, farmer Jojo and his ill-tempered wife Lulu hate each other, though their respective interests speak against divorce. The only thing that keeps the oppressed Jojo from murder is the threat of the guillotine...','/y6IAUOnvctKcnSpVdJNhPb11OvC.jpg','2001-02-28',89,'Released',NULL,'A Crime in Paradise',54544,1.8214,6.611,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16057,_binary '\0','/xr60oCXkfFIqMRJ4YxtMiD53zBy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0245562',6.1,77821,'en','Windtalkers','Joe Enders is a gung-ho Marine assigned to protect a \"windtalker\" - one of several Navajo Indians who were used to relay messages during World War II because their spoken language was indecipherable to Japanese code breakers.','/547q4HXlvEcS06lujfb2yzsTP3H.jpg','2002-06-07',134,'Released','Honor Was Their Code.','Windtalkers',12100,6.2727,6.4,'BfI-vfxEN3U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16058,_binary '\0','/aMZYX05Qgi3NqfD1h3nmOhJLdfh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0245573',5.9,3488,'en','XX/XY','Three friends begin a dangerous three-way relationship that spirals out of control, leading to dire consequences that haunt them ten years later.','/Avc51Le5NQbjbzE1PVmLFdi1nVs.jpg','2002-01-11',91,'Released','There\'s no room for honesty in a healthy relationship...','XX/XY',42383,3.3714,6,'EmgZSd9TBco','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16059,_binary '\0','/orIxqUMEcU3DT7qCs16Si8KWjBO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0245574',7.7,143083,'es','Y tu mamá también','In Mexico, two teenage boys and an attractive older woman embark on a road trip and learn a thing or two about life, friendship, sex, and each other.','/aj3rqjab8jfc2fWmcS3H3c5qbur.jpg','2001-06-08',106,'Released','Life has its ways of teaching.','Y Tu Mamá También',1391,10.6363,7.4,'inc0vS58ZKg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16060,_binary '\0','/x30bpi16AFWrfGVhYMqujbcCAWS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0245674',5.7,102661,'en','Thir13en Ghosts','Arthur and his two children inherit his uncle\'s estate: a glass house that serves as a prison to twelve ghosts. When the family, accompanied by a nanny and an attorney, enter the house they find themselves trapped inside an evil machine \'designed by the Devil and powered by the dead\' to open the Eye of Hell. Aided by a ghost hunter and his rival, a ghost rights activist out to set the ghosts free, the group must do what they can to get out of the house alive.','/6yrrddjIjx0ElCRZp5pTZeqrj3k.jpg','2001-10-25',91,'Released','Misery loves company.','Thir13en Ghosts',9378,11.6721,6.3,'Xj1LWNgG0Ng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16061,_binary '\0','/1g04YnMJQvWFRKOXJlUeZe1rOxF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0245686',6,66194,'en','Joe Dirt','Joe Dirt is a janitor with a mullet hairdo, acid-washed jeans and a dream to find the parents that he lost at the Grand Canyon when he was a belligerent, trailer park-raised eight-year-old. Now, blasting Van Halen in his jacked-up economy car, the irrepressibly optimistic Joe hits the road alone in search of his folks.','/yykDEtHk6DMtZK8EaxW88YyQ054.jpg','2001-04-10',92,'Released','Trailer trash wig wearin\' acid wash jean lovin\' rock concert t-shirt sportin\' hero.','Joe Dirt',10956,6.3255,5.7,'l3Ng784FblQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16062,_binary '\0','/iTkxwBriD9YKg4Q35qWEIlLXd6e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0245712',8,272992,'es','Amores perros','A fatalistic car crash in Mexico city sets off a chain of events in the lives of three people: a supermodel, a young man wanting to run off with his sister-in-law, and a homeless man.','/1lX74fPZsBoOyyE5fWL5xT7k9sV.jpg','2000-06-16',154,'Released','Love. Betrayal. Death.','Amores Perros',55,12.3445,7.646,'_P29GF_NbDc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16063,_binary '\0','/lZCDvCaCrnFK8EcX5TTmk72PzCy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0245803',5.5,53038,'en','Bulletproof Monk','A mysterious and immortal Tibetan kung fu master, who has spent the last 60 years traveling around the world protecting the ancient Scroll of the Ultimate, mentors a selfish street kid in the ancient intricacies of kung fu.','/kHWv16c4uDmiEujICSBdQ52TH55.jpg','2003-03-28',104,'Released','A power beyond measure requires a protector without equal.','Bulletproof Monk',11817,6.8808,5.5,'W6PjwmnDlMo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16064,_binary '\0','/dM4BrJCpcQvh5U8HqSE75Dxly5o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0245825',4.8,3969,'hi','Chal Mere Bhai','Vicky, a businessman, loves his younger brother Prem, who spends his time chasing women. The family feels that secretary Sapna will make a good wife for Vicky, but she is already in love with Prem.','/7eyv5NxoQFwFGYwi2je4ryayYWb.jpg','2000-05-04',136,'Released',NULL,'Chal Mere Bhai',161221,1.2368,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16065,_binary '\0','/3MjLpWQGIJj8YEtn8SRaui8zKir.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0245837',7.1,1912,'ko','춘향뎐','Once at a pagoda Mongryong Lee, a scion of a well-to-do family, meets Chunhyang, the young daughter of a courtesan and an aristocrat. Despite her low social standing she is smart and well-educated. The young people fall in love and think about marriage so that they could always be together. Mongryong is soon to go to the capital to take the state civil service exam. They part and in Chunhyang\'s life there appears the greedy and lustful Byun Hak-do, who tries to seduce her.','/eFrFFk33vPVYdR4VHFqqXQYabK1.jpg','2000-01-29',136,'Released','Her spirit became inspiration, Her name became legend.','Chunhyang',54986,1.8456,6.6,'s8_wYabfmJw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16066,_binary '\0','/AmN8ozRE0AbMGgZhqBu4fUjZkRt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0245844',7.7,161784,'en','The Count of Monte Cristo','Young sailor Edmond Dantès is wrongfully imprisoned, escapes, finds treasure, and reinvents himself as the wealthy Count of Monte Cristo to exact revenge on those who betrayed him.','/ifMgDAUXVQLY4DeOu3VTTi55jSP.jpg','2002-01-23',131,'Released','Prepare for adventure. Count on revenge.','The Count of Monte Cristo',11362,11.1808,7.7,'TsQnK5_5VSk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16067,_binary '\0','/51en001NJnZlZRcQZgaRKHuMpBA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0245891',5.7,1437,'en','Extreme Days','As four lifelong friends, Will, Bryan, Matt, and Corey, are on the road trip they\'ve been planning their whole lives, Corey\'s beloved grandfather unexpectedly dies. When going to claim Corey\'s inheritance, the gang meets Matt\'s beautiful cousin Jessie and embark on a hilarious, extreme sports-filled adventure.','/yZG7XdvaGHivmjZ5UKYl6zFuSd3.jpg','2001-09-28',93,'Released','Life\'s a trip......','Extreme Days',45864,1.3435,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16068,_binary '\0','/tCyfrw4XGbsAp9ssO20prHLzT6C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0245910',7.4,4590,'el','Φτηνά Τσιγάρα','As the lights flicker on a warm August night, amidst vacant Athens\' stillness, a modern bohemian flirts with a woman he just met at a phone booth, while strolling around the city\'s quiet night streets.','/3hgJukti4Is1aZJVgeYvzG27Cqc.jpg','2001-01-05',85,'Released',NULL,'Cheap Smokes',121652,0.5529,6.59,'HlKJbNYplEI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16069,_binary '\0','/epM1QllyysdMLI1G6BLP3Se80jC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0245929',8.2,9471,'zh','鬼子来了','During the Japanese occupation of China, two prisoners are dumped in a peasant\'s home in a small town. The owner is bullied into keeping the prisoners until the next New Year, at which time they will be collected. The village leaders convene to interrogate the prisoners. The townspeople then struggle to accommodate the prisoners. One is a bellicose Japanese nationalist, the other a nervous translator. Will the townspeople manage to keep the prisoners until the New Year?','/zpbyUenBJGhyA6RKa5RcQWGKOYb.jpg','2001-10-26',139,'Released','Comedy to carnage, in one remote village.','Devils on the Doorstep',25838,4.9587,8.2,'zA2xGrL_Y2s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16070,_binary '\0','/eGelHB3gfIPXFxgMUKIJQ2FVanN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0246119',7,1320,'ru','Свадьба','The beautiful Tanya returns to her small mining town, after supposedly working as a model in Moscow. She decides to marry her shy school sweetheart Mishka, who now works in the mine. The miners finally receive some pay, but Mishka still ends up with no money to buy his bride a gift, so he seeks the help of his perpetually drunk buddy Garkusha. Mishka\'s poor working-class family all help to put on a fine wedding with copious amounts of vodka, even though they are suspicious of Tanya\'s occupation in Moscow, and of her connection with her Mafia ex-boyfriend Borodin.','/zhOjTjPmuHcLnP1YkWNrJhheDf6.jpg','2000-05-14',114,'Released',NULL,'The Wedding',91520,1.3022,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16071,_binary '\0','/adVdIlj3YMGZIgOYRvqnplDgNa1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0246134',6.2,2402,'en','Lucky Break','Half-way through his 12-year prison sentence for an incompetent armed robbery, Jimmy Hands gets a lucky break: he\'s transferred to a prison from which he can probably escape. He convinces the governor to stage a musical in an old chapel next to the prison\'s outer wall. He rounds up volunteer actors and puts his escape plan into production. Two other barriers, besides the wall, confront him: the arrival of a nasty inmate, John Toombes, who insists on joining the escape, and Jimmy\'s feelings of attraction for Anabel, a social worker who agrees to appear in the play. Opening night approaches: is this Jimmy\'s breakout performance?','/63JHVXD2bkPBdIFgprqXKu3k8bw.jpg','2001-08-24',107,'Released',NULL,'Lucky Break',35944,1.9728,6.3,'NStGkCjDOBY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16072,_binary '\0','/gZET2df3Ietn2kYEBZ9X5cVPKxi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0246135',7.4,1737,'fr','Out 1','While two theater groups rehearse plays by Aeschylus, two solitary individuals wander the Parisian streets hustling the populace for cash.','/vcyr1IZOHtPriQkm0NP6oMXDeLS.jpg','1990-12-15',743,'Released',NULL,'Out 1',94528,1.4153,7.2,'CoLRNavAi_8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16073,_binary '\0','/4jauQUVs9zwpOJgTSlAgmfbVeRf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0246266',6.8,3056,'fa','تخته سياه','Itinerant Kurdish teachers, carrying blackboards on their backs, look for students in the hills and villages of Iran, near the Iraqi border during the Iran-Iraq war. Said falls in with a group of old men looking for their bombed-out village; he offers to guide them, and takes as his wife Halaleh, the clan\'s lone woman, a widow with a young son. Reeboir attaches himself to a dozen pre-teen boys weighed down by contraband they carry across the border; they\'re mules, always on the move. Said and Reeboir try to teach as their potential students keep walking. Danger is close; armed soldiers patrol the skies, the roads, and the border. Is there a role for a teacher? Is there hope?','/ApLKw8jjGTp7M4FbivX3mHXJ6da.jpg','2000-09-01',85,'Released',NULL,'Blackboards',28988,1.0146,6.7,'t4Mh0ZWL6Mk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16074,_binary '\0','/6JHA9BY7J9613DF9gdgin7ywY8S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0246404',6.4,3841,'en','The 24th Day','Tom and Dan\'s one-night stand turns into an intense power-play between captor and captive.','/ocNjvdbiStUk987OemlMfhtnI2k.jpg','2004-05-06',96,'Released','Your next lie may be your last.','The 24th Day',18165,2.2739,6.4,'OkKu8xox4P8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16075,_binary '\0','/zEeVLU2Y7zCWcEGvN7eO1gMLLXt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0246405',6.6,1600,'ka','27 Missing Kisses','A young woman\'s passion has a remarkable effect on a Russian village in this comedy-drama with fantasy elements. Sybill is a teenager who is sent to a small town in the country to spend the summer with her aunt. Despite her tender age, Sybill is ripe and sexually aware, and while the initial object of her attention is Alexander, a widower in his early 40s, she instead pairs up with Mickey, Alexander\'s teenage son. Mickey quickly becomes infatuated with Sybill and is more than happy to indulge her fondness for outdoor lovemaking. Between Sybill\'s carefree, youthful sensuality and the appearance of Emmanuelle at the local movie house, suddenly love and lust are in bloom all over town.','/sByH7a0Nt0WfJnBUcm8IcRE0UQ7.jpg','2000-10-26',95,'Released','A Hot Summer, A Broken Promise, A Tragic Comedy Love Story.','27 Missing Kisses',63607,1.6963,5.463,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16076,_binary '\0','/orI5mvpksYIlhJqzdmeipys6sHQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0246460',6.1,242531,'en','Die Another Day','James Bond is sent to investigate the connection between a North Korean terrorist and a diamond mogul, who is funding the development of an international space weapon.','/bZmGqOhMhaLn8AoFMvFDct4tbrL.jpg','2002-11-17',133,'Released','He\'s never been cooler.','Die Another Day',36669,15.537,5.999,'GTznf1x4khc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16077,_binary '\0','/jY6EdpztuCUPwWzlVHC2BW4K50r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0246464',6.4,23254,'en','Big Trouble','The story of how a mysterious suitcase brings together, and changes, the lives of a divorced dad, an unhappy housewife, two hitmen, a pair of street thugs, two love struck teens, two FBI men and a psychedelic toad. Based on Pulitzer Prize-winning humorist Dave Barry\'s best-selling first novel, \"Big Trouble.\"','/h844gBztdYMLrroUen6qbsomrGx.jpg','2002-04-05',85,'Released','They have forty-five minutes to save the world. They need forty-six.','Big Trouble',2185,5.8017,6.1,'os-iPdjKgMs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16078,_binary '\0','/4LJ9R6qTOlYxtx8bJg2iOCcAS19.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0246498',6.3,2462,'ja','漂流街 THE HAZARD CITY','Brazilian-Japanese gangster Mario rescues his Chinese girlfriend Kei as she\'s about to be deported from Japan. Desperate to escape, he hides in Tokyo\'s booming Japanese-Portuguese community and seeks passage from the country from a Russian mobster. To meet his price, they hold up a bigtime drug deal between the Chinese Mafia and the local Yakuza.','/2TajLnUCAWlAgl47qcmg28rAaZf.jpg','2000-09-15',102,'Released','Comes a story of love and violence spanning the globe.','The City of Lost Souls',36273,1.7595,6.196,'XttcmwItG-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16079,_binary '\0','/9d824Md86ERGEahIyavuAxEeFzR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0246500',6.3,5277,'en','Who Is Cletis Tout?','With a hitman’s gun aimed at him, Finch tells the story of how he broke out of jail, fell in love, and took the identity of a man wanted by the Mafia.','/udHRTgyZa1Fh2ryrUbInDviJl6T.jpg','2001-09-12',92,'Released','Getting the alias was half the battle. Surviving it is the other.','Who Is Cletis Tout?',33152,3.2057,5.9,'BfJse31_6cg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16080,_binary '\0','/tGt5ETwHMywbmq7Kp30bElC0fuS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0246544',4.8,15512,'en','The Musketeer','Young D\'Artagnan seeks to join the legendary musketeer brigade and avenge his father\'s death - but he finds that the musketeers have been disbanded.','/oaKp6HZQDTtCOwn4JGi2Mh7Ep95.jpg','2001-09-07',104,'Released','As you\'ve never seen it before.','The Musketeer',11370,6.2688,5.268,'gFnSmS-SUXQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16081,_binary '\0','/msCHK5Kh1YbdZ0zPJ2nzPUhhSN9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0246578',8,920275,'en','Donnie Darko','After narrowly escaping a bizarre accident, a troubled teenager is plagued by visions of a large bunny rabbit that manipulates him to commit a series of crimes.','/j2AtZFsflxiluaNtajMTI0Avm8C.jpg','2001-01-19',114,'Released','28 days, 6 hours, 42 minutes, 12 seconds... that is when the world will end.','Donnie Darko',141,15.9156,7.76,'71RaE7JYTUU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16082,_binary '\0','/9j4marPS1Rz543kA607BSZ9HGKm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0246592',6.6,7208,'en','Dummy','An ex-office worker becomes a ventriloquist, leading to a date with his unemployment counselor; but his quirky family and a gauche female friend may thwart his new career and love life.','/ii8h0p26vhp4G6x5Hw86ka3ys45.jpg','2002-09-12',91,'Released','Sometimes you need a little help finding yourself.','Dummy',17906,2.1725,5.9,'THPjGOjvBVw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16083,_binary '\0','/malautKSmlvT9gb1CZ1zkTKPYHE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0246628',6.7,3295,'en','Focus','In the waning months of World War II, a man and his wife are mistakenly identified as Jews by their anti-Semitic Brooklyn neighbors. Suddenly the victims of religious and racial persecution, they find themselves aligned with a local Jewish immigrant in a struggle for dignity and survival.','/x0VybfDiQ8U62kqdf4BzDebrCQV.jpg','2001-10-19',106,'Released','Everything is about to become very clear.','Focus',18192,1.79,6.5,'hNqrjzUhibc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16084,_binary '\0','/fZXukVAqNuVVPsxF886Ht91WBA9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0246674',6.9,1456,'ml','ഹരികൃഷ്ണ‍ന്‍സ്‌','When Guptan, a college lecturer, gets killed, the police suspect Gabriel to be the murderer. A girl takes help from her brothers, who are famous lawyers, in proving his innocence.','/aRwQ0lY9lESyKLwvvd5MkKt0B6G.jpg','1998-06-22',165,'Released',NULL,'Harikrishnans',269804,1.38,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16085,_binary '\0','/i2Qu0ZLOvNONkHZRuqxII9QkbTX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0246677',6.9,26031,'en','Heaven','A woman takes the law into her own hands after police ignore her pleas to arrest the man responsible for her husband\'s death, and finds herself not only under arrest for murder but falling in love with an officer.','/xPdtOuGtcQt655uRrmIdBkSRmVx.jpg','2002-02-06',96,'Released','When you take justice into your own hands, what are the consequences?','Heaven',10575,3.8438,6.478,'iwx-RkHjHbU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16086,_binary '\0','/hdmnRbJX7LAmxHn20GqTlX2qaCv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0246692',6.7,10220,'da','Gamle mænd i nye biler','The last wish of the dying \"Monk\" is for his foster child, Harald, to find his real son, Ludvig. But the latter is currently in a Swedish prison cell...','/n2KH5TlEcYPvinmwsJj4ULc1xDO.jpg','2002-07-12',95,'Released',NULL,'Old Men in New Cars: In China They Eat Dogs II',10751,1.999,6.8,'5ihCzPrsCeA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16087,_binary '\0','/eM1fjsRKGZXbGxqsYzk8XnFuzch.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0246729',6,6663,'hi','Khiladiyon Ka Khiladi','A man comes to America in order to find his brother who is wanted by the police. But his search forces him to get mixed up with a lady gangster that facilitates illegal underground fights.','/wFVvumuCAUovx7ZJTrZitqks7NO.jpg','1996-06-15',162,'Released',NULL,'Khiladiyon Ka Khiladi',230454,1.3512,5.429,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16088,_binary '\0','/6n1sWAEe4IMVPC6t9lgEHLC40zr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0246765',7.2,2240,'fr','Lumumba','The true story of the rise to power and brutal assassination of the formerly vilified and later redeemed leader of the independent Congo, Patrice Lumumba. Using newly discovered historical evidence, Haitian-born and later Congo-raised writer and director Raoul Peck renders an emotional and tautly woven account of the mail clerk and beer salesman with a flair for oratory and an uncompromising belief in the capacity of his homeland to build a prosperous nation independent of its former Belgian overlords. Lumumba emerges here as the heroic sacrificial lamb dubiously portrayed by the international media and led to slaughter by commercial and political interests in Belgium, the United States, the international community, and Lumumba\'s own administration; a true story of political intrigue and murder where political entities, captains of commerce, and the military dovetail in their quest for economic and political hegemony.','/evopdRBKjj85zttxMcrZ5xujaS8.jpg','2000-09-27',115,'Released',NULL,'Lumumba',55551,1.0088,6.8,'xRPYtkQon10','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16089,_binary '\0','/8o2RxrXLrfE9KnBA3Jgay7bAgF8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0246772',7.2,8910,'de','Bella Martha','Martha is a single woman who lives for one passion: cooking. The head chef at a chic restaurant, Martha has no time for anything - or anyone - else. But Martha\'s solitary life is shaken when a fateful accident brings her sister\'s eight-year-old daughter, Lina, to her doorstep.','/gnmIUzqZ8YW5i0QolN5P2dsiRT0.jpg','2001-09-09',106,'Released',NULL,'Mostly Martha',3640,2.3755,6.716,'q-jlmaYX2n0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16090,_binary '\0','/zRYuOiYZ8f1u726RtZBnU60LzgS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0246786',7.1,2101,'en','The Miracle Worker','Devoted teacher Anne Sullivan leads deaf, blind and mute Helen Keller out of solitude and helps integrate her into the world.','/A0PfwIMM7Mkit0ZoLzspgOWrmsQ.jpg','2000-11-12',95,'Released',NULL,'The Miracle Worker',1163,7.5953,7.2,'ISdHPEjNgl8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16091,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0246809',7.8,1979,'ml','ന്യൂ ഡൽഹി','A journalist is illegally jailed for exposing two corrupt politicians, He exacts revenge through his new mysterious newspaper.','/kLlqnlmYZHY8YxzQ4A1573uC0tW.jpg','1987-06-24',143,'Released',NULL,'New Delhi',277992,1.0975,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16092,_binary '\0','/7SItLONoMd5yiBUw4w5OUF3tN0d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0246834',5.9,2560,'en','The Other Me','When Will Browning is threatened with military summer school if he doesn\'t get better grades, he decides to do a science project that will definitely get an A. So he buys some Ocean Pups, unhatched sea creatures that will look spectacular, but he hasn\'t bargained for the cloning agent that the unscrupulous manufacturers have put in the kit. Next thing he knows there\'s another him.','/dA262duALaMG8CJcwnDZWQOa4RP.jpg','2000-09-08',90,'Released','Holy \'A\' in Science Class - I made myself clone!','The Other Me',39242,2.6363,5.6,'IVtewNNPfQE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16093,_binary '\0','/npuiLeBAjMF1PpJhLpwWqpt0I8M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0246875',6.7,2114,'en','Purely Belter','Gerry and Sewell are broke. Gerry\'s still at school and Sewell is unemployed. They both wish for better things in life. Owning two season tickets to their beloved football club is their biggest dream of all. The tickets cost £1000 - they\'re £1000 short. But they are nothing if not resourceful, and they set themselves a mission to raise the cash. While they think up increasingly outlandish money making schemes - from selling junk to shoplifting and the odd bit of housebreaking - real life begins to interfere with the pair\'s final scam going hilariously awry landing them in jail, only to discover that their punishment gets them exactly where they want to be!','/4fOyUtW8cosQZy4JnfzNyIlkR8I.jpg','2000-11-03',95,'Released','They\'re a couple of zeros short of a grand','Purely Belter',38294,1.2086,6.7,'a-XoZPzD-F8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16094,_binary '\0','/tjCAyz2Tu2xdZSFJrtU4fQrZ32A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0246894',3.2,29970,'en','Rollerball','In this fast action-packed thriller, Jonathan, Marcus, and Aurora compete in a dangerous, fierce sport called Rollerball. Although, Johnathan and Marcus try to quit, cruel and vindictive promoter Alexi Petrovich encourages them to still participate.','/5Wquo3EjfDpK7S1BHcybuC3TZDO.jpg','2002-02-08',98,'Released','Get in the game.','Rollerball',11535,4.4928,3.9,'uFWFEoK9Yz8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16095,_binary '\0','/A8xEhZSQAuJPih6S0uxd1yuohoq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0246905',6,1935,'hi','Saajan Chale Sasural','Naive villager Shyamsunder, who sings, comes to Bombay to try his luck with Bollywood and wealth. He ends up on the streets, playing for small alms. He meets with another musician, Muthu Swami, and both attempt to meet the owner of Tips Cassettes, Mr. Khurana, for an audition, in vain though. Then one day, Shyamsunder meets beautiful Divya, the only daughter of Mr. Khurana, and both fall in love with each other. Divya would like to marry Shyamsunder, and also further his career. What she does not know is that Shyamsunder loves another woman from his village by the name of Pooja, who he has promised to marry. Pooja arrives in the city, and with Divya already present there, Shyamsunder and Muthu Swami invent a look-alike of Shyamsunder, with hilarious results.','/hv9ro0IWbhqyTkSLxGU4aaQBamK.jpg','1996-04-11',134,'Released',NULL,'Saajan Chale Sasural',166871,1.1991,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16096,_binary '\0','/sCcWBZI794SiWjrnS3VWLmW11Kj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0246934',6.8,1467,'cs','Slunce, seno a pár facek','For a second time this film leads us to the village in South Bohemia. We meet again Konopnik family and Skopek family. Venca Konopnik is marrying Blazena Skopek but there is another woman Milada who is very jealous and she is spreading gossips about Venca Konopnik. Those gossips are so powerful that they lead to big fights between Konopnik and Skopek families. You will also see what a progress on milk-yielding-cows-project has been made.','/gDO1iiL4wanehAQVcyQx0sNlxt9.jpg','1989-07-01',128,'Released','This time, slaps will fly','Sun, Hay and a Couple of Slaps',36993,1.3554,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16097,_binary '\0','/eCtRseKCbltn8C6XW1GhqW0c4VA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0246989',5.3,20797,'en','Tomcats','College buddies chip in and promise that the group\'s last unmarried man will collect a cash pot. Seven years later, the kitty is worth $500,000 -- money Michael needs to pay a gambling debt. Problem is, the only other single guy is a hopeless womanizer!','/pAHD3TfoDJX6jCPVhICBNLBxnBH.jpg','2001-03-30',95,'Released','The Last Man Standing Gets The Kitty.','Tomcats',10646,3.8007,5.1,'40sg_DsrE5o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16098,_binary '\0','/jnJ4i6vPQETcfjxOvAODxzsdQfX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0247196',7.1,27446,'en','Before Night Falls','Spanning several decades, this powerful biopic offers a glimpse into the life of famed Cuban poet and novelist Reinaldo Arenas, an artist who was vilified for his homosexuality in Fidel Castro\'s Cuba.','/kb2dqj73cfmt6qHAh1ySIlVm6v0.jpg','2000-09-03',134,'Released',NULL,'Before Night Falls',5001,3.9159,6.651,'wEDGERJQiOE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16099,_binary '\0','/cDTDGNaF5zu4LYD4gZjkaZ8DjjY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0247199',7.1,44059,'en','The Believer','A hardcore US racist skinhead who, because of his intelligence, leads a gang dedicated to fighting the enemy: the supposed American-Jewish conspiracy for domination. However, he\'s hiding a secret: he\'s Jewish-born, a brilliant scholar whose questioning of the tenets of his faith has left him angry and confused, turning against those who he thinks have a tragic history of their own making.','/doe1zmrCRCSRkC3EdalFiUZhMxn.jpg','2001-08-23',98,'Released','He\'s a jew. He’s a Neo-Nazi. With one true enemy… Himself!','The Believer',4012,5.1187,6.9,'Zb--eD_XeBY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16100,_binary '\0','/qdAnQTyQ9TKALw5mcbCxIyrHwD8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0247254',5.1,2150,'en','The Code Conspiracy','A code that foretells the greatest prophecies of all time...Protected by the faith of one man.','/yCuoyvK1TpOQnMnrSqsdsHMoMQq.jpg','2002-04-10',97,'Released',NULL,'The Code Conspiracy',34192,1.3057,6.3,'_l8yYk0qXQc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16101,_binary '\0','/o1aZItEGLCy3ZERCqQC4yKV1Cqw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0247303',4.7,6050,'en','Down','After the elevators at a New York City skyscraper begin inexplicably malfunctioning, putting its passengers at risk, mechanic Mark Newman and reporter Jennifer Evans begin separate investigations. Newman gets resistance from superiors at his company, which manufactured the elevator, while additional elevator incidents cause several gruesome deaths. The police get involved and suspect that terrorists are responsible, but a far stranger explanation looms.','/jWPmTnu1zXZO3IFGIvNLQtjOkr7.jpg','2001-09-06',111,'Released','YOUR NEXT STOP... IS HELL.','Down',19058,3.6545,5.1,'9QrmPM5273g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16102,_binary '\0','/yvafnYvrxnwD3MrXcc18sUrkHqU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0247380',7.7,10358,'fr','Les Glaneurs et la Glaneuse','Varda focuses her eye on gleaners: those who scour already-reaped fields for the odd potato or turnip. Her investigation leads from forgotten corners of the French countryside to off-hours at the green markets of Paris, following those who insist on finding a use for that which society has cast off, whether out of necessity or activism.','/6IdCTKi4Eu7i897jpe59wIDGCri.jpg','2000-07-07',82,'Released',NULL,'The Gleaners and I',44379,2.4328,7.7,'XZF3VRGgxTU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16103,_binary '\0','/kwU5dgr0rRzz0jWK83HnSGiJr4f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0247394',7,1906,'hi','गुमनाम','Eight people are trapped on an island when their plane abandons them. They find a large mansion whose butler is expecting them. Then one by one, they begin to die...','/b8cRjiBC9BMX2zSfa32QtkmBouB.jpg','1965-02-06',151,'Released','And then there were none...','Gumnaam',82243,1.2089,6,'B3Ll1BAVS8w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16104,_binary '\0','/r73OdC9TpRIknIsVyGCd5SSwplO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0247425',7.4,44716,'en','In the Bedroom','Summertime on the coast of Maine, \"In the Bedroom\" centers on the inner dynamics of a family in transition. Matt Fowler is a doctor practicing in his native Maine and is married to New York born Ruth Fowler, a music teacher. His son is involved in a love affair with a local single mother. As the beauty of Maine\'s brief and fleeting summer comes to an end, these characters find themselves in the midst of unimaginable tragedy.','/IQj11YbraLDyPYaz79jtDoAscc.jpg','2001-11-23',131,'Released','A young man. An older woman. Her ex-husband. Things are about to explode...','In the Bedroom',1999,3.6313,6.93,'BaLtKJiBOrg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16105,_binary '\0','/chmTWdvet7wi2fqHZX58zLredPt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0247444',4.8,7651,'en','Juwanna Mann','A basketball star is booted out of the NBA when his on-court antics go too far, so he poses as a woman and joins the WUBA.','/1m5sbTbifesBhCrkE0gJncwMGXw.jpg','2002-06-21',91,'Released','The only way he can stay pro, is to play (like) a girl.','Juwanna Mann',35696,2.6988,5.1,'2_69TQPNIac','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16106,_binary '\0','/cNRVhZ2PFUnqaDNPZW7qbjxImbP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0247568',8.3,1858,'en','Nazi Concentration Camps','Produced and presented as evidence at the Nuremberg war crimes trial of Hermann Göring and twenty other Nazi leaders, this film consists primarily of dead and surviving prisoners and of facilities used to kill and torture during the World War II.','/ihhIITb37XmCPf6ST31fkToUjei.jpg','1945-11-29',59,'Released','August 28, 1945. This is an Official Documentary Report compiled from Films made by Military Photographers ordered by General Dwight H. Eisenhower, Supreme Commander.','Nazi Concentration Camps',207659,1.3173,7.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16107,_binary '\0','/e4tZvefBtA6P1T0vAPfeXG4Bj3r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0247586',7.9,63779,'es','Nueve reinas','Two con artists try to swindle a stamp collector by selling him a sheet of counterfeit rare stamps, the \"nine queens\".','/u2L4Foderu7SCPci5c3jsUfEJPP.jpg','2000-08-31',114,'Released','If you think you\'ve got it figured out... you\'ve been conned.','Nine Queens',18079,3.7687,7.8,'6svbO5QLzuc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16108,_binary '\0','/d9LNlmhjihHAAP1vKCQJo57JQFX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0247613',7.6,12939,'ko','박하사탕','In the spring of 1999, a group of old friends gather to celebrate their 20 year reunion. Among the group is Yeong-ho, a cold, unhappy man, whose demeanor puts a damper on the festivities. The seriousness of Yeong-ho\'s depression becomes apparent when he climbs a railroad bridge and looks like he might jump. At this crucial moment, memories of seven crucial episodes from Yeong-ho\'s past flood his mind.','/jPP0gFDgdXRa1YgP8Cn8arzOHI3.jpg','2000-01-01',131,'Released','A travel back in time to find a man\'s lost innocence.','Peppermint Candy',41245,4.1721,7.516,'PIuN3gfyGcY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16109,_binary '\0','/ktPixrzD9Rbet7Co4uUWxyR9191.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0247638',6.4,185973,'en','The Princess Diaries','A socially awkward but very bright 15-year-old girl being raised by a single mom discovers that she is the princess of a small European country because of the recent death of her long-absent father, who, unknown to her, was the crown prince of Genovia. She must make a choice between continuing the life of a San Francisco teen or stepping up to the throne.','/7axhsbEzFan6HQQ1aMOy7w3CFRx.jpg','2001-08-03',115,'Released','She rocks. She rules. She reigns.','The Princess Diaries',9880,20.3786,6.964,'2CkcwPi20ms','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16110,_binary '\0','/syJIWYB1L14wdIiiH9Q7pft4ga5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0247745',7,120545,'en','Super Troopers','Five bored, occasionally high and always ineffective Vermont state troopers must prove their worth to the governor or lose their jobs. After stumbling on a drug ring, they plan to make a bust, but a rival police force is out to steal the glory.','/yJyxPItcLNVfYr7idOphQTmQ9hK.jpg','2001-02-15',100,'Released','In their town, you don\'t screw with the law, the law screws with you.','Super Troopers',39939,10.9155,6.548,'KgHziCX4Kjc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16111,_binary '\0','/y5mSwh49BbbqIfAWuVbG0lYdUYq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0247911',3.2,3013,'hi','आप मुझे अच्छे लगने लगे','Sapna Dholakia desires nothing more than to be married to her love Rohit, but her conservative family and stubborn father will stop at nothing to make sure she marries the son of a friend of the family.','/hPGUJfuCHn02U8fepE9lrcfUfTO.jpg','2002-04-19',166,'Released',NULL,'Aap Mujhe Achche Lagne Lage',49518,1.3619,4.857,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16112,_binary '\0','/wpxuxWv50ZvuxbaKagdKtd6FjD9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0247944',5.1,1753,'hi','बादल','Badal is a victim of the 1984 riots, brought up by a terrorist. Badal aims to kill the treacherous police officer who had killed his parents and his loving sister. He takes shelter in the house of an honest police officer and falls in love with a minister\'s granddaughter. Will he be able to accomplish his revenge?','/lMMOhx1VTkf3TS5xnS1LisoRIHc.jpg','2000-02-11',173,'Released',NULL,'Badal',276846,1.6079,5.824,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16113,_binary '\0','/niFdUEVgRhk7823ORBIxvqPJIH9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0247945',7.3,2833,'te','బద్రి','Vennela accuses Badri of not loving her sincerely and challenges him that no one can love him like she does. However, their lives take a turn when he meets Sarayu and she falls madly in love with him.','/dlT10BkN6iyij65N3529xTeGSE6.jpg','2000-04-20',148,'Released','The Man in Love','Badri',80921,1.0462,6.156,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16114,_binary '\0','/bRAnOd3r6cwlqwN1Vyl4q28a4Le.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0247992',5.2,4289,'hi','दुल्हन हम ले जाएँगे','Sapna is raised by her three uncles, each one of them with a contrasting pursuit in life. She falls in love with Raja, who tries to impress each of her uncles in a different manner.','/xC05yY7nXCOMh31NvBQhHO4Qg4x.jpg','2000-03-20',141,'Released',NULL,'Dulhan Hum Le Jayenge',161223,1.643,5.455,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16115,_binary '\0','/cTJwZ4ZP5eI6D8FJEa821Z3NZxQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0248012',6,4807,'hi','फ़िज़ा','In 1993 Fiza\'s brother disappears during the riots in Mumbai. In 1999 Fiza is tired of waiting and goes looking for him.','/qS043WN2PK3tKljRyQKh8SXRHk5.jpg','2000-09-08',170,'Released','In Search of her brother','Fiza',56666,1.6735,5.905,'FnzRk7AKXOA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16116,_binary '\0','/6gm9lnVw768ILGA70Ie0oyS7HrG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0248036',7.3,1702,'no','Get Ready to Be Boyzvoiced','Norwegian mockumentary following the trials and tribulations of boyband Boyzvoice, their fans and management.','/notSp8OrXyIm9yjhPSyf3AfP5CD.jpg','2000-01-12',95,'Released','The True Story','Get Ready to Be Boyzvoiced',25696,1.3723,5.6,'zk9YLgZjsiI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16117,_binary '\0','/o6zffRCP8OKyG2QGoSnuQE0qJBZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0248103',6.9,2993,'de','Die innere Sicherheit','Clara and Hans are left-wing terrorists who have been sought by police for almost fifteen years. Their increasingly rebellious daughter Jeanne begins to pose a threat to their security when she falls in love with a boy she meets on the beach.','/wQoYYvXYaeZNsGPtP1vvvyTmuhF.jpg','2001-02-01',106,'Released',NULL,'The State I Am In',191,1.5211,6.8,'1SBpi-ZBFxc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16118,_binary '\0','/sPMBiyjTco4JdKojlfGIz5Wd0jC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0248126',7.5,63854,'hi','कभी ख़ुशी कभी ग़म','Years after his father disowns his adopted brother for marrying a woman of lower social standing, a young man goes on a mission to reunite his family.','/eJrD94E1msYEa0DygvkvdEKpChm.jpg','2001-12-14',209,'Released','It\'s all about loving your parents.','Kabhi Khushi Kabhie Gham',10757,5.2247,7.7,'7uY1JbWZKPA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16119,_binary '\0','/xLqA8gBY4RGlinv3PYEeNRjlfHw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0248185',6.6,8122,'hi','मिशन कश्मीर','A police officer adopts the son and sole survivor of a family he has massacred while pursuing a terrorist. After some time the foster son finds out what the stepfather did.','/tf2kw9HfzuowczsT7VDVR5KQxJH.jpg','2000-10-27',151,'Released','Two brave men battle each other... and paradise burns','Mission Kashmir',46406,1.7818,6.315,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16120,_binary '\0','/3NKNb8uDQ192oiTLN2Aq5rmmJzg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0248190',6,4761,'en','No Such Thing','A young journalist journeys to Iceland to find her missing fiancé only to encounter a mythical creature who longs to die.','/2RYZU5QTXISHqRKuTKMVTdpg9f5.jpg','2002-03-29',102,'Released','A modern day fable.','No Such Thing',29135,1.63,6,'SB-Qk7pVMsM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16121,_binary '\0','/lUK6pWQeamOVKeNGJJ6Q4Y9HzOU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0248216',4.9,3231,'hi','ना तुम जानो ना हम','Esha and Rahul start a letter based friendship that blossoms into love. They don\'t exchange names or pictures. Her parents would like Esha to marry Akshay who\'s eager to tie the knot, so Esha is forced to make a decision...','/cOIrm9WvMGvbliNZ88bK8hVYUc1.jpg','2002-05-10',159,'Released','Sometimes you just leave it to God...','Na Tum Jaano Na Hum',83902,1.335,5.125,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16122,_binary '\0','/myMyQm33NwyCcgLBSLDdd59py14.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0248379',6,1981,'de','Die Rothschilds','Biopic about the Rothschilds, a Jewish family whose members rose to the top of the European banking community during the Napoleonic era.','/fgLOKOE3fn19Px2CvgqdcYKljgL.jpg','1940-07-17',97,'Released',NULL,'The Rothschilds',277452,1.5056,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16123,_binary '\0','/cvxv0u07o3NWsiQX4LngJLejWJ7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0248408',6.7,23440,'de','Der Schuh des Manitu','Abahachi, Chief of the Apache Indians, and his blood brother Ranger maintain peace and justice in the Wild West. One day, Abahachi needs to take up a credit from the Shoshone Indians to finance his tribe\'s new saloon. Unfortunately Santa Maria, who sold the saloon, betrays Abahachi, takes the money and leaves. Soon, the Shoshones are on the warpath to get their money back, and Abahachi is forced to organize it quickly.','/5vliuDzm4Mxzsu25VefoLZZMQ7w.jpg','2001-07-11',85,'Released',NULL,'Manitou\'s Shoe',8366,4.8129,6.8,'cwvFpqyy_1s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16124,_binary '\0','/6uWsB0Py916Ham1SjJmL26U5XrU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0248409',6.4,3798,'de','Schule','The last three weeks of school life have begun: After the Abitur, Germany\'s leaving certificate, the friends and schoolmates of Gymnasium Kerkheim (Kerkheim High) will not see each other again so soon. It is a hard time for Markus and his girl Sandra from a lower grade, as he wants to hang out with his old friends, whereas she wants him to be there for her. It\'s an even harder time for Dirk, who is to be expelled from school if he fails the math exam that is coming up around midday, and it is the hardest time for Michael, who is a perfect pupil, but has no fun in life at all - and doesn\'t even know it yet. When Steven calls out a party to celebrate his letter of exemption from the army, they all get together for one of the last real cool events ever.','/qbGTIhLDCjnY6QvopLZ37DGvTdK.jpg','2000-12-07',99,'Released',NULL,'No More School',9565,1.9661,5.9,'7VwWDdt-afo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16125,_binary '\0','/aelAcajUDpxRaDPEU1X6wXG7vmU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0248547',8.3,5373,'te','తొలిప్రేమ','Balu falls in love with Anu who has come to her grandfather\'s house from the US. He even saves her life during an accident, but he is still not able to express his love to her.','/jx7BcuTXozA58uVXA3Em6142zfa.jpg','1998-07-24',136,'Released',NULL,'Tholi Prema',112846,1.0695,6.783,'FyLIKuWLaRo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16126,_binary '\0','/oMewPuhPxSA1qoGWGvUHipOfgMq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0248617',4.2,4098,'hi','यादें','When Ronit meets Isha, both are attracted to each other and fall in love. They want to surprise Ronit\'s parents and Raj, and they accordingly decide to share this news with Raj, only to find out that Raj has been actively involved in trying to get Ronit married to Monishka Rai.','/hCNl3EkwEAmuZt8vxq9gyGG3e7e.jpg','2001-07-27',193,'Released','Memories to cherish...','Yaadein',39837,1.6379,5.337,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16127,_binary '\0','/iTcADFqn39COatobIUezlMnRcNQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0248640',4.5,3845,'en','Hard Cash','Released from prison, an infamous thief and his new crew pull of a brilliant robbery but then become embroiled with a corrupt FBI agent when they discover the money is marked.','/4bRMUS1zhvN1EJcjc1PrVWsauvy.jpg','2002-02-15',98,'Released',NULL,'Hard Cash',21106,2.381,4.7,'JPUYHFlHA1Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16128,_binary '\0','/9nfSDkOTu7pOv0L9S4RlOqvvYSX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0248661',5.8,1419,'en','3 A.M.','The feature film directing debut of Spike Lee protege Lee Davis takes the viewer into the world of taxi drivers. Developed in the Sundance Laboratory, this film offers dove-tailing stories centering on the lives of individual taxi drivers as they reflect on and experience romance, politics, sociology, and spirituality.','/9QHNvh0pNpIgbHIofWHdtlHBdhQ.jpg','2001-07-01',88,'Released','Driving the night shift can be deadly.','3 A.M.',77084,1.855,5.8,'pEYvVNM7PWI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16129,_binary '\0','/sdWxVWhnJBiMq9N2ikfOmxeozKh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0248667',6.7,111049,'en','Ali','In 1964, a brash, new pro boxer, fresh from his Olympic gold medal victory, explodes onto the scene: Cassius Clay. Bold and outspoken, he cuts an entirely new image for African Americans in sport with his proud public self-confidence and his unapologetic belief that he is the greatest boxer of all time. Yet at the top of his game, both Ali\'s personal and professional lives face the ultimate test.','/32l3FaCzs8cXWps6hkgNJAcOsP.jpg','2001-12-10',157,'Released','Float like a butterfly and sting like a bee.','Ali',8489,6.8274,6.746,'Gej0ngCyHf4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16130,_binary '\0','/uY5EB9VIX8lT03MdYcR9DzlhEGM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0248845',7.7,38237,'en','Hedwig and the Angry Inch','Raised a boy in East Berlin, Hedwig undergoes a personal transformation in order to emigrate to the U.S., where she reinvents herself as an \'internationally ignored\' but divinely talented rock diva, inhabiting a \'beautiful gender of one\'.','/jafIFAW8sHQkzWPGoMDR4892dFI.jpg','2001-07-20',95,'Released','An anatomically incorrect rock odyssey.','Hedwig and the Angry Inch',13403,3.7769,7.447,'j9LxKv7ZkRo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16131,_binary '\0','/lFDx7wwrHqWEabJvAy5yPiHETZm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0248912',7.7,2080,'en','Into the Arms of Strangers: Stories of the Kindertransport','In the nine months prior to World War II, 10.000 innocent children left behind their families, their homes, their childhood, and took the journey... to Britain to escape the Nazi Holocaust.','/9vNRpMYT5H9L9UYf6Yq17isnQem.jpg','2000-09-15',122,'Released',NULL,'Into the Arms of Strangers: Stories of the Kindertransport',58062,1.8761,7.4,'J6asjV9r41s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16132,_binary '\0','/r59iYMNMXOp0G007g9RARqVo0w1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0249047',8.5,2834,'ml','നമുക്കു പാർക്കാൻ മുന്തിരിത്തോപ്പുകൾ','Solomon falls in love with Sofia, his new neighbor but then finds that her family life is difficult.','/iEFnNQThqLfKTS8jjZ3gaBIK32w.jpg','1986-07-15',137,'Released',NULL,'Namukku Parkkan Munthiri Thoppukal',243840,1.3785,7.225,'uRzuAF5n8sI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16133,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0249110',6.6,1448,'fi','Rentun ruusu','The life of Irwin Goodman, a Finnish singer.','/wXGhiJ73DhkH08xuTFv6j8Mx1xo.jpg','2001-01-12',103,'Released',NULL,'The Rose of the Rascal',32099,1.2154,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16134,_binary '\0','/sTxHcKpFDpK1miNSd6i9CUDYey0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0249131',6.2,1287,'fi','Rölli ja metsänhenki','Hairy and rowdy creatures called rolleys sail to a land inhabited by more peace-loving elves. When the rolleys arrive to the elf village, they scare the elves away and settle down in the village. One of the elves, Milli, a brave elf girl, returns to the village to make a peace with the rolleys. The rolleys do not warm to Milli\'s peace proposal, but she becomes friends with a rolley called Rölli. It becomes their mission to solve the conflict between the elves and the rolleys.','/v8bRR4s5i3qTgHyNDTONJmP5H6i.jpg','2001-12-21',92,'Released',NULL,'Rollo and the Spirit of the Woods',64029,0.8279,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16135,_binary '\0','/hEo94T3jCtAQMUBOedHHIWfj29G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0249188',8.6,5564,'ml','തൂവാനത്തുമ്പികൾ','Jayakrishnan falls in love with two girls, Radha (a villager) and Clara (a sex-worker), and fights his confusion about whom he should marry and spend his life with.','/oErJKCcv93enXavRSdQOLtcl3s.jpg','1987-01-03',151,'Released',NULL,'Thoovanathumbikal',210492,1.3217,7.259,'A1nDvpLQkoI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16136,_binary '\0','/pyCUjcPHZrMY125lWpWAxEexe7C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0249241',7.9,18439,'hu','Werckmeister harmóniák','A naive young man witnesses an escalation of violence in his small hometown following the arrival of a mysterious circus attraction.','/ix3pquGqTkCW86UbVTdRcrhGEFm.jpg','2001-02-01',139,'Released',NULL,'Werckmeister Harmonies',23160,5.4497,7.9,'-tJVdq_G_Go','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16137,_binary '\0','/pZ3jkKH9nCoEMxYsosmKOaHLQ4P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0249248',7.5,1772,'de','Julianes Sturz in den Dschungel','Werner Herzog returns to the South American jungle with Juliane Koepcke, the German woman who was the sole survivor of a plane crash there in 1971. They find the remains of the plane and recreate her journey out of the jungle.','/ru9fBYoWeovh7GdRJXQ4tyVMP4h.jpg','1999-10-20',65,'Released',NULL,'Wings of Hope',99657,1.592,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16138,_binary '\0','/nvbAJmfmLr4We0pSQPbjRDYvAOe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0249336',8.9,3594,'te','అహ నా పెళ్ళంట!','Krishna Murthy, the son of a rich industrialist, falls in love with Padma, the daughter of a greedy miser. To win her heart and teach her father a lesson, Krishna acts like a greedy miser.','/aKeZsdUDIhXddTrLzraNsrCHcxn.jpg','1987-11-27',147,'Released',NULL,'Aha Naa Pellanta!',37612,1.1537,7.675,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16139,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0249361',8.1,1954,'te','అన్నమయ్య','A cinematic version of the life of famous Indian saint-poet, Annamayya (born May 1408), follows the spiritual awakening of the mystic composer Annamayya, who\'s first motivated to write a song of praise after visiting a temple. His devotion is put to the test when he vows to fast until he comes face to face with God, an act of faith for which he\'s rewarded with a blessed meal of prasad. As his fame as a singer spreads, Annamayya eventually becomes a real personification of the holy Nandaka Sword.','/jmgzq8MWSMthVYE08H9bAKVTpu8.jpg','1997-05-22',150,'Released',NULL,'Annamayya',80798,1.5174,6.206,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16140,_binary '\0','/jyGiG4wcr0BHpqIXiep5MRCQ7Kz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0249371',6.4,16382,'hi','अशोक','A young Prince Asoka works to perfect his skills in battle and also deals with family conflict. During a struggle with one of his step-brothers, his mother urges Asoka to escape to stay alive. While away, Asoka meets Kaurwaki and falls in love, but must use his skills as a warrior to protect her. A dangerous and heartbreaking web of conspiracy follows, which leads Asoka to embrace a Buddhist path.','/ckFDMqLjhsYo2kH3X5auV1NnjPM.jpg','2001-09-13',175,'Released','Only the dead have seen the end of war','Aśoka',4435,2.4506,6.5,'y_zTqTW-npg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16141,_binary '\0','/tvH2BVDNDHkCs282vkTxtGQShzy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0249380',4.5,19733,'fr','Baise-moi','Nadine and Manu are two mad women, as tidy as can be, almost perfectionists. They have several things in common: extreme sex, drugs, beer and the trigger. They find the solution to their problems with guns and beware to those who dare to get in their way!','/zmkh7qyNIQmx2xi972WL39wzqOH.jpg','2000-06-28',77,'Released','Art or Pornography? You be the judge! Complete and Uncut the most controversial film of all time...A hard-core Thelma & Louise.','Baise-moi',3134,11.0963,4.8,'QrNhnhDN_gA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16142,_binary '\0','/urzflyf41uySpgciGHdQzpcaMOY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0249462',7.7,153774,'en','Billy Elliot','County Durham, England, 1984. The miners\' strike has started and the police have started coming up from Bethnal Green, starting a class war with the lower classes suffering. Caught in the middle of the conflict is 11-year old Billy Elliot, who, after leaving his boxing club for the day, stumbles upon a ballet class and finds out that he\'s naturally talented. He practices with his teacher Mrs. Wilkinson for an upcoming audition in Newcastle-upon Tyne for the royal Ballet school in London.','/mYtqgWCJiXpDeZwjVcC3OQGD8IR.jpg','2000-09-28',111,'Released','Inside every one of us is a special talent waiting to come out. The trick is finding it.','Billy Elliot',71,6.8513,7.6,'Im7n8HGOQMs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16143,_binary '\0','/uKwQGbxSQ3VWfVRJWeZ7sNQlBJ5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0249478',5.6,29930,'en','Domestic Disturbance','Frank Morrison is a divorced father with a 12-year-old son, Danny. His ex-wife Susan and son Danny now live with Rick Barnes, Susan\'s new husband. Danny, who has a reputation for telling lies, accuses his stepfather of committing a murder. Initially, no one believes his accusations, but then Frank becomes convinced and is the only one who believes him. Now, the father Danny trusts must protect him from the stepfather he fears.','/quRhjnXAuIn04VmgM84nmKzt79J.jpg','2001-10-28',89,'Released','He will do anything to protect his family.','Domestic Disturbance',11456,5.012,5.8,'NZo72VgUAik','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16144,_binary '\0','/t7zb6CnRQwhzQSq0apR4ESFYiWN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0249516',1.3,12797,'en','Foodfight!','The evil Brand X joins a supermarket that becomes a city after closing time.','/to9ggXVyhNTCICHcHMCtFtANd8P.jpg','2012-06-15',91,'Released','A story of when good food... goes bad!','Foodfight!',116977,3.6735,2,'81uIhu8qrrs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16145,_binary '\0','/deL3OnRZAlLyFDV5ACR1YX6btq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0249577',7.3,1793,'en','Here Comes Peter Cottontail','Peter Cottontail wants to be the #1 chief Easter Bunny, and everyone in April Valley agrees...except for Evil Irontail. Peter must deliver more eggs than this archrival to earn the top spot...and save Easter for children everywhere!','/85pOfm8QfOHCTud8D91sqXESFi6.jpg','1971-04-04',51,'Released',NULL,'Here Comes Peter Cottontail',47182,1.8288,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16146,_binary '\0','/uANZlyroNA1CygPGuQT98I8qECM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0249795',9,7048,'te','మాయాబజార్','Balarama promises Subhadra that he\'ll marry his daughter to her son. But when the Pandavas lose their kingdom to the Kauravas, Balarama breaks his promise.','/pJfpDHlmVgMgg0VNCufj9gIhnbU.jpg','1957-03-27',181,'Released',NULL,'Mayabazar',158023,1.402,8.109,'i3m27aET8ag','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16147,_binary '\0','/omhi3m7n6c4osm0zAMB2bBqmO1F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0249893',6.5,1843,'en','The Price of Milk','Lucinda lives a fairytale life with dairy farmer Rob, and his 117 cows. But after a freak car accident she decides to test Rob\'s love for her by trying to make him angry. He passes her tests until a quilt goes missing from their bed and the price of getting it back is high.','/cPbkNfGmCKOSbAVrLqcbYuKT5cE.jpg','2001-02-14',87,'Released','A man, a woman, and 117 cows.','The Price of Milk',21620,1.3914,5.6,'9CCws3v_ptI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16148,_binary '\0','/soFSQhZQL7eawOuRWDtV8tBSfUj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250067',7,4028,'en','The Trip','When 19-year-old gay-rights activist Tommy and 24-year-old Alan first meet in 1973, they find themselves on the opposite sides of the political coin...','/9eaNr0CYiEaofbw5MF5Nsr2MnOI.jpg','2002-11-01',95,'Released','The things we do for love and things we should have done','The Trip',15850,1.5963,6.2,'7nKExyTX3HI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16149,_binary '\0','/oYUOT1Ijrpy5cDcyNdlQw1sTfvY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250081',6.8,18989,'en','Storytelling','College and high school serve as the backdrop for two stories about dysfunction and personal turmoil.','/5hSpaT8x0LQy7G5TXb6vGWQrRSU.jpg','2001-11-21',87,'Released','Sex, race, celebrity, exploitation.','Storytelling',16550,3.4599,6.5,'eJGhPooHcfg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16150,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250122',7.3,1345,'hi','Yeshwant','After arresting a drug dealer during an undercover operation, police officer Yeshwant Lohar is framed for murder and imprisoned by his corrupt supervisor, Salim Shaikh, who is involved in distributing narcotics. Determined to prove her husband\'s innocence, wife Ragini resists Salim\'s attempts to intimidate or bribe her. Salim then releases false photos of Ragini having an affair with police officer Atul, shaking Yeshwant\'s faith in his wife.','/4vqNYrsEHp0m0T1S4GfUwud4Z1b.jpg','1997-02-07',145,'Released',NULL,'Yeshwant',370645,0.8689,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16151,_binary '\0','/aWFWZ9scvRFDhW4mHD9bghPdrK9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250125',7.2,1795,'fa','زیر پوست شهر','Tuba works daily at a grueling textile factory in Iran, returning home every night to deal with the rest of her problematic family, which includes: a pregnant daughter whose husband beats her regularly; a teenage son, who\'s been getting into trouble due to his burgeoning career in radical politics; and an older son who goes to great lengths--such as attempting to sell the family\'s meager house--in order to get an engineering job in Japan as a means of getting out of Iran.','/AgBIKR1gKI5BNKfGuPvQ793CPkj.jpg','2005-05-25',92,'Released',NULL,'Under the Skin of the City',44081,0.7862,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16152,_binary '\0','/dJxCfBDW1VuwNi0ZyiTgJcOgvNH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250202',6.4,5256,'en','All Over the Guy','A contemporary romantic comedy exploring the unlikely pairing of two 20-somethings thrown together by their respective best friends in hopes of igniting their own romance.','/tIO6jd2stGtM6pLvX8Jm85efw9Q.jpg','2001-08-10',95,'Released','4 friends, 2 couples. Twice as much to lie about in the morning.','All Over the Guy',21055,2.6057,5.8,'WqmooUqgJ9M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16153,_binary '\0','/2kpPVHLvkHfsc9uurzmEB1PoC6R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250223',6.7,63909,'fr','Astérix & Obélix : Mission Cléopâtre','History\'s favorite Gauls assist Queen Cleopatra when she wagers that the Egyptian people can build a palace for Julius Caesar in just three months.','/i4k9LPyy2j5d6m5bzDaZj0E7eR7.jpg','2002-01-30',108,'Released','The funniest film in ancient history!','Asterix & Obelix: Mission Cleopatra',2899,9.9614,7.4,'XlhihCd6qtw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16154,_binary '\0','/zbFG63ineDZdEHHyv7WwASRpOAM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250224',6.4,27825,'en','Crazy/Beautiful','At Pacific Palisades High, a poor Latino falls hard for a troubled girl from the affluent neighborhood.','/1kxn6w6lvKkrhmVxfVqI0cfBmLa.jpg','2001-06-29',99,'Released','When it\'s real. When it\'s right. Don\'t let anything stand in your way.','Crazy/Beautiful',10691,4.4338,6.6,'NuUiO85Xva0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16155,_binary '\0','/uxMcyp2U1SKpAK3gOMkBugCxn0X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250258',7.7,99214,'de','Das Experiment','20 volunteers agree to take part in a seemingly well-paid experiment advertised by the university. It is supposed to be about aggressive behavior in an artificial prison situation. A journalist senses a story behind the ad and smuggles himself in among the test subjects. They are randomly divided into prisoners and guards. What seems like a game at the beginning soon turns into bloody seriousness.','/mfxXel8k2UWkgJ4MIsvVBsqnvFp.jpg','2001-03-08',120,'Released','You are invited to participate','The Experiment',575,5.2365,7.4,'MG_xQs9_MGQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16156,_binary '\0','/53nJUF7glpXU235vOVO9CMxKNRG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250274',6.3,5372,'en','The Brothers','This is the story of four African-American \"yuppies\" (a banker, a doctor, a lawyer, and a \"playboy\") who call themselves \"The Brothers\". When the playboy gets engaged, the other three friends find themselves having to come to terms with their own issues of commitment and honesty...','/342I0mOBCNTzx4ls4GvIagfzu2m.jpg','2001-03-23',106,'Released','There is nothing like a good woman to make a brother want to be a man.','The Brothers',20322,1.9921,6.6,'X0_ttpqt6nc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16157,_binary '\0','/ppkPKckjePdzEXhlyj6h1Wv848.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250292',6,4590,'en','Cheats','While other kids buy into countless hours of studying just so they can get a mark in some teacher\'s report book, Handsome Davis sees it as nothing more than a system of control over your mind. That\'s why Handsome and his three best friends Sammy, Victor and the cribsheet genius Applebee have banded together and found ways to cheat on their tests all through their school years.','/fHvZndfliyf7TNTu1civhu4Lq8L.jpg','2002-10-31',86,'Released','Where there\'s a will there\'s an \"A\"','Cheats',16875,1.9169,5.4,'pOFp8-LwWPM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16158,_binary '\0','/3kOMMRwf9AEdQ2STIb4tjcsRx9w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250310',4.8,14274,'en','Corky Romano','Corky Romano is a bumbling, simpleton, veterinarian and the youngest, outcast son of an aging gangster, named Pops Romano, who calls upon Corky to infiltrate the local FBI and retrieve and destroy evidence being used to incriminate Pops for racketeering charges.','/aLgzSIgHTyWggrP7ieDVYE3PB8g.jpg','2001-10-12',86,'Released','Undercover and Out The Way!','Corky Romano',17708,4.5527,4.5,'-LlHmJ3xqHM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16159,_binary '\0','/970o9Snv0Nttpr15DaZVZYYr2LH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250323',6.5,12547,'en','The Deep End','With her husband Jack perpetually away at work, Margaret Hall raises her children virtually alone. Her teenage son is testing the waters of the adult world, and early one morning she wakes to find the dead body of his gay lover on the beach of their rural lakeside home. What would you do? What is rational and what do you do to protect your child? How far do you go and when do you stop?','/sWRTQpTb65Itp4bdNas3W4a1QHy.jpg','2001-01-21',101,'Released','How far would you go to protect your family?','The Deep End',24936,3.3806,6.1,'1BgxNWvx36c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16160,_binary '\0','/5ec2l5M4i0KnvRVHZWx5wobhm2d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250347',5.7,4145,'en','Double Whammy','Ray Pluto has many problems. He is satirized in the tabloids as the \"loser cop.\" His partner is starting to seem suspiciously attracted to him. A pair of screenwriters across the hall keep bugging him for help. The superintendent of his building is stabbed by hoodlums hired by his own rebellious daughter. To top it off, a sexually aggressive chiropractor may just be Ray\'s undoing.','/AvyjEU4VEhAtnOxjC9NaTtiPXlZ.jpg','2001-10-17',93,'Released','A comedy about a detective with everything... but a clue.','Double Whammy',14390,3.0029,5.5,'OIoDsEEKtm8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16161,_binary '\0','/eYRVyA4oBRNkrT4kAqPS7xiiZHc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250371',6.3,5163,'en','The Other Side of Heaven','John H. Groberg, a middle class kid from Idaho Falls, crosses the Pacific to become a Mormon missionary in the remote and exotic Tongan island kingdom during the 1950\'s. He leaves behind a loving family and the true love of his life, Jean. Through letters and musings across the miles, John shares his humbling and sometimes hilarious adventures with \"the girl back home\", and her letters buoy up his spirits in difficult times. John must struggle to overcome language barriers, physical hardship and deep-rooted suspicion to earn the trust and love of the Tongan people he has come to serve. Throughout his adventure-filled three years on the islands, he discovers friends and wisdom in the most unlikely places. John H. Groberg\'s Tongan odyssey will change his life forever.','/1jHSJULA0nEDfVeewlLvppsjve8.jpg','2001-04-12',113,'Released','An Epic Journey.','The Other Side of Heaven',16651,3.2132,6.3,'5dKsHYzIoUI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16162,_binary '\0','/A5PkMdiD7CBT2Ov3fxcerRevMgm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250415',5.2,5375,'hi','हर दिल जो प्यार करेगा','Jahnvi’s best friend Pooja attempts suicide when her boyfriend jilts her. Raj, a struggling singer, saves Pooja but she still goes into a coma and Raj gets stuck into caring for her. Upon recovery, Pooja falls for Raj, but he is in love with Jahnvi.','/66CpsF2lrolmsHI2BgZH16Cb7EB.jpg','2000-08-04',168,'Released','Love can happen... anytime','Har Dil Jo Pyar Karega',157800,1.5668,5.531,'eUTwR8Zvjac','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16163,_binary '\0','/6ROn5ZSUCFvDkksHnZAkcW4UzTP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250425',7.4,1666,'en','Holiday Heart','After losing his police officer lover, Christian drag queen Holiday Heart meets 12-year-old Niki and her drug-addicted mother, Wanda. Heart finds relief from heartache and a renewed sense of purpose when he steps in as a father figure to Niki and welcomes the two women into his life. But when Wanda becomes romantically involved with her drug dealer, Silas, it may endanger Niki and threaten to destroy the makeshift family.','/rAh8a5dSYMBlmFiuYSo7O1ywJnE.jpg','2000-12-10',96,'Released','He\'ll do anything in his power... to keep them together.','Holiday Heart',57450,1.9494,7.1,'4Q5uyoE0Hm4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16164,_binary '\0','/uh5AivSZ21EwMTAKhY9IYwMFDlO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250440',8.1,4456,'en','Daria in \'Is It Fall Yet?\'','Daria is a 16-year-old girl who is a little too smart and funny to fit in with the crowd. It’s summertime and the livin\' is hard. Daria finds herself forced into volunteering at the OK To Cry Corral, a summer camp for the overly sensitive and those who\'d like to be.','/KCRALQVraaSSfK9STb7lrnbwmS.jpg','2000-08-27',75,'Released',NULL,'Daria in \'Is It Fall Yet?\'',44756,2.2615,7.3,'wQrH5qDZQg0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16165,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250452',5.1,1479,'hi','Joru ka Ghulam','Dhaneshwar Pitamber, has four daughters. All the four daughters are not ready to marry, each one having their own reason. The daughters always play mischievous tricks on the one coming with a proposal of marriage, and their gang leader is the youngest daughter Durga. Kader Khan is so desperate to get his daughters married that he is ready to give a dowry of five crores to each son-in-law. Raja and Kanahaiya are small time con men at the airport. Raju Patel is an NRI from America who comes to India to get married to one of the daughters of Dhaneshwar.','/lqukWizp1euDvBjfx7FNFsQt5sp.jpg','2000-06-15',162,'Released',NULL,'Joru ka Ghulam',232696,1.0716,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16166,_binary '\0','/jcFJzhUp3seSyBJbYvwmf8VATBK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250468',5.4,21011,'en','Killing Me Softly','A woman grows suspicious of her controlling husband after she discovers secrets about the women in his past.','/pgfFJw7mqAmJdZizrJ6oOK0ejOZ.jpg','2002-05-10',100,'Released','How do you escape… what you can\'t resist?','Killing Me Softly',14365,4.8968,5.6,'0--GfkfHlWA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16167,_binary '\0','/g7J9ca14gehBg3fBhCPOJPCDhfB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250478',6.6,6482,'es','Krámpack','While his parents are away for the summer, 16-year-old Dani invites his best friend, the irrepressible Nico, to stay for the holidays. Jealously rears its head when Nico appears more interested in the local girls than in Dani. Hot summer nights and too many joints lead to experimentation which neither boy can talk about, a situation complicated by the appearance of the older and openly gay Julián, a published writer and old friend of Dani’s father.','/iw5BLbL1rSmya9I6puP1q5dUn81.jpg','2000-05-18',91,'Released','Two boys… and the summer that would change everything','Nico and Dani',12806,1.9032,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16168,_binary '\0','/zoXbkvFC2ANw72FvfeZOdHv3vPc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250483',5.8,2503,'hi','Kya Kehna','Priya, a young college girl faces hardships and challenges after she becomes pregnant before marriage.','/xk8PvgLZkL33tBP1jh9WqZHN3ae.jpg','2000-05-18',155,'Released',NULL,'Kya Kehna',165573,1.3101,5.739,'NvTD2FXJIu0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16169,_binary '\0','/23rdBoAg6vO9ToCQ6VL3Z9dbJBd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250491',6.7,2434,'en','Late Night Shopping','Four friends Sean, Vincent, Lenny and Jody find themselves at something of a deadend. Trapped in a twilight world of permanent night shift work, they hang out together in the local cafe, drinking coffee and entertaining themselves by observing Vincent\'s unwavering success in pulling women. There seems to be little prospect of change...until Vincent accidentally sleeps with Sean\'s girlfriend.','/3aRREJVPJFQGCv2PqNeeANnspjk.jpg','2001-06-22',88,'Released','Let\'s Not Go To Work','Late Night Shopping',18088,2.3342,6.4,'2akHzDTQhi0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16170,_binary '\0','/viU23X3BIycUFf6TOlm9c7TxLgM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250494',6.5,293284,'en','Legally Blonde','Fashionable sorority queen Elle Woods has it all, but, she wants nothing more than to be Mrs. Warner Huntington III. But he dumps her before heading to Harvard Law School. Elle rallies all of her resources and gets into Harvard, determined to win him back. While there, she figures out that there is more to herself than just good looks.','/9ohlMrJHQqKhfUKh7Zr3JQqHNLZ.jpg','2001-07-13',96,'Released','Boldly going where no blonde has gone.','Legally Blonde',8835,19.9202,6.816,'vWOHwI_FgAo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16171,_binary '\0','/oJe5xph6PxARGmEAYpuf06fFw45.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250593',5.8,5897,'en','Mom\'s Got a Date with a Vampire','The Hansen kids are in a jam. Adam and his best friend Duffy have gotten their hands on some tickets for the Headless Horseman concert, and his sister Chelsea has a date with her dreamy boyfriend Peter. The only problem is they\'re both grounded. Chelsea and Adam will do whatever it takes to get their mom Lynette out of the house, even if it includes a chance meeting with a very mysterious man. Everything seems to go according to plan until their little brother Taylor realizes that this stranger might be a vampire.','/2c7oXpT7y0Rtwko7vm73zWKyLUn.jpg','2000-10-13',85,'Released','They aren\'t the only ones dying to get their mom out on a date.','Mom\'s Got a Date with a Vampire',92208,4.4449,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16172,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250617',5.7,1243,'en','Night at the Golden Eagle','Two elderly criminals spend their final night in Los Angeles, California at the Golden Eagle Hotel prior to their departure to Las Vegas, Nevada, to lead a life without crime. Unfortunately, on the hottest night of the summer, these two ex-criminals seemingly get caught in the malice of prostitutes, pimps, drunken bums, fighting monkeys, and young runaways.','/mWDwuXdDZBk2VB5sfYEr0Wf0oGW.jpg','2002-05-17',87,'Released',NULL,'Night at the Golden Eagle',55249,1.6641,4.8,'ZEWjFW2g8a0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16173,_binary '\0','/xVRhmVxW189omnEjW8LzRX4vBB2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250638',7,5933,'cn','PTU','Follows a police tactical unit during one dangerous night on the streets of Hong Kong as they try to recover a cop\'s stolen gun. Things turn deadly when they run into a web of gangland crimes.','/sTpoWAe5Dx8MNlTOo4t4OXDwoX8.jpg','2003-04-17',88,'Released','Into the Perilous Night...','PTU',25536,2.3319,7,'jmrJSJ9jyVI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16174,_binary '\0','/vian6RN3bC4QdBQzY1wTmBkhxVQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250687',6.5,131781,'en','Rat Race','In an ensemble film about easy money, greed, manipulation and bad driving, a Las Vegas casino tycoon entertains his wealthiest high rollers -- a group that will bet on anything -- by pitting six ordinary people against each other in a wild dash for $2 million jammed into a locker hundreds of miles away. The tycoon and his wealthy friends monitor each racer\'s every move to keep track of their favorites. The only rule in this race is that there are no rules.','/8ghNCfFbCJjcNSz2K5jOC3eO6ZD.jpg','2001-08-17',112,'Released','563 miles. 9 people. $2 million. 1001 problems!','Rat Race',9896,5.6899,6.293,'OY2S_kY2KWU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16175,_binary '\0','/pMjCTJJlyuiSlOWdoqGHjilMhRT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250690',5.2,2259,'hi','रिफ्यूजी','An unnamed young man helps illegal refugees from India and Pakistan cross the border through the Great Rann of Kutch.','/gr8xmJPVUzNRpoIijXco6FMUjbK.jpg','2000-06-30',210,'Released','A human story','Refugee',166231,3.1911,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16176,_binary '\0','/2HBbMRoh87XjlmyA7LQ1IStePvP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250698',4.8,2338,'en','Ritual','An American doctor encounters members of a voodoo cult when she is summoned to Jamaica to treat a wealthy man\'s brother.','/bq2jYd777zT3ymSDIaXslc0mzw0.jpg','2002-09-18',111,'Released','Older than Bones. Darker than Blood. Stronger than Science.','Ritual',41235,2.095,4.723,'7aEUOE53lgY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16177,_binary '\0','/7CYcy9eZZdhgBzaHGPH73hrjcNr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250720',5.4,10208,'en','See Spot Run','A drug sniffing agent canine is a target for an assassin boss so the FBI calls Witness Protection to send him somewhere else. Meanwhile a single Mom puts her 6 year old boy James in the care of her irresponsible, mailman, neighbor, Gordon, when the babysitter bails on her. Meanwhile, an assassin mob boss hires 2 goons to kill Agent 11. But when 11 escapes from the van when they tried to kill him, he hides in Gordon\'s Mailtruck that James is in too. And guess what they name him. Spot.','/29iKqRGRcNqhrT710ohxVq5WwcE.jpg','2001-03-02',94,'Released','The Smart One Isn\'t Wearing Any Pants.','See Spot Run',39180,3.64,6.1,'dZTkoS6LxPk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16178,_binary '\0','/6MKjlvPFH2YDOU43WDcwdxGmvYJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250754',5.7,1895,'en','Stepsister from Planet Weird','Megan\'s world is turned upside down when she hears her calm life with her little brother and single mum is about to change. She hears she\'s soon to have a stepfather and a stepsister. Megan thinks they\'re a bit weird and is determined to stop the wedding. She discovers they\'re actually even stranger than she thought - they\'re from another planet.','/ui3XjIVDZn740k7hPOh5gJmFsME.jpg','2000-06-17',85,'Released',NULL,'Stepsister from Planet Weird',70773,2.4537,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16179,_binary '\0','/egVj5Y9f79xPnyAQJmeDR0Uwow3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250797',6.7,108779,'en','Unfaithful','A New York suburban couple\'s marriage goes dangerously awry when the wife indulges in an adulterous fling.','/bjiHEhuiwhIygzjczbTPAA07cGc.jpg','2002-05-10',124,'Released','Where do you go when you\'ve gone too far?','Unfaithful',2251,18.418,6.7,'EfptM8xKyUI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16180,_binary '\0','/l8fZIjnAR5rzK70ruatTyucFrFx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250798',7.2,5423,'en','Uprising','In the Warsaw ghetto in 1943, Jews rise against the Nazis.','/2Sl2XSNE4qW9rJ7zB80wqLxPfWf.jpg','2001-11-04',177,'Released','They did the one thing the Nazis never expected. They fought back.','Uprising',31010,3.3738,6.5,'OoCU2gd_2b0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16181,_binary '\0','/cT3grVcsGHCfZGATDl7ifXkaoiG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250809',6.8,4496,'es','La virgen de los sicarios','World-weary author Fernando has returned to his native Colombia to live out his days in peace. But Fernando\'s once-quiet hometown has become a hotbed of violence, drugs, and corruption. On the brink of despair, Fernando meets Alexis, a beautiful but hardened street kid who lives by the rule of the gun. Together, they forge an unlikely relationship.','/q5jT6BBCIWIysr712UIZY7BOGje.jpg','2000-09-20',101,'Released',NULL,'Our Lady of the Assassins',44321,2.0457,7.2,'FO7bAqsJnKc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16182,_binary '\0','/sppsVNrv69QXloyYUWG7Dohmn4H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250934',7.7,17577,'en','61*','In 1961, Roger Maris and Mickey Mantle played for the New York Yankees. One, Mantle, was universally loved, while the other, Maris, was universally hated. Both men started off with a bang, and both were nearing Babe Ruth\'s 60 home run record. Which man would reach it?','/hAbxkPCC8pWYZy4kcftS3H3oku7.jpg','2001-04-28',129,'Released','Why did America have room in its heart for only one hero?','61*',20536,3.2245,7,'1po8PgfJU_Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16183,_binary '\0','/xgRAavMKNdVUQrzG4ODTCvRD3oJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0250990',2,1271,'en','The Bogus Witch Project','In 1994, three filmmakers went into the woods to film a documentary about the legendary Blair Witch. They disappeared and have never been found… But the film grossed a lot of money. How come? We don\'t know... In 2000, three more filmmakers went into the woods to find out what happened to the three unfortunate filmmakers... They also disappeared... But what did all these people do? A collection of short films by filmmakers searching for their \"Witch\" in an attempt to imitate the 1999 blockbuster.','/v5joJaXXii5yLt4b1Fd9TFztPhY.jpg','2000-10-10',85,'Released','They\'re about to get lost in the woods... Again!','The Bogus Witch Project',128862,2.0686,3.2,'8seeLoreZEQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16184,_binary '\0','/vSAtqIdjJmoPjTkOZoV8X2f70nw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0251031',6.5,6808,'en','Series 7','A reality TV program selects six contestants to participate in a free-for-all, no holds barred deathmatch, where they must skillfully outwit and kill each other in order to be the last person alive.','/85tuJxQdjQcec3DTMc9dxwlYYfi.jpg','2001-01-20',87,'Released','Real People in Real Danger!','Series 7',19513,3.0996,6.3,'oKM5Qq-ZuLM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16185,_binary '\0','/vu03gJO1Xn1mC7QvG39puoXFfTl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0251052',6.7,3924,'en','The Discovery of Heaven','Disappointed with humanity, God wants to revoke his contract with humanity and wants to take back the stone tablets containing the ten commandments. To this end an angel is sent out to affect the personal lives of three humans so an appropriate child may be conceived.','/posrSb1UQBfsoPb9U68vWqbGMOb.jpg','2001-10-01',127,'Released','Coincidence doesn\'t exist, everything happens for a reason.','The Discovery of Heaven',1373,2.153,6.6,'yxmqGA7XaO4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16186,_binary '\0','/uQVXQ7VI0jbLDo5QwGGyLQUd1so.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0251075',6.1,143091,'en','Evolution','A comedy that follows the chaos that ensues when a meteor hits the Earth carrying alien life forms that give new meaning to the term \"survival of the fittest.\" David Duchovny, Orlando Jones, Seann William Scott, and Julianne Moore are the only people standing between the aliens and world domination... which could be bad news for the Earth.','/dwIrP544LxJtXToLpzkEa08pIMm.jpg','2001-06-08',102,'Released','Coming to wipe that silly smile off your planet.','Evolution',9397,9.8028,6.1,'NCRrGp5bkjY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16187,_binary '\0','/b75tBJu4IOyzPfLNsoIDENd9U0E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0251110',6.7,2068,'en','Gypsy 83','Two young misfits head for New York City to celebrate their idol and muse, Stevie Nicks, at The Night of 1,000 Stevies. Along the road, in order for them to escape their painful pasts, they must discover their strengths and learn self-acceptance.','/tGokj0bZyMLaUA96sdjfHRFjraJ.jpg','2001-10-18',94,'Released','Some of us were never meant to fit in.','Gypsy 83',33343,1.4812,6.5,'g0mYZZWHiCk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16188,_binary '\0','/nKWbbDyUSJDZfygnd5uy6RWxsEr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0251114',6.4,58201,'en','Hart\'s War','When Col. William McNamara is stripped of his freedom in a German POW camp, he\'s determined to keep on fighting even from behind enemy lines. Enlisting the help of a young lieutenant in a brilliant plot against his captors, McNamara risks everything on a mission to free his men and change the outcome of the war.','/yRUhSU7vzs5ePa72LNPcKKCCMZ5.jpg','2002-02-15',125,'Released','Beyond courage, beyond honor.','Hart\'s War',10592,5.7976,6.371,'TcRuFgqFLrA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16189,_binary '\0','/cdYj6HFpKp5NTmLiHHbNEGSmDT4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0251127',6.6,330442,'en','How to Lose a Guy in 10 Days','It\'s the battle of wills, as Andie needs to prove she can dump a guy in 10 days, whereas Ben needs to prove he can win a girl in 10 days. Now, the clock is ticking—and the wildly entertaining comedy smash is off and running in this irresistible tale of sex, lies and outrageous romantic fireworks!','/2dlftyPz7mTYbrsPvTogyFmYd7d.jpg','2003-02-07',116,'Released','One of them is lying. So is the other.','How to Lose a Guy in 10 Days',9919,15.0423,6.87,'2ZMGk_Ml1fc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16190,_binary '\0','/9fZriiKFvp589TlBIRgg68we6ny.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0251141',7.1,2073,'en','Innocence','After more than forty years apart, Andreas and Claire embark on an affair as reckless and intense as when they were young lovers. Widowed musician Andreas decides to get back in touch with his one great love, Claire, who is still married to her first husband, John. Andreas and Claire find that the connection they shared when they were young is still there and they soon become involved in a rekindled love affair.','/pXr2zYUFkxqXQ9UG4W3S1VrUzMM.jpg','2000-09-08',94,'Released','Remember to love, surrender to love, and vow to never, never forget','Innocence',125707,0.9759,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16191,_binary '\0','/sBB39VMtByFltGGGW2c5N6LOAvj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0251160',7.1,156314,'en','John Q','John Quincy Archibald is a father and husband whose son is diagnosed with an enlarged heart and then finds out he cannot receive a transplant because HMO insurance will not cover it. Therefore, he decides to take a hospital full of patients hostage until the hospital puts his son\'s name on the donor\'s list.','/xEE91LvXiqgs7Hmdl44LCzHtFf6.jpg','2002-02-15',116,'Released','Give a father no options and you leave him no choice.','John Q',8470,8.7227,7.163,'-29JK-UA4E0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16192,_binary '\0','/9NzFDoXbV65KZu9BocAoNBkxQaq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0251174',4.5,1898,'en','Kevin of the North','A man must participate in the Iditarod dog race across Alaska to inherit property from his legendary grandfather, but ends up getting much more than he bargained for.','/gw1CJY7i2mYtPIr4uDwTv5jjEQl.jpg','2001-12-19',86,'Released',NULL,'Chilly Dogs',31910,2.323,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16193,_binary '\0','/tvJkMs2bRc9GVRsSz5Mx5FKhfpD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0251282',8.1,5384,'en','A Muppet Family Christmas','Fozzie Bear surprises his mother on Christmas Eve by bringing the entire Muppet gang to her farm to celebrate the holidays. Doc and his dog Sprocket, who had planned a quiet Christmas, end up joining the Muppets in their holiday activities and preparations. The Sesame Street and Fraggle Rock regulars join the festivities, but to Kermit\'s dismay, the only one missing is Miss Piggy, who has been caught in a snowstorm.','/k2t9NMMWRABHvb00ogcA7HjJw2I.jpg','1987-12-16',47,'Released','It\'s a merry Muppet Christmas with Fozzie and friends!','A Muppet Family Christmas',13247,2.4844,6.9,'O6r6fU3kI_4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16194,_binary '\0','/pXHZR1QssA19PDUlyweoAxNujbQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0251355',8.6,4468,'kn','ಪುಷ್ಪಕ ವಿಮಾನ','An unemployed man, who dreams of living it large, finds a rich man drunk and lying in the sewer. Things take a turn when he imprisons him and takes his identity to get a taste of his lifestyle.','/azTpDHh87L89TtEsj77bWnV08Ew.jpg','1987-11-17',131,'Released','A golden movie on the silver screen','Pushpaka Vimana',36810,1.5248,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16195,_binary '\0','/ArbsS6ycHOyCBb5MZdQrhx3wF3w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0251382',5.4,2411,'en','Santa Who?','Santa Claus develops amnesia after accidentally falling out of his sleigh and only the innocence of a small child can save him. Meanwhile, Santa has to battle the disbelief of a newsman.','/5qOwQ76sVubcbvS0CcD4gp1rJzI.jpg','2000-12-03',92,'Released','All he wants for Christmas is his memory back.','Santa Who?',42332,2.1668,5.5,'QOTcDw0cSpo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16196,_binary '\0','/8UJN9Ksfwy3jCASZ5lNzRBvw9fu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0251415',6.7,1595,'en','Stickmen','Jack, Thomas and Wayne are the Stickmen. They like nothing more than having a beer in one hand, a pool cue in the other, a coin on the table and a sexy bird or two. They play pub pool for fun and money at Dave\'s bar. Desperate to get out of debt, Dave gets the Stickmen entered into a high stakes pool tournament run by vicious crime boss \"Daddy\". He also gets them into a whole rack of trouble.','/ienPkHKjnKMW94JZRAfhpHGrcIe.jpg','2001-01-18',98,'Released',NULL,'Stickmen',14416,1.0774,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16197,_binary '\0','/k6RUUIiJDVn6Rs1jmenk0uNUwaY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0251433',6.7,5363,'cn','順流逆流','A streetwise young man becomes a bodyguard to score quick cash. He befriends a disillusioned mercenary determined to begin life anew. They find themselves working together to foil an assassination attempt, but their partnership ultimately can\'t last.','/ywm95TI4eZUNrQwXOEamn2diVD6.jpg','2000-10-19',113,'Released','Trust is fatal.','Time and Tide',49291,2.8303,6.5,'g0KN6NOJcJ4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16198,_binary '\0','/9Xx300Bgsg8vR5meHN0sN8hc1ke.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0251447',7.7,6590,'de','Der Tunnel','Inspired by true events, Olympic swimmer Harry Melchior defects from East Germany in the 1960s and hatches a daring plot to help his sister and others flee East Berlin through a 145-yard underground tunnel.','/teLjI0tmEytPJvP1uQWg0PTGa4A.jpg','2001-01-21',150,'Released',NULL,'The Tunnel',3577,2.4073,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16199,_binary '\0','/vqoAvefKxBAg4xqbXwLDBG7QVyq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0251640',7.8,2095,'en','Pee-wee\'s Playhouse Christmas Special','Pee-wee Herman and pals are celebrating Christmas in the Playhouse in their own creative ways: Pee-wee makes a list for Santa Claus 1.5 miles long, teaches Little Richard how to ice skate, goes for a sleigh ride with Magic Johnson, enslaves Frankie Avalon and Annette Funicello into making Christmas cards, receives a long phone call from Dinah Shore, even has more musical fun with k.d. lang, the Del Rubio Triplettes and Charo! Finally, Big Red arrives and announces that Pee-wee\'s Christmas list was so big, he didn\'t have enough presents for all the children of the world. Will Pee-wee follow his own advice and help others?','/aTgwm9t1z7PIOGa06lGY6ITlh3i.jpg','1988-12-21',49,'Released','If you love Christmas then why don\'t you merry it?','Pee-wee\'s Playhouse Christmas Special',49041,2.5297,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16200,_binary '\0','/1dZsVMqV9RtzTTBspjDy98AVCKe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0251661',6.6,1301,'el','Δεκαπενταύγουστος','Middle August in Athens. Three families, living in a three storey building, leave for their summer vacations. Everyone is wishing for a miracle to happen this summer. In the meantime, a drifter breaks into their apartments and rummages their personal belongings, thus unfolding hidden secrets.','/3OM1QOxMYBZS27KVZ6ngoxYSCin.jpg','2002-10-13',106,'Released',NULL,'One Day in August',47844,1.1459,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16201,_binary '\0','/jweRMLxgXqzfh12ILnTcmVz3Iix.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0251736',6,101226,'en','House of 1000 Corpses','Two teenage couples traveling across the backwoods of Texas searching for urban legends of serial killers end up as prisoners of a bizarre and sadistic backwater family of serial killers.','/29c2qgXmSREosLBevOILEuMWzQC.jpg','2003-04-11',89,'Released','The most shocking tale of carnage ever seen.','House of 1000 Corpses',2662,9.0441,6.2,'xbRRD-cD7h4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16202,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0251756',6.1,1388,'hi','Jungle','A couple is kidnapped and held for ransom until one of the kidnappers\' associates is released from custody.','/vVUohFu3aCIc1xjAajJUx81x5cb.jpg','2000-07-14',162,'Released','It Took His Love...','Jungle',166255,1.1779,6.182,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16203,_binary '\0','/mkMbdJxiHLx4Wxrc39o5h4lKfVe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0251777',7,1859,'es','Km. 0','Located in Madrid\'s Plaza del Sol, Km. 0 is the point from which all distances in Spain are measured from the capital. In Km. 0, it is also the meeting point for a gallery of characters. Bored, affluent housewife Marga meets up with gigolo Miguel, who co-habitates with gay Benjamin. Sergio, a soon-to-be-married office clerk who can\'t wait to lose his virginity, makes the acquaintance of prostitute Tatiana, while gay dancer Bruno meets Maximo. Meanwhile, wannabe director Pedro arranges to meet up with Silvia, an actress who wants to work in musicals directed by Gerardo, and bartender Mario is caught between Amor, who wants to marry him, and her little sister Roma, who is truly in love with him.','/nRLrKXWZdMBkP2SMi4iDxA3W6pT.jpg','2000-06-30',108,'Released','One hot day. Fourteen people. Countless possibilities.','Km. 0',40947,1.008,6.4,'GTr9LClZ-Uc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16204,_binary '\0','/kREtb7FbkZ533iECSinvUZ5Oyjs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0251806',4.8,6386,'en','Long Time Dead','A group of British students embark on summoning spirits on a Ouija board after a night of clubbing. But someone breaks the link before they have finished and now a demon is trapped in their world and the only way to banish it, is for all the people who summoned it to die.','/d2t90uhX9AYzAMX7Xzo2x7Tefpx.jpg','2002-01-18',94,'Released','Play It To Death','Long Time Dead',27259,3.6311,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16205,_binary '\0','/7aRm8GSxrPhJK671kVADYgmJy7w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252028',5.5,30814,'en','Surviving Christmas','Wealthy executive Drew Latham has no close relationships and becomes nostalgic for his childhood home as Christmas approaches. When he visits the house and finds another family living there, he offers the residents a large sum of money to pretend they are his parents.','/8jHtvFpCOOqp2U2qwI3L3h10cUv.jpg','2004-09-21',91,'Released','This year, Christmas comes early. Really early.','Surviving Christmas',15566,3.9669,5.729,'JUu_iG2IboI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16206,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252052',7.7,2012,'en','An American Reunion','The reality of life slams into the proverbial wall when a group of necessitous best friends and ex-lovers are reunited at a milestone reunion, igniting an already passionate and combustible past.',NULL,'2003-01-01',93,'Released',NULL,'An American Reunion',384199,1.2643,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16207,_binary '\0','/l5sD0AK286fBpXyDHRCbtaFMArN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252076',5.4,103311,'en','Maid in Manhattan','Marisa Ventura is a struggling single mom who works at a posh Manhattan hotel and dreams of a better life for her and her young son. One fateful day, hotel guest and senatorial candidate Christopher Marshall meets Marisa and mistakes her for a wealthy socialite. After an enchanting evening together, the two fall madly in love. But when Marisa\'s true identity is revealed, issues of class and social status threaten to separate them. Can two people from very different worlds overcome their differences and live happily ever after?','/gnEuTYH3jhHxl80QyoPfZjEYd0J.jpg','2002-12-13',105,'Released','...love checks in.','Maid in Manhattan',7303,7.9921,6.1,'7r_1rDfQfrg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16208,_binary '\0','/7326mzCqRT34F1M2o6u0jASgKGF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252084',7.9,3744,'tr','Vesikalı Yarim','Halil the greengrocer goes to a nightclub with his friends one day to break the monotony of his life. There he meets Sabiha, one of the women working at the club. They fall in love at first sight and begin living together. While Sabiha is making plans for the future with Halil, she learns a truth about him that she didn\'t know, and the forbidden love that began at the nightclub turns into a dead end filled with lies.','/d4KqrE0ryPlBPRgqn4vKnNz0COz.jpg','1968-05-25',89,'Released','Love is not enough. We should have met a long time ago.','My Prostitute Love',257261,0.8918,7.7,'PaTYIpXcr60','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16209,_binary '\0','/4F2iDN1D1we3W8ydXnoCuvz73Zr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252189',6.2,1557,'tr','Abuk Sabuk Bir Film','A misunderstood villager seeks remedy to protect his late father\'s settlement in post-modern times, when all of his wicked and proud neighbors lay a snare under each other. The villager soon finds himself trapped in a sociopathic crisis.','/eWDBpnA7oYorx7Yj7HOdXcm62yo.jpg','1990-04-27',94,'Released',NULL,'Abuk Sabuk Bir Film',483192,1.363,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16210,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252196',8.4,3753,'te','Aditya 369','In a series of events involving a stolen diamond, Krishna and Hema get caught in a time machine and travel through the centuries, encountering historical figures and exploring futuristic worlds.','/c2hMK5jAZYsEiiGIkeVtx7AeOK4.jpg','1991-08-18',140,'Released',NULL,'Aditya 369',280363,1.053,7.479,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16211,_binary '\0','/swvQ5EItkvwQPRFG9uXWGpDx8jR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252223',4.8,2768,'en','All the Queen\'s Men','A mismatched team of British Special Services agents led by an American must infiltrate, in disguise, a female-run Enigma factory in Berlin and bring back the decoding device that will end the war.','/oU5qvvUCj1DTCk2kKKTPQDIx7nd.jpg','2001-10-14',99,'Released','War is a Drag','All the Queen\'s Men',31668,2.0526,5,'YsaYkXdeMb8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16212,_binary '\0','/yeykFgwJcrHKVBGu50zeM6dkVfr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252245',7.6,5911,'tr','Atla Gel Şaban','Niyazi is a humble factory worker whose life is turned upside down when he wins the “altılı ganyan” (six-horse accumulator) lottery. Suddenly, everyone from neighbours to total strangers, claiming to be his long-lost relatives, crowds around him hoping for a share of his fortune. Thanks to his quick wit, Niyazi manages to outsmart these opportunists and keep his winnings.','/A8AO47pfYfxK1LaZ6hftntjx7Jg.jpg','1984-01-01',83,'Released',NULL,'Atla Gel Şaban',52285,1.1057,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16213,_binary '\0','/hWbDeXUhXLLqjn9f8SLBcATsI5C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252249',6.9,5013,'tr','Avanak Apti','Apti is a simple minded village man and he believes what is happening around him by chance is actually his doing. He becomes famous by beating a feared man and everyone starts to respect him than he meets a singer and an action-love story starts.','/SrqLRBam6DyjMpLVRdRtBgxueP.jpg','1978-10-01',86,'Released',NULL,'Apdi The Gullıble',148697,0.9544,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16214,_binary '\0','/tHnNMufc0zc61mR9uOZUTvALtup.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252269',7.6,7273,'tr','Bekçiler Kralı','The story of a guard who revolts because of exploiting reeve and tradespeople. People start to think he has an uncle working in the ministry of the interior.','/ndJmGQYyuSkoMl1KKjkT2OphwsP.jpg','1979-11-01',82,'Released',NULL,'King of The Guards',80838,0.8085,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16215,_binary '\0','/kGBv5ZjKRorL3JdBGzOHa7BO2Gi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252277',5.1,3423,'hi','बिच्छू','A contract killer with a tragic past trains a young woman to avenge the murder of her family and falls for her in the process.','/xMAyftiTGHsIIh3Vlx2rK67pKbi.jpg','2000-07-07',162,'Released',NULL,'Bichhoo',232496,1.527,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16216,_binary '\0','/fBdvq9KvdYBr7UNAlgfsm72Md4P.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252294',6.2,1265,'tr','Boynu Bükük Küheylan','With his 2 wives Kuheylan started as a doorkeeper in an apartment after immigrating from small town to city. While Kuheylan was dreaming to be rich, his wives got impressed under city culture and joined their forses agains their husband.','/9RuFycVwJVCQ4GkYHGEziJRk8SM.jpg','1990-01-01',85,'Released',NULL,'Boynu Bükük Küheylan',80840,1.0445,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16217,_binary '\0','/7Pw5NOv7aUtmHyh1yASEldOlAz0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252299',6.7,26490,'en','Buffalo Soldiers','A criminal subculture operates among U.S. soldiers stationed in West Germany just before the fall of the Berlin wall.','/qNl4T8xxC0xDeX8JFJVCBzH4Kg8.jpg','2002-10-31',98,'Released','War is hell... but peace is f*#!%!! boring.','Buffalo Soldiers',9104,3.8658,6.304,'iXI_qQeWlLY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16218,_binary '\0','/aJZJ93NNAPPbnOYA9F3RB9iLHa3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252360',7.1,3886,'tr','Davacı','It is a comedy of stubborn people who initiate a judicial process which would last 7 years because some sheep ate a few cabbages.','/aYQ8iROTDsIMAYXubrjPgUZfLMT.jpg','1987-01-01',79,'Released',NULL,'The Plaintiff',186572,0.6824,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16219,_binary '\0','/lijnOHPnF4MPbWErKG0VnPVjSfV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252361',8,10097,'tr','Davaro','Memo returns from Germany to get married with his love but his fathers killer Sulo is being released from jail. As a village rule he has to get revenge for his fahter or he can not get married but he doesn\'t want to kill so they stage a fake death with Sulo and after that his luck runs out.','/6ccohyzPylTYLOgaSC067TcPhZx.jpg','1981-11-09',94,'Released',NULL,'Davaro',31607,2.3403,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16220,_binary '\0','/t91VXq6tI3yDR3lBQQ7QAxaakrm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252364',7.3,4313,'tr','Deli Deli Küpeli','Two schizophrenic patients escape from a mental asylum supposing they were mistakenly quarantined. When they arrive at a country village, the villagers assume one is a sheriff and the other is a local magistrate.','/wRR6xrLGvlhi6M7n8pmMNSc4eRd.jpg','1986-03-01',87,'Released',NULL,'Deli Deli Küpeli',436055,1.4174,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16221,_binary '\0','/5k5E9SR7skxKXqcLuprUlIz5rbj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252375',6.8,2912,'tr','Devlet Kuşu','This is one of the tragicomic films of Kemal Sunal who is most \"serious-comic\" artist of the Turkish cinema. This film also reflects socio-economic and cultural life of the 70\'s-80\'s Turkiye. The film obviously talk to Turkish audience but who wonder that era of Turkiye can taste of it. The film underlines of love, friendship and -richness in the poorness- and also is a story about the people who prefers love, instead of money and fortune. The theme and narration may include some populist elements -like most Kemal Sunal films- but generally tells its story as well. The story is familiar to Turkish audience: A young man loves young girl. In most Turkish love films one of the partners is rich or poor according to the other but in this movie both sides are poor and they have many difficulties to reach happy end. In my opinion, these kind of movies always gives hope to people to get over it.','/j7fgxTJRYUJdb4orEOBX35IiKsS.jpg','1980-09-01',79,'Released',NULL,'Windfall',126986,0.816,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16222,_binary '\0','/8XC9pHHRPSpjVmAX6qBMogRV3tU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252388',6.9,4681,'tr','Doktor Civanım','Kemal writes a letter to his mother telling her that he is a doctor. His mother is so happy that she spreads the news throughout the village. When the girls in the village learn that Kemal is returning to the village, they do everything they can to win him over. However, Kemal falls in love with Sümbül, the daughter of Ruşen Ağa. The discovery that Kemal is not a doctor will put this love in jeopardy.','/ZUMnXDpGACSPiIExbeeOjd4C9g.jpg','1983-02-01',83,'Released',NULL,'Doktor Civanım',361064,0.774,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16223,_binary '\0','/m8qHcTwTtxb66v1fJ2PfK2FTrie.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252389',7.2,4486,'tr','Dokunmayın Şabanıma','Şaban is a minibus driver who is unsuccessful with women, while Ökkeş is a complete womanizer. Ökkeş and Şaban, two old army buddies, cross paths one day in prison. Ökkeş, who is being forced by his father to marry, asks Şaban to take his place, and they switch roles. However, when both of them fall in love with the daughter of the house they go to, things get complicated. The girl they are in love with has switched places with the housekeeper...','/wBME2NcIqRCSvDI99sW7mOQ6ZX3.jpg','1979-03-01',79,'Released',NULL,'Dokunmayın Şabanıma',190459,0.8549,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16224,_binary '\0','/lk98qoDh0BMnWRwqB07v1GORfIn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252405',7.3,3429,'tr','Düttürü Dünya','Living in an Ankara shantytown, Mehmet plays the clarinet at a nightclub to support his family. When their home is sold to a contractor by his brother-in-law, the gap between Mehmet’s dreams and reality significantly grows.','/vgS7rtdYMyOCkArO6OU4kufpGFQ.jpg','1988-09-02',91,'Released',NULL,'Queer World',436061,0.7062,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16225,_binary '\0','/esVaU8LiHjBFUtWzAfzVPrdMV3s.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252414',6.7,3515,'tr','En Büyük Şaban','A good man trys to help a blind girl to see again but he doesn\'t have enough money for the operation.','/lWuG9STXfqoqVQTrjkkYNROhe8r.jpg','1983-02-21',93,'Released',NULL,'En Büyük Şaban',236041,0.9067,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16226,_binary '\0','/aV7oXRhFeeTNIJKKgQ1yVPzYIlc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252437',7,2974,'tr','Filler ve Çimen','Elephants and Grass (Turkish: Filler ve Çimen) is a 2001 Turkish drama film, written and directed by Derviş Zaim, about six different stories that merge into a common theme. The film, which went on nationwide general release across Turkey on January 5, 2001, won awards at film festivals in Antalya and Istanbul, including the Golden Orange Behlül Dal Jury Special Award.','/dGA1sgokdShE2fx063RD3R35tvL.jpg','2000-10-22',115,'Released',NULL,'Elephants and Grass',232357,0.9495,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16227,_binary '\0','/2g0ilrxS3JpzSeLSyRQywPo0BjU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252444',7.4,31831,'en','Rabbit-Proof Fence','In 1931, three Aboriginal girls escape after being plucked from their homes to be trained as domestic staff, and set off on a trek across the Outback.','/vs8ATIRGEEYpcByrNtJ1WyI3LeD.jpg','2002-02-04',94,'Released','Follow your heart, follow the fence','Rabbit-Proof Fence',9555,3.0749,7.002,'Lbnk8wSVMaM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16228,_binary '\0','/kjfUZzO7vPvaXMOfGCiqPKi5Mbb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252465',7.1,4937,'tr','Garip','Kemal is a young man who does all kinds of work to make ends meet and is passionate about football. The young man who makes his living from the hardest, one day finds a baby abandoned on the side of the road. Kemal, who adopted the orphaned baby, raises and takes care of the girl like the baby\'s father.','/beRuuXKvZPXDQtV8GugVcHKQ2li.jpg','1986-10-28',96,'Released',NULL,'Poor',299508,0.861,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16229,_binary '\0','/5ID4LwQbqplYCmxR1bOraLIYuRT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252468',7.1,3639,'tr','Gerzek Şaban','People mistake a naive extra for his lookalike gangster and cause funny events.','/n2ccx4fqrQmqn7kx80yHL0KWztU.jpg','1980-11-01',76,'Released',NULL,'Idiot Saban',123599,1.0141,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16230,_binary '\0','/mbkRfz30Ywyck2dWrjOlNmxXgVw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252480',7,12214,'en','The Grey Zone','The story of Auschwitz\'s twelfth Sonderkommando — one of the thirteen consecutive \"Special Squads\" of Jewish prisoners placed by the Nazis in the excruciating moral dilemma of assisting in the extermination of fellow Jews in exchange for a few more months of life.','/8jRsWnpciWHRy0MC7K5eMDKKqPw.jpg','2001-09-13',108,'Released','The story you\'ve never seen.','The Grey Zone',15192,5.0542,6.6,'uGlfF3tDtaQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16231,_binary '\0','/ojqNpimiCSk09SUKNmO1aLTeUzL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252485',6.5,3904,'tr','Gurbetçi Şaban','Şaban is a poor man. In Germany, where Şaban went as a worker, tragicomic events happen.','/qDpSZIdw1MhvA3dXXt2rChhB6Kv.jpg','1985-10-01',87,'Released',NULL,'Expat Şaban',395902,0.8604,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16232,_binary '\0','/heJbSoXkN86gkk8Wo6QJ8zFwoQb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252486',6.9,4678,'tr','Gülen Adam','Yusuf Şaplak is a seemingly ordinary man who has a condition where he can\'t stop laughing. An idealist young doctor decides to cure him.','/qaZYQ09lciVxlOcbIKCTHLZTnGs.jpg','1989-01-26',91,'Released',NULL,'The Laughing Man',452929,0.9263,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16233,_binary '\0','/9u9XcPaeOvPcelm8RmMarEgvIAk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252487',9.1,46753,'tr','Hababam Sınıfı','A group of affluent private school slackers enjoy a prankster lifestyle until a tough new disciplinarian headmaster arrives.','/t2xLuEeZhy4uyiWIFT9D4mmyEA8.jpg','1975-04-01',85,'Released',NULL,'The Chaos Class',83651,2.7628,7.994,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16234,_binary '\0','/9sVMciEvGTc6wOTD0hi5regoyxZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252488',8.4,31485,'tr','Hababam Sınıfı Sınıfta Kaldı','A young and beautiful female teacher starts working in an all boys high school.','/zMfsVXGxJy2xh0FwUWcZ1XXDZus.jpg','1976-01-01',91,'Released',NULL,'The Chaos Class Failed the Class',31534,1.973,7.654,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16235,_binary '\0','/mV351zRmHJVXJFqyAZXNnB1BzCh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252489',8.6,20511,'tr','Hababam Sınıfı Tatilde','Lazy, uneducated male students mostly coming from money, share a very close band. They live together in the dormitory of this private highschool, where they daily plan their latest pranks on teachers or the other classes. Because of the financial crisis, the headmaster agrees to enroll female students. As the new students try to fit in, a struggle between both parties start, trying to prank the other part away. The prank war continues until PE-Teacher decides to take the class out on a trip for a becoming scouts.','/fJCB6RL59Jx0opaRfNaLmdSUAHp.jpg','1977-02-01',97,'Released',NULL,'The Chaos Class Is on Vacation',31402,1.2612,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16236,_binary '\0','/hMvW0SzAXCTQcrtAZCiW8mHsBlW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252490',8.7,22662,'tr','Hababam Sınıfı Uyanıyor','A sincere and hardworking student joins the Chaos Class, but acceptance seems unlikely when he becomes the target of their pranks.','/s6ysusBx8oBrbMXQEfD3leMmMHZ.jpg','1976-11-20',94,'Released',NULL,'The Chaos Class Is Waking Up',31408,1.637,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16237,_binary '\0','/wnfDEUSIRGGiKoMUOqzDPdlldOZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252496',6.3,4914,'tr','Hanzo','Hanzo, who was lost as a baby and raised by bears in the wild forest, behaving like them, is captured one day by a group that comes to the village for excavation.','/3r3lKxO16uCOktLRiEhLilOSVEW.jpg','1975-12-08',77,'Released',NULL,'Hanzo',101217,0.7336,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16238,_binary '\0','/fTodCkbbvvq6GjSDi5c2MEzO7hv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252501',6.9,43749,'en','Hearts in Atlantis','A widowed mother and her son change when a mysterious stranger enters their lives.','/qPTEh8vutS5FSCDoR16MWVGHqTm.jpg','2001-09-28',101,'Released','What if one of life\'s great mysteries moved in upstairs?','Hearts in Atlantis',11313,4.98,6.778,'l8yfW7LHYbk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16239,_binary '\0','/1acmRn1cnPnavQGQCrIJOERd6vX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252503',6.5,41594,'en','Heist','Joe Moore has a job he loves. He\'s a thief. His job goes sour when he gets caught on security camera tape. His fence, Bergman, reneges on the money he\'s owed, and his wife may be betraying him with the fence\'s young lieutenant. Moore and his partner, Bobby Blane, and their utility man, Pinky Pincus, find themselves broke, betrayed, and blackmailed. Moore is forced to commit his crew to do one last big job.','/xrwwSXFeW35wYsnobreXbGxHwUC.jpg','2001-11-09',107,'Released','It isn\'t love that makes the world go round.','Heist',11088,5.0261,6.324,'Yjmy0TcpDtA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16240,_binary '\0','/1lK70PohM5UgYn9zlNXxgb50IyN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252562',6.1,4355,'tr','Japon İşi','Veysel loves a singer named Basak. But she doesn’t love him back. One day Veysel saves the life of a Japanese tourist. Later, the tourist sends a gift to Veysel from Japan. The gift is a robot that looks exactly like the singer he loves, Basak.','/7GhL8QC62T54jrz6S92y8psAsph.jpg','1987-11-29',89,'Released',NULL,'Japanese Connection',236053,1.0005,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16241,_binary '\0','/fsfV5wl3GagBtpxHmH3Tyw0uc3J.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252589',7.1,3788,'tr','Kanlı Nigar',NULL,'/hOZpJweaLVT7Twhz91KqEeaoWGe.jpg','1981-12-01',81,'Released',NULL,'Kanlı Nigar',74160,1.8888,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16242,_binary '\0','/cLhWpwLekJhU0jMg5YSkELzmM2V.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252591',8.3,15149,'tr','Kapıcılar Kralı','Seyit, a resourceful doorman of a middle class apartment in Istanbul, finds himself in a struggle for power when the new superintendent decides to crack down on his slack attitude.','/s55cw0ZNAsAU4o8FnEPwJqfjLR0.jpg','1977-05-01',84,'Released',NULL,'King of the Doormen',69610,1.2194,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16243,_binary '\0','/xEQlWoAO11P4GfrogC3y30W9rwX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252592',6.5,4721,'tr','Katma Değer Şaban','Şaban returns to Istanbul from Germany to solve a fraud crime that was framed on his father. But the people who meet him at the airport see Şaban as a punk and think that he can\'t help them…','/sdmuzbcfXCtYHtONuefcxF5LQ34.jpg','1985-09-11',85,'Released',NULL,'Katma Değer Şaban',74162,0.9014,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16244,_binary '\0','/bBCxKQvxPwR6z1iuD09Hs3NiwpR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252596',6.5,1954,'tr','Keriz','Zülfü and Zülfiye get married. However, Abbas, Zülfü\'s uncle, who is trying to take over Zülfü\'s property, tries to separate the couple. Abbas spreads rumors about Zülfiye. He incites Zülfü to kill his wife. Eventually, Zülfiye secretly moves to Istanbul with her family. Zülfü goes to Istanbul to kill Zülfiye, influenced by his uncle\'s persuasion. However, when a mine is discovered on Zülfiye\'s father\'s land, all plans will change.','/6CX6Za52zETO0eQFYCb7uQLqoEI.jpg','1985-12-01',89,'Released',NULL,'Keriz',436067,0.8333,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16245,_binary '\0','/9t376elDJnO9QwZJd5z7LOz5Z0S.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252597',8.6,18868,'tr','Kibar Feyzo','To bid for his beloved\'s hand in marriage, poor villager Feyzo must come up with an enormous dowry to appease her father.','/bg5h5KhLD6DI2WiYeG3qugMu6D.jpg','1978-11-01',83,'Released',NULL,'Feyzo, The Polite One',27211,2.5588,7.896,'pdO2yIE48so','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16246,_binary '\0','/eqjcCWTifqK6NxHg6dz3g4nJV23.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252600',7,4007,'tr','Kılıbık','Father of two kids who looks exactly like a rowdy takes advantage of this and go into different and funny events.','/qn517cQlGHHvLMic4Ak89aKsGx0.jpg','1983-06-07',85,'Released',NULL,'Henpecked',307016,1.2039,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16247,_binary '\0','/sVBrC3P5S3XF9qsfNjcs453kEWe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252602',6.7,3103,'tr','Kiracı','Kerim lives with his family in a rent house for years. One day his landlord tells him to look for another house or raise the rent money.He finds a house by the help of Sühandan whom he works together and in love.','/sQ2JqfrskCV5NJjgtZQsEq8Oadi.jpg','1987-09-30',87,'Released',NULL,'Kiracı',191152,1.408,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16248,_binary '\0','/1NwkcGpGSILZxpGBNGxfx5ZpLuR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252607',7,3065,'tr','Koltuk Belası','Political satire comedy featuring the memories of a red leather chair. He is aware that no matter who the next governor will be, more corrupted will the system get. But only until the last governor who decides to set him on fire.','/9LPUJeVYAJqFNIP4zPC9s8Jj3h8.jpg','1990-11-01',85,'Released',NULL,'Seat Trouble',436068,2.1842,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16249,_binary '\0','/eGXlkQsvMcRu45vh06gLUCcbEML.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252611',8.1,8525,'tr','Korkusuz Korkak','He is a civil servant in the bland state office. His whole life changes when his reports get mixed up in the hospital and he gets news that he\'s going to die very soon.','/6lGiT6xEoh423cASVv84NCug39C.jpg','1979-01-01',77,'Released',NULL,'Korkusuz Korkak',123592,1.1788,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16250,_binary '\0','/ksVAPO0XqtNlH1YxswdMfh9a9sg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252618',7,3557,'tr','Köşeyi Dönen Adam','Adem is working as a waiter and he gets fired at that moment he inherits a fortune from his rich uncle in USA. Women start to throw themselves at him, people try to use him, everyone acts nicer to him while he is try to manage his new life.','/s487vXKOIhbwfnjtIamyemCvxS8.jpg','1978-12-01',82,'Released',NULL,'The Man Who Strikes Gold',68108,1.3373,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16251,_binary '\0','/knG8jqXobL6StCoH5Iv4zzjrPYI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252619',8.3,13062,'tr','Köyden Indim Sehire','After they find buried treasure, four hapless brothers from the countryside discover that changing their fortunes will take more than gold.','/kU5LmUNIvybpP0IJRhwgOb3FAB5.jpg','1974-10-01',82,'Released',NULL,'From the Village to the City',74302,1.0484,8.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16252,_binary '\0','/64yjHKlfshC8V7pFiNAP39IKnoX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252649',4.6,2387,'en','Lost Voyage','Twenty five years ago, the SS Corona Queen disappeared in the region known as, \"The Bermuda Triangle\". Now, it has returned. Seven people go on board to learn the truth behind her disappearance but the ship did not return alone...','/kmGotAxSQDwgoRlwYytu3mJIWZ7.jpg','2001-10-23',96,'Released',NULL,'Lost Voyage',52878,2.1287,4.652,'D7c3JatyMTo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16253,_binary '\0','/gYUGMcsoHdaZh4n2Kj8CgG3dopv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252665',6.5,2564,'fr','Le Vélo de Ghislain Lambert','In the 70s, there was Merckx and there were the others. Ghislain Lambert was one of the others. This is his story, a quite simple one. The story of a modest Belgian bike racer. His greatest ambition in life? To become a champion. His greatest tragedy? Not having the legs his heart deserves.','/lIYWYhFxWaDK3ECxWRRnUxpRs0B.jpg','2001-09-14',119,'Released',NULL,'Ghislain Lambert\'s Bicycle',40415,1.4948,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16254,_binary '\0','/4XbMsstfDmkixCLZZi7BsTmEZ0v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252684',7.1,11107,'en','Manic','In lieu of prison, Lyle, a violent adolescent, is placed in a juvenile mental institution where he encounters a group of equally troubled teens. This motley crew—abused, sexually confused, violent, and yet hanging on by their grit and anger—becomes Lyle\'s last lifeline as he fights to find meaning in a world that seems to defy understanding.','/af9Ym0HQuChr7e5N34PN9OSfYhu.jpg','2002-11-22',102,'Released','You can\'t escape yourself.','Manic',15098,3.3128,6.8,'-zVMC_eUsBo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16255,_binary '\0','/6DuKAN7lNJcOKKASQ0OjmqFefds.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252695',7.8,10535,'tr','Mavi Boncuk','After being humiliated and kicked out from a music hall because they could not pay the bill, six ne\'er-do-wells decide to kidnap the star performer Emel Sayın for revenge.','/8ybTIvC1uu3H5PodBjrtrtUJ8U1.jpg','1975-01-01',79,'Released',NULL,'The Blue Bead',69319,1.8228,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16256,_binary '\0','/9g7sm7cyZb01gTberEwe8ne1Lmp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252704',7.2,4753,'tr','Meraklı Köfteci','Zuhtu, a nosy hawker who sells meatballs, one night finds a young girl escaping from her cruel relatives. He intends to help the girl but this costs him too much.','/8zwGCXajDnJRbdfVaOTKj9u18Yg.jpg','1976-12-01',75,'Released',NULL,'Nosey Zühtü',74077,0.9257,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16257,_binary '\0','/as3gvp4DIXVRlXsj5x7OWPQI5lI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252866',6.5,289353,'en','American Pie 2','After a year apart - attending different schools, meeting different people - the guys rent a beach house and vow to make this the best summer ever. As it turns out, whether that will happen or not has a lot to do with the girls. Between the wild parties, outrageous revelations and yes, a trip to band camp, they discover that times change and people change, but in the end, it\'s all about sticking together.','/854ZZxXdeabAs90mrV72NqShJqR.jpg','2001-08-10',111,'Released','This summer it\'s all about sticking together.','American Pie 2',2770,12.9997,6.27,'ntxIBzJ0tU8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16258,_binary '\0','/kotqEuljz4lLii62LNBRV7dswsQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252963',5.4,6342,'en','The Bunker','In 1944, in the Belgian - German border, seven German soldiers survive an American attack in the front and lock themselves in a bunker to protect the position. Under siege by the enemy and with little ammunition, they decide to explore underground tunnels to seek supplies and find an escape route. While in the tunnel, weird things happen with the group.','/oR6ggIeLAFO1uLbytNVzW8ASq57.jpg','2001-09-14',95,'Released','Beyond War. Beyond Hell. Beyond the Grave.','The Bunker',7454,1.9877,5.661,'SO4J_kHkegs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16259,_binary '\0','/b1SXOxXkjJmvT9BG5aTpHSwKZhE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0252985',7.2,9811,'it','Chiedimi se sono felice','Aspiring thespians Aldo, Giovanni and Giacomo work dead-end jobs while nurturing their dream production of Cyrano de Bergerac, until love for the same woman tears their friendship apart. Three years later, Giovanni and Giacomo reunite after learning that Aldo is dying.','/7DtDnWwmZAI3dYUKNPsRy24SxV3.jpg','2000-12-15',100,'Released',NULL,'Ask Me If I\'m Happy',50531,1.8224,7.652,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16260,_binary '\0','/T66TqCBqDgsTY1A7e2j1KolRxH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253110',6,1394,'es','La gran vida','Lola, a Mexican waitress working in Madrid, befriends a 30-year-old suicidal man who has borrowed $1,000,000 to spend on his last day on Earth, knowing he will be killed anyway if he fails to return the money. After meeting Lola, however, he decides that life might be worth living after all.','/4Svz2C0Yn58ODjJQXOH23BNtslv.jpg','2000-10-11',112,'Released','Before you give it up, live it up.','Living It Up',34704,1.3517,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16261,_binary '\0','/xXY4lTRNJXXuIyuTzickQHPUvqi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253126',6.1,3863,'en','High Heels and Low Lifes','Two friends are drawn into a seedy underworld of extortion and violence when they try to blackmail a gang of bank robbers.','/mXyhSM5xuTTKcD7vmdYkqspYWzC.jpg','2001-07-16',86,'Released','They\'re not bad girls. They\'re just behaving that way.','High Heels and Low Lifes',10034,2.8892,6.1,'-xQSEm5KUIk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16262,_binary '\0','/qp0PwxbpHPYYA2ZNJhxw0qRN9Cy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253140',6.5,2487,'tr','İnatçı','While the dam project will be expropriated, Yellow poplar and Long poplar villages are included in the expropriation. Although this is supposed to protect the confidentiality, a member of the commission sells this information to a holding company and someone in that holding company sells what they heard to another holding company.','/3ZoKjUHziRA2aQfdMSmsawMC7Oj.jpg','1988-03-01',84,'Released',NULL,'Stubborn',191145,1.9702,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16263,_binary '\0','/2ObxAPLMy2Hmhi1f8kuRHOupZPR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253143',7.5,4969,'tr','İnek Şaban','A poor grocery owner becomes a popular goalkeeper.','/mTj5YwUMDA0hrGPdfSI1GTXlCjJ.jpg','1978-02-01',71,'Released',NULL,'İnek Şaban',148706,1.0356,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16264,_binary '\0','/n0Hgq2hT3wDdel3uKcoBNfbHUYw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253151',7.1,3327,'tr','İyi Aile Çocuğu','Identical twin brothers live separate lives for years without seeing each other. They have grown up in very different circumstances. One is a gangster who spreads terror around him, while the other is a modest bank clerk.','/vCmnaqPEZl2A8YSs3NdbcBPAR0c.jpg','1978-02-01',79,'Released',NULL,'A Good Family Kid',331119,0.9083,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16265,_binary '\0','/aTr5pfiDBEUtn3iRJDa5rDT9l8h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253157',8.3,1351,'te','జంబలకిడిపంబ','Fed up of a male-dominated society, a woman approaches a yogini who has prepared a herb that will make men behave like women. After a series of bizarre incidents, a police officer investigates.','/tqmyfoSEOtxXHK9Hu2oxYr1sf0z.jpg','1993-05-07',165,'Released',NULL,'Jambalakidi Pamba',403399,1.1854,6.429,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16266,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253194',5.2,1249,'hi','Kunwara','Raju meets Urmila in New Zealand. They have a fast romance and things are going well until Raju must make a trip back to India...','/tLSmEZTqWrj4NPu7PQJ6IHKRh0l.jpg','2000-07-14',134,'Released',NULL,'Kunwara',159067,1.1189,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16267,_binary '\0','/z4YiI1tyo1xifoWHTHAcBRoFoQa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253200',6.9,7230,'en','Last Orders','Jack Dodd was a London butcher who enjoyed a pint with his mates for over 50 years. When he died, he died as he lived, with a smile on his face watching a horse race on which he had bet, with borrowed money. But before he died he had a final request, \'Last Orders\', that his ashes be scattered in the sea at Margate. The movie follows his mates, Ray, Lenny and Vic and his foster son Vince as they journey to the sea with the ashes. Along the way, the threads of their lives, their loves and their disappointments are woven together in their memories of Jack and his wife Amy','/rcc3eL3wcydEUmXpX1tW9ro8NR9.jpg','2001-09-10',109,'Released',NULL,'Last Orders',14778,2.6015,6,'wut-VoNdzgs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16268,_binary '\0','/88ZRNbBEeipc2mRnHv10VhRQEmK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253377',7.2,3638,'tr','Oh Olsun','A tycoon tries to teach some life lessons to his three spoiled sons by making them work on the floor of his factory, where one of them falls in love.','/6TgwgoxMwtSmrQwWaEJD1kG8zbA.jpg','1973-01-01',83,'Released',NULL,'Oh Olsun',110029,1.574,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16269,_binary '\0','/545JJIh6Ow1EyraXwJtzsjBViqz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253378',6.9,1691,'ko','오! 수정','When filmmaker Young-soo introduces writer Soo-jung to his friend Jae-hoon, he unintentionally creates a love triangle. While Jae-hoon pursues Soo-jung, Young-soo clashes with his crew. Yet, just as the story appears to end, it starts all over again, this time with plenty of variations.','/nagbVuHU5XxUfIs5lKLEptjiIzg.jpg','2000-05-27',127,'Released',NULL,'Virgin Stripped Bare by Her Bachelors',54690,1.7086,6.4,'mAr4QHtt78w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16270,_binary '\0','/u60tPFNQKASYiOANyIfIAC6ylYR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253420',7.1,5575,'tr','Ortadirek Şaban','Şaban, who works as a clerk in a factory, is madly in love with Bahar, who works as a secretary in the same factory and attends university thanks to the financial support of the famous oil tycoon Adnan Bıçakçı. However, Bahar has her eye on the famous athlete Erkan. After Adnan Bıçakçı reveals that Bahar is his granddaughter, she is kidnapped by gangsters. However, the only person who tries to rescue her is not her boyfriend Erkan, but Orta Direk Şaban.','/9RH6gn1KtuISydcIjzXmP1ez6dO.jpg','1984-03-01',82,'Released',NULL,'Şaban, a Man from the Middle Class',191073,0.9591,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16271,_binary '\0','/c0fB9xk7D1aVb3Bg2rk2SVJcGn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253474',8.5,1024726,'en','The Pianist','The true story of pianist Władysław Szpilman\'s experiences in Warsaw during the Nazi occupation. When the Jews of the city find themselves forced into a ghetto, Szpilman finds work playing in a café; and when his family is deported in 1942, he stays behind, works for a while as a laborer, and eventually goes into hiding in the ruins of the war-torn city.','/2hFvxCCWrTmCYwfy7yum0GKRi3Y.jpg','2002-09-17',150,'Released','Music was his passion. Survival was his masterpiece.','The Pianist',423,22.6829,8.371,'og9hFxxdSOg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16272,_binary '\0','/5cCsMgEugzF5rfKdPFsR95PVUFh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253499',7,5239,'tr','Postacı','Sevtap and Adem, the postman in the neighborhood, are in love with each other. Sevtap remained single until the age of 30 because no one liked her, so she is still a virgin and has settled for Adem. However, there is someone who opposes this love, her older brother Latif, who was raised in German culture but can be described as a complete fool. One day, Sevtap and Adem send a telegram from Sevtap\'s father\'s mouth to convince him to accept the situation. After this telegram, wedding preparations begin. However, during this time, Latif returns permanently from Germany to Turkey, and the truth about the couple is revealed. Latif opposes the marriage at any cost, even if it means harming Adem. Later, despite his reservations, he accepts the marriage and fulfills Adem\'s every request.','/tnfJZWhvnDVHZpvA5jciJOXcoLV.jpg','1984-04-01',86,'Released',NULL,'The Postman',148735,1.7636,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16273,_binary '\0','/gAozjuCvXYyrxhpkb0P4SuLnEkV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253556',6.2,154092,'en','Reign of Fire','In post-apocalyptic England, an American volunteer and a British survivor team up to fight off a brood of fire-breathing dragons seeking to return to global dominance after centuries of rest underground. The Brit—leading a clan of survivors to hunt down the King of the Dragons—has much at stake: his mother was killed by a dragon, but his love is still alive.','/vZVXCj3jXzIPJUHLaQohzt2uTM3.jpg','2002-07-09',101,'Released','They\'re extremely intelligent. Highly evolved. And they don\'t like sharing the planet.','Reign of Fire',6278,11.1728,6.2,'NFZoDnP-1eE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16274,_binary '\0','/v1BGfr235oqpWSM4919gRpwMzqF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253612',6,1348,'fr','La Répétition','Nathalie and Louise are friends from childhood. While studying drama at University Louise becomes hopelessly obsessed with her friend. Jealous of the male friends she has she breaks up the friendship, followed by a suicide attempt. Later, Louise marries, but finds time to see the, by now quite accomplished actress, Nathalie. They fight through the years, La Repetition following them as their friendship comes together and breaks up frequently, while never actually reaching anything that can be called a climax.','/qlGdYZ4lsILxF5wnwvfU3XlYXq7.jpg','2001-08-22',96,'Released',NULL,'Replay',47254,1.1528,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16275,_binary '\0','/afqmjyqyZjfzRo1oVIRW1U5gPPN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253614',8.7,20255,'tr','Şaban Oğlu Şaban','Clumsy soldiers Şaban and Ramazan fall for a singer-dancer and accidentally become secret policemen tracking down a missing diamond.','/iPYrBGUaNTsrMjxcPoNvo4quEeL.jpg','1977-12-01',90,'Released',NULL,'Saban, Son of Saban',31547,1.406,7.858,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16276,_binary '\0','/lyQq27HGiKOpUvJlBryYRPVdkei.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253615',6.4,3251,'tr','Şaban Pabucu Yarım',NULL,'/dhgrGAEOfx4mDzFSPdEYWIn1fFu.jpg','1985-10-01',93,'Released',NULL,'Şaban Pabucu Yarım',123606,1.0768,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16277,_binary '\0','/qX1P8XqS0VY4qG2yjdzdNNpvoIJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253616',6.2,4287,'tr','Şabaniye','A poet, who works as a waiter to make ends meet, postures as a female singer to end a blood feud between two families.','/zpO9mXwIIyGuFnHaSR8dx37DY4r.jpg','1984-06-02',93,'Released',NULL,'Şabaniye',327935,0.8518,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16278,_binary '\0','/qlTAdxF9dHfwkeriq5ATibmjauE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253619',7.6,7190,'tr','Sahte Kabadayı','Kemal, unaware that his father is a mafia boss, sells cotton candy at train stations. After his father is killed, his inheritance is divided. Kemal begins visiting the establishments of Istanbul\'s most notorious thugs one by one to reclaim his father\'s inheritance, and gradually gains a reputation.','/yk71HfKyCMxa5K1I4yqUb8xTMir.jpg','1976-09-01',77,'Released',NULL,'Fake Gangster',74171,0.9205,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16279,_binary '\0','/wYItcG6am6ANrkyoJbAILZDWbga.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253621',8,10331,'tr','Sakar Şakir','Shakir, who lives in Kayseri, has a great legacy from his uncle who died in Istanbul. His uncle sends a telegram to Kayseri and dies before seeing Shakir, but a relative who does not want to share the legacy begins to make plans to eliminate him.','/f6s1DAx0twhQSIdE3dzHnOm2b9o.jpg','1977-11-01',81,'Released',NULL,'Sakar Şakir',111799,1.2445,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16280,_binary '\0','/viyufjFkoQvo3fXEf8GzFP1iSHv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253622',7.9,8645,'tr','Salak Milyoner','The funny treasure hunt of 4 rural brothers in Istanbul, after the recent death of their father who left them a treasure map as heritage.','/gI5UVo4Ow2xYb61BcU75WEdyYIQ.jpg','1974-04-01',84,'Released',NULL,'The Stupid Millionaire',110033,1.687,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16281,_binary '\0','/7AN8BLcEdGhA7bgg6bxFh48JWk1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253623',7.3,7205,'tr','Salako','A man falls hopelessly in love with a village leader\'s daughter, who herself has feelings for an outlaw.','/9lajIyjK8EtJkPt6BXSjFmBKYGM.jpg','1974-12-02',87,'Released',NULL,'Salako',110040,1.0609,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16282,_binary '\0','/5BiDTZbNGFEDJN6hQUHWpYi1ObH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253637',7.5,4906,'tr','Şark Bülbülü','The comical story of Şaban, who came to Istanbul to earn his dowry and, by chance, became a famous folk singer known as Şaban Ballıses.','/mcm5gYFkwmUP7tgv3i22SAP8ujr.jpg','1979-01-01',89,'Released',NULL,'Nightingale',123594,2.2083,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16283,_binary '\0','/kNFWXiUvNtfTamQPNr9YMO0iiFH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253639',6.7,3090,'tr','Şaşkın Damat','While Serpil pretends to be a religious village girl to his rich uncle she gets cought at an erotic party. Her uncle sees what she actually is than he forces her to marry simpleton Apti or she and her family cannot inherit his fortune.','/AvU08DuD4Gowz1TPRTyRwvrb38F.jpg','1975-03-01',78,'Released',NULL,'The Confused Groom',111795,0.7776,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16284,_binary '\0','/nO49RGWKtK1ugxGFVqye0UvPyUE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253670',6.5,3155,'tr','Şendul Şaban','She works as a factory worker alongside Şaban Ali. One day, they are fired for asking their boss for a raise. They search for work for a long time but cannot find any. Necla tells Şaban that it is easier for women to find work, and the couple make a bet. The next day, Necla starts working as a secretary. The roles at home change. Necla becomes the man of the house, and Şaban becomes the woman of the house. However, the couple is unhappy because of Necla\'s long working hours.','/nu5MnccfWNh1iFsXqUQkq8KeMhk.jpg','1985-11-10',94,'Released',NULL,'Şendul Şaban',236800,1.7723,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16285,_binary '\0','/wxuHquH4yaiuOQ1aNCq56Y4BXvC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253738',6.9,4053,'tr','Sosyete Şaban','Country bumpkin Şaban Ağa has long dreamed of winning the heart of Peri, the high-society belle he plans to marry, though she doesn’t even know he exists. Spurned when Peri agrees to wed him for his money then flees back to city life, Şaban reinvents himself as the sophisticated Dilaver Bey to exact his sweet revenge.','/cPMnly3A27WFb4H19sP7RcbM0n.jpg','1985-01-01',92,'Released',NULL,'Sosyete Şaban',123601,1.0377,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16286,_binary '\0','/6z9w8eidKWDDXwZNSVNaRolAYEP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253754',6.4,88566,'en','Star Trek: Nemesis','En route to the honeymoon of William Riker to Deanna Troi on her home planet of Betazed, Captain Jean-Luc Picard and the crew of the U.S.S. Enterprise receives word from Starfleet that a coup has resulted in the installation of a new Romulan political leader, Shinzon, who claims to seek peace with the human-backed United Federation of Planets. Once in enemy territory, the captain and his crew make a startling discovery: Shinzon is human, a slave from the Romulan sister planet of Remus, and has a secret, shocking relationship to Picard himself.','/cldAwhvBmOv9jrd3bXWuqRHoXyq.jpg','2002-12-13',116,'Released','A generation\'s final journey begins.','Star Trek: Nemesis',201,9.9251,6.3,'TXvCIWWCiFo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16287,_binary '\0','/7p9jc9Tt4xkoWtdNUReyLPnYOJ9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253779',8.8,22825,'tr','Süt Kardeşler','Saban, Ramazan and Bayram are sailors in an Ottoman Navy and Hüsamettin is their commander. Hüsamettin\'s aide Ramazan, Saban who is foster son of Hüsamettin\'s sister and Bayram who is married to Hüsamettin\'s niece stays at Hüsamettin\'s family residence. Hüsamettin\'s sister thinks Ramazan is her foster son Saban when she realizes her mistake she introduces Ramazan to her brother as her son in law Bayram since she was afraid of Hüsamettin\'s short-tempered character. Things get complicated when real Saban and Bayram come to the residence. Now Saban has to be Ramazan and Bayram has to be Saban. Meanwhile, a gulyabani (a ghoul from Turkish folklore) haunts the residence.','/vGW4S5CBTiIdkFE0nX6wljMDLjo.jpg','1976-02-01',80,'Released',NULL,'The Foster Brothers',31405,1.8233,7.976,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16288,_binary '\0','/kdcHeq8PTiqQrTcUOv4rbnVjXx0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253782',7,3228,'tr','Talih Kuşu','Osman, who lives a poor life with his wife, children, and mother-in-law, earns his living as a porter. His debts to the local shopkeepers and his landlord have piled up like a mountain. To make matters worse, he is constantly belittled by his wife Leman and mother-in-law! One day, the neighborhood ticket seller Şakir forces him to buy a lottery ticket. Osman hides the ticket somewhere but forgets where he put it. When Osman learns that the jackpot has been won by one of the tickets sold by Şakir, he mistakenly believes it is his and is overcome with joy.','/qk25UlnTocBF2J06I5SjzcKG6fc.jpg','1989-01-01',92,'Released',NULL,'Talih Kuşu',452926,0.9667,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16289,_binary '\0','/zD4s1UDa6FO8YSvEWIj1fYfn3Vj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253790',6.4,3503,'tr','Tarzan Rıfkı','A story about a poor and guilt guy who is being used by mafia for dirty work.','/4uii9igIoUpOPCWrxioc0IY0jLE.jpg','1986-03-12',83,'Released',NULL,'Tarzan Rıfkı',307020,1.2327,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16290,_binary '\0','/piw9XXc1rpDxesWw8fSQa81attD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253791',7.1,3071,'tr','Tatlı Dillim','Ferit is a basketball player from Istanbul. One day, at a camp he attends, he meets Emine, a village teacher. They fall in love at first sight and get married, but the spell is broken when Ferit\'s friends from the city arrive.','/hn47axAnJKPVVOlXPcdOjQpoexV.jpg','1972-01-01',94,'Released',NULL,'Sweet Talker',110028,1.4161,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16291,_binary '\0','/5bSEw2HquRZ6BoCogZLdCM9mjHM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253798',6.3,19595,'en','Out Cold','Rick Rambis and his friends are having the time of their lives on Bull Mountain—until the legendary Papa Muntz\' son decides to sell the mountain to a sleazy land developer, have the staff fired and turn Bull Mountain into \'Yuppieville\'.','/2aBepBnMXRs3hmde9Je3rn5bseJ.jpg','2001-11-21',89,'Released','They haven\'t quite figured it all out, but they\'re getting a little warmer.','Out Cold',14369,3.753,5.906,'NuUFpOyqj_E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16292,_binary '\0','/oEiVLD8RMW5FGvbS5XD2CcZsxgo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253822',7.7,7113,'tr','Tokatçı','A tragicomedy dramatizing how an innocent villager is driven into the crime world only to collect enough cash to make his biggest dream come true: Return to his village home and marry the girl next door.','/k06pQoVEKr9sOC8N63ECLXcB8gF.jpg','1984-02-01',83,'Released',NULL,'Tokatçı',123611,2.0855,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16293,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253827',5.5,1419,'en','The Martins','Out of work, scrounger Robert Martin lives with his dysfunctional family - long suffering wife accident prone son and pregnant teenage daughter in a shabby house next door to a giant shopping center in the London suburbs. The Martins are the family from hell! Robert dreams if winning a dream holiday for his family, and when he fails to win yet another competition he flips, out tracks down the elderly winners, ties them up in the cellar and steals their tickets!','/lOWsipWLCc1RuhjgYzhtHVJQVZ7.jpg','2001-09-14',87,'Released',NULL,'The Martins',39783,1.1705,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16294,_binary '\0','/kiu0xIcu9Rju9HTWSJOo8Svg9aW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253828',8.9,26701,'tr','Tosun Paşa','Late 19th century in Alexandria. Two traditionally rival Turkish families, \"Seferoglu\"s and \"Tellioglu\"s are competing for the \"Green Valley\". The winner will be determined by Daver Bey, who has a beautiful young daughter, Leyla. Both families try to arrange a marriage between a man from their family and Leyla, so that Daver Bey will be inclined to give the green valley to his \"relatives\". Tellioglus, who are behind in the race, desperately find a final solution: They will fake their idiotic butler, Saban, as the highest ranked Ottoman soldier in Egypt: Tosun Pasha.','/zqgB6E4yynfxkzzOurzC0VRObxf.jpg','1976-02-01',90,'Released','Green Valley is ours!','Tosun Pasha',38794,1.5789,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16295,_binary '\0','/zALO2v4saroXssOcHmhkGx0BoTs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253840',5.8,1681,'en','The Triumph of Love','A princess is determined to restore her homeland\'s throne to its rightful heir, a young prince with whom she falls in love.','/mLgC2GDegvwIucpQpn6rDR3ltiv.jpg','2001-09-07',112,'Released','Seduction, persuasion and utter confusion...a romantic comedy that aims for the heart.','The Triumph of Love',35337,1.7404,6.1,'wjsJnLjbxYs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16296,_binary '\0','/cAofmRdb9XincJk6UkNweNkAa9w.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253860',7.1,4055,'tr','Umudumuz Şaban',NULL,'/wsU9zMHT4bShuoHEiHZ6Gd110l5.jpg','1979-01-01',83,'Released',NULL,'Our Hope Is Şaban',148711,1.7458,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16297,_binary '\0','/7rQm6TZAB3CLB1UNDuocQ8EMdHk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253867',5.2,66783,'en','The Sweetest Thing','Christina\'s love life is stuck in neutral. After years of avoiding the hazards of a meaningful relationship, one night while club-hopping with her girlfriends, she meets Peter, her perfect match. Fed up with playing games, she finally gets the courage to let her guard down and follow her heart, only to discover that Peter has suddenly left town. Accompanied by Courtney, she sets out to capture the one that got away.','/qLysz4B5YmiDq52Op0zq4eD75LC.jpg','2002-04-12',84,'Released','A romantic comedy without the sugar.','The Sweetest Thing',11812,7.5517,5.618,'5sA8dpA3gig','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16298,_binary '\0','/zVhuDey6aoEJTA6DWqKDEmDygv1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253875',5.8,1748,'tr','Uyanık Gazeteci','A comedy of a journalist who feigns war news and makes his agency strand.','/9gBQK0lxTlfqBRFNgLy7lDlbeoX.jpg','1988-01-01',90,'Released',NULL,'Uyanık Gazeteci',331131,0.7664,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16299,_binary '\0','/3USM7RNio47fQf2N8HSfcdQNfGe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253884',6.6,3153,'tr','Varyemez','Ragıp Elibol is a wealthy and stingy businessman. He separated from Melek, the mother of his children, and married Dürdane. His son Cengiz is studying at university, while his daughter Zeliha is at home waiting for a husband. One day, Ragıp is hit by a car while driving. Four young people, who have many things they want to do but cannot afford, kidnap Ragıp, thinking he can provide them with the means to do so. They claim to be a secret organization and demand a ransom. His wife Dürdane informs the police, explaining that she is being threatened for ransom. Everyone he knows, including his family and business partner, is delighted about the ransom. No one contributes to the demanded ransom. Ragıp learns that he has no one who loves him thanks to those who kidnapped him. When the young people lose hope of getting the money, they release Ragıp.','/mQqmGs6DIR4fl1XXgf82Tj3GQ3v.jpg','1991-01-01',93,'Released',NULL,'Varyemez',452917,0.9141,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16300,_binary '\0','/99406RmWVdsJGLRHZJ3rf0mSxN3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253959',6.1,1740,'tr','Yakışıklı','Selim is a paperboy who delivers the morning papers with his truck. He buys a walkie talkie to find find a friend. His codename is \"The Handsome\". After a while he meets the girl and they start a relationship. It is hard for them to get married.','/we0YmR4gaxIPSDaRlQSXpbnKoE3.jpg','1987-01-01',86,'Released',NULL,'The Handsome',192596,0.7223,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16301,_binary '\0','/hg9D0Lbvpp6FlBvkhbKLPOBGSwy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253960',7.1,2673,'tr','Yalancı Yarim',NULL,'/uXMjsrgleBjEpZcTj902cKCMggJ.jpg','1973-12-01',97,'Released',NULL,'Yalancı Yarim',110031,0.7227,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16302,_binary '\0','/l08iqixei0VHWjvsO5dRUdt2Iwa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253963',7.6,8496,'tr','Yedi Bela Hüsnü','Hüsnü is a lovestruck young man determined to win the heart of his neighborhood’s beauty, Hüsniye, and enlists his friend’s dubious tactics to no avail. When a thug seizes the neighborhood deeds and forces everyone to flee, Hüsnü tries to become the local tough guy to save his community and impress Hüsniye, but his bravado draws the attention of a hired killer.','/oyjtzHkyeigMz2NsnRCM1K4cMYI.jpg','1983-06-01',84,'Released',NULL,'Troublemaker Hüsnü',123612,0.8206,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16303,_binary '\0','/rY3QWVMacZ7lv0uxEZplAYoaAic.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253966',7.3,3730,'tr','Yoksul','A kind-hearted tea maker works in a bustling commercial inn, where his good nature makes him an easy target. The business owner takes advantage of his generosity, while the woman he loves manipulates him for money, playing on his trust. As he faces these challenges, his simple routine slowly begins to shift, leading to unexpected turns that force him to rethink his place in the world.','/cwCEPahe7SWlcKu0x8BaAtY2dyp.jpg','1986-04-01',77,'Released',NULL,'Yoksul',436072,0.917,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16304,_binary '\0','/no3vXKcziP04LeUB4MJ4VH6yShZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253970',7.7,6699,'tr','100 Numaralı Adam','A poor young man chosen by a advertising company, and they made him a public hero to make him advertise poor quality products that no one buys.','/mL87572Gurwi5YWNMY9oWWaEZ5a.jpg','1978-12-27',83,'Released',NULL,'100 Numaralı Adam',52281,1.0486,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16305,_binary '\0','/jnFK1uyqFndIz9JJQPm2JukTFXu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253977',6.3,1563,'tr','Zehir Hafiye','The story of a young man who loves crime fiction books, and the daugher of a mafia leader.','/zOFHja4xj4ciQIWD3VCujTicr2R.jpg','1989-01-15',92,'Released',NULL,'Zehir Hafiye',157738,1.2737,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16306,_binary '\0','/osFL8vA0yoDEfdH6d2m6SpgdiVS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253991',8.5,12263,'tr','Zübük','This is the story of the politician named Zübük. He gets expelled from the political party that he is a member of, due to corruption. The journalist Yaşar wants to make a news story about his case and investigates Zübük\'s doings. Yaşar gets baffled at the sly tricks Zübük played on his village people. In the end, he feels sorry about Zübük\'s present situation, however, as things happen he becomes aware that Zübük has been tricking him.','/gmRXqXgyCbuC50mAs2Q32wdUjxO.jpg','1980-09-11',88,'Released',NULL,'Zübük',157737,2.1718,8.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16307,_binary '\0','/uTWykxsOubCRnSuCFMHPsyJqH7c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253996',6.7,3743,'tr','Çarıklı Milyoner','Hilmi Tok is a billionaire businessman. He dies one day while driving his own car. His real estate assets goes his son Bayram.','/fsxt2inqv3z0aTBKAMhVfptra0w.jpg','1983-01-01',86,'Released',NULL,'Çarıklı Milyoner',80958,1.7967,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16308,_binary '\0','/viJjUhzkxwttDaLIGxE78urG3Ej.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0253997',8.5,23257,'tr','Çöpçüler Kralı','Going through his daily routine in a stereotypical neighborhood, a street cleaner falls in love with a charwoman. Unfortunately for him, so does his superior officer.','/2UPESBpPY2N8ZqMTKlvAYHBtzCH.jpg','1977-08-09',80,'Released',NULL,'The King of the Street Cleaners',80961,1.5079,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16309,_binary '\0','/uVITEsSNLYpgIQJPiFdhZoS4WaZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0254000',7.2,3101,'tr','Öğretmen','Husnu has got issues and inabilities about the complex and expensive metropolitan life who was a successful teacher in his little town and got a promotion and appointment to Istanbul.','/byE0TeTixM30I35a19cFk2rO5tr.jpg','1988-11-01',89,'Released',NULL,'The Teacher',334526,0.8508,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16310,_binary '\0','/ll5iIQrURpvYtpzxK5qehcKN11u.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0254001',7.7,7194,'tr','Üç Kağıtçı','Rıfkı, who lives in Germany, returns to his village, which he left years ago, to sell the properties inherited from his late father. A few coincidences that occur upon his arrival in the village lead to his name being associated with the \'Saint\' title.','/h2roppgmY6lhTPaMc7Dg1voKquk.jpg','1981-10-01',88,'Released',NULL,'Trickster',148723,1.2983,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16311,_binary '\0','/pckxBd8HqMpi1W9i15aztoAcVBj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0254099',6.3,8925,'en','The Anniversary Party','While celebrating their reconciliation and six years of marriage, American actress Sally Nash and British novelist Joe Therrian receive their close friends, some colleagues and their next door neighbors in a party. Under the effect of Ecstasy, revelations are disclosed and relationships deteriorate among the group.','/3c4t8tTQp7TV1Z3qeltmhjRi5Ex.jpg','2001-06-09',115,'Released','It\'s not a party until something gets broken.','The Anniversary Party',26475,2.0647,5.6,'sgxwpjaJwrU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16312,_binary '\0','/5IOPVmirbepx2UBeKaPop0WnbRy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0254199',6.2,5217,'en','CQ','A young filmmaker in 1960s Paris juggles directing a cheesy sci-fi debacle, directing his own personal art film, coping with his crumbling relationship with his girlfriend, and a new-found infatuation with the sci-fi film\'s starlet.','/qembyZYP4BSGoh9djmh8ga2nVfG.jpg','2001-05-12',88,'Released','Every picture tells a story.','CQ',27834,4.8752,5.896,'8o8owi6-iyQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16313,_binary '\0','/e3AJkOwJoeIyD8MoWlXbuv4JQDB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0254235',6.9,1660,'it','Concorrenza sleale','Two textile traders, with the shop close to one another, fight for the supremacy of their own business during the racial laws in 1938 Italy.','/opLzBKoGIxfGEpZXsBxRtiWqyrU.jpg','2001-02-23',110,'Released',NULL,'Unfair Competition',58509,1.4517,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16314,_binary '\0','/hw6FyhItC32JdGG2fpZbvhGmGoX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0254334',5.3,3590,'en','The Fourth Angel','Workaholic reporter, Jack Elgin takes his family on a working trip to India, but their aircraft is hijacked in Cyprus by a previously-unknown terrorist movement, and his wife and daughter are among the slaughtered. With western governments suppressing key facts and unwilling to go after the terrorists, Jack uses his contacts and snooping skill to seek the truth himself.','/m4IndiS7IfUDjobyIENlFaba6b9.jpg','2001-08-15',96,'Released','Sometimes revenge is the only solution.','The Fourth Angel',57047,2.797,5.3,'hL9Nqqj1kYQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16315,_binary '\0','/pif2pejoGDWooOsGF9tldOfYV0F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0254455',7,40869,'es','Lucía y el sexo','Lucía is a young waitress in Madrid who seeks refuge on a quiet, secluded Mediterranean island after the loss of her longtime boyfriend. Amidst the fresh air, dazzling sun, and glistening deep blue water, Lucía begins to piece together the dark corners of her past relationship.','/gvErAg9bv7xOO3B40gottv6Bqip.jpg','2001-08-24',128,'Released',NULL,'Sex and Lucía',1364,7.159,6.699,'PO9MSeqrfhY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16316,_binary '\0','/ctOdk4RhL8h7Zh1vhin7uhqzsYc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0254463',7.5,4266,'tr','Kaç Para Kaç','The film is set in present-day Istanbul. Selim is a shop owner in his early forties. He sells clothing for men in his shop situated in one of the back streets of Istanbul. Selim is a family man who has devoted his life to his home and his work. He lives with his wife Ayla, his six-year-old daughter Esma and his old father in a simple flat in and old, modest neighbourhood. He has warm relations with his family. He is an affectionate father. One of his neighbours, a young widow named Nihal tries to seduce Selim, but her flirtation leaves him cold. Selim is known for his honesty and integrity among his family and friends. He is a careful spender. As a little child, he has learned that money is not easily earned. He has no tolerance for petty \"trickery\" met in daily life. One day, Selim finds a bag full of dollar bills (approximately 500,000$) in a cab. From that day on, Selim finds himself in a bewildered state with a bag full of money on his hands.','/sSk881stLcxpc743ldkCguylbSs.jpg','1999-12-17',100,'Released',NULL,'A Run for Money',47103,0.9324,7.145,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16317,_binary '\0','/ytQ9bT5TuDbSIXgmOC1wy49dkpM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0254481',7.2,32001,'hi','कोई मिल गया','A developmentally disabled boy\'s life changes after he encounters an extraterrestrial being.','/2iJVauDYcYxRRGciTmAOSjiATf9.jpg','2003-08-08',165,'Released','You are not alone.','Koi... Mil Gaya',25516,3.5876,7,'IBpZH-CFgZ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16318,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0254683',6,1854,'hi','फूल और काँटे','Ajay, the son of criminal leader Nageshwar, leads a peaceful family life. However, when the rivals kidnap Ajay\'s son, Nageshwar forces him to join the life of crime to rescue his child.','/lNxSSYUK2RZtTo9rKCyzVq1twzM.jpg','1991-11-22',180,'Released',NULL,'Phool Aur Kaante',230437,1.343,6.447,'ocVaqpvRxtc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16319,_binary '\0','/tEhvOU8nJp4v9goYwrJTASJJD3C.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0254686',7.5,82886,'fr','La Pianiste','Erika Kohut, a sexually repressed piano teacher living with her domineering mother, meets a young man who starts romantically pursuing her.','/gNHKYQnP1RnqEhkivHJzBPb4MOP.jpg','2001-09-05',131,'Released',NULL,'The Piano Teacher',1791,10.8862,7.3,'Z-frdy3mYHo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16320,_binary '\0','/2EN7PStJDnA6l4iQTl7drwdksP4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0254703',4.3,1322,'en','The Point Men','Some time after their botched operation to capture a known Palestinian terrorist, a team of Israeli agents starts to get killed off one by one. Their leader must get to the bottom of things before the killer(s) plan is complete.','/zNeO3ygV4sgsV0ERrJQzuCbTk8C.jpg','2001-09-07',88,'Released','It takes one to kill one.','The Point Men',46943,1.8511,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16321,_binary '\0','/78OprHsiNQ55uLXarn7YgFtwAJD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0254769',7.3,1824,'fa','شهر موشها','Mice who have to leave their school and immigrate because of a wild cat who wants to eat them up. Eventually the mice defeat the cat and go back to their home.','/3Ys9yIcsDVaVgiYfuwPCsuE09jn.jpg','1986-02-01',92,'Released',NULL,'City of Mice',469443,0.7275,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16322,_binary '\0','/gZ6uO7Y43nlzTaQfEgKEkbBDwpB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0254775',5.2,1434,'fr','La sirène rouge','Nearly 13, Alice rebels, telling the Paris police that her mother is a murderer. Alice has no evidence; her mother, Eva, rich and powerful, avoids charges. Alice promptly runs away, determined to find her dad whom she claims lives in Portugal. The police believe he is dead and that Alice is in denial. Nonetheless, they dispatch Anita, an Italian police officer on loan to the French, to find Alice and bring her back. Meanwhile, Eva has launched her own paramilitary force to hunt for Alice, and Alice has found a protector in Hugo, an ex-soldier turned hit man and gang member. He promises to get her to her father. All roads lead to a small town on the Portuguese coast.','/3mgcEZzKTg1pV2TH0g0JUgYfVf7.jpg','2002-08-21',118,'Released',NULL,'The Red Siren',57992,1.9525,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16323,_binary '\0','/vC5CSv2shpxiqSVZZqZpdYOzFMz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0254942',7.7,1659,'ml','അക്കരെയക്കരെയക്കരെ','Ramdas and Vijayan are sent on a mission to the US to retrieve a priceless gold crown stolen from India. With a couple of clues, the comic duo embarks on the adventure.','/ks1nhkO1xvTuZE1iadkQJoQanlX.jpg','1990-01-01',150,'Released','An American Mission of Dasan & Vijayan','Akkare Akkare Akkare',152625,3.4928,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16324,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0255013',7.3,1217,'ml','ബോയിംഗ് ബോയിംഗ്','Shyam, a flirt, seeks his friend\'s help to date several girls at the same time. However, an unexpected turn of events changes their situation and, later, they get caught in their own web of lies.','/5K3KUz4EWcBACPPY4jkIG6IdFLD.jpg','1985-09-01',150,'Released',NULL,'Boeing Boeing',134468,2.4934,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16325,_binary '\0','/lTjyjtr1NLNfeglWKzLS3gPW94v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0255067',7.2,13978,'es','La comunidad','After finding an enormous amount of money hidden in a dead man\'s apartment, real estate agent Julia must face the wrath of the very peculiar inhabitants of the apartment building, who will stop at nothing to get their hands on the money.','/witJ36VoxVAu62lpcyBhiKtAMAn.jpg','2000-09-29',109,'Released','Love thy neighbor\'s… money','Common Wealth',11477,2.4426,6.9,'xxogD57zp8E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16326,_binary '\0','/guzBItSjW1nPktU9LB8SAARGEzA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0255094',7.4,7520,'fa','دایره','Various women struggle to function in the oppressively sexist society of contemporary Iran.','/dUsPp5vacr3zZqsiquu5TTaApDr.jpg','2000-09-09',91,'Released',NULL,'The Circle',13898,1.4308,7,'M6FahWs_ctg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16327,_binary '\0','/e7K4QezLUQnRxytqeW4DWNL50rY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0255111',6.5,9089,'hi','Dhadkan','Anjali and Dev are in love with each other and plan to marry, but her family gets her married to Ram. Years later, Dev shows up to reunite with Anjali, however, she has fallen in love with Ram.','/icWt3AGrkXToqWyBviHEfG7auQV.jpg','2000-08-11',171,'Released','Never break a heart.....','Dhadkan',35064,2.6686,6.346,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16328,_binary '\0','/mrmE4NmxLRSjETTAHPngwGjcuPy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0255112',3.6,1593,'hi','ढाई अक्षर प्रेम के','Karan Khanna is an orphan and a captain in the Rajputana Armed Forces. He\'s madly in love with beautiful model Nisha, with whom he plans to tie the knot during his next leave.','/gabkUhs9jgF88XuIcn2ySre5HqM.jpg','2000-07-29',167,'Released','Love is the only inspiration...','Dhaai Akshar Prem Ke',211277,1.464,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16329,_binary '\0','/kPXOwLbo23QxPSXBWb5v2yX8mM5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0255195',6.8,2020,'en','The Goddess of 1967','A rich, young businessman travels to Australia with the intention of buying a 1967 Citroën DS. Once he arrives, things do not go to plan, and he must drive the DS into the outback alongside a blind young woman in order to track down its seller.','/sJ5EH3WJBfZPYU4elOAwZDuZQ7a.jpg','2000-12-21',119,'Released',NULL,'The Goddess of 1967',46226,1.9149,6.5,'rhC6WDGcjJs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16330,_binary '\0','/fsvWFzFJOoDGCadO3FstRRuY4Yu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0255198',6,5453,'ja','ゴジラ×メガギラス G消滅作戦','In an alternate timeline the original Godzilla is never defeated and repeatedly reemerges to feed on Japan\'s energy sources. A new inter-dimensional weapon called the Dimension Tide is created with the intent of eliminating Godzilla. However, the new weapon might also serve as a gateway to something far more sinister.','/jWOLrfoVmYCogt0FUsQuXSThi1s.jpg','2000-12-16',105,'Released','Godzilla disappears.','Godzilla vs. Megaguirus',39468,3.8947,6.658,'3_2bY-5olJQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16331,_binary '\0','/cbgvM5yZLbPdp9hUMuLi1gCPGI9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0255212',5.5,2258,'hi','Hamara Dil Aapke Paas Hai','When Preeti testifies against Bhavani Choudhry for a murder, he rapes her. After being humiliated and thrown out by her family, Avinash, a kind man, offers her a place to stay.','/jAmnbYwpSwZjHpZS9UX9RQVT1ux.jpg','2000-08-24',165,'Released',NULL,'Hamara Dil Aapke Paas Hai',75217,1.5142,5.553,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16332,_binary '\0','/rcG0vPCEBPGIlOVN46YgRILWDWv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0255289',8.5,5073,'ml','കാലാപാനി','Govardhan, a doctor by profession, is wrongly accused of bombing a train and is jailed by the British in Cellular Jail, also known as Kala Pani in Andaman and Nicobar Islands. He witnesses sufferings of hundreds of Indian prisoners there.','/byQ8bcRBpIOYW7OlNZCCYkAVUp2.jpg','1996-04-06',178,'Released',NULL,'Kaalapani',255459,1.6571,7.851,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16333,_binary '\0','/lX2IjZfLSRhug0GL17jfADEZ7qw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0255305',5.2,2281,'hi','Khiladi 420','Dev, a conman, gets killed by his wife Ritu, after she learns that the former is a debt-ridden thug who married her only to repay his debts. Her life turns upside down when she meets Anand, Dev\'s identical twin brother.','/2Ce13mjQLfwu5GNSA78vmEXuOw1.jpg','2000-12-29',168,'Released',NULL,'Khiladi 420',304755,1.1498,4.85,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16334,_binary '\0','/o582HZ0znsMmq4TzaBHUqX5DJbV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0255306',8.6,5509,'ml','കിലുക്കം','Nandini is an illegitimate child who comes to Ooty in search of her father. She meets Joji, a tourist guide, and pretends to be mentally unstable in order to get shelter in his house.','/5F37oi8ClcxKBcwqwUlATHBd1mD.jpg','1991-08-15',155,'Released',NULL,'Kilukkam',139476,1.27,7.488,'T3xRoX6QU5c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16335,_binary '\0','/bgC2OzzL5zdnbsRf2Ai8BV3AnNk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0255309',6.1,1284,'hi','Kurukshetra','Kurukshetra is a story of war between evil and truth. The D.S.P Prithvi Raj Singh(Sanjay Dutt) is an honest and brave police officer.All dishonest police officers , rogues, criminals and corrupt politicians are scared of him. The day he joins duty in Mumbai city, he destroys all the illegal business of Iqbal Pasina(Mukesh Rishi). From that day onwards, Iqbal Pasina starts admiring DSP Prithvi Raj Singh.Prithvi Raj Singh with his wife, Anjali (Mahima Chaudhary) and sister, Aarti is living a happy life. Aarti is in love with Sub-Inspector Avinash','/1Htj8whWO1haeqerbgWr7VVYxq7.jpg','2000-10-03',129,'Released',NULL,'Kurukshetra',81782,1.6292,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16336,_binary '\0','/zqLPycqWlUGHtJKpIEm5f0KLaga.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0255321',6.9,2752,'en','Liam','A morality tale of xenophobia, religious prejudice, mob violence, poverty, and their effect on two children in Liverpool during the Depression. When a shipyard closes, Liam and Teresa\'s dad loses his job. Liam, who\'s about 8, making his first Holy Communion, gets a regular dose of fire and brimstone at church. Teresa, about 13, has a job as a maid to the Jewish family that owns the closed shipyard. The lady of that house is having an affair, and Teresa becomes an accomplice. Liam stutters terribly, especially when troubled. Dad comes under the sway of the Fascists, who blame cheap Irish labor and Jewish owners. A Molotov cocktail brings things to a head.','/asM4LPB6VYUXxifG3jgUk5rPHwH.jpg','2001-01-23',90,'Released',NULL,'Liam',48834,1.3353,6.3,'v2xN_6VOMNA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16337,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0255373',7.9,1523,'ml','മിഥുനം','Midhunam movie is all about Sethumadhavan (Mohanlal) who has plans to start a biscuit factory near his house. But the bureaucracy and the corruption of the officials are the hurdles in front of him. Along with that he has to solve the problems in his family, which his brother (Innocent) and brother-in-law (Jagathy Sreekumar) creates. he marries his long-term fiancée Sulochana (Urvashi) who always cribs that he doesn\'t have love towards her, which he had shown before their marriage. How sethumadhavan succeeds in his life beating all the odds against him forms the rest of the story.','/jEJjl28AMWME6Yazk5ZUkzXYz6U.jpg','1993-07-04',155,'Released',NULL,'Midhunam',280271,1.17,7.553,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16338,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0255378',7.6,1525,'ml','മിന്നാരം','Bobby leads a carefree life until his former lover arrives at his place with a baby girl claiming she is his daughter. However, Bobby must find the truth behind her claims.','/fq6RKc4Gun2SfSTmHVwp43yOBSU.jpg','1994-07-04',144,'Released','An old relationship casts its threatening shadow on the present.','Minnaram',280268,1.0838,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16339,_binary '\0','/nM0rBV35ESYTDF4KWXZsN8vTuw7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0255477',4.3,8956,'it','Pinocchio','Roberto Benigni adapts the classic children\'s tale by Carlo Collodi for the big-budget family-oriented comedy Pinocchio.','/aN2Pa9FnbJA2g4mnHPCWajwtdQ4.jpg','2002-10-11',110,'Released',NULL,'Pinocchio',10599,3.0889,5.7,'3-9WCVRqKKU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16340,_binary '\0','/kUM5b2y1eveCOINZmq6FWFb2Iob.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0255589',6.9,15807,'ko','섬','Mute Hee-Jin is working as a clerk in a fishing resort in the Korean wilderness; selling baits, food and occasionally her body to the fishing tourists. One day she falls in love with Hyun-Shik, who is on the run from the police, and rescues him with a fish hook when he tries to commit suicide.','/zl8QGUiyjkdS7JNoPeXB7HLzYJR.jpg','2000-04-22',90,'Released','A beautiful yet dangerous place...','The Isle',8653,3.81,6.9,'NjpAjs70S9Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16341,_binary '\0','/p1iGi77Bf5Sj9eERNA62ZQ4l48Y.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0255605',5.7,5149,'en','Snow White','Snow White\'s mother dies during childbirth, leaving baby Snow and father John for dead on an icy field, who then receives a visit from one of Satan\'s representatives, granting him three wishes.','/xIjplbyfFDbHsN7ZK40klO5nnUw.jpg','2001-10-28',93,'Released','Still the fairest story of them all.','Snow White',32593,3.6316,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16342,_binary '\0','/A5C6YsURY43rG1tdFloo4CkfdSj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0255641',7.9,1464,'ml','താളവട്ടം','Vinod/Vinu (played by Mohanlal) is mentally ill and is hospitalized in the institution run by Dr. Ravindran ( M G Soman). Story progresses as Vinod recovers with the help of Dr. Savithri, Dr. Ravindran\'s daughter (Karthika) and Dr. Unnikrishnan (Nedumudi Venu) who finds that Vinu fell ill after the accidental death of his fiancée Anitha (Lizy). Later Vinu and Savithri fall in love but Savithri is already engaged to be married to her cousin, Hari(Mukesh). Plot progresses as Dr. Ravindran opposes the romance between the doctor and the recovered patient.','/eyRstPSfxtdEy0ppMFlkWISNdkg.jpg','1986-10-09',147,'Released',NULL,'Thalavattam',256372,1.1008,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16343,_binary '\0','/clTpVzNRRqIxknkxgZ0al82lsyC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0255643',8.1,3654,'ml','തേന്മാവിന്‍ കൊമ്പത്ത്','Sreekrishnan unknowingly falls in love with the woman his best friend, Manikyan, loves. Though Sreekrishnan tries his best to woo her, she resists, leading to a battle that ensues between the friends.','/9yW0mjzSqHRNczQRTQyJhHzKBgO.jpg','1994-01-22',164,'Released',NULL,'Thenmavin Kombath',247729,1.5245,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16344,_binary '\0','/zBaq5vRgaZteQq0GqtytWVs0LVW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0255653',6.7,5631,'en','Tortilla Soup','A Mexican-American master chef and father to three daughters has lost his taste for food but not for life.','/2JTgaodnScJHIyRrQTtaawOd949.jpg','2001-08-24',103,'Released','A comedy to arouse your appetite.','Tortilla Soup',15104,2.5595,6.421,'wWYj8gVdgZU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16345,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0255668',7.9,1520,'ml','വന്ദനം','Professor Kurian Fernandez escapes from jail with his cellmate Raghu. Inspectors, Unnikrishnan and K.Purushothaman Nair are sent to track him down. They follow Kurian Fernadez\'s daughter to track him.','/fxZZXplqO2Yc7sJGLmMo9kSHGcI.jpg','1989-05-14',180,'Released',NULL,'Vandanam',18149,1.179,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16346,_binary '\0','/uHDTgAcEzlik1crKe9Z0304uv2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0255702',5.2,2353,'en','Wishcraft','Brett is a high-school outcast who doesn\'t run with the in crowd, unlike Samantha, the cheerleader he has a desperate crush on. Then one day, he gets a parcel in the mail -- a totem with the power to grant his deepest, darkest desires. Brett wishes for Samantha to love him, and she does, although after a while her affection starts leaning toward obsession. Then murders start occurring in the school, which Brett gradually starts to connect to the totem.','/xCHr1JaeGEFQmnJmZ3t1BeEBPwR.jpg','2002-09-25',102,'Released','Be careful what you wish for.','Wishcraft',24649,2.6902,5.2,'LBpf7ws7kWM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16347,_binary '\0','/d0LvPveoC0Tu2CrvoexOgFcp38F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0255713',6.6,1904,'hi','ज़ुबेदा','Zubeidaa, an aspiring Muslim actress, marries a Hindu prince to become his second wife. Her tumultuous relationship with her husband, and her inner demons lead her to a decision which has fatal consequences for them all.','/mLKbYm0qhjmRbK5lu28mI5Xi3dy.jpg','2001-01-19',150,'Released',NULL,'Zubeidaa',262120,1.2986,5.206,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16348,_binary '\0','/nLWvnjWgm8CoVPaoaY2pNnVCwoz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0255798',4.9,67942,'en','The Animal','When loser Marvin Mange is involved in a horrible car accident, he\'s brought back to life by a deranged scientist as half man and half animal. His newfound powers are awesome -- but their adverse side effects could take over his life. Now, Marvin must fight to control his crazy primal urges around his new squeeze, Rianna, and his rival, Sgt. Sisk, who both think he\'s one cool cat.','/oNxEXmKTZtECHs0bQbI6dQoXYMV.jpg','2001-06-01',83,'Released','He wasn\'t much of a man... Now he\'s not much of an animal!','The Animal',11090,9.0285,5.2,'pBwcksgKcFs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16349,_binary '\0','/wyMfhalkfbEjrAnvlqs9zOnDsCZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0255819',6.5,18893,'en','Baby Boy','The story of Jody, a misguided, 20-year-old African-American who is really just a baby boy finally forced-kicking and screaming to face the commitments of real life. Streetwise and jobless, he has not only fathered two children by two different women-Yvette and Peanut but still lives with his own mother. He can\'t seem to strike a balance or find direction in his chaotic life.','/9dcic3zV5Gq6BQ1Et696qBtp9Xg.jpg','2001-06-27',130,'Released','Just a Baby Boy.','Baby Boy',16161,5.6364,7.106,'kgwOhuEft5Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16350,_binary '\0','/4j2ZMgGF8rNIoIYnRPPlT7sGb5e.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0255851',7.1,1240,'en','Boycott','This made-for-TV movie dramatizes the historic boycott of public buses in the 1950s, led by civil rights leader Dr. Martin Luther King, Jr.','/pk7u9Pvm5e8Zef2UiosM3aDi5Z6.jpg','2001-02-24',118,'Released','The Story of Martin Luther King and One Act of Defiance That Changed a Nation','Boycott',205361,1.7225,6.7,'i18fKu_fANQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16351,_binary '\0','/cQL39T3gY7eIl7zzpiiioSKrDnT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0255958',7,2693,'ru','Даун Хаус','Programmer Prince Myshkin returns to his historical homeland from Switzerland, where he was undergoing treatment in a psychiatric clinic. On the bus, the prince meets businessman Parfen Rogozhin, who is suffering from lovesickness for Nastasya Filippovna.','/mkEzedgAziNqOiBv6TbDeyAhrLi.jpg','2001-06-06',80,'Released',NULL,'Down House',63958,1.4473,6.232,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16352,_binary '\0','/iUFylO8khUHGiSJanUZQfzZYyXI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0256009',7.3,76185,'es','El espinazo del diablo','Spain, 1939. In the last days of the Spanish Civil War, the young Carlos arrives at the Santa Lucía orphanage, where he will make friends and enemies as he follows the quiet footsteps of a mysterious presence eager for revenge.','/iP1z1aJzPnkP8FHg77TS7ukqoEZ.jpg','2001-04-20',108,'Released','What is a ghost?','The Devil\'s Backbone',1433,5.861,7.3,'RZi4geYuSNE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16353,_binary '\0','/qoxriJ6n1qxvG1bBMPnsZBHKGco.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0256103',6,14257,'en','Intimacy','Failed musician Jay abandoned his family and now earns a living as head bartender in a trendy London pub. Every Wednesday afternoon, a woman comes to his house for graphic, almost wordless, sex. One day, Jay follows her and learns about her. This eventually disrupts their relationship.','/aiPhBVo2eNhuPw5Pezx4BHagvUx.jpg','2001-01-20',120,'Released','Every Wednesday. She meets him once per week.','Intimacy',11845,9.0781,6.2,'RxRMDE1RToc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16354,_binary '\0','/tVtkhIUKs4G0lSQ6F5txaMxQlsk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0256155',3.2,1428,'en','Beneath Loch Ness','A scientific expedition to Loch Ness runs into trouble when the group leader is killed in a mysterious diving accident. Soon after, when the unorthodox Professor Howell shows up to take over as leader of the group, more strange incidents and attacks start to occur. While Howell and TV producer Elizabeth Borden are busy investigating the source of the attacks, the body of an enormous sea creature washes up on the lake\'s shore.','/rklrzv8F2Cz10iMAGdDs9wAwj9.jpg','2001-07-06',96,'Released',NULL,'Beneath Loch Ness',27009,1.8115,3.8,'Nzx4B9bGfJg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16355,_binary '\0','/bbhM7N5GvYmO68yuj15gPVS6Ni6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0256259',7,1869,'nl','Pauline & Paulette','Pauline is a \'little girl of 66 years old\'. She is mentally retarded and been cared after by her sister Martha. When Martha dies, her two younger sisters, Paulette and Cecile have to make a decision on the best place for Pauline to be looked after. Neither of them is ready to take care of her. Paulette has a shop to look after and Cecile has her Albert. But according to Martha\'s last will, her fortune will only be divided in three equal parts if one of the sisters looks after Pauline. If they decide to take her to an institution, Pauline will be the only heir.','/d4uhUCENFLXauTEcpAkZqoNVYct.jpg','2001-06-27',78,'Released',NULL,'Pauline & Paulette',25110,2.123,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16356,_binary '\0','/aHhlnznHGimQbIo6CXov0g0RG2b.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0256276',6.3,14061,'en','Possession','Maud Bailey, a brilliant English academic, is researching the life and work of poet Christabel La Motte. Roland Michell is an American scholar in London to study Randolph Henry Ash, now best-known for a collection of poems dedicated to his wife. When Maud and Roland discover a cache of love letters that appear to be from Ash to La Motte, they follow a trail of clues across England, echoing the journey of the couple over a century earlier.','/12z5oCy4s3GBOUrNCWvcKYBK4eI.jpg','2002-08-16',102,'Released','The past will connect them. The passion will possess them.','Possession',30072,3.6978,6,'UP6jeq2MeUo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16357,_binary '\0','/eekWPyhZTpeAxc54lkXgKD9RswS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0256359',6.5,4483,'en','The Safety of Objects','In a suburban landscape, the lives of several families interlace with loss, despair and personal crisis. Esther Gold has lost focus on all but caring for her comatose son, Paul, and neglects her daughter and husband. Lawyer Jim Train is devoted to his career, not his family. Helen Christianson wants to find a new spark in life, while Annette Jennings tries to rebuild hers.','/i7w5Q2HP3dI6UbN59l3ZL55weir.jpg','2002-10-25',121,'Released','What do you hold on to when your world turns upside down?','The Safety of Objects',24186,2.9286,6.5,'wNbZB9zpSlE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16358,_binary '\0','/7QkEgz9pEnS9AYzQmu465LMSwh0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0256380',6,155739,'en','Shallow Hal','After taking his dying father\'s advice, Hal dates only the embodiments of female physical perfection. But that all changes after Hal has an unexpected run-in with self-help guru Tony Robbins. Intrigued by Hal\'s shallowness, Robbins hypnotizes him into seeing the beauty that exists even in the least physically appealing women. Hal soon falls for Rosemary, but he doesn\'t realize that his gorgeous girlfriend is actually a 300-pound-not-so-hottie.','/q4lZrHWTWuybb6pzMucj1c0ngCW.jpg','2001-11-01',114,'Released','Only a man this shallow could fall in love this deep.','Shallow Hal',9889,10.0242,6.184,'YGaqlO9bClk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16359,_binary '\0','/cQm7tq2QHEr3oE3t6q3kKC9nONZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0256408',7.1,3498,'en','Startup.com','Friends since high school, 20-somethings Kaleil Isaza Tuzman and Tom Herman have an idea: a Web site for people to conduct business with municipal governments. This documentary tracks the rise and fall of govWorks.com from May of 1999 to December of 2000, and the trials the business brings to the relationship of these best friends. Kaleil raises the money, Tom\'s the technical chief. A third partner wants a buy out; girlfriends come and go; Tom\'s daughter needs attention. And always the need for cash and for improving the site. Venture capital comes in by the millions. Kaleil is on C-SPAN, CNN, and magazine covers. Will the business or the friendship crash first?','/ognPQebXUCRfKwAyRodR0j0xLjd.jpg','2001-01-21',107,'Released',NULL,'Startup.com',14268,1.2465,6.7,'bZ27rbJH6hI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16360,_binary '\0','/xE0ouu4yVA4fBojdHg2UkfvRxY4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0256415',6.2,137063,'en','Sweet Home Alabama','New York fashion designer Melanie Carmichael suddenly finds herself engaged to the city\'s most eligible bachelor. But her past holds many secrets—including Jake, the redneck husband she married in high school, who refuses to divorce her. Bound and determined to end their contentious relationship once and for all, Melanie sneaks back home to Alabama to confront her past.','/698cbxq0SRwCdOPG5Bwi7JDk12d.jpg','2002-09-26',108,'Released','Sometimes what you\'re looking for is right where you left it.','Sweet Home Alabama',11529,7.7941,6.4,'BM89EgWx_Gs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16361,_binary '\0','/zYb4eTmDQyW5dmXZz1nvmU0nyF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0256459',6.7,2845,'en','The Truth About Jane','High schooler Jane struggles with the self-discovery that she is a lesbian after developing an intense friendship with another girl. However, this is only the start of Jane\'s troubles when her unaccepting mother Janice also contends with the surprising revelation brought forth by her only daughter.','/e4BheMHfvzFxCKWOWG4CdV2YaOr.jpg','2000-08-07',91,'Released',NULL,'The Truth About Jane',52805,2.022,6.3,'GgQUl7V1E30','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16362,_binary '\0','/3Uwk8UQjFcqs5QYhIGEEQhKRmze.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0256466',5.7,2218,'en','The Ultimate Christmas Present','When 13-year-old Allie Thompson and her best friend Sam happen upon a weather-making machine discarded by none other than Santa Claus, they use it to cause a snow day in Los Angeles. But when the machine gets out of hand, it threatens to ruin Christmas.','/4h5gZzj4l1TwOglj5ve0KSLFojz.jpg','2000-12-01',85,'Released','Los Angeles: a little sun, a little fun, and this Christmas... a lot of snow!','The Ultimate Christmas Present',71887,2.6974,5.4,'SIkMY3mdmmE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16363,_binary '\0','/vq4vYFV0TWCCovAFLcdZLCo4Qud.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0256524',6.7,43188,'en','The Curse of the Jade Scorpion','CW Briggs is a veteran insurance investigator, with many successes. Betty Ann Fitzgerald is a new employee in the company he works for, with the task of reorganizing the office. They don\'t like each other - or at least that\'s what they think. During a night out with the rest of the office employees, they go to watch Voltan, a magician who secretly hypnotizes both of them.','/mfvWefUp09oaLLxb8KhsvUYi7mX.jpg','2001-08-24',103,'Released','Love stings','The Curse of the Jade Scorpion',2779,4.6913,6.609,'_XQ_jlkWP7Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16364,_binary '\0','/fPbO1RDr7zEe2x8jCyQf1zCP1Vp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0256692',5.5,6025,'hi','चोरी चोरी चुपके चुपके','Raj and Priya are newly married. Priya is heavy with children, but due to unexpected circumstances, she loses her child and is unable to conceive again. Enter Madhoo, a prostitute who is willing to become surrogate mother for the couple. Their relationship becomes entangled with love triangle when Madhoo falls in love with Raj.','/lwanyGNvbpMO7AzRj18qhO46bcs.jpg','2001-03-09',160,'Released',NULL,'Chori Chori Chupke Chupke',107548,1.5195,5.94,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16365,_binary '\0','/ycXqbIrKgIAfjIpKLKJrrzqAh5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0256739',6,1427,'de','Emil und die Detektive','The twelve-year-old Emil and his father are haunted by bad luck. To take a break from a series of family disasters, Emil is allowed to spend a few days with a friend of the family, the female priest Hummel in Berlin. In the train he runs across the slick Max Grundeis who anaesthetizes Emil and steals his savings of 1500 DM. When he finally arrives in Berlin, Emil and a gang of street kids, led by the cheeky girl Pony Hütchen, try to find the gangster, who haunts the posh Hotel Adlon as a hotel thief. Meanwhile, to prevent anyone from finding out about Emil\'s mishap, Gypsi, a member of the gang of kids, passes himself off as Emil, thus wreaking havoc on the home of the priest.','/pUZzX1DY849sWSTnncNQUhQuXSP.jpg','2001-02-22',111,'Released',NULL,'Emil and the Detectives',10556,2.5973,6.4,'JJn4NmjDCVc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16366,_binary '\0','/wnuJmJQdMzuouQHEMLzk2dCJaqv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0256858',5.2,1493,'en','Killers','Odessa and Kyle James were just your average American boys until the night they went upstairs and killed their parents in cold blood... and smiled.','/zsbnZItIs4LZEFy1LOJQCqVG7Zj.jpg','1996-12-31',87,'Released','Meet the New Jamez Boyz!','Killers',51776,1.8265,5.258,'vyb4WlpV6BI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16367,_binary '\0','/t3SiKcENc5SafwMzJH1MLLTKDwR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0256951',8.2,1603,'hi','नदिया के पार','Chandan lives with his elder brother and uncle. One day while going across the river to get some medications for his uncle, he meets with Gunja, and both eventually fall in love. Fate makes Gunja\'s sister, Roopa, get married to Chandan\'s brother. Roopa dies in a freak accident. The family decides that Chandan\'s brother should get married again, and they propose marriage to Gunja. Will Chandan sacrifice his love for his nephew, and brother? Will Gunja accept her brother-in-law as her husband?','/1qhUaP7kqsbO7P6JWgjITtkWnfn.jpg','1982-01-01',149,'Released',NULL,'Nadiya Ke Paar',305834,1.2103,8.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16368,_binary '\0','/cDDyZ2qtBzNAepdTbgxKfFcxREl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0257044',7.6,302995,'en','Road to Perdition','Mike Sullivan works as a hit man for crime boss John Rooney. Sullivan views Rooney as a father figure, however after his son is witness to a killing, Mike Sullivan finds himself on the run in attempt to save the life of his son and at the same time looking for revenge on those who wronged him.','/loSpBeirRfTPJ3cMIqpQArstGhh.jpg','2002-07-12',117,'Released','Pray for Michael Sullivan.','Road to Perdition',4147,11.677,7.362,'LFe6arz3NcY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16369,_binary '\0','/dfSAFTqNLfB3YAs9Ppy13EUaNYI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0257076',6.1,160895,'en','S.W.A.T.','Hondo Harrelson recruits Jim Street to join an elite unit of the Los Angeles Police Department. Together they seek out more members, including tough Deke Kay and single mom Chris Sanchez. The team\'s first big assignment is to escort crime boss Alex Montel to prison. It seems routine, but when Montel offers a huge reward to anyone who can break him free, criminals of various stripes step up for the prize.','/bf1tgM4V6NoMjOhejwaRMBKThTT.jpg','2003-08-08',117,'Released','You\'re either S.W.A.T. or you\'re not.','S.W.A.T.',9257,11.6032,6.161,'Q-4MvX9zNgU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16370,_binary '\0','/cjSB3ZjaMpaa9oHFyeYha3KG0mp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0257106',5.4,200439,'en','Scary Movie 2','A group of students visit a mansion called \"Hell House,\" and murderous high jinks ensue.','/7Eb1JWK0Cb0rbfsYjwfc9g0PbQH.jpg','2001-07-04',82,'Released','No more mercy. No more shame. No more sequels - honest! - We lied.','Scary Movie 2',4248,19.3271,5.851,'wsHCoKGxjLk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16371,_binary '\0','/pi9H23H7DHE9tTeOha1IWhse34D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0257215',6.9,1270,'sv','En sång för Martin','Martin, conductor of a symphonic orchestra, meet Barbara, violine player and they start a relationship. Five years later Martin starts to develop loss of memory and becomes more and more confused. Finally he is diagnosed with Alzheimer\'s disease and Barbara tries to help as much as possible although Martin is often angry and violent towards her.','/n1QeC2dB3PzNDzbQs0AZEbQEeT7.jpg','2001-03-16',118,'Released',NULL,'A Song for Martin',38960,1.4792,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16372,_binary '\0','/nh8SmeNsG96fY7Wrg2xi899NesA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0257231',6.4,9140,'es','Torrente 2: Misión en Marbella','For this second film in the cult comedy series Torrente takes our fat police officer from Madrid to Marbella in Spain to investigate a villain’s plot to destroy the city with a missile. This James Bond style slapstick comedy became the most successful box-office film in Spanish film history beating out only the first Torrente film.','/9qu0svJv5dgclrHh0GFQMLyC04R.jpg','2001-03-30',99,'Released',NULL,'Torrente 2: Mission in Marbella',1284,3.1286,6.1,'leDEe7K6N5M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16373,_binary '\0','/tajqDJWDfN28Bx6fywVvDdywvzL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0257289',7,1624,'pl','Życie jako śmiertelna choroba przenoszona drogą płciową','Tomasz, a doctor, and atheist, is diagnosed with cancer. His ex-wife offers him the money for treatment in Paris, but his lung cancer is past the operating stage. Facing imminent death, he questions the beliefs he has held all his life and starts experimenting with both his own life and those of others.','/iRs0ncDwata0HXTdVaaGlaUVitl.jpg','2000-09-08',97,'Released',NULL,'Life as a Fatal Sexually Transmitted Disease',81219,1.377,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16374,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0257290',7.7,7840,'hu','Üvegtigris','This film tells the story of a few uneventful days in the life of six pals. Lali, a great fan of America, owns a sandwich stand on the side of the road, called The Glass Tiger. Gaben pinches cars; Fox is a petty swindler; Sanyi a half-wit homeless; Coco can\'t shut up about getting some dough and going to America; Slimmy keeps playing the saxophone, despite the others\' frayed nerves. Gaben talks Lali into buying an old Chevrolet Impala, the real American dream. After the long escapade of getting the car, Lali doesn\'t even get the chance to try the Chevvy out, because a truck completely demolishes it. Fox in the meantime is looking excitedly for the \"Wreck\", what he has been trying to sell for big money. But Lali has sold what he thought to be scrap, not good for anything. Fox is threatened by some tough guys to bring it back or pay up. He has to get money at all costs...','/tBSZcB63mGsnrEJ5y9uwPw0p8tz.jpg','2001-10-18',105,'Released',NULL,'Glass Tiger',22974,1.5623,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16375,_binary '\0','/gz4ZIoruJ5e5n3SByTJeDS7qAcs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0257360',7.2,137538,'en','About Schmidt','A recently retired man embarks on a journey to his estranged daughter\'s wedding, only to discover more about himself and life than he ever expected.','/tstvsrJHY57hc951lb190alXRQm.jpg','2002-12-12',125,'Released','Schmidt Happens.','About Schmidt',2755,4.6879,6.9,'G-dafG40eGU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16376,_binary '\0','/fvitJlMQHTpBY5HuFSLPvwNbdoi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0257497',8,1531,'fr','La Commune (Paris, 1871)','In 1871, a journalist for Versailles Television broadcasts a soothing and official view of events while a Commune television is set up to provide the perspectives of the Paris rebels. On a stage-like set, more than 200 actors interpret denizens of the Commune, especially the Popincourt neighborhood in the XIth arrondissement. They voice thoughts and feelings concerning the social and political reforms.','/rz39nFOxbeHAHx56ac4ao27OJbw.jpg','2003-07-03',345,'Released',NULL,'La Commune (Paris, 1871)',63195,1.9552,7.5,'N3a_7oskju8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16377,_binary '\0','/aJ4s9UjVdmkmsnx9NHpmdUqZxlz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0257516',5.1,37715,'en','Cursed','A werewolf loose in Los Angeles changes the lives of three young adults who, after being mauled by the beast, learn that the only way to break the curse put upon them is to kill the one who started it all.','/em45jL4CfTMyj5V83kj7rhdorJu.jpg','2005-02-25',97,'Released','Beware the full moon.','Cursed',10012,5.6061,5.582,'_e56-jMfL9I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16378,_binary '\0','/eSvRVTDjGJCbyc9Z51tvwMcs9B3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0257568',4.5,36322,'en','Kangaroo Jack','Two childhood friends — a New York hairstylist and a wanna-be musician — get mixed-up with the mob and are forced to deliver $50,000 to Australia, but things go all wrong when the money is lost to a wild kangaroo.','/3sphb3Bm8PZ5nqLaQ4u4yv2sSyx.jpg','2003-01-17',89,'Released','He stole the money... and he\'s not giving it back.','Kangaroo Jack',10628,6.4924,5.31,'QxAI1vg_YVU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16379,_binary '\0','/qRr6Mm8lywPySB1B7j4WHx7tGwE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0257756',6.4,52389,'en','High Crimes','A female attorney learns that her husband is really a marine officer who has been AWOL for fifteen years and accused of murdering fifteen civilians in El Salvador. Believing her husband when he tells her that he\'s being framed as part of a U.S. Military cover-up, the attorney defends him in a military court.','/hywuHoNTiDXp0M32LUa228EQ2br.jpg','2002-04-05',115,'Released','Everything you trust. Everything you know. May be a lie...','High Crimes',11560,8.6792,6.335,'FD51I774-TQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16380,_binary '\0','/kb6hMCaaou6lzfcDMLOJ8s4swDm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0257850',7.1,7322,'en','The Laramie Project','\"The Laramie Project\" is set in and around Laramie, Wyoming, in the aftermath of the murder of 21-year-old Matthew Shepard. To create the stage version of \"The Laramie Project,\" the eight-member New York-based Tectonic Theatre Project traveled to Laramie, Wyoming, recording hours of interviews with the town\'s citizens over a two-year period. The film adaptation dramatizes the troupe\'s visit, using the actual words from the transcripts to create a portrait of a town forced to confront itself.','/9Aj4DdvSZp7XRpIVbBXN3EccDwX.jpg','2002-01-10',95,'Released','Everyone carries a piece of the truth.','The Laramie Project',19448,3.4816,6.2,'mCWYOW_4Bvc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16381,_binary '\0','/gJfd2SzUsvY1q1iszthJ3ryuvEA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0258000',6.8,317054,'en','Panic Room','Trapped in their New York brownstone\'s panic room, a hidden chamber built as a sanctuary in the event of break-ins, newly divorced Meg Altman and her young daughter Sarah play a deadly game of cat-and-mouse with three intruders - Burnham, Raoul and Junior - during a brutal home invasion. But the room itself is the focal point because what the intruders really want is inside it.','/hANYbvfwxmkC9E4yY6YyJxYxlSJ.jpg','2002-03-29',111,'Released','It was supposed to be the safest room in the house.','Panic Room',4547,10.7383,6.794,'yCMKOqL94BQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16382,_binary '\0','/csH5MGh51Ndz1bJ3MHhukjs0Pyo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0258038',5.3,15913,'en','Pootie Tang','Pootie Tang, the musician/actor/folk hero of the ghetto, is chronicled from his early childhood to his battles against the evil Corporate America, who try to steal his magic belt and make him sell out by endorsing addictive products to his people. Pootie must learn to find himself and defeat the evil corporation for all the young Black children of America, supatime.','/fNvx45x4JWHYucpnV2vuKn9TZnV.jpg','2001-06-29',81,'Released','Too cool for words.','Pootie Tang',10615,3.2681,5.118,'dpV2ULCb6WU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16383,_binary '\0','/fay6quwuE1sqGJ7R9I2PH5SNmTn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0258068',7,31314,'en','The Quiet American','Cynical British journalist Fowler falls in love with a young Vietnamese woman but is dismayed when a naïve U.S. official also begins vying for her attention. In retaliation, Fowler informs the communists that the American is selling arms to their enemy.','/nLooNNrvzpf49G7HsB9siQT4036.jpg','2002-11-22',101,'Released','In war, the most powerful weapon is seduction.','The Quiet American',8198,4.2236,6.5,'UrI9gS6O-p8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16384,_binary '\0','/hBlYimYFistZDTK4i7C0Tk4NI5x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0258100',6.2,6353,'en','Run Ronnie Run','A redneck with an uncanny knack for getting arrested becomes the star of his own reality program.','/3AYJFRGu3rEGfFurxlc53RWiSWQ.jpg','2002-01-20',84,'Released','He didn’t get his 15 minutes of fame… He stole it.','Run Ronnie Run',14923,2.2828,5.9,'w2GWWpHKAIo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16385,_binary '\0','/pc3GErXMuP9Uol3pPc6Tk5TwWwP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0258153',6.1,64562,'en','S1m0ne','The career of a disillusioned producer, who is desperate for a hit, is endangered when his star walks off the film set. Forced to think fast, the producer decides to digitally create an actress \"Simone\" to sub for the star — the first totally believable synthetic actress.','/mdHEOCSGPvwa9pYiV1ZDZ1ihj42.jpg','2002-08-23',117,'Released','A star is... created.','S1m0ne',9296,3.6651,6,'HuAjeuKXX7c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16386,_binary '\0','/k61yNqKbQjokBZh2bvmXjieuSnH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0258273',6.7,8234,'en','Lovely & Amazing','An intimate family portrait of four hapless but resilient women and the bittersweet lessons they learn in keeping up with the hectic demands of their individual neuroses. Each of the women seeks redemption in her own haphazard way, but whatever salvation they find is illusory and short-lived.','/4HZ7Y7N4KHapO5ylOY8BePQYC5X.jpg','2002-08-02',92,'Released','If you\'re hoping for the perfect family don\'t hold your breath.','Lovely & Amazing',50035,2.8617,6.1,'B-rUuqyeObI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16387,_binary '\0','/hYiU4CJNaZInVXSUiFkS1BSnqs6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0258291',5.8,1688,'sv','Vingar av glas','Nazli is 18, born in Iran, raised in Sweden. She lives with her father Abbas and her older sister Mahin. Nazli, who wants to blend in calls herself Sara. One day Abbas tell her how he sees her future. He is planning a party for their friends and relatives. He also plans to invite two Iranian men, whom he sees as potential husbands for his daughters. Nazli, who has a very good relationship with his father, is appalled. When she meets with her Swedish boyfriend Johan, the situation immediately gets very complicated.','/aqVbPcOsZVhv5MjyiixprridVgR.jpg','2000-10-20',105,'Released',NULL,'Wings of Glass',30148,1.347,4.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16388,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0258351',6.6,1318,'en','Fidel','Centered on the six years before the fall of Batista\'s dictatorship and the subsequent 40 years of the Cuban Revolution.','/r6GF1DTLIeNGG3UaqzJFuaSh7xK.jpg','2002-01-27',205,'Released','Some would betray him. Others would never forgive him. No one will ever forget him.','Fidel',60370,1.29,5.1,'pN0scxr-SYc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16389,_binary '\0','/kJaRWmy1BGq3pHyE94LOTteiHer.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0258463',7.8,620672,'en','The Bourne Identity','Wounded to the brink of death and suffering from amnesia, Jason Bourne is rescued at sea by a fisherman. With nothing to go on but a Swiss bank account number, he starts to reconstruct his life, but finds that many people he encounters want him dead. However, Bourne realizes that he has the combat and mental skills of a world-class spy—but who does he work for?','/aP8swke3gmowbkfZ6lmNidu0y9p.jpg','2002-06-14',119,'Released','He was the perfect weapon until he became the target.','The Bourne Identity',2501,20.4384,7.486,'PGKK5wACwrU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16390,_binary '\0','/vUq8oKAnONAbYxIDNw4CQcEuADd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0258470',5.7,36533,'en','Bubble Boy','Jimmy is a young man who was born without an immune system and has lived his life within a plastic bubble in his bedroom... who pines for the sweet caresses of girl-next-door Chloe. But when Chloe decides to marry her high school boyfriend, Jimmy – bubble suit and all – treks cross-country to stop her.','/tFwvUSc8g0HHvDOBQ2rvC9LWVSj.jpg','2001-08-24',84,'Released','Life is an adventure. Don\'t blow it.','Bubble Boy',9683,3.9877,5.8,'O1_W2zfCSXo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16391,_binary '\0','/l2erRhchjH7qDktvTInRbaf13K4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0258489',6.7,1255,'cn','鎗王','Rick Pang, an IPSC champion who is also a gun expert who tinkers with his pistols to perfect his technique known as \'double tap\' which is the terminology where a shooter can place two exact shots in the same spot to maximize marksmanship.','/iVyN43Q3qZaj9HwkyktKWveFmrH.jpg','2000-05-27',96,'Released','Are You Ready?','Double Tap',127849,1.89,6.4,'pms3Zp8Fup0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16392,_binary '\0','/fku0yFRcYZjDuIUGABOpPu5x1hk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0258490',8.1,6596,'te','ఖుషి','College friends Siddhu and Madhumati part ways due to a misunderstanding. Although they are in love and realize they cannot live without each other, their egos prevent them from uniting.','/nYF9YgePZbskWvdtmwVmsDMTRIf.jpg','2001-04-26',169,'Released',NULL,'Khushi',81070,1.3569,6.556,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16393,_binary '\0','/vK0KkUP57W4N8CtbSaRlqXXjXIz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0258760',7.2,12470,'de','Lammbock','Stefan and Kai run a thriving business: a home-grown cannabis trade disguised as a pizza delivery service. For now they just have to fight aphids.','/z1AeFrBKkdZBUi4YvP7TsaQ7zoe.jpg','2001-08-23',93,'Released',NULL,'Lammbock',1583,1.2676,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16394,_binary '\0','/fGWpHs4qLg8zvVkYOD6BrINS4GY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0258761',7.2,2362,'en','Last Resort','Tanya leaves Moscow with her street-wise 10-year-old son Artiom to meet her English fiancée in London. But after he fails to turn up at the airport, Tanya, intent on staying in England, is forced to apply for political asylum and transferred to Stonehaven, a grimy former seaside resort where refugees are housed. Tanya gradually develops a relationship with an amusement arcade manager, who helps them escape. She must then decide whether to stay with him or return to Russia.','/b2sr7f28WuydA3IlvZtSGKVQ26D.jpg','2000-02-23',73,'Released',NULL,'Last Resort',31875,1.5579,6.3,'ENKvaGZN_1Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16395,_binary '\0','/gv1n0cvgaRuDxq8MTpB2ExIlozg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0258766',6.9,1942,'ja','日本黒社会 LEY LINES','The story follows a trio of Japanese youths of Chinese descent who escape their semi-rural upbringing and relocate to Shinjuku, Tokyo, where they befriend a troubled Shanghai prostitute and fall foul of a local crime syndicate. Like many of Miike\'s works, the film examines the underbelly of respectable Japanese society and the problems of assimilation faced by non-ethnically Japanese people in Japan.','/dDZTPig5u6zToILu3uYaFGCZYIV.jpg','1999-05-22',105,'Released',NULL,'Ley Lines',19337,1.7166,6.4,'9hB0d_u-6Zk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16396,_binary '\0','/njUgaQiMubIqErfN0Ken7BoXEKC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0258816',6.4,6746,'en','The Reckoning','In 14th Century England, this tale of murder and mystery follows a fugitive priest who falls in with a troupe of actors. As they arrive in a small town, the actors encounter a woman being sentenced to death for practicing witchcraft and murder. Discarding the expected bible stories, the actors now stage a performance based on the crime. Through the performance of the play, they discover a mystery.','/pv2ocoAR3b4TJ4oGQMIy1CJx2wQ.jpg','2004-02-26',112,'Released','The truth shall come to light.','The Reckoning',25935,2.4266,6.4,'uA1UojoCYfs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16397,_binary '\0','/dDVSRkk5ALWqT1vfwYCB6Be8LN5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0258827',5.4,4858,'de','Mädchen Mädchen!','The adventures of three teenage girls - Inken, Vicky and Lena - and their quest to have their first orgasm.','/edGsy5IFi6m6xe6JWFqUoKPiJ1n.jpg','2001-03-29',90,'Released',NULL,'Girls on Top',9337,2.9242,5.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16398,_binary '\0','/2zdZ0l7f4WydN4j98KWAKujWXTz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0258885',7.4,3516,'zh','站台','China’s rapid changes from the late 1970s to the early 1990s, as seen through the lives of four performers in a theater troupe.','/kFsp0NVmzHskDVoCjbpc9Asy8dV.jpg','2001-08-29',155,'Released',NULL,'Platform',80427,1.7062,7.1,'X92BU-BwQrI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16399,_binary '\0','/cJVJMpj8f7YhlSC6v6fBBJ4x8k0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0258960',6.6,2643,'ja','新宿黒社会 チャイナマフィア戦争','Tatsuhito, a cop, pursues Chinese warlord Wang through the underworld of Shinjuku and over to Taiwan.','/9C80qHKjbwgxDko88z6rxZ33Jjw.jpg','1995-08-26',100,'Released',NULL,'Shinjuku Triad Society',36250,1.4614,6.239,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16400,_binary '\0','/gtcDzhmnTV3eRrEx3FyNKWjNmmT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0258967',6.6,6965,'en','The Unsaid','A doctor dealing with the aftermath of his son\'s death tries to help a troubled young man.','/5tPbEeT5oQTOatgwBxYYfGf2DwV.jpg','2001-09-14',111,'Released',NULL,'The Unsaid',14782,2.7862,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16401,_binary '\0','/1S1QxaWnnXkX9LWk5TDUsicMgnd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0259060',5.8,6543,'fr','La Tour Montparnasse Infernale','Eric and Ramzy are working as window washers at the Montparnasse skyscraper in Paris. Thinking that he has a date set up with beautiful executive Marie-Joelle (who in reality hates his guts), Ramzy stays at work late while Eric hangs around with him. As a result, the pair witness a gang of terrorists seize the tower and take its late-night occupants (including Marie- Joelle) hostage. Knowing that only they can save the day, Eric and Ramzy swing into action.','/4QmPJAQWEqiBIwGTNivK8NYLhes.jpg','2001-03-28',92,'Released',NULL,'Don\'t Die Too Hard!',15449,2.1104,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16402,_binary '\0','/glBc1m1X5sEzdqk6xmx4tc4ukYD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0259072',7.7,9536,'fa','Zamani barayé masti asbha','After their father dies, a family of five children are forced to survive on their own in a Kurdish village on the border of Iran and Iraq.','/hQv7sCP0FddDwVo243Fpf32u4uR.jpg','2000-09-13',80,'Released',NULL,'A Time for Drunken Horses',29270,1.8476,7.6,'7QTStegCCTY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16403,_binary '\0','/vCHtCmcrJe4z2dE3V4mMis0X4tJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0259134',6.7,1536,'fr','Corto Maltese : La Cour secrète des Arcanes','At the end of 1918 while civil war is raging on in Russia, antagonism is slowly spreading to the East, between the Oral mountains and Shanghai. Stuck between a desire to save what\'s left of the great Imperial Russia, and starting from a clean slate, old generals, secret organizations, and mercenaries attracted by gold, struggle to take advantage of the events. As Corto Maltese returns to Shanghai, he barely gets time to cross paths with his old friend/nemesis Rasputin, and escape a murder attempt before being contacted by members of a Chinese secret organization called \"The Red Lanterns\". In the heart of violent Manchurian horizons, Corto and Rasputin launch themselves into a fabulous treasure hunt, following the tracks of the mysterious armor-plated train of Kolchak. A steel monster spiked with canons and machine guns, this trains protects the counter-revolutionaries gold...','/j5GDbGoCTM9pMFTLIqBWPVDulxu.jpg','2002-09-25',92,'Released',NULL,'Corto Maltese: The Secret Court of the Arcane',43071,2.2488,6.517,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16404,_binary '\0','/vUk2NGzv146gru1W5SUk3VXo41R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0259182',7.2,2049,'en','The American Nightmare','An examination into the nature of 1960\'s-70\'s horror films, the involved artists, and how they reflected contemporary society.','/qE21nRtXgUKbDY94tEkCqimn0rg.jpg','2000-09-11',73,'Released',NULL,'The American Nightmare',70779,2.0235,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16405,_binary '\0','/kM9D0sVUiaOclaw1dLNm6a2jEG7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0259288',6.1,41925,'en','Dragonfly','A grieving doctor is being contacted by his late wife through his patient\'s near death experiences.','/tafDYI10ZhorJ6nmsPqUfzQpRLn.jpg','2002-02-22',104,'Released','When someone you love dies... are they gone forever?','Dragonfly',10052,6.614,6.577,'_fglzCnPlec','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16406,_binary '\0','/3GyhaomqlZfZitNF9PujEIyVMOA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0259308',4.7,1728,'en','Felix the Cat: The Movie','In another dimension, the villainous scientist Duke of Zill, with the help of his mechanical, geometric army, ultimately takes over the golden kingdom of Oriana, where Duke has just escaped exile! But Felix the Cat must bravely save Princess Oriana and restore order once again, from her terrible Uncle Zill and his smoke-belching mechanical troops before he can put his sinister plot into action!','/RvUPLEJ3oRJnu9xhY73kBC31o3.jpg','1988-10-01',79,'Released','The cat is back!','Felix the Cat: The Movie',36523,1.963,4.8,'Gn4eSv0Mzqc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16407,_binary '\0','/zbV32WKHFuEYLXLTpr0rmVjQn11.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0259324',5.3,273979,'en','Ghost Rider','In order to save his dying father, young stunt cyclist Johnny Blaze sells his soul to Mephistopheles and sadly parts from the pure-hearted Roxanne Simpson, the love of his life. Years later, Johnny\'s path crosses again with Roxanne, now a go-getting reporter, and also with Mephistopheles, who offers to release Johnny\'s soul if Johnny becomes the fabled, fiery \'Ghost Rider\'.','/4quwR1VwZouD0YF9AaD72kQAjxH.jpg','2007-01-15',114,'Released','Long ago he made a deal to save someone he loved.','Ghost Rider',1250,19.2896,5.623,'nu6R7ypaz5g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16408,_binary '\0','/fggTHMrHqxzjMCRD0sQCrCSczZw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0259340',6.8,1603,'fr','Grégoire Moulin contre l\'humanité','Grégoire Moulin, a shy accountant, sets up a blind date with a dance teacher at a bar. What he needed to do was just to cross the road. But it didn\'t happen to be as easy as it seems especially because of the final game of French soccer championship the very same night!','/aqKgPGhZt4IVgjSsGTKmLNnrxEE.jpg','2001-09-26',90,'Released',NULL,'Gregoire Moulin vs. Humanity',45130,1.765,6.8,'wtAIdgEG8Rg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16409,_binary '\0','/nIKmKhX25M1mCQZS0koexBTRKab.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0259388',6.7,2398,'ja','降霊','A psychic housewife and her husband accidentally find a kidnapped girl. Instead of informing the police, they hatch a scheme to get famous by working with the police as a psychic consultant to \'find\' the girl. Just when it all seems to go right, everything goes horribly wrong.','/97JOZbruPejp4e37Lu8wzOxnlgV.jpg','2004-04-22',97,'Released','Is there a hell?','Séance',27742,1.843,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16410,_binary '\0','/s9ivjpkMFQNRNXbfGBGgFGcthCS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0259393',7.2,20983,'en','Lantana','Plagued with grief over the murder of her daughter, Valerie Somers suspects that her husband John is cheating on her. When Valerie disappears, Detective Leon Zat attempts to solve the mystery of her absence. A complex web of love, sex and deceit emerges -- drawing in four related couples whose various partners are distrustful and suspicious about each other\'s involvement.','/nTEUCdpDsfVDZJ5H0ndP1EmVtj.jpg','2001-10-04',121,'Released','Sometimes love isn\'t enough.','Lantana',9523,2.4688,6.7,'8ayPrLsBs_w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16411,_binary '\0','/8pfnGW6rPtN4f5HmZKs8h1Yv4IH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0259440',7.2,1488,'fr','Se souvenir des belles choses','Although barely 30, Claire believes she is showing the first symptoms of Alzheimer\'s disease, a condition from which her mother has recently died. Her sister, Nathalie, is certain that her memory loss, caused by a lightning strike, is temporary. In the clinic where she is being treated, Claire is attracted to Philippe, a man who is still traumatized after a car accident in which his wife and child were both killed. In spite of their personal tragedies, Claire and Philippe fall in love. When Philippe recovers, Claire moves into his home. Then Claire\'s condition takes a turn for the worse.','/9HnNGkpeGf8Wj0HPd1JFnnqFpp.jpg','2001-08-24',110,'Released',NULL,'Beautiful Memories',8351,1.8136,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16412,_binary '\0','/dSx6DXngFCGwWGvG35XV5WnQZjD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0259442',5.1,1707,'en','The Monkey\'s Mask','A lesbian private detective dives head first into murder, manipulation and the consuming power of sex.','/ndjld6gVqYxsdxG99hnNjwWVZDk.jpg','2001-05-10',93,'Released','No evidence just a smell of sex and violence.','The Monkey\'s Mask',47574,2.3103,4.4,'28KRo5uMzL4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16413,_binary '\0','/3d8Y4q172YFp2obUdfMjyErB7eU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0259446',6.6,152297,'en','My Big Fat Greek Wedding','A young Greek woman falls in love with a non-Greek and struggles to get her family to accept him while she comes to terms with her heritage and cultural identity.','/ztc05ym0T3stnBpRHdxEs3Zwsmp.jpg','2002-04-19',95,'Released','Love is here to stay... so is her family.','My Big Fat Greek Wedding',8346,7.8876,6.495,'O2mecmDFE-Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16414,_binary '\0','/jtWjSUOPiU69kiUaGwDChTklAU8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0259484',7,16733,'en','Paid in Full','Ace is an impressionable young man working for a dry cleaning business. His friend, drug dealer Mitch, goes to prison. In an unrelated incident, he finds some cocaine in a pants pocket. Soon, Ace finds himself dealing cocaine for Lulu. Via lucky breaks and solid interpersonal skills, Ace moves to the top of the Harlem drug world. Of course, unfaithful employees and/or rivals conspire to bring about Ace\'s fall.','/oiG5BObjENJjEacFdWw1KfK3TFx.jpg','2002-10-25',98,'Released','The American Dream... Their way.','Paid in Full',13098,4.6525,6.887,'d9vC9gUnTTc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16415,_binary '\0','/j4zVW7xqw3OdhjcqEyKgtDpiKJf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0259534',9.1,18084,'en','Ramayana : The Legend of Prince Rama','In Ayodhya, the royal palace of Kosala Kingdom in Ancient India, four princes were born to three queens, each of whom grew to great stature. Banished for 14 years due to court intrigue, Prince Rama retreated to the forest with his beautiful wife Sita. When Rama vanquishes the demons of the forest, he invites the wrath of the demon king Ravana, who kidnaps Sita. Based on the Indian epic the Ramayana.','/yqcdzIgsYdaIY2CNtDyWshuLdq0.jpg','1997-11-03',135,'Released','Has there ever been a story in which nature, God, man, and animals were so united in sorrow, fighting, and rejoicing together?','Ramayana : The Legend of Prince Rama',84092,3.4572,8.2,'9GKFfHcKVhk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16416,_binary '\0','/gk9IIYNLvBh15oj4tUX75DyBR8f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0259567',5.4,1485,'en','Perfect Opposites','The story of two college graduates from the Midwest who move to Los Angeles, where their love is tested for the first time.','/tpqIGV3DZCYGvNRRn4cqSDgNa4e.jpg','2004-02-06',90,'Released',NULL,'Perfect Opposites',44593,2.2818,5.6,'BqYzKiiuHdg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16417,_binary '\0','/wwLufumafJojc59hgIamHyJSTO9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0259711',6.9,312094,'en','Vanilla Sky','David Aames has it all: wealth, good looks and gorgeous women on his arm. But just as he begins falling for the warmhearted Sofia, his face is horribly disfigured in a car accident. That\'s just the beginning of his troubles as the lines between illusion and reality, between life and death, are blurred.','/cAh2pCiNPftsY3aSqJuIOde7uWr.jpg','2001-12-14',136,'Released','LoveHateDreamsLifeWorkPlayFriendshipSex.','Vanilla Sky',1903,11.8448,6.8,'7w2gRi0170U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16418,_binary '\0','/ocuPuLuPSXM9nyYPP4JpHRb2TWM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0259786',6.9,2154,'en','Lorna Doone','The year is 1675. England is threatened by religious and political rivalries. King Charles II\'s Catholic brother, James, is next in line for the throne, but many Protestants put their faith in Charles\' illegitimate son, The Duke of Monmouth. On the king\'s death, conflict is inevitable... Over seven days journey from London, Exmoor is a primitive and lawless area. Here, farmer Jack Ridd lives with his wife Sarah, son John, and two daughters. The only shadow over their simple life is cast by the notorious outlaw family the Doones. The aristocratic Doones were banished from their ancestral lands and now live through looting, theft, and murder. Their brutality is legendary...','/kNbE9SbQ3lsZIjeJ3afpoH2uO1U.jpg','2001-03-11',180,'Released','Passion, romance and epic adventure in a classic tale of rivalry and revenge','Lorna Doone',58458,1.4746,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16419,_binary '\0','/k0UwAGTYCe2JgUiRrf4AyOHR33A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0259822',5.5,9243,'en','.45','Kate and her brutish boyfriend Big Al sell handguns on the streets of New York. She\'s smart, stylish, and self-confident, but all that leaves her when Al, in a jealous and self-indulgent rage, beats her. Three friends encourage her recovery: Vic, a woman who would like to be Kate\'s lover; Reilly, who runs with Al but also is attracted to Kate and repulsed by Al\'s violence; and, Liz, the counselor assigned to Kate from a battered-women\'s program. Vic and Reilly talk about killing Al, Liz gives pep talks; Kate remains frightened. Will Al\'s menace and Kate\'s dependency hold sway?','/clv6FaRRliTN5E6GpDJI4FPFguk.jpg','2006-11-30',101,'Released','Nobody does revenge like a woman.','.45',14062,3.3623,5.1,'5Rw2Yh7JFc4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16420,_binary '\0','/4MVi016R3TQ1uNXMWkx2XEN5kCX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0259929',5.4,2418,'en','Christmas Carol: The Movie','Animated version of the classic Charles Dickens story. Warned by the ghost of his old business partner Marley that his sins would lead to punishment in the afterlife, the cruel and greedy Scrooge is visited by the Ghosts of Christmas Past, Present and Future to show him how the course of his life led him to where he is - and where it will lead if he doesn\'t change his ways.','/38NCcPC1zJ6hzQYvzPor5uguvDs.jpg','2001-12-07',77,'Released',NULL,'Christmas Carol: The Movie',35257,3.2086,5.2,'HEStW6KkSBg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16421,_binary '\0','/1ZFUt0LtYkF568iCkRXCScgBP5g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0259974',6.1,8644,'en','Digimon: The Movie','When a powerful new Internet Digimon hatches and begins to consume data at an alarming rate, the Digidestined - kids chosen to save the digital world - must put an end to the destruction before the damage becomes irreversible and worldwide communication halts forever. As computer-based missiles are launched, and a wayward Digimon kidnaps the Digidestined, only the combined efforts of a worldwide network of kids and a new group of \"Digidestined\" can rescue the others and stop global disaster.','/tiH1muonzAWzlLjPhjAcAYVAjzm.jpg','2000-10-06',89,'Released','New monsters. New battles. Now on the big screen.','Digimon: The Movie',20455,4.7148,6.5,'gFuNXUCG4Bs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16422,_binary '\0','/gkeSi7vXrOvoW9mo1vLt9prgMtm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0260191',7.7,2988,'ja','新機動戦記ガンダムＷ Endless Waltz 特別篇','After Colony (A.C.) 196, one year following the end of the battles between the Earth Sphere and the space colonies, peace has spread throughout. The Gundam pilots find themselves attempting to rebuild their lives. No longer having need of their weapons of war, their Gundams are sent into the sun to be destroyed. But suddenly, Relena Darlian, now a high-ranking government official, is kidnapped by a colony with aspirations of total dominance. The pilots and their allies find themselves called into action once again. The Endless Waltz has resumed...','/xbnN0pQwbveJnMi7xKkUEX8rjbr.jpg','1998-08-01',90,'Released','History is much like an endless waltz. The three beats of war, peace, and revolution continue on forever.','Gundam Wing: The Endless Waltz',22914,3.5221,7.3,'z1Bp4gKZX70','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16423,_binary '\0','/kFVfK6udZYnqNaJIxW5nNa51Q8L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0260320',5.7,5551,'en','Repli-Kate','A scientist and his sidekick accidentally clone a journalist and decide to turn the mistake into Repli-Kate, their idea of the perfect woman, who loves, beer, football, and frat parties.','/t4NcV5umUcFcG8bQgZSjdMaCg6e.jpg','2002-01-29',96,'Released','Every guy on campus wants a copy of Kate.','Repli-Kate',16261,2.2223,5.403,'M0KOfjQkVWY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16424,_binary '\0','/ms42duZvrOKa4TSU9b3nmW1BPfl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0260332',7.3,2161,'fa','روزی که زن شدم','A girl reaches the age of nine and is supposed to act as a grown woman according to her family. A girl participates in a bike race against the will of her husband. An elderly woman decides she wants to buy all the things she always wanted but could never get.','/iB9Ky0Vr4edWA9eXdqGxfdGt2l1.jpg','2000-09-01',74,'Released',NULL,'The Day I Became a Woman',44069,1.3164,6.1,'194rTpQhQF0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16425,_binary '\0','/4ckpJMJVdnewoCt0J6hveyNi9Ao.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0260414',7,4233,'en','Taking Sides','One of the most spectacular and renowned conductors of the 1930s, Wilhelm Furtwangler\'s reputation rivaled that of Toscanini\'s. After the war, he was investigated as part of the Allies\' de-Nazification programme. In the bombed-out Berlin of the immediate post-war period, the Allies slowly bring law and order to bear on an occupied Germany. An American major is given the Furtwangler file, and is told to find everything he can and to prosecute the man ruthlessly. Tough and hard-nosed, Major Steve Arnold sets out to investigate a world of which he knows nothing.','/lRkyqGbJC7omaeKgMid8LQcKsLt.jpg','2002-03-07',108,'Released',NULL,'Taking Sides',31094,2.1666,6.3,'SfURytVFKB0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16426,_binary '\0','/bkDY1T0cN1m1QHD8aVjxQTk6AYF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0260494',6.5,1296,'hi','वीराना','A beautiful young girl, possessed from childhood by a vengeful spirit, wanders around lonely places to seduce and kill people and thus, gradually becomes lost in a dark world of revenge and lust.','/u4XUTCxdi9YqYqqJ1cOoXNIMH1U.jpg','1988-05-06',135,'Released',NULL,'Veerana',98122,1.4811,5.9,'CS9rIEpna9w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16427,_binary '\0','/9JLub8iSdrUiNOIoJbCx7ZJlHp6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0260688',7.3,3179,'fr','Ali Zaoua, prince de la rue','Ali, Kwita, Omar and Boubker are street kids. The daily dose of glue sniffing represents their only escape from reality. Since they left Dib and his gang, they have been living on the portside of Casablanca. They live in constant fear of Dib\'s revenge. Ali wants to become a sailor - when he was living with his mother, a prostitute, he used to listen to a fairy tale about the sailor who discovered the miracle island with two suns. Instead of finding his island in the dream, Ali and his friends are confronted with Dib\'s gang. Matters are getting serious.','/5Uf2zhivRpxTNI9c1MjGwjT3Szx.jpg','2001-03-21',99,'Released',NULL,'Ali Zaoua: Prince of the Streets',49167,2.0996,6.7,'o-fMO7c-Ly4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16428,_binary '\0','/biDpaYDBNDk94wzbbw3Tt3Zm6EP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0260866',6.3,68341,'en','Don\'t Say a Word','When the daughter of a psychiatrist is kidnapped, he is horrified to discover that the abductors\' demand is that he break through to a young woman, suffering from PTSD, who knows a secret six digit code number.','/mDawnZWQnePqQbiisEWZaY9e4UI.jpg','2001-09-28',113,'Released','...I\'ll never tell.','Don\'t Say a Word',12103,8.4361,6.3,'aHASWXlET04','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16429,_binary '\0','/xIsZBpQDB7fgNoHMkkgW3vKDEDV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0260932',6.7,1423,'cn','古惑仔2之猛龍過江','Chicken is back in exile. Hung Hing, a triad, is trying to ally with Chicken\'s new group, the Taiwanese triad San Luen. A contest is on in Hong Kong. The winner will head the Causeway Bay branch.','/4pFybR8t2IypYus46KBRuAuwSA4.jpg','1996-03-30',101,'Released',NULL,'Young and Dangerous 2',48938,3.0464,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16430,_binary '\0','/hjxfWQq4cdR28kQ7jTcEgEHeuHr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0260987',7.3,1969,'zh','甲方乙方','Four friends come up with an unusual idea to make some money and have fun doing it. For a small fee, they will impersonate and act out any character role for their customers. In the course of executing this novel service, they encounter a whole spectrum of people in society, finding ways to genuinely help them boost their morale and overcome their fears, while gaining unusual and new insights into the human condition.','/yym0N7KLhHwVvaZuXhP16Ruy9dJ.jpg','1997-02-01',90,'Released',NULL,'The Dream Factory',79279,1.7395,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16431,_binary '\0','/z7w6ACQJTeGYASr1plSwfRe6Ytk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0260991',7.7,39555,'ko','공동경비구역 JSA','Two North Korean soldiers are killed in the border area between North and South Korea, prompting an investigation by a neutral body. The sergeant is the shooter, but the lead investigator, a Swiss-Korean woman, receives differing accounts from the two sides.','/lTpdrei4eWsEsCi4tYYKwdYCFxw.jpg','2000-09-09',108,'Released','Eight shots! The truth is there.','Joint Security Area',2440,6.495,7.8,'9SyVl0SDpjg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16432,_binary '\0','/k3bHHMRuTuqlaqH5rnKGhhzLPDw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0261066',6.2,1466,'en','Piñero','\"Piñero\" tells the story of the explosive life of a Latino icon, the gay poet-playwright-actor Miguel Piñero, whose urban poetry is recognized as a pre-cursor to rap and hip-hop. After doing time in hard-core Sing-Sing for petty thefts and drug dealing, Piñero\'s prison experiences developed into the 1974 Tony-nominated play Short Eyes. The resulting notoriety and fame was too much for the Latino bad-boy genius who retreated to the darker corners of New York City.','/rn1jbfASOd9cndsUr5Tt25jHsVZ.jpg','2001-10-05',103,'Released',NULL,'Piñero',55479,1.8997,6.1,'P3omQ5gs5w4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16433,_binary '\0','/4ZE2jekebM6Tg7DZpJjhIpPsKCG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0261175',6.2,2536,'nl','Pietje Bell','Peter is a cheerful -- but not very obedient -- boy from a very ordinary family in pre-war Rotterdam. His many pranks amuse some and cause a lot of trouble to others, even making the front pages of the big city newspapers. His growing popularity brings him many new friends, but also some very powerful enemies.','/sW3OSCbUbGtMGmbxSWW2x6VtpMN.jpg','2002-11-17',110,'Released',NULL,'Peter Bell',28827,1.0964,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16434,_binary '\0','/8GwGt5aXetp6xQTKTkzjuIax0tA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0261203',6,2584,'en','Prince Charming','After an extramarital indiscretion, a fairy-tale prince and his sidekick are turned into frogs for all eternity or until the prince can convince a maiden to kiss and then marry him.','/sma7B0TJNGfXMzi5Ob9HZOsmsP8.jpg','2001-07-13',91,'Released','So many frogs. So few princes.','Prince Charming',51532,4.2808,6.9,'Dyz45-nMx5w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16435,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0261243',7.4,1499,'en','Rockford','The movie chronicles the arrival of a (Hindu) student to a strict all-boys Christian boarding school in India and his assimilation into the school. The change is quite dramatic to the protagonist and there are a lot of events that could look extremely abusive to the viewer.','/g3arvaLw68T10lONJOcdtMBU06l.jpg','1999-10-07',102,'Released','Take a trip down memory lane...','Rockford',46422,1.834,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16436,_binary '\0','/qZiQ1ISNYjk6xn61NKwpcOGSG9a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0261289',5.3,19785,'en','Serving Sara','When Sara is served divorce papers while she is in New York, she is stunned. Not about to lose the fortune she amassed with her self-serving Texan husband, she makes an offer to her process server, Joe, that sets them off on a wild trip across the country.','/zi8uGxsyhxo0Uzg09ImxLzBDSK3.jpg','2002-08-23',100,'Released','The One Thing That Could Bring Them Together Is Revenge.','Serving Sara',12771,4.9748,5.4,'yH5LUdNfKb0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16437,_binary '\0','/hK6per38QqXr6oAtUosy1E1u1C5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0261311',5.9,2481,'es','Son de mar','A new literature teacher, Ulises, comes to a small town near the sea and falls in love with a young woman, Martina. This woman is loved by a rich businessman named Alberto but chooses Ulises. Soon after their marriage and the birth of their son, Ulises vanishes while fishing at sea. In the meanwhile Martina marries Alberto, but all is not what it seems...','/6WF4p8Z1QL0UYBB9bBotHysYXTo.jpg','2001-06-08',95,'Released',NULL,'Sound of the Sea',62191,3.0868,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16438,_binary '\0','/2K4ZRi6bYrl9Ha53uRi4ZyoYuft.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0261392',6.8,167374,'en','Jay and Silent Bob Strike Back','When Jay and Silent Bob learn that their comic-book alter egos, Bluntman and Chronic, have been sold to Hollywood as part of a big-screen movie that leaves them out of any royalties, the pair travel to Tinseltown to sabotage the production.','/aEsAdMAhwKYFgnHHxMOknktQYKK.jpg','2001-08-22',104,'Released','Hollywood had it coming.','Jay and Silent Bob Strike Back',2294,8.6737,6.4,'HjDSFna_LXQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16439,_binary '\0','/vWTS1l64zIw8Wue9sSJmaMMRUdz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0261552',6.9,2598,'ko','반칙왕','Dae-ho is a timid, unproductive, constantly harassed bank clerk. He starts secretly wrestling and adopts the persona of the cheating villain wrestler \"The Foul King\". He starts to stand up for himself but things soon start to get out of hand.','/6mKT6y7dvKkc0bR0YMzCbPo8uED.jpg','2000-02-04',112,'Released','In the ring, I\'m the king.','The Foul King',52663,2.3902,6.9,'3P7LT8Cn2VM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16440,_binary '\0','/rwkhcg2ms5oN2TgN7xZyyBnUcTj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0261739',6.7,1369,'tr','Hudutların Kanunu','In Deliviran, a village near Urfa close to the Syrian border, Hidir’s chief is involved in smuggling and gets shot. Hidir tries to stay out of illegal activities but circumstances contrive to push him in the opposite direction until he accepts to take a herd of sheep across the border.','/bGpWiiHLH1ji1lRWC4kIXAZ2b3O.jpg','1966-10-04',76,'Released',NULL,'Law of the Border',197297,1.9038,6.2,'wnEuK3xH0FY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16441,_binary '\0','/q00YpCIaO4ke4qstYnds9PtAz3t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0261983',6.3,67938,'en','Session 9','Tensions rise within an asbestos cleaning crew as they work in an abandoned mental hospital with a horrific past that seems to be coming back.','/A3Au37c3KJX29BDvldzGiYtaU5B.jpg','2001-08-10',100,'Released','Fear is a place.','Session 9',10972,4.3804,6.144,'4s-5eJq47bY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16442,_binary '\0','/sb4a5IbA5rQOHgnQOEpAYxyibEC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0261992',5,1600,'en','Winter Break','Viscerally experience a \"year off\" in Aspen, Colorado with a group of recent college grads who have elected to defer graduate school and career opportunities to ski, snow-board, climb, party, fall in love and basically live life to its absolute fullest out in this spectacular mountain town.','/jEPVFr6b9L1QSPmfAquDSNgKcrB.jpg','2003-03-22',92,'Released','Better Than Warm Apple Pie','Winter Break',14427,1.8221,4.4,'kpLK4CzVRQ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16443,_binary '\0','/idhHMkwBX01eOcuuwsBWFz32Qc2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0262001',5.8,1773,'en','The Sight','The American successful architect Michael Lewis travels to London with his partner and friend, the builder Jake, to refurbish an old hotel. Michael is having successive nightmares, and once in London, he realizes that twenty-one spirits are trying to contact him to solve murders of a serial killer. Michael, with the support of Jake, Detective Pryce and the ghosts, try to avoid the ninth crime and find the serial-killer.','/98XPZYfh2zRxrgcpOgAwVLOYOOq.jpg','2000-10-29',86,'Released','Can you help me?','The Sight',71550,1.3612,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16444,_binary '\0','/r12UYEfjhbFMbv3wIDkEUyPyIEf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0262037',7.6,2910,'ta','தெனாலி','Thenali suffers from panophobia and seeks doctor Kailash\'s help but the latter denies his request. Later, when Kailash goes on a vacation with his family, Thenali joins them and charms his sister.','/e4YrxXEx6IsriIRUj69WZVZ8cGh.jpg','2000-10-26',165,'Released',NULL,'Thenali',69577,1.3437,6.98,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16445,_binary '\0','/68Qic4gQ6YGoQdDyYxEhufJCunI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0262240',8.1,1745,'en','As I Was Moving Ahead Occasionally I Saw Brief Glimpses of Beauty','A compilation of over 30 years of private home movie footage shot by Lithuanian-American avant-garde director Jonas Mekas, assembled by Mekas \"purely by chance\", without concern for chronological order.','/tDaxB5juEGwXD7oZwh8IXsnisar.jpg','2000-11-05',288,'Released',NULL,'As I Was Moving Ahead Occasionally I Saw Brief Glimpses of Beauty',130824,2.551,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16446,_binary '\0','/kwAj4O11akIxRUj0mfxILKLGmK9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0262246',6.9,4715,'ko','주유소 습격사건','A quartet of disaffected Korean youths have robbed a Seoul gas station. After taking the gas station over, their wacky antics ensue; forcing the manager to sing, kidnapping customers that complain about the service, and staging fist-fights between street gang members and gas station employees; all of these reflect their own gripes against society.','/z4EXiiifZCfqE9nc4FYhcCt12Kw.jpg','1999-10-02',113,'Released','Just when you wanted to laugh, here they come.','Attack the Gas Station!',16606,2.1431,6.57,'hFgtINKmWiA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16447,_binary '\0','/upRYxyYrwL9WRGI2BmDrgL3O2tz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0262396',5.9,8297,'en','Empire','Big time drug dealer Victor Rosa is looking to get out of the game and sees his chance with a big deal with a new friend who happens to be a Wall St. stockbroker. Thinking this will be his chance to go out on top, Victor soon finds out that he\'s been double crossed and his last option is to get revenge.','/m6XxaRLltWox4C9pykjUILrlGp9.jpg','2002-12-06',99,'Released','Two worlds collide.','Empire',13369,2.4092,6.2,'SV_03kdGfGE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16448,_binary '\0','/5ZVRnltdsQXrRWhYCw7zHU4lruz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0262432',7.2,9009,'en','George Washington','During an innocent game in an abandoned amusement park, a member of the group dies. Narrated by one of the children, the film follows the kids as they struggle to balance their own ambitions and relationships against a tragic lie.','/g9nZi8u5LqSrVKEpSm199EM4hk5.jpg','2000-10-27',90,'Released','Down this twisted road, please watch over my soul and lift me up so gently so as not to touch the ground.','George Washington',18292,1.9202,6.7,'hagQfr1ZZpk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16449,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0262455',8.8,1712,'te','గుండమ్మ కథ','Gundamma is a rich widow who dotes on her daughter Saroja but mistreats her stepdaughter Lakshmi. When brothers Anji and Raja encounter this family, they decide to teach the old woman a lesson.','/iUQjWRkbIOZTbyAdITWj6uQJZRP.jpg','1962-06-07',166,'Released',NULL,'Gundamma Katha',86146,1.0413,7.769,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16450,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0262457',6.8,1797,'tr','Güle Güle','Car mechanic Şemsi separated from his wife years ago and lives alone, far away from his only child. Celal is a disciplined retired colonel married to Zarife. İsmet is an introverted film buff who has spent his life on the island, while Galip is a faithful platonic lover who has lived a strange \"love\" with Rosa, a Cuban woman he saw only once, and has never betrayed this woman with whom he has been corresponding for years. Unable to afford to go to Cuba or bring Rosa there, Galip falls ill and learns he has cancer. His friends do everything they can to make him happy before he dies, even putting their homes up for sale. But when the money still isn\'t enough, there\'s only one thing left to do: To obtain the money needed to send Galip to Cuba, they decide to rob five charming elderly bankers!','/dgCzaF8dYcNFHMApzXdzORNSjYo.jpg','2000-02-04',105,'Released',NULL,'Güle Güle',453482,0.9942,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16451,_binary '\0','/tdBOawrdkMjaPYF73gkWEWpOd1K.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0262699',5.1,2845,'fr','Le Pornographe','A former porn director, who once elevated the genre with 1960s counter-culture ideals, returns to filmmaking after 20 years, clashing with his producer\'s hard-core vision. Estranged from his son over the family business, they begin reconnecting as the son embraces political activism, while the director seeks personal renewal.','/lbwfC8IqXZYu9JVDRKmj42XCRcw.jpg','2001-10-03',108,'Released',NULL,'The Pornographer',15915,2.8124,5.1,'2zkehVWAxUo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16452,_binary '\0','/sOQzaDFqshQiJCDbSdW8gUTUxwQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0262826',7,2108,'fr','Thomas est amoureux','Thomas Thomas is agoraphobic, has a computer-generated girlfriend, and hasn\'t left his home in years. Can a prostitute convince him to leave cyberspace and his home for the real world?','/a31nJ0grVzwO8666xH14UTAJJ5F.jpg','2000-09-03',97,'Released',NULL,'Thomas in Love',21596,1.0499,6.7,'k2-L7hBQhcE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16453,_binary '\0','/ydBgg6YE5aXDmXBJllB7tbSm3Uu.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0262911',5.3,1300,'en','World Traveler','After hitting the road a man encounters characters that make him realize the importance of family.','/24d6LPAYXhudU8HAlxohPaVPRuL.jpg','2002-04-19',103,'Released','ever wander?','World Traveler',59199,1.3414,4.154,'APjGo3jlESo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16454,_binary '\0','/y08Do9SE9pQsExI5pQpoUs9aOjX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0262942',5.6,1944,'fr','Les Âmes fortes','At a wake one night in 1945, a group of aged women recall the life of one of their number. Sixty years before, Thérèse was barely 20 years old when she eloped with her boyfriend, Firmin, a blacksmith, to Châtillon, a town in Provence. Here, she makes the acquaintance of the wealthy Madame Numance, who is known for her good deeds. Realising that Thérèse is pregnant and unemployed, Madame Numance insists that she moves into a house on her estate. Whilst Firmin resents the arrangement, Thérèse soon finds that she can exploit the situation, using her benefactor\'s naivety and generosity for her own gain..','/dxo0UagoOaKOzUcIHxI4Y5LoQ5J.jpg','2001-05-20',120,'Released',NULL,'Savage Souls',47441,1.4838,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16455,_binary '\0','/VTtZgH68KVfXIN4hOUJ5WIJcCP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263026',5.5,2646,'tr','Abuzer Kadayıf','After his pregnant wife killed by thinner addicts, Ersin Balkan, decides on to establish a school for children who are abandoned ad thinner addicts. Noticing that he can not afford a such thing with his salary, takes a new career and becomes a singer.','/pPgjZKeMweq2dUsPywYHvJiUfLU.jpg','2000-09-29',104,'Released',NULL,'Abuzer Kadayıf',141214,0.966,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16456,_binary '\0','/xaNzd6ul326ZbNRYPFtvVaDY1ym.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263065',8,9033,'tr','Arabesk','Sener and Müjde, who can never come together because of endless obstacles and misunderstandings, slowly drift into the plaintive world of arabesque music.','/mnwrlDHwAELRWXitPPBKUbkpzvl.jpg','1989-02-01',105,'Released',NULL,'Arabesque',32279,1.5002,7.288,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16457,_binary '\0','/1i1GrS9RgZozeMMjrZ2VFSrWIyi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263071',6.9,1846,'tr','Aşık Oldum','Şakir is instantly infatuated with Sibel in a red dress whom he meets in the parking lot of the advertising agency where he works, and he is desperate to win this fascinating woman. But there is one obstacle; Şakir is married! Despite this, Şakir is determined to pursue Sibel and will try various ways to achieve his goal.','/u3N38S0sDMkN2Ka0p6H96qfJAAX.jpg','1985-09-04',97,'Released','Kirmizi is the Turkish word for red.','I Feel in Love',219210,1.9645,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16458,_binary '\0','/yjvDgbc1TOOzQdLomE7xAC5efHO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263074',7.6,4856,'tr','Aşk Filmlerinin Unutulmaz Yönetmeni','Hasmet, director of love stories, wants to make a film which is different than the movies he made before. This movie has a social message. He tries to find a producer but film industry is mainly out of money. When he thinks he finds one, nothing goes as it planned.','/9za2ZWMcFIg9YRChdwtfcVZ27Ee.jpg','1990-01-02',106,'Released',NULL,'The Unforgettable Director of Love Movies',327877,2.5066,7.081,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16459,_binary '\0','/rHfbunMWCGUiMoqvu6VNjbFaMBm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263101',6.5,3854,'th','บางกอกแดนเจอรัส เพชฌฆาตเงียบ อันตราย','Kong, a deaf-mute, lives a life of quiet desperation working for Bangkok mobsters. Despite his disability, Kong\'s mentor Joe trains him to be a stone-cold assassin. After a brutal hit abroad, Kong returns to Bangkok and falls in love with young pharmacy clerk.','/m7n8oGDoRCvia2oABTFZdYgpyaE.jpg','2000-11-24',105,'Released','Can we redeem ourselves from the wrongs we have done?','Bangkok Dangerous',3173,1.5474,5.706,'_2rQqjyTzjg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16460,_binary '\0','/yAffNAQD3H9lw697zNBW3UaLxMi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263102',7.6,8185,'tr','Banker Bilo','Bilo is a goodhearted man who wants to marry the cutest girl in the village but needs money to take the consent from her father. His best friend Mahmut offers him a way to go to Germany and work in a factory to save up the money he needs.','/whShZNqudVvUBfWE58105ootjOv.jpg','1980-01-01',85,'Released',NULL,'Bilo the Banker',184979,1.9614,7.187,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16461,_binary '\0','/nwPHdJp7bwFCFwcxUTuqHvtcESi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263124',7.7,7678,'pt','Bicho de Sete Cabeças','Neto is a middle class teenager living a normal life. After his father finds a marijuana cigarette on his pocket, he is sent to a mental institution, where he gets to know a completely absurd and inhumane reality in which people are devoured by a corrupt and cruel system.','/x6NXI2jvi9iKbzjjHRMtZ7mCPjB.jpg','2001-06-22',84,'Released','this trip may have no return','Brainstorm',53961,2.0839,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16462,_binary '\0','/rxjj5OHnbopzbSoKNC89EnCc7oN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263208',8,12113,'tr','Çiçek Abbas','While working as an assistant to swindling driver Şakir, ingenuous Abbas falls for the same woman his boss loves.','/rZE04pfDBPPIDIF9tw3E8DxgPkf.jpg','1982-09-01',87,'Released',NULL,'Abbas in Flower',54339,2.4622,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16463,_binary '\0','/263WR48pQGHc4sSRod0Qfkg5kbT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263211',7.5,5420,'tr','Çıplak Vatandaş','A family man, driven to the edge by his inability to financially support his family, is found running about on the street naked. Suddenly, he turns into a nationwide celebrity and an inspiration for millions of people in poverty.','/mofgrvRQ41WomkXFNnBoVpFUTyR.jpg','1985-09-05',82,'Released',NULL,'Naked Citizen',219217,1.036,7.259,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16464,_binary '\0','/5ltwoyIb4B0aCj6Uw0TbBP4G2Ky.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263215',5.4,1341,'en','Picture Claire','Quebec native Claire Beaucage has a one-night stand with a photographer of some renown. Despite the language barrier between them, he invites her to visit him in Toronto. She shows up on his doorstep after an arson attack leaves her homeless, but soon finds herself caught up in a case of murder and mistaken identity.','/2wEsMBXd4GlEhwF2Kpo6jU35fn.jpg','2001-09-10',91,'Released','They\'ve got the wrong woman… but she may not live long enough to prove it.','Picture Claire',28311,1.6967,5.6,'4dC1NibI-5A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16465,_binary '\0','/gu4AFMhKYGAbgAT5m2pgLlHAe00.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263257',7.4,2306,'tr','Değirmen','In the last years of the Ottoman Empire, a poor little Anatolian town named Saripinar is hit by a minor earthquake which has neither destroyed nor left it with many casualties. However, a telegraph sent to the central government exaggerates the situation and mentions that the governor of the town has been severely wounded, making the event a nationwide matter.','/4N3qikpEcTBLooR86hx6PAfMLmX.jpg','1986-02-04',99,'Released',NULL,'The Windmill',232326,1.2292,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16466,_binary '\0','/2lct2oNryaHOQ6dJ3kevXxmNFMD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263265',5.4,7275,'en','Shortcut to Happiness','In Manhattan, the aspirant writer Jabez Stone is a complete loser: he is not able to sell his novels, he lives in a lousy apartment and he does not have success with women. When one of his friends Julius Jenson sells his novel for US$ 190,000.00 to an editor, Jabez fells envy and promises to sell his soul to the devil for success and accidentally kills a woman with his typing machine. The Devil knocks on his door, fixes the situation and seals a contract with Jabez. His low quality novels have bad reviews but become best-sellers; Jabez enriches; has success with women, but has no time for his friends. Jabez meets with the publisher Daniel Webster who offers him a chance to break the contract with the devil.','/3wjWIV0ECQeWT4ckGwjSvupOtDS.jpg','2007-07-13',102,'Released','The devil is in the details.','Shortcut to Happiness',33932,3.5221,5.6,'BvsvsGZtXd0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16467,_binary '\0','/5qheYacokr8YwKOsbJhXlHZ9xVx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263269',7.2,1394,'tr','Devlerin Aşkı','Reunion of two former lovers brings the end to the society they are part of through hate through revenge and through bloodshed, especially when the lovers were obliged to stand against their associates and families.','/5m6tcSHF4Hjry7eTEtovm3wNMPp.jpg','1976-01-01',79,'Released',NULL,'Love of Giant',501325,0.8302,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16468,_binary '\0','/1xUQlVYv33yHw75D2mozl5LvjRG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263273',7.3,1780,'tr','Dila Hanım','Madam Dila is the grieving widow of a recently deceased Ağa (feudal landowner) who is hell-bent on wreaking revenge on Rıza, the man who murdered her husband. She sends her men to kill him and then ironically, saves his life because she doesn’t know it’s him.','/cZQuRJGVKYLiehYJ1R8SW6n9lL6.jpg','1977-01-19',86,'Released',NULL,'Madam Dilâ',319369,0.8707,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16469,_binary '\0','/tAC55WwwasZLQq8ExrQQyR2YDJM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263283',7.8,1432,'tr','Dönüş','Gülcan and her husband İbrahim dream of a happy future together in their village. However, they are subjected to the cruelty of the Agha, the local landowner who lords over the entire village. İbrahim is fed up and moves to Germany to find work. On the other hand, Gülcan has to deal with Agha\'s evils alone.','/hggcgv0yG2Qicm7wPcb5TGqLfaU.jpg','1972-02-01',94,'Released','The Struggle of a Lonely Woman.','The Return',265458,0.682,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16470,_binary '\0','/vBpVVFRDX3eGigtXb8sM3T3nlEI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263334',7.1,2735,'tr','Fasulye','The duty of taking the tax return forms of the villagers to the big city is assigned to a naive young guy. The villagers trust him, and hand their tax return forms to him. Taking the forms along with the lunchbox full of beans his mother cooked for him, he\'s underway. But he meets some weird people on the way, who also run into some other weird people, and things start to follow an unexpected path for everyone involved, bringing hillarious moments along.','/yqi6g5FB23q3y7Sc5qvHPs0lwoS.jpg','2000-05-05',105,'Released',NULL,'Beans',284139,1.422,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16471,_binary '\0','/yFxnuwsk4WFSrQCEpYRq31BR26G.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263386',4.6,1470,'en','Going Greek','Loner freshman Jake Taylor is forced to join the wildest fraternity on campus when the frat brothers refuse to accept his geeky cousin/roommate unless Jake agrees to pledge with him. As the semester progresses, Jake struggles to maintain his grades as well as his affair with Paige, a beautiful sophomore who hates all fraternities. Through naked scavenger hunts, sorority ass-signings and all night','/8btEohZgUniiRXNyxNjl5gm6uXw.jpg','2001-08-04',90,'Released','Sometimes the best memories can be hard to remember.','Going Greek',34305,1.8997,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16472,_binary '\0','/4eKOM7nANFsq83Zs72Tzcc5clon.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263388',7.6,4608,'tr','Gölge Oyunu','Mahmut and Abidin work as comedians at a night club, Mahmut is honest yet Abidin is sly. A deaf and mute girl named Kumru is brought to work in the night club.','/5DspOQzgOzaSKjK5SxQ2GpWPauY.jpg','1992-09-02',103,'Released',NULL,'The Shadow Play',14840,1.8348,7.238,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16473,_binary '\0','/3GhdN3yezfozDjZKPekvIeaEr5d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263404',6.2,1266,'tr','Güllü Geliyor Güllü','Güllü and the goddess Taka Nuri come to Istanbul to avenge a bloodshed. Güllü is a Black Sea girl. Nasi is a rich young man who grew up in the same village as Güllü. Nuri is given a gun in his circumcision wedding. The accidental bullet hits a relative of Güllü and thus starts a blood feud.','/65ngL8rTj3FT5DVh6LJHHSci3Yi.jpg','1973-01-01',86,'Released',NULL,'Güllü is Coming',110030,1.2536,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16474,_binary '\0','/wqofv8aHAtJtHqt93DBRgltnmhQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263438',8.1,30865,'tr','Her Şey Çok Güzel Olacak','When Altan swipes prescription drugs from his brother Nuri\'s pharmacy, they soon find themselves on a dangerous but funny road trip to get rid of the stuff and escape the mafiosi Altan tried to double-cross. Along the way, the brother who are compete opposites finally bond.','/hHuxySsdTsYfp9ePGeYTmq4YvM1.jpg','1998-11-27',109,'Released',NULL,'Everything\'s Gonna Be Great',81549,1.4374,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16475,_binary '\0','/uTyxqPifbTnnBBTtWHN6zZLIQYj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263467',6.6,2658,'en','In the Time of the Butterflies','Based on the book by Julia Alvarez. Three sisters become activists during the Dominican Republic\'s Trujillo regime when members of their family are killed by the government\'s troops.','/jmR3r54oVqrVy0nGUwhbQs28lxl.jpg','2001-10-21',95,'Released','Women had their place. Hers was in the revolution.','In the Time of the Butterflies',21997,2.327,6.311,'-6J5k1mYw50','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16476,_binary '\0','/m0yTFeh8vrsMP0fQDdYGSh4xthX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263488',6.3,158978,'en','Jeepers Creepers','On a desolate country highway, two homeward-bound teens are nearly run off the road by a maniac in a beat-up truck, and later spot him shoving what appears to be a body down a sewer pipe.','/g410Y1U1ELbmJG14Zru3UAimm1G.jpg','2001-07-01',90,'Released','What\'s eating you?','Jeepers Creepers',8922,13.3067,6.5,'5T7TFIOZ2xU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16477,_binary '\0','/b6RD6HawoFtCE1rjqkKEN6NGBte.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263491',4.9,1561,'hi','Jis Desh Mein Ganga Rehta Hai','Gangaram alias Ganga has been raised by his foster parents who reside in the village thus he gets accustom to village life. 24 years later his birth parents multi-millionaire Avinash and his wife Radha comes to ask him to move into their bungalow located in the city to which Ganga agrees and goes to bid farewell to his friends and girlfriend Saawni. While in the city Ganga is introduced to his elder brother, Milind, his wife, Supriya, and his younger brother; Ganga finds it very hard to adjust to the city life and is often scuffed at. Avinash arranges his marriage with equally wealthy Tina to which he agrees although he is not comfortable with this marriage as he is still in love with Saawni; meanwhile Ganga\'s honest policy gets him and his new found family into further problems.','/7uafbugXyAchvkdWJMA0JkmrvNe.jpg','2000-10-13',149,'Released',NULL,'Jis Desh Mein Ganga Rehta Hai',348762,1.2749,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16478,_binary '\0','/y8BSe3ySH3F899cgupJHa8X0QCR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263496',5.7,1225,'fr','Les jolies choses','Lucie, who works as a white-hot fashion model, exhibits a dominant, often controlling, \"Type A\" personality, whereas identical twin Marie consistently projects a backward, reserved, laconic and unassuming attitude. When Lucie receives a covetable French recording contract, a significant problem stands in her way: the inability to sing. Marie possesses the voice of an angel, however, and quickly jets off to Paris to stand in for her sister, unannounced - little realizing the dangerous and even violent string of consequences that she is igniting.','/xVlcUoZ586iHmNwftwx8RIuEzR7.jpg','2001-11-14',105,'Released',NULL,'Pretty Things',31355,4.2434,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16479,_binary '\0','/3B2DZdQrSn1SpygNAoatR9f3B7D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263534',7,1312,'tr','Kara Gözlüm','Azize, who sells fish with her father, is discovered by a bar owner with her beautiful voice. She becomes a famous singer in a short time with the anonymous compositions and even gets a movie offer from Hollywood. However, nothing goes as planned for Azize. She is forced to choose between her love and her dreams.','/tSdbPQmYjXaxfLXYdtd1zZHJzxR.jpg','1970-01-01',95,'Released','Anyone who wants to have everything loses what they have','Kara Gözlüm',302081,1.1324,6.8,'t2aRth41_Ss','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16480,_binary '\0','/3Y7F1xjEC8ReV5vYCYXXQMgc6SI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263671',6.3,2659,'en','Love the Hard Way','Claire, a brilliant student, seeks answers to the meaning of life in the calm of her biology laboratory. One day, she meets a mysterious young man, Jack, at the cinema, and is intrigued by his style, assurance and audacity.','/f3QvdfN1tE3Rf3oUhezBQBbgX4i.jpg','2003-03-27',104,'Released',NULL,'Love the Hard Way',39125,2.6775,6.3,'KR4llbJnK_Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16481,_binary '\0','/2nAmg0N5rG88tHCckbbCBWuG8F1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263725',6.7,5043,'en','Me Without You','During a long, hot summer in seventies London, young neighbors Holly and Marina make a childhood pact to be friends forever. For Marina, troubled, fiercely independent, determined to try everything, Holly stays the only constant in a life of divorcing parents, experimental drugs and fashionable self-destruction. But for Holly, a friendship that has never been equal gradually starts to feel like a trap.','/424IEKHWFSH9TNBzNLcwCVzjpDs.jpg','2001-11-01',107,'Released','...best friends forever?','Me Without You',26290,2.1076,6.4,'Jk14XBjbiLg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16482,_binary '\0','/toJBej1MkyvAVwV0V1mHEpkWcGJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263728',4,3089,'en','Megiddo: The Omega Code 2','Stone (the Antichrist) becomes President of the European Union and uses his seat of power to dissolve the United Nations and create a one world government called the World Union. Megiddo is a supernatural ride into a world teetering on the edge of the Apocalypse. It follows the rise of a Machiavellian leader bent on amassing the armies of the world for the battle of Armageddon while calamities of Biblical proportions pummel the Earth.','/gBFh6xxEManI9YJ5acKBfhqT9Nu.jpg','2001-09-07',104,'Released','In The Beginning, The End Had A Name.','Megiddo: The Omega Code 2',30379,2.8842,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16483,_binary '\0','/x85lqt2t3nqc9hnT23LWGdUudSz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263734',5.9,4923,'en','Men with Brooms','A decade ago, curler Chris Cutter disappeared suddenly on the verge of stardom, dropping his curling stones to the bottom of a lake and leaving his fiancée, Julie Foley, at the altar. But when his former coach dies, Cutter returns home for the funeral and attempts to fulfill the man\'s last wishes. The team is reunited under Cutter\'s estranged dad, Gordon — himself a former curling star — for a final attempt at glory.','/qWWvljKlmYwf1XtlJ0vu0u66xpi.jpg','2002-09-20',102,'Released','There\'s More Than One Way To Sweep a Woman Off Her Feet.','Men with Brooms',34341,1.7856,5.2,'KHOZHAb7VpM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16484,_binary '\0','/lM2bXToKFZzGA2xwOMuGzaistK7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263743',7.5,5075,'tr','Milyarder','A civil servant in a small town, shunned by his family and his friends due to his lack of ambition, hits the jackpot in the national lottery. Not trusting anybody around him, he gradually starts to lose his mind.','/oTn1uAiXWTlqkkc4oU8jc36v9rL.jpg','1986-09-07',96,'Released',NULL,'Billionaire',219998,1.8606,7.377,'ldKu0qhv1GI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16485,_binary '\0','/7TvehiVjzE9hMvnq94mOYjP8kGT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263757',6.3,54817,'en','Uptown Girls','Molly Gunn, the freewheeling daughter of a deceased rock legend, is forced to get a job when her manager steals her money. As nanny to Ray - the precocious, oft-ignored daughter of a music executive - she learns what it means to be an adult while teaching Ray how to be a child.','/liazMoopc2fhWq1YlfwasQcvWu.jpg','2003-08-15',92,'Released','They\'re about to teach each other how to act their age.','Uptown Girls',14926,10.1741,7.073,'ftSY4DW5tEk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16486,_binary '\0','/b3zxmlsmNKNvYE6vcBvU1j197oJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263776',8.1,8173,'tr','Namuslu','When an incorruptible government pay clerk, who isn\'t taken seriously by anyone including his family, get robbed while carrying huge amount of work money, he becomes popular because people believe he faked the robbery and kept the money.','/7cwXtgAcskhZ2CY8i75akoXmtU.jpg','1984-08-31',93,'Released',NULL,'The Honest One',180864,1.6203,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16487,_binary '\0','/sV0fkwQm0f6BXS24srw1YWe7YWd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263957',6.6,1529,'th','สตรีเหล็ก','A group of volleyball players, who are either transvestites or gay, form a team after they suffer discrimination and compete to win games amidst the hostility around them.','/oshXupyCh2hkGfDVtQvZ84wnMNu.jpg','2000-03-04',104,'Released','Sometimes Even Sportsmen Want To Be Ladies.','The Iron Ladies',106230,1.2207,5.3,'ijp4RKLeEL0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16488,_binary '\0','/z4ulnNGAI2ROE0fnsmKtldCyMgN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0263975',8.4,18403,'tr','Selvi Boylum Al Yazmalım','İlyas, a truck driver from Istanbul, arrives in a remote village to work on a dam construction project and meets a young village woman named Asya. They fall madly in love and get married. However, their life together is fraught with conflict. When İlyas cheats on Asya, the final straw in their relationship, she takes her son and begins wandering without knowing where she is going, until a familiar hand reaches out to help her selflessly.','/cFxItCQrYIbJ1FMISjo2YNApuPw.jpg','1977-11-18',86,'Released','Was that love? What is love?','The Girl with the Red Scarf',31412,1.6865,7.7,'dNzpV9tgLRA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16489,_binary '\0','/5kz0LCSAFxCjgiqNO3BuktZEuSB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0264051',7.5,4255,'tr','Sultan','A portrait of a young, depressed Turkish widow in the slums whose infinite dignity alone looks after her orphan kids is depicted by the son of the town sheriff, who is in love with her.','/zvfp8k0x2BC2M2qOcZxmFiEk4Sn.jpg','1978-12-01',88,'Released',NULL,'Sultan',452606,1.5651,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16490,_binary '\0','/cTaJYZKKb4k4XPhMgYrqCwg8nM8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0264150',5.3,30423,'en','View from the Top','No one thought Donna would go very far. But when she sets her sights on becoming a first-class international flight attendant, Donna throws caution to the wind and takes off in pursuit of her dream. The ride is anything but smooth, however, and Donna\'s laugh-packed journey of a lifetime is rocked by more turbulence than she bargained for.','/q8oHvYoFICQpTWjC15ZMwQr5Sox.jpg','2003-03-21',87,'Released','Prepare for her arrival.','View from the Top',11523,6.0066,5.6,'elF04ebuXHI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16491,_binary '\0','/pV5CchvsTMp9Hd1w8io57bWPrcB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0264192',7,1220,'en','Yesterday\'s Children','After having strange dreams, Jenny Cole discovers that in her last incarnation she was Mary Sutton, an Irishwoman who died in the 1930s. Suspicious, Jenny goes to Ireland to investigate her past life.','/w48F7Nxb84q5n2S7XF1zxXlG8jx.jpg','2000-10-15',93,'Released','Are they dreams... or memories?','Yesterday\'s Children',81207,2.0263,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16492,_binary '\0','/wbSuO3RQG3OwGXIh4j6m8NViyQn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0264205',7.5,1844,'tr','Zengin Mutfağı','Lutfu is a cook in the mansion of the wealthy Kerim. One morning he sees that there is nobody at home. The maid is to get engaged on that day but her fiancée does not show up either. From the brother of their driver, he learns that workers are on strike and their boss Kerim has gone to Europe. Things get back to normal.','/llHx0DbiETmGazgY3ywwzvOqjZo.jpg','1988-01-04',76,'Released',NULL,'The Rich One\'s Kitchen',432080,1.6853,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16493,_binary '\0','/8cHtECGEUaz6OI2Hq97HvlRtEGo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0264323',5.3,14309,'en','2001 Maniacs','On their way to Spring Break, college kids take a detour through an old Southern town. The people of Pleasant Valley insist the kids stay for their annual barbecue celebration... but instead of getting a taste of the old South, the old South gets a taste of them!','/bVGq9FOV1uoBzfO0ntou3fE7tvR.jpg','2005-05-12',87,'Released','You are what THEY eat!','2001 Maniacs',10845,4.6007,5.4,'dwMXQ-04g9g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16494,_binary '\0','/yiiUMuVRFkmZbuvt8awWh622yrb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0264333',6.6,1876,'en','The Abduction Club','A group of Irish noblemen kidnap girls in order to marry into their fortune and avoid becoming priests or soldiers.','/bjsQB6FT4ewznTmO4A5G8Rx1NUh.jpg','2002-07-19',96,'Released',NULL,'The Abduction Club',21893,1.6653,5.9,'o8ezBLfoggg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16495,_binary '\0','/nbQccqxcpAV1dwofccLeM3c6qzn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0264395',6.4,70155,'en','Basic','When a hurricane hits a US Army base on the edge of the Panama Canal, an elite covert operations team of US Army Rangers recruits are on a routine jungle training exercise that goes horribly awry. Only two recruits are rescued, one of which is badly injured, but both have different accounts regarding the fate of their leader, legendary and ruthless Army Ranger Drill Sergeant Nathan West, and the rest of their platoon. Tom Hardy, an ex-army Ranger turned maverick DEA agent is brought in to solve the mystery and uncover what really happened out there.','/jtyF4NF9fQlyGP8cgU1mK3DLUTB.jpg','2003-04-18',98,'Released','Deception is their most dangerous weapon.','Basic',10782,5.2023,6.511,'kE7Ue5hjJc0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16496,_binary '\0','/Nl5F3mPHBJKOAs9MaUxiFB8xfW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0264429',3.7,2068,'en','黑俠2','The Black Mask must stop a group intent on setting off a DNA bomb that could cause mutations to the human race.','/uc9rOZs8ybdZKQVi8zLwSiEP9kz.jpg','2002-12-24',102,'Released','Welcome to the evolution revolution!','Black Mask 2: City of Masks',49516,2.6176,4.6,'ZHdSS5SD7j4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16497,_binary '\0','/ggC3Brchf4RqPitEh7cROFoeAWn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0264464',8.1,1264822,'en','Catch Me If You Can','A true story about Frank Abagnale Jr. who, before his 19th birthday, successfully conned millions of dollars worth of checks as a Pan Am pilot, doctor, and legal prosecutor. An FBI agent makes it his mission to put him behind bars. But Frank not only eludes capture, he revels in the pursuit.','/ctjEj2xM32OvBXCq8zAdK3ZrsAj.jpg','2002-12-16',141,'Released','The true story of a real fake.','Catch Me If You Can',640,32.0249,7.978,'71rDQ7z4eFg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16498,_binary '\0','/lCPOmWoqtmVrI2yUNUw8iaOaTJn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0264472',6.5,77491,'en','Changing Lanes','A rush-hour fender-bender on New York City\'s crowded FDR Drive, under most circumstances, wouldn\'t set off a chain reaction that could decimate two people\'s lives. But on this day, at this time, a minor collision will turn two complete strangers into vicious adversaries. Their means of destroying each other might be different, but their goals, ultimately, will be the same: Each will systematically try to dismantle the other\'s life in a reckless effort to reclaim something he has lost.','/8wh9WzTKo5pJw3EgHYWA60W7Kbl.jpg','2002-04-07',98,'Released','One wrong turn deserves another.','Changing Lanes',1537,6.2419,6.288,'_9K-uuQJKmQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16499,_binary '\0','/rbHbljHG4zzXjzFzVpUfsRtHp3o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0264476',8.2,2592,'ro','Children Underground','Children Underground follows the story of five street children, aged eight to sixteen who live in a subway station in Bucharest, Romania. The street kids are encountered daily by commuting adults, who pass them by in the station as they starve, swindle, and steal, all while searching desperately for a fresh can of paint to get high with.','/uacoFb7DHq0MrUjMcjjMZlIgmu2.jpg','2001-09-19',104,'Released',NULL,'Children Underground',51722,0.813,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16500,_binary '\0','/nO8lpaJLo1UVIXL7eM5ewwudvtY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0264508',6.2,23628,'en','Dagon','A boating accident off the coast of Spain sends Paul and his girlfriend Barbara to the decrepit fishing village of Imboca. As night falls, people start to disappear and things not quite human start to appear. Paul is pursued by the entire town. Running for his life, he uncovers Imboca\'s secret..they worship Dagon, a monstrous god of the sea...and Dagon\'s unholy offspring are on the loose...','/8S648eMKObi8ERFS7cSYDocxSaZ.jpg','2001-10-12',95,'Released','A cursed people... an ancient cult... a nightmare come true.','Dagon',10836,3.4779,6.1,'72D1Rnxdsg4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16501,_binary '\0','/bbCygAkvqSc0hWdn1Iiv574J0H7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0264578',7.8,2447,'en','The Endurance - Shackleton\'s Legendary Antarctic Expedition','Documentary on the Shackleton Antartic expedition. A retelling of Sir Ernest Shackleton\'s ill-fated expedition to Antarctica in and the crew of his vessel \'The Endurance\', which was trapped in the ice floes and frigid open ocean of the Antarctic in 1914. Shackleton decided, with many of his crew injured and weak from exposure and starvation, to take a team of his fittest men and attempt to find help. Setting out in appalling conditions with hopelessly inadequate equipment, they endured all weather and terrain and finally reached safety. Persuading a local team of his confidence that the abandoned team would still be alive, he set out again to find them. After almost 2 years trapped on the ice, all members of the crew were finally rescued.','/7zWvRlfnDTbmcGw8F28PEx7KX2k.jpg','2000-09-02',97,'Released',NULL,'The Endurance',32567,2.611,7,'2QrNlbcz7XE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16502,_binary '\0','/vORzDiWl5mxm6nuXQu9h5bhi6rb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0264616',7.2,101960,'en','Frailty','A mysterious man arrives at the offices of an FBI agent and recounts his childhood: how his religious fanatic father received visions telling him to kill people who were in fact \"demons.\"','/jGuobXsIJOV3FmM4gRlK4QQMIos.jpg','2002-04-12',100,'Released','No soul is safe.','Frailty',12149,5.6867,7,'HUfNR_7YxQE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16503,_binary '\0','/4cRIz8wkaH9BekOnRC9d8ki4xxV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0264689',7.1,3582,'en','Home Room','A high school shooting has repercussions on the town and students.','/37BPWVtB956pkDIZarmjR2GjKVs.jpg','2002-04-12',133,'Released','A senseless tragedy. An unlikely friendship. A search for answers.','Home Room',55015,2.7354,6.8,'Xdq1omTwF7c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16504,_binary '\0','/mQaN0BrITQIwQHGYoEmASvXA7jS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0264695',5.9,1326,'en','The Hound of the Baskervilles','The mysterious death of Sir Charles Baskerville is blamed on a longstanding curse that has followed the Baskerville family for two hundred years. Enigmatic sleuth Sherlock Holmes is on the case to uncover the truth about a monstrous, supernatural hound who roams the moors, waiting to attack the latest heir to the Baskerville estate. Written by Echo Bridge Home Entertainment','/kOaXPlbnWAGIgcu6amLr7v7yCqK.jpg','2000-10-28',90,'Released',NULL,'The Hound of the Baskervilles',25293,2.1016,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16505,_binary '\0','/8h200JQ8vwKzQuaitYwmVfXwCaV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0264761',6.5,18086,'en','Kissing Jessica Stein','Jessica, a Jewish copy editor living and working in New York City, is plagued by failed blind dates with men, and decides to answer a newspaper\'s personal advertisement. The advertisement has been placed by \'lesbian-curious\' Helen Cooper, a thirtysomething art gallerist.','/8b2g8QZRLTJMYyzc3HirTSRQpLW.jpg','2002-03-13',97,'Released','When it comes to love, sometimes she just can\'t think straight.','Kissing Jessica Stein',15647,2.9643,6.043,'NaPqnezhXT8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16506,_binary '\0','/cq0xYG4TIcEPaFPhkgTpDhWLIqo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0264796',7.4,47597,'en','Life as a House','When a man is diagnosed with terminal cancer, he takes custody of his misanthropic teenage son, for whom quality time means getting high, engaging in small-time prostitution, and avoiding his father.','/qNFlcei9vWh5NCRTVrs52qDvUmq.jpg','2001-10-25',125,'Released','Seen from a distance, it\'s perfect.','Life as a House',11457,5.8134,7.1,'QlAXZclowmI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16507,_binary '\0','/5fsyOL5sNA4jpqgl9WsxHgbgTja.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0264935',6.2,67663,'en','Murder by Numbers','Tenacious homicide detective Cassie Mayweather and her still-green partner are working a murder case, attempting to profile two malevolently brilliant young men: cold, calculating killers whose dark secrets might explain their crimes.','/plH3TujSUVttiIikToKfwdCorJI.jpg','2002-04-19',120,'Released','The only flaw in their plan was her.','Murder by Numbers',11892,6.3361,6.2,'RDEAL9vbpM0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16508,_binary '\0','/xBddP0l69YCuScrehETiSWiOL6E.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0265010',4.9,2776,'en','100 Women','A young man returns to his ex-girlfriend and true love to discover the source of her increasing depression. As the young man earnestly tries to help his girlfriend through her troubles, their love begins to bloom.','/8ssSg7Bm05i4QRIQWdkGKLpALQx.jpg','2002-10-18',95,'Released','If at first you don\'t succeed...','100 Women',20648,2.8592,4.5,'n8UcmiJ0O-w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16509,_binary '\0','/3GKjUFl3QHXrDMYCDoB5Wn6taEN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0265018',7,1268,'ja','劇場版 ああっ女神さまっ','It has been three spring-times since Belldandy came to Earth to grant Keiichi one wish. Things seem to be fine with them while living in the temple with Belldandy\'s sisters Urd and Skuld, but little do they know that a fallen god from Belldandy\'s past has escaped from his lunar prison. He has plans for everyone which do not include what the goddess and her human lover wanted for themselves.','/5ovbBoerwuVaCulOkP5e6DwKtTJ.jpg','2000-10-21',106,'Released',NULL,'Ah! My Goddess: The Movie',21174,1.9589,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16510,_binary '\0','/vSCrjBiEWPMInaQyFvk2pNyZHHm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0265029',5.7,61972,'en','America\'s Sweethearts','In the midst of a nasty public breakup of married movie stars, a studio publicist scrambles to put a cap on the escalating situation as the couple\'s latest film has found it\'s only print kidnapped by the director.','/uU6sRJNHEO1B3pcPPB9jOdLi5wG.jpg','2001-07-17',102,'Released','Hollywood\'s hottest couple just split up. It\'ll take more than special effects to reunite them.','America\'s Sweethearts',11467,4.7328,5.723,'nE1ONQjgqqg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16511,_binary '\0','/7jaNOECZG8uS1tlq69HsY5xY8P9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0265086',7.7,459723,'en','Black Hawk Down','When U.S. Rangers and an elite Delta Force team attempt to kidnap two underlings of a Somali warlord, their Black Hawk helicopters are shot down, and the Americans suffer heavy casualties, facing intense fighting from the militia on the ground.','/7fU5dSqKRL4XHeEUz62rCKBfYok.jpg','2001-12-28',145,'Released','Leave no man behind.','Black Hawk Down',855,23.1776,7.4,'V1UV3Vj4z0w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16512,_binary '\0','/udgq4FDqsRgJIACUrWlk1BRtUhf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0265087',5,46621,'en','Black Knight','After nearly drowning, an employee working at a medieval amusement park awakens to find himself in 14th century England.','/pVxwVH461k9u4tUfRewT29DEZ2e.jpg','2001-11-21',95,'Released','A comedy about a man out of his time and out of his mind.','Black Knight',11469,8.8379,5.488,'lw7dzS8UJ4Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16513,_binary '\0','/jQ1OnD4CIrWjCcdQSCWs2ME5tEz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0265104',4.8,3116,'en','The Breed','Vampires have come out of the shadows and are living as normal citizens. Two policemen, one a vampire, are assigned to track down a serial killer who tears the throat of his victims and drains their blood.','/9oLpJMfJ7NtfQX9yNbG8GjyGexL.jpg','2001-07-19',91,'Released',NULL,'The Breed',51215,2.5012,5.2,'uRjzvaIAmcs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16514,_binary '\0','/7ZkmYMgHlAMY14mg7sVwsnX84LD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0265116',7,2667,'fr','Chaos','A bourgeois couple, modern yet conventional. One night by accident, a young prostitute barges into their lives. Hounded down, beaten up, threatened, she will continue to struggle, with the help of a well off lady, first for her survival-her resurrection-then for her dignity and freedom. Stormy encounters for everyone involved.','/7iRACW1bYueLZJ7CpyWMJgB1Ta4.jpg','2001-10-03',109,'Released',NULL,'Chaos',44164,2.5245,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16515,_binary '\0','/3FCblfEVJLCSzXSJx6wiYB2oxJo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0265144',7.3,3631,'tr','Dar Alanda Kısa Paslaşmalar','Thirtysomething Suat still lives with his parents and works at his father\'s store when not practicing as goalie for the local football team, Esnaf Spor. The neighborhood\'s greatest wish is for Esnaf Spor to win the amateur league championship.','/8YZLclSNUVT6ssKktg9unvGAGG6.jpg','2000-12-08',120,'Released','Life is like football.','Offside',23537,1.7249,7.083,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16516,_binary '\0','/sY9U6G7U2ee4QXds9jogoOZQHx3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0265148',3.9,5670,'hi','मैं प्रेम की दीवानी हूँ','Sanjana is a vivacious young woman who lives life on her own terms. She becomes upset when her mother, Susheela, arranges for her to meet a boy as a potential marriage prospect.','/1ubxLXZbSXi3MWk8nZRBDEoqfB0.jpg','2003-06-26',197,'Released',NULL,'Main Prem Ki Diwani Hoon',165402,3.9812,5.206,'wzRNn-Yff6I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16517,_binary '\0','/4oux2eoW5hI6uAWpKfFBGM1JSej.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0265171',5.6,5773,'en','Elvira\'s Haunted Hills','The setting is Carpathia. The year is 1851. When Elvira gets kicked out of an Inn for a slight monetary discrepancy, she is rescued by a local who takes her to stay at the castle in the hills high above the village. The fact that she happens to resemble the count\'s former \"missing\" wife opens a can of worms or two.','/woQR7BvgP8ZfuUrUg5bFQKNRRmv.jpg','2002-10-31',90,'Released','Evil. Terror. Lust.','Elvira\'s Haunted Hills',21597,3.311,5.5,'g7Bm0rsyicY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16518,_binary '\0','/qvcOovScPoRalRxDy50rYSYFree.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0265208',6.7,266987,'en','The Girl Next Door','Exceptionally ambitious high schooler Matthew has aspirations for a career in politics when he falls in love with his gorgeous 19-year-old neighbor, Danielle. But Matthew\'s bright future is jeopardized when he finds Danielle was once a porn star. As Danielle\'s past catches up with her, Matthew\'s love for her forces him to re-evaluate his goals.','/5mVyFHSY2rSsNgD4NfEwV82HigU.jpg','2004-04-09',110,'Released','Matt never saw her coming... but all his friends had!','The Girl Next Door',10591,21.4553,6.8,'0rD3Qkh-238','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16519,_binary '\0','/mAtBBhpdBR3U3C23q00QrY9KmXd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0265232',5.4,2564,'sv','Livet är en schlager','Mona Bergström is a sweet eurovision-obsessed woman in her 30s. She is married to a lazy husband and has four children, all named after her favorite Swedish Eurovision popstars. Her brother is a crossdressing guy self-titled \"Candy Darling\". Mona works in a retirement home for disabled people, where she is responsible for taking care of a young man named David who suffers a movement-restricting disease forcing him into a wheelchair. David\'s parents have abandoned him, as they wanted a normal child. Mona holds a big place in David\'s heart, and vica versa. David\'s goal is to get his parents to come and visit him, and he wants to show them that he is a great person, despite his handicap. Therefore he works with music on his computer, and his goal is to create a song, send it to \"The Cardigans\", a famous Swedish band and have them play the song and credit him, hoping his parents would spot it and want to visit him.','/9VwP8fMxTVErL4w5SUdPfe6cMCz.jpg','2000-11-10',108,'Released',NULL,'Once in a Lifetime',21842,1.859,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16520,_binary '\0','/d8B0UIH8yBsVKjLDIT9MIeHrlZX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0265298',5.6,43289,'en','Big Fat Liar','After one of his class papers is stolen and turned into a movie, a young student and his best friend exact a hilarious, slapstick revenge on the Hollywood hot shot who has taken credit!','/3EjpQeyOpH8VIaWqIq6SpCQrCks.jpg','2002-02-08',88,'Released','Two friends are about to cut one Hollywood big shot down to size.','Big Fat Liar',11870,7.7353,5.9,'bpc2wgc_b3E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16521,_binary '\0','/4E5iitr7WbHdK7P6pMVT4iNMIp4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0265307',6.6,4771,'en','The Man from Elysian Fields','A failed novelist\'s inability to pay the bills strains relations with his wife and leads him to work at an escort service, where he becomes entwined with a wealthy woman whose husband is a successful writer.','/mCUzyYDMHNdihZVTVH1g3KvTo8p.jpg','2001-09-13',106,'Released',NULL,'The Man from Elysian Fields',15720,3.5363,5.9,'UKD-eNyW7Ao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16522,_binary '\0','/bEkGHeIZYtULSgEvyjIbGHnMqgf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0265343',7.3,26765,'hi','Monsoon Wedding','A stressed father, a bride-to-be with a secret, a smitten event planner, and relatives from around the world create much ado about the preparations for an arranged marriage in India.','/vCwkv7tYFem0tQ9Duoq2MX7T7Zd.jpg','2001-08-30',114,'Released','The rain is coming... and so is the family.','Monsoon Wedding',480,3.4967,6.8,'sjQjw-UyAX0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16523,_binary '\0','/zQM01PhOwJY9ePnWPQ8L0YeKf8c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0265349',6.4,91157,'en','The Mothman Prophecies','Reporter John Klein is plunged into a world of impossible terror when fate draws him to the sleepy West Virginia town of Point Pleasant, whose residents are being visited by a great winged shape that sows hideous nightmares and fevered visions.','/z2PiOTyjbCOnMHY2QJdq3I4jU44.jpg','2002-01-25',119,'Released','What do you see?','The Mothman Prophecies',2637,6.5086,6.229,'Yt42df3AscE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16524,_binary '\0','/uwbp1RJkFR5vhaMJPujoB7Qkkgc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0265459',6.8,141390,'en','One Hour Photo','Sy Parrish has lovingly developed photographs for the Yorkin family since their son was a baby. But as the Yorkins\' lives become fuller, Sy\'s only seems lonelier, until he eventually convinces himself he\'s part of their family. When Sy\'s picture-perfect fantasy collides with an ugly dose of reality, a bizarre and thrilling confrontation ensues.','/fuSIN3Nq6dmaA8LZSkASpQueFO1.jpg','2002-08-21',96,'Released','The things that we fear the most have already happened to us...','One Hour Photo',9357,5.9944,6.667,'eWzILZ6wE9Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16525,_binary '\0','/1QQZbcIZU9tF3fOZRV8fr1Wb3De.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0265591',6.1,10122,'en','Pumpkin','Carolyn\'s sorority sisters set their sights on the Sorority of the Year award and coaching challenged athletes is their ticket to the trophy. But when the queen of formals finds herself mentoring Pumpkin, a disabled athlete, their two worlds collide.','/25qW6cO2zqYBpqTw8BBIhBIUpl4.jpg','2002-06-28',118,'Released','a comedy for the romantically challenged','Pumpkin',9719,1.8125,5.7,'7XaPgf3yg_o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16526,_binary '\0','/v69OaHOYjdihRz0o0nVUylUyraa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0265632',6.5,12698,'en','Recess: School\'s Out','The school year is finally ending, and T.J. Detweiler is looking forward to summer. But boredom quickly sets in when his friends leave for camp — until T.J. uncovers an evil plot to do away with summer vacation! A crazy former principal, Dr. Benedict, is planning to use a laser beam to alter the weather and create permanent winter. Faced with the dire threat of year-round school, T.J. rounds up the RECESS gang and bands together with some unexpected allies — Miss Finster and Principal Prickly — in a nonstop adventure to save everyone\'s summer break.','/qsUCoeTwCNIrvDrUiWlTCgyRFZy.jpg','2001-02-16',82,'Released','Saving the world one playground at a time.','Recess: School\'s Out',19405,5.8439,6.6,'9cRn-bV5vdc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16527,_binary '\0','/2yHD9xcjRYbrjzANIwJC7DdsEEJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0265651',6.6,20760,'en','Ripley\'s Game','Tom Ripley - cool, urbane, wealthy, and murderous - lives in a villa in the Veneto with Luisa, his harpsichord-playing girlfriend. A former business associate from Berlin\'s underworld pays a call asking Ripley\'s help in killing a rival. Ripley - ever a student of human nature - initiates a game to turn a mild and innocent local picture framer into a hit man. The artisan, Jonathan Trevanny, who\'s dying of cancer, has a wife, young son, and little to leave them. If Ripley draws Jonathan into the game, can Ripley maintain control? Does it stop at one killing? What if Ripley develops a conscience?','/eVhycD9GBWPwnttygKYDi9hllAy.jpg','2002-09-02',110,'Released','Older. Wiser. More Talented.','Ripley\'s Game',10955,4.2747,6.443,'izIgroi7_NU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16528,_binary '\0','/gf5ahmfnGuM02RJyoETKQXTLft0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0265662',6.9,39795,'en','The Rookie','Jim Morris never made it out of the minor leagues before a shoulder injury ended his pitching career twelve years ago. Now a married-with-children high-school chemistry teacher and baseball coach in Texas, Jim\'s team makes a deal with him: if they win the district championship, Jim will try out with a major-league organization. The bet proves incentive enough for the team, and they go from worst to first, making it to state for the first time in the history of the school. Jim, forced to live up to his end of the deal, is nearly laughed off the try-out field--until he gets onto the mound, where he confounds the scouts (and himself) by clocking successive 98 mph fastballs, good enough for a minor-league contract with the Tampa Bay Devil Rays. Jim\'s still got a lot of pitches to throw before he makes it to The Show, but with his big-league dreams revived, there\'s no telling where he could go.','/gNmLsseIs6thkBKne91iQZDGyBT.jpg','2002-03-25',127,'Released','Sometimes dreams come back to life.','The Rookie',14635,5.1612,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16529,_binary '\0','/cbuX448RKetr5Y5cZkmJEfu3xji.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0265666',7.6,338943,'en','The Royal Tenenbaums','Royal Tenenbaum and his wife Etheline had three children and then they separated. All three children are extraordinary --- all geniuses. Virtually all memory of the brilliance of the young Tenenbaums was subsequently erased by two decades of betrayal, failure, and disaster. Most of this was generally considered to be their father\'s fault. \"The Royal Tenenbaums\" is the story of the family\'s sudden, unexpected reunion one recent winter.','/nG7hZJn7wQTSDCQT39Gy3s3tbrp.jpg','2001-10-05',110,'Released','Family isn\'t a word... it\'s a sentence.','The Royal Tenenbaums',9428,10.4476,7.455,'-DNAI9bhBFU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16530,_binary '\0','/kdvEcs68ele4xgu0DaCRPQFu6tC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0265691',5.7,1397,'de','Das Sams','One Saturday, the Slurb, a strange little creature with a proboscis nose, enters Mr. Taschenbier\'s life. Slurb, who immediately adopts the shy Mr. Taschenbier as his \"daddy,\" is, however, his sheer opposite: he is cheeky and chaotic and throws his well-ordered life into sheer chaos. But when Taschenbier discovers that he can fulfill all his wishes with the help of Slurb\'s blue freckles, his life suddenly changes. He appeases his bad-tempered landlady, Mrs. Rotkohl, and he can finally get one over on his nasty neighbor, Mr. Lürcher. Everything could be so nice if Mr. Taschenbier didn\'t fall in love with his pretty colleague Mrs. März and if the Slurb didn\'t almost burst with jealousy...','/z5iCvXEzt4nXz8NQzqfTz7JuHBP.jpg','2001-10-17',100,'Released',NULL,'The Slurb',10645,1.4011,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16531,_binary '\0','/wdWaaSG5n4294HfA2D9Tr72LDge.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0265709',5.7,2174,'en','Scenes of the Crime','A young man about to get married earns extra cash by driving a local mobster, but things go awry when the mobster is shot dead by a rival crime boss.','/7I0lFUX3Eb0MKzI25Dd4AhrzC3r.jpg','2002-05-11',91,'Released',NULL,'Scenes of the Crime',31008,2.548,5.5,'UMiYe7lpRY0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16532,_binary '\0','/t1lcz05opAAgII5Rmve95LOO7z5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0265713',6.6,5051,'en','Scotland, PA','In a modernized retelling of \"MacBeth\" set in 1970s suburban Pennsylvania, Joe McBeth, an unambitious hamburger stand employee, is driven to success by his scheming wife.','/phyNpVgqHmxn9tTXbljeyodTeVH.jpg','2001-03-15',104,'Released','Greasy Spoon. Bloody Murder.','Scotland, PA',27593,1.7637,6.1,'hiF-ftELdv0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16533,_binary '\0','/lhyZNnh2vf8PdSKTNs5SqD9kyPt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0265730',8.1,3226,'ta','சேது...','A violent college student softens his tough exterior when he falls in love with a shy Brahmin woman. Just as the ice between them begins to melt, he\'s attacked viciously and loses his mental stability.','/ak7L2zzWojsnmwk7Bb3izV6ZkFr.jpg','1999-12-10',130,'Released',NULL,'Sethu...',69669,1.2283,6.605,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16534,_binary '\0','/xjBcaVGVQuXws9tqqhCs1xp7M8m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0265808',5.2,14278,'en','Stealing Harvard','John and his girlfriend have vowed to marry once they save $30,000 for their dream house. But the minute they achieve their financial goal, John finds out his niece has been accepted at Harvard, and he\'s reminded of his promise to pay for her tuition (nearly $30,000). John\'s friend Duff convinces him to turn to petty crime to make the payment … but Duff\'s hare-brained schemes spin quickly out of control.','/iCHAn0eVAXwybuzoQO598aKMVJD.jpg','2002-09-13',85,'Released','Their intentions were honorable. Their methods were criminal.','Stealing Harvard',12770,3.1352,4.9,'mmJD7_ueDLc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16535,_binary '\0','/p0djb9Yz0Bt4G0YNmM034Ij6rX4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0265859',5.4,1527,'en','Tempted','A wealthy man married to a beautiful younger woman puts her fidelity to the test.','/8eATKm6o4vraNjcVuoMdHqEqIoD.jpg','2001-01-01',95,'Released','I want to believe I can trust her...So I want to pay you to seduce my wife','Tempted',71204,2.5479,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16536,_binary '\0','/8sajLN5R5jNhqnYbL6KgRHDepa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0265930',6.9,9165,'it','L\'ultimo bacio','Giulia and Carlo have been happy together for three years, but Giulia\'s announcement that she is pregnant sends him into a secret panic. Terrified at his imminent entry into the adult world of irreversible responsibilities, Carlo finds himself tempted by a bewitching 18-year-old girl, Francesca, whom he meets by chance at a wedding. The possibility of one last youthful crazy fling before the impending prison of parenthood proves to be too attractive to resist.','/mPrhgVQfvopYaZVCowf4Tqm4UPC.jpg','2001-02-01',115,'Released','Love. Sex. Surrender.','The Last Kiss',12308,2.8403,6.4,'fCTZZ0gpnWU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16537,_binary '\0','/ousitgcF5XMOet65baBIGWZr4GF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0265944',3.6,2174,'en','Sasquatch','Harlan Knowles, billionaire and president of Bio-Comp Industries heads up a team of experts in a quest to locate a company plane that disappeared over the remote forests of the Pacific Northwest. Knowles is obsessed with finding the plane and rescuing his daughter, who was one of its passengers. The assembled team includes local guide Clayton Tyne, wilderness expert/author Winston Burg and Marla Lawson. Soon, the team begins to suspect that Knowles\' main objective is actually to recover the prototype of a DNA testing machine called the Huxley Project, which his company has spent years and millions of dollars developing.','/rPHneBW9Gles5QsFzSduoLAZVhy.jpg','2002-07-29',92,'Released',NULL,'Sasquatch',29883,1.5954,3.621,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16538,_binary '\0','/pHuqQjK8V03qIO5ZyeRtZXfbSEj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0265987',7.8,2394,'en','Victor/Victoria','A struggling female soprano finds work playing a male female impersonator, but it complicates her personal life. Filmed live during its opening night (October 25, 1995) at the Marquis Theatre in New York City.','/z4Lp1FH2ESnKWW1cpAMQoAT3awq.jpg','1996-01-18',146,'Released',NULL,'Victor/Victoria',177041,1.4846,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16539,_binary '\0','/npfTHcJkcXgrWHbeLLGkvbA0yFl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0266075',6.3,3829,'ko','여고괴담 두번째 이야기','The ghost of a lesbian high-school girl takes revenge on the people who used to bully her. And another young girl finds her old diary detailing her love and rejection when she was alive.','/2WbQ15hpKLeVoCMUMsW60EjvTig.jpg','1999-12-24',98,'Released','Some secrets should never be revealed.','Memento Mori',54111,2.1332,6.3,'RYDOS73D-aU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16540,_binary '\0','/4EWARZmmTVxJ0l5qcrBF4kkYQyk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0266260',7.3,1310,'hi','Arjun','Mr. Malwankar lives a small tenement in Grant Road, Bombay, with his son, Arjun, daughter, Sudha, and wife, Rukmini, who is his second wife, as his first wife passed away. Although he is well past his retirement age, he continues to work for an abusive employer, Ashok. Arjun\'s attempts at seeking employment are all in vain. One day when hoodlums are beating up a man, he intervenes, beats the hoodlums up with the help of half of his friends. This is when his life changes forever. One of his friends\', Mohan, is killed; Arjun finds out who the killers are, and kills them in broad daylight; he is arrested, and subsequently released, only to be told by his father that he is no longer welcome. A politician, Shiv Kumar Chougule, takes a liking to Arjun and employs him, and gives him all the support and assistance he needs to fight hoodlums. Arjun now finds he has a mission in life, and is quite content','/ULvER6xat5qiYV7Oxhw4OlV19N.jpg','1985-04-20',154,'Released',NULL,'Arjun',96112,0.9808,5.3,'U0w8g4_8axo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16541,_binary '\0','/gtYmm8HeM6CneomZ98flixAGsBe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0266308',7.5,208846,'ja','バトル・ロワイアル','In the future, the Japanese government captures a class of ninth-grade students and forces them to kill each other under the revolutionary \"Battle Royale\" act.','/aLGKAQKgzWpJ6egyWzzC11jXBRJ.jpg','2000-12-16',113,'Released','Could you kill your best friend?','Battle Royale',3176,9.5317,7.264,'icHkv92ph8Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16542,_binary '\0','/wGKaxjaJ8gR1PQ2MWQYYS8jpN1D.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0266391',6.4,9617,'en','The Cat\'s Meow','Semi-true story of the Hollywood murder that occurred at a star-studded gathering aboard William Randolph Hearst\'s yacht in 1924.','/zEVZa9EuApL5AQl2mE9NNAeCUix.jpg','2002-04-12',114,'Released','Some secrets won\'t stay buried.','The Cat\'s Meow',35080,3.0999,5.8,'jy9SS59oQFQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16543,_binary '\0','/r7zkELMYtf8dSh8nnzwXIH4DFh1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0266408',5.3,1989,'cn','雷霆戰警','A young Chinese Security Officer, Darren, is called for Team 808, which fights against the smuggling of drugs and corruption. Noriko, a Japanese Interpol officer, collaborates with Darren for the destruction of a large international drug cartel. At the same time, a senior government officer\'s daughter is suspected of corruption.','/7beE2wimzlaTQPMOoTquKNPoymh.jpg','2000-12-21',92,'Released','Extortion. Murder. Revenge.','China Strike Force',34856,2.7137,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16544,_binary '\0','/iESnRGuIiXKeNo3pKMRaZStXyH6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0266425',7.6,30790,'en','Conspiracy','At the Wannsee Conference on January 20, 1942, senior Nazi officials meet to determine the manner in which the so-called \"Final Solution to the Jewish Question\" can be best implemented.','/xKocKpTHaKcTuNRLu0rLbZWbLnH.jpg','2001-05-19',96,'Released','One meeting. Six million lives.','Conspiracy',12900,3.1539,7.3,'vWLvq0jC-c0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16545,_binary '\0','/6mGQxale5YOuszTXCdD2uofjuTk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0266437',7.4,3828,'ru','ДМБ','The student, Rifle, has managed to seduce his professor\'s wife, Bomber, an average working guy, has bought a factory and Bullet, the casino lover, is hiding from creditors. They all share a common path and conscription. In the army they teach you that everything must be smart and in order - cockades, straps and all, otherwise you\'re not fit to call yourself a person, you\'re a maggot. For a real man, there\'s no better place than the army.','/yxlffqupxvNatCmVPymb2ztceJJ.jpg','2000-03-31',85,'Released',NULL,'Demobbed',64266,1.4461,6.534,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16546,_binary '\0','/xse1f9OR0PVByGnTChplzUgYz7t.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0266452',6.3,45083,'en','Death to Smoochy','Tells the story of Rainbow Randolph, the corrupt, costumed star of a popular children\'s TV show, who is fired over a bribery scandal and replaced by squeaky-clean Smoochy, a puffy fuchsia rhinoceros. As Smoochy catapults to fame - scoring hit ratings and the affections of a network executive - Randolph makes the unsuspecting rhino the target of his numerous outrageous attempts to exact revenge and reclaim his status as America\'s sweetheart.','/wrwwuNLITsA5N5cVnA3ftvHFqHj.jpg','2002-03-29',109,'Released','Get ready for an unexpected hit.','Death to Smoochy',9275,5.2193,5.944,'jEoMWIxDdNA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16547,_binary '\0','/bPVCkI1NVHNuAdD9OB5NFHgOSXk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0266465',6,51425,'en','A Man Apart','When Vetter\'s wife is killed in a botched hit organized by Diablo, he seeks revenge against those responsible. But in the process, Vetter and Hicks have to fight their way up the chain to get to Diablo but it\'s easier said than done when all Vetter can focus on is revenge.','/mgcGj39KYcyPx6zDiICHsPQNAJQ.jpg','2003-04-04',109,'Released','Love changes a man. Revenge tears him apart.','A Man Apart',8409,7.6535,6.165,'Nxv0VLPy2_o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16548,_binary '\0','/peQaGE36oX0ClMj1xOPPzQxF1MM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0266489',5.9,66099,'en','Duplex','When a young couple buys their dream home, they have no idea what the sweet little old lady upstairs is going to put them through!','/mCQ4oO9djqcthBRD3ftTnR8qSP7.jpg','2003-09-26',89,'Released','Alex and Nancy finally found their dream home...and then they moved in.','Duplex',7288,6.3587,6.121,'lcsFE7C80-o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16549,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0266519',5.6,1555,'en','Everything for a Reason','When Manny, a young aspiring writer meets Eve, the girl of his dreams and a virgin to boot, he adamantly believes that getting into a serious relationship will derail him from his dream.','/wTw7o3v8WdjCHRodxd8SXKrepFa.jpg','2000-10-23',89,'Released',NULL,'Everything for a Reason',1489553,1.2696,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16550,_binary '\0','/eCynaAOgYYiw5yN5lBwz3IxqvaW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0266543',8.2,1225187,'en','Finding Nemo','Nemo, an adventurous young clownfish, is unexpectedly taken from his Great Barrier Reef home to a dentist\'s office aquarium. It\'s up to his worrisome father Marlin and a friendly but forgetful fish Dory to bring Nemo home -- meeting vegetarian sharks, surfer dude turtles, hypnotic jellyfish, hungry seagulls, and more along the way.','/eHuGQ10FUzK1mdOY69wF5pGgEf5.jpg','2003-05-30',100,'Released','There are 3.7 trillion fish in the ocean. They\'re looking for one.','Finding Nemo',12,38.3169,7.821,'SPHfeNgogVs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16551,_binary '\0','/epMOr2LsLgA0C411i3qDBWuLcDM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0266555',6.2,2084,'ja','フリーズ・ミー','When a woman is harassed and threatened by one of the men who gang-raped her five years previously, she is pushed to take icy revenge against her attackers.','/pFvL4nBFIAACLwrnts3FISNESDz.jpg','2000-05-27',101,'Released','I will freeze you into my past.','Freeze Me',37998,1.7898,5.8,'3KmF4xiu2PI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16552,_binary '\0','/iffzIhuLAO38Po6sh1s6ZEVwlNL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0266697',8.2,1324962,'en','Kill Bill: Vol. 1','An assassin is shot by her ruthless employer, Bill, and other members of their assassination circle – but she lives to plot her vengeance.','/v7TaX8kXMXs5yFFGR41guUDNcnB.jpg','2003-10-10',111,'Released','Here comes the bride.','Kill Bill: Vol. 1',24,30.9007,7.97,'sXwXk3jcrfU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16553,_binary '\0','/kJAo4SAL9hDJkwVAHowGqy2otXl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0266747',3,5649,'en','Marci X','Marci Feld, a pampered Jewish-American Princess, doesn’t know about rap or the business world. But everything changes after rapper Dr. S releases a controversial CD for the hard-core hip-hop record label owned by Marci’s father. After a national protest breaks out to boycott the new CD and the record label, her father is hospitalized by a heart attack. Marci decides to step in to save his reputation and the family business by taming the raunchy rapper\'s wild bad boy image.','/8gDhnXFVARqa5F2sCZdelDhiVjc.jpg','2003-08-22',84,'Released','Hip hop meets shop till you drop.','Marci X',32316,2.3481,3.5,'NI5_51pLv8E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16554,_binary '\0','/ys6Per2Ka2rdTG5gnOHOAoQqjNl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0266821',6.4,1864,'ru','Особенности национальной охоты в зимний период','Now the peculiarities of the national hunt are investigated during the winter season.','/saMcVgvwfpGNt5aTLDTGlwVbewd.jpg','2000-09-14',100,'Released',NULL,'Peculiarities of the National Hunt in the Winter',20883,1.5249,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16555,_binary '\0','/iwvSCGVtUIQZCHAnKk3MBsk0vyI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0266850',6.2,4489,'en','Phantom of the Megaplex','Pete Riley is a 17-year-old who lands a part-time job at a multiplex in his neighbourhood. He and his friends are excited when it\'s announced that the theatre will play host to the premier of a major motion picture, with a number of Hollywood celebrities in attendance. However, when the big night comes, Pete has to contend with disappearing staff, malfunctioning equipment, and a broken popcorn machine.','/saZEFau4Y4EYvXQgdAcVTxiDopy.jpg','2000-11-10',89,'Released',NULL,'Phantom of the Megaplex',26450,2.8711,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16556,_binary '\0','/1eDh6w4jpxfL7cp4qAXFlCnIehP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0266875',7,1595,'hi','रात','The Sharma family re-locate to a semi-urban locality in a house that has a \"reputation\". The Sharma family consists of Mr. Sharma, his wife Shalini Sharma, only daughter Manisha Sharma or \"Mini\" as they affectionately call her; and their grandchild Bunty, as his parents had been killed in an accident. Strange things start happening, with a return of a dead kitten, and the brutal murder of Manisha\'s friend, Reshmi; an attempt to kill Mr. Sharma and Manisha\'s boyfriend, Deepak. What is the force behind these brutalities? Is it natural or supernatural?','/krQAgqZuxMZ2szXSTzZsOrJOKHZ.jpg','1992-02-07',127,'Released',NULL,'Raat',228012,1.1654,6.733,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16557,_binary '\0','/vPJwn9pp5f58CqdaXU3eOSLoJkl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0266915',6.7,264071,'en','Rush Hour 2','It\'s vacation time for Carter as he finds himself alongside Lee in Hong Kong wishing for more excitement. While Carter wants to party and meet the ladies, Lee is out to track down a Triad gang lord who may be responsible for killing two men at the American Embassy. Things get complicated as the pair stumble onto a counterfeiting plot. The boys are soon up to their necks in fist fights and life-threatening situations. A trip back to the U.S. may provide the answers about the bombing, the counterfeiting, and the true allegiance of sexy customs agent Isabella.','/aBQf2vMiCINeVC9v6BGVYKXurTh.jpg','2001-08-03',90,'Released','Get ready for a second Rush!','Rush Hour 2',5175,14.1248,6.779,'SCTzYY95Aw4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16558,_binary '\0','/3B21dTZ5T1CaUoXl8KTjBEXrAfz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0266971',5.8,2979,'en','The Slaughter Rule','A young man finds solace with a young woman, his mother, and a high-school football coach who recruits him to quarterback a six-man team.','/menXGjXgiEaawdOUlxWI1youK6Q.jpg','2002-01-11',116,'Released','In life, every season counts.','The Slaughter Rule',21801,2.4554,5.7,'bo0FMvCnAO8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16559,_binary '\0','/7Hfatv0lZkMyxw8UBZmiK2qSXDR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0266987',7.1,178562,'en','Spy Game','On the day of his retirement, a veteran CIA agent learns that his former protégé has been arrested in China, is sentenced to die the next morning in Beijing, and that the CIA is considering letting that happen to avoid an international scandal.','/6y8M1rxjKofQCRKKe6xeV91K2Fc.jpg','2001-11-18',126,'Released','It\'s not how you play the game. It\'s how the game plays you.','Spy Game',1535,8.7788,6.922,'S7m6SWDODMA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16560,_binary '\0','/d84kHdmlZd46xFiQqyPId8ouVgd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0267116',6.3,4122,'ja','WiLD ZERO','Only legendary Japanese garage rock band Guitar Wolf can stand between a race of aliens from destroying Earth with an army of zombies.','/9HOpvIaFJSwFyDXoULC9hWVdVsS.jpg','1999-08-28',98,'Released','Trash and chaossss!!!!','Wild Zero',16231,1.5056,5.683,'cv5AYlKGt1E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16561,_binary '\0','/l6zhhG4HR1ovOPkWBXIoXkJyQz5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0267129',6.2,14212,'fr','Yamakasi - Les samouraïs des temps modernes','Yamakasi - Les samouraïs des temps modernes is a 2001 French movie written by Luc Besson. It demonstrates the skills of the Yamakasi, a group of traceurs who battle against injustice in the Paris ghetto. They use parkour to steal from the rich in order to pay off medical bills for a kid injured copying their techniques.','/7INcVJWvyT5pwnGHTYrhZXD7zvS.jpg','2001-04-04',90,'Released',NULL,'Yamakasi',6935,3.8,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16562,_binary '\0','/632yGRIcTau6hf5UyZv90HlatYF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0267248',4.8,10500,'en','Abandon','A psychological thriller about a senior at one of America\'s most prestigious universities. Under enormous pressure to complete her thesis and earn a top job at one of the world\'s most competitive consulting firms, Katie is still coping with the sudden unexplained disappearance of her first love two years prior. As the investigation continues, Katie is forced to choose between past passions and new possibilities, even as new facts are uncovered.','/7zRmopB7pnveyhFaCRSMZMiGO0v.jpg','2002-10-14',99,'Released','Watch who you leave behind.','Abandon',15992,2.832,4.8,'0_V7Hyqb4s8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16563,_binary '\0','/4HC0ADbWMMR59ek1bNmbjSqlEMB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0267261',5,2499,'it','Senso \'45','Livia, the attractive wife of a high-ranking Ministry of the People\'s Republic official, is accompanied by Ugo, a lawyer, her admirer and her husband\'s spy, to Venice. There, she is to meet her lover Helmut Schultz, a lieutenant in the infamous SS with whom she is having a passionate love affair. During the journey, Livia retraces the steps of her sexual aberration. But a surprise awaits her in the lagoon city.','/Cb8n2cAwssBCApYjwYbz67S6P0.jpg','2002-04-12',128,'Released',NULL,'Black Angel',30301,3.0898,5.352,'j_AU_L544z4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16564,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0267277',9,2400,'mr','अशी ही बनवा बनवी','Chaos ensues when two brothers, Dhananjay and Shantanu, force two friends to pose as their wives as their landlady allows only married couples as tenants.','/yUpM3iEpLGZL2L3T7YSiYEUyvP.jpg','1988-09-23',137,'Released',NULL,'Ashi Hi Banwa Banwi',302435,1.1463,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16565,_binary '\0','/cf8qwkSTSuHrRH9yIKfM6QYoCtB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0267287',6.4,14121,'pl','Avalon','In a future world, young people are increasingly becoming addicted to an illegal (and potentially deadly) battle simulation game called Avalon. When Ash, a star player, hears of rumors that a more advanced level of the game exists somewhere, she gives up her loner ways and joins a gang of explorers. Even if she finds the gateway to the next level, will she ever be able to come back to reality?','/jg4lqIDSXXqPmmZyyAFdJ7bel8t.jpg','2001-01-20',107,'Released','Dare to enter a world of future videogames.','Avalon',10881,2.4968,6.5,'KXRXclj99Xg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16566,_binary '\0','/gfiPdyCALO1p3fXKNpQEYr6MiSd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0267351',8.6,11398,'tr','Canım Kardeşim','Two poor men try to find a television as a last wish for the terminally ill brother of one of them.','/eYwfUkhKZ5C4g88uJU5mXkLsOk8.jpg','1973-03-01',92,'Released',NULL,'My Dear Brother',80841,0.8905,8.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16567,_binary '\0','/28AZMx63XQzDD5fbyl68dZdTIBp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0267363',7.6,2959,'hi','चांदनी बार','The gritty life of the Mumbai underworld, including prostitution, dance bars and gun crime.','/x714ESupc6VL0Y7Kdgwqdp389IR.jpg','2001-09-28',150,'Released',NULL,'Chandni Bar',20769,1.435,6.633,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16568,_binary '\0','/cZzuz3nbwh2126L0mFtngLNrNKd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0267548',6.4,4153,'hi','Haseena Maan Jaayegi','Brothers Sonu and Monu\'s regular pranks worry their father. However, their lives take a turn when they fall in love and go to great lengths to impress the girls\' father.','/pNZkVQOpSFkOEVRIXJGUInFNE5w.jpg','1999-06-25',150,'Released',NULL,'Haseena Maan Jaayegi',30321,1.4857,5.917,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16569,_binary '\0','/4dahYf4gDVvcw6NPjbCv8u6lRCK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0267601',5.4,1658,'en','The Irrefutable Truth About Demons','In the place between what you know, and what you fear, demons rule. All hope is stripped away as demonic forces overcome you. Dr. Harry Ballard has just unearthed the essence of evil. He’s a marked man, a living sacrifice, thrown to the depths of the demon world. At his side is a beautiful young woman – an ex-cult member who’s experienced their immeasurable power.','/oUDeAFislZ7xkCQn8VMt35nEtGz.jpg','2000-05-01',90,'Released','Hell is real.','The Irrefutable Truth About Demons',15701,1.5001,5.2,'DqUCQ4I9bEs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16570,_binary '\0','/vhGmRg0RyTwpoPsLpGHtqOcsGSI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0267626',6.7,72936,'en','K-19: The Widowmaker','When Russia\'s first nuclear submarine malfunctions on its maiden voyage, the crew must race to save the ship and prevent a nuclear disaster.','/vImR0HQkJs7Xs2qgdXEUDeX49m0.jpg','2002-07-19',138,'Released','Fate has found its hero.','K-19: The Widowmaker',8665,7.753,6.581,'BvHWH8xg0Rw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16571,_binary '\0','/7kOPoKt2pr0Fw9TIVFJBaiVgjzp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0267736',7.3,1726,'en','The Matthew Shepard Story','In a senseless act of hatred, openly gay college student Matthew Shepard was murdered in 1998. This critically-acclaimed, moving film recounts the final days of Matthew\'s killers\' trial—and the weeks leading to Matthew\'s death—with unnerving detail. Stockard Channing delivers an unforgettable, Emmy® Award-winning performance as Matthew\'s grieving mother, Judy, in a story of a murder that moved a nation to action. Also starring Law & Order\'s Sam Waterston.','/TChFELYf4ccNaenxCSyGFRyDTj.jpg','2002-03-16',92,'Released',NULL,'The Matthew Shepard Story',44528,2.4203,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16572,_binary '\0','/yZzPTih3HQZUBghrWirt0Rk17uE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0267804',5.9,100506,'en','The One','A sheriff\'s deputy fights an alternate universe version of himself who grows stronger with each alternate self he kills.','/gcr3t71KmeXINemMrhaGBGVJPwW.jpg','2001-11-02',87,'Released','Stealing the power of the universes one by one.','The One',10796,7.5196,6.138,'LfeIezSuRj4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16573,_binary '\0','/nYVrpgFL2kTbcQGNvbDy65NsXfP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0267891',5.8,41159,'en','The Ringer','Pressured by a greedy uncle and a pile of debt, lovable loser Steve Barker resorts to an unthinkable, contemptible, just-crazy-enough-to-work scheme. He pretends to be mentally challenged to rig the upcoming Special Olympics and bring home the gold. But when Steve\'s fellow competitors get wise to the con, they inspire him to rise to the greatest challenge of all: becoming a better person.','/sEkEGRMaqDj4SMofgjOYVGR4o18.jpg','2005-12-23',94,'Released','Make it special.','The Ringer',9927,3.736,5.7,'Tn_H5_O5v20','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16574,_binary '\0','/1RAxtBxslR4OZCZC1vxIRUxjR7a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0267913',5.4,143731,'en','Scooby-Doo','When the Mystery Inc. gang is invited to Spooky Island, a popular amusement park, they soon discover that the attractions aren\'t the only things that are spooky. Strange things are happening, and it\'s up to Scooby, Shaggy, Fred, Daphne, and Velma to uncover the truth behind the mysterious happenings.','/mTAiBJGg8mqEfnYHHbi37ZoRSZm.jpg','2002-06-14',87,'Released','Be afraid. Be kind of afraid.','Scooby-Doo',9637,10.7345,6.117,'lh6v23z6iek','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16575,_binary '\0','/mkjdussWOjts0Se6hEwfTQdwCv2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0268126',7.6,214592,'en','Adaptation.','Charlie Kaufman is a confused L.A. screenwriter overwhelmed by feelings of inadequacy, sexual frustration, self-loathing, and by the screenwriting ambitions of his freeloading twin brother Donald. While struggling to adapt \"The Orchid Thief,\" by Susan Orlean, Kaufman\'s life spins from pathetic to bizarre. The lives of Kaufman and Orlean\'s book become strangely intertwined as each one\'s search for passion collides with the other\'s.','/ffEmHQAiD0m5dEQ6rlsuA9vlllW.jpg','2002-12-06',115,'Released','From the creator of Being John Malkovich, comes the story about the creator of Being John Malkovich.','Adaptation.',2757,8.6641,7.328,'BMwOEkTmTyQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16576,_binary '\0','/ag90STh8Gvinuwg8Q0NRAcY3JAm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0268200',6.7,1754,'en','Brigham City','Wes Clayton is a lawman and a bishop in a Mormon community called Brigham. The town is shaken when a woman from California is found murdered. Clayton and his young deputy work with an FBI agent sent to investigate. As a civil and spiritual leader in the frightened town, Clayton must uncover the town\'s deepest secrets, find the murderer and keep Brigham from ripping itself apart.','/8CM2YIX0qLcqDY7d6iVb4uRXGG8.jpg','2001-03-30',119,'Released','Nothing attracts a serpent like paradise','Brigham City',26791,1.0956,6.5,'WLlqqHGgQbk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16577,_binary '\0','/6VclYrb4F7RNmz2CHo6W0MRvabo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0268219',6.8,1217,'fr','Comment j\'ai tué mon père','When his long-time disappeared father is entering his life again, Jean-Luc, a successful doctor, has no option but to face his own life story. Will he ever be able to forget and forgive?','/cdTmOhfLMMTJn4mSXhX01pvxPlM.jpg','2001-09-19',98,'Released',NULL,'How I Killed My Father',60608,1.5885,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16578,_binary '\0','/1VbDg9BfqnKoYpj6H0nxgqzdnry.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0268282',8,1732,'hr','Čudesna šuma','A painter falls asleep beneath a magical elm tree and awakens with magical powers that allow him to communicate with the creatures of the forest. In the limited time that he possesses these powers, he must help save the forest from the threat of the evil Cactus King.','/1CNba7hKs6wCkDyfGOH0wGfYAz2.jpg','1986-06-19',83,'Released','Listen Carefully To The Wind And You Will Hear Its Whispers.','The Elm-Chanted Forest',38832,1.5135,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16579,_binary '\0','/xDW6Az2fHgSnYKzAnHlvsx0FdXe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0268288',5.4,1984,'sv','Eva & Adam - Fyra födelsedagar och ett fiasko','Already a couple for 3 years, teenagers Eva and Adam are happy together. But when friends start joking about an impending marriage, Eva is angered and decides to dump Adam. Hurt and upset, Adam seeks comfort with Petra. But when Eva learns about Adam\'s new romance, she realizes she\'s made a mistake and sets out to win him back.','/xJhROD6troGYEdptIvnTpEOnWDF.jpg','2001-01-19',100,'Released','Just because you\'ve been together since age 11, you don’t need to stay together forever.','Eva & Adam: Four Birthdays and a Fiasco',61373,1.4785,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16580,_binary '\0','/w1NeirK1VT9JPV1fka4yKJZAKyA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0268303',4.2,1221,'sv','Festival','17 years old Lina goes to the Arvika Festival with her boyfriend Calle despite that her mother forbade her. At the festival she meets the singer Marc and they start to like each other but things are getting difficult.','/zMJXDwRWCR4Nzvu8Emx5RXN0dkm.jpg','2001-02-16',92,'Released',NULL,'Festival',77353,0.8177,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16581,_binary '\0','/wkkVMvP7qdHcE5MJtxQ8Ikatpat.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0268346',5.5,1303,'sv','Hans och hennes','Johan and Anna-Karin have been a couple for years but despite many attempts, Anna-Karin doesn\'t get pregnant. A visit to a fertility clinic shows why: Johan\'s sperm quality is too low. Johan is waiting to take over his father\'s farm, but what\'s the point if they can never have children? The news also puts a strain on their relationship since Anna-Karin desperately wants to be a mother.','/5lek7UhsHvQhGUSXwVhFfvY7LhI.jpg','2001-02-09',96,'Released',NULL,'His and Hers',52784,1.1143,4.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16582,_binary '\0','/oL41VHgASG30nWZ4T9aUvbErQ7v.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0268374',5.5,3632,'sv','Hundtricket - The Movie','Simon dreams of finding his one true love. Until then, he spends most of his time watching sloppy tearjerkers on video. He also shies away from the shallow young women that he and his friends Micke and Mario meet at bars. But Micke suggests one thing that is a guaranteed babe-magnet: taking a dog out for walks. It\'s an instant success for Simon, he meets the delightful Mia who immediately takes a liking to him. But things are not always what they may look like.','/3fS4xnUTrKKG4SlDPfcZeWkGyQJ.jpg','2002-10-25',106,'Released',NULL,'The Dog Trick',18225,1.5917,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16583,_binary '\0','/8pwIhymsxfAVjrAE7syDjQULn37.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0268380',7.5,572263,'en','Ice Age','Manny the mammoth, Sid the loquacious sloth, and Diego the sabre-toothed tiger go on a comical quest to return a human baby back to his father, across a world on the brink of an ice age.','/gLhHHZUzeseRXShoDyC4VqLgsNv.jpg','2002-03-14',81,'Released','Sub-zero heroes.','Ice Age',425,25.0181,7.4,'i4noiCRJRoE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16584,_binary '\0','/9stTjA64EvFfNtrlO5XKvpBX351.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0268397',6.1,40972,'en','Jimmy Neutron: Boy Genius','Jimmy Neutron is a boy genius and way ahead of his friends, but when it comes to being cool, he\'s a little behind. All until one day when his parents, and parents all over Earth are kidnapped by aliens, it\'s up to him to lead all the children of the world to rescue their parents.','/pUwdquA6Bf3Gq8yT5iQL1Yq0jkl.jpg','2001-12-14',83,'Released','A little genius becomes a big hero.','Jimmy Neutron: Boy Genius',12589,8.0063,6.1,'Njf8U5SnM4w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16585,_binary '\0','/apbl8Zv8p5H0q0F0Bote1TXijaB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0268401',4.5,2859,'hi','कहीं प्यार न हो जाए','Prem is in love with Nisha and plans to marry her, but on the day of the marriage Nisha does not show up. When Prem asks for an explanation, Nisha tells him that she is marrying a rich and wealthy young man from the US instead, who will be able to look after her and her ailing brother, devastating Prem.','/cb8oOM20UYi0BrmBKvRe9ZHOyKr.jpg','2000-11-17',165,'Released','...because marriages are made in heaven.','Kahin Pyaar Na Ho Jaaye',161219,1.3594,5.321,'Cc21usGvBeY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16586,_binary '\0','/ehLNVWeksv50rGuIt04JOApWkfT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0268437',6.4,5438,'en','The Man Who Sued God','A lawyer becomes a fisherman from frustration. When his one piece of property, his boat, is struck by lightning and destroyed he is denied insurance money because it was “an act of God”. He re-registers as a lawyer and sues the insurance company and, as God’s representative, The Church.','/4mB43zGijLyPZPgX9jC3oRtC4BY.jpg','2001-10-25',97,'Released',NULL,'The Man Who Sued God',9648,2.2867,6.3,'9ZfJywXiRyw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16587,_binary '\0','/2Q4KpJl74HUHdUVczlTXYskP08o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0268579',4.6,3317,'en','Ripper: Letter from Hell','A massacre survivor studies serial killers under a famous expert, but her classmates soon start dying at the hands of a Jack the Ripper copycat.','/c1aFQpsaPC2nUxHdDKu0YkSq3Sh.jpg','2001-08-08',114,'Released','He\'s back from the past to pick up the pieces.','Ripper: Letter from Hell',28314,2.5684,4.6,'T9dtL0xV7Nc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16588,_binary '\0','/cPOrHQ8HKgefGjEBU1zJ0H7ndv2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0268690',7,10670,'en','Thirteen Conversations About One Thing','In New York City, the lives of a lawyer, an actuary, a house-cleaner, a professor, and the people around them intersect as they ponder order and happiness in the face of life\'s cold unpredictability.','/mb3mEfzAudrPpQIxRzpLM12aiMV.jpg','2001-09-02',104,'Released','Ask yourself if you\'re really happy.','Thirteen Conversations About One Thing',17734,2.8688,6.2,'H1Lm5Jieg5c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16589,_binary '\0','/i0eOILDW8HipIkOUSKhB1dvZzNJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0268695',6,136852,'en','The Time Machine','Hoping to alter the events of the past, a 19th-century inventor instead travels 800,000 years into the future, where he finds mankind divided into two warring races.','/iYayQahkghlbAsfOQX8b5eBzGVy.jpg','2002-03-04',96,'Released','The greatest adventure THROUGH all time!','The Time Machine',2135,10.1119,6.359,'5zckzIWvygY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16590,_binary '\0','/hdY8F4WDODtJABVnY0Ivm0o26i4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0268711',4.5,1309,'es','Tuno negro','Students of the university of Salamanca are brutally murdered by a black masked minstrel. Alex, an architecture student who has recently moved to Salamanca discovers a pattern behind the killings; it seems as if the killer strikes regularly after the exams to free the campus from lousy students.','/vCaFIz33boKji3jwzchuTsf8E7U.jpg','2001-07-19',107,'Released','Ignorance kills.','Black Serenade',79359,1.3034,4.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16591,_binary '\0','/gHnuGyRMCoHzD1WT4965awn9P98.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0268896',7.2,1700,'el','Αυτή η Νύχτα Μένει','Stella is a beautiful young girl who dreams of becoming one day a famous singer. Her boyfriend Andreas leads a quiet life working at his small store, and doesn\'t approve Stella\'s quest for fame. When she decides to leave Athens for a singing job offered to her somewhere in north Greece, Andreas sets off on a quest to find her again and convince her to come back to him','/eoabhflaBPT97rFwEtQPoh44SkM.jpg','2000-01-06',112,'Released',NULL,'Edge of Night',251779,0.91,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16592,_binary '\0','/hCJFWTPghXCwwSpvPpAoIB8318Q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0268978',8.2,1063887,'en','A Beautiful Mind','From the heights of notoriety to the depths of depravity, John Forbes Nash Jr. experiences it all. As a brilliant but socially awkward mathematician, he made a groundbreaking discovery early in his career and stands on the brink of international acclaim. But as the handsome and arrogant Nash accepts secret work in cryptography, he becomes entangled in a mysterious conspiracy. His life takes a nightmarish turn and he soon finds himself on a painful and harrowing journey of self-discovery.','/rEIg5yJdNOt9fmX4P8gU9LeNoTQ.jpg','2001-12-14',135,'Released','He saw the world in a way no one could have imagined.','A Beautiful Mind',453,18.6323,7.852,'yC2VpkVMtXY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16593,_binary '\0','/pDd6GRNOIO9yOtRqtwbG5wrIjnl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0268995',6.9,61289,'en','The Majestic','Set in 1951, a blacklisted Hollywood writer gets into a car accident, loses his memory and settles down in a small town where he is mistaken for a long-lost son.','/m9WrB91B8ghxIZhyFugkoSleBE7.jpg','2001-12-21',153,'Released','Sometimes your life comes into focus one frame at a time.','The Majestic',11086,6.3134,6.767,'zbI-IVRinK4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16594,_binary '\0','/kwY1HeoEIDXCdpb4PMdyzCiBUCV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0269095',6.1,27901,'en','City by the Sea','Vincent LaMarca is a dedicated and well-respected New York City police detective who has gone to great lengths to distance himself from his past, but then makes the terrible discovery that his own son has fallen into a life of crime.','/vpjKtnE5SGTfmdw4YtJsnrfFJs0.jpg','2002-09-06',108,'Released','When you\'re searching for a killer... the last suspect you want to see is your son.','City by the Sea',13536,4.6119,5.803,'ssQu16utnR8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16595,_binary '\0','/btFXlXId0A6Jf4iJ725VnzSLoc0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0269217',6.9,3005,'th','ฟ้าทะลายโจร','Dum, the son of a peasant falls in love with Rumpoey, the daughter of a wealthy and respected family. The star-crossed lovers are torn apart for years, but their forbidden love survives. When tragedy strikes, Dum unleashes his rage and becomes the gun-slinging outlaw the \"Black Tiger\" who will stop at nothing to seek his revenge.','/pxoefU7hlNkhdVZe1DxOiYLCCjj.jpg','2000-09-29',110,'Released','LOVE TRAGEDY. CONCEAL SECRET. BETRAYAL.','Tears of the Black Tiger',2805,1.3254,6.5,'KU9SyIOJAPI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16596,_binary '\0','/4tpZ1LV2GucYokTRA2vyxfpEmTn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0269281',6,1814,'en','Global Heresy','A rock band bursts onto the scene and then their frontman disappears on the eve of a European tour.','/wvPRRiM2W4Qa4M6nAkvfHfEY22u.jpg','2002-09-03',106,'Released','The World\'s Hottest Band Is About to Be Torn Apart','Global Heresy',64293,1.2006,5,'Xe6-Js0GghI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16597,_binary '\0','/ejjKvXg1j9TKALpdidqhh7LzyPv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0269329',6.8,1712,'fr','Betty Fisher et autres histoires','When bestselling novelist Betty Fisher loses her young son in a tragic accident, her unstable mother resorts to unusual actions to alleviate Betty\'s grief, actions which set off a chain reaction among a promiscuous waitress and her criminal associates.','/ebo9Tgo8IYMmV7evHKEPXeKa7PQ.jpg','2001-09-01',103,'Released','Crimes of passion are not always between lovers.','Betty Fisher and Other Stories',55903,1.8911,6.1,'YO_gZvGMwqs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16598,_binary '\0','/38mKWUbVaWaMvKHeCNeXRJY5yLW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0269341',6.1,8184,'en','Two Can Play That Game','Corporate overachiever and all-around fly chick Shanté Smith thinks she\'s got the goods to keep her slickster boyfriend Keith, from straying—until he discovers a greener pasture, Shanté\'s archrival, Conny. Scorned, she plans to get her man back by any means necessary.','/oDWVsSJMXvDeX9KohSOtfqCFD7e.jpg','2001-09-07',90,'Released','The rules are simple. There are no rules.','Two Can Play That Game',25462,3.5831,6.5,'3sV3omf67jY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16599,_binary '\0','/2T3k09YnrM03CQd1yK3ZQLEHEZH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0269347',6.1,55604,'en','The Hunted','In the wilderness of British Columbia, two hunters are tracked and viciously murdered by Aaron Hallam. A former Special Operations instructor is approached and asked to apprehend Hallam—his former student—who has \'gone rogue\' after suffering severe battle stress from his time in Kosovo.','/AvdBPe2XSKm3cGyTKFgbquC2jCo.jpg','2003-03-11',94,'Released','Some men should not be found.','The Hunted',10632,6.7454,6.172,'53AH-k3go7U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16600,_binary '\0','/8EAYDoAZlWTo6jBlkVZwz4kYfLd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0269389',6.8,15484,'sv','Jalla! Jalla!','Roro, a foreign worker in Swedish parks, loves his girlfriend but is about to marry another girl to prevent her from being sent back to Lebanon. Meanwhile, Roro\'s best friend, Måns, has serious problems getting an erection.','/nwx3W0NAv7OOgODBoYHh62yaKDs.jpg','2000-12-22',88,'Released','Love, Friendships... and Penispumps?!','The Best Man\'s Wedding',10978,2.8789,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16601,_binary '\0','/a8Cj9xKljJEdBKW0xaCmfPzS6Bv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0269410',4.6,2072,'sv','Jönssonligan spelar högt','Vanheden and Dynamite-Harry are approached by Sickan\'s grandmother and Sickan\'s younger brother Sven-Ingvar. Their evil nemesis Wall-Enberg are planning to steal billions of euros of the European Union\'s grants to culture. The grant of 350 million kronor, paid by an Italian bank acting as intermediary, equals 60 billion lire but through assistance of a Sicilian \"businessman\", this sum becomes 60 billion kronor when transferred. The money is to be transferred to a large number of bank accounts, and the account numbers are saved on a floppy disc that the Jönsson gang is trying to steal.','/5qrDx7n1BVsVI81kcO0Av8vVplz.jpg','2000-12-25',89,'Released',NULL,'The Jönsson Gang at High Stakes',37730,1.022,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16602,_binary '\0','/2qqGIj2BVPRgQdU11LZD3yBIQj4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0269461',6.9,1729,'fr','Laissez-passer','During the Nazi occupation of France, two filmmakers try to build a career without compromising their ideals.','/4DAw1oo81ooyfXb3iU0yKJHOPNw.jpg','2002-01-09',171,'Released',NULL,'Safe Conduct',70443,2.3322,6.5,'auCmeQL_2rs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16603,_binary '\0','/c8777j87rV22k8IOwfXUxcsOc7d.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0269483',6,3406,'en','Lone Star State of Mind','Earl and Baby, two young lovers with a plan to escape their small Texas town. But when Baby\'s dim-witted cousin Junior gets tangled up in a whole heap of trouble, Earl has just 48 hours to save the day, rescue Junior and keep his promise to get his Baby to Los Angeles in time for sweeps.','/kWCFRsPrld9wcyf6251G06mLDJ2.jpg','2002-04-23',88,'Released','Sometimes doing the right thing can get downright ugly.','Lone Star State of Mind',35225,2.3409,5.4,'x1YZbyQt1xw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16604,_binary '\0','/v1LKZdVjw8jP8rn33EfCEECFlVk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0269499',6.4,3858,'fr','Ma femme est une actrice','A \"normal\" guy who is married to a hot actress gets worried that she is involved with her costar. This worry turns into jealousy and causes problems in their relationship. This is a story about trust and a comedy about the actions between men and women.','/1PdxR0RXVKs7PVzaTpxnBJV3Ijv.jpg','2001-11-14',95,'Released',NULL,'My Wife Is an Actress',14651,3.0945,6.1,'PLeaPDSQG1s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16605,_binary '\0','/uDdTU2WcVr7KiDLBcgLvI5RiHdU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0269587',6.7,1949,'th','ดอกฟ้าในมือมาร','A camera crew travels through Thailand asking villagers to invent the next chapter of an ever-growing story.','/tRaTxXUkHRqo4HOmzaCuvxXnH3E.jpg','2000-11-08',90,'Released',NULL,'Mysterious Object at Noon',93553,1.1021,6.5,'9S9AyJX3v7U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16606,_binary '\0','/cZfQOciISEwfPdKwyO63NcnNSEv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0269604',5,2100,'sv','Naken','When Anders wakes up on his wedding day, he finds himself naked in an elevator, only remembering some of what happened.','/hAcxezeEqcF3g96Kwpj3quCrNfH.jpg','2000-12-15',94,'Released',NULL,'Naked',11925,1.468,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16607,_binary '\0','/I6rNAQ0wzFOtLgGuD7BLCyAih6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0269743',6.9,12188,'ko','플란다스의 개','An idle part-time college lecturer is annoyed by the yapping sound of a nearby dog. He decides to take drastic action.','/msLr6T2RhqZNZtdCZScAA8nOWbU.jpg','2000-02-19',110,'Released',NULL,'Barking Dogs Never Bite',21531,3.2572,6.771,'SUAs8CE4oEY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16608,_binary '\0','/jtttw606rzded55mXL8F3QYeZwo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0269746',7.3,5681,'zh','你那邊幾點','A street vendor with a grim home-life forges a connection with a young woman on her way to Paris.','/dRsZF1I4s4jx99wEyZyIsOpu3Uw.jpg','2001-09-26',116,'Released',NULL,'What Time Is It There?',24166,1.815,7,'zoQCaJf5W-c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16609,_binary '\0','/xI7cduoBpEOO91mfHYM9YIenFJi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0269856',7.5,3441,'ja','式日','A disillusioned filmmaker has an encounter with a young woman who has a ritual of repeating \"Tomorrow is my birthday\" everyday. He tries to communicate with her through his video camera.','/h88yVKhgPAaPNEllDqsuhpQOJeL.jpg','2000-12-07',128,'Released','Tomorrow is my birthday.','Ritual',39056,3.5279,7.7,'CXneS91SrTk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16610,_binary '\0','/a3k5bho15gcv5VMLsdn7Jd59Zss.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0269857',5.9,1589,'ko','실제상황','A repressed artist receives ritual abuse from those who pass him as he paints portraits in the park. Gradually becoming more frustrated, anger builds up within the artist, leading him to embark upon a quest to gain revenge on all those who have humiliated him.','/i7KTWS9ZaKrrbNCmSvf75Y17uKo.jpg','2000-06-24',82,'Released','The art of revenge, shot in real time!','Real Fiction',25651,1.1869,5.5,'Z_HBFibeU4s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16611,_binary '\0','/wRMnG0b5LVS9qZC27xn4azcEh43.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0270053',8,41631,'tr','Vizontele','The story takes place in the small town of Hakkari in Turkey at the beginning of the \'70s. The time has come to bring technology to that small town. The first Television (called Visiontele by the citizens) arrives and the chaos begins.','/wbULza7DtchFu3bZKlroJsCVVh8.jpg','2001-02-02',110,'Released',NULL,'Vizontele',57892,2.4362,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16612,_binary '\0','/fB2uaTv0GzZGrHHSvHHHv2cpdRL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0270197',6.1,1335,'en','American Gun','A father uses the serial number on a hand gun in an attempt to track down his daughter\'s killer. The truth he uncovers is an unsettling reminder of the dangers of keeping handguns.','/7oJNiMYFQsn992Tm0fVFCmvMytx.jpg','2002-06-13',89,'Released',NULL,'American Gun',62190,1.4013,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16613,_binary '\0','/jGweQLLgnn2Kj4I2S6XZzvNa14O.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0270259',6.3,3863,'en','The Business of Strangers','A dark thriller about a successful businesswoman and her young assistant who toy with a slow-witted businessman while stuck at an airport hotel.','/5iVwXnV2fraxy6NYzxZ07jMWW0u.jpg','2001-09-13',84,'Released',NULL,'The Business of Strangers',31064,2.204,5.6,'E9l6-x9o36w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16614,_binary '\0','/uS03jRk64ZFFtpKNAhLppXa1nKP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0270288',7,96232,'en','Confessions of a Dangerous Mind','Television made him famous, but his biggest hits happened off screen. Television producer by day, CIA assassin by night, Chuck Barris was recruited by the CIA at the height of his TV career and trained to become a covert operative. Or so Barris said.','/mM58ABMRzwn5zVx6BS7IiNK0j3F.jpg','2002-12-31',113,'Released','Some things are better left top secret.','Confessions of a Dangerous Mind',4912,6.3275,6.672,'mWyLE7kjGrw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16615,_binary '\0','/tbd7wdqvqPL6QLkbo5ce858yJEp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0270317',6.5,1509,'en','A Diva\'s Christmas Carol','In this remake of Charles Dickens\' classic \"A Christmas Carol\", a cold-hearted superstar singer gets a reality check when she meets three Christmas spirits who would change her miserly ways for the better.','/owx5MHEuHIkW5zNxVhc9KsaODQ5.jpg','2000-12-13',89,'Released','Christmas can be such a bitch.','A Diva\'s Christmas Carol',24436,1.9433,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16616,_binary '\0','/vrOAx7NH3endEFByfAIWYpmv06r.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0270321',8.8,3049,'en','Dr. Babasaheb Ambedkar','The movie tells the story of Dr. B. R. Ambedkar, known mainly for his contributions in shaping the Constitution of India, as the chairman of the Drafting Committee of the Indian Constituent Assembly. He dedicated his life to fight against the evils of untouchability.','/sDzNFWANWAmYgiAkbilm12Khzzp.jpg','2000-12-15',180,'Released','They were segregated, humiliated, condemned...Until he changed the rules of the game.','Dr. Babasaheb Ambedkar',186110,1.0143,7.7,'RS0N2lbLeOc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16617,_binary '\0','/9Dc0GHDD7PTDvIUdU7CjMNtd12.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0270480',6.5,4373,'es','Juana la Loca','The tragic fate of Juana I of Castille, Queen of Spain, madly in love to an unfaithful husband, Felipe el Hermoso, Archduke of Austria.','/kgPW2uIIzkIKEIvrU7WKprJgVsI.jpg','2001-09-28',115,'Released',NULL,'Mad Love',26165,2.2582,6.1,'Xg5U6HJtyoE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16618,_binary '\0','/xnOUkH3RcAKDajBIXLuntiPkkO8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0270560',5.2,5577,'en','Our Lips Are Sealed','Mary-Kate and Ashley star in this Down Under adventure filled with nonstop Aussie intrigue, laughs and romance. After running afoul of a notorious gangster, Mary-Kate and Ashley take refuge in the FBI Witness Protection Program. Unfortunately, the girls are uncontrollable blabbermouths and they blow their cover in town after town until there\'s only one hiding place left - Australia.','/40gZ2WhqpZVv8woW0fCH8bMFzx8.jpg','2000-05-18',89,'Released',NULL,'Our Lips Are Sealed',34729,3.1185,6,'eXYxDpR_x18','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16619,_binary '\0','/eqS1NeiVdXVxnvhOZemR8Vrhn5H.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0270688',5.3,2044,'en','Teknolust','Anxious to use artificial life to improve the world, Rosetta Stone, a bio-geneticist, creates a Recipe for Cyborgs and uses her own DNA in order to breed three Self Replicating Automatons, part human, part computer named Ruby, Olive and Marine.','/bd3xzqCTVKkR0i8eZSwCkaxF9VA.jpg','2002-01-10',83,'Released','One part woman. One part science.','Teknolust',81540,2.2596,4.5,'6COJDiGk93c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16620,_binary '\0','/fGs4uCzpBcYBfqw4rINA7twHIGQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0270707',4.7,11547,'en','The Truth About Charlie','Regina meets charming Joshua while vacationing in Martinique, as she contemplates ending her whirlwind marriage to enigmatic Charlie. Upon her return to Paris, she finds that both her apartment and her bank account have been emptied, and her husband has been murdered. Stuck in ever-increasing danger and with four men pursuing her, another stranger offers assistance - but who can she trust?','/kQ6SdbWStviMhTFt5tatjpGvRGV.jpg','2002-10-25',104,'Released','Everybody has a secret.','The Truth About Charlie',13440,4.0112,4.9,'mkLF6Xh21G8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16621,_binary '\0','/ycDJVFipMvTc3rUrEQy2LG7EyRB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0270846',1.5,32158,'en','Superbabies: Baby Geniuses 2','Babies can communicate with each other using \'baby talk\', and have innate knowledge of the secrets of the universe. The infant geniuses become involved in a scheme by media mogul Bill Biscane. Assisting the geniuses is a legendary superbaby named Kahuna, who joins up with several other babies in an attempt to stop Biscane, who intends to use a state-of-the-art satellite system to control the world\'s population.','/7viULokoVzqrgVj0EljfXDzEKMk.jpg','2004-08-27',88,'Released','Meet the new generation of superheroes.','Superbabies: Baby Geniuses 2',31117,3.2552,2.9,'hyJuSjpoMfg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16622,_binary '\0','/haU0Q3gSjlULWxb214t2HMRz5v2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0270882',2.8,1708,'en','The Karate Dog','When LAPD computer expert Peter Fowler investigates the killing of an old man in Chinatown, he finds the only witness is his dog, Cho Cho. But Fowler soon discovers Cho Cho is the only dog in the world who can speak to humans... not only that, Cho Cho is an expert in martial arts. When they join forces to track down the mastermind behind the death of Cho Cho\'s master, it leads these unusual partners into uncovering a dangerous conspiracy which puts both of their lives in danger.','/rLlNug11CXPc5oFaK1gnCZtGxt0.jpg','2006-07-26',84,'Released','A new breed of action hero','The Karate Dog',42303,1.9174,5.2,'5f9BtkXgUw0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16623,_binary '\0','/cCvM5imkUyvO17eryldxwUfvOa2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0270891',4.7,2754,'nl','Costa!','The story about a wild week at the Spanish coast. Romance at the beach, competition on the dance floor. Salty water, sweet kisses...','/nQJASZFsnzYqMTHmiX4jnQNNWQz.jpg','2001-03-01',95,'Released',NULL,'Costa!',73678,2.0495,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16624,_binary '\0','/gYpiN2oqla45hWfDtPxTf8KXFbX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0270911',5,2083,'en','Dawg','To inherit a million dollars, an egotistical womanizer must find the women he\'s betrayed and convince them to forgive him.','/5865LCQVdV8AxCX27pBn94Ob2pB.jpg','2002-02-21',83,'Released','She\'s teaching this dog new tricks','Dawg',46112,1.9574,4.519,'4Tu4gg1fB_w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16625,_binary '\0','/wGn7q7UCYI6vb6Wez21u0boLHvi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0270919',7,2376,'ko','동감','In this endearing supernatural love story spanning two decades, a university student finds himself communicating with a female classmate from the same school through an antique ham radio.','/omeuvIYHe4RCak2eUQOXNZngj0C.jpg','2000-05-27',112,'Released','We are dreaming of the same love right now.','Ditto',81760,1.7237,6.946,'K-osR2bory4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16626,_binary '\0','/oL1xwtDOGL55Zyu7AuNKpt4y8N7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0270980',4.7,31871,'en','My Boss\'s Daughter','When a young man agrees to housesit for his boss, he thinks it\'ll be the perfect opportunity to get close to the woman he desperately has a crush on – his boss\'s daughter. But he doesn\'t plan on the long line of other houseguests that try to keep him from his mission. And he also has to deal with the daughter\'s older brother, who\'s on the run from local drug dealers.','/6z6ehjP1GyMLFeja9pHGGZb9B2.jpg','2003-08-21',83,'Released','There are some things you just don\'t do.','My Boss\'s Daughter',2830,6.081,5.056,'0kubIMUboWs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16627,_binary '\0','/62ySrux6DMuV7eEXf48VFvjhGxZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271027',6.6,70174,'en','Kiss of the Dragon','Liu Jian, an elite Chinese police officer, comes to Paris to arrest a Chinese drug lord. When Jian is betrayed by a French officer and framed for murder, he must go into hiding and find new allies.','/1ubtSyagwfNF9Bn9s2CKITRtx1d.jpg','2001-07-06',98,'Released','Kiss Fear Goodbye','Kiss of the Dragon',2140,9.7828,6.948,'pZUCr_vlO8Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16628,_binary '\0','/jjC46JlFhaTX8kGB2DXbpOxZf8n.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271029',7.5,3620,'de','Komm, süßer Tod','Former detective Brenner has become an ambulance driver and finds himself, much to his dismay, caught up in a war between two rival first aid organizations.','/fsuUPQK5j4J2Jr6OweWPYdyrCad.jpg','2000-12-22',107,'Released',NULL,'Come, Sweet Death',10469,1.325,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16629,_binary '\0','/g8njMFostWoF0H6dH9QXXFHEKnt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271136',5.3,3021,'en','Quicksand','The workaholic head of the compliance section of a New York bank flies to Monaco to investigate unusual deposits from an offshore bank and meets a down-on-his-luck international film star who has become embroiled in criminal activities.','/7XYJiltOE8AYsjMq1lkcGCTqC6Q.jpg','2003-01-08',94,'Released','He\'s running for his life and running out of time.','Quicksand',47517,1.7292,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16630,_binary '\0','/hc10GznHACMOOwGJSDWOrW4F41N.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271172',6,2335,'en','Jumping Ship','Michael has big plans to show his cousin Tommy a good time aboard a luxury yacht until he discovers that the yacht he\'s chartered is actually an old rusted fishing boat. But when modern-day pirates chase the fishing boat, the boys are forced to jump ship, leaving them stranded on a desert island with the boat\'s captain, Jake Hunter.','/4bLzgESoL4yetAPXayVJByPVKQl.jpg','2001-08-17',92,'Released',NULL,'Jumping Ship',68027,2.804,6.5,'e5zdq-Qz2fA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16631,_binary '\0','/mgieYh2u0nH7b5HVleRNdSBVSnI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271210',5.1,1237,'en','R.S.V.P.','A psychology student invites a group of his friends and teacher to a drug and alcohol-fueled party where he plans to murder them all.','/k7NctSrACmGE9Vhf8e8xzZAUP6a.jpg','2002-01-15',100,'Released','It\'s a going away party. Have a killer time.','R.S.V.P.',30081,2.286,4.2,'CJKae2My5wA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16632,_binary '\0','/aHSV0wrDE7hcr4fJtbehKABNqpe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271219',6.1,6428,'en','Tadpole','Beautiful, sophisticated women are all over Oscar Grubman. He is sensitive and compassionate, speaks French fluently, is passionate about Voltaire, and thinks the feature that tells the most about a woman is her hands. On the train home from Chauncey Academy for the Thanksgiving weekend, Oscar confides in his best friend that he has plans for this vacation--he will win the heart of his true love. But there is one major problem--Oscar\'s true love is his stepmother Eve.','/sKGC0ciNtxrAAxeeK3Qe390Ee8A.jpg','2002-07-19',79,'Released','Everyone says he should date girls his own age. Oscar respectfully disagrees.','Tadpole',39141,2.2419,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16633,_binary '\0','/681awPuRWfx0fqhThfRzCprAJbl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271237',4.6,1696,'en','The Triangle','This made-for-TV movie follows a group of friends as they try to find a boat lost for 50 years in the Bermuda Triangle.','/4iR7GXeVo6rw891RBFCvv4A5Ako.jpg','2001-08-13',92,'Released','In the Bermuda Triangle, nothing stays lost forever','The Triangle',71147,1.8866,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16634,_binary '\0','/iZKF6VKwTs3m0T664NePlKr7yeM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271259',6.3,16364,'en','Welcome to Collinwood','Five hapless inner-city low-lifes attempt to burgle a pawnbroker\'s safe, but end up being plagued by bad luck.','/7XyvoOopwWwDCWOcItOQiAwm30b.jpg','2002-10-04',86,'Released','Five guys. One safe. No brains.','Welcome to Collinwood',9260,3.7723,6.071,'87ry5noogGs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16635,_binary '\0','/t98noANuotqXJgIcgm3MvcvJCNr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271263',5.3,28628,'en','Eight Crazy Nights','Davey Stone, a 33-year old party animal, finds himself in trouble with the law after his wild ways go too far.','/p8yiNFvs7q7ymxVAkym3WuYygrn.jpg','2002-11-27',76,'Released','The ultimate battle between Naughty and Nice.','Eight Crazy Nights',13376,4.2398,5.232,'VoFIpnSGnZk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16636,_binary '\0','/zru7JSKyWSwhT1ZmR021AiX4yvU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271271',5.8,4680,'en','Zenon: The Zequel','Zenon Kar is 15 and lives on a space station which the military has taken over and is dismantling. She receives a mysterious signal and must convince everyone that it\'s from aliens who have come to help them.','/ferJbm4T34YoVzfuSOKeUoI4cOF.jpg','2001-01-12',89,'Released','Cetus-Lupedus! She\'s back!','Zenon: The Zequel',29742,2.6966,5.6,'YnnrtwFIz5s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16637,_binary '\0','/hOVtpgal5wWHP8vDczrEzZXkOEV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271367',5.5,62249,'en','Eight Legged Freaks','The residents of a rural mining town discover that an unfortunate chemical spill has caused hundreds of little spiders to mutate overnight to the size of SUVs. It\'s then up to mining engineer Chris McCormack and Sheriff Sam Parker to mobilize an eclectic group of townspeople, including the Sheriff\'s young son, Mike, her daughter, Ashley, and paranoid radio announcer Harlan, into battle against the bloodthirsty eight-legged beasts.','/5blAumPPS6vX6zcUlt9oIhOEheK.jpg','2002-07-17',99,'Released','Let the squashing begin!','Eight Legged Freaks',8869,7.4624,5.8,'V7mOxwoZIXw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16638,_binary '\0','/alQqTpmEkxSLgajfEYTsTH6nAKB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271383',8.6,22124,'pt','O Auto da Compadecida','The lively João Grilo and the sly Chicó are poor guys living in the hinterland who cheat a bunch of people in a small town in Northeastern Brazil. When they die, they have to be judged by Christ, the Devil and the Virgin Mary before they are admitted to paradise.','/z9Au9XtK0ARzkKGsZCzMkmKgMPf.jpg','2000-09-15',104,'Released','Lying with faith is not always a sin.','A Dog\'s Will',40096,6.2812,8.4,'wDVdgnhiNlY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16639,_binary '\0','/cpxihFukWXaQp9EHc9E249ENult.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271454',6.4,1847,'en','The Day Reagan Was Shot','March 10, 1981. An insane and obsessive young man named John Hinckley Jr. attempts to kill U.S. President Ronald Reagan. Rushed to a nearby hospital in critical condition, Reagan\'s life hangs in the balance as two young surgeons battle to save him. But only those behind the scenes in the corridors of power konw that this is more than a fight to save one man. With the Soviet Union poised to invade Poland and the possibility of a total nuclear war looming, someone must take control of the impending crisis. And as a bitter power struggle begins, the government of teh most powerful nation in on Earth is sliding into chaos.','/1hL7DXv5mpKfke3K7WJCZH03bzv.jpg','2001-12-09',98,'Released',NULL,'The Day Reagan Was Shot',81748,2.0012,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16640,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271459',8.1,2168,'ml','ധ്രുവം','Veerasimha Mannadiar gets killed by Hyder Marakkar, a notorious criminal. Thereafter, Veerasimha\'s brother, Narasimha Mannadiar, decides to avenge Veerasimha\'s death.','/tUKAFRfIqhLXRPPvjDvPulOx47j.jpg','1993-01-27',145,'Released',NULL,'Dhruvam',78681,1.3146,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16641,_binary '\0','/tUt8qfXeqD9bz6UOiWgHjUZslZr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271461',6.2,3806,'en','Dinner with Friends','A husband and wife reevaluate their marriage after their closest friends, another couple decide to split up after twelve years.','/pnCMUVTw6gb0OZbxWFhbmNjV9hg.jpg','2001-08-11',94,'Released','Four Friends. Two Marriages. One Divorce.','Dinner with Friends',24625,2.6688,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16642,_binary '\0','/3Q8sK1dRQQ7YtpRJS6GynwE11Ev.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271543',4.5,1410,'en','Hidden Agenda','Former government Jason Price makes people disappear for a living. But when a top lieutenant for a crime syndicate asks Price to help him drop out of sight, things take a grisly, unexpected turn. A mysterious hit man known as The Cleaner has infiltrated Price\'s tightly-controlled system, leaving a bloody trail behind. With the help of an enigmatic seductress posing as the mobster\'s chief assistant, Price methodically works through his network of associates to find out what went wrong, and is plunged headlong into a spiraling gauntlet of half-truths and full-blown lies where nobody is who they appear to be, and everyone has a deadly, hidden agenda','/pMHcp3SPTfkCJdajkdx91sm7vVk.jpg','2001-05-12',94,'Released',NULL,'Hidden Agenda',52273,2.4352,4.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16643,_binary '\0','/7ddFdHFYwygnxypmM4YOMq91Uru.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271545',7.3,1579,'ml','ഹിറ്റ്ലർ','Madhavan, an eligible bachelor, is very protective of his five sisters. However, things take an ugly turn for Madhavan when his sisters turn against him and fail to understand his love for them.','/itZ0GW5RyXNNOZfupBupLVa9Uii.jpg','1996-04-12',153,'Released',NULL,'Hitler',237735,1.3233,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16644,_binary '\0','/uEB0yS8hey6v927jZjtfEGO8etc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271580',7.1,1961,'en','Jet Boy','A coming-of-age story of a reluctant 13-year-old hustler named Nathan who will do whatever it takes to feel loved.','/y9wPJV2GmFrjgt7c0VIATsxctgY.jpg','2001-09-30',100,'Released','He wanted to be loved for more than just a night.','Jet Boy',31142,2.2331,6.5,'KZFOQUwKCFQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16645,_binary '\0','/zPYlLqV1T7XC7jXcggchIcM5sRG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271582',6.7,2263,'en','Joshua','When Joshua moves to the outskirts of Auburn, he awakens the curiosity of the sleepy town. They don’t know who he is or where he came from, but no one can shake the feeling they’ve known him for years. Despite his benevolence and selfless work in the community, some remain suspicious. Just what exactly is Joshua up to?','/7Y46xqBRwXSq25Hk5zlHvyz0TZi.jpg','2002-04-19',91,'Released','One man holds the answer','Joshua',18323,1.4919,6.5,'fTChiMC5KDg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16646,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271595',7.6,1769,'ml','ദി കിംഗ്','The King is a 1995 Malayalam action thriller film. Directed by Shaji Kailas and written by Renji Panicker with Mammootty in the title role as district collector.','/2y2whF3xMXOr2xmxWI3lJB5LfXC.jpg','1995-11-11',199,'Released',NULL,'The King',237728,0.8838,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16647,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271648',8,1617,'ml','മൃഗയ','Varunni, a hunter, is summoned to help some villagers capture a man-eating leopard. When he accidentally kills a man, he decides to support the deceased\'s grieving family.','/eis4ooC7idVzv3oNm0si8Hm16LN.jpg','1989-12-22',142,'Released',NULL,'Mrigaya',278009,0.7916,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16648,_binary '\0','/bflP0bP1tx46zBNbq9Ba20sMWi7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271668',5.6,58196,'en','National Security','Earl Montgomery, a bombastic police academy reject, and Hank Rafferty, a disgraced, mild-mannered cop, can\'t seem to escape each other. They met on opposite sides of the law during a routine traffic stop that escalated out of control; now as lowly security guards they\'re thrown together to bust a smuggling operation.','/2qZP18uhHFEgJEGEJUQwRPAKQPK.jpg','2003-01-17',89,'Released','They only look like cops.','National Security',11078,8.534,5.984,'pra0Mwr0ao8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16649,_binary '\0','/q7PWhOpuVbMcv2OXmVqZVK1aBLL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271678',7.7,1505,'ml','No. 20 മദ്രാസ് മെയിൽ','Enroute Madras via train, when three friends get falsely accused of a mysterious homicide, they escape and desperately search for the real killer.','/roD8sGzZzr8vuBL0d5OTJWa95wH.jpg','1990-02-16',177,'Released',NULL,'No. 20 Madras Mail',237666,1.5883,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16650,_binary '\0','/nSupruTHXTLI7dbdvGDrzIhxISJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271694',8.1,6688,'ml','ഒരു സി.ബി.ഐ. ഡയറിക്കുറിപ്പ്','Prabhakar Varma is appointed by the police to investigate the suicide of Omana, the daughter-in-law of a businessman. Varma decides to investigate further when all the clues reveal it was a murder.','/bBHFPAHJvnyTm1tQNjfOaSzVeFI.jpg','1988-02-17',132,'Released',NULL,'Oru CBI Diary Kurippu',278018,1.3697,6.258,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16651,_binary '\0','/ejYCVTGnTKtB9wv8xgoFtuJDsds.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271732',7.4,2908,'en','The Pretender 2001','Picking up where the television series left off, \"The Pretender 2001\" features even deeper explorations in the show\'s mythology, including a revealing look back at how Jarod originally espaced from the Centre. But now he must infiltrate the NSA to capture a ruthless assassin who might be a fellow Pretender from his past!','/j5RRwfUKab9f4DJnxDUVuCHZDZ9.jpg','2001-01-22',86,'Released','He is a master of disguise. She is a master of the hunt. Let the chase begin.','The Pretender 2001',27338,1.6187,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16652,_binary '\0','/2gAkClLzdp2vPqbrujw3ibLppNr.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271748',5.1,2450,'hi','राजू चाचा','Raju is hired to pose as uncle to three orphaned kids in order to usurp their inheritance. But he changes his mind after falling in love with their governess and decides to fight the greedy relatives.','/eWT27sD5lp8y5CaMoknhFO3OwRi.jpg','2000-12-21',163,'Released','Courage comes in all sizes.','Raju Chacha',383281,1.4573,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16653,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271857',8.4,3717,'ml','വാത്സല്യം','Raghavan, a farmer, raises his brother, Vijayakumar, and gives him an education. However, when he grows up and gets married to a rich woman, Vijayakumaran conveniently forgets about his brother.','/kP94aDe0CO5I6n6kAkSaciz4t0S.jpg','1993-04-11',155,'Released',NULL,'Vatsalyam',278030,1.2425,7.286,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16654,_binary '\0','/yQSPZyrQ4rB9GKb6l7SZdiuHW13.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271882',5.7,2761,'en','You Stupid Man','An actress dumps her boyfriend when she gets a television show. He finally gets over the breakup and falls in love again, just in time for his ex to return -- wanting him back.','/vNfx5MBXkeqZKOW6Wx9W5kiNdSL.jpg','2002-11-02',95,'Released','In love. In deep. In trouble.','You Stupid Man',24080,3.1334,5.505,'aq3DNR0RE4M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16655,_binary '\0','/oJqXClbe4ttTGohmbgO8n8UVVeV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271884',4.7,2269,'en','Zebra Lounge','Alan and Wendy Barnet have been married just long enough for the excitement to have gone out of their relationship, and they\'re looking for a way to put some spice back in their lives. After placing a personal ad looking for another couple interested in swapping mates, the Barnets are led to the Zebra Lounge, where they meet Jack and Louise Bauer, a pair of seasoned erotic adventurers. While the Barnets find the swinging scene exciting at first, they soon decide it may be doing more harm than good to their marriage. But easing the Bauers out of their lives proves to be neither simple nor safe.','/hyej1bAJkY39O1tVIYdjLM6nfl6.jpg','2001-10-04',93,'Released','Their first meeting was daring. Their last would be deadly.','Zebra Lounge',59940,17.1274,4.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16656,_binary '\0','/vJPt0k5yWlnfbiph8PU0sQqqwqa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271885',5.8,1706,'en','Zig Zag','An autistic 15-year-old boy steals money from his boss to provide rent for his abusive father, who uses the money to repay a loan shark.','/l9h5A2iI5jAhQh8SQXyg9LCnhgD.jpg','2002-06-14',101,'Released',NULL,'Zig Zag',13442,2.0781,5.7,'iIiDRkLz9DI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16657,_binary '\0','/2vQfPfzcFylZdPUBN6yNRusqe5X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271946',5.8,20229,'cn','特務迷城','A fun-filled story about an ordinary guy about to kick into an action-packed adventure. Jackie Chan plays a bored and unsuccessful salesman who never thought his life would amount to anything. All that changes one day when he becomes an instant hero by foiling an attempted bank robbery.','/fPW4Qn9wm82uOexHMB3TC8x6lRU.jpg','2001-01-18',107,'Released','Ordinary Guy. Extraordinary Spy.','The Accidental Spy',11847,2.5414,6,'FPdVCH1mIiw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16658,_binary '\0','/askwFNaEUj64i1ZFDxBwBtFmao8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0271972',4,3427,'en','Arachnid','Mercer\'s brother, an amateur pilot, crashes on an island and is killed by a giant spider. A year later, when Mercer goes in search of him, she discovers a breed of poisonous arachnids ready to attack.','/vvBZADXO4mJIAn5mlurR3cYGmH0.jpg','2001-06-29',95,'Released','It\'s coming from another world... TO STAY!','Arachnid',12587,2.1053,4.3,'4_U7bW0Sjds','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16659,_binary '\0','/tfxqUsrqvBcFDxQU9qpQQ21klmk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0272018',5.4,3045,'en','Call Me Claus','When Lucy Cullins, a successful but cranky producer at a home shopping network hires an actor named Nick to play Santa Claus on the network, she gets more than she bargained for.','/crP1L0S7F5RwrfZ6t25dJSsbzNy.jpg','2001-12-03',90,'Released','If She\'s Going To Save Christmas, She\'s Got Some Big Shoes To Fill.','Call Me Claus',17007,2.7469,5.711,'j8X2cOwvBjA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16660,_binary '\0','/mYnCnyGxdtXo2PDhhyFT0er9sp5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0272020',7,92322,'en','The Last Castle','A court-martialed general rallies together 1200 inmates to rise against the system that put him away.','/pYnUfauPVK6g8IRO2REYl4TUZ2p.jpg','2001-10-19',131,'Released','A castle can only have one king.','The Last Castle',2100,9.3067,7.2,'THWd2Qtp_mo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16661,_binary '\0','/AqIEJ3U4MZNNo9FyT1ZB2UMIQ17.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0272118',6.9,1520,'hi','हाथी मेरे साथी','Raju becomes very attached to his four elephants after they save his life. His wife, however, fears for her child and tells him that he must choose between the animals and his family.','/nCRXU6bAmUv3ebwlmWwu05sjAFX.jpg','1971-05-28',170,'Released',NULL,'Haathi Mere Saathi',304701,1.222,7.067,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16662,_binary '\0','/eYUgRLKh8Nt8U88wQtAAmqNGFco.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0272142',7,4063,'tr','İstanbul Kanatlarımın Altında','During the sea battle which took place between the Ottoman Empire and the Italians, a ship which had been seized in the Mediterranean Sea is brought to Istanbul, and a young wounded lady named Francesca, the daughter of the killed Captain, becomes a slave for Hezarfen Ahmet Celebi.','/3eOvoCVTawMjBYJsieG5EfBTl7C.jpg','1996-03-15',119,'Released',NULL,'Istanbul Beneath My Wings',103790,1.3851,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16663,_binary '\0','/v8xav2JYqqn3O14s0PR4UgWBz95.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0272152',7.4,204138,'en','K-PAX','Prot is a patient at a mental hospital who claims to be from a far away planet. His psychiatrist tries to help him, only to begin to doubt his own explanations.','/tafXZX0I6rso7EyoEzfygfTqxq6.jpg','2001-10-26',120,'Released','Change the way you look at the world.','K-PAX',167,8.2347,7.2,'YV5s07zI-Bg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16664,_binary '\0','/lu1eTRsyZztMmfR5Q30k2jFPMri.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0272207',7.1,45697,'en','Narc','Narcotics Sergeant Nick Tellis, on leave after a trauma, is called back to investigate the murder of fellow undercover operative Michael Calvess, joined by the victim\'s unpredictable and brutal ex-partner, Henry Oak. Working together in the back alleys of Detroit, Tellis and Oak delve into a dark investigation that leads them to uncover shocking secrets and question the corruption and morality within the department, encountering unorthodox methods and a brutal truth about Calvess\'s death.','/uGHFyVdMQKvIXlsLAoXa5nOUGF.jpg','2002-01-14',105,'Released',NULL,'Narc',11022,3.5728,6.8,'eHOp6K4HYGw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16665,_binary '\0','/dzqZDlXbHsW8eMO2EZaxjYqE9cy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0272255',6.4,2028,'en','The Princess & the Marine','Based on a true story, American Marine Jason Johnson is sent on assignment to the Emirate of Bahrain. While there, he meets and falls in love with a spirited, lovely young woman, Meriam, without realizing she is really a member of the Bahraini Royal Family. Meriam, who does not wish to consent to an arranged marriage, knows her love affair with Jason is dangerous, as he is a Mormon Christian and she a Muslim. Her parents would never consent to their match, and so Meriam and Jason race against time to escape Bahrain and make it to the United States, where they can marry. If Meriam is sent back, however, her life may be in jeopardy.','/rDzQcIUJDE75RkehI1AF72fRPL3.jpg','2001-02-18',100,'Released',NULL,'The Princess & the Marine',55733,1.9064,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16666,_binary '\0','/q8GwhIAttJwqmjDtbLW8JvEMMdw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0272338',7.3,199678,'en','Punch-Drunk Love','A socially awkward and volatile small business owner meets the love of his life after being threatened by a gang of scammers.','/htYp4yqFu4rzBEIa6j9jP8miDm3.jpg','2002-10-11',96,'Released','I have a love in my life. It makes me stronger than anything you can imagine.','Punch-Drunk Love',8051,10.2241,7.1,'9pG2nfxoUcs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16667,_binary '\0','/jyg3GYXIf5hhNZ7NvoPoCArAYpz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0272425',2.7,2033,'ko','용가리','A team of scientists working on a remote dig site find the buried body of an enormous monster, perfectly preserved even after 200 million years. As soon as the beast is uncovered, however, an alien spacecraft suddenly appears above them and brings the monster back to life! The creature immediately sets about levelling the surrounding urban landscape and shrugging off the best firepower the military can throw at it. A lone scientist, working on decrypting an ancient set of hieroglyphics, may be on the verge of finding the aliens\' weak point, but will it be too late?','/2cvqGP48RZX10gyrNcSoJzRZk1m.jpg','1999-07-17',98,'Released','Think Bigger','Yonggary',143136,1.4782,3,'nXv3S3iezNk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16668,_binary '\0','/mugVHtGhT8YpNfvVNW3b5F2m0Al.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0272575',4.4,1425,'en','The Day the World Ended','A school psychologist investigates the death of a student\'s mother and finds the boy believes he is the son of an alien being.','/4PFOqLdY6WlDoY38GLHbBN4Hrd8.jpg','2001-11-23',91,'Released',NULL,'The Day the World Ended',49804,1.9378,4.3,'yLqaZyD2qRc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16669,_binary '\0','/l0n3PCJsAawVyyu96wuxJUxbc9o.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0272606',6.2,1425,'en','Jett Jackson: The Movie','Jett Jackson, who is the star of Silverstone, is considering quitting Silverstone when it is given a three year extension. During the filming of the last episode, Jett is accidently sucked into Silverstone\'s world when a prop malfunctions. Silverstone is zapped into Jett\'s world as well. In Silverstone\'s world, Jett has to save the world from Dr. Kragg\'s evil plans.','/dckg0LWIlCAwuVfhT82whtawChU.jpg','2001-06-08',100,'Released','All the rules have changed.','Jett Jackson: The Movie',124111,1.6873,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16670,_binary '\0','/bh6EhhZu1w9NuABtYapSfjgYeT7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0272688',6.1,1416,'hi','Kasoor','The film starts with the murder of Priti (Divya Dutta), wife of Shekhar (Aftab Shivdasani), a well-known journalist. Inspector Lokhande (Ashutosh Rana) investigates the case and accuses Shekhar of the murder, saying he has enough evidences to arrest him. Upon getting bail from the court, Shekhar\'s lawyer tells him that he will not be able to fight his case because he is a corporate lawyer. He asks him to contact Simran Bhargav (Lisa Ray), who is a criminal lawyer to fight his case.','/szT2yDKj5MUNBovMS1l69Boh8o0.jpg','2001-02-02',151,'Released','A Dangerous Passion...','Kasoor',136615,1.4405,5.789,'4RGc8H4w5JY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16671,_binary '\0','/hAsyCZUndXQF5YBGIoA0xPHMYYi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0272736',5.2,7204,'hi','मुझसे दोस्ती करोगे!','A man falls in love with his childhood friend, but another friend is the one who reciprocates his feelings.','/tRND5b7pGAD8TAwP577jnaIVnat.jpg','2002-08-08',149,'Released',NULL,'Mujhse Dosti Karoge!',26277,2.4922,6.217,'2GP9HNBxW7U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16672,_binary '\0','/qefyZuDt0qnLCIziSfxWKsiFCTV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0272790',5.6,4976,'en','Princess of Thieves','Sherwood forest has a courageous new hero - Gwyn, the daughter of Robin Hood. Possessing the cunning skills of her legendary father and the beauty and intelligence of her mother Maid Marian, Gwyn is anxious to follow in her father\'s footsteps. King Richard nears death and Robin Hood and his Merry Men are summoned to help bring Richard\'s son Philip to his rightful place on the throne before the evil Prince John can assume power. Robin Hood\'s life and that of the future King of England soon lies in Gwyn\'s hands when Robin is captured and sentenced to death.','/8kVufc6afH4yfnq3eSbjJfkFdes.jpg','2001-03-11',88,'Released','If you thought Robin Hood broke all the rules, wait until you meet his daughter!','Princess of Thieves',5764,2.9137,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16673,_binary '\0','/vpz2ifA14M68XOneyAXyO5vIIgW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0273069',6.7,4336,'fr','L\'Adversaire','Based on the 2000 book of the same name by Emmanuel Carrère, it is inspired by the real-life story of Jean-Claude Romand. L\'Adversaire\'s protagonist Jean-Marc Faure (Auteuil) pursues an imaginary career as a doctor of medicine in a plot more closely based on Romand\'s life and Carrère\'s book than was Laurent Cantet\'s 2001 film L\'Emploi du Temps. The film was nominated for a Palme d\'Or at the 2002 Cannes Film Festival.','/aszdSOpOskv1THDeOvLKiQQwdJc.jpg','2002-08-28',129,'Released',NULL,'The Adversary',52999,2.5844,6.628,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16674,_binary '\0','/oaiwUCoLOboBr0qLsIX9VfeYUHl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0273108',7.4,4098,'en','The Beautiful Country','After reuniting with his mother in Ho Chi Minh City, a family tragedy causes Binh to flee from Viet Nam to America. Landing in New York, Binh begins a road trip to Texas, where his American father is said to live.','/cyPJuYz3c8kL7FcjfJDoB2o5yVt.jpg','2004-03-13',137,'Released','An epic story of hope.','The Beautiful Country',41714,2.3782,6.1,'C7sDLJGQ1Rk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16675,_binary '\0','/kkr0S3kbZSVwOmN5vlJWWAN7FMh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0273148',7.4,1815,'fr','La Chambre des officiers','The first days of WWI. Adrien, a young and handsome lieutenant, is wounded by a piece of shrapnel. He will spend the entire wartime at the Val-de-Grâce Hospital, in Paris. Five long years, and his life will change forever...','/lziC2dNU3HjjwSjJKm0AA5cO5lk.jpg','2001-09-26',135,'Released',NULL,'The Officers\' Ward',64481,1.8519,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16676,_binary '\0','/KNHZpydjylSxeIk6buVidChXe8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0273253',6.1,1367,'en','Haiku Tunnel','Josh is the consummate temp employee, avoiding all long-term connections and responsibilities, both at work and in his personal life. However, by the time his agency places him at the Schuyler &amp; Mitchell law firm, Josh is tired of his temporary life and agrees to take a permanent position at the firm. Josh has difficulty adapting to his new lifestyle, which manifests in his inability to complete his simple initial task: mailing seventeen important letters.','/9xVw4EtCcNcI9RmRdH4WRPZkwcJ.jpg','2001-09-07',88,'Released','Work has never been so funny!','Haiku Tunnel',75386,0.7585,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16677,_binary '\0','/wZqjiwEt2zlJ7emTNfDAGsIkYKt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0273300',7.1,1519,'en','Jump Tomorrow','When shy, straitlaced George meets vivacious, adorable Alicia, he\'s instantly smitten -- which puts his imminent arranged marriage in jeopardy. He vows to do the right thing, but then he falls in with Gerard, a lovesick, voluble Frenchman who overcomes George\'s sense of propriety and takes him on a meandering road trip to amour.','/akQsC56tG2T39eO0k1umZ334e2j.jpg','2001-11-09',97,'Released',NULL,'Jump Tomorrow',25985,1.1301,6.3,'3lOKZ3InRqk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16678,_binary '\0','/87eKC37NmZOYL8g3I7fCs0AbozE.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0273302',5.5,1257,'ja','JUNK','Four crooks rob a jewelery shop, then head for an abandoned factory where they plan to fence the goods to the Yakuza. Unfortunately, their chosen location happens to be the same place where American scientists had previously experimented on resurrecting the dead.','/55jjfoppdnTkCAAV8URyNWCeF86.jpg','2000-01-22',83,'Released','Everybody fights','Junk',39981,0.8873,4.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16679,_binary '\0','/xJZmoX5r5zcvJNbeqBGgdizC0d9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0273435',6.3,15078,'en','Ararat','Interrogated by a customs officer, a young man recounts how his life was changed during the making of a film about the Armenian genocide.','/kQkn715VQYLIs2nddAUf19Bz5Wj.jpg','2002-05-20',115,'Released','A quest for truth... among lies, deception, and denial.','Ararat',16351,2.8812,6.1,'tne7D73Zmqg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16680,_binary '\0','/d6o3AWR96rqPQMTo6s2m5GXC4JN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0273452',4.8,2455,'hi','बंधन','Unable to bear a child, Pooja is asked to compromise with her husband\'s new mistress or leave the house. Pooja\'s brother, Raju decides to fight for his sister and reunite her with her husband.','/4eL44roDevhwdu87MkLNzucG2ps.jpg','1998-10-02',154,'Released',NULL,'Bandhan',161229,1.2393,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16681,_binary '\0','/dO9VVu7Z2EqqgGnij7UubQfLGzA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0273517',5.4,21141,'en','Darkness','A teenage girl moves into a remote country home with her family, only to discover that the gloomy old house has a horrifying past that threatens to destroy them.','/e7Y1syIbxcG5Xb2tByPOIz2NhZL.jpg','2002-10-11',88,'Released','Some secrets should never come to light.','Darkness',11056,2.7765,5.66,'QB-rO_IInDw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16682,_binary '\0','/xcLrftlMYWyew0kXsoHjjmnPDnx.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0273656',8.1,4805,'en','Hornblower: Mutiny','Hornblower and his comrades come under the command of a revered but mentally unstable captain and are forced to mutiny in order to save their ship, the HMS Renown.','/r1HkhnkpTZcom8GGgeepAlIknoB.jpg','2001-04-08',98,'Released',NULL,'Hornblower: Mutiny',37068,1.872,7.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16683,_binary '\0','/2BUOolr9rlEX5pprS1iOMIC3dfs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0273657',8.1,4246,'en','Hornblower: Retribution','Hornblower and the other officers of the Renown must return to Jamaica to face a court-martial and possible execution for their actions in relieving their unstable captain.','/i0Zu9O5Pi4tUY8kmPK9Q8NYVsoc.jpg','2001-04-15',98,'Released',NULL,'Hornblower: Retribution',100931,1.4375,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16684,_binary '\0','/xd8bZMt5TThS2yqGUzAYjTCD5rG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0273689',5.3,8797,'en','It\'s All About Love','The story of two lovers and their attempts to save their relationship in a near-future world on the brink of cosmic collapse. John, and world-famous ice skating star, Elena, are about to sign divorce papers when they realise that, in spite of everything happening around them, their love is worth fighting for. It\'s All About Love is a fresh take on modern love and future life as two lovers struggle in a conspiracy of epic proportions.','/3RDSIkHsVy6NAgD6PfQKDCNTcmR.jpg','2003-01-10',104,'Released',NULL,'It\'s All About Love',12777,3.1286,5.4,'0MxquUjCTi4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16685,_binary '\0','/fo5SdMQB51AY3zhnQkLBlKytqYa.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0273718',5.8,3696,'tr','Komser Şekspir','After fainting in a school rehearsal, little Su is diagnosed with leukemia. As a result she is forced to give up the Snow White role she wanted so badly. Police Chief Cemil decides to stage the production of Snow White and the Seven Dwarves at his oppressive police station. He hopes to win a TV competition in order to save his dying daughter.','/53v7hFGCmorXdbPtV6MF3xHlIdi.jpg','2001-02-16',113,'Released',NULL,'Commissioner Shakespeare',331063,1.8134,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16686,_binary '\0','/PR4zplwe1LqkUiWhwwKx8maQcd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0273719',6,4078,'da','En kort, en lang','Jacob is a young man used to getting everything he wants. For several years, he has been living in a happy homosexual partnership with Jørgen, and one night Jacob decides to pop the big question to Jørgen. Jørgen happily accepts Jacobs marriage proposal, but then something happens: Jacob falls in love with a girl, and not just any girl. The girl is Caroline, married to Jørgens younger brother Tom.','/tKMnFxvNWGgb6VDTXGMkf9Ip2yR.jpg','2001-11-16',98,'Released',NULL,'Shake It All About',14893,2.1634,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16687,_binary '\0','/ziINAUKAi1W74PffqDdBPk9E62l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0273799',5.5,9573,'en','Max Keeble\'s Big Move','Max Keeble, the victim of his 7th grade class, plots revenge when he learns he\'s moving; it backfires when he doesn\'t move after all.','/eJ4olY0dZMC1MfMhRkLOWisWYtu.jpg','2001-10-05',86,'Released','His World. His Rules.','Max Keeble\'s Big Move',34549,3.926,5.862,'mlqumn2XTYQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16688,_binary '\0','/535riOR9UIi3JrYURXIe9vrHoqv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0273822',6.3,2638,'en','Mockingbird Don\'t Sing','The tragic true story of one of the worst cases of child abuse ever documented (in which a girl was locked in a room without social contact for nearly thirteen years) and what happened when she was finally rescued.','/x50tfqNxTRFtk4k70sWSvt4MEYg.jpg','2001-05-04',98,'Released','She was little more than a wild animal. And only one woman had the gift to heal her.','Mockingbird Don\'t Sing',27967,1.8275,6.4,'1mxn0ScpGTo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16689,_binary '\0','/n3i154ss2LGbueUYU53YZ7pYC8c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0273833',6.6,1685,'no','Mongoland','Pia is coming home for Christmas after traveling in England for about 6 months. She wants to catch up with her boyfriend, Kristoffer, who was supposed to have joined her on the trip, but backed out at the last minute. Finding him, however, is turning out to be quite a task. While searching, she meets several more or less disgruntled and dissatisfied people. And when Santa turns up things start happening...','/nnc7UM7XpQg0pkWwNRVs6Dwt8J6.jpg','2001-01-26',84,'Released',NULL,'Mongoland',71807,0.8641,6.2,'HgJhg4-krXE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16690,_binary '\0','/77pUDMyTKdLJcJswl9BDKlhsnhG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0273840',7.7,4215,'hu','Moszkva tér','1989 is an important year in the political history of Hungary. However, Petya and his friends couldn\'t care less. They are about to graduate high school. The only important things to them are the parties, girls, making some easy cash. And of course, passing the upcoming exam with the leaked questions.','/86rTWbQT83zlSHNu45S3tIbAMJ1.jpg','2001-09-20',88,'Released',NULL,'Moscow Square',41093,1.6504,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16691,_binary '\0','/zwFJcd6qMppTb5VbXKQxkMkp2wY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0273842',6.5,6118,'en','Motocrossed','Teenage Andrea Carson who loves motocross, despite her father finding her unsuited for the sport, being that she is \"just a girl\". When her twin brother Andrew breaks his leg just before a big race, their father is forced to go to Europe to find a replacement rider. In the meantime, Andrea secretly races in Andrew\'s place with her mother\'s help.','/7Us6BhiUfqfenFF7NjouXG81guK.jpg','2001-02-16',91,'Released',NULL,'Motocrossed',71885,3.2093,6.3,'dtr8FJkvlxQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16692,_binary '\0','/hzFAnOTA1CJxFmwAlRvofrFS88a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0273870',7.6,2251,'ml','നരസിംഹം','Poovalli Induchoodan (Mohanlal) is sentenced for six years prison life for murdering his classmate. Induchoodan, the only son of Justice Maranchery Karunakara Menon (Thilakan) was framed in the case by Manapally Madhavan Nambiar (Narayanan Nair) and his crony DYSP Sankaranarayanan (Bheeman Raghu) to take revenge on idealist judge Menon who had earlier given jail sentence to Manapally in a corruption case. The story begins with Induchoodan released and his father & mother coming to stay with him.','/mdXaqs1d4E8ybyReHUvPuUBy03O.jpg','2000-01-26',175,'Released',NULL,'Narasimham',193932,1.5255,7.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16693,_binary '\0','/xvSwVUZ85vaGbBir0OllTGxtG4R.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0273923',6.2,54334,'en','Orange County','Shaun Brumder is a local surfer kid from Orange County who dreams of going to Stanford to become a writer and to get away from his dysfunctional family household. Except Shaun runs into one complication after another, starting when his application is rejected after his dim-witted guidance counselor sends in the wrong form.','/pkyi0FYFVxymhqGNttYtDOHXjBM.jpg','2002-01-11',82,'Released','It\'s not just a place. It\'s a state of mind.','Orange County',11857,5.3271,6,'DigaxGStjC8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16694,_binary '\0','/bZy2miukfTlGqbHGF7Toxv6fM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0273982',6.8,11633,'en','Poolhall Junkies','A retired pool hustler is forced to pick up the stick again when his brother starts a game he can\'t finish.','/3MAGLk0AtuPi24PBwy3o4ILO0CV.jpg','2002-06-30',99,'Released','It\'s your shot. Take it.','Poolhall Junkies',14293,2.3479,6.4,'iIGtTshQ6Yo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16695,_binary '\0','/xSC7mZ1SBdGbfCtDdyy5TfNRlbp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0274012',8.1,3187,'ml','പഞ്ചാബി ഹൗസ്','A fisherman saves a suicidal Unni, only to sell him to a Punjabi moneylender in Kerala. Unni is then forced to pose as a man with hearing and speech impairment, resulting in hilarious consequences.','/v1bbWKzG9RDZbemuEmTDCQWhGTc.jpg','1998-09-04',146,'Released',NULL,'Punjabi House',234639,1.1678,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16696,_binary '\0','/lbgDinb2d9H9vkcMi6L91n8hhmy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0274114',7.8,1841,'ml','സമ്മര്‍ ഇന്‍ ബെത്ലഹേം','Ravishankar and Dennis live on Dennis’s estate in the hills. When Colonel Menon arrives with his daughters, Ravishankar wonders which one of them has been sending him amorous letters. Meanwhile, Dennis is attracted to the enigmatic Abhirami, but what does Abhirami want?','/qjT6aJgAjqsMe5fe1x4t19XnWsq.jpg','1998-07-04',155,'Released',NULL,'Summer in Bethlehem',280212,1.2052,7.614,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16697,_binary '\0','/xUCiXW8e6kX9ClySKqYjXkKeIA2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0274117',7.3,16252,'fr','Sur mes lèvres','She is almost deaf and she lip-reads. He is an ex-convict. She wants to help him. He thinks no one can help except himself.','/1YIkOan9JzbBVAQRvq5fIjHHBAP.jpg','2001-10-17',115,'Released',NULL,'Read My Lips',6173,2.8846,7.1,'idQKTEigAok','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16698,_binary '\0','/dIj2vSBgK6KN3FVEZJFwGrz3tAB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0274155',6.4,7753,'fr','Tanguy','Tanguy is 28 years old and still living with his parents. They think it\'s time he moves out. He doesn\'t, so they hatch a plan.','/hTSALpAPB5ANmplvBqwChgv1Hun.jpg','2001-11-21',108,'Released','At 28, he still lives with his parents','Tanguy',2029,1.8737,5.966,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16699,_binary '\0','/tGcIy7gA8jwYpi5W2UB1Rxrk2i6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0274166',6.3,187110,'en','Johnny English','A lowly pencil pusher working for MI7, Johnny English is suddenly promoted to super spy after Agent One is assassinated and every other agent is blown up at his funeral. When a billionaire entrepreneur sponsors the exhibition of the Crown Jewels—and the valuable gems disappear on the opening night and on English\'s watch—the newly-designated agent must jump into action to find the thief and recover the missing gems.','/mmzW88tnkB2MnOV3Un2F9IUxSnZ.jpg','2003-03-14',87,'Released','He knows no fear. He knows no danger. He knows nothing.','Johnny English',9486,9.9356,6.3,'7VlpHnog6rw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16700,_binary '\0','/ucRD8UUr5tllltg3ZTWoXOyPXyJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0274309',7.3,40836,'en','24 Hour Party People','Manchester, 1976. Tony Wilson is an ambitious but frustrated local TV news reporter looking for a way to make his mark. After witnessing a life-changing concert by a band known as the Sex Pistols, he persuades his station to televise one of their performances, and soon Manchester\'s punk groups are clamoring for him to manage them. Riding the wave of a musical revolution, Wilson and his friends create the legendary Factory Records label and The Hacienda club.','/8f50NQ1wz6hdxfCISCPV8XQ6DII.jpg','2002-02-13',117,'Released','Share the Ecstacy!','24 Hour Party People',2750,4.3078,6.975,'yGLF5g7pYsc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16701,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0274367',7.3,3659,'en','The Best of Borat','Series of reports from Borat Karabzhanov, the Kazakhstani TV journalist, a character featuring in DA ALI G SHOW, as he travels in Britain looking at British culture and customs, including visits to Henley Regatta, Saville Row and a tea party, and looking at aspects such as fox hunting. Made up of footage taken from DA ALI G SHOW plus new footage and links comparing life in Britain and Kazakhstan','/pTxjQgcWe01DZDHjcZ3I9bgCa0u.jpg','2001-01-18',25,'Released',NULL,'The Best of Borat',372623,1.3722,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16702,_binary '\0','/miF9RKGC0pqsNq0oiwKGMge8K1Z.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0274407',6.4,2852,'en','Callas Forever','Aging opera singer Maria Callas tries to make a comeback by performing in a production of Bizet\'s \"Carmen.\"','/oDtTHHmwZPDI9f9NQJ7NS5GAli0.jpg','2002-09-18',111,'Released','A triumph is worse than a failure if the price is too high','Callas Forever',47959,1.9296,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16703,_binary '\0','/dRTLDK88cHuzVV1YMW9xafsrcEZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0274415',4.7,1673,'en','Carmen: A Hip Hopera','An engaged Philadelphia policeman falls in love with a beautiful woman while dealing with a corrupt superior.','/4HbrlraSf2tb1WGyvO9sY8K5If5.jpg','2001-05-08',85,'Released','No man can resist her.','Carmen: A Hip Hopera',64255,2.4635,6.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16704,_binary '\0','/mYZ5dUUyZfLHLViuoD9gmwq3xwl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0274428',6.6,4240,'ar','يد إلهية‎','Santa Claus tries to outrun a gang of knife-wielding youth. It\'s one of several vignettes of Palestinian life in Israel - in a neighborhood in Nazareth and at Al-Ram checkpoint in East Jerusalem. Most of the stories are droll, some absurd, one is mythic and fanciful; few words are spoken. A man who goes through his mail methodically each morning has a heart attack. His son visits him in the hospital. The son regularly meets a woman at Al-Ram; they sit in a car, hands caressing. Once, she defies Israeli guards at the checkpoint; later, ninja-like, she takes on soldiers at a target range. A red balloon floats free overhead. Neighbors toss garbage over walls. Life goes on until it doesn\'t.','/pczspk2mTCVmG5eyErnB4BZD2HY.jpg','2002-10-02',92,'Released',NULL,'Divine Intervention',27744,2.2558,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16705,_binary '\0','/srOjpYje1x22Nzo7mAoqmQO8jzb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0274468',7.7,4977,'en','Door to Door','Sometimes the true heroes in our lives are those people who inspire us not with their superhuman accomplishments but simply by their refusal to give up in the face of seemingly insurmountable odds and the dignity in which they go about their lives. Bill Porter is one of those heroes. Born with cerebral palsy, he was told for many years that he was unemployable. But with the unwavering support of a dedicated mother and an indomitable spirit that has become his trademark, Porter did support himself as a door-to-door salesman in Portland, Oregon.','/cXrWdI2rUVqhy6E7w6025ldpFxd.jpg','2002-07-14',90,'Released',NULL,'Door to Door',41712,1.9924,7.4,'bv39D8QrBT4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16706,_binary '\0','/A5D298Emg8Cy4Dzc2trFJwl6JiA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0274497',7.3,10888,'it','Le fate ignoranti','When Antonia\'s husband Massimo is killed in a car accident, she accidentally discovers that he has been having a same-sex affair with a produce wholesaler named Michele.','/wJ2UV6OpenRBb5l0GQ0eCSatFcJ.jpg','2001-03-16',106,'Released',NULL,'His Secret Life',23550,2.4777,7.3,'k1wpI9YMmeY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16707,_binary '\0','/apIoUsBzoProHdpz5S7eOV6EEPP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0274557',5,1236,'en','Hounded','A teenager ends up being hounded by a well-groomed and seemingly cute and tiny dog that actually turns out to be a nightmare of a beast.','/p72pUEPo2FpA2dcOrRckG7Z5rle.jpg','2001-04-13',91,'Released',NULL,'Hounded',109167,1.6201,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16708,_binary '\0','/3oHFSEr4TRnsyTxWGrmY8Xi2FrR.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0274558',7.5,148060,'en','The Hours','The story of three women searching for more potent, meaningful lives. Each is alive at a different time and place, all are linked by their yearnings and their fears. Their stories intertwine, and finally come together in a surprising, transcendent moment of shared recognition.','/4myDtowDJQPQnkEDB1IWGtJR1Fo.jpg','2002-12-27',114,'Released','The time to hide is over. The time to regret is gone. The time to live is now.','The Hours',590,7.841,7.2,'CkPWXUxIiXs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16709,_binary '\0','/zNtFyREfrQbC6abWmiUtsfTde8h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0274604',6.7,1658,'ta','கண்ணுக்குள் நிலவு','Gautham meets Dr Rajasekhar, a psychologist, to learn about his memories pertaining to a girl named Gayathri. Rajasekhar learns that he is looking for Shanmugam, who he thinks has killed Gayathri.','/dYsVevca2nzJ1srdx595dDK3NcJ.jpg','2000-01-14',160,'Released',NULL,'Kannukkul Nilavu',69656,1.028,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16710,_binary '\0','/A9yKKhUK5mkmxgikXIEW33CYEED.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0274636',6.1,9833,'en','The Luck of the Irish','A teenager must battle for a gold charm to keep his family from being controlled by an evil leprechaun.','/SHuAb5qIxyKShcDvj13urwdsz.jpg','2001-03-09',86,'Released','Leprechaun tomorrow.','The Luck of the Irish',46004,3.4826,6.1,'YL_OAiiWEgo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16711,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0274659',5.8,4122,'en','Mermaid Chronicles Part 1: She Creature','Two carnies (Sewell and Gugino) abduct a mermaid in Ireland, circa 1900, and decide to transport her to America. As their ship loses its way and heads towards the mythical Forbidden Islands, the mermaid begins to display its deadly side.','/9XujfUiyhNxPG48cQHvJnkMnqSw.jpg','2001-12-20',91,'Released','Beatiful, seductive and totally deadly.','Mermaid Chronicles Part 1: She Creature',37254,2.8726,5.8,'WUgNerSNKcs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16712,_binary '\0','/z0hxaBMxj5sQqk7MtMDmX6eZmMF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0274711',5.4,12340,'en','People I Know','A New York press agent must scramble when his major client becomes embroiled in a huge scandal.','/7FsbWJq43lQGCIPxe8z3zBwEIkh.jpg','2002-11-21',100,'Released','He thought he\'d seen it all... until the night he saw too much.','People I Know',11458,3.2219,5.2,'eBBrNdxNx7k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16713,_binary '\0','/ejYCVTGnTKtB9wv8xgoFtuJDsds.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0274735',7.3,2058,'en','The Pretender: Island of the Haunted','Jarod takes a keen interest in an ancient symbol that may unlock secrets about his family. But Miss Parker is hot on Jarod\'s trail and about to make discoveries of her own. Their investigation leads to a remote Island off the Scottish coast, where a set of sacred scrolls, vital to the Centre, have been hidden – and protected – for centuries.','/6MBCzZhvfGTiH7LZIN5Xjzd1f0i.jpg','2001-12-10',91,'Released',NULL,'The Pretender: Island of the Haunted',27339,2.0426,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16714,_binary '\0','/AfMAcS5HmPPRtJ3d9tipXTQV2Xt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0274761',6.3,12301,'en','Halloweentown II: Kalabar\'s Revenge','The Cromwell clan lives in the real world, except for their grandmother who lives in Halloweentown, a place where monsters go to escape reality. But now the son of the Cromwells\' old enemy Kalabar has a plan to use the grandmother\'s book to turn Halloweentown into a grey dreary version of the real world while transforming the denizens of the real world into monsters.','/uDnp52aGXxnfU4vqnnc6YpfzjHb.jpg','2001-10-12',81,'Released','Your Favorite Witches Are Back!','Halloweentown II: Kalabar\'s Revenge',34205,5.1202,6.8,'nzSRaAHMPn8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16715,_binary '\0','/em2X6JSHaioKsRS3StUO3hpbuVg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0274789',6.8,1526,'ta','மின்சார கனவு','Priya decides that she wants to be a nun, much to the horror of her father and Thomas, the boy who is in love with her. Thomas decides to enlist the help of Deva to change her mind.','/h7a3GSQdt0r1dfQKw9CAkXfEiTk.jpg','1997-01-14',145,'Released',NULL,'Minsara Kanavu',79328,1.3624,6.594,'4j3H7q_Miwc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16716,_binary '\0','/ifHgVh5c7B3mbq5CfkzwsyMRmpG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0274812',6.8,110103,'en','Secretary','A young woman, recently released from a mental hospital, gets a job as a secretary to a demanding lawyer, where their employer-employee relationship turns into a sexual, sadomasochistic one.','/8mHdYNKCmvjB1r87waCtEi9nvTt.jpg','2002-09-20',111,'Released','Assume the position.','Secretary',11013,12.7391,6.8,'00zGV6p-dKc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16717,_binary '\0','/1CwgcHWyjHo7qbbyfLANd8ihlZY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0274931',6.6,2190,'tr','Tarkan: Mars\'ın Kılıcı','Tarkan, a fearless and loyal warrior of Attila the Hun, enters into a bloody struggle to capture the sword of God Mars, a weapon granting world domination to those who wield it.','/ysMvYyzAaLbAzQKdldb7vxby2RQ.jpg','1969-01-01',81,'Released',NULL,'Tarkan',405191,1.6994,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16718,_binary '\0','/zFoy8qPOaDOdQzjHPkdrhj7Evmt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0274932',6.4,2648,'tr','Tarkan: Viking Kanı','Features a mustached villain, who is the leader of a Viking clan that worships an octopus god-monster. The Vikings wish to kidnap a beautiful girl to sacrifice her to their demigod, but the heroic Tarkan, aided by his dog, Kurt, is there to save the day.','/up4IeoBIZoBFE0OvO5YQptHsuKy.jpg','1971-11-01',86,'Released',NULL,'Tarkan and the Blood of the Vikings',86256,1.0804,5.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16719,_binary '\0','/x3jHuXnep56ZUPdjbws3kFbxW9l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0274933',6.3,1840,'tr','Tarkan: Altın Madalyon','Vandal king Attila\'s trying to save his son kidnapped by Tarkan and stories of friends.','/yHl0rEDs8i7ZZQm6too0dZ4HuSx.jpg','1973-10-01',82,'Released',NULL,'Tarkan: The Golden Medallion',405188,1.2411,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16720,_binary '\0','/y4drEpaMJV5wl8u7v5RBZsySKGC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0274934',6.4,1725,'tr','Tarkan: Gümüş Eyer','Atilla the Hun gives a Silver Saddle to Altar as a gift. The intention of Kostok is the get rid of the Huns and seize the valuable saddle. Little Tarkan\'s foster mother is forced to leave him in a cave. His cry attracts the attention of a wolf, who raises Tarkan like his own cub.','/oYu55hQXn06hEnY723gxTh0bbz.jpg','1970-01-01',82,'Released',NULL,'Tarkan and the Silver Saddle',405189,0.9989,6.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16721,_binary '\0','/hYuu4iTyq7TVX9gokHM79QawEbI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0274935',6.5,1588,'tr','Tarkan: Güçlü Kahraman','Atilla the Hun, Tarkan its power in order to bring the sword to the floor at the pursuit of the enemy\'s appointed.','/ycwLbOiEu6NSmv8SUv6ei9R4NA7.jpg','1973-10-31',84,'Released',NULL,'Tarkan and the Armless Hero',405187,0.9153,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16722,_binary '\0','/igpUTEhu5zEtGt19iPuDgfuxoyL.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0275022',4,47865,'en','Crossroads','After eight years apart, three childhood friends - Lucy, Kit, and Mimi - rediscover their friendship on a cross-country trip. With barely a plan, practically no money but plenty of dreams, the girls catch a lift with Mimi\'s handsome friend Ben in his convertible. Along the way they not only gather experiences that will change their lives, but they also discover how important it is to hold onto their hearts\' desires.','/prdFY9Bc28frBhhWl7mPSr7JmFp.jpg','2002-02-15',93,'Released','Dreams change. Friends are forever.','Crossroads',17130,5.7548,5.206,'7bdelecH5cw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16723,_binary '\0','/v5QbzUkzCKzkTPbO50GvaI18gzD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0275067',5.1,5249,'en','Wendigo','A family from the city decide to spend a weekend away at a friend\'s country farmhouse. But a fluke accident sets off a chain of events that alters their lives forever and conjures up the ferocious spirit of the Wendigo.','/cPtteHPYzO0ZBgr94Bx0a87zmzy.jpg','2002-02-15',92,'Released','Some myths are real.','Wendigo',44340,1.9422,4.948,'43G7rai6rVk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16724,_binary '\0','/gUjWplwrg1Nd7KKfzw1nDgzlfpb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0275083',7.1,11522,'ko','무사','In 1375, China was in chaos between Yuan Dynasty and Ming Dynasty. Coryo (an ancient kingdom of Korea then) sent a delegation of many diplomats, soldiers and a silent slave to make peace with the new Chinese government. However, this delegation got charged as spies and sent in exile to a remote desert.','/i0lpQfqQHN7vEYzSHOk6B65dQbb.jpg','2001-09-07',155,'Released','Save the princess. We should be back home!','The Warrior',1436,2.7294,7,'C7Vg1HcgL8U','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16725,_binary '\0','/en3CUPO36ZZXq3mtx7cQe1lfkaH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0275089',7.6,1704,'tr','Yılanların Öcü','The film follows the life of a poor, old woman defying the hierarchy in the village. Irazca is an old woman who lives with her son Kara Bayram, her daughter-in-law Hatice, and three grandchildren. The headman of the village sells a lot from the common land of the village to Haceli. The family does not want a house to be built in front of their house and struggles against the tricks of the headman and Haceli.','/3TgJZCmknGugJEmMCTzYKqOXVqY.jpg','1962-01-24',108,'Released',NULL,'Revenge of the Snakes',270406,1.4981,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16726,_binary '\0','/17s9ojb8j8QnBGCfqDUJraXLlFi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0275230',6.6,14273,'ja','BLOOD THE LAST VAMPIRE','In Japan, the vampire-hunter Saya, who is a powerful original, is sent by her liaison with the government, David, posed as a teenage student to the Yokota High School on the eve of Halloween to hunt down vampires. Saya asks David to give a new katana to her. Soon she saves the school nurse Makiho Amano from two vampires disguised of classmates and Makiho witnesses her fight against the powerful demon.','/uRwR5lcl55n5JSaTiYPwp5KjP6A.jpg','2000-11-18',48,'Released','Where evil grows, she preys.','Blood: The Last Vampire',919,5.1807,6.871,'tYnciEGup9k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16727,_binary '\0','/19EKawKy1Z7nUJMhQE28XBL6Guc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0275277',7.8,57854,'ja','カウボーイビバップ 天国の扉','The year is 2071. Following a terrorist bombing, a deadly virus is released on the populace of Mars and the government has issued the largest bounty in history, for the capture of whoever is behind it. The bounty hunter crew of the spaceship Bebop; Spike, Faye, Jet and Ed, take the case with hopes of cashing in the bounty. However, the mystery surrounding the man responsible, Vincent, goes deeper than they ever imagined, and they aren\'t the only ones hunting him.','/34H5bsNc0EPILVr49TfOYXj50qV.jpg','2001-09-01',115,'Released','They\'re here to save the planet. But not for free.','Cowboy Bebop: The Movie',11299,5.3389,7.713,'DX9rKumF5Ao','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16728,_binary '\0','/ex21uMbWeAEju9QUAhkAqtfAgaO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0275309',7.6,13905,'en','Dogtown and Z-Boys','This award-winning, thrilling story is about a group of discarded kids who revolutionized skateboarding and shaped the attitude and culture of modern day extreme sports. Featuring old skool skating footage, exclusive interviews and a blistering rock soundtrack, DOGTOWN AND Z-BOYS captures the rise of the Zephyr skateboarding team from Venice\'s Dogtown, a tough \"locals only\" beach with a legacy of outlaw surfing.','/eb02dpopuAhuThf7nXAAwKtAF88.jpg','2002-05-10',90,'Released','The birth of extreme','Dogtown and Z-Boys',1282,3.0281,7,'0yrEHjl1vFo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16729,_binary '\0','/wNFiDhGnrnSfyqYxzeAa8mFnUhj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0275491',7.4,66403,'es','La mala educación','When an old friend brings filmmaker Enrique Goded a semi-autobiographical script chronicling their adolescence, Enrique is forced to relive his youth spent at a Catholic boarding school. Weaving through past and present, the script follows a transvestite performer who reconnects with a grade school sweetheart. Spurred on by this chance encounter, the character reflects on her childhood sexual victimization and the trauma of closeting her sexual orientation.','/ir4lkaAMJQrlLFMW1QM3BD9Jeb0.jpg','2004-03-19',105,'Released',NULL,'Bad Education',140,5.7934,7.4,'ME3TcDGM8t8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16730,_binary '\0','/vYDAxQ0ZecDL0lAw0okTWCrKRzD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0275692',5.2,1452,'en','Sol Goode','Sol Goode, a charismatic L.A. twenty-something, has always relied on charm, good looks, and fast talk to glide through life. But his luck may have run out; faced with eviction from his hipster apartment, totaling his car, and the threat of having to find a real job, Sol realizes that maybe the life he\'s been leading is no longer making him happy.','/geVTfFgPmnSrJu6hUzpX4zjD0JM.jpg','2003-03-11',99,'Released','Whether you\'re crude, lewd or just a slacker dude, it\'s...','Sol Goode',23603,2.1534,4.2,'0d5PuokL4wU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16731,_binary '\0','/o6PsWbkPva254PkEaVAnB87wpFH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0275719',7.2,22416,'en','Tape','Jon, a first-time filmmaker, finds himself in Lansing, Michigan to present his film at a local film festival. Vince, his high school friend who is now a volunteer fireman and small-time drug dealer, also visits the town to support Jon on his big day, or so it seems. After a raucous hello and much backslapping, it appears that there is an undercurrent of tension in the air.','/4Flz17KOjGdGqJ2dFRhKnB7eg5.jpg','2001-11-02',87,'Released','Some things can\'t be erased.','Tape',23949,2.9098,6.9,'JVSUQLGoYZ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16732,_binary '\0','/rZjRoASxOOyafFruGRuDBzL7dZ8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0275773',6.3,14255,'ja','ヴァーサス','A group of ruthless gangsters, an unknown woman and an escaped convict have met, in The Forest of Resurrection, the 444th portal to the other side. Their troubles start when those once killed and buried in the forest come back from the dead.','/dEk6Fpm4lkEBQBVpzTOLau7qgR9.jpg','2000-10-23',120,'Released','Witness a battle no one has ever seen.','Versus',5842,2.1414,6.2,'wg7ljhZuJJc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16733,_binary '\0','/AcxbOWUbwtIEDisfuhNGHQNfnMK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0275847',7.4,247195,'en','Lilo & Stitch','As Stitch, a runaway genetic experiment from a faraway planet, wreaks havoc on the Hawaiian Islands, he becomes the mischievous adopted alien \"puppy\" of an independent little girl named Lilo and learns about loyalty, friendship, and ʻohana, the Hawaiian tradition of family.','/cFuLvQJPoZpuruAtN3rVnMmLIH8.jpg','2002-06-21',85,'Released','There\'s one in every family.','Lilo & Stitch',11544,29.3683,7.559,'wAtaSKQ4-T0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16734,_binary '\0','/obToBLe55VZLgip1BoHgE5nLAM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0275913',3.5,1406,'en','Amazons and Gladiators','During the Roman Empire, General Crassius ruled a small province with an Iron fist. Serena, a young girl in a village, watches Crassius kill her parents. Crassius and Serena\'s destiny would lead them to the Gladiator ring; the Amazons Warrior vs the Roman General.','/ckTIGw3YllmMh7wikMZw8BQP3ye.jpg','2001-09-01',94,'Released','The fight is just beginning','Amazons and Gladiators',56753,1.6,3.2,'f8Vm0wu0fQA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16735,_binary '\0','/UNP6AvoiTo1am5WBx11slm5NOQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0275947',5.2,10844,'en','Avenging Angelo','A woman who has recently discovered that she is the daughter of Angelo, a major mafia boss, decides to wreak vengeance when he is killed by a hitman. She\'s aided by his faithful bodyguard, with whom she soon falls in love.','/hl4mI28D4NhE6ePNgPojQuyEYw7.jpg','2002-08-30',97,'Released','Her life is his job.','Avenging Angelo',13437,4.5741,5.4,'6uS-YBsJKEg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16736,_binary '\0','/jlQoEyTRwu3sM56cfsWfEyHSryc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0276016',6.6,1962,'en','He-Man and She-Ra: A Christmas Special','In this special Christmas episode of the He-Man and She-Ra cartoons, their sidekick Orko accidentally gets beamed to Earth during a test of a new spy satellite. Orko manages to get back Planet Eternia, but brings along two Earth children, Alisha and Manuel, with him. Since it\'s Christmastime on Earth, the kids are naturally filled with the holiday spirit, but this overflowing goodwill attracts the unwelcome attention of the Horde Prime and Skeletor. Will the combined power of He-Man, She-Ra and the spirit of Christmas be enough to stop them?','/ocpYH0zbi7sISxsoUfCYZqcPwfA.jpg','1985-12-25',44,'Released',NULL,'He-Man and She-Ra: A Christmas Special',50063,2.1842,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16737,_binary '\0','/6Bx6fsUqJDsBjDCgIMSnjN3ua6i.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0276033',4.4,6667,'en','The Country Bears','For Beary Barrington, The Country Bears\' young #1 fan, fitting in with his all-too-human family is proving im-paws-ible. When he runs away to find Country Bear Hall and his heroes, he discovers the venue that made them famous is near foreclosure. Beary hightails it over the river and through the woods to get the Bears in the Band back together for an all-out reunion concert to save Country Bear Hall.','/z0K5vNYSLDT8KOrXBrhwMj2Xnd8.jpg','2002-07-26',88,'Released','They’re legends. Bearly.','The Country Bears',18357,4.7154,4.723,'xeQRV0pskyw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16738,_binary '\0','/eBOZljHJ2wmEusMgzQZOGCeNfSy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0276191',5,2622,'tr','Hemşo','Directed by Ömer Ugur.','/ojTkLhY06ubNUcjsfqSFhK2ZcLs.jpg','2001-01-02',93,'Released',NULL,'Hemşo',272835,1.5369,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16739,_binary '\0','/idlu9jCRsKeUbYFPHIyd5L7R9OQ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0276276',6.6,1485,'en','Lawless Heart','In a British seaside resort, several lives intertwine following the funeral of a gay restaurant owner.','/afW2tM8Gw7BTfIIfj4AcXydNhu6.jpg','2002-06-28',100,'Released','Is the life you have the life you want?','Lawless Heart',77283,1.2353,5.2,'xSb-9gvw8Ns','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16740,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0276409',6.5,2204,'pl','Pieniądze to nie wszystko','The protagonist of the film is a 50-year-old businessman, Tomasz Adamczyk, who wants to give up running his winery business and devote himself to his lifelong passion for philosophy. This idea does not appeal to his business partner. On top of all this, Tomasz has an accident and is taken hostage by enthusiasts of the wine he produces.','/rDCReEq6rV0iI0spRrsV34gzo9m.jpg','2001-01-05',120,'Released',NULL,'Money Is Not Everything',39317,1.7475,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16741,_binary '\0','/mm3MhZPyq3XaOI3QVGnMNoUYHzq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0276501',7.2,4940,'zh','十七岁的单车','A seventeen-year-old country boy working in Beijing as a courier has his bicycle stolen, and finds it with a schoolboy his age.','/mkOBUHcJFfVWLJmWNvE0qZuzAW0.jpg','2001-02-17',113,'Released','One bicycle, two lives.','Beijing Bicycle',12659,2.0863,6.9,'wpHgZgFBfJ0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16742,_binary '\0','/7dTEbDVesZN6Ua28nEgoJKfcVRF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0276613',7.6,1811,'en','Waiting for Godot','Two tramps wait for a man named Godot, but instead meet a pompous man and his stooped-over slave.','/tbplaDEDebpazYDX5zBg0Diyhtm.jpg','2001-02-04',120,'Released',NULL,'Waiting for Godot',40373,1.4102,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16743,_binary '\0','/bGpRDAU5b0Ejc64wydAxt2ovx20.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0276617',7,3699,'de','Das weisse Rauschen','Lukas, a young schizophrenic man, has to deal with a new town, a new relationship, and the paranoia in his head.','/kYJLb69aANQhf6EvewCnKRpiJ5O.jpg','2001-12-31',107,'Released',NULL,'The White Sound',273,1.549,6.9,'KowTIH-lJ7I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16744,_binary '\0','/8F6SHIyZsIsN2R8s2Y4jmfwlBWP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0276744',5.6,1435,'en','13 Moons','Things aren\'t looking so good for television clown Banana\'s career, and the fact that his estranged wife, Suzi, has just been arrested for assaulting his girlfriend, Lily, just serves to compound Banana\'s despair.','/mzFrhP1kS0vko51GSdQc1KsMt5r.jpg','2002-08-30',94,'Released','Ever have one of those nights?','13 Moons',43656,1.5613,5.5,'9-P2EgbMy1A','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16745,_binary '\0','/xxiPjhXigJ4zPiqqrA77FK10ULo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0276751',7.1,199917,'en','About a Boy','Will Freeman is a good-looking, smooth-talking bachelor whose primary goal in life is avoiding any kind of responsibility. But when he invents an imaginary son in order to meet attractive single moms, Will gets a hilarious lesson about life from a bright, but hopelessly geeky 12-year-old named Marcus. Now, as Will struggles to teach Marcus the art of being cool, Marcus teaches Will that you\'re never too old to grow up.','/qoZ1bD0q9EFqcNiEYbEigsRcNCt.jpg','2002-04-26',101,'Released','Growing up has nothing to do with age.','About a Boy',245,6.4767,6.7,'xC7REp40_uc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16746,_binary '\0','/cAudNZRXllPucirnOIgLeQBzHtz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0276793',7.3,2012,'tr','Baba Bizi Eversene','A hopelessly yearning hippie is left alone with a newborn baby when his just married parents go for a vacation, but wittily he finds a solution to get back his expatriate girlfriend, utilizing the baby who has no idea what is going on.','/ucByHuULeMvTFWPBLs5ObRyGH9c.jpg','1975-12-30',97,'Released',NULL,'Dad, Make Me Marry',29099,1.4716,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16747,_binary '\0','/4MF9pKO06xmyJO4I6ra0ekNK8Hd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0276816',6.1,26792,'en','Below','In the dark silence of the sea during World War II, the submarine USS Tiger Shark prowls on what should be a routine rescue mission. But for the shell-shocked crew, trapped together in the sub\'s narrow corridors and constricted spaces, this is about to become a journey into the sensory delusions, mental deceptions and runaway fears that lurk just below the surface of the ocean.','/4tsaLD98DcXh4ltOn9wEWhsUkSc.jpg','2002-08-11',105,'Released','Six hundred feet beneath the surface terror runs deep','Below',12590,4.4392,6,'SR5YQbHZJfw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16748,_binary '\0','/co98TYty1zqwFtmxAeV8dxzhMrM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0276818',6.9,1790,'ko','번지점프를 하다','A likeable, married high school teacher spirals out of control when a student in his class begins unintentionally reminding him of his doomed first love, which ended 17 years earlier.','/dJTDjWhcy67lRfFwRXJkcyvHEMU.jpg','2001-02-03',101,'Released','A mysterious memory of feeling love...','Bungee Jumping of Their Own',83013,1.8311,6.5,'M_Rd6q3QeAc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16749,_binary '\0','/wm28GpStHM9BZPnXnu7V6W8Ocug.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0276820',7.1,1228,'de','Berlin is in Germany','When Martin, a former GDR citizen, is released from jail, he lately becomes confronted with the consequences of the German re-unification.','/vsejIOb5nxF0vJf5RtU6O5u1Dg2.jpg','2001-11-01',97,'Released',NULL,'Berlin is in Germany',211,1.6935,5.5,'iNgtmGG5FYQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16750,_binary '\0','/tGYwQCwqmfDbkLUq18RAxE0VE9q.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0276830',5.2,11544,'en','Blueberry','U.S Marshal Mike Donovan has dark memories of the death of his first love. He keeps peace between the Americans and the natives who had temporarily adopted and taken care of him. The evil actions of a white sorcerer lead him to confront the villain in the Sacred Mountains, and, through shamanic rituals conquer his fears and uncover a suppressed memory he would much rather deny.','/zDq2epiQUALGfYum0ijn51Re41o.jpg','2004-02-09',124,'Released','The devil you know.','Blueberry',10046,3.2396,4.841,'oBdYQloJ0as','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16751,_binary '\0','/r3xsFBD1VTUusk393bBc7SsDUJe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0276919',8,168950,'en','Dogville','A woman on the run from the mob is reluctantly accepted in a small Colorado community in exchange for labor, but when a search visits the town, she learns that their support has a price.','/lraVawavIXh5geMlVjpzCw9TGwR.jpg','2003-05-21',178,'Released','A quiet little town not far from here.','Dogville',553,7.9562,7.7,'J5-LqwUHTaM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16752,_binary '\0','/giIjwz5zyMJgkEBJ3o5A0BrconN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0276935',6.8,2994,'ja','エレクトリック·ドラゴン 80000V','A violent, guitar-playing, electrically charged boxer faces off against an electronic wizard half-merged with a metallic Buddha.','/t3smBnPMubO1Ket7KjpRtxwxlSt.jpg','2001-02-08',55,'Released',NULL,'Electric Dragon 80000V',27245,1.9286,6.9,'0dDdDugEO2Y','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16753,_binary '\0','/nMW4zQvosS3qUvML5kbjMvgETd1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0277027',7.6,163591,'en','I Am Sam','Sam, a neurodivergent man, has a daughter with a homeless woman who abandons them when they leave the hospital, leaving Sam to raise Lucy on his own. But as Lucy grows up, Sam\'s limitations as a parent start to become a problem and the authorities take her away. Sam convinces high-priced lawyer Rita to take his case pro bono and in turn teaches her the value of love and family.','/3MUXRSyx9gnA2lLSSTGLN8cQQ42.jpg','2001-12-28',132,'Released','Love is all you need.','I Am Sam',10950,8.4733,7.6,'z_AguDqCBvo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16754,_binary '\0','/nZSUgauXlVUrJGdGUGWMXCtnZx4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0277296',5.5,152808,'en','The Scorpion King','In ancient Egypt, peasant Mathayus is hired to exact revenge on the powerful Memnon and the sorceress Cassandra, who are ready to overtake Balthazar\'s village. Amid betrayals, thieves, abductions and more, Mathayus strives to bring justice to his complicated world.','/aITIsX20tACn6jgtyDcCYpRT216.jpg','2002-04-18',92,'Released','Warrior. Legend. King.','The Scorpion King',9334,14.295,5.6,'5c_6HUA9FAY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16755,_binary '\0','/eaVd8klHZKNR3JKQgLoAju2yGJj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0277327',7.3,8939,'de','So weit die Füße tragen','The German soldier Clemens Forel - determined to be reunited with his beloved family - makes a dramatic escape through bitter cold winters, desolate landscapes, and life threatening ventures from a Siberian labor camp after World War II. 8000 miles and three endless years of uncertainty later, he is finally about to reach his destination... An edge of your seat drama that celebrates the power of the human spirit and the force of will, while inspired and impowered by love.','/bSZTNaN7OqeRw1CT4hhcaw8imcP.jpg','2001-12-12',158,'Released',NULL,'As Far As My Feet Will Carry Me',11476,3.3102,7.2,'pG2Xi18ArxA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16756,_binary '\0','/lyf1jjoMD1Pe7KD6KKEqL4Owgeb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0277371',5.8,128486,'en','Not Another Teen Movie','On a bet, a gridiron hero at John Hughes High School sets out to turn a bespectacled plain Jane into a beautiful and popular prom queen in this outrageous send-up of the teen movies of the 1980s and \'90s.','/9ZaGxvj1mqdKVLpSloq4mzS7SK6.jpg','2001-12-07',89,'Released','They served you Breakfast. They gave you Pie. Now we’re gonna stuff your face.','Not Another Teen Movie',11397,11.3316,5.823,'f1sbQf58B50','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16757,_binary '\0','/7VYpAMHOK1EKpBhbZ54nIenprQs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0277412',3.6,1550,'en','Unspeakable','Despite vocal objections from Warden Blakely, prison psychologist Diana Purlow journeys deep inside the mind of serial killer Jesse Mowat in a desperate attempt to reveal the source of his psychotic tendencies.','/fb7rwndnd68QK3qX2GfYKvAs8v4.jpg','2003-12-01',108,'Released','Get ready for the trip of your life','Unspeakable',33308,2.2901,3.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16758,_binary '\0','/sGDXh6QU6CRqHVXfoYOBwqEnBVO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0277434',7.2,161133,'en','We Were Soldiers','The year is 1965 and America is at war with North Vietnam. Commanding the air cavalry is Lt. Col. Hal Moore (Gibson), a born leader committed to his troops. His target: the Ia Drang Valley, called \"The Valley of Death.\" As Moore prepares for one of the most violent battles in U.S. history, he delivers a stirring promise to his soldiers and their families: \"I will leave no man behind...dead or alive. We will all come home together.\"','/nzeSYldx7wIrwycLKHKHTTUJNWh.jpg','2002-03-01',138,'Released','Father, Husband, Brother. No Man is Just a Soldier.','We Were Soldiers',10590,10.5885,7.139,'HnLHmGzByPA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16759,_binary '\0','/5M3Hvwwi0hWcJglYakDUOO11uAy.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0277605',6.4,2944,'cn','生化壽屍','A group of young shoppers and employees must band together when a zombie outbreak overruns their shopping center.','/s7SjozBaxLoiD8JEhiwIgCGW2oK.jpg','1998-06-11',94,'Released',NULL,'Bio Zombie',24916,2.3708,5.9,'XB0SHD6KcAk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16760,_binary '\0','/nBLRUI675C2ALC7mWByI9DAU8iP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0277703',3.5,1222,'de','Feuer, Eis & Dosenbier','Two friends who are doing civil service flee to the Austrian Alps to escape being forced into the army. While there, one of them rediscovers his past and they realise that it\'s going to be more fun than they thought.','/p29vqeWk9aEDBxMPP8rDsry8h84.jpg','2002-02-21',83,'Released',NULL,'Feuer, Eis & Dosenbier',9274,1.4752,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16761,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0277705',5.8,1390,'en','Final','Waking up in a nearly empty room, Bill has strange recollections of his father\'s death and a car crash, and occasional paranoid delusions. Ann, a psychologist, tries to help him make sense of it all.','/ubpAhxDc7E42O6QaaBtNR10ZwWP.jpg','2001-06-08',111,'Released',NULL,'Final',21176,0.9899,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16762,_binary '\0','/ozN3eNz6bOBm35VFxfKo8WOY3b7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0277744',5.2,1559,'en','Dead Heat','Boston cop Pally is forced into early retirement, putting a strain on his marriage. Pally\'s stepbrother, Ray, attempts to lift his spirits by tipping him off to a sure-bet racehorse. But their attempts to secure the champion equine are thwarted by a local mob boss, who steals the horse as repayment for a gambling debt. With their investment on the line, Pally and Ray become entangled in a web of underworld crime and murder.','/oRFKEQ67NuFPTYMqsGTKtlSQ9Pb.jpg','2002-07-23',120,'Released','All Bets Are Off.','Dead Heat',20053,2.1043,5.5,'3TXFFIRVbvE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16763,_binary '\0','/qhzr6VAHd6WLtLpzqRwwxVZWY0m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0277909',6.6,1464,'en','Mutant Aliens','An unlikely crew – an astronaut, his intrepid daughter, and a quintet of sympathetic, albeit violent, alien creatures – seek revenge against a space industry baron.','/f6doYuJsaciPllLKy2VGWGLWXaV.jpg','2002-06-14',81,'Released','They\'re freaks coming to kick your butt!','Mutant Aliens',30863,1.8601,6.2,'3WGmJTNBF4k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16764,_binary '\0','/s7InPuEqbxTjuLUpIZeBX3R9uEA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0277941',6.4,29428,'en','Ned Kelly','After getting threatened by Kelly\'s friends and family, Constable Fitzpatrick places the blame on Ned Kelly and exaggerates what happened. With the biggest ever award available, Kelly and his gang set into the wild, to remain hidden from everyone who seeks them. Even if it means having his family arrested, the members of the Kelly Gang stay hidden and plan a way to get their names cleared.','/xmGQsMbXKELzD4n78uMoCsgJPi4.jpg','2003-03-22',110,'Released','The British Empire branded them as outlaws. The oppressed called them heroes.','Ned Kelly',10544,4.4749,6,'IdpcBIP7bvg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16765,_binary '\0','/zjEBmHV0T8KBetyIn5UmQIjKmB0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0278006',7.6,3313,'fa','سگ کشی','Golrokh, an Iranian author, struggles to settle her husband\'s debts caused by a business partner who left him to bear the consequences.','/kyrz64BOad6OmavwPW2R6EN4NYO.jpg','2001-02-07',143,'Released',NULL,'Killing Mad Dogs',266215,1.7303,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16766,_binary '\0','/tgD2ZK7y7DHWp9vw19GdHAQwWKd.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0278035',5.4,1267,'en','Shooters','Gilly comes out of prison after serving a six year stretch and decides that he will now turn his life around and go straight. But when he returns to his South London home and visits his old colleague J, in hope of obtaining his share of the proceeds from the job that landed him inside, J soon talks him into getting involved in one last scam.','/5H5iKhQol6opEhAn9ETYV2eQipE.jpg','2002-01-25',91,'Released',NULL,'Shooters',154219,1.6811,5.3,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16767,_binary '\0','/lajItWGSKuyHiFtMkJGFrLEGndU.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','t