ir sexual exploration begins, we notice Timo may not be as casual as he initially seemed and Diana on the other hand contains hidden strength. And so we realize there\'s more to \'Swingers\' than just sex. Swingers: could your relationship stand the test?','/cEIVkvx6mGSjnkOxlXh6eHd1Y4K.jpg','2002-10-01',93,'Released',NULL,'Swingers',93685,11.0592,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16940,_binary '\0','/ijTs2lWO8GPfGkziZfnjDRrv69x.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0284595',7.3,2149,'ru','В августе 44-го','The movie is set in Belarus, where a team of counter-intelligence officers is given only three days to find a German radio operator posing as a Soviet soldier, behind soviet lines, on the eve of a major offensive.','/dUX5I24hILFV0jZfFIHS0Qr3UBi.jpg','2001-05-04',109,'Released',NULL,'In August of 1944',64745,1.7744,6.283,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16941,_binary '\0','/fHa7RqZ1xtFOVYw7wXjXBxgPgzH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0284655',5.8,3334,'en','WiseGirls','Meg, Raychel and Kate are three waitresses at a restaurant frequented by mob bosses. Their lives become complicated when one of the women witnesses a crime, and the three friends suddenly find themselves entangled in their customers’ dangerous world.','/lUNOBEKNsa3vhRuPE3FDDoUHzOr.jpg','2002-12-06',96,'Released','These waitresses are about to turn the tables on The Mob.','WiseGirls',41209,1.8259,5.5,'YnG2zpGtkJ8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16942,_binary '\0','/tu5k0Trq86eFP2d7U9XzaHVu2lv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0284674',4.4,5177,'en','Pauly Shore Is Dead','Hollywood comedian/actor Pauly Shore loses everything: his house, nobody in Hollywood wants to represent him, he moves back home with his mom and is now parking cars at the Comedy Store. Then one night when he\'s up in his mom\'s loft, a dead famous comedian appears who tells Pauly to kill himself cause he\'ll go down as a comedic genius who died before his time. Pauly then fakes his own death, and the media goes crazy.','/e5o7LfDgSKurbBQTw6lL1pouKDQ.jpg','2003-03-11',82,'Released','Hollywood Will Never Be the Same','Pauly Shore Is Dead',27202,3.7454,4.4,'dVWsbV4OsIE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16943,_binary '\0','/l7oR2yVjfRWFEg4mBpuT1fVZ4P4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0284714',7.2,2404,'en','The Cat in the Hat','In a marvelously animated version of one of the most beloved of all Dr. Seuss tales, two youngsters find themselves at home with nothing to do on a rainy afternoon. But when the magical, mischievous Cat in the Hat arrives on the scene, they\'re all cat-apulted into a day of rousing, romping, outlandish antics they - and you - will never forget!','/uKHm41DzzC4VoDwLZDU9PBYj6ue.jpg','1971-03-10',24,'Released','Everyone Loves This World Famous Cat Who Pulls Magic And Music Right Out Of His Hat!','The Cat in the Hat',43580,1.923,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16944,_binary '\0','/mluEecJSwG0Pes0MfqmZ1XpfrZV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0284811',5,1776,'hi','Aarzoo','After her fiance, Vijay, is killed in a crash, a pregnant Pooja agrees to marry Amar, her childhood friend who has always loved her. But her life takes yet another turn when Vijay returns to her life.','/zdc5t0OFKFDU54qObcvsW7q7tnx.jpg','1999-03-18',163,'Released',NULL,'Aarzoo',232708,1.1495,5.667,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16945,_binary '\0','/qqfUWCjLlDLiSlCZ12SFoTGG6Xp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0284815',7.2,4147,'ko','수취인불명','Romances end in blood and the frail hopes of individuals are torn apart in a vile karmic continuity of colonialism, civil war and occupation. After surviving Japanese colonization, Korea became the first war zone of the Cold War. The legacy of war remains today in this divided country.','/5vnW8ggyUyZucOVFANdgw2O1pCk.jpg','2001-06-02',117,'Released','Innocence is a casualty of war.','Address Unknown',25650,2.027,7.1,'aI8rUnjhFc8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 1