3Yci3r3A.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0285175',5.4,22276,'en','Havoc','A wealthy Los Angeles teen and her superficial friends wants to break out of suburbia and experience Southern California\'s \"gangsta\" lifestyle. But problems arise when the preppies get in over their heads and provoke the wrath of a violent Latino gang. Suddenly, their role-playing seems a little too real.','/xY4c4bHPCRrwIvkxJ6qRLoyxQVo.jpg','2005-10-16',86,'Released','Too much is never enough.','Havoc',14695,5.0245,5.3,'pVy-sO3KHH0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16954,_binary '\0','/q3XAe77oga8zCH8G6d8T4izEPZ6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0285441',7.4,7093,'iu','ᐊᑕᓈᕐᔪᐊᑦ','Based on a local legend and set in an unknown era, it deals with universal themes of love, possessiveness, family, jealousy and power. Beautifully shot, and acted by Inuit people, it portrays a time when people fought duels by taking turns to punch each other until one was unconscious, made love on the way to the caribou hunt, ate walrus meat and lit their igloos with seal-oil lamps.','/jSGiFOTwosoiAAXLTLHtzMUCVUN.jpg','2002-02-01',172,'Released',NULL,'Atanarjuat: The Fast Runner',13245,2.0514,6.8,'Z9mrR0hu-Eo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16955,_binary '\0','/pVangQxphypCeoH84BY2yq8svMZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0285462',4.9,33664,'en','Boat Trip','Two guys whose love lives are a wreck look forward to finding ladies on the high seas. Unfortunately, they\'ve mistakenly been booked on a gay cruise.','/xHFJt9nEfVIUItBfKZr7qhbgveL.jpg','2002-10-01',94,'Released','Singles Cruise. Double Trouble.','Boat Trip',9557,5.1231,5.236,'KyOAP2UIgz4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16956,_binary '\0','/zJqv6s4XCdHWrnoqfLqlGzzxSjH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0285492',5.5,72248,'en','Cube 2: Hypercube','Eight strangers awaken with no memory, in a puzzling cube-shaped room where the laws of physics do not always apply.','/bEqqwtwUP7lm56VyeVONhv9Jt