tight politician. The only problem now is that her long-lost father is engaged to a fiercely territorial social climber with a daughter who makes Daphne\'s life miserable.','/gGpMruX59KWNuAXgHpiAm8hiChw.jpg','2003-03-27',105,'Released','Trying to fit in. Born to stand out.','What a Girl Wants',10735,10.7489,6.3,'rayI38YhpEc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16995,_binary '\0','/h807xfXuKq8fTJOzkrX4eimkWi9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0286797',6.5,2150,'cn','瘦身男女','A depressed, obese woman tries to lose weight in order to win back her ex-boyfriend with the help of a fellow Hong Konger whom she met in Japan.','/eCbmHKAfJd7xoFPmhTvCJVSFyHE.jpg','2001-06-21',94,'Released',NULL,'Love on a Diet',43152,1.479,6.1,'NmDHblkVvhU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16996,_binary '\0','/uOELfO3p02u60ApwmTWy4FH4xJB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0286855',6.4,1705,'en','Now You Know','On the eve of his bachelor party, a man learns his fiancee wants to call off the wedding. The unmarried couple returns to New Jersey to sort out their relationship.','/2hvvPtuZ1NjMqqtVXVE8xVFp4G5.jpg','2002-09-20',102,'Released',NULL,'Now You Know',31821,1.5874,5.1,'SsGTyiViwr8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16997,_binary '\0','/4ZaLVGIDmRa8LA0PCfdWkahbfmD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0286947',5.9,7365,'en','Scorched','Three mischievous employees of a bank in a small deserted town all make plans to rob it at the same time, however none of them knows about the others.','/bIBHeN4GkkNx0TBSiqGdqLSf4fd.jpg','2003-05-17',95,'Released','How many tellers does it take to rob a bank?','Scorched',4613,2.9433,5.5,'CpX0BwFzLaM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16998,_binary '\0','/dqIFuxkODykKrMT2rFe3iNMFmTF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0287015',7.5,1871,'tr','Teyzem','Üftade has long been the object of men’s fury. Her only hope is to marry the young man she is in love with and escape her traumatic life in the home of her abusive stepfather. However, when her lover suddenly leaves her, Üftade\'s despair increases exponentially, and she begins to lose her mental balance due to the traumas of her childhood. Throughout the years, her suffering is witnessed by her nephew, who feels helpless to do anything about her condition.','/vFq4PPEsoc309Go8yunRtoy7r1c.jpg','1986-10-01',107,'Released','Destruction of dreams.','My Aunt',300207,0.8286,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(16999,_binary '\0','/jQkfL8doOKCbwLuIlivQfamjj0m.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0287300',8,4239,'tr','Aile Şerefi','Rıza is a father of 5, who has economical problems but happy nevertheless. Everything changes when his younger son gets hit by a car.','/ag9HHfUeWvbBq9NLgv10e3DZ7ZK.jpg','1976-09-07',95,'Released',NULL,'Family Honour',157570,0.7821,7.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17000,_binary '\0','/r8Z9IEPsqvuMudFf9JsB2snQokm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0287322',7.2,1373,'ar','الأفوكاتو','After getting sentenced with one month in prison for contempt of court, the lawyer Sbankh tries to take advantage of his jail time to establish many relations, most notably with drug dealer Hassouna,and Salim Abu Zaid, one of the centers of power in the 60s.','/nqJgxyyvboG045t1g7ZE7qeFlcT.jpg','1983-11-01',108,'Released',NULL,'The Lawyer',193578,0.815,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17001,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0287425',6,2111,'en','Emmett\'s Mark','In the Philadelphia police department, Emmett Young is a hotshot, a workaholic newly promoted to homicide. He learns he has a disease that will soon kill him painfully, so he hires a stranger to arrange his own death. With one eye on the calendar (he\'s allowed a few days\' grace before his murder), he pursues a final case, the serial killing of young women. Emmett develops a profile of the assailant. Meanwhile, his fixer hires an ex-cop to kill Emmett, a lonely security guard whom the fixer taunts and belittles. In this limited time, can Emmett sort out what\'s important?','/z33ANbYqbxQWqQ4bsMFSl8dRIHl.jpg','2002-04-13',104,'Released','In order to avoid the debilitating effects of a terminal illness, a young detective orders a hit on himself.','Killing Emmett Young',33625,1.4896,5.4,'6z88tTYF6GY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17002,_binary '\0','/v8LqggHSNHwkmj0dBa0Sz4YgefC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0287457',7.1,1578,'en','Genesis','An African narrator tells the story of earth history, the birth of the universe and evolution of life. Beautiful imagery makes this movie documentary complete.','/vWFaFIgIpfqwhzyyRSOAoehc6wn.jpg','2004-09-26',77,'Released',NULL,'Genesis',31190,2.0088,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17003,_binary '\0','/rknvDtxOe1uqLX0EFWLHIQxRXcJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0287467',7.9,121187,'es','Hable con ella','Two men share an odd friendship while they care for two women who are both in deep comas.','/fWDbQlOWOqjR5jZm98KjGyYmUOw.jpg','2002-03-15',112,'Released',NULL,'Talk to Her',64,5.8826,7.6,'XwJGTuxj1t0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17004,_binary '\0','/m4OpHCXlPjwZ0WJEwM3oUy5HO06.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0287471',7.1,3703,'he','חתונה מאוחרת','Zaza is a 31-year old Israeli bachelor, handsome and intelligent, and his family wants to see him married. But tradition dictates that Zaza has to choose a young virgin. She must be beautiful and from a good family, preferably rich. Zaza\'s parents, Yasha and Lily drag Zaza to meet potential brides and their families. Zaza has no choice. He plays along with his family, advocates of the suffocating traditions of their Georgian Jewish heritage. But Zaza always manages to somehow get out of being engaged. What his parents don\'t know is that Zaza is already in love. Judith is sensuous, strong and intriguing. She\'s also a divorcée with a 6-year-old daughter. So Zaza has kept Judith a secret from his family. He will have to choose between respect of the strict confines of family and tradition, or the love of his life.','/9IcQsfhjfQamVvRgtpYkwdIKilw.jpg','2001-10-24',102,'Released',NULL,'Late Marriage',49680,1.5223,6.3,'Hq2lyuWmjCE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17005,_binary '\0','/rv2Q55chxmt37aeJQReWC9V2uyc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0287497',2.9,1471,'en','Infested','Horror tale of insects which eat their victims from the inside out.','/vopnye2ckkJFQCeoMp3BSB7mPJn.jpg','2002-10-18',80,'Released',NULL,'Infested',69437,2.2436,4.6,'g_zz74J1_Xk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17006,_binary '\0','/6Qxl17SKyxPBsmf6yGLCOEnFenA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0287535',7,8927,'en','The Lost Battalion','Fact-based war drama about an American battalion of over 500 men which gets trapped behind enemy lines in the Argonne Forest in October 1918 France during the closing weeks of World War I.','/kNnozLnF3YivsGGyGEgUiKaO4pT.jpg','2001-12-02',92,'Released','Caught between two lines of fire, the Germans gave them two options: surrender or die. They chose a third.','The Lost Battalion',35583,3.6799,6.7,'8E5FV9er7lQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17007,_binary '\0','/7PCHxCidw9EpAy4KkxjRkiRVfEO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0287537',6,2001,'hi','लव के लिये कुछ भी करेगा','Desperate for money, three men plot to kidnap a woman and hold her for ransom.','/kv0tSZciZhiMscuvhobJWGiXSS5.jpg','2001-06-21',139,'Released',NULL,'Love Ke Liye Kuch Bhi Karega',142631,1.0655,5.636,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17008,_binary '\0','/lnwNzJdU4gMlgoQlaT8HgSI2OpD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0287635',5.8,10613,'ja','劇場版ポケットモンスター セレビィ 時を超えた遭遇','In order to escape a greedy Pokémon hunter, Celebi must use the last of its energy to travel through time to the present day. Celebi brings along Sammy, a boy who had been trying to protect it. Along with Ash, Pikachu, and the rest of the gang, Sammy and Celebi must encounter an enemy far more advanced than the hunter, with the fate of the forest hanging in the balance.','/thz83PS9twtVBEEAM59J1bh75nU.jpg','2001-07-07',80,'Released','Best friends. Better heroes.','Pokémon 4Ever',12600,5.1733,6.5,'JRDRRhRQc0M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17009,_binary '\0','/knHrNkdS4PZqjSeCp3e90Wh7iqF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0287645',6.9,1684,'en','Rain','Janey is on vacation with her family at their beach house on the Mahurangi Peninsula in New Zealand. Her parents, Ed and Kate, are on the verge of divorce and sit around drinking whiskey all day, while Janey and Jim are left to their own devices. Cady, a local boaty who is having an affair with Kate, catches Janey\'s pubescent eye.','/56TiWd7pdzYuFzObofLbKhFff7T.jpg','2001-09-01',92,'Released','Be careful what your heart desires.','Rain',69324,1.0297,5.7,'efUN6kXgNJk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17010,_binary '\0','/5rKa5UKXnTdLsgY0mJbjAEQX3gB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0287717',5.3,78544,'en','Spy Kids 2: The Island of Lost Dreams','Exploring the further adventures of Carmen and Juni Cortez, who have now joined the family spy business as Level 2 OSS agents. Their new mission is to save the world from a mad scientist living on a volcanic island populated by an imaginative menagerie of creatures. On this bizarre island, none of the Cortez\'s gadgets work and they must rely on their wits--and each other--to survive and save the day.','/z8pfWCk6SlxxDLXXQdUHdxF5dwJ.jpg','2002-08-07',100,'Released','Little spies. Big attitudes.','Spy Kids 2: The Island of Lost Dreams',9488,13.4752,5.653,'RLkRbj8sv8E','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17011,_binary '\0','/oBQbANT75d5wsXIDIfi4KHZdrrq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0287733',4.9,1491,'en','Straight Into Darkness','The movie encompasses several different elements-the perils of war, a touch of macabre, sadness and redemption.','/4s4WmLgoxyVSjQg4UGecsaYSJW1.jpg','2004-01-01',95,'Released',NULL,'Straight Into Darkness',41849,0.0837,4.565,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17012,_binary '\0','/vP2kYhUZVMiZIZ9KSINp485A7oK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0287803',7.5,8825,'tr','Yazgı','Musa, a customs clerk, sees life as absurd. He drifts with events; his mother\'s death, though loved, brings him strange joy.','/qGG8UlkKCS5l4qbYcx7hzfJ8yde.jpg','2001-02-01',119,'Released',NULL,'Fate',41187,1.9011,7.243,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17013,_binary '\0','/xnBlbL2B9np0hiNYZUR4ccEmHbv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0287934',6.7,2531,'zh','大腕','Don Tyler, a famous film-maker, falls ill on the sets of his movie. Fascinated by the funereal traditions of China, he requests a cameraman named Yoyo to arrange a grand, comedic funeral for him.','/tI8YbogKmyul9UXeA01fcZ12mVO.jpg','2001-12-21',100,'Released',NULL,'Big Shot\'s Funeral',77633,2.2618,6.6,'FW7R171iEA0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17014,_binary '\0','/9ZekNmaB2maM7ZrOtE1oppz7SVo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0287963',6,5760,'fr','Choses secrètes','Two young women find themselves struggling to survive in Paris, street-wise Nathalie, a stripper, and naïve Sandrine, a barmaid. Together, they discover that sex can be used to their advantage, and pleasure.','/8OVBix4F2qUdb8e128jBu1EJUw0.jpg','2002-10-16',115,'Released',NULL,'Secret Things',35712,2.3238,5.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17015,_binary '\0','/e7jIX02GiSwsgkU5lMpeKjwq2Zc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0287978',5.3,242267,'en','Daredevil','By day, blind attorney Matt Murdock toils for justice in Hell\'s Kitchen. By night, he\'s Daredevil, The Man Without Fear - a powerful, masked vigilante stalking the dark streets with an uncanny \"radar sense\" that allows him to \"see\" with superhuman capabilities. But when the love of his life, fiery Elektra Natchios, is targeted by New York City\'s ruthless Kingpin of crime and his deadly assassin Bullseye, Daredevil may be about to meet his match.','/oCDBwSkntYamuw8VJIxMRCtDBmi.jpg','2003-02-14',103,'Released','When the streets have gone to Hell, have faith in the devil.','Daredevil',9480,13.5542,5.3,'t3Xc6FjRfoA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17016,_binary '\0','/oApWODJ1tPnZvI7f3CVpIcIFBw9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0287986',5.2,2576,'fr','Dieu est grand, je suis toute petite','Michèle, 20 years old, feels terrible after having broken up with her boy-friend. She meets Francois, who\'s a veterinarian and jewish. Michèle decides to convert into Judaism because she has to believe in something, if not in someone.','/jl0JxTK0r3H8K7GIpSQyKYfULpM.jpg','2001-09-26',100,'Released','Is it faith or just a fad?','God Is Great and I\'m Not',27204,1.7982,4.531,'FO6ZRaSzzcw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17017,_binary '\0','/m4nFWLNnY8p8mmi3MXjoIVEDaIj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0288036',7.7,1621,'tr','Hanım','An elderly piano teacher recently diagnosed with terminal cancer lives in fear of death. But her real fear is who will take care of her cat, her only friend, after her death. As she tries to find someone to take care of her cat, the generational clash of the times and the drastically changing urban identity of Istanbul confront her with an unpleasant prospect.','/1tK1HRGaClADULCeHHEiMiEUb1Y.jpg','1988-03-03',102,'Released',NULL,'Madame',239296,0.8204,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17018,_binary '\0','/533o6HpRqtdCCOiCitICyUSFJCj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0288045',5.2,46643,'en','The Medallion','A Hong Kong detective suffers a fatal accident involving a mysterious medallion and is transformed into an immortal warrior with superhuman powers.','/lbjFWKfe8WdS8Pj6WVPlyEKeVEo.jpg','2003-08-15',88,'Released','Follow the mystery. Fight the enemy. Discover the power of The Medallion.','The Medallion',10610,8.0913,5.648,'n8JP2Zh7Www','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17019,_binary '\0','/5OzFpCPy7wOj3s096blYMzT11Nn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0288243',3.6,2208,'en','Taboo','Six young adults struggle with their personal demons while staying at a secluded mansion during a dark and stormy night where a seemingly innocent game of \'taboo\' brings out their inter-most secrets which soon leads to murder.','/2eNwSS38g40j1JDoe6cCu2eoG1n.jpg','2002-01-14',80,'Released','Would you ever...?','Taboo',97206,2.5501,4,'oCUfpNDlFIY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17020,_binary '\0','/8QFuCy9fjcI6wm02fxFkJOjktRz.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0288330',7.5,3924,'cs','Želary','A nurse and her surgeon-lover are part of a resistance movement in 1940s Czechoslovakia. When they are discovered, her lover flees and she must find a place to hide. A patient whose life she saved, a man from a remote mountain village where time stopped 150 years ago, agrees to hide her as his wife.','/s4jFr3bnf8d5WYCSrf0N3e7G9ez.jpg','2003-09-04',150,'Released',NULL,'Zelary',19765,1.3222,6.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17021,_binary '\0','/ycWeCUOwWpAeyGeEfkiF4FGcBOV.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0288439',7.7,13495,'en','Bang Bang You\'re Dead','A troubled and bullied high school student fights against judgement from his community after threatening to bomb the football team.','/647kfvUPkDBXtIHQEhInJR2LUyX.jpg','2003-06-11',89,'Released','What some kids keep inside is beyond words','Bang Bang You\'re Dead',16876,2.7444,7.114,'2WTij_Dzq98','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17022,_binary '\0','/r4yVwsLF2pJr4C50pWizn9fYNbF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0288477',5.6,119264,'en','Ghost Ship','After discovering a passenger ship missing since 1962 floating adrift on the Bering Sea, salvagers claim the vessel as their own. Once they begin towing the ghost ship towards harbor, a series of bizarre occurrences happen and the group becomes trapped inside the ship, which they soon learn is inhabited by a demonic creature.','/qT9jhRnf67dmMNpX2FmNPMeuW57.jpg','2002-10-25',91,'Released','Sea evil.','Ghost Ship',9645,11.4245,6.015,'_RlzNBlMQpY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17023,_binary '\0','/eDZj78igJ02gWzh1xQQIBB17kun.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0288491',7.1,1643,'pl','Cześć, Tereska','Teenager Tereska comes from poor family and has to face difficult world and mean people around her.','/slHR2b0q5U9TnLBRmq2LcdNwGlv.jpg','2001-09-28',86,'Released',NULL,'Hi, Tereska',144541,0.7907,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17024,_binary '\0','/eNByAjPBAUypnQdZGx2VrEIIKW7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0288569',6.8,2055,'es','Iluminados por el fuego','A war veteran, haunted by the horrors of war and the experiences he shared with fellow soldiers drafted to the battlefront as an 18-year-old conscript, is forced to confront the memories of his past after a former comrade attempts suicide. 20 years after the war, he finally attempts to reconnect with his past to begin to heal his old wounds.','/mZyOHAWLvtdl39IwzAvZuJHcqL6.jpg','2005-09-08',100,'Released',NULL,'Blessed by Fire',60435,1.2367,7.2,'c3Pyou7P4DU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17025,_binary '\0','/1Ki8BBKYnmFBVMbiFpDSH423EdH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0288861',7.1,5074,'nl','Van God Los','Two small town Dutch boys whose socially unnatural friendship is so close, they care nothing for human or divine rules and lose all grip on reality, sliding into violent crime.','/7cgVJg6dnS8NYXZ1jck2T68WYJh.jpg','2003-04-24',90,'Released','Rock Hard and In Your Face','Godforsaken!',15525,1.6374,6.238,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17026,_binary '\0','/17nzLJMOCWw3koUhAuEO7KGpPnD.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0288869',5.8,1250,'es','Vidas privadas','Carmen Uranga is a 42 year-old woman who after 20 years jurisdiction of her native country (Argentina), she returns to solve a family problem related with the inheritance that her sick father wants to leave him. Their return trip results in the unavoidable memories of the torture that that was object during the dictatorship and a dramatic revelation.','/m10YpsCTCaEw7rSVGo8a4Q9LNQ.jpg','2001-03-24',97,'Released',NULL,'Private Lives',126975,1.3155,4.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17027,_binary '\0','/aJFwk1clMal1prxAvKAgHxKPAf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0289043',7.5,555870,'en','28 Days Later','Twenty-eight days after a killer virus was accidentally unleashed from a British research facility, a small group of London survivors are caught in a desperate struggle to protect themselves from the infected. Carried by animals and humans, the virus turns those it infects into homicidal maniacs -- and it\'s absolutely impossible to contain.','/sQckQRt17VaWbo39GIu0TMOiszq.jpg','2002-10-31',113,'Released','The days are numbered.','28 Days Later',170,25.194,7.245,'mWEhfF27O0c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17028,_binary '\0','/j1xGWkNCBP3ozPJdgzOIgaOpXQv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0289054',6.7,3101,'ja','赤い橋の下のぬるい水','A down-and-out businessman travels to a seaside town, where he meets a woman with unusual sexual powers.','/brUlHtuwXvHCmRUyDPKCRwH8xYY.jpg','2001-11-03',119,'Released',NULL,'Warm Water Under a Red Bridge',44768,2.7082,6.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17029,_binary '\0','/pEzTV5VoEjgCtQypIejfxCajiS3.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0289080',7.4,1950,'ar','أيام السادات','A biopic depicting the life of the late Egyptian president Anwar Sadat, following his early life, his political and military achievements, and his assassination during the Cairo annual victory parade.','/i9fLdlYNxiFhCZOgwuhmlIPvbfE.jpg','2001-06-26',166,'Released',NULL,'Days of El Sadat',28944,0.8255,7.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17030,_binary '\0','/uBHNItEzK2OqBb7goGDRXOV47Ru.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0289181',7.5,6618,'ko','파이란','After losing both her parents, Failan emmigrates to Korea to seek her only remaining relatives. Once she reaches Korea, she finds out that her relatives have moved to Canada well over a year ago. Desperate to stay and make a living in Korea, Failan is forced to have an arranged marriage through a match-making agency.','/3DG3eUhXyV0bVOuw3V0a1nIy7Jh.jpg','2001-04-28',115,'Released','Their paths cross by chance but the love lives on forever…','Failan',18704,2.0312,7.209,'CdqjO3gcHmw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17031,_binary '\0','/zuN52geFnpIzSmIBIwmarPg1W68.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0289195',5.9,1316,'da','Fukssvansen','Dennis and Carl are brothers who live on a small farm in the country. None too bright, Dennis wants a girlfriend for Christmas. Carl makes sure that Dennis gets just that when he meets Rita at the local pub. She is on the run from her husband and she doesn\'t turn down the chance to hide away at Carl and Dennis\'s place.','/aVgVztECEGRqnlrvXDJIX0QgsF4.jpg','2001-11-02',90,'Released',NULL,'Chop Chop',15955,1.506,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17032,_binary '\0','/fm8ca5ID0dwrKB4ZTW5EcgEjvph.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0289229',7,4155,'hu','Hukkle','Using almost no dialogue, the film follows a number of residents (both human and animal) of a small rural community in Hungary – an old man with hiccups, a shepherdess and her sheep, an old woman who may or may not be up to no good, some folk-singers at a wedding, etc. While most of the film is a series of vignettes, there is a sinister and often barely perceptible subplot involving murder.','/nngXEPKlfA9PfCrscN4Xjvwx0W.jpg','2002-10-24',78,'Released',NULL,'Hukkle',35848,0.9276,6.8,'WpG5f9VtJFM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17033,_binary '\0','/aBpJiueAc504nqU7F8sDIl6qaLe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0289320',7.2,2541,'ro','Marfa și banii','A young man from Constanța who has his own business aims to expand, but he doesn\'t have the resources.','/wwNz