','/gHpENTQtWJun7wLXYkwpJtjKuyL.jpg','1999-06-12',110,'Released','Even now, the curse of video continues.','The Ring Virus',37576,1.3704,5.1,'J1dbw0zCx_c','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17037,_binary '\0','/ojcnSztiM3N2Bv1Jy0OVK7t5JfO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0289432',6.9,2558,'it','Santa Maradona','An aimless college graduate jumping from one job interview to another — killing time in between with his wisecracking and deadbeat room-mate — falls in love with an actress.','/fYuwnWK4TN1EVB8RiGbNps5cyBr.jpg','2001-10-26',96,'Released',NULL,'Santa Maradona',56899,0.9771,7.025,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17038,_binary '\0','/bHqIHC1sK5CzAS2XkF1jbyuS4ww.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0289635',6.3,15418,'en','Young Adam','A young drifter working on a river barge disrupts his employers\' lives while hiding the fact that he knows more about a dead woman found in the river than he admits.','/rU5GJ5r4tQbSx9C2ENKbPkD6nr9.jpg','2003-09-26',93,'Released','Everyone has a past. Everyone has a secret.','Young Adam',237,4.7683,5.9,'V4LexLpsGxQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17039,_binary '\0','/7c65xpnYlea6VITznLLRS9cTuwS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0289765',7.2,314192,'en','Red Dragon','Former FBI Agent Will Graham, who was once almost killed by the savage Hannibal \'The Cannibal\' Lecter, now has no choice but to face him again, as it seems Lecter is the only one who can help Graham track down a new serial killer.','/ou9ZKA2cms02b7CdCdVqGkKu0O0.jpg','2002-10-02',124,'Released','To understand the origin of evil, you must go back to the beginning.','Red Dragon',9533,2.7911,7.049,'zLcI8OFyNUo','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17040,_binary '\0','/hAsQqSqvHtW4Q3f2woE0nMbTp2f.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0289782',8,1352,'ja','軍旗はためく下に','A war widow determined to clear the name of her disgraced husband, who was court-martialed for desertion and executed. Official records have been destroyed, and the ministry that distributes benefits continues to deny her a pension. Twenty-six years after the war, she seeks out four survivors of her husband\'s garrison. Each tells a dramatically different story about her husband\'s conduct, but she is determined to learn the truth.','/lBBZNl477SNsAORNjnHyFvprxAd.jpg','1972-03-12',96,'Released',NULL,'Under the Flag of the Rising Sun',62851,1.6166,7.6,'q8wSm5_Kcpg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17041,_binary '\0','/squEMJDrsY7ooVNFqbTSdIVO4Qh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0289848',5.9,93536,'en','Analyze That','The mafia\'s Paul Vitti is back in prison and will need some serious counseling when he gets out. Naturally, he returns to his analyst Dr. Ben Sobel for help and finds that Sobel needs some serious help himself as he has inherited the family practice, as well as an excess stock of stress.','/q3R6Hno3WFfIkHQg7CeVAEOcHQQ.jpg','2002-12-06',96,'Released','Back in therapy.','Analyze That',9932,6.7872,5.9,'vF-lF7slKV4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17042,_binary '\0','/nzMsysKmDnppV0nbwLfvETSSkPt.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0289873',6.7,1638,'en','Brian\'s Song','The story of professional football players Gale Sayes and Brian Piccolo, and how their friendship on and off the field was affected when Piccolo contracted a fatal disease','/cbCiDc9rq0LitdWSpeks133qj1m.jpg','2001-12-02',88,'Released',NULL,'Brian\'s Song',18048,1.7087,6.4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17043,_binary '\0','/75UPGUm2Zm6M60szq1gQisDF4g.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0289879',7.6,560715,'en','The Butterfly Effect','A young man struggles to access sublimated childhood memories. He finds a technique that allows him to travel back into the past, to occupy his childhood body and change history. However, he soon finds that every change he makes has unexpected consequences.','/ea5iv7TWMh18fOKoRGgmtcg85Gx.jpg','2004-01-17',113,'Released','Change one thing. Change everything.','The Butterfly Effect',1954,17.3398,7.58,'KctopagSGJE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17044,_binary '\0','/hy4NTiYVBmjHOYE9i3qY3NFOTen.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0289889',6.1,4486,'en','Carolina','A young woman escapes her wildly eccentric family in search for a life of normalcy.','/1PAL74nxKhCV7ubUcGAYtFi7W3W.jpg','2003-07-04',97,'Released',NULL,'Carolina',4592,1.7938,5.8,'f7zlKgZsCYw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17045,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0289893',7.6,1560,'ml','ചന്ദ്രലേഖേ','An unemployed man saves a rich woman and takes her to the hospital where her relatives mistake him as her husband. He plays along as he needs money to repay a loan.','/gy1kJXsXdvj135ZBHl7HATKJJYv.jpg','1997-09-04',172,'Released',NULL,'Chandralekha',280255,1.2697,7.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17046,_binary '\0','/59v7l22qddItsMuq2O3sD6WHNBb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0289944',6,9005,'en','Fear X','When his wife is killed in a seemingly random incident, Harry, prompted by mysterious visions, journeys to discover the true circumstances surrounding her murder.','/jOOfGiaZUMyrB9cZafFKjXErtoK.jpg','2003-04-04',91,'Released','The Past Can Never Be Rewound.','Fear X',37696,1.762,5.834,'yOQA2RLAVfs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17047,_binary '\0','/9o0f6grDTN0fBo3XYPgCEjuLOnM.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0289967',8.4,8444,'tr','Gülen Gözler','A couple who dreamed of having a son had five daughters in a row. When girls reach the age of marriage, there are moments that make them laugh and sometimes make them sad.','/p9rr1TO9soC5VWCUAoSMAbP0CF6.jpg','1977-03-01',97,'Released',NULL,'Smiling Eyes',65010,2.2626,8.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17048,_binary '\0','/1PKa6kO3WW9sAHXY9dpN70r4W1a.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0289968',7.2,9905,'tr','Hababam Sınıfı Dokuz Doğuruyor','Lazy, uneducated students mostly coming from money, share a very close band. They live together in the dormitory of this private highschool, where they daily plan their latest pranks on teachers or the other classes. When one of the students get his girlfriend pregnant, the whole class acts together to help him. The mother has to leave the baby for a while with the father, and this leads to a series of funny events.','/odAZRy6re7Sj97sqXrfe6e2Ay37.jpg','1979-02-01',88,'Released',NULL,'The Chaos Class Is Fretting Over',83655,1.3566,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17049,_binary '\0','/88wEXW9NIURi496KrIgD50dw87l.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0289992',7.5,133408,'en','The Life of David Gale','A man against capital punishment is accused of murdering a fellow activist and is sent to death row.','/7tcAvE82JyxIi79cwQV5br90KVz.jpg','2003-02-21',130,'Released','The crime is clear. The truth is not.','The Life of David Gale',11615,7.4584,7.4,'BnbNu4vl2Q0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17050,_binary '\0','/porZOny3iVvs5LK0osW1b52wWik.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0290002',6.4,303747,'en','Meet the Fockers','Hard-to-crack ex-CIA man Jack Byrnes and his wife Dina head for the warmer climes of Florida to meet the parents of their son-in-law-to-be, Greg Focker. Unlike their happily matched offspring, the future in-laws find themselves in a situation of opposites that definitely do not attract.','/59fXm6N2x7QSbvt6BaBxTNBXGL8.jpg','2004-12-22',115,'Released','Misery loves family.','Meet the Fockers',693,13.6954,6.252,'48S3ogRGpjM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17051,_binary '\0','/2AQlHRwiYXt7PHOLlMFpcFgWlIO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0290015',7,1312,'de','Nichts bereuen','This teenage drama deals with the emotional chaos of a high school graduate at the beginning of a new period of his life. 19-year-old Daniel is frustrated: he wants his great love Luca to be the \"first\" woman in his life, but she seems to be unreachable, so he is still a virgin. During his community service as a male nurse, his boss Anna falls in love with him and they finally have sex. Suddenly Luca is interested in Daniel...','/qbSOuvp6NhpApUKY8mB4cDLyV1J.jpg','2001-11-15',104,'Released',NULL,'No Regrets',2194,0.9329,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17052,_binary '\0','/m5odOM6r6VKkOJ4TWgqYo9umSaI.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0290095',5.4,94553,'en','The Tuxedo','Cabbie-turned-chauffeur Jimmy Tong learns there is really only one rule when you work for playboy millionaire Clark Devlin : Never touch Devlin\'s prized tuxedo. But when Devlin is temporarily put out of commission in an explosive accident, Jimmy puts on the tux and soon discovers that this extraordinary suit may be more black belt than black tie. Paired with a partner as inexperienced as he is, Jimmy becomes an unwitting secret agent.','/lTMnOx7E2zEzIGY0og1KkfgYMhY.jpg','2002-09-27',99,'Released','He\'s not looking for trouble...he\'s wearing it.','The Tuxedo',10771,17.2472,5.7,'5FeOoZrWSKI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17053,_binary '\0','/hpfL1vsEiCsMLd5s9oKxYQtxvuX.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0290145',6.6,3844,'en','Blue Car','Meg is a gifted but emotionally scarred 18-year-old who finds solace in writing poetry. Mr. Auster, her English teacher, recognizes her talent and encourages her to enter a national poetry contest. As tension at home escalates and Meg struggles to find a way to get to the poetry finals in Florida, Auster\'s role in her life becomes increasingly complex.','/6xld6dA6rlctR9mUtcVRigZTfu5.jpg','2003-04-25',96,'Released','Ready or not... the future comes just the same.','Blue Car',46989,1.6845,6.3,'we35nC2znWg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17054,_binary '\0','/kP65uCOSfDnsOgpGEDG6Y2sQTSJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0290210',6.4,7776,'en','Max','In 1918, a young, disillusioned Adolf Hitler strikes up a friendship with a Jewish art dealer while weighing a life of passion for art vs. talent at politics','/a2zqJWEAqSyPS7VZP0biBdJIpHn.jpg','2002-09-10',106,'Released','Art + Politics = Power','Max',13560,2.5576,6.2,'pNcUEraG5sA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17055,_binary '\0','/m2OFAqnsisznOp3gwwxofk3OQPN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0290212',4.7,10322,'en','Full Frontal','A day in the life of a group of men and women in Hollywood, in the hours leading up to a friend\'s birthday party.','/7FeoefSYELryi04Kz74xYTayPZk.jpg','2002-08-02',112,'Released','Everybody needs a release.','Full Frontal',15186,4.3003,4.623,'j5p4mfJ2tVY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17056,_binary '\0','/kfyLvdWaXlvXWSvKGYjA1JFxsAl.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0290296',7.4,1817,'en','Space Station 3D','Some 220 miles above Earth lies the International Space Station, a one-of-a-kind outer space laboratory that 16 nations came together to build. Get a behind-the-scenes look at the making of this extraordinary structure in this spectacular IMAX film. Viewers will blast off from Florida\'s Kennedy Space Center and the Baikonur Cosmodrome in Russia for this incredible journey -- IMAX\'s first-ever space film. Tom Cruise narrates.','/3WTMYkXYd1p9ObrrZmxBc179mUr.jpg','2002-04-17',47,'Released','A Select Few Have Been Aboard... Now It\'s Your Turn!','Space Station 3D',18221,1.9019,6.5,'XXjuIfIyrp0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17057,_binary '\0','/nWgnU0B3UrPieO5jU5eTK4htWLj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0290326',7.6,4239,'hi','तुम बिन','Shekhar, a businessman, accidentally kills his associate Amar, and ridden with guilt, decides to watch over Amar\'s company and take care of his family and friends. However, he falls in love with Amar\'s fiancé Piya - who is to marry tycoon Abhi Gyan to save the company','/wZTD1Vha7PyLTw9GlNKx36U7why.jpg','2001-06-25',158,'Released','Love Will Find the Way','Tum Bin',64880,1.3879,7.5,'nOKeq7ARIIM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17058,_binary '\0','/aRej5B87xx8ela2KWmHyvw4udtP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0290329',6.5,18426,'ja','ビジターQ','In a dysfunctional family where the mother is a heroin addict and prostitute, beaten by her son, and the father is an ex-TV reporter, sleeping with his daughter and filming his son being beaten up, ‘Q’, a complete stranger enters the bizarre family, changing their lives for the better, finding a balance in their disturbing natures.','/hkf41ujfmMwHdExD7q4j9DxgBDM.jpg','2001-03-17',84,'Released','The only thing stranger than this family is... Visitor Q.','Visitor Q',4241,4.8903,6.3,'CRc6dN7s1w4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17059,_binary '\0','/bh7uIB4vvio1tWvLPiAUi8PN9Fn.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0290331',5.9,1859,'hi','Waqt Hamara Hai','One-time rival collegians, Vikas Sabkuchwala and Sunil, are now friends and in love with sisters Ayesha and Mamta Vidrohi, who they would like to marry. But their politician father wants a size-able dowry as well as well-placed sons-in-laws, and refuses to have to do anything with them. The foursome get together and arrange the fake kidnapping of the sisters so as to extort a large sum of money from Vidrohi. Things go completely out of control and awry, when Vikas and Sunil find out that the kidnapping has taken place - not by them - but by notorious international terrorist and seemingly invincible Colonel Chikara.','/kvLDoThQibqHqXu3KrkIwelUOwC.jpg','1993-06-22',148,'Released','A romantic thriller.','Waqt Hamara Hai',161442,1.3378,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17060,_binary '\0','/dp2o4hCdHOxCRjoDj1jqTYsezQ1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0290332',4.8,8284,'en','The Wash','With the rent due and his car booted, Sean has to come up with some ends...and fast. When his best buddy and roommate Dee Loc, suggests that Sean get a job busting suds down at the local car wash.','/xb63VT8E4Q2RjLT7qnzvc5jRFAQ.jpg','2001-11-14',97,'Released','When you\'re down \'n dirty, it all comes out in The Wash.','The Wash',13408,2.3394,5.8,'ZeiARGTNwE4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17061,_binary '\0','/7TYITrR804tLITNur3b8VLCK6tw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0290334',7.4,619868,'en','X2','Professor Charles Xavier and his team of genetically gifted superheroes face a rising tide of anti-mutant sentiment led by Col. William Stryker. Storm, Wolverine and Jean Grey must join Magneto and Mystique to unhinge Stryker\'s scheme to exterminate all mutants.','/bst4alFUXCxISwdRUKSMhhkrX1M.jpg','2003-04-27',133,'Released','The time has come for those who are different to stand united.','X2',36658,1.0065,7.046,'-mFKFf9OzgM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17062,_binary '\0','/nW6Tm8zHmVIyfCZPVyl4akD5RMZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0290382',5.6,2618,'en','A Wrinkle in Time','Meg and Charles Wallace are aided by Calvin and three interesting women in the search for their father who disappeared during a government experiment. Their travels take them around the universe to a place unlike any other.','/mMES5XApmhBmc06RxsT1a0DmUHQ.jpg','2003-04-25',128,'Released','To rescue their father, they must save the universe.','A Wrinkle in Time',27874,2.5645,6.3,'vdjShe0ouiw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17063,_binary '\0','/yUQOG3DdMncPK62Foav5Py4sAo7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0290402',6,2261,'ar','افريكانو','The story of Badr, a young veterinarian, and his brother in law ‘Essaam, their desire for success and the seeming good fortune they encounter. Their life turned upside down when they get news that they have inherited a Zoo from Badr\'s uncle in South Africa. Badr and ‘Essaam fly to South Africa where they meet Gameela, Badr\'s niece, they find that the zoo is facing many problems. Badr, ‘Essaam, and Gameela face such challenges as vicious lion attacks, greedy bankers, treacherous relatives, with the help of Shaaker the father\'s lawyer and Adam, the loyal family employee.','/nBI7WzoTLX6akMQVVQ9N8llhfKG.jpg','2001-09-11',103,'Released',NULL,'Africano',418291,1.0937,6,'naYQ7C4EZcU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17064,_binary '\0','/ezGvEmwW3HUFXBwBVBHaG9sIk1L.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0290661',7,6868,'de','Hundstage','Vignettes of the lives of several residents of a Vienna suburb during a heat wave.','/s0W8wsed1RaUr3A69dy3pCJ3zkI.jpg','2001-09-03',122,'Released',NULL,'Dog Days',9025,2.3058,6.6,'d_LphQx4sP8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17065,_binary '\0','/8xjGGAmW2WmS5cQdvJKF6tejXJG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0290664',6.5,3535,'en','Hysterical Blindness','Two friends lament their unhappy single lives while searching for Mr. Right in 1980s New Jersey.','/3NcBAGkB4Iqh9AYCfIQHW3YQJiu.jpg','2002-01-16',99,'Released','In the 80\'s they said love was a battlefield... they were right.','Hysterical Blindness',45069,2.4812,6.1,'wiHSzCmf8IE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17066,_binary '\0','/xV1EfNSEg6id6juJPr1vM6p9x5X.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0290673',7.3,165440,'fr','Irréversible','A woman’s lover and her ex-boyfriend take justice into their own hands after she becomes the victim of a rapist. Because some acts can’t be undone. Because man is an animal. Because the desire for vengeance is a natural impulse. Because most crimes remain unpunished.','/rxeDxo8FvZpLu6iplNpxdtAVnfu.jpg','2002-05-22',97,'Released','Time destroys everything.','Irreversible',979,11.1982,7.2,'_mQud51zP38','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17067,_binary '\0','/qgoqb6IkNYA7NE6bgBhAnP2FEQ5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0290747',4.1,7723,'en','Man-Thing','Agents of an oil tycoon vanish while exploring a swamp marked for drilling. The local sheriff investigates and faces a Seminole legend come to life: Man-Thing, a shambling swamp-monster whose touch burns those who feel fear.','/kfPPnOygXSGaBFpsCUyu7xQdkoO.jpg','2005-04-21',97,'Released','The nature of fear','Man-Thing',18882,3.5376,4.3,'RTUL1GWbrRw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17068,_binary '\0','/ngkezcqJBetgna5i4oqgOqZJVsP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0290820',7.1,1362,'hi','राख','After witnessing the public humiliation & abuse of a female friend, a young man vows to avenge her by going after the hoodlums responsible. he is guided by a burnt out, cynical cop, who shows him the ropes as well as the realities of vigilante life.','/aWbd57CEvNKkKvUFGflmijciKBt.jpg','1989-04-21',153,'Released',NULL,'Raakh',159636,1.9287,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17069,_binary '\0','/9GEFQRdZpmqSVxqvn570cpst0VB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0290823',6.7,1350,'fa','رأی مخفی','A female election agent and a gun-toting soldier try to collect votes among the local islanders with mixed success.','/nirVNVYtwxG3wkH7klpEYDq0Gvb.jpg','2001-09-04',105,'Released',NULL,'Secret Ballot',43772,0.9563,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17070,_binary '\0','/j9DBtB4NfHfO8xLIbf7J7gaGBBw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0290839',6,1487,'hi','Sainik','Lieutenant Suraj Dutt has been in the Indian army for years. It is now time for him to take a leave of absence so that he can meet his father, Retired Colonel Yashpal Dutt, and sister, Minni. He travels home, and on the way rescues some school children held hostage by a group of armed men. The media portrays him as a hero, and it is here that he meets with a young woman named Alka, and both fall in love with each other. Alka and Suraj get the approval of their respective families\' and get married. Minni also gets married to a young man named Vijay Ghai. Shortly after the marriage, Suraj leaves his pregnant wife and re-joins duty at the border. His father is the first one to get the news that he is missing, believed dead. He decides to keep his news from Alka and Minni. What Yashpal does not know that both Minni and Alka have already received this devastating news - and both have decided to keep a brave front and also hide it from each other...','/2mYxT6sAzHyikBzcs1YxQTeqqh3.jpg','1993-06-30',137,'Released',NULL,'Sainik',161444,1.1148,6.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17071,_binary '\0','/cQtFpE3cyWw2AWdRb5VGU9glOj8.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0290879',6.4,2038,'th','สุริโยไท','During the 16th century, as Thailand contends with both a civil war and Burmese invasion, a beautiful princess rises up to help protect the glory of the Kingdom of Ayothaya. Based on the life of Queen Suriyothai.','/t7dh4Ex3xBJ1nwiPpRGxgCTUa3Y.jpg','2001-08-17',185,'Released','A woman warrior changed the course of history.','The Legend of Suriyothai',27329,2.3848,5.9,'Pifp1zWKCCY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17072,_binary '\0','/azkp4brPsmzJiyKw5ExkPDrVpWA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0290916',6.5,2721,'fr','Embrassez qui vous voudrez','Two couple of friends, one very rich, the other almost homeless, decide to go on Holiday. Julie, a single mother, joins them too. Once at seaside, it starts a complicate love cross among them that will involve also a transsexual, a jealous brother, a Latin Lover and another nervous stressed couple. Not to mention about the daughter of one of them that is secretly in Chicago with one of her father\'s employees... At the end of the summer, all of them will join the same party...','/laV4Xo5O1COZefAFPJLFZ28pkYS.jpg','2002-03-04',103,'Released',NULL,'Summer Things',8434,2.1456,5.9,'QhVkvcAv3fg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17073,_binary '\0','/yF7RubPthUoMMbqrBOjMoSXhjgj.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0290937',8.4,5452,'ml','യോദ്ധാ','Fate brings a young man from rural Kerala to be the protector of a young Lama in Nepal, who is being chased by a dangerous cult.','/gff3TrVV2QMdPA9oow4vpkOBYBI.jpg','1992-09-03',149,'Released',NULL,'Yoddha',210737,1.5045,7.603,'QetkLi9m4qM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17074,_binary '\0','/9fKYqsnqDKvu2vRgTzJMTfPeBoc.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0291003',7.6,7891,'pt','Abril Despedaçado','Brazilian badlands, April 1910. Tonho is ordered by his father to avenge the death of his older brother. The young man knows that if he commits this crime, his life will be divided in two: the twenty years he has already lived and the few days he has left to live, before the other family avenges their son\'s death. He is torn between fulfilling his ancestral duty and rebelling against it, urged by his younger brother Pacu. That\'s when a tiny travelling circus passes through the vast badlands where Tonho\'s family lives.','/zkNQBhT8op04I1JYwRqNhjX4quD.jpg','2001-12-12',95,'Released',NULL,'Behind the Sun',36093,1.7816,7.4,'T-Iz53_AqWY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17075,_binary '\0','/3fK2gv1nIkcQnRWwFge11JE0zrh.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0291032',7.2,4733,'zh','巴尔扎克与小裁缝','During the Cultural Revolution, two young men are sent to a remote mining village where they fall in love with the local tailor\'s beautiful granddaughter and discover a suitcase full of forbidden Western novels.','/boIPnACAr2J29oLanoAuMjmQP8i.jpg','2002-05-16',116,'Released','A tailor-made love story.','Balzac and the Little Chinese Seamstress',2111,1.8447,6.8,'HAoNmidK8Rg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17076,_binary '\0','/6UVM9ptCZTi9CvSrkmWLHdmMZ55.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0291131',7,1518,'fr','Les diables','The story of the struggle of an autistic girl and her brother trying to survive without their parents.','/aesSCsKOoiy5CWXVitmOJffLsbl.jpg','2002-09-11',105,'Released',NULL,'The Devils',26793,1.6374,6.2,'uYTFTh7rV6Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17077,_binary '\0','/qAo57W8YEn519sjys7FUT3seaOA.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0291172',7.5,10636,'fr','Le Fils','A joinery instructor at a rehab center refuses to take a new teen as his apprentice, but then begins to follow the boy through the hallways and streets.','/mbAG0JOVgcOIH8LVVynw87ONgej.jpg','2002-10-04',103,'Released',NULL,'The Son',35172,2.7758,7.448,'em1o2XzUFMM','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17078,_binary '\0','/5DluWz0UmtcWSNcNoHFMxpYgFYN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0291213',6.8,1847,'de','Große Mädchen weinen nicht','Kati and Steffi have been best friends forever. Now that their love lives are heating up, they\'re hitting the books less and going out to nightclubs more. But when Steffi sees her father out with another woman, her life begins to spiral out of control.','/eaNkIAGss0HOdlxADH1gLLTJGEG.jpg','2002-10-24',87,'Released','Best friends growing up too fast.','Big Girls Don\'t Cry',10636,2.0433,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17079,_binary '\0','/lXwvQ7JEHm5kaHPVm7QR4mAnOkN.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0291341',6.4,43208,'en','Mean Machine','Disgraced ex-England football captain, Danny \'Mean Machine\' Meehan, is thrown in jail for assaulting two police officers. He keeps his head down and has the opportunity to forget everything and change the lives of the prisoners. When these prisoners have the chance to put one over the evil guards during a prison football match, Danny takes the lead.','/ripTQsmWQJyccK6zB1dajSY3olv.jpg','2001-12-26',99,'Released','It\'s Not Just About Football, It\'s About Pride Inside!','Mean Machine',9991,4.7629,6.2,'NNXrZCPU5uc','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17080,_binary '\0','/jZW391Kknf4YiIaZ1XHyVjnJaKe.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0291350',7.8,37634,'ja','千年女優','Documentary filmmaker Genya Tachibana has tracked down the legendary actress Chiyoko Fujiwara, who mysteriously vanished at the height of her career. When he presents her with a key she had lost and thought was gone forever, the filmmaker could not have imagined that it would not only unlock the long-held secrets of Chiyoko’s life... but also his own.','/p44UXOFBCY5xbpCKEsWpi4filCD.jpg','2002-09-14',87,'Released','The magic of movies, the mystery of memory.','Millennium Actress',33320,6.0777,7.9,'2u5Ee1_jUCY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17081,_binary '\0','/c9GO0PQh1OoVn07fhh3RqAFBPE6.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0291376',7.8,19426,'hi','नायक','Shivajirao, a TV reporter, gets a chance to be the Chief Minister of Maharashtra for a day after being challenged by incumbent Chief Minister Balraj Chauhan. After his one-day stint turns out to be a huge success, his life spirals out of control and he is embroiled in political intrigue.','/5aFFHWnc3EtV3mkgAImOGENbcEc.jpg','2001-09-07',187,'Released','One Man. One Day. One Chance.','Nayak: The Real Hero',33457,1.4816,7.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17082,_binary '\0','/aE2JhJI4RBWLfRBOetX5XyETz5M.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0291392',5.6,2781,'fr','Novo','After an injury, Graham suffers from short-term memory loss, which causes him to fall back into the abyss of amnesia every 10 minutes. Those around him both profit and suffer from his condition -- his sex-crazed boss, Sabine, tricks him into regular trysts, while his family tries to come to terms with the situation. But when temp Irene starts working at Graham\'s company, they fall into an affair that begins to make a mark on his memory.','/5ETYsgeYtU7qXhHe9Ix7r7GWfva.jpg','2002-08-03',98,'Released','Each day is a new day... Each time, the first time...','Novo',60015,1.6748,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17083,_binary '\0','/zmFO36vWCEEhE7I3djqbo4cTr11.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0291395',6.6,1657,'da','Okay','Nete is a tough woman of 37 who runs her job, husband, and teenage daughter with a firm and efficient hand. Her father suddenly becomes ill. Seriously ill. Nete forces a doctor to tell her how much time he has left. 3 weeks, hardly any longer. Nete\'s father becomes bitter and introvert, but Nete insists that he come to live with her and her family the few weeks he has left. \"You should die with your family.\" Nete\'s father moves in and puts even more strain on Nete\'s family and everyday life. They all try to cope with the situation - he has only three weeks left, and you don\'t argue with a dying man. Three weeks pass by. A month. Nete\'s father does not die, his appetite comes back, the doctors begin to have doubts as to the prognosis, and Nete has a problem.','/qoInisUAv9B3JUTFz13eq8W8z0F.jpg','2002-03-27',93,'Released',NULL,'Okay',40002,2.3246,5.8,'sQhykta4E9k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17084,_binary '\0','/86UfYMcI2pOotv52YL9zeMuO7gw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0291400',7,3636,'fr','Monsieur Batignole','In 1942, in an occupied Paris, the apolitical grocer Edmond Batignole lives with his wife and daughter in a small apartment in the building of his grocery. When his future son-in-law and collaborator of the German Pierre-Jean Lamour calls the Nazis to arrest the Jewish Bernstein family, they move to the confiscated apartment. Some days later, the young Simon Bernstein escapes from the Germans and comes to his former home. When Batignole finds him, he feels sorry for the boy and lodges him, hiding Simon from Pierre-Jean and also from his wife. Later, two cousins of Simon meet him in the cellar of the grocery. When Pierre-Jean finds the children, Batignole decides to travel with the children to Switzerland.','/2Cse4C8YXXOoXmxeymyGIg45TvD.jpg','2002-03-06',100,'Released',NULL,'Monsieur Batignole',2594,2.7673,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17085,_binary '\0','/bzb6BDskaYbRvXMIENcqFdgwiY0.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0291502',3.6,18963,'en','Swept Away','Stranded and alone on a desert island during a cruise, a spoiled rich woman and a deckhand fall in love and make a date to reunite after their rescue.','/rAa3nTeDpwgLX6XxnT3wR86C5WE.jpg','2002-10-11',89,'Released','Paradise makes strange bedfellows.','Swept Away',12779,4.7135,4.733,'b6nSGbvxucE','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17086,_binary '\0','/nhd9X3yNBL0PDfRC5nKSFhrY1Pm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0291507',7,1219,'es','Taxi para 3','A taxi driver is given a difficult choice from 2 small time crooks: drive them around while they rob, or get locked up in the trunk.','/1mIk07uUalwivNQ6FOvmaMmHQhg.jpg','2001-08-02',90,'Released',NULL,'A Cab for Three',86126,1.2508,6.528,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17087,_binary '\0','/aRnqVepaoNwBZqtLwMlxF7W1Moq.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0291538',6.3,2028,'fr','Une femme de ménage','After his wife leaves him for another man, Jacques hires a housekeeper, Laura, to keep his Paris apartment in order. As he starts increasing her hours and spending more time with her on her days off, Jacques is torn between the pleasure of Laura\'s company, and the headache that such an intrusion brings to his new domain of singlehood.','/qOdswLSfHZ69RZkNodL2nmztD7d.jpg','2002-11-13',91,'Released',NULL,'The Housekeeper',34840,1.7877,5.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17088,_binary '\0','/xwPS4U5DoAohQJ8orDsEEg22zot.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0291579',7.1,20221,'fr','À la folie... pas du tout','A talented art student named Angélique is passionately in love with Dr. Loïc Le Garrec, a handsome married man whom she believes will leave his wife. When he eventually decides to stay in his marriage, it causes Angélique to spiral. However, as the story shifts from Angélique\'s perspective to Loïc\'s, the surprising truth about their relationship is revealed.','/dW5txTgCQADtHSyl2iRIc05iANX.jpg','2002-03-27',92,'Released','Every love story has two sides.','He Loves Me… He Loves Me Not',12112,2.9464,6.7,'Hrwigz5mDf8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17089,_binary '\0','/cU3K0wni55kbdU2DlAXt94Cay78.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0291832',6.8,3338,'en','Crackerjack','When dwindling membership and increasing overheads makes a local bowling club a prime candidate for a takeover, it\'s all hands on deck to save the club, in what turns into an epic battle where young meets old, greed meets good and people rise to the occasion in extraordinary circumstances.','/bSmzRS7R4HRw9EAGPydFuZJl3jw.jpg','2002-07-11',92,'Released','It’s on for young and old.','Crackerjack',14672,1.0618,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17090,_binary '\0','/oJQnkUYWoj9RZ6bsVTLkqUlLeUs.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0291855',8.7,7284,'ml','ദേവാസുരം','Neelakanthan squanders away the inheritance left by his father. However, his life turns upside down when his mother reveals a terrible secret on her deathbed that changes the course of his life.','/uHXwSFxtUlQemlI0lPE01Fv9S9j.jpg','1993-04-14',160,'Released',NULL,'Devasuram',237672,1.4319,7.125,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17091,_binary '\0','/sHwpxZgQ8S2xHI97epvIgvmnRZk.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0291883',5.8,1484,'hi','एक लड़का एक लड़की','A daughter returns to her deceased father\'s estate. She discovers that her uncle, who looks after the estate, has been embezzling her father\'s money.','/ndg8XIpYDFztjE2BbUopyc6GI9a.jpg','1992-06-19',162,'Released','kitna pyaar tum-he karte hain','Ek Ladka Ek Ladki',72568,1.3056,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17092,_binary '\0','/egx8J5Hxrnd5fbFdezt8XkyE8tg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0291905',6.8,1229,'de','Fickende Fische','16-year old Jan is absent-mindedly strolling through the streets when he\'s run over by roller-skating Nina. As fast as she has stormed into his life, however, she rushes off again. Nina is 15 years old and full of crazy ideas. She lives together with her brother, her father and his new girlfriend. Her mother isn\'t in touch much. That\'s why there is the unconventional Angel whose own daughter disappeared years ago and who is Nina\'s best friend and substitute mother.','/91NK7qR6lOKUcga3kD14EnivFkQ.jpg','2002-08-15',103,'Released','When you find the right one, hold onto it!','Do Fish Do It?',12147,1.0103,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17093,_binary '\0','/w2QUsItk4yAo0UwW86QJxnxgs5F.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0291988',7.4,5603,'es','Historias mínimas','Three people and a baby set off on separate journeys, along the same road; their disparate dreams and stories intertwine amidst the breathtaking deserted Patagonic route.','/dD27iIMNImAnGlSs7OroS0lvV95.jpg','2002-10-24',92,'Released','Stories that cross over...','Intimate Stories',51378,2.0267,7.286,'Ylxk1a46GaI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17094,_binary '\0','/dCQWMhMxuhQwXPImKiqgxQRygDF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0292066',7.2,3453,'zh','蓝宇','A love story between a country boy in Beijing to study and a wealthy businessman set against the backdrop of the 1989 Tiananmen Square incident.','/kiqzWsQFKPGDPhZV31DESl9JMhH.jpg','2001-05-18',87,'Released',NULL,'Lan Yu',27062,3.6491,7.2,'T3n2_sqIvZs','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17095,_binary '\0','/qi3x094RHm1WUvW27LphaGGT5Bp.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0292174',8.2,3572,'ml','പട്ടണപ്രവേശം','CID officers Ramdas and Vijayan go to Kerala to find the murderer of a police officer. While doing so, they face a dangerous crime syndicate that deals in drug trafficking.','/l0DQy5dWMkUXPXeT0X9ucLcYxZ5.jpg','1988-06-16',139,'Released',NULL,'Pattanapravesham',280306,0.947,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17096,_binary '\0','/wr05IEamXoBZ1B6jo5CDcQye5xw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0292220',7.9,1431,'ml','സന്മനസ്സുള്ളവർക്കു സമാധാനം','The only way Gopalakrishnan can escape from certain bankruptcy is to sell the property he owns in the city and use the proceeds to settle his debts. To do that, he has to evict his tenants from there first. Unfortunate for him, his tenant is the feisty Meera and her family, who absolutely refuses to vacate the house. Gopalakrishnan uses an obscure clause in the contract to take up residence at the house, and tries his best to smoke his tenants out.','/tOWsaCUfiHRK0c4t0vAOwkkiXIp.jpg','1986-07-04',133,'Released',NULL,'Sanmanassullavarkku Samadhanam',280321,1.1716,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17097,_binary '\0','/zpwe78YgXnL89jS39ZJehtc3GVS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0292236',5.8,1533,'tl','Silip','In the remote countryside of Ilongo, various women are sexually abused by local men. Two sisters meet Simon, the most attractive man in the village, and fight over him - one constantly haunted by Catholic dogma because of the abuse she suffered previously.','/qYTgng5TlhNbp7GfDBZ4UtSIpP3.jpg','1985-02-07',125,'Released','Raw and untamed.','Daughters of Eve',77321,2.1611,5,'kAz2_H_NHlQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17098,_binary '\0','/e3wwC2Rx0jqnteHpTcVa4FmRtA9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0292242',7.3,5918,'de','Solino','The movie portrays the story of an Italian family emigrated in Germany in the 1970s. Romano (Gigi Savoia), the father, decides to open a pizzeria which, by mutual decision with the wife Rosa (Antonella Attili), will call Solino, leaving his sons Gigi and Giancarlo to work there. A hostile relationship comes to life between the father and his sons, which will end up in the escape of the boys from family.','/nFtE6RBMnZd2bXu7n8yy0jszdFB.jpg','2002-09-23',120,'Released',NULL,'Solino',11628,1.5846,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17099,_binary '\0','/5rJ3kVQfOQvBSglUATWpqeca9vB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0292246',8.6,7808,'ml','സ്ഫടികം','Chacko Master, a school headmaster, is never happy with his son, Thomas, and always degrades him. Having had enough of his ill treatment, Thomas runs away from home only to return as a gangster after long.','/1bDOwCzW2cIVtRgeVQKn5ZTzcFf.jpg','1995-03-30',150,'Released',NULL,'Spadikam',240179,1.3745,7.369,'QKsjcae4IWg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17100,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0292319',8.1,2205,'ml','വരവേൽപ്പ്','Murali returns to his home in Kerala after working in the Gulf for seven years. He decides to settle in his hometown, but things do not go as expected.','/hhOKBBs8Rbc73kV2LZWENiPVIi4.jpg','1989-03-31',146,'Released',NULL,'Varavelpu',280297,0.9859,7.273,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17101,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0292332',7.8,1735,'ml','വിയറ്റ്നാം കോളനി','Krishnamurthy is appointed by a real estate company to vacate Vietnam Colony, a place buzzing with illegal and antisocial elements.','/go9hS8HP6TIi2mySsmfjLNALhDZ.jpg','1992-12-25',154,'Released',NULL,'Vietnam Colony',240213,1.6591,7.354,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17102,_binary '\0','/csII6cyp9ATED64IzYljnst3OTZ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0292432',7.5,4109,'sr','Apsolutnih sto','Igor Gordić was an Olympic champion in shooting, but now he is a junky without money and in debts to mafia. Saša is his younger brother and he is getting ready for the next World Championship. Since he\'s not getting enough terms to practice indoors, he has decided to go out and find himself a target to practice on.','/2fNZCWAZPfnrTuKmg4OL3zckSqI.jpg','2001-05-10',94,'Released','Sports skill became his weapon.','Absolute Hundred',44183,0.7881,6.9,'neOlPaaCujU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17103,_binary '\0','/fJ3k4ctIvIyeQxyNhUWZaLwKeP5.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0292490',8,80545,'hi','दिल चाहता है','Three inseparable childhood friends are just out of college. Nothing comes between them - until they each fall in love, and their wildly different approaches to relationships creates tension.','/d5yjk7hbv8AK0DR0oJUrSGHMn9A.jpg','2001-07-24',183,'Released','Welcome To A Summer Of Their Lives You Will Never Forget','Dil Chahta Hai',14752,2.7353,6.9,'OBAcYSSUf6o','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17104,_binary '\0','/bwDTWOd0SCFWfRw8ophhykOgUBS.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0292506',6.6,148190,'en','The Recruit','A brilliant CIA trainee must prove his worth at the Farm, the agency\'s secret training grounds, where he learns to watch his back and trust no one.','/xInKytrHV3EJeCAulOpn5Q0bMxh.jpg','2003-01-31',115,'Released','Trust. Betrayal. Deception. In the C.I.A. nothing is what it seems.','The Recruit',1647,7.9662,6.406,'TYvVJRtN0vg','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17105,_binary '\0','/kPRHoq1g68O5qawcnrB1c4LeO4I.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0292542',7.8,18072,'es','El hijo de la novia','At age 42, Rafael Belvedere is having a crisis. He lives in the shadow of his father, he feels guilty about rarely visiting his aging mother, his ex-wife says he doesn\'t spend enough time with their daughter and he has yet to make a commitment to his girlfriend. At his lowest point, a minor heart attack reunites him with Juan Carlos, a childhood friend, who helps Rafael to reconstruct his past.','/zXInKuQ8FW18Ko8CtY9V30qhz1P.jpg','2001-08-16',123,'Released',NULL,'Son of the Bride',19460,2.9035,7.5,'W-bp_E0Xq7w','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17106,_binary '\0','/29t7THr2KxAHcCrtd1yxaaNW3g9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0292610',5.4,8306,'en','No Good Deed','While doing a friend a favor and searching for a runaway teenager, a police detective stumbles upon a bizarre band of criminals about to pull off a bank robbery.','/lrQU72BcSfzJx71X1ko2K4LTtlE.jpg','2002-06-28',97,'Released','HE was more than a cop. SHE was more than a thief.','No Good Deed',2017,3.948,5.4,'CQDsuNpQbk0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17107,_binary '\0','/yTHvJqk7IFqnDCBBQ0ou60p2qvO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0292644',6.6,55917,'en','The Rules of Attraction','The incredibly spoiled and overprivileged students of Camden College are a backdrop for an unusual love triangle between a drug dealer, a virgin and a bisexual classmate.','/6OybelUmwUkDm7fbX1BI7OhpYeQ.jpg','2002-10-11',110,'Released','We all run on instinct','The Rules of Attraction',1809,6.2866,6.17,'TUgPOO4Z5FI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17108,_binary '\0','/63uPeGNzQSKOZchtM98uNukvBFw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0292886',6.3,4988,'es','800 balas','Almería, Tabernas desert, Spain, 2002. Texas Hollywood is a dilapidated and dusty town where Western movies have not been shot for decades. Julián Torralba and his partners, veteran film stuntmen, survive there, recreating pathetic action scenes for the pleasure of the few foreign tourists who visit the isolated region.','/f8tqwtxk0xUJA8fHaKqxZ0G8ey4.jpg','2002-10-18',124,'Released','Let the battle begin…','800 Bullets',37748,2.9991,5.8,'oq2l1O9KY5g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17109,_binary '\0','/ocAiyzGWhfr3PtNXxYih5s19c1h.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0292963',7.3,124008,'en','Before the Devil Knows You\'re Dead','When two brothers organize the robbery of their parents\' jewelry store, the job goes horribly wrong, triggering a series of events that send them and their family hurtling towards a shattering climax.','/h4QXi4Ysuc3zICiK9jHxjCAK9Oh.jpg','2007-09-26',117,'Released','No one was supposed to get hurt.','Before the Devil Knows You\'re Dead',7972,7.9627,7.11,'kiE8t8xbCog','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17110,_binary '\0','/rhrBU761a5B4w7hhpA9og3fNBCH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0293007',7.6,25250,'pt','Carandiru','When a doctor decides to carry out an AIDS prevention program inside Latin America’s largest prison: the Casa de Detenção de São Paulo – Carandiru, he meets the future victims of one of the darkest days in Brazilian history.','/bkq8RsbCb7ugW0ZmsD8SYEvQWSp.jpg','2003-04-11',145,'Released','Inside here nobody is guilty. Do you believe that?','Carandiru',8440,3.9078,7.6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17111,_binary '\0','/cj2isIuskSePAwpb2D6yUBZrhkJ.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0293069',6.3,1561,'en','Dark Blood','Filmed in 1993 but never completed due to River Phoenix\'s death, Dark Blood tells the story of Boy, a young widower living on a nuclear testing site in the desert. Boy is waiting for the end of the world and carves Katchina dolls that supposedly contain magical powers. Boy\'s solitude is interrupted when a Hollywood jet-set couple who are travelling across the desert become stranded after their car breaks down. The couple are rescued by Boy, who then holds them prisoner because of his desire for the woman and his ambition to create a better world with her.','/oAfT3B8efpfuQ65dqy7We3GvlH.jpg','2012-09-27',86,'Released',NULL,'Dark Blood',136884,1.355,6,'M9UIlO3NRng','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17112,_binary '\0','/vPdmF5W3vcSqoUhNb2XIwgtiolY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0293088',7,2769,'en','Devil\'s Playground','The Devil\'s Playground is a fascinating and moving documentary about a little-known aspect of Amish life. Amish are not permitted to join the church until their late teens, and have to do so of their own volition. The film explores Rumspringa, wherein young Amish are given the opportunity to explore the \"English\" way of life.','/5bOMMSTIDv2YiWP7v3yOr3hHWzx.jpg','2002-01-11',77,'Released','Amish Teenagers In The Modern World','Devil\'s Playground',30068,1.1212,6.6,'7b5nvjC4LT0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17113,_binary '\0','/m5annmG2kgJdIt0VmjNcLArSfAC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0293092',7.4,2208,'en','Dexter\'s Laboratory: Ego Trip','After Dexter is confronted with robots who wish to \"destroy the one who saved the future,\" he uses his time machine to see how he saved it. They declare that they are here to destroy the one who saved the future, and make ready to attack Dexter. Dexter easily destroys them with the use of various tools and gadgets from his lab. However, news that he is \"The One Who Saved the Future\" intrigues him, and he decides to travel through time to discover how cool he is. In the first time period he visits, Dexter finds a tall, skinny, weak version of himself working in office-designing cubicles, with Mandark as his rich, successful boss. The child Dexter unwittingly reveals the existence of blueprints regarding the \"Neurotomic Protocore\", and Mandark steals it after the two Dexters move forward in time.','/oiul6dw0tOkPW6EMPsZyLnvTqzA.jpg','1999-12-17',50,'Released','It\'s about time.','Dexter\'s Laboratory: Ego Trip',56828,3.0851,7.488,'1vRScRibZ1M','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17114,_binary '\0','/wXRwP81ZRSpRFCnrvbhV6zLGAGB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0293113',6.8,2356,'en','Dracula: Pages from a Virgin\'s Diary','A cinematic version of the Royal Winnipeg Ballet\'s adaptation of Bram Stoker\'s gothic novel Dracula. Filmed in a style reminiscent of silent Expressionist cinema of the early 20th century (complete with intertitles and monochrome photography), it uses dance to tell the story of a sinister but intriguing immigrant who preys upon young English women.','/qioaICsGsr8Bu8yr6UGPLmV9crX.jpg','2002-02-28',74,'Released',NULL,'Dracula: Pages from a Virgin\'s Diary',55616,1.9606,6.7,'Q6EfPB8I7pU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17115,_binary '\0','/93MS7SP7mLrNpGbBA7bhJf91fMm.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0293116',6.1,6303,'fr','Décalage Horaire','At Charles de Gaulle Airport in Paris, a beautician on her way to a new job in Mexico accidentally meets a cook who is on his way back from America. Labor strikes, bad weather, and pure luck cause the two of them to share a room overnight at the airport Hilton hotel. Will their initial mutual indifference and downright hostility turn into a one night stand or perhaps something more?','/us5es90wJgcXcWbFbmQG1yp6pEk.jpg','2002-10-30',91,'Released',NULL,'Jet Lag',18300,2.6663,5.5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17116,_binary '\0','/yL6C8QzWnHQQPePBXYGyiD7J5Xf.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0293124',4.2,1409,'de','Erkan & Stefan gegen die Mächte der Finsternis','A couple of slackers find an antique dagger and manage to free the gorgeous female warrior that was imprisoned in it by an evil spell. An evil sorcerer is not happy by this turn of events and determines to possess both the blade and the warrior through a sacrificial ceremony. The two heroes manage to rescue the damsel in distress and defeat the wizard and his minions by employing skills mastered through hours of video game play.','/rtymI0q2HufOwbOyowrA5twYPRM.jpg','2002-06-20',80,'Released',NULL,'The Bunny Guards vs. the Forces of Evil',1615,1.708,4.5,'6kR-B09Zb-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17117,_binary '\0','/bMIwUADaXuotza9utqOaDB47dOY.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0293176',5.1,1311,'en','Get Well Soon','After having a nervous breakdown, a popular talk-show host confronts his ex-girlfriend who is dating a cross-dresser.','/amec13CdBUJIidnIjyIwIRr6RF0.jpg','2001-12-20',95,'Released','Being famous isn\'t all it\'s cracked up to be.','Get Well Soon',80659,1.7635,4.2,'GONigIAhUGw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17118,_binary '\0','/7MgeScKMxnDkkaZnMqAlMqm29gw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0293191',6.3,1239,'es','Guerreros','Kosovo, winter 1999. KFOR forces perform their humanitarian task while trying to maintain a difficult neutrality between Kosovo Albanians and Serbs. A platoon of Spanish Army engineers becomes unwittingly caught up in the spiral of violence between the two sides.','/vZFCtoQQrnM5xhB91zyQBIssWiL.jpg','2002-03-22',96,'Released',NULL,'Warriors',89482,1.2586,5.1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17119,_binary '\0','/qW05mc9kMxhwPoKtGecJwdX9bY7.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0293271',6.1,3910,'tr','İbo ile Güllüşah','A poor villager who cannot marry the girl he loves because he cannot afford a bride-price, follows her to Istanbul. But he is unable to raise the money and appear in front of his father. Meanwhile, his friendship with a little girl he meets by chance complicates everything. Seeking attention from her family, the girl tells the young man to kidnap her for ransom. In this way, both she will test whether she is loved or not, and the poor boy will get the girl he loves and wants to marry thanks to the ransom. But things turn into a tangle in an instant.','/mJeVnn0GvpFEDKxKcVA4FzZCE3C.jpg','1977-01-01',88,'Released',NULL,'İbo and Güllüşah',111803,1.5114,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17120,_binary '\0','/b1UHZGlTZFJOrZ13Zh5XO3wcmQi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0293342',6.6,3150,'hi','लज्जा','Soon after Vaidehi marries Raghuvir, she becomes pregnant. Desperate to escape her unhappy marriage, she runs away with her unborn child, but she\'s pursued by her chauvinistic husband and must enlist the help of strangers.','/xFvCS5h3TyixKaBintDoVjYGyVZ.jpg','2001-08-31',185,'Released',NULL,'Lajja',56317,1.8566,7.139,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17121,_binary '\0','/1FBByew9RnXQ2HFqf7b6EWkyzTP.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0293416',7.2,24168,'ja','メトロポリス','In the midst of societal conflict in the futuristic city of Metropolis, Kenichi and his uncle Shunsaku Ban set out to uncover the mystery behind the first human-like robot, Tima.','/41WtqvaObaYE3RuqgBfQFPV3aV1.jpg','2001-05-26',107,'Released','Every epoch dreams its successor.','Metropolis',9606,5.9512,7.152,'XxQeZAJZl0g','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17122,_binary '\0','/6ELCZlTA5lGUops70hKdB83WJxH.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0293429',6.1,222807,'en','Mortal Kombat','Washed-up MMA fighter Cole Young, unaware of his heritage, and hunted by Emperor Shang Tsung\'s best warrior, Sub-Zero, seeks out and trains with Earth\'s greatest champions as he prepares to stand against the enemies of Outworld in a high stakes battle for the universe.','/nkayOAUBUu4mMvyNf9iHSUiPjF1.jpg','2021-04-07',110,'Released','Get over here','Mortal Kombat',460465,16.3419,7.033,'jBa_aHwCbC4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17123,_binary '\0','/bE7heFYMoc3b2fzwK8D8waMSOrW.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0293437',6.2,2298,'en','The Music Man','Traveling con artist Harold Hill targets the naïve residents of a small town in 1910s Iowa by posing as a boys\' bandleader to raise money before he can skip town.','/tlXwiVqhZokgCgrzGz63uVe1PBV.jpg','2003-02-16',132,'Released','There\'s big trouble happening in River City, Iowa.','The Music Man',24105,1.4721,5.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17124,_binary '\0','/YlPZHMV67Mucl1WCnKYpiHeFB9.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0293475',8,1317,'en','Original Cast Album: Company','In 1970, right after the triumphant premiere of Stephen Sondheim’s groundbreaking concept musical Company, the renowned composer and lyricist, his director Harold Prince, the show’s stars, and a large pit orchestra all went into a Manhattan recording studio as part of a time-honored Broadway tradition: the making of the original cast album. What ensued was a marathon session in which all involved pushed themselves to the limit.','/2kqkqG154DXzUOE9n9wXpfMLIao.jpg','1970-10-28',53,'Released',NULL,'Original Cast Album: Company',100776,2.6119,7.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17125,_binary '\0','/1C8kVf0623K15aR5zDeZwb443ct.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0293478',4.7,1279,'ja','弟切草','Nami has been creating artwork for a new video game based on images she\'s been seeing in her dreams. With one of the game producers, she travels out to an abandoned house that seems to match her visions. As they explore the old mansion, Nami begins to have more visions of a forgotten childhood, until at last she comes across a photo of twin infants, labelled \"Nami\" and \"Naomi\". As Nami and the producer go from room to room, an unseen person seems to be watching them from a hidden room.','/uboBtRWGpvfiwFGJgJW9fTCicB9.jpg','2001-01-27',85,'Released',NULL,'St. John\'s Wort',108790,1.0385,5.1,'i0399gd5ae8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17126,_binary '\0','/p3P0eTh8AnqauhRZg0wgoBFvcjF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0293508',7.2,139948,'en','The Phantom of the Opera','A young soprano becomes the obsession of a disfigured and murderous musical genius who lives beneath the Paris Opera House.','/aTsp2VTaCBiGs8w05OTXfD97FRZ.jpg','2004-12-08',141,'Released','Let the fantasy begin.','The Phantom of the Opera',9833,10.6451,7.267,'OSemQ2EKkY4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17127,_binary '\0','/5onbcnNYONrYWoCO8aIGywjzrl4.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0293562',7.2,1220,'en','The Rosa Parks Story','A seamstress recalls events leading to her act of peaceful defiance that prompted the 1955 bus boycott in Montgomery, Alabama.','/6YBX7mJ73Y4m7BQ9GFiweCmMV6K.jpg','2002-02-24',97,'Released','America, 1955. Her act of courage changed the world. But how it changed her life has never been told... until now.','The Rosa Parks Story',49635,2.2598,7.1,'1tuCAAPOZQQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17128,_binary '\0','/ozsLB1HRCN6ZAmJN89pWtoiAwnb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0293564',6.3,202400,'en','Rush Hour 3','After a botched assassination attempt, the mismatched duo finds themselves in Paris, struggling to retrieve a precious list of names, as the murderous crime syndicate\'s henchmen try their best to stop them. Once more, Lee and Carter must fight their way through dangerous gangsters; however, this time, the past has come back to haunt Lee. Will the boys get the job done once and for all?','/mp9CzKxLa2i7yblMXUrzVfGqsCo.jpg','2007-08-08',90,'Released','The rush is on!','Rush Hour 3',5174,13.7282,6.5,'Wwow2VOxGZQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17129,_binary '\0','/rhQK6grjWKHwuolvkEQGVf0vtuw.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0293660',4.6,1864,'en','The Touch','A sister and brother, the last heirs of a family of acrobats, are called upon by a Buddhist monk sect to retrieve an artifact that their ancestors have protected throughout the ages.','/voQXY7v9G8n4cPQEZIabkBzwzB6.jpg','2002-08-01',103,'Released',NULL,'The Touch',32091,1.854,5.1,'O-g1epV7qHw','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17130,_binary '\0','/8dXR9R0NUo4eyS4hnYOsCywmo16.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0293662',6.8,340955,'en','The Transporter','Former Special Forces officer Frank Martin will deliver anything to anyone for the right price, and his no-questions-asked policy puts him in high demand. But when he realizes his latest cargo is alive, it sets in motion a dangerous chain of events. The bound and gagged Lai is being smuggled to France by a shady American businessman, and Frank works to save her as his own illegal activities are uncovered by a French detective.','/dncJ81z1BahrT3ogLvlxOUC5n4u.jpg','2002-10-02',92,'Released','Rules are made to be broken.','The Transporter',4108,16.0917,6.73,'0poXFSvX0_4','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17131,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0293664',7.1,1678,'en','Treed Murray','An advertising executive, trapped in a tree by a gang of would-be muggers, manipulates them into fighting to save his life.','/aHGO7X8YRVTRE4Lhncgf79zyUnr.jpg','2001-09-13',90,'Released',NULL,'Treed Murray',25435,1.8533,6.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17132,_binary '\0','/13uKAt4M87HQi1lMZAwBmsNZRGg.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0293715',7.9,53433,'ko','엽기적인 그녀','A young man’s world is turned upside down when a female force of nature takes his life by storm in this outrageous and uplifting ode to true love.','/i964xFDEMwZ5uaweParv8ItBfbJ.jpg','2001-07-27',137,'Released','My date with her started.','My Sassy Girl',11178,5.5993,7.6,'4lnyW3vIGvI','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17133,_binary '\0','/bfnQPbcmPAXO2QmDONalx4vNWPB.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0293815',5.8,33143,'en','Friday After Next','Craig and his cousin Day-Day have finally moved out of their parents\' houses and into their own crib, working nights at a local mall as security guards. When their house is robbed on Christmas Eve they set out to track down the culprit.','/sxHFGPKLWj9e3aaA6wGVxghoiPE.jpg','2002-11-22',85,'Released','The party\'s back in the \'hood!','Friday After Next',10426,4.7127,6.406,'H3g5QQynaJk','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17134,_binary '\0','/1p0xvz3eBcXx4I1QsU8MJct7znv.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0293832',4.4,1674,'en','Hansel & Gretel','Hansel and Gretel is a 2002 film adaptation of the Brothers Grimm children\'s story. It stars Jacob Smith and Taylor Momsen as the eponymous characters. It includes the Sandman, played by Howie Mandel and Sinbad as a raven.','/eNY4aIyVuYnQWu1dGWds0nGeCBO.jpg','2002-10-16',89,'Released','Magically Delicious! A Real Family Treat!','Hansel & Gretel',49872,2.639,5.6,'3AAAMkYy2EA','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17135,_binary '\0','/jcKQ0xsFBKUrmvJvxO4kkMNWpfT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0293901',6.7,4480,'pl','Poranek Kojota','Kuba, a young cartoon artist who works as a waiter at sophisticated parties, falls in love with beautiful Noemi and accidentally gets involved in gangster affairs','/eIFA5olWYJbval7RrA8U1X8MWJg.jpg','2001-08-24',92,'Released',NULL,'Coyote\'s Morning',31857,0.9551,6.7,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17136,_binary '\0','/vpCWLrAPJayIO1vI7KVVl1Gy8no.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0294252',6.1,3490,'ko','2009 로스트메모리즈','A failed assassination attempt in Harbin, China in 1909 changes the course of history. Now two JBI agents must find the connections between it and an ancient Korean artifact.','/2qVZHS3FrbF8OfWARcAfu1dU5bK.jpg','2002-02-01',136,'Released','The war has begun!','2009: Lost Memories',23132,1.8294,6.2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17137,_binary '\0','/A7UpQd14JCK0FjgfyLqYlmT8vXi.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0294264',7.2,3479,'ta','ஆளவந்தான்','Nandu and Vijay are brothers who were abused by their stepmother during their younger days. Nandhu, who is mentally ill, decides to kill Vijay\'s fiancee as he visualizes her as his stepmother.','/u6C8youno9ycdYfO7DaRi01meax.jpg','2001-11-14',178,'Released',NULL,'Aalavandhan',66346,1.9273,6.817,'WnPu90GEWpU','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17138,_binary '\0','/rp09OsrEIpFdsxQjIyWn821Wp7c.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0294357',6.4,28623,'en','Beyond Borders','Sarah Jordan, an American living in London in 1984, is married to the son of a wealthy British industrialist. She encounters Nick Callahan, a renegade doctor, whose impassioned plea for help to support his relief efforts in war-torn Africa moves her deeply. As a result, Sarah embarks upon a journey of discovery that leads to danger, heartbreak and romance in the far corners of the world.','/j7Upm2AtGuTzCs2Asq0GyBIMAxX.jpg','2003-10-23',127,'Released','Where hope survives.','Beyond Borders',9839,3.4942,6.4,'p34rR9VWkLQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17139,_binary '\0','/5BShmjcYdkuTbSIWufRzNpZFUNK.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0294425',5.5,17628,'en','Cadet Kelly','Hyperactive teenager Kelly is enrolled into a military school when her new stepfather becomes the Commandant. At first she has problems fitting in and taking orders until she tries out for the drill team.','/eKtznndgJoVG9S9UENc7kHqmhgM.jpg','2002-03-07',100,'Released','Too Cool For The Rules!','Cadet Kelly',14008,4.7288,6.2,'8mIug513ot0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17140,_binary '\0','/z0eDQiO52orWuvZhzNyNWSGMC4p.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0294594',5.6,9603,'en','The Gathering','Itinerant traveler Cassie Grant comes out of a car accident in Glastonbury, England, with partial memory loss. The deeply regretful driver allows her to convalesce at a large rural home, where she becomes friends with the woman\'s stepson, Michael. As Cassie delves into Michael\'s research about an old, newly discovered area church, it triggers some strange premonitions and offers gradual clues about her deeper links to this British community.','/zIlPzicLM5NQgUriVgPZrAofmsv.jpg','2003-02-23',92,'Released','Evil Souls Rule','The Gathering',10943,2.6856,5.632,'serB6Phu1OQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17141,_binary '\0','/nppIdZbfRefoeIAqXR9vlJsxtHG.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0294662',6.6,5833,'hi','कांटे','Six men meet in a lock-up, where they\'ve been wrongfully detained. Seeking revenge, they make the perfect plan to rob the very bank where police department\'s salaries are deposited','/ekNwKxMMXy5pWauS9FqnuzhXAE9.jpg','2002-12-20',152,'Released','Six honest intentions. One perfect betrayal.','Kaante',35907,1.6309,5.5,'5Gt47cJDcr8','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17142,_binary '\0','/nXzGB9p0hzFei6QqdEZ3tlT2Lo2.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0294725',4.9,2010,'fi','Minä ja Morrison','A bittersweet tale of a love affair between two people whose lives seem to have lost all direction. The female lead, Milla, is drifting aimlessly through life until she meets Aki. They fall in love - but happiness in a relationship shadowed by crime and drugs is not necessarily a given. The movie is based on the novel Minä ja Morrison by first-time author Kata Kärkkäinen','/iooeCRndz201RpNlnZAm8V4bfkj.jpg','2001-12-28',91,'Released','What remains, when love is not enough?','Me and Morrison',53503,2.7444,4.315,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17143,_binary '\0','/Aby2bp5yZYLSvs8Ql32bZAamTFb.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0294870',6.9,58524,'en','Rent','In New York City\'s gritty East Village, a group of bohemians strive for success and acceptance while enduring the obstacles of poverty, illness and the AIDS epidemic.','/fomBrfOHWxlaVcjPk4yCQgIwAnh.jpg','2005-11-17',135,'Released','No day but today.','Rent',1833,4.4484,6.823,'BH0MLyu6HjY','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17144,_binary '\0','/rbMBH53DFIdLpRnuHhxFE5qUBbT.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0294939',5,2167,'sv','Sprängaren','The Victoriastadium is totally destroyed in a bomb attack and Christina Furhage, head-responsible for the Olympic Games in Stockholm, dies with it. Why did someone destroy the stadium and why is Christina murdered? The police desperately seek for clues that will lead them to the perpetrator but without any luck. As the Olympic Games draws near the situation becomes more desperate. Annika Bengtzon, a reporter for Kvällsposten, se a connection that no one else sees and without understanding it she starts a carousel that in the end will threaten her own life.','/mkz8UT6cQO4baLQytgst2xjgd5U.jpg','2001-10-24',128,'Released',NULL,'Deadline',100973,1.1158,4.8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17145,_binary '\0','/kuPpElzfYnzsCye0hF8EbJSrvwo.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0295178',6.3,236643,'en','Austin Powers in Goldmember','The world\'s most shagadelic spy continues his fight against Dr. Evil. This time, the diabolical doctor and his clone, Mini-Me, team up with a new foe—\'70s kingpin Goldmember. While pursuing the team of villains to stop them from world domination, Austin gets help from his dad and an old girlfriend.','/n8V61f1v7idya4WJzGEJNoIp9iL.jpg','2002-07-26',94,'Released','The grooviest movie of the summer has a secret, baby!','Austin Powers in Goldmember',818,10.7557,6,'JuOVbayBr0I','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17146,_binary '\0','/hKAtZM7kFz3MgckqzCklQRxz8NF.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0295192',7,2111,'ko','봄날은 간다','A recording engineer falls for a radio announcer after they work together to capture sounds of the natural world.','/aGeHzao6ZYaGIEELKJ8SJfht28V.jpg','2001-09-28',115,'Released','The moment you feel that love has come this far.','One Fine Spring Day',95453,2.4626,7,'MH87LbPwC_Q','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17147,_binary '\0','/zPOsgnW67I0US9fJ9kAKXGwbcWC.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0295238',6.4,4119,'en','Personal Velocity','In a series of three vignettes, three women in turn struggle to free themselves from the men who restrict their personal freedom.','/2Jkt0PQBU2lmSm4zQcyJBWvRGpv.jpg','2002-01-12',86,'Released','Three portraits.','Personal Velocity',32625,2.5531,5.9,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17148,_binary '\0','/5gnBqLDi1pjJxxCgpOJCu5VSLp1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0295254',3.4,24035,'en','FearDotCom','When four bodies are discovered among the industrial decay and urban grime of New York City, brash young detective Mike Reilly teams with ambitious Department of Health researcher Terry Huston to uncover the cause behind their violent and inexplicable deaths. The only common factor shared by the victims? Each died exactly 48 hours after logging onto a website called feardotcom.','/phcd5AJvA1S45JMKYoNLhTzFwsE.jpg','2002-08-09',101,'Released','The last site you\'ll ever see.','FearDotCom',9544,4.4204,3.8,'gZDIWcAV93k','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17149,_binary '\0','/Txzcr6Iqdam6WufVLlGEVz6N70.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0295289',5.6,19842,'en','A Guy Thing','Paul Morse is a good guy. When his friends throw him a wild bachelor party, he just wants to keep his conscience clean -- which is why he\'s shocked when he wakes up in bed with a beautiful girl named Becky and can\'t remember the night before. Desperate to keep his fiancée, Karen, from finding out what may or may not be the truth, he tells her a teensy lie. Soon his lies are spiraling out of control and his life is a series of comical misunderstandings.','/wWiPuP1wMW32pjX8Q9TEj69TxWI.jpg','2003-01-17',101,'Released','He finally found the perfect girl(s).','A Guy Thing',9582,5.6699,5.9,'HVHDev-T5iQ','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17150,_binary '\0','/zuYEvft5fuzBDOeq4ClYpiu9LlO.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0295297',7.5,777669,'en','Harry Potter and the Chamber of Secrets','Cars fly, trees fight back, and a mysterious house-elf comes to warn Harry Potter at the start of his second year at Hogwarts. Adventure and danger await when bloody writing on a wall announces: The Chamber Of Secrets Has Been Opened. To save Hogwarts will require all of Harry, Ron and Hermione\'s magical abilities and courage.','/sdEOH0992YZ0QSxgXNIGLq1ToUi.jpg','2002-11-13',161,'Released','Something evil has returned to Hogwarts!','Harry Potter and the Chamber of Secrets',672,45.4295,7.7,'nE11U5iBnH0','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17151,_binary '\0',NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0295303',6.8,1414,'en','Heartlands','Gentle Colin \'Col\' Lawes happily lead a quiet life, running a news agency with his soiled-rotten wife Sandra and playing competition darts in the Atletic Arms team. Colin catches her committing adultery with team captain Geoff, a cop, who pretends Colin abused her. Col is thrown off the team just after it qualified for the league finals in Blackpool. He decides to travel there alone, hoping to win her back.','/1KDKC1r7QTyzGNS5a7v33VQg4HY.jpg','2003-04-27',90,'Released','An offbeat road trip... An exciting new world!','Heartlands',54794,1.3085,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17152,_binary '\0','/gkmvlGeuydIUjEP7GY9FLnoa3f1.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0295362',6.6,1706,'ja','カオス','A kidnapping for ransom seemingly goes off without a hitch, but as one thread left unsolved suddenly reveals many more mysteries, the whole operation threatens to descend into chaos.','/n7uqF0Tx8izurvWGnyW7uu7UXPZ.jpg','2000-06-30',103,'Released','There are two sides to every woman','Chaos',39983,1.1169,6.4,'y_zWKGO4k-s','YouTube','Trailer','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000'),(17153,_binary '\0','/7NZEeQplC4bxYZZ8LvAPJeX3z59.jpg','2026-10-06 15:21:06.000000','tt0295368',6.8,1958,'ko','킬러들의 수다','Four unlikely assassins question their assignments because they genuinely care about their customers and victims. However, they attract police attention and a prosecutor is on their trail.','/An6QdeGRhDOMCXxw5pMcSiGyG2A.jpg','2001-10-12',120,'Released','Smile like baby... Kill like crazy.','Guns & Talks',23609,1.6751,6.6,'hlSUwU-Zoh